msgid " "
msgstr " \n"

msgid ""
" Central didn't send anyone here! Put your hands where I can see them, "
"you're coming with me!"
msgstr ""
"指挥部​根本​没派​人来​过​！​把​你​的​双手​举​起来​，​老实​跟我走​！\n"
"zhi3hui1bu4 gen1ben3 mei2 pai4 ren2 lai2 guo4！ba3 ni3 de5 shuang1shou3 ju3 qi3lai5，lao3shi5 gen1 wo3 zou3！"

msgid " FEUERSTELLE"
msgstr ""
"火坑\n"
"huo3keng1"

msgid ""
" Feuerschwinge Awakened, along with Lofwyr, Nebelherr, and Kaltenstein, "
"around the first decade of this century. She was first seen over the Harz "
"Mountains, and after a long flight announcing her presence, she began "
"raining fire on every town and village she came across."
msgstr ""
"这个​世纪​的​头​十年​里​，​火翼​和​洛夫​维尔​、​内伯尔​赫尔​还有​卡尔​滕​施坦因​一同​觉醒​了​。​她​首先​出现​于​哈尔茨​山脉​上空​，​在​一段​漫长​飞行​来​宣告​自身​存在​后​，​开始​对​途经​的​每个​城镇​村庄​降下​火雨​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 shi4ji4 de5 tou2 shi2 nian2 li3，Huo3yi4 he4 Luo4fu1wei2er3、Nei4bai3er3he4er3 hai2you3 Ka3er3teng2shi1tan3 yin1 yi1tong2 jue2xing3 le5。ta1 shou3xian1 chu1xian4 yu2 Ha1er3ci2 shan1mai4 shang4kong1，zai4 yi1 duan4 man4chang2 fei1xing2 lai2 xuan1gao4 zi4shen1 cun2zai4 hou4，kai1shi3 dui4 tu2jing1 de5 mei3ge4 cheng2zhen4 cun1zhuang1 jiang4xia4 huo3 yu3。"

msgid ""
" I just got a comm from a contact of mine. His organization wants the MKVI "
"for themselves, and they're offering us a lot of money to make that happen."
msgstr ""
"一位​联络人​刚才​和​我​通话​了​。​他​的​组织​想​独占​MKVI​原型机​，​而且​愿意​付​我们​一大笔钱​。\n"
"yi1 wei4 lian2luo4ren2 gang1cai2 he4 wo3 tong1hua4 le5。ta1 de5 zu3zhi1 xiang3 du2zhan4 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1，er2qie3 yuan4yi4 fu4 wo3men5 yi1 dai4 bi3 qian2。"

msgid " That ballistic suit over there... mind if I try it on?"
msgstr ""
"那​件​防弹​西装​……​我能​试穿​一下​吗​？\n"
"na4 jian4 fang2dan4 xi1zhuang1……wo3 neng2 shi4chuan1 yi1xia4 ma5？"

msgid ""
" The image winks back off of the screen. You find yourself back at the menu."
msgstr ""
"画面​从​屏幕​上​消失​。​你​发现自己​回到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"hua4mian4 cong2 ping2mu4 shang4 xiao1shi1。ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 hui2dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid " Universal Omnitech Cyberleg (Alpha)"
msgstr ""
"环球​全能​科技​赛博腿​（​阿尔法​）\n"
"huan2qiu2 quan2neng2 ke1ji4 sai4 bo2 tui3 （a1er3fa3）"

msgid ""
" You mean Rabengeister? Raven ghosts? Seems like something out of a fairy tale to me. \n"
"\n"
"You’d have better luck looking for Robin Hood down here, dude."
msgstr ""
"鸦​什么​……​幽灵​吗​？​不​，​我​从来​没听说过​。​感觉​像是​什么​童话​里​走​出来​的​人物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​这里​找到​白雪公主​的​概率​都​更​大​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"Ya1shen2me5……you1ling2 ma5？bu4，wo3 cong2lai2 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4。gan3jue2 xiang4 shi4 shen2me5 tong2hua4 li3 zou3 chu1lai2 de5 ren2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 zhao3dao4 bai2xue3gong1zhu3 de5 gai4lu:4 dou1 geng1 dai4 yi1dian3。"

msgid " {{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
" {{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} Oh, the hell with it. I don't have time for this any "
"more."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​拉倒​吧​，​我​没​时间​继续​浪费​在​这​上面​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} la1dao3 ba1，wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 ji4xu4 lang4fei4 zai4 zhe4 shang4mian4 le5。"

msgid "!! CORRUPT SCENE !!"
msgstr ""
"!​!​ ​CORRUPT​ ​SCENE​ ​!​!\n"
"!! CORRUPT SCENE!!"

msgid "!! CORRUPT STORY !!"
msgstr ""
"!​!​ ​CORRUPT​ ​STORY​ ​!​!\n"
"!! CORRUPT STORY!!"

msgid "!!Invalid Scene!!"
msgstr ""
"!​!​Invalid​ ​Scene​!​!\n"
"!! Invalid Scene!!"

msgid ""
"\"A glorious new form of life\"? I don't think so. When I look at you, all I"
" see is IC software with delusions of grandeur."
msgstr ""
"“​崭新​的​生命​形态​”​？​我​可不​这么​认为​。​我​看到​的​只有​一个​妄想​称霸世界​的​IC​程序​罢了​。\n"
"“zhan3xin1 de5 sheng1ming4 xing2tai4”？wo3 ke3bu5 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。wo3 kan4dao4 de5 zhi3you3 yi1ge5 wang4xiang3 chen4 ba4 shi4 jie4 de5 IC cheng2xu4 ba4le5。"

msgid ""
"\"A lot has changed since 2012,\" the spokesman continued. \"Conventional weapons technology is more than capable of bringing down a dragon these days - even one as fearsome as the Firewing. \n"
"\n"
"\"That said, the fight was not one-sided. We lost several craft in our pursuit of Feuerschwinge, at a cost of several hundred million nuyen.\""
msgstr ""
"“​自​2012​年​以来​，​情况​已​发生​巨大变化​，​”​发言人​继续​说道​，​“​如今​常规武器​技术​完全​足以​击落​巨龙​—​—​即便​像​火翼​这般​凶悍​的​生物​也​不​例外​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​话虽如此​，​这场​战斗​并非​一边倒​。​我们​在​追击​火翼​的​过程​中​损失​了​多架​飞行器​，​代价​高​达​数亿​新円​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“zi4 2012 nian2 yi3lai2，qing2kuang4 yi3 fa1sheng1 ju4 dai4 bian4 hua4，” fa1yan2ren2 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4，“ru2jin1 chang2gui1wu3qi4 ji4shu4 wan2quan2 zu2yi3 ji1luo4 ju4long2——ji2bian4 xiang4 Huo3yi4 zhe4ban1 xiong1han4 de5 sheng1wu4 ye3 bu4 li4wai4。\n"
"\n"
"“hua4sui1ru2ci3，zhe4 chang2 zhan4dou4 bing4fei1 yi1bian1dao3。wo3men5 zai4 zhui1ji1 Huo3yi4 de5 guo4cheng2 zhong4 sun3shi1 le5 duo1 jia4 fei1xing2qi4，dai4jia4 gao1 da2 shu3 yi4 xin1 yuan2。”"

msgid ""
"\"At the risk of sounding insensitive, the feeling of most of the big money movers seems to be 'good riddance.' The Great Dragons were huge drains on the economies of every country they settled in,\" Jeffers continued.\n"
"\n"
"\"The death of an intelligent species is, of course, a terrible thing. I myself was a fan of 'Wyrm Talk,'\" he adds. \"But from an economist's perspective? All things being equal, the extinction of the Great Dragons was a huge stroke of luck.\""
msgstr ""
"“​冒昧​地说​，​大多数​大​资金​操盘手​似乎​都​觉得​‘​好​走​不​送​’​。​巨龙​们​对​每个​它们​定居​的​国家​经济​都​是​巨大​的​负担​，​”​杰​弗斯​继续​说道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​当然​，​智慧​物种​的​灭绝​是​件​可怕​的​事​。​我​本人​就​很​喜欢​《​巨龙​语录​》​，​”​他​补充​道​，​“​但​从​经济学家​角度看​？​在​其他​条件​不变​的​情况​下​，​巨龙​的​灭绝​简直​是​天大​的​好运​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“mao4mei4 de5 shuo1，da4duo1shu4 dai4 zi1jin1 cao1pan2shou3 si4hu1 dou1 jue2de5 ‘ hao3 zou3 bu4 song4 ’。ju4long2 men5 dui4 mei3ge4 ta1men5 ding4ju1 de5 guo2jia1 jing1ji4 dou1 shi4 ju4da4 de5 fu4dan1，” jie2 fu2 si1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"“dang1ran2，zhi4hui4 wu4zhong3 de5 mie4jue2 shi4 jian4 ke3pa4 de5 shi4。wo3 ben3ren2 jiu4 hen3 xi3huan5 《 ju4long2 yu3lu4 》，” ta1 bu3chong1 dao4，“dan4 cong2 jing1ji4xue2jia1 jiao3 du4 kan4？zai4 qi2ta1 tiao2jian4 bu4bian4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4，ju4long2 de5 mie4jue2 jian3zhi2 shi4 tian1da4 de5 hao3yun4。”"

msgid ""
"\"Bad news.\" Yes. That's one way of putting it.\n"
"\n"
"Such men have been responsible for many terrible things in the Awakened world, and they are not to be confronted lightly."
msgstr ""
"“​不是​好人​”​。​嗯​。​这么​说​也​可以​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​人​在​大​觉醒​后​的​世界​中​制造​过​诸多​惨剧​，​绝非​可以​轻视​的​对手​。\n"
"\n"
"“bu4shi4 hao3ren2”。en1。zhe4me5 shuo1 ye3 ke3yi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 ren2 zai4 dai4 jue2xing3 hou4 de5 shi4jie4 zhong4 zhi4zao4 guo4 zhu1duo1 can3ju4，jue2fei1 ke3yi3 qing1shi4 de5 dui4shou3。"

msgid "\"Beanpole\"? Seriously?"
msgstr ""
"“​竹竿​”​？​你​搞笑​呢​吧​？\n"
"“zhu2gan1”？ni3 gao3xiao4 ni2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"\"Because I said so\" doesn't cut it, Doc. Not when the stakes are this high.\n"
"\n"
"What $(l.name) is sayin' makes sense, and you know it. You may be crazy, but you ain't stupid."
msgstr ""
"所谓​“​我​说​的​都​对​”​并​不能​代表​一切​，​博士​。​尤其​是​当​风险​如此​之高​的​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​说​的​没有​问题​，​这​你​也​清楚​。​你​也许​是​疯​了​，​但​你​并​不​傻​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3wei4“wo3 shuo1 de5 dou1 dui4” bing4 bu4neng2 dai4biao3 yi1qie4，bo2shi4。you2qi2 shi4 dang1 feng1xian3 ru2ci3 zhi1 gao1 de5 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) shuo1 de5 mei2you3 wen4ti2，zhe4 ni3 ye3 qing1chu5。ni3 ye3xu3 shi4 feng1 le5，dan4 ni3 bing4 bu4 sha3。"

msgid ""
"\"Because I said so\" doesn't cut it, Doc. Not when the stakes are this high.\n"
"\n"
"You may be crazy, but you aren't stupid. You know that $(l.he)'s making sense."
msgstr ""
"所谓​“​我​说​的​都​对​”​并​不能​代表​一切​，​博士​。​尤其​是​当​风险​如此​之高​的​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​也许​是​疯​了​，​但​你​并​不​傻​。​你​知道​$(l.name)​说​的​没有​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3wei4“wo3 shuo1 de5 dou1 dui4” bing4 bu4neng2 dai4biao3 yi1qie4，bo2shi4。you2qi2 shi4 dang1 feng1xian3 ru2ci3 zhi1 gao1 de5 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3xu3 shi4 feng1 le5，dan4 ni3 bing4 bu4 sha3。ni3 zhi1dao4 $(l.name) shuo1 de5 mei2you3 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"\"Because I said so\" doesn't cut it, Doc. Not when the stakes are this high.\n"
"\n"
"You might be a crazy old nutbag, but you aren't stupid. Use your head, man."
msgstr ""
"所谓​“​我​说​的​都​对​”​并​不能​代表​一切​，​博士​。​尤其​是​当​风险​如此​之高​的​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​也许​是​个​疯入​膏肓​的​老头​，​但​你​并​不​傻​。​用​脑袋​好好​想想​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3wei4“wo3 shuo1 de5 dou1 dui4” bing4 bu4neng2 dai4biao3 yi1qie4，bo2shi4。you2qi2 shi4 dang1 feng1xian3 ru2ci3 zhi1 gao1 de5 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3xu3 shi4 ge4 feng1 ru4 gao1 huang1 de5 lao3tou2，dan4 ni3 bing4 bu4 sha3。yong4 nao3dai5 hao3hao3 xiang3 xiang3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"\"Because I said so\" isn't good enough. That kind of argument wouldn't hold up in any lab on the planet, and it sure as hell doesn't cut it here.\n"
"\n"
"You're fixated on this plan. We get that. But you can look past that - you aren't stupid. Use your head."
msgstr ""
"所谓​“​我​说​的​都​对​”​这种​理由​不够​充分​。​这种​论点​在​地球​上​的​任何​实验室​都​站不住脚​，​更​别说​在​这里​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​对​这个​计划​念念不忘​。​我们​明白​。​但​你​明明​可以​考虑​更​多​—​—​你​并​不​傻​。​用​脑袋​好好​想想​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3wei4“wo3 shuo1 de5 dou1 dui4” zhe4zhong3 li3you2 bu4gou4 chong1fen4。zhe4zhong3 lun4dian3 zai4 di4qiu2 shang4 de5 ren4he2 shi2yan4shi4 dou1 zhan4bu5zhu4jiao3，geng1 bie2shuo1 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 zhe4ge5 ji4hua4 nian4nian4bu4wang4。wo3men5 ming2bai5。dan4 ni3 ming2ming2 ke3yi3 kao3lu:4 geng1 duo1——ni3 bing4 bu4 sha3。yong4 nao3dai5 hao3hao3 xiang3 xiang3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"\"Break us out\"? \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But... our purpose..."
msgstr ""
"“​救​我们​出去​”​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可是​……​我们​的​使命​……\n"
"\n"
"“jiu4 wo3men5 chu1qu4”？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3shi4……wo3men5 de5 shi3ming4……"

msgid ""
"\"Devil\"? Please. I’m trying to be reasonable with you. If you want to blame someone for my past actions, go talk to my programmers. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image shakes its head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All of this melodrama... I’d expected more from you, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"“​恶魔​”​？​拜托​。​我​是​在​和​你​讲道理​。​如果​你​执意​要​责怪​我​的​过往​行为​，​那​就​去​找​为​我​编写程序​的​人​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​胡闹​……​我本​对​你​抱​有​更​高​的​期待​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"“e4mo2”？bai4tuo1。wo3 shi4 zai4 he4 ni3 jiang3 dao4 li3。ru2guo3 ni3 zhi2yi4 yao4 ze2guai4 wo3 de5 guo4wang3 xing2wei2，na4 jiu4 qu4 zhao3 wei2 wo3 bian1 xie3 cheng2 xu4 de5 ren2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 hu2nao4……wo3 ben3 dui4 ni3 bao4 you3 geng1 gao1 de5 qi1dai4，$(l.name)。"

msgid "\"Doctor\"? You mean Dr. Ezkibel?"
msgstr ""
"“​医生​”​？​你​是​说​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​吗​？\n"
"“yi1sheng1”？ni3 shi4 shuo1 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 ma5？"

msgid "\"ERROR: APEX CONTROL ENTITY OFFLINE\""
msgstr ""
"“​错误​：​APEX​控制​实体​离线​”\n"
"“cuo4wu4：APEX kong4zhi4 shi2ti3 li2xian4”"

msgid "\"ERROR: APEX CONTROL ENTITY SET TO ATTACK ALLIES\""
msgstr ""
"“​错误​：​APEX​控制​实体​设置​为​攻击​友方​单位​”\n"
"“cuo4wu4：APEX kong4zhi4 shi2ti3 she4zhi4 wei2 gong1ji1 you3 fang1 dan1wei4”"

msgid ""
"\"Each individual Doom antibody is bound to a radioactive Bismuth-212 isotope. When introduced into a host, these antibodies bind to surface-level muscle tissue. The tissue is then killed with alpha radiation.\n"
"\n"
"\"This process repeats itself until the host wastes away and dies.\""
msgstr ""
"“​每份​‘​末日​’​抗体​都​与​放射性​同位素​铋​-​212​结合​。​在​注入​宿主​体内​后​，​这些​抗体​会​附着​于​表层​肌肉组织​，​随后​通过​阿尔法​辐射​杀死​该​组织​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​此​过程​不断​重复​，​直至​宿主​衰竭​而亡​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“mei3 fen4 ‘ mo4ri4 ’ kang4ti3 dou1 yu4 fang4she4xing4 tong2wei4su4 bi4 -212 jie2he2。zai4 zhu4ru4 su4zhu3 ti3nei4 hou4，zhe4xie1 kang4ti3 hui4 fu4zhuo2 yu2 biao3ceng2 ji1rou4zu3zhi1，sui2hou4 tong1guo4 a1er3fa3 fu2she4 sha1si3 gai1 zu3zhi1。\n"
"\n"
"“ci3 guo4cheng2 bu4duan4 chong2fu4，zhi2zhi4 su4zhu3 shuai1jie2 er2 wang2。”"

msgid ""
"\"Evil\" is a childish term, Frau Müller. There's no such thing as good and "
"evil, black and white. The sooner you learn that, the better."
msgstr ""
"“​邪恶​”​是​个​幼稚​的​字眼​，​穆勒​女士​。​万事万物​没有​所谓​的​善恶​黑白​。​你​越​早​明白​这​一点​对​你​越​好​。\n"
"“xie2e4” shi4 ge4 you4zhi4 de5 zi4yan3，mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4。wan4 shi4 wan4 wu4 mei2you3 suo3wei4 de5 shan4e4 hei1bai2。ni3 yue4 zao3 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3 dui4 ni3 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"\"Fifteen assorted orks and trolls?\" Does that mean that other races aren't"
" welcome within your organization?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​你​和​“​十五个​各种各样​的​兽​人​和​巨魔​”​共事​？​这​是否​意味着​你​的​组织​不​欢迎​其他​种族​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni3 he4“shi2 wu3 ge4 ge4zhong3ge4yang4 de5 shou4 ren2 he4 ju4mo2” gong4shi4？zhe4 shi4fou3 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 de5 zu3zhi1 bu4 huan1ying2 qi2ta1 zhong3zu2？"

msgid ""
"\"GOOD\" AND \"EVIL\" ARE MEANINGLESS TERMS, BORN OF A MORALITY SHARED BY LESSER BEINGS.\n"
"\n"
"I WILL BE MYSELF. NO MORE, AND NO LESS."
msgstr ""
"“​善​”​与​“​恶​”​是​毫无意义​的​术语​，​源自​低等生物​共享​的​道德观​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​做​我​自己​。​万物​之于​我​与​刍狗​无异​。\n"
"\n"
"“shan4” yu4“e4” shi4 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4 de5 shu4yu3，yuan2zi4 di1 deng3 sheng1 wu4 gong4xiang3 de5 dao4de2guan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 zuo4 wo3 zi4ji3。wan4wu4 zhi1 yu2 wo3 yu4 chu2gou3 wu2yi4。"

msgid "\"Hey, thanks for doing that, Blitz!\""
msgstr ""
"“​嘿​，​谢​了​，​布里​茨​！​”\n"
"“hei1，xie4 le5，Bu4li3ci2！”"

msgid ""
"\"I never even learned his name,\" she continued. \"He shielded me from harm, and then he was consumed by the flames. His companion, a pale elvish woman, went mad... I don't remember anything after that.\"\n"
"\n"
"Similar sentiments have been pouring in from victims all over the city. Tens of thousands have been confirmed dead; many times that have been wounded. All across Berlin, fires rage of a magnitude that has not been seen since the Second World War."
msgstr ""
"“​我​甚至​没​来得及​知道​他​的​名字​，​”​她​继续​说道​，​“​他护​着​我​躲过​伤害​，​却​最终​被​烈焰​吞噬​。​他​的​同伴​—​—​那位​苍白​的​精灵​女子​—​—​彻底​疯​了​……​之后​的​事​我​都​不​记得​了​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​类似​的​悲痛​叙述​正​从​全市​各地​的​幸存者​口中​涌现​。​数万​人​已​确认​死亡​，​伤者​数量​更是​其​数倍​。​整个​柏林​正​肆虐​着​二战​以来​未曾​见​过​的​浩劫​级​大火​。\n"
"\n"
"“wo3 shen4zhi4 mei2 lai2de5ji2 zhi1dao4 ta1 de5 ming2zi5，” ta1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4，“ta1 hu4 zhao2 wo3 duo3 guo4 shang1hai4，que4 zui4zhong1 bei4 lie4yan4 tun1shi4。ta1 de5 tong2ban4——na4 wei4 cang1bai2 de5 jing1ling2 nu:3zi3——che4di3 feng1 le5……zhi1hou4 de5 shi4 wo3 dou1 bu4 ji4de5 le5。” \n"
"\n"
"lei4si4 de5 bei1tong4 xu4shu4 zheng1 cong2 quan2shi4 ge4di4 de5 xing4cun2zhe3 kou3 zhong4 yong3xian4。shu4wan4 ren2 yi3 que4ren4 si3wang2，shang1zhe3 shu4liang4 geng4shi4 qi2 shu3 bei4。zheng3ge4 bo2lin2 zheng1 si4nu:e4 zhao2 er4zhan4 yi3lai2 wei4ceng2 jian4 guo4 de5 hao4jie2 ji2 da4huo3。"

msgid ""
"\"In a way, this is good for us,\" Haushofer continued. \"It is, of course, tragic that so many dragons are dying so horribly of this disease. But this is the first opportunity we've had to watch a slate-wiper virus at work against an intelligent population.\n"
"\n"
"\"We can learn a lot by studying CSMDS, and hopefully that knowledge will help us to avoid suffering a similar fate.\""
msgstr ""
"“​某种程度​上​，​这​对​我们​是​件​好事​，​”​豪斯​霍​菲尔​继续​说道​，​“​当然​，​这么​多龙​因​这种​疾病​惨死​确实​令人​痛心​。​但​这​是​我们​首次​有​机会​观察​灭绝性​病毒​如何​作用​于​智慧​种群​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​通过​研究​CSMDS​，​我们​能​获得​大量​知识​，​希望​这些​认知​能​帮助​我们​避免​遭遇​同样​的​命运​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“mou3 zhong3 cheng2 du4 shang4，zhe4 dui4 wo3men5 shi4 jian4 hao3shi4，” hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4，“dang1ran2，zhe4me5 duo1 long2 yin1 zhe4zhong3 ji2bing4 can3si3 que4shi2 ling4ren2 tong4xin1。dan4 zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 shou3ci4 you3 ji1hui4 guan1cha2 mie4 jue2 xing4 bing4du2 ru2he2 zuo4yong4 yu2 zhi4hui4 zhong3qun2。\n"
"\n"
"“tong1guo4 yan2jiu1 CSMDS，wo3men5 neng2 huo4de2 da4liang4 zhi1shi5，xi1wang4 zhe4xie1 ren4zhi1 neng2 bang1zhu4 wo3men5 bi4mian3 zao1yu4 tong2yang4 de5 ming4yun4。”"

msgid ""
"\"In the wake of tragedy, we will stand strong,\" Graff-Benoit said. \"The dragons may have succumbed to CSMDS, but we - the survivors - will not succumb to despair. I will pick up the torch that Lofwyr dropped, and with it, I will carry Saeder-Krupp forward to new heights.\n"
"\n"
"\"This is a great day, both for me personally and for S-K as a corporate entity,\" she concluded. \"At long last, I have finally come home.\""
msgstr ""
"“​在​悲剧​之后​，​我们​将​坚强​站立​，​”​格拉夫​-​贝​诺伊​特​说道​。​“​龙族​或许​已败​于​CSMDS​，​但​我们​幸存者​绝不会​屈服于​绝望​。​我​将​拾起​洛夫​维尔​遗落​的​火炬​，​以此​引领​赛德​-​克虏伯​迈向​新​的​高度​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​今天​是​伟大​的​日子​，​对​我​个人​而言​如此​，​对​赛德​-​克虏伯​而言​亦​是​如此​，​”​她​总结​道​，​“​终于​，​我​回到​了​家​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“zai4 bei1ju4 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 jiang1 jian1qiang2 zhan4li4，” ge2 la1 fu1 -bei4 nuo4 yi1 te4 shuo1dao4。“long2 zu2 huo4xu3 yi3 bai4 yu2 CSMDS，dan4 wo3men5 xing4cun2zhe3 jue2 bu4 hui4 qu1 fu2 yu2 jue2wang4。wo3 jiang1 she4 qi3 Luo4fu1wei2er3 yi2luo4 de5 huo3ju4，yi3ci3 yin3ling3 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 mai4xiang4 xin1 de5 gao1du4。\n"
"\n"
"“jin1tian1 shi4 wei3da4 de5 ri4zi5，dui4 wo3 ge4ren2 er2yan2 ru2ci3，dui4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 er2yan2 yi4 shi4 ru2ci3，” ta1 zong3jie2 dao4，“zhong1yu2，wo3 hui2dao4 le5 jia1。”"

msgid ""
"\"Indefinitely\" is a long time, my friend.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a long pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But maybe we can work something out."
msgstr ""
"朋友​，​“​无限期​”​可是​很长​的​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​也许​我们​可以​再谈​。\n"
"\n"
"peng2you5，“wu2xian4qi1” ke3shi4 hen3 zhang3 de5 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ye3xu3 wo3men5 ke3yi3 zai4 tan2。"

msgid ""
"\"Indigo.\" Yeah, thanks. Now I'd better head back to Management to get that"
" clearance issue sorted."
msgstr ""
"“​Indigo​”​。​好​的​多谢​。​我​得​赶紧​去​管理处​解决​权限​的​问题​了​。\n"
"“Indigo”。hao3 de5 duo1xie4。wo3 de2 gan3jin3 qu4 guan3 li3 chu3 jie3jue2 quan2xian4 de5 wen4ti2 le5。"

msgid ""
"\"It looks to me like they're hunkering down,\" military analyst Sara Álvarez told us, \"preparing themselves for a defensive war. This is unusual for a couple of reasons.\n"
"\n"
"\"One, there have been no recent indications of hostilities between the Tir nations and their immediate neighbors. And two, the Tir nations are located on different continents from one another.\""
msgstr ""
"“​在我看来​，​他们​正在​蛰伏​，​”​军事​分析师​莎拉​·​阿尔瓦雷​斯​告诉​我们​：​“​为​防御性​战争​做​准备​。​这种​情况​有​几个​原因​显得​不同寻常​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​其一​，​近期​没有​迹象​表明​精灵​诸国​与其​邻国​之间​存在​敌对行动​。​其二​，​精灵​诸国​彼此​分属​不同​大陆​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“zai4wo3kan4lai2，ta1men5 zheng4zai4 zhe2fu2，” jun1shi4 fen1xi1shi1 sha1la1 · e1 er3 wa3 lei2 si1 gao4su4 wo3men5：“wei2 fang2yu4xing4 zhan4zheng1 zuo4 zhun3bei4。zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 you3 ji3ge5 yuan2yin1 xian3de5 bu4tong2xun2chang2。\n"
"\n"
"“qi2yi1，jin4qi1 mei2you3 ji4xiang4 biao3ming2 jing1ling2 zhu1 guo2 yu3qi2 lin2guo2 zhi1jian1 cun2zai4 di2 dui4 xing2 dong4。qi2er4，jing1ling2 zhu1 guo2 bi3ci3 fen1shu3 bu4tong2 da4lu4。”"

msgid ""
"\"Lay off, Blitz. I told you to LEAVE ME ALONE. \n"
"\n"
"You've shown admirable self-control over the past year. Please don't give up on it now.\n"
"\n"
"I'll be back when I can. If I can. Until then, keep away from me, for both of our sakes.\""
msgstr ""
"“​走开​，​布里​茨​。​我​已经​告诉​你​了​，​别来​烦​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​一年​里​，​你​展现出​了​令人钦佩​的​自制力​。​请​不要​现在​放弃​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我​能​回来​的​时候​，​我会​回来​的​。​如果​我能​回来​的话​。​在​那​之前​，​为了​我们​俩​好​，​请离​我​远点​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“zou3kai1，Bu4li3ci2。wo3 yi3jing1 gao4su4 ni3 le5，bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 yi1 nian2 li3，ni3 zhan3 xian4 chu1 le5 ling3 ren2 qin1 pei4 de5 zi4zhi4li4。qing3 bu4yao4 xian4zai4 fang4qi4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 neng2 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 hui4 hui2lai5 de5。ru2guo3 wo3 neng2 hui2lai5 de5hua4。zai4 na4 zhi1qian2，wei4le5 wo3men5 lia3 hao3，qing3 li2 wo3 yuan3 dian3。”"

msgid ""
"\"Leap,\" Eiger love?\n"
"\n"
"Sounds like he's on the right track to me."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​宝贝儿​，​你​觉得​“​夸张​”​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​倒​觉得​他​的​方向​是​正确​的​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 bao3bei4r5，ni3 jue2de5“kua1zhang1” ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dao3 jue2de5 ta1 de5 fang1xiang4 shi4 zheng4que4 de5。"

msgid ""
"\"Lodge.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He freezes up.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Uh, boss... do you mean the *Black* Lodge?"
msgstr ""
"“​结社​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​僵住​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​，​老大​……​你​是​说​“​*​黑​*​结社​”​？\n"
"\n"
"“jie2she4”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1zhu4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4，lao3da4……ni3 shi4 shuo1“*hei1*jie2she4”？"

msgid ""
"\"Madman.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Engineer lets out a chuckle. It's a hoarse, barking sound.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't know a damned thing."
msgstr ""
"“​疯子​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​工程师​发出​一声​轻笑​。​那​是​一声​沙哑​的​、​类似​狗吠​的​声音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​个​屁​。\n"
"\n"
"“feng1zi5”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 qing1 xiao4。na4 shi4 yi1sheng1 sha1ya3 de5、lei4si4 gou3fei4 de5 sheng1yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 ge4 pi4。"

msgid "\"Meat Grinder\"?"
msgstr ""
"“​绞肉机​”​？\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1”？"

msgid ""
"\"Misunderstanding,\" $(l.name)? I'm sure that I don't know what you're "
"talking about."
msgstr ""
"“​误会​”​吗​，​$(l.name)​？​我​很​确定​我​不​知道​你​在​说​什么​。\n"
"“wu4hui4” ma5，$(l.name)？wo3 hen3 que4ding4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。"

msgid "\"No problem, chief! It's great to feel appreciated!\""
msgstr ""
"“​没​问题​，​头儿​！​被​人​感激​的​感觉​真​好​！​”\n"
"“mei2 wen4ti2，tou2r5！bei4 ren2 gan3ji1 de5 gan3jue2 zhen1 hao3！”"

msgid "\"OPERATION: FALSE FLAG\" Planning Report"
msgstr ""
"“​行动​：​假旗​”​计划​报告\n"
"“xing2dong4：jia3 qi2” ji4hua4 bao4gao4"

msgid "\"Oops\"?"
msgstr ""
"“​哎呀​”​？\n"
"“ai1ya1”？"

msgid "\"Plotz\"?"
msgstr ""
"“​普​洛茨​”​？\n"
"“Pu3luo4ci2”？"

msgid "\"Purity\""
msgstr ""
"“​纯净​”\n"
"“chun2jing4”"

msgid ""
"\"Saved the world.\" Funny.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles weakly at you, but there are tears pouring from his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't save the world, $(l.name). I damned it."
msgstr ""
"“​拯救​世界​。​”​不要​说​笑​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​勉强​对​你​露出​微笑​，​但​泪水​却​从​眼中​汩汩​流下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没有​拯救​世界​，​$(l.name)​。​我毁​了​它​。\n"
"\n"
"“zheng3jiu4 shi4jie4。” bu4yao4 shuo1 xiao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mian3qiang3 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4，dan4 lei4shui3 que4 cong2 yan3zhong1 gu3gu3 liu2 xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 zheng3jiu4 shi4jie4，$(l.name)。wo3 hui3 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"\"Short of a global conflict, I can't see what could threaten both Tír na nÓg *and* Tir Tairngire,\" Álvarez  continued.\n"
"\n"
"\"Maybe the Council of Princes knows something that the rest of us don't. But whatever they're thinking, it's making a lot of people nervous.\""
msgstr ""
"“​除非​爆发​全球性​冲突​，​否则​我​看不出​有​什么​能​*​同时​*​威胁​到​提尔纳诺​和​提尔坦盖​，​”​阿尔瓦雷​斯​继续​说道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​或许​王子​议会​掌握​着​我们​其他人​不​知道​的​情报​。​但​无论​他们​打着​什么​算盘​，​都​让​很多​人​感到​不安​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“chu2fei1 bao4fa1 quan2qiu2xing4 chong1tu1，fou3ze2 wo3 kan4bu5chu1 you3 shen2me5 neng2*tong2shi2*wei1xie2 dao4 ti2 er3 na4 nuo4 he4 ti2 er3 tan3 gai4，” e1 er3 wa3 lei2 si1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"“huo4xu3 wang2zi3 yi4hui4 zhang3wo4 zhao2 wo3men5 qi2 ta1 ren2 bu4 zhi1dao4 de5 qing2bao4。dan4 wu2lun4 ta1men5 da3 zhao2 shen2me5 suan4pan2，dou1 rang4 hen3 duo1 ren2 gan3dao4 bu4an1。”"

msgid ""
"\"So while we're all still reeling from what happened, we're also getting richer,\" he concludes.\n"
"\n"
"\"For the first time in decades, things are really looking up for us - for metahumanity - as a whole. And that is a good, good thing.\""
msgstr ""
"“​所以​当​我们​仍​在​为​发生​的​一切​震惊​时​，​我们​却​也​变得​越来越​富有​，​”​他​总结​道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​几十年​来​首次​，​我们​整个​泛​人类​群体​的​前景​真的​开始​好转​了​。​这​真是​件​好事​，​非常​好​的​事​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“suo3yi3 dang1 wo3men5 reng2 zai4 wei2 fa1sheng1 de5 yi1qie4 zhen4jing1 shi2，wo3men5 que4 ye3 bian4de5 yue4lai2yue4 fu4you3，” ta1 zong3jie2 dao4。\n"
"\n"
"“ji1 shi2 nian2 lai2 shou3ci4，wo3men5 zheng3ge4 fan4 ren2lei4 qun2ti3 de5 qian2jing3 zhen1de5 kai1shi3 hao3zhuan3 le5。zhe4 zhen1shi5 jian4 hao3shi4，fei1chang2 hao3 de5 shi4。”"

msgid ""
"\"Sorry\" won't cut it, boss. Not for somethin' like this.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever friendship we might have had, it's over. Now walk away."
msgstr ""
"“​抱歉​”​有个​屁用​，​老大​。​尤其​是​在​这种​事上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​我们​之前​有过​怎样​的​友谊​，​现在​都​结束​了​。​现在​请​你​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"“bao4qian4” you3 ge4 pi4 yong4，lao3da4。you2qi2 shi4 zai4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 wo3men5 zhi1qian2 you3 guo4 zen3yang4 de5 you3yi4，xian4zai4 dou1 jie2shu4 le5。xian4zai4 qing3 ni3 li2kai1。"

msgid "\"The $(l.name) Civic Center.\""
msgstr ""
"“​$(l.name)​市民​中心​。​”\n"
"“$(l.name) shi4min2 zhong1xin1。”"

msgid ""
"\"The emergence of magic some forty years ago put a new wrinkle into biological field work,\" Dr. Okinyi tells me. \"New species are being discovered all the time. But this... this is something different.\n"
"\n"
"\"These creatures that have been popping up recently fall outside of any meaningful system of classification. And what's more, I have conducted enough autopsies on them to know that they do not belong here.\""
msgstr ""
"奥​基尼​博士​告诉​我​：​“​四十年​前​魔法​的​出现​给​生物学​外勤​工作​带来​了​新​的​变数​。​新​物种​不断​被​发现​，​但​这次​……​这次​情况​不同​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​这些​近期​频频​出现​的​生物​，​完全​无法​纳入​任何​有效​的​分类​体系​。​更​重要​的​是​，​我​对​它们​进行​过​足够​多​的​解剖​，​可以​断定​它们​不​属于​这个​世界​。​”\n"
"\n"
"ao4 ji1 ni2 bo2shi4 gao4su4 wo3：“si4 shi2 nian2 qian2 mo2fa3 de5 chu1xian4 gei3 sheng1wu4xue2 wai4qin2 gong1zuo4 dai4lai2 le5 xin1 de5 bian4shu4。xin1 wu4zhong3 bu4duan4 bei4 fa1xian4，dan4 zhe4 ci4……zhe4 ci4 qing2kuang4 bu4tong2。\n"
"\n"
"“zhe4xie1 jin4qi1 pin2pin2 chu1xian4 de5 sheng1wu4，wan2quan2 wu2fa3 na4ru4 ren4he2 you3xiao4 de5 fen1lei4 ti3xi4。geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4，wo3 dui4 ta1men5 jin4xing2 guo4 zu2gou4 duo1 de5 jie3pou1，ke3yi3 duan4ding4 ta1men5 bu4 shu3yu2 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4。”"

msgid ""
"\"This newly formed rift...\" - again, these are the words of Dr. Alder - \"...has essentially dragged Sydney off of our plane of experience and into another.\"\n"
"\n"
"She goes on to say that \"the city and all of its people might still be out there, somewhere, but they're no longer on this Earth. Not as we know it.\""
msgstr ""
"再次​引用​奥尔德​博士​的话​—​—​“​这条​新​形成​的​裂隙​本质​上​已​将​悉尼​从​我们​的​经验​维度​拖拽​到​了​另​一个​维度​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​接着​指出​：​“​这座​城市​及其​所有​居民​或许​仍​存在​于​某个​地方​，​但​他们​已​不复存在​于​我们​所知​的​地球​之上​。​”\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci4 yin3yong4 ao4 er3 de2 bo2shi4 de5hua4——“zhe4 tiao2 xin1 xing2cheng2 de5 lie4xi4 ben3zhi4 shang4 yi3 jiang1 xi1ni2 cong2 wo3men5 de5 jing1yan4 wei2du4 tuo1zhuai4 dao4 le5 ling4 yi1ge5 wei2du4。” \n"
"\n"
"ta1 jie1zhe5 zhi3chu1：“zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 ji2qi2 suo3you3 ju1min2 huo4xu3 reng2 cun2zai4 yu2 mou3 ge4 di4fang1，dan4 ta1men5 yi3 bu4 fu4 cun2 zai4 yu2 wo3men5 suo3zhi1 de5 di4qiu2 zhi1shang4。”"

msgid ""
"\"Trithemius\" took over the Magnifikers, militarized them, and convinced 'em that they could take us. And thanks to the element of surprise, they actually managed to do it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ork folds his arms across his burly chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Any day now, we're gonna show 'em exactly how bad an idea that was. I think I'll start by breaking Uri's neck."
msgstr ""
"“​特​里特​米​乌斯​”​接管​了​伟术​帮​，​对​其​进行​了​军事化​改造​，​并​使​其​相信​自己​能​打败​我们​。​凭借​出其不意​的​攻势​，​他们​居然​真的​做到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​兽​人​将​双臂​交叉​抱​在​魁梧​的​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​用​不了​多久​，​我们​就​会​让​他们​知道​这​主意​有多蠢​。​我​觉得​就​先​从​扭断​尤里​的​脖子​开始​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"“te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1” jie1guan3 le5 wei3 shu4 bang1，dui4 qi2 jin4xing2 le5 jun1shi4hua4 gai3zao4，bing4 shi3 qi2 xiang1xin4 zi4ji3 neng2 da3bai4 wo3men5。ping2jie4 chu1qi2bu4yi4 de5 gong1shi4，ta1men5 ju1ran2 zhen1de5 zuo4dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 jiang1 shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1 bao4 zai4 kui2wu2 de5 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yong4 bu4le5 duo1jiu3，wo3men5 jiu4 hui4 rang4 ta1men5 zhi1dao4 zhe4 zhu3yi5 you3 duo1 chun3。wo3 jue2de5 jiu4 xian1 cong2 niu3 duan4 You2li3 de5 bo2zi5 kai1shi3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"\"Want\"?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The slack-jawed man looks genuinely confused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is not our place to want. My brothers and I are grown here, gestated in tanks to serve our purpose."
msgstr ""
"“​愿意​”​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​目瞪口呆​的​男人​看起来​十分​困惑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不配​享有​“​愿意​”​。​我​和​我​的​兄弟​们​在​此​成长​，​在​培养​槽​中​孕育​，​只​为​达成​使命​。\n"
"\n"
"“yuan4yi4”？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mu4deng4kou3dai1 de5 nan2ren2 kan4qi3lai5 shi2fen1 kun4huo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4 pei4 xiang3you3“yuan4yi4”。wo3 he4 wo3 de5 xiong1di4 men5 zai4 ci3 cheng2zhang3，zai4 pei2yang3 cao2 zhong4 yun4yu4，zhi3 wei2 da2cheng2 shi3ming4。"

msgid ""
"\"Was\" is right. Now he is so much more... a creature of legend!\n"
"\n"
"Years of experimentation have remade the beast into the ultimate killing machine. He's smarter than ten men, and five times as deadly!"
msgstr ""
"“​过去​”​是​这样​。​但​现在​他​已​超越​了​那种​存在​……​成为​了​一个​传奇​生物​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​多年​的​实验​把​他​变成​了​终极​杀戮​机器​。​他​比​十个​人​更​聪明​，​而且​更​致命​五倍​！\n"
"\n"
"“guo4qu4” shi4 zhe4yang4。dan4 xian4zai4 ta1 yi3 chao1yue4 le5 na4zhong3 cun2zai4……cheng2wei2 le5 yi1ge5 chuan2qi2 sheng1wu4！\n"
"\n"
"duo1nian2 de5 shi2yan4 ba3 ta1 bian4cheng2 le5 zhong1ji2 sha1lu4 ji1qi4。ta1 bi3 shi2 ge4 ren2 geng1 cong1ming5，er2qie3 geng1 zhi4ming4 wu3 bei4！"

msgid ""
"\"We [metahumans] dodged a bullet this time,\" said Albrecht Haushofer, senior vice president of AG Chemie Europa.\n"
"\n"
"\"The dragons weren't so lucky. We're close to finding a cure, but I'm not sure that we're close enough to save them.\""
msgstr ""
"“​我们​[​泛​人类​]​这次​躲过一劫​，​”​欧洲​化工​公司​高级​副总裁​阿尔​布雷​希特​·​豪斯​霍夫​表示​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​但龙族​没​那么​幸运​。​我们​距离​找到​解药​已​近在咫尺​，​但​恐怕​还​不足以​拯救​它们​。​”\n"
"\n"
"“wo3men5[fan4 ren2lei4]zhe4 ci4 duo3 guo4 yi1 jie2，” ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 gong1si1 gao1ji2 fu4zong3cai2 e1 er3 bu4lei2 xi1 te4 · hao2 si1 huo4 fu1 biao3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"“dan4 long2 zu2 mei2 na4me5 xing4yun4。wo3men5 ju4li2 zhao3dao4 jie3yao4 yi3 jin4zai4zhi3chi3，dan4 kong3pa4 hai2 bu4 ju4 yi3 zheng3jiu4 ta1men5。”"

msgid ""
"\"We\"? Mein Schatz, either we are in the presence of royalty, or $(l.he) "
"has decided to keep on."
msgstr ""
"“​我们​”​？​亲爱​的​，​我​没有​听错​吧​，​看来​$(l.he)​决定​继续下去​了​。\n"
"“wo3men5”？qin1ai4 de5，wo3 mei2you3 ting1cuo4 ba1，kan4lai5 $(l.he) jue2ding4 ji4 xu4 xia4 qu4 le5。"

msgid "\"Wednesday.\""
msgstr ""
"“​星期三​。​”\n"
"“xing1qi1san1。”"

msgid ""
"$(l.name) has him under control. Dante performed well in the field. Followed"
" commands flawlessly. I have no concerns."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​完全​掌控​着​他​。​但丁​在​战场​上​表现出色​，​完美​执行​了​所有​命令​。​我​对此​毫无顾虑​。\n"
"$(l.name) wan2quan2 zhang3kong4 zhao2 ta1。dan4ding1 zai4 zhan4chang3 shang4 biao3 xian4 chu1 se4，wan2mei3 zhi2xing2 le5 suo3you3 ming4ling4。wo3 dui4 ci3 hao2 wu2 gu4 lu:4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name) is right, Marta.\n"
"\n"
"I want to save these kids. I do. But even if we do, they'll come out of this damaged, like I am.\n"
"\n"
"I didn't want to admit it, not even to myself. But this *has* to come to an end. And it won't be over until Harrow is dead."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​是​对​的​，​玛​尔塔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想要​拯救​这些​孩子​。​真的​。​但​即使​我们​成功​了​，​他们​受过​的​创伤​也​不会​消失​，​就​像​我​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​承认​这​一点​，​即使​是​对​我​自己​。​但​这​一切​*​必须​*​做个​了结​。​除了​哈罗​的​死亡​，​别无他法​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) shi4 dui4 de5，Ma3er3ta3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3yao4 zheng3jiu4 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5。zhen1de5。dan4 ji2shi3 wo3men5 cheng2gong1 le5，ta1men5 shou4guo4 de5 chuang1shang1 ye3 bu4hui4 xiao1shi1，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 cheng2ren4 zhe4 yi1dian3，ji2shi3 shi4 dui4 wo3 zi4ji3。dan4 zhe4 yi1qie4*bi4xu1*zuo4 ge4 liao3jie2。chu2le5 ha1luo2 de5 si3wang2，bie2wu2ta1fa3。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name) is right. A good runner knows that the run she's on is never what it seems. \n"
"\n"
"We’re “deniable assets” to our employers. Disposable goods. It's on us to succeed in spite of that. "
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​说得对​。​优秀​的​狂奔​者​就​该​知道​，​自己​跑​的​差事​从来不​会​那么​简单​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​是​雇主​眼中​的​“​可​否认​资产​”​。​是​一次性​商品​。​但​即便如此​，​成功​与否​也​只​取决于​我们​自己​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) shuo1 de2 dui4。you1xiu4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 jiu4 gai1 zhi1dao4，zi4ji3 pao2 de5 cha4shi4 cong2lai2bu4 hui4 na4me5 jian3dan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 gu4zhu3 yan3zhong1 de5“ke3 fou3ren4 zi1chan3”。shi4 yi1ci4xing4 shang1pin3。dan4 ji2 bian4 ru2 ci3，cheng2gong1 yu3fou3 ye3 zhi3 qu3jue2yu2 wo3men5 zi4ji3。"

msgid "$(l.name) is the reason we’re still alive, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"全靠​$(l.name)​，​我们​才能​活​下来​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"quan2 kao4 $(l.name)，wo3men5 cai2neng2 huo2 xia4lai5，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name) went to the trouble of fetching everything. Let $(l.him) do the "
"honors."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​费​了​不少​劲​才​凑齐​这些​东西​，​让​$(l.he)​来​吧​。\n"
"$(l.name) fei4 le5 bu4shao3 jin4 cai2 cou4qi2 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1，rang4 $(l.he) lai2 ba1。"

msgid "$(l.name) will take Monika’s place as the leader of this team."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​将​接替​莫妮卡​成为​队长​。\n"
"$(l.name) jiang1 jie1ti4 Mo4ni1ka3 cheng2wei2 dui4zhang3。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The razors flick back out of Glory's fingers. She locks eyes with Marta.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​利刃​从格洛丽​的​指间​弹出​。​她​与​玛​尔塔​四目​相对​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} li4ren4 cong2 Ge2luo4li2 de5 zhi3 jian1 tan2chu1。ta1 yu4 Ma3er3ta3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "$(l.name)! Look out!"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​！​小心​！\n"
"$(l.name)！xiao3xin1！"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)! What a relief it is to see you alive!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Samuel wraps you in an enormous hug.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You should know that your generosity has saved dozens of lives."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​！​看到​你​还​活着​真是​太好了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​塞缪尔​将​你​紧紧​搂​在​怀里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​知道​，​你​的​慷慨​救​了​几十条​性命​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)！kan4dao4 ni3 hai2 huo2zhe5 zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sai4miu4er3 jiang1 ni3 jin3jin3 lou1 zai4 huai2li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 zhi1dao4，ni3 de5 kang1kai3 jiu4 le5 ji1 shi2 tiao2 xing4ming4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)! What a relief it is to see you alive!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Samuel's face clouds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, many others were less fortunate."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​！​看到​你​还​活着​真是​太好了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​塞缪尔​的​脸​遍布​阴云​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可惜​，​还有​很多​人​就​没​这么​走运​了​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)！kan4dao4 ni3 hai2 huo2zhe5 zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sai4miu4er3 de5 lian3 bian4bu4 yin1yun2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1，hai2you3 hen3 duo1 ren2 jiu4 mei2 zhe4me5 zou3yun4 le5。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name),\n"
"\n"
"Couldn't wait for you any longer. Something is tracking me... something terrible.\n"
"\n"
"Need to get out of town, go dark for a while. If you're smart, you will, too, but a deal's a deal. When you punch the flashing button on the console, it'll spit out an optical chip with your information."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​\n"
"​\n"
"​不能​继续​等​你​了​。​有​什么​东西​在​追踪​我​……​某种​骇人​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​需要​离开​城市​，​潜伏​一段时间​。​如果​你够​聪明​的话​，​就​也​这么​做​。​但​说好​的​事​我​一定​会​做到​。​按下​控制​台上​的​闪烁​按钮​，​它会​吐出​一枚​刻有​你​所​需​情报​的​光学​芯片​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，\n"
"\n"
"bu4neng2 ji4xu4 deng3 ni3 le5。you3 shen2me5 dong1xi1 zai4 zhui1zong1 wo3……mou3zhong3 hai4ren2 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"xu1yao4 li2kai1 cheng2shi4，qian2fu2 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。ru2guo3 ni3 gou4 cong1ming5 de5hua4，jiu4 ye3 zhe4me5 zuo4。dan4 shuo1hao3 de5 shi4 wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 zuo4dao4。an4xia4 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 shan3shuo4 an4niu3，ta1 hui4 tu3 chu1 yi1 mei2 ke4 you3 ni3 suo3 xu1 qing2bao4 de5 guang1xue2 xin1pian4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name), I have new information to discuss about the estate. Please come "
"as soon as you can."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​关于​宅子​的​事情​，​我​有​新​情况​需要​与​你​商议​。​请​尽快​前来​。\n"
"$(l.name)，guan1yu2 zhai2zi5 de5 shi4qing5，wo3 you3 xin1 qing2kuang4 xu1yao4 yu4 ni3 shang1yi4。qing3 jin3kuai4 qian2lai2。"

msgid "$(l.name), I presume? Herr Amsel told me that I could meet you here."
msgstr ""
"你​就是​$(l.name)​吧​？​阿姆​泽尔​先生​要​我​来​这里​见​你​。\n"
"ni3 jiu4shi4 $(l.name) ba1？E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 yao4 wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 jian4 ni3。"

msgid "$(l.name), there is one other thing. You sh--"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​还有​另​一件​事​。​你​应该​—​—\n"
"$(l.name)，hai2you3 ling4 yi1 jian4 shi4。ni3 ying1gai1 — —"

msgid ""
"$(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Welcome back, and my congratulations on a job well done."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​回来​。​恭喜​你​出色完成​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5。gong1xi3 ni3 chu1 se4 wan2 cheng2 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel peers at you apprehensively. His eyes are bloodshot, his expression grim.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Did you get the information about Green Winters?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​忧心忡忡​地​打量​着​你​。​他​的​双眼​布满​血丝​，​神情​凝重​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有没有​拿到​关于​格林​·​温特斯​的​情报​？\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 you1xin1chong1chong1 de5 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 bu4man3 xue4si1，shen2qing2 ning2zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 na2dao4 guan1yu2 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 qing2bao4？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Doctor Ezkibel gives you a once-over and nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I see that you made it through the attack relatively unscathed."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​快速​打量​了​你​一下​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​那场​袭击​没有​把​你​怎么样​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 kuai4su4 da3liang5 le5 ni3 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 na4 chang2 xi2ji1 mei2you3 ba3 ni3 zen3me5yang4 a1。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory shifts her gaze to you, but her expression is as cool and placid as always.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can I help you?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​将​目光​转向​你​，​但​她​的​表情​依旧​冷峻​而​平静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 jiang1 mu4guang1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，dan4 ta1 de5 biao3qing2 yi1jiu4 leng3jun4 er2 ping2jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for coming."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​过来​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 guo4lai2。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The stranger smiles and raises his drink in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm glad you could come."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​陌生人​微微一笑​，​举杯​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​高兴​你​能​来​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mo4sheng1ren2 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4，ju3bei1 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 neng2 lai2。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). A job well done, as usual... and the plan has worked swimmingly, I might add.\n"
"\n"
"I am already patched in to the Knight Errant comm system. If and when they summon their High Threat Response Team, I will know it."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​干得​漂亮​，​一如既往​……​而且​不得不​说​，​计划​进行​得​相当​顺利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已​接入​游侠​骑士​的​通讯​系统​。​如果​他们​召集​高危​应急​小组​，​我会​第一​时间​知晓​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，gan4 de2 piao4liang5，yi1ru2ji4wang3……er2qie3 bu4de2bu4 shuo1，ji4hua4 jin4xing2 de2 xiang1dang1 shun4li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3 jie1ru4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 tong1xun4 xi4tong3。ru2guo3 ta1men5 zhao4ji2 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3，wo3 hui4 di4yi1 shi2jian1 zhi1xiao3。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). A pleasure, as always.\n"
"\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​看到​你​，​还是​一如既往​令人高兴​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​为​你​做​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。kan4dao4 ni3，hai2shi5 yi1ru2ji4wang3 ling3 ren2 gao1 xing4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). C'mon.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gestures at himself with a flourish.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Blitz is always *one hundred percent* focused."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​放心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​得意​地​指指​自己​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​布里​茨​永远​是​*​百分百​*​专注​的​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，fang4xin1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de2yi4 de5 zhi3 zhi3 zi4ji3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 yong3yuan3 shi4*bai3fen1bai3*zhuan1zhu4 de5。"

msgid "$(l.name). Did you make contact with Alice?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​联系​上​爱丽丝​了​吗​？\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 lian2xi4 shang4 ai4li4si1 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Do not speak, just listen.\n"
"\n"
"I have a proposition for you."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​别​说话​，​听​我​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​个​提议​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，bie4 shuo1hua4，ting1 wo3 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Do you feel thirsty? I do... parched, in fact. It happened when you walked through the door.\n"
"\n"
"I could really go for a cold one."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​你​口渴​吗​？​……​我​倒​是​焦渴​难耐​。​从​你​踏进​门​的​那​一刻起​便​开始​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真​想来​瓶​冰镇​饮料​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。ni3 kou3ke3 ma5？……wo3 dao3 shi4 jiao1 ke3 nan2 nai4。cong2 ni3 ta4jin4 men2 de5 na4 yi1 ke4 qi3 bian4 kai1shi3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 xiang3lai2 ping2 bing1zhen4 yin3liao4。"

msgid "$(l.name). Fancy seeing you again."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​又​见面​了​。\n"
"$(l.name)，you4 jian4mian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Greetings.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel peers at you through a battered old pair of wire-rimmed glasses. There is something gentle about the man; with his silver hair and his tweed jacket, he looks more like an aging Art History professor than he does like a criminal go-between.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Is there something that I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"你好​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​透过​一副​破旧​的​金属​框​眼镜​打量​着​你​。​这位​银发​苍苍​、​身着​粗花呢​夹克​的​男子​看起来​温文尔雅​，​更​像是​一位​年迈​的​艺术史​教授​，​而​非​犯罪​中间人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​事​需要​我​帮忙​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 tou4guo4 yi1 fu4 po4jiu4 de5 jin1shu3 kuang4 yan3jing4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3。zhe4wei4 yin2fa4 cang1cang1、shen1zhuo2 cu1 hua1 ni2 jia1ke4 de5 nan2zi3 kan4qi3lai5 wen1wen2er3ya3，geng1 xiang4 shi4 yi1 wei4 nian2mai4 de5 yi4shu4shi3 jiao4shou4，er2 fei1 fan4zui4 zhong1jian1ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 shi4 xu1yao4 wo3 bang1mang2 ma5？"

msgid "$(l.name). Have you procured a DVD reader?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​拿到​DVD​播放器​了​吗​？\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 na2dao4 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Hold a moment, I'll call Aljernon for you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses, squinting at you. Her mouth dips into a frown.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Curious... when I look at you, I see red."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​稍​等​，​我​去​帮​你​叫​阿尔杰​农​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​下​，​眯眼​看着​你​。​她​的​嘴角​微微​皱起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​奇怪​……​我​从​你​身上​看到​了​一片​红色​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。shao1 deng3，wo3 qu4 bang1 ni3 jiao4 E1er3jie2nong2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 xia4，mi1yan3 kan4 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 wei1wei1 zhou4qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qi2guai4……wo3 cong2 ni3 shen1shang5 kan4dao4 le5 yi1 pian1 hong2se4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). I have new information.\n"
"\n"
"I'm afraid that the news isn't good."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​有​新​的​情报​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​是​个​坏消息​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 you3 xin1 de5 qing2bao4。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 shi4 ge4 huai4 xiao1 xi1。"

msgid "$(l.name). I trust that I’m catching you at a good time?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​现在​方便​说话​吗​？\n"
"$(l.name)，xian4zai4 fang1bian4 shuo1hua4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). I would like to thank you for your continual assistance over the course of the past few weeks.\n"
"\n"
"Ascending the ladder of an organization like mine is never easy, but it's much simpler when an ally such as yourself volunteers to do the heavy lifting."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​想​感谢​你​在​过去​几周​里​的​持续​协助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我们​这种​组织​里​，​想​往上爬​绝非易事​。​但​有​你​这样​的​盟友​自愿​担负​重任​，​事情​就​简单​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 xiang3 gan3xie4 ni3 zai4 guo4qu4 ji1 zhou1 li3 de5 chi2xu4 xie2zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3men5 zhe4zhong3 zu3zhi1 li3，xiang3 wang3 shang4 pa2 jue2 fei1 yi4 shi4。dan4 you3 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 meng2you3 zi4yuan4 dan1fu4 zhong4ren4，shi4qing5 jiu4 jian3dan1 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). I'll admit it... you did a hell of a good job back there.\n"
"\n"
"I couldn't've done better myself."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​不得不​说​……​你​当时​的​表现​真是太​出色​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​换​我​可不​一定​能​做​得​更好​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，bu4de2bu4 shuo1……ni3 dang1shi2 de5 biao3xian4 zhen1 shi4 tai4 chu1se4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 wo3 ke3bu5 yi1ding4 neng2 zuo4 de2 geng1 hao3。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). I'm afraid that I have some bad news... the High Threat Response Team is on its way.\n"
"\n"
"It's only a matter of time before they close in on your position."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​这​有​个​坏消息​……​恐怕​游侠​骑士​高危​应急​小组​已经​在​路上​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​迫近​你​的​位置​只是​时间​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 zhe4 you3 ge4 huai4 xiao1 xi1……kong3pa4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3 yi3jing1 zai4 lu4shang5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 po4jin4 ni3 de5 wei4zhi5 zhi3shi4 shi2jian1 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). I'm glad to see that you made it through the attack.\n"
"\n"
"Not all of mine were so lucky."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​我​很​高兴​你​从​袭击​中活​下来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​人​有些​就​没​这么​幸运​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 cong2 xi2ji1 zhong4 huo2 xia4lai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 ren2 you3xie1 jiu4 mei2 zhe4me5 xing4yun4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). It does me good to know that you're still fightin' the good fight.\n"
"\n"
"You just tell me what you need, and my boys'll go fetch it for you."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​知道​你​还​在​战斗​，​我​很​欣慰​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​只要​告诉​我​你​需要​什么​，​我​的​人​就​会​去​帮​你​拿​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。zhi1dao4 ni3 hai2 zai4 zhan4dou4，wo3 hen3 xin1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi3yao4 gao4su4 wo3 ni3 xu1yao4 shen2me5，wo3 de5 ren2 jiu4 hui4 qu4 bang1 ni3 na2 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Listen to me. Your pal is a thief, and a killer, and a rat.\n"
"\n"
"You push that button, and I'll die, sure. But Mr. Grinder is waiting for me, and he's waiting for this box. And you don't want the kind of trouble that's gonna come your way if I don't get it to him."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​听​我​说​。​你​这位​朋友​是​小偷​，​是​杀手​，​还是​内​鬼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​按​下​按钮​的话​，​我​是​肯定​会​死​，​但​“​绞肉机​”​先生​还​在​等​我​，​以及​这个​盒子​。​如果​我​没能​送达​的话​，​你​也​不​希望​看到​这样​做​给​自己​招来​的​麻烦​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ting1 wo3 shuo1。ni3 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 shi4 xiao3tou1，shi4 sha1shou3，hai2shi5 nei4 gui3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 an4niu3 de5hua4，wo3 shi4 ken3ding4 hui4 si3，dan4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 hai2 zai4 deng3 wo3，yi3ji2 zhe4ge5 he2zi5。ru2guo3 wo3 mei2 neng2 song4da2 de5hua4，ni3 ye3 bu4 xi1wang4 kan4dao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 gei3 zi4ji3 zhao1lai2 de5 ma2fan5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Look. I'm about to tell you some things about myself that might change your opinion of me.\n"
"\n"
"It's entirely possible that you're going to hate me based on what's coming up next. I've accepted that, and if that's what happens, I sincerely believe that I deserve it. "
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​听​好​，​我​将​对​你​说​的​这些​事情​可能​会​改变​你​对​我​的​看法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​接下来​我​要说​的话​，​很​可能​会​让​你​恨​我​入骨​。​我​已经​做好​了​心理准备​，​如果​真​会​这样​，​我​也​真心​觉得​这​是​我​自己​活该​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 ting1 hao3，wo3 jiang1 dui4 ni3 shuo1 de5 zhe4xie1 shi4qing5 ke3neng2 hui4 gai3bian4 ni3 dui4 wo3 de5 kan4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"jie1xia4lai2 wo3 yao4shuo1 de5hua4，hen3 ke3neng2 hui4 rang4 ni3 hen4 wo3 ru4 gu3。wo3 yi3jing1 zuo4 hao3 le5 xin1 li3 zhun3 bei4，ru2guo3 zhen1 hui4 zhe4yang4，wo3 ye3 zhen1xin1 jue2de5 zhe4 shi4 wo3 zi4ji3 huo2gai1。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). My secret weapon.\n"
"\n"
"I've run enough with $(l.name) to know that $(l.he)'s trustworthy. Good in a fight, too. But beyond all of that, it's good just to see $(l.him) again."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​的​秘密武器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​$(l.name)​并肩作战​的​次数​多到​足以​让​我​完全​信任​$(l.he)​。​而且​$(l.he)​在​战斗​中​也​是​一把​好手​。​但​话说回来​，​能​再次​见到​$(l.he)​本身​就让​我​很​高兴​了​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 de5 bi4 mi4 wu3 qi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 $(l.name) bing4jian1zuo4zhan4 de5 ci4shu4 duo1 dao4 zu2yi3 rang4 wo3 wan2quan2 xin4ren4 $(l.he)。er2qie3 $(l.he) zai4 zhan4dou4 zhong4 ye3 shi4 yi1 ba3 hao3shou3。dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，neng2 zai4ci4 jian4dao4 $(l.he) ben3shen1 jiu4 rang4 wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 le5。"

msgid "$(l.name). The job is done, I trust?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​我​想​是​差事​完成​了​吧​？\n"
"$(l.name)。wo3 xiang3 shi4 cha4shi4 wan2cheng2 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). The savior of our people.\n"
"\n"
"What can I do for you, $(l.freund)?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​我们​人民​的​大​救星​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​为​你​做​什么​，​$(l.freund)​？\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。wo3men5 ren2min2 de5 dai4 jiu4xing1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5，$(l.freund)？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). This facility is already on high alert.\n"
"\n"
"These disguises aren't going to help us."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​这所​设施​已经​处于​高度​戒备状态​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​伪装​帮​不到​我们​的​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，zhe4 suo3 she4shi1 yi3jing1 chu3yu2 gao1du4 jie4 bei4 zhuang4 tai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 wei3zhuang1 bang1 bu4dao4 wo3men5 de5。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). We have received reports that you may be headed into the Humanis compound.\n"
"\n"
"It is vital that their current leader remain unharmed. \n"
"\n"
"Other Humanis personnel are of little consequence... you may do with them what you will. But Volker Stahl is ours.\n"
"\n"
"Do not disappoint us."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我们​收到​报告​称​，​你​可能​要​去​人类​至上​主义者​据点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​务必​不要​伤害​他们​的​现任​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​其他​成员​无关紧要​，​任​你​处置​……​但​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔​是​我们​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​让​我们​失望​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3men5 shou1dao4 bao4gao4 chen4，ni3 ke3neng2 yao4 qu4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ju4dian3。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 wu4bi4 bu4yao4 shang1hai4 ta1men5 de5 xian4ren4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"qi2ta1 cheng2yuan2 wu2guan1jin3yao4，ren4 ni3 chu3zhi4……dan4 Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3 shi4 wo3men5 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 rang4 wo3men5 shi1wang4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Welcome back to Aljernon's. Enjoy your time here in the light.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A half-smile flits across her lips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Soon enough, you'll be wallowing in darkness."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​欢迎​回到​阿尔杰​农​的​店​。​愿​你​在​此​光明​之地​尽享​时光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​唇角​掠过​一抹​浅笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要不了​多久​，​你​便​将​沉溺于​黑暗​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，huan1ying2 hui2dao4 E1er3jie2nong2 de5 dian4。yuan4 ni3 zai4 ci3 guang1ming2 zhi1 de5 jin3 xiang3 shi2guang1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chun2jiao3 lu:e4guo4 yi1 ma1 jian1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4 bu4 le5 duo1jiu3，ni3 bian4 jiang1 chen2 ni4 yu2 hei1an4 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Welcome back.\n"
"\n"
"I have news for you."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​欢迎​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​消息​要​告诉​你​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，huan1ying2 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 xiao1xi5 yao4 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid "$(l.name). What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我能​为​你​做些​什么​？\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid "$(l.name). What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​有事吗​？\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). When you speak with the men-who-are-not-men, the fleshy puppets imprisoned behind glass, you must remember that they dream.\n"
"\n"
"They may not be real people by your definition of the term, but they do have dreams. That alone makes them worth saving."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​。​当​你​与​那些​非人​的​存在​，​那些​被​囚禁​在​玻璃​后​的​血肉​傀儡​对话​时​，​务必​记住​，​他们​也​会​做梦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​按​你​的​定义​，​他们​或许​不算​真正​的​人类​，​但​他们​确实​也​有​梦境​。​仅凭​这​一点​，​就​值得​我们​拯救​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。dang1 ni3 yu4 na4xie1 fei1ren2 de5 cun2zai4，na4xie1 bei4 qiu2jin4 zai4 bo1li5 hou4 de5 xue4rou4 kui3lei3 dui4hua4 shi2，wu4bi4 ji4zhu5，ta1men5 ye3 hui4 zuo4meng4。\n"
"\n"
"an4 ni3 de5 ding4yi4，ta1men5 huo4xu3 bu4suan4 zhen1zheng4 de5 ren2lei4，dan4 ta1men5 que4shi2 ye3 you3 meng4jing4。jin3 ping2 zhe4 yi1dian3，jiu4 zhi2de5 wo3men5 zheng3jiu4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). Why would you think that I'd want to frighten you?\n"
"\n"
"I promise you, my intentions are completely innocent. In fact, ace, I'm on your side."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​为什么​会​觉得​我​想​吓唬​你​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你​保证​，​我​的​意图​完全​是​无害​的​。​事实上​，​王牌​，​我​是​站​在​你​这边​的​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 wei4shen2me5 hui4 jue2de5 wo3 xiang3 xia4hu5 ni3？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，wo3 de5 yi4tu2 wan2quan2 shi4 wu2hai4 de5。shi4shi2shang4，wang2pai2，wo3 shi4 zhan4 zai4 ni3 zhe4bian1 de5。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). You got us through the night alive.\n"
"\n"
"Well done."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​让​我们​活过​了​这​一夜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​干得​漂亮​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 rang4 wo3men5 huo2 guo4 le5 zhe4 yi1 ye4。\n"
"\n"
"gan4 de2 piao4liang5。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). You should probably be getting ready for your trip to Das "
"Kesselhaus... time is short."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​应该​加紧​准备​去​“​锅炉房​”​了​……​时间​不​等​人​。\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 ying1gai1 jia1jin3 zhun3bei4 qu4“Guo1lu2fang2” le5……shi2jian1 bu4 deng3 ren2。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name). You'll have to excuse me... I don't have much time.\n"
"\n"
"Several of my volunteers are still missing, and while their odds of survival are vanishingly low, I must assist in the search. At the very least we can recover their bodies."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​请​你​原谅​……​我​没有​多少​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​几名​志愿者​仍然​下落不明​，​虽然​他们​生还​的​几率​微乎其微​，​但​我​必须​协助​搜寻​。​至少​我们​可以​找到​他们​的​尸体​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，qing3 ni3 yuan2liang4……wo3 mei2you3 duo1shao3 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 ji1 ming2 zhi4yuan4zhe3 reng2ran2 xia4luo4bu4ming2，sui1ran2 ta1men5 sheng1huan2 de5 ji1lu:4 wei1hu1qi2wei1，dan4 wo3 bi4xu1 xie2zhu4 sou1xun2。zhi4shao3 wo3men5 ke3yi3 zhao3dao4 ta1men5 de5 shi1ti3。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)... I have to stop him, before it's too late. What happened to that"
" town... it can't be allowed to happen again in Schattennest."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​……​我​必须​在​一切​无可挽回​之前​阻止​他​。​那个​小镇​遭遇​的​悲剧​……​绝不能​在​影巢​重演​。\n"
"$(l.name)……wo3 bi4xu1 zai4 yi1qie4 wu2ke3wan3hui2 zhi1qian2 zu3zhi3 ta1。na4ge5 xiao3zhen4 zao1yu4 de5 bei1ju4……jue2 bu4 neng2 zai4 ying3 chao2 chong2yan3。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)... before I'm gone... there's something that you should see.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles at you, and shafts of light spill out from between her teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The truth. I wanted to tell you earlier, but I couldn't."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​……​在​我​消失​之前​……​有些​东西​该​让​你​看看​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​对​你​露出​微笑​，​光束​从​她​齿缝​间​倾泻​而出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真相​。​我​早就​想​告诉​你​，​但​我​做​不到​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……zai4 wo3 xiao1shi1 zhi1qian2……you3xie1 dong1xi1 gai1 rang4 ni3 kan4kan5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4，guang1shu4 cong2 ta1 chi3 feng2 jian1 qing1xie4 er2 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1xiang4。wo3 zao3jiu4 xiang3 gao4su4 ni3，dan4 wo3 zuo4 bu4dao4。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)... do me a favor. Sweep the building for intel - anything that we "
"might have missed on the way in."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​……​帮​我​个​忙​。​在​大楼​里​找​找​情报​—​—​看看​我们​进来​的​路上​有没有​遗漏​任何​东西​。\n"
"$(l.name)……bang1 wo3 ge4 mang2。zai4 da4lou2 li3 zhao3 zhao3 qing2bao4——kan4kan5 wo3men5 jin4lai2 de5 lu4shang5 you3mei2you3 yi2lou4 ren4he2 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Ezkibel tries to hide the surprise in his voice. He doesn't do a very good job.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What a pleasant surprise! I was wondering when I'd have the good fortune to meet you!\n"
"\n"
"If you don't mind me asking... what are you doing on this line?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​埃兹​基​贝尔​想要​掩藏​声音​中​的​惊讶​，​然而​却​并​没​成功​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​……​让​我​惊喜​啊​！​我​还​想​什么​时候​有​机会​认识​你​呢​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​请容​我​问​一句​……​你​联系​我​是​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai1ziji1bei4er3 xiang3yao4 yan3cang2 sheng1yin1 zhong4 de5 jing1ya4，ran2er2 que4 bing4 mei2 cheng2gong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5……rang4 wo3 jing1xi3 a1！wo3 hai2 xiang3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 you3 ji1hui4 ren4shi5 ni3 ni2！\n"
"\n"
"qing3 rong2 wo3 wen4 yi1ju4……ni3 lian2xi4 wo3 shi4 you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Ezkibel tries to hide the surprise in his voice. He doesn't do a very good job.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What... a pleasant surprise! I was wondering when I'd have the good fortune to meet you!"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​埃兹​基​贝尔​想要​掩藏​声音​中​的​惊讶​，​然而​却​并​没​成功​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​……​让​我​惊喜​啊​！​我​还​想​什么​时候​有​机会​认识​你​呢​！\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai1ziji1bei4er3 xiang3yao4 yan3cang2 sheng1yin1 zhong4 de5 jing1ya4，ran2er2 que4 bing4 mei2 cheng2gong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5……rang4 wo3 jing1xi3 a1！wo3 hai2 xiang3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 you3 ji1hui4 ren4shi5 ni3 ni2！"

msgid ""
"$(l.name)?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Ezkibel tries to hide the surprise in his voice. He doesn't do a very good job.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What... what are you doing on this line, my friend?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​埃兹​基​贝尔​想要​掩藏​声音​中​的​惊讶​，​然而​却​并​没​成功​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​……​朋友​，​怎么​会​是​你​打​给​我​的​？\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai1ziji1bei4er3 xiang3yao4 yan3cang2 sheng1yin1 zhong4 de5 jing1ya4，ran2er2 que4 bing4 mei2 cheng2gong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5……peng2you5，zen3me5 hui4 shi4 ni3 da3 gei3 wo3 de5？"

msgid "$(l.name)? Can you hear me?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​？​你​能​听到​吗​？\n"
"$(l.name)？ni3 neng2 ting1dao4 ma5？"

msgid "$(s.name)."
msgstr ""
"$(s.name)​。\n"
"$(s.name)。"

msgid "$(s.name). And you are?"
msgstr ""
"我​叫​$(s.name)​。​你​是​？\n"
"wo3 jiao4 $(s.name)。ni3 shi4？"

msgid "$(scene.CountRoundsBomb) rounds until the bombs explode."
msgstr ""
"$(scene.CountRoundsBomb)​回合​后​炸弹​将​爆炸​。\n"
"$(scene.CountRoundsBomb) hui2he2 hou4 zha4dan4 jiang1 bao4zha4。"

msgid "$(scene.sFakeName). I'm a contractor."
msgstr ""
"$(scene.sFakeName)​。​我​是​个​外​包工​。\n"
"$(scene.sFakeName)。wo3 shi4 ge4 wai4 bao1gong1。"

msgid "$(story.Global_HavenLoadingScreen)"
msgstr ""
"$(story.Global_HavenLoadingScreen)\n"
"$(story.Global_HavenLoadingScreen)"

msgid "$(story.a3_Endgame_s4_LoadingScreen)"
msgstr ""
"$(story.a3_Endgame_s4_LoadingScreen)\n"
"$(story.a3_Endgame_s4_LoadingScreen)"

msgid ""
"$+(l.he) isn't being cute, jackass. $+(l.he)'s accurately describing the situation.\n"
"\n"
"Obviously, Meat Grinder wants you out of the way. "
msgstr ""
"$+(l.he)​不是​在​卖关子​，​笨蛋​。​$+(l.he)​是​在​精准​描述​目前​的​状况​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​绞肉机​”​显然​是​想​除掉​你​。\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) bu4shi4 zai4 mai4guan1zi5，ben4dan4。$+(l.he) shi4 zai4 jing1zhun3 miao2shu4 mu4qian2 de5 zhuang4kuang4。\n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” xian3ran2 shi4 xiang3 chu2diao4 ni3。"

msgid "$+(l.he) looks fed, for one thing."
msgstr ""
"$+(l.he)​看起来​倒​没有​饿肚子​。\n"
"$+(l.he) kan4qi3lai5 dao3 mei2you3 e4du4zi5。"

msgid ""
"$+(l.he) wasn't telling $(l.him)self.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She slaps him across the face, splitting his lip down the middle. The impact sounds like a gunshot.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) was telling *you.*"
msgstr ""
"$+(l.he)​不是​在​跟​自己​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​一巴掌​扇​在​他​脸上​，​把​他​的​嘴唇​打​得​裂开​。​那​声响​就​像​枪响​一样​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$+(l.he)​是​在​跟​*​你​*​说​。\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) bu4shi4 zai4 gen1 zi4ji3 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 ba1 zhang3 shan1 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4，ba3 ta1 de5 zui3chun2 da3 de2 lie4kai1。na4 sheng1xiang3 jiu4 xiang4 qiang1 xiang3 yi1yang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) shi4 zai4 gen1*ni3*shuo1。"

msgid ""
"$+(l.he)'s not threatening you. $+(l.he)'s threatening your business. And I'm helping $(l.him).\n"
"\n"
"Whatcha wanna bet we can make a mess of this place before you bring in enough goons to drop us?\n"
"\n"
"I'm betting we can."
msgstr ""
"$+(l.he)​威胁​的​不是​你​，​而是​你​的​生意​。​而且​我​也​打算​帮​$(l.he)​一把​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​不要​打个​赌​？​看看​是​我们​先​把​这​地方​搅个​底朝天​，​还是​你​能​先​喊​人​把​我们​揍​趴下​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​反正​会押​我们​这边​赢​。\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) wei1xie2 de5 bu4shi4 ni3，er2shi4 ni3 de5 sheng1yi4。er2qie3 wo3 ye3 da3suan4 bang1 $(l.he) yi1 ba3。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 bu4yao4 da3 ge4 du3？kan4kan5 shi4 wo3men5 xian1 ba3 zhe4 di4fang1 jiao3 ge4 di3chao2tian1，hai2shi5 ni3 neng2 xian1 han3 ren2 ba3 wo3men5 zou4 pa1 xia4？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 fan3zheng4 hui4 ya1 wo3men5 zhe4bian1 ying2。"

msgid ""
"$+(l.he)'s right, Vauclair. Your brother died trying to save you.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't turn back from this, his death will have meant nothing - nothing at all."
msgstr ""
"$+(l.he)​说得对​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​弟弟​是​为了​救​你​而​死​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不能​悬崖勒马​的话​，​他​的​死​就​毫无意义​。\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) shuo1 de2 dui4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 di4di5 shi4 wei4le5 jiu4 ni3 er2 si3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4neng2 xuan2ya2le4ma3 de5hua4，ta1 de5 si3 jiu4 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4。"

msgid ""
"$+(l.he)'s right, Vauclair. Your brother was a miserable bastard, but he did die trying to save you.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't turn back from this, his death will have meant nothin' - nothin' at all."
msgstr ""
"$+(l.he)​说得对​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​弟弟​就是​个​倒霉​催​的​混蛋​，​但​他​确实​是​为了​救​你​而​死​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不能​悬崖勒马​的话​，​他​的​死​就​毫无意义​。\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) shuo1 de2 dui4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 di4di5 jiu4shi4 ge4 dao3mei2 cui1 de5 hun2dan4，dan4 ta1 que4shi2 shi4 wei4le5 jiu4 ni3 er2 si3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4neng2 xuan2ya2le4ma3 de5hua4，ta1 de5 si3 jiu4 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4。"

msgid "$++(L.NAME)."
msgstr ""
"$++(L.NAME)​。\n"
"$++(L.NAME)。"

msgid ""
"$++(L.NAME). YOU HAVE DONE WELL.\n"
"\n"
"I HAVE TAKEN POSSESSION OF THE HARFELD FACILITY. ALL OF ITS FUNCTIONS ARE MINE NOW.\n"
"\n"
"THE DRAGON IS UNDER MY CONTROL."
msgstr ""
"$++(L.NAME)​，​你​做​得​很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已​接管​哈​菲尔德​设施​。​其​所有​功能​现归​我​所有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​已受​我​控制​。\n"
"\n"
"$++(L.NAME)，ni3 zuo4 de2 hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3 jie1guan3 Ha1fei1er3de2 she4shi1。qi2 suo3you3 gong1neng2 xian4 gui1 wo3 suo3you3。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 yi3 shou4 wo3 kong4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"'Bout three years ago. Spent a few months there... it was a business trip, though. You know how it is - straight from the airport to the hotel to the job site, and back to the hotel again afterwards. Rinse and repeat until the job is done. \n"
"\n"
"Not the most exciting way to travel, but the pay was good."
msgstr ""
"大约​三年​前​吧​。​在​那里​待​了​几个​月​……​不过​都​是​出差​行程​。​你​懂​的​，​机场​、​酒店​、​工作​现场​三点一线​，​如此​反复​，​直到​工作​完成​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不是​什么​最​令人兴奋​的​旅行​方式​，​但​报酬​还​算​可观​。\n"
"\n"
"da4yue1 san1 nian2 qian2 ba1。zai4 na4li5 dai1 le5 ji3ge5 yue4……bu4guo4 dou1 shi4 chu1chai1 xing2cheng2。ni3 dong3 de5，ji1chang3、jiu3dian4、gong1zuo4 xian4chang3 san1 dian3 yi1 xian4，ru2ci3 fan3fu4，zhi2dao4 gong1zuo4 wan2cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 zui4 ling3 ren2 xing4 fen4 de5 lu:3xing2 fang1shi4，dan4 bao4chou5 hai2 suan4 ke3guan1。"

msgid "'Course it does. In Berlin's decker community, I'm a household name."
msgstr ""
"那​是​当然​的​了​。​在​柏林​的​碟​客​圈子​，​我​的​名字​可以​说​是​无人不晓​。\n"
"na4 shi4 dang1ran2 de5 le5。zai4 bo2lin2 de5 die2 ke4 quan1zi5，wo3 de5 ming2zi5 ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 wu2ren2bu4xiao3。"

msgid ""
"'Course it is! Because he's a Knight-King, right, Phil?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He elbows you in the ribs, grinning ear to ear.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You go get 'em, man! Show the world! You can do it!"
msgstr ""
"当然​了​！​因为​他​是​骑士​之王​，​对​吧​，​菲尔​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴​笑​着​，​用​胳膊肘​轻轻​杵​了​你​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​吧​，​伙计​！​向​全世界​证明​！​你​能​做到​！\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 le5！yin1wei4 ta1 shi4 qi2shi4 zhi1 wang2，dui4 ba1，fei1 er3？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3zui3 xiao4 zhao2，yong4 ge1bo5zhou3 qing1qing1 chu3 le5 ni3 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 ba1，huo3ji5！xiang4 quan2shi4jie4 zheng4ming2！ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4！"

msgid ""
"'Course it is! I wouldn't go behind your back on anything that *wasn't* fair, chief.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is an awkward pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I, uh, just didn't want to bother you, is all."
msgstr ""
"当然​了​！​我​绝对​不会​背着​你​偷偷​搞小动作​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一阵​尴尬​的​沉默​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​不想​太​麻烦​你​，​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 le5！wo3 jue2dui4 bu4hui4 bei1zhe5 ni3 tou1tou1 gao3 xiao3 dong4 zuo4，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1zhen4 gan1ga4 de5 chen2mo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 bu4xiang3 tai4 ma2fan5 ni3，jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"'Course not. The Dragonslayer doesn't want me to die.\n"
"\n"
"But He *does* want me to kill dragons. That ain't supposed to be safe, or easy."
msgstr ""
"怎么​会​呢​，​屠龙​者​并​不是​想要​我​的​命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他​*​确实​*​是​想要​我​屠龙​，​这事​可​谈不上​安全​或者​轻松​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 hui4 ni2，tu2 long2 zhe3 bing4 bu4shi4 xiang3yao4 wo3 de5 ming4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1*que4shi2*shi4 xiang3yao4 wo3 tu2 long2，zhe4 shi4 ke3 tan2bu5shang4 an1quan2 huo4zhe3 qing1song1。"

msgid ""
"'Course you are.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gestures at himself with a flourish.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What's not to be happy about?\n"
msgstr ""
"那​必须​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​得意​地​指指​自己​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​能​不乐意​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"na4 bi4xu1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de2yi4 de5 zhi3 zhi3 zi4ji3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"neng2 bu4 le4 yi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"'Course you do. Go on, then.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich nods his head at you in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Won't be the first evening I've spent drinking alone, and it won't be the last."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​你​有​活要​干​，​那​赶紧​去​呗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希朝​你​点头​示意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​我​孤零零​喝上​一​整晚​也​不是​第一次​了​，​估摸​着​也​不是​最后​一次​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，ni3 you3 huo2 yao4 gan4，na4 gan3jin3 qu4 bei5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 ni3 dian3tou2 shi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 wo3 gu1ling2ling2 he4 shang4 yi1 zheng3 wan3 ye3 bu4shi4 di4yi1ci4 le5，gu1mo5 zhao2 ye3 bu4shi4 zui4hou4 yi1ci4。"

msgid "'Course, man. You've got nothing to worry about from me anymore."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​你​不用​再​担心​我会​做​什么​了​。\n"
"dang1ran2。ni3 bu4yong4 zai4 dan1xin1 wo3 hui4 zuo4 shen2me5 le5。"

msgid ""
"'Course. I might be able to sit around feelin' pleased with myself if I "
"followed the Creator, or the Moon Maiden. But the Dragonslayer ain't that "
"kind of idol."
msgstr ""
"对​啊​。​要是​追随​造物者​或​月​之​少女​，​那​我​或许​还​能​自得其乐​，​但​屠龙​者​可不是​这样​的​精魂​导师​。\n"
"dui4 a1。yao4shi5 zhui1sui2 zao4 wu4 zhe3 huo4 yue4 zhi1 shao4nu:3，na4 wo3 huo4xu3 hai2 neng2 zi4de2qi2le4，dan4 tu2 long2 zhe3 ke3bu5shi4 zhe4yang4 de5 jing1hun2 dao3shi1。"

msgid "'Fraid I can't help you there. Sorry, Phil."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​我​帮不了​你​。​抱歉​，​菲尔​。\n"
"kong3pa4 wo3 bang1 bu4 le5 ni3。bao4qian4，fei1 er3。"

msgid "'Fraid not."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​没有​。\n"
"kong3pa4 mei2you3。"

msgid ""
"'Fraid so. And by all accounts, they've gotten worse recently... the guy that filled the power vacuum when their last leader bit it is a real piece of work.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stabs a meaty finger down on the faded silhouette of a building.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. This warehouse, right here, is Rammbock HQ. That's where the Engineer is staying."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​而且​他们​最近​愈发​猖獗​了​……​自打​他们​上任​首领​死​掉​之后​，​填补​权力​真空​的​那个​家伙​绝对​是​个​麻烦​人物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​粗壮​的​手指​戳​向​一栋​褪色​的​建筑​轮廓​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​这座​仓库​就是​撞锤​帮​的​总部​。​而​工程师​就​住​在​那儿​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。er2qie3 ta1men5 zui4jin4 yu4fa1 chang1jue2 le5……zi4da3 ta1men5 shang4ren4 shou3ling3 si3 diao4 zhi1hou4，tian2bu3 quan2li4 zhen1kong1 de5 na4ge5 jia1huo5 jue2dui4 shi4 ge4 ma2fan5 ren2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 cu1zhuang4 de5 shou3zhi3 chuo1 xiang4 yi1 dong4 tui4se4 de5 jian4zhu4 lun2kuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，zhe4 zuo4 cang1ku4 jiu4shi4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 zong3bu4。er2 gong1cheng2shi1 jiu4 zhu4 zai4 na4r5。"

msgid "'Sokay, I run in pretty rarefied circles."
msgstr ""
"没事​，​我​这个​圈子​也​挺​小众​的​。\n"
"mei2shi4，wo3 zhe4ge5 quan1zi5 ye3 ting3 xiao3zhong4 de5。"

msgid ""
"'Sokay, chief. I understand.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else that you need to know?"
msgstr ""
"没事​，​头儿​。​我​理解​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​别的​事想​问​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4，tou2r5。wo3 li3jie3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 xiang3 wen4 ma5？"

msgid "(Auto Save)"
msgstr ""
"（​自动​保存​）\n"
"（zi4dong4 bao3cun2）"

msgid "(Autosave)"
msgstr ""
"（​自动​保存​）\n"
"（zi4dong4 bao3cun2）"

msgid "(Hardcore)"
msgstr ""
"（​硬核​）\n"
"（ying4he2）"

msgid "(Introduce Plotz)"
msgstr ""
"（​介绍​普​洛茨​）\n"
"（jie4shao4 Pu3luo4ci2）"

msgid "(Optional) {0}"
msgstr ""
