msgstr ""
"（​快速​保存​）\n"
"（kuai4su4 bao3cun2）"

msgid "(Quicksave)"
msgstr ""
"（​快速​保存​）\n"
"（kuai4su4 bao3cun2）"

msgid "({0}) Items In Queue"
msgstr ""
"（​{​0​}​）​件物品​在​队列​中\n"
"（{0}） jian4 wu4 pin3 zai4 dui4lie4 zhong4"

msgid "({0}) Items in Cart"
msgstr ""
"（​{​0​}​）​件物品​在​购物车​中\n"
"（{0}） jian4 wu4 pin3 zai4 gou4wu4che1 zhong4"

msgid "({0}) Items to Sell"
msgstr ""
"（​{​0​}​）​件物品​待​售出\n"
"（{0}） jian4 wu4 pin3 dai1 shou4 chu1"

msgid ""
"* ERROR * ERROR * ERROR *\n"
"\n"
">>>Defense subroutine \"APEX057-B\" not found.\n"
">>>Primary automated security systems OFFLINE.\n"
">>>Secondary protocols engaged."
msgstr ""
"*​错误​*​错误​*​错误​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​>​>​防御​子程序​“​APEX057​-​B​”​未找到​。​\n"
"​>​>​>​主要​自动​安保​系统​已​离线​。​\n"
"​>​>​>​次要​协议​已​启动​。\n"
"\n"
"*cuo4wu4*cuo4wu4*cuo4wu4*\n"
"\n"
">>>fang2yu4 zi3cheng2xu4“APEX057-bi1” wei4 zhao3 dao4。\n"
">>>zhu3yao4 zi4dong4 an1bao3 xi4tong3 yi3 li2xian4。\n"
">>>ci4yao4 xie2yi4 yi3 qi3dong4。"

msgid ""
"* ERROR * ERROR * ERROR *\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The control panel is scorched and apparently unusable.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"*​错误​*​错误​*​错误​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​控制面板​经过​灼烧​，​明显​已经​损坏​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*cuo4wu4*cuo4wu4*cuo4wu4*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 jing1guo4 zhuo2shao1，ming2xian3 yi3jing1 sun3huai4 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"*$+(l.he)* kept us together. *$+(l.he)* led us out of there in one piece. "
msgstr ""
"*​$+(l.he)​*​是​我们​的​主心骨​。​是​*​$+(l.he)​*​带​我们​逃出​生天​。\n"
"*$+(l.he)*shi4 wo3men5 de5 zhu3xin1gu3。shi4*$+(l.he)*dai4 wo3men5 tao2 chu1 sheng1 tian1。"

msgid ""
"*$+(l.he)* promised you the chip.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger smiles at the Engineer. Slowly, she pulls a knife from her belt.\n"
"\n"
"Its serrated edge glints in the light.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​*​$+(l.he)​*​答应​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​对​工程师​笑了笑​，​从​腰带​上​缓缓​抽出​一把​刀子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​的​锯齿​边缘​闪着​寒光​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4*$+(l.he)*da1ying5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 dui4 gong1cheng2shi1 xiao4 le5 xiao4，cong2 yao1dai4 shang4 huan3huan3 chou1chu1 yi1 ba3 dao1zi5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 ju4chi3 bian1yuan2 shan3 zhao2 han2 guang1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"*All who enter the... \"elevator,\" as you call it... first perform a ritual of entrance.*\n"
"\n"
"*A series of strange tapping motions on the pad mounted beside it.*"
msgstr ""
"*​所有​进入​这个​……​你们​称之为​“​电梯​”​的​人​……​都​要​先​进行​一个​入场​仪式​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​我​看​他们​在​旁边​的​面板​上​做出​过​一连串​奇怪​的​敲击​动作​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*suo3you3 jin4ru4 zhe4ge5……ni3men5 cheng1zhi1wei2“dian4ti1” de5 ren2……dou1 yao4 xian1 jin4xing2 yi1ge5 ru4chang3 yi2shi4。*\n"
"\n"
"*wo3 kan4 ta1men5 zai4 pang2bian1 de5 mian4ban3 shang4 zuo4chu1 guo4 yi1lian2chuan4 qi2guai4 de5 qiao1ji1 dong4zuo4。*"

msgid "*Ever since then, she has regularly travelled above.*"
msgstr ""
"*​从那以后​，​她​便​经常​往​楼上​去​。​*\n"
"*cong2 na4 yi3 hou4，ta1 bian4 jing1chang2 wang3 lou2shang4 qu4。*"

msgid ""
"*Every* run goes sideways at some point. You should've been prepared for it."
msgstr ""
"*​任何​*​差事​都​可能​在​某个​节点​出岔子​。​你们​本该​为此​做好​准备​的​。\n"
"*ren4he2*cha4shi4 dou1 ke3neng2 zai4 mou3 ge4 jie2dian3 chu1cha4zi5。ni3men5 ben3 gai1 wei4ci3 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4 de5。"

msgid ""
"*Few use this box. It is on the far side of the building.*\n"
"\n"
"*But this is my domain, and I see it as well as I do the rest.*"
msgstr ""
"*​很少​有人​用​这个​盒子​，​它​在​大楼​的​另一侧​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​这​终究​是​我​的​领域​，​我​对​它​了如指掌​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*hen3 shao3 you3ren2 yong4 zhe4ge5 he2zi5，ta1 zai4 da4lou2 de5 ling4 yi1 ce4。*\n"
"\n"
"*zhe4 zhong1jiu1 shi4 wo3 de5 ling3yu4，wo3 dui4 ta1 liao3ru2zhi3zhang3。*"

msgid ""
"*From the cracks in its armor poured a foul cloud of wrongness and death.*\n"
"\n"
"*It left a stain on everything it passed, and I was... afraid.*"
msgstr ""
"*​它​盔甲​的​缝隙​涌出​一股​污浊​，​扭曲​，​死亡​的​气息​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​其​所到之处​无不​留下​污痕​，​我​……​感到恐惧​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*ta1 kui1jia3 de5 feng4xi4 yong3chu1 yi1 gu3 wu1zhuo2，niu3qu1，si3wang2 de5 qi4xi1。*\n"
"\n"
"*qi2 suo3dao4zhi1chu4 wu2bu4 liu2xia4 wu1hen2，wo3……gan3 dao4 kong3 ju4。*"

msgid ""
"*Halt!* Stop right there.\n"
"\n"
"Clear the area. I'm not going to tell you again."
msgstr ""
"*​停下​！​*​站住​别动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​离开​此​区域​。​我​不会​再​重复​。\n"
"\n"
"*ting2xia4！*zhan4zhu4 bie4 dong4。\n"
"\n"
"li2kai1 ci3 qu1yu4。wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 chong2fu4。"

msgid ""
"*He believes himself to be of great import. Each day, upon his arrival, he travels above.*\n"
"\n"
"*He remains in that place until the sun falls. Then he leaves, to return the next day.*"
msgstr ""
"*​他​自视甚高​。​他​每天​来​，​都​直奔​楼上​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​随后​停留​至​日落​才​离去​，​翌日​复返​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*ta1 zi4shi4shen4gao1。ta1 mei3tian1 lai2，dou1 zhi2ben4 lou2shang4。*\n"
"\n"
"*sui2hou4 ting2liu2 zhi4 ri4luo4 cai2 li2qu4，yi4ri4 fu4fan3。*"

msgid ""
"*Her aura shines bright with energy. But I see flecks of the Man's darkness "
"beginning to take hold within her.*"
msgstr ""
"*​她​的​灵光​闪烁​，​能量​充盈​。​但​那个​男人​的​黑暗​正在​她​体内​扎根​。​*\n"
"*ta1 de5 ling2guang1 shan3shuo4，neng2liang4 chong1ying2。dan4 na4ge5 nan2ren2 de5 hei1an4 zheng4zai4 ta1 ti3nei4 zha1gen1。*"

msgid ""
"*His aura is dark and cold.*\n"
"\n"
"*Others move from his path, and flashes of fear spread through the auras of all those around him.*"
msgstr ""
"*​他​的​灵光​阴森​，​冷若冰霜​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​人们​纷纷​为​他​让路​，​他们​的​灵光​都​闪过​一丝​恐惧​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*ta1 de5 ling2guang1 yin1sen1，leng3ruo4bing1shuang1。*\n"
"\n"
"*ren2men5 fen1fen1 wei2 ta1 rang4lu4，ta1men5 de5 ling2guang1 dou1 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 kong3ju4。*"

msgid "*How may I serve?*"
msgstr ""
"*​有何​吩咐​？​*\n"
"*you3 he2 fen1fu5？*"

msgid ""
"*How she can stand to feed such a connection eludes me.*\n"
"\n"
"*But then, you physical creatures have always been a mystery to me.*"
msgstr ""
"*​让​我​百思不得其解​的​是​，​她​竟然​愿意​忍受​，​维持​这样​的​关系​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​不过​对​我​而言​，​你们​这些​实体​生物​始终​是​个​谜​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*rang4 wo3 bai3si1bu4de2qi2jie3 de5 shi4，ta1 jing4ran2 yuan4yi4 ren3shou4，wei2chi2 zhe4yang4 de5 guan1xi5。*\n"
"\n"
"*bu4guo4 dui4 wo3 er2yan2，ni3men5 zhe4xie1 shi2ti3 sheng1wu4 shi3zhong1 shi4 ge4 mei4。*"

msgid ""
"*I am the spirit of this domain. You have summoned me, and so I am yours.*"
msgstr ""
"*​我​是​这片​领域​的​精魂​。​你​召唤​了​我​，​我​便​属于​你​。​*\n"
"*wo3 shi4 zhe4 pian1 ling3yu4 de5 jing1hun2。ni3 zhao4huan4 le5 wo3，wo3 bian4 shu3yu2 ni3。*"

msgid ""
"*I can still feel the wrongness of it oozing down from above. Polluting the "
"magic of this place.*"
msgstr ""
"*​现在​它​的​邪​能​从​高处​向下​渗透​，​污染​着​这片​领域​的​魔法​。​*\n"
"*xian4zai4 ta1 de5 xie2 neng2 cong2 gao1chu4 xiang4xia4 shen4tou4，wu1ran3 zhao2 zhe4 pian1 ling3yu4 de5 mo2fa3。*"

msgid ""
"*I can tell you little. It was shielded from my sight.*\n"
"\n"
"*Yet... such great pain and sorrow can never be fully hidden.*"
msgstr ""
"*​我能​告诉​你​的​不​多​。​它​被​结界​遮挡​，​我​看不清​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​然而​……​那般​巨大​的​痛苦​与​悲伤​不​可能​被​完全​掩藏​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*wo3 neng2 gao4su4 ni3 de5 bu4 duo1。ta1 bei4 jie2jie4 zhe1dang3，wo3 kan4bu5qing1。*\n"
"\n"
"*ran2er2……na4 ban1 ju4da4 de5 tong4ku3 yu4 bei1shang1 bu4 ke3neng2 bei4 wan2quan2 yan3cang2。*"

msgid ""
"*I know little about what is above. The wards are too strong for spiritkind to penetrate.*\n"
"\n"
"*Only bland, physical creatures such as yourself may pass.*"
msgstr ""
"*​我​对​楼上​的​事​知之甚少​。​他们​设置​了​强大​的​结界​，​灵体​无法​穿过​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​只有​你​等​凡人​的​血肉之躯​才能​通过​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*wo3 dui4 lou2shang4 de5 shi4 zhi1 zhi1 shen4 shao3。ta1men5 she4zhi4 le5 qiang2da4 de5 jie2jie4，ling2ti3 wu2fa3 chuan1guo4。*\n"
"\n"
"*zhi3you3 ni3 deng3 fan2ren2 de5 xie3 rou4 zhi1 qu1 cai2neng2 tong1guo4。*"

msgid ""
"*I know little of the next floor. It is warded against my kind.*\n"
"\n"
"*However... there is a box. A box that climbs a tunnel, like the one that you came in.*"
msgstr ""
"*​我​对​楼上​的​事​知之甚少​，​他们​设置​了​阻挠​吾​等​的​结界​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​不过​……​你​该​去​找​一个​盒子​。​一个​沿着​隧道​爬升​的​盒子​，​和​你​来时​坐​的​那种​一样​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*wo3 dui4 lou2shang4 de5 shi4 zhi1 zhi1 shen4 shao3，ta1men5 she4zhi4 le5 zu3nao2 wu2 deng3 de5 jie2jie4。*\n"
"\n"
"*bu4guo4……ni3 gai1 qu4 zhao3 yi1ge5 he2zi5。yi1ge5 yan2zhe5 sui4dao4 pa2sheng1 de5 he2zi5，he4 ni3 lai2 shi2 zuo4 de5 na4zhong3 yi1yang4。*"

msgid ""
"*I'm* human. And I know those bastards.\n"
"\n"
"They'll talk to me. Believe it."
msgstr ""
"我​*​是​*​人类​，​我​了解​这帮​杂种​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​会​和​我​谈​的​，​相信​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*shi4*ren2lei4，wo3 liao3jie3 zhe4 bang1 za2zhong3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 hui4 he4 wo3 tan2 de5，xiang1xin4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"*I* am Philip Rex, the Knight-King of Sutterlin BioScience! I will have you banished for your transgressions, $(scene.badfantasy) - banished to the underworld, and left to the ravages of the all-powerful Billy.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses, blinking.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hold still while I fetch the robots that will banish you."
msgstr ""
"*​我​*​是​菲利普​·​雷克斯​，​苏​特林​生物科学​的​骑士​之王​！​我会​因​你​的​冒犯​将​你​放逐​，​$(scene.badfantasy)​—​—​放逐​到​冥界​，​让​你​任由​无敌​的​比利​摧残​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​站​着​别动​，​我​去​找​机器人​来​放逐​你​。\n"
"\n"
"*wo3*shi4 fei1li4pu3 · lei2ke4si1，su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 qi2shi4 zhi1 wang2！wo3 hui4 yin1 ni3 de5 mao4fan4 jiang1 ni3 fang4zhu2，$(scene.badfantasy)——fang4zhu2 dao4 ming2jie4，rang4 ni3 ren4you2 wu2di2 de5 bi3li4 cui1can2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhan4 zhao2 bie4 dong4，wo3 qu4 zhao3 ji1qi4ren2 lai2 fang4zhu2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"*I* have explaining to do? This is my *home.*\n"
"\n"
"You are the intruder here. If anyone needs to explain $(l.him)self, it's you."
msgstr ""
"*​我​*​要​解释一下​？​这里​可是​我​*​家​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​才​是​入侵者​。​如果​有人​要​解释一下​的话​，​也​应该​是​你​才​对​。\n"
"\n"
"*wo3*yao4 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4？zhe4li3 ke3shi4 wo3*jia1*。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 cai2 shi4 ru4qin1zhe3。ru2guo3 you3ren2 yao4 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4 de5hua4，ye3 ying1gai1 shi4 ni3 cai2 dui4。"

msgid ""
"*I* will track Harrow down.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She taps herself on the chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Myself, and the spirit that's bound to me. But as for you... I can't have you coming with me, $(l.name). Not this time.\n"
"\n"
"Your place is here."
msgstr ""
"是​*​我​*​去​找​哈罗​的​下落​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​点​了​点​自己​的​胸脯​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​与​我​相连​的​精魂​。​而​你​……​这次​我​不能​让​你​跟​我​一起​走​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​不能​没有​你​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4*wo3*qu4 zhao3 ha1luo2 de5 xia4luo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 le5 dian3 zi4ji3 de5 xiong1pu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 yu4 wo3 xiang1lian2 de5 jing1hun2。er2 ni3……zhe4 ci4 wo3 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 gen1 wo3 yi1qi3 zou3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 bu4neng2 mei2you3 ni3。"

msgid "*I,* on the other hand, didn't offer you a goddamned thing."
msgstr ""
"而​*​我​*​呢​，​可​没有​答应​你​任何​事情​。\n"
"er2*wo3*ni2，ke3 mei2you3 da1ying5 ni3 ren4he2 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"*It was discarded, along with the myriad refuse that you meat-beings produce.*\n"
"\n"
"*From there, it was moved to a larger receptacle to await removal. I assume that it is still there.*"
msgstr ""
"*​连同​你们​肉体​凡夫​产生​的​无数​垃圾​，​都​被​丢弃​了​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​随后​被​转移​到​一个​更大​的​容器​里​等待​清理​。​我​猜​它们​还​在​那里​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*lian2tong2 ni3men5 rou4ti3 fan2fu1 chan3sheng1 de5 wu2shu4 la1ji1，dou1 bei4 diu1qi4 le5。*\n"
"\n"
"*sui2hou4 bei4 zhuan3yi2 dao4 yi1ge5 geng1 dai4 de5 rong2qi4 li3 deng3dai4 qing1li3。wo3 cai1 ta1men5 hai2 zai4 na4li5。*"

msgid "*It was set aflame, then discarded.*"
msgstr ""
"*​被​他们​点火​烧毁​了​。​*\n"
"*bei4 ta1men5 dian3huo3 shao1hui3 le5。*"

msgid ""
"*Last night, there was a change. A group rode the elevator, towing something foul. It bled a cloud of corruption into the astral plane.*\n"
"\n"
"*I fled from it. I had no choice.*"
msgstr ""
"*​但​昨晚​有​变故​。​有​一群​人​乘坐​电梯​，​他们​拖拽​着​某种​污秽​之物​。​它​向​星界​散发​着​腐败​的​气息​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​我避​之​不及​，​别无选择​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*dan4 zuo2wan3 you3 bian4gu4。you3 yi1 qun2 ren2 cheng2zuo4 dian4ti1，ta1men5 tuo1zhuai4 zhao2 mou3zhong3 wu1hui4 zhi1 wu4。ta1 xiang4 xing1 jie4 san4fa1 zhao2 fu3bai4 de5 qi4xi1。*\n"
"\n"
"*wo3 bi4 zhi1 bu4ji2，bie2wu2xuan3ze2。*"

msgid ""
"*Metahuman* meat, Phil. Synthetic hearts and livers and kidneys, grown to be implanted into people like you and me.\n"
"\n"
"You're talking about eating people parts. It's fucking disgusting, and I won't do it."
msgstr ""
"*​泛​人类​*​肉​，​菲尔​。​那些​为了​移植​到​你​我​这种​人​身上​而​培养​出来​的​合成​人工心脏​、​肝脏​和​肾脏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​在​说​吃人肉​。​这太​恶心​了​，​我​绝对​不会​干​这种​事​。\n"
"\n"
"*fan4 ren2lei4*rou4，fei1 er3。na4xie1 wei4le5 yi2zhi2 dao4 ni3 wo3 zhe4zhong3 ren2 shen1shang5 er2 pei2yang3 chu1lai2 de5 he2cheng2 ren2 gong1 xin1 zang4、gan1zang4 he4 shen4zang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 zai4 shuo1 chi1 ren2 rou4。zhe4 tai4 e3xin1 le5，wo3 jue2dui4 bu4hui4 gan4 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"*Most terribly of all, I sensed a... presence. Buried deep.*\n"
"\n"
"*A twisted nexus of pain and loathing, suspended in the cloud of filth. And in the center of that cloud: awareness.*"
msgstr ""
"*​最​可怕​的​是​，​我能​感知​其中​的​深处​有​某种​……​存在​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​一个​由​痛苦​与​憎恶​交织​而成​的​核心​，​被​它​那​污浊​的​气息​包裹​着​。​而​就​在​这团​气息​的​中央​：​存在​着​意识​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*zui4 ke3pa4 de5 shi4，wo3 neng2 gan3zhi1 qi2zhong1 de5 shen1chu4 you3 mou3zhong3……cun2zai4。*\n"
"\n"
"*yi1ge5 you2 tong4ku3 yu4 zeng1e4 jiao1zhi1 er2 cheng2 de5 he2xin1，bei4 ta1 na4 wu1zhuo2 de5 qi4xi1 bao1guo3 zhao2。er2 jiu4 zai4 zhe4 tuan2 qi4xi1 de5 zhong1yang1：cun2zai4 zhao2 yi4shi2。*"

msgid ""
"*NO!* I won't let you outsmart me!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Cackling laughter bursts out from the speaker.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Go away, spirit! I'm keeping my eyes for *myself!*"
msgstr ""
"*​不​！​*​我​不会​让​你​骗​我​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​对讲机​里​爆发​出​癫狂​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走开​，​精魂​！​我​的​眼睛​是​*​我​自己​*​的​！\n"
"\n"
"*bu4！*wo3 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 pian4 wo3 de5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dui4jiang3ji1 li3 bao4fa1 chu1 dian1kuang2 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3kai1，jing1hun2！wo3 de5 yan3jing5 shi4*wo3 zi4ji3*de5！"

msgid ""
"*No. I know little about your technology. And what I do know has not enticed"
" me to learn more.*"
msgstr ""
"*​不​，​我​对​你们​的​科技​知之甚少​。​而​我​所​了解​的​那些​，​也​并未​激起​我​进一步​探索​的​兴趣​。​*\n"
"*bu4，wo3 dui4 ni3men5 de5 ke1ji4 zhi1 zhi1 shen4 shao3。er2 wo3 suo3 liao3jie3 de5 na4xie1，ye3 bing4wei4 ji1qi3 wo3 jin4yi1bu4 tan4suo3 de5 xing4qu4。*"

msgid ""
"*On the rare occasions that I have seen them together, her aura reaches out to meet his.*\n"
"\n"
"*She offers her energy and brightness to him, and she does it willingly.*"
msgstr ""
"*​他们​难得​在​一起​时​，​她​的​灵光​总会​主动​迎向​他​的​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​她​心甘情愿​地​将​自己​的​能量​与​光芒​奉献给​他​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*ta1men5 nan2de2 zai4 yi1qi3 shi2，ta1 de5 ling2guang1 zong3 hui4 zhu3dong4 ying2 xiang4 ta1 de5。*\n"
"\n"
"*ta1 xin1gan1qing2yuan4 de5 jiang1 zi4ji3 de5 neng2liang4 yu4 guang1mang2 feng4 xian4 gei3 ta1。*"

msgid ""
"*Sigh* I'm not surprised. Altruism often comes with an expiration date."
msgstr ""
"*​叹气​*​我​对此​并​不​意外​。​利他主义​往往​都​是​有​时效性​的​。\n"
"*tan4qi4*wo3 dui4 ci3 bing4 bu4 yi4wai4。li4ta1zhu3yi4 wang3wang3 dou1 shi4 you3 shi2xiao4xing4 de5。"

msgid "*Some yet remains.*"
msgstr ""
"*​有​些许​残骸​。​*\n"
"*you3 xie1xu3 can2hai2。*"

msgid ""
"*Stop.*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger's face has gone white as a sheet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Stop talking, right now."
msgstr ""
"*​住口​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​脸色​霎时间​变得​一片​惨白​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​立刻​给​我​住口​。\n"
"\n"
"*zhu4kou3。*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 lian3se4 sha4shi2jian1 bian4de5 yi1 pian1 can3bai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"li4ke4 gei3 wo3 zhu4kou3。"

msgid ""
"*Thank* you.\n"
"\n"
"Now, what else do you want? Go ahead, get it out in the open...better that than letting it fester."
msgstr ""
"*​谢谢​*​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​事​吗​？​有话​尽管​说​吧​……​说​出来​总比藏​着​掖​着​要​好​。\n"
"\n"
"*xie4xie5*a1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？you3 hua4 jin3guan3 shuo1 ba1……shuo1 chu1lai2 zong3 bi3 zang4 zhao2 ye1 zhao2 yao4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"*The Man has done this always.*\n"
"\n"
"*After she was summoned, the Woman took up the ritual as well.*"
msgstr ""
"*​男人​总会​进行​这个​仪式​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​自从​他​唤​来​女人​，​她​便​接过​了​仪式​职责​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*nan2ren2 zong3 hui4 jin4xing2 zhe4ge5 yi2shi4。*\n"
"\n"
"*zi4cong2 ta1 huan4 lai2 nu:3ren2，ta1 bian4 jie1guo4 le5 yi2shi4 zhi2ze2。*"

msgid ""
"*The Woman also serves another Man. She follows him, cleans for him, provides for him.*\n"
"\n"
"*He lacks the strength and darkness of the Man from above, and clearly fears him. But the Woman cares for him all the same.*"
msgstr ""
"*​这个​女人​还​侍奉​另​一个​男人​。​她​追随​他​，​为​他​打扫​，​供养​他​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​和​楼上​的​男人​相比​，​他​缺乏​力量​，​不够​阴暗​，​甚至​惧怕​后者​。​但​女人​依然​照料​着​他​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*zhe4ge5 nu:3ren2 hai2 shi4feng4 ling4 yi1ge5 nan2ren2。ta1 zhui1sui2 ta1，wei2 ta1 da3sao3，gong1yang3 ta1。*\n"
"\n"
"*he4 lou2shang4 de5 nan2ren2 xiang1bi3，ta1 que1fa2 li4liang5，bu4gou4 yin1an4，shen4zhi4 ju4pa4 hou4zhe3。dan4 nu:3ren2 yi1ran2 zhao4liao4 zhao2 ta1。*"

msgid ""
"*The Woman sits behind the closest door, when she is not visiting the dark "
"man above.*"
msgstr ""
"*​女人​坐在​最近​的​门​后​，​除非​她​要​上楼去​拜访​那位​阴暗​的​男人​。​*\n"
"*nu:3ren2 zuo4 zai4 zui4jin4 de5 men2 hou4，chu2fei1 ta1 yao4 shang4 lou2 qu4 bai4fang3 na4 wei4 yin1an4 de5 nan2ren2。*"

msgid "*The summons was delivered via parchment.*"
msgstr ""
"*​他​用​羊皮纸​来​传唤​女人​。​*\n"
"*ta1 yong4 yang2pi2zhi3 lai2 chuan2huan4 nu:3ren2。*"

msgid ""
"*Then,* during the Cold War, they designated this whole station an emergency fallout shelter. You know, in case the Russians and the Americans decided to blow each other up. This was back when Berlin was divided in two, of course. Things got better for a while after that.\n"
"\n"
"Hell, a few decades ago, before the Awakening, I hear they used to give tours.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He laughs.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"*​然后​*​在​冷战​期间​，​他们​把​整个​车站​都​指定​为​核战​避难所​，​以防​俄国人​和​美国​人​决定​把​对方​炸​上天​。​当然​，​那​是​在​柏林​被​一分为二​的​时候​。​在​那​之后​的​一段时间​里​，​情况​有所​好转​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​在​几十年​前​的​“​大​觉醒​”​之前​，​我​听说​那里​还​让​人​旅游​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​笑了起来​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*ran2hou4*zai4 leng3zhan4 qi1jian1，ta1men5 ba3 zheng3ge4 che1zhan4 dou1 zhi3ding4 wei2 he2zhan4 bi4nan4suo3，yi3fang2 e2guo2ren2 he4 mei3guo2 ren2 jue2ding4 ba3 dui4fang1 zha2 shang4tian1。dang1ran2，na4 shi4 zai4 bo2lin2 bei4 yi1fen1wei2er4 de5 shi2hou5。zai4 na4 zhi1hou4 de5 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3，qing2kuang4 you3suo3 hao3zhuan3。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 ji1 shi2 nian2 qian2 de5“dai4 jue2xing3” zhi1qian2，wo3 ting1shuo1 na4li5 hai2 rang4 ren2 lu:3you2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"*This* is what Humanis stands for. This is the agenda that its leaders strive to advance.\n"
"\n"
"They will not be satisfied until all metahumans - *everywhere* - are driven from the face of the Earth."
msgstr ""
"*​这​*​就是​人类​至上​主义者​的​主张​。​这​就是​其​领导人​努力​推进​的​议程​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除非​所有​变​人类​从​地球​上​消失​，​否则​他们​是​不会​满足​的​。\n"
"\n"
"*zhe4*jiu4shi4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 zhu3zhang1。zhe4 jiu4shi4 qi2 ling3dao3ren2 nu3li4 tui1jin4 de5 yi4cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 suo3you3 bian4 ren2lei4 cong2 di4qiu2 shang4 xiao1shi1，fou3ze2 ta1men5 shi4 bu4hui4 man3zu2 de5。"

msgid ""
"*Three receptacles sit together, behind the most distant door in this room.*\n"
"\n"
"*The furthest from us now holds what you seek.*"
msgstr ""
"*​三个​并排​的​容器​，​位于​这个​房间​最远​端的​那​扇门​后面​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​你​所求​之物​就​在​最​远处​的​容器​里​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*san1 ge4 bing4pai2 de5 rong2qi4，wei4yu2 zhe4ge5 fang2jian1 zui4yuan3 duan1di4 na4 shan1 men2 hou4mian5。*\n"
"\n"
"*ni3 suo3 qiu2 zhi1 wu4 jiu4 zai4 zui4 yuan3chu4 de5 rong2qi4 li3。*"

msgid ""
"*Until recently, only one. A human Man.*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a pause as the spirit collects its thoughts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*Now, the Man, but also a Woman. Never at the same time as the Man.*"
msgstr ""
"*​之前​只有​一个​。​一名​人类​男性​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​精魂​停顿​片刻​，​整理​思绪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​现在​除了​那名​男性​，​还有​一名​女性​，​她​从不​与​他​同时​出现​。​*\n"
"\n"
"*zhi1qian2 zhi3you3 yi1ge5。yi1 ming2 ren2lei4 nan2xing4。*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，zheng3li3 si1xu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*xian4zai4 chu2le5 na4 ming2 nan2xing4，hai2you3 yi1 ming2 nu:3xing4，ta1 cong2bu4 yu4 ta1 tong2shi2 chu1xian4。*"

msgid ""
"*You* stay *out* of this.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stabs an armored finger into your chest. Hard.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"*​这里​*​没有​*​你​*​说话​的​份​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​装甲​包裹​的​手指​狠狠​戳​向​你​的​胸口​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*zhe4li3*mei2you3*ni3*shuo1hua4 de5 fen4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 zhuang1jia3 bao1guo3 de5 shou3zhi3 hen3hen3 chuo1 xiang4 ni3 de5 xiong1kou3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"+1 Action Point! Your experience has increased your ability to operate in "
"dangerous situations."
msgstr ""
"+​1​行动​点​！​你​的​经验​提升​了​你​在​危险​环境​中​行动​的​能力​。\n"
"+1 xing2dong4 dian3！ni3 de5 jing1yan4 ti2sheng1 le5 ni3 zai4 wei1xian3 huan2jing4 zhong4 xing2dong4 de5 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"+2 DMG over the weapon's base, and pierces up to 2 points of Armor. Ignores "
"the weapon's AP damage. -10% to hit."
msgstr ""
"武器​的​基础​伤害​额外​增加​2​点​，​最​多​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。​忽略​武器​的​行动​力​损伤​。​命中率​降低​10​%\n"
"wu3qi4 de5 ji1chu3 shang1hai4 e2wai4 zeng1jia1 2 dian3，zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。hu1lu:e4 wu3qi4 de5 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。ming4zhong4lu:4 jiang4di1 10 %"

msgid ""
"--But we really need to finish our shopping trip. So if you wouldn't "
"mind...?"
msgstr ""
"—​—​但​我们​得​赶紧​把​东西​买​完​了​。​所以​如果​你​不介意​的话​……​？\n"
"— — dan4 wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 ba3 dong1xi1 mai3 wan2 le5。suo3yi3 ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4……？"

msgid "-10% to hit. Increases chance for critical DMG. Pierces up to 4 Armor."
msgstr ""
"-​10​%​命中率​。​增加​暴击​几率​。​最​多​提供​4​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"-10%ming4zhong4lu:4。zeng1jia1 bao4ji1 ji1lu:4。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 4 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid ""
"-5% accuracy. Target is ignited and takes 4 ongoing DMG for 2 RNDs. Strips 1"
" Armor from the target. Cannot hit adjacent targets."
msgstr ""
"-​5​%​精准度​。​目标​被​点燃​并​在​2​回合​内​每​回合​持续​受到​4​点​伤害​。​同时​剥离​目标​1​点护甲值​。​无法​击中​相邻​的​多个​目标​。\n"
"-5%jing1 zhun3 du4。mu4biao1 bei4 dian3ran2 bing4 zai4 2 hui2he2 nei4 mei3 hui2he2 chi2xu4 shou4dao4 4 dian3 shang1hai4。tong2shi2 bo1li2 mu4biao1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。wu2fa3 ji1zhong4 xiang1lin2 de5 duo1ge5 mu4biao1。"

msgid "..."
msgstr ""
"……\n"
"……"

msgid ""
"...'Course, if you prefer, you could always follow the Doc's example. Take the coward's way out.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pats a pistol on his hip. You recognize it instantly - it's the same hand cannon that he used to kill Amsel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Guess I couldn't fault you for it. Things are gonna get ugly over the next few years."
msgstr ""
"……​当然​了​，​如果​你​愿意​的话​，​也​可以​随时​步​博士​的​后尘​，​选择​以​懦夫​的​方式​逃避​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拍拍​腰上​的​手枪​。​你​立刻​认出​了​它​—​—​他​就是​用​这​把​枪杀​死​了​阿姆​泽尔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​不会​怪​你​。​再​过​几年​，​这​世道​可​就​不好过​喽​。\n"
"\n"
"……dang1ran2 le5，ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，ye3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 bu4 bo2shi4 de5 hou4chen2，xuan3ze2 yi3 nuo4fu1 de5 fang1shi4 tao2bi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 pai1 yao1 shang4 de5 shou3qiang1。ni3 li4ke4 ren4chu1 le5 ta1——ta1 jiu4shi4 yong4 zhe4 ba3 qiang1sha1 si3 le5 E1mu3ze2er3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 guai4 ni3。zai4 guo4 ji3nian2，zhe4 shi4dao4 ke3 jiu4 bu4 hao3 guo4 lou5。"

msgid ""
"...'Course, you don't *have* to stick around to face what's coming.\n"
"\n"
"You could always follow the Doc's example and take the coward's way out."
msgstr ""
"……​当然​了​，​你​也​不用​非得​见证​最后​的​结局​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​随时​步​博士​的​后尘​，​选择​以​懦夫​的​方式​逃避​。\n"
"\n"
"……dang1ran2 le5，ni3 ye3 bu4yong4 fei1dei3 jian4zheng4 zui4hou4 de5 jie2ju2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 bu4 bo2shi4 de5 hou4chen2，xuan3ze2 yi3 nuo4fu1 de5 fang1shi4 tao2bi4。"

msgid "...Aaand that's enough of that. Let's change the subject, huh?"
msgstr ""
"……​我​已经​听够​了​。​换个​话题​吧​？\n"
"……wo3 yi3jing1 ting1 gou4 le5。huan4 ge4 hua4ti2 ba1？"

msgid "...Actually, you have a point there."
msgstr ""
"……​确实​，​你​说​的​没错​。\n"
"……que4shi2，ni3 shuo1 de5 mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"...Again, for those of you just joining us, we are coming to you live from Stolberg. \n"
"\n"
"A few hours ago, the dragon Feuerschwinge launched an unprovoked attack on this sleepy Harz mountain town... and you can see the results behind me. Fire, ashes, and blood."
msgstr ""
"……​各位​刚刚开始​收看​的​观众​，​我们​正在​施托尔​贝格​为​您​现场直播​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几小时​前​，​巨龙​火翼​无端​攻击​了​这处​沉睡​的​哈尔茨​山城​……​你们​可以​在​我​身后​看到​一片​惨状​。​到处​是​火焰​、​灰烬​和​鲜血​。\n"
"\n"
"……ge4wei4 gang1 gang1 kai1 shi3 shou1kan4 de5 guan1zhong4，wo3men5 zheng4zai4 shi1 tuo1 er3 bei4 ge2 wei2 nin2 xian4chang3zhi2bo1。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 xiao3 shi2 qian2，ju4long2 Huo3yi4 wu2duan1 gong1ji1 le5 zhe4 chu3 chen2shui4 de5 Ha1er3ci2 shan1cheng2……ni3men5 ke3yi3 zai4 wo3 shen1hou4 kan4dao4 yi1 pian1 can3zhuang4。dao4chu4 shi4 huo3yan4、hui1jin4 he4 xian1xue4。"

msgid "...All right, fine. It's your building, I'll go with you on that."
msgstr ""
"……​好好​好​，​这​是​你​的​大楼​，​我​没​意见​行​了​吧​。\n"
"……hao3hao3 hao3，zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 da4lou2，wo3 mei2 yi4jian4 xing2 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"...And if we *do* shut it down, he'll be forced into a state of permanent "
"seizure."
msgstr ""
"……​而​如果​我们​*​能​*​把​它​关闭​，​他​就​会​被迫​陷入​永久性​癫痫​状态​。\n"
"……er2 ru2guo3 wo3men5*neng2*ba3 ta1 guan1bi4，ta1 jiu4 hui4 bei4po4 xian4ru4 yong3jiu3xing4 dian1xian2 zhuang4tai4。"

msgid ""
"...And more importantly, we *need* money, for the Alice fund.\n"
"\n"
"So, yeah. Sounds to me like we should do this, chief. Good choice!"
msgstr ""
"……​更​重要​的​是​，​我们​*​需要​*​钱​，​别忘了​爱丽丝​要求​的​费用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​在我看来​，​我们​应该​按​他​说​的​去​做​，​头儿​。​这么​选准​没错​！\n"
"\n"
"……geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4，wo3men5*xu1yao4*qian2，bie4 wang4 le5 ai4li4si1 yao1qiu2 de5 fei4yong4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 zai4wo3kan4lai2，wo3men5 ying1gai1 an4 ta1 shuo1 de5 qu4 zuo4，tou2r5。zhe4me5 xuan3 zhun3 mei2cuo4！"

msgid ""
"...And so, to find out, you let a homicidal loan shark know exactly when and"
" where to find me."
msgstr ""
"……​所以​，​你​就​为了​这个​，​把​我​的​行踪​出卖​给​了​一个​杀人越货​的​高利贷​主​。\n"
"……suo3yi3，ni3 jiu4 wei4le5 zhe4ge5，ba3 wo3 de5 xing2zong1 chu1mai4 gei3 le5 yi1ge5 sha1ren2yue4huo4 de5 gao1li4dai4 zhu3。"

msgid ""
"...And speaking of which, look at Yuli's temples. See that sweat beading up?\n"
"\n"
"I'd say that our friend here has developed himself a habit."
msgstr ""
"……​说​到​这个​，​你​可以​看看​尤里​的​太阳穴​。​看到​那里​的​汗珠​了​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​我们​这位​朋友​平时​有点​小​爱好​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"……shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5，ni3 ke3yi3 kan4kan5 You2li3 de5 tai4yang2xue2。kan4dao4 na4li5 de5 han4zhu1 le5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3men5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 ping2shi2 you3dian3 xiao3 ai4hao4 a1。"

msgid ""
"...And that takes care of that. Please return to the Kreuzbasar; the "
"remainder of your post-run interview will conclude upon your arrival."
msgstr ""
"……​这样一来​就​结束​了​。​请​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​；​之后​你​将​完成​剩余​的​差事​后​面试​环节​。\n"
"……zhe4yang4yi1lai2 jiu4 jie2shu4 le5。qing3 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ； zhi1hou4 ni3 jiang1 wan2cheng2 sheng4yu2 de5 cha4shi4 hou4 mian4shi4 huan2jie2。"

msgid "...And then we can get them out of here."
msgstr ""
"……​然后​我们​就​可以​带​他们​离开​这里​。\n"
"……ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 dai4 ta1men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid "...And this is where we came in."
msgstr ""
"……​我们​就​是从​这里​登场​的​。\n"
"……wo3men5 jiu4 shi4 cong2 zhe4li3 deng1chang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"...And this is why I warned you against gettin' in bed with them, by the way.\n"
"\n"
"They're bad news. I told you that."
msgstr ""
"……​另外​这​就是​为什么​我​之前​警告​你别​跟​他们​扯​上​关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​说​过​的​，​他们​不是​什么​善茬​。\n"
"\n"
"……ling4wai4 zhe4 jiu4shi4 wei4shen2me5 wo3 zhi1qian2 jing3gao4 ni3 bie4 gen1 ta1men5 che3 shang4 guan1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 guo4 de5，ta1men5 bu4shi4 shen2me5 shan4 cha2。"

msgid "...And what is the price? It doesn't say on this screen."
msgstr ""
"……​价格​是​多少​？​屏幕​上面​没​写​。\n"
"……jia4ge2 shi4 duo1shao3？ping2mu4 shang4mian4 mei2 xie3。"

msgid ""
"...And yet, setting it free was the right choice in your view. Even after it killed your friend.\n"
"\n"
"Even after it devoured my brother."
msgstr ""
"……​而​在你看来​，​释放​它​是​正确​的​事​。​即使​在​它​杀死​了​你​的​朋友​之后​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​即使​在​它​吞噬​了​我​的​弟弟​之后​。\n"
"\n"
"……er2 zai4 ni3 kan4 lai2，shi4fang4 ta1 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。ji2shi3 zai4 ta1 sha1si3 le5 ni3 de5 peng2you5 zhi1hou4。\n"
"\n"
"ji2shi3 zai4 ta1 tun1shi4 le5 wo3 de5 di4di5 zhi1hou4。"

msgid ""
"...And yet, you set it free anyway. Even after it killed your friend.\n"
"\n"
"Even after it devoured my brother."
msgstr ""
"……​而​你​还是​放​它​自由​了​。​即使​在​它​杀死​了​你​的​朋友​之后​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​即使​在​它​吞噬​了​我​的​弟弟​之后​。\n"
"\n"
"……er2 ni3 hai2shi5 fang4 ta1 zi4you2 le5。ji2shi3 zai4 ta1 sha1si3 le5 ni3 de5 peng2you5 zhi1hou4。\n"
"\n"
"ji2shi3 zai4 ta1 tun1shi4 le5 wo3 de5 di4di5 zhi1hou4。"

msgid "...And you think that I care?"
msgstr ""
"……​你​觉得​我​在乎​吗​？\n"
"……ni3 jue2de5 wo3 zai4hu5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"...And, chief... the other one is yours.\n"
"\n"
"They've got a whole dossier on you. No idea where they got it from, or why, but they have it."
msgstr ""
"……​还有​，​头儿​……​另​一个​名字​是​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​掌握​了​你​的​详细​情报​。​不​知道​他们​是从​哪弄​来​的​，​但​确实​非常​详细​。\n"
"\n"
"……hai2you3，tou2r5……ling4 yi1ge5 ming2zi5 shi4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zhang3wo4 le5 ni3 de5 xiang2xi4 qing2bao4。bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 shi4 cong2 na3 long4 lai2 de5，dan4 que4shi2 fei1chang2 xiang2xi4。"

msgid ""
"...And, sure enough, I did.\n"
"\n"
"A message from the genuine article herself."
msgstr ""
"……​而且​我​确实​找到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​来自​她​本人​的​消息​。\n"
"\n"
"……er2qie3 wo3 que4shi2 zhao3dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"lai2zi4 ta1 ben3ren2 de5 xiao1xi5。"

msgid "...And?"
msgstr ""
"……​然后​呢​？\n"
"……ran2hou4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"...Anyway, we should probably get movin', don'tcha think?\n"
"\n"
"I don't wanna be here when more of those Knight Errant bastards show up."
msgstr ""
"……​总之​，​我们​还是​赶紧​走​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可​不想​碰到​游侠​骑士​的​更​多​增援部队​。\n"
"\n"
"……zong3zhi1，wo3men5 hai2shi5 gan3jin3 zou3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 peng4dao4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 geng1 duo1 zeng1 yuan2 bu4 dui4。"

msgid ""
"...At least, it was in the beginning. The Azzies must've beefed up their "
"security over the past year."
msgstr ""
"……​至少​一​开始​是​这样​。​阿兹佬​在​过去​的​一年​里​肯定​加强​了​安保​措施​。\n"
"……zhi4shao3 yi1 kai1shi3 shi4 zhe4yang4。e1 zi1 lao3 zai4 guo4qu4 de5 yi1 nian2 li3 ken3ding4 jia1qiang2 le5 an1bao3 cuo4shi1。"

msgid ""
"...Besides, what have I got that's better to do? Go back to that disgusting hotel and hang out with drug addicts and gang members all day?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When I can hang out with insane dragons, assholes toting enormous machineguns, and devil dogs that hump my leg when no one’s looking?"
msgstr ""
"……​再说​，​我​还有​什么​更好​的​去处​？​回去​那个​令人作呕​的​旅馆​，​整天​和​瘾君子​还有​帮派​成员​鬼混​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​发疯​的​巨龙​，​扛着​巨型​机枪​的​混蛋​，​还有​趁人​不​注意​就​蹭​我​腿​的​地狱​犬​—​—​这样​的​日子​有​什么​不好​？\n"
"\n"
"……zai4shuo1，wo3 hai2you3 shen2me5 geng1 hao3 de5 qu4chu4？hui2qu5 na4ge5 ling3 ren2 zuo4 ou3 de5 lu:3guan3，zheng3tian1 he4 yin3jun1zi3 hai2you3 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 gui3hun4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fa1feng1 de5 ju4long2，gang1 zhao2 ju4xing2 ji1qiang1 de5 hun2dan4，hai2you3 chen4 ren2 bu4 zhu4yi4 jiu4 ceng4 wo3 tui3 de5 di4yu4 quan3——zhe4yang4 de5 ri4zi5 you3 shen2me5 bu4hao3？"

msgid ""
"...Between you and me, that's probably a gang called Surfturf. Strange ones, those. I heard they implant suction cups to their hands and feet. \n"
"\n"
"I guess... they really like hitching rides on the U-Bahn trains?"
msgstr ""
"……​我​悄悄​跟​你​说​啊​，​好像​有​这么​个​叫​“​海陆​会​”​的​帮派​，​反正​挺怪​的​。​我​听说​他们​在手​和​脚​上​都​植入​了​吸盘​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​……​他们​应该​很​喜欢​免费​蹭​地铁​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"……wo3 qiao1qiao1 gen1 ni3 shuo1 a1，hao3xiang4 you3 zhe4me5 ge4 jiao4“hai3lu4 hui4” de5 bang1pai4，fan3zheng4 ting3 guai4 de5。wo3 ting1shuo1 ta1men5 zai4 shou3 he4 jiao3 shang4 dou1 zhi2ru4 le5 xi1pan2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1……ta1men5 ying1gai1 hen3 xi3huan5 mian3fei4 ceng4 di4tie3 ba1？"

msgid "...Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"……​布里​茨​？\n"
"……Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid ""
"...But Father! Titonius Rex is risking his life - nay, his very SOUL - to defend Lightninghold from the Jubuthons!\n"
"\n"
"His enchanted sword, Argo-Nar, *feeds* upon his honor and bravery, and it seeks to transform him from a noble Knight-King into an evil Demon Lord!"
msgstr ""
"……​但是​，​父亲​！​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​正冒​着​生命危险​—​—​不​，​甚至​是​他​的​灵魂​的​危险​—​—​来​保卫​闪电​堡​免受​朱布松​的​侵袭​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​魔剑​阿尔​戈纳尔​以​他​的​荣耀​和​勇气​为食​，​并​试图​将​他​从​一位​高贵​的​骑士​之王​转变成​邪恶​的​恶魔​领主​！\n"
"\n"
"……dan4shi4，fu4qin1！Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 zheng1 mao4 zhao2 sheng1 ming4 wei1 xian3——bu4，shen4zhi4 shi4 ta1 de5 ling2hun2 de5 wei1xian3——lai2 bao3wei4 shan3dian4 pu4 mian3shou4 zhu1 bu4 song1 de5 qin1xi2！\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 mo2 jian4 e1 er3 ge1 na4 er3 yi3 ta1 de5 rong2yao4 he4 yong3qi4 wei2 shi2，bing4 shi4tu2 jiang1 ta1 cong2 yi1 wei4 gao1gui4 de5 qi2shi4 zhi1 wang2 zhuai3 bian4 cheng2 xie2e4 de5 e4mo2 ling3zhu3！"

msgid ""
"...But from what we've seen here tonight, I suspect that he isn't the real "
"power here any more."
msgstr ""
"……​但​就​今晚​我们​所​见​而言​，​我​怀疑​他​已经​不再​是​这里​的​主宰者​了​。\n"
"……dan4 jiu4 jin1wan3 wo3men5 suo3 jian4 er2yan2，wo3 huai2yi2 ta1 yi3jing1 bu4zai4 shi4 zhe4li3 de5 zhu3zai3zhe3 le5。"

msgid ""
"...But it wasn't right, was it?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stares down at his trembling hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I acted without considering all of the variables... didn't even consider that such variables could exist! I was *blind!*"
msgstr ""
"……​但​那​并​不​正确​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​低头​盯​着​自己​颤抖​的​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​行事​时​未曾​权衡​所有​变量​……​甚至​从未​想过​这些​变量​可能​存在​！​我​简直​是​*​瞎了眼​*​！\n"
"\n"
"……dan4 na4 bing4 bu4 zheng4que4，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 ding1 zhao2 zi4ji3 chan4dou3 de5 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xing2shi4 shi2 wei4ceng2 quan2heng2 suo3you3 bian4liang4……shen4zhi4 cong2wei4 xiang3 guo4 zhe4xie1 bian4liang4 ke3neng2 cun2zai4！wo3 jian3zhi2 shi4*xia1 le5 yan3*！"

msgid ""
"...But she doesn't know the first thing about dealing with corp security. And Danni knows even less about splicing into power lines. \n"
"\n"
"Confidence can only carry you so far."
msgstr ""
"……​但​她​根本​不​懂​怎么​对付​公司​安保​人员​。​而丹妮​对​偷电​懂​的​就​更​少​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​光有​信心​是​不够​的​。\n"
"\n"
"……dan4 ta1 gen1ben3 bu4 dong3 zen3me5 dui4fu5 gong1si1 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。er2 dan1 ni1 dui4 tou1 dian4 dong3 de5 jiu4 geng1 shao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"guang1 you3 xin4xin1 shi4 bu4gou4 de5。"

msgid ""
"...But that can't be what you said, because you know better than to do something like that.\n"
"\n"
"Right?"
msgstr ""
"……​但​你​不​可能​说​这种​话​，​你​分得清​哪些​事是​不该​做​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"……dan4 ni3 bu4 ke3neng2 shuo1 zhe4zhong3 hua4，ni3 fen4 de2 qing1 na3xie1 shi4 shi4 bu4gai1 zuo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"...But that's going to have to wait. Tracking Harrow down is going to be a full-time job, and I can't do it while we still have a Great Dragon hanging over our heads.\n"
"\n"
"After we've dealt with Vauclair and the Firewing, I'll devote myself wholeheartedly to finding that bastard and finishing this. But for now, we need to keep our eyes on the road ahead."
msgstr ""
"……​但​现在​还​不是​时候​。​寻找​哈罗​会​是​一项​全职​工作​。​在​巨龙​的​威胁​仍​悬于​头顶​之际​，​我​无法​抽身​追查​他​的​行踪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​解决​了​沃​克莱尔​与​火翼​之后​，​我定​会​倾尽全力​追捕​那​混蛋​，​彻底​了结​此事​。​但​眼下​，​我们​必须​专注​于​眼前​的​征途​。\n"
"\n"
"……dan4 xian4zai4 hai2 bu4shi4 shi2hou5。xun2zhao3 ha1luo2 hui4 shi4 yi1 xiang4 quan2zhi2 gong1zuo4。zai4 ju4long2 de5 wei1xie2 reng2 xuan2 yu2 tou2ding3 zhi1ji4，wo3 wu2fa3 chou1shen1 zhui1cha2 ta1 de5 xing2zong1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 jie3jue2 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 yu4 Huo3yi4 zhi1hou4，wo3 ding4 hui4 qing1 jin3 quan2 li4 zhui1bu3 na4 hun2dan4，che4di3 liao3jie2 ci3shi4。dan4 yan3xia4，wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 yan3qian2 de5 zheng1tu2。"

msgid ""
"...But then my name was slandered, and the fickle mistress that is public perception turned against me.\n"
"\n"
"An ugly business, I assure you. Even talking about my fall from grace makes my stomach turn... the injustice of it all is almost too much to bear."
msgstr ""
"……​但​后来​，​我​的​名声​受到​了​诽谤​，​公众​对​我​的​看法​也​让​我​倍感​压力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你​保证​，​这是​一件​丑陋​的​事情​。​甚至​说起​我​的​没落​，​我​的​胃​都​在​翻腾​……​这​一切​的​不公​几乎​让​我​无法​承受​。\n"
"\n"
"……dan4 hou4lai2，wo3 de5 ming2sheng1 shou4dao4 le5 fei3bang4，gong1zhong4 dui4 wo3 de5 kan4fa3 ye3 rang4 wo3 bei4gan3 ya1li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，zhe4 shi4 yi1 jian4 chou3lou4 de5 shi4qing5。shen4zhi4 shuo1qi3 wo3 de5 mo4luo4，wo3 de5 wei4 dou1 zai4 fan1teng2……zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 bu4gong1 ji1hu1 rang4 wo3 wu2fa3 cheng2shou4。"

msgid ""
"...But then, there's also Harrow to consider.\n"
"\n"
"I want that man dead. Lord knows he deserves it. And if we don't make killing him our top priority, he might get away from us. \n"
"\n"
"If that happens - if he runs - he'll eventually start up another cult somewhere else, where we can't find him. And all of this will have been for nothing."
msgstr ""
"……​不过​，​还有​哈罗​的​问题​需要​考虑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​恨不得​那人​死​掉​。​老天​知道​他​是​罪有应得​。​如果​我们​不​把​杀掉​他​当作​首要任务​，​他​可能​会​从​我们​手中​溜走​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​他​真的​逃走​了​，​他​迟早会​在​别处​另起炉灶​，​建立​新​的​邪教组织​，​而​我们​根本​找​不到​他​。​到​那时​，​我们​所​做​的​一切​都​将​付诸东流​。\n"
"\n"
"……bu4guo4，hai2you3 ha1luo2 de5 wen4ti2 xu1yao4 kao3lu:4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen4bu5de5 na4 ren2 si3 diao4。lao3tian1 zhi1dao4 ta1 shi4 zui4you3ying1de2。ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4 ba3 sha1diao4 ta1 dang4zuo4 shou3 yao4 ren4 wu4，ta1 ke3neng2 hui4 cong2 wo3men5 shou3 zhong4 liu1zou3。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 ta1 zhen1de5 tao2zou3 le5，ta1 chi2 zao3 hui4 zai4 bie2chu4 ling4qi3lu2zao4，jian4li4 xin1 de5 xie2 jiao1 zu3 zhi1，er2 wo3men5 gen1ben3 zhao3 bu4dao4 ta1。dao4 na4shi2，wo3men5 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 jiang1 fu4zhu1dong1liu2。"

msgid ""
"...But, of course, the person who opened the door wasn't my father.\n"
"\n"
"It was my mother."
msgstr ""
"……​然而​，​来​开门​的​人​并​不是​我​父亲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​我​的​母亲​。\n"
"\n"
"……ran2er2，lai2 kai1men2 de5 ren2 bing4 bu4shi4 wo3 fu4qin1。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 wo3 de5 mu3qin1。"

msgid ""
"...Case in point.\n"
"\n"
"Hello, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"……​就是​这么回事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"\n"
"……jiu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid "...Fair enough."
msgstr ""
"……​好​吧​。\n"
"……hao3 ba1。"

msgid "...Glory?"
msgstr ""
"……​格洛丽​？\n"
"……Ge2luo4li2？"

msgid ""
"...Glory? Is... is that you?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The acolyte is in his early twenties - close to Glory's age. His eyes are wide with astonishment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't know me, but... but I was a new initiate back when you lived here. When you were--"
msgstr ""
"……​格洛丽​？​……​是​你​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​这个​侍祭​大约​二十岁​出头​—​—​与​格洛丽​年龄​相仿​。​他​惊讶​得​睁​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​认识​我​，​但​……​但​你​住​在​这里​的​时候​，​我​还​只是​个​新来​的​学徒​。​那时​你​还​—​—\n"
"\n"
"……Ge2luo4li2？……shi4 ni3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4ge5 shi4 ji4 da4yue1 er4 shi2 sui4 chu1tou2——yu4 Ge2luo4li2 nian2ling2 xiang1fang3。ta1 jing1ya4 de2 zheng1 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 ren4shi5 wo3，dan4……dan4 ni3 zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 hai2 zhi3shi4 ge4 xin1 lai2 de5 xue2tu2。na4shi2 ni3 hai2 — —"

msgid ""
"...I don't want to let him live, either. What I *want* to do is watch the bastard bleed out.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her hands clench into fists.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Screw it. We'll do this your way. If nothing else, I'll get the satisfaction of watching that monster squirm."
msgstr ""
"……​我​也​不想​放​他​活命​。​我​*​想​*​亲眼看到​那​混蛋​的​凄惨​死状​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​双手​紧握​成拳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​算了​。​我们​按​你​的​方式​来​。​至少​能​让​我​看着​那​怪物​扭动​挣扎​的​样子​，​也​算​解气​了​。\n"
"\n"
"……wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 fang4 ta1 huo2ming4。wo3*xiang3*qin1 yan3 kan4 dao4 na4 hun2dan4 de5 qi1can3 si3 zhuang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suan4le5。wo3men5 an4 ni3 de5 fang1shi4 lai2。zhi4shao3 neng2 rang4 wo3 kan4 zhao2 na4 guai4wu5 niu3 dong4 zheng1zha2 de5 yang4zi5，ye3 suan4 jie3qi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"...I thought I had something going there.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever. The point is, I’m in."
msgstr ""
"……​我​还​以为​我​想​的​很​明白​了​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随便​了​。​重点​是​，​我会​留下来​。\n"
"\n"
"……wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 wo3 xiang3 de5 hen3 ming2bai5 le5 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 le5。chong2dian3 shi4，wo3 hui4 liu2 xia4 lai2。"

msgid "...I've got nothin'."
msgstr ""
"……​我​没什么​可说​的​。\n"
"……wo3 mei2shen2me5 ke3 shuo1 de5。"

msgid ""
"...Look, we've survived this long. If we play our cards right and do a proper bit of rationing, I reckon that we can live off of the executive snack bar for a long time to come.\n"
"\n"
"We'll have plenty of fat and sugar - those won't be a problem. We've got mixed nuts for protein. And we can get our vitamins and minerals from diet bars... There aren't many of those, but like I said, we'll ration."
msgstr ""
"……​听​着​，​我们​已经​撑​到​现在​了​。​只要​我们​的​策略​得当​，​再​进行​合理​的​定量​分配​，​我​觉得​我们​可以​靠​高管​零食​吧台​里​的​食物​继续​生存​很​久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​脂肪​和​糖分​我们​不缺​—​—​这​不成问题​。​混合​坚果​能​提供​蛋白质​。​维生素​和​矿物质​就​靠​营养​棒​补充​……​虽然​数量​有限​，​但​正如​我​所说​，​我们​会​合理​分配​。\n"
"\n"
"……ting1 zhao2，wo3men5 yi3jing1 cheng1 dao4 xian4zai4 le5。zhi3yao4 wo3men5 de5 ce4lu:e4 de2dang4，zai4 jin4xing2 he2li3 de5 ding4liang4 fen1pei4，wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 ke3yi3 kao4 gao1guan3 ling2shi2 ba1tai2 li3 de5 shi2wu4 ji4xu4 sheng1cun2 hen3 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi1fang2 he4 tang2fen4 wo3men5 bu4 que1——zhe4 bu4 cheng2 wen4 ti2。hun4he2 jian1guo3 neng2 ti2gong1 dan4bai2zhi4。wei2sheng1su4 he4 kuang4wu4zhi4 jiu4 kao4 ying2yang3 bang4 bu3chong1……sui1ran2 shu4liang4 you3xian4，dan4 zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，wo3men5 hui4 he2li3 fen1pei4。"

msgid ""
"...Making her your number-one girl.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She sounds tired. Resigned. But above all, disappointed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is more of your Flux-State idiocy at work, isn't it?"
msgstr ""
"……​所以​她​就​成​了​你​面前​的​红人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​听​起来​很​疲惫​。​很​无奈​。​但​最​重要​的​是​，​很​失望​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​是​你​那套​“​动荡​带​”​的​白痴​理论​在​作祟​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"……suo3yi3 ta1 jiu4 cheng2 le5 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 hong2ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 pi2bei4。hen3 wu2nai4。dan4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4，hen3 shi1wang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 shi4 ni3 na4 tao4“dong4dang4 dai4” de5 bai2chi1 li3lun4 zai4 zuo4sui4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"...Making him your golden boy.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She sounds tired. Resigned. But above all, disappointed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is more of your Flux-State idiocy at work, isn't it?"
msgstr ""
"……​所以​他​就​成​了​你​面前​的​红人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​听​起来​很​疲惫​。​很​无奈​。​但​最​重要​的​是​，​很​失望​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​是​你​那套​“​动荡​带​”​的​白痴​理论​在​作祟​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"……suo3yi3 ta1 jiu4 cheng2 le5 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 hong2ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 pi2bei4。hen3 wu2nai4。dan4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4，hen3 shi1wang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 shi4 ni3 na4 tao4“dong4dang4 dai4” de5 bai2chi1 li3lun4 zai4 zuo4sui4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "...Monika?"
msgstr ""
"……​莫妮卡​？\n"
"……Mo4ni1ka3？"

msgid ""
"...No, I don't think I'm okay with this. It sounds a little too sketchy for "
"comfort."
msgstr ""
"……​我​不能​同意​这个​。​这​听​起来​太​不靠​谱​了​。\n"
"……wo3 bu4neng2 tong2yi4 zhe4ge5。zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 tai4 bu4 kao4 pu3 le5。"

msgid "...No. If I'm doing runs for you, you're the boss."
msgstr ""
"……​没什么​。​毕竟​我​是​干活​的​，​你​说了算​。\n"
"……mei2shen2me5。bi4jing4 wo3 shi4 gan4huo2 de5，ni3 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid ""
"...No. Sorry. I was ashamed to admit it, but I'm new here, and I stepped out"
" for a smoke. Now I can't seem to get back in. Would you mind holding the "
"door for me?"
msgstr ""
"……​这个​，​抱歉​，​很​不好意思​，​我​是​新来​的​，​刚才​出门​抽​了​支烟​，​结果​现在​进不去​了​。​你​能​帮​我​开​一下​门​吗​？\n"
"……zhe4ge5，bao4qian4，hen3 bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5，gang1cai2 chu1men2 chou1 le5 zhi1 yan1，jie1guo3 xian4zai4 jin4 bu4 qu4 le5。ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3 kai1 yi1xia4 men2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"...Of course, you're free to decline if you wish. But know that there are hundreds of runners in Berlin who would kill for the opportunity to work for us.\n"
"\n"
"We came to you because we think that we see a glimmer of potential. If you prove us wrong, we will happily take our offer elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"……​当然​，​你​也​可以​选择​拒绝​。​但​你​要​知道​，​柏林​这​地方​有​数百名​狂奔​者​为了​获得​替​我们​工作​的​机会​而争​破头​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​之所以​选择​与​你​合作​，​是因为​我们​看到​了​你​身上​闪现​的​潜力​。​若​你​证明​我们​判断​有误​，​我们​也​很​乐意​将​合作​机会​转投​他​处​。\n"
"\n"
"……dang1ran2，ni3 ye3 ke3yi3 xuan3ze2 ju4jue2。dan4 ni3 yao4 zhi1dao4，bo2lin2 zhe4 di4fang1 you3 shu3 bai3 ming2 kuang2Ben1zhe3 wei4le5 huo4de2 ti4 wo3men5 gong1zuo4 de5 ji1hui4 er2 zheng1 po4 tou2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1suo3yi3 xuan3ze2 yu4 ni3 he2zuo4，shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3men5 kan4dao4 le5 ni3 shen1shang5 shan3xian4 de5 qian2li4。ruo4 ni3 zheng4ming2 wo3men5 pan4duan4 you3 wu4，wo3men5 ye3 hen3 le4yi4 jiang1 he2zuo4 ji1hui4 zhuai3 tou2 ta1 chu3。"

msgid ""
"...Of course, your doctor will bill you separately for installation. But "
"this way, you can ensure that the procedure is carried out wherever you're "
"most comfortable."
msgstr ""
"……​当然​，​医生​会​单独​向​你​收取​安装​费用​。​但​这样一来​，​你​就​能​确保​手术​会​在​最​舒适​的​环境​中​进行​。\n"
"……dang1ran2，yi1sheng1 hui4 dan1du2 xiang4 ni3 shou1qu3 an1zhuang1 fei4yong4。dan4 zhe4yang4yi1lai2，ni3 jiu4 neng2 que4bao3 shou3shu4 hui4 zai4 zui4 shu1shi4 de5 huan2jing4 zhong4 jin4xing2。"

msgid ""
"...Oh, and thanks, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"For everything."
msgstr ""
"……​还有​，​谢谢​你​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为​你​所​做​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"……hai2you3，xie4xie5 ni3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wei2 ni3 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid "...Oh."
msgstr ""
"……​噢​。\n"
"……o1。"

msgid "...Oops."
msgstr ""
"……​哎呀​。\n"
"……ai1ya1。"

msgid ""
"...Or they were real, and your boss is cutting you out of whatever he has "
"planned."
msgstr ""
"……​也​可能​就是​真的​，​只是​你​的​老大​把​你​从​他​的​计划​里面​踢出去​了​。\n"
"……ye3 ke3neng2 jiu4shi4 zhen1de5，zhi3shi4 ni3 de5 lao3da4 ba3 ni3 cong2 ta1 de5 ji4hua4 li3mian4 ti1 chu1 qu4 le5。"

msgid "...Parson? Are you okay?"
msgstr ""
"……​帕森​？​你​还好​吗​？\n"
"……pa4 sen1？ni3 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"...Say, just out of curiosity, what was it that he said to you, anyway?"
msgstr ""
"……​话​说​，​我​就​好奇​问问​，​他​到底​跟​你​说​了​什么​？\n"
"……hua4 shuo1，wo3 jiu4 hao4qi2 wen4 wen4，ta1 dao4di3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"...Says the man who's sitting in the nice, cozy soykaf shop. I'd say that invalidates your opinion about what could and couldn't hurt.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, $(l.name). Let's quit wasting time and find that vault."
msgstr ""
"……​你​倒​是​说​得​好听​。​谁​让​你​待​在​舒适​暖和​的​豆​咖​店里​呢​。​我​倒​是​觉得​，​这​恰恰​说明​你​根本​分不清​什么​有​坏处​，​什么​没​坏处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​走​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​别​浪费时间​了​，​我们​还​得​找到​保险库​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"……ni3 dao3 shi4 shuo1 de2 hao3ting1。shei2 rang4 ni3 dai1 zai4 shu1shi4 nuan3huo5 de5 dou4 ka1 dian4 li3 ni2。wo3 dao3 shi4 jue2de5，zhe4 qia4qia4 shuo1ming2 ni3 gen1ben3 fen4 bu4 qing1 shen2me5 you3 huai4chu5，shen2me5 mei2 huai4chu5。\n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 zou3 ba1，$(l.name)。bie4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1 le5，wo3men5 hai2 de2 zhao3dao4 bao3 xian3 ku4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"...So what you're telling me is this: You were working on our LTG box. And then, all of a sudden, everything *magically* overloaded and went to hell, taking our communications along for the ride.\n"
"\n"
"And you had *nothing* to do with it?"
msgstr ""
"……​所以​你​是​说​：​你​当时​正在​维护​我们​的​LTG​箱​。​然后​，​突然​之间​，​一切​全部​*​神奇​地​*​过载​报废​了​，​包括​我们​的​通讯​系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​这​与​你​*​无关​*​？\n"
"\n"
"……suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 shuo1：ni3 dang1shi2 zheng4zai4 wei2hu4 wo3men5 de5 LTG xiang1。ran2hou4，tu1ran2 zhi1jian1，yi1qie4 quan2bu4*shen2qi2 de5*guo4zai4 bao4fei4 le5，bao1kuo4 wo3men5 de5 tong1xun4 xi4tong3。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4 yu4 ni3*wu2guan1*？"

msgid ""
"...So you're a getaway driver?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz shoots the rigger a sidelong glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Vehicle riggers are even *less* likely to be found on the front lines."
msgstr ""
"……​所以​你​是​负责​开车​接应​的​司机​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​斜​瞥​了​机师​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​驻车​机师​更​*​不​*​可能​往​前线​跑​了​。\n"
"\n"
"……suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 fu4ze2 kai1che1 jie1ying4 de5 si1ji1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 xie2 pie1 le5 ji1shi1 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhu4 che1 ji1shi1 geng1*bu4*ke3neng2 wang3 qian2xian4 pao2 le5。"

msgid ""
"...So you're a getaway driver?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich shoots the rigger a sidelong glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Vehicle riggers are even *less* likely to be found on the front lines."
msgstr ""
"……​所以​你​是​负责​开车​接应​的​司机​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希斜​瞥​了​机师​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​驻车​机师​更​*​不​*​可能​往​前线​跑​了​。\n"
"\n"
"……suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 fu4ze2 kai1che1 jie1ying4 de5 si1ji1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 xie2 pie1 le5 ji1shi1 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhu4 che1 ji1shi1 geng1*bu4*ke3neng2 wang3 qian2xian4 pao2 le5。"

msgid ""
"...So's shooting down a teammate like that - especially in front the rest of the group.\n"
"\n"
"Just a word of advice."
msgstr ""
"……​击毙​队友​同理​—​—​尤其​是​在​全队​面前​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只是​一句​忠告​。\n"
"\n"
"……ji1bi4 dui4you3 tong2li3——you2qi2 shi4 zai4 quan2 dui4 mian4qian2 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3shi4 yi1ju4 zhong1gao4。"

msgid ""
"...Speaking of changes, your life is about to get a lot more exciting. Did the Doc tell you that you're standing in the animal research lab?\n"
"\n"
"It's overflowing with test subjects, and they don't play well with others. Nasty, dangerous things. And it's well past their feeding time."
msgstr ""
"……​说​到​这个​，​你们​的​生活​马上​就要​变得​无比​刺激​了​。​博士​有没有​说​过​，​你们​待​的​地方​是​动物​研究​实验室​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​到处​都​是​实验​体​，​而且​它们​彼此之间​相处​得​并​不​融洽​。​这些​东西​既​肮脏​又​危险​。​而且​，​它们​的​进食​时间​早就​过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"……shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5，ni3men5 de5 sheng1huo2 ma3shang4 jiu4yao4 bian4de5 wu2bi3 ci4ji1 le5。bo2shi4 you3mei2you3 shuo1 guo4，ni3men5 dai1 de5 di4fang1 shi4 dong4wu4 yan2jiu1 shi2yan4shi4？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 shi2yan4 ti3，er2qie3 ta1men5 bi3 ci3 zhi1 jian1 xiang1chu3 de2 bing4 bu4 rong2qia4。zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 ji4 ang1zang1 you4 wei1xian3。er2qie3，ta1men5 de5 jin4shi2 shi2jian1 zao3jiu4 guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"...Speaking of which, did the Doc tell you that you're standing in the animal research lab?\n"
"\n"
"It's overflowing with test subjects, and they don't play well with others. Nasty, dangerous things. And it's well past their feeding time."
msgstr ""
"……​说​起来​，​博士​有没有​说​过​，​你们​待​的​地方​是​动物​研究​实验室​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​到处​都​是​实验​体​，​而且​它们​彼此之间​相处​得​并​不​融洽​。​这些​东西​既​肮脏​又​危险​。​而且​，​它们​的​进食​时间​早就​过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"……shuo1 qi3lai5，bo2shi4 you3mei2you3 shuo1 guo4，ni3men5 dai1 de5 di4fang1 shi4 dong4wu4 yan2jiu1 shi2yan4shi4？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 shi2yan4 ti3，er2qie3 ta1men5 bi3 ci3 zhi1 jian1 xiang1chu3 de2 bing4 bu4 rong2qia4。zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 ji4 ang1zang1 you4 wei1xian3。er2qie3，ta1men5 de5 jin4shi2 shi2jian1 zao3jiu4 guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"...Still, I can't wait to start working with it. From what I've read, early clinical trials were promising in the extreme. \n"
"\n"
"Amazingly potent, this stuff. And increased potency means less frequent injections, at a lower dosage. There's nothing not to like."
msgstr ""
"……​当然​，​我​还是​等不及​测试​新​配方​了​。​根据​我读​到​的​资料​，​早期​的​临床试验​结果​极其​乐观​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​东西​的​药效​强得​惊人​。​药效​更强​意味着​注射​频率​减少​，​剂量​也​可以​减少​。​真是​无可挑剔​。\n"
"\n"
"……dang1ran2，wo3 hai2shi5 deng3bu4ji2 ce4shi4 xin1 pei4fang1 le5。gen1ju4 wo3 dou4 dao4 de5 zi1liao4，zao3qi1 de5 lin2 chuang2 shi4 yan4 jie1guo3 ji2qi2 le4guan1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 de5 yao4xiao4 jiang4 de2 jing1ren2。yao4xiao4 geng1 jiang4 yi4wei4zhe5 zhu4she4 pin2lu:4 jian3shao3，ji4liang4 ye3 ke3yi3 jian3shao3。zhen1shi5 wu2ke3tiao1ti5。"

msgid "...That's probably for the best. Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""
"……​或许​这是​最好​的​决定​。​我们​能聊点​别的​吗​？\n"
"……huo4xu3 zhe4 shi4 zui4hao3 de5 jue2ding4。wo3men5 neng2 liao2 dian3 bie2de5 ma5？"

msgid "...The fuck?"
msgstr ""
"……​什么​鬼​？\n"
"……shen2me5 gui3？"

msgid "...This is ridiculous. "
msgstr ""
"……​这太扯​了​。\n"
"……zhe4 tai4 che3 le5。"

msgid ""
"...Troubling news out of Geneva today.\n"
"\n"
"The United Nations Office on Drugs and Crime has released its annual report on international violent crime statistics, and according to its findings, violent crime across the globe has nearly *doubled* since September of 2054."
msgstr ""
"……​日内瓦​今日​传来​令人不安​的​消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​联合国​毒品​和​犯罪​问题​办公室​发布​了​年度​国际​暴力犯罪​统计​报告​，​数据​显示​自​2054​年​9​月​以来​，​全球​暴力犯罪​数量​已​接近​翻倍​。\n"
"\n"
"……ri4nei4wa3 jin1ri4 chuan2lai2 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 xiao1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"lian2he2guo2 du2pin3 he4 fan4zui4 wen4ti2 ban4gong1shi4 fa1bu4 le5 nian2du4 guo2ji4 bao4li4fan4zui4 tong3ji4 bao4gao4，shu4ju4 xian3shi4 zi4 2054 nian2 9 yue4 yi3lai2，quan2qiu2 bao4li4fan4zui4 shu4liang4 yi3 jie1jin4 fan1bei4。"

msgid ""
"...Unfortunately, you also know all about what happened here tonight, and I can't have that information getting out. Shooting your own partner is frowned upon, even here in Drogenkippe.\n"
"\n"
"It's a conundrum. I'm sure that you can understand."
msgstr ""
"……​遗憾​的​是​，​你​已经​知道​了​今晚​在​这里​发生​的​所有​事情​，​而​我​绝不能​让​这些​信息​流露​出去​。​开枪​打死​自己​的​搭档​是​令人​不齿​的​行径​，​即便​在​毒​坑区​也​是​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​个​艰难​的​决定​。​我​相信​你​肯定​能​理解​的​。\n"
"\n"
"……yi2han4 de5 shi4，ni3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 le5 jin1wan3 zai4 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 de5 suo3you3 shi4qing5，er2 wo3 jue2 bu4 neng2 rang4 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 liu2lu4 chu1qu4。kai1qiang1 da3si3 zi4ji3 de5 da1dang4 shi4 ling4ren2 bu4chi3 de5 xing2jing4，ji2bian4 zai4 du2 keng1 qu1 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4 jian1nan2 de5 jue2ding4。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 ken3ding4 neng2 li3jie3 de5。"

msgid ""
"...We should probably get moving.\n"
"\n"
"Those samples aren't going to stay frozen forever."
msgstr ""
"……​我们​该​走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​生体​殖装​样本​会​解冻​的​。\n"
"\n"
"……wo3men5 gai1 zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 hui4 jie3dong4 de5。"

msgid ""
"...We're back with more details on the tragic events in Australia. Horizon News' own Taylor Nguyen is live on the scene in Pyrmont with more on this breaking story.\n"
"\n"
"Taylor, are you with us?"
msgstr ""
"我们​继续​带来​澳大利亚​悲剧​事件​的​最新进展​。​地平线​新闻​的​泰勒​·​阮​正在​皮尔​蒙特​现场​连线​，​为​您​带来​这则​突发​新闻​的​更​多​细节​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​泰勒​，​你​在​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ji4xu4 dai4lai2 ao4da4li4ya4 bei1ju4 shi4jian4 de5 zui4 xin1 jin4 zhan3。di4ping2xian4 xin1wen2 de5 tai4le4 · ruan3 zheng4zai4 pi2er3 meng2 te4 xian4chang3 lian2xian4，wei2 nin2 dai4lai2 zhe4 ze2 tu1fa1 xin1wen2 de5 geng1 duo1 xi4jie2。\n"
"\n"
"tai4le4，ni3 zai4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"...Well, anyway. I don't want to dwell on it.\n"
"\n"
"I just want to say that I'm sorry for putting you in that position."
msgstr ""
"……​总之​，​我​不想​一直​纠结​于​这件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​想​说​，​我​很​抱歉​当时​让​你​陷入​那种​处境​。\n"
"\n"
"……zong3zhi1，wo3 bu4xiang3 yi1zhi2 jiu1jie2 yu2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 shuo1，wo3 hen3 bao4qian4 dang1shi2 rang4 ni3 xian4ru4 na4zhong3 chu3jing4。"

msgid ""
"...Well, more accurately, $(l.he) can give me control of those autoturrets "
"with the press of a button. And then *I* can kill you."
msgstr ""
"……​更​准确​来说​，​$(l.he)​只​需​轻轻​一​按​就​能​给​我​自动​炮塔​的​控制​权限​。​然后​*​我​*​就​可以​弄死​你​。\n"
"……geng1 zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1，$(l.he) zhi3 xu1 qing1qing1 yi1 an4 jiu4 neng2 gei3 wo3 zi4dong4 pao4ta3 de5 kong4zhi4 quan2xian4。ran2hou4*wo3*jiu4 ke3yi3 nong4si3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"...Well, there's a first time for everything. So, Zaak: how did your mojo "
"hold up after the operation?"
msgstr ""
"……​凡事​总有​第一次​嘛​。​跟​我​说​说​，​扎克​：​你​的​魔力​在​手术​之后​保持​得​如何​？\n"
"……fan2shi4 zong3you3 di4yi1ci4 ma5。gen1 wo3 shuo1 shuo1，Zha1ke4：ni3 de5 mo2li4 zai4 shou3shu4 zhi1hou4 bao3chi2 de2 ru2he2？"

msgid "...What's up?"
msgstr ""
"……​怎么​了​？\n"
"……zen3me5 le5？"

msgid "...What?"
msgstr ""
"……​什么​？\n"
"……shen2me5？"

msgid "...Will be carried by Feuerschwinge herself."
msgstr ""
"……​会​由​火翼​亲自​扩散​开来​。\n"
"……hui4 you2 Huo3yi4 qin1zi4 kuo4san4 kai1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"...Yeah, chief. I got it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shuffles his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey, I'm sorry about that \"vault door\" thing. I'll admit it, that was an oversight on my part."
msgstr ""
"……​嗯​，​头儿​。​我​懂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挪动​着​双脚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​关于​“​保险库​门​”​的​事情​我​很​抱歉​。​我​承认​确实​是​我​疏忽​了​。\n"
"\n"
"……en1，tou2r5。wo3 dong3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nuo2dong4 zhao2 shuang1jiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"guan1yu2“bao3 xian3 ku4 men2” de5 shi4qing5 wo3 hen3 bao4qian4。wo3 cheng2ren4 que4shi2 shi4 wo3 shu1hu5 le5。"

msgid "...Yes, John, I'm here."
msgstr ""
"……​是​的​，​约翰​，​我​在​现场​。\n"
"……shi4 de5，yue1han4，wo3 zai4 xian4chang3。"

msgid ""
"...Yes, that's right, John... well, that mana storm *exploded* this morning into a new phenomenon that experts are calling a \"mana rift.\"\n"
"\n"
"I'm standing here in Pyrmont, and this is as close to Sydney as you can get. There are security cordons in place to keep traffic away, and we're being told that it's just not safe to venture any nearer."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​约翰​，​你​没​听错​……​今早​那场​魔力​风暴​突然​爆发​，​形成​了​一种​新​现象​，​专家​称之为​“​魔力​裂隙​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​现在​身处​皮尔​蒙特​，​这里​是​距离​悉尼​最近​的​观察点​。​现场​已​设置​警戒线​疏导​交通​，​据称​再​往前​靠近​就​存在​安全隐患​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，yue1han4，ni3 mei2 ting1cuo4……jin1zao3 na4 chang2 mo2li4 feng1bao4 tu1ran2 bao4fa1，xing2cheng2 le5 yi1zhong3 xin1 xian4xiang4，zhuan1jia1 cheng1zhi1wei2“mo2li4 lie4xi4”。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 shen1chu3 pi2er3 meng2 te4，zhe4li3 shi4 ju4li2 xi1ni2 zui4jin4 de5 guan1 cha2 dian3。xian4chang3 yi3 she4zhi4 jing3jie4xian4 shu1dao3 jiao1tong1，ju4cheng1 zai4 wang3qian2 kao4jin4 jiu4 cun2zai4 an1 quan2 yin4 huan4。"

msgid ""
"...Yes. It is a sewer.\n"
"\n"
"But it is *also* a nightmarish labyrinth of--"
msgstr ""
"……​是​的​，​它​是​下水道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​它​*​也​*​是​一个​噩梦般​的​迷宫​—​—\n"
"\n"
"……shi4 de5，ta1 shi4 xia4shui3dao4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1*ye3*shi4 yi1ge5 e4 meng4 ban1 de5 mi2gong1 — —"

msgid "...You got all that, $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"……​你​都​看​明白​了​吗​，​$(l.name)​？\n"
"……ni3 dou1 kan4 ming2bai5 le5 ma5，$(l.name)？"

msgid "...You got all that, boss?"
msgstr ""
"……​你​都​看​明白​了​吗​，​老大​？\n"
"……ni3 dou1 kan4 ming2bai5 le5 ma5，lao3da4？"

msgid "...You got all that, chief?"
msgstr ""
"……​你​都​看​明白​了​吗​，​头儿​？\n"
"……ni3 dou1 kan4 ming2bai5 le5 ma5，tou2r5？"

msgid "...You got all that, fearless leader?"
msgstr ""
"……​你​都​看​明白​了​吗​，​无畏​领袖​？\n"
"……ni3 dou1 kan4 ming2bai5 le5 ma5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4？"

msgid "...You mean, like a dragon?"
msgstr ""
"……​你​是​说​，​像​巨龙​那样​的​？\n"
"……ni3 shi4 shuo1，xiang4 ju4long2 na4yang4 de5？"

msgid ""
"...You shouldn't have come here. The tools of government aren't welcome at Feuerstelle.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}You hear a soft sound. You recognize it instantly: a blade being drawn from its sheath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We have a use for people like you."
msgstr ""
"……​你​不该​来​这里​的​。​政府​的​工具​人​在​“​火坑​”​可不​受欢迎​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​听见​一声​轻响​。​你​马上​意识​到​，​那​是​刀刃​出鞘​的​声音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​像​你​这样​的​人​，​我们​正好​用得上​。\n"
"\n"
"……ni3 bu4gai1 lai2 zhe4li3 de5。zheng4fu3 de5 gong1ju4 ren2 zai4“huo3keng1” ke3bu5 shou4huan1ying2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ting1jian4 yi1sheng1 qing1 xiang3。ni3 ma3shang4 yi4shi2 dao4，na4 shi4 dao1ren4 chu1qiao4 de5 sheng1yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2，wo3men5 zheng4hao3 yong4de5shang4。"

msgid ""
"...You're right. Without ironclad proof, we can't let that bastard go. Forget that I said anything.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her hands clench into fists.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have to admit, a part of me was hoping that you'd say no. I want to watch that bastard bleed out, and now I'm gonna get the chance to."
msgstr ""
"……​你​是​对​的​。​没有​确凿​的​证据​，​我们​不能​放​那个​混蛋​逃走​。​当​我​刚才​什么​都​没​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​双手​紧握​成拳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​承认​，​我​内心​有​一部分​确实​希望​你​会​拒绝​。​我​想​亲眼看到​那​混蛋​的​凄惨​死状​，​而​现在​我​终于​有​机会​了​。\n"
"\n"
"……ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。mei2you3 que4zao2 de5 zheng4ju4，wo3men5 bu4neng2 fang4 na4ge5 hun2dan4 tao2zou3。dang1 wo3 gang1cai2 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 cheng2ren4，wo3 nei4xin1 you3 yi1bu4fen5 que4shi2 xi1wang4 ni3 hui4 ju4jue2。wo3 xiang3 qin1 yan3 kan4 dao4 na4 hun2dan4 de5 qi1can3 si3 zhuang4，er2 xian4zai4 wo3 zhong1yu2 you3 ji1hui4 le5。"

msgid "...You're sure that this room is secure? You've done a full sweep?"
msgstr ""
"……​你​确定​这​房间​是​安全​的​吗​？​你​彻底​检查​过​了​？\n"
"……ni3 que4ding4 zhe4 fang2jian1 shi4 an1quan2 de5 ma5？ni3 che4di3 jian3cha2 guo4 le5？"

msgid ""
"...a thousand nuyen? Paid up front, here and now, via the commlink's input "
"port."
msgstr ""
"……​一千​新円​吧​？​就​现在​，​用​通讯​链​的​输入​端口​当场​一次性​付清​。\n"
"……yi1 qian1 xin1 yuan2 ba1？jiu4 xian4zai4，yong4 tong1xun4 lian4 de5 shu1ru4 duan1kou3 dang1chang3 yi1ci4xing4 fu4qing1。"

msgid ""
"...and here, as promised, is your spirit focus.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He hands you an object carved with arcane symbols. It feels warm to the touch.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As you see, I honor my deals."
msgstr ""
"……​还有​这件​精魂​法器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​将​一个​雕刻​着​神秘​符号​的​物品​交给​你​。​它​的​表面​很​温暖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如​你​所见​，​我​是​个​信守​承诺​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"……hai2you3 zhe4 jian4 jing1hun2 fa3 qi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 yi1ge5 diao1ke4 zhao2 shen2mi4 fu2hao4 de5 wu4pin3 jiao1gei3 ni3。ta1 de5 biao3mian4 hen3 wen1nuan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2 ni3 suo3jian4，wo3 shi4 ge4 xin4shou3 cheng2nuo4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"...and now that the cat's out of the bag, they have no reason not to pull out the big guns on sight.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich grimaces.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right. We can't go back while APEX is in place."
msgstr ""
"……​现在​秘密​已经​泄露​，​他们​只要​见到​我们​，​就​会​毫无顾忌​地​大开杀戒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希皱​紧​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​。​只要​APEX​还​在​，​我们​就​回不去​。\n"
"\n"
"……xian4zai4 mi4mi4 yi3jing1 xie4lu4，ta1men5 zhi3yao4 jian4dao4 wo3men5，jiu4 hui4 hao2 wu2 gu4 ji4 de5 dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 zhou4 jin3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。zhi3yao4 APEX hai2 zai4，wo3men5 jiu4 hui2 bu4 qu4。"

msgid "...and then Winters was killed by the same thing that killed Monika."
msgstr ""
"……​然后​温特斯​也​被​杀害​莫妮卡​的​凶手​所杀​。\n"
"……ran2hou4 Wen1te4si1 ye3 bei4 sha1hai4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 xiong1shou3 suo3 sha1。"

msgid ""
"...but we all know that she wasn't comfortable putting a soldier in charge."
msgstr ""
"……​但​我们​都​知道​她​不想​让​当兵​的​做​队长​。\n"
"……dan4 wo3men5 dou1 zhi1dao4 ta1 bu4xiang3 rang4 dang1bing1 de5 zuo4 dui4zhang3。"

msgid "...but, uh... I think that I could get used to it."
msgstr ""
"……​不过​嘛​……​我​觉得​我能​用​得惯​。\n"
"……bu4guo4 ma5……wo3 jue2de5 wo3 neng2 yong4 de2 guan4。"

msgid ""
"...can't believe they sent my squad down here to search for those escaped fire drakes. No one's been in these tunnels since the Awakening. Who knows what the hell else is down here??? \n"
"\n"
"Hope those scorp sightings are just nerves - if a drake and a scorp see each other, they'll tear each other to pieces. Must be natural enemies or something. They seem to hate each other even more than they hate us. \n"
"\n"
"Don't want to have to report back to Audran with nothing but drake pieces to show for our time..."
msgstr ""
"……​真​不敢相信​他们​居然​派​我​的​小队​来​这里​搜寻​那些​逃脱​的​火​飞龙​。​自从​大​觉醒​以来​，​就​没人​再​踏足​过​这些​隧道​。​谁​知道​这里​还有​什么​其他​东西​？​？​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​希望​那些​蝎子​的​目击​报告​只是​紧张​情绪​造成​的​—​—​如果​一条​飞龙​和​一只​蝎子​碰面​，​它们​会​互相​撕成​碎片​。​它们​一定​是​天生​的​敌人​什么​的​。​它们​似乎​比​讨厌​我们​更​讨厌​彼此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不想​回去​向​奥​德兰​汇报​时​，​只能​带回​一些​飞龙​的​碎片​作为​我们​的​成果​……\n"
"\n"
"……zhen1 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 ta1men5 ju1ran2 pai4 wo3 de5 xiao3 dui4 lai2 zhe4li3 sou1xun2 na4xie1 tao2tuo1 de5 huo3 fei1long2。zi4cong2 dai4 jue2xing3 yi3lai2，jiu4 mei2 ren2 zai4 ta4zu2 guo4 zhe4xie1 sui4dao4。shei2 zhi1dao4 zhe4li3 hai2you3 shen2me5 qi2ta1 dong1xi1？？？\n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 na4xie1 xie1zi5 de5 mu4ji1 bao4gao4 zhi3shi4 jin3zhang1 qing2xu4 zao4cheng2 de5——ru2guo3 yi1 tiao2 fei1long2 he4 yi1 zhi3 xie1zi5 peng4mian4，ta1men5 hui4 hu4xiang1 si1 cheng2 sui4pian4。ta1men5 yi1ding4 shi4 tian1sheng1 de5 di2ren2 shen2me5 de5。ta1men5 si4hu1 bi3 tao3yan4 wo3men5 geng1 tao3yan4 bi3ci3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xiang3 hui2qu5 xiang4 Ao4de2lan2 hui4bao4 shi2，zhi3neng2 dai4hui2 yi1xie1 fei1long2 de5 sui4pian4 zuo4wei2 wo3men5 de5 cheng2guo3……"

msgid ""
"...defiled...\n"
"\n"
"I am DEFILED!"
msgstr ""
"……​玷污​了​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​被​玷污​了​！\n"
"\n"
"……dian4wu1 le5……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bei4 dian4wu1 le5！"

msgid "...let me guess. The nameless troll."
msgstr ""
"……​让​我​猜猜​。​那个​没​名字​的​巨魔​。\n"
"……rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。na4ge5 mei2 ming2zi5 de5 ju4mo2。"

msgid "...sigh."
msgstr ""
"……​唉​。\n"
"……ai1。"

msgid ""
"...the nurturing compounds upon itself....\n"
"\n"
"...tightens the fabric...\n"
"\n"
"rootstothesoil\n"
"\n"
"childtothemother"
msgstr ""
"……​滋养​的​化合物​自身​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​收紧​织物​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​根系​与​土壤​\n"
"​\n"
"​孩子​与​母亲\n"
"\n"
"……zi1yang3 de5 hua4he2wu4 zi4shen1……\n"
"\n"
"……shou1jin3 zhi1wu4……\n"
"\n"
"gen1xi4 yu4 tu3rang3 \n"
"\n"
"hai2zi5 yu4 mu3qin1"

