msgid ""
"<DEATH COMES IN MANY FORMS, CHILD.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The fluttering sensation in your chest grows into a rasping pain that steals the breath from your lungs. It feels like you're being eaten alive.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<YOURS WILL BE SWIFT AND BRUTAL.>"
msgstr ""
"<​死亡​有​千百种​方式​，​孩子​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​胸中​的​阵阵​悸动​逐渐​化作​撕扯​般的​剧痛​，​令​你​窒息​难耐​，​仿佛​活生生​被​吞噬​殆尽​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​而​你​的​死亡​将​是​迅速​而​残酷​的​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< si3wang2 you3 qian1 bai3 zhong3 fang1shi4，hai2zi5。>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiong1zhong1 de5 zhen4 zhen4 ji4dong4 zhu2jian4 hua4zuo4 si1che3 ban1 de5 ju4tong4，ling3 ni3 zhi4xi1 nan2 nai4，fang3fu2 huo2sheng1sheng1 bei4 tun1shi4 dai4jin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< er2 ni3 de5 si3wang2 jiang1 shi4 xun4su4 er2 can2ku4 de5。>"

msgid ""
"<Glory. Welcome, child.>\n"
"\n"
"<What a pleasure it is to see you again.>"
msgstr ""
"<​格洛丽​。​欢迎​你​，​孩子​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​很​高兴​再次​见到​你​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< Ge2luo4li2。huan1ying2 ni3，hai2zi5。>\n"
"\n"
"< hen3 gao1xing4 zai4ci4 jian4dao4 ni3。>"

msgid ""
"<Glory. Welcome, child.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}It speaks in a chorus of clear, lilting voices. You don't hear them so much as *feel* them; the sensation is strange, like hundreds of butterflies fluttering in your chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<What a pleasure it is to see you again.>"
msgstr ""
"<​格洛丽​。​欢迎​你​，​孩子​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​它​的​声音​如同​一阵​清脆悦耳​的​合唱​。​你​并非​听见​这些​声音​，​而是​*​感受​到​*​它们​；​这种​奇异​的​感觉​，​如同​数百只​蝴蝶​在​你​胸中​翩然​飞舞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​很​高兴​再次​见到​你​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< Ge2luo4li2。huan1ying2 ni3，hai2zi5。>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ru2tong2 yi1zhen4 qing1 cui4 yue4 er3 de5 he2chang4。ni3 bing4fei1 ting1jian4 zhe4xie1 sheng1yin1，er2shi4*gan3shou4 dao4*ta1men5 ； zhe4zhong3 qi2yi4 de5 gan3jue2，ru2tong2 shu3 bai3 zhi3 hu2die2 zai4 ni3 xiong1zhong1 pian1 ran2 fei1wu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< hen3 gao1xing4 zai4ci4 jian4dao4 ni3。>"

msgid ""
"<Good.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The fluttering feeling swells, and you feel your knees go weak. Marta sobs with joy.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"<​很​好​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​这种​悸动​感​愈发​强烈​，​你​不禁​感到​双膝​发软​。​玛​尔塔​喜极而泣​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"< hen3 hao3。>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4zhong3 ji4dong4 gan3 yu4fa1 qiang2lie4，ni3 bu4jin1 gan3dao4 shuang1xi1 fa1ruan3。Ma3er3ta3 xi3ji2er2qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"<He knows that you desire His servant's destruction. As a symbol of His love, He will grant you the power to bring an end to Harrow.\n"
"\n"
"He knows that you wish to free the children of Feuerstelle. As a sign of His compassion, He will help you set them free.\n"
"\n"
"You can have everything that you want, child. All of this and more.>"
msgstr ""
"<​祂​知道​你​渴望​祂​的​仆人​的​毁灭​。​作为​祂​爱心​的​象征​，​祂​会​赐予​你​终结​哈罗​的​力量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祂​知道​你​希望​解放​火坑​中​的​孩童​。​作为​祂​同情​的​象征​，​祂​会​帮助​你​释放​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​拥有​你​想要​的​一切​，​孩子​。​除此之外​还有​更​多​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< ta1 zhi1dao4 ni3 ke3wang4 ta1 de5 pu2ren2 de5 hui3mie4。zuo4wei2 ta1 ai4xin1 de5 xiang4zheng1，ta1 hui4 ci4yu3 ni3 zhong1jie2 ha1luo2 de5 li4liang5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhi1dao4 ni3 xi1wang4 jie3fang4 huo3keng1 zhong4 de5 hai2tong2。zuo4wei2 ta1 tong2qing2 de5 xiang4zheng1，ta1 hui4 bang1zhu4 ni3 shi4fang4 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 yong1you3 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 yi1qie4，hai2zi5。chu2ci3zhi1wai4 hai2you3 geng1 duo1。>"

msgid ""
"<I have a message for you from our Great Master.\n"
"\n"
"He has a gift for you. A peace offering. One that He offers freely.\n"
"\n"
"A sign of His continued affection for you.>"
msgstr ""
"<​我​有​一条​来自​我们​伟大​主人​给​你​的​消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祂​有​一份​礼物​要​给​你​。​一份​和平​礼物​。​祂​免费​提供​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​标志​着​祂​对​你​持续​的​喜爱​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< wo3 you3 yi1 tiao2 lai2zi4 wo3men5 wei3da4 zhu3ren2 gei3 ni3 de5 xiao1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 you3 yi1 fen4 li3wu4 yao4 gei3 ni3。yi1 fen4 he2ping2 li3wu4。ta1 mian3fei4 ti2gong1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"biao1zhi4 zhao2 ta1 dui4 ni3 chi2xu4 de5 xi3ai4。>"

msgid ""
"<Killers... innocents of... will *NOT* stand for! I *not* SLAVE!\n"
"\n"
"ALL... Lodge-men BASTARDS... I *KILL ALL!*>"
msgstr ""
"<​杀手​……​无辜者​的​……​*​不会​*​容忍​！​我​*​不​*​奴隶​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​……​结社​杂种​……​我​*​杀​所有​*​！​>\n"
"\n"
"< sha1shou3……wu2 gu1 zhe3 de5……*bu4hui4*rong2ren3！wo3*bu4*nu2li4！\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3……jie2she4 za2zhong3……wo3*sha1 suo3you3*！>"

msgid ""
"<Make amends. Heal the sick and the wounded. Bring them the succor of hearth and home.\n"
"\n"
"But we can do nothing without your help.>"
msgstr ""
"<​弥补​过失​。​医治​病患​。​给​他们​提供​家庭​和​家园​的​慰藉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​没有​你​的​帮助​，​我们​什么​也​做不了​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< mi2bu3 guo4shi1。yi1zhi4 bing4huan4。gei3 ta1men5 ti2gong1 jia1ting2 he4 jia1yuan2 de5 wei4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 mei2you3 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，wo3men5 shen2me5 ye3 zuo4 bu4 le5。>"

msgid ""
"<Marta. We welcome you back to our domain, child.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}It speaks in a chorus of clear, lilting voices. You don't hear them so much as *feel* them; the sensation is strange, like hundreds of butterflies fluttering in your chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<You will remain silent until you are addressed. Do you understand?>"
msgstr ""
"<​玛​尔塔​。​欢迎​你​回到​我们​的​领域​，​孩子​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​它​的​声音​如同​一阵​清脆悦耳​的​合唱​。​你​并非​听见​这些​声音​，​而是​*​感受​到​*​它们​；​这种​奇异​的​感觉​，​如同​数百只​蝴蝶​在​你​胸中​翩然​飞舞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​在​我们​询问​你​之前​，​你​必须​保持沉默​。​明白​了​吗​？​>\n"
"\n"
"< Ma3er3ta3。huan1ying2 ni3 hui2dao4 wo3men5 de5 ling3yu4，hai2zi5。>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ru2tong2 yi1zhen4 qing1 cui4 yue4 er3 de5 he2chang4。ni3 bing4fei1 ting1jian4 zhe4xie1 sheng1yin1，er2shi4*gan3shou4 dao4*ta1men5 ； zhe4zhong3 qi2yi4 de5 gan3jue2，ru2tong2 shu3 bai3 zhi3 hu2die2 zai4 ni3 xiong1zhong1 pian1 ran2 fei1wu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< zai4 wo3men5 xun2wen4 ni3 zhi1qian2，ni3 bi4xu1 bao3 chi2 chen2 mo4。ming2bai5 le5 ma5？>"

msgid ""
"<No. But the stone will.\n"
"\n"
"We are still bound to this shrine. Anchored here. We can do nothing without your help.>"
msgstr ""
"<​不​。​但​这块​石头​会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​仍然​受​这座​神龛​束缚​。​被​锚定​在​此​。​没有​你​的​帮助​，​我们​什么​也​做不了​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< bu4。dan4 zhe4 kuai4 shi2tou5 hui4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 reng2ran2 shou4 zhe4 zuo4 shen2kan1 shu4fu4。bei4 mao2 ding4 zai4 ci3。mei2you3 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，wo3men5 shen2me5 ye3 zuo4 bu4 le5。>"

msgid ""
"<Please.\n"
"\n"
"We *must* make amends. We *need* to. But we can do nothing without your assistance.>"
msgstr ""
"<​求求​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​必须​做出​弥补​。​我们​需要​。​但​我们​没有​你​的​帮助​什么​也​做不了​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< qiu2 qiu2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 zuo4chu1 mi2bu3。wo3men5 xu1yao4。dan4 wo3men5 mei2you3 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4 shen2me5 ye3 zuo4 bu4 le5。>"

msgid ""
"<The outsider may do whatever $(l.he) wishes. We will not interfere with $(l.him) unless $(l.he) provokes us.\n"
"\n"
"Our Great Master's offer was to you, child. Accept, and everything that you desire will be yours.>"
msgstr ""
"<​那名​外人​可以​做​$(l.he)​想​做​的​任何​事​。​除非​$(l.he)​挑衅​我们​，​我们​不会​干涉​$(l.he)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​伟大​主人​的​提议​是​向​你​发出​的​，​孩子​。​接受​它​，​你​欲求​的​一切​就​都​会​是​你​的​了​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< na4 ming2 wai4ren2 ke3yi3 zuo4 $(l.he) xiang3 zuo4 de5 ren4he2 shi4。chu2fei1 $(l.he) tiao3xin4 wo3men5，wo3men5 bu4hui4 gan1she4 $(l.he)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 wei3da4 zhu3ren2 de5 ti2yi4 shi4 xiang4 ni3 fa1chu1 de5，hai2zi5。jie1shou4 ta1，ni3 yu4qiu2 de5 yi1qie4 jiu4 dou1 hui4 shi4 ni3 de5 le5。>"

msgid ""
"<We are still bound to this shrine. Anchored here. We cannot leave without "
"your assistance.>"
msgstr ""
"<​我们​仍然​受​这座​神龛​束缚​。​被​锚定​在​此​。​没有​你​的​帮助​，​我们​什么​也​做不了​。​>\n"
"< wo3men5 reng2ran2 shou4 zhe4 zuo4 shen2kan1 shu4fu4。bei4 mao2 ding4 zai4 ci3。mei2you3 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，wo3men5 shen2me5 ye3 zuo4 bu4 le5。>"

msgid ""
"<We have already done so. The cultists of Feuerstelle are themselves again.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The spirit bows its head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<We... we wish to do more. We have much to atone for, as you said.>"
msgstr ""
"<​我们​已经​这样​做​了​。​“​火坑​”​的​教徒​们​已经​恢复​了​自我意识​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​精魂​低下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​我们​……​我们​希望​能​做​更​多​。​正如​你​所说​，​我们​有​很多​事情​需要​弥补​。​>\n"
"\n"
"< wo3men5 yi3jing1 zhe4yang4 zuo4 le5。“huo3keng1” de5 jiao4tu2 men5 yi3jing1 hui1fu4 le5 zi4wo3yi4shi2。>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 di1 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< wo3men5……wo3men5 xi1wang4 neng2 zuo4 geng1 duo1。zheng4ru2 ni3 suo3 shuo1，wo3men5 you3 hen3 duo1 shi4qing5 xu1yao4 mi2bu3。>"

msgid ""
"<We need an appropriate vessel to carry us out of the rock. Something touched by magic, but more dead than alive.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}It dips its head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<Do you have anything that can help us?>"
msgstr ""
"<​我们​需要​一个​合适​的​容器​带​我们​离开​这块​石头​。​它​需要​沾染​过​魔力​，​但​最好​不要​有生​者​气息​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​它​低下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​你​有​什么​能​帮助​我们​的​东西​吗​？​>\n"
"\n"
"< wo3men5 xu1yao4 yi1ge5 he2shi4 de5 rong2qi4 dai4 wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4 kuai4 shi2tou5。ta1 xu1yao4 zhan1ran3 guo4 mo2li4，dan4 zui4hao3 bu4yao4 you3 sheng1 zhe3 qi4xi1。>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< ni3 you3 shen2me5 neng2 bang1zhu4 wo3men5 de5 dong1xi1 ma5？>"

msgid "<You leave... things. Not life.>"
msgstr ""
"<​你​留下​了​……​东西​。​不是​生命​。​>\n"
"< ni3 liu2xia4 le5……dong1xi1。bu4shi4 sheng1ming4。>"

msgid ""
"<Your friend - this outsider - jokes at our Great Master's expense. But we take no offense.\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.hisher) words are like the babble of a newborn babe. $+(l.he) is ignorant of the truth.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The spirit inclines its head toward you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<If the noise continues, we will educate $(l.him), and the babble will cease.>"
msgstr ""
"<​你​的​这个​外来者​朋友​拿​我们​的​伟大​主人​开玩笑​。​但​我们​并​不​为此​感到​恼火​。​\n"
"​\n"
