"​我​说​我们​需要​原型机​，​言下之意​当然​是​我们​要​它​*​完好无损​*​，​并且​能​*​正常​运作​*​。\n"
"\n"
">>*shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5*\n"
">>shou1jian4ren2：$(l.name) \n"
"\n"
"chen4 ni3 de5 cha4shi4 cheng2guo3“bu4 jin3 ren2 yi4” dou1 suan4shi4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 wo3men5 xu1yao4 yuan2 xing2 ji1，yan2xia4zhi1yi4 dang1ran2 shi4 wo3men5 yao4 ta1*wan2hao3wu2sun3*，bing4qie3 neng2*zheng4chang2 yun4zuo4*。"

msgid ""
">>*Herr Schmidt*\n"
">>to: $(l.name)\n"
"\n"
"Your reputation is well deserved! The interests that I represent are deeply impressed, both with the MKVI itself and with your work on this assignment.\n"
"\n"
"Please accept this payment with our compliments.\n"
"\n"
"-Schmidt"
msgstr ""
">​>​*​施密特​先生​*​\n"
"​>​>​收件人​：​$(l.name)​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​果然​名不虚传​！​我​所​代表​的​各方​都​对​MKVI​本身​以及​你​在​此​行动​中​展现​的​专业​水准​深感​钦佩​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​收下​这笔​酬金​与​谢意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​-​施密特\n"
"\n"
">>*shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5*\n"
">>shou1jian4ren2：$(l.name) \n"
"\n"
"ni3 guo3ran2 ming2bu4xu1chuan2！wo3 suo3 dai4biao3 de5 ge4fang1 dou1 dui4 MKVI ben3shen1 yi3ji2 ni3 zai4 ci3 xing2dong4 zhong4 zhan3xian4 de5 zhuan1ye4 shui3zhun3 shen1gan3 qin1pei4。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 shou1xia4 zhe4 bi3 chou2jin1 yu4 xie4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"-shi1mi4te4"

msgid ""
">>*Jana*\n"
">>to: $(l.name)\n"
"\n"
"I guess that I should thank you - you got me out of that horrible job alive. I don't think I could've made it on my own.\n"
"\n"
"What happened on that run took everything else away from me, but at least I'm still breathing."
msgstr ""
">​>​*​简娜​*​\n"
"​>​>​收件人​：​$(l.name)​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​我​应该​谢谢​你​—​—​是​你​让​我​从​那份​糟糕​的​工作​中​安然无恙​地​脱身​。​只​凭​我​自己​恐怕​做​不到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那次​差事​夺走​了​我​的​一切​，​但​至少​我​还​活着​。\n"
"\n"
">>*Jian3na4*\n"
">>shou1jian4ren2：$(l.name) \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 ying1gai1 xie4xie5 ni3——shi4 ni3 rang4 wo3 cong2 na4 fen4 zao1gao1 de5 gong1zuo4 zhong4 an1ran2wu2yang4 de5 tuo1shen1。zhi3 ping2 wo3 zi4ji3 kong3pa4 zuo4 bu4dao4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ci4 cha4shi4 duo2zou3 le5 wo3 de5 yi1qie4，dan4 zhi4shao3 wo3 hai2 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
">>*Mettbach, Gunari*\n"
">>to: $(l.name)\n"
"\n"
"If you value new hardware coming into the Kreuzbasar, we need to talk. One of my weapons shipments was hijacked by a local gang. I can promise 500 nuyen - and if you can recover the shipment, I'll have some new gear on the shelf.\n"
"\n"
"Come see me for the details."
msgstr ""
">​>​*​古纳里​·​梅特​巴赫​*​\n"
"​>​>​收件人​：​$(l.name)​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​在乎​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​新​装备​，​我们​就​得​谈谈​。​我​的​一批​武器​被​当地​帮派​劫走​了​。​我​的​报价​是​500​新円​—​—​如果​你​能​找回​这​批货​，​我​就​能​把​新​装备​上架​卖​给​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​详情​面谈​。\n"
"\n"
">>*gu3 na4 li3 · mei2 te4 ba1he4*\n"
">>shou1jian4ren2：$(l.name) \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zai4hu5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 xin1 zhuang1bei4，wo3men5 jiu4 de2 tan2tan2。wo3 de5 yi1 pi1 wu3qi4 bei4 dang1di4 bang1pai4 jie2 zou3 le5。wo3 de5 bao4jia4 shi4 500 xin1 yuan2——ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zhao3hui2 zhe4 pi1 huo4，wo3 jiu4 neng2 ba3 xin1 zhuang1bei4 shang4jia4 mai4 gei3 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"xiang2qing2 mian4tan2。"

