">>*SCHOCKWELLENREITER*\n"
">>to: $(l.name)\n"
"\n"
">>>>>Thank you for your service.\n"
"\n"
">>>>>As a sign of our appreciation, we have decided to reward you with a piece of biotech that one of our operatives acquired on a recent job."
