">>>>>Congratulations, jackass.\n"
"\n"
">>>>>You've managed to blow an op five years in the making and endanger Emilie's life, all in one fell swoop.\n"
"\n"
">>>>>Thanks to you, we're going to have to work very hard to keep your ex alive. "
