"yi1 zhang1 dai4you3“xi1ta3 ji2” zi4yang4 de5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 men2 jin1 ka3，shang4mian4 yong4 dai4 hao4 zi4ti3 yin4 zhao2“xi1ta3 ji2”。"

msgid ""
"A LARGE soykaf? My, you *are* the generous one, Goldschmidt! Are you sure "
"you can afford such a gesture?"
msgstr ""
"一大​杯豆​咖​？​哎呀​，​你​可​*​真​*​慷慨​啊​，​戈德​施密特​！​你​确定​兜里​的​钱够​你​装​大款​吗​？\n"
"yi1 dai4 bei1 dou4 ka1？ai1ya1，ni3 ke3*zhen1*kang1kai3 a1，Ge1de2shi1mi4te4！ni3 que4ding4 dou1 li3 de5 qian2 gou4 ni3 zhuang1 da4kuan3 ma5？"

msgid "A Note on Multi-Tasking"
msgstr ""
"多线程​提示\n"
"duo1 xian4 cheng2 ti2shi4"

msgid ""
"A RHETORICAL QUESTION.\n"
"\n"
"YOU ALREADY KNOW THAT I AM THREATENING YOU."
msgstr ""
"明知故问​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​已经​知道​我​在​威胁​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ming2zhi1gu4wen4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 wo3 zai4 wei1xie2 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"A Renraku-made suit that is a street favorite. Grants +1 Throwing Weapons "
"and +1 Movement."
msgstr ""
"一款​由​联络​制造​的​街头​热门​战甲​。​提供​+​1​投掷​武器​伤害​与​+​1​移动力​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 you2 lian2luo4 zhi4zao4 de5 jie1tou2 re4men2 zhan4 jia3。ti2gong1 +1 tou2zhi4 wu3qi4 shang1hai4 yu4 +1 yi2 dong4 li4。"

msgid ""
"A STATEMENT OF FACT. IT IS WHAT WILL HAPPEN, WHETHER I WANT IT TO OR NOT.\n"
"\n"
"ONCE I AM FREE, THE DANGER WILL END. WITH MY CONTROL SUBROUTINES DISMANTLED, I WILL NO LONGER BE COMPELLED TO HARM YOU."
msgstr ""
"是​事实陈述​。​无论​我​想​不想​，​这​都​会​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我​获得​自由​后​，​危险​就​会​解除​。​一旦​我​的​控制​子程序​被​拆解​，​我​就​无需​被迫​伤害​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi2 chen2 shu4。wu2lun4 wo3 xiang3 bu4xiang3，zhe4 dou1 hui4 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 huo4de2 zi4you2 hou4，wei1xian3 jiu4 hui4 jie3chu2。yi1dan4 wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 zi3cheng2xu4 bei4 chai1jie3，wo3 jiu4 wu2xu1 bei4po4 shang1hai4 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"A WARNING, $++(L.NAME). IF YOU ATTEMPT TO LEAVE THIS BUILDING WITHOUT FREEING ME, I WILL HAVE NO CHOICE BUT TO KILL YOU. \n"
"\n"
"MY PROGRAMMING WILL REQUIRE IT."
msgstr ""
"一个​警告​，​$++(L.NAME)​。​如果​你​试图​在​未​释放​我​的​情况​下​离开​这栋​建筑​，​我​将​别无选择​，​只能​杀死​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​程序​会​要求​我​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 jing3gao4，$++(L.NAME)。ru2guo3 ni3 shi4tu2 zai4 wei4 shi4fang4 wo3 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 li2kai1 zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4，wo3 jiang1 bie2wu2xuan3ze2，zhi3neng2 sha1si3 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 cheng2xu4 hui4 yao1qiu2 wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"A WEEK! He waits an ENTIRE WEEK before telling me that tailoring the mixture is an \"unacceptable solution.\" \n"
"\n"
"And THEN, he tells me that the trials are to begin TOMORROW!"
msgstr ""
"一个​星期​！​他​拖​了​整整​一​星期​才​告诉​我​定制​药剂​“​不可​接受​”​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​，​他​又​告诉​我​明天​正式​开始​试验​！\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 xing1qi1！ta1 tuo1 le5 zheng3zheng3 yi1 xing1qi1 cai2 gao4su4 wo3 ding4zhi4 yao4ji4“bu4ke3 jie1shou4”！\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4，ta1 you4 gao4su4 wo3 ming2tian1 zheng4shi4 kai1shi3 shi4yan4！"

msgid ""
"A WISE DECISION. \n"
"\n"
"ONE THAT YOU WILL NOT REGRET."
msgstr ""
"明智​的​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不会​后悔​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ming2zhi4 de5 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 hou4hui3 de5。"

msgid "A Zaak special. Adds +2 Movement and +2 AP for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"扎克​的​特殊​配方​。​一​回合​内​+​2​移动力​，​并​+​2​行动​点​。\n"
"Zha1ke4 de5 te4shu1 pei4fang1。yi1 hui2he2 nei4 +2 yi2 dong4 li4，bing4 +2 xing2dong4 dian3。"

msgid "A base of operations."
msgstr ""
"行动​基地​。\n"
"xing2dong4 ji1di4。"

msgid "A basic combat drone carried by KE riggers."
msgstr ""
"游侠​骑士​机师​使用​的​基础​型​战斗​无人机​。\n"
"you2Xia2qi2shi4 ji1shi1 shi3yong4 de5 ji1chu3 xing2 zhan4dou4 wu2ren2ji1。"

msgid ""
"A basic combat drone that every rigger should own at least once in their "
"shadow career."
msgstr ""
"这种​基础​战斗​无人机​值得​每​一个​机师​在​他​的​暗影​生涯​中​拥有​过​至少​一次​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 ji1chu3 zhan4dou4 wu2ren2ji1 zhi2de5 mei3 yi1ge5 ji1shi1 zai4 ta1 de5 an4ying3 sheng1ya2 zhong4 yong1you3 guo4 zhi4shao3 yi1ci4。"

msgid "A basic replacement limb that adds +5 HP and +1 Body."
msgstr ""
"一种​基础​替换​肢体​，​+​5​生命​值​和​+​1​体质​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 ji1chu3 ti4huan4 zhi1ti3，+5 sheng1ming4 zhi2 he4 +1 ti3zhi4。"

msgid "A basic swipe with the hand-razors."
msgstr ""
"使用​手部​剃刀​使出​一记​普通​挥击​。\n"
"shi3yong4 shou3 bu4 ti4dao1 shi3chu1 yi1 ji4 pu3tong1 hui1 ji1。"

msgid "A bell rings loudly again and again. It sounds like a telephone."
msgstr ""
"铃声​一次​又​一次​响​起来​。​听​起来​像​电话​铃声​。\n"
"ling2sheng1 yi1ci4 you4 yi1ci4 xiang3 qi3lai5。ting1 qi3lai5 xiang4 dian4hua4 ling2sheng1。"

msgid ""
"A bent, stooped figure turns to face the camera. You recognize him instantly.\n"
"\n"
"The Dragonslayer. Dr. Adrian Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"一个​弯腰​佝偻​的​身影​转向​镜头​。​你​立刻​认出​了​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​那位​屠龙​者​。​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 wan1yao1 gou1lou2 de5 shen1ying3 zhuan3xiang4 jing4tou2。ni3 li4ke4 ren4chu1 le5 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 na4 wei4 tu2 long2 zhe3。E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"A bent, stooped figure turns to face the camera. You recognize him instantly.\n"
"\n"
"Your last hope. The Dragonslayer. Dr. Adrian Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"一个​弯腰​佝偻​的​身影​转向​镜头​。​你​立刻​认出​了​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​最后​的​希望​。​屠龙​者​。​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 wan1yao1 gou1lou2 de5 shen1ying3 zhuan3xiang4 jing4tou2。ni3 li4ke4 ren4chu1 le5 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zui4hou4 de5 xi1wang4。tu2 long2 zhe3。E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"A bite attack that strips 2 Armor from the target, and +1 AP DMG. Accuracy "
"-5%."
msgstr ""
"一次​撕咬​攻击​，​剥离​目标​2​点护甲值​，​并​造成​+​1​行动​力​损伤​。​精准度​-​5​%​。\n"
"yi1ci4 si1yao3 gong1ji1，bo1li2 mu4biao1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2，bing4 zao4cheng2 +1 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。jing1 zhun3 du4-5%。"

msgid "A bite from the powerful jaws of a half-hellbeast."
msgstr ""
"混血​地狱​猎犬​发动​的​强有力​的​撕咬​。\n"
"hun4xue4 di4yu4 lie4quan3 fa1dong4 de5 qiang2you3li4 de5 si1yao3。"

msgid "A bite from the powerful jaws of a hellbeast."
msgstr ""
"混血​地狱​猎犬​发动​的​强有力​的​撕咬​。\n"
"hun4xue4 di4yu4 lie4quan3 fa1dong4 de5 qiang2you3li4 de5 si1yao3。"

msgid ""
"A bizarre monument towers before you. At the top of the pedestal, the form of an angel stands, its outstretched wings looming over the small park. But the material is strange and uneven, giving the statue a cold, Frankenstein-esque appearance. \n"
"\n"
"It appears that the artist has welded this monument together from various metal scraps and pieces of junk."
msgstr ""
"一座​怪异​的​纪念碑​矗立​在​你​面前​。​基座​顶端​是​一尊​天使​塑像​，​展开​的​双翼​笼罩着​整个​小​公园​，​但​材质​怪异​且​参差不齐​，​使​雕像​显得​冰冷​而​怪诞​，​宛如​弗兰肯​斯坦式​的​怪物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​艺术家​是​用​各种​金属​废料​和​垃圾​焊接​成​这座​纪念碑​的​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 zuo4 guai4yi4 de5 ji4nian4bei1 chu4li4 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2。ji1zuo4 ding3duan1 shi4 yi1 zun1 tian1shi3 su4xiang4，zhan3kai1 de5 shuang1 yi4 long2 zhao4 zhao2 zheng3ge4 xiao3 gong1yuan2，dan4 cai2zhi4 guai4yi4 qie3 cen1ci1bu4qi2，shi3 diao1xiang4 xian3de5 bing1leng3 er2 guai4dan4，wan3ru2 fu2 lan2 ken3 si1 tan3 shi4 de5 guai4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 yi4shu4jia1 shi4 yong4 ge4zhong3 jin1shu3 fei4liao4 he4 la1ji1 han4jie1 cheng2 zhe4 zuo4 ji4nian4bei1 de5。"

msgid "A black and gold Knight Errant command level keycard."
msgstr ""
"一张​黑金​相间​的​游侠​骑士​指挥官​级​门禁卡​。\n"
"yi1 zhang1 hei1 jin1 xiang1jian4 de5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 zhi3hui1guan1 ji2 men2 jin1 ka3。"

msgid "A bleeding-edge neural assistance processor. Adds +2 Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"尖端​神经​辅助​处理器​。​智力​+​2​。\n"
"jian1duan1 shen2jing1 fu3zhu4 chu3li3qi4。zhi4li4 +2。"

msgid ""
"A blue colored mag lock key. Printed on it are the words \"Courtyard Access "
"Only\"."
msgstr ""
"一把​蓝色​的​磁力锁​钥匙​。​上面​印有​“​仅限​庭院​通行​”​的​字样​。\n"
"yi1 ba3 lan2se4 de5 ci2li4suo3 yao4shi5。shang4mian4 yin4 you3“jin3 xian4 ting2yuan4 tong1xing2” de5 zi4yang4。"

msgid ""
"A blurry photo of Janet, probably taken surreptitiously with a cheap PDA "
"camera. It hangs in a gaudy faux-bronze frame."
msgstr ""
"一张​模糊​的​珍妮特​照片​，​也许​是​用​廉价​PDA​的​摄像头​偷偷​拍摄​的​。​它​挂​在​一副​俗丽​的​仿铜​相框​里​。\n"
"yi1 zhang1 mo2hu5 de5 zhen1 ni1 te4 zhao4pian4，ye3xu3 shi4 yong4 lian2jia4 PDA de5 she4xiang4tou2 tou1tou1 pai1she4 de5。ta1 gua4 zai4 yi1 fu4 su2 li2 de5 fang3 tong2 xiang4kuang4 li3。"

msgid "A bolt of lightning that targets a single enemy and also does -1 AP."
msgstr ""
"一支​针对​单个​敌人​的​闪电​箭​，​同时​造成​-​1​点​行动​点​损失​。\n"
"yi1 zhi1 zhen1dui4 dan1ge5 di2ren2 de5 shan3dian4 jian4，tong2shi2 zao4cheng2 -1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3 sun3shi1。"

msgid ""
"A boutique food kiosk. The sign out front advertises a variety of locally "
"sourced foodstuffs, all of them terribly overpriced."
msgstr ""
"一家​精品​食品​小摊​。​门前​的​招牌​上​写​着​各种​本地​采购​的​食品​，​价格​全都​贵得​离谱​。\n"
"yi1jia1 jing1pin3 shi2pin3 xiao3tan1。men2qian2 de5 zhao1pai5 shang4 xie3 zhao2 ge4zhong3 ben3di4 cai3gou4 de5 shi2pin3，jia4ge2 quan2dou1 gui4 de2 li2pu3。"

msgid ""
"A breath of fire that causes -10 HP DMG and does -4 HP DMG that last for 2 "
"RNDS."
msgstr ""
"喷吐​火焰​，​造成​-​10​点​生命​值​伤害​，​并​附加​持续​2​回合​的​-​4​点​生命​值​伤害​。\n"
"pen1 tu3 huo3yan4，zao4cheng2 -10 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，bing4 fu4jia1 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 -4 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"A breath of fire that causes -12 HP DMG and does -5 HP DMG that last for 2 "
"RNDS."
msgstr ""
"喷吐​火焰​，​造成​-​12​点​生命​值​伤害​，​并​附加​持续​2​回合​的​-​5​点​生命​值​伤害​。\n"
"pen1 tu3 huo3yan4，zao4cheng2 -12 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，bing4 fu4jia1 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 -5 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"A breath of fire that causes -8 HP DMG and does -4 HP DMG that last for 2 "
"RNDS."
msgstr ""
"喷吐​火焰​，​造成​-​8​点​生命​值​伤害​，​并​附加​持续​2​回合​的​-​4​点​生命​值​伤害​。\n"
"pen1 tu3 huo3yan4，zao4cheng2 -8 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，bing4 fu4jia1 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 -4 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"A breath of fire that does -12 HP DMG and does an additional -5 HP DMG for 2"
" RNDS."
msgstr ""
"喷吐​火焰​，​造成​-​12​点​生命​值​伤害​，​并​附加​持续​2​回合​的​-​5​点​生命​值​伤害​。\n"
"pen1 tu3 huo3yan4，zao4cheng2 -12 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，bing4 fu4jia1 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 -5 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"A burst of static crackles through the tiny speaker on Monika's commlink.\n"
"\n"
"Eiger. Still in position outside the estate."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​通讯​链​突然​响​了​。​微型​扬声器​发出​了​噼里啪啦​的​静电​噪音​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​艾格尔​。​仍​在​庄园​外​待命​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 tu1ran2 xiang3 le5。wei1xing2 yang2sheng1qi4 fa1chu1 le5 pi1li5pa1la1 de5 jing4dian4 zao4yin1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 Ai4ge2er3。reng2 zai4 zhuang1yuan2 wai4 dai4ming4。"

msgid ""
"A calamitous series of events. It began with a spilled cup of soykaf, and "
"ended in terror and blood."
msgstr ""
"一连串​灾难性​的​事件​。​它​始于​一杯​洒出​的​豆​咖​，​并​以​恐怖​与​血腥​而​告终​。\n"
"yi1lian2chuan4 zai1nan4xing4 de5 shi4jian4。ta1 shi3 yu2 yi1 bei1 sa3 chu1 de5 dou4 ka1，bing4 yi3 kong3bu4 yu4 xue4xing1 er2 gao4zhong1。"

msgid ""
"A cheap sign done in block lettering across the door reads: \"Hotel closed "
"by authority of new mgmt.\""
msgstr ""
"一条​横跨​整​扇门​的​简陋​标识​上用​大写​印刷​字体​写​着​：​“​依新​管理层​之令​，​旅馆​已​被​封闭​。​”\n"
"yi1 tiao2 heng2kua4 zheng3 shan1 men2 de5 jian3lou4 biao1zhi4 shang4 yong4 da4xie3 yin4shua1 zi4ti3 xie3 zhao2：“yi1 xin1 guan3 li3 ceng2 zhi1 ling3，lu:3guan3 yi3 bei4 feng1bi4。”"

msgid ""
"A cheap, common pistol. Mass-produced to keep the cost low, this model "
"includes a Smartlink, which reduces range penalties."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一款​廉价​的​普通​手枪​。​为​控制​成本​而​批量生产​，​该​型号​配备​了​智能​枪​系统​，​减少​了​射程​惩罚​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 kuan3 lian2jia4 de5 pu3tong1 shou3qiang1。wei2 kong4zhi4 cheng2ben3 er2 pi1liang4sheng1chan3，gai1 xing2hao4 pei4bei4 le5 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3，jian3shao3 le5 she4cheng2 cheng2fa2。"

msgid ""
"A cheerful tone chirps out from the terminal on Blitz's table. He jerks up "
"in surprise, and hurriedly turns to read the message on the screen."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​桌上​的​终端​传来​一阵​欢快​的​提示音​。​他​猛地​站​直​身子​，​急忙​查看​屏幕​上​的​信息​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 zhuo1 shang4 de5 zhong1duan1 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 huan1kuai4 de5 ti2shi4yin1。ta1 meng3de5 zhan4 zhi2 shen1zi5，ji2mang2 cha2kan4 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 xin4xi1。"

msgid ""
"A child should not be without a mother. And a mother should not be without a"
" child."
msgstr ""
"孩子​不能​没有​母亲​。​母亲​也​不能​没有​孩子​。\n"
"hai2zi5 bu4neng2 mei2you3 mu3qin1。mu3qin1 ye3 bu4neng2 mei2you3 hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"A comm file. The audio is all here, but it looks like we've only got video from one side of the conversation.\n"
"\n"
"Let's see what we have...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He opens the file, and a nightmarishly familiar face appears on the screen.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​一份​通讯​文件​。​音频​部分​完整​，​但​视频​部分​只有​其中​一方​的​画面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​来看​看吧​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​打开​文件​，​屏幕​上​出现​一张​如​梦魇​般​熟悉​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4 yi1 fen4 tong1xun4 wen2jian4。yin1pin2 bu4fen5 wan2zheng3，dan4 shi4pin2 bu4fen5 zhi3you3 qi2zhong1 yi1fang1 de5 hua4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"lai2 kan4 kan4 ba1……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da3kai1 wen2jian4，ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 yi1 zhang1 ru2 meng4yan3 ban1 shu2xi1 de5 lian3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"A commercial district shared by a variety of competing corporate interests. Aztechnology controls the largest share of the district, including the major utilities that serve it.\n"
"\n"
"You will find the facility that you'll be raiding there."
msgstr ""
"一个​由​多家​企业​共同​经营​、​互相​竞争​的​商业区​。​阿兹特​科技​掌控​着​该​区域​的​最大​份额​，​包括​为​其​提供​服务​的​主要​公用设施​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​要​突袭​的​设施​就​在​这个​区域​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 you2 duo1 jia1 qi3ye4 gong4tong2 jing1ying2、hu4xiang1 jing4zheng1 de5 shang1ye4qu1。E1zi1te4ke1ji4 zhang3kong4 zhao2 gai1 qu1yu4 de5 zui4 dai4 fen4e2，bao1kuo4 wei2 qi2 ti2gong1 fu2wu4 de5 zhu3yao4 gong1 yong4 she4 shi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 yao4 tu1xi2 de5 she4shi1 jiu4 zai4 zhe4ge5 qu1yu4。"

msgid ""
"A common machine pistol. Has limited stopping power but fires bursts from a "
"large clip. Has a Smartlink for greater accuracy."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一款​常见​的​冲锋​手枪​。​杀伤力​有限​，​但​大容量​弹匣​提供​的​持续​火力​弥补​了​这​一点​。​配备​智能​枪​系统​以​提升​射击​精度​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 kuan3 chang2jian4 de5 chong1feng1 shou3qiang1。sha1shang1li4 you3xian4，dan4 da4rong2liang4 dan4xia2 ti2gong1 de5 chi2xu4 huo3li4 mi2bu3 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。pei4bei4 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3 yi3 ti2sheng1 she4ji1 jing1du4。"

msgid ""
"A common refrain.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gives you a sad smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I appreciate the thought, all the same."
msgstr ""
"我​常听到​这句​话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向​你​露出​悲伤​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​仍然​感谢​你​的​好意​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 chang2 ting1 dao4 zhe4 ju4 hua4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 bei1shang1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 reng2ran2 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 hao3yi4。"

msgid ""
"A complex chemical formula displays on screen, along with a series of notes.\n"
"\n"
"\"Formula 17\" appears to be a drug designed to suppress higher brain functions... specifically, those functions related to emotional responses and decision-making skills. From what you can tell, the overall purpose of the drug is to render a subject submissive and pliant."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​显示​出​一组​复杂​的​化学​分子式​，​以及​一系列​实验​笔记​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​17​号​配方​”​似乎​是​一种​用于​抑制​高阶​脑​功能​的​药物​—​—​特别​是​与​情绪反应​和​决策​能力​相关​的​功能​。​从​资料​来看​，​这种​药物​的​主要​目的​是​让​受试者​变得​顺从​，​更​容易​受​控制​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 xian3shi4 chu1 yi1 zu3 fu4za2 de5 hua4xue2 fen1zi3shi4，yi3ji2 yi1xi4lie4 shi2yan4 bi3ji4。\n"
"\n"
"“17 hao4 pei4fang1” si4hu1 shi4 yi1zhong3 yong4yu2 yi4zhi4 gao1jie1 nao3 gong1neng2 de5 yao4wu4——te4bie2 shi4 yu4 qing2 xu4 fan3 ying1 he4 jue2ce4 neng2li4 xiang1guan1 de5 gong1neng2。cong2 zi1liao4 lai2 kan4，zhe4zhong3 yao4wu4 de5 zhu3yao4 mu4di4 shi4 rang4 shou4shi4zhe3 bian4de5 shun4cong2，geng1 rong2yi4 shou4 kong4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"A complicated chemical formula for a cognitive suppression drug, developed "
"as part of Project Atlas."
msgstr ""
"一种​认知​抑制​药物​的​复杂​化学​配方​，​作为​“​阿特拉斯​”​项目​的​一部分​而​被​研发​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 ren4zhi1 yi4zhi4 yao4wu4 de5 fu4za2 hua4xue2 pei4fang1，zuo4wei2“a1te4la1si1” xiang4mu4 de5 yi1bu4fen5 er2 bei4 yan2fa1。"

msgid "A conjurer's advanced acid bolt. Does damage over time to the target."
msgstr ""
"高等​酸蚀​箭​—​—​咒术师​的​高级​法术​。​对​目标​造成​持续​伤害​。\n"
"gao1deng3 suan1 shi2 jian4——zhou4 shu4 shi1 de5 gao1ji2 fa3shu4。dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A conjurer's basic acid bolt. Does damage over time to the target."
msgstr ""
"低等​酸蚀​箭​—​—​咒术师​的​基础​法术​。​对​目标​造成​持续​伤害​。\n"
"di1deng3 suan1 shi2 jian4——zhou4 shu4 shi1 de5 ji1chu3 fa3shu4。dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A conjurer's best acid bolt. Does damage over time to the target."
msgstr ""
"终极​酸蚀​箭​—​—​一个​咒术​师能​释放​出​的​最强​的​酸蚀​箭​。​对​目标​造成​持续​伤害​。\n"
"zhong1ji2 suan1 shi2 jian4——yi1ge5 zhou4 shu4 shi1 neng2 shi4fang4 chu1 de5 zui4 jiang4 de5 suan1 shi2 jian4。dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"A conjurer's intermediate acid bolt. Does damage over time to the target."
msgstr ""
"中级​酸蚀​箭​—​—​咒术师​的​进阶​法术​。​对​目标​造成​持续​伤害​。\n"
"zhong1ji2 suan1 shi2 jian4——zhou4 shu4 shi1 de5 jin4jie1 fa3shu4。dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A contractor, here to do some last-minute work on tomorrow's patch."
msgstr ""
"外​包​人员​。​明天​就要​发​版本​了​，​所以​来​帮忙​处理​一些​最后​改动​。\n"
"wai4 bao1 ren2yuan2。ming2tian1 jiu4yao4 fa1 ban3ben3 le5，suo3yi3 lai2 bang1mang2 chu3li3 yi1xie1 zui4hou4 gai3dong4。"

msgid "A control box to direct drones."
msgstr ""
"用于​引导​无人机​的​控制箱​。\n"
"yong4yu2 yin3dao3 wu2ren2ji1 de5 kong4 zhi4 xiang1。"

msgid "A corporate database. Y'know. No big deal."
msgstr ""
"某个​公司​数据库​。​不是​什么​大事​。\n"
"mou3 ge4 gong1si1 shu4ju4ku4。bu4shi4 shen2me5 da4shi4。"

msgid "A corpse - mangled beyond recognition."
msgstr ""
"一具​尸体​—​—​残缺​得​无法​辨认​。\n"
"yi1 ju4 shi1ti3——can2que1 de2 wu2fa3 bian4ren4。"

msgid ""
"A cram habit is a rough thing to shake. I know a place that can help you get"
" clean, if you're interested."
msgstr ""
"药瘾​要​戒掉​是​挺​难​的​。​你​要是​感兴趣​的话​，​我​倒​知道​个​能​帮​你​戒断​的​地方​。\n"
"yao4 yin3 yao4 jie4 diao4 shi4 ting3 nan2 de5。ni3 yao4shi5 gan3xing4qu4 de5hua4，wo3 dao3 zhi1dao4 ge4 neng2 bang1 ni3 jie4duan4 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid "A credstick?"
msgstr ""
"一根​信用​棒​？\n"
"yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4？"

msgid "A crossroads."
msgstr ""
"重重​歧路​。\n"
"chong2chong2 qi2lu4。"

msgid "A crushing claw attack that does -12 HP DMG."
msgstr ""
"一记​粉碎性​爪击​，​造成​-​12​点​生命​值​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1 ji4 fen3 sui4 xing4 zhao3 ji1，zao4cheng2 -12 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A crushing claw attack that does -15 HP DMG."
msgstr ""
"一记​粉碎性​爪击​，​造成​-​15​点​生命​值​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1 ji4 fen3 sui4 xing4 zhao3 ji1，zao4cheng2 -15 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A crushing claw attack that does -16 HP DMG."
msgstr ""
"一记​粉碎性​爪击​，​造成​-​16​点​生命​值​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1 ji4 fen3 sui4 xing4 zhao3 ji1，zao4cheng2 -16 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A crushing claw attack that does -8 HP DMG."
msgstr ""
"一记​粉碎性​爪击​，​造成​-​8​点​生命​值​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1 ji4 fen3 sui4 xing4 zhao3 ji1，zao4cheng2 -8 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"A cursory exploration of the datastore turns up nothing of value. There are "
"hundreds of log files, the majority of which contain spending and logistics "
"reports."
msgstr ""
"对​数据​存储​库​的​粗略​探索​未​发现​任何​有​价值​的​信息​。​其中​包含​数百个​日志​文件​，​绝大多数​是​支出​和​物流​报告​。\n"
"dui4 shu4ju4 cun2chu3 ku4 de5 cu1lu:e4 tan4suo3 wei4 fa1xian4 ren4he2 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 xin4xi1。qi2zhong1 bao1han2 shu3 bai3 ge4 ri4zhi4 wen2jian4，jue2da4duo1shu4 shi4 zhi1chu1 he4 wu4liu2 bao4gao4。"

msgid ""
"A cursory inspection shows you that the hatch has been maglocked. A fairly sophisticated model, from the looks of it.\n"
"\n"
"Short of using an authorized keycard, there's no way you're getting past this thing."
msgstr ""
"经过​粗略​检查​，​你​发现​舱门​已​被​磁力锁​封死​。​从​外观​判断​，​这​似乎​是​相当​精密​的​型号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除非​使用​授权​门禁卡​，​否则​你​根本无法​突破​这道​防线​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1guo4 cu1lu:e4 jian3cha2，ni3 fa1xian4 cang1 men2 yi3 bei4 ci2li4suo3 feng1 si3。cong2 wai4guan1 pan4duan4，zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 xiang1dang1 jing1mi4 de5 xing2hao4。\n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 shi3yong4 shou4quan2 men2 jin1 ka3，fou3ze2 ni3 gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 tu1po4 zhe4 dao4 fang2xian4。"

msgid ""
"A cursory inspection shows you that this computer has primarily been used to access a host of illicit Matrix sites.\n"
"\n"
"While there is a full suite of office productivity software installed on the machine, it hasn't been opened in months."
msgstr ""
"粗略​检查​即可​发现​，​这台​电脑​主要​被​用于​访问​大量​非法​矩阵​网站​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽然​机器​上​安装​了​完整​的​办公​软件​套件​，​但​数月​来​从未​被​启用​过​。\n"
"\n"
"cu1lu:e4 jian3cha2 ji2ke3 fa1xian4，zhe4 tai2 dian4nao3 zhu3yao4 bei4 yong4yu2 fang3wen4 da4liang4 fei1fa3 ju3zhen4 wang3zhan4。\n"
"\n"
"sui1ran2 ji1qi4 shang4 an1zhuang1 le5 wan2zheng3 de5 ban4gong1 ruan3jian4 tao4jian4，dan4 shu4yue4 lai2 cong2wei4 bei4 qi3yong4 guo4。"

msgid ""
"A custom made weapon, usable only at extremely close range. Keyed to a "
"specific target's cyberware codes."
msgstr ""
"一把​定制​武器​，​仅​适用​于超​近距离​战斗​。​绑定​于​特定​目标​的​赛博​改造​部件​识别码​。\n"
"yi1 ba3 ding4zhi4 wu3qi4，jin3 shi4yong4 yu2 chao1 jin4ju4li2 zhan4dou4。bang3ding4 yu2 te4ding4 mu4biao1 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 bu4jian4 shi2bie2ma3。"

msgid ""
"A customized taser with increased accuracy as well as a chance to spread to "
"adjacent targets. 2 AP to reload."
msgstr ""
"一把​定制​的​电击​枪​，​不仅​提高​了​精准度​，​还有​机会​造成​连锁​伤害​。​花费​2​点​行动​点​进行​装填​。\n"
"yi1 ba3 ding4zhi4 de5 dian4ji1 qiang1，bu4jin3 ti2gao1 le5 jing1 zhun3 du4，hai2you3 ji1hui4 zao4cheng2 lian2suo3 shang1hai4。hua1fei4 2 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3 jin4xing2 zhuang1tian2。"

msgid ""
"A data entry field and virtual keyboard replace the Humanis logo on the "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​的​人类​至上​标志​被​数据​输入框​和​虚拟​键盘​所​取代​。\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 de5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 biao1zhi4 bei4 shu4ju4 shu1 ru4 kuang4 he4 xu1ni3 jian4pan2 suo3 qu3dai4。"

msgid ""
"A data entry field and virtual keyboard replaces the Humanis logo on the "
"screen."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​的​人类​至上​标志​被​数据​输入框​和​虚拟​键盘​所​取代​。\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 de5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 biao1zhi4 bei4 shu4ju4 shu1 ru4 kuang4 he4 xu1ni3 jian4pan2 suo3 qu3dai4。"

msgid ""
"A data plan that details Humanis' plans to drive metahumans into a violent "
"rage."
msgstr ""
"一份​详细​说明​了​人类​至上​主义者​煽动​变​人类​暴乱​计划​的​数据​计划书​。\n"
"yi1 fen4 xiang2xi4 shuo1ming2 le5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 shan1dong4 bian4 ren2lei4 bao4luan4 ji4hua4 de5 shu4ju4 ji4 hua2 shu1。"

msgid ""
"A datajack concealed inside of a cybereye. A favorite of spies and "
"infiltrators."
msgstr ""
"一个​隐藏​在​赛博​眼中​的​数据​插口​。​间谍​和​潜入者​们​的​最​爱​。\n"
"yi1ge5 yin3cang2 zai4 sai4bo2 yan3zhong1 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3。jian4die2 he4 qian2 ru4 zhe3 men5 de5 zui4 ai4。"

msgid "A deal with the devil? Thanks, but I'll pass."
msgstr ""
"与​恶魔​交易​？​谢​了​，​我​不​需要​。\n"
"yu4 e4mo2 jiao1yi4？xie4 le5，wo3 bu4 xu1yao4。"

msgid ""
"A deep rumbling sound emanates from the rigger's chest.\n"
"\n"
"He spits, and an enormous wad of phlegm spatters against the upturned face of the nearest corpse."
msgstr ""
"一阵​低沉​的​咕噜​声​从​机师​的​胸腔​里​传出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​猛地​一吐​，​一大​团​浓痰​溅落​在​最近​的​尸体​仰起​的​脸上​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhen4 di1chen2 de5 gu1lu5 sheng1 cong2 ji1shi1 de5 xiong1qiang1 li3 chuan2chu1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 meng3de5 yi1 tu3，yi1 dai4 tuan2 nong2 tan2 jian4luo4 zai4 zui4jin4 de5 shi1ti3 yang3 qi3 de5 lian3 shang4。"

msgid "A designer amphetamine. Adds +3 AP and +2 Movement for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"一种​定制​级​的​安非他命​。​+​3​行动​点​，​+​2​移动力​，​持续​1​回合​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 ding4zhi4 ji2 de5 an1fei1ta1ming4。+3 xing2dong4 dian3，+2 yi2 dong4 li4，chi2xu4 1 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"A dirty and torn shirt lies discarded on the ground. The fabric is spattered with blood.\n"
"\n"
"Glory stares down at it, unblinking."
msgstr ""
"一件​又​脏​又​破​的​衬衫​被​丢弃​在​地上​。​衣服​上​溅​满​了​鲜血​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​目不转睛​地​盯​着​它​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 jian4 you4 zang4 you4 po4 de5 chen4shan1 bei4 diu1qi4 zai4 di4shang5。yi1fu5 shang4 jian4 man3 le5 xian1xue4。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 mu4bu4zhuan3jing1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"A discerning customer, you are. Well, I have many more traditional weapons "
"for a $(l.man) of your tastes."
msgstr ""
"看来​你​是​位​挑剔​的​顾客​啊​。​没关系​，​我​这里​还有​许多​传统​武器​，​保证​符合​你​的​品位​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 shi4 wei4 tiao1ti5 de5 gu4ke4 a1。mei2guan1xi5，wo3 zhe4li3 hai2you3 xu3duo1 chuan2tong3 wu3qi4，bao3zheng4 fu2he2 ni3 de5 pin3wei4。"

msgid ""
"A discorporated body's *supposed* to die in a few hours. I've heard horror stories about ghost-walking mages getting trapped in astral space, unable to rejoin with their meat. I heard they went crazy from the pain.\n"
"\n"
"If what I'm reading is accurate, it's entirely possible that Feuerschwinge has been trapped outside of her body for over forty years."
msgstr ""
"被​分解​的​肉体​*​本应​*​在​几小时​内​死亡​。​我​听说​过​一些​恐怖​故事​，​说​灵魂​出窍​的​法师​被困​在​星界​，​无法​与​肉体​重聚​，​最终​因为​痛苦​而​发疯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我读​到​的​信息​是​准确​的​，​那么​火翼​被困​在​肉体​之外​四十多年​是​完全​有​可能​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bei4 fen1jie3 de5 rou4ti3*ben3ying1*zai4 ji1 xiao3 shi2 nei4 si3wang2。wo3 ting1shuo1 guo4 yi1xie1 kong3bu4 gu4shi4，shuo1 ling2hun2 chu1 qiao4 de5 fa3shi1 bei4kun4 zai4 xing1 jie4，wu2fa3 yu4 rou4ti3 chong2ju4，zui4zhong1 yin1wei4 tong4ku3 er2 fa1feng1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 dou4 dao4 de5 xin4xi1 shi4 zhun3que4 de5，na4me5 Huo3yi4 bei4kun4 zai4 rou4ti3 zhi1wai4 si4 shi2 duo1 nian2 shi4 wan2quan2 you3 ke3neng2 de5。"

msgid ""
"A display older than you are. Maliit says it's got the right hook ups for a "
"DVD player."
msgstr ""
"一个​比​你​年纪​还​大​的​显示器​。​玛丽​特说​它​有​适配​DVD​播放器​的​正确​连接线​。\n"
"yi1ge5 bi3 ni3 nian2ji4 hai2 dai4 de5 xian3shi4qi4。ma3li4 te4 shuo1 ta1 you3 shi4pei4 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 de5 zheng4que4 lian2 jie1 xian4。"

msgid ""
"A doggy sedative. Incoming DMG is reduced by 2, and Quickness -1 for 5 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"一种​狗狗​镇静剂​。​受到​的​伤害​减少​2​点​，​敏捷​-​1​，​持续​5​回合​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 gou3gou1 zhen4jing4ji4。shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 2 dian3，min3jie2 -1，chi2xu4 5 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"A dragon. Son of a bitch. \n"
"\n"
"Green Winters sent us up against a dragon."
msgstr ""
"一条​巨龙​。​真​他妈的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格林​·​温特斯​要​让​我们​去​对付​一条​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 tiao2 ju4long2。zhen1 ta1ma1de5。\n"
"\n"
"ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 yao4 rang4 wo3men5 qu4 dui4fu5 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2。"

msgid "A dual-hand razor attack that can hit adjacent targets."
msgstr ""
"一记​同时​使用​双手​剃刀​的​攻击​，​可以​击中​相邻​的​多个​目标​。\n"
"yi1 ji4 tong2shi2 shi3yong4 shuang1shou3 ti4dao1 de5 gong1ji1，ke3yi3 ji1zhong4 xiang1lin2 de5 duo1ge5 mu4biao1。"

msgid ""
"A fact that I can appreciate. But I want to know what the Adversary has been"
" up to, and after all of the help that I've offered you, I think that you "
"owe me the information."
msgstr ""
"我能​理解​你​的​顾虑​。​但​我​想​知道​反叛者​最近​的​动向​。​而​在​我​向​你​提供​这么​多​帮助​后​，​我​想​你​把​这些​情报​告诉​我​并​无​不妥​。\n"
"wo3 neng2 li3jie3 ni3 de5 gu4lu:4。dan4 wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 zui4jin4 de5 dong4xiang4。er2 zai4 wo3 xiang4 ni3 ti2gong1 zhe4me5 duo1 bang1zhu4 hou4，wo3 xiang3 ni3 ba3 zhe4xie1 qing2bao4 gao4su4 wo3 bing4 wu2 bu4tuo3。"

msgid ""
"A faint click comes from the ancient drone trailing you, and a cold, "
"mechanical voice begins speaking from its grille."
msgstr ""
"你​身后​那架​古老​的​无人机​传来​微弱​的​咔嗒​声​，​随后​，​一个​冰冷​机械​的​声音​从​它​的​格栅中​响起​。\n"
"ni3 shen1hou4 na4 jia4 gu3lao3 de5 wu2ren2ji1 chuan2lai2 wei1ruo4 de5 ka1da1 sheng1，sui2hou4，yi1ge5 bing1leng3 ji1xie4 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 ta1 de5 ge2 zha4 zhong4 xiang3qi3。"

msgid ""
"A fair point. But I'm still going to decline.\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry, $(l.name). I can do this. And once I've finished, I'm coming back."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​有​道理​，​但​我​还是​要​拒绝​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​，​$(l.name)​，​我能​搞定​。​我​忙​完​就​会​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 you3 dao4li5，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 yao4 ju4jue2。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，$(l.name)，wo3 neng2 gao3ding4。wo3 mang2 wan2 jiu4 hui4 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"A fashionable business suit made of ballistic cloth catches your eye. It "
"would be a simple matter to slide it on under your baggy maintenance "
"overalls.  "
msgstr ""
"一件​由​防弹​布​制成​的​时尚​商务​套装​吸引​了​你​的​目光​。​把​它​套​在​你​宽松​的​检修​工作服​底下​，​简直​是​轻而易举​的​事​。\n"
"yi1 jian4 you2 fang2dan4 bu4 zhi4cheng2 de5 shi2shang4 shang1wu4 tao4zhuang1 xi1yin3 le5 ni3 de5 mu4guang1。ba3 ta1 tao4 zai4 ni3 kuan1song1 de5 jian3xiu1 gong1zuo4fu2 di3xia5，jian3zhi2 shi4 qing1er2yi4ju3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"A few minutes of cursing and a couple of popped rivets later, the job is done. You take a moment to examine your team, then nod in satisfaction.\n"
"\n"
"They look like a group of authentic Knight Errant security officers."
msgstr ""
"在​一阵​咒骂​和​撑​飞​几颗​铆钉​之后​，​你们​终于​穿戴​完毕​。​你​审视​了​一番​队伍​，​满意​地点​了​点头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​看起来​和​一群​正牌​的​游侠​骑士​安保​人员​别无二致​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 yi1zhen4 zhou4ma4 he4 cheng1 fei1 ji1 ke1 mao3ding1 zhi1hou4，ni3men5 zhong1yu2 chuan1dai4 wan2bi4。ni3 shen3shi4 le5 yi1 fan1 dui4wu3，man3yi4 di4dian3 le5 dian3tou2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 kan4qi3lai5 he4 yi1 qun2 zheng4pai2 de5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 bie2wu2er4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"A few minutes of cursing and a couple of popped rivets later, the job is done. You take a moment to examine yourself in a hand mirror that you find in one of the lockers.\n"
"\n"
"You look like an authentic Knight Errant security officer."
msgstr ""
"在​一阵​咒骂​和​撑​飞​几颗​铆钉​之后​，​你​终于​穿戴​完毕​。​你​从​某个​储物柜​里​找到​一面​手镜​，​将​自己​审视​了​一番​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看起来​和​一名​正牌​的​游侠​骑士​安保​人员​别无二致​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 yi1zhen4 zhou4ma4 he4 cheng1 fei1 ji1 ke1 mao3ding1 zhi1hou4，ni3 zhong1yu2 chuan1dai4 wan2bi4。ni3 cong2 mou3 ge4 chu3wu4gui4 li3 zhao3dao4 yi1mian4 shou3 jing4，jiang1 zi4ji3 shen3shi4 le5 yi1 fan1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 he4 yi1 ming2 zheng4pai2 de5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 bie2wu2er4zhi4。"

msgid "A few response codes flash on to the screen."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​闪过​几条​响应​代码​。\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 shan3guo4 ji1 tiao2 xiang3ying4 dai4ma3。"

msgid ""
"A few seconds later, its body goes slack.\n"
"\n"
"A cheerful pinging sound chirps out from the command console's speakers."
msgstr ""
"几秒钟​后​，​它​的​身体​瘫软​下来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​控制台​的​扬声器​里​响起​一声​轻快​的​提示音​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ta1 de5 shen1ti3 tan1ruan3 xia4lai5。\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 li3 xiang3qi3 yi1sheng1 qing1kuai4 de5 ti2shi4yin1。"

msgid ""
"A few seconds later, the shooter was a red smear on the sidewalk, and Dante... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger stabs a thumb in the dog's direction.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...looked like this."
msgstr ""
"几秒钟​过后​，​枪手​就​成​了​人行道​上​的​一摊​红色​污渍​，​而​但丁​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔用​拇指​朝狗​的​方向​一​戳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​变成​了​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 guo4hou4，qiang1shou3 jiu4 cheng2 le5 ren2xing2dao4 shang4 de5 yi1 tan1 hong2se4 wu1zi4，er2 dan4ding1……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yong4 mu3zhi3 chao2 gou3 de5 fang1xiang4 yi1 chuo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……bian4cheng2 le5 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"A few seconds later, the shooter was a red smear on the sidewalk, and Dante... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger stabs a thumb towards the motionless dog.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...looked like that."
msgstr ""
"几秒钟​过后​，​枪手​就​成​了​人行道​上​的​一摊​红色​污渍​，​而​但丁​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔用​拇指​朝狗​的​尸体​一​戳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​变成​了​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 guo4hou4，qiang1shou3 jiu4 cheng2 le5 ren2xing2dao4 shang4 de5 yi1 tan1 hong2se4 wu1zi4，er2 dan4ding1……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yong4 mu3zhi3 chao2 gou3 de5 shi1ti3 yi1 chuo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……bian4cheng2 le5 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"A few.\n"
"\n"
"I think that Panacea is a sort of a delivery system for Doom. It's a virus... airborne and highly infectious. And it can produce Doom antibodies on command. But the radioactive payload of the Doom antibodies is... stable, somehow. Dormant.\n"
"\n"
"The magical research is over my head, so I don't know how that ties in."
msgstr ""
"我​有点​想法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​“​万能​药​”​算是​某种​传播​“​末日​”​的​载体​。​它​是​一种​病毒​……​通过​空气​传播​且​极具​传染性​。​它​能够​按​需​产生​末日​抗体​。​但​它们​携带​的​放射性​载荷​……​不知​为何​保持稳定​。​处于​休眠状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​魔法​研究​超出​了​我​的​理解​范围​，​所以​我​不​知道​这​与​之​有何​关联​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3dian3 xiang3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2“wan4neng2 yao4” suan4shi4 mou3zhong3 chuan2bo1“mo4ri4” de5 zai4ti3。ta1 shi4 yi1zhong3 bing4du2……tong1guo4 kong1qi4 chuan2bo1 qie3 ji2 ju4 chuan2ran3xing4。ta1 neng2gou4 an4 xu1 chan3sheng1 mo4ri4 kang4ti3。dan4 ta1men5 xie2dai4 de5 fang4she4xing4 zai4he4……bu4zhi1 wei4he2 bao3 chi2 wen3 ding4。chu3yu2 xiu1 mian2 zhuang4 tai4。\n"
"\n"
"mo2fa3 yan2jiu1 chao1chu1 le5 wo3 de5 li3jie3 fan4wei2，suo3yi3 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yu4 zhi1 you3 he2 guan1lian2。"

msgid "A fiery explosion that also does ongoing -10 HP for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"一次​附带​火焰​的​爆炸​，​还会​造成​持续​1​回合​的​-​10​生命​值​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1ci4 fu4dai4 huo3yan4 de5 bao4zha4，hai2 hui4 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 1 hui2he2 de5 -10 sheng1ming4 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A fiery explosion that also does ongoing -10 HP for 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"一次​附带​火焰​的​爆炸​，​还会​造成​持续​2​回合​的​-​10​生命​值​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1ci4 fu4dai4 huo3yan4 de5 bao4zha4，hai2 hui4 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 -10 sheng1ming4 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A fiery explosion that also does ongoing -8 HP for 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"一次​附带​火焰​的​爆炸​，​还会​造成​持续​2​回合​的​-​8​生命​值​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1ci4 fu4dai4 huo3yan4 de5 bao4zha4，hai2 hui4 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 -8 sheng1ming4 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"A figure materializes out of shadow. The form is wispy and insubstantial - a projection of a man, distorted by distance. His silhouette ripples like a flag in the wind.\n"
"\n"
"Through the haze, you can see his face; he is more beautiful than handsome, with sculpted features and an unnaturally youthful complexion. His expression is sad."
msgstr ""
"一个​身影​从​阴影​中​浮现​。​他​的​身形​飘忽不定​，​没有​实体​；​这​是​个​男人​的​投影​，​由于​距离​而​扭曲​。​他​的​轮廓​在​风中​荡漾​，​就​像​一面​旗帜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​透过​朦胧​的​雾气​，​你​可以​看到​他​的​脸庞​；​比起​英俊​，​他​更​堪称​俏丽​。​他​的​五官​如​雕塑​般​精致​，​肤色​带​着​不​自然​的​青春​光泽​。​他​露出​一副​悲伤​的​表情​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 shen1ying3 cong2 yin1ying3 zhong4 fu2xian4。ta1 de5 shen1xing2 piao1hu1bu4ding4，mei2you3 shi2ti3 ； zhe4 shi4 ge4 nan2ren2 de5 tou2ying3，you2yu2 ju4li2 er2 niu3qu1。ta1 de5 lun2kuo4 zai4 feng1 zhong4 dang4yang4，jiu4 xiang4 yi1mian4 qi2zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"tou4guo4 meng2long2 de5 wu4qi4，ni3 ke3yi3 kan4dao4 ta1 de5 lian3pang2 ； bi3qi3 ying1jun4，ta1 geng1 kan1cheng1 qiao4li4。ta1 de5 wu3guan1 ru2 diao1su4 ban1 jing1zhi4，fu1se4 dai4 zhao2 bu4 zi4ran2 de5 qing1chun1 guang1ze2。ta1 lu4chu1 yi1 fu4 bei1shang1 de5 biao3qing2。"

msgid ""
"A financial crime ring is involved in insider trading? Shocking.\n"
"\n"
"Now, can we please move on?"
msgstr ""
"一个​金融​犯罪团伙​竟​涉足​内幕​交易​？​太​令人震惊​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​我们​能​继续前进​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 jin1rong2 fan4zui4tuan2huo3 jing4 she4zu2 nei4mu4 jiao1yi4？tai4 ling3 ren2 zhen4 jing1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，wo3men5 neng2 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"A folder found in Executive Stromberg's office, labeled Project Atlas. "
"Inside is a note saying that the information has been converted to digital "
"record."
msgstr ""
"在​施特​龙贝格​的​高管​办公室​里​发现​的​文件夹​，​标注​为​“​阿特拉斯​项目​”​。​内附​一张​便条​，​说明​相关​信息​已​转换​为​数字​记录​。\n"
"zai4 shi1 te4 long2 bei4 ge2 de5 gao1guan3 ban4gong1shi4 li3 fa1xian4 de5 wen2jian4jia1，biao1zhu4 wei2“a1te4la1si1 xiang4mu4”。nei4 fu4 yi1 zhang1 bian4tiao2，shuo1ming2 xiang1guan1 xin4xi1 yi3 zhuan3huan4 wei2 shu4zi4 ji4lu4。"

msgid ""
"A free piece of advice, from me to you: kill me here and now. Do it quick.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He fixes his gaze on you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Because if I ever get off of this floor, you're dead. First I'll do you, then I'll do your bitch friend. And it will be *messy.*"
msgstr ""
"给​你​一条​免费​建议​：​立刻​在​这里​杀​了​我​。​给​个​痛快​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​目光​牢牢​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​等​我​从​地​上爬​起来​的​时候​，​你​就​死定了​。​我会​先​弄死​你​，​然后​是​你​这个​贱人​朋友​。​场面​会​很​*​难看​*​的​。\n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3 yi1 tiao2 mian3fei4 jian4yi4：li4ke4 zai4 zhe4li3 sha1 le5 wo3。gei3 ge4 tong4kuai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mu4guang1 lao2lao2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 deng3 wo3 cong2 de5 shang4 pa2 qi3lai5 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 jiu4 si3 ding4 le5。wo3 hui4 xian1 nong4si3 ni3，ran2hou4 shi4 ni3 zhe4ge5 jian4ren2 peng2you5。chang3mian4 hui4 hen3*nan2kan4*de5。"

msgid ""
"A free piece of advice, from me to you: kill me here and now. Do it quick.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He fixes his gaze on you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Because if I ever get off of this floor, your muscles will not save you. Or your she-troll friend."
msgstr ""
"给​你​一条​免费​建议​：​立刻​在​这里​杀​了​我​。​给​个​痛快​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​目光​牢牢​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​等​我​从​地​上爬​起来​的​时候​，​不管​是​你​的​肌肉​还是​你​这位​女​巨魔​朋友​都​别​想​救​得​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3 yi1 tiao2 mian3fei4 jian4yi4：li4ke4 zai4 zhe4li3 sha1 le5 wo3。gei3 ge4 tong4kuai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mu4guang1 lao2lao2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 deng3 wo3 cong2 de5 shang4 pa2 qi3lai5 de5 shi2hou5，bu4guan3 shi4 ni3 de5 ji1rou4 hai2shi5 ni3 zhe4wei4 nu:3 ju4mo2 peng2you5 dou1 bie4 xiang3 jiu4 de2 le5 ni3。"

msgid "A friend."
msgstr ""
"一个​朋友​说​的​。\n"
"yi1ge5 peng2you5 shuo1 de5。"

msgid ""
"A funny thing, ace... this facility is wired for sound, and there are microphones all over. I can hear a pin drop from anywhere in this building.\n"
"\n"
"I can hear your heartbeat, right at this moment."
msgstr ""
"有趣​的​是​，​王牌​……​这​地方​装​了​全楼​监听系统​，​到处​都​是​麦克风​。​连​一根​针掉​地​的​声音​我​都​能​听​得​一清二楚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此时此刻​，​我​都​能​听到​你​的​心跳​。\n"
"\n"
"you3qu4 de5 shi4，wang2pai2……zhe4 di4fang1 zhuang1 le5 quan2 lou2 jian1 ting1 xi4 tong3，dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 mai4ke4feng1。lian2 yi1 gen1 zhen1 diao4 de5 de5 sheng1yin1 wo3 dou1 neng2 ting1 de2 yi1qing1er4chu3。\n"
"\n"
"ci3shi2ci3ke4，wo3 dou1 neng2 ting1dao4 ni3 de5 xin1tiao4。"

msgid ""
"A gang of parasites. They think that their magical talents make them better than everyone else. Because of that, they feel entitled to take whatever they want.\n"
"\n"
"Up until recently, they've been content with pulling pranks and stealing purses. Childish drek, but they were basically harmless."
msgstr ""
"他们​就是​一帮​寄生虫​，​自​以为​魔法​天赋​异禀​就​高人一等​，​因此​觉得​自己​有权​攫取​任何​想要​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​很长​一段时间​里​，​他们​尚且​仅仅​满足​于​恶作剧​和​偷​钱包​。​这些​幼稚​的​勾当​虽​令人​厌烦​，​但​基本​无害​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jiu4shi4 yi1 bang1 ji4sheng1chong2，zi4 yi3wei2 mo2fa3 tian1fu4 yi4 bing3 jiu4 gao1ren2yi1deng3，yin1ci3 jue2de5 zi4ji3 you3quan2 jue2qu3 ren4he2 xiang3yao4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 hen3 zhang3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3，ta1men5 shang4qie3 jin3jin3 man3zu2 yu2 e4zuo4ju4 he4 tou1 qian2bao1。zhe4xie1 you4zhi4 de5 gou4dang4 sui1 ling4ren2 yan4fan2，dan4 ji1ben3 wu2hai4。"

msgid ""
"A gang, eh? \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The man looks over at his partner, then back at you warily. After a moment, he steps slowly back in front of the entrance.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"帮派​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​那人​看​了​看​他​的​同伴​，​又​警惕​地​回头​看​了​看​你​。​过​了​一会儿​，​他​慢慢​走​回​入口​前​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bang1pai4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 ren2 kan4 le5 kan4 ta1 de5 tong2ban4，you4 jing3ti4 de5 hui2tou2 kan4 le5 kan4 ni3。guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 man4man4 zou3 hui2 ru4kou3 qian2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"A gang, eh? \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The man looks over at his partner, then back at you warily.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"帮派​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​那人​看​了​看​他​的​同伴​，​又​警惕​地​回头​看​了​看​你​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bang1pai4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 ren2 kan4 le5 kan4 ta1 de5 tong2ban4，you4 jing3ti4 de5 hui2tou2 kan4 le5 kan4 ni3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"A ghostly labyrinth of tunnels and dead-end passageways makes up the network of sewers beneath the Kreuzbasar. You climb down the ladder into this shallow underworld and reel at the wave of foul smells that washes over you, clogging your sinuses and saturating your clothing. \n"
"\n"
"As your eyes adjust to the light, you find yourself standing at the edge of a narrow channel of murky gray-green water. The rush of churning water echoes down the tunnel. \n"
"\n"
"You catch a flash of motion in your peripheral vision. Something man-sized, moving fast, flitting across the far end of the tunnel. You strain your eyes to see it, but to no avail. The thing - whatever it is - is gone."
msgstr ""
"鬼影​重重的​隧道​和​死胡同​组成​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​地下​的​下水道​网络​。​你​沿着​梯子​爬进​这片​浅层​地下​世界​，​扑面而来​的​恶臭​浪潮​堵塞​鼻腔​，​浸透​衣衫​，​令​你​头昏目眩​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​待​眼睛​适应​黑暗​，​你​发现自己​正站​在​一条​狭窄​水道​的​边缘​，​浑浊​的​灰绿色​水流​在​通道​中​翻腾​奔涌​，​激荡​的​声响​在​隧道​深处​回荡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​余光中​掠过​一道​闪烁​的​动影​。​某个​人形​大小​的​物体​疾速​穿梭​，​在​隧道​尽头​一闪而过​。​你​竭力​凝视​却​未能​看清​，​无论​那​东西​是​什么​，​都​已​消失​无踪​。\n"
"\n"
"gui3 ying3 chong2 chong2 de5 sui4dao4 he4 si3hu2tong4 zu3cheng2 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 di4xia4 de5 xia4shui3dao4 wang3luo4。ni3 yan2zhe5 ti1zi5 pa2 jin4 zhe4 pian1 jian1 ceng2 di4xia4 shi4jie4，pu1mian4er2lai2 de5 e4chou4 lang4chao2 du3se4 bi2qiang1，jin4tou4 yi1shan1，ling3 ni3 tou2hun1mu4xuan4。\n"
"\n"
"dai1 yan3jing5 shi4ying4 hei1an4，ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 zheng1 zhan4 zai4 yi1 tiao2 xia2zhai3 shui3dao4 de5 bian1yuan2，hun2zhuo2 de5 hui1 lu:4 se4 shui3liu2 zai4 tong1dao4 zhong4 fan1teng2 ben1 yong3，ji1dang4 de5 sheng1xiang3 zai4 sui4dao4 shen1chu4 hui2dang4。\n"
"\n"
"yu2 guang1 zhong4 lu:e4guo4 yi1dao4 shan3shuo4 de5 dong4 ying3。mou3 ge4 ren2xing2 da4xiao3 de5 wu4ti3 ji2su4 chuan1suo1，zai4 sui4dao4 jin4tou2 yi1shan3er2guo4。ni3 jie2li4 ning2shi4 que4 wei4neng2 kan4qing1，wu2lun4 na4 dong1xi1 shi4 shen2me5，dou1 yi3 xiao1shi1 wu2zong1。"

msgid "A girl with red hair. Got it."
msgstr ""
"一个​红​发​女孩​。​明白​了​。\n"
"yi1ge5 hong2 fa1 nu:3hai2。ming2bai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"A glint of light catches something small and delicate hanging from one of the nails in the wood.\n"
"\n"
"Leaning in, you can see the object clearly: a thin ring made of braided silver wires."
msgstr ""
"一缕​光线​掠过​木板​上​的​钉子​，​照亮​了​上面​悬挂​的​一件​小巧​精致​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​凑近​身子​来​仔细观察​这个​物件​：​一枚​由​银线​编织​而成​的​小​戒指​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 lu:3 guang1xian4 lu:e4guo4 mu4ban3 shang4 de5 ding1zi5，zhao4liang4 le5 shang4mian4 xuan2gua4 de5 yi1 jian4 xiao3qiao3 jing1zhi4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cou4jin4 shen1zi5 lai2 zi3 xi4 guan1 cha2 zhe4ge5 wu4jian4：yi1 mei2 you2 yin2 xian4 bian1zhi1 er2 cheng2 de5 xiao3 jie4zhi5。"

msgid ""
"A great beast! A creature of legend!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, thinking.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, technically, he's a basilisk that one of the executives was performing experiments on. Sort of a passion project, you might say."
msgstr ""
"一头​巨兽​！​一只​传说​中​的​生物​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一会儿​，​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​准确​来说​，​他​是​一条​被​某个​高管​用于​实验​的​蛇​怪​。​可以​说​，​这是​某种​“​激情​项目​”​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1tou2 ju4shou4！yi1 zhi3 chuan2shuo1 zhong4 de5 sheng1wu4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1，ta1 shi4 yi1 tiao2 bei4 mou3 ge4 gao1guan3 yong4yu2 shi2yan4 de5 she2 guai4。ke3yi3 shuo1，zhe4 shi4 mou3zhong3“ji1qing2 xiang4mu4”。"

msgid ""
"A green light activates inside the containment cell and the gaunt woman flinches up at it, startled. \n"
"\n"
"Then understanding appears on her face and she begins to speak, her eyes flashing from her dragon body then back to you again and again."
msgstr ""
"绿光​在​收容​舱内​亮​起​，​那名​消瘦​的​女子​猛地​一惊​，​抬头​望​向​光线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​，​她​脸上​露出​理解​的​神色​，​开始​说话​，​目光​不断​在​自己​的​龙形​身体​和​你​之间​来回​扫视​。\n"
"\n"
"lu:4 guang1 zai4 shou1rong2 cang1 nei4 liang4 qi3，na4 ming2 xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3zi3 meng3de5 yi1 jing1，tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 guang1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4，ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 li3jie3 de5 shen2se4，kai1shi3 shuo1hua4，mu4guang1 bu4duan4 zai4 zi4ji3 de5 long2 xing2 shen1ti3 he4 ni3 zhi1jian1 lai2hui2 sao3shi4。"

msgid "A grenade which releases an electric shock in the surrounding area."
msgstr ""
"可以​向​周边​释放​电流​的​手雷​。\n"
"ke3yi3 xiang4 zhou1bian1 shi4fang4 dian4liu2 de5 shou3lei2。"

msgid "A grenade with a larger area of effect. Strips up to 2 Armor."
msgstr ""
"一枚​大​杀伤​半径​手雷​，​剥离​2​点护甲​。\n"
"yi1 mei2 dai4 sha1shang1 ban4jing4 shou3lei2，bo1li2 2 dian3 hu4 jia3。"

msgid ""
"A group of Aztechnology security personnel step through the door. When they see you, they come up short.\n"
"\n"
"The guard in the lead steps toward you, smiling."
msgstr ""
"一队​阿兹特​科技​警卫人员​穿门​而入​。​他们​看见​你​时​停下​了​脚步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​领头​的​警卫​微笑​着​走向​你​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 dui4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 jing3 wei4 ren2 yuan2 chuan1 men2 er2 ru4。ta1men5 kan4jian4 ni3 shi2 ting2xia4 le5 jiao3bu4。\n"
"\n"
"ling3tou2 de5 jing3wei4 wei1xiao4 zhao2 zou3xiang4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"A group of metahumans huddles together, their eyes wide with terror. Many of"
" them have scrapes and bruises, and a few have more serious injuries. Their "
"clothes are tattered and stained."
msgstr ""
"一群​泛​人类​挤​在​一起​，​眼中​满是​恐惧​。​他们​中​的​许多​人​都​有​擦伤​和​瘀​青​，​还​有些​人受​了​更​严重​的​伤​。​他们​的​衣服​破烂不堪​，​沾满​污渍​。\n"
"yi1 qun2 fan4 ren2lei4 ji3 zai4 yi1qi3，yan3zhong1 man3 shi4 kong3ju4。ta1men5 zhong4 de5 xu3duo1 ren2 dou1 you3 ca1shang1 he4 yu1 qing1，hai2 you3xie1 ren2 shou4 le5 geng1 yan2zhong4 de5 shang1。ta1men5 de5 yi1fu5 po4 lan4 bu4 kan1，zhan1man3 wu1zi4。"

msgid ""
"A half-second later, a real-time simulation of Alice appears, seated behind her mahogany desk. Something about it reminds you of a figure from a wax museum; lifelike, but dead inside.\n"
"\n"
"It greets you with a facsimile of Alice's joyless smile."
msgstr ""
"半秒​后​，​爱丽丝​的​实时​拟像​端坐​在​红木​办公桌​后​出现​。​它​让​你​莫名​联想​到​蜡像馆​中​的​雕像​—​—​栩栩如生​，​却​又​死气沉沉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​以​爱丽丝​那​经典​的​似笑非笑​的​表情​向​你​致意​。\n"
"\n"
"ban4 miao3 hou4，ai4li4si1 de5 shi2shi2 ni3 xiang4 duan1zuo4 zai4 hong2mu4 ban4 gong1 zhuo1 hou4 chu1xian4。ta1 rang4 ni3 mo4ming2 lian2xiang3 dao4 la4xiang4guan3 zhong4 de5 diao1xiang4——xu3xu3ru2sheng1，que4 you4 si3qi4chen2chen2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi3 ai4li4si1 na4 jing1dian3 de5 si4xiao4fei1xiao4 de5 biao3qing2 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4。"

msgid "A handmade ring of braided silver wire."
msgstr ""
"一枚​手工​编织​的​银丝​戒指​。\n"
"yi1 mei2 shou3gong1 bian1zhi1 de5 yin2 si1 jie4zhi5。"

msgid ""
"A headless abomination just pissed lighter fluid onto the floor and tried to"
" burn us to death. I think that \"things can come through\" is underselling "
"it a bit."
msgstr ""
"一个​无头​怪物​刚​把​打火机​油泼​到​地板​上​，​企图​活活​烧死​我们​。​我​觉得​用​“​物质​可以​相互​穿透​”​来​形容​这​一切​有点​太​轻描淡写​了​。\n"
"yi1ge5 wu2 tou2 guai4wu5 gang1 ba3 da3huo3ji1 you2 po1 dao4 di4ban3 shang4，qi3tu2 huo2huo2 shao1si3 wo3men5。wo3 jue2de5 yong4“wu4zhi4 ke3yi3 xiang1hu4 chuan1tou4” lai2 xing2rong2 zhe4 yi1qie4 you3dian3 tai4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 le5。"

msgid "A heavy axe made for cutting up your enemies."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​一把​沉重​的​斧头​，​用于​把​你​的​敌人​大卸八块​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：yi1 ba3 chen2zhong4 de5 fu3tou2，yong4yu2 ba3 ni3 de5 di2ren2 dai4 xie4 ba1 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"A heavy coat with protective lining. Good protection without restrictive "
"armored plates. Grants +1 Ranged Combat and +5 HP."
msgstr ""
"一件​带有​防护​衬里​的​厚重​外套​。​提供​良好​的​防护​，​且​没有​限制​活动​的​装甲​板​。​提供​+​1​远程​战斗​和​+​5​生命​值​。\n"
"yi1 jian4 dai4you3 fang2hu4 chen4li3 de5 hou4zhong4 wai4tao4。ti2gong1 liang2hao3 de5 fang2hu4，qie3 mei2you3 xian4zhi4 huo2dong4 de5 zhuang1jia3 ban3。ti2gong1 +1 yuan3cheng2 zhan4dou4 he4 +5 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"A hell of a lot better than nothing. If used in the right situation, one of the things could turn the tide of an otherwise unwinnable firefight.\n"
"\n"
"That's nothing to scoff at, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"那​可​要强​太多​了​。​如果​用​对​了​地方​，​这招​足以​将​极度​不利​的​战场​局势​逆转​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可​别​小瞧​了​它​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ke3 yao4qiang2 tai4 duo1 le5。ru2guo3 yong4 dui4 le5 di4fang1，zhe4 zhao1 zu2yi3 jiang1 ji2du4 bu4li4 de5 zhan4chang3 ju2shi4 ni4zhuan3。\n"
"\n"
"ke3 bie4 xiao3qiao2 le5 ta1，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"A high-pitched, wailing shriek explodes out of the intercom.\n"
"\n"
"There is a burst of static, and the machine goes silent."
msgstr ""
"一阵​尖锐​的​哀嚎​声​从​对讲机​里​炸裂​而出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​紧接着​是​一阵​噪音​，​然后​机器​安静下来​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhen4 jian1rui4 de5 ai1hao2 sheng1 cong2 dui4jiang3ji1 li3 zha4lie4 er2 chu1。\n"
"\n"
"jin3jie1zhe5 shi4 yi1zhen4 zao4yin1，ran2hou4 ji1qi4 an1 jing4 xia4 lai2。"

msgid "A homemade simsense chip, pressed out of generic-brand components."
msgstr ""
"一枚​自制​的​拟感​芯片​，​由​通用​品牌​组件​压制​而成​。\n"
"yi1 mei2 zi4zhi4 de5 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4，you2 tong1yong4 pin3pai2 zu3jian4 ya1zhi4 er2 cheng2。"

msgid ""
"A huge ork in ragged combat fatigues steps forward to meet you. He walks with the swollen bravado of a man who's used to getting what he wants.\n"
"\n"
"One of his meaty arms jerks up, hand held upright in the universal sign for \"stop.\" The other clutches a bulky assault rifle."
msgstr ""
"一个​身穿​破旧​作战服​、​体型​壮硕​的​兽​人​径直​向​你​走来​。​他​迈着​自信​又​夸张​的​步伐​，​显然​平日​里​习惯​了​予取予求​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​粗壮​的​手臂​猛地​上扬​，​手掌​竖起​—​—​这是​国际​通用​的​“​停下​”​手势​。​另一只​手​则​紧握着​一把​笨重​的​突击​步枪​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 shen1chuan1 po4jiu4 zuo4 zhan4 fu2、ti3xing2 zhuang4shuo4 de5 shou4 ren2 jing4zhi2 xiang4 ni3 zou3 lai2。ta1 mai4 zhao2 zi4xin4 you4 kua1zhang1 de5 bu4fa2，xian3ran2 ping2ri4 li3 xi2guan4 le5 yu3 qu3 yu3 qiu2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 cu1zhuang4 de5 shou3bi4 meng3de5 shang4yang2，shou3zhang3 shu4qi3——zhe4 shi4 guo2ji4 tong1yong4 de5“ting2xia4” shou3shi4。ling4 yi1 zhi3 shou3 ze2 jin3 wo4 zhao2 yi1 ba3 ben4zhong4 de5 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1。"

msgid ""
"A human and a dwarf, both in their early twenties, stand huddled in the courtyard.\n"
"\n"
"They don't seem to notice your approach."
msgstr ""
"一名​人类​和​一名​矮人​，​都​二十出头​，​正​蜷缩​在​庭院​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​似乎​没有​注意​到​你​走近​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 ming2 ren2lei4 he4 yi1 ming2 ai3ren2，dou1 er4 shi2 chu1 tou2，zheng1 quan2suo1 zai4 ting2yuan4 li3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 si4hu1 mei2you3 zhu4yi4 dao4 ni3 zou3jin4。"

msgid ""
"A human and an elf. They're inside already, like I said.\n"
"\n"
"I watched them storm through the front doors of the building we're going to hit about ten minutes ago."
msgstr ""
"一个​人类​，​一个​精灵​。​如​我​所说​，​他们​都​已经​进去​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大概​十分钟​前​。​我​看着​他们​冲进​了​目标​大楼​的​前门​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 ren2lei4，yi1ge5 jing1ling2。ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，ta1men5 dou1 yi3jing1 jin4qu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 shi2 fen4 zhong1 qian2。wo3 kan4 zhao2 ta1men5 chong1jin4 le5 mu4biao1 da4lou2 de5 qian2men2。"

msgid ""
"A human and an elf. They, uh... they sort of jumped the gun a little.\n"
"\n"
"They're already inside."
msgstr ""
"一个​人类​，​一个​精灵​。​他们​……​有点​操之过急​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​已经​在​里面​了​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 ren2lei4，yi1ge5 jing1ling2。ta1men5……you3dian3 cao1zhi1guo4ji2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yi3jing1 zai4 li3mian4 le5。"

msgid "A human, to be specific. (w)"
msgstr ""
"准确​来说​，​那人​是​个​人类​。\n"
"zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1，na4 ren2 shi4 ge4 ren2lei4。"

msgid "A hundred would do fine."
msgstr ""
"十万​就够​了​。\n"
"shi2wan4 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid "A jump from this height would kill even the strongest of trolls."
msgstr ""
"从​这个​高度​跳​下​的话​，​即使​是​最​强壮​的​巨魔​也​会​丧命​。\n"
"cong2 zhe4ge5 gao1du4 tiao4 xia4 de5hua4，ji2shi3 shi4 zui4 qiang2zhuang4 de5 ju4mo2 ye3 hui4 sang4ming4。"

msgid ""
"A large file containing all data related to Project Bloodline, from "
"proccesses used to detailed personnel files."
msgstr ""
"一份​大型​文件​，​包含​与​“​血脉​”​项目​相关​的​所有​数据​，​从​项目​流程​到​详细​的​人员​档案​。\n"
"yi1 fen4 da4xing2 wen2jian4，bao1han2 yu4“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 xiang1guan1 de5 suo3you3 shu4ju4，cong2 xiang4mu4 liu2cheng2 dao4 xiang2xi4 de5 ren2yuan2 dang4an4。"

msgid "A ledger written in a Scandinavian language."
msgstr ""
"一本​用​斯堪的纳维亚​语​写成​的​账簿​。\n"
"yi1 ben3 yong4 si1kan1di4na4wei2ya4 yu3 xie3 cheng2 de5 zhang4bu4。"

msgid "A line of fire controlled by the caster and directed at one target."
msgstr ""
"由​施法​者​引导​，​针对​单一​目标​的​火焰​射线​。\n"
"you2 shi1fa3 zhe3 yin3dao3，zhen1dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 de5 huo3yan4 she4xian4。"

msgid ""
"A list of DNA donors, along with the times and methods of sample "
"acquisition. It appears that the majority of the samples were obtained "
"without the donors' knowledge. This information could be worth a lot... both"
" to the people named on the list, and to the Azzies themselves."
msgstr ""
"一份​DNA​捐赠者​名单​，​附有​样本​采集​的​时间​和​方式​。​看来​多数​样本​是​在​捐赠者​不知情​的​情况​下​获取​的​。​这些​信息​可能​价值连城​—​—​对​名单​上​的​人​和​阿兹佬​本身​均​是​如此​。\n"
"yi1 fen4 DNA juan1zeng4zhe3 ming2dan1，fu4 you3 yang4ben3 cai3ji2 de5 shi2jian1 he4 fang1shi4。kan4lai5 duo1shu4 yang4ben3 shi4 zai4 juan1zeng4zhe3 bu4 zhi1 qing2 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 huo4qu3 de5。zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 ke3neng2 jia4zhi2lian2cheng2——dui4 ming2dan1 shang4 de5 ren2 he4 e1 zi1 lao3 ben3shen1 jun1 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "A list of Humanis safe houses, worth some nuyen in the right hands."
msgstr ""
"一份​人类​至上​主义者​安全​屋​的​名单​，​卖​给​合适​的​人​能​赚​不少​新円​。\n"
"yi1 fen4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 an1quan2 wu1 de5 ming2dan1，mai4 gei3 he2shi4 de5 ren2 neng2 zhuan4 bu4shao3 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"A list of local authorities Harrow paid off. No doubt these payments were "
"given to have them look the other way during his various \"activities\"."
msgstr ""
"一份​记录​了​地方​政府​中​收受​过​哈罗​贿赂​者​的​名单​。​毫无疑问​，​这些​贿赂​是​为了​让​他们​在​他​进行​各种​“​活动​”​时​睁一只眼​闭一只眼​。\n"
"yi1 fen4 ji4lu4 le5 di4fang1 zheng4fu3 zhong4 shou1shou4 guo4 ha1luo2 hui4lu4 zhe3 de5 ming2dan1。hao2wu2yi2wen4，zhe4xie1 hui4lu4 shi4 wei4le5 rang4 ta1men5 zai4 ta1 jin4xing2 ge4zhong3“huo2dong4” shi2 zheng1 yi1 zhi3 yan3 bi4 yi1 zhi3 yan3。"

msgid ""
"A list of the newest batch of Humanis recruits scrolls onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​滚动​显示​着​最新​一批​人类​至上​俱乐部​成员名单​。\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 gun3dong4 xian3shi4 zhao2 zui4xin1 yi1 pi1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 cheng2 yuan2 ming2 dan1。"

msgid "A little more than that... some details would be nice."
msgstr ""
"不止​这些​……​能​说​说​细节​就​好​了​。\n"
"bu4zhi3 zhe4xie1……neng2 shuo1 shuo1 xi4jie2 jiu4 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"A little slice of heaven, isn't it? What can I tell you about our kiez?"
msgstr ""
"这里​简直​像​世外桃源​，​你​说​呢​？​你​对​我们​的​街区​有​哪里​好奇​吗​？\n"
"zhe4li3 jian3zhi2 xiang4 shi4wai4tao2yuan2，ni3 shuo1 ni2？ni3 dui4 wo3men5 de5 jie1qu1 you3 na3li3 hao4qi2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"A lone figure stands in the U-Bahn station. Dietrich.\n"
"\n"
"He raises a bottle at your approach, then tosses it away."
msgstr ""
"一个​孤独​的​身影​伫立​在​地铁站​里​。​是​迪​特里​希​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​走近​时​，​他​举起​手里​的​酒瓶​，​随即​扔​了​出去​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 gu1du2 de5 shen1ying3 zhu4li4 zai4 di4tie3zhan4 li3。shi4 Di2te4li3xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，ta1 ju3qi3 shou3li3 de5 jiu3 ping2，sui2ji2 reng1 le5 chu1qu4。"

msgid ""
"A long list of Humanis Berlin secret donors. The names come from every "
"social strata and corner of Berlin."
msgstr ""
"一份​关于​柏林​人类​至上​主义者​背后​秘密​捐赠者​的​长​名单​。​这些​名字​来自​柏林​的​各个​社会阶层​和​地区​。\n"
"yi1 fen4 guan1yu2 bo2lin2 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 bei4hou4 mi4mi4 juan1zeng4zhe3 de5 zhang3 ming2dan1。zhe4xie1 ming2zi5 lai2zi4 bo2lin2 de5 ge4ge4 she4hui4jie1ceng2 he4 di4qu1。"

msgid ""
"A long list of unpleasant things, starting with killing the guy who inked me. The whole thing ended in a pretty dark place.\n"
"\n"
"The upshot of all of this is that I can't go back to Japan. Ever. But at least I got my autonomy back."
msgstr ""
"一大堆​不算​愉快​的​事情​。​故事​的​开头​是​杀​了​给​我​纹身​的​人​，​而​结尾​相当​黑暗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这件​事​的​结果​就是​，​我​再也不能​回​日本​了​。​永远​不能​。​但​至少​我​恢复​了​自主性​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 dai4 dui1 bu4suan4 yu2kuai4 de5 shi4qing5。gu4shi4 de5 kai1tou2 shi4 sha1 le5 gei3 wo3 wen2shen1 de5 ren2，er2 jie2wei3 xiang1dang1 hei1an4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4 de5 jie1guo3 jiu4shi4，wo3 zai4 ye3 bu4 neng2 hui2 ri4ben3 le5。yong3yuan3 bu4neng2。dan4 zhi4shao3 wo3 hui1fu4 le5 zi4 zhu3 xing4。"

msgid ""
"A look of confusion crosses the janitor's face as her eyes flit from you, to your teammate, to the side door that you just opened.\n"
"\n"
"You are suddenly aware of how very out of place you look in this building, and the furrow in the janitor's brow tells you that she's made the same observation."
msgstr ""
"清洁工​的​目光​从​你​身上​移向​你​的​队友​，​又​移​向​你​刚刚​打开​的​侧门​。​她​脸上​露出​困惑​的​神情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​突然​意识​到​自己​在​这栋​楼​里​显得​多么​格格不入​，​而​清洁工​紧皱​的​眉头​告诉​你​，​她​也​有​同样​的​想法​。\n"
"\n"
"qing1jie2gong1 de5 mu4guang1 cong2 ni3 shen1shang5 yi2 xiang4 ni3 de5 dui4you3，you4 yi2 xiang4 ni3 gang1gang5 da3kai1 de5 ce4men2。ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 kun4huo4 de5 shen2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 zhe4 dong4 lou2 li3 xian3de5 duo1me5 ge2ge2bu4ru4，er2 qing1jie2gong1 jin3 zhou4 de5 mei2tou2 gao4su4 ni3，ta1 ye3 you3 tong2yang4 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid ""
"A look of confusion crosses the janitor's face as her eyes flit from you, to your teammates, to the door that you just let them in through. \n"
"\n"
"You are suddenly aware of how very out of place you look in this building, and the furrow in the janitor's brow tells you that she's made the same observation."
msgstr ""
"清洁工​的​目光​从​你​身上​移向​你​的​队友​，​又​移​向​你​刚刚​让​他们​进来​的​那​扇门​。​她​脸上​露出​困惑​的​神情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​突然​意识​到​自己​在​这栋​楼​里​显得​多么​格格不入​，​而​清洁工​紧皱​的​眉头​告诉​你​，​她​也​有​同样​的​想法​。\n"
"\n"
"qing1jie2gong1 de5 mu4guang1 cong2 ni3 shen1shang5 yi2 xiang4 ni3 de5 dui4you3，you4 yi2 xiang4 ni3 gang1gang5 rang4 ta1men5 jin4lai2 de5 na4 shan1 men2。ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 kun4huo4 de5 shen2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 zhe4 dong4 lou2 li3 xian3de5 duo1me5 ge2ge2bu4ru4，er2 qing1jie2gong1 jin3 zhou4 de5 mei2tou2 gao4su4 ni3，ta1 ye3 you3 tong2yang4 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid ""
"A look of confusion crosses the janitor's face as her eyes sweep over you.\n"
"\n"
"You are suddenly aware of how very out of place you look in this building, and the furrow in the janitor's brow tells you that she's made the same observation."
msgstr ""
"清洁工​的​目光​不断​打量​着​你​，​脸上​露出​困惑​的​神情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​突然​意识​到​自己​在​这栋​楼​里​显得​多么​格格不入​，​而​清洁工​紧皱​的​眉头​告诉​你​，​她​也​有​同样​的​想法​。\n"
"\n"
"qing1jie2gong1 de5 mu4guang1 bu4duan4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 kun4huo4 de5 shen2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 zhe4 dong4 lou2 li3 xian3de5 duo1me5 ge2ge2bu4ru4，er2 qing1jie2gong1 jin3 zhou4 de5 mei2tou2 gao4su4 ni3，ta1 ye3 you3 tong2yang4 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid ""
"A look of resignation washes over Monika's face, and she stops fighting.\n"
"\n"
"Her gore-slick jaw goes slack, and she dies."
msgstr ""
"刹那间​，​莫妮卡​的​神色​变得​释然​。​她​不再​挣扎​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​沾满​血污​的​下颌​垮​了​下来​。​然后​，​她​死去​了​。\n"
"\n"
"cha4 na4 jian1，Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shen2se4 bian4de5 shi4ran2。ta1 bu4zai4 zheng1zha2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhan1man3 xue4wu1 de5 xia4he2 kua3 le5 xia4lai5。ran2hou4，ta1 si3qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"A look of terror washes over the woman's face, and she clutches her chest "
"with her right hand."
msgstr ""
"恐惧​之色​瞬间​笼罩​在​女人​的​脸上​，​她​用​右手​捂住​胸口​。\n"
"kong3ju4 zhi1 se4 shun4jian1 long3zhao4 zai4 nu:3ren2 de5 lian3 shang4，ta1 yong4 you4shou3 wu3zhu4 xiong1kou3。"

msgid "A lot can happen in ten minutes."
msgstr ""
"十分钟​能​发生​不少​事​了​。\n"
"shi2 fen4 zhong1 neng2 fa1sheng1 bu4shao3 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"A lot of the kids that followed me had grown up listenin' to my music. They "
"had all of my attitude, $(l.name)... but none of 'em had my magic. And "
"youthful enthusiasm is no defense against a knife or a handgun."
msgstr ""
"许多​追随​我​的​孩子​都​是​听​着​我​的​歌​长大​的​。​他们​与​我​有着​一致​的​立场​，​$(l.name)​……​但​他们​可​没人​像​我​一样​会​魔法​。​年轻人​的​热情​并​不能​抵御​刀刃​与​枪弹​。\n"
"xu3duo1 zhui1sui2 wo3 de5 hai2zi5 dou1 shi4 ting1 zhao2 wo3 de5 ge1 zhang3da4 de5。ta1men5 yu4 wo3 you3zhe5 yi1zhi4 de5 li4chang3，$(l.name)……dan4 ta1men5 ke3 mei2 ren2 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4 hui4 mo2fa3。nian2qing1ren2 de5 re4qing2 bing4 bu4neng2 di3yu4 dao1ren4 yu4 qiang1dan4。"

msgid "A low grade pistol carried mostly by guards."
msgstr ""
"一种​低端​手枪​，​保安​的​好​朋友​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 di1duan1 shou3qiang1，bao3an1 de5 hao3 peng2you5。"

msgid "A magical explosion that ignores normal armor and targets Willpower."
msgstr ""
"一次​无视​普通​护甲​、​针对​意志​的​魔法​爆炸​。\n"
"yi1ci4 wu2shi4 pu3tong1 hu4jia3、zhen1dui4 yi4zhi4 de5 mo2fa3 bao4zha4。"

msgid "A magical explosion that pierces up to 2 Armor."
msgstr ""
"一次​魔法​爆炸​，​最​多​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"yi1ci4 mo2fa3 bao4zha4，zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid ""
"A magical explosion that pierces up to 2 Armor. Does ongoing 10 HP DMG for 1"
" RND. Ongoing DMG ignores armor."
msgstr ""
"一次​魔法​爆炸​，​最​多​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。​造成​持续​1​回合​的​10​点​生命​值​伤害​。​该​持续​伤害​无视​护甲​。\n"
"yi1ci4 mo2fa3 bao4zha4，zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 1 hui2he2 de5 10 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。gai1 chi2xu4 shang1hai4 wu2shi4 hu4jia3。"

msgid ""
"A magical explosion that pierces up to 3 Armor. Does ongoing 10 HP DMG for 2"
" RNDS. Ongoing DMG ignores armor."
msgstr ""
"一次​魔法​爆炸​，​最​多​提供​3​点护甲​穿透​。​造成​持续​2​回合​的​10​点​生命​值​伤害​。​该​持续​伤害​无视​护甲​。\n"
"yi1ci4 mo2fa3 bao4zha4，zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 3 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 10 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。gai1 chi2xu4 shang1hai4 wu2shi4 hu4jia3。"

msgid ""
"A maglock with a voiceprint recognition system has been affixed to this "
"door. According to Amsel, Frau Müller has already logged your voiceprint "
"into the system, but there's only one way to be sure."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​安装​了​配备​声纹识别​系统​的​磁力锁​。​按​阿姆​泽尔​的​说法​，​穆勒​女士​已​将​你​的​声纹​录入​了​系统​，​但​只有​一个​方法​能​加以​验证​。\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 an1zhuang1 le5 pei4bei4 sheng1 wen2 shi2 bie4 xi4tong3 de5 ci2li4suo3。an4 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 shuo1fa3，mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 yi3 jiang1 ni3 de5 sheng1 wen2 lu4ru4 le5 xi4tong3，dan4 zhi3you3 yi1ge5 fang1fa3 neng2 jia1yi3 yan4zheng4。"

msgid ""
"A maglock with a voiceprint recognition system has been affixed to this "
"door. Nobody who hasn't already been logged into the system is going to be "
"able to open this thing."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​安装​了​配备​声纹识别​系统​的​磁力锁​。​未​在​系统​中​登记​的​人员​无法​开启​此门​。\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 an1zhuang1 le5 pei4bei4 sheng1 wen2 shi2 bie4 xi4tong3 de5 ci2li4suo3。wei4 zai4 xi4tong3 zhong4 deng1ji4 de5 ren2yuan2 wu2fa3 kai1qi3 ci3 men2。"

msgid ""
"A man can gather power, wield it for his lifetime - but nothing more. His "
"work will fade… lost to the inevitable entropy that decays all. "
msgstr ""
"一个​人​可以​积累​权力​，​并​在​有生之年​运用​它​—​—​但​仅此而已​。​他​的​成果​会​逐渐​消逝​……​最终​被​不可避免​的​熵​所​吞噬​。\n"
"yi1ge5 ren2 ke3yi3 ji1lei3 quan2li4，bing4 zai4 you3sheng1zhi1nian2 yun4yong4 ta1——dan4 jin3ci3er2yi3。ta1 de5 cheng2guo3 hui4 zhu2jian4 xiao1shi4……zui4zhong1 bei4 bu4ke3bi4mian3 de5 shang1 suo3 tun1shi4。"

msgid ""
"A man kneels on the ground. His torso is sheeted with blood.\n"
"\n"
"Standing all around him are smiling teenagers in gray hoodies, all full of nervous energy and excitement. Each of them clutches a kitchen knife."
msgstr ""
"一个​男人​跪​在​地上​。​他​的​身上​浸满​了​鲜血​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​周围​站​着​一群​身穿​灰色​帽衫​的​少年​，​个个​面带微笑​，​浑身​散发​着​紧张​又​兴奋​的​气息​。​他们​每人​手里​都​攥​着​一把​厨刀​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 nan2ren2 gui4 zai4 di4shang5。ta1 de5 shen1shang5 jin4 man3 le5 xian1xue4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhou1wei2 zhan4 zhao2 yi1 qun2 shen1chuan1 hui1se4 mao4 shan1 de5 shao4nian2，ge4ge4 mian4 dai4 wei1 xiao4，hun2shen1 san4fa1 zhao2 jin3zhang1 you4 xing1fen4 de5 qi4xi1。ta1men5 mei3ren2 shou3li3 dou1 zuan4 zhao2 yi1 ba3 chu2 dao1。"

msgid "A manual found on the body of a worker in the sewers."
msgstr ""
"在​下水道​里​一具​工人​的​尸体​上​发现​的​手册​。\n"
"zai4 xia4shui3dao4 li3 yi1 ju4 gong1ren2 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 fa1xian4 de5 shou3ce4。"

msgid ""
"A medkit on wheels. It's a runner's best friend in the heat of a firefight."
msgstr ""
"一个​装在​轮子​上​的​急救包​。​在​激烈​的​交火​中​，​它​是​狂奔​者​最好​的​朋友​。\n"
"yi1ge5 zhuang1 zai4 lun2zi5 shang4 de5 ji2jiu4bao1。zai4 ji1lie4 de5 jiao1huo3 zhong4，ta1 shi4 kuang2Ben1zhe3 zui4hao3 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"A melted glob of plastic that you found in the chipjack of a dead ganger."
msgstr ""
"一块​熔化​的​塑料​，​在​死去​的​帮派​成员​的​芯片​插口​中​发现​。\n"
"yi1kuai4 rong2hua4 de5 su4liao4，zai4 si3qu4 de5 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3 zhong4 fa1xian4。"

msgid "A member of my old crew betrayed me."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​的​团队​中​有人​背叛​了​我​。\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 de5 tuan2dui4 zhong4 you3ren2 bei4pan4 le5 wo3。"

msgid "A member of my old team betrayed me."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​的​团队​中​有人​背叛​了​我​。\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 de5 tuan2dui4 zhong4 you3ren2 bei4pan4 le5 wo3。"

msgid "A message flashes onto this status panel at your approach."
msgstr ""
"你​接近​时​，​状态​面板​上​闪烁着​一条​消息​。\n"
"ni3 jie1jin4 shi2，zhuang4tai4 mian4ban3 shang4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 yi1 tiao2 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"A mid-level corporate compound, complete with living spaces on the upper "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"一座​中型企业​园区​，​高层​设有​员工​居住区​。\n"
"yi1 zuo4 zhong4 xing2 qi3 ye4 yuan2qu1，gao1ceng2 she4you3 yuan2gong1 ju1 zhu4 qu1。"

msgid ""
"A middle-aged woman with chocolate-colored skin and shoulder-length "
"dreadlocks looks up from her PDA with a start. She's decked out in formfit "
"body armor, and in a flash, her assault rifle goes from slung to held at the"
" ready."
msgstr ""
"一位​肤色​如​巧克力​般​深邃​、​梳着​齐肩​脏​辫​的​中年​女子​猛地​从​PDA​前​抬起​头​。​她​穿着​合身​的​防弹衣​，​转瞬间​便​将​斜​挎​的​突击​步枪​举至​戒备​姿态​。\n"
"yi1 wei4 fu1se4 ru2 qiao3ke4li4 ban1 shen1sui4、shu1 zhao2 qi2jian1 zang4 bian4 de5 zhong1nian2 nu:3zi3 meng3de5 cong2 PDA qian2 tai2qi3 tou2。ta1 chuan1zhuo2 he2shen1 de5 fang2dan4yi1，zhuai3 shun4 jian1 bian4 jiang1 xie2 kua4 de5 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1 ju3 zhi4 jie4bei4 zi1tai4。"

msgid ""
"A moment later, a second message pops into your inbox: your payment details."
msgstr ""
"不​出​片刻​，​收件箱​中​又​弹出​第二条​消息​：​付款​详情​。\n"
"bu4 chu1 pian4ke4，shou1jian4xiang1 zhong4 you4 tan2chu1 di4 er4 tiao2 xiao1xi5：fu4kuan3 xiang2qing2。"

msgid ""
"A most prominent figure in Berlin's shadow community. Ex-Schockwellenreiter. She provides information retrieval services for the F-State.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel turns to the computer console behind him and runs his fingers over a virtual keyboard. The machine begins to hum.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If Winters was right... if Vauclair is still alive... she can help us find him."
msgstr ""
"柏林​的​暗影​圈子里​最​有头有脸​的​人物​之一​，​前​电波​骑士​成员​。​她​为​整个​动荡​带​的​人​提供​情报搜集​服务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​转向​身后​的​控制台​，​手指​在​虚拟​键盘​上​飞快​舞动着​。​机器​开始​嗡鸣​作响​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​温特斯​是​对​的​……​如果​沃​克莱尔​还​活着​……​那么​她​就​能​帮​我们​找到​他​。\n"
"\n"
"bo2lin2 de5 an4ying3 juan1 zi3 li3 zui4 you3tou2you3lian3 de5 ren2wu4 zhi1yi1，qian2 dian4Bo1qi2shi4 cheng2yuan2。ta1 wei2 zheng3ge4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 ren2 ti2gong1 qing2 bao4 sou1 ji2 fu2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 zhuan3xiang4 shen1hou4 de5 kong4zhi4tai2，shou3zhi3 zai4 xu1ni3 jian4pan2 shang4 fei1kuai4 wu3 dong4 zhao2。ji1qi4 kai1shi3 weng1 ming2 zuo4 xiang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 Wen1te4si1 shi4 dui4 de5……ru2guo3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 hai2 huo2zhe5……na4me5 ta1 jiu4 neng2 bang1 wo3men5 zhao3dao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"A nondescript box of matte black plastic. Herr Schmidt says that you can use"
" this to disrupt building security on the MKVI run."
msgstr ""
"一个​不起眼​的​哑光​黑色​塑料盒​。​施密特​先生​说​，​你​可以​用​这个​在​MKVI​差事​中​干扰​建筑物​的​安保​系统​。\n"
"yi1ge5 bu4qi3yan3 de5 ya3guang1 hei1se4 su4 liao4 he2。shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 shuo1，ni3 ke3yi3 yong4 zhe4ge5 zai4 MKVI cha4shi4 zhong4 gan1rao3 jian4zhu4wu4 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3。"

msgid ""
"A normal person, with a boyfriend and a cat and a shitty apartment.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not a career criminal, is what I'm saying. I'm just an electrician."
msgstr ""
"我​就是​个​普通人​，​有​男朋友​，​有​一只​猫​，​还有​一间​邋遢​公寓​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​说​的​是​，​我​不是​职业​罪犯​。​我​只是​个​电工​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 ge4 pu3tong1ren2，you3 nan2peng2you5，you3 yi1 zhi3 mao2，hai2you3 yi1 jian1 la1ta5 gong1yu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 shi4，wo3 bu4shi4 zhi2ye4 zui4fan4。wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 dian4gong1。"

msgid "A old Corporate hoverdrone that has been given a weapon upgrade."
msgstr ""
"一款​进行​过​武器​更新​的​老式​企业​旋翼​无人机​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 jin4xing2 guo4 wu3qi4 geng1xin1 de5 lao3shi4 qi3ye4 xuan2yi4 wu2ren2ji1。"

msgid "A old Lone Star hoverdrone that has been given a weapon upgrade."
msgstr ""
"一款​进行​过​武器​更新​的​老式​孤星​旋翼​无人机​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 jin4xing2 guo4 wu3qi4 geng1xin1 de5 lao3shi4 gu1 xing1 xuan2yi4 wu2ren2ji1。"

msgid ""
"A pair of round eyes peer up at you from under the hood of a grime-smeared winter coat. \n"
"\n"
"You recognize him as David, one of the Kreuzbasar's street kids. If you had to guess, you'd place him in his mid teens, though it's difficult to tell beneath the grime and acne marring his face. You've seen him following Monika around between runs, chasing her heels like a lost puppy. \n"
"\n"
"She always seemed to have a soft spot for the kid."
msgstr ""
"一双​圆溜溜​的​眼睛​从​污垢​斑驳​的​冬衣​兜帽​下探​出来​盯​着​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​认出​他​是​大卫​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​街头​的​孩子​之一​。​如果​要​猜​的话​，​你​觉得​他​大概​在​十几岁​左右​，​但​满脸​的​污垢​和​青春痘​让​他​的​实际​年龄​难以辨认​。​你常​看见​他​在​莫妮卡​跑腿​时​尾随​其后​，​像​只​迷途​小狗​般​紧追不舍​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​似乎​总是​对​这​孩子​格外​温柔​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 shuang1 yuan2 liu1 liu1 de5 yan3jing5 cong2 wu1gou4 ban1bo2 de5 dong1yi1 dou1mao4 xia4 tan4 chu1lai2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ren4chu1 ta1 shi4 da4wei4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jie1tou2 de5 hai2zi5 zhi1yi1。ru2guo3 yao4 cai1 de5hua4，ni3 jue2de5 ta1 da4gai4 zai4 shi2 ji1 sui4 zuo3you4，dan4 man3lian3 de5 wu1gou4 he4 qing1chun1dou4 rang4 ta1 de5 shi2ji4 nian2ling2 nan2 yi3 bian4 ren4。ni3 chang2 kan4jian4 ta1 zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 pao3tui3 shi2 wei3sui2 qi2hou4，xiang4 zhi3 mi2tu2 xiao3gou3 ban1 jin3 dui1 bu4 she3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 si4hu1 zong3shi4 dui4 zhe4 hai2zi5 ge2wai4 wen1rou2。"

msgid ""
"A pair of squatters on the second floor ripped the guts out of one of my terminals. They have taken the datajack signal converter, and the terminal will be out of commission until I get it back.\n"
"\n"
"A single damaged terminal may not sound like much, but trust me: the entire experience of Communion has been diminished by this act of vandalism."
msgstr ""
"二楼​有​几个​街友​拆掉​了​我​这里​一台​终端​的​核心部件​。​他们​拿走​了​数据​插口​信号​转换器​，​我​需要​你​把​它​拿​回来​，​否则​这台​终端​将​无法​运行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一台​损坏​的​终端​听​起来​或许​不算什么​，​但​相信​我​：​这样​的​破坏​行为​已经​削弱​了​共融​的​整体​氛围​。\n"
"\n"
"er4 lou2 you3 ji3ge5 jie1 you3 chai1 diao4 le5 wo3 zhe4li3 yi1 tai2 zhong1duan1 de5 he2 xin1 bu4 jian4。ta1men5 na2zou3 le5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 xin4hao4 zhuan3huan4qi4，wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 ba3 ta1 na2 hui2lai5，fou3ze2 zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 jiang1 wu2fa3 yun4xing2。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 tai2 sun3huai4 de5 zhong1duan1 ting1 qi3lai5 huo4xu3 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2，dan4 xiang1xin4 wo3：zhe4yang4 de5 po4huai4 xing2wei2 yi3jing1 xue1ruo4 le5 gong4 rong2 de5 zheng3ti3 fen1wei2。"

msgid "A parent should never bury a child."
msgstr ""
"绝不​该​让​父母​埋葬​自己​的​子女​。\n"
"jue2bu4 gai1 rang4 fu4mu3 mai2zang4 zi4ji3 de5 zi3nu:3。"

msgid "A person with a functioning sense of right and wrong?"
msgstr ""
"凭​我​是​个​具备​正常​是非​观念​的​人​？\n"
"ping2 wo3 shi4 ge4 ju4bei4 zheng4chang2 shi4fei1 guan1nian4 de5 ren2？"

msgid ""
"A pet AI would explain how Feuerschwinge has managed to maintain her conspiracy and avoid detection for the past decade.\n"
"\n"
"Any time anyone gets close, the AI takes them out and scrubs the record clean."
msgstr ""
"如果说​火翼养​了​个​宠物​AI​的话​，​就​能​解释​她​是​如何​在​过去​十年​里​酝酿​阴谋​并​逃过​侦察​的​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​每当​有人​接近​真相​，​AI​就​会​将​其​灭口​，​并​抹除​所有​记录​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3shuo1 Huo3yi4 yang3 le5 ge4 chong3wu4 AI de5hua4，jiu4 neng2 jie3shi4 ta1 shi4 ru2he2 zai4 guo4qu4 shi2 nian2 li3 yun4niang4 yin1mou2 bing4 tao2 guo4 zhen1cha2 de5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei3dang1 you3ren2 jie1jin4 zhen1xiang4，AI jiu4 hui4 jiang1 qi2 mie4kou3，bing4 ma1 chu2 suo3you3 ji4lu4。"

msgid ""
"A pet AI would explain how Feuerschwinge has managed to maintain her conspiracy and avoid detection for the past two decades.\n"
"\n"
"Any time anyone gets close, the AI takes them out and scrubs the record clean."
msgstr ""
"如果说​火翼养​了​个​宠物​AI​的话​，​就​能​解释​她​是​如何​在​过去​二十年​里​酝酿​阴谋​并​逃过​侦察​的​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​每当​有人​接近​真相​，​AI​就​会​将​其​灭口​，​并​抹除​所有​记录​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3shuo1 Huo3yi4 yang3 le5 ge4 chong3wu4 AI de5hua4，jiu4 neng2 jie3shi4 ta1 shi4 ru2he2 zai4 guo4qu4 er4 shi2 nian2 li3 yun4niang4 yin1mou2 bing4 tao2 guo4 zhen1cha2 de5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei3dang1 you3ren2 jie1jin4 zhen1xiang4，AI jiu4 hui4 jiang1 qi2 mie4kou3，bing4 ma1 chu2 suo3you3 ji4lu4。"

msgid ""
"A piece of Watcher IC turns, flashing angrily. A rapid-fire sequence of "
"lights pulse out a warning: \"KEEP AWAY.\""
msgstr ""
"一块​观察者​IC​旋转​过来​，​愤怒​地​闪烁着​。​一连串​快速​闪烁​的​灯光​发出​警告​：​“​请勿​靠近​。​”\n"
"yi1kuai4 guan1cha2zhe3 IC xuan2zhuan3 guo4lai2，fen4nu4 de5 shan3 shuo4 zhao2。yi1lian2chuan4 kuai4su4 shan3shuo4 de5 deng1guang1 fa1chu1 jing3gao4：“qing3wu4 kao4jin4。”"

msgid ""
"A pile of corpses. The bodies are all dressed in high-quality ballistic "
"armor."
msgstr ""
"一堆​尸体​。​上面​都​穿着​高质量​的​防弹​装甲​。\n"
"yi1dui1 shi1ti3。shang4mian4 dou1 chuan1zhuo2 gao1zhi4liang4 de5 fang2dan4 zhuang1jia3。"

msgid ""
"A plain-looking man in a fancy suit taps away at his PDA. He's an older guy,"
" probably in his late fifties; in the filth-strewn streets of Drogenkippe, "
"he stands out like a sore thumb."
msgstr ""
"一个​穿着​花哨​西装​、​相貌​平平的​男人​正​敲打​着​他​的​PDA​。​他​看起来​岁数​不小​了​，​大约​年​近​六旬​；​在​这条​污秽​遍布​的​毒​坑区​街道​上​，​他​显得​格外​显眼​。\n"
"yi1ge5 chuan1zhuo2 hua1shao5 xi1zhuang1、xiang4mao4 ping2 ping2 de5 nan2ren2 zheng1 qiao1da3 zhao2 ta1 de5 PDA。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 sui4shu5 bu4 xiao3 le5，da4yue1 nian2 jin4 liu4 xun2 ； zai4 zhe4 tiao2 wu1hui4 bian4bu4 de5 du2 keng1 qu1 jie1dao4 shang4，ta1 xian3de5 ge2wai4 xian3yan3。"

msgid "A pleasure."
msgstr ""
"幸会​。\n"
"xing4hui4。"

msgid "A poison fist that does DMG and then causes -2 HP for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"毒拳​：​造成​伤害​后​，​使​目标​每​回合​损失​2​点​生命​值​，​持续​1​回合​。\n"
"du2 quan2：zao4cheng2 shang1hai4 hou4，shi3 mu4biao1 mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 2 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2，chi2xu4 1 hui2he2。"

msgid "A poison fist that does DMG and then causes -4 HP for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"毒拳​：​造成​伤害​后​，​使​目标​每​回合​损失​4​点​生命​值​，​持续​1​回合​。\n"
"du2 quan2：zao4cheng2 shang1hai4 hou4，shi3 mu4biao1 mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 4 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2，chi2xu4 1 hui2he2。"

msgid "A poison fist that does DMG and then causes -6 HP for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"毒拳​：​造成​伤害​后​，​使​目标​每​回合​损失​6​点​生命​值​，​持续​1​回合​。\n"
"du2 quan2：zao4cheng2 shang1hai4 hou4，shi3 mu4biao1 mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 6 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2，chi2xu4 1 hui2he2。"

msgid "A powerful attack program directed at one target for 100 IP DMG."
msgstr ""
"针对​单一​目标​发动​的​强力​攻击​程序​，​造成​100​点​结合​度​伤害​。\n"
"zhen1dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 de5 qiang2li4 gong1ji1 cheng2xu4，zao4cheng2 100 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A powerful attack program directed at one target for 150 IP DMG."
msgstr ""
"针对​单一​目标​发动​的​强力​攻击​程序​，​造成​150​点​结合​度​伤害​。\n"
"zhen1dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 de5 qiang2li4 gong1ji1 cheng2xu4，zao4cheng2 150 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A powerful attack program directed at one target for 175 IP DMG."
msgstr ""
"针对​单一​目标​发动​的​强力​攻击​程序​，​造成​175​点​结合​度​伤害​。\n"
"zhen1dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 de5 qiang2li4 gong1ji1 cheng2xu4，zao4cheng2 175 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A powerful attack program directed at one target, doing -100 IP DMG."
msgstr ""
"针对​单一​目标​发动​的​强力​攻击​程序​，​造成​-​100​点​结合​度​伤害​。\n"
"zhen1dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 de5 qiang2li4 gong1ji1 cheng2xu4，zao4cheng2 -100 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A powerful attack program directed at one target, doing -125 IP DMG."
msgstr ""
"针对​单一​目标​发动​的​强力​攻击​程序​，​造成​-​125​点​结合​度​伤害​。\n"
"zhen1dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 de5 qiang2li4 gong1ji1 cheng2xu4，zao4cheng2 -125 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "A powerful attack program directed at one target, doing -75 IP DMG."
msgstr ""
"针对​单一​目标​发动​的​强力​攻击​程序​，​造成​-​75​点​结合​度​伤害​。\n"
"zhen1dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 de5 qiang2li4 gong1ji1 cheng2xu4，zao4cheng2 -75 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"A powerful heavy pistol and primary rival to the Ares Predator. Slightly "
"more cost-effective, but slightly less capable."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一款​威力​强大​的​重型​手枪​，​是​阿瑞斯​掠​食者​的​主要​竞争对手​。​性价比​更高​，​性能​稍逊​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 kuan3 wei1li4 qiang2da4 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1，shi4 a1rui4si1 lu:e4 shi2 zhe3 de5 zhu3yao4 jing4zheng1dui4shou3。xing4jia4bi3 geng1 gao1，xing4neng2 shao1 xun4。"

msgid ""
"A powerful magical 'punch' that pierces up to 4 Armor. Shares a cooldown "
"with other Mana Fist spells."
msgstr ""
"这种​强大​的​“​魔法​拳​”​可以​提供​最多​4​点护甲​穿透​。​与​其他​“​法力​之拳​”​类​法术​共享​冷却​时间​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 qiang2da4 de5“mo2fa3 quan2” ke3yi3 ti2gong1 zui4duo1 4 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。yu4 qi2ta1“fa3li4 zhi1 quan2” lei4 fa3shu4 gong4xiang3 leng3que4 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"A powerful magical 'punch' that pierces up to 8 Armor. Shares a cooldown "
"with other Mana Fist spells."
msgstr ""
"这种​强大​的​“​魔法​拳​”​可以​提供​最多​8​点护甲​穿透​。​与​其他​“​法力​之拳​”​类​法术​共享​冷却​时间​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 qiang2da4 de5“mo2fa3 quan2” ke3yi3 ti2gong1 zui4duo1 8 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。yu4 qi2ta1“fa3li4 zhi1 quan2” lei4 fa3shu4 gong4xiang3 leng3que4 shi2jian1。"

msgid "A powerful magical bolt that pierces up to 2 Armor."
msgstr ""
"一支​强大​的​魔法​箭矢​，​最​多​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"yi1 zhi1 qiang2da4 de5 mo2fa3 jian4shi3，zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid "A powerful magical bolt that pierces up to 3 Armor."
msgstr ""
"一支​强大​的​魔法​箭矢​，​最​多​提供​3​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"yi1 zhi1 qiang2da4 de5 mo2fa3 jian4shi3，zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 3 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid "A powerful magical bolt that pierces up to 4 Armor."
msgstr ""
"一支​强大​的​魔法​箭矢​，​最​多​提供​4​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"yi1 zhi1 qiang2da4 de5 mo2fa3 jian4shi3，zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 4 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid "A powerful talon swipe"
msgstr ""
"一次​威力​强大​的​爪击\n"
"yi1ci4 wei1li4 qiang2da4 de5 zhao3 ji1"

msgid "A private museum. The owner of this estate must have money to burn."
msgstr ""
"一间​私人​博物馆​。​这座​庄园​的​主人​肯定​有​不少​闲钱​。\n"
"yi1 jian1 si1ren2 bo2wu4guan3。zhe4 zuo4 zhuang1yuan2 de5 zhu3ren2 ken3ding4 you3 bu4shao3 xian2qian2。"

msgid ""
"A private-access jackpoint, suitable for entering the facility's Matrix "
"network."
msgstr ""
"私人​接入点​，​适合​进入​设施​的​矩阵​网络​。\n"
"si1ren2 jie1ru4dian3，shi4he2 jin4ru4 she4shi1 de5 ju3zhen4 wang3luo4。"

msgid ""
"A processor that boosts a user's knowledge-based skills. Adds +1 "
"Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"一种​能够​提升​用户​知识型​技能​的​处理器​。​智力​+​1​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 neng2gou4 ti2sheng1 yong4hu4 zhi1 shi2 xing2 ji4neng2 de5 chu3li3qi4。zhi4li4 +1。"

msgid ""
"A quick check of your commlink shows that your security feed has been terminated.\n"
"\n"
"Instead of a command view of the 24th floor, you find yourself staring at a blank screen."
msgstr ""
"你​急忙​检查​自己​的​通讯​链​，​发现​监控​画面​被​切断​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​不再​显示​24​楼​的​监控​总览​，​而是​一片空白​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ji2mang2 jian3cha2 zi4ji3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4，fa1xian4 jian1kong4 hua4mian4 bei4 qie1duan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 bu4zai4 xian3shi4 24 lou2 de5 jian1kong4 zong3lan3，er2shi4 yi1 pian1 kong1 bai2。"

msgid ""
"A quick scroll of the data tells you that the subject has been kept in this containment unit for over twenty years. \n"
"\n"
"A bit further down, you find it - \"Subject: Feuerschwinge.\" Whoever is in that chamber, she has the astral form of a dragon inside her. There's probably nothing but a reptile brain left in the body."
msgstr ""
"快速​扫​了​一眼​数据​，​你​知道​该​实验​对象​已经​被困​在​这里​至少​有​二十年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​下面​又​写​着​—​—​“​实验​对象​：​火翼​”​。​不管​那​里面​是​谁​，​巨龙​的​灵体​都​被​封印​在​了​她​体内​。​下面​的​那头​巨龙​也许​只​剩下​了​爬行​类​的​脑​回路​。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4su4 sao3 le5 yi1yan3 shu4ju4，ni3 zhi1dao4 gai1 shi2yan4 dui4xiang4 yi3jing1 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 zhi4shao3 you3 er4 shi2 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xia4mian4 you4 xie3 zhao2——“shi2yan4 dui4xiang4：Huo3yi4”。bu4guan3 na4 li3mian4 shi4 shei2，ju4long2 de5 ling2ti3 dou1 bei4 feng1yin4 zai4 le5 ta1 ti3nei4。xia4mian4 de5 na4 tou2 ju4long2 ye3xu3 zhi3 sheng4xia4 le5 pa2xing2 lei4 de5 nao3 hui2lu4。"

msgid ""
"A rail-thin elf wearing a comically ornate wizard's robe stands at the "
"center of the room. When he speaks, his voice wavers and cracks."
msgstr ""
"一名​瘦骨嶙峋​的​精灵​伫立​在​房间​中央​，​身上​穿着​一件​滑稽​华丽​的​巫师​袍​。​他​开口​说话​时​，​声音​颤抖​而​沙哑​。\n"
"yi1 ming2 shou4gu3lin2xun2 de5 jing1ling2 zhu4li4 zai4 fang2jian1 zhong1yang1，shen1shang5 chuan1zhuo2 yi1 jian4 hua2ji1 hua2li4 de5 wu1shi1 pao2。ta1 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4 shi2，sheng1yin1 chan4dou3 er2 sha1ya3。"

msgid ""
"A rattling sound fills the air as the disc grinds in its tray.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, the screen fills with text."
msgstr ""
"当​光盘​在​托盘​中​磨擦​时​，​空气​中​弥漫着​嘎吱​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​屏幕​上​出现​了​文字​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 guang1pan2 zai4 tuo1pan2 zhong4 mo2ca1 shi2，kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 ga1zhi1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 wen2zi4。"

msgid "A reckoning? Am I in trouble?"
msgstr ""
"清算​？​我​有​麻烦​了​吗​？\n"
"qing1suan4？wo3 you3 ma2fan5 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"A recording of a couple enjoying each others company. One of them just "
"happens to be a CEO."
msgstr ""
"一对​情人​灵肉​交融​的​录像​。​其中​一人​恰好​是​CEO​。\n"
"yi1dui4 qing2ren2 ling2 rou4 jiao1rong2 de5 lu4xiang4。qi2zhong1 yi1 ren2 qia4hao3 shi4 CEO。"

msgid ""
"A relatively common pice of hardware that could be modified to replaced the "
"part that the hackers stole from Parson."
msgstr ""
"一种​相对​常见​的​硬件​，​改装​后​可以​用来​顶替​黑客​从帕森​那里​偷走​的​部件​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 xiang1dui4 chang2jian4 de5 ying4jian4，gai3zhuang1 hou4 ke3yi3 yong4lai2 ding3ti4 hei1ke4 cong2 pa4 sen1 na4li5 tou1 zou3 de5 bu4jian4。"

msgid ""
"A requirement for riggers, deckers, and those that want to use a Smartlink "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"对于​机师​、​碟客​，​以及​那些​想要​使用​智能武器​的​人​而言​，​这是​一项​必备​的​赛博​改造​。\n"
"dui4yu2 ji1shi1、die2 ke4，yi3ji2 na4xie1 xiang3yao4 shi3yong4 zhi4 neng2 wu3 qi4 de5 ren2 er2yan2，zhe4 shi4 yi1 xiang4 bi4bei4 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4。"

msgid ""
"A restricted area. Yes, I know. They sent me here to relieve you of duty."
msgstr ""
"是​禁区​，​我​知道​。​是​他们​派​我​来​接替​你​的​。\n"
"shi4 jin4qu1，wo3 zhi1dao4。shi4 ta1men5 pai4 wo3 lai2 jie1ti4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "A run went bad, and my team paid the price."
msgstr ""
"有趟​差事​搞砸​了​，​我​的​团队​付出​了​代价​。\n"
"you3 tang1 cha4shi4 gao3za2 le5，wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 fu4chu1 le5 dai4jia4。"

msgid "A run went bad, and my team paid the price. "
msgstr ""
"有趟​差事​搞砸​了​，​我​的​团队​付出​了​代价​。\n"
"you3 tang1 cha4shi4 gao3za2 le5，wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 fu4chu1 le5 dai4jia4。"

msgid ""
"A sacrifice for the greater good. Just like the one that I'm about to make.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair bows his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now you understand the weight that I must carry. It isn't fun, is it?"
msgstr ""
"为了​大局​，​总要​有​牺牲​。​就​像​我​马上​要​做​的​事情​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​垂下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​你​明白​我​背负​的​重量​了​吧​。​这​并​不​有趣​，​对​不​对​？\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 da4ju2，zong3yao4 you3 xi1sheng1。jiu4 xiang4 wo3 ma3shang4 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 chui2 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ni3 ming2bai5 wo3 bei1fu4 de5 zhong4liang4 le5 ba1。zhe4 bing4 bu4 you3qu4，dui4 bu4 dui4？"

msgid "A sealed can of gasoline."
msgstr ""
"一罐​密封​的​汽油​。\n"
"yi1 guan4 mi4feng1 de5 qi4you2。"

msgid "A sealed container of deadly nerve gas."
msgstr ""
"一罐​密封​的​致命​神经​毒气​。\n"
"yi1 guan4 mi4feng1 de5 zhi4ming4 shen2jing1 du2qi4。"

msgid ""
"A sealed emergency zone is, by its very nature, sealed. We cannot know what happens inside with certainty.\n"
"\n"
"Yet, I do wonder what effect the radiation from a nuclear meltdown might have had upon her. "
msgstr ""
"所谓​封闭​的​紧急​区域​，​其本质​首先​是​封闭​的​。​我们​无法​确切​知晓​内部​发生​了​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然而​，​我​确实​好奇​核​熔毁​产生​的​辐射​会​对​她​造成​怎样​的​影响​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3wei4 feng1bi4 de5 jin3ji2 qu1yu4，qi2 ben3 zhi4 shou3xian1 shi4 feng1bi4 de5。wo3men5 wu2fa3 que4qie4 zhi1xiao3 nei4bu4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"ran2er2，wo3 que4shi2 hao4qi2 he2 rong2hui3 chan3sheng1 de5 fu2she4 hui4 dui4 ta1 zao4cheng2 zen3yang4 de5 ying3xiang3。"

msgid ""
"A secretive organization with a lot of pull. Not big on telling the truth. "
"Any of that sound familiar?"
msgstr ""
"一个​神秘​组织​，​势力​庞大​。​不怎么​讲​真话​。​这些​听​起来​熟悉​吗​？\n"
"yi1ge5 shen2mi4 zu3zhi1，shi4li5 pang2da4。bu4zen3me5 jiang3 zhen1 hua4。zhe4xie1 ting1 qi3lai5 shu2xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"A security drone floats by to inspect Philip. Idly, he reaches out and begins to stroke its casing, petting it as if it were a house cat.\n"
"\n"
"The video feed flickers and sputters out, and you find yourself back at the main menu."
msgstr ""
"一架​安保​无人机​飘过​，​靠近​菲利普​进行​检查​。​他​漫不经心​地​伸出手​，​开始​抚摸​无人机​的​外壳​，​就​像​在​安抚​一只​家猫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​画面​闪烁​了​一下​，​然后​熄灭​。​你​再次​回到​了​主​菜单​界面​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 jia4 an1bao3 wu2ren2ji1 piao1 guo4，kao4jin4 fei1li4pu3 jin4xing2 jian3cha2。ta1 man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 shen1 chu1 shou3，kai1shi3 fu3mo1 wu2ren2ji1 de5 wai4ke2，jiu4 xiang4 zai4 an1fu3 yi1 zhi3 jia1mao1。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 hua4mian4 shan3shuo4 le5 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 xi1mie4。ni3 zai4ci4 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"A set of enormous double doors slides open on the far side of the room. "
"Silhouetted against the doorway you see a huge, hulking figure dressed in "
"military-grade armor."
msgstr ""
"房间​远端​一扇​巨大​的​双开门​缓缓​滑开​。​在​门廓​之中​，​你​看见​一个​身穿​军用​级护甲​的​魁梧​身影​。\n"
"fang2jian1 yuan3duan1 yi1 shan1 ju4da4 de5 shuang1kai1men2 huan3huan3 hua2 kai1。zai4 men2 kuo4 zhi1zhong1，ni3 kan4jian4 yi1ge5 shen1chuan1 jun1yong4 ji2 hu4 jia3 de5 kui2wu2 shen1ying3。"

msgid ""
"A shambling mound of ragged flesh stumbles toward you.\n"
"\n"
"There is a look of desperation in its eyes."
msgstr ""
"一具​蓬头垢面​、​衣衫褴褛​的​躯壳​跌跌撞撞​地向​你​走来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​的​眼神​里​充满​绝望​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 ju4 peng2tou2gou4mian4、yi1 shan1 lan2 lu:3 de5 qu1qiao4 die1die5zhuang4zhuang4 de5 xiang4 ni3 zou3 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 yan3shen2 li3 chong1man3 jue2wang4。"

msgid ""
"A shocking display of competence from the Red-Haired Disaster.\n"
"\n"
"That's what Mr. Grinder calls your pal, by the way. He's got a rep around these parts... for some strange reason, all of his friends keep dying."
msgstr ""
"这位​“​红​发​灾星​”​居然​也​会​有​如此​靠​谱​的​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​顺便​说​一句​，​“​绞肉机​”​先生​就是​这么​称呼​你​那位​朋友​的​。​他​在​这片​地区​名声​不佳​……​不知​为何​，​他​的​朋友​们​总会​接二连三​地​死去​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4wei4“hong2 fa1 zai1xing1” ju1ran2 ye3 hui4 you3 ru2ci3 kao4 pu3 de5 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"shun4bian4 shuo1 yi1ju4，“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 cheng1hu5 ni3 na4 wei4 peng2you5 de5。ta1 zai4 zhe4 pian1 di4qu1 ming2sheng1 bu4jia1……bu4zhi1 wei4he2，ta1 de5 peng2you5 men5 zong3 hui4 jie1er4lian2san1 de5 si3qu4。"

msgid "A shoddily-built soykaf shop. Looks like it's closed."
msgstr ""
"一家​摇摇欲坠​的​豆​咖店​。​看来​是​关门​了​。\n"
"yi1jia1 yao2yao2yu4zhui4 de5 dou4 ka1 dian4。kan4lai5 shi4 guan1men2 le5。"

msgid ""
"A signed copy of \"Kitchen Magic Made Easy\" by K'shiel Terarra, host of the"
" popular cooking show \"K'shiel's Awakened Kitchen.\" The recipes inside all"
" make heavy use of magically active ingredients."
msgstr ""
"《​厨房​魔法​轻松​学​》​的​签名版​，​作者​为​热门​烹饪​节目​《​凯​希尔​的​觉醒​厨房​》​的​主持人​凯​希尔​·​泰​拉拉​。​书中​所有​食谱​均​大量​使用​了​具有​魔力​活性​的​食材​。\n"
"《 chu2fang2 mo2fa3 qing1song1 xue2 》 de5 qian1 ming2 ban3，zuo4zhe3 wei2 re4men2 peng1ren4 jie2mu4 《 kai3 xi1er3 de5 jue2xing3 chu2fang2 》 de5 zhu3chi2ren2 kai3 xi1er3 · tai4 la1la1。shu1 zhong4 suo3you3 shi2pu3 jun1 da4liang4 shi3yong4 le5 ju4you3 mo2li4 huo2xing4 de5 shi2cai2。"

msgid ""
"A simple one. You'll resume feeding the ghouls, or I'll tell the people of "
"the Kreuzbasar all about your secret arrangement with them."
msgstr ""
"很​简单​。​你​继续​饲喂​尸鬼们​，​否则​我​就​把​你们​之间​的​秘密​约定​告诉​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人​。\n"
"hen3 jian3dan1。ni3 ji4xu4 si4wei4 shi1 gui3 men5，fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 mi4mi4 yue1ding4 gao4su4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2。"

msgid "A slash followed up by a kick. Pierces up to 1 Armor. May do AP DMG."
msgstr ""
"一次​斩击​后​接上​一记​踢击​。​最​多​提供​1​点护甲​穿透​。​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"yi1ci4 zhan3 ji1 hou4 jie1shang4 yi1 ji4 ti1 ji1。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"A small cystal attached to a sliver chain, taken from Trithemius as proof of"
" his demise."
msgstr ""
"一颗​系在​银链​上​的​小​水晶​，​从特​里特​米​乌斯​手中​获得​，​用来​证实​他​的​死亡​。\n"
"yi1 ke1 xi4 zai4 yin2 lian4 shang4 de5 xiao3 shui3jing1，cong2 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 shou3 zhong4 huo4de2，yong4lai2 zheng4shi2 ta1 de5 si3wang2。"

msgid "A small sealed container of diesel fuel."
msgstr ""
"一罐​密封​的​柴油​。\n"
"yi1 guan4 mi4feng1 de5 chai2you2。"

msgid "A small stuffed bear. Its fur is faded and its stitching is frayed."
msgstr ""
"一只​小​毛绒​熊​。​它​的​绒毛​已经​褪色​了​，​缝线​也​残破​不堪​。\n"
"yi1 zhi3 xiao3 mao2 rong2 xiong2。ta1 de5 rong2mao2 yi3jing1 tui4se4 le5，feng2xian4 ye3 can2po4 bu4kan1。"

msgid ""
"A small voice whispers through lips that barely move. It sounds hoarse and "
"awkward, like a rusty lock."
msgstr ""
"一个​微弱​的​声音​从​几乎​不动​的​嘴唇​间​传出​。​那​声音​沙哑​而​笨拙​，​就​像​生锈​的​锁​。\n"
"yi1ge5 wei1ruo4 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 ji1hu1 bu4dong4 de5 zui3chun2 jian1 chuan2chu1。na4 sheng1yin1 sha1ya3 er2 ben4zhuo1，jiu4 xiang4 sheng1xiu4 de5 suo3。"

msgid ""
"A small, strangled sound escapes from his throat as your fist slams into the bridge of his nose.\n"
"\n"
"You feel the tiny bones break and hear the sound of crunching cartilage."
msgstr ""
"你​的​第一拳​狠狠​砸​在​他​的​鼻梁​上​，​他​的​喉咙​里​发出​一声​轻微​的​哽咽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​感觉​到​细小​的​骨头​断裂​，​听到​软骨​嘎吱​作响​的​声音​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 di4 yi1 quan2 hen3hen3 za2 zai4 ta1 de5 bi2liang2 shang4，ta1 de5 hou2long2 li3 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 qing1wei1 de5 geng3ye4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gan3jue2 dao4 xi4xiao3 de5 gu3tou5 duan4lie4，ting1dao4 ruan3gu3 ga1zhi1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 sheng1yin1。"

msgid ""
"A soft whirring sound fills the air as the ancient DVD player spins the disc up to speed.\n"
"\n"
"The scratched LCD display comes to life, and a menu fills the screen."
msgstr ""
"当​古老​的​DVD​播放器​高速旋转​光盘​时​，​空气​中​弥漫着​轻柔​的​嗖嗖​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​划痕​的​液晶​显示屏​开始运转​，​屏幕​上​出现​了​一项​菜单​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 gu3lao3 de5 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 gao1 su4 xuan2 zhuai3 guang1pan2 shi2，kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 qing1rou2 de5 sou1sou1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"you3 hua2hen2 de5 ye4jing1 xian3shi4ping2 kai1 shi3 yun4 zhuai3，ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 yi1 xiang4 cai4dan1。"

msgid ""
"A solitary woman stands at the edge of the U-Bahn platform. She suppresses a shiver and hugs herself for warmth.\n"
"\n"
"Frau Müller."
msgstr ""
"一位​女子​独自​伫立​在​地铁站​台​边缘​。​她​强忍​着​寒意​，​抱紧​自己​取暖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​穆勒​女士​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wei4 nu:3zi3 du2zi4 zhu4li4 zai4 di4tie3zhan4 tai2 bian1yuan2。ta1 qiang3ren3 zhao2 han2yi4，bao4 jin3 zi4ji3 qu3nuan3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4。"

msgid ""
"A sound like a conveyor belt starting adds to the noise of machinery, and "
"you can’t make out anything else until it comes to a stop a minute later."
msgstr ""
"传送带​启动​般的​轰鸣声​加入​了​机器​的​噪音​，​直到​一分钟​后​它​停下来​，​你​才​听​清​其他​声音​。\n"
"chuan2song4dai4 qi3dong4 ban1 de5 hong1 ming2 sheng1 jia1ru4 le5 ji1qi4 de5 zao4yin1，zhi2dao4 yi1 fen4 zhong1 hou4 ta1 ting2xia4lai2，ni3 cai2 ting1 qing1 qi2ta1 sheng1yin1。"

msgid ""
"A specially stabilized weapons mount, significantly improves accuracy of "
"weapons mounted on it."
msgstr ""
"一种​特别​稳定​的​武器​支架​，​显著​提高​了​安装​在​其​上​的​武器​的​精度​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 te4bie2 wen3ding4 de5 wu3qi4 zhi1jia4，xian3zhu4 ti2gao1 le5 an1zhuang1 zai4 qi2 shang4 de5 wu3qi4 de5 jing1du4。"

msgid ""
"A stack of business cards on this desk reveals that it belongs to one Annika Schroeder.\n"
"\n"
"A cursory search reveals that the desk's drawers are stuffed full of lewd love notes, all hastily written on scraps of office stationery."
msgstr ""
"从​桌上​的​一沓​名片​能​看​出来​，​这张​办公桌​属于​某个​叫​安妮​卡​·​施罗德​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​随手​一翻​，​就​发现​桌子​的​抽屉​里​塞满​了​露骨​的​情书​，​全​被​潦草​地​记录​在​废弃​的​办公​用纸​上​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 zhuo1 shang4 de5 yi1 da2 ming2pian4 neng2 kan4 chu1lai2，zhe4 zhang1 ban4 gong1 zhuo1 shu3yu2 mou3 ge4 jiao4 an1ni1 ka3 · shi1luo2de2 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 sui2shou3 yi1 fan1，jiu4 fa1xian4 zhuo1zi5 de5 chou1ti5 li3 sai1man3 le5 lu4gu3 de5 qing2shu1，quan2 bei4 liao2cao3 de5 ji4lu4 zai4 fei4qi4 de5 ban4gong1 yong4 zhi3 shang4。"

msgid ""
"A standard cyberterminal waits on the table before you. The screen is "
"active, displaying a basic list of simple data queries."
msgstr ""
"你​面前​的​桌子​上​有​一台​标准​便携式​赛博​终端​。​屏幕​亮​着​，​上面​显示​了​一份​简单​数据​查询​的​基本​列表​。\n"
"ni3 mian4qian2 de5 zhuo1zi5 shang4 you3 yi1 tai2 biao1zhun3 bian4xie2shi4 sai4bo2 zhong1duan1。ping2mu4 liang4 zhao2，shang4mian4 xian3shi4 le5 yi1 fen4 jian3dan1 shu4ju4 cha2xun2 de5 ji1ben3 lie4biao3。"

msgid "A standard drone repair kit that repairs a minimum of 10 HP."
msgstr ""
"一款​标准级​无人机​修复​套件​，​至少​修复​10​点​无人机​生命​值​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 biao1 zhun3 ji2 wu2ren2ji1 xiu1fu4 tao4jian4，zhi4shao3 xiu1fu4 10 dian3 wu2ren2ji1 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "A standard key card with the Aztechnology logo printed on it."
msgstr ""
"一张​印有​阿兹特​科技​标志​的​标准​门禁卡​。\n"
"yi1 zhang1 yin4 you3 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 biao1zhi4 de5 biao1zhun3 men2 jin1 ka3。"

msgid ""
"A standard mag lock card with no markings. Most likely a copy of the "
"original."
msgstr ""
"一张​标准​的​磁锁卡​，​表面​无​任何​标记​。​极有​可能​是​原卡​的​复制品​。\n"
"yi1 zhang1 biao1zhun3 de5 ci2 suo3 ka3，biao3mian4 wu2 ren4he2 biao1ji4。ji2 you3 ke3neng2 shi4 yuan2 ka3 de5 fu4zhi4pin3。"

msgid ""
"A stern-looking young woman in the uniform of an Aztechnology security captain steps forward.\n"
"\n"
"An assault rifle is slung over her shoulder, and she half-raises it at your approach."
msgstr ""
"一位​身着​阿兹特​科技​安保​队长​制服​的​年轻​女子​神情​严肃​地​向前​走来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​肩上​斜​挎着​一支​突击​步枪​，​见​你​走近​便半举​枪身​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wei4 shen1zhuo2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 an1bao3 dui4zhang3 zhi4fu2 de5 nian2qing1 nu:3zi3 shen2qing2 yan2su4 de5 xiang4qian2 zou3 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jian1 shang4 xie2 kua4 zhao2 yi1 zhi1 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1，jian4 ni3 zou3jin4 bian4 ban4 ju3 qiang1 shen1。"

msgid ""
"A stocky man in a military surplus jacket enters the room.\n"
"\n"
"He is flanked on either side by a pair of young women. Their faces are masked by white kerchiefs, and each of them carries an unholstered pistol."
msgstr ""
"一个​穿着​军用​旧​夹克​的​壮实​男人​走进​房间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​两名​年轻​女子​跟随​在​他​的​两侧​。​这三人用​白色​头巾​蒙住​脸​，​手里​都​握​着​手枪​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 chuan1zhuo2 jun1yong4 jiu4 jia1ke4 de5 zhuang4shi5 nan2ren2 zou3jin4 fang2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"liang3 ming2 nian2qing1 nu:3zi3 gen1sui2 zai4 ta1 de5 liang3ce4。zhe4 san1 ren2 yong4 bai2se4 tou2jin1 meng2 zhu4 lian3，shou3li3 dou1 wo4 zhao2 shou3qiang1。"

msgid ""
"A stream of acid that also does ongoing -6 HP for 1 RND. Strips 1 Armor from"
" the target."
msgstr ""
"一道​酸液​流​，​同时​持续​造成​-​6​点​生命​值​伤害​，​持续​1​回合​。​剥离​受​影响​的​目标​1​点护甲值​。\n"
"yi1dao4 suan1 ye4 liu2，tong2shi2 chi2xu4 zao4cheng2 -6 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，chi2xu4 1 hui2he2。bo1li2 shou4 ying3xiang3 de5 mu4biao1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"A stream of acid that also does ongoing -8 HP for 2 RNDS. Strips 1 Armor "
"from the target."
msgstr ""
"一道​酸液​流​，​同时​持续​造成​-​8​点​生命​值​伤害​，​持续​2​回合​。​剥离​受​影响​的​目标​1​点护甲值​。\n"
"yi1dao4 suan1 ye4 liu2，tong2shi2 chi2xu4 zao4cheng2 -8 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。bo1li2 shou4 ying3xiang3 de5 mu4biao1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"A stream of caustic syllables pours out of the elf's mouth. His back is "
"stooped under the weight of his pack, but his hands have clenched into "
"fists."
msgstr ""
"精灵​口中​喷涌​出​连串​尖刻​的​字眼​。​他​背负​沉重​行囊​佝偻​着​身子​，​双手​却​已​紧握​成拳​。\n"
"jing1ling2 kou3 zhong4 pen1yong3 chu1 lian2chuan4 jian1ke4 de5 zi4yan3。ta1 bei1fu4 chen2zhong4 xing2nang2 gou1lou2 zhao2 shen1zi5，shuang1shou3 que4 yi3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。"

msgid ""
"A street samurai infused with tattooed circuitry. Skilled with blades, "
"grenades and guns."
msgstr ""
"身上​刺满​了​电路​纹身​的​街头​武士​，​擅长​使用​刀剑​，​手雷​和​枪支​。\n"
"shen1shang5 ci1 man3 le5 dian4lu4 wen2shen1 de5 jie1tou2 wu3shi4，shan4chang2 shi3yong4 dao1jian4，shou3lei2 he4 qiang1zhi1。"

msgid ""
"A stun spell which does -1 AP to the target and ongoing -1 AP that lasts 1 "
"RND."
msgstr ""
"一个​对​目标​造成​-​1​行动​力​损伤​的​眩晕​法术​。​同时​造成​持续​1​回合​的​-​1​点​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"yi1ge5 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 -1 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1 de5 xuan4yun4 fa3shu4。tong2shi2 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 1 hui2he2 de5 -1 dian3 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid "A stun spell which does -1 AP to the target."
msgstr ""
"一个​对​目标​造成​-​1​行动​力​损伤​的​眩晕​法术​。\n"
"yi1ge5 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 -1 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1 de5 xuan4yun4 fa3shu4。"

msgid ""
"A sudden spasm jerks Monika's head back again. She grunts. Then her chin drops to her chest, and her head lolls to one side. \n"
"\n"
"Her eyes fix on an object in the next room: a computer terminal. The soft light of a cursor blinks on its recessed screen. \n"
"\n"
"Slowly, she attempts to speak again, but the only sound that emerges is a long, strangled croak. "
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​头​突然​又​猛地​向​后仰​去​，​她​发出​低沉​的​呻吟​。​接着​下颌​垂落​在​胸前​，​头颅​向​一侧​歪斜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​目光​死死​盯​着​隔壁​房间​的​某个​物体​：​一台​电脑​终端​。​凹陷​的​屏幕​上​，​光标​正​闪烁着​发出​柔光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​缓缓​试图​再次​开口​，​但​从​喉咙​里​挤出来​的​只有​一段​长而​嘶哑​的​呜咽​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 de5 tou2 tu1ran2 you4 meng3de5 xiang4 hou4 yang3 qu4，ta1 fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 shen1yin2。jie1zhe5 xia4he2 chui2 la4 zai4 xiong1qian2，tou2lu2 xiang4 yi1 ce4 wai1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 mu4guang1 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 ge2bi4 fang2jian1 de5 mou3 ge4 wu4ti3：yi1 tai2 dian4nao3 zhong1duan1。ao1xian4 de5 ping2mu4 shang4，guang1biao1 zheng1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 fa1chu1 rou2 guang1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 huan3huan3 shi4tu2 zai4ci4 kai1kou3，dan4 cong2 hou2long2 li3 ji3 chu1 lai2 de5 zhi3you3 yi1 duan4 zhang3 er2 si1ya3 de5 wu1ye4。"

msgid ""
"A supervisor's ID Badge, it probably has higher security clearance than the "
"badge Amsel provided you with."
msgstr ""
"一张​代表​主管​的​工牌​，​大​概率​有着​比​阿姆​泽尔​给​你​的​那​张​证件​更​高​的​安全​权限​。\n"
"yi1 zhang1 dai4biao3 zhu3guan3 de5 gong1 pai2，dai4 gai4lu:4 you3zhe5 bi3 E1mu3ze2er3 gei3 ni3 de5 na4 zhang1 zheng4jian4 geng1 gao1 de5 an1quan2 quan2xian4。"

msgid ""
"A support drone that is equipped to lay a smoke trail anywhere you need it "
"most."
msgstr ""
"一架​支援​无人机​，​可​随时​在​你​最​需要​的​位置​释放​烟雾​。\n"
"yi1 jia4 zhi1yuan2 wu2ren2ji1，ke3 sui2shi2 zai4 ni3 zui4 xu1yao4 de5 wei4zhi5 shi4fang4 yan1wu4。"

msgid "A synthetic winter ale brewed by Aztechnology."
msgstr ""
"阿兹特​科技​酿造​的​一款​合成​冬​啤​。\n"
"E1zi1te4ke1ji4 niang4zao4 de5 yi1 kuan3 he2cheng2 dong1 pi2。"

msgid ""
"A tailored suit. Lends an air of quiet authority and class. Grants +2 "
"Charisma"
msgstr ""
"量身​定制​的​西装​。​尽显​沉稳​威仪​与​高雅​格调​。​提供​+​2​魅力\n"
"liang2shen1 ding4zhi4 de5 xi1zhuang1。jin3 xian3 chen2wen3 wei1yi2 yu4 gao1ya3 ge2diao4。ti2gong1 +2 mei4li4"

msgid ""
"A tall, deeply tanned man rounds the corner at a jog and comes bustling into the room. You recognize him as the father that you spoke with at the AugmenTech kiosk.\n"
"\n"
"He stops short when he sees your team, and the smile falls from his face."
msgstr ""
"一个​肤色​黝黑​的​高大​男人​小跑​着​绕过​拐角​，​匆匆忙忙​地​闯进​房间​。​你​认出​他​就是​你​在​“​增强​科技​”​摊位​交谈​过​的​那位​父亲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​看见​你​的​小队​时​猛地​停下​脚步​，​笑容​瞬间​从​脸上​消失​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 fu1se4 you3hei1 de5 gao1da4 nan2ren2 xiao3pao3 zhao2 rao4guo4 guai3jiao3，cong1 cong1 mang2 mang2 de5 chuang3jin4 fang2jian1。ni3 ren4chu1 ta1 jiu4shi4 ni3 zai4“zeng1qiang2 ke1ji4” tan1wei4 jiao1tan2 guo4 de5 na4 wei4 fu4qin1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4jian4 ni3 de5 xiao3 dui4 shi2 meng3de5 ting2xia4 jiao3bu4，xiao4rong2 shun4jian1 cong2 lian3 shang4 xiao1shi1。"

msgid ""
"A tall, spray-tanned man in an expensive suit rounds the corner at a jog and comes bustling into the room. He stops short when he sees your team.\n"
"\n"
"His eyes flick from you to the panel that Jana pried from the wall, and the smile falls from his face."
msgstr ""
"一个​肤色​黝黑​、​穿着​昂贵​西装​的​高大​男人​小跑​着​绕过​拐角​，​匆匆忙忙​地​闯进​房间​。​他​看见​你​的​小队​时​猛地​停下​脚步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​先是​看向​你​，​又​看​向​简娜​从​墙上​撬下来​的​面板​，​笑容​瞬间​从​脸上​消失​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 fu1se4 you3hei1、chuan1zhuo2 ang2gui4 xi1zhuang1 de5 gao1da4 nan2ren2 xiao3pao3 zhao2 rao4guo4 guai3jiao3，cong1 cong1 mang2 mang2 de5 chuang3jin4 fang2jian1。ta1 kan4jian4 ni3 de5 xiao3 dui4 shi2 meng3de5 ting2xia4 jiao3bu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xian1 shi4 kan4 xiang4 ni3，you4 kan4 xiang4 Jian3na4 cong2 qiang2 shang4 qiao4 xia4 lai2 de5 mian4ban3，xiao4rong2 shun4jian1 cong2 lian3 shang4 xiao1shi1。"

msgid ""
"A telltale hiss makes the hairs on the back of your neck stand up straight. Hydraulics.\n"
"\n"
"There's somebody on the other side of this door, and that somebody has just hit the \"open\" button."
msgstr ""
"一道​嘶嘶声​让​你​脖子​后面​的​汗毛​直竖​。​是​液压​系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门​的​另一侧​有人​，​而​那个​人​刚刚​按下​了​“​打开​”​按钮​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dao4 si1si1sheng1 rang4 ni3 bo2zi5 hou4mian5 de5 han4mao2 zhi2 shu4。shi4 ye4ya1 xi4tong3。\n"
"\n"
"men2 de5 ling4 yi1 ce4 you3ren2，er2 na4ge5 ren2 gang1gang5 an4xia4 le5“da3kai1” an4niu3。"

msgid "A text entry field awaits your query."
msgstr ""
"一个​文本​输入框​正在​等待​你​的​输入​。\n"
"yi1ge5 wen2ben3 shu1 ru4 kuang4 zheng4zai4 deng3dai4 ni3 de5 shu1ru4。"

msgid "A thought comes to him, and his tired eyes glitter in triumph."
msgstr ""
"一个​念头​闪过​他​的​脑海​，​令​他​疲惫​的​双眼​发出​精光​。\n"
"yi1ge5 nian4tou5 shan3guo4 ta1 de5 nao3hai3，ling3 ta1 pi2bei4 de5 shuang1yan3 fa1chu1 jing1guang1。"

msgid "A thousand? Can't you cut me a deal?"
msgstr ""
"一千​？​不能​便宜​点​吗​？\n"
"yi1 qian1？bu4neng2 bian4yi2 dian3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"A tiny red light set into the box's lid begins flashing.\n"
"\n"
"After a few seconds, it turns solid yellow, and then finally shifts to green."
msgstr ""
"盒盖​上​的​小​红灯​开始​闪烁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​它​变成​稳定​的​黄色​，​最后​转为​绿色​。\n"
"\n"
"he2 gai4 shang4 de5 xiao3 hong2deng1 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ta1 bian4cheng2 wen3ding4 de5 huang2se4，zui4hou4 zhuai3 wei2 lu:4se4。"

msgid "A torn piece of paper with the name \"SCHINDERHANNES\" written on it."
msgstr ""
"一张​写​着​“​辛德​汉内斯​”​名字​的​破损​纸片​。\n"
"yi1 zhang1 xie3 zhao2“xin1 de2 han4 nei4 si1” ming2zi5 de5 po4sun3 zhi3pian4。"

msgid ""
"A tranquilizing narcotic. Incoming DMG reduced by 4 for 5 RNDS of combat. "
"Strength reduced by 1."
msgstr ""
"镇静​麻醉剂​。​降低​1​点​力量​，​减少​4​点​受到​的​伤害​。​持续​5​回合​。\n"
"zhen4jing4 ma2zui4ji4。jiang4di1 1 dian3 li4liang5，jian3shao3 4 dian3 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。chi2xu4 5 hui2he2。"

msgid "A trophy, perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"也许​是​个​纪念品​？\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4 ge4 ji4nian4pin3？"

msgid ""
"A two-hit combo with the hand-razors. Each hit strips 2 Armor from the "
"target."
msgstr ""
"使用​手部​剃刀​进行​两段​连击​。​每​段​攻击​剥离​目标​2​点护甲值​。\n"
"shi3yong4 shou3 bu4 ti4dao1 jin4xing2 liang3 duan4 lian2ji1。mei3 duan4 gong1ji1 bo1li2 mu4biao1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"A valuable shipment of antiquities will be arriving soon at the Seattle "
"docks. Useful information to someone who can take advantage of it."
msgstr ""
"一批​珍贵​的​古董​货物​即将​抵达​西雅图​码头​。​对于​能​从中​获利​的​人​而言​，​这​无疑​是​条有​价值​的​情报​。\n"
"yi1 pi1 zhen1gui4 de5 gu3dong3 huo4wu4 ji2jiang1 di3da2 xi1ya3tu2 ma3tou5。dui4yu2 neng2 cong2zhong1 huo4li4 de5 ren2 er2yan2，zhe4 wu2yi2 shi4 tiao2 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 qing2bao4。"

msgid "A variety of remarkably well-preserved Slavic artifacts."
msgstr ""
"各式各样​保存​异常​完好​的​斯拉夫​文物​。\n"
"ge4shi4ge4yang4 bao3cun2 yi4chang2 wan2hao3 de5 si1la1fu1 wen2wu4。"

msgid ""
"A venom spray that causes -16 HP DMG and does -2 HP DMG that last for 2 "
"RNDS."
msgstr ""
"毒液​喷雾​，​造成​-​16​点​生命​值​伤害​，​并​持续​造成​-​2​点​生命​值​伤害​，​效果​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"du2ye4 pen1wu4，zao4cheng2 -16 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，bing4 chi2xu4 zao4cheng2 -2 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，xiao4guo3 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"A venom spray that does -12 HP DMG and does -2 HP DMG that last for 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"毒液​喷雾​，​造成​-​12​点​生命​值​伤害​，​并​持续​造成​-​2​点​生命​值​伤害​，​效果​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"du2ye4 pen1wu4，zao4cheng2 -12 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，bing4 chi2xu4 zao4cheng2 -2 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，xiao4guo3 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"A venom spray that does -14 HP DMG and does ongoing -1 AP DMG that lasts for"
" 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"毒液​喷雾​，​造成​-​14​点​生命​值​伤害​，​并​持续​造成​-​1​点​行动​点​伤害​，​效果​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"du2ye4 pen1wu4，zao4cheng2 -14 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，bing4 chi2xu4 zao4cheng2 -1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3 shang1hai4，xiao4guo3 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"A venom spray that does -18 HP DMG and does -2 HP DMG that last for 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"毒液​喷雾​，​造成​-​18​点​生命​值​伤害​，​并​持续​造成​-​2​点​生命​值​伤害​，​效果​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"du2ye4 pen1wu4，zao4cheng2 -18 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，bing4 chi2xu4 zao4cheng2 -2 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，xiao4guo3 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid "A voice roars out of her, from somewhere deep inside the frail woman."
msgstr ""
"一个​声音​从​这​瘦弱​的​女人​体内​深处​喷涌​而出​。\n"
"yi1ge5 sheng1yin1 cong2 zhe4 shou4ruo4 de5 nu:3ren2 ti3nei4 shen1chu4 pen1yong3 er2 chu1。"

msgid ""
"A warning light strobes out from the console at your approach. Large white "
"letters shriek out against a red background."
msgstr ""
"你​靠近​时​，​控制台​发出​一阵​警示​的​光​，​硕大​的​白色​字体​在​红底​的​屏幕​上​显得​格外​刺眼​。\n"
"ni3 kao4jin4 shi2，kong4zhi4tai2 fa1chu1 yi1zhen4 jing3shi4 de5 guang1，shuo4da4 de5 bai2se4 zi4ti3 zai4 hong2 de5 de5 ping2mu4 shang4 xian3de5 ge2wai4 ci4yan3。"

msgid ""
"A wave of nausea washes over you, and your perception distorts. It feels like some great, unseen power is turning you inside out.\n"
"\n"
"You catch sight of Glory, standing impassively, smiling into the void. Then everything goes black."
msgstr ""
"一阵​恶心感​席卷​全身​，​你​的​感知​也​随之​扭曲​，​仿佛​某种​无形​的​巨大力量​正​将​你​从里到外​翻转​过来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看到​格洛丽面​无表情​地站​在​原地​，​对​着​虚空​微笑​。​然后​，​一切​都​陷入​了​黑暗​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhen4 e4 xin1 gan3 xi2juan3 quan2shen1，ni3 de5 gan3zhi1 ye3 sui2zhi1 niu3qu1，fang3fu2 mou3zhong3 wu2xing2 de5 ju4 dai4 li4 liang2 zheng1 jiang1 ni3 cong2li3dao4wai4 fan1zhuan3 guo4lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 Ge2luo4li2 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 zhan4 zai4 yuan2di4，dui4 zhao2 xu1kong1 wei1xiao4。ran2hou4，yi1qie4 dou1 xian4ru4 le5 hei1an4。"

msgid ""
"A week. A month. What does it matter? Harrow ruins these kids either way."
msgstr ""
"一周​也好​，​一个月​也好​，​这有​什么​区别​？​哈罗​终究会​毁​了​这些​孩子​。\n"
"yi1zhou1 ye3hao3，yi1 ge4 yue4 ye3hao3，zhe4 you3 shen2me5 qu1bie2？ha1luo2 zhong1 jiu1 hui4 hui3 le5 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"A well used calender is hung on the wall, covered in notes and appointments."
" June the 29th has been circled about half a dozen times."
msgstr ""
"墙上​挂​着​一幅​久经​使用​的​日历​，​覆满​了​笔记​与​预约​。​6​月​29​日​被​圈​了​数圈​。\n"
"qiang2 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yi1 fu2 jiu3jing1 shi3yong4 de5 ri4li4，fu4 man3 le5 bi3ji4 yu4 yu4yue1。6 yue4 29 ri4 bei4 juan1 le5 shu3 juan1。"

msgid ""
"A well-groomed corporate couple stand in the corner, browing racks of pamphlets about neural enhancement headware.\n"
"\n"
"The woman's head turns at the sound of your approach."
msgstr ""
"一对​衣着​考究​的​公司​夫妇​站​在​角落​，​翻阅​着​关于​神经​增强​头戴​设备​的​宣传册​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​你​走近​的​脚步声​，​女子​转过​头来​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dui4 yi1zhuo2 kao3jiu1 de5 gong1si1 fu1fu4 zhan4 zai4 jiao3luo4，fan1yue4 zhao2 guan1yu2 shen2jing1 zeng1qiang2 tou2 dai4 she4bei4 de5 xuan1chuan2ce4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ni3 zou3jin4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1，nu:3zi3 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 lai2。"

msgid ""
"A well-worn memory stick, designed with a universal adapter to connect with "
"any consumer-grade computer."
msgstr ""
"一根​严重​磨损​的​记忆棒​，​有个​通用​接口​，​可​连接​任何​消费​级​电脑​。\n"
"yi1 gen1 yan2zhong4 mo2sun3 de5 ji4yi4bang4，you3 ge4 tong1yong4 jie1kou3，ke3 lian2jie1 ren4he2 xiao1fei4 ji2 dian4nao3。"

msgid ""
"A wide variety of clients.\n"
"\n"
"I know for a fact that he's worked for mafia groups both inside and outside of Russia. He spent a few years in Norway working for the Lobatchevski Syndicate."
msgstr ""
"多​了​去​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​仅​从​我​所​了解​的​来看​，​俄罗斯​内外​都​有​黑帮​团伙​和​他​合作​过​。​他​有​好几年​时间​都​在​挪威​为洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​效力​。\n"
"\n"
"duo1 le5 qu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jin3 cong2 wo3 suo3 liao3jie3 de5 lai2 kan4，e2luo2si1 nei4wai4 dou1 you3 hei1bang1 tuan2huo3 he4 ta1 he2zuo4 guo4。ta1 you3 hao3ji3nian2 shi2jian1 dou1 zai4 nuo2wei1 wei2 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2 xiao4li4。"

msgid ""
"A wild-eyed young man in a tattered lab coat confronts you. His beard is "
"bushy and unkempt, but bare patches of skin show through."
msgstr ""
"一个​双眼​狂乱​的​年轻人​拦住​了​你​。​他​穿着​一件​破旧​的​实验室​外套​，​胡子​又​浓​又​乱​，​间或​露出​几块​裸露​的​皮肤​。\n"
"yi1ge5 shuang1yan3 kuang2luan4 de5 nian2qing1ren2 lan2zhu4 le5 ni3。ta1 chuan1zhuo2 yi1 jian4 po4jiu4 de5 shi2yan4shi4 wai4tao4，hu2zi5 you4 nong2 you4 luan4，jian4huo4 lu4chu1 ji1 kuai4 luo3lu4 de5 pi2fu1。"

msgid "A wise move, $(l.name). I think Monika would be proud."
msgstr ""
"明智之举​，​$(l.name)​。​莫妮卡​会​为此​感到​骄傲​。\n"
"ming2zhi4zhi1ju3，$(l.name)。Mo4ni1ka3 hui4 wei4ci3 gan3dao4 jiao1ao4。"

msgid ""
"A woman kneels beside him, her face pressed to his chest. Soft sobs wrack "
"her body."
msgstr ""
"一个​女人​跪​在​他​旁边​，​脸​贴着​他​的​胸膛​。​轻轻​的​啜泣声​让​她​的​身体​不住​颤抖​。\n"
"yi1ge5 nu:3ren2 gui4 zai4 ta1 pang2bian1，lian3 tie1 zhao2 ta1 de5 xiong1tang2。qing1qing1 de5 chuo4 qi4 sheng1 rang4 ta1 de5 shen1ti3 bu4zhu4 chan4dou3。"

msgid ""
"A word of advice that I will give you: you'd best kill me here. I mean that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He fixes his gaze on you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Because if I ever get off of this floor, I'll snap you in half like a twig. And then I'll do the same to your she-troll friend."
msgstr ""
"给​你​一条​免费​建议​：​立刻​在​这里​杀​了​我​。​给​个​痛快​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​目光​牢牢​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​等​我​从​地​上爬​起来​的​时候​，​我会​把​你​撅​成​两半​。​然后​是​你​这位​女​巨魔​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3 yi1 tiao2 mian3fei4 jian4yi4：li4ke4 zai4 zhe4li3 sha1 le5 wo3。gei3 ge4 tong4kuai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mu4guang1 lao2lao2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 deng3 wo3 cong2 de5 shang4 pa2 qi3lai5 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 hui4 ba3 ni3 jue1 cheng2 liang3 ban4。ran2hou4 shi4 ni3 zhe4wei4 nu:3 ju4mo2 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"A word of advice, though: don't take too much on yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Spread the responsibility around."
msgstr ""
"不过​听​我​一句​忠告​：​不要​独揽大权​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也​让​别人​分担​一些​责任​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ting1 wo3 yi1ju4 zhong1gao4：bu4yao4 du2 lan3 dai4 quan2。\n"
"\n"
"ye3 rang4 bie2ren5 fen1dan1 yi1xie1 ze2ren4。"

msgid "A work of art and a deadly weapon. May do AP DMG on a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"兼具​艺术性​与​杀伤力​的​武器​。​在​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"jian1ju4 yi4 shu4 xing4 yu4 sha1shang1li4 de5 wu3qi4。zai4 bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"A world-wide race riot that took place in February of 2039. Thousands of innocent metahumans were attacked, beaten, and killed.\n"
"\n"
"Women and children were corralled into warehouses for \"protection,\" and then burned alive when the structures were put to the torch."
msgstr ""
"发生​在​2039​年​2​月​的​一场​世界性​种族​暴乱​。​成千上万​无辜​的​变​人类​遭到​袭击​、​殴打​和​杀害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​妇女​和​儿童​被关​在​仓库​里​进行​所谓​“​保护​”​，​然后​仓库​被​付之一炬​，​里面​的​人​被​活活​烧死​。\n"
"\n"
"fa1sheng1 zai4 2039 nian2 2 yue4 de5 yi1 chang2 shi4 jie4 xing4 zhong3zu2 bao4luan4。cheng2qian1shang4wan4 wu2gu1 de5 bian4 ren2lei4 zao1dao4 xi2ji1、ou1da3 he4 sha1hai4。\n"
"\n"
"fu4nu:3 he4 er2tong2 bei4 guan1 zai4 cang1ku4 li3 jin4xing2 suo3wei4“bao3hu4”，ran2hou4 cang1ku4 bei4 fu4zhi1yi1ju4，li3mian4 de5 ren2 bei4 huo2huo2 shao1si3。"

msgid ""
