msgid ""
"A young woman stands at the bar, smoking a cigarette. You've seen her face before - Lucky Strike, one of the mercenaries from Monika's files.\n"
"\n"
"A plume of blue-gray smoke spills from the corner of her mouth as she turns her attention to you."
