msgid ""
"APEX is a sentient AI that assimilated Monika’s personality. Because of "
"that, it cares deeply about the F-State and intends to use the dragon to "
"help stabilize it."
msgstr ""
"APEX​是​融合​了​莫妮卡​人格​的​智能​AI​。​正因如此​，​它​对​动荡​带​十分​关切​，​并​打算​利用​巨龙​来​稳定​这片​地区​。\n"
"APEX shi4 rong2he2 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 ren2ge2 de5 zhi4neng2 AI。zheng1 yin1 ru2 ci3，ta1 dui4 dong4dang4 dai4 shi2fen1 guan1qie4，bing4 da3suan4 li4yong4 ju4long2 lai2 wen3ding4 zhe4 pian1 di4qu1。"

msgid ""
"APEX is the Matrix security system that killed Monika and subsumed her "
"personality. It plans to use Feuerschwinge to enforce its political agenda."
msgstr ""
"APEX​是​杀死​莫妮卡​并​吞噬​其​人格​的​矩阵​安保​系统​。​它​计划​利用​火翼来​实施​自己​的​政治​议程​。\n"
"APEX shi4 sha1si3 Mo4ni1ka3 bing4 tun1shi4 qi2 ren2ge2 de5 ju3zhen4 an1bao3 xi4tong3。ta1 ji4hua4 li4yong4 Huo3yi4 lai2 shi2shi1 zi4ji3 de5 zheng4zhi4 yi4cheng2。"

msgid "APEX killed him for *you,* Vauclair. Not for me."
