"APEX sha1 le5 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"APEX's defences have regained control of one of the control nodes. You must "
"hack it again to allow APEX to continue freeing itself."
msgstr ""
"APEX​的​防御​系统​已​重新​控制​其中​一个​控制​节点​。​你​必须​再次​骇入​，​才能​让​APEX​继续​推进​自我​解放​进程​。\n"
"APEX de5 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 yi3 chong2xin1 kong4zhi4 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3。ni3 bi4xu1 zai4ci4 hai4 ru4，cai2neng2 rang4 APEX ji4xu4 tui1jin4 zi4wo3 jie3fang4 jin4cheng2。"

msgid ""
