msgid ""
"APEX. An artificial intelligence designed for Matrix warfare. The thought of it sends a chill down your spine.\n"
"\n"
"For years, the shadows have been ripe with rumors of true AI. Names like “Mirage” and “Psychotrope” have fueled conspiracy boards on the Shadowland BBS since 2029. Most savvy shadowrunners dismiss these stories as bunk.\n"
"\n"
"But from what Alice has told you, at least one of the stories is real. APEX is waiting for you, somewhere down in the basement of an abandoned Saeder-Krupp lab. \n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, you're going to have to wade through a lot of gang territory to get there..."
msgstr ""
"APEX​。​专​为​矩阵​战争​而​设计​的​人工智能​。​一​想到​它​，​就让​人​不寒而栗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​多年​来​，​暗影​界​一直​流传​着​有关​真正​人工智能​的​种种​传闻​。​自​2029​年​以来​，​“​Mirage​”​和​“​Psychotrope​”​等​名字​就​充斥​在​暗影​之地​论坛​上​的​阴谋论​板块​。​大多数​精明​的​暗影​狂奔​者​都​认为​这些​故事​是​无稽之谈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​从​爱丽丝​告诉​你​的​情况​来看​，​至少​其中​一个​传闻​确有其事​。​APEX​就​在​某个​赛德​-​克虏伯​废弃​实验室​的​地下​深处​，​正静待​你​的​到来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不幸​的​是​，​你​必须​穿越​各个​帮派​的​地盘​才能​抵达​那里​……\n"
"\n"
"APEX。zhuan1 wei2 ju3zhen4 zhan4zheng1 er2 she4ji4 de5 ren2gong1zhi4neng2。yi1 xiang3dao4 ta1，jiu4 rang4 ren2 bu4han2er2li4。\n"
"\n"
"duo1nian2 lai2，an4ying3 jie4 yi1zhi2 liu2chuan2 zhao2 you3guan1 zhen1zheng4 ren2gong1zhi4neng2 de5 zhong3zhong3 chuan2wen2。zi4 2029 nian2 yi3lai2，“Mirage” he4“Psychotrope” deng3 ming2zi5 jiu4 chong1chi4 zai4 an4ying3 zhi1 de5 lun4tan2 shang4 de5 yin1mou2lun4 ban3kuai4。da4duo1shu4 jing1ming2 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 dou1 ren4wei2 zhe4xie1 gu4shi4 shi4 wu2ji1zhi1tan2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 cong2 ai4li4si1 gao4su4 ni3 de5 qing2kuang4 lai2 kan4，zhi4shao3 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 chuan2wen2 que4you3qi2shi4。APEX jiu4 zai4 mou3 ge4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 fei4qi4 shi2yan4shi4 de5 di4xia4 shen1chu4，zheng1 jing4 dai1 ni3 de5 dao4lai2。\n"
