"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​愤怒​地​低声​嘶吼​着​说出​这些​话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​杀害​了​他​，​而​你​却​放​它​*​自由​*​。\n"
"\n"
"APEX。ni3 de5 xin1 meng2you3。ta1 sha1hai4 le5 wo3 di4di5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fen4nu4 de5 di1sheng1 si1hou3 zhao2 shuo1chu1 zhe4xie1 hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
