msgid ""
"ARES WHISTLE-BLOWER LEAKS CHICAGO BOMB PLANS\n"
"August 31, 2055\n"
"\n"
"A whistle-blower from Ares Macrotechnology has leaked information that the corporation is planning to bomb Chicago.\n"
"\n"
"Metahuman casualties have been deemed \"acceptable losses\" by the company's think tanks, and the government has allegedly signed off on the plan."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​工业​告密者​泄露​芝加哥​炸弹​袭击​计划​\n"
"​2055​年​8​月​31​日​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿瑞斯​宏​技术​的​一名​内部​告密者​披露​，​该​公司​正​策划​对​芝加哥​实施​炸弹​袭击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​公司​智库​将泛​人类​伤亡​视为​“​可​接受​损失​”​，​据称​政府​已​批准​该​计划​。\n"
"\n"
"a1rui4si1 gong1ye4 gao4mi4zhe3 xie4lu4 zhi1jia1ge1 zha4dan4 xi2ji1 ji4hua4 \n"
"2055 nian2 8 yue4 31 ri4 \n"
"\n"
"a1rui4si1 hong2 ji4shu4 de5 yi1 ming2 nei4bu4 gao4mi4zhe3 pi1lu4，gai1 gong1si1 zheng1 ce4hua4 dui4 zhi1jia1ge1 shi2shi1 zha4dan4 xi2ji1。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 gong1si1 zhi4ku4 jiang1 fan4 ren2lei4 shang1wang2 shi4wei2“ke3 jie1shou4 sun3shi1”，ju4cheng1 zheng4fu3 yi3 pi1zhun3 gai1 ji4hua4。"

msgid ""
"ARMAMENTS: The MKVI PROTOTYPE comes equipped with an ARES VANQUISHER VEHICULAR ROTARY CANNON to demonstrate the MKVI's actuated strength and recoil suppression capabilities.\n"
"\n"
"The model is also equipped with a GLOBAL POLYMERS MONOFILAMENT AXE. For demonstration purposes, this weapon has been designed with a heft well beyond the lifting capacity of any unaugmented metahuman. The MKVI, of course, can swing it with ease."
msgstr ""
"武器装备​：​MKVI​原型机​配备​有​阿瑞斯​“​征服者​”​车载​旋转​火炮​，​用于​展示​MKVI​的​驱动​强度​与​后坐​抑制​力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​本款​原型机​同时​配备​有​全球​高分子​单​纤维​斧​。​为​实现​演示​效果​，​此​武器​设计​重量​远超​任何​未经​强化​变​人类​的​负重​极限​。​而​MKVI​则​自然​能​轻松​挥舞​。\n"
"\n"
"wu3 qi4 zhuang1 bei4：MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 pei4bei4 you3 a1rui4si1“zheng1fu2zhe3” che1zai4 xuan2zhuan3 huo3pao4，yong4yu2 zhan3shi4 MKVI de5 qu1dong4 qiang2du4 yu4 hou4zuo4 yi4zhi4 li4。\n"
"\n"
"ben3 kuan3 yuan2 xing2 ji1 tong2shi2 pei4bei4 you3 quan2qiu2 gao1fen1zi3 dan1 xian1wei2 fu3。wei2 shi2xian4 yan3shi4 xiao4guo3，ci3 wu3qi4 she4ji4 zhong4liang4 yuan3chao1 ren4he2 wei4jing1 qiang2hua4 bian4 ren2lei4 de5 fu4zhong4 ji2xian4。er2 MKVI ze2 zi4ran2 neng2 qing1song1 hui1wu3。"

msgid ""
"AUTHORIZATION CHECK FAILED. SECURITY VIOLATION IN PROGRESS.\n"
"\n"
"TARGET ACQUIRED. LETHAL FORCE AUTHORIZED."
msgstr ""
"授权​检查​失败​。​发生​安全​违规行为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​已​锁定目标​。​授权​使用​致命​武力​。\n"
"\n"
"shou4quan2 jian3cha2 shi1bai4。fa1sheng1 an1quan2 wei2 gui1 xing2 wei2。\n"
"\n"
"yi3 suo3 ding4 mu4 biao1。shou4quan2 shi3yong4 zhi4ming4 wu3li4。"

msgid "AUTHORIZATION FAILED."
msgstr ""
"授权​失败​。\n"
"shou4quan2 shi1bai4。"

msgid "AUTO"
msgstr ""
"自动\n"
"zi4dong4"

msgid "AVAILABLE"
msgstr ""
"可用\n"
"ke3 yong4"

msgid ""
"Aaaand that should do it, chief. You're good to head on inside. The main "
"server should be just ahead."
msgstr ""
"这样​应该​就行了​，​头儿​。​你们​可以​进去​了​。​主​服务器​应该​就​在​前面​。\n"
"zhe4yang4 ying1gai1 jiu4 xing2 le5，tou2r5。ni3men5 ke3yi3 jin4qu4 le5。zhu3 fu2wu4qi4 ying1gai1 jiu4 zai4 qian2mian4。"

msgid ""
"Aah, thank you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Schrotty gratefully accepts the coffee, then snaps the lid back and inhales deeply, wiggling his mustache as he processes the scent.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yep, that's the real stuff, all right."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​谢谢​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​施罗蒂​感激​地​接过​咖啡​，​迅速​合​上​盖子​，​深深​吸​了​一口气​，​连​胡子​也​随着​他​的​动作​而​微微​抖动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​货挺正​，​没​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，xie4xie5 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 gan3ji1 de5 jie1guo4 ka1fei1，xun4su4 ge3 shang4 gai4zi5，shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3qi4，lian2 hu2zi5 ye3 sui2zhe5 ta1 de5 dong4zuo4 er2 wei1wei1 dou3dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，huo4 ting3 zheng1，mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Aah. Excellent, my brother.\n"
"\n"
"Let me see them, if you please."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​太好了​，​我​的​兄弟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​把​它们​拿给​我​看看​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，tai4hao3le5，wo3 de5 xiong1di4。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ba3 ta1men5 na2 gei3 wo3 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"Aah. Excellent, my sister.\n"
"\n"
"Let me see them, if you please."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​太好了​，​我​的​姐妹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​把​它们​拿给​我​看看​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，tai4hao3le5，wo3 de5 jie3mei4。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ba3 ta1men5 na2 gei3 wo3 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"Abandoned?! This is my territory! My *home!*\n"
"\n"
"You are an invader in my territory, $(scene.badfantasy), and you have *murdered* my peasantry!"
msgstr ""
"废弃​？​！​这​是​我​的​领地​！​我​的​家​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​闯入​我​领地​的​入侵者​，​$(scene.badfantasy)​，​而且​你​*​屠杀​*​了​我​的​臣民​！\n"
"\n"
"fei4qi4？！zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 ling3di4！wo3 de5 jia1！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 chuang3ru4 wo3 ling3di4 de5 ru4qin1zhe3，$(scene.badfantasy)，er2qie3 ni3*tu2sha1*le5 wo3 de5 chen2min2！"

msgid ""
"Ability to petrify people that he doesn’t like and then rend their flesh "
"with tooth and claw? Yeah, that bothers me, too."
msgstr ""
"石化​不​喜欢​的​人​，​再用​尖牙​利爪​撕扯​他们​的​血肉​？​嗯​，​我​也​觉得​这招​太狠​了​。\n"
"shi2hua4 bu4 xi3huan5 de5 ren2，zai4 yong4 jian1ya2 li4zhao3 si1che3 ta1men5 de5 xue4rou4？en1，wo3 ye3 jue2de5 zhe4 zhao1 tai4 hen3 le5。"

msgid "Able to equip two drones"
msgstr ""
"可​装备​两架​无人机\n"
"ke3 zhuang1bei4 liang3 jia4 wu2ren2ji1"

msgid "About love, and about life."
msgstr ""
"关于​爱​，​也​关于​生活​。\n"
"guan1yu2 ai4，ye3 guan1yu2 sheng1huo2。"

msgid "About our friends. In the sewers."
msgstr ""
"我们​在​下水道​的​那些​朋友​。\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 xia4shui3dao4 de5 na4xie1 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"About ten minutes ago. I watched them storm through the front doors of the "
"building we're going to hit."
msgstr ""
"大概​十分钟​前​。​我​看着​他们​冲进​了​目标​大楼​的​前门​。\n"
"da4gai4 shi2 fen4 zhong1 qian2。wo3 kan4 zhao2 ta1men5 chong1jin4 le5 mu4biao1 da4lou2 de5 qian2men2。"

msgid "About those spirits..."
msgstr ""
"关于​那些​精魂​……\n"
"guan1yu2 na4xie1 jing1hun2……"

msgid "About time."
msgstr ""
"总算​说​到​正题​了​。\n"
"zong3suan4 shuo1 dao4 zheng1 ti2 le5。"

msgid ""
"About two years ago, things went sour. My name was slandered, and the fickle mistress that is public perception turned against me.\n"
"\n"
"An ugly business, I assure you. Even talking about my fall from grace makes my stomach turn... the injustice of it all is almost too much to bear."
msgstr ""
"大约​两年​前​，​事情​出​了​问题​。​我​的​名声​受到​了​诽谤​，​公众​对​我​的​看法​也​让​我​倍感​压力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你​保证​，​这是​一件​丑陋​的​事情​。​甚至​说起​我​的​没落​，​我​的​胃​都​在​翻腾​……​这​一切​的​不公​几乎​让​我​无法​承受​。\n"
"\n"
"da4yue1 liang3 nian2 qian2，shi4qing5 chu1 le5 wen4ti2。wo3 de5 ming2sheng1 shou4dao4 le5 fei3bang4，gong1zhong4 dui4 wo3 de5 kan4fa3 ye3 rang4 wo3 bei4gan3 ya1li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，zhe4 shi4 yi1 jian4 chou3lou4 de5 shi4qing5。shen4zhi4 shuo1qi3 wo3 de5 mo4luo4，wo3 de5 wei4 dou1 zai4 fan1teng2……zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 bu4gong1 ji1hu1 rang4 wo3 wu2fa3 cheng2shou4。"

msgid ""
"Above all, he taught me to connect with his \"Horned God,\" and through it I learned power and arrogance. \n"
"\n"
"And it was all downhill from there."
msgstr ""
"最​重要​的​是​，​他​教会​我​与​他​的​“​角神​”​建立联系​，​我​在此期间​领悟​了​力量​与​傲慢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​从那以后​，​一切​便​每况愈下​。\n"
"\n"
"zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4，ta1 jiao1hui4 wo3 yu4 ta1 de5“jiao3 shen2” jian4 li4 lian2 xi4，wo3 zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1 ling3wu4 le5 li4liang5 yu4 ao4man4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 cong2 na4 yi3 hou4，yi1qie4 bian4 mei3kuang4yu4xia4。"

msgid ""
"Abrasive as ever.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I promise you, Eiger, I am not lying. Monika - your Monika - is a part of me. I can prove it to you, if you want."
msgstr ""
"你​说话​还是​这么​冲​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​，​我​向​你​保证​，​我​没有​说谎​。​莫妮卡​，​你们​的​莫妮卡​，​是​我​的​一部分​。​如果​你​愿意​，​我​可以​向​你​证明​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1hua4 hai2shi5 zhe4me5 chong1 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，wo3 mei2you3 shuo1huang3。Mo4ni1ka3，ni3men5 de5 Mo4ni1ka3，shi4 wo3 de5 yi1bu4fen5。ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4，wo3 ke3yi3 xiang4 ni3 zheng4ming2。"

msgid ""
"Abruptly, Winters leans forward and reaches for something off-screen. The display goes black.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, the main menu returns."
msgstr ""
"突然​，​温特斯​向前​倾身​，​伸手​去够​屏幕​外​的​东西​。​显示屏​变黑​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​你​又​回到​了​主​菜单​。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2，Wen1te4si1 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，shen1shou3 qu4 gou4 ping2mu4 wai4 de5 dong1xi1。xian3shi4ping2 bian4hei1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1。"

msgid ""
"Abruptly, the screen goes black. Alice is gone.\n"
"\n"
"The optical chip sits in its cradle, waiting for you to take it."
msgstr ""
"突然​间​，​屏幕​陷入​一片​漆黑​。​爱丽丝​的​影像​消失​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​光学​芯片​静静​躺​在​托架​上​，​等待​你​将​它​拾起​。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2 jian1，ping2mu4 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。ai4li4si1 de5 ying3xiang4 xiao1shi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"guang1xue2 xin1pian4 jing4 jing4 tang3 zai4 tuo1jia4 shang4，deng3dai4 ni3 jiang1 ta1 she4 qi3。"

msgid ""
"Abruptly, the screen goes black. The console powers down.\n"
"\n"
"The optical chip sits in its cradle, waiting for you to take it."
msgstr ""
"突然​间​，​屏幕​陷入​一片​漆黑​。​控制台​关闭​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​光学​芯片​静静​躺​在​托架​上​，​等待​你​将​它​拾起​。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2 jian1，ping2mu4 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。kong4zhi4tai2 guan1bi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"guang1xue2 xin1pian4 jing4 jing4 tang3 zai4 tuo1jia4 shang4，deng3dai4 ni3 jiang1 ta1 she4 qi3。"

msgid "Absinthe"
msgstr ""
"苦艾​酒\n"
"ku3ai4 jiu3"

msgid ""
"Absinthe is a friend, nothing more. She helps out around the shop when the fancy strikes her.\n"
"\n"
"She is nobody's assistant, and I am no one's master."
msgstr ""
"苦艾​酒​是​我​的​朋友​，​仅此而已​。​当​她​有​兴致​时​，​就​会​帮忙​打理​店铺​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​不是​任何人​的​助手​，​我​也​不是​任何人​的​主人​。\n"
"\n"
"ku3ai4 jiu3 shi4 wo3 de5 peng2you5，jin3ci3er2yi3。dang1 ta1 you3 xing4zhi4 shi2，jiu4 hui4 bang1mang2 da3li3 dian4pu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bu4shi4 ren4 he2 ren2 de5 zhu4shou3，wo3 ye3 bu4shi4 ren4 he2 ren2 de5 zhu3ren2。"

msgid ""
"Absinthe smiles up at you from the counter. The light catches her hair in "
"such a way that it looks to you like spun gold."
msgstr ""
"苦艾​酒​在​柜台​后朝​你​微笑​。​光线​照​在​她​头发​上​的​角度​，​让​你​觉得​那​头发​仿佛​是​纺织​出来​的​金线​。\n"
"ku3ai4 jiu3 zai4 gui4tai2 hou4 chao2 ni3 wei1xiao4。guang1xian4 zhao4 zai4 ta1 tou2fa5 shang4 de5 jiao3du4，rang4 ni3 jue2de5 na4 tou2fa5 fang3fu2 shi4 fang3zhi1 chu1lai2 de5 jin1 xian4。"

msgid ""
"Absinthe sorts a box of small items behind the register. She cocks her head "
"at your approach."
msgstr ""
"苦艾​酒​正在​收银机​后​整理​一盒​小​物件​。​你​走近​时​，​她​歪头​看​了​你​一眼​。\n"
"ku3ai4 jiu3 zheng4zai4 shou1yin2ji1 hou4 zheng3li3 yi1 he2 xiao3 wu4jian4。ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，ta1 wai1 tou2 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。"

msgid ""
"Absinthe turns to face you. She takes care to avoid looking you in the eye."
msgstr ""
"苦艾​酒​转过​来​看着​你​，​但​刻意​避开​了​你​的​目光​。\n"
"ku3ai4 jiu3 zhuai3 guo4 lai2 kan4 zhao2 ni3，dan4 ke4yi4 bi4kai1 le5 ni3 de5 mu4guang1。"

msgid "Absolutely, Phil! Go get that lost episode - the world owes it to you!"
msgstr ""
"绝对​的​，​菲尔​！​去​找回​那​失落​的​剧集​吧​—​—​这是​全世界​欠​你​的​！\n"
"jue2dui4 de5，fei1 er3！qu4 zhao3hui2 na4 shi1luo4 de5 ju4ji2 ba1——zhe4 shi4 quan2shi4jie4 qian4 ni3 de5！"

msgid ""
"Absolutely, sir. We've run multiple sweeps with a complete sensor package, and we brought in a mage to search for signs of astral tampering.\n"
"\n"
"It all checks out clean. You're completely safe in here."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​先生​。​我们​已​使用​全套​传感器​设备​进行​了​多次​扫描​，​并​请来​一位​法师​搜寻​星界​干预​的​迹象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切正常​。​您​在​这里​绝对​安全​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，xian1sheng5。wo3men5 yi3 shi3yong4 quan2tao4 chuan2gan3qi4 she4bei4 jin4xing2 le5 duo1ci4 sao3miao2，bing4 qing3 lai2 yi1 wei4 fa3shi1 sou1xun2 xing1 jie4 gan1yu4 de5 ji4xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 qie1 zheng1 chang2。nin2 zai4 zhe4li3 jue2dui4 an1quan2。"

msgid ""
"Absolutely. Because I'm *trustworthy.*\n"
"\n"
"Now, I'll just activate those security doors, and--"
msgstr ""
"当然​。​因为​我​很​*​可信​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​让​我​来​启动​安全门​，​然后​—​—\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。yin1wei4 wo3 hen3*ke3xin4*。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 rang4 wo3 lai2 qi3dong4 an1 quan2 men2，ran2hou4 — —"

msgid "Absolutely. I want to rub her nose in this."
msgstr ""
"当然​了​。​我要​拿​这个​让​她​好好​反省​下​自己​当初​说​的​大话​。\n"
"dang1ran2 le5。wo3 yao4 na2 zhe4ge5 rang4 ta1 hao3hao3 fan3xing3 xia4 zi4ji3 dang1chu1 shuo1 de5 dai4 hua4。"

msgid "Academic"
msgstr ""
"学术\n"
"xue2shu4"

msgid "Access Denied"
msgstr ""
"拒绝​访问\n"
"ju4jue2 fang3wen4"

msgid "Accessing prototype override."
msgstr ""
"正在​访问​原型机​超控​程序​。\n"
"zheng4zai4 fang3wen4 yuan2 xing2 ji1 chao1 kong4 cheng2xu4。"

msgid ""
"According to Müller's intel, the facility is extraordinarily well-guarded.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever this \"Bloodline\" project is, the Azzies have spared no expense to defend it."
msgstr ""
"根据​穆勒​的​情报​，​设施​的​安保​异常​森严​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​这个​“​血脉​”​项目​是​什么​，​阿兹佬​无疑​都​投入​了​重金​加以​保护​。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 mu4 lei1 de5 qing2bao4，she4shi1 de5 an1bao3 yi4chang2 sen1yan2。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 zhe4ge5“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 shi4 shen2me5，e1 zi1 lao3 wu2yi2 dou1 tou2ru4 le5 zhong4jin1 jia1yi3 bao3hu4。"

msgid ""
"According to the client, the *reason* why Knight Errant showed up was "
"because your team started slaughtering the lab staff."
msgstr ""
"按照​客户​的​说法​，​游侠​骑士​出现​的​*​原因​*​是​你​的​小队​开始​屠杀​实验室​职员​。\n"
"an4zhao4 ke4hu4 de5 shuo1fa3，you2Xia2qi2shi4 chu1xian4 de5*yuan2yin1*shi4 ni3 de5 xiao3 dui4 kai1shi3 tu2sha1 shi2yan4shi4 zhi2yuan2。"

msgid ""
"According to the computer's file system, each of the six episodes has been viewed over four hundred times in the past two years.\n"
"\n"
"The last marathon viewing was this morning."
msgstr ""
"根据​电脑​的​文件系统​记录​，​这六​集中​的​每一集​在​过去​两年​内​都​被​观看​了​超过​四百​次​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​最近​的​一次​连播​观看​，​就​发生​在​今天​早上​。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 dian4nao3 de5 wen2 jian4 xi4 tong3 ji4lu4，zhe4 liu4 ji2zhong1 de5 mei3 yi1 ji2 zai4 guo4qu4 liang3 nian2 nei4 dou1 bei4 guan1kan4 le5 chao1guo4 si4 bai3 ci4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zui4jin4 de5 yi1ci4 lian2 bo1 guan1kan4，jiu4 fa1sheng1 zai4 jin1tian1 zao3shang5。"

msgid ""
"According to the synopsis, the show ends with Titonius Rex's victory over the Jubuthon horde after he inspires a peasant revolt to defeat the invaders.\n"
"\n"
"This development was not well-received by the show's (admittedly few) fans, who complained that it came out of nowhere. In addition, many of the show's ongoing plot threads were left unresolved."
msgstr ""
"根据​剧情简介​，​这部​剧​的​结局​是​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​在​发动​农民起义​后​击败​了​入侵​的​朱布松​大军​，​从而​取得​最终​胜利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​这样​的​情节​转折​并​没有​得到​（​本​就​不算​多​的​）​剧迷​的​认可​，​他们​抱怨​这一​情节​发展​毫无​铺垫​。​此外​，​剧中​的​许多​支线​剧情​，​未​得到​任何​交代​。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 ju4 qing2 jian3 jie4，zhe4 bu4 ju4 de5 jie2ju2 shi4 Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 zai4 fa1dong4 nong2min2qi3yi4 hou4 ji1bai4 le5 ru4qin1 de5 zhu1 bu4 song1 da4jun1，cong2er2 qu3de2 zui4zhong1 sheng4li4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，zhe4yang4 de5 qing2jie2 zhuan3zhe2 bing4 mei2you3 de2dao4 （ben3 jiu4 bu4suan4 duo1 de5） ju4 mi2 de5 ren4ke3，ta1men5 bao4yuan4 zhe4 yi1 qing2jie2 fa1zhan3 hao2wu2 pu1dian4。ci3wai4，ju4 zhong4 de5 xu3duo1 zhi1xian4 ju4qing2，wei4 de2dao4 ren4he2 jiao1dai4。"

msgid ""
"According to these dissenting voices, the true danger from Chicago comes - improbably - in the form of a swarm of giant, man-eating cockroaches.\n"
"\n"
"Assuming that these reports are not a hoax, the creatures have cut a bloody swath across every town they've appeared in, and the flow of insects out of Chicago shows no sign of slowing down."
msgstr ""
"据​这些​反对​声音​称​，​芝加哥​真正​的​威胁​竟以​一群​巨型​食​人​蟑螂​的​形态​出现​—​—​这​听​起来​难以置信​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​这些​报道​并非​恶作剧​，​这些​生物​已​在​其​出没​的​每个​城镇​留下​血腥​破坏​的​痕迹​，​而​从​芝加哥​涌出​的​虫​群​似乎​毫无​减缓​迹象​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4 zhe4xie1 fan3dui4 sheng1yin1 chen4，zhi1jia1ge1 zhen1zheng4 de5 wei1xie2 jing4 yi3 yi1 qun2 ju4xing2 shi2 ren2 zhang1lang2 de5 xing2tai4 chu1xian4——zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 nan2yi3zhi4xin4。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 zhe4xie1 bao4dao4 bing4fei1 e4zuo4ju4，zhe4xie1 sheng1wu4 yi3 zai4 qi2 chu1mo4 de5 mei3ge4 cheng2zhen4 liu2xia4 xue4xing1 po4huai4 de5 hen2ji4，er2 cong2 zhi1jia1ge1 yong3chu1 de5 chong2 qun2 si4hu1 hao2wu2 jian3huan3 ji4xiang4。"

msgid ""
"According to this datapad, Humanis compounds all over Berlin have received similar shipments. They are planning to deploy the gas tomorrow morning.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He exhales sharply, then nods again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have a feeling that the Flux-State will have a thing or two to say about that."
msgstr ""
"根据​这块​数据​板​的​内容​，​柏林​各地​的​人类​至上​主义者​都​收到​了​类似​的​货物​。​他们​计划​明早​部署​毒气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​深吸​一口气​，​然后​再次​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​预感​，​动荡​带​对此​会​有话要说​。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 zhe4 kuai4 shu4ju4 ban3 de5 nei4rong2，bo2lin2 ge4di4 de5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 dou1 shou1dao4 le5 lei4si4 de5 huo4wu4。ta1men5 ji4hua4 ming2zao3 bu4shu3 du2qi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，ran2hou4 zai4ci4 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 yu4gan3，dong4dang4 dai4 dui4 ci3 hui4 you3hua4yao4shuo1。"

msgid ""
"According to what you can see, the project was successful. Using this technique, isotopes of radium-224 were magically \"stabilized\" for over a month; during this period, the isotopes did not decay and emitted no harmful radiation.\n"
"\n"
"The typical radioactive half-life of radium-224 is just over three days."
msgstr ""
"从​你​读​到​的​内容​来看​，​该​项目​取得​了​成功​。​通过​这种​技术​，​镭​-​224​的​同位素​在​超过​一个月​的​时间​内​被​神奇​地​“​稳定​”​下来​；​在此期间​，​这些​同位素​未​发生​衰变​且​未​释放​任何​有害​辐射​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​镭​-​224​的​典型​放射性​半衰期​仅略​超过​三天​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ni3 dou4 dao4 de5 nei4rong2 lai2 kan4，gai1 xiang4mu4 qu3de2 le5 cheng2gong1。tong1guo4 zhe4zhong3 ji4shu4，lei2 -224 de5 tong2wei4su4 zai4 chao1guo4 yi1 ge4 yue4 de5 shi2jian1 nei4 bei4 shen2qi2 de5“wen3ding4” xia4lai5 ； zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1，zhe4xie1 tong2wei4su4 wei4 fa1sheng1 shuai1bian4 qie3 wei4 shi4fang4 ren4he2 you3hai4 fu2she4。\n"
"\n"
"lei2 -224 de5 dian3xing2 fang4she4xing4 ban4shuai1qi1 jin3 lu:e4 chao1guo4 san1 tian1。"

