"zai4 zhan4dou4 zhong4，ming4zhong4lu:4 ti2sheng1 6 %，zeng1jia1 3 dian3 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。chi2xu4 5 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Ach, this is asinine. \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) did well in there, Eiger. You didn't see it, and I know you don't *believe* it, but $(l.he) did. So do us all a favor and shut it down, okay?"
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​你​俩​在​这互​呛​什么​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​，​$(l.name)​在​行动​中​的​表现​很​出色​。​我​知道​你​没有​亲眼见到​，​也​不​愿意​*​相信​*​，​但​事实​就是​如此​。​所以​你​就​少说两句​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，ni3 lia3 zai4 zhe4 hu4 qiang1 shen2me5 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，$(l.name) zai4 xing2dong4 zhong4 de5 biao3xian4 hen3 chu1se4。wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 mei2you3 qin1 yan3 jian4 dao4，ye3 bu4 yuan4yi4*xiang1xin4*，dan4 shi4shi2 jiu4shi4 ru2ci3。suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 shao3 shuo1 liang3 ju4，hao3 ba1？"

