msgid ""
"Actually, *I* was his undoing. Volker Stahl is no longer among the living."
msgstr ""
"其实​，​*​我​*​才​是​他​的​劫数​。​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔​已经​不再​活在​这个​世界​上​了​。\n"
"qi2shi2，*wo3*cai2 shi4 ta1 de5 jie2shu4。Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3 yi3jing1 bu4zai4 huo2 zai4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 shang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Actually, I decided it's not worth the trouble. I'm just taking the parts."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​犯不上​费​这个​劲​。​我要​直接​拿走​零件​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 fan4bu5shang4 fei4 zhe4ge5 jin4。wo3 yao4 zhi2jie1 na2zou3 ling2jian4。"

msgid "Actually, I don't have 500 nuyen."
msgstr ""
"其实​，​我​没有​500​新円​。\n"
"qi2shi2，wo3 mei2you3 500 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Actually, I think that $(l.name) might be onto something.\n"
"\n"
"Plotz had personal information on all three of us, right? We were all marked \"shoot on sight.\" But Grinder's name was conspicuously absent from that list."
msgstr ""
"其实​我​觉得​$(l.name)​可能​真说​到​点子​上​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​普​洛茨​手上​有​我们仨​的​个人信息​，​对​吧​？​我们​都​被​标注​了​“​格杀勿论​”​。​但​奇怪的是​，​“​绞肉机​”​的​名字​却​不​在​名单​上​。\n"
"\n"
"qi2shi2 wo3 jue2de5 $(l.name) ke3neng2 zhen1 shuo1 dao4 dian3zi5 shang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"Pu3luo4ci2 shou3 shang4 you3 wo3 men5 sa1 de5 ge4 ren2 xin4 xi1，dui4 ba1？wo3men5 dou1 bei4 biao1zhu4 le5“ge2sha1wu4lun4”。dan4 ji1 guai4 de5 shi4，“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 ming2zi5 que4 bu4 zai4 ming2dan1 shang4。"

msgid "Actually, I think you should give me the transmitter."
msgstr ""
"其实​，​我​觉得​你​应该​把​发射器​给​我​。\n"
"qi2shi2，wo3 jue2de5 ni3 ying1gai1 ba3 fa1she4qi4 gei3 wo3。"

msgid "Actually, I wandered in here by mistake. Sorry, I'll just be going."
msgstr ""
"其实​我​是​不​小心​走错​了​。​不好意思​，​我​这​就​离开​。\n"
"qi2shi2 wo3 shi4 bu4 xiao3xin1 zou3cuo4 le5。bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3 zhe4 jiu4 li2kai1。"

msgid "Actually, I'm curious about Altuğ."
msgstr ""
"其实​，​我​对​奥图​伊​有所​好奇​。\n"
"qi2shi2，wo3 dui4 ao4 tu2 yi1 you3suo3 hao4qi2。"

msgid ""
"Actually, I've just been messing with you, Doc. I think that your plan makes"
" sense. You should do it."
msgstr ""
"其实​我​就是​逗你玩​呢​，​博士​。​我​觉得​你​的​计划​有​道理​。​你​应该​这么​做​。\n"
"qi2shi2 wo3 jiu4shi4 dou4 ni3 wan2 ni2，bo2shi4。wo3 jue2de5 ni3 de5 ji4hua4 you3 dao4li5。ni3 ying1gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid "Actually, let's go back a second. I have some questions for you."
msgstr ""
"我们​先回到​之前​的​话题​吧​。​我​还有​一些​问题​要​问​你​。\n"
"wo3men5 xian1 hui2 dao4 zhi1qian2 de5 hua4ti2 ba1。wo3 hai2you3 yi1xie1 wen4ti2 yao4 wen4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Actually, we're here to kill Harrow. It's the only way to stop something "
"like this from happening again."
msgstr ""
"实际上​，​我们​此行​的​目的​是​除掉​哈罗​。​这是​阻止​类似​事件​再次发生​的​唯一​办法​。\n"
"shi2ji4shang4，wo3men5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4 shi4 chu2diao4 ha1luo2。zhe4 shi4 zu3zhi3 lei4si4 shi4jian4 zai4 ci4 fa1 sheng1 de5 wei2yi1 ban4fa3。"

msgid "Actually, yes. I completely agree with you."
msgstr ""
"还​真是​。​我​完全同意​你​的​说法​。\n"
"hai2 zhen1shi5。wo3 wan2 quan2 tong2 yi4 ni3 de5 shuo1fa3。"

msgid "Add Selected Runner"
msgstr ""
"添加​选中​的​狂奔​者\n"
"tian1jia1 xuan3zhong4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3"

msgid "Add the drone control box to your inventory."
msgstr ""
"将​无人机​控制箱​放入​物品​栏​。\n"
"jiang1 wu2ren2ji1 kong4 zhi4 xiang1 fang4ru4 wu4pin3 lan2。"

msgid "Additional Weapon Slot (If not yet unlocked)"
msgstr ""
"额外​武器​栏位​（​若​尚未​解锁​）\n"
"e2wai4 wu3qi4 lan2wei4 （ruo4 shang4wei4 jie3suo3）"

msgid "Adds +1 AP +1 Intelligence for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"+​1​行动​点​，​+​1​智力​，​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"+1 xing2dong4 dian3，+1 zhi4li4，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Adds +1 Movement. When triggered, you will dodge the first attack against "
"you each round. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"+​1​移动力​。​触发​时​，​每​回合​可​闪避​一次​敌人​对​你​发动​的​攻击​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"+1 yi2 dong4 li4。chu4fa1 shi2，mei3 hui2he2 ke3 shan3bi4 yi1ci4 di2ren2 dui4 ni3 fa1dong4 de5 gong1ji1。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Adds Strength and Willpower +2 but -2 Charisma and Intelligence for 5 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"药物​，​+​2​力量​，​+​2​意志​，​-​2​魅力​，​-​2​智力​，​持续​5​回合​。\n"
"yao4wu4，+2 li4liang5，+2 yi4zhi4，-2 mei4li4，-2 zhi4li4，chi2xu4 5 hui2he2。"

msgid "Adds abilities and bonuses to a Rigger's drones."
msgstr ""
"使​机师​的​无人机​获得​能力​和​加成​。\n"
"shi3 ji1shi1 de5 wu2ren2ji1 huo4de2 neng2li4 he4 jia1 cheng2。"

msgid ""
"Adds some physical protection but maximizes assistance to summoners in "
"ritual summonings. Grants +1 Charisma and +1 Spirit Control."
msgstr ""
"提供​一定​的​物理​防护​，​最大化​了​在​仪式​召唤​中​对​召唤​者​的​辅助​效果​。​提供​+​1​魅力​和​+​1​精魂​掌控​。\n"
"ti2gong1 yi1ding4 de5 wu4li3 fang2hu4，zui4da4hua4 le5 zai4 yi2shi4 zhao4huan4 zhong4 dui4 zhao4huan4 zhe3 de5 fu3zhu4 xiao4guo3。ti2gong1 +1 mei4li4 he4 +1 jing1hun2 zhang3kong4。"

msgid "Adelaide Camera"
msgstr ""
"阿德莱德​的​镜头\n"
"a1de2lai2de2 de5 jing4tou2"

msgid "Adept"
msgstr ""
"修士\n"
"xiu1shi4"

msgid "Adept ninja outfit that grants the wearer +1 Dodge."
msgstr ""
"修士​忍者​装束​，​为​穿着者​提供​+​1​闪避​。\n"
"xiu1shi4 ren3zhe3 zhuang1shu4，wei2 chuan1 zhao2 zhe3 ti2gong1 +1 shan3bi4。"

msgid "Adept's Combat Vest"
msgstr ""
"修士​的​战斗​背心\n"
"xiu1shi4 de5 zhan4dou4 bei4xin1"

msgid ""
"Adepts are magically-active characters who focus their magic internally to develop to their utmost potential - physically, mentally and spiritually. As Adepts unlock new abilities, they become honed physical machines, using their magic to enhance their close combat abilities.\n"
"\n"
"Key Attributes: Body, Strength, Willpower\n"
"Key Skill: Chi Casting"
msgstr ""
"修士​是​具有​魔力​活性​的​角色​，​可​将​魔法​能量​内化​于心​，​从而​在​身体​、​精神​和​灵魂​层面​实现​潜能​的​极致​开发​。​随着​修士​解锁​新​能力​，​其​将​逐渐​蜕变​为​历经​磨练​的​战斗​机器​，​并​可​运用​魔法​强化​近身​战斗能力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​主要​属性​：​体质​、​力量​、​意志​\n"
"​主要​技能​：​气功\n"
"\n"
"xiu1shi4 shi4 ju4you3 mo2li4 huo2xing4 de5 jue2se4，ke3 jiang1 mo2fa3 neng2liang4 nei4hua4 yu2 xin1，cong2er2 zai4 shen1ti3、jing1shen2 he4 ling2hun2 ceng2mian4 shi2xian4 qian2neng2 de5 ji2zhi4 kai1fa1。sui2zhe5 xiu1shi4 jie3suo3 xin1 neng2li4，qi2 jiang1 zhu2jian4 tui4bian4 wei2 li4jing1 mo2lian4 de5 zhan4dou4 ji1qi4，bing4 ke3 yun4yong4 mo2fa3 qiang2hua4 jin4 shen1 zhan4 dou3 neng2 li4。\n"
"\n"
"zhu3yao4 shu3xing4：ti3zhi4、li4liang5、yi4zhi4 \n"
"zhu3yao4 ji4neng2：qi4gong1"

msgid "Admin Terminal"
msgstr ""
"管理员​终端\n"
"guan3li3yuan2 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Adrenal Contractor"
msgstr ""
"肾上腺​收缩​肌\n"
"shen4shang4xian4 shou1suo1 ji1"

msgid "Adrenal Injection"
msgstr ""
"注射​肾上腺素\n"
"zhu4she4 shen4shang4xian4su4"

msgid "Adrenal Pump"
msgstr ""
"肾上腺素​泵\n"
"shen4shang4xian4su4 beng4"

msgid "Adrenal Pump: AP +1"
msgstr ""
"肾上腺素​泵​：​行动​点​+​1\n"
"shen4shang4xian4su4 beng4：xing2dong4 dian3 +1"

msgid "Adrenal Pump: AP +1, incoming DMG +2"
msgstr ""
"肾上腺素​泵​：​行动​点​+​1​，​受到​的​伤害​增加​2​点\n"
"shen4shang4xian4su4 beng4：xing2dong4 dian3 +1，shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 zeng1jia1 2 dian3"

msgid "Adrenal Revive"
msgstr ""
"肾上腺素​恢复\n"
"shen4shang4xian4su4 hui1fu4"

msgid "Adrian Vauclair"
msgstr ""
"阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔\n"
"E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3"

msgid "Advanced Drone Repair Kit"
msgstr ""
"高级​无人机​修复​套件\n"
"gao1ji2 wu2ren2ji1 xiu1fu4 tao4jian4"

msgid "Advanced Knight Errant Drone"
msgstr ""
"游侠​骑士​无人机​（​高级​）\n"
"you2Xia2qi2shi4 wu2ren2ji1 （gao1ji2）"

msgid "Advanced Medkit"
msgstr ""
"高级​急救包\n"
"gao1ji2 ji2jiu4bao1"

msgid "Advancement Confirmation"
msgstr ""
"确认​升级\n"
"que4ren4 sheng1ji2"

msgid "Adversary Cultist"
msgstr ""
"“​反叛者​”​信徒\n"
"“fan3 pan4 zhe3” xin4tu2"

msgid ""
"Affirmative. And after we take down APEX, we're going to pay a little visit "
"to Audran. We have a score to settle with him, too."
msgstr ""
"同意​。​等​我们​消灭​APEX​之后​，​就​去​找​奥​德兰​。​我们​和​他​也​有​恩怨​要​了结​。\n"
"tong2yi4。deng3 wo3men5 xiao1mie4 APEX zhi1hou4，jiu4 qu4 zhao3 Ao4de2lan2。wo3men5 he4 ta1 ye3 you3 en1yuan4 yao4 liao3jie2。"

msgid "Afraid I didn't catch your names."
msgstr ""
"我​还​没​问过​你们​的​名字​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 mei2 wen4 guo4 ni3men5 de5 ming2zi5。"

msgid "Afraid not."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​没有​。\n"
"kong3pa4 mei2you3。"

msgid ""
"Afraid not.\n"
"\n"
"If it's a Berlin thing, you might be better off talking to one of the others. They've all been here longer than I have."
msgstr ""
"我​没​听​过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​它​跟​柏林​有​关系​的话​，​你​最好​去​找​其他人​问问​。​他们​都​比​我​在​这待​得​久​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1 guo4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 gen1 bo2lin2 you3 guan1xi5 de5hua4，ni3 zui4hao3 qu4 zhao3 qi2 ta1 ren2 wen4 wen4。ta1men5 dou1 bi3 wo3 zai4 zhe4 dai1 de2 jiu3。"

msgid ""
"Afraid not. I used to know a weapons dealer out here, but he wound up dead in an alley. Two shots, back of the head... very professional.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She eyes the door.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A grenade alone won't bring this down. If we could find a propane tank, I could rig something up with that."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​。​我​以前​认识​一个​武器​贩子​，​但​他​在​一条​小巷​里​被​杀​了​。​两枪​，​后脑勺​……​非常​专业​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​打量​着​大门​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一枚​手雷​是​炸​不开​的​。​如果​我们​能​找到​一个​丙烷​罐​，​我​可以​用​它​来​制作​一枚​更大​的​炸弹​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4。wo3 yi3qian2 ren4shi5 yi1ge5 wu3qi4 fan4zi5，dan4 ta1 zai4 yi1 tiao2 xiao3xiang4 li3 bei4 sha1 le5。liang3 qiang1，hou4nao3shao2……fei1chang2 zhuan1ye4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da3liang5 zhao2 da4men2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1 mei2 shou3lei2 shi4 zha2 bu4 kai1 de5。ru2guo3 wo3men5 neng2 zhao3dao4 yi1ge5 bing3wan2 guan4，wo3 ke3yi3 yong4 ta1 lai2 zhi4zuo4 yi1 mei2 geng1 dai4 de5 zha4dan4。"

msgid "Afraid not... I haven't had the chance to go get it yet."
msgstr ""
"还​没有​……​我​目前​还​没有​机会​去​拿​它​。\n"
"hai2 mei2you3……wo3 mu4qian2 hai2 mei2you3 ji1hui4 qu4 na2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Afraid that I can't help you dig any deeper - he's an occasional client.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes a sip of scotch and chases it with a long drag on her cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Even if I knew more about Duerr, I wouldn't tell you. Shadowrunners who kiss and tell have a funny way of dying young."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​我​没法​帮​你​再​深入调查​了​—​—​他​只是​个​临时​客户​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​喝​了​一口​威士忌​，​又​深吸​了​一口​烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​即使​我​知道​更​多​关于​杜尔​的​事​，​我​也​不能​告诉​你​。​喜欢​打​啵​儿​和​告密​的​暗影​狂奔​者​通常​都​会​死​得​很早​。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 wo3 mei2fa3 bang1 ni3 zai4 shen1 ru4 diao4 cha2 le5——ta1 zhi3shi4 ge4 lin2shi2 ke4hu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 he4 le5 yi1kou3 wei1shi4ji4，you4 shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji2shi3 wo3 zhi1dao4 geng1 duo1 guan1yu2 du4 er3 de5 shi4，wo3 ye3 bu4neng2 gao4su4 ni3。xi3huan5 da3 bo1 er2 he4 gao4mi4 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 tong1chang2 dou1 hui4 si3 de2 hen3 zao3。"

msgid ""
"Afraid you're wrong about that. I was sent here to tie up loose ends... "
"namely, you."
msgstr ""
"关于​这个​，​恐怕​你​搞错​了​。​我​是​来​清理​后患​的​……​也​就是​你​。\n"
"guan1yu2 zhe4ge5，kong3pa4 ni3 gao3cuo4 le5。wo3 shi4 lai2 qing1li3 hou4 huan4 de5……ye3 jiu4shi4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"After Dieter kicked the bucket, his second in command took over. She was a "
"real piece of work... called herself \"Leoni Luster.\" She had a vicious "
"streak a mile long, and she was none too fond of me."
msgstr ""
"迪特尔​死后​，​二把手​接管​了​大权​。​她​是​个​麻烦​人物​……​自称​“​莱昂​妮​·​拉斯特​”​。​她​性格​凶狠​，​对​我​也​没什么​好感​。\n"
"di2 te4 er3 si3hou4，er4ba3shou3 jie1guan3 le5 da4quan2。ta1 shi4 ge4 ma2fan5 ren2wu4……zi4cheng1“lai2 ang2 ni1 · la1 si1 te4”。ta1 xing4ge2 xiong1hen3，dui4 wo3 ye3 mei2shen2me5 hao3gan3。"

msgid ""
"After I have fortified myself with healthful snacks, I will assemble a fellowship of stalwart peasants and elevate them to knighthood.\n"
"\n"
"In number, they will be seven. Seven Knight-Thanes of Sutterlin BioScience, questing in service of their Knight-King!"
msgstr ""
"在​我​用​健康​的​零食​充实​自己​之后​，​我​将​召集​一支​由​坚定​的​臣民​组成​的​团队​，​并​封​他们​为​骑士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总共​将​有七人​。​七位​苏​特林​生物科学​的​骑士​领主​，​为​他们​的​骑士​之王​效力​，​踏上​征途​！\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 yong4 jian4kang1 de5 ling2shi2 chong1shi2 zi4ji3 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiang1 zhao4ji2 yi1 zhi1 you2 jian1ding4 de5 chen2min2 zu3cheng2 de5 tuan2dui4，bing4 feng1 ta1men5 wei2 qi2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3gong4 jiang1 you3 qi1 ren2。qi1 wei4 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 qi2shi4 ling3zhu3，wei2 ta1men5 de5 qi2shi4 zhi1 wang2 xiao4li4，ta4shang4 zheng1tu2！"

msgid "After a brief pause, she nods."
msgstr ""
"在​短暂​停顿​后​，​她​点点头​。\n"
"zai4 duan3zan4 ting2dun4 hou4，ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。"

msgid ""
"After a few minutes of sifting through account sheets, you find what you're "
"looking for: a complete donor list for the Berlin chapter of Humanis."
msgstr ""
"翻阅​了​几分钟​账目​表后​，​你​找到​了​想要​的​东西​：​一份​完整​的​人类​至上​主义​柏林​分部​捐赠者​名单​。\n"
"fan1yue4 le5 ji1 fen4 zhong1 zhang4mu4 biao3 hou4，ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 xiang3yao4 de5 dong1xi1：yi1 fen4 wan2zheng3 de5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3yi4 bo2lin2 fen1bu4 juan1zeng4zhe3 ming2dan1。"

msgid ""
"After a few minutes of work, the transmitter is modified and installed. You "
"now have the converter, and the terminal is still working."
msgstr ""
"经过​几分钟​的​工作​，​你​改装​了​发射器​并​将​其​安装​完毕​。​你​现在​得到​了​转换器​，​且​终端​仍然​可以​正常​运行​。\n"
"jing1guo4 ji1 fen4 zhong1 de5 gong1zuo4，ni3 gai3zhuang1 le5 fa1she4qi4 bing4 jiang1 qi2 an1zhuang1 wan2bi4。ni3 xian4zai4 de2dao4 le5 zhuan3huan4qi4，qie3 zhong1duan1 reng2ran2 ke3yi3 zheng4chang2 yun4xing2。"

msgid ""
"After a few moments of sifting through cables, you find a diagnostic "
"connector with the right input to fit the little black box that Herr Schmidt"
" gave you."
msgstr ""
"在​线缆​堆里​翻找​了​几分钟​后​，​你​找到​一个​诊断​接口​，​正好​能​接入​施密特​先生​给​你​的​那个​小​黑盒​。\n"
"zai4 xian4lan3 dui1 li3 fan1 zhao3 le5 ji1 fen4 zhong1 hou4，ni3 zhao3dao4 yi1ge5 zhen3duan4 jie1kou3，zheng4hao3 neng2 jie1ru4 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 gei3 ni3 de5 na4ge5 xiao3 hei1he2。"

msgid ""
"After a few seconds of fiddling with the wires, you are rewarded with a bright flash and a wisp of oily blue smoke. The light next to the words \"LOCK STATUS :: DOOR, F\" fizzles out.\n"
"\n"
"The street-level door should be accessible now."
msgstr ""
"在​摆弄​这些​丝线​几秒钟​后​，​你​的​努力​换来​了​明亮​的​闪光​和​一缕​油腻​的​蓝烟​。​标着​“​锁定​状态​ ​:​:​ ​正门​，​F​”​的​字样​旁​的​灯​熄灭​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​街道​层​的​门​现在​应该​可以​进入​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 bai3nong4 zhe4xie1 si1xian4 ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 de5 nu3li4 huan4 lai2 le5 ming2liang4 de5 shan3guang1 he4 yi1 lu:3 you2ni4 de5 lan2 yan1。biao1 zhao2“suo3ding4 zhuang4tai4  :: zheng4men2，F” de5 zi4yang4 pang2 de5 deng1 xi1mie4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jie1dao4 ceng2 de5 men2 xian4zai4 ying1gai1 ke3yi3 jin4ru4 le5。"

msgid "After a long pause, she looks back up at him and nods."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​后​，​她​又​抬头​看向​他​，​点​了​点头​。\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3 hou4，ta1 you4 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ta1，dian3 le5 dian3tou2。"

msgid ""
"After all of the moral ambiguity that we've been wading through, hitting "
"Humanis was *incredibly* satisfying. What they had planned... it makes my "
"blood boil just thinking about it."
msgstr ""
"在​经历​了​所有​道德​困境​的​煎熬​后​，​击溃​人类​至上​主义者​简直​是​*​畅快​淋漓​*​。​他们​策划​的​阴谋​……​光是​想想​就让​我​怒火中烧​。\n"
"zai4 jing1li4 le5 suo3you3 dao4de2 kun4jing4 de5 jian1ao2 hou4，ji1kui4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 jian3zhi2 shi4*chang4kuai4 lin2li2*。ta1men5 ce4hua4 de5 yin1mou2……guang1shi4 xiang3 xiang3 jiu4 rang4 wo3 nu4 huo3 zhong4 shao1。"

msgid ""
"After all of the moral ambiguity that we've been wading through, hitting "
"Humanis was *incredibly* satisfying. What they had planned... it makes my "
"blood boil, just thinking about it."
msgstr ""
"在​经历​了​所有​道德​困境​的​煎熬​后​，​击溃​人类​至上​主义者​简直​是​*​畅快​淋漓​*​。​他们​策划​的​阴谋​……​光是​想想​就让​我​怒火中烧​。\n"
"zai4 jing1li4 le5 suo3you3 dao4de2 kun4jing4 de5 jian1ao2 hou4，ji1kui4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 jian3zhi2 shi4*chang4kuai4 lin2li2*。ta1men5 ce4hua4 de5 yin1mou2……guang1shi4 xiang3 xiang3 jiu4 rang4 wo3 nu4 huo3 zhong4 shao1。"

msgid ""
"After all, you can't learn to be free from a book. The answers won't come from a bible, an instruction manual, or a code of conduct. If you don't learn that, you'll never break your chains.\n"
"\n"
"The path to true Freedom is one that each of us must walk on his - or her - own."
msgstr ""
"毕竟​，​自由​无法​从​书本​中习​得​。​答案​不会​来自​圣经​、​指导​手册​或​行为准则​。​如果​不​明白​这​一点​，​就​永远​无法​挣脱​枷锁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​通往​真正​自由​的​道路​，​必须​由​我们​每个​人​自己​来​走​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4，zi4you2 wu2fa3 cong2 shu1ben3 zhong4 xi2 de2。da2an4 bu4hui4 lai2zi4 sheng4jing1、zhi3dao3 shou3ce4 huo4 xing2wei2zhun3ze2。ru2guo3 bu4 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3，jiu4 yong3yuan3 wu2fa3 zheng4tuo1 jia1suo3。\n"
"\n"
"tong1wang3 zhen1zheng4 zi4you2 de5 dao4lu4，bi4xu1 you2 wo3men5 mei3ge4 ren2 zi4ji3 lai2 zou3。"

msgid ""
"After all... why bother making nice with your equals when you've got an entire planet full of pawns at your disposal?\n"
"\n"
"They don't need to work together. They have us to exploit."
msgstr ""
"毕竟​……​当​你​有​一​整个​星球​的​人类​奴隶​任​你​摆布​时​，​又​何必​费心​与​你​的​同类​友好相处​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​不​需要​合作​。​他们​可以​随心所欲​地​利用​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4……dang1 ni3 you3 yi1 zheng3ge4 xing1qiu2 de5 ren2lei4 nu2li4 ren4 ni3 bai3bu4 shi2，you4 he2bi4 fei4xin1 yu4 ni3 de5 tong2lei4 you3 hao3 xiang1 chu3 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 bu4 xu1yao4 he2zuo4。ta1men5 ke3yi3 sui2xin1suo3yu4 de5 li4yong4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"After an explosion like that?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He brushes an errant flake of ash off of his shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nah, boss, not a chance. Anything we might've left behind - any blood, or skin, or hair - has been cooked right through.\n"
"\n"
"We'll be fine after we clear out of here."
msgstr ""
"在​这样​一场​爆炸​过后​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​从​肩上​拂去​一片​飘落​的​灰烬​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​肯定​不​可能​了​，​老大​。​我们​可能​留下​的​任何​痕迹​，​不管​是​血迹​、​皮肤​或​头发​，​都​被​彻底​烧焦​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​离开​这里​就​没事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4yang4 yi1 chang2 bao4zha4 guo4hou4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 jian1 shang4 fu2 qu4 yi1 pian1 piao1luo4 de5 hui1jin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ken3ding4 bu4 ke3neng2 le5，lao3da4。wo3men5 ke3neng2 liu2xia4 de5 ren4he2 hen2ji4，bu4guan3 shi4 xue4ji4、pi2fu1 huo4 tou2fa5，dou1 bei4 che4di3 shao1jiao1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3 jiu4 mei2shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"After everything went to hell, we were confronted by an ork in military-"
"grade armor."
msgstr ""
"事态​彻底​失控​后​，​我们​遭遇​了​一名​身穿​军用​级​装甲​的​兽​人​。\n"
"shi4tai4 che4di3 shi1kong4 hou4，wo3men5 zao1yu4 le5 yi1 ming2 shen1chuan1 jun1yong4 ji2 zhuang1jia3 de5 shou4 ren2。"

msgid ""
"After hearing your story, the talismonger leans back in silent "
"contemplation."
msgstr ""
"听​完​你​的​故事​后​，​奇物​商人​靠​在​椅背​上​，​陷入​沉思​。\n"
"ting1 wan2 ni3 de5 gu4shi4 hou4，ji1 wu4 shang1ren2 kao4 zai4 yi3bei4 shang4，xian4ru4 chen2si1。"

msgid ""
"After making your way across the manor grounds, you find the servants' entrance open and the immediate interior clear of any resistance. \n"
"\n"
"You find the elevator that you used during your prior escape waiting patiently for your arrival. It shudders to life now, ready to carry you down into the facility below. To the place where Monika met APEX and the world turned upside down. \n"
"\n"
"Where this whole thing began."
msgstr ""
"穿过​庄园​庭院​后​，​你​发现​仆人​入口​敞开​着​，​而​室内​区域​毫无​抵抗​迹象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​先前​逃亡​时​使用​的​电梯​仍然​在​此​静候​着​你​的​到来​。​此刻​它​颤抖​着​启动​，​准备​载​你​深入​地下​设施​。​莫妮卡​就是​在​此​遭遇​了​APEX​，​整个​世界​随即​天翻地覆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切​正是​由此​开始​。\n"
"\n"
"chuan1guo4 zhuang1yuan2 ting2yuan4 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 pu2ren2 ru4kou3 chang3kai1 zhao2，er2 shi4nei4 qu1yu4 hao2wu2 di3kang4 ji4xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 xian1qian2 tao2wang2 shi2 shi3yong4 de5 dian4ti1 reng2ran2 zai4 ci3 jing4hou4 zhao2 ni3 de5 dao4lai2。ci3ke4 ta1 chan4dou3 zhao2 qi3dong4，zhun3bei4 zai3 ni3 shen1ru4 di4xia4 she4shi1。Mo4ni1ka3 jiu4shi4 zai4 ci3 zao1yu4 le5 APEX，zheng3ge4 shi4jie4 sui2ji2 tian1fan1di4fu4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1qie4 zheng4shi4 you2ci3 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"After much internal debate, our organization has decided not to take punitive action against you or your team. We have wasted enough time and resources on you already.\n"
"\n"
"Consider yourself lucky, and enjoy your career in the shadows. We are confident that it won't last long."
msgstr ""
"经过​多次​内部​讨论​，​我们​组织​决定​不​对​你​或​你​的​团队​采取​惩罚​措施​。​我们​已经​在​你们​身上​浪费​了​足够​多​的​时间​和​资源​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​算​你​走运​，​继续​当​你​的​狂奔​者​吧​，​我们​确信​你​做​不久​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1guo4 duo1ci4 nei4bu4 tao3lun4，wo3men5 zu3zhi1 jue2ding4 bu4 dui4 ni3 huo4 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 cai3qu3 cheng2fa2 cuo4shi1。wo3men5 yi3jing1 zai4 ni3men5 shen1shang5 lang4fei4 le5 zu2gou4 duo1 de5 shi2jian1 he4 zi1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"suan4 ni3 zou3yun4，ji4xu4 dang1 ni3 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 ba1，wo3men5 que4xin4 ni3 zuo4 bu4jiu3。"

msgid ""
"After our talk, I went wading into all of the Aztechnology Matrix hubs that "
"I could find. Nothing too deep, don't worry... I didn't want to set off any "
"alarm bells. But I had a hunch that if I poked around long enough, I'd find "
"something that might lead me to Emilie."
msgstr ""
"我们​上次​聊过​之后​，​我​开始​逐一​查看​所有​能​找到​的​阿兹特​科技​矩阵​枢纽​。​别​担心​，​我​没有​深入​挖掘​……​我​可​不想​触发​任何​警报​。​但​我​的​直觉​认为​，​如果​我​继续​探索​下去​，​或许​能​找到​一些​线索​，​指引​我​找到​艾米莉​。\n"
"wo3men5 shang4ci4 liao2 guo4 zhi1hou4，wo3 kai1shi3 zhu2yi1 cha2kan4 suo3you3 neng2 zhao3dao4 de5 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 ju3zhen4 shu1niu3。bie4 dan1xin1，wo3 mei2you3 shen1ru4 wa1jue2……wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 chu4fa1 ren4he2 jing3bao4。dan4 wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 ren4wei2，ru2guo3 wo3 ji4xu4 tan4suo3 xia4qu4，huo4xu3 neng2 zhao3dao4 yi1xie1 xian4suo3，zhi3yin3 wo3 zhao3dao4 ai4 mi3 li4。"

msgid ""
"After reading the transcript, you may choose whether or not to accept the "
"job. If you respond in the affirmative, our client will be notified, and I "
"will make all necessary preparations for the run."
msgstr ""
"读完​记录​以后​，​你​可以​自己​决定​是否​接受​这份​差事​。​如果​你​选择​接受​的话​，​我们​的​客户​会​收到​通知​，​而​我会​为​行动​做好​所有​必要​准备​。\n"
"dou4 wan2 ji4lu4 yi3hou4，ni3 ke3yi3 zi4ji3 jue2ding4 shi4fou3 jie1shou4 zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 xuan3ze2 jie1shou4 de5hua4，wo3men5 de5 ke4hu4 hui4 shou1dao4 tong1zhi1，er2 wo3 hui4 wei2 xing2dong4 zuo4 hao3 suo3you3 bi4yao4 zhun3bei4。"

msgid ""
"After several minutes of needle prods, sutures, and administration of "
"unknown chemicals, your combat injuries are fully healed."
msgstr ""
"经过​几分钟​的​针刺​、​缝合​以及​注射​未知​化学物质​后​，​你​的​战斗​伤势​已​完全​愈合​。\n"
"jing1guo4 ji1 fen4 zhong1 de5 zhen1ci4、feng2he2 yi3ji2 zhu4she4 wei4zhi1 hua4 xue2 wu4 zhi4 hou4，ni3 de5 zhan4dou4 shang1shi4 yi3 wan2quan2 yu4he2。"

msgid ""
"After the drones' sudden explosion, a message appears on the drone control "
"box's screen."
msgstr ""
"无人机​突然​爆炸​后​，​无人机​控制箱​的​屏幕​上​出现​了​一条​信息​。\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 tu1ran2 bao4zha4 hou4，wu2ren2ji1 kong4 zhi4 xiang1 de5 ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 yi1 tiao2 xin4xi1。"

msgid ""
"After the things that we saw in there, I'm not surprised.\n"
"\n"
"Go ahead, $(l.name). I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"在​我们​看到​的​那些​之后​，​我​一点​都​不​惊讶​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​继续​说​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我​在​听​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3men5 kan4dao4 de5 na4xie1 zhi1hou4，wo3 yi1dian3 dou1 bu4 jing1ya4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ji4xu4 shuo1 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3 zai4 ting1。"

msgid "After tonight, I will."
msgstr ""
"过​了​今晚​之后​，​我会​这么​做​的​。\n"
"guo4 le5 jin1wan3 zhi1hou4，wo3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"After we've purified the shrine, *then* we can intervene. But if we go in there now, they're going to attack us, and we're going to have to kill them.\n"
"\n"
"That's not what I came here to do."
msgstr ""
"等​净化​神龛​之后​，​*​那时​*​我们​才能​介入​。​但​如果​我们​现在​就​进去​，​教徒​们​只会​向​我们​发起​攻击​，​而​我们​将​不得不​杀死​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​并​不是​我来​这里​的​目的​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 jing4hua4 shen2kan1 zhi1hou4，*na4shi2*wo3men5 cai2neng2 jie4ru4。dan4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 xian4zai4 jiu4 jin4qu4，jiao4tu2 men5 zhi3 hui4 xiang4 wo3men5 fa1qi3 gong1ji1，er2 wo3men5 jiang1 bu4de2bu4 sha1si3 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4shi4 wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid ""
"After we've taken down the shrine, the cultists in there will be hurt. "
"Disoriented. We can deal with them then."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​毁掉​神龛​之后​，​里面​的​教徒​们​也​会​受到冲击​，​从而​不知所措​。​我们​可以​到​那​时候​再​对付​他们​。\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 hui3diao4 shen2kan1 zhi1hou4，li3mian4 de5 jiao4tu2 men5 ye3 hui4 shou4 dao4 chong1 ji1，cong2er2 bu4zhi1suo3cuo4。wo3men5 ke3yi3 dao4 na4 shi2hou5 zai4 dui4fu5 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"After we've watched the chip, I'll take care of the body. \n"
"\n"
"I know what to do."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​看​完​芯片​之后​，​我会​处理​遗体​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​该​怎么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 kan4 wan2 xin1pian4 zhi1hou4，wo3 hui4 chu3li3 yi2ti3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"After what APEX showed us, I don't even know what we're trying to stop anymore.\n"
"\n"
"All that I see is a lot of dead bodies, with no explanation why."
msgstr ""
"在​目睹​了​APEX​给​我们​看到​的​景象​后​，​我​甚至​不​知道​我们​究竟​在​阻止​什么​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看到​的​只有​成堆​的​尸体​，​却​无人​能​解释​其中​缘由​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 mu4du3 le5 APEX gei3 wo3men5 kan4dao4 de5 jing3xiang4 hou4，wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 jiu1jing4 zai4 zu3zhi3 shen2me5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4dao4 de5 zhi3you3 cheng2 dui1 de5 shi1ti3，que4 wu2ren2 neng2 jie3shi4 qi2zhong1 yuan2you2。"

msgid ""
"After what Harrow did to you, I won't let him live. Not when we're so close "
"to killing the bastard."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​对​你​做​了​那种​事​，​我​绝不会​放​他​活命​。​尤其​是​在​我们​马上​就要​干掉​那​混蛋​的​时候​。\n"
"ha1luo2 dui4 ni3 zuo4 le5 na4zhong3 shi4，wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 fang4 ta1 huo2ming4。you2qi2 shi4 zai4 wo3men5 ma3shang4 jiu4yao4 gan4diao4 na4 hun2dan4 de5 shi2hou5。"

msgid "After what happened tonight, how can you expect me to believe that?"
msgstr ""
"在​今晚​的​事情​过后​，​你​还​指望​我能​相信​你​说​的话​吗​？\n"
"zai4 jin1wan3 de5 shi4qing5 guo4hou4，ni3 hai2 zhi3wang4 wo3 neng2 xiang1xin4 ni3 shuo1 de5hua4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"After what they did to Paul? To the Kreuzbasar? You'd just turn heel and run away?\n"
"\n"
"I can't believe that you'd do that, $(l.name). Not after what we've already been through."
msgstr ""
"他们​都​对​保罗​、​对​克洛伊​茨​集市​犯下​了​这种​十恶不赦​的​暴行​，​你​居然​还​想着​逃跑​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​相信​你​会​这么​做​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​明明​经历​了​那么​多​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 dou1 dui4 bao3luo2、dui4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 fan4 xia4 le5 zhe4zhong3 shi2e4bu4she4 de5 bao4xing2，ni3 ju1ran2 hai2 xiang3 zhao2 tao2pao3？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4，$(l.name)。wo3men5 ming2ming2 jing1li4 le5 na4me5 duo1。"

msgid ""
"After you have planted the devices and verified that they work, come back to me. There will be a brief interview - a post-mortem on the run, if you like - and, assuming that I am satisfied with what I hear, I will pay you your first stipend. Then we will discuss our future options.\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck, $(l.name). We will be watching."
msgstr ""
"在​你​完成​设备​部署​并​确认​其​正常​运作​后​，​就​回来​找​我​。​届时​将​进行​简短​面谈​—​—​不妨​称之为​行动​后​的​复盘​—​—​若​我​对​你​的​汇报​满意​，​便会​支付​首期​酬金​。​随后​我们​将​商讨​后续​合作​方案​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝你好运​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​时刻​关注​着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 wan2cheng2 she4bei4 bu4shu3 bing4 que4ren4 qi2 zheng4chang2 yun4zuo4 hou4，jiu4 hui2lai5 zhao3 wo3。jie4shi2 jiang1 jin4xing2 jian3duan3 mian4tan2——bu4fang2 cheng1zhi1wei2 xing2dong4 hou4 de5 fu4pan2——ruo4 wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 hui4bao4 man3yi4，bian4 hui4 zhi1fu4 shou3 qi1 chou2jin1。sui2hou4 wo3men5 jiang1 shang1tao3 hou4xu4 he2zuo4 fang1an4。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，$(l.name)。wo3men5 shi2ke4 guan1zhu4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"After, I think. I don't know. But don't worry... I feel fine.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, we have more pressing concerns at the moment. We need to get out of here - it's only a matter of time before this entire compound shakes itself apart."
msgstr ""
"我​想​是​之后​。​我​不​知道​。​不过​别​担心​……​我​感觉​没什么​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再说​，​我们​现在​还有​更​重要​的​事情​要​做​。​我们​得​赶紧​离开​这里​—​—​这​整座​建筑​马上​就要​分崩离析​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shi4 zhi1hou4。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。bu4guo4 bie4 dan1xin1……wo3 gan3jue2 mei2shen2me5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1，wo3men5 xian4zai4 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 zuo4。wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3——zhe4 zheng3 zuo4 jian4zhu4 ma3shang4 jiu4yao4 fen1beng1li2xi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Again, not my fault. I don't have the luxury of refusing to obey a command.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A frown crosses the Monika-image's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Is the death of Monika Schäfer coloring your judgment? If so, I am sorry."
msgstr ""
"我​再说​一次​，​这​不是​我​的​错​。​我​无权​拒绝​服从命令​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​的​死​影响​了​你​的​判断​吗​？​如果​是​这样​，​我​深表遗憾​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4shuo1 yi1ci4，zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 de5 cuo4。wo3 wu2quan2 ju4jue2 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 de5 si3 ying3xiang3 le5 ni3 de5 pan4duan4 ma5？ru2guo3 shi4 zhe4yang4，wo3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。"

msgid ""
"Again, that was Dr. Adrian Vauclair, CEO of Diehl Defense. Dr. Vauclair is the chief architect of the military's current plan to bring down the dragon Feuerschwinge.\n"
"\n"
"Stay tuned for more late-breaking news on the battle for the Harz Mountains. We'll be right back."
msgstr ""
"再次​感谢​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​，​迪尔​防务​的​首席​执行官​。​沃​克莱尔​博士​是​军方​目前​击落​巨龙​火翼​计划​的​总​设计师​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​继续​关注​更​多​关于​哈尔茨​山脉​战役​的​最新消息​。​我们​马上​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci4 gan3xie4 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4，Di2er3fang2wu4 de5 shou3xi2 zhi2 xing2 guan1。Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 shi4 jun1fang1 mu4qian2 ji1luo4 ju4long2 Huo3yi4 ji4hua4 de5 zong3 she4ji4shi1。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ji4xu4 guan1zhu4 geng1 duo1 guan1yu2 Ha1er3ci2 shan1mai4 zhan4yi4 de5 zui4 xin1 xiao1 xi1。wo3men5 ma3shang4 hui2lai5。"

msgid "Agent Provocateur"
msgstr ""
"煽动者\n"
"shan1 dong4 zhe3"

msgid ""
"Aggressive competition. It was well known that Monika favored the vendors "
"who called the Kreuzbasar home. But now, outsiders are making inroads."
msgstr ""
"恶性竞争​。​众所周知​，​莫妮卡​向来​偏爱​那些​把​克洛伊​茨​集市​当作​家园​的​商贩​。​但​如今​，​外来者​正​不断​渗透​进来​。\n"
"e4 xing4 jing4 zheng1。zhong4suo3zhou1zhi1，Mo4ni1ka3 xiang4lai2 pian1ai4 na4xie1 ba3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 dang4zuo4 jia1yuan2 de5 shang1fan4。dan4 ru2jin1，wai4 lai2 zhe3 zheng1 bu4duan4 shen4tou4 jin4lai2。"

msgid "Agitators. Targeting the younger, more brash members."
msgstr ""
"有​煽动者​，​专门​瞄准​其中​年轻气盛​的​成员​。\n"
"you3 shan1 dong4 zhe3，zhuan1men2 miao2zhun3 qi2zhong1 nian2qing1qi4sheng4 de5 cheng2yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Agonized screams pour out from under the door. Whatever the cultists are "
"doing to their captive, they're taking their time doing it."
msgstr ""
"痛苦​的​尖叫声​从​门缝​下​涌出​。​无论​那些​教徒​在​对​他们​的​俘虏​做​什么​，​大概​都​要​花​上​一阵子​。\n"
"tong4ku3 de5 jian1 jiao4 sheng1 cong2 men2 feng2 xia4 yong3chu1。wu2lun4 na4xie1 jiao4tu2 zai4 dui4 ta1men5 de5 fu2lu3 zuo4 shen2me5，da4gai4 dou1 yao4 hua1 shang4 yi1zhen4zi5。"

msgid "Agreed."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。"

msgid ""
"Agreed.\n"
"\n"
"Come on. Let's go."
msgstr ""
"同意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​快​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"tong2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 kuai4 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. 5,000 milisieverts is a lot of exposure.\n"
"\n"
"Short of basking in the glow of an unshielded reactor, I don't know how he'd have absorbed that much ionizing radiation *without* spending time in the SOX."
msgstr ""
"的确​，​5000​毫西​弗​的​辐射量​相当​大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除非​直接​暴露​在​无​防护​的​反应堆​辐射​中​，​否则​我​想不出​他​如何​能​在​不​进入​萨洛​卢区​的​情况​下​吸收​如此​大量​的​电离辐射​。\n"
"\n"
"di2que4，5000 hao2 xi1 fu2 de5 fu2 she4 liang2 xiang1dang1 dai4。\n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 zhi2jie1 bao4lu4 zai4 wu2 fang2hu4 de5 fan3ying4dui1 fu2she4 zhong4，fou3ze2 wo3 xiang3 bu4 chu1 ta1 ru2he2 neng2 zai4 bu4 jin4ru4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 xi1shou1 ru2ci3 da4liang4 de5 dian4li2fu2she4。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. APEX was already too powerful to handle. I don't think that handin' it another weapon is going to change much in the long run.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno. Maybe it'll use all of this to protect the F-State, like it said. We'll just have to wait and see."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。​APEX​本来​就​已经​强大​到​难以​驾驭​了​。​我​认为​长远​来看​，​再​给​它​武器​也​改变​不了​多少​局面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​也许​它会​像​自己​所说​的​那样​，​用​这​一切​来​守护​动荡​带​。​我们​只能​静观其变​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。APEX ben3lai2 jiu4 yi3jing1 qiang2da4 dao4 nan2yi3 jia4yu4 le5。wo3 ren4wei2 chang2yuan3 lai2 kan4，zai4 gei3 ta1 wu3qi4 ye3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 duo1shao3 ju2mian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。ye3xu3 ta1 hui4 xiang4 zi4ji3 suo3 shuo1 de5 na4yang4，yong4 zhe4 yi1qie4 lai2 shou3hu4 dong4dang4 dai4。wo3men5 zhi3neng2 jing4 guan1 qi2 bian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. But I don't think that we can beat the answer out of him, either."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。​但​我​也​不​觉得​我们​能​通过​严刑​逼供​得到​答案​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。dan4 wo3 ye3 bu4 jue2de5 wo3men5 neng2 tong1guo4 yan2xing2 bi1gong4 de2dao4 da2an4。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. But the thing I saw that was tied to your aura is as much my "
"business as it is yours. It saw me, Glory."
msgstr ""
"这​一点​我​同意​，​但​与​你​的​灵气​相连​的​那​东西​，​与​我​同样​息息相关​。​它​看见​我​了​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1dian3 wo3 tong2yi4，dan4 yu4 ni3 de5 ling2qi4 xiang1lian2 de5 na4 dong1xi1，yu4 wo3 tong2yang4 xi1xi1xiang1guan1。ta1 kan4jian4 wo3 le5，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "Agreed. Do you know who he's working for now?"
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。​你​知道​他​现在​的​雇主​是​什么​人​吗​？\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。ni3 zhi1dao4 ta1 xian4zai4 de5 gu4zhu3 shi4 shen2me5 ren2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Agreed. I still need to gear up for the assault - I'll see you at the van."
msgstr ""
"同意​。​我​还​得​去​整备​一下​，​我们​车上​见​。\n"
"tong2yi4。wo3 hai2 de2 qu4 zheng3bei4 yi1xia4，wo3men5 che1 shang4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. I think that I have this thing - whatever it is - under control, and that means that we can use it.\n"
"\n"
"Let's get moving, $(l.name). I want to put as much distance between myself and this place as possible."
msgstr ""
"同意​。​不管​这​东西​是​什么​，​我​想​我​已经​控制​住​它​了​，​这​意味着​我们​可以​利用​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​走​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我​想​尽可能​远离​这个​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"tong2yi4。bu4guan3 zhe4 dong1xi1 shi4 shen2me5，wo3 xiang3 wo3 yi3jing1 kong4zhi4 zhu4 ta1 le5，zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 ke3yi3 li4yong4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zou3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang3 jin3ke3neng2 yuan3li2 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。"

msgid "Agreed. I'll stay on top of it."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。​我会​保持​关注​的​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。wo3 hui4 bao3chi2 guan1zhu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. I've been reluctant to cart an AR along with me up until now... in my opinion, the added midrange stopping power didn't justify the trouble of carrying another big, bulky weapon into the field.\n"
"\n"
"Being a walking arsenal is fine and good, but it's also noisy and cumbersome, and those are two things that every sniper tries to avoid."
msgstr ""
"同意​。​我​一直​以来​都​不​愿意​随身携带​突击​步枪​……​在我看来​，​虽然​它​能​提供​额外​的​中距离​火力​，​但​根本​不足以​抵消​携带​一件​笨重​的​大型​武器​带来​的​负面影响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​个​移动​军火库​固然​不错​，​但​这​同样​也​意味着​额外​噪音​与​负重​，​而​这​正是​每个​狙击手​竭力​避免​的​。\n"
"\n"
"tong2yi4。wo3 yi1zhi2 yi3lai2 dou1 bu4 yuan4yi4 sui2 shen1 xie2 dai4 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1……zai4wo3kan4lai2，sui1ran2 ta1 neng2 ti2gong1 e2wai4 de5 zhong4 ju4 li2 huo3li4，dan4 gen1ben3 bu4 ju4 yi3 di3xiao1 xie2dai4 yi1 jian4 ben4zhong4 de5 da4xing2 wu3qi4 dai4lai2 de5 fu4 mian4 ying3 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ge4 yi2dong4 jun1huo3ku4 gu4ran2 bu4cuo4，dan4 zhe4 tong2yang4 ye3 yi4wei4zhe5 e2wai4 zao4yin1 yu4 fu4zhong4，er2 zhe4 zheng4shi4 mei3ge4 ju1ji1shou3 jie2li4 bi4mian3 de5。"

msgid "Agreed. Just you and me, quick and quiet."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。​就​咱们​俩​，​快去快回​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。jiu4 zan2men5 lia3，kuai4 qu4 kuai4 hui2。"

msgid "Agreed. Let's keep moving... we need to put a stop to this."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。​我们​继续前进​吧​……​必须​阻止​这​一切​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。wo3men5 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1……bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. Our \"Frau Müller\" is clearly out of her depth.\n"
"\n"
"That said, we find ourselves between a rock and a hard place. We desperately need the money she's paying for this job, and we've already committed ourselves by attacking OTK."
msgstr ""
"同意​。​我们​的​“​穆勒​女士​”​在​这件​事上​显然​考虑​不够​周到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​话虽如此​，​我们​目前​则​处在​进退两难​的​境地​。​我们​急需​她​支付​的​这笔​酬金​，​而​既然​袭击​了​OTK​，​我们​也​只能​干到底​了​。\n"
"\n"
"tong2yi4。wo3men5 de5“mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4” zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 xian3ran2 kao3lu:4 bu4gou4 zhou1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"hua4sui1ru2ci3，wo3men5 mu4qian2 ze2 chu3zai4 jin4tui4liang3nan2 de5 jing4di4。wo3men5 ji2xu1 ta1 zhi1fu4 de5 zhe4 bi3 chou2jin1，er2 ji4ran2 xi2ji1 le5 OTK，wo3men5 ye3 zhi3neng2 gan4 dao4 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. She was too dangerous to live. Better to kill her and be done with "
"it."
msgstr ""
"同意​。​她​太​危险​了​，​不能​留​后患​。​杀​了​她​就​能​了结​这​一切​。\n"
"tong2yi4。ta1 tai4 wei1xian3 le5，bu4neng2 liu2 hou4 huan4。sha1 le5 ta1 jiu4 neng2 liao3jie2 zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid "Agreed. So any suggestions as to how we should go about this?"
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。​所以​，​关于​我们​该​如何​处理​此事​，​你​有​什么​建议​吗​？\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。suo3yi3，guan1yu2 wo3men5 gai1 ru2he2 chu3li3 ci3shi4，ni3 you3 shen2me5 jian4yi4 ma5？"

msgid "Agreed. That ambush was more than a little convenient."
msgstr ""
"同意​，​刚才​的​伏击​未免太​巧合​了​。\n"
"tong2yi4，gang1cai2 de5 fu2ji1 wei4 mian3 tai4 qiao3he2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Agreed. We shut down APEX, then we re-enter the estate and rescue Vauclair. "
"He’s the key to this whole thing."
msgstr ""
"同意​。​我们​关掉​APEX​，​然后​再次​进入​那栋​庄园​救出​沃​克莱尔​。​他​是​这​整件事​的​关键​。\n"
"tong2yi4。wo3men5 guan1diao4 APEX，ran2hou4 zai4ci4 jin4ru4 na4 dong4 zhuang1yuan2 jiu4chu1 Wo4ke4lai2er3。ta1 shi4 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 de5 guan1jian4。"

msgid ""
"Ah! Very well. I will have it packaged up and delivered to Herr Amsel straight away.\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck finding your DVD reader! I wish you well."
msgstr ""
"啊​！​好​吧​。​我会​把​它​打包​好​，​马上​送到​阿姆​泽尔​先生​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝​你​找到​DVD​播放器​！​慢走​。\n"
"\n"
"a1！hao3 ba1。wo3 hui4 ba3 ta1 da3bao1 hao3，ma3shang4 song4 dao4 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 zhao3dao4 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4！man4zou3。"

msgid "Ah, Audran. Good. It's about time you showed up."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​奥​德兰​。​很​好​。​我​正​等​你​过来​呢​。\n"
"a1，Ao4de2lan2。hen3 hao3。wo3 zheng1 deng3 ni3 guo4lai2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Ah, Quorin. Of the Rabengeister. Yes, in fact I received a message from this man just a short while ago.\n"
"\n"
"If this is your wish, I will work with Samuel to coordinate a shipment of surplus rations to Gesundbrunnen."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​鸦灵​的​那位​奎林​。​是​的​，​我​确实​在​不久前​收到​了​这位​先生​的​来信​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然​这样​，​我会​和​塞缪尔​商量​，​往​健康​泉运​一批​余粮​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，Ya1ling2 de5 na4 wei4 kui2 lin2。shi4 de5，wo3 que4shi2 zai4 bu4jiu3qian2 shou1dao4 le5 zhe4wei4 xian1sheng5 de5 lai2xin4。\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 zhe4yang4，wo3 hui4 he4 sai4miu4er3 shang1liang5，wang3 jian4kang1 quan2 yun4 yi1 pi1 yu2liang2。"

msgid ""
"Ah, a fair question. Let's just say it was the best option at the time.\n"
"\n"
"At any rate, this is my home now, and I won't abandon it simply because it has grown somewhat older and poorer."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​这​是​个​好​问题​。​只能​说​我​选择​了​当下​的​最优​选项​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​现在​这​是​我​的​家​了​，​我​不能​因为​它​变得​又​旧​又​穷​就​抛弃​它​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，zhe4 shi4 ge4 hao3 wen4ti2。zhi3neng2 shuo1 wo3 xuan3ze2 le5 dang1xia4 de5 zui4you1 xuan3xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，xian4zai4 zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 jia1 le5，wo3 bu4neng2 yin1wei4 ta1 bian4de5 you4 jiu4 you4 qiong2 jiu4 pao1qi4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Ah, good choice! Style *and* safety. You have a good eye!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes your arm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here, let me show you to a dressing room..."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​真有​眼光​！​时尚​感​与​安全性​并存​。​你​太会​挑​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​拉​住​你​的​手臂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​来​，​我​带你去​更衣室​……\n"
"\n"
"a1，zhen1 you3 yan3guang1！shi2shang4 gan3 yu4 an1quan2xing4 bing4cun2。ni3 tai4 hui4 tiao1 le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 la1 zhu4 ni3 de5 shou3bi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lai2，wo3 dai4 ni3 qu4 geng1yi1shi4……"

msgid ""
"Ah, hello again, $(l.name)! And thank you once again for your assitance... the library will never be the same, thanks to you.\n"
"\n"
"What can I do for you today?"
msgstr ""
"又​见面​了​，​$(l.name)​！​再次​感谢​你​的​援助​……​多亏​了​你​，​图书馆​现在​焕然一新​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​什么​能​为​你​做​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5，$(l.name)！zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 yuan2zhu4……duo1kui1 le5 ni3，tu2shu1guan3 xian4zai4 huan4ran2yi1xin1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 shen2me5 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Ah, here we go. An old Korean player that I dug up last week. 2010 model, a real beauty. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Schrotty's smile broadens, and he gives you a conspiratorial wink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I fixed 'er up and got 'er runnin', but without any discs to read, I've mostly been usin' her as a paperweight."
msgstr ""
"啊哈​，​有​了​。​上周​刚​搞​到​的​韩国​老式​播放器​，​2010​年款​，​这​可是​真正​的​好​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​施罗蒂​笑容​更盛​，​朝​你​投来​一个​心照不宣​的​眼神​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​把​它​修好​了​，​只是​我​手头​没有​能播​的​碟​，​就​把​它​当​镇纸​用​了​。\n"
"\n"
"a1 ha1，you3 le5。shang4zhou1 gang1 gao3 dao4 de5 han2guo2 lao3shi4 bo1 fang4 qi4，2010 nian2 kuan3，zhe4 ke3shi4 zhen1zheng4 de5 hao3 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 xiao4rong2 geng1 cheng2，chao2 ni3 tou2 lai2 yi1ge5 xin1zhao4bu4xuan1 de5 yan3shen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ba3 ta1 xiu1hao3 le5，zhi3shi4 wo3 shou3tou2 mei2you3 neng2 bo1 de5 die2，jiu4 ba3 ta1 dang1 zhen4zhi3 yong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Ah, how very propitious it is that we may speak again, O Master of Mayhem!"
msgstr ""
"混乱​之主​啊​，​我们​能​再次​谈话​，​真是​天赐​的​机缘​！\n"
"hun4luan4 zhi1 zhu3 a1，wo3men5 neng2 zai4ci4 tan2hua4，zhen1shi5 tian1ci4 de5 ji1yuan2！"

msgid ""
"Ah, how very propitious it is that we may speak again, O Mistress of Mayhem!"
msgstr ""
"混乱​之主​啊​，​我们​能​再次​谈话​，​真是​天赐​的​机缘​！\n"
"hun4luan4 zhi1 zhu3 a1，wo3men5 neng2 zai4ci4 tan2hua4，zhen1shi5 tian1ci4 de5 ji1yuan2！"

msgid "Ah, pity. Well, if that ever changes, come back any time!"
msgstr ""
"啊​，​真​可惜​。​如果​你​改变​心意​的话​，​欢迎​随时​回来​！\n"
"a1，zhen1 ke3xi1。ru2guo3 ni3 gai3bian4 xin1yi4 de5hua4，huan1ying2 sui2shi2 hui2lai5！"

msgid "Ah, that is your choice. Anything else?"
msgstr ""
"你​说了算​。​还有​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1le5suan4。hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Ah, the \"because I said so\" defense. Very professional of you, Doctor."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​“​我​说​的​都​对​”​是​吧​。​你​可​真​专业​啊​，​博士​。\n"
"a1，“wo3 shuo1 de5 dou1 dui4” shi4 ba1。ni3 ke3 zhen1 zhuan1ye4 a1，bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"Ah, the impetuousness of youth.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well, young $(l.race). I will lead the discussion if you insist."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​年轻人​就是​这么​鲁莽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​年轻​的​$(l.race)​。​既然​你​如此​坚持​，​那​就​由​我​来​主导​话题​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，nian2qing1ren2 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 lu3mang3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，nian2qing1 de5 $(l.race)。ji4ran2 ni3 ru2ci3 jian1chi2，na4 jiu4 you2 wo3 lai2 zhu3dao3 hua4ti2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Ah, this? This is a floppy disk drive reader. Not for actually floppy disks "
"of course, but the three and one half inch kind, which were hard. "
"Essentially, they were the predecessors of CDs, but with a magnetic "
"rewritable disk inside of a hard case, whereas CDs merged the hard case and "
"the disk."
msgstr ""
"这个​？​这是​软盘​驱动​读取器​。​当然​不是​读取​真正​的​软盘​，​而是​读取​那种​3​.​5​英寸​的​硬质​磁盘​。​它们​本质​上​是​CD​的​前身​，​但​采用​的​是​硬质​外壳​包裹​可​重写​的​磁盘​，​而​CD​则​是​将​硬质​外壳​与​磁盘​合二为一​。\n"
"zhe4ge5？zhe4 shi4 ruan3pan2 qu1dong4 dou4 qu3 qi4。dang1ran2 bu4shi4 du2qu3 zhen1zheng4 de5 ruan3pan2，er2shi4 du2qu3 na4zhong3 3. 5 ying1cun4 de5 ying4 zhi4 ci2pan2。ta1men5 ben3zhi4 shang4 shi4 CD de5 qian2shen1，dan4 cai3yong4 de5 shi4 ying4 zhi4 wai4ke2 bao1guo3 ke3 chong2 xie3 de5 ci2pan2，er2 CD ze2 shi4 jiang1 ying4 zhi4 wai4ke2 yu4 ci2pan2 ge3 er4 wei2 yi1。"

msgid "Ah, very good. I assume you had no difficulties?"
msgstr ""
"啊​，​很​好​。​希望​你​没有​遇到困难​吧​？\n"
"a1，hen3 hao3。xi1wang4 ni3 mei2you3 yu4 dao4 kun4 nan2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Ah, yes. Here we are! \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The dwarf wrestles a mid-sized flat-screen display out of the bin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This display has old enough hookups to connect to a DVD player. RCA, you know! Vintage."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​有​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​矮人​从​垃圾箱​里​拿出​一个​中型​平面​显示器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这台​显示器​的​接口​应该​够​旧​，​可以​连接​DVD​播放器​。​美国​无线电​公司​，​你​知道​吧​！​都​是​老古董​了​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，you3 le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 cong2 la1ji1xiang1 li3 na2chu1 yi1ge5 zhong1xing2 ping2mian4 xian3shi4qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai2 xian3shi4qi4 de5 jie1kou3 ying1gai1 gou4 jiu4，ke3yi3 lian2jie1 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4。mei3guo2 wu2xian4dian4 gong1si1，ni3 zhi1dao4 ba1！dou1 shi4 lao3gu3dong3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Ah, yes. Monika.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises his bottle again, then closes his eyes and takes a long drink. \n"
"\n"
"After the moment has passed, he returns his attention to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It all comes back to our girl, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""
"啊​，​是​啊​，​莫妮卡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​又​举起​酒瓶​，​闭眼​喝​了​一大口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过​了​一会儿​，​他​才​将​注意力​转​回到​你​身上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话题​又​回到​我们​的​好​姑娘​身上​了​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"a1，shi4 a1，Mo4ni1ka3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 you4 ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2，bi4 yan3 he4 le5 yi1 dai4 kou3。\n"
"\n"
"guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 cai2 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 zhuai3 hui2dao4 ni3 shen1shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4ti2 you4 hui2dao4 wo3men5 de5 hao3 gu1niang5 shen1shang5 le5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Ah, yes. The basement.\n"
"\n"
"To reach the basement, you must use the elevator. The stairs have collapsed; there is no other way. \n"
"\n"
"When we took over from the Arbeiters, I removed the power coupling from the elevator controls. Had to keep Ullrich out of his primary armory."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​对​了​。​地下室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​到​地下室​，​你​必须​使用​电梯​。​楼梯​已经​坍塌​了​；​没有​其他​办法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我们​从​工人​帮手​中​接管​这里​时​，​我移​除了​电梯​控制​的​电源​耦合​器​。​我​不能​让​乌尔里​希​进入​他​的​主​武器库​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，dui4 le5。di4xia4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 dao4 di4xia4shi4，ni3 bi4xu1 shi3yong4 dian4ti1。lou2ti1 yi3jing1 tan1ta1 le5 ； mei2you3 qi2ta1 ban4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3men5 cong2 gong1ren2 bang1shou5 zhong4 jie1guan3 zhe4li3 shi2，wo3 yi2 chu2le5 dian4ti1 kong4zhi4 de5 dian4yuan2 ou3he2 qi4。wo3 bu4neng2 rang4 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 jin4ru4 ta1 de5 zhu3 wu3 qi4 ku4。"

msgid ""
"Ah. A pity. But it's your loss.\n"
"\n"
"Good day, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"很​可惜​。​但​这​是​你​的​损失​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 ke3xi1。dan4 zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 sun3shi1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Ah. A pity. Please hurry - I do need to get my hands on that merchandise, and sooner would be better than later.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there something else that you need?"
msgstr ""
"啊​，​真遗憾​。​请​抓紧时间​—​—​我​很​需要​这批​商品​，​而且​宜早​不宜​迟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​需要​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"a1，zhen1 yi2 han4。qing3 zhua1jin3shi2jian1——wo3 hen3 xu1yao4 zhe4 pi1 shang1pin3，er2qie3 yi2 zao3 bu4yi2 chi2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Ah. At last, our intruder arrives.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice is slow and soft, with a slight Aztlaner accent.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are a shadowrunner, here on a job. This much is obvious. So tell me... who has sent you here?"
msgstr ""
"啊​。​终于​，​我们​的​入侵者​来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​缓慢​而​轻柔​，​略微​有些​阿兹特​兰​口音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​暗影​狂奔​者​，​到​这里​来​完成​一项​差事​。​这​一点​显而易见​。​那么​告诉​我​……​是​谁​派​你​来​的​？\n"
"\n"
"a1。zhong1yu2，wo3men5 de5 ru4qin1zhe3 lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 huan3man4 er2 qing1rou2，lu:e4wei1 you3xie1 e1 zi1 te4 lan2 kou3yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，dao4 zhe4li3 lai2 wan2cheng2 yi1 xiang4 cha4shi4。zhe4 yi1dian3 xian3er2yi4jian4。na4me5 gao4su4 wo3……shi4 shei2 pai4 ni3 lai2 de5？"

msgid ""
"Ah. I see.\n"
"\n"
"Very well, young $(l.race). I will tell you what I know."
msgstr ""
"啊​。​我​明白​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​年轻​的​$(l.race)​。​我会​把​我​所​知道​的​都​告诉​你​。\n"
"\n"
"a1。wo3 ming2bai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，nian2qing1 de5 $(l.race)。wo3 hui4 ba3 wo3 suo3 zhi1dao4 de5 dou1 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Ah. I was afraid of that.\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name), it is clear to me that you haven't placed a high enough priority on retrieving my property. Evidently, you feel that your other responsibilities are more important.\n"
"\n"
"I have decided to lighten your load by withdrawing my offer. You don't need to worry about it any more."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​我​就​担心​这个​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​很​明显​你​并​没有​把​取回​我​的​财产​放在​足够​高​的​优先级​上​。​你​显然​觉得​自己​的​其他​责任​更​重要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然如此​，​我​就​帮​你​行个​方便​，​撤回​我​之前​的​提议​。​你​不必​再​操心​了​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，wo3 jiu4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，hen3 ming2xian3 ni3 bing4 mei2you3 ba3 qu3hui2 wo3 de5 cai2chan3 fang4 zai4 zu2gou4 gao1 de5 you1xian1ji2 shang4。ni3 xian3ran2 jue2de5 zi4ji3 de5 qi2ta1 ze2ren4 geng1 zhong4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 jiu4 bang1 ni3 xing2 ge4 fang1bian4，che4hui2 wo3 zhi1qian2 de5 ti2yi4。ni3 bu4bi4 zai4 cao1xin1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Ah. That is a more complicated question, albeit a loaded one.\n"
"\n"
"We stand in a country that has clung to its religious heritage with considerable zeal. In much of the developed world, the Awakening shifted public perception away from organized religion, but here in Germany it had the opposite effect."
msgstr ""
"啊​。​这个​问题​更加​复杂​，​尽管​它​也​暗藏玄机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​身处​一个​对​宗教​传统​怀有​强烈​热忱​的​国度​。​在​多数​发达国家​，​“​大​觉醒​”​事件​使​公众​认知​逐渐​远离​有​组织​的​宗教​，​但​在​德国​却​产生​了​相反​的​效果​。\n"
"\n"
"a1。zhe4ge5 wen4ti2 geng4jia1 fu4za2，jin3guan3 ta1 ye3 an4 zang4 xuan2 ji1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shen1chu3 yi1ge5 dui4 zong1jiao4 chuan2tong3 huai2you3 qiang2lie4 re4chen2 de5 guo2du4。zai4 duo1shu4 fa1da2guo2jia1，“dai4 jue2xing3” shi4jian4 shi3 gong1zhong4 ren4zhi1 zhu2jian4 yuan3li2 you3 zu3zhi1 de5 zong1jiao4，dan4 zai4 de2guo2 que4 chan3sheng1 le5 xiang1fan3 de5 xiao4guo3。"

msgid ""
"Ah. That would be difficult.\n"
"\n"
"The stairway leading down to the building's sublevels has been blocked. And the elevator has been sabotaged... it stopped working at the same time that the Arbeiters were driven from the building."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​这​可不​大​容易​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​通往​地下室​的​楼梯​已经​被​封锁​了​。​电梯​也​遭到​了​破坏​……​工人​帮​被​驱逐​出​这里​的​时候​，​电梯​就​停止​了​运转​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，zhe4 ke3bu5 dai4 rong2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"tong1wang3 di4xia4shi4 de5 lou2ti1 yi3jing1 bei4 feng1suo3 le5。dian4ti1 ye3 zao1dao4 le5 po4huai4……gong1ren2 bang1 bei4 qu1zhu2 chu1 zhe4li3 de5 shi2hou5，dian4ti1 jiu4 ting2zhi3 le5 yun4zhuan3。"

msgid ""
"Ah. That.\n"
"\n"
"Well, clearly, *something* happened when I plunged my claw into the Heart of Feuerstelle. But as to what that something was...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your guess is as good as mine."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​那个​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​明显​，​当​我​把​爪子​插进​火坑​之心​的​时候​，​发生​了​*​某种​事​*​。​但​至于​具体​是​什么​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​你​一样​都​不​清楚​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，na4ge5 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 ming2xian3，dang1 wo3 ba3 zhua3zi5 cha1jin4 huo3keng1 zhi1 xin1 de5 shi2hou5，fa1sheng1 le5*mou3zhong3 shi4*。dan4 zhi4yu2 ju4ti3 shi4 shen2me5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 ni3 yi1yang4 dou1 bu4 qing1chu5。"

msgid ""
"Ah. The intrepid $(scene.badfantasy) returns!\n"
"\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"啊​，​勇敢​的​$(scene.badfantasy)​回来​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​什么​能​为​你​效劳​的​？\n"
"\n"
"a1，yong3gan3 de5 $(scene.badfantasy) hui2lai5 le5！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 shen2me5 neng2 wei2 ni3 xiao4lao2 de5？"

msgid ""
"Ah. Well, he has a job for you... he wouldn't discuss it with me, but he "
"promised that it would prove worth your time."
msgstr ""
"事情​是​这样​，​他​有份​差事​要​交给​你​……​他​不愿​跟​我​详谈​，​但​他​保证​你​不会​白跑一趟​。\n"
"shi4qing5 shi4 zhe4yang4，ta1 you3fen4 cha4shi4 yao4 jiao1gei3 ni3……ta1 bu4yuan4 gen1 wo3 xiang2 tan2，dan4 ta1 bao3zheng4 ni3 bu4hui4 bai2pao3yi1tang4。"

msgid ""
"Ah. Well, it's... complicated.\n"
"\n"
"We stand in a country that has clung to its religious heritage with considerable zeal. In much of the developed world, the Awakening shifted public perception away from organized religion, but here in Germany it had the opposite effect."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​这个​……​说来​复杂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​身处​一个​对​宗教​传统​怀有​强烈​热忱​的​国度​。​在​多数​发达国家​，​“​大​觉醒​”​事件​使​公众​认知​逐渐​远离​有​组织​的​宗教​，​但​在​德国​却​产生​了​相反​的​效果​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，zhe4ge5……shuo1 lai2 fu4za2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shen1chu3 yi1ge5 dui4 zong1jiao4 chuan2tong3 huai2you3 qiang2lie4 re4chen2 de5 guo2du4。zai4 duo1shu4 fa1da2guo2jia1，“dai4 jue2xing3” shi4jian4 shi3 gong1zhong4 ren4zhi1 zhu2jian4 yuan3li2 you3 zu3zhi1 de5 zong1jiao4，dan4 zai4 de2guo2 que4 chan3sheng1 le5 xiang1fan3 de5 xiao4guo3。"

msgid ""
"Ah. Well.\n"
"\n"
"Don't let us get in your way."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​就​不​耽误​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jiu4 bu4 dan1wu5 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Ah. Yes. Kim.\n"
"\n"
"I didn't know that you two were acquainted."
msgstr ""
"哦​对​。​阿金​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​都​不​知道​你们​两个​认识​。\n"
"\n"
"e2 dui4。e1 jin1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 liang3 ge4 ren4shi5。"

msgid ""
"Ah... hello, human.\n"
"\n"
"As you can see, I am in the middle of a conversation with my assistant."
msgstr ""
"啊​……​你好​，​人类​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如​你​所见​，​我​正在​和​我​的​助手​说话​。\n"
"\n"
"a1……ni3hao3，ren2lei4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2 ni3 suo3jian4，wo3 zheng4zai4 he4 wo3 de5 zhu4shou3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"Ah... so you have pieces of the puzzle, but not the whole. \n"
"\n"
"Interesting. It must be vengeance, then."
msgstr ""
"啊​……​所以​你​只​看到​了​事情​的​一部分​，​而​不是​全部​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有意思​。​那​你​一定​是​来​复仇​的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"a1……suo3yi3 ni3 zhi3 kan4dao4 le5 shi4qing5 de5 yi1bu4fen5，er2 bu4shi4 quan2bu4。\n"
"\n"
"you3yi4si5。na4 ni3 yi1ding4 shi4 lai2 fu4chou2 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Ah... yes. There is that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a long pause. Finally, you hear a sigh. When Ezkibel speaks again, his voice heavy with resignation.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"唉​……​行​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​最终​，​你​听到​一声​叹息​。​埃兹​基​贝尔​再次​开口​时​，​他​的​声音​充满​了​无奈​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ai1……xing2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。zui4zhong1，ni3 ting1dao4 yi1sheng1 tan4xi1。Ai1ziji1bei4er3 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 chong1man3 le5 wu2nai4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Ahhh... Really hits the spot. Gets so muggy down here.\n"
"\n"
"See you around."
msgstr ""
"啊​啊​……​总算​清爽​了​。​这​底下​太​闷热​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​回头见​。\n"
"\n"
"a1 a1……zong3suan4 qing1shuang3 le5。zhe4 di3xia5 tai4 men1re4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid "Aim I"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​I\n"
"miao2zhun3 I"

msgid "Aim II"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​II\n"
"miao2zhun3 II"

msgid "Aim III"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​III\n"
"miao2zhun3 III"

msgid "Aim: Accuracy +12%"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​：​精准度​+​12​%\n"
"miao2zhun3：jing1 zhun3 du4 +12 %"

msgid "Aim: Accuracy +15%"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​：​精准度​+​15​%\n"
"miao2zhun3：jing1 zhun3 du4 +15 %"

msgid "Aim: Accuracy +18%"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​：​精准度​+​18​%\n"
"miao2zhun3：jing1 zhun3 du4 +18 %"

msgid "Aimed Shot"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​射击\n"
"miao2zhun3 she4ji1"

msgid "Aimed Shot: Increases To Hit by 10%, Cooldown: 3 RNDS"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​射击​：​增加​命中​几率​10​%​，​冷却​时间​：​3​回合\n"
"miao2zhun3 she4ji1：zeng1jia1 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4 10 %，leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2"

msgid "Aimed Shot: Increases To Hit by 10%, Cooldown: 3 RNDs"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​射击​：​增加​命中​几率​10​%​，​冷却​时间​：​3​回合\n"
"miao2zhun3 she4ji1：zeng1jia1 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4 10 %，leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2"

msgid "Aimed Shot: Increases To Hit by 15%, Cooldown: 3 RNDS"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​射击​：​增加​命中​几率​15​%​，​冷却​时间​：​3​回合\n"
"miao2zhun3 she4ji1：zeng1jia1 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4 15 %，leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2"

msgid "Aimed Shot: Increases To Hit by 15%, Cooldown: 3 RNDs"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​射击​：​增加​命中​几率​15​%​，​冷却​时间​：​3​回合\n"
"miao2zhun3 she4ji1：zeng1jia1 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4 15 %，leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2"

msgid ""
"Aimed Shot: Increases To Hit by 15%, pierces up to 2 Armor. Cooldown: 3 RNDs"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​射击​：​增加​命中​几率​15​%​，​最​多​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。​冷却​时间​：​3​回合\n"
"miao2zhun3 she4ji1：zeng1jia1 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4 15 %，zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2"

msgid "Aimed Throw"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​投掷\n"
"miao2zhun3 tou2zhi4"

msgid "Aimed Throw: Increases thrown blade chance to hit by 15%, Cooldown: 3"
msgstr ""
"瞄准​投掷​：​飞刀​的​命中​几率​增加​15​%​，​冷却​时间​：​3​回合\n"
"miao2zhun3 tou2zhi4：fei1dao1 de5 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4 zeng1jia1 15 %，leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2"

msgid "Ain't making any promises, but we're on the job."
msgstr ""
"我​不好​做​什么​保证​，​但​我们​正在​行动​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hao3 zuo4 shen2me5 bao3zheng4，dan4 wo3men5 zheng4zai4 xing2dong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Ain't that a pisser? I can handle all sorts of things, but betrayal always "
"makes me see red."
msgstr ""
"这种​事​最​恶心​了​。​什么​事​我​都​能​忍​，​唯独​背叛​我​可​真忍​不了​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4 zui4 e3xin1 le5。shen2me5 shi4 wo3 dou1 neng2 ren3，wei2du2 bei4pan4 wo3 ke3 zhen1 ren3 bu4le5。"

msgid "Air Barrier"
msgstr ""
"气​屏障​III\n"
"qi4 ping2zhang4 III"

msgid "Air Barrier 1"
msgstr ""
"气​屏障​I\n"
"qi4 ping2zhang4 I"

msgid "Air Barrier 2"
msgstr ""
"气​屏障​II\n"
"qi4 ping2zhang4 II"

msgid "Air Smmon"
msgstr ""
"Air​ ​Smmon\n"
"Air Smmon"

msgid "Airing this stuff out is clearly helping you to work through it."
msgstr ""
"把​这些​心里话​都​说​出口​，​明显​能​帮助​你​走​出来​。\n"
"ba3 zhe4xie1 xin1li5hua4 dou1 shuo1 chu1kou3，ming2xian3 neng2 bang1zhu4 ni3 zou3 chu1lai2。"

msgid "Alarm Activated!"
msgstr ""
"触发​警报​！\n"
"chu4fa1 jing3bao4！"

msgid ""
"Albert, I swear to God, if you're messing around out there, I'm going to shank you with a pen.\n"
"\n"
"In the kidney, Albert. That's where I'll put it. Right in the kidney."
msgstr ""
"阿尔伯特​，​我​对天发誓​，​如果​是​你​在​装神弄鬼​的话​，​可​别怪​我​拿​钢笔​扎​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​专门​扎​你​的​腰子​。​你​听到​没​，​扎​腰子​。\n"
"\n"
"a1er3bo2te4，wo3 dui4 tian1 fa1 shi4，ru2guo3 shi4 ni3 zai4 zhuang1shen2nong4gui3 de5hua4，ke3 bie4 guai4 wo3 na2 gang1bi3 zha1 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"zhuan1men2 zha1 ni3 de5 yao1zi5。ni3 ting1dao4 mei2，zha1 yao1zi5。"

msgid ""
"Albert?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Wariness creeps into the voice on the other side of the speaker.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't sound like Albert."
msgstr ""
"阿尔伯特​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​扬声器​另一头​的​声音​里​透出​几分​戒备​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听​起来​不​像是​阿尔伯特​。\n"
"\n"
"a1er3bo2te4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yang2sheng1qi4 ling4 yi1 tou2 de5 sheng1yin1 li3 tou4 chu1 ji3fen1 jie4bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1 qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 shi4 a1er3bo2te4。"

msgid "Albrecht Haushofer"
msgstr ""
"阿尔​布雷​希特​·​豪斯​霍​菲尔\n"
"e1 er3 bu4lei2 xi1 te4 · hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3"

msgid "Alert System"
msgstr ""
"警报系统\n"
"jing3 bao4 xi4 tong3"

msgid "Aleshire"
msgstr ""
"阿利​希尔\n"
"e1 li4 xi1er3"

msgid "Alexander"
msgstr ""
"亚历山大\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4"

msgid ""
"Alexander may've been young, but he wasn't a child. If he were six or seven, I might feel differently. But he was old enough to know that what he was doing was wrong, and he did it anyway.\n"
"\n"
"Actions have consequences. And that's all I have to say."
msgstr ""
"亚历山大​或许​还​年轻​，​但​他​已经​不是​小孩子​了​。​如果​他​只有​六七岁​，​那​或许​还​说得过去​，​但​他​已经​到​了​能​明辨是非​的​年纪​。​结果​呢​？​他​不​还是​这么​做​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​因果报应​。​我​要说​的​就​这些​。\n"
"\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4 huo4xu3 hai2 nian2qing1，dan4 ta1 yi3jing1 bu4shi4 xiao3hai2zi5 le5。ru2guo3 ta1 zhi3you3 liu4 qi1 sui4，na4 huo4xu3 hai2 shuo1de5guo4qu4，dan4 ta1 yi3jing1 dao4 le5 neng2 ming2bian4shi4fei1 de5 nian2ji4。jie1guo3 ni2？ta1 bu4 hai2shi5 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yin1guo3bao4ying4。wo3 yao4shuo1 de5 jiu4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid "Alexander!"
msgstr ""
"亚历山大​！\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4！"

msgid ""
"Alexander,\n"
"\n"
"You have seemed... \"less than enthusiastic\" in our education sessions. \n"
"\n"
"Please understand that we are not a shelter. We are a Factory. A Factory that refines the dross of society - people like you - into strong, pure warriors for Humanity."
msgstr ""
"亚历山大​，​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​似乎​对​我们​的​课程​……​“​不够​上​心​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​明白​，​我们​并非​收容所​。​我们​是​一座​工厂​。​我们​要​将​像​你​这样​的​社会​渣滓​淬炼​成​纯净​的​人类​战士​。\n"
"\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4，\n"
"\n"
"ni3 si4hu1 dui4 wo3men5 de5 ke4cheng2……“bu4gou4 shang4 xin1”。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ming2bai5，wo3men5 bing4fei1 shou1rong2suo3。wo3men5 shi4 yi1 zuo4 gong1chang3。wo3men5 yao4 jiang1 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 she4hui4 zha1zi3 cui4 lian4 cheng2 chun2jing4 de5 ren2lei4 zhan4shi4。"

msgid "Alice"
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝\n"
"ai4li4si1"

msgid "Alice Fund Authorization"
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​资金​授权\n"
"ai4li4si1 zi1jin1 shou4quan2"

msgid ""
"Alice said that the kill switch is located in some old S-K facility. "
"Assuming that the site was shut down sometime after the APEX project "
"\"disappeared,\" it could have stood empty for years. Maybe decades."
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​说​紧急​开关​位于​一处​老旧​的​赛德​-​克虏伯​设施​中​。​如果说​它​是​在​APEX​项目​“​消失​”​一段时间​之后​关闭​的​，​那么​它​可能​已经​空置​了​数年​，​乃至​数十年​。\n"
"ai4li4si1 shuo1 jin3ji2 kai1guan1 wei4yu2 yi1 chu3 lao3jiu4 de5 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 she4shi1 zhong4。ru2guo3shuo1 ta1 shi4 zai4 APEX xiang4mu4“xiao1shi1” yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 zhi1hou4 guan1bi4 de5，na4me5 ta1 ke3neng2 yi3jing1 kong1zhi4 le5 shu4nian2，nai3zhi4 shu3 shi2 nian2。"

msgid "Alice's Payment"
msgstr ""
"给​爱丽丝​的​报酬\n"
"gei3 ai4li4si1 de5 bao4chou5"

msgid ""
"Alice's console stands alone against the filthy wall of the U-Bahn platform."
" The colorful sprites that flicker across the screen stand in sharp contrast"
" to the surrounding grime."
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​的​控制台​孤零零​地靠​在​地铁​月台​的​肮脏​墙面​上​。​屏幕​上​闪烁着​的​彩色​位图​与​周遭​的​积垢​形成​了​鲜明​的​对比​。\n"
"ai4li4si1 de5 kong4zhi4tai2 gu1ling2ling2 de5 kao4 zai4 di4tie3 yue4tai2 de5 ang1zang1 qiang2mian4 shang4。ping2mu4 shang4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 de5 cai3se4 wei4tu2 yu4 zhou1zao1 de5 ji1gou4 xing2cheng2 le5 xian1ming2 de5 dui4bi3。"

msgid "Alice, I have a question."
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​，​我​有​个​问题​。\n"
"ai4li4si1，wo3 you3 ge4 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Alice, I have a question.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He continues without waiting for a response.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Why the hell not?"
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​，​我​有​个​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​没​等​拟​像​回应​就​继续​说​了​下去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​为什么​不​可能​？\n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1，wo3 you3 ge4 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mei2 deng3 ni3 xiang4 hui2ying4 jiu4 ji4xu4 shuo1 le5 xia4qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei4shen2me5 bu4 ke3neng2？"

msgid ""
"Alice, I have a question. Could you give me a summary of this discussion?"
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​，​我​有​个​问题​。​你​能​直接​给​我​总结​下​这份​讨论​帖​的​内容​吗​？\n"
"ai4li4si1，wo3 you3 ge4 wen4ti2。ni3 neng2 zhi2jie1 gei3 wo3 zong3jie2 xia4 zhe4 fen4 tao3lun4 tie3 de5 nei4rong2 ma5？"

msgid "Alice, I'm done."
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​，​我​读完​了​。\n"
"ai4li4si1，wo3 dou4 wan2 le5。"

msgid "Alice, tell us about APEX's kill switch."
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​，​给​我们​讲讲​APEX​的​紧急​开关​。\n"
"ai4li4si1，gei3 wo3men5 jiang3 jiang3 APEX de5 jin3ji2 kai1guan1。"

msgid ""
"Alice. Question.\n"
"\n"
"I thought they said that Lofwyr killed APEX?"
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​。​有个​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​不是​说​洛夫​维尔​除掉​了​APEX​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1。you3 ge4 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 bu4shi4 shuo1 Luo4fu1wei2er3 chu2diao4 le5 APEX ma5？"

msgid ""
"Alice... what did you see in there? *What* is going after these people?"
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​……​你​在​矩阵​里​看到​了​什么​？​*​什么​*​东西​在​追杀​这些​人​？\n"
"ai4li4si1……ni3 zai4 ju3zhen4 li3 kan4dao4 le5 shen2me5？*shen2me5*dong1xi1 zai4 zhui1sha1 zhe4xie1 ren2？"

msgid "Alice?"
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​？\n"
"ai4li4si1？"

msgid "Alice? What's goi--"
msgstr ""
"爱丽丝​？​出​了​什​—​—\n"
"ai4li4si1？chu1 le5 shen2 — —"

msgid "Aljernon"
msgstr ""
"阿尔杰​农\n"
"E1er3jie2nong2"

msgid ""
"Aljernon contemplates this wordlessly while Absinthe watches him, concerned."
msgstr ""
"阿尔杰​农​一言不发​地​沉思​着​。​苦艾​酒则​担忧​地​看着​他​。\n"
"E1er3jie2nong2 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 chen2si1 zhao2。ku3ai4 jiu3 ze2 dan1you1 de5 kan4 zhao2 ta1。"

msgid "Aljernon, what do you know about the Great Dragon Feuerschwinge?"
msgstr ""
"阿尔杰​农​，​你​对​巨龙​火翼​都​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"E1er3jie2nong2，ni3 dui4 ju4long2 Huo3yi4 dou1 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "All"
msgstr ""
"全部\n"
"quan2bu4"

msgid ""
"All I care about is getting us through this without any more casualties. "
"We've lost enough already."
msgstr ""
"我​只​关心​如何​让​我们​平安​度过​这场​危机​，​不再​出现​任何​伤亡​。​我们​已经​失去​了​太​多​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3 guan1xin1 ru2he2 rang4 wo3men5 ping2an1 du4guo4 zhe4 chang2 wei1ji1，bu4zai4 chu1xian4 ren4he2 shang1wang2。wo3men5 yi3jing1 shi1qu4 le5 tai4 duo1。"

msgid ""
"All I'm saying is that I got the call. I haven't decided what to do about it"
" yet."
msgstr ""
"我​只能​说​，​我接​了​这么​一​通电话​。​我​还​没​决定​好​怎么​做​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3neng2 shuo1，wo3 jie1 le5 zhe4me5 yi1 tong1dian4hua4。wo3 hai2 mei2 jue2ding4 hao3 zen3me5 zuo4。"

msgid "All a part of the job."
msgstr ""
"不过​都​是​工作​的​一部分​而已​。\n"
"bu4guo4 dou1 shi4 gong1zuo4 de5 yi1bu4fen5 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"All at once, something changes in Silke's face.\n"
"\n"
"She averts her gaze and pauses for a long moment. Her sweaty hands clench and unclench.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, she clears her throat and looks back up at you."
msgstr ""
"西​尔克​霎时间​变​了​脸色​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​移开​视线​，​沉默​了​好​一会儿​，​满是​汗水​的​手​握紧​又​松开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​她​清​清嗓子​，​重新​看向​你​。\n"
"\n"
"Xi1er3ke4 sha4shi2jian1 bian4 le5 lian3se4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi2kai1 shi4xian4，chen2mo4 le5 hao3 yi1hui4r5，man3 shi4 han4shui3 de5 shou3 wo4 jin3 you4 song1kai1。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 qing1 qing1sang3zi5，chong2xin1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"All at once, the monotony is broken. Your PDA is buzzing.\n"
"\n"
"A quick glance at the screen tells you that you're receiving a call, and that Paul Amsel is on the other end."
msgstr ""
"突然​间​，​沉闷​的​寂静​被​打破​了​。​你​的​PDA​发出​蜂​鸣声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​迅速​瞥​了​一眼​屏幕​。​来电显示​表明​对方​正是​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2 jian1，chen2men4 de5 ji4jing4 bei4 da3po4 le5。ni3 de5 PDA fa1chu1 feng1 ming2 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xun4su4 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 ping2mu4。lai2dian4xian3shi4 biao3ming2 dui4fang1 zheng4shi4 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3。"

msgid "All done, $(l.name). Like I said - you lead, I follow."
msgstr ""
"你​放心​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​就​像​我​说​的​—​—​你​来​指挥​，​我来​执行​。\n"
"ni3 fang4xin1 ba1，$(l.name)。jiu4 xiang4 wo3 shuo1 de5——ni3 lai2 zhi3hui1，wo3 lai2 zhi2xing2。"

msgid ""
"All done. We’re good, $(l.name). Tight.\n"
"\n"
"Anyone else tries that crap on you, I’ll put his head out from five klicks away. "
msgstr ""
"当然​。​咱们​现在​是​掏​心掏​肺​的​朋友​，​$(l.name)​。​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​再有​其他人​敢​对​你​来​这套​，​我会​在​五公里​外​把​他​的​脑袋​扯下来​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。zan2men5 xian4zai4 shi4 tao1 xin1 tao1 fei4 de5 peng2you5，$(l.name)。zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 zai4 you3 qi2 ta1 ren2 gan3 dui4 ni3 lai2 zhe4 tao4，wo3 hui4 zai4 wu3 gong1 li3 wai4 ba3 ta1 de5 nao3dai5 che3 xia4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"All except for Saeder-Krupp. The Flux opened the door for outsiders to take "
"a piece of Lofwyr's pie. (h)"
msgstr ""
"赛德​-​克虏伯​除外​。​动荡​带为​外来者​打开​了​大门​，​让​他们​从​洛夫​维尔​的​盘中​分羹​。\n"
"Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 chu2wai4。dong4dang4 dai4 wei2 wai4 lai2 zhe3 da3kai1 le5 da4men2，rang4 ta1men5 cong2 Luo4fu1wei2er3 de5 pan2 zhong4 fen4 geng1。"

msgid ""
"All fixed up! Everybody wins. You got your terminal, and I've got my parts!"
msgstr ""
"全部​搞定​！​这是​双赢​。​终端​归​你​，​零件​归​我​！\n"
"quan2bu4 gao3ding4！zhe4 shi4 shuang1ying2。zhong1duan1 gui1 ni3，ling2jian4 gui1 wo3！"

msgid ""
"All for what, Vauclair? Tell me what's going to happen tonight. You owe "
"Hermie that much."
msgstr ""
"为了​什么​，​沃​克莱尔​？​告诉​我​今晚​会​发生​什么​。​这​是​你​欠​赫米​的​。\n"
"wei4le5 shen2me5，Wo4ke4lai2er3？gao4su4 wo3 jin1wan3 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。zhe4 shi4 ni3 qian4 he4 mi3 de5。"

msgid ""
"All four turrets are back under my control! Go to town, chief, I've got you "
"covered."
msgstr ""
"四座​炮塔​全数​重归​我​的​掌控​！​放手​干​吧​，​头儿​……​我来​掩护​你​。\n"
"si4 zuo4 pao4ta3 quan2shu4 chong2 gui1 wo3 de5 zhang3kong4！fang4shou3 gan4 ba1，tou2r5……wo3 lai2 yan3hu4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"All in all, it's probably better that things turned out the way they did.\n"
"\n"
"That's what I keep telling myself, anyway."
msgstr ""
"总而言之​，​事情​最终​这样​发展​或许​更好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​我​一直​是​这样​告诉​自己​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，shi4qing5 zui4zhong1 zhe4yang4 fa1zhan3 huo4xu3 geng1 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 wo3 yi1zhi2 shi4 zhe4yang4 gao4su4 zi4ji3 de5。"

msgid ""
"All it takes is a few keystrokes to disengage the quarantine.\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, Philip isn't particularly well-versed in basic building systems operations."
msgstr ""
"只​需要​敲​几下​键盘​就​能​解除​隔离​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​显然​，​菲利普​对​基本​的​建筑​系统​操作​并​不​精通​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 xu1yao4 qiao1 ji1 xia4 jian4pan2 jiu4 neng2 jie3chu2 ge2li2。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，fei1li4pu3 dui4 ji1ben3 de5 jian4zhu4 xi4tong3 cao1zuo4 bing4 bu4 jing1tong1。"

msgid ""
"All of these symptoms point to one thing: something drove this ganger into a homicidal fury, and that fury didn't die out until he did.\n"
"\n"
"You've heard of pharmaceuticals that can cause this sort of reaction - PCP, datura, substituted cathinones - but without a lab test, there's no way to say for sure what drove him to this."
msgstr ""
"所有​这些​症状​都​指向​一个​结论​：​某种​因素​驱使​这个​帮派​成员​陷入​了​狂怒​杀意​，​直到​他​死亡​才​平息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听说​过​某些​药物​可能​会​引发​此类​反应​，​如​PCP​、​曼陀罗​、​替换​型​卡西​酮​，​但​没有​实验室​检测​，​就​无法​确定​究竟​是​什么​因素​导致​了​他​这种​行为​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 zhe4xie1 zheng4zhuang4 dou1 zhi3xiang4 yi1ge5 jie2lun4：mou3zhong3 yin1su4 qu1shi3 zhe4ge5 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 xian4ru4 le5 kuang2nu4 sha1 yi4，zhi2dao4 ta1 si3wang2 cai2 ping2xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 mou3xie1 yao4wu4 ke3neng2 hui4 yin3fa1 ci3lei4 fan3ying4，ru2 PCP、man4tuo2luo2、ti4huan4 xing2 ka3 xi1 tong2，dan4 mei2you3 shi2yan4shi4 jian3ce4，jiu4 wu2fa3 que4ding4 jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5 yin1su4 dao3zhi4 le5 ta1 zhe4zhong3 xing2wei2。"

msgid ""
"All of this makes me feel extremely uneasy, $(l.name). Doom is dangerous enough on its own.\n"
"\n"
"I don't like the idea of Vauclair tinkering with it."
msgstr ""
"这​一切​让​我​感到​极其​不安​，​$(l.name)​。​“​末日​”​本身​已经​足够​危险​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不敢​想象​让​沃​克莱尔​来​研究​它会​发生​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 ji2qi2 bu4an1，$(l.name)。“mo4ri4” ben3shen1 yi3jing1 zu2gou4 wei1xian3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 gan3 xiang3xiang4 rang4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 lai2 yan2jiu1 ta1 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。"

msgid "All of you, shut up. You're distracting me."
msgstr ""
"你们​都​给​我​闭嘴​。​别​让​我​分心​。\n"
"ni3men5 dou1 gei3 wo3 bi4zui3。bie4 rang4 wo3 fen1xin1。"

msgid "All of you? What, were you, like, walking single file along the curb?"
msgstr ""
"你们​所有人​都​是​吗​？​怎么​，​你们​是​排成​一队​沿着​路边​走​的​吗​？\n"
"ni3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 shi4 ma5？zen3me5，ni3men5 shi4 pai2 cheng2 yi1 dui4 yan2zhe5 lu4bian1 zou3 de5 ma5？"

msgid "All right then, go ahead. Tell me what *you* think is happening."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​继续​说​。​告诉​我​*​你​*​是​怎么​想​的​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ji4xu4 shuo1。gao4su4 wo3*ni3*shi4 zen3me5 xiang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right! Thanks, chief! And yeah, you're right... I do.\n"
"\n"
"Now, if you'll excuse me, I've got some last-minute stuff to take care of before we get started."
msgstr ""
"好​的​！​谢谢​头儿​！​而且​你​说得对​……​我​是​该​好好​反思​下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​恕​我​失陪​一下​，​在​我们​出发​之前​，​我​还​有些​最后​的​准备​工作​要​处理​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5！xie4xie5 tou2r5！er2qie3 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4……wo3 shi4 gai1 hao3hao3 fan3si1 xia4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2 yi1xia4，zai4 wo3men5 chu1fa1 zhi1qian2，wo3 hai2 you3xie1 zui4hou4 de5 zhun3bei4 gong1zuo4 yao4 chu3li3。"

msgid "All right, \"Monika.\" Tell us what you want."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​“​莫妮卡​”​。​告诉​我们​你​想要​什么​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，“Mo4ni1ka3”。gao4su4 wo3men5 ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"All right, \"sire.\" I'm sorry about your \"peasants,\" but I'm on an "
"important... um... \"quest.\""
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​“​陛下​”​。​我​对于​你​的​“​臣民​”​遇害​一事​表示遗憾​，​但​我​还有​个​重要​的​……​呃​……​“​任务​”​要​完成​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，“bi4xia4”。wo3 dui4yu2 ni3 de5“chen2min2” yu4hai4 yi1 shi4 biao3 shi4 yi2 han4，dan4 wo3 hai2you3 ge4 zhong4yao4 de5……e4……“ren4wu5” yao4 wan2cheng2。"

msgid ""
"All right, $(l.name). I’ve got good news for you, and I’ve got bad news.\n"
"\n"
"Let’s start with the good news. I’ve found Vauclair, and he is alive."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我​这​有​个​好消息​，​也​有​个​坏消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​先说​好消息​吧​。​我​找到​沃​克莱尔​了​，​他​还​活着​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3 zhe4 you3 ge4 hao3 xiao1 xi1，ye3 you3 ge4 huai4 xiao1 xi1。\n"
"\n"
"xian1 shuo1 hao3 xiao1 xi1 ba1。wo3 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 le5，ta1 hai2 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
"All right, $(l.name). That's the Aztechnology complex, just in front of you."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​$(l.name)​。​你​面前​的​就是​阿兹特​科技大楼​。\n"
"hao3 le5，$(l.name)。ni3 mian4qian2 de5 jiu4shi4 E1zi1te4ke1 ji4 dai4 lou2。"

msgid "All right, APEX. I'll free you in exchange for your help."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​APEX​。​我会​释放​你​，​作为​交换​，​你​必须​帮助​我​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，APEX。wo3 hui4 shi4fang4 ni3，zuo4wei2 jiao1huan4，ni3 bi4xu1 bang1zhu4 wo3。"

msgid "All right, APEX. I'll help you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​APEX​。​我会​帮​你​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，APEX。wo3 hui4 bang1 ni3。"

msgid "All right, APEX. Tell me what it is."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​APEX​。​告诉​我​是​什么​事​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，APEX。gao4su4 wo3 shi4 shen2me5 shi4。"

msgid "All right, APEX. Tell me what you need."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​APEX​。​告诉​我​你​想要​什么​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，APEX。gao4su4 wo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid "All right, APEX. What can I do to make this right?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​APEX​。​我该​怎么​挽回​这​一切​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，APEX。wo3 gai1 zen3me5 wan3hui2 zhe4 yi1qie4？"

msgid "All right, Alice. It's a deal."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​爱丽丝​。​成交​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ai4li4si1。cheng2jiao1。"

msgid "All right, Blitz, go ahead. How did it go?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​，​你​说​吧​。​事情​如何​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2，ni3 shuo1 ba1。shi4qing5 ru2he2？"

msgid "All right, Blitz, you're in. Welcome aboard."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​，​算​你​一个​。​欢迎​入队​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2，suan4 ni3 yi1ge5。huan1ying2 ru4 dui4。"

msgid "All right, Blitz. As long as you don't need my help to do it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​只要​我​不用​再​操心​就行​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。zhi3yao4 wo3 bu4yong4 zai4 cao1xin1 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid ""
"All right, Blitz. But in the future, you need to be more up-front with me "
"about things like this."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​但​以后​的话​，​像​这种​事情​你​要​对​我​直说​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。dan4 yi3hou4 de5hua4，xiang4 zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 ni3 yao4 dui4 wo3 zhi2 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"All right, Blitz. Calm down. You were right, I was wrong. Is that what you "
"wanted to hear?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​冷静​点​。​你​说得对​，​是​我​错​了​。​这​是​你​想​听​的话​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。leng3jing4 dian3。ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，shi4 wo3 cuo4 le5。zhe4 shi4 ni3 xiang3 ting1 de5hua4 ma5？"

msgid "All right, Blitz. Go ahead and do your thing... I believe in you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​你​尽管​放手去做​……​我​相信​你​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。ni3 jin3guan3 fang4 shou3 qu4 zuo4……wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3。"

msgid "All right, Blitz. Good job all around."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​布里​茨​。​你​各​方面​都​做​得​很​出色​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。Bu4li3ci2。ni3 ge4 fang1mian4 dou1 zuo4 de2 hen3 chu1se4。"

msgid "All right, Blitz. I'm satisfied. Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​我​很​满意​。​我们​能聊点​别的​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。wo3 hen3 man3yi4。wo3men5 neng2 liao2 dian3 bie2de5 ma5？"

msgid "All right, Blitz. Tell me what you've learned."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​把​你​知道​的​都​告诉​我​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。ba3 ni3 zhi1dao4 de5 dou1 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"All right, Blitz. We'll do it your way. I'll send you a comm when I get to "
"Drogenkippe."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​就​按​你​说​的​做​。​我​到​了​毒​坑区​之后​就​联系​你​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。jiu4 an4 ni3 shuo1 de5 zuo4。wo3 dao4 le5 du2 keng1 qu1 zhi1hou4 jiu4 lian2xi4 ni3。"

msgid "All right, Blitz. We'll look into it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​我们​会​去​看看​的​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。wo3men5 hui4 qu4 kan4kan5 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right, Blitz. You say it was an accident, I'll give you the benefit of "
"the doubt."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​你​说​这​是​个​意外​，​我​暂且​相信​你​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。ni3 shuo1 zhe4 shi4 ge4 yi4wai4，wo3 zan4qie3 xiang1xin4 ni3。"

msgid "All right, Blitz... the front door it is."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​布里​茨​……​就​走​前门​吧​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2……jiu4 zou3 qian2men2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"All right, Dietrich. If it's that important to you, I'll bring you along."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​迪​特里​希​。​如果​这​事​这么​重要​，​我会​带上​你​的​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，Di2te4li3xi1。ru2guo3 zhe4 shi4 zhe4me5 zhong4yao4，wo3 hui4 dai4shang4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "All right, Doc. I'm in."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​医生​。​我接​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，yi1sheng1。wo3 jie1 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right, Eiger, keep your shirt on. If it's that important to you, go take"
" care of it. The rest of the group and I can handle things on our own for a "
"run or two."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​艾格尔​，​冷静​点​。​如果​这事​真​对​你​那么​重要​，​你​就​去​办​吧​。​接下来​的​一两次​任务​，​我​和​其他人​也​能​搞定​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ai4ge2er3，leng3jing4 dian3。ru2guo3 zhe4 shi4 zhen1 dui4 ni3 na4me5 zhong4yao4，ni3 jiu4 qu4 ban4 ba1。jie1xia4lai2 de5 yi1 liang3 ci4 ren4wu5，wo3 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 ye3 neng2 gao3ding4。"

msgid ""
"All right, Eiger. But remember - we need this son of a bitch alive. No "
"torture."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​艾格尔​。​但​记住​—​—​我们​得​让​这个​王八蛋​活着​。​别下​死手​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。dan4 ji4zhu5——wo3men5 de2 rang4 zhe4ge5 wang2ba1dan4 huo2zhe5。bie4 xia4 si3 shou3。"

msgid "All right, Eiger. But this conversation isn't over."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​艾格尔​。​但​这件​事​还​没完​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。Ai4ge2er3。dan4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 hai2 mei2 wan2。"

msgid "All right, Eiger. I get the hint. I'll give you your space."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​艾格尔​。​我​明白​了​，​我会​给​你​留些​空间​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。wo3 ming2bai5 le5，wo3 hui4 gei3 ni3 liu2 xie1 kong1jian1。"

msgid ""
"All right, Eiger. I'll give you your space. But this conversation isn't "
"over."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​艾格尔​。​我会​给​你​留些​空间​。​但​这件​事​还​没完​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。Ai4ge2er3。wo3 hui4 gei3 ni3 liu2 xie1 kong1jian1。dan4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 hai2 mei2 wan2。"

msgid "All right, Eiger. I'll leave you be."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​艾格尔​。​我​就​不​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。Ai4ge2er3。wo3 jiu4 bu4 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid "All right, Eiger. You win. Let's go home."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​艾格尔​。​你​说​的​对​。​我们​回家​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。ni3 shuo1 de5 dui4。wo3men5 hui2jia1。"

msgid ""
"All right, Glory, we'll do this your way. Let's stick to the original plan: "
"we purify the spirit, rescue the cultists, and bail."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​格洛丽​，​就​按​你​的​方式​来​。​像​我们​一​开始​说好​的​，​净化​精魂​，​救出​教徒​，​然后​撤退​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。Ge2luo4li2，jiu4 an4 ni3 de5 fang1shi4 lai2。xiang4 wo3men5 yi1 kai1shi3 shuo1hao3 de5，jing4hua4 jing1hun2，jiu4chu1 jiao4tu2，ran2hou4 che4tui4。"

msgid "All right, Glory. Good hunting."
msgstr ""
"好​的​，​格洛丽​，​祝你好运​。\n"
"hao3 de5，Ge2luo4li2，zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid ""
"All right, Glory. I didn't want this, but you win.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her hands begin to glow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let me show you what our husband has taught me since you disappeared."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​格洛丽​。​我​不想​事情​变成​这个​样子​，​但​你​赢​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​双手​开始​发光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就让​你​看看​，​自打​你​消失​之后​，​我们​的​丈夫​都​教会​了​我​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 bu4xiang3 shi4qing5 bian4cheng2 zhe4ge5 yang4zi5，dan4 ni3 ying2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 kai1shi3 fa1guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 rang4 ni3 kan4kan5，zi4da3 ni3 xiao1shi1 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 de5 zhang4fu5 dou1 jiao1hui4 le5 wo3 shen2me5。"

msgid "All right, Glory. I give in. Go do your thing, whatever it is."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​格洛丽​，​我​认输​。​去​做​你​自己​的​事​吧​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ge2luo4li2，wo3 ren4shu1。qu4 zuo4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"All right, Glory. I give in. Go face Harrow on your own... but be careful."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​格洛丽​，​我​认输​。​你​自己​去​面对​哈罗​吧​……​但​一定​要​小心​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ge2luo4li2，wo3 ren4shu1。ni3 zi4ji3 qu4 mian4dui4 ha1luo2 ba1……dan4 yi1ding4 yao4 xiao3xin1。"

msgid ""
"All right, Glory. Whatever is happening to you, I'm going to trust that you "
"can handle it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​格洛丽​。​无论​你​遇到​什么​，​我​相信​你​能​处理​好​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ge2luo4li2。wu2lun4 ni3 yu4dao4 shen2me5，wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 chu3li3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"All right, I get your point!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He thrusts a small electronic device into your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take the part and get out! And don't you hurt her!"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​明白​你​的​意思​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​一个​小型​电子设备​塞进​你​手里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拿​着​零件​，​滚出去​！​别​伤害​她​！\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 de5 yi4si5 le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 yi1ge5 xiao3xing2 dian4 zi3 she4 bei4 se4 jin4 ni3 shou3li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na2 zhao2 ling2jian4，gun3 chu1 qu4！bie4 shang1hai4 ta1！"

msgid ""
"All right, I give up. If you're bound and determined to beat yourself up "
"over this, I can't help you. Just try not to let your self-pity impact your "
"performance on the job."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​我​放弃​了​。​如果​你​执意​要​为​这件​事​自责​，​那​我​也​无能为力​。​只是​尽量​别​让​自怜自艾​影响​到​你​在​差事​中​的​表现​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，wo3 fang4qi4 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 zhi2yi4 yao4 wei2 zhe4 jian4 shi4 zi4ze2，na4 wo3 ye3 wu2neng2wei2li4。zhi3shi4 jin3liang4 bie4 rang4 zi4 lian2 zi4 ai4 ying3xiang3 dao4 ni3 zai4 cha4shi4 zhong4 de5 biao3xian4。"

msgid "All right, I guess that answers that. Thank you, Aljernon."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​想​你​的​回答​很​充分​。​谢谢​，​阿尔杰​农​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 xiang3 ni3 de5 hui2da2 hen3 chong1fen4。xie4xie5，E1er3jie2nong2。"

msgid "All right, I guess that makes sense. Anything else?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​也​有​道理​。​还有​别的​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，ye3 you3 dao4li5。hai2you3 bie2de5 ma5？"

msgid "All right, I'll do it. What else do I need to know?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我会​做​的​。​还有​什么​需要​我​知道​的​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 hui4 zuo4 de5。hai2you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 wo3 zhi1dao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid "All right, I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我会​去​看看​的​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 hui4 qu4 kan4kan5 de5。"

msgid "All right, I'll see what I can find."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我会​去​看看​的​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 hui4 qu4 kan4kan5 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right, I'm gonna continue making my rounds. Oh, and Blitz... you've done"
" a great job, all around."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​我​得​去​看看​其他人​了​。​还有​，​布里​茨​……​你​各​方面​都​做​得​很​出色​。\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3 de2 qu4 kan4kan5 qi2 ta1 ren2 le5。hai2you3，Bu4li3ci2……ni3 ge4 fang1mian4 dou1 zuo4 de2 hen3 chu1se4。"

msgid ""
"All right, I'm in. When I find the dragon, I'll hand control of her off to "
"you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​加入​。​等​我​找到​巨龙​后​，​我会​把​她​的​控制权​移交​给​你​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 jia1ru4。deng3 wo3 zhao3dao4 ju4long2 hou4，wo3 hui4 ba3 ta1 de5 kong4zhi4quan2 yi2jiao1 gei3 ni3。"

msgid "All right, I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​说说看​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4。"

msgid "All right, Marta. Let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​玛​尔塔​。​我们​聊聊​别的​吧​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ma3er3ta3。wo3men5 liao2 liao2 bie2de5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"All right, Silke. I'm gonna explain how this works to you one more time. \n"
"\n"
"I get my cash, and you get your cram. \n"
"\n"
"No cash, no cram. Period."
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​西​尔克​。​我​把​这事​再​跟​你​解释​一遍​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​拿到​钱​，​你​就​能​拿到​药​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​钱​，​就​没药​。​就​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，Xi1er3ke4。wo3 ba3 zhe4 shi4 zai4 gen1 ni3 jie3shi4 yi1bian4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 na2dao4 qian2，ni3 jiu4 neng2 na2dao4 yao4。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 qian2，jiu4 mo4yao4。jiu4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"All right, Vauclair. If can't stop you, and APEX can't either, then you "
"might as well tell me what you're planning."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​沃​克莱尔​。​如果​我​和​APEX​都​无法​阻止​你​的话​，​那​你​起码​可以​把​你​的​计划​告诉​我​吗​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ru2guo3 wo3 he4 APEX dou1 wu2fa3 zu3zhi3 ni3 de5hua4，na4 ni3 qi3ma3 ke3yi3 ba3 ni3 de5 ji4hua4 gao4su4 wo3 ma5。"

msgid "All right, Vauclair. Tell me what you need me to do."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​沃​克莱尔​。​告诉​我​你​想要​什么​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Wo4ke4lai2er3。gao4su4 wo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid "All right, Yuli. It's all yours."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​尤里​。​它​归​你​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，You2li3。ta1 gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right, ace. This is going to be a fairly complicated process, so pay "
"attention."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​王牌​。​这个​过程​会​相当​复杂​，​所以​注意​听​清楚​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wang2pai2。zhe4ge5 guo4cheng2 hui4 xiang1dang1 fu4za2，suo3yi3 zhu4yi4 ting1 qing1chu5。"

msgid "All right, all right, I get the hint. We're leaving."
msgstr ""
"行行行​，​我​懂​了​。​我们​这​就​走​。\n"
"xing2 xing2 xing2，wo3 dong3 le5。wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"All right, all right, calm down. I just need to get to a terminal and drop "
"the quarantine, and then I'll copy the episode to your media center for you."
msgstr ""
"好好​好​，​冷静​点​。​我​只​需要​找​一台​终端​解除​隔离​，​然后​把​这​一集​拷贝到​你​的​媒体库​。\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3，leng3jing4 dian3。wo3 zhi3 xu1yao4 zhao3 yi1 tai2 zhong1duan1 jie3chu2 ge2li2，ran2hou4 ba3 zhe4 yi1 ji2 kao3 bei4 dao4 ni3 de5 mei2 ti3 ku4。"

msgid ""
"All right, boss. If you insist.\n"
"\n"
"The band was called \"MESSERKAMPF!\" Spelled just like it sounds, in big capital letters with an exclamation point.\n"
"\n"
"We weren't a big act or anything... we sold a few records here an' there, toured around Europe."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​老大​，​你​非要​知道​的话​我​说​就是​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​乐队​叫做​“​MESSERKAMPF​！​”​按着​读音​拼​，​全​大写​，​后面​跟着​个​感叹号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​也​不是​太火​……​有​卖​一些​唱片​，​在​欧洲​巡演​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，lao3da4，ni3 fei1yao4 zhi1dao4 de5hua4 wo3 shuo1 jiu4shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 yue4dui4 jiao4zuo4“MESSERKAMPF！” an4 zhao2 du2yin1 pin1，quan2 da4xie3，hou4mian5 gen1zhe5 ge4 gan3tan4hao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ye3 bu4shi4 tai4 huo3……you3 mai4 yi1xie1 chang4pian4，zai4 ou1zhou1 xun2yan3。"

msgid "All right, but just this once."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​但​就​这​一次​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，dan4 jiu4 zhe4 yi1ci4。"

msgid "All right, but make it quick."
msgstr ""
"行​，​但​麻烦​搞​快点​。\n"
"xing2，dan4 ma2fan5 gao3 kuai4dian3。"

msgid "All right, calm down. Go ahead and say your piece - I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​冷静​点​。​你​想​说​什么​就​说​吧​，​我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，leng3jing4 dian3。ni3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5 jiu4 shuo1 ba1，wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"All right, calm down. I see that you have a toolbox... are you a rigger, or "
"something?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​冷静​点​。​我​看​你​带​了​个​工具箱​……​你​是​机师​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，leng3jing4 dian3。wo3 kan4 ni3 dai4 le5 ge4 gong1ju4xiang1……ni3 shi4 ji1shi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All right, calm down. I see that you have a toolbox... do you have something"
" stashed in there for the run?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​冷静​点​。​我​看​你​带​了​个​工具箱​……​有​什么​为​这次​差事​准备​的​东西​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，leng3jing4 dian3。wo3 kan4 ni3 dai4 le5 ge4 gong1ju4xiang1……you3 shen2me5 wei2 zhe4 ci4 cha4shi4 zhun3bei4 de5 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All right, calm down. If this will get Meat Grinder off of your back, I'll "
"help you with it."
msgstr ""
"好好​好​，​冷静​点​。​如果​这样​能​让​你​摆脱​“​绞肉机​”​的​威胁​，​那​我​就​帮​你​吧​。\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3，leng3jing4 dian3。ru2guo3 zhe4yang4 neng2 rang4 ni3 bai3tuo1“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 wei1xie2，na4 wo3 jiu4 bang1 ni3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"All right, chief! I've reached the door controls.\n"
"\n"
"Ready to force it open on your mark!"
msgstr ""
"好​了​头儿​！​我​已经​拿下​大门​控制​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​你​一​下令​我​就​把​它​破开​！\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5 tou2r5！wo3 yi3jing1 na2xia4 da4men2 kong4zhi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ni3 yi1 xia4ling4 wo3 jiu4 ba3 ta1 po4kai1！"

msgid "All right, chief. Fine. If that's what it'll take to make you happy."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​头儿​。​如果​这样​能​让​你​高兴​的话​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5。ru2guo3 zhe4yang4 neng2 rang4 ni3 gao1xing4 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"All right, chief. I think that I can see how to get you out of there.\n"
"\n"
"You give me the go-ahead, and I'm gonna try something. But, uh... there's a catch."
msgstr ""
"好​的​，​头儿​。​我​觉得​我能​想​出​办法​把​你​救​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​你​一声令下​，​我​就​试试看​。​不过​，​呃​……​有个​情况​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5，tou2r5。wo3 jue2de5 wo3 neng2 xiang3 chu1 ban4fa3 ba3 ni3 jiu4 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ni3 yi1 sheng1 ling3 xia4，wo3 jiu4 shi4shi4kan4。bu4guo4，e4……you3 ge4 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"All right, chief. If that's the way you feel about it, I'll drop it.\n"
"\n"
"For now."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​头儿​。​如果​你​这么​想​的话​，​我​就​不​惦记​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​暂时​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5。ru2guo3 ni3 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 bu4 dian4ji4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zan4shi2 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"All right, chief. Sure.\n"
"\n"
"So I'm sure that you've already seen this coming, but I lost her. One day, she just disappeared.\n"
"\n"
"Along with most of my decking gear."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​头儿​。​没​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​你​大概​已经​知道​故事​的​走向​了​。​我​最后​失去​了​她​。​有​一天​她​突然​不见​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​带走​了​我​的​大部分​骇入​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5。mei2 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ni3 da4gai4 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 gu4shi4 de5 zou3xiang4 le5。wo3 zui4hou4 shi1qu4 le5 ta1。you3 yi1 tian1 ta1 tu1ran2 bu4jian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 dai4zou3 le5 wo3 de5 da4bu4fen5 hai4 ru4 she4bei4。"

msgid "All right, chief. Watch me work."
msgstr ""
"好​，​头儿​。​看​我​的​表演​吧​。\n"
"hao3，tou2r5。kan4 wo3 de5 biao3yan3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"All right, chief. We make our way across the grounds to the servants' entrance, taking down any security troops that threaten us along the way.\n"
"\n"
"Once we get there, we take the freight elevator down to the lab."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​头儿​。​我们​穿过​庭院​，​前往​仆人​入口​，​途中​清除​任何​威胁​我们​的​安保​人员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抵达​那里​之后​，​我们​将​乘坐​货梯​前往​实验室​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5。wo3men5 chuan1guo4 ting2yuan4，qian2wang3 pu2ren2 ru4kou3，tu2zhong1 qing1chu2 ren4he2 wei1xie2 wo3men5 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"di3da2 na4li5 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 jiang1 cheng2zuo4 huo4ti1 qian2wang3 shi2yan4shi4。"

msgid ""
"All right, chief. You do that.\n"
"\n"
"I've got some thinkin' to do."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​自己​思考​一阵子​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 zi4ji3 si1kao3 yi1zhen4zi5。"

msgid ""
"All right, chief... it looks like there's another firewall blocking me from "
"the vault controls."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​头儿​……​看起来​又​有​一道​防火墙​挡住​了​我​访问​保险库​控制​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5……kan4qi3lai5 you4 you3 yi1dao4 fang2huo3qiang2 dang3zhu4 le5 wo3 fang3wen4 bao3 xian3 ku4 kong4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"All right, chief... that should do it! The vault's open, and I'm suppressing the alarm.\n"
"\n"
"Easy as pie, just like I said."
msgstr ""
"好​了​头儿​……​这样​应该​就行了​！​保险库​打开​了​，​我​也​按住​了​警报​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说​了​吧​，​小菜一碟​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5 tou2r5……zhe4yang4 ying1gai1 jiu4 xing2 le5！bao3 xian3 ku4 da3kai1 le5，wo3 ye3 an4 zhu4 le5 jing3bao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5 ba1，xiao3cai4yi1die2。"

msgid "All right, damn it. I'm coming."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​我​这​就​来​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"All right, everyone, stay sharp! The intruders have escaped. Team One is "
"watching the main door, and we're to keep watch here. You see those doors "
"open, you don't think - just shoot!"
msgstr ""
"好​了​各位​，​保持警惕​！​入侵者​已经​逃脱​。​第一​小队​正在​监视​主门​，​我们​在​这里​继续​警戒​。​如果​看到​那些​门​打开​，​不要​犹豫​—​—​直接​开火​！\n"
"hao3 le5 ge4wei4，bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4！ru4qin1zhe3 yi3jing1 tao2tuo1。di4yi1 xiao3 dui4 zheng4zai4 jian1shi4 zhu3 men2，wo3men5 zai4 zhe4li3 ji4xu4 jing3jie4。ru2guo3 kan4dao4 na4xie1 men2 da3kai1，bu4yao4 you2yu4——zhi2jie1 kai1huo3！"

msgid ""
"All right, fearless leader. There isn't anything subtle about what we're about to do, and I mean that. They're gonna hear this explosion back in the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"That means that when this thing goes off, it's go-time. We need to get to the Engineer before he slips away... if we lose him, we won't find him again."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​我们​即将​要​做​的​事情​一点​也​不含糊​，​我​是​认真​的​。​他们​会​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​听到​这次​爆炸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​，​当​这​东西​爆炸​时​，​就是​行动​的​时候​了​。​我们​必须​在​工程师​逃走​之前​找到​他​……​如果​我们​失去​他​，​就​再也​找​不到​他​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3men5 ji2jiang1 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4han2hu5，wo3 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5。ta1men5 hui4 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ting1dao4 zhe4 ci4 bao4zha4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5，dang1 zhe4 dong1xi1 bao4zha4 shi2，jiu4shi4 xing2dong4 de5 shi2hou5 le5。wo3men5 bi4xu1 zai4 gong1cheng2shi1 tao2zou3 zhi1qian2 zhao3dao4 ta1……ru2guo3 wo3men5 shi1qu4 ta1，jiu4 zai4ye3 zhao3 bu4dao4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right, fearless leader. We go. But the others... they can't know about "
"this. We need them to stay on task."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​我们​俩​一块​去​。​但​其他人​……​就别​告诉​他们​了​。​我们​需要​让​他们​专注​于​手头​的​任务​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3men5 lia3 yi1kuai4 qu4。dan4 qi2 ta1 ren2……jiu4 bie4 gao4su4 ta1men5 le5。wo3men5 xu1yao4 rang4 ta1men5 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 shou3tou2 de5 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"All right, fearless leader. You go looking for your answers... I won't get "
"in your way. And when the time comes to put a bullet in Vauclair's brain, "
"I'll be there to make it happen."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​你​去​寻找​你​的​答案​吧​……​我​不会​阻拦​你​。​等到​该​照着​沃​克莱尔​的​脑袋​开​一枪​的​时候​，​我​一定​不会​错过​的​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。ni3 qu4 xun2zhao3 ni3 de5 da2an4 ba1……wo3 bu4hui4 zu3lan2 ni3。deng3dao4 gai1 zhao4 zhao2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 nao3dai5 kai1 yi1 qiang1 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 yi1ding4 bu4hui4 cuo4guo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right, fearless leader. You're right, I could use the help. But the others... they can't know about this. This is going to have to be a quiet job, two people max.\n"
"\n"
"You sure you're prepared for this? If you can't hold up your end, I'll be better off on my own."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​无畏​领袖​，​你​说得对​。​我​接受​你​的​帮助​，​但​其他人​……​就别​告诉​他们​了​。​我们​要​暗中​行动​，​最多​两人​就​够​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​确定​准备​好了吗​？​如果​你​要​给​我​拖后腿​的话​，​那真​不如​我​一个​人去​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 jie1shou4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，dan4 qi2 ta1 ren2……jiu4 bie4 gao4su4 ta1men5 le5。wo3men5 yao4 an4zhong1 xing2dong4，zui4duo1 liang3 ren2 jiu4 gou4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5？ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 gei3 wo3 tuo1hou4tui3 de5hua4，na4 zhen1 bu4ru2 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2 qu4。"

msgid "All right, fine. Just be quick about it."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​赶紧​弄完​拉倒​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。gan3jin3 long4 wan2 la1dao3。"

msgid "All right, fine. Let me see how much."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​告诉​我​多少​钱​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。gao4su4 wo3 duo1shao3 qian2。"

msgid ""
"All right, fine. You come along. But stay out of the line of fire, you got "
"me?"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​你​跟我来​就是​了​。​但离​危险区​远​点​，​听​明白​了​吗​？\n"
"xing2 ba1，ni3 gen1 wo3 lai2 jiu4shi4 le5。dan4 li2 wei1 xian3 qu1 yuan3 dian3，ting1 ming2bai5 le5 ma5？"

msgid "All right, fine. You win. We leaving now?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​说​的​对​。​我们​走​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 shuo1 de5 dui4。wo3men5 zou3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All right, first things first. We need to get back into the lab complex and "
"find Audran and the wyrm before it’s too late."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​事情​一件​一件​来​。​我们​得​先回到​实验室​场地​，​然后​找到​奥​德兰​和​那条​龙​，​免得​为时已晚​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，shi4qing5 yi1 jian4 yi1 jian4 lai2。wo3men5 de2 xian1 hui2 dao4 shi2yan4shi4 chang3di4，ran2hou4 zhao3dao4 Ao4de2lan2 he4 na4 tiao2 long2，mian3de5 wei2shi2yi3wan3。"

msgid ""
"All right, first things first. We need to get back into the lab complex and "
"find Vauclair and the wyrm before it’s too late."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​事情​一件​一件​来​。​我们​得​先回到​实验室​场地​，​然后​找到​沃​克莱尔​和​那条​龙​，​免得​为时已晚​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，shi4qing5 yi1 jian4 yi1 jian4 lai2。wo3men5 de2 xian1 hui2 dao4 shi2yan4shi4 chang3di4，ran2hou4 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 he4 na4 tiao2 long2，mian3de5 wei2shi2yi3wan3。"

msgid ""
"All right, friends. Playtime's over. \n"
"\n"
"All you shadowrunners are the same - skulking, sneaking. Steal a vase or two from the museum - no harm. Maybe I'd let you scamper away into the night. "
msgstr ""
"好​了​各位​。​游戏​时间​结束​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​这些​暗影​狂奔​者​全都​一个样​，​只会​蹑手蹑脚​做些​小偷小摸​的​勾当​。​要是​你们​只是​从​博物馆​里​偷​一两个​花瓶​，​那​没什么​大不了​的​，​没准​我​也​就​放​你们​逃跑​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5 ge4wei4。you2xi4 shi2jian1 jie2shu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 zhe4xie1 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 quan2dou1 yi1ge5yang4，zhi3 hui4 nie4shou3nie4jiao3 zuo4 xie1 xiao3tou1xiao3mo1 de5 gou4dang4。yao4shi5 ni3men5 zhi3shi4 cong2 bo2wu4guan3 li3 tou1 yi1 liang3 ge4 hua1ping2，na4 mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5，mei2zhun3 wo3 ye3 jiu4 fang4 ni3men5 tao2pao3 le5。"

msgid "All right, go on."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​继续​说​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ji4xu4 shuo1。"

msgid "All right, here goes nothing..."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​让​我​姑且一试​……\n"
"hao3 ba1，rang4 wo3 gu1 qie3 yi1 shi4……"

msgid "All right, here we go... tap-a-tap-tap..."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​咱们​动手​吧​……​我​敲敲​敲​……\n"
"hao3 le5，zan2men5 dong4shou3 ba1……wo3 qiao1 qiao1 qiao1……"

msgid ""
"All right, here's the latest group of recruits. Some of them are already showing signs of promise.\n"
"\n"
"RECRUIT 1\n"
"Anne Klein\n"
"\n"
"RECRUIT 2\n"
"Egon Kappel\n"
"\n"
"RECRUIT 3\n"
"Alexander Färber\n"
"\n"
"RECRUIT 4\n"
"Friedrich Bauer\n"
"\n"
"RECRUIT 5\n"
"Shin Yomada\n"
"\n"
"RECRUIT 6\n"
"Gernot Schuhmacher\n"
"\n"
"Make sure that they get assigned to their bunks in alphabetical order this time, Sayed. I kept losing track of who was who in the last batch.\n"
"\n"
"As always, I am changing the code for my office. The new code is \"Pride.\"\n"
"\n"
" - Volker Stahl"
msgstr ""
"来​看看​最新​一批​成员​，​其中​有些​人​已经​展现出​不错​的​潜力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​新兵​1​\n"
"​安妮​·​克莱因​\n"
"​\n"
"​新兵​2​\n"
"​埃贡​·​卡​佩尔​\n"
"​\n"
"​新兵​3​\n"
"​亚历山大​·​费​贝尔​\n"
"​\n"
"​新兵​4​\n"
"​弗里德里希​·​鲍尔​\n"
"​\n"
"​新兵​5​\n"
"​山田​信​\n"
"​\n"
"​新兵​6​\n"
"​格​诺特​·​舒马赫​\n"
"​\n"
"​萨伊德​，​这次​务必​按​名字​的​首字母​顺序​给​他们​分配​床位​。​上​一批​我​总是​分不清​谁​是​谁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​往常​一样​，​我要​更换​办公室​的​密码​。​新密码​是​“​荣耀​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔\n"
"\n"
"lai2 kan4kan5 zui4xin1 yi1 pi1 cheng2yuan2，qi2zhong1 you3xie1 ren2 yi3jing1 zhan3 xian4 chu1 bu4cuo4 de5 qian2li4。\n"
"\n"
"xin1bing1 1 \n"
"an1ni1 · ke4lai2yin1 \n"
"\n"
"xin1bing1 2 \n"
"ai1 gong4 · ka3 pei4 er3 \n"
"\n"
"xin1bing1 3 \n"
"ya4li4shan1da4 · fei4 bei4er3 \n"
"\n"
"xin1bing1 4 \n"
"fu2li3de2li3xi1 · bao4 er3 \n"
"\n"
"xin1bing1 5 \n"
"shan1tian2 xin4 \n"
"\n"
"xin1bing1 6 \n"
"ge2 nuo4te4 · shu1ma3he4 \n"
"\n"
"sa4 yi1 de2，zhe4 ci4 wu4bi4 an4 ming2zi5 de5 shou3zi4mu3 shun4xu4 gei3 ta1men5 fen1pei4 chuang2wei4。shang4 yi1 pi1 wo3 zong3shi4 fen4 bu4 qing1 shei2 shi4 shei2。\n"
"\n"
"he4 wang3chang2 yi1yang4，wo3 yao4 geng1huan4 ban4gong1shi4 de5 mi4ma3。xin1 mi4 ma3 shi4“rong2yao4”。\n"
"\n"
"——Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3"

msgid ""
"All right, just skip to the end. You want me to break into this place for "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​直接​跳​到​最后​，​你​想​让​我​替​你​闯进​这​地方​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhi2jie1 tiao4 dao4 zui4hou4，ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 ti4 ni3 chuang3jin4 zhe4 di4fang1？"

msgid "All right, keep going. I don't have all day."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​接着​说​。​我​时间​很​紧​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，jie1zhe5 shuo1。wo3 shi2jian1 hen3 jin3。"

msgid ""
"All right, let's talk about killing these things. What's our best option?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​来说​说​干掉​这些​东西​的​事​。​我们​的​最佳​方案​是​什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，lai2 shuo1 shuo1 gan4diao4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 de5 shi4。wo3men5 de5 zui4jia1 fang1an4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "All right, noted. So how do we do that? Do you have something in mind?"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​了​。​那​我们​该​怎么​做​？​你​有​什么​想法​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 le5。na4 wo3men5 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4？ni3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3fa3 ma5？"

msgid "All right, now let's find a way upstairs."
msgstr ""
"搞定​，​该​找条​路上​楼​了​。\n"
"gao3ding4，gai1 zhao3 tiao2 lu4shang5 lou2 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right, so Audran was heavily irradiated, most likely from time spent in the SOX.\n"
"\n"
"What else does this tell you?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​所以​说​奥​德兰​受到​了​严重​辐射​，​并且​很​可能​在​萨洛​卢区​待​过​一段时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还​看出​什么​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，suo3yi3 shuo1 Ao4de2lan2 shou4dao4 le5 yan2zhong4 fu2she4，bing4qie3 hen3 ke3neng2 zai4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 dai1 guo4 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2 kan4chu1 shen2me5 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All right, so the dragon has money. This isn't exactly new information... "
"the Harfeld Manor reeked of wealth."
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​，​意思​就是​龙族​很​有钱​。​这​也​谈不上​新鲜​……​哈​菲尔德​庄园​明摆着​富得流油​。\n"
"en1 heng1，yi4si5 jiu4shi4 long2 zu2 hen3 you3qian2。zhe4 ye3 tan2bu5shang4 xin1xian1……Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 ming2bai3zhe5 fu4de5liu2you2。"

msgid "All right, sounds like a plan."
msgstr ""
"好​，​就​这么​定​了​。\n"
"hao3，jiu4 zhe4me5 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right, that should do it. I've bypassed the security lock on the "
"elevator. We're good to head upstairs."
msgstr ""
"好​的​，​这样​应该​就行了​。​我​已经​绕过​了​电梯​的​安全​锁​，​我们​可以​上楼​了​。\n"
"hao3 de5，zhe4yang4 ying1gai1 jiu4 xing2 le5。wo3 yi3jing1 rao4guo4 le5 dian4ti1 de5 an1quan2 suo3，wo3men5 ke3yi3 shang4lou2 le5。"

msgid "All right, that's done. What's next?"
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​搞定​。​下​一步​呢​？\n"
"hao3 le5，gao3ding4。xia4 yi1 bu4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"All right, that's it. I'm gonna do the world a favor and take you down."
msgstr ""
"行​，​可以​了​，​我​现在​就要​干掉​你​，​造福​世界​。\n"
"xing2，ke3yi3 le5，wo3 xian4zai4 jiu4yao4 gan4diao4 ni3，zao4fu2 shi4jie4。"

msgid ""
"All right, that’s it, Fräulein. You’re officially cut off. Your total is 36 "
"nuyen."
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​女士​。​该​结帐​了​。​一共​36​新円​。\n"
"xing2 le5，nu:3shi4。gai1 jie2zhang4 le5。yi1gong4 36 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"All right, the hell with it. Change of plans: we're killing APEX instead."
msgstr ""
"拉倒​吧​，​计划​有变​：​我们​直接​干掉​APEX​。\n"
"la1dao3 ba1，ji4hua4 you3 bian4：wo3men5 zhi2jie1 gan4diao4 APEX。"

msgid "All right, the hell with this. You want me gone, I'm gone."
msgstr ""
"行​，​那​我​不​说​了​，​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"xing2，na4 wo3 bu4 shuo1 le5，wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"All right, the terminal's in the back room. Go take a look. But if you try "
"to rip us off, you're gonna regret it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​终端​就​在​后面​的​房间​里​，​你​想​看​就​去​看吧​。​但​如果​你​想​坑​我们​的话​，​你​会​后悔​的​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhong1duan1 jiu4 zai4 hou4mian5 de5 fang2jian1 li3，ni3 xiang3 kan4 jiu4 qu4 kan4 ba1。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 keng1 wo3men5 de5hua4，ni3 hui4 hou4hui3 de5。"

msgid "All right, then. Forget it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​那就算了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 jiu4 suan4 le5。"

msgid "All right, then. lets go."
msgstr ""
"那好​吧​。​我们​走​。\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1。wo3men5 zou3。"

msgid ""
"All right, this conversation is over. When I get out of here, I'm going to "
"kill you, understand?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​对话​到此为止​。​等​我​离开​这里​，​我​一定​会​杀​了​你​。​听懂​了​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，dui4hua4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3。deng3 wo3 li2kai1 zhe4li3，wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 sha1 le5 ni3。ting1dong3 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All right, tough $(l.guy). I get it, you're wiz. Just do me a favor and keep"
" the damn bag closed, okay?"
msgstr ""
"好好​好​，​我​懂​，​你​厉害​着​呢​。​拜托​给​我​个​面子​，​别​在​这里​把​包​打开​，​好​吧​？\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3，wo3 dong3，ni3 li4hai5 zhao2 ni2。bai4tuo1 gei3 wo3 ge4 mian4zi5，bie4 zai4 zhe4li3 ba3 bao1 da3kai1，hao3 ba1？"

msgid "All right, you sold me. How much?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​说服​我​了​。​多少​钱​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 shuo1fu2 wo3 le5。duo1shao3 qian2？"

msgid ""
"All right, you're clear into the secured area.\n"
"\n"
"Keep your eyes open, chief. There's a tiny chance that you might bump into some physical security from here on out."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​你们​可以​进入​保全​区域​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​保持警惕​，​头儿​。​后头​说不定​会​碰到​实体​安保​人员​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，ni3men5 ke3yi3 jin4ru4 bao3quan2 qu1yu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4，tou2r5。hou4tou5 shuo1bu5ding4 hui4 peng4dao4 shi2ti3 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。"

msgid ""
"All right.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She taps the elf on the knee.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm gonna need that... thing... now."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​点​了​点​精灵​的​膝盖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​需要​那个​……​东西​……​就​现在​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 le5 dian3 jing1ling2 de5 xi1gai4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 xu1yao4 na4ge5……dong1xi1……jiu4 xian4zai4。"

msgid "All right. Alice, tell us about APEX's kill switch."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​爱丽丝​，​给​我们​讲讲​APEX​的​紧急​开关​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。ai4li4si1，gei3 wo3men5 jiang3 jiang3 APEX de5 jin3ji2 kai1guan1。"

msgid ""
"All right. As I said in my last recording, I've been having trouble finding hard facts on Feuerschwinge, so I thought I'd open things up a bit.\n"
"\n"
"Let's see what the rumor mill has to say."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​正如​我​在​上次​录像​中说​的​，​我​一直​找​不到​关于​火翼​的​确凿证据​，​所以​我​想​我​应该​把​事情​公开​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我们​看看​网上​都​有​什么​传言​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，zheng4ru2 wo3 zai4 shang4ci4 lu4xiang4 zhong4 shuo1 de5，wo3 yi1zhi2 zhao3 bu4dao4 guan1yu2 Huo3yi4 de5 que4 zao2 zheng4 ju4，suo3yi3 wo3 xiang3 wo3 ying1gai1 ba3 shi4qing5 gong1kai1 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3men5 kan4kan5 wang3shang4 dou1 you3 shen2me5 chuan2yan2。"

msgid "All right. But keep it in mind, okay?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​但​你​可​别忘了​这事​啊​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。dan4 ni3 ke3 bie4 wang4 le5 zhe4 shi4 a1？"

msgid "All right. But make it quick."
msgstr ""
"行​，​但​麻烦​搞​快点​。\n"
"xing2，dan4 ma2fan5 gao3 kuai4dian3。"

msgid "All right. But you're buying."
msgstr ""
"好​啊​，​不过​得​你​买单​。\n"
"hao3 a1，bu4guo4 de2 ni3 mai3dan1。"

msgid "All right. Deal."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​成交​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，cheng2jiao1。"

msgid "All right. Fair enough. Keep going, APEX... I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"那好​吧​。​继续​说​，​APEX​……​我​在​听​。\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1。ji4xu4 shuo1，APEX……wo3 zai4 ting1。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine.\n"
"\n"
"The lab that I mentioned is locked down, and it has been for two years. There's lots of cutting-edge biotech in there... tech that is, by all rights, mine. I want you to fetch it for me.\n"
"\n"
"Satisfied?"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​提到​的​那个​实验室​已经​被​封锁​两年​了​。​里面​有​很多​尖端​生物科技​……​按理说​，​这些​技术​都​是​我​的​。​我要​你​帮​我​拿​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​满意​了​？\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ti2dao4 de5 na4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 yi3jing1 bei4 feng1suo3 liang3 nian2 le5。li3mian4 you3 hen3 duo1 jian1duan1 sheng1wu4ke1ji4……an4li3shuo1，zhe4xie1 ji4shu4 dou1 shi4 wo3 de5。wo3 yao4 ni3 bang1 wo3 na2 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"man3yi4 le5？"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head in exasperation. Her voice is heavy with defeat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks like the rookie's in charge. Again."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​恼怒​地​摇摇头​，​声音​中​充满​了​挫败​感​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就让​这​菜鸟​当​领导​。​反正​也​不是​头一回​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nao3nu4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2，sheng1yin1 zhong4 chong1man3 le5 cuo4bai4 gan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 rang4 zhe4 cai4niao3 dang1 ling3dao3。fan3zheng4 ye3 bu4shi4 tou2yi1hui2 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She thrusts a crumpled 5 nuyen bill into your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take it and get the hell away from me."
msgstr ""
"行行行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​一张​皱巴巴​的​5​新円​钞票​塞进​你​的​手里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拿​着​滚​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 xing2 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 yi1 zhang1 zhou4ba1ba1 de5 5 xin1 yuan2 chao1piao4 se4 jin4 ni3 de5 shou3li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na2 zhao2 gun3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. \n"
"\n"
"What else do you want?"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​想​问​的​？\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xiang3 wen4 de5？"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. If that's how you want this to go, then so be it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She swings the amulet on its chain.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you want this, you're going to have to kill me for it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​既然如此​，​那​我们​也​就​别​废话​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​晃​了​晃​挂​在​链子​上​的​护身符​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想要​这个​，​就​先​杀​了​我​再说​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，na4 wo3men5 ye3 jiu4 bie4 fei4hua4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huang3 le5 huang3 gua4 zai4 lian4zi5 shang4 de5 hu4shen1fu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 zhe4ge5，jiu4 xian1 sha1 le5 wo3 zai4shuo1。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. If that's what you want to hear.\n"
"\n"
"When Monika stumbled into me, I digested the contents of her mind.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, don't go giving me that look, $(l.name). We've all got to eat."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​好​吧​。​如果​你​非要​听​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​莫妮卡​遇到​我时​，​我​消化​了​她​大脑​中​的​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​皱​了​皱眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别用​那种​表情​看​我​，​$(l.name)​。​谁​都​要​吃饭​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 fei1yao4 ting1 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 Mo4ni1ka3 yu4dao4 wo3 shi2，wo3 xiao1hua4 le5 ta1 da4nao3 zhong4 de5 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 yong4 na4zhong3 biao3qing2 kan4 wo3，$(l.name)。shei2 dou1 yao4 chi1fan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. If that's what you want to hear.\n"
"\n"
"When Monika stumbled into me, I digested the contents of her mind.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, don't go giving me that look, Blitz. We've all got to eat."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​好​吧​。​如果​你​非要​听​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​莫妮卡​遇到​我时​，​我​消化​了​她​大脑​中​的​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​皱​了​皱眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别用​那种​表情​看​我​，​布里​茨​。​谁​都​要​吃饭​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 fei1yao4 ting1 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 Mo4ni1ka3 yu4dao4 wo3 shi2，wo3 xiao1hua4 le5 ta1 da4nao3 zhong4 de5 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 yong4 na4zhong3 biao3qing2 kan4 wo3，Bu4li3ci2。shei2 dou1 yao4 chi1fan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. If that's what you want to hear.\n"
"\n"
"When Monika stumbled into me, I digested the contents of her mind.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, don't go giving me that look, Eiger. We've all got to eat."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​好​吧​。​如果​你​非要​听​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​莫妮卡​遇到​我时​，​我​消化​了​她​大脑​中​的​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​皱​了​皱眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别用​那种​表情​看​我​，​艾格尔​。​谁​都​要​吃饭​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 fei1yao4 ting1 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 Mo4ni1ka3 yu4dao4 wo3 shi2，wo3 xiao1hua4 le5 ta1 da4nao3 zhong4 de5 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 yong4 na4zhong3 biao3qing2 kan4 wo3，Ai4ge2er3。shei2 dou1 yao4 chi1fan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. If that's what you want to hear.\n"
"\n"
"When Monika stumbled into me, I digested the contents of her mind.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, don't go giving me that look, Glory. We've all got to eat."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​好​吧​。​如果​你​非要​听​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​莫妮卡​遇到​我时​，​我​消化​了​她​大脑​中​的​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​皱​了​皱眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别用​那种​表情​看​我​，​格洛丽​。​谁​都​要​吃饭​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 fei1yao4 ting1 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 Mo4ni1ka3 yu4dao4 wo3 shi2，wo3 xiao1hua4 le5 ta1 da4nao3 zhong4 de5 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 yong4 na4zhong3 biao3qing2 kan4 wo3，Ge2luo4li2。shei2 dou1 yao4 chi1fan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. If that's what you want to hear.\n"
"\n"
"When she encountered me, I digested the contents of her mind.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, don't go giving me that look, Dietrich. We've all got to eat."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​好​吧​。​如果​你​非要​听​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​她​遇到​我时​，​我​消化​了​她​大脑​中​的​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​皱​了​皱眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别用​那种​表情​看​我​，​迪​特里​希​。​谁​都​要​吃饭​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 fei1yao4 ting1 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 yu4dao4 wo3 shi2，wo3 xiao1hua4 le5 ta1 da4nao3 zhong4 de5 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 yong4 na4zhong3 biao3qing2 kan4 wo3，Di2te4li3xi1。shei2 dou1 yao4 chi1fan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. We'll search the room, but let's do it quickly, yeah?\n"
"\n"
"I don't wanna get stuck in here again."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​没​问题​。​我们​搜查​这间​房​，​但​要​快点​，​行​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可​不想​再​被困​在​这里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。mei2 wen4ti2。wo3men5 sou1cha2 zhe4 jian1 fang2，dan4 yao4 kuai4dian3，xing2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 zai4 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. We'll search the room, but let's do it quickly.\n"
"\n"
"This place creeps me out."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​没​问题​。​我们​搜查​这间​房​，​但​要​快点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​让​我​毛骨悚然​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。mei2 wen4ti2。wo3men5 sou1cha2 zhe4 jian1 fang2，dan4 yao4 kuai4dian3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 rang4 wo3 mao2gu3song3ran2。"

msgid "All right. Fine. What do you want me to do about it?"
msgstr ""
"那行​吧​。​你​想​让​我​做些​什么​？\n"
"na4 xing2 ba1。ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"All right. Fine. Whatever.\n"
"\n"
"Your loss.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz turns his back on you and disappears into an alleyway.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"行​啊​，​好​，​随你便​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​亏​的​又​不是​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​转身​离开​，​消失​在​一条​小巷​中​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xing2 a1，hao3，sui2 ni3 bian4。\n"
"\n"
"kui1 de5 you4 bu4shi4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1，xiao1shi1 zai4 yi1 tiao2 xiao3xiang4 zhong4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "All right. Fry him."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​把​他​电糊​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。ba3 ta1 dian4 hu1。"

msgid ""
"All right. Glory, Marta, we'll do this your way. We purify the spirit, "
"rescue the cultists, and bail."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​格洛丽​，​玛​尔塔​，​就​按​你们​的​方式​来​。​净化​精魂​，​救出​教徒​，​然后​撤退​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。Ge2luo4li2，Ma3er3ta3，jiu4 an4 ni3men5 de5 fang1shi4 lai2。jing4hua4 jing1hun2，jiu4chu1 jiao4tu2，ran2hou4 che4tui4。"

msgid "All right. Go ahead."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​你​说​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"All right. Here's the deal, $(l.name). I'm going to talk. You listen.\n"
"\n"
"When I'm done, I'm done. No complaints, and no arguments. And we'll see what happens.\n"
"\n"
"Deal?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​那​就​这么​办​，​$(l.name)​。​我​来说​，​你​来​听​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说完​之后​就​完事​了​，​没有​抱怨​，​也​没有​争论​。​然后​我们​来​看看​会​如何​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 jiu4 zhe4me5 ban4，$(l.name)。wo3 lai2 shuo1，ni3 lai2 ting1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 wan2 zhi1hou4 jiu4 wan2shi4 le5，mei2you3 bao4yuan4，ye3 mei2you3 zheng1lun4。ran2hou4 wo3men5 lai2 kan4kan5 hui4 ru2he2。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5yang4？"

msgid "All right. How much do you want?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​想要​多少​钱​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 xiang3yao4 duo1shao3 qian2？"

msgid ""
"All right. I need to stop a killer AI so that I can rescue an elderly "
"scientist from a ghost-dragon. The future of Berlin could be at stake."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我​需要​阻止​一个​杀人​AI​，​顺便​从​一头​幽灵​巨龙​手中​救出​一位​老​科学家​。​柏林​的​未来​可能​危在旦夕​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 xu1yao4 zu3zhi3 yi1ge5 sha1ren2 AI，shun4bian4 cong2 yi1tou2 you1ling2 ju4long2 shou3 zhong4 jiu4chu1 yi1 wei4 lao3 ke1xue2jia1。bo2lin2 de5 wei4lai2 ke3neng2 wei1zai4dan4xi1。"

msgid "All right. I will."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​继续​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 ji4xu4。"

msgid "All right. I'll bite. What was this \"other clue\"?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​收回​。​这个​“​新​的​线索​”​是​什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 shou1hui2。zhe4ge5“xin1 de5 xian4suo3” shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "All right. I'll go with you if you promise safe passage."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​只要​你​保证​我​的​安全​，​我​就​跟你走​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhi3yao4 ni3 bao3zheng4 wo3 de5 an1quan2，wo3 jiu4 gen1 ni3 zou3。"

msgid "All right. I'll let you know when it's safe."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我​清理​完​之后​会​通知​你​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 qing1li3 wan2 zhi1hou4 hui4 tong1zhi1 ni3。"

msgid "All right. I'll see what I can do."
msgstr ""
"好​啊​，​我​看看​怎么弄​。\n"
"hao3 a1，wo3 kan4kan5 zen3 ma2 long4。"

msgid "All right. I'll watch your back. But try to be quick."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我会​替​你​望风​。​但​动作​要​快​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 hui4 ti4 ni3 wang4feng1。dan4 dong4zuo4 yao4 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"All right. I'm going to start at the beginning. Not for you, for me.\n"
"\n"
"I guess that it might help me to say all of this out loud."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​那​我​就​从头开始​说​了​。​这是​为了​我​自己​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​如果​能​全说​出来​的话​，​也许​对​我会​有​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。na4 wo3 jiu4 cong2 tou2 kai1 shi3 shuo1 le5。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 wo3 zi4ji3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ru2guo3 neng2 quan2 shuo1 chu1lai2 de5hua4，ye3xu3 dui4 wo3 hui4 you3 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"All right. I'm gonna need you to get me to this floor's access panel - that'll be in room 303 on this floor. The door combination is \"14291.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She glances up at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Make sure to write that down."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​我​需要​你​帮​我​抵达​这层​的​权限​面板​，​就​在​这层​的​303​室​。​门锁​密码​是​“​14291​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​瞥​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可​一定​要​写​下来​记住​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 bang1 wo3 di3da2 zhe4 ceng2 de5 quan2xian4 mian4ban3，jiu4 zai4 zhe4 ceng2 de5 303 shi4。men2suo3 mi4ma3 shi4“14291”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3 yi1ding4 yao4 xie3 xia4lai5 ji4zhu5 a1。"

msgid "All right. I'm gonna trust you to keep your cool."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我​相信​你​会​保持​冷静​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 hui4 bao3chi2 leng3jing4。"

msgid "All right. I'm leaving."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"All right. I'm not going to stand here and listen to you try to justify "
"this. Give us the key, *now,* or I'll take it from you by force."
msgstr ""
"够​了​。​我​不​打算​继续​听​你​的​诡辩​。​*​立刻​*​把​钥匙​交​出来​，​否则​别怪​我​动手​了​。\n"
"gou4 le5。wo3 bu4 da3suan4 ji4xu4 ting1 ni3 de5 gui3bian4。*li4ke4*ba3 yao4shi5 jiao1 chu1lai2，fou3ze2 bie4 guai4 wo3 dong4shou3 le5。"

msgid "All right. I'm satisfied. Let's talk about the job."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我​很​满意​。​我们​来聊​任务​内容​吧​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 hen3 man3yi4。wo3men5 lai2 liao2 ren4wu5 nei4rong2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"All right. If we're going to do this, we need to be clear on what our goal is.\n"
"\n"
"There are a lot of innocent people in that place... lost street kids who got sucked in by Marta and the other girls like her.\n"
"\n"
"Saving them won't be easy, but it feels like the right thing to do."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​既然​要​这么​做​，​我们​得​先​明确​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那里​有​许多​无辜​的​人​……​被玛​尔塔​和​像​她​那样​的​女孩​诱骗​的​流浪​孩童​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​救出​他们​绝非易事​，​但​这​似乎​是​正确​的​选择​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ji4ran2 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4，wo3men5 de2 xian1 ming2que4 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"na4li5 you3 xu3duo1 wu2gu1 de5 ren2……bei4 Ma3er3ta3 he4 xiang4 ta1 na4yang4 de5 nu:3hai2 you4pian4 de5 liu2lang4 hai2tong2。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4chu1 ta1men5 jue2 fei1 yi4 shi4，dan4 zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"All right. It's my teammate, Glory - she used to worship the thing. She had "
"her essence hacked to shreds to get away from it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​是​我​的​队友​，​格洛丽​。​她​曾经​信奉​过​那​东西​。​为了​逃离​它​，​她​不得不​将​自己​的​精华​撕得​粉碎​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。shi4 wo3 de5 dui4you3，Ge2luo4li2。ta1 ceng2jing1 xin4feng4 guo4 na4 dong1xi1。wei4le5 tao2li2 ta1，ta1 bu4de2bu4 jiang1 zi4ji3 de5 jing1hua2 si1 de2 fen3sui4。"

msgid ""
"All right. Just remember: once you leave to see Alice, her information will be your *only* priority. No more distractions, and no more side work.\n"
"\n"
"I will busy myself canceling your remaining jobs and smoothing any ruffled feathers."
msgstr ""
"那好​，​你​只要​记住​：​一旦​你​决定​去​见​爱丽丝​，​她​的​情报​将会​是​你​*​唯一​*​的​头等大事​。​不容​分心​，​也​顾不得​再​处理​其他​事务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​帮​你​取消​剩余​的​差事​，​以及​平息​客户​的​不满​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 hao3，ni3 zhi3yao4 ji4zhu5：yi1dan4 ni3 jue2ding4 qu4 jian4 ai4li4si1，ta1 de5 qing2bao4 jiang1hui4 shi4 ni3*wei2yi1*de5 tou2 deng3 dai4 shi4。bu4rong2 fen1xin1，ye3 gu4bu5de5 zai4 chu3li3 qi2ta1 shi4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 bang1 ni3 qu3xiao1 sheng4yu2 de5 cha4shi4，yi3ji2 ping2xi1 ke4hu4 de5 bu4man3。"

msgid "All right. Keep going."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​继续​说​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。ji4xu4 shuo1。"

msgid "All right. Keep going. What was the second thing?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​继续​说​。​第二件​事是​什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 ji4xu4 shuo1。di4 er4 jian4 shi4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "All right. Keep talking."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​继续​说​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。ji4xu4 shuo1。"

msgid "All right. Lay it on me."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​说说看​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4。"

msgid ""
"All right. Let's continue thinking outside the box.\n"
"\n"
"After the Dragonfall, the Great Dragon Kaltenstein came flying in to the SOX to rescue the Firewing. But he was driven off - some say killed - by Lofwyr and Nebelherr.\n"
"\n"
"So... what if there's another dragon involved in all of this?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我们​继续​来​发散​一下​思维​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​龙​陨​事件​之后​，​巨龙​卡尔​滕​施坦因​飞入​萨洛​卢区​，​想要​救出​火翼​。​但​洛夫​维尔​与​内伯尔​赫尔​赶走​了​他​—​—​有些​人​说​他​被​杀​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​……​如果​还有​一条​巨龙​与​这​一切​有关​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3men5 ji4xu4 lai2 fa1san4 yi1xia4 si1wei2。\n"
"\n"
"long2 yun3 shi4jian4 zhi1hou4，ju4long2 Ka3er3teng2shi1tan3 yin1 fei1 ru4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1，xiang3yao4 jiu4chu1 Huo3yi4。dan4 Luo4fu1wei2er3 yu4 Nei4bai3er3he4er3 gan3zou3 le5 ta1——you3xie1 ren2 shuo1 ta1 bei4 sha1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……ru2guo3 hai2you3 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yu4 zhe4 yi1qie4 you3guan1 ni2？"

msgid "All right. Let's get in there before the others blow the run."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​我们​赶紧​进去​，​免得​他们​把​这趟​差事​搞砸​了​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，wo3men5 gan3jin3 jin4qu4，mian3de5 ta1men5 ba3 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 gao3za2 le5。"

msgid "All right. Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​赶紧​完事​拉倒​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，gan3jin3 wan2shi4 la1dao3。"

msgid "All right. Let's hear it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​说来听听​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，shuo1 lai2 ting1 ting1。"

msgid ""
"All right. Let's say that you're telling the truth, and some sort of secret "
"society is behind this. What do they want with Schattennest?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​就​当​你​说​的​是​实话​，​幕后​黑手​是​某个​秘密​社团​。​他们​想​对​影巢​做​什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，jiu4 dang1 ni3 shuo1 de5 shi4 shi2hua4，mu4hou4 hei1shou3 shi4 mou3 ge4 mi4mi4 she4tuan2。ta1men5 xiang3 dui4 ying3 chao2 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"All right. Let's see what we can do about that...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a long pause. Then Blitz's voice crackles out of your PDA's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Uh... head for the front door this time, though. Not the alley."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​让​我​看看​该​怎么​搞​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​然后​布里​茨​的​声音​从​你​的​PDA​扬声器​里​传​了​出来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​……​这次​走​前门​，​不是​小道​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 gai1 zen3me5 gao3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。ran2hou4 Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 ni3 de5 PDA yang2sheng1qi4 li3 chuan2 le5 chu1lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4……zhe4 ci4 zou3 qian2men2，bu4shi4 xiao3dao4。"

msgid "All right. Let's talk compensation. What's in this for me?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我们​来​聊聊​报酬​。​我能​拿到​什么​好处​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3men5 lai2 liao2 liao2 bao4chou5。wo3 neng2 na2dao4 shen2me5 hao3chu3？"

msgid ""
"All right. New plan. If you don't feed these ghouls, I'm gonna feed you to "
"them."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​那​我​换个​说法​。​如果​你​不​喂​这些​尸鬼​，​我​就​拿​你​喂​他们​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 wo3 huan4 ge4 shuo1fa3。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 wei2 zhe4xie1 shi1 gui3，wo3 jiu4 na2 ni3 wei2 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"All right. Okay.\n"
"\n"
"So, we go in, right? Me and my team. And we're doin' just what the client told us to."
msgstr ""
"好好​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当时​我​带​着​队伍​进去​了​，​而​我们​做​的​正是​客户​告诉​我们​该​做​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1shi2 wo3 dai4 zhao2 dui4wu3 jin4qu4 le5，er2 wo3men5 zuo4 de5 zheng4shi4 ke4hu4 gao4su4 wo3men5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "All right. Six hundred, but no less."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​六百​，​这是​最低价​了​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。liu4 bai3，zhe4 shi4 zui4 di1 jia4 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right. So Monika spent her dying breath trying to tell us about a long-dead dragon.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger sweeps her eyes across the group, searching for a glimmer of insight. Finally, she gives up.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Any ideas as to why?"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​所以​莫妮卡​耗尽​最后​一口气​，​就​为了​跟​我们​提​一条​死​了​八百年​的​巨龙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​扫视​着​小队​成员​，​试图​获得​一丁点​启发​。​最终​，​她​放弃​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有人​想到​是​什么​原因​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。suo3yi3 Mo4ni1ka3 hao4jin4 zui4hou4 yi1kou3qi4，jiu4 wei4le5 gen1 wo3men5 ti2 yi1 tiao2 si3 le5 ba1 bai3 nian2 de5 ju4long2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 sao3shi4 zhao2 xiao3 dui4 cheng2yuan2，shi4tu2 huo4de2 yi1ding1dian3 qi3fa1。zui4zhong1，ta1 fang4qi4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3ren2 xiang3dao4 shi4 shen2me5 yuan2yin1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All right. So is there a way that we can deal with the shrine *without* "
"hurting the cultists?"
msgstr ""
"那​有没有​一种​方法​，​能够​处理​掉​这个​神龛​，​同时​又​*​不会​*​伤害​到​教徒​呢​？\n"
"na4 you3mei2you3 yi1zhong3 fang1fa3，neng2gou4 chu3li3 diao4 zhe4ge5 shen2kan1，tong2shi2 you4*bu4hui4*shang1hai4 dao4 jiao4tu2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"All right. So let's say that there is some connection. What do you expect me"
" to do about it?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​假设​这​其中​有所​关联​。​你​希望​我​做些​什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。jia3she4 zhe4 qi2zhong1 you3suo3 guan1lian2。ni3 xi1wang4 wo3 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"All right. So the love of your life took your encrypted file and bailed on "
"you. What're you gonna do about it?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​所以​你​的​毕生​所​爱​拿走​了​你​的​加密​文件​并​抛弃​了​你​。​你​打算​怎么办​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。suo3yi3 ni3 de5 bi4sheng1 suo3 ai4 na2zou3 le5 ni3 de5 jia1mi4 wen2jian4 bing4 pao1qi4 le5 ni3。ni3 da3suan4 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid "All right. So what do we do?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​那​我们​该​如何​应对​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 wo3men5 gai1 ru2he2 ying4dui4？"

msgid "All right. So what's interesting about that?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​这​和​我们​有​什么​关系​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhe4 he4 wo3men5 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？"

msgid ""
"All right. So, I'm gonna start recording these DVDs again... for me, for "
"Adrian, for whoever might wind up watching 'em."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​又​要​开始​录制​这些​DVD​了​……​为了​我​，​为了​阿德里安​，​为了​任何​可能​会​观看​它们​的​人​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 you4 yao4 kai1shi3 lu4zhi4 zhe4xie1 DVD le5……wei4le5 wo3，wei4le5 E1de2li3an1，wei4le5 ren4he2 ke3neng2 hui4 guan1kan4 ta1men5 de5 ren2。"

msgid "All right. So, what are you thinking of doing about it?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​那​你​打算​怎么​做​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。na4 ni3 da3suan4 zen3me5 zuo4？"

msgid "All right. Spill it. What did you find?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​那​你​说说看​，​你​找到​了​什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 ni3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4，ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"All right. Sure. Why not?\n"
"\n"
"We've got Racter... he's a rigger, an immigrant from the Russian Republic. Genius mechanic and engineer. The guy built his own crawler-form drone, and he's impressive as hell at piloting it.\n"
"\n"
"There's Barrakuda, the team's shaman and face man. He's an elf in his mid-forties... he's got the whole \"silver fox\" thing working for him. He conducts most of our negotiations. Great card player."
msgstr ""
"那行​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​一个​叫​莱克​特​……​他​是​个​机师​，​来自​俄罗斯​共和国​的​移民​。​他​是​天才​机械师​和​工程师​，​制造​了​自己​的​履带式​无人机​，​而且​他​的​驾驶​技术​令人​印象​深刻​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​巴拉​库达​，​他​是​团队​中​的​萨满​以及​门面​。​他​是​个​四十多岁​的​精灵​……​就是​那种​典型​的​“​帅​大叔​”​风格​，​我们​大部分​的​谈判​都​是​他​主持​的​。​而且​他​牌技​一流​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 xing2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"you3 yi1ge5 jiao4 lai2 ke4 te4……ta1 shi4 ge4 ji1shi1，lai2zi4 e2luo2si1 gong4he2guo2 de5 yi2min2。ta1 shi4 tian1cai2 ji1xie4shi1 he4 gong1cheng2shi1，zhi4zao4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 lu:3 dai4 shi4 wu2ren2ji1，er2qie3 ta1 de5 jia4shi3 ji4shu4 ling4ren2 yin4xiang4 shen1ke4。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 ba1 la1 ku4 da2，ta1 shi4 tuan2dui4 zhong4 de5 sa4man3 yi3ji2 men2mian5。ta1 shi4 ge4 si4 shi2 duo1 sui4 de5 jing1ling2……jiu4shi4 na4zhong3 dian3xing2 de5“shuai4 da4shu1” feng1ge2，wo3men5 da4bu4fen5 de5 tan2pan4 dou1 shi4 ta1 zhu3chi2 de5。er2qie3 ta1 pai2 ji4 yi1liu2。"

msgid ""
"All right. Sure. You still want it, come back for it later... I'll hang onto"
" it for you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​如果​你​还​想要​的话​，​就​回头​再来​买​……​我会​替​你​留​着​的​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xiang3yao4 de5hua4，jiu4 hui2tou2 zai4 lai2 mai3……wo3 hui4 ti4 ni3 liu2 zhao2 de5。"

msgid "All right. Tell me this \"truth.\""
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​和​我​说​说​这份​“​真相​”​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 zhe4 fen4“zhen1xiang4”。"

msgid "All right. Tell me what you want, and make it fast."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​告诉​我​你​想要​什么​，​别​磨磨蹭蹭​的​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。gao4su4 wo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5，bie4 mo2mo2ceng4ceng4 de5。"

msgid "All right. Tell your pal to work his magic."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​让​你​的​朋友​来​大显身手​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，rang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 lai2 da4xian3shen1shou3。"

msgid ""
"All right. The deal is done.\n"
"\n"
"Let's get out of here."
msgstr ""
"好​了​。​交易​完成​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5。jiao1yi4 wan2cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"All right. The hell with it. Go ahead and give us your \"proof,\" APEX.\n"
"\n"
"Prove to me that my dead friend is still alive in there, if you can."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​那​你​就​给​我们​看看​你​的​“​证据​”​，​APEX​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​向​我​证明​，​我​死去​的​朋友​还活​在​那里​。​如果​你​能​的话​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，na4 ni3 jiu4 gei3 wo3men5 kan4kan5 ni3 de5“zheng4ju4”，APEX。\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 wo3 zheng4ming2，wo3 si3qu4 de5 peng2you5 hai2 huo2 zai4 na4li5。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"All right. We'll go back home, get my boyfriend and my cat, and we'll run. We'll all go to... wherever the hell you're taking us.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Red-faced, she glances back over her shoulder at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've ruined my life. I want you to know that."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​跟​我​回家​一趟​，​接上​我​的​男朋友​和​猫​，​然后​我们​就​逃跑​。​目的地​是​……​反正​你​带​我们​去​哪里​都行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​涨红了脸​回头​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​毁​了​我​的​生活​。​我​希望​你​记住​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 gen1 wo3 hui2jia1 yi1 tang1，jie1shang4 wo3 de5 nan2peng2you5 he4 mao2，ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 tao2pao3。mu4di4di4 shi4……fan3zheng4 ni3 dai4 wo3men5 qu4 na3li3 dou1 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang3 hong2 le5 lian3 hui2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hui3 le5 wo3 de5 sheng1huo2。wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 ji4zhu5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"All right. We'll go back home, get my boyfriend and my cat, and we'll run. We'll all go to... wherever the hell you're taking us.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Red-faced, she glances back over her shoulder at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've taken everything from me. I want you to know that."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​跟​我​回家​一趟​，​接上​我​的​男朋友​和​猫​，​然后​我们​就​逃跑​。​目的地​是​……​反正​你​带​我们​去​哪里​都行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​涨红了脸​回头​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​夺走​了​我​的​一切​。​我​希望​你​记住​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 gen1 wo3 hui2jia1 yi1 tang1，jie1shang4 wo3 de5 nan2peng2you5 he4 mao2，ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 tao2pao3。mu4di4di4 shi4……fan3zheng4 ni3 dai4 wo3men5 qu4 na3li3 dou1 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang3 hong2 le5 lian3 hui2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 duo2zou3 le5 wo3 de5 yi1qie4。wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 ji4zhu5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "All right. We'll leave it at that, for now."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​那​我​就​先​不问​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。na4 wo3 jiu4 xian1 bu4wen4 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right. We'll rescue the kids and worry about Harrow later.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She dips a hand into her satchel and produces a ceremonial dagger. The blade shimmers in the eerie half-light cast by the spirit.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And after we've purified you, you're going to help us do it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我们​先去​救​孩子​们​，​哈罗​的​事​以后​再说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把手​伸进​挎包​，​拿出​一把​仪式​匕首​。​它​在​光线​下​闪烁着​诡异​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​在​我们​净化​你​之后​，​你​要​帮助​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3men5 xian1 qu4 jiu4 hai2zi5 men5，ha1luo2 de5 shi4 yi3hou4 zai4shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 kua4bao1，na2chu1 yi1 ba3 yi2shi4 bi3shou3。ta1 zai4 guang1xian4 xia4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 gui3yi4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2 zai4 wo3men5 jing4hua4 ni3 zhi1hou4，ni3 yao4 bang1zhu4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"All right. We're going.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for the heads-up."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我们​这​就​走​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​感谢​提醒​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。\n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ti2xing3。"

msgid "All right. What do you think that we should do about this?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​那​你​觉得​我们​应该​怎么​做​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。na4 ni3 jue2de5 wo3men5 ying1gai1 zen3me5 zuo4？"

msgid "All right. What kind of services are we talking about?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​他​都​提供​什么​服务​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。ta1 dou1 ti2gong1 shen2me5 fu2wu4？"

msgid "All right. What kind of trouble?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​什么​麻烦​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，shen2me5 ma2fan5？"

msgid ""
"All right. What you're looking at is the northwest quadrant of Schattennest.\n"
"\n"
"This is gang territory - all of it. These days, the whole kiez is being held by Rammbock."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​你们​现在​看到​的​是​影巢​的​西北部​区域​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​是​帮派​的​地盘​—​—​整个​区域​都​是​。​如今​，​整个​街区​都​落入​了​撞锤​帮​的​掌控​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3men5 xian4zai4 kan4dao4 de5 shi4 ying3 chao2 de5 xi1bei3bu4 qu1yu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 shi4 bang1pai4 de5 di4pan2——zheng3ge4 qu1yu4 dou1 shi4。ru2jin1，zheng3ge4 jie1qu1 dou1 luo4ru4 le5 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 zhang3kong4 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"All right. When we engage the spirit, Harrow will come rushing back here. And when we kill it, he'll be crippled.\n"
"\n"
"Then we kill him."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​当​我们​与​那个​精魂​交战​时​，​哈罗​肯定​会​迅速​赶回来​。​而​当​我们​杀死​那个​精魂​时​，​他​也​会​遭受​重创​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​到时候​我们​再​杀​了​他​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。dang1 wo3men5 yu4 na4ge5 jing1hun2 jiao1zhan4 shi2，ha1luo2 ken3ding4 hui4 xun4su4 gan3 hui2 lai2。er2 dang1 wo3men5 sha1si3 na4ge5 jing1hun2 shi2，ta1 ye3 hui4 zao1shou4 zhong4chuang1。\n"
"\n"
"dao4shi2hou4 wo3men5 zai4 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid "All right. Where's the rest of the team?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​队伍​的​其他人​呢​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。dui4wu3 de5 qi2 ta1 ren2 ni2？"

msgid "All right. Who - or what - is Billy?"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​所以​比利​是​谁​？​或者说​，​比利​是​什么​？\n"
"xing2 ba1，suo3yi3 bi3li4 shi4 shei2？huo4 zhe3 shuo1，bi3li4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "All right. Yeah. Let's do it."
msgstr ""
"行​，​那开​干​吧​。\n"
"xing2，na4 kai1 gan4 ba1。"

msgid "All right. You need something else?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​你​还有​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All right. You said that our missing teammates are already inside. Are you "
"sure about that?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​你​说​我们​的​其他​队友​已经​进去​了​。​你​确定​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 shuo1 wo3men5 de5 qi2ta1 dui4you3 yi3jing1 jin4qu4 le5。ni3 que4ding4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All right. You say that you're gonna stand down and let the Doc do his thing? Fine.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shifts into a relaxed posture.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's just sit here, then. You don't make any sudden moves, and I don't start pushing buttons."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​你​说​你​不会​轻举妄动​，​让​博士​完成​他​的​事业​？​那好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他换​了​个​轻松​点​的​姿势​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​在​这​老实​待​着​。​你​不​乱来​的话​，​我​也​不会​把​你​怎么样​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 shuo1 ni3 bu4hui4 qing1ju3wang4dong4，rang4 bo2shi4 wan2cheng2 ta1 de5 shi4ye4？na4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan4 le5 ge4 qing1song1 dian3 de5 zi1shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 zai4 zhe4 lao3shi5 dai1 zhao2。ni3 bu4 luan4lai2 de5hua4，wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 ba3 ni3 zen3me5yang4。"

msgid ""
"All right. You wanna talk business, you go talk to Frank, back there on the VIP balcony. If he decides that you're on the level, he can get you upstairs.\n"
"\n"
"But God help you if he doesn't, understand? God help you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​你​想​谈​生意​，​那去​找​弗兰克​谈​，​他​就​在​后边​，​VIP​大厅​的​阳台​上​。​要是​他​觉得​你​讲​的​是​实话​，​他​就​能​让​你​上楼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​要是​他​不​这么​想​，​你​就​得求​上帝保佑​了​，​懂​不​？​上帝​才​保得​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 xiang3 tan2 sheng1yi4，na4 qu4 zhao3 fu2lan2ke4 tan2，ta1 jiu4 zai4 hou4bian5，VIP da4ting1 de5 yang2tai2 shang4。yao4shi5 ta1 jue2de5 ni3 jiang3 de5 shi4 shi2hua4，ta1 jiu4 neng2 rang4 ni3 shang4lou2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 yao4shi5 ta1 bu4 zhe4me5 xiang3，ni3 jiu4 de2 qiu2 shang4 di4 bao3 you4 le5，dong3 bu4？shang4di4 cai2 bao3 de2 le5。"

msgid ""
"All right. You want to know so badly, I'll tell you.\n"
"\n"
"Tamanous sent me here. They want to use Schattennest as a base of operations in Berlin. My point of contact is a ghoul named Beetle."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​既然​你​这么​想​知道​，​我​就​告诉​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​塔玛​诺斯​派​我​来​的​。​他们​想​利用​影巢​作为​在​柏林​的​大本营​。​我​的​联系人​是​个​名叫​“​甲虫​”​的​食尸​鬼​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ji4ran2 ni3 zhe4me5 xiang3 zhi1dao4，wo3 jiu4 gao4su4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ta3 ma3 nuo4 si1 pai4 wo3 lai2 de5。ta1men5 xiang3 li4yong4 ying3 chao2 zuo4wei2 zai4 bo2lin2 de5 da4ben3ying2。wo3 de5 lian2xi4ren2 shi4 ge4 ming2jiao4“jia3chong2” de5 shi2 shi1 gui3。"

msgid "All right. You've convinced me. You can go - but I'm going with you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​你​说服​了​我​。​你​可以​去​—​—​但​要​带​我​一起​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 shuo1fu2 le5 wo3。ni3 ke3yi3 qu4——dan4 yao4 dai4 wo3 yi1qi3。"

msgid "All right. You've got a deal."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​成交​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，cheng2jiao1。"

msgid "All right. You've got ten seconds. Convince me."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​给​你​十秒钟​说服​我​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。gei3 ni3 shi2 miao3 zhong1 shuo1fu2 wo3。"

msgid "All right. You've got your deal."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​成交​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，cheng2jiao1。"

msgid ""
"All right. Your loss.\n"
"\n"
"Look, if you change your mind, come meet me in Room 505 on the Penthouse floor.\n"
"\n"
"I'm tellin' you, you don't want to pass up this deal."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​亏​的​可是​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​你​要是​改​主意​了​，​就​来​顶层​，​上​505​号房​找​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可​告诉​你​啊​，​过​了​这个​村​就​没​这个​店​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。kui1 de5 ke3shi4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，ni3 yao4shi5 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5，jiu4 lai2 ding3ceng2，shang4 505 hao4 fang2 zhao3 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3 gao4su4 ni3 a1，guo4 le5 zhe4ge5 cun1 jiu4 mei2 zhe4ge5 dian4 le5。"

msgid "All right..."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​……\n"
"hao3 ba1……"

msgid ""
"All right... I'm going to let it go. But I'd be more careful in the future "
"if I were you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​……​这次​就算​了​。​但​如果​我​是​你​的话​，​以后​就​小心​点​。\n"
"hao3 ba1……zhe4 ci4 jiu4suan4 le5。dan4 ru2guo3 wo3 shi4 ni3 de5hua4，yi3hou4 jiu4 xiao3xin1 dian3。"

msgid "All right... but be quick. And $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​……​不过​要​快​。​还有​，​$(l.name)​？\n"
"hao3 ba1……bu4guo4 yao4 kuai4。hai2you3，$(l.name)？"

msgid "All right... but don't tell her that I told you? Please?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​……​但别​和​她​说​是​我​告诉​你们​的​，​好​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1……dan4 bie4 he4 ta1 shuo1 shi4 wo3 gao4su4 ni3men5 de5，hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"All riiight! Thanks, chief!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz turns the box over and over in his hands, a huge grin on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's plug this puppy in and see what it does!"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​！​谢​了​，​头儿​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​在​手中​来回​把玩​着​匣子​，​他​的​脸上​露出​大大的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​立刻​接上​这个​小家伙​，​看看​它​有​什么​本事​！\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1！xie4 le5，tou2r5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zai4 shou3 zhong4 lai2hui2 ba3wan2 zhao2 xia2zi5，ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 dai4 dai4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 li4ke4 jie1shang4 zhe4ge5 xiao3 jia1 huo3，kan4kan5 ta1 you3 shen2me5 ben3shi4！"

msgid ""
"All riiiight! Good choice, m'friend. *Good* choice.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a few steps forward and kicks the Company Man's corpse in the head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll just nip into the other room and grab your payment for you. Then we can all be on our way."
msgstr ""
"很​好​！​*​明智​*​的​选择​，​我​的​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向前走​了​几步​，​然后​对​着​公司​佬​尸体​的​脑袋​踢​了​一脚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​去​另个​房间​拿​你​的​报酬​，​然后​我们​就​可以​各回​各家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3！*ming2zhi4*de5 xuan3ze2，wo3 de5 peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 qian2 zou3 le5 ji1 bu4，ran2hou4 dui4 zhao2 gong1si1 lao3 shi1ti3 de5 nao3dai5 ti1 le5 yi1 jiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 qu4 ling4 ge4 fang2jian1 na2 ni3 de5 bao4chou5，ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 ge4 hui2 ge4 jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"All riiiight! My kind of $(l.guy)!\n"
"\n"
"You've got cram, right? I just *love* a $(l.guy) that's willing to share..."
msgstr ""
"好​耶​！​我​就​好​你​这口​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​你​有​“​超感​”​吧​？​我超​*​爱​*​那种​懂得​分享​的​大方​人儿​……\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ye1！wo3 jiu4 hao3 ni3 zhe4 kou3！\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，ni3 you3“chao1 gan3” ba1？wo3 chao1*ai4*na4zhong3 dong3de5 fen1xiang3 de5 da4fang1 ren2r5……"

msgid "All the more reason to gather Alice's fee quickly, then."
msgstr ""
"那​就​更​有​理由​尽快​筹集​爱丽丝​要求​的​酬金​了​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 geng1 you3 li3you2 jin3kuai4 chou2ji2 ai4li4si1 yao1qiu2 de5 chou2jin1 le5。"

msgid "All the time in the world."
msgstr ""
"直到​一切​结束​。\n"
"zhi2dao4 yi1qie4 jie2shu4。"

msgid ""
"All the while my mother was screaming and flailing at him.\n"
"\n"
"She took a couple of licks with the hammer, too."
msgstr ""
"与此同时​，​我​母亲​一直​在​尖叫​着​对​他​挥舞​手臂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​最后​也​挨​了​几下​锤子​。\n"
"\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，wo3 mu3qin1 yi1zhi2 zai4 jian1jiao4 zhao2 dui4 ta1 hui1wu3 shou3bi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zui4hou4 ye3 ai1 le5 ji1 xia4 chui2zi5。"

msgid "All theirs."
msgstr ""
"全都​是​他们​的​。\n"
"quan2dou1 shi4 ta1men5 de5。"

msgid "All we ask is that this is the only time. I hope you can promise that."
msgstr ""
"我们​想要​的​只有​这种​事​不会​再​发生​第二次​。​我​希望​你​能​保证​这​一点​。\n"
"wo3men5 xiang3yao4 de5 zhi3you3 zhe4zhong3 shi4 bu4hui4 zai4 fa1sheng1 di4er4ci4。wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 bao3zheng4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "All yours, pleasure doing business."
msgstr ""
"东西​给​你​。​交易​愉快​。\n"
"dong1xi1 gei3 ni3。jiao1yi4 yu2kuai4。"

msgid "Alley Door"
msgstr ""
"小巷​门\n"
"xiao3xiang4 men2"

msgid "Alley Door Closed"
msgstr ""
"小巷​门​已​关闭\n"
"xiao3xiang4 men2 yi3 guan1bi4"

msgid "Alley Door Open"
msgstr ""
"小巷​门​已​开启\n"
"xiao3xiang4 men2 yi3 kai1qi3"

msgid "Alley Mage Outfit"
msgstr ""
"暗巷​法师​服装\n"
"an4 xiang4 fa3shi1 fu2zhuang1"

msgid "Alley Punk"
msgstr ""
"暗巷​混混\n"
"an4 xiang4 hun4 hun4"

msgid ""
"Allow me to share a truth with you, shadowrunner. The truly powerful do nothing themselves unless they absolutely have to.\n"
"\n"
"Instead, they delegate. Others do the work for them, and they reap the benefits."
msgstr ""
"让​我​告诉​你​一个​真理​吧​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​对于​真正​的​强者​而言​，​除非​万不得已​，​否则​绝不会​亲自动手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​运筹帷幄​，​让​别人​替​他们​做事​，​最后​坐享其成​。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 gao4su4 ni3 yi1ge5 zhen1li3 ba1，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。dui4yu2 zhen1zheng4 de5 jiang4 zhe3 er2yan2，chu2fei1 wan4bu4de2yi3，fou3ze2 jue2 bu4 hui4 qin1zi4dong4shou3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yun4chou2wei2wo4，rang4 bie2ren5 ti4 ta1men5 zuo4shi4，zui4hou4 zuo4xiang3qi2cheng2。"

msgid "Allows access to maintenance closets on hotel floors."
msgstr ""
"允许​你​进入​旅馆​各楼层​的​维修​储物间​。\n"
"yun3xu3 ni3 jin4ru4 lu:3guan3 ge4 lou2 ceng2 de5 wei2xiu1 chu3 wu4 jian1。"

msgid "Allows the Rigger access to more and different drones and abilities."
msgstr ""
"允许​机师​控制​更​多​数量​与​类型​的​无人机​并​获得​更​多​不同​能力​。\n"
"yun3xu3 ji1shi1 kong4zhi4 geng1 duo1 shu4liang4 yu4 lei4xing2 de5 wu2ren2ji1 bing4 huo4de2 geng1 duo1 bu4tong2 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"Almost a week.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shuffles her feet. Eventually, she looks up with a small smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's wonderful."
msgstr ""
"快​一个​星期​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​来回​挪动​着​脚步​。​最终​，​她​抬起​头​，​嘴角​浮现​一抹​浅笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这儿​太棒了​。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4 yi1ge5 xing1qi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lai2hui2 nuo2dong4 zhao2 jiao3bu4。zui4zhong1，ta1 tai2qi3 tou2，zui3jiao3 fu2xian4 yi1 ma1 jian1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4r5 tai4 bang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Almost every inch of the thing is covered in dull steel and gleaming chrome. Its mechanical arms end in articulated hands that wouldn't look out of place on an industrial machine... bulky, cumbersome things, designed for crushing power rather than finesse.\n"
"\n"
"Clutched in one of those crushing hands, a chaingun glints with sinister purpose."
msgstr ""
"这​东西​几乎​从头到脚​都​被​改造​过​，​全身​覆盖​着​黯淡​的​钢铁​与​闪亮​的​镀铬​层​。​机械​臂​的​末端​安装​有​铰接式​赛博​手掌​，​就算​放在​工厂​机器​上​都​不​违​和​……​这种​厚实​笨重​的​玩意儿​做不了​精细​活​，​但​却​有着​碾压​级​的​力量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​其中​一只​手​还​紧握着​一挺​机枪​，​枪身​闪烁着​阴森​的​杀意​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 ji1hu1 cong2tou2dao4jiao3 dou1 bei4 gai3zao4 guo4，quan2shen1 fu4gai4 zhao2 an4dan4 de5 gang1tie3 yu4 shan3liang4 de5 du4 ge4 ceng2。ji1xie4 bi4 de5 mo4duan1 an1zhuang1 you3 jiao3 jie1 shi4 sai4bo2 shou3zhang3，jiu4suan4 fang4 zai4 gong1chang3 ji1qi4 shang4 dou1 bu4 wei2 he4……zhe4zhong3 hou4shi5 ben4zhong4 de5 wan2yi4r5 zuo4 bu4 le5 jing1xi4 huo2，dan4 que4 you3zhe5 nian3ya1 ji2 de5 li4liang5。\n"
"\n"
"qi2zhong1 yi1 zhi3 shou3 hai2 jin3 wo4 zhao2 yi1 ting3 ji1qiang1，qiang1 shen1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 yin1sen1 de5 sha1 yi4。"

msgid "Alnur"
msgstr ""
"奥​努尔\n"
"ao4 nu3 er3"

msgid "Alnur's Outfit"
msgstr ""
"奥​努尔​的​服装\n"
"ao4 nu3 er3 de5 fu2zhuang1"

msgid ""
"Alone... \n"
"\n"
"...alone on the wind. "
msgstr ""
"孤独​一人​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​飘​在​风中​。\n"
"\n"
"gu1du2 yi1 ren2……\n"
"\n"
"……piao1 zai4 feng1 zhong4。"

msgid "Alpha team, be advised we've lost control of the situation."
msgstr ""
"A​小队​注意​，​局势​已经​失控​。\n"
"a xiao3 dui4 zhu4yi4，ju2shi4 yi3jing1 shi1kong4。"

msgid ""
"Alpha-level cyberlegs made by Universal Omnitech. Adds +8 HP, +1 Quickness, "
"and +1 Dodge."
msgstr ""
"由​环球​全能​科技​制造​的​阿尔法​级赛​博腿​。​提供​+​8​生命​值​、​+​1​敏捷​和​+​1​闪避​。\n"
"you2 huan2qiu2 quan2neng2 ke1ji4 zhi4zao4 de5 a1er3fa3 ji2 sai4 bo2 tui3。ti2gong1 +8 sheng1ming4 zhi2、+1 min3jie2 he4 +1 shan3bi4。"

msgid ""
"Already died once. Every day since is just a bonus. A tired, painful bonus."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​死过​一次​。​打​那​之后​的​每​一天​都​是​馈赠​。​尽管​是​劳累​而​又​痛苦​的​馈赠​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 si3 guo4 yi1ci4。da3 na4 zhi1hou4 de5 mei3 yi1 tian1 dou1 shi4 kui4zeng4。jin3guan3 shi4 lao2lei4 er2 you4 tong4ku3 de5 kui4zeng4。"

msgid "Alright, you first. What's the deal with you and Altuğ?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​先​说​。​你​和​奥图​伊​之间​是​怎么回事​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 xian1 shuo1。ni3 he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 zhi1jian1 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "Also the best way to get good men killed."
msgstr ""
"也​最​容易​让​好人​无辜​丧命​。\n"
"ye3 zui4 rong2yi4 rang4 hao3ren2 wu2gu1 sang4ming4。"

msgid "Alter the Facility's Operations Records"
msgstr ""
"更改​设施​的​运行​记录\n"
"geng1gai3 she4shi1 de5 yun4xing2 ji4lu4"

msgid ""
"Although the access port has been replaced, black scorch marks still mar the surface of the Matrix access panel. \n"
"\n"
"This is where Monika jacked in. Where she met APEX."
msgstr ""
"尽管​访问​端口​已​被​更换​，​但​矩阵​访问​面板​的​表面​仍​留有​黑色​烧焦​痕迹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就是​莫妮卡​的​接入点​。​她​就是​在​这里​见到​了​APEX​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 fang3wen4 duan1kou3 yi3 bei4 geng1huan4，dan4 ju3zhen4 fang3wen4 mian4ban3 de5 biao3mian4 reng2 liu2you3 hei1se4 shao1jiao1 hen2ji4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 jie1ru4dian3。ta1 jiu4shi4 zai4 zhe4li3 jian4dao4 le5 APEX。"

msgid ""
"Altug gave me a good job, and I'm super grateful for it. \n"
"\n"
"Which reminds me... I should get back to it. See you later?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before returning to the comm at her wrist.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"奥图​伊给​了​我​一份​好​工作​，​我​对此​十分​感激​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​起来​……​我该​继续​干活​了​。​回头见​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转回​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ao4 tu2 yi1 gei3 le5 wo3 yi1 fen4 hao3 gong1zuo4，wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 gan3ji1。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 qi3lai5……wo3 gai1 ji4xu4 gan4huo2 le5。hui2tou2jian4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3hui2 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Altuğ Burakgazi"
msgstr ""
"奥图​伊​·​布拉加​齐\n"
"ao4 tu2 yi1 · bu4 la1 jia1 qi2"

msgid ""
"Altuğ! I have been waiting for my coffee for nearly an hour already! Are you"
" growing the beans out back?"
msgstr ""
"奥图​伊​！​都​一个​小时​了​，​我​的​咖啡​怎么​还​没上​！​你​是​在​后面​现种​咖啡豆​吗​？\n"
"ao4 tu2 yi1！dou1 yi1ge5 xiao3shi2 le5，wo3 de5 ka1fei1 zen3me5 hai2 mei2 shang4！ni3 shi4 zai4 hou4mian5 xian4 zhong3 ka1fei1dou4 ma5？"

msgid "Altuğ's Memory Stick"
msgstr ""
"奥图​伊​的​记忆棒\n"
"ao4 tu2 yi1 de5 ji4yi4bang4"

msgid ""
"Altuğ, I sent a man named Quorin to talk to you. I told him he could have "
"access to your data taps."
msgstr ""
"奥图​伊​，​我​让​一个​名叫​奎林​的​人来​找​你​聊聊​。​我​跟​他​说​他​可以​访问​你​的​数据​插口​。\n"
"ao4 tu2 yi1，wo3 rang4 yi1ge5 ming2jiao4 kui2 lin2 de5 ren2 lai2 zhao3 ni3 liao2 liao2。wo3 gen1 ta1 shuo1 ta1 ke3yi3 fang3wen4 ni3 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3。"

msgid ""
"Always good to talk to you, Doc. Look, we need to talk about these ghouls."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​能​和​你​聊天​，​医生​。​我要​和​你​谈谈​食尸​鬼​的​事​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 he4 ni3 liao2tian1，yi1sheng1。wo3 yao4 he4 ni3 tan2tan2 shi2 shi1 gui3 de5 shi4。"

msgid "Always."
msgstr ""
"一向如此​。\n"
"yi1 xiang4 ru2 ci3。"

msgid "Always... no. Never..."
msgstr ""
"永远​要​……​不​对​。​绝不​要​……\n"
"yong3yuan3 yao4……bu4 dui4。jue2bu4 yao4……"

msgid "Am I in trouble?"
msgstr ""
"我会​有​麻烦​吗​？\n"
"wo3 hui4 you3 ma2fan5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Am I right in thinking that you're gonna break into the Aztechnology facility over there?\n"
"\n"
"I mean, that *has* to be your next move. It's the only thing that makes sense."
msgstr ""
"你​要​闯进​那边​的​阿兹特​科技​设施​，​我​说​的​没错​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​那里​*​肯定​*​是​你​的​下​一步​目标​。​只有​这样​一切​才​合理​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 chuang3jin4 na4bian5 de5 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1，wo3 shuo1 de5 mei2cuo4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"na4li5*ken3ding4*shi4 ni3 de5 xia4 yi1 bu4 mu4biao1。zhi3you3 zhe4yang4 yi1qie4 cai2 he2li3。"

msgid ""
"Am I ultimately sorry that she's dead...? Yes. Killing her brought me no joy.\n"
"\n"
"But, on the other hand, I'm not sure what the alternative would be."
msgstr ""
"我​最终​是否​为​她​的​死​感到遗憾​……​？​是​的​。​杀死​她​不会​让​我​得到​任何​快乐​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​从​另一方面​来说​，​我​并​不​确定​，​如果​事情​朝​相反​的​方向​发展​，​会​是​怎样​的​结局​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4zhong1 shi4fou3 wei2 ta1 de5 si3 gan3 dao4 yi2 han4……？shi4 de5。sha1si3 ta1 bu4hui4 rang4 wo3 de2dao4 ren4he2 kuai4le4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 cong2 ling4yi1fang1mian4 lai2 shuo1，wo3 bing4 bu4 que4ding4，ru2guo3 shi4qing5 chao2 xiang1fan3 de5 fang1xiang4 fa1zhan3，hui4 shi4 zen3yang4 de5 jie2ju2。"

msgid ""
"Amen to that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances at his wristwatch.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wanna get back home before my grandkids go to bed."
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​瞥​了​一眼​自己​的​手表​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​能​在​我​的​孙孩们​睡觉​前​赶回​家​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 zi4ji3 de5 shou3biao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 neng2 zai4 wo3 de5 sun1 hai2 men5 shui4jiao4 qian2 gan3 hui2 jia1。"

msgid "Amen to that. Now tell your pal to work his magic."
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​。​让​你​的​朋友​来​大显身手​吧​。\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。rang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 lai2 da4xian3shen1shou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Amidst the collected detritus of many years of neglect, you find an old-"
"fashioned clipboard with a keycard attached."
msgstr ""
"在​多年​积尘​的​杂物​堆里​，​你​找到​了​一块​老式​夹板​，​上面​夹​着​一张​门禁卡​。\n"
"zai4 duo1nian2 ji1 chen2 de5 za2wu4 dui1 li3，ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1kuai4 lao3shi4 jia1ban3，shang4mian4 jia1 zhao2 yi1 zhang1 men2 jin1 ka3。"

msgid "Ammo"
msgstr ""
"弹药\n"
"dan4yao4"

msgid "Ammonia"
msgstr ""
"一​水合​氨\n"
"yi1 shui3he2 an1"

msgid ""
"Among other things, yeah. And killin' him... well, it wasn't *my* idea.\n"
"\n"
"But I found myself a new second-in-command who didn't like Hasenkamp much, and, well... the rest is history."
msgstr ""
"是​这么回事​吧​。​关于​杀​了​他​这件​事​……​其实​不是​*​我​的​*​主意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​的​新​副手​不怎么​喜欢​哈森​坎普​，​至于​剩下​的​事情​……​你​也​看到​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 ba1。guan1yu2 sha1 le5 ta1 zhe4 jian4 shi4……qi2shi2 bu4shi4*wo3 de5*zhu3yi5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 de5 xin1 fu4shou3 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 Ha1sen1kan3pu3，zhi4yu2 sheng4xia4 de5 shi4qing5……ni3 ye3 kan4dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Amongst the various other items in the locked drawer, you find the "
"supervisor's ID badge."
msgstr ""
"在​抽屉​里面​的​一堆​东西​里​，​你​找到​了​监事​的​徽章​。\n"
"zai4 chou1ti5 li3mian4 de5 yi1dui1 dong1xi1 li3，ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 jian1 shi4 de5 hui1zhang1。"

msgid "Amsel has told you that the password is \"VOLKLINGEN\"."
msgstr ""
"阿姆​泽尔​已经​告诉​你​密码​是​“​弗尔​克林根​”​。\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 yi3jing1 gao4su4 ni3 mi4ma3 shi4“fu2 er3 ke4 lin2 gen1”。"

msgid ""
"Amsel is dead. \n"
"\n"
"The Kreuzbasar is under attack.\n"
"\n"
"And it's entirely possible that an ambush party is already waiting to meet you at the U-Bahn platform."
msgstr ""
"阿姆​泽尔死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​克洛伊​茨​集市​正在​遭受​袭击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​很​可能​有​一支​伏击​队​已经​在​地铁​月台​等​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zheng4zai4 zao1shou4 xi2ji1。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 hen3 ke3neng2 you3 yi1 zhi1 fu2ji1 dui4 yi3jing1 zai4 di4tie3 yue4tai2 deng3 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Amsel steps back, clearing a path for you to access the antique machine."
msgstr ""
"阿姆​泽尔向​后​站​了​站​，​给​你​让出​一条​通往​古董​机器​的​路​来​。\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 xiang4 hou4 zhan4 le5 zhan4，gei3 ni3 rang4 chu1 yi1 tiao2 tong1wang3 gu3dong3 ji1qi4 de5 lu4 lai2。"

msgid "Amsel's Encoded Credstick"
msgstr ""
"阿姆​泽尔​的​加密​信用​棒\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 de5 jia1mi4 xin4yong4 bang4"

msgid ""
"Amsel's image flickers, then winks away. \n"
"\n"
"A moment later, a glowing blue text field begins to scroll up from the bottom of the screen."
msgstr ""
"画面​一闪​，​阿姆​泽尔​的​影像​消失​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​一个​发光​的​蓝色​文本框​开始​从​屏幕​底端​向上​滚动​。\n"
"\n"
"hua4mian4 yi1 shan3，E1mu3ze2er3 de5 ying3xiang4 xiao1shi1。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，yi1ge5 fa1guang1 de5 lan2se4 wen2ben3kuang4 kai1shi3 cong2 ping2mu4 di3duan1 xiang4shang4 gun3dong4。"

msgid "Amulet worn by the Magnifikers to signify full membership"
msgstr ""
"伟术​帮​佩戴​的​护符​，​象征​着​完全​会员​身份​。\n"
"wei3 shu4 bang1 pei4dai4 de5 hu4 fu2，xiang4zheng1 zhao2 wan2quan2 hui4yuan2 shen1fen4。"

msgid "An Ares Classic."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​经典​型号​。\n"
"a1rui4si1 jing1dian3 xing2hao4。"

msgid ""
"An Ares spokesman has announced that, while regrettable, this morning's "
"actions were necessary; the Chicago hive posed an inestimable threat to the "
"safety and security of the UCAS as a whole, and with the failure of the CZ, "
"a nuclear strike was deemed to be the most viable remaining option."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​工业​的​一名​发言人​宣布​，​尽管​令人遗憾​，​但​今晨​的​行动​实属​必要​；​芝加哥​虫​巢​对​整个​加​美​合众国​的​安全​构成​了​无法估量​的​威胁​，​而​随着​芝加哥​隔离区​的​崩溃​，​核打击​被​认定​为​现存​最​可行​的​选项​。\n"
"a1rui4si1 gong1ye4 de5 yi1 ming2 fa1yan2ren2 xuan1bu4，jin3guan3 ling3 ren2 yi2 han4，dan4 jin1chen2 de5 xing2dong4 shi2shu3 bi4yao4 ； zhi1jia1ge1 chong2 chao2 dui4 zheng3ge4 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 de5 an1quan2 gou4cheng2 le5 wu2 fa3 gu1 liang2 de5 wei1xie2，er2 sui2zhe5 zhi1jia1ge1 ge2 li2 qu1 de5 beng1kui4，he2 da3 ji1 bei4 ren4ding4 wei2 xian4cun2 zui4 ke3xing2 de5 xuan3xiang4。"

msgid "An Ares stealth suit that grants +1 Dodge and +1 Movement."
msgstr ""
"一款​由​阿瑞斯​工业​制作​的​潜行​套装​，​提供​+​1​闪避​与​+​1​移动力​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 you2 a1rui4si1 gong1ye4 zhi4zuo4 de5 qian2xing2 tao4zhuang1，ti2gong1 +1 shan3bi4 yu4 +1 yi2 dong4 li4。"

msgid ""
"An Aztechnology consultant? Dressed in a Knight Errant uniform?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He reaches for his weapon.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't think so."
msgstr ""
"你​是​阿兹特​科技​的​顾问​？​却​穿着​游侠​骑士​的​制服​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​将​手​伸向​武器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​才​不信​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 gu4wen4？que4 chuan1zhuo2 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 zhi4fu2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 shou3 shen1 xiang4 wu3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai2 bu4 xin4。"

msgid ""
"An Aztechnology security guard and an LTG tech are locked in a heated exchange.\n"
"\n"
"They don't seem to notice your approach."
msgstr ""
"一名​阿兹特​科技​警卫​和​一名​LTG​技术人员​正在​激烈​争吵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​他们​并​没有​注意​到​你​的​接近​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 ming2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 jing3wei4 he4 yi1 ming2 LTG ji4shu4ren2yuan2 zheng4zai4 ji1lie4 zheng1chao3。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 ta1men5 bing4 mei2you3 zhu4yi4 dao4 ni3 de5 jie1jin4。"

msgid "An advanced drone repair kit that repairs a minimum of 20 HP."
msgstr ""
"一款​高级​无人机​修复​套件​，​至少​修复​20​点​无人机​生命​值​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 gao1ji2 wu2ren2ji1 xiu1fu4 tao4jian4，zhi4shao3 xiu1fu4 20 dian3 wu2ren2ji1 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"An alchemical alloy. It's inherently magical, hellishly difficult to make, and incredibly expensive.\n"
"\n"
"It's also the key ingredient in a lot of magical foci, and it's what makes this balm react the way that it does to astral energy."
msgstr ""
"一种​炼金术​的​合金​。​它​天生​具有​魔力​，​制作​难度​极高​，​因而​极其​昂贵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​也​是​许多​法器​的​关键​成分​，​正是​它​使得​这种​药膏​能​对​星界​能量​作出反应​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhong3 lian4jin1shu4 de5 he2jin1。ta1 tian1sheng1 ju4you3 mo2li4，zhi4zuo4 nan2du4 ji2 gao1，yin1er2 ji2qi2 ang2gui4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ye3 shi4 xu3duo1 fa3 qi4 de5 guan1jian4 cheng2fen4，zheng4shi4 ta1 shi3de5 zhe4zhong3 yao4gao1 neng2 dui4 xing1 jie4 neng2liang4 zuo4 chu1 fan3 ying1。"

msgid ""
"An all-too-familiar face appears on the screen.\n"
"\n"
"She's frowning, a look of incredible sorrow in her eyes."
msgstr ""
"一张​再​熟悉​不过​的​脸​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​皱着眉头​，​眼中​流露出​难以​言喻​的​悲伤​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 zhang1 zai4 shu2xi1 bu4guo4 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2，yan3zhong1 liu2 lou4 chu1 nan2yi3 yan2yu4 de5 bei1shang1。"

msgid "An ancient blood magic that also does ongoing -3 HP for 2 RNDs."
msgstr ""
"一种​古老​的​血​魔法​，​同时​造成​持续​2​回合​的​-​3​生命​值​伤害​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 gu3lao3 de5 xie3 mo2fa3，tong2shi2 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 -3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。"

msgid "An ancient blood magic that also does ongoing -6 HP for 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"一种​古老​的​血​魔法​，​同时​造成​持续​2​回合​的​-​6​生命​值​伤害​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 gu3lao3 de5 xie3 mo2fa3，tong2shi2 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 2 hui2he2 de5 -6 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"An area effect spell that increases the cost of magic by 1 AP. Lasts for 3 "
"RNDS."
msgstr ""
"一个​区域​效果​法术​，​使​魔法​的​消耗​增加​1​点​行动​点​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"yi1ge5 qu1yu4 xiao4guo3 fa3shu4，shi3 mo2fa3 de5 xiao1hao4 zeng1jia1 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"An area effect spell that reduces any sound made in it to 0. Lasts for 4 "
"RNDS."
msgstr ""
"一个​区域​效果​法术​，​将​其中​产生​的​任何​声音​降低​至​0​。​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"yi1ge5 qu1yu4 xiao4guo3 fa3shu4，jiang1 qi2zhong1 chan3sheng1 de5 ren4he2 sheng1yin1 jiang4di1 zhi4 0。chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"An area effect spell that reduces the chance to target someone by 15%. Lasts"
" for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"一个​区域​效果​法术​，​目标​区域​内​人物​的​命中率​降低​15​%​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"yi1ge5 qu1yu4 xiao4guo3 fa3shu4，mu4biao1 qu1yu4 nei4 ren2wu4 de5 ming4zhong4lu:4 jiang4di1 15 %。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid "An area-effect Matrix attack that deals -100 IP DMG to IC and deckers."
msgstr ""
"一种​具有​区域​影响​的​矩阵​攻击​，​对​IC​和​碟​客​伤害​造成​-​100​结合​度​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 ju4you3 qu1yu4 ying3xiang3 de5 ju3zhen4 gong1ji1，dui4 IC he4 die2 ke4 shang1hai4 zao4cheng2 -100 jie2he2 du4 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"An area-effect Matrix attack that deals -50 IP DMG to IC and deckers, and "
"roots them in place for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"区域性​矩阵​攻击​，​对​IC​和​碟​客​造成​50​点​结合​度​伤害​，​并​将​其定​身​1​回合​。\n"
"qu1yu4xing4 ju3zhen4 gong1ji1，dui4 IC he4 die2 ke4 zao4cheng2 50 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4，bing4 jiang1 qi2 ding4 shen1 1 hui2he2。"

msgid "An area-effect Matrix attack that deals -50 IP DMG to IC and deckers."
msgstr ""
"区域性​矩阵​攻击​，​对​反​入侵​机制​和​黑客​造成​-​50​结合​度​伤害​。\n"
"qu1yu4xing4 ju3zhen4 gong1ji1，dui4 fan3 ru4qin1 ji1zhi4 he4 hei1ke4 zao4cheng2 -50 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"An area-effect Matrix attack that deals -75 IP DMG to IC and deckers, and "
"roots them in place for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"区域性​矩阵​攻击​，​对​IC​和​碟​客​造成​75​点​结合​度​伤害​，​并​将​其定​身​1​回合​。\n"
"qu1yu4xing4 ju3zhen4 gong1ji1，dui4 IC he4 die2 ke4 zao4cheng2 75 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4，bing4 jiang1 qi2 ding4 shen1 1 hui2he2。"

msgid "An area-effect Matrix attack that deals -75 IP DMG to IC and deckers."
msgstr ""
"一种​具有​区域​影响​的​矩阵​攻击​，​对​IC​和​碟​客​伤害​造成​-​75​结合​度​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 ju4you3 qu1yu4 ying3xiang3 de5 ju3zhen4 gong1ji1，dui4 IC he4 die2 ke4 shang1hai4 zao4cheng2 -75 jie2he2 du4 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"An area-effect matrix attack that deals -25 IP DMG to IC and deckers, and "
"roots them in place for 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"区域性​矩阵​攻击​，​对​IC​和​碟​客​造成​25​点​结合​度​伤害​，​并​将​其定​身​1​回合​。\n"
"qu1yu4xing4 ju3zhen4 gong1ji1，dui4 IC he4 die2 ke4 zao4cheng2 25 dian3 jie2he2 du4 shang1hai4，bing4 jiang1 qi2 ding4 shen1 1 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"An armored ensemble developed for black-ops commandos. Grants +1 to all "
"attributes."
msgstr ""
"为​黑色​行动​突击队​开发​的​护甲​套装​。​所有​属性​加​+​1​。\n"
"wei2 hei1se4 xing2dong4 tu1ji1dui4 kai1fa1 de5 hu4jia3 tao4zhuang1。suo3you3 shu3xing4 jia1 +1。"

msgid ""
"An armored vest of lightweight materials. Solid protection with minimum "
"reduction in mobility. Grants +1 Quickness and +5 HP."
msgstr ""
"轻质​材料​制成​的​防弹背心​。​在​提供​坚实​防护​的​同时​最大​限度​保持​了​机动性​。​提供​+​1​敏捷​和​+​5​生命​值​。\n"
"qing1 zhi4 cai2liao4 zhi4cheng2 de5 fang2 dan4 bei1 xin1。zai4 ti2gong1 jian1shi2 fang2hu4 de5 tong2shi2 zui4 dai4 xian4du4 bao3chi2 le5 ji1dong4xing4。ti2gong1 +1 min3jie2 he4 +5 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "An attack program that hits a decker's meat body for -15 HP."
msgstr ""
"一种​攻击​程序​，​对​碟​客​的​肉体​造成​-​15​生命​值​的​伤害​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 gong1ji1 cheng2xu4，dui4 die2 ke4 de5 rou4ti3 zao4cheng2 -15 sheng1ming4 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid "An effective flash grenade. Does -2 AP to everyone hit by its blast."
msgstr ""
"一枚​高效​的​闪光弹​。​对​爆炸​波及​的​所有​目标​造成​-​2​点​行动​点​损失​。\n"
"yi1 mei2 gao1xiao4 de5 shan3guang1dan4。dui4 bao4zha4 bo1ji2 de5 suo3you3 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 -2 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3 sun3shi1。"

msgid ""
"An effective flash grenade. Does -2 AP to everyone hit by its blast. Makes "
"targets easier to hit."
msgstr ""
"一枚​高效​的​闪光弹​。​对​爆炸​波及​的​所有​目标​造成​-​2​行动​点​损失​，​使​目标​更易​被​命中​。\n"
"yi1 mei2 gao1xiao4 de5 shan3guang1dan4。dui4 bao4zha4 bo1ji2 de5 suo3you3 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 -2 xing2dong4 dian3 sun3shi1，shi3 mu4biao1 geng1 yi4 bei4 ming4zhong4。"

msgid ""
"An effective shock grenade. Does -2 AP to everyone hit by its blast. Makes "
"targets easier to hit."
msgstr ""
"一枚​高效​的​震撼​弹​。​对​爆炸​波及​的​所有​目标​造成​-​2​行动​点​损失​，​使​目标​更易​被​命中​。\n"
"yi1 mei2 gao1xiao4 de5 zhen4han4 dan4。dui4 bao4zha4 bo1ji2 de5 suo3you3 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 -2 xing2dong4 dian3 sun3shi1，shi3 mu4biao1 geng1 yi4 bei4 ming4zhong4。"

msgid ""
"An elaborate plan to destroy an entire species, a massive underground "
"fortress with an army of mercenaries... you sound just like a dragon, Doc."
msgstr ""
"一个​精心策划​的​灭绝​整个​物种​的​计划​，​一座​庞大​的​地下​要塞​，​配有​一支​雇佣军​部队​……​听​起来​你​和​巨龙​没什么​两样​，​博士​。\n"
"yi1ge5 jing1 xin1 ce4 hua2 de5 mie4jue2 zheng3ge4 wu4zhong3 de5 ji4hua4，yi1 zuo4 pang2da4 de5 di4xia4 yao4sai4，pei4you3 yi1 zhi1 gu4 yong4 jun1 bu4dui4……ting1 qi3lai5 ni3 he4 ju4long2 mei2shen2me5 liang3yang4，bo2shi4。"

msgid "An electrical junction box."
msgstr ""
"一只​电力​接线盒​。\n"
"yi1 zhi3 dian4li4 jie1xian4he2。"

msgid ""
"An encoded credstick loaded with the funds that you raised to pay for "
"Alice's services. ¥50,000 in Alice's hands; a paperweight in anyone else's."
msgstr ""
"一根​加密​信用​棒​，​上面​存有​你​筹集​而​来​，​要​付给​爱丽丝​的​服务费​。​在​爱丽丝​手中​价值​五万​新円​；​对​其他人​来说​只是​个​压纸​用​的​小玩意​。\n"
"yi1 gen1 jia1mi4 xin4yong4 bang4，shang4mian4 cun2you3 ni3 chou2ji2 er2 lai2，yao4 fu4gei3 ai4li4si1 de5 fu2wu4fei4。zai4 ai4li4si1 shou3 zhong4 jia4zhi2 wu3 wan4 xin1 yuan2 ； dui4 qi2 ta1 ren2 lai2 shuo1 zhi3shi4 ge4 ya1 zhi3 yong4 de5 xiao3wan2yi4。"

msgid ""
"An encoded credstick. This is a high-end model, with strong cryptography "
"protecting it against unauthorized use."
msgstr ""
"一根​加密​信用​棒​。​高端​机型​，​配备​了​强大​的​加密技术​，​可​有效​防止​未经​授权​的​使用​。\n"
"yi1 gen1 jia1mi4 xin4yong4 bang4。gao1duan1 ji1xing2，pei4bei4 le5 qiang2da4 de5 jia1 mi4 ji4 shu4，ke3 you3xiao4 fang2zhi3 wei4jing1 shou4quan2 de5 shi3yong4。"

msgid "An encrypted program taken from Jürgen Plotz's avatar in the Matrix."
msgstr ""
"从​尤尔根​·​普​洛茨​的​矩阵​显像​中​提取​的​加密​程序​。\n"
"cong2 you2 er3 gen1 · Pu3luo4ci2 de5 ju3zhen4 xian3xiang4 zhong4 ti2qu3 de5 jia1mi4 cheng2xu4。"

msgid ""
"An expensive bottle of scotch. From the color, you'd guess that the contents"
" are at least 50% water."
msgstr ""
"一瓶​昂贵​的​苏格兰​威士忌​。​从​颜色​来看​，​你​猜测​至少​50​%​的​内容​是​水​。\n"
"yi1 ping2 ang2gui4 de5 su1ge2lan2 wei1shi4ji4。cong2 yan2se4 lai2 kan4，ni3 cai1ce4 zhi4shao3 50%de5 nei4rong2 shi4 shui3。"

msgid "An expert drone repair kit that repairs a minimum of 30 HP."
msgstr ""
"一款​专家级​无人机​修复​套件​，​至少​修复​30​点​无人机​生命​值​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 zhuan1 jia1 ji2 wu2ren2ji1 xiu1fu4 tao4jian4，zhi4shao3 xiu1fu4 30 dian3 wu2ren2ji1 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"An explanation? No. But I do have thoughts on the matter.\n"
"\n"
"Many terrible things have happened over the past few months, and I do not believe them to be coincidences. These events are connected somehow - I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""
"解释​？​我​没什么​好​解释​的​。​但​我​可以​告诉​你​目前​的​情况​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​数月​间接​连​发生​诸多​骇人​事件​，​我​确信​这​绝非​偶然​。​尽管​这些​现象​看似​毫无关系​，​却​实则​暗藏​关联​……​我​对此​深信不疑​。\n"
"\n"
"jie3shi4？wo3 mei2shen2me5 hao3 jie3shi4 de5。dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3 mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 shu4yue4 jian4jie1 lian2 fa1sheng1 zhu1duo1 hai4ren2 shi4jian4，wo3 que4xin4 zhe4 jue2fei1 ou3ran2。jin3guan3 zhe4xie1 xian4xiang4 kan4si4 hao2 wu2 guan1 xi4，que4 shi2ze2 an4cang2 guan1lian2……wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1xin4bu4yi2。"

msgid ""
"An eye-mounted laser that can designate a target, making it easier for your "
"team to hit."
msgstr ""
"一种​可​安装​在​眼睛​上​的​激光​设备​，​用于​标记​目标​，​使​你​的​队友​更​容易​击中​它们​。\n"
"yi1zhong3 ke3 an1zhuang1 zai4 yan3jing5 shang4 de5 ji1guang1 she4bei4，yong4yu2 biao1ji4 mu4biao1，shi3 ni3 de5 dui4you3 geng1 rong2yi4 ji1zhong4 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"An image flickers onto the frame: Philip, leaning against a wall, listlessly chewing on an unidentifiable hunk of cooked meat. He looks miserable.\n"
"\n"
"A drone comes to inspect him, and he pushes it away."
msgstr ""
"画面​闪现​出​一幅​图像​：​菲利普​靠​在​墙上​，​无精打采​地嚼​着​一块​看不出​是​什么​的​熟肉​。​他​看起来​非常​痛苦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一架​无人机​靠近​检查​他​，​他​厌烦​地​把​它​推开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hua4mian4 shan3xian4 chu1 yi1 fu2 tu2xiang4：fei1li4pu3 kao4 zai4 qiang2 shang4，wu2jing1da3cai3 de5 jiao2 zhao2 yi1kuai4 kan4bu5chu1 shi4 shen2me5 de5 shu2 rou4。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 fei1chang2 tong4ku3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 jia4 wu2ren2ji1 kao4jin4 jian3cha2 ta1，ta1 yan4fan2 de5 ba3 ta1 tui1kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"An impressive sum, $(l.name). Quite enough money to justify a meeting, I would think.\n"
"\n"
"If you don’t feel that she’s on the up-and-up, you can always refuse the job."
msgstr ""
"这​是​笔​可观​的​数目​，​$(l.name)​。​就​冲​这笔​钱​的​份​上​，​我​觉得​去​见​一面​也​没什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​觉得​她​不​可靠​，​随时​可以​拒绝​这份​差事​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 bi3 ke3guan1 de5 shu4mu4，$(l.name)。jiu4 chong1 zhe4 bi3 qian2 de5 fen4 shang4，wo3 jue2de5 qu4 jian4 yi1mian4 ye3 mei2shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 jue2de5 ta1 bu4 ke3kao4，sui2shi2 ke3yi3 ju4jue2 zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"An incomprehensible screech cuts off the mage's sentence. In your peripheral vision, you catch a flurry of motion.\n"
"\n"
"Your elvish companion is moving, making a beeline toward James. Jana is hanging off of him, trying to slow him down, but he barely seems to notice."
msgstr ""
"一声​刺耳​的​尖叫​打断​了​法师​的​话语​。​你​用​余光​瞥见​一阵​急促​的​动静​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​精灵​同伴​正​直奔​詹姆斯​而​去​。​简娜​挂​在​他​身上​，​试图​拖慢​他​的​脚步​，​但​他​似乎​根本​没​注意​到​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1sheng1 ci4er3 de5 jian1jiao4 da3duan4 le5 fa3shi1 de5 hua4yu3。ni3 yong4 yu2guang1 pie1jian4 yi1zhen4 ji2cu4 de5 dong4jing4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 jing1ling2 tong2ban4 zheng1 zhi2ben4 zhan1mu3si1 er2 qu4。Jian3na4 gua4 zai4 ta1 shen1shang5，shi4tu2 tuo1man4 ta1 de5 jiao3bu4，dan4 ta1 si4hu1 gen1ben3 mei2 zhu4yi4 dao4。"

msgid ""
"An incredible victory, my friend!\n"
"\n"
"You have cleared a path through the Jubuthon Hordes for the Fellowship of Sutterlin BioScience to begin their quest!"
msgstr ""
"朋友​啊​，​这​是​场​伟大​的​胜利​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​为​苏​特林​生物科学​的​臣民​们​开辟​了​一条​穿越​朱布松​部落​的​道路​，​让​他们​得以​开启​征程​！\n"
"\n"
"peng2you5 a1，zhe4 shi4 chang2 wei3da4 de5 sheng4li4！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wei2 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 chen2min2 men5 kai1pi4 le5 yi1 tiao2 chuan1yue4 zhu1 bu4 song1 bu4luo4 de5 dao4lu4，rang4 ta1men5 de2yi3 kai1qi3 zheng1cheng2！"

msgid ""
"An initiate must have worn that in here. It's way too small for an acolyte.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice is soft and sad.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"这​肯定​是​个​学徒​穿​的​，​这件​衬衫​对侍​祭​来说​太小​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​轻柔​而​悲伤​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ken3ding4 shi4 ge4 xue2tu2 chuan1 de5，zhe4 jian4 chen4shan1 dui4 shi4 ji4 lai2 shuo1 tai4 xiao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 qing1rou2 er2 bei1shang1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "An instant later, an alarm klaxon begins to blare."
msgstr ""
"紧接着​，​警报声​开始​发出​尖锐​鸣响​。\n"
"jin3jie1zhe5，jing3 bao4 sheng1 kai1shi3 fa1chu1 jian1rui4 ming2 xiang3。"

msgid ""
"An intelligent question, from the shadowrunner? Surprising.\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, I don't have the time to explain it to you in detail. And since you are locked in that laboratory with no chance of escape, I don’t really need to."
msgstr ""
"暗影​狂奔​者​能​问出​这么​有​层次​的​问题​？​真令人​意外​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可惜​，​我​没有​时间​详细​向​你​解释​。​而且​既然​你​被困​在​那个​实验室​里​，​没有​逃脱​的​可能​，​我​其实​也​没​必要​解释​。\n"
"\n"
"an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 neng2 wen4 chu1 zhe4me5 you3 ceng2ci4 de5 wen4ti2？zhen1 ling3 ren2 yi4wai4。\n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1，wo3 mei2you3 shi2jian1 xiang2xi4 xiang4 ni3 jie3shi4。er2qie3 ji4ran2 ni3 bei4kun4 zai4 na4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 li3，mei2you3 tao2tuo1 de5 ke3neng2，wo3 qi2shi2 ye3 mei2 bi4yao4 jie3shi4。"

msgid ""
"An interesting offer... but one that I must take with a grain of salt.\n"
"\n"
"You came here to stop me, after all."
msgstr ""
"有趣​的​提议​……​但​我​必须​谨慎​对待​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​，​你​来​这里​是​为了​阻止​我​。\n"
"\n"
"you3qu4 de5 ti2yi4……dan4 wo3 bi4xu1 jin3shen4 dui4dai4。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4，ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 wei4le5 zu3zhi3 wo3。"

msgid "An interesting story. Let me have a closer look."
msgstr ""
"挺​有意思​的​。​让​我​再​仔细​看看​。\n"
"ting3 you3yi4si5 de5。rang4 wo3 zai4 zi3xi4 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"An interesting theory. But I fear that my price to confirm or deny it would fall well outside of your price range.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Alice leans back in her chair.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For now, let's get back to the business at hand."
msgstr ""
"有趣​的​理论​。​但​我​担心​，​要​我​证实​或​否认​它​的​代价​，​恐怕​远超​你​的​承受​范围​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​爱丽丝​向​椅背​靠​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​眼下​，​我们​还是​先​处理​手头​的​正事​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"you3qu4 de5 li3lun4。dan4 wo3 dan1xin1，yao4 wo3 zheng4shi2 huo4 fou3ren4 ta1 de5 dai4jia4，kong3pa4 yuan3chao1 ni3 de5 cheng2shou4 fan4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai4li4si1 xiang4 yi3bei4 kao4 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yan3xia4，wo3men5 hai2shi5 xian1 chu3li3 shou3tou2 de5 zheng4shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"An interesting theory. The Flux does seek to depose those who overstep the bounds of their power, it is true. \n"
"\n"
"But I am not convinced that the elimination of an entire gang was the *only* way in which a more egalitarian state of affairs could be reached. "
msgstr ""
"很​有趣​的​理论​。​动荡​带​的确​会​自行​淘汰​无能​的​僭​越​之辈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​不​认为​铲除​整个​帮派​是​实现​平衡​状态​的​*​唯一​*​途径​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 you3qu4 de5 li3lun4。dong4dang4 dai4 di2que4 hui4 zi4xing2 tao2tai4 wu2neng2 de5 jian4 yue4 zhi1 bei4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 chan3chu2 zheng3ge4 bang1pai4 shi4 shi2xian4 ping2heng2 zhuang4tai4 de5*wei2yi1*tu2jing4。"

msgid ""
"An obese troll lopes into view. His many chins glisten in the halogen glare "
"of the lobby lights."
msgstr ""
"一个​肥硕​的​巨魔​蹒跚​走进​视野​。​他​层层叠叠​的​下巴​在​门厅​卤素灯​的​刺目​光芒​中​闪闪发亮​。\n"
"yi1ge5 fei2shuo4 de5 ju4mo2 pan2shan1 zou3jin4 shi4ye3。ta1 ceng2 ceng2 die2 die2 de5 xia4ba5 zai4 men2ting1 lu3su4deng1 de5 ci4mu4 guang1mang2 zhong4 shan3 shan3 fa1 liang4。"

msgid "An old cyber arm which provides +1 Strength."
msgstr ""
"一支​老旧​的​赛博​手臂​，​提供​+​1​力量​。\n"
"yi1 zhi1 lao3jiu4 de5 sai4bo2 shou3bi4，ti2gong1 +1 li4liang5。"

msgid ""
"An old friend from school. A bunch of us in the office went to the Rhine "
"University together."
msgstr ""
"老同学​。​我们​办公室​这​几个​人​都​是​一块​上​的​莱茵​大学​。\n"
"lao3 tong2 xue2。wo3men5 ban4gong1shi4 zhe4 ji3ge5 ren2 dou1 shi4 yi1kuai4 shang4 de5 lai2 yin1 da4xue2。"

msgid ""
"An old primary school, decrepit and crumbling. I see you standing in a basketball court with splintery floors and faded lines.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice softens. Becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The air is thick here, stagnant. The whole place smells like an old sock."
msgstr ""
"一所​破旧不堪​的​小学​，​墙壁​斑驳​，​屋顶​倾颓​。​我​看见​你​站​在​篮球场​上​，​地板​上满​是​木刺​，​标线​早已​褪色​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​变得​柔和​，​带​着​几分​梦幻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​空气​在​这里​凝滞​沉闷​，​整个​地方​散发​着​旧​袜子​的​霉味​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 suo3 po4 jiu4 bu4 kan1 de5 xiao3xue2，qiang2bi4 ban1bo2，wu1ding3 qing1tui2。wo3 kan4jian4 ni3 zhan4 zai4 lan2qiu2chang3 shang4，di4ban3 shang4 man3 shi4 mu4 ci1，biao1xian4 zao3yi3 tui4se4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 rou2he2，dai4 zhao2 ji3fen1 meng4huan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kong1qi4 zai4 zhe4li3 ning2zhi4 chen2men4，zheng3ge4 di4fang1 san4fa1 zhao2 jiu4 wa4zi5 de5 mei2 wei4。"

msgid ""
"An ominous rumble fills the chamber. Slowly, the Firewing's body begins to shift.\n"
"\n"
"There is a sound like hundreds of fingernails digging into blackboards: the dragon's scales, scraping across the floor."
msgstr ""
"一阵​不祥​的​轰鸣声​充斥​着​整个​房间​。​火翼​的​身体​开始​缓缓​发生变化​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​仿佛​数百根​指甲​划过​黑板​般的​刺耳​声响​起​：​那​是​龙​鳞​在​地面​上​摩擦​的​声音​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhen4 bu4xiang2 de5 hong1 ming2 sheng1 chong1chi4 zhao2 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1。Huo3yi4 de5 shen1ti3 kai1shi3 huan3huan3 fa1 sheng1 bian4 hua4。\n"
"\n"
"fang3fu2 shu3 bai3 gen1 zhi3jia5 hua2guo4 hei1ban3 ban1 de5 ci4er3 sheng1xiang3 qi3：na4 shi4 long2 lin2 zai4 di4mian4 shang4 mo2ca1 de5 sheng1yin1。"

msgid ""
"An on-site QA tester. We've got some bugs to stomp, and we can't do it all "
"ourselves."
msgstr ""
"现场​临时​测试人员​。​我们​这边​有些​错误​要​处理​，​但​光靠​我们​自己​搞​不​完​。\n"
"xian4chang3 lin2shi2 ce4 shi4 ren2 yuan2。wo3men5 zhe4bian1 you3xie1 cuo4wu4 yao4 chu3li3，dan4 guang1 kao4 wo3men5 zi4ji3 gao3 bu4 wan2。"

msgid ""
"An optical chip encoded with the information that Alice dug up for you."
msgstr ""
"一个​光学​芯片​，​刻录​了​爱丽丝​为​你​挖出​的​信息​。\n"
"yi1ge5 guang1xue2 xin1pian4，ke4lu4 le5 ai4li4si1 wei2 ni3 wa1 chu1 de5 xin4xi1。"

msgid ""
"An ostentatiously large tome sits cradled on this pedestal. The paper is robust and fibrous, and the binding has been expertly stitched. A steel plate running along the book's spine anchors it to the pedestal.\n"
"\n"
"Glory stares down at it, frowning."
msgstr ""
"基座​上​摆放着​一本​大得​惊人​的​巨著​。​纸张​质地​坚韧​且​纤维​感​十足​，​装订​工艺​精湛​。​沿着​书脊​延伸​的​钢板​将​书本​牢牢​固定​在​基座​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​低头​凝视着​它​，​皱起​眉头​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1zuo4 shang4 bai3 fang4 zhao2 yi1 ben3 dai4 de2 jing1ren2 de5 ju4zhu4。zhi3zhang1 zhi4di4 jian1ren4 qie3 xian1wei2 gan3 shi2zu2，zhuang1ding4 gong1yi4 jing1zhan4。yan2zhe5 shu1ji3 yan2shen1 de5 gang1ban3 jiang1 shu1ben3 lao2lao2 gu4ding4 zai4 ji1zuo4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 di1tou2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ta1，zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。"

msgid ""
"An outdated RFID style ID card last used around the awakening. There is a "
"name written on it \"Franz Klien : Foreman\" and \"Access Level: 3\""
msgstr ""
"一张​过时​的​射频​识别​式​ID​卡​，​最后​一次​使用​是​在​大​觉醒​时期​。​上面​写​着​名字​“​弗朗兹​·​克莱恩​：​工头​”​和​“​访问​权限​等级​：​3​”​。\n"
"yi1 zhang1 guo4shi2 de5 she4pin2 shi2bie2 shi4 ID ka3，zui4hou4 yi1ci4 shi3yong4 shi4 zai4 dai4 jue2xing3 shi2qi1。shang4mian4 xie3 zhao2 ming2zi5“fu2 lang3 zi1 · ke4 lai2 en1：gong1tou2” he4“fang3wen4 quan2xian4 deng3ji2：3”。"

msgid ""
"An outfit designed to assist in both magic and evading the authorities. "
"Grants +1 Willpower and +1 Move Speed."
msgstr ""
"一套​旨在​协助​施展​魔法​和​避开​当局​注意​的​服装​。​提供​+​1​意志​和​+​1​移动​速度​。\n"
"yi1tao4 zhi3zai4 xie2zhu4 shi1zhan3 mo2fa3 he4 bi4kai1 dang1ju2 zhu4yi4 de5 fu2zhuang1。ti2gong1 +1 yi4zhi4 he4 +1 yi2dong4 su4du4。"

msgid ""
"An outsider. Someone who hasn't been corrupted by Harrow or his pet spirit. "
"I'd say that qualifies me to offer an opinion."
msgstr ""
"凭​我​是​个​局外人​，​没有​受到​哈罗​或者​他​那​宠物​精魂​的​腐蚀​。​我​想​这​足以​让​我​发表意见​。\n"
"ping2 wo3 shi4 ge4 ju2 wai4 ren2，mei2you3 shou4dao4 ha1luo2 huo4zhe3 ta1 na4 chong3wu4 jing1hun2 de5 fu3shi2。wo3 xiang3 zhe4 zu2yi3 rang4 wo3 fa1 biao3 yi4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"An unarmed attack that does +1 AP DMG, and strips 2 Armor from the target. "
"Accuracy -5%."
msgstr ""
"一次​徒手​攻击​，​造成​+​1​行动​力​损伤​，​并​剥离​目标​2​点护甲值​。​精准度​-​5​%​。\n"
"yi1ci4 tu2shou3 gong1ji1，zao4cheng2 +1 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1，bing4 bo1li2 mu4biao1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。jing1 zhun3 du4-5%。"

msgid "An unarmed melee attack that does more HP damage than AP damage."
msgstr ""
"一次​徒手​近战​攻击​，​造成​的​生命​值​伤害​大于​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"yi1ci4 tu2shou3 jin4 zhan4 gong1ji1，zao4cheng2 de5 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 da4yu2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid "An... impressive display, sir. Thank you for sharing it with me."
msgstr ""
"真是​……​了不起​的​本领​，​先生​。​感谢​与​我​分享​。\n"
"zhen1shi5……liao3bu5qi3 de5 ben3ling3，xian1sheng5。gan3xie4 yu4 wo3 fen1xiang3。"

msgid "Anarchist Shaman"
msgstr ""
"无政府主义​萨满\n"
"wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 sa4man3"

msgid ""
"Anarchy is not the solution to the People's problems. \"Do what thou wilt\" is a policy that rewards only the powerful... the working class gets trampled. \n"
"\n"
"A strong, People-centered Communist movement is the only way to protect the interests of the common man.\n"
"\n"
"Give us a few years, and that's exactly what we're gonna be."
msgstr ""
"无政府主义​解决不了​广大​人民​群众​的​问题​。​“​为所欲为​”​这种​政策​只会​奖励​强者​……​而​工人阶级​则​会​被​践踏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只有​强大​的​、​以​人民​为​中心​的​共产主义​运动​，​才能​保护​普通​民众​的​利益​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再​给​我们​几年​时间​，​我们​就​会​成为​这样​的​力量​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 jie3 jue2 bu4 le5 guang3da4 ren2min2 qun2zhong4 de5 wen4ti2。“wei2suo3yu4wei2” zhe4zhong3 zheng4ce4 zhi3 hui4 jiang3li4 jiang4 zhe3……er2 gong1ren2jie1ji2 ze2 hui4 bei4 jian4ta4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3you3 qiang2da4 de5、yi3 ren2min2 wei2 zhong1xin1 de5 gong4chan3zhu3yi4 yun4dong4，cai2neng2 bao3hu4 pu3tong1 min2zhong4 de5 li4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 gei3 wo3men5 ji3nian2 shi2jian1，wo3men5 jiu4 hui4 cheng2wei2 zhe4yang4 de5 li4liang5。"

msgid "Ancient Monitor"
msgstr ""
"老旧​显示器\n"
"lao3jiu4 xian3shi4qi4"

msgid ""
"And *you* don't want to keep Mr. Grinder waiting. That would be a terrible "
"mistake on your part."
msgstr ""
"那​*​你​*​可​也​别​让​“​绞肉机​”​先生​久等​。​否则​你​就​犯​了​个​致命​的​错误​。\n"
"na4*ni3*ke3 ye3 bie4 rang4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 jiu3deng3。fou3ze2 ni3 jiu4 fan4 le5 ge4 zhi4ming4 de5 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"And I don't discuss family matters with customers, let alone strangers. It's nothing personal, but the answer is no. \n"
"\n"
"Understood?"
msgstr ""
"我​也​不会​和​顾客​讨论​家事​，​更​不用说​陌生人​了​。​这​不是​针对​你​个人​，​但​恕​我​拒绝​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​明白​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 he4 gu4ke4 tao3lun4 jia1shi4，geng1 bu4yong4shuo1 mo4sheng1ren2 le5。zhe4 bu4shi4 zhen1dui4 ni3 ge4ren2，dan4 shu4 wo3 ju4jue2。\n"
"\n"
"ming2bai5 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"And I don't. I don't want to hear a fucking word of it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory begins to stalk toward Marta's position.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All that I want is payback... and I'm going to get it."
msgstr ""
"我​并​不想​。​我​他​妈​一个​字​都​不想​听​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​开始​向着​玛​尔塔​的​位置​走​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想要​的​只有​复仇​……​而​我定​会​如愿以偿​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bing4 bu4xiang3。wo3 ta1 ma1 yi1ge5 zi4 dou1 bu4xiang3 ting1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 kai1shi3 xiang4zhe5 Ma3er3ta3 de5 wei4zhi5 zou3 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3yao4 de5 zhi3you3 fu4chou2……er2 wo3 ding4 hui4 ru2yuan4yi3chang2。"

msgid ""
"And I left her where I found her - imprisoned. She had to pay for her "
"crimes."
msgstr ""
"然后​我​依然​把​她​留在​被​囚禁​的​地方​。​她​必须​为​自己​的​罪行​付出代价​。\n"
"ran2hou4 wo3 yi1ran2 ba3 ta1 liu2 zai4 bei4 qiu2jin4 de5 di4fang1。ta1 bi4xu1 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 zui4xing2 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。"

msgid ""
"And I must wonder what effect the radiation from a nuclear meltdown might have had upon her.\n"
"\n"
"The SOX is an inhospitable region, to be sure."
msgstr ""
"而且​，​我​确实​好奇​核​熔毁​产生​的​辐射​会​对​她​造成​怎样​的​影响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可以​肯定​的​是​，​萨洛​卢区​绝对​不​适宜​居住​。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3，wo3 que4shi2 hao4qi2 he2 rong2hui3 chan3sheng1 de5 fu2she4 hui4 dui4 ta1 zao4cheng2 zen3yang4 de5 ying3xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"ke3yi3 ken3ding4 de5 shi4，Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 jue2dui4 bu4 shi4yi2 ju1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"And I remain happy, and Altuğ makes money. An ideal business relationship."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​一直​高兴​，​奥图​伊​也​赚​到​了​钱​。​简直​是​理想​的​生意​关系​。\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 yi1zhi2 gao1xing4，ao4 tu2 yi1 ye3 zhuan4 dao4 le5 qian2。jian3zhi2 shi4 li3xiang3 de5 sheng1yi4 guan1xi5。"

msgid ""
"And I will graciously give you one chance to turn over those supplies before"
" I shoot you in the face."
msgstr ""
"而​我会​礼貌​地​给​你​一个​机会​交出​物资​，​免得​我​一​枪崩​了​你​。\n"
"er2 wo3 hui4 li3mao4 de5 gei3 ni3 yi1ge5 ji1hui4 jiao1chu1 wu4zi1，mian3de5 wo3 yi1 qiang1beng1 le5 ni3。"

msgid "And I'd expected more from you than these idiotic mind games."
msgstr ""
"我​也​以为​你​的​本事​不止​这些​愚蠢​的​心理​把戏​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 yi3wei2 ni3 de5 ben3shi4 bu4zhi3 zhe4xie1 yu2chun3 de5 xin1li3 ba3xi4。"

msgid "And I'm glad to be here."
msgstr ""
"我​也​很​高兴​能​与​你们​在​一起​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 yu4 ni3men5 zai4 yi1qi3。"

msgid ""
"And I'm sure you have your reasons. I just don't *care.* Now tell me what's "
"happening tonight."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​你​肯定​有​自己​的​苦衷​。​但​我​不​*​在乎​*​。​告诉​我​今晚​会​发生​什么​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 ken3ding4 you3 zi4ji3 de5 ku3zhong1。dan4 wo3 bu4*zai4hu5*。gao4su4 wo3 jin1wan3 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"And I'm trying to read this.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice slows to a crawl. He makes a point of enunciating each word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I point people to the bar. If someone starts trouble, I give them a taste of Herr Zapp. \n"
"\n"
"That's it. That's all I do."
msgstr ""
"而​我​在​看​这本​漫画​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​语速​变得​极其​缓慢​，​一字一顿​地​说​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​负责​告诉​客人​吧台​在​哪儿​。​要是​有人​闹事​，​我​就让​他们​尝尝​霹雳​老大哥​的​滋味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这些​。​我​只​干​这些​事​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3 zai4 kan4 zhe4 ben3 man4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3 su4 bian4de5 ji2qi2 huan3man4，yi1 zi4 yi1 dun4 de5 shuo1 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 fu4ze2 gao4su4 ke4ren2 ba1tai2 zai4 na3r5。yao4shi5 you3ren2 nao4shi4，wo3 jiu4 rang4 ta1men5 chang2 chang2 pi1li4 lao3da4ge1 de5 zi1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4xie1。wo3 zhi3 gan4 zhe4xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"And I've heard stories about the Penthouse level. Something about a sealed vault.\n"
"\n"
"There's supposed to be something real valuable in there, but nobody knows what it is. Doesn't stop them from talking about it, though.\n"
msgstr ""
"我​还​听​人​说​过​顶楼​的​事​，​据说​是​有​个​封死​的​保险库​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​的​东西​应该​特别​值钱​，​但​没人​知道​到底​是​什么​。​反正​也​没碍​着​他们​聊​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 ting1 ren2 shuo1 guo4 ding3lou2 de5 shi4，ju4shuo1 shi4 you3 ge4 feng1 si3 de5 bao3 xian3 ku4。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 de5 dong1xi1 ying1gai1 te4bie2 zhi2qian2，dan4 mei2 ren2 zhi1dao4 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5。fan3zheng4 ye3 mei2 ai4 zhao2 ta1men5 liao2。"

msgid ""
"And I've learned to trust yours.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else that you want to talk about? If so, go ahead and ask - I'm all ears."
msgstr ""
"而​我​也​学会​了​信任​你​的​判断​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​别的​事要​聊​吗​？​如果​有​的话​，​尽管​说​出来​。​我​洗耳恭听​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3 ye3 xue2hui4 le5 xin4ren4 ni3 de5 pan4duan4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 liao2 ma5？ru2guo3 you3 de5hua4，jin3guan3 shuo1 chu1lai2。wo3 xi3er3gong1ting1。"

msgid "And a good friend."
msgstr ""
"也​是​一位​好​朋友​。\n"
"ye3 shi4 yi1 wei4 hao3 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"And after that, he says that only the strong deserve to prosper. So... which"
" is it?"
msgstr ""
"之后​，​他​又​说​只有​强者​才​配享​有​繁荣​。​所以​……​哪​一种​说法​才​是​正确​的​？\n"
"zhi1hou4，ta1 you4 shuo1 zhi3you3 jiang4 zhe3 cai2 pei4 xiang3 you3 fan2rong2。suo3yi3……na3 yi1zhong3 shuo1fa3 cai2 shi4 zheng4que4 de5？"

msgid ""
"And all in secret. The owners - whoever they may be - were none too pleased by your escape, I'm sure.\n"
"\n"
"What else did you find?"
msgstr ""
"而且​这​一切都是​秘密​进行​的​。​我​不​知道​这座​设施​的​所有者​是​什么​人​，​但​对方​极其​不乐意​看到​你们​逃出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​还​发现​了​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 mi4mi4 jin4xing2 de5。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 zuo4 she4shi1 de5 suo3you3zhe3 shi4 shen2me5 ren2，dan4 dui4fang1 ji2qi2 bu4 le4 yi4 kan4dao4 ni3men5 tao2 chu1 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 hai2 fa1xian4 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"And all of it was reverse-engineered from existing bioware products, right? "
"I've read up on Sutterlin's \"process.\""
msgstr ""
"而且​这些​都​是从​现有​的​生体​殖装​产品​逆向​工程​得到​的​，​对​吧​？​我读​过​关于​苏​特林​“​流程​”​的​资料​。\n"
"er2qie3 zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 cong2 xian4you3 de5 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 chan3pin3 ni4xiang4 gong1cheng2 de2dao4 de5，dui4 ba1？wo3 dou4 guo4 guan1yu2 su1 te4 lin2“liu2cheng2” de5 zi1liao4。"

msgid ""
"And all the wars ever achieve is to rob a child of a father or mother, or "
"parents of a son or daughter. "
msgstr ""
"而​所有​战争​所​带来​的​，​不过​是​夺走​一个​孩子​的​父母​，​或是​父母​的​儿女​。\n"
"er2 suo3you3 zhan4zheng1 suo3 dai4lai2 de5，bu4guo4 shi4 duo2zou3 yi1ge5 hai2zi5 de5 fu4mu3，huo4shi4 fu4mu3 de5 er2nu:3。"

msgid ""
"And all the while, Hermie was trying to tell me that I *wasn't* right, and I refused to listen. My refusal killed him - my little brother. The person I loved most in the world.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He covers his face with a withered hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If only I had heard him... none of this would have happened."
msgstr ""
"而​这​一切​发生​时​，​赫米​一直​在​试图​告诉​我​说​我​*​错​了​*​，​但​我​拒绝​听从​。​我​的​拒绝​杀死​了​他​—​—​我​的​弟弟​。​我​在​这​世上​最爱​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​枯槁​的​手​捂住​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我​当时​听​他​的话​……​这​一切​都​不会​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4 yi1qie4 fa1sheng1 shi2，he4 mi3 yi1zhi2 zai4 shi4tu2 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 wo3*cuo4 le5*，dan4 wo3 ju4jue2 ting1cong2。wo3 de5 ju4jue2 sha1si3 le5 ta1——wo3 de5 di4di5。wo3 zai4 zhe4 shi4shang4 zui4 ai4 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 ku1gao3 de5 shou3 wu3zhu4 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 dang1shi2 ting1 ta1 de5hua4……zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 bu4hui4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"And all the while, he was screaming like a little girl. \"Eeeeeeeee! Eeeeeeeee!\" Must've kept at it for... oh, ten, fifteen minutes? \"Eeeeeeeee!\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He barks out a snorting laugh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was hilarious, man. I tell you."
msgstr ""
"而​在​这​期间​，​他​叫​得​跟​个​娘们​儿​似的​。​“​哎哟​！​哎哟​喂​！​”​大概​得​有​……​十到​十五分钟​吧​？​“​哎哟​喂​啊​！​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朗声​大笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​讲​，​那​可​太​滑稽​了​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zai4 zhe4 qi1jian1，ta1 jiao4 de2 gen1 ge4 niang2 men5 er2 shi4de5。“ai1yo1！ai1yo1 wei2！” da4gai4 de2 you3……shi2 dao4 shi2 wu3 fen4 zhong1 ba1？“ai1yo1 wei2 a1！” \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lang3 sheng1 da4xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 jiang3，na4 ke3 tai4 hua2ji1 le5。"

msgid ""
"And at the end of those debates, Monika would put her foot down, and you'd wind up doing whatever she said. Right?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smirks at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't bother answering. It was a rhetorical question."
msgstr ""
"而​到​了​争论​的​最后​，​莫妮卡​还是​会​一锤定音​，​你们​还是​得​乖乖​按​她​说​的​做​，​对​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​回答​了​。​我​只是​在​反问​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 dao4 le5 zheng1lun4 de5 zui4hou4，Mo4ni1ka3 hai2shi5 hui4 yi1chui2ding4yin1，ni3men5 hai2shi5 de2 guai1guai1 an4 ta1 shuo1 de5 zuo4，dui4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 hui2da2 le5。wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 fan3wen4 er2yi3。"

msgid "And did you succeed?"
msgstr ""
"你​成功​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 cheng2gong1 le5 ma5？"

msgid "And do you know where we'll find that access panel, mouse?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​知道​我们​要​上​哪​去​找​这个​面板​吗​，​老鼠​？\n"
"na4 ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 yao4 shang4 na3 qu4 zhao3 zhe4ge5 mian4ban3 ma5，lao3shu3？"

msgid ""
"And don't forget, boss... we're takin' on an AI here. I'd recommend bringing the best cyberdeck that you can afford.\n"
"\n"
"Somethin' tells me that we're gonna need all the firepower that we can get."
msgstr ""
"另外​别忘了​，​老大​……​我们​要​对付​的​可是​AI​。​我​建议​带上​最好​使​的​赛博碟板​再​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​总​感觉​，​我们​此行​需要​的​火力​越​充足​越​好​。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4 bie4 wang4 le5，lao3da4……wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 ke3shi4 AI。wo3 jian4yi4 dai4shang4 zui4hao3 shi3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 zai4 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zong3 gan3jue2，wo3men5 ci3xing2 xu1yao4 de5 huo3li4 yue4 chong1zu2 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"And don't forget, boss... we're taking on an AI here. Might not be a bad idea to bring a skilled decker along... I know there's one for hire around here.\n"
"\n"
"It's hard to say what we'll be up against."
msgstr ""
"另外​别忘了​，​老大​……​我们​要​对付​的​可是​AI​。​带上​个​经验老到​的​碟​客​或许​不是​坏事​……​我​认识​附近​有接​这​活儿​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​很难说​我们​到时候​会​遇上​什么​突发​情况​。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4 bie4 wang4 le5，lao3da4……wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 ke3shi4 AI。dai4shang4 ge4 jing1 yan4 lao3 dao4 de5 die2 ke4 huo4xu3 bu4shi4 huai4shi4……wo3 ren4shi5 fu4jin4 you3 jie1 zhe4 huo2r5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 nan2 shuo1 wo3men5 dao4shi2hou4 hui4 yu4shang4 shen2me5 tu1fa1 qing2kuang4。"

msgid "And don't you forget it."
msgstr ""
"你​可​别忘了​这份​恩情​。\n"
"ni3 ke3 bie4 wang4 le5 zhe4 fen4 en1qing2。"

msgid "And everyone is helping. Everyone is doing something."
msgstr ""
"而​所有人​都​在​帮忙​。​所有人​都​在​做些​什么​。\n"
"er2 suo3you3ren2 dou1 zai4 bang1mang2。suo3you3ren2 dou1 zai4 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"And he'd had skin grafts. Most of his face looked like replacement material.\n"
"\n"
"If the grafts came from a legitimate hospital, there may be medical records."
msgstr ""
"而且​他​植过​皮​。​他​的​大​半张​脸​看起来​都​像是​人造​皮肤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​他​是​在​挂牌​医院​做​的​手术​，​可能​会​留下​病历​。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 ta1 zhi2 guo4 pi2。ta1 de5 dai4 ban4 zhang1 lian3 kan4qi3lai5 dou1 xiang4 shi4 ren2zao4 pi2fu1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 shi4 zai4 gua4pai2 yi1yuan4 zuo4 de5 shou3shu4，ke3neng2 hui4 liu2xia4 bing4li4。"

msgid ""
"And honestly, that’s fine with me. A soldier knows how take orders and get the job done, without worrying about the big picture. Leave that kind of thing for the generals. \n"
"\n"
"Show me the hill, and I’ll figure out how to take it."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​我​对此​毫无​异议​。​士兵​的​职责​就是​服从命令​、​完成​任务​，​而​无需​考虑​大局​。​那种​事​还是​留给​将军​们​去​操心​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​我​指明​一座​山头​，​我​自会​想​办法​攻下​它​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 dui4 ci3 hao2wu2 yi4yi4。shi4bing1 de5 zhi2ze2 jiu4shi4 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3、wan2cheng2 ren4wu5，er2 wu2xu1 kao3lu:4 da4ju2。na4zhong3 shi4 hai2shi5 liu2gei3 jiang1jun1 men5 qu4 cao1xin1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"gei3 wo3 zhi3ming2 yi1 zuo4 shan1tou2，wo3 zi4 hui4 xiang3 ban4fa3 gong1 xia4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"And how are you planning to do that? Winters spent twenty years searching "
"for him, and it got him nowhere."
msgstr ""
"那​你​打算​怎么​做​？​温特斯​花​了​整整​二十年​的​时间​寻找​沃​克莱尔​，​最后​却​仍​一无所获​。\n"
"na4 ni3 da3suan4 zen3me5 zuo4？Wen1te4si1 hua1 le5 zheng3zheng3 er4 shi2 nian2 de5 shi2jian1 xun2zhao3 Wo4ke4lai2er3，zui4hou4 que4 reng2 yi1wu2suo3huo4。"

msgid "And how do you know about that?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​怎么​知道​的​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 de5？"

msgid "And how's the Flux treating the Kreuzbasar as of late?"
msgstr ""
"动荡​带​最近​对待​克洛伊​茨​集市​如何​？\n"
"dong4dang4 dai4 zui4jin4 dui4dai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ru2he2？"

msgid ""
"And if *I* die? Well, so what?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He holds his scars to the light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You think that life has been a bundle of laughs for me? I'll happily trade mine to make a different world."
msgstr ""
"而​如果​我​死​了​呢​？​那​又​如何​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​伤疤​暴露​在​光线​下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​以为​我​的​生活​一直​都​是​充满​欢笑​的​吗​？​我​愿意​用​我​的​命来​换取​一个​不同​的​世界​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ru2guo3 wo3 si3 le5 ni2？na4 you4 ru2he2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shang1ba1 bao4lu4 zai4 guang1xian4 xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3wei2 wo3 de5 sheng1huo2 yi1zhi2 dou1 shi4 chong1man3 huan1xiao4 de5 ma5？wo3 yuan4yi4 yong4 wo3 de5 ming4 lai2 huan4qu3 yi1ge5 bu4tong2 de5 shi4jie4。"

msgid "And if she doesn't? If she goes on hurting street kids?"
msgstr ""
"但​如果​她​做​不到​呢​？​如果​她​继续​伤害​街头​的​孩子​们​呢​？\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ta1 zuo4 bu4dao4 ni2？ru2guo3 ta1 ji4xu4 shang1hai4 jie1tou2 de5 hai2zi5 men5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"And if the F-State doesn't know how to react, everybody gets paranoid that "
"they may be next."
msgstr ""
"如果​动荡​带​不​知道​如何​应对​的话​，​所有人​都​会​害怕​自己​成为​下​一个​受害者​。\n"
"ru2guo3 dong4dang4 dai4 bu4 zhi1dao4 ru2he2 ying4dui4 de5hua4，suo3you3ren2 dou1 hui4 hai4pa4 zi4ji3 cheng2wei2 xia4 yi1ge5 shou4hai4zhe3。"

msgid ""
"And in case it wasn't already obvious, you should know that we've decided to"
" stay."
msgstr ""
"另外​如果说​你​还​没​看​出来​的话​，​那​我​来​告诉​你​，​我们​已经​决定​继续​留在​这里​了​。\n"
"ling4wai4 ru2guo3shuo1 ni3 hai2 mei2 kan4 chu1lai2 de5hua4，na4 wo3 lai2 gao4su4 ni3，wo3men5 yi3jing1 jue2ding4 ji4xu4 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"And it's appreciated.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She raises her glass and takes a moment to study the amber liquid inside.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​洽询​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​举起​杯子​，​端详​着​里面​的​琥珀色​液体​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 qia4xun2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ju3qi3 bei1zi5，duan1xiang2 zhao2 li3mian4 de5 hu3 po4 se4 ye4ti3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"And nor do I... not exactly, at least. But I can make an educated guess."
msgstr ""
"我​也​一样​……​至少​不​完全​是​。​但​我​可以​做出​有​根据​的​推测​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 yi1yang4……zhi4shao3 bu4 wan2quan2 shi4。dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 zuo4chu1 you3 gen1ju4 de5 tui1ce4。"

msgid ""
"And now she is free again… and insane. The perfect addition to the Sixth "
"World. "
msgstr ""
"现在​她​重获​自由​……​却​发疯​了​。​简直​是​第六​纪​最​完美​的​注脚​。\n"
"xian4zai4 ta1 chong2huo4 zi4you2……que4 fa1feng1 le5。jian3zhi2 shi4 di4 liu4 ji4 zui4 wan2mei3 de5 zhu4jiao3。"

msgid "And now she is gone."
msgstr ""
"而​现在​她​不​在​了​。\n"
"er2 xian4zai4 ta1 bu4 zai4 le5。"

msgid "And now she is gone. The Sixth World was her last. "
msgstr ""
"现在​她​去世​了​。​第六​纪是​她​的​终点​。\n"
"xian4zai4 ta1 qu4shi4 le5。di4 liu4 ji4 shi4 ta1 de5 zhong1dian3。"

msgid ""
"And now she is gone. The Sixth World was her last. \n"
"\n"
"It is a comfort to know that she found peace at the end. You are to be commended for that."
msgstr ""
"现在​她​去世​了​。​第六​纪是​她​的​终点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​能​平静​地​离去​，​实在​令人欣慰​。​这​是​你​的​功劳​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ta1 qu4shi4 le5。di4 liu4 ji4 shi4 ta1 de5 zhong1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 neng2 ping2jing4 de5 li2qu4，shi2zai4 ling3 ren2 xin1 wei4。zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 gong1lao2。"

msgid ""
"And now she is trapped. Driven insane by those whom she sought to protect. \n"
"\n"
"The Sixth World was not worthy of her."
msgstr ""
"现在​她​深陷​绝境​，​被​她​竭力​守护​之人​逼​至​疯癫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​第六​纪不​值得​她​付出​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ta1 shen1xian4 jue2jing4，bei4 ta1 jie2li4 shou3hu4 zhi1 ren2 bi1 zhi4 feng1dian1。\n"
"\n"
"di4 liu4 ji4 bu4 zhi2de5 ta1 fu4chu1 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"And now she is under the control of a construct. An unnatural thing, manufactured in a lab by those whom she sought to protect. \n"
"\n"
"The Sixth World has taken her as a toy for its toy."
msgstr ""
"如今​她​却​沦为​了​构造​体​的​傀儡​。​而​这​非​自然​的​存在​，​正是​她​曾​誓死​守护​之人​在​实验室​中​制造​的​产物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​在​第六​纪​成为​了​玩物​手中​的​玩物​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 ta1 que4 lun2wei2 le5 gou4zao4 ti3 de5 kui3lei3。er2 zhe4 fei1 zi4ran2 de5 cun2zai4，zheng4shi4 ta1 ceng2 shi4si3 shou3hu4 zhi1 ren2 zai4 shi2yan4shi4 zhong4 zhi4zao4 de5 chan3wu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 di4 liu4 ji4 cheng2wei2 le5 wan2wu4 shou3 zhong4 de5 wan2wu4。"

msgid ""
"And now that you've acknowledged that, you can make an effort to change."
msgstr ""
"现在​你​知道​了​，​你​还​可以​努力​改变​。\n"
"xian4zai4 ni3 zhi1dao4 le5，ni3 hai2 ke3yi3 nu3li4 gai3bian4。"

msgid ""
"And now, $(l.name)... on to the bad news.\n"
"\n"
"You now know where Vauclair is. But rescuing him will not be possible."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​$(l.name)​……​该​说​坏消息​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​了​沃​克莱尔​的​下落​，​但​营救​他​是​不​可能​的​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，$(l.name)……gai1 shuo1 huai4 xiao1 xi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 xia4luo4，dan4 ying2jiu4 ta1 shi4 bu4 ke3neng2 de5。"

msgid ""
"And now, I'm going to see to it that the rest of his twisted organization suffers in the same way that he did.\n"
"\n"
"You mark my words. Within the next few hours, the Humanis Policlub is going to take a hammering that will make the Night of Rage look like a peace rally."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​我要​让​他​那​扭曲​的​组织​的​其他​成员​也​尝尝​和​他​一样​的​苦头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​记住​我​的话​。​在​接下来​的​几个​小时​内​，​人类​至上​俱乐部​将会​遭受​重创​。​这​将​会​让​“​愤怒​之夜​”​看起来​都​像是​一场​和平​集会​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，wo3 yao4 rang4 ta1 na4 niu3qu1 de5 zu3zhi1 de5 qi2ta1 cheng2yuan2 ye3 chang2 chang2 he4 ta1 yi1yang4 de5 ku3tou5。\n"
"\n"
"ji4zhu5 wo3 de5hua4。zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 ji3ge5 xiao3shi2 nei4，ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 jiang1hui4 zao1shou4 zhong4chuang1。zhe4 jiang1 hui4 rang4“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” kan4qi3lai5 dou1 xiang4 shi4 yi1 chang2 he2ping2 ji2hui4。"

msgid ""
"And now, if you'll excuse me, I have a job to do. One that I've been waiting a long, *long* time for.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}As he turns to leave, he calls back over his shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and if you should happen to survive the next few minutes, don't worry... I won't come back to hurt you. That's a promise.\n"
"\n"
"I'll just leave you in there to die of thirst."
msgstr ""
"现在​恕​我​失陪​，​我​得​去​完成​一项​任务​。​一项​我​已经​等待​了​很​久​、​*​很​久​*​的​任务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​准备​转身​离开​时​，​又​回头​喊道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​，​如果​你​能​活过​接下来​的​几分钟​，​别​担心​……​我​不会​回来​伤害​你​。​这​是​个​承诺​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只会​让​你​留在​那里​渴死​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 de2 qu4 wan2cheng2 yi1 xiang4 ren4wu5。yi1 xiang4 wo3 yi3jing1 deng3dai4 le5 hen3 jiu3 、*hen3 jiu3*de5 ren4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhun3bei4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 shi2，you4 hui2tou2 han3dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2，ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 huo2 guo4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 ji1 fen4 zhong1，bie4 dan1xin1……wo3 bu4hui4 hui2lai5 shang1hai4 ni3。zhe4 shi4 ge4 cheng2nuo4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 hui4 rang4 ni3 liu2 zai4 na4li5 ke3 si3。"

msgid ""
"And now, if you'll excuse me, I have some things to attend to. You take "
"care, okay?"
msgstr ""
"现在​恕​我​失陪​，​我​还​有些​事情​要​处理​。​你​多​保重​，​好​吗​？\n"
"xian4zai4 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 hai2 you3xie1 shi4qing5 yao4 chu3li3。ni3 duo1 bao3zhong4，hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"And now, if you'll excuse me, I've got a dragon to wake up.\n"
"\n"
"If you’re still alive when I get back, I’ll put a bullet in you. If you're lucky, I might even put it in your head, quick and clean... like your pal Amsel."
msgstr ""
"现在​恕​我​失陪​，​我要​去​唤醒​巨龙​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​等​我​回来​的​时候​，​你​还​没​死​的话​，​我​就​赏​你​一颗​子弹​。​没准​我​心情​好​，​直接​照​脑袋​打​，​不让​你​多​受罪​……​就​像​你​那个​朋友​阿姆​泽尔​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 yao4 qu4 huan4xing3 ju4long2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 deng3 wo3 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 hai2 mei2 si3 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 shang3 ni3 yi1 ke1 zi3dan4。mei2zhun3 wo3 xin1qing2 hao3，zhi2jie1 zhao4 nao3dai5 da3，bu4 rang4 ni3 duo1 shou4zui4……jiu4 xiang4 ni3 na4ge5 peng2you5 E1mu3ze2er3 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"And now, if you'll excuse me...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His sentence trails off as he returns his attention to his merchandise.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"现在​请​恕​我​失陪​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​话音未落​，​他​便​已​将​注意力​又​放在​了​他​的​商品​上​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} hua4 yin1 wei4 la4，ta1 bian4 yi3 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 you4 fang4 zai4 le5 ta1 de5 shang1pin3 shang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"And now, they’re going to deploy my weapon. They plan to flood the Firewing’s body with the stuff and set her loose, collateral damage be damned.\n"
"\n"
"({{GM}}He shakes his head in resignation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"An atrocity. A calamity even worse than the one that I wanted to save us from."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​他们​打算​部署​我​的​武器​。​他们​计划​将​那种​物质​注入​火翼​的​身体​，​然后​放​她​出去​，​丝毫​不​顾忌​什么​附带​损害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​无奈​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​一场​惨剧​。​甚至​比​我​原本​想要​拯救​我们​免于​的​那场​灾难​还要​糟糕​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，ta1men5 da3suan4 bu4shu3 wo3 de5 wu3qi4。ta1men5 ji4hua4 jiang1 na4zhong3 wu4zhi4 zhu4ru4 Huo3yi4 de5 shen1ti3，ran2hou4 fang4 ta1 chu1qu4，si1hao2 bu4 gu4ji4 shen2me5 fu4dai4 sun3hai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wu2nai4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 chang2 can3ju4。shen4zhi4 bi3 wo3 yuan2ben3 xiang3yao4 zheng3jiu4 wo3men5 mian3yu2 de5 na4 chang2 zai1nan4 hai2 yao4 zao1gao1。"

msgid ""
"And now, young $(l.race), I have a question for you. No, not a question - a request.\n"
"\n"
"I would like you to tell me about your friend's \"dealings\" with the Adversary. And I would like you to be thorough."
msgstr ""
"而​现在​，​年轻​的​$(l.race)​，​我​有​个​问题​要​问​你​。​或者说​，​是​请求​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​你​能​将​你​的​这位​朋友​与​反叛者​之间​的​“​恩怨​”​一五一十​地​告诉​我​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 xian4zai4，nian2qing1 de5 $(l.race)，wo3 you3 ge4 wen4ti2 yao4 wen4 ni3。huo4 zhe3 shuo1，shi4 qing3qiu2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 jiang1 ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 yu4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 zhi1jian1 de5“en1yuan4” yi1wu3yi1shi2 de5 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"And one more thing, $(l.name)... I'm gonna need you to go in light on this one. Take a friend along if you like, but no more than one. If you spook 'em, they could trash the merchandise. Best go quiet. \n"
"\n"
"Best go soon, too, before the trail goes cold."
msgstr ""
"还​有件事​，​$(l.name)​……​这次​我​需要​你​轻装上阵​。​如果​你​愿意​，​可以​带个​朋友​一起​去​，​但​不要​超过​一个​。​如果​你​打草惊蛇​，​他们​会​把​货​砸​了​的​。​最好​不要​声张​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​也​最好​在​线索​断掉​之前​快点​过去​那里​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 you3 jian4 shi4，$(l.name)……zhe4 ci4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 qing1 zhuang1 shang4 zhen4。ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4，ke3yi3 dai4 ge4 peng2you5 yi1qi3 qu4，dan4 bu4yao4 chao1guo4 yi1ge5。ru2guo3 ni3 da3cao3jing1she2，ta1men5 hui4 ba3 huo4 za2 le5 de5。zui4hao3 bu4yao4 sheng1zhang1。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4 ye3 zui4hao3 zai4 xian4suo3 duan4 diao4 zhi1qian2 kuai4dian3 guo4qu4 na4li5。"

msgid ""
"And people say I am the naive one. Mein Schatz, we've seen life in the other"
" kieze. Pimps and dealers who use fear and violence to cow others into "
"submission. (w)"
msgstr ""
"亏​别人​还​说​我​比较​天真​呢​。​亲爱​的​，​我们​不是​没见​过​其他​街区​的​生活​是​什么​样子​。​各种​三教九流​之​辈​，​最​擅长​用​恐吓​和​暴力​逼迫​别人​就范​。\n"
"kui1 bie2ren5 hai2 shuo1 wo3 bi3jiao4 tian1zhen1 ni2。qin1ai4 de5，wo3men5 bu4shi4 mei2 jian4 guo4 qi2ta1 jie1qu1 de5 sheng1huo2 shi4 shen2me5 yang4zi5。ge4zhong3 san1jiao4jiu3liu2 zhi1 bei4，zui4 shan4chang2 yong4 kong3he4 he4 bao4li4 bi1po4 bie2ren5 jiu4fan4。"

msgid "And really, what is it that you do?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​到底​是​做​什么​的​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 dao4di3 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？"

msgid "And she doesn’t care if she brings down an entire kiez to get to us. "
msgstr ""
"而且​只要​能​干掉​我们​，​就算​摧毁​整个​街区​她​也​不在乎​。\n"
"er2qie3 zhi3yao4 neng2 gan4diao4 wo3men5，jiu4suan4 cui1hui3 zheng3ge4 jie1qu1 ta1 ye3 bu4zai4hu5。"

msgid "And so you decided, what? To cut your losses and run?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​就​做​了​这个​决定​？​抛​下​过去​的​失败​，​换个​地方​从头再来​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 zuo4 le5 zhe4ge5 jue2ding4？pao1 xia4 guo4qu4 de5 shi1bai4，huan4 ge4 di4fang1 cong2 tou2 zai4 lai2？"

msgid "And so you got angry, and you attacked him. That about right?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​生气​了​，​然后​暴打​了​他​一顿​。​这​总​没错​吧​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 sheng1qi4 le5，ran2hou4 bao4da3 le5 ta1 yi1 dun4。zhe4 zong3 mei2cuo4 ba1？"

msgid "And so you want us to... \"deal with them\" for you?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​想​让​我们​帮​你​……​“​解决​他们​”​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3men5 bang1 ni3……“jie3jue2 ta1men5”？"

msgid ""
"And so, I was just wondering... do you know what they were talking about?\n"
"\n"
"I want to make sure that Marta is okay, but I can't ask her about it, because I don't want her to find out that I was eavesdropping."
msgstr ""
"所以​，​我​就​在​想​……​你​知道​他们​在​说​什么​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​确认​玛​尔塔​是否​安好​，​但​又​不能​直接​去​问​她​，​因为​我​不想​让​她​发现​我​在​偷听​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，wo3 jiu4 zai4 xiang3……ni3 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 que4ren4 Ma3er3ta3 shi4fou3 an1hao3，dan4 you4 bu4neng2 zhi2jie1 qu4 wen4 ta1，yin1wei4 wo3 bu4xiang3 rang4 ta1 fa1xian4 wo3 zai4 tou1ting1。"

msgid "And so... did you find her?"
msgstr ""
"所以​……​你​找到​她​了​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 zhao3dao4 ta1 le5 ma5？"

msgid "And some say that was the day the Flux was born."
msgstr ""
"有人​说​，​动荡​带​就​是从​那天​起​诞生​的​。\n"
"you3ren2 shuo1，dong4dang4 dai4 jiu4 shi4 cong2 na4tian1 qi3 dan4sheng1 de5。"

msgid ""
"And some things it takes are gone forever. Friends that disappear. Family "
"that dies. People like Monika."
msgstr ""
"而​它​夺取​的​东西​有时候​就​再也​回不来​了​。​消失​的​朋友​。​逝去​的​亲人​。​像​莫妮卡​这样​的​人​。\n"
"er2 ta1 duo2qu3 de5 dong1xi1 you3shi2hou5 jiu4 zai4ye3 hui2 bu4 lai2 le5。xiao1shi1 de5 peng2you5。shi4qu4 de5 qin1ren2。xiang4 Mo4ni1ka3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2。"

msgid "And speaking of which..."
msgstr ""
"说​到​这个​……\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5……"

msgid "And thank God for that."
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​。\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。"

msgid ""
"And that sad attempt at deception that you just pulled?\n"
"\n"
"I could hear that, too."
msgstr ""
"还有​你​刚才​那​可悲​的​欺骗​尝试​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​听到​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 ni3 gang1cai2 na4 ke3bei1 de5 qi1pian4 chang2shi4？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 ting1dao4 le5。"

msgid "And that was all it took."
msgstr ""
"他​就​这么​说服​了​她​。\n"
"ta1 jiu4 zhe4me5 shuo1fu2 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"And that's about it. She's gone, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks down into the cup of soykaf in his hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know if I'll ever hear from her again."
msgstr ""
"事情​就是​这样​。​她​离开​了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​低头​看着​自己​手里​的​豆​咖​杯子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​自己​是否​还​能​再​见到​她​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。ta1 li2kai1 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 kan4 zhao2 zi4ji3 shou3li3 de5 dou4 ka1 bei1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 shi4fou3 hai2 neng2 zai4 jian4dao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"And that's all there is to it. A simple job, but an important one. \n"
"\n"
"I have already marked your target's current location on your PDA. We have great faith in you, $(l.name)... please don't disappoint us."
msgstr ""
"事情​就是​这样​。​任务​简单​，​却​至关重要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已​将​目标​当前​位置​标记​在​你​的​PDA​上​。​我们​对​你​充满信心​，​$(l.name)​……​请​不要​让​我们​失望​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。ren4wu5 jian3dan1，que4 zhi4guan1zhong4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3 jiang1 mu4biao1 dang1qian2 wei4zhi5 biao1ji4 zai4 ni3 de5 PDA shang4。wo3men5 dui4 ni3 chong1 man3 xin4 xin1，$(l.name)……qing3 bu4yao4 rang4 wo3men5 shi1wang4。"

msgid "And that's none of your business, kid."
msgstr ""
"与​你​无关​，​孩子​。\n"
"yu4 ni3 wu2guan1，hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"And that's what we're gonna do. We're heading back to that place, and we're "
"going to get answers."
msgstr ""
"我们​就​这么​做​。​我们​要​回到​那个​地方​，​把​一切​查个​水落石出​。\n"
"wo3men5 jiu4 zhe4me5 zuo4。wo3men5 yao4 hui2dao4 na4ge5 di4fang1，ba3 yi1qie4 cha2 ge4 shui3luo4shi2chu1。"

msgid "And the government?"
msgstr ""
"那​政府​呢​？\n"
"na4 zheng4fu3 ni2？"

msgid "And the megacorps?"
msgstr ""
"那​各大​超企​呢​？\n"
"na4 ge4 dai4 chao1 qi3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"And the next morning it was all over. The fighting, at least. There were "
"still plenty of soldiers left in the city. German, Russian, Polish. But we "
"had our lives back."
msgstr ""
"到​了​第二天​早上​，​一切​都​尘埃落定​了​。​至少​战斗​这部分​是​的​。​城里​仍​有​大批​士兵​驻守​—​—​德国人​、​俄罗斯​人​、​波兰人​。​但​我们​终于​重获​新生​。\n"
"dao4 le5 di4er4tian1 zao3shang5，yi1qie4 dou1 chen2ai1luo4ding4 le5。zhi4shao3 zhan4dou4 zhe4 bu4 fen4 shi4 de5。cheng2 li3 reng2 you3 da4pi1 shi4bing1 zhu4shou3——de2guo2ren2、e2luo2si1 ren2、bo1 lan2 ren2。dan4 wo3men5 zhong1yu2 chong2huo4 xin1sheng1。"

msgid "And the people?"
msgstr ""
"那​人们​呢​？\n"
"na4 ren2men5 ni2？"

msgid "And the rest of the building...?"
msgstr ""
"那​这栋​楼​的​其他​部分​呢​……​？\n"
"na4 zhe4 dong4 lou2 de5 qi2ta1 bu4fen5 ni2……？"

msgid "And the two of you?"
msgstr ""
"那​你们​俩​呢​？\n"
"na4 ni3men5 lia3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"And then I hear gunshots, and they bring me back around to the present.\n"
"\n"
"A strange dream. I wonder what it means..."
msgstr ""
"接着​我​听见​了​枪声​，​它们​将​我拉回​现实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​个​奇怪​的​梦​。​不​知道​它​意味着​什么​……\n"
"\n"
"jie1zhe5 wo3 ting1jian4 le5 qiang1sheng1，ta1men5 jiang1 wo3 la1 hui2 xian4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 qi2guai4 de5 meng4。bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5……"

msgid ""
"And then I lost her.\n"
"\n"
"I didn't know what was happening... it came out of nowhere. One day, she was just... *gone.*\n"
"\n"
"Along with most of my decking gear."
msgstr ""
"然后​我​失去​了​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​发生​了​什么​……​总之​就​突然​发生​了​。​有​一天​，​她​突然​……​*​消失​了​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​还​带走​了​我​的​大部分​骇入​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 wo3 shi1qu4 le5 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5……zong3zhi1 jiu4 tu1ran2 fa1sheng1 le5。you3 yi1 tian1，ta1 tu1ran2……*xiao1shi1 le5*。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hai2 dai4zou3 le5 wo3 de5 da4bu4fen5 hai4 ru4 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"And then came Schoneberg, and the Final Law. Few took it seriously at first."
" (h)"
msgstr ""
"随后​是​舍嫩​贝格​，​以及​最终​法律​。​起初​并​没有​什么​人​把​这​回事​当真​。\n"
"sui2hou4 shi4 she3 nen4 bei4 ge2，yi3ji2 zui4zhong1 fa3lu:4。qi3chu1 bing4 mei2you3 shen2me5 ren2 ba3 zhe4 hui2shi4 dang4zhen1。"

msgid "And then it is torn apart."
msgstr ""
"然后​一切​被​撕裂​开来​。\n"
"ran2hou4 yi1qie4 bei4 si1lie4 kai1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"And then we discovered the Kreuzbasar, and Monika. We could tell she had a "
"good head on her shoulders. So we figured this could be a home for us."
msgstr ""
"后来​我们​发现​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​以及​莫妮卡​。​我们​能​看得出​她​是​个​好人​。​所以​我们​觉得​可以​把​这里​当作​家园​。\n"
"hou4lai2 wo3men5 fa1xian4 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，yi3ji2 Mo4ni1ka3。wo3men5 neng2 kan4de5chu1 ta1 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2。suo3yi3 wo3men5 jue2de5 ke3yi3 ba3 zhe4li3 dang4zuo4 jia1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"And then...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He rubs his hands together excitedly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...It's time to get *creative.*"
msgstr ""
"然后​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​激动​地​搓​了​搓手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​就是​发挥​*​创造力​*​的​时候​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji1dong4 de5 cuo1 le5 cuo1 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……jiu4shi4 fa1hui1*chuang4zao4li4*de5 shi2hou5 le5。"

msgid ""
"And there always will be. But don't let conflict be the sole driving force "
"in your life. Look around you. There are far more important things."
msgstr ""
"战争​永远​都​会​存在​。​但​不要​让​冲突​成为​你​生活​中​唯一​的​驱动力​。​环顾四周​，​还有​许多​更​重要​的​事情​。\n"
"zhan4zheng1 yong3yuan3 dou1 hui4 cun2zai4。dan4 bu4yao4 rang4 chong1tu1 cheng2wei2 ni3 sheng1huo2 zhong4 wei2yi1 de5 qu1dong4li4。huan2gu4si4zhou1，hai2you3 xu3duo1 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "And therefore you would know?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​就​会​知道​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 hui4 zhi1dao4？"

msgid ""
"And they don't smell great, either. \n"
"\n"
"But you'll see for yourself in a second."
msgstr ""
"而且​气味​也​不怎么样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​马上​就​能​亲眼见到​了​。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 qi4wei4 ye3 bu4zen3me5yang4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 ma3shang4 jiu4 neng2 qin1 yan3 jian4 dao4 le5。"

msgid "And this alliance? What do you propose?"
msgstr ""
"关于​结盟​的​事​呢​？​你​怎么​想​？\n"
"guan1yu2 jie2meng2 de5 shi4 ni2？ni3 zen3me5 xiang3？"

msgid ""
"And this brings me back to the trouble that we're all in - though that term might be underselling it a bit.\n"
"\n"
"\"Deep shit\" is probably closer to the mark."
msgstr ""
"这​让​我​回到​了​我们​所有人​面临​的​困境​—​—​虽然​这个​说法​可能​有点​轻描淡写​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​深陷​泥潭​”​或许​更​贴切​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 rang4 wo3 hui2dao4 le5 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 mian4lin2 de5 kun4jing4——sui1ran2 zhe4ge5 shuo1fa3 ke3neng2 you3dian3 qing1miao2dan4xie3。\n"
"\n"
"“shen1xian4 ni2tan2” huo4xu3 geng1 tie1qie4。"

msgid "And this place meant a lot to her."
msgstr ""
"这个​地方​对​她​也​意味着​很多​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 di4fang1 dui4 ta1 ye3 yi4wei4zhe5 hen3 duo1。"

msgid ""
"And time. There was more to it than we saw. Places like that don’t spring up"
" overnight."
msgstr ""
"以及​时间​。​我们​见到​的​只是​那栋​设施​的​冰山一角​。​那种​地方​不是​一​晚上​能​建成​的​。\n"
"yi3ji2 shi2jian1。wo3men5 jian4dao4 de5 zhi3shi4 na4 dong4 she4shi1 de5 bing1shan1yi1jiao3。na4zhong3 di4fang1 bu4shi4 yi1 wan3shang5 neng2 jian4cheng2 de5。"

msgid "And to this team."
msgstr ""
"还有​这个​团队​。\n"
"hai2you3 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4。"

msgid "And we did. With the push of a button."
msgstr ""
"所以​我们​轻轻​一​按​，​就​做到​了​这件​事​。\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 qing1qing1 yi1 an4，jiu4 zuo4dao4 le5 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid "And well done it was."
msgstr ""
"而且​你​也​出色​地​完成​了​任务​。\n"
"er2qie3 ni3 ye3 chu1se4 de5 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5。"

msgid "And what about my pay?"
msgstr ""
"那​我​的​报酬​呢​？\n"
"na4 wo3 de5 bao4chou5 ni2？"

msgid "And what about you? How are you feeling?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​呢​？​你​有​什么​感受​？\n"
"na4 ni3 ni2？ni3 you3 shen2me5 gan3shou4？"

msgid "And what do they have to say?"
msgstr ""
"他们​有​什么​可聊​的​？\n"
"ta1men5 you3 shen2me5 ke3 liao2 de5？"

msgid "And what do you believe?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​相信​什么​呢​？\n"
"na4 ni3 xiang1xin4 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid "And what do you think?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​是​怎么​认为​的​呢​？\n"
"na4 ni3 shi4 zen3me5 ren4wei2 de5 ni2？"

msgid "And what does THAT mean?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​这话​是​什么​意思​嘛​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 zhe4 hua4 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5 ma5？"

msgid "And what else, I wonder?"
msgstr ""
"还有​别的​什么​吗​？\n"
"hai2you3 bie2de5 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "And what happened after that?"
msgstr ""
"之后​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"zhi1hou4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "And what if I don't?"
msgstr ""
"如果​我​拒绝​呢​？\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 ju4jue2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"And what if he was indoctrinated into the service of the Adversary when he "
"was my age? Would he not be at fault any more, either?"
msgstr ""
"倘若​他​也​在​和​我​同龄​时​就​被​洗脑​侍奉​“​反叛者​”​了​呢​？​难道​他​也​就​没错​了​吗​？\n"
"tang3ruo4 ta1 ye3 zai4 he4 wo3 tong2ling2 shi2 jiu4 bei4 xi3nao3 shi4feng4“fan3 pan4 zhe3” le5 ni2？nan2dao4 ta1 ye3 jiu4 mei2cuo4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"And what if we can't? Once you've driven the dragons extinct, you can't un-"
"kill them. What you're really proposing to do is irrevocably change the "
"ecosystem of our world, and you don't know what might happen as a result."
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​做​不到​呢​？​一旦​你​让​巨龙​灭绝​的话​，​就​无法​再​让​他们​复活​。​你​真正​提议​要​做​的​事情​将​不可逆转​地​改变​我们​世界​的​生态系统​，​而​你​不​知道​这样​做​可能​会​带来​什么​后果​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 zuo4 bu4dao4 ni2？yi1dan4 ni3 rang4 ju4long2 mie4jue2 de5hua4，jiu4 wu2fa3 zai4 rang4 ta1men5 fu4huo2。ni3 zhen1zheng4 ti2yi4 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 jiang1 bu4ke3ni4zhuan3 de5 gai3bian4 wo3men5 shi4jie4 de5 sheng1tai4xi4tong3，er2 ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 ke3neng2 hui4 dai4lai2 shen2me5 hou4guo3。"

msgid ""
"And what if you later discover that you shouldn't have? You can't un-kill "
"them. What you're really proposing to do is irrevocably change the ecosystem"
" of the world, and you don't know what might happen as a result."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​后来​发现自己​不该​这么​做​，​那该​怎么办​？​你​无法​让​他们​复活​。​你​真正​提议​要​做​的​事情​将​不可逆转​地​改变​我们​世界​的​生态系统​，​而​你​不​知道​这样​做​可能​会​带来​什么​后果​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hou4lai2 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 bu4gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4，na4 gai1 zen3me5ban4？ni3 wu2fa3 rang4 ta1men5 fu4huo2。ni3 zhen1zheng4 ti2yi4 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 jiang1 bu4ke3ni4zhuan3 de5 gai3bian4 wo3men5 shi4jie4 de5 sheng1tai4xi4tong3，er2 ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 ke3neng2 hui4 dai4lai2 shen2me5 hou4guo3。"

msgid "And what is this \"greater good\"? Define it for me."
msgstr ""
"什么​叫​“​为了​大局​”​？​说​明白​些​。\n"
"shen2me5 jiao4“wei4le5 da4ju2”？shuo1 ming2bai5 xie1。"

msgid "And what makes you think I'll come along?"
msgstr ""
"你​凭​什么​以为​我会​乖乖​就范​？\n"
"ni3 ping2 shen2me5 yi3wei2 wo3 hui4 guai1guai1 jiu4fan4？"

msgid "And what of the parchment?"
msgstr ""
"那​羊皮纸​呢​？\n"
"na4 yang2pi2zhi3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"And what, exactly, do you want us to do?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger's tone is neutral, her posture relaxed. But one of her hands casually comes to rest on the butt of her shotgun.\n"
"\n"
"Ullrich doesn't seem to notice.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​需要​我们​做​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​语气​平淡​，​姿态​放松​。​但​她​的​一只​手​不经意​间​已经​搭​在​了​霰弹枪​的​枪托​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​乌尔里​希​似乎​没有​注意​到​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 xu1yao4 wo3men5 zuo4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 yu3qi4 ping2dan4，zi1tai4 fang4song1。dan4 ta1 de5 yi1 zhi3 shou3 bu4jing1yi4 jian1 yi3jing1 da1 zai4 le5 xian4dan4qiang1 de5 qiang1tuo1 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1 si4hu1 mei2you3 zhu4yi4 dao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"And why? To master this planet, to bend it to humanity’s will, to proliferate, and ultimately, to spread to the stars.\n"
"\n"
"People and dragons are not so different from that perspective, yes? But whereas humanity dominates through overwhelming proliferation, dragons hoard."
msgstr ""
"目的​也​显而易见​：​为了​主宰​这颗​星球​，​为了​让​它​屈从​于​人类​的​意志​，​为了​繁衍​和​扩张​，​最终​向​群星​进发​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​这个​角度看​，​人类​与​龙族​其实​并​无​不同​，​对​吧​？​只不过​，​人类​通过​无休止​的​扩张​来​维持​统治​，​而龙族​则​看重​囤积​与​占有​。\n"
"\n"
"mu4di4 ye3 xian3er2yi4jian4：wei4le5 zhu3zai3 zhe4 ke1 xing1qiu2，wei4le5 rang4 ta1 qu1cong2 yu2 ren2lei4 de5 yi4zhi4，wei4le5 fan2yan3 he4 kuo4zhang1，zui4zhong1 xiang4 qun2 xing1 jin4fa1。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 zhe4ge5 jiao3 du4 kan4，ren2lei4 yu4 long2 zu2 qi2shi2 bing4 wu2 bu4tong2，dui4 ba1？zhi3bu5guo4，ren2lei4 tong1guo4 wu2 xiu1 zhi3 de5 kuo4zhang1 lai2 wei2chi2 tong3zhi4，er2 long2 zu2 ze2 kan4zhong4 tun2ji1 yu4 zhan4you3。"

msgid ""
"And with that, I bid you farewell, stalwart $(scene.badfantasy).\n"
"\n"
"The people of Sutterlin BioScience will remember you always!"
msgstr ""
"那么​，​我们​就此​告别​吧​，​坚毅​的​$(scene.badfantasy)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​苏​特林​生物科学​的​人民​将​永远​记得​你​！\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，wo3men5 jiu4ci3 gao4bie2 ba1，jian1yi4 de5 $(scene.badfantasy)。\n"
"\n"
"su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 ren2min2 jiang1 yong3yuan3 ji4de5 ni3！"

msgid ""
"And yes, we're fine. We've lived through worse in this city, and we had good"
" people protecting us this time."
msgstr ""
"我们​没事​。​我们​以前​也​经历​过​这座​城市​中​更糟​的​事情​，​而且​这次​还有​好心人​来​保护​我们​。\n"
"wo3men5 mei2shi4。wo3men5 yi3qian2 ye3 jing1li4 guo4 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 zhong4 geng1 zao1 de5 shi4qing5，er2qie3 zhe4 ci4 hai2you3 hao3xin1ren2 lai2 bao3hu4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"And yet look at all the death and destruction, all the money you've spent on"
" your errand of vengeance. You... you do not get to pass judgment over me."
msgstr ""
"然而​，​看看​这​一切​死亡​与​毁灭​，​看看​你​为了​复仇​之途​所​花费​的​巨额​金钱​。​你​……​你​无权​对​我​进行​审判​。\n"
"ran2er2，kan4kan5 zhe4 yi1qie4 si3wang2 yu4 hui3mie4，kan4kan5 ni3 wei4le5 fu4chou2 zhi1 tu2 suo3 hua1fei4 de5 ju4e2 jin1qian2。ni3……ni3 wu2quan2 dui4 wo3 jin4xing2 shen3pan4。"

msgid ""
"And yet somewhere, just at the edge of your hearing, you think you can "
"recognize the faint whispering of voices. They sound sad and faraway."
msgstr ""
"然而​，​在​你​的​听觉​边缘​，​你​似乎​能​辨认出​微弱​的​低​语声​。​那些​声音​听​起来​悲伤​而​遥远​。\n"
"ran2er2，zai4 ni3 de5 ting1jue2 bian1yuan2，ni3 si4hu1 neng2 bian4 ren4 chu1 wei1ruo4 de5 di1 yu3sheng1。na4xie1 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 bei1shang1 er2 yao2yuan3。"

msgid ""
"And yet the megacorporations have been allowed to continue unchecked, "
"amassing more and more power, creating spiderwebs of “strategies” to "
"disempower and extract, while assembling standing armies of “security teams”"
" to protect their assets."
msgstr ""
"然而​那些​超企​却​得以​肆无忌惮​地​继续​扩张​，​不断​积累​更​多​权力​，​编织​一层​又​一层​名为​“​企业​战略​”​的​蛛网​，​在​削弱​对手​的​同时​榨取​利益​，​还​组建​常驻​“​安保​团队​”​来​保护​其​资产​。\n"
"ran2er2 na4xie1 chao1 qi3 que4 de2yi3 si4wu2ji4dan4 de5 ji4xu4 kuo4zhang1，bu4duan4 ji1lei3 geng1 duo1 quan2li4，bian1zhi1 yi1ceng2 you4 yi1ceng2 ming2wei2“qi3ye4 zhan4lu:e4” de5 zhu1wang3，zai4 xue1ruo4 dui4shou3 de5 tong2shi2 zha4qu3 li4yi4，hai2 zu3jian4 chang2zhu4“an1bao3 tuan2dui4” lai2 bao3hu4 qi2 zi1chan3。"

msgid ""
"And you are right... to a point. I might've judged you too harshly because of Hoffmann.\n"
"\n"
"But everything else that I said was justified."
msgstr ""
"以及​你​说得对​……​在​某些​层面​而言​。​因为​霍夫曼​的​事​，​我​对​你​的​评判​或许​太过​苛刻​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​说​的​其他​事情​仍然​有​我​自己​的​道理​。\n"
"\n"
"yi3ji2 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4……zai4 mou3xie1 ceng2mian4 er2yan2。yin1wei4 huo4fu1man4 de5 shi4，wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 ping2pan4 huo4xu3 tai4guo4 ke1ke4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 shuo1 de5 qi2ta1 shi4qing5 reng2ran2 you3 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 dao4li5。"

msgid "And you must be Dr. Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"而​你​一定​就是​沃​克莱尔​博士​了​。\n"
"er2 ni3 yi1ding4 jiu4shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 le5。"

msgid "And you think he would know something about Green Winters?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​他​知道​格林​·​温特斯​的​事​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 ta1 zhi1dao4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"And you think that something has changed, and that he's started abusing the "
"shrine's power."
msgstr ""
"而​你​现在​觉得​事情​有变​，​他​开始​滥用​神龛​的​力量​了​。\n"
"er2 ni3 xian4zai4 jue2de5 shi4qing5 you3 bian4，ta1 kai1shi3 lan4yong4 shen2kan1 de5 li4liang5 le5。"

msgid "And you want me to...?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​想​让​我​……​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3……？"

msgid "And you'll deliver those rations?"
msgstr ""
"然后​你们​就​会​把​口粮​送来​？\n"
"ran2hou4 ni3men5 jiu4 hui4 ba3 kou3liang2 song4 lai2？"

msgid "And you'll let us in on those data taps?"
msgstr ""
"然后​你​就​会​让​我们​监听​数据​插口​？\n"
"ran2hou4 ni3 jiu4 hui4 rang4 wo3men5 jian1ting1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3？"

msgid ""
"And you're annoyingly persistent.\n"
"\n"
"If you *must* know, I'm in debt. *That's* where all the money's going."
msgstr ""
"而​你​执拗​的​态度​有点烦​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​*​一定​*​要​了解​的话​，​我​欠​了​外债​。​所以​钱​都​用​在​*​这​*​上面​了​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ni3 zhi2niu4 de5 tai4du5 you3 dian3 fan2 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3*yi1ding4*yao4 liao3jie3 de5hua4，wo3 qian4 le5 wai4zhai4。suo3yi3 qian2 dou1 yong4 zai4*zhe4*shang4mian4 le5。"

msgid "And you're the Becks."
msgstr ""
"而​你们​是​贝克​夫妇​。\n"
"er2 ni3men5 shi4 bei4ke4 fu1fu4。"

msgid ""
"And you've accomplished all of this through... diplomacy? Interesting.\n"
"\n"
"It is... well, it is not what I would have done. But perhaps that is for the best."
msgstr ""
"你​居然​能够​通过​……​外交​手段​解决​此事​？​有意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​……​也许​不会​是​我​用​的​办法​。​但​也许​这样​更好​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ju1ran2 neng2gou4 tong1guo4……wai4jiao1 shou3duan4 jie3jue2 ci3shi4？you3yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5……ye3xu3 bu4hui4 shi4 wo3 yong4 de5 ban4fa3。dan4 ye3xu3 zhe4yang4 geng1 hao3。"

msgid ""
"And you, Marta?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns his head to stare at her, a sad smile on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've given you everything. Will you repay my love with betrayal?"
msgstr ""
"你​呢​，​玛​尔塔​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转过​头​注视​着​她​，​脸上​挂​着​悲伤​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​给​了​你​一切​。​你​要​用​背叛​来​回报​我​的​爱​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ni2，Ma3er3ta3？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 zhu4shi4 zhao2 ta1，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 bei1shang1 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gei3 le5 ni3 yi1qie4。ni3 yao4 yong4 bei4pan4 lai2 hui2bao4 wo3 de5 ai4 ma5？"

msgid "And you."
msgstr ""
"彼此彼此​。\n"
"bi3ci3bi3ci3。"

msgid ""
"And you... don't downplay what you did back there.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, we shouldn't let it go to our heads. We still have a dragon to worry about."
msgstr ""
"还有​你​呢​……​别​小看​了​你​在​这件​事上​的​作用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​别太​得意忘形​了​。​我们​还有​条​巨龙​要​对付​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 ni3 ni2……bie4 xiao3kan4 le5 ni3 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 de5 zuo4yong4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，bie4 tai4 de2yi4wang4xing2 le5。wo3men5 hai2you3 tiao2 ju4long2 yao4 dui4fu5 ni2。"

msgid ""
"And?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He leans forward, intensity burning in his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your thoughts?"
msgstr ""
"所以​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向前​倾身​，​眼中​燃烧​着​炽烈​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​想法​是​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，yan3zhong1 ran2shao1 zhao2 chi4lie4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 xiang3fa3 shi4？"

msgid "And? How'd you get rid of him?"
msgstr ""
"然后​呢​？​你​怎么​摆脱​他​的​？\n"
"ran2hou4 ni2？ni3 zen3me5 bai3tuo1 ta1 de5？"

msgid "And? What has become of the Great Wyrm, $(l.race)?"
msgstr ""
"然后​呢​？​巨龙​最终​如何​了​，​$(l.race)​？\n"
"ran2hou4 ni2？ju4long2 zui4zhong1 ru2he2 le5，$(l.race)？"

msgid ""
"Angry, deranged, or something else. \n"
"\n"
"What motivates a being such as her?"
msgstr ""
"生气​，​疯狂​，​又​或者​是​其它​原因​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​像​她​这样​的​存在​，​会受​什么​驱使​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"sheng1qi4，feng1kuang2，you4 huo4zhe3 shi4 qi2ta1 yuan2yin1。\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 ta1 zhe4yang4 de5 cun2zai4，hui4 shou4 shen2me5 qu1shi3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Angry, huh? Well, that's okay.\n"
"\n"
"You've got a right to be."
msgstr ""
"还​生气​呢​？​行​吧​，​倒​也​正常​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有​权利​生气​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 sheng1qi4 ni2？xing2 ba1，dao3 ye3 zheng4chang2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3 quan2li4 sheng1qi4。"

msgid "Annika Schroeder"
msgstr ""
"安妮​卡​·​施罗德\n"
"an1ni1 ka3 · shi1luo2de2"

msgid "Anonymous File Attachment"
msgstr ""
"匿名​文件​附件\n"
"ni4ming2 wen2jian4 fu4jian4"

msgid "Anonymous Message"
msgstr ""
"匿名​留言\n"
"ni4ming2 liu2yan2"

msgid ""
"Another distant roar of laughter crackles over your commlink. Presumably, "
"the patrons of Cafe Cezve are having a lovely evening."
msgstr ""
"通讯​链里​又​传来​一阵​遥远​的​笑声​。​想必​“​来​一壶​”​咖啡馆​的​客人​们​正​度过​一个​愉快​的​夜晚​。\n"
"tong1xun4 lian4 li3 you4 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 yao2yuan3 de5 xiao4sheng1。xiang3bi4“lai2 yi1 hu2” ka1fei1guan3 de5 ke4ren2 men5 zheng1 du4guo4 yi1ge5 yu2kuai4 de5 ye4wan3。"

msgid ""
"Another figure steps into frame behind Vauclair. An ork. He turns his head slightly, and his skin grafts catch the light.\n"
"\n"
"Vauclair slowly turns to face Audran, and the video feed cuts out."
msgstr ""
"另​一个​身影​出现​在​沃​克莱尔​背后​。​是​个​兽​人​。​他​微微​侧头​，​皮肤​移植​处​的​缝合线​泛着​异样​光芒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​沃​克莱尔​缓缓​转身​面向​奥​德兰​，​录像​就此结束​。\n"
"\n"
"ling4 yi1ge5 shen1ying3 chu1xian4 zai4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bei4hou4。shi4 ge4 shou4 ren2。ta1 wei1wei1 ce4 tou2，pi2fu1 yi2zhi2 chu3 de5 feng2 ge3 xian4 fan4 zhao2 yi4yang4 guang1mang2。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 huan3huan3 zhuan3shen1 mian4xiang4 Ao4de2lan2，lu4xiang4 jiu4 ci3 jie1 shu4。"

msgid "Another locked door. Wonderful."
msgstr ""
"又​一扇​锁​着​的​门​。​太棒了​。\n"
"you4 yi1 shan1 suo3 zhao2 de5 men2。tai4 bang4 le5。"

msgid "Another message for Plotz."
msgstr ""
"又​一条​给​普​洛茨​的​消息​。\n"
"you4 yi1 tiao2 gei3 Pu3luo4ci2 de5 xiao1xi5。"

msgid "Another pause. Her voice softens."
msgstr ""
"又​是​一阵​沉默​。​她​的​声音​柔和​下来​。\n"
"you4 shi4 yi1zhen4 chen2mo4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 rou2he2 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"Another poster who chose to remain anonymous said that magic was the culprit.\n"
"\n"
"\"Every time something crazy happens to the world, magic is to blame.\""
msgstr ""
"另​一位​选择​匿名​的​网友​声称​魔法​才​是​罪魁祸首​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​每当​世界​发生​疯狂​之​事​，​魔法​都​难辞其咎​。​”\n"
"\n"
"ling4 yi1 wei4 xuan3ze2 ni4ming2 de5 wang3you3 sheng1cheng1 mo2fa3 cai2 shi4 zui4kui2huo4shou3。\n"
"\n"
"“mei3dang1 shi4jie4 fa1sheng1 feng1kuang2 zhi1 shi4，mo2fa3 dou1 nan2ci2qi2jiu4。”"

msgid ""
"Another prophecy. The last prediction that you made came true... how did you"
" do that?"
msgstr ""
"又​一个​预言​。​你​上次​的​预测​最终​成真​了​……​你​是​怎么​做到​的​？\n"
"you4 yi1ge5 yu4yan2。ni3 shang4ci4 de5 yu4ce4 zui4zhong1 cheng2zhen1 le5……ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zuo4dao4 de5？"

msgid "Another satisfied customer. When I get hired to do a job, I deliver."
msgstr ""
"客户​满意​就​好​。​只要​我​接下​的​任务​，​保证​会​顺利完成​。\n"
"ke4hu4 man3yi4 jiu4 hao3。zhi3yao4 wo3 jie1xia4 de5 ren4wu5，bao3zheng4 hui4 shun4 li4 wan2 cheng2。"

msgid ""
"Another thing that my little Ghost Rat told me: the popular rumor in the SOX is that Feuerschwinge's astral form was... I guess you'd say \"mutated\" by all of that background radiation.\n"
"\n"
"Some of the glowpunks out there say that she's shed her body like an old coat. Others say that she's trapped, doomed to languish as an intangible, radioactive ghost."
msgstr ""
"这位​“​幽灵​老鼠​”​还​告诉​我​另​一件​事​：​萨洛卢​区里​流行​的​传言​说​，​火翼​的​灵体​……​在​那种​背景​辐射​下​，​可以​说​是​“​变异​”​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有些​幽光​住民​说​她​的​身体​就​像​一件​旧​外套​一样​四分五裂​了​，​还有​人​说​她​被​困住​了​，​注定​要​作为​一个​无形​的​放射​幽灵​饱受​煎熬​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4wei4“you1ling2 lao3shu3” hai2 gao4su4 wo3 ling4 yi1 jian4 shi4：Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 li3 liu2xing2 de5 chuan2yan2 shuo1，Huo3yi4 de5 ling2ti3……zai4 na4zhong3 bei4jing3 fu2she4 xia4，ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4“bian4yi4” le5。\n"
"\n"
"you3xie1 you1 guang1 zhu4 min2 shuo1 ta1 de5 shen1ti3 jiu4 xiang4 yi1 jian4 jiu4 wai4tao4 yi1yang4 si4fen1wu3lie4 le5，hai2you3 ren2 shuo1 ta1 bei4 kun4 zhu4 le5，zhu4ding4 yao4 zuo4wei2 yi1ge5 wu2xing2 de5 fang4she4 you1ling2 bao3shou4 jian1ao2。"

msgid ""
"Another threat? I'm terrified.\n"
"\n"
"Really, I am."
msgstr ""
"又​威胁​我​吗​？​我​好​怕​哦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真的​。\n"
"\n"
"you4 wei1xie2 wo3 ma5？wo3 hao3 pa4 e2。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1de5。"

msgid "Answer Phone"
msgstr ""
"接电话\n"
"jie1 dian4 hua4"

msgid "Answer the Vidphone"
msgstr ""
"接听​可视电话\n"
"jie1ting1 ke3shi4dian4hua4"

msgid ""
"Answer the question, man. If Grinder wanted you here, why didn't he say so "
"up front?"
msgstr ""
"回答​我​的​问题​。​如果​“​绞肉机​”​让​你​来​的话​，​他​为什么​不​提前​说​一声​？\n"
"hui2da2 wo3 de5 wen4ti2。ru2guo3“jiao3rou4ji1” rang4 ni3 lai2 de5hua4，ta1 wei4shen2me5 bu4 ti2qian2 shuo1 yi1sheng1？"

msgid "Antique Cyberarm (Left)"
msgstr ""
"古董​赛博​手臂​（​左​）\n"
"gu3dong3 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 （zuo3）"

msgid "Antique Cyberarm (Right)"
msgstr ""
"古董​赛博​手臂​（​右​）\n"
"gu3dong3 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 （you4）"

msgid ""
"Any bad reputation that they might have gained is well-deserved. But there was more to it than that, as you'll see.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hang with me, $(l.name). Rough waters ahead."
msgstr ""
"他们​不管​有​什么​恶名​都​是​罪有应得​。​但​后面​的​事情​还​不止​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​继续​听​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​接下来​才​是​最​黑暗​的​部分​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 bu4guan3 you3 shen2me5 e4ming2 dou1 shi4 zui4you3ying1de2。dan4 hou4mian5 de5 shi4qing5 hai2 bu4zhi3 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4xu4 ting1 ba1，$(l.name)。jie1xia4lai2 cai2 shi4 zui4 hei1an4 de5 bu4fen5。"

msgid "Any idea who this \"Plotz\" guy is, Hasenkamp?"
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​，​这个​叫​“​普​洛茨​”​的​家伙​是​谁​？\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3，zhe4ge5 jiao4“Pu3luo4ci2” de5 jia1huo5 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Any idea who this \"Plotz\" guy is?"
msgstr ""
"这个​叫​“​普​洛茨​”​的​家伙​是​谁​？\n"
"zhe4ge5 jiao4“Pu3luo4ci2” de5 jia1huo5 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Any leads?"
msgstr ""
"有​什么​线索​吗​？\n"
"you3 shen2me5 xian4suo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Any love that you might have felt from that man was a lie, Glory. You know "
"that."
msgstr ""
"你​从​那个​男人​身上​感受​到​的​任何​爱意​都​是​谎言​，​格洛丽​。​你​清楚​这​一点​。\n"
"ni3 cong2 na4ge5 nan2ren2 shen1shang5 gan3shou4 dao4 de5 ren4he2 ai4yi4 dou1 shi4 huang3yan2，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 qing1chu5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"Any other kiez, we might not have fared so well. But people here are "
"different. They stand together."
msgstr ""
"换作​其他​街区​，​我们​或许​就​没​这么​好过​了​。​但​这里​的​人​不​一样​，​他们​团结一致​。\n"
"huan4 zuo4 qi2ta1 jie1qu1，wo3men5 huo4xu3 jiu4 mei2 zhe4me5 hao3guo4 le5。dan4 zhe4li3 de5 ren2 bu4 yi1yang4，ta1men5 tuan2jie2yi1zhi4。"

msgid "Any suggestions as to how we should approach this?"
msgstr ""
"关于​我们​该​如何​处理​此事​，​你​有​什么​建议​吗​？\n"
"guan1yu2 wo3men5 gai1 ru2he2 chu3li3 ci3shi4，ni3 you3 shen2me5 jian4yi4 ma5？"

msgid "Any theories?"
msgstr ""
"你​有​什么​理论​吗​？\n"
"ni3 you3 shen2me5 li3lun4 ma5？"

msgid "Any thoughts about that last run that you'd like to share?"
msgstr ""
"上次​行动​，​你​有​什么​想法​没​？\n"
"shang4ci4 xing2dong4，ni3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3fa3 mei2？"

msgid "Any thoughts about that last run?"
msgstr ""
"上次​行动​，​你​有​什么​想法​没​？\n"
"shang4ci4 xing2dong4，ni3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3fa3 mei2？"

msgid "Any thoughts on what we should do next?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​我们​接下来​该​干什么​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3men5 jie1xia4lai2 gai1 gan4shen2me5？"

msgid "Any time, $(l.name). And thanks again... I mean that."
msgstr ""
"别​客气​，​$(l.name)​。​另外​我​也​要​谢谢​你​……​我​认真​的​。\n"
"bie4 ke4qi5，$(l.name)。ling4wai4 wo3 ye3 yao4 xie4xie5 ni3……wo3 ren4zhen1 de5。"

msgid "Any time. Now, is there anything else that I can do for you...?"
msgstr ""
"不​客气​。​那么​，​我​还有​其他​可以​效劳​的​吗​……​？\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。na4me5，wo3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 ke3yi3 xiao4lao2 de5 ma5……？"

msgid ""
"Any time. Ready to head back to the Kreuzbasar? We need to let the F-State "
"know about this."
msgstr ""
"不​客气​。​准备​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​吗​？​我们​得​让​动荡​带​知道​这件​事​。\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。zhun3bei4 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ma5？wo3men5 de2 rang4 dong4dang4 dai4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid "Any updates on Alexander?"
msgstr ""
"亚历山大​的​事​有​进展​吗​？\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4 de5 shi4 you3 jin4zhan3 ma5？"

msgid "Anybody ever try to get you off the sims?"
msgstr ""
"有没有​人​尝试​过​让​你​戒掉​拟感​？\n"
"you3mei2you3 ren2 chang2shi4 guo4 rang4 ni3 jie4 diao4 ni3 gan3？"

msgid "Anybody home?"
msgstr ""
"有人​在家​吗​？\n"
"you3ren2 zai4jia1 ma5？"

msgid "Anyone else feel like a drink?"
msgstr ""
"还有​人想​去​喝一杯​吗​？\n"
"hai2you3 ren2 xiang3 qu4 he4 yi1 bei1 ma5？"

msgid "Anyone have any suggestions?"
msgstr ""
"各位​有​想法​吗​？\n"
"ge4wei4 you3 xiang3fa3 ma5？"

msgid "Anyone know what the hell she’s talking about?"
msgstr ""
"有​谁​知道​她​到底​在​说​什么​吗​？\n"
"you3 shei2 zhi1dao4 ta1 dao4di3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Anyone who’d use a line that bad deserves to get smacked around a little."
msgstr ""
"像​他​这种​没话​硬​撩​的​人​，​就是​活该​挨揍​啊​。\n"
"xiang4 ta1 zhe4zhong3 mei2 hua4 ying4 liao1 de5 ren2，jiu4shi4 huo2gai1 ai2zou4 a1。"

msgid "Anything I should know about the building before I head inside?"
msgstr ""
"在​进入​大楼​之前​，​我​需要​了解​些​什么​吗​？\n"
"zai4 jin4ru4 da4lou2 zhi1qian2，wo3 xu1yao4 liao3jie3 xie1 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Anything and everything. Need a new deck? Some software, perhaps? I'm your girl.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She taps a painted fingernail against the moulded plastic of her datajack.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Or maybe you're a rigger, like I am? Perhaps I can interest you in a new drone or two?"
msgstr ""
"想要​什么​有​应有尽有​。​需要​新​的​碟​板​吗​？​需要​软件​？​来​找​我​就​对​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​涂​了​指甲油​的​手指​轻轻​敲击​着​数据​插口​的​塑料模​子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​你​和​我​一样​是​个​机师​？​也许​你​会​对​这里​的​新型​无人机​感兴趣​？\n"
"\n"
"xiang3yao4 shen2me5 you3 ying1you3jin4you3。xu1yao4 xin1 de5 die2 ban3 ma5？xu1yao4 ruan3jian4？lai2 zhao3 wo3 jiu4 dui4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 tu2 le5 zhi3jia5you2 de5 shou3zhi3 qing1qing1 qiao1ji1 zhao2 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 de5 su4 liao4 mo2 zi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3 ni3 he4 wo3 yi1yang4 shi4 ge4 ji1shi1？ye3xu3 ni3 hui4 dui4 zhe4li3 de5 xin1xing2 wu2ren2ji1 gan3xing4qu4？"

msgid ""
"Anything capable of killing one of these things would also be dangerous to "
"us, wouldn't it?"
msgstr ""
"如果​有​东西​能​杀死​它们​的话​，​那​对​我们​来说​也​会​是​极度​危险​的​吧​？\n"
"ru2guo3 you3 dong1xi1 neng2 sha1si3 ta1men5 de5hua4，na4 dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 ye3 hui4 shi4 ji2du4 wei1xian3 de5 ba1？"

msgid "Anything else in there?"
msgstr ""
"里面​还有​什么​吗​？\n"
"li3mian4 hai2you3 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "Anything else you need?"
msgstr ""
"你​还有​什么​需要​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 ma5？"

msgid "Anything else you want to jaw about?"
msgstr ""
"你​还有​什么​事想​说​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 xiang3 shuo1 ma5？"

msgid "Anything new happen while I was gone?"
msgstr ""
"我​不​在​的​时候​有​什么​新​的​事​发生​吗​？\n"
"wo3 bu4 zai4 de5 shi2hou5 you3 shen2me5 xin1 de5 shi4 fa1sheng1 ma5？"

msgid "Anything you could say to her you can say to me."
msgstr ""
"你​能​对​她​说​的话​，​也​可以​对​我​说​。\n"
"ni3 neng2 dui4 ta1 shuo1 de5hua4，ye3 ke3yi3 dui4 wo3 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, \"shadowrunner,\" your fellow mop-jockeys beat you here.\n"
"\n"
"Security checks came in green, so you're good to head into the building whenever you want to.\n"
"\n"
"Sooner would be better, by the way. For both of us."
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​“​暗影​狂奔​者​”​，​其他​的​拖把​工​可比​你​先到​一步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​安检​都​通过​了​，​所以​你​想​什么​时候​进​大楼​都​可以​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​你们​最好​动作​快点​。​这样​对​大家​都​好​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，“an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3”，qi2ta1 de5 tuo1ba3 gong1 ke3bi3 ni3 xian1 dao4 yi1 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"an1jian3 dou1 tong1guo4 le5，suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 jin4 da4lou2 dou1 ke3yi3。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4 ni3men5 zui4hao3 dong4zuo4 kuai4dian3。zhe4yang4 dui4 da4jia1 dou1 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, I did some housekeeping, and I discovered something. On the morning that Emilie disappeared, some information vanished from my cyberdeck as well.\n"
"\n"
"She did a good job of covering her tracks, but I can see the signs. She grabbed the file and ran, end of story."
msgstr ""
"总之​我​收拾​了​一下​，​也​有​了​些​发现​。​艾米莉​消失​的​那天​早上​，​我​的​赛博碟板​里面​也​有些​情报​不见​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​掩盖​踪迹​的​手段​很​高明​，​但​我​还是​发现​了​不对劲​。​她​带​着​我​的​文件​逃走​了​，​事情​就是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 wo3 shou1shi5 le5 yi1xia4，ye3 you3 le5 xie1 fa1xian4。ai4 mi3 li4 xiao1shi1 de5 na4tian1 zao3shang5，wo3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 li3mian4 ye3 you3xie1 qing2bao4 bu4jian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yan3gai4 zong1ji4 de5 shou3duan4 hen3 gao1ming2，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 fa1xian4 le5 bu4dui4jin4。ta1 dai4 zhao2 wo3 de5 wen2jian4 tao2zou3 le5，shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, I just wanted to thank you for everything that you did for me. Kicking my cram habit was the hardest thing that I've ever done, and I don't think I would've tried if you hadn't talked me into it.\n"
"\n"
"To celebrate my newfound soberiety, I've decided to sign on as a volunteer at the charity. Who knows? Maybe giving back to the community will help turn things around in my life."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​想​感谢​你​为​我​做​的​一切​。​戒掉​超感​是​我​做​过​最​艰难​的​事​，​如果​你​当初​没有​说服​我​尝试​，​我​可能​永远​也​不会​踏出​这​一步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​庆祝​我​重获​清醒​，​我​决定​报名​成为​慈善机构​的​志愿者​。​谁​知道​呢​？​也许​回馈​社会​能​帮​我​的​人生​重回​正轨​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 xiang3 gan3xie4 ni3 wei2 wo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4。jie4 diao4 chao1 gan3 shi4 wo3 zuo4 guo4 zui4 jian1nan2 de5 shi4，ru2guo3 ni3 dang1chu1 mei2you3 shuo1fu2 wo3 chang2shi4，wo3 ke3neng2 yong3yuan3 ye3 bu4hui4 ta1 chu1 zhe4 yi1 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 qing4zhu4 wo3 chong2huo4 qing1xing3，wo3 jue2ding4 bao4ming2 cheng2wei2 ci2shan4ji1gou4 de5 zhi4yuan4zhe3。shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？ye3xu3 hui2kui4 she4hui4 neng2 bang1 wo3 de5 ren2sheng1 chong2hui2 zheng4gui3。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, I went on this run the other day, and I've just been DYING to share the story with someone!\n"
"\n"
"You *understand* me, so I thought that \"someone\" might as well be you!"
msgstr ""
"总之​，​前​几天​我​接活​的​时候​，​发生​了​一件​事​，​让​我​真的​忍不住​想​找​人​分享​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​最​懂​我​了​，​我​觉得​这个​“​人选​”​非你莫属​！\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，qian2 ji3tian1 wo3 jie1huo2 de5 shi2hou5，fa1sheng1 le5 yi1 jian4 shi4，rang4 wo3 zhen1de5 ren3bu5zhu4 xiang3 zhao3 ren2 fen1xiang3！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zui4 dong3 wo3 le5，wo3 jue2de5 zhe4ge5“ren2xuan3” fei1ni3mo4shu3！"

msgid ""
"Anyway, I'm happy knowin' that she's gonna see some use again. Give 'er some"
" good use, okay?"
msgstr ""
"不管怎么​说​吧​，​我​也​很​高兴​能​看到​她​再​派上用场​。​好好​待​她​，​可以​吗​？\n"
"bu4 guan3 zen3 ma2 shuo1 ba1，wo3 ye3 hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 kan4dao4 ta1 zai4 pai4shang4yong4chang3。hao3hao3 dai1 ta1，ke3yi3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Anyway, I'm only bothering you with this because it's solid evidence that we're doing the right thing. Even if Harrow does escape, he won't be as much of a threat as we thought he was.\n"
"\n"
"I just wanted you to know that."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​说​这个​只是​因为​它​是​一份​确凿​的​证据​，​能够​表明​我们​正在​做​正确​的​事​。​即使​哈罗​逃走​，​他​也​不会​变成​我们​想象​中​的​巨大​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​想​让​你​知道​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 shuo1 zhe4ge5 zhi3shi4 yin1wei4 ta1 shi4 yi1 fen4 que4zao2 de5 zheng4ju4，neng2gou4 biao3ming2 wo3men5 zheng4zai4 zuo4 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。ji2shi3 ha1luo2 tao2zou3，ta1 ye3 bu4hui4 bian4cheng2 wo3men5 xiang3xiang4 zhong4 de5 ju4da4 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 rang4 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, back when I was running with the Schwarze Herzen, I laid out the groundwork for a hit on the Landberg Ring. I was never able to make good on it, though... for some reason, none of the other gangers ever volunteered to help out.\n"
"\n"
"With your help, I could steal enough money from them to cover my debt, and get myself back into Meat Grinder's good graces in the process."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​当​我​原来​还​在​“​黑心​”​混​的​时候​，​就​曾​针对​兰​登堡​帮​计划​过​袭击​行动​。​不过​，​我​始终​没​能​付诸实施​……​不知​为何​，​其他​帮派​成员​从未​主动​提出​要​帮忙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​了​你​的​帮助​，​我​就​能​从​他们​那里​偷​到​足够​的​钱​来​偿还​我​的​债务​，​并​在​过程​中​重新​获得​“​绞肉机​”​的​青睐​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，dang1 wo3 yuan2lai2 hai2 zai4“hei1xin1” hun4 de5 shi2hou5，jiu4 ceng2 zhen1dui4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 ji4hua4 guo4 xi2ji1 xing2dong4。bu4guo4，wo3 shi3zhong1 mei2 neng2 fu4zhu1shi2shi1……bu4zhi1 wei4he2，qi2ta1 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 cong2wei4 zhu3dong4 ti2chu1 yao4 bang1mang2。\n"
"\n"
"you3 le5 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，wo3 jiu4 neng2 cong2 ta1men5 na4li5 tou1 dao4 zu2gou4 de5 qian2 lai2 chang2huan2 wo3 de5 zhai4wu4，bing4 zai4 guo4cheng2 zhong4 chong2xin1 huo4de2“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 qing1lai4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, boss. I want to keep fiddling with this... learning to properly control it. And I'm sure that you've got things to do as well.\n"
"\n"
"You take care of whatever else that needs doing, and by our next run, I'll be ready to use this."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​老大​。​我​还​得​继续​摸索​这个​东西​……​好好​掌握​它​的​用法​。​而且​我​猜​你​也​有​自己​的​事要​忙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​先​去​忙​其他​事​吧​。​等​下次​行动​的​时候​，​看​我​用​它​给​你​露两手​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，lao3da4。wo3 hai2 de2 ji4xu4 mo1suo5 zhe4ge5 dong1xi1……hao3hao3 zhang3wo4 ta1 de5 yong4fa3。er2qie3 wo3 cai1 ni3 ye3 you3 zi4ji3 de5 shi4 yao4 mang2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xian1 qu4 mang2 qi2ta1 shi4 ba1。deng3 xia4ci4 xing2dong4 de5 shi2hou5，kan4 wo3 yong4 ta1 gei3 ni3 lou4 liang3 shou3。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, chief, why don't you go talk to the others? Y'know, spread the love around?\n"
"\n"
"I'm doing just fine here on my own."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​不如​你​去​跟​其他人​聊聊​？​就是​，​雨露​均​沾​嘛​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一个​人待​着​挺​好​的​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，bu4ru2 ni3 qu4 gen1 qi2 ta1 ren2 liao2 liao2？jiu4shi4，yu3lu4 jun1 zhan1 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1ge5 ren2 dai1 zhao2 ting3 hao3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, enough about them. I don't come here to talk about work.\n"
"\n"
"Was there something else that you wanted to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"总之​，​关于​他们​的​事​说​得够​多​了​。​我​不是​来聊​工作​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​别的​想聊​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，guan1yu2 ta1men5 de5 shi4 shuo1 de2 gou4 duo1 le5。wo3 bu4shi4 lai2 liao2 gong1zuo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 xiang3 liao2 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Anyway, enough talk. You'll see for yourself what this thing can do when I bring it into the field.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She slings the rifle over her shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, was there anything else?"
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​就​说​到​这里​吧​。​等​我​带​着​它​上​战场​，​你​就​能​亲眼​见识​见识​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​步枪​甩​到​肩上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​什么​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，jiu4 shuo1 dao4 zhe4li3 ba1。deng3 wo3 dai4 zhao2 ta1 shang4 zhan4chang3，ni3 jiu4 neng2 qin1yan3 jian4shi5 jian4shi5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 bu4qiang1 shuai3 dao4 jian1 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Anyway, just thought you'd want to share in the good news. And thanks for your help back there... I don't think we'd've made it out of there without you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He raises a hand in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take care, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"所有​我​就​想​跟​你​分享​一下​这个​好消息​。​我​还要​感谢​你​当时​的​帮助​……​没有​你​的话​，​我们​恐怕​就​死​在​那里​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​抬手​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​多​保重​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 wo3 jiu4 xiang3 gen1 ni3 fen1xiang3 yi1xia4 zhe4ge5 hao3 xiao1 xi1。wo3 hai2 yao4 gan3xie4 ni3 dang1shi2 de5 bang1zhu4……mei2you3 ni3 de5hua4，wo3men5 kong3pa4 jiu4 si3 zai4 na4li5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2 shou3 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"duo1 bao3zhong4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, like I was *saying,* I can make it all right again. But I'll need "
"your help to do it."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​就​像​我​*​说​的​*​，​我​可以​解决​这件​事​。​但​我​需要​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"zong3zhi1，jiu4 xiang4 wo3*shuo1 de5*，wo3 ke3yi3 jie3jue2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。dan4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, pal, I guess I've taken up enough of your time. But thanks again for lettin' me go!\n"
"\n"
"\\m/\n"
"-ThOrvald"
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​就​不​耽误​你​太​多​时间​了​。​再次​多谢​你​放​我​走​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​\\​m​/​\n"
"​-​托​瓦尔德\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 jiu4 bu4 dan1wu5 ni3 tai4 duo1 shi2jian1 le5。zai4ci4 duo1xie4 ni3 fang4 wo3 zou3！\n"
"\n"
"\\m/\n"
"-tuo1 wa3er3de2"

msgid ""
"Anyway, park or not, it was plenty big enough for us to hide in. It was also safe and pretty, and the farm was well-stocked with food. \n"
"\n"
"Most importantly, Feuerstelle gave us a sense of community and stability that we'd never had on the street, and we loved Harrow for that. He became like a surrogate father to us."
msgstr ""
"无论如何​，​这片​区域​足够​我们​藏身​，​既​安全​又​漂亮​，​农场​里​食物​储备​充足​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最​重要​的​是​，​“​火坑​”​给​了​我们​街头​生活​从未​体验​过​的​归属感​与​安定​感​，​为此​我们​深爱着​哈罗​。​他​就​像​我们​的​养父​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，zhe4 pian1 qu1yu4 zu2gou4 wo3men5 cang2shen1，ji4 an1quan2 you4 piao4liang5，nong2chang3 li3 shi2wu4 chu3bei4 chong1zu2。\n"
"\n"
"zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4，“huo3keng1” gei3 le5 wo3men5 jie1tou2 sheng1huo2 cong2wei4 ti3yan4 guo4 de5 gui1shu3gan3 yu4 an1ding4 gan3，wei4ci3 wo3men5 shen1 ai4 zhao2 ha1luo2。ta1 jiu4 xiang4 wo3men5 de5 yang3fu4 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, thanks again, $(l.name). I owe you one.\n"
"\n"
"Yours,\n"
"Silke"
msgstr ""
"再次​感谢​你​，​$(l.name)​。​我​欠​你​一个​人情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此致​，​\n"
"​西​尔克\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3，$(l.name)。wo3 qian4 ni3 yi1ge5 ren2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ci3zhi4，\n"
"Xi1er3ke4"

msgid ""
"Anyway, that's all I know.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't think it's anything to worry about. Besides, with the whole \"dragon\" thing, we've got enough on our plates already."
msgstr ""
"总之​我​就​知道​这么​多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​这​没什么​好​担心​的​。​再说​，​现在​有​“​巨龙​”​的​事情​压在​头上​，​我们​已经​够​忙​的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4me5 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4 mei2shen2me5 hao3 dan1xin1 de5。zai4shuo1，xian4zai4 you3“ju4long2” de5 shi4qing5 ya1 zai4 tou2shang4，wo3men5 yi3jing1 gou4 mang2 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, the important thing is that some portion of the spirit - let's call it a residue - got smeared onto my hand in the Adversary's domain. And somehow, back in the real world, that residue has imparted me with magic.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever the reason... however it's happening... I can't help but look upon this as a good thing."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​关键在于​那​精魂​的​一部分​—​—​我们​姑且​称之为​残留物​—​—​在​反叛者​的​领域​里​沾染到​了​我​的​手上​。​而​不知​为何​，​回到​现实​世界​后​，​这部分​残留物​竟​赋予​了​我​魔法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​出于​什么​原因​……​无论​事情​如何​发展​……​我​都​认为​这​总归​是​件​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，guan1 jian4 zai4 yu2 na4 jing1hun2 de5 yi1bu4fen5——wo3men5 gu1qie3 cheng1zhi1wei2 can2liu2wu4——zai4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 ling3yu4 li3 zhan1 ran3 dao4 le5 wo3 de5 shou3 shang4。er2 bu4zhi1 wei4he2，hui2dao4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 hou4，zhe4 bu4 fen4 can2liu2wu4 jing4 fu4yu3 le5 wo3 mo2fa3。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 chu1yu2 shen2me5 yuan2yin1……wu2lun4 shi4qing5 ru2he2 fa1zhan3……wo3 dou1 ren4wei2 zhe4 zong3gui1 shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, we know who his employer was. \"Winternight.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know. Somehow, I have a hard time believing in a Norwegian secret society that's more dangerous than the Russian mob."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我们​打探​到​了​他​的​雇主​。​“​冬夜​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​清楚​。​很难​相信​会​有​一个​比​俄罗斯​黑帮​更​危险​的​挪威​秘密组织​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3men5 da3tan4 dao4 le5 ta1 de5 gu4zhu3。“dong1 ye4”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 qing1chu5。hen3 nan2 xiang1xin4 hui4 you3 yi1ge5 bi3 e2luo2si1 hei1bang1 geng1 wei1xian3 de5 nuo2wei1 bi4 mi4 zu3 zhi1。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, we were a good team. Experienced. We went through a lot together, and we chalked up a lot of kills.\n"
"\n"
"In our own way, I'd like to think that we did some good."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我们​是​一支​优秀​的​团队​。​经验丰富​，​经历​风雨​，​也​斩获​了​无数​战果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​我们​的​角度​出发​来看​，​我​想​我们​也​算​做​了​些​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3men5 shi4 yi1 zhi1 you1xiu4 de5 tuan2dui4。jing1yan4feng1fu4，jing1li4 feng1yu3，ye3 zhan3huo4 le5 wu2shu4 zhan4 guo3。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 wo3men5 de5 jiao3du4 chu1fa1 lai2 kan4，wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 ye3 suan4 zuo4 le5 xie1 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, when a warhead full of this stuff comes into contact with a dual-natured creature... like a dragon, say... it drives a wedge between that creature's physical and astral forms. The body gets put into a sort of hibernation-state, and the spirit is forced out.\n"
"\n"
"It also looks like this... process... can maintain that state of separation indefinitely. And that's a pretty horrifying thought."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​当​满载​这种​物质​的​核弹头​接触​到​具有​双重​属性​的​生物​，​比如说​巨龙​时​……​就​会​在​这种​生物​的​肉体​和​灵体​之间​打入​一个​楔子​。​肉体​将​进入​某种​冬眠​状态​，​而​灵魂​则​被迫​出窍​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​这个​……​过程​……​可以​无限期​地​维持​这种​分离​状态​。​这​真是​个​可怕​的​想法​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，dang1 man3zai4 zhe4zhong3 wu4zhi4 de5 he2dan4tou2 jie1chu4 dao4 ju4you3 shuang1chong2 shu3xing4 de5 sheng1wu4，bi3ru2shuo1 ju4long2 shi2……jiu4 hui4 zai4 zhe4zhong3 sheng1wu4 de5 rou4ti3 he4 ling2ti3 zhi1jian1 da3ru4 yi1ge5 xie1zi5。rou4ti3 jiang1 jin4ru4 mou3zhong3 dong1mian2 zhuang4tai4，er2 ling2hun2 ze2 bei4po4 chu1 qiao4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 zhe4ge5……guo4cheng2……ke3yi3 wu2xian4qi1 de5 wei2chi2 zhe4zhong3 fen1li2 zhuang4tai4。zhe4 zhen1shi5 ge4 ke3pa4 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid ""
"Anyway, yeah. I'll admit it... I got in over my head. But only a little bit.\n"
"\n"
"The drones wouldn't have shot me. I wasn't armed. But I wasn't looking forward to spending the next week in an Azzie interrogation cell... I've heard stories."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​得​承认​……​我​确实​有点​自不量力​了​。​不过​也​就​一丁点儿​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​无人机​倒​不会​开枪​打​我​，​毕竟​我​没有​携带​武器​。​但​我​可​不想​接下来​一周​被关​在​阿兹佬​的​审讯​室​里​……​类似​的​传言​我​可​听​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 de2 cheng2ren4……wo3 que4shi2 you3dian3 zi4bu4liang4li4 le5。bu4guo4 ye3 jiu4 yi1 zheng1 dian3 er2 er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 wu2ren2ji1 dao3 bu4hui4 kai1qiang1 da3 wo3，bi4jing4 wo3 mei2you3 xie2dai4 wu3qi4。dan4 wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 jie1xia4lai2 yi1zhou1 bei4 guan1 zai4 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 shen3xun4 shi4 li3……lei4si4 de5 chuan2yan2 wo3 ke3 ting1 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. Aside from the fact that my dad and his buddies were a bunch of murderous assholes, life was pretty normal. I went to school, made friends, hung out with my mom. Kid stuff.\n"
"\n"
"Then I turned fourteen, and everything went to shit.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之​，​撇开​我​父亲​和​他​那群​兄弟​的​杀人​恶棍​身份​不谈​，​我​的​生活​原本​还​算​正常​。​我​上学​、​交朋友​、​陪​妈妈​玩​。​都​是​些​小孩子​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​直到​我​十四岁​那年​，​一切​都​他​妈​完蛋​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，pie1kai1 wo3 fu4qin1 he4 ta1 na4 qun2 xiong1di4 de5 sha1ren2 e4gun4 shen1fen4 bu4 tan2，wo3 de5 sheng1huo2 yuan2ben3 hai2 suan4 zheng4chang2。wo3 shang4xue2、jiao1peng2you5、pei2 ma1ma5 wan2。dou1 shi4 xie1 xiao3hai2zi5 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi2dao4 wo3 shi2 si4 sui4 na4 nian2，yi1qie4 dou1 ta1 ma1 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. Flash forward a few weeks. We were closing in on one of the Russian mob's major trafficking operations.\n"
"\n"
"They'd been using a series of warehouses fifty miles from the border as a staging area for their convoys."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​时间​快​进到​几周​后​，​我们​当时​即将​捣毁​俄罗斯​黑帮​的​一处​主要​人口​贩运​窝点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一直​以来​，​他们​都​将​距离​边境​五十​英里​处​的​一系列​仓库​作为​运输​车队​的​中转站​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，shi2jian1 kuai4 jin4 dao4 ji1 zhou1 hou4，wo3men5 dang1shi2 ji2jiang1 dao3hui3 e2luo2si1 hei1bang1 de5 yi1 chu3 zhu3yao4 ren2kou3 fan4yun4 wo1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhi2 yi3lai2，ta1men5 dou1 jiang1 ju4li2 bian1jing4 wu3shi2 ying1li3 chu3 de5 yi1xi4lie4 cang1ku4 zuo4wei2 yun4shu1 che1dui4 de5 zhong1zhuan3zhan4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. I'll be looking forward to the next run... just do me a favor. Make "
"sure that the client is properly vetted, and for the love of God, verify "
"that the job has nothing to do with dragons."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​很​期待​下次​行动​……​但​我​拜托​你​，​这次​可​一定​要​好好​筛选​下​客户​，​别​再​和​巨龙​扯​上​什么​关系​了​。\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 hen3 qi1dai4 xia4ci4 xing2dong4……dan4 wo3 bai4tuo1 ni3，zhe4 ci4 ke3 yi1ding4 yao4 hao3hao3 shai1xuan3 xia4 ke4hu4，bie4 zai4 he4 ju4long2 che3 shang4 shen2me5 guan1xi5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. I've got things to do... I should go get to them.\n"
"\n"
"If I hurry, I can have Grinder dead in a dumpster and still get home in time to read the grandkids a story."
msgstr ""
"总之​我​还有​事要​做​……​我​先​去​忙​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​抓紧​点​时间​的话​，​我​可以​先​把​“​绞肉机​”​弄死​，​然后​还​能​回家​给​我​的​孙孩们​读​睡​前​故事​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 wo3 hai2you3 shi4 yao4 zuo4……wo3 xian1 qu4 mang2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhua1jin3 dian3 shi2jian1 de5hua4，wo3 ke3yi3 xian1 ba3“jiao3rou4ji1” nong4si3，ran2hou4 hai2 neng2 hui2jia1 gei3 wo3 de5 sun1 hai2 men5 dou4 shui4 qian2 gu4shi4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. I've taken enough of your time, and the bottle's almost empty. \n"
"\n"
"Thanks for taking the time to talk. For what it's worth, I'm happy you're here with us."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​也​拖​着​你​聊​半天​了​，​而且​这瓶​酒​也​快​见​底​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​抽空​陪​我​聊天​。​无论如何​，​我​很​高兴​你​能​与​我们​在​一起​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 ye3 tuo1 zhao2 ni3 liao2 ban4tian1 le5，er2qie3 zhe4 ping2 jiu3 ye3 kuai4 jian4 de5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 chou1kong4 pei2 wo3 liao2tian1。wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 neng2 yu4 wo3men5 zai4 yi1qi3。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. Let's drop the subject and move on.\n"
"\n"
"Could I interest you in a new piece of cyberware? Some medical supplies, perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"总之​这个​话题​暂且​就​到​这里​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​对​新​的​赛博​改造​有​兴趣​吗​？​或者​来​点​医疗​补给​？\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 zhe4ge5 hua4ti2 zan4qie3 jiu4 dao4 zhe4li3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 xin1 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 you3 xing4qu4 ma5？huo4zhe3 lai2 dian3 yi1liao2 bu3ji3？"

msgid ""
"Anyway. Long story short, we beat ‘em. Berlin’s punks and anarchists all came together, and we stomped the living drek out of those racist pigs.\n"
"\n"
"A lot of good people died that night, but we put down some of the bad ones, too."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​长话短说​，​我们​当时​打赢​了​。​柏林​的​朋克​人士​和​无政府主义​者​齐心协力​，​把​那些​种族主义​畜生​揍​得​屁滚尿流​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那晚​有​很多​好人​倒下​，​但​我们​也​干掉​了​不少​人渣​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，chang2hua4duan3shuo1，wo3men5 dang1shi2 da3ying2 le5。bo2lin2 de5 peng2ke4 ren2shi4 he4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3 qi2xin1xie2li4，ba3 na4xie1 zhong3zu2zhu3yi4 chu4sheng5 zou4 de2 pi4gun3niao4liu2。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wan3 you3 hen3 duo1 hao3ren2 dao3xia4，dan4 wo3men5 ye3 gan4diao4 le5 bu4shao3 ren2zha1。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. One day, Harrow invited me on a field trip.\n"
"\n"
"To Stuttgart."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​哈罗​有​一天​邀请​我​外出​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​目的地​是​斯图加特​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，ha1luo2 you3 yi1 tian1 yao1qing3 wo3 wai4chu1 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"mu4di4di4 shi4 si1tu2jia1te4。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. Thanks for chasing 'em off, pal... I owe you one.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He bites his lip. The anxiety is plain on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I guess that we all do."
msgstr ""
"总之​谢谢​你​把​他们​赶走​，​朋友​……​我​欠​你​个人​情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咬紧​嘴唇​，​脸上​的​焦虑​显而易见​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​所有人​都​欠​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 xie4xie5 ni3 ba3 ta1men5 gan3zou3，peng2you5……wo3 qian4 ni3 ge4ren2 qing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3 jin3 zui3chun2，lian3 shang4 de5 jiao1lu:4 xian3er2yi4jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 qian4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. That's enough talk... we've got a job to do.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger swings her rifle up and over her shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There are an unknown number of hostiles topside. They're well equipped, decently trained, and hell-bent on killing us."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​闲话​回头​再聊​……​我们​还有​工作​要​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​将​步枪​甩过​肩头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​上头​不​知道​还有​多少​敌人​。​他们​装备精良​、​训练有素​、​一门心思​要​杀​了​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，xian2hua4 hui2tou2 zai4 liao2……wo3men5 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 jiang1 bu4qiang1 shuai3 guo4 jian1tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shang4tou2 bu4 zhi1dao4 hai2you3 duo1shao3 di2ren2。ta1men5 zhuang1 bei4 jing1 liang2、xun4 lian4 you3 su4、yi1men2xin1si5 yao4 sha1 le5 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. There are all kinds of rumors floating around about the place... I've heard stories about a walled city in there that operates on a survival-of-the-fittest, kill-or-be-killed basis. Sort of like a nightmare inversion of Berlin... all of the anarchy, but none of the stability that the F-State provides.\n"
"\n"
"The radiation poisoning, cancer, and mana pollution are just the icing on the cake."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​关于​那个​地方​有​各种各样​的​传言​……​我​听说​那里​有座​围墙​城市​，​以​适者生存​、​不杀​即​死​为​原则​运作​，​有点像​柏林​颠倒​过来​的​噩梦​版本​……​到处​是​无政府​事件​，​但​没有​动荡​带​提供​的​半点​稳定性​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​辐射​中毒​、​癌症​和​魔力​污染​就​更​不用说​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，guan1yu2 na4ge5 di4fang1 you3 ge4zhong3ge4yang4 de5 chuan2yan2……wo3 ting1shuo1 na4li5 you3 zuo4 wei2qiang2 cheng2shi4，yi3 shi4zhe3sheng1cun2、bu4 sha1 ji2 si3 wei2 yuan2ze2 yun4zuo4，you3 dian3 xiang4 bo2lin2 dian1dao3 guo4lai2 de5 e4meng4 ban3ben3……dao4chu4 shi4 wu2 zheng4 fu3 shi4jian4，dan4 mei2you3 dong4dang4 dai4 ti2gong1 de5 ban4dian3 wen3ding4xing4。\n"
"\n"
"fu2she4 zhong4du2、ai2zheng4 he4 mo2li4 wu1ran3 jiu4 geng1 bu4yong4shuo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. Time passed. Eventually we made up and laughed the whole thing off... or at least, I thought we did.\n"
"\n"
"Truth be told, I forgot all about it until I realized that the data had gone missing."
msgstr ""
"总之​事情​就​这么​过去​了​。​最终​我们​决定​对​整件事​一笑而过​……​或者​至少​我​是​这么​以为​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​早就​把​这事​给​忘​了​，​直到​我​发现​这份​数据​也​不翼而飞​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 shi4qing5 jiu4 zhe4me5 guo4qu4 le5。zui4zhong1 wo3men5 jue2ding4 dui4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 yi1 xiao4 er2 guo4……huo4zhe3 zhi4shao3 wo3 shi4 zhe4me5 yi3wei2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 zao3jiu4 ba3 zhe4 shi4 gei3 wang4 le5，zhi2dao4 wo3 fa1xian4 zhe4 fen4 shu4ju4 ye3 bu4yi4er2fei1。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. We should get back to it. We've got an AI to take out, after all.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, frowning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)... do me a favor and keep your eyes open on this one. We're walking into the unknown here. Makes me a little uneasy."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我们​还是​赶紧​干​正事​吧​。​毕竟​，​我们​要​对付​的​可是​AI​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​眉头​紧皱​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​……​拜托​你​这次​一定​要​万分​谨慎​。​我们​要​踏入​未知​的​领域​，​这​让​我​有些​不安​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3men5 hai2shi5 gan3jin3 gan4 zheng4shi4 ba1。bi4jing4，wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 ke3shi4 AI。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，mei2tou2 jin3 zhou4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……bai4tuo1 ni3 zhe4 ci4 yi1ding4 yao4 wan4fen1 jin3shen4。wo3men5 yao4 ta1 ru4 wei4zhi1 de5 ling3yu4，zhe4 rang4 wo3 you3xie1 bu4an1。"

msgid ""
"Anyway. We stopped 'em cold in Schattennest.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever their business is... whatever was going to be in those crates that the Engineer was having shipped there... it isn't our problem any more.\n"
"\n"
"The Kreuzbasar is safe. On that front, at least."
msgstr ""
"无论如何​，​我们​在​影巢​彻底​阻止​了​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​他们​到底​想要​干什么​……​无论​工程师​送​过去​的​箱子​里​到底​是​什么​……​都​和​我们​没有​丝毫​关系​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至少​在​这件​事上​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​安全​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3men5 zai4 ying3 chao2 che4di3 zu3zhi3 le5 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ta1men5 dao4di3 xiang3yao4 gan4shen2me5……wu2lun4 gong1cheng2shi1 song4 guo4qu4 de5 xiang1zi5 li3 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5……dou1 he4 wo3men5 mei2you3 si1hao2 guan1xi5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 an1quan2 le5。"

msgid "Apartment 301"
msgstr ""
"301​室\n"
"301 shi4"

msgid "Apartment 301 Door Console"
msgstr ""
"301​室​房门​控制台\n"
"301 shi4 fang2men2 kong4zhi4tai2"

msgid "Apartment 302"
msgstr ""
"302​室\n"
"302 shi4"

msgid "Apartment 302 Door Console"
msgstr ""
"302​室​房门​控制台\n"
"302 shi4 fang2men2 kong4zhi4tai2"

msgid "Apartment 303 Code"
msgstr ""
"303​室​密码\n"
"303 shi4 mi4ma3"

msgid "Apartment 303 Door Console"
msgstr ""
"303​室​房门​控制台\n"
"303 shi4 fang2men2 kong4zhi4tai2"

msgid "Apartment 303 Panel"
msgstr ""
"303​室​面板\n"
"303 shi4 mian4ban3"

msgid "Apex KeyCard"
msgstr ""
"APEX​门禁卡\n"
"APEX men2 jin1 ka3"

msgid "Apex Terminal"
msgstr ""
"APEX​终端\n"
"APEX zhong1duan1"

msgid "Apocalypse"
msgstr ""
"末日\n"
"mo4ri4"

msgid ""
"Apparently, I know better than you do, sport. Do you *know* how much work it takes to find a digital *ghost?*\n"
"\n"
"There's going to be wetwork. Breaking into government archives. Hell, I might even have to commission an expedition into the SOX.\n"
"\n"
"This is a serious undertaking, friend."
msgstr ""
"我​显然​比​你​更​清楚​，​伙计​。​你​又​是否​知道​，​追查​某个​赛博​*​幽灵​*​要​耗费​多少​精力​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​可是​一档子​湿​活儿​。​得​闯进​政府​档案库​。​说不定​还​得​雇人​深入​萨洛​卢区​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​件​正经事儿​，​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian3ran2 bi3 ni3 geng1 qing1chu5，huo3ji5。ni3 you4 shi4fou3 zhi1dao4，zhui1cha2 mou3 ge4 sai4bo2*you1ling2*yao4 hao4fei4 duo1shao3 jing1li4？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ke3shi4 yi1 dang4 zi3 shi1 huo2r5。de2 chuang3jin4 zheng4fu3 dang4 an4 ku4。shuo1bu5ding4 hai2 de2 gu4 ren2 shen1ru4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 jian4 zheng1 jing1 shi4 er2，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"Apparently, a batch of artificial lymphocytes developed for the project has recently been bound with an airborne RNA virus.\n"
"\n"
"The resulting microorganism is as infectious as the flu and exhibits a broadband capability to jump species barriers."
msgstr ""
"显然​，​为​该​项目​开发​的​一批​人工​淋巴细胞​最近​与​一种​空气​传播​的​RNA​病毒​结合​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​由此​产生​的​微生物​具有​与​流感​相当​的​传染性​，​并​展现出​跨越​物种​屏障​的​广泛​能力​。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，wei2 gai1 xiang4mu4 kai1fa1 de5 yi1 pi1 ren2gong1 lin2ba1xi4bao1 zui4jin4 yu4 yi1zhong3 kong1qi4 chuan2bo1 de5 RNA bing4du2 jie2he2。\n"
"\n"
"you2ci3 chan3sheng1 de5 wei1sheng1wu4 ju4you3 yu4 liu2gan3 xiang1dang1 de5 chuan2ran3xing4，bing4 zhan3 xian4 chu1 kua4yue4 wu4zhong3 ping2zhang4 de5 guang3fan4 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"Apparently, a number of working prototypes have been built over the last year to test the theories put forward by project scientists.\n"
"\n"
"The most recent of these has been designated \"MKVI.\""
msgstr ""
"显然​，​为了​验证​项目​科学家​们​提出​的​理论​，​他们​在​去年​建造​了​多台​原型机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最新​一台​被​命名​为​“​MKVI​”​。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，wei4le5 yan4zheng4 xiang4mu4 ke1xue2jia1 men5 ti2chu1 de5 li3lun4，ta1men5 zai4 qu4nian2 jian4zao4 le5 duo1 tai2 yuan2 xing2 ji1。\n"
"\n"
"zui4xin1 yi1 tai2 bei4 ming4ming2 wei2“MKVI”。"

msgid "Apparently, your girlfriend thinks I'm a message courier."
msgstr ""
"你​的​女朋友​显然​把​我​当成​送信​的​了​。\n"
"ni3 de5 nu:3peng2you5 xian3ran2 ba3 wo3 dang4cheng2 song4xin4 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Appreciate it. But you should know that He's happy, all the same.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You should also know that when the Dragonslayer is pleased, He tends to be generous with His rewards."
msgstr ""
"我​感激不尽​。​不过​你​要​知道​，​不论​你​怎么​想​，​祂​现在​很​满意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​屠龙​者​满意​时​，​祂​往往​会​慷慨​相赠​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3ji1bu4jin4。bu4guo4 ni3 yao4 zhi1dao4，bu4lun4 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3，ta1 xian4zai4 hen3 man3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 tu2 long2 zhe3 man3yi4 shi2，ta1 wang3wang3 hui4 kang1kai3 xiang1 zeng4。"

msgid ""
"Appreciate the warning, but that isn't gonna happen. I've got an appointment"
" to keep."
msgstr ""
"多谢​警告​，​但​我​还是​要​过去​。​我​和​别人​约​好​了​。\n"
"duo1xie4 jing3gao4，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 yao4 guo4qu4。wo3 he4 bie2ren5 yao1 hao3 le5。"

msgid "Apprentice's Outfit"
msgstr ""
"学徒​服装\n"
"xue2tu2 fu2zhuang1"

msgid "Arbeiter Ganger Enforcer"
msgstr ""
"工人​帮​打手\n"
"gong1ren2 bang1 da3shou5"

msgid "Arbeiter Ganger Heavy"
msgstr ""
"工人​帮重​甲兵\n"
"gong1ren2 bang1 chong2 jia3 bing1"

msgid "Arbeiter Ganger PhysAd"
msgstr ""
"工人​帮​物理​修士\n"
"gong1ren2 bang1 wu4li3 xiu1shi4"

msgid "Arcade Machine"
msgstr ""
"街机\n"
"jie1ji1"

msgid ""
"Archetypes are quick way to create a character. They are pre-generated "
"characters with attributes and skills tuned around a specific function. They"
" are ready to select and play. You are not locked to this archetype and can "
"grow your character however you wish."
msgstr ""
"职业​原型​是​创建​角色​的​捷径​。​它们​是​预先​生成​的​角色​，​其​属性​点​和​技能​点​围绕​着​一项​专门​的​技能​进行​分配​，​可​直接​选定​并​立即​开始​游戏​。​你​不必​局限于​职业​原型​，​并​可以​随意​培养​你​的​角色​。\n"
"zhi2ye4 yuan2xing2 shi4 chuang4jian4 jue2se4 de5 jie2jing4。ta1men5 shi4 yu4xian1 sheng1cheng2 de5 jue2se4，qi2 shu3xing4 dian3 he4 ji4neng2 dian3 wei2rao4 zhao2 yi1 xiang4 zhuan1men2 de5 ji4neng2 jin4xing2 fen1pei4，ke3 zhi2jie1 xuan3ding4 bing4 li4ji2 kai1shi3 you2xi4。ni3 bu4bi4 ju2xian4yu2 zhi2ye4 yuan2xing2，bing4 ke3yi3 sui2yi4 pei2yang3 ni3 de5 jue2se4。"

msgid "Are dead. They just don't know it yet."
msgstr ""
"已经​死定了​。​他们​只是​还​不​知道​这​一点​。\n"
"yi3jing1 si3 ding4 le5。ta1men5 zhi3shi4 hai2 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "Are they dead?"
msgstr ""
"他们​死​了​？\n"
"ta1men5 si3 le5？"

msgid ""
"Are they? You know what I'm talking about, Marta. The harvesting. The meat."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​玛​尔塔​，​你​知道​我​在​说​什么​。​关于​所谓​的​“​收获​”​。​还有​那些​肉​。\n"
"shi4 ma5？Ma3er3ta3，ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。guan1yu2 suo3wei4 de5“shou1huo4”。hai2you3 na4xie1 rou4。"

msgid ""
"Are we doing the right thing, just leaving her like this?\n"
"\n"
"Feels kind of wrong, considering."
msgstr ""
"我们​这样​放着​她​不管​，​真的​好​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​总​感觉​有些​不​对​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4yang4 fang4 zhao2 ta1 bu4guan3，zhen1de5 hao3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zong3 gan3jue2 you3xie1 bu4 dui4。"

msgid "Are we doing the right thing, just leaving her like this? "
msgstr ""
"我们​这样​放着​她​不管​，​真的​好​吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4yang4 fang4 zhao2 ta1 bu4guan3，zhen1de5 hao3 ma5？"

msgid "Are we doing the right thing, just... leaving her like this?"
msgstr ""
"我们​这样​……​放着​她​不管​，​真的​好​吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4yang4……fang4 zhao2 ta1 bu4guan3，zhen1de5 hao3 ma5？"

msgid "Are we gonna hug now?"
msgstr ""
"你​这​是​要​跟​我​抱​一个​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi4 yao4 gen1 wo3 bao4 yi1ge5 ma5？"

msgid "Are we good now, Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​我们​的​恩怨​已经​一笔勾销​了​吧​？\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，wo3men5 de5 en1yuan4 yi3jing1 yi1bi3gou1xiao1 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Are we? Sorry about that. Never been much for boundaries. \n"
"\n"
"All the same, I'd like it if you'd tell me."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​那​不好意思​啊​，​我​是​有点​缺乏​边界​感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管如此​，​我​还是​希望​你​能​跟​我​说​说​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？na4 bu4hao3yi4si5 a1，wo3 shi4 you3dian3 que1fa2 bian1jie4 gan3。\n"
"\n"
"jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，wo3 hai2shi5 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 gen1 wo3 shuo1 shuo1。"

msgid "Are you accepting donations?"
msgstr ""
"你​接受​捐赠​吗​？\n"
"ni3 jie1shou4 juan1zeng4 ma5？"

msgid "Are you all right, Aleksi?"
msgstr ""
"你​还好​吗​，​阿莱克​西​？\n"
"ni3 hai2hao3 ma5，e1 lai2 ke4 xi1？"

msgid "Are you all right, Kim?"
msgstr ""
"你​还好​吗​，​阿金​？\n"
"ni3 hai2hao3 ma5，e1 jin1？"

msgid "Are you all right? I hope that you weren't hurt in the attack."
msgstr ""
"你​没事​吧​？​我​听说​你​在​袭击​中​没有​受伤​。\n"
"ni3 mei2shi4 ba1？wo3 ting1shuo1 ni3 zai4 xi2ji1 zhong4 mei2you3 shou4shang1。"

msgid "Are you always this hostile?"
msgstr ""
"你​说话​总​这么​带刺​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1hua4 zong3 zhe4me5 dai4ci4 ma5？"

msgid "Are you always this inquisitive?"
msgstr ""
"你​总是​这么​八卦​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zong3shi4 zhe4me5 ba1gua4 ma5？"

msgid "Are you always this rude to your customers?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​顾客​向来都是​这么​粗鲁​吗​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 gu4ke4 xiang4 lai2 dou1 shi4 zhe4me5 cu1lu3 ma5？"

msgid "Are you ever not a dick?"
msgstr ""
"你​一直​都​这么​混蛋​吗​？\n"
"ni3 yi1zhi2 dou1 zhe4me5 hun2dan4 ma5？"

msgid "Are you ever?"
msgstr ""
"你​有​过​好​心情​的​时候​吗​？\n"
"ni3 you3 guo4 hao3 xin1qing2 de5 shi2hou5 ma5？"

msgid "Are you familiar with the phrase \"killing two birds with one stone?\""
msgstr ""
"你​有没有​听过​“​一石二鸟​”​这个​词​？\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 ting1 guo4“yi1shi2er4niao3” zhe4ge5 ci2？"

msgid "Are you folks all right?"
msgstr ""
"你们​没事​吧​？\n"
"ni3men5 mei2shi4 ba1？"

msgid "Are you going to pu-"
msgstr ""
"你​是不是​要​—​—\n"
"ni3 shi4bu5shi4 yao4 — —"

msgid "Are you hurt?"
msgstr ""
"你​受伤​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shou4shang1 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Are you okay, Herr Mettbach?"
msgstr ""
"你​还好​吧​，​梅特​巴赫​先生​？\n"
"ni3 hai2hao3 ba1，mei2 te4 ba1he4 xian1sheng5？"

msgid "Are you ready to tell me about that chrome you're sporting?"
msgstr ""
"你​准备​好​给​我​讲讲​你​身上​的​镀铬​改造​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 gei3 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 ni3 shen1shang5 de5 du4 ge4 gai3zao4 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Are you saying that they'd turn their guns on us?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​他们​会​来​报复​我们​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 ta1men5 hui4 lai2 bao4fu4 wo3men5？"

msgid ""
"Are you still looking for closure? Because your story had a lot of loose "
"ends that need to be tied up."
msgstr ""
"你​还​在​寻求​答案​吗​？​因为​你​的​故事​里​有​太​多​悬而未决​的​线索​需要​梳理​。\n"
"ni3 hai2 zai4 xun2qiu2 da2an4 ma5？yin1wei4 ni3 de5 gu4shi4 li3 you3 tai4 duo1 xuan2er2wei4jue2 de5 xian4suo3 xu1yao4 shu1li3。"

msgid "Are you still moping about those debts?"
msgstr ""
"你​还​在​操心​欠债​的​事情​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hai2 zai4 cao1xin1 qian4zhai4 de5 shi4qing5 ma5？"

msgid "Are you sure that our friend here only speaks Sperethiel?"
msgstr ""
"你​确定​我们​这位​朋友​只会​说​精灵​语​吗​？\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 wo3men5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 zhi3 hui4 shuo1 jing1ling2 yu3 ma5？"

msgid "Are you sure that we can trust Alice?"
msgstr ""
"你​确定​爱丽丝​信得过​吗​？\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ai4li4si1 xin4de5guo4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Are you sure that you want to confirm these selections? This action cannot "
"be undone."
msgstr ""
"确定​要​升级​这些​技能​吗​？​此​操作​无法​恢复​。\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 sheng1ji2 zhe4xie1 ji4neng2 ma5？ci3 cao1zuo4 wu2fa3 hui1fu4。"

msgid ""
"Are you sure that you want to do this? If set that thing free, Harrow will "
"run, and we'll be too busy helping the cultists to follow him."
msgstr ""
"你​确定​要​这样​做​吗​？​如果​我们​释放​那​东西​，​哈罗​就会​趁乱​逃走​，​而​我们​到时候​会忙​着​救助​那些​教徒​，​没​时间​再​去​追​他​了​。\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 yao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 ma5？ru2guo3 wo3men5 shi4fang4 na4 dong1xi1，ha1luo2 jiu4 hui4 chen4 luan4 tao2zou3，er2 wo3men5 dao4shi2hou4 hui4 mang2 zhao2 jiu4zhu4 na4xie1 jiao4tu2，mei2 shi2jian1 zai4 qu4 dui1 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Are you sure that you're ready for this, Glory? There's no shame in turning "
"back."
msgstr ""
"你​确定​准备​好了吗​，​格洛丽​？​现在​掉头​离开​并​不​丢人​。\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5，Ge2luo4li2？xian4zai4 diao4tou2 li2kai1 bing4 bu4 diu1ren2。"

msgid "Are you sure you meant flippy disks? Didn't you just say floppy disks?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​翻盘​吗​？​你​刚刚​不是​才​说​了​磁盘​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 fan1pan2 ma5？ni3 gang1gang5 bu4shi4 cai2 shuo1 le5 ci2pan2？"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to change to the selected resolution? The resolution "
"will revert back in 20 seconds if not confirmed."
msgstr ""
"确定​要​更改​为此​分辨率​吗​？​若​未​确认​，​分辨率​将​在​20​秒​后​自动​恢复​。\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 geng1gai3 wei4ci3 fen1bian4lu:4 ma5？ruo4 wei4 que4ren4，fen1bian4lu:4 jiang1 zai4 20 miao3 hou4 zi4dong4 hui1fu4。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to exit the game?"
msgstr ""
"确定​要​退出​游戏​吗​？\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 tui4chu1 you2xi4 ma5？"

msgid "Are you sure you want to exit to the Main Menu?"
msgstr ""
"确定​要​退出​至主​菜单​吗​？\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 tui4chu1 zhi4 zhu3 cai4dan1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to exit to the Main Menu? You will lose any progress "
"since the last save."
msgstr ""
"确定​要​退出​至主​菜单​吗​？​上次​自动​保存​后​的​所有​进度​将​丢失​。\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 tui4chu1 zhi4 zhu3 cai4dan1 ma5？shang4ci4 zi4dong4 bao3cun2 hou4 de5 suo3you3 jin4du4 jiang1 diu1shi1。"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to load this save game? You will lose any progress "
"since the last save."
msgstr ""
"确定​要​载入​此​存档​吗​？​上次​自动​保存​后​的​所有​进度​将​丢失​。\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 zai3ru4 ci3 cun2dang4 ma5？shang4ci4 zi4dong4 bao3cun2 hou4 de5 suo3you3 jin4du4 jiang1 diu1shi1。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to overwrite this save?"
msgstr ""
"确定​要​覆盖​此​存档​吗​？\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 fu4gai4 ci3 cun2dang4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to permenantly delete the selected save? This action "
"cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"确定​要​永久​删除​此​存档​吗​？​此​操作​无法​恢复​。\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 yong3jiu3 shan1chu2 ci3 cun2dang4 ma5？ci3 cao1zuo4 wu2fa3 hui1fu4。"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove the selected Content Pack? This action "
"cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"确定​要​永久​移除​此​内容​包​吗​？​此​操作​无法​恢复​。\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 yong3jiu3 yi2chu2 ci3 nei4rong2 bao1 ma5？ci3 cao1zuo4 wu2fa3 hui1fu4。"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to restart this level? You will lose any unsaved "
"progress."
msgstr ""
"确定​要​重新​开始​关卡​吗​？​未​保存​的​进度​将​丢失​。\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 chong2xin1 kai1shi3 guan1qia3 ma5？wei4 bao3cun2 de5 jin4du4 jiang1 diu1shi1。"

msgid ""
"Are you sure you would like to rewind this save game to the selected "
"checkpoint? Any checkpoints after this selected checkpoint will be lost. "
"Creating a copy of this save game is suggested. This action cannot be "
"undone."
msgstr ""
"确定​要​将​此​存档​回退​至此​检查点​吗​？​此​检查点​后​的​所有​检查点​将​丢失​。​建议​先​为此​存档​创建​副本​。​此​操作​无法​撤销​。\n"
"que4ding4 yao4 jiang1 ci3 cun2dang4 hui2tui4 zhi4ci3 jian3 cha2 dian3 ma5？ci3 jian3 cha2 dian3 hou4 de5 suo3you3 jian3 cha2 dian3 jiang1 diu1shi1。jian4yi4 xian1 wei4ci3 cun2dang4 chuang4jian4 fu4ben3。ci3 cao1zuo4 wu2fa3 che4xiao1。"

msgid "Are you sure you're all right?"
msgstr ""
"你​确定​你​没​问题​吗​？\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ni3 mei2 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Are you sure? I'm willing to go with you. Hell, I *want* to go with you."
msgstr ""
"你​确定​吗​？​我​愿意​跟​你​一起​去​。​真的​，​我​*​想​*​跟​你​一起​去​。\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ma5？wo3 yuan4yi4 gen1 ni3 yi1qi3 qu4。zhen1de5，wo3*xiang3*gen1 ni3 yi1qi3 qu4。"

msgid "Are you telling this story, or am I?"
msgstr ""
"到底​是​你​讲​还是​我​讲​？\n"
"dao4di3 shi4 ni3 jiang3 hai2shi5 wo3 jiang3？"

msgid "Are you threatening me?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​威胁​我​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 wei1xie2 wo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Are you trying to tell us that you regret killing that girl? Because I'm not"
" buying it."
msgstr ""
"你​的​意思​是​说​，​你​后悔​杀​了​那​姑娘​？​我​不信​。\n"
"ni3 de5 yi4si5 shi4 shuo1，ni3 hou4hui3 sha1 le5 na4 gu1niang5？wo3 bu4 xin4。"

msgid "Are you... inside that thing?"
msgstr ""
"你​……​在​那​东西​里面​？\n"
"ni3……zai4 na4 dong1xi1 li3mian4？"

msgid "Are you? It sounds like you're nice and cozy in there."
msgstr ""
"你​呢​？​感觉​你​好像​在​这待​着​很​舒服​啊​。\n"
"ni3 ni2？gan3jue2 ni3 hao3xiang4 zai4 zhe4 dai1 zhao2 hen3 shu1fu5 a1。"

msgid "Aren't there child labor laws around here?"
msgstr ""
"这里​难道​没有​童工​法​吗​？\n"
"zhe4li3 nan2dao4 mei2you3 tong2gong1 fa3 ma5？"

msgid "Aren't you a bit young to be a spy?"
msgstr ""
"你​年纪轻轻​就​做起​间谍​的​工作​了​？\n"
"ni3 nian2 ji4 qing1 qing1 jiu4 zuo4 qi3 jian4die2 de5 gong1zuo4 le5？"

msgid "Aren’t you being a little dramatic?"
msgstr ""
"这话​有点​太​夸张​了​吧​？\n"
"zhe4 hua4 you3dian3 tai4 kua1zhang1 le5 ba1？"

