msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​掠​食者​（​智能​枪版​）\n"
"a1rui4si1 lu:e4 shi2 zhe3 （zhi4neng2 qiang1ban3）"

msgid "Ares' basic dermal armor plating implants. Adds +1 Armor."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​的​标准级​真皮​镀层​。​+​1​护甲​。\n"
"a1rui4si1 de5 biao1 zhun3 ji2 zhen1pi2 du4ceng2。+1 hu4jia3。"

msgid ""
"Ares' top-of-the-line assault rifle. Its bullpup design allows for the "
"accuracy of a long barrel in a small, lightweight package."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​生产​的​顶级​突击​步枪​。​其无托​设计​兼顾​了​长​枪管​的​高精度​与​整枪​的​紧凑​轻便​。\n"
"a1rui4si1 sheng1chan3 de5 ding3ji2 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1。qi2 wu2 tuo1 she4ji4 jian1gu4 le5 zhang3 qiang1guan3 de5 gao1jing1du4 yu4 zheng3 qiang1 de5 jin3cou4 qing1bian4。"

msgid ""
"Ares' top-of-the-line concussion grenade. Does -3 AP to everyone hit by its "
"blast."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​的​顶级​震撼​弹​。​爆炸​波及​的​所有​目标​将​承受​-​3​点​行动​点​损失​。\n"
"a1rui4si1 de5 ding3ji2 zhen4han4 dan4。bao4zha4 bo1ji2 de5 suo3you3 mu4biao1 jiang1 cheng2shou4 -3 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3 sun3shi1。"

msgid ""
"Ares' unique hi-tech dermal armor plating implants. Adds +2 Armor and +1 "
"Body."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​特制​的​高科技​真皮​镀层​。​+​2​护甲​，​+​1​体质​。\n"
"a1rui4si1 te4zhi4 de5 gao1ke1ji4 zhen1pi2 du4ceng2。+2 hu4jia3，+1 ti3zhi4。"

msgid "Arm"
msgstr ""
"手臂\n"
"shou3bi4"

