msgid "Armory Door Code"
msgstr ""
"军械库​门​密码\n"
"jun1 xie4 ku4 men2 mi4ma3"

msgid "Armory door opened."
msgstr ""
"军械库​的​门​打开​了​。\n"
"jun1 xie4 ku4 de5 men2 da3kai1 le5。"

msgid "Arooo."
msgstr ""
"嗷​呜​。\n"
"ao2 wu1。"

msgid ""
"Around and around they go, twirling and writhing across the laboratory floor. There is an enormous smile on Philip's face.\n"
"\n"
"Then the lights go dim, and an alarm begins to sound."
msgstr ""
"他们​在​实验室​的​地板​上​旋转​着​、​扭动​着​，​绕​了​一圈​又​一圈​。​菲利普​脸上​带​着​灿烂​的​笑容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​灯光​逐渐​变暗​，​刺耳​的​警报声​开始​响起​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 shi2yan4shi4 de5 di4ban3 shang4 xuan2zhuan3 zhao2、niu3 dong4 zhao2，rao4 le5 yi1 juan1 you4 yi1 juan1。fei1li4pu3 lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 deng1guang1 zhu2jian4 bian4an4，ci4er3 de5 jing3 bao4 sheng1 kai1shi3 xiang3qi3。"

msgid ""
"As Dietrich holds Monika's thrashing body, you grab her head in both hands "
"and hold it steady. Glory wraps a cybernetically enhanced hand around the "
"cord leading to Monika's datajack and pries it free."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希箍着​莫妮卡​不停​抽搐​的​身体​，​而​你​用​双手​按住​她​的​头​，​好​让​它​牢牢​固定​住​。​格洛丽​伸出​机械手​，​握住​莫妮卡​数据​插口​上​的​线​，​然后​把​它​撬​了​下来​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 gu1 zhao2 Mo4ni1ka3 bu4ting2 chou1chu4 de5 shen1ti3，er2 ni3 yong4 shuang1shou3 an4 zhu4 ta1 de5 tou2，hao3 rang4 ta1 lao2lao2 gu4ding4 zhu4。Ge2luo4li2 shen1chu1 ji1 xie4 shou3，wo4zhu4 Mo4ni1ka3 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 shang4 de5 xian4，ran2hou4 ba3 ta1 qiao4 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"As Glory speaks, you continue to focus, sifting through the void left by her"
" vintage chrome to find the tatters of her original essence. Finally, you "
"catch a glimpse of color, a flash of her true self... and behind it, "
"something else."
msgstr ""
"趁着​格洛丽​说话​的​工夫​，​你​继续​保持​专注​，​穿透​她​的​古旧​铬层​留下​的​虚空​，​寻找​她​原始​精华​的​残片​。​终于​，​你​瞥见​一抹​色彩​，​她​真实​本​我​的​闪现​……​而​在​那​之后​，​另有​异象​。\n"
"chen4 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 shuo1hua4 de5 gong1fu1，ni3 ji4xu4 bao3chi2 zhuan1zhu4，chuan1tou4 ta1 de5 gu3jiu4 ge4 ceng2 liu2xia4 de5 xu1kong1，xun2zhao3 ta1 yuan2shi3 jing1hua2 de5 can2 pian1。zhong1yu2，ni3 pie1jian4 yi1 ma1 se4cai3，ta1 zhen1shi2 ben3 wo3 de5 shan3xian4……er2 zai4 na4 zhi1hou4，ling4you3 yi4xiang4。"

msgid ""
"As Hasenkamp steps out past the security grate, it slams shut and latches."
msgstr ""
"当哈森​坎普​踏过​安检​栅门​时​，​它​突然​猛地​一下​锁住​了​。\n"
"dang1 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 ta1 guo4 an1jian3 zha4men2 shi2，ta1 tu1ran2 meng3de5 yi1xia4 suo3 zhu4 le5。"

msgid "As I said, I did not trust the man."
msgstr ""
"我​说​过​，​我​不​信任​这个​人​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 guo4，wo3 bu4 xin4ren4 zhe4ge5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"As I said, the work of a master craftsman! A weapon made by any other would "
"simply break after being fired!"
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​，​这是​大师​工匠​的​杰作​！​其他人​制作​的​武器​开火​之后​就​直接​断​了​！\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，zhe4 shi4 da4shi1 gong1jiang4 de5 jie2zuo4！qi2 ta1 ren2 zhi4zuo4 de5 wu3qi4 kai1huo3 zhi1hou4 jiu4 zhi2jie1 duan4 le5！"

msgid ""
"As I said. These items are not for everybody.\n"
"\n"
"Was there something else that interested you?"
msgstr ""
"正如​我​所说​，​这​东西​并非​适合​所有人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​别的​想要​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，zhe4 dong1xi1 bing4fei1 shi4he2 suo3you3ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 xiang3yao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"As I told you, take the stairs up to the third floor. You'll find an abandoned apartment at the end of the hall. \n"
"\n"
"Look for the stylized \"M\" painted on the wall. It looks like two crude lightning bolts facing one another... that's Trithemius' personal sigil."
msgstr ""
"如​我​之前​所说​，​走​楼梯​去​三楼​，​走廊​尽头​有​一间​废弃​的​公寓​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​墙上​寻找​一个​涂绘​的​“​M​”​形​标志​，​看起来​像是​两道​闪电​彼此​对峙​……​那​就是​特​里特​米​乌斯​的​个人​徽记​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2 wo3 zhi1qian2 suo3 shuo1，zou3 lou2ti1 qu4 san1 lou2，zou3lang2 jin4tou2 you3 yi1 jian1 fei4qi4 de5 gong1yu4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 qiang2 shang4 xun2zhao3 yi1ge5 tu2 hui4 de5“M” xing2 biao1zhi4，kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 liang3 dao4 shan3dian4 bi3ci3 dui4zhi4……na4 jiu4shi4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 ge4ren2 hui1ji4。"

msgid ""
"As I was crawling away, my father told me that if he or any of his Kreuzritter brothers ever saw me again, they'd treat me \"as the Berlin chapter treats the enemies of God.\" \n"
"\n"
"If you're not familiar with how the Kreuzritters here in Berlin deal with heretics, it's decidedly less pretty than what my dad and his buddies did to their victims. I got the hint, and the next morning, I hitched a ride out of Stuttgart."
msgstr ""
"当​我​艰难​向外​爬​的​时候​，​父亲​告诉​我​，​如果​他​或​他​的​十字军​兄弟​再​见到​我​，​就​会​像​“​柏林​分会​对待​上帝​的​敌人​那样​”​对待​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不​清楚​柏林​的​十字军​如何​处置​异端​，​我​只能​说​那些​手段​可比​我​父亲​和​他​的​兄弟​们​对付​受害者​时要​残酷​得​多​。​我​听懂​了​他​的话​，​次日​清晨​便​搭便车​离开​了​斯图加特​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 jian1nan2 xiang4wai4 pa2 de5 shi2hou5，fu4qin1 gao4su4 wo3，ru2guo3 ta1 huo4 ta1 de5 shi2zi4jun1 xiong1di4 zai4 jian4dao4 wo3，jiu4 hui4 xiang4“bo2lin2 fen1hui4 dui4dai4 shang4di4 de5 di2ren2 na4yang4” dui4dai4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 qing1chu5 bo2lin2 de5 shi2zi4jun1 ru2he2 chu3zhi4 yi4duan1，wo3 zhi3neng2 shuo1 na4xie1 shou3duan4 ke3bi3 wo3 fu4qin1 he4 ta1 de5 xiong1di4 men5 dui4fu5 shou4hai4zhe3 shi2 yao4 can2ku4 de2 duo1。wo3 ting1dong3 le5 ta1 de5hua4，ci4ri4 qing1chen2 bian4 da1bian4che1 li2kai1 le5 si1tu2jia1te4。"

msgid ""
"As I watched her flesh blacken and melt, as I heard her scream and I broke into hysterics, I heard the Adversary laugh.\n"
"\n"
"And at that moment, I realized that it was laughing at me."
msgstr ""
"当​我​目睹​她​的​血肉​焦黑​融化​，​当​我​听见​她​的​尖叫​而​自己​发出​歇斯底里​的​痛哭​时​，​我​听见​了​魔鬼​的​笑声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​在​那一刻​，​我​意识​到​那​笑声​是​在​嘲弄​我​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 mu4du3 ta1 de5 xue4rou4 jiao1 hei1 rong2hua4，dang1 wo3 ting1jian4 ta1 de5 jian1jiao4 er2 zi4ji3 fa1chu1 xie1si1di3li3 de5 tong4ku1 shi2，wo3 ting1jian4 le5 mo2gui3 de5 xiao4sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 na4 yi1 ke4，wo3 yi4shi2 dao4 na4 xiao4sheng1 shi4 zai4 chao2nong4 wo3。"

msgid "As a matter of fact, I was."
msgstr ""
"我​确实​要​去​。\n"
"wo3 que4shi2 yao4 qu4。"

msgid ""
"As a proof-of-concept demonstration model, the MKVI was designed for REMOTE OPERATION. A ZEISS \"EYE-IN-THE-SKY\" DRONE CONTROL SYSTEM has been incorporated into the MKVI's cyberskull.\n"
"\n"
"COMMLINK control is also possible for casual control, but for product demonstration purposes, use of the drone control system is advised."
msgstr ""
"作为​概念​验证​演示​模型​，​MKVI​专为​远程​操控​而​设计​。​其赛​博​头骨​内​已​集成​蔡司​“​天眼​”​无人机​控制系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽可​通过​通讯​链​进行​常规​操控​，​但​为​实现​产品​演示​效果​，​建议​使用​无人机​控制系统​。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 gai4nian4 yan4zheng4 yan3shi4 mo2xing2，MKVI zhuan1 wei2 yuan3cheng2 cao1kong4 er2 she4ji4。qi2 sai4 bo2 tou2gu3 nei4 yi3 ji2cheng2 cai4 si1“tian1yan3” wu2ren2ji1 kong4 zhi4 xi4 tong3。\n"
"\n"
"sui1 ke3 tong1guo4 tong1xun4 lian4 jin4xing2 chang2gui1 cao1kong4，dan4 wei2 shi2xian4 chan3pin3 yan3shi4 xiao4guo3，jian4yi4 shi3yong4 wu2ren2ji1 kong4 zhi4 xi4 tong3。"

msgid "As are we all. So, shall we go grab it?"
msgstr ""
"谁​不是​呢​。​那​咱们​就​去​拿​吧​？\n"
"shei2 bu4shi4 ni2。na4 zan2men5 jiu4 qu4 na2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"As did I. But even if $(l.he) has some other endgame in mind, it's too late for $(l.him) to do anything about it now.\n"
"\n"
"Please watch over our guest, if you will. See to it that $(l.he)'s well treated, but do not allow $(l.him) to leave that room until I return.\n"
"\n"
"I will begin the Panacea infusion process."
msgstr ""
"我​之前​也​是​。​但​就算​$(l.he)​另有​什么​打算​，​到​现在​这个​时候​也​无能为力​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​你​代为​照顾​我们​的​客人​。​好生​对待​$(l.he)​，​但​不要​让​$(l.he)​离开​房间​，​直到​我​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​正式​开始​“​万能​药​”​的​注入​流程​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 ye3 shi4。dan4 jiu4suan4 $(l.he) ling4you3 shen2me5 da3suan4，dao4 xian4zai4 zhe4ge5 shi2hou5 ye3 wu2neng2wei2li4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ni3 dai4wei2 zhao4gu5 wo3men5 de5 ke4ren2。hao3sheng1 dui4dai4 $(l.he)，dan4 bu4yao4 rang4 $(l.he) li2kai1 fang2jian1，zhi2dao4 wo3 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 zheng4shi4 kai1shi3“wan4neng2 yao4” de5 zhu4ru4 liu2cheng2。"

msgid ""
"As for my part... $(l.name) saved our lives back there. You may not believe it, but $(l.he) did. \n"
"\n"
"The way I see it, that means I follow $(l.hisher) lead a while longer."
msgstr ""
"要​我​说​……​$(l.name)​在​那时​救​了​我们​。​你​可能​不​信​，​但​$(l.he)​确实​做到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​我​个人​而言​，​我​愿意​再​跟​$(l.he)​一段时间​。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 wo3 shuo1……$(l.name) zai4 na4shi2 jiu4 le5 wo3men5。ni3 ke3neng2 bu4 xin4，dan4 $(l.he) que4shi2 zuo4dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 wo3 ge4ren2 er2yan2，wo3 yuan4yi4 zai4 gen1 $(l.he) yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"As good a cause as any, I suppose.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Drink away, then."
msgstr ""
"这​理由​没什么​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​举杯​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 li3you2 mei2shen2me5 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 ju3bei1 ba1。"

msgid "As good a time as any. What’s up?"
msgstr ""
"我​随时​都​有空​。​怎么​了​？\n"
"wo3 sui2shi2 dou1 you3kong4。zen3me5 le5？"

msgid ""
"As he mouths the words, you can see the hope on his face flicker and die.\n"
"\n"
"If anything, he looks even more miserable than he did before."
msgstr ""
"随着​他​慢慢​念完​这​条​消息​，​你​看到​他​脸上​的​希望​在​一点点​消退​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​看起来​比​之前​更加​苦涩​了​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ta1 man4man4 nian4 wan2 zhe4 tiao2 xiao1xi5，ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 xi1wang4 zai4 yi1dian3dian3 xiao1tui4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 bi3 zhi1qian2 geng4jia1 ku3se4 le5。"

msgid ""
"As if in turn, Dante lowers his head sadly, lets out a heavy sigh, and "
"closes his eyes. "
msgstr ""
"仿佛​知道​轮到​了​自己​，​但丁​悲伤地​低下头​，​重重​叹​了​口气​，​然后​闭上​双眼​。\n"
"fang3fu2 zhi1dao4 lun2dao4 le5 zi4ji3，dan4ding1 bei1 shang1 de5 di1 xia4 tou2，chong2chong2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，ran2hou4 bi4shang5 shuang1yan3。"

msgid ""
"As if on cue, an ominous creaking sound reverberates throughout the halls of Feuerstelle, followed by the groan of buckling support struts from above.\n"
"\n"
"Other, stranger noises can be heard further in the distance: panicked screams and faint cries for help, intermingled with the bellowing roars of escaped spirits."
msgstr ""
"就​在​此时​，​一阵​不祥​的​吱呀​声​回荡​在​“​火坑​”​的​走廊​里​，​紧接着​从​头顶​传来​支撑​梁​倒塌​的​呻吟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​更远​的​地方​传来​其他​更​诡异​的​声响​：​惊恐​的​尖叫​与​微弱​的​求救​声​，​混杂着​逃逸​精魂​的​咆哮​怒吼​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 ci3shi2，yi1zhen4 bu4xiang2 de5 zhi1ya1 sheng1 hui2dang4 zai4“huo3keng1” de5 zou3lang2 li3，jin3jie1zhe5 cong2 tou2ding3 chuan2lai2 zhi1cheng1 liang2 dao3ta1 de5 shen1yin2。\n"
"\n"
"geng1 yuan3 de5 di4fang1 chuan2lai2 qi2ta1 geng1 gui3yi4 de5 sheng1xiang3：jing1kong3 de5 jian1jiao4 yu4 wei1ruo4 de5 qiu2jiu4 sheng1，hun4 za2 zhao2 tao2yi4 jing1hun2 de5 pao2xiao4 nu4hou3。"

msgid ""
"As it happens, I can supply some of that help in the form of cutting-edge biotech. Very helpful stuff for a runner in a bind.\n"
"\n"
"But before I can do that, you'll need to do this job for me."
msgstr ""
"我​刚好​可以​通过​尖端​生物科技​的​形式​提供​一些​帮助​。​这​对​陷入困境​的​狂奔​者​很​有​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​在此之前​，​你​得​先​帮​我​完成​这趟​差事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gang1hao3 ke3yi3 tong1guo4 jian1duan1 sheng1wu4ke1ji4 de5 xing2shi4 ti2gong1 yi1xie1 bang1zhu4。zhe4 dui4 xian4 ru4 kun4 jing4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 hen3 you3 bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zai4ci3zhi1qian2，ni3 de2 xian1 bang1 wo3 wan2cheng2 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4。"

msgid "As it happens, we could use a decker, yes."
msgstr ""
"巧​了​，​我们​还​真的​需要​一个​碟客​。\n"
"qiao3 le5，wo3men5 hai2 zhen1de5 xu1yao4 yi1ge5 die2 ke4。"

msgid ""
"As long as he knows what he's doing, that's good enough for me. Anything "
"beyond that is none of my business anyway."
msgstr ""
"只要​他​的​专业​水平​过关​，​对​我​来说​就够​了​。​至于​其他​的​事​，​反正​也​与我无关​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 ta1 de5 zhuan1ye4 shui3ping2 guo4guan1，dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 jiu4 gou4 le5。zhi4yu2 qi2ta1 de5 shi4，fan3zheng4 ye3 yu4 wo3 wu2 guan1。"

msgid "As long as it doesn't get in the way of what I have to do."
msgstr ""
"只要​不​耽误​我要​做​的​正事​就行​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 bu4 dan1wu5 wo3 yao4 zuo4 de5 zheng4shi4 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid "As long as she follows orders, she can think what she wants."
msgstr ""
"只要​她​能​服从命令​，​她​爱​怎么​想​怎么​想​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 ta1 neng2 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3，ta1 ai4 zen3me5 xiang3 zen3me5 xiang3。"

msgid ""
"As long as they can get me in the front door, I can take care of the rest."
msgstr ""
"只要​他们​能​让​我​从前​门​进去​，​剩下​的​交给​我来​搞定​就行了​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 ta1men5 neng2 rang4 wo3 cong2qian2 men2 jin4qu4，sheng4xia4 de5 jiao1gei3 wo3 lai2 gao3ding4 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid "As long as those concerns remain between you and me, we'll be fine."
msgstr ""
"只要​别​和​其他人​讲​就​行​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 bie4 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 jiang3 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid ""
"As luck would have it, there are a variety of individuals within the Kreuzbasar who can help you with that. Some are even reputable.\n"
"\n"
"What are you looking for?"
msgstr ""
"你​很​走运​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​里​有​各种​人​可以​帮​你​解决​这个​问题​，​其中​不乏​信誉​良好​的​商人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​需要​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hen3 zou3yun4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 li3 you3 ge4zhong3 ren2 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 jie3jue2 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2，qi2zhong1 bu4fa2 xin4yu4 liang2hao3 de5 shang1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"As luck would have it, there is an excellent soykaf shop just outside. If you are willing to splash out, the proprietor, Mr. Altuğ Burakgazi, has genuine coffee from his native Turkey. \n"
"\n"
"Such luxuries are rare, even in Berlin. It's well worth the cost if you can afford it."
msgstr ""
"说来​也​巧​，​门外​就​有​一家​上​好​的​豆​咖店​。​如果​你​舍得​破费​，​店主​奥图​伊​·​布拉加​齐​先生​还​提供​来自​他​故乡​土耳其​的​正宗​咖啡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​即便​在​柏林​，​如此​奢侈​享受​也​实属​罕见​。​只要​你​出得​起价​，​绝对​可说是​物超所值​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 lai2 ye3 qiao3，men2wai4 jiu4 you3 yi1jia1 shang4 hao3 de5 dou4 ka1 dian4。ru2guo3 ni3 she3de5 po4fei4，dian4zhu3 ao4 tu2 yi1 · bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 xian1sheng5 hai2 ti2gong1 lai2zi4 ta1 gu4xiang1 tu3er3qi2 de5 zheng4zong1 ka1fei1。\n"
"\n"
"ji2bian4 zai4 bo2lin2，ru2ci3 she1chi3 xiang3shou4 ye3 shi2shu3 han3jian4。zhi3yao4 ni3 chu1 de2 qi3jia4，jue2dui4 ke3 shuo1 shi4 wu4chao1suo3zhi2。"

msgid "As many as I could."
msgstr ""
"我​尽力​去​救人​了​。\n"
"wo3 jin4li4 qu4 jiu4 ren2 le5。"

msgid ""
"As much as I loved Marta, and as much as I thought she loved me, we forgot "
"all about one another when Harrow was around. All that we wanted was to be "
"close to him, to be a part of his inner circle. And soon enough, we were."
msgstr ""
"尽管​我​深爱着​玛​尔塔​，​也​认为​她​同样​深爱着​我​，​但​每当​哈罗​出现​时​，​我们​便会​完全​忘记​彼此​。​我们​唯一​渴望​的​就是​靠近​他​，​成为​他​核心​圈子​中​的​一员​。​而​很快​，​我们​便​如愿以偿​。\n"
"jin3guan3 wo3 shen1 ai4 zhao2 Ma3er3ta3，ye3 ren4wei2 ta1 tong2yang4 shen1 ai4 zhao2 wo3，dan4 mei3dang1 ha1luo2 chu1xian4 shi2，wo3men5 bian4 hui4 wan2quan2 wang4ji4 bi3ci3。wo3men5 wei2yi1 ke3wang4 de5 jiu4shi4 kao4jin4 ta1，cheng2wei2 ta1 he2xin1 quan1zi5 zhong4 de5 yi1yuan2。er2 hen3 kuai4，wo3men5 bian4 ru2yuan4yi3chang2。"

msgid ""
"As much fun as it is listening to you squirm, I'm gonna stop you right "
"there. You've got some explaining to do."
msgstr ""
"虽然​听​你​这么​恭维​我​挺​有意思​的​，​但​我​还是​得​打断​你​。​有件事​需要​你​解释一下​。\n"
"sui1ran2 ting1 ni3 zhe4me5 gong1wei5 wo3 ting3 you3yi4si5 de5，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 de2 da3duan4 ni3。you3 jian4 shi4 xu1yao4 ni3 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4。"

msgid ""
"As of the writing of this article, no official statements from Tir "
"Tairngire's Council of Princes or the Tuatha Dé Danaan of Tír na nÓg have "
"been released."
msgstr ""
"截至​本文​撰写​之​时​，​提尔坦盖​的​王子​议会​及​提尔纳诺​的​达南​神族​尚未​发布​任何​官方​声明​。\n"
"jie2zhi4 ben3wen2 zhuan4xie3 zhi1 shi2，ti2 er3 tan3 gai4 de5 wang2zi3 yi4hui4 ji2 ti2 er3 na4 nuo4 de5 da2 nan2 shen2 zu2 shang4wei4 fa1bu4 ren4he2 guan1fang1 sheng1ming2。"

msgid ""
"As per our agreement, there will be no monetary compensation for this run. But if you'll give me a moment, I will add the samples that you've recovered to my inventory.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks over the samples that you've brought him, and eagerly begins punching their serial numbers into his PDA.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I think that you'll be pleasantly surprised."
msgstr ""
"按照​我们​的​约定​，​这趟​差事​不会​有​任何​金钱​补偿​。​但​如果​你​能​给​我​一点​时间​，​我会​把​你​找到​的​样本​加入​我​的​库存​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​看着​你​带给​他​的​样本​，​开始​把​它们​的​序列号​噼里啪啦​地​输入​他​的​PDA​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​给你个​惊喜​的​。\n"
"\n"
"an4zhao4 wo3men5 de5 yue1ding4，zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 bu4hui4 you3 ren4he2 jin1qian2 bu3chang2。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 gei3 wo3 yi1dian3 shi2jian1，wo3 hui4 ba3 ni3 zhao3dao4 de5 yang4ben3 jia1ru4 wo3 de5 ku4cun2 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 zhao2 ni3 dai4gei3 ta1 de5 yang4ben3，kai1shi3 ba3 ta1men5 de5 xu4lie4hao4 pi1li5pa1la1 de5 shu1ru4 ta1 de5 PDA。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 gei3 ni3 ge4 jing1xi3 de5。"

msgid ""
"As per your instructions, we're gonna try to take $(l.him) out on $(l.hisher) way back. $+(l.he)'ll be more vulnerable that way.\n"
"\n"
"Hopefully injured and low on ammo, too, but only time will tell."
msgstr ""
"按照​你​的​指示​，​我们​打算​在​$(l.he)​回来​的​路上​动手​，​趁​$+(l.he)​更加​脆弱​的​时候​干掉​$(l.he)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​希望​他​到时候​会​身负重伤​，​弹药​短缺​，​但​目前​还​不好​说​。\n"
"\n"
"an4zhao4 ni3 de5 zhi3shi4，wo3men5 da3suan4 zai4 $(l.he) hui2lai5 de5 lu4shang5 dong4shou3，chen4 $+(l.he) geng4jia1 cui4ruo4 de5 shi2hou5 gan4diao4 $(l.he)。\n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 ta1 dao4shi2hou4 hui4 shen1fu4zhong4shang1，dan4yao4 duan3que1，dan4 mu4qian2 hai2 bu4hao3 shuo1。"

msgid "As promised, all yours."
msgstr ""
"按照​说好​的​，​都​给​你​了​。\n"
"an4zhao4 shuo1hao3 de5，dou1 gei3 ni3 le5。"

msgid "As quickly as it appeared, her energy drains away."
msgstr ""
"她​的​这股​能量​来得快​，​去​得​也​快​。\n"
"ta1 de5 zhe4 gu3 neng2liang4 lai2 de2 kuai4，qu4 de2 ye3 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"As she smiles up at you, her eyes fixed on yours, a curious feeling of weightlessness fills your chest. It feels as though you're floating in a warm, calm sea.\n"
"\n"
"A gentle current pulls you closer to Absinthe, and the sensation is pleasant. As you drift, the golden specks in her eyes begin to move."
msgstr ""
"当​她​抬头​对​你​微笑​，​目光​锁定​你​的​瞬间​，​一种​奇妙​的​失重​感​充盈​在​你​的​胸膛​，​仿佛​漂浮​在​温暖​平静​的​海洋​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​温柔​的​潮汐​将​你​推向​苦艾​酒​，​这般​感受​令人​愉悦​。​当​你​随波逐流​时​，​她​眼中​的​金色​斑点​也​开始​流动​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 tai2tou2 dui4 ni3 wei1xiao4，mu4guang1 suo3ding4 ni3 de5 shun4jian1，yi1zhong3 qi2miao4 de5 shi1zhong4 gan3 chong1ying2 zai4 ni3 de5 xiong1tang2，fang3fu2 piao1fu2 zai4 wen1nuan3 ping2jing4 de5 hai3yang2 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"wen1rou2 de5 chao2xi1 jiang1 ni3 tui1 xiang4 ku3ai4 jiu3，zhe4ban1 gan3shou4 ling4ren2 yu2yue4。dang1 ni3 sui2bo1zhu2liu2 shi2，ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 jin1se4 ban1dian3 ye3 kai1shi3 liu2dong4。"

msgid ""
"As soon as that idiot made his little joke, it was a foregone conclusion that I was getting saddled with the nickname \"Eiger.\"\n"
"\n"
"My only choice in the matter was whether it happened under his terms, or under mine."
msgstr ""
"在​那个​蠢货​讲出​他​的​弱智​玩笑​之后​，​我​就​注定​要​背上​“​艾格尔​”​这个​绰号​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当时​唯一​能​做​的​，​就是​让​它​充满​我​自己​的​风格​，​而​不是​被​他​牵着鼻子​走​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4ge5 chun3huo4 jiang3 chu1 ta1 de5 ruo4zhi4 wan2xiao4 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiu4 zhu4ding4 yao4 bei1 shang4“Ai4ge2er3” zhe4ge5 chuo4hao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 wei2yi1 neng2 zuo4 de5，jiu4shi4 rang4 ta1 chong1man3 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 feng1ge2，er2 bu4shi4 bei4 ta1 qian1 zhao2 bi2 zi3 zou3。"

msgid ""
"As soon as that's been done, I'm gonna have to rewrite my control sequences. This is gonna take a few minutes, so you'll need to sit tight while I take care of it.\n"
"\n"
"Bear with me, ace. We're almost done."
msgstr ""
"完成​之后​，​我​将​需要​重写​我​的​控制​序列​。​这​将​需要​几分钟​时间​，​所以​在​我​处理​这个​过程​时​，​你​需要​稍作​等待​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​坚持​一下​，​王牌​。​我​马上​就​说完​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wan2cheng2 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiang1 xu1yao4 chong2 xie3 wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 xu4lie4。zhe4 jiang1 xu1yao4 ji1 fen4 zhong1 shi2jian1，suo3yi3 zai4 wo3 chu3li3 zhe4ge5 guo4cheng2 shi2，ni3 xu1yao4 shao1 zuo4 deng3dai4。\n"
"\n"
"jian1chi2 yi1xia4，wang2pai2。wo3 ma3shang4 jiu4 shuo1 wan2 le5。"

msgid ""
"As soon as you're finished resupplying, I'd recommend heading directly to "
"the Jewühl District."
msgstr ""
"等​你​补给​完毕​后​，​我​建议​你​直接​去​耶沃​于尔区​。\n"
"deng3 ni3 bu3ji3 wan2bi4 hou4，wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 zhi2jie1 qu4 ye1 wo4 yu2 er3 qu1。"

msgid ""
"As soon as you've finished with the safe, the nearby vidphone begins to "
"ring."
msgstr ""
"你​一​打开​保险箱​，​旁边​的​可视电话​就​马上​响​了​起来​。\n"
"ni3 yi1 da3kai1 bao3xian3xiang1，pang2bian1 de5 ke3shi4dian4hua4 jiu4 ma3shang4 xiang3 le5 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"As the U-Bahn hums toward the Frankfurter Tor, you tug idly at the fabric of your maintenance uniform. You found it in a duffel bag on your seat when you boarded, along with a note from Duerr to put it on before your arrival.\n"
"\n"
"\"The moment you step off this train,\" the note said, \"your trial run begins. You are to rendezvous with the rest of your team, reconnoiter the building, and plant the specified devices in Aleshire's suite. Beyond that, your approach will be left to you.\n"
"\n"
"\"Do not disappoint us. You are being watched.\""
msgstr ""
"当地​铁​嗡嗡地​驶向​法兰克福​门时​，​你​漫不经心​地​摩挲​着​维修工​制服​的​布料​。​你​上车时​在​座位​上​的​帆布包​里​发现​了​这套​制服​，​还有​一条​杜尔​留下​的​纸条​，​要求​你​在​抵达​前​穿​上​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​纸条​上​写道​：​“​踏出​列车​的​那​一刻起​，​你​的​试用​差事​即刻​开始​。​你​需要​与​其余​队员​会合​，​侦察​目标​建筑​，​并​将​指定​装置​安放​在​阿利​希尔​的​套房​。​其余​行动​全权​交由​你​自行​处置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​别​让​我们​失望​。​我们​在​看着​你​。​”\n"
"\n"
"dang1di4 tie3 weng1 weng1 de5 shi3xiang4 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2 shi2，ni3 man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 ma1sa5 zhao2 wei2 xiu1 gong1 zhi4fu2 de5 bu4liao4。ni3 shang4 che1 shi2 zai4 zuo4wei4 shang4 de5 fan1 bu4 bao1 li3 fa1xian4 le5 zhe4 tao4 zhi4fu2，hai2you3 yi1 tiao2 du4 er3 liu2xia4 de5 zhi3tiao2，yao1qiu2 ni3 zai4 di3da2 qian2 chuan1 shang4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3tiao2 shang4 xie3dao4：“ta1 chu1 lie4che1 de5 na4 yi1 ke4 qi3，ni3 de5 shi4yong4 cha4shi4 ji2ke4 kai1shi3。ni3 xu1yao4 yu4 qi2yu2 dui4yuan2 hui4he2，zhen1cha2 mu4biao1 jian4zhu4，bing4 jiang1 zhi3ding4 zhuang1zhi4 an1fang4 zai4 e1 li4 xi1er3 de5 tao4fang2。qi2yu2 xing2dong4 quan2quan2 jiao1you2 ni3 zi4xing2 chu3zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"“bie4 rang4 wo3men5 shi1wang4。wo3men5 zai4 kan4 zhao2 ni3。”"

msgid ""
"As the astral plane shimmers into view, you focus on Glory.\n"
"\n"
"You can still see her with your corporeal vision: her delicate frame, the bulky cyberware that breaks her silhouette, the faraway look in her eyes. But laid over the top of her physical body, there is a slight shimmer - her aura, damaged though it may be."
msgstr ""
"当星界​闪烁着​显现​时​，​你​将​目光​聚焦​于格洛丽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​仍​能​用​肉眼​看见​她​：​纤细​的​身躯​，​破坏​她​轮廓​的​笨重​赛博​改造​，​以及​她​眼中​那​抹​遥远​的​神情​。​但​她​的​现实​躯体​之上​，​还​覆盖​着​一层​微弱​的​闪烁​—​—​那​是​她​的​灵光​，​尽管​已然​受损​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 xing1 jie4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 xian3xian4 shi2，ni3 jiang1 mu4guang1 ju4jiao1 yu2 Ge2luo4li2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 reng2 neng2 yong4 rou4yan3 kan4jian4 ta1：xian1xi4 de5 shen1qu1，po4huai4 ta1 lun2kuo4 de5 ben4zhong4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4，yi3ji2 ta1 yan3zhong1 na4 ma1 yao2yuan3 de5 shen2qing2。dan4 ta1 de5 xian4shi2 qu1ti3 zhi1shang4，hai2 fu4gai4 zhao2 yi1ceng2 wei1ruo4 de5 shan3shuo4——na4 shi4 ta1 de5 ling2guang1，jin3guan3 yi3ran2 shou4sun3。"

msgid ""
"As the astral plane shimmers into view, you focus on Glory.\n"
"\n"
"You can still see her with your corporeal vision: her delicate frame, the bulky cyberware that breaks her silhouette, the faraway look in her eyes. But laid over the top of her physical body, there is a slight shimmer: her aura, damaged though it may be."
msgstr ""
"当星界​闪烁着​显现​时​，​你​将​目光​聚焦​于格洛丽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​仍​能​用​肉眼​看见​她​：​纤细​的​身躯​，​破坏​她​轮廓​的​笨重​赛博​改造​，​以及​她​眼中​那​抹​遥远​的​神情​。​但​她​的​现实​躯体​之上​，​还​覆盖​着​一层​微弱​的​闪烁​—​—​那​是​她​的​灵光​，​尽管​已然​受损​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 xing1 jie4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 xian3xian4 shi2，ni3 jiang1 mu4guang1 ju4jiao1 yu2 Ge2luo4li2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 reng2 neng2 yong4 rou4yan3 kan4jian4 ta1：xian1xi4 de5 shen1qu1，po4huai4 ta1 lun2kuo4 de5 ben4zhong4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4，yi3ji2 ta1 yan3zhong1 na4 ma1 yao2yuan3 de5 shen2qing2。dan4 ta1 de5 xian4shi2 qu1ti3 zhi1shang4，hai2 fu4gai4 zhao2 yi1ceng2 wei1ruo4 de5 shan3shuo4——na4 shi4 ta1 de5 ling2guang1，jin3guan3 yi3ran2 shou4sun3。"

msgid ""
"As the briefcase grows larger on the screen, you can hear the whine of motors spinning up in the arcade cabinet's guts. \n"
"\n"
"With a smooth, mechanical motion, a generic-brand optical chip slides out of the payment port in front of you."
msgstr ""
"随着​屏幕​上​的​公文箱​越来越​大​，​你​能​听见​街机​柜台​内部​电机​加速​运转​的​嗡​鸣声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​机械​流畅​的​动作​，​一枚​常见​的​光学​芯片​从​你​面前​的​支付​端口​缓缓​滑​出​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 gong1 wen2 xiang1 yue4lai2yue4 dai4，ni3 neng2 ting1jian4 jie1ji1 gui4tai2 nei4bu4 dian4ji1 jia1su4 yun4zhuan3 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ji1xie4 liu2chang4 de5 dong4zuo4，yi1 mei2 chang2jian4 de5 guang1xue2 xin1pian4 cong2 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 zhi1fu4 duan1kou3 huan3huan3 hua2 chu1。"

msgid ""
"As the leader of this team, *I* say what our priorities are. And I say that "
"dealing with this mercenary pales in comparison with stopping the Firewing."
msgstr ""
"作为​队长​，​事情​的​优先级​应该​由​*​我​*​来​决定​。​而​在我看来​，​与​阻止​火翼​相比​，​对付​这个​雇佣兵​的​事​简直​不值一提​。\n"
"zuo4wei2 dui4zhang3，shi4qing5 de5 you1xian1ji2 ying1gai1 you2*wo3*lai2 jue2ding4。er2 zai4wo3kan4lai2，yu4 zu3zhi3 Huo3yi4 xiang1bi3，dui4fu5 zhe4ge5 gu4yong1bing1 de5 shi4 jian3zhi2 bu4 zhi2 yi1 ti2。"

msgid ""
"As the smoke begins to clear, a cry of jubilation sounds out over the "
"Sutterlin BioScience building's intercom system."
msgstr ""
"随着​烟雾​逐渐​散​去​，​苏​特林​生物科学​大楼​的​广播系统​中​传来​了​欢呼声​。\n"
"sui2zhe5 yan1wu4 zhu2jian4 san3 qu4，su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 da4lou2 de5 yan3 bo1 xi4 tong3 zhong4 chuan2lai2 le5 huan1 hu1 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"As the video feed kicks in, Philip is engaged in an animated discussion with someone who's standing just outside camera range. You can see his shoes and his shadow, but nothing more.\n"
"\n"
"The voice sounds human. You'd guess that the off-camera speaker is a man in his early twenties."
msgstr ""
"录像​开始​播放​，​菲利普​正​与​画面​外​的​某人​进行​着​热烈​的​讨论​。​你​只能​看到​他​的​鞋子​和​影子​，​除此之外​一无所见​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​声音​听​起来​是​个​人类​。​你​猜​镜头​外​的​说话​者​是​个​二十岁​出头​的​年轻​男性​。\n"
"\n"
"lu4xiang4 kai1shi3 bo1fang4，fei1li4pu3 zheng1 yu4 hua4mian4 wai4 de5 mou3ren2 jin4xing2 zhao2 re4lie4 de5 tao3lun4。ni3 zhi3neng2 kan4dao4 ta1 de5 xie2zi5 he4 ying3zi5，chu2ci3zhi1wai4 yi1 wu2 suo3 jian4。\n"
"\n"
"sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 shi4 ge4 ren2lei4。ni3 cai1 jing4tou2 wai4 de5 shuo1hua4 zhe3 shi4 ge4 er4 shi2 sui4 chu1tou2 de5 nian2qing1 nan2xing4。"

msgid ""
"As we discussed, if you recover my stolen property, I will tell you how to find Trithemius.\n"
"\n"
"Otherwise, you could try your luck with Ullrich out front... but I wouldn't recommend it."
msgstr ""
"如​我们​之前​所说​，​如果​你​能​找回​我​的​被盗​物品​，​我​就​会​告诉​你​如何​找到​特​里特​米​乌斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​，​你​可以​试试​和​外面​的​乌尔里​希​谈谈​……​但​我​不​推荐​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2 wo3men5 zhi1qian2 suo3 shuo1，ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zhao3hui2 wo3 de5 bei4 dao4 wu4pin3，wo3 jiu4 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 ru2he2 zhao3dao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1。\n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2，ni3 ke3yi3 shi4 shi4 he4 wai4mian4 de5 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 tan2tan2……dan4 wo3 bu4 tui1jian4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"As we drove out to pick up the new recruits, I was already planning ahead.\n"
"\n"
"It was a foregone conclusion that I would pay my father a visit; the irony of a group of Kreuzritters getting immolated by a genuine servant of the actual Devil tickled me to no end. So when Harrow stopped to fill up on diesel, I hopped out of the van and headed out on foot to my parents' place. "
msgstr ""
"当​我们​开车​去​接入​会​的​新人​时​，​我​已​在​盘算​下​一步​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我拿定​了​主意​要​去​拜访​我​父亲​—​—​想到​一群​十字军​被​真正​的​魔鬼​仆从​烧死​，​这​讽刺​意味​让​我​忍俊不禁​。​所以​当​哈罗​停车​加油​时​，​我​跳​下​货车​，​徒步​走向​父母​家​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3men5 kai1che1 qu4 jie1ru4 hui4 de5 xin1ren2 shi2，wo3 yi3 zai4 pan2suan4 xia4 yi1 bu4 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 na2 ding4 le5 zhu3yi5 yao4 qu4 bai4fang3 wo3 fu4qin1——xiang3dao4 yi1 qun2 shi2zi4jun1 bei4 zhen1zheng4 de5 mo2gui3 pu1 cong2 shao1si3，zhe4 feng3ci4 yi4wei4 rang4 wo3 ren3jun4bu4jin1。suo3yi3 dang1 ha1luo2 ting2che1 jia1you2 shi2，wo3 tiao4 xia4 huo4che1，tu2bu4 zou3xiang4 fu4mu3 jia1。"

msgid ""
"As well you should! Nobody knows more about the treachery of the underworld better than I do! No one has *tasted* the pungent stench of its winding passageways as I have.\n"
"\n"
"It is a nightmare world of slippery walkways and subpar architecture! A Hell of our own devising! A dark, twisting, mouldering pit that stretches into the abyssal realms of--"
msgstr ""
"你​当然​该​如此​！​谁​能比​我​更​清楚​冥界​的​阴险​诡诈​？​谁​比​我​更​曾​亲身​*​嗅过​*​那些​蜿蜒​通道​里​刺鼻​的​恶臭​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​个​噩梦般​的​世界​：​地面​湿滑​难行​，​建筑​粗制滥造​！​是​我们​亲手​打造​的​地狱​！​一个​黑暗​、​蜿蜒​、​腐朽​的​深坑​，​延伸​至​深渊​之境​的​—​—\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dang1ran2 gai1 ru2ci3！shei2 neng2 bi3 wo3 geng1 qing1chu5 ming2jie4 de5 yin1xian3 gui3zha4？shei2 bi3 wo3 geng1 ceng2 qin1shen1*xiu4 guo4*na4xie1 wan1yan2 tong1dao4 li3 ci4bi2 de5 e4chou4？\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 ge4 e4 meng4 ban1 de5 shi4jie4：di4mian4 shi1hua2 nan2xing2，jian4zhu4 cu1zhi4lan4zao4！shi4 wo3men5 qin1shou3 da3zao4 de5 di4yu4！yi1ge5 hei1an4、wan1yan2、fu3xiu3 de5 shen1keng1，yan2shen1 zhi4 shen1yuan1 zhi1 jing4 de5 — —"

msgid ""
"As would I. We saved a lot of lives today.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a beat, then a small smile crosses her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's a good feeling."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​。​我们​今天​拯救​了​许多​生命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一下​，​然后​脸上​露出​一丝​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​感觉​不错​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4。wo3men5 jin1tian1 zheng3jiu4 le5 xu3duo1 sheng1ming4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 yi1 si1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 gan3jue2 bu4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"As you approach the MKVI, its head turns to track you. Its body is held at "
"rigid attention."
msgstr ""
"当​你​接近​MKVI​时​，​它​的​头部​转过​来​注视​你​，​身体​仍然​保持​着​僵直​姿势​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 jie1jin4 MKVI shi2，ta1 de5 tou2bu4 zhuai3 guo4 lai2 zhu4shi4 ni3，shen1ti3 reng2ran2 bao3chi2 zhao2 jiang1zhi2 zi1shi4。"

msgid "As you approach the console, the red warnings blink out."
msgstr ""
"你​靠近​控制台​，​屏幕​上​不再​显示​红色​的​警告​。\n"
"ni3 kao4jin4 kong4zhi4tai2，ping2mu4 shang4 bu4zai4 xian3shi4 hong2se4 de5 jing3gao4。"

msgid ""
"As you approach the counter, you find Absinthe counting a bundle of antique "
"paper money in the till. She doesn't bother looking up."
msgstr ""
"当​你​走近​柜台​时​，​发现​苦艾​酒​正在​收银机​后​清点​一沓​古旧​纸币​。​她​连头​都​没​抬​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 gui4tai2 shi2，fa1xian4 ku3ai4 jiu3 zheng4zai4 shou1yin2ji1 hou4 qing1dian3 yi1 da2 gu3jiu4 zhi3bi4。ta1 lian2 tou2 dou1 mei2 tai2。"

msgid ""
"As you approach the counter, you find Absinthe reading a small, soykaf-"
"stained booklet. The pages are old and weathered."
msgstr ""
"当​你​走近​柜台​时​，​发现​苦艾​酒正​翻阅​一本​沾​着​豆​咖​污渍​的​小册子​。​那些​纸页​早已​陈旧​斑驳​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 gui4tai2 shi2，fa1xian4 ku3ai4 jiu3 zheng1 fan1yue4 yi1 ben3 zhan1 zhao2 dou4 ka1 wu1zi4 de5 xiao3ce4zi5。na4xie1 zhi3 xie2 zao3yi3 chen2jiu4 ban1bo2。"

msgid ""
"As you approach the elf, you notice that he's in mid-conversation. His lips "
"move rapidly, and his voice comes out in a low, quiet tone. The glossy "
"plastic shell of a high-grade commlink glints on his wrist."
msgstr ""
"你​走近​精灵​时​，​发现​他​正在​交谈​。​他​的​嘴唇​快速​蠕动​，​声音​低沉​。​高级​通讯​链​的​光亮​塑料​外壳​在​他​手腕​上​闪烁着​。\n"
"ni3 zou3jin4 jing1ling2 shi2，fa1xian4 ta1 zheng4zai4 jiao1tan2。ta1 de5 zui3chun2 kuai4su4 ru2dong4，sheng1yin1 di1chen2。gao1ji2 tong1xun4 lian4 de5 guang1liang4 su4liao4 wai4ke2 zai4 ta1 shou3wan4 shang4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"As you approach the shrine, a chorus of high, sibilant voices fills the air.\n"
"\n"
"The sound is light and airy, but something about it fills you with a bone-deep dread."
msgstr ""
"当​你​靠近​神龛​时​，​一阵​清亮​的​嘶声​齐齐​回荡​在​空气​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​声音​轻盈​飘渺​，​却​莫名​让​你​感到​彻骨​的​恐惧​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 kao4jin4 shen2kan1 shi2，yi1zhen4 qing1liang4 de5 si1 sheng1 qi2 qi2 hui2dang4 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 sheng1yin1 qing1ying2 piao1miao3，que4 mo4ming2 rang4 ni3 gan3dao4 che4gu3 de5 kong3ju4。"

msgid ""
"As you approach, Eiger turns to face you. Her rifle has been field-stripped and is lying in pieces on a sheet of butcher paper.\n"
"\n"
"Arranged in a neat row along the edge of the paper are bottles of copper solvent, bore cleaner, and lighter fluid."
msgstr ""
"当​你​走近​时​，​艾格尔​转过身​来​面对​你​。​她​的​步枪​已​被​拆解​，​零部件​散落​在​牛皮纸​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​纸张​边缘​整齐​排列​着​几瓶​铜​溶剂​、​枪管​清洁剂​和​打火机​油​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，Ai4ge2er3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 mian4dui4 ni3。ta1 de5 bu4qiang1 yi3 bei4 chai1jie3，ling2bu4jian4 san3luo4 zai4 niu2pi2zhi3 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3zhang1 bian1yuan2 zheng3qi2 pai2lie4 zhao2 ji1 ping2 tong2 rong2ji4、qiang1guan3 qing1jie2ji4 he4 da3huo3ji1 you2。"

msgid ""
"As you approach, a small, grimy monitor at the base of the statue flickers "
"dimly to life. The grainy face of a smug young ork appears onscreen."
msgstr ""
"当​你​走近​时​，​雕像​底座​有​一台​肮脏​的​小​显示器​闪烁着​亮​起​黯淡​的​光​。​模糊不清​的​屏幕​上​浮现​出​一个​得意洋洋​的​年轻​兽​人​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，diao1xiang4 di3zuo4 you3 yi1 tai2 ang1zang1 de5 xiao3 xian3shi4qi4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 liang4 qi3 an4dan4 de5 guang1。mo2hu5bu4qing1 de5 ping2mu4 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1ge5 de2yi4yang2yang2 de5 nian2qing1 shou4 ren2。"

msgid ""
"As you approach, he stops what he's doing, a look of intense irritation on his face.\n"
"\n"
"He clears his throat, and a harsh rasping sound emerges from the loudspeaker next to the glass."
msgstr ""
"当​你​走近​时​，​他​停下​了​手头​的​工作​，​脸上​露出​极度​不耐烦​的​神情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​清了清​嗓子​，​玻璃​旁边​的​扬声器​里​传来​一阵​刺耳​的​沙哑​声​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，ta1 ting2xia4 le5 shou3tou2 de5 gong1zuo4，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 ji2du4 bu4nai4fan2 de5 shen2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 qing1 le5 qing1 sang3zi5，bo1li5 pang2bian1 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 li3 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 ci4er3 de5 sha1ya3 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"As you approach, you can see that the Engineer's chest is sheeted with blood. Most of it seems to be streaming from his nose, which has been crushed into a wad of bloody meat.\n"
"\n"
"Eiger turns to face you. Her bunched fists are dripping red."
msgstr ""
"你​走近​时​，​看到​工程师​的​胸口​浸满​了​鲜血​。​他​的​鼻子​已经​被​压成​了​一团​血肉模糊​的​肉块​，​大部分​鲜血​似乎​就​是从​这里​流​出来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​转过​来​面对​你​。​她​握紧​的​双拳​正​缓缓​滴血​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，kan4dao4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 xiong1kou3 jin4 man3 le5 xian1xue4。ta1 de5 bi2zi5 yi3jing1 bei4 ya1 cheng2 le5 yi1 tuan2 xue4rou4mo2hu5 de5 rou4 kuai4，da4bu4fen5 xian1xue4 si4hu1 jiu4 shi4 cong2 zhe4li3 liu2 chu1lai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 zhuai3 guo4 lai2 mian4dui4 ni3。ta1 wo4 jin3 de5 shuang1 quan2 zheng1 huan3huan3 di1 xie3。"

msgid ""
"As you are about to tap your finger on the key, you feel a hand clasp your "
"shoulder."
msgstr ""
"正当​你​准备​按下​按键​时​，​你​感觉​有​一只​手拉住​了​你​的​肩膀​。\n"
"zheng4dang1 ni3 zhun3bei4 an4xia4 an4jian4 shi2，ni3 gan3jue2 you3 yi1 zhi3 shou3 la1 zhu4 le5 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。"

msgid ""
"As you are resetting the data tap, you notice that someone has duct-taped a "
"small homemade receiver to the system. An earplug dangles from the receiver."
msgstr ""
"你​重置​数据​插口​时​，​发现​有人​用​胶带​将​一个​自制​的​小型​接收器​粘​在​了​系统​上​。​有个​耳塞​从​接收器​上​垂下来​。\n"
"ni3 chong2zhi4 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 shi2，fa1xian4 you3ren2 yong4 jiao1dai4 jiang1 yi1ge5 zi4zhi4 de5 xiao3xing2 jie1shou1qi4 zhan1 zai4 le5 xi4tong3 shang4。you3 ge4 er3sai1 cong2 jie1shou1qi4 shang4 chui2 xia4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"As you desire, O Ample One!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Turk whispers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The man is a moron but he eats his weight in baklava and pastries, so who am I to care?"
msgstr ""
"如你所愿​，​丰腴​之​人​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​土耳其人​对​你​低声​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那家伙​是​个​蠢货​，​但​他​吃​的​果仁​蜜饼​和​糕点​简直​和​他​的​体重​差不多​，​所以​我管​他​干什么​？\n"
"\n"
"ru2 ni3 suo3 yuan4，feng1yu2 zhi1 ren2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu3er3qi2ren2 dui4 ni3 di1sheng1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jia1 huo3 shi4 ge4 chun3huo4，dan4 ta1 chi1 de5 guo3ren2 mi4 bing3 he4 gao1dian3 jian3zhi2 he4 ta1 de5 ti3zhong4 cha4bu5duo1，suo3yi3 wo3 guan3 ta1 gan4shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"As you did to poor Marta?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The air all around him begins to pulse with scintillating bursts of color. His rippling, transparent form glows with heat from within.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That was a terrible thing, Glory. You've brought this upon yourself."
msgstr ""
"就​像​你​对​可怜​的​玛​尔塔​做​的​那样​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​周围​的​空气​开始​涌动​闪烁​的​彩色​光斑​。​他​那​波动​的​透明​身躯​从​内部​散发出​炽热​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​下手​太狠​了​，​格洛丽​。​这​是​你​自找​的​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 ni3 dui4 ke3lian2 de5 Ma3er3ta3 zuo4 de5 na4yang4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou1wei2 de5 kong1qi4 kai1shi3 yong3dong4 shan3shuo4 de5 cai3se4 guang1ban1。ta1 na4 bo1dong4 de5 tou4ming2 shen1qu1 cong2 nei4bu4 san3 fa1 chu1 chi4re4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xia4shou3 tai4 hen3 le5，Ge2luo4li2。zhe4 shi4 ni3 zi4zhao3 de5。"

msgid ""
"As you draw your arm back to smash the glass, Dietrich catches it. His "
"gnarled hand tightens around your wrist."
msgstr ""
"当​你​抡​起​胳膊​，​准备​打碎​玻璃​时​，​迪​特里​希​一把​抓住​了​你​。​他​粗砺​变形​的​手​紧紧​箍​着​你​的​手腕​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 lun1 qi3 ge1bo5，zhun3bei4 da3sui4 bo1li5 shi2，Di2te4li3xi1 yi1 ba3 zhua1zhu4 le5 ni3。ta1 cu1 li4 bian4xing2 de5 shou3 jin3jin3 gu1 zhao2 ni3 de5 shou3wan4。"

msgid ""
"As you emerge from the dingy confines of the U-Bahn terminal and step into "
"the light of day, you find yourself confronted by a wall of muscle in a "
"Knight Errant uniform."
msgstr ""
"当​你​从​阴暗​的​地铁站​出口​踏入​阳光​下​，​眼前​赫然​矗立​着​一位​身着​游侠​骑士​制服​的​壮汉​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 cong2 yin1an4 de5 di4tie3zhan4 chu1kou3 ta1 ru4 yang2guang1 xia4，yan3qian2 he4ran2 chu4li4 zhao2 yi1 wei4 shen1zhuo2 you2Xia2qi2shi4 zhi4fu2 de5 zhuang4 han4。"

msgid ""
"As you emerge, blinking, into the light of day, you find yourself standing face to face with a veritable wall of security personnel.\n"
"\n"
"A man in an expensive suit raises a megaphone to shout at you."
msgstr ""
"当​你​眨​着​眼睛​重新​走​回​日光​之下​时​，​你​发现自己​正面​对​着​一堵​安保​人员​组成​的​人墙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​身穿​昂贵​西装​的​男人​举起​扩音器​冲​你​大喊​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zha3 zhao2 yan3jing5 chong2xin1 zou3 hui2 ri4guang1 zhi1xia4 shi2，ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 zheng4mian4 dui4 zhao2 yi1 du3 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 zu3cheng2 de5 ren2qiang2。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 shen1chuan1 ang2gui4 xi1zhuang1 de5 nan2ren2 ju3qi3 kuo4yin1qi4 chong1 ni3 da4han3。"

msgid ""
"As you hurry past the scene of carnage in the operating theater, a peculiar smile crosses the rigger's face.\n"
"\n"
"He slows to a stop, then points at the dismembered body on the other side of the glass."
msgstr ""
"当​你们​匆匆​经过​手术室​的​惨烈​现场​时​，​机师​的​脸上​掠过​一丝​诡异​的​微笑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​放慢​脚步​停下​，​随即​指向​玻璃​另一侧​那具​支离破碎​的​尸体​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3men5 cong1cong1 jing1guo4 shou3shu4shi4 de5 can3lie4 xian4chang3 shi2，ji1shi1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu:e4guo4 yi1 si1 gui3yi4 de5 wei1xiao4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 fang4man4 jiao3bu4 ting2xia4，sui2ji2 zhi3xiang4 bo1li5 ling4 yi1 ce4 na4 ju4 zhi1li2po4sui4 de5 shi1ti3。"

msgid ""
"As you inspect Danni's work, it occurs to you that you could use this tap to your advantage.\n"
"\n"
"It wouldn't take a lot of technical skill to manufacture a power spike from here. In theory, you could bring Aztechnology's entire power grid down."
msgstr ""
"在​你​检视​丹妮​的​成果​时​，​你​意识​到​自己​可以​利用​这个​接口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​用​它​制造​一波​电力​尖峰​并不需要​多少​技术​能力​。​理论​上​，​你​可以​让​阿兹特​科技​的​整个​电网​陷入​停摆​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 jian3shi4 dan1 ni1 de5 cheng2guo3 shi2，ni3 yi4shi2 dao4 zi4ji3 ke3yi3 li4yong4 zhe4ge5 jie1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"yong4 ta1 zhi4zao4 yi1 bo1 dian4li4 jian1feng1 bing4 bu4 xu1 yao4 duo1shao3 ji4shu4 neng2li4。li3lun4 shang4，ni3 ke3yi3 rang4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 zheng3ge4 dian4wang3 xian4ru4 ting2bai3。"

msgid ""
"As you kick the door open and stumble forward into the room, you find yourself surrounded by a sea of teenage faces.\n"
"\n"
"Initiates and acolytes, huddled together and trembling. With the spirit's influence cleared from their minds, their swagger is gone - they look frightened and lost, like kids who've had their security blankets torn away."
msgstr ""
"你​一脚​踹​开​房门​，​跌跌撞撞​地冲进​房间​，​瞬间​被​数十张​稚嫩​的​面孔​包围​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​学徒​们​和​侍​祭们​蜷​缩成一团​，​浑身​颤抖​。​在​精魂​的​影响​从​他们​的​意识​中​消散​后​，​他们​不再​神气十足​—​—​他们​看起来​既​害怕​又​迷茫​，​宛如​被​强行​夺走​了​安慰​毯​的​孩童​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1 jiao3 chuai4 kai1 fang2men2，die1die5zhuang4zhuang4 de5 chong1 jin4 fang2jian1，shun4jian1 bei4 shu3 shi2 zhang1 zhi4nen4 de5 mian4kong3 bao1wei2。\n"
"\n"
"xue2tu2 men5 he4 shi4 ji4 men5 quan2 suo1cheng2yi1tuan2，hun2shen1 chan4dou3。zai4 jing1hun2 de5 ying3xiang3 cong2 ta1men5 de5 yi4shi2 zhong4 xiao1san4 hou4，ta1men5 bu4zai4 shen2 qi4 shi2 ju4——ta1men5 kan4qi3lai5 ji4 hai4pa4 you4 mi2mang2，wan3ru2 bei4 qiang2xing2 duo2zou3 le5 an1wei4 tan3 de5 hai2tong2。"

msgid ""
"As you kick the door open and stumble forward into the room, you find yourself surrounded by a sea of teenage faces.\n"
"\n"
"Initiates, all huddled together and trembling. With the spirit's influence cleared from their minds, they look frightened and lost, like kids who've had their security blankets torn away."
msgstr ""
"你​一脚​踹​开​房门​，​跌跌撞撞​地冲进​房间​，​瞬间​被​数十张​稚嫩​的​面孔​包围​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​学徒​们​蜷​缩成一团​，​浑身​颤抖​。​在​精魂​的​影响​从​他们​的​意识​中​消散​后​，​他们​看起来​既​害怕​又​迷茫​，​宛如​被​强行​夺走​了​安慰​毯​的​孩童​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1 jiao3 chuai4 kai1 fang2men2，die1die5zhuang4zhuang4 de5 chong1 jin4 fang2jian1，shun4jian1 bei4 shu3 shi2 zhang1 zhi4nen4 de5 mian4kong3 bao1wei2。\n"
"\n"
"xue2tu2 men5 quan2 suo1cheng2yi1tuan2，hun2shen1 chan4dou3。zai4 jing1hun2 de5 ying3xiang3 cong2 ta1men5 de5 yi4shi2 zhong4 xiao1san4 hou4，ta1men5 kan4qi3lai5 ji4 hai4pa4 you4 mi2mang2，wan3ru2 bei4 qiang2xing2 duo2zou3 le5 an1wei4 tan3 de5 hai2tong2。"

msgid ""
"As you know, our organization takes good care of its friends. It would be to your advantage to help us.\n"
"\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"正如​你​所知​，​我们​组织​对​朋友​一向​关照​有加​，​帮​我们​也​是​在​帮​你​自己​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 ni3 suo3zhi1，wo3men5 zu3zhi1 dui4 peng2you5 yi1xiang4 guan1zhao4 you3jia1，bang1 wo3men5 ye3 shi4 zai4 bang1 ni3 zi4ji3。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"As you labor in vain to wipe the slime of the dumpster off of your hands, you realize that a group of transients is staring at you.\n"
"\n"
"The woman at the center of the group takes a step toward you, her shoulders hunched."
msgstr ""
"当​你​徒劳地​擦拭​着​手上​的​垃圾箱​黏液​时​，​突然​发现​一群​流浪者​正​盯​着​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​站​在​人群​中央​的​女人​蜷缩​着​肩膀​朝​你​迈​进一步​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 tu2 lao2 de5 ca1shi4 zhao2 shou3 shang4 de5 la1ji1xiang1 nian2ye4 shi2，tu1ran2 fa1xian4 yi1 qun2 liu2lang4zhe3 zheng1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"zhan4 zai4 ren2qun2 zhong1yang1 de5 nu:3ren2 quan2suo1 zhao2 jian1bang3 chao2 ni3 mai4 jin4yi1bu4。"

msgid ""
"As you lead your team through the shadows, your companions will continue to develop and learn new combat skills. Clicking the icon in the lower right-hand corner of the screen will open the Crew Advancement menu. When this icon is highlighted, one or more of your companions is eligible to learn a new combat skill.\n"
"\n"
"At each advancement level, you may choose one of two possible combat skills for each of your runners. Choose wisely."
msgstr ""
"当​你​率队​在​暗影​中​不断​前行​时​，​你​的​同伴​们​将​持续​成长​并​学习​新​的​战斗​技能​。​点击​屏幕​右下角​的​图标​打开​“​成员​升级​”​菜单​。​当​此​图标​高亮​时​，​表明​你​有​同伴​可以​学习​新​的​战斗​技能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​每次​升级​时​，​你​可以​为​每位​狂奔​者​在​两种​可用​的​战斗​技能​之中​选择​一种​。​请​慎重​选择​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 shuai4 dui4 zai4 an4ying3 zhong4 bu4duan4 qian2xing2 shi2，ni3 de5 tong2ban4 men5 jiang1 chi2xu4 cheng2zhang3 bing4 xue2xi2 xin1 de5 zhan4dou4 ji4neng2。dian3ji1 ping2mu4 you4 xia4 jiao3 de5 tu2biao1 da3kai1“cheng2yuan2 sheng1ji2” cai4dan1。dang1 ci3 tu2biao1 gao1liang4 shi2，biao3ming2 ni3 you3 tong2ban4 ke3yi3 xue2xi2 xin1 de5 zhan4dou4 ji4neng2。\n"
"\n"
"mei3ci4 sheng1ji2 shi2，ni3 ke3yi3 wei2 mei3 wei4 kuang2Ben1zhe3 zai4 liang3 zhong3 ke3 yong4 de5 zhan4dou4 ji4neng2 zhi1zhong1 xuan3ze2 yi1zhong3。qing3 shen4zhong4 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"As you lean in to read, the text slowly begins to scroll up from the bottom "
"of the screen."
msgstr ""
"你​倾身​开始​阅读​，​文字​随即​从​屏幕​底部​缓缓​向上​滚动​。\n"
"ni3 qing1 shen1 kai1shi3 yue4du2，wen2zi4 sui2ji2 cong2 ping2mu4 di3bu4 huan3huan3 xiang4shang4 gun3dong4。"

msgid ""
"As you near the edge of the Kreuzbasar, the familiar piss-and-asphalt stench of Schattennest crawls into your nostrils and sticks in the back of your throat.\n"
"\n"
"The dilapidated husks of burnt-out buildings loom above you, giving the place an air of menace."
msgstr ""
"当​你​接近​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​边缘​时​，​影巢​那​熟悉​的​尿​骚味​与​沥青​味​混合​在​一起​的​臭气​扑鼻而来​，​在​咽喉​后部​久久​不​散​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​被​烧毁​的​破旧​建筑​的​残骸​高高​耸立​在​你​上方​，​让​整个​地方​笼罩着​一股​凶恶​的​气息​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 jie1jin4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 bian1yuan2 shi2，ying3 chao2 na4 shu2xi1 de5 niao4 sao1wei4 yu4 li4qing1 wei4 hun4he2 zai4 yi1qi3 de5 chou4qi4 pu1 bi2 er2 lai2，zai4 yan1hou2 hou4bu4 jiu3jiu3 bu4 san3。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 bei4 shao1hui3 de5 po4jiu4 jian4zhu4 de5 can2hai2 gao1 gao1 song3li4 zai4 ni3 shang4fang1，rang4 zheng3ge4 di4fang1 long2 zhao4 zhao2 yi1 gu3 xiong1e4 de5 qi4xi1。"

msgid ""
"As you open the refrigerator door, a whiff of ammonia sticks in your nostrils. Watery light glints off of the door's polished interior.\n"
"\n"
"The fridge is stacked full of large plastic bins, all tightly sealed and neatly labeled. It's hard to tell through the opaque plastic, but they appear to be full of meat."
msgstr ""
"你​打开​冰箱门​的​瞬间​，​刺鼻​的​氨​气味​扑面而来​。​水汽​氤氲​的​光线​在​门板​的​抛光​内壁​上​闪烁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​冰箱​里​塞满​了​大型​塑料​储物箱​，​每个​都​封得​严严实实​，​贴着​工整​的​标签​。​虽然​不​透明​的​塑料​箱体​让​人​难以辨认​，​但​里面​似乎​装满​了​肉类​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 da3kai1 bing1 xiang1 men2 de5 shun4jian1，ci4bi2 de5 an1 qi4wei4 pu1mian4er2lai2。shui3qi4 yin1yun1 de5 guang1xian4 zai4 men2 ban3 de5 pao1guang1 nei4 bi4 shang4 shan3shuo4。\n"
"\n"
"bing1xiang1 li3 sai1man3 le5 da4xing2 su4liao4 chu3 wu4 xiang1，mei3ge4 dou1 feng1 de2 yan2yan2shi2shi2，tie1 zhao2 gong1zheng3 de5 biao1qian1。sui1ran2 bu4 tou4ming2 de5 su4liao4 xiang1 ti3 rang4 ren2 nan2 yi3 bian4 ren4，dan4 li3mian4 si4hu1 zhuang1man3 le5 rou4lei4。"

msgid ""
"As you pass by the open door, you see a middle-aged wageslave working at a console.\n"
"\n"
"His back is facing the doorway, and he doesn't seem to have noticed you."
msgstr ""
"你​经过​敞开​的​门​时​，​看到​一个​中​年薪​奴​正在​控制​台前​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​背对着​门口​，​似乎​没有​注意​到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jing1guo4 chang3kai1 de5 men2 shi2，kan4dao4 yi1ge5 zhong4 nian2xin1 nu2 zheng4zai4 kong4zhi4 tai2qian2 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bei1 dui4 zhao2 men2kou3，si4hu1 mei2you3 zhu4yi4 dao4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"As you press your way forward through the cozy, smoke-filled confines of "
"Cafe Cezve, you catch sight of Frau Müller."
msgstr ""
"当​你​在​“​来​一壶​”​咖啡馆​那​烟雾​缭绕​的​温馨​小​空间​向前​挪动​时​，​穆勒​女士​的​身影​映入​你​的​眼帘​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 zai4“lai2 yi1 hu2” ka1fei1guan3 na4 yan1wu4 liao2rao4 de5 wen1xin1 xiao3 kong1jian1 xiang4qian2 nuo2dong4 shi2，mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 de5 shen1ying3 ying4ru4 ni3 de5 yan3lian2。"

msgid ""
"As you reach forward, Marta steps back with the opposite leg and brings her "
"palm down in an overhand slap."
msgstr ""
"你​向前​探身​之际​，​玛​尔塔​反身​后撤​一步​，​随即​挥掌​向​你​拍击​下来​。\n"
"ni3 xiang4qian2 tan4shen1 zhi1ji4，Ma3er3ta3 fan3shen1 hou4che4 yi1 bu4，sui2ji2 hui1 zhang3 xiang4 ni3 pai1ji1 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"As you settle in for your trip back to the Kreuzbasar, you can feel rest of the world compartmentalize and fall away.\n"
"\n"
"No more distractions. Just you, the train, and the optical chip. It sits in your pocket like a hot stone, impossible to ignore."
msgstr ""
"坐在​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​列车​上​，​你​感觉​外面​的​世界​仿佛​被​隔绝​开来​，​渐渐​淡出​视野​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此刻​再​无​纷扰​。​唯有​你​、​列车​与​那​枚​光学​芯片​。​它​像​块​滚烫​的​石头​般​躺​在​你​的​口袋​里​，​令人​无法​忽视​。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4 zai4 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lie4che1 shang4，ni3 gan3jue2 wai4mian4 de5 shi4jie4 fang3fu2 bei4 ge2jue2 kai1 lai2，jian4jian4 dan4chu1 shi4ye3。\n"
"\n"
"ci3ke4 zai4 wu2 fen1rao3。wei2you3 ni3、lie4che1 yu4 na4 mei2 guang1xue2 xin1pian4。ta1 xiang4 kuai4 gun3tang4 de5 shi2tou5 ban1 tang3 zai4 ni3 de5 kou3dai4 li3，ling4ren2 wu2fa3 hu1shi4。"

msgid ""
"As you start towards the safehouse door, a large four-legged form steps around the corner. Dante. Monika's dog, an enormous mongrel of indeterminate breed. \n"
"\n"
"A low whimper emerges as he enters the room, head hanging low."
msgstr ""
"当​你​起身​走向​安全​屋​大门​时​，​一只​巨大​的​四足​兽​从​角落里​走​了​出来​。​它​是​但丁​，​莫妮卡​的​狗​，​一只​品种​不明​的​特大号​杂种​犬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​低着头​走入​房间​，​发出​一声​低沉​的​哀鸣​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 qi3shen1 zou3xiang4 an1quan2 wu1 da4men2 shi2，yi1 zhi3 ju4da4 de5 si4 ju4 shou4 cong2 jiao3 la4 li3 zou3 le5 chu1lai2。ta1 shi4 dan4ding1，Mo4ni1ka3 de5 gou3，yi1 zhi3 pin3zhong3 bu4ming2 de5 te4da4hao4 za2zhong3 quan3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 di1 zhao2 tou2 zou3ru4 fang2jian1，fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 di1chen2 de5 ai1ming2。"

msgid ""
"As you step away from the door, the crawling sensation gradually recedes. A "
"moment later, the strength returns to your limbs."
msgstr ""
"当​你​离开​门口​时​，​那种​蠕动​的​感觉​逐渐​消退​。​片刻​之后​，​你​的​四肢​恢复​了​力量​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 li2kai1 men2kou3 shi2，na4zhong3 ru2dong4 de5 gan3jue2 zhu2jian4 xiao1tui4。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ni3 de5 si4zhi1 hui1fu4 le5 li4liang5。"

msgid ""
"As you step away from the drone, the hissing sound grows into a roar. Bright white sparks spit out from the drone's melting chassis and streak across the room.\n"
"\n"
"You've seen this kind of reaction before: thermite. Whoever built the drone must have wired it with a self-destruct device."
msgstr ""
"当​你​从​无人机​处退​开时​，​嘶嘶声​逐渐​变成​轰鸣声​。​明亮​的​白色​火花​从​无人机​熔化​的​机身​中​喷射​而出​，​划过​整个​房间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​以前​见过​这种​反应​：​热​熔剂​。​制造​无人机​的​人​一定​在​其中​安装​了​自毁​装置​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 cong2 wu2ren2ji1 chu3 tui4 kai1 shi2，si1si1sheng1 zhu2jian4 bian4cheng2 hong1 ming2 sheng1。ming2liang4 de5 bai2se4 huo3hua1 cong2 wu2ren2ji1 rong2hua4 de5 ji1shen1 zhong4 pen1she4 er2 chu1，hua2guo4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3qian2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 fan3ying4：re4 rong2 ji4。zhi4zao4 wu2ren2ji1 de5 ren2 yi1ding4 zai4 qi2zhong1 an1zhuang1 le5 zi4hui3 zhuang1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"As you step forward, Absinthe puts down the box of inventory that she was "
"rifling through. She pushes it aside and beckons to you."
msgstr ""
"当​你​向前​迈步​时​，​苦艾​酒​放下​正在​翻找​的​物品​箱​，​将​其​推到​一旁​，​向​你​招手​示意​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 xiang4qian2 mai4bu4 shi2，ku3ai4 jiu3 fang4xia4 zheng4zai4 fan1 zhao3 de5 wu4pin3 xiang1，jiang1 qi2 tui1 dao4 yi1pang2，xiang4 ni3 zhao1shou3 shi4yi4。"

msgid ""
"As you step forward, the rest of your team falls silent.\n"
"\n"
"Amsel shifts his attention to you. You can see the worry on his face."
msgstr ""
"当​你​走上​前时​，​其他​队员​陷入​了​沉默​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿姆​泽尔​将​注意力​转向​你​。​你​能​看到​他​脸上​的​忧虑​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3 shang4 qian2 shi2，qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 xian4ru4 le5 chen2mo4。\n"
"\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。ni3 neng2 kan4dao4 ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 you1lu:4。"

msgid ""
"As you step forward, the scintillating red light that streams from the doorway flickers and dies.\n"
"\n"
"There is a strange, lurching sensation in your gut, but it clears almost instantly. The door swings open with a touch."
msgstr ""
"当​你​向前​迈步​时​，​门缝​中​流淌​出​的​璀璨​红光​忽明忽暗​，​最终​熄灭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​胃里​涌起​一阵​怪异​的​翻腾​感​，​但​转瞬即逝​。​你​轻轻​一碰​，​门​应声​而开​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 xiang4qian2 mai4bu4 shi2，men2 feng2 zhong4 liu2tang3 chu1 de5 cui3can4 hong2 guang1 hu1 ming2 hu1 an4，zui4zhong1 xi1mie4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 wei4 li3 yong3qi3 yi1zhen4 guai4yi4 de5 fan1teng2 gan3，dan4 zhuan3shun4ji2shi4。ni3 qing1qing1 yi1 peng4，men2 ying4sheng1 er2 kai1。"

msgid ""
"As you step forward, you find yourself gagging. The air in this room is saturated with a slaughterhouse smell, a smell like blood and bile and feces.\n"
"\n"
"The stench of an abattoir."
msgstr ""
"你​刚​迈步​向前​，​便​感到​一阵​恶心​。​屠宰场​的​气味​充斥​在​整个​房间​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​血腥​、​胆汁​与​粪便​混合​在​一起​散发出​的​恶臭​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1 mai4bu4 xiang4qian2，bian4 gan3dao4 yi1zhen4 e3xin1。tu2zai3chang3 de5 qi4wei4 chong1chi4 zai4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 xue4xing1、dan3zhi1 yu4 fen4bian4 hun4he2 zai4 yi1qi3 san3 fa1 chu1 de5 e4chou4。"

msgid ""
"As you step into the room, the lights begin to flicker and dim.\n"
"\n"
"One by one they wink out, and the room is swallowed by darkness."
msgstr ""
"当​你​走进​房间​时​，​灯光​开始​闪烁​并​逐渐​暗淡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一盏​接​一盏​熄灭​，​直到​房间​被​黑暗​吞噬​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 fang2jian1 shi2，deng1guang1 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4 bing4 zhu2jian4 an4dan4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 zhan3 jie1 yi1 zhan3 xi1mie4，zhi2dao4 fang2jian1 bei4 hei1an4 tun1shi4。"

msgid ""
"As you step into the room, you find yourself standing in a charnel house. "
"There are fresh corpses spread across the floor, and the metal tiles are "
"smeared with blood."
msgstr ""
"当​你​踏入​房间​时​，​发现​这里​到处​都​堆积​着​尸骨​。​地上​散落​着​新鲜​的​尸体​，​金属​地砖​上​沾满​了​鲜血​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 ta1 ru4 fang2jian1 shi2，fa1xian4 zhe4li3 dao4chu4 dou1 dui1ji1 zhao2 shi1gu3。di4shang5 san3luo4 zhao2 xin1xian1 de5 shi1ti3，jin1shu3 di4zhuan1 shang4 zhan1man3 le5 xian1xue4。"

msgid ""
"As you step out of the elevator, you immediately spot the console built into the wall just off to your left.\n"
"\n"
"Seconds later, your PDA is connected, and the words \"Link Established\" flash across the screen before visual feeds from all around the building begin flooding in."
msgstr ""
"刚​走出​电梯​，​你​就​注意​到​左侧​墙壁​内嵌​的​控制台​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒​之后​，​你​将​PDA​接入​控制台​，​“​已​建立​链接​”​的​字样​在​屏幕​上​闪过​，​整栋​大楼​的​实时​监控​随即​涌入​你​的​眼帘​。\n"
"\n"
"gang1 zou3chu1 dian4ti1，ni3 jiu4 zhu4yi4 dao4 zuo3ce4 qiang2bi4 nei4 kan3 de5 kong4zhi4tai2。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhi1hou4，ni3 jiang1 PDA jie1ru4 kong4zhi4tai2，“yi3 jian4li4 lian4jie1” de5 zi4yang4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4 shan3guo4，zheng3 dong4 da4lou2 de5 shi2shi2 jian1kong4 sui2ji2 yong3ru4 ni3 de5 yan3lian2。"

msgid ""
"As you step through the door, you find yourself confronted by a pair of men wearing the same kind of uniform that you are. Judging by their expressions, there is no love lost between the two.\n"
"\n"
"Hearing the door swing open, they turn to face you."
msgstr ""
"你​推门而入​，​发现​迎面​站​着​两名​与​你​穿着​相同​制服​的​男子​。​从​他们​神情​来看​，​两人​显然​互不​待见​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听到​门​吱呀​开启​的​声响​，​他们​转过身​来​面对​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tui1 men2 er2 ru4，fa1xian4 ying2mian4 zhan4 zhao2 liang3 ming2 yu4 ni3 chuan1zhuo2 xiang1tong2 zhi4fu2 de5 nan2zi3。cong2 ta1men5 shen2qing2 lai2 kan4，liang3 ren2 xian3ran2 hu4 bu4 dai4jian5。\n"
"\n"
"ting1dao4 men2 zhi1ya1 kai1qi3 de5 sheng1xiang3，ta1men5 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 mian4dui4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"As you stoop to pick up the guard's keycard, something catches your eye. A flash of light.\n"
"\n"
"Sweeping your gaze across the room, you see a variety of terminals, all displaying flickering error messages.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever security APEX provided here, it's off line now, leaving the machines unlocked and unprotected."
msgstr ""
"当​你​弯腰​捡起​守卫​的​门禁卡​时​，​某物​吸引​了​你​的​注意​。​一道​闪光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​环顾四周​，​你​看到​各种​终端设备​，​全都​显示​着​错误信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​APEX​在​这里​提供​了​什么样​的​安全措施​，​现在​都​已​离线​，​导致​这些​设备​处于​未​锁定​且​无​保护​的​状态​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 wan1yao1 jian3 qi3 shou3wei4 de5 men2 jin1 ka3 shi2，mou3wu4 xi1yin3 le5 ni3 de5 zhu4yi4。yi1dao4 shan3guang1。\n"
"\n"
"huan2gu4si4zhou1，ni3 kan4dao4 ge4zhong3 zhong1 duan1 she4 bei4，quan2dou1 xian3shi4 zhao2 cuo4 wu4 xin4 xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 APEX zai4 zhe4li3 ti2gong1 le5 shen2me5yang4 de5 an1quan2cuo4shi1，xian4zai4 dou1 yi3 li2xian4，dao3zhi4 zhe4xie1 she4bei4 chu3yu2 wei4 suo3ding4 qie3 wu2 bao3hu4 de5 zhuang4tai4。"

msgid ""
"As you struggle to keep your footing, you hear grunts of pain from all around you. Your teammates, doubling over in agony.\n"
"\n"
"The blood mage stands impassively, his lips slightly parted. A whispered chant spills from him, and every syllable is like another dagger in your stomach."
msgstr ""
"当​你​竭力​保持平衡​时​，​四周​传来​阵阵​呻吟​。​你​的​队友​们​也​已​痛苦​地弯​下腰​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​血​法师​面​无表情​地​伫立​着​，​双唇​微启​。​咒语​从​他​口中​低声​流淌​而出​，​每个​音节​都​像​一把​匕首​，​不断​刺进​你​的​腹部​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 jie2li4 bao3 chi2 ping2 heng2 shi2，si4zhou1 chuan2lai2 zhen4 zhen4 shen1yin2。ni3 de5 dui4you3 men5 ye3 yi3 tong4ku3 de5 wan1 xia4yao1。\n"
"\n"
"xie3 fa3shi1 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 zhu4li4 zhao2，shuang1 chun2 wei1 qi3。zhou4yu3 cong2 ta1 kou3 zhong4 di1sheng1 liu2tang3 er2 chu1，mei3ge4 yin1jie2 dou1 xiang4 yi1 ba3 bi3shou3，bu4duan4 ci1 jin4 ni3 de5 fu4bu4。"

msgid ""
"As you take your position outside the van, you hear a shrill voice bark out an order.\n"
"\n"
"A pair of portable gun turrets begins to self-calibrate in response."
msgstr ""
"当​你​在​货车​外​就位​时​，​一声​尖锐​的​命令​突然​响起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​两座​便携式​炮塔​随即​启动​自动​校准​程序​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zai4 huo4che1 wai4 jiu4 wei4 shi2，yi1sheng1 jian1rui4 de5 ming4ling4 tu1ran2 xiang3qi3。\n"
"\n"
"liang3 zuo4 bian4xie2shi4 pao4ta3 sui2ji2 qi3dong4 zi4dong4 jiao4zhun3 cheng2xu4。"

msgid "As you turn to leave, Blitz pulls you aside."
msgstr ""
"你​正​准备​离开​时​，​布里​茨​把​你​拉​到​一旁​。\n"
"ni3 zheng1 zhun3bei4 li2kai1 shi2，Bu4li3ci2 ba3 ni3 la1 dao4 yi1pang2。"

msgid ""
"As you turn to leave, a strange sensation flits across you. Through you.\n"
"\n"
"It might just be your imagination. It's *probably* your imagination.\n"
"\n"
"But that doesn't stop your knees from going weak or your stomach from churning."
msgstr ""
"你​刚要​转身​离开​，​却​感到​某种​奇异​的​悸动​掠过​你​的​意识​，​穿透​你​的​身体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​只是​你​的​想象​吧​，​*​多半​*​只是​想象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​仍​控制​不住​地​两腿​发软​，​胃里​翻江倒海​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1 yao4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1，que4 gan3dao4 mou3zhong3 qi2yi4 de5 ji4dong4 lu:e4guo4 ni3 de5 yi4shi2，chuan1tou4 ni3 de5 shen1ti3。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 zhi3shi4 ni3 de5 xiang3xiang4 ba1，*duo1ban4*zhi3shi4 xiang3xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 reng2 kong4zhi4 bu4zhu4 de5 liang3 tui3 fa1ruan3，wei4 li3 fan1jiang1dao3hai3。"

msgid ""
"As you turn to leave, a strange sensation flits across your consciousness. Through you.\n"
"\n"
"It might just be your imagination. It's *probably* your imagination.\n"
"\n"
"But that doesn't stop your knees from going weak or your stomach from churning."
msgstr ""
"你​刚要​转身​离开​，​却​感到​某种​奇异​的​悸动​掠过​你​的​意识​，​穿透​你​的​身体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​只是​你​的​想象​吧​，​*​多半​*​只是​想象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​仍​控制​不住​地​两腿​发软​，​胃里​翻江倒海​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1 yao4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1，que4 gan3dao4 mou3zhong3 qi2yi4 de5 ji4dong4 lu:e4guo4 ni3 de5 yi4shi2，chuan1tou4 ni3 de5 shen1ti3。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 zhi3shi4 ni3 de5 xiang3xiang4 ba1，*duo1ban4*zhi3shi4 xiang3xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 reng2 kong4zhi4 bu4zhu4 de5 liang3 tui3 fa1ruan3，wei4 li3 fan1jiang1dao3hai3。"

msgid ""
"As you turn to run you see his hand flash out and smack the alarm panel.\n"
"\n"
"The door slams shut as an ear-piercing siren begins to blare."
msgstr ""
"当​你​转身​逃跑​时​，​你​看到​他​的​手​猛然​砸​向​警报​面板​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​刺耳​的​警报声​响起​，​门​砰​地​关上​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zhuan3shen1 tao2pao3 shi2，ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 de5 shou3 meng3ran2 za2 xiang4 jing3bao4 mian4ban3。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ci4er3 de5 jing3 bao4 sheng1 xiang3qi3，men2 peng1 de5 guan1shang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"As you turn, you catch sight of something *sliding* into the world. \n"
"\n"
"It looks like a charred man, with a pair of tortured faces where its shoulders should be. The thing burns like a Roman candle, spitting white-hot sparks in a fiery plume. An oily substance runs down between its dangling legs and spatters onto the floor, and where those drips land, they burn."
msgstr ""
"你​转过身​，​刚好​看到​某个​东西​*​滑入​*​这个​世界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​看起来​像​一具​烧焦​的​人类​尸体​，​肩膀​的​位置​却是​两张​受尽折磨​的​面孔​。​它​像​烟花​一般​燃烧​着​，​喷吐​着​炽白​火花​，​形成​滚滚​火柱​。​油腻​的​液体​从​垂落​的​双腿​间​流淌​，​溅落​在​地板​上​，​滴落​之处​皆​燃起​火焰​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，gang1hao3 kan4dao4 mou3 ge4 dong1xi1*hua2 ru4*zhe4ge5 shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 yi1 ju4 shao1jiao1 de5 ren2lei4 shi1ti3，jian1bang3 de5 wei4zhi5 que4shi4 liang3 zhang1 shou4 jin3 zhe1 mo2 de5 mian4kong3。ta1 xiang4 yan1hua1 yi1ban1 ran2shao1 zhao2，pen1 tu3 zhao2 chi4 bai2 huo3hua1，xing2cheng2 gun3gun3 huo3zhu4。you2ni4 de5 ye4ti3 cong2 chui2 la4 de5 shuang1tui3 jian1 liu2tang3，jian4luo4 zai4 di4ban3 shang4，di1 la4 zhi1 chu3 jie1 ran2qi3 huo3yan4。"

msgid ""
"As you unclip the keycard, you notice the heading on the top page of the clipboard.\n"
"\n"
"\"PROJECT APEX SHUTDOWN PROCEDURES.\""
msgstr ""
"取​下​门禁卡​时​，​你​注意​到​了​夹板​首页​的​标题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​APEX​项目​关闭程序​。​”\n"
"\n"
"qu3 xia4 men2 jin1 ka3 shi2，ni3 zhu4yi4 dao4 le5 jia1ban3 shou3ye4 de5 biao1ti2。\n"
"\n"
"“APEX xiang4mu4 guan1 bi4 cheng2 xu4。”"

msgid ""
"As you walk away from the frightened shopkeeper, a menacing dwarf approaches"
" you, and he's packing heat."
msgstr ""
"当​你​从​惊慌失措​的​店主​身边​走开​时​，​一个​气势汹汹​、​手持​武器​的​矮​人​向​你​走来​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 cong2 jing1huang1shi1cuo4 de5 dian4zhu3 shen1bian1 zou3kai1 shi2，yi1ge5 qi4shi4xiong1xiong1、shou3 chi2 wu3qi4 de5 ai3 ren2 xiang4 ni3 zou3 lai2。"

msgid ""
"As you watch, the chemical fire that rages from the Engineer's body blackens his flesh and spits sparks across the room.\n"
"\n"
"It's the same reaction that you saw when the drone went up. A thermite reaction."
msgstr ""
"在​你们​的​注视​下​，​工程师​体内​燃烧​的​化学​火焰​将​他​的​肉体​烧焦​，​并​向​房间​各处​喷射出​火花​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​与​你​之前​看到​无人机​升空​时​发生​的​反应​相同​。​一种​热熔​反应​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3men5 de5 zhu4shi4 xia4，gong1cheng2shi1 ti3nei4 ran2shao1 de5 hua4xue2 huo3yan4 jiang1 ta1 de5 rou4ti3 shao1jiao1，bing4 xiang4 fang2jian1 ge4chu4 pen1 she4 chu1 huo3hua1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yu4 ni3 zhi1qian2 kan4dao4 wu2ren2ji1 sheng1kong1 shi2 fa1sheng1 de5 fan3ying4 xiang1tong2。yi1zhong3 re4 rong2 fan3ying4。"

msgid ""
"As you watch, the chemical fire that rages from the Engineer's body blackens his flesh and spits sparks across the room.\n"
"\n"
"It's the same reaction that you saw when the drone went up. A thermite reaction.\n"
"\n"
"It takes him a full minute to stop twitching."
msgstr ""
"在​你们​的​注视​下​，​工程师​体内​燃烧​的​化学​火焰​将​他​的​肉体​烧焦​，​并​向​房间​各处​喷射出​火花​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​与​你​之前​看到​无人机​升空​时​发生​的​反应​相同​。​一种​热熔​反应​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过​了​整整​一分钟​后​，​他​才​停止​抽搐​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3men5 de5 zhu4shi4 xia4，gong1cheng2shi1 ti3nei4 ran2shao1 de5 hua4xue2 huo3yan4 jiang1 ta1 de5 rou4ti3 shao1jiao1，bing4 xiang4 fang2jian1 ge4chu4 pen1 she4 chu1 huo3hua1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yu4 ni3 zhi1qian2 kan4dao4 wu2ren2ji1 sheng1kong1 shi2 fa1sheng1 de5 fan3ying4 xiang1tong2。yi1zhong3 re4 rong2 fan3ying4。\n"
"\n"
"guo4 le5 zheng3zheng3 yi1 fen4 zhong1 hou4，ta1 cai2 ting2zhi3 chou1chu4。"

msgid ""
"As you watch, the hope dies from Marta's eyes. All that you can read in her expression is pain.\n"
"\n"
"She swallows, hard, and exhales. Opens her mouth to speak. Then that strange whispering noise fills the back of your skull again, and the muscles of her face relax."
msgstr ""
"在​你​的​注视​下​，​希望​从玛​尔塔​眼中​逐渐​消逝​。​你​只能​从​她​的​表情​中​读出​痛苦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​用力​咽​了​口​唾沫​，​呼​出​一口气​，​张口​欲言​。​接着​那​诡异​的​低​语声​再度​充盈​你​的​脑后​，​她​面部​的​肌肉​随之​松弛​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 de5 zhu4shi4 xia4，xi1wang4 cong2 Ma3er3ta3 yan3zhong1 zhu2jian4 xiao1shi4。ni3 zhi3neng2 cong2 ta1 de5 biao3qing2 zhong4 du2chu1 tong4ku3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yong4li4 yan1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5，hu1 chu1 yi1kou3qi4，zhang1kou3 yu4 yan2。jie1zhe5 na4 gui3yi4 de5 di1 yu3sheng1 zai4du4 chong1ying2 ni3 de5 nao3hou4，ta1 mian4bu4 de5 ji1rou4 sui2zhi1 song1chi2。"

msgid ""
"As you watch, the number on the screen slowly begins to climb.\n"
"\n"
"This is going to take a while."
msgstr ""
"你​看见​屏幕​上​的​数字​开始​缓慢​增加​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​得​有​一会儿​才能​完事​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4jian4 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 shu4zi4 kai1shi3 huan3man4 zeng1jia1。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 de2 you3 yi1hui4r5 cai2neng2 wan2shi4。"

msgid ""
"As you watch, the spirit's body begins to rupture. Great lesions open up in the creature's chest and back, and its rib cage cracks from some horrible internal pressure.\n"
"\n"
"The spirit's chest heaves, and a foul liquid pours from the rips in its flesh. A flash of light stabs your eyes, and when your vision clears, you find three identical spirits floating before you."
msgstr ""
"在​你​的​注视​下​，​精魂​的​身体​开始​破裂​。​它​的​胸部​和​背部​都​出现​了​巨大​的​裂痕​，​肋骨​也​因为​可怕​的​内部​压力​而​开裂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​精魂​的​胸口​剧烈​起伏​，​污秽​的​液体​从​撕裂​的​血肉​中​涌出​。​一道​刺​目的​光芒​刺痛​了​你​的​双眼​，​待​视线​恢复​清晰​时​，​你​发现​三个​一模一样​的​精魂​正​悬浮​在​眼前​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 de5 zhu4shi4 xia4，jing1hun2 de5 shen1ti3 kai1shi3 po4lie4。ta1 de5 xiong1bu4 he4 bei4bu4 dou1 chu1xian4 le5 ju4da4 de5 lie4hen2，lei4gu3 ye3 yin1wei4 ke3pa4 de5 nei4bu4 ya1li4 er2 kai1lie4。\n"
"\n"
"jing1hun2 de5 xiong1kou3 ju4lie4 qi3fu2，wu1hui4 de5 ye4ti3 cong2 si1lie4 de5 xue4rou4 zhong4 yong3chu1。yi1dao4 ci1 mu4di4 guang1mang2 ci4tong4 le5 ni3 de5 shuang1yan3，dai1 shi4xian4 hui1fu4 qing1xi1 shi2，ni3 fa1xian4 san1 ge4 yi1mu2yi1yang4 de5 jing1hun2 zheng1 xuan2fu2 zai4 yan3qian2。"

msgid ""
"As you watch, the spot that Dietrich is pointing at begins to glow. Lines of"
" force spread out in a scintillating web, and a feeling of raw power "
"suffuses your body."
msgstr ""
"你​的​目光​随之​望去​，​只见​他​指向​的​位置​开始​泛起​光芒​。​力量​的​线条​如​闪烁​的​蛛网​般向​外扩散​，​一股​原始​能量​充盈​你​的​全身​。\n"
"ni3 de5 mu4guang1 sui2zhi1 wang4 qu4，zhi3jian4 ta1 zhi3xiang4 de5 wei4zhi5 kai1shi3 fan4qi3 guang1mang2。li4liang5 de5 xian4tiao2 ru2 shan3shuo4 de5 zhu1wang3 ban1 xiang4 wai4 kuo4 san3，yi1 gu3 yuan2shi3 neng2liang4 chong1ying2 ni3 de5 quan2shen1。"

msgid ""
"As you wish, Uncle. I will see to it right away.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Kami offers you a shy grin, snaps her gum, and hurries back into the room that she came from.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"如你所愿​，​叔叔​。​我​这​就​去​办​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​卡米​朝​你​露出​腼腆​的​微笑​，​吹破​嘴里​的​口香糖​，​又​匆忙​跑​回后​屋​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ru2 ni3 suo3 yuan4，shu1shu5。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 qu4 ban4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ka3mi3 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 mian3tian3 de5 wei1xiao4，chui1 po4 zui3li3 de5 kou3xiang1tang2，you4 cong1mang2 pao2 hui2 hou4 wu1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"As you wish. \n"
"\n"
"Auf Wiedersehen."
msgstr ""
"如你所愿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2 ni3 suo3 yuan4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"As you wish. Maliit is going to continue working on the other DVDs... she'll"
" be in touch if and when she makes any headway."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。​玛丽​特​还​在​努力​修复​其他​几张​DVD​……​她​告诉​我​说​，​如果​有​进展​会​随时​联系​我​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。ma3li4 te4 hai2 zai4 nu3li4 xiu1fu4 qi2ta1 ji1 zhang1 DVD……ta1 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1，ru2guo3 you3 jin4zhan3 hui4 sui2shi2 lian2xi4 wo3。"

msgid "As you wish. You will hear from us again."
msgstr ""
"如你所愿​。​我们​会​再​联系​你​的​。\n"
"ru2 ni3 suo3 yuan4。wo3men5 hui4 zai4 lian2xi4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"As you've already pointed out, we're running late. Shouldn't we get moving?"
msgstr ""
"你​刚才​不是​说​我们​已经​要​迟到​了​吗​。​那​我们​还​不​出发​？\n"
"ni3 gang1cai2 bu4shi4 shuo1 wo3men5 yi3jing1 yao4 chi2dao4 le5 ma5。na4 wo3men5 hai2 bu4 chu1fa1？"

msgid ""
"As your doctor, I'm obligated to tell you that I wouldn't recommend it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But if your mind's made up, be my guest. Go out looking for discount brain surgery. See where that gets you."
msgstr ""
"作为​你​的​医生​，​我​有​义务​告诉​你​，​我​不​建议​你​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​你​心意​已决​，​那​就​请便​吧​。​出去​做个​廉价​脑外​手术​，​看看​你​会​有​什么​下场​。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 ni3 de5 yi1sheng1，wo3 you3 yi4wu4 gao4su4 ni3，wo3 bu4 jian4yi4 ni3 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 xin1yi4 yi3 jue2，na4 jiu4 qing3bian4 ba1。chu1qu4 zuo4 ge4 lian2jia4 nao3 wai4 shou3shu4，kan4kan5 ni3 hui4 you3 shen2me5 xia4chang3。"

msgid ""
"As your finger nears the eject button, a black screen cuts in over the "
"static. A moment later, Green Winters' haggard face appears."
msgstr ""
"正当​你​准备​按下​弹出​按钮​时​，​屏幕​变为​一片​漆黑​。​片刻​之后​，​格林​·​温特斯​那张​憔悴​的​脸​出现​了​。\n"
"zheng4dang1 ni3 zhun3bei4 an4xia4 tan2chu1 an4niu3 shi2，ping2mu4 bian4wei2 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 na4 zhang1 qiao2cui4 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"As your third eye opens to the hidden world around you, you feel the "
"familiar tingle of dormant senses awakening. The room that you're standing "
"in slowly shifts to match its true nature: a lifeless expanse of gray, ugly "
"and cold. Your own body, however, explodes into a swirling chaos of "
"scintillating color."
msgstr ""
"当​你​开启​天眼​，​窥见​周遭​隐秘​的​世界​时​，​你​感受​到​沉睡​感官​苏醒​时​熟悉​的​刺痛​。​你​所​站立​的​房间​正​缓缓​转变​，​显露出​其​真实​面目​：​一片​死寂​的​灰色​荒原​，​丑陋​而​冰冷​。​然而​你​的​身体​却​迸发出​绚烂​色彩​，​化作​一片​混沌​的​漩涡​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 kai1qi3 tian1yan3，kui1jian4 zhou1zao1 yin3mi4 de5 shi4jie4 shi2，ni3 gan3shou4 dao4 chen2shui4 gan3guan1 su1xing3 shi2 shu2xi1 de5 ci4tong4。ni3 suo3 zhan4li4 de5 fang2jian1 zheng1 huan3huan3 zhuan3bian4，xian3lu4chu1 qi2 zhen1shi2 mian4mu4：yi1 pian1 si3ji4 de5 hui1se4 huang1yuan2，chou3lou4 er2 bing1leng3。ran2er2 ni3 de5 shen1ti3 que4 beng4 fa1 chu1 xuan4lan4 se4cai3，hua4zuo4 yi1 pian1 hun4dun4 de5 xuan2wo1。"

msgid "Aside from warping children into remorseless killers, you mean?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​，​除了​把​孩子​们​扭曲​成​冷血​杀手​这件​事​之外​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1，chu2le5 ba3 hai2zi5 men5 niu3qu1 cheng2 leng3xue4 sha1shou3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 zhi1wai4？"

msgid "Ask me again nicely."
msgstr ""
"摆正​你​的​态度​再​问​。\n"
"bai3 zheng1 ni3 de5 tai4du5 zai4 wen4。"

msgid "Assassin"
msgstr ""
"刺客\n"
"ci4ke4"

msgid "Assassinate"
msgstr ""
"暗杀\n"
"an4sha1"

msgid "Assistant"
msgstr ""
"助理\n"
"zhu4li3"

msgid ""
"Assuming that APEX keeps its word, that is. We'll find out soon enough."
msgstr ""
"前提​是​假设​APEX​会​信守诺言​。​这​一点​我们​很快​就​会​知道​了​。\n"
"qian2ti2 shi4 jia3she4 APEX hui4 xin4 shou3 nuo4 yan2。zhe4 yi1dian3 wo3men5 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 zhi1dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Assuming that you complete this trial to our satisfaction, I will then offer you a variety of simple tasks. All of these should be achievable in the course of your everyday business - you won't need to go out of your way or expose yourself to much unnecessary risk.\n"
"\n"
"For each task that you complete, you will be rewarded handsomely, and there will be a bonus if you finish them all."
msgstr ""
"假设​你​能​圆满完成​的话​，​我​将​为​你​提供​一系列​简单​任务​。​这些​任务​均​可​在​你​的​日常​工作​中​完成​—​—​无需​额外​奔波​，​也​无需​承担​过多​不必要​的​风险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​每​完成​一项​任务​，​你​都​将​获得​丰厚​报酬​，​若能​全部​完成​，​还​将​额外​获得​奖励​。\n"
"\n"
"jia3she4 ni3 neng2 yuan2 man3 wan2 cheng2 de5hua4，wo3 jiang1 wei2 ni3 ti2gong1 yi1xi4lie4 jian3dan1 ren4wu5。zhe4xie1 ren4wu5 jun1 ke3 zai4 ni3 de5 ri4chang2 gong1zuo4 zhong4 wan2cheng2——wu2xu1 e2wai4 ben1bo1，ye3 wu2xu1 cheng2dan1 guo4duo1 bu4bi4yao4 de5 feng1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"mei3 wan2cheng2 yi1 xiang4 ren4wu5，ni3 dou1 jiang1 huo4de2 feng1hou4 bao4chou5，ruo4 neng2 quan2bu4 wan2cheng2，hai2 jiang1 e2wai4 huo4de2 jiang3li4。"

msgid ""
"Assuming we're alive, of course. \n"
"\n"
"So... uh, ready to go, $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"当然​，​前提​是​我们​能活​下来​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​……​准备​好了吗​，​$(l.name)​？\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，qian2ti2 shi4 wo3men5 neng2 huo2 xia4lai5 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5，$(l.name)？"

msgid "Astral Entity Containment Cell has been lowered."
msgstr ""
"灵体​收容​舱​已​降下​。\n"
"ling2ti3 shou1rong2 cang1 yi3 jiang4xia4。"

msgid ""
"Astral dragon stuck in a jar, big dumb dragon body rigged up to obey your "
"commands. Got it."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​的​灵体​被困​在​弹丸之地​，​庞大​的​肉身​则​被迫​听​你​的​指挥​。​明白​了​。\n"
"ju4long2 de5 ling2ti3 bei4kun4 zai4 dan4wan2zhi1di4，pang2da4 de5 rou4shen1 ze2 bei4po4 ting1 ni3 de5 zhi3hui1。ming2bai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"At a time like this, you're worried about money? What's wrong with you, "
"Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"现在​这种​时候​，​你​居然​还​想着​钱​？​你​怎么回事​，​布里​茨​？\n"
"xian4zai4 zhe4zhong3 shi2hou5，ni3 ju1ran2 hai2 xiang3 zhao2 qian2？ni3 zen3me5hui2shi4，Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid ""
"At any rate, I believe that I've come up with a solution to the Knight "
"Errant problem. I'll discuss the matter with your Herr Amsel if you decide "
"to take the job."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​算是​有​办法​解决​游侠​骑士​的​问题​。​如果​你​决定​接受​这份​差事​，​我​就​会​和​阿姆​泽尔​先生​开始​商议​细节​。\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 suan4shi4 you3 ban4fa3 jie3jue2 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 wen4ti2。ru2guo3 ni3 jue2ding4 jie1shou4 zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4，wo3 jiu4 hui4 he4 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 kai1shi3 shang1yi4 xi4jie2。"

msgid ""
"At any rate, if anything happens to me, it's good to know that $(l.he)'ll be on hand to fill my shoes.\n"
"\n"
"It's not what Eiger would want. But it is what would be best for the team."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​对​$(l.he)​十分​放心​。​如果​我出​了​什么​事​，​$(l.he)​会​是​接替​我​的​不二​人选​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​肯定​不​希望​这样​，​但​对​团队​而言​，​这是​最好​的​安排​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 dui4 $(l.he) shi2fen1 fang4xin1。ru2guo3 wo3 chu1 le5 shen2me5 shi4，$(l.he) hui4 shi4 jie1ti4 wo3 de5 bu4er4 ren2xuan3。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 ken3ding4 bu4 xi1wang4 zhe4yang4，dan4 dui4 tuan2dui4 er2yan2，zhe4 shi4 zui4hao3 de5 an1pai2。"

msgid ""
"At any rate, the point is this, friend: I think that maybe, if enough people believe something to be true, it can change the truth of that thing.\n"
"\n"
"Perhaps if enough people here in Gesundbrunnen have a hope to believe in, then our fate will change as well. Until then... well, we continue on. "
msgstr ""
"朋友​，​当今​这个​时代​是​这样​的​：​要​我​说​，​如果​足够​多​的​人​相信​某件事​是​真的​，​这​甚至​足以​改变​这件​事​原本​的​真相​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​如果​有​足够​多住​在​健康​泉​的​人​心怀​希望​的话​，​我们​的​命运​也​就​有​了​转机​。​在此之前​……​我们​先​努力​活下去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"peng2you5，dang1jin1 zhe4ge5 shi2dai4 shi4 zhe4yang4 de5：yao4 wo3 shuo1，ru2guo3 zu2gou4 duo1 de5 ren2 xiang1xin4 mou3 jian4 shi4 shi4 zhen1de5，zhe4 shen4zhi4 zu2yi3 gai3bian4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 yuan2ben3 de5 zhen1xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ru2guo3 you3 zu2gou4 duo1 zhu4 zai4 jian4kang1 quan2 de5 ren2 xin1huai2 xi1wang4 de5hua4，wo3men5 de5 ming4yun4 ye3 jiu4 you3 le5 zhuan3ji1。zai4ci3zhi1qian2……wo3men5 xian1 nu3li4 huo2xia4qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"At first glace, this terminal appears unremarkable. It's password-locked, "
"and a cheerful screen saver marches across its display."
msgstr ""
"乍看之下​，​这台​终端​似乎​平平​无​奇​。​它​设有​密码锁​，​此刻​屏幕​上​正​播放​着​欢快​的​屏保​动画​。\n"
"zha4 kan4 zhi1 xia4，zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 si4hu1 ping2ping2 wu2 ji1。ta1 she4you3 mi4ma3suo3，ci3ke4 ping2mu4 shang4 zheng1 bo1fang4 zhao2 huan1kuai4 de5 ping2bao3 dong4hua4。"

msgid ""
"At last! My ticket back into the hallowed halls of the Executive Wing, with its expansive supply of nonperishable treats!\n"
"\n"
"Hurry, noble stranger! Use it to unlock the door, and make all of our dreams come true!"
msgstr ""
"终于​！​这张​门禁卡​是​我​回到​行政区域​的​神圣​殿堂​的​门票​，​那里​有​无穷无尽​的​非​易腐​食品​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​快点​，​高贵​的​陌生人​！​用​它​打开​大门​，​让​我们​所有​的​梦想成真​！\n"
"\n"
"zhong1yu2！zhe4 zhang1 men2 jin1 ka3 shi4 wo3 hui2dao4 xing2zheng4qu1yu4 de5 shen2sheng4 dian4tang2 de5 men2piao4，na4li5 you3 wu2qiong2wu2jin4 de5 fei1 yi4 fu3 shi2pin3！\n"
"\n"
"kuai4dian3，gao1gui4 de5 mo4sheng1ren2！yong4 ta1 da3kai1 da4men2，rang4 wo3men5 suo3you3 de5 meng4 xiang3 cheng2 zhen1！"

msgid ""
"At least I know that, when I arrive in Hell, I'll be in good company.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His finger tightens on the trigger. The breath catches in his throat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll see you soon, Hermie."
msgstr ""
"至少​我​知道​，​当​我​下​地狱​时​，​会​有人​陪​着​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​手指​紧扣​扳机​。​喉咙​里​哽住​了​气息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很快​就​能​见到​你​了​，​赫米​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3 wo3 zhi1dao4，dang1 wo3 xia4 di4yu4 shi2，hui4 you3ren2 pei2 zhao2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shou3zhi3 jin3kou4 ban1ji1。hou2long2 li3 geng3 zhu4 le5 qi4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 kuai4 jiu4 neng2 jian4dao4 ni3 le5，he4 mi3。"

msgid "At least I wasn't paying you."
msgstr ""
"至少​我​没有​付​你​钱​。\n"
"zhi4shao3 wo3 mei2you3 fu4 ni3 qian2。"

msgid "At least now we have a name to put to the face. Audran."
msgstr ""
"至少​我们​知道​那家伙​的​名字​了​。​奥​德兰​。\n"
"zhi4shao3 wo3men5 zhi1dao4 na4 jia1 huo3 de5 ming2zi5 le5。Ao4de2lan2。"

msgid ""
"At least you'll be alive. If I hadn't done what I did, the guy in that "
"apartment wouldn't be."
msgstr ""
"至少​你​能​活下去​。​如果​我​当时​没有​出手​的话​，​公寓​里​的​那家伙​已经​死​了​。\n"
"zhi4shao3 ni3 neng2 huo2xia4qu4。ru2guo3 wo3 dang1shi2 mei2you3 chu1shou3 de5hua4，gong1yu4 li3 de5 na4 jia1 huo3 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"At some point, after we're done with what we're doing, I'll look into this. I'll get to the truth, whatever it might be.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But I'm not going to do it today."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​手头​的​事​处理​完​，​我会​查​清楚​这件​事​。​无论​真相​是​什么​，​我​都​会​查个​水落石出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​不是​在​今天​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 shou3tou2 de5 shi4 chu3li3 wan2，wo3 hui4 cha2 qing1chu5 zhe4 jian4 shi4。wu2lun4 zhen1xiang4 shi4 shen2me5，wo3 dou1 hui4 cha2 ge4 shui3luo4shi2chu1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 bu4shi4 zai4 jin1tian1。"

msgid ""
"At that instant, all of the lights in the garage turn off. A few seconds later, the emergency lighting kicks in.\n"
"\n"
"If what Schmidt told you was true, you've just killed the main power for most of the building."
msgstr ""
"转瞬之间​，​车库里​的​所有​灯光​突然​熄灭​。​几秒钟​后​，​应急照明​系统启动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​施密特​所言非虚​，​那么​你​刚刚​切断​了​整栋​楼​大部分​区域​的​主​电源​。\n"
"\n"
"zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1，che1 ku4 li3 de5 suo3you3 deng1guang1 tu1ran2 xi1mie4。ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ying1 ji2 zhao4 ming2 xi4 tong3 qi3 dong4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 shi1mi4te4 suo3yan2fei1xu1，na4me5 ni3 gang1gang5 qie1duan4 le5 zheng3 dong4 lou2 da4bu4fen5 qu1yu4 de5 zhu3 dian4yuan2。"

msgid ""
"At that moment, the door behind you slides open.\n"
"\n"
"A trio of figures make their way into the room."
msgstr ""
"就​在​此时​，​你们​身后​的​门​滑开​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一行​三人​走进​了​房间​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 ci3shi2，ni3men5 shen1hou4 de5 men2 hua2 kai1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yi1xing2 san1 ren2 zou3jin4 le5 fang2jian1。"

msgid ""
"At the back of the binder, you find a note scrawled on a slip of scrap "
"paper."
msgstr ""
"在​活页夹​的​背面​，​你​发现​一张​废纸​上​潦草​地写​着​几行字​。\n"
"zai4 huo2 xie2 jia1 de5 bei4mian4，ni3 fa1xian4 yi1 zhang1 fei4zhi3 shang4 liao2cao3 de5 xie3 zhao2 ji1 xing2 zi4。"

msgid ""
"At the base of the controller panel, you find a cleverly-hidden input port. \n"
"\n"
"The port is shrouded in black plastic, and it appears to be the approximate shape of a typical credstick."
msgstr ""
"在​控制面板​底部​，​你​发现​了​一个​巧妙​隐藏​的​输入​端口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​端口​被​黑色​塑料​外壳​包裹​，​其​轮廓​近似于​标准​信用​棒​的​形状​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 di3bu4，ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1ge5 qiao3miao4 yin3cang2 de5 shu1ru4 duan1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"duan1kou3 bei4 hei1se4 su4liao4 wai4ke2 bao1guo3，qi2 lun2kuo4 jin4 si4 yu2 biao1zhun3 xin4yong4 bang4 de5 xing2zhuang4。"

msgid ""
"At the end of the day, the whole thing was pretty by-the-numbers. The rigger died, we got paid, and everyone went home happy.\n"
"\n"
"That's a win in my book."
msgstr ""
"总而言之​，​一切​都​按计划​顺利进行​。​机师​死​了​，​我们​拿到​了​报酬​，​大家​开开心心​回家​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​我​来说​，​这​就是​一场​胜利​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，yi1qie4 dou1 an4 ji4 hua2 shun4 li4 jin4 xing2。ji1shi1 si3 le5，wo3men5 na2dao4 le5 bao4chou5，da4jia1 kai1 kai1 xin1 xin1 hui2jia1。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 jiu4shi4 yi1 chang2 sheng4li4。"

msgid ""
"At the end of the duct, you find a maintenance panel. It was designed with a"
" big, chunky handle suitable for drone operation."
msgstr ""
"在​管道​末端​，​你​发现​了​一处​检修​面板​。​其​设计​配有​一个​粗壮​的​把手​，​专​为​无人机​操作​而设​。\n"
"zai4 guan3dao4 mo4duan1，ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 chu3 jian3xiu1 mian4ban3。qi2 she4ji4 pei4you3 yi1ge5 cu1zhuang4 de5 ba3shou3，zhuan1 wei2 wu2ren2ji1 cao1zuo4 er2 she4。"

msgid ""
"At the moment, it is impossible to remove the part without disabling the "
"terminal. The converter is required so that the signal the terminal sends "
"can be interpreted by the datajack of its user."
msgstr ""
"目前​无法​在​不让​终端​失效​的​情况​下移​除该​部件​。​若想​使​终端​发送​的​信号​被​用户端​数据​插口​正确​解读​，​转换器​就是​必需​的​。\n"
"mu4qian2 wu2fa3 zai4 bu4 rang4 zhong1duan1 shi1xiao4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 yi2 chu2 gai1 bu4jian4。ruo4 xiang3 shi3 zhong1duan1 fa1song4 de5 xin4hao4 bei4 yong4 hu4 duan1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 zheng4que4 jie3du2，zhuan3huan4qi4 jiu4shi4 bi4xu1 de5。"

msgid ""
"At the sound of the word \"free,\" the woman's eyes open wide, and she "
"presses her hands to the glass."
msgstr ""
"一​听到​“​自由​”​两个​字​，​女人​的​眼睛​突然​张大​，​双手​紧紧​按​在​玻璃​上​。\n"
"yi1 ting1dao4“zi4you2” liang3 ge4 zi4，nu:3ren2 de5 yan3jing5 tu1ran2 zhang1 dai4，shuang1shou3 jin3jin3 an4 zai4 bo1li5 shang4。"

msgid ""
"At the sound of your approach, the ork turns to face you. He wears a severe "
"expression, but there is kindness in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"听到​你​走近​，​兽​人​转过身​来​面对​你​。​他​表情​严肃​，​但​眼神​中​充满​善意​。\n"
"ting1dao4 ni3 zou3jin4，shou4 ren2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 mian4dui4 ni3。ta1 biao3qing2 yan2su4，dan4 yan3shen2 zhong4 chong1man3 shan4yi4。"

msgid ""
"At times we regretted staying on this side of the walls. But then we found "
"the Kreuzbasar, and we were home. (w)"
msgstr ""
"我们​当时​甚至​有些​后悔​留在​了​墙​的​这​一边​。​但​随后​我们​找到​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​也​终于​在​这里​安家​。\n"
"wo3men5 dang1shi2 shen4zhi4 you3xie1 hou4hui3 liu2 zai4 le5 qiang2 de5 zhe4 yi1bian1。dan4 sui2hou4 wo3men5 zhao3dao4 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，ye3 zhong1yu2 zai4 zhe4li3 an1jia1。"

msgid "Atlas"
msgstr ""
"阿特拉斯\n"
"a1te4la1si1"

msgid "Atlas Visual Testing Records"
msgstr ""
"“​阿特拉斯​”​视觉​测试​记录\n"
"“a1te4la1si1” shi4jue2 ce4shi4 ji4lu4"

msgid ""
"Atmosphere purged.\n"
"\n"
"No contaminents detected.\n"
"\n"
"Disengaging Lockdown."
msgstr ""
"空气​已​净化​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​检测​到​无​污染物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正在​解除​封锁​。\n"
"\n"
"kong1qi4 yi3 jing4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"jian3ce4 dao4 wu2 wu1ran3wu4。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4zai4 jie3chu2 feng1suo3。"

msgid "Attack"
msgstr ""
"攻击\n"
"gong1ji1"

msgid "Attack Program"
msgstr ""
"攻击​程序\n"
"gong1ji1 cheng2xu4"

msgid "Attack!"
msgstr ""
"攻击​！\n"
"gong1ji1！"

msgid "Attempt to read the entry."
msgstr ""
"尝试​阅读​条目​。\n"
"chang2shi4 yue4du2 tiao2mu4。"

msgid "Audran"
msgstr ""
"奥​德兰\n"
"Ao4de2lan2"

msgid ""
"Audran accepts the bottle back with a nod, then takes a long drink. When he finishes, he holds the bottle to the light.\n"
"\n"
"Gazing idly through the glass at the bronze liquor inside, a wistful expression crosses his face."
msgstr ""
"奥​德兰​点点头​，​接过​酒瓶​长​啜​一口​。​喝完​后​，​他​举起​酒瓶​迎着​光线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​漫不经心​地​透过​玻璃​观察​瓶​中​青铜色​的​酒液​，​脸上​掠过​一丝​怅然​神色​。\n"
"\n"
"Ao4de2lan2 dian3 dian3 tou2，jie1guo4 jiu3 ping2 zhang3 chuo4 yi1kou3。he4 wan2 hou4，ta1 ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2 ying2 zhao2 guang1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 tou4guo4 bo1li5 guan1cha2 ping2 zhong4 qing1 tong2 se4 de5 jiu3 ye4，lian3 shang4 lu:e4guo4 yi1 si1 chang4ran2 shen2se4。"

msgid ""
"Audran might have spent some time in the SOX. That radiation poisoning "
"didn't happen on its own."
msgstr ""
"奥​德兰​应该​在​萨洛​卢区​待​过​一段时间​，​不然​不​可能​平白无故​辐射​中毒​。\n"
"Ao4de2lan2 ying1gai1 zai4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 dai1 guo4 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1，bu4ran2 bu4 ke3neng2 ping2bai2wu2gu4 fu2she4 zhong4du2。"

msgid ""
"Audran raises his green bottle to his own lips and takes a long drink. When he finishes, he holds the bottle to the light.\n"
"\n"
"Gazing idly through the glass at the bronze liquor inside, a wistful expression crosses his face."
msgstr ""
"奥​德兰​举起​绿​酒瓶​长​啜​一口​。​喝完​后​，​他​举起​酒瓶​迎着​光线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​漫不经心​地​透过​玻璃​观察​瓶​中​青铜色​的​酒液​，​脸上​掠过​一丝​怅然​神色​。\n"
"\n"
"Ao4de2lan2 ju3qi3 lu:4 jiu3 ping2 zhang3 chuo4 yi1kou3。he4 wan2 hou4，ta1 ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2 ying2 zhao2 guang1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 tou4guo4 bo1li5 guan1cha2 ping2 zhong4 qing1 tong2 se4 de5 jiu3 ye4，lian3 shang4 lu:e4guo4 yi1 si1 chang4ran2 shen2se4。"

msgid "Audran said that you offered him treasure."
msgstr ""
