msgid ""
"Audran's eyes go wide as you reach for his weapon. He tries to bat your hands away, but a wave of coughing sends him into a fit. A bloody mist fills the air.\n"
"\n"
"You level the weapon, and he thrashes in panic."
msgstr ""
"你​伸手​去​拿​奥​德兰​的​武器​时​，​他​的​眼睛​突然​睁​大​。​他​试图​挥开​你​的​手​，​但​一阵​剧烈​的​咳嗽​让​他​陷入​了​痉挛​。​空气​中​弥漫着​血雾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​举起​武器​，​他​惊慌失措​地​扭动​着​身体​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shen1shou3 qu4 na2 Ao4de2lan2 de5 wu3qi4 shi2，ta1 de5 yan3jing5 tu1ran2 zheng1 dai4。ta1 shi4tu2 hui1 kai1 ni3 de5 shou3，dan4 yi1zhen4 ju4lie4 de5 ke2sou5 rang4 ta1 xian4ru4 le5 jing4luan2。kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 xie3 wu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ju3qi3 wu3qi4，ta1 jing1huang1shi1cuo4 de5 niu3 dong4 zhao2 shen1ti3。"

msgid ""
"Audran's injuries were extensive. He had two broken ribs and a shattered pelvis, and he had sustained third degree burns over sixty percent of his body.\n"
"\n"
"Most damningly of all, he was suffering from acute radiation poisoning. His body had absorbed over 5,000 millisieverts of ionizing radiation... a lethal dose without treatment. "
msgstr ""
"奥​德兰​的​伤势​很​严重​。​他断​了​两根​肋骨​，​骨盆​碎裂​，​全身​百分之六十​的​面积​遭受​三度​烧伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​更​要命​的​是​，​他​还​患有​急性​辐射​中毒​。​他​的​身体​吸收​了​超过​5000​毫西​弗​的​电离辐射​……​是​足以​致命​的​剂量​。\n"
"\n"
"Ao4de2lan2 de5 shang1shi4 hen3 yan2zhong4。ta1 duan4 le5 liang3 gen1 lei4gu3，gu3pen2 sui4lie4，quan2shen1 bai3 fen4 zhi1 liu4 shi2 de5 mian4ji1 zao1shou4 san1du4 shao1shang1。\n"
"\n"
"geng1 yao4ming4 de5 shi4，ta1 hai2 huan4you3 ji2xing4 fu2she4 zhong4du2。ta1 de5 shen1ti3 xi1shou1 le5 chao1guo4 5000 hao2 xi1 fu2 de5 dian4li2fu2she4……shi4 zu2yi3 zhi4ming4 de5 ji4liang4。"

msgid ""
"Audran.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair looks up at the ork. His voice trembles slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
