msgid ""
"Awakening. Eyes opening for the first time in… an age. The spectrum of "
"colors is beautiful - broader than humanity can imagine. Astral and physical"
" space are one to you and the green is alive, waiting to show you its growth"
" during your long sleep."
msgstr ""
"大​觉醒​。​双眼​在​……​漫长​的​岁月​后​首次​睁开​。​色彩​的​谱系​美不胜收​—​—​其​广度​远超​人类​的​想象​。​星界​与​现界​在​你​眼中​合二为一​，​而​那片​绿色​生机勃勃​，​正等待​着​在​你​长眠​期间​向​你​展现​它​的​成长​。\n"
"dai4 jue2xing3。shuang1yan3 zai4……man4chang2 de5 sui4yue4 hou4 shou3ci4 zheng1kai1。se4cai3 de5 pu3xi4 mei3bu4sheng4shou1——qi2 guang3du4 yuan3chao1 ren2lei4 de5 xiang3xiang4。xing1 jie4 yu4 xian4 jie4 zai4 ni3 yan3zhong1 ge3 er4 wei2 yi1，er2 na4 pian1 lu:4se4 sheng1ji1bo2bo2，zheng1 deng3 dai1 zhao2 zai4 ni3 chang2mian2 qi1jian1 xiang4 ni3 zhan3xian4 ta1 de5 cheng2zhang3。"

msgid ""
"Awesome! Unfortunately, there aren’t a lot of options here: they’ve got beer, a home-brewed gin, and schnaps. Pick your poison. \n"
"\n"
"I’ve been drinking gin and tonics - the tonic cuts out some of the gas flavor. I think they’ve been distilling in old propane tanks. Yech."
