msgid ""
"Aztechnology. A giant in the worlds of technological and magical research. One of the most powerful - and feared - corporations on the planet. There are very few places in this world that the tendrils of Aztechnology cannot reach.\n"
"\n"
"Germany is no exception. The black glass edifice of an Azzie pyramid dominates the courtyard of the Zitadelle Spandau. And countless other, more innocuous facilities can be found all over Berlin.\n"
"\n"
"The lab that they maintain in the Jewühl District is one of these. According to your client, the project that the Azzies are working on here is dangerous. \n"
"\n"
"So dangerous that she's paying you to bring the entire building down."
msgstr ""
"阿兹特​科技​是​科技​与​魔法​研究​领域​的​巨头​，​也​是​地球​上​最​强大​、​最​令人​恐惧​的​公司​之一​。​世间​鲜有​阿兹特​科技​的​触手​无法​抵达​之​处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​德国​也​不​例外​。​阿兹佬​那​金字塔​形​的​黑色​玻璃​大厦​俯瞰​着施​潘道​城堡​的​庭院​，​还有​无数​相对​不起眼​的​设施​遍布​柏林​各处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​在​耶沃​于尔区​运作​的​实验室​就是​其中​之一​。​据​你​的​客户​所​言​，​阿兹佬​在​这里​进行​的​项目​很​危险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​危险​到​她​不惜重金​也​要​雇佣​你​摧毁​整栋​建筑​。\n"
"\n"
"E1zi1te4ke1ji4 shi4 ke1ji4 yu4 mo2fa3 yan2jiu1 ling3yu4 de5 ju4tou2，ye3 shi4 di4qiu2 shang4 zui4 qiang2da4、zui4 ling4ren2 kong3ju4 de5 gong1si1 zhi1yi1。shi4jian1 xian1 you3 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 chu4shou3 wu2fa3 di3da2 zhi1 chu3。\n"
"\n"
"de2guo2 ye3 bu4 li4wai4。e1 zi1 lao3 na4 jin1zi4ta3 xing2 de5 hei1se4 bo1li5 da4sha4 fu3kan4 zhao2 shi1 pan1 dao4 cheng2bao3 de5 ting2yuan4，hai2you3 wu2shu4 xiang1dui4 bu4qi3yan3 de5 she4shi1 bian4bu4 bo2lin2 ge4chu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 ye1 wo4 yu2 er3 qu1 yun4zuo4 de5 shi2yan4shi4 jiu4shi4 qi2zhong1 zhi1yi1。ju4 ni3 de5 ke4hu4 suo3 yan2，e1 zi1 lao3 zai4 zhe4li3 jin4xing2 de5 xiang4mu4 hen3 wei1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"wei1xian3 dao4 ta1 bu4 xi1 chong2 jin1 ye3 yao4 gu4yong1 ni3 cui1hui3 zheng3 dong4 jian4zhu4。"

