msgid ""
"BE FREE. Be free in all things, and experience that freedom with your whole being - body, mind, and spirit.\n"
"\n"
"Discard the oppressive traditions of modesty and shame that you've been indoctrinated with since birth - the Free Thinker has no use for them.\n"
"\n"
"Your body is a source of pride, of  pleasure, and of succor, for yourself and for others. Enjoy it, and share that joy freely with those who desire it."
msgstr ""
"自由​。​在​所有​事情​上​都​要​自由​，​用​你​的​整个​身心​和​精神​来​体验​这种​自由​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​摒弃​从​出生​起​就​被​灌输​的​谦虚​和​羞耻​的​压迫​性​传统​—​—​它们​对​自由​思想者​毫无用处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​身体​是​骄傲​的​源泉​，​是​快乐​的​源泉​，​也​是​帮助​你​自己​和​他人​的​源泉​。​享受​它​，​并​与​渴望​它​的​人​自由​分享​这份​快乐​。\n"
"\n"
"zi4you2。zai4 suo3you3 shi4qing5 shang4 dou1 yao4 zi4you2，yong4 ni3 de5 zheng3ge4 shen1xin1 he4 jing1shen2 lai2 ti3yan4 zhe4zhong3 zi4you2。\n"
"\n"
"bing4qi4 cong2 chu1sheng1 qi3 jiu4 bei4 guan4shu1 de5 qian1xu1 he4 xiu1chi3 de5 ya1po4 xing4 chuan2tong3——ta1men5 dui4 zi4you2 si1 xiang3 zhe3 hao2 wu2 yong4 chu3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 shen1ti3 shi4 jiao1ao4 de5 yuan2quan2，shi4 kuai4le4 de5 yuan2quan2，ye3 shi4 bang1zhu4 ni3 zi4ji3 he4 ta1ren2 de5 yuan2quan2。xiang3shou4 ta1，bing4 yu4 ke3wang4 ta1 de5 ren2 zi4you2 fen1xiang3 zhe4 fen4 kuai4le4。"

msgid ""
"BE FREE. Be free in all things, and experience that freedom with your whole being - body, mind, and spirit.\n"
"\n"
"Discard the oppressive traditions of modesty and shame that you've been indoctrinated with since birth - the Free Thinker has no use for them.\n"
"\n"
"Your body is a source of pride, of pleasure, and of succor, for yourself and for others. Enjoy it, and share that joy freely with those who desire it."
msgstr ""
"自由​。​在​一切​事物​中​自由自在​，​用​你​的​整个​身体​、​内心​和​精神​来​体验​这种​自由​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​摒弃​那些​自​出生​起​就​被​灌输​的​压抑​传统​和​关于​矜持​与​羞耻​的​教条​—​—​它们​对​自由​思想者​毫无用处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​身体​是​自豪​的​源泉​，​是​愉悦​的​源泉​，​是​慰藉​的​源泉​。​既​滋养​自己​，​也​抚慰​他人​。​尽情​享受​它​，​并​将​这份​喜悦​自由​地​分享​给​渴求​之​人​。\n"
"\n"
"zi4you2。zai4 yi1qie4 shi4wu4 zhong4 zi4you2zi4zai4，yong4 ni3 de5 zheng3ge4 shen1ti3、nei4xin1 he4 jing1shen2 lai2 ti3yan4 zhe4zhong3 zi4you2。\n"
"\n"
"bing4qi4 na4xie1 zi4 chu1sheng1 qi3 jiu4 bei4 guan4shu1 de5 ya1yi4 chuan2tong3 he4 guan1yu2 jin1chi2 yu4 xiu1chi3 de5 jiao4tiao2——ta1men5 dui4 zi4you2 si1 xiang3 zhe3 hao2 wu2 yong4 chu3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 shen1ti3 shi4 zi4hao2 de5 yuan2quan2，shi4 yu2yue4 de5 yuan2quan2，shi4 wei4jie4 de5 yuan2quan2。ji4 zi1yang3 zi4ji3，ye3 fu3wei4 ta1ren2。jin4qing2 xiang3shou4 ta1，bing4 jiang1 zhe4 fen4 xi3yue4 zi4you2 de5 fen1xiang3 gei3 ke3qiu2 zhi1 ren2。"

msgid ""
"BE SELFISH. Don't enslave yourself to others at the expense of your own happiness. Take what you want, and do so unashamedly.\n"
"\n"
"Our desires are an important part of what makes us human. Society has trained us to hide that part of ourselves from the world, but the Free Living person doesn't cower in the shadows. Own your desires, and rejoice in them.\n"
"\n"
"Selflessness is ultimately dishonest, and dishonesty has no place in a free society."
msgstr ""
"自私​。​不要​为了​取悦​他人​而​牺牲​自己​的​幸福​。​对​你​想要​的​东西​予取予求​，​并且​不要​为此​感到​羞耻​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​欲望​是​人性​中​不可或缺​的​部分​。​社会​教导​我们​向​世界​隐藏​这部分​自我​，​但​自由​生活​者​不会​蜷缩​在​阴影​里​。​拥抱​你​的​欲望​，​并​为​之​欢欣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无私​终究​是​虚伪​的​，​而​虚伪​在​自由​社会​中​毫无​立足之地​。\n"
"\n"
"zi4si1。bu4yao4 wei4le5 qu3yue4 ta1ren2 er2 xi1sheng1 zi4ji3 de5 xing4fu2。dui4 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 dong1xi1 yu3 qu3 yu3 qiu2，bing4qie3 bu4yao4 wei4ci3 gan3dao4 xiu1chi3。\n"
"\n"
"yu4wang4 shi4 ren2xing4 zhong4 bu4ke3huo4que1 de5 bu4fen5。she4hui4 jiao4dao3 wo3men5 xiang4 shi4jie4 yin3cang2 zhe4 bu4 fen4 zi4wo3，dan4 zi4you2 sheng1huo2 zhe3 bu4hui4 quan2suo1 zai4 yin1ying3 li3。yong1bao4 ni3 de5 yu4wang4，bing4 wei2 zhi1 huan1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"wu2si1 zhong1jiu1 shi4 xu1wei3 de5，er2 xu1wei3 zai4 zi4you2 she4hui4 zhong4 hao2wu2 li4 ju4 zhi1 de5。"

msgid ""
"BECAUSE VAUCLAIR IS CORRECT. DRAGONS ARE A THREAT THAT CANNOT BE IGNORED."
msgstr ""
"因为​沃​克莱尔​是​正确​的​。​巨龙​是​无法​忽视​的​威胁​。\n"
"yin1wei4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 shi4 zheng4que4 de5。ju4long2 shi4 wu2fa3 hu1shi4 de5 wei1xie2。"

msgid "BENEATH THE KREUZBASAR"
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​之下\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi1xia4"

msgid ""
"BEWARE YOUR TONGUE LITTLE $++(l.race)\n"
"\n"
"IT WILL BE YOUR UNDOING"
msgstr ""
"说话​注意​点​小​$++(l.race)​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​你​没有​好下场\n"
"\n"
"shuo1hua4 zhu4yi4 dian3 xiao3 $++(l.race) \n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2 ni3 mei2you3 hao3 xia4 chang2"

msgid "BLOODLINE"
msgstr ""
"血脉\n"
"xue4mai4"

msgid "Bachmeier"
msgstr ""
"巴赫​迈尔\n"
"ba1he4 mai4 er3"

msgid ""
"Bachmeier.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The voice bleats out from Amsel's speakers, filling the room.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Audran here. What's your status?"
msgstr ""
"巴赫​迈尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​扬声器​传出​的​声音​带有​一丝​不满​，​在​整个​房间​回荡​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​奥​德兰​，​你​那边​情况​如何​？\n"
"\n"
"ba1he4 mai4 er3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 chuan2chu1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4you3 yi1 si1 bu4man3，zai4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1 hui2dang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 Ao4de2lan2，ni3 na4bian5 qing2kuang4 ru2he2？"

msgid "Back"
msgstr ""
"返回\n"
"fan3hui2"

msgid "Back again?"
msgstr ""
"又​回来​了​吗​？\n"
"you4 hui2lai5 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Back before I emigrated here from my native Spain, I worked in partnership with a Berlin-based R&D lab. The biotech that they were developing was very hush-hush, very cutting edge.\n"
"\n"
"Our arrangement was that I would bankroll their research, and that they, in turn, would provide me with unique merchandise to sell in my clinics."
msgstr ""
"在​我​从​祖国​西班牙​移民​到​这里​之前​，​我​曾​与​柏林​的​一家​研发​实验室​合作​。​他们​研发​的​生物科技​非常​秘密​，​也​非常​尖端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​的​合作​方式​是​，​我​为​他们​的​研究​提供​资金​，​而​他们​则​为​我​提供​独特​的​商品​，​在​我​的​多家​诊所​里​销售​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 cong2 zu3guo2 xi1ban1ya2 yi2min2 dao4 zhe4li3 zhi1qian2，wo3 ceng2 yu4 bo2lin2 de5 yi1jia1 yan2fa1 shi2yan4shi4 he2zuo4。ta1men5 yan2fa1 de5 sheng1wu4ke1ji4 fei1chang2 mi4mi4，ye3 fei1chang2 jian1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 he2zuo4 fang1shi4 shi4，wo3 wei2 ta1men5 de5 yan2jiu1 ti2gong1 zi1jin1，er2 ta1men5 ze2 wei2 wo3 ti2gong1 du2te4 de5 shang1pin3，zai4 wo3 de5 duo1 jia1 zhen3suo3 li3 xiao1shou4。"

msgid ""
"Back before I ran away, Feuerstelle was nothing more than a cult of "
"personality that revolved around Harrow. He didn't need magical help to keep"
" us here - we loved him, and we believed in his message. He created the "
"shrine as an insurance policy."
msgstr ""
"在​我​逃离​之前​，​“​火坑​”​不过​是​围绕​哈罗​建立​的​个人崇拜​。​他​无需​魔法​手段​就​能​将​我们​束缚​在​此​—​—​我们​深爱着​他​，​坚信​他​的​教义​。​他​建造​了​那个​神龛​，​不过​是​为​自己​多留​一份​保险​。\n"
"zai4 wo3 tao2li2 zhi1qian2，“huo3keng1” bu4guo4 shi4 wei2rao4 ha1luo2 jian4li4 de5 ge4ren2chong2bai4。ta1 wu2xu1 mo2fa3 shou3duan4 jiu4 neng2 jiang1 wo3men5 shu4fu4 zai4 ci3——wo3men5 shen1 ai4 zhao2 ta1，jian1xin4 ta1 de5 jiao4yi4。ta1 jian4zao4 le5 na4ge5 shen2kan1，bu4guo4 shi4 wei2 zi4ji3 duo1 liu2 yi1 fen4 bao3xian3。"

msgid ""
"Back down? Back *down?!* You have invaded my home, $(scene.badfantasy)!\n"
"\n"
"My peasantry lies dead at your hands! As a matter of honor, I must confront you!"
msgstr ""
"让​我​退下​？​*​退​下​*​？​！​是​你​入侵​了​我​的​家园​，​$(scene.badfantasy)​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​臣民​死​在​你​手里​！​事关​荣誉​，​我​必须​与​你​对抗​！\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 tui4xia4？*tui4 xia4*？！shi4 ni3 ru4qin1 le5 wo3 de5 jia1yuan2，$(scene.badfantasy)！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 chen2min2 si3 zai4 ni3 shou3li3！shi4guan1 rong2yu4，wo3 bi4xu1 yu4 ni3 dui4kang4！"

msgid "Back home, with the Finnish Defence Force. Jaeger Brigade. "
msgstr ""
"我​在​家乡​入伍​，​加入​了​芬兰国防军​的​猎兵​旅​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 jia1xiang1 ru4wu3，jia1ru4 le5 fen1 lan2 guo2 fang2 jun1 de5 lie4 bing1 lu:3。"

msgid ""
"Back in my lab, Dr. Hansen is still staring.\n"
"\n"
"\"You need to get the word out about this, Liz,\" he tells me. \"I'll back you. The community needs to know.\"\n"
"\n"
"He's right, of course. We, as a community, need to pool our resources to find a way to reverse this trend. And we need to do it quickly."
msgstr ""
"在​我​的​实验室​中​，​汉森​博士​仍​在​凝视着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​丽兹​，​你​必须​让​大家​知道​这件​事​，​”​他​对​我​说​，​“​我会​支持​你​。​整个​科学界​需要​了解​真相​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​说​的​没错​。​我们​这个​科学界​需要​汇聚​力量​，​找到​扭转局势​的​方法​。​而且​必须​火速​行动​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 de5 shi2yan4shi4 zhong4，han4sen1 bo2shi4 reng2 zai4 ning2 shi4 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"“li2 zi1，ni3 bi4xu1 rang4 da4jia1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4，” ta1 dui4 wo3 shuo1，“wo3 hui4 zhi1chi2 ni3。zheng3ge4 ke1xue2jie4 xu1yao4 liao3jie3 zhen1xiang4。” \n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de5 mei2cuo4。wo3men5 zhe4ge5 ke1xue2jie4 xu1yao4 hui4ju4 li4liang5，zhao3dao4 niu3 zhuai3 ju2 shi4 de5 fang1fa3。er2qie3 bi4xu1 huo3su4 xing2dong4。"

msgid ""
"Back when I lived here, Harrow would never have let such a fresh convert "
"prepare a sacrifice. He'd wait until she was in so deep - until she felt so "
"*indebted* to him  - that she *couldn't* turn tail and run."
msgstr ""
"要是​在​以前​，​哈罗​绝不会​让​这种​新人​准备​祭品​。​他会​等到​对方​陷得够​深​，​直到​感觉​自己​*​亏欠​*​他​，​根本​*​无法​*​抽身​逃跑​。\n"
"yao4shi5 zai4 yi3qian2，ha1luo2 jue2 bu4 hui4 rang4 zhe4zhong3 xin1ren2 zhun3bei4 ji4pin3。ta1 hui4 deng3dao4 dui4fang1 xian4 de2 gou4 shen1，zhi2dao4 gan3jue2 zi4ji3*kui1qian4*ta1，gen1ben3*wu2fa3*chou1shen1 tao2pao3。"

msgid ""
"Back when I lived here, I would have, too.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All that we've done is trade two innocent lives for one."
msgstr ""
"我​还​待​在​这里​的​时候​，​也​会​做​同样​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过​头去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​救​了​一个​人​，​代价​则​是​两条​无辜​的​性命​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 shi2hou5，ye3 hui4 zuo4 tong2yang4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jiu4 le5 yi1ge5 ren2，dai4jia4 ze2 shi4 liang3 tiao2 wu2gu1 de5 xing4ming4。"

msgid ""
"Back when I was in basic training, a fellow recruit made a vulgar joke at my expense. He said that I reminded him of the north face of the Eiger, in the Bernese Alps. \"Huge, and beautiful, but dangerous to climb.\"\n"
"\n"
"His tone left little doubt as to what sort of \"climbing\" he had in mind."
msgstr ""
"我​在​新兵训练​营时​，​有个​同营​的​人​对​着​我​开​黄腔​。​他​说​自己​一​看到​我​，​就​想起​伯尔尼​山​的​艾​格尔峰​北壁​—​—​“​又​大​又​美​，​但​想​登上​去​可不​容易​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​他​口中​的​“​登​”​是​什么​意思​，​听​他​的​口气​就​能​猜个​八九不离十​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 xin1 bing1 xun4 lian4 ying2 shi2，you3 ge4 tong2 ying2 de5 ren2 dui4 zhao2 wo3 kai1 huang2qiang1。ta1 shuo1 zi4ji3 yi1 kan4dao4 wo3，jiu4 xiang3qi3 bo2er3ni2 shan1 de5 Ai4ge2er3 feng1 bei3 bi4——“you4 dai4 you4 mei3，dan4 xiang3 deng1shang4 qu4 ke3bu5 rong2yi4。” \n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 ta1 kou3 zhong4 de5“deng1” shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5，ting1 ta1 de5 kou3qi4 jiu4 neng2 cai1 ge4 ba1jiu3bu4li2shi2。"

msgid ""
"Back when we took on Humanis, you said that you fought in the Night of Rage."
" I'd like to hear more about that."
msgstr ""
"咱们​对付​人类​至上​主义者​的​时候​，​你​说​你​曾​在​“​愤怒​之夜​”​战斗​过​。​能​不能​给​我​细说​一下​？\n"
"zan2men5 dui4fu5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 shuo1 ni3 ceng2 zai4“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” zhan4dou4 guo4。neng2 bu4neng2 gei3 wo3 xi4shuo1 yi1xia4？"

msgid ""
"Bad guys. I mean, like, *real* bad guys.\n"
"\n"
"The gang that used to run this place wasn't all bad... They kept the cram flowing, and the prices weren't too high. They never hassled me as long as I kept buying.\n"
"\n"
"The new guys killed 'em all when they took over. Now I'm stuck dealing with assholes like Kroner."
msgstr ""
"坏人​。​我​是​说​，​*​特别​*​坏​的​那种​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​之前​管​这​地方​的​黑帮​还​没​那么​坏​……​药​一直​有​货​，​价格​也​不是​很​离谱​。​只要​我​还​在​买药​，​他们​就​从来不​会​找​我​麻烦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​新来​的​这帮​人​抢​地盘​的​时候​，​把​他们​全杀​了​。​现在​我​只能​跟克​罗纳​这种​混账​打交道​。\n"
"\n"
"huai4ren2。wo3 shi4 shuo1，*te4bie2*huai4 de5 na4zhong3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi1qian2 guan3 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 hei1bang1 hai2 mei2 na4me5 huai4……yao4 yi1zhi2 you3 huo4，jia4ge2 ye3 bu4shi4 hen3 li2pu3。zhi3yao4 wo3 hai2 zai4 mai3 yao4，ta1men5 jiu4 cong2lai2bu4 hui4 zhao3 wo3 ma2fan5。\n"
"\n"
"xin1 lai2 de5 zhe4 bang1 ren2 qiang3 di4pan2 de5 shi2hou5，ba3 ta1men5 quan2 sha1 le5。xian4zai4 wo3 zhi3neng2 gen1 ke4 luo2na4 zhe4zhong3 hun4zhang4 da3jiao1dao4。"

msgid "Bad idea, Glory. I don't trust this thing."
msgstr ""
"这​是​个​坏主意​，​格洛丽​。​我​不​相信​这​东西​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4 huai4 zhu3 yi4，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 zhe4 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Bad luck, Dietrich. That's all it was."
msgstr ""
"时运不济​罢了​，​迪​特里​希​。​仅此而已​。\n"
"shi2yun4bu4ji4 ba4le5，Di2te4li3xi1。jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid "Bad news, Blitz. That Mystery Box of yours is no more."
msgstr ""
"坏消息​，​布里​茨​。​你​的​那个​谜​匣​不能​要​了​。\n"
"huai4 xiao1 xi1，Bu4li3ci2。ni3 de5 na4ge5 mei4 xia2 bu4neng2 yao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Bad news, my friend... somebody is hunting us. They set up an ambush on the "
"U-Bahn line."
msgstr ""
"坏消息​，​我​的​朋友​……​有人​在​追杀​我们​，​他们​在​地铁线​路上​设置​了​埋伏​。\n"
"huai4 xiao1 xi1，wo3 de5 peng2you5……you3ren2 zai4 zhui1sha1 wo3men5，ta1men5 zai4 de5 tie3 xian4 lu4shang5 she4zhi4 le5 mai2fu2。"

msgid ""
"Badass, huh?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich smiles wryly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, then I *know* that we did the right thing. Come on, boss... let's get out of here."
msgstr ""
"够​狠​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​苦笑​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​我​*​知道​*​我们​做​了​正确​的​事​。​走​吧​老大​……​我们​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"gou4 hen3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ku3xiao4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3*zhi1dao4*wo3men5 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。zou3 ba1 lao3da4……wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid "Ball Lightning I"
msgstr ""
"闪电​球​I\n"
"shan3dian4 qiu2 I"

msgid "Ball Lightning II"
msgstr ""
"闪电​球​II\n"
"shan3dian4 qiu2 II"

msgid "Ballistic Cloth Suit"
msgstr ""
"防弹​西装\n"
"fang2dan4 xi1zhuang1"

msgid "Banish Spirit?"
msgstr ""
"放逐​精魂​？\n"
"fang4zhu2 jing1hun2？"

msgid "Bannik"
msgstr ""
"班尼克\n"
"ban1 ni2 ke4"

msgid ""
