msgid ""
"Basic yet powerful metal machine replacement for your leg. Adds +8 HP and +1"
" Quickness."
msgstr ""
"基础​型号​，​但​功能强大​的​合金​机械​腿部​替换​件​。​提供​+​8​生命​值​与​+​1​敏捷​。\n"
"ji1chu3 xing2hao4，dan4 gong1 neng2 jiang4 dai4 de5 he2jin1 ji1xie4 tui3bu4 ti4huan4 jian4。ti2gong1 +8 sheng1ming4 zhi2 yu4 +1 min3jie2。"

msgid ""
"Basically, what you have here is a crystalline version of the methamphetamine \"Cram\" which is popular in some neighboring kiez. It hasn't caught on around the Kreuzbasar quite yet though.\n"
"\n"
"These crystals were ground into a fine dust, then it was cut with powdered sugar, and what appears to be a polycarbonate \"glitter\". I would imagine that when the drug is administered, the glitter would open micro-lacerations in the skin, allowing the drug's effects to be felt more rapidly."
msgstr ""
"简单​来说​，​这​东西​是​甲基苯丙胺​“​超感​”​的​结晶体​，​在​一些​邻近地区​很​流行​。​不过​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​还​没​怎么​出现​过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​晶体​被​研磨​成​细小​的​粉末​，​然后​混入​糖粉​和​一种​看似​聚碳酸酯​的​“​闪粉​”​进行​稀释​。​我​估计​在​用药​时​，​闪粉​会​在​皮肤​上​割开​微小​的​裂口​，​从而​更​快感​受到​药效​。\n"
"\n"
"jian3dan1 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 dong1xi1 shi4 jia3ji1ben3bing3an4“chao1 gan3” de5 jie2jing1ti3，zai4 yi1xie1 lin2 jin4 de5 qu1 hen3 liu2xing2。bu4guo4 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 hai2 mei2 zen3me5 chu1xian4 guo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 jing1ti3 bei4 yan2mo2 cheng2 xi4xiao3 de5 fen3mo4，ran2hou4 hun4ru4 tang2fen3 he4 yi1zhong3 kan4si4 ju4tan4suan1zhi3 de5“shan3 fen3” jin4xing2 xi1shi4。wo3 gu1ji4 zai4 yong4 yao4 shi2，shan3 fen3 hui4 zai4 pi2fu1 shang4 ge1 kai1 wei1xiao3 de5 lie4kou3，cong2er2 geng1 kuai4gan3 shou4dao4 yao4xiao4。"

msgid "Basics"
msgstr ""
"基础\n"
"ji1chu3"

msgid "Basilisk"
msgstr ""
"蛇怪\n"
"she2 guai4"

msgid ""
"Bastard came at me with a knife.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger wipes her mouth with the back of her hand.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Under the circumstances, maintaining my personal cleanliness wasn't a top priority."
msgstr ""
"有个​杂种​拿​刀​朝​我​扑​了​过来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔用​手背​擦​了​擦​嘴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​考虑​到​当时​的​情况​，​我​也​顾不上​保持​个人卫生​了​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ge4 za2zhong3 na2 dao1 chao2 wo3 pu1 le5 guo4lai2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yong4 shou3bei4 ca1 le5 ca1 zui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 dang1shi2 de5 qing2kuang4，wo3 ye3 gu4bu5shang4 bao3chi2 ge4 ren2 wei4 sheng1 le5。"

msgid "Bastard made a liar of me, when I beat him with my crutch."
msgstr ""
"那​混蛋​害得​我成​了​骗子​—​—​当​我​抄起​拐杖​突然​打​他​的​时候​。\n"
"na4 hun2dan4 hai4de5 wo3 cheng2 le5 pian4zi5——dang1 wo3 chao1 qi3 guai3zhang4 tu1ran2 da3 ta1 de5 shi2hou5。"

msgid "Bastard!"
msgstr ""
