"wei4sheng1jian1"

msgid "Battle Hardened"
msgstr ""
"身经百战\n"
"shen1jing1bai3zhan4"

msgid "Bauer"
msgstr ""
"鲍尔\n"
"bao4 er3"

msgid ""
"Be careful how you label such a creature. A Great Dragon is not a mindless animal. \n"
"\n"
"What motivates a being such as her?"
msgstr ""
"可​不要​随随便便​对​这样​的​生物​擅下​定论​。​巨龙​并非​心智​低下​的​动物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​像​她​这样​的​存在​，​会受​什么​驱使​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"ke3 bu4yao4 sui2 sui2 bian4 bian4 dui4 zhe4yang4 de5 sheng1wu4 shan4 xia4 ding4lun4。ju4long2 bing4fei1 xin1zhi4 di1xia4 de5 dong4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 ta1 zhe4yang4 de5 cun2zai4，hui4 shou4 shen2me5 qu1shi3 ni2？"

