msgstr ""
"要​小心​，​保罗​。​别忘了​莫妮卡​的​下场​。\n"
"yao4 xiao3xin1，bao3luo2。bie4 wang4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 xia4chang3。"

msgid ""
"Be cool, Dietrich. It isn't moving. I think that it's... I dunno, on standby or something.\n"
"\n"
"The lights are on, but nobody's home."
msgstr ""
"别慌​，​迪​特里​希​。​它​没有​要动​的​意思​。​我​看​它​是​……​处于​某种​待机​状态​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​好像​开着机​，​不过​程序​没跑​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 huang1，Di2te4li3xi1。ta1 mei2you3 yao4 dong4 de5 yi4si5。wo3 kan4 ta1 shi4……chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 kai1 zhao2 ji1，bu4guo4 cheng2xu4 mei2 pao2 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"Be cool, Eiger. It isn't moving. I think that it's... I dunno, on standby or something.\n"
"\n"
"The lights are on, but nobody's home."
msgstr ""
"别慌​，​艾格尔​。​它​没有​要动​的​意思​。​我​看​它​是​……​处于​某种​待机​状态​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​好像​开着机​，​不过​程序​没跑​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 huang1，Ai4ge2er3。ta1 mei2you3 yao4 dong4 de5 yi4si5。wo3 kan4 ta1 shi4……chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 kai1 zhao2 ji1，bu4guo4 cheng2xu4 mei2 pao2 qi3lai5。"

