"bie4 huang1，ta1 mei2you3 yao4 dong4 de5 yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"Be my guest, it's your drone.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else that you want?"
msgstr ""
"随便​，​反正​这​是​你​的​无人机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​什么​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4，fan3zheng4 zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 wu2ren2ji1。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Be my guest."
msgstr ""
"你​请​自便​。\n"
"ni3 qing3 zi4bian4。"

