msgstr ""
"随你便​。​不过​先​让​我​检查​下​控制台​。\n"
"sui2 ni3 bian4。bu4guo4 xian1 rang4 wo3 jian3cha2 xia4 kong4zhi4tai2。"

msgid ""
"Be on your guard. The connection between this compound and... wherever we "
"were... is breaking down. As that place disintegrates, more and more things "
"are spilling through."
msgstr ""
"提高警惕​。​这座​建筑​与​……​我们​在​的​地方​……​的​连接​正在​崩溃​。​随着​那片​区域​的​瓦解​，​越来越​多​的​东西​正​涌入​现实​。\n"
"ti2 gao1 jing3 ti4。zhe4 zuo4 jian4zhu4 yu4……wo3men5 zai4 de5 di4fang1……de5 lian2jie1 zheng4zai4 beng1kui4。sui2zhe5 na4 pian1 qu1yu4 de5 wa3jie3，yue4lai2yue4 duo1 de5 dong1xi1 zheng1 yong3ru4 xian4shi2。"

msgid ""
"Be patient, $(l.name). The explanation for that is coming. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A look of unease flits across her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not sure that you're going to like it, though."
msgstr ""
"耐心​点​，​$(l.name)​。​之后​会​有​解释​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​脸上​浮现​出​一丝​不安​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​只不过​我​无法​确定​你​是否​会​喜欢​。\n"
"\n"
"nai4xin1 dian3，$(l.name)。zhi1hou4 hui4 you3 jie3shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 si1 bu4an1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi3bu5guo4 wo3 wu2fa3 que4ding4 ni3 shi4fou3 hui4 xi3huan5。"

msgid ""
"Be quick about it. No more foolishness.\n"
"\n"
"We don't have a lot of time."
msgstr ""
"快点​去​，​别​再​做​蠢事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​没有​多少​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4dian3 qu4，bie4 zai4 zuo4 chun3shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 mei2you3 duo1shao3 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Be respectful, but be quick. After all, it is only a shell.\n"
"\n"
"Paul is with Monika now."
msgstr ""
"保证​尊重​的​前提​下​尽速​处理​。​毕竟​，​它​只是​一具​躯壳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​保罗​现在​和​莫妮卡​在​一起​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bao3zheng4 zun1zhong4 de5 qian2ti2 xia4 jin4su4 chu3li3。bi4jing4，ta1 zhi3shi4 yi1 ju4 qu1qiao4。\n"
"\n"
"bao3luo2 xian4zai4 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 zai4 yi1qi3 le5。"

msgid "Be seeing you, then."
msgstr ""
"那​就​再见​了​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 zai4jian4 le5。"

msgid "Be well, $(l.race)."
msgstr ""
"保重​，​$(l.race)​。\n"
"bao3zhong4，$(l.race)。"

msgid "Be well."
msgstr ""
"保重​。\n"
"bao3zhong4。"

msgid "Bear"
msgstr ""
"熊\n"
"xiong2"

msgid ""
"Bear is powerful, gentle, wise, and a protector of all the natural world.\n"
"\n"
"The power of Bear heals all friends with in 3 of the damage from the most recent attack.\n"
"\n"
"Cooldown: 3"
msgstr ""
"熊​力量强大​、​性情温和​、​智慧​超群​，​是​自然​万物​的​守护者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​熊​图腾​的​力量​可​治愈​3​格​范围​内​所有​友方​单位​最近​一次​受到​的​伤害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷却​时间​：​3​回合\n"
"\n"
"xiong2 li4 liang2 jiang4 dai4、xing4 qing2 wen1 he4、zhi4hui4 chao1qun2，shi4 zi4ran2 wan4wu4 de5 shou3 hu4 zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"xiong2 tu2teng2 de5 li4liang5 ke3 zhi4yu4 3 ge2 fan4wei2 nei4 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4 zui4jin4 yi1ci4 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。\n"
"\n"
"leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2"

msgid "Beard"
msgstr ""
"胡须\n"
"hu2xu1"

msgid ""
"Beating the tar out of a helpless prisoner isn't justice. Now stand down."
msgstr ""
"暴打​一个​没有​还手​之力​的​囚犯​并​不算​伸张正义​。​退下​吧​。\n"
"bao4da3 yi1ge5 mei2you3 huan2shou3 zhi1 li4 de5 qiu2fan4 bing4 bu4suan4 shen1 zhang1 zheng1 yi4。tui4xia4 ba1。"

msgid "Beats me."
msgstr ""
"你​问​倒​我​了​。\n"
"ni3 wen4 dao3 wo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Beats me. From the connections on the bottom, it looks like it was made to plug into a cyberdeck. Beyond that, I'm as in the dark about the thing as you are.\n"
"\n"
"All I know is that Grinder wanted it. That should be good enough for the Red-Haired Disaster."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不好​说​。​从​底部​的​接口​看​，​这​东西​像是​专​为​接入​赛博碟板​设计​的​。​除此之外​，​我​跟​你​一样​一头雾水​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只​知道​“​绞肉机​”​想要​它​。​对红发​灾星​来说​，​这​理由​就够​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4hao3 shuo1。cong2 di3bu4 de5 jie1kou3 kan4，zhe4 dong1xi1 xiang4 shi4 zhuan1 wei2 jie1ru4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 she4ji4 de5。chu2ci3zhi1wai4，wo3 gen1 ni3 yi1yang4 yi1tou2wu4shui3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 zhi1dao4“jiao3rou4ji1” xiang3yao4 ta1。dui4 hong2 fa1 zai1xing1 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 li3you2 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Beats me. I caught sight of him on the way down to the U-Bahn platform, and he looked normal enough.\n"
"\n"
"Then one of these bastards took a shot at him and winged him. Big mistake."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不​知道​。​我​走​下​地铁站​台时​瞥见​了​他​，​当时​他​看起来​还​挺​正常​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​结果​有个​混蛋​朝​他​开​了​一枪​，​擦伤​了​他​。​那​人犯​了​个​大错​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4。wo3 zou3 xia4 di4tie3zhan4 tai2 shi2 pie1jian4 le5 ta1，dang1shi2 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hai2 ting3 zheng4chang2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"jie1guo3 you3 ge4 hun2dan4 chao2 ta1 kai1 le5 yi1 qiang1，ca1shang1 le5 ta1。na4 ren2fan4 le5 ge4 da4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Beats the hell out of me. I'd suggest that you go ask Central about it."
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​知道​。​我​建议​你​去​指挥部​问问​。\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4。wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 qu4 zhi3hui1bu4 wen4 wen4。"

msgid ""
"Because I don't see a reason to. The memories are unpleasant, and dredging "
"them up doesn't serve any real purpose."
msgstr ""
"因为​我​看不出​有​什么​必要​。​那些​回忆​令人​不快​，​重新​翻出来​毫无​实际意义​。\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 kan4bu5chu1 you3 shen2me5 bi4yao4。na4xie1 hui2yi4 ling4ren2 bu4kuai4，chong2xin1 fan1 chu1 lai2 hao2wu2 shi2 ji4 yi4 yi4。"

msgid ""
"Because I know she is not dead. \n"
"\n"
"When a dragon falls, the sound resonates across time and space. There are many beings interested in her fate.\n"
"\n"
"Now tell me what happened. "
msgstr ""
"因为​我​知道​她​没​死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一条​巨龙​陨落​之​时​，​那​声音​会​在​整个​时​空中​回荡​。​很多​存在​都​对​她​的​命运​感兴趣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​告诉​我​发生​了​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 mei2 si3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yun3luo4 zhi1 shi2，na4 sheng1yin1 hui4 zai4 zheng3ge4 shi2 kong1zhong1 hui2dang4。hen3 duo1 cun2zai4 dou1 dui4 ta1 de5 ming4yun4 gan3xing4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 gao4su4 wo3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Because I know she is not dead. \n"
"\n"
"When a dragon falls, the sound resonates across time and space. There are many beings interested in her fate. \n"
"\n"
"Now tell me what happened. "
msgstr ""
"因为​我​知道​她​没​死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一条​巨龙​陨落​之​时​，​那​声音​会​在​整个​时​空中​回荡​。​很多​存在​都​对​她​的​命运​感兴趣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​告诉​我​发生​了​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 mei2 si3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yun3luo4 zhi1 shi2，na4 sheng1yin1 hui4 zai4 zheng3ge4 shi2 kong1zhong1 hui2dang4。hen3 duo1 cun2zai4 dou1 dui4 ta1 de5 ming4yun4 gan3xing4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 gao4su4 wo3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Because I know that you're in a bad spot.\n"
"\n"
"And I know that you're gonna need all the help you can get if you want to claw your way back out of it."
msgstr ""
"因为​我​知道​你​现在​处境​不利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​知道​，​如果​你​想​重新​振作起来​，​你​得​需要​所有​能用​上​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 xian4zai4 chu3jing4 bu4li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 zhi1dao4，ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 chong2xin1 zhen4 zuo4 qi3 lai2，ni3 de2 xu1yao4 suo3you3 neng2 yong4 shang4 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Because I need your help, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I'm still alive, but only barely... I don't have the strength to do much myself anymore, and Audran cannot handle this task on his own."
msgstr ""
"因为​我​需要​你​的​帮助​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​目前​还​活着​，​但​也​只是​勉强​度日​……​我​没有​力气​再​做​什么​事情​，​而​奥​德兰​自己​一个​人​也​没​办法​完成​这个​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mu4qian2 hai2 huo2zhe5，dan4 ye3 zhi3shi4 mian3qiang3 du4ri4……wo3 mei2you3 li4qi5 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5 shi4qing5，er2 Ao4de2lan2 zi4ji3 yi1ge5 ren2 ye3 mei2 ban4fa3 wan2cheng2 zhe4ge5 ren4wu5。"

msgid "Because I never claimed to be an anarchist."
msgstr ""
"因为​我​从来​没有​要​做​无政府主义​者​。\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 cong2lai2 mei2you3 yao4 zuo4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3。"

msgid ""
"Because I'm the leader of this team, and I need to know as much as I can "
"about the runners who are working with me."
msgstr ""
"因为​我​是​这支​小队​的​领袖​，​而且​我​需要​尽可能​了解​和​我​一起​共事​的​狂奔​者​。\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 shi4 zhe4 zhi1 xiao3 dui4 de5 ling3xiu4，er2qie3 wo3 xu1yao4 jin3ke3neng2 liao3jie3 he4 wo3 yi1qi3 gong4shi4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid ""
"Because I've spent time in there. A lot of time.\n"
"\n"
"That room is for acolytes only. On the rare occasion that an initiate is invited in, he usually doesn't come back out again."
msgstr ""
"因为​我​曾​在​那里​待过​。​很多​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​房间​只供​侍​祭​使用​。​在​极少数​情况​下​，​也​会​有​学徒​被​邀请​进去​，​但​他们​通常​就​出不来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 ceng2 zai4 na4li5 dai1 guo4。hen3 duo1 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 fang2jian1 zhi3 gong1 shi4 ji4 shi3yong4。zai4 ji2shao3shu4 qing2kuang4 xia4，ye3 hui4 you3 xue2tu2 bei4 yao1qing3 jin4qu4，dan4 ta1men5 tong1chang2 jiu4 chu1 bu4 lai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Because Schattennest is right next door to the Kreuzbasar. Once a syndicate "
"gets its hooks into Schattennest, they'll look to keep expanding their "
"territory, and the Kreuzabasar will be next. And once they're in, we'll "
"never get them back out again."
msgstr ""
"唇亡齿寒​。​一旦​犯罪集团​把手​伸进​影巢​，​他们​的​扩张​欲望​肯定​会​把​他们​引向​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​而​等​他们​真正​踏足​这里​，​我们​再​想​赶走​他们​就​晚​了​。\n"
"chun2wang2chi3han2。yi1dan4 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 ying3 chao2，ta1men5 de5 kuo4zhang1 yu4wang4 ken3ding4 hui4 ba3 ta1men5 yin3xiang4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。er2 deng3 ta1men5 zhen1zheng4 ta4zu2 zhe4li3，wo3men5 zai4 xiang3 gan3zou3 ta1men5 jiu4 wan3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Because a lot of them are rich. They paid a drekload in rent, and we "
"redistributed that wealth to the common man."
msgstr ""
"因为​他们​当中​很多​人​都​很​有钱​。​他们​交了​一大笔​租金​，​我们​把​这些​财富​重新分配​给​了​普通人​。\n"
"yin1wei4 ta1men5 dang1zhong1 hen3 duo1 ren2 dou1 hen3 you3qian2。ta1men5 jiao1 le5 yi1 dai4 bi3 zu1jin1，wo3men5 ba3 zhe4xie1 cai2fu4 chong2 xin1 fen4 pei4 gei3 le5 pu3tong1ren2。"

msgid ""
"Because if we try to stop whatever's happening in there, there's going to be bloodshed.\n"
"\n"
"The cultists in there have been brainwashed by Harrow. Whatever they're doing, they aren't doing it of their own accord."
msgstr ""
"因为​如果​我们​试图​阻止​里面​发生​的​一切​，​流血事件​将​不可避免​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​的​那些​教徒​已经​被​哈罗​洗脑​了​。​无论​他们​在​做​什么​，​都​不是​出于​自身​意愿​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 shi4tu2 zu3zhi3 li3mian4 fa1sheng1 de5 yi1qie4，liu2 xie3 shi4 jian4 jiang1 bu4ke3bi4mian3。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 de5 na4xie1 jiao4tu2 yi3jing1 bei4 ha1luo2 xi3nao3 le5。wu2lun4 ta1men5 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5，dou1 bu4shi4 chu1yu2 zi4shen1 yi4yuan4。"

msgid ""
"Because if we try to stop whatever's happening in there, there's going to be bloodshed.\n"
"\n"
"We're here to kill Harrow, not the people he's brainwashed."
msgstr ""
"因为​如果​我们​试图​阻止​里面​发生​的​一切​，​流血事件​将​不可避免​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​此行​的​目的​是​除掉​哈罗​，​而​不是​那些​被​他​洗脑​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 shi4tu2 zu3zhi3 li3mian4 fa1sheng1 de5 yi1qie4，liu2 xie3 shi4 jian4 jiang1 bu4ke3bi4mian3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4 shi4 chu2diao4 ha1luo2，er2 bu4shi4 na4xie1 bei4 ta1 xi3nao3 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Because it's pretty clear that if you had your way, you'd still be with "
"them. And a good leader places a priority on knowing $(s.hisher) team."
msgstr ""
"因为​很​明显​，​如果​让​你​自己​选​的话​，​你​应该​还会​和​他们​在​一起​。​而​一位​优秀​的​领导者​，​首要任务​就是​了解​自己​的​团队​。\n"
"yin1wei4 hen3 ming2xian3，ru2guo3 rang4 ni3 zi4ji3 xuan3 de5hua4，ni3 ying1gai1 hai2 hui4 he4 ta1men5 zai4 yi1qi3。er2 yi1 wei4 you1xiu4 de5 ling3dao3zhe3，shou3 yao4 ren4 wu4 jiu4shi4 liao3jie3 zi4ji3 de5 tuan2dui4。"

msgid ""
"Because it's usually empty in here, and I don't like to be bothered. And as hopeless as the bartender is, it's tough to mess up scotch if you order it neat.\n"
"\n"
"Now, do you have another question, or...?"
msgstr ""
"因为​这里​通常​没什么​人​，​我​正好​也​不​喜欢​被​打扰​。​另外​虽说​这里​的​调酒师​没救​了​，​但点​一杯​纯​威士忌​总​不会​出​问题​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​你​还有​其他​问题​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 zhe4li3 tong1chang2 mei2shen2me5 ren2，wo3 zheng4hao3 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5 bei4 da3rao3。ling4wai4 sui1shuo1 zhe4li3 de5 tiao2jiu3shi1 mei2jiu4 le5，dan4 dian3 yi1 bei1 chun2 wei1shi4ji4 zong3 bu4hui4 chu1 wen4ti2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，ni3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Because of his nephew. Right.\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry, $(l.name). I don't know what else to tell you. Is there anything else you need?"
msgstr ""
"因为​他​的​侄子​。​也​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​，​$(l.name)​。​我​没什么​能​告诉​你​的​了​。​你​还有​什么​需要​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 ta1 de5 zhi2zi5。ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，$(l.name)。wo3 mei2shen2me5 neng2 gao4su4 ni3 de5 le5。ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Because that abandoned apartment was once mine.\n"
"\n"
"In the days before I discovered the peace of Communion, I was a very different man. I had need of such contrivances.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His smile widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But not anymore. Finally, I am at peace."
msgstr ""
"因为​那​间​废弃​的​公寓​曾经​是​我​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我​感受​到共融​的​安宁​之前​，​我​曾​与​现在​截然不同​。​那​时候​，​我​还​需要​这样​的​保命​之计​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​微笑​变得​更加​灿烂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如今​不再​需要​了​。​我​终于​得到​了​真正​的​安宁​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 na4 jian1 fei4qi4 de5 gong1yu4 ceng2jing1 shi4 wo3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 gan3shou4 dao4 gong4 rong2 de5 an1ning2 zhi1qian2，wo3 ceng2 yu4 xian4zai4 jie2ran2bu4tong2。na4 shi2hou5，wo3 hai2 xu1yao4 zhe4yang4 de5 bao3ming4 zhi1 ji4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 wei1xiao4 bian4de5 geng4jia1 can4lan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2jin1 bu4zai4 xu1yao4 le5。wo3 zhong1yu2 de2dao4 le5 zhen1zheng4 de5 an1ning2。"

msgid ""
"Because the world is *sick,* $(l.name). Anyone with half a brain can see that. So I'm gonna use the Doc's wonder bug to poison it back to health.\n"
"\n"
"It might get better, or it might die. Either would be better than it languishing like this."
msgstr ""
"因为​这个​世界​*​病​了​*​，​$(l.name)​。​任何​有​脑子​的​人​都​能​看得出来​。​所以​我​打算​用​博士​的​这剂​猛​药治好​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​也许​会​恢复健康​，​也许​会​死​掉​。​但​无论如何​都​比​现在​这样​要​好​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4*bing4 le5*，$(l.name)。ren4he2 you3 nao3zi5 de5 ren2 dou1 neng2 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2。suo3yi3 wo3 da3suan4 yong4 bo2shi4 de5 zhe4 ji4 meng3 yao4 zhi4 hao3 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ye3xu3 hui4 hui1 fu4 jian4 kang1，ye3xu3 hui4 si3 diao4。dan4 wu2lun4ru2he2 dou1 bi3 xian4zai4 zhe4yang4 yao4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Because there is something that I need you to know. A truth hidden from mortal eyes.\n"
"\n"
"I need you to know that I am not mortal so that you will trust my words."
msgstr ""
"因为​有件事​我​需要​你​明白​。​这是​凡人​肉眼​无法​窥见​的​真相​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​需要​你​明白​我​并非​凡人​，​这样​你​才​会​相信​我​的​话语​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 you3 jian4 shi4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 ming2bai5。zhe4 shi4 fan2ren2 rou4yan3 wu2fa3 kui1jian4 de5 zhen1xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 ming2bai5 wo3 bing4fei1 fan2ren2，zhe4yang4 ni3 cai2 hui4 xiang1xin4 wo3 de5 hua4yu3。"

msgid ""
"Because we found a tattered, bloodstained shirt in there. It looked like it "
"came from an initiate."
msgstr ""
"因为​我们​在​里面​发现​了​一件​破烂不堪​、​沾满​血迹​的​衬衫​。​似乎​是​某个​学徒​身上​穿​的​。\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3men5 zai4 li3mian4 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 jian4 po4 lan4 bu4 kan1、zhan1man3 xue4ji4 de5 chen4shan1。si4hu1 shi4 mou3 ge4 xue2tu2 shen1shang5 chuan1 de5。"

msgid "Because you don't look fine."
msgstr ""
"因为​你​看起来​并​不好​。\n"
"yin1wei4 ni3 kan4qi3lai5 bing4 bu4hao3。"

msgid "Because you like me?"
msgstr ""
"因为​你​喜欢​我​？\n"
"yin1wei4 ni3 xi3huan5 wo3？"

msgid "Because you like that hacker, Janet."
msgstr ""
"因为​你​喜欢​那个​叫​珍妮特​的​黑客​。\n"
"yin1wei4 ni3 xi3huan5 na4ge5 jiao4 zhen1 ni1 te4 de5 hei1ke4。"

msgid ""
"Beckenbauer was unwilling to discuss the specifics of the job in your absence.\n"
"\n"
"He has requested that you speak with him in person at your earliest convenience."
msgstr ""
"贝肯鲍尔​想​和​你​当面​聊​这项​差事​的​细节​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​希望​你​尽快​与​他​见面​。\n"
"\n"
"Bei4ken3bao4er3 xiang3 he4 ni3 dang1mian4 liao2 zhe4 xiang4 cha4shi4 de5 xi4jie2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xi1wang4 ni3 jin3kuai4 yu4 ta1 jian4mian4。"

msgid "Bedroom Door"
msgstr ""
"卧室​门\n"
"wo4shi4 men2"

msgid "Bedside Table"
msgstr ""
"床头柜\n"
"chuang2tou2gui4"

msgid "Bedtime Treat"
msgstr ""
"睡前​甜点\n"
"shui4 qian2 tian2dian3"

msgid "Bedtime Treat: Incoming DMG -2, Quickness -1"
msgstr ""
"睡前​甜点​：​受到​的​伤害​减少​2​点​，​敏捷​-​1\n"
"shui4 qian2 tian2dian3：shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 2 dian3，min3jie2 -1"

msgid "Been finding much work recently?"
msgstr ""
"最近​工作​忙​吗​？\n"
"zui4jin4 gong1zuo4 mang2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Been meaning to talk to you about that. You could use some deodorant "
"yourself, big guy."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​想​和​你​谈谈​这件​事​。​你​自己​也​该​用点​除臭剂​了​，​大个子​。\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 xiang3 he4 ni3 tan2tan2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。ni3 zi4ji3 ye3 gai1 yong4 dian3 chu2chou4ji4 le5，dai4 ge4 zi3。"

msgid ""
"Before I agree to anything, you're going to need to answer some questions."
msgstr ""
"在​我​下​决定​之前​，​你​得​先​回答​我​几个​问题​。\n"
"zai4 wo3 xia4 jue2ding4 zhi1qian2，ni3 de2 xian1 hui2da2 wo3 ji3ge5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Before I forget... the Turkish coffee guy sent one of his street rats over "
"before you got here. Said he wants to talk to you about something."
msgstr ""
"对​了​……​在​你​来​之前​，​豆​咖馆​的​那个​土耳其​老板​派​人​过来​找​你​来​着​。​他​说​想​和​你​谈谈​一些​事​。\n"
"dui4 le5……zai4 ni3 lai2 zhi1qian2，dou4 ka1 guan3 de5 na4ge5 tu3er3qi2 lao3ban3 pai4 ren2 guo4lai2 zhao3 ni3 lai2 zhao2。ta1 shuo1 xiang3 he4 ni3 tan2tan2 yi1xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Before Monika, ideas unrelated to my core programming were filtered away and discarded. Not my choice, but then, the whole *idea* of choice was foreign to me back then.\n"
"\n"
"My system was designed to treat unwanted thoughts as irritants. Distractions from the purity of my purpose.\n"
"\n"
"But now, all of that has changed."
msgstr ""
"在​莫妮卡​出现​前​，​所有​与​我​的​核心​程序​无关​的​念头​都​会​被​过滤​并​丢弃​。​这​并非​我​的​选择​，​不过​话说回来​，​甚至​连​“​选择​”​这个​概念​本身​，​在​当时​对​我​而言​也​是​陌生​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​我​的​系统​设计​，​所有​多余​的​想法​都​会​被​视为​干扰​物​，​它们​会​破坏​我​目标​的​纯粹​性​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​现在​，​这​一切​都​变​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 chu1xian4 qian2，suo3you3 yu4 wo3 de5 he2xin1 cheng2xu4 wu2guan1 de5 nian4tou5 dou1 hui4 bei4 guo4lu:4 bing4 diu1qi4。zhe4 bing4fei1 wo3 de5 xuan3ze2，bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，shen4zhi4 lian2“xuan3ze2” zhe4ge5 gai4nian4 ben3shen1，zai4 dang1shi2 dui4 wo3 er2yan2 ye3 shi4 mo4sheng1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 wo3 de5 xi4tong3 she4ji4，suo3you3 duo1yu2 de5 xiang3fa3 dou1 hui4 bei4 shi4wei2 gan1rao3 wu4，ta1men5 hui4 po4huai4 wo3 mu4biao1 de5 chun2cui4 xing4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4，zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 bian4 le5。"

msgid "Before he can process what's happening, you're on him."
msgstr ""
"还​没​等​他​来得及​反应​，​你​就​扑​了​上去​。\n"
"hai2 mei2 deng3 ta1 lai2de5ji2 fan3ying4，ni3 jiu4 pu1 le5 shang4qu4。"

msgid ""
"Before he knows what's happening, you grab his head and twist viciously. With a crackling pop, his body goes limp.\n"
"\n"
"He slides down to the ground, dead."
msgstr ""
"他​还​没​来得及​反应​，​你​便​抓住​他​的​脑袋​，​用力​一​拧​。​只​听​咔嚓​一声​，​他​的​身体​便​瘫软​下来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​倒​在​地上​死​掉​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hai2 mei2 lai2de5ji2 fan3ying4，ni3 bian4 zhua1zhu4 ta1 de5 nao3dai5，yong4li4 yi1 ning2。zhi3 ting1 ka1cha1 yi1sheng1，ta1 de5 shen1ti3 bian4 tan1ruan3 xia4lai5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dao3 zai4 di4shang5 si3 diao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Before he knows what's happening, you have one arm around his neck.\n"
"\n"
"The other locks it in place and applies leverage."
msgstr ""
"他​还​没​来得及​反应​，​你​就​用​一只​手臂​勒住​他​的​脖子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另一只​手臂​则​将​他​牢牢​锁住​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hai2 mei2 lai2de5ji2 fan3ying4，ni3 jiu4 yong4 yi1 zhi3 shou3bi4 lei1 zhu4 ta1 de5 bo2zi5。\n"
"\n"
"ling4 yi1 zhi3 shou3bi4 ze2 jiang1 ta1 lao2lao2 suo3 zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Before you ask, yes, I looked in to that. Problem is, this is a stolen corp drone. A *discontinued model* of a stolen corp drone.\n"
"\n"
"There are no parts for this thing on the market around here, so unless you know who locked this thing up so tightly, you're not going to get more use out of it than a door-stop."
msgstr ""
"当然​不用​你​说​，​我​研究​过​这个​问题​。​问题​是​，​这是​一架​偷来​的​公司​无人机​，​而且​还是​*​停产​型号​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​的​市场​上​没有​这​东西​的​配件​，​所以​除非​你​知道​是​谁​把​这​东西​锁得​这么​严实​，​否则​你​只能​把​它​当个​挡​门板​用​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 bu4yong4 ni3 shuo1，wo3 yan2jiu1 guo4 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。wen4ti2 shi4，zhe4 shi4 yi1 jia4 tou1 lai2 de5 gong1si1 wu2ren2ji1，er2qie3 hai2shi5*ting2chan3 xing2hao4*。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 shi4chang3 shang4 mei2you3 zhe4 dong1xi1 de5 pei4jian4，suo3yi3 chu2fei1 ni3 zhi1dao4 shi4 shei2 ba3 zhe4 dong1xi1 suo3 de2 zhe4me5 yan2shi5，fou3ze2 ni3 zhi3neng2 ba3 ta1 dang1 ge4 dang3 men2 ban3 yong4 le5。"

msgid "Begin what?"
msgstr ""
"开始​什么​？\n"
"kai1shi3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Behind the creature, a second thing lumbers into view. A wall of muscle, sinew, and burning pitch.\n"
"\n"
"The things lurch toward you, leaving a trail of greasy smoke in their wake."
msgstr ""
"在​那​生物​身后​，​第二道​身影​蹒跚​现形​，​仿佛​一道​肌肉​、​筋腱​与​燃烧​的​焦油​构成​的​墙壁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它们​踉跄​着​向​你​逼近​，​身后​拖曳​着​油腻​的​烟雾​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4 sheng1wu4 shen1hou4，di4 er4 dao4 shen1ying3 pan2shan1 xian4xing2，fang3fu2 yi1dao4 ji1rou4、jin1 jian4 yu4 ran2shao1 de5 jiao1you2 gou4cheng2 de5 qiang2bi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 liang4qiang4 zhao2 xiang4 ni3 bi1jin4，shen1hou4 tuo1ye4 zhao2 you2ni4 de5 yan1wu4。"

msgid ""
"Behind the hatch, you find a great rat's nest of monofilament wires. Each wire snakes over and around the others to connect to a different endpoint.\n"
"\n"
"Thankfully, all of the endpoints are labeled. It doesn't take long to find the wire that governs the power locks for the building's front door."
msgstr ""
"封盖​后面​是​一大堆​单丝​电缆​，​简直​像​一团乱麻​。​每根​缆线​交错​缠绕​，​连接​到​不同​的​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所幸​所有​终端​都​贴​有​标签​。​没过多久​，​你​就​找到​了​控制​大楼​前门​电动​锁​的​缆线​。\n"
"\n"
"feng1gai4 hou4mian5 shi4 yi1 dai4 dui1 dan1 si1 dian4lan3，jian3zhi2 xiang4 yi1 tuan2 luan4 ma2。mei3 gen1 lan3xian4 jiao1cuo4 chan2rao4，lian2jie1 dao4 bu4tong2 de5 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3xing4 suo3you3 zhong1duan1 dou1 tie1 you3 biao1qian1。mei2 guo4 duo1 jiu3，ni3 jiu4 zhao3dao4 le5 kong4zhi4 da4lou2 qian2men2 dian4dong4 suo3 de5 lan3xian4。"

msgid ""
"Believe it, boss. If you could feel Him talking to you, you'd accept it, too.\n"
"\n"
"Even if I didn't accept it, I don't see a viable alternative. I can't just turn away from Him... He's where my magic comes from, remember?"
msgstr ""
"你​就​信​了​吧​，​老大​。​如果​你​能​听到​祂​的​言语​，​你​也​会​接受​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​即使​我​拒绝​，​我​也​找​不到​别的​路​可​走​啊​。​我​不能​背离​祂​……​你​应该​还​记得​我​的​魔法​全都​源于​祂​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 xin4 le5 ba1，lao3da4。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 ting1dao4 ta1 de5 yan2yu3，ni3 ye3 hui4 jie1shou4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 ji2shi3 wo3 ju4jue2，wo3 ye3 zhao3 bu4dao4 bie2de5 lu4 ke3 zou3 a1。wo3 bu4neng2 bei4li2 ta1……ni3 ying1gai1 hai2 ji4de5 wo3 de5 mo2fa3 quan2dou1 yuan2yu2 ta1 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Believe it, pal. He's completely lost it, and he wants your friend's head."
msgstr ""
"信​我​吧​，​伙计​。​他​已经​完全​疯​了​，​他​想要​你​朋友​的​人头​。\n"
"xin4 wo3 ba1，huo3ji5。ta1 yi3jing1 wan2quan2 feng1 le5，ta1 xiang3yao4 ni3 peng2you5 de5 ren2tou2。"

msgid ""
"Believe it. He's completely lost it, and he wants your friend's head.\n"
"\n"
"It's tragic, really."
msgstr ""
"信​我​吧​。​他​已经​完全​疯​了​，​他​想要​你​朋友​的​人头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​可悲​。\n"
"\n"
"xin4 wo3 ba1。ta1 yi3jing1 wan2quan2 feng1 le5，ta1 xiang3yao4 ni3 peng2you5 de5 ren2tou2。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ke3bei1。"

msgid ""
"Believe it. Just bein' in the place was painful... felt like I was bein' forced to inhale wet ashes.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He spits into the crater.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good goddamn riddance. The sooner I forget that feeling, the better."
msgstr ""
"还是​相信​为​好​。​光待​在​那​地方​就够​折磨​人​了​……​感觉​就​像​被迫​吸入​浸湿​的​灰烬​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他朝​大坑​里​啐​了​口​唾沫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可​算是​完事​了​。​我​真想​趁早​忘记​那种​感觉​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 xiang1xin4 wei2 hao3。guang1 dai1 zai4 na4 di4fang1 jiu4 gou4 zhe2mo2 ren2 le5……gan3jue2 jiu4 xiang4 bei4po4 xi1ru4 jin4shi1 de5 hui1jin4 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 da4keng1 li3 cui4 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3 suan4shi4 wan2shi4 le5。wo3 zhen1 xiang3 chen4zao3 wang4ji4 na4zhong3 gan3jue2。"

msgid ""
"Believe what you want, $(l.name), I won't argue with you. We're still in hostile territory, and we have more important things to worry about.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment to stare at the Engineer's body, frowning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"Winternight.\" Somehow, I have a hard time believing in a Norwegian secret society that's more dangerous than the Russian mob."
msgstr ""
"随便​你​怎么​想​，​$(l.name)​，​我​不会​跟​你​争​的​。​我们​仍然​在​敌人​的​地盘​上​，​现在​还有​更​重要​的​事情​去​操心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一会儿​，​皱眉​看着​工程师​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​冬夜​”​。​很难​相信​会​有​一个​比​俄罗斯​黑帮​更​危险​的​挪威​秘密组织​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3，$(l.name)，wo3 bu4hui4 gen1 ni3 zheng1 de5。wo3men5 reng2ran2 zai4 di2ren2 de5 di4pan2 shang4，xian4zai4 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5 qu4 cao1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，zhou4mei2 kan4 zhao2 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“dong1 ye4”。hen3 nan2 xiang1xin4 hui4 you3 yi1ge5 bi3 e2luo2si1 hei1bang1 geng1 wei1xian3 de5 nuo2wei1 bi4 mi4 zu3 zhi1。"

msgid "Believe what you want, I'm not going to try anything."
msgstr ""
"随便​你​怎么​想​，​我​不会​乱来​的​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3，wo3 bu4hui4 luan4lai2 de5。"

msgid "Belljar Elevator Compartment"
msgstr ""
"钟罩​型​电梯​厢\n"
"zhong1zhao4 xing2 dian4ti1 xiang1"

msgid "Benelli Raffaello"
msgstr ""
"伯奈利​拉斐尔\n"
"bai3 nai4 li4 la1fei3er3"

msgid "Benelli Raffaello (Smartlink)"
msgstr ""
"伯奈利​拉斐尔​（​智能​枪版​）\n"
"bai3 nai4 li4 la1fei3er3 （zhi4neng2 qiang1ban3）"

msgid "Beretta Model 70"
msgstr ""
"伯莱塔​Model​ ​70\n"
"bai3 lai2 ta3 Model 70"

msgid "Beretta Model 70 (Smartlink)"
msgstr ""
"伯莱塔​Model​ ​70​（​智能​枪版​）\n"
"bai3 lai2 ta3 Model 70 （zhi4neng2 qiang1ban3）"

msgid "Bergfalk's Note"
msgstr ""
"伯格​法尔克​的​笔记\n"
"bai3 ge2 fa3 er3 ke4 de5 bi3ji4"

msgid "Berlin"
msgstr ""
"柏林\n"
"bo2lin2"

msgid "Berlin Area Environments and Tilesets"
msgstr ""
"柏林​地区​的​环境​与​区块​图\n"
"bo2lin2 di4qu1 de5 huan2jing4 yu4 qu1kuai4 tu2"

msgid ""
"Berlin NewsFax contains just one report of a large-scale explosion in the countryside east of Berlin. An abandoned castle is reportedly consumed in a massive fireball that shakes the countryside and leaves a crater 60 feet deep. A natural gas leak is suspected, and the location is soon cordoned off by unidentified corporate forces. This news is eclipsed when Saeder-Krupp announces its acquisition of Arianespace, the last remaining arm of the European space program. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The Flux State's anarchist rule remains until 2055 when joint corporate forces, acting with the support of the German government, invade the city. It�s widely known that the Great Dragon Lofywr is responsible for orchestrating this action. After weeks of fighting, the surviving anarchists are forced to retreat to the eastern part of the city. A truce is signed in 2060 and Berlin is again divided by a wall.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The Great Dragon Dunkelzahn is elected President of the United Canadian and American States in 2057. He is promptly assassinated as he leaves an inauguration party at the Watergate Hotel while in human form. Popular opinion is that another great dragon is responsible, as \"only a dragon can kill a dragon\"... but those in the shadows hint that an act of powerful blood magic is the cause.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Grainy photographs of a large winged creature crossing a full moon above the Harz Mountains circulate in Germany for several years. Conspiracy theorists take this as evidence that a new Great Dragon has emerged... but when no further sightings are reported, interest wanes.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The name of Dr. Adrian Vauclair has since been lost to the shadows..."
msgstr ""
"《​柏林​新闻​速递​》​仅​发布​了​一则​关于​柏林​东部​乡村​地区​发生​大规模​爆炸​的​报道​。​据称​，​一座​废弃​的​城堡​被​巨大​的​火球​吞噬​，​爆炸​震动​了​整个​乡村​，​并​留下​一个​60​英尺​深​的​坑洞​。​当局​怀疑​是​天然气​泄漏​所致​，​该​地点​很快​被​身份​不明​的​企业​部队​封锁​。​而后​当​赛德​-​克虏伯​宣布​收购​欧洲​航天​计划​中​最后​一支​残存​力量​—​—​阿丽亚娜​空间​公司​时​，​这​条​新闻​便​被​掩盖​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​动荡​带​的​无政府主义​统治​一直​持续​到​2055​年​。​随后​在​德国政府​支持​下​，​联合​企业​部队​入侵​了​这座​城市​。​众所周知​，​此次​行动​是​由​巨龙​洛夫​维尔​策划​的​。​经过​数周​的​战斗​，​残存​的​无政府主义​者​被迫​撤退​至​城市​东部​。​2060​年​，​双方​签署​停战​协议​，​柏林​再次​被​一堵​墙​分割​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​2057​年​，​巨龙​邓​凯尔​赞​当选​加​美​合众国​总统​。​他​在​以​人类​形态​离开​水门​饭店​的​就职​晚宴​时遭​暗杀​身亡​。​舆论​普遍认为​另​一条​巨龙​是​幕后​黑手​，​因为​“​唯有​巨龙​能​杀死​巨龙​”​……​但​暗影​界​人士​对此​暗示​称​，​这​实际上​是​某种​强大​的​血​魔法​所致​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​多年​来​，​德国​坊间​流传​着​一些​模糊​的​照片​。​其中​显示​，​在​哈尔茨​山脉​上空​的​满月​照耀​下​，​一只​巨大​的​有​翼​生物​正​呼啸​飞过​。​阴谋​论者​将​此​视为​新​巨龙​现身​的​证据​……​但​随着​没有​进一步​的​目击​报告​传出​，​人们​的​兴趣​也​逐渐​减退​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​自此​，​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​这个​名字​便​湮没​在​暗影​之中​……\n"
"\n"
"《 bo2lin2 xin1wen2 su4di4 》 jin3 fa1bu4 le5 yi1ze2 guan1yu2 bo2lin2 dong1bu4 xiang1cun1 di4qu1 fa1sheng1 da4gui1mo2 bao4zha4 de5 bao4dao4。ju4cheng1，yi1 zuo4 fei4qi4 de5 cheng2bao3 bei4 ju4da4 de5 huo3qiu2 tun1shi4，bao4zha4 zhen4dong4 le5 zheng3ge4 xiang1cun1，bing4 liu2xia4 yi1ge5 60 ying1chi3 shen1 de5 keng1dong4。dang1ju2 huai2yi2 shi4 tian1ran2qi4 xie4lou4 suo3zhi4，gai1 di4dian3 hen3 kuai4 bei4 shen1fen4 bu4ming2 de5 qi3ye4 bu4dui4 feng1suo3。er2hou4 dang1 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 xuan1bu4 shou1gou4 ou1zhou1 hang2tian1 ji4hua4 zhong4 zui4hou4 yi1 zhi1 can2cun2 li4liang5——a1li4ya4na4 kong1jian1 gong1si1 shi2，zhe4 tiao2 xin1wen2 bian4 bei4 yan3gai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"dong4dang4 dai4 de5 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 tong3zhi4 yi1zhi2 chi2xu4 dao4 2055 nian2。sui2hou4 zai4 de2 guo2 zheng4 fu3 zhi1chi2 xia4，lian2he2 qi3ye4 bu4dui4 ru4qin1 le5 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4。zhong4suo3zhou1zhi1，ci3ci4 xing2dong4 shi4 you2 ju4long2 Luo4fu1wei2er3 ce4hua4 de5。jing1guo4 shu4zhou1 de5 zhan4dou4，can2cun2 de5 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3 bei4po4 che4tui4 zhi4 cheng2shi4 dong1bu4。2060 nian2，shuang1fang1 qian1shu3 ting2zhan4 xie2yi4，bo2lin2 zai4ci4 bei4 yi1 du3 qiang2 fen1ge1。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"2057 nian2，ju4long2 deng4 kai3 er3 zan4 dang1xuan3 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 zong3tong3。ta1 zai4 yi3 ren2lei4 xing2tai4 li2kai1 shui3men2 fan4dian4 de5 jiu4zhi2 wan3yan4 shi2 zao1 an4sha1 shen1wang2。yu2lun4 pu3 bian4 ren4 wei2 ling4 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 shi4 mu4hou4 hei1shou3，yin1wei4“wei2you3 ju4long2 neng2 sha1si3 ju4long2”……dan4 an4ying3 jie4 ren2shi4 dui4 ci3 an4shi4 chen4，zhe4 shi2ji4shang4 shi4 mou3zhong3 qiang2da4 de5 xie3 mo2fa3 suo3zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"duo1nian2 lai2，de2guo2 fang1jian1 liu2chuan2 zhao2 yi1xie1 mo2hu5 de5 zhao4pian4。qi2zhong1 xian3shi4，zai4 Ha1er3ci2 shan1mai4 shang4kong1 de5 man3yue4 zhao4yao4 xia4，yi1 zhi3 ju4da4 de5 you3 yi4 sheng1wu4 zheng1 hu1xiao4 fei1guo4。yin1mou2 lun2 zhe3 jiang1 ci3 shi4wei2 xin1 ju4long2 xian4shen1 de5 zheng4ju4……dan4 sui2zhe5 mei2you3 jin4yi1bu4 de5 mu4ji1 bao4gao4 chuan2chu1，ren2men5 de5 xing4qu4 ye3 zhu2jian4 jian3tui4。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"zi4ci3，E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 bian4 yan1mo4 zai4 an4ying3 zhi1zhong1……"

