"\n"
"\n"
"2061 nian2，guan1yu2 mou3 ge4“wan3ru2 shen2ming2” de5 ren2gong1zhi4neng2 yu4“e1 zha1 ni2 ya4 de5 tong3zhi4zhe3” yu3 she2 mu4 gu3 ji2 zhi1jian1 jin4xing2 jiao1liu2 de5 shuo1fa3 kai1shi3 liu2 chuan2 kai1 lai2。yi1 wei4 ming2jiao4“tuo1er3si1tai4” de5 die2 ke4 sheng1cheng1，zhe4 shuo1ming2 ren2gong1zhi4neng2 yu4 long2 zu2 zhi1jian1 de5 chi2xu4 tan2pan4 yi3 jin4ru4 quan2xin1 jie1duan4，dan4 zhe4 yi1 shuo1fa3 shang4wei4 de2dao4 zheng4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"zi4ci3，E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 bian4 yan1mo4 zai4 an4ying3 zhi1zhong1……"

msgid "Berlin is still standing, isn’t it? I’d count that as a win."
msgstr ""
"柏林​仍然​屹立​于​此​，​不是​吗​？​我​愿意​把​这​算作​一次​胜利​。\n"
"bo2lin2 reng2ran2 yi4li4 yu2 ci3，bu4shi4 ma5？wo3 yuan4yi4 ba3 zhe4 suan4 zuo4 yi1ci4 sheng4li4。"

msgid ""
"Besides which, I don't even know if I *can* refuse Him anymore. He's been "
"with me for so long, I don't know where He stops and I begin."
msgstr ""
"而且​，​我​甚至​不​知道​自己​是否​还​*​能​*​拒绝​祂​。​祂​与​我​相伴​已​久​，​我​分不清​祂​的​界限​于​何处​止息​，​我​的​边界​又​从​何处​开始​。\n"
"er2qie3，wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 shi4fou3 hai2*neng2*ju4jue2 ta1。ta1 yu4 wo3 xiang1ban4 yi3 jiu3，wo3 fen4 bu4 qing1 ta1 de5 jie4xian4 yu2 he2chu4 zhi3xi1，wo3 de5 bian1jie4 you4 cong2 he2chu4 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"Besides, I had a good reason not to join the Monika Schäfer Fan Club. Any real anarchist would.\n"
"\n"
"Nobody likes a poser."
msgstr ""
"再说​，​我​有​充分​的​理由​不去​加入​“​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​粉丝​俱乐部​”​。​每个​真正​的​无政府主义​者​都​会​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​人​喜欢​装模作样​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1，wo3 you3 chong1fen4 de5 li3you2 bu4 qu4 jia1ru4“Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 fen3si1 ju4le4bu4”。mei3ge4 zhen1zheng4 de5 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3 dou1 hui4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 xi3huan5 zhuang1mo2zuo4yang4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Besides, I'm not a career criminal like the rest of you. I've never broken into anything, or shot at anyone in my *life.*\n"
"\n"
"I'm just an electrician!"
msgstr ""
"再说​，​我​跟​你们​其他人​不​一样​，​我​不是​职业​罪犯​。​我​*​这辈子​*​从来​没有​过​入室​抢劫​，​或者​朝​谁​开枪​什么​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​个​电工​！\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1，wo3 gen1 ni3men5 qi2 ta1 ren2 bu4 yi1yang4，wo3 bu4shi4 zhi2ye4 zui4fan4。wo3*zhe4 bei4 zi3*cong2lai2 mei2you3 guo4 ru4 shi4 qiang3jie2，huo4zhe3 chao2 shei2 kai1qiang1 shen2me5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 dian4gong1！"

msgid ""
"Besides, if we piss off this \"Herr Schmidt,\" who cares? I mean, we live in"
" Berlin! There're bound to be *plenty* of other clients out there."
msgstr ""
"再说​了​，​“​施密特​先生​”​算​哪​根葱​？​我们​可是​在​柏林​！​没​了​他​，​也​有​*​大​把​*​客户​等​着​呢​。\n"
"zai4shuo1 le5，“shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5” suan4 na3 gen1 cong1？wo3men5 ke3shi4 zai4 bo2lin2！mei2 le5 ta1，ye3 you3*dai4 ba3*ke4hu4 deng3 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Besides, this should be a milk run. Security is supposed to be light. A few automatic weapons, no armor.\n"
"\n"
"With a little luck, they'll never know we were here."
msgstr ""
"再说​了​，​这次​活​应该​轻松​得​很​。​安保​估计​很​松​。​他们​没护甲​，​最多​有​几把​自动步枪​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​运气​好​，​他们​都​不会​知道​我们​来过​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1 le5，zhe4 ci4 huo2 ying1gai1 qing1song1 de2 hen3。an1bao3 gu1ji4 hen3 song1。ta1men5 mei2 hu4 jia3，zui4duo1 you3 ji1 ba3 zi4 dong4 bu4 qiang1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 yun4qi5 hao3，ta1men5 dou1 bu4hui4 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 lai2 guo4。"

msgid ""
"Besides...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}With a jerk, she hoists a corpse up from behind the makeshift barricade. A young man, maybe in his early twenties, his eyes frozen wide in surprise. \n"
"\n"
"What's left of his throat hangs down in ragged flaps.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...the other guy looks worse."
msgstr ""
"再说​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔用​手背​擦擦​嘴​，​然后​从​她​的​临时​街垒​后面​拖​出​一具​尸体​。​那​是​个​二十出头​的​年轻人​，​双眼​因​惊愕​而​永远​定格​在​圆​睁​的​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​喉咙​残余​的​部分​像​破布​般​垂落​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​这​家伙​的​下场​更惨​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yong4 shou3bei4 ca1 ca1 zui3，ran2hou4 cong2 ta1 de5 lin2shi2 jie1 lei3 hou4mian5 tuo1 chu1 yi1 ju4 shi1ti3。na4 shi4 ge4 er4 shi2 chu1 tou2 de5 nian2qing1ren2，shuang1yan3 yin1 jing1e4 er2 yong3yuan3 ding4ge2 zai4 yuan2 zheng1 de5 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hou2long2 can2yu2 de5 bu4fen5 xiang4 po4bu4 ban1 chui2 la4 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……zhe4 jia1huo5 de5 xia4chang3 geng1 can3。"

msgid ""
"Best get to them in a hurry, then. This place feels like it's shaking itself"
" apart."
msgstr ""
"那得​赶紧​找到​他们​。​这​地方​快​散架​了​。\n"
"na4 de2 gan3jin3 zhao3dao4 ta1men5。zhe4 di4fang1 kuai4 san3jia4 le5。"

msgid "Best get used to it, Eiger love."
msgstr ""
"早点​习惯​吧​，​亲爱​的​艾格尔​。\n"
"zao3dian3 xi2guan4 ba1，qin1ai4 de5 Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "Best not get too close to those guys..."
msgstr ""
"最好​不要​离​那些​家伙​太近​……\n"
"zui4hao3 bu4yao4 li2 na4xie1 jia1huo5 tai4 jin4……"

msgid ""
"Best of luck then. Everyone here would sure appreciate knowing that the "
"situation is being handled."
msgstr ""
"那​就​祝你好运​吧​。​这里​的​每个​人​肯定​都​希望​听到​事态​已​得到​控制​的​消息​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4 ba1。zhe4li3 de5 mei3ge4 ren2 ken3ding4 dou1 xi1wang4 ting1dao4 shi4tai4 yi3 de2dao4 kong4zhi4 de5 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"Best of luck to you, $(l.name), and good hunting.\n"
"\n"
"Know that you are doing a great thing for the metahumans of Berlin. Your efforts will not go unrecognized."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​祝你好运​，​以及​狩猎​愉快​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​知道​，​你们​正在​为​柏林​的​变​人类​做​一件​伟大​的​事情​。​你们​的​努力​不会​被忽视​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，yi3ji2 shou4lie4 yu2kuai4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 zhi1dao4，ni3men5 zheng4zai4 wei2 bo2lin2 de5 bian4 ren2lei4 zuo4 yi1 jian4 wei3da4 de5 shi4qing5。ni3men5 de5 nu3li4 bu4hui4 bei4 hu1 shi4。"

msgid "Best of luck with that."
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​。\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid ""
"Best of luck with that. Even as we speak, loyal Soldiers of Humanity are converging on this position.\n"
"\n"
"Get ready to die, $(l.race)."
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​。​我们​说话​的​时候​，​忠诚​的​人类​战士​正在​向​我​的​位置​集结​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​准备​受死​吧​，​$(l.race)​。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。wo3men5 shuo1hua4 de5 shi2hou5，zhong1cheng2 de5 ren2lei4 zhan4shi4 zheng4zai4 xiang4 wo3 de5 wei4zhi5 ji2jie2。\n"
"\n"
"zhun3bei4 shou4si3 ba1，$(l.race)。"

msgid ""
"Best of luck with that. Even as we speak, loyal Soldiers of Humanity are converging on this position.\n"
"\n"
"Get ready to die, traitor."
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​。​我们​说话​的​时候​，​忠诚​的​人类​战士​正在​向​我​的​位置​集结​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​准备​受死​吧​，​叛徒​。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。wo3men5 shuo1hua4 de5 shi2hou5，zhong1cheng2 de5 ren2lei4 zhan4shi4 zheng4zai4 xiang4 wo3 de5 wei4zhi5 ji2jie2。\n"
"\n"
"zhun3bei4 shou4si3 ba1，pan4tu2。"

msgid "Best of luck. Let me know how it turns out."
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​。​有​进展​的话​就​告诉​我​。\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。you3 jin4zhan3 de5hua4 jiu4 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "Best step back and stand down before you get hurt."
msgstr ""
"你​最好​老实​后退​，​免得​我伤​了​你​。\n"
"ni3 zui4hao3 lao3shi5 hou4tui4，mian3de5 wo3 shang1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Best that I can tell, he's just a middle-rung toady, like any other corporate suit that you deal with before a run. Only difference is that his organization isn't a corp.\n"
"\n"
"I think he's a little fresh-faced for what the Lodge has him doing. In the beginning, there were some credibility issues - I had a hard time taking the guy seriously. But then he started waving wads of nuyen around, and that all cleared up in a flash."
msgstr ""
"据我所知​，​他​只是​个​中层​傀儡​，​就​像​你​在​干活​之前​要​打交道​的​其他​公司​职员​一样​。​唯一​不同​的​是​，​他​的​组织​不是​公司​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​他​还​太嫩​了​，​扛​不起​“​结社​”​让​他​做​的​事情​。​一​开始​，​他​的​可信度​有些​问题​—​—​我​很​难​把​他​的话​当真​。​但​后来​他​开始​挥舞​着​一沓​沓​的​新円​，​这​一切​怀疑​瞬间​就​烟消云散​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4wo3suo3zhi1，ta1 zhi3shi4 ge4 zhong1ceng2 kui3lei3，jiu4 xiang4 ni3 zai4 gan4huo2 zhi1qian2 yao4 da3jiao1dao4 de5 qi2ta1 gong1si1 zhi2yuan2 yi1yang4。wei2yi1 bu4tong2 de5 shi4，ta1 de5 zu3zhi1 bu4shi4 gong1si1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ta1 hai2 tai4 nen4 le5，gang1 bu4 qi3“jie2she4” rang4 ta1 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5。yi1 kai1shi3，ta1 de5 ke3xin4du4 you3xie1 wen4ti2——wo3 hen3 nan2 ba3 ta1 de5hua4 dang4zhen1。dan4 hou4lai2 ta1 kai1shi3 hui1wu3 zhao2 yi1 da2 da2 de5 xin1 yuan2，zhe4 yi1qie4 huai2yi2 shun4jian1 jiu4 yan1xiao1yun2san4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Best thing for the kid will be to learn through immersion.\n"
"\n"
"If he stays with Samuel's group, he'll have no choice but to interact with metahumans. Soon enough, he'll learn that they're no different than anyone else."
msgstr ""
"就是​得​给​他​制造​这么​个​沉浸​式​环境​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​他​待​在​塞缪尔​那里​，​就​不得不​和​变​人类​打交道​。​很快​他​就​会​明白​，​这些​人​其实​与​人类​并​没有​什么​不同​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 de2 gei3 ta1 zhi4zao4 zhe4me5 ge4 chen2jin4 shi4 huan2jing4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 dai1 zai4 sai4miu4er3 na4li5，jiu4 bu4de2bu4 he4 bian4 ren2lei4 da3jiao1dao4。hen3 kuai4 ta1 jiu4 hui4 ming2bai5，zhe4xie1 ren2 qi2shi2 yu4 ren2lei4 bing4 mei2you3 shen2me5 bu4tong2。"

msgid ""
"Best to be cautious, in our line of work. Should I go meet with Altuğ, then?"
msgstr ""
"干​我们​这行​的​是​该​谨慎​些​。​那么​，​我​是不是​该​去​跟​奥图​伊见​个面​了​？\n"
"gan4 wo3men5 zhe4 xing2 de5 shi4 gai1 jin3shen4 xie1。na4me5，wo3 shi4bu5shi4 gai1 qu4 gen1 ao4 tu2 yi1 jian4 ge4 mian4 le5？"

msgid ""
"Best to keep moving. The control panel for the generators can't be far from your location. When you reach it, the password \"Xolotl\" should allow you to disengage their safety overrides.\n"
"\n"
"Get the job done and get out, $(l.name). I'll be waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"最好​继续前进​。​发电机组​的​控制面板​离​你​所在​的​位置​应该​不远​。​到达​那里​后​，​输入​密码​“​修​洛特​尔​”​应该​就​能​解除​其​安全​超控​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​完成​任务​后​尽快​撤离​，​$(l.name)​。​我会​等​着​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hao3 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 de5 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 li2 ni3 suo3zai4 de5 wei4zhi5 ying1gai1 bu4 yuan3。dao4da2 na4li5 hou4，shu1ru4 mi4ma3“Xiu1luo4te4er3” ying1gai1 jiu4 neng2 jie3chu2 qi2 an1quan2 chao1 kong4。\n"
"\n"
"wan2cheng2 ren4wu5 hou4 jin3kuai4 che4li2，$(l.name)。wo3 hui4 deng3 zhao2 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Bet you told your researchers that their lab would be safe, too. Look how "
"that turned out."
msgstr ""
"你​跟​手下​的​研究员​们​肯定​也​说​过​实验室​十分​安全​吧​。​结果​呢​。\n"
"ni3 gen1 shou3xia4 de5 yan2jiu1yuan2 men5 ken3ding4 ye3 shuo1 guo4 shi2yan4shi4 shi2fen1 an1quan2 ba1。jie1guo3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Better for me to stay out of the public eye an' stick to the shadows. My "
"stint as a role model was ill-advised."
msgstr ""
"对​我​来说​，​最好​还是​远离​公众​目光​，​遁入​暗影​。​我​当初​就​不该​去​做​这个​榜样​。\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1，zui4hao3 hai2shi5 yuan3li2 gong1zhong4 mu4guang1，dun4 ru4 an4ying3。wo3 dang1chu1 jiu4 bu4gai1 qu4 zuo4 zhe4ge5 bang3yang4。"

msgid ""
"Better safe than sorry. You decouple your drone control rig from the drone's interface.\n"
"\n"
"The little thing continues bobbing there, awaiting further instruction."
msgstr ""
"你​选择​稳妥​起​见​，​将​无人机​控制​装置​与​无人机​的​接口​分离​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​小东西​继续​在​那里​晃动​，​等待​进一步​的​指令​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xuan3ze2 wen3tuo3 qi3 jian4，jiang1 wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4 zhuang1zhi4 yu4 wu2ren2ji1 de5 jie1kou3 fen1li2。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 xiao3 dong1 xi1 ji4xu4 zai4 na4li5 huang4dong4，deng3dai4 jin4yi1bu4 de5 zhi3ling4。"

msgid "Better than you, looks like."
msgstr ""
"看起来​比​你​好些​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 bi3 ni3 hao3xie1。"

msgid "Better to be strong and smart in the real world."
msgstr ""
"在​现实​世界​聪明​强壮​不是​更好​吗​。\n"
"zai4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 cong1ming5 qiang2zhuang4 bu4shi4 geng1 hao3 ma5。"

msgid ""
"Better to stick with the lost, desperate souls who've already spent years on the street. The castoffs that nobody cares about.\n"
"\n"
"Lord knows there are enough of them out there."
msgstr ""
"更​稳妥​的​选择​是​继续​吸引​那些​已经​在​街头​流浪​多年​的​迷失​绝望​之​人​。​那些​无人问津​的​弃儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​天知道​外面​有​多少​这样​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"geng1 wen3tuo3 de5 xuan3ze2 shi4 ji4xu4 xi1yin3 na4xie1 yi3jing1 zai4 jie1tou2 liu2lang4 duo1nian2 de5 mi2shi1 jue2wang4 zhi1 ren2。na4xie1 wu2ren2wen4jin1 de5 qi4 er2。\n"
"\n"
"tian1 zhi1 dao4 wai4mian4 you3 duo1shao3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Better to wipe out a species older than humanity, yes? \n"
"\n"
"A creature that has seen the cycle of magic rise and fall time and again could be of no use, surely. "
msgstr ""
"而且​最好​消灭​比​人类​更​古老​的​种族​，​是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​见证​了​魔法​纪元​兴衰​的​种族​肯定​毫无用处​。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 zui4hao3 xiao1mie4 bi3 ren2lei4 geng1 gu3lao3 de5 zhong3zu2，shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 jian4zheng4 le5 mo2fa3 ji4yuan2 xing1shuai1 de5 zhong3zu2 ken3ding4 hao2 wu2 yong4 chu3。"

msgid ""
"Better. But keep the jokes to yourself from now on. Otherwise, I might just decide to treat you like the criminal that you claim to be.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He drops his hand to the handle of his sidearm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here's a hint: you don't want that to happen."
msgstr ""
"这​还​差不多​。​但​你​之后​最好​少​讲​笑话​。​否则​别怪​我​真​把​你​当作​罪犯​来​对待​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​伸手​去​摸​腰间​的​配枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给你个​提示​：​最好​别​让​这种​事​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 cha4bu5duo1。dan4 ni3 zhi1hou4 zui4hao3 shao3 jiang3 xiao4hua5。fou3ze2 bie4 guai4 wo3 zhen1 ba3 ni3 dang4zuo4 zui4fan4 lai2 dui4dai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1shou3 qu4 mo1 yao1jian1 de5 pei4 qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3 ge4 ti2shi4：zui4hao3 bie4 rang4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Beware the holovids, my friend. They will rot your brain.\n"
"\n"
"Nevertheless, it is possible that the Firewing still exists."
msgstr ""
"少​看些​全息​视频​吧​，​我​的​朋友​。​它们​会​腐蚀​你​的​大脑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​无论如何​，​火翼​的确​有​可能​还​活着​。\n"
"\n"
"shao3 kan4 xie1 quan2xi1 shi4pin2 ba1，wo3 de5 peng2you5。ta1men5 hui4 fu3shi2 ni3 de5 da4nao3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wu2lun4ru2he2，Huo3yi4 di2que4 you3 ke3neng2 hai2 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
"Beyond the Hub, there isn't much to speak of. There's a small shop down the hall if you're hungry, or in need of basic supplies.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs and offers you an apologetic smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And that's about it, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""
"除了​中枢​以外​，​就​没什么​可说​的​了​。​如果​你​饿​了​，​或​需要​基础​物资​的话​，​走廊​尽头​有家​小店​可​供​光顾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​，​向​你​露出​一个​歉意​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​就​这些​了​。\n"
"\n"
"chu2le5 zhong1shu1 yi3wai4，jiu4 mei2shen2me5 ke3 shuo1 de5 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 e4 le5，huo4 xu1yao4 ji1chu3 wu4zi1 de5hua4，zou3lang2 jin4tou2 you3 jia1 xiao3dian4 ke3 gong1 guang1gu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1，xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 qian4yi4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 jiu4 zhe4xie1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Big mistake, $(l.man). BIG mistake.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a step back, then turns his head to shout at the toughs behind him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"C'MON, BOYS! Let's show this PARASITE who's boss."
msgstr ""
"大错特错​，​伙计​。​大错特错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​后退​一步​，​转身​朝​身后​的​打手​们​吼道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​兄弟​们​给​我​上​！​让​这个​寄生虫​知道​谁​才​是​老大​！\n"
"\n"
"da4cuo4te4cuo4，huo3ji5。da4cuo4te4cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hou4tui4 yi1 bu4，zhuan3shen1 chao2 shen1hou4 de5 da3shou5 men5 hou3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiong1di4 men5 gei3 wo3 shang4！rang4 zhe4ge5 ji4sheng1chong2 zhi1dao4 shei2 cai2 shi4 lao3da4！"

msgid "Bigger than on the schematic."
msgstr ""
"瞅​着​比​图纸​上​那个​大多​了​。\n"
"chou3 zhao2 bi3 tu2zhi3 shang4 na4ge5 da4duo1 le5。"

msgid "Billy"
msgstr ""
"比利\n"
"bi3li4"

msgid ""
"Billy is no ordinary basilisk! Years of experimentation have remade him into"
" the ultimate killing machine. He's smarter than ten men, and five times as "
"deadly!"
msgstr ""
"比利​可不是​普通​的​蛇​怪​！​多年​的​实验​把​他​变成​了​终极​杀戮​机器​。​他​比​十个​人​更​聪明​，​而且​更​致命​五倍​！\n"
"bi3li4 ke3bu5shi4 pu3tong1 de5 she2 guai4！duo1nian2 de5 shi2yan4 ba3 ta1 bian4cheng2 le5 zhong1ji2 sha1lu4 ji1qi4。ta1 bi3 shi2 ge4 ren2 geng1 cong1ming5，er2qie3 geng1 zhi4ming4 wu3 bei4！"

msgid ""
"Bingo.\n"
"\n"
"No hard feelings - it's just business. I have already hired someone else to take your place."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别往​心里​去​。​生意​就是​生意​。​我​已经​雇​了​其他人​来​代替​你​的​位置​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 wang3 xin1li5 qu4。sheng1yi4 jiu4shi4 sheng1yi4。wo3 yi3jing1 gu4 le5 qi2 ta1 ren2 lai2 dai4ti4 ni3 de5 wei4zhi5。"

msgid "BioTech"
msgstr ""
"生物科技\n"
"sheng1wu4ke1ji4"

msgid "Biometric Scanner"
msgstr ""
"生物​扫描仪\n"
"sheng1wu4 sao3miao2yi2"

msgid "Biotech"
msgstr ""
"生物科技\n"
"sheng1wu4ke1ji4"

msgid "Bioware Samples"
msgstr ""
"生体​改造​样本\n"
"sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4 yang4ben3"

msgid ""
"Bioware. A cluster of specialized nervous tissue that filters out pain "
"responses. +1 Willpower, -1 Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"生体​改造​：​一簇​专门​培育​的​神经​组织​，​能够​过滤​疼痛​反应​。​提供​+​1​意志​，​-​1​智力​。\n"
"sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4：yi1 cu4 zhuan1men2 pei2yu4 de5 shen2jing1 zu3zhi1，neng2gou4 guo4lu:4 teng2tong4 fan3ying4。ti2gong1 +1 yi4zhi4，-1 zhi4li4。"

msgid ""
"Bioware. Braids flourinated polymers into existing muscle tissue to increase"
" physical performance. +1 Quickness, +1 Strength."
msgstr ""
"生体​改造​。​将​氟化​聚合物​融入​现有​肌肉组织​中​，​增强​身体​机能​。​+​1​敏捷​，​+​1​力量​。\n"
"sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4。jiang1 fu2hua4 ju4he2wu4 rong2ru4 xian4you3 ji1rou4zu3zhi1 zhong4，zeng1qiang2 shen1ti3 ji1neng2。+1 min3jie2，+1 li4liang5。"

msgid ""
"Bioware. Coats and lubricates joint surfaces of the legs to provide extreme "
"fluidity of motion. +1 Dodge, +1 Quickness."
msgstr ""
"生体​改造​。​涂覆​在​腿部​关节​表面​用以​润滑​，​将​动作​流畅性​提升​到​极致​。​+​1​闪避​，​+​1​敏捷​。\n"
"sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4。tu2 fu4 zai4 tui3bu4 guan1jie2 biao3mian4 yong4yi3 run4hua2，jiang1 dong4zuo4 liu2 chang4 xing4 ti2sheng1 dao4 ji2zhi4。+1 shan3bi4，+1 min3jie2。"

msgid ""
"Bioware. Implants a genetically tailored toxin sac above the larynx. Popular"
" among assassins. Grants a close-range poison attack. 10 DMG, 4 ongoing."
msgstr ""
"生体​改造​。​在​喉部​植入​基因​定制​毒液​囊​，​在​暗杀​者​中​很​常见​。​赋予​近距离​毒液​攻击能力​。​造成​10​点​伤害​，​同时​造成​4​点​持续​伤害​。\n"
"sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4。zai4 hou2bu4 zhi2ru4 ji1yin1 ding4zhi4 du2ye4 nang2，zai4 an4sha1 zhe3 zhong4 hen3 chang2jian4。fu4yu3 jin4ju4li2 du2ye4 gong1 ji1 neng2 li4。zao4cheng2 10 dian3 shang1hai4，tong2shi2 zao4cheng2 4 dian3 chi2xu4 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"Bioware. Increases thrombocyte production to a high level, lessening trauma "
"from recent wounds."
msgstr ""
"生体​改造​：​显著​提升​血小板​生成​水平​，​减轻​近期​创伤​造成​的​损伤​。\n"
"sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4：xian3zhu4 ti2sheng1 xue4xiao3ban3 sheng1cheng2 shui3ping2，jian3qing1 jin4qi1 chuang1shang1 zao4cheng2 de5 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"Bioware. Introduces additional convolutions and gyri into the frontal lobes "
"of the cerebellum, boosting intelligence by 1."
msgstr ""
"生体​改造​：​为​你​的​大脑​额叶​添加​额外​的​沟回​。​提升​1​点​智力​。\n"
"sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4：wei2 ni3 de5 da4nao3 e2ye4 tian1jia1 e2wai4 de5 gou1 hui2。ti2sheng1 1 dian3 zhi4li4。"

msgid ""
"Bioware. Weaves grafts of synthagen, an energy-diffusing material, under the"
" skin. Adds +1 Armor."
msgstr ""
"生体​改造​。​在​皮下​编织​移植​的​合成​素​，​这是​一种​能量​扩散​材料​。​+​1​护甲​。\n"
"sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4。zai4 pi2xia4 bian1zhi1 yi2zhi2 de5 he2cheng2 su4，zhe4 shi4 yi1zhong3 neng2liang4 kuo4san4 cai2liao4。+1 hu4jia3。"

msgid "Bitch!"
msgstr ""
"贱人​！\n"
"jian4ren2！"

msgid "Black Hammer Lvl 1"
msgstr ""
"黑锤​I\n"
"hei1 chui2 I"

msgid "Black IC"
msgstr ""
"黑​IC\n"
"hei1 IC"

msgid "Blade Specialist I"
msgstr ""
"刀刃​专家​I\n"
"dao1ren4 zhuan1jia1 I"

msgid "Bladed Distraction"
msgstr ""
"分神​之刃\n"
"fen1shen2 zhi1 ren4"

msgid ""
"Bladed Distraction: Does +1 AP DMG but reduces HP DMG by 3. Cooldown: 2"
msgstr ""
"分神​之刃​：​造成​的​行动​力​损伤​增加​1​点​，​生命​值​伤害​减少​3​点​。​冷却​时间​：​2​回合\n"
"fen1shen2 zhi1 ren4：zao4cheng2 de5 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1 zeng1jia1 1 dian3，sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 3 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：2 hui2he2"

msgid "Blame Harrow for that, not me."
msgstr ""
"这​都​要​怪​哈罗​，​而​不是​我​。\n"
"zhe4 dou1 yao4 guai4 ha1luo2，er2 bu4shi4 wo3。"

msgid "Blame whoever you like. It doesn’t change what you are."
msgstr ""
"你​要​怪​谁​都​可以​。​但​这​改变​不了​你​的​本质​。\n"
"ni3 yao4 guai4 shei2 dou1 ke3yi3。dan4 zhe4 gai3bian4 bu4le5 ni3 de5 ben3zhi4。"

msgid "Blast Door Control Node"
msgstr ""
"防爆​门​控制​节点\n"
"fang2 bao4 men2 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3"

msgid "Blast Doors"
msgstr ""
"防爆​门\n"
"fang2 bao4 men2"

msgid "Blaster Lvl 1"
msgstr ""
"冲击波​I\n"
"chong1ji1bo1 I"

