msgstr ""
"极乐\n"
"ji2le4"

msgid "Bliss: Incoming DMG -3, Strength -1"
msgstr ""
"极乐​：​受到​的​伤害​减少​3​点​，​力量​-​1\n"
"ji2le4：shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 3 dian3，li4liang5 -1"

msgid "Bliss: Incoming DMG -4, Strength -1"
msgstr ""
"极乐​：​受到​的​伤害​减少​4​点​，​力量​-​1\n"
"ji2le4：shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 4 dian3，li4liang5 -1"

msgid "Blitz"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨\n"
"Bu4li3ci2"

msgid "Blitz Died."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​死​了​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 si3 le5。"

msgid "Blitz Must Survive"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​必须​存活\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 bi4xu1 cun2huo2"

msgid ""
"Blitz falls into a disgruntled silence. You can hear the soft murmur of Hasenkamp speaking into his commlink from across the room.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, he taps the power button and deactivates the device."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​陷入​不满​的​沉默​。​隔壁​房间​传来​哈森​坎普​对​着​通讯​链​轻声​说话​的​低语​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​他​轻敲​电源​按钮​，​关闭​了​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 xian4ru4 bu4man3 de5 chen2mo4。ge2bi4 fang2jian1 chuan2lai2 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 dui4 zhao2 tong1xun4 lian4 qing1sheng1 shuo1hua4 de5 di1yu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 qing1 qiao1 dian4yuan2 an4niu3，guan1bi4 le5 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"Blitz gains a Fairlight Excalibur cyberdeck, replacing his old VirtuaX deck."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​获得​一台​衡光​的​断​钢剑赛​博碟板​，​替换​了​他​老旧​的​VirtuaX​赛博碟板​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 huo4de2 yi1 tai2 heng2 guang1 de5 duan4 gang1 jian4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3，ti4huan4 le5 ta1 lao3jiu4 de5 VirtuaX sai4 bo2 die2 ban3。"

msgid ""
"Blitz gains a hydraulic jack cyberware, increasing his move speed by 4 as a "
"0 AP action. Duration: 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​获得​了​一个​液压​千斤顶​赛博​改造​，​可以​用​一个​不​花费​行动​点​的​动作​增加​4​点​移动​速度​。​持续时间​：​1​回合​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 huo4de2 le5 yi1ge5 ye4ya1 qian1jin1ding3 sai4bo2 gai3zao4，ke3yi3 yong4 yi1ge5 bu4 hua1fei4 xing2dong4 dian3 de5 dong4zuo4 zeng1jia1 4 dian3 yi2dong4 su4du4。chi2xu4shi2jian1：1 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Blitz gives you a significant glance.\n"
"\n"
"You can see the disgust in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​意味深长​地瞥​了​你​一眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​看出​他​眼中​的​憎恶​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 yi4wei4shen1chang2 de5 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 zeng1e4。"

msgid ""
"Blitz gives you a small nod. His hand falls away from the machine pistol at "
"his waist."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​朝​你​微微​点头​。​他​的​手​从​腰间​的​冲锋​手枪​上移​开​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 chao2 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。ta1 de5 shou3 cong2 yao1jian1 de5 chong1feng1 shou3qiang1 shang4 yi2 kai1。"

msgid "Blitz holds his tongue and nods."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​闭上嘴​，​点​了​点头​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 bi4 shang4 zui3，dian3 le5 dian3tou2。"

msgid "Blitz must find the Matrix node to unlock the side entrance."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​必须​找到​矩阵​节点​才能​解锁​侧门​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 bi4xu1 zhao3dao4 ju3zhen4 jie2dian3 cai2neng2 jie3suo3 ce4men2。"

msgid ""
"Blitz must not get dumped from the Matrix or he won't be able to get back "
"into the Landenburg Ring System."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​不能​被​踢​出​矩阵​，​否则​他​将​无法​回到​兰​登堡​帮​的​系统​中​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 bu4neng2 bei4 ti1 chu1 ju3zhen4，fou3ze2 ta1 jiang1 wu2fa3 hui2dao4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5 xi4tong3 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Blitz plugs his cyberdeck into the terminal and punches the \"Escape\" key with a flourish. A second later, he hits the \"Y\" key.\n"
"\n"
"The building lights flicker."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​将​自己​的​赛博碟板​插入​终端​，​然后​潇洒​地​按​下​“​Esc​”​键​。​紧接着​，​他​又​迅速​敲​下​“​Y​”​键​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大楼​的​灯光​闪烁​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 jiang1 zi4ji3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 cha1ru4 zhong1duan1，ran2hou4 xiao1sa3 de5 an4 xia4“Esc” jian4。jin3jie1zhe5，ta1 you4 xun4su4 qiao1 xia4“Y” jian4。\n"
"\n"
"da4lou2 de5 deng1guang1 shan3shuo4 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"Blitz slots the optical cable into the jackpoint on the terminal.\n"
"\n"
"His body relaxes as his mind enters the Matrix."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​将​光缆​插进​终端​的​接入点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​意识​接入​矩阵​，​身体​随即​放松​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 jiang1 guang1lan3 cha1jin4 zhong1duan1 de5 jie1ru4dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 yi4shi2 jie1ru4 ju3zhen4，shen1ti3 sui2ji2 fang4song1 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"Blitz steps back, blinking. A sudden gust of wind kicks smoke and dust into "
"the air."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​后退​一步​，​眨​了​眨眼​。​一阵​狂风​骤起​，​卷起​漫天​烟尘​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 hou4tui4 yi1 bu4，zha3 le5 zha3yan3。yi1zhen4 kuang2feng1 zhou4 qi3，juan3qi3 man4tian1 yan1chen2。"

msgid ""
"Blitz takes a moment to examine the protrusion at the base of the MKVI's spine. Then he pops the case on the Cyberzombie's control unit.\n"
"\n"
"He connects an optical cable to the jack above his temple and the other end into the MKVI's circuitry. A moment later, a strange shiver runs through its body, and he snatches the cable loose."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​花​了​片刻​时间​检查​MKVI​脊柱​底部​的​凸起​物​，​随即​撬​开赛​博​僵尸​控制​单元​的​外壳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​把​一根​光缆​接到​MKVI​太阳穴​上方​的​接口​，​另一端​接入​MKVI​的​电路​。​不​出​片刻​，​MKVI​的​躯体​诡异​地​颤​了​一下​，​布里​茨​也​收回​了​他​的​光缆​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 hua1 le5 pian4ke4 shi2jian1 jian3cha2 MKVI ji3zhu4 di3bu4 de5 tu1qi3 wu4，sui2ji2 qiao4 kai1sai4 bo2 jiang1shi1 kong4zhi4 dan1yuan2 de5 wai4ke2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ba3 yi1 gen1 guang1lan3 jie1dao4 MKVI tai4yang2xue2 shang4fang1 de5 jie1kou3，ling4 yi1 duan1 jie1ru4 MKVI de5 dian4lu4。bu4 chu1 pian4ke4，MKVI de5 qu1ti3 gui3yi4 de5 chan4 le5 yi1xia4，Bu4li3ci2 ye3 shou1hui2 le5 ta1 de5 guang1lan3。"

msgid ""
"Blitz unclips his cyberdeck from its place on his back. With an ease born of endless repetition, he connects himself to his cyberdeck.\n"
"\n"
"He shoots you a nervous glance, his body language completely at odds with his typical hot-shot bravado. Then he moves to connect his deck to the jackpoint on the terminal."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​从​背上​取下赛​博碟板​。​凭借​无数次​重复​的​熟练​操作​，​他​驾轻就熟​地连上​自己​的​碟​板​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​朝​你​投来​紧张​的​目光​，​此刻​肢体​语言​与​他​惯常​的​狂妄​气焰​截然​相反​。​随后​他​起身​，​将​碟​板​插进​终端​的​接入点​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 cong2 bei1 shang4 qu3 xia4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3。ping2jie4 wu2 shu3 ci4 chong2fu4 de5 shu2lian4 cao1zuo4，ta1 jia4qing1jiu4shu2 de5 lian2 shang4 zi4ji3 de5 die2 ban3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chao2 ni3 tou2 lai2 jin3zhang1 de5 mu4guang1，ci3ke4 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 yu4 ta1 guan4chang2 de5 kuang2wang4 qi4yan4 jie2ran2 xiang1fan3。sui2hou4 ta1 qi3shen1，jiang1 die2 ban3 cha1jin4 zhong1duan1 de5 jie1ru4dian3。"

msgid "Blitz' Outfit"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​的​服装\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 de5 fu2zhuang1"

msgid "Blitz's Decking is increased by 1."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​的​骇入​增加​1​点​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 de5 hai4 ru4 zeng1jia1 1 dian3。"

msgid "Blitz's ESP Control is increased by 1."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​的​专家系统​程序控制​增加​1​点​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 de5 zhuan1jia1xi4tong3 cheng2 xu4 kong4 zhi4 zeng1jia1 1 dian3。"

msgid ""
"Blitz's basic cybereyes are upgraded to a deluxe model. Accuracy increased "
"by 3%, for a total of 6%."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​的​基础​赛博眼​升级​为​高级​型号​。​精准度​增加​3​%​，​总共​增加​6​%​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 de5 ji1chu3 sai4 bo2 yan3 sheng1ji2 wei2 gao1ji2 xing2hao4。jing1 zhun3 du4 zeng1jia1 3 %，zong3gong4 zeng1jia1 6%。"

msgid "Blitz's trusty submachine gun now pierces 1 point of Armor."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​的​可靠​冲锋枪​现在​可以​提供​1​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 de5 ke3kao4 chong1feng1qiang1 xian4zai4 ke3yi3 ti2gong1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid ""
"Blitz's voice cuts out, and the air fills with a distinctive whirring sound.\n"
"\n"
"Two of the turrets retrain themselves on you."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​的​声音​戛然而止​，​空气​中​充斥​着​独特​的​嗡嗡声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​两座​炮塔​重新​瞄准​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 jia2ran2er2zhi3，kong1qi4 zhong4 chong1chi4 zhao2 du2te4 de5 weng1weng1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"liang3 zuo4 pao4ta3 chong2xin1 miao2zhun3 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Blitz's voice falls silent. A few seconds later, a brief message appears on "
"the screen of your PDA."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​说完​的​几秒钟​后​，​你​的​PDA​屏幕​上​出现​了​一条​短消息​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 shuo1 wan2 de5 ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 de5 PDA ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 yi1 tiao2 duan3 xiao1 xi1。"

msgid "Blitz, I changed my mind. Waste this guy for me."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​我​改变​主意​了​。​给​我​弄死​这​家伙​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，wo3 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 le5。gei3 wo3 nong4si3 zhe4 jia1huo5。"

msgid "Blitz, I'm detecting a pattern here."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​我​这里​有​情况​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，wo3 zhe4li3 you3 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"Blitz, is that loan shark still giving you trouble? Maybe we should take "
"care of that first..."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​那个​放高利贷​的​还​在​给​你​找麻烦​吗​？​也许​我们​应该​先​处理​那个​……\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，na4ge5 fang4 gao1 li4 dai4 de5 hai2 zai4 gei3 ni3 zhao3ma2fan5 ma5？ye3xu3 wo3men5 ying1gai1 xian1 chu3li3 na4ge5……"

msgid "Blitz, what the hell--"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​什么​鬼​—​—\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，shen2me5 gui3 — —"

msgid "Blitz, you need to--"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​你​需要​—​—\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，ni3 xu1yao4 — —"

msgid ""
"Blitz. I am having a conversation with $(l.name), and I don't appreciate being interrupted.\n"
"\n"
"If you keep this up, I'm going to get irritated. So for the rest of this conversation, you keep your mouth shut. Understand?"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​。​我​正在​和​$(l.name)​谈话​，​我​不​喜欢​被​打断​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​再​这样​下去​的话​，​我​就要​不耐烦​了​。​所以​接下来​的​对话​里​，​闭上​你​的​嘴​。​明白​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2。wo3 zheng4zai4 he4 $(l.name) tan2hua4，wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 bei4 da3duan4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 zhe4yang4 xia4qu4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4yao4 bu4nai4fan2 le5。suo3yi3 jie1xia4lai2 de5 dui4hua4 li3，bi4shang5 ni3 de5 zui3。ming2bai5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Blitz. I don't blame you for your reaction... you don't even know me, after "
"all. But I know you quite well."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​我​不怪​你​的​反应​……​毕竟​你​根本​不​认识​我​。​但​我​对​你​却​很​了解​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，wo3 bu4 guai4 ni3 de5 fan3ying4……bi4jing4 ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 ren4shi5 wo3。dan4 wo3 dui4 ni3 que4 hen3 liao3jie3。"

msgid ""
"Blitz. LISTEN TO ME. You need to show some more of that self-control and "
"*drop* this."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​听​我​说​。​你​需要​展现出​更强​的​自制力​，​*​放下​*​这​一切​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，ting1 wo3 shuo1。ni3 xu1yao4 zhan3 xian4 chu1 geng1 jiang4 de5 zi4zhi4li4，*fang4xia4*zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"Blitz. Listen to me. This is a bad idea, and nothing good is going to come "
"from it."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​听​我​说​。​这​是​个​坏主意​，​而且​绝对​不会​有​什么​好​后果​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，ting1 wo3 shuo1。zhe4 shi4 ge4 huai4 zhu3 yi4，er2qie3 jue2dui4 bu4hui4 you3 shen2me5 hao3 hou4guo3。"

msgid ""
"Blitz. Tell me what happened between Luster putting the price on your head "
"and the hotel getting attacked."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​告诉​我​，​拉斯特​悬赏​追杀​你​和​旅馆​遇袭​之间​发生​了​什么​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，gao4su4 wo3，la1 si1 te4 xuan2shang3 zhui1sha1 ni3 he4 lu:3guan3 yu4xi2 zhi1jian1 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid "Blitz. Where did you take this data *from?*"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​你​*​从​哪​*​弄​来​的​数据​？\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，ni3*cong2 na3*long4 lai2 de5 shu4ju4？"

msgid ""
"Blitz. You sadden me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image slowly shakes its head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I was hoping that this would be pleasant meeting."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​你​让​我​感到​悲哀​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​慢慢​地摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我本​希望​这会​是​一次​愉快​的​相逢​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，ni3 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 bei1ai1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 man4man4 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3 xi1wang4 zhe4 hui4 shi4 yi1ci4 yu2kuai4 de5 xiang1feng2。"

msgid ""
"Blitz... I don't want to offend you. But I've really, truly heard enough "
"about your love life."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​……​不是​我​说​你​，​但​你​的​感情​故事​，​我​真的​听够​了​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2……bu4shi4 wo3 shuo1 ni3，dan4 ni3 de5 gan3qing2 gu4shi4，wo3 zhen1de5 ting1 gou4 le5。"

