"\n"
"lao3da4。ni3 zai4 kao3lu:4 xia4 ba1。*qiu2 ni3 le5。*\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ke3shi4 wo3 de5*jia1ren2*。ta1 hai2 zhi3shi4 ge4*hai2zi5*。er2qie3 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2 zhen1 gao3 bu4 ding4 zhe4 shi4。"

