msgid ""
"Breaking the rock won't work. We'll have to take on the spirit directly... track it to where it lives, and kill it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pats the satchel that hangs from her shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've brought what we'll need to do that."
msgstr ""
"只​打碎​石头​是​没用​的​。​我们​必须​直接​对付​那个​精魂​……​得​追踪​到​它​的​所在地​，​然后​杀死​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​拍拍​挂​在​肩上​的​挎包​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​带上​了​必备​的​工具​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 da3sui4 shi2tou5 shi4 mei2yong4 de5。wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhi2jie1 dui4fu5 na4ge5 jing1hun2……de2 zhui1zong1 dao4 ta1 de5 suo3zai4di4，ran2hou4 sha1si3 ta1。\n"
