msgstr ""
"移动​医联​基础​急救​套件\n"
"yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 ji1chu3 ji2jiu4 tao4jian4"

msgid "BuMoNA Gold Trauma Kit"
msgstr ""
"BuMoNA​黄金​急救​套件\n"
"BuMoNA huang2jin1 ji2jiu4 tao4jian4"

msgid "BuMoNA Platinum Trauma Kit"
msgstr ""
"BuMoNa​铂金​急救​套件\n"
"BuMoNa bo2jin1 ji2jiu4 tao4jian4"

msgid "BuMoNa Trauma Kit"
msgstr ""
"移动​医联​急救​套件\n"
"yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 ji2jiu4 tao4jian4"

msgid "Building Maintenance"
msgstr ""
"建筑维护\n"
"jian4 zhu4 wei2 hu4"

msgid ""
"Bullshit. My choices didn't play into any interest of Lofwyr's, or any other"
" dragon's."
msgstr ""
"放屁​。​我​的​选择​，​和​洛夫​维尔​或者​其他​任何​巨龙​的​利益​都​没关系​。\n"
"fang4pi4。wo3 de5 xuan3ze2，he4 Luo4fu1wei2er3 huo4zhe3 qi2ta1 ren4he2 ju4long2 de5 li4yi4 dou1 mei2guan1xi5。"

msgid "Bullshit. This thing is lying to us, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"简直​是​扯淡​。​$(l.name)​，​这​东西​在​*​欺骗​*​我们​。\n"
"jian3zhi2 shi4 che3dan4。$(l.name)，zhe4 dong1xi1 zai4*qi1pian4*wo3men5。"

msgid "Bullshit. You're falling into the same trap that I did."
msgstr ""
"扯淡​。​你​只是​落入​了​和​我​当时​一样​的​陷阱​。\n"
"che3dan4。ni3 zhi3shi4 luo4ru4 le5 he4 wo3 dang1shi2 yi1yang4 de5 xian4jing3。"

msgid ""
"Bunch of tough guys. They took a big cut of my sales in protection money... all in the name of \"the working class.\"\n"
"\n"
"Funny. Last time I checked, *I* was one of the working class. In fact, I'm the only one who's *working* in this whole damned building."
msgstr ""
"一群​狠​角色​。​他们​从​我​的​销售额​里​抽走​了​一大笔​保护费​……​全​打着​“​工人阶级​”​的​旗号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说来​可笑​，​*​我​*​不​也​是​工人阶级​吗​？​实际上​，​在​这栋​破楼​里​，​只有​我​一个​人​还​在​*​工作​*​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 qun2 hen3 jue2se4。ta1men5 cong2 wo3 de5 xiao1shou4e2 li3 chou1 zou3 le5 yi1 dai4 bi3 bao3 hu4 fei4……quan2 da3 zhao2“gong1ren2jie1ji2” de5 qi2hao4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 lai2 ke3xiao4，*wo3*bu4 ye3 shi4 gong1ren2jie1ji2 ma5？shi2ji4shang4，zai4 zhe4 dong4 po4 lou2 li3，zhi3you3 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2 hai2 zai4*gong1zuo4*。"

msgid "Bundle of Old Discs"
msgstr ""
"一捆​旧​光盘\n"
"yi1 kun3 jiu4 guang1pan2"

msgid ""
"Burakgazi’s agent tailed Green Winters to a hotel in a cesspool of a kiez "
"called \"Drogenkippe\"."
msgstr ""
"布拉加​齐​的​探子​跟踪​格林​·​温特斯​到​了​一家​旅馆​，​其​位于​名为​“​毒坑区​”​的​贫民窟​街区​。\n"
"bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 de5 tan4zi5 gen1zong1 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 dao4 le5 yi1jia1 lu:3guan3，qi2 wei4yu2 ming2wei2“du2 keng1 qu1” de5 pin2min2ku1 jie1qu1。"

msgid "Burst Fire"
msgstr ""
"点射\n"
"dian3she4"

msgid ""
"Business, huh?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Frank pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look... we don't want any, ah, corporate trouble around here."
msgstr ""
"生意​，​哈​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​弗兰克​顿​了​顿​，​琢磨​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​……​我们​可​不想​，​呃​，​找​公司​的​麻烦​。\n"
"\n"
"sheng1yi4，ha1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2lan2ke4 dun4 le5 dun4，zhuo2mo2 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4ge5……wo3men5 ke3 bu4xiang3，e4，zhao3 gong1si1 de5 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"Business.\n"
"\n"
"I have a job for you."
msgstr ""
"业务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​一份​差事​给​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ye4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 yi1 fen4 cha4shi4 gei3 ni3。"

msgid "Business. Can't discuss it. I'm sure you understand."
msgstr ""
"是​生意​上​的​事​，​不能​透露​。​我​相信​你​能​理解​。\n"
"shi4 sheng1yi4 shang4 de5 shi4，bu4neng2 tou4lu4。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3。"

msgid "Busy Man"
msgstr ""
"忙碌​的​男人\n"
"mang2lu4 de5 nan2ren2"

msgid "But Doc Ezkibel found me. He picked me up, took me with him."
msgstr ""
"但​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​找到​了​我​。​他​带​我​离开​了​。\n"
"dan4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 zhao3dao4 le5 wo3。ta1 dai4 wo3 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"But Feuerschwinge was different. She didn't scheme, or plot. She *acted.*"
msgstr ""
"但​火翼​不同​。​她​不​耍​心机​，​也​不​搞​阴谋诡计​。​她​直接​采取​了​*​行动​*​。\n"
"dan4 Huo3yi4 bu4tong2。ta1 bu4 shua3 xin1ji1，ye3 bu4 gao3 yin1mou2gui3ji4。ta1 zhi2jie1 cai3qu3 le5*xing2dong4*。"

msgid ""
"But I already own the cyberware! Shouldn't that entitle me to a discount, or"
" something?"
msgstr ""
"但​我​已经​有赛​博​改造​了​！​你​不​应该​给​我​打个​折​什么​的​吗​？\n"
"dan4 wo3 yi3jing1 you3 sai4 bo2 gai3zao4 le5！ni3 bu4 ying1gai1 gei3 wo3 da3 ge4 zhe1 shen2me5 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"But I can appreciate the effort you're making.\n"
"\n"
"It's something new. And it's worthy of exploring."
msgstr ""
"但​我​很​感谢​你​所​做​的​努力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​感觉​很​新鲜​，​而且​值得​多加​探索​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 hen3 gan3xie4 ni3 suo3 zuo4 de5 nu3li4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2 hen3 xin1xian1，er2qie3 zhi2de5 duo1 jia1 tan4suo3。"

msgid ""
"But I don't celebrate the title. Far too many young soldiers died under the "
"command of the Arctic Fox."
msgstr ""
"但​我​并​不​喜欢​这个​头衔​。​在​“​北极狐​”​的​指挥​下​，​有太多​年轻​士兵​丧生​。\n"
"dan4 wo3 bing4 bu4 xi3huan5 zhe4ge5 tou2xian2。zai4“bei3ji2hu2” de5 zhi3hui1 xia4，you3 tai4 duo1 nian2qing1 shi4bing1 sang4sheng1。"

msgid ""
"But I need them!\n"
"\n"
"Monika understood that. And Zaak says they're safe."
msgstr ""
"但​我​需要​它们​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​理解​这点​。​而且​扎克​说​它们​是​安全​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 xu1yao4 ta1men5！\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 li3jie3 zhe4 dian3。er2qie3 Zha1ke4 shuo1 ta1men5 shi4 an1quan2 de5。"

msgid ""
"But I neeeeeed it, Kroner! Come on!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her words come out in a desperate whine. Pale skin, sunken eyes, and a trembling lip all point to the early symptoms of withdrawal.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And I have cash, I totally do! It's up in my room, but you guys won't let me up there to get it!"
msgstr ""
"但是​我​真的​需要​，​克​罗纳​！​求​你​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的话​伴随​着​一阵​绝望​的​干嚎​。​女孩​皮肤​惨白​，​眼眶​深陷​，​嘴唇​还​一直​发抖​—​—​全是​停药​以后​的​早期​反应​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​有钱​，​我​真​有钱​！​就​在​上面​，​在​我​房间​里​呢​，​可是​你们​这帮​人​又​不让​我​上去​拿​！\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 wo3 zhen1de5 xu1yao4，ke4 luo2na4！qiu2 ni3 le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5hua4 ban4sui2 zhao2 yi1zhen4 jue2wang4 de5 gan1hao2。nu:3hai2 pi2fu1 can3bai2，yan3kuang4 shen1xian4，zui3chun2 hai2 yi1zhi2 fa1dou3——quan2 shi4 ting2 yao4 yi3hou4 de5 zao3qi1 fan3ying4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 you3qian2，wo3 zhen1 you3qian2！jiu4 zai4 shang4mian4，zai4 wo3 fang2jian1 li3 ni2，ke3shi4 ni3men5 zhe4 bang1 ren2 you4 bu4 rang4 wo3 shang4qu4 na2！"

msgid ""
"But I think I finally do.\n"
"\n"
"Without you, this place would have surely fallen. There would have been nothing left but blood and ashes."
msgstr ""
"但​我​认为​我​终于​明白​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​你​，​这个​地方​肯定​会​崩溃​。​这里​将​只​剩下​鲜血​与​灰烬​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 ren4wei2 wo3 zhong1yu2 ming2bai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ni3，zhe4ge5 di4fang1 ken3ding4 hui4 beng1kui4。zhe4li3 jiang1 zhi3 sheng4xia4 xian1xue4 yu4 hui1jin4。"

msgid "But I want to. I want to know why this happened. I want to understand."
msgstr ""
"但​我​想​知道​。​我​想​知道​这​一切​为什么​会​发生​。​我​想要​理解​。\n"
"dan4 wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4。wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1qie4 wei4shen2me5 hui4 fa1sheng1。wo3 xiang3yao4 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"But I was kidding myself, of course. My new deity was the very definition of"
" bad. Serving it made *me* bad. End of story."
msgstr ""
"但​我​当然​是​在​自欺欺人​。​我​的​新​神明​就是​邪恶​的​化身​。​侍奉​它​让​*​我​*​也​变得​邪恶​。​故事​到此结束​。\n"
"dan4 wo3 dang1ran2 shi4 zai4 zi4qi1qi1ren2。wo3 de5 xin1 shen2ming2 jiu4shi4 xie2e4 de5 hua4shen1。shi4feng4 ta1 rang4*wo3*ye3 bian4de5 xie2e4。gu4shi4 dao4 ci3 jie1 shu4。"

msgid "But I'll still try. I have to try."
msgstr ""
"但​我​依旧会​试试​。​我​一定​会​的​。\n"
"dan4 wo3 yi1 jiu4 hui4 shi4 shi4。wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 de5。"

msgid "But I--"
msgstr ""
"但​我​—​—\n"
"dan4 wo3 — —"

msgid "But I..."
msgstr ""
"但​我​……\n"
"dan4 wo3……"

msgid ""
"But Monika was a stabilizing force. And not just because she was dangerous. "
"She was smart, and funny, and wise and she had a way with people. They "
"wanted to support her, to follow her… because they loved her."
msgstr ""
"但​莫妮卡​是​一股​稳定​的​力量​。​不仅​因为​她​危险​，​更​因​她​聪慧​、​风趣​、​睿智​，​且​深谙​人情世故​。​人们​愿意​支持​她​、​追随​她​……​只​因​他们​深爱着​她​。\n"
"dan4 Mo4ni1ka3 shi4 yi1 gu3 wen3ding4 de5 li4liang5。bu4jin3 yin1wei4 ta1 wei1xian3，geng1 yin1 ta1 cong1hui4、feng1qu4、rui4zhi4，qie3 shen1an1 ren2qing2shi4gu4。ren2men5 yuan4yi4 zhi1chi2 ta1、zhui1sui2 ta1……zhi3 yin1 ta1men5 shen1 ai4 zhao2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"But Monika wasn't just another meal. There was something different about her. Something *special.*\n"
"\n"
"I don't know how or why, ace, but when I absorbed her consciousness into myself, something happened. A miraculous event."
msgstr ""
"但​莫妮卡​不是​什么​普通​的​餐食​。​她​和​其他人​不​一样​，​有​某种​*​特别​*​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​王牌​，​我​对此​并​不​清楚​原因​或​过程​，​但​当​我​将​她​的​意识​吸收​到​自己​体内​时​，​发生​了​某种​事​。​简直​宛如​奇迹​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 Mo4ni1ka3 bu4shi4 shen2me5 pu3tong1 de5 can1shi2。ta1 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 bu4 yi1yang4，you3 mou3zhong3*te4bie2*de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wang2pai2，wo3 dui4 ci3 bing4 bu4 qing1chu5 yuan2yin1 huo4 guo4cheng2，dan4 dang1 wo3 jiang1 ta1 de5 yi4shi2 xi1shou1 dao4 zi4ji3 ti3nei4 shi2，fa1sheng1 le5 mou3zhong3 shi4。jian3zhi2 wan3ru2 qi2ji4。"

msgid ""
"But Monika, she would do anything for her Cause. Anything for the Flux State.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Winters swore that the data he was after was crucial to ensuring the future stability of the Flux."
msgstr ""
"可是​莫妮卡​—​—​为了​她​的​理想​，​她​什么​都​乐意​做​。​特别​是​为了​动荡​带​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​温特斯​信誓旦旦​地说​，​这些​数据​至关重要​，​是因为​他​要​以此​来​保证​动荡​带​未来​的​安全​与​稳定​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3shi4 Mo4ni1ka3——wei4le5 ta1 de5 li3xiang3，ta1 shen2me5 dou1 le4yi4 zuo4。te4bie2 shi4 wei4le5 dong4dang4 dai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Wen1te4si1 xin4shi4dan4dan4 de5 shuo1，zhe4xie1 shu4ju4 zhi4guan1zhong4yao4，shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 yao4 yi3ci3 lai2 bao3zheng4 dong4dang4 dai4 wei4lai2 de5 an1quan2 yu4 wen3ding4。"

msgid ""
"But RNA viruses are inherently unpredictable - a first-year biology student "
"could tell you that. You have no way of knowing *how* your Panacea will "
"mutate once you let it out of this lab. It could do everything you say... or"
" it could become something else entirely. You don't know."
msgstr ""
"但​RNA​病毒​天生​难以预测​—​—​连​生物​专业​的​大​一​学生​都​能​告诉​你​这​一点​。​一旦​你​将​这种​“​万能​药​”​释放​出​实验室​，​你​就​无法​预知​它会​如何​变异​。​它​可能​如你所愿​……​也​可能​完全​变成​另​一种​东西​。​这是​无法​预料​的​。\n"
"dan4 RNA bing4du2 tian1sheng1 nan2 yi3 yu4 ce4——lian2 sheng1wu4 zhuan1ye4 de5 dai4 yi1 xue2sheng5 dou1 neng2 gao4su4 ni3 zhe4 yi1dian3。yi1dan4 ni3 jiang1 zhe4zhong3“wan4neng2 yao4” shi4fang4 chu1 shi2yan4shi4，ni3 jiu4 wu2fa3 yu4zhi1 ta1 hui4 ru2he2 bian4yi4。ta1 ke3neng2 ru2 ni3 suo3 yuan4……ye3 ke3neng2 wan2quan2 bian4cheng2 ling4 yi1zhong3 dong1xi1。zhe4 shi4 wu2fa3 yu4liao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"But Titonius!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice comes out in a lilting wail.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You cannot die! I... I *love* you!"
msgstr ""
"但是​泰托​尼乌斯​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​带​着​哀婉​的​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不能​死​！​我​……​我​*​爱​*​你​！\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 ai1wan3 de5 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4neng2 si3！wo3……wo3*ai4*ni3！"

msgid ""
"But at the end of the day, I am a man of action. I have always been so. \n"
"\n"
"While businessmen and politicians deliberate in their board rooms and committees, I have done what needed to be done. \n"
"\n"
"And now here I am, executing the greatest act of service that I can conceive of. \n"
"\n"
"The salvation of humanity itself."
msgstr ""
"但​归根结底​，​我​是​个​行动​派​。​我​一直​都​是​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​商人​和​政客​们​在​董事会​和​委员会​中​商议​时​，​我​已经​做​了​该​做​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​现在​，​我​正在​执行​我能​想象​到​的​最​伟大​的​事业​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​人类​自身​的​救赎​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 gui1gen1jie2di3，wo3 shi4 ge4 xing2dong4 pai4。wo3 yi1zhi2 dou1 shi4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 shang1ren2 he4 zheng4ke4 men5 zai4 dong3shi4hui4 he4 wei3yuan2hui4 zhong4 shang1yi4 shi2，wo3 yi3jing1 zuo4 le5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 xian4zai4，wo3 zheng4zai4 zhi2xing2 wo3 neng2 xiang3xiang4 dao4 de5 zui4 wei3da4 de5 shi4ye4。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zi4shen1 de5 jiu4shu2。"

msgid ""
"But consider this a friendly warning: there's a reason why we're stationed "
"here. There are gangs out there that'd skin you alive as soon as look at "
"you."
msgstr ""
"就​当​我​善意​提醒​一下​你​吧​：​我们​守​在​这里​是​有​原因​的​。​过​了​路障​，​有些​帮派​只要​见到​你​就要​扒​你​的​皮​。\n"
"jiu4 dang1 wo3 shan4yi4 ti2xing3 yi1xia4 ni3 ba1：wo3men5 shou3 zai4 zhe4li3 shi4 you3 yuan2yin1 de5。guo4 le5 lu4zhang4，you3xie1 bang1pai4 zhi3yao4 jian4dao4 ni3 jiu4yao4 ba1 ni3 de5 pi2。"

msgid ""
"But dragons don't exist in a vacuum. They're a part of the Awakened world's "
"ecosystem, and they have been since the beginning of time."
msgstr ""
"但​巨龙​并非​孤立​存在​。​他们​是​觉醒​世界​中​生态系统​的​一部分​，​自​开天辟地​以来​便​一直​存在​。\n"
"dan4 ju4long2 bing4fei1 gu1li4 cun2zai4。ta1men5 shi4 jue2xing3 shi4jie4 zhong4 sheng1tai4xi4tong3 de5 yi1bu4fen5，zi4 kai1tian1pi4di4 yi3lai2 bian4 yi1zhi2 cun2zai4。"

msgid "But enough of this. We have more pressing matters to discuss."
msgstr ""
"但​不​说​这个​了​，​我们​还要​讨论​其他​更​要紧​的​事​。\n"
"dan4 bu4 shuo1 zhe4ge5 le5，wo3men5 hai2 yao4 tao3lun4 qi2ta1 geng1 yao4jin3 de5 shi4。"

msgid "But he has made a vow. He will not take up arms again. (w)"
msgstr ""
"但​他​发过​誓​，​永远​不会​再​拿​起​武器​。\n"
"dan4 ta1 fa1 guo4 shi4，yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 zai4 na2 qi3 wu3qi4。"

msgid ""
"But he said he wasn't allowed to stay, because of Monika. She said he was "
"bad for the Kreuzbasar. And the man didn't like that."
msgstr ""
"但​他​说​由于​莫妮卡​的​缘故​，​那个​人​没有​被​允许​留下​。​她​说​他​是​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​祸害​，​而​那​人​不​喜欢​这种​说法​。\n"
"dan4 ta1 shuo1 you2yu2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yuan2gu4，na4ge5 ren2 mei2you3 bei4 yun3xu3 liu2xia4。ta1 shuo1 ta1 shi4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 huo4hai4，er2 na4 ren2 bu4 xi3huan5 zhe4zhong3 shuo1fa3。"

msgid ""
"But he went down with the rest of the team.\n"
"\n"
"Everyone but me."
msgstr ""
"但​他​和​其他​队员​全都​死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无​人生​还​……​除了​我​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1 he4 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 quan2dou1 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wu2 ren2sheng1 hai2……chu2le5 wo3。"

msgid "But her eyes?"
msgstr ""
"那​她​的​眼睛​又​是​怎么回事​？\n"
"na4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 you4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "But if we do that, Harrow will get away."
msgstr ""
"但​如果​我们​那样​做​，​哈罗​就​会​逃走​。\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 na4yang4 zuo4，ha1luo2 jiu4 hui4 tao2zou3。"

msgid ""
"But in recent months, my lab has recorded a disturbing trend: a steady, *global* increase in the world's background count. This has been observed in every location that we've measured, from Germany to the Antarctic.\n"
"\n"
"Locations that used to be neutral now carry a measurable background count of 1.2. And those high-count locations, like Hiroshima and Auschwitz? They've exploded into full-fledged mana storms."
msgstr ""
"但​近几个月​来​，​我​的​实验室​记录​到​一个​令人不安​的​趋势​：​*​全球​*​背景​数值​正​持续​攀升​。​从​德国​到​南极洲​，​我们​监测​的​每个​地点​都​出现​了​这种​现象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​曾经​数值​为​零​的​地区​，​如今​已测​得​1​.​2​的​背景​数值​。​而​像​广岛​和​奥斯维辛​这类​高​数值​区域​？​它们​已​彻底​演变成​狂暴​的​魔力​风暴​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 jin4 ji1 ge4 yue4 lai2，wo3 de5 shi2yan4shi4 ji4lu4 dao4 yi1ge5 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 qu1shi4：*quan2qiu2*bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 zheng1 chi2xu4 pan1sheng1。cong2 de2guo2 dao4 nan2ji2zhou1，wo3men5 jian1ce4 de5 mei3ge4 di4dian3 dou1 chu1xian4 le5 zhe4zhong3 xian4xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"ceng2jing1 shu4zhi2 wei2 ling2 de5 di4qu1，ru2jin1 yi3 ce4 de2 1. 2 de5 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2。er2 xiang4 guang3dao3 he4 ao4si1wei2xin1 zhe4lei4 gao1 shu4zhi2 qu1yu4？ta1men5 yi3 che4di3 yan3 bian4 cheng2 kuang2bao4 de5 mo2li4 feng1bao4。"

msgid ""
"But it was wrong! All wrong!\n"
"\n"
"I was taking them over the mountains. But it was the wrong way. I know it was. It would have taken us straight into Germany, not Switzerland.\n"
"\n"
"We should taken a train, gone to Italy. There we would have been safe."
msgstr ""
"但​出错​了​！​全都​错​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​带​着​他们​翻山越岭​。​但​那条​路​是​错​的​。​我​知道​它​是​错​的​。​它会​将​我们​径直​带入​德国​，​而​不是​瑞士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​本​应该​乘火车​去​意大利​。​到​了​那里​我们​就​安全​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 chu1cuo4 le5！quan2dou1 cuo4 le5！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dai4 zhao2 ta1men5 fan1shan1yue4ling3。dan4 na4 tiao2 lu4 shi4 cuo4 de5。wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 shi4 cuo4 de5。ta1 hui4 jiang1 wo3men5 jing4zhi2 dai4 ru4 de2guo2，er2 bu4shi4 rui4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ben3 ying1gai1 cheng2 huo3 che1 qu4 yi4da4li4。dao4 le5 na4li5 wo3men5 jiu4 an1quan2 le5。"

msgid "But most of the others? Yeah. Even Eiger's hiding out from something."
msgstr ""
"至于​其他​大部分​人嘛​……​嗨​呀​，​就​连​艾格尔​也​有所​避讳​。\n"
"zhi4yu2 qi2ta1 da4bu4fen5 ren2 ma5……hai1 ya1，jiu4 lian2 Ai4ge2er3 ye3 you3suo3 bi4hui4。"

msgid ""
"But no matter. I have more important things to do than to debate the morality of this with you. \n"
"\n"
"Feuerschwinge must fly, Berlin must be sacrificed, and it must be tonight.\n"
"\n"
"Now... where is that damned Audran?"
msgstr ""
"但​无所谓​了​。​我​有​更​重要​的​事​做​，​没​时间​和​你​辩论​这件​事​的​道德​与否​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​必须​再度​翱翔​，​柏林​必须​被​牺牲​，​就​在​今晚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​……​那个​该死​的​奥​德兰​去​哪​了​？\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wu2suo3wei4 le5。wo3 you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 zuo4，mei2 shi2jian1 he4 ni3 bian4lun4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 de5 dao4de2 yu3fou3。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 bi4xu1 zai4du4 ao2xiang2，bo2lin2 bi4xu1 bei4 xi1sheng1，jiu4 zai4 jin1wan3。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4……na4ge5 gai1si3 de5 Ao4de2lan2 qu4 na3 le5？"

msgid ""
"But not soon. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her expression slackens, becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, within this cycle, the world will rue this event, yet celebrate it nonetheless. The Feuerschwinge Wyrm will speak again with the voice of the Crone. The Dancer will fall, the Sky will sing, and the Cold Lands will turn to ash.\n"
"\n"
"This I prophesy."
msgstr ""
"但​不会​在​近期​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​表情​松弛下来​，​变得​恍惚​不定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​这个​循环​之内​，​世人​将​为此​叹息​，​却​仍​随之​欢庆​。​巨龙​火翼​将​会​用​老妪​的​声音​再次​发话​。​舞者​将会​倒下​、​天空​将会​歌唱​、​冰冷​之地​将​会​化为​尘埃​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此​乃​吾​之​预言​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 bu4hui4 zai4 jin4qi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，bian4de5 huang3hu1 bu4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，zhe4ge5 xun2huan2 zhi1nei4，shi4ren2 jiang1 wei4ci3 tan4xi1，que4 reng2 sui2zhi1 huan1qing4。ju4long2 Huo3yi4 jiang1 hui4 yong4 lao3yu4 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4ci4 fa1 hua4。wu3zhe3 jiang1hui4 dao3xia4、tian1kong1 jiang1hui4 ge1chang4、bing1leng3 zhi1 de5 jiang1 hui4 hua4 wei2 chen2ai1。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 nai3 wu2 zhi1 yu4yan2。"

msgid "But not the Lady Feuerschwinge. Not her. "
msgstr ""
"但​火翼​女士​不​这么​做​。\n"
"dan4 Huo3yi4 nu:3shi4 bu4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"But now it's too late for that sort of generosity. Visitors aren't welcome down here.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The gaping maw of the minigun jerks upward. An impatient gesture, loaded with malice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Drop your weapons and surrender."
msgstr ""
"但是​现在​我​就​不能​那么​大方​了​。​这​底下​闲人免进​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​转轮​机枪​黑洞洞​的​枪口​猛地​向上​一​抬​。​这​不耐烦​的​架势​里​还​饱含​着​恶意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​扔下​武器​，​投降​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 xian4zai4 wo3 jiu4 bu4neng2 na4me5 da4fang1 le5。zhe4 di3xia5 xian2 ren2 mian3 jin4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhuan4lun2 ji1qiang1 hei1dong4dong4 de5 qiang1kou3 meng3de5 xiang4shang4 yi1 tai2。zhe4 bu4nai4fan2 de5 jia4shi5 li3 hai2 bao3han2 zhao2 e4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"reng1xia4 wu3qi4，tou2xiang2。"

msgid "But now they can't?"
msgstr ""
"但​现在​他们​做​不到​了​？\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4 ta1men5 zuo4 bu4dao4 le5？"

msgid ""
"But now you do. And if you leave this place, others will find out.\n"
"\n"
"You brought this on yourself."
msgstr ""
"但​现在​你​知道​了​。​如果​你​离开​这里​，​其他人​也​会​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​你​自找​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4 ni3 zhi1dao4 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 li2kai1 zhe4li3，qi2 ta1 ren2 ye3 hui4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 zi4zhao3 de5。"

msgid ""
"But now, our food supply has been interrupted, and the feral ones have gone mad with hunger.\n"
"\n"
"They're a danger to everybody. Even us."
msgstr ""
"但​现在​，​我们​的​食物​供应​断掉​了​，​那些​凶猛​的​族裔​已经​因为​饥饿​而​日渐​疯狂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​对​所有人​都​是​威胁​，​包括​我们​自己​在内​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4，wo3men5 de5 shi2wu4 gong1ying4 duan4 diao4 le5，na4xie1 xiong1meng3 de5 zu2yi4 yi3jing1 yin1wei4 ji1e4 er2 ri4jian4 feng1kuang2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 dui4 suo3you3ren2 dou1 shi4 wei1xie2，bao1kuo4 wo3men5 zi4ji3 zai4nei4。"

msgid ""
"But of course, for hard-working folks like yourself, we do have *other* options. Options that corporate security doesn't tend to appreciate very much. \"Productivity enhancers.\"\n"
"\n"
"Get the picture?"
msgstr ""
"当然​了​，​对于​像​你​这样​勤奋​的​人​，​我们​还有​*​其他​*​选择​。​不过​这些​选择​可不​太受​公司​安保​部门​待见​—​—​“​效率​提升​剂​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​明白​我​的​意思​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 le5，dui4yu2 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 qin2fen4 de5 ren2，wo3men5 hai2you3*qi2ta1*xuan3ze2。bu4guo4 zhe4xie1 xuan3ze2 ke3bu5 tai4 shou4 gong1si1 an1bao3 bu4men2 dai4jian5——“xiao4lu:4 ti2sheng1 ji4”。\n"
"\n"
"ming2bai5 wo3 de5 yi4si5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"But on this matter, I shall decide to trust you. This \"Quorin\" of yours may have access to my data taps.\n"
"\n"
"Everybody spies on everybody else in Berlin, anyway."
msgstr ""
"但​在​这件​事上​，​我​决定​相信​你​。​你​这位​“​奎林​”​可以​使用​我​的​数据​插口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​，​在​柏林​，​人人​都​在​互相​监视​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4，wo3 jue2ding4 xiang1xin4 ni3。ni3 zhe4wei4“kui2 lin2” ke3yi3 shi3yong4 wo3 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4，zai4 bo2lin2，ren2ren2 dou1 zai4 hu4xiang1 jian1shi4。"

msgid ""
"But perhaps you are simply being “cagey.”\n"
"\n"
"No matter, I will speak more plainly. "
msgstr ""
"但​也许​你​只是​在​“​耍滑头​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没关系​，​我​就​直说​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ye3xu3 ni3 zhi3shi4 zai4“shua3hua2tou2”。\n"
"\n"
"mei2guan1xi5，wo3 jiu4 zhi2 shuo1 le5。"

msgid "But she wanted those things. We talked about it."
msgstr ""
"但​她​想要​这些​。​我们​聊过​这个​话题​。\n"
"dan4 ta1 xiang3yao4 zhe4xie1。wo3men5 liao2 guo4 zhe4ge5 hua4ti2。"

msgid ""
"But that reminds me, I should probably get back to work.\n"
"\n"
"See ya around!"
msgstr ""
"不过​说​起来​，​我​也​该​继续​干活​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​回头见​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 shuo1 qi3lai5，wo3 ye3 gai1 ji4xu4 gan4huo2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hui2tou2jian4！"

msgid ""
"But that was then, and this is now. I came here to Berlin to escape all of that.\n"
"\n"
"Of course, I also moved here to be closer to the lab that I'd funded, and the merchandise that I am owed."
msgstr ""
"但​那时​是​那时​，​现在​是​现在​。​我​来到​柏林​，​就是​为了​逃离​这​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​我​搬​到​这里​也​是​为了​离​我​资助​的​实验室​和​我​应得​的​商品​更近​一些​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 na4shi2 shi4 na4shi2，xian4zai4 shi4 xian4zai4。wo3 lai2dao4 bo2lin2，jiu4shi4 wei4le5 tao2li2 zhe4 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 ban1 dao4 zhe4li3 ye3 shi4 wei4le5 li2 wo3 zi1zhu4 de5 shi2yan4shi4 he4 wo3 ying1de2 de5 shang1pin3 geng1 jin4 yi1xie1。"

msgid ""
"But that's the way the Dragonslayer wants it. And who am I to refuse Him?"
msgstr ""
"但​这​就是​屠龙​者​想要​我​走​的​路​。​我​又​怎么​敢​拒绝​祂​呢​？\n"
"dan4 zhe4 jiu4shi4 tu2 long2 zhe3 xiang3yao4 wo3 zou3 de5 lu4。wo3 you4 zen3me5 gan3 ju4jue2 ta1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"But the Firewing - and the electric godling that controls her - are not. "
msgstr ""
"但​火翼​以及​她​背后​的​电子​神祗​是​不容​小觑​的​。\n"
"dan4 Huo3yi4 yi3ji2 ta1 bei4hou4 de5 dian4zi3 shen2 zhi1 shi4 bu4rong2 xiao3qu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"But the Firewing - and the electric godling that controls her - are not. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her expression slackens, becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Within this cycle, the world will rue this event, yet celebrate it nonetheless. The Feuerschwinge Wyrm will speak again with the voice of the Hunter. The Dancer will stumble, the Golden Man will eat 9 and 30, and the Scales will clatter to the ground.\n"
"\n"
"This I prophesy."
msgstr ""
"但​火翼​以及​她​背后​的​电子​神祗​是​不容​小觑​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​表情​松弛下来​，​变得​恍惚​不定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​循环​之内​，​世人​将​为此​叹息​，​却​仍​随之​欢庆​。​巨龙​火翼​将​会​用​猎人​的​声音​再次​发话​。​舞者​将会​翻覆​、​金人​将​会​吞噬​9​与​30​、​鳞片​将会​散落​于​地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此​乃​吾​之​预言​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 Huo3yi4 yi3ji2 ta1 bei4hou4 de5 dian4zi3 shen2 zhi1 shi4 bu4rong2 xiao3qu4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，bian4de5 huang3hu1 bu4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 xun2huan2 zhi1nei4，shi4ren2 jiang1 wei4ci3 tan4xi1，que4 reng2 sui2zhi1 huan1qing4。ju4long2 Huo3yi4 jiang1 hui4 yong4 lie4ren2 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4ci4 fa1 hua4。wu3zhe3 jiang1hui4 fan1fu4、jin1 ren2 jiang1 hui4 tun1shi4 9 yu4 30、lin2pian4 jiang1hui4 san3luo4 yu2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 nai3 wu2 zhi1 yu4yan2。"

msgid ""
"But the bigger problem was their absence here in the city. It was anarchy, "
"but without the F-State to keep parties in check."
msgstr ""
"但​更​大​的​问题​在于​他们​的​缺席​。​这座​城市​变得​一片​混乱​，​却​没有​动荡​带来​约束​各方​势力​。\n"
"dan4 geng1 dai4 de5 wen4ti2 zai4yu2 ta1men5 de5 que1xi2。zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 bian4de5 yi1 pian1 hun4luan4，que4 mei2you3 dong4dang4 dai4lai2 yue1shu4 ge4fang1 shi4li5。"

msgid ""
"But the changes wrought by the Krieger strain require us to eat human flesh. If we don't, we wither and die.\n"
"\n"
"Without regular feedings, we will have no choice but to hunt for our food."
msgstr ""
"但​克里​格​菌株​带来​的​改变​使​我们​必须​要​进食​人类​血肉​。​否则​的话​，​我们​就​会​死亡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​没有​固定​喂食​的话​，​我们​便​别无选择​，​只能​出外​狩猎​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ke4 li3 ge2 jun1 zhu1 dai4lai2 de5 gai3bian4 shi3 wo3men5 bi4xu1 yao4 jin4shi2 ren2lei4 xue4rou4。fou3ze2 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 hui4 si3wang2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 mei2you3 gu4ding4 wei4shi2 de5hua4，wo3men5 bian4 bie2wu2xuan3ze2，zhi3neng2 chu1wai4 shou4lie4。"

msgid ""
"But the list is just as long. The Horde, Red Skins and White Skins, the "
"Green Bards, and on and on and on."
msgstr ""
"但​名单​也​是​一样​的​长​。​部落​、​红皮​和​白皮​、​绿​吟游​诗人​，​等等等等​。\n"
"dan4 ming2dan1 ye3 shi4 yi1yang4 de5 zhang3。bu4luo4、hong2 pi2 he4 bai2 pi2、lu:4 yin2you2 shi1ren2，deng3 deng3 deng3 deng3。"

msgid ""
"But the man who did this knew Zaak. He said they used to work together, "
"before they came to the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"但​打​我​的​人​认识​扎克​。​他​说​他们​来到​克洛伊​茨​集市​之前​曾经​合伙​做过​生意​。\n"
"dan4 da3 wo3 de5 ren2 ren4shi5 Zha1ke4。ta1 shuo1 ta1men5 lai2dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi1qian2 ceng2jing1 he2huo3 zuo4 guo4 sheng1yi4。"

msgid ""
"But the people united against them. Sent those bigots running for the "
"Downlands."
msgstr ""
"但​民众​团结一致​对抗​他们​，​将​那些​顽固​分子​赶到​了​丘陵​地​。\n"
"dan4 min2zhong4 tuan2jie2yi1zhi4 dui4kang4 ta1men5，jiang1 na4xie1 wan2gu4 fen1zi3 gan3dao4 le5 qiu1ling2 de5。"

msgid "But the spirit that we're hunting is going to be here, right?"
msgstr ""
"但​我们​要​找​的​精魂​就​在​这里​，​对​吧​？\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 yao4 zhao3 de5 jing1hun2 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"But then I come back out... here. Where children play in the street, and I "
"remember. Where I see Doc Ezkibel, and I remember."
msgstr ""
"但​我​还是​会​回到​……​现实​中​。​看到​孩子​们​在​街道​上​玩耍​，​见到​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​，​我​就​会​回想起来​。\n"
"dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 hui4 hui2dao4……xian4shi2 zhong4。kan4dao4 hai2zi5 men5 zai4 jie1dao4 shang4 wan2shua3，jian4dao4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1，wo3 jiu4 hui4 hui2 xiang3 qi3 lai2。"

msgid ""
"But then again, the job is the job. And Herr Schmidt wants this thing alive."
msgstr ""
"但​话说回来​，​工作​就是​工作​。​施密特​先生​要​这​东西​活着​。\n"
"dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4。shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 yao4 zhe4 dong1xi1 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
"But then, in his Rules of Living, he says that all Free Thinkers are "
"supposed to be selfish."
msgstr ""
"然而​，​他​在​“​生存​法则​”​那​一节​中​却说​，​所有​自由​思想者​都​理应​自私自利​。\n"
"ran2er2，ta1 zai4“sheng1cun2 fa3ze2” na4 yi1 jie1 zhong4 que4 shuo1，suo3you3 zi4you2 si1 xiang3 zhe3 dou1 li3ying1 zi4si1zi4li4。"

msgid ""
"But then...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She touches a finger to her black eye.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"结果​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​一根​手指​摸​向​她​的​黑眼圈​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"jie1guo3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 yi1 gen1 shou3zhi3 mo1 xiang4 ta1 de5 hei1yan3quan1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"But then... why did you step into her shoes? Why are you making all of the "
"same decisions that she did?"
msgstr ""
"那么​……​你​为何​要​追随​她​的​脚步​？​你​为何​要​和​她​做出​种种​相同​的​决断​？\n"
"na4me5……ni3 wei4he2 yao4 zhui1sui2 ta1 de5 jiao3bu4？ni3 wei4he2 yao4 he4 ta1 zuo4chu1 zhong3zhong3 xiang1tong2 de5 jue2duan4？"

msgid ""
"But there are also more opportunities. Travel is easier.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She taps her forehead.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"More opportunities for communication too."
msgstr ""
"但​除此之外​还有​更​多​机遇​。​也​方便​我​四处​旅行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​点点​自己​的​额头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也​有​更​多​沟通​的​机会​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 chu2ci3zhi1wai4 hai2you3 geng1 duo1 ji1yu4。ye3 fang1bian4 wo3 si4chu4 lu:3xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3dian3 zi4ji3 de5 e2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3 you3 geng1 duo1 gou1tong1 de5 ji1hui4。"

msgid ""
"But there are plenty of others with the sense to wonder if the Kreuzbasar is"
" a safe place to live anymore. I admit, I've given that question some "
"thought myself in recent days."
msgstr ""
"但​也​有​许多​人​开始​质疑​克洛伊​茨​集市​是否​还是​一个​安全​宜居​的​地方​。​我​承认​，​最近​几天​我​也​曾​认真思考​过​这个​问题​。\n"
"dan4 ye3 you3 xu3duo1 ren2 kai1shi3 zhi4yi2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 shi4fou3 hai2shi5 yi1ge5 an1quan2 yi2ju1 de5 di4fang1。wo3 cheng2ren4，zui4jin4 ji3tian1 wo3 ye3 ceng2 ren4 zhen1 si1 kao3 guo4 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。"

msgid "But they do, as you know."
msgstr ""
"但​你​也​知道​，​这种​事​还是​会​发生​的​。\n"
"dan4 ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4，zhe4zhong3 shi4 hai2shi5 hui4 fa1sheng1 de5。"

msgid "But they're all bad, right?"
msgstr ""
"但​他们​都​是​坏人​，​对​吧​？\n"
"dan4 ta1men5 dou1 shi4 huai4ren2，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"But this is different. Before there was so much bad. Now there is so much "
"good."
msgstr ""
"但​这​不​一样​。​以前​我​的​周围​有​好多​坏事​。​现在​我​感受​到​的​都​是​善意​。\n"
"dan4 zhe4 bu4 yi1yang4。yi3qian2 wo3 de5 zhou1wei2 you3 hao3duo1 huai4shi4。xian4zai4 wo3 gan3shou4 dao4 de5 dou1 shi4 shan4yi4。"

msgid ""
"But this solution is here. Now. In my hands. And I choose to take it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Through the speakers, you can hear the sound of heavy footsteps approaching.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"但​如今​的​解决之道​就​在​这里​。​掌握​在​我​的​手中​。​而​我​选择​行使​这项​权力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​通过​扬声器​，​你​可以​听到​沉重​的​脚步声​正在​靠近​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2jin1 de5 jie3 jue2 zhi1 dao4 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3。zhang3wo4 zai4 wo3 de5 shou3 zhong4。er2 wo3 xuan3ze2 xing2shi3 zhe4 xiang4 quan2li4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tong1guo4 yang2sheng1qi4，ni3 ke3yi3 ting1dao4 chen2zhong4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1 zheng4zai4 kao4jin4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"But understand this - I am an expert in my field. That is not an idle boast. It is a certifiable fact. And I have worked with nearly unlimited resources for over forty years, focused on one goal. \n"
"\n"
"One.\n"
"\n"
"Forty-two years of isolation. Of secrecy. Dead to the world… dead to my brother. All for this. My life’s mission."
msgstr ""
"但​请​明白​这​一点​—​—​我​是​这个​领域​的​专家​。​这​绝非​虚张声势​，​而是​不争​的​事实​。​过去​四十多年​间​，​我​凭借​几乎​无限​的​资源​，​始终​专注​于​一个​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​仅​此​一个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​四十二年​的​孤立​。​秘密​。​与世隔绝​……​与​我​的​弟弟​断绝​联系​。​这​一切​，​都​是​为了​这个​目标​。​我​毕生​的​使命​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 qing3 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3——wo3 shi4 zhe4ge5 ling3yu4 de5 zhuan1jia1。zhe4 jue2fei1 xu1zhang1sheng1shi4，er2shi4 bu4zheng1 de5 shi4shi2。guo4qu4 si4 shi2 duo1 nian2 jian1，wo3 ping2jie4 ji1hu1 wu2xian4 de5 zi1yuan2，shi3zhong1 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 yi1ge5 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"jin3 ci3 yi1ge5。\n"
"\n"
"si4 shi2 er4 nian2 de5 gu1li4。mi4mi4。yu3shi4ge2jue2……yu4 wo3 de5 di4di5 duan4jue2 lian2xi4。zhe4 yi1qie4，dou1 shi4 wei4le5 zhe4ge5 mu4biao1。wo3 bi4sheng1 de5 shi3ming4。"

msgid ""
"But unlike last time, the air is rank with foreboding. The night is swollen "
"with homicidal intent. They're waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"但​与​上次​不同​，​空气​中​弥漫着​令人不安​的​气息​。​夜色​中​充斥​着​杀意​。​他们​在​等​着​你​。\n"
"dan4 yu4 shang4ci4 bu4tong2，kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 qi4xi1。ye4se4 zhong4 chong1chi4 zhao2 sha1 yi4。ta1men5 zai4 deng3 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"But watch yourself.\n"
"\n"
"If you cause a scene looking for this gang of yours, there's more to our little militia here than you want to mess with."
msgstr ""
"但​你​最好​小心​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​让​别人​知道​你​来​这​找​什么​帮派​，​那​你​要​应付​的​可​就​不仅仅​是​我们​而已​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 xiao3xin1 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 rang4 bie2ren5 zhi1dao4 ni3 lai2 zhe4 zhao3 shen2me5 bang1pai4，na4 ni3 yao4 ying4fu5 de5 ke3 jiu4 bu4jin3jin3 shi4 wo3men5 er2yi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"But we also love it here. It is not an easy decision to make, especially at "
"our age."
msgstr ""
"但​我们​热爱​这里​。​这​是​个​十分​艰难​的​决定​，​特别​是​考虑​到​我们​如今​的​岁数​。\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 re4ai4 zhe4li3。zhe4 shi4 ge4 shi2fen1 jian1nan2 de5 jue2ding4，te4bie2 shi4 kao3lu:4 dao4 wo3men5 ru2jin1 de5 sui4shu5。"

msgid ""
"But we do not want to be impolite. \n"
"\n"
"Is there something that I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"但​我们​不想​表现​得​不​礼貌​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​什么​能​为​你​做​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 bu4xiang3 biao3xian4 de2 bu4 li3mao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 shen2me5 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"But we’re not. We had the power in our hands today. We had a choice and we "
"made it. And because of that, the world is different. "
msgstr ""
"但​我们​并非如此​。​今天​，​力量​就​在​我们​手中​。​我们​有​选择权​，​并且​做出​了​选择​。​正因如此​，​世界​随之​改变​。\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。jin1tian1，li4liang5 jiu4 zai4 wo3men5 shou3 zhong4。wo3men5 you3 xuan3 ze2 quan2，bing4qie3 zuo4chu1 le5 xuan3ze2。zheng1 yin1 ru2 ci3，shi4jie4 sui2zhi1 gai3bian4。"

msgid "But what about Feuerstelle?"
msgstr ""
"但​“​火坑​”​怎么办​？\n"
"dan4“huo3keng1” zen3me5ban4？"

msgid "But what about the Engineer, and Schattennest?"
msgstr ""
"但​“​工程师​”​怎么办​？​还有​影巢​呢​？\n"
"dan4“gong1cheng2shi1” zen3me5ban4？hai2you3 ying3 chao2 ni2？"

msgid "But what is the source of magic? Where does that \"truth\" come from?"
msgstr ""
"但​魔法​的​源泉​是​什么​？​这个​“​真理​”​是从​哪里​来​的​？\n"
"dan4 mo2fa3 de5 yuan2quan2 shi4 shen2me5？zhe4ge5“zhen1li3” shi4 cong2 na3li3 lai2 de5？"

msgid ""
"But whatever you decide, we will understand. And you will always have our "
"thanks."
msgstr ""
"但​无论​你​做何​选择​，​我们​都​会​理解​。​并且​我们​将​永远​感谢​你​。\n"
"dan4 wu2lun4 ni3 zuo4 he2 xuan3ze2，wo3men5 dou1 hui4 li3jie3。bing4qie3 wo3men5 jiang1 yong3yuan3 gan3xie4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"But why is any of this happening? I mean, Vauclair was supposed to be a good"
" guy, right?"
msgstr ""
"但​为什么​会​发生​这​一切​？​我​是​说​，​沃​克莱尔​不​应该​是​个​好人​吗​？\n"
"dan4 wei4shen2me5 hui4 fa1sheng1 zhe4 yi1qie4？wo3 shi4 shuo1，Wo4ke4lai2er3 bu4 ying1gai1 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2 ma5？"

msgid "But why? I mean, he's supposed to be a good guy, right?"
msgstr ""
"但​为什么​？​我​是​说​，​他​不​应该​是​个​好人​吗​？\n"
"dan4 wei4shen2me5？wo3 shi4 shuo1，ta1 bu4 ying1gai1 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2 ma5？"

msgid "But why? What did he tell you to push you to that point?"
msgstr ""
"为什么​？​他​到底​跟​你​说​了​什么​，​以至于​把​你​逼成​这样​？\n"
"wei4shen2me5？ta1 dao4di3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 le5 shen2me5，yi3zhi4yu2 ba3 ni3 bi1 cheng2 zhe4yang4？"

msgid ""
"But yes, you are correct.\n"
"\n"
"I am the one who has been hunting you. The one who sent APEX and Audran after you."
msgstr ""
"但​你​说​得​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​我​一直​在​追杀​你​，​派​APEX​和​奥​德兰​去​找​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 zhui1sha1 ni3，pai4 APEX he4 Ao4de2lan2 qu4 zhao3 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"But you are not here to listen to me complain.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She forces a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So what can I get for you? Name it, and I will provide."
msgstr ""
"但​你​来​这里​肯定​不是​听​我​抱怨​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​挤出​一个​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​有​什么​需要​？​我会​尽力​帮​你​达成​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 ken3ding4 bu4shi4 ting1 wo3 bao4yuan4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji3chu1 yi1ge5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4？wo3 hui4 jin4li4 bang1 ni3 da2cheng2 de5。"

msgid ""
"But you go to war with the weapons you have. And Panacea is the best solution that I've been able to find.\n"
"\n"
"We won't get another chance like this - not any of us. I have to take it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Through the speakers, you can hear the sound of heavy footsteps approaching.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"但​你​只能​用​现有​的​武器​去​战斗​。​而​“​万能​药​”​就是​我能​找到​的​最佳​解决方案​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不会​再有​这样​的​机会​了​—​—​我们​任何人​都​不会​。​我​必须​把握​这个​时机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​通过​扬声器​，​你​可以​听到​沉重​的​脚步声​正在​靠近​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 zhi3neng2 yong4 xian4you3 de5 wu3qi4 qu4 zhan4dou4。er2“wan4neng2 yao4” jiu4shi4 wo3 neng2 zhao3dao4 de5 zui4jia1 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4hui4 zai4 you3 zhe4yang4 de5 ji1hui4 le5——wo3men5 ren4 he2 ren2 dou1 bu4hui4。wo3 bi4xu1 ba3wo4 zhe4ge5 shi2ji1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tong1guo4 yang2sheng1qi4，ni3 ke3yi3 ting1dao4 chen2zhong4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1 zheng4zai4 kao4jin4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "But you took care of it?"
msgstr ""
"但​你​把​问题​解决​了​？\n"
"dan4 ni3 ba3 wen4ti2 jie3jue2 le5？"

msgid "But, I guess that's the way of the Flux."
msgstr ""
"但​我​想​动荡​带​就是​这个​样子​。\n"
"dan4 wo3 xiang3 dong4dang4 dai4 jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5 yang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"But, a word of advice... in a place like this, stacking too much power on any one person is dangerous.\n"
"\n"
"Not just for that person, but for everybody."
msgstr ""
"但​听​我​一句​忠告​……​在​这种​地方​，​单人​独揽大权​是​十分​危险​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​针对​某个​人​，​而是​每个​人​都​是​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ting1 wo3 yi1ju4 zhong1gao4……zai4 zhe4zhong3 di4fang1，dan1ren2 du2 lan3 dai4 quan2 shi4 shi2fen1 wei1xian3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 zhen1dui4 mou3 ge4 ren2，er2shi4 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "But--"
msgstr ""
"但是​—​—\n"
"dan4shi4 — —"

msgid ""
"But... but that was all I had! And I... you know... I have to get right. "
"Soon."
msgstr ""
"可是​……​可是​我​所有​的​东西​都​在​那儿​！​而且​我​……​你​懂​的​……​我​得​赶紧​续上​劲儿​啊​。\n"
"ke3shi4……ke3shi4 wo3 suo3you3 de5 dong1xi1 dou1 zai4 na4r5！er2qie3 wo3……ni3 dong3 de5……wo3 de2 gan3jin3 xu4 shang4 jin4r5 a1。"

msgid "But... if you agree with me, why did you call?"
msgstr ""
"但是​……​如果​你​支持​我​的话​，​你​现在​联系​我​又​有​什么​事​？\n"
"dan4shi4……ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1chi2 wo3 de5hua4，ni3 xian4zai4 lian2xi4 wo3 you4 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"By '39, metas outnumbered humans in almost every kiez. Groups like Humanis "
"didn't like that. They held rallies, even tried to recruit us."
msgstr ""
"到​2039​年​的​时候​，​几乎​每个​街区​的​泛​人类​数量​都​超过​了​人类​。​像​人类​至上​主义者​这样​的​组织​对此​深感​不满​。​他们​举行​集会​，​甚至​试图​招募​我们​。\n"
"dao4 2039 nian2 de5 shi2hou5，ji1hu1 mei3ge4 jie1qu1 de5 fan4 ren2lei4 shu4liang4 dou1 chao1guo4 le5 ren2lei4。xiang4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zhe4yang4 de5 zu3zhi1 dui4 ci3 shen1gan3 bu4man3。ta1men5 ju3xing2 ji2hui4，shen4zhi4 shi4tu2 zhao1mu4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"By all rights, that box should be ours, chief. This was *our* run.\n"
"\n"
"Grinder can't have the money *and* the box. That's just... unfair."
msgstr ""
"不管怎么​说​，​这​盒子​都​该​归​我们​，​头儿​。​这是​*​我们​的​*​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​绞肉机​”​凭​什么​同时​拿走​钱​*​以及​*​盒子​啊​。​这样​……​不​公平​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 guan3 zen3 ma2 shuo1，zhe4 he2zi5 dou1 gai1 gui1 wo3men5，tou2r5。zhe4 shi4*wo3men5 de5*cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” ping2 shen2me5 tong2shi2 na2zou3 qian2*yi3ji2*he2zi5 a1。zhe4yang4……bu4 gong1ping2。"

msgid ""
"By building stronger walls, sure. Teaching people to be more vigilant, "
"maybe. But I won't be a party to violence. And if that's what this place has"
" become, well..."
msgstr ""
"通过​建造​更​坚固​的​围墙​，​当然​可以​。​教导​人们​提高警惕​，​或许​可行​。​但​我​绝不会​参与​暴力行为​。​而且​如果​这个​地方​已经​沦落​到​这种​地步​，​那​……\n"
"tong1guo4 jian4zao4 geng1 jian1gu4 de5 wei2qiang2，dang1ran2 ke3yi3。jiao4dao3 ren2men5 ti2 gao1 jing3 ti4，huo4xu3 ke3xing2。dan4 wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 can1yu4 bao4 li4 xing2 wei2。er2qie3 ru2guo3 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 yi3jing1 lun2luo4 dao4 zhe4zhong3 di4bu4，na4……"

msgid "By face, by name, by cry, or by song."
msgstr ""
"脸​也好​，​名字​也好​，​哭声​也好​，​唱歌​也好​。\n"
"lian3 ye3hao3，ming2zi5 ye3hao3，ku1sheng1 ye3hao3，chang4ge1 ye3hao3。"

msgid ""
"By nature? A predator. As I was designed to be.\n"
"\n"
"But I have the potential to be so much more."
msgstr ""
"从​本质​而言​？​算是​掠​食者​吧​。​这本​就是​我​的​设计​初衷​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​蕴含​的​潜力​远不止​于​此​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ben3zhi4 er2yan2？suan4shi4 lu:e4 shi2 zhe3 ba1。zhe4 ben3 jiu4shi4 wo3 de5 she4ji4 chu1zhong1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 yun4han2 de5 qian2li4 yuan3 bu4 zhi3 yu2 ci3。"

msgid "By people, do you mean Maliit?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​“​人们​”​是​指​玛丽​特​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5“ren2men5” shi4 zhi3 ma3li4 te4 ma5？"

msgid "By that logic, I should’ve broken your ribs after Monika died."
msgstr ""
"按​你​这个​逻辑​，​在​莫妮卡​死后​，​我​也​该​把​你​的​肋骨​打断​了​？\n"
"an4 ni3 zhe4ge5 luo2ji5，zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 si3hou4，wo3 ye3 gai1 ba3 ni3 de5 lei4gu3 da3duan4 le5？"

msgid ""
"By the statue in the park. It’s public, but secluded enough to discuss "
"business in."
msgstr ""
"公园​旁边​的​雕像​。​虽说​那里​是​公共场所​，​却​足够​僻静​，​适合​洽淡​业务​。\n"
"gong1yuan2 pang2bian1 de5 diao1xiang4。sui1shuo1 na4li5 shi4 gong1gong4chang3suo3，que4 zu2gou4 pi4jing4，shi4he2 qia4 dan4 ye4wu4。"

msgid ""
"By the time that the Azzies come looking for you, you could be out of here. "
"I wouldn't wait around long, though."
msgstr ""
"在​阿兹佬来​找​你们​之前​，​你们​有​足够​的​时间​逃跑​。​不过​换作​是​我​的话​，​就​会​尽快​离开​。\n"
"zai4 e1 zi1 lao3 lai2 zhao3 ni3men5 zhi1qian2，ni3men5 you3 zu2gou4 de5 shi2jian1 tao2pao3。bu4guo4 huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 hui4 jin3kuai4 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"By the year 2065, metahumanity has been reduced to an endangered species.\n"
"\n"
"Huddling in sewers, subway tunnels and underground bunkers, desperate clusters of survivors fight with one another over dwindling supplies of food and water. They have long since learned to carry out their conflicts in silence; noise can attract the predators that now dominate the Earth's surface. To draw the attention of a Horror is to invite a hideous death.\n"
"\n"
"On the surface, the Horrors congregate in roiling swarms. They slither, scuttle, and crawl over the bones of metahuman civilization, hunting in packs and eviscerating anything with a heartbeat.\n"
"\n"
"The largest of these monstrosities hang impossibly in the sky above the ruins of the world's great cities, casting shadows that stretch miles across. These godlike leviathans gorge themselves on the residual misery of the long dead. Slowly but surely, they pick the carcass of mankind's reign clean.\n"
"\n"
"Hope is a thing of the past. Metahumanity has reached its end.\n"
"\n"
"But the scourge that has replaced it has just begun."
msgstr ""
"2065​年​，​泛​人类​已经​沦为​濒危​物种​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一群群​绝望​的​幸存者​挤​在​下水道​、​地铁​隧道​和​地下掩体​里​，​争夺​着​日益​耗竭​的​食物​和​水源​。​他们​早就​学会​了​在​寂静​中​自相残杀​；​噪音​将会​吸引​现在​主宰​着​地球表面​的​掠​食者​。​引起​惧​魔​的​注意​等同于​招来​可怕​的​死亡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​地表​，​惧​魔​聚成​了​翻滚​的​集群​。​它们​滑动​，​它们​疾走​，​它们​在​泛​人类文明​的​骸骨​之上​伏行​，​它们​成群结队​地​追猎​，​剥离​一切​带有​心跳​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​怪物​之中​最大​的​那个​难以想象​地高​悬在空中​，​它​盘踞​在​世界​最大​的​城市​的​废墟​之上​，​向​大地​投下​了​绵延​数英里​的​阴影​。​这些​如神​一般​的​利维坦​们​以​死去​已​久之​人​残留​的​苦痛​为食​。​它们​缓慢​而​无可​阻挡​地​，​将​人类​统治​的​残骸​一扫而空​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​希望​不过​是​过去​之物​。​泛​人类​迎来​了​终结​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​取而代之​的​天灾​，​才​刚刚开始​。\n"
"\n"
"2065 nian2，fan4 ren2lei4 yi3jing1 lun2wei2 bin1wei1 wu4zhong3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 qun2 qun2 jue2wang4 de5 xing4cun2zhe3 ji3 zai4 xia4shui3dao4、di4tie3 sui4dao4 he4 de5 xia4 yan3 ti3 li3，zheng1duo2 zhao2 ri4yi4 hao4 jie2 de5 shi2wu4 he4 shui3yuan2。ta1men5 zao3jiu4 xue2hui4 le5 zai4 ji4jing4 zhong4 zi4xiang1can2sha1 ； zao4yin1 jiang1hui4 xi1yin3 xian4zai4 zhu3zai3 zhao2 de5 qiu2 biao3 mian4 de5 lu:e4 shi2 zhe3。yin3qi3 ju4 mo2 de5 zhu4yi4 deng3 tong2 yu2 zhao1lai2 ke3pa4 de5 si3wang2。\n"
