msgid ""
"COCl2, or phosgene, is a valuable pharmaceutical component. In its gaseous form, it is both colorless and odorless, and is extremely toxic.\n"
"\n"
"It can be neutralized with the introduction of gaseous ammonia."
msgstr ""
"COCl2​又称​光气​，​是​一种​重要​的​医药原料​成分​。​气态​下​无色​无味​，​具有​剧毒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可​通过​注入​氨气​进行​中​和​处理​。\n"
"\n"
"COCl2 you4cheng1 guang1qi4，shi4 yi1zhong3 zhong4yao4 de5 yi1 yao4 yuan2 liao4 cheng2fen4。qi4tai4 xia4 wu2se4 wu2wei4，ju4you3 ju4du2。\n"
"\n"
"ke3 tong1guo4 zhu4ru4 an1qi4 jin4xing2 zhong4 he4 chu3li3。"

msgid ""
"COCl2. Commonly known as phosgene gas. A highly toxic, colorless gas that gained infamy for its use as a chemical weapon during the First World War. \n"
"\n"
"It is also valued as an industrial reagent, and as a building block from which pharmaceuticals and other organic compounds can be synthesized."
msgstr ""
"COCl2​，​俗称​光气​，​是​一种​无色​的​剧毒​气体​，​因在​第一次世界大战​中​被​用作​化学武器​而​臭名昭著​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​同时​也​是​一种​重要​的​工业​试剂​，​是​合成​药物​及其​他​有机​化合物​的​基础​原料​。\n"
"\n"
"COCl2，su2cheng1 guang1qi4，shi4 yi1zhong3 wu2se4 de5 ju4du2 qi4ti3，yin1 zai4 di4yi1ci4shi4jie4da4zhan4 zhong4 bei4 yong4zuo4 hua4xue2wu3qi4 er2 chou4ming2zhao1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tong2shi2 ye3 shi4 yi1zhong3 zhong4yao4 de5 gong1ye4 shi4ji4，shi4 he2cheng2 yao4wu4 ji2qi2 ta1 you3ji1 hua4he2wu4 de5 ji1chu3 yuan2liao4。"

msgid ""
"CONSTITUENT MEMBERS OF THE F-STATE WOULD FEAR ME. THIS IS EXPECTED BEHAVIOR.\n"
