"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1 ba1。bu4guan3 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5，ta1 xian4zai4 dou1 shi4 wo3 de5 yi1bu4fen5 le5。"

msgid "Call it whatever you want. He deserved to die."
msgstr ""
"随便​你​怎么​说​吧​。​他​死有余辜​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1 ba1。ta1 si3you3yu2gu1。"

