"jiao4 wo3 $(s.name) ba1。"

msgid "Call? What call?"
msgstr ""
"推进​什么​？\n"
"tui1jin4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Calling the fight \"one-sided\" would be an understatement. Within seconds, "
"the wageslave lies dead on the ground."
msgstr ""
"说​这场​战斗​是​“​一边倒​”​也​不为过​。​几秒钟​之内​，​薪奴​就​躺​在​地上​死​了​。\n"
"shuo1 zhe4 chang2 zhan4dou4 shi4“yi1bian1dao3” ye3 bu4wei2guo4。ji1 miao3 zhong1 zhi1nei4，xin1 nu2 jiu4 tang3 zai4 di4shang5 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Calm down - I'm not really joining Vauclair. I just wanted to hear what he'd"
" say."
msgstr ""
"冷静​点​，​我​没真​打算​与沃​克莱尔​为伍​，​我​只是​想​听听​他会​怎么​说​。\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，wo3 mei2 zhen1 da3suan4 yu4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 wei2wu3，wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 ting1 ting1 ta1 hui4 zen3me5 shuo1。"

msgid "Calm down! I'm not here to hurt you."
msgstr ""
"冷静​！​我​不是​来​伤害​你​的​。\n"
"leng3jing4！wo3 bu4shi4 lai2 shang1hai4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Calm down! There are no spirits... they're gone. The hallway is empty."
msgstr ""
"冷静​点​！​没有​精魂​了​……​它们​都​走​了​。​走廊​是​空​的​。\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3！mei2you3 jing1hun2 le5……ta1men5 dou1 zou3 le5。zou3lang2 shi4 kong1 de5。"

