msgstr ""
"冷静​点​，​我​改变​主意​了​。​我会​接下​差事​。\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，wo3 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 le5。wo3 hui4 jie1xia4 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"Calm down, Marta.\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name), you know that I agree with you in principle... I have more reason to hate Harrow than anybody. But I have reason to suspect that he isn't the real power here anymore."
msgstr ""
"冷静​点​，​玛​尔塔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​你​知道​我​原则上​同意​你​的​看法​……​比起​其他人​，​我​更​有​理由​憎恨​哈罗​。​但​我​也​有​理由​怀疑​，​哈罗​已经​不再​是​这里​的​主宰者​了​。\n"
"\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，Ma3er3ta3。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 yuan2ze2shang5 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 kan4fa3……bi3qi3 qi2 ta1 ren2，wo3 geng1 you3 li3you2 zeng1hen4 ha1luo2。dan4 wo3 ye3 you3 li3you2 huai2yi2，ha1luo2 yi3jing1 bu4zai4 shi4 zhe4li3 de5 zhu3zai3zhe3 le5。"

