msgstr ""
"冷静​点​，​玛​尔塔​。​格洛丽​不是​说​了​吗​，​我们​要​净化​那个​精魂​。\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，Ma3er3ta3。Ge2luo4li2 bu4shi4 shuo1 le5 ma5，wo3men5 yao4 jing4hua4 na4ge5 jing1hun2。"

