msgstr ""
"冷静​点​，​先生​。​调度​中心​肯定​出​了​问题​。​你​上周​就​应该​收到​工作​单​的​。\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，xian1sheng5。diao4du4 zhong1xin1 ken3ding4 chu1 le5 wen4ti2。ni3 shang4zhou1 jiu4 ying1gai1 shou1dao4 gong1zuo4 dan1 de5。"

