msgstr ""
"冷静​点​。​我​叫​穆勒​。​游侠​骑士​派​我​来​的​。\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3。wo3 jiao4 mu4 lei1。you2Xia2qi2shi4 pai4 wo3 lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Calm yourself. You are safe here with me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He flicks the ash from the tip of his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Short of employing a tactical nuclear weapon, APEX cannot touch us down here... and that is unlikely, to say the least."
msgstr ""
"你​冷静​些​。​你​在​这里​是​安全​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​弹掉​烟头​上​的​灰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​除非​动用​战术​核武器​，​否则​APEX​根本无法​触及​这里​……​而​这种​可能性​，​至少​可以​说​是​微乎其微​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 leng3jing4 xie1。ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 shi4 an1quan2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dan4 diao4 yan1tou2 shang4 de5 hui1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 dong4yong4 zhan4shu4 he2wu3qi4，fou3ze2 APEX gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 chu4ji2 zhe4li3……er2 zhe4zhong3 ke3neng2xing4，zhi4shao3 ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 wei1hu1qi2wei1。"

