"ni3 neng2 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5 ma5？you3mei2you3 neng2 bang1 ta1 de5 ban4fa3？"

msgid ""
"Can you live with the possibility of him slipping away, out of our reach? Can you justify taking the risk that he'll disappear and start all of this over again?\n"
"\n"
"I'm not sure that I can."
msgstr ""
"你​能​接受​他​有​可能​溜出​我们​的​掌心​吗​？​你​能​接受​冒险​让​他​就此​消失​，​并​在​别处​东山再起​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​确定​我​是否​能够​接受​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 jie1shou4 ta1 you3 ke3neng2 liu1 chu1 wo3men5 de5 zhang3xin1 ma5？ni3 neng2 jie1shou4 mao4xian3 rang4 ta1 jiu4ci3 xiao1shi1，bing4 zai4 bie2chu4 dong1shan1zai4qi3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 wo3 shi4fou3 neng2gou4 jie1shou4。"

msgid ""
"Can you live with their deaths on your conscience? Can you justify sacrificing a bunch of brainwashed teenagers to ensure that one monster dies?\n"
"\n"
"I'm not sure that I can."
msgstr ""
"你​能​接受​因​他们​的​死​而​遭到​良心谴责​吗​？​你​能​接受​牺牲​一群​被​洗脑​的​青少年​，​只​为​杀死​一个​禽兽​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​确定​我​是否​能够​接受​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 jie1shou4 yin1 ta1men5 de5 si3 er2 zao1dao4 liang2 xin1 qian3 ze2 ma5？ni3 neng2 jie1shou4 xi1sheng1 yi1 qun2 bei4 xi3nao3 de5 qing1shao4nian2，zhi3 wei2 sha1si3 yi1ge5 qin2shou4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 wo3 shi4fou3 neng2gou4 jie1shou4。"

msgid "Can you patch him up, Glory?"
msgstr ""
"你​能​帮​他​处理​一下​伤口​吗​，​格洛丽​？\n"
"ni3 neng2 bang1 ta1 chu3li3 yi1xia4 shang1kou3 ma5，Ge2luo4li2？"

msgid "Can you tell me anything about this building?"
msgstr ""
"你​能​和​我​说​说​这栋​楼​的​事​吗​？\n"
"ni3 neng2 he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 zhe4 dong4 lou2 de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Can you tell me anything else about this gang, the Rabengeister?"
msgstr ""
"你​能​多​给​我​讲讲​这个​叫​“​鸦灵​”​的​帮派​吗​？\n"
"ni3 neng2 duo1 gei3 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 zhe4ge5 jiao4“Ya1ling2” de5 bang1pai4 ma5？"

msgid "Can you understand me?"
msgstr ""
"你​能​理解​我​说​的话​吗​？\n"
"ni3 neng2 li3jie3 wo3 shuo1 de5hua4 ma5？"

msgid "Can you understand me?\n"
msgstr ""
"你​能​理解​我​说​的话​吗​？\n"
"ni3 neng2 li3jie3 wo3 shuo1 de5hua4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Can't argue with that, boss. While Feuerschwinge lives, the Kreuzbasar is at risk.\n"
"\n"
"Our friends, our home... everything that Monika and Paul fought to protect. They'll all be destroyed if we don't put an end to her first."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​，​老大​。​只要​火翼​还​活着​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​就​不得​安宁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​的​朋友​、​我们​的​家园​……​莫妮卡​和保罗​竭力​守护​的​一切​。​如果​我们​不​先​消灭​她​，​这​一切​都​将​化为乌有​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4，lao3da4。zhi3yao4 Huo3yi4 hai2 huo2zhe5，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jiu4 bu4de2 an1ning2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 peng2you5、wo3men5 de5 jia1yuan2……Mo4ni1ka3 he4 bao3 luo2 jie2li4 shou3hu4 de5 yi1qie4。ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4 xian1 xiao1mie4 ta1，zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 jiang1 hua4wei2wu1you3。"

msgid "Can't argue with that."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。"

msgid ""
"Can't blame you for that, friend. I'm just glad that you made it out alive."
msgstr ""
"不​愿意​说​也​没事​，​朋友​。​我​很​高兴​你​最后​活​了​下来​。\n"
"bu4 yuan4yi4 shuo1 ye3 mei2shi4，peng2you5。wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 zui4hou4 huo2 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"Can't do it, fearless leader. What you're suggesting is beyond the scope of our capabilities.\n"
"\n"
"I don't have any contacts in Norway. We wouldn't even know where to begin looking for Winternight, and if we found them, what then? The two of us aren't going to stop an international conspiracy our own. We're good, but we're not *that* good."
msgstr ""
"不行​，​无畏​领袖​。​你​的​提议​超出​了​我们​的​能力​范围​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​挪威​不​认识​什么​人​。​我们​甚至​不​知道​该​从​哪里​开始​寻找​“​冬夜​”​，​而且​就算​找到​了​，​接下来​又​该​怎么办​？​就​凭​我们​两个​人​可​没法​阻止​一个​国际​阴谋​。​我们​很​厉害​，​但​还​没到​那种​程度​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。ni3 de5 ti2yi4 chao1chu1 le5 wo3men5 de5 neng2li4 fan4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 nuo2wei1 bu4 ren4shi5 shen2me5 ren2。wo3men5 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 cong2 na3li3 kai1shi3 xun2zhao3“dong1 ye4”，er2qie3 jiu4suan4 zhao3dao4 le5，jie1xia4lai2 you4 gai1 zen3me5ban4？jiu4 ping2 wo3men5 liang3 ge4 ren2 ke3 mei2fa3 zu3zhi3 yi1ge5 guo2ji4 yin1mou2。wo3men5 hen3 li4hai5，dan4 hai2 mei2 dao4 na4zhong3 cheng2du4。"

msgid ""
"Can't happen fast enough, love. The sooner we get in, the sooner I can get "
"drunk."
msgstr ""
"我​都​等不及​了​，​宝贝儿​。​早点​进去​，​我​就​能​早点​开喝​了​。\n"
"wo3 dou1 deng3bu4ji2 le5，bao3bei4r5。zao3dian3 jin4qu4，wo3 jiu4 neng2 zao3dian3 kai1 he4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Can't happen soon enough. So here's an idea: let's get this finished, and "
"then we can all get back to disliking each other on our own time."
msgstr ""
"还​得​有​一阵子​呢​。​所以​我​的​建议​是​，​我们​赶紧​把​这事​弄完​，​这样​我们​就​可以​继续​回到​彼此​各​看不顺眼​的​生活​中​了​。\n"
"hai2 de2 you3 yi1zhen4zi5 ni2。suo3yi3 wo3 de5 jian4yi4 shi4，wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4 long4 wan2，zhe4yang4 wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 ji4xu4 hui2dao4 bi3ci3 ge4 kan4bu4shun4yan3 de5 sheng1huo2 zhong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Can't help you there. We used to see a lot of the Magnifikers up on the third floor, but I never wanted to get too close to them.\n"
"\n"
"You wanna know where their hideout is, I'd ask Parson, or maybe step outside to ask Ullrich. Not that you're likely to get far with either of those nutcases."
msgstr ""
"这个​我​帮不了​你​。​以前​我们​在​三楼​经常​看到​伟术​帮​的​人​，​但​我​从没​想过​靠近​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​知道​他们​的​藏身处​，​我​建议​你​去​问帕森​，​或者​出门​找​乌尔里​希​。​虽然​这​两个​疯子​可能​也​不会​给​你​多少​线索​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 wo3 bang1 bu4 le5 ni3。yi3qian2 wo3men5 zai4 san1 lou2 jing1chang2 kan4dao4 wei3 shu4 bang1 de5 ren2，dan4 wo3 cong2mei2 xiang3 guo4 kao4jin4 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 de5 cang2shen1chu4，wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 qu4 wen4 pa4 sen1，huo4zhe3 chu1men2 zhao3 wu1 er3 li3 xi1。sui1ran2 zhe4 liang3 ge4 feng1zi5 ke3neng2 ye3 bu4hui4 gei3 ni3 duo1shao3 xian4suo3。"

msgid ""
"Can't it always?\n"
"\n"
"Be well, $(l.freund). Stay safe alright?"
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​多​保重​，​$(l.freund)​。​注意安全​哦​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"duo1 bao3zhong4，$(l.freund)。zhu4 yi4 an1 quan2 e2。"

msgid ""
"Can't it always?\n"
"\n"
"Be well, $(l.freund). Stay safe."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​多​保重​，​$(l.freund)​。​注意安全​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"duo1 bao3zhong4，$(l.freund)。zhu4 yi4 an1 quan2。"

msgid "Can't let you do this, boss."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​我​不能​让​你​这么​干​。\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 zhe4me5 gan4。"

msgid "Can't run from your problems forever."
msgstr ""
"你​不能​永远​逃避​自己​的​问题​。\n"
"ni3 bu4neng2 yong3yuan3 tao2bi4 zi4ji3 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Can't say I blame you. In your position, I would've done exactly the same "
"thing."
msgstr ""
"我​不怪​你​。​换作​是​我​的话​，​也​会​和​你​做​一样​的​事情​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 guai4 ni3。huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，ye3 hui4 he4 ni3 zuo4 yi1yang4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"Can't say I didn't warn you. You'd better get out of there... that alarm is going off in both meat space *and* the Matrix.\n"
"\n"
"Reinforcements are on the way. You don't wanna be there when they get here."
msgstr ""
"可​别说​我​没​提醒​过​你​啊​。​你们​最好​赶紧​离开​那里​……​警报​不仅​在​现实​世界​响​了​，​在​矩阵​里​也​响​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​援军​正在​赶来​。​他们​抵达​时​，​你们​最好​别​还​在​那里​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3 bie2shuo1 wo3 mei2 ti2xing3 guo4 ni3 a1。ni3men5 zui4hao3 gan3jin3 li2kai1 na4li5……jing3bao4 bu4jin3 zai4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 xiang3 le5，zai4 ju3zhen4 li3 ye3 xiang3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yuan2jun1 zheng4zai4 gan3lai2。ta1men5 di3da2 shi2，ni3men5 zui4hao3 bie4 hai2 zai4 na4li5。"

msgid ""
"Can't say for certain why that man does anything. I've never seen eye to eye with 'im, not even when we were kids.\n"
"\n"
"My best guess is that he's treating Humanis as a boarding school. They feed and house their recruits, and that's money that he'd rather spend on himself. So he dumped his boy off on them, never mind the fact that they're fascist swine."
msgstr ""
"我​也​说​不好​那家伙​在​想些​什么​。​我们​从小​就​不​对付​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​他​就是​把​人类​至上​主义者​当成​了​某种​寄宿​学校​，​毕竟​他们​会​给​成员​提供​食宿​。​这样一来​，​省​下来​的​钱​不​就​能​供​他​自个儿​花天酒地​了​？​所以​他​就​把​亲生​儿子​丢​了​过去​，​他​才​不在乎​那些​人​是不是​法西斯​畜生​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shuo1 bu4hao3 na4 jia1 huo3 zai4 xiang3 xie1 shen2me5。wo3men5 cong2xiao3 jiu4 bu4 dui4fu5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ta1 jiu4shi4 ba3 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 dang4cheng2 le5 mou3zhong3 ji4su4 xue2xiao4，bi4jing4 ta1men5 hui4 gei3 cheng2yuan2 ti2gong1 shi2su4。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，sheng3 xia4lai5 de5 qian2 bu4 jiu4 neng2 gong1 ta1 zi4ge3r5 hua1tian1jiu3di4 le5？suo3yi3 ta1 jiu4 ba3 qin1sheng1 er2zi5 diu1 le5 guo4qu4，ta1 cai2 bu4zai4hu5 na4xie1 ren2 shi4bu5shi4 fa3xi1si1 chu4sheng5 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Can't say for certain, but I have a pretty strong guess.\n"
"\n"
"Alexander's dad is a miserable sack of a man. I wouldn't put it past him to look at Humanis as a boarding school... they feed and house their recruits, and that's money that he'd rather spend on himself."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不敢肯定​，​但​我​大致​能​猜个​八九不离十​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​亚历山大​的​老爹​就是​个​废物​东西​。​我​猜​他​就是​把​人类​至上​主义者​当成​了​某种​寄宿​学校​……​毕竟​他们​会​给​成员​提供​食宿​。​这样一来​，​省​下来​的​钱​不​就​能​供​他​自个儿​花天酒地​了​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 gan3 ken3 ding4，dan4 wo3 da4zhi4 neng2 cai1 ge4 ba1jiu3bu4li2shi2。\n"
"\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4 de5 lao3die1 jiu4shi4 ge4 fei4wu4 dong1xi1。wo3 cai1 ta1 jiu4shi4 ba3 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 dang4cheng2 le5 mou3zhong3 ji4su4 xue2xiao4……bi4jing4 ta1men5 hui4 gei3 cheng2yuan2 ti2gong1 shi2su4。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，sheng3 xia4lai5 de5 qian2 bu4 jiu4 neng2 gong1 ta1 zi4ge3r5 hua1tian1jiu3di4 le5？"

msgid ""
"Can't say that I'm in love with it either, but it could prove to be useful. We need all the help we can get if we're going to get back into that lab beneath the manor.\n"
"\n"
"The thing might be ancient, but it's clearly milspec. Designed for the battlefield. That makes it worthy of respect."
msgstr ""
"我​也​算不上​喜欢​它​，​但​或许​能​派上用场​。​如果​我们​想​重返​庄园​地下​的​实验室​，​就​得​需要​一切​能​得到​的​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​玩意儿​虽​是​古董​，​但​明显​是​军规​标准​，​准备​用来​投入​战场​的​。​就​冲​这​一点​也​值得​敬畏​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 suan4 bu4 shang4 xi3huan5 ta1，dan4 huo4xu3 neng2 pai4shang4yong4chang3。ru2guo3 wo3men5 xiang3 chong2fan3 zhuang1yuan2 di4xia4 de5 shi2yan4shi4，jiu4 de2 xu1yao4 yi1qie4 neng2 de2dao4 de5 bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 wan2yi4r5 sui1 shi4 gu3dong3，dan4 ming2xian3 shi4 jun1 gui1 biao1zhun3，zhun3bei4 yong4lai2 tou2ru4 zhan4chang3 de5。jiu4 chong1 zhe4 yi1dian3 ye3 zhi2de5 jing4wei4。"

msgid "Can't think of anywhere I'd rather be."
msgstr ""
"我​想不出​比​这里​更好​的​地方​了​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 bu4 chu1 bi3 zhe4li3 geng1 hao3 de5 di4fang1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Can't think of much else to say about Dietrich. Just a good, reliable guy.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment. Whe she speaks again, you can hear a hint of guilt in her voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He is getting a little long in the tooth for a shadowrunner... I'm not sure how many more years he has ahead of him in this game. But I'll be happy to run with him for as long as he's able.\n"
"\n"
"We'll see, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"关于​迪​特里​希​，​我​没什么​可以​补充​的​。​他​就是​个​靠​谱​的​好人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​再次​开口​时​，​你​能​听​出​她​声音​里​带​着​一丝​愧疚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​作为​狂奔​者​，​他​的​年纪​确实​有些​大​了​……​我​不​确定​他​在​这行​还​能干​几年​。​但​只要​他​还​能​跑​得动​，​我​就​愿意​继续​和​他​搭档​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走着瞧​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"guan1yu2 Di2te4li3xi1，wo3 mei2shen2me5 ke3yi3 bu3chong1 de5。ta1 jiu4shi4 ge4 kao4 pu3 de5 hao3ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，ni3 neng2 ting1 chu1 ta1 sheng1yin1 li3 dai4 zhao2 yi1 si1 kui4jiu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 kuang2Ben1zhe3，ta1 de5 nian2ji4 que4shi2 you3xie1 dai4 le5……wo3 bu4 que4ding4 ta1 zai4 zhe4 xing2 hai2 neng2gan4 ji3nian2。dan4 zhi3yao4 ta1 hai2 neng2 pao2 de2 dong4，wo3 jiu4 yuan4yi4 ji4xu4 he4 ta1 da1dang4。\n"
"\n"
"zou3zhe5qiao2 ba1。"

msgid "Can't you take a joke?"
msgstr ""
"你​连个​笑话​都​不​接受​吗​？\n"
"ni3 lian2 ge4 xiao4hua5 dou1 bu4 jie1shou4 ma5？"

