msgstr ""
"行动​期间​无法​保存​。\n"
"xing2dong4 qi1jian1 wu2fa3 bao3cun2。"

msgid ""
"Captain von Trapp is very well known and respected. The poor dear lost his "
"wife, and the children their mother."
msgstr ""
"冯​·​特拉普​舰长​声名​远扬​万人​崇敬​。​这个​可怜​人​失去​了​他​的​妻子​，​孩子​们​也​失去​了​母亲​。\n"
"ping2 · te4 la1 pu3 jian4zhang3 sheng1ming2 yuan3yang2 wan4ren2 chong2jing4。zhe4ge5 ke3lian2 ren2 shi1qu4 le5 ta1 de5 qi1zi3，hai2zi5 men5 ye3 shi1qu4 le5 mu3qin1。"

msgid "Cardboard Box"
msgstr ""
"纸箱\n"
"zhi3xiang1"

msgid "Care to explain that to the rest of us?"
msgstr ""
"能​给​我们​解释一下​吗​？\n"
"neng2 gei3 wo3men5 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4 ma5？"

