msgstr ""
"城堡​大门​右侧​已​关闭\n"
"cheng2bao3 da4men2 you4ce4 yi3 guan1bi4"

msgid "Cat"
msgstr ""
"猫\n"
"mao2"

msgid ""
"Cat is secretive, sly, and stealthy and very hard to trap.\n"
"\n"
"Cat grants: Dodge +1 for 3 rounds to all allies in an area around the shaman when cast.\n"
"\n"
"Cooldown: 1"
msgstr ""
"猫​天性​隐秘​狡黠​，​行动​如​幽灵​般​难以​捕捉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​猫​图腾​的​力量​可使​萨满​附近​一定​范围​内​所有​友方​单位​闪避​+​1​，​持续​3​回合​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷却​时间​：​1​回合\n"
"\n"
"mao2 tian1xing4 yin3mi4 jiao3xia2，xing2dong4 ru2 you1ling2 ban1 nan2yi3 bu3zhuo1。\n"
"\n"
"mao2 tu2teng2 de5 li4liang5 ke3 shi3 sa4man3 fu4jin4 yi1ding4 fan4wei2 nei4 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4 shan3bi4 +1，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。\n"
"\n"
"leng3que4 shi2jian1：1 hui2he2"

msgid "Catalyst? What catalyst?"
msgstr ""
"催化剂​？​什么​催化剂​？\n"
"cui1hua4ji4？shen2me5 cui1hua4ji4？"

msgid "Catalyst? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""
"催化剂​？​你​什么​意思​？\n"
"cui1hua4ji4？ni3 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid "Catch you later, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"回头​再聊​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"hui2tou2 zai4 liao2，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid "Catching you red-handed. You've got some explaining to do, Doc."
msgstr ""
"你​被​我​逮到​了​。​医生​，​你​最好​解释一下​。\n"
"ni3 bei4 wo3 dai3 dao4 le5。yi1sheng1，ni3 zui4hao3 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4。"

msgid "Catching you red-handed. You've got some explaining to do, doctor."
msgstr ""
"你​被​我​逮到​了​。​医生​，​你​最好​解释一下​。\n"
"ni3 bei4 wo3 dai3 dao4 le5。yi1sheng1，ni3 zui4hao3 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4。"

msgid "Catchy."
msgstr ""
"挺​好​记​的​。\n"
"ting3 hao3 ji4 de5。"

msgid "Catering? I don't follow."
msgstr ""
"餐饮​承办​工作​？​我​没​听​明白​。\n"
"can1yin3 cheng2ban4 gong1zuo4？wo3 mei2 ting1 ming2bai5。"

msgid ""
"Caught in the viselike grip of those heavy, industrial cyberarms, the MKVI's cyberskull might as well be made of tinfoil.\n"
"\n"
"The air fills with the tortured sounds of tearing plastic and buckling steel."
msgstr ""
"被​那双​强劲​的​工业​级​赛博​手臂​钳住​，​MKVI​的​赛博​颅骨​简直​像​锡箔纸​般​脆弱不堪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​房间​充斥​着​塑料​撕裂​与​金属​扭曲​的​刺耳​声响​。\n"
"\n"
"bei4 na4 shuang1 qiang2jing4 de5 gong1ye4 ji2 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 qian2zhu4，MKVI de5 sai4bo2 lu2gu3 jian3zhi2 xiang4 xi1bo2zhi3 ban1 cui4 ruo4 bu4 kan1。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 chong1chi4 zhao2 su4liao4 si1lie4 yu4 jin1shu3 niu3qu1 de5 ci4er3 sheng1xiang3。"

msgid "Causes a distracting sound but does no DMG."
msgstr ""
"产生​令人​分心​的​声音​，​但​不会​造成​伤害​。\n"
"chan3sheng1 ling4ren2 fen1xin1 de5 sheng1yin1，dan4 bu4hui4 zao4cheng2 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"Causes additional magical damage over time to target upon impact. Base "
"damage is your Strength + 3."
msgstr ""
"命中​时​对​目标​造成​额外​的​持续​魔法​伤害​。​基础​伤害​相当于​你​的​力量​值​+​3​。\n"
"ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 de5 chi2xu4 mo2fa3 shang1hai4。ji1chu3 shang1hai4 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 de5 li4liang5 zhi2 +3。"

msgid ""
"Causes additional magical damage over time to target upon impact. Base "
"damage is your Strength + 4."
msgstr ""
"命中​时​对​目标​造成​额外​的​持续​魔法​伤害​。​基础​伤害​相当于​你​的​力量​值​+​4​。\n"
"ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 de5 chi2xu4 mo2fa3 shang1hai4。ji1chu3 shang1hai4 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 de5 li4liang5 zhi2 +4。"

msgid ""
"Causes heavy bleeding to target upon impact. Damage is your Strength + 2. "
"May do AP DMG on a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"命中​时​对​目标​造成​严重​出血​，​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​+​2​的​伤害​。​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 yan2zhong4 chu1xue4，zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 +2 de5 shang1hai4。bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"Causes minor bleeding to target upon impact. Damage is equal to your "
"Strength. May do AP DMG on a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"命中​时​对​目标​造成​轻微​出血​，​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​的​伤害​。​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 qing1wei1 chu1xue4，zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 de5 shang1hai4。bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"Causes minor bleeding to target upon impact. Damage is your Strength + 2."
msgstr ""
"命中​时​对​目标​造成​轻微​出血​。​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​+​2​的​伤害​。\n"
"ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 qing1wei1 chu1xue4。zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 +2 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"Causes minor bleeding to target upon impact. Damage is your Strength + 3."
msgstr ""
"命中​时​对​目标​造成​轻微​出血​。​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​+​3​的​伤害​。\n"
"ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 qing1wei1 chu1xue4。zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 +3 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"Causes minor bleeding to target upon impact. Damage is your Strength + 4."
msgstr ""
"命中​时​对​目标​造成​轻微​出血​。​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​+​4​的​伤害​。\n"
"ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 qing1wei1 chu1xue4。zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 +4 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"Causes moderate bleeding to target upon impact. Damage is your Strength + 1."
" May do AP DMG on a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"命中​时​对​目标​造成​中等​出血​，​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​+​1​的​伤害​。​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 zhong1deng3 chu1xue4，zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 +1 de5 shang1hai4。bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid "Cavalier Concussion Grenade"
msgstr ""
"骑​将​震撼​弹\n"
"ji4 jiang1 zhen4han4 dan4"

msgid "Cavalier Deputy"
msgstr ""
"骑​将​副​警长\n"
"ji4 jiang1 fu4 jing3 zhang3"

msgid "Cavalier Deputy (Smartlink)"
msgstr ""
"骑​将​副​警长​（​智能​枪版​）\n"
"ji4 jiang1 fu4 jing3 zhang3 （zhi4neng2 qiang1ban3）"

msgid "Cavalier Frag Grenade"
msgstr ""
"骑​将​破片​手榴弹\n"
"ji4 jiang1 po4pian4 shou3liu2dan4"

msgid "Cavalier's midline frag grenade."
msgstr ""
"骑​将​的​中端​破片​手榴弹​。\n"
"ji4 jiang1 de5 zhong4 duan1 po4pian4 shou3liu2dan4。"

msgid "Celestial Mana Fist"
msgstr ""
"星界​之拳\n"
"xing1 jie4 zhi1 quan2"

msgid "Cell Hack"
msgstr ""
"骇入​收容​室\n"
"hai4 ru4 shou1rong2 shi4"

msgid ""
"Center-stage, sitting behind a large mahogany desk, is the silhouette of an impressive-looking woman in a charcoal-gray suit. The tip of a cigarette glows cherry-red in the shadows.\n"
"\n"
"She leans forward into the light, and you catch your first glimpse of Alice."
msgstr ""
"舞台​中央​，​一位​轮廓​分明​、​身着​炭灰色​套装​的​女性​坐在​巨大​的​桃花心木​办公桌​后​。​烟头​在​阴影​中​透出​淡淡的​红光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​向前​探身​迎​向​光线​，​你​也​终于​初次​见到​了​爱丽丝​。\n"
"\n"
"wu3tai2 zhong1yang1，yi1 wei4 lun2kuo4 fen1ming2、shen1zhuo2 tan4 hui1 se4 tao4zhuang1 de5 nu:3xing4 zuo4 zai4 ju4da4 de5 tao2hua1xin1mu4 ban4 gong1 zhuo1 hou4。yan1tou2 zai4 yin1ying3 zhong4 tou4 chu1 dan4 dan4 de5 hong2 guang1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang4qian2 tan4shen1 ying2 xiang4 guang1xian4，ni3 ye3 zhong1yu2 chu1ci4 jian4dao4 le5 ai4li4si1。"

msgid ""
"Central has questions about your loyalty. You'll double-time it back to your"
" supervisor if you know what's good for you."
msgstr ""
"指挥部​对​你​的​忠诚​有所​疑虑​。​要是​你​还​在乎​自己​，​就​赶紧​回去​找​你​的​主管​报​到​。\n"
"zhi3hui1bu4 dui4 ni3 de5 zhong1cheng2 you3suo3 yi2lu:4。yao4shi5 ni3 hai2 zai4hu5 zi4ji3，jiu4 gan3jin3 hui2qu5 zhao3 ni3 de5 zhu3guan3 bao4 dao4。"

msgid ""
"Central sent me to inspect you, and I don't like what I see! Now get out of "
"my sight!"
msgstr ""
"指挥部​派​我​来​检查​你们​，​而​眼下​这​副​景象​可​让​我​很​不​满意​！​立刻​从​我​眼前​消失​！\n"
"zhi3hui1bu4 pai4 wo3 lai2 jian3cha2 ni3men5，er2 yan3xia4 zhe4 fu4 jing3xiang4 ke3 rang4 wo3 hen3 bu4 man3yi4！li4ke4 cong2 wo3 yan3qian2 xiao1shi1！"

msgid "Centurion Laser Axe"
msgstr ""
"百夫长​激光​斧\n"
"bai3 fu1 zhang3 ji1guang1 fu3"

msgid "Cerebral Booster"
msgstr ""
"大脑​增幅\n"
"da4nao3 zeng1fu2"

msgid ""
"Certainly! They've been spinning quite a tale in these parts, of late.\n"
"\n"
"Hard to know anything for sure, though. One rumor says they hijack freight out of Frankfurter Tor. Then the next day, you hear about a sighting down in Alexanderplatz!"
msgstr ""
"当然​！​这些​家伙​的​事​最近​可​在​风口浪尖​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​倒​也​没有​什么​能​确定​的​消息​。​头​一天​有人​说​他们​在​法兰克福​门外​头劫​了​货​，​第二天​又​有人​说​在​亚历山大广场​看到​了​他们​！\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2！zhe4xie1 jia1huo5 de5 shi4 zui4jin4 ke3 zai4 feng1kou3lang4jian1 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 dao3 ye3 mei2you3 shen2me5 neng2 que4ding4 de5 xiao1xi5。tou2 yi1 tian1 you3ren2 shuo1 ta1men5 zai4 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2wai4 tou2 jie2 le5 huo4，di4er4tian1 you4 you3ren2 shuo1 zai4 ya4 li4 shan1 dai4 yan3 chang2 kan4dao4 le5 ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"Certainly. I must confess that, before I moved to Berlin, I was something of a celebrity doctor. I had a chain of TRIAGE clinics that stretched from Bilbao to Madrid.\n"
"\n"
"I was a very wealthy man."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​我​必须​承认​，​在​搬​到​柏林​之前​，​我​也​算是​个​名医​。​我​开设​了​一连串​的​“​分诊​”​诊所​，​从​毕尔巴鄂​一直​延伸​到​马德里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​个​非常​富有​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。wo3 bi4xu1 cheng2ren4，zai4 ban1 dao4 bo2lin2 zhi1qian2，wo3 ye3 suan4shi4 ge4 ming2yi1。wo3 kai1she4 le5 yi1lian2chuan4 de5“fen4 zhen3” zhen3suo3，cong2 bi4er3ba1e4 yi1zhi2 yan2shen1 dao4 ma3de2li3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 ge4 fei1chang2 fu4you3 de5 ren2。"

msgid "Ceska Black Scorpion"
msgstr ""
"CZ​黑蝎\n"
"CZ hei1 xie1"

msgid "Ceska Black Scorpion (Smartlink)"
msgstr ""
"CZ​黑蝎​（​智能​枪版​）\n"
"CZ hei1 xie1 （zhi4neng2 qiang1ban3）"

msgid "Cestus"
msgstr ""
"皮带​拳套\n"
"pi2dai4 quan2tao4"

msgid "Chainshot"
msgstr ""
"连环​射击\n"
"lian2huan2 she4ji1"

msgid "Chainshot: Attack three different targets in a single attack"
msgstr ""
"连环​射击​：​单次​攻击​三名​不同​目标\n"
"lian2huan2 she4ji1：dan1 ci4 gong1ji1 san1 ming2 bu4tong2 mu4biao1"

msgid ""
"Chainshot: Attack three different targets in a single attack. Cannot be used"
" with Revolvers."
msgstr ""
"连环​射击​：​单次​攻击​三名​不同​目标\n"
"lian2huan2 she4ji1：dan1 ci4 gong1ji1 san1 ming2 bu4tong2 mu4biao1"

msgid "Change Resolution"
msgstr ""
"更改​分辨率\n"
"geng1gai3 fen1bian4lu:4"

msgid ""
"Change your mind, friend? If you want in, I can get you a paring knife..."
msgstr ""
"改变​主意​了​吗​，​朋友​？​如果​你​想​加入​，​我​可以​给​你​一把​水果刀​……\n"
"gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 le5 ma5，peng2you5？ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 jia1ru4，wo3 ke3yi3 gei3 ni3 yi1 ba3 shui3guo3dao1……"

msgid "Changed my mind. Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​。​总之​还是​谢​了​。\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。zong3zhi1 hai2shi5 xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Changing the subject, are we? I know you're hiding something back there."
msgstr ""
"故意​转换​话题​是​吧​？​我​知道​你们​在​后头​藏​了​什么​东西​。\n"
"gu4yi4 zhuan3huan4 hua4ti2 shi4 ba1？wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 zai4 hou4tou5 zang4 le5 shen2me5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Chaos. You are staring into the mouth of chaos. A howling vortex of golden light and green water, with a gaping maw of pure nothingness at its center.\n"
"\n"
"As you stare into the void, you can feel it staring back; its vision reaches into and through you. And then, all at once, it swallows you."
msgstr ""
"一片​混沌​。​你​正​凝视着​混沌​之口​。​金色​光芒​与​碧绿​水流​交织成​咆哮​的​漩涡​，​其​中心​是​纯粹​虚无​的​巨口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​凝视​虚空​时​，​能​感受​到​它​也​在​凝视着​你​；​它​的​目光​穿透​你​的​躯体​直抵​灵魂深处​。​霎时间​，​它​将​你​吞噬​殆尽​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 pian1 hun4dun4。ni3 zheng1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 hun4dun4 zhi1 kou3。jin1se4 guang1mang2 yu4 bi4lu:4 shui3liu2 jiao1 zhi1 cheng2 pao2xiao4 de5 xuan2wo1，qi2 zhong1xin1 shi4 chun2cui4 xu1wu2 de5 ju4 kou3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 ning2shi4 xu1kong1 shi2，neng2 gan3shou4 dao4 ta1 ye3 zai4 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3 ； ta1 de5 mu4guang1 chuan1tou4 ni3 de5 qu1ti3 zhi2 di3 ling2hun2shen1chu4。sha4shi2jian1，ta1 jiang1 ni3 tun1shi4 dai4jin4。"

msgid "Character:"
msgstr ""
"角色​：\n"
"jue2se4："

msgid "Charisma"
msgstr ""
"魅力\n"
"mei4li4"

msgid "Charming."
msgstr ""
"很​不错​。\n"
"hen3 bu4cuo4。"

msgid "Cheap Booze"
msgstr ""
"廉价​酒\n"
"lian2jia4 jiu3"

msgid "Cheap but potent alcohol."
msgstr ""
"廉价​但​后劲​十足​的​酒​。\n"
"lian2jia4 dan4 hou4jin4 shi2zu2 de5 jiu3。"

msgid ""
"Cheap corporate art. Looks like marble from a distance, but up close, it's "
"clearly made of injection molded plasticrete."
msgstr ""
"廉价​的​企业​风格​艺术​。​远​看​还​以为​是​大理石​，​但​离近​了​瞧​会​发现​，​明显​是​注射​成型​的​混凝​塑料​。\n"
"lian2jia4 de5 qi3ye4 feng1ge2 yi4shu4。yuan3 kan4 hai2 yi3wei2 shi4 da4li3shi2，dan4 li2 jin4 le5 qiao2 hui4 fa1xian4，ming2xian3 shi4 zhu4she4 cheng2xing2 de5 hun4 ning2 su4liao4。"

msgid ""
"Cheap, synthesized music pipes in from somewhere off-screen. Philip turns to stare in the direction that the music came from.\n"
"\n"
"A smooth baritone voice sings out a phrase in Slovak. A half-second later, a different voice shouts a translation in German."
msgstr ""
"廉价​的​合成​音乐​从​屏幕​外​的​某处​传来​。​菲利普​转过​头​，​盯​着​音乐​传来​的​方向​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​流畅​的​男中音​用​斯洛伐克语​唱​出​一句​歌词​。​半秒​后​，​另​一个​声音​用​德语​大声​喊出​了​翻译​。\n"
"\n"
"lian2jia4 de5 he2cheng2 yin1yue4 cong2 ping2mu4 wai4 de5 mou3chu4 chuan2lai2。fei1li4pu3 zhuai3 guo4 tou2，ding1 zhao2 yin1yue4 chuan2lai2 de5 fang1xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 liu2chang4 de5 nan2zhong1yin1 yong4 si1luo4fa2ke4yu3 chang4 chu1 yi1ju4 ge1ci2。ban4 miao3 hou4，ling4 yi1ge5 sheng1yin1 yong4 de2yu3 da4sheng1 han3 chu1 le5 fan1yi4。"

msgid "Check my credentials with your friend back there. Go on, I can wait."
msgstr ""
"去​你​那位​朋友​那儿​查查​我​的​身份​。​去​吧​，​我​可以​等​着​。\n"
"qu4 ni3 na4 wei4 peng2you5 na4r5 cha2 cha2 wo3 de5 shen1fen4。qu4 ba1，wo3 ke3yi3 deng3 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"Check the Shadowlands BBS on the mission computer. Monika... she used the "
"bidding service there to sell valuable data."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​用​任务​电脑​访问​暗影​之地​论坛​。​莫妮卡​……​她​以前​会​用​论坛​上​的​拍卖​功能​贩卖​有​价值​的​数据​。\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 yong4 ren4wu5 dian4nao3 fang3wen4 an4ying3 zhi1 de5 lun4tan2。Mo4ni1ka3……ta1 yi3qian2 hui4 yong4 lun4tan2 shang4 de5 pai1mai4 gong1neng2 fan4mai4 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 shu4ju4。"

msgid ""
"Check the body and see if he had a chipjack. Just be quick about it - I "
"don't know how long it'll be before we have company here."
msgstr ""
"去​看看​尸体​上​是否​有​芯片​插口​。​不过​要​快​—​—​我​不​知道​敌人​还有​多久​会​来​。\n"
"qu4 kan4kan5 shi1ti3 shang4 shi4fou3 you3 xin1pian4 cha1kou3。bu4guo4 yao4 kuai4——wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 di2ren2 hai2you3 duo1jiu3 hui4 lai2。"

msgid "Check yourself, Blitz. You wait for my go from here on out."
msgstr ""
"给​我​收敛​点​，​布里​茨​。​现在​你​得​听​我​指挥​。\n"
"gei3 wo3 shou1lian3 dian3，Bu4li3ci2。xian4zai4 ni3 de2 ting1 wo3 zhi3hui1。"

msgid "Checkpoint Drone 2"
msgstr ""
"检查点​无人机​2\n"
"jian3 cha2 dian3 wu2ren2ji1 2"

msgid "Chemical Barrel"
msgstr ""
"化学​桶\n"
"hua4xue2 tong3"

msgid ""
"Chemical storage barrels. A light jostle shows that they're completely "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"化学物质​贮存​桶​。​轻推​之下​显示​它们​是​空​的​。\n"
"hua4 xue2 wu4 zhi4 zhu4cun2 tong3。qing1 tui1 zhi1xia4 xian3shi4 ta1men5 shi4 kong1 de5。"

msgid "Chemicals"
msgstr ""
"化学品\n"
"hua4xue2pin3"

msgid "Chi Casting"
msgstr ""
"气功\n"
"qi4gong1"

msgid ""
"Chief, I never knew your friend, but this ain't her. I've heard spook stories about something like this... deckers disappearin' from the Matrix, then showin' up again, but... *wrong.*\n"
"\n"
"I never put much stock in 'em... not until now."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​我​没见​过​你​的​朋友​，​但​这​不​可能​是​她​。​我​听​过​类似​的​灵异​故事​……​碟客​从​矩阵​中​消失​，​但​之后​……​又​以​*​诡异​*​的​样子​出现​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从没​太​相信​这些​故事​……​直到现在​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，wo3 mei2 jian4 guo4 ni3 de5 peng2you5，dan4 zhe4 bu4 ke3neng2 shi4 ta1。wo3 ting1 guo4 lei4si4 de5 ling2yi4 gu4shi4……die2 ke4 cong2 ju3zhen4 zhong4 xiao1shi1，dan4 zhi1hou4……you4 yi3*gui3yi4*de5 yang4zi5 chu1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2mei2 tai4 xiang1xin4 zhe4xie1 gu4shi4……zhi2dao4xian4zai4。"

msgid ""
"Chief, I'm telling you... if you don't kill him, he's going to kill you."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​我​跟​你​说​……​如果​你​不​弄死​他​的话​，​他​就​会​弄死​你​的​。\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1……ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 nong4si3 ta1 de5hua4，ta1 jiu4 hui4 nong4si3 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Chief, don't take this the wrong way... but you can be astonishingly creepy "
"sometimes. I'm, y'know... I'm just sayin'."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​别误会​我​的​意思​……​但​你​有时候​真的​会​让​人​毛骨悚然​。​这个​，​我​……​我​只是​随便说说​。\n"
"tou2r5，bie4 wu4 hui4 wo3 de5 yi4si5……dan4 ni3 you3shi2hou5 zhen1de5 hui4 rang4 ren2 mao2gu3song3ran2。zhe4ge5，wo3……wo3 zhi3shi4 sui2 bian4 shuo1 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Chief, let me ask you something... did you suspect that something like this "
"was going to happen? When you let me go in there, did you know that I was "
"going to fuck it up somehow?"
msgstr ""
"老大​，​我​想​问问​你​……​你​之前​是不是​怀疑​过会​发生​这种​事​？​你​同意​我​行动​的​时候​，​是不是​已经​想到​我​可能​会​搞砸​了​？\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 xiang3 wen4 wen4 ni3……ni3 zhi1qian2 shi4bu5shi4 huai2yi2 guo4 hui4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4？ni3 tong2yi4 wo3 xing2dong4 de5 shi2hou5，shi4bu5shi4 yi3jing1 xiang3dao4 wo3 ke3neng2 hui4 gao3za2 le5？"

msgid ""
"Chief. Please.\n"
"\n"
"I always operate at a hundred percent. *Especially* when I'm on a run."
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从来​都​是​拿出​百分百​的​干劲​。​*​尤其​*​是​我​在​跑​差事​的​时候​。\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2lai2 dou1 shi4 na2chu1 bai3fen1bai3 de5 gan4jin4。*you2qi2*shi4 wo3 zai4 pao2 cha4shi4 de5 shi2hou5。"

msgid "Chill, I only meant that it can be a hard life for a kid."
msgstr ""
"淡定​，​我​只是​说​你​一个​孩子​过​这种​生活​太苦​了​。\n"
"dan4ding4，wo3 zhi3shi4 shuo1 ni3 yi1ge5 hai2zi5 guo4 zhe4zhong3 sheng1huo2 tai4 ku3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Chilling news, Taylor. We'll all be rooting for those brave volunteers back "
"here at home."
msgstr ""
"令人心寒​的​消息​，​泰勒​。​我们​所有人​都​会​在​家乡​为​那些​勇敢​的​志愿者​们​加油​助威​。\n"
"ling3 ren2 xin1 han2 de5 xiao1xi5，tai4le4。wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 hui4 zai4 jia1xiang1 wei2 na4xie1 yong3gan3 de5 zhi4yuan4zhe3 men5 jia1you2 zhu4wei1。"

msgid ""
"Chin up, fearless leader. We did good back there.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, we still have a dragon to worry about."
msgstr ""
"振作​点​，​无畏​领袖​。​我们​已经​做​得​很​好​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​况且​，​我们​还有​条​巨龙​要​对付​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen4zuo4 dian3，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3men5 yi3jing1 zuo4 de2 hen3 hao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"kuang4qie3，wo3men5 hai2you3 tiao2 ju4long2 yao4 dui4fu5 ni2。"

