"\n"
"wo3 zhen1 fu2 le5。dou1 dao4 zhe4 fen4 shang4 le5 ni3 hai2 gen1 wo3 fei4hua4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei2 ni3 chu1sheng1ru4si3，bu4 qiu2 duo1 gao1 de5 hui2bao4，zhi4shao3 ni3 de2 ting1 wo3 ba3 hua4 shuo1 wan2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Christ. I'm getting too close to something. There's a trail of bodies, and there have been disappearances.\n"
"\n"
"Gearbox. Marcian. Peregrine. They've all disappeared within the past few years... Gearbox just went AWOL yesterday. And they were all making the same sorts of inquiries about the Firewing that I've been."
msgstr ""
"该死​。​我离​某些​事太近​了​。​有​很多​尸体​，​还有​很多​失踪​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​齿轮箱​。​马尔​西安​。​游​隼​。​他们​都​是​在​过去​几年​内​失踪​的​……​齿轮箱​昨天​才​刚刚​失踪​。​而且​他们​都​和​我​一样​打听​过火​翼​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"gai1si3。wo3 li2 mou3xie1 shi4 tai4 jin4 le5。you3 hen3 duo1 shi1ti3，hai2you3 hen3 duo1 shi1zong1 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"chi3lun2xiang1。ma3 er3 xi1an1。you2 sun3。ta1men5 dou1 shi4 zai4 guo4qu4 ji3nian2 nei4 shi1zong1 de5……chi3lun2xiang1 zuo2tian1 cai2 gang1gang5 shi1zong1。er2qie3 ta1men5 dou1 he4 wo3 yi1yang4 da3ting5 guo4Huo3yi4 de5 shi4。"

