"Christ. Poor Vik.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know how I'm gonna tell his folks. Real close-knit family, they were."
msgstr ""
"唉​。​可怜​的​维克​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​该​怎么​告诉​他​的​家人​。​他们​的​关系​十分​亲密​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1。ke3lian2 de5 wei2 ke4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 gao4su4 ta1 de5 jia1ren2。ta1men5 de5 guan1xi5 shi2fen1 qin1mi4。"

msgid ""
"Christ. Twenty years. All this time, and still, no leads. Even with all of my contacts, and my resources...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes another long swallow of cheap liquor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Even with my \"legendary bullheadedness,\" I've made no progress at all. I haven't turned up a single god damned thing."
msgstr ""
"老天​。​二十年​了​。​这么久​还是​没有​线索​。​即使​我​动用​了​所有​的​关系​和​资源​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​喝​了​一大口​廉价​酒​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​即使​我​有​“​传说​中​的​牛脾气​”​，​我​还是​毫无​进展​。​我​什么​也​没​找到​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1。er4 shi2 nian2 le5。zhe4 ma2 jiu3 hai2shi5 mei2you3 xian4suo3。ji2shi3 wo3 dong4yong4 le5 suo3you3 de5 guan1xi5 he4 zi1yuan2……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 he4 le5 yi1 dai4 kou3 lian2jia4 jiu3 {{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ji2shi3 wo3 you3“chuan2shuo1 zhong4 de5 niu2pi2qi5”，wo3 hai2shi5 hao2wu2 jin4zhan3。wo3 shen2me5 ye3 mei2 zhao3dao4。"

