"xing2 le5，Bu4li3ci2。ni3 de5 zi4zun1xin1 qu4 na3r5 le5？ru2guo3 ta1 xiang3 yi1zou3liao3zhi1，ba3 suo3you3 ze2ren4 dou1 tui1 gei3 ni3，na4 wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 rang4 ta1 zou3——na4 shi4 ta1 de5 sun3shi1。"

msgid ""
"Come on, Doc. Think past your vendetta for a second. What if exterminating "
"the dragons changes the landscape in a way that we can't predict?"
