msgid "Consider it a test. I need to know where your loyalties lie."
msgstr ""
"就​当​这​是​一次​考验​。​我​需要​看看​你​是否​忠诚​。\n"
"jiu4 dang1 zhe4 shi4 yi1ci4 kao3yan4。wo3 xu1yao4 kan4kan5 ni3 shi4fou3 zhong1cheng2。"

msgid ""
"Consider yourself lucky to be talking to me. I barely made it here in one "
"piece."
msgstr ""
"能​跟​你​说​上​话​已经​算​走运​了​。​我​差点​就​没能​赶到​这里​。\n"
"neng2 gen1 ni3 shuo1 shang4 hua4 yi3jing1 suan4 zou3yun4 le5。wo3 cha4dian3 jiu4 mei2 neng2 gan3dao4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Considering Schäfer's skill and experience, on-site IC must've been extreme... even by Berlin standards. Security of that kind costs money - REAL money.\n"
"\n"
"Given the evidence uncovered so far, corporate involvement unlikely. The connection to the Firewing is too strong.\n"
"\n"
"So... let's come right out and say it. The dragon is what we're dealing with here. And the smart money says that she's coming for me next."
msgstr ""
"考虑​到​舍费尔​的​技术​和​经验​，​现场​IC​一定​极其​夸张​……​即使​按照​柏林​的​标准​也​是​如此​。​这种​规格​的​安全​系统​需要​一大笔钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​目前​发现​的​证据​来看​，​公司​不太可能​参与​其中​。​与​火翼​的​联系​太​紧密​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​……​我​就​直说​了​吧​。​我们​要​对付​的​就是​巨龙​。​有点​脑子​的​人​就​会​知道​，​她​下​一个​目标​是​我​。\n"
"\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 she3 fei4 er3 de5 ji4shu4 he4 jing1yan4，xian4chang3 IC yi1ding4 ji2qi2 kua1zhang1……ji2shi3 an4zhao4 bo2lin2 de5 biao1zhun3 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。zhe4zhong3 gui1ge2 de5 an1quan2 xi4tong3 xu1yao4 yi1 dai4 bi3 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 mu4qian2 fa1xian4 de5 zheng4ju4 lai2 kan4，gong1si1 bu4 tai4 ke3 neng2 can1yu4 qi2zhong1。yu4 Huo3yi4 de5 lian2xi4 tai4 jin3mi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……wo3 jiu4 zhi2 shuo1 le5 ba1。wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 jiu4shi4 ju4long2。you3dian3 nao3zi5 de5 ren2 jiu4 hui4 zhi1dao4，ta1 xia4 yi1ge5 mu4biao1 shi4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Considering Schäfer's skill and experience, on-site IC must've been extreme... even by Berlin standards. Security of that kind costs money - REAL money.\n"
"\n"
"Given the evidence uncovered so far, corporate involvement unlikely. The connection to the Firewing is too strong. And the smart money says that she's comin' after me next."
msgstr ""
"考虑​到​舍费尔​的​技术​和​经验​，​现场​IC​一定​极其​夸张​……​即使​按照​柏林​的​标准​也​是​如此​。​这种​规格​的​安全​系统​需要​一大笔钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​目前​发现​的​证据​来看​，​公司​不太可能​参与​其中​。​与​火翼​的​联系​太​紧密​了​。​有点​脑子​的​人​就​会​知道​，​她​下​一个​目标​是​我​。\n"
"\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 she3 fei4 er3 de5 ji4shu4 he4 jing1yan4，xian4chang3 IC yi1ding4 ji2qi2 kua1zhang1……ji2shi3 an4zhao4 bo2lin2 de5 biao1zhun3 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。zhe4zhong3 gui1ge2 de5 an1quan2 xi4tong3 xu1yao4 yi1 dai4 bi3 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 mu4qian2 fa1xian4 de5 zheng4ju4 lai2 kan4，gong1si1 bu4 tai4 ke3 neng2 can1yu4 qi2zhong1。yu4 Huo3yi4 de5 lian2xi4 tai4 jin3mi4 le5。you3dian3 nao3zi5 de5 ren2 jiu4 hui4 zhi1dao4，ta1 xia4 yi1ge5 mu4biao1 shi4 wo3。"

msgid "Considering current events, I'd say that you're not wrong about that."
msgstr ""
"考虑​到​眼下​的​一系列​事情​，​我​觉得​你​这个​决定​还​真​没错​。\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 yan3xia4 de5 yi1xi4lie4 shi4qing5，wo3 jue2de5 ni3 zhe4ge5 jue2ding4 hai2 zhen1 mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Considering the level of security that Azetechnology is running, I wouldn't count on medical evac being available on this run. In fact, I'd bet against it.\n"
"\n"
"That means that if anyone falls unconscious in there, they'll be buried when the building collapses. Obviously, you can't let that happen.\n"
"\n"
"I'd suggest stocking up on medical supplies before leaving the Kreuzbasar. "
msgstr ""
"考虑​到​阿兹特​科技​目前​的​安保​等级​，​我​不​认为​这次​行动​能​有​撤离​伤员​的​机会​。​事实上​，​我敢​打赌​根本​不​可能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也就是说​，​如果​有​队员​在​这次​行动​中​失去​意识​，​建筑​坍塌​时​他们​就​会​被​活埋​。​显然​，​我们​绝​不能允许​这种​情况​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​建议​你​离开​克洛伊​茨​集市​前先备​好​医疗​物资​。\n"
"\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 mu4qian2 de5 an1bao3 deng3ji2，wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 neng2 you3 che4li2 shang1yuan2 de5 ji1hui4。shi4shi2shang4，wo3 gan3 da3du3 gen1ben3 bu4 ke3neng2。\n"
"\n"
"ye3jiu4shi4shuo1，ru2guo3 you3 dui4yuan2 zai4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 zhong4 shi1qu4 yi4shi2，jian4zhu4 tan1ta1 shi2 ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 bei4 huo2mai2。xian3ran2，wo3men5 jue2 bu4 neng2 yun3 xu3 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 li2kai1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 qian2 xian1 bei4 hao3 yi1liao2 wu4zi1。"

msgid ""
"Considering the state of the rest of the building, this stairwell looks "
"relatively clean and intact."
msgstr ""
"考虑​到​建筑​其余部分​的​状况​，​这个​楼梯间​显得​相对​干净​完好​。\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 jian4zhu4 qi2 yu2 bu4 fen4 de5 zhuang4kuang4，zhe4ge5 lou2ti1jian1 xian3de5 xiang1dui4 gan1jing4 wan2hao3。"

