"shou1suo1 shen4shang4xian4。shi3yong4zhe3 huo4de2 +1 xing2dong4 dian3，dan4 shou4dao4 shang1hai4 shi2 e2wai4 cheng2shou4 2 dian3 shang1hai4，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

