msgid ""
"Conventional weapons haven't done much to hurt them, I'm afraid. Even the small ones have shown an extraordinary resilience to physical damage, and bigger ones that have been popping up are nigh unkillable. There was an amoeboid thing with many tongues terrorizing the skies above Buenos Aires... they destroyed half the city trying to bring it down.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Bad business."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​常规武器​对​它们​几乎​毫无​杀伤力​。​就​连​体型​较​小​的​个体​也​展现出​非凡​的​物理​抗性​，​而​那些​不断​冒出来​的​大型​生物​更是​近乎​不死​之身​。​有次​布宜诺斯艾利斯​上空​出现​过​一个​长着​许多​舌头​的​变形虫​状​怪物​肆虐​天际​……​他们​为​击落​它​几乎​摧毁​了​半座​城市​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​糟糕透顶​。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 chang2gui1wu3qi4 dui4 ta1men5 ji1hu1 hao2wu2 sha1shang1li4。jiu4 lian2 ti3xing2 jiao4 xiao3 de5 ge4ti3 ye3 zhan3 xian4 chu1 fei1fan2 de5 wu4li3 kang4xing4，er2 na4xie1 bu4duan4 mao4chu1lai2 de5 da4xing2 sheng1wu4 geng4shi4 jin4hu5 bu4 si3 zhi1 shen1。you3ci4 bu4yi2nuo4si1ai4li4si1 shang4kong1 chu1xian4 guo4 yi1ge5 zhang3 zhao2 xu3duo1 she2tou5 de5 bian4xing2chong2 zhuang4 guai4wu5 si4nu:e4 tian1ji4……ta1men5 wei2 ji1luo4 ta1 ji1hu1 cui1hui3 le5 ban4 zuo4 cheng2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zao1 gao1 tou4 ding3。"

msgid ""
"Conversation between Player, Blitz and Hasenkamp. Tells about the Decker and"
" guards coming."
msgstr ""
"玩家​、​布里​茨​与​哈森​坎普​的​对话​。​关于​碟客​和​即将​到来​的​警卫​。\n"
"wan2jia1、Bu4li3ci2 yu4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 dui4hua4。guan1yu2 die2 ke4 he4 ji2jiang1 dao4lai2 de5 jing3wei4。"

msgid ""
"Conversation between the Player, Blitz, and Hasenkamp. Hasenkamp gives the "
"player the black box, and says that he's going to deal with Meat Grinder."
msgstr ""
"玩家​、​布里​茨​与​哈森​坎普​的​对话​。​哈森​坎普​将​黑匣子​交给​玩家​，​并​表示​他​将​亲自​处理​“​绞肉机​”​。\n"
"wan2jia1、Bu4li3ci2 yu4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 dui4hua4。Ha1sen1kan3pu3 jiang1 hei1xia2zi5 jiao1gei3 wan2jia1，bing4 biao3shi4 ta1 jiang1 qin1zi4 chu3li3“jiao3rou4ji1”。"

