msgstr ""
"说服​亚历山大​离开​人类​至上​主义者\n"
"shuo1fu2 ya4li4shan1da4 li2kai1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3"

msgid ""
"Convince you of what? That I'm not a monster?\n"
"\n"
"I don't know how to do that, Glory."
msgstr ""
"你​要​我​说​什么​？​让​你​相信​我​不是​怪物​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​该​怎么​做到​这​一点​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 wo3 shuo1 shen2me5？rang4 ni3 xiang1xin4 wo3 bu4shi4 guai4wu5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3，Ge2luo4li2。"

