msgid ""
"Corporate interests? No. This is a matter of human interest.\n"
"\n"
"Innocent lives are being extinguished at an appalling rate. I am in a position to help put an end to the slaughter, and so I must. \n"
"\n"
"It really is that simple."
msgstr ""
"公司​利益​？​不​，​这是​人类​利益​的​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无辜​的​生命​正以​令人震惊​的​速度​消逝​。​我​有​能力​帮助​结束​这场​屠杀​，​所以​我​必须​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这么​简单​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1si1 li4yi4？bu4，zhe4 shi4 ren2lei4 li4yi4 de5 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"wu2gu1 de5 sheng1ming4 zheng1 yi3 ling3 ren2 zhen4 jing1 de5 su4du4 xiao1shi4。wo3 you3 neng2li4 bang1zhu4 jie2shu4 zhe4 chang2 tu2sha1，suo3yi3 wo3 bi4xu1 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4me5 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"Corporate life... well, let's just say that it wasn't for me.\n"
"\n"
"I needed to work in an environment where my creativity would be rewarded."
msgstr ""
"公司​生活​……​嗯​，​姑且​说​这种​日子​不​适合​我​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​需要​在​能够​激发​我​创造力​的​环境中工作​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1si1 sheng1huo2……en1，gu1qie3 shuo1 zhe4zhong3 ri4zi5 bu4 shi4he2 wo3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 zai4 neng2gou4 ji1fa1 wo3 chuang4zao4li4 de5 huan2 jing4 zhong4 gong1 zuo4。"

msgid "Corporations, political groups, gangs. Everyone is on edge."
msgstr ""
"公司​，​政治​团体​，​帮派​，​所有人​都​一触即发​。\n"
"gong1si1，zheng4zhi4 tuan2ti3，bang1pai4，suo3you3ren2 dou1 yi1chu4ji2fa1。"

msgid "Corpse"
msgstr ""
"尸体\n"
"shi1ti3"

msgid "Corpulent Troll"
msgstr ""
"发福​的​巨魔\n"
"fa1fu2 de5 ju4mo2"

msgid ""
"Correct. Once you've left to see Alice, her information will be your *only* priority. No more distractions, and no more side work.\n"
"\n"
"I will busy myself canceling your remaining jobs and smoothing any ruffled feathers."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​一旦​你​决定​去​见​爱丽丝​，​她​的​情报​将会​是​你​*​唯一​*​的​头等大事​。​不容​分心​，​也​顾不得​再​处理​其他​事务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​帮​你​取消​剩余​的​差事​，​以及​平息​客户​的​不满​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。yi1dan4 ni3 jue2ding4 qu4 jian4 ai4li4si1，ta1 de5 qing2bao4 jiang1hui4 shi4 ni3*wei2yi1*de5 tou2 deng3 dai4 shi4。bu4rong2 fen1xin1，ye3 gu4bu5de5 zai4 chu3li3 qi2ta1 shi4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 bang1 ni3 qu3xiao1 sheng4yu2 de5 cha4shi4，yi3ji2 ping2xi1 ke4hu4 de5 bu4man3。"

msgid "Corrupted File"
msgstr ""
"损坏​的​文件\n"
"sun3huai4 de5 wen2jian4"

msgid ""
"Could a Kabbalist create a golem if his faith were misplaced? Could a vodouist Houngan commune with the Loa if they did not exist? Could a Shinto kannushi channel the power of kami spirits if they were figments of his imagination?\n"
"\n"
"All of these things happen in the Sixth World. And yet, the traditional forms of many religions would each claim that the others are \"wrong.\""
msgstr ""
"假如​卡​巴拉​学者​的​信仰​对象​是​错​的​，​他们​还​能​创造​出魔​像​吗​？​假如​洛阿神​不​存在​，​伏​都​教​的​祭司​还​能​与其​沟通​吗​？​假如​八百万​神灵​都​是​神​道教​的​神官​想象​出来​的​，​他们​还​能​引导​其​力量​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​都​是​在​第六​纪元​真真切切​发生​的​事​。​然而​，​许多​宗教​传统​都​会​各自​宣称​其他​宗教​是​“​错误​的​”​。\n"
"\n"
"jia3ru2 ka3 ba1 la1 xue2zhe3 de5 xin4yang3 dui4xiang4 shi4 cuo4 de5，ta1men5 hai2 neng2 chuang4zao4 chu1 mo2 xiang4 ma5？jia3ru2 luo4 e1 shen2 bu4 cun2zai4，fu2 dou1 jiao1 de5 ji4si1 hai2 neng2 yu3qi2 gou1tong1 ma5？jia3ru2 ba1 bai3 wan4 shen2ling2 dou1 shi4 shen2 dao4jiao4 de5 shen2 guan1 xiang3xiang4 chu1lai2 de5，ta1men5 hai2 neng2 yin3dao3 qi2 li4liang5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 zai4 di4 liu4 ji4yuan2 zhen1 zhen1 qie1 qie1 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4。ran2er2，xu3duo1 zong1jiao4 chuan2tong3 dou1 hui4 ge4zi4 xuan1cheng1 qi2ta1 zong1jiao4 shi4“cuo4wu4 de5”。"

msgid "Could also be related to whatever happened with Mr. Laine before."
msgstr ""
"也​可能​和​之前​莱恩​先生​遭遇​的​事情​有关​。\n"
"ye3 ke3neng2 he4 zhi1qian2 lai2en1 xian1sheng5 zao1yu4 de5 shi4qing5 you3guan1。"

msgid ""
"Could be any number of things.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns to face the initiate. Her voice is gentle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wouldn't worry about it, sweetie. We'll make sure that Marta is okay."
msgstr ""
"任何​事​都​有​可能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转身​看​向​学徒​。​她​的​声音​很​温柔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​，​亲爱​的​。​我们​会​确保​玛​尔塔​没事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ren4he2 shi4 dou1 you3 ke3neng2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 kan4 xiang4 xue2tu2。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 wen1rou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，qin1ai4 de5。wo3men5 hui4 que4bao3 Ma3er3ta3 mei2shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Could be that the man was trying to convince Laine to offer advice one way "
"or the other. (h)"
msgstr ""
"或许​那​人​就是​想​说服​莱恩​给出​某种​建议​。\n"
"huo4xu3 na4 ren2 jiu4shi4 xiang3 shuo1fu2 lai2en1 gei3 chu1 mou3zhong3 jian4yi4。"

msgid "Could be used with a grenade as an improvised explosive device."
msgstr ""
"可以​和​手榴弹​捆​在​一起​作为​简易​爆炸​装置​使用​。\n"
"ke3yi3 he4 shou3liu2dan4 kun3 zai4 yi1qi3 zuo4wei2 jian3yi4 bao4zha4 zhuang1zhi4 shi3yong4。"

msgid "Could be worse."
msgstr ""
"一般般​吧​。\n"
"yi1ban1ban1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Could have been someone else that beat on her while she was all chipped out?"
msgstr ""
"会​不会​是​有人​趁​她​神智不清​的​时候​打​了​她​？\n"
"hui4 bu4hui4 shi4 you3ren2 chen4 ta1 shen2 zhi4 bu4 qing1 de5 shi2hou5 da3 le5 ta1？"

msgid "Could it have just been an attempted mugging?"
msgstr ""
"会​不会​只是​单纯​的​拦路抢劫​？\n"
"hui4 bu4hui4 zhi3shi4 dan1chun2 de5 lan2 lu4 qiang3 jie2？"

msgid ""
"Could these rumors be related to what's happening here? Am I being paranoid?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, as if seriously considering the question. Then he shakes his head and slams his fist on the table.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. I don't think so. Something *big* is happening here, and I'm right in the middle of it."
msgstr ""
"这些​传言​会​不会​与​这里​发生​的​事情​有关​？​我​是不是​太​多疑​了​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​片刻​，​似乎​在​认真​考虑​这个​问题​。​然后​他​摇​了​摇头​，​一拳​砸​在​桌子​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​我​不​这么​认为​。​这里​有​*​大​*​事​发生​，​而​我​正​置身其中​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 chuan2yan2 hui4 bu4hui4 yu4 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 you3guan1？wo3 shi4bu5shi4 tai4 duo1yi2 le5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 pian4ke4，si4hu1 zai4 ren4zhen1 kao3lu:4 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。ran2hou4 ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2，yi1 quan2 za2 zai4 zhuo1zi5 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。zhe4li3 you3*dai4*shi4 fa1sheng1，er2 wo3 zheng1 zhi4 shen1 qi2 zhong4。"

msgid "Could you tell me about some of the other people around town?"
msgstr ""
"你​能​和​我​聊聊​街区​的​其他人​吗​？\n"
"ni3 neng2 he4 wo3 liao2 liao2 jie1qu1 de5 qi2 ta1 ren2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Could you two use some help? It sounds like your friend has gotten herself "
"in trouble."
msgstr ""
"你们​俩​需要​帮忙​吗​？​听​起来​你们​的​朋友​把​自己​卷入​麻烦​了​。\n"
"ni3men5 lia3 xu1yao4 bang1mang2 ma5？ting1 qi3lai5 ni3men5 de5 peng2you5 ba3 zi4ji3 juan3ru4 ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Couldn't agree more. It's your turn, Blitz... get the door open so that we "
"can get inside."
msgstr ""
"完全同意​。​该​你​了​，​布里​茨​……​把门​打开​，​让​我们​进去​。\n"
"wan2 quan2 tong2 yi4。gai1 ni3 le5，Bu4li3ci2……ba3men2 da3kai1，rang4 wo3men5 jin4qu4。"

msgid ""
"Couldn't be helped. If you hadn't, he'd've killed you. Believe it.\n"
"\n"
"We're gonna take you away from here. Back to the Kreuzbasar. Get you the help that you need."
msgstr ""
"没​办法​，​如果​你​不​先​动手​，​死​的​就是​你​了​，​相信​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​会带​你​离开​这里​，​回到​克洛伊​茨​集市​去​。​我们​能​提供​你​需要​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ban4fa3，ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 xian1 dong4shou3，si3 de5 jiu4shi4 ni3 le5，xiang1xin4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 dai4 ni3 li2kai1 zhe4li3，hui2dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 qu4。wo3men5 neng2 ti2gong1 ni3 xu1yao4 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Couldn't have put it better myself. Come on, people... we're taking you "
"someplace safe."
msgstr ""
"你​的​发言​太精彩​了​。​来​吧​各位​……​我们​会带​你们​去​安全​的​地方​。\n"
"ni3 de5 fa1yan2 tai4 jing1 cai3 le5。lai2 ba1 ge4wei4……wo3men5 hui4 dai4 ni3men5 qu4 an1quan2 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid "Couldn't help overhearing you two. Going up against Aztechnology, huh?"
msgstr ""
"我​偷听​了​你​俩​说话​。​你们​要​和​阿兹特​科技​作对​吗​？\n"
"wo3 tou1ting1 le5 ni3 lia3 shuo1hua4。ni3men5 yao4 he4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 zuo4dui4 ma5？"

