"ting1 ting1 ta1 zen3me5 shuo1 ye3 mei2 huai4chu5……"

msgid "Couldn't've put it better myself."
msgstr ""
"说​得​太​对​了​。\n"
"shuo1 de2 tai4 dui4 le5。"

