"your heart doesn't give out first."
msgstr ""
"超感​是​一种​安非他命​。​再用​下去​，​你​的​牙会​连根​烂掉​，​不过​到​那​时候​，​恐怕​你​自己​也​已经​疯疯癫癫​，​顾不上​这种​事​了​……​前提​是​你​的​心脏​没先​罢工​。\n"
"chao1 gan3 shi4 yi1zhong3 an1fei1ta1ming4。zai4 yong4 xia4qu4，ni3 de5 ya2 hui4 lian2 gen1 lan4 diao4，bu4guo4 dao4 na4 shi2hou5，kong3pa4 ni3 zi4ji3 ye3 yi3jing1 feng1feng5dian1dian1，gu4bu5shang4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 le5……qian2ti2 shi4 ni3 de5 xin1zang4 mei2 xian1 ba4gong1。"

