"​看来​得​杀出​一条​血路​了​。​又​是​场​不必要​的​耽搁​。\n"
"\n"
"gai1si3。wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 dang1shi2 mei2 gan4diao4 na4ge5 xi3huan5 mei3 hei1 de5 chun3huo4 chi2 zao3 hui4 chu1shi4——wo3 zao3jiu4 liao4dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 hua4zuo4 li4zhao3，zhou1wei2 de5 kong1qi4 fang3fu2 dou1 zai4 chan4dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 de2 sha1 chu1 yi1 tiao2 xue4lu4 le5。you4 shi4 chang2 bu4bi4yao4 de5 dan1ge5。"

msgid ""
"Damn it. I knew this was gonna happen. I fuckin' knew it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He cranes his neck around to look you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Everybody pile out of the van. And get ready, $(l.name)... we're gonna need some muscle in a second."
msgstr ""
"见鬼​。​我​就​知道​会​这样​。​我​他​妈​早就​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转过​头​直视​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有人​滚​下车​。​$(l.name)​，​准备​好​……​我们​要​干​一场​硬仗​了​。\n"
"\n"
"jian4gui3。wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 hui4 zhe4yang4。wo3 ta1 ma1 zao3jiu4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 zhi2shi4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3you3ren2 gun3 xia4che1。$(l.name)，zhun3bei4 hao3……wo3men5 yao4 gan4 yi1 chang2 ying4zhang4 le5。"

msgid "Damn it. I was really looking forward to killing a dragon."
msgstr ""
"该死​。​我​本来​很​期待​杀死​一头​巨龙​的​。\n"
"gai1si3。wo3 ben3lai2 hen3 qi1dai4 sha1si3 yi1tou2 ju4long2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Damn it. We're in trouble enough already... we can't afford to lose what few"
" leads we have."
msgstr ""
"该死​。​我们​已经​够​倒霉​了​……​可​不能​再​失去​仅​有​的​线索​了​。\n"
"gai1si3。wo3men5 yi3jing1 gou4 dao3mei2 le5……ke3 bu4neng2 zai4 shi1qu4 jin3 you3 de5 xian4suo3 le5。"

msgid "Damn right I am. Remember that."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​你​给​我​记住​了​啊​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。ni3 gei3 wo3 ji4zhu5 le5 a1。"

msgid ""
"Damn right I did.\n"
"\n"
"Out in the field, nothing will kill you faster than losing the respect of your team. I’d remember that if I were you."
msgstr ""
"那​是​自然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​战场​上​，​如果​连​你​手底下​的​人​都​不再​尊重​你​，​那​你​的​死期​就​不远​了​。​我​建议​你​把​这个​牢牢记​在​心里​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 zi4ran2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhan4chang3 shang4，ru2guo3 lian2 ni3 shou3 de5 xia4 de5 ren2 dou1 bu4zai4 zun1zhong4 ni3，na4 ni3 de5 si3qi1 jiu4 bu4 yuan3 le5。wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 ba3 zhe4ge5 lao2 lao2 ji4 zai4 xin1li5。"

msgid ""
"Damn right it is. That thing is insane, and dangerous, and she murdered thousands.\n"
"\n"
"I would’ve made the same call. "
msgstr ""
"确实​。​她​疯癫​又​危险​，​而且​还​杀害​了​成千上万​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​换作​是​我​也​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2。ta1 feng1dian1 you4 wei1xian3，er2qie3 hai2 sha1hai4 le5 cheng2qian1shang4wan4 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid "Damn right you do."
msgstr ""
"你​可算​说​对​了​。\n"
"ni3 ke3 suan4 shuo1 dui4 le5。"

msgid "Damn right."
msgstr ""
"太对​了​。\n"
"tai4 dui4 le5。"

msgid "Damn right. Go! Go! Go!"
msgstr ""
"说​得​没错​。​行动​！\n"
"shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。xing2dong4！"

msgid ""
"Damn right. She's insane, and dangerous, and she's murdered thousands.\n"
"\n"
"I would’ve made the same call. "
msgstr ""
"确实​。​她​疯癫​又​危险​，​而且​还​杀害​了​成千上万​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​换作​是​我​也​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2。ta1 feng1dian1 you4 wei1xian3，er2qie3 hai2 sha1hai4 le5 cheng2qian1shang4wan4 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid "Damn you, Hasenkamp..."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​，​你​大爷​的​……\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3，ni3 da4ye2 de5……"

msgid ""
"Damn. Damn it to hell.\n"
"\n"
"All right, $(l.name). With your decker down, you'll need a command-access key to get through the security door.\n"
"\n"
"High-ranking Knight Errant personnel should carry such a key. When I see one on the screen, I'll mark him for you."
msgstr ""
"见鬼​。​真是​见鬼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​由于​你​的​碟​客​倒下​，​你​需要​拿到​指挥​级​权限​密钥​才能​通过​那扇​安全门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​高阶​游侠​骑士​人员​应该​会​携带​这样​的​钥匙​。​如果​我​在​屏幕​上​看到​的话​，​就​为​你​标记​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"jian4gui3。zhen1shi5 jian4gui3。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，$(l.name)。you2yu2 ni3 de5 die2 ke4 dao3xia4，ni3 xu1yao4 na2dao4 zhi3hui1 ji2 quan2xian4 mi4yao4 cai2neng2 tong1guo4 na4 shan1 an1 quan2 men2。\n"
"\n"
"gao1jie1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 ren2yuan2 ying1gai1 hui4 xie2dai4 zhe4yang4 de5 yao4shi5。ru2guo3 wo3 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4 kan4dao4 de5hua4，jiu4 wei2 ni3 biao1ji4 chu1lai2。"

msgid "Damn. For a second there, I thought you might be getting somewhere."
msgstr ""
"该死​。​有​那么​一会儿​，​我​还​以为​你​的话​能成​呢​。\n"
"gai1si3。you3 na4me5 yi1hui4r5，wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 de5hua4 neng2 cheng2 ni2。"

msgid "Damn. Just when I thought you were getting through to this nutjob."
msgstr ""
"该死​。​我​还​以为​你​真的​说服​了​这个​疯子​。\n"
"gai1si3。wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 zhen1de5 shuo1fu2 le5 zhe4ge5 feng1zi5。"

msgid ""
"Damn. Well, that's okay, chief... I helped keep you from eating a bullet, and that's what's most important.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, that decker had some drek-hot programs loaded into his rig. I managed to snatch up one of 'em, too... looks like a sort of hijacking tool for taking over hostile IC."
msgstr ""
"可恶​。​行​吧​，​头儿​……​我​努力​没​让​你​吃​到​枪子儿​，​这才​是​最​重要​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此外​，​那个​碟客​的​设备​里​还​装​了​些​牛​逼​的​程序​。​我​也​顺手​弄​来​了​一个​……​看起来​像是​某种​劫持​工具​，​能​用来​接管​敌对​的​IC​程序​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3wu4。xing2 ba1，tou2r5……wo3 nu3li4 mei2 rang4 ni3 chi1 dao4 qiang1 zi3 er2，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ci3wai4，na4ge5 die2 ke4 de5 she4bei4 li3 hai2 zhuang1 le5 xie1 niu2 bi1 de5 cheng2xu4。wo3 ye3 shun4shou3 long4 lai2 le5 yi1ge5……kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 mou3zhong3 jie2chi2 gong1ju4，neng2 yong4lai2 jie1guan3 di2dui4 de5 IC cheng2xu4。"

msgid ""
"Damu-zid. That is one of the names, yes. \n"
"\n"
"Damuzid of the fair-spoken mouth, of the ever-kind eyes."
msgstr ""
"塔木兹​。​其中​一个​名字​，​是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​塔木兹​，​口若悬河​，​眼如​明镜​。\n"
"\n"
"ta3 mu4 zi1。qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 ming2zi5，shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta3 mu4 zi1，kou3ruo4xuan2he2，yan3 ru2 ming2jing4。"

msgid "Dancer"
msgstr ""
"舞者\n"
"wu3zhe3"

msgid "Dancer's Bag"
msgstr ""
"舞者​的​包\n"
"wu3zhe3 de5 bao1"

msgid ""
"Danger. Danger. Intruder Detected.\n"
"\n"
"Security Protocols Engaged."
msgstr ""
"危险​。​危险​。​检测​到​入侵者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​安全​协议​已​启动​。\n"
"\n"
"wei1xian3。wei1xian3。jian3ce4 dao4 ru4qin1zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"an1quan2 xie2yi4 yi3 qi3dong4。"

msgid "Danni"
msgstr ""
"丹妮\n"
"dan1 ni1"

msgid ""
"Danni looks you up and down. When she's finished sizing you up, she puts her"
" hands on her hips and smiles."
msgstr ""
"丹妮​上下​打量​了​你​一番​。​之后​，​她​双手​叉腰​，​露出​微笑​。\n"
"dan1 ni1 shang4xia4 da3liang5 le5 ni3 yi1 fan1。zhi1hou4，ta1 shuang1shou3 cha1yao1，lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"Danni's work is amateur-level, but serviceable. The connections look solid, and the whole job is neat and tidy.\n"
"\n"
"In theory, this tap could power the kids' soykaf shop for years to come."
msgstr ""
"丹妮​的​工作​成果​只是​业余​水平​，​但​也​已经​够用​了​。​连接​部分​看起来​相当​牢固​，​整个​物件​看上去​整齐​干净​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​理论​上​，​这个​电力​接口​足以​让​豆​咖店​在​未来​的​数年​里​免除​缺电​之虞​。\n"
"\n"
"dan1 ni1 de5 gong1zuo4 cheng2guo3 zhi3shi4 ye4yu2 shui3ping2，dan4 ye3 yi3jing1 gou4yong4 le5。lian2jie1 bu4fen5 kan4qi3lai5 xiang1dang1 lao2gu4，zheng3ge4 wu4jian4 kan4shang5qu5 zheng3qi2 gan1jing4。\n"
"\n"
"li3lun4 shang4，zhe4ge5 dian4li4 jie1kou3 zu2yi3 rang4 dou4 ka1 dian4 zai4 wei4lai2 de5 shu4nian2 li3 mian3chu2 que1dian4 zhi1 yu2。"

msgid "Dante"
msgstr ""
"但丁\n"
"dan4ding1"

msgid ""
"Dante appears depressed. He looks at you sadly from time to time but doesn't"
" attempt to gain your attention. "
msgstr ""
"但丁​显得​情绪低落​。​他​时不时​悲伤地​望​着​你​，​却​没有​试图​引起​你​的​注意​。\n"
"dan4ding1 xian3de5 qing2 xu4 di1 la4。ta1 shi2bu4shi2 bei1 shang1 de5 wang4 zhao2 ni3，que4 mei2you3 shi4tu2 yin3qi3 ni3 de5 zhu4yi4。"

msgid ""
"Dante glows like a burning coal. His aura is a shifting explosion of red and yellow light.\n"
"\n"
"As you look into the dog's aura, you can feel it looking back into yours. Acknowledging you. In astral space.\n"
"\n"
"Dante is more than just a dog. "
msgstr ""
"但丁​如同​一块​燃烧​的​炭块​，​周身​散发​着​变幻​的​红黄色​灵光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​凝视​巨犬​的​灵光​时​，​你​注意​到​它​也​在​回望​你​。​在​这星界​中​认知​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但丁​不仅仅​是​一条​狗​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 ru2tong2 yi1kuai4 ran2shao1 de5 tan4 kuai4，zhou1shen1 san4fa1 zhao2 bian4huan4 de5 hong2 huang2 se4 ling2guang1。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 ning2shi4 ju4 quan3 de5 ling2guang1 shi2，ni3 zhu4yi4 dao4 ta1 ye3 zai4 hui2wang4 ni3。zai4 zhe4 xing1 jie4 zhong4 ren4zhi1 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 bu4jin3jin3 shi4 yi1 tiao2 gou3。"

msgid ""
"Dante got mad. Real mad. He started shaking and twitching, and I saw fire in his eyes.\n"
"\n"
"He was on the guy before I could blink."
msgstr ""
"但丁​发怒​了​。​异常​愤怒​。​他​开始​浑身​颤抖​抽搐​，​我​看见​他​眼中​燃着​怒火​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​眨眼​间​，​他​就​扑​向​了​那​人​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 fa1nu4 le5。yi4chang2 fen4nu4。ta1 kai1shi3 hun2shen1 chan4dou3 chou1chu4，wo3 kan4jian4 ta1 yan3zhong1 ran2 zhao2 nu4huo3。\n"
"\n"
"zha3yan3 jian1，ta1 jiu4 pu1 xiang4 le5 na4 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Dante growls low and begins to drool. Droplets hiss as they hit the frozen "
"pavement. He lowers his head, and the hackles on the back of his neck stand "
"stiff."
msgstr ""
"但丁​低​吼​着​，​口角​淌​下​涎水​，​滴​在​结冰​的​路面​上​嘶​嘶​作响​。​他​低下头​，​颈后​的​寒​毛根根​竖起​。\n"
"dan4ding1 di1 hou3 zhao2，kou3jiao3 tang3 xia4 xian2shui3，di1 zai4 jie2bing1 de5 lu4mian4 shang4 si1 si1 zuo4 xiang3。ta1 di1 xia4 tou2，jing3 hou4 de5 han2 mao2 gen1 gen1 shu4qi3。"

msgid "Dante humped your leg?"
msgstr ""
"但丁​会​蹭​你​的​腿​？\n"
"dan4ding1 hui4 ceng4 ni3 de5 tui3？"

msgid ""
"Dante leads the pack! Allies within a range of 3 gain +1 Movement. Lasts 2 "
"RND."
msgstr ""
"但丁​引领​着​队伍​！​但丁​3​格​以内​的​盟友​获得​+​1​移动力​。​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"dan4ding1 yin3ling3 zhao2 dui4wu3！dan4ding1 3 ge2 yi3nei4 de5 meng2you3 huo4de2 +1 yi2 dong4 li4。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Dante leans into you and looks up mournfully, pressing his ribs against your"
" leg. "
msgstr ""
"但丁​靠着​你​的​身体​，​用​肋骨​抵住​你​的​腿​，​悲伤地​抬头​看向​你​。\n"
"dan4ding1 kao4 zhao2 ni3 de5 shen1ti3，yong4 lei4gu3 di3zhu4 ni3 de5 tui3，bei1 shang1 de5 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Dante lifts his head and looks up at you mournfully. The feral aggression is"
" gone from his eyes. He’s changed - you can see it - but he’s still Dante."
msgstr ""
"但丁​悲伤地​抬头​看向​你​。​他​眼中​那股​野性​般的​凶光​消失​了​。​你​看得出​他​已然​不同​—​—​但​他​仍​是​但丁​。\n"
"dan4ding1 bei1 shang1 de5 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。ta1 yan3zhong1 na4 gu3 ye3xing4 ban1 de5 xiong1guang1 xiao1shi1 le5。ni3 kan4de5chu1 ta1 yi3ran2 bu4tong2——dan4 ta1 reng2 shi4 dan4ding1。"

msgid ""
"Dante lowers his head, the hackles on the back of his neck standing stiff. \n"
"\n"
"He takes another step towards you and Eiger."
msgstr ""
"但丁​低下头​，​颈后​的​寒​毛根根​竖起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​朝​你​和​艾格尔​又​迈出​一步​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 di1 xia4 tou2，jing3 hou4 de5 han2 mao2 gen1 gen1 shu4qi3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chao2 ni3 he4 Ai4ge2er3 you4 mai4chu1 yi1 bu4。"

msgid ""
"Dante sniffs the air. Looks uninterested. But now that he's seen your aura in astral space, his expression softens. His ears stand back up, and you could swear that you see him smile.\n"
"\n"
"He takes his place by your side."
msgstr ""
"但丁​嗅​着​空气​。​看起来​他​对​肉干​不感兴趣​。​但​他​在​星界​中​看见​了​你​的​灵光​，​于是​表情​随之​柔和​下来​。​他​的​耳朵​重新​竖起​，​仿佛​对​你​露出​了​微笑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​在​你​身边​站​好​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 xiu4 zhao2 kong1qi4。kan4qi3lai5 ta1 dui4 rou4gan1 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。dan4 ta1 zai4 xing1 jie4 zhong4 kan4jian4 le5 ni3 de5 ling2guang1，yu2shi4 biao3qing2 sui2zhi1 rou2he2 xia4lai5。ta1 de5 er3duo5 chong2xin1 shu4qi3，fang3fu2 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 le5 wei1xiao4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 ni3 shen1bian1 zhan4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Dante stands his ground, resolute. Defiant. \n"
"\n"
"His jaws part, and his throat begins to pulse. His mouth glows as if it were stuffed with burning coals."
msgstr ""
"但丁​站​在​原地​。​纹丝不动​。​满怀​蔑视​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​下颌​微张​，​喉结​开始​起伏​，​口腔​内​发出​耀光​，​仿佛​塞满​了​熊熊燃烧​的​煤炭​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 zhan4 zai4 yuan2di4。wen2si1bu4dong4。man3huai2 mie4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 xia4he2 wei1 zhang1，hou2jie2 kai1shi3 qi3fu2，kou3qiang1 nei4 fa1chu1 yao4 guang1，fang3fu2 sai1man3 le5 xiong2 xiong2 ran2 shao1 de5 mei2tan4。"

msgid "Dante stays with me. Where I run, he runs."
msgstr ""
"但丁​会​和​我​待​在​一起​。​我​到​哪儿​，​他​就​到​哪儿​。\n"
"dan4ding1 hui4 he4 wo3 dai1 zai4 yi1qi3。wo3 dao4 na3r5，ta1 jiu4 dao4 na3r5。"

msgid ""
"Dante takes the treat in his mouth, but it’s clear he has no appetite for it"
" and the jerky drops to the floor. He leans into you and looks up "
"mournfully, pressing his ribs against your leg."
msgstr ""
"但丁​将​食物​吃进​嘴里​，​但​很​明显​他​并​没有​什么​胃口​，​肉干​又​从​他​嘴里​掉​到​地上​。​他​靠着​你​的​身体​，​用​肋骨​抵住​你​的​腿​，​悲伤地​抬头​看向​你​。\n"
"dan4ding1 jiang1 shi2wu4 chi1 jin4 zui3li3，dan4 hen3 ming2xian3 ta1 bing4 mei2you3 shen2me5 wei4kou3，rou4gan1 you4 cong2 ta1 zui3li3 diao4 dao4 di4shang5。ta1 kao4 zhao2 ni3 de5 shen1ti3，yong4 lei4gu3 di3zhu4 ni3 de5 tui3，bei1 shang1 de5 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。"

msgid "Dante was Monika's. That makes him one of us, in a way."
msgstr ""
"但丁​是​莫妮卡​养​的​狗​。​某种意义​上​来说​，​他​也​是​我们​的​一员​。\n"
"dan4ding1 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 yang3 de5 gou3。mou3 zhong3 yi4 yi4 shang4 lai2 shuo1，ta1 ye3 shi4 wo3men5 de5 yi1yuan2。"

msgid "Dante whimpers and looks up at you mournfully."
msgstr ""
"但丁​呜咽​着​，​悲伤地​抬头​看向​你​。\n"
"dan4ding1 wu1ye4 zhao2，bei1 shang1 de5 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Dante's expression softens. He's seen your aura in astral space. His ears stand back up, and you could swear that you see him smile.\n"
"\n"
"He trots over and takes his place by your side."
msgstr ""
"但丁​的​表情​柔和​下来​。​他​在​星界​中​看见​了​你​的​灵光​。​他​的​耳朵​重新​竖起​，​仿佛​对​你​露出​了​微笑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​小跑​过来​，​在​你​身边​站​好​。\n"
"\n"
