msgid ""
"Das Kesselhaus-Hotel & Nightclub. Crown jewel of Drogenkippe, the filthiest kiez in Berlin.\n"
"\n"
"Opening the door to the ground-level dance club is like bashing your head into a wall of sound. Flashing lights stab your eyes, and the air is perfumed with cheap synthohol and engine grease. Everything in here is cranked up to 11. A playground for the numb.\n"
"\n"
"Green Winters is somewhere in this building. You steel yourself for the sensory assault and step inside. The team makes a quick check of their weapons and follows you into Das Kesselhaus. "
msgstr ""
"“​锅炉房​”​旅馆​&​夜店​。​这里​是​柏林​最​肮脏​的​街区​“​毒坑区​”​之中​最​耀眼​的​明珠​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​推开​地面​层​舞厅​的​门​，​你​感觉​自己​仿佛​在​用头​撞​向​一堵​声浪​之墙​。​闪烁​的​灯光​刺痛​双眼​，​空气​中​弥漫着​廉价​合成​酒精​与​机油​的​混合​气味​。​这里​的​一切​都​调到​了​最大​档位​，​可以​说​是​麻木​者​的​游乐场​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格林​·​温特斯​就​在​这栋​建筑​里​的​某个​地方​。​你​强忍​着​感官​冲击​踏入​其中​。​其他​队员​快速​检查​武器​，​然后​紧随​你​进入​了​锅炉房​。\n"
"\n"
"“Guo1lu2fang2” lu:3guan3 & ye4dian4。zhe4li3 shi4 bo2lin2 zui4 ang1zang1 de5 jie1qu1“du2 keng1 qu1” zhi1zhong1 zui4 yao4yan3 de5 ming2zhu1。\n"
"\n"
"tui1kai1 di4mian4 ceng2 wu3ting1 de5 men2，ni3 gan3jue2 zi4ji3 fang3fu2 zai4 yong4 tou2 zhuang4 xiang4 yi1 du3 sheng1lang4 zhi1 qiang2。shan3shuo4 de5 deng1guang1 ci4tong4 shuang1yan3，kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 lian2jia4 he2cheng2 jiu3jing1 yu4 ji1you2 de5 hun4he2 qi4wei4。zhe4li3 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 diao4 dao4 le5 zui4 dai4 dang4 wei4，ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 ma2mu4 zhe3 de5 you2le4chang3。\n"
"\n"
"ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 jiu4 zai4 zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4 li3 de5 mou3 ge4 di4fang1。ni3 qiang3ren3 zhao2 gan3guan1 chong1ji1 ta1 ru4 qi2zhong1。qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 kuai4su4 jian3cha2 wu3qi4，ran2hou4 jin3 sui2 ni3 jin4ru4 le5 Guo1lu2fang2。"

