msgid ""
"Dear. Don't be rude.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles apologetically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're both under a lot of stress, and this isn't a purchase that we're making lightly. You see, Hans is enrolled in a very prestigious - and very competitive - school. Buying him AugmenTech enhancements isn't a luxury, it's a *necessity.*"
msgstr ""
"亲爱​的​，​别​这么​粗鲁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​露出​歉意​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​俩​都​承受​着​巨大​压力​，​而​这次​购买​也​绝非​轻率​之​举​。​要​知道​，​汉斯​就读​的​是​一所​声望​卓著​，​且​竞争​异常​激烈​的​学校​。​给​他​购买​“​增强​科技​”​的​强化​装置​并非​奢侈品​，​而是​*​必需品​*​。\n"
"\n"
"qin1ai4 de5，bie4 zhe4me5 cu1lu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 qian4yi4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 lia3 dou1 cheng2shou4 zhao2 ju4da4 ya1li4，er2 zhe4 ci4 gou4mai3 ye3 jue2fei1 qing1shuai4 zhi1 ju3。yao4 zhi1dao4，han4si1 jiu4du2 de5 shi4 yi1 suo3 sheng1wang4 zhuo2zhu4，qie3 jing4zheng1 yi4chang2 ji1lie4 de5 xue2xiao4。gei3 ta1 gou4mai3“zeng1qiang2 ke1ji4” de5 qiang2hua4 zhuang1zhi4 bing4fei1 she1chi3pin3，er2shi4*bi4xu1pin3*。"

msgid ""
"Dearest Talya,\n"
"\n"
"Please stop asking me where my work has taken me. You know I can't tell you that - I made it clear when we parted at the train station last year. Security on this project is very tight, and all of our outgoing email is being scanned. Although we have been quite busy recently, I believe we are nearing a breaking point, and I can come home to you and Felix soon.\n"
"\n"
"All my love,\n"
"Lili"
msgstr ""
"亲爱​的​塔尔​亚​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​请别​再​问​我​工作​带我去​了​哪里​。​你​知道​我​不能​告诉​你​—​—​去年​我们​在​火车站​分别​时​我​就​已经​说​清楚​了​。​这个​项目​的​安保​措施​非常​严格​，​所有​外发​的​邮件​都​会​被​扫描​。​虽然​我们​最近​一直​很​忙​，​但​我​相信​我们​即将​达到​临界点​，​很快​我​就​能​回家​和​你​以及​费利克斯​团聚​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​爱​你​的​，​\n"
"​莉莉\n"
"\n"
"qin1ai4 de5 ta3 er3 ya4：\n"
"\n"
"qing3 bie4 zai4 wen4 wo3 gong1zuo4 dai4 wo3 qu4 le5 na3li3。ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 bu4neng2 gao4su4 ni3——qu4nian2 wo3men5 zai4 huo3che1zhan4 fen1bie2 shi2 wo3 jiu4 yi3jing1 shuo1 qing1chu5 le5。zhe4ge5 xiang4mu4 de5 an1bao3 cuo4shi1 fei1chang2 yan2ge2，suo3you3 wai4 fa1 de5 you2jian4 dou1 hui4 bei4 sao3miao2。sui1ran2 wo3men5 zui4jin4 yi1zhi2 hen3 mang2，dan4 wo3 xiang1xin4 wo3men5 ji2jiang1 da2dao4 lin2jie4dian3，hen3 kuai4 wo3 jiu4 neng2 hui2jia1 he4 ni3 yi3ji2 fei4li4ke4si1 tuan2ju4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ai4 ni3 de5，\n"
"li4 li4"

msgid ""
"Death is nothing. NOTHING! If you'd seen what I've seen, you would know for yourselves.\n"
"\n"
"The chip... it OPENS YOUR EYES. Slot one, and you become a *GOD.*"
msgstr ""
"死亡​不算什么​。​不算什么​！​如果​你们​亲眼见到​我​所​见​过​的​景象​，​你们​就​会​明白​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​芯片​……​会​开辟​你​的​视界​。​装​上​一块​，​你​就​会​成为​*​神​*​。\n"
"\n"
"si3wang2 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2。bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2！ru2guo3 ni3men5 qin1 yan3 jian4 dao4 wo3 suo3 jian4 guo4 de5 jing3xiang4，ni3men5 jiu4 hui4 ming2bai5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 xin1pian4……hui4 kai1pi4 ni3 de5 shi4jie4。zhuang1 shang4 yi1kuai4，ni3 jiu4 hui4 cheng2wei2*shen2*。"

