msgid ""
"Deciphering the arcane sigils that fill the page is child's play. It looks "
"as though the hermetic theoreticians here have been working to develop a "
"metamagical method of dealing with radiation."
msgstr ""
"破解​页面​上​布满​的​奥术​符文​易如反掌​。​看来​这里​的​赫耳墨斯​理论家​们​一直​在​致力于​研发​一种​超​魔法​方法​来​应对​辐射​。\n"
"po4jie3 ye4mian4 shang4 bu4man3 de5 ao4 shu4 fu2wen2 yi4ru2fan3zhang3。kan4lai5 zhe4li3 de5 he4er3mo4si1 li3lun4jia1 men5 yi1zhi2 zai4 zhi4 li4 yu2 yan2fa1 yi1zhong3 chao1 mo2fa3 fang1fa3 lai2 ying4dui4 fu2she4。"

