"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can't say that I like the idea of handin' this thing over to Schmidt... Lord knows what he's going to do with it."
msgstr ""
"该​做​决定​了​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​并​不是​很​想​把​这​东西​交给​施密特​……​天知道​他​要​用来​干什么​。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 zuo4 jue2ding4 le5，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bing4 bu4shi4 hen3 xiang3 ba3 zhe4 dong1xi1 jiao1gei3 shi1mi4te4……tian1 zhi1 dao4 ta1 yao4 yong4lai2 gan4shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Decision time, boss. We've got two different clients, and they both want the same thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can't say that I like the idea of givin' this thing to either of 'em."
msgstr ""
"该​做​决定​了​，​老大​。​我们​的​两位​客户​想要​同​一样​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​我​说​，​我​谁​都​不想​给​。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 zuo4 jue2ding4 le5，lao3da4。wo3men5 de5 liang3 wei4 ke4hu4 xiang3yao4 tong2 yi1yang4 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4 wo3 shuo1，wo3 shei2 dou1 bu4xiang3 gei3。"

msgid ""
"Decisions, decisions, huh, chief?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
