msgid ""
"Deckers can *manage* a building, sure. But when I rig into a security system, I *become* the building.\n"
"\n"
"Anything hardwired into the system becomes a part of me. Turrets, doors, elevators... you name it."
msgstr ""
"碟客​确实​是​能​*​管理​*​一栋​楼​。​但​当​我​黑进​安保​系统​的​时候​，​我​就​*​成为​*​了​大楼​本身​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​接入​系统​的​设备​都​会​成为​我​的​一部分​。​炮塔​、​门​、​电梯​……​无一例外​。\n"
"\n"
"die2 ke4 que4shi2 shi4 neng2*guan3li3*yi1 dong4 lou2。dan4 dang1 wo3 hei1 jin4 an1bao3 xi4tong3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 jiu4*cheng2wei2*le5 da4lou2 ben3shen1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 jie1ru4 xi4tong3 de5 she4bei4 dou1 hui4 cheng2wei2 wo3 de5 yi1bu4fen5。pao4ta3、men2、dian4ti1……wu2 yi1 li4 wai4。"

msgid ""
"Deckers use a cyberdeck to jack into the Matrix - the worldwide information grid and computer network. By projecting their minds into the electronic world, deckers can find secrets others keep hidden away. They use programs and Expert Systems to fight off the protections that megacorporations place in their way.\n"
"\n"
"Key Attributes: Intelligence\n"
"Key Skill: Decking\n"
"Key Specialization: Expert Systems\n"
"Key Gear: Must have a cyberdeck to jack into the Matrix"
msgstr ""
"碟客​使用​赛博碟板​接入​被​称为​“​矩阵​”​的​全球化​信息网​及​计算机网络​。​碟客​可​将​其​意识​投射​到​电子​世界​中​，​以此​寻获​他人​藏匿​起来​的​秘密​。​他们​使用​程序​和​专家系统​来​对抗​超级​集团​设下​的​重重​保护​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​主要​属性​：​智力​\n"
"​主要​技能​：​骇入​\n"
"​主要​专长​：​专家系统​\n"
"​主要​装备​：​必须​使用​赛博碟板​接入​矩阵\n"
"\n"
"die2 ke4 shi3yong4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 jie1ru4 bei4 cheng1wei2“ju3zhen4” de5 quan2qiu2hua4 xin4 xi1 wang3 ji2 ji4 suan4 ji1 wang3 lao4。die2 ke4 ke3 jiang1 qi2 yi4shi2 tou2she4 dao4 dian4zi3 shi4jie4 zhong4，yi3ci3 xun2huo4 ta1ren2 cang2ni4 qi3lai5 de5 mi4mi4。ta1men5 shi3yong4 cheng2xu4 he4 zhuan1jia1xi4tong3 lai2 dui4kang4 chao1ji2 ji2tuan2 she4 xia4 de5 chong2chong2 bao3hu4。\n"
"\n"
