"这​就要​看​你​怎么​理解​了​。​我​不会​再​质疑​你​的​能力​了​……​至少​当着​他们​的​面​不会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​老实​说​，​$(l.name)​，​我​对​你​还是​有些​担忧​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4yao4 kan4 ni3 zen3me5 li3jie3 le5。wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 zhi4yi2 ni3 de5 neng2li4 le5……zhi4shao3 dang1zhe5 ta1men5 de5 mian4 bu4hui4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 lao3shi5 shuo1，$(l.name)，wo3 dui4 ni3 hai2shi5 you3xie1 dan1you1。"

msgid "Depends on who's caring for her."
msgstr ""
"那得​看​是​谁​照料​她​了​。\n"
