"zhuan1 wei2 zai4 qiang1 lin2 dan4 yu3 zhong4 bao3hu4 xiu1shi4 er2 she4ji4，shi3 xiu1shi4 men5 neng2gou4 jie1jin4 ta1men5 de5 mu4biao1。ti2gong1 +1 tu2shou3 gong1ji1 he4 +1 yi4zhi4。"

