"桌子\n"
"zhuo1zi5"

msgid "Desk Drawers"
msgstr ""
"桌子​抽屉\n"
"zhuo1zi5 chou1ti5"

msgid ""
"Despite Frau Müller's lack of professionalism, we need to press forward.\n"
"\n"
"And that means that you're going to need to get past that door."
msgstr ""
"尽管​穆勒​女士​的​沟通​并​不​专业​，​但​行动​还是​要​继续​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也就是说​，​你​必须​进入​那​扇门​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 de5 gou1tong1 bing4 bu4 zhuan1ye4，dan4 xing2dong4 hai2shi5 yao4 ji4xu4。\n"
"\n"
"ye3jiu4shi4shuo1，ni3 bi4xu1 jin4ru4 na4 shan1 men2。"

msgid ""
"Despite Saeder-Krupp's victory over the dragon, today remains a day of mourning across Germany.\n"
"\n"
"The Free City of Berlin lies in ruins, set to the torch by a monster that the world thought dead."
msgstr ""
"尽管​赛德​-​克虏伯​击败​了​巨龙​，​今日​德国​全境​仍​处于​哀悼​之中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​柏林​自由​城​已成​废墟​，​被​世人​以为​早已​灭绝​的​怪物​付之一炬​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 ji1bai4 le5 ju4long2，jin1ri4 de2guo2 quan2 jing4 reng2 chu3yu2 ai1dao4 zhi1zhong1。\n"
"\n"
"bo2lin2 zi4you2 cheng2 yi3 cheng2 fei4xu1，bei4 shi4ren2 yi3wei2 zao3yi3 mie4jue2 de5 guai4wu5 fu4zhi1yi1ju4。"

msgid ""
"Despite all odds against, the Kreuzbasar's oldest residents have survived. "
"Kristian and Karin Beck are even helping tend to the wounds of the "
"defenders. They are so focused on their work that they don't even notice "
"your approach."
msgstr ""
"尽管​困难重重​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​最​年长​的​居民​们​依然​坚守​着​。​克里斯蒂安​和​卡琳​·​贝克​夫妇​甚至​正​协助​照料​守卫者​的​伤势​。​他们​全神贯注​于​工作​，​甚至​未曾​察觉​你​的​到来​。\n"
"jin3guan3 kun4 nan2 chong2 chong2，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zui4 nian2zhang3 de5 ju1min2 men5 yi1ran2 jian1shou3 zhao2。ke4li3si1di4an1 he4 ka3 lin2 · bei4ke4 fu1fu4 shen4zhi4 zheng1 xie2zhu4 zhao4liao4 shou3wei4zhe3 de5 shang1shi4。ta1men5 quan2shen2guan4zhu4 yu2 gong1zuo4，shen4zhi4 wei4ceng2 cha2jue2 ni3 de5 dao4lai2。"

msgid ""
"Despite my enthusiasm, there is still much to be done. Speeding up absorption rates is first on the list, and I have some concerns regarding the subjects' immune reactions.\n"
"\n"
"Perhaps the formula could be tailored on a patient-by-patient basis..."
msgstr ""
"尽管​我​热情高涨​，​但​还是​有​许多​工作​要​做​。​首先​是​提升​药物​吸收​速率​，​我​对​受试者​的​免疫​反应​存在​一些​顾虑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​可以​针对​每位​受试者​单独​调整​配方​……\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 wo3 re4 qing2 gao1 zhang3，dan4 hai2shi5 you3 xu3duo1 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。shou3xian1 shi4 ti2sheng1 yao4wu4 xi1shou1 su4lu:4，wo3 dui4 shou4shi4zhe3 de5 mian3yi4 fan3ying4 cun2zai4 yi1xie1 gu4lu:4。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ke3yi3 zhen1dui4 mei3 wei4 shou4shi4zhe3 dan1du2 tiao2zheng3 pei4fang1……"

msgid ""
"Despite the corporations' impending insolvency, the files suggest buying heavily into all of them. \n"
"\n"
"Apparently, the Landenberg Ring's sources have led them to believe that all of these corporations are on the verge of being acquired by a single megacorp. The file doesn't say which one."
msgstr ""
"尽管​这些​公司​濒临破产​，​文件​却​建议​大量​买入​它们​的​股票​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​显然​，​兰​登堡​帮​的​情报来源​使​他们​相信​，​所有​这些​公司​都​即将​被​某家​超级​巨头​收购​。​文件​未​透露​具体​是​哪​一家​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 zhe4xie1 gong1si1 bin1 lin2 po4 chan3，wen2jian4 que4 jian4yi4 da4liang4 mai3ru4 ta1men5 de5 gu3piao4。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5 qing2 bao4 lai2 yuan2 shi3 ta1men5 xiang1xin4，suo3you3 zhe4xie1 gong1si1 dou1 ji2jiang1 bei4 mou3 jia1 chao1ji2 ju4tou2 shou1gou4。wen2jian4 wei4 tou4lu4 ju4ti3 shi4 na3 yi1jia1。"

msgid ""
"Despite the horrifying stories that Glory told you about this place, something about it feels strangely comforting.\n"
"\n"
"In the back of your mind, insidious voices whisper that you could stay here forever."
msgstr ""
"尽管​格洛丽​向​你​讲述​过​关于​此地​种种​骇人听闻​的​故事​，​这里​却​莫名​令人​感到​安心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​潜意识​里​，​有​阴险​的​声音​在​你​耳畔​低语​：​你​可以​永远​留在​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 Ge2luo4li2 xiang4 ni3 jiang3shu4 guo4 guan1yu2 ci3di4 zhong3zhong3 hai4ren2ting1wen2 de5 gu4shi4，zhe4li3 que4 mo4ming2 ling4ren2 gan3dao4 an1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"qian2yi4shi2 li3，you3 yin1xian3 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4 ni3 er3pan4 di1yu3：ni3 ke3yi3 yong3yuan3 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Despite the shopkeeper's claims, her inventory looks decidedly poor. Most of"
" these weapons appear rusty and in ill repair. A particularly cobbled-"
"together pistol stands out from the bunch."
msgstr ""
"虽然​店主​极力​自夸​，​但​她​的​存货​确实​没什么​可看​的​。​这些​武器​大多​锈迹斑斑​，​修理​不善​。​其中​一把​拼凑​起来​的​手枪​尤其​显眼​。\n"
"sui1ran2 dian4zhu3 ji2li4 zi4kua1，dan4 ta1 de5 cun2huo4 que4shi2 mei2shen2me5 ke3kan4 de5。zhe4xie1 wu3qi4 da4duo1 xiu4 ji4 ban1 ban1，xiu1li3 bu4shan4。qi2zhong1 yi1 ba3 pin1cou4 qi3lai5 de5 shou3qiang1 you2qi2 xian3yan3。"

msgid "Destroy APEX"
msgstr ""
"摧毁​APEX\n"
"cui1hui3 APEX"

msgid "Destroy the Commlink Software"
msgstr ""
"销毁​通讯​链​软件\n"
"xiao1hui3 tong1xun4 lian4 ruan3jian4"

msgid "Destroy the Shrine Spirit"
msgstr ""
"消灭​神龛​精魂\n"
"xiao1mie4 shen2kan1 jing1hun2"

msgid "Destroyed Floor"
msgstr ""
"已​损毁​的​地板\n"
"yi3 sun3hui3 de5 di4ban3"

msgid ""
"Determines resistance to physical damage. Increases chance to take reduced "
"damage from attacks. For every point of Body, Hit Points increase by 10."
msgstr ""
"决定​对​物理​伤害​的​抗性​。​增加​受到​攻击​时​降低​所​受伤害​的​几率​。​每点​体质​增加​10​点​生命​值​。\n"
"jue2ding4 dui4 wu4li3 shang1hai4 de5 kang4xing4。zeng1jia1 shou4dao4 gong1ji1 shi2 jiang4di1 suo3 shou4 shang1 hai4 de5 ji1lu:4。mei3 dian3 ti3zhi4 zeng1jia1 10 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "Diary"
msgstr ""
"日记\n"
"ri4ji4"

msgid "Did Amsel call ahead and brief you about this?"
msgstr ""
"阿姆​泽尔​之前​有​和​你​说​过​这些​吗​？\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 zhi1qian2 you3 he4 ni3 shuo1 guo4 zhe4xie1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Did I hear you right? Did you really say that I was \"tardy\"? I mean, what "
"are you going to do, send me to detention?"
msgstr ""
"我​没​听错​吧​？​你​居然​说​我​“​迟到​”​？​你​打算​怎么​做​，​让​我​留堂​吗​？\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1cuo4 ba1？ni3 ju1ran2 shuo1 wo3“chi2dao4”？ni3 da3suan4 zen3me5 zuo4，rang4 wo3 liu2tang2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Did I say \"fought\"?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Zaak winks at you, his smile twisting up into a licentious smirk. You can't help noticing that his eyelashes appear to be dusted with glitter.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nah, chummer. Zaak Flash is a lover, not a fighter. We partied, then we tussled. Hard not to get banged up under the circumstances."
msgstr ""
"我​有​说​是​“​打架​”​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​扎克​向​你​眨​了​眨眼睛​，​笑容​变得​有些​放荡​。​你​不禁​注意​到​，​他​的​睫毛​上​似乎​沾满​了​闪粉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​的​，​亲​。​我​扎克​·​弗莱​士​不善​武力​，​更爱​浪漫​。​我们​当时​在​聚会​，​然后​就​纠缠​到​一起​了​。​在​那种​环境​下​，​情难​自禁​也​正常​嘛​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 shuo1 shi4“da3jia4” ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 xiang4 ni3 zha3 le5 zha3yan3jing1，xiao4rong2 bian4de5 you3xie1 fang4dang4。ni3 bu4jin1 zhu4yi4 dao4，ta1 de5 jie2mao2 shang4 si4hu1 zhan1man3 le5 shan3 fen3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 de5，qin1。wo3 Zha1ke4 · fu2 lai2 shi4 bu4shan4 wu3li4，geng1 ai4 lang4man4。wo3men5 dang1shi2 zai4 ju4hui4，ran2hou4 jiu4 jiu1chan2 dao4 yi1qi3 le5。zai4 na4zhong3 huan2jing4 xia4，qing2 nan2 zi4 jin1 ye3 zheng4chang2 ma5。"

msgid ""
"Did I say that? No, young $(l.race). If anything, I am saying that all belief systems are equally valid.\n"
"\n"
"After all, they are all different interpretations of the truth. And how can the truth be wrong?"
msgstr ""
"我​有​这么​说​过​吗​？​不​，​年轻​的​$(l.race)​。​倒不如说​，​所有​信仰​体系​都​具有​同等​价值​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​，​它们​都​是​对​真理​的​不同​诠释​而已​。​而​真理​怎么​可能​是​错误​的​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 zhe4me5 shuo1 guo4 ma5？bu4，nian2qing1 de5 $(l.race)。dao3 bu4 ru2 shuo1，suo3you3 xin4yang3 ti3xi4 dou1 ju4you3 tong2deng3 jia4zhi2。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4，ta1men5 dou1 shi4 dui4 zhen1li3 de5 bu4tong2 quan2shi4 er2yi3。er2 zhen1li3 zen3me5 ke3neng2 shi4 cuo4wu4 de5 ni2？"

msgid "Did he do that to you?"
msgstr ""
"是​他​打​的​你​？\n"
"shi4 ta1 da3 de5 ni3？"

msgid ""
"Did he... did he tell you that we did exactly what he told us to?\n"
"\n"
"Did he tell you that it was *his* bad intel that got me hung out to dry like this?"
msgstr ""
"他​……​他​难道​没有​说​，​我们​完全​是​奉命行事​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​怎么​不说​，​是​*​他​的​*​错误​情报​才​导致​我​陷入​了​如此​境地​？\n"
"\n"
"ta1……ta1 nan2dao4 mei2you3 shuo1，wo3men5 wan2quan2 shi4 feng4 ming4 xing2 shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zen3me5 bu4 shuo1，shi4*ta1 de5*cuo4wu4 qing2bao4 cai2 dao3zhi4 wo3 xian4ru4 le5 ru2ci3 jing4di4？"

msgid "Did she turn on you?"
msgstr ""
"她​对​你​下手​了​？\n"
"ta1 dui4 ni3 xia4shou3 le5？"

msgid ""
"Did we do the right thing, leaving all of this to APEX? The dragon, the "
"research... everything?"
msgstr ""
"我们​把​一切​全部​交给​APEX​，​这样​真的​好​吗​？​巨龙​、​研究​……​这​所有​的​一切​？\n"
"wo3men5 ba3 yi1qie4 quan2bu4 jiao1gei3 APEX，zhe4yang4 zhen1de5 hao3 ma5？ju4long2、yan2jiu1……zhe4 suo3you3 de5 yi1qie4？"

msgid ""
"Did you bother asking yourself such questions, I wonder, when you set that... *thing* free?\n"
"\n"
"Did you consider the consequences of loosing a man-eating superpredator into the global Matrix? Tell me. I want to know."
msgstr ""
"你​是否​曾​问过​自己​这样​的​问题​，​当​你​释放​那个​……​*​东西​*​时​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是否​考虑​过​将​这个​以​人类​为​目标​的​超级​掠​食者​释放​到​全球​矩阵​中​的​后果​？​告诉​我​。​我​想​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4fou3 ceng2 wen4 guo4 zi4ji3 zhe4yang4 de5 wen4ti2，dang1 ni3 shi4fang4 na4ge5……*dong1xi1*shi2？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4fou3 kao3lu:4 guo4 jiang1 zhe4ge5 yi3 ren2lei4 wei2 mu4biao1 de5 chao1ji2 lu:e4 shi2 zhe3 shi4fang4 dao4 quan2qiu2 ju3zhen4 zhong4 de5 hou4guo3？gao4su4 wo3。wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Did you find anything else? We need to be sure about this before moving "
"forward."
msgstr ""
"你​还有​别的​发现​吗​？​我们​需要​确定​这些​之后​才能​继续前进​。\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 fa1xian4 ma5？wo3men5 xu1yao4 que4ding4 zhe4xie1 zhi1hou4 cai2neng2 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid "Did you have any run-ins with the attackers?"
msgstr ""
"你​与​袭击者​发生​过​冲突​吗​？\n"
"ni3 yu4 xi2ji1zhe3 fa1sheng1 guo4 chong1tu1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Did you have anything else to say? Any other examples of how Harrow is supposedly \"hurting\" us to wave in my face?\n"
"\n"
"If so, do it - I'm all ears. I can't promise that you'll like my response, though."
msgstr ""
"你​还有​什么​要说​的​？​还有​什么​其他​例子​能​当着​我​的​面​证明​哈罗​在​故意​“​伤害​”​我们​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​有​，​尽管​说​出来​，​我​洗耳恭听​。​不过​我​可​不敢​保证​你​会​喜欢​我​的​回应​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4shuo1 de5？hai2you3 shen2me5 qi2ta1 li4zi5 neng2 dang1zhe5 wo3 de5 mian4 zheng4ming2 ha1luo2 zai4 gu4yi4“shang1hai4” wo3men5？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 you3，jin3guan3 shuo1 chu1lai2，wo3 xi3er3gong1ting1。bu4guo4 wo3 ke3 bu4 gan3 bao3zheng4 ni3 hui4 xi3huan5 wo3 de5 hui2ying4。"

msgid "Did you have family there?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​那里​还有​家人​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 na4li5 hai2you3 jia1ren2 ma5？"

msgid "Did you hear that, Alice? Do you have any suggestions?"
msgstr ""
"听到​了​吗​，​爱丽丝​？​你​有​什么​建议​吗​？\n"
"ting1dao4 le5 ma5，ai4li4si1？ni3 you3 shen2me5 jian4yi4 ma5？"

msgid "Did you know anything about this, Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​这事​有​什么​了解​吗​，​布里​茨​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 zhe4 shi4 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3 ma5，Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid "Did you know that Monika's dog was part hellhound, Eiger? "
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​狗​有​一部分​地狱​猎犬​的​血统​。​艾格尔​，​你​知道​这事​吗​？\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 de5 gou3 you3 yi1bu4fen5 di4yu4 lie4quan3 de5 xue4tong3。Ai4ge2er3，ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Did you think of her as a mom?"
msgstr ""
"你​把​她​当作​母亲​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 ba3 ta1 dang4zuo4 mu3qin1 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Did you want something? Because I've got things to do, you know. Zaak says "
"he has a new sim for me. One with aliens and a little girl I need to save. "
"She's waiting for me, and I can't let her down."
msgstr ""
"你​找​我​有事吗​？​因为​我​还有​事要​忙​呢​。​扎克​说​他​有​个​新拟​感要​给​我​。​里面​有​外星人​和​一个​需要​我​拯救​的​小女孩​。​她​在​等​我​，​而​我​不能​让​她​失望​。\n"
"ni3 zhao3 wo3 you3 shi4 ma5？yin1wei4 wo3 hai2you3 shi4 yao4 mang2 ni2。Zha1ke4 shuo1 ta1 you3 ge4 xin1 ni3 gan3 yao4 gei3 wo3。li3mian4 you3 wai4xing1ren2 he4 yi1ge5 xu1yao4 wo3 zheng3jiu4 de5 xiao3 nu:3 hai2。ta1 zai4 deng3 wo3，er2 wo3 bu4neng2 rang4 ta1 shi1wang4。"

msgid ""
"Did your people ever look into that surveillance device on your data tap?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​人​有没有​检查​过​数据​插口​上​的​监控​设备​？\n"
"ni3 de5 ren2 you3mei2you3 jian3cha2 guo4 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 shang4 de5 jian1kong4 she4bei4？"

msgid "Did... Did it get violent?"
msgstr ""
"有​……​有​发生​暴力​冲突​吗​？\n"
"you3……you3 fa1sheng1 bao4li4 chong1tu1 ma5？"

msgid "Did... did I get it?"
msgstr ""
"我​……​把​它​抠出来​了​吗​？\n"
"wo3……ba3 ta1 kou1 chu1 lai2 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Didn't mean no offense. But look at me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gestures at himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Compared to me, *every* $(l.race) is a beanpole. Ain't a bad thing. It's just the way it is."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​冒犯​的​意思​，​但​瞧瞧​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​指​了​指​自己​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​我​比​，​*​每个​*​$(l.race)​都​是​竹竿​。​这​也​不是​坏事​，​都​是​天生​如此​罢了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 mao4fan4 de5 yi4si5，dan4 qiao2 qiao2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3 le5 zhi3 zi4ji3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 wo3 bi3，*mei3ge4*$(l.race) dou1 shi4 zhu2gan1。zhe4 ye3 bu4shi4 huai4shi4，dou1 shi4 tian1sheng1 ru2ci3 ba4le5。"

msgid "Didn't mean to bother you. I'll leave you alone."
msgstr ""
"无意​打扰​。​我们​这​就​走​。\n"
"wu2yi4 da3rao3。wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"Didn't she?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She locks eyes with you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Then why did the place start falling apart the second that she got geeked?"
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​与​你​四目​相对​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​为什么​在​她​死​掉​之后​，​街区​就​分崩离析​了​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wei4shen2me5 zai4 ta1 si3 diao4 zhi1hou4，jie1qu1 jiu4 fen1beng1li2xi1 le5？"

msgid "Diesel Fuel"
msgstr ""
"柴油\n"
"chai2you2"

msgid "Dietrich"
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1"

msgid "Dietrich and Glory nod in agreement."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希和格洛丽​点头​表示同意​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 he4 Ge2luo4li2 dian3tou2 biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。"

msgid "Dietrich and I aren't really on speaking terms any more."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希和​我​现在​已经​不怎么​说话​了​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 he4 wo3 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 bu4zen3me5 shuo1hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich gives you a significant glance.\n"
"\n"
"You can see the disgust in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​意味深长​地瞥​了​你​一眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​看出​他​眼中​的​憎恶​。\n"
"\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 yi4wei4shen1chang2 de5 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 zeng1e4。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich gives you a small nod. The uncanny feeling in the air around you "
"dies away."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希朝​你​微微​点头​。​周围​空气​中​那种​诡异​的​感觉​消失​了​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。zhou1wei2 kong1qi4 zhong4 na4zhong3 gui3yi4 de5 gan3jue2 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich is right, boss.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz's voice comes out in a hushed tone. His eyes have gone wide with fear.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...I don't think that's your friend."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​说得对​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​压低​了​声音​。​他​的​双眼​因​恐惧​而​瞪​得​老大​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​我​不​觉得​那​是​你​的​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 shuo1 de2 dui4，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 ya1di1 le5 sheng1yin1。ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 yin1 kong3ju4 er2 deng4 de2 lao3da4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……wo3 bu4 jue2de5 na4 shi4 ni3 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid "Dietrich now carries a Earth Elemental fetish on each mission."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​现在​在​每次​任务​中​都​将​携带​一个​地​精魂​信物​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 xian4zai4 zai4 mei3ci4 ren4wu5 zhong4 dou1 jiang1 xie2dai4 yi1ge5 de5 jing1hun2 xin4wu4。"

msgid "Dietrich now carries a Fire Elemental fetish on each mission."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​现在​在​每次​任务​中​都​将​携带​一个​火​精魂​信物​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 xian4zai4 zai4 mei3ci4 ren4wu5 zhong4 dou1 jiang1 xie2dai4 yi1ge5 huo3 jing1hun2 xin4wu4。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich trains further with thrown weapons, increasing his accuracy with "
"throwing knives."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​进一步​练习​了​使用​投掷​武器​的​技巧​，​提高​了​他​投掷​飞刀​的​精准度​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 jin4yi1bu4 lian4xi2 le5 shi3yong4 tou2zhi4 wu3qi4 de5 ji4qiao3，ti2gao1 le5 ta1 tou2zhi4 fei1dao1 de5 jing1 zhun3 du4。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich turns his head at your approach. His aging face is traced with a "
"network of faint scars, the legacy of too many fights over too many years. "
"While he still retains a degree of strength and vigor, it's obvious that the"
" shaman you see today is a shadow of his former self."
msgstr ""
"听到​你​走近​的​声音​，​迪​特里​希​转过​头来​。​他​饱经风霜​的​脸上​布满​细密​的​疤痕​，​那​是​多年​征战​岁月​留下​的​印记​。​虽然​他​仍​保留​着​些许​力量​与​活力​，​但​眼前​这位​萨满​显然​已不复​当年​之勇​。\n"
"ting1dao4 ni3 zou3jin4 de5 sheng1yin1，Di2te4li3xi1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 lai2。ta1 bao3jing1feng1shuang1 de5 lian3 shang4 bu4man3 xi4mi4 de5 ba1hen2，na4 shi4 duo1nian2 zheng1zhan4 sui4yue4 liu2xia4 de5 yin4ji4。sui1ran2 ta1 reng2 bao3liu2 zhao2 xie1xu3 li4liang5 yu4 huo2li4，dan4 yan3qian2 zhe4wei4 sa4man3 xian3ran2 yi3 bu4 fu4 dang1nian2 zhi1 yong3。"

msgid "Dietrich's Digs"
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​的​常服\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 de5 chang2 fu2"

msgid "Dietrich's Electro Core spell now costs 1 AP to cast."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​的​电子​核心​法术​现在​只​需要​消耗​1​点​行动​点​即可​释放​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 de5 dian4zi3 he2xin1 fa3shu4 xian4zai4 zhi3 xu1yao4 xiao1hao4 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3 ji2ke3 shi4fang4。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich's Electro Core spell now strips 1 Armor from affected targets."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​的​电子​核心​法术​现在​会​剥离​受​影响​的​敌人​1​点护甲值​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 de5 dian4zi3 he2xin1 fa3shu4 xian4zai4 hui4 bo1li2 shou4 ying3xiang3 de5 di2ren2 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich's basic nerve bolt spell now flushes enemies from cover when they "
"are hit."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​的​基础​鲁莽​之箭​法术​现在​能​在​击中​敌人​时​刺激​他们​离开​掩体​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 de5 ji1chu3 lu3mang3 zhi1 jian4 fa3shu4 xian4zai4 neng2 zai4 ji1zhong4 di2ren2 shi2 ci4ji1 ta1men5 li2kai1 yan3ti3。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich's eyes go wide. He takes a step toward the nearest Humanis gunman."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希瞪大​了​眼睛​，​他​向​最近​的​人类​至上​主义者​枪手​走​了​一步​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5，ta1 xiang4 zui4jin4 de5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 qiang1shou3 zou3 le5 yi1 bu4。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich's idol grows more powerful, decreasing incoming DMG by an "
"additional 2 points. Cost: 1 AP, Radius: 3, Duration: 3. "
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​的​精魂​导师​力量​增强​，​额外​减少​2​点​受到​的​伤害​。​花费​：​1​点​行动​点​，​范围​：​3​，​持续时间​：​3​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 de5 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 li4liang5 zeng1qiang2，e2wai4 jian3shao3 2 dian3 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。hua1fei4：1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3，fan4wei2：3，chi2xu4shi2jian1：3。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich's right, Glory. You've changed. And something about that worries "
"me."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希是​对​的​，​格洛丽​。​你​变​了​。​而​这​让​我​有些​不安​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 shi4 dui4 de5，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 bian4 le5。er2 zhe4 rang4 wo3 you3xie1 bu4an1。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich's right. We're not talking about a piece of merchandise.\n"
"\n"
"There's a living troll buried under all that chrome."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希是​对​的​，​我们​谈论​的​并​不是​什么​货物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 shi4 dui4 de5，wo3men5 tan2lun4 de5 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 huo4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich's years of devotion to the Dragonslayer idol imbue him with an "
"innate +1 Armor."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​多年​来​对​屠龙​者​精魂​导师​的​虔诚​奉献​赋予​了​他​固有​的​+​1​护甲​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 duo1nian2 lai2 dui4 tu2 long2 zhe3 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 de5 qian2cheng2 feng4xian4 fu4yu3 le5 ta1 gu4you3 de5 +1 hu4jia3。"

msgid ""
"Dietrich. One of my dearest friends, and a shaman of tremendous power. A good man to have at your side in a fight.\n"
"\n"
"I tend to use Dietrich in a support role. His magic can dramatically bolster the combat effectiveness of a front-line fighter like Eiger or Glory. But when the chips are down, he's more than capable of dishing out punishment on his own."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​，​我​最​亲密​的​朋友​之一​，​同时​也​是​位​拥有​强大​力量​的​萨满​。​能​和​他​并肩作战​是​件​幸运​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​倾向​于​让​迪​特里​希​扮演​支援​角色​。​他​的​魔法​能​显著​增强​像​艾格尔​或​格洛丽​这类​前线​战士​的​战斗力​。​但​当​形势危急​时​，​他​也​完全​有​能力​独自​给予​敌人​沉重打击​。\n"
"\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1，wo3 zui4 qin1mi4 de5 peng2you5 zhi1yi1，tong2shi2 ye3 shi4 wei4 yong1you3 qiang2da4 li4liang5 de5 sa4man3。neng2 he4 ta1 bing4jian1zuo4zhan4 shi4 jian4 xing4yun4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qing1xiang4 yu2 rang4 Di2te4li3xi1 ban4yan3 zhi1yuan2 jue2se4。ta1 de5 mo2fa3 neng2 xian3zhu4 zeng1qiang2 xiang4 Ai4ge2er3 huo4 Ge2luo4li2 zhe4lei4 qian2xian4 zhan4shi4 de5 zhan4dou4li4。dan4 dang1 xing2 shi4 wei1 ji2 shi2，ta1 ye3 wan2quan2 you3 neng2li4 du2zi4 ji3yu3 di2ren2 chen2zhong4da3ji1。"

msgid "Dietrich... when does this pattern end?"
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​……​你​这样​啥时候​是​个头​啊​？\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1……ni3 zhe4yang4 sha2 shi2 hou4 shi4 ge4tou2 a1？"

msgid "Dietrich? Did any of that make any sense to you?"
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​？​你​觉得​这​一切​是​怎么回事​？\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1？ni3 jue2de5 zhe4 yi1qie4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "DietrichErrantSwap"
msgstr ""
"DietrichErrantSwap\n"
"DietrichErrantSwap"

msgid "Different how?"
msgstr ""
"不同​在​什么​地方​？\n"
"bu4tong2 zai4 shen2me5 di4fang1？"

msgid "Different? What do you mean different?"
msgstr ""
"变得​不​一样​？​你​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"bian4de5 bu4 yi1yang4？ni3 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid ""
"Difficulties? No. One of the taps had been... modified a bit, though. "
"Someone was using it as a surveillance device. "
msgstr ""
"困难​？​那​倒​没有​。​只不过​其中​一处​插口​……​被​改造​过​。​有人​把​它​用作​监控​设备​。\n"
"kun4nan5？na4 dao3 mei2you3。zhi3bu5guo4 qi2zhong1 yi1 chu3 cha1kou3……bei4 gai3zao4 guo4。you3ren2 ba3 ta1 yong4zuo4 jian1kong4 she4bei4。"

msgid "Digital Archive Terminal"
msgstr ""
"数字​档案​终端\n"
"shu4zi4 dang4an4 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Dikoted Katana"
msgstr ""
"钻石​涂层​武士刀\n"
"zuan4shi2 tu2ceng2 wu3shi4dao1"

msgid "Direct fire attack with a fire trail"
msgstr ""
"直接​对​路径​上​所有​目标​造成​火焰​伤害​的​攻击\n"
"zhi2jie1 dui4 lu4jing4 shang4 suo3you3 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 huo3yan4 shang1hai4 de5 gong1ji1"

msgid "Direct on-going venom damage attack"
msgstr ""
"直接​造成​持续​毒性​伤害​的​攻击\n"
"zhi2jie1 zao4cheng2 chi2xu4 du2xing4 shang1hai4 de5 gong1ji1"

msgid "Disable the Second Firewall"
msgstr ""
"关闭​第二道​防火墙\n"
"guan1bi4 di4 er4 dao4 fang2huo3qiang2"

msgid "Disarm"
msgstr ""
"缴械\n"
"jiao3xie4"

msgid "Disarm: Forces target to drop weapon"
msgstr ""
"缴械​：​迫使​目标​丢掉​武器\n"
"jiao3xie4：po4shi3 mu4biao1 diu1diao4 wu3qi4"

msgid ""
"Disarm: Forces target to drop weapon / Maximum for Humans, Dwarves, and Orks"
msgstr ""
"缴械​：​迫使​目标​丢掉​武器​ ​/​ ​人类​、​矮人​与​兽​人​最大值\n"
"jiao3xie4：po4shi3 mu4biao1 diu1diao4 wu3qi4/ren2lei4、ai3ren2 yu4 shou4 ren2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Disarm: Forces the target to drop their weapon on a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"缴械​：​暴击时​可​迫使​目标​丢掉​武器​。\n"
"jiao3xie4：bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3 po4shi3 mu4biao1 diu1diao4 wu3qi4。"

msgid "Disarmed!"
msgstr ""
"被​缴械​！\n"
"bei4 jiao3xie4！"

msgid "Discarded Tires"
msgstr ""
"废弃​轮胎\n"
"fei4qi4 lun2tai1"

msgid "Discover the Humanis Plot"
msgstr ""
"查明​人类​至上​主义者​的​秘密​计划\n"
"cha2ming2 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 mi4mi4 ji4hua4"

msgid "Discuss Your Findings with Amsel"
msgstr ""
"与​阿姆​泽尔​讨论​你​的​发现\n"
"yu4 E1mu3ze2er3 tao3lun4 ni3 de5 fa1xian4"

msgid "Disembodied Voice"
msgstr ""
"幽灵​般的​声音\n"
"you1ling2 ban1 de5 sheng1yin1"

msgid "Disgusting. And this job of yours has something to do with Humanis?"
msgstr ""
"真​恶心​。​所以​你​这份​差事​和​人类​至上​主义者​有关​吗​？\n"
"zhen1 e3xin1。suo3yi3 ni3 zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4 he4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 you3guan1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Dispatch?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The guard sounds both confused and frightened.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, it's my first day, but... the Captain didn't say anything about--"
msgstr ""
"特遣队​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​警卫​的​声音​混杂着​困惑​和​惊恐​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​第一天​上班​，​但是​……​队长​没​和​我​说​过​这个​—​—\n"
"\n"
"te4 qian3 dui4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 de5 sheng1yin1 hun4 za2 zhao2 kun4huo4 he4 jing1kong3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 di4 yi1 tian1 shang4ban1，dan4shi4……dui4zhang3 mei2 he4 wo3 shuo1 guo4 zhe4ge5 — —"

msgid "Dispel Magic"
msgstr ""
"驱散​魔法\n"
"qu1san4 mo2fa3"

msgid "Dispelled!"
msgstr ""
"被​驱散​！\n"
"bei4 qu1san4！"

msgid "Dispels any target's ongoing magical effect."
msgstr ""
"驱散​目标​身上​的​魔法​效果​。\n"
"qu1san4 mu4biao1 shen1shang5 de5 mo2fa3 xiao4guo3。"

msgid "Displaced Metahuman"
msgstr ""
"流离失所​的​泛​人类\n"
"liu2li2shi1suo3 de5 fan4 ren2lei4"

msgid "Distracted: Accuracy -12%"
msgstr ""
"分心​：​精准度​-​12​%\n"
"fen1xin1：jing1 zhun3 du4-12 %"

msgid "Distracted: Accuracy -15%"
msgstr ""
"分心​：​精准度​-​15​%\n"
"fen1xin1：jing1 zhun3 du4-15 %"

msgid "Distracted: Accuracy -18%"
msgstr ""
"分心​：​精准度​-​18​%\n"
"fen1xin1：jing1 zhun3 du4-18 %"

msgid "Distraction I"
msgstr ""
"分心​I\n"
"fen1xin1 I"

msgid "Distraction II"
msgstr ""
"分心​II\n"
"fen1xin1 II"

msgid "Distraction III"
msgstr ""
"分心​III\n"
"fen1xin1 III"

msgid "Do I know you, friend?"
msgstr ""
"我​认识​你​吗​，​朋友​？\n"
"wo3 ren4shi5 ni3 ma5，peng2you5？"

msgid "Do Not Let the Engineer Escape"
msgstr ""
"不要​让​工程师​逃跑\n"
"bu4yao4 rang4 gong1cheng2shi1 tao2pao3"

msgid "Do it!"
msgstr ""
"动手​！\n"
"dong4shou3！"

msgid "Do it, James."
msgstr ""
"动手​吧​，​詹姆斯​。\n"
"dong4shou3 ba1，zhan1mu3si1。"

msgid "Do it, you stupid boy. DO IT."
msgstr ""
"动手​啊​，​你​个​傻小子​。​快​开枪​！\n"
"dong4shou3 a1，ni3 ge4 sha3 xiao3 zi3。kuai4 kai1qiang1！"

msgid "Do it."
msgstr ""
"动手​吧​。\n"
"dong4shou3 ba1。"

msgid "Do it. I want to see what you really are."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我​想​看看​你​真正​的​样子​。\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3 xiang3 kan4kan5 ni3 zhen1zheng4 de5 yang4zi5。"

msgid "Do me a favor and ditch the paranoia. Central sent me to relieve you."
msgstr ""
"拜托​别​再​疑神疑鬼​了​。​是​指挥部​派​我​来​接替​你​的​。\n"
"bai4tuo1 bie4 zai4 yi2shen2yi2gui3 le5。shi4 zhi3hui1bu4 pai4 wo3 lai2 jie1ti4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Do me a favor, boss?\n"
"\n"
"Leave me alone for a while."
msgstr ""
"拜托​了​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​一个​人​待会儿​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1 le5，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2 dai1hui4r5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Do not be too hard on her. \n"
"\n"
"The sight of Winters' body has shaken her to a considerable extent."
msgstr ""
"别​对​她​这么​苛刻​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​温特斯​的​死​状​让​她​大受​震撼​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dui4 ta1 zhe4me5 ke1ke4。\n"
"\n"
"Wen1te4si1 de5 si3 zhuang4 rang4 ta1 dai4 shou4 zhen4han4。"

msgid "Do not jest, Half-Dream. We must be going, and soon."
msgstr ""
"不要​开玩笑​，​半梦者​。​我们​得​走​了​。​而且​越快越好​。\n"
"bu4yao4 kai1wan2xiao4，ban4 meng4 zhe3。wo3men5 de2 zou3 le5。er2qie3 yue4 kuai4 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Do not mock the $(l.race), Aljernon Half-Dream.\n"
"\n"
"But nor should you praise $(l.him), either.\n"
"\n"
"For good or ill, the cycle of a Great Wyrm has ended. Never again will she walk upon this Earth, nor soar over its mountains. This day is full of portent. "
msgstr ""
"不要​取笑​那个​$(l.race)​，​半梦者​阿尔杰​农​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​也​不​应当​赞美​$(l.he)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论是​吉是​凶​，​这​条​巨龙​的​生命​轮回​已然​终结​。​她​再​不会​踏足​这片​大地​，​亦​不会​翱翔​于​群山​之上​。​众多​预兆​在​这​一天​满溢​而出​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 qu3xiao4 na4ge5 $(l.race)，ban4 meng4 zhe3 E1er3jie2nong2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 ye3 bu4 ying1dang1 zan4mei3 $(l.he)。\n"
"\n"
"wu2 lun2 shi4 ji2 shi4 xiong1，zhe4 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 sheng1ming4 lun2hui2 yi3ran2 zhong1jie2。ta1 zai4 bu4hui4 ta4zu2 zhe4 pian1 da4di4，yi4 bu4hui4 ao2xiang2 yu2 qun2shan1 zhi1shang4。zhong4duo1 yu4zhao4 zai4 zhe4 yi1 tian1 man3yi4 er2 chu1。"

msgid ""
"Do not presume to know what is or isn't my concern. \n"
"\n"
"But... I will honor your wishes in this, for now. You will hear from us again."
msgstr ""
"不要​妄自​揣测​哪些​事​和​我​有​关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​……​就​目前​而言​，​在​这件​事上​我会​尊重​你​的​愿望​。​我们​会​再​联系​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 wang4 zi4 chuai3ce4 na3xie1 shi4 he4 wo3 you3 guan1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4……jiu4 mu4qian2 er2yan2，zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 wo3 hui4 zun1zhong4 ni3 de5 yuan4wang4。wo3men5 hui4 zai4 lian2xi4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Do not simply dismiss the $(l.race), Aljernon Half-Dream. You are wiser than that, and $(l.he) has proven $(l.hisher) worth more than once.\n"
"\n"
"Here we have a firsthand account of the Feuerschwinge Wyrm and what became of her. Shall we remain ignorant or shall we listen?"
msgstr ""
"不要​随便​赶走​那个​$(l.race)​，​半梦者​阿尔杰​农​。​你​本​可​有​更​睿智​的​举动​，​$(l.he)​也​不止一次​证明​了​自己​的​价值​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如今​摆在​我们​面前​的​，​是​关于​巨龙​火翼​和​她​的​命运​的​第一手​消息​源​。​我们​是​该​保持​无知​，​还是​该​倾听​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 sui2bian4 gan3zou3 na4ge5 $(l.race)，ban4 meng4 zhe3 E1er3jie2nong2。ni3 ben3 ke3 you3 geng1 rui4zhi4 de5 ju3dong4，$(l.he) ye3 bu4zhi3yi1ci4 zheng4ming2 le5 zi4ji3 de5 jia4zhi2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 bai3 zai4 wo3men5 mian4qian2 de5，shi4 guan1yu2 ju4long2 Huo3yi4 he4 ta1 de5 ming4yun4 de5 di4yi1shou3 xiao1xi5 yuan2。wo3men5 shi4 gai1 bao3chi2 wu2zhi1，hai2shi5 gai1 qing1ting1？"

msgid ""
"Do not simply dismiss the $(l.race), Aljernon Half-Dream. You are wiser than that, and $(l.he) has proven $(l.hisher) worth more than once.\n"
"\n"
"Here, we have a firsthand account of the Feuerschwinge Wyrm and what became of her. Shall we remain ignorant, or shall we listen?"
msgstr ""
"不要​随便​赶走​那个​$(l.race)​，​半梦者​阿尔杰​农​。​你​本​可​有​更​睿智​的​举动​，​$(l.he)​也​不止一次​证明​了​自己​的​价值​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如今​摆在​我们​面前​的​，​是​关于​巨龙​火翼​和​她​的​命运​的​第一手​消息​源​。​我们​是​该​保持​无知​，​还是​该​倾听​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 sui2bian4 gan3zou3 na4ge5 $(l.race)，ban4 meng4 zhe3 E1er3jie2nong2。ni3 ben3 ke3 you3 geng1 rui4zhi4 de5 ju3dong4，$(l.he) ye3 bu4zhi3yi1ci4 zheng4ming2 le5 zi4ji3 de5 jia4zhi2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 bai3 zai4 wo3men5 mian4qian2 de5，shi4 guan1yu2 ju4long2 Huo3yi4 he4 ta1 de5 ming4yun4 de5 di4yi1shou3 xiao1xi5 yuan2。wo3men5 shi4 gai1 bao3chi2 wu2zhi1，hai2shi5 gai1 qing1ting1？"

msgid "Do they ever?"
msgstr ""
"他们​什么​时候​解释​过​吗​？\n"
"ta1men5 shen2me5 shi2hou5 jie3shi4 guo4 ma5？"

msgid "Do us all a favor and keep your opinions to yourself."
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​你​还是​把​这些​想法​咽回​肚子​里​吧​。\n"
"bai4tuo1，ni3 hai2shi5 ba3 zhe4xie1 xiang3fa3 yan1 hui2 du4zi5 li3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Do we have anything to worry about, Dietrich? Any chance that Aztechnology "
"corporate could use blood magic to track us?"
msgstr ""
"我们​有​什么​需要​担心​的​吗​，​迪​特里​希​？​阿兹特​科技​有没有​可能​用血​魔法​追踪​我们​？\n"
"wo3men5 you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 dan1xin1 de5 ma5，Di2te4li3xi1？E1zi1te4ke1ji4 you3mei2you3 ke3neng2 yong4 xie3 mo2fa3 zhui1zong1 wo3men5？"

msgid "Do we know yet who they were? What happened?"
msgstr ""
"我们​知道​那些​袭击者​的​身份​了​吗​？​究竟​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1dao4 na4xie1 xi2ji1zhe3 de5 shen1fen4 le5 ma5？jiu1jing4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "Do you at least know how to defend yourself?"
msgstr ""
"你​起码​知道​怎么​保护​自己​吧​？\n"
"ni3 qi3ma3 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 bao3hu4 zi4ji3 ba1？"

msgid "Do you care?"
msgstr ""
"你​关心​这个​干什么​？\n"
"ni3 guan1xin1 zhe4ge5 gan4shen2me5？"

msgid "Do you even have to ask?"
msgstr ""
"你​还要​问​我​？\n"
"ni3 hai2 yao4 wen4 wo3？"

msgid ""
"Do you feel it? The lure of this place?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory gestures with a limb of chrome and steel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When I was a kid - when I was *whole* - the pull was irresistible."
msgstr ""
"你​感觉​到​了​吗​？​这个​地方​的​诱惑​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽用​镀铬​的​钢铁​义肢​比划​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​还是​个​孩子​，​四肢​还​*​完整​*​的​时候​，​这种​吸引力​简直​无法​抗拒​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gan3jue2 dao4 le5 ma5？zhe4ge5 di4fang1 de5 you4huo4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yong4 du4 ge4 de5 gang1tie3 yi4zhi1 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 hai2shi5 ge4 hai2zi5，si4zhi1 hai2*wan2zheng3*de5 shi2hou5，zhe4zhong3 xi1yin3li4 jian3zhi2 wu2fa3 kang4ju4。"

msgid "Do you have another question?"
msgstr ""
"你​还有​其他​问题​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid "Do you have any suggestions?"
msgstr ""
"你​有​什么​建议​吗​？\n"
"ni3 you3 shen2me5 jian4yi4 ma5？"

msgid "Do you have the part?"
msgstr ""
"你​拿到​零件​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 na2dao4 ling2jian4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Do you honestly think that they didn't install a safeguard in that thing? That we couldn't take it back from you at a moment's notice?\n"
"\n"
"Now drop your weapons, or I'll have that abomination tear YOU in half."
msgstr ""
"你​真​以为​他们​没​给​那​东西​装​保险​？​以为​我们​不能​随时​夺回​控制权​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​放下​武器​，​不然​我​就​叫​那​怪物​把​*​你​*​撕成​两半​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1 yi3wei2 ta1men5 mei2 gei3 na4 dong1xi1 zhuang1 bao3xian3？yi3wei2 wo3men5 bu4neng2 sui2shi2 duo2hui2 kong4zhi4quan2？\n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 fang4xia4 wu3qi4，bu4ran2 wo3 jiu4 jiao4 na4 guai4wu5 ba3*ni3*si1 cheng2 liang3 ban4。"

msgid "Do you know anything about an organization called the Lodge?"
msgstr ""
"你​知道​有个​名叫​“​结社​”​的​组织​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 you3 ge4 ming2jiao4“jie2she4” de5 zu3zhi1 ma5？"

msgid "Do you know anything about the hackers over by the stairs?"
msgstr ""
"你​知道​楼梯​那边​的​黑客​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 lou2ti1 na4bian5 de5 hei1ke4 ma5？"

msgid "Do you know how we can read these things?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​知道​怎么​读取​里面​的​内容​吗​？\n"
"na4 ni3 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 du2qu3 li3mian4 de5 nei4rong2 ma5？"

msgid "Do you know the ritual?"
msgstr ""
"你​知道​怎么​进行​仪式​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 jin4xing2 yi2shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Do you know what we just did, chief? We released an insane Great Dragon into the wild. And not just any Great Dragon... a *legendary* Great Dragon. The Firewing.\n"
"\n"
"We set her loose like a caged bird."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​我们​刚刚​做​了​什么​吗​，​头儿​？​我们​把​一头​发疯​的​巨龙​放归​自然​。​而且​还​不是​一般​的​巨龙​……​她​是​一头​*​传说​级​*​的​巨龙​。​她​是​火翼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​就​像​释放​笼中鸟​一样​把​她​放走​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 gang1gang5 zuo4 le5 shen2me5 ma5，tou2r5？wo3men5 ba3 yi1tou2 fa1feng1 de5 ju4long2 fang4 gui1 zi4ran2。er2qie3 hai2 bu4shi4 yi1ban1 de5 ju4long2……ta1 shi4 yi1tou2*chuan2shuo1 ji2*de5 ju4long2。ta1 shi4 Huo3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jiu4 xiang4 shi4fang4 long2 zhong4 niao3 yi1yang4 ba3 ta1 fang4zou3 le5。"

msgid "Do you know where the Magnifiker hideout is?"
msgstr ""
"你​知道​伟术​帮​的​藏身处​在​哪里​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wei3 shu4 bang1 de5 cang2shen1chu4 zai4 na3li3 ma5？"

msgid "Do you like the song?"
msgstr ""
"你​喜欢​这​首歌​吗​？\n"
"ni3 xi3huan5 zhe4 shou3 ge1 ma5？"

msgid "Do you need anything more?"
msgstr ""
"还​需要​什么​吗​？\n"
"hai2 xu1yao4 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "Do you really think that you can get to that door before I get to you?"
msgstr ""
"你​真​以为​自己​能​活着​跑​进​那​扇门​里​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhen1 yi3wei2 zi4ji3 neng2 huo2zhe5 pao2 jin4 na4 shan1 men2 li3 ma5？"

msgid "Do you recognize any of these other crates out here?"
msgstr ""
"你​认得​外面​这些​其他​的​板条箱​吗​？\n"
"ni3 ren4de5 wai4mian4 zhe4xie1 qi2ta1 de5 ban3tiao2xiang1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Do you see a tie around my neck, pal? Do I look like a corporate stooge to you?\n"
"\n"
"We are the friends of the People. And we *are* the People. Don't you dare to question it."
msgstr ""
"你​看​我​脖子​上​有​领带​吗​，​伙计​？​我​看起来​像​个​公司​佬​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​是​人民​的​朋友​。​而且​我们​*​就是​*​人民​。​不准​你​质疑​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4 wo3 bo2zi5 shang4 you3 ling3dai4 ma5，huo3ji5？wo3 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 ge4 gong1si1 lao3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 ren2min2 de5 peng2you5。er2qie3 wo3men5*jiu4shi4*ren2min2。bu4zhun3 ni3 zhi4yi2 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"Do you see the ramifications of this, $(l.name)? Do you understand what this means?\n"
"\n"
"Were the project completed... were the techniques described within to be perfected... nobody would be safe."
msgstr ""
"你​明白​这​其中​的​后果​吗​，​$(l.name)​？​你​明白​这​意味着​什么​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​倘若​项目​完成​……​倘若​其中​描述​的​技术​臻于完善​……​世间​便​再​无人​是​安全​的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ming2bai5 zhe4 qi2zhong1 de5 hou4guo3 ma5，$(l.name)？ni3 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"tang3ruo4 xiang4mu4 wan2cheng2……tang3ruo4 qi2zhong1 miao2shu4 de5 ji4shu4 zhen1yu2wan2shan4……shi4jian1 bian4 zai4 wu2ren2 shi4 an1quan2 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Do you think it's the shrine? Could he be using it to brainwash the "
"initiates at an accelerated rate?"
msgstr ""
"你​怀疑​是​那座​神龛​？​他​可能​在​用​它​加速​对​学徒​的​洗脑​？\n"
"ni3 huai2yi2 shi4 na4 zuo4 shen2kan1？ta1 ke3neng2 zai4 yong4 ta1 jia1su4 dui4 xue2tu2 de5 xi3nao3？"

msgid "Do you think that we did the right thing back there?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​我们​当时​做​了​正确​的​事​吗​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3men5 dang1shi2 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Do you think this is some sort of *game,* runner? \n"
"\n"
"There is far more at stake here than the lives of a few petty criminals."
msgstr ""
"你​以为​这是​什么​*​游戏​*​吗​，​狂奔​者​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​里面​涉及​的​远不止​几个​罪犯​的​性命​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3wei2 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5*you2xi4*ma5，kuang2Ben1zhe3？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 li3mian4 she4ji2 de5 yuan3 bu4 zhi3 ji3ge5 zui4fan4 de5 xing4ming4。"

msgid "Do you trust me, Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"你​信任​我​吗​，​艾格尔​？\n"
"ni3 xin4ren4 wo3 ma5，Ai4ge2er3？"

msgid "Do you two ever speak plainly?"
msgstr ""
"你们​两个​就​不能​好好​说话​吗​？\n"
"ni3men5 liang3 ge4 jiu4 bu4neng2 hao3hao3 shuo1hua4 ma5？"

msgid "Do you want the cram, or not?"
msgstr ""
"这超感​你​到底​是​要​还是​不要​？\n"
"zhe4 chao1 gan3 ni3 dao4di3 shi4 yao4 hai2shi5 bu4yao4？"

msgid "Do you want to argue, or do you want to finish this?"
msgstr ""
"你​到底​是​想​吵架​，​还是​想​赶紧​完事​？\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 shi4 xiang3 chao3jia4，hai2shi5 xiang3 gan3jin3 wan2shi4？"

msgid "Do you want to help?"
msgstr ""
"你​想​帮忙​吗​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3 bang1mang2 ma5？"

msgid "Do you want to talk about that black eye now?"
msgstr ""
"可以​说​说​你​的​黑眼圈​了​吗​？\n"
"ke3yi3 shuo1 shuo1 ni3 de5 hei1yan3quan1 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Doberman"
msgstr ""
"杜宾犬\n"
"du4bin1quan3"

msgid "Doc Ezkibel. He found me. He picked me up, took me with him."
msgstr ""
"是​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​。​他​找到​了​我​。​他​带​我​离开​了​。\n"
"shi4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1。ta1 zhao3dao4 le5 wo3。ta1 dai4 wo3 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Doctor Vauclair,                                             2034.09.10\n"
"\n"
"It is my sad duty to inform you that, by unanimous vote of the Aufsichtsrat, your position as CEO of Diehl Defense will be terminated at the end of this calendar month.\n"
"\n"
"Your continued misallocation of company funds to pursue personal agendas cannot - and will not - be tolerated any longer."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​博士​，​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​2034​年​9​月​10​日​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​遗憾​地​通知​您​，​经​董事会​全票​通过​，​您​作为​迪尔​防务​首席​执行官​的​职务​将​于​本月底​终止​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​无法​再​容忍​你​继续​滥用​公司​资金​，​谋求​个人​私利​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4，2034 nian2 9 yue4 10 ri4 \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 yi2han4 de5 tong1zhi1 nin2，jing1 dong3shi4hui4 quan2piao4 tong1guo4，nin2 zuo4wei2 Di2er3fang2wu4 shou3xi2 zhi2 xing2 guan1 de5 zhi2wu4 jiang1 yu2 ben3 yue4 de5 zhong1zhi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 wu2fa3 zai4 rong2ren3 ni3 ji4xu4 lan4yong4 gong1si1 zi1jin1，mou2qiu2 ge4ren2 si1li4。"

msgid "Doctor Vauclair, tell us about your efforts to bring down the dragon."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​博士​，​请​和​我们​讲讲​你​为​打倒​巨龙​而​付出​的​努力​吧​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4，qing3 he4 wo3men5 jiang3 jiang3 ni3 wei2 da3dao3 ju4long2 er2 fu4chu1 de5 nu3li4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Doctor Vauclair, you must understand my skepticism. Our viewers aren't "
"looking for a PR statement, they come to us for the tru--"
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​博士​，​你​必须​理解​我​的​怀疑​态度​。​我们​的​观众​不是​来看​公关​声明​的​，​他们​是​来看​真相​的​—​—\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4，ni3 bi4xu1 li3jie3 wo3 de5 huai2yi2 tai4du5。wo3men5 de5 guan1zhong4 bu4shi4 lai2 kan4 gong1guan1 sheng1ming2 de5，ta1men5 shi4 lai2 kan4 zhen1xiang4 de5 — —"

msgid "Doctor. Please. You know as well as I do what needs to happen here."
msgstr ""
"医生​，​拜托​。​你​我​都​知道​这里​需要​什么​。\n"
"yi1sheng1，bai4tuo1。ni3 wo3 dou1 zhi1dao4 zhe4li3 xu1yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid "Dodge"
msgstr ""
"躲闪\n"
"duo3shan3"

msgid "Dodge helps to reduce the chance to be hit by physical attacks."
msgstr ""
"躲闪​有助于​降低​被​物理攻击​命中​的​几率​。\n"
"duo3shan3 you3zhu4yu2 jiang4di1 bei4 wu4 li3 gong1 ji1 ming4zhong4 de5 ji1lu:4。"

msgid "Dodge!"
msgstr ""
"躲闪​！\n"
"duo3shan3！"

msgid "Does +1 AP DMG but reduces HP DMG by 3. Reduced accuracy."
msgstr ""
"造成​的​行动​力​损伤​增加​1​点​，​生命​值​伤害​减少​3​点​。​精准度​降低​。\n"
"zao4cheng2 de5 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1 zeng1jia1 1 dian3，sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 3 dian3。jing1 zhun3 du4 jiang4di1。"

msgid "Does -1 AP to a single target."
msgstr ""
"对​单一​目标​造成​-​1​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 -1 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid "Does -2 AP to a single target."
msgstr ""
"对​单一​目标​造成​-​2​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"dui4 dan1yi1 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 -2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid "Does an additional -3 HP. Ignores the weapon's AP damage. -15% to hit."
msgstr ""
"武器​的​基础​伤害​额外​增加​3​点​，​忽略​武器​的​行动​力​损伤​。​命中率​降低​15​%\n"
"wu3qi4 de5 ji1chu3 shang1hai4 e2wai4 zeng1jia1 3 dian3，hu1lu:e4 wu3qi4 de5 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。ming4zhong4lu:4 jiang4di1 15 %"

msgid ""
"Does it matter? I'm your team leader, and I'm asking you a question. I'd "
"like you to answer it."
msgstr ""
"有​什么​问题​？​我​是​队长​，​现在​是​我​在​向​你​提问​，​希望​你​能​做出​回答​。\n"
"you3 shen2me5 wen4ti2？wo3 shi4 dui4zhang3，xian4zai4 shi4 wo3 zai4 xiang4 ni3 ti2wen4，xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 zuo4chu1 hui2da2。"

msgid ""
"Does minor damage, but unbalances the target making them easier to hit."
msgstr ""
"造成​较​少​伤害​，​但会​使​目标​失衡​，​从而​更​容易​被​击中​。\n"
"zao4cheng2 jiao4 shao3 shang1hai4，dan4 hui4 shi3 mu4biao1 shi1heng2，cong2er2 geng1 rong2yi4 bei4 ji1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Does minor damage, but unbalances the target making them easier to hit. The "
"target is also flushed from cover."
msgstr ""
"造成​较​少​伤害​，​但会​使​目标​失去平衡​，​从而​更​容易​被​击中​。​同时​目标​会​主动​脱离​掩体​。\n"
"zao4cheng2 jiao4 shao3 shang1hai4，dan4 hui4 shi3 mu4biao1 shi1 qu4 ping2 heng2，cong2er2 geng1 rong2yi4 bei4 ji1zhong4。tong2shi2 mu4biao1 hui4 zhu3dong4 tuo1li2 yan3ti3。"

msgid "Does that mean something to you?"
msgstr ""
"你​知道​这是​什么​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Does the Lobatchevski Syndicate do things like that? Plant those kinds of "
"bombs in people?"
msgstr ""
"洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​会​做​这种​事​吗​？​在​别人​体内​安装​炸弹​？\n"
"luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2 hui4 zuo4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 ma5？zai4 bie2ren5 ti3nei4 an1zhuang1 zha4dan4？"

msgid ""
"Does the whole \"magic elf\" routine help with sales? Help me out here, "
"poser."
msgstr ""
"“​魔法​精灵​”​这套​把戏​对​生意​有​帮助​吗​？​你​倒​说说看​啊​，​冒牌货​。\n"
"“mo2fa3 jing1ling2” zhe4 tao4 ba3xi4 dui4 sheng1yi4 you3 bang1zhu4 ma5？ni3 dao3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4 a1，mao4pai2huo4。"

msgid "Does this proprietor have a name?"
msgstr ""
"这位​店主​有​名字​吗​？\n"
"zhe4wei4 dian4zhu3 you3 ming2zi5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Does this “interested party” understand that information is a commodity?"
msgstr ""
"这位​“​当事人​”​是否​明白​情报​是​一种​商品​？\n"
"zhe4wei4“dang1shi4ren2” shi4fou3 ming2bai5 qing2bao4 shi4 yi1zhong3 shang1pin3？"

msgid "Doesn't it?"
msgstr ""
"对​吧​？\n"
"dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Doesn't it? Our actions might have drawn attention to those people. Made "
"them targets."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​但​正是​我们​的​行动​引起​了​犯罪集团​的​注意​，​让​那些​人​成为​了​目标​。\n"
"shi4 ma5？dan4 zheng4shi4 wo3men5 de5 xing2dong4 yin3qi3 le5 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 de5 zhu4yi4，rang4 na4xie1 ren2 cheng2wei2 le5 mu4biao1。"

msgid ""
"Doesn't look like the train will be going anywhere with the access bridge "
"extended."
msgstr ""
"看来​在​接驳​桥​伸展​的​情况​下​，​列车​是​无法​开动​的​。\n"
"kan4lai5 zai4 jie1bo2 qiao2 shen1zhan3 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4，lie4che1 shi4 wu2fa3 kai1dong4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Doesn't matter what I'm in this for. What matters is that I'm on your side "
"until I get it."
msgstr ""
"不用​管​我​来​这里​做​什么​，​重点​是​我​站​在​你​这边​。\n"
"bu4yong4 guan3 wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 zuo4 shen2me5，chong2dian3 shi4 wo3 zhan4 zai4 ni3 zhe4bian1。"

msgid ""
"Doesn't matter what he told us. The contract says that we have to put you "
"down."
msgstr ""
"他​和​我们​说​了​什么​并​不​重要​。​契约​的​内容​要​我们​必须​杀​了​你​。\n"
"ta1 he4 wo3men5 shuo1 le5 shen2me5 bing4 bu4 zhong4yao4。qi4yue1 de5 nei4rong2 yao4 wo3men5 bi4xu1 sha1 le5 ni3。"

msgid "Doesn't matter what they did. What you did was still wrong."
msgstr ""
"他们​做​了​什么​并​不​重要​。​你​做​的​事情​仍然​是​不​对​的​。\n"
"ta1men5 zuo4 le5 shen2me5 bing4 bu4 zhong4yao4。ni3 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 reng2ran2 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Doesn't matter. They're gonna have to deal with me, whether they want to or "
"not."
msgstr ""
"无所谓​，​他们​早晚​要​面对​我​。\n"
"wu2suo3wei4，ta1men5 zao3wan3 yao4 mian4dui4 wo3。"

msgid "Doesn't sound like something I'd be good at."
msgstr ""
"这​不​像是​我​擅长​的​事情​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4 xiang4 shi4 wo3 shan4chang2 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "Doesn't sound too bad."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​没​那么​糟​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 mei2 na4me5 zao1。"

msgid "Doesn't that mean that the backlash will hit us, too?"
msgstr ""
"这​不​意味着​我们​也​会​受到​反噬​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 ye3 hui4 shou4dao4 fan3shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Doesn't this go against your vow?"
msgstr ""
"这​不是​违背​了​你​的​誓言​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 wei2bei4 le5 ni3 de5 shi4yan2 ma5？"

msgid "DogStim"
msgstr ""
"犬类​刺激​设备\n"
"quan3 lei4 ci4ji1 she4bei4"

msgid "Doing a little remodeling?"
msgstr ""
"在​翻修​吗​？\n"
"zai4 fan1xiu1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Doing your best to look uninterested, you lean in slightly and strain your "
"ears. You find that you can make out the doctor's end of the conversation."
msgstr ""
"你​尽力​装​出​一副​不感兴趣​的​样子​，​实则​微微​侧身​，​竖起​耳朵​。​你​发现自己​可以​听​清​医生​的​谈话​内容​。\n"
"ni3 jin4li4 zhuang1 chu1 yi1 fu4 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4 de5 yang4zi5，shi2ze2 wei1wei1 ce4shen1，shu4qi3 er3duo5。ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 ke3yi3 ting1 qing1 yi1sheng1 de5 tan2hua4 nei4rong2。"

msgid "Don't I know it."
msgstr ""
"这​我​可​太​清楚​了​。\n"
"zhe4 wo3 ke3 tai4 qing1chu5 le5。"

msgid "Don't I know it. Take care of yourself."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​你​多​保重​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。ni3 duo1 bao3zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Don't act so surprised. APEX wants to murder you, too - you must know that."
msgstr ""
"别​假装​这么​惊讶​。​APEX​也​想​弄死​你​—​—​你​肯定​知道​吧​。\n"
"bie4 jia3zhuang1 zhe4me5 jing1ya4。APEX ye3 xiang3 nong4si3 ni3——ni3 ken3ding4 zhi1dao4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Don't be. Back when I was a wealthy man... before my legal troubles... I paid the lease for a decade in advance.\n"
"\n"
"...And before you say anything: yes, it was a huge expense. But what's locked away inside of that lab is worth ten times what I've spent on it. I don't want anyone laying claim to it but me."
msgstr ""
"不必​惊讶​。​当​我​还是​个​有钱人​的​时候​……​我​是​说​在​我​遇到​法律纠纷​之前​……​我​预付​了​十年​的​房租​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​你​想​说​什么​。​没错​，​那​是​一笔​巨大​的​开支​。​但锁​在​实验室​里​的​那些​商品​，​足以​抵​上​这些​成本​的​十倍​之多​。​我​不​希望​它们​被​除我之外​的​任何人​夺走​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4bi4 jing1ya4。dang1 wo3 hai2shi5 ge4 you3qian2ren2 de5 shi2hou5……wo3 shi4 shuo1 zai4 wo3 yu4dao4 fa3 lu:4 jiu1 fen1 zhi1qian2……wo3 yu4fu4 le5 shi2 nian2 de5 fang2zu1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5。mei2cuo4，na4 shi4 yi1 bi3 ju4da4 de5 kai1zhi1。dan4 suo3 zai4 shi2yan4shi4 li3 de5 na4xie1 shang1pin3，zu2yi3 di3 shang4 zhe4xie1 cheng2ben3 de5 shi2bei4 zhi1 duo1。wo3 bu4 xi1wang4 ta1men5 bei4 chu2 wo3 zhi1 wai4 de5 ren4 he2 ren2 duo2zou3。"

msgid "Don't blame yourself. Blame Humanis."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​你​的​错​。​都​怪​那​帮​人类​至上​主义者​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4。dou1 guai4 na4 bang1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3。"

msgid "Don't blow a gasket, I'm leaving."
msgstr ""
"不用​吹胡子瞪眼​的​，​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"bu4yong4 chui1hu2zi5deng4yan3 de5，wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "Don't blow a gasket. I'll go read up."
msgstr ""
"别​急眼​。​我​现在​就​去​看看​。\n"
"bie4 ji2yan3。wo3 xian4zai4 jiu4 qu4 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"Don't bother answering that - it was a rhetorical question. And I can see that you won't be satisfied until I offer you some sort of real answer.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She steeples his fingers, musing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose it's possible that, when the spirit died, some portion of its essence was trapped in the hand that I used to kill it."
msgstr ""
"不必​费心​回答​了​，​我​是​在​反问​而已​。​而且​我能​看​出来​，​如果​我​不​给出​一些​确切​的​答案​，​你​是​不会​罢休​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​十指​交叉​，​陷入​沉思​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​，​当​那​精魂​消亡​时​，​或许​有​部分​精华​被困​在​了​我​杀死​它​时​所用​的​那​只​手中​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4bi4 fei4xin1 hui2da2 le5，wo3 shi4 zai4 fan3wen4 er2yi3。er2qie3 wo3 neng2 kan4 chu1lai2，ru2guo3 wo3 bu4 gei3 chu1 yi1xie1 que4qie4 de5 da2an4，ni3 shi4 bu4hui4 ba4xiu1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shi2 zhi3 jiao1cha1，xian4ru4 chen2si1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3，dang1 na4 jing1hun2 xiao1wang2 shi2，huo4xu3 you3 bu4fen5 jing1hua2 bei4kun4 zai4 le5 wo3 sha1si3 ta1 shi2 suo3 yong4 de5 na4 zhi3 shou3 zhong4。"

msgid "Don't bother. I'll be watching."
msgstr ""
"不用​。​我​也​会​盯​着​的​。\n"
"bu4yong4。wo3 ye3 hui4 ding1 zhao2 de5。"

msgid "Don't bother. We don't have time to waste on this."
msgstr ""
"别​折腾​了​。​我们​没​时间​浪费​在​这​上面​。\n"
"bie4 zhe1teng5 le5。wo3men5 mei2 shi2jian1 lang4fei4 zai4 zhe4 shang4mian4。"

msgid ""
"Don't call it that in front of her, though. Word on the street is that she "
"hates it."
msgstr ""
"不过​别​在​她​面前​这么​叫​。​听说​她​讨厌​“​兔子​洞​”​这个​称呼​。\n"
"bu4guo4 bie4 zai4 ta1 mian4qian2 zhe4me5 jiao4。ting1shuo1 ta1 tao3yan4“tu4zi5 dong4” zhe4ge5 cheng1hu5。"

msgid ""
"Don't call me colonel, pup. And these are the only reinforcements you'll get"
" from me. "
msgstr ""
"别​叫​我​上校​，​小鬼​。​另外​我能​给​你​提供​的​增援​就​这么​多​。\n"
"bie4 jiao4 wo3 shang4xiao4，xiao3gui3。ling4wai4 wo3 neng2 gei3 ni3 ti2gong1 de5 zeng1yuan2 jiu4 zhe4me5 duo1。"

msgid "Don't deckers usually handle that kind of thing?"
msgstr ""
"这种​事情​不是​通常​由​碟​客来​处理​吗​？\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 bu4shi4 tong1chang2 you2 die2 ke4 lai2 chu3li3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Don't do this, $(l.name). If he goes through with his plan, everyone who survived the attack will die. They'll be *incinerated.*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich's voice is low, barely a whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you really want to help this monster... you'll do it over my dead body."
msgstr ""
"别​这么​做​，​$(l.name)​。​如果​他​真的​实施​这个​计划​，​所有​幸存者​都​会​死​。​他们​会​被​*​烧成​灰烬​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​的​声音​很​低​，​几乎​听不见​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​真的​想​帮助​这个​怪物​……​你​得​从​我​的​尸体​上​踏​过去​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4，$(l.name)。ru2guo3 ta1 zhen1de5 shi2shi1 zhe4ge5 ji4hua4，suo3you3 xing4cun2zhe3 dou1 hui4 si3。ta1men5 hui4 bei4*shao1 cheng2 hui1jin4*。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 di1，ji1hu1 ting1bu5jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 bang1zhu4 zhe4ge5 guai4wu5……ni3 de2 cong2 wo3 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 ta1 guo4qu4。"

msgid ""
"Don't do this, $(l.name). If he goes through with his plan, everyone who survived the attack will die. They'll be *incinerated.*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger's voice cracks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I *trusted* you, $(l.name). Maybe I still do. But if you want to help this monster... you'll do it over my dead body."
msgstr ""
"别​这么​做​，​$(l.name)​。​如果​他​真的​实施​这个​计划​，​所有​幸存者​都​会​死​。​他们​会​被​*​烧成​灰烬​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​声音​颤抖​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​曾经​*​信任​你​，​$(l.name)​。​也许​我​仍然​如此​。​但​如果​你​想​帮助​这个​怪物​……​你​得​从​我​的​尸体​上​踏​过去​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4，$(l.name)。ru2guo3 ta1 zhen1de5 shi2shi1 zhe4ge5 ji4hua4，suo3you3 xing4cun2zhe3 dou1 hui4 si3。ta1men5 hui4 bei4*shao1 cheng2 hui1jin4*。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 chan4dou3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3*ceng2jing1*xin4ren4 ni3，$(l.name)。ye3xu3 wo3 reng2ran2 ru2ci3。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 bang1zhu4 zhe4ge5 guai4wu5……ni3 de2 cong2 wo3 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 ta1 guo4qu4。"

msgid "Don't do this, Grinder."
msgstr ""
"别​这么​做​，​“​绞肉机​”​。\n"
"bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4，“jiao3rou4ji1”。"

msgid ""
"Don't engage with him. Just let him hang onto his little fantasy.\n"
"\n"
"We need to get out of here before these bioware samples thaw."
msgstr ""
"别​再​搭​茬​了​。​就让​他​继续​沉浸​在​幻想​中​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​得​在​这些​生体​殖装​样本​解冻​之前​赶紧​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 zai4 da1 cha2 le5。jiu4 rang4 ta1 ji4xu4 chen2jin4 zai4 huan4xiang3 zhong4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de2 zai4 zhe4xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 jie3dong4 zhi1qian2 gan3jin3 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"Don't engage with him. Just let him hang onto his little fantasy... we need "
"to get out of here before these bioware samples thaw."
msgstr ""
"别​再​搭​茬​了​。​就让​他​继续​沉浸​在​幻想​中​吧​……​我们​得​在​这些​生体​殖装​样本​解冻​之前​赶紧​离开​。\n"
"bie4 zai4 da1 cha2 le5。jiu4 rang4 ta1 ji4xu4 chen2jin4 zai4 huan4xiang3 zhong4 ba1……wo3men5 de2 zai4 zhe4xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 jie3dong4 zhi1qian2 gan3jin3 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"Don't engage with him. Just let him hang onto his little fantasy... we need "
"to get out of here before those bioware samples start to thaw."
msgstr ""
"别​再​搭​茬​了​。​就让​他​继续​沉浸​在​幻想​中​吧​……​我们​得​在​这些​生体​殖装​样本​解冻​之前​赶紧​离开​。\n"
"bie4 zai4 da1 cha2 le5。jiu4 rang4 ta1 ji4xu4 chen2jin4 zai4 huan4xiang3 zhong4 ba1……wo3men5 de2 zai4 zhe4xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 jie3dong4 zhi1qian2 gan3jin3 li2kai1。"

msgid "Don't get cute with me, $(l.name). Say what you mean."
msgstr ""
"别​卖关子​了​，​$(l.name)​。​有话直说​。\n"
"bie4 mai4guan1zi5 le5，$(l.name)。you3 hua4 zhi2 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Don't get too carried away. We *won,* Dietrich. We kicked ass and took names, and saved a lot of lives to boot.\n"
"\n"
"We *are* heroes. Don't tell yourself any different."
msgstr ""
"不要​想些​有​的​没​的​。​我们​*​赢​了​*​，​迪​特里​希​。​我们​干掉​了​凶残​的​敌人​，​也​拯救​了​许多​生命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​*​就是​*​英雄​。​不要​对​自己​有所​怀疑​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 xiang3 xie1 you3 de5 mei2 de5。wo3men5*ying2 le5*，Di2te4li3xi1。wo3men5 gan4diao4 le5 xiong1can2 de5 di2ren2，ye3 zheng3jiu4 le5 xu3duo1 sheng1ming4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5*jiu4shi4*ying1xiong2。bu4yao4 dui4 zi4ji3 you3suo3 huai2yi2。"

msgid "Don't get too excited, love. We still need the part."
msgstr ""
"别​高兴​得太早​，​亲爱​的​。​我们​还是​需要​那个​零件​。\n"
"bie4 gao1xing4 de2 tai4 zao3，qin1ai4 de5。wo3men5 hai2shi5 xu1yao4 na4ge5 ling2jian4。"

msgid "Don't get too excited. I still need the part. Any ideas?"
msgstr ""
"别​高兴​得太早​。​我​还是​需要​那个​零件​。​有​什么​主意​吗​？\n"
"bie4 gao1xing4 de2 tai4 zao3。wo3 hai2shi5 xu1yao4 na4ge5 ling2jian4。you3 shen2me5 zhu3yi5 ma5？"

msgid "Don't get too excited. We still need the part."
msgstr ""
"别​高兴​得太早​。​我们​还是​需要​那个​零件​。\n"
"bie4 gao1xing4 de2 tai4 zao3。wo3men5 hai2shi5 xu1yao4 na4ge5 ling2jian4。"

msgid "Don't give up. We can still turn this around!"
msgstr ""
"别​放弃​。​我们​还​能​扭转乾坤​！\n"
"bie4 fang4qi4。wo3men5 hai2 neng2 niu3zhuan3qian2kun1！"

msgid ""
"Don't have to tell me twice.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She plunges her blade into the Engineer's throat. He lets out a startled gurgling sound, thrashes, and dies.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"求之不得​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​刀刃​深深​刺入​工程师​的​喉咙​。​他​发出​一声​惊慌​的​咕噜​声​，​挣扎​几下​后​死​掉​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"qiu2zhi1bu4de2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 dao1ren4 shen1shen1 ci1 ru4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 hou2long2。ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 jing1huang1 de5 gu1lu5 sheng1，zheng1zha2 ji1 xia4 hou4 si3 diao4 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Don't kill me!"
msgstr ""
"别杀​我​！\n"
"bie4 sha1 wo3！"

msgid "Don't know the man. Sorry."
msgstr ""
"不​认识​，​抱歉​。\n"
"bu4 ren4shi5，bao4qian4。"

msgid "Don't know, don't care. I just want to find that bioware."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​，​也​不在乎​。​我​只​想​找到​那件​生体​殖装​。\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4，ye3 bu4zai4hu5。wo3 zhi3 xiang3 zhao3dao4 na4 jian4 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1。"

msgid "Don't know, don't care. Sorry."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​，​我​也​不在乎​。​不好意思​喽​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，wo3 ye3 bu4zai4hu5。bu4hao3yi4si5 lou5。"

msgid "Don't know. Couldn't find him."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​。​我​没能​找到​他​。\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4。wo3 mei2 neng2 zhao3dao4 ta1。"

msgid "Don't leave me in suspense. What've you got?"
msgstr ""
"别吊​我​胃口​了​。​你​这​都​有​什么​？\n"
"bie4 diao4 wo3 wei4kou3 le5。ni3 zhe4 dou1 you3 shen2me5？"

msgid "Don't leave me in suspense. Who was it?"
msgstr ""
"别​卖关子​了​，​到底​是​谁​？\n"
"bie4 mai4guan1zi5 le5，dao4di3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Don't let him get away!"
msgstr ""
"别​让​他​跑​了​！\n"
"bie4 rang4 ta1 pao2 le5！"

msgid "Don't let him pressure you, boy."
msgstr ""
"别​听​他​发号施令​，​孩子​。\n"
"bie4 ting1 ta1 fa1hao4shi1ling4，hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"Don't let him sweet-talk you, chief. Push the button and let me blow him "
"away!"
msgstr ""
"别​被​他​的​花言巧语​给​骗​了​，​头儿​。​赶紧​按下​按钮​，​让​我​崩​了​这​王八蛋​！\n"
"bie4 bei4 ta1 de5 hua1yan2qiao3yu3 gei3 pian4 le5，tou2r5。gan3jin3 an4xia4 an4niu3，rang4 wo3 beng1 le5 zhe4 wang2ba1dan4！"

msgid "Don't let the door hit you on the way out."
msgstr ""
"走​的​时候​别撞​门上​。\n"
"zou3 de5 shi2hou5 bie4 zhuang4 men2 shang4。"

msgid ""
"Don't listen to him, chief. Hasenkamp is planning on screwing you.\n"
"\n"
"I've had a bot digging up intel on the man ever since you stepped into that building together. And let me tell you, he is NOT trustworthy."
msgstr ""
"别​听​他​的​，​头儿​。​哈森​坎普​想​在​你​身后​搞小动作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自从​你们​一起​走进​那栋​楼​，​我​就​派​机器人​在​打探​那家伙​的​情报​。​我​跟​你​说​，​他​绝对​不可​信​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 ting1 ta1 de5，tou2r5。Ha1sen1kan3pu3 xiang3 zai4 ni3 shen1hou4 gao3 xiao3 dong4 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"zi4cong2 ni3men5 yi1qi3 zou3jin4 na4 dong4 lou2，wo3 jiu4 pai4 ji1qi4ren2 zai4 da3tan4 na4 jia1 huo3 de5 qing2bao4。wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1，ta1 jue2dui4 bu4ke3 xin4。"

msgid "Don't listen to this asshole, chief. He shouldn't even be here."
msgstr ""
"别​听​这​混蛋​乱说​，​头儿​。​他​都​不​应该​来​这里​。\n"
"bie4 ting1 zhe4 hun2dan4 luan4shuo1，tou2r5。ta1 dou1 bu4 ying1gai1 lai2 zhe4li3。"

msgid "Don't listen to this thing, Glory."
msgstr ""
"别​听​它​的​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"bie4 ting1 ta1 de5，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "Don't make me kill you, man."
msgstr ""
"别​逼​我​杀​了​你​，​伙计​。\n"
"bie4 bi1 wo3 sha1 le5 ni3，huo3ji5。"

msgid "Don't mind if I do."
msgstr ""
"那​我​就​不​客气​了​。\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 bu4 ke4qi5 le5。"

msgid "Don't mind me, I'm just passing through."
msgstr ""
"不用​管​我​，​我​就是​路过​。\n"
"bu4yong4 guan3 wo3，wo3 jiu4shi4 lu4guo4。"

msgid "Don't mind me, folks."
msgstr ""
"二位​不用​管​我​。\n"
"er4 wei4 bu4yong4 guan3 wo3。"

msgid "Don't mind me, just passing through."
msgstr ""
"不用​管​我​，​我​就是​路过​。\n"
"bu4yong4 guan3 wo3，wo3 jiu4shi4 lu4guo4。"

msgid ""
"Don't mistake this decision for a reprimand. Monika considered your "
"contributions to the team to be invaluable."
msgstr ""
"不要​误会​，​我​没有​责备​你​的​意思​，​莫妮卡​认为​你​对​团队​的​贡献​是​无价​的​。\n"
"bu4yao4 wu4hui4，wo3 mei2you3 ze2bei4 ni3 de5 yi4si5，Mo4ni1ka3 ren4wei2 ni3 dui4 tuan2dui4 de5 gong4xian4 shi4 wu2jia4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Don't need it. But thanks anyway.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns to leave.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You did good, $(l.name). You ever get tired of running the shadows, you come see me. I could find a place in my organization for a $(l.man) like you."
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​什么​好运​。​但​还是​谢谢​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转身​准备​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​干得​不错​，​$(l.name)​。​如果​你​厌倦​了​暗影​差事​的​生活​，​你​可以​随时​来​找​我​。​我​的​组织​肯定​用得上​像​你​这样​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 shen2me5 hao3yun4。dan4 hai2shi5 xie4xie5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 zhun3bei4 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gan4 de2 bu4cuo4，$(l.name)。ru2guo3 ni3 yan4juan4 le5 an4ying3 cha4shi4 de5 sheng1huo2，ni3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 lai2 zhao3 wo3。wo3 de5 zu3zhi1 ken3ding4 yong4de5shang4 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Don't open that in here. There are people in this room who would kill you "
"for what's in that bag."
msgstr ""
"别​在​这里​打开​。​如果​让​人​看到​里面​的​东西​，​绝对​会​有人​为了​它​跟​你们​玩命​的​。\n"
"bie4 zai4 zhe4li3 da3kai1。ru2guo3 rang4 ren2 kan4dao4 li3mian4 de5 dong1xi1，jue2dui4 hui4 you3ren2 wei4le5 ta1 gen1 ni3men5 wan2 ming4 de5。"

msgid "Don't play dumb with me. We need to talk about this."
msgstr ""
"别​装傻​了​。​我们​得​谈谈​。\n"
"bie4 zhuang1sha3 le5。wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"Don't question him, just roll with it. We need to get this bioware back to "
"Ezkibel before it starts to thaw."
msgstr ""
"他​都​已经​这样​了​，​就​顺着​他​说​吧​。​我们​需要​在​生体​殖装​开始​解冻​之前​将​其​带给​埃兹​基​贝尔​。\n"
"ta1 dou1 yi3jing1 zhe4yang4 le5，jiu4 shun4zhe5 ta1 shuo1 ba1。wo3men5 xu1yao4 zai4 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 kai1shi3 jie3dong4 zhi1qian2 jiang1 qi2 dai4gei3 Ai1ziji1bei4er3。"

msgid "Don't rush me. This is complicated."
msgstr ""
"别​催​我​。​这​东西​很​复杂​的​。\n"
"bie4 cui1 wo3。zhe4 dong1xi1 hen3 fu4za2 de5。"

msgid "Don't shoot!"
msgstr ""
"别​开枪​！\n"
"bie4 kai1qiang1！"

msgid "Don't start."
msgstr ""
"别跟我​提​这事​。\n"
"bie4 gen1 wo3 ti2 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Don't suppose I would. Like I said, I've got a team of my own - good people who've earned my loyalty a hundred times over.\n"
"\n"
"I can do a little moonlighting here and there, but they wouldn't take it kindly if I up and bailed on them."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​不会​的​。​就​像​我​说​的​，​我​有​自己​的​团队​，​他们​都​是​好人​，​我​对​他们​忠心耿耿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可以​不时​给​自己​找点​兼职​，​但​如果​我​离队​的话​，​他们​会​不​高兴​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 bu4hui4 de5。jiu4 xiang4 wo3 shuo1 de5，wo3 you3 zi4ji3 de5 tuan2dui4，ta1men5 dou1 shi4 hao3ren2，wo3 dui4 ta1men5 zhong1xin1geng3geng3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 bu4shi2 gei3 zi4ji3 zhao3 dian3 jian1zhi2，dan4 ru2guo3 wo3 li2dui4 de5hua4，ta1men5 hui4 bu4 gao1xing4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Don't suppose you'd be interested in taking a permanent position on my team?"
msgstr ""
"你​有​兴趣​在​我​的​团队​里​长期​占个​位子​吗​？\n"
"ni3 you3 xing4qu4 zai4 wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 li3 chang2qi1 zhan1 ge4 wei4zi5 ma5？"

msgid "Don't sweat it. Even shadowrunners have families."
msgstr ""
"不用​客气​。​就算​暗影​狂奔​者​也​是​有​家人​的​。\n"
"bu4yong4 ke4qi5。jiu4suan4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 ye3 shi4 you3 jia1ren2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Don't take it personally, I just don't want to talk about it. Let's chat "
"about something else, eh?"
msgstr ""
"别往​心里​去​，​我​只是​单纯​不想​谈​这件​事​。​我们​聊点​别的​吧​？\n"
"bie4 wang3 xin1li5 qu4，wo3 zhi3shi4 dan1chun2 bu4xiang3 tan2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。wo3men5 liao2 dian3 bie2de5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Don't talk to me about that run, boss.\n"
"\n"
"Not ever again."
msgstr ""
"别​再​提​那次​行动​的​事​了​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再也​别提​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 zai4 ti2 na4 ci4 xing2dong4 de5 shi4 le5，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ye3 bie4 ti2 le5。"

msgid "Don't tell me you're changing your mind."
msgstr ""
"别跟我​说​你​改变​主意​了​。\n"
"bie4 gen1 wo3 shuo1 ni3 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Don't test me, Albert. You've always been a royal pain in the ass, you know that?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a burst of static as he coughs into the microphone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...By the way, what happened to your voice? You don't sound like yourself."
msgstr ""
"别​挑战​我​的​耐心​，​阿尔伯特​。​你​一直​都​很​烦人​，​懂​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​麦克风​里​传来​一阵​他​咳嗽​的​杂音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​话​说​你​的​声音​怎么​了​？​听​起来​不像​你​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 tiao3zhan4 wo3 de5 nai4xin1，a1er3bo2te4。ni3 yi1zhi2 dou1 hen3 fan2ren2，dong3？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mai4ke4feng1 li3 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 ta1 ke2sou5 de5 za2yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……hua4 shuo1 ni3 de5 sheng1yin1 zen3me5 le5？ting1 qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 ni3 a1。"

msgid ""
"Don't thank me until we're safely back in the Kreuzbasar. We still don't "
"know how this is going to turn out."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​安全​回到​克洛伊​茨​集市​后​再说​谢​我​的​事​吧​。​我们​还​不​知道​事情​会​如何​收场​。\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 an1quan2 hui2dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 hou4 zai4shuo1 xie4 wo3 de5 shi4 ba1。wo3men5 hai2 bu4 zhi1dao4 shi4qing5 hui4 ru2he2 shou1chang3。"

msgid "Don't thank me. You got yourself out of that building."
msgstr ""
"不用谢​我​。​是​你​自己​成功​逃出​了​大楼​。\n"
"bu4yong4xie4 wo3。shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 cheng2gong1 tao2 chu1 le5 da4lou2。"

msgid ""
"Don't underestimate him. Remember the box of thumbs that I got in the mail?\n"
"\n"
"I mean, *thumbs,* chief! How creepy is *that?*"
msgstr ""
"别​低估​了​他​。​还​记得​我​在​邮箱​里​收到​的​一盒​拇指​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​可是​一大​盒​啊​，​头儿​！​这得​多​可怕​啊​？\n"
"\n"
"bie4 di1gu1 le5 ta1。hai2 ji4de5 wo3 zai4 you2xiang1 li3 shou1dao4 de5 yi1 he2 mu3zhi3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"na4 ke3shi4 yi1 dai4 he2 a1，tou2r5！zhe4 de2 duo1 ke3pa4 a1？"

msgid ""
"Don't worry about it, Dietrich. I'm just glad that everything worked out "
"okay."
msgstr ""
"不用​这么​见外​，​迪​特里​希​。​事情​顺利​解决​比​什么​都​强​。\n"
"bu4yong4 zhe4me5 jian4wai4，Di2te4li3xi1。shi4qing5 shun4li4 jie3jue2 bi3 shen2me5 dou1 jiang4。"

msgid "Don't worry about it, man. It wasn't even all that difficult."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​伙计​。​这​根本​不是​什么​难事​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，huo3ji5。zhe4 gen1ben3 bu4shi4 shen2me5 nan2 shi4。"

msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""
"不​重要​了​。\n"
"bu4 zhong4yao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry about it. I wasn't planning to bring you along on our last run "
"anyway."
msgstr ""
"没什么​，​反正​我​本来​上次​也​没​打算​带​你​出​任务​的​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5，fan3zheng4 wo3 ben3lai2 shang4ci4 ye3 mei2 da3suan4 dai4 ni3 chu1 ren4wu5 de5。"

msgid "Don't worry about it. What's done is done."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​事已至此​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。shi4yi3zhi4ci3。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry about me - everything's all right on my end.\n"
"\n"
"But this asshole is right about one thing: we aren't going to solve this on his word alone."
msgstr ""
"不用​担心​我​—​—​我​没事​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​混蛋​有​一件​事说​对​了​：​我们​不能​指望​单凭​他​的话​来​解决​这​事​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3——wo3 mei2shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 hun2dan4 you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 shuo1 dui4 le5：wo3men5 bu4neng2 zhi3wang4 dan1 ping2 ta1 de5hua4 lai2 jie3jue2 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry about me, $(l.name). What I have to do... I can handle it on my own, and it's my own responsibility anyway.\n"
"\n"
"As soon as I've finished doing what I have to do, I'll be back. It shouldn't take long."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​我​，​$(l.name)​。​我​该​做​的​事​……​我​自己​能​处理​。​毕竟​这​是​我​的​责任​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我​忙​完​就​会​回来​，​应该​不会​花太​长时间​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1 wo3，$(l.name)。wo3 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4……wo3 zi4ji3 neng2 chu3li3。bi4jing4 zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 ze2ren4。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 mang2 wan2 jiu4 hui4 hui2lai5，ying1gai1 bu4hui4 hua1 tai4 zhang3 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry about me, fearless leader. I've done this before.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She glances down at the Engineer's prostrate body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's one thing this asshole has said that holds water. We aren't going to solve this on his word alone."
msgstr ""
"不用​担心​我​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​以前​也​做​过​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​低头​望​向​倒​在​地上​的​工程师​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​混蛋​有​一件​事说​得​没错​。​我们​不能​指望​单凭​他​的话​来​解决​这​事​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3 yi3qian2 ye3 zuo4 guo4 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 wang4 xiang4 dao3 zai4 di4shang5 de5 gong1cheng2shi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hun2dan4 you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。wo3men5 bu4neng2 zhi3wang4 dan1 ping2 ta1 de5hua4 lai2 jie3jue2 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid "Don't worry about me, grandpa. I'm doing just fine."
msgstr ""
"不用​担心​我​，​老爷子​。​我​好​着​呢​。\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3，lao3ye2zi5。wo3 hao3 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Don't worry about me. I'm solid."
msgstr ""
"不用​担心​，​我​顶得住​。\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1，wo3 ding3 de2 zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry, $(l.name). I will.\n"
"\n"
"And once I've finished, I'm coming back... that's a promise."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​$(l.name)​，​我会​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​忙​完​就​会​回来​……​我​保证​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，$(l.name)，wo3 hui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mang2 wan2 jiu4 hui4 hui2lai5……wo3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry, Dietrich. We'll get this over with as quickly as we can.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, perhaps we should work out what we're going to do about APEX. While $(l.name) and I are indisposed, the rest of you can start gearing up for the assault."
msgstr ""
"不必​担心​，​迪​特里​希​。​我们​会​尽快​把​事​办完​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​与此同时​，​或许​我们​该​研究​下​如何​应对​APEX​。​这样一来​，​$(l.name)​和​我​离开​的​时候​，​你们​其他人​也好​为​进攻​做​准备​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4bi4 dan1xin1，Di2te4li3xi1。wo3men5 hui4 jin3kuai4 ba3 shi4 ban4 wan2。\n"
"\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，huo4xu3 wo3men5 gai1 yan2jiu1 xia4 ru2he2 ying4dui4 APEX。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，$(l.name) he4 wo3 li2kai1 de5 shi2hou5，ni3men5 qi2 ta1 ren2 ye3hao3 wei2 jin4gong1 zuo4 zhun3bei4。"

msgid "Don't worry, Eiger. I've got your back."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​艾格尔​。​有​我​在​呢​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，Ai4ge2er3。you3 wo3 zai4 ni2。"

msgid "Don't worry, I won't."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​我​就​待​在​这里​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，wo3 jiu4 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid "Don't worry, Kim. We won't let him come back."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​阿金​。​我们​不会​让​他​回来​的​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，e1 jin1。wo3men5 bu4hui4 rang4 ta1 hui2lai5 de5。"

msgid "Don't worry, Paul. I will."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​保罗​。​我会​的​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，bao3luo2。wo3 hui4 de5。"

msgid "Don't worry, he's not going anywh--"
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​他​哪儿​也​别​想​去​—​—\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，ta1 na3r5 ye3 bie4 xiang3 qu4 — —"

msgid ""
"Don't worry, it's going to be fine. Let's find the others and do what we "
"came here to do."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​不会​有事​的​。​我们​先去​找​其他人​，​然后​去​完成​此行​的​任务​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。wo3men5 xian1 qu4 zhao3 qi2 ta1 ren2，ran2hou4 qu4 wan2cheng2 ci3xing2 de5 ren4wu5。"

msgid "Don't worry, kid. Nobody's getting hurt tonight."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​孩子​。​今晚​没人会​受伤​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，hai2zi5。jin1wan3 mei2 ren2 hui4 shou4shang1。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry, we're doing fine on the job front. Amsel's been working "
"overtime."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​差事​方面​一切顺利​。​阿姆​泽尔​一直​在​加班​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，cha4shi4 fang1mian4 yi1 qie1 shun4 li4。E1mu3ze2er3 yi1zhi2 zai4 jia1ban1。"

msgid "Don't worry. I won't try to change her mind."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​。​我​不会​试图​改变​她​的​想法​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1。wo3 bu4hui4 shi4tu2 gai3bian4 ta1 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid "Don't worry. I won't."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​我​不会​的​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，wo3 bu4hui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry. The pain will fade, in time.\n"
"\n"
"I wouldn't recommend doing that again, though."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​。​疼痛​会​渐渐​消退​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​并​不​建议​你​再​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1。teng2tong4 hui4 jian4jian4 xiao1tui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 bing4 bu4 jian4yi4 ni3 zai4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid "Don't worry. We won't."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​。​我们​不会​的​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1。wo3men5 bu4hui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Don't worry. We won't.\n"
"\n"
"How long have you been here, by the way?"
msgstr ""
"别​担心​。​我们​不会​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​，​你​来​这里​多久​了​？\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1。wo3men5 bu4hui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1，ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 duo1jiu3 le5？"

msgid "Don't you have people for this?"
msgstr ""
"你​手底下​没人​做​这个​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shou3 de5 xia4 mei2 ren2 zuo4 zhe4ge5 ma5？"

msgid "Don't you have somewhere to be?"
msgstr ""
"你​不是​还有​事要​忙​吗​？\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 hai2you3 shi4 yao4 mang2 ma5？"

msgid "Don't you start with me, mein Schatz."
msgstr ""
"不许​取笑​我​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"bu4xu3 qu3xiao4 wo3，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid "Don't you want to know what caused the lockdown?"
msgstr ""
"你​不想​知道​是​什么​导致​了​封锁​吗​？\n"
"ni3 bu4xiang3 zhi1dao4 shi4 shen2me5 dao3zhi4 le5 feng1suo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Don't you worry about Grinder. I can handle him.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else, or can I go about my day?"
msgstr ""
"不用​担心​“​绞肉机​”​的​事​。​我能​搞定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​别的​事​吗​？​还是​说​我​可以​自己​忙​去​了​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 shi4。wo3 neng2 gao3ding4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 wo3 ke3yi3 zi4ji3 mang2 qu4 le5？"

msgid ""
"Don't you worry, stranger.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His smile widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You'll be dealt with soon enough."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​陌生人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​脸上​的​笑容​更盛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很快​就​会​有人​来​解决​你​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，mo4sheng1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 geng1 cheng2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 you3ren2 lai2 jie3jue2 ni3。"

msgid "Don't--"
msgstr ""
"不要​—​—\n"
"bu4yao4 — —"

msgid "Don't."
msgstr ""
"别​。\n"
"bie4。"

msgid "Donations for the soup kitchen have slowed, Samuel."
msgstr ""
"塞缪尔​，​给施​食处​的​捐赠​已经​放缓​了​。\n"
"sai4miu4er3，gei3 shi1 shi2 chu3 de5 juan1zeng4 yi3jing1 fang4huan3 le5。"

msgid "Done"
msgstr ""
"Done\n"
"Done"

msgid "Done and done, chief."
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​，​头儿​。\n"
"gao3ding4 le5，tou2r5。"

msgid "Done and done."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Done and done. The horrible conclusion to that terrible show is waiting for Phil on his media center.\n"
"\n"
"You wanna know how it ends?"
msgstr ""
"搞定​。​这破剧​的​烂尾​结局​已经​在​菲尔​的​媒体​库里​等​他​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​想​让​我​给​你​剧透​一下​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"gao3ding4。zhe4 po4 ju4 de5 lan4wei3 jie2ju2 yi3jing1 zai4 fei1 er3 de5 mei2ti3 ku4 li3 deng3 ta1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 rang4 wo3 gei3 ni3 ju4tou4 yi1xia4 ma5？"

msgid "Done and done. This'll be easy as pie, you wait and see."
msgstr ""
"这​就​去​办​。​这​简直​是​小菜一碟​，​你​就​瞧​好​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4 qu4 ban4。zhe4 jian3zhi2 shi4 xiao3cai4yi1die2，ni3 jiu4 qiao2 hao3 ba1。"

msgid "Done! Wait, when did that thing get installed?"
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​！​等会儿​，​那​东西​是​什么​时候​装上​的​啊​？\n"
"gao3ding4 le5！deng3 hui4 er2，na4 dong1xi1 shi4 shen2me5 shi2hou5 zhuang1 shang4 de5 a1？"

msgid "Done. Get moving on to the next one."
msgstr ""
"搞定​。​去​弄​下​一个​吧​。\n"
"gao3ding4。qu4 long4 xia4 yi1ge5 ba1。"

msgid "Done. This philosophy of Harrow's really starts to break dow--"
msgstr ""
"我​看​完​了​。​哈罗​的​这种​哲学思想​已经​开始​自我​崩溃​了​—​—\n"
"wo3 kan4 wan2 le5。ha1luo2 de5 zhe4zhong3 zhe2 xue2 si1 xiang3 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 zi4wo3 beng1kui4 le5 — —"

msgid ""
"Don’t be so self-righteous. We drive new species to extinction *every single year* on this planet. \n"
"\n"
"Dragons, at least, we have cause to destroy.\n"
msgstr ""
"别​那么​自以为是​。​我们​每年​都​在​让​这个​星球​上​新​的​物种​灭绝​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至少​，​我们​有​充足​的​理由​去​消灭​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 na4me5 zi4yi3wei2shi4。wo3men5 mei3nian2 dou1 zai4 rang4 zhe4ge5 xing1qiu2 shang4 xin1 de5 wu4zhong3 mie4jue2。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3，wo3men5 you3 chong1zu2 de5 li3you2 qu4 xiao1mie4 ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"Don’t do it, Vauclair! Don’t go down in history as the man who turned Berlin"
" into an inferno. "
msgstr ""
"别​这么​做​，​沃​克莱尔​！​不要​成为​把​柏林​化为​炼狱​的​历史​罪人​。\n"
"bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4，Wo4ke4lai2er3！bu4yao4 cheng2wei2 ba3 bo2lin2 hua4 wei2 lian4yu4 de5 li4shi3 zui4ren2。"

msgid ""
"Don’t do it, Vauclair. \n"
"\n"
"I swear, I will make you hurt if you do. And I'll make it *last*."
msgstr ""
"别​这么​做​，​沃​克莱尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​发誓​，​如果​你​敢​动手​的话​，​我​饶​不了​你​。​而且​会​持续​*​很​久​*​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 fa1shi4，ru2guo3 ni3 gan3 dong4shou3 de5hua4，wo3 rao2 bu4le5 ni3。er2qie3 hui4 chi2xu4*hen3 jiu3*。"

msgid ""
"Don’t do it, Vauclair. \n"
"\n"
"I swear, I will make you hurt if you do. And I'll make it *last.*"
msgstr ""
"别​这么​做​，​沃​克莱尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​发誓​，​如果​你​敢​动手​的话​，​我​饶​不了​你​。​而且​会​持续​*​很​久​*​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 fa1shi4，ru2guo3 ni3 gan3 dong4shou3 de5hua4，wo3 rao2 bu4le5 ni3。er2qie3 hui4 chi2xu4*hen3 jiu3*。"

msgid ""
"Don’t flatter yourself. I couldn’t care less whether you like me or not."
msgstr ""
"别​自作多情​了​。​我​可​不在乎​你​喜不喜欢​我​。\n"
"bie4 zi4zuo4duo1qing2 le5。wo3 ke3 bu4zai4hu5 ni3 xi3 bu4 xi3 huan1 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Don’t get carried away, fearless leader. You still have a whole hell of a "
"lot to prove. And I’ll be watching to make sure that you do."
msgstr ""
"别太​得意忘形​，​无畏​领袖​。​你​要​证明​自己​的​地方​还​有的是​。​可别​想​蒙混过关​，​我会​一直​盯​着​你​的​。\n"
"bie4 tai4 de2yi4wang4xing2，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。ni3 yao4 zheng4ming2 zi4ji3 de5 di4fang1 hai2 you3de5shi4。ke3 bie4 xiang3 meng2hun4guo4guan1，wo3 hui4 yi1zhi2 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Don’t give up hope, Feuerschwinge."
msgstr ""
"不要​放弃​希望​，​火翼​。\n"
"bu4yao4 fang4qi4 xi1wang4，Huo3yi4。"

msgid ""
"Don’t take the moral high ground with me, *shadowrunner.* How many people did you and your team butcher to get here? Dozens, easily. \n"
"\n"
"And why? To avenge the deaths of your friends? To protect your Kreuzbasar? "
msgstr ""
"别跟我​摆​出​一副​道德​优越​的​姿态​，​*​暗影​狂奔​者​*​。​你​和​你​的​团队​为了​来到​这里​杀害​了​多少​人​？​起码​随随便便​也​有​数十​人​了​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​什么​？​为​死去​的​朋友​复仇​？​还是​为了​保护​你们​的​克洛伊​茨​集市​？\n"
"\n"
"bie4 gen1 wo3 bai3 chu1 yi1 fu4 dao4de2 you1yue4 de5 zi1tai4，*an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3*。ni3 he4 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 wei4le5 lai2dao4 zhe4li3 sha1hai4 le5 duo1shao3 ren2？qi3ma3 sui2 sui2 bian4 bian4 ye3 you3 shu3 shi2 ren2 le5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 shen2me5？wei2 si3qu4 de5 peng2you5 fu4chou2？hai2shi5 wei4le5 bao3hu4 ni3men5 de5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4？"

msgid "Don’t worry about it, Dietrich. It’s under control."
msgstr ""
"不用​担心​，​迪​特里​希​。​情况​尽​在​掌握​之中​。\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1，Di2te4li3xi1。qing2kuang4 jin3 zai4 zhang3wo4 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"Don’t worry about the body. \n"
"\n"
"I know what to do."
msgstr ""
"不用​操心​遗体​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​该​怎么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 cao1xin1 yi2ti3 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Don’t worry, $(l.name). I won’t question your competence again… not in front of the others, at least.\n"
"\n"
"But I won’t lie. I still have concerns about you."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​$(l.name)​。​我​不会​再​质疑​你​的​能力​了​……​至少​当着​他们​的​面​不会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​老实​说​，​我​对​你​还是​有些​担忧​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，$(l.name)。wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 zhi4yi2 ni3 de5 neng2li4 le5……zhi4shao3 dang1zhe5 ta1men5 de5 mian4 bu4hui4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 dui4 ni3 hai2shi5 you3xie1 dan1you1。"

msgid ""
"Don’t worry. I won’t.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You should go, fearless leader. I’ve got prep work to do for our next run, and you’ve got more important things to do than watch me pack my gear."
msgstr ""
"不用​担心​，​我​不会​忘​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​该​走​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​得​为​下次​行动​做​准备​了​，​而且​比起​看​我​收拾​东西​，​你​应该​有​更​重要​的​事要​做​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1，wo3 bu4hui4 wang4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gai1 zou3 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3 de2 wei2 xia4ci4 xing2dong4 zuo4 zhun3bei4 le5，er2qie3 bi3qi3 kan4 wo3 shou1shi5 dong1xi1，ni3 ying1gai1 you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 zuo4 ba1？"

msgid "Door"
msgstr ""
"门\n"
"men2"

msgid "Door 01"
msgstr ""
"大门​01\n"
"da4men2 01"

msgid "Door Console"
msgstr ""
"大门​控制台\n"
"da4men2 kong4zhi4tai2"

msgid "Door Control"
msgstr ""
"大门​控制\n"
"da4men2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Door Control North"
msgstr ""
"北侧​大门​控制\n"
"bei3ce4 da4men2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Door Control South"
msgstr ""
"南侧​大门​控制\n"
"nan2ce4 da4men2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Door Control Terminal"
msgstr ""
"门禁​控制​终端\n"
"men2jin4 kong4zhi4 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Door Controls"
msgstr ""
"大门​控制\n"
"da4men2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Door Override Terminal"
msgstr ""
"大门​超控​终端\n"
"da4men2 chao1 kong4 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Door Panel"
msgstr ""
"大门​面板\n"
"da4men2 mian4ban3"

msgid "Dorm Room Door"
msgstr ""
"宿舍​门\n"
"su4she4 men2"

msgid "Double Tap"
msgstr ""
"双发​连射\n"
"shuang1 fa1 lian2 she4"

msgid ""
"Double Tap: 2 attacks on a single target, Increased Critical Hit chance. "
"Cannot be used with Revolvers."
msgstr ""
"双发​连射​：​对​单个​目标​发动​2​次​攻击​，​暴击​几率​提升​。​无法​在​使用​左轮手枪​时​发动​。\n"
"shuang1 fa1 lian2 she4：dui4 dan1ge5 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 2 ci4 gong1ji1，bao4ji1 ji1lu:4 ti2sheng1。wu2fa3 zai4 shi3yong4 zuo3lun2shou3qiang1 shi2 fa1dong4。"

msgid "Double-Click"
msgstr ""
"双击\n"
"shuang1ji1"

msgid ""
"Double-Tap: 2 attacks on a single target, Increased Critical Hit chance"
msgstr ""
"双发​连射​：​对​单个​目标​发动​2​次​攻击​，​暴击​几率​提升\n"
"shuang1 fa1 lian2 she4：dui4 dan1ge5 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 2 ci4 gong1ji1，bao4ji1 ji1lu:4 ti2sheng1"

msgid ""
"Doubt there's much I could tell you that you wouldn't have learned in "
"school. That you should've learned in school."
msgstr ""
"我能​告诉​你​的​东西​都​是​你​在​学校​里​学过​的​。​或者说​本该​在​学校​里​学过​的​。\n"
"wo3 neng2 gao4su4 ni3 de5 dong1xi1 dou1 shi4 ni3 zai4 xue2xiao4 li3 xue2 guo4 de5。huo4 zhe3 shuo1 ben3 gai1 zai4 xue2xiao4 li3 xue2 guo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Down. We'll be exiting via an old servants' entrance to the west of the main"
" grounds. I need you to keep that exit clear."
msgstr ""
"死​了​。​我们​要​从​一个​老旧​的​仆人​入口​撤退​到​主​庭院​的​西侧​。​帮​我们​清理​掉​那​附近​的​敌人​。\n"
"si3 le5。wo3men5 yao4 cong2 yi1ge5 lao3jiu4 de5 pu2ren2 ru4kou3 che4tui4 dao4 zhu3 ting2yuan4 de5 xi1ce4。bang1 wo3men5 qing1li3 diao4 na4 fu4jin4 de5 di2ren2。"

msgid "Downloading"
msgstr ""
"正在​下载\n"
"zheng4zai4 xia4zai3"

msgid ""
"Dr. Adrian Vauclair. The hero of the people. The Dragonslayer. \n"
"\n"
"My brother.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grimaces and rubs his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hard to believe it's been almost twenty years."
msgstr ""
"阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。​人民​的​英雄​。​巨龙​的​勇士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​哥哥​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​苦笑​着​揉​揉​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很难​相信​已经​过去​二十年​了​。\n"
"\n"
"E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。ren2min2 de5 ying1xiong2。ju4long2 de5 yong3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 ge1ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ku3xiao4 zhao2 rou2 rou2 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 nan2 xiang1xin4 yi3jing1 guo4qu4 er4 shi2 nian2 le5。"

msgid "Dr. Exabier Ezkibel"
msgstr ""
"沙​比尔​·​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生\n"
"sha1 bi3er3 · Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1"

msgid ""
"Dr. Hansen's proclamation confirms what I already know. Still, I wince.\n"
"\n"
"I was hoping he'd find something to prove me wrong."
msgstr ""
"汉森​博士​的​声明​证实​了​我​早已​知晓​的​事实​。​尽管如此​，​我​仍​不禁​皱起​眉头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​曾​希望​他​能​发现​什么​来​证明​我错​了​。\n"
"\n"
"han4sen1 bo2shi4 de5 sheng1ming2 zheng4shi2 le5 wo3 zao3yi3 zhi1xiao3 de5 shi4shi2。jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，wo3 reng2 bu4jin1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ceng2 xi1wang4 ta1 neng2 fa1xian4 shen2me5 lai2 zheng4ming2 wo3 cuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Dr. Kristine Martin, director of research at Universal Omnitech, took a more cautious view of the CSMDS pandemic. \"This disease - or a mutant strain of it - could still do to us what it's doing to the dragons. That's why it's imperative that we find a cure quickly.\n"
"\n"
"\"Thankfully, we're getting close to doing just that. While standard zeta-interferon treatments have proven ineffective, we have been working around the clock to gengineer a variant of Z-interferon that can combat the disease.\""
msgstr ""
"环球​全能​科技​研究​总监​克里斯​汀​·​马丁​博士​对​CSMDS​大​流行​的​看法​更为​谨慎​。​“​这种​疾病​—​—​或​其​变异​株​—​—​仍​可能​对​人类​造成​与​对​龙族​相同​的​危害​。​因此​我们​必须​尽快​找到​解药​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​值得​庆幸​的​是​，​我们​已​接近​成功​。​虽然​标准​的​泽塔​干扰素​疗法​已​被​证实​无效​，​但​我们​正​昼夜​不停​地​通过​基因工程​改造​一种​能​对抗​该​疾病​的​Z​干扰素​变体​。​”\n"
"\n"
"huan2qiu2 quan2neng2 ke1ji4 yan2jiu1 zong3jian1 ke4 li3 si1 ting1 · ma3ding1 bo2shi4 dui4 CSMDS dai4 liu2xing2 de5 kan4fa3 geng4wei2 jin3shen4。“zhe4zhong3 ji2bing4——huo4 qi2 bian4yi4 zhu1——reng2 ke3neng2 dui4 ren2lei4 zao4cheng2 yu4 dui4 long2 zu2 xiang1tong2 de5 wei1hai4。yin1ci3 wo3men5 bi4xu1 jin3kuai4 zhao3dao4 jie3yao4。” \n"
"\n"
"“zhi2de5 qing4xing4 de5 shi4，wo3men5 yi3 jie1jin4 cheng2gong1。sui1ran2 biao1zhun3 de5 ze2ta3 gan1rao3su4 liao2fa3 yi3 bei4 zheng4shi2 wu2xiao4，dan4 wo3men5 zheng1 zhou4ye4 bu4ting2 de5 tong1guo4 ji1yin1gong1cheng2 gai3zao4 yi1zhong3 neng2 dui4kang4 gai1 ji2bing4 de5 Z gan1rao3su4 bian4ti3。”"

msgid ""
"Dr. Okinyi goes on to tell me that many similar creatures had been captured "
"throughout the jungles of Nairobi - monkey-like things with bizarre "
"mutations and vicious temperaments. But each has been different enough from "
"the others to defy classification; this one had a cluster of eyes and an "
"extra set of legs, while that one had a coat of quills and the rasping mouth"
" of a lamprey."
msgstr ""
"奥​基尼​博士​接着​告诉​我​，​在​内罗毕​的​丛林中​曾​捕获​过​许多​类似​的​生物​—​—​那些​猴子​般的​生物​带​着​怪异​的​突变​和​凶残​的​性情​。​但​每​只​都​与​其他​个体差异​显著​，​难以​归类​：​这​只长​着​一簇​眼睛​和​多余​的​腿​，​那​只​则​披​着​刺猬​般的​皮毛​，​还​拥有​七鳃鳗​那样​的​锉刀​状​口腔​。\n"
"ao4 ji1 ni2 bo2shi4 jie1zhe5 gao4su4 wo3，zai4 nei4luo2bi4 de5 cong2 lin2 zhong4 ceng2 bu3huo4 guo4 xu3duo1 lei4si4 de5 sheng1wu4——na4xie1 hou2zi5 ban1 de5 sheng1wu4 dai4 zhao2 guai4yi4 de5 tu1bian4 he4 xiong1can2 de5 xing4qing2。dan4 mei3 zhi3 dou1 yu4 qi2ta1 ge4 ti3 cha4 yi4 xian3zhu4，nan2yi3 gui1lei4：zhe4 zhi3 zhang3 zhao2 yi1 cu4 yan3jing5 he4 duo1yu2 de5 tui3，na4 zhi3 ze2 pi1 zhao2 ci4wei5 ban1 de5 pi2mao2，hai2 yong1you3 qi1sai1man2 na4yang4 de5 cuo4dao1 zhuang4 kou3qiang1。"

msgid ""
"Dr. Okinyi sees my reaction, and he laughs. \"What you see now is nothing,\" he tells me. \"When it was alive, it killed six men - ripped the faces and genitals off of two, and bathed the other four in some sort of caustic fluid. And all the while, it was laughing.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Laughing?\" I ask. \"Like, hyena-laughing?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No. It was laughing like a man.\""
msgstr ""
"奥​基尼​博士​看到​我​的​反应​，​他​笑​了​。​“​你​现在​看到​的​算不了​什么​，​”​他​告诉​我​，​“​活着​的​时候​，​它​杀​了​六个​人​—​—​把​两个​人​的​脸​和​生殖器​撕​了​下来​，​还​用​某种​腐蚀性​液体​浇​了​另外​四人​。​而​整个​过程​中​，​它​都​在​笑​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​笑​？​”​我​追问​，​“​像​鬣狗​那样​笑​？​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​不​。​它​笑​得​像​个人​。​”\n"
"\n"
"ao4 ji1 ni2 bo2shi4 kan4dao4 wo3 de5 fan3ying4，ta1 xiao4 le5。“ni3 xian4zai4 kan4dao4 de5 suan4bu4liao3 shen2me5，” ta1 gao4su4 wo3，“huo2zhe5 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 sha1 le5 liu4 ge4 ren2——ba3 liang3 ge4 ren2 de5 lian3 he4 sheng1zhi2qi4 si1 le5 xia4lai5，hai2 yong4 mou3zhong3 fu3shi2xing4 ye4ti3 jiao1 le5 ling4wai4 si4 ren2。er2 zheng3ge4 guo4cheng2 zhong4，ta1 dou1 zai4 xiao4。” \n"
"\n"
"“xiao4？” wo3 zhui1wen4，“xiang4 lie4gou3 na4yang4 xiao4？” \n"
"\n"
"“bu4。ta1 xiao4 de2 xiang4 ge4ren2。”"

msgid ""
"Dr. Vauclair’s my family, asshole. He’s a great man. A man of vision. \n"
"\n"
"And I’m gonna make sure that his vision becomes reality."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​博士​就是​我​的​家人​，​混蛋​。​他​是​个​了不起​的​人​，​极具​远见​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​我会​确保​他​的​远见​成为​现实​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 jiu4shi4 wo3 de5 jia1ren2，hun2dan4。ta1 shi4 ge4 liao3bu5qi3 de5 ren2，ji2 ju4 yuan3jian4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3 hui4 que4bao3 ta1 de5 yuan3jian4 cheng2wei2 xian4shi2。"

msgid "Dr. Xabier Ezkibel"
msgstr ""
"沙​比尔​·​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生\n"
"sha1 bi3er3 · Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1"

msgid "Dragon's Breath Round"
msgstr ""
"龙息弹\n"
"long2 xi1 dan4"

msgid "DragonfallExtended"
msgstr ""
"龙​陨​拓展\n"
"long2 yun3 tuo4zhan3"

msgid ""
"Dragons are cunning… quite, quite cunning. And a sealed emergency zone is, by its very nature, sealed; we cannot know what happens inside with certainty.\n"
"\n"
"One must wonder what effect the radiation from a nuclear meltdown might have had upon her."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​素来​以​狡诈​闻名​……​可以​说​是​十足​的​狡诈​。​而​所谓​封闭​的​紧急​区域​，​其本质​首先​是​封闭​的​。​我们​无法​确切​知晓​内部​发生​了​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​确实​好奇​核​熔毁​产生​的​辐射​会​对​她​造成​怎样​的​影响​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 su4lai2 yi3 jiao3zha4 wen2ming2……ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 shi2zu2 de5 jiao3zha4。er2 suo3wei4 feng1bi4 de5 jin3ji2 qu1yu4，qi2 ben3 zhi4 shou3xian1 shi4 feng1bi4 de5。wo3men5 wu2fa3 que4qie4 zhi1xiao3 nei4bu4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 que4shi2 hao4qi2 he2 rong2hui3 chan3sheng1 de5 fu2she4 hui4 dui4 ta1 zao4cheng2 zen3yang4 de5 ying3xiang3。"

msgid ""
"Dragons are no different from anyone else. There are those who take and "
"those who get taken. A dragon is just another taker."
msgstr ""
"龙族​和​其他​种族​并​无​不同​。​这​世上​有​掠夺者​，​也​有​被​掠夺者​。​巨龙​不过​是​一种​掠夺者​罢了​。\n"
"long2 zu2 he4 qi2ta1 zhong3zu2 bing4 wu2 bu4tong2。zhe4 shi4shang4 you3 lu:e4duo2zhe3，ye3 you3 bei4 lu:e4duo2zhe3。ju4long2 bu4guo4 shi4 yi1zhong3 lu:e4duo2zhe3 ba4le5。"

msgid ""
"Dragons aren't smallpox. If you drive them extinct, you'll be creating a "
"condition that has never existed for the whole of human history. There's no "
"telling what might happen as a result."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​不是​天花​。​如果​你​让​他们​灭绝​，​你​将​创造​一种​在​整个​人类​历史​上​从未​存在​过​的​状况​。​谁​也​说​不准​会​发生​什么​。\n"
"ju4long2 bu4shi4 tian1hua1。ru2guo3 ni3 rang4 ta1men5 mie4jue2，ni3 jiang1 chuang4zao4 yi1zhong3 zai4 zheng3ge4 ren2lei4 li4shi3 shang4 cong2wei4 cun2zai4 guo4 de5 zhuang4kuang4。shei2 ye3 shuo1 bu4zhun3 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。"

msgid "Dragons do not hope, little $(l.race). That gift is for you alone."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​不会​心存​希望​，​小​$(l.race)​。​那​是​你们​才​有​的​天赋​。\n"
"ju4long2 bu4hui4 xin1 cun2 xi1wang4，xiao3 $(l.race)。na4 shi4 ni3men5 cai2 you3 de5 tian1fu4。"

msgid "Dragonslayer Idol"
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​精魂​导师\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 jing1hun2 dao3shi1"

msgid "Dragonslayer's Favor 1"
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​之​恩典​I\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 zhi1 en1dian3 I"

msgid "Dragonslayer's Favor 2"
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​之​恩典​II\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 zhi1 en1dian3 II"

msgid "Dragonslayer's Shield"
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​之盾\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 zhi1 dun4"

msgid "Dragonslayer's Wrath"
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​之​怒\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 zhi1 nu4"

msgid "Dragonslayer: Incoming DMG -3"
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​：​受到​的​伤害​减少​3​点\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3：shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 3 dian3"

