msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​：​受到​的​伤害​减少​5​点\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3：shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 5 dian3"

msgid ""
"Dragons… dragons are *immortal.* Time means little to them. \n"
"\n"
"What they will, they will. And no power can truly stop them unless it is death itself.\n"
"\n"
"War, plague, famine, natural disaster… setbacks. Merely setbacks. Avarice eternal."
msgstr ""
"而​巨龙​呢​……​巨龙​是​*​不朽​*​的​。​时间​对​他们​毫无意义​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​会​予取予求​。​没有​什么​力量​能​阻止​他们​，​除了​死亡​本身​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​战争​、​瘟疫​、​饥荒​、​天灾​……​这些​不过​是​暂时性​的​挫折​。​仅此而已​。​只有​贪婪​是​永恒​的​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ju4long2 ni2……ju4long2 shi4*bu4xiu3*de5。shi2jian1 dui4 ta1men5 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 hui4 yu3 qu3 yu3 qiu2。mei2you3 shen2me5 li4liang5 neng2 zu3zhi3 ta1men5，chu2le5 si3wang2 ben3shen1。\n"
"\n"
"zhan4zheng1、wen1yi4、ji1huang1、tian1zai1……zhe4xie1 bu4guo4 shi4 zan4 shi2 xing4 de5 cuo4zhe2。jin3ci3er2yi3。zhi3you3 tan1lan2 shi4 yong3heng2 de5。"

msgid "Drained!"
msgstr ""
"流失​！\n"
"liu2shi1！"

msgid "Drek happens. People die. Life moves on."
msgstr ""
"世事​无常​。​人有​生死​祸福​。​生活​总​要​继续​。\n"
"shi4shi4 wu2chang2。ren2 you3 sheng1si3 huo4fu2。sheng1huo2 zong3 yao4 ji4xu4。"

msgid "Drek! What happened in there?"
msgstr ""
"该死​！​那里​发生​了​什么​事​？\n"
"gai1si3！na4li5 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"Drek, finally. I was worried that you wouldn't come back, either.\n"
"\n"
"So tell me. what happened. Everything go okay?"
msgstr ""
"老天​，​你​总算​回来​了​。​我​还​担心​你​也​要​一去不回​了​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​下面​怎么回事​？​一切​还好​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1，ni3 zong3suan4 hui2lai5 le5。wo3 hai2 dan1xin1 ni3 ye3 yao4 yi1qu4bu4hui2 le5 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 xia4mian4 zen3me5hui2shi4？yi1qie4 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid "Drek, they're back! Intruders!"
msgstr ""
"该死​，​他们​回来​了​！​入侵者​！\n"
"gai1si3，ta1men5 hui2lai5 le5！ru4qin1zhe3！"

msgid "Drek. Dante... why?"
msgstr ""
"妈​的​。​但丁​……​为什么​？\n"
"ma1 de5。dan4ding1……wei4shen2me5？"

msgid "Drek. Well, I'll ask around for its owner. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"该死​。​那​我​就​去​问问​谁​是​它​的​主人​吧​。​谢​了​。\n"
"gai1si3。na4 wo3 jiu4 qu4 wen4 wen4 shei2 shi4 ta1 de5 zhu3ren2 ba1。xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Drekheads blamed me for the death. The fool disobeyed orders and got killed,"
" but somehow they decided it was my fault."
msgstr ""
"那帮​傻​逼​把​错​全怪​在​我​头上​。​明明​是​那个​蠢货​自己​不​听​命令​送​了​小命​，​结果​他们​非说​是​我​的​问题​。\n"
"na4 bang1 sha3 bi1 ba3 cuo4 quan2 guai4 zai4 wo3 tou2shang4。ming2ming2 shi4 na4ge5 chun3huo4 zi4ji3 bu4 ting1 ming4ling4 song4 le5 xiao3 ming4，jie1guo3 ta1men5 fei1 shuo1 shi4 wo3 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid "Dressed one step above a street ganger. Grants +3 HP."
msgstr ""
"穿​得​只​比​街头​混混​稍微​好​一点​。​提供​+​3​生命​值​。\n"
"chuan1 de2 zhi3 bi3 jie1tou2 hun4 hun4 shao1wei1 hao3 yi1dian3。ti2gong1 +3 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "Dresser"
msgstr ""
"梳妆台\n"
"shu1zhuang1tai2"

msgid ""
"Drogenkippe. It'd be high up on anyone's list of places to avoid, but that's where you're headed... and you're going there alone this time. The last time that you saw Blitz, he was carting his portable terminal over to Cafe Cezve, presumably so that he could do his decking in the most comfortable environment possible.\n"
"\n"
"Like everything else related to Drogenkippe, the U-bahn train that services it is in poor repair. The car that you're riding in stinks like a chemical toilet on a hot day. On the floor near the doorway, you catch sight of a trampled lump of tattered fur; the longer you stare at it, the more convinced you become that you're looking at the remains of a long-dead squirrel.\n"
"\n"
"The train rumbles to a stop, and the doors slide open. Time to get this over with."
msgstr ""
"毒坑区​。​它​在​任何人​的​避​之​不及​清单​上​都​名列前茅​，​但​你​这次​就是​要​去​那里​……​而且​是​独自​前往​。​你​最后​一次​见到​布里​茨​时​，​他​正带​着​便携​终端​前往​“​来​一壶​”​咖啡馆​，​大概​是​要​在​最​舒适​的​环境​中​完成​他​的​骇入​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如同​毒坑区​的​一切​事物​，​在​该​地区​运行​的​地铁​也​破败​不堪​。​你​乘坐​的​车厢​散发​着​炎炎​酷暑​之下​化学​厕所​般的​恶臭​。​车门​附近​的​地板​上​，​你​瞥见​一团​被​踩踏​得​支离破碎​的​毛皮​；​多​看​一会儿​之后​，​你​愈发​确信​那​是​一只​早已​死去​的​松鼠​的​残骸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​列车​轰隆​停下​，​车门​缓缓​滑开​。​是​时候​结束​这​一切​了​。\n"
"\n"
"du2 keng1 qu1。ta1 zai4 ren4 he2 ren2 de5 bi4 zhi1 bu4ji2 qing1dan1 shang4 dou1 ming2lie4qian2mao2，dan4 ni3 zhe4 ci4 jiu4shi4 yao4 qu4 na4li5……er2qie3 shi4 du2zi4 qian2wang3。ni3 zui4hou4 yi1ci4 jian4dao4 Bu4li3ci2 shi2，ta1 zheng1 dai4 zhao2 bian4xie2 zhong1duan1 qian2wang3“lai2 yi1 hu2” ka1fei1guan3，da4gai4 shi4 yao4 zai4 zui4 shu1shi4 de5 huan2jing4 zhong4 wan2cheng2 ta1 de5 hai4 ru4 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2tong2 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 yi1qie4 shi4wu4，zai4 gai1 di4qu1 yun4xing2 de5 di4tie3 ye3 po4bai4 bu4kan1。ni3 cheng2zuo4 de5 che1xiang1 san4fa1 zhao2 yan2yan2 ku4shu3 zhi1xia4 hua4xue2 ce4suo3 ban1 de5 e4chou4。che1men2 fu4jin4 de5 di4ban3 shang4，ni3 pie1jian4 yi1 tuan2 bei4 cai3ta4 de2 zhi1li2po4sui4 de5 mao2pi2 ； duo1 kan4 yi1hui4r5 zhi1hou4，ni3 yu4fa1 que4xin4 na4 shi4 yi1 zhi3 zao3yi3 si3qu4 de5 song1shu3 de5 can2hai2。\n"
"\n"
"lie4che1 hong1long1 ting2xia4，che1men2 huan3huan3 hua2 kai1。shi4 shi2hou5 jie2shu4 zhe4 yi1qie4 le5。"

