"无人机​室门​无​警报\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 shi4 men2 wu2 jing3bao4"

msgid ""
"Drone Targeting Override: Engaged\n"
"Targeting Data: Accepted\n"
"Engaging New Target"
msgstr ""
"无人机​目标​覆盖​：​已​启动​\n"
"​目标​数据​：​已​接受​\n"
"​正在​锁定​新​目标\n"
"\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 mu4biao1 fu4gai4：yi3 qi3dong4 \n"
"mu4biao1 shu4ju4：yi3 jie1shou4 \n"
"zheng4zai4 suo3ding4 xin1 mu4biao1"

msgid "Drone control center."
msgstr ""
"无人机​控制中心​。\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 kong4 zhi4 zhong4 xin1。"

msgid "Drones"
msgstr ""
"无人机\n"
"wu2ren2ji1"

msgid "Drop the attitude, or you can roll into this meeting without me."
msgstr ""
"再用​那种​语气​跟​我​说话​，​你​就​自己​去​接头​吧​。\n"
"zai4 yong4 na4zhong3 yu3qi4 gen1 wo3 shuo1hua4，ni3 jiu4 zi4ji3 qu4 jie1tou2 ba1。"

msgid "Drug Formula (Jazz)"
msgstr ""
"药物​配方​（​捷势​）\n"
"yao4wu4 pei4fang1 （jie2 shi4）"

msgid ""
"Drugs, guns, the usual. Seems like more drugs than guns lately, so maybe "
"things will pick up around here!"
msgstr ""
"就是​毒品​啊​枪支​啊​什么​的​。​最近​毒品​似乎​比​枪支​多​，​所以​也许​这里​的​情况​会​有所​好转​！\n"
"jiu4shi4 du2pin3 a1 qiang1zhi1 a1 shen2me5 de5。zui4jin4 du2pin3 si4hu1 bi3 qiang1zhi1 duo1，suo3yi3 ye3xu3 zhe4li3 de5 qing2kuang4 hui4 you3suo3 hao3zhuan3！"

msgid "Drugs. I need some combat stims."
msgstr ""
"药物​。​我​需要​一些​战斗​兴奋剂​。\n"
"yao4wu4。wo3 xu1yao4 yi1xie1 zhan4dou4 xing1fen4ji4。"

msgid ""
"Dude, chill! Forget I asked.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns to you with a shrug.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry I couldn't get you anything else, but thanks for being a pal."
msgstr ""
"淡定​，​伙计​！​当​我​没​说​过行​了​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转向​你​，​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​我​没法​请​你​了​，​不过​还是​谢谢​你​陪​我​聊天​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding4，huo3ji5！dang1 wo3 mei2 shuo1 guo4 xing2 le5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 wo3 mei2fa3 qing3 ni3 le5，bu4guo4 hai2shi5 xie4xie5 ni3 pei2 wo3 liao2tian1。"

msgid ""
"Due to the powdered sugar and glitter, though, I would imagine that you're "
"getting less Cram than you would from a pure, uncut source."
msgstr ""
"不过​，​由于​添加​了​糖粉​和​闪粉​，​其中​含有​的​“​超感​”​成分​应该​会​比纯​货要​少​一些​。\n"
"bu4guo4，you2yu2 tian1jia1 le5 tang2fen3 he4 shan3 fen3，qi2zhong1 han2you3 de5“chao1 gan3” cheng2fen4 ying1gai1 hui4 bi3 chun2 huo4 yao4 shao3 yi1xie1。"

msgid ""
"Duerr studies your face for a moment.\n"
"\n"
"A slow smile spreads across his lips, and he nods."
msgstr ""
"杜尔​对​着​你​的​脸​端详​了​片刻​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​脸上​慢慢​浮出​一抹​微笑​，​然后​点点头​。\n"
"\n"
"du4 er3 dui4 zhao2 ni3 de5 lian3 duan1xiang2 le5 pian4ke4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 man4man4 fu2chu1 yi1 ma1 wei1xiao4，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。"

msgid ""
"Duerr's group, you mean?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sure, I've done a few jobs for them. They pay well. The whole \"ominous secret organization\" thing they try to keep going is a little weird, but whatever - money is money, and they've got it."
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​杜尔​的​那个​组织​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​给​他们​干过​几单​差事​。​挺​大方​的​。​他们​搞​那​什么​“​不祥​秘密组织​”​的​玩意儿​是​有点​唬人​，​但管​他​呢​，​我​只要​钱​，​而​他们​能​给​我​钱​，​这​就​够​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 du4 er3 de5 na4ge5 zu3zhi1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 gei3 ta1men5 gan4 guo4 ji1 dan1 cha4shi4。ting3 da4fang1 de5。ta1men5 gao3 na4 shen2me5“bu4xiang2 bi4 mi4 zu3 zhi1” de5 wan2yi4r5 shi4 you3dian3 hu3ren2，dan4 guan3 ta1 ni2，wo3 zhi3yao4 qian2，er2 ta1men5 neng2 gei3 wo3 qian2，zhe4 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Duerr's group, you mean?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She tips back her glass and swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sure, I've done a few jobs for them. They pay well. The whole \"ominous secret organization\" thing they try to keep going is a little weird, but whatever - money is money, and they've got it."
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​杜尔​的​那个​组织​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​端​起​酒杯​，​喝​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​给​他们​干过​几单​差事​。​挺​大方​的​。​他们​搞​那​什么​“​不祥​秘密组织​”​的​玩意儿​是​有点​唬人​，​但管​他​呢​，​我​只要​钱​，​而​他们​能​给​我​钱​，​这​就​够​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 du4 er3 de5 na4ge5 zu3zhi1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 duan1 qi3 jiu3bei1，he4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 gei3 ta1men5 gan4 guo4 ji1 dan1 cha4shi4。ting3 da4fang1 de5。ta1men5 gao3 na4 shen2me5“bu4xiang2 bi4 mi4 zu3 zhi1” de5 wan2yi4r5 shi4 you3dian3 hu3ren2，dan4 guan3 ta1 ni2，wo3 zhi3yao4 qian2，er2 ta1men5 neng2 gei3 wo3 qian2，zhe4 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

