msgid ""
"During World War II, many unfinished tunnels and stations along the U8 line were converted into air raid shelters, including parts of Gesundbrunnen Station. In the decades following the war, the station also served as an emergency fallout shelter in the event of a nuclear attack. \n"
"\n"
"During the Cold War, the U8 line continued to run between Neukölln and Gesundbrunnen, taking it under the wall and through parts of East Berlin. The train would skip all East Berlin stations until it emerged on the far side, near Gesundbrunnen."
msgstr ""
"二战​期间​，​U8​线路​沿线​许多​未​完工​的​隧道​和​车站​都​被​改建​成​了​防空洞​，​其中​包括​健康​泉​车站​的​部分​区域​。​在​战后​的​几十年​里​，​该​车站​还​被​用作​核​袭击​时​的​紧急​庇护所​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷战​期间​，​U8​线路​继续​在​新​科隆​和​健康​泉​之间​运行​，​穿过​柏林墙​和​东柏林​的​部分​地区​。​列车​将​跳​过​所有​的​东柏林​车站​，​直至​抵达​远处​的​健康​泉​附近​。\n"
"\n"
"er4zhan4 qi1jian1，U8 xian4lu4 yan2xian4 xu3duo1 wei4 wan2gong1 de5 sui4dao4 he4 che1zhan4 dou1 bei4 gai3jian4 cheng2 le5 fang2kong1dong4，qi2zhong1 bao1kuo4 jian4kang1 quan2 che1zhan4 de5 bu4fen5 qu1yu4。zai4 zhan4hou4 de5 ji1 shi2 nian2 li3，gai1 che1zhan4 hai2 bei4 yong4zuo4 he2 xi2ji1 shi2 de5 jin3ji2 bi4hu4suo3。\n"
"\n"
"leng3zhan4 qi1jian1，U8 xian4lu4 ji4xu4 zai4 xin1 ke1long2 he4 jian4kang1 quan2 zhi1jian1 yun4xing2，chuan1guo4 bo2lin2qiang2 he4 dong1 bai3 lin2 de5 bu4fen5 di4qu1。lie4che1 jiang1 tiao4 guo4 suo3you3 de5 dong1 bai3 lin2 che1zhan4，zhi2zhi4 di3da2 yuan3chu4 de5 jian4kang1 quan2 fu4jin4。"

msgid ""
"During the attack on the Kreuzbasar... they broke through the door, heavily armed. Two of them. They broke through the door and just started shooting. \n"
"\n"
"No questions. No robbery. Just… shooting. Kami… my girl… my little street rat… they…\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He holds his hands over his face. Collects himself.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​遭到​袭击​时​……​那些​全副武装​的​暴徒​闯​了​进来​。​一共​两个​人​。​他们​进来​之后​就​开始​胡乱​开枪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​没​开口​说话​，​也​不​抢​东西​，​就是​……​疯狂​扫射​。​卡米​……​我家​姑娘​……​我​的​小​特工​……​那些​混蛋​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​双手​掩面​，​试图​让​自己​镇定​下来​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zao1dao4 xi2ji1 shi2……na4xie1 quan2fu4wu3zhuang1 de5 bao4tu2 chuang3 le5 jin4lai2。yi1gong4 liang3 ge4 ren2。ta1men5 jin4lai2 zhi1hou4 jiu4 kai1shi3 hu2luan4 kai1qiang1。\n"
