msgid ""
"Dwarves are the shortest of the metahuman races. To compensate, their torsos and shoulders are wider than their size would indicate. Thus their strength is equal to, and sometimes greater than, the larger races.  A side effect of their metahuman nature is increased resistance to pathogens and magic that attacks from within.\n"
