"艾格尔​重重​叹​了​口气​，​但​什么​也​没​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​转身​背对​你​，​开始​检查​装备​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 chong2chong2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，dan4 shen2me5 ye3 mei2 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhuan3shen1 bei4dui4 ni3，kai1shi3 jian3cha2 zhuang1bei4。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gains a customized Ranger Arms SM-3. DMG: 20, CAP: 6, Armor Piercing: "
"2."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​获得​一把​定制​版​游骑兵​军械​SM​-​3​狙击步枪​。​伤害​：​20​，​弹​容量​：​6​，​护甲​穿透​：​2​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 huo4de2 yi1 ba3 ding4zhi4 ban3 you2 ji4 bing1 jun1 xie4 SM-3 ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1。shang1hai4：20，dan4 rong2liang4：6，hu4jia3 chuan1tou4：2。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gains a shotgun ability that imbalances targets, making them easier to"
" hit on subsequent attacks. Cost: 1 AP. Cooldown: 2."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​获得​一项​霰弹枪​能力​，​能够​使​目标​失衡​，​让​后续​攻击​更​容易​命中​。​花费​：​1​点​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​2​回合​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 xian4dan4qiang1 neng2li4，neng2gou4 shi3 mu4biao1 shi1heng2，rang4 hou4xu4 gong1ji1 geng1 rong2yi4 ming4zhong4。hua1fei4：1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gains a shotgun ability that sets targets on fire, and strips 1 Armor."
" Ongoing DMG: 4 Cost: 1 AP. Cooldown: 3."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​获得​一项​霰弹枪​能力​，​能够​点燃​目标​并​剥离​其​1​点护甲值​。​持续​伤害​：​4​。​花费​：​1​点​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​3​回合​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 xian4dan4qiang1 neng2li4，neng2gou4 dian3ran2 mu4biao1 bing4 bo1li2 qi2 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。chi2xu4 shang1hai4：4。hua1fei4：1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gains a sniper rifle ability that increases accuracy by 35% for one "
"shot. Cost: 2 AP. Cooldown: 3."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​获得​一项​狙击步枪​能力​，​可​使​精准度​提高​35​%​，​仅限​一次​射击​。​花费​：​2​点​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​3​回合​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1 neng2li4，ke3 shi3 jing1 zhun3 du4 ti2gao1 35 %，jin3 xian4 yi1ci4 she4ji1。hua1fei4：2 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gains a sniper rifle ability. Fires a discarding-sabot HTI round that "
"ignores armor completely. Cost: 2 AP. Cooldown: 5."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​获得​一项​狙击步枪​能力​。​发射​一枚​完全​无视​护甲​的​HTI​（​硬​目标​拦截​）​脱壳​穿甲弹​。​花费​：​2​点​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​5​回合​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1 neng2li4。fa1she4 yi1 mei2 wan2quan2 wu2shi4 hu4jia3 de5 HTI （ying4 mu4biao1 lan2jie2） tuo1ke2 chuan1 jia3 dan4。hua1fei4：2 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：5 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gains an ability that can target two enemies in one action. Cost: 1 "
"AP. Cooldown: 3."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​获得​一项​能力​，​使​她​可以​在​一次​行动​中​同时​攻击​两个​敌人​。​花费​：​1​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​3​回合​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 neng2li4，shi3 ta1 ke3yi3 zai4 yi1ci4 xing2dong4 zhong4 tong2shi2 gong1ji1 liang3 ge4 di2ren2。hua1fei4：1 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gains an ability that reloads all of her equipped weapons for 0 AP. "
"Cooldown: 7."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​获得​一项​能力​，​可以​在​不​花费​行动​点​的​情况​下​重新​装填​装备​的​所有​武器​。​冷却​时间​：​7​回合​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 neng2li4，ke3yi3 zai4 bu4 hua1fei4 xing2dong4 dian3 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 chong2xin1 zhuang1tian2 zhuang1bei4 de5 suo3you3 wu3qi4。leng3que4 shi2jian1：7 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gives you a significant glance.\n"
"\n"
"You can see the disgust in her eyes."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​意味深长​地瞥​了​你​一眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​看出​她​眼中​的​憎恶​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 yi4wei4shen1chang2 de5 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 zeng1e4。"

msgid ""
"Eiger gives you a small nod. Her hand falls away from the the stock of her "
"shotgun."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​对​你​点点头​，​手​从​霰弹枪​的​枪托​上放​了​下来​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 dui4 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2，shou3 cong2 xian4dan4qiang1 de5 qiang1tuo1 shang4 fang4 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid "Eiger holds her silence, but concedes the point with a small nod."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​保持沉默​，​但​还是​微微​点头​表示同意​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 bao3 chi2 chen2 mo4，dan4 hai2shi5 wei1wei1 dian3tou2 biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。"

msgid ""
"Eiger holds her tongue, but her body language speaks volumes: tight lips, rigid pose, slight color in her pale cheeks.\n"
"\n"
"You've seen it before. She's furious."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​没有​说话​，​但​她​的​肢体​语言​已经​说明​了​一切​：​紧​抿​的​嘴唇​，​僵硬​的​姿势​，​苍白​脸颊​泛起​微红​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​之前​也​见​过​她​这样​。​她​正​处于​勃然大怒​中​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 mei2you3 shuo1hua4，dan4 ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 yi3jing1 shuo1ming2 le5 yi1qie4：jin3 min3 de5 zui3chun2，jiang1ying4 de5 zi1shi4，cang1bai2 lian3jia2 fan4qi3 wei1 hong2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 ye3 jian4 guo4 ta1 zhe4yang4。ta1 zheng1 chu3yu2 bo2ran2da4nu4 zhong4。"

msgid "Eiger is right. This charade has gone on long enough."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​是​对​的​。​这场​闹剧​该​结束​了​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 shi4 dui4 de5。zhe4 chang2 nao4ju4 gai1 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Eiger leans in and grabs the Engineer's head with her left hand, then pries his chipjack open with her right. She slaps the chip into the jack, then clicks it shut.\n"
"\n"
"Seconds pass. Nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​向前​俯身​，​用​左手​抓住​工程师​的​脑袋​，​然后​用​右手​撬开​他​的​芯片​插口​。​她​把​芯片​塞​了​进去​，​然后​关上​插口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​过去​了​。​什么​都​没​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 xiang4qian2 fu3shen1，yong4 zuo3shou3 zhua1zhu4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 nao3dai5，ran2hou4 yong4 you4shou3 qiao4kai1 ta1 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3。ta1 ba3 xin1pian4 se4 le5 jin4qu4，ran2hou4 guan1shang4 cha1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 guo4qu4 le5。shen2me5 dou1 mei2 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Eiger leans in toward the Engineer. He recoils, grinding the back of his "
"head against the grease-stained duraplast tiles."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔向​工程师​凑近​。​他​向​后​退缩​着​，​后脑勺​在​沾满​机油​的​硬化​塑料​砖上​摩擦​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 xiang4 gong1cheng2shi1 cou4jin4。ta1 xiang4 hou4 tui4suo1 zhao2，hou4nao3shao2 zai4 zhan1man3 ji1you2 de5 ying4hua4 su4liao4 zhuan1 shang4 mo2ca1。"

msgid ""
"Eiger looks down at the mangled corpse of the dog-thing that just attacked you. The body smolders on the ground.\n"
"\n"
"Despite its monstrous appearance, you can recognize the creature for what it used to be.\n"
"\n"
"Monika's old dog. Dante."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​低头​看着​刚刚​攻击​了​你​、​现在​已经​面目全非​的​狗​形​尸体​。​它​的​残骸​在​地上​冒​着​白烟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​外表​狰狞​可怖​，​但​你​还是​认出​了​它​曾经​的​模样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​是​莫妮卡​的​狗​。​但丁​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 di1tou2 kan4 zhao2 gang1gang5 gong1ji1 le5 ni3、xian4zai4 yi3jing1 mian4mu4quan2fei1 de5 gou3 xing2 shi1ti3。ta1 de5 can2hai2 zai4 di4shang5 mao4 zhao2 bai2 yan1。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 wai4biao3 zheng1ning2 ke3 bu4，dan4 ni3 hai2shi5 ren4chu1 le5 ta1 ceng2jing1 de5 mu2yang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 gou3。dan4ding1。"

msgid ""
"Eiger looks from Dietrich, to Glory, to Amsel. Finally, down at Dante. Then "
"she sighs."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​的​目光​从迪​特里​希​转向​格洛丽​，​再​到​阿姆​泽尔​。​最后​，​她​低头​看​向​但丁​，​叹​了​口气​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 de5 mu4guang1 cong2 Di2te4li3xi1 zhuan3xiang4 Ge2luo4li2，zai4 dao4 E1mu3ze2er3。zui4hou4，ta1 di1tou2 kan4 xiang4 dan4ding1，tan4 le5 kou3qi4。"

msgid ""
"Eiger might serve in a time of conflict, but she was not made for peace."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​或许​能​在​战时​服役​，​但​她​生来​就​不​适合​活在​和平​年代​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 huo4xu3 neng2 zai4 zhan4shi2 fu2yi4，dan4 ta1 sheng1lai2 jiu4 bu4 shi4he2 huo2 zai4 he2ping2 nian2dai4。"

msgid ""
"Eiger nods, then turns to check her equipment. The rest of the group "
"disperses in turn."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​点点头​，​转身​检查​她​的​装备​。​其余​队员​也​陆续​离开​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2，zhuan3shen1 jian3cha2 ta1 de5 zhuang1bei4。qi2yu2 dui4yuan2 ye3 lu4xu4 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"Eiger now carries a Cavalier Frag Grenade on each mission instead of a "
"Fichetti Frag Grenade, which does +4 HP DMG."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​艾格尔​在​每次​任务​中将​携带​骑​将​破片​手榴弹​，​而​不是​菲切​蒂​破片​手榴弹​，​手榴弹​造成​的​生命​值​伤害​增加​4​点​。\n"
"xian4zai4，Ai4ge2er3 zai4 mei3ci4 ren4wu5 zhong1jiang4 xie2dai4 ji4 jiang1 po4pian4 shou3liu2dan4，er2 bu4shi4 fei1 qie1 di4 po4pian4 shou3liu2dan4，shou3liu2dan4 zao4cheng2 de5 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 zeng1jia1 4 dian3。"

msgid ""
"Eiger now carries a Knight Errant Flashbang grenade on each mission, which "
"does 2 AP DMG and makes affected targets easier to hit."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​现在​在​每次​任务​中​都​将​携带​一枚​游侠​骑士​闪光弹​，​该​闪光弹​可​造成​2​点​行动​力​损伤​，​并​使​受​影响​的​敌人​更​容易​被​命中​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 xian4zai4 zai4 mei3ci4 ren4wu5 zhong4 dou1 jiang1 xie2dai4 yi1 mei2 you2Xia2qi2shi4 shan3guang1dan4，gai1 shan3guang1dan4 ke3 zao4cheng2 2 dian3 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1，bing4 shi3 shou4 ying3xiang3 de5 di2ren2 geng1 rong2yi4 bei4 ming4zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Eiger reaches in and pulls out a cylindrical object about the size of a beer can.\n"
"\n"
"She inspects it, and a smile creeps across her face."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​伸手​进去​，​掏出​一个​大约​啤酒罐​大小​的​圆柱形​物体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​仔细​查看​，​脸上​浮现​出​一丝​微笑​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 shen1shou3 jin4qu4，tao1chu1 yi1ge5 da4yue1 pi2 jiu3 guan4 da4xiao3 de5 yuan2zhu4xing2 wu4ti3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zi3xi4 cha2kan4，lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 si1 wei1xiao4。"

msgid "Eiger says nothing, but her eyes narrow."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​一言不发​，​但​她​的​眼睛​眯​了​起来​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 yi1yan2bu4fa1，dan4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 mi2 le5 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"Eiger shoulder-checks the door, and the crack of splintering plastic fills your ears.\n"
"\n"
"The door pops open."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔用​肩膀​抵住​门​，​塑料​碎裂​的​咔嚓​声​在​耳边​响起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门​应声​而开​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 yong4 jian1bang3 di3zhu4 men2，su4liao4 sui4lie4 de5 ka1cha1 sheng1 zai4 er3 bian1 xiang3qi3。\n"
"\n"
"men2 ying4sheng1 er2 kai1。"

msgid ""
"Eiger shoulder-checks the wall, and the weak wood slats give way with a "
"crunch."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔用​肩膀​撞​了​一下​墙​，​本​就​不​牢固​的​木板​条​发出​嘎吱​一声​，​轰然​倒塌​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 yong4 jian1bang3 zhuang4 le5 yi1xia4 qiang2，ben3 jiu4 bu4 lao2gu4 de5 mu4ban3 tiao2 fa1chu1 ga1zhi1 yi1sheng1，hong1ran2 dao3ta1。"

msgid "Eiger snorts a laugh. Then she’s back to business."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​哈哈​一笑​，​然后​重新​聊回​正题​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 ha1ha1 yi1 xiao4，ran2hou4 chong2xin1 liao2 hui2 zheng1 ti2。"

msgid ""
"Eiger stares at him, her expression flat.\n"
"\n"
"The Engineer sneers."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​凝视着​他​，​脸上​毫无​表情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​工程师​冷​哼​一声​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ta1，lian3 shang4 hao2wu2 biao3qing2。\n"
"\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。"

msgid "Eiger! Are you all right?"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​！​你​还好​吗​？\n"
"Ai4ge2er3！ni3 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid "Eiger! I gave you an order!"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​！​你​敢​违抗命令​！\n"
"Ai4ge2er3！ni3 gan3 wei2 kang4 ming4 ling3！"

msgid "Eiger's Leather Jacket"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​的​皮夹克\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 de5 pi2 jia1 ke4"

msgid ""
"Eiger's right, Monika. We should have a second in command... just in case."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​说​得​没错​，​莫妮卡​。​我们​是​该​有​个​二把手​……​以防万一​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4，Mo4ni1ka3。wo3men5 shi4 gai1 you3 ge4 er4ba3shou3……yi3fang2wan4yi1。"

msgid "Eiger, I don't--"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​我​不​—​—\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，wo3 bu4 — —"

msgid "Eiger, refresh my memory... what's a BTL?"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​和​我​说​说​……​BTL​是​什么​？\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1……BTL shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Eiger, why don't you tell the doc how we feel about being trapped?"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​不如​你​来​告诉​博士​我们​被困​在​这里​的​感觉​吧​？\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，bu4ru2 ni3 lai2 gao4su4 bo2shi4 wo3men5 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 gan3jue2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Eiger.\n"
"\n"
"What to say about Eiger? She's smart, she's strong, and she's one hell of a soldier. In a close-up fight, I've seen her take apart an entire security team with her shotgun, and she's even more dangerous at range. It's a handy thing, having a trained sniper on the team.\n"
"\n"
"All in all, we enjoy one hell of an advantage thanks to her."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​怎么​形容​艾格尔​呢​？​她​聪明​且​强悍​，​是​顶尖​的​战士​。​近距离​作战​时​，​我​亲眼​见​她​用​霰弹枪​放​倒​整支​安保​小队​；​而​在​远距离​作战​时​，​她​更加​危险​—​—​队里​有个​训练有素​的​狙击手​，​实在​方便​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总而言之​，​有​她​在​，​我们​总能​占上风​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 zen3me5 xing2rong2 Ai4ge2er3 ni2？ta1 cong1ming5 qie3 qiang2han4，shi4 ding3jian1 de5 zhan4shi4。jin4ju4li2 zuo4zhan4 shi2，wo3 qin1yan3 jian4 ta1 yong4 xian4dan4qiang1 fang4 dao3 zheng3 zhi1 an1bao3 xiao3 dui4 ； er2 zai4 yuan3ju4li2 zuo4zhan4 shi2，ta1 geng4jia1 wei1xian3——dui4 li3 you3 ge4 xun4 lian4 you3 su4 de5 ju1ji1shou3，shi2zai4 fang1bian4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，you3 ta1 zai4，wo3men5 zong3neng2 zhan4shang4feng1。"

msgid ""
"Eiger.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Monika's tone is all business. Evidently, she has heard enough.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The decision’s made. You have your answer."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​语调​变得​严肃​起来​。​她​显然​是​听够​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​你​要​我​给​个​说法​，​现在​你​得偿​所愿​了​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yu3diao4 bian4de5 yan2su4 qi3lai5。ta1 xian3ran2 shi4 ting1 gou4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3 yao4 wo3 gei3 ge4 shuo1fa3，xian4zai4 ni3 de2 chang2 suo3yuan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Eiger. I thought that we were past this. You said that you don't blame me "
"for Monika's death."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​这​一页​不是​揭​过去​了​吗​？​你​说​过​不会​再​把​莫妮卡​的​死​归咎于​我​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，zhe4 yi1 xie2 bu4shi4 jie1 guo4qu4 le5 ma5？ni3 shuo1 guo4 bu4hui4 zai4 ba3 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 gui1 jiu4 yu2 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Eiger. It's okay. I just wanted to give you the opportunity to tell your "
"side of the story."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​，​艾格尔​。​我​只是​想​给你个​机会​，​从​你​的​角度​讲述​这个​故事​。\n"
