"恩施​塔德​走进​了​自动​手术​机器人​所在​的​房间​。​在​血迹斑斑​的​手术台​下​翻找​片刻​后​，​他​掏出​了​一部​PDA​，​以及​一台​造型​凶悍​的​设备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​透过​玻璃窗​朝​你​笑笑​。\n"
"\n"
"en1Shi1ta3de2 zou3jin4 le5 zi4dong4 shou3shu4 ji1qi4ren2 suo3zai4 de5 fang2jian1。zai4 xue4ji4ban1ban1 de5 shou3shu4tai2 xia4 fan1 zhao3 pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 tao1chu1 le5 yi1 bu4 PDA，yi3ji2 yi1 tai2 zao4xing2 xiong1han4 de5 she4bei4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tou4guo4 bo1 li2 chuang1 chao2 ni3 xiao4 xiao4。"

