"​任务​完成​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1Shi1ta3de2 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ren4wu5 wan2cheng2 le5。"

msgid ""
