msgid ""
"Etiquette is about knowing how to behave in various social situations. The "
"right etiquette can give you an edge in certain conversations. Choose an "
"Etiquette from the list below. Choosing an Etiquette does not cost karma, "
"and each Etiquette can only be chosen once."
msgstr ""
"礼仪​关乎​在​各种​社交​场合​中​如何​得体​行事​。​恰当​的​礼仪​能​在​特定​对话​中为​你​赢得​优势​。​请​从​下方​列表​中​选择​一项​礼仪​。​选择​礼仪​无需​消耗​业力​，​且​每项​礼仪​仅​可​选择​一次​。\n"
"li3yi2 guan1hu1 zai4 ge4zhong3 she4jiao1 chang3he2 zhong4 ru2he2 de2ti3 xing2shi4。qia4dang4 de5 li3yi2 neng2 zai4 te4ding4 dui4hua4 zhong4 wei2 ni3 ying2de2 you1shi4。qing3 cong2 xia4fang1 lie4biao3 zhong4 xuan3ze2 yi1 xiang4 li3yi2。xuan3ze2 li3yi2 wu2xu1 xiao1hao4 ye4li4，qie3 mei3 xiang4 li3yi2 jin3 ke3 xuan3ze2 yi1ci4。"

msgid "Evasion"
msgstr ""
"闪避\n"
"shan3bi4"

msgid ""
"Even if he was telling the truth, that doesn't invalidate what your unit was"
" doing over there."
msgstr ""
"即使​他​说​的​是​真的​，​也​不能​抹除​你​的​小队​做过​的​事​。\n"
"ji2shi3 ta1 shuo1 de5 shi4 zhen1de5，ye3 bu4neng2 ma1 chu2 ni3 de5 xiao3 dui4 zuo4 guo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Even if it were, I wouldn’t take it. I’m not running from this.\n"
"\n"
"Not after what they did here tonight."
msgstr ""
"就算​有​得​选​，​我​也​不会​接受​的​。​我​不会​逃避​这​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尤其​是​在​他们​今晚​于​此处​的​暴行​之后​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4suan4 you3 de2 xuan3，wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 jie1shou4 de5。wo3 bu4hui4 tao2bi4 zhe4 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"you2qi2 shi4 zai4 ta1men5 jin1wan3 yu2 ci3chu4 de5 bao4xing2 zhi1hou4。"

msgid ""
"Even if you succeed at this, eliminating dragons will create a dangerous "
"power vacuum. "
msgstr ""
"就算​你​能​成功​的话​，​消灭​巨龙​也​会​带来​危险​的​权力​真空​。\n"
"jiu4suan4 ni3 neng2 cheng2gong1 de5hua4，xiao1mie4 ju4long2 ye3 hui4 dai4lai2 wei1xian3 de5 quan2li4 zhen1kong1。"

msgid ""
"Even if... even *if* we'd consider going off-mission... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shoots you a significant glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Which we *wouldn't*..."
msgstr ""
"就算​……​*​就算​*​我们​会​考虑​擅自作主​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​意味深长​地​看​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​当然​我们​*​并​不会​*​……\n"
"\n"
"jiu4suan4……*jiu4suan4*wo3men5 hui4 kao3lu:4 shan4 zi4 zuo4 zhu3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi4wei4shen1chang2 de5 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……dang1ran2 wo3men5*bing4 bu4hui4*……"

msgid "Even so, I should have made a proper introduction before."
msgstr ""
"即便如此​，​我​之前​也​应该​好好​介绍​下​自己​的​。\n"
"ji2 bian4 ru2 ci3，wo3 zhi1qian2 ye3 ying1gai1 hao3hao3 jie4shao4 xia4 zi4ji3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Eventually, the Firewing was brought down by a man named Dr. Adrian Vauclair. Well - with the help of the Luftwaffe, of course. But it was experimental weapons designed by Dr. Vauclair that finally pierced her hide.\n"
"\n"
"She fell in a hail of bullets and rocket fire, and crashed down in the radioactive wasteland of the SOX."
msgstr ""
"最终​，​火翼​被​一位​名叫​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​的​人​击落​。​当然​，​这​离不开​德国​空军​的​协助​。​但​真正​刺穿​她​鳞甲​的​，​正是​沃​克莱尔​博士​设计​的​实验性​武器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​在​枪林弹雨​中​坠落​下来​，​一头​栽进​了​萨洛​卢区​那片​被​辐射​污染​的​荒地​。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，Huo3yi4 bei4 yi1 wei4 ming2jiao4 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 de5 ren2 ji1luo4。dang1ran2，zhe4 li2bu5kai1 de2guo2 kong1jun1 de5 xie2zhu4。dan4 zhen1zheng4 ci4chuan1 ta1 lin2jia3 de5，zheng4shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 she4ji4 de5 shi2 yan4 xing4 wu3qi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 qiang1 lin2 dan4 yu3 zhong4 zhui4luo4 xia4lai5，yi1tou2 zai1 jin4 le5 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 na4 pian1 bei4 fu2she4 wu1ran3 de5 huang1di4。"

msgid ""
"Eventually, the trembling in your limbs begins to subside, taking the pain along with it.\n"
"\n"
"Glory releases you and steps back."
msgstr ""
"最终​，​你​四肢​的​颤抖​开始​平息​，​疼痛​也​随之​消退​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​松开​你​，​退后​一步​。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ni3 si4zhi1 de5 chan4dou3 kai1shi3 ping2xi1，teng2tong4 ye3 sui2zhi1 xiao1tui4。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 song1kai1 ni3，tui4hou4 yi1 bu4。"

msgid ""
"Eventually, you find a batch of lab keycards coated with a vile liquid, but "
"they've been snapped in half."
msgstr ""
"最终​，​你​在​一层​恶心​的​液体​包裹​之中​发现​了​一批​实验室​门禁卡​，​只是​都​被​折断​成​了​两半​。\n"
"zui4zhong1，ni3 zai4 yi1ceng2 e3xin1 de5 ye4ti3 bao1guo3 zhi1zhong1 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 pi1 shi2yan4shi4 men2 jin1 ka3，zhi3shi4 dou1 bei4 zhe2duan4 cheng2 le5 liang3 ban4。"

msgid ""
"Every client I've ever worked for has kept secrets. I don't see how this is "
"any different."
msgstr ""
"我​服务​过​的​客户​都​有着​自己​的​秘密​。​我​想​这次​也​没什么​不同​。\n"
"wo3 fu2wu4 guo4 de5 ke4hu4 dou1 you3zhe5 zi4ji3 de5 mi4mi4。wo3 xiang3 zhe4 ci4 ye3 mei2shen2me5 bu4tong2。"

msgid "Every day is a fine da-"
msgstr ""
"每天​都​是​—​—\n"
"mei3tian1 dou1 shi4 — —"

msgid ""
"Every time I do this, it winds up feeling like a waste of time. But I keep doing it anyway, on the off-chance that I'll find something important.\n"
"\n"
"If I stumble into the clue that leads me to my brother, I know that I'm gonna want it on film. I've been doing this for almost twenty years now, after all.\n"
"\n"
"No sense in quitting now."
msgstr ""
"每次​这样​做​，​我​都​觉得​是​在​浪费时间​。​但​我​还是​坚持​做​下去​，​万一​能​找到​什么​重要​线索​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我​偶然​发现​了​找到​我​哥哥​的​线索​，​我​知道​我​一定​要​把​它​拍下来​。​毕竟​我​已经​这样​做​了​快​二十年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​必要​现在​放弃​。\n"
"\n"
"mei3ci4 zhe4yang4 zuo4，wo3 dou1 jue2de5 shi4 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 jian1chi2 zuo4 xia4qu4，wan4yi1 neng2 zhao3dao4 shen2me5 zhong4yao4 xian4suo3 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 ou3ran2 fa1xian4 le5 zhao3dao4 wo3 ge1ge5 de5 xian4suo3，wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3 yi1ding4 yao4 ba3 ta1 pai1 xia4 lai2。bi4jing4 wo3 yi3jing1 zhe4yang4 zuo4 le5 kuai4 er4 shi2 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 bi4yao4 xian4zai4 fang4qi4。"

msgid "Everybody STAND DOWN!"
msgstr ""
"所有人​都​退下​！\n"
"suo3you3ren2 dou1 tui4xia4！"

msgid "Everyone but Eiger."
msgstr ""
"除了​艾格尔​之外​的​所有人​都​在​。\n"
"chu2le5 Ai4ge2er3 zhi1wai4 de5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 zai4。"

msgid ""
"Everyone in this room knows what went down here. He lied to us, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"There was no \"bad intel.\" He brought security down on his own team when he chose to murder these people."
msgstr ""
"这​间​屋子里​的​所有人​都​已经​听​明白​了​。​他​对​我们​撒谎​了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根本​没有​什么​“​错误​情报​”​。​正是​由于​他​滥杀无辜​，​才​把​安保​人员​引向​了​自己​的​队伍​。\n"
"\n"
