msgstr ""
"说​得​有​道理​。​我们​就​按计划​行事​，​先​救出​那些​教徒​。​那​你​打算​如何​处理​此事​？\n"
"shuo1 de2 you3 dao4li5。wo3men5 jiu4 an4 ji4 hua2 xing2shi4，xian1 jiu4chu1 na4xie1 jiao4tu2。na4 ni3 da3suan4 ru2he2 chu3li3 ci3shi4？"

msgid ""
"Fair point, boss. All right, I'll tell you.\n"
"\n"
"The band was called \"MESSERKAMPF!\" Spelled just like it sounds, in big capital letters with an exclamation point.\n"
"\n"
"We weren't a big act, or anything... we sold a few records here an' there, toured around Europe. Same story you'll hear from a bunch of other washed-up old relics, I'm sure."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​老大​。​好​吧​，​我​告诉​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​乐队​叫做​“​MESSERKAMPF​！​”​按着​读音​拼​，​全​大写​，​后面​跟着​个​感叹号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​也​不是​太火​……​有​卖​一些​唱片​，​在​欧洲​巡演​。​就是​这么​个​老掉牙​的​故事​，​我敢​说​你​肯定​都​听厌​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，lao3da4。hao3 ba1，wo3 gao4su4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 yue4dui4 jiao4zuo4“MESSERKAMPF！” an4 zhao2 du2yin1 pin1，quan2 da4xie3，hou4mian5 gen1zhe5 ge4 gan3tan4hao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ye3 bu4shi4 tai4 huo3……you3 mai4 yi1xie1 chang4pian4，zai4 ou1zhou1 xun2yan3。jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 ge4 lao3diao4ya2 de5 gu4shi4，wo3 gan3 shuo1 ni3 ken3ding4 dou1 ting1 yan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Fair point. But this... this is just too far out there for me to accept.\n"
"\n"
"It's far more likely that they released these stories themselves to throw people off of whatever they're really doing."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​也​有​道理​，​但是​这个​……​这个​对​我​来说​实在​太​离谱​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​更​可能​是​在​主动​散布​这些​消息​，​以此​混淆视听​，​掩盖​自己​真正​的​目的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 ye3 you3 dao4li5，dan4shi4 zhe4ge5……zhe4ge5 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 shi2zai4 tai4 li2pu3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 geng1 ke3neng2 shi4 zai4 zhu3dong4 san4bu4 zhe4xie1 xiao1xi5，yi3ci3 hun4xiao2shi4ting1，yan3gai4 zi4ji3 zhen1zheng4 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid "Fair point. But you aren't going to change my opinion of Monika."
msgstr ""
"有​道理​，​但​你​别​想​改变​我​对​莫妮卡​的​观点​。\n"
"you3 dao4li5，dan4 ni3 bie4 xiang3 gai3bian4 wo3 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 guan1dian3。"

msgid "Fairlight Excalibur"
msgstr ""
"衡光断​钢剑\n"
"heng2 guang1 duan4 gang1 jian4"

msgid "Fall back and re-group!"
msgstr ""
"撤退​，​然后​重新​集结​！\n"
"che4tui4，ran2hou4 chong2xin1 ji2jie2！"

msgid "False hope. I was lying, I don't have a thing for you."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​我​随便​说​的​，​我​没什么​能​给​你​的​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。wo3 sui2bian4 shuo1 de5，wo3 mei2shen2me5 neng2 gei3 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Families just don't feel safe anymore."
msgstr ""
"这里​的​家庭​已经​失去​了​安全感​。\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 jia1ting2 yi3jing1 shi1qu4 le5 an1quan2gan3。"

msgid "Family Apartment Door"
msgstr ""
"家庭​公寓​门\n"
"jia1ting2 gong1yu4 men2"

msgid "Fantastic. Now what?"
msgstr ""
"这下​可好​。​现在​怎么办​？\n"
"zhe4xia4 ke3hao3。xian4zai4 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid ""
"Farewell, stalwart $(scene.badfantasy)!\n"
"\n"
"We will remember you always!"
msgstr ""
"再见​，​坚毅​的​$(scene.badfantasy)​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​永远​记得​你​！\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4，jian1yi4 de5 $(scene.badfantasy)！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yong3yuan3 ji4de5 ni3！"

msgid "Fascinating. Well, I've gotta run. Take care, Zaak."
msgstr ""
"有意思​。​我​得​走​了​。​你​多​保重​，​扎克​。\n"
"you3yi4si5。wo3 de2 zou3 le5。ni3 duo1 bao3zhong4，Zha1ke4。"

msgid "Fast"
msgstr ""
"快\n"
"kuai4"

msgid "Fastest"
msgstr ""
"最快\n"
"zui4 kuai4"

msgid "Feeling better, Yuli? Ready to chat?"
msgstr ""
"感觉​好点没​，​尤里​？​愿意​说话​了​吗​？\n"
"gan3jue2 hao3 dian3 mei2，You2li3？yuan4yi4 shuo1hua4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Feeling chatty tonight, aren't we?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She releases a plume of smoke from the corner of her mouth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So... what do you want?"
msgstr ""
"今晚​很​健谈​嘛​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​从​嘴角​逸​出​一股​烟雾​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​……​你​有​什么​事​？\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 hen3 jian4tan2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 zui3jiao3 yi4 chu1 yi1 gu3 yan1wu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "Female"
msgstr ""
"女性\n"
"nu:3xing4"

msgid "Female Initiate"
msgstr ""
"女​学徒\n"
"nu:3 xue2tu2"

msgid "Female Newscaster"
msgstr ""
"女​播音员\n"
"nu:3 bo1yin1yuan2"

msgid "Female Voice"
msgstr ""
"女声\n"
"nu:3 sheng1"

msgid "Feral Ghoul"
msgstr ""
"凶猛​食尸​鬼\n"
"xiong1meng3 shi2 shi1 gui3"

msgid "Fetish"
msgstr ""
"信物\n"
"xin4wu4"

msgid "Feuerschwiinnnggeeee."
msgstr ""
"火​—​—​翼​……\n"
"huo3——yi4……"

msgid "Feuerschwinge"
msgstr ""
"火翼\n"
"Huo3yi4"

msgid "Feuerschwinge Virus Level: $(scene.countPoisonClock) / 10"
msgstr ""
"火翼​病毒​水平​：​$(scene.countPoisonClock)​/​10\n"
"Huo3yi4 bing4du2 shui3ping2：$(scene.countPoisonClock)/10"

msgid "Feuerschwinge showed me a way out. Now I’m offering one to you."
msgstr ""
"火翼​给​我​指​了​一条​出路​。​现在​我​也​在​对​你​做​同样​的​事​。\n"
"Huo3yi4 gei3 wo3 zhi3 le5 yi1 tiao2 chu1lu4。xian4zai4 wo3 ye3 zai4 dui4 ni3 zuo4 tong2yang4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "Feuerschwinge was insane and dangerous. We had to kill her."
msgstr ""
"火翼​疯癫​又​危险​，​我们​必须​杀死​她​。\n"
"Huo3yi4 feng1dian1 you4 wei1xian3，wo3men5 bi4xu1 sha1si3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Feuerschwinge will breathe her infected fire upon Berlin. Thousands will die... and through that destruction, the virus will take to the air. \n"
"\n"
"A critical mass of Berlin's metahuman population will be exposed, but no one will even *think* to quarantine the city until it’s too late. The Flux State lacks any centralized authority.\n"
"\n"
"Corporations will evacuate their own. Thousands will flee the city. Infected."
msgstr ""
"火翼​将​向​柏林​喷吐​被​感染​的​火焰​。​成千上万​人​将​死去​……​而​在​这片​废墟​中​，​病毒​将​随​空气​传播​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​柏林​将​有​大量​泛​人类​暴露​于​病毒​之下​，​但​等到​有人​想起​要​对​这座​城市​实施​隔离​时​，​早就​为时已晚​了​。​动荡​带​缺乏​任何​中央集权​的​领头​作用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​企业​将​撤离​自己​的​员工​。​成千上万​人​将​逃离​这座​城市​。​而​他们​届时​都​已​被​感染​。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 jiang1 xiang4 bo2lin2 pen1 tu3 bei4 gan3ran3 de5 huo3yan4。cheng2qian1shang4wan4 ren2 jiang1 si3qu4……er2 zai4 zhe4 pian1 fei4xu1 zhong4，bing4du2 jiang1 sui2 kong1qi4 chuan2bo1。\n"
"\n"
"bo2lin2 jiang1 you3 da4liang4 fan4 ren2lei4 bao4lu4 yu2 bing4du2 zhi1xia4，dan4 deng3dao4 you3ren2 xiang3qi3 yao4 dui4 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 shi2shi1 ge2li2 shi2，zao3jiu4 wei2shi2yi3wan3 le5。dong4dang4 dai4 que1fa2 ren4he2 zhong1yang1ji2quan2 de5 ling3tou2 zuo4yong4。\n"
"\n"
"qi3ye4 jiang1 che4li2 zi4ji3 de5 yuan2gong1。cheng2qian1shang4wan4 ren2 jiang1 tao2li2 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4。er2 ta1men5 jie4shi2 dou1 yi3 bei4 gan3ran3。"

msgid ""
"Feuerschwinge will fly to the long sleep until the next age of the world...\n"
"\n"
"for theforevertask\n"
"\n"
"the shelter... the shield... the shepherd..."
msgstr ""
"火翼会​进入​长眠​，​直到​世界​的​下​一个​时代​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​永恒​的​使命​\n"
"​\n"
"​庇护所​……​护盾​……​牧羊人​……\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 hui4 jin4ru4 chang2mian2，zhi2dao4 shi4jie4 de5 xia4 yi1ge5 shi2dai4……\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4 \n"
"\n"
"bi4hu4suo3……hu4dun4……mu4yang2ren2……"

msgid ""
"Feuerschwinge wrought destruction with fire and claw. The dragons of today... Lofwyr, Dunkelzahn, Celedyr... they kill and conquer with subtler tools. Deception, manipulation, corruption. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He spits with disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They use us as pawns. Playing pieces. Puppets in their millennia-long machinations..."
msgstr ""
"火翼​不过​是​以​火焰​与​利爪​肆虐​。​而​当今​的​巨龙​……​洛夫​维尔​、​邓​凯尔​赞​、​塞勒​迪尔​……​他们​以​更​隐蔽​的​手段​杀戮​与​征服​。​欺骗​、​操控​、​腐蚀​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​厌恶​地​啐​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​将​我们​当作​随意​摆弄​的​棋子​。​在​他们​长​达​千年​的​阴谋​中​肆意​操纵​的​傀儡​……\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 bu4guo4 shi4 yi3 huo3yan4 yu4 li4zhao3 si4nu:e4。er2 dang1jin1 de5 ju4long2……Luo4fu1wei2er3、deng4 kai3 er3 zan4、se4 lei1 di2 er3……ta1men5 yi3 geng1 yin3bi4 de5 shou3duan4 sha1lu4 yu4 zheng1fu2。qi1pian4、cao1kong4、fu3shi2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan4wu4 de5 cui4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jiang1 wo3men5 dang4zuo4 sui2yi4 bai3nong4 de5 qi2zi3。zai4 ta1men5 zhang3 da2 qian1nian2 de5 yin1mou2 zhong4 si4yi4 cao1zong4 de5 kui3lei3……"

msgid ""
"Feuerschwinge's astral form has been trapped in this woman for forty years. \n"
"\n"
"And she's been confined to this cage for twenty.\n"
"\n"
"That's torture."
msgstr ""
"火翼​的​灵体​已经​被困​在​那位​女性​体内​长​达​四十年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​她​自己​也​被​囚禁​在​这座​牢笼​中​已有​二十年​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​简直​是​种​折磨​。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 de5 ling2ti3 yi3jing1 bei4kun4 zai4 na4 wei4 nu:3xing4 ti3nei4 zhang3 da2 si4 shi2 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ta1 zi4ji3 ye3 bei4 qiu2jin4 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 lao2long2 zhong4 yi3 you3 er4 shi2 nian2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian3zhi2 shi4 zhong3 zhe2mo2。"

msgid "Feuerschwinge. Try and focus. "
msgstr ""
"火翼​。​集中​注意​听​我​说话​。\n"
"Huo3yi4。ji2zhong1 zhu4yi4 ting1 wo3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid "Feuerschwinge?"
msgstr ""
"火翼​？\n"
"Huo3yi4？"

msgid ""
"Feuershcwinge was insane and dangerous. Killing her was the right thing to "
"do."
msgstr ""
"火翼​疯癫​又​危险​，​杀死​她​是​正确​的​选择​。\n"
"Huo3yi4 feng1dian1 you4 wei1xian3，sha1si3 ta1 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"Feuerstelle lets them be themselves, but in a safe place. Certainly safer "
"than the back alleys of some urban hellhole like the one that you live in."
msgstr ""
"“​火坑​”​让​他们​得以​在​这个​安全​之地​展露​真实​的​自我​。​起码​这​地方​要​比​你们​那些​所谓​城市​的​地狱​般的​街头巷尾​要​安全​许多​。\n"
"“huo3keng1” rang4 ta1men5 de2yi3 zai4 zhe4ge5 an1quan2 zhi1 de5 zhan3lu4 zhen1shi2 de5 zi4wo3。qi3ma3 zhe4 di4fang1 yao4 bi3 ni3men5 na4xie1 suo3wei4 cheng2shi4 de5 di4yu4 ban1 de5 jie1tou2xiang4wei3 yao4 an1quan2 xu3duo1。"

msgid ""
"Few folks of any real discipline around here. Monika kept them calm, by "
"keeping them safe. Now that she's gone, they're going to start realizing "
"what a heap of misery this blasted city can be."
msgstr ""
"这里​很少​有​真正​有​教养​的​人​。​莫妮卡​保护​了​他们​的​安全​，​才​让​他们​能够​保持​冷静​。​现在​她​不​在​了​，​他们​也​会​开始​意识​到​，​这座​该死​的​城市​有​多​糟糕​。\n"
"zhe4li3 hen3 shao3 you3 zhen1zheng4 you3 jiao4yang3 de5 ren2。Mo4ni1ka3 bao3hu4 le5 ta1men5 de5 an1quan2，cai2 rang4 ta1men5 neng2gou4 bao3chi2 leng3jing4。xian4zai4 ta1 bu4 zai4 le5，ta1men5 ye3 hui4 kai1shi3 yi4shi2 dao4，zhe4 zuo4 gai1si3 de5 cheng2shi4 you3 duo1 zao1gao1。"

msgid "Few here do, thankfully. (w)"
msgstr ""
"还好​这里​没什么​这样​的​人​。\n"
"hai2hao3 zhe4li3 mei2shen2me5 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2。"

msgid "Few places in this world are."
msgstr ""
"世界​上​也​没​几个​适合​的​地方​了​。\n"
"shi4jie4 shang4 ye3 mei2 ji3ge5 shi4he2 de5 di4fang1 le5。"

msgid "Few things appear to be routine these days. (w)"
msgstr ""
"最近​没什么​事​可以​称得上​“​例行​”​了​。\n"
"zui4jin4 mei2shen2me5 shi4 ke3yi3 cheng1de5shang4“li4xing2” le5。"

msgid "Fichetti Concussion Grenade"
msgstr ""
"菲切​蒂​震撼​弹\n"
"fei1 qie1 di4 zhen4han4 dan4"

msgid "Fichetti Frag Grenade"
msgstr ""
"菲切​蒂​破片​手榴弹\n"
"fei1 qie1 di4 po4pian4 shou3liu2dan4"

msgid "Fichetti Security 500"
msgstr ""
"菲切​蒂​安全​500\n"
"fei1 qie1 di4 an1quan2 500"

msgid "Fichetti Security 500 (Smartlink)"
msgstr ""
"菲切​蒂​安全​500​（​智能​枪版​）\n"
"fei1 qie1 di4 an1quan2 500 （zhi4neng2 qiang1ban3）"

msgid "Fichetti's basic frag grenade."
msgstr ""
"菲切​蒂​的​基础​破片​手雷​。\n"
"fei1 qie1 di4 de5 ji1chu3 po4pian4 shou3lei2。"

msgid ""
"Fichetti's basic non-lethal grenade. Does -1 AP to everyone hit by its "
"blast."
msgstr ""
"菲切​蒂​公司​的​基础​非​致命​手雷​。​爆炸​波及​的​所有​目标​将​承受​-​1​点​行动​点​损失​。\n"
"fei1 qie1 di4 gong1si1 de5 ji1chu3 fei1 zhi4ming4 shou3lei2。bao4zha4 bo1ji2 de5 suo3you3 mu4biao1 jiang1 cheng2shou4 -1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3 sun3shi1。"

msgid "Figure of speech. I didn't mean to offend you. Please, go on."
msgstr ""
"比喻​而已​。​我​无意​冒犯​。​请​继续​吧​。\n"
"bi3yu4 er2yi3。wo3 wu2yi4 mao4fan4。qing3 ji4xu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Figured I’d run into you here, boss.\n"
"\n"
"Wanted to be sure that I caught you before you headed off."
msgstr ""
"我​就​知道​你​会​来​这​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​你​离开​前​，​咱们​怎么​都​得​再见​一面​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 hui4 lai2 zhe4，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 li2kai1 qian2，zan2men5 zen3me5 dou1 de2 zai4jian4 yi1mian4。"

msgid "Figures."
msgstr ""
"我​就​知道​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "File Cabinet"
msgstr ""
"文件柜\n"
"wen2 jian4 ju3"

msgid "File deleted."
msgstr ""
"文件​已​删除​。\n"
"wen2jian4 yi3 shan1chu2。"

msgid "Filthy Drawers"
msgstr ""
"肮脏​的​抽屉\n"
"ang1zang1 de5 chou1ti5"

msgid ""
"Finally, I have been checking up on our friend... the ork with the skin "
"grafts. I haven't heard anything back yet, but I'll keep you appraised as "
"the situation develops."
msgstr ""
"最后​，​我​一直​在​关注​那位​关键人物​的​情况​……​就是​那个​做​了​皮肤​移植​的​兽​人​。​目前​还​没收​到​任何​消息​，​但​我会​随时​向​你​告知​事态​进展​。\n"
"zui4hou4，wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 guan1zhu4 na4 wei4 guan1 jian4 ren2 wu4 de5 qing2kuang4……jiu4shi4 na4ge5 zuo4 le5 pi2fu1 yi2zhi2 de5 shou4 ren2。mu4qian2 hai2 mo4shou1 dao4 ren4he2 xiao1xi5，dan4 wo3 hui4 sui2shi2 xiang4 ni3 gao4zhi1 shi4tai4 jin4zhan3。"

msgid ""
"Finally, the date of admission catches your attention. Audran was delivered "
"to the hospital on the 25th of September, 2039. The admitting nurse "
"estimated his age at the time to be 25."
msgstr ""
"最后​，​入院​日期​引起​了​你​的​注意​。​奥​德兰​于​2039​年​9​月​25​日​被​送​进​医院​。​接诊​护士​估计​他​当时​的​年龄​为​25​岁​。\n"
"zui4hou4，ru4yuan4 ri4qi1 yin3qi3 le5 ni3 de5 zhu4yi4。Ao4de2lan2 yu2 2039 nian2 9 yue4 25 ri4 bei4 song4 jin4 yi1yuan4。jie1 zhen3 hu4shi5 gu1ji4 ta1 dang1shi2 de5 nian2ling2 wei2 25 sui4。"

msgid ""
"Finally, you show your true colors.\n"
"\n"
"I can't say I'm surprised."
msgstr ""
"你​终于​露出​真面目​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​倒也不​觉得​意外​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhong1yu2 lu4chu1 zhen1mian4mu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dao3 ye3 bu4 jue2de5 yi4wai4。"

msgid "Financial Data Server"
msgstr ""
"财务数据​服务器\n"
"cai2 wu4 shu3 ju4 fu2wu4qi4"

msgid ""
"Financial records for OTK International. Definitely worth nuyen to the right"
" buyer."
msgstr ""
"OTK​国际​的​财务​记录​。​卖​给​合适​的​人​能​赚​不少​新円​。\n"
"OTK guo2ji4 de5 cai2wu4 ji4lu4。mai4 gei3 he2shi4 de5 ren2 neng2 zhuan4 bu4shao3 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid "Find Dietrich"
msgstr ""
"找到​迪​特里​希\n"
"zhao3dao4 Di2te4li3xi1"

msgid "Find Glory"
msgstr ""
"找到​格洛丽\n"
"zhao3dao4 Ge2luo4li2"

msgid "Find More Stories"
msgstr ""
"寻找​更​多​故事\n"
"xun2zhao3 geng1 duo1 gu4shi4"

msgid "Find Someone to Decipher the Aztechnology Data"
msgstr ""
"找人来​解密​阿兹特​科技​数据\n"
"zhao3 ren2 lai2 jie3mi4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 shu4ju4"

msgid "Find Trithemius"
msgstr ""
"找到​特​里特​米​乌斯\n"
"zhao3dao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1"

msgid "Find Trithemius's Power Coupling"
msgstr ""
"找到​特​里特​米​乌斯​的​电源​耦合​器\n"
"zhao3dao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 dian4yuan2 ou3he2 qi4"

msgid "Find Vauclair"
msgstr ""
"找到​沃​克莱尔\n"
"zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3"

msgid "Find Vauclair to Stop Feuerschwinge"
msgstr ""
"找到​沃​克莱尔​以​阻止​火翼\n"
"zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 yi3 zu3zhi3 Huo3yi4"

msgid "Find a Way Back Into the Facility"
msgstr ""
"想​办法​返回​设施\n"
"xiang3 ban4fa3 fan3hui2 she4shi1"

msgid "Find a Way to Access the Hotel Area"
msgstr ""
"想​办法​进入​旅馆​区域\n"
"xiang3 ban4fa3 jin4ru4 lu:3guan3 qu1yu4"

msgid ""
"Find a terminal in the secure area, and disable the second firewall to let "
"Blitz into the secure Matrix node."
msgstr ""
"在​管制​区域​找到​某处​终端​，​禁用​第二道​防火墙​，​让​布里​茨​进入​安保​矩阵​节点​。\n"
"zai4 guan3zhi4 qu1yu4 zhao3dao4 mou3chu4 zhong1duan1，jin1yong4 di4 er4 dao4 fang2huo3qiang2，rang4 Bu4li3ci2 jin4ru4 an1bao3 ju3zhen4 jie2dian3。"

msgid "Find a way into the Basement to Access APEX's Kill Switch"
msgstr ""
"想​办法​进入​地下室​，​并​使用​APEX​的​紧急​开关\n"
"xiang3 ban4fa3 jin4ru4 di4xia4shi4，bing4 shi3yong4 APEX de5 jin3ji2 kai1guan1"

msgid "Find an Impulse Transmitter"
msgstr ""
"找到​一个​脉冲​发射器\n"
"zhao3dao4 yi1ge5 mai4chong1 fa1she4qi4"

msgid ""
"Find anything?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She speaks to you through clenched teeth. Her voice sounds strained, and her cheeks are flushed.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"有​什么​发现​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​透过​咬紧​的​牙关​向​你​问道​。​她​的​声音​听​起来​很​吃力​，​脸颊​也​涨红​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 fa1xian4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tou4guo4 yao3 jin3 de5 ya2guan1 xiang4 ni3 wen4dao4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 chi1li4，lian3jia2 ye3 zhang4hong2 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Find her for us, okay? Please, bring her back safe."
msgstr ""
"帮​我们​找到​她​，​好​吗​？​求求​你​了​，​把​她​安全带​回来​。\n"
"bang1 wo3men5 zhao3dao4 ta1，hao3 ma5？qiu2 qiu2 ni3 le5，ba3 ta1 an1quan2dai4 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"Find our missing client. Extract some answers.\n"
"\n"
"Beyond that? Find another decker. \n"
"\n"
"Monika won't be easy to replace. Best start looking now."
msgstr ""
"找到​我们​那个​客户​，​问​出​答案​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​呢​？​再​找​一个​碟客​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​像​莫妮卡​那样​的​高手​可​不多见​，​最好​早点​开始​找​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"zhao3dao4 wo3men5 na4ge5 ke4hu4，wen4 chu1 da2an4。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ni2？zai4 zhao3 yi1ge5 die2 ke4。\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 Mo4ni1ka3 na4yang4 de5 gao1shou3 ke3 bu4 duo1 jian4，zui4hao3 zao3dian3 kai1shi3 zhao3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Find our missing client. Extract some answers.\n"
"\n"
"Beyond that? Take jobs. Get paid."
msgstr ""
"找到​我们​那个​客户​，​问​出​答案​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​呢​？​接活​，​赚钱​。\n"
"\n"
"zhao3dao4 wo3men5 na4ge5 ke4hu4，wen4 chu1 da2an4。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ni2？jie1huo2，zhuan4qian2。"

msgid "Find out more about Project Atlas"
msgstr ""
"调查​关于​“​阿特拉斯​”​项目​的​更​多​详情\n"
"diao4cha2 guan1yu2“a1te4la1si1” xiang4mu4 de5 geng1 duo1 xiang2qing2"

msgid ""
"Find someone else. I have better things to do with my time than play second "
"fiddle to Audran."
msgstr ""
"去​找​别人​吧​。​我​还有​别的​事要​忙​，​没​时间​陪奥​德兰​过家家​。\n"
"qu4 zhao3 bie2ren5 ba1。wo3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 mang2，mei2 shi2jian1 pei2 Ao4de2lan2 guo4jia1jia1。"

msgid "Find something interesting?"
msgstr ""
"有​什么​有趣​的​发现​吗​？\n"
"you3 shen2me5 you3qu4 de5 fa1xian4 ma5？"

msgid "Find the AI Terminal"
msgstr ""
"找到​AI​终端\n"
"zhao3dao4 AI zhong1duan1"

msgid "Find the Humanis Donor List"
msgstr ""
"找到​人类​至上​主义者​的​资助者​名单\n"
"zhao3dao4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 zi1 zhu4 zhe3 ming2dan1"

msgid "Find the Rigger"
msgstr ""
"找到​机师\n"
"zhao3dao4 ji1shi1"

msgid ""
"Find the server control terminal and bypass the first firewall to allow "
"Blitz deeper into the system."
msgstr ""
"找到​服务器​控制​终端​并​绕过​第一道​防火墙​，​让​布里​茨​进入​系统​的​更​深处​。\n"
"zhao3dao4 fu2wu4qi4 kong4zhi4 zhong1duan1 bing4 rao4guo4 di4 yi1 dao4 fang2huo3qiang2，rang4 Bu4li3ci2 jin4ru4 xi4tong3 de5 geng1 shen1chu4。"

msgid ""
"Finding Harrow is going to be a full-time job. I can't track him down while we still have a Great Dragon hanging over our heads.\n"
"\n"
"After we've dealt with Vauclair and the Firewing, I'll devote myself wholeheartedly to finding that bastard and finishing this. But for now, we need to keep our eyes on the road ahead."
msgstr ""
"寻找​哈罗​会​是​一项​全职​工作​。​在​巨龙​的​威胁​仍​悬于​头顶​之际​，​我​无法​抽身​追查​他​的​行踪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​解决​了​沃​克莱尔​与​火翼​之后​，​我定​会​倾尽全力​追捕​那​混蛋​，​彻底​了结​此事​。​但​眼下​，​我们​必须​专注​于​眼前​的​征途​。\n"
"\n"
"xun2zhao3 ha1luo2 hui4 shi4 yi1 xiang4 quan2zhi2 gong1zuo4。zai4 ju4long2 de5 wei1xie2 reng2 xuan2 yu2 tou2ding3 zhi1ji4，wo3 wu2fa3 chou1shen1 zhui1cha2 ta1 de5 xing2zong1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 jie3jue2 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 yu4 Huo3yi4 zhi1hou4，wo3 ding4 hui4 qing1 jin3 quan2 li4 zhui1bu3 na4 hun2dan4，che4di3 liao3jie2 ci3shi4。dan4 yan3xia4，wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 yan3qian2 de5 zheng1tu2。"

msgid ""
"Finding a copy of the seventh episode of \"Knight-Kings of Lightninghold\" "
"proves to be a more ambitious undertaking. Eventually, you find a pirate "
"site for old trid programs."
msgstr ""
"找到​《​闪电​堡​骑士​王​》​第七集​的​拷贝​要​比​解除​隔离​麻烦​得​多​。​最后​，​你​在​一个​专门​提供​老​3D​影像​剧集​的​盗版​网站​上​找到​了​它​。\n"
"zhao3dao4 《 shan3dian4 pu4 qi2shi4 wang2 》 di4 qi1 ji2 de5 kao3bei4 yao4 bi3 jie3chu2 ge2li2 ma2fan5 de2 duo1。zui4hou4，ni3 zai4 yi1ge5 zhuan1men2 ti2gong1 lao3 3D ying3xiang4 ju4ji2 de5 dao4ban3 wang3zhan4 shang4 zhao3dao4 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Fine by me, boss. I'd probably do the same thing... just wanted to make sure that you knew the stakes of the game.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He cracks his knuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's get movin', then. We've got a job to do."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​，​老大​。​换​我​大概​也​会​这么​做​……​我​就是​想​确认​你​清楚​这里​头​的​风险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​掰​了​掰​指节​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​动身​吧​，​还有​工作​要​做​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4，lao3da4。huan4 wo3 da4gai4 ye3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4……wo3 jiu4shi4 xiang3 que4ren4 ni3 qing1chu5 zhe4li3 tou2 de5 feng1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bai1 le5 bai1 zhi3jie2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 dong4shen1 ba1，hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4 ni2。"

msgid "Fine by me, just thought I'd offer."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​，​只是​想​提个​建议​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4，zhi3shi4 xiang3 ti2 ge4 jian4yi4。"

msgid "Fine by me."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。"

msgid "Fine by me. Anything else that we need to know, Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​。​你​还有​什么​要说​的​吗​，​布里​茨​？\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4shuo1 de5 ma5，Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid "Fine by me. Let's get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​。​我们​离开​这鬼​地方​吧​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4 gui3 di4fang1 ba1。"

msgid "Fine with me. Anything else that you need?"
msgstr ""
"行​，​你​还有​什么​需要​？\n"
"xing2，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4？"

msgid ""
"Fine! Stopped! Whatever!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Winters swipes a bottle off the table in front of him, drains it, and drops it to the floor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Call it whatever you want. But Adrian, you're the only one who's still this obsessed with the damned things! There aren't that many of them, and they're *not* taking over the world!"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​！​是​阻止​！​随便​吧​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​温特斯​从​面前​的​桌上​抄起​一瓶​酒​，​一口气​喝个​精光​，​然后​丢​在​地板​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿德里安​，​你​想​怎么​说​都行​，​但​现在​只有​你​一个​人​还​跟​丢​了​魂儿​似的​这么​想​！​并​没有​那么​多​巨龙​，​他们​也​*​不会​*​占领​世界​！\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1！shi4 zu3zhi3！sui2bian4 ba1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 cong2 mian4qian2 de5 zhuo1 shang4 chao1 qi3 yi1 ping2 jiu3，yi1kou3qi4 he4 ge4 jing1guang1，ran2hou4 diu1 zai4 di4ban3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"E1de2li3an1，ni3 xiang3 zen3me5 shuo1 dou1 xing2，dan4 xian4zai4 zhi3you3 ni3 yi1ge5 ren2 hai2 gen1 diu1 le5 hun2 er2 shi4de5 zhe4me5 xiang3！bing4 mei2you3 na4me5 duo1 ju4long2，ta1men5 ye3*bu4hui4*zhan4ling3 shi4jie4！"

msgid "Fine, I'll do it. "
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​交给​我​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，jiao1gei3 wo3。"

msgid "Fine, but I’m not promising anything."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​但​我​可​不会​做​任何​承诺​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，dan4 wo3 ke3 bu4hui4 zuo4 ren4he2 cheng2nuo4。"

msgid ""
"Fine, fine. But let's make this quick, alright? I want to get this "
"merchandise logged into inventory before it starts to thaw."
msgstr ""
"好好​好​，​那​你​快点​行​吗​？​我​想​赶紧​把​这份​商品​录入​我​的​库存​，​免得​它​开始​融化​了​。\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3，na4 ni3 kuai4dian3 xing2 ma5？wo3 xiang3 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 fen4 shang1pin3 lu4ru4 wo3 de5 ku4cun2，mian3de5 ta1 kai1shi3 rong2hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Fine.\n"
"\n"
"Did you have some other example of how my husband is supposedly \"hurting\" us? If so, share it with me... I'll show you how ridiculous you're being."
msgstr ""
"行​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​其他​事例​能​说明​我​丈夫​在​故意​“​伤害​”​我们​吗​？​如果​有​，​尽管​说​出来​……​我​倒​要​听听看​你​有​多​荒谬​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 shi4li4 neng2 shuo1ming2 wo3 zhang4fu5 zai4 gu4yi4“shang1hai4” wo3men5 ma5？ru2guo3 you3，jin3guan3 shuo1 chu1lai2……wo3 dao3 yao4 ting1 ting1 kan4 ni3 you3 duo1 huang1miu4。"

msgid "Fine. 250 per head. But that's my final offer."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​每个​人头​250​新円​。​但​这​是​我​的​最终​报价​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。mei3ge4 ren2tou2 250 xin1 yuan2。dan4 zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 zui4zhong1 bao4jia4。"

msgid ""
"Fine. Call it what you will. \n"
"\n"
"What I do will prevent a greater evil from taking place. \n"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​随便​你​怎么​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这样​做​是​为了​避免​更大​的​恶行​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 wei4le5 bi4mian3 geng1 dai4 de5 e4xing2 fa1sheng1。"

msgid "Fine. Go ahead. But I'm watching you."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​但​我会​盯​着​你​的​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。dan4 wo3 hui4 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Fine. I can't help you if you don't want to be helped."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​你​要是​不想​让​人​帮​，​我​也​帮不了​你​啊​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。ni3 yao4shi5 bu4xiang3 rang4 ren2 bang1，wo3 ye3 bang1 bu4 le5 ni3 a1。"

msgid ""
"Fine. I don't know who you are, or what you're doing snooping around down here. \n"
"\n"
"But you'd better come with me, now. Our leader's going to want to speak with you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her free hand reaches down to produce a thick leather blindfold.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​我​不​知道​你​是​谁​，​也​不​知道​你​在​这里​窥探​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​最好​现在​就​跟我走​。​我们​的​领袖​要​和​你​谈谈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​空闲​的​那​只​手​从​怀里​扯​出​一条​厚皮​眼罩​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 shei2，ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 kui1tan4 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 xian4zai4 jiu4 gen1 wo3 zou3。wo3men5 de5 ling3xiu4 yao4 he4 ni3 tan2tan2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 kong4xian2 de5 na4 zhi3 shou3 cong2 huai2li3 che3 chu1 yi1 tiao2 hou4 pi2 yan3zhao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Fine. Talk."
msgstr ""
"行​，​说​吧​。\n"
"xing2，shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Fine. What we heard is that someone came advertising cheaper BTLs than what "
"our resident Mr. Flash provides. It got Kim's attention. (w)"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我们​听到​的​消息​是​，​有人​在​打广告​，​说​自己​卖​的​BTL​比​我们​这里​的​Flash​先生​卖​的​价格​更​便宜​。​这​引起​了​阿金​的​注意​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3men5 ting1dao4 de5 xiao1xi5 shi4，you3ren2 zai4 da3 yan3 gao4，shuo1 zi4ji3 mai4 de5 BTL bi3 wo3men5 zhe4li3 de5 Flash xian1sheng5 mai4 de5 jia4ge2 geng1 bian4yi2。zhe4 yin3qi3 le5 e1 jin1 de5 zhu4yi4。"

msgid ""
"Fine. You win, asshole. Take 'em.\n"
"\n"
"The terminal's in the back room."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​赢​了​，​混蛋​。​拿走​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​终端​在​后面​的​房间​里​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 ying2 le5，hun2dan4。na2zou3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1duan1 zai4 hou4mian5 de5 fang2jian1 li3。"

msgid ""
"Fine. You won't see us again. Just let us collect our things, and we'll be "
"gone."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​不会​再​见到​我们​了​。​让​我们​把​东西​收拾​好​，​我们​这​就​离开​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 bu4hui4 zai4 jian4dao4 wo3men5 le5。rang4 wo3men5 ba3 dong1xi1 shou1shi5 hao3，wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 li2kai1。"

msgid "Fire Attunement"
msgstr ""
"火焰​调谐\n"
"huo3yan4 tiao2xie2"

msgid "Fire Barrier"
msgstr ""
"火​屏障​III\n"
"huo3 ping2zhang4 III"

msgid "Fire Barrier 1"
msgstr ""
"火​屏障​I\n"
"huo3 ping2zhang4 I"

msgid "Fire Barrier 2"
msgstr ""
"火​屏障​II\n"
"huo3 ping2zhang4 II"

msgid "Fire Escape"
msgstr ""
"消防梯\n"
"xiao1 fang2 ti1"

msgid "Fire explosion."
msgstr ""
"附带​火焰​的​爆炸​。\n"
"fu4dai4 huo3yan4 de5 bao4zha4。"

msgid "Fire-breathing? Pretty cool trick, don’t you think?"
msgstr ""
"喷火​能力​？​这招​不是​挺酷​的​吗​？\n"
"pen1huo3 neng2li4？zhe4 zhao1 bu4shi4 ting3 ku4 de5 ma5？"

msgid "Fire: HP -6"
msgstr ""
"火焰​：​损失​6​点​生命​值\n"
"huo3yan4：sun3shi1 6 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "FirePower Round"
msgstr ""
"强力​弹\n"
"qiang2li4 dan4"

msgid "Fireball"
msgstr ""
"火球​术\n"
"huo3qiu2 shu4"

msgid "Fireball I"
msgstr ""
"火球​术​I\n"
"huo3qiu2 shu4 I"

msgid "Fireball II"
msgstr ""
"火球​术​II\n"
"huo3qiu2 shu4 II"

msgid "Fireball III"
msgstr ""
"火球​术​III\n"
"huo3qiu2 shu4 III"

msgid "Firedrake"
msgstr ""
"火龙​兽\n"
"huo3long2 shou4"

msgid "Firedrake Explode"
msgstr ""
"火龙​兽​爆炸\n"
"huo3long2 shou4 bao4zha4"

msgid "Fires a discarding-sabot HTI round that ignores armor completely."
msgstr ""
"发射​一枚​完全​无视​护甲​的​HTI​脱壳​穿甲弹​。\n"
"fa1she4 yi1 mei2 wan2quan2 wu2shi4 hu4jia3 de5 HTI tuo1ke2 chuan1 jia3 dan4。"

msgid ""
"Fires an explosive shell that can damage adjacent targets. May miss and skew"
" to a nearby tile."
msgstr ""
"发射​一枚​榴弹​，​可以​伤害​相邻​的​多个​目标​。​可能​会​错过​目标​并​打​偏到​附近​的​格子​。\n"
"fa1she4 yi1 mei2 liu2dan4，ke3yi3 shang1hai4 xiang1lin2 de5 duo1ge5 mu4biao1。ke3neng2 hui4 cuo4guo4 mu4biao1 bing4 da3 pian1 dao4 fu4jin4 de5 ge2zi5。"

msgid "Firewall Lvl 1"
msgstr ""
"防火墙​I\n"
"fang2huo3qiang2 I"

