"\n"
"shou3xian1，ni3 chuang3ru4 le5 wo3 de5 zhuang1yuan2……xian3ran2，ni3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 na4 shi4*wo3 de5*di4pan2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4，ni3 hua1 le5 yi1 dai4 bi3 qian2 lai2 zhui1zong1 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Firstly, there is almost no personally identifying information listed on the chart. Apparently, Audran was delivered to the hospital without any form of ID, and they were unable to find a listing for him in their medical database.\n"
"\n"
"His name is listed as \"Max Mustermann\" - the local equivalent of \"John Doe.\""
msgstr ""
"首先​，​病历​上​几乎​没有​列出​任何​个人身份​信息​。​显然​，​奥​德兰​被​送往​医院​时未​携带​任何​身份证明​文件​，​院方​也​未能​在​医疗​数据库​中​找到​他​的​注册​记录​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​姓名​被​登记​为​“​马克斯​·​穆​斯特曼​”​—​—​相当于​德国​版本​的​“​无名氏​”​。\n"
"\n"
"shou3xian1，bing4li4 shang4 ji1hu1 mei2you3 lie4chu1 ren4he2 ge4 ren2 shen1 fen4 xin4xi1。xian3ran2，Ao4de2lan2 bei4 song4 wang3 yi1yuan4 shi2 wei4 xie2dai4 ren4he2 shen1fen4zheng4ming2 wen2jian4，yuan4 fang1 ye3 wei4neng2 zai4 yi1liao2 shu4ju4ku4 zhong4 zhao3dao4 ta1 de5 zhu4ce4 ji4lu4。\n"
"\n"
