msgid ""
"For a $(l.man) of your talents, it should be.\n"
"\n"
"The moment that you board the train to Frankfurter Tor, your test will begin. I would advise you to bring what you need in terms of medical supplies and ordinance - once you embark on your trial run, there will be no turning back."
msgstr ""
"对于​像​你​这样​的​人​来说​，​这是​肯定​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​踏上​开往​法兰克福​门​的​列车​，​考验​便​已​开始​。​我​建议​你备​妥​所​需​的​医疗​物资​与​军需品​—​—​一旦​踏上​试炼​之旅​，​便​再​无​回头路​可​走​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yu2 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 shi4 ken3ding4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 ta4shang4 kai1wang3 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2 de5 lie4che1，kao3yan4 bian4 yi3 kai1shi3。wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 bei4 tuo3 suo3 xu1 de5 yi1liao2 wu4zi1 yu4 jun1 xu1 pin3——yi1dan4 ta4shang4 shi4lian4 zhi1 lu:3，bian4 zai4 wu2 hui2tou2lu4 ke3 zou3。"

msgid ""
"For a drug gang, the Schwarze Herzen were decent enough folks. I made a lot of money with them... helped them take the hotel in the first place. We had a lot of good years there.\n"
"\n"
"Then Dieter was killed in a firefight, and our happy little family fell apart."
msgstr ""
"对于​一个​贩毒​团伙​来说​，​“​黑心​”​还​算是​一群​不错​的​人​。​我​跟​他们​一起​赚​了​不少​钱​……​当初​就是​帮​他们​拿下​那​家​旅馆​的​。​在​那段​日子​里​，​我们​过得​相当​不错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​迪特​在​一次​枪战​中​被​杀​，​我们​这个​幸福​的​小​家族​也​因此​支离破碎​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yu2 yi1ge5 fan4du2 tuan2huo3 lai2 shuo1，“hei1xin1” hai2 suan4shi4 yi1 qun2 bu4cuo4 de5 ren2。wo3 gen1 ta1men5 yi1qi3 zhuan4 le5 bu4shao3 qian2……dang1chu1 jiu4shi4 bang1 ta1men5 na2xia4 na4 jia1 lu:3guan3 de5。zai4 na4 duan4 ri4zi5 li3，wo3men5 guo4de2 xiang1dang1 bu4cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4 di2 te4 zai4 yi1ci4 qiang1zhan4 zhong4 bei4 sha1，wo3men5 zhe4ge5 xing4fu2 de5 xiao3 jia1zu2 ye3 yin1ci3 zhi1li2po4sui4。"

msgid ""
"For a girl of seventeen, it was all terribly exciting. Harrow had these "
"\"Rules of Living\" that he would teach us, rules about self-determination "
"and the importance of disobedience. He claimed to have taught classes at the"
" University of Berlin, which he painted as a mix between an earthly Paradise"
" and an anarchist playground."
msgstr ""
"对​一个十七岁​的​女孩​来说​，​这​一切​都​令人​无比​兴奋​。​哈罗​会​教导​我们​各种​“​生存​法则​”​，​关于​自我​决定权​，​以及​叛逆​的​重要性​。​他​自称​曾​在​柏林​大学​授课​，​将​那里​描绘成​人间天堂​与​无政府主义​游乐场​的​混合体​。\n"
"dui4 yi1 ge4 shi2 qi1 sui4 de5 nu:3hai2 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 ling4ren2 wu2bi3 xing1fen4。ha1luo2 hui4 jiao4dao3 wo3men5 ge4zhong3“sheng1cun2 fa3ze2”，guan1yu2 zi4wo3 jue2 ding4 quan2，yi3ji2 pan4ni4 de5 zhong4yao4xing4。ta1 zi4cheng1 ceng2 zai4 bo2lin2 da4xue2 shou4ke4，jiang1 na4li5 miao2 hui4 cheng2 ren2jian1tian1tang2 yu4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 you2le4chang3 de5 hun4he2ti3。"

msgid ""
"For a long moment, Vauclair stares at her, unmoving.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, his eyes flit to the ground."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​凝视着​她​，​一动不动​，​足足​有数​刻之久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​他​的​目光​移​向​地面​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ta1，yi1dong4bu4dong4，zu2zu2 you3shu4 ke4 zhi1 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 de5 mu4guang1 yi2 xiang4 di4mian4。"

msgid ""
"For a long moment, Vauclair stares at him, unmoving.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, his eyes flit to the ground."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​凝视着​他​，​一动不动​，​足足​有数​刻之久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​他​的​目光​移​向​地面​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ta1，yi1dong4bu4dong4，zu2zu2 you3shu4 ke4 zhi1 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 de5 mu4guang1 yi2 xiang4 di4mian4。"

msgid ""
"For a long moment, Vauclair stares at you, unmoving.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, his eyes flit to the ground."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​凝视着​你​，​一动不动​，​足足​有数​刻之久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​他​的​目光​移​向​地面​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3，yi1dong4bu4dong4，zu2zu2 you3shu4 ke4 zhi1 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 de5 mu4guang1 yi2 xiang4 di4mian4。"

msgid "For a long moment, nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"过​了​很​久​，​什么​都​没有​发生​。\n"
"guo4 le5 hen3 jiu3，shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"For a moment, nothing seems to happen.\n"
"\n"
"Then you blink, and the camera is gone."
msgstr ""
"片刻之间​，​似乎​什么​都​没​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​你​只​一眨眼​，​摄像头​便​不见​了​。\n"
"\n"
"pian1 ke4 zhi1 jian1，si4hu1 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4 ni3 zhi3 yi1zha3yan3，she4xiang4tou2 bian4 bu4jian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"For a moment, you can see the conflict behind Marta's eyes. If cognitive dissonance had a face, it would be hers... confused, frightened, angry. At war with herself. For a moment, she struggles to speak.\n"
"\n"
"Then the whispering sensation that you felt outside of the compound comes back, and her face changes. The muscles of her brow relax, and she appears to be at peace."
msgstr ""
"片刻间​，​你​能​从​玛​尔塔​的​眼中​窥见​她​内心​的​挣扎​。​如果说​认知失调​能​具象化​，​那​便是​她​现在​的​模样​—​—​困惑​、​恐惧​，​夹杂着​愤怒​。​她​在​与​自我​激烈​交锋​。​她​努力​想要​开口​，​却​一时间​难以启齿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​，​你​先前​在​建筑​外感​受到​的​低语​再次​袭​来​。​她​的​面容​随之​改变​，​眉间​的​肌肉​舒展​，​整个​人​仿佛​重归​平静​。\n"
"\n"
"pian1 ke4 jian1，ni3 neng2 cong2 Ma3er3ta3 de5 yan3zhong1 kui1jian4 ta1 nei4xin1 de5 zheng1zha2。ru2guo3shuo1 ren4zhi1shi1tiao2 neng2 ju4 xiang4 hua4，na4 bian4shi4 ta1 xian4zai4 de5 mu2yang4——kun4huo4、kong3ju4，jia1 za2 zhao2 fen4nu4。ta1 zai4 yu4 zi4wo3 ji1lie4 jiao1feng1。ta1 nu3li4 xiang3yao4 kai1kou3，que4 yi1shi2jian1 nan2yi3qi3chi3。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4，ni3 xian1qian2 zai4 jian4zhu4 wai4 gan3 shou4dao4 de5 di1yu3 zai4ci4 xi2 lai2。ta1 de5 mian4rong2 sui2zhi1 gai3bian4，mei2jian1 de5 ji1rou4 shu1zhan3，zheng3ge4 ren2 fang3fu2 chong2 gui1 ping2jing4。"

msgid ""
"For a task of this magnitude, we need to make contact with the premeire information broker in Berlin. \n"
"\n"
"We need to talk to Alice."
msgstr ""
"对于​如此​重大​的​任务​，​我们​得​去​找​柏林​首屈一指​的​情报​商​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​和​爱丽丝​谈谈​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yu2 ru2ci3 zhong4da4 de5 ren4wu5，wo3men5 de2 qu4 zhao3 bo2lin2 shou3qu1yi1zhi3 de5 qing2bao4 shang1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 he4 ai4li4si1 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"For all of its augmentations, the MKVI still has plenty of meat left on its body. Your bullet rips through muscle, sinew, and fat before lodging in the base of its spine.\n"
"\n"
"It drops like a puppet with its strings cut. Dead before it hits the floor."
msgstr ""
"即便​经过​再​多​的​改造​，​MKVI​体内​仍​保留​着​大量​的​血肉​组织​。​你​的​子弹​穿透​肌肉​，​肌腱​和​脂肪​，​直达​它​的​脊柱​底部​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​如​断线​木偶​一般​倒下​，​落地​前​已然​毙命​。\n"
"\n"
"ji2bian4 jing1guo4 zai4 duo1 de5 gai3zao4，MKVI ti3nei4 reng2 bao3liu2 zhao2 da4liang4 de5 xue4rou4 zu3zhi1。ni3 de5 zi3dan4 chuan1tou4 ji1rou4，ji1jian4 he4 zhi1fang2，zhi2da2 ta1 de5 ji3zhu4 di3bu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ru2 duan4xian4 mu4ou3 yi1ban1 dao3xia4，luo4di4 qian2 yi3ran2 bi4ming4。"

msgid ""
"For decades, we'd used ATVs. Nasus and Bandvagns mostly. Slow, lumbering "
"things, but built for the snows of the Lapland. I was the one who changed "
"all that, moving us over to t-birds. I made us fast and nimble."
msgstr ""
"几十年​来​，​我们​一直​使用​全​地形​车​。​主要​是​Nasu​和​Bandvagn​型号​。​这些​车​虽然​速度慢​、​行动​笨拙​，​但​专为​拉普兰​的​积雪​环境​设计​。​正是​我​改变​了​这​一切​，​决定​转而​使用​雷鸟​，​让​我们​的​部队​变得​快速​且​灵活​。\n"
"ji1 shi2 nian2 lai2，wo3men5 yi1zhi2 shi3yong4 quan2 di4xing2 che1。zhu3yao4 shi4 Nasu he4 Bandvagn xing2hao4。zhe4xie1 che1 sui1ran2 su4 du4 man4、xing2dong4 ben4zhuo1，dan4 zhuan1 wei2 la1pu3lan2 de5 ji1xue3 huan2jing4 she4ji4。zheng4shi4 wo3 gai3bian4 le5 zhe4 yi1qie4，jue2ding4 zhuan3er2 shi3yong4 lei2niao3，rang4 wo3men5 de5 bu4dui4 bian4de5 kuai4su4 qie3 ling2huo2。"

msgid ""
"For good reason, it would seem. I’ll talk to Altuğ and see what he knows "
"about Green Winters."
msgstr ""
"看来​这​怀疑​还​真​站得住脚​。​我会​去​跟​奥图​伊​谈谈​，​看看​关于​格林​·​温特斯​他​都​知道​些​什么​。\n"
"kan4lai5 zhe4 huai2yi2 hai2 zhen1 zhan4 de2 zhu4 jiao3。wo3 hui4 qu4 gen1 ao4 tu2 yi1 tan2tan2，kan4kan5 guan1yu2 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 ta1 dou1 zhi1dao4 xie1 shen2me5。"

msgid "For good, or for ill. "
msgstr ""
"无论​好坏​。\n"
"wu2lun4 hao3huai4。"

msgid ""
"For medics on the go. Built-in biomonitor. Grants +1 Intelligence, +1 Move "
"Speed, and +1 Biotech."
msgstr ""
"为​行动​中​的​医疗​人员​设计​。​内置​生物​监测器​。​提供​+​1​智力​，​+​1​移动​速度​和​+​1​生物科技​。\n"
"wei2 xing2dong4 zhong4 de5 yi1liao2 ren2yuan2 she4ji4。nei4zhi4 sheng1wu4 jian1 ce4 qi4。ti2gong1 +1 zhi4li4，+1 yi2dong4 su4du4 he4 +1 sheng1wu4ke1ji4。"

msgid ""
"For my part, I saw red every time I looked at him. But he was a member of "
"the team, and it was my responsibility to get him back across the border."
msgstr ""
"就​我​而言​，​每次​看到​他​都​气不打​一处​来​。​但​他​毕竟​是​团队​成员​，​而​我​的​职责​就是​把​他​送回​边境​这头​。\n"
"jiu4 wo3 er2yan2，mei3ci4 kan4dao4 ta1 dou1 qi4 bu4 da3 yi1 chu3 lai2。dan4 ta1 bi4jing4 shi4 tuan2dui4 cheng2yuan2，er2 wo3 de5 zhi2ze2 jiu4shi4 ba3 ta1 song4 hui2 bian1jing4 zhe4 tou2。"

msgid ""
"For my part, I'm going to continue working on the other DVDs. To tell you the truth, I wouldn't hold out much hope, though... they're all badly damaged, and suffering from disc rot besides.\n"
"\n"
"I'll be in touch. My best to you and your team!"
msgstr ""
"我​这边​会​继续​修复​其他​DVD​。​不过​说实话​，​我​并​不​抱​太大​希望​……​这些​光盘​损毁​严重​，​有​的​还​氧化​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​再​联系​你​的​。​祝​你​和​团队​顺利​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4bian1 hui4 ji4xu4 xiu1fu4 qi2ta1 DVD。bu4guo4 shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 bing4 bu4 bao4 tai4 dai4 xi1wang4……zhe4xie1 guang1pan2 sun3hui3 yan2zhong4，you3 de5 hai2 yang3hua4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 zai4 lian2xi4 ni3 de5。zhu4 ni3 he4 tuan2dui4 shun4li4！"

msgid ""
"For now, I've only managed to make one voltaic grenade... they aren't the easiest things in the world to manufacture, or the cheapest.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods thoughtfully.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...But I should be able to scrounge up enough raw materials to put a new one together between each run."
msgstr ""
"目前​我​只​制作​了​一枚​电流​手雷​……​这​玩意儿​造​起来​不​简单​，​更​不​便宜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​若有所思​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​但​我​应该​能​凑够​足够​的​原材料​，​在​每次​差事​的​间隙​制作​一枚​新​的​。\n"
"\n"
"mu4qian2 wo3 zhi3 zhi4zuo4 le5 yi1 mei2 dian4liu2 shou3lei2……zhe4 wan2yi4r5 zao4 qi3lai5 bu4 jian3dan1，geng1 bu4 bian4yi2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ruo4you3suo3si1 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……dan4 wo3 ying1gai1 neng2 cou4 gou4 zu2gou4 de5 yuan2cai2liao4，zai4 mei3ci4 cha4shi4 de5 jian4xi4 zhi4zuo4 yi1 mei2 xin1 de5。"

msgid "For now, let's all agree to be more vigilant."
msgstr ""
"目前​我们​都​保持​警醒​一些​吧​。\n"
"mu4qian2 wo3men5 dou1 bao3chi2 jing3xing3 yi1xie1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"For now, let's concentrate on the undamaged disc. There is a little shop outside, the \"Data Haven.\"\n"
"\n"
"Talk to the proprietor, Maliit Holyey... she might be able to help. Tell her to put the cost of the device on my account."
msgstr ""
"不过​，​我们​现在​还是​先想​办法​播放​这张​完好​的​光碟​吧​。​附近​有家​小店​，​名叫​“​数据​港湾​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​店主​玛丽​特​·​霍利耶​谈谈​……​她​或许​能​帮​上​忙​。​让​她​把​设备​费用​记在​我​的​账​上​就​行​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，wo3men5 xian4zai4 hai2shi5 xian1 xiang3 ban4fa3 bo1fang4 zhe4 zhang1 wan2hao3 de5 guang1die2 ba1。fu4jin4 you3 jia1 xiao3dian4，ming2jiao4“shu4ju4 gang3wan1”。\n"
"\n"
"he4 dian4zhu3 ma3li4 te4 · huo4 li4 ye1 tan2tan2……ta1 huo4xu3 neng2 bang1 shang4 mang2。rang4 ta1 ba3 she4bei4 fei4yong4 ji4 zai4 wo3 de5 zhang4 shang4 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid ""
"For once, $(l.name) and I are in complete agreement.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We all knew what we were here to do. Good on you for stepping up and doing it."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​这次​总算​和​我​意见​完全一致​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​来​这里​就是​跑​差事​的​。​你​站​出来​完成​了​任务​，​这​是​件​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) zhe4 ci4 zong3suan4 he4 wo3 yi4jian4 wan2 quan2 yi1 zhi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 jiu4shi4 pao2 cha4shi4 de5。ni3 zhan4 chu1lai2 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5，zhe4 shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"For once, Hasenkamp doesn't complain about the detour. When he sees the "
"information in front of you, he stops dead in his tracks."
msgstr ""
"这​一次​，​哈森​坎普​没有​抱怨​绕路​。​他​看到​你​前面​的​文件​里​，​整个​人​愣​在​原地​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1ci4，Ha1sen1kan3pu3 mei2you3 bao4yuan4 rao4lu4。ta1 kan4dao4 ni3 qian2mian4 de5 wen2jian4 li3，zheng3ge4 ren2 leng4 zai4 yuan2di4。"

msgid ""
"For once, he and I are in agreement.\n"
"\n"
"I can't put this place behind me quickly enough. All I want to do is go home, hug my cat, and forget that tonight ever happened."
msgstr ""
"这次​我​同意​他​的​说法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​恨不得​立刻​逃离​这个​地方​。​此刻​我​只​想​回家​，​抱抱​我​的​猫​，​然后​彻底​忘记​今晚​发生​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ci4 wo3 tong2yi4 ta1 de5 shuo1fa3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen4bu5de5 li4ke4 tao2li2 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。ci3ke4 wo3 zhi3 xiang3 hui2jia1，bao4bao4 wo3 de5 mao2，ran2hou4 che4di3 wang4ji4 jin1wan3 fa1sheng1 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"For over three years, we protected that place. We held it for the People, to do with as they pleased. Kept it safe from parasites and exploiters.\n"
"\n"
"Everything was cool until those drecksau Magnifikers sucker punched us."
msgstr ""
"三年​多来​，​我们​一直​保护​着​那个​地方​，​让​其中​的​居民​得以​自由自在​地​生活​，​免受​寄生虫​和​剥削者​的​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​日子​本来​一切​安好​，​直到​伟术​帮​那些​混蛋​突然​偷袭​了​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"san1 nian2 duo1 lai2，wo3men5 yi1zhi2 bao3hu4 zhao2 na4ge5 di4fang1，rang4 qi2zhong1 de5 ju1min2 de2yi3 zi4you2zi4zai4 de5 sheng1huo2，mian3shou4 ji4sheng1chong2 he4 bo1xue1zhe3 de5 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 ri4zi5 ben3lai2 yi1qie4 an1hao3，zhi2dao4 wei3 shu4 bang1 na4xie1 hun2dan4 tu1ran2 tou1xi2 le5 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"For runners on the go. Has breathable fabric, gel-based padding, and "
"densiplast for top mobility. Grants +1 Dodge and +1 Move Speed."
msgstr ""
"为​忙碌​的​狂奔​者​设计​。​采用​透气​面料​，​凝胶​式​缓冲​垫​和​高密度​塑料​实现​了​顶级​移动性​。​提供​+​1​闪避​和​+​1​移动​速度​。\n"
"wei2 mang2lu4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 she4ji4。cai3yong4 tou4qi4 mian4liao4，ning2jiao1 shi4 huan3chong1 dian4 he4 gao1 mi4 du4 su4liao4 shi2xian4 le5 ding3ji2 yi2dong4xing4。ti2gong1 +1 shan3bi4 he4 +1 yi2dong4 su4du4。"

msgid ""
"For such a rabid anarchist, your friend seemed awfully comfortable being in power.\n"
"\n"
"Kind of a contradiction in terms, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"作为​一个​狂热​的​无政府主义​者​，​你​的​朋友​似乎​很​喜欢​掌权​的​感觉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​觉得​这​有点​矛盾​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 yi1ge5 kuang2re4 de5 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3，ni3 de5 peng2you5 si4hu1 hen3 xi3huan5 zhang3quan2 de5 gan3jue2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 jue2de5 zhe4 you3dian3 mao2dun4 ma5？"

msgid "For that kind of money, I'm all yours, Doc."
msgstr ""
"有​了​这笔​钱​，​你​说​什么​都行​，​博士​。\n"
"you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 qian2，ni3 shuo1 shen2me5 dou1 xing2，bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"For that professional rigger look. Grants +1 Drone Combat and +1 Drone "
"Control."
msgstr ""
"为了​那​专业​机师​的​派头​。​提供​+​1​无人机​战斗​和​+​1​无人机​控制​。\n"
"wei4le5 na4 zhuan1ye4 ji1shi1 de5 pai4tou2。ti2gong1 +1 wu2ren2ji1 zhan4dou4 he4 +1 wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4。"

msgid "For the Communion!"
msgstr ""
"为了​共​融会​！\n"
"wei4le5 gong4 rong2hui4！"

msgid "For the Kreuzbasar to remain safe, it needs people like you."
msgstr ""
"为了​克洛伊​茨​集市​能​保持​安全​，​这里​需要​像​你​这样​的​人​。\n"
"wei4le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 neng2 bao3chi2 an1quan2，zhe4li3 xu1yao4 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"For the love of God, shut up. Just stop talking. We're both sick to death of"
" you."
msgstr ""
"老天​在​上​，​你​可​闭嘴​吧​。​别​再​说话​了​。​我们​俩​都​要​被​你​烦死​了​。\n"
"lao3tian1 zai4 shang4，ni3 ke3 bi4zui3 ba1。bie4 zai4 shuo1hua4 le5。wo3men5 lia3 dou1 yao4 bei4 ni3 fan2 si3 le5。"

msgid "For the love of God, try not to blow anything else up."
msgstr ""
"看来​老天​的​份​上​，​别​再​搞​出​什么​爆炸​了​。\n"
"kan4lai5 lao3tian1 de5 fen4 shang4，bie4 zai4 gao3 chu1 shen2me5 bao4zha4 le5。"

msgid ""
"For the next few years, I lived at Feuerstelle as Harrow's enforcer and right-hand girl. I was also his sometimes-wife and concubine, but that was a distinction that I shared with all of the girls in the commune, including my beloved Marta.\n"
"\n"
"I came to learn that she'd been his long before she met me, but by that point, I didn't care. I'd embraced the Rules of Living, I was Harrow's creature through and through. I didn't ask questions, and I walked the path that was in front of me."
msgstr ""
"在​接下来​的​几年​里​，​我以​哈罗​的​打手​兼​得力助手​的​身份​住​在​“​火坑​”​之中​。​我​不时​也​会​扮演​他​的​妻子​和​妾​室​，​但​这种​身份​我​与​公社​里​的​所有​女孩​共享​，​包括​我​深爱​的​玛​尔塔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​后来​我​才​知晓​，​她​早​在​遇见​我​之前​便是​他​的​女人​。​但​那时​我​已​无所谓​。​我​已​全然​接受​“​生存​法则​”​，​彻底​成为​哈罗​的​附庸​。​我​不问​缘由​，​只​踏​着​眼前​铺就​的​道路​前行​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 ji3nian2 li3，wo3 yi3 ha1luo2 de5 da3shou5 jian1 de2 li4 zhu4 shou3 de5 shen1fen4 zhu4 zai4“huo3keng1” zhi1zhong1。wo3 bu4shi2 ye3 hui4 ban4yan3 ta1 de5 qi1zi3 he4 qie4 shi4，dan4 zhe4zhong3 shen1fen4 wo3 yu4 gong1she4 li3 de5 suo3you3 nu:3hai2 gong4xiang3，bao1kuo4 wo3 shen1ai4 de5 Ma3er3ta3。\n"
"\n"
"hou4lai2 wo3 cai2 zhi1xiao3，ta1 zao3 zai4 yu4jian4 wo3 zhi1qian2 bian4shi4 ta1 de5 nu:3ren2。dan4 na4shi2 wo3 yi3 wu2suo3wei4。wo3 yi3 quan2ran2 jie1shou4“sheng1cun2 fa3ze2”，che4di3 cheng2wei2 ha1luo2 de5 fu4yong1。wo3 bu4wen4 yuan2you2，zhi3 ta1 zhao2 yan3qian2 pu1 jiu4 de5 dao4lu4 qian2xing2。"

msgid ""
"For this? No.\n"
"\n"
"While Herr Burakgazi is very capable, a task of this magnitude is beyond him. We need to make contact with the premiere information broker in Berlin.\n"
"\n"
"We need to talk to Alice."
msgstr ""
"去​问​这种​情报​？​怎么​可能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​布拉加​齐​先生​再有​能耐​，​也​接​不下​如此​重大​的​任务​。​我们​得​去​找​柏林​首屈一指​的​情报​商​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​和​爱丽丝​谈谈​。\n"
"\n"
"qu4 wen4 zhe4zhong3 qing2bao4？zen3me5 ke3neng2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 xian1sheng5 zai4 you3 neng2nai4，ye3 jie1 bu4xia4 ru2ci3 zhong4da4 de5 ren4wu5。wo3men5 de2 qu4 zhao3 bo2lin2 shou3qu1yi1zhi3 de5 qing2bao4 shang1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 he4 ai4li4si1 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"For those of us in the inner sanctum, Harrow would share even more. He had "
"power the likes of which I had never seen... not my father's drunken fists "
"or my own childish experiments, but genuine, incredible power. He said that "
"it came from the Horned God, an ancient deity that he venerated. "
msgstr ""
"对于​我们​这些​身处​核心​圈子​的​人​，​哈罗​会​透露​更​多​秘密​。​他​拥有​我​从未见过​的​力量​—​—​那​不是​我​父亲​醉酒​时​的​拳头​，​也​不是​我​儿时​的​拙劣​实验​，​而是​真正​令人​难以置信​的​力量​。​他​说​这​力量​源自​他​崇拜​的​古老​神祇​：​角神​。\n"
"dui4yu2 wo3men5 zhe4xie1 shen1chu3 he2xin1 quan1zi5 de5 ren2，ha1luo2 hui4 tou4lu4 geng1 duo1 mi4mi4。ta1 yong1you3 wo3 cong2 wei4 jian4 guo4 de5 li4liang5——na4 bu4shi4 wo3 fu4qin1 zui4jiu3 shi2 de5 quan2tou5，ye3 bu4shi4 wo3 er2shi2 de5 zhuo1lie4 shi2yan4，er2shi4 zhen1zheng4 ling4ren2 nan2yi3zhi4xin4 de5 li4liang5。ta1 shuo1 zhe4 li4liang5 yuan2zi4 ta1 chong2bai4 de5 gu3lao3 shen2qi2：jiao3 shen2。"

msgid ""
"For those who dress for inside the Matrix and out. Grants +1 Intelligence "
"and +1 ESP Control."
msgstr ""
"为了​那些​在​矩阵​内外​都​注重​着装​的​人​。​提供​+​1​智力​与​+​1​专家系统​程序控制​。\n"
"wei4le5 na4xie1 zai4 ju3zhen4 nei4wai4 dou1 zhu4zhong4 zhuo2zhuang1 de5 ren2。ti2gong1 +1 zhi4li4 yu4 +1 zhuan1jia1xi4tong3 cheng2 xu4 kong4 zhi4。"

msgid ""
"For those who dress for inside the Matrix and out. Grants +1 Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"为了​那些​在​矩阵​内外​都​注重​着装​的​人​。​提供​+​1​智力​。\n"
"wei4le5 na4xie1 zai4 ju3zhen4 nei4wai4 dou1 zhu4zhong4 zhuo2zhuang1 de5 ren2。ti2gong1 +1 zhi4li4。"

msgid ""
"For what it's worth, you have no reason to worry about my professionalism. My job is to support you and the rest of this team, and that's exactly what I'm gonna do.\n"
"\n"
"As long as you hold up your end, everything should work out just fine."
msgstr ""
"尽管如此​，​你​并不需要​怀疑​我​的​专业​水准​。​我​的​职责​就是​对​你​以及​整个​团队​提供​支持​，​而​我​也​会​尽职尽责​完成​任务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​你​这头​不出​什么​纰漏​，​一切​应该​就​能​顺利进行​。\n"
"\n"
