"yong3cun2"

msgid "Forever is a long time. But for now, we're glad to have you."
msgstr ""
"永远​可是​一段​漫长​的​时间​。​但是​现在​，​我们​很​高兴​有​你​在​。\n"
"yong3yuan3 ke3shi4 yi1 duan4 man4chang2 de5 shi2jian1。dan4shi4 xian4zai4，wo3men5 hen3 gao1xing4 you3 ni3 zai4。"

msgid "Forget I said anything. Let's go."
msgstr ""
"当​我​没​说​。​走​吧​。\n"
"dang1 wo3 mei2 shuo1。zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Forget I said anything. You should go after her. I'm sure that she needs "
"you."
msgstr ""
"当​我​什么​都​没​说​。​你​应该​去​找​她​，​我​想​她​肯定​需要​你​。\n"
"dang1 wo3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 shuo1。ni3 ying1gai1 qu4 zhao3 ta1，wo3 xiang3 ta1 ken3ding4 xu1yao4 ni3。"

msgid "Forget about it. Changed my mind."
msgstr ""
"算了​。​我​改​主意​了​。\n"
"suan4le5。wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。"

msgid "Forget it, then."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​当​我​没​说​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，dang1 wo3 mei2 shuo1。"

msgid "Forget it."
msgstr ""
"算了​。\n"
"suan4le5。"

msgid "Forget it. If you want to be lab rats, I'm not gonna stop you."
msgstr ""
"算了​。​如果​你们​想当​小白鼠​，​那​我​也​不会​阻止​你们​。\n"
"suan4le5。ru2guo3 ni3men5 xiang3 dang1 xiao3bai2shu3，na4 wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3men5。"

msgid "Forget it. Just go back to doing what you were doing."
msgstr ""
"算了​。​你​先忙​你​手头​的​事情​吧​。\n"
"suan4le5。ni3 xian1 mang2 ni3 shou3tou2 de5 shi4qing5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Forget the trinket, $(l.name). We need the money.\n"
"\n"
"Fifteen thousand nuyen is a lot to give up, and the hit to our reputation will be even worse."
msgstr ""
"别​惦记​那个​小玩意儿​了​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​需要​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​放弃​一万五千​新円​可是​笔​不小​的​损失​，​而​我们​声誉​受损​的​代价​将​更为​惨重​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dian4ji4 na4ge5 xiao3 wan2 yi4 er2 le5，$(l.name)。wo3men5 xu1yao4 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"fang4qi4 yi1 wan4 wu3 qian1 xin1 yuan2 ke3shi4 bi3 bu4 xiao3 de5 sun3shi1，er2 wo3men5 sheng1yu4 shou4sun3 de5 dai4jia4 jiang1 geng4wei2 can3zhong4。"

msgid "Forget this. It's time to get out of here."
msgstr ""
"算了吧​。​该​离开​这里​了​。\n"
"suan4 le5 ba1。gai1 li2kai1 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid "Forklift"
msgstr ""
"叉车\n"
"cha1che1"

msgid "Formula 17"
msgstr ""
"17​号​配方\n"
"17 hao4 pei4fang1"

msgid ""
"Forty-two years. Forty-two years and we finally had our chance to make a difference. \n"
"\n"
"And you destroyed it."
msgstr ""
"四十二年​了​。​整整​四十二年​，​我们​终于​有​了​改变现状​的​机会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​你​毁​了​它​。\n"
"\n"
"si4 shi2 er4 nian2 le5。zheng3zheng3 si4 shi2 er4 nian2，wo3men5 zhong1yu2 you3 le5 gai3 bian4 xian4 zhuang4 de5 ji1hui4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ni3 hui3 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Forum posters speculate that the development team was killed by Lofwyr, the new CEO of Saeder-Krupp, in an effort to wipe out the project. APEX is presumed to have been deleted as a part of that same effort.\n"
"\n"
"End of recap."
msgstr ""
"有​论坛​发帖​者​推测​，​赛德​-​克虏伯​的​新任​CEO​洛夫​维尔​意图​抹除​该​项目​，​因而​将​开发​团队​灭口​。​据称​APEX​也​因此​遭到​删除​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​概括​结束​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 lun4tan2 fa1tie3 zhe3 tui1ce4，Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 de5 xin1ren4 CEO Luo4fu1wei2er3 yi4tu2 ma1 chu2 gai1 xiang4mu4，yin1er2 jiang1 kai1fa1 tuan2dui4 mie4kou3。ju4cheng1 APEX ye3 yin1ci3 zao1dao4 shan1chu2。\n"
"\n"
"gai4kuo4 jie2shu4。"

msgid ""
"Found an old news article that mentions Adrian, from way back in 2036. It was printed in a financial magazine called \"das Finanzwesen\"... one of those chic print-based mags that they produced for the retro crowd.\n"
"\n"
"There aren't any clues in here, but it's good to see someone else acknowledge his existence."
msgstr ""
"我​找到​了​一篇​提到​阿德里安​的​旧​新闻​，​这​都​是​2036​年​的​老​内容​了​。​这​篇文章​刊登​在​一本​名为​《​金融体系​》​的​财经​杂志​上​……​这是​一本​为​复古​人群​制作​的​时髦​印刷​杂志​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​里面​没有​任何​线索​，​但​很​高兴​看到​有人​承认​他​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1 pian1 ti2dao4 E1de2li3an1 de5 jiu4 xin1wen2，zhe4 dou1 shi4 2036 nian2 de5 lao3 nei4rong2 le5。zhe4 pian1 wen2 zhang1 kan1deng1 zai4 yi1 ben3 ming2wei2 《 jin1 rong2 ti3 xi4 》 de5 cai2jing1 za2zhi4 shang4……zhe4 shi4 yi1 ben3 wei2 fu4gu3 ren2qun2 zhi4zuo4 de5 shi2mao2 yin4shua1 za2zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 li3mian4 mei2you3 ren4he2 xian4suo3，dan4 hen3 gao1xing4 kan4dao4 you3ren2 cheng2ren4 ta1 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid "Found in Billy's stomach. Grants access to executive level areas."
msgstr ""
"发现​于​比利​的​胃​中​。​可用​来​进入​行政​楼层​区域​。\n"
"fa1xian4 yu2 bi3li4 de5 wei4 zhong4。ke3 yong4 lai2 jin4ru4 xing2zheng4 lou2ceng2 qu1yu4。"

msgid "Found in Green Winters' locked safe in Das Kesselhaus Hotel."
msgstr ""
"发现​于​格林​·​温特斯​在​“​锅炉房​”​旅馆​的​上锁​保险箱​中​。\n"
"fa1xian4 yu2 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 zai4“Guo1lu2fang2” lu:3guan3 de5 shang4suo3 bao3xian3xiang1 zhong4。"

msgid "Found in a rotting dumpster on the sidewalk near Sutterlin BioScience."
msgstr ""
"发现​于​苏​特林​生物科学​公司​附近​人行道​上​一个​腐烂​的​垃圾箱​内​。\n"
"fa1xian4 yu2 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 gong1si1 fu4jin4 ren2xing2dao4 shang4 yi1ge5 fu3lan4 de5 la1ji1xiang1 nei4。"

msgid ""
"Found in a trash bin in the janitor's closest.\n"
"It's badly burnt, but the first few letter of each line can still be made out:\n"
"\n"
"Ann...\n"
"I c...\n"
"mor...\n"
"get... \n"
"if ...\n"
"ele ...\n"
"cod...\n"
"847...\n"
msgstr ""
"发现​于​清洁工​储物间​的​垃圾箱​里​。​\n"
"​纸张​被​严重​烧毁​，​但​每行​开头​的​几个​字母​仍​可辨认​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​安​……​\n"
"​我​不​……​\n"
"​更​多​……​\n"
"​获得​……​\n"
"​如果​……​\n"
"​电​……​\n"
"​码​……​\n"
"​847​……\n"
"\n"
"fa1xian4 yu2 qing1jie2gong1 chu3 wu4 jian1 de5 la1ji1xiang1 li3。\n"
"zhi3zhang1 bei4 yan2zhong4 shao1hui3，dan4 mei3 xing2 kai1tou2 de5 ji3ge5 zi4mu3 reng2 ke3 bian4 ren4：\n"
"\n"
"an1……\n"
"wo3 bu4……\n"
"geng1 duo1……\n"
"huo4de2……\n"
"ru2guo3……\n"
"dian4……\n"
"ma3……\n"
"847……"

msgid "Found in the Sutterlin BioScience laboratory."
msgstr ""
"发现​于​苏​特林​生物科学​实验室​。\n"
"fa1xian4 yu2 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 shi2yan4shi4。"

msgid "Found on Annika's Desk: 84792"
msgstr ""
"发现​于​安妮​卡​的​办公桌​上​：​84792\n"
"fa1xian4 yu2 an1ni1 ka3 de5 ban4 gong1 zhuo1 shang4：84792"

msgid "Found on Lab Table: 54139"
msgstr ""
"发现​于​实验​桌上​：​54139\n"
"fa1xian4 yu2 shi2yan4 zhuo1 shang4：54139"

msgid "Found on Security Desk: 54139"
msgstr ""
"发现​于​安保​办公桌​上​：​54139\n"
"fa1xian4 yu2 an1bao3 ban4 gong1 zhuo1 shang4：54139"

msgid "Found on a desk in the Landenberg Ring building."
msgstr ""
"兰​登堡​帮​窝点​的​一张​桌子​上​找到​的​。\n"
"lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 wo1dian3 de5 yi1 zhang1 zhuo1zi5 shang4 zhao3dao4 de5。"

msgid "Found on a mercenary sent to kill you in the U-Bahn tunnels."
msgstr ""
"在​被​派​到​地铁​隧道​刺杀​你​的​佣兵​身上​找到​的​PDA​。\n"
"zai4 bei4 pai4 dao4 di4tie3 sui4dao4 ci4sha1 ni3 de5 yong1bing1 shen1shang5 zhao3dao4 de5 PDA。"

msgid ""
"Found the message Adrian left me, all those years ago. Got it cleaned up as best I could.\n"
"\n"
"Strange, hearing his voice again.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses to take a long pull on the bottle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's good to hear him... even if he did insist on calling me \"Hermie.\""
msgstr ""
"找到​了​阿德里安​多年​前​留给​我​的​信息​。​我​尽力​把​它​整理​好​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再次​听到​他​的​声音​，​感觉​很​奇怪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​喝​了​一大口​酒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听到​他​的​声音​真​好​……​即使​他​坚持​叫​我​“​赫米​”​。\n"
"\n"
"zhao3dao4 le5 E1de2li3an1 duo1nian2 qian2 liu2gei3 wo3 de5 xin4xi1。wo3 jin4li4 ba3 ta1 zheng3li3 hao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci4 ting1dao4 ta1 de5 sheng1yin1，gan3jue2 hen3 qi2guai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，he4 le5 yi1 dai4 kou3 jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1dao4 ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhen1 hao3……ji2shi3 ta1 jian1chi2 jiao4 wo3“he4 mi3”。"

