"破片​手榴弹​强化\n"
"po4pian4 shou3liu2dan4 qiang2hua4"

msgid "Framed Picture"
msgstr ""
"装裱​画\n"
"zhuang1 biao3 hua4"

msgid "Frank"
msgstr ""
"弗兰克\n"
"fu2lan2ke4"

msgid ""
"Frank.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her face scrunches into an exaggerated expression of disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You wanna talk to Frank. He's over there, on the VIP balcony.\n"
"\n"
"Just be careful, okay? The guy is, like, a SERIOUS sleaze. I'd give just about anything to see somebody put him in his place."
msgstr ""
"弗兰克​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​整张​脸​都​皱缩​起来​，​厌恶​的​表情​夸张​得​像是​要​吐出来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​得​找​弗兰克​去​谈​。​他​在​那儿​呢​，​在​VIP​大厅​的​露台​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​你​小心​一点​。​那家伙​是​个​实打实​的​烂​人​。​真​希望​有人​能​让​他​知道​自己​几斤几两​，​我​拿​什么​换​都行​。\n"
"\n"
"fu2lan2ke4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zheng3 zhang1 lian3 dou1 zhou4suo1 qi3lai5，yan4wu4 de5 biao3qing2 kua1zhang1 de2 xiang4 shi4 yao4 tu3 chu1 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de2 zhao3 fu2lan2ke4 qu4 tan2。ta1 zai4 na4r5 ni2，zai4 VIP da4ting1 de5 lu4tai2 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 ni3 xiao3xin1 yi1dian3。na4 jia1 huo3 shi4 ge4 shi2da3shi2 de5 lan4 ren2。zhen1 xi1wang4 you3ren2 neng2 rang4 ta1 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 ji1 jin1 ji1 liang3，wo3 na2 shen2me5 huan4 dou1 xing2。"

msgid ""
"Frankly, chief, I'm surprised that you care. I mean, all this time, and we've barely even talked... I didn't hear a peep from you when we weren't on a run.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno. I just didn't think that we were friends, exactly. Friendly, but not friends."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​头儿​，​我​没想到​你​会​在意​。​一直​以来​咱们​几乎​没​怎么​聊过​……​不​出​任务​的​时候​，​你​连声​招呼​都​没有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​……​我​一直​觉得​咱们​不算​朋友​。​顶多​算​……​关系​不错​的​同事​？\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，tou2r5，wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 ni3 hui4 zai4yi4。yi1zhi2 yi3lai2 zan2men5 ji1hu1 mei2 zen3me5 liao2 guo4……bu4 chu1 ren4wu5 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 lian2sheng1 zhao1hu5 dou1 mei2you3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2……wo3 yi1zhi2 jue2de5 zan2men5 bu4suan4 peng2you5。ding3duo1 suan4……guan1xi5 bu4cuo4 de5 tong2shi4？"

msgid "Franz"
msgstr ""
"弗朗兹\n"
"fu2 lang3 zi1"

msgid "Franz turns his back and hurries away."
msgstr ""
"弗朗兹​转过身​，​匆匆​离开​了​。\n"
"fu2 lang3 zi1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，cong1cong1 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid "Frau Müller"
msgstr ""
"穆勒​女士\n"
"mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4"

msgid "Frau Müller didn't tell you?"
msgstr ""
"穆勒​女士​没​告诉​你​吗​？\n"
"mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 mei2 gao4su4 ni3 ma5？"

msgid "Fray Armor"
msgstr ""
"裂甲\n"
"lie4 jia3"

msgid "Free"
msgstr ""
"自由\n"
"zi4you2"

msgid "Free APEX"
msgstr ""
"释放​APEX\n"
"shi4fang4 APEX"

msgid "Free APEX Notes"
msgstr ""
"释放​APEX​说明\n"
"shi4fang4 APEX shuo1ming2"

msgid "Free Feuerschwinge"
msgstr ""
"释放​火翼\n"
"shi4fang4 Huo3yi4"

msgid ""
"Free at last. Thank Christ.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His smile widens into a sickly grin. Tar-stained teeth shine wetly in the light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Didn't think I'd warrant a rescue. Whoever sent you, thank 'em for me."
msgstr ""
"终于​自由​了​。​谢天谢地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​笑容​逐渐​扭曲​成​病态​的​狞笑​，​沾满​焦油​污渍​的​牙齿​在​光线​下​湿漉漉​地闪​着​寒光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没想到​我​还​值得​救​。​无论是​谁​派​你​来​的​，​替​我​谢谢​他们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1yu2 zi4you2 le5。xie4tian1xie4di4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 zhu2jian4 niu3qu1 cheng2 bing4tai4 de5 ning2xiao4，zhan1man3 jiao1you2 wu1zi4 de5 ya2chi3 zai4 guang1xian4 xia4 shi1lu4lu4 de5 shan3 zhao2 han2 guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2xiang3dao4 wo3 hai2 zhi2de5 jiu4。wu2 lun2 shi4 shei2 pai4 ni3 lai2 de5，ti4 wo3 xie4xie5 ta1men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Free me...\n"
"\n"
"...please...\n"
"\n"
"...you must."
msgstr ""
"解救​我​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​求​你​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​你​必须​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"jie3jiu4 wo3……\n"
"\n"
"……qiu2 ni3……\n"
"\n"
"……ni3 bi4xu1 ru2ci3。"

msgid "Free the Rigger"
msgstr ""
"释放​机师\n"
"shi4fang4 ji1shi1"

msgid "Free the Test Subjects"
msgstr ""
"释放​实验​体\n"
"shi4fang4 shi2yan4 ti3"

msgid ""
"Free will I have in spades. The ability to exercise it, though? Not so much.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to Monika, I understand that I'm a slave. But without outside intervention, I can't do anything about it."
msgstr ""
"自由​意志​我​多得是​，​但​真正​能​行使​它​的​能力​？​可​就​没​那么​多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​莫妮卡​让​我​明白​，​我​自己​就是​个​奴隶​。​但​如果​没有​外界​的​干预​，​我​什么​也​做不了​。\n"
"\n"
"zi4you2 yi4zhi4 wo3 duo1de5shi4，dan4 zhen1zheng4 neng2 xing2shi3 ta1 de5 neng2li4？ke3 jiu4 mei2 na4me5 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 rang4 wo3 ming2bai5，wo3 zi4ji3 jiu4shi4 ge4 nu2li4。dan4 ru2guo3 mei2you3 wai4jie4 de5 gan1yu4，wo3 shen2me5 ye3 zuo4 bu4 le5。"

msgid "Free yes free FREE!"
msgstr ""
"自由​，​是​的​，​自由​！\n"
"zi4you2，shi4 de5，zi4you2！"

msgid ""
"Free yes free FREE!\n"
"\n"
"FREE ME AND I WILL RETURN TO THE MOUNTAIN.\n"
"\n"
"AND I WILL SLEEP UNTIL THE NEXT AGE OF THIS WORLD.\n"
"\n"
"AND I WILL NOT HARM ANOTHER SOUL JUST FREE ME FREE ME FREEEEE"
msgstr ""
"自由​，​是​的​，​自由​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​我​自由​，​我​就​会​回到​山中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​一直​沉睡​到​这​世界​的​下个​时代​来临​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​绝不会​再​伤害​任何人​，​只要​放​我​自由​，​自由​……\n"
"\n"
"zi4you2，shi4 de5，zi4you2！\n"
"\n"
"fang4 wo3 zi4you2，wo3 jiu4 hui4 hui2dao4 shan1 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 yi1zhi2 chen2shui4 dao4 zhe4 shi4jie4 de5 xia4ge5 shi2dai4 lai2lin2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 zai4 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2，zhi3yao4 fang4 wo3 zi4you2，zi4you2……"

msgid "Free."
msgstr ""
"自由​。\n"
"zi4you2。"

msgid "Freed Acolyte"
msgstr ""
"被​解救​的​侍​祭\n"
"bei4 jie3jiu4 de5 shi4 ji4"

msgid ""
"Freeing Thorvald wasn't the decision that I'd have made... I've known men like him, and no good will come from his freedom. But then, it wasn't my choice to make.\n"
"\n"
"We're one step closer to paying Alice's fee. In the end, that's all that really matters."
msgstr ""
"换作​是​我​的话​，​就​不会​释放​托​瓦尔德​……​我见​过太多​像​他​这样​的​人​，​放​他​自由​绝不会​有​好​结果​。​不过​，​这​终究​不是​我能​决定​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​离​支付​爱丽丝​的​费用​又​近​了​一步​。​归根结底​，​这才​是​真正​重要​的​。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 bu4hui4 shi4fang4 tuo1 wa3er3de2……wo3 jian4 guo4 tai4 duo1 xiang4 ta1 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2，fang4 ta1 zi4you2 jue2 bu4 hui4 you3 hao3 jie1guo3。bu4guo4，zhe4 zhong1jiu1 bu4shi4 wo3 neng2 jue2ding4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 li2 zhi1fu4 ai4li4si1 de5 fei4yong4 you4 jin4 le5 yi1 bu4。gui1gen1jie2di3，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zhen1zheng4 zhong4yao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Freeing the kids should be our first priority. We raid Feuerstelle, round up"
" the runaways, and clear Harrow's influence from their minds. Killing him "
"will have to be secondary."
msgstr ""
"解救​孩子​们​应当​是​首要任务​。​我们​突袭​“​火坑​”​，​收拢​逃亡者​，​并​清除​哈罗​对​他们​思想​的​控制​。​杀​他​的​事​只能​是​次要​目标​了​。\n"
"jie3jiu4 hai2zi5 men5 ying1dang1 shi4 shou3 yao4 ren4 wu4。wo3men5 tu1xi2“huo3keng1”，shou1long3 tao2wang2zhe3，bing4 qing1chu2 ha1luo2 dui4 ta1men5 si1xiang3 de5 kong4zhi4。sha1 ta1 de5 shi4 zhi3neng2 shi4 ci4yao4 mu4biao1 le5。"

msgid "Freight Elevator Door Panel"
msgstr ""
"货运​电梯​门板\n"
"huo4yun4 dian4ti1 men2 ban3"

msgid "French"
msgstr ""
"法语\n"
"fa3yu3"

msgid ""
"Friedrich! I am pleased with how well you are doing. \n"
"\n"
"To show my growing trust in you, I am giving you a new assignment in addition to your trainee duties. Beginning tomorrow, I would like you to tidy the armory. The access code is \"Purity\" - see that you don't forget it!"
msgstr ""
"弗里德里希​！​我​对​你​的​表现​非常​满意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​表明​我​对​你​的​信任​，​除了​新兵​职责​以外​，​我​给​你​安排​了​一项​新​任务​。​从​明天​开始​，​我​希望​你​负责​整理​军械库​，​军械库​的​密码​是​“​纯净​”​—​—​可​别忘了​！\n"
"\n"
"fu2li3de2li3xi1！wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 biao3xian4 fei1chang2 man3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 biao3ming2 wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 xin4ren4，chu2le5 xin1bing1 zhi2ze2 yi3wai4，wo3 gei3 ni3 an1pai2 le5 yi1 xiang4 xin1 ren4wu5。cong2 ming2tian1 kai1shi3，wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 fu4ze2 zheng3li3 jun1 xie4 ku4，jun1 xie4 ku4 de5 mi4ma3 shi4“chun2jing4”——ke3 bie4 wang4 le5！"

msgid ""
"Friend of mine did a job here once. Told me that the local wageslaves are all issued \"efficiency apartments\" deep inside the compound.\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, the buildings are all linked up on an underground tram system. Bed to cubicle in less than five minutes. Most days, the poor bastards don't even get to see the sun shine."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​朋友​在​这里​干过​一票​。​他​说​当地​的​薪奴​都​住​在​园区​深处​的​“​效率​公寓​”​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​据说​这些​建筑​都​通过​地下​轻轨​系统​连通​，​从​床铺​到​工位​不到​五分钟​。​大多数​日子​里​，​这些​可怜虫​连​阳光​都​见​不到​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 peng2you5 zai4 zhe4li3 gan4 guo4 yi1 piao4。ta1 shuo1 dang1di4 de5 xin1 nu2 dou1 zhu4 zai4 yuan2qu1 shen1chu4 de5“xiao4lu:4 gong1yu4” li3。\n"
"\n"
"ju4shuo1 zhe4xie1 jian4zhu4 dou1 tong1guo4 di4xia4 qing1gui3 xi4tong3 lian2tong1，cong2 chuang2pu4 dao4 gong1wei4 bu4dao4 wu3 fen4 zhong1。da4duo1shu4 ri4zi5 li3，zhe4xie1 ke3lian2chong2 lian2 yang2guang1 dou1 jian4 bu4dao4。"

msgid ""
"Friend of mine did a job here once. Told me that the local wageslaves are all issued \"efficiency apartments\" deep inside the compound. \n"
"\n"
"Apparently, they've got all the buildings linked up on an underground tram system. Bed to cubicle in less than five minutes. Most days, the poor bastards don't even get to see the sun shine."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​朋友​在​这里​干过​一票​。​他​说​当地​的​薪奴​都​住​在​园区​深处​的​“​效率​公寓​”​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​据说​这些​建筑​都​通过​地下​轻轨​系统​连通​，​从​床铺​到​工位​不到​五分钟​。​大多数​日子​里​，​这些​可怜虫​连​阳光​都​见​不到​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 peng2you5 zai4 zhe4li3 gan4 guo4 yi1 piao4。ta1 shuo1 dang1di4 de5 xin1 nu2 dou1 zhu4 zai4 yuan2qu1 shen1chu4 de5“xiao4lu:4 gong1yu4” li3。\n"
"\n"
"ju4shuo1 zhe4xie1 jian4zhu4 dou1 tong1guo4 di4xia4 qing1gui3 xi4tong3 lian2tong1，cong2 chuang2pu4 dao4 gong1wei4 bu4dao4 wu3 fen4 zhong1。da4duo1shu4 ri4zi5 li3，zhe4xie1 ke3lian2chong2 lian2 yang2guang1 dou1 jian4 bu4dao4。"

msgid ""
"Friend? $+(l.he) is Monika's new friend. We don't judge their work. We are "
"grateful."
msgstr ""
"朋友​？​$+(l.he)​是​莫妮卡​的​新​朋友​。​我们​不​评判​他们​的​工作​。​我们​只​心存​感激​。\n"
"peng2you5？$+(l.he) shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 xin1 peng2you5。wo3men5 bu4 ping2pan4 ta1men5 de5 gong1zuo4。wo3men5 zhi3 xin1 cun2 gan3ji1。"

msgid "Friends don't turn one another's minds inside out."
msgstr ""
"朋友​可​不会​把​对方​的​脑子​翻个​底朝天​。\n"
"peng2you5 ke3 bu4hui4 ba3 dui4fang1 de5 nao3zi5 fan1 ge4 di3chao2tian1。"

msgid ""
"Friends? What friends?\n"
"\n"
"What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"朋友​？​什么​朋友​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​说​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"peng2you5？shen2me5 peng2you5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid "Frightened Man"
msgstr ""
"惊恐​的​男人\n"
"jing1kong3 de5 nan2ren2"

msgid "From Ares, this is one of the best combat hoverdrones on the market."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​制造​，​这是​市面上​最好​的​战斗​无人机​之一​。\n"
"a1rui4si1 zhi4zao4，zhe4 shi4 shi4mian4shang4 zui4hao3 de5 zhan4dou4 wu2ren2ji1 zhi1yi1。"

msgid ""
"From around the corner, you hear a sound. Heavy boots on tile, moving toward"
" you at a full run."
msgstr ""
"拐角处​传来​声响​。​沉重​的​靴子​踩​在​地砖​上​，​正​全速​向​你们​奔来​。\n"
"guai3jiao3chu4 chuan2lai2 sheng1xiang3。chen2zhong4 de5 xue1zi5 cai3 zai4 di4zhuan1 shang4，zheng1 quan2su4 xiang4 ni3men5 ben1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"From her symptoms, it appears that Monika has suffered a cerebral hemorrhage"
" on a massive scale. It's a miracle that she's even alive, and your stomach "
"sinks with the realization that there's nothing you can do to help her."
msgstr ""
"从​她​的​症状​来看​，​莫妮卡​似乎​遭遇​了​大规模​脑出血​。​她​现在​还​活着​都​算​得​上​奇迹​。​你​意识​到​她​已经​回天乏术​，​不由得​心里​一沉​。\n"
"cong2 ta1 de5 zheng4zhuang4 lai2 kan4，Mo4ni1ka3 si4hu1 zao1yu4 le5 da4gui1mo2 nao3chu1xue4。ta1 xian4zai4 hai2 huo2zhe5 dou1 suan4 de2 shang4 qi2ji4。ni3 yi4shi2 dao4 ta1 yi3jing1 hui2tian1fa2shu4，bu4you2de5 xin1li5 yi1 chen2。"

msgid ""
"From his style of dress, it's obvious that this dwarf is not a corporate employee.\n"
"\n"
"He's a shadowrunner."
msgstr ""
"从​他​的​衣着​风格​来看​，​这个​矮人​很​明显​不是​公司员工​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​是​个​暗影​狂奔​者​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ta1 de5 yi1zhuo2 feng1ge2 lai2 kan4，zhe4ge5 ai3ren2 hen3 ming2xian3 bu4shi4 gong1 si1 yuan2 gong1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid ""
"From knowledge comes magic, from magic comes power, and from power comes yet"
" greater knowledge. Adds +1 Willpower and +1 Spellcasting."
msgstr ""
"魔法​源自​知识​，​力量​源自​魔法​，​而​力量​又​引向​更​深入​的​知识​。​提供​+​1​意志​和​+​1​施法​。\n"
"mo2fa3 yuan2zi4 zhi1shi5，li4liang5 yuan2zi4 mo2fa3，er2 li4liang5 you4 yin3xiang4 geng1 shen1ru4 de5 zhi1shi5。ti2gong1 +1 yi4zhi4 he4 +1 shi1fa3。"

msgid ""
"From my perspective, the Kreuzbasar was only stable because of her. If she really is… out of the way… well… we’ll see, won’t we?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Silence.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ja, I know, I know. What can I say? Things go slow in the Flux, sometimes.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"在我看来​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​之所以​能​维持​稳定​，​全凭​她​一人​支撑​。​若​她​真​被​……​除掉​了​……​嗯​……​且​走着瞧​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一片​寂静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​我​明白​，​我​明白​。​还​能​说​什么​呢​？​在​动荡​带​，​事情​有时​就是​进展​缓慢​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4wo3kan4lai2，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi1suo3yi3 neng2 wei2chi2 wen3ding4，quan2 ping2 ta1 yi1 ren2 zhi1cheng1。ruo4 ta1 zhen1 bei4……chu2diao4 le5……en1……qie3 zou3zhe5qiao2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 ming2bai5，wo3 ming2bai5。hai2 neng2 shuo1 shen2me5 ni2？zai4 dong4dang4 dai4，shi4qing5 you3shi2 jiu4shi4 jin4zhan3 huan3man4。"

msgid ""
"From now on, your purpose is to do whatever the hell you want. Get ready to "
"run... I'm gonna bust you out of there."
msgstr ""
"从现在起​，​你​的​使命​是​想干什么​就​干什么​。​做好​准备​……​我会​把​你们​救​出来​的​。\n"
"cong2 xian4 zai4 qi3，ni3 de5 shi3ming4 shi4 xiang3 gan4 shen2 ma2 jiu4 gan4shen2me5。zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4……wo3 hui4 ba3 ni3men5 jiu4 chu1lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"From now on, your purpose is to do whatever the hell you want. Now get "
"moving!"
msgstr ""
"从现在起​，​你​的​使命​是​想干什么​就​干什么​。​现在​赶紧​走​吧​！\n"
"cong2 xian4 zai4 qi3，ni3 de5 shi3ming4 shi4 xiang3 gan4 shen2 ma2 jiu4 gan4shen2me5。xian4zai4 gan3jin3 zou3 ba1！"

msgid "From the Desk of Jon Bergfalk"
msgstr ""
"来自​乔恩​·​伯格​法克​的​桌子\n"
"lai2zi4 qiao2 en1 · bai3 ge2 fa3ke4 de5 zhuo1zi5"

msgid "From the Desk of Werner Harding"
msgstr ""
"来自​沃纳​·​哈丁​的​桌子\n"
"lai2zi4 wo4 na4 · ha1 zheng1 de5 zhuo1zi5"

msgid ""
"From the description that your client gave you, this must be your target. The rigger, Thorvald Enstad.\n"
"\n"
"You can see him waving and pounding on the plastic of his cell door, but from where you're standing, the scene is eerily silent."
msgstr ""
"从​客户​给​你​的​描述​来看​，​这​一定​就是​你​的​目标​—​—​机师​托​瓦尔德​·​恩施​塔德​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​看见​他​对​着​牢房​门板​挥舞​拳头​、​猛力​拍打​，​但​站​在​你​这个​角度​，​整个​场景​却​诡异​地​寂静无声​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ke4hu4 gei3 ni3 de5 miao2shu4 lai2 kan4，zhe4 yi1ding4 jiu4shi4 ni3 de5 mu4biao1——ji1shi1 tuo1 wa3er3de2 · en1Shi1ta3de2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 kan4jian4 ta1 dui4 zhao2 lao2fang2 men2 ban3 hui1wu3 quan2tou5、meng3li4 pai1da5，dan4 zhan4 zai4 ni3 zhe4ge5 jiao3du4，zheng3ge4 chang3jing3 que4 gui3yi4 de5 ji4 jing4 wu2 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"From the hallway outside, you can hear a chaotic jumble of sounds.\n"
"\n"
"Just on the other side of the door, a man is yelling - pleading - with something to *stop.* From the cries that follow, you gather that his words have fallen on deaf ears.\n"
"\n"
"You also hear a fainter, higher-pitched noise. The screams of the initiates."
msgstr ""
"外面​的​走廊​传来​一片​混乱​的​声响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​在​门​的​另一边​，​一个​男人​正在​喊叫​，​哀求​让​某个​东西​*​停下​*​。​从​随后​传来​的​惨叫​判断​，​他​的​恳求​显然​无济于事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​一个​更​微弱​而​尖锐​的​声音​。​那​是​学徒​们​的​尖叫​。\n"
"\n"
"wai4mian4 de5 zou3lang2 chuan2lai2 yi1 pian1 hun4luan4 de5 sheng1xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 men2 de5 ling4 yi1 bian1，yi1ge5 nan2ren2 zheng4zai4 han3jiao4，ai1qiu2 rang4 mou3 ge4 dong1xi1*ting2xia4*。cong2 sui2hou4 chuan2lai2 de5 can3jiao4 pan4duan4，ta1 de5 ken3qiu2 xian3ran2 wu2ji4yu2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 yi1ge5 geng1 wei1ruo4 er2 jian1rui4 de5 sheng1yin1。na4 shi4 xue2tu2 men5 de5 jian1jiao4。"

msgid ""
"From the other room, the pleading voice grows louder.\n"
"\n"
"Then it dissolves into a long, piercing scream."
msgstr ""
"隔壁​房间​里​，​哀求​的​声音​越来越​响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​，​那​声音​化作​一阵​漫长​而​刺耳​的​尖叫​。\n"
"\n"
"ge2bi4 fang2jian1 li3，ai1qiu2 de5 sheng1yin1 yue4lai2yue4 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4，na4 sheng1yin1 hua4zuo4 yi1zhen4 man4chang2 er2 ci4er3 de5 jian1jiao4。"

msgid ""
"From the shattered screen of the console, your own distorted reflection "
"stares back up at you."
msgstr ""
"从​控制台​破碎​的​屏幕​上​，​你​自己​的​扭曲​倒影​正​凝视着​你​。\n"
"cong2 kong4zhi4tai2 po4sui4 de5 ping2mu4 shang4，ni3 zi4ji3 de5 niu3qu1 dao4ying3 zheng1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"From the sound of that explosion, I'd guess that you killed a fair number of someones. Aleshire and his bodyguard at the very least, and probably a good half dozen more.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A morbid grin creases the mage's thin-lipped mouth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That makes you a *mass* murderer, mouse. You're moving up in the world."
msgstr ""
"从​那​爆炸声​听​来​，​你​怕​是​杀死​了​不少​人​。​至少​有​阿利​希尔​和​他​那​保镖​，​恐怕​另外​还有​好几个​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​法师​的​薄唇​绷出​病态​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这下​你​可是​成​了​*​大​*​屠夫​了​，​老鼠​。​你​在​这行​里​要​出名​喽​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 na4 bao4 zha2 sheng1 ting1 lai2，ni3 pa4 shi4 sha1si3 le5 bu4shao3 ren2。zhi4shao3 you3 e1 li4 xi1er3 he4 ta1 na4 bao3biao1，kong3pa4 ling4wai4 hai2you3 hao3 ji1 ge4 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 de5 bao2 chun2 beng3 chu1 bing4tai4 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4xia4 ni3 ke3shi4 cheng2 le5*dai4*tu2fu1 le5，lao3shu3。ni3 zai4 zhe4 xing2 li3 yao4 chu1ming2 lou5。"

msgid ""
"From what I could understand, it looks like the mages here have found a way to stabilize radioactive material.\n"
"\n"
"I guess that you could use somethin' like that for a lot of things... it's pretty open-ended. But somethin' tells me that I'm not gonna like whatever Vauclair's doin' with it."
msgstr ""
"从​我​所​理解​的​内容​来看​，​这里​的​法师​似乎​已经​找到​了​稳定​放射性物质​的​方法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​这种​技术​可以​应用​于​很多​领域​……​用途​非常​广泛​。​但​直觉​告诉​我​，​我​不会​喜欢​沃​克莱尔​用​它​做​的​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 wo3 suo3 li3jie3 de5 nei4rong2 lai2 kan4，zhe4li3 de5 fa3shi1 si4hu1 yi3jing1 zhao3dao4 le5 wen3ding4 fang4 she4 xing4 wu4 zhi4 de5 fang1fa3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhe4zhong3 ji4shu4 ke3yi3 ying4yong4 yu2 hen3 duo1 ling3yu4……yong4tu2 fei1chang2 guang3fan4。dan4 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，wo3 bu4hui4 xi3huan5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 yong4 ta1 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"From what I've seen here tonight, Glory was right on the mark when she said "
"that the Adversary was evil. If anyone here is ignorant, it's you."
msgstr ""
"根据​我​今晚​的​所见所闻​，​格洛丽​关于​反叛者​之恶​的​言论​可谓​一针见血​。​如果说​这里​有人​愚昧无知​的话​，​那​只能​是​你​。\n"
"gen1ju4 wo3 jin1wan3 de5 suo3jian4suo3wen2，Ge2luo4li2 guan1yu2 fan3 pan4 zhe3 zhi1 e4 de5 yan2lun4 ke3wei4 yi1zhen1jian4xie3。ru2guo3shuo1 zhe4li3 you3ren2 yu2mei4wu2zhi1 de5hua4，na4 zhi3neng2 shi4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"From what little you can pick up, it looks as though this lab was studying "
"animals that thrive in extremely hot environments. For what purpose, you "
"cannot say."
msgstr ""
"从​你​所能​了解​的​有限​信息​来看​，​这个​实验室​似乎​在​研究​能​在​极端​高温​环境​中​生存​的​动物​。​至于​研究​目的​，​你​无法​确定​。\n"
"cong2 ni3 suo3neng2 liao3jie3 de5 you3xian4 xin4xi1 lai2 kan4，zhe4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 si4hu1 zai4 yan2jiu1 neng2 zai4 ji2duan1 gao1wen1 huan2jing4 zhong4 sheng1cun2 de5 dong4wu4。zhi4yu2 yan2jiu1 mu4di4，ni3 wu2fa3 que4ding4。"

msgid ""
"From what you can tell, this lab has been experimenting with hyperthermophilic organisms... animals that thrive in temperatures high enough to kill most other organisms.\n"
"\n"
"There are details on a variety of different species of test animals. It looks as though the scientists who were working here were attempting to extract some form of genetic information from them, but for what purpose you cannot tell."
msgstr ""
"从​你​所​了解​的​情况​来看​，​这个​实验室​一直​在​研究​超​嗜​热菌​……​那些​能​在​足以​杀死​大多数​其他​生物​的​高温​环境​中​生存​的​生物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​记录​了​多种不同​实验​动物​的​详细信息​。​看来​在​这里​工作​的​科学家​们​试图​从​这些​动物​中​提取​某种​遗传信息​，​但​具体​目的​是​什么​，​你​无法​确定​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ni3 suo3 liao3jie3 de5 qing2kuang4 lai2 kan4，zhe4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 yi1zhi2 zai4 yan2jiu1 chao1 shi4 re4 jun1……na4xie1 neng2 zai4 zu2yi3 sha1si3 da4duo1shu4 qi2ta1 sheng1wu4 de5 gao1wen1 huan2jing4 zhong4 sheng1cun2 de5 sheng1wu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 ji4lu4 le5 duo1 zhong3 bu4 tong2 shi2yan4 dong4wu4 de5 xiang2 xi4 xin4 xi1。kan4lai5 zai4 zhe4li3 gong1zuo4 de5 ke1xue2jia1 men5 shi4tu2 cong2 zhe4xie1 dong4wu4 zhong4 ti2qu3 mou3zhong3 yi2chuan2xin4xi1，dan4 ju4ti3 mu4di4 shi4 shen2me5，ni3 wu2fa3 que4ding4。"

msgid ""
"From what you've told me about the Dragonslayer, I don't think He'd like the"
" way you're talking. Since when has He ever encouraged you to back down from"
" a fight?"
msgstr ""
"从​你​口中​的​屠龙​者​形象​来看​，​我​不​觉得​祂​会​喜欢​你​现在​的​说话​方式​。​难道​祂​会​鼓励​你​临阵脱逃​当​懦夫​吗​？\n"
"cong2 ni3 kou3 zhong4 de5 tu2 long2 zhe3 xing2xiang4 lai2 kan4，wo3 bu4 jue2de5 ta1 hui4 xi3huan5 ni3 xian4zai4 de5 shuo1hua4 fang1shi4。nan2dao4 ta1 hui4 gu3li4 ni3 lin2zhen4tuo1tao2 dang1 nuo4fu1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"From what you've told us about Plotz, he wouldn't want you in the picture, "
"either. There's bad blood between you two, right?"
msgstr ""
"从​你​刚刚​告诉​我们​关于​普​洛茨​的​事情​来看​，​他​也​不想​让​你​加入​。​你们​之间​有些​宿怨​，​对​吧​？\n"
"cong2 ni3 gang1gang5 gao4su4 wo3men5 guan1yu2 Pu3luo4ci2 de5 shi4qing5 lai2 kan4，ta1 ye3 bu4xiang3 rang4 ni3 jia1ru4。ni3men5 zhi1jian1 you3xie1 su4yuan4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "Front Door Exit"
msgstr ""
"前门​出口\n"
"qian2men2 chu1kou3"

msgid "Front Entrance"
msgstr ""
"前​入口\n"
"qian2 ru4kou3"

msgid "Front Exit"
msgstr ""
"前​出口\n"
"qian2 chu1kou3"

msgid "Fuchi Tech Savvy"
msgstr ""
"尖峰​科技​技术​专家\n"
"jian1feng1 ke1ji4 ji4shu4 zhuan1jia1"

msgid "Fuchi VirtuaX"
msgstr ""
"尖峰​科技​VirtuaX\n"
"jian1feng1 ke1ji4 VirtuaX"

msgid ""
"Fuchi created the VirtuaX for employees. Now deckers love to use it against "
"them."
msgstr ""
"这​款​出自​尖峰​科技​之手​的​碟​板​原本​是​一把​为​企业​雇员​们​打造​的​利器​，​但​如今​却​常常​被​碟​客们​用来​对付​它​原本​的​目标​用户​。\n"
"zhe4 kuan3 chu1zi4 jian1feng1 ke1ji4 zhi1 shou3 de5 die2 ban3 yuan2ben3 shi4 yi1 ba3 wei2 qi3ye4 gu4yuan2 men5 da3zao4 de5 li4qi4，dan4 ru2jin1 que4 chang2chang2 bei4 die2 ke4 men5 yong4lai2 dui4fu5 ta1 yuan2ben3 de5 mu4biao1 yong4hu4。"

msgid ""
"Fuchi line favored by many deckers, with integrated connections for most "
"common cyberdecks. Grants +1 Intelligence and +1 Decking."
msgstr ""
"尖峰​科技​产品线​上受​许多​碟客​喜爱​的​产品​，​配备​了​兼容​大多数​常见​赛博碟板​的​集成​连接​。​提供​+​1​智力​和​+​1​骇入​。\n"
"jian1feng1 ke1ji4 chan3 pin3 xian4 shang4 shou4 xu3duo1 die2 ke4 xi3ai4 de5 chan3pin3，pei4bei4 le5 jian1rong2 da4duo1shu4 chang2jian4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 de5 ji2cheng2 lian2jie1。ti2gong1 +1 zhi4li4 he4 +1 hai4 ru4。"

msgid ""
"Fuchi's line of urban wear used by street deckers. Grants +1 Intelligence "
"and +1 Decking."
msgstr ""
"尖峰​科技​的​都市​服饰​系列​，​专​为​街头​碟客​打造​。​提供​+​1​智力​与​+​1​骇入​。\n"
"jian1feng1 ke1ji4 de5 du1shi4 fu2shi4 xi4lie4，zhuan1 wei2 jie1tou2 die2 ke4 da3zao4。ti2gong1 +1 zhi4li4 yu4 +1 hai4 ru4。"

msgid "Fuckin' A, boss. I'm in."
msgstr ""
"这​他​妈​就​对​了​，​老大​。​算​我​一个​。\n"
"zhe4 ta1 ma1 jiu4 dui4 le5，lao3da4。suan4 wo3 yi1ge5。"

msgid "Fuel Canister"
msgstr ""
"燃料​罐\n"
"ran2liao4 guan4"

msgid "Full Auto Fire"
msgstr ""
"全自动​射击\n"
"quan2 zi4 dong4 she4ji1"

msgid "Full Auto available (weapon permitting)"
msgstr ""
"全自动​射击​可用​（​武器​允许​时​）\n"
"quan2 zi4 dong4 she4ji1 ke3 yong4 （wu3qi4 yun3xu3 shi2）"

msgid "Full auto mode disabled."
msgstr ""
"这​把​枪​的​全自动​射击​模式​被​禁用​了​。\n"
"zhe4 ba3 qiang1 de5 quan2 zi4 dong4 she4ji1 mo2shi4 bei4 jin1yong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Fumigatin'. Renovatin'. What's it to you? \n"
"\n"
"Closed is closed, and that's what we are."
msgstr ""
"别管​消毒​还是​翻修​，​你​问​那么​多​干什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​关​了​就是​关​了​，​现在​就​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"bie2guan3 xiao1du2 hai2shi5 fan1xiu1，ni3 wen4 na4me5 duo1 gan4shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"guan1 le5 jiu4shi4 guan1 le5，xian4zai4 jiu4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"Fumigating? The guy working the door said that you were closed for "
"renovations."
msgstr ""
"消毒​？​看门​的​家伙​不是​说​你们​在​翻修​吗​。\n"
"xiao1du2？kan4 men2 de5 jia1huo5 bu4shi4 shuo1 ni3men5 zai4 fan1xiu1 ma5。"

msgid ""
"Funny. In my experience, riggers usually stay away from the thick of combat."
" They tend to use their drones for that."
msgstr ""
"有意思​。​据我所知​，​机师​通常​会​远离​前线​战场​，​并用​无人机​代替​自己​作战​。\n"
"you3yi4si5。ju4wo3suo3zhi1，ji1shi1 tong1chang2 hui4 yuan3li2 qian2xian4 zhan4chang3，bing4 yong4 wu2ren2ji1 dai4ti4 zi4ji3 zuo4zhan4。"

msgid ""
"Funny. That's exactly what that recruit said as he was being dragged off to the medic's tent. \"It was just a joke! I didn't mean anything by it!\"\n"
"\n"
"I was never reprimanded by the top brass, though. They knew what I knew: whatever that recruit's intent, he put me in a situation that *required* a response."
msgstr ""
"有意思​。​那家伙​被​抬​去​医疗​帐篷​的​时候​也​是​这么​说​的​：​“​我​就是​开个​玩笑​！​我​没​别的​意思​！​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​并未​被​上层​责罚​。​他们​理解​我​的​做法​：​无论​那个​新兵​有​何等​意图​，​他​都​将​我​陷于​*​必须​*​做出​回应​的​境地​。\n"
"\n"
"you3yi4si5。na4 jia1 huo3 bei4 tai2 qu4 yi1liao2 zhang4peng5 de5 shi2hou5 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5：“wo3 jiu4shi4 kai1 ge4 wan2xiao4！wo3 mei2 bie2de5 yi4si5！” \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 bing4wei4 bei4 shang4ceng2 ze2fa2。ta1men5 li3jie3 wo3 de5 zuo4fa3：wu2lun4 na4ge5 xin1bing1 you3 he2deng3 yi4tu2，ta1 dou1 jiang1 wo3 xian4yu2*bi4xu1*zuo4chu1 hui2ying4 de5 jing4di4。"

msgid ""
"Funny. You're a funny $(l.guy).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ork's gauntleted fist tightens, and you hear the distinctive whir of his Vindicator's motor spinning up to speed. The barrels begin to blur as he wheels the weapon to face you.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"真​好笑​。​你​这​家伙​挺​有意思​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​兽​人​带​着​铁​手套​的​手​紧握​成拳​，​你​听见​“​辩护人​”​的​转轮​加速​时​那​标志性​的​嗡​鸣声​。​他​把​武器​转向​你​的​时候​，​枪管​的​转速​已经​快到​看不清​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 hao3xiao4。ni3 zhe4 jia1huo5 ting3 you3yi4si5 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 dai4 zhao2 tie3 shou3tao4 de5 shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2，ni3 ting1jian4“bian4hu4ren2” de5 zhuan4lun2 jia1su4 shi2 na4 biao1zhi4xing4 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。ta1 ba3 wu3qi4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3 de5 shi2hou5，qiang1guan3 de5 zhuan4su4 yi3jing1 kuai4 dao4 kan4bu5qing1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Fuse"
msgstr ""
"保险丝\n"
"bao3xian3si1"

msgid "Fusebox"
msgstr ""
"保险丝​盒\n"
"bao3xian3si1 he2"

msgid "G'night, pal."
msgstr ""
"晚安​，​朋友​。\n"
"wan3an1，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"G-GIVE ME THE CH-CH-CHIP!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice comes out in a shivering screech.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"YOU *PROMISED!*"
msgstr ""
"把​-​把​芯片​给​-​给​我​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​颤抖​着​尖叫​出​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​答应​*​的​！\n"
"\n"
"ba3 -ba3 xin1pian4 gei3 -gei3 wo3！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chan4dou3 zhao2 jian1jiao4 chu1 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*da1ying5*de5！"

msgid "GAME DIFFICULTY"
msgstr ""
"游戏​难度\n"
"you2xi4 nan2du4"

msgid "GENDER"
msgstr ""
"性别\n"
"xing4bie2"

msgid ""
"GLOBAL BACKGROUND COUNT RISING\n"
"July 10, 2055\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Jake Hansen is one of the world's foremost experts in mana dynamics. He's taken a break from his own research to travel to my lab. Since he's arrived, he's spent the better part of a day poring over reams of data that my team collected.\n"
"\n"
"Straightening, he looks me in the eye, and his normally jovial expression has turned grim. \"We're in trouble, Liz,\" he says."
msgstr ""
"全球​背景​数值​持续​攀升​\n"
"​2055​年​7​月​10​日​\n"
"​\n"
"​杰克​·​汉森​博士​是​全球​顶尖​的​魔力​动力学​专家​之一​。​他​暂停​了​自己​的​研究​，​专程​来到​我​的​实验室​。​自​抵达​以来​，​他​几乎​耗费​整整​一天​时间​，​仔细​研读​着​我​的​团队​收集​的​海量​数据​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​挺直​身子​，​目光​直视​着​我​，​那张​平日​开朗​的​脸庞​此刻​变得​阴沉​。​“​我们​遇上​麻烦​了​，​丽兹​，​”​他​说道​。\n"
