"访客​：​由于​恩施​塔德​及其​团队​已经​让​该​设施​处于​高度​戒备状态​，​恐怕​潜入​是​行不通​了​。​贵​团队​需要​正面​强攻​，​消灭​恩施​塔德​，​然后​撤离​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​：​任务​目标​明确​，​我​的​团队​可以​胜任​。​请问​贵方​提供​的​报酬​是​？\n"
"\n"
"fang3ke4：you2yu2 en1Shi1ta3de2 ji2qi2 tuan2dui4 yi3jing1 rang4 gai1 she4shi1 chu3yu2 gao1du4 jie4 bei4 zhuang4 tai4，kong3pa4 qian2ru4 shi4 xing2bu5tong1 le5。gui4 tuan2dui4 xu1yao4 zheng4mian4 qiang2gong1，xiao1mie4 en1Shi1ta3de2，ran2hou4 che4li2。\n"
"\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3：ren4wu5 mu4biao1 ming2que4，wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 ke3yi3 sheng4ren4。qing3wen4 gui4fang1 ti2gong1 de5 bao4chou5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"GUEST: Facing such dangers is the purpose of a shadowrunner, Herr Amsel. Your team will be rewarded handsomely for their services... my employers have set aside 20,000 nuyen for the job. Consider it hazard pay if you wish.\n"
"\n"
