"\n"
"fang3ke4：22,500 xin1 yuan2，zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 zui4zhong1 bao4jia4。"

msgid ""
"GUEST: Further, I can assist your team in disabling building security and gaining access to the 24th floor. From there, however, they will be on their own.\n"
"\n"
"P_AMSEL: Such vagueness can be dangerous, Herr Schmidt. I will not commit my team to a run without a better understanding of what the job entails."
