msgid ""
"Gesundbrunnen Station opened on April 18, 1930, as the final stop along the U-Bahn's U8 line. It was designed by prominent U-Bahn architect Alfred Grenander.\n"
"\n"
"Construction on the U8 line began in 1914 under Allgemeine Elektrizitäts-Gesellschaft, but labor shortages and the First World War put the project on hold for over a decade. The eventual completion and opening of this \"home line\" between Neukölln and Gesundbrunnen in 1930 represented a major step forward in connecting Berlin's working class districts to the city center."
msgstr ""
"健康​泉​车站​于​1930​年​4​月​18​日​开通​，​是​地铁​U8​线​的​终点站​。​它​由​著名​的​地铁​建筑师​阿尔弗雷​德​·​格​雷纳德​设计​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​U8​线于​1914​年​由​通用​电力公司​开始​建设​，​但​由于​劳动力​短缺​和​第一次世界大战​，​该​项目​被​搁置​了​十多年​。​1930​年​，​这​条​连接​新​科隆​和​健康​泉​的​“​主干线​”​最终​竣工​通车​，​标志​着​柏林​在​将​工人阶级​聚居区​与​市中心​连接起来​这​一方面​迈出​了​重要​一步​。\n"
"\n"
"jian4kang1 quan2 che1zhan4 yu2 1930 nian2 4 yue4 18 ri4 kai1tong1，shi4 di4tie3 U8 xian4 de5 zhong1dian3zhan4。ta1 you2 zhu4ming2 de5 di4tie3 jian4zhu4shi1 e1 er3 fu2 lei2 de2 · ge2 lei2 na4 de2 she4ji4。\n"
"\n"
"U8 xian4 yu2 1914 nian2 you2 tong1yong4 dian4 li4 gong1 si1 kai1shi3 jian4she4，dan4 you2yu2 lao2dong4li4 duan3que1 he4 di4yi1ci4shi4jie4da4zhan4，gai1 xiang4mu4 bei4 ge1zhi4 le5 shi2 duo1 nian2。1930 nian2，zhe4 tiao2 lian2jie1 xin1 ke1long2 he4 jian4kang1 quan2 de5“zhu3gan4xian4” zui4zhong1 jun4gong1 tong1che1，biao1zhi4 zhao2 bo2lin2 zai4 jiang1 gong1ren2jie1ji2 ju4 ju1 qu1 yu4 shi4zhong1xin1 lian2 jie1 qi3 lai2 zhe4 yi1fang1mian4 mai4chu1 le5 zhong4yao4 yi1 bu4。"

msgid ""
