"​\n"
"​让​别人​消失​才​是​他​的​*​工作​*​，​$(l.name)​。​“​绞肉机​”​派​他​来​意味着​他​根本​没想​让​你​活着​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 wo3 shuo1，tou2r5：zhe4ge5 wang2ba1dan4 qi2shi2 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 kuai4ji4。ta1 shi4 ge4 sha1shou3，ye3 shi4 fu3zuo3“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 er4ba3shou3。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 bie2ren5 xiao1shi1 cai2 shi4 ta1 de5*gong1zuo4*，$(l.name)。“jiao3rou4ji1” pai4 ta1 lai2 yi4wei4zhe5 ta1 gen1ben3 mei2 xiang3 rang4 ni3 huo2zhe5 li2kai1。"

