"​\n"
"​给​一棵​幼苗​浇水​能​得到​什么​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​在​黑夜​的​恐惧​中​拥抱​一个​孩子​又​能​得到​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"de2dao4？\n"
"\n"
"gei3 yi1 ke1 you4miao2 jiao1shui3 neng2 de2dao4 shen2me5……\n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3 zai4 hei1ye4 de5 kong3ju4 zhong4 yong1bao4 yi1ge5 hai2zi5 you4 neng2 de2dao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Getting involved is the entire reason why we came here."
msgstr ""
"我们​到​这里​来​就是​要​“​插手​”​事情​的​。\n"
"wo3men5 dao4 zhe4li3 lai2 jiu4shi4 yao4“cha1shou3” shi4qing5 de5。"

msgid "Getting kind of paranoid, aren’t you?"
msgstr ""
"你​是不是​太​偏执​了​？\n"
"ni3 shi4bu5shi4 tai4 pian1zhi2 le5？"

msgid ""
"Getting past the wall was fairly simple... you know how easy it is to obtain falsified papers. The biggest obstacle that I faced during my flight was the Adversary itself.\n"
"\n"
"I could run from Harrow, but how do you run from something that's tied to your own soul?"
