"翻越​那​堵墙​其实​相当​简单​……​你​也​知道​伪造​文件​有​多​容易​。​逃亡​途中​最大​的​阻碍​，​还是​在于​魔鬼​本身​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​逃离​哈罗​，​但​当​某种​存在​与​你​的​灵魂​相连​时​，​你​又​怎能​逃得​掉​？\n"
"\n"
"fan1yue4 na4 du3 qiang2 qi2shi2 xiang1dang1 jian3dan1……ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 wei3zao4 wen2jian4 you3 duo1 rong2yi4。tao2wang2 tu2zhong1 zui4 dai4 de5 zu3ai4，hai2shi5 zai4yu2 mo2gui3 ben3shen1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 tao2li2 ha1luo2，dan4 dang1 mou3zhong3 cun2zai4 yu4 ni3 de5 ling2hun2 xiang1lian2 shi2，ni3 you4 zen3neng2 tao2 de2 diao4？"

