"ji2 si1 bu4lei2 xi1 te4 de5 shou4quan2 mi4ma3，fa1xian4 yu2 an1bao3 ban4gong1shi4 nei4bu4。"

msgid ""
"Gingerly, Blitz steps forward. His hair is mussed, and there's a fresh bullet hole in his jacket.\n"
"\n"
"He smells like smoke, and blood, and stale sweat, and his hands tremble as he takes them out of his pockets."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​小心翼翼​地​走上​前来​。​他​的​头发​凌乱不堪​，​外套​上​还​新添​了​一个​弹孔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​身上​带​着​烟味​、​血腥味​和​陈旧​的​汗味​。​他​把手​从​口袋​里​伸出​来时​，​你​看到​它们​在​不住​地​颤抖​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 xiao3xin1yi4yi4 de5 zou3 shang4 qian2lai2。ta1 de5 tou2fa5 ling2luan4bu4kan1，wai4tao4 shang4 hai2 xin1 tian1 le5 yi1ge5 dan4kong3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen1shang5 dai4 zhao2 yan1 wei4、xie3 xing1 wei4 he4 chen2jiu4 de5 han2 wei4。ta1 ba3shou3 cong2 kou3dai4 li3 shen1chu1 lai2 shi2，ni3 kan4dao4 ta1men5 zai4 bu4zhu4 de5 chan4dou3。"

msgid ""
"Give $(l.him) a soykaf! A big one! And put it on my account! I like the cut "
"of $(l.hisher) jib."
msgstr ""
"给​$(l.he)​来杯​豆​咖​！​大杯​的​！​记在​我​账​上​！​我​喜欢​这​家伙​的​作风​。\n"
"gei3 $(l.he) lai2 bei1 dou4 ka1！dai4 bei1 de5！ji4 zai4 wo3 zhang4 shang4！wo3 xi3huan5 zhe4 jia1huo5 de5 zuo4feng1。"

msgid "Give her some time. We'll get to the bottom of this."
msgstr ""
"给​她​点​时间​吧​。​我们​会查​个​水落石出​的​。\n"
"gei3 ta1 dian3 shi2jian1 ba1。wo3men5 hui4 cha2 ge4 shui3luo4shi2chu1 de5。"

