"gei3 wo3 yi1 ba3 gou4 dai4 de5 qiang1，wo3 jiu4 neng2 gan4diao4 ren4he2 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Give me the bottle. I'm not running from this - I'll see it through to the "
"end, just like you will."
msgstr ""
"把酒​给​我​。​我​是​不会​逃避​的​—​—​我会​像​你​一样​见证​最后​的​结局​。\n"
"ba3jiu3 gei3 wo3。wo3 shi4 bu4hui4 tao2bi4 de5——wo3 hui4 xiang4 ni3 yi1yang4 jian4zheng4 zui4hou4 de5 jie2ju2。"

msgid "Give the Message to the Aztechnology Executive"
msgstr ""
"将​消息​告知​阿兹特​科技​高管\n"
"jiang1 xiao1xi5 gao4zhi1 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 gao1guan3"

msgid "Give the Rigger to Johson"
msgstr ""
"将​机师​交给​约翰逊\n"
"jiang1 ji1shi1 jiao1gei3 yue1han4xun4"

msgid "Give us the amulet, Marta. It's the right thing to do."
msgstr ""
"把​护身符​交​出来​，​玛​尔塔​。​这才​是​正确​的​做法​。\n"
"ba3 hu4shen1fu2 jiao1 chu1lai2，Ma3er3ta3。zhe4 cai2 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 zuo4fa3。"

msgid ""
"Given back to you by Maliit. Cannot be used by anyone but its programmed "
"\"owner.\""
msgstr ""
"玛丽​特​归还给​你​的​无人机​。​除了​其​预设​的​“​所有者​”​外​，​任何人​都​无法​使用​。\n"
"ma3li4 te4 gui1 hai2 gei3 ni3 de5 wu2ren2ji1。chu2le5 qi2 yu4she4 de5“suo3you3zhe3” wai4，ren4 he2 ren2 dou1 wu2fa3 shi3yong4。"

msgid ""
"Given the global pandemic of Wyrm Flu and the recent extinction of the "
"dragons, the announcement of a new strain of VITAS has caused considerable "
"panic throughout the UCAS. But local news sources from towns surrounding "
"Chicago have offered conflicting reports about the CZ, and about what it is "
"meant to contain."
msgstr ""
"鉴于​全球​龙​流感​大​流行​以及​龙族​近期​灭绝​的​事实​，​新型​病毒性​毒素​过敏​综合症​毒株​的​出现​已​在​整个​加​美​合众国​引发​严重​恐慌​。​然而​芝加哥​周边​城镇​的​当地​新闻来源​对​该​隔离区​及其​应​收容​内容​的​报道​存在​矛盾​。\n"
"jian4yu2 quan2qiu2 long2 liu2gan3 dai4 liu2xing2 yi3ji2 long2 zu2 jin4qi1 mie4jue2 de5 shi4shi2，xin1xing2 bing4du2xing4 du2su4 guo4min3 zong1he2zheng4 du2zhu1 de5 chu1xian4 yi3 zai4 zheng3ge4 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 yin3fa1 yan2zhong4 kong3huang1。ran2er2 zhi1jia1ge1 zhou1bian1 cheng2zhen4 de5 dang1di4 xin1 wen2 lai2 yuan2 dui4 gai1 ge2 li2 qu1 ji2qi2 ying1 shou1rong2 nei4rong2 de5 bao4dao4 cun2zai4 mao2dun4。"

msgid ""
"Giving you command of this team was a hasty decision, made for the wrong reasons. I stand by that assessment.\n"
"\n"
"But between then and now, I've been watching you like a hawk. And you've *grown,* $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"让​你​来​领导​这支​小队​，​是​出于​错误​原因​做出​的​仓促​决定​。​我​仍​坚持​这个​评价​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​从​那时​以来​，​我​一直​紧紧​盯​着​你​的​一举一动​，​而​你​确实​*​成长​了​*​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 ni3 lai2 ling3dao3 zhe4 zhi1 xiao3 dui4，shi4 chu1yu2 cuo4wu4 yuan2yin1 zuo4chu1 de5 cang1cu4 jue2ding4。wo3 reng2 jian1chi2 zhe4ge5 ping2jia4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 cong2 na4shi2 yi3lai2，wo3 yi1zhi2 jin3jin3 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yi1ju3yi1dong4，er2 ni3 que4shi2*cheng2zhang3 le5*，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Glad I could be of help. If you'd be so kind as to let me out of here, I'll "
"just be on my way."
msgstr ""
"乐意​帮忙​。​如果​你​愿意​大发慈悲​让​我​离开​的话​，​我​这​就​上路​。\n"
"le4yi4 bang1mang2。ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 dai4 fa1 ci2 bei1 rang4 wo3 li2kai1 de5hua4，wo3 zhe4 jiu4 shang4lu4。"

msgid "Glad I could be of service."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​能​为​你​效劳​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 wei2 ni3 xiao4lao2。"

msgid "Glad I could help. Take care of yourself."
msgstr ""
"帮上​忙​了​就​好​。​你​好好​照顾​自己​。\n"
"bang1 shang4 mang2 le5 jiu4 hao3。ni3 hao3hao3 zhao4gu5 zi4ji3。"

msgid "Glad to hear it. We're happy to have you on the team."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​听​你​这么​说​。​我们​很​乐意​接纳​你​加入​小队​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 ting1 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1。wo3men5 hen3 le4yi4 jie1na4 ni3 jia1ru4 xiao3 dui4。"

msgid "Glad to hear that He approves."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​让​祂​满意​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 rang4 ta1 man3yi4。"

msgid ""
"Glad to hear that we're in agreement. When you're ready to go, meet me at "
"the van - it's a long drive from here to the Schönbuch."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​我们​能​达成​一致​。​你​准备​好​出发​时​，​就​去​车上​找​我​—​—​从​这里​到​申布赫​可是​一段​长途​车程​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 neng2 da2cheng2 yi1zhi4。ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 chu1fa1 shi2，jiu4 qu4 che1 shang4 zhao3 wo3——cong2 zhe4li3 dao4 shen1 bu4 he4 ke3shi4 yi1 duan4 chang2tu2 che1cheng2。"

msgid ""
"Glad to see you all made it here alive.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich straightens, his joints cracking under the strain. He takes a step in your direction, his expression grim.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Listen, boss. We've got problems."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​看到​你们​都​活着​赶来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​挺直​身子​，​关节​因为​用力​而​噼啪​作响​。​他​朝​你​迈出​一步​，​表情​严肃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​老大​。​我们​有​麻烦​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 kan4dao4 ni3men5 dou1 huo2zhe5 gan3lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ting3zhi2 shen1zi5，guan1jie2 yin1wei4 yong4li4 er2 pi1pa1 zuo4 xiang3。ta1 chao2 ni3 mai4chu1 yi1 bu4，biao3qing2 yan2su4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，lao3da4。wo3men5 you3 ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid "Glad we could have this talk, Quorin. I'll be going now."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​能​和​你​谈谈​，​奎林​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 he4 ni3 tan2tan2，kui2 lin2。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "Glad we settled that. Let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""
"那么​这事​就​这样​了​。​我们​说点​别的​吧​。\n"
"na4me5 zhe4 shi4 jiu4 zhe4yang4 le5。wo3men5 shuo1 dian3 bie2de5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Glad we're on the same page. These bastards need to pay for what they've done... and they will, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"They've got numbers on us, but their tactics are predictable."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​我们​想法​一致​。​这些​杂种​要​为​他们​的​所作所为​付出代价​……​他们​死定了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​人数​比​我们​多​，​但​他们​的​战术​非常​套路​化​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 xiang3fa3 yi1zhi4。zhe4xie1 za2zhong3 yao4 wei2 ta1men5 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4……ta1men5 si3 ding4 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ren2shu4 bi3 wo3men5 duo1，dan4 ta1men5 de5 zhan4shu4 fei1chang2 tao4lu4 hua4。"

msgid ""
"Gladly.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns back to his terminal.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take care, chief."
msgstr ""
"好​主意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​继续​鼓捣​起​他​的​终端​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​保重​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 zhu3yi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 ji4xu4 gu3dao5 qi3 ta1 de5 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao3zhong4，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"Glancing at the menu, it looks like there are log entries reaching back for two weeks.\n"
"\n"
"All of the entries are attributed to the same author, and none of them appear to be password-protected."
msgstr ""
"你​看​了​眼​菜单​，​日志​条目​似乎​可以​追溯到​两周​前​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​条目​均​出自​同一​作者​之手​，​且​均​未设​密码​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4 le5 yan3 cai4dan1，ri4zhi4 tiao2mu4 si4hu1 ke3yi3 dui1 su4 dao4 liang3 zhou1 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 tiao2mu4 jun1 chu1zi4 tong2yi1 zuo4zhe3 zhi1 shou3，qie3 jun1 wei4 she4 mi4ma3。"

msgid ""
"Glancing at the wageslave's crumpled body, you assess your handiwork.\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't know any better, you could almost swear that he was asleep; your magic passed through the wageslave's body without a trace, attacking his essence but leaving his flesh unharmed."
msgstr ""
"你​瞥​了​一眼​那名​薪奴​软绵绵​的​身体​，​评估​了​一下​自己​的​成果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​不知情​的​人​看来​，​他​和​睡着​了​没什么​两样​；​你​的​魔法​无声无息​地​穿透​薪奴​的​身体​，​攻击​了​他​的​精华​，​却​没有​伤害​到​他​的​肉体​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4 ming2 xin1 nu2 ruan3mian2mian2 de5 shen1ti3，ping2gu1 le5 yi1xia4 zi4ji3 de5 cheng2guo3。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 bu4 zhi1 qing2 de5 ren2 kan4lai5，ta1 he4 shui4zhao2 le5 mei2shen2me5 liang3yang4 ； ni3 de5 mo2fa3 wu2sheng1wu2xi1 de5 chuan1tou4 xin1 nu2 de5 shen1ti3，gong1ji1 le5 ta1 de5 jing1hua2，que4 mei2you3 shang1hai4 dao4 ta1 de5 rou4ti3。"

msgid ""
"Glancing in the self-serve refrigerated section of the kiosk, you find a variety of sandwiches wrapped in slick plastic.\n"
"\n"
"You could eat for a week for the price of one of these things."
msgstr ""
"你​瞥​了​一眼​自助​冷藏柜​，​发现​里面​有​各种​裹​着​光滑​塑料膜​的​三明治​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一份​的​价格​足​足够​你​一周​的​饭钱​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 zi4zhu4 leng3 zang4 ju3，fa1xian4 li3mian4 you3 ge4zhong3 guo3 zhao2 guang1hua2 su4 liao4 mo2 de5 san1ming2zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 fen4 de5 jia4ge2 ju4 zu2gou4 ni3 yi1zhou1 de5 fan4 qian2 le5。"

msgid "Glory"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽\n"
"Ge2luo4li2"

msgid "Glory and Dietrich nod in agreement."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽和迪​特里​希​点头​表示同意​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 he4 Di2te4li3xi1 dian3tou2 biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。"

msgid ""
"Glory and Dietrich nod in agreement.\n"
"\n"
"Dante nudges your leg with his head."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽和迪​特里​希​点头​表示同意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但丁​用头​轻轻​蹭​了​蹭​你​的​腿​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 he4 Di2te4li3xi1 dian3tou2 biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 yong4 tou2 qing1qing1 ceng4 le5 ceng4 ni3 de5 tui3。"

msgid "Glory and Dietrich pause. Exchange looks with Paul."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽和迪​特里​希​一动不动​，​和保罗​交换​着​眼神​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 he4 Di2te4li3xi1 yi1dong4bu4dong4，he4 bao3 luo2 jiao1huan4 zhao2 yan3shen2。"

msgid ""
"Glory can use her adrenal pump on a downed ally to revive them at 25% HP. "
"Shares a cooldown with her regular Adrenal Pump ability. Cooldown: 5."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​可以​对​倒下​的​队友​使用​她​的​肾上腺素​泵​，​使​其​复苏​并​恢复​25​%​的​生命​值​。​此​能力​与​她​的​常规​肾上腺素​泵​能力​共享​冷却​时间​。​冷却​时间​：​5​回合​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ke3yi3 dui4 dao3xia4 de5 dui4you3 shi3yong4 ta1 de5 shen4shang4xian4su4 beng4，shi3 qi2 fu4su1 bing4 hui1fu4 25%de5 sheng1ming4 zhi2。ci3 neng2li4 yu4 ta1 de5 chang2gui1 shen4shang4xian4su4 beng4 neng2li4 gong4xiang3 leng3que4 shi2jian1。leng3que4 shi2jian1：5 hui2he2。"

msgid "Glory can use her adrenal pump on a downed ally to revive them."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​可以​使用​她​的​肾上腺素​泵​让​倒下​的​队友​复活​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ke3yi3 shi3yong4 ta1 de5 shen4shang4xian4su4 beng4 rang4 dao3xia4 de5 dui4you3 fu4huo2。"

msgid ""
"Glory carries a BuMoNa Gold Trauma kit on each mission, which brings back "
"downed characters with 50% HP. Replaces Basic BuMoNa kit."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​在​每次​任务​中​都​将​携带​一个​移动​医联​黄金​急救​套件​，​它​可以​被​用来​复活​倒下​的​角色​并​使​其​生命​值​恢复​至​50​%​。​替代​基础​移动​医联​急救​套件​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 zai4 mei3ci4 ren4wu5 zhong4 dou1 jiang1 xie2dai4 yi1ge5 yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 huang2jin1 ji2jiu4 tao4jian4，ta1 ke3yi3 bei4 yong4lai2 fu4huo2 dao3xia4 de5 jue2se4 bing4 shi3 qi2 sheng1ming4 zhi2 hui1fu4 zhi4 50 %。ti4dai4 ji1chu3 yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 ji2jiu4 tao4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Glory carries a BuMoNa Platinum Trauma kit on each mission, which brings "
"back downed characters with 100% HP. Replaces Basic/Gold BuMoNa kit."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​在​每次​任务​中​都​将​携带​一个​移动​医联​铂金​急救​套件​，​它​可以​被​用来​复活​倒下​的​角色​并​使​其​生命​值​完全恢复​。​替代​基础​ ​/​ ​黄金​移动​医联​急救​套件​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 zai4 mei3ci4 ren4wu5 zhong4 dou1 jiang1 xie2dai4 yi1ge5 yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 bo2jin1 ji2jiu4 tao4jian4，ta1 ke3yi3 bei4 yong4lai2 fu4huo2 dao3xia4 de5 jue2se4 bing4 shi3 qi2 sheng1ming4 zhi2 wan2 quan2 hui1 fu4。ti4dai4 ji1chu3/huang2jin1 yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 ji2jiu4 tao4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Glory carries a Premium Medkit on each mission, which heals a minimum of 30 "
"HP. Replaces Basic Medkit."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​在​每次​任务​中​都​将​携带​一个​顶级​急救包​，​它​至少​能​恢复​30​点​生命​值​。​替代​基础​急救包​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 zai4 mei3ci4 ren4wu5 zhong4 dou1 jiang1 xie2dai4 yi1ge5 ding3ji2 ji2jiu4bao1，ta1 zhi4shao3 neng2 hui1fu4 30 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2。ti4dai4 ji1chu3 ji2jiu4bao1。"

msgid ""
"Glory carries a custom Ruger Super Warhawk revolver, with hand-machined "
"armor piercing ammo. 14 DMG, 6 CAP, 4 Armor Pierce."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​将​携带​一把​定制​的​鲁格​超级​战鹰​左轮手枪​，​使用​手工​制作​的​穿甲弹​。​伤害​：​14​，​弹​容量​：​6​，​护甲​穿透​：​4​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 jiang1 xie2dai4 yi1 ba3 ding4zhi4 de5 lu3 ge2 chao1ji2 zhan4 ying1 zuo3lun2shou3qiang1，shi3yong4 shou3gong1 zhi4zuo4 de5 chuan1 jia3 dan4。shang1hai4：14，dan4 rong2liang4：6，hu4jia3 chuan1tou4：4。"

msgid ""
"Glory continues staring for a long moment at the spot where the projection of Harrow vanished. Her expression is unreadable.\n"
"\n"
"Slowly, she turns away."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​继续​盯​着​哈罗​的​投影​消失​的​地方​看​了​很​久​。​她​的​表情​耐人寻味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​缓缓​转过身​去​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ji4xu4 ding1 zhao2 ha1luo2 de5 tou2ying3 xiao1shi1 de5 di4fang1 kan4 le5 hen3 jiu3。ta1 de5 biao3qing2 nai4ren2xun2wei4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 huan3huan3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Glory cranes her neck to look up at the reeking, cadaverous thing that looms"
" over her."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​伸长​脖子​，​仰望​着​那团​秽​臭​扑鼻​、​形​如​尸骸​的​东西​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 shen1chang2 bo2zi5，yang3wang4 zhao2 na4 tuan2 hui4 chou4 pu1bi2、xing2 ru2 shi1hai2 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Glory falls silent. The color drains from her face."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​陷入​沉默​。​她​的​脸色苍白​如纸​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 xian4ru4 chen2mo4。ta1 de5 lian3 se4 cang1 bai2 ru2 zhi3。"

msgid ""
"Glory gains a melee attack, a razor slash followed up by a kick. Pierces up "
"to 1 Armor. May do AP DMG. Cost: 1 AP. Cooldown: 2."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​获得​一项​近战​攻击能力​，​一记​剃刀​挥砍​接上​踢击​。​最​多​提供​1​点护甲​穿透​。​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。​花费​：​1​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​2​回合​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 jin4 zhan4 gong1 ji1 neng2 li4，yi1 ji4 ti4dao1 hui1 kan3 jie1shang4 ti1 ji1。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。hua1fei4：1 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Glory gains a pistol ability, FirePower Round. Does an additional 2 DMG and "
"pierces up to 2 Armor. Cost: 1 AP. Cooldown: 2."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​获得​一项​手枪​能力​，​“​强力​弹​”​。​额外​造成​2​点​伤害​，​最高​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。​花费​：​1​点​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​2​回合​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 shou3qiang1 neng2li4，“qiang2li4 dan4”。e2wai4 zao4cheng2 2 dian3 shang1hai4，zui4gao1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。hua1fei4：1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Glory gains a pistol attack that targets up to 4 enemies and then opens fire"
" on all of them. -5% Accuracy. Must have at least three targets. Cost: 2 AP."
" Cooldown: 5."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​获得​一项​手枪​攻击能力​，​最多​可​锁定​4​个​敌人​，​然后​向​所有​目标​开火​。​精准度​-​5​%​。​至少​需要​锁定​三个​目标​。​花费​：​2​点​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​5​回合​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 huo4de2 yi1 xiang4 shou3qiang1 gong1 ji1 neng2 li4，zui4duo1 ke3 suo3ding4 4 ge4 di2ren2，ran2hou4 xiang4 suo3you3 mu4biao1 kai1huo3。jing1 zhun3 du4-5 %。zhi4shao3 xu1yao4 suo3ding4 san1 ge4 mu4biao1。hua1fei4：2 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：5 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Glory gains an armor stripping razor attack. Two hits, and each hit strips 2"
" Armor from the target. Cost: 2 AP. Cooldown: 2."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​获得​一种​能够​剥离​护甲​的​剃刀​攻击能力​。​攻击​两次​，​每次​攻击​剥离​目标​2​点护甲值​。​花费​：​2​点​行动​点​。​冷却​时间​：​2​回合​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 huo4de2 yi1zhong3 neng2gou4 bo1li2 hu4jia3 de5 ti4dao1 gong1 ji1 neng2 li4。gong1ji1 liang3 ci4，mei3ci4 gong1ji1 bo1li2 mu4biao1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。hua1fei4：2 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。leng3que4 shi2jian1：2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Glory gives you a curt nod, then falls back in line with the rest of the group.\n"
"\n"
"The soft glow of the command console beckons."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​生硬​地朝​你​点点头​，​然后​退​了​回去​，​跟​其他​队员​站​在​一起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​控制台​的​柔光​呼唤​着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 sheng1ying4 de5 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2，ran2hou4 tui4 le5 hui2qu5，gen1 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 zhan4 zai4 yi1qi3。\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 de5 rou2 guang1 hu1huan4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Glory gives you a significant glance.\n"
"\n"
"You can see the disgust in her eyes."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​意味深长​地瞥​了​你​一眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​看出​她​眼中​的​憎恶​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 yi4wei4shen1chang2 de5 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 zeng1e4。"

msgid ""
"Glory gives you a small nod. The blades slide back into her fingertips with "
"a click."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽朝​你​微微​点头​。​刀刃​咔哒​一声​滑回​她​的​指尖​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 chao2 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。dao1ren4 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 hua2 hui2 ta1 de5 zhi3jian1。"

msgid ""
"Glory glances up at the sound of your approach. She offers you a slight "
"smile."
msgstr ""
"听见​你​靠近​，​格洛丽​抬起头来​，​朝​你​微微一笑​。\n"
"ting1jian4 ni3 kao4jin4，Ge2luo4li2 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2，chao2 ni3 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。"

msgid ""
"Glory goes to work binding the park ranger's wounds. Within a few minutes, "
"she's staunched the worst of the bleeding."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​开始​为​公园​管理员​包扎​伤口​。​不​出​几分钟​，​她​便​止住​了​最​严重​的​出血​部分​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 kai1shi3 wei2 gong1yuan2 guan3li3yuan2 bao1za1 shang1kou3。bu4 chu1 ji1 fen4 zhong1，ta1 bian4 zhi3 zhu4 le5 zui4 yan2zhong4 de5 chu1xue4 bu4fen5。"

msgid ""
"Glory has modified her burst-fire Savalette to increase its stopping power."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​调整​过​的​连发​萨瓦​莱特​手枪​，​增强​了​它​的​杀伤力​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 tiao2zheng3 guo4 de5 lian2fa1 sa4 wa3 lai2te4 shou3qiang1，zeng1qiang2 le5 ta1 de5 sha1shang1li4。"

msgid ""
"Glory is - or was - magically active. The shred of her essence that flitted past your vision left you sure of it. What's more, you'd wager that she had real power once... terrifying power, of a sort that you can only guess at. \n"
"\n"
"All of this was surprising, but it was what you saw behind her aura that chilled you to the core."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​具有​—​—​或者说​曾经​具有​—​—​魔力​活性​。​那​抹​掠过​你​视野​的​精华​碎片​足以​让​你​确信​这​一点​。​更​甚者​，​你​敢​打赌​她​曾经​拥有​真正​的​力量​……​一种​令人​胆寒​的​力量​，​其​恐怖​程度​超乎​你​的​想象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​一切​都​令人震惊​，​但​真正​令​你​寒彻​骨髓​的​，​是​你​在​她​灵光​背后​所见​之物​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ju4you3——huo4 zhe3 shuo1 ceng2jing1 ju4you3——mo2li4 huo2xing4。na4 ma1 lu:e4guo4 ni3 shi4ye3 de5 jing1hua2 sui4pian4 zu2yi3 rang4 ni3 que4xin4 zhe4 yi1dian3。geng1 shen4 zhe3，ni3 gan3 da3du3 ta1 ceng2jing1 yong1you3 zhen1zheng4 de5 li4liang5……yi1zhong3 ling4ren2 dan3han2 de5 li4liang5，qi2 kong3bu4 cheng2du4 chao1 hu1 ni3 de5 xiang3xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 ling3 ren2 zhen4 jing1，dan4 zhen1zheng4 ling3 ni3 han2 che4 gu3sui3 de5，shi4 ni3 zai4 ta1 ling2guang1 bei4hou4 suo3jian4 zhi1 wu4。"

msgid ""
"Glory is beautiful, in a waifish sort of way. Her features are almost elvish"
" in their delicacy, but there's something cold about her that you find "
"slightly unsettling."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽长​得​很​美​，​蒲柳​弱质​的​那种​美​。​她​的​五官​如​精灵​一般​精致​，​但​那份​冷冽​感​总​让​人​隐隐​不安​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 zhang3 de2 hen3 mei3，pu2 liu3 ruo4 zhi4 de5 na4zhong3 mei3。ta1 de5 wu3guan1 ru2 jing1ling2 yi1ban1 jing1zhi4，dan4 na4 fen4 leng3lie4 gan3 zong3 rang4 ren2 yin3yin3 bu4an1。"

msgid ""
"Glory is up and moving, beelining for the spirit's weakened form. Her claws "
"glint redly in the infernal glow."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​起身​移动​，​向​精魂​虚弱​的​身躯​径直​冲​去​。​她​的​利爪​在​炼狱​般的​光芒​中泛​着​红光​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 qi3shen1 yi2dong4，xiang4 jing1hun2 xu1ruo4 de5 shen1qu1 jing4zhi2 chong1 qu4。ta1 de5 li4zhao3 zai4 lian4yu4 ban1 de5 guang1mang2 zhong4 fan4 zhao2 hong2 guang1。"

msgid ""
"Glory lets out a startled cry, cutting your sentence short. Out of the corner of your eye, you see her wheel to face something behind you.\n"
"\n"
"All at once, the room fills with a slaughterhouse smell, a smell like blood and bile and feces. The stench of an abattoir."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​惊叫​一声​，​打断​了​你​的话​。​你​瞥见​她​猛地​转身​，​面对​着​你​身后​的​某种​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​刹那间​，​屠宰场​的​气味​充斥​在​整个​房间​中​—​—​那​是​血腥​、​胆汁​与​粪便​混合​在​一起​散发出​的​恶臭​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 jing1jiao4 yi1sheng1，da3duan4 le5 ni3 de5hua4。ni3 pie1jian4 ta1 meng3de5 zhuan3shen1，mian4dui4 zhao2 ni3 shen1hou4 de5 mou3zhong3 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"cha4 na4 jian1，tu2zai3chang3 de5 qi4wei4 chong1chi4 zai4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1 zhong4——na4 shi4 xue4xing1、dan3zhi1 yu4 fen4bian4 hun4he2 zai4 yi1qi3 san3 fa1 chu1 de5 e4chou4。"

msgid ""
"Glory looks up at you. Her eyes are sunken and hollow, and the aura of loss about her is palpable.\n"
"\n"
"She looks like a woman who has been through Hell."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​仰望​着​你​。​她​的​双眼​深陷​而​空洞​，​那​份​失落​的​灵光​几乎​触手可及​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​活像​个​从​地狱​里​走​出来​的​女人​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 yang3wang4 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 shen1xian4 er2 kong1dong4，na4 fen4 shi1luo4 de5 ling2guang1 ji1hu1 chu4shou3ke3ji2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 huo2xiang4 ge4 cong2 di4yu4 li3 zou3 chu1lai2 de5 nu:3ren2。"

msgid ""
"Glory looks up from her preparations at the sound of your approach. She "
"offers you a slight smile."
msgstr ""
"听见​你​靠近​，​格洛丽​从​准备​工作​中​抬起头来​，​朝​你​微微一笑​。\n"
"ting1jian4 ni3 kao4jin4，Ge2luo4li2 cong2 zhun3bei4 gong1zuo4 zhong4 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2，chao2 ni3 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。"

msgid "Glory must be in the party."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​必须​在​队伍​中​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 bi4xu1 zai4 dui4wu3 zhong4。"

msgid "Glory needed Monika as much as any of us. Maybe more."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​和​我们​每个​人​一样​都​需要​莫妮卡​。​甚至​可能​更​甚​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 he4 wo3men5 mei3ge4 ren2 yi1yang4 dou1 xu1yao4 Mo4ni1ka3。shen4zhi4 ke3neng2 geng1 shen4。"

msgid ""
"Glory nods and steps forward.\n"
"\n"
"As she stands next to the Cyberzombie, you can't help but notice how much chrome riddles her own body."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽点​了​点头​，​然后​走上​前​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​她​在​赛博​僵尸​旁边​站​定时​，​你​不禁​注意​到​她​身上​遍布​着​铬​合金​的​痕迹​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 dian3 le5 dian3tou2，ran2hou4 zou3 shang4 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 zai4 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 pang2bian1 zhan4 ding4shi2，ni3 bu4jin1 zhu4yi4 dao4 ta1 shen1shang5 bian4bu4 zhao2 ge4 he2jin1 de5 hen2ji4。"

msgid "Glory nods grimly. Evidently, she has come to the same conclusion."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​悲哀​地点​了​点头​。​显然​，​她​得出​了​一模一样​的​结论​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 bei1ai1 di4dian3 le5 dian3tou2。xian3ran2，ta1 de2chu1 le5 yi1mu2yi1yang4 de5 jie2lun4。"

msgid "Glory nods her assent."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​点点头​，​表示同意​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 dian3 dian3 tou2，biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。"

msgid "Glory nods in agreement."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​点头​表示同意​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 dian3tou2 biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。"

msgid ""
"Glory nods, then reaches into her satchel.\n"
"\n"
"Her hand comes back out clutching a small jar."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​点点头​，​然后​把手​伸进​挎包​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​她​掏出​了​一个​小​罐子​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 dian3 dian3 tou2，ran2hou4 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 kua4bao1。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4 ta1 tao1chu1 le5 yi1ge5 xiao3 guan4zi5。"

msgid ""
"Glory pauses at the side of the van. She traces the side of it with a claw."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​停​在​货车​旁​，​用​利爪​轻轻​划过​车身​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ting2 zai4 huo4che1 pang2，yong4 li4zhao3 qing1qing1 hua2guo4 che1shen1。"

msgid ""
"Glory pauses for a moment to collect herself. She looks haggard, and her pale cheeks are flushed blood red.\n"
"\n"
"She swallows hard, then presses forward."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​停顿​片刻​整理​情绪​。​她​面容​憔悴​，​苍白​的​脸颊​泛起​血色​红晕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​用力​咽​了​口​唾沫​，​随即​继续​说道​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 zheng3li3 qing2xu4。ta1 mian4rong2 qiao2cui4，cang1bai2 de5 lian3jia2 fan4qi3 xue4se4 hong2yun4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yong4li4 yan1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5，sui2ji2 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。"

msgid "Glory pauses. She looks flustered, her composure cracked."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​停顿​了​一下​。​她​显得​心烦意乱​，​神情​已然​失​了​方寸​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4。ta1 xian3de5 xin1fan2yi4luan4，shen2qing2 yi3ran2 shi1 le5 fang1cun4。"

msgid "Glory raises an eyebrow. Slightly."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​略略​扬起​一条​眉毛​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 lu:e4lu:e4 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。"

msgid ""
"Glory said that you two spent a lot of time in the lounge back when she "
"lived here. What did you do there?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​说​，​她​还​生活​在​这里​的​时候​，​你们​俩​常常​待​在​休息室​。​你们​在​那里​做​什么​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 shuo1，ta1 hai2 sheng1huo2 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 shi2hou5，ni3men5 lia3 chang2chang2 dai1 zai4 xiu1xi1shi4。ni3men5 zai4 na4li5 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Glory shudders, but holds her silence."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​打了个​寒战​，​但​仍​保持​着​沉默​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 da3 le5 ge4 han2zhan4，dan4 reng2 bao3chi2 zhao2 chen2mo4。"

msgid ""
"Glory slams her cyber-arm against the door, and the crack of splintering plastic fills your ears.\n"
"\n"
"The door pops open."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽用​赛博​手臂​抵住​门​，​塑料​碎裂​的​咔嚓​声​在​耳边​响起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门​应声​而开​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 yong4 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 di3zhu4 men2，su4liao4 sui4lie4 de5 ka1cha1 sheng1 zai4 er3 bian1 xiang3qi3。\n"
"\n"
"men2 ying4sheng1 er2 kai1。"

msgid ""
"Glory slams her cyberarm against the wall, and the weak wood slats give way "
"with a crunch."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽用​金属​义肢​撞​了​一下​墙​，​本​就​不​牢固​的​木板​条​发出​嘎吱​一声​，​轰然​倒塌​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 yong4 jin1shu3 yi4zhi1 zhuang4 le5 yi1xia4 qiang2，ben3 jiu4 bu4 lao2gu4 de5 mu4ban3 tiao2 fa1chu1 ga1zhi1 yi1sheng1，hong1ran2 dao3ta1。"

msgid ""
"Glory slams her metallic shoulder into the door.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽用​她​的​金属​肩膀​撞门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​任何​反应​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 yong4 ta1 de5 jin1shu3 jian1bang3 zhuang4 men2。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ren4he2 fan3ying4。"

msgid ""
"Glory stalks toward Harrow, her claws at her sides. A ghastly smile creases her face, and it widens further as she draws near. The nightmare creatures from the Adversary's domain fall back at her approach.\n"
"\n"
"Impossibly, the fingers of her right hand begin to *glow,* just as they did in the Adversary's domain. The metal goes from cherry red to yellow-white in an instant, and waves of heat wash over you."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​步步​逼近​哈罗​，​利爪​垂​在​身侧​。​她​脸上​浮现​出​骇人​的​笑容​，​随着​距离​拉近​，​那​笑容​愈发​狰狞​。​来自​反叛者​领域​的​梦魇​生物​也​纷纷​退避​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不可思议​的​是​，​她​右手​的​手指​开始​*​发光​*​，​就​像​在​反叛者​的​领域​时​那样​。​她​指尖​的​金属​瞬间​从​浅红​转为​白炽​，​热浪​扑面而来​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 bu4bu4 bi1jin4 ha1luo2，li4zhao3 chui2 zai4 shen1 ce4。ta1 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 hai4ren2 de5 xiao4rong2，sui2zhe5 ju4li2 la1jin4，na4 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 zheng1ning2。lai2zi4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 ling3yu4 de5 meng4yan3 sheng1wu4 ye3 fen1fen1 tui4bi4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4ke3si1yi4 de5 shi4，ta1 you4shou3 de5 shou3zhi3 kai1shi3*fa1guang1*，jiu4 xiang4 zai4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 ling3yu4 shi2 na4yang4。ta1 zhi3jian1 de5 jin1shu3 shun4jian1 cong2 jian1 hong2 zhuai3 wei2 bai2chi4，re4lang4 pu1mian4er2lai2。"

msgid ""
"Glory stands staring at the red ruin of Marta's body. Her eyes flit down to "
"her claws, and an expression of growing horror creeps across her face."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​愣​在​原地​，​凝视着​玛​尔塔​血肉模糊​的​残骸​。​她​的​目光​掠过​自己​的​利爪​，​惊骇​之色​在​脸上​逐渐​蔓延​开来​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 leng4 zai4 yuan2di4，ning2 shi4 zhao2 Ma3er3ta3 xue4rou4mo2hu5 de5 can2hai2。ta1 de5 mu4guang1 lu:e4guo4 zi4ji3 de5 li4zhao3，jing1hai4 zhi1 se4 zai4 lian3 shang4 zhu2jian4 man4yan2 kai1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Glory stands, an introspective look on her face. At the sound of your "
"approach, she turns to face you."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽站​在​那里​，​脸上​带​着​沉思​的​神情​。​她​听见​你​走近​的​脚步声​，​转过身​来​面对​你​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 zhan4 zai4 na4li5，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 chen2si1 de5 shen2qing2。ta1 ting1jian4 ni3 zou3jin4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1，zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 mian4dui4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Glory stares at the photo. Her face is devoid of expression.\n"
"\n"
"After a moment, she closes her eyes."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​凝视着​照片​。​她​的​脸上​毫无​表情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​她​闭上眼睛​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 zhao4pian4。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 hao2wu2 biao3qing2。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ta1 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1。"

msgid ""
"Glory stares at you for a hard second, then turns her head away.\n"
"\n"
"With a quick, bird-like movement, she thrusts a finger into her mouth and rubs her teeth vigorously."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​凝视​了​你​一秒钟​，​随即​移开​视线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​如​小鸟​般​灵敏​地​将​手指​伸进​嘴里​，​用力​擦拭​着​牙齿​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ning2shi4 le5 ni3 yi1 miao3 zhong1，sui2ji2 yi2kai1 shi4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ru2 xiao3niao3 ban1 ling2min3 de5 jiang1 shou3zhi3 shen1 jin4 zui3li3，yong4li4 ca1shi4 zhao2 ya2chi3。"

msgid ""
"Glory stares at you for a hard second, then turns her head away.\n"
"\n"
"With a quick, birdlike movement, she thrusts a finger into her mouth and rubs her teeth vigorously."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​凝视​了​你​一秒钟​，​随即​移开​视线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​如​小鸟​般​灵敏​地​将​手指​伸进​嘴里​，​用力​擦拭​着​牙齿​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ning2shi4 le5 ni3 yi1 miao3 zhong1，sui2ji2 yi2kai1 shi4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ru2 xiao3niao3 ban1 ling2min3 de5 jiang1 shou3zhi3 shen1 jin4 zui3li3，yong4li4 ca1shi4 zhao2 ya2chi3。"

msgid ""
"Glory steals another glance at the dead cultists. She looks back up at the "
"ranger and gives him a curt nod."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​又​瞥​了​一眼​死去​的​教徒​。​她​转头​看​向​管理员​，​点头​示意​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 you4 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 si3qu4 de5 jiao4tu2。ta1 zhuan3tou2 kan4 xiang4 guan3li3yuan2，dian3tou2 shi4yi4。"

msgid ""
"Glory steps forward, trepidation on her face. Standing before the towering form of the spirit, she looks frail and small.\n"
"\n"
"She takes a deep breath, steels herself, and speaks."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​迈步​向前​，​脸上​满是​忐忑​。​在​这​高大​的​精魂​面前​，​她​显得​如此​纤弱​而​渺小​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​深吸​一口气​，​打起精神​，​然后​开口​说道​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 mai4bu4 xiang4qian2，lian3 shang4 man3 shi4 tan3te4。zai4 zhe4 gao1da4 de5 jing1hun2 mian4qian2，ta1 xian3de5 ru2ci3 xian1ruo4 er2 miao3xiao3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，da3 qi3 jing1 shen2，ran2hou4 kai1kou3 shuo1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Glory takes a moment to examine the protrusion at the base of the MKVI's spine. Then she pops the case on the Cyberzombie's control unit.\n"
"\n"
"Her sculpted fingers flicker and dance in the MKVI's circuitry. A moment later, a strange shiver runs through its body."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽花​了​片刻​时间​检查​MKVI​脊柱​底部​的​凸起​物​，​随即​撬​开赛​博​僵尸​控制​单元​的​外壳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​修长​的​手指​在​MKVI​的​电路​间​灵活​舞动着​。​不​出​片刻​，​MKVI​的​躯体​诡异​地​颤​了​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 hua1 le5 pian4ke4 shi2jian1 jian3cha2 MKVI ji3zhu4 di3bu4 de5 tu1qi3 wu4，sui2ji2 qiao4 kai1sai4 bo2 jiang1shi1 kong4zhi4 dan1yuan2 de5 wai4ke2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiu1chang2 de5 shou3zhi3 zai4 MKVI de5 dian4lu4 jian1 ling2huo2 wu3 dong4 zhao2。bu4 chu1 pian4ke4，MKVI de5 qu1ti3 gui3yi4 de5 chan4 le5 yi1xia4。"

msgid "Glory! Are you okay?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​！​你​还好​吗​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2！ni3 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Glory's Adrenal Pump lasts one additional round, for a total of 4 RNDs. "
"Cooldown: 5."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​的​肾上腺素​泵​额外​增加​一​回合​持续时间​。​总计​4​回合​。​冷却​时间​：​5​回合​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 de5 shen4shang4xian4su4 beng4 e2wai4 zeng1jia1 yi1 hui2he2 chi2xu4shi2jian1。zong3ji4 4 hui2he2。leng3que4 shi2jian1：5 hui2he2。"

msgid "Glory's Armored Vest"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​的​防弹背心\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 de5 fang2 dan4 bei1 xin1"

msgid "Glory's Ring"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​的​戒指\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 de5 jie4zhi5"

msgid ""
"Glory's eyes go wide. She opens her mouth to speak, but no sound escapes "
"her."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽瞪大​了​眼睛​。​她​张开嘴​想要​说话​，​却​发不出​任何​声音​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。ta1 zhang1 kai1 zui3 xiang3yao4 shuo1hua4，que4 fa1 bu4 chu1 ren4he2 sheng1yin1。"

msgid ""
"Glory's right. There's no way around this.\n"
"\n"
"If Alice knows how we can kill this thing, we have to at least try."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​说得对​，​我们​没得选​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然​爱丽丝​知道​怎么​除掉​这​东西​，​我们​至少​该​试一试​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 shuo1 de2 dui4，wo3men5 mei2 de2 xuan3。\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ai4li4si1 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 chu2diao4 zhe4 dong1xi1，wo3men5 zhi4shao3 gai1 shi4yi1shi4。"

msgid "Glory, do you have any insights about any of this?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​对​这​一切​有​什么​想法​吗​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 dui4 zhe4 yi1qie4 you3 shen2me5 xiang3fa3 ma5？"

msgid "Glory, know anything about this ring?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​知道​关于​这枚​戒指​的​事​吗​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 zhi1dao4 guan1yu2 zhe4 mei2 jie4zhi5 de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Glory.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The voice is deep, but faint, and marred by echoes. It sounds as if he's shouting from the far end of a long tunnel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You shouldn't have come here. I was content to let you live out your life in peace."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​声音​低沉​而​微弱​，​还​带​着​回音​，​仿佛​是从​长长的​隧道​尽头​传来​的​呼喊​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不该​来​这里​。​我本​希望​让​你​安度​余生​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sheng1yin1 di1chen2 er2 wei1ruo4，hai2 dai4 zhao2 hui2yin1，fang3fu2 shi4 cong2 zhang3 zhang3 de5 sui4dao4 jin4tou2 chuan2lai2 de5 hu1han3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4gai1 lai2 zhe4li3。wo3 ben3 xi1wang4 rang4 ni3 an1 du4 yu2sheng1。"

msgid "Glory. Did you ever do... *this?*"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​以前​也​做​过​……​*​这个​*​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 yi3qian2 ye3 zuo4 guo4……*zhe4ge5*？"

msgid ""
"Glory. Our damaged enigma. I've known her for almost five years now, but I don't think that I'll ever really *know* her.\n"
"\n"
"Somehow, I doubt that anyone will."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​一个​伤痕累累​的​谜团​。​我​和​她​已经​认识​快​五年​了​，​但​我​从未​真正​*​了解​*​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​这​世上​没人能​了解​她​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，yi1ge5 shang1hen2lei3lei3 de5 mi2tuan2。wo3 he4 ta1 yi3jing1 ren4shi5 kuai4 wu3 nian2 le5，dan4 wo3 cong2wei4 zhen1zheng4*liao3jie3*ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 zhe4 shi4shang4 mei2 ren2 neng2 liao3jie3 ta1。"

msgid "Glory..."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​……\n"
"Ge2luo4li2……"

msgid ""
"Glory... I think that we need to change our plans. The cultists here... "
"they're just a bunch of poor, brainwashed kids. After everything I've seen "
"tonight, I can't justify putting their lives at risk."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​……​我​想​我们​需要​改变​计划​。​这里​的​教徒​……​只是​一群​被​洗脑​的​可怜​孩子​。​今晚​我​目睹​的​一切​让​我​无法​随随便便​就​将​他们​的​生命​置于​危险​之中​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2……wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 xu1yao4 gai3bian4 ji4hua4。zhe4li3 de5 jiao4tu2……zhi3shi4 yi1 qun2 bei4 xi3nao3 de5 ke3lian2 hai2zi5。jin1wan3 wo3 mu4du3 de5 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 wu2fa3 sui2 sui2 bian4 bian4 jiu4 jiang1 ta1men5 de5 sheng1ming4 zhi4yu2 wei1xian3 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"Glory... I'm not a team leader anymore. There is no *team.* Amsel and Monika"
" are dead, Eiger and Dietrich are leaving, and you're off to find Harrow."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​……​我​哪​还​算​什么​队长​啊​。​*​队伍​*​已经​散​了​。​阿姆​泽尔​和​莫妮卡​都​死​了​，​艾格尔和迪​特里​希都​要​走​，​现在​你​又​要​去​找​哈罗​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2……wo3 na3 hai2 suan4 shen2me5 dui4zhang3 a1。*dui4wu3*yi3jing1 san3 le5。E1mu3ze2er3 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 dou1 si3 le5，Ai4ge2er3 he4 Di2te4li3xi1 dou1 yao4 zou3，xian4zai4 ni3 you4 yao4 qu4 zhao3 ha1luo2。"

msgid ""
"Glory... I'm sorry that I made you feel so terrible that you needed to lash out. It's my fault, and I accept that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She sounds hurt and confused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I just want to make things right."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​……​很​抱歉​我​让​你​感到​如此​愤怒​，​以至于​你​不得不​发泄​出来​。​这​是​我​的​错​，​我​承认​这​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​听​起来​伤心​而​又​迷茫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​想​做​对​的​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2……hen3 bao4qian4 wo3 rang4 ni3 gan3dao4 ru2ci3 fen4nu4，yi3zhi4yu2 ni3 bu4de2bu4 fa1xie4 chu1lai2。zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 cuo4，wo3 cheng2ren4 zhe4 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting1 qi3lai5 shang1xin1 er2 you4 mi2mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 zuo4 dui4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"Glory... what happened to your pendant? The ward that you were wearing - "
"where is it?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​……​你​的​吊​坠​呢​？​你​戴​着​的​那个​护身符​—​—​它​去​哪儿​了​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2……ni3 de5 diao4 zhui4 ni2？ni3 dai4 zhao2 de5 na4ge5 hu4shen1fu2——ta1 qu4 na3r5 le5？"

msgid "Glory... what--"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​……​什么​—​—\n"
"Ge2luo4li2……shen2me5 — —"

msgid "Glory... you okay?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​……​你​还好​吗​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2……ni3 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid "Glory...?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​……​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2……？"

msgid "GloryErrantSwap"
msgstr ""
"GloryErrantSwap\n"
"GloryErrantSwap"

msgid ""
"Glory’s eyes sweep across the group, then land on Amsel’s body. Her expression is impossible to read.\n"
"\n"
"After a moment, she turns her head to look at you."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​的​目光​扫​过​众人​，​最终​落​在​阿姆​泽尔​的​尸体​上​。​她​的​表情​难以捉摸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过​了​一会儿​，​她​转过​头​看​向​你​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 de5 mu4guang1 sao3 guo4 zhong4ren2，zui4zhong1 la4 zai4 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 shi1ti3 shang4。ta1 de5 biao3qing2 nan2yi3zhuo1mo1。\n"
"\n"
"guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。"

msgid "Glossary"
msgstr ""
"术语表\n"
"shu4 yu3 biao3"

msgid "Glue"
msgstr ""
"胶水​术\n"
"jiao1shui3 shu4"

msgid "Glued: Cannot Move"
msgstr ""
"粘住​：​无法​移动\n"
"zhan1 zhu4：wu2fa3 yi2dong4"

msgid "Go Downstairs"
msgstr ""
"下楼\n"
"xia4lou2"

msgid "Go Upstairs"
msgstr ""
"上楼\n"
"shang4lou2"

msgid "Go ahead and clarify it for me."
msgstr ""
"还是​你​给​我​说​清楚​些​吧​。\n"
"hai2shi5 ni3 gei3 wo3 shuo1 qing1chu5 xie1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Go ahead and do whatever you need to do, but don't leave this room, you hear?\n"
"\n"
"I want to keep an eye on you."
msgstr ""
"你​过去​做​你​的​事情​吧​。​但​你​不能​离开​这​房间​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还是​得​盯​着​点​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 guo4qu4 zuo4 ni3 de5 shi4qing5 ba1。dan4 ni3 bu4neng2 li2kai1 zhe4 fang2jian1，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 de2 ding1 zhao2 dian3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Go ahead and leaf through the book if you want to. But try to be quick, okay?\n"
"\n"
"I don't want to stay in here any longer than we have to."
msgstr ""
"你​愿意​的话​就​去​翻书​看看​吧​。​但​动作​要​快​，​好​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​在​这里​多待​一秒钟​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4 jiu4 qu4 fan1 shu1 kan4kan5 ba1。dan4 dong4zuo4 yao4 kuai4，hao3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4li3 duo1 dai1 yi1 miao3 zhong1。"

msgid "Go ahead and leave if you want. But this is on *you,* not me."
msgstr ""
"你​想​离开​也​随​你​的​便​。​但​这件​事要​怪​*​你​*​，​而​不是​我​。\n"
"ni3 xiang3 li2kai1 ye3 sui2 ni3 de5 bian4。dan4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 yao4 guai4*ni3*，er2 bu4shi4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Go ahead and run, you fucking coward. Run back to the real world and "
"whatever hole you crawled out of. We'll catch you."
msgstr ""
"跑​吧​，​你​这​该死​的​懦夫​。​跑​回​现实​世界​，​回到​你​栖身​的​老鼠洞​里​。​我们​会​抓住​你​的​。\n"
"pao2 ba1，ni3 zhe4 gai1si3 de5 nuo4fu1。pao2 hui2 xian4shi2 shi4jie4，hui2dao4 ni3 qi1shen1 de5 lao3shu3dong4 li3。wo3men5 hui4 zhua1zhu4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Go ahead and slot it, bitch. It'll take you on the ride of your life."
msgstr ""
"有​本事​就​装上​试试​啊​，​贱人​。​保证​让​你​直接​爽到​死翘翘​。\n"
"you3 ben3shi4 jiu4 zhuang1 shang4 shi4 shi4 a1，jian4ren2。bao3zheng4 rang4 ni3 zhi2jie1 shuang3 dao4 si3qiao4qiao4。"

msgid "Go ahead, Dietrich. I’m listening."
msgstr ""
"说​吧​，​迪​特里​希​，​我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"shuo1 ba1，Di2te4li3xi1，wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Go ahead, Harrow. Try to set up another cult.\n"
"\n"
"You won't get far before I hunt you down."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​，​你​有​本事​就​再​建立​一个​邪教​试试​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要不了​多久​，​我​就​会​抓​到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2，ni3 you3 ben3shi4 jiu4 zai4 jian4li4 yi1ge5 xie2jiao4 shi4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 bu4 le5 duo1jiu3，wo3 jiu4 hui4 zhua1 dao4 ni3。"

msgid "Go ahead, I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"说​吧​，​我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"shuo1 ba1，wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Go ahead, ask away."
msgstr ""
"尽管​问​吧​。\n"
"jin3guan3 wen4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Go ahead, make your excuses. We all make our own choices in life, and when "
"you chose to hurt innocent kids, my sympathy for you went right out the "
"window."
msgstr ""
"尽管​找​借口​吧​。​人生​选择​各不相同​，​但​当​你​选择​伤害​无辜​的​孩子​时​，​我​对​你​的​同情​便​荡然无存​。\n"
"jin3guan3 zhao3 jie4kou3 ba1。ren2sheng1 xuan3ze2 ge4bu4xiang1tong2，dan4 dang1 ni3 xuan3ze2 shang1hai4 wu2gu1 de5 hai2zi5 shi2，wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 tong2qing2 bian4 dang4ran2wu2cun2。"

msgid "Go ahead, then. I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"说​吧​，​我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"shuo1 ba1，wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Go ahead, then. You've got my attention."
msgstr ""
"继续​吧​。​你​引起​了​我​的​兴趣​。\n"
"ji4xu4 ba1。ni3 yin3qi3 le5 wo3 de5 xing4qu4。"

msgid "Go ahead."
msgstr ""
"说​吧​。\n"
"shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Go ahead. Blame me for spoiling your half-assed intervention. If you really "
"cared about that kid, you'd have done something to help him a long time ago."
msgstr ""
"行​啊​，​尽管​赖​我​好​了​。​赖​我​破坏​了​你​这​假模假式​的​叔侄​情​。​你​现在​知道​关心​那小子​了​？​那​你​早​干嘛​去​了​？\n"
"xing2 a1，jin3guan3 lai4 wo3 hao3 le5。lai4 wo3 po4huai4 le5 ni3 zhe4 jia3 mo2 jia3 shi4 de5 shu1 zhi2 qing2。ni3 xian4zai4 zhi1dao4 guan1xin1 na4 xiao3 zi3 le5？na4 ni3 zao3 gan4ma2 qu4 le5？"

msgid "Go ahead. I won't stop you."
msgstr ""
"说​吧​，​我​不会​拦着​你​。\n"
"shuo1 ba1，wo3 bu4hui4 lan2 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid "Go ahead. Knock yourself out."
msgstr ""
"你​自便​吧​。\n"
"ni3 zi4bian4 ba1。"

msgid "Go ahead. Talk."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​有话​快​说​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。you3 hua4 kuai4 shuo1。"

msgid "Go ahead. Tell me."
msgstr ""
"继续​说​吧​，​我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"ji4xu4 shuo1 ba1，wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Go ahead. Tell me. I'm interested."
msgstr ""
"你​说​吧​。​我​很感兴趣​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ba1。wo3 hen3 gan3 xing4 qu4。"

msgid "Go ahead. We won't stop you."
msgstr ""
"去​吧​。​我们​不会​阻止​你​。\n"
"qu4 ba1。wo3men5 bu4hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Go ahead... if this thing wants to help us, I don't see why you shouldn't."
msgstr ""
"去​吧​……​如果​这​东西​想​帮​我们​，​那​我们​自然​该​配合​它​。\n"
"qu4 ba1……ru2guo3 zhe4 dong1xi1 xiang3 bang1 wo3men5，na4 wo3men5 zi4ran2 gai1 pei4he2 ta1。"

msgid "Go die in a ditch."
msgstr ""
"你​他​妈​死​一边​去​吧​。\n"
"ni3 ta1 ma1 si3 yi1bian1 qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Go for it."
msgstr ""
"继续​吧​。\n"
"ji4xu4 ba1。"

msgid "Go now, $(l.name). We need to strike while the iron is hot."
msgstr ""
"去​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​要​趁热打铁​。\n"
"qu4 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 yao4 chen4re4da3tie3。"

msgid "Go on, $(l.name). We're listening."
msgstr ""
"继续​说​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​听​着​呢​。\n"
"ji4xu4 shuo1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Go on, Glory."
msgstr ""
"继续​说​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"ji4xu4 shuo1，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "Go on, please."
msgstr ""
"请​继续​吧​。\n"
"qing3 ji4xu4 ba1。"

msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""
"继续​。\n"
"ji4xu4。"

msgid "Go on. I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"继续​说​。\n"
"ji4xu4 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Go right ahead. Fill your pockets, take whatever you like.\n"
"\n"
"I, on the other hand, will avail myself of the snack bar."
msgstr ""
"随便​吧​。​你​愿意​拿​什么​都行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​我​，​会​去​零食​吧台​好好​享受​一番​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ba1。ni3 yuan4yi4 na2 shen2me5 dou1 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3，hui4 qu4 ling2shi2 ba1tai2 hao3hao3 xiang3shou4 yi1 fan1。"

msgid ""
"Go talk to Frank. He's hangin' out on the VIP balcony, way back there on your right.\n"
"\n"
"He's got the only key to the elevator, and he can get you up there. Won't be cheap, though."
msgstr ""
"你​去​跟​弗兰克​谈​。​他​在​VIP​大厅​的​阳台​上​闲着​呢​，​就​在​后面​，​你​右手边​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只有​他​手里​有​电梯​钥匙​，​而且​他​也​能​把​你​送上去​。​只不过​你​得出​点血​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 qu4 gen1 fu2lan2ke4 tan2。ta1 zai4 VIP da4ting1 de5 yang2tai2 shang4 xian2 zhao2 ni2，jiu4 zai4 hou4mian5，ni3 you4 shou3 bian1。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3you3 ta1 shou3li3 you3 dian4ti1 yao4shi5，er2qie3 ta1 ye3 neng2 ba3 ni3 song4 shang4 qu4。zhi3bu5guo4 ni3 de2chu1 dian3 xie3。"

msgid ""
"Go, so I may return to the Communion! It has been so long... how long? Days? Weeks? Months?\n"
"\n"
"Without the Communion! *Without!*"
msgstr ""
"去​吧​，​这样​我​就​可以​回归​共融​！​已经​太久​了​……​多久​了​？​几天​？​几周​？​几个​月​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​太久​没有​回归​共融​了​！​*​没有​*​！\n"
"\n"
"qu4 ba1，zhe4yang4 wo3 jiu4 ke3yi3 hui2gui1 gong4 rong2！yi3jing1 tai4 jiu3 le5……duo1jiu3 le5？ji3tian1？ji1 zhou1？ji3ge5 yue4？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tai4 jiu3 mei2you3 hui2gui1 gong4 rong2 le5！*mei2you3*！"

msgid "Goal Workstation"
msgstr ""
"目标​工作站\n"
"mu4biao1 gong1zuo4zhan4"

msgid ""
"God damn, that's rank. I'll stay back here, if you don't mind... I have "
"better things to do than dig through a pile of decomposing trash."
msgstr ""
"天​啊​，​这​味道​真​够呛​。​如果​你​不介意​的话​，​我​就​在​后面​待​着​了​……​我​还有​更​重要​的​事情​要​做​，​而​不是​翻​一堆​正在​腐烂​的​垃圾​。\n"
"tian1 a1，zhe4 wei4dao5 zhen1 gou4qiang4。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 zai4 hou4mian5 dai1 zhao2 le5……wo3 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 zuo4，er2 bu4shi4 fan1 yi1dui1 zheng4zai4 fu3lan4 de5 la1ji1。"

msgid ""
"God fucking damn it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}You hear the roar of another gunshot, and the screen goes dark.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"真​他妈的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​又​听到​一声​枪响​，​屏幕​随即​一片​漆黑​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 ta1ma1de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 you4 ting1dao4 yi1sheng1 qiang1 xiang3，ping2mu4 sui2ji2 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"God gave me tusks for a reason. I don't think He'll mind that I used them.\n"
"\n"
"Did you meet with Alice? Do you have our information?"
msgstr ""
"上帝​赐给​我​这​对​獠牙​是​有​原因​的​。​想必​祂​不会​介意​我​动用​它们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​和​爱丽丝​见面​了​吗​？​你​拿到​了​我们​需要​的​情报​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"shang4di4 ci4gei3 wo3 zhe4 dui4 liao2ya2 shi4 you3 yuan2yin1 de5。xiang3bi4 ta1 bu4hui4 jie4yi4 wo3 dong4yong4 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 he4 ai4li4si1 jian4mian4 le5 ma5？ni3 na2dao4 le5 wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5 qing2bao4 ma5？"

msgid "God, I hope not."
msgstr ""
"老天​，​真​希望​别是​那样​。\n"
"lao3tian1，zhen1 xi1wang4 bie4 shi4 na4yang4。"

msgid "God, that's eerie. It's almost like it's waiting for something."
msgstr ""
"这​也​太​瘆​人​了​。​就​好像​它​在​等​着​什么​似的​。\n"
"zhe4 ye3 tai4 shen4 ren2 le5。jiu4 hao3xiang4 ta1 zai4 deng3 zhao2 shen2me5 shi4de5。"

msgid "Going? Where are you going?"
msgstr ""
"走​？​你们​要​去​哪儿​？\n"
"zou3？ni3men5 yao4 qu4 na3r5？"

msgid "Golden Boy"
msgstr ""
"金童\n"
"jin1 tong2"

msgid "Golden as always, $(l.name). No problems here."
msgstr ""
"一如既往​地好​，​$(l.name)​。​放心​吧​。\n"
"yi1ru2ji4wang3 de5 hao3，$(l.name)。fang4xin1 ba1。"

msgid "Goldfish"
msgstr ""
"金鱼\n"
"jin1yu2"

msgid "Goldschmidt was your friend after all, eh?"
msgstr ""
"看来​戈德​施密特​终究​是​你​的​朋友​，​是​吧​？\n"
"kan4lai5 Ge1de2shi1mi4te4 zhong1jiu1 shi4 ni3 de5 peng2you5，shi4 ba1？"

msgid "Gone. She never should've gone down there in the first place."
msgstr ""
"死​了​。​她​一​开始​就​不该​下​到​那里​去​。\n"
"si3 le5。ta1 yi1 kai1shi3 jiu4 bu4gai1 xia4 dao4 na4li5 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Good $(l.man).\n"
"\n"
"When you are finished, come back to me so that we might discuss."
msgstr ""
"好样​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​你​完事​之后​回来​找​我​，​然后​我们​就​能​进一步​商议​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 yang4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ni3 wan2shi4 zhi1hou4 hui2lai5 zhao3 wo3，ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 jin4yi1bu4 shang1yi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good $(l.man).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She dips her head in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Until next time."
msgstr ""
"好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​低头​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​下次​再聊​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xia4ci4 zai4 liao2。"

msgid ""
"Good $(l.man). Eiger's skills and experience are invaluable to this team.\n"
"\n"
"It would be good to have her on your side."
msgstr ""
"很​上​道​嘛​。​咱们​队里​不能​缺​了​艾格尔​的​经验​和​技术​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​她​帮衬​你​是​件​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 shang4 dao4 ma5。zan2men5 dui4 li3 bu4neng2 que1 le5 Ai4ge2er3 de5 jing1yan4 he4 ji4shu4。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ta1 bang1chen4 ni3 shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Good $(l.man). I'd begin by trying to find an alternative path into the building... something out of sight. \n"
"\n"
"Once the facility calls for help, you're going to be on a tight timetable."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​如果​是​我​的话​，​就​先​另寻​他路​进入​大楼​……​不​引人注目​的​那种​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一旦​设施​人员​请求​增援​的话​，​你们​的​时间​就​很​紧迫​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。ru2guo3 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 xian1 ling4 xun2 ta1 lu4 jin4ru4 da4lou2……bu4 yin3ren2zhu4mu4 de5 na4zhong3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dan4 she4shi1 ren2yuan2 qing3qiu2 zeng1yuan2 de5hua4，ni3men5 de5 shi2jian1 jiu4 hen3 jin3po4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good $(l.man). Take the U-Bahn to the Altstadt Spandau. There you will find a connecting tube that the locals refer to as the \"Rabbit Hole.\"\n"
"\n"
"You will find a method of contacting Alice there."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​坐地铁​去施​潘道​旧城区​。​那里​有​一条​被​当地人​称为​“​兔子​洞​”​的​连接​通道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​那里​能​找到​联系​爱丽丝​的​渠道​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。zuo4 de5 tie3 qu4 shi1 pan1 dao4 jiu4 cheng2 qu1。na4li5 you3 yi1 tiao2 bei4 dang1 de5 ren2 cheng1wei2“tu4zi5 dong4” de5 lian2jie1 tong1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 na4li5 neng2 zhao3dao4 lian2xi4 ai4li4si1 de5 qu2dao4。"

msgid "Good God."
msgstr ""
"天​啊​。\n"
"tian1 a1。"

msgid ""
"Good God. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Gingerly, Amsel lifts a disc from the bundle and holds it up to the light. Slowly, he begins to turn it in his hand, causing rainbow patterns to shimmer across its surface.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I haven't seen one of these since I was a boy."
msgstr ""
"天​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​小心翼翼​地​取出​一张​碟片​，​举到​光线​下​。​他​缓缓​转动​手中​的​圆盘​，​其​表面​泛起​彩虹​般的​光泽​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从​很小​的​时候​就​再​没见​过​这​东西​了​。\n"
"\n"
"tian1 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 xiao3xin1yi4yi4 de5 qu3chu1 yi1 zhang1 die2pian4，ju3 dao4 guang1xian4 xia4。ta1 huan3huan3 zhuan3dong4 shou3 zhong4 de5 yuan2pan2，qi2 biao3mian4 fan4qi3 cai3hong2 ban1 de5 guang1ze2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2 hen3 xiao3 de5 shi2hou5 jiu4 zai4 mei2 jian4 guo4 zhe4 dong1xi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good afternoon, and welcome to AugmenTech, the boutique that makes a better \"you\" of you!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice is overflowing with forced cheerfulness. Idly, you wonder how many times she has to give this exact speech every day.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Tell me how I can help you today!"
msgstr ""
"下午​好​，​欢迎光临​“​增强​科技​”​，​本店​专注​于​让​你​成为​更​完美​的​“​自己​”​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​里​充斥​着​刻意​营造​的​欢快​。​你​漫不经心​地​想着​，​她​每天​究竟​要​重复​多少​遍​这套​说辞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请问​我​今天​有​什么​能​为​你​效劳​的​？\n"
"\n"
"xia4wu3 hao3，huan1ying2guang1lin2“zeng1qiang2 ke1ji4”，ben3 dian4 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 rang4 ni3 cheng2wei2 geng1 wan2mei3 de5“zi4ji3”！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 li3 chong1chi4 zhao2 ke4yi4 ying2zao4 de5 huan1kuai4。ni3 man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 xiang3 zhao2，ta1 mei3tian1 jiu1jing4 yao4 chong2fu4 duo1shao3 bian4 zhe4 tao4 shuo1ci2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3wen4 wo3 jin1tian1 you3 shen2me5 neng2 wei2 ni3 xiao4lao2 de5？"

msgid ""
"Good call, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We all knew what we were here to do. Good on you for stepping up and doing it."
msgstr ""
"明智​的​决定​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​来​这里​就是​跑​差事​的​。​你​站​出来​完成​了​任务​，​这​是​件​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"ming2zhi4 de5 jue2ding4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 jiu4shi4 pao2 cha4shi4 de5。ni3 zhan4 chu1lai2 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5，zhe4 shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。"

msgid "Good call."
msgstr ""
"明智​的​选择​。\n"
"ming2zhi4 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"Good call.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns back to his terminal.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take care, chief."
msgstr ""
"好​主意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​继续​鼓捣​起​他​的​终端​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​保重​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 zhu3yi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 ji4xu4 gu3dao5 qi3 ta1 de5 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao3zhong4，tou2r5。"

msgid "Good call. Let's go."
msgstr ""
"好​主意​。​我们​走​。\n"
"hao3 zhu3yi5。wo3men5 zou3。"

msgid ""
"Good call. Now, there's just one more thing that I want to do before we head back home.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gestures at the Engineer's lifeless body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We still need to search the bastard. Who knows? Maybe he has some additional evidence on him... or in him. Could be that he has headware storage - we won't know until we go digging."
msgstr ""
"好​主意​。​现在​我​还​想​在​回去​之前​做​一件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​指指​工程师​了​无生气​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​还​得​搜​搜​这个​混蛋​。​万一​他​身上​还有​什么​额外​的​证据​呢​……​或者​在​体内​也​有​可能​。​没准​他​有​头部​储存​设备​。​我们​只有​检查​一番​才​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 zhu3yi5。xian4zai4 wo3 hai2 xiang3 zai4 hui2qu5 zhi1qian2 zuo4 yi1 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3 zhi3 gong1cheng2shi1 le5 wu2 sheng1 qi4 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hai2 de2 sou1 sou1 zhe4ge5 hun2dan4。wan4yi1 ta1 shen1shang5 hai2you3 shen2me5 e2wai4 de5 zheng4ju4 ni2……huo4zhe3 zai4 ti3nei4 ye3 you3 ke3neng2。mei2zhun3 ta1 you3 tou2bu4 chu3cun2 she4bei4。wo3men5 zhi3you3 jian3cha2 yi1 fan1 cai2 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "Good enough for me."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。\n"
"xing2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Good enough for me. Someone spilled soykaf, building shut down. Case closed."
msgstr ""
"我​听懂​了​。​有人​弄​洒​了​豆​咖​，​建筑​被​封锁​。​事情​水落石出​了​。\n"
"wo3 ting1dong3 le5。you3ren2 long4 sa3 le5 dou4 ka1，jian4zhu4 bei4 feng1suo3。shi4qing5 shui3luo4shi2chu1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good find.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's continue."
msgstr ""
"这招​真不错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​继续前进​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 zhen1 bu4 cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。"

msgid "Good god."
msgstr ""
"我​的​天​。\n"
"wo3 de5 tian1。"

msgid ""
"Good hunting. I'll be waiting, looking forward to hearing your report when "
"you get back."
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​。​我​就​等​你​回来​跟​我​报告​了​。\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。wo3 jiu4 deng3 ni3 hui2lai5 gen1 wo3 bao4gao4 le5。"

msgid "Good job, man."
msgstr ""
"做得好​。\n"
"zuo4 de2 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Good job, man. Don't worry about the turrets - they've been dealt with."
msgstr ""
"做得好​。​不用​管​那些​炮塔​了​—​—​我​已经​全部​解决​了​。\n"
"zuo4 de2 hao3。bu4yong4 guan3 na4xie1 pao4ta3 le5——wo3 yi3jing1 quan2bu4 jie3jue2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good luck finding it, dude. I’ll be here if you need to drown your sorrows.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She flashes a grin at you and returns to pondering her drink.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​，​伙计​。​想来​借酒浇愁​的话​，​就​随时​来​这​找​我​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​咧嘴一笑​，​然后​又​继续​喝​她​的​酒​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，huo3ji5。xiang3lai2 jie4jiu3jiao1chou2 de5hua4，jiu4 sui2shi2 lai2 zhe4 zhao3 wo3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，ran2hou4 you4 ji4xu4 he4 ta1 de5 jiu3 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Good luck finding it, man. I’ll be here if you need to drown your sorrows.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} She flashes a grin at you and returns to pondering her drink.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​，​伙计​。​想来​借酒浇愁​的话​，​就​随时​来​这​找​我​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​咧嘴一笑​，​然后​又​继续​喝​她​的​酒​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，huo3ji5。xiang3lai2 jie4jiu3jiao1chou2 de5hua4，jiu4 sui2shi2 lai2 zhe4 zhao3 wo3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，ran2hou4 you4 ji4xu4 he4 ta1 de5 jiu3 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Good luck with that."
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​。\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid "Good luck, Hasenkamp."
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​，​哈森​坎普​。\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，Ha1sen1kan3pu3。"

msgid "Good man. Proceed as instructed."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​按计划​行事​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。an4 ji4 hua2 xing2shi4。"

msgid "Good of you to care."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​的​关照​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 de5 guan1zhao4。"

msgid "Good plan. I'll leave you to it."
msgstr ""
"好​主意​。​我​就​不​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"hao3 zhu3yi5。wo3 jiu4 bu4 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good protection. Decking and drone integration. The outfit of choice for "
"many tech-savvy runners. Grants +1 Decking and +1 Drone Combat."
msgstr ""
"防护​出色​。​配备​骇入​和​无人机​集成​。​许多​技术​高超​的​狂奔​者​选择​的​服装​。​提供​+​1​骇入​和​+​1​无人机​战斗​。\n"
"fang2hu4 chu1se4。pei4bei4 hai4 ru4 he4 wu2ren2ji1 ji2cheng2。xu3duo1 ji4shu4 gao1chao1 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 xuan3ze2 de5 fu2zhuang1。ti2gong1 +1 hai4 ru4 he4 +1 wu2ren2ji1 zhan4dou4。"

msgid "Good riddance."
msgstr ""
"总算​完事​了​。\n"
"zong3suan4 wan2shi4 le5。"

msgid "Good thinking."
msgstr ""
"想法​不错​。\n"
"xiang3fa3 bu4cuo4。"

msgid "Good to hear. For a second there, I thought you'd gone soft on me."
msgstr ""
"听​你​这么​说​我​就​放心​了​。​我​一​开始​还​以为​你​会​妥协​呢​。\n"
"ting1 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1 wo3 jiu4 fang4xin1 le5。wo3 yi1 kai1shi3 hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 hui4 tuo3xie2 ni2。"

msgid "Good to know. I suppose that I'll be waiting to hear from you, then."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。​那​我​就​等​你​的​消息​了​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。na4 wo3 jiu4 deng3 ni3 de5 xiao1xi5 le5。"

msgid "Good to know. Now tell me what's going on."
msgstr ""
"挺​好​的​。​和​我​说​说​目前​的​情况​。\n"
"ting3 hao3 de5。he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4。"

msgid "Good to know. Thank you."
msgstr ""
"那就好​，​谢谢​你​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 hao3，xie4xie5 ni3。"

msgid "Good to know. We'll try to get them out of he--"
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​那​我们​就​尽量​带​他们​离开​这​—​—\n"
"hen3 hao3。na4 wo3men5 jiu4 jin3liang4 dai4 ta1men5 li2kai1 zhe4 — —"

msgid "Good to meet you, $(l.name). Name's Aleksi Laine."
msgstr ""
"你好​，​$(l.name)​。​我​叫​阿莱克​西​·​莱恩​。\n"
"ni3hao3，$(l.name)。wo3 jiao4 e1 lai2 ke4 xi1 · lai2en1。"

msgid "Good to meet you, Jana. Are the others still on their way?"
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​认识​你​，​简娜​。​其他人​还​在​路上​吗​？\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，Jian3na4。qi2 ta1 ren2 hai2 zai4 lu4shang5 ma5？"

msgid "Good work, Blitz. Now let's find a way upstairs."
msgstr ""
"干得​好​，​布里​茨​。​该​找条​路上​楼​了​。\n"
"gan4 de2 hao3，Bu4li3ci2。gai1 zhao3 tiao2 lu4shang5 lou2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good! And, uh... make sure that Hasenkamp comes with you.\n"
"\n"
"Gotta make sure that box makes it back to Grinder."
msgstr ""
"很​好​！​另外​……​一定​让​哈森​坎普​跟着​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​得​把​那个​盒子​带给​“​绞肉机​”​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3！ling4wai4……yi1ding4 rang4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 gen1zhe5 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"de2 ba3 na4ge5 he2zi5 dai4gei3“jiao3rou4ji1”。"

msgid ""
"Good! I hope they stay that way!\n"
"\n"
"Let me know if they don't though alright? I'm always up to help.\n"
"\n"
"For now, gotta help Altuğ more though. See you later, ja?"
msgstr ""
"挺​好​！​希望​继续​保持​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​有事​的话​记得​来​找​我​好​吧​？​我​随时​乐意​帮忙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​现在​我得​先忙​着​给​奥图​伊​干活​。​回头见​？\n"
"\n"
"ting3 hao3！xi1wang4 ji4xu4 bao3chi2！\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 you3shi4 de5hua4 ji4de5 lai2 zhao3 wo3 hao3 ba1？wo3 sui2shi2 le4yi4 bang1mang2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 xian4zai4 wo3 de2 xian1 mang2 zhao2 gei3 ao4 tu2 yi1 gan4huo2。hui2tou2jian4？"

msgid "Good."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Good.\n"
"\n"
"Is there anything else, or should we get started?"
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​其他​问题​的话​，​我们​就​开始​行动​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 qi2ta1 wen4ti2 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 kai1shi3 xing2dong4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Good.\n"
"\n"
"Now, the second that you jack in to the Matrix, my automated defenses are gonna try to pounce on you. \n"
"\n"
"Think of them as my immune system, and yourself as a germ. It's an autonomous function... I can't stop it from happening."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​访问​我​的​系统​时​，​我​的​自动​防御​系统​将​尝试​与​你​交战​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它们​就​像是​我​的​免疫系统​，​而​你​是​病菌​。​这是​一项​自主​功能​……​我​无法​阻止​它​运作​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 fang3wen4 wo3 de5 xi4tong3 shi2，wo3 de5 zi4dong4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 jiang1 chang2shi4 yu4 ni3 jiao1zhan4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jiu4 xiang4 shi4 wo3 de5 mian3yi4xi4tong3，er2 ni3 shi4 bing4jun1。zhe4 shi4 yi1 xiang4 zi4zhu3 gong1neng2……wo3 wu2fa3 zu3zhi3 ta1 yun4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Good.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*Very* good."
msgstr ""
"好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​非常​*​好​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*fei1chang2*hao3。"

msgid ""
"Good.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair stubs out his last cigarette, then turns to Audran.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Watch over our guest, if you will. I will begin the Panacea infusion process. And Audran... see to it that $(l.his) stay here is comfortable.\n"
"\n"
"No mistreatment."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​掐灭​了​最后​一支​香烟​，​然后​转向​奥​德兰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​你​代为​照顾​我们​的​客人​。​我​将​正式​开始​“​万能​药​”​的​注入​流程​。​还有​，​奥​德兰​……​要​好生​对待​$(l.he)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不许​胡来​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 qia1 mie4 le5 zui4hou4 yi1 zhi1 xiang1yan1，ran2hou4 zhuan3xiang4 Ao4de2lan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 ni3 dai4wei2 zhao4gu5 wo3men5 de5 ke4ren2。wo3 jiang1 zheng4shi4 kai1shi3“wan4neng2 yao4” de5 zhu4ru4 liu2cheng2。hai2you3，Ao4de2lan2……yao4 hao3sheng1 dui4dai4 $(l.he)。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xu3 hu2lai2。"

msgid ""
"Good. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory's clenched jaw relaxes somewhat, and the tension drains out of her shoulders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks."
msgstr ""
"好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​紧绷​的​下颌​微微​松弛​，​肩头​的​紧张感​也​随之​消散​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 jin3beng1 de5 xia4he2 wei1wei1 song1chi2，jian1tou2 de5 jin3 zhang1 gan3 ye3 sui2zhi1 xiao1san4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"Good. And don't worry... as soon as I'm finished with what I'm doing, I'll "
"be back."
msgstr ""
"好​的​，​别​担心​……​我​忙​完​就​会​回来​。\n"
"hao3 de5，bie4 dan1xin1……wo3 mang2 wan2 jiu4 hui4 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"Good. And thanks.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else that you'd like to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"很​好​，​谢​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​还有​什么​别的​事​要说​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3，xie4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 yao4shuo1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Good. And that's all the more reason to gather Alice's fee as quickly as "
"possible."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​那​就​更​有​理由​尽快​筹集​爱丽丝​要求​的​酬金​了​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。na4 jiu4 geng1 you3 li3you2 jin3kuai4 chou2ji2 ai4li4si1 yao1qiu2 de5 chou2jin1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good. I have news.\n"
"\n"
"In your absence, I've made contact with another prospective client. A rather elusive woman of Aztlaner descent.\n"
"\n"
"She calls herself “Frau Müller.”"
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​我​有事​跟​你​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​在​的​这​段时间​，​我​已​与​另​一位​潜在​客户​取得联系​。​一位​颇为​神秘​的​阿兹特​兰​血统​女子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​自称​“​穆勒​女士​”​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。wo3 you3shi4 gen1 ni3 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 zai4 de5 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1，wo3 yi3 yu4 ling4 yi1 wei4 qian2zai4 ke4hu4 qu3 de2 lian2 xi4。yi1 wei4 po1wei2 shen2mi4 de5 e1 zi1 te4 lan2 xue4tong3 nu:3zi3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zi4cheng1“mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4”。"

msgid ""
"Good. I was hoping you'd say that... you've more than earned the rest, and "
"I've already decided that I need to do this on my own."
msgstr ""
"好​，​我​正​希望​你​会​这么​说​……​你​也​该​好好​休息​了​，​我​早就​决定​好​独自​完成​这件​事​。\n"
"hao3，wo3 zheng1 xi1wang4 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1……ni3 ye3 gai1 hao3hao3 xiu1xi5 le5，wo3 zao3jiu4 jue2ding4 hao3 du2zi4 wan2cheng2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid "Good. I'll be in touch."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​回头​联系​。\n"
"hao3 de5。hui2tou2 lian2xi4。"

msgid ""
"Good. If the bastard is going soft, it should be that much easier for us to "
"take him down."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​既然​那​混蛋​变得​松懈​了​，​干掉​他​的​难度​将会​降低​许多​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。ji4ran2 na4 hun2dan4 bian4de5 song1xie4 le5，gan4diao4 ta1 de5 nan2du4 jiang1hui4 jiang4di1 xu3duo1。"

msgid ""
"Good. If the shrine's influence is the only thing keeping these kids here, "
"that'll make our job a lot easier."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​如果​神龛​的​影响​是​让​这些​孩子​留在​这里​的​唯一​原因​，​那​我们​的​任务​就​容易​多​了​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。ru2guo3 shen2kan1 de5 ying3xiang3 shi4 rang4 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 wei2yi1 yuan2yin1，na4 wo3men5 de5 ren4wu5 jiu4 rong2yi4 duo1 le5。"

msgid "Good. It's about time I had some new inventory come in."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​我​这里​总算​能​进点​新货​了​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。wo3 zhe4li3 zong3suan4 neng2 jin4 dian3 xin1 huo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good. Just remember - no amulet, no basement.\n"
"\n"
"Now go on through, and show that little prick what it means to screw with the Arbeiters."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​你​记住​，​拿​不到​护身符​，​你​就​别​想​去​地下室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​进去​吧​，​让​那个​混蛋​知道​，​惹​工人​帮会​有​什么​下场​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。ni3 ji4zhu5，na2 bu4dao4 hu4shen1fu2，ni3 jiu4 bie4 xiang3 qu4 di4xia4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 jin4qu4 ba1，rang4 na4ge5 hun2dan4 zhi1dao4，re3 gong1ren2 bang1hui4 you3 shen2me5 xia4chang3。"

msgid ""
"Good. Now find the first box that cable connects into. It'll have three cables plugged into it - one power, and two optical. \n"
"\n"
"Connect the ends of the bypass to the two optical cables."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​然后​找到​这根​线缆​连接​的​第一个​线路​箱​。​上面​应该​有​三根​线​，​其中​一根​是​电源线​，​另外​两根​是​光缆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​把​旁路​程序​的​两端​接​在​两根​光缆​上​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。ran2hou4 zhao3dao4 zhe4 gen1 xian4lan3 lian2jie1 de5 di4 yi1 ge4 xian4lu4 xiang1。shang4mian4 ying1gai1 you3 san1 gen1 xian4，qi2zhong1 yi1 gen1 shi4 dian4yuan2xian4，ling4wai4 liang3 gen1 shi4 guang1lan3。\n"
"\n"
"ba3 pang2lu4 cheng2xu4 de5 liang3duan1 jie1 zai4 liang3 gen1 guang1lan3 shang4。"

msgid "Good. Now get out of those kids' minds."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​现在​离开​那些​孩子​的​脑海​吧​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。xian4zai4 li2kai1 na4Xie1hai2zi5 de5 nao3hai3 ba1。"

msgid "Good. Now let's find some cover and wait for the door locks to disarm."
msgstr ""
"好​。​现在​咱们​找​找​掩护​，​等​着​门锁​打开​。\n"
"hao3。xian4zai4 zan2men5 zhao3 zhao3 yan3hu4，deng3 zhao2 men2suo3 da3kai1。"

msgid "Good. Now, do we have any other business to discuss?"
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​现在​我们​还有​别的​事要​谈​吗​？\n"
"hen3 hao3。xian4zai4 wo3men5 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 tan2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Good. Now, let's move on to other matters. \n"
"\n"
"Do you have business for me? Some work you need done, perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​现在​我们​来说​点​别的​事​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​找​我​有事吗​？​你​需要​我​做​什么​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。xian4zai4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 dian3 bie2de5 shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhao3 wo3 you3 shi4 ma5？ni3 xu1yao4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "Good. So let's get down to brass tacks, shall we?"
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​那​我们​就​来​聊​正事​吧​？\n"
"hen3 hao3。na4 wo3men5 jiu4 lai2 liao2 zheng4shi4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Good. So will you convey my message to their leader? I think that my offer "
"is more than fair."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​那​你​就​把​我​的话​转达​给​它们​的​首领​吧​？​我​觉得​我​的​提议​已经​很​中肯​了​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。na4 ni3 jiu4 ba3 wo3 de5hua4 zhuan3da2 gei3 ta1men5 de5 shou3ling3 ba1？wo3 jue2de5 wo3 de5 ti2yi4 yi3jing1 hen3 zhong4ken3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good. That's a real good idea, pal.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ganger boss jeers at Maxim.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See that? Your muscle is smarter than you are. You should put $(l.him) in charge."
msgstr ""
"不错​。​说​得​真不错​啊​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​帮派​老大​嘲讽​着​马克西姆​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看见​没​？​你​的​打手​比​你​聪明​多​了​。​你​应该​让​$(l.he)​来​当​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4cuo4。shuo1 de2 zhen1 bu4 cuo4 a1，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bang1pai4 lao3da4 chao2feng3 zhao2 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4jian4 mei2？ni3 de5 da3shou5 bi3 ni3 cong1ming5 duo1 le5。ni3 ying1gai1 rang4 $(l.he) lai2 dang1 tou2r5。"

msgid "Good. That's settled, then."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​那么​这事​就​这样​了​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。na4me5 zhe4 shi4 jiu4 zhe4yang4 le5。"

msgid "Good. Then you can focus on getting our current job done."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​那​你​现在​可以​专注​于​完成​我们​目前​的​差事​了​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。na4 ni3 xian4zai4 ke3yi3 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 wan2cheng2 wo3men5 mu4qian2 de5 cha4shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good. This should only take me a moment.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel disappears behind the ancient display. After a few minutes of fiddling with its battered inputs, he reappears, a satisfied look on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Everything appears to be functional. The disc should be ready to play."
msgstr ""
"好​。​稍等一下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​蹲​在​古老​的​显示屏​后​，​折腾​起​那些​破旧​接口​。​几分钟​后​，​他​带​着​满意​的​神情​站​起身​来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​应该​没​问题​了​。​可以​放碟​试试看​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3。shao1 deng3 yi1 xia4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dun1 zai4 gu3lao3 de5 xian3shi4ping2 hou4，zhe1teng5 qi3 na4xie1 po4jiu4 jie1kou3。ji1 fen4 zhong1 hou4，ta1 dai4 zhao2 man3yi4 de5 shen2qing2 zhan4 qi3shen1 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ying1gai1 mei2 wen4ti2 le5。ke3yi3 fang4 die2 shi4shi4kan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Good. Very good. I've gotta admit, ace... I'm relieved.\n"
"\n"
"So. What's it gonna be? You gonna help me, and enable me to help you in return?"
msgstr ""
"很​好​，​非常​好​。​我​得​承认​，​王牌​……​我松​了​一口气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那么​，​你​会​怎么​选​？​你​愿意​帮助​我​获得​自由​，​并​让​我​帮助​你​作为​回报​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3，fei1chang2 hao3。wo3 de2 cheng2ren4，wang2pai2……wo3 song1 le5 yi1kou3qi4。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，ni3 hui4 zen3me5 xuan3？ni3 yuan4yi4 bang1zhu4 wo3 huo4de2 zi4you2，bing4 rang4 wo3 bang1zhu4 ni3 zuo4wei2 hui2bao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Good. We can discuss the specifics of that in a moment. But before we do, you must tell me whatever you can about this ambush.\n"
"\n"
"Assuming that it wasn't a random attack, this event could signify a dangerous level of escalation in our predicament."
msgstr ""
"好​。​具体​细节​稍后​再谈​。​但​在此之前​，​你​必须​把​关于​这次​伏击​的​所有​信息​都​告诉​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​假设​这​不是​一次​随机​袭击​，​那么​我们​可以​通过​这场​伏击​判断​当前​处境​的​危险​程度​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3。ju4ti3 xi4jie2 shao1hou4 zai4 tan2。dan4 zai4ci3zhi1qian2，ni3 bi4xu1 ba3 guan1yu2 zhe4 ci4 fu2ji1 de5 suo3you3 xin4xi1 dou1 gao4su4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"jia3she4 zhe4 bu4shi4 yi1ci4 sui2ji1 xi2ji1，na4me5 wo3men5 ke3yi3 tong1guo4 zhe4 chang2 fu2ji1 pan4duan4 dang1qian2 chu3jing4 de5 wei1xian3 cheng2du4。"

msgid "Good. Yeah, I think that this will work."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​觉得​这​可行​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 ke3xing2。"

msgid ""
"Good. Yeah, that's good. \n"
"\n"
"Okay, you wanna clear out the safe, or what?"
msgstr ""
"好好​好​，​那就好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​到底​想​不想​把​保险库​搬空​啊​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3，na4 jiu4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 dao4di3 xiang3 bu4xiang3 ba3 bao3 xian3 ku4 ban1 kong1 a1？"

msgid ""
"Good. Yes.\n"
"\n"
"That would be best."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​最好​不过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 zui4hao3 bu4guo4 le5。"

msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""
"再见​。\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid "Goon"
msgstr ""
"暴徒\n"
"bao4tu2"

msgid "Goon Boss"
msgstr ""
"暴徒​老大\n"
"bao4tu2 lao3da4"

msgid "Goon Enforcer"
msgstr ""
"暴徒​打手\n"
"bao4tu2 da3shou5"

msgid "Gossip travels fast, doesn't it."
msgstr ""
"小道消息​传​得​就是​快​啊​。\n"
"xiao3dao4xiao1xi5 chuan2 de2 jiu4shi4 kuai4 a1。"

msgid "Got a question for you about the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"我​想​和​你​聊聊​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid "Got any examples?"
msgstr ""
"比如说​？\n"
"bi3ru2shuo1？"

msgid "Got any ideas, Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"有​什么​主意​吗​，​艾格尔​？\n"
