msgstr ""
"人类​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​为什么​矮人​的​店​都​是​家族​经营​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​免费​劳动力​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​谁家​的​生意​遭殃​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4！\n"
"\n"
"wei4shen2me5 ai3ren2 de5 dian4 dou1 shi4 jia1zu2 jing1ying2？\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 mian3fei4 lao2dong4li4！\n"
"\n"
"na4 shei2 jia1 de5 sheng1yi4 zao1yang1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"HUMAN,\n"
"\n"
"They say that you can't get a job because of the economy, but you know the real reason.\n"
"\n"
"METAHUMANS."
msgstr ""
"人类​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​说​你​找​不到​工作​的​原因​是​经济​不景气​，​但​真正​的​原因​我们​心知肚明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​变​人类​！\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4！\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 shuo1 ni3 zhao3 bu4dao4 gong1zuo4 de5 yuan2yin1 shi4 jing1ji4 bu4jing3qi4，dan4 zhen1zheng4 de5 yuan2yin1 wo3men5 xin1zhi1du4ming2。\n"
"\n"
"bian4 ren2lei4！"

msgid ""
"HUMAN,\n"
"\n"
"You work hard. You play fair. And still, you can't get ahead. But have you ever wondered why?\n"
"\n"
"The answer is simple. The ELF is using the ORK and the TROLL as muscle against you."
msgstr ""
"人类​同胞们​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​努力​工作​，​你​公平竞争​，​但​你​总是​慢人​一步​。​你​是否​思考​过​原因​何在​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​答案​很​简单​，​就是​精灵​在​利用​兽​人​和​巨魔​打压​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 tong2 bao1 men5！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 nu3li4 gong1zuo4，ni3 gong1ping2jing4zheng1，dan4 ni3 zong3shi4 man4 ren2 yi1 bu4。ni3 shi4fou3 si1kao3 guo4 yuan2yin1 he2zai4？\n"
"\n"
"da2an4 hen3 jian3dan1，jiu4shi4 jing1ling2 zai4 li4yong4 shou4 ren2 he4 ju4mo2 da3ya1 ni3。"

msgid ""
"HURRY NOW, $++(l.race).\n"
"\n"
"SET ME FREE."
msgstr ""
"快些​行动​吧​，​渺小​的​$++(l.race)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​获得​自由​。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4 xie1 xing2dong4 ba1，miao3xiao3 de5 $++(l.race)。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 huo4de2 zi4you2。"

msgid "HVAC Controls"
msgstr ""
"空调​控制\n"
"kong1tiao2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "HVAC Diagram"
msgstr ""
"空调​示意图\n"
"kong1tiao2 shi4yi4tu2"

msgid ""
"Ha ha! Yes, of course. In the same way that the Sutterlin Empire is \"just "
"an office building,\" eh?"
msgstr ""
"哈哈​！​当然​啦​，​就​像​苏​特林​帝国​“​只是​一个​办公楼​”​一样​，​对​吧​？\n"
"ha1ha1！dang1ran2 la5，jiu4 xiang4 su1 te4 lin2 di4guo2“zhi3shi4 yi1ge5 ban4gong1lou2” yi1yang4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Ha! I suppose so. We'll see what gives out first. Your will or my plastic "
"knees."
msgstr ""
"哈哈​！​我​猜​也​是​。​我们​来​看看​谁​会​先​屈服​。​是​你​的​意志​，​还是​我​的​塑料​膝盖​。\n"
"ha1ha1！wo3 cai1 ye3 shi4。wo3men5 lai2 kan4kan5 shei2 hui4 xian1 qu1fu2。shi4 ni3 de5 yi4zhi4，hai2shi5 wo3 de5 su4liao4 xi1gai4。"

msgid ""
"Ha! No... you would think. But that is an altogether different tale, I "
"assure you. Much more romanticized."
msgstr ""
"哈​！​你​会​这么​想​也​难怪​。​但​我​向​你​保证​，​那​是​个​完全​不同​的​故事​，​而且​要​浪漫​得​多​。\n"
"ha1！ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 xiang3 ye3 nan2guai4。dan4 wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，na4 shi4 ge4 wan2quan2 bu4tong2 de5 gu4shi4，er2qie3 yao4 lang4man4 de2 duo1。"

msgid ""
"Ha! You're a sharp one.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles at you, revealing a mouth filled with jagged teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This building's under Arbeiter protection. We can't just let you waltz in and shoot up the place."
msgstr ""
"哈哈​！​你​挺​聪明​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​冲​你​咧嘴一笑​，​露出​满口​参差不齐​的​牙齿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这栋​建筑​现在​由​工人​帮​保护​。​我们​可​不能​让​你​大摇大摆​地​闯进去​大开杀戒​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1ha1！ni3 ting3 cong1ming5 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，lu4chu1 man3kou3 cen1ci1bu4qi2 de5 ya2chi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4 xian4zai4 you2 gong1ren2 bang1 bao3hu4。wo3men5 ke3 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 da4yao2da4bai3 de5 chuang3 jin4 qu4 dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4。"

msgid ""
"Ha. Ha.\n"
"\n"
"For what it's worth, I'm not gonna kill you, either - not anymore. There are only two people left in this world who need to worry about me shooting them."
msgstr ""
"哈​。​哈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​我​也​不​打算​杀​你​了​。​这​世上​只​剩下​两个​人​需要​担心​我会​开枪​打​他们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1。ha1。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3 ye3 bu4 da3suan4 sha1 ni3 le5。zhe4 shi4shang4 zhi3 sheng4xia4 liang3 ge4 ren2 xu1yao4 dan1xin1 wo3 hui4 kai1qiang1 da3 ta1men5 le5。"

msgid "Ha. Ha. Ha."
msgstr ""
"哈​。​哈​。​哈​。\n"
"ha1。ha1。ha1。"

msgid ""
"Ha... you are a funny $(l.man), efendim. Assumptions can be dangerous "
"things."
msgstr ""
"哈​……​你​真​爱说笑​，​贵人​。​随便​假设​可是​件​很​危险​的​事​。\n"
"ha1……ni3 zhen1 ai4 shuo1 xiao4，gui4ren2。sui2bian4 jia3she4 ke3shi4 jian4 hen3 wei1xian3 de5 shi4。"

msgid "Hack Both the AI Control Nodes"
msgstr ""
"骇入​两个​AI​控制​节点\n"
"hai4 ru4 liang3 ge4 AI kong4zhi4 jie2dian3"

msgid "Hack Node"
msgstr ""
"骇入​节点\n"
"hai4 ru4 jie2dian3"

msgid "Hack Relay"
msgstr ""
"骇入​中转​设备\n"
"hai4 ru4 zhong1zhuan3 she4bei4"

msgid "Hack Vault Door"
msgstr ""
"骇入​保险库​门\n"
"hai4 ru4 bao3 xian3 ku4 men2"

msgid ""
"Hack both of the secondary control nodes, and keep them active until the "
"control sequences have been erased."
msgstr ""
"骇入​两个​辅助​控制​节点​，​并​保持​它们​处于​活跃​状态​，​直到​控制​序列​被​抹除​。\n"
"hai4 ru4 liang3 ge4 fu3zhu4 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3，bing4 bao3chi2 ta1men5 chu3yu2 huo2yue4 zhuang4tai4，zhi2dao4 kong4zhi4 xu4lie4 bei4 ma1 chu2。"

msgid "Hack the Final Control Node"
msgstr ""
"骇入​最终​控制​节点\n"
"hai4 ru4 zui4zhong1 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3"

msgid "Hacker Decker"
msgstr ""
"黑客​碟客\n"
"hei1ke4 die2 ke4"

msgid "Hacker Enforcer"
msgstr ""
"黑客​打手\n"
"hei1ke4 da3shou5"

msgid "Hacker Rigger"
msgstr ""
"伟术​帮​机师\n"
"wei3 shu4 bang1 ji1shi1"

msgid "Hacker Terminal"
msgstr ""
"黑客​终端\n"
"hei1ke4 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Hail of Bullets"
msgstr ""
"子弹​风暴\n"
"zi3dan4 feng1bao4"

msgid ""
"Hail, noble $(scene.badfantasy)! Bringer of good tidings and glorious adventure!\n"
"\n"
"What news of your quest?"
msgstr ""
"向​你​致敬​，​高贵​的​$(scene.badfantasy)​！​带来​喜讯​与​辉煌​冒险​的​使者​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​任务​有何​进展​？\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 ni3 zhi4jing4，gao1gui4 de5 $(scene.badfantasy)！dai4lai2 xi3xun4 yu4 hui1huang2 mao4xian3 de5 shi3zhe3！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ren4wu5 you3 he2 jin4zhan3？"

msgid "Hairstyle"
msgstr ""
"发型\n"
"fa4xing2"

msgid "Hallway Vent"
msgstr ""
"走廊​通风口\n"
"zou3lang2 tong1feng1kou3"

msgid "Hand Razors"
msgstr ""
"剃刀​爪\n"
"ti4dao1 zhao3"

msgid "Hand of Glory"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​之手\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 zhi1 shou3"

msgid "Hand-Forged Katana"
msgstr ""
"手工​锻造​武士刀\n"
"shou3gong1 duan4zao4 wu3shi4dao1"

msgid "Handle it, James. I won't stop you."
msgstr ""
"你​动手​吧​，​詹姆斯​。​我​不会​拦着​你​。\n"
"ni3 dong4shou3 ba1，zhan1mu3si1。wo3 bu4hui4 lan2 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid "Handy little thing."
msgstr ""
"这​小东西​还​挺​方便​。\n"
"zhe4 xiao3 dong1 xi1 hai2 ting3 fang1bian4。"

msgid "Handy little thing. All right, team, let's go."
msgstr ""
"这​小东西​还​挺​方便​。​好​了​各位​，​我们​走​。\n"
"zhe4 xiao3 dong1 xi1 hai2 ting3 fang1bian4。hao3 le5 ge4wei4，wo3men5 zou3。"

msgid ""
"Hang on a second - we should search the body first. Who knows? Maybe he has some additional evidence on him... or in him.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She taps a finger against his forehead.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Could be that he has headware storage. We won't know until we go digging."
msgstr ""
"等​一下​，​我们​先​搜​搜​尸体​。​万一​他​身上​还有​什么​额外​的​证据​呢​……​或者​在​体内​也​有​可能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​一根​手指​点​在​他​的​额头​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没准​他​有​头部​储存​设备​。​我们​只有​检查​一番​才​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，wo3men5 xian1 sou1 sou1 shi1ti3。wan4yi1 ta1 shen1shang5 hai2you3 shen2me5 e2wai4 de5 zheng4ju4 ni2……huo4zhe3 zai4 ti3nei4 ye3 you3 ke3neng2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 yi1 gen1 shou3zhi3 dian3 zai4 ta1 de5 e2tou2 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2zhun3 ta1 you3 tou2bu4 chu3cun2 she4bei4。wo3men5 zhi3you3 jian3cha2 yi1 fan1 cai2 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Hang on a second, chief.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He holds out an arm to restrain you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You should hear the end of this. I mean, really."
msgstr ""
"等​一下​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​伸出​一只​胳膊​拦住​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​应该​听到​最后​。​我​是​认真​的​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1chu1 yi1 zhi3 ge1bo5 lan2zhu4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 ting1dao4 zui4hou4。wo3 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Hang on a second, there was something else that I wanted to talk with you "
"about. "
msgstr ""
"等​下​，​我​还有​事​想要​和​你​说​。\n"
"deng3 xia4，wo3 hai2you3 shi4 xiang3yao4 he4 ni3 shuo1。"

msgid "Hang on a second. I already have a team."
msgstr ""
"等​下​，​我​已经​有​小队​了​。\n"
"deng3 xia4，wo3 yi3jing1 you3 xiao3 dui4 le5。"

msgid "Hang on a second. I want to check this out."
msgstr ""
"等​下​。​我​想​检查​看看​。\n"
"deng3 xia4。wo3 xiang3 jian3cha2 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"Hang on a second. Just how many more \"peasants\" do you have in this "
"building?"
msgstr ""
"等等​。​你​在​这栋​楼​里​到底​还有​多少​“​臣民​”​？\n"
"deng3deng3。ni3 zai4 zhe4 dong4 lou2 li3 dao4di3 hai2you3 duo1shao3“chen2min2”？"

msgid "Hang on a second. There could be something useful in here."
msgstr ""
"稍等一下​。​可能​会​有​什么​有用​的​东西​。\n"
"shao1 deng3 yi1 xia4。ke3neng2 hui4 you3 shen2me5 you3yong4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Hang on a second. You're going to sic the Firewing on *Berlin?*"
msgstr ""
"等​一下​。​你​要​让​火翼​去​袭击​*​柏林​*​？\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4。ni3 yao4 rang4 Huo3yi4 qu4 xi2ji1*bo2lin2*？"

msgid "Hang on! What the hell was *that?*"
msgstr ""
"等等​！​刚刚​那​是​什么​鬼​？\n"
"deng3deng3！gang1gang5 na4 shi4 shen2me5 gui3？"

msgid ""
"Hang on, Eiger... I'm not comfortable leaving Winternight to the Flux State."
" I think that we should handle them ourselves."
msgstr ""
"等等​，​艾格尔​……​我​不​放心​把​“​冬夜​”​留给​动荡​带​。​我​觉得​还是​应该​由​我们​自己​来​动手​解决​。\n"
"deng3deng3，Ai4ge2er3……wo3 bu4 fang4xin1 ba3“dong1 ye4” liu2gei3 dong4dang4 dai4。wo3 jue2de5 hai2shi5 ying1gai1 you2 wo3men5 zi4ji3 lai2 dong4shou3 jie3jue2。"

msgid ""
"Hang on, Glory. We still have that... business... out at Feuerstelle to take"
" care of. Maybe we should do that first."
msgstr ""
"等​下​，​格洛丽​。​我们​不是​还要​去​“​火坑​”​处理​那​件​……​事情​吗​。​也许​我们​应该​先​做​那个​。\n"
"deng3 xia4，Ge2luo4li2。wo3men5 bu4shi4 hai2 yao4 qu4“huo3keng1” chu3li3 na4 jian4……shi4qing5 ma5。ye3xu3 wo3men5 ying1gai1 xian1 zuo4 na4ge5。"

msgid ""
"Hang on, boss. That'd leave Feuerschwinge - both the dragon and the woman - "
"to burn to death. I'm on board, just sayin'."
msgstr ""
"等​一下​，​老大​。​这样​会​让​火翼​的​肉身​与​那个​女人​一起​被​活活​烧死​。​你​确定​这​是​你​想要​的​吗​？\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，lao3da4。zhe4yang4 hui4 rang4 Huo3yi4 de5 rou4shen1 yu4 na4ge5 nu:3ren2 yi1qi3 bei4 huo2huo2 shao1si3。ni3 que4ding4 zhe4 shi4 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hang on, chief. That'd leave Feuerschwinge - both the dragon and the woman -"
" to burn to death. Is that really what you want?"
msgstr ""
"等​一下​，​头儿​。​这样​会​让​火翼​的​肉身​与​那个​女人​一起​被​活活​烧死​。​你​确定​这​是​你​想要​的​吗​？\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，tou2r5。zhe4yang4 hui4 rang4 Huo3yi4 de5 rou4shen1 yu4 na4ge5 nu:3ren2 yi1qi3 bei4 huo2huo2 shao1si3。ni3 que4ding4 zhe4 shi4 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hang on, there might be something important in here. Let's have a quick "
"look."
msgstr ""
"等等​，​这里​也许​有​什么​重要​的​东西​。​我们​迅速​看​一眼​吧​。\n"
"deng3deng3，zhe4li3 ye3xu3 you3 shen2me5 zhong4yao4 de5 dong1xi1。wo3men5 xun4su4 kan4 yi1yan3 ba1。"

msgid "Hang on, you neve--"
msgstr ""
"等等​，​你​没​—​—\n"
"deng3deng3，ni3 mei2 — —"

msgid "Hang on. Are you telling me that you've never been on a run before?"
msgstr ""
"等​下​。​你​是​说​你​以前​从来​没有​跑​过​差事​？\n"
"deng3 xia4。ni3 shi4 shuo1 ni3 yi3qian2 cong2lai2 mei2you3 pao2 guo4 cha4shi4？"

msgid "Hang on. Does this mean that you're leaving the group?"
msgstr ""
"等等​，​你​的​意思​是​要​退队​？\n"
"deng3deng3，ni3 de5 yi4si5 shi4 yao4 tui4 dui4？"

msgid "Hang on. How is this your fault? I don't see it."
msgstr ""
"等等​，​这​怎么​会​是​你​的​错​？​我​不​明白​。\n"
"deng3deng3，zhe4 zen3me5 hui4 shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4？wo3 bu4 ming2bai5。"

msgid "Hang on. How the hell did you hear about that?"
msgstr ""
"等等​，​你​是​怎么​听说​这事​的​？\n"
"deng3deng3，ni3 shi4 zen3me5 ting1shuo1 zhe4 shi4 de5？"

msgid "Hang on. I don't like the sound of that."
msgstr ""
"等等​。​这​听​起来​很​冒险​啊​。\n"
"deng3deng3。zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 mao4xian3 a1。"

msgid ""
"Hang on. That'd leave Feuerschwinge - both the dragon and the woman - to "
"burn to death. Is that really what you want?"
msgstr ""
"等​一下​。​这样​会​让​火翼​的​肉身​与​那个​女人​一起​被​活活​烧死​。​你​确定​这​是​你​想要​的​吗​？\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4。zhe4yang4 hui4 rang4 Huo3yi4 de5 rou4shen1 yu4 na4ge5 nu:3ren2 yi1qi3 bei4 huo2huo2 shao1si3。ni3 que4ding4 zhe4 shi4 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid "Hang on. There are a few more details that we need to discuss."
msgstr ""
"等​下​，​我们​还​有些​细节​要​讨论​。\n"
"deng3 xia4，wo3men5 hai2 you3xie1 xi4jie2 yao4 tao3lun4。"

msgid ""
"Hang on... the things that you named are all commercially available. "
"Hellishly expensive, but obtainable. They can't be what you were developing "
"here."
msgstr ""
"等等​……​你​列举​的​这些​都​是​市面上​能​买​到​的​。​虽说​贵得​离谱​，​但​确实​能​买​到​。​你们​研发​的​不​可能​是​这种​东西​。\n"
"deng3deng3……ni3 lie4ju3 de5 zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 shi4mian4shang4 neng2 mai3 dao4 de5。sui1shuo1 gui4 de2 li2pu3，dan4 que4shi2 neng2 mai3 dao4。ni3men5 yan2fa1 de5 bu4 ke3neng2 shi4 zhe4zhong3 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Hang on... we don't have a decker with the right equipment to do that."
msgstr ""
"等等​……​我们​没有​带​合适​设备​的​碟​客能​做到​这​一点​。\n"
"deng3deng3……wo3men5 mei2you3 dai4 he2shi4 she4bei4 de5 die2 ke4 neng2 zuo4dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"Hanging against the wall, you find a grainy photograph that has been mounted"
" to a wooden panel. The wood looks like it was recovered from a construction"
" site; it's rough, splintery stuff, and there are a few nails jutting out of"
" it at odd angles."
msgstr ""
"你​看到​墙上​挂​着​一张​装裱​在​木板​上​的​粗糙​照片​。​那​木板​像是​从​建筑工地​回收​的​，​表面​粗糙​带刺​，​几枚​钉子​以​奇怪​的​角度​凸出来​。\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 qiang2 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yi1 zhang1 zhuang1 biao3 zai4 mu4ban3 shang4 de5 cu1cao1 zhao4pian4。na4 mu4ban3 xiang4 shi4 cong2 jian4 zhu4 gong1 de5 hui2shou1 de5，biao3mian4 cu1cao1 dai4ci4，ji1 mei2 ding1zi5 yi3 qi2guai4 de5 jiao3du4 tu1 chu1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Hanging on the wall is a large, gaudily framed painting. An impressionist landscape, inexpertly rendered in splotches of cheap acrylic.\n"
"\n"
"A nameplate in the frame reads \"HARZ MOUNTAINS 2011.\""
msgstr ""
"墙上​挂​着​一张​巨大​的​装饰画​，​还配​了​一个​浮夸​的​画框​。​这​是​张​印象派​风格​的​风景画​，​用​廉价​的​丙烯​颜料​绘制​而成​，​画得​十分​蹩脚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​画框​上​的​铭牌​写​着​“​2011​年​，​绘于​哈茨山​”​。\n"
"\n"
"qiang2 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yi1 zhang1 ju4da4 de5 zhuang1 shi4 hua4，hai2 pei4 le5 yi1ge5 fu2kua1 de5 hua4kuang4。zhe4 shi4 zhang1 yin4xiang4pai4 feng1ge2 de5 feng1 jing3 hua4，yong4 lian2jia4 de5 bing3xi1 yan2liao4 hui4zhi4 er2 cheng2，hua4 de2 shi2fen1 bie2jiao3。\n"
"\n"
"hua4kuang4 shang4 de5 ming2pai2 xie3 zhao2“2011 nian2，hui4 yu2 ha1 ci2 shan1”。"

msgid ""
"Hanging on the wall is a large, gaudily framed painting. An unimaginative "
"still life of some kitchen objects sitting on a table."
msgstr ""
"墙上​挂​着​一张​巨大​的​装饰画​，​还配​了​一个​浮夸​的​画框​。​这​是​张​缺乏​想象力​的​静物画​，​只画​了​一些​散落​在​桌面上​的​厨具​。\n"
"qiang2 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yi1 zhang1 ju4da4 de5 zhuang1 shi4 hua4，hai2 pei4 le5 yi1ge5 fu2kua1 de5 hua4kuang4。zhe4 shi4 zhang1 que1fa2 xiang3xiang4li4 de5 jing4 wu4 hua4，zhi3 hua4 le5 yi1xie1 san3luo4 zai4 zhuo1 mian4 shang4 de5 chu2ju4。"

msgid "Hans Brackhaus"
msgstr ""
"汉斯​·​布拉克​豪斯\n"
"han4si1 · bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1"

msgid ""
"Happened fast, too. Just before you got here. I caught sight of him on the way down to the U-Bahn platform, and he looked normal enough.\n"
"\n"
"Then one of these bastards took a shot at him and winged him. Big mistake."
msgstr ""
"事情​发生​得​很快​。​就​在​你​到​这​之前​。​我​走​下​地铁站​台时​瞥见​了​他​，​当时​他​看起来​还​挺​正常​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​结果​有个​混蛋​朝​他​开​了​一枪​，​擦伤​了​他​。​那​人犯​了​个​大错​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 fa1sheng1 de2 hen3 kuai4。jiu4 zai4 ni3 dao4 zhe4 zhi1qian2。wo3 zou3 xia4 di4tie3zhan4 tai2 shi2 pie1jian4 le5 ta1，dang1shi2 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hai2 ting3 zheng4chang2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"jie1guo3 you3 ge4 hun2dan4 chao2 ta1 kai1 le5 yi1 qiang1，ca1shang1 le5 ta1。na4 ren2fan4 le5 ge4 da4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Happened to her? What could happen to her? What do you mean?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His bloodshot eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you threatening Janet?"
msgstr ""
"出事​？​她​会​出​什么​事​？​你​什么​意思​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​布满​血丝​的​眼睛​睁​大​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​在​威胁​珍妮特​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"chu1shi4？ta1 hui4 chu1 shen2me5 shi4？ni3 shen2me5 yi4si5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bu4man3 xue4si1 de5 yan3jing5 zheng1 dai4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 zai4 wei1xie2 zhen1 ni1 te4 ma5？"

msgid "Happens to the best of us."
msgstr ""
"正常​。\n"
"zheng4chang2。"

msgid "Happier times, huh?"
msgstr ""
"那​时候​的​日子​很​快乐​吧​？\n"
"na4 shi2hou5 de5 ri4zi5 hen3 kuai4le4 ba1？"

msgid "Happy to be of help."
msgstr ""
"乐意效劳​。\n"
"le4 yi4 xiao4 lao2。"

msgid "Happy to be of service."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​能​帮忙​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 bang1mang2。"

msgid "Happy to help, Sam."
msgstr ""
"乐意​帮忙​，​萨姆​。\n"
"le4yi4 bang1mang2，sa4 mu3。"

msgid "Happy to help. It must've been terrible to be stuck in here."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​我能​帮到​你​。​被困​在​这里​的​感觉​一定​很​糟糕​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 wo3 neng2 bang1 dao4 ni3。bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 gan3jue2 yi1ding4 hen3 zao1gao1。"

msgid "Hard"
msgstr ""
"困难\n"
"kun4nan5"

msgid "Hard to say."
msgstr ""
"不好​说​。\n"
"bu4hao3 shuo1。"

msgid "Hardcore"
msgstr ""
"硬核\n"
"ying4he2"

msgid ""
"Harding stepped into the role to replace Dr. Adrian Vauclair, who "
"disappeared under mysterious circumstances two years ago."
msgstr ""
"此前​哈丁​曾​接替​两年​前​神秘​失踪​的​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。\n"
"ci3qian2 ha1 zheng1 ceng2 jie1ti4 liang3 nian2 qian2 shen2mi4 shi1zong1 de5 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"Harebrained Schemes is a small team of passionate game developers led by "
"Jordan Weisman, the creator of Shadowrun, Crimson Skies, BattleTech, "
"MechWarrior, and many other acclaimed properties. Founded in 2011, the "
"Seattle-based studio is centered around collaboration between seasoned "
"veterans and fresh talent."
msgstr ""
"Harebrained​ ​Schemes​是​由​《​Shadowrun​》​、​《​Crimson​ ​Skies​》​、​《​BattleTech​》​、​《​MechWarrior​》​等​好评​游戏​的​制作​人​Jordan​ ​Weisman​率领​的​一支​充满​激情​的​游戏​开发​团队​。​这家​总部​位于​西雅图​的​工作室​成立​于​2011​年​，​核心理念​在于​资深​老将​与​新锐​人才​的​协作​共创​。\n"
"Harebrained Schemes shi4 you2 《 Shadowrun 》、《 Crimson Skies 》、《 BattleTech 》、《 MechWarrior 》 deng3 hao3ping2 you2xi4 de5 zhi4zuo4 ren2 Jordan Weisman shuai4ling3 de5 yi1 zhi1 chong1man3 ji1qing2 de5 you2xi4 kai1fa1 tuan2dui4。zhe4 jia1 zong3bu4 wei4yu2 xi1ya3tu2 de5 gong1zuo4shi4 cheng2li4 yu2 2011 nian2，he2 xin1 li3 nian4 zai4yu2 zi1shen1 lao3jiang4 yu4 xin1rui4 ren2cai2 de5 xie2zuo4 gong4 chuang4。"

msgid ""
"Harmless? I don't think so. Step away from me, elf... I want nothing more to"
" do with you."
msgstr ""
"没有​伤害​？​我​不​这么​认为​。​离​我​远点​，​精灵​……​我​不想​再​跟​你​有​任何​交集​。\n"
"mei2you3 shang1hai4？wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。li2 wo3 yuan3 dian3，jing1ling2……wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 gen1 ni3 you3 ren4he2 jiao1ji2。"

msgid "Harrow"
msgstr ""
"哈罗\n"
"ha1luo2"

msgid "Harrow Heal Wound"
msgstr ""
"哈罗​的​治愈​伤口\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 zhi4yu4 shang1kou3"

msgid ""
"Harrow and Feuerstelle are my responsibility. I don't need anyone else to hold my hand through dealing with them - that time has passed.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not afraid to face this anymore. I can *do* this. And once I've finished, I'm coming back to this team."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​和​“​火坑​”​都​是​我​的​责任​，​我​不​需要​别人​手把手​教我如何​处理​—​—​我​已经​不是​过去​的​我​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​勇敢​地面​对​这​一切​，​我能​*​做到​*​。​等​我​忙​完​，​我​就​归队​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 he4“huo3keng1” dou1 shi4 wo3 de5 ze2ren4，wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 bie2ren5 shou3 ba3 shou3 jiao1 wo3 ru2 he2 chu3li3——wo3 yi3jing1 bu4shi4 guo4qu4 de5 wo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 yong3gan3 di4mian4 dui4 zhe4 yi1qie4，wo3 neng2*zuo4dao4*。deng3 wo3 mang2 wan2，wo3 jiu4 gui1dui4。"

msgid ""
"Harrow doesn't take the young ones for wives... I don't know what Glory's told you, but he isn't a monster. And even the youngest initiates here aren't children - not really.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice goes soft.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Life on the street took that from them a long time ago."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​不会​娶​幼童​为妻​……​我​不​知道​格洛丽​对​你​说​过​什么​，​但​他​并​不是​一个​怪物​。​况且​这里​最​年轻​的​学徒​也​已经​脱离​了​孩童​的​范畴​—​—​至少​在​名义​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​变得​柔和​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​街头​生活​早已​剥夺​了​他们​的​童年​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 bu4hui4 qu3 you4tong2 wei2 qi4……wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 Ge2luo4li2 dui4 ni3 shuo1 guo4 shen2me5，dan4 ta1 bing4 bu4shi4 yi1ge5 guai4wu5。kuang4qie3 zhe4li3 zui4 nian2qing1 de5 xue2tu2 ye3 yi3jing1 tuo1li2 le5 hai2tong2 de5 fan4chou2——zhi4shao3 zai4 ming2yi4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 rou2he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jie1tou2 sheng1huo2 zao3yi3 bo1duo2 le5 ta1men5 de5 tong2nian2。"

msgid "Harrow got away, just like you said he would."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​逃走​了​，​和​你​说​的​一样​。\n"
"ha1luo2 tao2zou3 le5，he4 ni3 shuo1 de5 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"Harrow had this charisma, this raw, magnetic attraction that just made people latch onto him.\n"
"\n"
"I saw it over and over. All it took was a few words and a pat on the shoulder, and Harrow would have a new convert. The other kids at the farm followed him around like lost puppies. "
msgstr ""
"哈罗​身上​有​一种​魅力​，​一种​原始​而​强大​的​吸引力​，​让​人​不由自主​地被​他​吸引​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我见​过​无数次​这样​的​场景​。​只​需​几句话​，​然后​拍拍​肩膀​，​哈罗​就​能​赢得​新​的​追随者​。​农场​里​的​其他​孩子​都​像​迷途​的​小狗​般​围着​他​转​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 shen1shang5 you3 yi1zhong3 mei4li4，yi1zhong3 yuan2shi3 er2 qiang2da4 de5 xi1yin3li4，rang4 ren2 bu4you2zi4zhu3 de5 bei4 ta1 xi1yin3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian4 guo4 wu2 shu3 ci4 zhe4yang4 de5 chang3jing3。zhi3 xu1 ji1 ju4 hua4，ran2hou4 pai1 pai1 jian1bang3，ha1luo2 jiu4 neng2 ying2de2 xin1 de5 zhui1sui2zhe3。nong2chang3 li3 de5 qi2ta1 hai2zi5 dou1 xiang4 mi2tu2 de5 xiao3gou3 ban1 wei2 zhao2 ta1 zhuai3。"

msgid ""
"Harrow is *dead.* Feuerstelle is *gone.* Forget about the cultists, think about the future generations of street kids who will never have to go through what I did.\n"
"\n"
"Nobody will ever be corrupted by that place again. Who knows how many lives we've saved?"
msgstr ""
"哈罗​*​死​了​*​。​“​火坑​”​*​完蛋​了​*​。​别​想着​邪教徒​的​事​，​多​想想​以后​街头​的​孩子​们​，​起码​他们​不用​再​经历​我​那时​经历​的​一切​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​人会​再​被​那个​地方​腐蚀​。​这样​算下来​，​我们​间接​救​了​多少​性命​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2*si3 le5*。“huo3keng1”*wan2dan4 le5*。bie4 xiang3 zhao2 xie2 jiao1 tu2 de5 shi4，duo1 xiang3 xiang3 yi3hou4 jie1tou2 de5 hai2zi5 men5，qi3ma3 ta1men5 bu4yong4 zai4 jing1li4 wo3 na4shi2 jing1li4 de5 yi1qie4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ren2 hui4 zai4 bei4 na4ge5 di4fang1 fu3shi2。zhe4yang4 suan4 xia4 lai2，wo3men5 jian4jie1 jiu4 le5 duo1shao3 xing4ming4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Harrow is *evil.* You get that, right? I mean, he worships the *devil.* What"
" else do you need?"
msgstr ""
"哈罗​是​*​邪恶​*​的​。​你​明白​吧​？​我​是​说​，​他​崇拜​*​魔鬼​*​。​这​还​需要​什么​别的​证据​？\n"
"ha1luo2 shi4*xie2e4*de5。ni3 ming2bai5 ba1？wo3 shi4 shuo1，ta1 chong2bai4*mo2gui3*。zhe4 hai2 xu1yao4 shen2me5 bie2de5 zheng4ju4？"

msgid ""
"Harrow is a monster. If you can't see that after all of this, then you "
"deserve to go down with him."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​是​个​怪物​。​如果​在​这​一切​发生​后​你​还是​看不清​真相​，​那​你​活该​与​他​一起​去​死​。\n"
"ha1luo2 shi4 ge4 guai4wu5。ru2guo3 zai4 zhe4 yi1qie4 fa1sheng1 hou4 ni3 hai2shi5 kan4bu5qing1 zhen1xiang4，na4 ni3 huo2gai1 yu4 ta1 yi1qi3 qu4 si3。"

msgid ""
"Harrow is full of shit. There's nothing enlightened about any of this! It's all one big, narcissistic power trip for him.\n"
"\n"
"He's a psychopath. And he *hurts* those kids. He made *me* hurt them!"
msgstr ""
"哈罗​只会​胡说八道​而已​。​他​的​话语​根本​没有​任何​所谓​启蒙​可言​！​对​他​来说​，​这​不过​是​一场​自恋​的​权力​狂欢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​就是​个​疯子​。​他​*​伤害​*​了​那些​孩子​，​也​逼​得​*​我​*​去​伤害​他们​！\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 zhi3 hui4 hu2shuo1ba1dao4 er2yi3。ta1 de5 hua4yu3 gen1ben3 mei2you3 ren4he2 suo3wei4 qi3meng2 ke3yan2！dui4 ta1 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 bu4guo4 shi4 yi1 chang2 zi4lian4 de5 quan2li4 kuang2huan1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiu4shi4 ge4 feng1zi5。ta1*shang1hai4*le5 na4Xie1hai2zi5，ye3 bi1 de2*wo3*qu4 shang1hai4 ta1men5！"

msgid "Harrow is going to get you. You'll see!"
msgstr ""
"哈罗​会​来​抓住​你​的​，​等着瞧​吧​！\n"
"ha1luo2 hui4 lai2 zhua1zhu4 ni3 de5，deng3zhe5qiao2 ba1！"

msgid ""
"Harrow is hurting the runaways that you bring here. You can see that, can't "
"you?"
msgstr ""
"哈罗​正在​伤害​那些​被​你​带到​这里​的​离家出走​的​孩子​。​你​看不出来​吗​？\n"
"ha1luo2 zheng4zai4 shang1hai4 na4xie1 bei4 ni3 dai4 dao4 zhe4li3 de5 li2jia1chu1zou3 de5 hai2zi5。ni3 kan4 bu4 chu1 lai2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Harrow is responsible for all of this, Marta. For you, for me... even for the corruption of this spirit.\n"
"\n"
"He has to die. It's the only way that this will ever really be over."
msgstr ""
"这​一切都是​哈罗​造成​的​，​玛​尔塔​。​你​我​长久以来​的​遭遇​……​甚至​还有​这个​精魂​的​堕落​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​必须​死​。​只有​这样​，​这​一切​才能​真正​结束​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 ha1luo2 zao4cheng2 de5，Ma3er3ta3。ni3 wo3 chang2jiu3yi3lai2 de5 zao1yu4……shen4zhi4 hai2you3 zhe4ge5 jing1hun2 de5 duo4luo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bi4xu1 si3。zhi3you3 zhe4yang4，zhe4 yi1qie4 cai2neng2 zhen1zheng4 jie2shu4。"

msgid ""
"Harrow keeps a shrine in the compound. It's the key to his control over the cultists.\n"
"\n"
"We're going to purify the shrine and break that control. And then we're going to lead those kids out of here."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​在​这里​供奉​着​一座​神龛​。​这​是​他​控制​教徒​的​关键所在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​净化​神龛​，​打破​他​的​控制​，​然后​带​那些​孩子​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 zai4 zhe4li3 gong4feng4 zhao2 yi1 zuo4 shen2kan1。zhe4 shi4 ta1 kong4zhi4 jiao4tu2 de5 guan1 jian4 suo3 zai4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 jing4hua4 shen2kan1，da3po4 ta1 de5 kong4zhi4，ran2hou4 dai4 na4Xie1hai2zi5 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Harrow lives, then. We focus our attention on rescuing the cultists instead."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​不动​哈罗​了​。​我们​会​集中精力​营救​那些​教徒​。\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 bu4dong4 ha1luo2 le5。wo3men5 hui4 ji2 zhong4 jing1 li4 ying2jiu4 na4xie1 jiao4tu2。"

msgid ""
"Harrow needs to die. I don't want any other kids hurt or killed, but Harrow... that bastard has to *pay* for what he did to me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stops, as if suddenly unsure of herself. A moment later, a newfound confidence seems to seize her. She looks to you, and there is fire in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He has to pay for what he did to all of us. I won't let this happen again. He needs to die."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​必须​死​。​我​不愿​再有​其他​孩子​受伤​或​丧命​，​但​哈罗​……​那​混蛋​必须​为​他​对​我​做​的​事​付出​*​代价​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​突然​停住​，​仿佛​对​自己​产生​了​怀疑​。​片刻​后​，​新生​的​坚定​似乎​重新​掌控​了​她​。​她​转向​你​，​眼中​燃烧​着​火焰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​必须​为​伤害​我们​所有人​付出代价​。​我​绝不会​让​悲剧重演​。​他​必须​死​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 bi4xu1 si3。wo3 bu4yuan4 zai4 you3 qi2ta1 hai2zi5 shou4shang1 huo4 sang4ming4，dan4 ha1luo2……na4 hun2dan4 bi4xu1 wei2 ta1 dui4 wo3 zuo4 de5 shi4 fu4chu1*dai4jia4*。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tu1ran2 ting2zhu4，fang3fu2 dui4 zi4ji3 chan3sheng1 le5 huai2yi2。pian4ke4 hou4，xin1sheng1 de5 jian1ding4 si4hu1 chong2xin1 zhang3kong4 le5 ta1。ta1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，yan3zhong1 ran2shao1 zhao2 huo3yan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 bi4xu1 wei2 shang1hai4 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 rang4 bei1 ju4 chong2 yan3。ta1 bi4xu1 si3。"

msgid ""
"Harrow stumbles backward, clutching his head. The rippling motion of his outline has become ragged and violent. \n"
"\n"
"Through the haze, you can see rivulets of gore tracing their way down from his ears and nose. The whites of his eyes have gone pink with blood.\n"
"\n"
"He shrieks at Glory, and his voice comes out in a strangled croak."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​踉跄​后退​，​捂住​脑袋​。​他​轮廓​的​涟漪​状​波动​变得​支离破碎​，​并且​愈发​剧烈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​透过​朦胧​的​雾气​，​你​看见​血流​从​他​的​耳​鼻间​如​小溪​般淌​下​。​他​的​眼白​已​被​鲜血​染成​了​粉红色​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​对​着​格洛丽​发出​尖叫​，​喉咙​里​挤出​嘶哑​的​嘶鸣​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 liang4qiang4 hou4tui4，wu3zhu4 nao3dai5。ta1 lun2kuo4 de5 lian2yi1 zhuang4 bo1dong4 bian4de5 zhi1li2po4sui4，bing4qie3 yu4fa1 ju4lie4。\n"
"\n"
"tou4guo4 meng2long2 de5 wu4qi4，ni3 kan4jian4 xue4liu2 cong2 ta1 de5 er3 bi2 jian1 ru2 xiao3xi1 ban1 tang3 xia4。ta1 de5 yan3bai2 yi3 bei4 xian1xue4 ran3 cheng2 le5 fen3hong2se4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dui4 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 fa1chu1 jian1jiao4，hou2long2 li3 ji3chu1 si1ya3 de5 si1ming2。"

msgid ""
"Harrow teaches all of the initiates how to do it - how to harvest the meat, how to store it, how to label it. Nobody likes doing it at first, but you learn.\n"
"\n"
"By the end, it doesn't even bother you anymore."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​会​把​完整​流程​教给​每​一位​学徒​—​—​从​割肉​方法​，​到​储存​技巧​，​再​到​标签​规范​。​起初​大家​都​对​这项​工作​充满​抵触​，​但​渐渐​也​就​习惯​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​到​最后​，​这些​事​已经​不会​在​你​心里​激起​任何​波澜​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 hui4 ba3 wan2zheng3 liu2cheng2 jiao1 gei3 mei3 yi1 wei4 xue2tu2——cong2 ge1rou4 fang1fa3，dao4 chu3cun2 ji4qiao3，zai4 dao4 biao1qian1 gui1fan4。qi3chu1 da4jia1 dou1 dui4 zhe4 xiang4 gong1zuo4 chong1man3 di3chu4，dan4 jian4jian4 ye3 jiu4 xi2guan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dao4 zui4hou4，zhe4xie1 shi4 yi3jing1 bu4hui4 zai4 ni3 xin1li5 ji1qi3 ren4he2 bo1lan2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Harrow wasn't overly concerned about my absence. I had long since reached "
"the point where I could assert my autonomy, and he knew that I'd be back."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​对​我​的​缺席​并​不​特别​在意​。​我​早已​到​了​能够​坚持​自主​决定​的​年纪​，​他​知道​我​终会​归来​。\n"
"ha1luo2 dui4 wo3 de5 que1xi2 bing4 bu4 te4bie2 zai4yi4。wo3 zao3yi3 dao4 le5 neng2gou4 jian1chi2 zi4zhu3 jue2ding4 de5 nian2ji4，ta1 zhi1dao4 wo3 zhong1 hui4 gui1lai2。"

msgid ""
"Harrow would send the girls out to neighboring cities to lure in the street "
"kids that nobody would miss. He targeted children because they were easy to "
"indoctrinate, and because nothing makes the Adversary happier than the "
"corruption of the innocent."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​会派​女孩​们​前往​邻近​城市​，​引诱​那些​无人​会​察觉​的​街头​流浪儿​。​他​选择​儿童​作为​目标​，​因为​他们​容易​被​洗脑​，​更​因为​没有​什么​比​腐蚀​纯真​更令​魔鬼​欢欣​。\n"
"ha1luo2 hui4 pai4 nu:3hai2 men5 qian2wang3 lin2jin4 cheng2shi4，yin3you4 na4xie1 wu2ren2 hui4 cha2jue2 de5 jie1tou2 liu2lang4er2。ta1 xuan3ze2 er2tong2 zuo4wei2 mu4biao1，yin1wei4 ta1men5 rong2yi4 bei4 xi3nao3，geng1 yin1wei4 mei2you3 shen2me5 bi3 fu3shi2 chun2zhen1 geng1 ling3 mo2gui3 huan1xin1。"

msgid "Harrow's Manifesto"
msgstr ""
"哈罗​的​宣言\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 xuan1yan2"

msgid "Harrow's Shield"
msgstr ""
"哈罗​的​护盾\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 hu4dun4"

msgid "Harrow's magic shrine won't save him. Let's get to work."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​的​魔法​神龛​也​救​不了​他​。​我们​开始​行动​吧​。\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 mo2fa3 shen2kan1 ye3 jiu4 bu4le5 ta1。wo3men5 kai1shi3 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Harrow's magic still protects him, but not well enough. At least half of his body has been seared black by the creatures' attacks.\n"
"\n"
"Blood spills from his ears and nose, and his eyes have gone wide with terror."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​的​魔法​仍然​在​保护​他​，​但​效果​并​不好​。​他​的​身体​至少​有​一半​被​那些​生物​的​攻击​烧焦​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​鲜血​从​他​的​耳​鼻​涌出​。​他​的​双眼​因​恐惧​而​瞪​得​老大​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 mo2fa3 reng2ran2 zai4 bao3hu4 ta1，dan4 xiao4guo3 bing4 bu4hao3。ta1 de5 shen1ti3 zhi4shao3 you3 yi1ban4 bei4 na4xie1 sheng1wu4 de5 gong1ji1 shao1jiao1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian1xue4 cong2 ta1 de5 er3 bi2 yong3chu1。ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 yin1 kong3ju4 er2 deng4 de2 lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"Harrow's manifesto lies in its cradle, still open to the page that you were "
"looking at when you walked away."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​的​宣言​平摊​在​托架​上​，​翻开​的​位置​仍停留​在​你​离开​时读​到​的​那​一页​。\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 xuan1yan2 ping2tan1 zai4 tuo1jia4 shang4，fan1kai1 de5 wei4zhi5 reng2 ting2 liu2 zai4 ni3 li2kai1 shi2 dou4 dao4 de5 na4 yi1 xie2。"

msgid ""
"Harrow's manifesto. The handcrafted line of bullshit that he feeds to his initiates.\n"
"\n"
"We all ate it up with a smile, and came away convinced that he was a genius."
msgstr ""
"这是​哈罗​的​宗教​宣言​。​这些​都​是​他​一手​炮制​的​胡言乱语​，​然后​被​灌输​给​他​的​学徒​们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​都​面带微笑​地​选择​接受​，​并​坚信​他​是​个​天才​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 zong1jiao4 xuan1yan2。zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 ta1 yi1shou3 pao2zhi4 de5 hu2yan2luan4yu3，ran2hou4 bei4 guan4shu1 gei3 ta1 de5 xue2tu2 men5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 mian4 dai4 wei1 xiao4 de5 xuan3ze2 jie1shou4，bing4 jian1xin4 ta1 shi4 ge4 tian1cai2。"

msgid "Harrow."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​。\n"
"ha1luo2。"

msgid "Has there been any more fallout from Monika's death?"
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​死​是否​引发​了​更​多​后续​影响​？\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 shi4fou3 yin3fa1 le5 geng1 duo1 hou4xu4 ying3xiang3？"

msgid "Hasenkamp"
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3"

msgid "Hasenkamp Must Survive"
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​必须​存活\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 bi4xu1 cun2huo2"

msgid "Hasenkamp falls silent, but his mouth curls into a frown."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​陷入​了​沉默​，​但​他​的​嘴角​用力​扭曲​着​。\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 xian4ru4 le5 chen2mo4，dan4 ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 yong4li4 niu3qu1 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"Hasenkamp must survive to report success back to Meat Grinder and clear "
"Blitz's debt."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​必须​存活​并​向​“​绞肉机​”​报告​行动​成功​，​这样​才能​清偿​布里​茨​的​债务​。\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 bi4xu1 cun2huo2 bing4 xiang4“jiao3rou4ji1” bao4gao4 xing2dong4 cheng2gong1，zhe4yang4 cai2neng2 qing1chang2 Bu4li3ci2 de5 zhai4wu4。"

msgid ""
"Hasenkamp steps outside. Immediately afterward, the door slams shut behind him.\n"
"\n"
"You hear a dull thud. A maglock sliding shut."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​走​了​过去​。​紧接着​，​门​在​他​身上​猛地​关上​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听到​沉闷​的​咣当​声​。​磁力锁​重新​就位​。\n"
"\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 zou3 le5 guo4qu4。jin3jie1zhe5，men2 zai4 ta1 shen1shang5 meng3de5 guan1shang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 chen2men4 de5 guang1dang1 sheng1。ci2li4suo3 chong2xin1 jiu4 wei4。"

msgid ""
"Hasenkamp walks to a nearby safe and taps a code into the keypad. The door swings open.\n"
"\n"
"He reaches inside and pulls out a small plastic box, then taps the activator on his commlink."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​走​到​附近​一个​保险箱​前​，​在​小键盘​上​输入​了​一串​密码​。​门​应声​而开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​伸手​从​里面​拿出​了​一个​小​塑料盒​，​然后​按响​了​自己​的​通讯​链​。\n"
"\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 zou3 dao4 fu4jin4 yi1ge5 bao3xian3xiang1 qian2，zai4 xiao3 jian4 pan2 shang4 shu1ru4 le5 yi1 chuan4 mi4ma3。men2 ying4sheng1 er2 kai1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen1shou3 cong2 li3mian4 na2chu1 le5 yi1ge5 xiao3 su4 liao4 he2，ran2hou4 an4 xiang3 le5 zi4ji3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。"

msgid "Hasenkamp was smart. Loyal. Why replace him at all?"
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​是​个​聪明​又​忠诚​的​人​。​为什么​要​换掉​他​呢​？\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 shi4 ge4 cong1ming5 you4 zhong1cheng2 de5 ren2。wei4shen2me5 yao4 huan4 diao4 ta1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Hasenkamp's body lies on the ground, riddled with bullets.\n"
"\n"
"Some of the turret fire must have caught the box that he was carrying. It lays splayed open, its electronic guts spilled across the floor."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​的​尸体​躺​在​地上​，​全身​遍布​弹孔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​炮塔​的​射击​肯定​是​打中​了​他​怀里​的​盒子​。​盖子​在​地上​敞开​着​，​里面​的​电子元件​散落​一地​。\n"
"\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 shi1ti3 tang3 zai4 di4shang5，quan2shen1 bian4bu4 dan4kong3。\n"
"\n"
"pao4ta3 de5 she4ji1 ken3ding4 shi4 da3zhong4 le5 ta1 huai2li3 de5 he2zi5。gai4zi5 zai4 di4shang5 chang3kai1 zhao2，li3mian4 de5 dian4 zi3 yuan2 jian4 san3luo4 yi1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Hasenkamp's fingers dance over the terminal's keypad. A progress bar winks "
"onto the screen and rapidly climbs toward 100%."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​的​手指​在​小键盘​上​飞速​跃动​着​。​进度条​在​屏幕​上​闪现​，​并​迅速​攀升​至​100​%​。\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 shou3zhi3 zai4 xiao3 jian4 pan2 shang4 fei1su4 yue4 dong4 zhao2。jin4du4tiao2 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4 shan3xian4，bing4 xun4su4 pan1sheng1 zhi4 100%。"

msgid "Haste I"
msgstr ""
"神速​I\n"
"shen2su4 I"

msgid "Haste II"
msgstr ""
"神速​II\n"
"shen2su4 II"

msgid "Haste III"
msgstr ""
"神速​III\n"
"shen2su4 III"

msgid "Haste IV"
msgstr ""
"神速​IV\n"
"shen2su4 IV"

msgid "Haste: AP +1"
msgstr ""
"神速​：​行动​点​+​1\n"
"shen2su4：xing2dong4 dian3 +1"

msgid "Haste: AP +2"
msgstr ""
"神速​：​行动​点​+​2\n"
"shen2su4：xing2dong4 dian3 +2"

msgid "Hatch"
msgstr ""
"舱口\n"
"cang1 kou3"

msgid ""
"Hate to break it to you, but those supplies were stolen from another kiez. "
"*My* kiez. That means all that money you've been making belongs to *me.*"
msgstr ""
"恕我直言​，​这批​物资​是从​另​一个​街区​偷来​的​。​*​我​的​*​街区​。​这​意味着​你​通过​它​赚​来​的​所有​钱​都​该​归​*​我​*​。\n"
"shu4 wo3 zhi2 yan2，zhe4 pi1 wu4zi1 shi4 cong2 ling4 yi1ge5 jie1qu1 tou1 lai2 de5。*wo3 de5*jie1qu1。zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 tong1guo4 ta1 zhuan4 lai2 de5 suo3you3 qian2 dou1 gai1 gui1*wo3*。"

msgid ""
"Hate to burst your bubble, but I'm not overly enthusiastic about either of "
"you. So let's just get this over with, all right?"
msgstr ""
"我​真​不想​戳破​你​的​幻想​，​但​我​对​你们​俩​都​没什么​好感​。​所以​咱们​赶紧​把​这事​弄完​行​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhen1 bu4xiang3 chuo1po4 ni3 de5 huan4xiang3，dan4 wo3 dui4 ni3men5 lia3 dou1 mei2shen2me5 hao3gan3。suo3yi3 zan2men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4 long4 wan2 xing2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hate to disappoint you, but that isn't gonna happen.\n"
"\n"
"Not that I don't appreciate it, mind you. I just can't work with a team like yours on a permanent basis."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​要​让​你​失望​了​，​我​并​没有​这个​打算​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​感谢​这个​机会​，​只是​我​不能​长期​和​你们​这样​的​团队​合作​。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 yao4 rang4 ni3 shi1wang4 le5，wo3 bing4 mei2you3 zhe4ge5 da3suan4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gan3xie4 zhe4ge5 ji1hui4，zhi3shi4 wo3 bu4neng2 chang2qi1 he4 ni3men5 zhe4yang4 de5 tuan2dui4 he2zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Hate to say it, but he's right. If you want me to get you around that "
"firewall, you're going to have to give me instructions."
msgstr ""
"他​说​的​确实​没错​。​如果​你​想​让​我​帮​你​搞定​防火墙​的话​，​就​得​告诉​我​具体步骤​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de5 que4shi2 mei2cuo4。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 bang1 ni3 gao3ding4 fang2huo3qiang2 de5hua4，jiu4 de2 gao4su4 wo3 ju4 ti3 bu4 zhou4。"

msgid ""
"Hatred burns in the Engineer's stare. He struggles to rise from the floor, "
"but after a few seconds of ineffectual thrashing, he gives up."
msgstr ""
"仇恨​在​工程师​的​目光​中​燃烧​。​他​努力​想​从​地​上爬​起​，​但​在​几秒钟​的​徒劳​挣扎​后​，​他​放弃​了​。\n"
"chou2hen4 zai4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 mu4guang1 zhong4 ran2shao1。ta1 nu3li4 xiang3 cong2 de5 shang4 pa2 qi3，dan4 zai4 ji1 miao3 zhong1 de5 tu2lao2 zheng1zha2 hou4，ta1 fang4qi4 le5。"

msgid "Haushofer"
msgstr ""
"豪斯​霍​菲尔\n"
"hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3"

msgid "Have Blitz open the Vault, to allow the transfer to be initiated."
msgstr ""
"让​布里​茨​打开​保险库​，​开始​转账​程序​。\n"
"rang4 Bu4li3ci2 da3kai1 bao3 xian3 ku4，kai1shi3 zhuan3zhang4 cheng2xu4。"

msgid ""
"Have Blitz open the first security door to gain access to the secure area at"
" the back of the bank."
msgstr ""
"让​布里​茨​打开​第一道​安全门​，​进入​银行​后方​的​管制​区域​。\n"
"rang4 Bu4li3ci2 da3kai1 di4 yi1 dao4 an1 quan2 men2，jin4ru4 yin2hang2 hou4fang1 de5 guan3zhi4 qu1yu4。"

msgid ""
"Have a change of heart? Decided that maybe you should help us?\n"
"\n"
"Because if you haven't, we want nothin' to do with you."
msgstr ""
"改变​主意​了​？​决定​或许​该​帮帮​我们​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​的话​，​我们​可​不想​跟​你​扯​上​关系​。\n"
"\n"
"gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 le5？jue2ding4 huo4xu3 gai1 bang1 bang1 wo3men5？\n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2 de5hua4，wo3men5 ke3 bu4xiang3 gen1 ni3 che3 shang4 guan1xi5。"

msgid "Have a good one, then."
msgstr ""
"再见​。\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Have a good time. And behave yourself.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He returns to his comic book, licks a thick finger, and turns the page.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"玩得​开心​点​，​做事​规矩​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​重新​看​向​漫画书​，​舔​了​下​粗壮​的​手指​，​捻​开下​一页​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wan2 de2 kai1xin1 dian3，zuo4shi4 gui1ju5 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong2xin1 kan4 xiang4 man4 hua4 shu1，tian3 le5 xia4 cu1zhuang4 de5 shou3zhi3，nian3 kai1 xia4 yi1 xie2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Have fun. "
msgstr ""
"玩去​吧​。\n"
"wan2 qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Have it your way.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The security personnel raise their weapons into an attack posture.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"随便​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​安保​人员​举起​武器​进入​攻击​姿态​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} an1bao3 ren2yuan2 ju3qi3 wu3qi4 jin4ru4 gong1ji1 zi1tai4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Have no idea who they're messing with."
msgstr ""
"他们​不​知道​自己​招惹​了​什么​人物​。\n"
"ta1men5 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zhao1re3 le5 shen2me5 ren2wu4。"

msgid "Have they alerted that Knight Errant team that you told me about?"
msgstr ""
"你​之前​说​过​的​那支​游侠​骑士​小组​出动​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 guo4 de5 na4 zhi1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 xiao3zu3 chu1dong4 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Have you any more questions for me, or may I get back to work?"
msgstr ""
"你​还有​别的​问题​吗​？​没事​的话​我​就​先​去​忙​了​。\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 wen4ti2 ma5？mei2shi4 de5hua4 wo3 jiu4 xian1 qu4 mang2 le5。"

msgid "Have you been able to do any digging on Winternight?"
msgstr ""
"你​有没有​查​到​任何​关于​“​冬夜​”​的​情报​？\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 cha2 dao4 ren4he2 guan1yu2“dong1 ye4” de5 qing2bao4？"

msgid ""
"Have you been able to do any digging since we got back? I need to know that "
"we made the right decision back there."
msgstr ""
"我们​回来​后​你​查到​什么​线索​了​吗​？​我​得​知道​我们​有没有​做出​正确​的​决定​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui2lai5 hou4 ni3 cha2 dao4 shen2me5 xian4suo3 le5 ma5？wo3 de2 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 you3mei2you3 zuo4chu1 zheng4que4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid "Have you ever heard of a gang called the Kreuzritters?"
msgstr ""
"你​有没有​听说​过​一个​叫​“​十字军​”​的​帮派​？\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 ting1shuo1 guo4 yi1ge5 jiao4“shi2zi4jun1” de5 bang1pai4？"

msgid "Have you ever heard of an organization called \"The Lodge\"?"
msgstr ""
"你​有没有​听说​过​一个​叫​“​结社​”​的​组织​？\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 ting1shuo1 guo4 yi1ge5 jiao4“jie2she4” de5 zu3zhi1？"

msgid "Have you found my stuff yet? I really need that money..."
msgstr ""
"你​找到​我​的​东西​了​吗​？​我​真的​很​需要​那笔​钱​……\n"
"ni3 zhao3dao4 wo3 de5 dong1xi1 le5 ma5？wo3 zhen1de5 hen3 xu1yao4 na4 bi3 qian2……"

msgid ""
"Have you gone over my research? Do you understand what we're up against?"
msgstr ""
"你​是否​看过​我​的​研究​？​你​知道​我们​要​对抗​什么​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shi4fou3 kan4 guo4 wo3 de5 yan2jiu1？ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 yao4 dui4kang4 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Have you had a chance to play with that rifle that we got from the "
"Engineer's stash?"
msgstr ""
"你​有没有​试过​那支​从​工程师​的​藏匿处​弄​来​的​步枪​？\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 shi4 guo4 na4 zhi1 cong2 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 zang4 ni4 chu3 long4 lai2 de5 bu4qiang1？"

msgid "Have you heard of a guy named Green Winters?"
msgstr ""
"你​听说​过​一个​叫​格林​·​温特斯​的​家伙​吗​？\n"
"ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 yi1ge5 jiao4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 jia1huo5 ma5？"

msgid "Have you put any thought into what I said earlier?"
msgstr ""
"你​有没有​仔细​考虑​我​之前​说​的​？\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 zi3xi4 kao3lu:4 wo3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 de5？"

msgid "Have you reconsidered, then? Will you help me?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​考虑​好了吗​？​你​会​帮​我​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 kao3lu:4 hao3 le5 ma5？ni3 hui4 bang1 wo3 ma5？"

msgid "Have you seen a shipment of weapons pass through here recently?"
msgstr ""
"你​最近​有见​过​一批​武器​经过​这里​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zui4jin4 you3 jian4 guo4 yi1 pi1 wu3qi4 jing1guo4 zhe4li3 ma5？"

msgid "Have you seen the captain's children?"
msgstr ""
"你​见​过​舰长​的​孩子​们​吗​？\n"
"ni3 jian4 guo4 jian4zhang3 de5 hai2zi5 men5 ma5？"

msgid "Have you seen the captain?"
msgstr ""
"你​见​过​舰长​吗​？\n"
"ni3 jian4 guo4 jian4zhang3 ma5？"

msgid "Haven't been here long."
msgstr ""
"我​到​这里​还​没多久​。\n"
"wo3 dao4 zhe4li3 hai2 mei2duo1jiu3。"

msgid "Having fun?"
msgstr ""
"玩得​开心​吗​？\n"
"wan2 de2 kai1xin1 ma5？"

msgid "He *wouldn't* be here if you hadn't spilled the beans to Meat Grinder."
msgstr ""
"如果​不是​你​向​“​绞肉机​”​透露消息​的话​，​他​就​*​不会​*​在​这里​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 bu4shi4 ni3 xiang4“jiao3rou4ji1” tou4 lou4 xiao1 xi1 de5hua4，ta1 jiu4*bu4hui4*zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid "He appeared to be the head of security."
msgstr ""
"他​似乎​是​安保​团队​的​头领​。\n"
"ta1 si4hu1 shi4 an1bao3 tuan2dui4 de5 tou2ling3。"

msgid "He checks the data readout on the terminal next to the woman."
msgstr ""
"他​检查​着​女人​旁边​的​终端​数据​。\n"
"ta1 jian3cha2 zhao2 nu:3ren2 pang2bian1 de5 zhong1duan1 shu4ju4。"

msgid "He clamshells the terminal closed, then puts his head in his hands."
msgstr ""
"他​一把​合​上​终端​，​然后​用​双手​捂住​脸​。\n"
"ta1 yi1 ba3 ge3 shang4 zhong1duan1，ran2hou4 yong4 shuang1shou3 wu3zhu4 lian3。"

msgid ""
"He clearly has no combat experience, but he fights like a cornered animal.\n"
"\n"
"Seeing an opening, you knock him off balance and propel him, face first, into the corner of the desk."
msgstr ""
"他​显然​没有​实战经验​，​却​仍​在​做​困兽之斗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​抓住​一个​空档​，​把​他​打​得​失去平衡​，​然后​把​他​脸朝下​按​向​桌角​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xian3ran2 mei2you3 shi2 zhan4 jing1 yan4，que4 reng2 zai4 zuo4 kun4 shou4 zhi1 dou3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhua1zhu4 yi1ge5 kong4dang4，ba3 ta1 da3 de2 shi1 qu4 ping2 heng2，ran2hou4 ba3 ta1 lian3 chao2 xia4 an4 xiang4 zhuo1 jiao3。"

msgid ""
"He clicks an off-screen button, and the image of Winters disappears. It is "
"replaced by a digital scan of a magazine page."
msgstr ""
"他​按​下​屏幕​外​的​一个​按钮​，​温特斯​的​图像​消失​了​，​取而代之​的​是​杂志​页面​的​数字​扫描​图像​。\n"
"ta1 an4 xia4 ping2mu4 wai4 de5 yi1ge5 an4niu3，Wen1te4si1 de5 tu2xiang4 xiao1shi1 le5，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 za2zhi4 ye4mian4 de5 shu4zi4 sao3miao2 tu2xiang4。"

msgid ""
"He closes his eyes and concentrates. Minutes pass.\n"
"\n"
"Slowly, a smile creeps across his face."
msgstr ""
"他​闭上眼睛​，​全神贯注​。​几分钟​过去​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​慢慢​地​，​一抹​笑容​出现​在​他​脸上​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1，quan2shen2guan4zhu4。ji1 fen4 zhong1 guo4qu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"man4man4 de5，yi1 ma1 xiao4rong2 chu1xian4 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4。"

msgid ""
"He continues to stare for a long time.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, he shrugs."
msgstr ""
"他​继续​盯​着​你​看​了​好久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​他​耸耸肩​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ji4xu4 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 hao3jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 song3 song3 jian1。"

msgid ""
"He continues to stare.\n"
"\n"
"Eventually, he seems to come to some sort of decision. He nods once, then drops his hands to his sides."
msgstr ""
"他​继续​盯​着​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​他​似乎​做出​了​某种​决定​。​他​微微​点头​，​然后​垂​下​手臂​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ji4xu4 ding1 zhao2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ta1 si4hu1 zuo4chu1 le5 mou3zhong3 jue2ding4。ta1 wei1wei1 dian3tou2，ran2hou4 chui2 xia4 shou3bi4。"

msgid "He couldn't hack it in a fight. Too bad for him."
msgstr ""
"他​没有​打架​的​本事​。​真​可惜​。\n"
"ta1 mei2you3 da3jia4 de5 ben3shi4。zhen1 ke3xi1。"

msgid ""
"He currently holds an executive position in the Berlin office, overseeing Project *REDACTED*. He has been labeled a moderate-high risk by AGC Security due to the sensitive nature of his knowledge.\n"
"\n"
"He is to be considered a non-expendable employee, and holds a \"Top Secret\" security clearence."
msgstr ""
"他​目前​在​柏林​分部​担任​主管​职务​，​负责​监督​*​已​编辑​*​项目​。​由于​掌握​敏感​信息​，​欧洲​化工​安全部门​已​将​其​标记​为​中​高风险​人员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​员工​被​视为​不可​替代​人员​，​并​持有​“​绝密​”​级​安全​许可​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 mu4qian2 zai4 bo2lin2 fen1bu4 dan1ren4 zhu3guan3 zhi2wu4，fu4ze2 jian1du1*yi3 bian1ji2*xiang4mu4。you2yu2 zhang3wo4 min3gan3 xin4xi1，ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 an1 quan2 bu4 men2 yi3 jiang1 qi2 biao1ji4 wei2 zhong4 gao1feng1xian3 ren2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 yuan2gong1 bei4 shi4wei2 bu4ke3 ti4dai4 ren2yuan2，bing4 chi2you3“jue2mi4” ji2 an1quan2 xu3ke3。"

msgid "He deserved it. James was a bastard."
msgstr ""
"那​是​他​活该​。​詹姆斯​就是​个​混蛋​。\n"
"na4 shi4 ta1 huo2gai1。zhan1mu3si1 jiu4shi4 ge4 hun2dan4。"

msgid "He did, huh?"
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？\n"
"shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"He doesn't need a criminal empire to cut your thumbs off, Blitz. All that he"
" needs is a pair of scissors and a grudge."
msgstr ""
"想要​切掉​你​的​拇指​并不需要​什么​犯罪​帝国​，​布里​茨​。​他​需要​的​只有​一把​剪子​和​对​你​的​仇恨​。\n"
"xiang3yao4 qie1 diao4 ni3 de5 mu3zhi3 bing4 bu4 xu1 yao4 shen2me5 fan4zui4 di4guo2，Bu4li3ci2。ta1 xu1yao4 de5 zhi3you3 yi1 ba3 jian3zi5 he4 dui4 ni3 de5 chou2hen4。"

msgid "He doesn't seem to be afraid to use it either."
msgstr ""
"他​似乎​也​不​惧怕​使用​。\n"
"ta1 si4hu1 ye3 bu4 ju4pa4 shi3yong4。"

msgid ""
"He falls silent, blinking. As you watch, his expression clouds.\n"
"\n"
"When he speaks again, his voice is small."
msgstr ""
"他​沉默​下来​，​眨​了​眨眼​。​在​你​的​注视​下​，​他​的​表情​变得​阴郁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​他​再次​开口​时​，​声音​变得​低沉​而​微弱​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chen2mo4 xia4lai5，zha3 le5 zha3yan3。zai4 ni3 de5 zhu4shi4 xia4，ta1 de5 biao3qing2 bian4de5 yin1yu4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 bian4de5 di1chen2 er2 wei1ruo4。"

msgid ""
"He falls silent.\n"
"\n"
"There is a long, awkward pause."
msgstr ""
"他​沉默​了​下来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​场面​一片​尴尬​，​气氛​凝滞​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chen2mo4 le5 xia4lai5。\n"
"\n"
"chang3mian4 yi1 pian1 gan1ga4，qi4fen1 ning2zhi4。"

msgid "He found her alive in the SOX, after all."
msgstr ""
"他​果然​把​她​活着​带离​了​萨洛​卢区​。\n"
"ta1 guo3ran2 ba3 ta1 huo2zhe5 dai4 li2 le5 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1。"

msgid "He gestures to his left."
msgstr ""
"他朝​左手边​比划​了​一下​。\n"
"ta1 chao2 zuo3 shou3 bian1 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"He glances at you with red-rimmed eyes, then averts his gaze.\n"
"\n"
"Without a word, he turns the terminal so that you can read the message on the screen."
msgstr ""
"他​用​布满​血丝​的​眼睛​瞥​了​你​一眼​，​然后​移开​了​视线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​一言不发​，​将​终端​转向​你​，​让你能​看到​屏幕​上​的​信息​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yong4 bu4man3 xue4si1 de5 yan3jing5 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，ran2hou4 yi2kai1 le5 shi4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1，jiang1 zhong1duan1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，rang4 ni3 neng2 kan4dao4 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 xin4xi1。"

msgid "He hands you an icy beer from the crate."
msgstr ""
"他​从​箱子​里​拿给​你​一瓶​冰​啤酒​。\n"
"ta1 cong2 xiang1zi5 li3 na2 gei3 ni3 yi1 ping2 bing1 pi2jiu3。"

msgid ""
"He hid me in a drawer. Gave me a blanket and told me to be quiet. It was so "
"dark, and it smelled. But I didn't make a sound."
msgstr ""
"他​把​我​藏​在​一个​抽屉​里​，​给​了​我​一块​毯子​，​叫​我别​出声​。​里面​太黑​了​，​而且​味道​很​糟糕​。​但​我​没​出声​。\n"
"ta1 ba3 wo3 zang4 zai4 yi1ge5 chou1ti5 li3，gei3 le5 wo3 yi1kuai4 tan3zi5，jiao4 wo3 bie4 chu1sheng1。li3mian4 tai4 hei1 le5，er2qie3 wei4dao5 hen3 zao1gao1。dan4 wo3 mei2 chu1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"He holds his tongue, still examining your face.\n"
"\n"
"A long, awkward silence descends over the both of you."
msgstr ""
"他​紧闭​双唇​，​仍​在​打量​你​的​脸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​漫长​的​尴尬​沉默​笼罩着​你们​两人​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jin3bi4 shuang1 chun2，reng2 zai4 da3liang5 ni3 de5 lian3。\n"
"\n"
"man4chang2 de5 gan1ga4 chen2mo4 long2 zhao4 zhao2 ni3men5 liang3 ren2。"

msgid ""
"He hung there… suspended in time, as they shot him… dancing on their bullets as they ripped him apart.\n"
"\n"
"But… but he shielded me long enough, efendi. I was able to get to my gun and end those sons of whores."
msgstr ""
"他​就​停​在​那里​……​子弹​射来​的​时候​，​时间​仿佛​也​凝固​了​……​他​就​这样​被​乱​枪​活活​打死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​……​他​为​我​争取​了​足够​多​的​时间​，​贵人​。​我​拿到​了​枪​，​然后​干死​了​那​两个​王八蛋​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiu4 ting2 zai4 na4li5……zi3dan4 she4 lai2 de5 shi2hou5，shi2jian1 fang3fu2 ye3 ning2gu4 le5……ta1 jiu4 zhe4yang4 bei4 luan4 qiang1 huo2huo2 da3si3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4……ta1 wei2 wo3 zheng1qu3 le5 zu2gou4 duo1 de5 shi2jian1，gui4ren2。wo3 na2dao4 le5 qiang1，ran2hou4 gan4 si3 le5 na4 liang3 ge4 wang2ba1dan4。"

msgid ""
"He is an elf named Aljernon. \n"
"\n"
"If the assistant has a name, I haven't heard it. She's a captivating young woman, but... how to put it? \n"
"\n"
"A bit strange, I suppose. She has a peculiar manner and extraordinary eyes. You will have to see for yourself."
msgstr ""
"他​是​个​精灵​，​名叫​阿尔杰​农​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​那位​助手​，​我​倒​从没​听过​她​的​名字​。​她​是​个​迷人​的​年轻​姑娘​，​但是​……​怎么​说​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​只能​说​，​有些​古怪​吧​。​她​举止​特立独行​，​更​有​一双​摄人心魄​的​眼睛​。​你​还是​亲自​去​看看​为​好​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 jing1ling2，ming2jiao4 E1er3jie2nong2。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 na4 wei4 zhu4shou3，wo3 dao3 cong2mei2 ting1 guo4 ta1 de5 ming2zi5。ta1 shi4 ge4 mi2ren2 de5 nian2qing1 gu1niang5，dan4shi4……zen3me5 shuo1 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"zhi3neng2 shuo1，you3xie1 gu3guai4 ba1。ta1 ju3zhi3 te4li4du2xing2，geng1 you3 yi1 shuang1 she4 ren2 xin1 po4 de5 yan3jing5。ni3 hai2shi5 qin1zi4 qu4 kan4kan5 wei2 hao3。"

msgid ""
"He is currently considered to be one of the most influential employees of AGC, and is currently leading Project *REDACTED*. He has been labeled low-risk by AGC Security; despite the sensitive nature of his knowledge, he is considered to be absolutely loyal. \n"
"\n"
"He is to be considered a non-expendable employee, and holds a \"Top Secret\" security clearance."
msgstr ""
"目前​，​他​被​公认​为​是​欧洲​化工​最具​影响力​的​员工​之一​，​正在​主导​*​已​编辑​*​项目​。​尽管​掌握​敏感​信息​，​欧洲​化工​安保​部门​仍​将​其​列为​低​风险​人员​，​因其​被​认为​具有​绝对​的​忠诚度​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​员工​被​视为​不可​替代​人员​，​并​持有​“​绝密​”​级​安全​许可​。\n"
"\n"
"mu4qian2，ta1 bei4 gong1ren4 wei2 shi4 ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 zui4 ju4 ying3xiang3li4 de5 yuan2gong1 zhi1yi1，zheng4zai4 zhu3dao3*yi3 bian1ji2*xiang4mu4。jin3guan3 zhang3wo4 min3gan3 xin4xi1，ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 an1bao3 bu4men2 reng2 jiang1 qi2 lie4wei2 di1 feng1xian3 ren2yuan2，yin1 qi2 bei4 ren4wei2 ju4you3 jue2dui4 de5 zhong1 cheng2 du4。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 yuan2gong1 bei4 shi4wei2 bu4ke3 ti4dai4 ren2yuan2，bing4 chi2you3“jue2mi4” ji2 an1quan2 xu3ke3。"

msgid ""
"He is suddenly overcome by another fit of coughing. He steadies himself on "
"one arm of the chair."
msgstr ""
"他​突然​又​一阵​剧烈​的​咳嗽​。​他​扶​着​椅子​的​扶手​稳住​身体​。\n"
"ta1 tu1ran2 you4 yi1zhen4 ju4lie4 de5 ke2sou5。ta1 fu2 zhao2 yi3zi5 de5 fu2shou3 wen3 zhu4 shen1ti3。"

msgid ""
"He is. I know his rep. I know that he's much too careful to get himself addicted to sims.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She glances at the Engineer. His eyes are locked on the chip.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If these things have him hooked this badly, they must be even more addictive than standard BTLs."
msgstr ""
"他​当然​是​专业​的​，​我​对​他​的​名声​很​了解​。​他​这么​谨慎​的​人​，​不​可能​让​自己​随便​陷入​拟感​成瘾​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​扫​了​一眼​工程师​。​他​的​双眼​仍然​死死​盯​着​芯片​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​这​东西​对​他​有​如此​强​的​效力​，​就​说明​这​肯定​不是​普通​的​BTL​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dang1ran2 shi4 zhuan1ye4 de5，wo3 dui4 ta1 de5 ming2sheng1 hen3 liao3jie3。ta1 zhe4me5 jin3shen4 de5 ren2，bu4 ke3neng2 rang4 zi4ji3 sui2bian4 xian4ru4 ni3 gan3 cheng2yin3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sao3 le5 yi1yan3 gong1cheng2shi1。ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 reng2ran2 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 xin1pian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 dong1xi1 dui4 ta1 you3 ru2ci3 jiang4 de5 xiao4li4，jiu4 shuo1ming2 zhe4 ken3ding4 bu4shi4 pu3tong1 de5 BTL。"

msgid ""
"He is... adjusting. With difficulty.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Samuel shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your friend Dietrich took a chance in sending his nephew to us. I will do my best to justify his faith in me."
msgstr ""
"他​……​还​在​调整​。​挺​不​容易​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​塞缪尔​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​朋友​迪​特里​希​冒险​把​他​的​侄子​送到​了​我们​这里​。​我会​尽力​证明​他​对​我​的​信任​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1……hai2 zai4 tiao2zheng3。ting3 bu4 rong2yi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sai4miu4er3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 peng2you5 Di2te4li3xi1 mao4xian3 ba3 ta1 de5 zhi2zi5 song4 dao4 le5 wo3men5 zhe4li3。wo3 hui4 jin4li4 zheng4ming2 ta1 dui4 wo3 de5 xin4ren4。"

msgid "He isn't worth the effort."
msgstr ""
"他​不​值得​费​那么​大劲​。\n"
"ta1 bu4 zhi2de5 fei4 na4me5 dai4 jin4。"

msgid ""
"He just needs to tell people about what he’s working on. \n"
"\n"
"He seems like the kind of guy who could live a hermit’s life, but to me it’s obvious he needs someone to talk to. Maybe it helps him work, I dunno."
msgstr ""
"他​只是​想​跟​别人​说​他​在​做​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​看起来​像是​那种​能过​隐士​生活​的​人​，​但​在我看来​，​他​显然​需要​有人​倾诉​。​也许​这​有助于​他​的​工作​，​谁​知道​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhi3shi4 xiang3 gen1 bie2ren5 shuo1 ta1 zai4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 na4zhong3 neng2 guo4 yin3shi4 sheng1huo2 de5 ren2，dan4 zai4wo3kan4lai2，ta1 xian3ran2 xu1yao4 you3ren2 qing1su4。ye3xu3 zhe4 you3zhu4yu2 ta1 de5 gong1zuo4，shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"He just snapped. When these mercs started gunning people down in the street...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The words trail off again.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"他​突然​发狂​了​。​当时​这些​佣兵​在​街上​大肆​开枪​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​再次​渐渐​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tu1ran2 fa1kuang2 le5。dang1shi2 zhe4xie1 yong1bing1 zai4 jie1shang5 da4si4 kai1qiang1……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4ci4 jian4jian4 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "He killed himself."
msgstr ""
"他​自杀​了​。\n"
"ta1 zi4sha1 le5。"

msgid ""
"He knew about my latent abilities right away, and he offered to teach me.\n"
"\n"
"Naturally, I accepted."
msgstr ""
"他​立刻​就​察觉到​我​潜藏​的​才能​，​并​主动​提出​要教​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​自然​也​选择​欣然接受​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 li4ke4 jiu4 cha2 jiao4 dao4 wo3 qian2cang2 de5 cai2neng2，bing4 zhu3dong4 ti2chu1 yao4 jiao1 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zi4ran2 ye3 xuan3ze2 xin1 ran2 jie1 shou4。"

msgid ""
"He leans forward, bracing himself against the computer terminal in front of him.\n"
"\n"
"He gulps down air in short, panicked breaths."
msgstr ""
"他​向前​倾身​，​双手​撑​在​眼前​的​电脑​终端​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​急促​地喘​着​粗气​，​像是​在​拼命​吞咽​空气​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，shuang1shou3 cheng1 zai4 yan3qian2 de5 dian4nao3 zhong1duan1 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ji2cu4 de5 chuan3 zhao2 cu1 qi4，xiang4 shi4 zai4 pin1ming4 tun1yan4 kong1qi4。"

msgid ""
"He left under his own power. Scampered off into the street.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her shoulders raise in a slight shrug.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The last I saw of him, he was cracking his own skull open with a rock."
msgstr ""
"他​自行​窜​回​了​街上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​微微​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​最后​看见​他时​，​他​正用​石头​砸开​自己​的​头骨​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zi4xing2 cuan4 hui2 le5 jie1shang5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4hou4 kan4jian4 ta1 shi2，ta1 zheng4yong4 shi2tou5 za2 kai1 zi4ji3 de5 tou2gu3。"

msgid ""
"He lets out a final, barking cough. A fine red mist sprays from his mouth and nostrils.\n"
"\n"
"His eyes go wide, and he struggles for breath. It doesn't come."
msgstr ""
"他​发出​最后​一声​嘶哑​的​咳嗽​。​一缕​细细的​红色​雾气​从​他​的​口​鼻中​喷出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​眼睛​瞪​得​老大​，​拼命​呼吸​。​但​空气​无法​进入​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 fa1chu1 zui4hou4 yi1sheng1 si1ya3 de5 ke2sou5。yi1 lu:3 xi4 xi4 de5 hong2se4 wu4qi4 cong2 ta1 de5 kou3 bi2 zhong4 pen1chu1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 yan3jing5 deng4 de2 lao3da4，pin1ming4 hu1xi1。dan4 kong1qi4 wu2fa3 jin4ru4。"

msgid ""
"He looks like he's had a rough go of things. One of his eyes has been blackened, and his lower lip is split wide open.\n"
"\n"
"Not particularly surprising, given the temperament of his captors."
msgstr ""
"他​看起来​受​了​不少​罪​。​一只​眼睛​被​揍​了​个​乌眼青​，​下唇​也​裂开​了​大​口子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​考虑​到​抓住​他​的​那些​人​是​什么​性情​，​这倒​也​不算​太​令人​意外​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 shou4 le5 bu4shao3 zui4。yi1 zhi3 yan3jing5 bei4 zou4 le5 ge4 wu1 yan3 qing1，xia4chun2 ye3 lie4kai1 le5 dai4 kou3zi5。\n"
"\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 zhua1zhu4 ta1 de5 na4xie1 ren2 shi4 shen2me5 xing4qing2，zhe4 dao3 ye3 bu4suan4 tai4 ling4ren2 yi4wai4。"

msgid "He looks up at you quizzically."
msgstr ""
"他​疑惑​地望​着​你​。\n"
"ta1 yi2huo4 de5 wang4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"He looks you dead in the eye, and for a moment his expression remains unchanged.\n"
"\n"
"Then his smile broadens, and a stream of giggles comes pouring out of him."
msgstr ""
"他​直勾勾​地​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​。​有​那么​一会儿​，​他​的​表情​毫无​变化​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​紧接着​，​他​的​笑容​逐渐​扩大​，​喉咙​里​发出​一阵​嘿嘿​的​笑声​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhi2gou1gou1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。you3 na4me5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 de5 biao3qing2 hao2wu2 bian4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"jin3jie1zhe5，ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 zhu2jian4 kuo4da4，hou2long2 li3 fa1chu1 yi1zhen4 hei1hei1 de5 xiao4sheng1。"

msgid ""
"He may have been a bad soldier, but that doesn't justify what you did. You "
"murdered him."
msgstr ""
"他​也许​不是​个​好​士兵​，​但​这​不能​成为​你​杀害​他​的​借口​。\n"
"ta1 ye3xu3 bu4shi4 ge4 hao3 shi4bing1，dan4 zhe4 bu4neng2 cheng2wei2 ni3 sha1hai4 ta1 de5 jie4kou3。"

msgid ""
"He must see my brow furrow, because he continues on. \n"
"\n"
"\"This was not a simple animal, Dr. Alder. It acted with *purpose* when it killed those men, and the only surviving witness tells me that it grew fat on their screams.\"\n"
"\n"
"Sure enough, the creature's belly does look distended. I know that the thing is dead, but that doesn't stop me from edging away."
msgstr ""
"他​一定​是​注意​到​我​紧蹙​的​眉头​，​因此​继续​说道​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​这​绝非​寻常​野兽​，​奥尔德​博士​。​它​杀害​那些​人​的​时候​带​着​*​目的​*​，​唯一​的​幸存者​告诉​我​，​它​是​在​他们​的​惨叫声​中​饱餐​的​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​果不其然​，​那​生物​的​腹部​确实​显得​鼓胀​异常​。​我​清楚​它​已​死去​，​却​仍​不由自主​地向​后​挪动​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi1ding4 shi4 zhu4yi4 dao4 wo3 jin3 cu4 de5 mei2tou2，yin1ci3 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4：\n"
"\n"
"“zhe4 jue2fei1 xun2chang2 ye3shou4，ao4 er3 de2 bo2shi4。ta1 sha1hai4 na4xie1 ren2 de5 shi2hou5 dai4 zhao2*mu4di4*，wei2yi1 de5 xing4cun2zhe3 gao4su4 wo3，ta1 shi4 zai4 ta1men5 de5 can3 jiao4 sheng1 zhong4 bao3can1 de5。” \n"
"\n"
"guo3bu4qi2ran2，na4 sheng1wu4 de5 fu4bu4 que4shi2 xian3de5 gu3zhang4 yi4chang2。wo3 qing1chu5 ta1 yi3 si3qu4，que4 reng2 bu4you2zi4zhu3 de5 xiang4 hou4 nuo2dong4。"

msgid ""
"He must've been fairly comfortable with me too, otherwise he wouldn't have "
"offered me a job!"
msgstr ""
"他​一定​对​我​也​很​放心​，​不然​他​也​不会​主动​给​我​提供​工作​机会​！\n"
"ta1 yi1ding4 dui4 wo3 ye3 hen3 fang4xin1，bu4ran2 ta1 ye3 bu4hui4 zhu3dong4 gei3 wo3 ti2gong1 gong1zuo4 ji1hui4！"

msgid "He must've convulsed hard enough to break his own spine."
msgstr ""
"一定​是​他​痉挛​得​太​厉害​，​导致​脊柱​折断​了​。\n"
"yi1ding4 shi4 ta1 jing4luan2 de2 tai4 li4hai5，dao3zhi4 ji3zhu4 zhe2duan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"He navigates a series of command line menus and a wall of amber text floods the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Amsel scans it, mouthing the words as his eyes flit back and forth."
msgstr ""
"他​操作​着​一系列​命令行​菜单​，​琥珀色​的​文字​随即​如​洪水​般​淹没​了​屏幕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿姆​泽尔​飞速​扫视​着​这些​文字​，​嘴唇​微动​默念​，​目光​来回​游移​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 cao1zuo4 zhao2 yi1xi4lie4 ming4ling4hang2 cai4dan1，hu3 po4 se4 de5 wen2zi4 sui2ji2 ru2 hong2shui3 ban1 yan1mo4 le5 ping2mu4。\n"
"\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 fei1su4 sao3shi4 zhao2 zhe4xie1 wen2zi4，zui3chun2 wei1 dong4 mo4nian4，mu4guang1 lai2hui2 you2yi2。"

msgid ""
"He nods, and reaches back to unsling his pack.\n"
"\n"
"Placing it on the floor, he opens it and pulls out a large blue canister. It takes all of his strength to wrestle it up from the ground and into the space in the access panel that Jana has cleared."
msgstr ""
"他​点点头​，​伸手​向​后​解下​背包​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​背包​落地​后​，​他​从中​取出​一个​大型​蓝色​罐体​。​他​使出​浑身​力气​才​将​它​从​地面​拽​起​，​塞进​简娜​清理​好​的​检修​面板​中​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，shen1shou3 xiang4 hou4 jie3 xia4 bei1bao1。\n"
"\n"
"bei1bao1 luo4di4 hou4，ta1 cong2zhong1 qu3chu1 yi1ge5 da4xing2 lan2se4 guan4 ti3。ta1 shi3chu1 hun2shen1 li4qi5 cai2 jiang1 ta1 cong2 di4mian4 zhuai1 qi3，se4 jin4 Jian3na4 qing1li3 hao3 de5 jian3xiu1 mian4ban3 zhong4。"

msgid "He nods, eyes wide, and licks his lips again."
msgstr ""
"他​点点头​，​瞪​大​眼睛​，​再次​舔​了​舔​嘴唇​。\n"
"ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，deng4 dai4 yan3jing5，zai4ci4 tian3 le5 tian3 zui3chun2。"

msgid ""
"He pats a pistol on his hip.\n"
"\n"
"You recognize it instantly - it's the same hand cannon that he used to kill Amsel."
msgstr ""
"他​拍拍​腰上​的​手枪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​立刻​认出​了​它​—​—​他​就是​用​这​把​枪杀​死​了​阿姆​泽尔​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 pai1 pai1 yao1 shang4 de5 shou3qiang1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 li4ke4 ren4chu1 le5 ta1——ta1 jiu4shi4 yong4 zhe4 ba3 qiang1sha1 si3 le5 E1mu3ze2er3。"

msgid ""
"He pauses for a moment, considering. Then, all at once, he seems to perk up."
" His chest puffs out, and he nods once, decisively."
msgstr ""
"他​停下​思索​了​一会儿​。​接着​，​他​突然​精神​一​振​。​胸膛​挺​得​笔直​，​果断​点​了​点头​。\n"
"ta1 ting2xia4 si1suo3 le5 yi1hui4r5。jie1zhe5，ta1 tu1ran2 jing1shen2 yi1 zhen4。xiong1tang2 ting3 de2 bi3zhi2，guo3duan4 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。"

msgid "He pauses, puzzled."
msgstr ""
"他​停顿​了​一下​，​对此​感到​困惑​。\n"
"ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，dui4 ci3 gan3dao4 kun4huo4。"

msgid ""
"He plugs the PDA in to his computer and goes to work. A few moments later, "
"he lets out a grunt of dismay."
msgstr ""
"他​把​PDA​插进​电脑​开始​工作​。​片刻​之后​，​他​沮丧​地​咕哝​一声​。\n"
"ta1 ba3 PDA cha1jin4 dian4nao3 kai1shi3 gong1zuo4。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ta1 ju3sang4 de5 gu1nong5 yi1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"He plugs the cable into his head and the screen cuts to static.\n"
"\n"
"A moment later, the main menu returns."
msgstr ""
"他​把​数据线​插入​自己​的​脑袋​，​屏幕​随即​变回​了​雪花​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​你​又​回到​了​主​菜单​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ba3 shu4ju4xian4 cha1ru4 zi4ji3 de5 nao3dai5，ping2mu4 sui2ji2 bian4hui2 le5 xue3hua1。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ni3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1。"

msgid ""
"He presses a button on the terminal, and a large observation window at the "
"far end of the room rises slowly open."
msgstr ""
"他​按​下​终端​上​的​按钮​，​房间​尽头​的​一扇​大型​观察窗​缓缓​升起​打开​。\n"
"ta1 an4 xia4 zhong1duan1 shang4 de5 an4niu3，fang2jian1 jin4tou2 de5 yi1 shan1 da4xing2 guan1 cha2 chuang1 huan3huan3 sheng1qi3 da3kai1。"

msgid ""
"He punches a button, and from the corner of the room you hear a hissing "
"sound. Pneumatic locks sliding open."
msgstr ""
"他​按​下​一个​按钮​，​从​房间​的​角落​传来​嘶嘶声​。​气动​锁​滑开​。\n"
"ta1 an4 xia4 yi1ge5 an4niu3，cong2 fang2jian1 de5 jiao3luo4 chuan2lai2 si1si1sheng1。qi4dong4 suo3 hua2 kai1。"

msgid ""
"He raises the bottle to his own lips and takes a long drink. When he finishes, he holds the bottle to the light.\n"
"\n"
"Gazing idly through the glass at the bronze liquor inside, a wistful expression crosses his face."
msgstr ""
"他​举起​酒瓶​长​啜​一口​。​喝完​后​，​他​举起​酒瓶​迎着​光线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​漫不经心​地​透过​玻璃​观察​瓶​中​青铜色​的​酒液​，​脸上​掠过​一丝​怅然​神色​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2 zhang3 chuo4 yi1kou3。he4 wan2 hou4，ta1 ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2 ying2 zhao2 guang1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 tou4guo4 bo1li5 guan1cha2 ping2 zhong4 qing1 tong2 se4 de5 jiu3 ye4，lian3 shang4 lu:e4guo4 yi1 si1 chang4ran2 shen2se4。"

msgid ""
"He raises the jewel high above his head, then hurls it to the ground.\n"
"\n"
"It explodes into spray of dull, glassy shards across the concrete."
msgstr ""
"他​将​护符​高举​过​头顶​，​随即​猛地​摔​向​地面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​在​水泥​地上​炸裂​开来​，​变成​无数​黯淡​的​玻璃​碎片​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiang1 hu4 fu2 gao1ju3 guo4 tou2ding3，sui2ji2 meng3de5 shuai1 xiang4 di4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 shui3ni2 di4shang5 zha4lie4 kai1 lai2，bian4cheng2 wu2shu4 an4dan4 de5 bo1li5 sui4pian4。"

msgid "He reaches out to blindfold you, and the world goes dark."
msgstr ""
"他​伸手​把​眼罩​套​在​你​头上​。​你​的​世界​变得​一片​漆黑​。\n"
"ta1 shen1shou3 ba3 yan3zhao4 tao4 zai4 ni3 tou2shang4。ni3 de5 shi4jie4 bian4de5 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。"

msgid ""
"He reaches up with a scowl and clasps your hand. Slowly and painfully, he "
"pulls himself to his feet."
msgstr ""
"他​皱着眉头​握住​你​的​手​，​缓慢​而​痛苦​地站​了​起来​。\n"
"ta1 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2 wo4zhu4 ni3 de5 shou3，huan3man4 er2 tong4ku3 de5 zhan4 le5 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"He said he could help me. He gave me the money up front. But he said I had "
"to come back for medicine every month, until it was time to pay him back. "
"And I did. I took the medicine, just like he said."
msgstr ""
"他​说​他​能​帮​我​。​他​帮​我​全额​垫付​了​费用​，​但​要求​我​必须​每个​月​都​回去​找​他​拿药​，​直到​该​偿还​他​的​时候​。​所以​我​就​照​他​说​的​做​了​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 ta1 neng2 bang1 wo3。ta1 bang1 wo3 quan2e2 dian4fu4 le5 fei4yong4，dan4 yao1qiu2 wo3 bi4xu1 mei3ge4 yue4 dou1 hui2qu5 zhao3 ta1 na2 yao4，zhi2dao4 gai1 chang2huan2 ta1 de5 shi2hou5。suo3yi3 wo3 jiu4 zhao4 ta1 shuo1 de5 zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"He said that your team botched a run. Went loud too early, and got a lot of "
"people killed."
msgstr ""
"他​说​你​的​小队​搞砸​了​一场​差事​，​在​行动​中​过早​暴露​，​结果​害死​了​不少​人​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 ni3 de5 xiao3 dui4 gao3za2 le5 yi1 chang2 cha4shi4，zai4 xing2dong4 zhong4 guo4zao3 bao4lu4，jie1guo3 hai4si3 le5 bu4shao3 ren2。"

msgid "He said to tell Zaak that he was coming back to take what was his."
msgstr ""
"他​要​我​转告​扎克​，​说​他​要​来​夺回​属于​自己​的​东西​。\n"
"ta1 yao4 wo3 zhuan3gao4 Zha1ke4，shuo1 ta1 yao4 lai2 duo2hui2 shu3yu2 zi4ji3 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "He scowls and continues to pace."
msgstr ""
"他​蹙​起​眉头​，​又​开始​踱步​。\n"
"ta1 cu4 qi3 mei2tou2，you4 kai1shi3 duo2bu4。"

msgid "He seems like a tough kid. I don't doubt that you're right."
msgstr ""
"那小子​看起来​挺​坚强​的​。​我​觉着​错​不了​。\n"
"na4 xiao3 zi3 kan4qi3lai5 ting3 jian1qiang2 de5。wo3 jiao4 zhao2 cuo4 bu4le5。"

msgid ""
"He sets up bribes, takes out key members of the opposition, and forges alliances with existing street gangs. All of the groundwork that a syndicate needs.\n"
"\n"
"He's extremely bad news, $(l.name). And my contact spotted him in Schattennest."
msgstr ""
"他​能​安排​行贿​，​能​清除​反对派​核心成员​，​还​懂得​和​街头​帮派​搞好关系​。​这些​全都​是​犯罪集团​需要​的​基础​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​是​个​极度​危险​的​家伙​，​$(l.name)​。​而​我​的​线​人​在​影巢​发现​了​他​的​踪迹​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 neng2 an1pai2 xing2hui4，neng2 qing1chu2 fan3dui4pai4 he2 xin1 cheng2 yuan2，hai2 dong3de5 he4 jie1tou2 bang1pai4 gao3 hao3 guan1 xi4。zhe4xie1 quan2dou1 shi4 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 xu1yao4 de5 ji1chu3 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 ji2du4 wei1xian3 de5 jia1huo5，$(l.name)。er2 wo3 de5 xian4 ren2 zai4 ying3 chao2 fa1xian4 le5 ta1 de5 zong1ji4。"

msgid "He sits."
msgstr ""
"他​坐下​了​。\n"
"ta1 zuo4xia5 le5。"

msgid ""
"He started coming towards me next, teeth bared. I've never seen anything like it before, $(l.name). It was terrifying.\n"
"\n"
"I dropped a flash grenade behind me and booked it down to the U-Bahn."
msgstr ""
"然后​他​就​朝​我​扑​来​，​獠牙​毕露​。​我​从未见过​如此​景象​，​$(l.name)​。​简直​太​吓人​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我往​身后​扔​了​颗​闪光弹​，​就​赶紧​冲进​了​地铁​。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1 jiu4 chao2 wo3 pu1 lai2，liao2ya2 bi4 lou4。wo3 cong2 wei4 jian4 guo4 ru2ci3 jing3xiang4，$(l.name)。jian3zhi2 tai4 xia4ren2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wang3 shen1hou4 reng1 le5 ke1 shan3guang1dan4，jiu4 gan3jin3 chong1jin4 le5 di4tie3。"

msgid ""
"He steps back, allowing you to return your attention to the control console."
msgstr ""
"他​往​后退​开​，​你​得以​把​注意力​转回​控制​台上​。\n"
"ta1 wang3 hou4tui4 kai1，ni3 de2yi3 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3hui2 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4。"

msgid "He strikes me as one who shirks responsibility more often than not."
msgstr ""
"他​给​我​的​印象​是​，​他​往往​会​选择​推卸责任​。\n"
"ta1 gei3 wo3 de5 yin4xiang4 shi4，ta1 wang3wang3 hui4 xuan3ze2 tui1 xie4 ze2 ren4。"

msgid ""
"He sweeps his eyes across the carnage that was his life's work until they "
"come to rest on the dragon. He grits his teeth."
msgstr ""
"他​扫视​着​自己​毕生​心血​的​残骸​，​直到​目光​落​在​巨龙​身上​。​他​咬紧牙关​。\n"
"ta1 sao3shi4 zhao2 zi4ji3 bi4sheng1 xin1xue4 de5 can2hai2，zhi2dao4 mu4guang1 la4 zai4 ju4long2 shen1shang5。ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1。"

msgid ""
"He takes a long drag on his cigarette, holds it, and slowly releases the "
"smoke. It seems to calm him."
msgstr ""
"他​深深​吸​了​一口​烟​，​然后​攥​紧​烟头​，​缓缓​吐​出​烟雾​。​这​似乎​让​他​平静下来​。\n"
"ta1 shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1，ran2hou4 zuan4 jin3 yan1tou2，huan3huan3 tu3 chu1 yan1wu4。zhe4 si4hu1 rang4 ta1 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"He tells me you’re developing the menu for a friend of his now - \"Herr "
"Winters\", I believe. I want to hear all about it."
msgstr ""
"他​告诉​我​说​，​你​正在​为​他​的​一位​朋友​设计​菜单​—​—​我​记得​是​叫​“​温特斯​先生​”​。​我​想​听听​这​其中​的​详情​。\n"
"ta1 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1，ni3 zheng4zai4 wei2 ta1 de5 yi1 wei4 peng2you5 she4ji4 cai4dan1——wo3 ji4de5 shi4 jiao4“Wen1te4si1 xian1sheng5”。wo3 xiang3 ting1 ting1 zhe4 qi2zhong1 de5 xiang2qing2。"

msgid ""
"He told me about a bunch of Polish towns that my unit swept for Syndicate activity.\n"
"\n"
"He told me how the mob poured back in right after we left, and what they did to the people who'd accepted our help."
msgstr ""
"他​说出​了​一系列​波兰​城镇​的​名字​—​—​我们​小队​曾经​在​这些​城镇​里​清剿​过​犯罪集团​活动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​告诉​我​说​，​就​在​我们​离开​后​，​黑帮​又​立刻​蜂拥​而​归​，​还​讲述​了​他们​对​那些​接受​过​我们​帮助​的​人​做​了​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1chu1 le5 yi1xi4lie4 bo1lan2 cheng2zhen4 de5 ming2zi5——wo3men5 xiao3 dui4 ceng2jing1 zai4 zhe4xie1 cheng2zhen4 li3 qing1jiao3 guo4 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 huo2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1，jiu4 zai4 wo3men5 li2kai1 hou4，hei1bang1 you4 li4ke4 feng1yong1 er2 gui1，hai2 jiang3shu4 le5 ta1men5 dui4 na4xie1 jie1shou4 guo4 wo3men5 bang1zhu4 de5 ren2 zuo4 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"He told me about the beatings. The rapes. The killing rooms, and the torture, and worse.\n"
"\n"
"He relished in describing it - the relentless, hideous barbarism of it all. All meant to teach some sort of lesson.\n"
"\n"
"I think that's the cruelest part of this entire story. Those people, they didn't *need* a lesson in how terrible life can be. They live with that every day."
msgstr ""
"殴打​，​强奸​，​拷问​，​屠杀​室​，​甚至​更糟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​津津有味​地​描述​着​这​一切​—​—​这样​无情​而​骇人​的​野蛮​行径​，​就​为了​给​他们​“​上​一课​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​这才​是​整件事​中​最​残酷​的​部分​。​那些​人​根本​不​需要​别人​来​让​他们​知晓​生活​的​苦难​。​他们​每天​都​活​在​这样​的​现实​里​。\n"
"\n"
"ou1da3，qiang2jian1，kao3wen4，tu2sha1 shi4，shen4zhi4 geng1 zao1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jin1jin1you3wei4 de5 miao2shu4 zhao2 zhe4 yi1qie4——zhe4yang4 wu2qing2 er2 hai4ren2 de5 ye3man2 xing2jing4，jiu4 wei4le5 gei3 ta1men5“shang4 yi1 ke4”。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4 cai2 shi4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 zhong4 zui4 can2ku4 de5 bu4fen5。na4xie1 ren2 gen1ben3 bu4 xu1yao4 bie2ren5 lai2 rang4 ta1men5 zhi1xiao3 sheng1huo2 de5 ku3nan4。ta1men5 mei3tian1 dou1 huo2 zai4 zhe4yang4 de5 xian4shi2 li3。"

msgid "He told us enough."
msgstr ""
"他​和​我们​说​的​足够​多​了​。\n"
"ta1 he4 wo3men5 shuo1 de5 zu2gou4 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"He told us how Feuerstelle would be the focal point of a new movement for the children of the Fatherland. He told us that we were special.\n"
"\n"
"We ate it up, of course. We were kids."
msgstr ""
"他​告诉​我们​，​“​火坑​”​将​作为​祖国​子弟​新​运动​的​中心​。​他​告诉​我们​说​，​我们​是​特别​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对于​他​的​这些​话​，​我们​当然​全盘接受​了​。​毕竟​我们​那时​只是​孩子​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gao4su4 wo3men5，“huo3keng1” jiang1 zuo4wei2 zu3guo2 zi3di4 xin1 yun4dong4 de5 zhong1xin1。ta1 gao4su4 wo3men5 shuo1，wo3men5 shi4 te4bie2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yu2 ta1 de5 zhe4xie1 hua4，wo3men5 dang1ran2 quan2 pan2 jie1 shou4 le5。bi4jing4 wo3men5 na4shi2 zhi3shi4 hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"He took off with Maliit. Said somethin' about jamming the attackers' comms.\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry about them. We've gotta deal with those bombs!"
msgstr ""
"他​和玛丽​特走​了​。​说​什么​要​干扰​袭击者​的​通讯​链​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​担心​他们​。​我们​必须​得​处理​那些​炸弹​！\n"
"\n"
"ta1 he4 ma3 li2 te4 zou3 le5。shuo1 shen2me5 yao4 gan1rao3 xi2ji1zhe3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1 ta1men5。wo3men5 bi4xu1 de2 chu3li3 na4xie1 zha4dan4！"

msgid ""
"He took off with Maliit. Said something about jamming the attackers' comms.\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry about them. We have to deal with those bombs."
msgstr ""
"他​和玛丽​特走​了​。​说​什么​要​干扰​袭击者​的​通讯​链​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​担心​他们​。​我们​必须​得​处理​那些​炸弹​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 he4 ma3 li2 te4 zou3 le5。shuo1 shen2me5 yao4 gan1rao3 xi2ji1zhe3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1 ta1men5。wo3men5 bi4xu1 de2 chu3li3 na4xie1 zha4dan4。"

msgid ""
"He tosses something to you. Reflexively, you snatch it out of the air.\n"
"\n"
"The object feels smooth and warm to the touch. It's the plastic box that Hasenkamp pulled out of the safe deposit box."
msgstr ""
"他​朝​你​扔​来​一样​东西​。​你​下意识​地​一把​接​住​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​物件​触感​光滑​而​温热​。​正是​哈森​坎普​从​保险箱​里​取出​的​塑料盒​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chao2 ni3 reng1 lai2 yi1yang4 dong1xi1。ni3 xia4yi4shi2 de5 yi1 ba3 jie1 zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wu4jian4 chu4gan3 guang1hua2 er2 wen1re4。zheng4shi4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 cong2 bao3xian3xiang1 li3 qu3chu1 de5 su4 liao4 he2。"

msgid ""
"He tried to upsell me on better merchandise, arguing that what I was asking for was old and inefficient, better suited to be installed in a museum than in a body.\n"
"\n"
"He told me that I'd be shredding my essence, and that once it was gone, I'd never be able to get it back."
msgstr ""
"他​试图​向​我​兜售​更​高级​的​商品​，​说​我​想要​的​东西​又​旧​又​低效​，​更​适合​摆在​博物馆​里​，​而​不是​装在​身体​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​告诉​我​，​这样​做会​撕碎​我​的​精华​，​一旦​失去​，​就​永远​无法挽回​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4tu2 xiang4 wo3 dou1shou4 geng1 gao1ji2 de5 shang1pin3，shuo1 wo3 xiang3yao4 de5 dong1xi1 you4 jiu4 you4 di1xiao4，geng1 shi4he2 bai3 zai4 bo2wu4guan3 li3，er2 bu4shi4 zhuang1 zai4 shen1ti3 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gao4su4 wo3，zhe4yang4 zuo4 hui4 si1sui4 wo3 de5 jing1hua2，yi1dan4 shi1qu4，jiu4 yong3yuan3 wu2 fa3 wan3 hui2。"

msgid ""
"He turns and punches a series of buttons on his control console.\n"
"\n"
"When he turns back, he seems to have calmed somewhat, but there's a firmness to his tone that wasn't there before."
msgstr ""
"他​转身​在​控制​台上​按下​一系列​按钮​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​他​转​回来​时​，​似乎​已​稍稍​平静下来​，​但​语气​中​却​多​了​一份​此前​没有​的​坚定​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhuan3shen1 zai4 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 an4xia4 yi1xi4lie4 an4niu3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 zhuai3 hui2lai5 shi2，si4hu1 yi3 shao1shao1 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2，dan4 yu3qi4 zhong4 que4 duo1 le5 yi1 fen4 ci3qian2 mei2you3 de5 jian1ding4。"

msgid "He wags his tail."
msgstr ""
"他​摇摇​尾巴​。\n"
"ta1 yao2 yao2 wei3ba5。"

msgid ""
"He wanted to dissuade me from lending my voice or experience to any pro-"
"metahuman parties. "
msgstr ""
"他​想​劝阻​我​不要​为​任何​支持​泛​人类​的​组织​提供​声援​或​经验​。\n"
"ta1 xiang3 quan4zu3 wo3 bu4yao4 wei2 ren4he2 zhi1chi2 fan4 ren2lei4 de5 zu3zhi1 ti2gong1 sheng1yuan2 huo4 jing1yan4。"

msgid ""
"He wants you to continue maintaining the sewers, and he wants you to do jobs"
" for him."
msgstr ""
"他​想要​你们​继续​维护​下水道​，​此外​还要​帮​他​做些​差事​。\n"
"ta1 xiang3yao4 ni3men5 ji4xu4 wei2hu4 xia4shui3dao4，ci3wai4 hai2 yao4 bang1 ta1 zuo4 xie1 cha4shi4。"

msgid "He was *stopping* it because it *won't work!*"
msgstr ""
"他​要​*​停止​*​的​理由​是​这样​*​行不通​*​！\n"
"ta1 yao4*ting2zhi3*de5 li3you2 shi4 zhe4yang4*xing2bu5tong1*！"

msgid ""
"He was a beautiful fool, that Heiner. I told him that we didn't need to eat Billy, that we could survive indefinitely on synthesized cardiac tissue and choco nubs.\n"
"\n"
"But he wouldn't listen, and Keycard E was lost. And without it, I can no longer access the Executive Wing and its expansive snack bar."
msgstr ""
"他​是​个​美丽​的​傻瓜​，​那个​海纳​。​我​告诉​过​他​我们​不​需要​吃掉​比利​，​我们​可以​无限期​地​依靠​合成​心脏​组织​和​巧克力​块​存活​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他​不​听​，​也​失去​了​门禁卡​E​。​而​没有​它​，​我​再也​无法​进入​行政部​，​享受​里面​丰富​的​零食​吧台​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 mei3li4 de5 sha3gua1，na4ge5 hai3 na4。wo3 gao4su4 guo4 ta1 wo3men5 bu4 xu1yao4 chi1diao4 bi3li4，wo3men5 ke3yi3 wu2xian4qi1 de5 yi1kao4 he2cheng2 xin1zang4 zu3zhi1 he4 qiao3ke4li4 kuai4 cun2huo2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1 bu4 ting1，ye3 shi1qu4 le5 men2 jin1 ka3 E。er2 mei2you3 ta1，wo3 zai4ye3 wu2fa3 jin4ru4 xing2 zheng4 bu4，xiang3shou4 li3mian4 feng1fu4 de5 ling2shi2 ba1tai2。"

msgid ""
"He was an older guy, for one. From the sound of his voice, I'm guessing mid-"
"to-late forties. Pretty old for an ork."
msgstr ""
"反正​他​肯定​上岁数​了​。​就​他​那​把​嗓子​，​我​估摸​着​他​得​奔​五​了​。​在​兽​人里​算是​年纪​大​的​。\n"
"fan3zheng4 ta1 ken3ding4 shang4 sui4 shu3 le5。jiu4 ta1 na4 ba3 sang3zi5，wo3 gu1mo5 zhao2 ta1 de2 ben1 wu3 le5。zai4 shou4 ren2 li3 suan4shi4 nian2ji4 dai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"He was going to put a stop to it. The plan.\n"
"\n"
"You think I'd just stand by and let that happen?"
msgstr ""
"他​要​停止​这​整个​计划​的​继续​进行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​觉得​我会​眼睁睁​看着​这​一切​发生​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yao4 ting2zhi3 zhe4 zheng3ge4 ji4hua4 de5 ji4xu4 jin4xing2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3 hui4 yan3zheng1zheng1 kan4 zhao2 zhe4 yi1qie4 fa1sheng1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"He was going to say something else, but I'll never know what it was. "
"Hoffmann put a bullet in his brain."
msgstr ""
"他本​想​再说​些​什么​，​但​我​永远​无从​知晓​。​霍夫曼​朝​他​的​脑袋​开​了​一枪​。\n"
"ta1 ben3 xiang3 zai4shuo1 xie1 shen2me5，dan4 wo3 yong3yuan3 wu2cong2 zhi1xiao3。huo4fu1man4 chao2 ta1 de5 nao3dai5 kai1 le5 yi1 qiang1。"

msgid ""
"He was mad at me for losing her, but now I don't know if he even remembers. "
"He looks right through me. But I did what he told me..."
msgstr ""
"他​曾经​因为​失去​她​而​对​我​发火​，​但​现在​我​甚至​不​知道​他​是否​还​记得​这​回事​。​他​对​我​视若无睹​。​但​我​做​了​他​叫​我​做​的​事​……\n"
"ta1 ceng2jing1 yin1wei4 shi1qu4 ta1 er2 dui4 wo3 fa1huo3，dan4 xian4zai4 wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 shi4fou3 hai2 ji4de5 zhe4 hui2shi4。ta1 dui4 wo3 shi4ruo4wu2du3。dan4 wo3 zuo4 le5 ta1 jiao4 wo3 zuo4 de5 shi4……"

msgid "He was our captive. We don't kill prisoners, Eiger. It's wrong."
msgstr ""
"他​是​我们​的​俘虏​。​我们​不杀​囚犯​，​艾格尔​。​这样​做​是​不​对​的​。\n"
"ta1 shi4 wo3men5 de5 fu2lu3。wo3men5 bu4 sha1 qiu2fan4，Ai4ge2er3。zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"He was stealing from the French, you see.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He chuckles, then continues.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"他​偷​的​都​是​法国人​的​东西​，​你​懂​了​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​笑​了​一下​，​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tou1 de5 dou1 shi4 fa3guo2ren2 de5 dong1xi1，ni3 dong3 le5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 yi1xia4，you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "He was there the *whole time?*"
msgstr ""
"他​*​一直​以来​*​都​在​那儿​？\n"
"ta1*yi1zhi2 yi3lai2*dou1 zai4 na4r5？"

msgid ""
"He was using you, just like he uses everyone else. You said so yourself."
msgstr ""
"他​一直​在​利用​你​，​就​像​他​利用​其他人​一样​。​你​自己​也​这么​说​过​。\n"
"ta1 yi1zhi2 zai4 li4yong4 ni3，jiu4 xiang4 ta1 li4yong4 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4。ni3 zi4ji3 ye3 zhe4me5 shuo1 guo4。"

msgid ""
"He was, like, forty five. That's way outside of the \"dinosaur\" age "
"bracket."
msgstr ""
"他​差不多​45​岁​吧​。​这离​“​老古董​”​的​范畴​还​差得远​呢​。\n"
"ta1 cha4bu5duo1 45 sui4 ba1。zhe4 li2“lao3gu3dong3” de5 fan4chou2 hai2 cha4 de2 yuan3 ni2。"

msgid "He wasn't lying. He said that you had a job for me."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​他​说​你​有​项​差事​要​交给​我​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。ta1 shuo1 ni3 you3 xiang4 cha4shi4 yao4 jiao1gei3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"He wasn't specific, but I think that he was talking about jobs of the bloody"
" kind."
msgstr ""
"他​没有​具体​说​是​什么​，​但​我​猜​应该​是​各种​沾血​的​脏活​。\n"
"ta1 mei2you3 ju4ti3 shuo1 shi4 shen2me5，dan4 wo3 cai1 ying1gai1 shi4 ge4zhong3 zhan1 xie3 de5 zang4 huo2。"

msgid "He whispers to the third camera, and soon enough, it fades from view."
msgstr ""
"他​对​着​第三个​摄像头​轻声​念咒​，​它​便​随即​隐形​了​。\n"
"ta1 dui4 zhao2 di4 san1 ge4 she4xiang4tou2 qing1sheng1 nian4zhou4，ta1 bian4 sui2ji2 yin3xing2 le5。"

msgid ""
"He would, would he?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His eyes twinkle with mirth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I shall have to share that opinion with him. I think that he would be most amused."
msgstr ""
"他会​这么​想​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​眼中​闪烁着​愉悦​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​把​这个​想法​告诉​他​，​他​一定​会​觉得​很​有趣​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hui4 zhe4me5 xiang3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan3zhong1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 yu2yue4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 ba3 zhe4ge5 xiang3fa3 gao4su4 ta1，ta1 yi1ding4 hui4 jue2de5 hen3 you3qu4。"

msgid "He'll live. C'mon, let's go."
msgstr ""
"他​不会​怎么着​的​。​我们​走​。\n"
"ta1 bu4hui4 zen3me5zhao1 de5。wo3men5 zou3。"

msgid ""
"He's a good kid, $(l.name). I don't believe for a second that he's bought into their bullshit.\n"
"\n"
"But I have it on good authority that he's signed on with Humanis, all the same."
msgstr ""
"他​是​个​好孩子​，​$(l.name)​。​我​绝不​相信​他会​把​那些​人​的​鬼话​当真​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​确实​收到​了​可靠消息​，​说​他​跟​人类​至上​主义者​混到​了​一起​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 hao3 hai2 zi3，$(l.name)。wo3 jue2bu4 xiang1xin4 ta1 hui4 ba3 na4xie1 ren2 de5 gui3hua4 dang4zhen1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 que4shi2 shou1dao4 le5 ke3 kao4 xiao1 xi1，shuo1 ta1 gen1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 hun4 dao4 le5 yi1qi3。"

msgid ""
"He's a good kid, that nephew of mine. Give him some time, and he'll shake Stahl's programming. It might take a while, but he'll adjust to life here in the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, I've found a good home for him. Samuel's agreed to take him in."
msgstr ""
"我​那​侄子​本性​并​不坏​。​假以时日​，​他​肯定​能​摆脱​斯塔尔​的​洗脑​。​或许​还​需要​点​时间​，​但​他​终会​适应​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​生活​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​也​给​他​找​了​个​好​住处​，​塞缪尔​同意​收留​他​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 na4 zhi2zi5 ben3xing4 bing4 bu4 huai4。jia3 yi3 shi2 ri4，ta1 ken3ding4 neng2 bai3tuo1 Si1ta3er3 de5 xi3nao3。huo4xu3 hai2 xu1yao4 dian3 shi2jian1，dan4 ta1 zhong1 hui4 shi4ying4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 sheng1huo2。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 ye3 gei3 ta1 zhao3 le5 ge4 hao3 zhu4chu4，sai4miu4er3 tong2yi4 shou1liu2 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"He's a great man. He would never hurt us, whatever you say.\n"
"\n"
"You're taking everything out of context.\n"
"\n"
"You don't understand."
msgstr ""
"他​是​个​了不起​的​人​。​不管​你​说​什么​，​他​都​绝不会​伤害​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​完全​曲解​了​我​的​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​根本​不​明白​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 liao3bu5qi3 de5 ren2。bu4guan3 ni3 shuo1 shen2me5，ta1 dou1 jue2 bu4 hui4 shang1hai4 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wan2quan2 qu1jie3 le5 wo3 de5 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 ming2bai5。"

msgid ""
"He's a runner,  $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I suggest that we at least hear him out. "
msgstr ""
"他​是​个​狂奔​者​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​提议​我们​至少​应该​听​他​把​话​说完​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 kuang2Ben1zhe3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ti2yi4 wo3men5 zhi4shao3 ying1gai1 ting1 ta1 ba3 hua4 shuo1 wan2。"

msgid ""
"He's corrupting you all. How many of them has he taken as his \"wives\" - "
"yourself included?"
msgstr ""
"他​正在​腐蚀​你们​所有人​。​他​究竟​收​了​多少​人当​他​的​“​妻子​”​—​—​包括​你​在内​？\n"
"ta1 zheng4zai4 fu3shi2 ni3men5 suo3you3ren2。ta1 jiu1jing4 shou1 le5 duo1shao3 ren2 dang1 ta1 de5“qi1zi3”——bao1kuo4 ni3 zai4nei4？"

msgid ""
"He's dead... Doctor Vauclair is dead.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her eyes are open wide, and her cheeks have flushed red. The tone of her voice is one of utter despair.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're doomed. The world is going to die."
msgstr ""
"他​死​了​……​沃​克莱尔​博士​死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​双眼​瞪​得​老大​，​双颊​涨红​，​声音​里​透​着​彻底​的​绝望​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​完​了​。​世界​就要​毁灭​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 si3 le5……Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 deng4 de2 lao3da4，shuang1 jia2 zhang4hong2，sheng1yin1 li3 tou4 zhao2 che4di3 de5 jue2wang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 wan2 le5。shi4jie4 jiu4yao4 hui3mie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"He's dumb as a post, but he can lift heavy things. Might not be bad in a "
"fight, either... at the very least, he can soak up a few bullets for the "
"rest of us."
msgstr ""
"他蠢​得​像​根​木头​，​但​力气​倒​是​不小​。​打架​时​说不定​还​行​……​至少​能替​我们​挡​几颗​子弹​。\n"
"ta1 chun3 de2 xiang4 gen1 mu4tou5，dan4 li4qi5 dao3 shi4 bu4 xiao3。da3jia4 shi2 shuo1bu5ding4 hai2 xing2……zhi4shao3 neng2 ti4 wo3men5 dang3 ji1 ke1 zi3dan4。"

msgid ""
"He's going to make the initiates - the *young* initiates, like the girl in "
"the next room - do something horrible."
msgstr ""
"他​要​让​那些​*​年轻​*​的​学徒​，​比如​隔壁​房间​里​的​那个​女孩​，​做​一些​可怕​的​事​。\n"
"ta1 yao4 rang4 na4xie1*nian2qing1*de5 xue2tu2，bi3ru2 ge2bi4 fang2jian1 li3 de5 na4ge5 nu:3hai2，zuo4 yi1xie1 ke3pa4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "He's got a real shtick, doesn't he?"
msgstr ""
"还​挺​有​他​的​风格​的​。\n"
"hai2 ting3 you3 ta1 de5 feng1ge2 de5。"

msgid ""
"He's kept her in this containment unit for twenty years, at least. \n"
"\n"
"There's probably nothing but a reptile brain left in the dragon down there."
msgstr ""
"他​把​她​困​在​这里​至少​有​二十年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​下面​的​那头​巨龙​也许​只​剩下​了​爬行​类​的​脑​回路​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ba3 ta1 kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 zhi4shao3 you3 er4 shi2 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xia4mian4 de5 na4 tou2 ju4long2 ye3xu3 zhi3 sheng4xia4 le5 pa2xing2 lei4 de5 nao3 hui2lu4。"

msgid ""
"He's kept her in this thing for twenty years, at least. \n"
"\n"
"There's probably nothing but a reptile brain left in the dragon down there."
msgstr ""
"他​把​她​困​在​这里​至少​有​二十年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​下面​的​那头​巨龙​也许​只​剩下​了​爬行​类​的​脑​回路​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ba3 ta1 kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 zhi4shao3 you3 er4 shi2 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xia4mian4 de5 na4 tou2 ju4long2 ye3xu3 zhi3 sheng4xia4 le5 pa2xing2 lei4 de5 nao3 hui2lu4。"

msgid ""
"He's not got a trade skill. He's not goblinised so he couldn't hang with Beckenbauer. \n"
"\n"
"If he opened a normal shop, he'd be ousted by someone thinking he's stealing their job because he's not German.\n"
"\n"
"The coffee shop was a good option because it's obvious. He stays exotic, and does what they expect of him, with the intel and stuff."
msgstr ""
"他​没有​一技之长​。​他​没有​哥布林​的​外表​，​所以​无法​与​贝肯鲍尔​混​到​一起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​他开​一家​普通​商店​，​肯定​会​被​认为​是​在​抢​别人​的​饭碗​而​被​赶走​，​因为​他​不是​德国人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​咖啡店​是​个​不错​的​选择​，​因为​这​很​明显​。​他​保持​着​异国​风格​，​做​着​人们​期望​他​做​的​事​，​倒卖​情报​之类​的​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 mei2you3 yi1ji4zhi1chang2。ta1 mei2you3 ge1bu4lin2 de5 wai4biao3，suo3yi3 wu2fa3 yu4 Bei4ken3bao4er3 hun4 dao4 yi1qi3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 kai1 yi1jia1 pu3tong1 shang1dian4，ken3ding4 hui4 bei4 ren4wei2 shi4 zai4 qiang3 bie2ren5 de5 fan4wan3 er2 bei4 gan3zou3，yin1wei4 ta1 bu4shi4 de2guo2ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ka1fei1dian4 shi4 ge4 bu4cuo4 de5 xuan3ze2，yin1wei4 zhe4 hen3 ming2xian3。ta1 bao3chi2 zhao2 yi4guo2 feng1ge2，zuo4 zhao2 ren2men5 qi1wang4 ta1 zuo4 de5 shi4，dao3mai4 qing2bao4 zhi1lei4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"He's not the type, Kristian. We know him. Zaak is hardly an angel, but he is"
" not capable of that kind of violence. (w)"
msgstr ""
"他​不是​这种​人​，​克里斯蒂安​。​我们​很​了解​他​。​扎克​肯定​算不上​什么​正人君子​，​但​他​也​绝不会​诉诸​此等​程度​的​暴力​。\n"
"ta1 bu4shi4 zhe4zhong3 ren2，ke4li3si1di4an1。wo3men5 hen3 liao3jie3 ta1。Zha1ke4 ken3ding4 suan4 bu4 shang4 shen2me5 zheng4ren2jun1zi5，dan4 ta1 ye3 jue2 bu4 hui4 su4zhu1 ci3 deng3 cheng2du4 de5 bao4li4。"

msgid ""
"He's not wrong, ace. I am APEX. But I'm also Monika.\n"
"\n"
"\"Spook stories\" to the contrary, I am not a monster. I'm... something else. Something quite beyond your understanding."
msgstr ""
"他​没​说错​，​王牌​。​我​是​APEX​。​但​我​也​是​莫妮卡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​与​“​灵异​故事​”​相反​，​我​并​不是​怪物​。​我​是​……​某种​其他​东西​。​一种​远远​超出​你们​理解​范围​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 mei2 shuo1 cuo4，wang2pai2。wo3 shi4 APEX。dan4 wo3 ye3 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。\n"
"\n"
"yu4“ling2yi4 gu4shi4” xiang1fan3，wo3 bing4 bu4shi4 guai4wu5。wo3 shi4……mou3zhong3 qi2ta1 dong1xi1。yi1zhong3 yuan3yuan3 chao1chu1 ni3men5 li3jie3 fan4wei2 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"He's right, Blitz... this isn't a scavenger hunt. We need to get this done "
"and get out of here."
msgstr ""
"他​说得对​，​布里​茨​……​这​不是​拾荒​行动​。​我们​得​赶紧​完事​然后​离开​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de2 dui4，Bu4li3ci2……zhe4 bu4shi4 shi2huang1 xing2dong4。wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 wan2shi4 ran2hou4 li2kai1。"

msgid "He's right, we're on a timetable here. Let's go."
msgstr ""
"他​说得对​，​我们​时间​不​多​。​走​吧​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de2 dui4，wo3men5 shi2jian1 bu4 duo1。zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"He's right. Nothing we're carrying can even scratch dikote - that \"glass\" is essentially sheathed in diamond. We'd need military-grade explosives to crack it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're stuck in here."
msgstr ""
"他​说​得​没错​。​我们​携带​的​东西​无法​对​镀​钻​工艺​造成​任何​损伤​—​—​那​块​“​玻璃​”​是​被​钻石​包裹​着​的​。​我们​需要​军用​级​炸药​才能​打破​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​被困​在​这里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。wo3men5 xie2dai4 de5 dong1xi1 wu2fa3 dui4 du4 zuan1 gong1yi4 zao4cheng2 ren4he2 sun3shang1——na4 kuai4“bo1li5” shi4 bei4 zuan4shi2 bao1guo3 zhao2 de5。wo3men5 xu1yao4 jun1yong4 ji2 zha4yao4 cai2neng2 da3po4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"He's supposed to be some sort of F-State activist. Calls himself Green "
"Winters."
msgstr ""
"他​应该​是​个​动荡​带​的​活动分子​，​自称​格林​·​温特斯​。\n"
"ta1 ying1gai1 shi4 ge4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 huo2 dong4 fen4 zi3，zi4cheng1 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。"

msgid ""
"He's taken contracts with the Triads as well. My contacts tell me that he's even done a few jobs for Tamanous.\n"
"\n"
"When it comes to his paychecks, the Engineer doesn't discriminate."
msgstr ""
"他​也​接过​三合会​的​活儿​。​我​的​线​人​说​，​他​甚至​还给​塔玛​诺斯​做过​几单​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​有钱​拿​，​工程师​从不​挑三拣四​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ye3 jie1guo4 san1he2hui4 de5 huo2r5。wo3 de5 xian4 ren2 shuo1，ta1 shen4zhi4 huan2gei3 ta3 ma3 nuo4 si1 zuo4 guo4 ji1 dan1 cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 you3qian2 na2，gong1cheng2shi1 cong2bu4 tiao1san1jian3si4。"

msgid ""
"He's taken contracts with the Triads as well. My contacts tell me that he's even done work for Tamanous.\n"
"\n"
"When it comes to his paychecks, the Engineer doesn't discriminate."
msgstr ""
"他​也​接过​三合会​的​活儿​。​我​的​线​人​说​，​他​甚至​还给​塔玛​诺斯​做过​几单​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​有钱​拿​，​工程师​从不​挑三拣四​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ye3 jie1guo4 san1he2hui4 de5 huo2r5。wo3 de5 xian4 ren2 shuo1，ta1 shen4zhi4 huan2gei3 ta3 ma3 nuo4 si1 zuo4 guo4 ji1 dan1 cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 you3qian2 na2，gong1cheng2shi1 cong2bu4 tiao1san1jian3si4。"

msgid "Head"
msgstr ""
"头部\n"
"tou2bu4"

msgid "Head into the sewers?"
msgstr ""
"进入​下水道​？\n"
"jin4ru4 xia4shui3dao4？"

msgid "Head to APEX's Backdoor Facility"
msgstr ""
"前往​APEX​的​后门​设施\n"
"qian2wang3 APEX de5 hou4men2 she4shi1"

msgid "Headed somewhere?"
msgstr ""
"要​去​哪​吗​？\n"
"yao4 qu4 na3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Heading for the drone control console, I'll get those drones into the fight "
"sir!"
msgstr ""
"前往​无人机​控制台​，​我能​让​无人机​参与​战斗​，​长官​！\n"
"qian2wang3 wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4tai2，wo3 neng2 rang4 wu2ren2ji1 can1yu4 zhan4dou4，zhang3guan1！"

msgid "Heading inside, chief. This won't take five seconds."
msgstr ""
"我​正在​行动​，​头儿​。​这​活儿​用​不了​五​秒钟​就​能​搞定​。\n"
"wo3 zheng4zai4 xing2dong4，tou2r5。zhe4 huo2r5 yong4 bu4le5 wu3 miao3zhong1 jiu4 neng2 gao3ding4。"

msgid "Headshot"
msgstr ""
"爆头\n"
"bao4tou2"

msgid ""
"Headshot: Increases chance of critical hit, reduces accuracy, Cooldown: 2 "
"RNDS"
msgstr ""
"爆头​：​增加​暴击​几率​，​降低​精准度​，​冷却​时间​：​2​回合\n"
"bao4tou2：zeng1jia1 bao4ji1 ji1lu:4，jiang4di1 jing1 zhun3 du4，leng3que4 shi2jian1：2 hui2he2"

msgid ""
"Headshot: Increases chance of critical hit, reduces accuracy, Cooldown: 2 "
"RNDs"
msgstr ""
"爆头​：​增加​暴击​几率​，​降低​精准度​，​冷却​时间​：​2​回合\n"
"bao4tou2：zeng1jia1 bao4ji1 ji1lu:4，jiang4di1 jing1 zhun3 du4，leng3que4 shi2jian1：2 hui2he2"

msgid "Heal"
msgstr ""
"治疗\n"
"zhi4liao2"

msgid "Heal I"
msgstr ""
"治疗​I\n"
"zhi4liao2 I"

msgid "Heal II"
msgstr ""
"治疗​II\n"
"zhi4liao2 II"

msgid "Heal III"
msgstr ""
"治疗​III\n"
"zhi4liao2 III"

msgid "Heal IV"
msgstr ""
"治疗​IV\n"
"zhi4liao2 IV"

msgid "Heal V"
msgstr ""
"治疗​V\n"
"zhi4liao2 V"

msgid "Heal Wound I"
msgstr ""
"治愈​伤口​I\n"
"zhi4yu4 shang1kou3 I"

msgid "Heal Wound II"
msgstr ""
"治愈​伤口​II\n"
"zhi4yu4 shang1kou3 II"

msgid "Heal targets (With cleaning shrapnel)."
msgstr ""
"治疗​目标​（​附带​清理​弹片​效果​）​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 mu4biao1 （fu4dai4 qing1li3 dan4pian4 xiao4guo3）。"

msgid "Heal targets."
msgstr ""
"治疗​目标​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 mu4biao1。"

msgid "Healed"
msgstr ""
"受到​治疗\n"
"shou4dao4 zhi4liao2"

msgid ""
"Heals all of the damage from the most recent attack. Can be cast outside of "
"combat."
msgstr ""
"治愈​最近​一次​被​攻击​所受​的​所有​伤害​。​可以​在​战斗​外​施放​。\n"
"zhi4yu4 zui4jin4 yi1ci4 bei4 gong1ji1 suo3 shou4 de5 suo3you3 shang1hai4。ke3yi3 zai4 zhan4dou4 wai4 shi1fang4。"

msgid ""
"Heals all of the damage from the most recent attack. Shares a cooldown with "
"other Heal Wound spells."
msgstr ""
"治愈​最近​一次​被​攻击​所​受​所有​伤害​，​与​其余​治愈​伤口​技能​共享​冷却​。\n"
"zhi4yu4 zui4jin4 yi1ci4 bei4 gong1ji1 suo3 shou4 suo3you3 shang1hai4，yu4 qi2yu2 zhi4yu4 shang1kou3 ji4neng2 gong4xiang3 leng3que4。"

msgid "Heals the last wound taken by self."
msgstr ""
"治愈​你​最近​一次​受到​的​伤害​。\n"
"zhi4yu4 ni3 zui4jin4 yi1ci4 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid "Heals the last wound taken by the target."
msgstr ""
"治愈​目标​最近​一次​受到​的​伤害​。\n"
"zhi4yu4 mu4biao1 zui4jin4 yi1ci4 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid "Heals yourself or a friendly target for 10 HP."
msgstr ""
"治疗​自身​或​友方​目标​，​恢复​10​点​生命​值​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 zi4shen1 huo4 you3 fang1 mu4biao1，hui1fu4 10 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "Heals yourself or a friendly target for 100 HP."
msgstr ""
"治疗​自身​或​友方​目标​，​恢复​100​点​生命​值​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 zi4shen1 huo4 you3 fang1 mu4biao1，hui1fu4 100 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "Heals yourself or a friendly target for 25 HP."
msgstr ""
"治疗​自身​或​友方​目标​，​恢复​25​点​生命​值​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 zi4shen1 huo4 you3 fang1 mu4biao1，hui1fu4 25 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "Heals yourself or a friendly target for 40 IP."
msgstr ""
"治疗​你​自己​或​友方​目标​40​点​结合​度​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 ni3 zi4ji3 huo4 you3 fang1 mu4biao1 40 dian3 jie2he2 du4。"

msgid "Heals yourself or a friendly target for 50 HP."
msgstr ""
"治疗​自身​或​友方​目标​，​恢复​50​点​生命​值​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 zi4shen1 huo4 you3 fang1 mu4biao1，hui1fu4 50 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "Heals yourself or a friendly target for 60 IP."
msgstr ""
"治疗​你​自己​或​友方​目标​60​点​结合​度​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 ni3 zi4ji3 huo4 you3 fang1 mu4biao1 60 dian3 jie2he2 du4。"

msgid "Heals yourself or a friendly target for 75 HP."
msgstr ""
"治疗​自身​或​友方​目标​，​恢复​75​点​生命​值​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 zi4shen1 huo4 you3 fang1 mu4biao1，hui1fu4 75 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid "Heals yourself or a friendly target for 90 IP."
msgstr ""
"治疗​你​自己​或​友方​目标​90​点​结合​度​。\n"
"zhi4liao2 ni3 zi4ji3 huo4 you3 fang1 mu4biao1 90 dian3 jie2he2 du4。"

msgid ""
"Hear me out, Most Improvident of Calamities! Burakgazi knows Berlin. Knows the players.\n"
"\n"
"I have already found a potential client. A most prosperous one, with deep pockets. He is most eager to meet you. \n"
"\n"
"I have already set it up. At least do me the courtesy of talking to him."
msgstr ""
"缺乏​远见​之人​啊​，​请​先​听​我​说完​！​布拉加​齐​熟悉​柏林​。​熟悉​其中​形形色色​的​人​事物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​发现​了​一名​潜在​客户​。​一位​财力雄厚​、​腰缠万贯​之​人​。​他​迫切希望​与​你​见面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​安排​好​了​事宜​。​看​在​我​的​面子​上​，​至少​和​他​谈谈​。\n"
"\n"
"que1fa2 yuan3jian4 zhi1 ren2 a1，qing3 xian1 ting1 wo3 shuo1 wan2！bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 shu2xi1 bo2lin2。shu2xi1 qi2zhong1 xing2xing2se4se4 de5 ren2 shi4wu4。\n"
"\n"
