"Hai3mo4 li3 xi1 zhang1kou3 xiang3yao4 shuo1 xie1 shen2me5，dan4 kan4lai5 zui4zhong1 jue2ding4 hai2shi5 bu4 shuo1 wei2 miao4。"

msgid "Heiner"
msgstr ""
"海纳\n"
"hai3 na4"

msgid ""
"Hell no! I wasn't gonna stand for that! Where does she get off, stealing from me and then acting like it was *my* fault?\n"
"\n"
"I tried to trace the message, like any good decker would."
msgstr ""
"怎么​可能​！​我​才​不会​听信​这种​话​！​她​不辞而别​，​偷​了​我​的​东西​，​现在​还​好像​这​都​是​*​我​的​*​错​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​身为​一名​出色​的​碟​客​，​我​试图​追溯​消息​的​来源​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 ke3neng2！wo3 cai2 bu4hui4 ting1xin4 zhe4zhong3 hua4！ta1 bu4ci2er2bie2，tou1 le5 wo3 de5 dong1xi1，xian4zai4 hai2 hao3xiang4 zhe4 dou1 shi4*wo3 de5*cuo4？\n"
"\n"
"shen1wei2 yi1 ming2 chu1se4 de5 die2 ke4，wo3 shi4tu2 zhui1su4 xiao1xi5 de5 lai2yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Hell of a thing, that was. I remember the terror, the senseless violence. The murdered children.\n"
"\n"
"I remember this little dwarf boy… they stuffed his body in the gutter, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I can still see his face, all bruised and broken. To this day, it makes my blood boil."
msgstr ""
"真他妈​是​一群​畜生​。​我​仍​记得​那晚​的​恐怖​情景​，​那种​毫无道理​的​暴力​。​那些​被​残杀​的​孩子​们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​记得​那个​矮人​男孩​……​他们​把​他​的​尸体​抛进​了​臭水沟​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​那​支离破碎​的​脸庞​至今​仍会​在​我​面前​浮现​。​哪怕​到​现在​，​一​想起​这些​事​，​我​仍然​恨​得​牙痒痒​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 ta1 ma1 shi4 yi1 qun2 chu4sheng5。wo3 reng2 ji4de5 na4 wan3 de5 kong3bu4 qing2jing3，na4zhong3 hao2 wu2 dao4 li3 de5 bao4li4。na4xie1 bei4 can2sha1 de5 hai2zi5 men5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 ji4de5 na4ge5 ai3ren2 nan2hai2……ta1men5 ba3 ta1 de5 shi1ti3 pao1 jin4 le5 chou4 shui3 gou1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 na4 zhi1li2po4sui4 de5 lian3pang2 zhi4jin1 reng2 hui4 zai4 wo3 mian4qian2 fu2xian4。na3pa4 dao4 xian4zai4，yi1 xiang3qi3 zhe4xie1 shi4，wo3 reng2ran2 hen4 de2 ya2 yang3 yang3。"

msgid ""
"Hell of a thing, wasn't it? That run made me glad that I don't have to spend a lot of time in hospitals, I'll tell you that much.\n"
"\n"
"There wasn't a single aspect of that building that didn't make me feel uneasy."
msgstr ""
"真他妈​要命​啊​。​这么​说​吧​，​我能​安然无恙​从​这趟​差事​回来​，​没有​缺​胳膊​少腿进​医院​养伤​，​都​算​谢天谢地​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那栋​建筑​，​从头到脚​就​没​一处​不透​着​危险​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 ta1 ma1 yao4ming4 a1。zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，wo3 neng2 an1ran2wu2yang4 cong2 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 hui2lai5，mei2you3 que1 ge1bo5 shao3 tui3 jin4 yi1yuan4 yang3shang1，dou1 suan4 xie4tian1xie4di4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"na4 dong4 jian4zhu4，cong2tou2dao4jiao3 jiu4 mei2 yi1 chu3 bu4 tou4 zhao2 wei1xian3 de5。"

msgid "Hell of a way to go."
msgstr ""
"这​死法​也​太​遭罪​了​。\n"
"zhe4 si3 fa3 ye3 tai4 zao1zui4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Hell yeah, chief. Keep your eyes open. Maybe, when his back is turned...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice trails off.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, wait. Damn it. This isn't going to work."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​头儿​。​注意​把握​时机​。​也许​等​他​转过身​去​的​时候​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​逐渐​低落​下去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等等​。​该死​的​。​这样​不行​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，tou2r5。zhu4yi4 ba3wo4 shi2ji1。ye3xu3 deng3 ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4 de5 shi2hou5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhu2jian4 di1luo4 xia4qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3deng3。gai1si3 de5。zhe4yang4 bu4xing2。"

