"就​在​昨天​，​我​还​听到​有人​声称​在​地铁​隧道​里​看到​“​鸦灵​”​的​一名​成员​扒​着​一​节车厢​飞驰​而​过​。​哈​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​凑近​了​些​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 zuo2tian1，wo3 hai2 ting1dao4 you3ren2 sheng1cheng1 zai4 di4tie3 sui4dao4 li3 kan4dao4“Ya1ling2” de5 yi1 ming2 cheng2yuan2 ba1 zhao2 yi1 jie1 che1 xiang1 fei1chi2 er2 guo4。ha1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cou4jin4 le5 xie1。{{/GM}}"

