"\n"
"bang1 wo3 ba3 zhe4 jia1huo5 tuo1 hui2 cang1ku4 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de2 gao3 qing1 chu3 ta1 dou1 zhi1dao4 xie1 shen2me5。"

