"na4 jiu4 bang1 bang1 wo3men5 ba1。fan3zheng4 ni3 dou1 shi4 yao4si3 de5 ren2 le5，tou4lu4 yi1dian3 mi4mi4 you4 you3 shen2me5 ni2？"

