"{{GM}} ta1 tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 tian1hua1ban3，zi4yan2zi4yu3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，he4 mi3。wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 you3 duo1 xi3huan5 dong4dang4 dai4，dan4 xian4zai4 zhe4 yi3jing1 bu4 zhong4yao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 shi4 bo2lin2。"

msgid ""
"Her face contorts in a mask of fury and her mouth opens wide - wider than should be possible. \n"
"\n"
"Her neck cranes forward and her head swings from side-to-side as she hisses her rage. \n"
"\n"
"She slathers, her spittle hitting the glass between you as she speaks."
msgstr ""
"她​的​脸​扭曲​成​愤怒​的​面具​，​嘴巴​大大​张开​到​超乎​想象​的​程度​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​脖子​向前​伸出​，​头​左右​摇晃​，​发出​愤怒​的​嘶嘶声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​口水​横飞​，​唾沫​一直​溅​到​你们​之间​的​玻璃​上​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 lian3 niu3qu1 cheng2 fen4nu4 de5 mian4ju4，zui3ba5 da4da4 zhang1kai1 dao4 chao1 hu1 xiang3xiang4 de5 cheng2du4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 bo2zi5 xiang4qian2 shen1chu1，tou2 zuo3you4 yao2huang4，fa1chu1 fen4nu4 de5 si1si1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kou3shui3 heng2fei1，tuo4mo5 yi1zhi2 jian4 dao4 ni3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 bo1li5 shang4。"

msgid "Her face falls."
msgstr ""
"她​垮下​脸来​。\n"
"ta1 kua3 xia4 lian3 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Her face is all hard planes and sculpted angles, with high cheekbones and almond eyes. Her lips are painted a frigid blue, but the look in her eyes is even colder. A head of lustrous black hair is interspersed with flowing streams of cyan light.\n"
"\n"
"Alice exhales a plume of smoke, then tips her cigarette into a nearby ashtray. She fixes her eyes on you, and her lips curl into a humorless smile."
msgstr ""
"她​的​脸庞​棱角分明​，​高耸​的​颧骨​勾勒​出​雕塑​般的​轮廓​，​杏仁​状​的​眼睛​深邃​幽暗​。​唇​上​涂​着​冰冷​的​蓝色​，​但​眼底​的​寒意​更​甚​。​乌黑​发亮​的​秀发​间​，​流淌​着​氤氲​的​青蓝色​光流​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​爱丽丝​吐​出​一缕​烟雾​，​将​烟头​掐进​附近​的​烟灰缸​。​她​凝视着​你​，​嘴角​勾起​一抹​毫无​喜悦​之感​的​冷笑​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 lian3pang2 leng2 jiao3 fen4 ming2，gao1song3 de5 quan2gu3 gou1le4 chu1 diao1su4 ban1 de5 lun2kuo4，xing4ren2 zhuang4 de5 yan3jing5 shen1sui4 you1an4。chun2 shang4 tu2 zhao2 bing1leng3 de5 lan2se4，dan4 yan3di3 de5 han2yi4 geng1 shen4。wu1hei1 fa1liang4 de5 xiu4fa4 jian1，liu2tang3 zhao2 yin1yun1 de5 qing1 lan2 se4 guang1 liu2。\n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1 tu3 chu1 yi1 lu:3 yan1wu4，jiang1 yan1tou2 qia1 jin4 fu4jin4 de5 yan1hui1gang1。ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3，zui3jiao3 gou1qi3 yi1 ma1 hao2wu2 xi3yue4 zhi1 gan3 de5 leng3xiao4。"

msgid ""
"Her fragile form trembles but she steadies herself. When she speaks again, "
"her voice is calm. At peace."
msgstr ""
"她​纤弱​的​身躯​颤抖​着​，​但​她​稳住​了​自己​。​当​她​再次​开口​时​，​声音​已然​平静​。​安宁​。\n"
"ta1 xian1ruo4 de5 shen1qu1 chan4dou3 zhao2，dan4 ta1 wen3 zhu4 le5 zi4ji3。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 yi3ran2 ping2jing4。an1ning2。"

msgid "Her hand drops to her side."
msgstr ""
"她​垂​下手​。\n"
"ta1 chui2 xia4shou3。"

msgid "Her mother died. We're going to go calm her down right now."
msgstr ""
"她​的​母亲​去世​了​。​我们​现在​要​去​让​她​冷静下来​。\n"
"ta1 de5 mu3qin1 qu4shi4 le5。wo3men5 xian4zai4 yao4 qu4 rang4 ta1 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2。"

msgid "Her yellow eyes lock on yours. Focus hard."
msgstr ""
"她​黄色​的​双眼​死死​盯​着​你​。\n"
"ta1 huang2se4 de5 shuang1yan3 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid "Her yellow eyes open wide and she swallows hard."
msgstr ""
"她​黄色​的​眼睛​睁​得​大大的​，​艰难​地吞​了​口​唾沫​。\n"
"ta1 huang2se4 de5 yan3jing5 zheng1 de2 dai4 dai4 de5，jian1nan2 de5 tun1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。"

msgid ""
"Here is a brief recap of the operational parameters for this job, as provided me by our client.\n"
"\n"
"> Samuel Beckenbauer (CLIENT) suspects that the Humanis Policlub is planning something nefarious involving a highly toxic chemical.\n"
"\n"
"> Beckenbauer wants you to infiltrate a group of smugglers to gain entry into a Humanis compound."
msgstr ""
"以下​是​客户​向​我​提供​的​任务​简报​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔​（​客户​）​怀疑​人类​至上​俱乐部​正在​策划​某种​涉及​剧毒​化学品​的​阴谋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​贝肯鲍尔​需要​你​潜入​走私者​团伙​，​以此​混入​人类​至上​主义者​的​一处​据点​。\n"
"\n"
"yi3xia4 shi4 ke4hu4 xiang4 wo3 ti2gong1 de5 ren4wu5 jian3bao4：\n"
"\n"
">sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3 （ke4hu4） huai2yi2 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 zheng4zai4 ce4hua4 mou3zhong3 she4ji2 ju4du2 hua4xue2pin3 de5 yin1mou2。\n"
"\n"
">Bei4ken3bao4er3 xu1yao4 ni3 qian2ru4 zou3 si1 zhe3 tuan2huo3，yi3ci3 hun4ru4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 yi1 chu3 ju4dian3。"

msgid ""
"Here is a brief recap of the operational parameters for this job, as provided me by our client:\n"
"\n"
"> Samuel Beckenbauer (CLIENT) suspects that the Humanis Policlub is planning something nefarious involving a highly toxic chemical.\n"
"\n"
"> Beckenbauer wants you to infiltrate a group of smugglers to gain entry into a Humanis compound."
msgstr ""
"以下​是​客户​向​我​提供​的​任务​简报​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔​（​客户​）​怀疑​人类​至上​俱乐部​正在​策划​某种​涉及​剧毒​化学品​的​阴谋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​贝肯鲍尔​需要​你​潜入​走私者​团伙​，​以此​混入​人类​至上​主义者​的​一处​据点​。\n"
"\n"
"yi3xia4 shi4 ke4hu4 xiang4 wo3 ti2gong1 de5 ren4wu5 jian3bao4：\n"
"\n"
">sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3 （ke4hu4） huai2yi2 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 zheng4zai4 ce4hua4 mou3zhong3 she4ji2 ju4du2 hua4xue2pin3 de5 yin1mou2。\n"
"\n"
">Bei4ken3bao4er3 xu1yao4 ni3 qian2ru4 zou3 si1 zhe3 tuan2huo3，yi3ci3 hun4ru4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 yi1 chu3 ju4dian3。"

msgid ""
"Here is a brief recap of the operational parameters for this job, as provided me by our potential client:\n"
"\n"
"> Frau Müller (CLIENT) wants you to level an Aztechnology research facility in order to stop the work that they're doing there (project name: \"Bloodline\").\n"
"\n"
"> To accomplish this, you must overload the facility's power generators."
msgstr ""
"以下​是​潜在​客户​给​我​提供​的​任务​简报​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​穆勒​女士​（​客户​）​要​你们​夷平​一处​阿兹特​科技​研究​设施​，​借此​阻止​他们​正在​进行​的​工作​（​项目名称​：​“​血脉​”​）​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​为​达成​目的​，​你们​必须​让​设施​的​发电机组​过载​。\n"
"\n"
"yi3xia4 shi4 qian2zai4 ke4hu4 gei3 wo3 ti2gong1 de5 ren4wu5 jian3bao4：\n"
"\n"
">mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 （ke4hu4） yao4 ni3men5 yi2ping2 yi1 chu3 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 yan2jiu1 she4shi1，jie4ci3 zu3zhi3 ta1men5 zheng4zai4 jin4xing2 de5 gong1zuo4 （xiang4 mu4 ming2 chen4：“xue4mai4”）。\n"
"\n"
">wei2 da2cheng2 mu4di4，ni3men5 bi4xu1 rang4 she4shi1 de5 fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 guo4zai4。"

msgid ""
"Here is your payment as promised. And, should you need any new weapons... thanks to you, I have some new merchandise available. \n"
"\n"
"Would you like to take a look?"
msgstr ""
"这是​说好​的​报酬​。​另外​，​如果​你​需要​新​武器​的话​……​多亏​了​你​，​我​这边​也​有​新货​上架​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​看看​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 shuo1hao3 de5 bao4chou5。ling4wai4，ru2guo3 ni3 xu1yao4 xin1 wu3qi4 de5hua4……duo1kui1 le5 ni3，wo3 zhe4bian1 ye3 you3 xin1 huo4 shang4jia4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 kan4kan5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Here is your payment, then. It is at least good to know that our shipments will be safe again.\n"
"\n"
"Until next time, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"这​是​你​的​报酬​。​至少​我们​的​货​之后​总算​安全​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​下次​见​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 bao4chou5。zhi4shao3 wo3men5 de5 huo4 zhi1hou4 zong3suan4 an1quan2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xia4ci4 jian4，$(l.name)。"

msgid "Here you are, payment in full."
msgstr ""
"这些​钱​归​你​了​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 qian2 gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid "Here you go, Eiger. All yours."
msgstr ""
"拿​着​吧​，​艾格尔​。​归​你​了​。\n"
"na2 zhao2 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Hermie's great! I mean, dead as a doornail - somebody's pet AI fried his "
"brain - but other than that, he's great!"
msgstr ""
"赫米​挺​好​的​！​我​是​说​，​已经​死透​了​—​—​某人​的​宠物​AI​烧坏​了​他​的​大脑​—​—​但​除此之外​，​他​挺​好​的​！\n"
"he4 mi3 ting3 hao3 de5！wo3 shi4 shuo1，yi3jing1 si3 tou4 le5——mou3ren2 de5 chong3wu4 AI shao1 huai4 le5 ta1 de5 da4nao3——dan4 chu2ci3zhi1wai4，ta1 ting3 hao3 de5！"

msgid ""
"Hermie. My theories are not, as you call them, \"fairy tales.\"\n"
"\n"
"Dragons are *real.* I saved Germany from one. Have you forgotten?"
msgstr ""
"赫米​。​我​的​理论​并​不是​“​胡说八道​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​是​*​真的​*​。​我​就​曾经​拯救​德国​免遭​一条​巨龙​的​毒​爪​，​你​忘​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3。wo3 de5 li3lun4 bing4 bu4shi4“hu2shuo1ba1dao4”。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 shi4*zhen1de5*。wo3 jiu4 ceng2jing1 zheng3jiu4 de2guo2 mian3zao1 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 du2 zhao3，ni3 wang4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hermie... I think we've found her. After all this time. Feuerschwinge... I knew that she wasn't dead!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His speech is jittery. You can hear the urgency in his voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She survived the Dragonfall. Just as I've always said. I knew it, and I was *right!*"
msgstr ""
"赫米​……​我​想​我们​找到​她​了​。​过​了​这么久​。​火翼​……​我​就​知道​她​没​死​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​说话​有些​颤抖​。​你​能​从​他​的​声音​中​听​出​他​的​紧迫感​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​在​龙​陨​事件​中活​了​下来​，​就​像​我​一直​说​的​那样​。​我​就​知道​，​我​是​*​对​的​*​！\n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3……wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 zhao3dao4 ta1 le5。guo4 le5 zhe4 ma2 jiu3。Huo3yi4……wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 mei2 si3！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuo1hua4 you3xie1 chan4dou3。ni3 neng2 cong2 ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhong4 ting1 chu1 ta1 de5 jin3 po4 gan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 long2 yun3 shi4jian4 zhong4 huo2 le5 xia4lai5，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1zhi2 shuo1 de5 na4yang4。wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4，wo3 shi4*dui4 de5*！"

msgid ""
"Herr Fuchs sent us to check up on you. Given his recent troubles with shadowrunners, this should not come as a surprise.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Company Man smiles and nods slightly{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I shall return to him and report your task completed to my satisfaction.\n"
"\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"富克斯​先生​派​我们​来​进行​核查​。​鉴于​他​最近​与​暗影​狂奔​者​之间​的​麻烦​，​你​应该​不会​感觉​意外​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​公司​佬​微笑​着​略略​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​向​他​报告​说​你​已​圆满完成​任务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 pai4 wo3men5 lai2 jin4xing2 he2cha2。jian4yu2 ta1 zui4jin4 yu4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 zhi1jian1 de5 ma2fan5，ni3 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 gan3jue2 yi4wai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1si1 lao3 wei1xiao4 zhao2 lu:e4lu:e4 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 xiang4 ta1 bao4gao4 shuo1 ni3 yi3 yuan2 man3 wan2 cheng2 ren4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Herr Fuchs sent us to check up on you. Given his recent troubles with shadowrunners, this should not come as a surprise.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Company Man smiles at Enstad. The rigger shrinks back against the wall.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No more than your betrayal surprises me."
msgstr ""
"富克斯​先生​派​我们​来​进行​核查​。​鉴于​他​最近​与​暗影​狂奔​者​之间​的​麻烦​，​你​应该​不会​感觉​意外​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​公司​佬​朝​恩施​塔德​笑了笑​。​机师​向​后​退缩​紧紧​贴着​墙​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​你​的​背叛​，​倒​也​没​让​我​感到​意外​。\n"
"\n"
"Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 pai4 wo3men5 lai2 jin4xing2 he2cha2。jian4yu2 ta1 zui4jin4 yu4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 zhi1jian1 de5 ma2fan5，ni3 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 gan3jue2 yi4wai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1si1 lao3 chao2 en1Shi1ta3de2 xiao4 le5 xiao4。ji1shi1 xiang4 hou4 tui4suo1 jin3jin3 tie1 zhao2 qiang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 ni3 de5 bei4pan4，dao3 ye3 mei2 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 yi4wai4。"

msgid ""
"Herr Schmidt hired us for a reason. We should just give it to him and wash our hands of it.\n"
"\n"
"The job's the job, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"施密特​先生​不是​白​雇佣​我们​的​，​我们​应当​如实​交货​，​就此​了结​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​工作​就是​工作​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 bu4shi4 bai2 gu4yong1 wo3men5 de5，wo3men5 ying1dang1 ru2shi2 jiao1huo4，jiu4ci3 liao3jie2。\n"
"\n"
"gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Herr Schmidt will get what he wants. I just wanted you to know in case any "
"fallout from this decision comes drifting back our way."
msgstr ""
"施密特​先生​会​如愿以偿​的​。​我​只是​想先​告诉​你们​，​免得​万一​有​什么​变故​的话​，​你们​还​蒙在鼓里​。\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 hui4 ru2yuan4yi3chang2 de5。wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 xian1 gao4su4 ni3men5，mian3de5 wan4yi1 you3 shen2me5 bian4gu4 de5hua4，ni3men5 hai2 meng2zai4gu3li3。"

msgid "Herr Schmidt's Van"
msgstr ""
"施密特​先生​的​货车\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 de5 huo4che1"

msgid ""
"Herr Vauclair, why are you directing Diehl Defense's energies to the killing"
" of Feuerschwinge? Are there corporate interests at play in this?"
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​先生​，​你​为什么​要​把​迪尔​防务​的​资源​放在​击杀​火翼​上​呢​？​这​其中​是否​有​公司​利益​在​作祟​？\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 xian1sheng5，ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 ba3 Di2er3fang2wu4 de5 zi1yuan2 fang4 zai4 ji1sha1 Huo3yi4 shang4 ni2？zhe4 qi2zhong1 shi4fou3 you3 gong1si1 li4yi4 zai4 zuo4sui4？"

msgid ""
"Hey Kappel,\n"
"\n"
"You come highly recommended. Anyone who did what you did to those elves will go far around here. You can hit the kitchen anytime, but otherwise stay close unless otherwise told.\n"
"\n"
"Your locker code is 2619, Locker 3.\n"
"\n"
"- Owen"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​卡​佩尔​，​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可是​备受​推崇​。​你​能​对​精灵​做出​那种​事​，​在​这儿​你​肯定​前途无量​。​你​可以​随时​去​厨房​，​但​除此之外​，​没有​指示​就别​乱跑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​储物柜​是​3​号​柜​，​密码​是​2619​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​欧文\n"
"\n"
"hei1，ka3 pei4 er3，\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3shi4 bei4shou4 tui1chong2。ni3 neng2 dui4 jing1ling2 zuo4chu1 na4zhong3 shi4，zai4 zhe4r5 ni3 ken3ding4 qian2tu2wu2liang4。ni3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 qu4 chu2fang2，dan4 chu2ci3zhi1wai4，mei2you3 zhi3shi4 jiu4 bie4 luan4pao3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 chu3wu4gui4 shi4 3 hao4 ju3，mi4ma3 shi4 2619。\n"
"\n"
"——ou1wen2"

msgid "Hey again, $(l.name). What's up?"
msgstr ""
"又​见面​了​，​$(l.name)​。​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5，$(l.name)。you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey again.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whatcha need?"
msgstr ""
"又​见面​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​需要​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 ma5？"

msgid "Hey boss you better come over and talk to this guy."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​你​最好​过来​和​这​家伙​谈谈​。\n"
"lao3da4，ni3 zui4hao3 guo4lai2 he4 zhe4 jia1huo5 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"Hey there, \"muscle.\" Not sure if Tuck gave me the right address, but I figured it was worth a shot.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know if you heard, but our favorite policlub got hit from all sides by the F-State today. It was glorious."
msgstr ""
"你好​啊​，​“​打手​”​。​我​不​清楚​塔克​给​我​的​收件​地址​对​不​对​，​反正​我​就​先​试试看​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​知道​你​听说​了​没​，​咱们​最爱​的​政治​俱乐部​今天​被​动荡​带​的​各方​势力​轮番​打击​，​那​场面​真是​精彩绝伦​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3 a1，“da3shou5”。wo3 bu4 qing1chu5 ta3 ke4 gei3 wo3 de5 shou1 jian4 di4zhi3 dui4 bu4 dui4，fan3zheng4 wo3 jiu4 xian1 shi4shi4kan4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 ting1shuo1 le5 mei2，zan2men5 zui4 ai4 de5 zheng4zhi4 ju4le4bu4 jin1tian1 bei4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 ge4fang1 shi4li5 lun2fan1 da3ji1，na4 chang3mian4 zhen1shi5 jing1 cai3 jue2 lun2。"

msgid "Hey there, chief. Don't hang up - I've got a proposition for ya."
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​头儿​。​先别​挂​—​—​我​有​个​提议​。\n"
"hei1，tou2r5。xian1 bie4 gua4——wo3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4。"

msgid ""
"Hey! Could an idiot turn up *another clue* in under a day?\n"
"\n"
"No? I didn't think so. So take your insults and choke on 'em."
msgstr ""
"喂​！​哪个​笨蛋​能​在​一天​之内​就​找到​*​新​的​线索​*​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​这么回事​吧​？​所以​收回​你​对​我​的​侮辱​。\n"
"\n"
"wei2！na3ge5 ben4dan4 neng2 zai4 yi1 tian1 zhi1nei4 jiu4 zhao3dao4*xin1 de5 xian4suo3*？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 ba1？suo3yi3 shou1hui2 ni3 dui4 wo3 de5 wu3ru3。"

msgid ""
"Hey! Good-lookin'! You're back!\n"
"\n"
"You got that cram yet?"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​可人儿​！​你​回来​啦​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​搞​到​药​了​没​？\n"
"\n"
"hei1，ke3 ren2 er2！ni3 hui2lai5 la5！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gao3 dao4 yao4 le5 mei2？"

msgid "Hey! Hey, sweetie, over here!"
msgstr ""
"嗨​！​嗨​，​亲爱​的​，​在​这儿​！\n"
"hai1！hai1，qin1ai4 de5，zai4 zhe4r5！"

msgid ""
"Hey! I do good work here. But this complication is on a whole 'nother level."
msgstr ""
"喂​！​我​已经​尽力​了​好​吧​。​但​这​根本​就​不是​一般​人能​处理​的​。\n"
"wei2！wo3 yi3jing1 jin4li4 le5 hao3 ba1。dan4 zhe4 gen1ben3 jiu4 bu4shi4 yi1ban1 ren2 neng2 chu3li3 de5。"

msgid "Hey! We were just getting started here."
msgstr ""
"喂​！​我们​才刚​开始​呢​。\n"
"wei2！wo3men5 cai2 gang1 kai1shi3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Hey, $(l.name)! That \"fireworks display\" that *mysteriously* went off at the Azzie compound was a thing of beauty!\n"
"\n"
"We wish you could've been in the coffee shop with us to see it, but we understand that you had more important things to do."
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​$(l.name)​！​阿兹佬​园区​那场​*​神秘​*​绽放​的​“​烟花​秀​”​真是​美不胜收​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​真​希望​你​能​在​咖啡馆​跟​我们​一起​看​，​但​我们​理解​你​有​更​重要​的​事情​要​处理​。\n"
"\n"
"hei1，$(l.name)！e1 zi1 lao3 yuan2qu1 na4 chang2*shen2mi4*zhan4fang4 de5“yan1hua1 xiu4” zhen1shi5 mei3bu4sheng4shou1！\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 zai4 ka1fei1guan3 gen1 wo3men5 yi1qi3 kan4，dan4 wo3men5 li3jie3 ni3 you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 chu3li3。"

msgid ""
"Hey, *you* started this when you stole our property. Can't we talk about "
"this?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​明明​是​*​你们​*​先偷​了​我们​的​东西​。​我们​就​不能​谈谈​吗​？\n"
"wei2，ming2ming2 shi4*ni3men5*xian1 tou1 le5 wo3men5 de5 dong1xi1。wo3men5 jiu4 bu4neng2 tan2tan2 ma5？"

msgid "Hey, Blitz? Open the door."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​？​把门​打开​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2？ba3men2 da3kai1。"

msgid "Hey, Dante. Hey, boy. How you doin’?"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​但丁​，​小家伙​。​你​感觉​怎么样​啊​？\n"
"hei1，dan4ding1，xiao3 jia1 huo3。ni3 gan3jue2 zen3me5yang4 a1？"

msgid "Hey, Glory. How're you holding up?"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​格洛丽​，​你​还好​吗​？\n"
"hei1，Ge2luo4li2，ni3 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey, Grinder... speaking of Blitz, there's something else that I think he "
"can give you. Consider it compound interest on his loan."
msgstr ""
"对​了​，​“​绞肉机​”​……​说​到​布里​茨​的​事情​，​我​觉得​他​还​能​再​给​你​点​别的​。​就​当​是​他​那笔​贷款​的​复利​吧​。\n"
"dui4 le5，“jiao3rou4ji1”……shuo1 dao4 Bu4li3ci2 de5 shi4qing5，wo3 jue2de5 ta1 hai2 neng2 zai4 gei3 ni3 dian3 bie2de5。jiu4 dang1 shi4 ta1 na4 bi3 dai4kuan3 de5 fu4li4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Hey, Hasenkamp, what does Grinder think about this? Isn't money lending "
"*his* racket?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​哈森​坎普​，​你​说​“​绞肉机​”​对​这个​会​有​什么​看法​？​高利贷​不是​*​他​的​*​老本行​吗​？\n"
"wei2，Ha1sen1kan3pu3，ni3 shuo1“jiao3rou4ji1” dui4 zhe4ge5 hui4 you3 shen2me5 kan4fa3？gao1li4dai4 bu4shi4*ta1 de5*lao3 ben3 xing2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey, I don't mean to be rude, but this is my off-time. I intend to spend it smoking and drinking myself into a stupor - not talking.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She waves you away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you wanna chat later, we'll chat. For now, give me some breathing room."
msgstr ""
"无意​冒犯​，​但​现在​是​我​的​休息时间​。​我​打算​在​这​段时间​里​抽烟​喝酒​，​而​不是​说话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​挥手​让​你​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​以后​想​聊天​，​我们​可以​聊​。​现在​先​别​打扰​我​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2yi4 mao4fan4，dan4 xian4zai4 shi4 wo3 de5 xiu1 xi1 shi2 jian1。wo3 da3suan4 zai4 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3 chou1yan1 he1jiu3，er2 bu4shi4 shuo1hua4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui1shou3 rang4 ni3 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yi3hou4 xiang3 liao2tian1，wo3men5 ke3yi3 liao2。xian4zai4 xian1 bie4 da3rao3 wo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Hey, I gotcha. Business is business, and all that.\n"
"\n"
"Say, speaking of business... you wouldn't happen to need a nova-hot decker, would you? 'Cause I suddenly find myself unemployed."
msgstr ""
"嗨​，​我​懂​的​。​生意​就是​生意​，​也​只是​生意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​说​到​生意​……​你们​不会​正好​缺​一个​超棒​的​碟​客​吧​？​因为​我​突然​意识​到​，​我​现在​没​工作​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hai1，wo3 dong3 de5。sheng1yi4 jiu4shi4 sheng1yi4，ye3 zhi3shi4 sheng1yi4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，shuo1 dao4 sheng1yi4……ni3men5 bu4hui4 zheng4hao3 que1 yi1ge5 chao1 bang4 de5 die2 ke4 ba1？yin1wei4 wo3 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4，wo3 xian4zai4 mei2 gong1zuo4 le5。"

msgid "Hey, I'll take it. Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""
"行​，​我​记下​了​。​我们​能​聊聊​别的​吗​？\n"
"xing2，wo3 ji4 xia4 le5。wo3men5 neng2 liao2 liao2 bie2de5 ma5？"

msgid "Hey, I'm a *great* decker! I mean, I got the door open, didn't I?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​我​的​碟​客​技术​很​厉害​的​！​毕竟​我​把门​弄开​了​，​对​吧​？\n"
"wei2，wo3 de5 die2 ke4 ji4shu4 hen3 li4hai5 de5！bi4jing4 wo3 ba3men2 long4 kai1 le5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Hey, Marta... didn't Harrow say something about wanting this outsider alive?"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​玛​尔塔​……​哈罗​不是​说​让​这个​外来者​活着​吗​？\n"
"hei1，Ma3er3ta3……ha1luo2 bu4shi4 shuo1 rang4 zhe4ge5 wai4 lai2 zhe3 huo2zhe5 ma5？"

msgid "Hey, Monika, you think that you can crack this?"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​莫妮卡​，​你​能​破解​掉​这​东西​吗​？\n"
"hei1，Mo4ni1ka3，ni3 neng2 po4jie3 diao4 zhe4 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey, ace. If you're reading this, it means that I've either died or stepped down... hopefully the latter, but probably the former.\n"
"\n"
"Not many shadowrunners make it to retirement age."
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​王牌​。​如果​你​在读​这​条​消息​，​说明​我​要么​已经​死​了​，​要么​卸任​了​……​我​希望​是​后者​，​但​多半​是​前者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​几个​狂奔​者​能​活到​退休​。\n"
"\n"
"hei1，wang2pai2。ru2guo3 ni3 zai4du2 zhe4 tiao2 xiao1xi5，shuo1ming2 wo3 yao4me5 yi3jing1 si3 le5，yao4me5 xie4ren4 le5……wo3 xi1wang4 shi4 hou4zhe3，dan4 duo1ban4 shi4 qian2zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ji3ge5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 neng2 huo2 dao4 tui4xiu1。"

msgid "Hey, all riiight!"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​这个​好​！\n"
"hei1，zhe4ge5 hao3！"

msgid "Hey, as long as there are Deutcsh Marks to make..."
msgstr ""
"只要​能​有钱赚​的话​……\n"
"zhi3yao4 neng2 you3 qian2 zhuan4 de5hua4……"

msgid ""
"Hey, at least she jacked out. So she's still alive... that's something, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"至少​她​成功​逃出去​了​。​所以​说​她​还​活着​……​这​也​算​有所​收获​吧​？\n"
"zhi4shao3 ta1 cheng2gong1 tao2 chu1 qu4 le5。suo3yi3 shuo1 ta1 hai2 huo2zhe5……zhe4 ye3 suan4 you3suo3 shou1huo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Hey, boss.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich gives you a slight nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希朝​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hei1，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey, boss... I think that you should check this out. It might be important."
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​老大​……​我​想​你​应该​看看​这个​。​这​可能​很​重要​。\n"
"hei1，lao3da4……wo3 xiang3 ni3 ying1gai1 kan4kan5 zhe4ge5。zhe4 ke3neng2 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"Hey, buddy... sorry to bother you, but I could use some help over here.\n"
"\n"
"You wanna make a little extra scratch? Shouldn't take long."
msgstr ""
"朋友​……​抱歉​打扰​下​，​我​这里​需要​一点​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​赚点​外快​吗​？​应该​用​不了​多久​。\n"
"\n"
"peng2you5……bao4qian4 da3rao3 xia4，wo3 zhe4li3 xu1yao4 yi1dian3 bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 zhuan4 dian3 wai4kuai4 ma5？ying1gai1 yong4 bu4le5 duo1jiu3。"

msgid ""
"Hey, c'mon, *I* didn't steal that stuff! I'm just trying to get by here."
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​又​不是​*​我​*​偷​的​！​我​只是​想​在​这里​混口饭吃​。\n"
"bai4tuo1，you4 bu4shi4*wo3*tou1 de5！wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 zai4 zhe4li3 hun4 kou3 fan4 chi1。"

msgid "Hey, chief! Ready to do this thing?"
msgstr ""
"嗨​，​头儿​！​准备​好开​干​了​吗​？\n"
"hai1，tou2r5！zhun3bei4 hao3 kai1 gan4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey, chief... I didn't want to say this in front of Dietrich, but what you did there was cold. You didn't just kill her, you left her soul trapped in a jar.\n"
"\n"
"That was hardcore, $(l.name). As in, cold-blooded.\n"
"\n"
"Remind me not to piss you off."
msgstr ""
"头儿​……​我​不想​当着​迪​特里​希的面​这么​说​，​但​你​做​的​事情​太​冷酷​了​。​你​不仅​杀​了​她​，​还​把​她​的​灵魂​困在​了​方寸之间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​太狠​了​，​$(l.name)​。​或者说​，​冷血​无情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​小心​不要​招惹​到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5……wo3 bu4xiang3 dang1zhe5 Di2te4li3xi1 de5 mian4 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 ni3 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 tai4 leng3ku4 le5。ni3 bu4jin3 sha1 le5 ta1，hai2 ba3 ta1 de5 ling2hun2 kun4 zai4 le5 fang1 cun4 zhi1 jian1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai4 hen3 le5，$(l.name)。huo4 zhe3 shuo1，leng3xue4 wu2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 xiao3xin1 bu4yao4 zhao1re3 dao4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Hey, chief... I didn't want to say this in front of Glory, but what you did there was cold. You didn't just kill her, you left her soul trapped in a jar.\n"
"\n"
"That was hardcore, $(l.name). As in, cold-blooded.\n"
"\n"
"Remind me not to piss you off."
msgstr ""
"头儿​……​我​不想​当着​格洛丽​的​面​这么​说​，​但​你​做​的​事情​太​冷酷​了​。​你​不仅​杀​了​她​，​还​把​她​的​灵魂​困在​了​方寸之间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​太狠​了​，​$(l.name)​。​或者说​，​冷血​无情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​小心​不要​招惹​到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5……wo3 bu4xiang3 dang1zhe5 Ge2luo4li2 de5 mian4 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 ni3 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 tai4 leng3ku4 le5。ni3 bu4jin3 sha1 le5 ta1，hai2 ba3 ta1 de5 ling2hun2 kun4 zai4 le5 fang1 cun4 zhi1 jian1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai4 hen3 le5，$(l.name)。huo4 zhe3 shuo1，leng3xue4 wu2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 xiao3xin1 bu4yao4 zhao1re3 dao4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Hey, chief... I didn't want to say this in front of the others, but what you did there was cold. You didn't just kill her, you left her soul trapped in a jar.\n"
"\n"
"That was hardcore, $(l.name). As in, cold-blooded.\n"
"\n"
"Remind me not to piss you off."
msgstr ""
"头儿​……​我​不想​当着​别人​的​面​这么​说​，​但​你​做​的​事情​太​冷酷​了​。​你​不仅​杀​了​她​，​还​把​她​的​灵魂​困在​了​方寸之间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​太狠​了​，​$(l.name)​。​或者说​，​冷血​无情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​小心​不要​招惹​到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5……wo3 bu4xiang3 dang1zhe5 bie2ren5 de5 mian4 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 ni3 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 tai4 leng3ku4 le5。ni3 bu4jin3 sha1 le5 ta1，hai2 ba3 ta1 de5 ling2hun2 kun4 zai4 le5 fang1 cun4 zhi1 jian1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai4 hen3 le5，$(l.name)。huo4 zhe3 shuo1，leng3xue4 wu2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 xiao3xin1 bu4yao4 zhao1re3 dao4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Hey, chief...? I found something here that you might want to have a look at."
msgstr ""
"那个​，​头儿​……​？​我​这里​有​东西​，​你​也许​会想​看看​。\n"
"na4ge5，tou2r5……？wo3 zhe4li3 you3 dong1xi1，ni3 ye3xu3 hui4 xiang3 kan4kan5。"

msgid "Hey, chief? *Now* will you push that button?"
msgstr ""
"头儿​？​*​现在​*​你​能​按​下​那个​按钮​了​吗​？\n"
"tou2r5？*xian4zai4*ni3 neng2 an4 xia4 na4ge5 an4niu3 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Hey, hang on... it couldn't hurt to--"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​等​下​啊​……​这​也​没​坏处​—​—\n"
"wei2，deng3 xia4 a1……zhe4 ye3 mei2 huai4chu5 — —"

msgid "Hey, hold up a second."
msgstr ""
"喂​，​听​我​说​一句​。\n"
"wei2，ting1 wo3 shuo1 yi1ju4。"

msgid "Hey, if she wants her cram, she's gotta pay. Same as anybody else."
msgstr ""
"她​要是​想要​药​，​就​得​掏点​啥​。​跟​其他人​一样​。\n"
"ta1 yao4shi5 xiang3yao4 yao4，jiu4 de2 tao1 dian3 sha2。gen1 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"Hey, if you wanna do it that way, don't let me stop you. We could probably "
"even do it together - you tackle one door, and I'll take the other."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想​这么​做​的话​，​我​也​没​意见​。​我们​甚至​可以​合作​—​—​你​负责​一扇门​，​我来​搞定​另​一扇门​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5hua4，wo3 ye3 mei2 yi4jian4。wo3men5 shen4zhi4 ke3yi3 he2zuo4——ni3 fu4ze2 yi1 shan1 men2，wo3 lai2 gao3ding4 ling4 yi1 shan1 men2。"

msgid ""
"Hey, if you wanna try talking your way past 'em, be my guest. It's your "
"funeral."
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​既然​你​这么​想​找​他们​谈判​，​那​随​你​，​你​想​死​我​不​拦​你​。\n"
"hei1，ji4ran2 ni3 zhe4me5 xiang3 zhao3 ta1men5 tan2pan4，na4 sui2 ni3，ni3 xiang3 si3 wo3 bu4 lan2 ni3。"

msgid "Hey, if you want to die, that can be arranged..."
msgstr ""
"你​要是​愿意​寻死​的话​，​我​也​可以​安排​……\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 yuan4yi4 xun2si3 de5hua4，wo3 ye3 ke3yi3 an1pai2……"

msgid "Hey, is that a beer from... downstairs?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​那​是​……​楼下​的​啤酒​？\n"
"wei2，na4 shi4……lou2xia4 de5 pi2jiu3？"

msgid ""
"Hey, like I said, I'm all for it. And I don't want to get on *anyone* else's bad side - we're on enough of those already.\n"
"\n"
"So what are we still talkin' about this for? Let's do it, get paid, and get back home!"
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​，​我​完全​赞成​。​我​可​不想​*​再​*​得罪​什么​人​了​—​—​咱​已经​够​吃不开​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱​还​磨蹭​啥​？​赶紧​动手​，​拿​钱​走​人​回家​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，wo3 wan2quan2 zan4cheng2。wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3*zai4*de2zui4 shen2me5 ren2 le5——za2 yi3jing1 gou4 chi1bu5kai1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"za2 hai2 mo2ceng5 sha2？gan3jin3 dong4shou3，na2 qian2 zou3 ren2 hui2jia1！"

msgid ""
"Hey, man, you're the one who knows about this stuff. Can't you just answer "
"the question?"
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​你​不是​最​懂​这些​的​么​？​你​就​不能​直截了当​地​回答​吗​？\n"
"bai4tuo1，ni3 bu4shi4 zui4 dong3 zhe4xie1 de5 ma2？ni3 jiu4 bu4neng2 zhi2jie2liao3dang4 de5 hui2da2 ma5？"

msgid "Hey, no problem. It was a fun project."
msgstr ""
"小事​。​鼓捣​这个​还​挺好玩​的​。\n"
"xiao3shi4。gu3dao5 zhe4ge5 hai2 ting3 hao3 wan2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Hey, sounds great.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stuffs another handful of chips into his pocket, more forcefully this time.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And don't worry... I'll be gone by the time you're back from your next run."
msgstr ""
"太好了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​抓​了​一把​芯片​塞进​口袋​里​，​这次​动作​更加​用力​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​……​等​你​下次​差事​回来​的​时候​，​我​已经​离开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"tai4hao3le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 zhua1 le5 yi1 ba3 xin1pian4 se4 jin4 kou3dai4 li3，zhe4 ci4 dong4zuo4 geng4jia1 yong4li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1……deng3 ni3 xia4ci4 cha4shi4 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 yi3jing1 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Hey, sounds great. What do you want us to do?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz's tone is neutral... almost bored. But you catch the motion as he thumbs the safety off of his machine pistol.\n"
"\n"
"Ullrich doesn't seem to notice.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​啊​，​你​希望​我们​做​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​语气​平淡​……​几乎​显得​有些​无聊​。​但​你​瞥见​他​已经​拨开​了​冲锋​手枪​的​保险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​乌尔里​希​似乎​没有​注意​到​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 a1，ni3 xi1wang4 wo3men5 zuo4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 yu3qi4 ping2dan4……ji1hu1 xian3de5 you3xie1 wu2liao2。dan4 ni3 pie1jian4 ta1 yi3jing1 bo1kai1 le5 chong1feng1 shou3qiang1 de5 bao3xian3。\n"
"\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1 si4hu1 mei2you3 zhu4yi4 dao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Hey, thanks for the assist. Can't tell you how happy I am to leave this "
"place behind."
msgstr ""
"对​了​，​我要​感谢​你​的​帮助​。​终于​能​离开​这​地方​了​，​你​都​不​知道​我​有​多​高兴​。\n"
"dui4 le5，wo3 yao4 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。zhong1yu2 neng2 li2kai1 zhe4 di4fang1 le5，ni3 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 you3 duo1 gao1xing4。"

msgid "Hey, thanks! I'll do that!"
msgstr ""
"谢​了​！​我会​的​！\n"
"xie4 le5！wo3 hui4 de5！"

msgid ""
"Hey, thanks, Hasenkamp. Uh, yeah, you too.\n"
"\n"
"Now, you two ready to get out of there?"
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​哈森​坎普​。​你​也​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​俩​准备​好​离开​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5，Ha1sen1kan3pu3。ni3 ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 lia3 zhun3bei4 hao3 li2kai1 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey, thanks. They'll...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns the manual over in his hands, rubs his thumb over the careworn paper cover.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...they'll appreciate it. Here's the money I promised you."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​他们​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​手册​在​手里​翻来覆去​，​用​大拇指​摩挲​着​破旧​的​纸质​封面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​他们​会​感谢​你​的​。​这是​说好​的​报酬​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5。ta1men5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shou3ce4 zai4 shou3li3 fan1lai2fu4qu4，yong4 da4mu5zhi3 ma1sa5 zhao2 po4jiu4 de5 zhi3zhi4 feng1mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ta1men5 hui4 gan3xie4 ni3 de5。zhe4 shi4 shuo1hao3 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid "Hey, that sounds great. Take care, Phil!"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​那​听​起来​很棒​。​保重​，​菲尔​！\n"
"hei1，na4 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 bang4。bao3zhong4，fei1 er3！"

msgid ""
"Hey, that's *our* dumpster!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She spits out a wad of phlegm. It lands with a splat on the filthy asphalt.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Frag off, chumbnuts! Or on second thought, maybe we'll *frag* you off!"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​那​是​*​我们​的​*​垃圾箱​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​啐​出​一口​痰​液​，​落​在​肮脏​的​沥青​地上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哪儿​来​的​回​哪儿​去​，​蠢货​！​或者​干脆​让​我们​送​你们​回​*​老家​*​！\n"
"\n"
"wei2，na4 shi4*wo3men5 de5*la1ji1xiang1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cui4 chu1 yi1kou3 tan2 ye4，la4 zai4 ang1zang1 de5 li4qing1 di4shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na3r5 lai2 de5 hui2 na3r5 qu4，chun3huo4！huo4zhe3 gan1cui4 rang4 wo3men5 song4 ni3men5 hui2*lao3jia1*！"

msgid ""
"Hey, that's great, Zaak. Look, I've gotta go. Keep storing that energy!"
msgstr ""
"挺不错​啊​，​扎克​。​我​得​走​了​，​你​继续​好好​积蓄​能量​吧​！\n"
"ting3 bu4 cuo4 a1，Zha1ke4。wo3 de2 zou3 le5，ni3 ji4xu4 hao3hao3 ji1xu4 neng2liang4 ba1！"

msgid ""
"Hey, that's great. But time's a-ticking, so let's keep moving.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances at the jumble of wire and circuitry through the open access panel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"To hell with the cleanup, we'll be gone before anyone notices anything anyway."
msgstr ""
"挺​好​的​。​不过​我们​时间​不​多​，​所以​还是​继续前进​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​透过​敞开​的​检修​面板​，​瞥见​里面​乱成一团​的​电线​和​电路​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​管​什么​清理​，​等​有人​注意​到​的​时候​，​我们​早就​远走高飞​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ting3 hao3 de5。bu4guo4 wo3men5 shi2jian1 bu4 duo1，suo3yi3 hai2shi5 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tou4guo4 chang3kai1 de5 jian3xiu1 mian4ban3，pie1jian4 li3mian4 luan4cheng2yi1tuan2 de5 dian4xian4 he4 dian4lu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 guan3 shen2me5 qing1li3，deng3 you3ren2 zhu4yi4 dao4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 zao3jiu4 yuan3zou3gao1fei1 le5。"

msgid "Hey, this headware looks interesting. Mind if I take a look?"
msgstr ""
"这​款​头戴式​设备​有点​意思​。​我能​看看​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 kuan3 tou2 dai4 shi4 she4bei4 you3dian3 yi4si5。wo3 neng2 kan4kan5 ma5？"

msgid "Hey, wanna beer?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​要​喝啤酒​吗​？\n"
"wei2，yao4 he4 pi2 jiu3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey, what's done is done.\n"
"\n"
"You want my advice? You do what the Lodge says. I don't want to be on their bad side, and you shouldn't, either."
msgstr ""
"事已至此​就别​多​想​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​我​说​，​就照​结社​说​的​做​。​我​可​不想​得罪​他们​，​你​最好​也​别​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3 jiu4 bie4 duo1 xiang3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 wo3 shuo1，jiu4 zhao4 jie2she4 shuo1 de5 zuo4。wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 de2zui4 ta1men5，ni3 zui4hao3 ye3 bie4。"

msgid "Hey, whatever. As long as it keeps Phil happy."
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​随便​吧​。​只要​能​让​菲尔​开心​就行​。\n"
"hei1，sui2bian4 ba1。zhi3yao4 neng2 rang4 fei1 er3 kai1xin1 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid ""
"Hey, whoa, hold up. I don't *owe* any interest! Grinder didn't say anything about interest!\n"
"\n"
"If you're grabbing things out of safe deposit boxes, we want a cut."
msgstr ""
"喂喂​，​等​一下​，​我​可​没有​欠​什么​利息​！​“​绞肉机​”​没说​过​还有​什么​利息​啊​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​要​从​保险箱​里​捞​东西​的话​，​那​我们​也​要​分​走​一份​。\n"
"\n"
"wei2 wei2，deng3 yi1xia4，wo3 ke3 mei2you3 qian4 shen2me5 li4xi1！“jiao3rou4ji1” mei2 shuo1 guo4 hai2you3 shen2me5 li4xi1 a1！\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 cong2 bao3xian3xiang1 li3 lao1 dong1xi1 de5hua4，na4 wo3men5 ye3 yao4 fen4 zou3 yi1 fen4。"

msgid ""
"Hey.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The distinctive circuit-pattern tattoos that line her face shimmer and pulse with light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You need somethin'?"
msgstr ""
"嗨​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​脸上​独特​的​电路​图案​纹身​闪闪发光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​需要​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hai1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 du2te4 de5 dian4lu4 tu2an4 wen2shen1 shan3 shan3 fa1 guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hey. Chief. C'mon. I feel bad enough about this already, there's no need to "
"rub it in."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​别​这样​。​我​已经​很​难受​了​，​就别​继续​往​我​伤口​上​撒盐​了​。\n"
"lao3da4，bie4 zhe4yang4。wo3 yi3jing1 hen3 nan2shou4 le5，jiu4 bie4 ji4xu4 wang3 wo3 shang1kou3 shang4 sa1 yan2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Hey... yeah, you're right!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks up at you. The scowl has disappeared from her face, but she doesn't look happy, either.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look. I really appreciate the help, but I have to do this myself. I'm already *way* behind, and Corporate's gonna have my ass if I don't get it done before lunch."
msgstr ""
"嘿​……​是​啊​，​你​说得对​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​抬头​看向​你​。​现在​她​的​表情​没​那么​阴沉​了​，​但​也​说不上​开心​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​感谢​你​的​帮忙​，​但​我​必须​自己​完成​这个​。​我​的​进度​已经​*​严重​*​落后​了​，​要是​我​不​在​午饭​前​把​它​修好​，​公司​就要​修理​我​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hei1……shi4 a1，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。xian4zai4 ta1 de5 biao3qing2 mei2 na4me5 yin1chen2 le5，dan4 ye3 shuo1bu5shang4 kai1xin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 bang1mang2，dan4 wo3 bi4xu1 zi4ji3 wan2cheng2 zhe4ge5。wo3 de5 jin4du4 yi3jing1*yan2zhong4*luo4hou4 le5，yao4shi5 wo3 bu4 zai4 wu3fan4 qian2 ba3 ta1 xiu1hao3，gong1si1 jiu4yao4 xiu1li3 wo3 le5。"

msgid "Heyya, chief. That was a hell of a thing, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""
"嘿​呀​，​头儿​。​咱们​这​段​冒险​可够​传奇​的​啊​？\n"
"hei1 ya1，tou2r5。zan2men5 zhe4 duan4 mao4xian3 ke3 gou4 chuan2qi2 de5 a1？"

msgid ""
"Heyyy, all riiight!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The girl's hand snakes forward with alarming speed. In the blink of an eye, she snatches the cram inhaler from your hand.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"对​对​对​，​就要​这个​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​女孩​晃晃悠悠​地​伸出手​，​速度​却​快​得​惊人​。​一眨眼​的​工夫​，​她​就​把​“​超感​”​的​吸入​器​从​你​手里​抢走了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"dui4 dui4 dui4，jiu4yao4 zhe4ge5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3hai2 huang4huang5you1you1 de5 shen1 chu1 shou3，su4du4 que4 kuai4 de2 jing1ren2。yi1zha3yan3 de5 gong1fu1，ta1 jiu4 ba3“chao1 gan3” de5 xi1ru4 qi4 cong2 ni3 shou3li3 qiang3 zou3 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "He’s not a normal dog. Not by a long shot. Is he possessed?"
msgstr ""
"他​不是​条​普通​的​狗​。​远远​不是​。​他​这​是​被​附身​了​？\n"
"ta1 bu4shi4 tiao2 pu3tong1 de5 gou3。yuan3yuan3 bu4shi4。ta1 zhe4 shi4 bei4 fu4shen1 le5？"

msgid "He’s part hellhound. Monika trained him for months to be combat ready."
msgstr ""
"他​有​地狱​猎犬​的​血统​。​之前​莫妮卡​为了​让​他​做好​战斗准备​，​训练​了​他​好几个​月​呢​。\n"
"ta1 you3 di4yu4 lie4quan3 de5 xue4tong3。zhi1qian2 Mo4ni1ka3 wei4le5 rang4 ta1 zuo4 hao3 zhan4 dou3 zhun3 bei4，xun4lian4 le5 ta1 hao3 ji1 ge4 yue4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Hi there, stranger. I got a sale on today. You interested in some rations? "
"Salvage? Some home remedies? "
msgstr ""
"你好​，​陌生人​。​我​这边​今天​在​搞​促销​。​想买些​口粮​吗​？​回收​品​？​还是​家用​药物​？\n"
"ni3hao3，mo4sheng1ren2。wo3 zhe4bian1 jin1tian1 zai4 gao3 cu4xiao1。xiang3 mai3 xie1 kou3liang2 ma5？hui2shou1 pin3？hai2shi5 jia1yong4 yao4wu4？"

msgid "Hi, I'm Quorin."
msgstr ""
"你好​，​我​叫奎林​。\n"
"ni3hao3，wo3 jiao4 kui2 lin2。"

msgid "Hidden Panel Area"
msgstr ""
"隐藏​面板​区域\n"
"yin3cang2 mian4ban3 qu1yu4"

msgid "High-Grade Street Armor"
msgstr ""
"高级​街头​护甲\n"
"gao1ji2 jie1tou2 hu4jia3"

msgid "High-Pitched Man"
msgstr ""
"声音​高亢​的​男人\n"
"sheng1yin1 gao1kang4 de5 nan2ren2"

msgid ""
"High-energy flashbulbs hidden in a cybereye. Capable of temporarily blinding"
" an opponent."
msgstr ""
"内​置于​赛博​眼中​的​大功率​闪光灯​，​其​强光​足以​致盲​对手​。\n"
"nei4 zhi4yu2 sai4bo2 yan3zhong1 de5 dai4 gong1 shuai4 shan3guang1deng1，qi2 jiang4 guang1 zu2yi3 zhi4 mang2 dui4shou3。"

msgid "HighEx Round"
msgstr ""
"高​爆弹\n"
"gao1 bao4dan4"

msgid ""
"Highly-focused decker and crack-shot thanks to his steady supply of "
"\"Hyper\"."
msgstr ""
"得益于​他​稳定​的​“​高能​”​供应​，​他​是​一位​高度​专注​的​碟​客​和​神枪手​。\n"
"de2yi4yu2 ta1 wen3ding4 de5“gao1neng2” gong1ying4，ta1 shi4 yi1 wei4 gao1du4 zhuan1zhu4 de5 die2 ke4 he4 shen2qiang1shou3。"

msgid ""
"Highly-trained former Special Forces commando. Marksman with a sniper rifle."
msgstr ""
"训练有素​的​前​特种部队​突击队员​。​手持​狙击步枪​的​神射手​。\n"
"xun4 lian4 you3 su4 de5 qian2 te4zhong3bu4dui4 tu1ji1dui4yuan2。shou3 chi2 ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1 de5 shen2 she4 shou3。"

msgid "Hijack Commlink"
msgstr ""
"劫持​通讯​链\n"
"jie2chi2 tong1xun4 lian4"

msgid ""
"Hilarious? *Hilarious?*\n"
"\n"
"Screw you, chief. Seriously. I don't even know if I want to be on this team any more."
msgstr ""
"滑稽​？​*​滑稽​？​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​头儿​，​你​真是​个​混蛋​。​我​甚至​觉得​我​不​应该​再待​在​这个​团队​里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hua2ji1？*hua2ji1？*\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 hun2dan4。wo3 shen4zhi4 jue2de5 wo3 bu4 ying1gai1 zai4 dai1 zai4 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4 li3 le5。"

msgid "Hired Mage"
msgstr ""
"雇佣​法师\n"
"gu4yong1 fa3shi1"

msgid "Hired Runners"
msgstr ""
"雇佣​狂奔​者\n"
"gu4yong1 kuang2Ben1zhe3"

msgid "Hiring incomplete"
msgstr ""
"未​完成​雇佣\n"
"wei4 wan2cheng2 gu4yong1"

msgid "Hiring prerequisite {0} not fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"雇佣​前提条件​{​0​}​未​达成​。\n"
"gu4yong1 qian2ti2tiao2jian4 {0} wei4 da2cheng2。"

msgid ""
"His brother, Tuck, works for a smuggling operation based in Schattennest.\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, these smugglers have accepted a contract from Volker Stahl. Stahl is a vicious ideologue, and the leader of the Berlin chapter of Humanis."
msgstr ""
"他​的​兄弟​塔克​是​给​影巢​的​某个​走私​集团​做事​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​显然​，​这些​走私者​接受​了​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔​的​一份​合同​。​斯塔尔​是​个​邪恶​的​意识形态​主义者​，​也​是​人类​至上​主义者​柏林​分部​的​领导人​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 xiong1di4 ta3 ke4 shi4 gei3 ying3 chao2 de5 mou3 ge4 zou3si1 ji2tuan2 zuo4shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，zhe4xie1 zou3 si1 zhe3 jie1shou4 le5 Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3 de5 yi1 fen4 he2tong5。Si1ta3er3 shi4 ge4 xie2e4 de5 yi4shi2xing2tai4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3，ye3 shi4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 bo2lin2 fen1bu4 de5 ling3dao3ren2。"

msgid ""
"His ears stand back up, and you could swear that you see him smile.\n"
"\n"
"Dante takes his place by your side."
msgstr ""
"他​的​耳朵​重新​竖起​，​仿佛​对​你​露出​了​微笑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但丁​在​你​身边​站​好​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 er3duo5 chong2xin1 shu4qi3，fang3fu2 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 le5 wei1xiao4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 zai4 ni3 shen1bian1 zhan4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"His employers. Winternight. They must have implanted that thing in him."
msgstr ""
"他​的​雇主​。​“​冬夜​”​。​肯定​是​那​帮人​把​这​东西​植入​到​他​体内​的​。\n"
"ta1 de5 gu4zhu3。“dong1 ye4”。ken3ding4 shi4 na4 bang1 ren2 ba3 zhe4 dong1xi1 zhi2ru4 dao4 ta1 ti3nei4 de5。"

msgid ""
"His experiences fighting in the Euro Wars could make all the difference in a"
" conflict. (h)"
msgstr ""
"他​在​欧洲​战争​期间​的​战斗​经历​足以​在​某场​冲突​中​起到​至关重要​的​作用​。\n"
"ta1 zai4 ou1zhou1 zhan4zheng1 qi1jian1 de5 zhan4dou4 jing1li4 zu2yi3 zai4 mou3 chang2 chong1tu1 zhong4 qi3dao4 zhi4guan1zhong4yao4 de5 zuo4yong4。"

msgid ""
"His eyes sweep across the team as he takes it all in. The grim faces. The "
"hard stares. Eiger's fury. Monika's absence."
msgstr ""
"他​的​视线​扫​过​整个​小队​，​审视​着​情况​。​每个​人​都​脸色铁青​，​目光​沉重​。​艾格尔​满腔​怒火​，​莫妮卡​不见踪影​。\n"
"ta1 de5 shi4xian4 sao3 guo4 zheng3ge4 xiao3 dui4，shen3shi4 zhao2 qing2kuang4。mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 lian3 se4 tie3 qing1，mu4guang1 chen2zhong4。Ai4ge2er3 man3qiang1 nu4huo3，Mo4ni1ka3 bu4 jian4 zong1 ying3。"

msgid ""
"His fingers dance over the deck's keypad.\n"
"\n"
"A few minutes later, he glances up with a smile."
msgstr ""
"他​的​手指​在​碟​板​的​键盘​上​飞快​地​跳动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几分钟​后​，​他​抬起​头​，​脸上​带​着​微笑​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shou3zhi3 zai4 die2 ban3 de5 jian4pan2 shang4 fei1kuai4 de5 tiao4dong4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 fen4 zhong1 hou4，ta1 tai2qi3 tou2，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 wei1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"His hands are badly broken, too. You've seen these sorts of injuries after bare-knuckle fistfights, but never anything this severe.\n"
"\n"
"This man punched something hard, and went on punching until his hands were reduced to useless slabs of meat."
msgstr ""
"他​的​双手​也​伤得​很重​。​你​以前​见过​这种​类型​的​伤势​出现​在​徒手​拳击​之后​，​但​从未​到​如此​严重​的​程度​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​人​持续​击打​了​某个​坚硬​的​物体​，​直到​他​的​双手​变成​毫无用处​的​肉块​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 ye3 shang1 de2 hen3 chong2。ni3 yi3qian2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 lei4xing2 de5 shang1shi4 chu1xian4 zai4 tu2shou3 quan2ji1 zhi1hou4，dan4 cong2wei4 dao4 ru2ci3 yan2zhong4 de5 cheng2du4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 ren2 chi2xu4 ji1da3 le5 mou3 ge4 jian1ying4 de5 wu4ti3，zhi2dao4 ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 bian4cheng2 hao2 wu2 yong4 chu3 de5 rou4 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"His hands clasp in front of him in a sign of supplication.\n"
"\n"
"You can see the terror in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"他​将​双手​紧握​在​身前​以示​恳求​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​在​他​的​眼中​看见​恐惧​的​神色​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiang1 shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 zai4 shen1 qian2 yi3 shi4 ken3qiu2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 kan4jian4 kong3ju4 de5 shen2se4。"

msgid ""
"His hands twist into claws, and he raises them high. An instant later, they "
"are wreathed in an unnatural purple glow."
msgstr ""
"他​的​双手​扭曲​成​利爪​，​高高​举起​。​顷刻间​，​它们​便​笼罩着​诡异​的​紫色​光芒​。\n"
"ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 niu3qu1 cheng2 li4zhao3，gao1 gao1 ju3qi3。qing3ke4jian1，ta1men5 bian4 long2 zhao4 zhao2 gui3yi4 de5 zi3se4 guang1mang2。"

msgid ""
"His head snaps back as though it were mounted on a hinge, and he unceremoniously crumples to the floor.\n"
"\n"
"You'd guess that he's going to be out for a while."
msgstr ""
"他​的​头​就​像​装​在​铰链​上​一样​向​后仰​去​，​扑通​一下​倒​在​地上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​猜​他​会​昏迷​一段时间​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 tou2 jiu4 xiang4 zhuang1 zai4 jiao3lian4 shang4 yi1yang4 xiang4 hou4 yang3 qu4，pu1tong1 yi1xia4 dao3 zai4 di4shang5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cai1 ta1 hui4 hun1mi2 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"His mouth twists into a cruel smile. In a single, smooth motion, he pulls a knife from his belt and draws it along his own forearm. The blade leaves a stripe of bright red blood in its wake.\n"
"\n"
"Still smiling, he begins to chant."
msgstr ""
"他​的​嘴角​扭出​一道​残忍​的​笑容​。​他​从​腰带​上​抽出​一把​匕首​，​沿着​自己​的​前臂​行云流水​般划​去​。​刀刃​划过​之​处​，​留下​鲜红​的​血痕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​依然​微笑​着​，​开始​吟唱​咒语​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 niu3 chu1 yi1dao4 can2ren3 de5 xiao4rong2。ta1 cong2 yao1dai4 shang4 chou1chu1 yi1 ba3 bi3shou3，yan2zhe5 zi4ji3 de5 qian2bi4 xing2yun2liu2shui3 ban1 hua2 qu4。dao1ren4 hua2guo4 zhi1 chu3，liu2xia4 xian1hong2 de5 xie3 hen2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi1ran2 wei1xiao4 zhao2，kai1shi3 yin2chang4 zhou4yu3。"

msgid ""
"His name is Yuli Kozlov, but he's better known by his handle, \"the Engineer.\" \n"
"\n"
"He's a mercenary. Ex-Spetsnaz. One of the best in his field.\n"
"\n"
"I ran up against him in my KSK days."
msgstr ""
"他​叫​尤里​·​科兹洛夫​，​但​他​的​代号​“​工程师​”​要​更​响亮​些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​曾​是​苏联​特战​队员​，​现在​成​了​雇佣兵​，​是​一等一​的​高手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​在​KSK​的​时候​就​和​他​交​过手​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiao4 You2li3 · ke1 zi1 luo4 fu1，dan4 ta1 de5 dai4hao4“gong1cheng2shi1” yao4 geng1 xiang3liang4 xie1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ceng2 shi4 su1lian2 te4 zhan4 dui4yuan2，xian4zai4 cheng2 le5 gu4yong1bing1，shi4 yi1deng3yi1 de5 gao1shou3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 zai4 KSK de5 shi2hou5 jiu4 he4 ta1 jiao1 guo4 shou3。"

msgid "His name's Green Winters. Know him?"
msgstr ""
"他​名叫​格林​·​温特斯​。​你​认识​吗​？\n"
"ta1 ming2jiao4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。ni3 ren4shi5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"His pride was our undoing. He tripped and fell, and his soykaf spilled into a console in the Animal Testing Wing.\n"
"\n"
"There was a terrible snap of shorting circuits, coupled with the stench of ozone. All over the building, emergency lights flashed and alarms blared.\n"
"\n"
"The building went into quarantine mode."
msgstr ""
"他​的​自傲​毁​了​我们​。​他​绊​了​一下​，​摔倒​了​，​豆​咖洒​进​了​动物​实验​部​的​控制台​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随之而来​的​是​刺耳​的​电路​短路​声​，​伴随​着​浓烈​的​臭氧​味​。​整个​建筑​的​警报灯​开始​闪烁​，​警铃​大作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​建筑​进入​了​隔离​模式​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 zi4ao4 hui3 le5 wo3men5。ta1 ban4 le5 yi1xia4，shuai1dao3 le5，dou4 ka1 sa3 jin4 le5 dong4wu4 shi2yan4 bu4 de5 kong4zhi4tai2 li3。\n"
"\n"
"sui2 zhi1 er2 lai2 de5 shi4 ci4er3 de5 dian4lu4 duan3lu4 sheng1，ban4sui2 zhao2 nong2lie4 de5 chou4yang3 wei4。zheng3ge4 jian4zhu4 de5 jing3 bao4 deng1 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4，jing3ling2 da4zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"jian4zhu4 jin4ru4 le5 ge2li2 mo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"His specialties are social engineering and wetwork.\n"
"\n"
"In practice, he spends most of his time paving the way for organized crime syndicates to seize new territory."
msgstr ""
"他​的​专长​是​社会​工程学​和​湿​活儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​事实上​，​他​绝大部分​时间​都​在​为​犯罪集团​铺路​，​帮助​他们​夺取​地盘​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 zhuan1chang2 shi4 she4hui4 gong1cheng2xue2 he4 shi1 huo2r5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4shi2shang4，ta1 jue2da4bu4fen5 shi2jian1 dou1 zai4 wei2 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 pu1lu4，bang1zhu4 ta1men5 duo2qu3 di4pan2。"

msgid ""
"His uniform is intact and unbloodied. Unfortunately, there's no way that "
"it'll fit you."
msgstr ""
"他​的​制服​完好无损​，​也​没有​沾染​血迹​。​只​可惜​，​你​肯定​穿不下​这件​衣服​。\n"
"ta1 de5 zhi4fu2 wan2hao3wu2sun3，ye3 mei2you3 zhan1ran3 xue4ji4。zhi3 ke3xi1，ni3 ken3ding4 chuan1 bu4 xia4 zhe4 jian4 yi1fu5。"

msgid ""
"His voice cuts off. There is a long pause, punctuated by crackles of static "
"from your commlink."
msgstr ""
"他​的​声音​中断​了​。​很长​一段时间​里​，​你​的​通讯​链中​只​传来​噼啪​的​杂音​。\n"
"ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhong1duan4 le5。hen3 zhang3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3，ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 zhong4 zhi3 chuan2lai2 pi1pa1 de5 za2yin1。"

msgid "Hit Points"
msgstr ""
"生命​值\n"
"sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid ""
"Hm. That's an interesting suggestion.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The line goes quiet for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I might be able to work with that."
msgstr ""
"唔​。​这个​提议​挺​有意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​通讯​那头​沉默​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​这个​我​可以​接受​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2。zhe4ge5 ti2yi4 ting3 you3yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tong1xun4 na4 tou2 chen2mo4 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 zhe4ge5 wo3 ke3yi3 jie1shou4。"

msgid ""
"Hmm.\n"
"\n"
"What do you want, then?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​有​什么​事​？\n"
"\n"
"en1。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "Hmm. Let me reconsider."
msgstr ""
"唔​。​让​我​再​想想​。\n"
"wu2。rang4 wo3 zai4 xiang3 xiang3。"

msgid ""
"Hmmm. *Very* nice.\n"
"\n"
"The design appears to be simple enough. Yes, I should be able to provide you with this.\n"
"\n"
"It won't be cheap, though."
msgstr ""
"唔​。​*​非常​*​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​设计​似乎​很​简单​。​是​的​，​我​应该​可以​帮​你​安装​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​价格​可不​便宜​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2。*fei1chang2*hao3。\n"
"\n"
"she4ji4 si4hu1 hen3 jian3dan1。shi4 de5，wo3 ying1gai1 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 an1zhuang1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 jia4ge2 ke3bu5 bian4yi2。"

msgid "Hmmm... an activation bit. Time to go find a socket to plug it into."
msgstr ""
"唔​……​是​个​激活​模块​。​得​找个​插座​把​它​插进去​。\n"
"wu2……shi4 ge4 ji1huo2 mo2kuai4。de2 zhao3 ge4 cha1zuo4 ba3 ta1 cha1 jin4 qu4。"

msgid "Hoffmann."
msgstr ""
"霍夫曼​。\n"
"huo4fu1man4。"

msgid ""
"Hoi again, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Well, I've recovered one last DVD for you, but I'm afraid that's all you're gonna get. You might as well use the rest as coasters... they're all beyond repair."
msgstr ""
"还是​我​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​这样​，​我​又​给​你​修好​一张​DVD​，​但​恐怕​这是​最后​一张​了​。​剩下​的​你​干脆​当杯​垫​用​吧​……​已经​彻底​没法​修​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 wo3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4，wo3 you4 gei3 ni3 xiu1hao3 yi1 zhang1 DVD，dan4 kong3pa4 zhe4 shi4 zui4hou4 yi1 zhang1 le5。sheng4xia4 de5 ni3 gan1cui4 dang1 bei1 dian4 yong4 ba1……yi3jing1 che4di3 mei2fa3 xiu1 le5。"

msgid "Hoi gramps. Working on anything good?"
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​老爷子​，​你​在​鼓捣​啥​好​东西​呢​？\n"
"hei1，lao3ye2zi5，ni3 zai4 gu3dao5 sha2 hao3 dong1xi1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Hoi, $(l.name)! Just wanted to tell you that I've met with limited success "
"in working on that stack of DVDs... it's a thorny problem, but at least I'm "
"making *some* headway."
msgstr ""
"嗨​，​$(l.name)​！​我​就是​想​跟​你​说​一声​，​那堆​DVD​不好​弄​……​虽然​是​个​棘手​的​问题​，​但​我​还是​取得​了​*​一些​*​进展​。\n"
"hai1，$(l.name)！wo3 jiu4shi4 xiang3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 yi1sheng1，na4 dui1 DVD bu4hao3 long4……sui1ran2 shi4 ge4 ji2shou3 de5 wen4ti2，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 qu3de2 le5*yi1xie1*jin4zhan3。"

msgid ""
"Hoi, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Whatcha need?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wei2，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Hoi, $(l.name). What's shakin'?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​$(l.name)​。​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"wei2，$(l.name)。you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Hoi, Eiger. Been a long time.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He taps a thumb on the rim of his coffee cup.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Keeping busy?"
msgstr ""
"你好​，​艾格尔​。​好久不见​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​拇指​在​咖啡杯​的​边缘​摩挲​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​最近​挺忙​啊​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，Ai4ge2er3。hao3jiu3bu5jian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 mu3zhi3 zai4 ka1 fei1 bei1 de5 bian1yuan2 ma1sa5 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zui4jin4 ting3 mang2 a1？"

msgid ""
"Hoi, chief! Thanks again for the help with that little side-run... I really do appreciate it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He offers you a winning smile, but it falls almost immediately.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I, uh... I'm a happy guy. Really, I am."
msgstr ""
"哇​，​头儿​！​再次​感谢​你​帮​我​跑​这​一趟​……​我​真的​非常感谢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向​你​露出​一个​胜利​的​微笑​，​但​又​立刻​转瞬即逝​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​是​个​乐天派​。​真的​。\n"
"\n"
"wa1，tou2r5！zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3 bang1 wo3 pao2 zhe4 yi1 tang1……wo3 zhen1de5 fei1chang2gan3xie4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 sheng4li4 de5 wei1xiao4，dan4 you4 li4ke4 zhuan3shun4ji2shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 shi4 ge4 le4tian1pai4。zhen1de5。"

msgid "Hold"
msgstr ""
"停止\n"
"ting2zhi3"

msgid ""
"Hold a moment. I'm transferring your payment now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Alice's attention is fixed on the PDA mounted to her wrist. A moment passes, then she nods, lowers her arm, and shifts her gaze to you. Her smile looks forced, and her eyes keep darting back to the clock on the wall.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Everything seems to be in order. Good."
msgstr ""
"等​下​。​我​在​处理​你​的​付款​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​爱丽丝​的​目光​紧盯​着​手腕​上​的​PDA​。​片刻​后​，​她​微微​点头​，​垂​下​手臂​，​将​视线​转向​你​。​她​的​笑容​显得​勉强​，​目光​不时​瞟向​墙上​的​时钟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​一切正常​。​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 xia4。wo3 zai4 chu3li3 ni3 de5 fu4kuan3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai4li4si1 de5 mu4guang1 jin3ding1 zhao2 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 PDA。pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 wei1wei1 dian3tou2，chui2 xia4 shou3bi4，jiang1 shi4xian4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 xian3de5 mian3qiang3，mu4guang1 bu4shi2 piao3 xiang4 qiang2 shang4 de5 shi2zhong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 yi1 qie1 zheng1 chang2。hen3 hao3。"

msgid "Hold for a second, Blitz. We aren't in position yet."
msgstr ""
"等​一下​，​布里​茨​。​我们​还​没​就位​。\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，Bu4li3ci2。wo3men5 hai2 mei2 jiu4 wei4。"

msgid "Hold on, Monika… who's in charge while you're jacked in?"
msgstr ""
"先​等​一下​，​莫妮卡​……​你​接入​的​时候​谁来管​事​？\n"
"xian1 deng3 yi1xia4，Mo4ni1ka3……ni3 jie1ru4 de5 shi2hou5 shei2 lai2 guan3 shi4？"

msgid "Hold on, everybody... we can still talk this out..."
msgstr ""
"等​下​，​各位​……​我们​不能​再​沟通​下​吗​……\n"
"deng3 xia4，ge4wei4……wo3men5 bu4neng2 zai4 gou1tong1 xia4 ma5……"

msgid "Hold on. What, exactly, are you going to do to Berlin?"
msgstr ""
"等等​。​你​究竟​要​对​柏林​做​什么​？\n"
"deng3deng3。ni3 jiu1jing4 yao4 dui4 bo2lin2 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Hold up, Eiger--"
msgstr ""
"等等​，​艾格尔​—​—\n"
"deng3deng3，Ai4ge2er3 — —"

msgid "Hold up. Where’s Monika?"
msgstr ""
"等等​。​莫妮卡​人​呢​？\n"
"deng3deng3。Mo4ni1ka3 ren2 ni2？"

msgid "Hold up. Who are \"they\"?"
msgstr ""
"等等​，​“​他们​”​是​谁​？\n"
"deng3deng3，“ta1men5” shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Hold up. Who are you?"
msgstr ""
"等等​，​你​是​谁​？\n"
"deng3deng3，ni3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Hold your fire, I'm leaving!"
msgstr ""
"别​开火​，​我​这​就​走​！\n"
"bie4 kai1huo3，wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3！"

msgid "Hold your horses, Blitz. We don't know enough about it yet."
msgstr ""
"你​最好​悠着点​，​布里​茨​。​我们​还​不​知道​这​东西​怎么回事​呢​。\n"
"ni3 zui4hao3 you1 zhao2 dian3，Bu4li3ci2。wo3men5 hai2 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 dong1xi1 zen3me5hui2shi4 ni2。"

msgid "Holding Cell Controls"
msgstr ""
"拘留​室​控制\n"
"ju1liu2 shi4 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Holding Position"
msgstr ""
"留在​原位\n"
"liu2 zai4 yuan2wei4"

msgid ""
"Holding the drone steady with one hand, you shatter the flimsy plastic that protects its cargo with the other.\n"
"\n"
"The reaction is swift and violent. Within a fraction of a second, the air is filled with a loud hissing sound, and the drone erupts in flame. A growing hole in its undercarriage begins spitting out a hail of white-hot sparks."
msgstr ""
"你​用​一只​手​稳稳​握住​无人机​，​然后​用​另一只​手​猛地​砸碎​保护​货舱​的​塑料​薄壳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​反制​措施​迅速​而​猛烈​。​不到​一秒钟​，​空气​中便​充斥​着​刺耳​的​嘶嘶声​，​无人机​瞬间​被​火焰​吞噬​。​其​底盘​上​不断扩大​的​孔洞​开始​喷射出​密集​的​炽热​火花​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong4 yi1 zhi3 shou3 wen3 wen3 wo4zhu4 wu2ren2ji1，ran2hou4 yong4 ling4 yi1 zhi3 shou3 meng3de5 za2sui4 bao3hu4 huo4cang1 de5 su4liao4 bao2 ke2。\n"
"\n"
"fan3zhi4 cuo4shi1 xun4su4 er2 meng3lie4。bu4dao4 yi1 miao3 zhong1，kong1qi4 zhong4 bian4 chong1chi4 zhao2 ci4er3 de5 si1si1sheng1，wu2ren2ji1 shun4jian1 bei4 huo3yan4 tun1shi4。qi2 di3pan2 shang4 bu4 duan4 kuo4 dai4 de5 kong3dong4 kai1shi3 pen1 she4 chu1 mi4ji2 de5 chi4re4 huo3hua1。"

msgid ""
"Holy shit, this is big.\n"
"\n"
"All right. Okay. Back up, slow down. Breathe."
msgstr ""
"好家伙​，​这​真是​个​大​新闻​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​深呼吸​，​从头开始​慢慢说​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3jia1huo5，zhe4 zhen1shi5 ge4 dai4 xin1wen2。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，shen1 hu1 xi1，cong2 tou2 kai1 shi3 man4 man4 shuo1。"

msgid "Holy shit."
msgstr ""
"好家伙​。\n"
"hao3jia1huo5。"

msgid ""
"Holy shit. I just stumbled onto some of Adrian's old lab notes.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not gonna say how I came across these... someone might get hurt if the wrong people watch this.\n"
"\n"
"But I've checked 'em against some of Adrian's old handwriting samples, and they're legitimate!"
msgstr ""
"好家伙​，​我​偶然​发现​了​一些​阿德里安​的​旧​实验​笔记​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​说​我​是​怎么​发现​这些​的​……​如果​被​坏人​看到​，​可能​会​有人​受伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​对照​了​阿德里安​以前​的​笔迹​样本​，​这​确实​是​如假包换​的​真迹​！\n"
"\n"
"hao3jia1huo5，wo3 ou3ran2 fa1xian4 le5 yi1xie1 E1de2li3an1 de5 jiu4 shi2yan4 bi3ji4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 shuo1 wo3 shi4 zen3me5 fa1xian4 zhe4xie1 de5……ru2guo3 bei4 huai4ren2 kan4dao4，ke3neng2 hui4 you3ren2 shou4shang1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 dui4zhao4 le5 E1de2li3an1 yi3qian2 de5 bi3ji4 yang4ben3，zhe4 que4shi2 shi4 ru2jia3bao1huan4 de5 zhen1ji4！"

msgid ""
"Home is where the heart is. But I lost my heart.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She places one hand over her frail chest, patting it twice.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"心在​哪里​，​家​就​在​哪里​。​但​我​失去​了​我​的​心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​将​一只​手​放在​自己​虚弱​的​胸口​，​拍​了​两下​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xin1 zai4 na3li3，jia1 jiu4 zai4 na3li3。dan4 wo3 shi1qu4 le5 wo3 de5 xin1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 yi1 zhi3 shou3 fang4 zai4 zi4ji3 xu1ruo4 de5 xiong1kou3，pai1 le5 liang3xia4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Home."
msgstr ""
"家园​。\n"
"jia1yuan2。"

msgid "Homemade Simsense Chip"
msgstr ""
"自制​拟感​芯片\n"
"zi4zhi4 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4"

msgid ""
"Honestly, Doc, I don't know. You say that all of this adds up to something, "
"but I'll be damned if I know what it is."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​博士​，​我​不​知道​。​你​说​这​一切​合​起来​代表​着​某些​事​，​可​我​压根​搞不懂​你​是​什么​意思​。\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，bo2shi4，wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。ni3 shuo1 zhe4 yi1qie4 ge3 qi3lai5 dai4biao3 zhao2 mou3xie1 shi4，ke3 wo3 ya4gen1 gao3bu5dong3 ni3 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5。"

msgid "Honestly, boss... I don't think that I believe either of 'em."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​老大​……​我​不​相信​他们​任何​一个​人​。\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，lao3da4……wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ta1men5 ren4he2 yi1ge5 ren2。"

msgid "Honestly, chief... I don't think that I believe either of 'em."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​头儿​……​我​不​相信​他们​任何​一个​人​。\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，tou2r5……wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ta1men5 ren4he2 yi1ge5 ren2。"

msgid "Honestly? I had a pretty good idea, yeah."
msgstr ""
"说实话​吗​？​我​对此​相当​肯定​，​嗯​。\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4 ma5？wo3 dui4 ci3 xiang1dang1 ken3ding4，en1。"

msgid "Honestly? I'm done with this."
msgstr ""
"说实话​吗​？​那​就​不聊​了​吧​。\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4 ma5？na4 jiu4 bu4 liao2 le5 ba1。"

msgid "Honestly? I'm not sure."
msgstr ""
"真的​吗​？​我​不​太​确定​。\n"
"zhen1de5 ma5？wo3 bu4 tai4 que4ding4。"

msgid "Honestly? It wouldn't matter to me either way."
msgstr ""
"老实​说​？​我​都​无所谓​。\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1？wo3 dou1 wu2suo3wei4。"

msgid ""
"Honestly? Workin' the stage was gettin' *boring,* boss.\n"
"\n"
"Spittin' and screamin' at the world was fine 'n' good when I was a kid, but it just didn't do it for me anymore."
msgstr ""
"实话实说​吗​？​老大​，​舞台​生活​已经​让​我​感觉​*​无聊​*​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​台前​又​唱​又​跳​什么​的​，​或许​年轻​时候​让​我​感觉​挺​好​，​但​现在​已经​没多大​意思​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi2hua4shi2shuo1 ma5？lao3da4，wu3tai2 sheng1huo2 yi3jing1 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2*wu2liao2*le5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 tai2qian2 you4 chang4 you4 tiao4 shen2me5 de5，huo4xu3 nian2qing1 shi2hou5 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2 ting3 hao3，dan4 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 mei2 duo1 dai4 yi4si5 le5。"

msgid "Horns"
msgstr ""
"犄角\n"
"ji1jiao3"

msgid "Host"
msgstr ""
"主机\n"
"zhu3ji1"

msgid ""
"Hostile target will take 25 additional DMG from incoming attacks for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌方​目标​在​接下来​的​3​个​回合​内​受到​的​攻击​将​额外​增加​25​点​伤害​。\n"
"di2fang1 mu4biao1 zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 3 ge4 hui2he2 nei4 shou4dao4 de5 gong1ji1 jiang1 e2wai4 zeng1jia1 25 dian3 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"Hostile target will take 50 additional DMG from incoming attacks for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌方​目标​在​接下来​的​3​个​回合​内​受到​的​攻击​将​额外​增加​50​点​伤害​。\n"
"di2fang1 mu4biao1 zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 3 ge4 hui2he2 nei4 shou4dao4 de5 gong1ji1 jiang1 e2wai4 zeng1jia1 50 dian3 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"Hostile target will take 75 additional DMG from incoming attacks for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌方​目标​在​接下来​的​3​个​回合​内​受到​的​攻击​将​额外​增加​75​点​伤害​。\n"
"di2fang1 mu4biao1 zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 3 ge4 hui2he2 nei4 shou4dao4 de5 gong1ji1 jiang1 e2wai4 zeng1jia1 75 dian3 shang1hai4。"

msgid "Hostiles! Engage!"
msgstr ""
"有​敌人​！​开始​交火​！\n"
"you3 di2ren2！kai1shi3 jiao1huo3！"

msgid "Hotel Administration Terminal"
msgstr ""
"旅馆​管理​终端\n"
"lu:3guan3 guan3li3 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Hotel Elevator Key"
msgstr ""
"旅馆​电梯​钥匙\n"
"lu:3guan3 dian4ti1 yao4shi5"

msgid ""
"Hotel's closed.\n"
"\n"
"We're, uh... fumigatin' up there. Y'know, for bugs."
msgstr ""
"旅馆​关门​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​上边​，​呃​……​在​消毒​呢​。​你​懂​的​，​得​杀​杀​虫子​嘛​。\n"
"\n"
"lu:3guan3 guan1men2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shang4bian5，e4……zai4 xiao1du2 ni2。ni3 dong3 de5，de2 sha1 sha1 chong2zi5 ma5。"

msgid ""
"Hotel's under new management, beautiful. You don't HAVE a room any more.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever was up there, you might as well forget about it."
msgstr ""
"旅馆​换​老板​了​，​美女​。​你​已经​没​房间​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​楼上​有​什么​东西​，​你​最好​都​当​它​没​了​。\n"
"\n"
"lu:3guan3 huan4 lao3ban3 le5，mei3nu:3。ni3 yi3jing1 mei2 fang2jian1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 lou2shang4 you3 shen2me5 dong1xi1，ni3 zui4hao3 dou1 dang1 ta1 mei2 le5。"

msgid "Hotshot decker, full-time smartass."
msgstr ""
"王牌​碟客​，​专职​自作聪明​。\n"
"wang2pai2 die2 ke4，zhuan1zhi2 zi4zuo4cong1ming2。"

msgid "Hotshot decker, part-time rigger, and full-time smartass."
msgstr ""
"王牌​碟客​，​兼职​机师​，​专职​自作聪明​。\n"
"wang2pai2 die2 ke4，jian1zhi2 ji1shi1，zhuan1zhi2 zi4zuo4cong1ming2。"

msgid ""
"Hovering silently, the drones sweep their optical sensors over your stolen ID badge.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, a synthesized voice chirps out of the nearest drone's speaker grille."
msgstr ""
"无人机​静静地​悬停​在​空中​，​用​光学​传感器​扫过​你​偷来​的​身份​徽章​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​最近​的​无人机​扬声器​中​传出​一道​合成​音​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 jing4 jing4 de5 xuan2ting2 zai4 kong1zhong1，yong4 guang1xue2 chuan2gan3qi4 sao3 guo4 ni3 tou1 lai2 de5 shen1fen4 hui1zhang1。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，zui4jin4 de5 wu2ren2ji1 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2chu1 yi1dao4 he2cheng2 yin1。"

msgid "How 'bout you drop your enormous gun and step over here instead?"
msgstr ""
"我​看​不如​你​把​大枪​撂下​，​走​到​这边​来​？\n"
"wo3 kan4 bu4ru2 ni3 ba3 dai4 qiang1 liao4 xia4，zou3 dao4 zhe4bian1 lai2？"

msgid "How about a little something for the effort?"
msgstr ""
"能​给​点​酬劳​吗​？\n"
"neng2 gei3 dian3 chou2lao2 ma5？"

msgid "How about the Night of Rage?"
msgstr ""
"“​愤怒​之夜​”​的​事​呢​？\n"
"“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” de5 shi4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"How about you? Are *you* ready, $(l.name)?\n"
"\n"
"You're going to see some terrible things in this place. Feuerstelle exists to prey on the young, and we're going to have to come face to face with that."
msgstr ""
"你​呢​？​*​你​*​准备​好了吗​，​$(l.name)​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​将​在​这里​目睹​可怕​的​景象​。​“​火坑​”​就是​以​年轻人​为​猎物​而​存在​的​，​而​我们​必须​直面​这个​残酷​现实​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ni2？*ni3*zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5，$(l.name)？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 zai4 zhe4li3 mu4du3 ke3pa4 de5 jing3xiang4。“huo3keng1” jiu4shi4 yi3 nian2qing1ren2 wei2 lie4wu4 er2 cun2zai4 de5，er2 wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhi2mian4 zhe4ge5 can2ku4 xian4shi2。"

msgid "How are people handling the loss of Monika?"
msgstr ""
"人们​对于​失去​莫妮卡​的​事情​有​什么​看法​？\n"
"ren2men5 dui4yu2 shi1qu4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4qing5 you3 shen2me5 kan4fa3？"

msgid "How are things going between you and Marta?"
msgstr ""
"你​和​玛​尔塔​之间​怎么样​了​？\n"
"ni3 he4 Ma3er3ta3 zhi1jian1 zen3me5yang4 le5？"

msgid ""
"How are you going to get Feuerschwinge to go along with this plan of yours?"
msgstr ""
"你​要​怎么​让​火翼​配合​你​的​这项​计划​？\n"
"ni3 yao4 zen3me5 rang4 Huo3yi4 pei4he2 ni3 de5 zhe4 xiang4 ji4hua4？"

msgid "How could I say no?"
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​可能​拒绝​呢​？\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 ke3neng2 ju4jue2 ni2？"

msgid "How could that happen?"
msgstr ""
"怎么​会​有​这种​事​？\n"
"zen3me5 hui4 you3 zhe4zhong3 shi4？"

msgid ""
"How couldn't I run? \n"
"\n"
"You stop having dreams, in a place like that. "
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​能​不​逃​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​那种​地方​，​梦想​都​会​被​消磨​掉​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 neng2 bu4 tao2 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4zhong3 di4fang1，meng4xiang3 dou1 hui4 bei4 xiao1mo2 diao4 de5。"

msgid "How crazy are we talking, here?"
msgstr ""
"具体​荒谬​到​什么​程度​？\n"
"ju4ti3 huang1miu4 dao4 shen2me5 cheng2du4？"

msgid "How dare you--"
msgstr ""
"你​居然​敢​—​—\n"
"ni3 ju1ran2 gan3 — —"

msgid "How did I let you talk me into coming back to this hellhole?"
msgstr ""
"我​是​怎么​让​你​说服​我​回到​这个​鬼​地方​的​？\n"
"wo3 shi4 zen3me5 rang4 ni3 shuo1fu2 wo3 hui2dao4 zhe4ge5 gui3 di4fang1 de5？"

msgid "How did Meat Grinder even know that I would be here?"
msgstr ""
"“​绞肉机​”​怎么​知道​我会​在​这里​？\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” zen3me5 zhi1dao4 wo3 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3？"

msgid "How did this happen?"
msgstr ""
"到底​是​怎么​一​回事​？\n"
"dao4di3 shi4 zen3me5 yi1 hui2shi4？"

msgid "How did you go from fronting a band to running the shadows?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​怎么​从​乐队​主唱​变成​一个​狂奔​者​的​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 zen3me5 cong2 yue4dui4 zhu3chang4 bian4cheng2 yi1ge5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 de5？"

msgid "How did you know about the dragon? "
msgstr ""
"你们​怎么​知道​关于​巨龙​的​事​？\n"
"ni3men5 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 guan1yu2 ju4long2 de5 shi4？"

msgid "How did you make it through the attack?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​撑过​袭击​的​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 cheng1 guo4 xi2ji1 de5？"

msgid "How do I free you? I don't see an instrument panel for this cell."
msgstr ""
"我要​怎么​救​你​？​我​没​看到​这​牢房​有​控制面板​什么​的​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 zen3me5 jiu4 ni3？wo3 mei2 kan4dao4 zhe4 lao2fang2 you3 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 shen2me5 de5。"

msgid "How do I get into the elevator?"
msgstr ""
"我该​怎么​进入​电梯​？\n"
"wo3 gai1 zen3me5 jin4ru4 dian4ti1？"

msgid "How do I get out of this room, Feuerschwinge?"
msgstr ""
"我要​怎么​离开​这里​，​火翼​？\n"
"wo3 yao4 zen3me5 li2kai1 zhe4li3，Huo3yi4？"

msgid "How do I get to Gesundbrunnen?"
msgstr ""
"我要​怎么​去​健康​泉​？\n"
"wo3 yao4 zen3me5 qu4 jian4kang1 quan2？"

msgid "How do I get up there?"
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​上去​？\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 shang4qu4？"

msgid "How do I get up to the next floor?"
msgstr ""
"我该​怎么​上楼​？\n"
"wo3 gai1 zen3me5 shang4lou2？"

msgid "How do I know you won’t hurt anyone else?"
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​知道​你​不会​再​伤害​别人​？\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 ni3 bu4hui4 zai4 shang1hai4 bie2ren5？"

msgid "How do I know you’ll keep your promise?"
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​知道​你​会​不会​遵守​诺言​？\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 ni3 hui4 bu4hui4 zun1shou3 nuo4yan2？"

msgid "How do we find this guy?"
msgstr ""
"我们​怎么​找到​这​家伙​？\n"
"wo3men5 zen3me5 zhao3dao4 zhe4 jia1huo5？"

msgid "How do we get through?"
msgstr ""
"我们​要​如何​通过​？\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 ru2he2 tong1guo4？"

msgid "How do we know that this isn’t a huge waste of time?"
msgstr ""
"我们​怎么​知道​这​不是​在​浪费时间​？\n"
"wo3men5 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 zhe4 bu4shi4 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1？"

msgid "How do we know that you'll keep your word?"
msgstr ""
"我们​怎么​知道​你​会​信守​承诺​？\n"
"wo3men5 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 ni3 hui4 xin4shou3 cheng2nuo4？"

msgid "How do you feel about Monika's death?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​莫妮卡​的​死​作何​感想​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 zuo4 he2 gan3xiang3？"

msgid "How do you know all of this?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​会​知道​这些​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 hui4 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1？"

msgid "How do you know she's still alive?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​知道​她​还​活着​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 ta1 hai2 huo2zhe5？"

msgid "How do you know that they're acolytes?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​知道​他们​是​侍​祭​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 shi4 shi4 ji4？"

msgid ""
"How do you know that they're acolytes? I can't make out what they're saying."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​知道​他们​是​侍​祭​？​我​都​听不清​他们​在​说​什么​。\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 shi4 shi4 ji4？wo3 dou1 ting1 bu4 qing1 ta1men5 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。"

msgid "How do you know that?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​怎么​知道​的​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 de5？"

msgid "How do you know their names?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​知道​他们​的​名字​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 de5 ming2zi5？"

msgid "How do you like the guys that run this place?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​管​这个​店​的​人​怎么样​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 guan3 zhe4ge5 dian4 de5 ren2 zen3me5yang4？"

msgid "How do you mean?"
msgstr ""
"你​这​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid "How do you want to go about tracking him?"
msgstr ""
"你​想​怎么​追查​他​的​下落​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3 zen3me5 zhui1cha2 ta1 de5 xia4luo4？"

msgid "How does Parson figure into all of this?"
msgstr ""
"帕森​在​这​一切​中​扮演​了​什么​角色​？\n"
"pa4 sen1 zai4 zhe4 yi1qie4 zhong4 ban4yan3 le5 shen2me5 jue2se4？"

msgid ""
"How expensive are we talking, here? Even if you had a raging cram habit, I'd"
" think that you'd have at least *some* money left..."
msgstr ""
