"​\n"
"​我敢​打赌​，​你​已经​记不清​了​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，duo1shao3 ren2 yin1wei4 ni3 cheng2 le5 shi1ti3？tong1guo4 huang3yan2 he4 bei4pan4，ni3 mai2zang4 le5 duo1shao3 peng2you5？\n"
