"​你​数得​过来​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我敢​打赌​，​你​已经​记不清​了​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，duo1shao3 ren2 yin1wei4 ni3 cheng2 le5 shi1ti3？wei4le5 zhuan4qian2，ni3 rang4 duo1shao3 hai2zi5 cheng2 le5 gu1er2？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shu3 de2 guo4lai2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 da3du3，ni3 yi3jing1 ji4 bu4 qing1 le5。"

