"wo3 dao4di3 hai2 yao4 jing1li4 duo1shao3 ci4 zhe4zhong3 shi4？zheng1 dai4 yan3 jing1 qiao2 qiao2，huo3ji5。wo3 shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"How many times have I told you? You can’t trust anything that comes out of a dragon’s mouth.\n"
"\n"
"That trid-trash will rot your brain. "
