"真惨​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停下​思考​了​一会儿​，​然后​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​我​而言​，​他​想​住​多久​就​住​多久​。​租期​到​2061​年​，​那栋​楼​对​我​也​没​任何​用处​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 can3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2xia4 si1kao3 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3 er2yan2，ta1 xiang3 zhu4 duo1jiu3 jiu4 zhu4 duo1jiu3。zu1 qi1 dao4 2061 nian2，na4 dong4 lou2 dui4 wo3 ye3 mei2 ren4he2 yong4chu5。"

