msgstr ""
"对​你​是​挺​好​的​。​而​这​一切​的​代价​就是​莫妮卡​的​性命​。\n"
"dui4 ni3 shi4 ting3 hao3 de5。er2 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 dai4jia4 jiu4shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 xing4ming4。"

msgid "How'd that whole \"Emilie\" situation work out? Turn up anything new?"
