"你​怎么​知道​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4？"

msgid "How'd you make it out?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​出来​的​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 chu1lai2 de5？"

msgid "How're you doing, Glory?"
msgstr ""
"最近​如何​，​格洛丽​？\n"
"zui4jin4 ru2he2，Ge2luo4li2？"

msgid ""
"How're you holding up? You seemed to take Monika's death harder than the "
"others did."
msgstr ""
"你​还好​吧​？​感觉​莫妮卡​的​死​对​你​打击​最大​。\n"
"ni3 hai2hao3 ba1？gan3jue2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 dui4 ni3 da3ji1 zui4 dai4。"

msgid "How's Alexander holding up?"
msgstr ""
"亚历山大​还好​吧​？\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4 hai2hao3 ba1？"

