msgstr ""
"艾米莉​的​事情​如何​了​？​搜索​有没有​什么​进展​？\n"
"ai4 mi3 li4 de5 shi4qing5 ru2he2 le5？sou1suo3 you3mei2you3 shen2me5 jin4zhan3？"

msgid ""
"However sure you are that your Panacea works, you can't risk releasing it, "
"Vauclair. There's too much at stake."
