"老​夫妇​彼此​相拥​，​此刻​看起来​比​你​初见​时​更显​苍老​衰弱​。​待​消息​传开​，​今夜​哀悼​的​绝​不止​他们​二人​。\n"
"lao3 fu1fu4 bi3ci3 xiang1yong1，ci3ke4 kan4qi3lai5 bi3 ni3 chu1 jian4 shi2 geng1 xian3 cang1lao3 shuai1ruo4。dai1 xiao1xi5 chuan2kai1，jin1ye4 ai1dao4 de5 jue2 bu4zhi3 ta1men5 er4 ren2。"

msgid "Huh. Good to know, I guess. I think I’ll be on my way."
