"嗯​，​挺​好​的​。​我​就​先​走​了​。\n"
"en1，ting3 hao3 de5。wo3 jiu4 xian1 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Huh. I guess that we're kind of responsible for that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That... uh... that doesn't feel very good, chief."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​我​猜​我们​多少​要​为此​负责​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​咽​了​口​唾沫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​……​呃​……​感觉​不太好​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。wo3 cai1 wo3men5 duo1shao3 yao4 wei4ci3 fu4ze2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 yan1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4……e4……gan3jue2 bu4tai4hao3，tou2r5。"

msgid "Huh. Never heard of it."
