"啧​。​从来​没听说过​。\n"
"ze2。cong2lai2 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4。"

msgid ""
"Huh. The control system looks interesting... like a drone control interface, but it's wired into the base of the skull.\n"
"\n"
"From the positioning, I'd say that it's connected directly to the thing's brain stem."
