"​\n"
"​从​位置​判断​，​我​猜​它​直接​连​着​那​玩意儿​的​脑干​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2。zhe4ge5 kong4 zhi4 xi4 tong3 kan4qi3lai5 you3dian3 yi4si5……xiang4 shi4 wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4 jie4mian4，dan4 zhi2jie1 he4 lu2di3 xiang1lian2。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 wei4zhi5 pan4duan4，wo3 cai1 ta1 zhi2jie1 lian2 zhao2 na4 wan2yi4r5 de5 nao3gan4。"

msgid ""
"Huh. Well, it took you long enough, chief.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz turns the box over and over in his hands, frowning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, I guess. Let's plug this puppy in and see what it does."
