"呵​。​你​总算​想​起来​给​我​了​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​在​手中​来回​把玩​着​匣子​，​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​让​我​立刻​接上​这个​小家伙​，​看看​它​有​什么​本事​。\n"
"\n"
"he1。ni3 zong3suan4 xiang3 qi3lai5 gei3 wo3 le5，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zai4 shou3 zhong4 lai2hui2 ba3wan2 zhao2 xia2zi5，zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，rang4 wo3 li4ke4 jie1shang4 zhe4ge5 xiao3 jia1 huo3，kan4kan5 ta1 you3 shen2me5 ben3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Huh. Well, this is weird.\n"
"\n"
"The data hard-coded onto this thing is jam-packed with commlink software. It looks like it has protocols for all of the major brands... sysadmin-level tools, too. And there's something else..."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这​就​怪​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​东西​的​硬​编码数据​中​塞满​了​通讯​链​软件​。​看起来​它​支持​所有​主要​品牌​的​协议​……​以及​系统管理员​级别​的​工具​。​还有​一件​事​……\n"
"\n"
"en1，zhe4 jiu4 guai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 de5 ying4 bian1 ma3 shu3 ju4 zhong4 sai1man3 le5 tong1xun4 lian4 ruan3jian4。kan4qi3lai5 ta1 zhi1chi2 suo3you3 zhu3yao4 pin3pai2 de5 xie2yi4……yi3ji2 xi4 tong3 guan3 li3 yuan2 ji2bie2 de5 gong1ju4。hai2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4……"

msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""
"哈​？\n"
"ha1？"

