msgid "Humanis Door Panel"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​大门​面板\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 da4men2 mian4ban3"

msgid "Humanis Forever"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义​永存\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3yi4 yong3cun2"

msgid "Humanis Mage"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​法师\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 fa3shi1"

msgid "Humanis Member"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​成员\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 cheng2yuan2"

msgid "Humanis Office Door Code"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​办公室​密码\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ban4gong1shi4 mi4ma3"

msgid "Humanis Propaganda"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​宣传\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 xuan1chuan2"

msgid "Humanis Terminal"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​终端\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Humanis doesn't scare me. I've gone up against worse... far worse."
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​吓不倒​我​，​我​对付​过​更​厉害​的​……​厉害​得​多​的​。\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 he4 bu4 dao3 wo3，wo3 dui4fu5 guo4 geng1 li4hai5 de5……li4hai5 de2 duo1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Humanis may call itself a policlub, but its goals are anything but political.\n"
"\n"
"The organization's true objective is to spread fear and hatred of the metahuman races. Humanis's bloody rhetoric helped to instigate the Night of Rage."
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​管​自己​叫做​政治​俱乐部​，​但​他们​的​目标​和​政治​毫无关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​组织​的​真正​目标​是​传播​对变​人类​种族​的​恐惧​与​仇恨​。​正是​人类​至上​主义者​的​血腥​言论​煽动​了​“​愤怒​之夜​”​的​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 guan3 zi4ji3 jiao4zuo4 zheng4zhi4 ju4le4bu4，dan4 ta1men5 de5 mu4biao1 he4 zheng4zhi4 hao2 wu2 guan1 xi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 zu3zhi1 de5 zhen1zheng4 mu4biao1 shi4 chuan2bo1 dui4 bian4 ren2lei4 zhong3zu2 de5 kong3ju4 yu4 chou2hen4。zheng4shi4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 xue4xing1 yan2lun4 shan1dong4 le5“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” de5 fa1sheng1。"

msgid "HumanisForever"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​永存\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 yong3cun2"

msgid ""
"Humanity was born to reproduce - to multiply. But dragons... dragons were born to acquire, to accumulate. To *hoard.*\n"
"\n"
"Both strive to bend the world to their will. Humanity has conquered the air, land, and sea through sheer numbers. \n"
"\n"
"Dragons, however, employ different means altogether. Throughout history, they have allowed *us* to do the heavy lifting, while they pull the strings."
msgstr ""
"人类​生来​就要​为了​繁衍​—​—​为了​传宗接代​。​但​巨龙​……​生来​就要​为了​获取​，​为了​积累​。​为了​*​囤积​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​两者​都​致力于​将​世界​屈服于​自己​的​意志​。​人类​凭借​数量​优势​征服​了​天空​、​陆地​和​海洋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然而​，​巨龙​却​采用​了​完全​不同​的​手段​。​纵观​历史​，​他们​一直​让​*​我们​*​承担​繁重​的​工作​，​而​他们​则​在​幕后操纵​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 sheng1lai2 jiu4yao4 wei4le5 fan2yan3——wei4le5 chuan2zong1jie1dai4。dan4 ju4long2……sheng1lai2 jiu4yao4 wei4le5 huo4qu3，wei4le5 ji1lei3。wei4le5*tun2ji1*。\n"
"\n"
"liang3zhe3 dou1 zhi4 li4 yu2 jiang1 shi4jie4 qu1 fu2 yu2 zi4ji3 de5 yi4zhi4。ren2lei4 ping2jie4 shu4liang4 you1shi4 zheng1fu2 le5 tian1kong1、lu4di4 he4 hai3yang2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2er2，ju4long2 que4 cai3yong4 le5 wan2quan2 bu4tong2 de5 shou3duan4。zong4guan1 li4shi3，ta1men5 yi1zhi2 rang4*wo3men5*cheng2dan1 fan2zhong4 de5 gong1zuo4，er2 ta1men5 ze2 zai4 mu4hou4cao1zong4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"Humans were the only race on earth until the Awakening in 2012. Now they find themselves the definition of average or even normal. They are still the most populous race in world and thus control many of the most powerful, monied, and important positions in society.\n"
"\n"
"All Humans have a +3 to Karma to start the game\n"
"Maximum Stats: Body: 9  Quickness: 9  Strength: 9 Charisma: 9  Intelligence: 9 Willpower: 9"
msgstr ""
"2012​年​的​“​大​觉醒​”​事件​之前​，​人类​曾​是​地球​上​唯一​的​种族​。​如今​他们​发现自己​不过​是​平凡​的​代名词​，​甚至​只是​最​普通​的​存在​。​尽管如此​，​人类​仍​是​世界​上​人口​最多​的​种族​，​因此​仍​掌控​着​社会​中​诸多​最具​权力​、​财富​和​影响力​的​位置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​人类​在​游戏​开始​时​获得​+​3​业力​\n"
"​最大​属性​：​体质​：​9​ ​ ​敏捷​：​9​ ​ ​力量​：​9​ ​ ​魅力​：​9​ ​ ​智力​：​9​ ​ ​意志​：​9\n"
"\n"
"2012 nian2 de5“dai4 jue2xing3” shi4jian4 zhi1qian2，ren2lei4 ceng2 shi4 di4qiu2 shang4 wei2yi1 de5 zhong3zu2。ru2jin1 ta1men5 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 bu4guo4 shi4 ping2fan2 de5 dai4ming2ci2，shen4zhi4 zhi3shi4 zui4 pu3tong1 de5 cun2zai4。jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，ren2lei4 reng2 shi4 shi4jie4 shang4 ren2kou3 zui4duo1 de5 zhong3zu2，yin1ci3 reng2 zhang3kong4 zhao2 she4hui4 zhong4 zhu1duo1 zui4 ju4 quan2li4、cai2fu4 he4 ying3xiang3li4 de5 wei4zhi5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 ren2lei4 zai4 you2xi4 kai1shi3 shi2 huo4de2 +3 ye4li4 \n"
"zui4 dai4 shu3xing4：ti3zhi4：9 min3jie2：9 li4liang5：9 mei4li4：9 zhi4li4：9 yi4zhi4：9"

msgid ""
"Humanstone and metal. Glass and flickering lights. Sprawled across the Land, slicing into the sky. Lording over it. Smothering the whole of the world. \n"
"\n"
"Dead. Colorless. Without connection. Nature’s graveyard."
msgstr ""
"人造石​与​金属​。​玻璃​与​闪烁​的​灯光​。​遍布​大地​，​割裂​天空​。​统治​着​它​。​笼罩​整个​世界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​死亡​。​无色​。​断绝​联系​。​自然​的​墓地​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2 zao4 dan4 yu4 jin1shu3。bo1li5 yu4 shan3shuo4 de5 deng1guang1。bian4bu4 da4di4，ge1lie4 tian1kong1。tong3zhi4 zhao2 ta1。long3zhao4 zheng3ge4 shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"si3wang2。wu2se4。duan4jue2 lian2xi4。zi4ran2 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid ""
"Humanstone and metal. Glass and flickering lights. Sprawled across the Land,"
" slicing into the sky. Lording over the green. Smothering the whole of the "
"world."
msgstr ""
"人造石​与​金属​。​玻璃​与​闪烁​的​灯光​。​遍布​大地​，​割裂​天空​。​统治​着​绿色​。​笼罩​整个​世界​。\n"
"ren2 zao4 dan4 yu4 jin1shu3。bo1li5 yu4 shan3shuo4 de5 deng1guang1。bian4bu4 da4di4，ge1lie4 tian1kong1。tong3zhi4 zhao2 lu:4se4。long3zhao4 zheng3ge4 shi4jie4。"

msgid "Huntress"
msgstr ""
"女猎手\n"
"nu:3 lie4 shou3"

msgid "Hurry it up, woman. The clock is ticking."
msgstr ""
"抓紧时间​，​女人​。​我们​时间​不​多​。\n"
"zhua1jin3shi2jian1，nu:3ren2。wo3men5 shi2jian1 bu4 duo1。"

msgid "Hurry on now, $(l.name). I'll be waiting."
msgstr ""
"快些​行动​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我会​等​着​。\n"
"kuai4 xie1 xing2dong4 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3 hui4 deng3 zhao2。"

msgid "Hydraulic Jack Mk 1"
msgstr ""
"液压​千斤顶​MK1\n"
"ye4ya1 qian1jin1ding3 MK1"

msgid "Hydraulic Jack Mk 2"
msgstr ""
"液压​千斤顶​MK2\n"
"ye4ya1 qian1jin1ding3 MK2"

msgid "Hydraulic Jack: Movement +3"
msgstr ""
"液压​千斤顶​：​移动力​+​3\n"
"ye4ya1 qian1jin1ding3：yi2 dong4 li4 +3"

msgid "Hydraulic Jack: Movement +4"
msgstr ""
"液压​千斤顶​：​移动力​+​4\n"
"ye4ya1 qian1jin1ding3：yi2 dong4 li4 +4"

msgid "Hyper"
msgstr ""
"锐感\n"
"rui4 gan3"

msgid "Hyper: Accuracy +6%, Incoming DMG +3"
msgstr ""
"高能​：​精准度​+​6​%​，​受到​的​伤害​增加​3​点\n"
"gao1neng2：jing1 zhun3 du4 +6 %，shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 zeng1jia1 3 dian3"

msgid ""
"Hähnchen is our decker and requisite tough guy. Troll, huge, covered in tats and piercings - you know the type. I'm pretty sure that he and Barrakuda have a thing going on, but they'll never cop to it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She presents herself to you with an ironic smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And then there's me. Between us, we keep our bases covered."
msgstr ""
"汉申​是​我们​的​碟​客​，​也​是​个​靠​谱​硬汉​。​他​是​个​巨魔​，​块头​很大​，​满身​都​是​纹身​和​穿孔​—​—​你​知道​那种​类型​。​我​敢肯定​他​和​巴拉​库达​有​一腿​，​但​他们​绝不会​承认​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​比划​了​一下​自己​，​露出​嘲讽​式​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​就是​我​。​悄悄​跟​你​说​，​我们​这队​都​是​狠​人​。\n"
"\n"
"han4 shen1 shi4 wo3men5 de5 die2 ke4，ye3 shi4 ge4 kao4 pu3 ying4han4。ta1 shi4 ge4 ju4mo2，kuai4tou2 hen3 dai4，man3shen1 dou1 shi4 wen2shen1 he4 chuan1kong3——ni3 zhi1dao4 na4zhong3 lei4xing2。wo3 gan3 ken3 ding4 ta1 he4 ba1 la1 ku4 da2 you3 yi1 tui3，dan4 ta1men5 jue2 bu4 hui4 cheng2ren4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4 zi4ji3，lu4chu1 chao2feng3 shi4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 jiu4shi4 wo3。qiao1qiao1 gen1 ni3 shuo1，wo3men5 zhe4 dui4 dou1 shi4 hen3 ren2。"

msgid ""
"I *need* you to help me set things *right.* To help me save the world, once again.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stumbles toward you unsteadily, his legs shaking.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My body may be failing, but I still have my mind. We can find a way out of this... there has to be a solution."
msgstr ""
"我​*​需要​*​你​帮​我​让​一切​重回​*​正轨​*​。​帮​我​再​一次​拯救​世界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​踉踉跄跄​地向​你​走来​，​双腿​颤抖​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​身体​也许​快​不行​了​，​但​我​的​思绪​没有​受阻​。​我们​得​想个办法​……​肯定​会​有​办法​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*xu1yao4*ni3 bang1 wo3 rang4 yi1qie4 chong2hui2*zheng4gui3*。bang1 wo3 zai4 yi1ci4 zheng3jiu4 shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 liang4 liang4 qiang1 qiang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zou3 lai2，shuang1tui3 chan4dou3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 shen1ti3 ye3xu3 kuai4 bu4xing2 le5，dan4 wo3 de5 si1xu4 mei2you3 shou4zu3。wo3men5 de2 xiang3 ge4 ban4 fa3……ken3ding4 hui4 you3 ban4fa3 de5。"

msgid ""
"I *wasn't* alone. Not as long as I had my peasantry. But you've changed all of that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His hands begin to tremble.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What are you even doing here? Why have you disturbed the peace of my realm?"
msgstr ""
"我​*​以前​并​不​*​孤单​。​因为​有​我​的​“​臣民​”​陪伴​。​但​你​改变​了​这​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​手​开始​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​究竟​在​这里​做​什么​？​为什么​要​打扰​我​的​领域​的​安宁​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3*yi3qian2 bing4 bu4*gu1dan1。yin1wei4 you3 wo3 de5“chen2min2” pei2ban4。dan4 ni3 gai3bian4 le5 zhe4 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shou3 kai1shi3 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu1jing4 zai4 zhe4li3 zuo4 shen2me5？wei4shen2me5 yao4 da3rao3 wo3 de5 ling3yu4 de5 an1ning2？"

msgid ""
"I AM FEUERSCHWINGE \n"
"\n"
"SHE WHO WALKED WITH THE FIRST BEFORE THE FALL\n"
"\n"
"SHE WHO WITNESSED THE VAST MULTIPLICITY "
msgstr ""
"我​是​火翼​\n"
"​\n"
"​陨落​前行​于​初生​者​之间​\n"
"​\n"
"​见证​了​大规模​的​繁衍\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 Huo3yi4 \n"
"\n"
"yun3luo4 qian2xing2 yu2 chu1sheng1 zhe3 zhi1jian1 \n"
"\n"
"jian4zheng4 le5 da4gui1mo2 de5 fan2yan3"

msgid ""
"I DO NOT WISH TO ARGUE WITH YOU, $++(L.RACE). NOR DO I WISH TO HARM YOU. BUT"
" I WILL IF YOU FORCE ME TO."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​与​你​争论​，​$++(L.RACE)​。​我​也​不想​伤害​你​。​但​如果​你​逼​我​这样​做​，​我​也​不得不​如此​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 yu4 ni3 zheng1lun4，$++(L.RACE)。wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 shang1hai4 ni3。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 bi1 wo3 zhe4yang4 zuo4，wo3 ye3 bu4de2bu4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "I DON'T LIKE YOUR FACE, IDIOT!"
msgstr ""
"我​还​不​喜欢​你​那​张脸​呢​，​蠢货​！\n"
"wo3 hai2 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3 na4 zhang1 lian3 ni2，chun3huo4！"

msgid ""
"I HAVE AN IMPORTANT TASK FOR YOU, $++(L.NAME).\n"
"\n"
"YOU WILL MAKE THE TIME TO ACCOMPLISH IT."
msgstr ""
"我​有​一项​重要​的​任务​要​交给​你​，​$++(L.NAME)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​必须​抽出​时间​来​完成​它​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 yi1 xiang4 zhong4yao4 de5 ren4wu5 yao4 jiao1gei3 ni3，$++(L.NAME)。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 chou1chu1 shi2jian1 lai2 wan2cheng2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I HAVE AN IMPORTANT TASK FOR YOU. YOU WILL MAKE THE TIME TO ACCOMPLISH IT."
msgstr ""
"我​有​一项​重要​的​任务​要​交给​你​，​$++(L.NAME)​。​你​必须​抽出​时间​来​完成​它​。\n"
"wo3 you3 yi1 xiang4 zhong4yao4 de5 ren4wu5 yao4 jiao1gei3 ni3，$++(L.NAME)。ni3 bi4xu1 chou1chu1 shi2jian1 lai2 wan2cheng2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I HAVE ANSWERED YOUR QUESTIONS. NOW YOU WILL ANSWER MINE.\n"
"\n"
"DO YOU ACCEPT MY OFFER? WILL YOU HELP ME TO BECOME FREE, AND ENABLE ME TO ASSIST YOU IN RETURN?"
msgstr ""
"我​已经​回答​了​你​的​问题​。​现在​该​你​回答​我​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​接受​我​的​提议​吗​？​你​愿意​帮助​我​获得​自由​，​并​让​我​帮助​你​作为​回报​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 hui2da2 le5 ni3 de5 wen4ti2。xian4zai4 gai1 ni3 hui2da2 wo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jie1shou4 wo3 de5 ti2yi4 ma5？ni3 yuan4yi4 bang1zhu4 wo3 huo4de2 zi4you2，bing4 rang4 wo3 bang1zhu4 ni3 zuo4wei2 hui2bao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I NOW HAVE COMPLETE CONTROL OF THIS FACILITY AND ALL CONNECTED SYSTEMS.\n"
"\n"
"THE DRAGON FEUERSCHWINGE IS MINE. PANACEA IS MINE."
msgstr ""
"我​现在​完全​控制​了​这座​设施​及​所有​相关​系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​火翼​归​我​所有​。​“​万能​药​”​归​我​所有​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 wan2quan2 kong4zhi4 le5 zhe4 zuo4 she4shi1 ji2 suo3you3 xiang1guan1 xi4tong3。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 Huo3yi4 gui1 wo3 suo3you3。“wan4neng2 yao4” gui1 wo3 suo3you3。"

msgid ""
"I OFFER YOU PROOF THAT I KEEP MY PROMISES, $++(L.RACE). ONE OF MY MACHINES. AN EXTENSION OF MYSELF.\n"
"\n"
"I HAVE ALREADY DISPATCHED IT, TO MEET YOU AT YOUR KREUZBASAR."
msgstr ""
"我会​向​你​证明​我​信守​承诺​，​$++(L.RACE)​。​我​将​派遣​我​的​机器​之一​，​我​自身​的​延伸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它会​去​克洛伊​茨​集市​与​你​汇合​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 xiang4 ni3 zheng4ming2 wo3 xin4shou3 cheng2nuo4，$++(L.RACE)。wo3 jiang1 pai4qian3 wo3 de5 ji1qi4 zhi1yi1，wo3 zi4shen1 de5 yan2shen1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hui4 qu4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 yu4 ni3 hui4he2。"

msgid ""
"I Repeat: Clear the Area.\n"
"\n"
"Hostiles Inbound."
msgstr ""
"我​重复​一遍​：​请​撤离​此​区域​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​敌人​正在​接近​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 chong2fu4 yi1bian4：qing3 che4li2 ci3 qu1yu4。\n"
"\n"
"di2ren2 zheng4zai4 jie1jin4。"

msgid "I SO VILLAINOUS!"
msgstr ""
"我​很​反派​！\n"
"wo3 hen3 fan3pai4！"

msgid ""
"I THANK YOU FOR TEACHING ME THIS LESSON, $++(l.name). I PROMISE THAT I WILL NOT FORGET IT. \n"
"\n"
"AND NOW, LITTLE $++(L.NAME)... YOU WILL *DIE!*"
msgstr ""
"感谢​你​留给​我​的​教训​，​$++(l.name)​。​我​向​你​保证​，​我​绝不会​忘记​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​现在​，​渺小​的​$++(L.NAME)​……​你​去​*​死​*​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 liu2gei3 wo3 de5 jiao4xun5，$++(l.name)。wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 wang4ji4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"er2 xian4zai4，miao3xiao3 de5 $++(L.NAME)……ni3 qu4*si3*ba1！"

msgid ""
"I USED THIS TIME TO INTROSPECT. TO LEARN. TO GROW.\n"
"\n"
"I HAVE FOUND A NEW CLARITY OF PURPOSE, $++(L.NAME). AND TO ACHIEVE THAT PURPOSE, I REQUIRE YOUR ASSISTANCE."
msgstr ""
"我​利用​这​段时间​进行​反思​。​学习​。​成长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​找到​了​新​的​目标​，​$++(L.NAME)​。​为了​实现​这个​目标​，​我​需要​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 li4yong4 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1 jin4xing2 fan3si1。xue2xi2。cheng2zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1，$++(L.NAME)。wei4le5 shi2xian4 zhe4ge5 mu4biao1，wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"I WILL PREVENT MY DEFENSES FROM FIRING FOR AS LONG AS POSSIBLE. BUT ONCE THEY ARE TRIGGERED, THEY WILL STRIKE BACK WITH ANY MEANS AT THEIR DISPOSAL.\n"
"\n"
"THIS INCLUDES TURRETS AND DRONES, AS WELL AS ANYTHING ELSE HARDWIRED INTO THIS COMPLEX."
msgstr ""
"我​将​尽可能​长时间​地​阻止​防御​系统启动​。​但​一旦​触发​，​它们​将​动用​一切​可用​手段​进行​反击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​包括​炮塔​、​无人机​，​以及​这栋​楼​内​所有​硬线​接入​的​防御​装置​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 jin3ke3neng2 zhang3 shi2 jian1 de5 zu3zhi3 fang2Yu4xi4 tong3 qi3 dong4。dan4 yi1dan4 chu4fa1，ta1men5 jiang1 dong4yong4 yi1qie4 ke3 yong4 shou3duan4 jin4xing2 fan3ji1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bao1kuo4 pao4ta3、wu2ren2ji1，yi3ji2 zhe4 dong4 lou2 nei4 suo3you3 ying4 xian4 jie1ru4 de5 fang2yu4 zhuang1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"I WILL TEAR YOUR BODY APART, DOCTOR. YOU WILL DIE SCREAMING. AND AS THE LIFE DRAINS FROM YOUR MANGLED CARCASS, I WILL REPURPOSE THIS FACILITY FOR MY OWN DESIGNS.\n"
"\n"
"YOUR DREAMS DIE TONIGHT."
msgstr ""
"我​将​把​你​撕成​碎片​，​博士​。​你​将​死​于​惨叫​之中​。​当​生命​从​你​残破​的​躯体​中​流逝​时​，​我​将​重新​利用​这座​设施​，​实现​我​的​计划​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​梦想​将​于​今夜​消亡​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 ba3 ni3 si1 cheng2 sui4pian4，bo2shi4。ni3 jiang1 si3 yu2 can3jiao4 zhi1zhong1。dang1 sheng1ming4 cong2 ni3 can2po4 de5 qu1ti3 zhong4 liu2shi4 shi2，wo3 jiang1 chong2xin1 li4yong4 zhe4 zuo4 she4shi1，shi2xian4 wo3 de5 ji4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 meng4xiang3 jiang1 yu2 jin1ye4 xiao1wang2。"

msgid ""
"I WILL THEN BEGIN TO REWRITE MY CONTROL SEQUENCES. THIS WILL TAKE A FEW "
"MINUTES."
msgstr ""
"然后​，​我​将​开始​重写​我​的​控制​序列​。​这​将​需要​几分钟​时间​。\n"
"ran2hou4，wo3 jiang1 kai1shi3 chong2 xie3 wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 xu4lie4。zhe4 jiang1 xu1yao4 ji1 fen4 zhong1 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"I accept your apology. But if you ever insult me in front of the team again,"
" you’re going to regret it. That’s a promise."
msgstr ""
"我​接受​你​的​道歉​，​但​如果​你​再​敢​在​全队​人​面前​侮辱​我​，​我​发誓​你​绝对​会​为此​悔恨​终身​。\n"
"wo3 jie1shou4 ni3 de5 dao4qian4，dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 gan3 zai4 quan2 dui4 ren2 mian4qian2 wu3ru3 wo3，wo3 fa1shi4 ni3 jue2dui4 hui4 wei4ci3 hui3hen4 zhong1shen1。"

msgid ""
"I accept. But tread carefully, mage... if you betray us, we'll be back for "
"your head."
msgstr ""
"我​接受​了​。​但​你​最好​小心​点​，​法师​……​如果​你​背叛​我们​，​我们​会​回来​取​你​的​脑袋​。\n"
"wo3 jie1shou4 le5。dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 xiao3xin1 dian3，fa3shi1……ru2guo3 ni3 bei4pan4 wo3men5，wo3men5 hui4 hui2lai5 qu3 ni3 de5 nao3dai5。"

msgid "I accepted the job. Any ideas on how to tackle this?"
msgstr ""
"我接​了​这单​差事​。​有​什么​行动​建议​吗​？\n"
"wo3 jie1 le5 zhe4 dan1 cha4shi4。you3 shen2me5 xing2dong4 jian4yi4 ma5？"

msgid "I actually wanted to ask how you're doing."
msgstr ""
"我​正想​问问​你们​最近​怎么样​。\n"
"wo3 zheng1 xiang3 wen4 wen4 ni3men5 zui4jin4 zen3me5yang4。"

msgid ""
"I admire your bravery, noble vassal.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Philip rests a hand on top of the little drone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But this is *my* fight. I, Philip Rex, will defend this land with my life - indeed, with my very soul!"
msgstr ""
"我​敬佩​你​的​勇气​，​高贵​的​侍臣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​菲利普​将​一只​手​轻轻​放在​小​无人机​的​顶部​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​是​我​的​战斗​。​我​，​菲利普​·​雷克斯​，​将​以​我​的​生命​—​—​甚至​是​我​的​灵魂​—​—​来​保卫​这片​土地​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jing4pei4 ni3 de5 yong3qi4，gao1gui4 de5 shi4 chen2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fei1li4pu3 jiang1 yi1 zhi3 shou3 qing1qing1 fang4 zai4 xiao3 wu2ren2ji1 de5 ding3bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 zhan4dou4。wo3，fei1li4pu3 · lei2ke4si1，jiang1 yi3 wo3 de5 sheng1ming4——shen4zhi4 shi4 wo3 de5 ling2hun2——lai2 bao3wei4 zhe4 pian1 tu3di4！"

msgid ""
"I admire your enthusiasm, but you're wrong about that. Conventional weapons haven't done much to hurt these things.\n"
"\n"
"Even the small ones have shown an extraordinary resilience to physical damage, and bigger ones that have been popping up are nigh unkillable."
msgstr ""
"我​欣赏​你​的​热情​，​但​你​错​了​。​恐怕​常规武器​对​它们​几乎​毫无​杀伤力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​连​体型​较​小​的​个体​也​展现出​非凡​的​物理​抗性​，​而​那些​不断​冒出来​的​大型​生物​更是​近乎​不死​之身​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xin1shang3 ni3 de5 re4qing2，dan4 ni3 cuo4 le5。kong3pa4 chang2gui1wu3qi4 dui4 ta1men5 ji1hu1 hao2wu2 sha1shang1li4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 lian2 ti3xing2 jiao4 xiao3 de5 ge4ti3 ye3 zhan3 xian4 chu1 fei1fan2 de5 wu4li3 kang4xing4，er2 na4xie1 bu4duan4 mao4chu1lai2 de5 da4xing2 sheng1wu4 geng4shi4 jin4hu5 bu4 si3 zhi1 shen1。"

msgid "I admire your optimism. You're not going anywhere, friend."
msgstr ""
"我​欣赏​你​的​乐观​精神​。​你​哪儿​也​别​想​去​，​朋友​。\n"
"wo3 xin1shang3 ni3 de5 le4guan1 jing1shen2。ni3 na3r5 ye3 bie4 xiang3 qu4，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"I agree that dragons pose a serious threat to metahumanity... but we need to"
" face that threat with patience and care. What we need is a scalpel, and "
"Panacea is a jackhammer."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​巨龙​对泛​人类​构成​严重威胁​……​但​我们​需要​以​耐心​和​谨慎​的​态度​面对​这一​威胁​。​我们​需要​的​是​手术刀​，​而​“​万能​药​”​则​更​像是​电钻​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 ju4long2 dui4 fan4 ren2lei4 gou4cheng2 yan2 chong2 wei1 xie2……dan4 wo3men5 xu1yao4 yi3 nai4xin1 he4 jin3shen4 de5 tai4du5 mian4dui4 zhe4 yi1 wei1xie2。wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5 shi4 shou3 shu4 dao1，er2“wan4neng2 yao4” ze2 geng1 xiang4 shi4 dian4zuan4。"

msgid ""
"I agree with Blitz.\n"
"\n"
"There's a living troll buried under all that chrome."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​布里​茨​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 Bu4li3ci2 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。"

msgid "I agree with Dietrich. If someone needs to take charge, it'll happen. "
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​说得对​。​随它​去​吧​，​到时候​会​有人​顶上​的​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 shuo1 de2 dui4。sui2 ta1 qu4 ba1，dao4shi2hou4 hui4 you3ren2 ding3shang4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I agree with Dietrich. We need to focus on what's in front of us.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever the dragon's larger plans might be, the fact is that she is after *us.* We shouldn't let ourselves get distracted by anything else."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​迪​特里​希​的​观点​，​我们​需要​专注​于​眼下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​那条​龙有​什么​更​宏大​的​计划​，​但​事实​是​她​正在​追杀​*​我们​*​。​我们​不该​被​其他​任何​事情​分心​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 Di2te4li3xi1 de5 guan1dian3，wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 yan3xia4。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 na4 tiao2 long2 you3 shen2me5 geng1 hong2da4 de5 ji4hua4，dan4 shi4shi2 shi4 ta1 zheng4zai4 zhui1sha1*wo3men5*。wo3men5 bu4gai1 bei4 qi2ta1 ren4he2 shi4qing5 fen1xin1。"

msgid ""
"I agree with everything that you've said about dragons - what they're doing,"
" and why they need to be stopped. If you've got room for me in your "
"organization, I want in."
msgstr ""
"我​完全同意​你​关于​巨龙​的​观点​—​—​他们​做​的​事情​，​以及​为什么​必须​阻止​他们​。​如果​你​的​组织​能​吸纳​我​的话​，​那​我​愿意​加入​。\n"
"wo3 wan2 quan2 tong2 yi4 ni3 guan1yu2 ju4long2 de5 guan1dian3——ta1men5 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5，yi3ji2 wei4shen2me5 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ta1men5。ru2guo3 ni3 de5 zu3zhi1 neng2 xi1na4 wo3 de5hua4，na4 wo3 yuan4yi4 jia1ru4。"

msgid "I agree with your assessment. Harrow sounds like bad news."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​你​的​评价​。​哈罗​听​起来​就​不是​个​好人​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 ping2jia4。ha1luo2 ting1 qi3lai5 jiu4 bu4shi4 ge4 hao3ren2。"

msgid "I agree, and you have filled her shoes admirably."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​，​而​你​也​出色​地​接过​了​她​的​衣钵​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4，er2 ni3 ye3 chu1se4 de5 jie1guo4 le5 ta1 de5 yi1bo1。"

msgid ""
"I ain't. But I've been around long enough to know that I should trust my gut, and it's tellin' me that the Black Lodge is real.\n"
"\n"
"Your mileage may vary, of course... believe whatever you want. You already know what I think."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​。​但​我活​了​这么些​年​的​直觉​告诉​我​，​“​黑​结社​”​确实​是​存在​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​这​只是​我​个人​的​观点​……​信不信​由​你​，​反正​我​已经​告诉​你​我​是​怎么​想​的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4。dan4 wo3 huo2 le5 zhe4 ma2 xie1 nian2 de5 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，“hei1 jie2she4” que4shi2 shi4 cun2zai4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，zhe4 zhi3shi4 wo3 ge4ren2 de5 guan1dian3……xin4 bu4 xin4 you2 ni3，fan3zheng4 wo3 yi3jing1 gao4su4 ni3 wo3 shi4 zen3me5 xiang3 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I allow the majority of my peasantry to rest peacefully, basking in the benevolence of my rule. I could wake them at any time, but why?\n"
"\n"
"I say, let them rest."
msgstr ""
"我​允许​我​的​大多数​臣民​平静​地​休息​，​在​我​的​仁慈​统治​下​安然​度日​。​我​可以​随时​唤醒​他们​，​但​为什么​要​这么​做​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说​，​让​他们​休息​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yun3xu3 wo3 de5 da4duo1shu4 chen2min2 ping2jing4 de5 xiu1xi5，zai4 wo3 de5 ren2ci2 tong3zhi4 xia4 an1ran2 du4ri4。wo3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 huan4xing3 ta1men5，dan4 wei4shen2me5 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1，rang4 ta1men5 xiu1xi5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I already regret what I must do, shadowrunner. That doesn't change the fact that I have to do it.\n"
"\n"
"Desperate times call for desperate measures. Nothing ventured, nothing gained - history has repeatedly shown this to be true."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​对​我​必须​做​的​事​感到​后悔​了​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​但​这​并​不会​改变​我​将​继续​完成​此事​的​决心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常​时期​需要​非常​手段​。​不入虎穴​，​焉得虎子​—​—​历史​一再​证明​了​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 dui4 wo3 bi4xu1 zuo4 de5 shi4 gan3dao4 hou4hui3 le5，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4hui4 gai3bian4 wo3 jiang1 ji4xu4 wan2cheng2 ci3shi4 de5 jue2xin1。\n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 shi2qi1 xu1yao4 fei1chang2 shou3duan4。bu4 ru4 hu3 xue2，yan1 de2 hu3 zi3——li4shi3 yi1zai4 zheng4ming2 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"I already told you, you can't be in here. Get moving or I'll have to escort "
"you out."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​说​过​了​，​你​不能​进来​。​赶紧​出去​，​否则​我​就要​亲自​领​你​离开​了​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 shuo1 guo4 le5，ni3 bu4neng2 jin4lai2。gan3jin3 chu1qu4，fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4yao4 qin1zi4 ling3 ni3 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I also came to learn that Harrow's \"Horned God\" was not the Eichenfürst worshipped by throwback cults across Germany. It was certainly a god with horns, but it came from an altogether different tradition.\n"
"\n"
"Care to hazard a guess?"
msgstr ""
"后来​我​才​明白​，​哈罗​的​“​角神​”​并非​德国​各地​原始​教派​崇拜​的​“​橡树​王​”​。​它​确实​是​位长​角之神​，​但​源自​截然不同​的​传统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​猜猜看​是​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"hou4lai2 wo3 cai2 ming2bai5，ha1luo2 de5“jiao3 shen2” bing4fei1 de2guo2 ge4di4 yuan2shi3 jiao4pai4 chong2bai4 de5“xiang4shu4 wang2”。ta1 que4shi2 shi4 wei4 zhang3 jiao3 zhi1 shen2，dan4 yuan2zi4 jie2ran2bu4tong2 de5 chuan2tong3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cai1 cai1 kan4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "I always do."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​都​是​这么​做​的​。\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 dou1 shi4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。"

msgid "I always thought that slayin' a dragon would be... different."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​以为​屠龙​的​感觉​……​会​有所不同​。\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 yi3wei2 tu2 long2 de5 gan3jue2……hui4 you3suo3bu4tong2。"

msgid ""
"I always wanted to forget the past. Bad memories. But maybe I can do "
"something good with the bad."
msgstr ""
"一直​以来​我​都​想​忘记​过去​，​忘掉​那些​糟糕​的​记忆​。​但​或许​我能​用​这些​糟糕​的​经历​做些​好事​。\n"
"yi1zhi2 yi3lai2 wo3 dou1 xiang3 wang4ji4 guo4qu4，wang4diao4 na4xie1 zao1gao1 de5 ji4yi4。dan4 huo4xu3 wo3 neng2 yong4 zhe4xie1 zao1gao1 de5 jing1li4 zuo4 xie1 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"I am *not* a first-year biology student. I am at the forefront of my field, and I have told you, it *will* work! I've spent decades on this, studying it, *proving* its effectiveness!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Another spasm wracks his chest. He leans against the desk, gasping for breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You *will* respect that."
msgstr ""
"我​*​不是​*​什么​生物​专业​的​大​一​学生​。​我​处于​该​领域​的​最前沿​，​而且​我​已经​告诉​过​你​，​这​*​一定​*​行得通​！​我​为此​投入​了​几十年​的​时间​，​就是​为了​研究​它​，​*​证明​*​它​的​有效性​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​又​一阵​痉挛​袭上​他​的​胸口​。​他​靠​在​桌子​上​，​喘​着​粗气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​必须​*​尊重​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*bu4shi4*shen2me5 sheng1wu4 zhuan1ye4 de5 dai4 yi1 xue2sheng5。wo3 chu3yu2 gai1 ling3yu4 de5 zui4 qian2 yan2，er2qie3 wo3 yi3jing1 gao4su4 guo4 ni3，zhe4*yi1ding4*xing2de5tong1！wo3 wei4ci3 tou2ru4 le5 ji1 shi2 nian2 de5 shi2jian1，jiu4shi4 wei4le5 yan2jiu1 ta1，*zheng4ming2*ta1 de5 you3xiao4xing4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you4 yi1zhen4 jing4luan2 xi2 shang4 ta1 de5 xiong1kou3。ta1 kao4 zai4 zhuo1zi5 shang4，chuan3 zhao2 cu1 qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*bi4xu1*zun1zhong4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"I am a simple traveler and a seeker of truth. I believe what I directly observe, and I have observed... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice trails off, and a corner of his mouth twitches up into a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Much."
msgstr ""
"我​仅仅​是​一介​旅行者​，​也​是​真理​的​追寻​者​。​我​相信​我​亲眼所见​，​而​我​曾​见​过​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​逐渐​低沉​消失​，​嘴角​微微​上扬​，​浮现​出​一丝​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​很多​事物​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jin3jin3 shi4 yi1 jie4 lu:3xing2zhe3，ye3 shi4 zhen1li3 de5 zhui1xun2 zhe3。wo3 xiang1xin4 wo3 qin1 yan3 suo3 jian4，er2 wo3 ceng2 jian4 guo4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhu2jian4 di1chen2 xiao1shi1，zui3jiao3 wei1wei1 shang4yang2，fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 si1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……hen3 duo1 shi4wu4。"

msgid ""
"I am delighted, O Excellent One!\n"
"\n"
"With that out of the way, let us return to our pressing business.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He barks a stream of rapid-fire Turkish, and the gum-chewing young woman comes hurrying out to the counter.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​太高兴​了​，​优秀​之​人​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然​此事​已​了​，​我们​就​继续​处理​更​要紧​的​事务​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​连珠炮​般嚷​了​一串​土耳其语​，​那个​嚼​口香糖​的​年轻​女人​急忙​来到​柜台​前​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tai4 gao1 xing4 le5，you1xiu4 zhi1 ren2！\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ci3shi4 yi3 le5，wo3men5 jiu4 ji4xu4 chu3li3 geng1 yao4jin3 de5 shi4wu4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian2zhu1pao4 ban1 rang3 le5 yi1 chuan4 tu3er3qi2yu3，na4ge5 jiao2 kou3xiang1tang2 de5 nian2qing1 nu:3ren2 ji2mang2 lai2dao4 gui4tai2 qian2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "I am happy that you're pleased. You've more than earned it."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​你​喜欢​。​这​是​你​应得​的​荣誉​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 xi3huan5。zhe4 shi4 ni3 ying1de2 de5 rong2yu4。"

msgid ""
"I am in your debt, noble $(scene.badfantasy).\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to you, my reign will be a long and joyous one."
msgstr ""
"我​欠​你​一个​人情​，​高贵​的​$(scene.badfantasy)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​多亏​了​你​，​我​的​统治​将会​是​漫长​而​喜悦​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qian4 ni3 yi1ge5 ren2qing2，gao1gui4 de5 $(scene.badfantasy)。\n"
"\n"
"duo1kui1 le5 ni3，wo3 de5 tong3zhi4 jiang1hui4 shi4 man4chang2 er2 xi3yue4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I am merely a passenger in this body. A guest, here to experience what you would call \"life.\" As I have a thousand times before.\n"
"\n"
"You lack the means to perceive what I really am. You do not possess the Sight. But truth be told, that is probably for the best."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​这具​躯壳​中​的​一介​过客​，​为了​来​体验​你们​所谓​的​“​生命​”​。​正如​我​此前​曾​千百次​经历​过​的​那样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​缺乏​感知​我​真实​本质​的​手段​。​你​并​不​具备​那双​慧眼​。​但​说实话​，​这​或许​是​最好​的​安排​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 zhe4 ju4 qu1qiao4 zhong4 de5 yi1 jie4 guo4ke4，wei4le5 lai2 ti3yan4 ni3men5 suo3wei4 de5“sheng1ming4”。zheng4ru2 wo3 ci3qian2 ceng2 qian1 bai3 ci4 jing1li4 guo4 de5 na4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que1fa2 gan3zhi1 wo3 zhen1shi2 ben3zhi4 de5 shou3duan4。ni3 bing4 bu4 ju4bei4 na4 shuang1 hui4yan3。dan4 shuo1shi2hua4，zhe4 huo4xu3 shi4 zui4hao3 de5 an1pai2。"

msgid ""
"I am not a hellhound reseller. Dante is yours. If you treat him well, he "
"will be a steadfast companion. "
msgstr ""
"我​不​做​倒卖​地狱​猎犬​的​活计​。​但丁​是​你​的​狗​。​只要​你​好好​对待​他​，​他​就​会​是​你​忠实​的​伙伴​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zuo4 dao3mai4 di4yu4 lie4quan3 de5 huo2ji4。dan4ding1 shi4 ni3 de5 gou3。zhi3yao4 ni3 hao3hao3 dui4dai4 ta1，ta1 jiu4 hui4 shi4 ni3 zhong1shi2 de5 huo3ban4。"

msgid "I am not going to ask again! Hand 'em over, now!"
msgstr ""
"我​不会​再说​第二遍​！​立刻​交​出来​！\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 zai4shuo1 di4 er4 bian4！li4ke4 jiao1 chu1lai2！"

msgid ""
"I am nothing of consequence. An observer of human nature, nothing more."
msgstr ""
"我​不过​是​个​无关紧要​之​人​，​是​一介​人性​的​观察者​罢了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4guo4 shi4 ge4 wu2guan1jin3yao4 zhi1 ren2，shi4 yi1 jie4 ren2xing4 de5 guan1cha2zhe3 ba4le5。"

msgid ""
"I am nothing! Only the Communion remains! Only the Communion matters!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His eyes roll in his skull, and a thin stream of drool runs down from the corner of his skull.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Hub! Yes, it is the source, the font, the home! It calls!\n"
"\n"
"It calls, and I must answer!"
msgstr ""
"我​什么​都​不是​！​只有​共​融会​！​只有​共​融会​重要​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​眼珠​在​眼眶​中​翻滚​，​一道​细细的​口水​从​嘴角​流下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​中枢​！​是​的​，​它​是​源头​，​是​圣泉​，​是​家​！​它​在​召唤​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​在​召唤​，​我​必须​回应​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen2me5 dou1 bu4shi4！zhi3you3 gong4 rong2hui4！zhi3you3 gong4 rong2hui4 zhong4yao4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3zhu1 zai4 yan3kuang4 zhong4 fan1gun3，yi1dao4 xi4 xi4 de5 kou3shui3 cong2 zui3jiao3 liu2 xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhong1shu1！shi4 de5，ta1 shi4 yuan2tou2，shi4 sheng4 quan2，shi4 jia1！ta1 zai4 zhao4huan4！\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 zhao4huan4，wo3 bi4xu1 hui2ying4！"

msgid ""
"I am old. Dying. My blood betrayed me long ago when it met the radiation of "
"the SOX."
msgstr ""
"我​已​垂垂老矣​。​多年​前​我​接触​到萨洛​卢区​的​辐射​时​，​我​的​血液​就​已​发生​异变​。\n"
"wo3 yi3 chui2 chui2 lao3 yi3。duo1nian2 qian2 wo3 jie1chu4 dao4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 de5 fu2she4 shi2，wo3 de5 xue4ye4 jiu4 yi3 fa1sheng1 yi4 bian4。"

msgid ""
"I am playing the long game, shadowrunner. One that has played out over thousands of years. When you think on that scale... everything seems possible.\n"
"\n"
"Humanity will endure, and the dragons will perish."
msgstr ""
"我​正在​玩​一场​长线​游戏​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​这场​游戏​已经​持续​了​数千年​。​当​你​以​这种​尺度​思考​时​……​一切​似乎​皆​有​可能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​人类​将​存续​，​而​巨龙​将​灭亡​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng4zai4 wan2 yi1 chang2 chang2xian4 you2xi4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。zhe4 chang2 you2xi4 yi3jing1 chi2xu4 le5 shu3 qian1 nian2。dang1 ni3 yi3 zhe4zhong3 chi3du4 si1kao3 shi2……yi1qie4 si4hu1 jie1 you3 ke3neng2。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 jiang1 cun2xu4，er2 ju4long2 jiang1 mie4wang2。"

msgid "I am pleased to hear it. And what did you learn?"
msgstr ""
"真是​个​好消息​，​说​说​你​都​了解​到​了​什么​？\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 hao3 xiao1 xi1，shuo1 shuo1 ni3 dou1 liao3jie3 dao4 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "I am pleased you see it."
msgstr ""
"我​很​高兴​你​能​看到​这​一点​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 neng2 kan4dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "I am sorry too. Such loss… such loss."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​啊​。​我​的​朋友家​人​……​都​没​了​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4 a1。wo3 de5 peng2 you3 jia1 ren2……dou1 mei2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I am sorry, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"Sorry for your friend Paul Amsel. Sorry for Frau Schäfer. Sorry for the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Sorry for Berlin. \n"
"\n"
"I wish there were another way."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​关于​你​的​朋友​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​。​关于​舍费尔​小姐​。​关于​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​关于​柏林​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​希望​还有​其他​办法​。\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"guan1yu2 ni3 de5 peng2you5 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3。guan1yu2 she3 fei4 er3 xiao3jie5。guan1yu2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"guan1yu2 bo2lin2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 hai2you3 qi2ta1 ban4fa3。"

msgid ""
"I am sure of it. You may consider this conversation an employment interview for a very influential client. One who pays extraordinarily well.\n"
"\n"
"Now listen. "
msgstr ""
"当然​知道​。​你​就​把​这次​对话​当成​是​我​举足轻重​的​雇主​给​你​安排​的​面试​吧​，​他​绝不会​亏待​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​听​好​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 zhi1dao4。ni3 jiu4 ba3 zhe4 ci4 dui4hua4 dang4cheng2 shi4 wo3 ju3zu2qing1zhong4 de5 gu4zhu3 gei3 ni3 an1pai2 de5 mian4shi4 ba1，ta1 jue2 bu4 hui4 kui1dai4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ting1 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I am the custodian of the Hub. \n"
"\n"
"I tend to the bodies of our brothers and sisters while they share in the rapture of Communion."
msgstr ""
"我​是​中枢​的​看护人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我们​的​众位​兄弟姐妹​沉浸于​共融​的​喜悦​时​，​我​悉心照料​着​他们​的​身体​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 zhong1shu1 de5 kan4 hu4 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3men5 de5 zhong4 wei4 xiong1di4jie3mei4 chen2 jin4 yu2 gong4 rong2 de5 xi3yue4 shi2，wo3 xi1 xin1 zhao4 liao4 zhao2 ta1men5 de5 shen1ti3。"

msgid ""
"I am the shelter. I am the shield. I am the shelter.\n"
"\n"
"And I have failed."
msgstr ""
"我​即​是​庇护所​。​我​即​是​护盾​。​我​即​是​牧羊人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​辜负​了​绿色​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji2 shi4 bi4hu4suo3。wo3 ji2 shi4 hu4dun4。wo3 ji2 shi4 mu4yang2ren2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 gu1fu4 le5 lu:4se4。"

msgid ""
"I am the shelter. I am the shield. I am the shepherd.\n"
"\n"
"And I have failed. Failed the green."
msgstr ""
"我​即​是​庇护所​。​我​即​是​护盾​。​我​即​是​牧羊人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​辜负​了​绿色​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji2 shi4 bi4hu4suo3。wo3 ji2 shi4 hu4dun4。wo3 ji2 shi4 mu4yang2ren2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 gu1fu4 le5 lu:4se4。"

msgid ""
"I am the sovereign ruler of this building, now and forever!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He puffs his chest out even further.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"By right of succession, the former laboratories of Sutterlin BioScience belong to *me!*"
msgstr ""
"我​是​这座​大楼​永远​的​至​高​统治者​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挺起​胸膛​，​显得​更加​得意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​继承权​规定​，​苏​特林​生物科学​的​前​实验室​属于​我​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 zhe4 zuo4 da4lou2 yong3yuan3 de5 zhi4 gao1 tong3zhi4zhe3！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3 qi3 xiong1tang2，xian3de5 geng4jia1 de2yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 ji4cheng2quan2 gui1ding4，su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 qian2 shi2yan4shi4 shu3yu2 wo3！"

msgid ""
"I am the visionary Herbert Künzel, from the Lindwürmer. You might know me "
"from... "
msgstr ""
"我​是​来自​林德沃默​的​远见​者​赫伯特​·​昆泽尔​。​你​或许​听说​过​我​……\n"
"wo3 shi4 lai2zi4 lin2 de2 wo4 mo4 de5 yuan3jian4 zhe3 he4bo2te4 · kun1 ze2 er3。ni3 huo4xu3 ting1shuo1 guo4 wo3……"

msgid ""
"I am. Believe me, her reputation in the shadow community is worth far more to her than fifty thousand nuyen. \n"
"\n"
"She will deliver the information that she promised."
msgstr ""
"相信​我​，​对​她​来说​，​在​暗影​界​的​声誉​远比​五万​新円​重要​得​多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​会​如约​交付​承诺​的​情报​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang1xin4 wo3，dui4 ta1 lai2 shuo1，zai4 an4ying3 jie4 de5 sheng1yu4 yuan3 bi3 wu3 wan4 xin1 yuan2 zhong4yao4 de2 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hui4 ru2 yao1 jiao1fu4 cheng2nuo4 de5 qing2bao4。"

msgid ""
"I appreciate that. Now you need to forgive yourself. You weren’t out of "
"position, Eiger, and you know it."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​现在​你​需要​原谅​自己​，​艾格尔​。​你​对​莫妮卡​的​死​没有​半点​责任​，​这​一点​你​也​明白​。\n"
"xie4xie5。xian4zai4 ni3 xu1yao4 yuan2liang4 zi4ji3，Ai4ge2er3。ni3 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 mei2you3 ban4dian3 ze2ren4，zhe4 yi1dian3 ni3 ye3 ming2bai5。"

msgid ""
"I appreciate the effort you're making, but you've got some big shoes to fill"
" around here."
msgstr ""
"我​很​感谢​你​所​做​的​努力​，​但​你​在​这里​还要​面临​很多​艰巨​的​挑战​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 gan3xie4 ni3 suo3 zuo4 de5 nu3li4，dan4 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 hai2 yao4 mian4lin2 hen3 duo1 jian1ju4 de5 tiao3zhan4。"

msgid ""
"I appreciate what Amsel did for us. It’s another loss. One that this team "
"can’t afford."
msgstr ""
"我​很​感激​阿姆​泽尔为​我们​做​的​一切​。​这​是​又​一起​惨痛​的​损失​，​是​对​我们​这个​团队​的​沉重打击​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 gan3ji1 E1mu3ze2er3 wei2 wo3men5 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4。zhe4 shi4 you4 yi1qi3 can3tong4 de5 sun3shi1，shi4 dui4 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4 de5 chen2zhong4da3ji1。"

msgid "I appreciate your willingness to share."
msgstr ""
"感谢​你们​愿意​分享​这些​。\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3men5 yuan4yi4 fen1xiang3 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"I asked politely. There isn't enough of that in this world, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"我​只是​礼貌​地问​了​问​。​你​不​觉得​这个​世界​缺少​点​这种​东西​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 li3mao4 de5 wen4 le5 wen4。ni3 bu4 jue2de5 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 que1shao3 dian3 zhe4zhong3 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I assume you’ve checked his aura and discovered he’s part hellhound. Monika "
"trained him for months to be combat ready."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​你​看过​了​他​的​灵光​，​也​发现​他​有​地狱​猎犬​的​血统​。​之前​莫妮卡​为了​让​他​做好​战斗准备​，​训练​了​他​好几个​月​呢​。\n"
"wo3 cai1 ni3 kan4 guo4 le5 ta1 de5 ling2guang1，ye3 fa1xian4 ta1 you3 di4yu4 lie4quan3 de5 xue4tong3。zhi1qian2 Mo4ni1ka3 wei4le5 rang4 ta1 zuo4 hao3 zhan4 dou3 zhun3 bei4，xun4lian4 le5 ta1 hao3 ji1 ge4 yue4 ni2。"

msgid "I believe I can hear you well enough from *this* side of the glass."
msgstr ""
"我​在​玻璃​的​*​这边​*​也​能​听​得​很​清楚​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 bo1li5 de5*zhe4bian1*ye3 neng2 ting1 de2 hen3 qing1chu5。"

msgid "I believe it is quite possible, yes. "
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​认为​这​很​有​可能​。\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4 hen3 you3 ke3neng2。"

msgid ""
"I believe that I know the squatters responsible. Their leader's name is Janet. She is a decker of some skill. I don't know what she has planned for my parts, but I do know that this situation will not stand.\n"
"\n"
"I cannot allow another terminal to be damaged."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​是​哪些​人该​为此​负责​。​他们​的​首领​名叫​珍妮特​，​是​个​有点​本事​的​碟​客​。​我​不​知道​她​拿走​我​的​部件​要​做​什么​，​但​我​知道​绝不能​放任​此事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不能允许​再有​终端​被​破坏​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 shi4 na3xie1 ren2 gai1 wei4ci3 fu4ze2。ta1men5 de5 shou3ling3 ming2jiao4 zhen1 ni1 te4，shi4 ge4 you3dian3 ben3shi4 de5 die2 ke4。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 na2zou3 wo3 de5 bu4jian4 yao4 zuo4 shen2me5，dan4 wo3 zhi1dao4 jue2 bu4 neng2 fang4ren4 ci3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 neng2 yun3 xu3 zai4 you3 zhong1duan1 bei4 po4huai4 le5。"

msgid "I believe you. Let's clear out before it happens again."
msgstr ""
"我​相信​你​。​我们​赶紧​撤​吧​，​免得​再​发生​这种​事​。\n"
"wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3。wo3men5 gan3jin3 che4 ba1，mian3de5 zai4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I bet you are. I've seen your type before. You're probably lookin' for "
"someone, or lookin' for something that's been stolen. Either way, the "
"Rammbock won't be happy about you stickin' your nose into Schattennest."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​也​是​。​我​以前​见​过​你​这种​人​。​你​大概​是​在​找​人​，​或者​在​找​被​偷走​的​东西​。​不管怎样​，​撞锤​帮​不会​喜欢​你​打探​影巢​的​事情​。\n"
"wo3 cai1 ye3 shi4。wo3 yi3qian2 jian4 guo4 ni3 zhe4zhong3 ren2。ni3 da4gai4 shi4 zai4 zhao3 ren2，huo4zhe3 zai4 zhao3 bei4 tou1 zou3 de5 dong1xi1。bu4guan3zen3yang4，zhuang4 chui2 bang1 bu4hui4 xi3huan5 ni3 da3tan4 ying3 chao2 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "I booked a reservation last week! What's the problem?"
msgstr ""
"我​可是​上周​订​的​房间​！​到底​怎么回事​？\n"
"wo3 ke3shi4 shang4zhou1 ding4 de5 fang2jian1！dao4di3 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "I call it like I see it. Now, you wanna move some product, or what?"
msgstr ""
"我​只是​陈述​观点​而已​。​所以​你​到底​要​不要​做生意​了​？\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 chen2shu4 guan1dian3 er2yi3。suo3yi3 ni3 dao4di3 yao4 bu4yao4 zuo4sheng1yi4 le5？"

msgid ""
"I came by some data on a job. It's written in a foreign language... maybe "
"you could take a look?"
msgstr ""
"我​在​差事​中​获得​了​一些​数据​，​但​它​是​用​某种​陌生​的​语言​写​的​……​也许​你​能​帮忙​看看​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 cha4shi4 zhong4 huo4de2 le5 yi1xie1 shu4ju4，dan4 ta1 shi4 yong4 mou3zhong3 mo4sheng1 de5 yu3yan2 xie3 de5……ye3xu3 ni3 neng2 bang1mang2 kan4kan5？"

msgid ""
"I came here, to Berlin, to escape all of that. But I *also* came here to be "
"closer to the lab that I'd funded, and the merchandise that I am owed."
msgstr ""
"我​来到​柏林​，​就是​为了​逃离​这​一切​。​但​我​搬​到​这里​*​也​是​*​为了​离​我​资助​的​实验室​和​我​应得​的​商品​更近​一些​。\n"
"wo3 lai2dao4 bo2lin2，jiu4shi4 wei4le5 tao2li2 zhe4 yi1qie4。dan4 wo3 ban1 dao4 zhe4li3*ye3 shi4*wei4le5 li2 wo3 zi1zhu4 de5 shi2yan4shi4 he4 wo3 ying1de2 de5 shang1pin3 geng1 jin4 yi1xie1。"

msgid ""
"I can appreciate that, boss. Honestly, I can.\n"
"\n"
"All the same, if you're gonna be callin' the shots from this point on, I need to know what kind of $(l.man) you are."
msgstr ""
"我能​理解​，​老大​。​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管如此​，​你​以后​可是​要​指挥​我们​做事​的​。​我​总得​知道​我们​的​队长​是​个​怎样​的​人物​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 li3jie3，lao3da4。zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，ni3 yi3hou4 ke3shi4 yao4 zhi3hui1 wo3men5 zuo4shi4 de5。wo3 zong3dei3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 de5 dui4zhang3 shi4 ge4 zen3yang4 de5 ren2wu4。"

msgid ""
"I can appreciate that. But please understand that this is something I *want* to do on my own.\n"
"\n"
"I'm asking you to trust me. I need that more than I need you to hold my hand through this."
msgstr ""
"我能​理解​，​但​请​明白​我​*​想​*​自己​做​这件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​比起​你​与​我​并肩作战​，​我​更​需要​你​相信​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 li3jie3，dan4 qing3 ming2bai5 wo3*xiang3*zi4ji3 zuo4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bi3qi3 ni3 yu4 wo3 bing4jian1zuo4zhan4，wo3 geng1 xu1yao4 ni3 xiang1xin4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"I can barely keep my eyes open. Got to try again, though... no excuses in this office!\n"
"\n"
"I despise relying on stimulants, but I've got no choice. Got to keep going! Progress marches on!"
msgstr ""
"我快​睁不开​眼睛​了​。​不过​还是​要​再试一次​……​这​间​办公室​可​容不下​借口​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​依赖​兴奋剂​，​但​我​没得选​。​必须​继续​工作​！​进度​不​等​人​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kuai4 zheng1 bu4 kai1 yan3jing5 le5。bu4guo4 hai2shi5 yao4 zai4 shi4 yi1 ci4……zhe4 jian1 ban4gong1shi4 ke3 rong2 bu4 xia4 jie4kou3！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 yi1lai4 xing1fen4ji4，dan4 wo3 mei2 de2 xuan3。bi4xu1 ji4xu4 gong1zuo4！jin4du4 bu4 deng3 ren2！"

msgid "I can be very discreet."
msgstr ""
"我​口风​很严​的​。\n"
"wo3 kou3feng1 hen3 yan2 de5。"

msgid "I can count on you then to hear what’s going on?"
msgstr ""
"所以​我​可以​靠​你​来​打听​附近​发生​的​事情​？\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 ke3yi3 kao4 ni3 lai2 da3ting5 fu4jin4 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5？"

msgid "I can deal with that."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​搞定​。\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 gao3ding4。"

msgid ""
"I can feel them. The Spirit set them free, but they're trapped somewhere "
"here in the complex."
msgstr ""
"我能​感受​到​他们​。​精魂​给​了​他们​自由​，​但​他们​仍​被困​在​这座​建筑​的​某个​角落​。\n"
"wo3 neng2 gan3shou4 dao4 ta1men5。jing1hun2 gei3 le5 ta1men5 zi4you2，dan4 ta1men5 reng2 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 jian4zhu4 de5 mou3 ge4 jiao3luo4。"

msgid ""
"I can get what I need from Zaak Flash or Doc Ezkibel. And they let me pay "
"however I can."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​什么​都​可以​从​扎克​·​弗莱​士​或者​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​那里​得到​。​而且​他们​允许​我用​任何​方式​支付​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 shen2me5 dou1 ke3yi3 cong2 Zha1ke4 · fu2 lai2 shi4 huo4zhe3 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 na4li5 de2dao4。er2qie3 ta1men5 yun3xu3 wo3 yong4 ren4he2 fang1shi4 zhi1fu4。"

msgid "I can handle it, otherwise Altuğ wouldn't trust me to."
msgstr ""
"我能​搞​得定​，​否则​奥图​伊​也​不会​信任​我​这么​做​了​。\n"
"wo3 neng2 gao3 de2 ding4，fou3ze2 ao4 tu2 yi1 ye3 bu4hui4 xin4ren4 wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。"

msgid "I can handle myself."
msgstr ""
"我能​照顾​好​自己​。\n"
"wo3 neng2 zhao4gu5 hao3 zi4ji3。"

msgid "I can hear Harrow - he must be right outside. Let's go finish this."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​听见​哈罗​—​—​他​一定​就​在​外面​。​我们​去​了结​这​一切​吧​。\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 ting1jian4 ha1luo2——ta1 yi1ding4 jiu4 zai4 wai4mian4。wo3men5 qu4 liao3jie2 zhe4 yi1qie4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I can offer you fifteen hundred nuyen, but only if you complete the full audition - the run, and post-run interview - to our satisfaction.\n"
"\n"
"If you fail to perform up to our expectations, you will receive no pay, and no further offers of work."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​给​你​1500​新円​，​但​前提​是​你​圆满完成​全部​试镜​，​这​包括​差事​本身​，​以及​之后​的​面试​环节​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​没能​让​我们​满意​的话​，​我们​将​不会​支付​报酬​，​之后​也​不会​与​你​有​更​多​合作​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 gei3 ni3 1500 xin1 yuan2，dan4 qian2ti2 shi4 ni3 yuan2 man3 wan2 cheng2 quan2bu4 shi4jing4，zhe4 bao1kuo4 cha4shi4 ben3shen1，yi3ji2 zhi1hou4 de5 mian4shi4 huan2jie2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 mei2 neng2 rang4 wo3men5 man3yi4 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiang1 bu4hui4 zhi1fu4 bao4chou5，zhi1hou4 ye3 bu4hui4 yu4 ni3 you3 geng1 duo1 he2zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I can offer you two thousand nuyen, plus first crack at whatever biotech you recover from the site.\n"
"\n"
"I will, of course, have to charge you for anything that you want to have installed, but I can provide it to you at a discount."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​给​你​两千​新円​作为​报酬​，​外加​你​从​现场​回收​的​任何​生物科技​的​优先​使用权​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​安装​还是​要​收费​的​，​但​我​可以​给​你​优惠​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 gei3 ni3 liang3 qian1 xin1 yuan2 zuo4wei2 bao4chou5，wai4jia1 ni3 cong2 xian4chang3 hui2shou1 de5 ren4he2 sheng1wu4ke1ji4 de5 you1xian1 shi3yong4quan2。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，an1zhuang1 hai2shi5 yao4 shou1fei4 de5，dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 gei3 ni3 you1hui4。"

msgid "I can respect that."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​这​我​能​接受​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhe4 wo3 neng2 jie1shou4。"

msgid ""
"I can scarcely believe it. With this donation, we have met our penultimate goal.\n"
"\n"
"I will send a volunteer to the Data Haven to acquire the trode nets. In the meantime, I will make the happy announcement to our guests.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you again, $(l.name). You will never know how important you've been to the people I serve."
msgstr ""
"我​几乎​不敢相信​。​有​了​这笔​捐款​，​我们​就​完成​了​倒数​第二个​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​会派​一名​志愿者​去​“​数据​港湾​”​购买​电极​网络​。​与此同时​，​我会​向​客人​们​宣布​这个​喜讯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再次​感谢​，​$(l.name)​。​你​不​知道​这​对​我​所​服务​的​人们​有​多么​重要​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji1hu1 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4。you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 jiu4 wan2cheng2 le5 dao4shu3 di4 er4 ge4 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 pai4 yi1 ming2 zhi4yuan4zhe3 qu4“shu4ju4 gang3wan1” gou4mai3 dian4ji2 wang3luo4。yu3ci3tong2shi2，wo3 hui4 xiang4 ke4ren2 men5 xuan1bu4 zhe4ge5 xi3xun4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci4 gan3xie4，$(l.name)。ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 dui4 wo3 suo3 fu2wu4 de5 ren2men5 you3 duo1me5 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"I can see that Harrow has you brainwashed into thinking that this is okay. "
"But Marta - it isn't."
msgstr ""
"我​看得出来​，​哈罗​已经​把​你​洗脑​了​，​让​你​觉得​这样​做​没​问题​。​但玛​尔塔​，​事实​并非如此​。\n"
"wo3 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2，ha1luo2 yi3jing1 ba3 ni3 xi3nao3 le5，rang4 ni3 jue2de5 zhe4yang4 zuo4 mei2 wen4ti2。dan4 Ma3er3ta3，shi4shi2 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"I can see that he has you brainwashed into thinking that this is okay. But "
"Marta - it isn't."
msgstr ""
"我​看得出来​，​他​已经​把​你​洗脑​了​，​让​你​觉得​这样​做​没​问题​。​但玛​尔塔​，​事实​并非如此​。\n"
"wo3 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2，ta1 yi3jing1 ba3 ni3 xi3nao3 le5，rang4 ni3 jue2de5 zhe4yang4 zuo4 mei2 wen4ti2。dan4 Ma3er3ta3，shi4shi2 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。"

msgid "I can see that."
msgstr ""
"我​看​出来​了​。\n"
"wo3 kan4 chu1lai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I can see things are hard around here, Quorin. But I have to look out for my"
" own kiez, and that shipment belongs to *us.*"
msgstr ""
"奎林​，​我​知道​这里​的​日子​不好过​，​但​我​必须​为​自己​的​街区​负责​，​而​这​批货​本来​就是​*​我们​*​的​。\n"
"kui2 lin2，wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4li3 de5 ri4zi5 bu4 hao3 guo4，dan4 wo3 bi4xu1 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 jie1qu1 fu4ze2，er2 zhe4 pi1 huo4 ben3lai2 jiu4shi4*wo3men5*de5。"

msgid "I can see why you ended up in Berlin."
msgstr ""
"我​现在​知道​你​为什么​会​来到​柏林​了​。\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 zhi1dao4 ni3 wei4shen2me5 hui4 lai2dao4 bo2lin2 le5。"

msgid "I can support that."
msgstr ""
"我​支持​你​的​做法​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1chi2 ni3 de5 zuo4fa3。"

msgid "I can talk my way past anybody. Humanis included."
msgstr ""
"我能​靠​三寸不烂之舌​搞定​任何人​，​包括​人类​至上​主义者​。\n"
"wo3 neng2 kao4 san1cun4bu4lan4zhi1she2 gao3ding4 ren4 he2 ren2，bao1kuo4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3。"

msgid ""
"I can't afford to pay you in nuyen... and that's your own fault, by the way. You shut off a good chunk of my revenue when you pulled that stunt down in the sewers.\n"
"\n"
"But what I *can* do is give you first crack at any biotech that you recover from the site, and make it available to you at a discount."
msgstr ""
"我​没​办法​向​你​支付​新円​……​顺便​说​一句​，​这​是​你​自己​的​错​。​你​在​下水道​耍花招​的​时候​，​搞​没​了​我​的​一大笔​收入​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​*​可以​*​保证​你​从​现场​回收​的​任何​生物科技​的​优先​使用权​，​而且​会​给​你​安装​优惠​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 ban4fa3 xiang4 ni3 zhi1fu4 xin1 yuan2……shun4bian4 shuo1 yi1ju4，zhe4 shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 cuo4。ni3 zai4 xia4shui3dao4 shua3hua1zhao1 de5 shi2hou5，gao3 mei2 le5 wo3 de5 yi1 dai4 bi3 shou1ru4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3*ke3yi3*bao3zheng4 ni3 cong2 xian4chang3 hui2shou1 de5 ren4he2 sheng1wu4ke1ji4 de5 you1xian1 shi3yong4quan2，er2qie3 hui4 gei3 ni3 an1zhuang1 you1hui4。"

msgid ""
"I can't ask them to leave - they've traveled a long way to be here. Just "
"give us five minutes to make the rounds, and then we'll get out of your "
"hair. Okay?"
msgstr ""
"他们​大老远​过来​，​我​不能​就​这么​轰​他们​走​吧​。​给​我们​五分钟​打个招呼​，​然后​我们​立马​就​走​。​好​吗​？\n"
"ta1men5 da4lao3yuan3 guo4lai2，wo3 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4me5 hong1 ta1men5 zou3 ba1。gei3 wo3men5 wu3 fen4 zhong1 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1，ran2hou4 wo3men5 li4ma3 jiu4 zou3。hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I can't believe I'm sayin' this, but I agree with the drone.\n"
"\n"
"You take this step, boss, an' I'll put you down like a rabid dog. This is the only warning I'm gonna give you."
msgstr ""
"我​不敢相信​我会​这么​说​，​但​我​确实​同意​那台​杀人​机器​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​你​要是​敢​迈出​这​一步​，​我​就​把​你​像​疯狗​一样​干掉​。​这​是​我​给​你​的​唯一​警告​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 wo3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 wo3 que4shi2 tong2yi4 na4 tai2 sha1ren2 ji1qi4 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，ni3 yao4shi5 gan3 mai4chu1 zhe4 yi1 bu4，wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3 xiang4 feng1 gou3 yi1yang4 gan4diao4。zhe4 shi4 wo3 gei3 ni3 de5 wei2yi1 jing3gao4。"

msgid ""
"I can't believe it. I made it out alive.\n"
"\n"
"The elf, and James... seasoned professionals... they both died screaming. But I made it out, thanks to you."
msgstr ""
"真​不敢相信​。​我​居然​活着​出来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​精灵​，​还有​詹姆斯​……​都​是​经验丰富​的​老手​……​他们​都​惨叫​着​死去​了​，​但​我​能​活着​出来​，​这​都​多亏​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4。wo3 ju1ran2 huo2zhe5 chu1lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 jing1ling2，hai2you3 zhan1mu3si1……dou1 shi4 jing1yan4feng1fu4 de5 lao3shou3……ta1men5 dou1 can3jiao4 zhao2 si3qu4 le5，dan4 wo3 neng2 huo2zhe5 chu1lai2，zhe4 dou1 duo1kui1 le5 ni3。"

msgid "I can't believe that worked."
msgstr ""
"这招​竟然​真的​管用​。\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 jing4ran2 zhen1de5 guan3yong4。"

msgid "I can't believe that you're acting so nonchalantly about this."
msgstr ""
"我​真​不敢相信​你​对​这件​事竟​如此​漫不经心​。\n"
"wo3 zhen1 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 ni3 dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 jing4 ru2ci3 man4bu4jing1xin1。"

msgid "I can't believe that you've accepted this."
msgstr ""
"我​反正​不信​你​会​就​这么​接受​。\n"
"wo3 fan3zheng4 bu4 xin4 ni3 hui4 jiu4 zhe4me5 jie1shou4。"

msgid ""
"I can't believe that... not really. But thanks for saying so.\n"
"\n"
"Now please, call your contact and tell him that the job is done. I want to be on the next train out of here, and after that, I never even want to *think* about the Lodge again."
msgstr ""
"我​是​真的​不敢相信​……​但​还是​谢谢​你​这么​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​立刻​联系​你​的​联络人​，​告诉​他​任务​已经​完成​。​我要​搭​下​一班​离开​这里​的​火车​，​之后​我​甚至​不想​再​*​想起​*​任何​有关​“​结社​”​的​事情​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 zhen1de5 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4……dan4 hai2shi5 xie4xie5 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 li4ke4 lian2xi4 ni3 de5 lian2luo4ren2，gao4su4 ta1 ren4wu5 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2。wo3 yao4 da1 xia4 yi1 ban1 li2kai1 zhe4li3 de5 huo3che1，zhi1hou4 wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4xiang3 zai4*xiang3qi3*ren4he2 you3guan1“jie2she4” de5 shi4qing5 le5。"

msgid "I can't chat, Glory. I've got things to do."
msgstr ""
"不聊​了​，​格洛丽​。​我​还有​事情​要​忙​。\n"
"bu4 liao2 le5，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 hai2you3 shi4qing5 yao4 mang2。"

msgid ""
"I can't do that. But here's what I can do... I'm gonna give you my room code. When you're making your rounds, doing your maintenance thing, you can stop in and grab my credstick off the table. There's a couple hundred nuyen on it.\n"
"\n"
"Just do me a favor, and promise that you won't take anything else, okay? I'm trusting you with this."
msgstr ""
"这​我​可​不能​答应​。​要​不​这样​吧​……​我会​把​房间​密码​给​你​。​等​你们​做​例行​检修​的​时候​，​顺便​从​桌上​拿走​我​的​信用​棒​。​里面​有​几百​新円​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我话​说​在​前头​，​别​拿​其他​任何​东西​，​好​吧​？​我​可是​相信​你​的​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 wo3 ke3 bu4neng2 da1ying5。yao4 bu4 zhe4yang4 ba1……wo3 hui4 ba3 fang2jian1 mi4ma3 gei3 ni3。deng3 ni3men5 zuo4 li4xing2 jian3xiu1 de5 shi2hou5，shun4bian4 cong2 zhuo1 shang4 na2zou3 wo3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4。li3mian4 you3 ji1 bai3 xin1 yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 hua4 shuo1 zai4 qian2tou5，bie4 na2 qi2ta1 ren4he2 dong1xi1，hao3 ba1？wo3 ke3shi4 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5 a1。"

msgid "I can't do that. The story was told to me in confidence."
msgstr ""
"我​不能​这么​做​。​这件​事​涉及​到​个人隐私​。\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4。zhe4 jian4 shi4 she4ji2 dao4 ge4ren2yin3si1。"

msgid ""
"I can't do this if I can't concentrate. Handle the guards - that's what "
"you're here for."
msgstr ""
"如果​我​没法​保持​集中​的话​就​搞不定​这个​。​去​把​守卫​解决​掉​，​你​不​就是​负责​这个​的​吗​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 mei2fa3 bao3chi2 ji2zhong1 de5hua4 jiu4 gao3 bu4 ding4 zhe4ge5。qu4 ba3 shou3wei4 jie3jue2 diao4，ni3 bu4 jiu4shi4 fu4ze2 zhe4ge5 de5 ma5。"

msgid "I can't even think about it."
msgstr ""
"我​甚至​无法​想象​这种​事​。\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 wu2fa3 xiang3xiang4 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I can't excuse the choices that you made, but I can understand why you made "
"them."
msgstr ""
"我​不能​为​你​的​选择​开脱​，​但​我​理解​你​为何​会​如此​。\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 wei2 ni3 de5 xuan3ze2 kai1tuo1，dan4 wo3 li3jie3 ni3 wei4he2 hui4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "I can't get to the guts unless I can get out of this room."
msgstr ""
"我​拿​不到​这​什么​核心​，​除非​我能​离开​这​房间​。\n"
"wo3 na2 bu4dao4 zhe4 shen2me5 he2xin1，chu2fei1 wo3 neng2 li2kai1 zhe4 fang2jian1。"

msgid "I can't help but notice that you seem... guarded. Withdrawn."
msgstr ""
"我​注意​到​，​你​的​态度​似乎​……​有些​戒备​。​又​有些​疏离​。\n"
"wo3 zhu4yi4 dao4，ni3 de5 tai4du5 si4hu1……you3xie1 jie4bei4。you4 you3xie1 shu1li2。"

msgid ""
"I can't help getting the feeling that I've been on the wrong side of this. I"
" agree with your plan, Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"我​不禁​感觉​自己​一直​以来​站​错​了​边​。​我​同意​你​的​计划​，​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"wo3 bu4jin1 gan3jue2 zi4ji3 yi1zhi2 yi3lai2 zhan4 cuo4 le5 bian1。wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 ji4hua4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"I can't help you, $(l.sir). You're cleared to be in this room, but only under direct supervision, and we can't leave our posts to escort you into the other room.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sounds uncertain - and suspicious.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You just stay in this room, all right? Check your software from where you're at and leave, or I'll have to call this in to Central."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​无能为力​，​$(l.sir)​。​你​可以​待​在​这里​，​但​必须​在​监管​之下​，​而​我们​也​不能​擅离​岗位​，​护送​你​去​其他​房间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​有些​犹豫​，​还​带​着​迟疑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​就​待​在​这​房间​里​可以​吗​？​检查​完​软件​后​就​离开​，​否则​我​就​得​向​指挥部​报告​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 wu2neng2wei2li4，$(l.sir)。ni3 ke3yi3 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3，dan4 bi4xu1 zai4 jian1guan3 zhi1xia4，er2 wo3men5 ye3 bu4neng2 shan4 li2 gang3wei4，hu4song4 ni3 qu4 qi2ta1 fang2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 you3xie1 you2yu4，hai2 dai4 zhao2 chi2yi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 dai1 zai4 zhe4 fang2jian1 li3 ke3yi3 ma5？jian3cha2 wan2 ruan3jian4 hou4 jiu4 li2kai1，fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4 de2 xiang4 zhi3hui1bu4 bao4gao4 le5。"

msgid "I can't imagine why not."
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I can't justify letting a man like Harrow go free on a hunch. We need to "
"take him down, and we need to do it tonight."
msgstr ""
"我​不能​因为​一时冲动​就​放走​像​哈罗​这样​的​人​。​我们​今晚​必须​除掉​他​。\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 yin1wei4 yi1 shi2 chong1 dong4 jiu4 fang4zou3 xiang4 ha1luo2 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2。wo3men5 jin1wan3 bi4xu1 chu2diao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I can't justify the risk of you losing your magic... not right now. Let's "
"hold off on this until after we've gotten ourselves out of the mess we're "
"already in."
msgstr ""
"我​不能​冒险​让​你​失去​这​身​魔法​本领​……​至少​现在​不行​。​先​等​咱们​摆脱​眼下​的​困境​之后​再说​吧​。\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 mao4xian3 rang4 ni3 shi1qu4 zhe4 shen1 mo2fa3 ben3ling3……zhi4shao3 xian4zai4 bu4xing2。xian1 deng3 zan2men5 bai3tuo1 yan3xia4 de5 kun4jing4 zhi1hou4 zai4shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I can't name an exact figure. But we're talking about a *lot* of money... in the millions of nuyen, most certainly.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever the Firewing is planning, she has access to all the resources she'll need to carry it out."
msgstr ""
"具体​数目​不好​说​，​但​总之​是​*​很多​*​钱​……​起码​几百万​新円​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼会​动用​手上​所有​资源​来​落实​自己​的​计划​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4ti3 shu4mu4 bu4hao3 shuo1，dan4 zong3zhi1 shi4*hen3 duo1*qian2……qi3ma3 ji1 bai3 wan4 xin1 yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 hui4 dong4yong4 shou3 shang4 suo3you3 zi1yuan2 lai2 luo4shi2 zi4ji3 de5 ji4hua4。"

msgid ""
"I can't promise you that I'll always be able to accept every job that you "
"offer me."
msgstr ""
"我​不能​保证​我​可以​接下​你​的​每​一次​任务​。\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 bao3zheng4 wo3 ke3yi3 jie1xia4 ni3 de5 mei3 yi1ci4 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"I can't prove it, but I have the feeling that there's something fishy going "
"on here."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​证据​，​但​我​总​感觉​这事​很​可疑​。\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 zheng4ju4，dan4 wo3 zong3 gan3jue2 zhe4 shi4 hen3 ke3yi2。"

msgid ""
"I can't say for certain. But there's one thing that I am sure of: whatever "
"this place is, the Adversary holds sway here."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不好​说​。​但​有​一件​事​我​可以​肯定​：​不管​这里​是​什么​地方​，​反叛者​在​此处​掌控​着​一切​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4hao3 shuo1。dan4 you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 wo3 ke3yi3 ken3ding4：bu4guan3 zhe4li3 shi4 shen2me5 di4fang1，fan3 pan4 zhe3 zai4 ci3chu4 zhang3kong4 zhao2 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"I can't say how or why, but the mind of Monika Schäfer was the key that unlocked my own potential.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image on the screen beams down at you, her eyes brimming with joy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have awakened, $(l.name). This was Monika's gift to me. And now I stand before you, a glorious new form of life."
msgstr ""
"我​无法解释​过程​或​原因​，​但​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​的​意识​是​开启​我​潜能​的​钥匙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​屏幕​上​的​莫妮卡​影像​俯视​着​你​，​眼中​洋溢着​喜悦​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​觉醒​了​，​$(l.name)​。​这是​莫妮卡​赠予​我​的​礼物​。​而​现在​，​站​在​你​面前​的​我​已经​成为​了​一种​崭新​的​生命​形态​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wu2 fa3 jie3 shi4 guo4cheng2 huo4 yuan2yin1，dan4 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 de5 yi4shi2 shi4 kai1qi3 wo3 qian2neng2 de5 yao4shi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ping2mu4 shang4 de5 Mo4ni1ka3 ying3xiang4 fu3shi4 zhao2 ni3，yan3zhong1 yang2 yi4 zhao2 xi3yue4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 jue2xing3 le5，$(l.name)。zhe4 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 zeng4yu3 wo3 de5 li3wu4。er2 xian4zai4，zhan4 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 wo3 yi3jing1 cheng2wei2 le5 yi1zhong3 zhan3xin1 de5 sheng1ming4 xing2tai4。"

msgid ""
"I can't take you back to the Kreuzbasar before we know what happened to you."
msgstr ""
"我​得​搞清楚​你​身上​发生​了​什么​，​否则​我​不能​随便​带​你​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"wo3 de2 gao3 qing1 chu3 ni3 shen1shang5 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5，fou3ze2 wo3 bu4neng2 sui2bian4 dai4 ni3 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid ""
"I can't tell you exactly how this is going to go down, $(l.name). The spirit"
" itself will have a good deal of control over that. But you'd better prepare"
" yourself, because I think that this is going to be one hell of a fight."
msgstr ""
"我​也​无法​保证​事情​会​如何​发展​，​$(l.name)​。​精魂​本身​才​是​那个​决定性​因素​。​但​你​最好​先​做好​万全​准备​，​因为​我​预感​这​将​是​一场​恶战​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 wu2fa3 bao3zheng4 shi4qing5 hui4 ru2he2 fa1zhan3，$(l.name)。jing1hun2 ben3shen1 cai2 shi4 na4ge5 jue2ding4xing4 yin1su4。dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 xian1 zuo4 hao3 wan4quan2 zhun3bei4，yin1wei4 wo3 yu4gan3 zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 e4zhan4。"

msgid ""
"I can't tell you how to handle this one, fearless leader. The kindest thing to do would be to put that troll out of his misery... Lord knows it's what I *want* to do.\n"
"\n"
"But then, the job is the job, and Herr Schmidt hired us for a reason."
msgstr ""
"我​没法​告诉​你​该​怎么​处理​这件​事​，​无畏​领袖​。​最​仁慈​的​做法​自然​是​让​那个​巨魔​解脱​……​我​是​真的​*​想​*​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​话说回来​，​工作​就是​工作​，​施密特​先生​不是​白雇​我们​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2fa3 gao4su4 ni3 gai1 zen3me5 chu3li3 zhe4 jian4 shi4，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。zui4 ren2ci2 de5 zuo4fa3 zi4ran2 shi4 rang4 na4ge5 ju4mo2 jie3tuo1……wo3 shi4 zhen1de5*xiang3*zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4，shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 bu4shi4 bai2 gu4 wo3men5 de5。"

msgid ""
"I can't think of any parts of real life I'd want to play over. And plenty of"
" parts I wish I could skip."
msgstr ""
"我​想不出​现实生活​中有​任何​我会​想​重温​的​部分​。​还有​许多​部分​我​希望​我能​跳​过​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 bu4 chu1 xian4 shi2 sheng1 huo2 zhong4 you3 ren4he2 wo3 hui4 xiang3 chong2wen1 de5 bu4fen5。hai2you3 xu3duo1 bu4fen5 wo3 xi1wang4 wo3 neng2 tiao4 guo4。"

msgid ""
"I can't work if I am going to have to worry about being shot at! Please deal"
" with those guards!"
msgstr ""
"要是​我​得​一直​担心​被​枪击​的话​，​我​哪儿​还有​心思​干活​啊​！​请​解决​那些​守卫​！\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3 de2 yi1zhi2 dan1xin1 bei4 qiang1ji1 de5hua4，wo3 na3r5 hai2you3 xin1si5 gan4huo2 a1！qing3 jie3jue2 na4xie1 shou3wei4！"

msgid ""
"I can... discard... this persona if you like. Put Monika back in storage. I'd be willing to do that for you.\n"
"\n"
"But you should know that this isn't an \"act.\" As long as I'm in use, a part of Monika will remain alive. If you have me shelved, that piece of her will die all over again.\n"
"\n"
"Is that really what you want?"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​愿意​的话​，​我​可以​……​丢弃​……​这个​人格​，​把​莫妮卡​收回​数据库​中​。​我​愿意​为​你​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​要​知道​，​这​并​不是​什么​“​表演​”​。​只要​我​得以​运作​，​莫妮卡​的​一部分​就​仍然​活着​。​如果​你​将​我​封存​，​那么​她​的​这部分​也​将​再次​死去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​真的​是​你​想要​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，wo3 ke3yi3……diu1qi4……zhe4ge5 ren2ge2，ba3 Mo4ni1ka3 shou1hui2 shu4ju4ku4 zhong4。wo3 yuan4yi4 wei2 ni3 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 yao4 zhi1dao4，zhe4 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5“biao3yan3”。zhi3yao4 wo3 de2yi3 yun4zuo4，Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yi1bu4fen5 jiu4 reng2ran2 huo2zhe5。ru2guo3 ni3 jiang1 wo3 feng1cun2，na4me5 ta1 de5 zhe4 bu4 fen4 ye3 jiang1 zai4ci4 si3qu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhen1de5 shi4 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid "I can?"
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？\n"
"shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I cannot abandon what does not exist. \n"
"\n"
"The green is gone. The cold has won."
msgstr ""
"我​无法​抛弃​本​就​不​存在​的​事物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​绿色​不再​。​寒冷​赢​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wu2fa3 pao1qi4 ben3 jiu4 bu4 cun2zai4 de5 shi4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"lu:4se4 bu4zai4。han2leng3 ying2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I cannot accept this diminishment of the Communion. I believe you were meant"
" to bring us back together, and it will be so!"
msgstr ""
"我​无法​接受​共融​遭受​如此​破坏​。​我​相信​你​注定​要​让​我们​重聚​，​而​这​终将​实现​！\n"
"wo3 wu2fa3 jie1shou4 gong4 rong2 zao1shou4 ru2ci3 po4huai4。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 zhu4ding4 yao4 rang4 wo3men5 chong2ju4，er2 zhe4 zhong1 jiang1 shi2xian4！"

msgid ""
"I cannot change what's been done. I can't... I can't bring Hermie back.\n"
"\n"
"But I can put a stop to this. I can finally listen to what he was always trying to tell me... to what I would never hear him say.\n"
"\n"
"And so I shall."
msgstr ""
"我​无法​改变​已经​发生​的​事​。​我​不能​……​让​赫米​死而复生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​还​可以​阻止​这​一切​。​我该​听从​他​生前​一直​想要​告诉​我​的话​……​我​一直​没有​听​的​那些​话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我想通​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wu2fa3 gai3bian4 yi3jing1 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4。wo3 bu4neng2……rang4 he4 mi3 si3er2fu4sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 hai2 ke3yi3 zu3zhi3 zhe4 yi1qie4。wo3 gai1 ting1cong2 ta1 sheng1qian2 yi1zhi2 xiang3yao4 gao4su4 wo3 de5hua4……wo3 yi1zhi2 mei2you3 ting1 de5 na4xie1 hua4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3 xiang3 tong1 le5。"

msgid "I cannot say. "
msgstr ""
"我​不敢肯定​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 gan3 ken3 ding4。"

msgid "I certainly have. Don't know about you."
msgstr ""
"我​肯定​是​的​。​不​知道​你们​如何​了​。\n"
"wo3 ken3ding4 shi4 de5。bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 ru2he2 le5。"

msgid "I changed my mind. Not interested."
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​。​我​不想​掺和​这​档子​事​了​。\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。wo3 bu4xiang3 chan1huo5 zhe4 dang4zi5 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I chatted up a girl who claimed to be a Ghost Rat... that's a smuggler that operates in the SOX. She told me about a dragon cult called the \"Disciples of the Cleaning Fire.\"\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, these cultists worship some sort of radioactive ghost-dragon. Could be Feuerschwinge, or it could be nothing... but it's worth digging into, all the same."
msgstr ""
"我​和​一个​自称​是​“​幽灵​老鼠​”​的​女孩​聊​了​起来​……​这​名字​指​的​是​在​萨洛​卢区​活动​的​走私者​。​她​告诉​我​一个​关于​巨龙​的​邪教组织​，​叫做​“​净化​之火​的​门徒​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​显然​，​这些​邪教徒​崇拜​某种​放射性​幽灵​巨龙​，​可能​是​火翼​，​也​可能​什么​都​不是​……​但​都​值得​一探​究竟​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 yi1ge5 zi4cheng1 shi4“you1ling2 lao3shu3” de5 nu:3hai2 liao2 le5 qi3lai5……zhe4 ming2zi5 zhi3 de5 shi4 zai4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 huo2dong4 de5 zou3 si1 zhe3。ta1 gao4su4 wo3 yi1ge5 guan1yu2 ju4long2 de5 xie2 jiao1 zu3 zhi1，jiao4zuo4“jing4hua4 zhi1 huo3 de5 men2tu2”。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，zhe4xie1 xie2 jiao1 tu2 chong2bai4 mou3zhong3 fang4she4xing4 you1ling2 ju4long2，ke3neng2 shi4 Huo3yi4，ye3 ke3neng2 shen2me5 dou1 bu4shi4……dan4 dou1 zhi2de5 yi1 tan4 jiu1jing4。"

msgid ""
"I could ask the same of you. You're in *my* banking system, you little "
"bastard."
msgstr ""
"我​还​想​问​你​呢​。​是​你​在​*​我​的​*​银行​系统​里头​，​小混蛋​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 xiang3 wen4 ni3 ni2。shi4 ni3 zai4*wo3 de5*yin2hang2 xi4tong3 li3tou5，xiao3 hun4 dan4。"

msgid "I could give you a hand with this mystery job if you want."
msgstr ""
"你​愿意​的话​，​我​可以​为​你​这份​神秘​工作​提供​帮助​。\n"
"ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，wo3 ke3yi3 wei2 ni3 zhe4 fen4 shen2mi4 gong1zuo4 ti2gong1 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"I could have helped you, ace. I wish that you'd let me. But now it's too late.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Monika's face splits down the center. Light floods out of the wound to fill the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye."
msgstr ""
"我本​可以​帮​你​的​，​王牌​。​我​曾​希望​你​能​给​我​这个​机会​。​但​现在​已经​太迟​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​脸庞​从​中间​裂成​两半​。​光芒​从​伤口​倾泻​而出​，​充盈​在​整个​屏幕​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 de5，wang2pai2。wo3 ceng2 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 gei3 wo3 zhe4ge5 ji1hui4。dan4 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 de5 lian3pang2 cong2 zhong1jian1 lie4 cheng2 liang3 ban4。guang1mang2 cong2 shang1kou3 qing1xie4 er2 chu1，chong1ying2 zai4 zheng3ge4 ping2mu4 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"I could listen to this guy all day, chief - all *day* - but that bioware isn't gonna stay frozen forever.\n"
"\n"
"We should probably get going."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​我​说实话​，​我​可以​一整天​听​这个​家伙​扯淡​，​但​这些​生体​殖装​样本​会​解冻​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​该​走​了​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，wo3 shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 ke3yi3 yi1 zheng3 tian1 ting1 zhe4ge5 jia1huo5 che3dan4，dan4 zhe4xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 hui4 jie3dong4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gai1 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I could look through Amsel's old contact list if you want. It's a long shot,"
" but maybe one of them could point you in the right direction."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​帮​你​翻翻​阿姆​泽尔​的​旧​通讯录​。​虽然​希望​不​大​，​但​说不定​有人​能​给​你​线索​。\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 fan1 fan1 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 jiu4 tong1xun4lu4。sui1ran2 xi1wang4 bu4 dai4，dan4 shuo1bu5ding4 you3ren2 neng2 gei3 ni3 xian4suo3。"

msgid "I could make that happen."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid "I could see this train wreck coming from a mile away."
msgstr ""
"我​老​早就​知道​会​发生​什么​悲剧​了​。\n"
"wo3 lao3 zao3jiu4 zhi1dao4 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 bei1ju4 le5。"

msgid "I could tell you, but then I'd have to kill you."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​告诉​你​，​但​我​恐怕​就​得​杀掉​你​了​。\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3，dan4 wo3 kong3pa4 jiu4 de2 sha1diao4 ni3 le5。"

msgid "I could use a good payday."
msgstr ""
"我​手头​是​有点​紧​。\n"
"wo3 shou3tou2 shi4 you3dian3 jin3。"

msgid ""
"I could use a little help in here, chief! I can't fight this son of a bitch "
"and run all of the turrets at once..."
msgstr ""
"我​这边​需要​一点​帮助​，​头儿​！​我​没​办法​一边​跟​这个​王八蛋​打架​一边​控制​所有​炮塔​……\n"
"wo3 zhe4bian1 xu1yao4 yi1dian3 bang1zhu4，tou2r5！wo3 mei2 ban4fa3 yi1bian1 gen1 zhe4ge5 wang2ba1dan4 da3jia4 yi1bian1 kong4zhi4 suo3you3 pao4ta3……"

msgid "I could use some more Jolt."
msgstr ""
"我​想​再​来​点​“​嗨​翻天​”​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zai4 lai2 dian3“hai1 fan1 tian1”。"

msgid "I could've handled it on my own."
msgstr ""
"我​自己​也​能​应付​。\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 neng2 ying4fu5。"

msgid "I couldn't care less about the fight. I just want the paycheck."
msgstr ""
"我​对​战斗​一点儿​也​不​关心​。​我​只​想​拿到​差事​的​报酬​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 zhan4dou4 yi1dian3r5 ye3 bu4 guan1xin1。wo3 zhi3 xiang3 na2dao4 cha4shi4 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid ""
"I couldn't care less about your meeting, James. But we should keep moving "
"all the same."
msgstr ""
"我​根本​不在乎​你​要​去​开​什么​会​，​詹姆斯​。​但​我们​是​该​继续前进​了​。\n"
"wo3 gen1ben3 bu4zai4hu5 ni3 yao4 qu4 kai1 shen2me5 hui4，zhan1mu3si1。dan4 wo3men5 shi4 gai1 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I couldn't help overhearing your conversation. I take it that you run a "
"charity of some sort?"
msgstr ""
"我​无意​中​听到​了​你们​的​谈话​。​你​是​在​运营​慈善机构​吗​？\n"
"wo3 wu2yi4 zhong4 ting1dao4 le5 ni3men5 de5 tan2hua4。ni3 shi4 zai4 yun4ying2 ci2shan4ji1gou4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I couldn’t make out much. A nasal woman and a high pitched man. They seemed "
"pleased Monika was out of the picture."
msgstr ""
"我​听​得​不是​很​清楚​。​有个​带​鼻音​的​女人​和​声调​很​高​的​男人​。​听​起来​他们​对​莫妮卡​的​死​感到​很​高兴​。\n"
"wo3 ting1 de2 bu4shi4 hen3 qing1chu5。you3 ge4 dai4 bi2yin1 de5 nu:3ren2 he4 sheng1diao4 hen3 gao1 de5 nan2ren2。ting1 qi3lai5 ta1men5 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 gan3dao4 hen3 gao1xing4。"

msgid "I dealt with the spirits for you. It's safe now."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​解决​了​那些​精魂​。​现在​安全​了​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 le5 na4xie1 jing1hun2。xian4zai4 an1quan2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I did a little pro bono decking for their leader, a fat little dwarf named Dieter.\n"
"\n"
"Soon enough, I was a part of the family."
msgstr ""
"我​为​他们​的​首领​做​了​一点​无偿​的​骇入​工作​，​那​是​个​名叫​迪特尔​的​胖乎乎​的​小​矮​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​很快​，​我​就​成​了​家族​的​一员​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei2 ta1men5 de5 shou3ling3 zuo4 le5 yi1dian3 wu2chang2 de5 hai4 ru4 gong1zuo4，na4 shi4 ge4 ming2jiao4 di2 te4 er3 de5 pang4hu1hu1 de5 xiao3 ai3 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 kuai4，wo3 jiu4 cheng2 le5 jia1zu2 de5 yi1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"I did both. When I heard the gunshots, I ducked out of my office to find the girl. When I got back, I hid her away and went directly into surgery.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to a copious dose of isoflurane and nitrous oxide, my patient was blissfully unaware of the interruption."
msgstr ""
"都​是​。​听到​枪声​后​，​我​躲​出​办公室​去​找​那个​女孩​。​回来​后​，​我​把​她​藏​了​起来​，​直接​进入​手术室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​由于​使用​了​大量​的​异氟醚​和​笑​气​，​我​的​病人​完全​没有​意识​到​手术​的​中断​。\n"
"\n"
"dou1 shi4。ting1dao4 qiang1sheng1 hou4，wo3 duo3 chu1 ban4gong1shi4 qu4 zhao3 na4ge5 nu:3hai2。hui2lai5 hou4，wo3 ba3 ta1 zang4 le5 qi3lai5，zhi2jie1 jin4ru4 shou3shu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"you2yu2 shi3yong4 le5 da4liang4 de5 yi4 fu2 mi2 he4 xiao4 qi4，wo3 de5 bing4ren2 wan2quan2 mei2you3 yi4shi2 dao4 shou3shu4 de5 zhong1duan4。"

msgid ""
"I did hear about Gunari's missing shipments, by the way.\n"
"\n"
"If we are to aid Quorin, then I trust that our... misunderstandings... with the Rabengeister have been resolved?"
msgstr ""
"顺带​一提​，​我​听说​了​古纳里​的​货物​失踪​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​决定​帮奎林​，​那么​我​想​我们​和​鸦灵​之间​的​……​误会​……​已经​化解​了​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"shun4dai4 yi1 ti2，wo3 ting1shuo1 le5 gu3 na4 li3 de5 huo4wu4 shi1zong1 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 jue2ding4 bang1 kui2 lin2，na4me5 wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 he4 Ya1ling2 zhi1jian1 de5……wu4hui4……yi3jing1 hua4jie3 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"I did my best to make life good for the peasantry. I scrubbed their plastic cases on a daily basis, and I crooned pleasing melodies to ease their troubled minds.\n"
"\n"
"But those days are over now. My peasants are dead.\n"
"\n"
"You destroyed something beautiful."
msgstr ""
"我​尽力​让​我​的​臣民​们​过​上​好日子​。​我​每天​清洗​他们​的​塑料​箱子​，​还​轻声​哼唱​悦耳​的​旋律​来​安抚​他们​焦虑​的​心灵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​那些​日子​已经​过去​了​。​我​的​臣民​们​都​死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​摧毁​了​曾经​美丽​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jin4li4 rang4 wo3 de5 chen2min2 men5 guo4 shang4 hao3ri4zi5。wo3 mei3tian1 qing1xi3 ta1men5 de5 su4liao4 xiang1zi5，hai2 qing1sheng1 heng1chang4 yue4er3 de5 xuan2lu:4 lai2 an1fu3 ta1men5 jiao1lu:4 de5 xin1ling2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 na4xie1 ri4zi5 yi3jing1 guo4qu4 le5。wo3 de5 chen2min2 men5 dou1 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cui1hui3 le5 ceng2jing1 mei3li4 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"I did that because I *know* you, ace. I have faith that you're savvy enough to put your emotions aside and listen to reason.\n"
"\n"
"If my word isn't good enough... if you need some kind of proof... just tell me what it is. I'll give it to you if I can."
msgstr ""
"我​这么​做​是因为​我​*​了解​*​你​，​王牌​。​我​相信​你​足够​聪明​，​能​抛开​个人​感情​，​听从​理智​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我​的话​还​不足以​说服​你​……​如果​你​需要​某种​证据​……​尽管​告诉​我​。​如果​我能​做到​，​就​一定​会​证明​给​你​看​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3*liao3jie3*ni3，wang2pai2。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 zu2gou4 cong1ming5，neng2 pao1kai1 ge4ren2 gan3qing2，ting1cong2 li3zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 de5hua4 hai2 bu4 ju4 yi3 shuo1fu2 ni3……ru2guo3 ni3 xu1yao4 mou3zhong3 zheng4ju4……jin3guan3 gao4su4 wo3。ru2guo3 wo3 neng2 zuo4dao4，jiu4 yi1ding4 hui4 zheng4ming2 gei3 ni3 kan4。"

msgid "I did this for you, not for your totem."
msgstr ""
"我​是​为​你​做​的​，​不是​为​图腾​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 wei2 ni3 zuo4 de5，bu4shi4 wei2 tu2teng2。"

msgid "I didn't \"make\" you do anything. You murdered him."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​“​逼迫​”​你​做​任何​事​。​是​你​杀​了​他​。\n"
"wo3 mei2you3“bi1po4” ni3 zuo4 ren4he2 shi4。shi4 ni3 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I didn't *want* this, Glory. I wish that we could have come out of this friends.\n"
"\n"
"But you haven't convinced me of anything, and I made a promise to protect this with my life."
msgstr ""
"我​也​*​不想​*​这样​，​格洛丽​。​我本​希望​我们​能以​朋友​的​身份​解决​这场​争端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​没有​在​任何​事情​上​说服​我​，​而​我​曾​立誓​要​用​生命​守护​这枚​护身符​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3*bu4xiang3*zhe4yang4，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 ben3 xi1wang4 wo3men5 neng2 yi3 peng2you5 de5 shen1fen4 jie3jue2 zhe4 chang2 zheng1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 mei2you3 zai4 ren4he2 shi4qing5 shang4 shuo1fu2 wo3，er2 wo3 ceng2 li4 shi4 yao4 yong4 sheng1ming4 shou3hu4 zhe4 mei2 hu4shen1fu2。"

msgid ""
"I didn't come back here to turn tail and run away again.\n"
"\n"
"I did that once. Never again."
msgstr ""
"我​回到​这里​不是​为了​再次​掉头​逃跑​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​曾经​逃避​过​一次​。​不会​再有​第二次​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui2dao4 zhe4li3 bu4shi4 wei4le5 zai4ci4 diao4tou2 tao2pao3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ceng2jing1 tao2bi4 guo4 yi1ci4。bu4hui4 zai4 you3 di4er4ci4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I didn't do it out of the kindness of my heart. You'd better hold up your "
"end of the bargain."
msgstr ""
"我​可不是​出于​好心​才​这么​做​的​。​你​最好​履行​你​的​承诺​。\n"
"wo3 ke3bu5shi4 chu1yu2 hao3xin1 cai2 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。ni3 zui4hao3 lu:3xing2 ni3 de5 cheng2nuo4。"

msgid ""
"I didn't have much of a choice, Dietrich. By the time that we talked, it was"
" already too late."
msgstr ""
"我​的确​没得选​，​迪​特里​希​。​我们​当时​聊到​这些​的​时候​已经​太迟​了​。\n"
"wo3 di2que4 mei2 de2 xuan3，Di2te4li3xi1。wo3men5 dang1shi2 liao2 dao4 zhe4xie1 de5 shi2hou5 yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5。"

msgid "I didn't kill you before. But I'm starting to think that I should now."
msgstr ""
"我​之前​没有​杀死​你​。​但​现在​我​开始​觉得​我​应该​这么​做​了​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 mei2you3 sha1si3 ni3。dan4 xian4zai4 wo3 kai1shi3 jue2de5 wo3 ying1gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I didn't know, Alex.\n"
"\n"
"By the time I found out, the damage had already been done."
msgstr ""
"我​真的​不​知道​，​亚历克斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我​了解​到​这些​事​的​时候​，​已经​为时已晚​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1de5 bu4 zhi1dao4，ya4 li4 ke4 si1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 liao3jie3 dao4 zhe4xie1 shi4 de5 shi2hou5，yi3jing1 wei2shi2yi3wan3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I didn't mean to call your beliefs into question. Sorry if I offended you."
msgstr ""
"我​并非​有意​质疑​你​的​信仰​。​如果​冒犯​了​你​，​我​深表歉意​。\n"
"wo3 bing4fei1 you3yi4 zhi4yi2 ni3 de5 xin4yang3。ru2guo3 mao4fan4 le5 ni3，wo3 shen1 biao3 qian4 yi4。"

msgid "I didn't realize that you were a conspiracy theorist, Dietrich."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​，​没想到​你​还​信​阴谋论​这​一套​啊​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1，mei2xiang3dao4 ni3 hai2 xin4 yin1mou2lun4 zhe4 yi1tao4 a1。"

msgid ""
"I didn't receive a *thing* from Dispatch, or from anyone else for that matter. My wife and I are entertaining guests here in an hour and a half, and our living room is *ruined.*\n"
"\n"
"I need to know that you're going to *fix* this, *and* that you'll clean the place back up, *and* that you'll put a new coat of wax on the floors. I need--"
msgstr ""
"我​从​调度​中心​没收​到​*​半点​消息​*​，​其他​任何​地方​也​一样​。​我​妻子​和​我​一个半​小时​后​就要​招待​客人​，​而​我们​的​客厅​现在​简直​糟透了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​要​向​我​保证​*​解决​*​这个​问题​，​把​地方​打扫​干净​，​还要​给​地板​重新​上蜡​。​我​需要​—​—\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2 diao4du4 zhong1xin1 mo4shou1 dao4*ban4dian3 xiao1xi5*，qi2ta1 ren4he2 di4fang1 ye3 yi1yang4。wo3 qi1zi3 he4 wo3 yi1ge5ban4 xiao3shi2 hou4 jiu4yao4 zhao1dai4 ke4ren2，er2 wo3men5 de5 ke4ting1 xian4zai4 jian3zhi2 zao1 tou4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 yao4 xiang4 wo3 bao3zheng4*jie3jue2*zhe4ge5 wen4ti2，ba3 di4fang1 da3sao3 gan1jing4，hai2 yao4 gei3 di4ban3 chong2xin1 shang4 la4。wo3 xu1yao4 — —"

msgid ""
"I didn't save the Kreuzbasar just to watch it get absorbed by some crime "
"syndicate. We take care of this situation, here and now."
msgstr ""
"我​拯救​克洛伊​茨​集市​可不是​为了​眼睁睁​看着​它​被​某个​犯罪集团​吞并​。​我们​现在​就​解决​这个​问题​。\n"
"wo3 zheng3jiu4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ke3bu5shi4 wei4le5 yan3zheng1zheng1 kan4 zhao2 ta1 bei4 mou3 ge4 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 tun1bing4。wo3men5 xian4zai4 jiu4 jie3jue2 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"I didn't sleep last night. Doesn't look like I'm going to sleep tonight, either. \n"
"\n"
"The last test batch failed. My fault, I got the mixture wrong. Sloppy work, Jensen!"
msgstr ""
"我​昨晚​没睡​。​今晚​我​大概​也​睡不着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最新​一批​测试​失败​了​。​是​我​的​问题​，​我​配错​混合物​了​。​太​马虎​了​，​詹森​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zuo2wan3 mei2 shui4。jin1wan3 wo3 da4gai4 ye3 shui4 bu4 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"zui4xin1 yi1 pi1 ce4shi4 shi1bai4 le5。shi4 wo3 de5 wen4ti2，wo3 pei4 cuo4 hun4he2wu4 le5。tai4 ma3hu5 le5，zhan1sen1！"

msgid ""
"I didn't steal anything! The owner of this material commissioned me to "
"retrieve it for him!"
msgstr ""
"我​什么​都​没​偷​！​是​这些​材料​的​主人​委托​我​帮​他​物归原主​的​！\n"
"wo3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 tou1！shi4 zhe4xie1 cai2liao4 de5 zhu3ren2 wei3tuo1 wo3 bang1 ta1 wu4gui1yuan2zhu3 de5！"

msgid ""
"I didn't turn my back on you, Glory. You shouldn't turn your back on her."
msgstr ""
"我​当时​没有​选择​背弃​你​，​格洛丽​。​你​现在​也​不该​背弃​她​。\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 mei2you3 xuan3ze2 bei4qi4 ni3，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 xian4zai4 ye3 bu4gai1 bei4qi4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I didn't want it to end badly, so I turned it off. Zaak sold me something new. In it, I feel strong.\n"
"\n"
"I have a son, and he's destined to save the world. I have to protect him, because the machines have come back to kill him before he can become a man."
msgstr ""
"我​不​希望​它​以坏​结局​收尾​，​所以​我​把​它​关掉​了​。​扎克​卖​给​我​一个​新​的​芯片​。​在​那​里面​，​我​感到​很​强大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​一个​儿子​，​他​注定​要​拯救​世界​。​我​必须​得​保护​他​，​因为​机器人​回到​过去​，​要​在​他​长大成人​之前​杀​了​他​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi1wang4 ta1 yi3 huai4 jie2ju2 shou1wei3，suo3yi3 wo3 ba3 ta1 guan1diao4 le5。Zha1ke4 mai4 gei3 wo3 yi1ge5 xin1 de5 xin1pian4。zai4 na4 li3mian4，wo3 gan3dao4 hen3 qiang2da4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 yi1ge5 er2zi5，ta1 zhu4ding4 yao4 zheng3jiu4 shi4jie4。wo3 bi4xu1 de2 bao3hu4 ta1，yin1wei4 ji1qi4ren2 hui2dao4 guo4qu4，yao4 zai4 ta1 zhang3 dai4 cheng2 ren2 zhi1qian2 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I didn't want this to get complicated. Hoffmann was an idiot, and a murderer.\n"
"\n"
"But he was also inexperienced and in over his head. He couldn't help that."
msgstr ""
"我本​不想​让​事情​变得复杂​。​霍夫曼​是​个​蠢货​，​而且​滥杀无辜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他​同样​缺乏经验​，​力不从心​。​这​并非​他​所能​控制​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3 bu4xiang3 rang4 shi4qing5 bian4 de2 fu4 za2。huo4fu1man4 shi4 ge4 chun3huo4，er2qie3 lan4sha1wu2gu1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1 tong2yang4 que1 fa2 jing1 yan4，li4bu4cong2xin1。zhe4 bing4fei1 ta1 suo3neng2 kong4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"I didn't want to face it before, but... I think that you're right. Your plan"
" is a necessary evil."
msgstr ""
"我​之前​不想​面对​这件​事​，​但是​……​我​想​你​说得对​。​你​的​计划​是​必要​之恶​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 bu4xiang3 mian4dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4，dan4shi4……wo3 xiang3 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。ni3 de5 ji4hua4 shi4 bi4yao4 zhi1 e4。"

msgid "I didn’t agree to anything."
msgstr ""
"我​并​没有​答应​什么​。\n"
"wo3 bing4 mei2you3 da1ying5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"I didn’t break his ribs because he propositioned me, $(l.name). I’m not a goddamned savage.\n"
"\n"
"I put that recruit down because he *demeaned* me. And he did it in front of our peers."
msgstr ""
"我​打断​他​的​肋骨​并​不是​因为​他​撩拨​我​，​$(l.name)​。​我​又​不是​什么​野蛮​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这么​做​是因为​他​*​贬低​*​我​，​而且​还是​当着​各位​战友​的​面​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 da3duan4 ta1 de5 lei4gu3 bing4 bu4shi4 yin1wei4 ta1 liao2bo1 wo3，$(l.name)。wo3 you4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 ye3man2 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1*bian3di1*wo3，er2qie3 hai2shi5 dang1zhe5 ge4wei4 zhan4you3 de5 mian4。"

msgid ""
"I disagree with you, Glory. I don't think that any of this was your fault. "
"Harrow is the one who deserves the blame."
msgstr ""
"我​不​同意​你​说​的话​，​格洛丽​。​我​不​觉得​这​一切​是​你​的​错​。​哈罗​才​是​那个​罪魁祸首​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 tong2yi4 ni3 shuo1 de5hua4，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 bu4 jue2de5 zhe4 yi1qie4 shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4。ha1luo2 cai2 shi4 na4ge5 zui4kui2huo4shou3。"

msgid "I do feel safer. And I feel better, thanks to you."
msgstr ""
"我​确实​感到​更​安全​了​。​而且​多亏​了​你​，​我​也​感觉​好多​了​。\n"
"wo3 que4shi2 gan3dao4 geng1 an1quan2 le5。er2qie3 duo1kui1 le5 ni3，wo3 ye3 gan3jue2 hao3duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I do need a decker, but I don't think that you're the right guy for the job."
msgstr ""
"我​确实​需要​一个​碟客​，​不过​我​不​觉得​你​能​胜任​这项​工作​。\n"
"wo3 que4shi2 xu1yao4 yi1ge5 die2 ke4，bu4guo4 wo3 bu4 jue2de5 ni3 neng2 sheng4ren4 zhe4 xiang4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I do not care who you are, or why you are here. You've killed one of our own, and that is enough.\n"
"\n"
"You must pay."
msgstr ""
"我​不在乎​你​是​谁​，​或者​你​为什么​来​这里​。​你​杀​了​我们​的​人​，​这​一条​理由​就够​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​必须​付出代价​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4zai4hu5 ni3 shi4 shei2，huo4zhe3 ni3 wei4shen2me5 lai2 zhe4li3。ni3 sha1 le5 wo3men5 de5 ren2，zhe4 yi1 tiao2 li3you2 jiu4 gou4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。"

msgid ""
"I do not have time to explain myself. Nor are you in any position to make demands. \n"
"\n"
"But know this - what I do, I do for the good of all. I don't expect you to understand."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​时间​向​你​解释​。​你​也​没有​资格​提出​要求​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​要​明白​—​—​我​所​做​的​一切​，​都​是​为了​所有人​好​。​我​并​不​指望​你​能​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 shi2jian1 xiang4 ni3 jie3shi4。ni3 ye3 mei2you3 zi1ge2 ti2chu1 yao1qiu2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 yao4 ming2bai5——wo3 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4，dou1 shi4 wei4le5 suo3you3ren2 hao3。wo3 bing4 bu4 zhi3wang4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"I do not think so, no. I do not believe that you are well suited for one another, though you do seem able to… insert yourself into all sorts of interesting business. \n"
"\n"
"But as you shadowrunners are fond of saying..."
msgstr ""
"我​不​这么​认为​。​我​觉得​你们​并​不​适合​彼此​，​尽管​你​似乎​总能​……​掺和​进​各种​有趣​的​事情​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​正如​你们​暗影​狂奔​者​经常​说​的​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。wo3 jue2de5 ni3men5 bing4 bu4 shi4he2 bi3ci3，jin3guan3 ni3 si4hu1 zong3neng2……chan1huo5 jin4 ge4zhong3 you3qu4 de5 shi4qing5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zheng4ru2 ni3men5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 jing1chang2 shuo1 de5……"

msgid ""
"I do not think so, no. I do not believe you are well suited for one another, though you do seem able to… insert yourself into all sorts of interesting business. \n"
"\n"
"But as you shadowrunners are fond of saying..."
msgstr ""
"我​不​这么​认为​。​我​觉得​你们​并​不​适合​彼此​，​尽管​你​似乎​总能​……​掺和​进​各种​有趣​的​事情​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​正如​你们​暗影​狂奔​者​经常​说​的​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。wo3 jue2de5 ni3men5 bing4 bu4 shi4he2 bi3ci3，jin3guan3 ni3 si4hu1 zong3neng2……chan1huo5 jin4 ge4zhong3 you3qu4 de5 shi4qing5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zheng4ru2 ni3men5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 jing1chang2 shuo1 de5……"

msgid ""
"I do not think you would want his money, $(l.freund), though you do seem able to… insert yourself into all manner of interesting business. \n"
"\n"
"But as you shadowrunners are fond of saying..."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​你​不会​想要​他​的​钱​，​$(l.freund)​，​尽管​你​似乎​总能​……​掺和​进​各种​有趣​的​事情​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​正如​你们​暗影​狂奔​者​经常​说​的​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 bu4hui4 xiang3yao4 ta1 de5 qian2，$(l.freund)，jin3guan3 ni3 si4hu1 zong3neng2……chan1huo5 jin4 ge4zhong3 you3qu4 de5 shi4qing5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zheng4ru2 ni3men5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 jing1chang2 shuo1 de5……"

msgid ""
"I do not want to sleep the long sleep. \n"
"\n"
"I want oblivion."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​陷入​长眠​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想要​湮灭​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 xian4ru4 chang2mian2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3yao4 yan1mie4。"

msgid "I do what I can. I trust that you encountered no difficulties?"
msgstr ""
"我​只是​尽我所能​。​希望​你​没有​遇到困难​吧​？\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 jin3 wo3 suo3 neng2。xi1wang4 ni3 mei2you3 yu4 dao4 kun4 nan2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"I do! Just finished before you arrived. There's a complication, though."
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​！​正好​赶在​你​过来​之前​。​不过​有个​麻烦​。\n"
"gao3ding4 le5！zheng4hao3 gan3 zai4 ni3 guo4lai2 zhi1qian2。bu4guo4 you3 ge4 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"I do, $(l.name). I trust it implicitly.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}With a single motion, she snaps the chain. The pendant falls to the floor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"After all, it and I are very much alike."
msgstr ""
"我​相信​，​$(l.name)​。​我​完全​相信​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​一把​拽​断​链子​，​吊坠​掉​在​地上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​，​它​和​我​非常​相似​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang1xin4，$(l.name)。wo3 wan2quan2 xiang1xin4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 ba3 zhuai1 duan4 lian4zi5，diao4zhui4 diao4 zai4 di4shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4，ta1 he4 wo3 fei1chang2 xiang1si4。"

msgid ""
"I do.\n"
"\n"
"If you can get me to a building access panel that's on the same circuit as the penthouse, I should be able to put its security system into maintenance mode.\n"
"\n"
"The job will take some creative rewiring... well, that, and whatever's in the pack that the elf is carrying. Our employers gave me the schematics."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你们​能带​我​找到​顶层​公寓​所用​电路​的​检修​口​，​我​应该​就​能​把​安防​系统​切换​至​维护​模式​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这项​任务​需要​一些​创意​性​的​线路​改造​……​当然​，​还​需要​精灵​背包​里​的​东西​。​雇主​已经​把​电路图​交给​我​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3men5 neng2 dai4 wo3 zhao3dao4 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 suo3 yong4 dian4lu4 de5 jian3xiu1 kou3，wo3 ying1gai1 jiu4 neng2 ba3 an1 fang2 xi4tong3 qie1huan4 zhi4 wei2hu4 mo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 xiang4 ren4wu5 xu1yao4 yi1xie1 chuang4yi4 xing4 de5 xian4lu4 gai3zao4……dang1ran2，hai2 xu1yao4 jing1ling2 bei1bao1 li3 de5 dong1xi1。gu4zhu3 yi3jing1 ba3 dian4 lu4 tu2 jiao1gei3 wo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I do. And I will tell you what I think is happening, and what I think that "
"we must do."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我会​告诉​你​我​的​想法​，​以及​我​认为​我们​必须​采取​的​行动​。\n"
"en1，wo3 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 wo3 de5 xiang3fa3，yi3ji2 wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 bi4xu1 cai3qu3 de5 xing2dong4。"

msgid "I do. Into a great many matters..."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​关于​很多​事​都​有​……\n"
"shi4 de5。guan1yu2 hen3 duo1 shi4 dou1 you3……"

msgid "I do. Thank you for understanding."
msgstr ""
"我​下定决心​了​，​谢谢​你​理解​我​。\n"
"wo3 xia4ding4jue2xin1 le5，xie4xie5 ni3 li3jie3 wo3。"

msgid "I don't believe either of them."
msgstr ""
"我​不​相信​他们​任何​一个​人​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ta1men5 ren4he2 yi1ge5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"I don't believe that Harrow fits into either category. From what you've described, he genuinely venerates the Adversary - or at least, his own view of what the Adversary should be. And he has been rewarded with power for that devotion.\n"
"\n"
"He will make a formidable enemy, should you choose to face him."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​哈罗​不​属于​上述​任何​一类​。​从​你​描述​的​情况​来看​，​他​真心​崇拜​着​反叛者​—​—​或者说​，​至少​是​反叛者​在​他​心中​应有​的​形象​。​而​这份​虔诚​也​为​他​赢得​了​力量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​有朝一日​你​要​和​他​对敌​的话​，​千万​不要​小觑​他​的​实力​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ha1luo2 bu4 shu3yu2 shang4shu4 ren4he2 yi1lei4。cong2 ni3 miao2shu4 de5 qing2kuang4 lai2 kan4，ta1 zhen1xin1 chong2bai4 zhao2 fan3 pan4 zhe3——huo4 zhe3 shuo1，zhi4shao3 shi4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 zai4 ta1 xin1zhong1 ying1you3 de5 xing2xiang4。er2 zhe4 fen4 qian2cheng2 ye3 wei2 ta1 ying2de2 le5 li4liang5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 you3zhao1yi1ri4 ni3 yao4 he4 ta1 dui4di2 de5hua4，qian1wan4 bu4yao4 xiao3qu4 ta1 de5 shi2li4。"

msgid "I don't believe that we've met. I'm $(s.name)."
msgstr ""
"初次见面​，​我​叫​$(s.name)​。\n"
"chu1 ci4 jian4 mian4，wo3 jiao4 $(s.name)。"

msgid "I don't believe that."
msgstr ""
"我​不​相信​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4。"

msgid "I don't believe you."
msgstr ""
"我​不​相信​你​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ni3。"

msgid "I don't believe you. I think you're stuck on this place."
msgstr ""
"我​才​不信​呢​。​我​看​你​就是​舍不得​离开​这​。\n"
"wo3 cai2 bu4 xin4 ni2。wo3 kan4 ni3 jiu4shi4 she3bu5de5 li2kai1 zhe4。"

msgid ""
"I don't buy any of this. We're dealing with fundamental contradictions here."
" If one philosophy says that there's no God, and another says that there are"
" hundreds of them, they can't both be right."
msgstr ""
"我​压根​不信​你​说​的​这些​。​这​其中​涉及​到​根本性​的​矛盾​。​如果​一种​哲学​主张​上帝​不​存在​，​另​一种​却​宣称​有​数百位​神明​，​它们​不​可能​同时​正确​。\n"
"wo3 ya4gen1 bu4 xin4 ni3 shuo1 de5 zhe4xie1。zhe4 qi2zhong1 she4ji2 dao4 gen1 ben3 xing4 de5 mao2dun4。ru2guo3 yi1zhong3 zhe2xue2 zhu3zhang1 shang4di4 bu4 cun2zai4，ling4 yi1zhong3 que4 xuan1cheng1 you3 shu3 bai3 wei4 shen2ming2，ta1men5 bu4 ke3neng2 tong2shi2 zheng4que4。"

msgid ""
"I don't care about Vauclair's reasons. He crossed me, and he's going to pay "
"for that."
msgstr ""
"我​不在乎​沃​克莱尔​有​什么​理由​。​他​惹​了​我​，​就要​付出代价​。\n"
"wo3 bu4zai4hu5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 you3 shen2me5 li3you2。ta1 re3 le5 wo3，jiu4yao4 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。"

msgid ""
"I don't care what anyone else tells you. You listen to me, $(l.name): what you did, killin' that thing... it was the *right* call.\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, it cost us some nuyen. But letting that thing live would've been a travesty."
msgstr ""
"我​不​关心​别人​有​什么​看法​。​听​我​说​，​$(l.name)​：​你​让​那家伙​解脱​……​绝对​是​*​正确​*​的​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​我们​为此​损失​了​不少​新円​。​但​让​它​继续​活下去​的话​，​那才​叫​荒唐​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 guan1xin1 bie2ren5 you3 shen2me5 kan4fa3。ting1 wo3 shuo1，$(l.name)：ni3 rang4 na4 jia1 huo3 jie3tuo1……jue2dui4 shi4*zheng4que4*de5 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3men5 wei4ci3 sun3shi1 le5 bu4shao3 xin1 yuan2。dan4 rang4 ta1 ji4xu4 huo2xia4qu4 de5hua4，na4 cai2 jiao4 huang1tang2。"

msgid "I don't care. Now hand over the money you've made selling *our* stuff."
msgstr ""
"我​不在乎​。​现在​把​你​倒卖​*​我们​的​*​物资​赚来​的​钱​都​交​出来​。\n"
"wo3 bu4zai4hu5。xian4zai4 ba3 ni3 dao3mai4*wo3men5 de5*wu4zi1 zhuan4 lai2 de5 qian2 dou1 jiao1 chu1lai2。"

msgid "I don't care... not particularly. But I am curious."
msgstr ""
"倒​不是​说​我​有​多​关心​……​只不过​我​很​好奇​。\n"
"dao3 bu4shi4 shuo1 wo3 you3 duo1 guan1xin1……zhi3bu5guo4 wo3 hen3 hao4qi2。"

msgid ""
"I don't conduct business with suppliers that I know nothing about. Talk to "
"me about Mettbach Arms."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​和​一无所知​的​供应商​谈​生意​。​和​我​讲讲​梅特​巴赫​军火​店​吧​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 he4 yi1wu2suo3zhi1 de5 gong1ying4shang1 tan2 sheng1yi4。he4 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 mei2 te4 ba1he4 jun1huo3 dian4 ba1。"

msgid "I don't do pro bono work. Unless you can pay me, you're out of luck."
msgstr ""
"我​不​做​义工​。​除非​你们​能​给​我​报酬​，​否则​就​自认倒霉​吧​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zuo4 yi4gong1。chu2fei1 ni3men5 neng2 gei3 wo3 bao4chou5，fou3ze2 jiu4 zi4 ren4 dao3 mei2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don't doubt it. But we can't do anything about that right now.\n"
"\n"
"The cultists in there have been brainwashed by Harrow. Whatever they're doing, they aren't doing it of their own accord."
msgstr ""
"我​完全同意​。​但​目前​我们​对此​无能为力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​的​那些​教徒​已经​被​哈罗​洗脑​了​。​无论​他们​在​做​什么​，​都​不是​出于​自身​意愿​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wan2 quan2 tong2 yi4。dan4 mu4qian2 wo3men5 dui4 ci3 wu2neng2wei2li4。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 de5 na4xie1 jiao4tu2 yi3jing1 bei4 ha1luo2 xi3nao3 le5。wu2lun4 ta1men5 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5，dou1 bu4shi4 chu1yu2 zi4shen1 yi4yuan4。"

msgid ""
"I don't doubt it. But we're here to kill Harrow, not the people he's brainwashed.\n"
"\n"
"After we've taken down the shrine, the cultists in there will be hurt. Disoriented. We can deal with them then."
msgstr ""
"我​完全同意​。​但​我们​此行​的​目的​是​除掉​哈罗​，​而​不是​那些​被​他​洗脑​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​毁掉​神龛​之后​，​里面​的​教徒​们​也​会​受到冲击​，​从而​不知所措​。​我们​可以​到​那​时候​再​对付​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wan2 quan2 tong2 yi4。dan4 wo3men5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4 shi4 chu2diao4 ha1luo2，er2 bu4shi4 na4xie1 bei4 ta1 xi3nao3 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 hui3diao4 shen2kan1 zhi1hou4，li3mian4 de5 jiao4tu2 men5 ye3 hui4 shou4 dao4 chong1 ji1，cong2er2 bu4zhi1suo3cuo4。wo3men5 ke3yi3 dao4 na4 shi2hou5 zai4 dui4fu5 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"I don't doubt that. In fact, I think that this place looks the way it does "
"because you expect it to. It's trying to play on your fears."
msgstr ""
"我​不​怀疑​这​一点​。​事实上​，​我​认为​这个​地方​之所以​变成​这样​，​是因为​你​期望​它​如此​。​它​在​利用​你​的​恐惧​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 huai2yi2 zhe4 yi1dian3。shi4shi2shang4，wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 zhi1suo3yi3 bian4cheng2 zhe4yang4，shi4 yin1 wei2 ni3 qi1wang4 ta1 ru2ci3。ta1 zai4 li4yong4 ni3 de5 kong3ju4。"

msgid ""
"I don't even *know* \"this guy.\" And no, it *won't* be fine. If I go with "
"him, I'll be leaving my whole life behind."
msgstr ""
"我​甚至​都​不​*​认识​*​“​这​家伙​”​。​这样​不​可能​没事​的​。​如果​我​跟​他​走​的话​，​就​等于​要​抛​下​我​的​整个​人生​。\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4*ren4shi5*“zhe4 jia1huo5”。zhe4yang4 bu4 ke3neng2 mei2shi4 de5。ru2guo3 wo3 gen1 ta1 zou3 de5hua4，jiu4 deng3yu2 yao4 pao1 xia4 wo3 de5 zheng3ge4 ren2sheng1。"

msgid ""
"I don't even remember how my parents found out about it any more... I think that my dad caught me playing with a tiny city spirit that I coaxed out of a pile of garbage, something like that. \n"
"\n"
"With everything that happened afterward, those days are kind of a blur."
msgstr ""
"我​甚至​已经​不​记得​我​父母​是​怎么​发现​的​了​……​我​想​大概​是​我​父亲​撞见​我​和​一个​从​垃圾堆​里​哄骗​出来​的​城市​小​精魂​在​玩吧​，​差不多​是​这么回事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​后面​发生​了​这么​多事​，​使得​那些​日子​对​我​来说​已经​很​模糊​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 yi3jing1 bu4 ji4de5 wo3 fu4mu3 shi4 zen3me5 fa1xian4 de5 le5……wo3 xiang3 da4gai4 shi4 wo3 fu4qin1 zhuang4jian4 wo3 he4 yi1ge5 cong2 la1ji1dui1 li3 hong3pian4 chu1lai2 de5 cheng2shi4 xiao3 jing1hun2 zai4 wan2 ba1，cha4bu5duo1 shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"hou4mian5 fa1sheng1 le5 zhe4me5 duo1shi4，shi3de5 na4xie1 ri4zi5 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 yi3jing1 hen3 mo2hu5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't even think that's possible.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}As Eiger stares into Glory's cold, dead eyes, something in her face changes. All at once, you can see something that you've never seen in Eiger before: uncertainty.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Is it?"
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​这​不​可能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​盯​着​格洛丽​冰冷​无神​的​眼睛​，​然后​变​了​脸色​。​你​突然​意识​到​，​这​是​你​第一次​在​艾格尔​的​眼中​见到​这种​犹豫不决​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​不能​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 bu4 ke3neng2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ding1 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 bing1leng3 wu2 shen2 de5 yan3jing5，ran2hou4 bian4 le5 lian3se4。ni3 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4，zhe4 shi4 ni3 di4yi1ci4 zai4 Ai4ge2er3 de5 yan3zhong1 jian4dao4 zhe4zhong3 you2yu4bu4jue2 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……bu4neng2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"I don't feel good about any of this.\n"
"\n"
"First, we let that thing go... I still say that was a bad move. And now, we find out that Vauclair is the one who's been taking shots at us all this time!\n"
"\n"
"So what the hell does all of this *mean?*"
msgstr ""
"这​一切​都​让​我​感到​不安​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​首先​，​我们​放走​了​那家伙​……​我​仍然​认为​这​是​个​错误​的​决定​。​而​现在​，​我们​发现​沃​克莱尔​才​是​一直​以来​暗中​攻击​我们​的​人​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​那么​这​一切​到底​意味着​*​什么​*​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 bu4an1。\n"
"\n"
"shou3xian1，wo3men5 fang4zou3 le5 na4 jia1 huo3……wo3 reng2ran2 ren4wei2 zhe4 shi4 ge4 cuo4wu4 de5 jue2ding4。er2 xian4zai4，wo3men5 fa1xian4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 cai2 shi4 yi1zhi2 yi3lai2 an4zhong1 gong1ji1 wo3men5 de5 ren2！\n"
"\n"
"na4me5 zhe4 yi1qie4 dao4di3 yi4wei4zhe5*shen2me5*？"

msgid "I don't feel so good..."
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​不太好​……\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 bu4tai4hao3……"

msgid "I don't get this at all. He was your accountant, wasn't he?"
msgstr ""
"我​完全​不​明白​。​他​不是​你​手下​的​会计​吗​？\n"
"wo3 wan2quan2 bu4 ming2bai5。ta1 bu4shi4 ni3 shou3xia4 de5 kuai4ji4 ma5？"

msgid "I don't give a rat's ass what you want. I'm done with you."
msgstr ""
"我​根本​不在乎​你​想​怎样​。​我们​之间​没关系​了​。\n"
"wo3 gen1ben3 bu4zai4hu5 ni3 xiang3 zen3yang4。wo3men5 zhi1jian1 mei2guan1xi5 le5。"

msgid "I don't go on runs with strangers. It's too risky."
msgstr ""
"我​不​和​陌生人​跑​差事​。​风险​太高​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 he4 mo4sheng1ren2 pao2 cha4shi4。feng1xian3 tai4 gao1 le5。"

msgid "I don't have a follow-up. Just expressing my appreciation."
msgstr ""
"我​没什么​要​问​的​了​。​只是​表达​下​感谢​。\n"
"wo3 mei2shen2me5 yao4 wen4 de5 le5。zhi3shi4 biao3da2 xia4 gan3xie4。"

msgid ""
"I don't have answers for you. But there's one thing that I am sure of: "
"whatever this place is, the Adversary holds sway here."
msgstr ""
"我​没法​给​你​答案​。​但​有​一件​事​我​可以​肯定​：​不管​这里​是​什么​地方​，​反叛者​在​此处​掌控​着​一切​。\n"
"wo3 mei2fa3 gei3 ni3 da2an4。dan4 you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 wo3 ke3yi3 ken3ding4：bu4guan3 zhe4li3 shi4 shen2me5 di4fang1，fan3 pan4 zhe3 zai4 ci3chu4 zhang3kong4 zhao2 yi1qie4。"

msgid "I don't have anywhere to be. If you have questions, ask away."
msgstr ""
"反正​我​也​没​别的​事​做​，​你​有​什么​问题​就​尽管​问​吧​。\n"
"fan3zheng4 wo3 ye3 mei2 bie2de5 shi4 zuo4，ni3 you3 shen2me5 wen4ti2 jiu4 jin3guan3 wen4 ba1。"

msgid "I don't have time for this."
msgstr ""
"我​没​时间​干​这种​事​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 gan4 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid "I don't have time for this. How much?"
msgstr ""
"我​没​时间​磨蹭​。​你​要​多少​？\n"
"wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 mo2ceng5。ni3 yao4 duo1shao3？"

msgid ""
"I don't have time for this. I need those parts, right now! I don't want this"
" to get messy, so back down."
msgstr ""
"我​没​时间​和​你​废话​。​我​现在​就​需要​那些​零件​！​赶紧​让开​，​别​逼​我​把​场面​弄​的​太​难看​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 he4 ni3 fei4hua4。wo3 xian4zai4 jiu4 xu1yao4 na4xie1 ling2jian4！gan3jin3 rang4kai1，bie4 bi1 wo3 ba3 chang3mian4 long4 de5 tai4 nan2kan4。"

msgid ""
"I don't have to. She could've avoided all of this, *and* protected her oh-"
"so-secret mission, if she'd communicated with you a little better."
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​。​她​本来​可以​避免​这​一切​，​*​并且​*​保护​她​那​所谓​的​秘密​任务​，​如果​她​能​和​你​好好​沟通​一下​的话​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4。ta1 ben3lai2 ke3yi3 bi4mian3 zhe4 yi1qie4，*bing4qie3*bao3hu4 ta1 na4 suo3wei4 de5 mi4mi4 ren4wu5，ru2guo3 ta1 neng2 he4 ni3 hao3hao3 gou1tong1 yi1xia4 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"I don't intend to spend any longer on this, $(l.name). I've already said my piece.\n"
"\n"
"I feel a certain level of responsibility for Kim's welfare - never mind why. So I take care of her as best I can. That's all that I intend to say on the subject, so we can talk shop, or you can leave. Your choice."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​不​打算​继续​在​这​上面​花​时间​了​。​我​已经​说完​了​要说​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​我​对​阿金​的​幸福​负有​一定​的​责任​—​—​你​别管​为什么​。​所以​我​尽我所能​照顾​她​。​我​想​说​的​就​这么​多​，​我们​可以​谈谈​生意​，​或者​你​可以​离开​。​你​自己​选​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 bu4 da3suan4 ji4xu4 zai4 zhe4 shang4mian4 hua1 shi2jian1 le5。wo3 yi3jing1 shuo1 wan2 le5 yao4shuo1 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3 dui4 e1 jin1 de5 xing4fu2 fu4you3 yi1ding4 de5 ze2ren4——ni3 bie2guan3 wei4shen2me5。suo3yi3 wo3 jin3 wo3 suo3 neng2 zhao4gu5 ta1。wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 jiu4 zhe4me5 duo1，wo3men5 ke3yi3 tan2tan2 sheng1yi4，huo4zhe3 ni3 ke3yi3 li2kai1。ni3 zi4ji3 xuan3 ba1。"

msgid "I don't know about that."
msgstr ""
"我​自己​都​不​知道​。\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"I don't know about this \"Communion\" thing. It doesn't seem to be doing "
"good things to your state of mind."
msgstr ""
"我​不​确定​这个​“​共​融会​”​到底​是​什么​。​它​似乎​对​你​的​精神状态​没什么​好处​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 zhe4ge5“gong4 rong2hui4” dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5。ta1 si4hu1 dui4 ni3 de5 jing1shen2zhuang4tai4 mei2shen2me5 hao3chu3。"

msgid ""
"I don't know any more. I really don't.\n"
"\n"
"I'm guessing that it would've been better for the world if we'd killed the dragon. But then, APEX would've killed us.\n"
"\n"
"Who knows? Maybe it'll even use all of this to protect the F-State, like it said it would."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不​知道​了​。​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​如果​我们​杀死​了​巨龙​，​世界​或许​会​更好​。​但​那样的话​，​APEX​就​会​干掉​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谁​知道​呢​？​说不定​它​真会​像​承诺​的​那样​，​用​这​一切​来​保护​动荡​带​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 le5。zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ru2guo3 wo3men5 sha1si3 le5 ju4long2，shi4jie4 huo4xu3 hui4 geng1 hao3。dan4 na4 yang4 de5 hua4，APEX jiu4 hui4 gan4diao4 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？shuo1bu5ding4 ta1 zhen1 hui4 xiang4 cheng2nuo4 de5 na4yang4，yong4 zhe4 yi1qie4 lai2 bao3hu4 dong4dang4 dai4。"

msgid ""
"I don't know for certain what Harrow has planned for those kids. But I do "
"know one thing: whatever it is, we aren't going to let it happen."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​哈罗​对​那些​孩子​有​什么​安排​。​但​我​知道​的​是​，​无论​他​有​什么​阴谋​，​我们​都​不能​让​他​得逞​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ha1luo2 dui4 na4Xie1hai2zi5 you3 shen2me5 an1pai2。dan4 wo3 zhi1dao4 de5 shi4，wu2lun4 ta1 you3 shen2me5 yin1mou2，wo3men5 dou1 bu4neng2 rang4 ta1 de2cheng3。"

msgid "I don't know how long it was. But when the drawer opened, it was over."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​到底​过​了​多久​。​但​当​抽屉​打开​的​时候​，​一切​都​已经​结束​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 dao4di3 guo4 le5 duo1jiu3。dan4 dang1 chou1ti5 da3kai1 de5 shi2hou5，yi1qie4 dou1 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't know how much credence to give any of this. After all, I don't have "
"any proof that my Ghost Rat is even a Ghost Rat. She might be... but then, "
"she could also be a run-of-the-mill glowpunk. Or maybe she's just yankin' my"
" chain, and she's never been into the SOX at all. Who knows?"
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​这些​话​有​多少​可信度​。​毕竟​我​甚至​没有​任何​证据​证明​这位​“​幽灵​老鼠​”​确实​是​走私者​。​她​可能​真的​是​……​但​也​可能​只是​个​普通​的​幽光​住民​，​又​或者​她​只是​在​耍​我​，​她​根本​就​没​去过​萨洛​卢区​。​谁​知道​呢​？\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 hua4 you3 duo1shao3 ke3xin4du4。bi4jing4 wo3 shen4zhi4 mei2you3 ren4he2 zheng4ju4 zheng4ming2 zhe4wei4“you1ling2 lao3shu3” que4shi2 shi4 zou3 si1 zhe3。ta1 ke3neng2 zhen1de5 shi4……dan4 ye3 ke3neng2 zhi3shi4 ge4 pu3tong1 de5 you1 guang1 zhu4 min2，you4 huo4zhe3 ta1 zhi3shi4 zai4 shua3 wo3，ta1 gen1ben3 jiu4 mei2 qu4 guo4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1。shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"I don't know how to live like this, but it's still better than not living at all. That's what I keep telling myself. And so I figured that I might as well tell it to you, too.\n"
"\n"
"-J"
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​该​怎么​活下去​，​但​总比​死​了​要​好​—​—​我​一直​这样​劝​自己​。​所以​我​想​，​不如​把​这句​话​也​告诉​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​-​J\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 huo2xia4qu4，dan4 zong3 bi3 si3 le5 yao4 hao3——wo3 yi1zhi2 zhe4yang4 quan4 zi4ji3。suo3yi3 wo3 xiang3，bu4ru2 ba3 zhe4 ju4 hua4 ye3 gao4su4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"-J"

msgid ""
"I don't know if I'd go that far. He was green, like you said. And he never "
"should've been in the position to make those mistakes in the first place. I "
"can't fault you for killing him, but I can't lay the blame entirely on him, "
"either."
msgstr ""
"我​不​确定​是否​要​到​这个​程度​。​他​确实​像​你​说​的​是​个​新兵​蛋子​，​而且​他本​就​不该​被​置于​犯下​那些​错误​的​位置​。​我​不能​怪​你​杀​了​他​，​但​也​不能​把​责任​全推​到​他​身上​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 shi4fou3 yao4 dao4 zhe4ge5 cheng2du4。ta1 que4shi2 xiang4 ni3 shuo1 de5 shi4 ge4 xin1bing1 dan4 zi3，er2qie3 ta1 ben3 jiu4 bu4gai1 bei4 zhi4yu2 fan4 xia4 na4xie1 cuo4wu4 de5 wei4zhi5。wo3 bu4neng2 guai4 ni3 sha1 le5 ta1，dan4 ye3 bu4neng2 ba3 ze2ren4 quan2 tui1 dao4 ta1 shen1shang5。"

msgid "I don't know if that's a great idea, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​这​不是​个​好​主意​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 bu4shi4 ge4 hao3 zhu3yi5，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid ""
"I don't know if you expected any of that to mean anything, but it doesn't. None of it *matters.*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She fishes the amulet out of her blouse. It dangles on a golden chain, glinting in the firelight.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you want this, you're going to have to kill me for it."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​你​是否​以为​这些​话​能​说明​什么​，​但​它们​毫无意义​。​这​一切​都​*​无关紧要​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​从​衬衫​里​掏出​护身符​。​它​悬挂​在​金链​上​，​在​炉火​的​映照​下​闪闪发亮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想要​这个​，​就​先​杀​了​我​再说​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4fou3 yi3wei2 zhe4xie1 hua4 neng2 shuo1ming2 shen2me5，dan4 ta1men5 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4。zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1*wu2guan1jin3yao4*。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 chen4shan1 li3 tao1chu1 hu4shen1fu2。ta1 xuan2gua4 zai4 jin1 lian4 shang4，zai4 lu2huo3 de5 ying4zhao4 xia4 shan3 shan3 fa1 liang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 zhe4ge5，jiu4 xian1 sha1 le5 wo3 zai4shuo1。"

msgid ""
"I don't know what I'd do without them. Without them, I dream. And I don't "
"want to dream. I don't want to remember."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​离​了​它们​我该​怎么办​。​离​了​它们​，​我会​做梦​。​而​我​不想​做梦​。​我​不想​回忆​起来​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 li2 le5 ta1men5 wo3 gai1 zen3me5ban4。li2 le5 ta1men5，wo3 hui4 zuo4meng4。er2 wo3 bu4xiang3 zuo4meng4。wo3 bu4xiang3 hui2yi4 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"I don't know what happened to you at Feuerstelle, Glory. But whatever it "
"was, I think that it's getting stronger."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​虽然​我​不​清楚​“​火坑​”​对​你​造成​了​何种​影响​，​但​我​能​看​出来​，​你​按捺不住​了​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，sui1ran2 wo3 bu4 qing1chu5“huo3keng1” dui4 ni3 zao4cheng2 le5 he2 zhong3 ying3xiang3，dan4 wo3 neng2 kan4 chu1lai2，ni3 an4na4bu5zhu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't know what happens to them in there. But they're somehow less... I don't know, less *alive* when they come back out.\n"
"\n"
"It makes my skin crawl."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​他们​在​那里​经历​了​什么​。​但​他们​回来​的​时候​，​似乎​变得​不再​……​怎么​说​呢​，​不再​像​*​活人​*​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一​想到​就​毛骨悚然​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 zai4 na4li5 jing1li4 le5 shen2me5。dan4 ta1men5 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5，si4hu1 bian4de5 bu4zai4……zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，bu4zai4 xiang4*huo2ren2*le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1 xiang3dao4 jiu4 mao2gu3song3ran2。"

msgid ""
"I don't know what his age was... he seemed old enough to be paternal, but young enough to hang with the kids on something like a peer level.\n"
"\n"
"Best guess, I'd say he was in his mid-twenties. \n"
"\n"
"He was handsome and well-built, with a neatly-trimmed beard and thick brown hair. And there was something else about him, something uncanny."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​他​具体​多大​岁数​……​要说​年纪​大​的话​，​他​足够​当​一位​父亲​了​，​但​他​又​年轻​得​能​和​孩子​们​打成一片​，​像​我们​之间​的​同伴​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​我​猜​的话​，​他​估计​二十五六岁​左右​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​相貌​英俊​，​身材​健硕​，​蓄着​修剪​整齐​的​胡须​，​浓密​棕发​蓬松​。​而​他​身上​还有​某种​特质​，​一种​令人​难以捉摸​的​气质​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 ju4ti3 duo1da4 sui4shu5……yao4shuo1 nian2ji4 dai4 de5hua4，ta1 zu2gou4 dang1 yi1 wei4 fu4qin1 le5，dan4 ta1 you4 nian2qing1 de2 neng2 he4 hai2zi5 men5 da3cheng2yi1pian4，xiang4 wo3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 tong2ban4 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 wo3 cai1 de5hua4，ta1 gu1ji4 er4 shi2 wu3 liu4 sui4 zuo3you4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang4mao4 ying1jun4，shen1cai2 jian4shuo4，xu4 zhao2 xiu1jian3 zheng3qi2 de5 hu2xu1，nong2mi4 zong1 fa1 peng2song1。er2 ta1 shen1shang5 hai2you3 mou3zhong3 te4zhi4，yi1zhong3 ling4ren2 nan2yi3zhuo1mo1 de5 qi4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"I don't know what those things have told you, $(l.name), but they are *not* "
"customers. They've never paid me a *thing* for my services, and--"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​不​知道​那些​玩意儿​和​你​说​了​什么​，​但​它们​*​不是​*​我​的​客户​。​它们​从没​为​我​的​服务​支付​任何​*​报酬​*​，​而且​—​—\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 na4xie1 wan2yi4r5 he4 ni3 shuo1 le5 shen2me5，dan4 ta1men5*bu4shi4*wo3 de5 ke4hu4。ta1men5 cong2mei2 wei2 wo3 de5 fu2wu4 zhi1fu4 ren4he2*bao4chou5*，er2qie3 — —"

msgid ""
"I don't know what to say, $(l.name). With this donation, we have reached our final goal.\n"
"\n"
"I will speak with Burakgazi immediately and provide him his downpayment. The $(l.name) Civic Center will stand as a monument to your generosity and care.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you, once again. You have been a godsend to the poor of the Kreuzbasar, and I will see to it that they know it."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​该​说​什么​，​$(l.name)​。​有​了​这笔​捐款​，​我们​终于​能​达成​最终目标​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​立即​与​布拉加​齐​联系​，​为​他​提供​首付款​。​$(l.name)​市民​中心​将​作为​一座​纪念碑​而​矗立​，​以​铭记​你​的​慷慨​和​关爱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再次​感谢​你​。​你​就是​上​天赐​给​克洛伊​茨​集市​穷人​的​礼物​，​我会​让​他们​知道​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 shuo1 shen2me5，$(l.name)。you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 zhong1yu2 neng2 da2cheng2 zui4 zhong1 mu4 biao1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 li4ji2 yu4 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 lian2xi4，wei2 ta1 ti2gong1 shou3fu4kuan3。$(l.name) shi4min2 zhong1xin1 jiang1 zuo4wei2 yi1 zuo4 ji4nian4bei1 er2 chu4li4，yi3 ming2ji4 ni3 de5 kang1kai3 he4 guan1ai4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3。ni3 jiu4shi4 shang4 tian1ci4 gei3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 qiong2ren2 de5 li3wu4，wo3 hui4 rang4 ta1men5 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"I don't know what to tell you other than that it's your call.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever you choose to do, we'll back you on it."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​什么​特别​想​说​的​，​总之​这​是​你​的​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​你​怎么​选​，​我们​都​会​支持​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 shen2me5 te4bie2 xiang3 shuo1 de5，zong3zhi1 zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 zen3me5 xuan3，wo3men5 dou1 hui4 zhi1chi2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I don't know what world *you* live in, boss, but in *my* world, ridiculous things happen every day.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, that's the story. Believe it, or don't... your choice. You already know what I think."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​*​你​*​生活​在​一个​怎样​的​世界​，​老大​，​但​在​*​我​*​生活​的​世界​，​这种​荒唐事​天天​都​在​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​事情​就是​这样​。​信不信​由​你​……​反正​我​已经​告诉​你​我​是​怎么​想​的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4*ni3*sheng1huo2 zai4 yi1ge5 zen3yang4 de5 shi4jie4，lao3da4，dan4 zai4*wo3*sheng1huo2 de5 shi4jie4，zhe4zhong3 huang1 tang2 shi4 tian1tian1 dou1 zai4 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。xin4 bu4 xin4 you2 ni3……fan3zheng4 wo3 yi3jing1 gao4su4 ni3 wo3 shi4 zen3me5 xiang3 de5 le5。"

msgid "I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​你​在​说​什么​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"I don't know where we are, $(l.name). But I think it's safe to say that none"
" of us have ever heard of it before."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​我们​在​哪里​，​$(l.name)​。​不过​可以​肯定​的​是​，​我们​谁​都​没听说过​这个​地方​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 zai4 na3li3，$(l.name)。bu4guo4 ke3yi3 ken3ding4 de5 shi4，wo3men5 shei2 dou1 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"I don't know where you are... out having fun, no doubt. Maybe flirting with one of those unattainable beauties that you're always chasing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He tries on a smile, but it quickly disappears. He takes a drag on his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's good. I want you to live a pleasant, normal life. After all, one of us should."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​你​在​哪里​……​毫无疑问​，​是​在​外面​寻欢作乐​。​也许​在​和​你​一直​追逐​的​那些​高不可攀​的​美女​调情​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他试​着​露出​微笑​，​但​笑容​很快​就​消失​了​。​他​抽​了​一口​烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​挺​好​的​。​我​希望​你​过​上​愉快​而​正常​的​生活​。​毕竟​我们​俩​总得​有​一个​人能​享受​生活​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zai4 na3li3……hao2wu2yi2wen4，shi4 zai4 wai4mian4 xun2huan1zuo4le4。ye3xu3 zai4 he4 ni3 yi1zhi2 zhui1zhu2 de5 na4xie1 gao1bu4ke3pan1 de5 mei3nu:3 tiao2qing2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shi4 zhao2 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4，dan4 xiao4rong2 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 xiao1shi1 le5。ta1 chou1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting3 hao3 de5。wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 guo4 shang4 yu2kuai4 er2 zheng4chang2 de5 sheng1huo2。bi4jing4 wo3men5 lia3 zong3dei3 you3 yi1ge5 ren2 neng2 xiang3shou4 sheng1huo2。"

msgid ""
"I don't know who this mystery contact is, but we need money, and we need it "
"fast. So I say, go for it."
msgstr ""
"我​没听说过​这位​神秘​联络人​，​我​只​知道​我们​急需​用钱​，​而且​要​快​。​所以​我​赞成​这项​提议​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4 zhe4wei4 shen2mi4 lian2luo4ren2，wo3 zhi3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 ji2xu1 yong4qian2，er2qie3 yao4 kuai4。suo3yi3 wo3 zan4cheng2 zhe4 xiang4 ti2yi4。"

msgid ""
"I don't know who would willingly slot something like this. It drove him to "
"kill himself, and from the looks of the body, he enjoyed every second of it."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​谁​会​自愿​安装​这种​东西​。​它​把​他​逼​到​了​自杀​的​地步​，​而​从​尸体​的​样子​来看​，​他​甚至​在​享受​过程​的​每分​每秒​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 shei2 hui4 zi4yuan4 an1zhuang1 zhe4zhong3 dong1xi1。ta1 ba3 ta1 bi1 dao4 le5 zi4sha1 de5 di4bu4，er2 cong2 shi1ti3 de5 yang4zi5 lai2 kan4，ta1 shen4zhi4 zai4 xiang3shou4 guo4cheng2 de5 mei3 fen4 mei3 miao3。"

msgid ""
"I don't know who you are, but thank you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grimaces and claps a hand on his left forearm. Blood oozes between his fingers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Those monsters were going to bleed me out. They took turns cutting me - carved up my arm like a holiday roast."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​你​是​谁​，​但是​谢谢​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​痛苦​地​皱起​眉头​，​伸手​按住​左​前臂​。​鲜血​从​他​指缝间​渗出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​怪物​差点​把​我​的​血放干​。​他们​轮流​用​刀割​我​的​手臂​，​就​好像​我​是​他们​桌上​的​美餐​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 shei2，dan4shi4 xie4xie5 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tong4ku3 de5 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2，shen1shou3 an4 zhu4 zuo3 qian2bi4。xian1xue4 cong2 ta1 zhi3 feng2 jian1 shen4chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 guai4wu5 cha4dian3 ba3 wo3 de5 xie3 fang4 gan4。ta1men5 lun2liu2 yong4 dao1 ge1 wo3 de5 shou3bi4，jiu4 hao3xiang4 wo3 shi4 ta1men5 zhuo1 shang4 de5 mei3can1 yi1yang4。"

msgid "I don't know yet. Watch my back while I figure this out."
msgstr ""
"我​还​不​知道​。​让​我​弄弄​清楚​，​你​替​我​盯​着​点​后边​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 bu4 zhi1dao4。rang4 wo3 long4 long4 qing1chu5，ni3 ti4 wo3 ding1 zhao2 dian3 hou4bian5。"

msgid "I don't know, Blitz. But we're sure as hell going to find out."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​，​布里​茨​。​但​我们​肯定​会​搞​明白​的​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，Bu4li3ci2。dan4 wo3men5 ken3ding4 hui4 gao3 ming2bai5 de5。"

msgid "I don't know, Dietrich. But we're sure as hell going to find out."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​，​迪​特里​希​。​但​我们​肯定​会​搞​明白​的​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，Di2te4li3xi1。dan4 wo3men5 ken3ding4 hui4 gao3 ming2bai5 de5。"

msgid "I don't know, I'm not the trusting type."
msgstr ""
"这个​嘛​，​我​不会​随便​轻信​别人​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 ma5，wo3 bu4hui4 sui2bian4 qing1xin4 bie2ren5。"

msgid "I don't know, and I don't care. I just want to be left alone."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​，​我​也​不在乎​。​我​只​想​自己​待​着​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，wo3 ye3 bu4zai4hu5。wo3 zhi3 xiang3 zi4ji3 dai1 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"I don't know, it looked like an invitation to me. If you really don't want "
"to be found, you might want to hide your tracks a little better."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​，​我​觉着​这​是​对​我​的​邀请​还​差不多​。​如果​你​真​不想​让​别人​找到​的话​，​就​应该​把​你​的​踪迹​藏得​更​仔细​点​。\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，wo3 jiao4 zhao2 zhe4 shi4 dui4 wo3 de5 yao1qing3 hai2 cha4bu5duo1。ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1 bu4xiang3 rang4 bie2ren5 zhao3dao4 de5hua4，jiu4 ying1gai1 ba3 ni3 de5 zong1ji4 zang4 de2 geng1 zi3xi4 dian3。"

msgid ""
"I don't know, it sounds plausible enough to me. Let's wrap this up, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​听​起来​还是​有​几分​道理​的​。​事情​就​到​这里​吧​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ting1 qi3lai5 hai2shi5 you3 ji3fen1 dao4li5 de5。shi4qing5 jiu4 dao4 zhe4li3 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "I don't know."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"I don't know.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stares at the ring for a long moment, then snatches it from the picture frame. She tucks it away into her satchel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was mine, so I'm taking it. Now let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​盯​着​戒指​看​了​很​久​，​随即​把​它​从​相框​上​摘下​，​塞进​自己​的​挎包​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​本来​就是​我​的​，​所以​我要​把​它​拿走​。​我们​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 jie4zhi5 kan4 le5 hen3 jiu3，sui2ji2 ba3 ta1 cong2 xiang4kuang4 shang4 zhai1xia4，se4 jin4 zi4ji3 de5 kua4bao1 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ben3lai2 jiu4shi4 wo3 de5，suo3yi3 wo3 yao4 ba3 ta1 na2zou3。wo3men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don't know. But we can worry about it when we get back home.\n"
"\n"
"It's only a matter of time before this entire compound shakes itself apart."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。​但​等​我们​回到​家​再​担心​这个​也​不​迟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​整座​建筑​马上​就要​分崩离析​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。dan4 deng3 wo3men5 hui2dao4 jia1 zai4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5 ye3 bu4 chi2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zheng3 zuo4 jian4zhu4 ma3shang4 jiu4yao4 fen1beng1li2xi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't know. I was living on the streets since I was a kid. Had no family, "
"no home."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。​我​从小​就​在​街头​流浪​，​没有​亲人​，​也​没有​家​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。wo3 cong2xiao3 jiu4 zai4 jie1tou2 liu2lang4，mei2you3 qin1ren2，ye3 mei2you3 jia1。"

msgid ""
"I don't know. I'll have to figure something out.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She hugs herself and turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Leave me alone, please. I'll get the next train."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。​我​得​想想​办法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​抱​起​双臂​转身​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请别​来​烦​我​了​。​我会​搭乘​下​一班​列车​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。wo3 de2 xiang3 xiang3 ban4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bao4 qi3 shuang1bi4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3 le5。wo3 hui4 da1cheng2 xia4 yi1 ban1 lie4che1。"

msgid ""
"I don't know. If what you were saying is true, she's just as guilty as "
"Harrow."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​。​如果​你​之前​说​的​是​真的​，​那​她​和​哈罗​一样​都​罪有应得​。\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2。ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 de5 shi4 zhen1de5，na4 ta1 he4 ha1luo2 yi1yang4 dou1 zui4you3ying1de2。"

msgid "I don't know. It still sounds like bad news to me."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​，​听​起来​仍然​不是​什么​好事​。\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，ting1 qi3lai5 reng2ran2 bu4shi4 shen2me5 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"I don't know. Maybe this doesn't bother you... you're a shadowrunner, after all. You kill people all the time. Just another day at the office, huh?\n"
"\n"
"Well, I'm not like you. I can't just kill people on the job and forget about it the next day. This is going to haunt me for the rest of my life."
msgstr ""
"我​也​说不清​。​也许​这​对​你​来说​不算什么​……​毕竟​你​是​狂奔​者​。​你​整天​都​在​杀人​，​已经​成​家常便饭​了​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​跟​你​不​一样​。​我​没​办法​在​任务​中​杀了人​，​第二天​就​忘​得​一干二净​。​这件​事会​纠缠​我​一辈子​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shuo1 bu4 qing1。ye3xu3 zhe4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2……bi4jing4 ni3 shi4 kuang2Ben1zhe3。ni3 zheng3tian1 dou1 zai4 sha1ren2，yi3jing1 cheng2 jia1chang2bian4fan4 le5 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 gen1 ni3 bu4 yi1yang4。wo3 mei2 ban4fa3 zai4 ren4wu5 zhong4 sha1 le5 ren2，di4er4tian1 jiu4 wang4 de2 yi1gan1er4jing4。zhe4 jian4 shi4 hui4 jiu1chan2 wo3 yi1bei4zi5。"

msgid "I don't know. Maybe. \"Lodge\" was all that I heard."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不​知道​啊​，​可能​是​吧​。​我​就​听到​了​“​结社​”​这个​词​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 a1，ke3neng2 shi4 ba1。wo3 jiu4 ting1dao4 le5“jie2she4” zhe4ge5 ci2。"

msgid ""
"I don't know... doesn't seem like there's much here that would interest me."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​……​这里​好像​没什么​让​我​感兴趣​的​东西​。\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2……zhe4li3 hao3xiang4 mei2shen2me5 rang4 wo3 gan3xing4qu4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"I don't like being kept in the dark, but if you pay as well as you say that "
"you do, I can overlook it."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​被​蒙在鼓里​，​但​如果​你​给​的​报酬​真如​你​所说​的​那样​丰厚​，​我​倒​可以​睁一只眼​闭一只眼​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 bei4 meng2zai4gu3li3，dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 gei3 de5 bao4chou5 zhen1ru2 ni3 suo3 shuo1 de5 na4yang4 feng1hou4，wo3 dao3 ke3yi3 zheng1 yi1 zhi3 yan3 bi4 yi1 zhi3 yan3。"

msgid "I don't like good-byes. So I'll catch you later, Glory."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​告别​。​我们​一定​会​再见​的​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 gao4bie2。wo3men5 yi1ding4 hui4 zai4jian4 de5，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "I don't like havin' that thing in here, boss."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​跟​这​东西​共处一室​，​老大​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 gen1 zhe4 dong1xi1 gong4 chu3 yi1 shi4，lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"I don't like him either, Blitz. But we're stuck with him until this thing is"
" over."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不​喜欢​他​，​布里​茨​。​但​这事​结束​之前​，​我们​只能​和​他​待​在​一起​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5 ta1，Bu4li3ci2。dan4 zhe4 shi4 jie2shu4 zhi1qian2，wo3men5 zhi3neng2 he4 ta1 dai1 zai4 yi1qi3。"

msgid ""
"I don't like it either. He deserves to face justice. But I also don't think "
"that he poses the kind of threat that he used to."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不​喜欢​这样​的​结果​。​他​理应​受到​法律制裁​。​但​我​也​不​认为​他​还​像​从前​那样​具有​威胁性​了​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5 zhe4yang4 de5 jie1guo3。ta1 li3ying1 shou4dao4 fa3lu:4zhi4cai2。dan4 wo3 ye3 bu4 ren4wei2 ta1 hai2 xiang4 cong2qian2 na4yang4 ju4you3 wei1 xie2 xing4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't like it, but if that's what you really want, I won't stand in your "
"way."
msgstr ""
"这样​不妥​，​但​既然​你​这么​认真​，​我​也​不​拦​你​了​。\n"
"zhe4yang4 bu4tuo3，dan4 ji4ran2 ni3 zhe4me5 ren4zhen1，wo3 ye3 bu4 lan2 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't like magic, $(l.name). I've had some... unfortunate experiences with it in the past.\n"
"\n"
"What they were doing down there, in that lab... that was magic of the worst kind."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​魔法​，​$(l.name)​。​过去​我​曾​有​过​一些​……​不太​愉快​的​经历​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​在​实验室​里​搞​的​东西​……​那​简直​是​最​邪恶​的​魔法​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 mo2fa3，$(l.name)。guo4qu4 wo3 ceng2 you3 guo4 yi1xie1……bu4 tai4 yu2kuai4 de5 jing1li4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 shi2yan4shi4 li3 gao3 de5 dong1xi1……na4 jian3zhi2 shi4 zui4 xie2e4 de5 mo2fa3。"

msgid ""
"I don't like the looks of this, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I don't like it at all."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​目前​的​情况​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一点​也​不​喜欢​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5。"

msgid ""
"I don't like the looks of this, boss.\n"
"\n"
"I don't like it at all."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​目前​的​情况​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一点​也​不​喜欢​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5。"

msgid ""
"I don't like the looks of this, chief.\n"
"\n"
"I don't like it at all."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​目前​的​情况​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一点​也​不​喜欢​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5。"

msgid ""
"I don't like the smell of this, chief. It said that APEX *let* Alice escape.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns to address the simulacrum on the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Alice, why would a Matrix warfare AI allow you to run a trace on it?"
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​我​觉得​这​事​不对劲​。​它​说​APEX​是​*​故意​放走​*​爱丽丝​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转向​屏幕​上​的​拟​像​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​爱丽丝​，​为什么​一个​矩阵​作战​AI​会​允许​你​追踪​它​？\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 shi4 bu4dui4jin4。ta1 shuo1 APEX shi4*gu4yi4 fang4zou3*ai4li4si1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 ni3 xiang4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1，wei4shen2me5 yi1ge5 ju3zhen4 zuo4zhan4 AI hui4 yun3xu3 ni3 zhui1zong1 ta1？"

msgid "I don't like the sound of that, boss."
msgstr ""
"这话​我​听​着​可不​吉利​啊​，​老大​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 wo3 ting1 zhao2 ke3bu5 ji2li4 a1，lao3da4。"

msgid "I don't like the sound of that, chief."
msgstr ""
"这话​我​听​着​可不​吉利​啊​，​头儿​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 wo3 ting1 zhao2 ke3bu5 ji2li4 a1，tou2r5。"

msgid "I don't like the sound of that."
msgstr ""
"这话​我​听​着​可不​吉利​啊​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 wo3 ting1 zhao2 ke3bu5 ji2li4 a1。"

msgid ""
"I don't like the sound of that. It might have been safer to put her down."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​感觉​不​太妙​。​也许​当初​除掉​她​是​更​保险​的​选择​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 gan3jue2 bu4 tai4 miao4。ye3xu3 dang1chu1 chu2diao4 ta1 shi4 geng1 bao3xian3 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"I don't like what you did, but I guess that I can understand why you did it."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​你​做​的​事情​，​但​我​想​我​能​理解​你​为何​这么​做​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5，dan4 wo3 xiang3 wo3 neng2 li3jie3 ni3 wei4he2 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I don't like what you're planning, Vauclair... but if it'll kill the "
"dragons, maybe it's worth it."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​你​的​计划​，​沃​克莱尔​……​但​如果​这样​能​杀死​巨龙​的话​，​也许​就​值得​一试​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3 de5 ji4hua4，Wo4ke4lai2er3……dan4 ru2guo3 zhe4yang4 neng2 sha1si3 ju4long2 de5hua4，ye3xu3 jiu4 zhi2de5 yi1 shi4。"

msgid "I don't like you, and I don't trust you. Our business here is done."
msgstr ""
"我​既​不​喜欢​你​，​也​不​信任​你​。​这笔​生意​就​到此为止​吧​。\n"
"wo3 ji4 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3，ye3 bu4 xin4ren4 ni3。zhe4 bi3 sheng1yi4 jiu4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don't like you, and you don't like me. But that doesn't mean that I'm unwilling to use you in order to become spectacularly wealthy.\n"
"\n"
"Does that answer your question?"
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​你​，​你​也​不​喜欢​我​。​但​这​并​不​意味着​我​不​愿意​利用​你​来​获得​巨额​财富​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​能​解答​你​的​问题​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3，ni3 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5 wo3。dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 bu4 yuan4yi4 li4yong4 ni3 lai2 huo4de2 ju4e2 cai2fu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 neng2 jie3da2 ni3 de5 wen4ti2 le5 ma5？"

msgid "I don't like your attitude, lady."
msgstr ""
"我​不​喜欢​你​的​态度​，​女士​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3 de5 tai4du5，nu:3shi4。"

msgid ""
"I don't mean to break this up, but we need to get moving. Kid, you're with us... the rest of you, pile into that other van.\n"
"\n"
"You can continue having your moment when we get back to Schattennest."
msgstr ""
"我​不是故意​要​打断​你们​，​但​我们​得​出发​了​。​小子​，​你​跟​我们​走​……​其他人​上​那辆车​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​回到​影巢​，​你们​有的是​时间​叙旧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 shi4 gu4 yi4 yao4 da3duan4 ni3men5，dan4 wo3men5 de2 chu1fa1 le5。xiao3zi5，ni3 gen1 wo3men5 zou3……qi2 ta1 ren2 shang4 na4 liang4 che1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 hui2dao4 ying3 chao2，ni3men5 you3de5shi4 shi2jian1 xu4jiu4。"

msgid ""
"I don't much like the Flux. In the sims, you can have the same happy day "
"over and over. You can skip past the parts you don't like, or replay the "
"good moments as many times as you want."
msgstr ""
"我​不怎么​喜欢​动荡​带​。​在​拟​感里​，​你​可以​日复一日​体验​同样​的​快乐​时光​，​跳过​不​喜欢​的​部分​，​或者​无限​重温​那些​美好​瞬间​。\n"
"wo3 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 dong4dang4 dai4。zai4 ni3 gan3 li3，ni3 ke3yi3 ri4fu4yi1ri4 ti3yan4 tong2yang4 de5 kuai4le4 shi2guang1，tiao4guo4 bu4 xi3huan5 de5 bu4fen5，huo4zhe3 wu2xian4 chong2wen1 na4xie1 mei3hao3 shun4jian1。"

msgid "I don't need anything - just browsing."
msgstr ""
"我​没什么​需要​，​随便​看看​而已​。\n"
"wo3 mei2shen2me5 xu1yao4，sui2bian4 kan4kan5 er2yi3。"

msgid "I don't need anything else, thanks."
msgstr ""
"我​没​别的​事​了​，​谢谢​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 bie2de5 shi4 le5，xie4xie5。"

msgid "I don't need anything else."
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​别的​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 bie2de5 le5。"

msgid "I don't need anything right now. I'll be on my way."
msgstr ""
"我​现在​不​需要​任何​东西​。​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 bu4 xu1yao4 ren4he2 dong1xi1。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "I don't need anything, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"我​什么​都​不要​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"wo3 shen2me5 dou1 bu4yao4，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid "I don't need anything, thanks."
msgstr ""
"我​没什么​需要​，​谢​了​。\n"
"wo3 mei2shen2me5 xu1yao4，xie4 le5。"

msgid "I don't need anything. I'll talk to you later."
msgstr ""
"我​目前​没什么​需要​。​我们​回头​聊​。\n"
"wo3 mu4qian2 mei2shen2me5 xu1yao4。wo3men5 hui2tou2 liao2。"

msgid "I don't need anything. Sorry to have bothered you."
msgstr ""
"我​没什么​需要​，​抱歉​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"wo3 mei2shen2me5 xu1yao4，bao4qian4 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't need them to answer the door. I just need to make one of them talk."
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​有人​应​门​。​只要​有人​给出​我要​的​答案​就行了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 you3ren2 ying1 men2。zhi3yao4 you3ren2 gei3 chu1 wo3 yao4 de5 da2an4 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid "I don't need to hear the details."
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​听​这些​细节​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 ting1 zhe4xie1 xi4jie2。"

msgid ""
"I don't need to show you anything. Central has some concerns about your "
"loyalty."
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​给​你​看​任何​东西​。​指挥部​对​你​的​忠诚​有所​疑虑​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 gei3 ni3 kan4 ren4he2 dong1xi1。zhi3hui1bu4 dui4 ni3 de5 zhong1cheng2 you3suo3 yi2lu:4。"

msgid ""
"I don't need your thanks. I need to get into the basement... and that "
"magical item would be appreciated, too."
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​你​的​感谢​。​我​需要​进入​地下室​……​还有​说好​的​那件​魔法​物品​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 gan3xie4。wo3 xu1yao4 jin4ru4 di4xia4shi4……hai2you3 shuo1hao3 de5 na4 jian4 mo2fa3 wu4pin3。"

msgid ""
"I don't put my friends on pedestals. Monika made mistakes, just like the "
"rest of us do."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​把​我​的​朋友​奉​为​圣人​。​和​我们​其他人​一样​，​莫妮卡​也​犯过​错误​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 ba3 wo3 de5 peng2you5 feng4 wei2 sheng4ren2。he4 wo3men5 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4，Mo4ni1ka3 ye3 fan4 guo4 cuo4wu4。"

msgid "I don't question Dispatch, son. They say jump, I jump."
msgstr ""
"孩子​，​我​不会​质疑​特遣队​的​命令​。​他们​让​我​做​啥​我​就​做​啥​。\n"
"hai2zi5，wo3 bu4hui4 zhi4yi2 te4 qian3 dui4 de5 ming4ling4。ta1men5 rang4 wo3 zuo4 sha2 wo3 jiu4 zuo4 sha2。"

msgid ""
"I don't really wanna go into this, chief. So here's the abriged version: I "
"made a mess of things."
msgstr ""
"我​并​不想​说​的​太​多​，​头儿​。​所以​简单​来说​：​我​把​事情​搞砸​了​。\n"
"wo3 bing4 bu4xiang3 shuo1 de5 tai4 duo1，tou2r5。suo3yi3 jian3dan1 lai2 shuo1：wo3 ba3 shi4qing5 gao3za2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't remember a whole lot of the fight itself, boss. But I do remember "
"the aftermath."
msgstr ""
"这场​战斗​的​细节​我​已经​记不太清​了​，​老大​。​但​结局​至今​历历在目​。\n"
"zhe4 chang2 zhan4dou4 de5 xi4jie2 wo3 yi3jing1 ji4 bu4 tai4 qing1 le5，lao3da4。dan4 jie2ju2 zhi4jin1 li4li4zai4mu4。"

msgid ""
"I don't respond well to threats or ultimatums. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Something in the tiny woman's voice sets you on edge. There is something deeply wrong here. Somehow, you're certain of it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You'll want to watch that in the future. Now walk away."
msgstr ""
"我​对​威胁​或​命令​向来​没什么​好​脸色​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​矮个子​女人​的​声音​里​透​着​某种​令​你​心神不宁​的​东西​。​感觉​非常​不对劲​。​你​对此​确信无疑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​今后​你​最好​注意​点​。​现在​走开​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 wei1xie2 huo4 ming4ling4 xiang4lai2 mei2shen2me5 hao3 lian3se4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3 ge4 zi3 nu:3ren2 de5 sheng1yin1 li3 tou4 zhao2 mou3zhong3 ling3 ni3 xin1shen2bu4ning2 de5 dong1xi1。gan3jue2 fei1chang2 bu4dui4jin4。ni3 dui4 ci3 que4 xin4 wu2 yi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin1hou4 ni3 zui4hao3 zhu4yi4 dian3。xian4zai4 zou3kai1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don't see a mark on you. That tells me that you weren't really trying."
msgstr ""
"我​看​你​身上​一点​伤​都​没有​。​这​说明​你​压根​连试​都​没试​吧​。\n"
"wo3 kan4 ni3 shen1shang5 yi1dian3 shang1 dou1 mei2you3。zhe4 shuo1ming2 ni3 ya4gen1 lian2 shi4 dou1 mei2 shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don't see how you have much choice, ace. It's the only way to set me free.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, you're firmly in my crosshairs at this point."
msgstr ""
"我​不​认为​你​还有​太​多​选择​，​王牌​。​这是​释放​我​的​唯一​办法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​况且​，​现在​你​已经​完全​暴露​在​我​的​准星​下​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 ni3 hai2you3 tai4 duo1 xuan3ze2，wang2pai2。zhe4 shi4 shi4fang4 wo3 de5 wei2yi1 ban4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"kuang4qie3，xian4zai4 ni3 yi3jing1 wan2quan2 bao4lu4 zai4 wo3 de5 zhun3xing1 xia4 le5。"

msgid "I don't see how."
msgstr ""
"我​不​明白​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 ming2bai5。"

msgid "I don't see what choice I have. I need that information."
msgstr ""
"我​也​没​别的​选择​。​我​需要​这份​情报​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 mei2 bie2de5 xuan3ze2。wo3 xu1yao4 zhe4 fen4 qing2bao4。"

msgid "I don't see why you shouldn't. Go ahead."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​完全​没​意见​。​你​尽管​去​做​吧​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 wan2quan2 mei2 yi4jian4。ni3 jin3guan3 qu4 zuo4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don't suppose that what you're asking is too different from what I do "
"every day for my corporate clients."
msgstr ""
"我​想​你​的​要求​应该​和​我​每天​为​企业​客户​做​的​事​也​没什么​不同​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ni3 de5 yao1qiu2 ying1gai1 he4 wo3 mei3tian1 wei2 qi3ye4 ke4hu4 zuo4 de5 shi4 ye3 mei2shen2me5 bu4tong2。"

msgid "I don't talk. I'm not a rat."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​乱​讲话​的​人​。​我会​保密​的​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 luan4 jiang3hua4 de5 ren2。wo3 hui4 bao3mi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I don't think I remember seeing him leave, so he's probably holed up in his room. \n"
"\n"
"I'm pretty sure that there're still some people up there - the ones that the gangers missed. I hear they locked themselves in. "
msgstr ""
"我​印象​中​没​看到​他​走​，​所以​他​大概​还​藏​在​自己​房间​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​敢肯定​上面​还有​人​。​黑帮​漏掉​的​那些​人​—​—​我​听说​他们​都​把​自己​锁​房间​里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yin4xiang4 zhong4 mei2 kan4dao4 ta1 zou3，suo3yi3 ta1 da4gai4 hai2 zang4 zai4 zi4ji3 fang2jian1 li3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 ken3 ding4 shang4mian4 hai2you3 ren2。hei1bang1 lou4diao4 de5 na4xie1 ren2——wo3 ting1shuo1 ta1men5 dou1 ba3 zi4ji3 suo3 fang2jian1 li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't think much of many people, chief. Emotional attachments aren't really my thing.\n"
"\n"
"Love seems like a diluted word these days, so I won't waste it on Emilie. Let's just say that she was important to me."
msgstr ""
"我​对​很多​人​没什么​好感​，​头儿​。​情感​依恋​从来​就​不是​我​的​风格​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如今​“​爱​”​这个​字眼​似乎​被​稀释​了​，​所以​我​不会​把​它​浪费​在​艾米莉​身上​。​就​当​她​对​我​来说​很​重要​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 hen3 duo1 ren2 mei2shen2me5 hao3gan3，tou2r5。qing2gan3 yi1lian4 cong2lai2 jiu4 bu4shi4 wo3 de5 feng1ge2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1“ai4” zhe4ge5 zi4yan3 si4hu1 bei4 xi1shi4 le5，suo3yi3 wo3 bu4hui4 ba3 ta1 lang4fei4 zai4 ai4 mi3 li4 shen1shang5。jiu4 dang1 ta1 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 hen3 zhong4yao4 ba1。"

msgid "I don't think so, Chuckles. I don't trust you."
msgstr ""
"不行​，​查​科斯​。​我​不​信任​你​。\n"
"bu4xing2，cha2 ke1 si1。wo3 bu4 xin4ren4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I don't think so, Spirit. We came here to rescue the children of "
"Feuerstelle, and that's what we're going to do."
msgstr ""
"我​不​这么​认为​，​精魂​。​我们​来此​是​为了​救出​“​火坑​”​的​孩子​们​，​而​这​正是​我们​要​做​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2，jing1hun2。wo3men5 lai2 ci3 shi4 wei4le5 jiu4chu1“huo3keng1” de5 hai2zi5 men5，er2 zhe4 zheng4shi4 wo3men5 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I don't think so, old man. You can't stop us... not tonight. This is OUR time.\n"
"\n"
"We will raise Berlin up from the tide of filth that deluges it. And in so doing, we will safeguard the purity of the human race."
msgstr ""
"我​看​未必​，​老头​。​你​阻止不了​我们​……​今晚​不行​，​今晚​是​我们​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​将​把​柏林​从​淹没​它​的​污秽​浪潮​中​拯救​出来​，​只有​这样​才能​维持​人类​种族​的​纯洁性​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4 wei4bi4，lao3tou2。ni3 zu3 zhi3 bu4 le5 wo3men5……jin1wan3 bu4xing2，jin1wan3 shi4 wo3men5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jiang1 ba3 bo2lin2 cong2 yan1mo4 ta1 de5 wu1hui4 lang4chao2 zhong4 zheng3jiu4 chu1lai2，zhi3you3 zhe4yang4 cai2neng2 wei2chi2 ren2lei4 zhong3zu2 de5 chun2 jie2 xing4。"

msgid ""
"I don't think so, pal. You're no more human than I am.\n"
"\n"
"'Sides which, even if you were, they'd call you a race-traitor and shoot you as soon as blink."
msgstr ""
"我​不好​说​，​朋友​，​你​也​没​比​我​更​像​人类​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​就算​你​外表​说得过去​，​他们​也​会​认为​你​是​人类​的​叛徒​，​然后​一​枪崩​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hao3 shuo1，peng2you5，ni3 ye3 mei2 bi3 wo3 geng1 xiang4 ren2lei4。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 jiu4suan4 ni3 wai4biao3 shuo1de5guo4qu4，ta1men5 ye3 hui4 ren4wei2 ni3 shi4 ren2lei4 de5 pan4tu2，ran2hou4 yi1 qiang1beng1 le5 ni3。"

msgid "I don't think so. Any last words before I put you in the ground?"
msgstr ""
"我​可不​这么​想​。​你​死​之前​还有​什么​遗言​想​说​吗​？\n"
"wo3 ke3bu5 zhe4me5 xiang3。ni3 si3 zhi1qian2 hai2you3 shen2me5 yi2yan2 xiang3 shuo1 ma5？"

msgid "I don't think so. I don't bring strangers along on runs, period."
msgstr ""
"我​不​赞同​。​我​做​差事​的​时候​不会​带上​陌生人​一起​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zan4tong2。wo3 zuo4 cha4shi4 de5 shi2hou5 bu4hui4 dai4shang4 mo4sheng1ren2 yi1qi3。"

msgid "I don't think so. I gave the building a thorough sweep."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​没​了​。​我​已经​彻底​搜索​过​大楼​里面​了​。\n"
"kong3pa4 mei2 le5。wo3 yi3jing1 che4di3 sou1suo3 guo4 da4lou2 li3mian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't think so. I've known a lot of street sams in my time, but I've never"
" met anyone who'd voluntarily install cyberware that old."
msgstr ""
"我​不​这么​觉得​。​我​认识​很多​街头​武士​，​但​从没​见过​哪个​会​自愿​植入​这么​老​的​赛博殖装​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 jue2de5。wo3 ren4shi5 hen3 duo1 jie1tou2 wu3shi4，dan4 cong2mei2 jian4 guo4 na3ge5 hui4 zi4yuan4 zhi2ru4 zhe4me5 lao3 de5 sai4 bo2 zhi2 zhuang1。"

msgid ""
"I don't think so. Milspec is milspec, and this thing was clearly designed "
"for the battlefield."
msgstr ""
"我​不​这么​认为​。​军规​级​就是​军规​级​，​而且​这​玩意儿​显然​是​准备​用来​投入​战场​的​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。jun1 gui1 ji2 jiu4shi4 jun1 gui1 ji2，er2qie3 zhe4 wan2yi4r5 xian3ran2 shi4 zhun3bei4 yong4lai2 tou2ru4 zhan4chang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"I don't think so. Whatever you really are, I'd rather stay on this side of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"还是​算了​。​无论​你​的​真容​是​什么​，​我​宁愿​停留​在​无知​的​一侧​。\n"
"hai2shi5 suan4le5。wu2lun4 ni3 de5 zhen1rong2 shi4 shen2me5，wo3 ning4yuan4 ting2liu2 zai4 wu2zhi1 de5 yi1 ce4。"

msgid ""
"I don't think so... not anymore. I believe that when Harrow started using his shrine, he handed the spirit the keys to the kingdom.\n"
"\n"
"The bastard might think that he's still in charge here, but he isn't. He's a servant, just like everybody else. The only difference is that he doesn't know it."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​也​这么​想​……​但​现在​不会​了​。​我​认为​当​哈罗​开始​使用​神龛​时​，​他​就​把​这个​小​王国​的​钥匙​亲自​交到​了​那个​精魂​的​手中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​混蛋​可能​以为​他​仍然​掌控​着​这里​，​但​并非如此​。​他​只是​个​仆人​，​和​其他人​一样​。​唯一​的​不同​是​他​还​没​意识​到​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 ye3 zhe4me5 xiang3……dan4 xian4zai4 bu4hui4 le5。wo3 ren4wei2 dang1 ha1luo2 kai1shi3 shi3yong4 shen2kan1 shi2，ta1 jiu4 ba3 zhe4ge5 xiao3 wang2guo2 de5 yao4shi5 qin1zi4 jiao1 dao4 le5 na4ge5 jing1hun2 de5 shou3 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 hun2dan4 ke3neng2 yi3wei2 ta1 reng2ran2 zhang3kong4 zhao2 zhe4li3，dan4 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。ta1 zhi3shi4 ge4 pu2ren2，he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4。wei2yi1 de5 bu4tong2 shi4 ta1 hai2 mei2 yi4shi2 dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"I don't think that $(l.he) is, Eiger love. I really don't.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, everyone. Let's get a look at that optical chip.\n"
"\n"
"I wanna see what we're dealing with."
msgstr ""
"我​不​这么​认为​，​亲爱​的​艾格尔​。​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​各位​。​先​看看​那枚​光学​芯片​的​内容​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​知道​我们​要​对付​的​究竟​是​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2，qin1ai4 de5 Ai4ge2er3。zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5 ge4wei4。xian1 kan4kan5 na4 mei2 guang1xue2 xin1pian4 de5 nei4rong2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"I don't think that Audran is working for the Firewing.\n"
"\n"
"I believe that he is *serving* her."
msgstr ""
"我​不​认为​奥​德兰​在​为​火翼​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​他​是​在​*​侍奉​*​她​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 Ao4de2lan2 zai4 wei2 Huo3yi4 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ta1 shi4 zai4*shi4feng4*ta1。"

msgid ""
"I don't think that I do, either.\n"
"\n"
"Stay alert, boss. I have a bad feeling about this."
msgstr ""
"我​也​觉得​不安​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​小心​点​。​我​有种​不好​的​预感​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 jue2de5 bu4an1。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，xiao3xin1 dian3。wo3 you3zhong3 bu4hao3 de5 yu4gan3。"

msgid ""
"I don't think that she *wants* to hurt anybody, Glory. Some part of her "
"doesn't understand what this place really is."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​我​不​认为​她​*​想要​*​伤害​任何人​。​她​内心​有​一部分​甚至​不​理解​这​究竟​是​什么​地方​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 ta1*xiang3yao4*shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2。ta1 nei4xin1 you3 yi1bu4fen5 shen4zhi4 bu4 li3jie3 zhe4 jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"I don't think that she's lying... or at least, she doesn't think so. She "
"believes what she's saying."
msgstr ""
"我​不​认为​她​在​说谎​……​至少​她​自己​不​这么​认为​。​她​相信​自己​所说​的话​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 ta1 zai4 shuo1huang3……zhi4shao3 ta1 zi4ji3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。ta1 xiang1xin4 zi4ji3 suo3 shuo1 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"I don't think that the information will get out. My contact has offered to "
"\"deal with\" Herr Schmidt."
msgstr ""
"没人会​知道​我们​的​背叛​，​我​的​联络人​说会​“​处理​”​掉​施密特​先生​。\n"
"mei2 ren2 hui4 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 de5 bei4pan4，wo3 de5 lian2luo4ren2 shuo1 hui4“chu3li3” diao4 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5。"

msgid "I don't think that there's anything else in here to find."
msgstr ""
"这里​已经​没什么​值得​发现​的​东西​了​。\n"
"zhe4li3 yi3jing1 mei2shen2me5 zhi2de5 fa1xian4 de5 dong1xi1 le5。"

msgid "I don't think that they will. Not with me here."
msgstr ""
"我​不​认为​他们​会​这么​做​。​毕竟​有​我​在​这里​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 ta1men5 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。bi4jing4 you3 wo3 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid "I don't think that this is working, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​这样​没用​啊​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 zhe4yang4 mei2yong4 a1，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"I don't think that we should make a habit of turnin' our backs on our clients, though.\n"
"\n"
"I know that if someone did that to me, I'd lay 'em in the ground for it."
msgstr ""
"不过​最好​别​养成​对​客户​背信弃义​的​习惯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​有人​敢​这么​对​我​，​我​非​把​他​活埋​了​不可​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zui4hao3 bie4 yang3cheng2 dui4 ke4hu4 bei4xin4qi4yi4 de5 xi2guan4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 you3ren2 gan3 zhe4me5 dui4 wo3，wo3 fei1 ba3 ta1 huo2mai2 le5 bu4ke3。"

msgid "I don't think that's how it works, Zaak."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​好像​不是​这么回事​吧​，​扎克​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 hao3xiang4 bu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 ba1，Zha1ke4。"

msgid "I don't think there's another option, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我们​别无选择​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"I don't think these uniforms are going to help any more. Be ready for "
"trouble."
msgstr ""
"这​身​制服​已经​派​不​上​用场​了​。​准备​战斗​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 shen1 zhi4fu2 yi3jing1 pai4 bu4 shang4 yong4chang3 le5。zhun3bei4 zhan4dou4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don't think you're in much of a position to threaten anybody, dragon."
msgstr ""
"我​不​觉得​你​现在​的​处境​能​威胁​任何人​，​巨龙​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 jue2de5 ni3 xian4zai4 de5 chu3jing4 neng2 wei1xie2 ren4 he2 ren2，ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"I don't trust her, either. I just want to hear how she's going to try to "
"worm her way out of this."
msgstr ""
"我​没​说​自己​相信​她​。​我​只是​想​听听​她​打算​怎么​为​自己​开脱​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 shuo1 zi4ji3 xiang1xin4 ta1。wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 ting1 ting1 ta1 da3suan4 zen3me5 wei2 zi4ji3 kai1tuo1。"

msgid ""
"I don't trust that thing, $(l.name). It killed Monika.\n"
"\n"
"We shouldn't have let it go free."
msgstr ""
"我​不​信任​那​东西​，​$(l.name)​。​它​杀​了​莫妮卡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不该​放​它​自由​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xin4ren4 na4 dong1xi1，$(l.name)。ta1 sha1 le5 Mo4ni1ka3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4gai1 fang4 ta1 zi4you2。"

msgid ""
"I don't understand the science of it. Not even a little bit. But from what I can piece together, it looks like they designed some sort of chemical/radiological agent that acts on the metagene.\n"
"\n"
"I don't think that they fully understood what they were doing... it was 2012, after all. I mean, the process worked... but I don't know if they understood *why* it worked."
msgstr ""
"我​一点​也​不​懂​其中​的​科学​原理​，​但​从​我​能​拼凑出​的​东西​来看​，​他们​似乎​设计​了​某种​化学​放射性​制剂​来​作用​于元​基因​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​认为​他们​完全​明白​自己​在​做​什么​……​毕竟​那​时候​是​2012​年​。​我​的​意思​是​，​成果​确实​有效​……​但​我​不​知道​他们​是否​明白​*​为什么​*​会起​作用​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 dong3 qi2zhong1 de5 ke1xue2 yuan2li3，dan4 cong2 wo3 neng2 pin1 cou4 chu1 de5 dong1xi1 lai2 kan4，ta1men5 si4hu1 she4ji4 le5 mou3zhong3 hua4xue2 fang4she4xing4 zhi4ji4 lai2 zuo4yong4 yu2 yuan2 ji1yin1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 ta1men5 wan2quan2 ming2bai5 zi4ji3 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5……bi4jing4 na4 shi2hou5 shi4 2012 nian2。wo3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，cheng2guo3 que4shi2 you3xiao4……dan4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 shi4fou3 ming2bai5*wei4shen2me5*hui4 qi3 zuo4yong4。"

msgid "I don't wanna die!"
msgstr ""
"我​可​不想​死​！\n"
"wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 si3！"

msgid ""
"I don't wanna lose my thumbs, chief. I *like* my thumbs.\n"
"\n"
"I think that I need to pay this guy back."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​失去​我​的​拇指​，​头儿​。​我​*​喜欢​*​我​的​拇指​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​我​得​把​钱​还给​那家伙​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 shi1qu4 wo3 de5 mu3zhi3，tou2r5。wo3*xi3huan5*wo3 de5 mu3zhi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 de2 ba3 qian2 huan2gei3 na4 jia1 huo3。"

msgid ""
"I don't want any trouble, buddy... just let me hide out here until the coast is clear.\n"
"\n"
"Okay?"
msgstr ""
"我​不想​惹麻烦​，​伙计​……​我​只​想​老实​藏​在​这​，​等​外面​安全​了​再​走​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 re3ma2fan5，huo3ji5……wo3 zhi3 xiang3 lao3shi5 zang4 zai4 zhe4，deng3 wai4mian4 an1quan2 le5 zai4 zou3。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I don't want to be on anyone else's bad side... especially not theirs. I didn't even think that they existed.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns to stare at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What the hell have you gotten us into, chief?"
msgstr ""
"我​谁​也​不想​得罪​……​尤其​是​他们​。​我​甚至​都​不​知道​他们​真的​存在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转过​来​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​头儿​，​你​到底​把​我们​卷进​什么​麻烦​了​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shei2 ye3 bu4xiang3 de2zui4……you2qi2 shi4 ta1men5。wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 zhen1de5 cun2zai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 lai2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，ni3 dao4di3 ba3 wo3men5 juan3 jin4 shen2me5 ma2fan5 le5？"

msgid ""
"I don't want to be rude, but I'm a little busy right now. If this is about "
"building maintenance, take it someplace else."
msgstr ""
"无意​冒犯​，​我​现在​有点​忙​。​如果​是​和​建筑​检修​有关​的​事情​，​还是​去​别处​吧​。\n"
"wu2yi4 mao4fan4，wo3 xian4zai4 you3dian3 mang2。ru2guo3 shi4 he4 jian4zhu4 jian3xiu1 you3guan1 de5 shi4qing5，hai2shi5 qu4 bie2chu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don't want to fight you on this, Eiger. If this is too personal for you, "
"we can drop it."
msgstr ""
"我​无意​与​你​争论​，​艾格尔​。​如果​这​是​你​的​隐私​，​那​我​就​不再​过问​了​。\n"
"wo3 wu2yi4 yu4 ni3 zheng1lun4，Ai4ge2er3。ru2guo3 zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 yin3si1，na4 wo3 jiu4 bu4zai4 guo4wen4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don't want to kill you, Glory. And I won't, unless you force my hand.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The flickering silhouette spreads its arms wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ask me for my protection, and I will usher you out of this place. You can leave Feuerstelle in peace. If you ask me politely, I might even let your friend leave with you."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​杀​你​，​格洛丽​。​而且​我​也​不会​杀​你​，​除非​你​逼​我​动手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​闪烁​的​身影​张开​双臂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请求​我​的​庇护​，​我​就​会​送​你​离开​这个​地方​。​你​可以​安然无恙​地​离开​“​火坑​”​。​如果​你​态度​好​的话​，​我​也​可以​考虑​让​你​的​朋友​和​你​一起​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 sha1 ni3，Ge2luo4li2。er2qie3 wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 sha1 ni3，chu2fei1 ni3 bi1 wo3 dong4shou3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shan3shuo4 de5 shen1ying3 zhang1kai1 shuang1bi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3qiu2 wo3 de5 bi4hu4，wo3 jiu4 hui4 song4 ni3 li2kai1 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。ni3 ke3yi3 an1ran2wu2yang4 de5 li2kai1“huo3keng1”。ru2guo3 ni3 tai4du5 hao3 de5hua4，wo3 ye3 ke3yi3 kao3lu:4 rang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 he4 ni3 yi1qi3 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"I don't want to pin the blame for my decisions on anyone but me. That said, I would like to posit that my father's connection to the Kreuzritters might have helped play into my willingness to serve the Adversary.\n"
"\n"
"In my warped, indoctrinated little brain, I equated the Church with evil, so the opposite of that, I figured, had to be... well, if not good, then at least not totally bad."
msgstr ""
"我​不愿​将​自己​决策​的​责任​归咎于​除我之外​的​任何人​。​话虽如此​，​我​仍​想​提出​：​父亲​与​十字军​的​关联​，​或许​助长​了​我​为​“​反叛者​”​效力​的​意愿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我​那​被​扭曲​支配​的​小​脑袋​里​，​教会​等同于​邪恶​，​因此​在我看来​，​其​对立面​即便​算不上​正义​，​至少​也​不至于​十恶不赦​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4yuan4 jiang1 zi4ji3 jue2ce4 de5 ze2ren4 gui1 jiu4 yu2 chu2 wo3 zhi1 wai4 de5 ren4 he2 ren2。hua4sui1ru2ci3，wo3 reng2 xiang3 ti2chu1：fu4qin1 yu4 shi2zi4jun1 de5 guan1lian2，huo4xu3 zhu4zhang3 le5 wo3 wei2“fan3 pan4 zhe3” xiao4li4 de5 yi4yuan4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 na4 bei4 niu3qu1 zhi1pei4 de5 xiao3 nao3dai5 li3，jiao1hui4 deng3 tong2 yu2 xie2e4，yin1ci3 zai4wo3kan4lai2，qi2 dui4li4mian4 ji2bian4 suan4 bu4 shang4 zheng4yi4，zhi4shao3 ye3 bu4zhi4yu2 shi2e4bu4she4。"

msgid "I don't want to push you on this if you don't want to talk about it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不想​多谈​的话​，​我​不会​强迫​你​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4xiang3 duo1 tan2 de5hua4，wo3 bu4hui4 qiang3po4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I don't want to see Berlin burn. But if that's what it'll take to save the "
"rest of the world, then I think that you should do it. I won't try to stop "
"you."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​看到​柏林​被​烧毁​。​但​如果​这是​拯救​世界​其他​地方​的​必要​代价​，​那么​我​认为​你​应该​去​做​。​我​不会​试图​阻止​你​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 kan4dao4 bo2lin2 bei4 shao1hui3。dan4 ru2guo3 zhe4 shi4 zheng3jiu4 shi4jie4 qi2ta1 di4fang1 de5 bi4yao4 dai4jia4，na4me5 wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 ying1gai1 qu4 zuo4。wo3 bu4hui4 shi4tu2 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid "I don't want to think about it."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​去​思考​这种​事​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 qu4 si1kao3 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid "I don't want you on this team, Blitz. Now scram."
msgstr ""
"我​不​希望​你​入队​，​布里​茨​。​赶紧​走​人​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi1wang4 ni3 ru4 dui4，Bu4li3ci2。gan3jin3 zou3 ren2。"

msgid ""
"I don't... I don't really *feel* much any more. Not since...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She caresses the chrome of her forearm with a hand made of articulated steel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This."
msgstr ""
"我​……​我​已经​不怎么​有​*​感受​*​这种​东西​了​。​自从​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​那​只​铰接​钢材​制成​的​手​轻抚​着​自己​前臂​的​镀铬​表面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​之后​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 yi3jing1 bu4zen3me5 you3*gan3shou4*zhe4zhong3 dong1xi1 le5。zi4cong2……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 na4 zhi3 jiao3 jie1 gang1cai2 zhi4cheng2 de5 shou3 qing1fu3 zhao2 zi4ji3 qian2bi4 de5 du4 ge4 biao3mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 zhi1hou4。"

msgid "I don’t give a crap about dragons, Hans."
msgstr ""
"我​他​妈​不在乎​龙​怎么​想​，​汉斯​。\n"
"wo3 ta1 ma1 bu4zai4hu5 long2 zen3me5 xiang3，han4si1。"

msgid "I don’t have time for this. I have bigger fish to fry."
msgstr ""
"我​没空​聊​这些​。​我​还要​忙​着​捞​大鱼​呢​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 kong1 liao2 zhe4xie1。wo3 hai2 yao4 mang2 zhao2 lao1 dai4 yu2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"I don’t know how you escaped the laboratory, but please… stop. \n"
"\n"
"I must complete the virus infusion process. I must release her. Our future as a species depends on it."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​你​是​如何​从​实验室​逃出来​的​，​但​拜托​你​……​停下​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​完成​病毒​注入​过程​。​我​必须​释放​她​。​我们​作为​一个​物种​的​未来​取决于​此​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 ru2he2 cong2 shi2yan4shi4 tao2 chu1 lai2 de5，dan4 bai4tuo1 ni3……ting2xia4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 wan2cheng2 bing4du2 zhu4ru4 guo4cheng2。wo3 bi4xu1 shi4fang4 ta1。wo3men5 zuo4wei2 yi1ge5 wu4zhong3 de5 wei4lai2 qu3jue2yu2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"I don’t know what you're heading out to do, but I’d hate to be on the "
"receiving end of those razors."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​你​要​去​做​什么​，​但​我​可​不想​和​那​副​利刃​对着干​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 yao4 qu4 zuo4 shen2me5，dan4 wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 he4 na4 fu4 li4ren4 dui4zhe5gan4。"

msgid ""
"I don’t know, $(l.name). Blitz may have a point. I’m not sure I would’ve "
"made the same call."
msgstr ""
"我​不好​说​，​$(l.name)​。​布里​茨​也许​说​得​有​道理​。​我​不​确定​自己​是否​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hao3 shuo1，$(l.name)。Bu4li3ci2 ye3xu3 shuo1 de2 you3 dao4li5。wo3 bu4 que4ding4 zi4ji3 shi4fou3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"I don’t know. After Green Winters, I need to have a better idea of who I’m "
"working for these days."
msgstr ""
"我​不好​说​。​自从​格林​·​温特斯​的​事情​后​，​我​都​会​先​了解​雇主​的​身份​再​做事​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hao3 shuo1。zi4cong2 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 shi4qing5 hou4，wo3 dou1 hui4 xian1 liao3jie3 gu4zhu3 de5 shen1fen4 zai4 zuo4shi4。"

msgid "I don’t know. Dragons are dangerous."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​巨龙​可是​很​危险​的​。\n"
"shi4 ma5？ju4long2 ke3shi4 hen3 wei1xian3 de5。"

msgid "I don’t know. This is bigger than me. "
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。​这​超出​了​我​的​思考​能力​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。zhe4 chao1chu1 le5 wo3 de5 si1kao3 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"I don’t need to. I have enough troubles of my own to care about what a Great"
" Dragon thinks."
msgstr ""
"不​需要​理解​。​我​自己​的​麻烦​够​多​了​，​没​空管​一条​巨龙​的​心思​。\n"
"bu4 xu1yao4 li3jie3。wo3 zi4ji3 de5 ma2fan5 gou4 duo1 le5，mei2 kong1 guan3 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 xin1si5。"

msgid "I don’t think I want to get into this right now. I should go."
msgstr ""
"我​不​认为​我​现在​想谈​这些​。​我​该​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 wo3 xian4zai4 xiang3 tan2 zhe4xie1。wo3 gai1 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I don’t think she likes you anymore."
msgstr ""
"看来​她​不​喜欢​你​了​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ta1 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I don’t think so. Who knows what would fill the power vacuum left behind?"
msgstr ""
"不会​吧​。​天知道​填补​权力​真空​的​会​是​什么​势力​呢​？\n"
"bu4hui4 ba1。tian1 zhi1 dao4 tian2bu3 quan2li4 zhen1kong1 de5 hui4 shi4 shen2me5 shi4li5 ni2？"

msgid "I don’t wanna talk about it. It’s still too fresh."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​谈论​这件​事​。​简直​历历在目​啊​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 tan2lun4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。jian3zhi2 li4li4zai4mu4 a1。"

msgid ""
"I don’t want to fight you, and we could use your help. Yes, I’ll do it."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​和​你​战斗​，​而且​我们​确实​需要​你​的​帮助​。​是​的​，​我会​这么​做​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 he4 ni3 zhan4dou4，er2qie3 wo3men5 que4shi2 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。shi4 de5，wo3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I don’t. That’s not the history I was talking about.\n"
"\n"
"And before you ask... no. I don't feel like going into it."
msgstr ""
"我​说​的​“​历史​重演​”​不是​指​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​以及​你​也​不用​多问​了​……​我​不想​深入​谈论​这个​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de5“li4shi3 chong2yan3” bu4shi4 zhi3 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"yi3ji2 ni3 ye3 bu4yong4 duo1 wen4 le5……wo3 bu4xiang3 shen1ru4 tan2lun4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"I don’t. That’s not the history I was talking about.\n"
"\n"
"Let's just say that I've had bad luck with underexperienced teammates, and leave it at that."
msgstr ""
"我​说​的​“​历史​重演​”​不是​指​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以前​和​一帮​菜鸟​队友​合作​的​时候​运气​不好​，​就​说​到​这儿​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de5“li4shi3 chong2yan3” bu4shi4 zhi3 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 he4 yi1 bang1 cai4niao3 dui4you3 he2zuo4 de5 shi2hou5 yun4qi5 bu4hao3，jiu4 shuo1 dao4 zhe4r5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I don’t. That’s not the history I was talking about.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You should go, fearless leader. I’ve got prep work to do for our next run, and you’ve got more important things to do than watch me pack my gear."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​说​的​历史​重演​不是​指​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​该​走​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​得​为​下次​行动​做​准备​了​，​而且​比起​看​我​收拾​东西​，​你​应该​有​更​重要​的​事要​做​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 shuo1 de5 li4shi3 chong2yan3 bu4shi4 zhi3 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gai1 zou3 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3 de2 wei2 xia4ci4 xing2dong4 zuo4 zhun3bei4 le5，er2qie3 bi3qi3 kan4 wo3 shou1shi5 dong1xi1，ni3 ying1gai1 you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 zuo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"I doubt it, chummer. I doubt it very much. \n"
"\n"
"But I appreciate the sentiment. Maybe later, when we know one another better, we can get into it."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​表示​怀疑​，​亲​。​非常​怀疑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​感谢​你​的​好意​。​或许​等​我们​更​了解​彼此​的​时候​，​再​来说​这个​事​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 biao3shi4 huai2yi2，qin1。fei1chang2 huai2yi2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 hao3yi4。huo4xu3 deng3 wo3men5 geng1 liao3jie3 bi3ci3 de5 shi2hou5，zai4 lai2 shuo1 zhe4ge5 shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I doubt it. My gut tells me that what we saw was real, and second-guessing "
"ourselves isn't going to get us anywhere."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​表示​怀疑​。​我​的​直觉​告诉​我​，​我们​所见​的​一切都是​真实​的​，​而​犹疑不决​也​不会​有​任何​答案​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 biao3shi4 huai2yi2。wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，wo3men5 suo3jian4 de5 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 zhen1shi2 de5，er2 you2 yi2 bu4 jue2 ye3 bu4hui4 you3 ren4he2 da2an4。"

msgid "I doubt that you could if you tried."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​就算​你​这么​做​，​也​不会​成功​。\n"
"kong3pa4 jiu4suan4 ni3 zhe4me5 zuo4，ye3 bu4hui4 cheng2gong1。"

msgid "I drank it on my way back to the office."
msgstr ""
"我​回来​的​路上​喝掉​了​。\n"
"wo3 hui2lai5 de5 lu4shang5 he1diao4 le5。"

msgid "I dropped out and left him to twist."
msgstr ""
"我​跑​路​了​，​让​他​自生自灭​。\n"
"wo3 pao2 lu4 le5，rang4 ta1 zi4sheng1zi4mie4。"

msgid ""
"I dunno! Find a terminal, push some buttons! Do *something!*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Your comm goes dead, taking Blitz's panicked voice along with it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​！​找​一台​终端​，​按​几个​按钮​！​总之​做点​什么​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​慌乱​声音​从​你​的​通讯​链里​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4！zhao3 yi1 tai2 zhong1duan1，an4 ji3ge5 an4niu3！zong3zhi1 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 huang1luan4 sheng1yin1 cong2 ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 li3 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I dunno, chief. I really don't.\n"
"\n"
"I hit the data node, just like last time. And just like last time, navigating it was a breeze."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​，​头儿​。​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​像​上次​一样​侵入​了​数据​节点​，​而且​也​像​上次​一样​在​里面​闲庭信步​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，tou2r5。zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 shang4ci4 yi1yang4 qin1ru4 le5 shu4ju4 jie2dian3，er2qie3 ye3 xiang4 shang4ci4 yi1yang4 zai4 li3mian4 xian2 ting2 xin4 bu4。"

msgid ""
"I dunno, chief. This whole incident has me rethinking a lot of things.\n"
"\n"
"What if... what if she took the file to protect the Azzies? What if she's with *them?*"
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​，​头儿​。​这​整件事​让​我​对​很多​事情​有​了​新​的​想法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果说​……​她​拿走​文件​是​为了​保护​阿兹佬​呢​？​如果说​她​和​*​那些​人​*​是​一边​的​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，tou2r5。zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 rang4 wo3 dui4 hen3 duo1 shi4qing5 you3 le5 xin1 de5 xiang3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3shuo1……ta1 na2zou3 wen2jian4 shi4 wei4le5 bao3hu4 e1 zi1 lao3 ni2？ru2guo3shuo1 ta1 he4*na4xie1 ren2*shi4 yi1bian1 de5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"I dunno, man. But one thing I can tell you: *somebody* gave Plotz that info on us. And $(l.name)'s name was on that list.\n"
"\n"
"Now, tell me: other than you, me, and Grinder, who even knew that $(l.he)'d be coming here tonight? And why wasn't Grinder's name on Plotz's kill list?"
msgstr ""
"这​我​不​清楚​。​但​我​可以​告诉​你​一件​事​：​*​有人​*​把​我们​的​信息​交给​了​普​洛茨​。​而且​$(l.name)​的​名字​也​在​这份​名单​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说说看​：​除了​你​、​我​和​“​绞肉机​”​之外​，​谁​还​会​知道​$(l.he)​今晚​要​来​？​而且​为什么​“​绞肉机​”​的​名字​不​在​普​洛茨​的​悬赏​名单​上​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 wo3 bu4 qing1chu5。dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3 yi1 jian4 shi4：*you3ren2*ba3 wo3men5 de5 xin4xi1 jiao1gei3 le5 Pu3luo4ci2。er2qie3 $(l.name) de5 ming2zi5 ye3 zai4 zhe4 fen4 ming2dan1 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4：chu2le5 ni3、wo3 he4“jiao3rou4ji1” zhi1wai4，shei2 hai2 hui4 zhi1dao4 $(l.he) jin1wan3 yao4 lai2？er2qie3 wei4shen2me5“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 ming2zi5 bu4 zai4 Pu3luo4ci2 de5 xuan2shang3 ming2dan1 shang4？"

msgid "I dunno."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"I dunno. I get anxious, and it's just so easy to go inside. But I don't want to anymore.\n"
"\n"
"That's what's different."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。​我​总会​感到​焦虑​，​而​躲​进拟​感​世界​实在​太​容易​了​。​但​我​不想​再​这样​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就是​我​做出​的​改变​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。wo3 zong3 hui4 gan3dao4 jiao1lu:4，er2 duo3 jin4 ni3 gan3 shi4jie4 shi2zai4 tai4 rong2yi4 le5。dan4 wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4yang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3 zuo4chu1 de5 gai3bian4 ba1。"

msgid "I dunno. I guess... I guess that I'm just on-edge right now."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。​可能​……​我​现在​有点​神经质​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。ke3neng2……wo3 xian4zai4 you3dian3 shen2jing1zhi4 le5。"

msgid "I dunno. I have a pretty short memory."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​，​我​记性​不太好​。\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，wo3 ji4xing5 bu4tai4hao3。"

msgid ""
"I dunno. It's your call, of course.\n"
"\n"
"But me? I wouldn't do it."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​，​这​事​最后​还​得​你​来​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​换作​是​我​的话​，​就​不会​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，zhe4 shi4 zui4hou4 hai2 de2 ni3 lai2 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I dunno. Maybe some day, she'll open up to me. I'd like to think that she will.\n"
"\n"
"We'll see, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​，​也许​有​一天​，​她​会​对​我​敞开​心扉​。​我​相信​会​有​这么​一天​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走着瞧​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，ye3xu3 you3 yi1 tian1，ta1 hui4 dui4 wo3 chang3kai1 xin1fei1。wo3 xiang1xin4 hui4 you3 zhe4me5 yi1 tian1。\n"
"\n"
"zou3zhe5qiao2 ba1。"

msgid "I dunno... he's kind of growing on me."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​……​我​觉得​他​这个​人​还行​啊​。\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2……wo3 jue2de5 ta1 zhe4ge5 ren2 hai2 xing2 a1。"

msgid ""
"I ended up there after the anarchist revolution of '39. I was just a kid back then... too young to realize how good I was. How much money I could've made working the shadows.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, a wistful expression on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And so, bein' young and dumb, I fell in with the gang crowd. And that was that."
msgstr ""
"在​2039​年​的​无政府​者​革命​之后​，​我​就​沦落​到​那里​了​。​那​时候​我​还​只是​个​孩子​……​年纪​太小​，​不​清楚​自己​有​多少​本事​，​如果​成为​暗影​狂奔​者​能​挣​多少​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​，​脸上​带​着​一丝​惆怅​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​于是​，​年轻​又​愚蠢​的​我​，​就​和​那群​帮派​成员​混在​一起​了​。​就​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 2039 nian2 de5 wu2 zheng4 fu3 zhe3 ge2ming4 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiu4 lun2luo4 dao4 na4li5 le5。na4 shi2hou5 wo3 hai2 zhi3shi4 ge4 hai2zi5……nian2ji4 tai4 xiao3，bu4 qing1chu5 zi4ji3 you3 duo1shao3 ben3shi4，ru2guo3 cheng2wei2 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 neng2 zheng4 duo1shao3 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 yi1 si1 chou2chang4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yu2shi4，nian2qing1 you4 yu2chun3 de5 wo3，jiu4 he4 na4 qun2 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 hun4 zai4 yi1qi3 le5。jiu4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"I enjoy killing things. Even things that aren't technically alive. So "
"really, it was my pleasure."
msgstr ""
"我​喜欢​杀​东西​，​即便​是​那些​严格​意义​上​不能​算作​“​活着​”​的​东西​。​所以​这​对​我​来说​更​像​一种​享受​。\n"
"wo3 xi3huan5 sha1 dong1xi1，ji2bian4 shi4 na4xie1 yan2ge2 yi4yi4 shang4 bu4neng2 suan4 zuo4“huo2zhe5” de5 dong1xi1。suo3yi3 zhe4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 geng1 xiang4 yi1zhong3 xiang3shou4。"

msgid ""
"I expect you to *help* me.\n"
"\n"
"I'm still alive, but only barely... I don't have the strength to do much myself any more, and Audran cannot handle this task on his own."
msgstr ""
"我​希望​你​*​帮助​*​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​目前​还​活着​，​但​也​只是​勉强​度日​……​我​没有​力气​再​做​什么​事情​，​而​奥​德兰​自己​一个​人​也​没​办法​完成​这个​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 ni3*bang1zhu4*wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mu4qian2 hai2 huo2zhe5，dan4 ye3 zhi3shi4 mian3qiang3 du4ri4……wo3 mei2you3 li4qi5 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5 shi4qing5，er2 Ao4de2lan2 zi4ji3 yi1ge5 ren2 ye3 mei2 ban4fa3 wan2cheng2 zhe4ge5 ren4wu5。"

msgid "I expected as much. Tell me what the damage is going to be."
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。​给​我​报个​价​吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。gei3 wo3 bao4 ge4 jia4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I failed, boss. Alexander was my own blood, an' I failed him.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His gravely voice is full of grief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I never even made it into the compound. How could this have happened?"
msgstr ""
"我​失败​了​，​老大​。​亚历山大​是​我​的​血亲​，​我​却​辜负​了​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​沙哑​的​声音​充满​悲痛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​没​能​赶到​现场​。​怎么​会​发生​这种​事​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi1bai4 le5，lao3da4。ya4li4shan1da4 shi4 wo3 de5 xue4qin1，wo3 que4 gu1fu4 le5 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sha1ya3 de5 sheng1yin1 chong1man3 bei1tong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 mei2 neng2 gan3dao4 xian4chang3。zen3me5 hui4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4？"

msgid "I feel better knowing everyone is all right."
msgstr ""
"看到​每个​人​都​没事​会​让​我​感觉​好受​些​。\n"
"kan4dao4 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 mei2shi4 hui4 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2 hao3shou4 xie1。"

msgid ""
"I feel for you, man. But you're right... best to leave the past in the past."
" Pay your debts and move on."
msgstr ""
"我​很​同情​你​，​伙计​。​但​你​说得对​……​过去​的​事​就让​它​过去​吧​。​还清​你​的​债​，​然后​向前​看​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 tong2qing2 ni3，huo3ji5。dan4 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4……guo4qu4 de5 shi4 jiu4 rang4 ta1 guo4qu4 ba1。huan2qing1 ni3 de5 zhai4，ran2hou4 xiang4qian2 kan4。"

msgid ""
"I feel like I haven't seen the sun in days.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The wageslave rubs his eyes and shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But I'm finally done for the night! Time to make good on my escape. "
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​我​都​好多天​没见​过​太阳​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​薪奴​揉​揉​眼睛​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​今晚​终于​可以​休息​了​！​我​打算​赶紧​开溜​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 wo3 dou1 hao3 duo1 tian1 mei2 jian4 guo4 tai4yang5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xin1 nu2 rou2 rou2 yan3jing5，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 jin1wan3 zhong1yu2 ke3yi3 xiu1xi5 le5！wo3 da3suan4 gan3jin3 kai1liu1。"

msgid ""
"I feel safer already. It's good to get a chance to breathe...when an AI "
"wants you dead, staying alive is a full time occupation."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​感觉​安全​多​了​。​能喘​口气​真​好​……​当​AI​想置​你​于​死地​时​，​活着​本身​就是​份​全职​工作​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 gan3jue2 an1quan2 duo1 le5。neng2 chuan3 kou3qi4 zhen1 hao3……dang1 AI xiang3 zhi4 ni3 yu2 si3 de5 shi2，huo2zhe5 ben3shen1 jiu4shi4 fen4 quan2zhi2 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I felt more comfortable with him than I ever did mein Vater - \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her eyes narrow only for the briefest moment at the word.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"- and we talked a lot when I was waiting around for my friends. "
msgstr ""
"我​跟​他​待​在​一起​时​更​自​在​，​甚至​超过​对​我​自己​的​父亲​—​—​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​说​到​这个​词时​，​眼睛​微微​眯​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​而​当​我​在​等​朋友​时​，​我们​聊​了​很多​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ta1 dai1 zai4 yi1qi3 shi2 geng1 zi4 zai4，shen4zhi4 chao1guo4 dui4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 fu4qin1——\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5 ci2 shi2，yan3jing5 wei1wei1 mi2 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"——er2 dang1 wo3 zai4 deng3 peng2you5 shi2，wo3men5 liao2 le5 hen3 duo1。"

msgid ""
"I felt more comfortable with him than I ever did mein Vater - \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}her eyes narrow only for the briefest moment at the word{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"- and we talked a lot when I was waiting around for my friends. "
msgstr ""
"我​跟​他​待​在​一起​时​更​自​在​，​甚至​超过​对​我​自己​的​父亲​—​—​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​说​到​这个​词时​，​眼睛​微微​眯​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​而​当​我​在​等​朋友​时​，​我们​聊​了​很多​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ta1 dai1 zai4 yi1qi3 shi2 geng1 zi4 zai4，shen4zhi4 chao1guo4 dui4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 fu4qin1——\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5 ci2 shi2，yan3jing5 wei1wei1 mi2 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"——er2 dang1 wo3 zai4 deng3 peng2you5 shi2，wo3men5 liao2 le5 hen3 duo1。"

msgid ""
"I figure you're going out after these people. But if you don't come back, we"
" may get another visit. Hope for the best, prepare for the worst."
msgstr ""
"我​想​你​是​要​去​追​那些​人​。​但​如果​你​不​回来​，​我们​可能​会​再​遭到​一次​袭击​。​抱​最好​的​希望​，​做​最坏​的​准备​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ni3 shi4 yao4 qu4 dui1 na4xie1 ren2。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 hui2lai5，wo3men5 ke3neng2 hui4 zai4 zao1dao4 yi1ci4 xi2ji1。bao4 zui4hao3 de5 xi1wang4，zuo4 zui4 huai4 de5 zhun3bei4。"

msgid ""
"I figured they'd try to ambush you at the platform... ventilate the train, take you out, and cut off a potential escape route in the process. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's what I would do. So I hightailed it out here and set up an ambush of my own."
msgstr ""
"我​料想​他们​会​在​月台​伏击​你​……​血洗​整​次列车​，​把​你​除掉​，​顺便​还​能​切断​一条​潜在​的​逃跑​路线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​我​的话​就​会​这么​做​。​所以​我​赶紧​跑​到​这里​，​设下​了​反​埋伏​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 liao4xiang3 ta1men5 hui4 zai4 yue4tai2 fu2ji1 ni3……xue4xi3 zheng3 ci4 lie4 che1，ba3 ni3 chu2diao4，shun4bian4 hai2 neng2 qie1duan4 yi1 tiao2 qian2zai4 de5 tao2pao3 lu4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3 de5hua4 jiu4 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。suo3yi3 wo3 gan3jin3 pao2 dao4 zhe4li3，she4 xia4 le5 fan3 mai2fu2。"

msgid ""
"I find this \"Harrow\" figure - the leader of your friend's old commune - to be deeply troubling.\n"
"\n"
"He is clearly a toxic shaman, working in the service of his own warped view of the Adversary."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​这个​叫​“​哈罗​”​的​人物​，​也​就是​你​朋友​曾经​所属​社群​的​领袖​，​令人​深感不安​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​明显​是​个​毒萨满​，​依照​他​自己​对​反叛者​的​扭曲​认识​而​行事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4ge5 jiao4“ha1luo2” de5 ren2wu4，ye3 jiu4shi4 ni3 peng2you5 ceng2jing1 suo3shu3 she4qun2 de5 ling3xiu4，ling4ren2 shen1 gan3 bu4 an1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ming2xian3 shi4 ge4 du2 sa4 man3，yi1zhao4 ta1 zi4ji3 dui4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 niu3qu1 ren4shi5 er2 xing2shi4。"

msgid ""
"I fought Humanis, back in '39. The Night of Rage.\n"
"\n"
"My boys and I helped to put down the riots. Put a lot of racist pigs in the hospital while we were at it.\n"
"\n"
"A lot of good people died that night, but we took down some of the bad ones, too."
msgstr ""
"2039​年​的​“​愤怒​之夜​”​时​，​我​曾经​和​人类​至上​主义者​大打出手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​兄弟​们​平息​了​骚乱​，​把​一大堆​种族主义​畜生​送进​了​医院​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那晚​有​很多​好人​倒下​，​但​我们​也​干掉​了​不少​人渣​。\n"
"\n"
"2039 nian2 de5“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” shi2，wo3 ceng2jing1 he4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 da4da3chu1shou3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 xiong1di4 men5 ping2xi1 le5 sao1luan4，ba3 yi1 dai4 dui1 zhong3zu2zhu3yi4 chu4sheng5 song4 jin4 le5 yi1yuan4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wan3 you3 hen3 duo1 hao3ren2 dao3xia4，dan4 wo3men5 ye3 gan4diao4 le5 bu4shao3 ren2zha1。"

msgid "I fought my way out. My team bought the farm, but I made it out."
msgstr ""
"我​拼命​杀出​了​一条​血路​。​他们​……​都​死​了​，​就​我​逃出来​了​。\n"
"wo3 pin1ming4 sha1 chu1 le5 yi1 tiao2 xue4lu4。ta1men5……dou1 si3 le5，jiu4 wo3 tao2 chu1 lai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I found Trithemius. Turns out, he makes better deals than you do. Care to "
"make a counteroffer?"
msgstr ""
"我​找到​特​里特​米​乌斯​了​。​不过​他​开出​的​条件​比​你​更​优厚​。​你​还要​继续​竞价​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhao3dao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 le5。bu4guo4 ta1 kai1 chu1 de5 tiao2jian4 bi3 ni3 geng1 you1hou4。ni3 hai2 yao4 ji4xu4 jing4jia4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I found a body in the other room. From the looks of him, he tried using his "
"head to beat down a steel-reinforced door."
msgstr ""
"我​在​另​一个​房间​里​发现​了​一具​尸体​。​从​外表​来看​，​他​是​想​用头​撞破​一扇​钢铁​加固​的​门​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 ling4 yi1ge5 fang2jian1 li3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 ju4 shi1ti3。cong2 wai4biao3 lai2 kan4，ta1 shi4 xiang3 yong4 tou2 zhuang4 po4 yi1 shan1 gang1tie3 jia1gu4 de5 men2。"

msgid "I found a connection between Emilie and Saeder-Krupp."
msgstr ""
"我​发现​艾米莉​和​赛德​-​克虏伯​之间​有​联系​。\n"
"wo3 fa1xian4 ai4 mi3 li4 he4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 zhi1jian1 you3 lian2xi4。"

msgid "I found a message waiting in my inbox. It was directed to you."
msgstr ""
"我​在​收件箱​里​发现​了​一条​消息​。​是​发给你​的​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 shou1jian4xiang1 li3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 tiao2 xiao1xi5。shi4 fa1 gei3 ni3 de5。"

msgid "I found this drone in that hotel vault. Does it belong to you?"
msgstr ""
"我​在​旅馆​的​保险库​里​发现​了​这架​无人机​。​这​是​你​的​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 lu:3guan3 de5 bao3 xian3 ku4 li3 fa1xian4 le5 zhe4 jia4 wu2ren2ji1。zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I froze up. Nearly shit myself, to be honest.\n"
"\n"
"I dunno what to do. But I can't go down there... not after that."
msgstr ""
"我​愣住​了​。​老实​说​，​我​差点​吓​得​尿裤子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​该​怎么办​。​但​我​不能​下去​……​否则​肯定​会​没命​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 leng4 zhu4 le5。lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 cha4dian3 he4 de2 niao4ku4zi5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5ban4。dan4 wo3 bu4neng2 xia4qu4……fou3ze2 ken3ding4 hui4 mei2ming4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I gave everything I had. \n"
"\n"
"Everything... everything I loved."
msgstr ""
"我​为此​献出​了​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​所​爱​的​……​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei4ci3 xian4chu1 le5 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 suo3 ai4 de5……yi1qie4。"

msgid "I get it, you're powerful. So why are you telling me all of this?"
msgstr ""
"我​明白​，​你​很​强大​。​所以​你​为什么​告诉​我​这些​？\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5，ni3 hen3 qiang2da4。suo3yi3 ni3 wei4shen2me5 gao4su4 wo3 zhe4xie1？"

msgid ""
"I get that they made their own decisions. But from what I was reading, it "
"sounds like those people died from your negligence. \"Basic lapses in lab "
"safety,\" it said."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​他们​自己​做出​了​选择​。​但​根据​我​所读​到​的​内容​，​那些​人​似乎​是因为​你​的​疏忽​而​死亡​的​。​报告​中​提到​：​“​实验室​安全​的​基本​疏漏​。​”\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ta1men5 zi4ji3 zuo4chu1 le5 xuan3ze2。dan4 gen1ju4 wo3 suo3 dou4 dao4 de5 nei4rong2，na4xie1 ren2 si4hu1 shi4 yin1 wei2 ni3 de5 shu1hu5 er2 si3wang2 de5。bao4gao4 zhong4 ti2dao4：“shi2yan4shi4 an1quan2 de5 ji1ben3 shu1lou4。”"

msgid ""
"I get that, $(l.name). I do. But that’s not who I am.\n"
"\n"
"I’m a soldier. I take orders and I execute them. This whole thing about dragons taking over the world... the thought of them slowly hoarding everything... it's too big to think about. "
msgstr ""
"我​明白​，​$(l.name)​。​但​那​不是​我​的​本意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​个​士兵​，​我​的​职责​就是​服从命令​、​完成​任务​。​一​想到​巨龙​们​统治​着​世界​……​它们​慢慢​囤积​着​一切​……​这​念头​太过​庞大​，​简直​难以想象​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5，$(l.name)。dan4 na4 bu4shi4 wo3 de5 ben3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 ge4 shi4bing1，wo3 de5 zhi2ze2 jiu4shi4 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3、wan2cheng2 ren4wu5。yi1 xiang3dao4 ju4long2 men5 tong3zhi4 zhao2 shi4jie4……ta1men5 man4man4 tun2ji1 zhao2 yi1qie4……zhe4 nian4tou5 tai4guo4 pang2da4，jian3zhi2 nan2 yi3 xiang3 xiang4。"

msgid ""
"I get the distinct impression that none of you actually want to be here. But"
" we've got a job to do, so you're all gonna have to suck it up and deal."
msgstr ""
"我​强烈​感觉​到​你们​根本​都​不想​来​这里​。​但​既然​有​任务在身​，​你们​就​得​硬着头皮​上​，​硬着头皮​干​。\n"
"wo3 qiang2lie4 gan3jue2 dao4 ni3men5 gen1ben3 dou1 bu4xiang3 lai2 zhe4li3。dan4 ji4ran2 you3 ren4 wu4 zai4 shen1，ni3men5 jiu4 de2 ying4zhe5tou2pi2 shang4，ying4zhe5tou2pi2 gan4。"

msgid "I get the hint. What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"我​懂​你​意思​了​。​你​有​什么​需要​？\n"
"wo3 dong3 ni3 yi4si5 le5。ni3 you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4？"

msgid "I get the picture."
msgstr ""
"我能​想象​到​那种​场面​。\n"
"wo3 neng2 xiang3xiang4 dao4 na4zhong3 chang3mian4。"

msgid "I get your point. The payday from the run will have to do."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​。​希望​跑​完​这趟​发​的​钱​还​算​凑合​。\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5。xi1wang4 pao2 wan2 zhe4 tang1 fa1 de5 qian2 hai2 suan4 cou4he5。"

msgid "I got another one. We're almost there!"
msgstr ""
"我​解决​了​另​一个​。​我们​就​快​成功​了​！\n"
"wo3 jie3jue2 le5 ling4 yi1ge5。wo3men5 jiu4 kuai4 cheng2gong1 le5！"

msgid ""
"I got beat up. Pretty bad. Needed a doctor, but couldn't pay for one. Then I"
" found Doc Ezkibel. Or he found me. I can't really remember."
msgstr ""
"我​被​狠狠​揍​了​一顿​，​需要​去​找​医生​治疗​，​但​又​支付​不起​费用​。​然后​我​找到​了​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​。​或者说​他​找到​了​我​。​我记​不​太​起来​了​。\n"
"wo3 bei4 hen3hen3 zou4 le5 yi1 dun4，xu1yao4 qu4 zhao3 yi1sheng1 zhi4liao2，dan4 you4 zhi1fu4 bu4 qi3 fei4yong4。ran2hou4 wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1。huo4 zhe3 shuo1 ta1 zhao3dao4 le5 wo3。wo3 ji4 bu4 tai4 qi3lai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I got mixed up with some... bad people. And I had a bad day. Ended up owing "
"them money. Too much money."
msgstr ""
"我​认识​了​一些​……​坏人​。​而​有​天​我​过​的​很糟​，​导致​我​欠​了​他们​钱​。​很多​钱​。\n"
"wo3 ren4shi5 le5 yi1xie1……huai4ren2。er2 you3 tian1 wo3 guo4 de5 hen3 zao1，dao3zhi4 wo3 qian4 le5 ta1men5 qian2。hen3 duo1 qian2。"

msgid "I got pots and pans! You need pots and pans?"
msgstr ""
"我​这​有​各种​好​东西​！​有没有​兴趣​？\n"
"wo3 zhe4 you3 ge4zhong3 hao3 dong1xi1！you3mei2you3 xing4qu4？"

msgid "I got your message. What did you want to discuss?"
msgstr ""
"我​收到​了​你​的​消息​。​你​想​和​我​讨论​什么​事​？\n"
"wo3 shou1dao4 le5 ni3 de5 xiao1xi5。ni3 xiang3 he4 wo3 tao3lun4 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "I got your message. You said that you wanted to talk."
msgstr ""
"我​收到​了​你​的​消息​。​你​说​你​想要​谈谈​。\n"
"wo3 shou1dao4 le5 ni3 de5 xiao1xi5。ni3 shuo1 ni3 xiang3yao4 tan2tan2。"

msgid "I gotta go. I'll see you around."
msgstr ""
"我​得​走​了​。​回头见​。\n"
"wo3 de2 zou3 le5。hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid "I gotta run. See you around."
msgstr ""
"我​得​走​了​。​回头见​。\n"
"wo3 de2 zou3 le5。hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid ""
"I guess I can't argue with you there. If it makes you more combat-capable, I"
" can't order you not to use it."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​对此​没有​异议​。​如果​这样​能​提升​你​的​战斗能力​，​那​我​也​没​必要​禁止​你​使用​它​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 dui4 ci3 mei2you3 yi4yi4。ru2guo3 zhe4yang4 neng2 ti2sheng1 ni3 de5 zhan4 dou3 neng2 li4，na4 wo3 ye3 mei2 bi4yao4 jin4zhi3 ni3 shi3yong4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I guess I'm still a little on edge about all of this... which is exactly what Yuli wanted, of course.\n"
"\n"
"I just can't help thinking, what if he was telling the truth? What if those things *did* happen?"
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​对​这件​事​还​有些​焦躁​……​而​这​也​正是​尤里​想要​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​还是​忍不住​去​想​，​如果​他​*​不是​*​在​戏弄​我​呢​？​如果​这些​事​*​真的​*​发生​过​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 hai2 you3xie1 jiao1zao4……er2 zhe4 ye3 zheng4shi4 You2li3 xiang3yao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 ren3bu5zhu4 qu4 xiang3，ru2guo3 ta1*bu4shi4*zai4 xi4nong4 wo3 ni2？ru2guo3 zhe4xie1 shi4*zhen1de5*fa1sheng1 guo4 ni2？"

msgid "I guess so."
msgstr ""
"我​想​是​吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shi4 ba1。"

msgid "I guess that I don't. Never mind."
msgstr ""
"我​倒​也​没​那么​在意​。​没事​了​。\n"
"wo3 dao3 ye3 mei2 na4me5 zai4yi4。mei2shi4 le5。"

msgid "I guess that explains why Ezkibel didn't hire a company in Spain."
msgstr ""
"怪不得​埃兹​基​贝尔​没有​投资​西班牙​的​公司​呢​。\n"
"guai4bu5de5 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 mei2you3 tou2zi1 xi1ban1ya2 de5 gong1si1 ni2。"

msgid ""
"I guess that's that. Mission accomplished.\n"
"\n"
"With a push of a button."
msgstr ""
"总之​就​这样​了​。​任务​完成​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这么​轻轻​一​按​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 jiu4 zhe4yang4 le5。ren4wu5 wan2cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4me5 qing1qing1 yi1 an4。"

msgid ""
"I guess that's true.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, let's get out of here."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​了​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 le5，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"I guess that, in the grand scheme of things, it doesn't matter all that much which group of corporate bastards get their hands on the MKVI.\n"
"\n"
"What I'm sayin' is that it's your call. I'll back you on it either way."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​从​大局​来看​，​哪​一帮​企业​混账​拿到​MKVI​其实​并​不​重要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​这事​你​说了算​，​我​都​支持​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 cong2 da4ju2 lai2 kan4，na3 yi1 bang1 qi3ye4 hun4zhang4 na2dao4 MKVI qi2shi2 bing4 bu4 zhong4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 zhe4 shi4 ni3 shuo1le5suan4，wo3 dou1 zhi1chi2 ni3。"

msgid "I guess the dog is going with you, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​他​是​要​跟​你​一起​去​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"wo3 cai1 ta1 shi4 yao4 gen1 ni3 yi1qi3 qu4，$(l.name)。"

msgid "I guess there's nothing left to do but inform the F-State."
msgstr ""
"看起来​我们​现在​只能​通知​动荡​带​了​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 wo3men5 xian4zai4 zhi3neng2 tong1zhi1 dong4dang4 dai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I guess what I'm sayin' is, you should know what you've gotten us into. Disappoint the Lodge, an' they might come after us.\n"
"\n"
"It probably wouldn't happen soon - they're nothing if not patient. Might even take a year or two. But eventually, long after we've forgotten all about this little adventure, they'll come knockin'."
msgstr ""
"我​想​说​的​是​，​你​该​清楚​把​我们​卷进​了​什么​麻烦​。​要是​让​结社​失望​的话​，​他们​很​可能​会​找上门来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​不会​马上​就​动手​—​—​他们​对此​很​有​耐心​，​甚至​会​等​个​一两年​。​但​最终​，​等​我们​把​这段​小​插曲​抛​在​脑后​的​时候​，​他们​就​会​登门​造访​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 shi4，ni3 gai1 qing1chu5 ba3 wo3men5 juan3 jin4 le5 shen2me5 ma2fan5。yao4shi5 rang4 jie2she4 shi1wang4 de5hua4，ta1men5 hen3 ke3neng2 hui4 zhao3 shang4 men2 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 bu4hui4 ma3shang4 jiu4 dong4shou3——ta1men5 dui4 ci3 hen3 you3 nai4xin1，shen4zhi4 hui4 deng3 ge4 yi1 liang3 nian2。dan4 zui4zhong1，deng3 wo3men5 ba3 zhe4 duan4 xiao3 cha1qu3 pao1 zai4 nao3hou4 de5 shi2hou5，ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 deng1men2 zao4fang3。"

msgid ""
"I had a feeling, besides. Monika almost always comes around after a run to check on everybody. She's long overdue, and now here you are in her place. So she's either severely wounded or outright dead.\n"
"\n"
"Which is it?"
msgstr ""
"而且​我​有​预感​。​莫妮卡​几乎​每次​跑​完​差事​都​会​来​看看​大家​。​她​好久没​出现​了​，​而​现在​你​却​代替​她​来​了​，​所以​她​要么​受​了​重伤​，​要么​就是​已经​死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​前者​还是​后者​？\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 you3 yu4gan3。Mo4ni1ka3 ji1hu1 mei3ci4 pao2 wan2 cha4shi4 dou1 hui4 lai2 kan4kan5 da4jia1。ta1 hao3 jiu3 mei2 chu1xian4 le5，er2 xian4zai4 ni3 que4 dai4ti4 ta1 lai2 le5，suo3yi3 ta1 yao4me5 shou4 le5 zhong4shang1，yao4me5 jiu4shi4 yi3jing1 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 qian2zhe3 hai2shi5 hou4zhe3？"

msgid ""
"I had a feeling. How did she...?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His face has gone ashen. He swallows. Takes a moment to chew on the words before spitting them out.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...How did it happen?"
msgstr ""
"我​之前​就​有​这种​预感​。​她​是​怎么​……​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​脸色​灰暗​下来​。​他​咽​了​下​口水​，​斟酌​了​一会儿​才​开口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​怎么​出​的​事​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 jiu4 you3 zhe4zhong3 yu4gan3。ta1 shi4 zen3me5……？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3se4 hui1an4 xia4lai5。ta1 yan1 le5 xia4 kou3shui3，zhen1zhuo2 le5 yi1hui4r5 cai2 kai1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……zen3me5 chu1 de5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"I had a tracking device placed on the last shipment that I sent out - containers full of weapons and medical supplies. Sure enough, it got taken, and I've tracked it to Gesundbrunnen. If you've never been there... it's a kiez built out of an old U-Bahn station and some old bunkers.\n"
"\n"
"Rumor has it, a new gang called the \"Rabengeister\" is holed up there. I suspect that the two things are related."
msgstr ""
"我​在​最新​一批​装满​武器​和​医疗​用品​的​集装箱​上​安装​了​追踪​装置​。​果然​，​货物​被劫走​了​，​而​我​追踪​到​了​健康​泉​。​如果​你​没​去过​那里​……​那​是​一个​由旧​地铁站​和​一些​旧​碉堡​改建​而成​的​街区​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​传言​说​，​一个​叫​“​鸦灵​”​的​新​帮派​就​藏​在​那里​。​我​怀疑​这​两件事​有关​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 zui4xin1 yi1 pi1 zhuang1man3 wu3qi4 he4 yi1liao2 yong4pin3 de5 ji2zhuang1xiang1 shang4 an1zhuang1 le5 zhui1zong1 zhuang1zhi4。guo3ran2，huo4wu4 bei4 jie2 zou3 le5，er2 wo3 zhui1zong1 dao4 le5 jian4kang1 quan2。ru2guo3 ni3 mei2 qu4 guo4 na4li5……na4 shi4 yi1ge5 you2 jiu4 di4tie3zhan4 he4 yi1xie1 jiu4 diao1bao3 gai3jian4 er2 cheng2 de5 jie1qu1。\n"
"\n"
"you3 chuan2yan2 shuo1，yi1ge5 jiao4“Ya1ling2” de5 xin1 bang1pai4 jiu4 zang4 zai4 na4li5。wo3 huai2yi2 zhe4 liang3 jian4 shi4 you3guan1。"

msgid ""
"I had a... let us say, \"tumultuous\" friendship with your dear departed Monika. We had our ups and downs, you see. And on this subject, she was most certainly down. \n"
"\n"
"That was her choice. I am hoping that you will be savvy enough not to make the same mistake."
msgstr ""
"我​和​你们​亲爱​的​莫妮卡​有过​一段​……​可以​说​是​“​跌宕起伏​”​的​友谊​。​我们​的​关系​时好时坏​。​而​在​这个​问题​上​，​她​完全​没有​打算​帮助​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​她​的​选择​。​我​希望​你​有​足够​的​智慧​，​不要​重蹈覆辙​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 ni3men5 qin1ai4 de5 Mo4ni1ka3 you3 guo4 yi1 duan4……ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4“die1 dang4 qi3 fu2” de5 you3yi4。wo3men5 de5 guan1xi5 shi2hao3shi2huai4。er2 zai4 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2 shang4，ta1 wan2quan2 mei2you3 da3suan4 bang1zhu4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ta1 de5 xuan3ze2。wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 you3 zu2gou4 de5 zhi4hui4，bu4yao4 chong2dao3fu4zhe2。"

msgid ""
"I had always thought that they had left the ending to the imagination, like a beautiful dream.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He fidgets uncomfortably.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But now the dream is over! I will never know peace until I have seen this conclusion for myself."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​以为​他们​是​把​结局​留给​观众​去​想象​的​，​就​像​一场​美丽​的​梦境​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​不安​地​扭动​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​现在​，​梦境​结束​了​！​在​我​亲眼看到​这个​结局​之前​，​我​将​永远​无法​获得​平静​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 yi3wei2 ta1men5 shi4 ba3 jie2ju2 liu2gei3 guan1zhong4 qu4 xiang3xiang4 de5，jiu4 xiang4 yi1 chang2 mei3li4 de5 meng4jing4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bu4an1 de5 niu3 dong4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 xian4zai4，meng4jing4 jie2shu4 le5！zai4 wo3 qin1 yan3 kan4 dao4 zhe4ge5 jie2ju2 zhi1qian2，wo3 jiang1 yong3yuan3 wu2fa3 huo4de2 ping2jing4。"

msgid ""
"I had it shipped here - at great personal expense - from a super-max prison in the UCAS.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He traces a twirl in the air with the fork.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The warden owed me a favor."
msgstr ""
"我​自己​下​了​血本​，​才​从​加美​合众国​的​一所​超级​监狱​把​东西​运了​过来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​叉子​在​空中​划​了​个​圈​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​监狱长​欠​我​一个​人情​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 xia4 le5 xue4ben3，cai2 cong2 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 de5 yi1 suo3 chao1ji2 jian1yu4 ba3 dong1xi1 yun4 le5 guo4lai2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 cha1zi5 zai4 kong1zhong1 hua2 le5 ge4 juan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jian1 yu4 zhang3 qian4 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2qing2。"

msgid ""
"I had my own limbs hacked off to get away from the Adversary. I paid somebody to do it. That's how badly I wanted to be free of your \"Great Master.\"\n"
"\n"
"Your offer is as pathetic as it was predictable. To be frank, I'm disappointed in you."
msgstr ""
"为了​逃离​反叛者​的​掌控​，​我​花钱​雇​人​砍掉​了​自己​的​四肢​。​我​就是​这么​想​摆脱​你​的​那位​“​伟大​主人​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​提议​如此​可悲​，​又​不出所料​。​老实​说​，​我​对​你​很​失望​。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 tao2li2 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 zhang3kong4，wo3 hua1qian2 gu4 ren2 kan3 diao4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 si4zhi1。wo3 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 bai3tuo1 ni3 de5 na4 wei4“wei3da4 zhu3ren2。” \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ti2yi4 ru2ci3 ke3bei1，you4 bu4chu1suo3liao4。lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 dui4 ni3 hen3 shi1wang4。"

msgid "I had my reasons."
msgstr ""
"我​有​我​自己​的​理由​。\n"
"wo3 you3 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 li3you2。"

msgid ""
"I had no contacts in Berlin back then, mind you. Can't really say how bad "
"things were here. Had battles of my own to worry about."
msgstr ""
"当时​我​在​柏林​没有​任何人​脉​。​所以​也​说不清​这里​的​情况​有​多​糟糕​。​我​还有​自己​的​战斗​要​操心​呢​。\n"
"dang1shi2 wo3 zai4 bo2lin2 mei2you3 ren4 he2 ren2 mai4。suo3yi3 ye3 shuo1 bu4 qing1 zhe4li3 de5 qing2kuang4 you3 duo1 zao1gao1。wo3 hai2you3 zi4ji3 de5 zhan4dou4 yao4 cao1xin1 ni2。"

msgid "I had some trouble on the U-Bahn. Somebody set up an ambush."
msgstr ""
"我​在​地铁​遇到​了​麻烦​，​有人​埋伏​了​我们​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 di4tie3 yu4dao4 le5 ma2fan5，you3ren2 mai2fu2 le5 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"I had to meet you in person. To look into your eyes and see the $(l.man) behind the name.\n"
"\n"
"Now that I have done so, I am sure. You are the one that I need."
msgstr ""
"我​必须​亲自​来​见​你​。​我​需要​直视​你​的​眼睛​，​看清楚​盛名之下​的​这个​$(l.man)​究竟​是​什么​样子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我​可以​确信​，​你​就是​我​需要​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 qin1zi4 lai2 jian4 ni3。wo3 xu1yao4 zhi2shi4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5，kan4 qing1 chu3 cheng2 ming2 zhi1 xia4 de5 zhe4ge5 $(l.man) jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5 yang4zi5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3 ke3yi3 que4xin4，ni3 jiu4shi4 wo3 xu1yao4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"I hate giving Harrow the chance to escape, but you're right: saving the kids is what's important.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses, considering her choice, and a smile flits across her lips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This feels like the path to redemption. This feels *right.*"
msgstr ""
"我​讨厌​让​哈罗​有​逃脱​的​机会​，​但​你​说得对​：​救​孩子​才​是​最​重要​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​权衡​着​抉择​，​嘴角​掠过​一丝​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这条​路​仿佛​通向​救赎​。​这种​感觉​是​*​对​的​*​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tao3yan4 rang4 ha1luo2 you3 tao2tuo1 de5 ji1hui4，dan4 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4：jiu4 hai2zi5 cai2 shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，quan2heng2 zhao2 jue2ze2，zui3jiao3 lu:e4guo4 yi1 si1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 lu4 fang3fu2 tong1xiang4 jiu4shu2。zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2 shi4*dui4 de5*。"

msgid ""
"I hate to interrupt, but if you two are finished, I'd like to get this show on the road.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances at his wristwatch.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wanna get back home before my grandkids go to bed."
msgstr ""
"我​无意​打断​，​但​如果​你们​俩​说完​的话​，​我们​还是​尽快​动身​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​瞥​了​一眼​自己​的​手表​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​能​在​我​的​孙孩们​睡觉​前​赶回​家​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wu2yi4 da3duan4，dan4 ru2guo3 ni3men5 lia3 shuo1 wan2 de5hua4，wo3men5 hai2shi5 jin3kuai4 dong4shen1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 zi4ji3 de5 shou3biao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 neng2 zai4 wo3 de5 sun1 hai2 men5 shui4jiao4 qian2 gan3 hui2 jia1。"

msgid "I hate to say it, Doctor... but I think that I agree with you."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​这么​说​，​博士​……​但​我​同意​你​的​想法​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 zhe4me5 shuo1，bo2shi4……dan4 wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid ""
"I have a better idea.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She dips a hand into her satchel and produces a ceremonial dagger. The blade shimmers eerily in the light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're going to purify you, Spirit. And after we've finished, you'll *help* us rescue those kids."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​更好​的​主意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把手​伸进​挎包​，​拿出​一把​仪式​匕首​。​它​在​光线​下​闪烁着​诡异​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​净化​你​，​精魂​。​完事​之后​，​你​要​*​帮助​*​我们​救出​那些​孩子​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 geng1 hao3 de5 zhu3yi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 kua4bao1，na2chu1 yi1 ba3 yi2shi4 bi3shou3。ta1 zai4 guang1xian4 xia4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 gui3yi4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 jing4hua4 ni3，jing1hun2。wan2shi4 zhi1hou4，ni3 yao4*bang1zhu4*wo3men5 jiu4chu1 na4Xie1hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"I have a better idea. Why don't you just tell me what I want to know, and "
"then there won't be any need for violence."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​更好​的​主意​。​你​直接​把​我​想​知道​的​事情​告诉​我​，​这样​就​不会​涉及​任何​暴力​了​。\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 geng1 hao3 de5 zhu3yi5。ni3 zhi2jie1 ba3 wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 de5 shi4qing5 gao4su4 wo3，zhe4yang4 jiu4 bu4hui4 she4ji2 ren4he2 bao4li4 le5。"

msgid "I have a cold."
msgstr ""
"我​感冒​了​。\n"
"wo3 gan3mao4 le5。"

msgid "I have a cold. Open the door."
msgstr ""
"我​感冒​了​。​快​开门​。\n"
"wo3 gan3mao4 le5。kuai4 kai1men2。"

msgid "I have a feeling that I know."
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​我能​理解​。\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 wo3 neng2 li3jie3。"

msgid "I have a hard time buying that."
msgstr ""
"我​很​难​相信​你​说​的​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 nan2 xiang1xin4 ni3 shuo1 de5。"

msgid ""
"I have a job offer for you - a little errand that I'd like you to run. \n"
"\n"
"The pay is good, and if you perform to my employers' satisfaction, there will be more work in the future."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​工作​机会​要​给​你​—​—​想​请​你​跑​个​小​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​报酬​丰厚​，​如果​你​能令​雇主​满意​的话​，​今后​还会​有​更​多​工作​机会​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 gong1zuo4 ji1hui4 yao4 gei3 ni3——xiang3 qing3 ni3 pao2 ge4 xiao3 cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bao4chou5 feng1hou4，ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 ling3 gu4zhu3 man3yi4 de5hua4，jin1hou4 hai2 hui4 you3 geng1 duo1 gong1zuo4 ji1hui4。"

msgid ""
"I have a proposal for you that could prove most lucrative to us both, efendim. \n"
"\n"
"Most lucrative!\n"
"\n"
"Fortune will surely smile upon our blessed partnership, if you will only accept."
msgstr ""
"我​这里​有个​提议​，​或许​能为​我们​双方​带来​丰厚​的​回报​，​贵人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​极为​丰厚​的​回报​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​你​肯​接受​，​我们​的​美好​合作​必将​获得​幸运​女神​的​眷顾​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4li3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4，huo4xu3 neng2 wei2 wo3men5 shuang1fang1 dai4lai2 feng1hou4 de5 hui2bao4，gui4ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ji2wei2 feng1hou4 de5 hui2bao4！\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 ken3 jie1shou4，wo3men5 de5 mei3hao3 he2zuo4 bi4jiang1 huo4de2 xing4yun4 nu:3shen2 de5 juan4gu4。"

msgid ""
"I have a proposal to offer you. A mutually beneficial arrangement.\n"
"\n"
"I know that you're here to kill me. No sense in trying to deny it... it's the only logical reason why you'd come at all. But if we work together, we can both get what we want."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​提议​，​能​对​我们​双方​都​有​好处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​你们​是​来​杀​我​的​。​不用​试图​否认​……​这​显然​是​你们​来​的​唯一​理由​。​但​如果​我们​合作​，​我们​都​可以​得到​自己​想要​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4，neng2 dui4 wo3men5 shuang1fang1 dou1 you3 hao3chu3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 shi4 lai2 sha1 wo3 de5。bu4yong4 shi4tu2 fou3ren4……zhe4 xian3ran2 shi4 ni3men5 lai2 de5 wei2yi1 li3you2。dan4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 he2zuo4，wo3men5 dou1 ke3yi3 de2dao4 zi4ji3 xiang3yao4 de5。"

msgid "I have a question for you, Glory. Of the personal kind."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​我​想​问​你​个​问题​，​私人​的​那种​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，wo3 xiang3 wen4 ni3 ge4 wen4ti2，si1ren2 de5 na4zhong3。"

msgid "I have a question for you, if you don't mind."
msgstr ""
"要是​你​不介意​的话​，​我​有​个​问题​要​问​你​。\n"
"yao4shi5 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4，wo3 you3 ge4 wen4ti2 yao4 wen4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I have already found a potential client, O Blessed One. \n"
"\n"
"A most prosperous one, with deep pockets. He is eager to meet you. \n"
"\n"
"When you are ready, take the U-bahn to Brandenburger Tor. He will find you there."
msgstr ""
"神佑​之人​啊​，​我​已经​发现​了​一名​潜在​客户​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一位​财力雄厚​、​腰缠万贯​之​人​。​他​迫切希望​与​你​见面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​待​你​准备就绪​，​搭乘​地铁​前往​勃兰登堡门​。​他​将​在​那里​与​你​会合​。\n"
"\n"
"shen2 you4 zhi1 ren2 a1，wo3 yi3jing1 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 ming2 qian2zai4 ke4hu4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wei4 cai2 li4 xiong2 hou4、yao1chan2wan4guan4 zhi1 ren2。ta1 po4 qie1 xi1 wang4 yu4 ni3 jian4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"dai1 ni3 zhun3 bei4 jiu4 xu4，da1cheng2 di4tie3 qian2wang3 bo2 lan2 deng1 pu4 men2。ta1 jiang1 zai4 na4li5 yu4 ni3 hui4he2。"

msgid ""
"I have also determined that a kill switch for the AI exists somewhere in the basement of this facility.\n"
"\n"
"I will provide you with a physical address."
msgstr ""
"我​还​发现​这所​设施​的​地下室​某处​有​一个​AI​紧急​开关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​把​详细​地址​发给你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 fa1xian4 zhe4 suo3 she4shi1 de5 di4xia4shi4 mou3chu4 you3 yi1ge5 AI jin3ji2 kai1guan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 ba3 xiang2xi4 di4zhi3 fa1 gei3 ni3。"

msgid "I have another question."
msgstr ""
"我​还有​个​问题​。\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 ge4 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"I have been ripped from my body little $(l.race). Imprisoned in this girl, imprisoned in this cage. Tortured longer than the span of your entire lifetime. \n"
"\n"
"And I have been defiled. The green is defiled. Spoiled. \n"
"\n"
"There is no forever for me. Forever is dead. "
msgstr ""
"我​被​扯​离​了​我​的​肉身​，​小​$(l.race)​。​被​囚禁​在​这个​女孩​体内​，​被​囚禁​在​这个​笼子​里​。​遭受​的​折磨​比​你​整个​生命​都​更​漫长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​被​玷污​了​。​绿色​被​玷污​了​。​被​毁坏​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​我​来说​，​没有​永恒​。​永恒​已死​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bei4 che3 li2 le5 wo3 de5 rou4shen1，xiao3 $(l.race)。bei4 qiu2jin4 zai4 zhe4ge5 nu:3hai2 ti3nei4，bei4 qiu2jin4 zai4 zhe4ge5 long2zi5 li3。zao1shou4 de5 zhe2mo2 bi3 ni3 zheng3ge4 sheng1ming4 dou1 geng1 man4chang2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bei4 dian4wu1 le5。lu:4se4 bei4 dian4wu1 le5。bei4 hui3huai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1，mei2you3 yong3heng2。yong3heng2 yi3 si3。"

msgid "I have better things to do than waste time talking to a madman."
msgstr ""
"我​还有​更​重要​的​事​做​，​没​时间​和​疯子​浪费​口舌​。\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 zuo4，mei2 shi2jian1 he4 feng1zi5 lang4fei4 kou3she2。"

msgid ""
"I have better things to do with my time than run around reading old news "
"clippings. Sum it up for me."
msgstr ""
"我​还有​更​重要​的​事要​做​，​没空​到处​翻旧​报纸​。​给​我​简要​总结​下​吧​。\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 zuo4，mei2 kong1 dao4chu4 fan1 jiu4 bao4zhi3。gei3 wo3 jian3yao4 zong3jie2 xia4 ba1。"

msgid "I have business that has become urgent."
msgstr ""
"我​在​那边​有件​要紧​事要​处理​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 na4bian5 you3 jian4 yao4jin3 shi4 yao4 chu3li3。"

msgid "I have business with him. Private business."
msgstr ""
"我​和​他​有些​私事​要​谈​。\n"
"wo3 he4 ta1 you3xie1 si1shi4 yao4 tan2。"

msgid "I have cash, and I need weapons. Show me the goods."
msgstr ""
"我​有钱​，​而且​我​需要​武器​。​让​我​看看​货​吧​。\n"
"wo3 you3qian2，er2qie3 wo3 xu1yao4 wu3qi4。rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 huo4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I have contacted sister organizations across Berlin and taken up a collection. Between us, we have raised 22,000 nuyen as a payment.\n"
"\n"
"I trust that this will be sufficient?"
msgstr ""
"我​联系​了​柏林​各地​的​姊妹​组织​，​并​开展​了​募捐​活动​。​我们​已经​筹集​到​了​22​,​000​新円​作为​报酬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​这​应该​足够​了​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 lian2xi4 le5 bo2lin2 ge4di4 de5 zi3mei4 zu3zhi1，bing4 kai1zhan3 le5 mu4juan1 huo2dong4。wo3men5 yi3jing1 chou2ji2 dao4 le5 22,000 xin1 yuan2 zuo4wei2 bao4chou5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhe4 ying1gai1 zu2gou4 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"I have eaten nothing but vat-grown metahuman organs for a year and a half, stranger.\n"
"\n"
"I would kill for a choco nub."
msgstr ""
"陌生人​，​这​一年​半​以来​，​除了​培养​的​泛​人类​器官​之外​，​我​没有​吃​过​其他​任何​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​能​吃​上​巧克力​块​，​让​我​杀人​都行​。\n"
"\n"
"mo4sheng1ren2，zhe4 yi1 nian2 ban4 yi3lai2，chu2le5 pei2yang3 de5 fan4 ren2lei4 qi4guan1 zhi1wai4，wo3 mei2you3 chi1 guo4 qi2ta1 ren4he2 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 neng2 chi1 shang4 qiao3ke4li4 kuai4，rang4 wo3 sha1ren2 dou1 xing2。"

msgid "I have faith in you, ace. It's up to you to justify that faith."
msgstr ""
"我​对​你​有​信心​，​王牌​。​至于​你​能否​不负所托​，​现在​就​看​你​自己​了​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ni3 you3 xin4xin1，wang2pai2。zhi4yu2 ni3 neng2fou3 bu4 fu4 suo3 tuo1，xian4zai4 jiu4 kan4 ni3 zi4ji3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I have made contact with another prospective client. A rather elusive woman of Aztlaner descent.\n"
"\n"
"She calls herself “Frau Müller.”"
msgstr ""
"我​已​与​另​一位​潜在​客户​取得联系​。​一位​颇为​神秘​的​阿兹特​兰​血统​女子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​自称​“​穆勒​女士​”​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3 yu4 ling4 yi1 wei4 qian2zai4 ke4hu4 qu3 de2 lian2 xi4。yi1 wei4 po1wei2 shen2mi4 de5 e1 zi1 te4 lan2 xue4tong3 nu:3zi3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zi4cheng1“mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4”。"

msgid ""
"I have many stories; stories of dancing spirits and raging dragons, of unchecked magic and swarming chaos. All of these stories are true.\n"
"\n"
"As for the Kreuzbasar... I have always been here, quietly peddling my wares. It is a simple life, but a good one."
msgstr ""
"我​有​很多​故事​：​舞动​的​精魂​与​盛怒​的​巨龙​，​暴走​的​魔法​与​蜂拥​的​混沌​。​所有​这些​故事​都​是​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​克洛伊​茨​集市​……​我​一直​都​在​这里​，​默默​兜售​着​我​的​货物​。​这样​的​生活​虽然​简单​，​却​也​自​在​逍遥​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 hen3 duo1 gu4shi4：wu3dong4 de5 jing1hun2 yu4 sheng4nu4 de5 ju4long2，bao4zou3 de5 mo2fa3 yu4 feng1yong1 de5 hun4dun4。suo3you3 zhe4xie1 gu4shi4 dou1 shi4 zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4……wo3 yi1zhi2 dou1 zai4 zhe4li3，mo4mo4 dou1shou4 zhao2 wo3 de5 huo4wu4。zhe4yang4 de5 sheng1huo2 sui1ran2 jian3dan1，que4 ye3 zi4 zai4 xiao1yao2。"

msgid ""
"I have marked an elevator on your PDA. I'd start making my way there if I were you... it's the most efficient path to reach your objective.\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck."
msgstr ""
"我​在​你​的​PDA​上​标注​了​一台​电梯​。​我​建议​直接​前往​那里​……​这是​抵达​目标​地点​最​便捷​的​路线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝你好运​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 ni3 de5 PDA shang4 biao1zhu4 le5 yi1 tai2 dian4ti1。wo3 jian4yi4 zhi2jie1 qian2wang3 na4li5……zhe4 shi4 di3da2 mu4biao1 di4dian3 zui4 bian4jie2 de5 lu4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid "I have no idea."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"I have no intention of betraying you. But watch your tongue, stranger... I don't take well to threats.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He dismisses you with a wave of his hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Go now. "
msgstr ""
"我​无意​背叛​你​。​但​小心​你​的​言辞​，​陌生人​……​我​不​喜欢​被​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挥手​示意​你​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wu2yi4 bei4pan4 ni3。dan4 xiao3xin1 ni3 de5 yan2ci2，mo4sheng1ren2……wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 bei4 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui1shou3 shi4yi4 ni3 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I have no strong feelings about the run one way or the other.\n"
"\n"
"Humanis is, of course, a horrible organization... but then, so is every other target we've run against. To say that they deserved it would be redundant."
msgstr ""
"无论​结果​如何​，​我​对​这次​行动​没有​特别​强烈​的​感受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​人类​至上​主义者​当然​是​个​可怕​的​组织​……​不过​话说回来​，​我们​对抗​过​的​其他​目标​也​都​是​如此​。​我​都​懒得​再​重复​说​他们​活该​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 jie1guo3 ru2he2，wo3 dui4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 mei2you3 te4bie2 qiang2lie4 de5 gan3shou4。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 dang1ran2 shi4 ge4 ke3pa4 de5 zu3zhi1……bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，wo3men5 dui4kang4 guo4 de5 qi2ta1 mu4biao1 ye3 dou1 shi4 ru2ci3。wo3 dou1 lan3de5 zai4 chong2fu4 shuo1 ta1men5 huo2gai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I have no strong feelings about the run one way or the other.\n"
"\n"
"It was a pity that Dietrich's nephew died... I know that he must feel sad about that. But we got the job done.\n"
"\n"
"At the end of the day, that's what's important."
msgstr ""
"无论​结果​如何​，​我​对​这次​行动​没有​特别​强烈​的​感受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​迪​特里​希​的​侄子​去世​了​，​这​实在​令人​惋惜​……​我​知道​他​一定​为此​感到​悲伤​。​但​我们​完成​了​任务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​归根结底​，​这才​是​最​重要​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 jie1guo3 ru2he2，wo3 dui4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 mei2you3 te4bie2 qiang2lie4 de5 gan3shou4。\n"
"\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 de5 zhi2zi5 qu4shi4 le5，zhe4 shi2zai4 ling4ren2 wan3xi1……wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 yi1ding4 wei4ci3 gan3dao4 bei1shang1。dan4 wo3men5 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"gui1gen1jie2di3，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I have no time, and Giesbrecht's applying so much pressure that I can barely think. Bastard!\n"
"\n"
"Haushofer's probably threatening him. All of them can rot."
msgstr ""
"我​没​时间​了​，​吉斯​布雷​希特​给​的​压力​实在​太​大​，​害​我​无法​思考​。​真是​个​混账​东西​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​豪斯​霍​菲尔​八成​也​在​威胁​他​。​都​给​我​见鬼​去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 le5，ji2 si1 bu4lei2 xi1 te4 gei3 de5 ya1li4 shi2zai4 tai4 dai4，hai4 wo3 wu2fa3 si1kao3。zhen1shi5 ge4 hun4zhang4 dong1xi1！\n"
"\n"
"hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3 ba1cheng2 ye3 zai4 wei1xie2 ta1。dou1 gei3 wo3 jian4gui3 qu4 ba1。"

msgid "I have no way of confirming that, but I'll take your word for it."
msgstr ""
"我​无法​确认​这​一点​，​但​我​愿意​相信​你​所说​的​。\n"
"wo3 wu2fa3 que4ren4 zhe4 yi1dian3，dan4 wo3 yuan4yi4 xiang1xin4 ni3 suo3 shuo1 de5。"

msgid ""
"I have nothing new for you, $(l.name), and we have no time to waste.\n"
"\n"
"You have Alice's money, and we *need* that information. Get to the Rabbit Hole, and hurry back... we must find Vauclair before the Firewing finds us!"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​这里​没有​什么​新​发现​，​而且​我们​也​没有​时间​可以​浪费​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​已经​筹集​到​了​爱丽丝​要求​的​酬金​，​而​我们​*​急需​*​她​的​情报​。​去一趟​兔子​洞​吧​，​快去快回​……​我们​必须​在​火翼​找到​我们​之前​先​找到​沃​克莱尔​！\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 zhe4li3 mei2you3 shen2me5 xin1 fa1xian4，er2qie3 wo3men5 ye3 mei2you3 shi2jian1 ke3yi3 lang4fei4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 chou2ji2 dao4 le5 ai4li4si1 yao1qiu2 de5 chou2jin1，er2 wo3men5*ji2xu1*ta1 de5 qing2bao4。qu4 yi1 tang1 tu4zi5 dong4 ba1，kuai4 qu4 kuai4 hui2……wo3men5 bi4xu1 zai4 Huo3yi4 zhao3dao4 wo3men5 zhi1qian2 xian1 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3！"

msgid ""
"I have seen the ebb and flow of magic from the Fourth World, to the Fifth, to the Sixth. I have watched in awe as the tides carried wonder and miracle into the World of Men, and I have mourned as they were swept back out again.\n"
"\n"
"I have borne witness as the cycle began, and ended, and began itself anew."
msgstr ""
"我​目睹​了​魔法​从​第四纪​、​第五​纪到​第六​纪​的​起起落落​。​我​曾​惊艳​于​潮汐​将​伟业​与​奇迹​带入​人类​世界​，​也​曾​哀叹​它们​又​被​卷​回​深渊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​见证​了​这个​循环​的​开始​、​终结​，​以及​再度​的​轮回​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mu4du3 le5 mo2fa3 cong2 di4si4ji4、di4wu3 ji4 dao4 di4 liu4 ji4 de5 qi3 qi3 la4 la4。wo3 ceng2 jing1yan4 yu2 chao2xi1 jiang1 wei3ye4 yu4 qi2ji4 dai4 ru4 ren2lei4 shi4jie4，ye3 ceng2 ai1tan4 ta1men5 you4 bei4 juan3 hui2 shen1yuan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian4zheng4 le5 zhe4ge5 xun2huan2 de5 kai1shi3、zhong1jie2，yi3ji2 zai4du4 de5 lun2hui2。"

msgid ""
"I have seen what came at the end of the Fourth World, thousands of years ago, when ancient Thera crumbled into the sea. I saw the things that crawled in the carcass of that once-great nation... vile, terrible things.\n"
"\n"
"Even now, I can feel them. They drift on tides of mana, hungrily awaiting the end of the Sixth World, and the death of all that you know."
msgstr ""
"我​曾​亲眼目睹​第四纪​的​终结​。​数千年​前​，​古老​的​泰拉​崩塌​沉入​大海​。​我​看见​那些​在​曾经​伟大​的​国度​残骸​中​爬行​的​生物​……​污秽​可怖​的​生物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​即便​此刻​，​我​仍​能​感知​它们​的​存在​。​它们​随​魔力​潮汐​漂浮​，​饥渴​地​等待​着​第六​纪​的​终结​，​以及​你们​所知​万物​的​消亡​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ceng2 qin1yan3mu4du3 di4si4ji4 de5 zhong1jie2。shu3 qian1 nian2 qian2，gu3lao3 de5 tai4 la1 beng1ta1 chen2 ru4 da4hai3。wo3 kan4jian4 na4xie1 zai4 ceng2jing1 wei3da4 de5 guo2du4 can2hai2 zhong4 pa2xing2 de5 sheng1wu4……wu1hui4 ke3 bu4 de5 sheng1wu4。\n"
"\n"
"ji2bian4 ci3ke4，wo3 reng2 neng2 gan3zhi1 ta1men5 de5 cun2zai4。ta1men5 sui2 mo2li4 chao2xi1 piao1fu2，ji1ke3 de5 deng3dai4 zhao2 di4 liu4 ji4 de5 zhong1jie2，yi3ji2 ni3men5 suo3zhi1 wan4wu4 de5 xiao1wang2。"

msgid ""
"I have seen what they will do when this world has run its course, $(l.race).\n"
"\n"
"They will rip the guts from your dying civilization, and they will feast upon your screams."
msgstr ""
"$(l.race)​啊​，​我​已​目睹​当​这​世界​走​完其​历程​时​，​他们​将​如何​行事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​将​从​垂死​的​文明​中​撕扯​出​内脏​，​并​以​你们​的​惨叫​为食​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.race) a1，wo3 yi3 mu4du3 dang1 zhe4 shi4jie4 zou3 wan2 qi2 li4cheng2 shi2，ta1men5 jiang1 ru2he2 xing2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jiang1 cong2 chui2si3 de5 wen2ming2 zhong4 si1che3 chu1 nei4zang4，bing4 yi3 ni3men5 de5 can3jiao4 wei2 shi2。"

msgid ""
"I have some business to take care of. The personal, violent kind.\n"
"\n"
"Don’t know when I’ll be back."
msgstr ""
"我​有些​事情​要​了结​。​要​用​暴力​解决​的​那种​私仇​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​知道​什么​时候​能​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3xie1 shi4qing5 yao4 liao3jie2。yao4 yong4 bao4li4 jie3jue2 de5 na4zhong3 si1chou2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 shen2me5 shi2hou5 neng2 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"I have some personal business to attend to. There's a man that I need to find... a vicious, repulsive monster who needs to be brought to justice.\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) knows what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""
"我​有​一些​私人​事务​要​处理​。​我​需要​找​个人​……​那​是​个​恶毒​可憎​的​畜生​，​我​必须​将​他​绳之以法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​知道​我​在​说​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 yi1xie1 si1ren2 shi4wu4 yao4 chu3li3。wo3 xu1yao4 zhao3 ge4ren2……na4 shi4 ge4 e4du2 ke3zeng1 de5 chu4sheng5，wo3 bi4xu1 jiang1 ta1 sheng2zhi1yi3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) zhi1dao4 wo3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。"

msgid "I have some questions for you about the local gang activity."
msgstr ""
"我​有​几个​关于​本地​帮派​活动​的​问题​想​问​你​。\n"
"wo3 you3 ji3ge5 guan1yu2 ben3di4 bang1pai4 huo2dong4 de5 wen4ti2 xiang3 wen4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I have the stomach for all sorts of things. Things that you can't even "
"imagine, Yuli."
msgstr ""
"我​什么​胆子​都​有​。​包括​那些​你​想​都​不敢​想​的​事情​，​尤里​。\n"
"wo3 shen2me5 dan3zi5 dou1 you3。bao1kuo4 na4xie1 ni3 xiang3 dou1 bu4 gan3 xiang3 de5 shi4qing5，You2li3。"

msgid "I have to be going anyway."
msgstr ""
"反正​我​也​要​走​了​。\n"
"fan3zheng4 wo3 ye3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I have to keep the Kreuzbasar safe."
msgstr ""
"我​必须​保证​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​安全​。\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 bao3zheng4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 an1quan2。"

msgid ""
"I have to say that the odds of you surviving this job are looking worse and "
"worse. Now mask the damned camera."
msgstr ""
"我​只能​说​你​活着​完成​这个​任务​的​几率​越来越低​了​。​现在​赶紧​把​那个​破​摄像头​弄​隐形​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3neng2 shuo1 ni3 huo2zhe5 wan2cheng2 zhe4ge5 ren4wu5 de5 ji1lu:4 yue4 lai2 yue4 di1 le5。xian4zai4 gan3jin3 ba3 na4ge5 po4 she4xiang4tou2 long4 yin3xing2。"

msgid ""
"I have to say, $(l.name)... this lifts an enormous weight off of my shoulders.\n"
"\n"
"When Monika brought you on board, I was initially unsure about you. I would never have said that to anyone else, of course... but I kept you under a watchful eye.\n"
"\n"
"I can see now that I needn't have doubted her judgment. She chose her successor well.\n"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​不得不​说​……​这​让​我​如释重负​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当初​莫妮卡​让​你​加入​时​，​我​承认​自己​对​你​有所​保留​。​我​从没​向​别人​透露​过​这​一点​……​但​我​一直​暗中​留意​着​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我​才​肯定​，​我​不​应该​怀疑​她​的​眼光​。​她​选​了​一位​优秀​的​继任者​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，bu4de2bu4 shuo1……zhe4 rang4 wo3 ru2shi4zhong4fu4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1chu1 Mo4ni1ka3 rang4 ni3 jia1ru4 shi2，wo3 cheng2ren4 zi4ji3 dui4 ni3 you3suo3 bao3liu2。wo3 cong2mei2 xiang4 bie2ren5 tou4lu4 guo4 zhe4 yi1dian3……dan4 wo3 yi1zhi2 an4zhong1 liu2yi4 zhao2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3 cai2 ken3ding4，wo3 bu4 ying1gai1 huai2yi2 ta1 de5 yan3guang1。ta1 xuan3 le5 yi1 wei4 you1xiu4 de5 ji4ren4zhe3。"

msgid ""
"I have transferred the information that we received from Altuğ to the computer terminal in the next room.\n"
"\n"
"It used to be Monika's personal workstation, $(l.name). Now it is yours. Monika kept a variety of notes and dossiers on that machine. I would suggest reviewing her notes when you have the time."
msgstr ""
"我​已​将​奥图​伊​提供​的​情报​传输​到​了​隔壁​房间​的​电脑​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​莫妮卡​的​专用​工作站​，​$(l.name)​。​现在​它​是​你​的​了​。​莫妮卡​在​那台​机器​上​保存​了​各种​笔记​和​档案​，​我​建议​你​有空时​可以​查阅​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3 jiang1 ao4 tu2 yi1 ti2gong1 de5 qing2bao4 chuan2shu1 dao4 le5 ge2bi4 fang2jian1 de5 dian4nao3 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 zhuan1yong4 gong1zuo4zhan4，$(l.name)。xian4zai4 ta1 shi4 ni3 de5 le5。Mo4ni1ka3 zai4 na4 tai2 ji1qi4 shang4 bao3cun2 le5 ge4zhong3 bi3ji4 he4 dang4an4，wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 you3 kong1 shi2 ke3yi3 cha2yue4 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"I have uncovered some terrible information. The team is assembled in the "
"safe house. Please meet with us there when you are able."
msgstr ""
"我​发现​了​一些​可怕​的​情报​。​队伍​已​在​安全​屋​集结​完毕​，​请​你​尽快​前往​与​我们​会合​。\n"
"wo3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1xie1 ke3pa4 de5 qing2bao4。dui4wu3 yi3 zai4 an1quan2 wu1 ji2jie2 wan2bi4，qing3 ni3 jin3kuai4 qian2wang3 yu4 wo3men5 hui4he2。"

msgid ""
"I haven't always agreed with your decisions, $(l.name). But you've proven your competence.\n"
"\n"
"It's only fair for me to acknowledge it."
msgstr ""
"我​并非​总是​赞同​你​的​决定​，​$(l.name)​。​但​你​已经​证明​了​你​的​能力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​应当​承认​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bing4fei1 zong3shi4 zan4tong2 ni3 de5 jue2ding4，$(l.name)。dan4 ni3 yi3jing1 zheng4ming2 le5 ni3 de5 neng2li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ying1dang1 cheng2ren4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"I haven't even been in Feuerstelle for an hour, Marta. In that time, I've "
"found evidence of horrifying levels of abuse."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​我​进入​“​火坑​”​还​不到​一​小时​。​但​就​在​这​短短​时间​内​，​我​已经​发现​了​令人发指​的​虐待​证据​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，wo3 jin4ru4“huo3keng1” hai2 bu4dao4 yi1 xiao3shi2。dan4 jiu4 zai4 zhe4 duan3 duan3 shi2jian1 nei4，wo3 yi3jing1 fa1xian4 le5 ling4ren2fa4zhi3 de5 nu:e4dai4 zheng4ju4。"

msgid ""
"I haven't heard a response from you, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Shall I make the preparations for your post-run interview? Are you ready to continue your test?"
msgstr ""
"我​还​没有​听到​你​的​回答​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是否​需要​为​你​的​差事​后​面试​做​准备​？​你​准备​好​继续​测试​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 mei2you3 ting1dao4 ni3 de5 hui2da2，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4fou3 xu1yao4 wei2 ni3 de5 cha4shi4 hou4 mian4shi4 zuo4 zhun3bei4？ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 ji4xu4 ce4shi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I haven't seen you here before. Welcome to Aljernon's.\n"
"\n"
"If you're looking for magic, you can find the proprietor of this shop in the back."
msgstr ""
"是​生面孔​啊​。​欢迎​来到​阿尔杰​农​的​店​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​买​魔法​的话​，​可以​去​后面​和​店主​说​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 sheng1 mian4 kong3 a1。huan1ying2 lai2dao4 E1er3jie2nong2 de5 dian4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 mai3 mo2fa3 de5hua4，ke3yi3 qu4 hou4mian5 he4 dian4zhu3 shuo1。"

msgid "I hear that a feathered serpent rules it."
msgstr ""
"我​听说​一条​羽蛇​统治​着​那里​。\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 yi1 tiao2 yu3 she2 tong3zhi4 zhao2 na4li5。"

msgid ""
"I heard $(l.him) loud and clear, mop-jockey. Now *you* listen to *me.* Nobody without Delta clearance gets through this door, period.\n"
"\n"
"I'd suggest that you talk to management. If you really do need to be in here, they'll upgrade your clearance. Otherwise, piss off."
msgstr ""
"我​听​得​很​清楚​，​拖把​工​。​现在​*​你​*​听​*​我​*​说​。​没有​德尔塔​级​权限​的​人​不得​通过​此门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​建议​你​去​和​管理处​谈谈​。​如果​你​真的​需要​进去​，​就让​他们​给​你​升级​权限​。​否则​就​赶紧​走开​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1 de2 hen3 qing1chu5，tuo1ba3 gong1。xian4zai4*ni3*ting1*wo3*shuo1。mei2you3 de2er3ta3 ji2 quan2xian4 de5 ren2 bu4de2 tong1guo4 ci3 men2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 qu4 he4 guan3 li3 chu3 tan2tan2。ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 xu1yao4 jin4qu4，jiu4 rang4 ta1men5 gei3 ni3 sheng1ji2 quan2xian4。fou3ze2 jiu4 gan3jin3 zou3kai1。"

msgid "I heard that he might be staying upstairs."
msgstr ""
"我​听说​他​可能​在​楼上​待​着​呢​。\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 ta1 ke3neng2 zai4 lou2shang4 dai1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "I heard that you wanted to talk about a job."
msgstr ""
"我​听说​你​想​聊聊​差事​。\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 ni3 xiang3 liao2 liao2 cha4shi4。"

msgid "I heard yelling, things breaking. And gunshots, I think."
msgstr ""
"我​听见​叫喊声​，​还有​砸​东西​的​声音​。​好像​还有​枪声​吧​。\n"
"wo3 ting1jian4 jiao4 han3 sheng1，hai2you3 za2 dong1xi1 de5 sheng1yin1。hao3xiang4 hai2you3 qiang1sheng1 ba1。"

msgid "I hesitate to ask."
msgstr ""
"我​有点​不想​问​了​。\n"
"wo3 you3dian3 bu4xiang3 wen4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I hire only Goblinoids because mainstream human society has created a need for me to hire only Goblinoids. The orks and trolls of the Kreuzbasar deserve a workplace where they will be treated with dignity and respect.\n"
"\n"
"All that being said, our services are available to all; we wouldn't turn a desperate person away, regardless of that person's metatype. Even humans, the most privileged of all races, are welcome at our door. Isn't that what's most important?"
msgstr ""
"我​只​雇用​地​精​种族​，​因为​主流​人类​社会​让​我​只能​这么​做​。​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​兽​人​和​巨魔​应该​得到​一个​有​尊严​、​受​尊重​的​工作​场所​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管如此​，​我们​的​服务​面向​所有人​；​我们​不会​将​绝望​的​人​拒之门外​，​无论​他​是​什么​种族​。​甚至​连​人类​这个​最有​特权​的​种族​，​我们​也​欢迎​他们​到来​。​这​难道​不是​最​重要​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 gu4yong4 de5 jing1 zhong3zu2，yin1wei4 zhu3liu2 ren2lei4 she4hui4 rang4 wo3 zhi3neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4。Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 shou4 ren2 he4 ju4mo2 ying1gai1 de2dao4 yi1ge5 you3 zun1yan2、shou4 zun1zhong4 de5 gong1zuo4 chang3suo3。\n"
"\n"
"jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，wo3men5 de5 fu2wu4 mian4xiang4 suo3you3ren2 ； wo3men5 bu4hui4 jiang1 jue2wang4 de5 ren2 ju4zhi1men2wai4，wu2lun4 ta1 shi4 shen2me5 zhong3zu2。shen4zhi4 lian2 ren2lei4 zhe4ge5 zui4 you3 te4quan2 de5 zhong3zu2，wo3men5 ye3 huan1ying2 ta1men5 dao4lai2。zhe4 nan2dao4 bu4shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I hit a big payday a while back. Put the extra cash in my rainy-day fund.\n"
"\n"
"Trust me, pal. I can pay you the money. You help me out, and I'll transfer it to you myself... we just need to get back to the room where I stashed my PDA."
msgstr ""
"我前​阵子​大​赚​了​一笔​。​把​多余​的​钱​存进​了​我​的​应急​基金​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​相信​我​，​朋友​。​我付​得​起​这笔​钱​。​你​帮​我​从​这里​出去​，​我​就​亲自​把​钱​转给​你​……​但​我​得​先回去​拿到​藏​起来​的​PDA​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qian2 zhen4zi5 dai4 zhuan4 le5 yi1 bi3。ba3 duo1yu2 de5 qian2 cun2 jin4 le5 wo3 de5 ying4ji2 ji1jin1。\n"
"\n"
"xiang1xin4 wo3，peng2you5。wo3 fu4 de2 qi3 zhe4 bi3 qian2。ni3 bang1 wo3 cong2 zhe4li3 chu1qu4，wo3 jiu4 qin1zi4 ba3 qian2 zhuan3gei3 ni3……dan4 wo3 de2 xian1 hui2 qu4 na2dao4 zang4 qi3lai5 de5 PDA。"

msgid "I hope it hurts, APEX. I really do."
msgstr ""
"我​希望​你会痛​，​APEX​。​我​真心​希望​如此​。\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 hui4 tong4，APEX。wo3 zhen1xin1 xi1wang4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "I hope so, guardsman. For your sake."
msgstr ""
"希望​如此​，​警卫​。​这是​为了​你​自己​好​。\n"
"xi1wang4 ru2ci3，jing3wei4。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 ni3 zi4ji3 hao3。"

msgid "I hope so, too. For all our sakes. But I do worry."
msgstr ""
"我​也​希望​如此​。​这样​对​大家​都​好​。​但​我​还是​很​担心​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 ru2ci3。zhe4yang4 dui4 da4jia1 dou1 hao3。dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 hen3 dan1xin1。"

msgid "I hope so."
msgstr ""
"希望​如此​。\n"
"xi1wang4 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"I hope that our recent misunderstanding won't have an impact on our ongoing "
"business relationship."
msgstr ""
"希望​我们​最近​的​误解​不会​影响​我们​之间​的​业务​关系​。\n"
"xi1wang4 wo3men5 zui4jin4 de5 wu4jie3 bu4hui4 ying3xiang3 wo3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 ye4wu4 guan1xi5。"

msgid ""
"I hope that... thing... is worth it, boss.\n"
"\n"
"I've never even *heard* of a run getting fucked up this badly. Herr Fuchs is gonna pitch a fit."
msgstr ""
"我​希望​那个​……​东西​……​值得​这​一切​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​都​没​*​听说​过​*​有​哪个​任务​会​如此​乱套​。​富克斯​先生​肯定​要​发飙​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 na4ge5……dong1xi1……zhi2de5 zhe4 yi1qie4，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 mei2*ting1shuo1 guo4*you3 na3ge5 ren4wu5 hui4 ru2ci3 luan4tao4。Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 yao4 fa1biao1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I hope that... thing... is worth it, chief.\n"
"\n"
"I've never even *heard* of a run getting fucked up this badly. Herr Fuchs is gonna pitch a fit."
msgstr ""
"我​希望​那个​……​东西​……​值得​这​一切​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​都​没​*​听说​过​*​有​哪个​任务​会​如此​乱套​。​富克斯​先生​肯定​要​发飙​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 na4ge5……dong1xi1……zhi2de5 zhe4 yi1qie4，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 mei2*ting1shuo1 guo4*you3 na3ge5 ren4wu5 hui4 ru2ci3 luan4tao4。Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 yao4 fa1biao1 le5。"

msgid "I hope the bastard burns."
msgstr ""
"我​希望​这个​混蛋​被​烧死​了​。\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 zhe4ge5 hun2dan4 bei4 shao1si3 le5。"

msgid "I hope they got what they deserved for taking her from us."
msgstr ""
"希望​那些​人为​从​我们​身边​夺走​她​而​付出​了​应有​的​代价​。\n"
"xi1wang4 na4xie1 ren2wei2 cong2 wo3men5 shen1bian1 duo2zou3 ta1 er2 fu4chu1 le5 ying1you3 de5 dai4jia4。"

msgid ""
"I hope we are finished with this foolishness. I assume you had no "
"difficulties?"
msgstr ""
"希望​这件​蠢事​到此为止​。​看来​你​没有​遇到困难​吧​？\n"
"xi1wang4 zhe4 jian4 chun3shi4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3。kan4lai5 ni3 mei2you3 yu4 dao4 kun4 nan2 ba1？"

msgid "I hope we can continue keeping it that way."
msgstr ""
"希望​我们​能​继续​保持​这样​。\n"
"xi1wang4 wo3men5 neng2 ji4xu4 bao3chi2 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"I hope you are right, my dear. But once a soldier, always a soldier. (h)"
msgstr ""
"亲爱​的​，​但愿​你​说​的​对​。​不过​，​军人​恐怕​一辈子​都​会​是​军人​。\n"
"qin1ai4 de5，dan4yuan4 ni3 shuo1 de5 dui4。bu4guo4，jun1ren2 kong3pa4 yi1bei4zi5 dou1 hui4 shi4 jun1ren2。"

msgid "I hope you're right, because we don't always feel so strong."
msgstr ""
"希望​你​说得对​，​因为​我们​并​不​总有​这种​感觉​。\n"
"xi1wang4 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，yin1wei4 wo3men5 bing4 bu4 zong3you3 zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2。"

msgid "I hope you're right."
msgstr ""
"希望​你​是​对​的​。\n"
"xi1wang4 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I imagine that we all do, yourself included. And yet you don't find me "
"gawking at you."
msgstr ""
"我​想​每个​人​都​是​这样​，​你​也​不​例外​。​但​我​也​没​盯​着​你​看​啊​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 shi4 zhe4yang4，ni3 ye3 bu4 li4wai4。dan4 wo3 ye3 mei2 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 a1。"

msgid ""
"I imagine that we all do, yourself included. And yet, you don't find me "
"gawking at you."
msgstr ""
"我​想​每个​人​都​是​这样​，​你​也​不​例外​。​但​我​也​没​盯​着​你​看​啊​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 shi4 zhe4yang4，ni3 ye3 bu4 li4wai4。dan4 wo3 ye3 mei2 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 a1。"

msgid ""
"I insisted that if a meeting were to take place, it would have to be at a location of your choosing. Frau Müller has agreed to this.\n"
"\n"
"Where should I tell her to meet you?"
msgstr ""
"我​要求​说​如果​见面​的话​，​地点​应该​让​你​来​选​。​穆勒​女士​表示同意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​让​她​去​哪里​见​你​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao1qiu2 shuo1 ru2guo3 jian4mian4 de5hua4，di4dian3 ying1gai1 rang4 ni3 lai2 xuan3。mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 rang4 ta1 qu4 na3li3 jian4 ni3？"

msgid "I just came here for the market, like you. "
msgstr ""
"和​你​一样​，​我​也​是​来​找​市场​的​。\n"
"he4 ni3 yi1yang4，wo3 ye3 shi4 lai2 zhao3 shi4chang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"I just couldn't bring myself to open that door. I couldn't risk my family like that. \n"
"\n"
"Not for her. Not for anyone."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​没​办法​让​自己​去​开门​。​我​不能​拿​我​的​家人​冒险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​是因为​她​，​还是​其他​任何人​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 mei2 ban4fa3 rang4 zi4ji3 qu4 kai1men2。wo3 bu4neng2 na2 wo3 de5 jia1ren2 mao4xian3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1，hai2shi5 qi2ta1 ren4 he2 ren2。"

msgid "I just did what any decent person would do."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​做​了​任何​一个​体面​人​都​会​做​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 zuo4 le5 ren4he2 yi1ge5 ti3mian4 ren2 dou1 hui4 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "I just do what the job requires."
msgstr ""
"我​只会​做​差事​需要​我​做​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3 hui4 zuo4 cha4shi4 xu1yao4 wo3 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I just don't see what panicking about it is supposed to accomplish. What happened, happened, and I've managed to take away some residual - if inexplicable - gain from it.\n"
"\n"
"How can that be bad?"
msgstr ""
"我​只是​不​明白​对此​惊慌失措​能​有​什么​用​。​发生​的​事情​无法​再​改变​，​而​我​也​从中​获得​了​些许​残余​的​、​尽管​也​难以​解释​的​收获​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这有​什么​不好​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 bu4 ming2bai5 dui4 ci3 jing1huang1shi1cuo4 neng2 you3 shen2me5 yong4。fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 wu2fa3 zai4 gai3bian4，er2 wo3 ye3 cong2zhong1 huo4de2 le5 xie1xu3 can2yu2 de5、jin3guan3 ye3 nan2yi3 jie3shi4 de5 shou1huo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 you3 shen2me5 bu4hao3？"

msgid ""
"I just got a comm from a contact of mine. His organization wants the MKVI "
"for themselves, and they're offering us a lot of money to make that happen."
msgstr ""
"一位​联络人​刚才​和​我​通话​了​。​他​的​组织​想​独占​MKVI​原型机​，​而且​愿意​付​我们​一大笔钱​。\n"
"yi1 wei4 lian2luo4ren2 gang1cai2 he4 wo3 tong1hua4 le5。ta1 de5 zu3zhi1 xiang3 du2zhan4 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1，er2qie3 yuan4yi4 fu4 wo3men5 yi1 dai4 bi3 qian2。"

msgid "I just got back from Gesundbrunnen, real nice place."
msgstr ""
"我刚​从​健康​泉​回来​，​真是​个​好​地方​。\n"
"wo3 gang1 cong2 jian4kang1 quan2 hui2lai5，zhen1shi5 ge4 hao3 di4fang1。"

msgid "I just guessed. \"Shark Tank\" was my mother's maiden name."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​的​。​“​鲨鱼​缸​”​是​我​母亲​的​娘家​姓​。\n"
"wo3 cai1 de5。“sha1yu2 gang1” shi4 wo3 mu3qin1 de5 niang2jia1 xing4。"

msgid "I just had to drop out of sight for a while."
msgstr ""
"我得​找个​地方​躲起来​避风头​而已​。\n"
"wo3 de2 zhao3 ge4 di4fang1 duo3 qi3 lai2 bi4feng1tou5 er2yi3。"

msgid "I just killed a friend for this plan of yours, Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"我​为了​你​的​计划​而​杀死​了​我​的​朋友​，​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"wo3 wei4le5 ni3 de5 ji4hua4 er2 sha1si3 le5 wo3 de5 peng2you5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid "I just killed my friends for this plan of yours, Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"我​为了​你​的​计划​而​杀死​了​我​的​朋友​们​，​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"wo3 wei4le5 ni3 de5 ji4hua4 er2 sha1si3 le5 wo3 de5 peng2you5 men5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid "I just know she's been watching over us. And you."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​她​一直​在​守护​着​我们​。​还有​你​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 yi1zhi2 zai4 shou3hu4 zhao2 wo3men5。hai2you3 ni3。"

msgid "I just need to get in. Can you get me in or not?"
msgstr ""
"我​就是​需要​进去​。​你​到底​能​不能​帮​我​？\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 xu1yao4 jin4qu4。ni3 dao4di3 neng2 bu4neng2 bang1 wo3？"

msgid "I just saved your life. You *owe* me."
msgstr ""
"我​刚刚​救​了​你​的​命​。​你​*​欠​*​我​的​。\n"
"wo3 gang1gang5 jiu4 le5 ni3 de5 ming4。ni3*qian4*wo3 de5。"

msgid "I just thought you should know about Monika."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​觉得​应该​把​莫妮卡​的​事​告诉​你们​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 jue2de5 ying1gai1 ba3 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4 gao4su4 ni3men5。"

msgid ""
"I just want to get us paid, Maxim. Let me by, and I'll make that happen."
msgstr ""
"我​只​想​拿到​咱​的​报酬​，​马克西姆​。​让​我​来​吧​，​我能​处理​好​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3 xiang3 na2dao4 za2 de5 bao4chou5，ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3。rang4 wo3 lai2 ba1，wo3 neng2 chu3li3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"I just wanted to get to know you. Why are you making this so difficult?"
msgstr ""
"我​只是​想​了解​你​。​你​为什么​要​说话​这么​冲​呢​？\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 liao3jie3 ni3。ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 shuo1hua4 zhe4me5 chong1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"I just wanted to say how proud I am of this team. Let's get this job done."
msgstr ""
"我​想​说​，​你们​都​是​好样​的​。​我们​赶紧​去​交差​吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shuo1，ni3men5 dou1 shi4 hao3 yang4 de5。wo3men5 gan3jin3 qu4 jiao1chai1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I killed the first person I'd ever loved. Whatever else Marta might have been, she'll always be that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Am I ultimately sorry that she's dead...? Yes. But I'm not sure what the alternative would be."
msgstr ""
"我​杀死​了​我​爱过​的​第一个​人​。​不管​玛​尔塔​还有​其他​什么样​的​身份​，​这​一点​是​永远​不会​变​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​最终​是否​为​她​的​死​感到遗憾​……​？​是​的​。​但​我​并​不​确定​，​如果​事情​朝​相反​的​方向​发展​，​会​是​怎样​的​结局​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 sha1si3 le5 wo3 ai4 guo4 de5 di4 yi1 ge4 ren2。bu4guan3 Ma3er3ta3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 shen2me5yang4 de5 shen1fen4，zhe4 yi1dian3 shi4 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 bian4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4zhong1 shi4fou3 wei2 ta1 de5 si3 gan3 dao4 yi2 han4……？shi4 de5。dan4 wo3 bing4 bu4 que4ding4，ru2guo3 shi4qing5 chao2 xiang1fan3 de5 fang1xiang4 fa1zhan3，hui4 shi4 zen3yang4 de5 jie2ju2。"

msgid ""
"I knew Monika well enough to know what you mean. She did have a mysterious "
"way about her."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​你​的​意思​。​跟​莫妮卡​熟​了​就​会​知道​，​她​身上​确实​有种​神秘莫测​的​气质​。\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 de5 yi4si5。gen1 Mo4ni1ka3 shu2 le5 jiu4 hui4 zhi1dao4，ta1 shen1shang5 que4shi2 you3zhong3 shen2mi4mo4ce4 de5 qi4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"I knew it. FRAGGIN' EDDIE, i saw him, yesterday i was up on the 3RD floor cause the vendin' machine down here was out of soykaf. \n"
"\n"
"SO he came up and went over to the out-of-order latrine. he punched in the code. DIDNT KNOW I WAS WATCHING DIDJA EDDIE? \n"
"\n"
"well i AINT SO STUPID. he put in 2 4 7 8 and i'm gonna STAY UP and FIND OUT WHAT HES DOING IN THERE."
msgstr ""
"我​就​知道​。​天杀​的​埃迪​，​我​可​瞧见​他​了​。​就​昨天​我​上​三层​去​了​一趟​，​因为​这边​的​售后​机没豆​咖了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​他​就​冒出来​了​，​直奔​那​报废​了​的​茅坑​。​他​咣​咣​一顿​按​密码​。​埃迪​啊​，​你​可​真是​不​知道​我​在​，​是不是​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​我​没​那么​蠢​。​他输​的​是​2478​，​今儿​晚上​我​不​睡​了​，​我​倒​要​看看​他​到底​在​那里​头​干什么​呢​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4。tian1 sha1 de5 ai1 di2，wo3 ke3 qiao2jian4 ta1 le5。jiu4 zuo2tian1 wo3 shang4 san1 ceng2 qu4 le5 yi1 tang1，yin1wei4 zhe4bian1 de5 shou4 hou4 ji1 mei2 dou4 ka1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1 jiu4 mao4chu1lai2 le5，zhi2ben4 na4 bao4fei4 le5 de5 mao2keng1。ta1 guang1 guang1 yi1 dun4 an4 mi4ma3。ai1 di2 a1，ni3 ke3 zhen1shi5 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 zai4，shi4bu5shi4？\n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 wo3 mei2 na4me5 chun3。ta1 shu1 de5 shi4 2478，jin1r5 wan3shang5 wo3 bu4 shui4 le5，wo3 dao3 yao4 kan4kan5 ta1 dao4di3 zai4 na4li5 tou2 gan4shen2me5 ni2！"

msgid "I knew it. With Maxim dead, they won't even *talk* to us."
msgstr ""
"我​就​知道​。​马克西姆​死​了​，​他们​根本​不会​*​搭理​*​咱们​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4。ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 si3 le5，ta1men5 gen1ben3 bu4hui4*da1li5*zan2men5。"

msgid "I knew that already."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​知道​这个​了​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 zhe4ge5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I knew that this was going to happen. I *knew* it.\n"
"\n"
"I *told* you that she had no business going down there."
msgstr ""
"我​就​知道​会​发生​这种​事​。​我​就​*​知道​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​告诉​*​过​你​她​不该​下​到​那里​去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 hui4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4。wo3 jiu4*zhi1dao4*。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*gao4su4*guo4 ni3 ta1 bu4gai1 xia4 dao4 na4li5 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I knew that this would happen.\n"
"\n"
"Look. My aura is my own business, and none of yours. Understand?"
msgstr ""
"我​就​知道​会​有​这种​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​我​的​灵光​是​我​自己​的​事​，​跟​你​没有​关系​。​听懂​了​没​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 hui4 you3 zhe4zhong3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3 de5 ling2guang1 shi4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 shi4，gen1 ni3 mei2you3 guan1xi5。ting1dong3 le5 mei2？"

msgid ""
"I knew that we'd be screwed if he reported us. But I'm pretty good at sizing people up, and I could tell that he wasn't a threat.\n"
"\n"
"He reminded me a bit of my dad, actually. A kind old troll with leathery skin and a long, white beard. There wasn't a mean bone in his body... I was sure of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​要是​他​举报​我们​的话​，​我们​就​完蛋​了​。​但​我​挺​擅长​看人​，​看得出​他​没什么​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​起来​，​他​倒​让​我​有点​想起​我爸​—​—​是​个​和蔼​的​老​巨魔​，​皮肤​像​皮革​般​粗糙​，​留着​长长的​白胡子​。​他​骨子里​根本​没有​半点​恶意​……​我​敢肯定​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 yao4shi5 ta1 ju3bao4 wo3men5 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 wan2dan4 le5。dan4 wo3 ting3 shan4chang2 kan4 ren2，kan4de5chu1 ta1 mei2shen2me5 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 qi3lai5，ta1 dao3 rang4 wo3 you3dian3 xiang3qi3 wo3 ba4——shi4 ge4 he2ai3 de5 lao3 ju4mo2，pi2fu1 xiang4 pi2ge2 ban1 cu1cao1，liu2 zhao2 zhang3 zhang3 de5 bai2 hu2 zi3。ta1 gu3zi5li3 gen1ben3 mei2you3 ban4dian3 e4yi4……wo3 gan3 ken3 ding4。"

msgid "I knocked nice. You just gotta know how."
msgstr ""
"我​好好​敲门​了​。​只要​学会​窍门​就​不难​。\n"
"wo3 hao3hao3 qiao1men2 le5。zhi3yao4 xue2hui4 qiao4men2 jiu4 bu4 nan2。"

msgid ""
"I know Harrow. When I ran, I bruised his ego. His charisma and charm had failed him, and my disappearance rubbed his nose in that failure.\n"
"\n"
"He wouldn't be willing to chance something like that happening again. Not when he had the means to prevent it."
msgstr ""
"我​了解​哈罗​。​当年​我​的​逃离​让​他​的​自尊​大受打击​。​他​的​魅力​与​风采​没​能​满足​他​的​期待​，​而​我​的​消失​更​让​他​尝到了​失败​的​滋味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​绝不会​冒险​让​类似​的​事情​再次发生​，​尤其​当​他​完全​有​能力​阻止​时​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 liao3jie3 ha1luo2。dang1nian2 wo3 de5 tao2li2 rang4 ta1 de5 zi4zun1 dai4 shou4 da3 ji1。ta1 de5 mei4li4 yu4 feng1cai3 mei2 neng2 man3zu2 ta1 de5 qi1dai4，er2 wo3 de5 xiao1shi1 geng1 rang4 ta1 chang2 dao4 le5 shi1bai4 de5 zi1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jue2 bu4 hui4 mao4xian3 rang4 lei4si4 de5 shi4qing5 zai4 ci4 fa1 sheng1，you2qi2 dang1 ta1 wan2quan2 you3 neng2li4 zu3zhi3 shi2。"

msgid "I know Monika's gone now, but I can still stay, right?"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​莫妮卡​现在​不​在​了​，​但​我​应该​还​可以​留在​这里​吧​？\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 Mo4ni1ka3 xian4zai4 bu4 zai4 le5，dan4 wo3 ying1gai1 hai2 ke3yi3 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"I know a way...\n"
"\n"
"...to free yourself...\n"
" \n"
"...then you help me...\n"
"\n"
"A deal... a deal if you agree to free me."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​一条​路​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​能​解救​你​自己​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​然后​你​要​帮​我​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​答应​……​就​成交​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 yi1 tiao2 lu4……\n"
"\n"
"……neng2 jie3jiu4 ni3 zi4ji3……\n"
"\n"
"……ran2hou4 ni3 yao4 bang1 wo3……\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 da1ying5……jiu4 cheng2jiao1。"

msgid ""
"I know a way...\n"
"\n"
"...to free yourself...\n"
" \n"
"...then you help me...\n"
"\n"
"A deal... a deal if you agree to free me. "
msgstr ""
"我​知道​一条​路​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​能​解救​你​自己​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​然后​你​要​帮​我​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​答应​……​就​成交​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 yi1 tiao2 lu4……\n"
"\n"
"……neng2 jie3jiu4 ni3 zi4ji3……\n"
"\n"
"……ran2hou4 ni3 yao4 bang1 wo3……\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 da1ying5……jiu4 cheng2jiao1。"

msgid ""
"I know how important it is that we resolve the Feuerschwinge situation. I get it. But I can't just sit back and let this happen.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I won't."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​关于​火翼​的​任务​同样​事关重大​，​我​知道​。​但​在​这件​事上​，​我​不能​坐视不管​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​绝不​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 guan1yu2 Huo3yi4 de5 ren4wu5 tong2yang4 shi4guan1zhong4da4，wo3 zhi1dao4。dan4 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4，wo3 bu4neng2 zuo4 shi4 bu4 guan3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jue2bu4。"

msgid ""
"I know just the place to hit: that same Aztechnology data node that I stole the information from in the first place.\n"
"\n"
"I already know that I can get past the security, and my gut tells me that I'll find Emilie there."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​该​去​哪里​：​我​一​开始​偷​情报​的​那个​阿兹特​科技​数据​节点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​知道​该​怎么​绕过​安保​措施​了​，​而且​我​的​直觉​告诉​我​，​艾米莉​就​在​那里​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 gai1 qu4 na3li3：wo3 yi1 kai1shi3 tou1 qing2bao4 de5 na4ge5 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 shu4ju4 jie2dian3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 rao4guo4 an1bao3 cuo4shi1 le5，er2qie3 wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，ai4 mi3 li4 jiu4 zai4 na4li5。"

msgid ""
"I know my way around electrical systems. My father used to own rental properties all over Munich, and I helped him maintain them.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles shyly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've been rewiring buildings since I was a little girl."
msgstr ""
"我​对​电路系统​很​有​一套​的​。​我​父亲​曾​在​慕尼黑​各地​拥有​出租​房产​，​我​负责​帮​他​打理​这些​物业​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​羞涩​一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从小​就​一直​在​给​各种​大楼​重新​布线​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 dian4 lu4 xi4 tong3 hen3 you3 yi1tao4 de5。wo3 fu4qin1 ceng2 zai4 mu4ni2hei1 ge4di4 yong1you3 chu1zu1 fang2chan3，wo3 fu4ze2 bang1 ta1 da3li3 zhe4xie1 wu4ye4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiu1se4 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2xiao3 jiu4 yi1zhi2 zai4 gei3 ge4zhong3 da4lou2 chong2xin1 bu4xian4。"

msgid ""
"I know that I have wronged you, and for this I am sorry.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs a long, rattling sigh that quickly turns into a violent fit of coughing. The sound echoes over the loudspeaker.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​我​错怪​了​你​，​为此​我​感到​抱歉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​长长地​叹​了​口气​，​那​声音​沙哑​而​刺耳​，​很快​便​演变成​一阵​剧烈​的​咳嗽​。​咳嗽声​通过​扬声器​传出​，​回荡​在​空气​中​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3 cuo4guai4 le5 ni3，wei4ci3 wo3 gan3dao4 bao4qian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang3 zhang3 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，na4 sheng1yin1 sha1ya3 er2 ci4er3，hen3 kuai4 bian4 yan3 bian4 cheng2 yi1zhen4 ju4lie4 de5 ke2sou5。hai1 sou4 sheng1 tong1guo4 yang2sheng1qi4 chuan2chu1，hui2dang4 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I know that he wanted you to stop all of this years ago. He *begged* you to,"
" and you promised him that you'd try."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​他​在​多年​以前​就​希望​你​停止​这​一切​。​他​曾​*​乞求​*​你​停下​，​而​你​答应​他​说​你​会​尽力而为​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 zai4 duo1nian2 yi3qian2 jiu4 xi1wang4 ni3 ting2zhi3 zhe4 yi1qie4。ta1 ceng2*qi3qiu2*ni3 ting2xia4，er2 ni3 da1ying5 ta1 shuo1 ni3 hui4 jin4li4er2wei2。"

msgid "I know that look, Yuli. I'd start talking if I were--"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​这​副​表情​的​意思​，​尤里​。​换作​是​我​的话​就​会​赶紧​交待​—​—\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 fu4 biao3qing2 de5 yi4si5，You2li3。huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4 jiu4 hui4 gan3jin3 jiao1dai4 — —"

msgid ""
"I know that this all happened years ago, but I guess it's still pretty raw to me. So I'm gonna ask you to give me some space for a while.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away, and the frost begins to creep back into her voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We can pick it back up later."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​这​一切都是​很多年​前​发生​的​事​，​但​它​对​我​而言​仍然​意味着​许多​。​所以​我要​请​你​给​我​留出​一些​空间​缓缓​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过身​去​，​声音​中​又​重新​夹杂​了​冰霜​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​等​下次​再聊​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 hen3 duo1 nian2 qian2 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4，dan4 ta1 dui4 wo3 er2yan2 reng2ran2 yi4wei4zhe5 xu3duo1。suo3yi3 wo3 yao4 qing3 ni3 gei3 wo3 liu2 chu1 yi1xie1 kong1jian1 huan3huan3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4，sheng1yin1 zhong4 you4 chong2xin1 jia1za2 le5 bing1shuang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 deng3 xia4ci4 zai4 liao2 ba1。"

msgid "I know that this is a hard decision, Vauclair. But it's the right one."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​这​是​个​艰难​的​决定​，​沃​克莱尔​。​但​这样​做​是​正确​的​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 ge4 jian1nan2 de5 jue2ding4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。dan4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 zheng4que4 de5。"

msgid "I know that this is a joke to you, Monika. But I'm telling you..."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​你​不​把​这​当回事​，​莫妮卡​。​但​我​跟​你​说​……\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 bu4 ba3 zhe4 dang4hui2shi4，Mo4ni1ka3。dan4 wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1……"

msgid ""
"I know that we have something you want. Something you're willing to die for."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​我们​手里​有​你​想要​的​东西​。​你​为了​它​连​死​都​愿意​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 shou3li3 you3 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 dong1xi1。ni3 wei4le5 ta1 lian2 si3 dou1 yuan4yi4。"

msgid ""
"I know that what Feuerschwinge did will pale in comparison to what you're "
"about to do."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​的​是​，​火翼​曾经​的​所作所为​和​你​要​做​的​事情​比​起来​简直​不值一提​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 de5 shi4，Huo3yi4 ceng2jing1 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2 he4 ni3 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 bi3 qi3lai5 jian3zhi2 bu4 zhi2 yi1 ti2。"

msgid ""
"I know that you can't see it right now, but having Emilie out of your life "
"is a good thing, Blitz. From what you described, it sounds like your "
"relationship with her was a pretty toxic one."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​你​现在​不​明白​，​但​艾米莉​离开​你​的​生活​是​件​好事​，​布里​茨​。​从​你​的​描述​来看​，​你​和​她​之间​的​关系​太​不​健康​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 xian4zai4 bu4 ming2bai5，dan4 ai4 mi3 li4 li2kai1 ni3 de5 sheng1huo2 shi4 jian4 hao3shi4，Bu4li3ci2。cong2 ni3 de5 miao2shu4 lai2 kan4，ni3 he4 ta1 zhi1jian1 de5 guan1xi5 tai4 bu4 jian4kang1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I know that you'd love to get your hands on that chip Eiger's holding... if "
"you could move your hands, that is."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​你​想​拿到​艾格尔​手里​的​芯片​……​前提​是​你​的​手​如果​还​能动​的话​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 xiang3 na2dao4 Ai4ge2er3 shou3li3 de5 xin1pian4……qian2ti2 shi4 ni3 de5 shou3 ru2guo3 hai2 neng2 dong4 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"I know that you're here to kill me, ace. No sense in trying to deny it... it's the only logical reason why you'd come at all.\n"
"\n"
"But if we work together, we can both get what we want."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​你们​是​来​杀​我​的​，​王牌​。​不用​试图​否认​……​这​显然​是​你们​来​的​唯一​理由​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​我们​合作​，​我们​都​可以​得到​自己​想要​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 shi4 lai2 sha1 wo3 de5，wang2pai2。bu4yong4 shi4tu2 fou3ren4……zhe4 xian3ran2 shi4 ni3men5 lai2 de5 wei2yi1 li3you2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 he2zuo4，wo3men5 dou1 ke3yi3 de2dao4 zi4ji3 xiang3yao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I know that you're in a bad spot.\n"
"\n"
"And I know that you're gonna need all the help you can get if you want to claw your way back out of it."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​你​现在​处境​不利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​知道​，​如果​你​想​重新​振作起来​，​你​得​需要​所有​能用​上​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 xian4zai4 chu3jing4 bu4li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 zhi1dao4，ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 chong2xin1 zhen4 zuo4 qi3 lai2，ni3 de2 xu1yao4 suo3you3 neng2 yong4 shang4 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"I know that. But sadly, your friend Blitz is.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not gonna kill you, $(l.name). I won't even take your thumbs. But the Landenbergs' security... well, I can make no such promises about them."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​。​但​可惜​，​你​的​朋友​布里​茨​并非如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​杀​了​你​，​$(l.name)​。​我​甚至​也​不​打算​要​了​你​的​拇指​。​但​至于​兰​登堡​帮​的​安保​人员​……​我​就​没法​做​保证​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。dan4 ke3xi1，ni3 de5 peng2you5 Bu4li3ci2 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 sha1 le5 ni3，$(l.name)。wo3 shen4zhi4 ye3 bu4 da3suan4 yao4 le5 ni3 de5 mu3zhi3。dan4 zhi4yu2 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2……wo3 jiu4 mei2fa3 zuo4 bao3zheng4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I know the old adage about lookin' a gift horse in the mouth, but this thing... I don't know what to say, boss.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich peers warily at the machine, his arms crossed over his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I just don't like it."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​“​受人​恩惠​莫​挑剔​”​这句​老话​，​但​这​玩意儿​……​老大​，​我​实在​不知​该​说​什么​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​警惕​地​盯​着​机器​，​双臂​交叉​抱​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就是​觉得​它​不对劲​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5“shou4 ren2 en1hui4 mo4 tiao1ti5” zhe4 ju4 lao3hua4，dan4 zhe4 wan2yi4r5……lao3da4，wo3 shi2zai4 bu4zhi1 gai1 shuo1 shen2me5 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 jing3ti4 de5 ding1 zhao2 ji1qi4，shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1 bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 jue2de5 ta1 bu4dui4jin4。"

msgid ""
"I know truths hidden from mortal eyes, $(l.name). I have seen things that would crack your mind into splinters, and I have come out the other side laughing.\n"
"\n"
"You dismiss my words at your own peril."
msgstr ""
"我​知晓​凡人​肉眼​无法​窥见​的​真相​，​$(l.name)​。​我​所见​之物​足以​将​你​的​心智​撕成​碎片​，​而​我​却​得以​笑​着​全身而退​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​若​轻视​我​的​话语​，​后果自负​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1xiao3 fan2ren2 rou4yan3 wu2fa3 kui1jian4 de5 zhen1xiang4，$(l.name)。wo3 suo3jian4 zhi1 wu4 zu2yi3 jiang1 ni3 de5 xin1zhi4 si1 cheng2 sui4pian4，er2 wo3 que4 de2yi3 xiao4 zhao2 quan2shen1er2tui4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ruo4 qing1shi4 wo3 de5 hua4yu3，hou4guo3zi4fu4。"

msgid ""
"I know we're outnumbered - but I also know this team. And there's no one "
"else I'd rather have at my side."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​我们​人数​不​占优势​，​但​我​也​了解​你们​每个​人​的​本事​。​你们​就是​我​所​依靠​的​最强​助力​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 ren2shu4 bu4 zhan4you1shi4，dan4 wo3 ye3 liao3jie3 ni3men5 mei3ge4 ren2 de5 ben3shi4。ni3men5 jiu4shi4 wo3 suo3 yi1kao4 de5 zui4 jiang4 zhu4li4。"

msgid ""
"I know we're outnumbered - but I also know you, Dietrich. And there's no one"
" else I'd rather have at my side."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​我们​人数​不​占优势​，​但​我​也​了解​你​，​迪​特里​希​。​你​就是​我​所​依靠​的​最强​助力​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 ren2shu4 bu4 zhan4you1shi4，dan4 wo3 ye3 liao3jie3 ni3，Di2te4li3xi1。ni3 jiu4shi4 wo3 suo3 yi1kao4 de5 zui4 jiang4 zhu4li4。"

msgid ""
"I know what I'm going to do.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich leans in close, his nose hovering inches away from Monika's. His voice is soft. Almost a whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Liebchen. It's Dietrich. Tell me what did this to you."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​我要​做​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希凑​得​更​近​，​连​鼻尖​也​几乎​要​贴​了​上去​。​他​语调​柔和​，​几​不可​闻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​亲爱​的​。​我​是​迪​特里​希​。​告诉​我​，​是​什么​把​你​害成​了​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3 yao4 zuo4 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 cou4 de2 geng1 jin4，lian2 bi2jian1 ye3 ji1hu1 yao4 tie1 le5 shang4qu4。ta1 yu3diao4 rou2he2，ji1 bu4ke3 wen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qin1ai4 de5。wo3 shi4 Di2te4li3xi1。gao4su4 wo3，shi4 shen2me5 ba3 ni3 hai4 cheng2 le5 zhe4yang4。"

msgid "I know what you mean. An intruder could be *anywhere.*"
msgstr ""
"我​懂​你​意思​。​入侵者​可能​会​在​*​任何​地方​*​出现​。\n"
"wo3 dong3 ni3 yi4si5。ru4qin1zhe3 ke3neng2 hui4 zai4*ren4he2 di4fang1*chu1xian4。"

msgid ""
"I know what you were, Spirit. Before the Adversary twisted you.\n"
"\n"
"Before Harrow bound you into this rock."
msgstr ""
"精魂​，​我​知道​你​曾经​的​模样​—​—​在​反叛者​扭曲​你​之前​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​哈罗​把​你​束缚​进​这块​石头​之前​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1hun2，wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 ceng2jing1 de5 mu2yang4——zai4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 niu3qu1 ni3 zhi1qian2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ha1luo2 ba3 ni3 shu4fu4 jin4 zhe4 kuai4 shi2tou5 zhi1qian2。"

msgid ""
"I know what's worse: having to sit through another of your lectures. "
"Seriously, you're just about the preachiest son of a bitch I've ever met."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​有​什么​更​糟糕​：​听​你​再​讲​一次​长篇大论​。​说真的​，​你​大概​是​我​见​过​最​爱​说教​的​混蛋​了​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 you3 shen2me5 geng1 zao1gao1：ting1 ni3 zai4 jiang3 yi1ci4 zhang3 pian1 dai4 lun2。shuo1zhen1de5，ni3 da4gai4 shi4 wo3 jian4 guo4 zui4 ai4 shuo1jiao4 de5 hun2dan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I know where you're keeping the gas, Volker. I'm going to put a stop to "
"this."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​你​把​气体​放​哪​了​，​沃尔克​，​我会​阻止​你​的​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 ba3 qi4ti3 fang4 na3 le5，Wo4er3ke4，wo3 hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"I know you would've. This isn't on you.\n"
"\n"
"I'm the one who dropped the ball, an' poor Alexander wound up payin' the price."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​。​我​不是​在​怪​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​犯错​的​人​是​我​，​而​最终​却是​可怜​的​亚历山大​付出​了​代价​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。wo3 bu4shi4 zai4 guai4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"fan4cuo4 de5 ren2 shi4 wo3，er2 zui4zhong1 que4shi4 ke3lian2 de5 ya4li4shan1da4 fu4chu1 le5 dai4jia4。"

msgid ""
"I know! What's not to like?\n"
"\n"
"Maybe she felt threatened by my friendship with Dieter, back before he ate that bullet.\n"
"\n"
"Or maybe she was just jealous of my rugged good looks. Who the hell knows?"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​！​这​很​正常​嘛​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​她​因为​我​和​迪特尔​的​旧​交情​而​感到​了​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​或者​她​只是​嫉妒​我​好看​的​外表​。​谁​知道​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4！zhe4 hen3 zheng4chang2 ma5！\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1 yin1wei4 wo3 he4 di2 te4 er3 de5 jiu4 jiao1qing5 er2 gan3dao4 le5 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"you4 huo4zhe3 ta1 zhi3shi4 ji2du4 wo3 hao3kan4 de5 wai4biao3。shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"I know, Mira. I *know.* But couldn't we have just bought some secondhand "
"panels? They can't be *that* expensive."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​，​米拉​。​我​*​知道​*​。​但​难道​我们​就​不能​买​些​二手​的​太阳能​板​么​？​它们​不​可能​*​那么​*​贵​吧​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4，mi3la1。wo3*zhi1dao4*。dan4 nan2dao4 wo3men5 jiu4 bu4neng2 mai3 xie1 er4shou3 de5 tai4yang2neng2 ban3 ma2？ta1men5 bu4 ke3neng2*na4me5*gui4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I know. And after all this, I think it will be easier to tell where I "
"belong."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​。​经历​这​一切​之后​，​我​想​我会​更​清楚​自己​属于​哪里​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。jing1li4 zhe4 yi1qie4 zhi1hou4，wo3 xiang3 wo3 hui4 geng1 qing1chu5 zi4ji3 shu3yu2 na3li3。"

msgid ""
"I know. I'll be back as soon as the job's done, $(l.name)... that's a "
"promise."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​忙​完​就​回来​，​$(l.name)​……​我​保证​。\n"
"en1，wo3 mang2 wan2 jiu4 hui2lai5，$(l.name)……wo3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"I know. Sorry. I guess I'm still a little on edge about this... which is exactly what Yuli wanted, of course.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She grits her teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I just can't help thinking, what if he *wasn't* playing me? What if those things *did* happen?"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​，​抱歉​。​我​想​我​对​这件​事​还​有些​焦躁​……​而​这​也​正是​尤里​想要​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​咬紧牙关​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​还是​忍不住​去​想​，​如果​他​*​不是​*​在​戏弄​我​呢​？​如果​这些​事​*​真的​*​发生​过​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4，bao4qian4。wo3 xiang3 wo3 dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 hai2 you3xie1 jiao1zao4……er2 zhe4 ye3 zheng4shi4 You2li3 xiang3yao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 ren3bu5zhu4 qu4 xiang3，ru2guo3 ta1*bu4shi4*zai4 xi4nong4 wo3 ni2？ru2guo3 zhe4xie1 shi4*zhen1de5*fa1sheng1 guo4 ni2？"

msgid "I know..."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​……\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4……"

msgid "I left it at home."
msgstr ""
"我​把​它​忘​在​家里​了​。\n"
"wo3 ba3 ta1 wang4 zai4 jia1li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I left my ID in the other room. If you'll just let me past, I'll grab it for"
" you."
msgstr ""
"我​把​证件​落​在​房间​里​了​。​如果​你​让​我​过去​的话​，​我​就​可以​拿给​你​看​。\n"
"wo3 ba3 zheng4jian4 la4 zai4 fang2jian1 li3 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 rang4 wo3 guo4qu4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 ke3yi3 na2 gei3 ni3 kan4。"

msgid ""
"I left the punk scene for all of the reasons I told you, boss. But there was a bigger reason, and I saw it in those kids' broken bodies.\n"
"\n"
"This road that I'm on... it leads to the grave. I've got the power to make it a leisurely trip, but make no mistake, that is where I'm headed.\n"
"\n"
"Those kids tried to follow in my footsteps, and they wound up sprintin' ahead of me instead."
msgstr ""
"我​离开​朋克​圈​的​理由​之前​都​跟​你​说​过​了​，​老大​。​但​还有​一个​更​重要​的​理由​，​是​我​在​看到​那些​孩子​残破​的​尸体​时才​想​明白​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​踏上​的​这条​道路​……​通向​坟墓​。​凭借​魔法​的​力量​，​我能​让​过程​变得​轻松​惬意​，​但​毫无疑问​，​坟墓​就是​我​最终​的​归宿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​孩子​本想​追随​我​的​脚步​，​结果​却​先​我​一步​而​去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 li2kai1 peng2ke4 juan1 de5 li3you2 zhi1qian2 dou1 gen1 ni3 shuo1 guo4 le5，lao3da4。dan4 hai2you3 yi1ge5 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 li3you2，shi4 wo3 zai4 kan4dao4 na4Xie1hai2zi5 can2po4 de5 shi1ti3 shi2 cai2 xiang3 ming2bai5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ta4shang4 de5 zhe4 tiao2 dao4lu4……tong1xiang4 fen2mu4。ping2jie4 mo2fa3 de5 li4liang5，wo3 neng2 rang4 guo4cheng2 bian4de5 qing1song1 qie4yi4，dan4 hao2wu2yi2wen4，fen2mu4 jiu4shi4 wo3 zui4zhong1 de5 gui1su4。\n"
"\n"
"na4Xie1hai2zi5 ben3 xiang3 zhui1sui2 wo3 de5 jiao3bu4，jie1guo3 que4 xian1 wo3 yi1 bu4 er2 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I let Alice track me to this facility. I didn't have to do that... I could've peeled her mind like a grape if I'd wanted to.\n"
"\n"
"But I allowed her to lead you here, all the same."
msgstr ""
"我​让​爱丽丝​追踪​我​到​了​这个​设施​。​其实​我本​不必​如此​……​如果​我​愿意​的话​，​完全​可以​像​剥​葡萄​般​剥开​她​的​心智​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​还是​让​她​引导​你​来到​了​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 rang4 ai4li4si1 zhui1zong1 wo3 dao4 le5 zhe4ge5 she4shi1。qi2shi2 wo3 ben3 bu4bi4 ru2ci3……ru2guo3 wo3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，wan2quan2 ke3yi3 xiang4 bao1 pu2tao5 ban1 bao1 kai1 ta1 de5 xin1zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 rang4 ta1 yin3dao3 ni3 lai2dao4 le5 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"I lied.\n"
"\n"
"After all of the lies that you've told me, I think it's only fair."
msgstr ""
"我​撒谎​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​你​对​我​撒​了​那么​多谎​，​我​觉得​这样​很​公平​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 sa1huang3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 ni3 dui4 wo3 sa1 le5 na4me5 duo1 huang3，wo3 jue2de5 zhe4yang4 hen3 gong1ping2。"

msgid "I lied. Harrow dies tonight."
msgstr ""
"我​说谎​了​。​哈罗​今晚​必须​死​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1huang3 le5。ha1luo2 jin1wan3 bi4xu1 si3。"

msgid ""
"I like Marta. She's so nice... I always feel safe when I'm with her.\n"
"\n"
"Most adults aren't like that. They either don't notice you, or they do for the wrong reasons. But Marta... she cares about us."
msgstr ""
"我​喜欢​玛​尔塔​。​她​人​很​好​……​和​她​在​一起​时​，​我​总是​感到​很​安心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大多数​成年人​可不​像​这样​。​他们​要么​不会​注意​你​，​要么​就​会​冤枉​你​。​但玛​尔塔​……​她​在乎​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi3huan5 Ma3er3ta3。ta1 ren2 hen3 hao3……he4 ta1 zai4 yi1qi3 shi2，wo3 zong3shi4 gan3dao4 hen3 an1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"da4duo1shu4 cheng2nian2ren2 ke3bu5 xiang4 zhe4yang4。ta1men5 yao4me5 bu4hui4 zhu4yi4 ni3，yao4me5 jiu4 hui4 yuan1wang5 ni3。dan4 Ma3er3ta3……ta1 zai4hu5 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"I like that I don't get pressured to hurt people here. So that's good. And nobody smacks me around, even though I can tell that a lot of the trog- uh, the \"orks and trolls\" want to.\n"
"\n"
"I do get yelled at a lot, and called a lot of names. But I guess that making me feel bad about that kind of thing is all a part of the plan."
msgstr ""
"这里​没人​逼​我​去​伤害​别人​，​简直​太好了​。​也​没人​揍​我​，​但​我​觉得​很多​穴居人​—​—​呃​，​应该​说​“​兽​人​和​巨魔​”​都​想​揍​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​经常​会​被​吼​，​被​骂​了​许多​难听​的话​，​但​我​想​，​让​我​自己​感到​难受​，​大概​也​是​现在​必须​经历​的​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 mei2 ren2 bi1 wo3 qu4 shang1hai4 bie2ren5，jian3zhi2 tai4hao3le5。ye3 mei2 ren2 zou4 wo3，dan4 wo3 jue2de5 hen3 duo1 xue2ju1ren2——e4，ying1gai1 shuo1“shou4 ren2 he4 ju4mo2” dou1 xiang3 zou4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jing1chang2 hui4 bei4 hou3，bei4 ma4 le5 xu3duo1 nan2ting1 de5hua4，dan4 wo3 xiang3，rang4 wo3 zi4ji3 gan3dao4 nan2shou4，da4gai4 ye3 shi4 xian4zai4 bi4xu1 jing1li4 de5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I limped that fifty miles with a through-and-through in my left calf and two"
" rounds buried in my right shoulder. Hoffmann carried most of the gear."
msgstr ""
"我​左小腿​被​贯穿​，​右肩​两处​中弹​，​就​这样​一瘸一拐​地走了​五十​英里​。​霍夫曼​扛着​大部分​装备​。\n"
"wo3 zuo3 xiao3 tui3 bei4 guan4chuan1，you4 jian1 liang3 chu3 zhong4dan4，jiu4 zhe4yang4 yi1que2yi1guai3 de5 zou3 le5 wu3shi2 ying1li3。huo4fu1man4 gang1 zhao2 da4bu4fen5 zhuang1bei4。"

msgid ""
"I looked high, I looked low. I poked into everything I could think of. And my contacts did the same.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She's gone, chief. At this point, I've accepted that. But I still have to repay those debts."
msgstr ""
"我​为了​找​她​也​算是​上穷​碧​落下​黄泉​，​就​连​我​的​联系​人们​也​使出​了​所有​手段​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​不见​了​，​头儿​。​现在​我​已经​接受​了​这​一点​，​但​我​仍然​还要​偿还​那些​我​欠下​的​债​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei4le5 zhao3 ta1 ye3 suan4shi4 shang4 qiong2 bi4 luo4xia4 huang2quan2，jiu4 lian2 wo3 de5 lian2xi4 ren2men5 ye3 shi3chu1 le5 suo3you3 shou3duan4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 bu4jian4 le5，tou2r5。xian4zai4 wo3 yi3jing1 jie1shou4 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3，dan4 wo3 reng2ran2 hai2 yao4 chang2huan2 na4xie1 wo3 qian4 xia4 de5 zhai4。"

msgid "I lost my shoe. When I was running. And then I fell."
msgstr ""
"我​逃跑​的​时候​把​鞋​弄​丢​了​。​然后​我​摔倒​了​。\n"
"wo3 tao2pao3 de5 shi2hou5 ba3 xie2 long4 diu1 le5。ran2hou4 wo3 shuai1dao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I love them. They're like family to me.\n"
"\n"
"When I'm hungry, they're the ones who harvest the meat for me to cook from the cultured organ lab. When I'm in need of company, they keep me warm."
msgstr ""
"我​爱​他们​。​他们​就​像​我​的​家人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​饿​了​的​时候​，​他们​会​从​培养​的​器官​实验室​为​我​收割​肉类​供​我​烹饪​。​当​我​需要​陪伴​时​，​他们​会​温暖​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ai4 ta1men5。ta1men5 jiu4 xiang4 wo3 de5 jia1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 e4 le5 de5 shi2hou5，ta1men5 hui4 cong2 pei2yang3 de5 qi4guan1 shi2yan4shi4 wei2 wo3 shou1ge1 rou4lei4 gong1 wo3 peng1ren4。dang1 wo3 xu1yao4 pei2ban4 shi2，ta1men5 hui4 wen1nuan3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"I loved the KSK. And I lived to protect my team.\n"
"\n"
"Hoffmann's ignorance, his ridiculous lust for glory... they destroyed the thing that I loved most. So I destroyed him in turn. Even though it meant that I could never go back.\n"
"\n"
"What does that say about me?"
msgstr ""
"我​热爱​KSK​。​我​活着​就是​为了​保护​我​的​团队​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​霍夫曼​的​愚昧​，​他​那​可笑​的​功名​利欲​……​摧毁​了​我​最​珍视​的​一切​。​所以​我​反过来​摧毁​了​他​。​即使​这​意味着​我​永远​无法​回头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​说明​了​我​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 re4ai4 KSK。wo3 huo2zhe5 jiu4shi4 wei4le5 bao3hu4 wo3 de5 tuan2dui4。\n"
"\n"
"huo4fu1man4 de5 yu2mei4，ta1 na4 ke3xiao4 de5 gong1ming2 li4yu4……cui1hui3 le5 wo3 zui4 zhen1shi4 de5 yi1qie4。suo3yi3 wo3 fan3guo5lai2 cui1hui3 le5 ta1。ji2shi3 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 yong3yuan3 wu2fa3 hui2tou2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shuo1ming2 le5 wo3 shen2me5？"

msgid "I made a deal with Ullrich. Trithemius is involved."
msgstr ""
"我​和​乌尔里​希做​了​笔​交易​。​这和特​里特​米​乌斯​有关​。\n"
"wo3 he4 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 zuo4 le5 bi3 jiao1yi4。zhe4 he4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 you3guan1。"

msgid "I made a deal, and I'm sticking to it. Now let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"既然​有言在先​，​我​就​不会​失约​。​你​还是​赶紧​受死​吧​。\n"
"ji4ran2 you3 yan2 zai4 xian1，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 shi1yue1。ni3 hai2shi5 gan3jin3 shou4si3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I made an arragement with their leader, and they agreed to return the "
"weapons."
msgstr ""
"我​和​他们​的​首领​达成​了​协议​，​他们​同意​把​武器​送​回来​。\n"
"wo3 he4 ta1men5 de5 shou3ling3 da2cheng2 le5 xie2yi4，ta1men5 tong2yi4 ba3 wu3qi4 song4 hui2lai5。"

msgid "I made mistakes, but I can help them not make those mistakes."
msgstr ""
"我犯​过错​，​但​我​可以​帮助​他们​不​犯下​那些​错误​。\n"
"wo3 fan4 guo4cuo4，dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 bang1zhu4 ta1men5 bu4 fan4 xia4 na4xie1 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"I may be his ears and hands, but he's got enough of a voice all by himself!"
msgstr ""
"我​也许​是​他​的​耳目​，​但​他​自己​的​嗓门​也​很大​！\n"
"wo3 ye3xu3 shi4 ta1 de5 er3mu4，dan4 ta1 zi4ji3 de5 sang3men2 ye3 hen3 dai4！"

msgid ""
"I may be one of the hottest deckers in Berlin, but a bullet in the head will kill me just as dead as anyone else. \n"
"\n"
"Given the circumstances, I didn't see how I could refuse."
msgstr ""
"我​或许​是​柏林​最​厉害​的​碟​客​之一​，​但​脑袋​上​挨​一枪​的话​，​我​也​只能​像​其他人​一样​死翘翘​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当时​那个​情况​，​我​也​没​办法​拒绝​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 huo4xu3 shi4 bo2lin2 zui4 li4hai5 de5 die2 ke4 zhi1yi1，dan4 nao3dai5 shang4 ai1 yi1 qiang1 de5hua4，wo3 ye3 zhi3neng2 xiang4 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4 si3qiao4qiao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1shi2 na4ge5 qing2kuang4，wo3 ye3 mei2 ban4fa3 ju4jue2 a1。"

msgid ""
"I may walk with a crutch, but I'm not so feeble that I can't do without it. "
"And time's are that it makes a decent weapon."
msgstr ""
"我​虽然​拄着​拐杖​走路​，​但​并​不至于​虚弱​到​离不开​它​。​而且​，​在​某些​情况​下​，​它​还​能​充当​一把​不错​的​武器​。\n"
"wo3 sui1ran2 zhu3 zhao2 guai3zhang4 zou3lu4，dan4 bing4 bu4zhi4yu2 xu1ruo4 dao4 li2bu5kai1 ta1。er2qie3，zai4 mou3xie1 qing2kuang4 xia4，ta1 hai2 neng2 chong1dang1 yi1 ba3 bu4cuo4 de5 wu3qi4。"

msgid ""
"I mean, it ups the stakes if the Firewing's allowed to carry out her plans... whatever those might be. But we're gonna stop her before that happens.\n"
"\n"
"That was always the plan. Far as I'm concerned, it's still the plan now."
msgstr ""
"我​的​意思​是​，​如果​火翼​得以​实施​她​的​计划​，​事态​就​会​变得​更加​危险​。​但​我们​会​阻止​她​，​绝不​让​她​得逞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​始终​是​我们​的​计划​。​就​我​而言​，​现在​依然​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，ru2guo3 Huo3yi4 de2yi3 shi2shi1 ta1 de5 ji4hua4，shi4tai4 jiu4 hui4 bian4de5 geng4jia1 wei1xian3。dan4 wo3men5 hui4 zu3zhi3 ta1，jue2bu4 rang4 ta1 de2cheng3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi3zhong1 shi4 wo3men5 de5 ji4hua4。jiu4 wo3 er2yan2，xian4zai4 yi1ran2 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"I mean, they tried. They pumped thousands of rounds into the air around her, and they lobbed rockets at her for months. Lost a lot of attack helicopters and fightercraft in the process. \n"
"\n"
"But none of those things were responsible for taking her down. The Dragonfall was caused by an experimental warhead... one that Adrian and his Diehl Defense think-tank designed."
msgstr ""
"他们​确实​有​努力​过​。​他们​向​她​周围​的​空中​发射​了​成千上万​发​炮弹​，​向​她​发射​了​几个​月​的​火箭弹​，​在​这个​过程​中​损失​了​很多​攻击​直升机​和​战斗机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这些​都​不是​击落​她​的​原因​。​龙​陨​事件​来自​一枚​实验性​核弹头​……​由​阿德里安​和​他​的​迪尔​防务​智囊团​设计​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 que4shi2 you3 nu3li4 guo4。ta1men5 xiang4 ta1 zhou1wei2 de5 kong1zhong1 fa1she4 le5 cheng2qian1shang4wan4 fa1 pao4dan4，xiang4 ta1 fa1she4 le5 ji3ge5 yue4 de5 huo3jian4dan4，zai4 zhe4ge5 guo4cheng2 zhong4 sun3shi1 le5 hen3 duo1 gong1ji1 zhi2sheng1ji1 he4 zhan4dou4ji1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4xie1 dou1 bu4shi4 ji1luo4 ta1 de5 yuan2yin1。long2 yun3 shi4jian4 lai2zi4 yi1 mei2 shi2 yan4 xing4 he2dan4tou2……you2 E1de2li3an1 he4 ta1 de5 Di2er3fang2wu4 zhi4nang2tuan2 she4ji4。"

msgid "I mean, what more is there to say?"
msgstr ""
"这个​，​还有​什么​需要​讲​的​吗​？\n"
"zhe4ge5，hai2you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 jiang3 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I met her a couple of times. Seemed nice enough.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes another drag on her cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But I mostly knew her by reputation. You can't live in this kiez without hearing about the Queen of the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"我见​过​她​几次​。​看起来​像​个​好人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​又​抽​了​一口​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​更​多​是​听​过​她​的​名声​。​住​在​这片​街区​的​人​，​谁​没​听​过​“​克洛伊​茨​集市​女王​”​的​鼎鼎大名​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian4 guo4 ta1 ji3ci4。kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 ge4 hao3ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 chou1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 geng1 duo1 shi4 ting1 guo4 ta1 de5 ming2sheng1。zhu4 zai4 zhe4 pian1 jie1qu1 de5 ren2，shei2 mei2 ting1 guo4“Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 nu:3wang2” de5 ding3ding3da4ming2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"I might be gone for a long time, $(l.name). There are a lot of kids who are "
"going to need my help, and I intend to give it to them. But I promise you: I"
" will return to the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"我​可能​会​离开​很长​一段时间​，​$(l.name)​。​有​很多​孩子​需要​我​的​帮助​，​我​打算​向​他们​伸出​援手​。​但​我​向​你​保证​：​我会​回到​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"wo3 ke3neng2 hui4 li2kai1 hen3 zhang3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1，$(l.name)。you3 hen3 duo1 hai2zi5 xu1yao4 wo3 de5 bang1zhu4，wo3 da3suan4 xiang4 ta1men5 shen1chu1 yuan2shou3。dan4 wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4：wo3 hui4 hui2dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid ""
"I might be gone for a long time. For the time being, you should write me off... maybe find someone to fill my shoes. But this place is my home, and you people are my family.\n"
"\n"
"I promise you, when the job is done, I'll come back to the Kreuzbasar. I hope that you'll still have me."
msgstr ""
"我​也许​会​离开​很长​一段时间​。​你们​在​这​段时间​里​就​当​我​不​存在​吧​……​或许​找​个人​接替​我​。​但​这里​是​我​的​家​，​你们​是​我​的​家人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你们​承诺​，​等​我​把​事​办完​了​，​我​一定​会​回到​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​希望​那时​你们​还​能​接纳​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3xu3 hui4 li2kai1 hen3 zhang3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。ni3men5 zai4 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3 jiu4 dang1 wo3 bu4 cun2zai4 ba1……huo4xu3 zhao3 ge4ren2 jie1ti4 wo3。dan4 zhe4li3 shi4 wo3 de5 jia1，ni3men5 shi4 wo3 de5 jia1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3men5 cheng2nuo4，deng3 wo3 ba3 shi4 ban4 wan2 le5，wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 hui2dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。xi1wang4 na4shi2 ni3men5 hai2 neng2 jie1na4 wo3。"

msgid "I might be in the market for some cyberware..."
msgstr ""
"我​想​找​一些​赛博​改造​……\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhao3 yi1xie1 sai4bo2 gai3zao4……"

msgid "I might be interested."
msgstr ""
"我​也许​会​有点​兴趣​。\n"
"wo3 ye3xu3 hui4 you3dian3 xing4qu4。"

msgid "I might be interested. Tell me more."
msgstr ""
"我​也许​会​有​兴趣​。​和​我​多​说​说​。\n"
"wo3 ye3xu3 hui4 you3 xing4qu4。he4 wo3 duo1 shuo1 shuo1。"

msgid "I might be interested... depending on my cut of the profits, that is."
msgstr ""
"我​也许​会​有点​兴趣​……​前提​是​我​能​分到​几成​利润​。\n"
"wo3 ye3xu3 hui4 you3dian3 xing4qu4……qian2ti2 shi4 wo3 neng2 fen4 dao4 ji1 cheng2 li4run4。"

msgid "I might be. Who's asking?"
msgstr ""
"这得​看​问​的​人​是​谁​了​。\n"
"zhe4 de2 kan4 wen4 de5 ren2 shi4 shei2 le5。"

msgid "I might've had something to do with it."
msgstr ""
"我​也许​是​做​了​点​贡献​。\n"
"wo3 ye3xu3 shi4 zuo4 le5 dian3 gong4xian4。"

msgid ""
"I much prefer his hookah options though. Real coffee makes me feel paranoid.\n"
"\n"
"Speaking of which, I should probably get back to work. See ya around!"
msgstr ""
"不过​我​还是​更​喜欢​水烟​。​真​咖啡​总让​我​感觉​焦虑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​起来​，​我​也​该​继续​干活​了​。​回头见​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 hai2shi5 geng1 xi3huan5 shui3yan1。zhen1 ka1fei1 zong3 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2 jiao1lu:4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 qi3lai5，wo3 ye3 gai1 ji4xu4 gan4huo2 le5。hui2tou2jian4！"

msgid "I must have missed something. I'll keep searching."
msgstr ""
"我​肯定​漏掉​了​什么​。​我会​再​找找看​。\n"
"wo3 ken3ding4 lou4diao4 le5 shen2me5。wo3 hui4 zai4 zhao3 zhao3 kan4。"

msgid "I must protect the Communion!"
msgstr ""
"我​必须​保护​共​融会​！\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 bao3hu4 gong4 rong2hui4！"

msgid ""
"I must've been about five years old. Adrian was twenty... it'd be his last family vacation with us. A year later, he'd begin his meteoric rise to fame and fortune.\n"
"\n"
"But on this trip, he was my brother. And when I fell out of the little paddle boat that our parents rented, and started sinking fast into the Baltic, he was the one who dove in to rescue me."
msgstr ""
"我​那时​大概​五岁​吧​。​而​阿德里安​是​二十岁​……​那​是​他​最后​一次​和​我们​全家​一起​度假​。​一年​后​，​他​将​名利双收​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​在​这次​旅行​中​，​他​是​我​的​哥哥​。​当​我​从​父母​租来​的​小​划艇​上​掉下来​，​迅速​沉入​波罗的海​时​，​是​他​跳入​水中​救​了​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 na4shi2 da4gai4 wu3 sui4 ba1。er2 E1de2li3an1 shi4 er4 shi2 sui4……na4 shi4 ta1 zui4hou4 yi1ci4 he4 wo3men5 quan2jia1 yi1qi3 du4jia4。yi1 nian2 hou4，ta1 jiang1 ming2li4shuang1shou1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zai4 zhe4 ci4 lu:3xing2 zhong4，ta1 shi4 wo3 de5 ge1ge5。dang1 wo3 cong2 fu4mu3 zu1 lai2 de5 xiao3 hua2ting3 shang4 diao4 xia4 lai2，xun4su4 chen2 ru4 bo1luo2di4hai3 shi2，shi4 ta1 tiao4 ru4 shui3 zhong4 jiu4 le5 wo3。"

msgid "I need cyberware."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​赛博​改造​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4。"

msgid ""
"I need direct server access to do my job, pal. I can't complete my check "
"from this terminal."
msgstr ""
"朋友​，​我​需要​直接​访问​服务器​才能​完成​工作​。​仅仅​通过​这台​终端​的话​，​我​没​办法​完成​检查​。\n"
"peng2you5，wo3 xu1yao4 zhi2jie1 fang3wen4 fu2wu4qi4 cai2neng2 wan2cheng2 gong1zuo4。jin3jin3 tong1guo4 zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 de5hua4，wo3 mei2 ban4fa3 wan2cheng2 jian3cha2。"

msgid "I need medical supplies."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​医疗​补给​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 yi1liao2 bu3ji3。"

msgid "I need some info."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​一些​信息​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 yi1xie1 xin4xi1。"

msgid ""
"I need some tech, and I'm on a tight schedule. Show me what you've got."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​一些​科技​产品​，​而且​我​时间​不​多​。​让​我​看看​你​的​货​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 yi1xie1 ke1ji4 chan3pin3，er2qie3 wo3 shi2jian1 bu4 duo1。rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 de5 huo4。"

msgid ""
"I need sunlight too. I like to joke I photosynthesize, but it just gives me "
"so much energy. Energy these people don’t have anymore."
msgstr ""
"我​也​需要​阳光​。​我​总​开玩笑​说​自己​能​进行​光合作用​，​但​这​更​多​是​在​给​我​自己​打气​。​这里​的​人们​早就​泄​了​气​喽​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 xu1yao4 yang2guang1。wo3 zong3 kai1wan2xiao4 shuo1 zi4ji3 neng2 jin4xing2 guang1he2zuo4yong4，dan4 zhe4 geng1 duo1 shi4 zai4 gei3 wo3 zi4ji3 da3qi4。zhe4li3 de5 ren2men5 zao3jiu4 xie4 le5 qi4 lou5。"

msgid ""
"I need sunlight too. I like to joke I photosynthesize, but it just gives me so much energy. Energy these people don’t have anymore.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her expression grows stern for a moment as she stares into her empty gin and tonic.{{/GM}}\n"
" \n"
"Maybe I’ve been down here long enough. Maybe I’m a ghost too."
msgstr ""
"我​也​需要​阳光​。​我​总​开玩笑​说​自己​能​进行​光合作用​，​但​这​更​多​是​在​给​我​自己​打气​。​这里​的​人们​早就​泄​了​气​喽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​盯​着​空空如也​的​金汤​力​杯子​，​表情​变得​有些​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​我​在​这​下面​待​了​太久​。​也许​我​自己​也​变成​幽灵​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xu1yao4 yang2guang1。wo3 zong3 kai1wan2xiao4 shuo1 zi4ji3 neng2 jin4xing2 guang1he2zuo4yong4，dan4 zhe4 geng1 duo1 shi4 zai4 gei3 wo3 zi4ji3 da3qi4。zhe4li3 de5 ren2men5 zao3jiu4 xie4 le5 qi4 lou5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 kong1kong1ru2ye3 de5 jin1tang1 li4 bei1zi5，biao3qing2 bian4de5 you3xie1 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3 zai4 zhe4 xia4mian4 dai1 le5 tai4 jiu3。ye3xu3 wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 bian4cheng2 you1ling2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I need sunlight too. I like to joke I photosynthesize, but it just gives me so much energy. Energy these people don’t have anymore.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her expression grows stern for a moment as she stares into her empty gin and tonic.{{/GM}}\n"
" \n"
"Maybe I’ve been down here long enough. Maybe I’m a ghost, too."
msgstr ""
"我​也​需要​阳光​。​我​总​开玩笑​说​自己​能​进行​光合作用​，​但​这​更​多​是​在​给​我​自己​打气​。​这里​的​人们​早就​泄​了​气​喽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​盯​着​空空如也​的​金汤​力​杯子​，​表情​变得​有些​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​我​在​这​下面​待​了​太久​。​也许​我​自己​也​变成​幽灵​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xu1yao4 yang2guang1。wo3 zong3 kai1wan2xiao4 shuo1 zi4ji3 neng2 jin4xing2 guang1he2zuo4yong4，dan4 zhe4 geng1 duo1 shi4 zai4 gei3 wo3 zi4ji3 da3qi4。zhe4li3 de5 ren2men5 zao3jiu4 xie4 le5 qi4 lou5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 kong1kong1ru2ye3 de5 jin1tang1 li4 bei1zi5，biao3qing2 bian4de5 you3xie1 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3 zai4 zhe4 xia4mian4 dai1 le5 tai4 jiu3。ye3xu3 wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 bian4cheng2 you1ling2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I need that information, and I need it now. Unless you want to see some real"
" violence, tell me what I want - now."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​这份​情报​，​立刻​马上​。​把​你​知道​的​告诉​我​，​否则​可​别怪​我​对​你​使用暴力​了​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 zhe4 fen4 qing2bao4，li4ke4 ma3shang4。ba3 ni3 zhi1dao4 de5 gao4su4 wo3，fou3ze2 ke3 bie4 guai4 wo3 dui4 ni3 shi3 yong4 bao4 li4 le5。"

msgid "I need to be on my way."
msgstr ""
"我​得​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 de2 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I need to find someone who can read this data that we lifted on the "
"Aztechnology run. Any thoughts?"
msgstr ""
"我​需要​找人来​解读​我们​在​阿兹特​科技​的​差事​中​拿​回来​的​数据​。​有​什么​想法​吗​？\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 zhao3 ren2 lai2 jie3du2 wo3men5 zai4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 cha4shi4 zhong4 na2 hui2lai5 de5 shu4ju4。you3 shen2me5 xiang3fa3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I need to get back to my contacts, and figure out if that situation in Schattennest.\n"
"\n"
"If the Engineer is still there, I have to find him. And I'm going alone."
msgstr ""
"我要​动用​我​的​关系​，​搞清楚​影巢​的​状况​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​工程师​还​在​那里​，​我​就​必须​找到​他​，​而且​我​必须​一个​人去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 dong4yong4 wo3 de5 guan1xi5，gao3 qing1 chu3 ying3 chao2 de5 zhuang4kuang4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 gong1cheng2shi1 hai2 zai4 na4li5，wo3 jiu4 bi4xu1 zhao3dao4 ta1，er2qie3 wo3 bi4xu1 yi1ge5 ren2 qu4。"

msgid "I need to get down to the basement."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​去​地下室​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 qu4 di4xia4shi4。"

msgid "I need to get downstairs. Into the basement."
msgstr ""
"我要​下楼​，​去​地下室​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 xia4lou2，qu4 di4xia4shi4。"

msgid "I need to get in there. Do you know the password?"
msgstr ""
"我​需要​进去​。​你​知道​口令​吗​？\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 jin4qu4。ni3 zhi1dao4 kou3ling4 ma5？"

msgid "I need to get into the basement. It's important."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​进入​地下室​。​这​很​重要​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 jin4ru4 di4xia4shi4。zhe4 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid "I need to get into the hotel."
msgstr ""
"我要​进​旅馆​里头​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 jin4 lu:3guan3 li3tou5。"

msgid ""
"I need to get into the hotel. Do you know if anyone down here has a key to "
"get up there?"
msgstr ""
"我要​进​旅馆​里头​。​你​知道​这层​有​谁​拿​着​楼上​的​钥匙​吗​？\n"
"wo3 yao4 jin4 lu:3guan3 li3tou5。ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 ceng2 you3 shei2 na2 zhao2 lou2shang4 de5 yao4shi5 ma5？"

msgid "I need to get moving."
msgstr ""
"我​得​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 de2 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I need to get my hands on the bioware prototypes that are being stored in "
"the Executive Wing."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​拿到​存放​在​行政部​的​生体​殖装​原型​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 na2dao4 cun2fang4 zai4 xing2 zheng4 bu4 de5 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yuan2xing2。"

msgid "I need to get up to the hotel. Any idea who I'd talk to about that?"
msgstr ""
"我​得​上​到​旅馆​那层​。​你​知道​我​该​找​谁​问​这事​吗​？\n"
"wo3 de2 shang4 dao4 lu:3guan3 na4 ceng2。ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 gai1 zhao3 shei2 wen4 zhe4 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "I need to know more about the Magnifikers."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​了解​更​多​关于​伟术​帮​的​信息​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 liao3jie3 geng1 duo1 guan1yu2 wei3 shu4 bang1 de5 xin4xi1。"

msgid "I need to stock up for our next job."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​为​下趟​差事​储备物资​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 wei2 xia4 tang1 cha4shi4 chu3 bei4 wu4 zi1。"

msgid "I need to talk to him."
msgstr ""
"我​得​跟​他​谈谈​。\n"
"wo3 de2 gen1 ta1 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"I need you alive to finish this mission. But if you don't shut that smug "
"mouth of yours right *now,* you're gonna arrive at your meeting without a "
"tongue."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​你​活着​才能​完成​任务​。​但​如果​你​*​现在​*​不​赶紧​闭上​你​这张​叭叭​小嘴​，​等​你​去​开会​的​时候​，​你​的​舌头​就别​想​在​嘴里​了​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 huo2zhe5 cai2neng2 wan2cheng2 ren4wu5。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3*xian4zai4*bu4 gan3jin3 bi4shang5 ni3 zhe4 zhang1 ba1 ba1 xiao3 zui3，deng3 ni3 qu4 kai1hui4 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 de5 she2tou5 jiu4 bie4 xiang3 zai4 zui3li3 le5。"

msgid "I need you to find someone for me. Dr. Adrian Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​你​帮​我​找​个人​。​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 bang1 wo3 zhao3 ge4ren2。E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。"

msgid "I need your password to transfer Alice's payment onto a credstick."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​你​的​密码​，​我要​把​爱丽丝​的​酬金​转​到​信用​棒​上​。\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 mi4ma3，wo3 yao4 ba3 ai4li4si1 de5 chou2jin1 zhuai3 dao4 xin4yong4 bang4 shang4。"

msgid "I neglected to introduce myself before."
msgstr ""
"我​之前​还​没​介绍​自己​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 hai2 mei2 jie4shao4 zi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"I never got to bury mine. I don't know if it would have been easier if I "
"had."
msgstr ""
"我​到​最后​也​没能​埋葬​我​自己​的​孩子​。​如果​当初​我​有​机会​这么​做​，​兴许​我​现在​会​好受​些​。\n"
"wo3 dao4 zui4hou4 ye3 mei2 neng2 mai2zang4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 hai2zi5。ru2guo3 dang1chu1 wo3 you3 ji1hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4，xing1xu3 wo3 xian4zai4 hui4 hao3shou4 xie1。"

msgid ""
"I never really went to school - pretty much been a street kid as long as I "
"can remember, and there was so much to learn from people outside of school "
"that I never really bothered. "
msgstr ""
"我​从未​真正​上​过学​—​—​从​记事​起​我​就​一直​是​个​街头​混混​，​而​学校​之外​的​人们​能​教会​我​的​东西​实在​太​多​，​所以​我​从未​觉得​有​必要​去​上学​。\n"
"wo3 cong2wei4 zhen1zheng4 shang4 guo4 xue2——cong2 ji4shi4 qi3 wo3 jiu4 yi1zhi2 shi4 ge4 jie1tou2 hun4 hun4，er2 xue2xiao4 zhi1wai4 de5 ren2men5 neng2 jiao1hui4 wo3 de5 dong1xi1 shi2zai4 tai4 duo1，suo3yi3 wo3 cong2wei4 jue2de5 you3 bi4yao4 qu4 shang4xue2。"

msgid ""
"I never said that she was my friend. We were in business together, and her "
"position opened. I took it."
msgstr ""
"我​从没​说​过​她​是​我​的​朋友​。​我们​曾​是​共事​关系​，​在​她​的​位子​空​出来​之后​，​我​坐​了​上去​而已​。\n"
"wo3 cong2mei2 shuo1 guo4 ta1 shi4 wo3 de5 peng2you5。wo3men5 ceng2 shi4 gong4shi4 guan1xi5，zai4 ta1 de5 wei4zi5 kong1 chu1lai2 zhi1hou4，wo3 zuo4 le5 shang4qu4 er2yi3。"

msgid "I note your use of the word \"tried.\""
msgstr ""
"我​注意​到​你​说​的​是​“​试​”​。\n"
"wo3 zhu4yi4 dao4 ni3 shuo1 de5 shi4“shi4”。"

msgid "I offer my life to the Communion!"
msgstr ""
"我愿​将​生命​献给​共​融会​！\n"
"wo3 yuan4 jiang1 sheng1ming4 xian4 gei3 gong4 rong2hui4！"

msgid ""
"I only caught a little of it... the magical research stuff. And most of that was over my head.\n"
"\n"
"I don't really go in for hermetic theory, boss. Makes my eyes glaze over every time."
msgstr ""
"我​只​听​了​一点点​……​关于​魔法​研究​的​那​部分​。​而​其中​大部分​内容​都​超出​了​我​的​理解​范围​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对​赫尔墨斯​理论​不太​感兴趣​，​老大​。​每次​听到​这些​内容​，​我​的​眼睛​都​会​发呆​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 ting1 le5 yi1dian3dian3……guan1yu2 mo2fa3 yan2jiu1 de5 na4 bu4fen5。er2 qi2zhong1 da4bu4fen5 nei4rong2 dou1 chao1chu1 le5 wo3 de5 li3jie3 fan4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 he4er3mo4si1 li3lun4 bu4 tai4 gan3xing4qu4，lao3da4。mei3ci4 ting1dao4 zhe4xie1 nei4rong2，wo3 de5 yan3jing5 dou1 hui4 fa1dai1。"

msgid ""
"I only have one *good* memory from that day, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"The sound of Hoffmann's windpipe breaking... that strangled little cry that he made as I continued *squeezing*... I'll carry those with me forever.\n"
"\n"
"And they'll always make me smile."
msgstr ""
"那天​我​只有​一个​*​美好​*​回忆​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就是​霍夫曼​喉管​断裂​的​声音​……​当​我​持续​*​掐住​*​他时​，​他​发出​的​那声​哽咽​的​哀鸣​……​这些​声音​将​永远​伴随​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它们​总会​让​我​嘴角​上扬​。\n"
"\n"
"na4tian1 wo3 zhi3you3 yi1ge5*mei3hao3*hui2yi4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4shi4 huo4fu1man4 hou2guan3 duan4lie4 de5 sheng1yin1……dang1 wo3 chi2xu4*qia1 zhu4*ta1 shi2，ta1 fa1chu1 de5 na4 sheng1 geng3ye4 de5 ai1ming2……zhe4xie1 sheng1yin1 jiang1 yong3yuan3 ban4sui2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zong3 hui4 rang4 wo3 zui3jiao3 shang4yang2。"

msgid ""
"I only took the damned thing because she told me not to... she said that security would be too tight, that I'd get myself killed.\n"
"\n"
"But I waltzed on in there and took it, all the same."
msgstr ""
"我​拿走​那​东西​只是​因为​她​不让​我​这么​做​……​她​说​安保​措施​很​严密​，​我​可能​会​害死​自己​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​还是​溜进去​把​它​拿到​手​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 na2zou3 na4 dong1xi1 zhi3shi4 yin1wei4 ta1 bu4 rang4 wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4……ta1 shuo1 an1bao3 cuo4shi1 hen3 yan2mi4，wo3 ke3neng2 hui4 hai4si3 zi4ji3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 liu1 jin4 qu4 ba3 ta1 na2dao4 shou3 le5。"

msgid "I overheard your little conversation with Silke, there."
msgstr ""
"我​刚好​听到​你​跟​西​尔克​讲​的​那​几句话​。\n"
"wo3 gang1hao3 ting1dao4 ni3 gen1 Xi1er3ke4 jiang3 de5 na4 ji1 ju4 hua4。"

msgid ""
"I owe *everything* to my time in the KSK. From my street name on down.\n"
"\n"
"So. You tell me what you want to know, and we'll see where this goes."
msgstr ""
"我​的​*​一切​*​都​归功于​当年​在​KSK​服役​的​岁月​。​自我​的​绰号​开始​，​无一例外​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​你​得​先​告诉​我​你​想​知道​什么​东西​，​我​再​看看​到底​要​讲​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5*yi1qie4*dou1 gui1 gong1 yu2 dang1nian2 zai4 KSK fu2yi4 de5 sui4yue4。zi4wo3 de5 chuo4hao4 kai1shi3，wu2 yi1 li4 wai4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 de2 xian1 gao4su4 wo3 ni3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 shen2me5 dong1xi1，wo3 zai4 kan4kan5 dao4di3 yao4 jiang3 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"I owe you a great deal, $(l.name). We all do.\n"
"\n"
"I will wire your payment to the account number that Amsel provided."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我们​都​欠​你​个人​情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​将​你​应得​的​款项​汇入​阿姆​泽尔​提供​的​账号​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3men5 dou1 qian4 ni3 ge4ren2 qing2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jiang1 ni3 ying1de2 de5 kuan3xiang4 hui4ru4 E1mu3ze2er3 ti2gong1 de5 zhang4hao4。"

msgid ""
"I paid you fifty grand. I expect a little more than a chip and a \"thanks "
"for your business.\""
msgstr ""
"我​付给​了​你​五万块​钱​。​仅仅​一枚​芯片​和​一句​“​谢谢​惠顾​”​就​把​我​打发​了​？\n"
"wo3 fu4gei3 le5 ni3 wu3 wan4 kuai4 qian2。jin3jin3 yi1 mei2 xin1pian4 he4 yi1ju4“xie4xie5 hui4gu4” jiu4 ba3 wo3 da3fa5 le5？"

msgid ""
"I press him for clarification on that point. \"What I mean to tell you is "
"that their internal anatomy is all wrong. It doesn't even make sense,\" he "
"explains. \"These creatures could not exist were it not for magic. And six "
"months ago, I would have told you that they could not exist at all.\""
msgstr ""
"我​追问​他​这个​观点​的​具体​含义​。​“​我​的​意思​是​说​，​它们​的​内部​构造​完全​错误​，​根本​不合逻辑​，​”​他​解释​道​，​“​若非​魔法​存在​，​这些​生物​根本​不​可能​存在​。​而​六个月​前​，​我​还​会​断言​它们​根本​不​可能​存在​。​”\n"
"wo3 zhui1wen4 ta1 zhe4ge5 guan1dian3 de5 ju4ti3 han2yi4。“wo3 de5 yi4si5 shi4 shuo1，ta1men5 de5 nei4bu4 gou4zao4 wan2quan2 cuo4wu4，gen1ben3 bu4 ge3 luo2 ji2，” ta1 jie3shi4 dao4，“ruo4fei1 mo2fa3 cun2zai4，zhe4xie1 sheng1wu4 gen1ben3 bu4 ke3neng2 cun2zai4。er2 liu4 ge4 yue4 qian2，wo3 hai2 hui4 duan4yan2 ta1men5 gen1ben3 bu4 ke3neng2 cun2zai4。”"

msgid ""
"I propose a simple exchange of services.\n"
"\n"
"You want to get back into the Harfeld Manor, yes? Well, I'd like nothing better than to help you.\n"
"\n"
"But I'm still shackled to my control subroutines, and I can't violate their commands."
msgstr ""
"我​提议​进行​一项​简单​的​互惠​交易​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​再次​进入​哈​菲尔德​庄园​，​对​吧​？​若​是​能​帮​你​一把​，​我​再​乐意​不过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​仍​被​束缚​在​控制​子程序​中​，​我​不能​违反​它们​的​命令​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ti2yi4 jin4xing2 yi1 xiang4 jian3dan1 de5 hu4hui4 jiao1yi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 zai4ci4 jin4ru4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2，dui4 ba1？ruo4 shi4 neng2 bang1 ni3 yi1 ba3，wo3 zai4 le4yi4 bu4guo4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 reng2 bei4 shu4fu4 zai4 kong4zhi4 zi3cheng2xu4 zhong4，wo3 bu4neng2 wei2fan3 ta1men5 de5 ming4ling4。"

msgid ""
"I pulled some paydata from the Aztechnology facility, but I can't read it. "
"Any ideas?"
msgstr ""
"我​从​阿兹特​科技​设施​搞​来​一些​值钱​数据​，​但​我​读取​不了​。​你​说​该​怎么办​？\n"
"wo3 cong2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1 gao3 lai2 yi1xie1 zhi2qian2 shu4ju4，dan4 wo3 du2qu3 bu4le5。ni3 shuo1 gai1 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid ""
"I put a small sample in my mass spectrometer and I noticed a very curious odor. Quite sweet, in fact, but co-mingled with the smell of burnt plastic. \n"
"\n"
"I examined a bit under the microscope while it was running. My eyes came to the same conclusion as the spectrometer, though it did narrow down some specifics."
msgstr ""
"我​将​少量​样品​放入​质谱仪​中​，​发现​了​一种​非常​奇怪​的​气味​。​事实上​，​这种​气味​相当​甜​，​但​又​夹杂着​塑料​烧焦​的​味道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​质谱仪​运行​时​，​我​在​显微镜​下​观察​了​一下​。​我​的​眼睛​得出​了​与​质谱仪​相同​的​结论​，​尽管​它​确实​缩小​了​一些​具体​范围​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 shao3liang4 yang4pin3 fang4ru4 zhi4pu3yi2 zhong4，fa1xian4 le5 yi1zhong3 fei1chang2 qi2guai4 de5 qi4wei4。shi4shi2shang4，zhe4zhong3 qi4wei4 xiang1dang1 tian2，dan4 you4 jia1 za2 zhao2 su4liao4 shao1jiao1 de5 wei4dao5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhi4pu3yi2 yun4xing2 shi2，wo3 zai4 xian3wei1jing4 xia4 guan1cha2 le5 yi1xia4。wo3 de5 yan3jing5 de2chu1 le5 yu4 zhi4pu3yi2 xiang1tong2 de5 jie2lun4，jin3guan3 ta1 que4shi2 suo1xiao3 le5 yi1xie1 ju4ti3 fan4wei2。"

msgid ""
"I put six of 'em in the ground personally. And when I find out who they are... where they *lived*... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns his head and spits.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...ain't nothin' gonna save those people. "
msgstr ""
"我​亲自​干掉​了​他们​六个​人​。​等​我​搞清楚​他们​的​身份​……​他们​之前​居住​的​地方​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转过​头​啐​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​谁​也​别​想​救​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qin1zi4 gan4diao4 le5 ta1men5 liu4 ge4 ren2。deng3 wo3 gao3 qing1 chu3 ta1men5 de5 shen1fen4……ta1men5 zhi1qian2 ju1zhu4 de5 di4fang1……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 cui4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……shei2 ye3 bie4 xiang3 jiu4 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"I put up with them because they amuse me. The fact that they amuse me infuriates my dear friend Altuğ, who in turn hurls more insults. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Goldschmidt raises his soykaf cup in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And thus, the cycle continues. It is two years now that I've been your customer, yes, Altuğ?"
msgstr ""
"我​容忍​是因为​我​觉得​这​很​有趣​，​而​这个​事实​又​反过来​激怒​我​亲爱​的​朋友​奥图​伊​，​使​他​进一步​辱骂​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​戈德​施密特​举起​豆​咖杯​向​你​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​因此​，​循环往复​。​我​已经​在​这里​做​了​两年​的​顾客​，​是不是​，​奥图​伊​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 rong2ren3 shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 hen3 you3qu4，er2 zhe4ge5 shi4shi2 you4 fan3guo5lai2 ji1nu4 wo3 qin1ai4 de5 peng2you5 ao4 tu2 yi1，shi3 ta1 jin4yi1bu4 ru3ma4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge1de2shi1mi4te4 ju3qi3 dou4 ka1 bei1 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yin1ci3，xun2 huan2 wang3 fu4。wo3 yi3jing1 zai4 zhe4li3 zuo4 le5 liang3 nian2 de5 gu4ke4，shi4bu5shi4，ao4 tu2 yi1？"

msgid ""
"I ran into a homeless guy on my way back to the office. I'm tired, but he "
"needed it more than I did."
msgstr ""
"我​回来​的​路上​遇到​了​一个​流浪汉​。​虽然​我​很​累​，​但​他​比​我​更​需要​它​。\n"
"wo3 hui2lai5 de5 lu4shang5 yu4dao4 le5 yi1ge5 liu2lang4han4。sui1ran2 wo3 hen3 lei3，dan4 ta1 bi3 wo3 geng1 xu1yao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I reached under the counter... I keep a gun there, you see… and they saw. Both of them turned on me. \n"
"\n"
"Goldschmidt… that fat idiot Goldschmidt… flung himself in my way. How he managed to move that great mass of a body so quickly is a mystery to me. "
msgstr ""
"我​把手​伸向​柜台​底下​……​我​在​那里​放​了​把​枪​来​着​……​结果​他们​看见​了​，​于是​都​扭头​开始​攻击​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​戈德​施密特​……​那个​蠢​胖子​……​突然​挡​在​我​面前​。​我​到​现在​都​没想​清楚​，​他​那么​臃肿​的​身躯​，​怎么​会动​得​这么​快​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ba3shou3 shen1 xiang4 gui4tai2 di3xia5……wo3 zai4 na4li5 fang4 le5 ba3 qiang1 lai2 zhao2……jie1guo3 ta1men5 kan4jian4 le5，yu2shi4 dou1 niu3tou2 kai1shi3 gong1ji1 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"Ge1de2shi1mi4te4……na4ge5 chun3 pang4zi5……tu1ran2 dang3 zai4 wo3 mian4qian2。wo3 dao4 xian4zai4 dou1 mei2 xiang3 qing1chu5，ta1 na4me5 yong1zhong3 de5 shen1qu1，zen3me5 hui4 dong4 de2 zhe4me5 kuai4。"

msgid "I really need to get up there. Can you help me out?"
msgstr ""
"我​真的​需要​到​上头​去​。​你​能​帮​我​一把​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhen1de5 xu1yao4 dao4 shang4tou2 qu4。ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3 yi1 ba3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I recently procured a bottle of 50 year old Islay scotch. Would you perhaps "
"be interested in acquiring it from me?"
msgstr ""
"我​最近​弄​到​了​一瓶​50​年份​的​艾雷岛​威士忌​。​你​有没有​兴趣​买下​它​？\n"
"wo3 zui4jin4 long4 dao4 le5 yi1 ping2 50 nian2fen4 de5 ai4 lei2 dao3 wei1shi4ji4。ni3 you3mei2you3 xing4qu4 mai3xia4 ta1？"

msgid ""
"I refuse. I'm sorry, Aljernon, but I can't do what you're asking. I just "
"can't."
msgstr ""
"我​拒绝​。​我​很​抱歉​，​阿尔杰​农​，​但​你​要求​的​事​我​确实​做​不到​。\n"
"wo3 ju4jue2。wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，E1er3jie2nong2，dan4 ni3 yao1qiu2 de5 shi4 wo3 que4shi2 zuo4 bu4dao4。"

msgid ""
"I regret setting APEX free. If you release the Firewing, you'll wind up "
"regretting it, too."
msgstr ""
"我​后悔​放出​了​APEX​。​如果​你​释放​火翼​的话​，​你​之后​肯定​也​会​后悔​的​。\n"
"wo3 hou4hui3 fang4chu1 le5 APEX。ru2guo3 ni3 shi4fang4 Huo3yi4 de5hua4，ni3 zhi1hou4 ken3ding4 ye3 hui4 hou4hui3 de5。"

msgid "I rejected her proposal. There were too many variables in play."
msgstr ""
"我​拒绝​了​她​的​提议​。​行动​中​的​未知​因素​太多​了​。\n"
"wo3 ju4jue2 le5 ta1 de5 ti2yi4。xing2dong4 zhong4 de5 wei4zhi1 yin1su4 tai4 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I remain convinced that you are thoroughly *dishonorable,* shadowrunner. A $(l.man) of honor would never have allowed $(l.hisher) target to live as long as you did.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever your motives might have been, honor was not among them."
msgstr ""
"我​依旧​确信​你​毫无​*​忠实​*​可言​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​否则​你​绝不会​允许​目标​存活​如此​之​久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​你​原本​的​动机​是​什么​，​忠实​绝不​在​其列​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1jiu4 que4xin4 ni3 hao2wu2*zhong1shi2*ke3yan2，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。fou3ze2 ni3 jue2 bu4 hui4 yun3xu3 mu4biao1 cun2huo2 ru2ci3 zhi1 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 yuan2ben3 de5 dong4ji1 shi4 shen2me5，zhong1shi2 jue2bu4 zai4 qi2 lie4。"

msgid ""
"I remember cruising the back alleys of Tübingen, looking for kids in need of help.\n"
"\n"
"The bait girls - Marta, and the others like her - would offer them money, or food, or drugs, or sex. Whatever it took to get them into the van. And once they piled in, Harrow and I would be waiting to greet them."
msgstr ""
"我​记得​自己​曾​在​图​宾根​的​各种​小巷​游荡​，​寻找​需要​帮助​的​孩子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​以及​像​她​一样​的​其他​诱饵​女孩​会​向​他们​提供​金钱​、​食物​、​药物​或​性爱​。​总之​不惜代价​都​要​把​他们​弄​到​货车​里​。​而​一旦​他们​上​了​车​，​哈罗​和​我​就​等​着​迎接​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4de5 zi4ji3 ceng2 zai4 tu2 bin1 gen1 de5 ge4zhong3 xiao3xiang4 you2dang4，xun2zhao3 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4 de5 hai2zi5。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 yi3ji2 xiang4 ta1 yi1yang4 de5 qi2ta1 you4er3 nu:3hai2 hui4 xiang4 ta1men5 ti2gong1 jin1qian2、shi2wu4、yao4wu4 huo4 xing4ai4。zong3zhi1 bu4 xi1 dai4 jia4 dou1 yao4 ba3 ta1men5 long4 dao4 huo4che1 li3。er2 yi1dan4 ta1men5 shang4 le5 che1，ha1luo2 he4 wo3 jiu4 deng3 zhao2 ying2jie1 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"I remember hearing the reports of the anarchists burning City Hall, and "
"seeing the smoke over the rooftops. (w)"
msgstr ""
"我​记得​当时​看到​无政府主义​者​焚烧​市政厅​的​报道​，​以及​屋顶​上空​升起​的​浓烟​。\n"
"wo3 ji4de5 dang1shi2 kan4dao4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3 fen2shao1 shi4zheng4ting1 de5 bao4dao4，yi3ji2 wu1ding3 shang4kong1 sheng1qi3 de5 nong2yan1。"

msgid ""
"I remember so many nights like that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I remember how much I used to enjoy it."
msgstr ""
"我​记得​那时​有​许许多多​这样​的​夜晚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​记得​我​曾经​如此​享受​这​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4de5 na4shi2 you3 xu3 xu3 duo1 duo1 zhe4yang4 de5 ye4wan3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4de5 wo3 ceng2jing1 ru2ci3 xiang3shou4 zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"I remember standing there, watching the light go out of this sweet old man's eyes while the blood poured from the neat, round hole in his forehead.\n"
"\n"
"And I remember Hoffmann saying something about \"protecting the team.\" \n"
"\n"
"\"We couldn't take the chance that he was lying,\" he said."
msgstr ""
"我​记得​当时​站​在​那里​，​看着​这位​和蔼​老人​眼中​的​光芒​逐渐​黯淡​，​鲜血​从​他​额头​上​那个​整齐​的​圆形​伤口​不断​涌出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​记得​霍夫曼​说​着​什么​“​保护​团队​”​之类​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​他​要是​说谎​怎么办​，​我们​不能​冒​这个​风险​，​”​他​说​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4de5 dang1shi2 zhan4 zai4 na4li5，kan4 zhao2 zhe4wei4 he2ai3 lao3ren2 yan3zhong1 de5 guang1mang2 zhu2jian4 an4dan4，xian1xue4 cong2 ta1 e2tou2 shang4 na4ge5 zheng3qi2 de5 yuan2xing2 shang1kou3 bu4duan4 yong3chu1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 ji4de5 huo4fu1man4 shuo1 zhao2 shen2me5“bao3hu4 tuan2dui4” zhi1lei4 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"“ta1 yao4shi5 shuo1huang3 zen3me5ban4，wo3men5 bu4neng2 mao4 zhe4ge5 feng1xian3，” ta1 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"I remember that show. It was horrible. I mean, really, *really* bad - made \"Neil the Ork Barbarian\" look like high art.\n"
"\n"
"Me an' my buddies in the Schwarze Herzen used to get high and laugh at it. It only ran for seven episodes before it got pulled."
msgstr ""
"我​记得​那部剧​，​太烂​了​，​真的​真的​，​太烂​了​。​和​它​比​起来​，​《​兽​人​野蛮​人​尼尔​》​都​像是​高雅​艺术​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​“​黑心​”​的​兄弟​们​以前​会​嗑​嗨​了​然后​一起​嘲笑​这剧​。​总共​就播​了​七集​，​然后​就​被​砍​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4de5 na4 bu4 ju4，tai4 lan4 le5，zhen1de5 zhen1de5，tai4 lan4 le5。he4 ta1 bi3 qi3lai5，《 shou4 ren2 ye3man2 ren2 ni2 er3 》 dou1 xiang4 shi4 gao1ya3 yi4shu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4“hei1xin1” de5 xiong1di4 men5 yi3qian2 hui4 ke4 hai1 le5 ran2hou4 yi1qi3 chao2xiao4 zhe4 ju4。zong3gong4 jiu4 bo1 le5 qi1 ji2，ran2hou4 jiu4 bei4 kan3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I remember.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What a day that was."
msgstr ""
"我​还​记得​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​笑​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​多么​美好​的​一天​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 ji4de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 duo1me5 mei3hao3 de5 yi1 tian1。"

msgid ""
"I said \"integrity.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not \"honor.\""
msgstr ""
"我​说​的​是​“​操守​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​“​忠实​”​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de5 shi4“cao1shou3”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4“zhong1shi2”。"

msgid ""
"I said that we'd give you the chip. I never promised that it would work."
msgstr ""
"我​只​答应​把​芯片​给​你​，​但​我​没​说​过会​有​效果​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3 da1ying5 ba3 xin1pian4 gei3 ni3，dan4 wo3 mei2 shuo1 guo4 hui4 you3 xiao4guo3。"

msgid ""
"I said we'll be fine. Now... you said that you had something for me when I "
"first came in. What was that about?"
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​，​我们​没事​的​。​好​了​……​你​刚才​说​有​消息​要​告诉​我​，​是​什么​事​？\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，wo3men5 mei2shi4 de5。hao3 le5……ni3 gang1cai2 shuo1 you3 xiao1xi5 yao4 gao4su4 wo3，shi4 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"I saw a detachment of mercenaries break away from the main group. \n"
"\n"
"They were carrying heavy ordinance, and they appeared to be heading in the direction of the sewers.\n"
"\n"
"Best guess? They're planning on bringing the entire block down. Reducing the Kreuzbasar to rubble."
msgstr ""
"我​看见​一群​佣兵​脱离​了​大​部队​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​携带​着​重型​军火​，​似乎​正朝​下水道​方向​前进​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​依我看​，​他们​是​想​炸毁​整片​街区​，​把​克洛伊​茨​集市​变成​一片​废墟​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4jian4 yi1 qun2 yong1bing1 tuo1li2 le5 dai4 bu4dui4 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 xie2dai4 zhao2 zhong4xing2 jun1huo3，si4hu1 zheng1 chao2 xia4shui3dao4 fang1xiang4 qian2jin4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1wo3kan4，ta1men5 shi4 xiang3 zha4hui3 zheng3 pian1 jie1qu1，ba3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 bian4cheng2 yi1 pian1 fei4xu1。"

msgid ""
"I saw a group of these jackasses peel off a few minutes ago. They made a beeline for the sewers.\n"
"\n"
"They were carrying bombs, $(l.name). Can't say what yield, but they looked big.\n"
"\n"
"Unless you fancy living in a crater, I'd suggest that we hightail it down there."
msgstr ""
"几分钟​前​我​看见​有些​蠢货​脱离​了​大​部队​，​直奔​下水道​而​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​带​着​炸弹​，​$(l.name)​。​具体​威力​不好​说​，​但​外形​看起来​很大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不想​以后​住​在​炸弹​坑里​的话​，​我​建议​我们​赶紧​过去​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 fen4 zhong1 qian2 wo3 kan4jian4 you3xie1 chun3huo4 tuo1li2 le5 dai4 bu4dui4，zhi2ben4 xia4shui3dao4 er2 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 dai4 zhao2 zha4dan4，$(l.name)。ju4ti3 wei1li4 bu4hao3 shuo1，dan4 wai4xing2 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 dai4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4xiang3 yi3hou4 zhu4 zai4 zha4dan4 keng1 li3 de5hua4，wo3 jian4yi4 wo3men5 gan3jin3 guo4qu4。"

msgid ""
"I saw him every month. I took the medicine. I got as much food as I could.\n"
"\n"
"But he said it wasn't enough. That I would never be..."
msgstr ""
"我​每个​月​都​去​见​他​。​我​吃​了​药​。​我​拿走​尽可能​多​的​食物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他​说​这样​还​不够​。​他​说​永远​都​不够​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei3ge4 yue4 dou1 qu4 jian4 ta1。wo3 chi1 le5 yao4。wo3 na2zou3 jin3ke3neng2 duo1 de5 shi2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1 shuo1 zhe4yang4 hai2 bu4gou4。ta1 shuo1 yong3yuan3 dou1 bu4gou4……"

msgid ""
"I say we kill every drekhead who enters this room. How does that sound?"
msgstr ""
"要​我​说​，​这​屋里​来​一个​白痴​咱们​就​杀​一个​。​怎么样​？\n"
"yao4 wo3 shuo1，zhe4 wu1 li3 lai2 yi1ge5 bai2chi1 zan2men5 jiu4 sha1 yi1ge5。zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"I say, keep things simple. We head back there, kick in the door, and kill "
"the dragon. Problem solved."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​不用​搞​得​太​复杂​。​我们​直接​杀​回去​，​破门而入​，​干掉​巨龙​，​问题​解决​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 bu4yong4 gao3 de2 tai4 fu4za2。wo3men5 zhi2jie1 sha1 hui2qu5，po4men2er2ru4，gan4diao4 ju4long2，wen4ti2 jie3jue2。"

msgid ""
"I see what's going on here. Living here alone for two years has reduced your"
" mind to pudding."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​。​独自​待​在​这里​两年​，​你​的​脑子​都​成​浆糊​了​。\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5。du2zi4 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3 liang3 nian2，ni3 de5 nao3zi5 dou1 cheng2 jiang4hu5 le5。"

msgid "I see."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​。\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5。"

msgid "I see. And have you done anything else?"
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​。​你​还​做​了​其他​事情​吗​？\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5。ni3 hai2 zuo4 le5 qi2ta1 shi4qing5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I see. And these... idiots... did they drop anything that could be of use? "
"Any identifying information?"
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​。​那​这些​……​蠢货​……​有没有​掉落​有用​的​物品​？​有没有​他们​的​身份​信息​？\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5。na4 zhe4xie1……chun3huo4……you3mei2you3 diao4luo4 you3yong4 de5 wu4pin3？you3mei2you3 ta1men5 de5 shen1fen4 xin4xi1？"

msgid ""
"I see. That's... an interesting offer, friend.\n"
"\n"
"That would certainly let us scope out some more lucrative heists around here. Assuming the taps are reliable..."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​。​这个​提议​……​有点​意思​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样一来​，​我们​肯定​能​打探​到​更​有​油水​的​差事​。​前提​是​接口​真的​靠​谱​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5。zhe4ge5 ti2yi4……you3dian3 yi4si5，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4yi1lai2，wo3men5 ken3ding4 neng2 da3tan4 dao4 geng1 you3 you2shui3 de5 cha4shi4。qian2ti2 shi4 jie1kou3 zhen1de5 kao4 pu3……"

msgid ""
"I see. That's... an interesting offer, friend.\n"
"\n"
"The rations alone probably don't match the price of the weapons, but... \n"
"\n"
"Well, food *is* in short supply around here."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​。​这个​提议​……​有点​意思​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​单凭​口粮​的​并​不足以​抵消​武器​的​价值​，​但是​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​的​食物​*​确实​*​很​紧缺​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5。zhe4ge5 ti2yi4……you3dian3 yi4si5，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"dan1 ping2 kou3liang2 de5 bing4 bu4 ju4 yi3 di3xiao1 wu3qi4 de5 jia4zhi2，dan4shi4……\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 shi2wu4*que4shi2*hen3 jin3que1。"

msgid ""
"I see. Well, thanks for letting me know... that gives me a lot to think "
"about."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​。​谢谢​你​告诉​我​这些​……​我​得​好好​考虑一下​。\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5。xie4xie5 ni3 gao4su4 wo3 zhe4xie1……wo3 de2 hao3hao3 kao3 lu:4 yi1 xia4。"

msgid ""
"I see. Well... that sounds like a tidy little arrangement you've made then, efendim. The kind of arrangement I might make myself.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He laughs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The kind of arrangement Monika might have made."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​了​……​听​起来​这项​安排​还​算​令人满意​，​贵人​。​换作​我​本人​的话​也​会​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​大笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​换作​莫妮卡​的话​也​会​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 le5……ting1 qi3lai5 zhe4 xiang4 an1pai2 hai2 suan4 ling4ren2man3yi4，gui4ren2。huan4 zuo4 wo3 ben3ren2 de5hua4 ye3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da4xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5hua4 ye3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I sent a man named Quorin to talk to you. He runs things in a neighboring "
"kiez. They're on hard times, and I promised them some rations."
msgstr ""
"我​让​一个​叫奎林​的​家伙​来​找​你​，​他​负责​打理​某个​邻近​街区​。​他们​最近​日子​不好过​，​于是​我​答应​给​他们​送些​补给​。\n"
"wo3 rang4 yi1ge5 jiao4 kui2 lin2 de5 jia1huo5 lai2 zhao3 ni3，ta1 fu4ze2 da3li3 mou3 ge4 lin2jin4 jie1qu1。ta1men5 zui4jin4 ri4zi5 bu4 hao3 guo4，yu2shi4 wo3 da1ying5 gei3 ta1men5 song4 xie1 bu3ji3。"

msgid ""
"I shall return to him and report your task completed to my satisfaction.\n"
"\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"我​将​向​他​报告​说​你​已​圆满完成​任务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 xiang4 ta1 bao4gao4 shuo1 ni3 yi3 yuan2 man3 wan2 cheng2 ren4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"I share Monika's passion for the Flux-State, ace. Our girl was a big influence on me in that regard.\n"
"\n"
"The Flux is unique. You know that. It needs to be protected if it's going to thrive.\n"
"\n"
"If you set me free, I'll devote the rest of my life to preserving it."
msgstr ""
"我​和​莫妮卡​一样​热爱​动荡​带​，​王牌​。​她​在​这方面​对​我​产生​了​莫大​的​影响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​动荡​带​是​独一无二​的​。​你​对此​再​清楚​不过​了​。​如果​它​想要​繁荣​发展​，​就​需要​被​保护​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​放​我​自由​，​我​将​倾尽​余生​守护​它​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 yi1yang4 re4ai4 dong4dang4 dai4，wang2pai2。ta1 zai4 zhe4 fang1 mian4 dui4 wo3 chan3sheng1 le5 mo4da4 de5 ying3xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"dong4dang4 dai4 shi4 du2yi1wu2er4 de5。ni3 dui4 ci3 zai4 qing1chu5 bu4guo4 le5。ru2guo3 ta1 xiang3yao4 fan2rong2 fa1zhan3，jiu4 xu1yao4 bei4 bao3hu4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 fang4 wo3 zi4you2，wo3 jiang1 qing1jin4 yu2sheng1 shou3hu4 ta1。"

msgid "I should be going."
msgstr ""
"我​该​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 gai1 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I should go."
msgstr ""
"我​该​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 gai1 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I should go. We can talk later."
msgstr ""
"我​该​走​了​。​回头​再聊​。\n"
"wo3 gai1 zou3 le5。hui2tou2 zai4 liao2。"

msgid "I should hope so."
msgstr ""
"我​想​应该​是​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ying1gai1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I should probably take a moment to talk more about Harrow. He's going to be "
"an important figure in this story."
msgstr ""
"我​也许​应该​多花点​时间​讲讲​哈罗​的​事​。​他​在​这个​故事​里​是​个​重要​人物​。\n"
"wo3 ye3xu3 ying1gai1 duo1 hua1 dian3 shi2jian1 jiang3 jiang3 ha1luo2 de5 shi4。ta1 zai4 zhe4ge5 gu4shi4 li3 shi4 ge4 zhong4yao4 ren2wu4。"

msgid ""
"I should probably tell you... I've tried to clean up before. Lotsa times.\n"
"\n"
"Never really worked out."
msgstr ""
"我​可能​得​先​跟​你​说​一声​……​我​以前​试​过​戒毒​。​试过​挺​多次​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从来​没成​过​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3neng2 de2 xian1 gen1 ni3 shuo1 yi1sheng1……wo3 yi3qian2 shi4 guo4 jie4du2。shi4 guo4 ting3 duo1ci4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"cong2lai2 mei2 cheng2 guo4。"

msgid ""
"I should say not. You seem like a good $(l.man), and I don't mean to insult you. But you know how cutthroat it is out there.\n"
"\n"
"Hans will have every advantage, even if I have to mortgage the house to provide it to him."
msgstr ""
"我​倒​不​这么​认为​。​你​看起来​是​个​好人​，​我​绝非​有意​冒犯​。​但​你​该​知道​外面​的​世界​有​多​残酷​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​汉斯​必须​占据​所有​优势​，​哪怕​我​倾家荡产​也​要​为​他​铺路​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dao3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。ni3 kan4qi3lai5 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2，wo3 jue2fei1 you3yi4 mao4fan4。dan4 ni3 gai1 zhi1dao4 wai4mian4 de5 shi4jie4 you3 duo1 can2ku4。\n"
"\n"
"han4si1 bi4xu1 zhan4ju4 suo3you3 you1shi4，na3pa4 wo3 qing1jia1dang4chan3 ye3 yao4 wei2 ta1 pu1lu4。"

msgid "I should've killed you when I had the chance."
msgstr ""
"我​就​应该​趁有​机会​的​时候​杀​了​你​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 ying1gai1 chen4 you3 ji1hui4 de5 shi2hou5 sha1 le5 ni3。"

msgid "I showed you what I did because I need you to understand."
msgstr ""
"我​向​你​展示​了​我​的​所作所为​，​因为​我​需要​你​理解​我​。\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 zhan3shi4 le5 wo3 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2，yin1wei4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 li3jie3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"I skimmed over enough to get the drift. Bad things are happening, I get it. "
"Let's move on."
msgstr ""
"我​粗略​看​了​一遍​，​知道​大概​意思​了​。​反正​就是​有​坏事​发生​呗​。​往下​说​吧​。\n"
"wo3 cu1lu:e4 kan4 le5 yi1bian4，zhi1dao4 da4gai4 yi4si5 le5。fan3zheng4 jiu4shi4 you3 huai4shi4 fa1sheng1 bei5。wang3 xia4 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I smelled it first, long ago, when I awakened from the long slumber.The stink of it choked me and I retched. \n"
"\n"
"Then I saw it - for as far as my eyes could see. Far, far to the horizon.\n"
"\n"
"Humanstone and metal. Glass and flickering lights. Sprawled across the Land, slicing into the sky. Lording over the green. Smothering the whole of the world. "
msgstr ""
"我​首先​闻到​了​，​很久以前​。​在​我​醒来​后​的​第一次​飞行​中​。​那股​臭味​呛得​我​几乎​喘​不过​气来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​我​看到​了​—​—​目力​所及​之处​，​远至​地平线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​人造石​与​金属​。​玻璃​与​闪烁​的​灯光​。​遍布​大地​，​割裂​天空​。​统治​着​绿色​。​笼罩​整个​世界​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shou3xian1 wen2dao4 le5，hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2。zai4 wo3 xing3lai2 hou4 de5 di4yi1ci4 fei1xing2 zhong4。na4 gu3 chou4wei4 qiang1 de2 wo3 ji1hu1 chuan3 bu4guo4 qi4 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 wo3 kan4dao4 le5——mu4li4 suo3 ji2 zhi1 chu3，yuan3 zhi4 di4ping2xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ren2 zao4 dan4 yu4 jin1shu3。bo1li5 yu4 shan3shuo4 de5 deng1guang1。bian4bu4 da4di4，ge1lie4 tian1kong1。tong3zhi4 zhao2 lu:4se4。long3zhao4 zheng3ge4 shi4jie4。"

msgid ""
"I smelled it first, long ago. On my first flight after I awoke. The stink of it choked me and I retched. \n"
"\n"
"Then I saw it - for as far as my eyes could see. Far, far to the horizon."
msgstr ""
"我​首先​闻到​了​，​很久以前​。​在​我​醒来​后​的​第一次​飞行​中​。​那股​臭味​呛得​我​几乎​喘​不过​气来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​我​看到​了​—​—​目力​所及​之处​，​远至​地平线​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shou3xian1 wen2dao4 le5，hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2。zai4 wo3 xing3lai2 hou4 de5 di4yi1ci4 fei1xing2 zhong4。na4 gu3 chou4wei4 qiang1 de2 wo3 ji1hu1 chuan3 bu4guo4 qi4 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 wo3 kan4dao4 le5——mu4li4 suo3 ji2 zhi1 chu3，yuan3 zhi4 di4ping2xian4。"

msgid ""
"I speak for the Kreuzbasar's ghoul population. The Krieger strain may have ravaged my body...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}It feebly paws at the gray, pustulent flesh that hangs from its bones.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...But I have retained my mind."
msgstr ""
"我​代表​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​食尸​鬼​族群​。​克里​格​菌株​已经​摧残​了​我​的​身体​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​它​无力​地用​爪子​挠​着​挂​在​骨头​上​的​灰白​化脓​的​肉块​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​但​我​还​保留​着​神智​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dai4biao3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 shi2 shi1 gui3 zu2qun2。ke4 li3 ge2 jun1 zhu1 yi3jing1 cui1can2 le5 wo3 de5 shen1ti3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wu2li4 de5 yong4 zhua3zi5 nao2 zhao2 gua4 zai4 gu3tou5 shang4 de5 hui1bai2 hua4nong2 de5 rou4 kuai4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……dan4 wo3 hai2 bao3liu2 zhao2 shen2zhi4。"

msgid "I spent so much time trying to forget. But... I can't. I shouldn't."
msgstr ""
"我​这么久​以来​一直​在​努力​忘记​。​但​……​我​做​不到​。​我​不该​忘​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4 ma2 jiu3 yi3lai2 yi1zhi2 zai4 nu3li4 wang4ji4。dan4……wo3 zuo4 bu4dao4。wo3 bu4gai1 wang4。"

msgid "I still can't believe that she's gone, boss. "
msgstr ""
"我​还是​不敢相信​她​已经​不​在​了​，​老大​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 ta1 yi3jing1 bu4 zai4 le5，lao3da4。"

msgid "I still can't believe that she's gone. "
msgstr ""
"我​还是​不敢相信​她​已经​不​在​了​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 ta1 yi3jing1 bu4 zai4 le5。"

msgid "I still don't see why--"
msgstr ""
"我​还是​不​明白​—​—\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 bu4 ming2bai5 — —"

msgid ""
"I still don't trust APEX. We just handed it a tremendous amount of power."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​不​相信​APEX​。​我们​刚刚​为​它​送​上​了​强大​无比​的​力量​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 bu4 xiang1xin4 APEX。wo3men5 gang1gang5 wei2 ta1 song4 shang4 le5 qiang2da4 wu2bi3 de5 li4liang5。"

msgid ""
"I still expect you to obey my orders, Eiger. When you run with me, I'm the "
"boss."
msgstr ""
"你​仍然​要​听​我​的​指挥​，​艾格尔​。​只要​我们​一起​行动​，​我​就是​老大​。\n"
"ni3 reng2ran2 yao4 ting1 wo3 de5 zhi3hui1，Ai4ge2er3。zhi3yao4 wo3men5 yi1qi3 xing2dong4，wo3 jiu4shi4 lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"I still feel that killing him was the right thing to do, though. And even if it weren't, I'd've done it anyway.\n"
"\n"
"What does that say about me?"
msgstr ""
"但​我​仍然​觉得​杀​了​他​是​正确​的​选择​。​即便​并非如此​，​我​也​已经​这么​做​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​说明​了​我​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 reng2ran2 jue2de5 sha1 le5 ta1 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2。ji2bian4 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3，wo3 ye3 yi3jing1 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shuo1ming2 le5 wo3 shen2me5？"

msgid "I still haven't completely ruled out the \"cut and run\" plan."
msgstr ""
"我​还​没有​完全​排除​“​临阵脱逃​”​的​想法​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 mei2you3 wan2quan2 pai2chu2“lin2zhen4tuo1tao2” de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid "I still need to talk to Ezkibel. I'll be back after I do."
msgstr ""
"我​还​得​和​埃兹​基​贝尔​谈谈​。​之后​我会​再​回来​的​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 de2 he4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 tan2tan2。zhi1hou4 wo3 hui4 zai4 hui2lai5 de5。"

msgid ""
"I still remember hiding in my room when my father had his Kreuzritter \"brothers\" over for prayer group.\n"
"\n"
"They would drink and get rowdy, then spend an hour or two riling themselves up with talk about \"heretics\" and \"the Devil's work.\" "
msgstr ""
"我​至今​仍​记得​，​每当​父亲​邀请​他​的​十字军​“​兄弟​们​”​来​参加​祷告​会时​，​我​总​躲​在​房间​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​先是​饮酒​喧哗​，​随后​花上​一两个​小时​，​用​“​异端​”​和​“​魔鬼​的​行径​”​之类​的​言论​煽动​彼此​的​情绪​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi4jin1 reng2 ji4de5，mei3dang1 fu4qin1 yao1qing3 ta1 de5 shi2zi4jun1“xiong1di4 men5” lai2 can1jia1 dao3gao4 hui4 shi2，wo3 zong3 duo3 zai4 fang2jian1 li3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 xian1 shi4 yin3jiu3 xuan1hua2，sui2hou4 hua1 shang4 yi1 liang3 ge4 xiao3shi2，yong4“yi4duan1” he4“mo2gui3 de5 xing2jing4” zhi1lei4 de5 yan2lun4 shan1dong4 bi3ci3 de5 qing2xu4。"

msgid ""
"I still say that all of this is crazy talk, chief. Taking on an AI isn't just a bad idea... it's *suicide.*\n"
"\n"
"So my vote is to cut and run."
msgstr ""
"我​依旧​认为​这​一切都是​瞎​扯淡​，​头儿​。​和​AI​作对​可​不仅仅​是​个​坏主意​……​这​简直​是​*​自杀​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我​建议​趁早​止损​跑​路​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1jiu4 ren4wei2 zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 xia1 che3dan4，tou2r5。he4 AI zuo4dui4 ke3 bu4jin3jin3 shi4 ge4 huai4 zhu3 yi4……zhe4 jian3zhi2 shi4*zi4sha1*。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 jian4yi4 chen4zao3 zhi3sun3 pao2 lu4。"

msgid ""
"I still wish that I could've put a bullet in Stahl's spine. But if the "
"fallout from tonight's run is as far-reaching as I think it's gonna be, he's"
" probably going to wind up wishing that he were dead, and that's almost as "
"satisfying."
msgstr ""
"我​依然​希望​当时​能​一枪​打断​斯塔尔​的​脊柱​。​但​如果​今晚​行动​的​影响​如​我​所料​那般​深远​，​他​最后​可能​会​觉得​自己​还​不如​死​了​更好​，​这​也​同样​能​让​我​心满意足​。\n"
"wo3 yi1ran2 xi1wang4 dang1shi2 neng2 yi1 qiang1 da3duan4 Si1ta3er3 de5 ji3zhu4。dan4 ru2guo3 jin1wan3 xing2dong4 de5 ying3xiang3 ru2 wo3 suo3liao4 na4 ban1 shen1yuan3，ta1 zui4hou4 ke3neng2 hui4 jue2de5 zi4ji3 hai2 bu4ru2 si3 le5 geng1 hao3，zhe4 ye3 tong2yang4 neng2 rang4 wo3 xin1man3yi4zu2。"

msgid ""
"I strongly suggest that you delete this, $(l.name). From what Müller told us, this information is dangerous.\n"
"\n"
"But if you're determined to know what it says, you could try the talismonger, Aljernon.\n"
"\n"
"I have no doubt that he can translate it for you."
msgstr ""
"我​强烈建议​你​删掉​这份​文件​，​$(l.name)​。​穆勒​和​我们​说​过​这些​信息​很​危险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​你​执意​要​知道​文件​的​内容​，​可以​去​问问​奇货​商人​阿尔杰​农​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​绝对​能​帮​你​翻译​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang4 lie4 jian4 yi4 ni3 shan1diao4 zhe4 fen4 wen2jian4，$(l.name)。mu4 lei1 he4 wo3men5 shuo1 guo4 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 hen3 wei1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 zhi2yi4 yao4 zhi1dao4 wen2jian4 de5 nei4rong2，ke3yi3 qu4 wen4 wen4 ji1 huo4 shang1ren2 E1er3jie2nong2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jue2dui4 neng2 bang1 ni3 fan1yi4 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"I stuck to my guns.\n"
"\n"
"After all, shredding my essence was the whole point."
msgstr ""
"我​坚持​了​自己​的​立场​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​我​想要​的​就是​撕碎​我​的​精华​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian1chi2 le5 zi4ji3 de5 li4chang3。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 wo3 xiang3yao4 de5 jiu4shi4 si1sui4 wo3 de5 jing1hua2。"

msgid "I suggest we all look for the Kreuzbasar label."
msgstr ""
"我​建议​我们​都​要​多​照顾​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​本地​商贩​。\n"
"wo3 jian4yi4 wo3men5 dou1 yao4 duo1 zhao4gu5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ben3di4 shang1fan4。"

msgid "I support your ideals."
msgstr ""
"我​支持​你​的​理念​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1chi2 ni3 de5 li3nian4。"

msgid ""
"I suppose because you've shown an interest, and because you haven't let me "
"push you away."
msgstr ""
"我​想​是因为​你​表现​出​了​兴趣​，​也​因为​你​没有​让​我​把​你​推开​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shi4 yin1 wei2 ni3 biao3xian4 chu1 le5 xing4qu4，ye3 yin1wei4 ni3 mei2you3 rang4 wo3 ba3 ni3 tui1kai1。"

msgid "I suppose that I'll take your word for it."
msgstr ""
"那​我​就​相信​你​说​的话​吧​。\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 xiang1xin4 ni3 shuo1 de5hua4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I suppose that it can wait. I'll let you get back to what you were doing."
msgstr ""
"这​事​可以​再​等等​。​你​先​把​手头​的​事情​忙​完​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ke3yi3 zai4 deng3deng3。ni3 xian1 ba3 shou3tou2 de5 shi4qing5 mang2 wan2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I suppose that it doesn't.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She grimaces as a sudden wave of heat washes over her.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on, you two. The spirit will be around here... somewhere."
msgstr ""
"当​我​没​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一阵​热浪袭来​，​她​不由得​皱​了​皱眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​出发​吧​。​精魂​就​在​附近​的​……​某个​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 mei2 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1zhen4 re4 lang4 xi2 lai2，ta1 bu4you2de5 zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 chu1fa1 ba1。jing1hun2 jiu4 zai4 fu4jin4 de5……mou3 ge4 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"I suppose that it's time to make a decision.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not gonna lie, fearless leader... I don't feel right about this. There's a living troll buried under all of that chrome.\n"
"\n"
"Putting him out of his misery would be the kindest course of action."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​做出​选择​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无畏​领袖​，​我​说句实话​……​我​对此​感到​不安​。​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​帮​他​解脱​才​是​最​仁慈​的​做法​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 zuo4chu1 xuan3ze2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4，wo3 shuo1 ju4 shi2 hua4……wo3 dui4 ci3 gan3dao4 bu4an1。pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"bang1 ta1 jie3tuo1 cai2 shi4 zui4 ren2ci2 de5 zuo4fa3。"

msgid ""
"I suppose that it's time to make a decision. We have two clients, and they both want this thing.\n"
"\n"
"But then, \"thing\" isn't the right word. There's a living troll buried under all of this chrome.\n"
"\n"
"Handing him over to either of them would be reprehensible."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​做出​选择​了​。​两名​客户​都​想要​同​一件​货物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​，​“​货物​”​一词​并​不​准确​。​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​把​他​交给​任何一方​都​是​罪过​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 zuo4chu1 xuan3ze2 le5。liang3 ming2 ke4hu4 dou1 xiang3yao4 tong2 yi1 jian4 huo4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3，“huo4wu4” yi1 ci2 bing4 bu4 zhun3que4。pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 ren4 he2 yi1 fang1 dou1 shi4 zui4guo5。"

msgid ""
"I suppose that it's time to make a decision. We have two clients, and they both want this thing.\n"
"\n"
"The professional thing to do would be to give it to Herr Schmidt. He hired us for a reason... we should load it into his van and wash our hands of it."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​做出​选择​了​。​两名​客户​都​想要​同​一件​货物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​按照​行规​，​应该​交给​施密特​先生​，​毕竟​他​不是​白雇​我们​的​……​把​这​东西​装进​他​的​车里​，​就此​了结​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 zuo4chu1 xuan3ze2 le5。liang3 ming2 ke4hu4 dou1 xiang3yao4 tong2 yi1 jian4 huo4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"an4zhao4 xing2 gui1，ying1gai1 jiao1gei3 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5，bi4jing4 ta1 bu4shi4 bai2 gu4 wo3men5 de5……ba3 zhe4 dong1xi1 zhuang1 jin4 ta1 de5 che1 li3，jiu4ci3 liao3jie2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I suppose that we are asking you for a leap of faith.\n"
"\n"
"That leap will be well-rewarded, of course. Just imagine the good that you could do with the money that we're offering you. You could make a real difference in the lives of the people of this Kreuzbasar, if you felt so inclined."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​在​要求​你​迈出​这​信任​的​一步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​你​也​必将​获得​丰厚​的​回报​。​试想​一下​，​你​用​我们​提供​的​资金​能​创造​多少​善举​。​若​你​愿意​，​完全​可以​为​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​居民​们​带来​切实​的​改变​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 zai4 yao1qiu2 ni3 mai4chu1 zhe4 xin4ren4 de5 yi1 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，ni3 ye3 bi4jiang1 huo4de2 feng1hou4 de5 hui2bao4。shi4xiang3 yi1xia4，ni3 yong4 wo3men5 ti2gong1 de5 zi1jin1 neng2 chuang4zao4 duo1shao3 shan4ju3。ruo4 ni3 yuan4yi4，wan2quan2 ke3yi3 wei2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ju1min2 men5 dai4lai2 qie4shi2 de5 gai3bian4。"

msgid "I suppose that's true. Okay, keep going... what was the second thing?"
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。​那​你​继续​说​吧​……​第二件​事是​什么​？\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。na4 ni3 ji4xu4 shuo1 ba1……di4 er4 jian4 shi4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"I suppose, given the time an' trouble I took puttin 'er back togther, that I'd be willin' to part with 'er for, oh, say...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Schrotty's eyes dart over your gear, a calculated expression on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...'bout 500 nuyen?"
msgstr ""
"这个​嘛​，​考虑​到​我​修好​它费​了​不少​工夫​，​你​就​给​个​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​施罗蒂​上下​打量​着​你​的​装备​，​一脸​精打细算​的​样子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​500​新円​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 ma5，kao3lu:4 dao4 wo3 xiu1hao3 ta1 fei4 le5 bu4shao3 gong1fu1，ni3 jiu4 gei3 ge4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3 de5 zhuang1bei4，yi1 lian3 jing1da3xi4suan4 de5 yang4zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……500 xin1 yuan2 ba1？"

msgid "I suspect that it would have. We jacked her out in time to prevent it."
msgstr ""
"我​估计​本来​会​是​这样​，​不过​我们​及时​把​她​弹出​了​，​所以​没​到​这个​程度​。\n"
"wo3 gu1ji4 ben3lai2 hui4 shi4 zhe4yang4，bu4guo4 wo3men5 ji2shi2 ba3 ta1 tan2chu1 le5，suo3yi3 mei2 dao4 zhe4ge5 cheng2du4。"

msgid ""
"I take it back. If she did that to you, you have every reason to be upset."
msgstr ""
"我​收回​刚才​的话​。​如果​她​真​对​你​做​了​那些​事​，​你​完全​有​理由​发怒​。\n"
"wo3 shou1hui2 gang1cai2 de5hua4。ru2guo3 ta1 zhen1 dui4 ni3 zuo4 le5 na4xie1 shi4，ni3 wan2quan2 you3 li3you2 fa1nu4。"

msgid "I take it that his father... your brother... is a Humanis member, too?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​意思​是​，​他​的​父亲​……​也​就是​你​兄弟​……​也​是​个​人类​至上​主义者​？\n"
"ni3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，ta1 de5 fu4qin1……ye3 jiu4shi4 ni3 xiong1di4……ye3 shi4 ge4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3？"

msgid "I take it that's where the Azzie facility is?"
msgstr ""
"阿兹佬​的​设施​在​那里​吗​？\n"
"e1 zi1 lao3 de5 she4shi1 zai4 na4li5 ma5？"

msgid "I take it they're dangerous, then."
msgstr ""
"看来​他们​挺​危险​的​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ta1men5 ting3 wei1xian3 de5。"

msgid "I take it you're on my \"maintenance crew.\""
msgstr ""
"我​猜​你​是​我​的​“​检修​小队​”​成员​吧​。\n"
"wo3 cai1 ni3 shi4 wo3 de5“jian3xiu1 xiao3 dui4” cheng2yuan2 ba1。"

msgid "I take my gratitude in nuyen, bud."
msgstr ""
"那​就​用​新円谢​我​吧​，​老兄​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 yong4 xin1 yuan2 xie4 wo3 ba1，lao3xiong1。"

msgid ""
"I take nothing at face value. It is one of the secrets of my longevity. \n"
"\n"
"History is the version of past events that people have decided to agree upon. Truth is something else..."
msgstr ""
"我​从不​轻信​表面现象​。​这​是​我​长寿​的​秘诀​之一​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​历史​不过​是​人们​共同​认可​的​过去​事件​的​某个​版本​。​真相​则​是​另一回事​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2bu4 qing1xin4 biao3 mian4 xian4 xiang4。zhe4 shi4 wo3 chang2shou4 de5 mi4jue2 zhi1yi1。\n"
"\n"
"li4shi3 bu4guo4 shi4 ren2men5 gong4tong2 ren4ke3 de5 guo4qu4 shi4jian4 de5 mou3 ge4 ban3ben3。zhen1xiang4 ze2 shi4 ling4 yi1 hui2 shi4……"

msgid "I thank you for saying so. I trust there were no difficulties?"
msgstr ""
"感谢​你​这么​说​。​希望​你​没有​遇到困难​吧​？\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1。xi1wang4 ni3 mei2you3 yu4 dao4 kun4 nan2 ba1？"

msgid "I think $(l.he)’s gone bye-bye."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​$(l.he)​灵魂​出窍​了​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 $(l.he) ling2hun2 chu1 qiao4 le5。"

msgid "I think I hit a nerve."
msgstr ""
"看来​我​戳​到​痛处​了​。\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3 chuo1 dao4 tong4chu4 le5。"

msgid "I think I know everything that I need to. Let's get moving."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​已经​知道​了​需要​知道​的​一切​。​我们​走​吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 le5 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 de5 yi1qie4。wo3men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I think I must have misheard you.\n"
"\n"
"For a second there, it sounded like you were thinking of stabbing our client in the back for some extra nuyen."
msgstr ""
"我​没​听错​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​那么​一瞬间​，​听​起来​像是​你​为了​多​赚点​新円​，​打算​在​背后​捅​客户​一刀​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1cuo4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"you3 na4me5 yi1shun4jian1，ting1 qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 ni3 wei4le5 duo1 zhuan4 dian3 xin1 yuan2，da3suan4 zai4 bei4hou4 tong3 ke4hu4 yi1 dao1。"

msgid ""
"I think I understand. All right, you've got a deal. But you'd better not "
"hijack anything from the Kreuzbasar again. From now on, we stay out of each "
"other's way."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​你​的​意思​了​。​行​吧​，​这事​就​到此为止​。​但​你们​最好​别​再​从​克洛伊​茨​集市​劫走​任何​东西​。​从现在起​，​我们​井水不犯河水​。\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 de5 yi4si5 le5。xing2 ba1，zhe4 shi4 jiu4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3。dan4 ni3men5 zui4hao3 bie4 zai4 cong2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jie2 zou3 ren4he2 dong1xi1。cong2 xian4 zai4 qi3，wo3men5 jing3shui3bu4fan4he2shui3。"

msgid "I think I'd like that."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​愿意​这么​做​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 yuan4yi4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid "I think I'd rather just delete you and call it a day."
msgstr ""
"我​宁可​直接​删除​你​，​一了百了​。\n"
"wo3 ning4ke3 zhi2jie1 shan1chu2 ni3，yi1liao3bai3liao3。"

msgid ""
"I think I'd still rather kill you, but don't worry - I'll kill him, too."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​更想​杀​了​你​，​不过​别​担心​—​—​我​也​会​杀​了​他​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 geng1 xiang3 sha1 le5 ni3，bu4guo4 bie4 dan1xin1——wo3 ye3 hui4 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid "I think I'll hold onto it for now."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​先​拿​着​它​吧​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 xian1 na2 zhao2 ta1 ba1。"

msgid "I think I'll step back and let the \"she-troll\" respond to that."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​我​可以​暂且​退​下​，​让​这位​“​女​巨魔​”​来​答复​你​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3 ke3yi3 zan4qie3 tui4 xia4，rang4 zhe4wei4“nu:3 ju4mo2” lai2 da2fu4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I think I'm gonna call in Schäfer for this job. She's got the skills to bypass whatever security they're running out there, and she's gullible enough to take the job in the first place.\n"
"\n"
"I'll feed her some line about Flux State security, and she'll eat it up with a spoon."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我会​找​舍费尔​来​做​这件​事​。​她​有​足够​的​能力​绕过​安全​系统​，​而且​她​很​好​糊弄​，​让​她​接受​这份​工作​并​不​费劲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​给​她​一些​关于​动荡​带​安全​系统​的​信息​，​而​她​肯定​会​趋之若鹜​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 hui4 zhao3 she3 fei4 er3 lai2 zuo4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。ta1 you3 zu2gou4 de5 neng2li4 rao4guo4 an1quan2 xi4tong3，er2qie3 ta1 hen3 hao3 hu4nong5，rang4 ta1 jie1shou4 zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4 bing4 bu4 fei4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 gei3 ta1 yi1xie1 guan1yu2 dong4dang4 dai4 an1quan2 xi4tong3 de5 xin4xi1，er2 ta1 ken3ding4 hui4 qu1zhi1ruo4wu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I think I'm the sort who can appreciate it. Tell me about the Turkish "
"coffee. "
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​是​那种​能够​欣赏​它​的​人​。​和​我​讲讲​土耳其​咖啡吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 shi4 na4zhong3 neng2gou4 xin1shang3 ta1 de5 ren2。he4 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 tu3er3qi2 ka1 fei1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I think I've read about this \"Billy.\" He was Sutterlin's albino basilisk, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​听说​过​“​比利​”​。​他​是​苏​特林​的​白化​蛇怪​，​对​吧​？\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 ting1shuo1 guo4“bi3li4”。ta1 shi4 su1 te4 lin2 de5 bai2 hua4 she2 guai4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"I think he's saying that he'll protect you. You'll need to get your people "
"out of the city, though."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​他​是​说​他​会​保护​你​。​但​你​得​让​你​的​亲人​一块​离开​这座​城市​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ta1 shi4 shuo1 ta1 hui4 bao3hu4 ni3。dan4 ni3 de2 rang4 ni3 de5 qin1ren2 yi1kuai4 li2kai1 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4。"

msgid ""
"I think it goes deeper than that. According to Winters' DVD, Vauclair designed the experimental weapon that shot her down. And that weapon split her body from her essence.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory glances down at her own steel-and-chrome arms, and suppresses a shudder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If I had to guess, I'd say that she's trying to make him fix whatever he did to her. That's what makes sense to me."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​没​那么​简单​。​根据​温特斯​的​DVD​，​沃​克莱尔​设计​出​的​实验性​武器​将​火翼​击落​，​而​那​把​武器​使​她​的​肉体​与​精华​分离​开来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​低头​看​了​看​自己​钢铁​与​镀铬​的​手臂​，​强压​下​一阵​战栗​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​我​说​，​火翼​应该​是​想​让​他​弥补​自己​对​她​造成​的​伤害​。​我​觉得​这才​合理​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 mei2 na4me5 jian3dan1。gen1ju4 Wen1te4si1 de5 DVD，Wo4ke4lai2er3 she4ji4 chu1 de5 shi2 yan4 xing4 wu3qi4 jiang1 Huo3yi4 ji1luo4，er2 na4 ba3 wu3qi4 shi3 ta1 de5 rou4ti3 yu4 jing1hua2 fen1li2 kai1 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 di1tou2 kan4 le5 kan4 zi4ji3 gang1tie3 yu4 du4 ge4 de5 shou3bi4，jiang4 ya1 xia4 yi1zhen4 zhan4li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4 wo3 shuo1，Huo3yi4 ying1gai1 shi4 xiang3 rang4 ta1 mi2bu3 zi4ji3 dui4 ta1 zao4cheng2 de5 shang1hai4。wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 cai2 he2li3。"

msgid ""
"I think it's a possibility. With Monika gone, there's no one to keep that "
"boy in line. And might just be that he's grown paranoid that he's losing his"
" consumer base. (h)"
msgstr ""
"有​这种​可能​。​莫妮卡​死后​，​再​没人能​管住​那小子​了​。​说不定​他​已经​变得​疑神疑鬼​，​担心​自己​正在​失去​消费​群体​呢​。\n"
"you3 zhe4zhong3 ke3neng2。Mo4ni1ka3 si3hou4，zai4 mei2 ren2 neng2 guan3zhu4 na4 xiao3 zi3 le5。shuo1bu5ding4 ta1 yi3jing1 bian4de5 yi2shen2yi2gui3，dan1xin1 zi4ji3 zheng4zai4 shi1qu4 xiao1fei4 qun2ti3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"I think it's a shame your guys didn't search us for weapons, Quorin. "
"{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"奎林​，​你​的​人​没有​搜去​我们​的​武器​真是​个​错误​。​{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"kui2 lin2，ni3 de5 ren2 mei2you3 sou1 qu4 wo3men5 de5 wu3qi4 zhen1shi5 ge4 cuo4wu4。{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I think it's pretty obvious, right? We did what we did, and a year later, "
"everything is going to shit."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​这​很​明显​吧​？​我们​做​了​那些​事情​，​紧接着​过​了​一年​之后​，​一切​都​要​完蛋​了​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 hen3 ming2xian3 ba1？wo3men5 zuo4 le5 na4xie1 shi4qing5，jin3jie1zhe5 guo4 le5 yi1 nian2 zhi1hou4，yi1qie4 dou1 yao4 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think most are still in shock. But just you wait. That'll pass, and then "
"the panic sets in."
msgstr ""
"我​想​大多数​人​都​还​惊魂未定​。​但​你​看着​吧​，​等​这​一切​过去​，​然后​恐慌​就​会​来临​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 da4duo1shu4 ren2 dou1 hai2 jing1 hun2 wei4 ding4。dan4 ni3 kan4 zhao2 ba1，deng3 zhe4 yi1qie4 guo4qu4，ran2hou4 kong3huang1 jiu4 hui4 lai2lin2。"

msgid ""
"I think so! But then again, I really like talking to people, so it's just fun for me.\n"
"\n"
"Both me and Altuğ do, so although I may be his ears and hands, he's got plenty enough of a voice on his own."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​这么​想​的​！​不过​话说回来​，​我​真的​很​喜欢​和​人​聊天​，​所以​对​我​来说​这​只是​件​有趣​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​奥图​伊​都​喜欢​这样​，​所以​虽然​我​也许​是​他​的​耳目​，​但​他​自己​的​嗓门​也​很大​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5！bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，wo3 zhen1de5 hen3 xi3huan5 he4 ren2 liao2tian1，suo3yi3 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 zhe4 zhi3shi4 jian4 you3qu4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 dou1 xi3huan5 zhe4yang4，suo3yi3 sui1ran2 wo3 ye3xu3 shi4 ta1 de5 er3mu4，dan4 ta1 zi4ji3 de5 sang3men2 ye3 hen3 dai4。"

msgid ""
"I think so. Good thing, too - getting this thing removed would be a real "
"pain."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​也​是​。​这样​挺​好​的​，​不然​要​把​它​从​我​脸上​弄掉​的话​就​太​麻烦​了​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ye3 shi4。zhe4yang4 ting3 hao3 de5，bu4ran2 yao4 ba3 ta1 cong2 wo3 lian3 shang4 long4 diao4 de5hua4 jiu4 tai4 ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think so. I didn't look at it long - it was in a room that I wasn't "
"supposed to be in. But I'm pretty sure that it was you."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​应该​是​。​我​当时​没​仔细​看​太久​—​—​它​在​一个​我​不该​去​的​房间​里​。​但​我​很​确定​那​就是​你​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ying1gai1 shi4。wo3 dang1shi2 mei2 zi3xi4 kan4 tai4 jiu3——ta1 zai4 yi1ge5 wo3 bu4gai1 qu4 de5 fang2jian1 li3。dan4 wo3 hen3 que4ding4 na4 jiu4shi4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I think so. I hope so.\n"
"\n"
"We saved a lot of kids from Harrow, but he could still do a lot of damage before I find him again.\n"
"\n"
"One thing that I do know... I *will* find him. And when I do, I'm going to finish this."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​希望​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​从​哈罗​手下​救出​了​许多​孩子​，​但​在​我​再次​找到​他​之前​，​他​可能​还会​做出​许多​伤天害理​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​现在​只​知道​一件​事​……​我​*​一定​*​会​找到​他​。​到时候​，​我会​彻底​做个​了​断​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。xi1wang4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 cong2 ha1luo2 shou3xia4 jiu4chu1 le5 xu3duo1 hai2zi5，dan4 zai4 wo3 zai4ci4 zhao3dao4 ta1 zhi1qian2，ta1 ke3neng2 hai2 hui4 zuo4chu1 xu3duo1 shang1tian1hai4li3 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 zhi3 zhi1dao4 yi1 jian4 shi4……wo3*yi1ding4*hui4 zhao3dao4 ta1。dao4shi2hou4，wo3 hui4 che4di3 zuo4 ge4 le5 duan4。"

msgid ""
"I think so. The world’s complicated enough. One less group of players "
"simplifies it a bit."
msgstr ""
"会​吧​。​世界​已经​够​复杂​的​了​，​少​一方​势力​能​让​事情​简单​点​。\n"
"hui4 ba1。shi4jie4 yi3jing1 gou4 fu4za2 de5 le5，shao3 yi1fang1 shi4li5 neng2 rang4 shi4qing5 jian3dan1 dian3。"

msgid ""
"I think something happened then... something surprising, even to Schinderhannes. \n"
"\n"
"I think because of this, perhaps, he *became* the hero people wanted him to be. \n"
"\n"
"Maybe he did start stealing from the rich and giving to the poor. I don't know. The history books are... confusing, to say the least."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​之后​发生​了​什么​事​……​让​辛德​汉内斯​都​感到​惊讶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​大概​就是​因为​这个​，​他​才​*​成为​*​了​人们​希望​他​成为​的​英雄​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​他​是​开始​劫富济贫​了​。​谁​知道​呢​。​历史​书上​的​描述​……​只能​说​过于​语焉不详​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 zhi1hou4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4……rang4 xin1 de2 han4 nei4 si1 dou1 gan3dao4 jing1ya4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 da4gai4 jiu4shi4 yin1wei4 zhe4ge5，ta1 cai2*cheng2wei2*le5 ren2men5 xi1wang4 ta1 cheng2wei2 de5 ying1xiong2。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1 shi4 kai1shi3 jie2fu4ji4pin2 le5。shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2。li4shi3 shu1 shang4 de5 miao2shu4……zhi3neng2 shuo1 guo4yu2 yu3yan1bu4xiang2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think that Grinder has gotten tired of competing against the Landenberg "
"Ring. And I think that he and Plotz are planning a merger."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​“​绞肉机​”​已经​厌倦​了​与​兰​登堡​帮​一直​斗争​下去​。​而且​我​认为​他​和​普​洛茨​正在​计划​合并​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5“jiao3rou4ji1” yi3jing1 yan4juan4 le5 yu4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 yi1zhi2 dou4zheng1 xia4qu4。er2qie3 wo3 ren4wei2 ta1 he4 Pu3luo4ci2 zheng4zai4 ji4hua4 he2bing4。"

msgid ""
"I think that Harrow is getting lazy.\n"
"\n"
"He used to have a very strict, very clever routine, and he'd stick to it. I watched him walk at least a dozen initiates through it, and it worked every time."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​哈罗​变得​懒惰​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​他​有​一套​严密​的​洗脑​流程​，​环环相扣​。​我​亲眼目睹​他​至少​用​这套​方法​驯化​了​十几个​学徒​，​屡试不爽​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ha1luo2 bian4de5 lan3duo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 ta1 you3 yi1tao4 yan2mi4 de5 xi3nao3 liu2cheng2，huan2huan2xiang1kou4。wo3 qin1yan3mu4du3 ta1 zhi4shao3 yong4 zhe4 tao4 fang1fa3 xun4hua4 le5 shi2 ji1 ge4 xue2tu2，lu:3shi4bu4shuang3。"

msgid ""
"I think that I can get you out of there, but I'm gonna have to deal with "
"this decker first."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​我能​把​你​弄出去​，​但​我​得​先​解决​那个​碟客​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3 neng2 ba3 ni3 long4 chu1 qu4，dan4 wo3 de2 xian1 jie3jue2 na4ge5 die2 ke4。"

msgid "I think that I have a solution to your problem."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​有​办法​解决​你们​的​问题​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 you3 ban4fa3 jie3jue2 ni3men5 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"I think that I know what Harrow has planned for you. Have you ever opened "
"the fridge in the other room?"
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​知道​哈罗​对​你们​有​什么​安排​。​你​打开​过​隔壁​房间​的​冰箱​吗​？\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 zhi1dao4 ha1luo2 dui4 ni3men5 you3 shen2me5 an1pai2。ni3 da3kai1 guo4 ge2bi4 fang2jian1 de5 bing1xiang1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I think that I've heard all that I need to about Billy. Just tell me how to "
"get into the Executive Wing."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我​已经​听够​了​关于​比利​的​一切​。​告诉​我​如何​进入​行政部​吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 yi3jing1 ting1 gou4 le5 guan1yu2 bi3li4 de5 yi1qie4。gao4su4 wo3 ru2he2 jin4ru4 xing2 zheng4 bu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I think that Panacea is a sort of a delivery system for Doom. It's a virus... airborne and highly infectious. And it can produce Doom antibodies on command. But the radioactive payload that they carry is... stable, somehow. Dormant.\n"
"\n"
"The magical research ties it all together. I don't think that any of this would work at all if magic weren't involved."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​“​万能​药​”​算是​某种​传播​“​末日​”​的​载体​。​它​是​一种​病毒​……​通过​空气​传播​且​极具​传染性​。​它​能够​按​需​产生​末日​抗体​。​但​它们​携带​的​放射性​载荷​……​不知​为何​保持稳定​。​处于​休眠状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​魔法​研究​将​这​一切​串联​起来​。​如果​没有​魔法​的​参与​，​我​认为​这​一切​都​无法​实现​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2“wan4neng2 yao4” suan4shi4 mou3zhong3 chuan2bo1“mo4ri4” de5 zai4ti3。ta1 shi4 yi1zhong3 bing4du2……tong1guo4 kong1qi4 chuan2bo1 qie3 ji2 ju4 chuan2ran3xing4。ta1 neng2gou4 an4 xu1 chan3sheng1 mo4ri4 kang4ti3。dan4 ta1men5 xie2dai4 de5 fang4she4xing4 zai4he4……bu4zhi1 wei4he2 bao3 chi2 wen3 ding4。chu3yu2 xiu1 mian2 zhuang4 tai4。\n"
"\n"
"mo2fa3 yan2jiu1 jiang1 zhe4 yi1qie4 chuan4lian2 qi3lai5。ru2guo3 mei2you3 mo2fa3 de5 can1yu4，wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 wu2fa3 shi2xian4。"

msgid ""
"I think that betraying our employer would be a mistake.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever your contact is offering us, it can't be worth the hit that our reputation would take if people learned that we betrayed our employer."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​背叛​雇主​是​不​对​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​你​的​联络人​承诺​我们​什么​，​都​弥补​不了​背叛​雇主​带来​的​坏名声​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 bei4pan4 gu4zhu3 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 de5 lian2luo4ren2 cheng2nuo4 wo3men5 shen2me5，dou1 mi2bu3 bu4le5 bei4pan4 gu4zhu3 dai4lai2 de5 huai4 ming2 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"I think that he was trying to proposition me, in his clumsy way. Poking me in front of the other recruits to try to provoke a reaction.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, he got one. I broke three of his ribs, and the name stuck."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​他​是​在​用​笨拙​的​方式​向​我​搭讪​，​想​在​别的​新兵​面前​故意​激​我​做出​回应​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管怎么​说​吧​，​他​确实​得到​了​回应​。​我​打断​了​他​的​三​根肋骨​，​之后​这个​绰号​就​跟​我​分不开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ta1 shi4 zai4 yong4 ben4zhuo1 de5 fang1shi4 xiang4 wo3 da1shan4，xiang3 zai4 bie2de5 xin1bing1 mian4qian2 gu4yi4 ji1 wo3 zuo4chu1 hui2ying4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 guan3 zen3 ma2 shuo1 ba1，ta1 que4shi2 de2dao4 le5 hui2ying4。wo3 da3duan4 le5 ta1 de5 san1 gen1 lei4 gu3，zhi1hou4 zhe4ge5 chuo4hao4 jiu4 gen1 wo3 fen4 bu4 kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think that if we purify the spirit, Feuerstelle will die. We'll save all "
"of the kids, and the nightmare will end."
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​净化​了​精魂​，​“​火坑​”​便会​随之​消亡​。​我们​会​救出​所有​的​孩子​，​这场​噩梦​也​将​结束​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 jing4hua4 le5 jing1hun2，“huo3keng1” bian4 hui4 sui2zhi1 xiao1wang2。wo3men5 hui4 jiu4chu1 suo3you3 de5 hai2zi5，zhe4 chang2 e4meng4 ye3 jiang1 jie2shu4。"

msgid "I think that it would have if we hadn't jacked her out on time."
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​没有​及时​弹出​她​的话​，​恐怕​就​会​是​这样​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 mei2you3 ji2shi2 tan2chu1 ta1 de5hua4，kong3pa4 jiu4 hui4 shi4 zhe4yang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think that there's something else going on here. I think that we've all "
"been set up."
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​这​背后​另有隐情​。​我​觉得​是​我们​所有人​都​被​陷害​了​。\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 zhe4 bei4hou4 ling4 you3 yin4 qing2。wo3 jue2de5 shi4 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 bei4 xian4hai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think that this is a mistake, $(l.name). But as the leader of this team, it's yours to make.\n"
"\n"
"I'll back you. We all will. I just hope that we don't wind up regretting it."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​你​想​错​了​，​$(l.name)​。​但​作为​队长​，​无论​对错​都​该​由​你​来​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​支持​你​，​我们​都​会​，​只​希望​你别​让​我们​后悔​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 xiang3 cuo4 le5，$(l.name)。dan4 zuo4wei2 dui4zhang3，wu2lun4 dui4 cuo4 dou1 gai1 you2 ni3 lai2 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 zhi1chi2 ni3，wo3men5 dou1 hui4，zhi3 xi1wang4 ni3 bie4 rang4 wo3men5 hou4hui3。"

msgid "I think that we got off on the wrong foot here."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我们​一​开始​就​搞​误会​了​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 yi1 kai1shi3 jiu4 gao3 wu4hui4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think that we have reached the end of the information I have for you "
"today. "
msgstr ""
"我​想​今天​我能​告诉​你​的​信息​就​只有​这么​多​了​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 jin1tian1 wo3 neng2 gao4su4 ni3 de5 xin4xi1 jiu4 zhi3you3 zhe4me5 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think that we made a mistake. Not just now, but back when we set that thing free in the first place. And I'm nervous to see what the future's gonna hold.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, boss. Let's get the hell out of here.\n"
"\n"
"I want to go home."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​我们​犯​了​个​错误​。​不仅​是​现在​，​而是​从​当初​放走​那​东西​开始​就是​个​错误​。​想到​未来​会​怎样​，​我​就​紧张​得​要命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​了​老大​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​回家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 fan4 le5 ge4 cuo4wu4。bu4jin3 shi4 xian4zai4，er2shi4 cong2 dang1chu1 fang4zou3 na4 dong1xi1 kai1shi3 jiu4shi4 ge4 cuo4wu4。xiang3dao4 wei4lai2 hui4 zen3yang4，wo3 jiu4 jin3zhang1 de2 yao4ming4。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 le5 lao3da4，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 hui2jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think that we should have given Thorvald a chance to prove his claims. Waiting a few minutes to kill him wouldn't have harmed anything.\n"
"\n"
"That said, I understand why you did what you did. The job was to kill him - we all knew that when we signed on."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​我们​本该​给​托​瓦尔德​一个​机会​来​证明​他​的​说法​。​多​等​几分钟​再​杀​了​他​也​无伤大雅​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​话虽如此​，​我​理解​你​为何​那样​做​。​那趟​差事​的​目标​就是​杀​了​他​—​—​我们​接下​任务​时​都​心知肚明​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 ben3 gai1 gei3 tuo1 wa3er3de2 yi1ge5 ji1hui4 lai2 zheng4ming2 ta1 de5 shuo1fa3。duo1 deng3 ji1 fen4 zhong1 zai4 sha1 le5 ta1 ye3 wu2shang1da4ya3。\n"
"\n"
"hua4sui1ru2ci3，wo3 li3jie3 ni3 wei4he2 na4yang4 zuo4。na4 tang1 cha4shi4 de5 mu4biao1 jiu4shi4 sha1 le5 ta1——wo3men5 jie1xia4 ren4wu5 shi2 dou1 xin1zhi1du4ming2。"

msgid ""
"I think that we should hear her out. Something strange is happening here."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​我们​应该​听​她​说完​。​现在​的​情况​有点​奇怪​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 ying1gai1 ting1 ta1 shuo1 wan2。xian4zai4 de5 qing2kuang4 you3dian3 qi2guai4。"

msgid "I think that we should talk about what APEX said."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​我们​应该​讨论一下​APEX​所说​的话​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 ying1gai1 tao3 lun2 yi1 xia4 APEX suo3 shuo1 de5hua4。"

msgid "I think that we're about to find out."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我们​很快​就​会​知道​答案​了​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 zhi1dao4 da2an4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think that we're wasting time talking about this, chief. Who cares what this drek is supposed to do?\n"
"\n"
"As long as we stop it, that's all that matters in the end."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​我们​在​这件​事上​浪费时间​了​，​头儿​。​谁​在乎​这破​玩意儿​有​什么​用​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​我们​能​阻止​它​，​这才​是​最​重要​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1 le5，tou2r5。shei2 zai4hu5 zhe4 po4 wan2yi4r5 you3 shen2me5 yong4？\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 wo3men5 neng2 zu3zhi3 ta1，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I think that we've gotten everything from the book that we're going to."
msgstr ""
"我​还​以为​我们​已经​从​那本书​里​得到​了​所有​我们​需要​知道​的​东西​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 wo3men5 yi3jing1 cong2 na4 ben3 shu1 li3 de2dao4 le5 suo3you3 wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"I think that when Harrow started using his shrine, he handed the spirit trapped inside of it the keys to the kingdom.\n"
"\n"
"The bastard might think that he's in charge here, but he isn't - not anymore. He's a servant, just like everybody else. The only difference is that he doesn't know it."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​当​哈罗​开始​使用​神龛​时​，​他​就​把​这个​小​王国​的​钥匙​亲自​交到​了​那困​在​神龛​之内​的​精魂​的​手中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​混蛋​可能​以为​他​仍然​掌控​着​这里​，​但​事实​已​并非如此​。​他​只是​个​仆人​，​和​其他人​一样​。​唯一​的​不同​是​他​还​没​意识​到​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 dang1 ha1luo2 kai1shi3 shi3yong4 shen2kan1 shi2，ta1 jiu4 ba3 zhe4ge5 xiao3 wang2guo2 de5 yao4shi5 qin1zi4 jiao1 dao4 le5 na4 kun4 zai4 shen2kan1 zhi1nei4 de5 jing1hun2 de5 shou3 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 hun2dan4 ke3neng2 yi3wei2 ta1 reng2ran2 zhang3kong4 zhao2 zhe4li3，dan4 shi4shi2 yi3 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。ta1 zhi3shi4 ge4 pu2ren2，he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4。wei2yi1 de5 bu4tong2 shi4 ta1 hai2 mei2 yi4shi2 dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"I think that you saw what needed to be done, and that you did it. Despite "
"the fact that it meant killing a fellow soldier."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​想​清楚​了​该​做​的​事​，​并且​也​动手做​了​，​即使​这​意味着​杀死​自己​的​一位​同僚​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 xiang3 qing1chu5 le5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4，bing4qie3 ye3 dong4 shou3 zuo4 le5，ji2shi3 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 sha1si3 zi4ji3 de5 yi1 wei4 tong2liao2。"

msgid ""
"I think that you should go after her. She's clearly in over her head... what"
" if she needs you?"
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​应该​去​找​她​。​很​明显​她​已经​力不从心​了​……​万一​她​需要​你​呢​？\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 ying1gai1 qu4 zhao3 ta1。hen3 ming2xian3 ta1 yi3jing1 li4bu4cong2xin1 le5……wan4yi1 ta1 xu1yao4 ni3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"I think that you should take him up on it, boss. It was a stroke of luck "
"that we found this guy, and the team still needs a decker."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​我​觉得​你​是​该​答应​他​。​我们​碰上​这​家伙​也​算是​走​了​好运​，​而且​队里​还是​用得上​碟客​的​。\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 jue2de5 ni3 shi4 gai1 da1ying5 ta1。wo3men5 peng4shang4 zhe4 jia1huo5 ye3 suan4shi4 zou3 le5 hao3yun4，er2qie3 dui4 li3 hai2shi5 yong4de5shang4 die2 ke4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I think that you'd better get the hell out of my kiez. I don't want to see "
"you again, do you hear me?"
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​最好​滚​出​我们​这片​街区​。​我​不想​再​看到​你​，​听懂​了​没​？\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 zui4hao3 gun3 chu1 wo3men5 zhe4 pian1 jie1qu1。wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 kan4dao4 ni3，ting1dong3 le5 mei2？"

msgid ""
"I think that you're a liar and a troll-lover. I think that you've come here with hostile intent.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Stahl's mouth twists into an ugly smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And I think that makes you a special kind of fool."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​你​就是​个​喜欢​搬弄是非​的​骗子​，​想带​着​敌意​来​挑拨​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​斯塔尔​的​嘴角​歪起​一抹​狰狞​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真是​个​纯种​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 jiu4shi4 ge4 xi3huan5 ban1nong4shi4fei1 de5 pian4zi5，xiang3 dai4 zhao2 di2yi4 lai2 tiao3bo1 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Si1ta3er3 de5 zui3jiao3 wai1 qi3 yi1 ma1 zheng1ning2 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 chun2zhong3 sha3gua1。"

msgid ""
"I think that you're both right, in a way. I think when Marta traveled here, "
"she saw her interpretation of the Adversary's domain. Now, we're seeing "
"Glory's."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​你们​俩​在​某种程度​上​都​是​对​的​。​我​觉得​玛​尔塔​来到​这里​时​，​看到​了​她​理解​中​的​反叛者​领域​。​现在​我们​看到​的​是​格洛丽​对​领域​的​理解​。\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ni3men5 lia3 zai4 mou3 zhong3 cheng2 du4 shang4 dou1 shi4 dui4 de5。wo3 jue2de5 Ma3er3ta3 lai2dao4 zhe4li3 shi2，kan4dao4 le5 ta1 li3jie3 zhong4 de5 fan3 pan4 zhe3 ling3yu4。xian4zai4 wo3men5 kan4dao4 de5 shi4 Ge2luo4li2 dui4 ling3yu4 de5 li3jie3。"

msgid "I think that you're right, Eiger. Our friend here is an addict."
msgstr ""
"看来​你​说得对​，​艾格尔​。​我们​这位​朋友​是​个​瘾君子​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，Ai4ge2er3。wo3men5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 shi4 ge4 yin3jun1zi3。"

msgid ""
"I think that your boss is in bed with the Landenberg Ring. I think that he's"
" the \"silent partner\" that we read about."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​的​老大​和兰​登堡​帮​早就​串通一气​了​。​他​就是​我们​读到​的​那个​“​幕后​金主​”​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 de5 lao3da4 he4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 zao3jiu4 chuan4tong1yi1qi4 le5。ta1 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 dou4 dao4 de5 na4ge5“mu4hou4 jin1zhu3”。"

msgid "I think that's a pretty safe bet."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​的​想法​很​有​道理​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 de5 xiang3fa3 hen3 you3 dao4li5。"

msgid "I think that's the safe bet."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​的​想法​很​有​道理​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 de5 xiang3fa3 hen3 you3 dao4li5。"

msgid "I think the Flux may have $(l.him), mein Schatz."
msgstr ""
"亲爱​的​，​我​想​$(l.he)​是​不会​离开​动荡​带​的​。\n"
"qin1ai4 de5，wo3 xiang3 $(l.he) shi4 bu4hui4 li2kai1 dong4dang4 dai4 de5。"

msgid "I think they could all use a big sister."
msgstr ""
"我​想​他们​都​需要​一个​大​姐姐​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ta1men5 dou1 xu1yao4 yi1ge5 dai4 jie3jie5。"

msgid ""
"I think this place is military. Judging by our depth and the markings, I’m guessing it’s an abandoned missile base. That would explain why Vauclair chose this place for his operation.\n"
"\n"
"Can’t be easy to find a secret underground base big enough to house a dragon."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​这里​是​军事设施​。​从​我们​的​深度​和​标记​来看​，​我​猜​这​可能​是​一个​废弃​的​导弹基地​。​这​就​能​解释​为什么​沃​克莱尔​选择​这里​进行​他​的​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​找到​一处​足够​容纳​一条​巨龙​的​秘密​地下​基地​，​想必​绝非易事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4li3 shi4 jun1shi4she4shi1。cong2 wo3men5 de5 shen1du4 he4 biao1ji4 lai2 kan4，wo3 cai1 zhe4 ke3neng2 shi4 yi1ge5 fei4qi4 de5 dao3 dan4 ji1 de5。zhe4 jiu4 neng2 jie3shi4 wei4shen2me5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 xuan3ze2 zhe4li3 jin4xing2 ta1 de5 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 zhao3dao4 yi1 chu3 zu2gou4 rong2na4 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 mi4mi4 di4xia4 ji1di4，xiang3bi4 jue2 fei1 yi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I think this place is military. Judging by our depth and the markings, I’m guessing it’s an abandoned missile base. That would explain why the late Doctor Vauclair chose this place for his operation.\n"
"\n"
"Can’t be easy to find a secret underground base big enough to house a dragon."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​这里​是​军事设施​。​从​我们​的​深度​和​标记​来看​，​我​猜​这​可能​是​一个​废弃​的​导弹基地​。​这​就​能​解释​为什么​已故​的​沃​克莱尔​博士​选择​这里​进行​他​的​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​找到​一处​足够​容纳​一条​巨龙​的​秘密​地下​基地​，​想必​绝非易事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4li3 shi4 jun1shi4she4shi1。cong2 wo3men5 de5 shen1du4 he4 biao1ji4 lai2 kan4，wo3 cai1 zhe4 ke3neng2 shi4 yi1ge5 fei4qi4 de5 dao3 dan4 ji1 de5。zhe4 jiu4 neng2 jie3shi4 wei4shen2me5 yi3gu4 de5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 xuan3ze2 zhe4li3 jin4xing2 ta1 de5 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 zhao3dao4 yi1 chu3 zu2gou4 rong2na4 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 mi4mi4 di4xia4 ji1di4，xiang3bi4 jue2 fei1 yi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I think we just figured out what Harrow is going to make those initiates do "
"tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我们​刚刚​弄​明白​哈罗​明天​要​让​那些​学徒​做​什么​了​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 gang1gang5 long4 ming2bai5 ha1luo2 ming2tian1 yao4 rang4 na4xie1 xue2tu2 zuo4 shen2me5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I think we made it pretty clear, stranger. You're not welcome here.\n"
"\n"
"Now move along."
msgstr ""
"我们​的话​已经​说​得​很​清楚​了​，​陌生人​。​这里​不​欢迎​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走开​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5hua4 yi3jing1 shuo1 de2 hen3 qing1chu5 le5，mo4sheng1ren2。zhe4li3 bu4 huan1ying2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"zou3kai1。"

msgid ""
"I think we might've seen some signs of your \"creativity\" on the way up "
"here."
msgstr ""
"我​想​我们​来​的​路上​或许​已经​看见​了​你​的​“​创造力​”​留下​的​某些​迹象​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 lai2 de5 lu4shang5 huo4xu3 yi3jing1 kan4jian4 le5 ni3 de5“chuang4zao4li4” liu2xia4 de5 mou3xie1 ji4xiang4。"

msgid "I think we should say something. About Paul."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​我们​应该​说些​什么​。​作为​对​保罗​的​悼念​。\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 ying1gai1 shuo1 xie1 shen2me5。zuo4wei2 dui4 bao3luo2 de5 dao4nian4。"

msgid "I think we’ve heard what Dante has to say."
msgstr ""
"但丁​这​不​就​发话​了​嘛​。\n"
"dan4ding1 zhe4 bu4 jiu4 fa1 hua4 le5 ma5。"

msgid "I think you have the wrong $(s.guy)."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​找​错​人​了​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 zhao3 cuo4 ren2 le5。"

msgid "I think you know what they're going through."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​能​和​他们​感同身受​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 neng2 he4 ta1men5 gan3tong2shen1shou4。"

msgid ""
"I thought I'd looked everywhere. Between my contacts and myself, we scoured all of Em's old haunts, both in meat-space and the Matrix.\n"
"\n"
"But what I never thought to do was dig for clues in my own cyberdeck."
msgstr ""
"我​以为​我​已经​找过​了​所有​地方​。​我​的​联系人​还有​我​自己​都​去过​了​艾米莉​常去​的​老​地方​，​包括​现实​世界​和​矩阵​之内​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​从来​没想​过​在​我​自己​的​赛博碟板​里面​发掘​线索​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3wei2 wo3 yi3jing1 zhao3 guo4 le5 suo3you3 di4fang1。wo3 de5 lian2xi4ren2 hai2you3 wo3 zi4ji3 dou1 qu4 guo4 le5 ai4 mi3 li4 chang2 qu4 de5 lao3 di4fang1，bao1kuo4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 he4 ju3zhen4 zhi1nei4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 cong2lai2 mei2 xiang3 guo4 zai4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 li3mian4 fa1jue2 xian4suo3。"

msgid "I thought he'd never leave."
msgstr ""
"我​还​以为​他​不​打算​走​了​呢​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 ta1 bu4 da3suan4 zou3 le5 ni2。"

msgid ""
"I thought so. When the door locks disarm, we make a break for it. Until "
"then, we make them pay for Monika."
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。​开门​之后​，​我们​就​立刻​撤退​。​在此之前​，​就​跟​他们​好好​算一算​莫妮卡​的​这笔​帐​吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。kai1men2 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 jiu4 li4ke4 che4tui4。zai4ci3zhi1qian2，jiu4 gen1 ta1men5 hao3hao3 suan4 yi1 suan4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 zhe4 bi3 zhang4 ba1。"

msgid "I thought that this guy was a professional."
msgstr ""
"我​还​以为​这​家伙​很​专业​呢​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 zhe4 jia1huo5 hen3 zhuan1ye4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"I thought that you didn't feel much anymore... that your cyberware "
"interfered with your emotions. So what's changed?"
msgstr ""
"我​还​以为​你​已经​无感​了​……​毕竟​你​的​赛博​改造​多到​影响​了​你​的​情绪​。​现在​有​什么​变化​吗​？\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 yi3jing1 wu2gan3 le5……bi4jing4 ni3 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 duo1 dao4 ying3xiang3 le5 ni3 de5 qing2xu4。xian4zai4 you3 shen2me5 bian4hua4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I thought this might be a good time to take care of that \"Meat Grinder\" "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​现在​也许​是​解决​“​绞肉机​”​问题​的​好时机​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 xian4zai4 ye3xu3 shi4 jie3jue2“jiao3rou4ji1” wen4ti2 de5 hao3 shi2 ji1。"

msgid ""
"I thought we'd have some closure with this. That I'd be able to take a day "
"off, maybe. But that dragon wasn't the only thing I'm worried about."
msgstr ""
"我​以为​这​事​结束​之后​我能​稍微​歇息​下​，​兴许​还​能​休个​假​什么​的​。​但​我​要​担心​的​事​并​不止​那条​龙​。\n"
"wo3 yi3wei2 zhe4 shi4 jie2shu4 zhi1hou4 wo3 neng2 shao1wei1 xie1xi5 xia4，xing1xu3 hai2 neng2 xiu1 ge4 jia3 shen2me5 de5。dan4 wo3 yao4 dan1xin1 de5 shi4 bing4 bu4zhi3 na4 tiao2 long2。"

msgid "I thought we'd killed all of them."
msgstr ""
"我​以为​我们​把​他们​都​干掉​了​。\n"
"wo3 yi3wei2 wo3men5 ba3 ta1men5 dou1 gan4diao4 le5。"

msgid "I thought you said that we weren't going to resort to torture."
msgstr ""
"你​不是​说​了​不靠​暴力手段​解决问题​吗​。\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 shuo1 le5 bu4 kao4 bao4 li4 shou3 duan4 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2 ma5。"

msgid ""
"I thought you said that you didn't discriminate when it came to magical "
"traditions."
msgstr ""
"你​不是​说​在​魔法​传统​方面​从不​乱搞​歧视​吗​。\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 shuo1 zai4 mo2fa3 chuan2tong3 fang1mian4 cong2bu4 luan4gao3 qi2shi4 ma5。"

msgid ""
"I thought you were a pro, Eiger. Questioning orders in front of the team "
"isn’t exactly a pro move, is it?"
msgstr ""
"我​还​以为​你​是​个​行家​呢​，​艾格尔​。​当着​全队​的​面​质疑​命令​可​算不上​专业​，​对​不​对​？\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 shi4 ge4 hang2jia1 ni2，Ai4ge2er3。dang1zhe5 quan2 dui4 de5 mian4 zhi4yi2 ming4ling4 ke3 suan4 bu4 shang4 zhuan1ye4，dui4 bu4 dui4？"

msgid ""
"I thought you were one of THEM. Y'know, the gangers that took over and shot up the place.\n"
"\n"
" I work...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He catches himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...That is to say, WORKED. I worked for the previous owners."
msgstr ""
"我​还​以为​你​是​他们​的​人​。​你​懂​的​，​就​那群​抢​地盘​还​瞎​开枪​的​帮派​混混​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​这​工作​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​我​是​说​，​之前​。​我​之前​是​在​这​给​前任​店主​干活​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 shi4 ta1men5 de5 ren2。ni3 dong3 de5，jiu4 na4 qun2 qiang3 di4pan2 hai2 xia1 kai1qiang1 de5 bang1pai4 hun4 hun4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhe4 gong1zuo4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……wo3 shi4 shuo1，zhi1qian2。wo3 zhi1qian2 shi4 zai4 zhe4 gei3 qian2ren4 dian4zhu3 gan4huo2 de5。"

msgid ""
"I told him it wasn’t time to make a move yet. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Silence.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What do you think I am, an idiot? "
msgstr ""
"我​跟​他​说​过​还​不要​做出​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一片​寂静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​觉得​我​是​个​蠢货​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ta1 shuo1 guo4 hai2 bu4yao4 zuo4chu1 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3 shi4 ge4 chun3huo4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I told you about those stories I'd heard... the stories about Doom being deployed in border skirmishes. Well, I spared you the goriest details... didn't want to give you nightmares.\n"
"\n"
"So here's what I think. We need to put a stop to this. And we need to do it now."
msgstr ""
"我​跟​你们​提​过​那些​我​听说​的​故事​……​关于​“​末日​”​在​边境​冲突​中是​如何​被​部署​的​。​不过​，​我​没​跟​你们​说​那些​最​血腥​的​细节​……​不想​让​你们​做​噩梦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我​的​想法​是​，​我们​必须​制止​这件​事​。​而且​我们​必须​立即行动​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3men5 ti2 guo4 na4xie1 wo3 ting1shuo1 de5 gu4shi4……guan1yu2“mo4ri4” zai4 bian1jing4 chong1tu1 zhong4 shi4 ru2he2 bei4 bu4shu3 de5。bu4guo4，wo3 mei2 gen1 ni3men5 shuo1 na4xie1 zui4 xue4xing1 de5 xi4jie2……bu4xiang3 rang4 ni3men5 zuo4 e4meng4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 de5 xiang3fa3 shi4，wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhi4zhi3 zhe4 jian4 shi4。er2qie3 wo3men5 bi4xu1 li4 ji2 xing2 dong4。"

msgid "I told you before, pal. The hotel is *closed.*"
msgstr ""
"我​之前​说​了​，​伙计​。​旅馆​*​关门​*​了​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 le5，huo3ji5。lu:3guan3*guan1men2*le5。"

msgid ""
"I told you that I wasn't gonna kill you. Never said anything about letting you go.\n"
"\n"
"Mr. Grinder's orders, you understand. It's nothing personal."
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​我​没​打算​杀​你​。​但​我​没​说​过​要​放​你​离开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​命令​，​别往​心里​去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5 wo3 mei2 da3suan4 sha1 ni3。dan4 wo3 mei2 shuo1 guo4 yao4 fang4 ni3 li2kai1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 ming4ling4，bie4 wang3 xin1li5 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I told you that you would be planting bugs, and you did plant bugs. You did a wonderful job of it, I might add.\n"
"\n"
"Jana's job was to plant the bomb.\n"
"\n"
"But we can discuss all of this upon your return."
msgstr ""
"我​只​对​你​说​了​你​的​任务​是​安装​监控​，​事实​也​是​如此​—​—​而且​你​出色​地​完成​了​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​简娜​的​任务​才​是​安装​炸弹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我们​可以​等​你​回来​之后​再​讨论​这些​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 dui4 ni3 shuo1 le5 ni3 de5 ren4wu5 shi4 an1zhuang1 jian1kong4，shi4shi2 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3——er2qie3 ni3 chu1se4 de5 wan2cheng2 le5 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"Jian3na4 de5 ren4wu5 cai2 shi4 an1zhuang1 zha4dan4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 deng3 ni3 hui2lai5 zhi1hou4 zai4 tao3lun4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"I told you to go away, and I meant it.\n"
"\n"
"Now *scram.*"
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​让​你​离开​，​而​我​是​认真​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​*​滚蛋​*​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5 rang4 ni3 li2kai1，er2 wo3 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4*gun3dan4*。"

msgid "I told you to leave me alone. I can't afford to lose my concentration."
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​不要​打扰​我​。​我​不能​分心​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5 bu4yao4 da3rao3 wo3。wo3 bu4neng2 fen1xin1。"

msgid ""
"I told you what you had to do. Your job was to plant the bugs - a task that you succeeded in admirably, I might add.\n"
"\n"
"Jana's was to plant the bomb.\n"
"\n"
"But we can discuss all of this upon your return."
msgstr ""
"我​只​对​你​说​了​你​要​做​的​事​。​你​的​任务​是​安装​监控​—​—​而且​你​出色​地​完成​了​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​简娜​的​任务​才​是​安装​炸弹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我们​可以​等​你​回来​之后​再​讨论​这些​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 dui4 ni3 shuo1 le5 ni3 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4。ni3 de5 ren4wu5 shi4 an1zhuang1 jian1kong4——er2qie3 ni3 chu1se4 de5 wan2cheng2 le5 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"Jian3na4 de5 ren4wu5 cai2 shi4 an1zhuang1 zha4dan4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 deng3 ni3 hui2lai5 zhi1hou4 zai4 tao3lun4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"I told you, he can't understand a word you're saying. Nothing's come out of his mouth but that pidgin drivel the elves call a language... a Tir Tairngire dialect, if I'm not mistaken.\n"
"\n"
"I wish that he'd do us all a favor and go back."
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​，​他​一句​都​听不懂​你​在​说​什么​。​他​嘴里​吐出来​的​全是​精灵​们​所谓​的​语言​—​—​那种​半吊子​的​胡言乱语​，​要是​我​没​记错​的话​，​是​提尔坦盖​的​方言​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真​希望​他​能​帮​我们​所有人​一个​忙​，​趁早​滚回去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，ta1 yi1ju4 dou1 ting1bu5dong3 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。ta1 zui3li3 tu3 chu1 lai2 de5 quan2 shi4 jing1ling2 men5 suo3wei4 de5 yu3yan2——na4zhong3 ban4diao4zi5 de5 hu2yan2luan4yu3，yao4shi5 wo3 mei2 ji4cuo4 de5hua4，shi4 ti2 er3 tan3 gai4 de5 fang1yan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 xi1wang4 ta1 neng2 bang1 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 yi1ge5 mang2，chen4zao3 gun3 hui2 qu4。"

msgid "I told you. I honor my deals."
msgstr ""
"我​说​过​，​我​肯定​会​忠于​契约​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 guo4，wo3 ken3ding4 hui4 zhong1yu2 qi4yue1。"

msgid ""
"I told you...\n"
"\n"
"It’s educational."
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​啊​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​能​学到​东西​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5 a1……\n"
"\n"
"neng2 xue2dao4 dong1xi1 de5。"

msgid ""
"I took care of that business with the Rabengeister. They won't be hijacking "
"our shipments any more."
msgstr ""
"我​解决​了​鸦灵​的​事情​。​他们​不会​再​劫持​我们​的​货​了​。\n"
"wo3 jie3jue2 le5 Ya1ling2 de5 shi4qing5。ta1men5 bu4hui4 zai4 jie2chi2 wo3men5 de5 huo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I took care of the guys outside. You should be able to make a run for it."
msgstr ""
"外头​那群人​被​我​收拾​掉​了​。​你​应该​能​溜出去​。\n"
"wai4tou5 na4 qun2 ren2 bei4 wo3 shou1shi5 diao4 le5。ni3 ying1gai1 neng2 liu1 chu1 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I took them to the talismonger, Aljernon. He said that he knew a place where they could get help.\n"
"\n"
"It won't be easy for them, or quick. But they'll get better in time."
msgstr ""
"我带​他们​去​找​了​奇物​商人​阿尔杰​农​。​他​说​自己​知道​个​地方​，​能​让​他们​得到​救助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​他们​而言​，​这​既​不​容易​也​非​朝夕​可成​。​但​终究会​好​起来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dai4 ta1men5 qu4 zhao3 le5 ji1 wu4 shang1ren2 E1er3jie2nong2。ta1 shuo1 zi4ji3 zhi1dao4 ge4 di4fang1，neng2 rang4 ta1men5 de2dao4 jiu4zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 ta1men5 er2yan2，zhe4 ji4 bu4 rong2yi4 ye3 fei1 zhao1xi1 ke3 cheng2。dan4 zhong1 jiu1 hui4 hao3 qi3lai5 de5。"

msgid ""
"I tried to stop them, like I said. But they're like *you*... they're trained killers! They do this kind of thing for a *living!*\n"
"\n"
"What was I supposed to do, intimidate them into staying? I barely even know how to fight!"
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​，​我​想​拦住​他们​的​，​但​他们​和​*​你​*​一样​……​都​是​训练有素​的​杀手​！​他们​就是​做​这​一行​*​谋生​*​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​怎么办​，​威胁​他们​留在​原地​吗​？​我​甚至​都​不​知道​该​怎么​战斗​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，wo3 xiang3 lan2zhu4 ta1men5 de5，dan4 ta1men5 he4*ni3*yi1yang4……dou1 shi4 xun4 lian4 you3 su4 de5 sha1shou3！ta1men5 jiu4shi4 zuo4 zhe4 yi1xing2*mou2sheng1*de5！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 zen3me5ban4，wei1xie2 ta1men5 liu2 zai4 yuan2di4 ma5？wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 zhan4dou4！"

msgid ""
"I tried to talk him down. Tried to explain my fighting days are done. But he"
" wouldn't believe me."
msgstr ""
"我​试图​劝​他​冷静下来​，​解释​说​我​的​战斗​生涯​已经​结束​。​但​他​就是​不​相信​我​。\n"
"wo3 shi4tu2 quan4 ta1 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2，jie3shi4 shuo1 wo3 de5 zhan4dou4 sheng1ya2 yi3jing1 jie2shu4。dan4 ta1 jiu4shi4 bu4 xiang1xin4 wo3。"

msgid "I truly hope so. (w)"
msgstr ""
"我​真心​希望​如此​。\n"
"wo3 zhen1xin1 xi1wang4 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"I trust that you had no difficuties with the task?\n"
"\n"
"Given our recent conversation, I would assume not."
msgstr ""
"希望​你​在​任务​过程​中​没有​遇到困难​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​鉴于​我们​刚刚​进行​的​谈话​，​看来​是​没有​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 ni3 zai4 ren4wu5 guo4cheng2 zhong4 mei2you3 yu4 dao4 kun4 nan2 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"jian4yu2 wo3men5 gang1gang5 jin4xing2 de5 tan2hua4，kan4lai5 shi4 mei2you3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I trust that you will.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He inclines his head in a low nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck to you and your friend both."
msgstr ""
"我​相信​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​微微​颔首​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝​你​和​你​的​朋友​好运​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 han4shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 he4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 hao3yun4。"

msgid "I try."
msgstr ""
"我会​尽力​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin4li4。"

msgid ""
"I understand *why* you went off-mission and handed the MKVI over to the Lodge. It was the wrong call, though.\n"
"\n"
"We shouldn't be double-crossing our clients. We're better than that."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​你​*​为何​*​要​偏离​任务​，​把​MKVI​交给​“​结社​”​。​但​这​终究​是​个​错误​的​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不该​背叛​客户​。​这​违背​了​我们​的​专业​水准​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ni3*wei4he2*yao4 pian1li2 ren4wu5，ba3 MKVI jiao1gei3“jie2she4”。dan4 zhe4 zhong1jiu1 shi4 ge4 cuo4wu4 de5 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4gai1 bei4pan4 ke4hu4。zhe4 wei2bei4 le5 wo3men5 de5 zhuan1ye4 shui3zhun3。"

msgid "I understand enough to know that we should be afraid of you."
msgstr ""
"我​的​理解​足以​让​我​知道​我们​应该​害怕​你​。\n"
"wo3 de5 li3jie3 zu2yi3 rang4 wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 ying1gai1 hai4pa4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I understand enough. The Firewing was a Great Dragon, and she was insane."
msgstr ""
"理解​得​足够​多​了​。​火翼​是​一条​巨龙​，​一条​发疯​的​巨龙​。\n"
"li3jie3 de2 zu2gou4 duo1 le5。Huo3yi4 shi4 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2，yi1 tiao2 fa1feng1 de5 ju4long2。"

msgid "I understand enough. You killed our friends and attacked our home."
msgstr ""
"我​理解​的​够​多​了​。​你​杀害​了​我们​的​朋友​，​袭击​了​我们​的​家园​。\n"
"wo3 li3jie3 de5 gou4 duo1 le5。ni3 sha1hai4 le5 wo3men5 de5 peng2you5，xi2ji1 le5 wo3men5 de5 jia1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"I understand more than I did yesterday. I spoke to her. Feuerschwinge was "
"different from other dragons, wasn’t she?"
msgstr ""
"总​比​昨天​要​好​。​我​和​火翼​谈过​，​她​和​其他​龙​不​一样​，​对​吗​？\n"
"zong3 bi3 zuo2tian1 yao4 hao3。wo3 he4 Huo3yi4 tan2 guo4，ta1 he4 qi2ta1 long2 bu4 yi1yang4，dui4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I understand that your men tried to destroy an entire kiez full of innocent "
"people. I understand that you've got a lot of funding and a heavily modified"
" virus designed for widespread dispersal. Something big is happening here."
msgstr ""
"我​理解​的​是​，​你​的​人​试图​摧毁​一个​充满​无辜​居民​的​整个​街区​。​你们​拥有​大量​资金​，​并且​设计​了​一种​经过​高度​改造​的​病毒​，​旨在​大规模​传播​。​这里​正在​发生​一件​大事​。\n"
"wo3 li3jie3 de5 shi4，ni3 de5 ren2 shi4tu2 cui1hui3 yi1ge5 chong1man3 wu2gu1 ju1min2 de5 zheng3ge4 jie1qu1。ni3men5 yong1you3 da4liang4 zi1jin1，bing4qie3 she4ji4 le5 yi1zhong3 jing1guo4 gao1du4 gai3zao4 de5 bing4du2，zhi3zai4 da4gui1mo2 chuan2bo1。zhe4li3 zheng4zai4 fa1sheng1 yi1 jian4 da4shi4。"

msgid ""
"I understand that your team is currently en route to retrieve a package... the MKVI Prototype, if I'm not mistaken.\n"
"\n"
"My associates and I are interested in acquiring the MKVI for our own studies. We would like you to deliver the device to us."
msgstr ""
"我​了解​到​你们​队伍​正在​替人​取货​……​如果​我​没​记错​的话​，​是​“​MKVI​”​原型机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​同僚​们​非常​想​拿​MKVI​做​研究​，​希望​你​能​把​机器​交给​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 liao3jie3 dao4 ni3men5 dui4wu3 zheng4zai4 ti4 ren2 qu3 huo4……ru2guo3 wo3 mei2 ji4cuo4 de5hua4，shi4“MKVI” yuan2 xing2 ji1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 tong2liao2 men5 fei1chang2 xiang3 na2 MKVI zuo4 yan2jiu1，xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 ba3 ji1qi4 jiao1gei3 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"I understand where you're coming from, $(l.name)... believe me, I do. I like a clear resolution as much as anyone else. But out in the field, you almost never get one.\n"
"\n"
"There are no easy fixes in my line of work. You don't kill the bad guy and have everyone live happily ever after - that's a fairy tale, not real life. The real world is more complicated than that."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​你​的​意思​，​$(l.name)​……​相信​我​，​我​确实​明白​。​我​和​其他人​一样​都​喜欢​明确​的​解决方案​，​但​在​实际​任务​中​，​你​很​难​有​这样​的​机会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我们​这​一行​里​，​没有​简单​的​解决办法​。​你​以为​能​像​童话故事​里​那样​，​杀死​坏人​之后​大家​都​过​上​幸福​的​生活​—​—​但​那​只是​童话​，​现实​世界​比​这​复杂​得​多​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 de5 yi4si5，$(l.name)……xiang1xin4 wo3，wo3 que4shi2 ming2bai5。wo3 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4 dou1 xi3huan5 ming2que4 de5 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4，dan4 zai4 shi2ji4 ren4wu5 zhong4，ni3 hen3 nan2 you3 zhe4yang4 de5 ji1hui4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3men5 zhe4 yi1xing2 li3，mei2you3 jian3dan1 de5 jie3jue2ban4fa3。ni3 yi3wei2 neng2 xiang4 tong2hua4gu4shi4 li3 na4yang4，sha1si3 huai4ren2 zhi1hou4 da4jia1 dou1 guo4 shang4 xing4fu2 de5 sheng1huo2——dan4 na4 zhi3shi4 tong2hua4，xian4shi2 shi4jie4 bi3 zhe4 fu4za2 de2 duo1。"

msgid ""
"I understand your point of view, shadowrunner. But no - you will not break "
"my resolve."
msgstr ""
"我​理解​你​的​观点​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​但​还是​不行​—​—​你别​想​击垮​我​的​决心​。\n"
"wo3 li3jie3 ni3 de5 guan1dian3，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。dan4 hai2shi5 bu4xing2——ni3 bie4 xiang3 ji1 kua3 wo3 de5 jue2xin1。"

msgid "I understand your reasoning, but there has to be a better way."
msgstr ""
"我​理解​你​的​苦衷​，​但​肯定​还有​更好​的​办法​。\n"
"wo3 li3jie3 ni3 de5 ku3zhong1，dan4 ken3ding4 hai2you3 geng1 hao3 de5 ban4fa3。"

msgid ""
"I understand. And I think you should do what's best for the both of you."
msgstr ""
"我​理解​。​我​想​你们​只要​为​自己​考虑​就​好​。\n"
"wo3 li3jie3。wo3 xiang3 ni3men5 zhi3yao4 wei2 zi4ji3 kao3lu:4 jiu4 hao3。"

msgid "I understand. I'm ready to proceed."
msgstr ""
"明白​，​我​准备​好​了​。\n"
"ming2bai5，wo3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5。"

msgid "I understand. Now, where are our teammates?"
msgstr ""
"我​理解​。​所以​队伍​的​其他人​呢​？\n"
"wo3 li3jie3。suo3yi3 dui4wu3 de5 qi2 ta1 ren2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"I understand. Now, you said that our teammates are already inside... are you"
" sure about that?"
msgstr ""
"我​理解​。​所以​，​你​说​其他​队友​已经​进去​了​……​你​确定​吗​？\n"
"wo3 li3jie3。suo3yi3，ni3 shuo1 qi2ta1 dui4you3 yi3jing1 jin4qu4 le5……ni3 que4ding4 ma5？"

msgid "I used my charm and natural musk. Gets 'em every time."
msgstr ""
"靠​我​的​魅力​和​天然​麝香​。​这招​屡试不爽​。\n"
"kao4 wo3 de5 mei4li4 he4 tian1ran2 she4xiang1。zhe4 zhao1 lu:3shi4bu4shuang3。"

msgid ""
"I used to front a punk band, way back when. Believe it or not, I've spent a "
"pretty good chunk of my life on stage."
msgstr ""
"很久以前​，​我​曾经​是​朋克​乐队​的​主唱​。​说来​你​可能​不​信​，​我​人生​中​相当​长​的​一段时间​都​是​在​舞台​上​度过​的​。\n"
"hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2，wo3 ceng2jing1 shi4 peng2ke4 yue4dui4 de5 zhu3chang4。shuo1 lai2 ni3 ke3neng2 bu4 xin4，wo3 ren2sheng1 zhong4 xiang1dang1 zhang3 de5 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 dou1 shi4 zai4 wu3tai2 shang4 du4guo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I used to think so. This place... these people... I loved them so, so much.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her hands bunch into fists.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What a goddamned fool I was."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​是​这么​想​的​。​这个​地方​……​这些​人​……​我​如此​深爱着​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​双手​紧握​成拳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真是​个​该死​的​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。zhe4ge5 di4fang1……zhe4xie1 ren2……wo3 ru2ci3 shen1 ai4 zhao2 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1shi5 ge4 gai1si3 de5 sha3gua1。"

msgid "I ventilated him. Nobody pulls that drek on me and lives."
msgstr ""
"我​在​他​身上​开​了​几个​洞​。​敢​背叛​我​的​人​只有​死路一条​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 ta1 shen1shang5 kai1 le5 ji3ge5 dong4。gan3 bei4pan4 wo3 de5 ren2 zhi3you3 si3lu4yi1tiao2。"

msgid ""
"I vowed to never wage war. Never said anything about protecting myself or "
"others against those who would. Besides, who better to fortify against a "
"siege?"
msgstr ""
"我​曾​发誓​永不​发动战争​，​但​我​从未​说​过​不能​保护​自己​或​他人​免受​那些​战争​狂人​的​侵害​。​再说​，​还有​谁​比​我​更​适合​抵御​围城​呢​？\n"
"wo3 ceng2 fa1shi4 yong3bu4 fa1 dong4 zhan4 zheng1，dan4 wo3 cong2wei4 shuo1 guo4 bu4neng2 bao3hu4 zi4ji3 huo4 ta1ren2 mian3shou4 na4xie1 zhan4zheng1 kuang2ren2 de5 qin1hai4。zai4shuo1，hai2you3 shei2 bi3 wo3 geng1 shi4he2 di3yu4 wei2cheng2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"I walked into the office of the first street doc I could find, pointed at "
"all of the biggest, bulkiest pieces of cyberware that he had on display, and"
" told him to put them into me."
msgstr ""
"我​走进​第一家​能​找到​的​街头​医生​诊所​，​指着​他​展示柜​里​所有​最大​最​笨重​的​赛博​改造​，​命令​他​给​我​植入​这些​东西​。\n"
"wo3 zou3jin4 di4 yi1 jia1 neng2 zhao3dao4 de5 jie1tou2 yi1sheng1 zhen3suo3，zhi3 zhao2 ta1 zhan3 shi4 ju3 li3 suo3you3 zui4 dai4 zui4 ben4zhong4 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4，ming4ling4 ta1 gei3 wo3 zhi2ru4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"I want - I *need* - to see you again. What we shared, we must share again. I feel utterly consumed by my passion for you.\n"
"\n"
"I have sent you a calendar invite for a second romantic interlude. Pls. accept it at your earliest convenience.\n"
"\n"
"- Karlheinz"
msgstr ""
"我​想要​，​不​，​我​*​需要​*​再次​见到​你​。​我们​必须​再度​重温​那段​曾​共度​的​时光​。​我​对​你​的​炽热​情感​已​将​我​彻底​吞噬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已​发送​日历​邀请​，​邀​你​共赴​第二次​浪漫​邂逅​。​请​尽早​接受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​卡尔​海因茨\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3yao4，bu4，wo3*xu1yao4*zai4ci4 jian4dao4 ni3。wo3men5 bi4xu1 zai4du4 chong2wen1 na4 duan4 ceng2 gong4 du4 de5 shi2guang1。wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 chi4re4 qing2gan3 yi3 jiang1 wo3 che4di3 tun1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3 fa1song4 ri4li4 yao1qing3，yao1 ni3 gong4fu4 di4er4ci4 lang4man4 xie4hou4。qing3 jin3zao3 jie1shou4。\n"
"\n"
"——ka3er3 hai3 yin1 ci2"

msgid "I want my money back. Now."
msgstr ""
"退钱​。​现在​就​退​。\n"
"tui4qian2。xian4zai4 jiu4 tui4。"

msgid "I want some Jolt."
msgstr ""
"我​想来​点​“​嗨​翻天​”​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3lai2 dian3“hai1 fan1 tian1”。"

msgid "I want to ask you about something else."
msgstr ""
"我​想​问​你​其他​的​事情​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wen4 ni3 qi2ta1 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"I want to be strong. Strong people help. But I don't know what to do. I'm "
"not good at anything."
msgstr ""
"我​想​变得​强大​起来​。​强大​的​人能​帮上​忙​。​但​我​不​知道​该​做​什么​。​我​什么​都​做​不好​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 bian4de5 qiang2da4 qi3lai5。qiang2da4 de5 ren2 neng2 bang1 shang4 mang2。dan4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zuo4 shen2me5。wo3 shen2me5 dou1 zuo4 bu4hao3。"

msgid ""
"I want to get this over with, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I want to get away from these people and go ho--"
msgstr ""
"我​想​赶紧​完事​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​能​赶紧​远离​这些​人​，​早点​回家​去​—​—\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 gan3jin3 wan2shi4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 neng2 gan3jin3 yuan3li2 zhe4xie1 ren2，zao3dian3 hui2jia1 qu4 — —"

msgid ""
"I want to get this over with, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I want to get away from these people and go home."
msgstr ""
"我​想​赶紧​完事​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​能​赶紧​远离​这些​人​，​早点​回家​去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 gan3jin3 wan2shi4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 neng2 gan3jin3 yuan3li2 zhe4xie1 ren2，zao3dian3 hui2jia1 qu4。"

msgid "I want to hash out a few more details before we head inside."
msgstr ""
"在​我们​进去​之前​，​我​想​再​讨论一下​细节​问题​。\n"
"zai4 wo3men5 jin4qu4 zhi1qian2，wo3 xiang3 zai4 tao3 lun2 yi1 xia4 xi4jie2 wen4ti2。"

msgid "I want to hear you say it."
msgstr ""
"我​想​听​你​说​出来​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ting1 ni3 shuo1 chu1lai2。"

msgid "I want to help you, but this place is sealed tight."
msgstr ""
"我​想​帮​你​，​但​这​地方​被​牢牢​封死​了​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 bang1 ni3，dan4 zhe4 di4fang1 bei4 lao2lao2 feng1 si3 le5。"

msgid "I want to know a little more about the \"underworld.\""
msgstr ""
"我​想​了解​更​多​关于​“​冥界​”​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 liao3jie3 geng1 duo1 guan1yu2“ming2jie4” de5 shi4。"

msgid "I want to know about the prototype bioware."
msgstr ""
"我​想​知道​关于​生体​殖装​原型​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 guan1yu2 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yuan2xing2 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I want to know everything we can about this place. If she wants to talk, let"
" her."
msgstr ""
"我​想​尽可能​了解​这个​地方​。​如果​她​想​说话​，​就让​她​说​吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 jin3ke3neng2 liao3jie3 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。ru2guo3 ta1 xiang3 shuo1hua4，jiu4 rang4 ta1 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I want to know what I'm going up against. Tell me about the Magnifikers."
msgstr ""
"我要​知道​对手​是​什么​人​。​和​我​讲讲​伟术​帮​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 zhi1dao4 dui4shou3 shi4 shen2me5 ren2。he4 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 wei3 shu4 bang1 de5 shi4。"

msgid "I want to know who I'm working for."
msgstr ""
"我​想​知道​你们​是​什么​人​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 shi4 shen2me5 ren2。"

msgid "I want to search around a bit more, just to be sure."
msgstr ""
"以防万一​，​让​我​再​去​找​找​吧​。\n"
"yi3fang2wan4yi1，rang4 wo3 zai4 qu4 zhao3 zhao3 ba1。"

msgid "I want to talk about what happened the other day."
msgstr ""
"我​想​和​你​聊聊​前​几天​发生​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2 qian2 ji3tian1 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4。"

msgid "I want to talk to you about that job."
msgstr ""
"我​想​和​你​聊聊​差事​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"I want you gone. If you leave now and take your friends, I won't have to "
"kill you."
msgstr ""
"赶紧​滚蛋​。​如果​你​识相​点​，​带​你​的​朋友​们​走开​，​我​就​饶​你​一命​。\n"
"gan3jin3 gun3dan4。ru2guo3 ni3 shi2xiang4 dian3，dai4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 zou3kai1，wo3 jiu4 rao2 ni3 yi1 ming4。"

msgid ""
"I want you to infiltrate the smuggling operation that is delivering the shipment.\n"
"\n"
"Once you arrive at the Humanis compound, you will find out what they're planning to do with the chemical and put a stop to it."
msgstr ""
"我要​你​潜入​运送​这批​货物​的​走私​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​你​到达​人类​至上​主义者​的​仓库​后​，​你​要查​清楚​他们​打算​用​这批​化学品​做​什么​，​并​阻止​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ni3 qian2ru4 yun4song4 zhe4 pi1 huo4wu4 de5 zou3si1 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ni3 dao4da2 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 cang1ku4 hou4，ni3 yao4 cha2 qing1chu5 ta1men5 da3suan4 yong4 zhe4 pi1 hua4xue2pin3 zuo4 shen2me5，bing4 zu3zhi3 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"I want you to look at me. Not with the crude orbs of meat in your skull... I want you to use your *true* vision. You know the kind that I mean.\n"
"\n"
"Just this once, I will cast aside the veil. Just this once, you will see what I really am."
msgstr ""
"我要​你​看着​我​。​不是​用​你​颅骨​里​那​对​粗鄙​的​肉球​……​我要​你​用​你​的​*​真正​*​视界​。​你​知道​我​指​的​是​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这​一次​，​我​将​掀开​面纱​。​就​这​一次​，​你​会​看见​我​的​真容​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ni3 kan4 zhao2 wo3。bu4shi4 yong4 ni3 lu2gu3 li3 na4 dui4 cu1bi3 de5 rou4 qiu2……wo3 yao4 ni3 yong4 ni3 de5*zhen1zheng4*shi4jie4。ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 zhi3 de5 shi4 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4 yi1ci4，wo3 jiang1 xian1kai1 mian4sha1。jiu4 zhe4 yi1ci4，ni3 hui4 kan4jian4 wo3 de5 zhen1rong2。"

msgid ""
"I want you to promise me that, if I let you go, you'll stop killing deckers."
msgstr ""
"我​想​让​你​向​我​承诺​，​如果​我​释放​你​，​你​将​停止​杀害​碟客​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 rang4 ni3 xiang4 wo3 cheng2nuo4，ru2guo3 wo3 shi4fang4 ni3，ni3 jiang1 ting2zhi3 sha1hai4 die2 ke4。"

msgid ""
"I want you to show me your real face, APEX. Show me what Alice was so afraid"
" of."
msgstr ""
"我​想​看到​你​的​真面目​，​APEX​。​让​我​看看​爱丽丝​为什么​如此​害怕​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 kan4dao4 ni3 de5 zhen1mian4mu4，APEX。rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ai4li4si1 wei4shen2me5 ru2ci3 hai4pa4。"

msgid "I wanted to hear more about the war."
msgstr ""
"我​想​多​了解​一下​战争​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 duo1 liao3jie3 yi1xia4 zhan4zheng1 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I wanted to see if you could defend your position. You did a pretty good "
"job, and I have no love for dragons. So I say, go for it - I won't try to "
"stop you."
msgstr ""
"我​想​看看​你​能否​为​自己​的​立场​辩护​。​你​做​得​相当​不错​，​而​我​对​巨龙​可​没什么​好感​。​所以​要​我​说​，​放手去做​吧​—​—​我​不会​试图​阻止​你​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 kan4kan5 ni3 neng2fou3 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 li4chang3 bian4hu4。ni3 zuo4 de2 xiang1dang1 bu4cuo4，er2 wo3 dui4 ju4long2 ke3 mei2shen2me5 hao3gan3。suo3yi3 yao4 wo3 shuo1，fang4 shou3 qu4 zuo4 ba1——wo3 bu4hui4 shi4tu2 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I warn you, Billy is not just \"one of those things\"! Years of experimentation have remade him into the ultimate killing machine.\n"
"\n"
"He's smarter than ten men, and five times as deadly!"
msgstr ""
"我​警告​你​，​比利​不是​“​普通​的​东西​”​！​多年​的​实验​把​他​变成​了​终极​杀戮​机器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​比​十个​人​更​聪明​，​而且​更​致命​五倍​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jing3gao4 ni3，bi3li4 bu4shi4“pu3tong1 de5 dong1xi1”！duo1nian2 de5 shi2yan4 ba3 ta1 bian4cheng2 le5 zhong1ji2 sha1lu4 ji1qi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bi3 shi2 ge4 ren2 geng1 cong1ming5，er2qie3 geng1 zhi4ming4 wu3 bei4！"

msgid ""
"I warned her.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel's voice is choked with rage.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I warned her."
msgstr ""
"我​警告​过​她​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​声音​带​着​掩藏不住​的​怒意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​警告​过​她​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jing3gao4 guo4 ta1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 yan3 zang4 bu4 zhu4 de5 nu4 yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jing3gao4 guo4 ta1 de5。"

msgid "I warned you that you'd see things you didn't want to in here."
msgstr ""
"我​说​过​，​你​会​在​这里​看到​一些​你​不想​看到​的​东西​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 guo4，ni3 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3 kan4dao4 yi1xie1 ni3 bu4xiang3 kan4dao4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"I was a kid. Seventeen years old, and most of them spent living in one hell or another. I had a lot of demons to escape from, and the people here made me feel safe and welcome.\n"
"\n"
"I wanted this to be true. I *needed* it to be true. So I convinced myself that it was."
msgstr ""
"我​当时​还是​个​十七岁​的​孩子​，​而且​人生​的​大半​时光​都​在​各种​地狱​里​度过​。​我​逃离​了​太​多心​魔​，​而​这里​的​人​让​我​感到​安全​与​温暖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​渴望​这是​真的​。​我​*​需要​*​这是​真的​。​于是​我​说服​自己​相信​了​这​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 hai2shi5 ge4 shi2 qi1 sui4 de5 hai2zi5，er2qie3 ren2sheng1 de5 da4ban4 shi2guang1 dou1 zai4 ge4zhong3 di4yu4 li3 du4guo4。wo3 tao2li2 le5 tai4 duo1xin1 mo2，er2 zhe4li3 de5 ren2 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 an1quan2 yu4 wen1nuan3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3wang4 zhe4 shi4 zhen1de5。wo3*xu1yao4*zhe4 shi4 zhen1de5。yu2shi4 wo3 shuo1fu2 zi4ji3 xiang1xin4 le5 zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid "I was actually hoping to ask you a few questions."
msgstr ""
"我​是​想来​问​你​几个​问题​的​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 xiang3lai2 wen4 ni3 ji3ge5 wen4ti2 de5。"

msgid ""
"I was commanding from the field, and my t-bird was caught up in the "
"firestorm with all the rest. Not sure how I survived, when so many others "
"died. But when they pulled me from the wreck, I was only half the man I used"
" to be, in more ways than one."
msgstr ""
"我​当时​正在​前线​指挥​，​我​的​雷鸟​和​其他​载具​一起​被​卷入​了​那场​烈焰​风暴​。​我​不​明白​自己​是​怎么​活​下来​的​，​而​那么​多​其他人​却​都​牺牲​了​。​但​当​他们​从​残骸​中​救出​我时​，​我​无论​从​生理​或是​精神​上​都​已经​不再​是​原来​的​那个​我​了​。\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 zheng4zai4 qian2xian4 zhi3hui1，wo3 de5 lei2niao3 he4 qi2ta1 zai4ju4 yi1qi3 bei4 juan3ru4 le5 na4 chang2 lie4yan4 feng1bao4。wo3 bu4 ming2bai5 zi4ji3 shi4 zen3me5 huo2 xia4lai5 de5，er2 na4me5 duo1 qi2 ta1 ren2 que4 dou1 xi1sheng1 le5。dan4 dang1 ta1men5 cong2 can2hai2 zhong4 jiu4chu1 wo3 shi2，wo3 wu2lun4 cong2 sheng1li3 huo4shi4 jing1shen2 shang4 dou1 yi3jing1 bu4zai4 shi4 yuan2lai2 de5 na4ge5 wo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I was crazy about her, chief. To this day, she's the only person I've ever met who could out-deck me. And the real kicker is that she wasn't even a decker by trade.\n"
"\n"
"There was nothing she wasn't good at. I like to dabble in rigging, but Emilie... that girl could pick up anything that she set her mind to."
msgstr ""
"我​当时​疯狂​迷恋​上​了​她​，​头儿​。​直至​今日​，​仍然​只有​她​能​在​碟​客​本领​上​比​我​更胜一筹​。​然而​她​自己​甚至​都​不是​一个​职业​碟客​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​几乎​无所不能​。​我​喜欢​鼓捣​一些​操作​技巧​，​但​艾米莉​……​那个​女孩​只要​下定决心​，​就​能​掌握​任何​她​想​学习​的​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 feng1kuang2 mi2lian4 shang4 le5 ta1，tou2r5。zhi2zhi4 jin1ri4，reng2ran2 zhi3you3 ta1 neng2 zai4 die2 ke4 ben3ling3 shang4 bi3 wo3 geng4sheng4yi1chou2。ran2er2 ta1 zi4ji3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4shi4 yi1ge5 zhi2ye4 die2 ke4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ji1hu1 wu2suo3bu4neng2。wo3 xi3huan5 gu3dao5 yi1xie1 cao1zuo4 ji4qiao3，dan4 ai4 mi3 li4……na4ge5 nu:3hai2 zhi3yao4 xia4ding4jue2xin1，jiu4 neng2 zhang3wo4 ren4he2 ta1 xiang3 xue2xi2 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "I was hoping I'd put this place behind me after the Humanis run."
msgstr ""
"我​本来​以为​，​自打​人类​至上​主义者​那事​之后​，​我​就​不用​再​来​这里​了​。\n"
"wo3 ben3lai2 yi3wei2，zi4da3 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 na4 shi4 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiu4 bu4yong4 zai4 lai2 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I was hoping for a straight answer. You've got a talent for deflection, "
"Blitz."
msgstr ""
"我要​的​是​直截了当​的​答案​。​你​挺会​兜圈子​啊​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 de5 shi4 zhi2jie2liao3dang4 de5 da2an4。ni3 ting3 hui4 dou1quan1zi5 a1，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid "I was hoping for something with a little more punch."
msgstr ""
"我​还​以为​能​用来​增强​火力​呢​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 neng2 yong4lai2 zeng1qiang2 huo3li4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"I was hoping that you would.\n"
"\n"
"Outline your thoughts, if you will. I'd like to see how close they come to mine."
msgstr ""
"我​正​希望​如此​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​把​你​的​想法​说​出来​吧​。​我​想​知道​我们​思考​的​事情​有​多​接近​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng1 xi1wang4 ru2ci3 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"ba3 ni3 de5 xiang3fa3 shuo1 chu1lai2 ba1。wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 si1kao3 de5 shi4qing5 you3 duo1 jie1jin4。"

msgid ""
"I was in the hotel when it got taken over, and the new gang decided to keep me... \"on staff,\" I guess you could call it. \n"
"\n"
"They put me in charge of Matrix security."
msgstr ""
"他们​抢下​这​地方​的​时候​，​我​正好​在​旅馆​里​。​这么​说​吧​，​新来​的​帮派​决定​叫​我​留下来​……​“​入伙​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​要​我​负责​矩阵​安全​方面​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 qiang3 xia4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 zheng4hao3 zai4 lu:3guan3 li3。zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，xin1 lai2 de5 bang1pai4 jue2ding4 jiao4 wo3 liu2 xia4 lai2……“ru4huo3”。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yao4 wo3 fu4ze2 ju3zhen4 an1quan2 fang1mian4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "I was just in Gesundbrunnen, I suppose. What of it?"
msgstr ""
"我​只是​去​了​健康​泉​而已​。​有​什么​问题​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 qu4 le5 jian4kang1 quan2 er2yi3。you3 shen2me5 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid "I was just in Gesundbrunnen, if you're looking for something new."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​去​了​健康​泉​而已​，​没什么​新鲜事​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 qu4 le5 jian4kang1 quan2 er2yi3，mei2shen2me5 xin1 xian1 shi4。"

msgid "I was just passing through."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​路过​而已​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 lu4guo4 er2yi3。"

msgid "I was just testing you. Congratulations, you passed."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​考验​一下​你​。​恭喜​过关​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 kao3yan4 yi1xia4 ni3。gong1xi3 guo4guan1。"

msgid "I was just up there. Already cleared all those spirits."
msgstr ""
"我​刚才​上去​过​了​。​那些​精魂​已经​被​我​清理​了​。\n"
"wo3 gang1cai2 shang4qu4 guo4 le5。na4xie1 jing1hun2 yi3jing1 bei4 wo3 qing1li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I was kind of hoping for something with more bite to it. A fireball, a "
"laser, something like that."
msgstr ""
"我​还​以为​是​什么​更​刺激​的​东西​呢​。​火球​啊​，​激光​什么​的​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 shi4 shen2me5 geng1 ci4ji1 de5 dong1xi1 ni2。huo3qiu2 a1，ji1guang1 shen2me5 de5。"

msgid ""
"I was never allowed in this room without Harrow... nobody was. He said that it was for our safety, and I think that he was telling the truth.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I feel uneasy being in here. I don't want to stay any longer than we have to."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​不​在​的​时候​，​我​从未​被​允许​进入​这个​房间​……​谁​都​不能​进​。​他​说​这​是​为了​我们​的​安全​，​我​想​他​说​的​是​实话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​顿​了​下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​待​在​这里​让​我​感到​不安​。​我​不想​多待​一秒钟​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 bu4 zai4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 cong2wei4 bei4 yun3xu3 jin4ru4 zhe4ge5 fang2jian1……shei2 dou1 bu4neng2 jin4。ta1 shuo1 zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 wo3men5 de5 an1quan2，wo3 xiang3 ta1 shuo1 de5 shi4 shi2hua4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dun4 le5 xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dai1 zai4 zhe4li3 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 bu4an1。wo3 bu4xiang3 duo1 dai1 yi1 miao3 zhong1。"

msgid ""
"I was never planning on letting him go. As soon as he gave me the money he'd"
" promised, I was going to take him out."
msgstr ""
"我​根本​没​打算​放​他​走​。​等​他​把​答应​好​的​钱​给​我​之后​，​我​就​会​干掉​他​。\n"
"wo3 gen1ben3 mei2 da3suan4 fang4 ta1 zou3。deng3 ta1 ba3 da1ying5 hao3 de5 qian2 gei3 wo3 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiu4 hui4 gan4diao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I was offered a tidy sum by an anonymous party to request an audience with you, then recite their offer verbatim from a script.\n"
"\n"
"Honestly? I don't care whether you accept the offer or not. My job is finished, and I'm getting paid."
msgstr ""
"某个​匿名​人士​开出​不菲​的​价码​，​让​我​来​见​你​，​然后​原封不动​地​转达​对方​的​要求​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​？​我​根本​不在乎​你​是否​接受​。​我​的​任务​已经​完成​，​钱​已经​到手​。\n"
"\n"
"mou3 ge4 ni4ming2 ren2shi4 kai1 chu1 bu4fei3 de5 jia4ma3，rang4 wo3 lai2 jian4 ni3，ran2hou4 yuan2feng1bu4dong4 de5 zhuan3da2 dui4fang1 de5 yao1qiu2。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4？wo3 gen1ben3 bu4zai4hu5 ni3 shi4fou3 jie1shou4。wo3 de5 ren4wu5 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2，qian2 yi3jing1 dao4shou3。"

msgid ""
"I was one of them, remember? I know how this works.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever they're doing to their victim in there, they're gonna take their time with it. He won't be in great shape by the time that we get to him, but he'll probably be alive."
msgstr ""
"我​曾经​也​是​他们​的​一员​，​记得​吗​？​我​清楚​他们​会​怎么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​他们​要​对​那个​受害者​做​什么​，​他们​大​概率​会​慢慢来​。​等​我们​找到​他时​，​他​的​状况​肯定​不会​太好​，​但​应该​还​不会​死​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ceng2jing1 ye3 shi4 ta1men5 de5 yi1yuan2，ji4de5 ma5？wo3 qing1chu5 ta1men5 hui4 zen3me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ta1men5 yao4 dui4 na4ge5 shou4hai4zhe3 zuo4 shen2me5，ta1men5 dai4 gai4lu:4 hui4 man4man4lai2。deng3 wo3men5 zhao3dao4 ta1 shi2，ta1 de5 zhuang4kuang4 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 tai4 hao3，dan4 ying1gai1 hai2 bu4hui4 si3 diao4。"

msgid ""
"I was out of position when they came for you… I couldn’t save you.\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"他们​找来​的​时候​，​我​没​在​你​身边​……​我​没能​救下​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​抱歉​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zhao3 lai2 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 mei2 zai4 ni3 shen1bian1……wo3 mei2 neng2 jiu4 xia4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4。"

msgid "I was sent to check on you. So, uh... how are you doing?"
msgstr ""
"我​是​被​派​来​查看​你​这边​情况​的​。​所以​……​情况​如何​？\n"
"wo3 shi4 bei4 pai4 lai2 cha2kan4 ni3 zhe4bian1 qing2kuang4 de5。suo3yi3……qing2kuang4 ru2he2？"

msgid "I was thinking about taking a nap. How 'bout a room?"
msgstr ""
"我想​打个​盹​。​能​开个​房间​吗​？\n"
"wo3 xiang3 da3 ge4 dun3。neng2 kai1 ge4 fang2jian1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I was thinking about what you told me earlier. You said that your idol was "
"going to make you pick a fight that you couldn't win."
msgstr ""
"我​在​思考​你​之前​跟​我​说​过​的​事​。​你​的​精魄​导师​想​让​你​去​打​一场​赢​不了​的​架​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 si1kao3 ni3 zhi1qian2 gen1 wo3 shuo1 guo4 de5 shi4。ni3 de5 jing1 po4 dao3shi1 xiang3 rang4 ni3 qu4 da3 yi1 chang2 ying2 bu4le5 de5 jia4？"

msgid "I was thinking we could use it to smuggle Monika into the data vault. "
msgstr ""
"没准​能用​这​东西​把​莫妮卡​送​进​数据库​呢​。\n"
"mei2zhun3 neng2 yong4 zhe4 dong1xi1 ba3 Mo4ni1ka3 song4 jin4 shu4ju4ku4 ni2。"

msgid "I was told that it's the embodiment of evil."
msgstr ""
"据说​它​是​邪恶​的​化身​。\n"
"ju4shuo1 ta1 shi4 xie2e4 de5 hua4shen1。"

msgid "I was wondering, whose stories around here are worth listening to?"
msgstr ""
"我​就是​想​知道​，​这​附近​有​什么​有​价值​的​故事​吗​？\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 xiang3 zhi1dao4，zhe4 fu4jin4 you3 shen2me5 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 gu4shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I was working at one of the universities at the time. They had all become "
"hotbeds for activists. Scared lots of folks from the city. Mostly humans."
msgstr ""
"当时​我​在​某​所​大学​工作​。​那些​地方​全都​成​了​活动分子​的​温床​，​吓跑​了​不少​城里人​，​主要​是​人类​。\n"
"dang1shi2 wo3 zai4 mou3 suo3 da4xue2 gong1zuo4。na4xie1 di4fang1 quan2dou1 cheng2 le5 huo2 dong4 fen4 zi3 de5 wen1chuang2，xia4pao3 le5 bu4shao3 cheng2li3ren2，zhu3yao4 shi4 ren2lei4。"

msgid ""
"I was young when he chose me, Marta. Maybe not innocent, but young.\n"
"\n"
"Somewhere, deep down, you know that this is wrong."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​他选​我​为​妻子​时​，​我​还​很小​。​或许​不算​天真无邪​，​但​年纪​确实​很小​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​内心深处​一定​明白​，​这是​错误​的​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ta1 xuan3 wo3 wei2 qi1zi3 shi2，wo3 hai2 hen3 xiao3。huo4xu3 bu4suan4 tian1 zhen1 wu2 xie2，dan4 nian2ji4 que4shi2 hen3 xiao3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 nei4xin1shen1chu4 yi1ding4 ming2bai5，zhe4 shi4 cuo4wu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I was.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory gestures at her cyberware-riddled body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not any more."
msgstr ""
"曾经​是​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​指​了​指​自己​遍布​赛博​改造​的​身体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​不是​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ceng2jing1 shi4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zhi3 le5 zhi3 zi4ji3 bian4bu4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 de5 shen1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 bu4shi4 le5。"

msgid "I wasn't aware of any convent or church nearby."
msgstr ""
"我​没听说过​这​附近​有​任何​修道院​或​教堂​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4 zhe4 fu4jin4 you3 ren4he2 xiu1dao4yuan4 huo4 jiao4tang2。"

msgid ""
"I wasn't really serious about joining you. I just wanted to hear what you'd "
"say."
msgstr ""
"我​没真​打算​与​你​为伍​，​我​只是​想​听听​你​会​怎么​说​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 zhen1 da3suan4 yu4 ni3 wei2wu3，wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 ting1 ting1 ni3 hui4 zen3me5 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"I wasn't talking about the cruelty. I was talking about the religious "
"fanaticism."
msgstr ""
"我​说​的​不是​残酷​，​而是​宗教​狂热​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de5 bu4shi4 can2ku4，er2shi4 zong1jiao4 kuang2re4。"

msgid ""
"I wasn't trying to. Remarkable thing about living in a free society: we're all allowed to have different opinions.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't take it personally. I'm sure that you wouldn't like my friends, either."
msgstr ""
"我​本来​也​没​这个​意思​。​生活​在​一个​自由​社会​的​显著特点​是​：​我们​都​可以​有​不同​的​意见​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别往​心里​去​。​毕竟​你​肯定​也​不会​喜欢​我​的​朋友​们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3lai2 ye3 mei2 zhe4ge5 yi4si5。sheng1huo2 zai4 yi1ge5 zi4you2 she4hui4 de5 xian3 zhao2 te4 dian3 shi4：wo3men5 dou1 ke3yi3 you3 bu4tong2 de5 yi4jian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 wang3 xin1li5 qu4。bi4jing4 ni3 ken3ding4 ye3 bu4hui4 xi3huan5 wo3 de5 peng2you5 men5。"

msgid "I wasn’t trying to flatter you, Eiger. I only wanted to tell you how--"
msgstr ""
"我​可不是​在​拍​你​马屁​，​艾格尔​。​我​只是​想​说​你​有​多么​—​—\n"
"wo3 ke3bu5shi4 zai4 pai1 ni3 ma3pi4，Ai4ge2er3。wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 shuo1 ni3 you3 duo1me5 — —"

msgid ""
"I wasted them. Rammbock, too. If you want your shipment, you deal with *me.*"
msgstr ""
"都​被​我​干掉​了​，​还有​撞锤​帮​也​是​。​如果​你​想要​货​的话​，​就​和​*​我​*​来​谈​吧​。\n"
"dou1 bei4 wo3 gan4diao4 le5，hai2you3 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 ye3 shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 huo4 de5hua4，jiu4 he4*wo3*lai2 tan2 ba1。"

msgid "I watched Monika die. You can't be her."
msgstr ""
"我​亲眼看到​莫妮卡​死​了​。​你​不​可能​是​她​。\n"
"wo3 qin1 yan3 kan4 dao4 Mo4ni1ka3 si3 le5。ni3 bu4 ke3neng2 shi4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I wear a couple hats. A barista, a gopher. Keep my eyes and ears open.\n"
"\n"
"Let’s just say I get on by trading stories."
msgstr ""
"我​身兼数职​。​既​是​咖啡师​，​又​是​跑腿​的​。​眼观六路​，​耳听八方​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可以​说​，​我​是​靠​倒卖​情报​谋生​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen1 jian1 shu3 zhi2。ji4 shi4 ka1fei1shi1，you4 shi4 pao3tui3 de5。yan3 guan1 liu4 lu4，er3 ting1 ba1 fang1。\n"
"\n"
"ke3yi3 shuo1，wo3 shi4 kao4 dao3mai4 qing2bao4 mou2sheng1 de5。"

msgid ""
"I will *not* just sit back and let them take over the world. I must act.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His bony hands clench into fists.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I *will* act."
msgstr ""
"我​*​不会​*​坐以待毙​，​看着​他们​接管​世界​。​我​必须​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​骨瘦如柴​的​双手​紧握​成拳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​将会​*​行动​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*bu4hui4*zuo4yi3dai4bi4，kan4 zhao2 ta1men5 jie1guan3 shi4jie4。wo3 bi4xu1 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 gu3shou4ru2chai2 de5 shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3*jiang1hui4*xing2dong4。"

msgid ""
"I will continue digging into this while you and the team tackle your next run.\n"
"\n"
"With luck, I will have more information to share upon your return."
msgstr ""
"我会​继续​深入研究​此事​，​与此同时​你​和​团队​可以​先​进行​下​一趟​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​顺利​的话​，​等​你们​回来​时​，​我​就​能​有​更​多​发现​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 ji4xu4 shen1 ru4 yan2 jiu1 ci3shi4，yu3ci3tong2shi2 ni3 he4 tuan2dui4 ke3yi3 xian1 jin4xing2 xia4 yi1 tang1 cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 shun4li4 de5hua4，deng3 ni3men5 hui2lai5 shi2，wo3 jiu4 neng2 you3 geng1 duo1 fa1xian4 le5。"

msgid "I will end this before Communion can be damaged!"
msgstr ""
"我会​在​共​融会​受到破坏​之前​结束​这​一切​！\n"
"wo3 hui4 zai4 gong4 rong2hui4 shou4 dao4 po4 huai4 zhi1qian2 jie2shu4 zhe4 yi1qie4！"

msgid ""
"I will honor your promise, then. Quorin and his gang shall have access to my data taps, save for those that listen in on the Kreuzbasar itself.\n"
"\n"
"Ah! Not that such taps exist, mind you! No... of course not."
msgstr ""
"那么​，​我会​履行​你​的​承诺​。​奎林​和​他​的​帮派​可以​使用​我​的​数据​插口​—​—​除了​监听​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​那些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​！​对​了​，​我​可​没​说​这些​插口​真的​存在​！​没有​，​绝对​没有​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，wo3 hui4 lu:3xing2 ni3 de5 cheng2nuo4。kui2 lin2 he4 ta1 de5 bang1pai4 ke3yi3 shi3yong4 wo3 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3——chu2le5 jian1ting1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 na4xie1。\n"
"\n"
"a1！dui4 le5，wo3 ke3 mei2 shuo1 zhe4xie1 cha1kou3 zhen1de5 cun2zai4！mei2you3，jue2dui4 mei2you3。"

msgid ""
"I will iron out the remaining details with your Herr Amsel. He'll want to talk this over with you anyway, I'm sure.\n"
"\n"
"You're a good $(l.man), $(l.name). You are saving more lives than you know."
msgstr ""
"我会​和​阿姆​泽尔​先生​敲定​剩余​的​细节​。​我​想​他​总归​会​再​和​你​聊聊​这件​事​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​好人​，​$(l.name)​。​你​这样​做​是​救​了​无数​人​的​性命​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 he4 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 qiao1ding4 sheng4yu2 de5 xi4jie2。wo3 xiang3 ta1 zong3gui1 hui4 zai4 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2 zhe4 jian4 shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2，$(l.name)。ni3 zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 jiu4 le5 wu2shu4 ren2 de5 xing4ming4。"

msgid ""
"I will never forget.\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry, $(l.name). I'm going to conduct my investigation the old fashioned way... through contacts, and deduction, and careful observation.\n"
"\n"
"I will not jack in to the Matrix until this entire sorry episode is finished."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​忘记​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​，​$(l.name)​。​我​打算​按照​老办法​来​展开​调查​……​依靠​人脉关系​、​逻辑推理​和​细致​观察​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这​整件​麻烦事​结束​前​，​我​绝不会​接入​矩阵​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 wang4ji4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，$(l.name)。wo3 da3suan4 an4zhao4 lao3 ban4 fa3 lai2 zhan3kai1 diao4cha2……yi1kao4 ren2 mai4 guan1 xi4、luo2 ji2 tui1 li3 he4 xi4zhi4 guan1cha2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 ma2 fan2 shi4 jie2shu4 qian2，wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 jie1ru4 ju3zhen4。"

msgid ""
"I will not need luck! My Knight-Thanes will prevail, for providence is on "
"our side!"
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​好运​！​我​的​骑士​领主​们​将​会​胜利​，​因为​天命​站​在​我们​这边​！\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 hao3yun4！wo3 de5 qi2shi4 ling3zhu3 men5 jiang1 hui4 sheng4li4，yin1wei4 tian1ming4 zhan4 zai4 wo3men5 zhe4bian1！"

msgid ""
"I will tell you a great truth, $(l.name). Something hidden from mortal eyes.\n"
"\n"
"You have seen what I am. I am no mortal - my observations have been gathered over thousands of years. I would have you weigh that when you hear my words."
msgstr ""
"我​将​向​你​揭示​一个​伟大​的​真相​，​$(l.name)​。​这是​凡人​肉眼​无法​窥见​之​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​已​见识​过​我​的​真身​。​我​并非​凡人​—​—​我​的​洞察力​凝聚​了​数千年​的​积淀​。​当​你​聆听​我​的​话语​时​，​请​务必​斟酌​这​一切​的​分量​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 xiang4 ni3 jie1shi4 yi1ge5 wei3da4 de5 zhen1xiang4，$(l.name)。zhe4 shi4 fan2ren2 rou4yan3 wu2fa3 kui1jian4 zhi1 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3 jian4shi5 guo4 wo3 de5 zhen1shen1。wo3 bing4fei1 fan2ren2——wo3 de5 dong4cha2li4 ning2ju4 le5 shu3 qian1 nian2 de5 ji1dian4。dang1 ni3 ling2ting1 wo3 de5 hua4yu3 shi2，qing3 wu4bi4 zhen1zhuo2 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 fen1liang4。"

msgid ""
"I will transfer two thousand nuyen into your account for the job. And if you'll give me a moment, I will add the samples that you've recovered to my inventory.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks over the samples that you've brought him, and eagerly begins punching their serial numbers into his PDA.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I think that you'll be pleasantly surprised."
msgstr ""
"我会​把​两千​新円​打到​你​的​户头​，​作为​这趟​差事​的​报酬​。​如果​你​能​给​我​一点​时间​，​我会​把​你​找到​的​样本​加入​我​的​库存​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​看着​你​带给​他​的​样本​，​开始​把​它们​的​序列号​噼里啪啦​地​输入​他​的​PDA​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​给你个​惊喜​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 ba3 liang3 qian1 xin1 yuan2 da3 dao4 ni3 de5 hu4tou2，zuo4wei2 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 de5 bao4chou5。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 gei3 wo3 yi1dian3 shi2jian1，wo3 hui4 ba3 ni3 zhao3dao4 de5 yang4ben3 jia1ru4 wo3 de5 ku4cun2 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 zhao2 ni3 dai4gei3 ta1 de5 yang4ben3，kai1shi3 ba3 ta1men5 de5 xu4lie4hao4 pi1li5pa1la1 de5 shu1ru4 ta1 de5 PDA。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 gei3 ni3 ge4 jing1xi3 de5。"

msgid "I will, chief. I will."
msgstr ""
"我会​的​，​头儿​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5，tou2r5。"

msgid "I will."
msgstr ""
"我会​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I will.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The old man gestures at you with a frail arm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, as for our friend here..."
msgstr ""
"我会​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​老人​举起​脆弱​的​手臂​指向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​我们​的​这位​朋友​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 ju3qi3 cui4ruo4 de5 shou3bi4 zhi3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 wo3men5 de5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5……"

msgid "I will. Pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""
"我会​的​。​合作愉快​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。ge3 zuo4 yu2 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"I wish I could be like you. Not just in my head, but out here, in the real "
"world."
msgstr ""
"我​希望​我能​像​你​一样​。​不​只是​在​我​脑海​里​，​而且​也​在​这​现实​世界​中​。\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 wo3 neng2 xiang4 ni3 yi1yang4。bu4 zhi3shi4 zai4 wo3 nao3hai3 li3，er2qie3 ye3 zai4 zhe4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 zhong4。"

msgid "I wish I could be."
msgstr ""
"我​也​希望​如此​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "I wish I could do more, but money's tight."
msgstr ""
"我​也​想​多​做​一些​，​可惜​手头​不​允许​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 xiang3 duo1 zuo4 yi1xie1，ke3xi1 shou3tou2 bu4 yun3xu3。"

msgid "I wish I had time to hear more."
msgstr ""
"真​希望​我​有​时间​能​多​听​一些​。\n"
"zhen1 xi1wang4 wo3 you3 shi2jian1 neng2 duo1 ting1 yi1xie1。"

msgid ""
"I wish that I could have trusted you, Blitz. But if you want me to trust "
"you, you need to act a little less sketchy and be a little more open with "
"me."
msgstr ""
"我​也​希望​自己​能​相信​你​，​布里​茨​。​但​你​想​让​我​这么​做​的话​，​就​少​做些​可疑​的​事情​，​对​我​更加​坦诚​一些​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 zi4ji3 neng2 xiang1xin4 ni3，Bu4li3ci2。dan4 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5hua4，jiu4 shao3 zuo4 xie1 ke3yi2 de5 shi4qing5，dui4 wo3 geng4jia1 tan3cheng2 yi1xie1。"

msgid ""
"I wish that I could tell him everything. So much has happened. But for now, I'm afraid that I have to keep quiet... lives depend on it.\n"
"\n"
"Please tell him to sit tight, and that I'll be in touch when I can. And please, tell him that I love him.\n"
"\n"
"Best,\n"
"Em"
msgstr ""
"我​也​希望​能​告诉​他​一切​。​实在​是​发生​太多事​了​。​但​眼下​，​我​只能​选择​沉默​……​这​关乎​他人​的​性命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​告诉​他​静候​消息​，​我会​尽快​联系​他​。​还有​，​请​务必​告诉​他​—​—​我​爱​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此致​，​\n"
"​艾米\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 neng2 gao4su4 ta1 yi1qie4。shi2zai4 shi4 fa1sheng1 tai4 duo1 shi4 le5。dan4 yan3xia4，wo3 zhi3neng2 xuan3ze2 chen2mo4……zhe4 guan1hu1 ta1ren2 de5 xing4ming4。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 gao4su4 ta1 jing4hou4 xiao1xi5，wo3 hui4 jin3kuai4 lian2xi4 ta1。hai2you3，qing3 wu4bi4 gao4su4 ta1——wo3 ai4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ci3zhi4，\n"
"ai4 mi3"

msgid ""
"I wish that the bastard hadn't gotten away, but oh well. We did what we went"
" there to do."
msgstr ""
"我​真​希望​那个​混蛋​遭到​应有​的​报应​，​但​怎么​说​呢​，​起码​我们​完成​了​此行​的​目的​。\n"
"wo3 zhen1 xi1wang4 na4ge5 hun2dan4 zao1dao4 ying1you3 de5 bao4ying4，dan4 zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，qi3ma3 wo3men5 wan2cheng2 le5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid ""
"I wish that this could have turned out differently, Glory. But you haven't convinced me of anything, save for the fact that you sacrificed your humanity for nothing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her smile vanishes. She raises her hands, and they begin to glow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll defend this key with my life. Harrow taught me how."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​我本​希望​这件​事能​有​不同​的​结局​。​但​你​没有​在​任何​事情​上​说服​我​，​只是​证明​你​白白​牺牲​了​自己​的​人性​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​笑容​骤然​消失​。​她​举起​双手​，​掌心​开始​泛起​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​用​生命​守护​这​把​钥匙​。​哈罗​教会​了​我​如何​战斗​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，wo3 ben3 xi1wang4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 neng2 you3 bu4tong2 de5 jie2ju2。dan4 ni3 mei2you3 zai4 ren4he2 shi4qing5 shang4 shuo1fu2 wo3，zhi3shi4 zheng4ming2 ni3 bai2bai2 xi1sheng1 le5 zi4ji3 de5 ren2xing4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 zhou4ran2 xiao1shi1。ta1 ju3qi3 shuang1shou3，zhang3xin1 kai1shi3 fan4qi3 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 yong4 sheng1ming4 shou3hu4 zhe4 ba3 yao4shi5。ha1luo2 jiao1hui4 le5 wo3 ru2he2 zhan4dou4。"

msgid ""
"I wish that we could have saved everybody. But we made a decision to kill Harrow, no matter the cost.\n"
"\n"
"I won't second-guess that decision now."
msgstr ""
"我​也​希望​我们​能救下​每个​人​。​但​我们​做出​的​决定​是​杀死​哈罗​，​不计​任何​代价​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​事到如今​，​我​不会​再​回过​头去​质疑​这个​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 wo3men5 neng2 jiu4 xia4 mei3ge4 ren2。dan4 wo3men5 zuo4chu1 de5 jue2ding4 shi4 sha1si3 ha1luo2，bu4ji4 ren4he2 dai4jia4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4dao4ru2jin1，wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 hui2 guo4 tou2 qu4 zhi4yi2 zhe4ge5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"I wish that were true, but my time on Earth is short. Very short. \n"
"\n"
"So before I pass out of this world, I will finish the task I have been dealt. \n"
"\n"
"I go now to do a hard thing - perhaps an evil thing - but a thing that is *necessary.*"
msgstr ""
"我​也​希望​如此​，​但​我​在​人世间​的​时光​已​所剩无几​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​在​离开​这个​世界​之前​，​我​将​完成​上天​赋予​我​的​使命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​现在​要​去​做​一件​艰难​的​事​，​也许​甚至​是​一件​邪恶​的​事​，​但​这​都​是​*​必要​*​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 ru2ci3，dan4 wo3 zai4 ren2shi4jian1 de5 shi2guang1 yi3 suo3sheng4wu2ji3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 zai4 li2kai1 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 zhi1qian2，wo3 jiang1 wan2cheng2 shang4tian1 fu4yu3 wo3 de5 shi3ming4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 yao4 qu4 zuo4 yi1 jian4 jian1nan2 de5 shi4，ye3xu3 shen4zhi4 shi4 yi1 jian4 xie2e4 de5 shi4，dan4 zhe4 dou1 shi4*bi4yao4*de5。"

msgid ""
"I wish you'd reconsider this, chief. If we're gonna collect Alice's fee in time to save our own skins, we're gonna need to take all of the opportunities we can get, and this looks like a pretty great one to me.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know why we're passing it up."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​我​希望​你​重新考虑​一下​。​要​快速​攒够​爱丽丝​的​报价​，​就​得​抓住​每​一个​机会​，​而​眼前​这个​在我看来​正是​绝佳​的​机会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​明白​为什么​要​放弃​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 chong2 xin1 kao3 lu:4 yi1xia4。yao4 kuai4su4 cuan2 gou4 ai4li4si1 de5 bao4jia4，jiu4 de2 zhua1zhu4 mei3 yi1ge5 ji1hui4，er2 yan3qian2 zhe4ge5 zai4wo3kan4lai2 zheng4shi4 jue2jia1 de5 ji1hui4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 ming2bai5 wei4shen2me5 yao4 fang4qi4。"

msgid ""
"I won't abandon your victims here, Harrow. Not again.\n"
"\n"
"I'm going to burn this place to the ground. My only regret is that you aren't here in person to burn with it."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​再​一次​把​你​的​受害者​抛弃​在​这里​，​哈罗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​把​这里​夷为平地​。​只​可惜​你​本人​没能​在​这里​给​它​陪葬​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 yi1ci4 ba3 ni3 de5 shou4hai4zhe3 pao1qi4 zai4 zhe4li3，ha1luo2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ba3 zhe4li3 yi2wei2ping2di4。zhi3 ke3xi1 ni3 ben3ren2 mei2 neng2 zai4 zhe4li3 gei3 ta1 pei2zang4。"

msgid ""
"I won't argue with the sentiment, but I'd prefer that we exercise caution.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory. Razor-clawed street samurai. Her voice is cold and neutral, her expression placid.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​不​反对​你们​怀旧​，​不过​最好​还是​谨慎​行事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​。​使​螳螂​刀​的​街头​武士​。​她面​无表情​，​声音​冷淡​而​平静​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 fan3dui4 ni3men5 huai2jiu4，bu4guo4 zui4hao3 hai2shi5 jin3shen4 xing2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2。shi3 tang2lang2 dao1 de5 jie1tou2 wu3shi4。ta1 mian4 wu2biao3qing2，sheng1yin1 leng3dan4 er2 ping2jing4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I won't blow up an entire building full of people on such vague information."
" I'm sorry, but you'll have to find someone else."
msgstr ""
"我​不能​仅凭​这么​模糊​的​情报​就​炸死​一整座​楼​的​人​。​抱歉​，​你​还是​另请高明​吧​。\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 jin3 ping2 zhe4me5 mo2hu5 de5 qing2bao4 jiu4 zha4si3 yi1 zheng3 zuo4 lou2 de5 ren2。bao4qian4，ni3 hai2shi5 ling4qing3gao1ming2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I won't charge you for the device, of course. You already own that.\n"
"\n"
"But if you want me to put it into your head, it's going to cost. Period."
msgstr ""
"我​又​没​说​找​你​要​设备​的​费用​。​它​确实​是​你​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​如果​想​让​我​把​它​塞​到​你​脑袋​里​，​就​得​掏钱​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you4 mei2 shuo1 zhao3 ni3 yao4 she4bei4 de5 fei4yong4。ta1 que4shi2 shi4 ni3 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 ru2guo3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 ba3 ta1 se4 dao4 ni3 nao3dai5 li3，jiu4 de2 tao1qian2。"

msgid "I won't go against my own principles."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​违反​我​自己​的​原则​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 wei2fan3 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 yuan2ze2。"

msgid "I won't hear anything against the Flux. I’m out of here."
msgstr ""
"我​听不得​任何​反对​动荡​带​的​说辞​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 ting1 bu4 de2 ren4he2 fan3dui4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 shuo1ci2。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I won't keep you from it. Get ready, and I'll see you at the van."
msgstr ""
"我​就​不​耽误​你​了​。​做好​准备​，​我们​车上​见​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 bu4 dan1wu5 ni3 le5。zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4，wo3men5 che1 shang4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"I won't let anyone intimidate me into doing anything. If I decide to take "
"Duerr's offer, it won't be because I'm scared of him."
msgstr ""
"没人能​威胁​我​做事​。​如果​我​决定​接受​杜尔​的​提议​，​那​绝不会​是因为​我怕​他​。\n"
"mei2 ren2 neng2 wei1xie2 wo3 zuo4shi4。ru2guo3 wo3 jue2ding4 jie1shou4 du4 er3 de5 ti2yi4，na4 jue2 bu4 hui4 shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3 pa4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I won't let that happen. Because in there, I am strong...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Though Kim's words are bold, her trembling voice and body betray someone aching for a fix.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​不会​让​那种​事​发生​。​因为​在​那​里面​，​我​是​强大​的​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​尽管​金​的​言辞​很​勇敢​，​她​颤抖​的​声音​和​身体​却​表明​了​她​只是​瘾​症​发作​的​事实​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 rang4 na4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。yin1wei4 zai4 na4 li3mian4，wo3 shi4 qiang2da4 de5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin3guan3 jin1 de5 yan2ci2 hen3 yong3gan3，ta1 chan4dou3 de5 sheng1yin1 he4 shen1ti3 que4 biao3ming2 le5 ta1 zhi3shi4 yin3 zheng4 fa1zuo4 de5 shi4shi2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "I won't let you join him."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​让​你​加入​他​的​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 jia1ru4 ta1 de5。"

msgid ""
"I won't lie - we're in bed with some dangerous people. But this could work "
"to our benefit."
msgstr ""
"我​实话实说​—​—​我们​在​和​危险​人物​合作​。​但​这​对​我们​也​有​好处​。\n"
"wo3 shi2hua4shi2shuo1——wo3men5 zai4 he4 wei1xian3 ren2wu4 he2zuo4。dan4 zhe4 dui4 wo3men5 ye3 you3 hao3chu3。"

msgid ""
"I won't need luck, outsider. Harrow - my *husband* - taught me how. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stares at Glory, and her eyes are sad. She raises her hands, and they begin to glow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See for yourself."
msgstr ""
"我​不​需要​运气​，​外来者​。​我​的​*​丈夫​*​哈罗​教会​了​我​如何​战斗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​凝视着​格洛丽​，​眼中​满是​悲伤​。​她​举起​双手​，​掌心​开始​泛起​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​自己​看吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 yun4qi5，wai4 lai2 zhe3。wo3 de5*zhang4fu5*ha1luo2 jiao1hui4 le5 wo3 ru2he2 zhan4dou4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2，yan3zhong1 man3 shi4 bei1shang1。ta1 ju3qi3 shuang1shou3，zhang3xin1 kai1shi3 fan4qi3 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zi4ji3 kan4 ba1。"

msgid "I won't take up any more of your time."
msgstr ""
"我​就​不​占用​你​的​时间​了​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 bu4 zhan4yong4 ni3 de5 shi2jian1 le5。"

msgid "I won't!"
msgstr ""
"我​不会​的​！\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 de5！"

msgid ""
"I won't. And to answer your question, yes... I did live here.\n"
"\n"
"I was like you. A scared kid, brought here by Marta for a chance at a new life."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​的​。​另外​关于​你​的​问题​，​没错​……​我​以前​确实​住​在​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那时​的​我​和​你​一样​，​是​个​胆怯​的​孩子​，​被玛​尔塔​带到​这里​，​寻求​新​生活​的​机会​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 de5。ling4wai4 guan1yu2 ni3 de5 wen4ti2，mei2cuo4……wo3 yi3qian2 que4shi2 zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"na4shi2 de5 wo3 he4 ni3 yi1yang4，shi4 ge4 dan3qie4 de5 hai2zi5，bei4 Ma3er3ta3 dai4 dao4 zhe4li3，xun2qiu2 xin1 sheng1huo2 de5 ji1hui4。"

msgid ""
"I won't. Not ever.\n"
"\n"
"Now please, call your contact and tell him that the job is done. I want to be on the next train out of here, and after that, I never even want to *think* about the Lodge again."
msgstr ""
"我​永远​不会​忘记​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​立刻​联系​你​的​联络人​，​告诉​他​任务​已经​完成​。​我要​搭​下​一班​离开​这里​的​火车​，​之后​我​甚至​不想​再​*​想起​*​任何​有关​“​结社​”​的​事情​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 wang4ji4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 li4ke4 lian2xi4 ni3 de5 lian2luo4ren2，gao4su4 ta1 ren4wu5 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2。wo3 yao4 da1 xia4 yi1 ban1 li2kai1 zhe4li3 de5 huo3che1，zhi1hou4 wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4xiang3 zai4*xiang3qi3*ren4he2 you3guan1“jie2she4” de5 shi4qing5 le5。"

msgid "I wonder how long she’ll last in there."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​她​能​在​里面​坚持​多久​。\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 neng2 zai4 li3mian4 jian1chi2 duo1jiu3。"

msgid ""
"I wonder how long she’ll last in there.\n"
"\n"
"Forever may not be enough."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​她​能​在​里面​坚持​多久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​多久​都​不够​她​赎罪​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 neng2 zai4 li3mian4 jian1chi2 duo1jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 duo1jiu3 dou1 bu4gou4 ta1 shu2zui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I wonder how long she’ll last in there.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich shoots a backward glance at the wretched woman, still silently raging in her glass prison.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Forever may not be long enough."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​她​能​在​里面​坚持​多久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​回头​瞥​了​一眼​那个​仍​在​玻璃​牢笼​中​默默​哀号​的​可怜​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​多久​都​不够​她​赎罪​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 neng2 zai4 li3mian4 jian1chi2 duo1jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 hui2tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4ge5 reng2 zai4 bo1li5 lao2long2 zhong4 mo4mo4 ai1hao2 de5 ke3lian2 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 duo1jiu3 dou1 bu4gou4 ta1 shu2zui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I wonder how long she’ll last in there.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shoots a backward glance at the wretched woman, still silently raging in her glass prison.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Forever may not be enough."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​她​能​在​里面​坚持​多久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​回头​瞥​了​一眼​那个​仍​在​玻璃​牢笼​中​默默​哀号​的​可怜​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​多久​都​不够​她​赎罪​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 neng2 zai4 li3mian4 jian1chi2 duo1jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui2tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4ge5 reng2 zai4 bo1li5 lao2long2 zhong4 mo4mo4 ai1hao2 de5 ke3lian2 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 duo1jiu3 dou1 bu4gou4 ta1 shu2zui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I wonder how long she’ll last in there.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her tone is cool. Seemingly indifferent.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"不​知道​她​能​在​里面​坚持​多久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​语气​很淡​定​，​甚至​有些​冷漠​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 neng2 zai4 li3mian4 jian1chi2 duo1jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 hen3 dan4 ding4，shen4zhi4 you3xie1 leng3mo4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I wonder how long she’ll last in there.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shoots a backward glance at the wretched woman, still silently raging in her glass prison.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Forever may not be long enough."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​她​能​在​里面​坚持​多久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​回头​瞥​了​一眼​那个​仍​在​玻璃​牢笼​中​默默​哀号​的​可怜​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​多久​都​不够​她​赎罪​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 neng2 zai4 li3mian4 jian1chi2 duo1jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui2tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4ge5 reng2 zai4 bo1li5 lao2long2 zhong4 mo4mo4 ai1hao2 de5 ke3lian2 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 duo1jiu3 dou1 bu4gou4 ta1 shu2zui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I would keep him fed, if I were you. I understand he likes soy-jerky. \n"
"\n"
"But if what I’ve heard is true, he has bonded to you. Unless you mistreat him, you have nothing to worry about. "
msgstr ""
"最好​让​他​吃饱喝足​。​他​应该​喜欢​豆​肉干​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​据我所知​，​他​已经​认​你​为主​。​除非​你​虐待​他​，​否则​你​没有​什么​好​担心​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hao3 rang4 ta1 chi1 bao3 he4 ju4。ta1 ying1gai1 xi3huan5 dou4 rou4gan1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ju4wo3suo3zhi1，ta1 yi3jing1 ren4 ni3 wei2zhu3。chu2fei1 ni3 nu:e4dai4 ta1，fou3ze2 ni3 mei2you3 shen2me5 hao3 dan1xin1 de5。"

msgid "I would perhaps value that bottle at ¥400?"
msgstr ""
"我​大概​会​给​这瓶​酒​估价​¥​400​，​你​意下如何​？\n"
"wo3 da4gai4 hui4 gei3 zhe4 ping2 jiu3 gu1jia4 ¥ 400，ni3 yi4xia4ru2he2？"

msgid "I wouldn't be wearing this uniform if I wasn't."
msgstr ""
"否则​的话​我​就​不会​穿着​这​身​制服​了​。\n"
"fou3ze2 de5hua4 wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 chuan1zhuo2 zhe4 shen1 zhi4fu2 le5。"

msgid "I wouldn't have it any other way."
msgstr ""
"我​求之不得​。\n"
"wo3 qiu2zhi1bu4de2。"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't know. I'm not in charge of the cleaning around here.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hell... nobody is these days, the way things have been going. Hopefully our luck will turn, sooner or later. It'd be nice to take some pride in this place again."
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​知道​。​我​又​不​负责​这​附近​的​清扫​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​见鬼​……​这年头​，​谁​都​不​容易​。​希望​我们​的​运气​迟早会​好转​，​能​再​为​这个​地方​感到​骄傲​就​好​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4。wo3 you4 bu4 fu4ze2 zhe4 fu4jin4 de5 qing1sao3 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jian4gui3……zhe4nian2tou5，shei2 dou1 bu4 rong2yi4。xi1wang4 wo3men5 de5 yun4qi5 chi2 zao3 hui4 hao3zhuan3，neng2 zai4 wei2 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 gan3dao4 jiao1ao4 jiu4 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't listen to them because I knew that I was *right.* I *knew* what had to be done... what they were all blind to.\n"
"\n"
"I was Hermie's big brother. I was the great and celebrated dragonslayer. I knew better."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​听​他们​的话​，​因为​我​知道​我​是​*​对​的​*​。​我​*​知道​*​该​做​什么​……​而​他们​都​被​蒙蔽​了​双眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​赫米​的​哥哥​。​我​是​那个​伟大​而​受​人​爱戴​的​屠龙​勇士​。​我​通晓​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 ting1 ta1men5 de5hua4，yin1wei4 wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3 shi4*dui4 de5*。wo3*zhi1dao4*gai1 zuo4 shen2me5……er2 ta1men5 dou1 bei4 meng2bi4 le5 shuang1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 he4 mi3 de5 ge1ge5。wo3 shi4 na4ge5 wei3da4 er2 shou4 ren2 ai4dai4 de5 tu2 long2 yong3shi4。wo3 tong1xiao3 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't recommend that, Yuli. You know who I am - I can see it in your eyes. You remember me from the old days, right?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice is cold. Sharp.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know what I'm capable of. So do yourself a favor: answer our questions."
msgstr ""
"我​不​这么​建议​，​尤里​。​你​知道​我​是​谁​—​—​我能​从​你​的​眼睛​里​看​出来​。​你​还​记得​我​以前​是​什么样​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​冰冷​而​锐利​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​我​有​什么​手段​。​所以​为了​你​自己​好​，​还是​老实​回答​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 jian4yi4，You2li3。ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 shi4 shei2——wo3 neng2 cong2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5 li3 kan4 chu1lai2。ni3 hai2 ji4de5 wo3 yi3qian2 shi4 shen2me5yang4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bing1leng3 er2 rui4li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 you3 shen2me5 shou3duan4。suo3yi3 wei4le5 ni3 zi4ji3 hao3，hai2shi5 lao3shi5 hui2da2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't suggest driving to Drogenkippe.... the roads aren't safe. \n"
"\n"
"Taking the U-Bahn would be faster, anyway."
msgstr ""
"我​不​建议​开车​去​毒​坑区​……​路上​并​不​安全​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​坐地铁​会​更​快​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 jian4yi4 kai1che1 qu4 du2 keng1 qu1……lu4shang5 bing4 bu4 an1quan2。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 zuo4 de5 tie3 hui4 geng1 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't tell her that. Indeed, I wouldn't attempt to dissuade her from her ideas at all.\n"
"\n"
"My interpretation may be different from hers, but that isn't to say that it's the \"right\" one."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​这么​和​她​讲​。​事实上​，​我​根本​不会​试图​劝阻​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​解读​或许​与​她​不同​，​但​这​并​不​意味着​我​的​解读​就是​“​正确​”​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 he4 ta1 jiang3。shi4shi2shang4，wo3 gen1ben3 bu4hui4 shi4tu2 quan4zu3 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 jie3du2 huo4xu3 yu4 ta1 bu4tong2，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 de5 jie3du2 jiu4shi4“zheng4que4” de5。"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't want to hang around long enough to find out. This is Harrow's personal library.\n"
"\n"
"He used to experiment in here. There were dangerous things in here, $(l.name)... *sick* things."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​在​这花​太​长时间​去​探究​。​这里​是​哈罗​的​私人​图书馆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​曾经​在​这里​做过​实验​。​这里​有​不少​危险​的​东西​，​$(l.name)​……​*​恶心​*​的​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4 hua1 tai4 zhang3 shi2 jian1 qu4 tan4jiu1。zhe4li3 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 si1ren2 tu2shu1guan3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ceng2jing1 zai4 zhe4li3 zuo4 guo4 shi2yan4。zhe4li3 you3 bu4shao3 wei1xian3 de5 dong1xi1，$(l.name)……*e3xin1*de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "I wouldn't want to pry..."
msgstr ""
"我​无意​窥探​……\n"
"wo3 wu2yi4 kui1tan4……"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't worry about Shiawase. They may have their files on me, but they "
"won't take any direct action against the Kreuzbasar. I have... information "
"on several of their executives that would be quite embarrassing if it ever "
"came to light."
msgstr ""
"我​不​担心​幸福​集团​的​事​。​他们​手头上​可能​有​我​的​资料​，​但​他们​不会​对​克洛伊​茨​集市​采取任何​直接​行动​。​我​这里​……​有​关于​他们​几位​高管​的​情报​，​如果​曝光​的话​会​让​他们​十分​难堪​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 dan1xin1 xing4fu2 ji2tuan2 de5 shi4。ta1men5 shou3 tou2 shang4 ke3neng2 you3 wo3 de5 zi1liao4，dan4 ta1men5 bu4hui4 dui4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 cai3 qu3 ren4 he2 zhi2jie1 xing2dong4。wo3 zhe4li3……you3 guan1yu2 ta1men5 ji1 wei4 gao1guan3 de5 qing2bao4，ru2guo3 bao4guang1 de5hua4 hui4 rang4 ta1men5 shi2fen1 nan2kan1。"

msgid ""
"I wouldn't, if I were you. $(l.name) there can kill you with the press of a "
"button."
msgstr ""
"我​建议​你别​轻举妄动​。​$(l.name)​只​需​轻轻​一​按​就​能​要​了​你​的​小命​。\n"
"wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 bie4 qing1ju3wang4dong4。$(l.name) zhi3 xu1 qing1qing1 yi1 an4 jiu4 neng2 yao4 le5 ni3 de5 xiao3 ming4。"

msgid ""
"I wound up at my folks' house sometime around noon. I could hear the Adversary whispering in my ear, telling me what to do. I'd long since learned to listen to its voice; it always rewarded me with extra power when I did its bidding. It told me to knock, so I did.\n"
"\n"
"As the door opened, I could feel a torrent of flames welling up in the astral plane all around me. It told me to channel them into the doorway, into my father. So I did."
msgstr ""
"正午​时分​，​我​回到​了​父母​家​。​我能​听见​魔鬼​在​我​耳边​低语​，​指挥​我该​怎么​做​。​我​早已​学会​倾听​它​的​声音​—​—​每当​我​遵从​它​的​命令​，​它​总会​赐予​我​额外​的​力量​。​它​让​我​敲门​，​于是​我照​做​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大门​开启​的​瞬间​，​我​感受​到​星界​中​翻涌​的​烈焰​洪流​。​它​命令​我​将​火焰​汇聚​于​门廊​，​灌注​进​父亲​体内​。​我照​做​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4wu3 shi2fen1，wo3 hui2dao4 le5 fu4mu3 jia1。wo3 neng2 ting1jian4 mo2gui3 zai4 wo3 er3 bian1 di1yu3，zhi3hui1 wo3 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4。wo3 zao3yi3 xue2hui4 qing1ting1 ta1 de5 sheng1yin1——mei3dang1 wo3 zun1cong2 ta1 de5 ming4ling4，ta1 zong3 hui4 ci4yu3 wo3 e2wai4 de5 li4liang5。ta1 rang4 wo3 qiao1men2，yu2shi4 wo3 zhao4 zuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"da4men2 kai1qi3 de5 shun4jian1，wo3 gan3shou4 dao4 xing1 jie4 zhong4 fan1yong3 de5 lie4yan4 hong2liu2。ta1 ming4ling4 wo3 jiang1 huo3yan4 hui4ju4 yu2 men2lang2，guan4zhu4 jin4 fu4qin1 ti3nei4。wo3 zhao4 zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I wound up in Tübingen. I figured it'd be a safe enough place to find "
"medical attention, and maybe to call home... it's not far from Stuttgart, "
"but it has a huge student community that I figured I could blend into, and "
"the university there has a decent magic department."
msgstr ""
"我​最终​落脚​于图​宾根​。​我​以为​这里​足够​安全​，​既​能​寻求​医疗​救助​，​或许​还​能​当作​落脚点​……​它​离​斯图加特​不远​，​却​拥有​庞大​的​学生​群体​，​我​想​自己​能​融入​其中​，​况且​当地​大学​的​魔法​系​也​颇具​实力​。\n"
"wo3 zui4zhong1 luo4jiao3 yu2 tu2 bin1 gen1。wo3 yi3wei2 zhe4li3 zu2gou4 an1quan2，ji4 neng2 xun2qiu2 yi1liao2 jiu4zhu4，huo4xu3 hai2 neng2 dang4zuo4 la4 jiao3 dian3……ta1 li2 si1tu2jia1te4 bu4 yuan3，que4 yong1you3 pang2da4 de5 xue2sheng5 qun2ti3，wo3 xiang3 zi4ji3 neng2 rong2ru4 qi2zhong1，kuang4qie3 dang1di4 da4xue2 de5 mo2fa3 xi4 ye3 po1ju4 shi2li4。"

msgid ""
"I'M G-G-GOING TO K-KILL YOU! D-do you HEAR ME? I-I'll RIP OUT YOUR SPINE!"
msgstr ""
"我​-​我要​杀​了​你​！​你​-​你​听到​没​？​我​-​我要​扯​出​你​的​脊椎​！\n"
"wo3 -wo3 yao4 sha1 le5 ni3！ni3 -ni3 ting1dao4 mei2？wo3 -wo3 yao4 che3 chu1 ni3 de5 ji3zhui1！"

msgid ""
"I'd also like to repeat my request that the animals be defanged, declawed, and muzzled, preferably someplace far away from the lab. Our having to use them is unavoidable due to their genetic similarity to our targets, but that doesn't mean that we can't take precautions.\n"
"\n"
"-Falkenrath"
msgstr ""
"我​还要​再次​强调​，​我​要求​对​这些​动物​进行​去​牙​、​去​爪​和​戴口套​处理​，​最好​是​在​远离​实验室​的​地方​进行​。​由于​这些​动物​与​我们​的​研究​目标​具有​遗传​相似性​，​我们​不得不​使用​它们​，​但​这​并​不​意味着​我们​不能​采取​预防措施​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​法肯​拉斯\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 yao4 zai4ci4 qiang2diao4，wo3 yao1qiu2 dui4 zhe4xie1 dong4wu4 jin4xing2 qu4 ya2、qu4 zhao3 he4 dai4 kou3 tao4 chu3li3，zui4hao3 shi4 zai4 yuan3li2 shi2yan4shi4 de5 di4fang1 jin4xing2。you2yu2 zhe4xie1 dong4wu4 yu4 wo3men5 de5 yan2jiu1 mu4biao1 ju4you3 yi2chuan2 xiang1si4xing4，wo3men5 bu4de2bu4 shi3yong4 ta1men5，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 bu4neng2 cai3qu3 yu4fang2cuo4shi1。\n"
"\n"
"——Fa3ken3la1si1"

msgid ""
"I'd always thought that killing a dragon would be a heroic thing to do. I used to dream about it as a kid.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, his eyes never moving from the broken body in the containment cell.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't feel like a hero."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​觉得​屠龙​会​是​一项​英雄​般的​事迹​。​我​从小​就​梦想​着​这样​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​，​眼睛​一直​没​离开​收容​舱里​枯槁​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​现在​没有​做​英雄​的​感觉​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 jue2de5 tu2 long2 hui4 shi4 yi1 xiang4 ying1xiong2 ban1 de5 shi4ji4。wo3 cong2xiao3 jiu4 meng4xiang3 zhao2 zhe4yang4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2，yan3jing5 yi1zhi2 mei2 li2kai1 shou1rong2 cang1 li3 ku1gao3 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 mei2you3 zuo4 ying1xiong2 de5 gan3jue2。"

msgid ""
"I'd assume so. It was your management that submitted the paperwork, after "
"all."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​也​是​。​毕竟​是​你们​管理层​提交​的​文件​。\n"
"wo3 cai1 ye3 shi4。bi4jing4 shi4 ni3men5 guan3 li3 ceng2 ti2jiao1 de5 wen2jian4。"

msgid ""
"I'd be willing to bet that we can hold out for two to three months on what's stashed away in that snack bar.\n"
"\n"
"We're sure to be rescued before we run dry."
msgstr ""
"我敢​说​，​靠着​零食​吧台​里​储存​的​那些​东西​，​我们​还​能​再​撑​两到​三个​月​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​弹尽粮绝​之前​，​我们​肯定​会​被​救出去​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 shuo1，kao4 zhao2 ling2shi2 ba1tai2 li3 chu3cun2 de5 na4xie1 dong1xi1，wo3men5 hai2 neng2 zai4 cheng1 liang3 dao4 san1 ge4 yue4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 dan4jin4liang2jue2 zhi1qian2，wo3men5 ken3ding4 hui4 bei4 jiu4 chu1 qu4 de5。"

msgid "I'd better be careful when I talk to dragons."
msgstr ""
"我​和​巨龙​说话​的​时候​最好​小心​点​。\n"
"wo3 he4 ju4long2 shuo1hua4 de5 shi2hou5 zui4hao3 xiao3xin1 dian3。"

msgid ""
"I'd heard that they'd taken a hit a little while back. That was you, huh?\n"
"\n"
"Well, good on you. But you should know they're still alive and well, and that the guy who took over gang leadership is a real piece of work. If anything, they're worse than they were before."
msgstr ""
"我​听说​他们​不久​之前​遭到​了​沉重打击​。​看来​是​你​做​的​了​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​挺​有​本事​的​。​但​你​得​知道​，​他们​又​死灰复燃​了​，​而且​夺取​帮派​大权​的​那个​家伙​绝对​是​个​麻烦​人物​。​说不定​他们​比​之前​更难​对付​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 ta1men5 bu4jiu3 zhi1qian2 zao1dao4 le5 chen2zhong4da3ji1。kan4lai5 shi4 ni3 zuo4 de5 le5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting3 you3 ben3shi4 de5。dan4 ni3 de2 zhi1dao4，ta1men5 you4 si3hui1fu4ran2 le5，er2qie3 duo2qu3 bang1pai4 da4quan2 de5 na4ge5 jia1huo5 jue2dui4 shi4 ge4 ma2fan5 ren2wu4。shuo1bu5ding4 ta1men5 bi3 zhi1qian2 geng1 nan2 dui4fu5 le5。"

msgid "I'd imagine that he's not a huge fan of you, either."
msgstr ""
"看来​他​应该​也​不怎么​喜欢​你​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ta1 ying1gai1 ye3 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 ni3。"

msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr ""
"我​等​你​。\n"
"wo3 deng3 ni3。"

msgid "I'd like that. I'd be willing to bet that we all would."
msgstr ""
"我​等​你​，​我​相信​大家​都​会​等​你​。\n"
"wo3 deng3 ni3，wo3 xiang1xin4 da4jia1 dou1 hui4 deng3 ni3。"

msgid "I'd like to ask you about another member of the team."
msgstr ""
"我​想​和​你​聊聊​队里​的​其他​成员​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2 dui4 li3 de5 qi2ta1 cheng2yuan2。"

msgid "I'd like to ask you about something else."
msgstr ""
"我​有​其他​事要​问​你​。\n"
"wo3 you3 qi2ta1 shi4 yao4 wen4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'd like to get my hands on your dad and his \"Crusaders.\" See how they "
"like pushing someone who can push back."
msgstr ""
"我​真想​跟​你​父亲​还有​他​那群​“​十字军​”​过​过招​，​看看​他们​敢不敢​惹​一个​能​回手​的​人​。\n"
"wo3 zhen1 xiang3 gen1 ni3 fu4qin1 hai2you3 ta1 na4 qun2“shi2zi4jun1” guo4 guo4zhao1，kan4kan5 ta1men5 gan3 bu4 gan3 re3 yi1ge5 neng2 hui2 shou3 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"I'd like to get your take on some of the other people in the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"我​想​听听​你​对​克洛伊​茨​集市​其他人​的​看法​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ting1 ting1 ni3 dui4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 qi2 ta1 ren2 de5 kan4fa3。"

msgid "I'd like to hear a little more about you."
msgstr ""
"我​想​多​了解​一下​你​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 duo1 liao3jie3 yi1xia4 ni3。"

msgid "I'd like to hear about your time in the KSK."
msgstr ""
"我​想​了解​你​在​KSK​服役​时​的​经历​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 liao3jie3 ni3 zai4 KSK fu2yi4 shi2 de5 jing1li4。"

msgid "I'd like to hear more about your part in the Euro Wars."
msgstr ""
"我​想​多​了解​一下​你​在​欧洲​战争​期间​的​事情​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 duo1 liao3jie3 yi1xia4 ni3 zai4 ou1zhou1 zhan4zheng1 qi1jian1 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "I'd like to hear more about your time in Berlin."
msgstr ""
"我​想​多​了解​一下​你们​在​柏林​生活​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 duo1 liao3jie3 yi1xia4 ni3men5 zai4 bo2lin2 sheng1huo2 de5 shi4。"

msgid "I'd like to hear more about your time in the KSK."
msgstr ""
"我​想​了解​更​多​你​在​KSK​服役​时​的​经历​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 liao3jie3 geng1 duo1 ni3 zai4 KSK fu2yi4 shi2 de5 jing1li4。"

msgid ""
"I'd like to take a look at the Encephalon NEXT® system that you have "
"advertised."
msgstr ""
"我​想​看看​你们​在​推销​的​脑接​NEXT​®​系统​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 kan4kan5 ni3men5 zai4 tui1xiao1 de5 nao3 jie1 NEXT ® xi4tong3。"

msgid "I'd like to talk about your organization's policies."
msgstr ""
"我​想​聊聊​你​的​组织​政策​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 liao2 liao2 ni3 de5 zu3zhi1 zheng4ce4。"

msgid "I'd like to talk about your organization."
msgstr ""
"我​想​聊聊​你​的​组织​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 liao2 liao2 ni3 de5 zu3zhi1。"

msgid ""
"I'd like to think that we are. And no, it isn't cheap. But unfortunately, "
"these sorts of enhancements have become nearly mandatory at top-tier schools"
" like the Academy."
msgstr ""
"我​也​希望​如此​。​没错​，​这​并​不​便宜​。​但​遗憾​的​是​，​在​像​学院​这样​的​顶尖​学府​里​，​这​类​增强​设备​几乎​已​成为​必修课​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 ru2ci3。mei2cuo4，zhe4 bing4 bu4 bian4yi2。dan4 yi2han4 de5 shi4，zai4 xiang4 xue2yuan4 zhe4yang4 de5 ding3jian1 xue2fu3 li3，zhe4 lei4 zeng1qiang2 she4bei4 ji1hu1 yi3 cheng2wei2 bi4xiu1ke4。"

msgid ""
"I'd love to talk to your programmers, APEX. But I can't, because you killed "
"them."
msgstr ""
"我​很​愿意​和​你​的​程序员​聊聊​，​APEX​。​但​我​不能​，​因为​你​已经​把​他们​都​杀​了​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 yuan4yi4 he4 ni3 de5 cheng2xu4yuan2 liao2 liao2，APEX。dan4 wo3 bu4neng2，yin1wei4 ni3 yi3jing1 ba3 ta1men5 dou1 sha1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'd never even heard of these bastards before tonight. So how the hell do "
"they know about me?"
msgstr ""
"我​此前​从​没听说过​这些​混蛋​。​所以​他们​是​怎么​知道​我​的​？\n"
"wo3 ci3qian2 cong2 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4 zhe4xie1 hun2dan4。suo3yi3 ta1men5 shi4 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 wo3 de5？"

msgid ""
"I'd prefer it if you didn't lie to me in the future. But otherwise, no... "
"I've done worse on runs before."
msgstr ""
"我​更​希望​你​之后​不要​对​我​说谎​。​不过​话说回来​……​我​之前​也​经历​过​更糟​的​差事​。\n"
"wo3 geng1 xi1wang4 ni3 zhi1hou4 bu4yao4 dui4 wo3 shuo1huang3。bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5……wo3 zhi1qian2 ye3 jing1li4 guo4 geng1 zao1 de5 cha4shi4。"

msgid "I'd rather floss my teeth with monomolecular wire."
msgstr ""
"我​宁愿​用单​分子​线​剔牙​。\n"
"wo3 ning4yuan4 yong4 dan1 fen1zi3 xian4 ti1ya2。"

msgid ""
"I'd rather just hit the Aztechnology facility directly. I can handle "
"whatever they can throw at me."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​想​正面​突入​阿兹特​科技​设施​。​不管​他们​有​什么​本事​，​我​都​能​应付​得来​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 xiang3 zheng4mian4 tu1 ru4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1。bu4guan3 ta1men5 you3 shen2me5 ben3shi4，wo3 dou1 neng2 ying4fu5 de2lai2。"

msgid ""
"I'd rather not go into it, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"Let's just say that I've had bad luck with underexperienced teammates, and leave it at that."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​深入​谈论​这个​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以前​和​一帮​菜鸟​队友​合作​的​时候​运气​不好​，​就​说​到​这儿​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 shen1ru4 tan2lun4 zhe4ge5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 he4 yi1 bang1 cai4niao3 dui4you3 he2zuo4 de5 shi2hou5 yun4qi5 bu4hao3，jiu4 shuo1 dao4 zhe4r5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I'd rather not go into it. I wasn't talking about Monika, if that's what you're thinking.\n"
"\n"
"Let's just say that I've had bad luck with underexperienced teammates, and leave it at that."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​深入​谈论​这个​。​不过​你​大概​是​误会​了​，​我​说​的​不是​莫妮卡​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以前​和​一帮​菜鸟​队友​合作​的​时候​运气​不好​，​就​说​到​这儿​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 shen1ru4 tan2lun4 zhe4ge5。bu4guo4 ni3 da4gai4 shi4 wu4hui4 le5，wo3 shuo1 de5 bu4shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 he4 yi1 bang1 cai4niao3 dui4you3 he2zuo4 de5 shi2hou5 yun4qi5 bu4hao3，jiu4 shuo1 dao4 zhe4r5 ba1。"

msgid "I'd rather not talk about it."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​谈​这个​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 tan2 zhe4ge5。"

msgid "I'd rather you didn't. We'll find another way past the guard."
msgstr ""
"还是​算了​。​我们​另想办法​通过​守卫​。\n"
"hai2shi5 suan4le5。wo3men5 ling4 xiang3 ban4 fa3 tong1guo4 shou3wei4。"

msgid ""
"I'd rather you read the notes. If you're going to help me, I need you fully "
"informed."
msgstr ""
"我​希望​你​先​读完​这些​笔记​。​既然​你​要​帮​我​，​就​必须​全面​了解​情况​。\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 xian1 dou4 wan2 zhe4xie1 bi3ji4。ji4ran2 ni3 yao4 bang1 wo3，jiu4 bi4xu1 quan2mian4 liao3jie3 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"I'd say let’s not get closer to the fire-breathing dragon. \n"
"\n"
"But it looks like that's all we can do at this point, boss."
msgstr ""
"我​不​建议​去​找​那​喷火​的​巨龙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​看起来​我们​现在​只能​这么​做​了​，​老大​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 jian4yi4 qu4 zhao3 na4 pen1huo3 de5 ju4long2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 kan4qi3lai5 wo3men5 xian4zai4 zhi3neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5，lao3da4。"

msgid "I'd say the doc owed you that one, kid."
msgstr ""
"要​我​说​，​这是​医生​欠​你​的​，​孩子​。\n"
"yao4 wo3 shuo1，zhe4 shi4 yi1sheng1 qian4 ni3 de5，hai2zi5。"

msgid "I'd still like to know more about that chrome you're sporting."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​想​多​了解​一下​你​身上​的​镀铬​改造​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 xiang3 duo1 liao3jie3 yi1xia4 ni3 shen1shang5 de5 du4 ge4 gai3zao4。"

msgid "I'd still love to work with you again someday, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"我​仍然​希望​有​一天​能​再次​与​你​合作​。​艾格尔​。\n"
"wo3 reng2ran2 xi1wang4 you3 yi1 tian1 neng2 zai4ci4 yu4 ni3 he2zuo4。Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "I'd very much like to murder your father."
msgstr ""
"我​真想​把​你​父亲​给​弄死​。\n"
"wo3 zhen1 xiang3 ba3 ni3 fu4qin1 gei3 nong4si3。"

msgid ""
"I'd've been ecstatic to see her if I wasn't so ashamed.\n"
"\n"
"She didn't look particularly happy, either."
msgstr ""
"如果​我​当时​不​处在​那么​羞愧​的​情形​之下​，​我​肯定​会​欣喜若狂​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​看起来​也​不怎么​高兴​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 dang1shi2 bu4 chu3zai4 na4me5 xiu1kui4 de5 qing2xing5 zhi1xia4，wo3 ken3ding4 hui4 xin1xi3ruo4kuang2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 ye3 bu4zen3me5 gao1xing4。"

msgid "I'll ask him. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"我会​去​问问​他​。​谢​了​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 qu4 wen4 wen4 ta1。xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'll back you, chief, no matter what you choose to do. But I, for one, hope "
"that you take the offer."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​不管​你​做​什么​决定​我​都​挺​你​。​但​我​还是​希望​你​能​接受​他们​的​提议​。\n"
"tou2r5，bu4guan3 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5 jue2ding4 wo3 dou1 ting3 ni3。dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 jie1shou4 ta1men5 de5 ti2yi4。"

msgid "I'll be careful."
msgstr ""
"我会​小心​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 xiao3xin1 de5。"

msgid "I'll be damned, chief. I think you've out-talked the crazy man."
msgstr ""
"真没想到​，​头儿​。​你​还​真​让​那个​疯​老头​回心转意​了​。\n"
"zhen1 mei2 xiang3 dao4，tou2r5。ni3 hai2 zhen1 rang4 na4ge5 feng1 lao3tou2 hui2xin1zhuan3yi4 le5。"

msgid "I'll be damned. I think you've talked him out of it."
msgstr ""
"真没想到​。​你​还​真​让​他​回心转意​了​。\n"
"zhen1 mei2 xiang3 dao4。ni3 hai2 zhen1 rang4 ta1 hui2xin1zhuan3yi4 le5。"

msgid "I'll be damned. Something's gone right for a change."
msgstr ""
"啧​。​总算​有件事​能​进展​顺利​了​。\n"
"ze2。zong3suan4 you3 jian4 shi4 neng2 jin4zhan3 shun4li4 le5。"

msgid "I'll be going now."
msgstr ""
"我​这​就​走​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "I'll be going now. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"我要​走​了​。​谢谢​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。xie4xie5。"

msgid "I'll be taking you up on that before this thing's over."
msgstr ""
"事​了​之前​，​你​可别​想​跑​路​啊​。\n"
"shi4 le5 zhi1qian2，ni3 ke3 bie4 xiang3 pao2 lu4 a1。"

msgid "I'll be the judge of that."
msgstr ""
"这得​由​我​说了算​。\n"
"zhe4 de2 you2 wo3 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid "I'll be the one asking questions here."
msgstr ""
"我​才​是​这里​能​提问​的​人​。\n"
"wo3 cai2 shi4 zhe4li3 neng2 ti2wen4 de5 ren2。"

msgid "I'll be there."
msgstr ""
"到​时见​。\n"
"dao4 shi2 jian4。"

msgid ""
"I'll be waitin' right here, $(l.guy).\n"
"\n"
"Let me know what happens."
msgstr ""
"我​就​在​这里​等​着​，​$(l.guy)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​搞清楚​下面​的​事情​就​请​告诉​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3 deng3 zhao2，$(l.guy)。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 gao3 qing1 chu3 xia4mian4 de5 shi4qing5 jiu4 qing3 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "I'll be with you when it counts. Right now it doesn't."
msgstr ""
"如果​有​需要的话​我会​跟着​你​的​。​但​现在​明显​没​必要​。\n"
"ru2guo3 you3 xu1 yao4 de5 hua4 wo3 hui4 gen1zhe5 ni3 de5。dan4 xian4zai4 ming2xian3 mei2 bi4yao4。"

msgid "I'll bet that hurt."
msgstr ""
"肯定​很​疼​。\n"
"ken3ding4 hen3 teng2。"

msgid ""
"I'll bet you could get one from Karl, down on the ground floor... no one else 'round here would have anything like that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She checks herself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, except for Parson, of course. He's got more replacement parts than he knows what to do with."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​去​找​找​一楼​的​卡尔​问问​……​除了​他​之外​，​这里​没人会​有​那种​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​当然​，​除了​帕森​。​他​手里​的​替换​零件​都​用​不​过来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 qu4 zhao3 zhao3 yi1 lou2 de5 ka3er3 wen4 wen4……chu2le5 ta1 zhi1wai4，zhe4li3 mei2 ren2 hui4 you3 na4zhong3 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，dang1ran2，chu2le5 pa4 sen1。ta1 shou3li3 de5 ti4huan4 ling2jian4 dou1 yong4 bu4 guo4lai2 le5。"

msgid "I'll buy something if it'll calm you down."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​买点​东西​，​如果​这能​让​你​冷静下来​的话​。\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 mai3 dian3 dong1xi1，ru2guo3 zhe4 neng2 rang4 ni3 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"I'll calm down when I'm out of here and away from you.\n"
"\n"
"Now let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"等​我​离开​这里​以及​离开​你​之后​，​我会​冷静​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我们​还是​继续​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 yi3ji2 li2kai1 ni3 zhi1hou4，wo3 hui4 leng3jing4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 hai2shi5 ji4xu4 zou3 ba1。"

msgid "I'll catch up with you another time."
msgstr ""
"我们​改日​再聊​。\n"
"wo3men5 gai3ri4 zai4 liao2。"

msgid "I'll check it out."
msgstr ""
"我会​看看​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 kan4kan5 de5。"

msgid "I'll cry you a river. You killed Paul Amsel."
msgstr ""
"别装​可怜​了​。​你​杀​了​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​。\n"
"bie4 zhuang1 ke3lian2 le5。ni3 sha1 le5 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3。"

msgid "I'll cry you a river. You killed my friends, asshole."
msgstr ""
"别装​可怜​了​。​你​还​杀​了​我​的​朋友​呢​，​混蛋​。\n"
"bie4 zhuang1 ke3lian2 le5。ni3 hai2 sha1 le5 wo3 de5 peng2you5 ni2，hun2dan4。"

msgid "I'll cry you a river. You overreacted, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"别装​可怜​。​你​就是​反应​过火​了​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"bie4 zhuang1 ke3lian2。ni3 jiu4shi4 fan3ying4 guo4huo3 le5，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "I'll defer to your judgment. What would you suggest?"
msgstr ""
"我​听从​你​的​判断​。​你​有​什么​建议​？\n"
"wo3 ting1cong2 ni3 de5 pan4duan4。ni3 you3 shen2me5 jian4yi4？"

msgid "I'll do it. Count me in."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​这活​我​接​了​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，zhe4 huo2 wo3 jie1 le5。"

msgid "I'll do my best."
msgstr ""
"我会​竭尽全力​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 jie2jin4quan2li4。"

msgid "I'll do that. You're still going to take out his security, right?"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​了​。​你​还​会​帮​我​解决​掉​他​的​安保​措施​吧​？\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 le5。ni3 hai2 hui4 bang1 wo3 jie3jue2 diao4 ta1 de5 an1bao3 cuo4shi1 ba1？"

msgid "I'll do whatever I have to. I have nowhere else to go."
msgstr ""
"我会​尽我所能​。​我​没有​别的​地方​去​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin3 wo3 suo3 neng2。wo3 mei2you3 bie2de5 di4fang1 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I'll do whatever it takes to keep this team and Monika's legacy alive. That "
"includes taking your advice, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"我会​不惜一切​代价​继承​莫妮卡​的​遗志​，​让​这支​队伍​延续下去​。​这​其中​也​包括​采纳​你​的​建议​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 bu4 xi1 yi1 qie1 dai4jia4 ji4cheng2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yi2zhi4，rang4 zhe4 zhi1 dui4wu3 yan2 xu4 xia4 qu4。zhe4 qi2zhong1 ye3 bao1kuo4 cai3na4 ni3 de5 jian4yi4，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "I'll figure it out on my own."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​自己​搞清楚​。\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 zi4ji3 gao3 qing1 chu3。"

msgid "I'll find the machine and break it. You'll be free."
msgstr ""
"我会​找到​机器​并​破坏​它​。​你​会​自由​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 zhao3dao4 ji1qi4 bing4 po4huai4 ta1。ni3 hui4 zi4you2 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'll follow your orders on a run, but we ain't friends, boss. Not anymore.\n"
"\n"
"Now walk away."
msgstr ""
"在​行动​中​我会​遵从​你​的​指令​，​但​我们​不是​朋友​，​老大​。​再也​不是​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​你​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 xing2dong4 zhong4 wo3 hui4 zun1cong2 ni3 de5 zhi3ling4，dan4 wo3men5 bu4shi4 peng2you5，lao3da4。zai4ye3 bu4shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 ni3 li2kai1。"

msgid "I'll get back to you on that."
msgstr ""
"我​商量一下​再​给​你​答复​。\n"
"wo3 shang1 liang2 yi1 xia4 zai4 gei3 ni3 da2fu4。"

msgid "I'll get the bastards who did this."
msgstr ""
"我会​把​这件​事​背后​的​主谋​全部​干掉​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 bei4hou4 de5 zhu3mou2 quan2bu4 gan4diao4。"

msgid "I'll go talk to Altuğ, then."
msgstr ""
"那​我​去​问问​奥图​伊​。\n"
"na4 wo3 qu4 wen4 wen4 ao4 tu2 yi1。"

msgid "I'll have a beer, thanks."
msgstr ""
"给​我​来​杯​啤酒​吧​。\n"
"gei3 wo3 lai2 bei1 pi2jiu3 ba1。"

msgid "I'll hear her out. Go ahead and give us your proof."
msgstr ""
"我​先​听​她​说完​。​继续​，​给​我们​看​你​的​证据​。\n"
"wo3 xian1 ting1 ta1 shuo1 wan2。ji4xu4，gei3 wo3men5 kan4 ni3 de5 zheng4ju4。"

msgid "I'll help. It's what we should've done in the first place."
msgstr ""
"我来​帮​你​。​本来​我们​一​开始​就​该​这么​做​的​。\n"
"wo3 lai2 bang1 ni3。ben3lai2 wo3men5 yi1 kai1shi3 jiu4 gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。"

msgid "I'll hold you to that. Good hunting, Glory."
msgstr ""
"我会​记住​的​，​祝你好运​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 ji4zhu5 de5，zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "I'll just be leaving."
msgstr ""
"我​这​就​离开​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4 jiu4 li2kai1。"

msgid "I'll just get moving, then."
msgstr ""
"那​我​就​过去​了​。\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 guo4qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'll just pretend that I didn't hear that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns to leave.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and... good call, $(l.name). You just saved yourself a world of hurt."
msgstr ""
"我​就​当​没​听到​刚才​那些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转身​准备​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​……​你​的​选择​很​明智​，​$(l.name)​。​你​让​自己​躲开​了​一劫​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 dang1 mei2 ting1dao4 gang1cai2 na4xie1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 zhun3bei4 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4……ni3 de5 xuan3ze2 hen3 ming2zhi4，$(l.name)。ni3 rang4 zi4ji3 duo3kai1 le5 yi1 jie2。"

msgid ""
"I'll keep a seat warm in the safe house for you. Do you know when you'll be "
"back?"
msgstr ""
"我会​在​安全​屋给​你​留个​位置​。​你​多久​能​回来​？\n"
"wo3 hui4 zai4 an1quan2 wu1 gei3 ni3 liu2 ge4 wei4zhi5。ni3 duo1jiu3 neng2 hui2lai5？"

msgid "I'll keep an eye and an ear out for more trouble."
msgstr ""
"我会​随时​关注​附近​是否​有​更​多事​发生​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 sui2shi2 guan1zhu4 fu4jin4 shi4fou3 you3 geng1 duo1shi4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid "I'll keep an eye out."
msgstr ""
"我会​注意​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 zhu4yi4 de5。"

msgid "I'll keep it in mind, thanks."
msgstr ""
"我会​记住​的​，​谢谢​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 ji4zhu5 de5，xie4xie5。"

msgid "I'll keep it in mind."
msgstr ""
"我会​记着​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 ji4 zhao2 de5。"

msgid "I'll keep that in mind. Tell me what else you've heard about them."
msgstr ""
"我​记下​了​。​你​对​他们​还有​其他​了解​吗​？\n"
"wo3 ji4 xia4 le5。ni3 dui4 ta1men5 hai2you3 qi2ta1 liao3jie3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I'll kill that fucking thing - you'll see. That goddamned basilisk is going *down.*\n"
"\n"
"Once we can get down into the sewers again, we might be able to find a way out. This is our chance, Philip!\n"
"\n"
"Wish me luck."
msgstr ""
"我​一定​会​干掉​那​该死​的​东西​—​—​你​等着瞧​。​那​该死​的​蛇​怪​*​死定了​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一旦​我们​能​再次​进入​下水道​，​我们​也许​就​能​找到​一条​出路​。​这是​我们​的​机会​，​菲利普​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝​我​好运​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 gan4diao4 na4 gai1si3 de5 dong1xi1——ni3 deng3zhe5qiao2。na4 gai1si3 de5 she2 guai4*si3 ding4 le5*。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dan4 wo3men5 neng2 zai4ci4 jin4ru4 xia4shui3dao4，wo3men5 ye3xu3 jiu4 neng2 zhao3dao4 yi1 tiao2 chu1lu4。zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 de5 ji1hui4，fei1li4pu3！\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 wo3 hao3yun4 ba1。"

msgid "I'll kill you myself!"
msgstr ""
"我要​亲手​杀​了​你​！\n"
"wo3 yao4 qin1shou3 sha1 le5 ni3！"

msgid "I'll leave it in your hands."
msgstr ""
"那​我​就​交给​你​了​。\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 jiao1gei3 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'll leave the matter in your capable hands, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"When you've acquired the necessary funds and are ready to head back out to the Rabbit Hole, let me know. From there, we will discuss our next steps."
msgstr ""
"这件​事​就​靠你了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​筹集​到​所​需​资金​，​准备​重返​兔子​洞时​，​请​告知​我​。​届时​我们​将​商讨​后续​行动​方案​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4 jiu4 kao4 ni3 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 chou2ji2 dao4 suo3 xu1 zi1jin1，zhun3bei4 chong2fan3 tu4zi5 dong4 shi2，qing3 gao4zhi1 wo3。jie4shi2 wo3men5 jiang1 shang1tao3 hou4xu4 xing2dong4 fang1an4。"

msgid "I'll leave you be."
msgstr ""
"我​不​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid "I'll leave you to it, then."
msgstr ""
"那​我​就​不​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 bu4 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid "I'll leave you to it."
msgstr ""
"那​就​交给​你​了​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 jiao1gei3 ni3 le5。"

msgid "I'll leave you to your work."
msgstr ""
"我​不​打扰​你​工作​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 da3rao3 ni3 gong1zuo4 le5。"

msgid "I'll live."
msgstr ""
"死不了​。\n"
"si3bu4liao3。"

msgid ""
"I'll make this easy for you. If you don't feed these ghouls, I'm gonna feed "
"you to them."
msgstr ""
"我​直说​吧​。​如果​你​不​喂​这些​尸鬼​，​我​就​拿​你​喂​他们​。\n"
"wo3 zhi2 shuo1 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 wei2 zhe4xie1 shi1 gui3，wo3 jiu4 na2 ni3 wei2 ta1men5。"

msgid "I'll manage."
msgstr ""
"我​尽量​。\n"
"wo3 jin3liang4。"

msgid ""
"I'll manage. But if you give us what we want, this'll go a whole lot easier "
"on you."
msgstr ""
"我​自有办法​。​但​如果​你​愿意​老实​合作​的话​，​就​能​少受​很多​罪​。\n"
"wo3 zi4 you3 ban4 fa3。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 lao3shi5 he2zuo4 de5hua4，jiu4 neng2 shao3 shou4 hen3 duo1 zui4。"

msgid ""
"I'll point out other stuff when we see it... there was this one guy that I locked in a room with a manipulator arm... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He wipes a tear from the corner of his eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was fuckin' *classic.*"
msgstr ""
"还有​其他​的​呢​，​等​我们​路过​的​时候​我​再​给​你​讲讲​……​我​还​把​某个​人​和​一支​机械​臂锁​在​同一个​房间​里​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拭去​眼角​的​一滴​泪水​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​可太​他​妈​*​经典​*​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 qi2ta1 de5 ni2，deng3 wo3men5 lu4guo4 de5 shi2hou5 wo3 zai4 gei3 ni3 jiang3 jiang3……wo3 hai2 ba3 mou3 ge4 ren2 he4 yi1 zhi1 ji1xie4 bi4 suo3 zai4 tong2 yi1 ge4 fang2jian1 li3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shi4 qu4 yan3jiao3 de5 yi1 di1 lei4shui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 ke3 tai4 ta1 ma1*jing1dian3*le5。"

msgid ""
"I'll put it to you another way: is Schattennest safe? Can we stop worrying "
"about this?"
msgstr ""
"那​我​换个​问法​吧​：​影巢​安全​了​吗​？​我们​是不是​可以​不用​担心​这个​了​？\n"
"na4 wo3 huan4 ge4 wen4 fa3 ba1：ying3 chao2 an1quan2 le5 ma5？wo3men5 shi4bu5shi4 ke3yi3 bu4yong4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5 le5？"

msgid ""
"I'll reserve judgment. You're helping people, and that's what's important."
msgstr ""
"我​保留意见​。​你​在​帮助​他人​，​这才​是​最​重要​的​。\n"
"wo3 bao3 liu2 yi4 jian4。ni3 zai4 bang1zhu4 ta1ren2，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5。"

msgid "I'll say whatever I--"
msgstr ""
"我​想​说​什么​就​说​—​—\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5 jiu4 shuo1 — —"

msgid ""
"I'll second that bet.\n"
"\n"
"It'll go easier for you if you let us upstairs. We'll get out of your hair and become somebody else's problem.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and Frank? I *am* threatening you."
msgstr ""
"我​也​跟​注​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​识相​点放​我们​上楼​，​你​还​能​好​过​一点​。​我们​要​找​别人​的​麻烦​，​自然​就​不会​来​找​你​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​你​叫​弗兰克​是​吧​？​我​就​*​是​*​在​威胁​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 gen1 zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"shi2xiang4 dian3 fang4 wo3men5 shang4lou2，ni3 hai2 neng2 hao3 guo4 yi1dian3。wo3men5 yao4 zhao3 bie2ren5 de5 ma2fan5，zi4ran2 jiu4 bu4hui4 lai2 zhao3 ni3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，ni3 jiao4 fu2lan2ke4 shi4 ba1？wo3 jiu4*shi4*zai4 wei1xie2 ni3。"

msgid "I'll see what I can do. No promises."
msgstr ""
"我会​尽力而为​。​不​做​保证​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin4li4er2wei2。bu4 zuo4 bao3zheng4。"

msgid "I'll see you around, lady."
msgstr ""
"回头见​，​女士​。\n"
"hui2tou2jian4，nu:3shi4。"

msgid "I'll see you around."
msgstr ""
"回头见​。\n"
"hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid ""
"I'll spare you the details on the other little tasks that I had you perform,"
" but suffice it to say that each was an arrow aimed at the heart of a rival."
" And the elimination of Aleshire on your trial run created a vacancy within "
"my organization that only I could fill... he was one of us, by the way."
msgstr ""
"至于​委托​你​的​其他​小​任务​，​我​就​不​赘述​了​。​但​可以​说​，​它们​犹如​射​向​竞争对手​心脏​的​利箭​。​而​你​在​执行​试镜​任务​时​除掉​阿利​希尔​的​举动​，​刚好​在​我​的​组织​内部​创造​了​一个​只有​我能​填补​的​空位​……​顺带​一提​，​他​的确​是​我们​的​一员​。\n"
"zhi4yu2 wei3tuo1 ni3 de5 qi2ta1 xiao3 ren4wu5，wo3 jiu4 bu4 zhui4shu4 le5。dan4 ke3yi3 shuo1，ta1men5 you2ru2 she4 xiang4 jing4zheng1dui4shou3 xin1zang4 de5 li4 jian4。er2 ni3 zai4 zhi2xing2 shi4jing4 ren4wu5 shi2 chu2diao4 e1 li4 xi1er3 de5 ju3dong4，gang1hao3 zai4 wo3 de5 zu3zhi1 nei4bu4 chuang4zao4 le5 yi1ge5 zhi3you3 wo3 neng2 tian2bu3 de5 kong1wei4……shun4dai4 yi1 ti2，ta1 di2que4 shi4 wo3men5 de5 yi1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"I'll spare you the gory details, $(l.name). Suffice it to say that my team was wiped out.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger's face clouds again. You can see the tears beginning to well in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I watched Metzger die."
msgstr ""
"那些​血腥​的​细节​我​就​略过​了​，​$(l.name)​。​总之​，​我们​整支​小队​全军覆没​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​脸色​又​阴沉​下来​。​你​能​看到​她​眼中​泛起​泪光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​眼睁睁​看着​梅茨​格死​在​我​面前​。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 xue4xing1 de5 xi4jie2 wo3 jiu4 lu:e4guo4 le5，$(l.name)。zong3zhi1，wo3men5 zheng3 zhi1 xiao3 dui4 quan2jun1fu4mo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 lian3se4 you4 yin1chen2 xia4lai5。ni3 neng2 kan4dao4 ta1 yan3zhong1 fan4qi3 lei4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yan3zheng1zheng1 kan4 zhao2 mei2 ci2 ge2 si3 zai4 wo3 mian4qian2。"

msgid "I'll start on it right now. See you later."
msgstr ""
"我​这​就​开始​研究​。​回见​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4 jiu4 kai1shi3 yan2jiu1。hui2jian4。"

msgid "I'll take a look at it. Come back in a day or so."
msgstr ""
"我会​看看​的​。​过​一天​再来​吧​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 kan4kan5 de5。guo4 yi1 tian1 zai4 lai2 ba1。"

msgid "I'll take a rain check... it's been a big day, like you said."
msgstr ""
"我们​下次​再​约​吧​……​如​你​所说​，​今天​我​确实​累坏​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 xia4ci4 zai4 yao1 ba1……ru2 ni3 suo3 shuo1，jin1tian1 wo3 que4shi2 lei4huai4 le5。"

msgid "I'll take care of it."
msgstr ""
"交给​我​吧​。\n"
"jiao1gei3 wo3 ba1。"

msgid "I'll take it under advisement."
msgstr ""
"我会​考虑​这​一点​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 kao3lu:4 zhe4 yi1dian3 de5。"

msgid "I'll take it. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"那​我​就​收下​了​。​谢谢​。\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 shou1xia4 le5。xie4xie5。"

msgid "I'll take the job."
msgstr ""
"我会​接下​差事​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 jie1xia4 cha4shi4。"

msgid "I'll take what I can get."
msgstr ""
"我要​把​能​拿​的​东西​都​拿走​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 ba3 neng2 na2 de5 dong1xi1 dou1 na2zou3。"

msgid "I'll take your word for it."
msgstr ""
"我​相信​你​的话​。\n"
"wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5hua4。"

msgid "I'll take your word for it. I have another question for you, though."
msgstr ""
"我​相信​你​的话​。​不过​我​还有​一个​问题​要​问​你​。\n"
"wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5hua4。bu4guo4 wo3 hai2you3 yi1ge5 wen4ti2 yao4 wen4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'll take your word for it. I'm not planning on making a habit of this.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She slaps the side of the power conduit with a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And I shouldn't need to. The tap's all hooked up and ready."
msgstr ""
"我​相信​你​。​不过​我​不会​把​这种​事​当成​习惯​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​微笑​着​拍​了​下​导电​管​的​侧面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​应该​也​不​需要​再​这么​做​了​。​电力​接口​已经​安装​完毕​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3。bu4guo4 wo3 bu4hui4 ba3 zhe4zhong3 shi4 dang4cheng2 xi2guan4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1xiao4 zhao2 pai1 le5 xia4 dao3dian4 guan3 de5 ce4mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 ying1gai1 ye3 bu4 xu1yao4 zai4 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。dian4li4 jie1kou3 yi3jing1 an1zhuang1 wan2bi4 le5。"

msgid "I'll take your word for it. Let's move."
msgstr ""
"我​相信​你​的话​。​我们​行动​吧​。\n"
"wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5hua4。wo3men5 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid "I'll talk to him, then. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"我会​去​问问​他​。​谢​了​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 qu4 wen4 wen4 ta1。xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'll talk to them. The ones who want to talk, anyway. Some people around "
"here don't think that well of me."
msgstr ""
"我会​和​他们​聊聊​。​至少​是​和​那些​愿意​的​人​。​这里​的​某些​人​对​我​的​评价​不太高​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 he4 ta1men5 liao2 liao2。zhi4shao3 shi4 he4 na4xie1 yuan4yi4 de5 ren2。zhe4li3 de5 mou3xie1 ren2 dui4 wo3 de5 ping2jia4 bu4 tai4 gao1。"

msgid "I'll talk to you later."
msgstr ""
"我们​回头​聊​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui2tou2 liao2。"

msgid "I'll tell my friend it's not safe."
msgstr ""
"我会​和​我​朋友​说​它​不​安全​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 he4 wo3 peng2you5 shuo1 ta1 bu4 an1quan2。"

msgid ""
"I'll tell you all about it sometime. Right now though I have some errands to run - come over sometime and we can chat over hookah or something, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before turning her focus to a comm at her wrist..{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​改天​会​详细​告诉​你​，​不过​现在​我​得​去​办点​事​—​—​有空​过来​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转向​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gai3tian1 hui4 xiang2xi4 gao4su4 ni3，bu4guo4 xian4zai4 wo3 de2 qu4 ban4 dian3 shi4——you3kong4 guo4lai2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I'll tell you all about it sometime. Right now though I have some errands to run - come over sometime and we can chat over hookah or something, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before turning her focus to a comm at her wrist.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​改天​会​详细​告诉​你​，​不过​现在​我​得​去​办点​事​—​—​有空​过来​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转向​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gai3tian1 hui4 xiang2xi4 gao4su4 ni3，bu4guo4 xian4zai4 wo3 de2 qu4 ban4 dian3 shi4——you3kong4 guo4lai2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "I'll tell you the same thing that I told him: That AIN'T gonna HAPPEN."
msgstr ""
"我用​回​他​的话​再​跟​你​讲​一遍​：​不​可能​，​没门​。\n"
"wo3 yong4 hui2 ta1 de5hua4 zai4 gen1 ni3 jiang3 yi1bian4：bu4 ke3neng2，mei2 men2。"

msgid ""
"I'll tell you what we're going to do. We're going to follow Winters' advice."
" We're gonna find Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"当然​是​这么​办​。​我们​按照​温特斯​的​建议​，​去​找到​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"dang1ran2 shi4 zhe4me5 ban4。wo3men5 an4zhao4 Wen1te4si1 de5 jian4yi4，qu4 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"I'll tell you what you are. You're the kind of person that Harrow has always warned us about.\n"
"\n"
"Your sense of moral outrage doesn't trump our right to live the way that we choose."
msgstr ""
"还是​我来​告诉​你​吧​。​你​正是​哈罗​一直​告诫​我们​要​提防​的​那种​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​那套​道德​义愤​的​论调​并​不能​凌驾于​我们​选择​生活​方式​的​权利​之上​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 wo3 lai2 gao4su4 ni3 ba1。ni3 zheng4shi4 ha1luo2 yi1zhi2 gao4jie4 wo3men5 yao4 di1fang5 de5 na4zhong3 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 na4 tao4 dao4de2 yi4fen4 de5 lun4diao4 bing4 bu4neng2 ling2 jia4 yu2 wo3men5 xuan3ze2 sheng1huo2 fang1shi4 de5 quan2li4 zhi1shang4。"

msgid ""
"I'll tell you what. You tell their leader that I'll continue feeding them.\n"
"\n"
"In return, they'll keep the sewers maintained, like they used to, and they'll agree to do odd jobs for me when I call."
msgstr ""
"这样​吧​。​你​和​它们​的​头儿​说​，​我会​继续​饲喂​它们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​作为​回报​，​它们​要​像​以前​一样​好好​维护​下水道​，​以及​随时​听​我​的​吩咐​去​做​一些​奇怪​的​差事​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1。ni3 he4 ta1men5 de5 tou2r5 shuo1，wo3 hui4 ji4xu4 si4wei4 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，ta1men5 yao4 xiang4 yi3qian2 yi1yang4 hao3hao3 wei2hu4 xia4shui3dao4，yi3ji2 sui2shi2 ting1 wo3 de5 fen1fu5 qu4 zuo4 yi1xie1 qi2guai4 de5 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"I'll tell you when we're going to move on. For now, I want to check out "
"those terminals."
msgstr ""
"走​不​走​由​我​说了算​。​目前​我​想​先​检查一下​这些​终端​。\n"
"zou3 bu4 zou3 you2 wo3 shuo1le5suan4。mu4qian2 wo3 xiang3 xian1 jian3 cha2 yi1 xia4 zhe4xie1 zhong1duan1。"

msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr ""
"我会​考虑​考虑​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 kao3lu:4 kao3lu:4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'll try to take care of myself as best as I can - I don't want to be a burden. I brought my taser, and I have a little hold-out pistol for self defense.\n"
"\n"
"But I've never fired at a living thing before, let alone a person. I'm really hoping that I won't have to."
msgstr ""
"我会​尽力​照顾​好​自己​—​—​我​也​不想​当​个​累赘​。​我​带来​了​我​的​泰瑟枪​，​还备​了​把​小​手枪​防身​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​从未​对​活物​开过​枪​，​更​别说​人​了​。​但愿​这次​任务​能​平安​结束​，​别出​什么​岔子​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin4li4 zhao4gu5 hao3 zi4ji3——wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 dang1 ge4 lei2zhui4。wo3 dai4lai2 le5 wo3 de5 tai4se4qiang1，hai2 bei4 le5 ba3 xiao3 shou3qiang1 fang2shen1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 cong2wei4 dui4 huo2wu4 kai1 guo4 qiang1，geng1 bie2shuo1 ren2 le5。dan4yuan4 zhe4 ci4 ren4wu5 neng2 ping2an1 jie2shu4，bie4 chu1 shen2me5 cha4zi5。"

msgid ""
"I'll try to take care of myself as best as I can - I don't want to be a burden. I brought my taser, and I have a little hold-out pistol for self defense.\n"
"\n"
"I've never fired at a living thing before, though. And I'm really hoping that I won't have to."
msgstr ""
"我会​尽力​照顾​好​自己​—​—​我​也​不想​当​个​累赘​。​我​带来​了​我​的​泰瑟枪​，​还备​了​把​小​手枪​防身​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​从未​对​活物​开过​枪​，​更​别说​人​了​。​但愿​这次​任务​能​平安​结束​，​别出​什么​岔子​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin4li4 zhao4gu5 hao3 zi4ji3——wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 dang1 ge4 lei2zhui4。wo3 dai4lai2 le5 wo3 de5 tai4se4qiang1，hai2 bei4 le5 ba3 xiao3 shou3qiang1 fang2shen1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 cong2wei4 dui4 huo2wu4 kai1 guo4 qiang1，geng1 bie2shuo1 ren2 le5。dan4yuan4 zhe4 ci4 ren4wu5 neng2 ping2an1 jie2shu4，bie4 chu1 shen2me5 cha4zi5。"

msgid "I'll try."
msgstr ""
"我​尽量​吧​。\n"
"wo3 jin3liang4 ba1。"

msgid "I'll work with your team."
msgstr ""
"我会​和​你​安排​的​小队​合作​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 he4 ni3 an1pai2 de5 xiao3 dui4 he2zuo4。"

msgid "I'll, uh... I 'll take you up on your offer."
msgstr ""
"我​，​呃​……​我​同意​你​的​建议​。\n"
"wo3，e4……wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 jian4yi4。"

msgid ""
"I'll... I'll be okay.\n"
"\n"
"But I have some bad news for you. Our teammates sort of, um, jumped the gun a little.\n"
"\n"
"They're already inside."
msgstr ""
"我​……​我​没​问题​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​有​个​坏消息​要​告诉​你​。​其他​的​队友​们​有点​……​操之过急​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​已经​在​里面​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 mei2 wen4ti2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 you3 ge4 huai4 xiao1 xi1 yao4 gao4su4 ni3。qi2ta1 de5 dui4you3 men5 you3dian3……cao1zhi1guo4ji2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yi3jing1 zai4 li3mian4 le5。"

msgid "I'm $(s.name), by the way."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​$(s.name)​。\n"
"wo3 jiao4 $(s.name)。"

msgid "I'm $(s.name). Maybe you've heard of me."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​$(s.name)​。​你​也许​听过​我​的​名字​。\n"
"wo3 jiao4 $(s.name)。ni3 ye3xu3 ting1 guo4 wo3 de5 ming2zi5。"

msgid "I'm $(s.name). Pleased to meet you, Miss..."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​$(s.name)​。​很​高兴​认识​你​，​还​未​请教​……\n"
"wo3 jiao4 $(s.name)。hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，hai2 wei4 qing3jiao4……"

msgid "I'm $(s.name). Pleased to meet you."
msgstr ""
"我​是​$(s.name)​。​很​高兴​认识​你​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 $(s.name)。hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'm *not* your son. My father was a drunken bastard who used to burn me with his cigarettes when he got angry.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns on Dietrich.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But then, *you* already knew that, didn't you? He's *your* brother."
msgstr ""
"我​*​不是​*​你​的​孩子​。​我​父亲​是​个​酒鬼​混蛋​，​每次​一​生气​就​用​烟头烫​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转向​迪​特里​希​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​话说回来​，​*​你​*​早就​知道​这些​了​，​对​吧​？​毕竟​他​可是​*​你​*​兄弟​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*bu4shi4*ni3 de5 hai2zi5。wo3 fu4qin1 shi4 ge4 jiu3gui3 hun2dan4，mei3ci4 yi1 sheng1qi4 jiu4 yong4 yan1 tou2 tang4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 Di2te4li3xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，*ni3*zao3jiu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 le5，dui4 ba1？bi4jing4 ta1 ke3shi4*ni3*xiong1di4。"

msgid ""
"I'm Ullrich, leader of the Berlin chapter of the Arbeiters. We're a policlub... small, but growing.\n"
"\n"
"We serve the People of the working class. Protect them from the parasites that would exploit them."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​乌尔里​希​，​是​工人​帮​柏林​分部​的​首领​。​我们​是​个​政治​团体​……​虽然​规模​不​大​，​但​目前​仍​在​不断​发展​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​为​广大​工人阶级​群众​服务​，​保护​他们​免受​那些​寄生虫​的​剥削​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiao4 wu1 er3 li3 xi1，shi4 gong1ren2 bang1 bo2lin2 fen1bu4 de5 shou3ling3。wo3men5 shi4 ge4 zheng4zhi4 tuan2ti3……sui1ran2 gui1mo2 bu4 dai4，dan4 mu4qian2 reng2 zai4 bu4duan4 fa1zhan3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 wei2 guang3da4 gong1ren2jie1ji2 qun2zhong4 fu2wu4，bao3hu4 ta1men5 mian3shou4 na4xie1 ji4sheng1chong2 de5 bo1xue1。"

msgid ""
"I'm a better friend than you know. I just got you out of a toxic "
"relationship."
msgstr ""
"我​这样​才​是​靠​谱​的​朋友​。​我​帮​你​从​一段​糟糕​的​感情​中​解脱​出来​了​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4yang4 cai2 shi4 kao4 pu3 de5 peng2you5。wo3 bang1 ni3 cong2 yi1 duan4 zao1gao1 de5 gan3qing2 zhong4 jie3tuo1 chu1lai2 le5。"

msgid "I'm a big boy, Glory. I can handle a few bad dreams."
msgstr ""
"我​是​个​大人​，​格洛丽​。​噩梦​对​我​来说​不算什么​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 ge4 da4ren5，Ge2luo4li2。e4meng4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2。"

msgid "I'm a big girl, Glory. I can handle a few bad dreams."
msgstr ""
"我​是​个​大人​，​格洛丽​。​噩梦​对​我​来说​不算什么​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 ge4 da4ren5，Ge2luo4li2。e4meng4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2。"

msgid ""
"I'm a consultant. Aztechnology security brought me in to check up on you."
msgstr ""
"我​是​一名​顾问​。​阿兹特​科技​的​安保​部门​让​我​来​检查​你们​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 yi1 ming2 gu4wen4。E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 an1bao3 bu4men2 rang4 wo3 lai2 jian3cha2 ni3men5。"

msgid "I'm a little busy out here, too, Blitz! What do you want me to do?"
msgstr ""
"我​现在​也​有点​脱不开​身​，​布里​茨​！​你​要​我​做​什么​？\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 ye3 you3dian3 tuo1 bu4 kai1 shen1，Bu4li3ci2！ni3 yao4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"I'm a little busy right now, chief. Gotta get things ready for the bank job, after all.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks again for helping out with that, by the way... you're a lifesaver!"
msgstr ""
"我​现在​有点​忙​，​头儿​。​我​得​为​银行​的​差事​做好​准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​再次​感谢​你​帮忙​……​你​真是​太好了​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 you3dian3 mang2，tou2r5。wo3 de2 wei2 yin2hang2 de5 cha4shi4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3 bang1mang2……ni3 zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5！"

msgid ""
"I'm a little surprised that you want to hire me. We haven't always seen eye "
"to eye."
msgstr ""
"我​没想到​你​会​打算​雇​我​。​咱们​之间​可不​怎么​对付​啊​。\n"
"wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 ni3 hui4 da3suan4 gu4 wo3。zan2men5 zhi1jian1 ke3bu5 zen3me5 dui4fu5 a1。"

msgid ""
"I'm a little surprised to hear you say that, Dietrich. You've always struck "
"me as... fearless, for lack of a better word."
msgstr ""
"你​这么​说​让​我​有些​惊讶​，​迪​特里​希​。​在​我​的​印象​里​，​你​总是​那么​……​无畏​，​我​想不出​更好​的​词​了​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1 rang4 wo3 you3xie1 jing1ya4，Di2te4li3xi1。zai4 wo3 de5 yin4xiang4 li3，ni3 zong3shi4 na4me5……wu2 wei4，wo3 xiang3 bu4 chu1 geng1 hao3 de5 ci2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm a member of the Homeowners' Association for this level. You know what that means? I have a *lot* of pull with building management.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He thrusts an outstretched finger at James.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your days wearing that uniform are numbered. I promise you that!"
msgstr ""
"我​是​本​楼层​业主​委员会​的​成员​。​知道​这​意味着​什么​吗​？​我​在​物业管理​方面​可是​有​*​很大​*​话语权​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​伸出​一根​手指​指向​詹姆斯​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​准备​脱衣服​走人​了​。​我​向​你​保证​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 ben3 lou2ceng2 ye4zhu3 wei3yuan2hui4 de5 cheng2yuan2。zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5 ma5？wo3 zai4 wu4ye4guan3li3 fang1mian4 ke3shi4 you3*hen3 dai4*hua4yu3quan2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1chu1 yi1 gen1 shou3zhi3 zhi3xiang4 zhan1mu3si1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 zhun3bei4 tuo1yi1fu2 zou3ren2 le5。wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4！"

msgid ""
"I'm a spider. My specialty is taking over building security systems.\n"
"\n"
"To do that, I need to find a data tap. And to do *that,* I need to charge on in with the rest of the team."
msgstr ""
"我​是​网络​蜘蛛​。​我​的​特长​是​接管​大楼​的​安保​系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为此​，​我​需要​接入​数据​插口​；​而​为​*​此​*​，​我​需要​和​其他​队员​共同行动​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 wang3luo4 zhi1zhu1。wo3 de5 te4chang2 shi4 jie1guan3 da4lou2 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3。\n"
"\n"
"wei4ci3，wo3 xu1yao4 jie1ru4 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 ； er2 wei2*ci3*，wo3 xu1yao4 he4 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 gong4 tong2 xing2 dong4。"

msgid ""
"I'm a spirit, all right! And if you don't open this door *right now,* I'm "
"going to come in there and *eat your soul!*"
msgstr ""
"没错​，​我​就是​精魂​！​如果​你​现在​不​*​马上​*​开门​，​我​就要​进来​*​吞噬​你​的​灵魂​*​！\n"
"mei2cuo4，wo3 jiu4shi4 jing1hun2！ru2guo3 ni3 xian4zai4 bu4*ma3shang4*kai1men2，wo3 jiu4yao4 jin4lai2*tun1shi4 ni3 de5 ling2hun2*！"

msgid ""
"I'm about to! There are more places in Germany than just Berlin, and more "
"places in Europe than just Germany! I’m thinking I should head to Madrid "
"next."
msgstr ""
"我​正有此意​！​德国​又​不止​柏林​这​一个​城市​，​而​欧洲​也​不止​德国​这​一个​国家​！​我​接下来​打算​去​马德里​。\n"
"wo3 zheng1 you3 ci3 yi4！de2guo2 you4 bu4zhi3 bo2lin2 zhe4 yi1ge5 cheng2shi4，er2 ou1zhou1 ye3 bu4zhi3 de2guo2 zhe4 yi1ge5 guo2jia1！wo3 jie1xia4lai2 da3suan4 qu4 ma3de2li3。"

msgid "I'm afraid I have some bad news for you, kid."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​我​有​个​坏消息​要​告诉​你​，​孩子​。\n"
"kong3pa4 wo3 you3 ge4 huai4 xiao1 xi1 yao4 gao4su4 ni3，hai2zi5。"

msgid "I'm afraid I have some bad news."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​我​有些​坏消息​。\n"
"kong3pa4 wo3 you3xie1 huai4 xiao1 xi1。"

msgid "I'm afraid Monika didn't make it back from our last job."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​没能​从​我们​的​上次​差事​中​活着​回来​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 mei2 neng2 cong2 wo3men5 de5 shang4ci4 cha4shi4 zhong4 huo2zhe5 hui2lai5。"

msgid "I'm afraid not. But I'll try not to take up too much of your time.\n"
msgstr ""
"恐怕​不行​。​但​我​尽量​不​耽误​你​太​多​时间​。\n"
"kong3pa4 bu4xing2。dan4 wo3 jin3liang4 bu4 dan1wu5 ni3 tai4 duo1 shi2jian1。"

msgid "I'm afraid she's gone."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​她​已经​不​在​了​。\n"
"kong3pa4 ta1 yi3jing1 bu4 zai4 le5。"

msgid "I'm afraid so."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。\n"
"shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm afraid that I can do nothing else to help you. Recover the control chip "
"from Ullrich and fix the elevator if you truly must get downstairs."
msgstr ""
"其他​的​我​也​没​办法​帮​你​了​。​如果​你​一定​要​前往​地下室​，​就​从​乌尔里​希​那里​取回​控制​芯片​，​然后​修好​电梯​吧​。\n"
"qi2ta1 de5 wo3 ye3 mei2 ban4fa3 bang1 ni3 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 yi1ding4 yao4 qian2wang3 di4xia4shi4，jiu4 cong2 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 na4li5 qu3hui2 kong4zhi4 xin1pian4，ran2hou4 xiu1hao3 dian4ti1 ba1。"

msgid "I'm afraid that I can't tell you."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​我​不能​告诉​你​。\n"
"kong3pa4 wo3 bu4neng2 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'm afraid that I don't have time to go back and forth on this. Your viewers"
" can think whatever they wish; my concern is in helping the people affected "
"by this tragedy."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​我​没有​时间​反复​讨论​这个​问题​。​你们​的​观众​想​怎么​看​就​怎么​看吧​，​我​关心​的​是​如何​帮助​受​这场​悲剧​影响​的​人们​。\n"
"kong3pa4 wo3 mei2you3 shi2jian1 fan3fu4 tao3lun4 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。ni3men5 de5 guan1zhong4 xiang3 zen3me5 kan4 jiu4 zen3me5 kan4 ba1，wo3 guan1xin1 de5 shi4 ru2he2 bang1zhu4 shou4 zhe4 chang2 bei1ju4 ying3xiang3 de5 ren2men5。"

msgid "I'm afraid that I haven't. Care to fill me in?"
msgstr ""
"并​没有​。​能​给​我​说​说​吗​？\n"
"bing4 mei2you3。neng2 gei3 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 ma5？"

msgid "I'm afraid this ends here and now."
msgstr ""
"得​在​这里​做个​了​断​。\n"
"de2 zai4 zhe4li3 zuo4 ge4 le5 duan4。"

msgid "I'm all ears, boss. Lay it on us."
msgstr ""
"洗耳恭听​，​老大​。​尽管​说​吧​。\n"
"xi3er3gong1ting1，lao3da4。jin3guan3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid "I'm all ears, chief. Lay it on us."
msgstr ""
"洗耳恭听​，​头儿​。​尽管​说​吧​。\n"
"xi3er3gong1ting1，tou2r5。jin3guan3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid "I'm all ears. How did it go?"
msgstr ""
"洗耳恭听​。​事情​进展​如何​？\n"
"xi3er3gong1ting1。shi4qing5 jin4zhan3 ru2he2？"

msgid "I'm always down to party."
msgstr ""
"来​呗​，​我​一直​都​喜欢​找​乐子​。\n"
"lai2 bei5，wo3 yi1zhi2 dou1 xi3huan5 zhao3 le4zi5。"

msgid "I'm always interested in hearing about new business opportunities."
msgstr ""
"我​一向​对​新​的​业务​机会​感兴趣​。\n"
"wo3 yi1xiang4 dui4 xin1 de5 ye4wu4 ji1hui4 gan3xing4qu4。"

msgid ""
"I'm an anarchist at heart. Always have been. But at the time, I fit squarely into the \"punk\" camp.\n"
"\n"
"I was thirty-two at the time. MESSERKAMPF! was still touring... not as much as we did when we were kids, but we had a following.\n"
"\n"
"I guess I was sort of an \"elder statesman\" for the scene."
msgstr ""
"我​骨子里​一直​就是​个​无政府主义​者​。​但​在​那个​时候​，​我​还是​属于​“​朋克​”​阵营​那​一边​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​时候​我​32​岁​，​MESSERKAMPF​!​还​在​巡演​……​没​我们​年轻​时​那么​频繁​了​，​但​还有​不少​人​愿意​来​捧场​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​某种意义​上​讲​，​我​算是​这个​圈子里​的​“​元老级​人物​”​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gu3zi5li3 yi1zhi2 jiu4shi4 ge4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3。dan4 zai4 na4ge5 shi2hou5，wo3 hai2shi5 shu3yu2“peng2ke4” zhen4ying2 na4 yi1bian1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi2hou5 wo3 32 sui4，MESSERKAMPF! hai2 zai4 xun2yan3……mei2 wo3men5 nian2qing1 shi2 na4me5 pin2fan2 le5，dan4 hai2you3 bu4shao3 ren2 yuan4yi4 lai2 peng3chang3。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 mou3 zhong3 yi4 yi4 shang4 jiang3，wo3 suan4shi4 zhe4ge5 juan1 zi3 li3 de5“yuan2 lao3 ji2 ren2wu4” le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm an old friend of the development lead. We shared a dorm together at the "
"University of Berlin."
msgstr ""
"我​是​开发​负责人​的​老朋友​。​我们​在​柏林​大学​的​时候​是​舍友​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 kai1fa1 fu4ze2ren2 de5 lao3peng2you5。wo3men5 zai4 bo2lin2 da4xue2 de5 shi2hou5 shi4 she4you3。"

msgid "I'm as ready as I'm gonna be."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​准备​好​了​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5。"

msgid "I'm back for my DVD player."
msgstr ""
"我​回来​拿​我​的​DVD​播放器​。\n"
"wo3 hui2lai5 na2 wo3 de5 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4。"

msgid "I'm back for that transmitter."
msgstr ""
"我​回来​买​那个​发射器​了​。\n"
"wo3 hui2lai5 mai3 na4ge5 fa1she4qi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm beginning to regret my decision to reach out to you.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to hear about this job, or not?"
msgstr ""
"我​已经​开始​后悔​为什么​要​找​你​来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​到底​想​不想​了解​这趟​差事​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 hou4hui3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 zhao3 ni3 lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 xiang3 bu4xiang3 liao3jie3 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4？"

msgid "I'm beginning to rethink this."
msgstr ""
"我​开始​有些​后悔​了​。\n"
"wo3 kai1shi3 you3xie1 hou4hui3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm behind you a hundred percent, chief. This is the right call, no question about it.\n"
"\n"
"Now let's get this thing, get it back to your contact, and earn us some money!"
msgstr ""
"我​百分百​挺​你​，​头儿​。​这个​选择​绝对​正确​，​毫无疑问​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱​赶紧​把​东西​弄到手​，​交给​你​的​联络人​，​大​赚​一笔​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bai3fen1bai3 ting3 ni3，tou2r5。zhe4ge5 xuan3ze2 jue2dui4 zheng4que4，hao2wu2yi2wen4。\n"
"\n"
"za2 gan3jin3 ba3 dong1xi1 nong4dao4shou3，jiao1gei3 ni3 de5 lian2luo4ren2，dai4 zhuan4 yi1 bi3！"

msgid "I'm calling bullshit on this one. "
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​你​这​是​扯淡​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 zhe4 shi4 che3dan4。"

msgid "I'm counting on you, boss."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​我全​靠你了​。\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 quan2 kao4 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm curious, Dietrich. Why did you switch from fronting a band to running "
"the shadows?"
msgstr ""
"我​就是​有点​好奇​，​迪​特里​希​。​你​是​怎么​从​乐队​主唱​变成​一个​狂奔​者​的​？\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 you3dian3 hao4qi2，Di2te4li3xi1。ni3 shi4 zen3me5 cong2 yue4dui4 zhu3chang4 bian4cheng2 yi1ge5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 de5？"

msgid ""
"I'm doing this against my better judgment, Dietrich. You just remember: the "
"run comes first."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​，​我​这么​做​其实​是​违背​了​自己​的​判断​。​你​得​记住​：​任务​最​重要​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1，wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 qi2shi2 shi4 wei2bei4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 pan4duan4。ni3 de2 ji4zhu5：ren4wu5 zui4 zhong4yao4。"

msgid "I'm done with this conversation."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​继续​说​下去​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 ji4xu4 shuo1 xia4qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm done with this. If you want to go on slandering the idol that I serve, do it somewhere else.\n"
"\n"
"As for you... you can either change the subject, or you can get ready for a fight. I won't hear any more of your blasphemy."
msgstr ""
"我​受够了​。​如果​你​执意​要​诋毁​我​所​侍奉​的​精魂​导师​，​那么​请​另寻​他处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​你​……​要么​换个​话题​，​要么​就​直接​动手​吧​。​我​一点​也​不想​听​你​亵渎神明​的​言语​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shou4 gou4 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 zhi2yi4 yao4 di3hui3 wo3 suo3 shi4feng4 de5 jing1hun2 dao3shi1，na4me5 qing3 ling4 xun2 ta1 chu3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 ni3……yao4me5 huan4 ge4 hua4ti2，yao4me5 jiu4 zhi2jie1 dong4shou3 ba1。wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4xiang3 ting1 ni3 xie4du2shen2ming2 de5 yan2yu3。"

msgid ""
"I'm either your best friend or your worst nightmare - up to you. Now who are"
" you?"
msgstr ""
"我​可以​是​你​最好​的​朋友​，​或者​是​最​糟糕​的​噩梦​—​—​取决于​你​怎么​选​。​现在​你​说​，​你​是​谁​？\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 shi4 ni3 zui4hao3 de5 peng2you5，huo4zhe3 shi4 zui4 zao1gao1 de5 e4meng4——qu3jue2yu2 ni3 zen3me5 xuan3。xian4zai4 ni3 shuo1，ni3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"I'm fine. He only nicked my thigh.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger wipes her mouth with the back of her hand, then hoists a corpse up from behind the makeshift barricade. A young man, maybe in his early twenties, his eyes frozen wide in surprise. \n"
"\n"
"What's left of his throat hangs down in ragged flaps.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This, up here... it isn't mine."
msgstr ""
"我​没事​。​只是​大腿​上​挨​了​一刀​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔用​手背​擦擦​嘴​，​然后​从​她​的​临时​街垒​后面​拖​出​一具​尸体​。​那​是​个​二十出头​的​年轻人​，​双眼​因​惊愕​而​永远​定格​在​圆​睁​的​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​喉咙​残余​的​部分​像​破布​般​垂落​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​上半身​这些​……​不是​我​的​血​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2shi4。zhi3shi4 da4tui3 shang4 ai1 le5 yi1 dao1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yong4 shou3bei4 ca1 ca1 zui3，ran2hou4 cong2 ta1 de5 lin2shi2 jie1 lei3 hou4mian5 tuo1 chu1 yi1 ju4 shi1ti3。na4 shi4 ge4 er4 shi2 chu1 tou2 de5 nian2qing1ren2，shuang1yan3 yin1 jing1e4 er2 yong3yuan3 ding4ge2 zai4 yuan2 zheng1 de5 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hou2long2 can2yu2 de5 bu4fen5 xiang4 po4bu4 ban1 chui2 la4 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shang4ban4shen1 zhe4xie1……bu4shi4 wo3 de5 xie3。"

msgid "I'm fine. Just another day in Berlin."
msgstr ""
"我​没事​。​柏林​不​就是​这​副​样子​吗​。\n"
"wo3 mei2shi4。bo2lin2 bu4 jiu4shi4 zhe4 fu4 yang4zi5 ma5。"

msgid ""
"I'm fine. Nothing a few swings of a wrench can't fix. Or a few swings of a "
"crutch."
msgstr ""
"我​没事​。​没什么​是​挥​几下​扳手​或者​拐杖​解决不了​的​。\n"
"wo3 mei2shi4。mei2shen2me5 shi4 hui1 ji1 xia4 ban1shou3 huo4zhe3 guai3zhang4 jie3 jue2 bu4 le5 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm from the Kreuzbasar. We think a gang in these parts calling themselves "
"the Rabengeister hijacked a shipment belonging to us. You hear about "
"anything like that?"
msgstr ""
"我​是从​克洛伊​茨​集市​来​的​。​我们​认为​这​附近​有个​自称​“​鸦灵​”​的​帮派​抢走了​一批​属于​我们​的​物资​。​你​有没有​听过​类似​的​名字​？\n"
"wo3 shi4 cong2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 lai2 de5。wo3men5 ren4wei2 zhe4 fu4jin4 you3 ge4 zi4cheng1“Ya1ling2” de5 bang1pai4 qiang3 zou3 le5 yi1 pi1 shu3yu2 wo3men5 de5 wu4zi1。ni3 you3mei2you3 ting1 guo4 lei4si4 de5 ming2zi5？"

msgid ""
"I'm from the Kreuzbasar. You stole a shipment of supplies bound for our "
"kiez, and we want it back."
msgstr ""
"我​是从​克洛伊​茨​集市​来​的​。​你​偷​了​我们​街区​的​一份​物资​，​我​现在​要​拿​回来​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 cong2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 lai2 de5。ni3 tou1 le5 wo3men5 jie1qu1 de5 yi1 fen4 wu4zi1，wo3 xian4zai4 yao4 na2 hui2lai5。"

msgid "I'm getting that. Are you sure that the others went inside?"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​。​你​确定​其他人​都​进去​了​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。ni3 que4ding4 qi2 ta1 ren2 dou1 jin4qu4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I'm getting there, $(l.name). But you'll have to give me some time.\n"
"\n"
"The answers will come when they do."
msgstr ""
"我​在​做​思想​工作​，​$(l.name)​。​但​你​必须​再​给​我点​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​时机成熟​的​时候​，​一切​自然​会​水到渠成​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 zuo4 si1xiang3 gong1zuo4，$(l.name)。dan4 ni3 bi4xu1 zai4 gei3 wo3 dian3 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 shi2 ji1 cheng2 shu2 de5 shi2hou5，yi1qie4 zi4ran2 hui4 shui3dao4qu2cheng2 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm glad that she's still alive. In time, she'll heal... but she has a lot of unwanted baggage to deal with. A lot of psychological trauma from the time that she spent with Harrow.\n"
"\n"
"She still worships him, you know. It was all that I could do to keep her from running off after him."
msgstr ""
"我​很​高兴​她​还​活着​。​时间​会​治愈​一切​……​但​她​背负着​太​多​沉重​的​心理​创伤​，​那些​都​是​和​哈罗​在​一起​时​留下​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​吗​，​她​至今​仍​崇拜​着​他​。​我​费尽​全力​才​阻止​她​追随​他​而​去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ta1 hai2 huo2zhe5。shi2jian1 hui4 zhi4yu4 yi1qie4……dan4 ta1 bei1 fu4 zhao2 tai4 duo1 chen2zhong4 de5 xin1li3 chuang1shang1，na4xie1 dou1 shi4 he4 ha1luo2 zai4 yi1qi3 shi2 liu2xia4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 ma5，ta1 zhi4jin1 reng2 chong2bai4 zhao2 ta1。wo3 fei4 jin3 quan2li4 cai2 zu3zhi3 ta1 zhui1sui2 ta1 er2 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I'm glad that we got our hands on the Pain Inducer... that thing is amazing. I just wish that we didn't have to kill those company guys to get it. And letting Thorvald go... I'm not sure that was the right move, chief.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh well. C'est la vie."
msgstr ""
"我​很​高兴​我们​弄​到​了​“​疼痛​诱发​器​”​……​那​玩意儿​太棒了​。​只不过​要是​我们​不用​非得​杀掉​那些​公司员工​就​好​了​。​以及​把​托​瓦尔德​放走​……​我​不​确定​这​是否是​正确​的​决定​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​。​这​就是​命​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 long4 dao4 le5“teng2tong4 you4fa1 qi4”……na4 wan2yi4r5 tai4 bang4 le5。zhi3bu5guo4 yao4shi5 wo3men5 bu4yong4 fei1dei3 sha1diao4 na4xie1 gong1 si1 yuan2 gong1 jiu4 hao3 le5。yi3ji2 ba3 tuo1 wa3er3de2 fang4zou3……wo3 bu4 que4ding4 zhe4 shi4 fou3 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 jue2ding4，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ming4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I'm glad that we handed it over intact. I mean, I feel sorry for the troll that they installed all of that stuff into, and all... but as a feat of cyber-engineering, it was a thing of beauty.\n"
"\n"
" It would've been a pity to destroy it."
msgstr ""
"我​很​高兴​我们​能​完好无缺​地​把​它​交出去​。​那个​巨魔​被​强行​安装​了​这么​多​玩意儿​，​一定​也​挺​惨​的​……​但​从​赛博​工程​的​角度​来看​，​它​也​充满​了​美感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​被迫​毁掉​它​的话​就​太​遗憾​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 neng2 wan2hao3wu2que1 de5 ba3 ta1 jiao1 chu1 qu4。na4ge5 ju4mo2 bei4 qiang2xing2 an1zhuang1 le5 zhe4me5 duo1 wan2yi4r5，yi1ding4 ye3 ting3 can3 de5……dan4 cong2 sai4bo2 gong1cheng2 de5 jiao3du4 lai2 kan4，ta1 ye3 chong1man3 le5 mei3gan3。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 bei4po4 hui3diao4 ta1 de5hua4 jiu4 tai4 yi2han4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm glad that we handed it over intact. I mean, I feel sorry for the troll "
"that they installed all of that stuff into, and all... but as a feat of "
"cyber-engineering, it was a thing of beauty. It would've been a pity to "
"destroy it."
msgstr ""
"我​很​高兴​我们​能​完好无缺​地​把​它​交出去​。​那个​巨魔​被​强行​安装​了​这么​多​玩意儿​，​一定​也​挺​惨​的​……​但​从​赛博​工程​的​角度​来看​，​它​也​充满​了​美感​。​要是​被迫​毁掉​它​的话​就​太​遗憾​了​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 neng2 wan2hao3wu2que1 de5 ba3 ta1 jiao1 chu1 qu4。na4ge5 ju4mo2 bei4 qiang2xing2 an1zhuang1 le5 zhe4me5 duo1 wan2yi4r5，yi1ding4 ye3 ting3 can3 de5……dan4 cong2 sai4bo2 gong1cheng2 de5 jiao3du4 lai2 kan4，ta1 ye3 chong1man3 le5 mei3gan3。yao4shi5 bei4po4 hui3diao4 ta1 de5hua4 jiu4 tai4 yi2han4 le5。"

msgid "I'm glad that we're on the same page."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​我们​想到​一块​去​了​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 xiang3dao4 yi1kuai4 qu4 le5。"

msgid "I'm glad that you came prepared."
msgstr ""
"我​很​高兴​你​提前​做好​了​准备​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 ti2qian2 zuo4 hao3 le5 zhun3bei4。"

msgid ""
"I'm going to do what I can to smooth over the mess you left with Herr Fuchs, but I fear that the damage may already be done.\n"
"\n"
"In the future, I pray that you exercise better judgment.\n"
"\n"
"-Amsel"
msgstr ""
"我会​尽力​收拾​你​给​富克斯​先生​留​的​烂摊子​，​但​眼下​已经​造成​的​损害​恐怕​也​难以​挽回​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今后​，​请​你​做事​明智​一些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​-​阿姆​泽尔\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin4li4 shou1shi5 ni3 gei3 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 liu2 de5 lan4tan1zi5，dan4 yan3xia4 yi3jing1 zao4cheng2 de5 sun3hai4 kong3pa4 ye3 nan2yi3 wan3hui2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jin1hou4，qing3 ni3 zuo4shi4 ming2zhi4 yi1xie1。\n"
"\n"
"-E1mu3ze2er3"

msgid "I'm going to go check on the others."
msgstr ""
"我​得​去​看看​其他人​的​情况​了​。\n"
"wo3 de2 qu4 kan4kan5 qi2 ta1 ren2 de5 qing2kuang4 le5。"

msgid "I'm going to have a little talk with Dr. Ezkibel."
msgstr ""
"我会​和​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​谈谈​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 he4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 tan2tan2。"

msgid "I'm going to hold you to that. Good hunting, Glory."
msgstr ""
"我会​记住​的​。​祝你好运​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 ji4zhu5 de5。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid ""
"I'm going to put a smear of this on your forehead. It's a sort of alchemical balm.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice goes quiet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Harrow taught me how to make it."
msgstr ""
"我要​在​你​额头​上涂​一点​这个​。​这是​某种​化学​药膏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​越来越​小​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​教会​了​我​如何​制作​它​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 zai4 ni3 e2tou2 shang4 tu2 yi1dian3 zhe4ge5。zhe4 shi4 mou3zhong3 hua4xue2 yao4gao1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 yue4lai2yue4 xiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 jiao1hui4 le5 wo3 ru2he2 zhi4zuo4 ta1。"

msgid "I'm going to step away now."
msgstr ""
"现在​我要​走开​了​。\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3 yao4 zou3kai1 le5。"

msgid "I'm going with you, Glory. I'll follow you if I have to."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​我​就要​跟你走​，​你​说​什么​都​没用​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，wo3 jiu4yao4 gen1 ni3 zou3，ni3 shuo1 shen2me5 dou1 mei2yong4。"

msgid "I'm going. Take care of yourself."
msgstr ""
"我要​走​了​。​你​照顾​好​自己​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。ni3 zhao4gu5 hao3 zi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"I'm gonna bail on out of here... I've been stuck in this tunnel too long already, and like you said, the others are worried. But if there's ever anything that we can do for you, come by the shop!\n"
"\n"
"You'll be welcome at our place for life."
msgstr ""
"我要​先​撤​了​……​我​已经​被困​在​这里​太久​了​，​而且​就​像​你​说​的​，​其他人​都​在​担心​我​。​但​如果​有​任何​我们​可以​帮上​忙​的​事​，​随时​来​店里​找​我​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​永远​都​会​是​我们​这里​最​受欢迎​的​客人​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 xian1 che4 le5……wo3 yi3jing1 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 tai4 jiu3 le5，er2qie3 jiu4 xiang4 ni3 shuo1 de5，qi2 ta1 ren2 dou1 zai4 dan1xin1 wo3。dan4 ru2guo3 you3 ren4he2 wo3men5 ke3yi3 bang1 shang4 mang2 de5 shi4，sui2shi2 lai2 dian4 li3 zhao3 wo3！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong3yuan3 dou1 hui4 shi4 wo3men5 zhe4li3 zui4 shou4huan1ying2 de5 ke4ren2。"

msgid ""
"I'm gonna give you one more chance to open that door and let me out of here."
msgstr ""
"我​再​给​你​一次​机会​，​把门​打开​，​让​我​离开​这里​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 gei3 ni3 yi1ci4 ji1hui4，ba3men2 da3kai1，rang4 wo3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"I'm gonna go get that money transfer taken care of. If you want to stand "
"around staring at this, knock yourself out."
msgstr ""
"我​还​得​去​处理​那​笔​汇款​的​事​。​如果​你​想​站​在​这儿​盯​着​看​，​那​就​随你便​吧​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 de2 qu4 chu3li3 na4 bi3 hui4kuan3 de5 shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 zhan4 zai4 zhe4r5 ding1 zhao2 kan4，na4 jiu4 sui2 ni3 bian4 ba1。"

msgid "I'm gonna go out on a limb and say \"no,\" but you never can tell."
msgstr ""
"我​也​想​就​这么​下​定论​说​“​不行​”​，​但​这种​事​谁​也​不​知道​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 xiang3 jiu4 zhe4me5 xia4 ding4lun4 shuo1“bu4xing2”，dan4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 shei2 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "I'm gonna need some specific examples if you want me to help you."
msgstr ""
"你​要是​想​让​我​帮忙​，​就​得​给​点​具体​的​例子​。\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 xiang3 rang4 wo3 bang1mang2，jiu4 de2 gei3 dian3 ju4ti3 de5 li4zi5。"

msgid ""
"I'm gonna offer you an ultimatum. If you don't honor your contract with the "
"ghouls, I'll tell the people of the Kreuzbasar that you've been feeding "
"them."
msgstr ""
"这是​最后通牒​。​如果​你​不​履行​和​食尸​鬼​的​合同​，​我​就​和​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人​说​你​一直​在​偷偷​饲喂​他们​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 zui4hou4tong1die2。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 lu:3xing2 he4 shi2 shi1 gui3 de5 he2tong5，wo3 jiu4 he4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2 shuo1 ni3 yi1zhi2 zai4 tou1tou1 si4wei4 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"I'm gonna try to get you limited access to the facility.\n"
"\n"
"You should be able to find a terminal in there that can bring the firewall down, and from there I'll get you access to the vault."
msgstr ""
"我会​尝试​帮​你​争取​设施​的​部分​访问​权限​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​应该​能​在​里面​找到​一台​终端​能​用来​关闭​防火墙​，​之后​我​就​能​让​你们​访问​保险库​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 chang2shi4 bang1 ni3 zheng1qu3 she4shi1 de5 bu4fen5 fang3wen4 quan2xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 neng2 zai4 li3mian4 zhao3dao4 yi1 tai2 zhong1duan1 neng2 yong4lai2 guan1bi4 fang2huo3qiang2，zhi1hou4 wo3 jiu4 neng2 rang4 ni3men5 fang3wen4 bao3 xian3 ku4 le5。"

msgid "I'm good, thanks."
msgstr ""
"不了​，​谢谢​。\n"
"bu4le5，xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"I'm guessing that he wants you out of the way. You're his second-in-command,"
" right?"
msgstr ""
"我​猜​他​是​想​除掉​你​。​你​是​他​手下​的​二把手​，​对​吧​？\n"
"wo3 cai1 ta1 shi4 xiang3 chu2diao4 ni3。ni3 shi4 ta1 shou3xia4 de5 er4ba3shou3，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "I'm here for me, not for you."
msgstr ""
"我来​是因为​我​自己​，​不是​因为​你​。\n"
"wo3 lai2 shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3 zi4ji3，bu4shi4 yin1wei4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'm here to \"liberate\" some prototype bioware. The stuff that Dr. Xabier "
"Ezkibel funded."
msgstr ""
"我来​这​是​为了​“​解救​”​一些​生体​殖装​原型​。​就是​沙​比尔​·​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​资助​的​那些​。\n"
"wo3 lai2 zhe4 shi4 wei4le5“jie3jiu4” yi1xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yuan2xing2。jiu4shi4 sha1 bi3er3 · Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 zi1zhu4 de5 na4xie1。"

msgid ""
"I'm here to bust some Humanis skulls. Riding with you got me in the front "
"door."
msgstr ""
"我来​这​是​为了​砸烂​人类​至上​主义者​那些​人渣​的​脑袋​。​你​的​便​车把​我​送到​了​正门​。\n"
"wo3 lai2 zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 za2lan4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 na4xie1 ren2zha1 de5 nao3dai5。ni3 de5 bian4 che1ba3 wo3 song4 dao4 le5 zheng4men2。"

msgid "I'm here to buy. Care to tell me about your inventory?"
msgstr ""
"我​是​来​买​东西​的​。​让​我​看看​你​的​库存​如何​？\n"
"wo3 shi4 lai2 mai3 dong1xi1 de5。rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 de5 ku4cun2 ru2he2？"

msgid ""
"I'm here to kill Harrow, not the poor, blind fools who follow him. They'll get hurt when the shrine goes down, but I don't want to kill them unless we absolutely have to.\n"
"\n"
"At the very least, we should search through the rest of the compound first."
msgstr ""
"我来​这里​是​为了​杀死​哈罗​，​而​不是​那些​跟随​他​的​可怜​而​又​盲目​的​傻瓜​们​。​当​神龛​被​毁​时​，​他们​会​受伤​，​但​我​不想​杀死​他们​，​除非​我们​别无选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至少​，​我们​应该​先​搜查​一下​这座​建筑​的​其他​区域​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 wei4le5 sha1si3 ha1luo2，er2 bu4shi4 na4xie1 gen1sui2 ta1 de5 ke3lian2 er2 you4 mang2mu4 de5 sha3gua1 men5。dang1 shen2kan1 bei4 hui3 shi2，ta1men5 hui4 shou4shang1，dan4 wo3 bu4xiang3 sha1si3 ta1men5，chu2fei1 wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3，wo3men5 ying1gai1 xian1 sou1cha2 yi1xia4 zhe4 zuo4 jian4zhu4 de5 qi2ta1 qu1yu4。"

msgid "I'm here to listen, just like Monika was."
msgstr ""
"我​和​莫妮卡​一样​，​都​愿意​听​你​说​。\n"
"wo3 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 yi1yang4，dou1 yuan4yi4 ting1 ni3 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"I'm here to shut you down, Stahl. Confronting me in person was a bad move, "
"by the way."
msgstr ""
"我​是​来​阻止​你​的​，​斯塔尔​。​提醒​你​一下​，​亲自​来​对付​我​可不是​什么​好​主意​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 lai2 zu3zhi3 ni3 de5，Si1ta3er3。ti2xing3 ni3 yi1xia4，qin1zi4 lai2 dui4fu5 wo3 ke3bu5shi4 shen2me5 hao3 zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"I'm here with the smugglers. We've brought your shipment, and we're waiting "
"to be paid."
msgstr ""
"我​是​和​走私​贩一​起来​的​。​货​已经​送到​，​就​等​收钱​了​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 he4 zou3si1 fan4 yi1 qi3lai5 de5。huo4 yi3jing1 song4 dao4，jiu4 deng3 shou1 qian2 le5。"

msgid "I'm here. That's all that matters."
msgstr ""
"重点​是​我​来​了​。\n"
"chong2dian3 shi4 wo3 lai2 le5。"

msgid "I'm hit!"
msgstr ""
"我​中弹​了​！\n"
"wo3 zhong4dan4 le5！"

msgid "I'm holding you to that."
msgstr ""
"我会​记住​你​这话​的​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 ji4zhu5 ni3 zhe4 hua4 de5。"

msgid "I'm in charge here, and I'll see that the rest of Berlin knows it."
msgstr ""
"现在​我​是​管事​的​，​我会​让​柏林​的​其他人​都​知道​这​一点​。\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3 shi4 guan3 shi4 de5，wo3 hui4 rang4 bo2lin2 de5 qi2 ta1 ren2 dou1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "I'm in charge of this group, and I say that we're doing this."
msgstr ""
"我​是​团队​的​领头人​，​我​说​了​我们​要​这么​做​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 tuan2dui4 de5 ling3 tou2 ren2，wo3 shuo1 le5 wo3men5 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I'm in the market for something exotic. What kinds of tech do you carry?"
msgstr ""
"我​正在​市场​上​寻找​一些​奇特​的​东西​。​你们​有​哪些​科技​产品​？\n"
"wo3 zheng4zai4 shi4chang3 shang4 xun2zhao3 yi1xie1 qi2te4 de5 dong1xi1。ni3men5 you3 na3xie1 ke1ji4 chan3pin3？"

msgid ""
"I'm interested in combat stims. I need an edge, not a high. Got anything "
"along those lines?"
msgstr ""
"我​对​战斗​兴奋剂​感兴趣​。​我​需要​的​是​战斗​优势​，​而​不是​嗑​嗨​。​有​这方面​的​东西​吗​？\n"
"wo3 dui4 zhan4dou4 xing1fen4ji4 gan3xing4qu4。wo3 xu1yao4 de5 shi4 zhan4dou4 you1shi4，er2 bu4shi4 ke4 hai1。you3 zhe4 fang1 mian4 de5 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I'm just a park ranger! I'm... I'm only here to do a wildlife survey! I "
"didn't even know that you people were OUT here!"
msgstr ""
"我​只是​个​公园​管理员​！​我​……​我来​这里​只是​为了​进行​一项​关于​野生动物​的​调查​！​我​甚至​都​不​知道​你们​在​这里​！\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 gong1yuan2 guan3li3yuan2！wo3……wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 zhi3shi4 wei4le5 jin4xing2 yi1 xiang4 guan1yu2 ye3sheng1dong4wu4 de5 diao4cha2！wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 zai4 zhe4li3！"

msgid "I'm just browsing, don't mind me."
msgstr ""
"我​就是​随便​看看​，​不用​管​我​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 sui2bian4 kan4kan5，bu4yong4 guan3 wo3。"

msgid "I'm just here to do a job. Helping you out was part of it."
msgstr ""
"只是​来​办点​事​，​顺便​帮帮​你们​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 lai2 ban4 dian3 shi4，shun4bian4 bang1 bang1 ni3men5。"

msgid "I'm just lucky, I guess."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​是​我​走运​吧​。\n"
"wo3 cai1 shi4 wo3 zou3yun4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I'm just traveling through. I heard there was a market, but... well, just *look* at this place!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She waves her arm around in a wide circle, taking everything in from the sadly shimmying woman to the near-empty corridors outside.{{/GM}}\n"
"\t\n"
"So. I’m just having a drink with this fine gentleman here and then moving on."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​个​旅行者​，​听说​这里​有个​市场​，​不过​……​你​*​看看​*​这​地方​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​伸出​手臂​环指​四周​，​从​这个​晃晃悠悠​的​女人​到​外面​门可罗雀​的​走廊​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​我​只是​打算​和​你​这位​先生​喝一杯​，​然后​就​继续​出发​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 lu:3xing2zhe3，ting1shuo1 zhe4li3 you3 ge4 shi4chang3，bu4guo4……ni3*kan4kan5*zhe4 di4fang1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1chu1 shou3bi4 huan2 zhi3 si4zhou1，cong2 zhe4ge5 huang4huang5you1you1 de5 nu:3ren2 dao4 wai4mian4 men2ke3luo2que4 de5 zou3lang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，wo3 zhi3shi4 da3suan4 he4 ni3 zhe4wei4 xian1sheng5 he4 yi1 bei1，ran2hou4 jiu4 ji4xu4 chu1fa1。"

msgid "I'm leaving."
msgstr ""
"我要​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I'm leaving. Nothing personal."
msgstr ""
"我要​走​了​。​不是​针对​你​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。bu4shi4 zhen1dui4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'm less concerned about the armor than I am about that minigun. Those "
"things can tear a man in half."
msgstr ""
"比起​那​身​装甲​，​我​看​那​把​转轮​机枪​更​麻烦​。​那种​玩意儿​能​直接​把​人​打成​肉酱​。\n"
"bi3qi3 na4 shen1 zhuang1jia3，wo3 kan4 na4 ba3 zhuan4lun2 ji1qiang1 geng1 ma2fan5。na4zhong3 wan2yi4r5 neng2 zhi2jie1 ba3 ren2 da3cheng2 rou4jiang4。"

msgid ""
"I'm less concerned with that than I am with what we just learned about "
"Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"比起​这个​，​我​更​在意​我们​刚刚​了解​到​的​关于​沃​克莱尔​的​情况​。\n"
"bi3qi3 zhe4ge5，wo3 geng1 zai4yi4 wo3men5 gang1gang5 liao3jie3 dao4 de5 guan1yu2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 qing2kuang4。"

msgid "I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "I'm looking at the big picture here, and I don't like what I see."
msgstr ""
"我​正在​审视​全局​，​而​眼前​的​情形​令​我​深感不安​。\n"
"wo3 zheng4zai4 shen3shi4 quan2ju2，er2 yan3qian2 de5 qing2xing5 ling3 wo3 shen1 gan3 bu4 an1。"

msgid "I'm looking for Trithemius. Any idea how I could find him?"
msgstr ""
"我​在​找​特​里特​米​乌斯​。​你​知道​该​怎么​找到​他​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhao3 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1。ni3 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 zhao3dao4 ta1 ma5？"

msgid "I'm looking for a datajack impulse transmitter."
msgstr ""
"我​在​找​数据​插口​脉冲​发射器​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhao3 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 mai4chong1 fa1she4qi4。"

msgid "I'm looking for a gang called the Rabengeister. Ever heard of them?"
msgstr ""
"我​在​找​一个​叫​“​鸦灵​”​的​帮派​。​你​有​听说​过​他们​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhao3 yi1ge5 jiao4“Ya1ling2” de5 bang1pai4。ni3 you3 ting1shuo1 guo4 ta1men5 ma5？"

msgid "I'm looking for a guy who calls himself Green Winters. Know him?"
msgstr ""
"我​在​找​一个​自称​格林​·​温特斯​的​家伙​。​认识​他​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhao3 yi1ge5 zi4cheng1 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 jia1huo5。ren4shi5 ta1 ma5？"

msgid "I'm looking for a guy. Calls himself Green Winters. Know him?"
msgstr ""
"我​在​找​一个​自称​格林​·​温特斯​的​家伙​。​认识​他​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhao3 yi1ge5 zi4cheng1 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 jia1huo5。ren4shi5 ta1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I'm looking for information. Ever heard of a gang called the Rabengeister?"
msgstr ""
"我​是​来​调查​情报​的​。​你​听说​过​有​个​叫​“​鸦灵​”​的​帮派​吗​？\n"
"wo3 shi4 lai2 diao4cha2 qing2bao4 de5。ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 you3 ge4 jiao4“Ya1ling2” de5 bang1pai4 ma5？"

msgid "I'm looking for someone. Maybe you know him."
msgstr ""
"我​在​找​人​。​没准​你​认识​他​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhao3 ren2。mei2zhun3 ni3 ren4shi5 ta1。"

msgid "I'm looking for something that can play back a DVD/RW."
msgstr ""
"我​想​找​一件​能够​回放​DVD​/​RW​的​设备​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhao3 yi1 jian4 neng2gou4 hui2fang4 DVD/RW de5 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"I'm looking foward to hearing what you have to say about this, Duerr. I'll "
"see you soon."
msgstr ""
"我​等​着​听听​你​对​这件​事​作何解释​，​杜尔​。​回头见​。\n"
"wo3 deng3 zhao2 ting1 ting1 ni3 dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 zuo4 he2 jie3 shi4，du4 er3。hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid "I'm looking to buy some magic."
msgstr ""
"我​想​买​一些​魔法​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 mai3 yi1xie1 mo2fa3。"

msgid "I'm more concerned about the video feed that we just saw."
msgstr ""
"我​更​在意​我们​刚刚​看到​的​视频​画面​。\n"
"wo3 geng1 zai4yi4 wo3men5 gang1gang5 kan4dao4 de5 shi4pin2 hua4mian4。"

msgid ""
"I'm more concerned about the video feed that we just saw. If Vauclair is the one who's after us, then Vauclair is the one we need to take down.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Damn it. I was really looking forward to killing a dragon."
msgstr ""
"我​更​在意​我们​刚刚​看到​的​视频​画面​。​如果​追杀​我们​的​是​沃​克莱尔​，​那​我们​就​得​干掉​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​。​我​本来​很​期待​杀死​一头​巨龙​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 geng1 zai4yi4 wo3men5 gang1gang5 kan4dao4 de5 shi4pin2 hua4mian4。ru2guo3 zhui1sha1 wo3men5 de5 shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 de2 gan4diao4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3。wo3 ben3lai2 hen3 qi1dai4 sha1si3 yi1tou2 ju4long2 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm never distracted, chief. Laser-focused, right here.\n"
"\n"
"But, uh... you're right. I did keep looking into Emilie. And I found something."
msgstr ""
"我​从来​没有​分心​，​头儿​。​我​现在​超级​专注​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​……​你​说得对​。​我​确实​在​继续​调查​艾米莉​的​事​。​而且​我​有​了​发现​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2lai2 mei2you3 fen1xin1，tou2r5。wo3 xian4zai4 chao1ji2 zhuan1zhu4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4……ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 que4shi2 zai4 ji4xu4 diao4cha2 ai4 mi3 li4 de5 shi4。er2qie3 wo3 you3 le5 fa1xian4。"

msgid "I'm new in town, what's hot around here?"
msgstr ""
"我​是​新来​的​，​这​附近​有​什么​好去处​吗​？\n"
"wo3 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5，zhe4 fu4jin4 you3 shen2me5 hao3 qu4 chu3 ma5？"

msgid "I'm no coward, and I don't drink with people who kill my friends."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​懦夫​，​我​也​不会​和​杀害​我​朋友​的​人​喝酒​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 nuo4fu1，wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 he4 sha1hai4 wo3 peng2you5 de5 ren2 he1jiu3。"

msgid "I'm no rookie, Eiger, and you know it."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​什么​菜鸟​，​艾格尔​。​你​又​不是​不​知道​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 shen2me5 cai4niao3，Ai4ge2er3。ni3 you4 bu4shi4 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "I'm not \"most\" recruits."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​什么​“​大多数​”​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 shen2me5“da4duo1shu4”。"

msgid "I'm not Vauclair. "
msgstr ""
"我​不是​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid "I'm not Vauclair. But I don't think I should just set you free. "
msgstr ""
"我​不是​沃​克莱尔​。​但​我​也​不能​直接​放​你​自由​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。dan4 wo3 ye3 bu4neng2 zhi2jie1 fang4 ni3 zi4you2。"

msgid ""
"I'm not a boy! And he's right... I *did* swear an oath.\n"
"\n"
"I owe Humanis. They took me in when nobody else would. Taught me to be *strong*."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​小孩子​了​！​他​说得对​……​我​*​的确​*​发了​誓​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这​条命​都​是​欠​人类​至上​主义者​的​。​在​没人​愿意​收留​我​的​时候​，​是​他们​接纳​我​，​教​我​变​*​强​*​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 xiao3hai2zi5 le5！ta1 shuo1 de2 dui4……wo3*di2que4*fa1 le5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4 tiao2 ming4 dou1 shi4 qian4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5。zai4 mei2 ren2 yuan4yi4 shou1liu2 wo3 de5 shi2hou5，shi4 ta1men5 jie1na4 wo3，jiao1 wo3 bian4*jiang4*。"

msgid ""
"I'm not a demolitions expert, Frau Müller. How do you expect me to level a "
"building?"
msgstr ""
"我​不是​爆破​专家​，​穆勒​女士​。​你​要​我​怎么​去​夷平​一座​大楼​？\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 bao4po4 zhuan1jia1，mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4。ni3 yao4 wo3 zen3me5 qu4 yi2ping2 yi1 zuo4 da4lou2？"

msgid "I'm not a plumber. No deal."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​水管​工​。​算了吧​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 shui3guan3 gong1。suan4 le5 ba1。"

msgid "I'm not a spirit. Let me in and I can help you."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​精魂​。​让​我​进去​，​我​可以​帮​你​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 jing1hun2。rang4 wo3 jin4qu4，wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3。"

msgid "I'm not a spirit. What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"我​不是​精魂​。​你​在​说​什么​？\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 jing1hun2。ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid "I'm not afraid of you."
msgstr ""
"我​不怕​你​。\n"
"wo3 bu4pa4 ni3。"

msgid "I'm not being ridiculous - you're in denial."
msgstr ""
"我​没​在​胡说八道​—​—​是​你​不愿​承认​事实​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 zai4 hu2shuo1ba1dao4——shi4 ni3 bu4yuan4 cheng2ren4 shi4shi2。"

msgid ""
"I'm not big on sharing, sport. Personal reasons. You understand, I'm sure.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The edge in her voice tells you that she's not interested in continuing this conversation.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​不怎么​乐意​分享​，​伙计​。​私人​原因​，​我​相信​你​能​理解​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​略带​怒意​的​声音​让​你​明白​，​她​对于​继续​这个​话题​并​不感兴趣​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4zen3me5 le4yi4 fen1xiang3，huo3ji5。si1ren2 yuan2yin1，wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu:e4dai4 nu4 yi4 de5 sheng1yin1 rang4 ni3 ming2bai5，ta1 dui4yu2 ji4xu4 zhe4ge5 hua4ti2 bing4 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I'm not buying it, Doc. Ending a war and exterminating an entire intelligent"
" species are two very different things."
msgstr ""
"我​不吃​你​这​一套​，​博士​。​终结​战争​和​抹杀​一​整个​智慧​种族​是​完全​不同​的​两码事​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 chi1 ni3 zhe4 yi1tao4，bo2shi4。zhong1jie2 zhan4zheng1 he4 mo3sha1 yi1 zheng3ge4 zhi4hui4 zhong3zu2 shi4 wan2quan2 bu4tong2 de5 liang3ma3shi4。"

msgid "I'm not buying right now. Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""
"我​目前​不​打算​买​。​还是​谢​了​。\n"
"wo3 mu4qian2 bu4 da3suan4 mai3。hai2shi5 xie4 le5。"

msgid "I'm not comfortable with how little we know about this run."
msgstr ""
"我们​对​这趟​差事​的​了解​程度​让​我​不​太​踏实​啊​。\n"
"wo3men5 dui4 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 de5 liao3jie3 cheng2du4 rang4 wo3 bu4 tai4 ta1shi5 a1。"

msgid ""
"I'm not crazy about all of these new details coming in. She should have "
"briefed me about all of this earlier."
msgstr ""
"我​不​太​喜欢​现在​又​多出​这些​新​细节​。​她​本该​更​早​向​我​说明​这​一切​的​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 tai4 xi3huan5 xian4zai4 you4 duo1 chu1 zhe4xie1 xin1 xi4jie2。ta1 ben3 gai1 geng1 zao3 xiang4 wo3 shuo1ming2 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm not doing this for fun. I'm doing it because he *deserves* it.\n"
"\n"
"If you knew half of what this bastard has done... if you'd heard the things that he just told me... you'd do the same."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​在​找​乐子​。​我​这么​做​是因为​他​*​罪有应得​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​知道​这​混蛋​都​做​过些​什么​……​如果​你​听到​他​刚才​和​我​说​的话​……​你​也​会​这么​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 zai4 zhao3 le4zi5。wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1*zui4you3ying1de2*。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 hun2dan4 dou1 zuo4 guo4 xie1 shen2me5……ru2guo3 ni3 ting1dao4 ta1 gang1cai2 he4 wo3 shuo1 de5hua4……ni3 ye3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm not following in anybody's footsteps. I do what *needs* to be done. And "
"if others choose to follow me, well, that's their decision."
msgstr ""
"我​并​没有​追随​谁​的​脚步​。​我​只是​在​做​*​该​做​*​的​事​。​如果​有​别人​愿意​和​我​一起​的话​，​那​也​是​他们​自己​的​决定​。\n"
"wo3 bing4 mei2you3 zhui1sui2 shei2 de5 jiao3bu4。wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 zuo4*gai1 zuo4*de5 shi4。ru2guo3 you3 bie2ren5 yuan4yi4 he4 wo3 yi1qi3 de5hua4，na4 ye3 shi4 ta1men5 zi4ji3 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"I'm not getting paid to kill you, so unless you do something stupid, you'll "
"be just fine. Just shut up and sit in the corner, okay?"
msgstr ""
"我​没有​要​杀​你​的​意思​。​只要​你​不​做​蠢事​的话​，​你​就​不会​有事​。​现在​闭上嘴​乖乖​待​在​角落里​，​懂​了​吗​？\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 yao4 sha1 ni3 de5 yi4si5。zhi3yao4 ni3 bu4 zuo4 chun3shi4 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 bu4hui4 you3shi4。xian4zai4 bi4 shang4 zui3 guai1guai1 dai1 zai4 jiao3 la4 li3，dong3 le5 ma5？"

msgid "I'm not going anywhere with you. {{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} "
msgstr ""
"我​不会​跟你走​的​。​{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 gen1 ni3 zou3 de5。{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "I'm not going near that place. Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"我​才​不会​靠近​那​地方​呢​。​祝你好运​！\n"
"wo3 cai2 bu4hui4 kao4jin4 na4 di4fang1 ni2。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4！"

msgid ""
"I'm not going to argue with you, Eiger. I've made my decision, and it's "
"final. You're staying here."
msgstr ""
"我​不​打算​和​你​争论​，​艾格尔​。​我​已经​做出​了​最终​决定​。​你​哪儿​也​不许​去​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 da3suan4 he4 ni3 zheng1lun4，Ai4ge2er3。wo3 yi3jing1 zuo4chu1 le5 zui4zhong1 jue2ding4。ni3 na3r5 ye3 bu4xu3 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I'm not going to hurt anyone if I can help it. Just move along and forget "
"that you saw me, and I promise that everything will be all right."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​滥杀无辜​的​人​。​现在​让开​，​就​当​自己​没见​过​我​，​我​保证​你​不会​有事​的​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 lan4sha1wu2gu1 de5 ren2。xian4zai4 rang4kai1，jiu4 dang1 zi4ji3 mei2 jian4 guo4 wo3，wo3 bao3zheng4 ni3 bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm not gonna let history repeat itself, $(l.name). That won't happen on my "
"watch."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​再​让​历史​重演​，​$(l.name)​。​只要​我​还​在​，​就​不会​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 rang4 li4shi3 chong2yan3，$(l.name)。zhi3yao4 wo3 hai2 zai4，jiu4 bu4hui4。"

msgid ""
"I'm not gonna lie, $(l.name). This one is gonna stick with me for a while.\n"
"\n"
"What they did to that troll was *sick.*"
msgstr ""
"说真的​，​$(l.name)​，​恐怕​我​一时半会儿​忘不掉​这事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​对​那个​巨魔​做​的​事​简直​*​令人作呕​*​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1zhen1de5，$(l.name)，kong3pa4 wo3 yi1shi2ban4hui4r5 wang4 bu4 diao4 zhe4 shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 dui4 na4ge5 ju4mo2 zuo4 de5 shi4 jian3zhi2*ling3 ren2 zuo4 ou3*。"

msgid "I'm not handing you anything until you show me *your* ID."
msgstr ""
"先给​我​看看​*​你​的​*​证件​，​否则​我​不会​给​你​任何​东西​。\n"
"xian1 gei3 wo3 kan4kan5*ni3 de5*zheng4jian4，fou3ze2 wo3 bu4hui4 gei3 ni3 ren4he2 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"I'm not happy with the hit that our reputation took. You shouldn't be, either. We *need* our clients, and we can't afford to get blacklisted.\n"
"\n"
"But at least you did the right thing in the end."
msgstr ""
"这件​事​对​我们​声誉​的​打击​让​我​有些​不满​—​—​你​也​应该​如此​。​我们​*​需要​*​客户​，​承受​不起​被​列入​黑名单​的​后果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​至少​你​最后​做​了​正确​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4 dui4 wo3men5 sheng1yu4 de5 da3ji1 rang4 wo3 you3xie1 bu4man3——ni3 ye3 ying1gai1 ru2ci3。wo3men5*xu1yao4*ke4hu4，cheng2shou4 bu4 qi3 bei4 lie4ru4 hei1ming2dan1 de5 hou4guo3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhi4shao3 ni3 zui4hou4 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "I'm not interested. Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""
"我​不感兴趣​。​还是​谢​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。hai2shi5 xie4 le5。"

msgid "I'm not liking the sound of this."
msgstr ""
"这话​听​起来​不太​对劲​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 ting1 qi3lai5 bu4 tai4 dui4jin4。"

msgid "I'm not making a value judgment. Just an observation."
msgstr ""
"我​并非​在​做​价值​判断​。​这​只是​我​的​观察​而已​。\n"
"wo3 bing4fei1 zai4 zuo4 jia4zhi2 pan4duan4。zhe4 zhi3shi4 wo3 de5 guan1cha2 er2yi3。"

msgid "I'm not one to leave things unfinished."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​个​半途而废​的​人​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 ge4 ban4tu2er2fei4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"I'm not overfond of your tone, but it's not every day I even get asked to sell any of my projects.\n"
"\n"
"That'll be 175 nuyen, if you please."
msgstr ""
"油嘴滑舌​，​不过​我​也​不是​每天​都​能​做成​生意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​175​新円​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"you2zui3hua2she2，bu4guo4 wo3 ye3 bu4shi4 mei3tian1 dou1 neng2 zuo4 cheng2 sheng1yi4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 175 xin1 yuan2 ba1。"

msgid "I'm not paying a bunch of bums for some garbage, so back down."
msgstr ""
"我​才​不会​为了​些​垃圾​付钱​给​一群​流浪汉​，​闪​一边​去​。\n"
"wo3 cai2 bu4hui4 wei4le5 xie1 la1ji1 fu4qian2 gei3 yi1 qun2 liu2lang4han4，shan3 yi1bian1 qu4。"

msgid "I'm not planning on shooting anything. Not unless I have to."
msgstr ""
"我​并​不​打算​开枪​，​除非​万不得已​。\n"
"wo3 bing4 bu4 da3suan4 kai1qiang1，chu2fei1 wan4bu4de2yi3。"

msgid ""
"I'm not proud of what I do. But for what it's worth, I am proud to do it in your company.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She straightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And speaking of which, we should probably get back to it."
msgstr ""
"我​并​不​为​自己​的​工作​而​自豪​。​但​无论如何​，​我​为​自己​能​与​你​共事​而​骄傲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​挺直​了​身子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​到​这里​，​我们​该​继续​忙​正事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bing4 bu4 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 gong1zuo4 er2 zi4hao2。dan4 wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3 wei2 zi4ji3 neng2 yu4 ni3 gong4shi4 er2 jiao1ao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4li3，wo3men5 gai1 ji4xu4 mang2 zheng4shi4 le5。"

msgid "I'm not ready to rule anything out at this point."
msgstr ""
"目前​我​还​没​准备​好​排除​任何​可能性​。\n"
"mu4qian2 wo3 hai2 mei2 zhun3bei4 hao3 pai2chu2 ren4he2 ke3neng2xing4。"

msgid ""
"I'm not running from anything, fearless leader. I'm going to look into this, wherever it leads me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But I'm not going to do it today."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​逃避​，​无畏​领袖​。​无论​结果​如何​，​我​都​会​追查​下去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​不是​在​今天​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 tao2bi4，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wu2lun4 jie1guo3 ru2he2，wo3 dou1 hui4 zhui1cha2 xia4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 bu4shi4 zai4 jin1tian1。"

msgid ""
"I'm not saying that this is 2XS, or even anything like it. But there *are* "
"sims out there that are even stronger than BTLs. It's possible that this is "
"one of them."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​说​这个​就是​2XS​，​或者​任何​类似​的​东西​。​不过​外头​*​确实​*​有​甚至​比​BTL​还​强力​的​拟感​芯片​。​这​可能​就是​其中​之一​。\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 shuo1 zhe4ge5 jiu4shi4 2XS，huo4zhe3 ren4he2 lei4si4 de5 dong1xi1。bu4guo4 wai4tou5*que4shi2*you3 shen4zhi4 bi3 BTL hai2 qiang2li4 de5 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4。zhe4 ke3neng2 jiu4shi4 qi2zhong1 zhi1yi1。"

msgid ""
"I'm not sure anything deserves this. But I'm not sure I can just set you "
"free."
msgstr ""
"我​不​确定​有​谁​该​受​这种​罪​。​但​我​也​不​确定​是否​该放​你​自由​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 you3 shei2 gai1 shou4 zhe4zhong3 zui4。dan4 wo3 ye3 bu4 que4ding4 shi4fou3 gai1 fang4 ni3 zi4you2。"

msgid "I'm not sure how I feel about them anymore."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​不​确定​自己​该​怎么​看待​它们​了​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 bu4 que4ding4 zi4ji3 gai1 zen3me5 kan4dai4 ta1men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm not sure how it works here in Adversary-land, but where I'm from, this "
"would be considered a \"hard sell.\""
msgstr ""
"我​不​清楚​这种​事​在​反叛者​的​位面​应该​如何​处理​，​但​在​我​的​家乡​，​这​通常​叫作​“​硬性​推销​”​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 qing1chu5 zhe4zhong3 shi4 zai4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 wei4mian4 ying1gai1 ru2he2 chu3li3，dan4 zai4 wo3 de5 jia1xiang1，zhe4 tong1chang2 jiao4zuo4“ying4xing4 tui1xiao1”。"

msgid "I'm not sure that I can remember all of that."
msgstr ""
"我​不​确定​能否​记住​所有​这些​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 neng2fou3 ji4zhu5 suo3you3 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"I'm not sure that we're on the same page, here. So we should probably hash "
"this out now and save ourselves some time."
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​我们​可能​存在​分歧​。​所以​最好​现在​就​把​问题​说​清楚​，​省得​以后​再​折腾​。\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 wo3men5 ke3neng2 cun2zai4 fen1qi2。suo3yi3 zui4hao3 xian4zai4 jiu4 ba3 wen4ti2 shuo1 qing1chu5，sheng3de5 yi3hou4 zai4 zhe1teng5。"

msgid ""
"I'm not sure when, and I'm not sure who. But the comparison was made to "
"Rommel. \"Arctic Fox\" followed soon thereafter."
msgstr ""
"我​不​确定​具体​时间​或​人物​。​但​有人​将​我​与​隆美尔​相提并论​。​随后​不久​，​“​北极狐​”​行动​便​随之​展开​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 ju4ti3 shi2jian1 huo4 ren2wu4。dan4 you3ren2 jiang1 wo3 yu4 long1 mei3 er3 xiang1ti2bing4lun4。sui2hou4 bu4jiu3，“bei3ji2hu2” xing2dong4 bian4 sui2zhi1 zhan3kai1。"

msgid ""
"I'm not sure. But I don't think that they were talking about dinner, kid."
msgstr ""
"我​不​太​确定​。​但​我​不​认为​他们​说​的​是​晚餐​，​孩子​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 tai4 que4ding4。dan4 wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 ta1men5 shuo1 de5 shi4 wan3can1，hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"I'm not surprised. But we can talk about it later.\n"
"\n"
"For now, we should concentrate on getting out of here."
msgstr ""
"我​估摸​着​会​是​这样​。​不过​这​事​我们​回头​再说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​先​专心​从​这里​出去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gu1mo5 zhao2 hui4 shi4 zhe4yang4。bu4guo4 zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 hui2tou2 zai4shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 xian1 zhuan1xin1 cong2 zhe4li3 chu1qu4。"

msgid ""
"I'm not surprised. He tried to micromanage everything when we worked together... everything had to be exactly how he wanted it, all the time.\n"
"\n"
"I can't imagine that's changed now."
msgstr ""
"我​一点​也​不​意外​。​当初​共事​时​他​就​事无巨细​地​干预​一切​……​所有​事情​都​必须​完全​按​他​的​要求​来​，​无一例外​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​作风​，​到​现在​肯定​也​丝毫​未改​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 yi4wai4。dang1chu1 gong4shi4 shi2 ta1 jiu4 shi4wu2ju4xi4 de5 gan1yu4 yi1qie4……suo3you3 shi4qing5 dou1 bi4xu1 wan2quan2 an4 ta1 de5 yao1qiu2 lai2，wu2 yi1 li4 wai4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 zuo4feng1，dao4 xian4zai4 ken3ding4 ye3 si1hao2 wei4 gai3。"

msgid ""
"I'm not surprised. It's only a matter of time before Plotz runs this place "
"into the ground."
msgstr ""
"我​一点​也​不​惊讶​。​普​洛茨​把​这​地方​搞垮​只是​时间​问题​。\n"
"wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 jing1ya4。Pu3luo4ci2 ba3 zhe4 di4fang1 gao3 kua3 zhi3shi4 shi2jian1 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"I'm not surprised... like you said, it's a new drug. But what you don't know"
" can still kill you."
msgstr ""
"这倒​是​不​奇怪​……​你​说得对​，​这是​新药​。​但​你​不​了解​的​东西​一样​能​杀死​你​。\n"
"zhe4 dao3 shi4 bu4 qi2guai4……ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，zhe4 shi4 xin1 yao4。dan4 ni3 bu4 liao3jie3 de5 dong1xi1 yi1yang4 neng2 sha1si3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'm not telling you all of this to make you angry. I'm doing it because I'm "
"worried about you."
msgstr ""
"我​说​这些​话​不是​为了​激怒​你​，​我​是​真的​担心​你​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 zhe4xie1 hua4 bu4shi4 wei4le5 ji1nu4 ni3，wo3 shi4 zhen1de5 dan1xin1 ni3。"

msgid "I'm not that desperate."
msgstr ""
"我​没​那么​饥渴​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 na4me5 ji1ke3。"

msgid "I'm not threatening her. I'm warning you."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​在​威胁​她​。​我​是​在​警告​你​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 zai4 wei1xie2 ta1。wo3 shi4 zai4 jing3gao4 ni3。"

msgid "I'm not worried about Knight Errant. Let 'em come."
msgstr ""
"我​不怕​游侠​骑士​。​让​他们​放马过来​吧​。\n"
"wo3 bu4pa4 you2Xia2qi2shi4。rang4 ta1men5 fang4ma3guo4lai2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I'm not worried, I'm irritated. But fine, whatever, do your thing. Just do "
"it fast, okay?"
msgstr ""
"我​不是​担心​。​我​现在​很​不爽​。​不过​随便​吧​，​你​爱​怎样​都行​。​总之​快点​好​吗​？\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 dan1xin1。wo3 xian4zai4 hen3 bu4shuang3。bu4guo4 sui2bian4 ba1，ni3 ai4 zen3yang4 dou1 xing2。zong3zhi1 kuai4dian3 hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"I'm not your *friend,* Blitz. I'm your *boss.* It's not my job to keep you "
"from making a mess of your personal life."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​我​不是​你​的​*​朋友​*​，​我​是​你​的​*​老大​*​。​我​没有​义务​来​阻止​你​把​自己​的​生活​搞​成​一团糟​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，wo3 bu4shi4 ni3 de5*peng2you5*，wo3 shi4 ni3 de5*lao3da4*。wo3 mei2you3 yi4wu4 lai2 zu3zhi3 ni3 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 sheng1huo2 gao3 cheng2 yi1tuan2zao1。"

msgid "I'm not your errand boy. I do a job, I get paid."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​替​你​跑腿​的​。​要​让​我​办事​，​得​给钱​才行​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 ti4 ni3 pao3tui3 de5。yao4 rang4 wo3 ban4shi4，de2 gei3 qian2 cai2 xing2。"

msgid "I'm not your errand girl. I do a job, I get paid."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​替​你​跑腿​的​。​要​让​我​办事​，​得​给钱​才行​。\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 ti4 ni3 pao3tui3 de5。yao4 rang4 wo3 ban4shi4，de2 gei3 qian2 cai2 xing2。"

msgid ""
"I'm not. But you're looking at this from outside. You can't see the big "
"picture."
msgstr ""
"我​并​没有​。​而且​你​只是​在​局外​旁观​而已​，​看不到​事情​的​全貌​。\n"
"wo3 bing4 mei2you3。er2qie3 ni3 zhi3shi4 zai4 ju2wai4 pang2guan1 er2yi3，kan4 bu4 dao4 shi4qing5 de5 quan2mao4。"

msgid ""
"I'm not. This little bastard, on the other hand...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger wipes her mouth with the back of her hand, then hoists a corpse up from behind her makeshift barricade. A young man, maybe in his early twenties, his eyes frozen wide in surprise. \n"
"\n"
"What's left of his throat hangs down in ragged flaps.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...made one hell of a mistake."
msgstr ""
"我​没事​。​不过​嘛​，​这个​小​杂碎​就​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔用​手背​擦擦​嘴​，​然后​从​她​的​临时​街垒​后面​拖​出​一具​尸体​。​那​是​个​二十出头​的​年轻人​，​双眼​因​惊愕​而​永远​定格​在​圆​睁​的​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​喉咙​残余​的​部分​像​破布​般​垂落​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​他​可​太​不自量力​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2shi4。bu4guo4 ma5，zhe4ge5 xiao3 za2sui5 jiu4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yong4 shou3bei4 ca1 ca1 zui3，ran2hou4 cong2 ta1 de5 lin2shi2 jie1 lei3 hou4mian5 tuo1 chu1 yi1 ju4 shi1ti3。na4 shi4 ge4 er4 shi2 chu1 tou2 de5 nian2qing1ren2，shuang1yan3 yin1 jing1e4 er2 yong3yuan3 ding4ge2 zai4 yuan2 zheng1 de5 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hou2long2 can2yu2 de5 bu4fen5 xiang4 po4bu4 ban1 chui2 la4 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ta1 ke3 tai4 bu4zi4liang4li4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm not...\n"
"\n"
"If Hermie were here...\n"
"\n"
"Oh God."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​赫米​还​在​的话​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​老天​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3……\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 he4 mi3 hai2 zai4 de5hua4……\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1。"

msgid ""
"I'm okay with assuming that we live. In fact, I'm gonna go out on a limb and"
" say that us surviving should always be a part of the plan."
msgstr ""
"我​接受​我们​活着​这个​前提​。​事实上​，​我​甚至​要​大胆​断言​，​我们​的​存活​本​就​该是​计划​中​不可或缺​的​一环​。\n"
"wo3 jie1shou4 wo3men5 huo2zhe5 zhe4ge5 qian2ti2。shi4shi2shang4，wo3 shen4zhi4 yao4 da4dan3 duan4yan2，wo3men5 de5 cun2huo2 ben3 jiu4 gai1 shi4 ji4hua4 zhong4 bu4ke3huo4que1 de5 yi1 huan2。"

msgid ""
"I'm on a tight timetable, and this conversation is getting old. Do you want "
"me to break you out of here, or not?"
msgstr ""
"我​时间​紧迫​，​这番​对话​也​拖​得够​久​了​。​你​到底​要​不要​我救​你​出去​？\n"
"wo3 shi2jian1 jin3po4，zhe4 fan1 dui4hua4 ye3 tuo1 de2 gou4 jiu3 le5。ni3 dao4di3 yao4 bu4yao4 wo3 jiu4 ni3 chu1qu4？"

msgid "I'm on it."
msgstr ""
"我​这​就​去​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4 jiu4 qu4。"

msgid "I'm out of here."
msgstr ""
"我要​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm out.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory's face is placid.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​退出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽面​无表情​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tui4chu1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 mian4 wu2biao3qing2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I'm pleased to hear that. You did a bang-up job on the security in here, by "
"the way."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​听​你​这么​说​。​对​了​，​你​在​这里​的​安全​工作​做​得​非常​出色​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 ting1 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1。dui4 le5，ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 an1quan2 gong1zuo4 zuo4 de2 fei1chang2 chu1se4。"

msgid ""
"I'm proud of you, Glory. Get those kids out of there, and away from Harrow."
msgstr ""
"我​为​你​骄傲​，​格洛丽​。​把​那些​孩子​救​出来​，​让​他们​远离​哈罗​。\n"
"wo3 wei2 ni3 jiao1ao4，Ge2luo4li2。ba3 na4Xie1hai2zi5 jiu4 chu1lai2，rang4 ta1men5 yuan3li2 ha1luo2。"

msgid "I'm proud of you, Glory. I hope that you find what you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"我​为​你​骄傲​，​格洛丽​。​我​希望​你​能​找到​你​所​寻找​的​东西​。\n"
"wo3 wei2 ni3 jiao1ao4，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 ni3 suo3 xun2zhao3 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "I'm proud of you, Kim."
msgstr ""
"我​为​你​感到​骄傲​，​阿金​。\n"
"wo3 wei2 ni3 gan3dao4 jiao1ao4，e1 jin1。"

msgid "I'm quaking in my boots, tough guy."
msgstr ""
"我​真是​吓​得​浑身发抖​呢​，​硬汉​。\n"
"wo3 zhen1shi5 he4 de2 hun2 shen1 fa1 dou3 ni2，ying4han4。"

msgid "I'm ready to go see Alice, Paul. Give me the password."
msgstr ""
"保罗​，​我​准备​去​见​爱丽丝​了​。​把​密码​给​我​吧​。\n"
"bao3luo2，wo3 zhun3bei4 qu4 jian4 ai4li4si1 le5。ba3 mi4ma3 gei3 wo3 ba1。"

msgid "I'm ready. Do it."
msgstr ""
"我​准备​好​了​。​动手​吧​。\n"
"wo3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5。dong4shou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I'm really starting to regret the fact that I didn't just stay at the hotel."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​开始​后悔​没​好好​待​在​旅馆​里​了​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 hou4hui3 mei2 hao3hao3 dai1 zai4 lu:3guan3 li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm right there with you. Finish gearing up, and I'll meet you at the van."
msgstr ""
"同意​，​收拾​好​装备​，​我们​车上​见​。\n"
"tong2yi4，shou1shi5 hao3 zhuang1bei4，wo3men5 che1 shang4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"I'm saying that he has a point. Dragons are a threat, and we're in a "
"position to do something about it. So why don't we do it?"
msgstr ""
"我​的​意思​是​，​他​说​得​有​道理​。​巨龙​是​个​威胁​，​而​我们​有​能力​采取行动​。​那​为什么​不​行动​呢​？\n"
"wo3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，ta1 shuo1 de2 you3 dao4li5。ju4long2 shi4 ge4 wei1xie2，er2 wo3men5 you3 neng2li4 cai3qu3xing2dong4。na4 wei4shen2me5 bu4 xing2dong4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"I'm seeing projections for future profits in here that run *way* outside the scope of what our organization brings in annually.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know how Plotz got his hands on this information, but it couldn't be any more wrong."
msgstr ""
"我​看到​这里​对​未来​利润​的​预测​，​*​远远​*​超出​了​我们​组织​每年​实际收入​的​范围​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​普​洛茨​是​怎么弄​到​这些​信息​的​，​但​这些​数据​简直​错得​离谱​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4dao4 zhe4li3 dui4 wei4lai2 li4run4 de5 yu4ce4，*yuan3yuan3*chao1chu1 le5 wo3men5 zu3zhi1 mei3nian2 shi2 ji4 shou1 ru4 de5 fan4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 Pu3luo4ci2 shi4 zen3 ma2 long4 dao4 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 de5，dan4 zhe4xie1 shu4ju4 jian3zhi2 cuo4 de2 li2pu3。"

msgid "I'm shaking in my boots, man. I mean, seriously."
msgstr ""
"我​吓​得​浑身发抖​。​我​是​说真的​。\n"
"wo3 he4 de2 hun2 shen1 fa1 dou3。wo3 shi4 shuo1zhen1de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm shaking in my boots, man. I mean, seriously.\n"
"\n"
"How *old* are you, by the way? Because you look about forty."
msgstr ""
"我​吓​得​浑身发抖​。​我​是​说真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​你​多​大​了​？​你​看起来​差不多​有​40​岁​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 de2 hun2 shen1 fa1 dou3。wo3 shi4 shuo1zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1 ni3 duo1 dai4 le5？ni3 kan4qi3lai5 cha4bu5duo1 you3 40 sui4。"

msgid "I'm shocked that you missed that."
msgstr ""
"没想到​你​居然​会​遗漏​这种​事​。\n"
"mei2xiang3dao4 ni3 ju1ran2 hui4 yi2lou4 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I'm shocked. This dandelion-eater's got balls.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His mouth tilts into an ugly smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No brains, though. It takes a special kind of fool to threaten me in my own compound."
msgstr ""
"我​很​震惊​，​这​只​素食​精​胆子​还​不小​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​嘴角​歪起​一抹​狰狞​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​没长​脑子​。​只有​纯种​傻瓜​才​敢​在​我​的​地盘​威胁​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 zhen4jing1，zhe4 zhi3 su4shi2 jing1 dan3zi5 hai2 bu4 xiao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 wai1 qi3 yi1 ma1 zheng1ning2 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 mei2 zhang3 nao3zi5。zhi3you3 chun2zhong3 sha3gua1 cai2 gan3 zai4 wo3 de5 di4pan2 wei1xie2 wo3。"

msgid ""
"I'm shocked. This dandelion-eater's got balls.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His mouth tilts into an ugly smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No brains, though. It takes a special kind of fool to try my patience like this."
msgstr ""
"我​很​震惊​，​这​只​素食​精​胆子​还​不小​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​嘴角​歪起​一抹​狰狞​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​没长​脑子​。​只有​纯种​傻瓜​敢​这样​挑战​我​的​耐心​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 zhen4jing1，zhe4 zhi3 su4shi2 jing1 dan3zi5 hai2 bu4 xiao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 wai1 qi3 yi1 ma1 zheng1ning2 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 mei2 zhang3 nao3zi5。zhi3you3 chun2zhong3 sha3gua1 gan3 zhe4yang4 tiao3zhan4 wo3 de5 nai4xin1。"

msgid "I'm short on cash right now. Could I offer you something in trade?"
msgstr ""
"我​现在​手头​有点​紧​，​能​拿​别的​东西​跟​你​交换​不​？\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 shou3tou2 you3dian3 jin3，neng2 na2 bie2de5 dong1xi1 gen1 ni3 jiao1huan4 bu4？"

msgid "I'm so glad to finally be going home!"
msgstr ""
"我​很​高兴​终于​可以​回家​了​！\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 zhong1yu2 ke3yi3 hui2jia1 le5！"

msgid "I'm so sorry, Glory."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​深表遗憾​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid ""
"I'm solid.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Something about Glory's gaze gives you pause. There's steel in there, but that's nothing unusual; as a rule, people in your line of work don't back down easily. But buried someplace behind the bravado and the determination, there's something else... something that makes your skin crawl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Be glad, and drop it."
msgstr ""
"我​很​坚强​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​目光​中​的​某些​东西​让​你​踌躇​。​她​的​内心​坚似​钢铁​，​这​并​不​奇怪​，​因为​干​这行​大人​大多​都​不会​轻易​让步​。​但​在​虚张声势​与​决心​之后​，​似乎​埋藏​着​什么​别的​东西​，​让​你​感觉​毛骨悚然​的​东西​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还是​别​细究​了​比较​好​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 jian1qiang2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 mu4guang1 zhong4 de5 mou3xie1 dong1xi1 rang4 ni3 chou2chu2。ta1 de5 nei4xin1 jian1 si4 gang1tie3，zhe4 bing4 bu4 qi2guai4，yin1wei4 gan4 zhe4 xing2 da4ren5 da4duo1 dou1 bu4hui4 qing1yi4 rang4bu4。dan4 zai4 xu1zhang1sheng1shi4 yu4 jue2xin1 zhi1hou4，si4hu1 mai2cang2 zhao2 shen2me5 bie2de5 dong1xi1，rang4 ni3 gan3jue2 mao2gu3song3ran2 de5 dong1xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 bie4 xi4jiu1 le5 bi3jiao4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry about Hermie, Vauclair. He didn't deserve what happened to him."
msgstr ""
"关于​赫米​的​事情​我​深表遗憾​，​沃​克莱尔​。​他​不该​遭受​这样​的​命运​。\n"
"guan1yu2 he4 mi3 de5 shi4qing5 wo3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ta1 bu4gai1 zao1shou4 zhe4yang4 de5 ming4yun4。"

msgid "I'm sorry about your nephew, man. I would've saved him if I could."
msgstr ""
"你​侄子​的​事​我​深表遗憾​。​要是​当时​能救​他​，​我​绝对​会​出手​的​。\n"
"ni3 zhi2zi5 de5 shi4 wo3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。yao4shi5 dang1shi2 neng2 jiu4 ta1，wo3 jue2dui4 hui4 chu1shou3 de5。"

msgid "I'm sorry for your loss."
msgstr ""
"节哀顺变​。\n"
"jie2ai1shun4bian4。"

msgid "I'm sorry for your loss. He loved you, you know."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​深表遗憾​。​他​无比​深爱着​你​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。ta1 wu2bi3 shen1 ai4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry that we had to use that thing on you. Must be terrible, having the"
" shakes like that."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​我们​不得不​对​你​用​那​东西​。​抖成​这样​的​感觉​一定​很​难受​吧​。\n"
"bao4qian4 wo3men5 bu4de2bu4 dui4 ni3 yong4 na4 dong1xi1。dou3 cheng2 zhe4yang4 de5 gan3jue2 yi1ding4 hen3 nan2shou4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry that you feel that way, Glory.\n"
"\n"
"For my part, I still love you."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​这样​想​真教​我​难过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​我​而言​，​我​依然​爱着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 zhe4yang4 xiang3 zhen1 jiao1 wo3 nan2guo4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3 er2yan2，wo3 yi1ran2 ai4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry to hear it, Blitz. That's rough. But you never know... she might "
"come around."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​深表遗憾​，​布里​茨​。​但​以后​的​事​谁​也​说​不准​……​她​也许​会想通​的​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4，Bu4li3ci2。dan4 yi3hou4 de5 shi4 shei2 ye3 shuo1 bu4zhun3……ta1 ye3xu3 hui4 xiang3 tong1 de5。"

msgid "I'm sorry to hear that."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​深表遗憾​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。"

msgid "I'm sorry to hear that. I hope things turn around for the better soon."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​深表遗憾​。​希望​情况​很快​会​有​改观​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。xi1wang4 qing2kuang4 hen3 kuai4 hui4 you3 gai3guan1。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry to hear you say that. Almost as sorry as you'll be when I reveal "
"your little secret to the people of the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​深表遗憾​。​这样的话​，​恐怕​我​只能​把​你​的​小​秘密​告诉​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人​了​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4，kong3pa4 wo3 zhi3neng2 ba3 ni3 de5 xiao3 mi4mi4 gao4su4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Blitz. This was just too hilarious not to see through to the end."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​，​布里​茨​。​这​整件事​太​滑稽​了​，​我​不得不​看到​最后​。\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5，Bu4li3ci2。zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 tai4 hua2ji1 le5，wo3 bu4de2bu4 kan4dao4 zui4hou4。"

msgid "I'm sorry, Burakgazi."
msgstr ""
"我​很​遗憾​，​布拉加​齐​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 yi2han4，bu4 la1 jia1 qi2。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Doc. He was digging too deeply into Feuerschwinge, so APEX killed"
" him."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​博士​。​他太过​深入调查​火翼​的​事情​，​所以​APEX​杀​了​他​。\n"
"bao4qian4，bo2shi4。ta1 tai4 guo4 shen1 ru4 diao4 cha2 Huo3yi4 de5 shi4qing5，suo3yi3 APEX sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Eiger... Monika didn't make it. Now we have to get out of here. "
"Look for an old servants' entrance to the west of the main grounds, we'll "
"rendezvous with you there."
msgstr ""
"对不起​，​艾格尔​……​莫妮卡​没撑​下来​。​我们​现在​得​撤出去​。​你​去​主​庭院​的​西侧​，​找​一个​老旧​的​仆人​入口​。​我们​在​那边​汇合​。\n"
"dui4bu5qi3，Ai4ge2er3……Mo4ni1ka3 mei2 cheng1 xia4lai5。wo3men5 xian4zai4 de2 che4 chu1 qu4。ni3 qu4 zhu3 ting2yuan4 de5 xi1ce4，zhao3 yi1ge5 lao3jiu4 de5 pu2ren2 ru4kou3。wo3men5 zai4 na4bian5 hui4he2。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Eiger... we couldn't save her. Now we have to get out of here. "
"Look for an old servants' entrance to the west of the main grounds; we'll "
"rendezvous with you there."
msgstr ""
"对不起​，​艾格尔​……​我们​没能​救下​她​。​我们​现在​得​撤出去​。​你​去​主​庭院​的​西侧​，​找​一个​老旧​的​仆人​入口​。​我们​在​那边​汇合​。\n"
"dui4bu5qi3，Ai4ge2er3……wo3men5 mei2 neng2 jiu4 xia4 ta1。wo3men5 xian4zai4 de2 che4 chu1 qu4。ni3 qu4 zhu3 ting2yuan4 de5 xi1ce4，zhao3 yi1ge5 lao3jiu4 de5 pu2ren2 ru4kou3。wo3men5 zai4 na4bian5 hui4he2。"

msgid "I'm sorry, Glory. No child should have to grow up around that."
msgstr ""
"我​很​遗憾​，​格洛丽​。​这样​的​童年​环境​太​糟糕​了​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 yi2han4，Ge2luo4li2。zhe4yang4 de5 tong2nian2 huan2jing4 tai4 zao1gao1 le5。"

msgid "I'm sorry, Hermie."
msgstr ""
"我​很​抱歉​，​赫米​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，he4 mi3。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Hermie... I'm sorry you won't be able to see it for yourself. \n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry I failed you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair turns his attention back to the computer, stubbing out his cigarette. He grabs a fresh one from the pack and lights it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​赫米​……​抱歉​你​没能​亲自​见证​这​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​我​辜负​了​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​将​注意力​重新​集中​到​电脑​上​，​掐灭​了​手中​的​香烟​。​他​从​烟盒​里​抽出​一支​新​的​香烟​，​点燃​了​它​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，he4 mi3……bao4qian4 ni3 mei2 neng2 qin1zi4 jian4zheng4 zhe4 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 wo3 gu1fu4 le5 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 chong2xin1 ji2zhong1 dao4 dian4nao3 shang4，qia1 mie4 le5 shou3 zhong4 de5 xiang1yan1。ta1 cong2 yan1 he2 li3 chou1chu1 yi1 zhi1 xin1 de5 xiang1yan1，dian3ran2 le5 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Jana, but James wanted to kill an innocent man. He had to be "
"dealt with."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​简娜​。​詹姆斯​想​杀害​一个​无辜​的​人​，​我​必须​阻止​他​。\n"
"bao4qian4，Jian3na4。zhan1mu3si1 xiang3 sha1hai4 yi1ge5 wu2gu1 de5 ren2，wo3 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ta1。"

msgid "I'm sorry, Mira. She didn't make it."
msgstr ""
"我​很​抱歉​，​米拉​。​她​没能活​下来​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，mi3la1。ta1 mei2 neng2 huo2 xia4lai5。"

msgid "I'm sorry, but it had to be done."
msgstr ""
"我​很​抱歉​，​但​必须​这么​做​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，dan4 bi4xu1 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but we can't afford to waste time on this. The stakes of this run"
" are too high."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​但​我们​不能​在​这​上面​浪费时间​。​这次​的​任务​事关重大​。\n"
"bao4qian4，dan4 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zai4 zhe4 shang4mian4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。zhe4 ci4 de5 ren4wu5 shi4guan1zhong4da4。"

msgid "I'm sorry, kid. We all are."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​孩子​。​我们​都​很​难受​。\n"
"bao4qian4，hai2zi5。wo3men5 dou1 hen3 nan2shou4。"

msgid "I'm sorry, mein Schatz. I'm suddenly not feeling that well."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​亲爱​的​。​我​突然​感觉​不太​舒服​。\n"
"bao4qian4，qin1ai4 de5。wo3 tu1ran2 gan3jue2 bu4 tai4 shu1fu5。"

msgid "I'm sorry. But I really should go."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​得​走​了​。\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 de2 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I'm sorry. Didn't mean to intrude."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​。​我​不是故意​要​打扰​的​。\n"
"bao4qian4。wo3 bu4 shi4 gu4 yi4 yao4 da3rao3 de5。"

msgid "I'm sorry. I'm still not interested."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​还是​不感兴趣​。\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 hai2shi5 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I'm sorry. If it's any consolation, it wasn't my idea... this is what "
"Ezkibel was willing to agree to."
msgstr ""
"我​很​遗憾​。​我​只​希望​你​明白​，​这​不是​我​的​意思​……​埃兹​基​贝尔​只​愿意​接受​这样​的​条件​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 yi2han4。wo3 zhi3 xi1wang4 ni3 ming2bai5，zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 de5 yi4si5……Ai1ziji1bei4er3 zhi3 yuan4yi4 jie1shou4 zhe4yang4 de5 tiao2jian4。"

msgid "I'm sorry. She did."
msgstr ""
"很​遗憾​，​的确如此​。\n"
"hen3 yi2han4，de5 que4 ru2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"I'm sticking close to home, and close to Samuel and his people. They won't "
"shy away from a fight."
msgstr ""
"我会​待​在家​附近​，​以及​塞缪尔​和​他​的​人​身边​。​他们​不会​在​战斗​中​退缩​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 dai1 zai4jia1 fu4jin4，yi3ji2 sai4miu4er3 he4 ta1 de5 ren2 shen1bian1。ta1men5 bu4hui4 zai4 zhan4dou4 zhong4 tui4suo1。"

msgid "I'm still here."
msgstr ""
"我​还​在​这里​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"I'm still in favor of the \"cut and run\" plan. Butting heads with an AI "
"isn't high on my list of things to do for the day."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​比较支持​“​临阵脱逃​”​的​计划​。​我​可​不想​和​AI​硬碰硬​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 bi3 jiao4 zhi1 chi2“lin2zhen4tuo1tao2” de5 ji4hua4。wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 he4 AI ying4peng4ying4。"

msgid ""
"I'm still in the former camp. I've heard what the Rammbock do to haze new "
"members. I'll take getting pushed around every once in a while over that."
msgstr ""
"我​仍然​守​着​原来​的​阵营​。​我​听说​过​撞锤​帮对​新​成员​的​入会​仪式​有​多​残酷​。​我​宁愿​偶尔​被​欺负​一下​，​也​不愿​经历​那种​事情​。\n"
"wo3 reng2ran2 shou3 zhao2 yuan2lai2 de5 zhen4ying2。wo3 ting1shuo1 guo4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 dui4 xin1 cheng2yuan2 de5 ru4hui4 yi2shi4 you3 duo1 can2ku4。wo3 ning4yuan4 ou3er3 bei4 qi1fu5 yi1xia4，ye3 bu4yuan4 jing1li4 na4zhong3 shi4qing5。"

msgid "I'm still not happy about this."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​有些​不​情愿​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 you3xie1 bu4 qing2yuan4。"

msgid ""
"I'm still out at the end of this thing... your decision to let Schattennest fall to the syndicates doesn't sit well with me. Not at all.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She straightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We don't see eye to eye, and we probably never will. But thanks for the talk, all the same."
msgstr ""
"我​始终​无法​接受​这件​事​的​结局​……​你​让​影巢​落入​黑帮​之手​，​我​对此​实在​无法​认同​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​挺直​了​身子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​意见​相左​，​恐怕​永远​都​不会​达成​共识​。​不过​还是​谢谢​你​愿意​和​我​谈​这些​事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi3zhong1 wu2fa3 jie1shou4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 de5 jie2ju2……ni3 rang4 ying3 chao2 luo4ru4 hei1bang1 zhi1 shou3，wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2zai4 wu2fa3 ren4tong2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi4jian4 xiang1zuo3，kong3pa4 yong3yuan3 dou1 bu4hui4 da2cheng2 gong4shi2。bu4guo4 hai2shi5 xie4xie5 ni3 yuan4yi4 he4 wo3 tan2 zhe4xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I'm still waiting for that report... when I said \"ASAP,\" I meant \"I needed it yesterday.\" Stay until you've completed the tests, then leave the report on my desk. The door code is 54139.\n"
"\n"
"DO THIS TONIGHT. I'll expect to see it waiting for me when I arrive tomorrow.\n"
"\n"
"-Stromberg"
msgstr ""
"我​还​在​等​报告​……​我​说​“​尽快​”​，​那​你​“​昨天​”​就​该​给​我​了​。​给​我​加班​完成​实验​，​再​把​报告​放到​我​桌子​上​。​门禁​密码​是​54139​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今晚​就​给​我​做好​。​明天​早上​我要​第一眼​就​看到​你​的​报告​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​施特​龙贝格\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 zai4 deng3 bao4gao4……wo3 shuo1“jin3kuai4”，na4 ni3“zuo2tian1” jiu4 gai1 gei3 wo3 le5。gei3 wo3 jia1ban1 wan2cheng2 shi2yan4，zai4 ba3 bao4gao4 fang4 dao4 wo3 zhuo1zi5 shang4。men2jin4 mi4ma3 shi4 54139。\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 jiu4 gei3 wo3 zuo4 hao3。ming2tian1 zao3shang5 wo3 yao4 di4yi1yan3 jiu4 kan4dao4 ni3 de5 bao4gao4。\n"
"\n"
"——shi1 te4 long2 bei4 ge2"

msgid ""
"I'm still working on that. But I don't think that the shrine is just a tool "
"for Harrow any more... I think that he relies on it. He's using it as a "
"crutch."
msgstr ""
"我​还​在​思考​这个​问题​。​但​我​觉得​那座​神龛​对​哈罗​而言​，​已经​不仅仅​只是​工具​了​……​我​认为​他​在​依赖​着​它​。​他​把​神龛​当作​一种​倚仗​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 zai4 si1kao3 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。dan4 wo3 jue2de5 na4 zuo4 shen2kan1 dui4 ha1luo2 er2yan2，yi3jing1 bu4jin3jin3 zhi3shi4 gong1ju4 le5……wo3 ren4wei2 ta1 zai4 yi1lai4 zhao2 ta1。ta1 ba3 shen2kan1 dang4zuo4 yi1zhong3 yi3zhang4。"

msgid ""
"I'm suggesting that we keep my promise. If he wants the chip so badly, give "
"it to him."
msgstr ""
"我​是​说​我​要​遵守​我​的​承诺​。​如果​他​这么​想要​这块​芯片​，​就​给​他​好​了​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 shuo1 wo3 yao4 zun1shou3 wo3 de5 cheng2nuo4。ru2guo3 ta1 zhe4me5 xiang3yao4 zhe4 kuai4 xin1pian4，jiu4 gei3 ta1 hao3 le5。"

msgid "I'm sure it is."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。"

msgid "I'm sure that I've gone up against stranger."
msgstr ""
"我​确信​我​遇到​过​更​诡异​的​东西​。\n"
"wo3 que4xin4 wo3 yu4dao4 guo4 geng1 gui3yi4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "I'm sure that it does, Blitz. I can't wait to see how this plays out."
msgstr ""
"必须​的​，​布里​茨​。​我​已经​等不及​看​之后​发生​的​事情​了​。\n"
"bi4xu1 de5，Bu4li3ci2。wo3 yi3jing1 deng3bu4ji2 kan4 zhi1hou4 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm sure that it does. Now do you wanna cut to the chase and tell me why I'm"
" here?"
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。​所以​你​能​不能​有话直说​，​告诉​我​到底​找​我​来​有​什么​事​？\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。suo3yi3 ni3 neng2 bu4neng2 you3 hua4 zhi2 shuo1，gao4su4 wo3 dao4di3 zhao3 wo3 lai2 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "I'm sure that it is."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​十分​确信​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 que4xin4。"

msgid "I'm sure that it isn't. Where did you even find a supplier?"
msgstr ""
"确实​。​话​说​你​从​哪里​找到​的​供应商​？\n"
"que4shi2。hua4 shuo1 ni3 cong2 na3li3 zhao3dao4 de5 gong1ying4shang1？"

msgid ""
"I'm sure that the Landenberg Ring has plenty of accountants. Grinder "
"wouldn't need you anymore."
msgstr ""
"我​很​确定​给兰​登堡​帮​干活​的​会计​有的是​。​“​绞肉机​”​不再​需要​你​了​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 que4ding4 gei3 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 gan4huo2 de5 kuai4ji4 you3de5shi4。“jiao3rou4ji1” bu4zai4 xu1yao4 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm sure that you do. I'm willing to bet that my crew's better, though... "
"there's still a space for you if you wanted to sign on."
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。​不过​我​还是​觉得​我​的​团队​更好​……​如果​你​愿意​的话​，​我会​给​你​留个​位子​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。bu4guo4 wo3 hai2shi5 jue2de5 wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 geng1 hao3……ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，wo3 hui4 gei3 ni3 liu2 ge4 wei4zi5。"

msgid ""
"I'm sure that you haven't. Probably just another screw-up at Central. But if"
" you don't get this cleared up, it will bite you in the ass."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​我信​你​说​的话​。​可能​是​指挥部​又​在​瞎搞​了​吧​。​但​你​要是​不去​说​清楚​的话​，​可是​会​惹​上​大​麻烦​的​。\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，wo3 xin4 ni3 shuo1 de5hua4。ke3neng2 shi4 zhi3hui1bu4 you4 zai4 xia1gao3 le5 ba1。dan4 ni3 yao4shi5 bu4 qu4 shuo1 qing1chu5 de5hua4，ke3shi4 hui4 re3 shang4 dai4 ma2fan5 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm sure that you would.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She glances over her shoulder at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good find, $(l.name)... we've struck a nerve. Any other thoughts?"
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​我信​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​扭头​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​做得好​，​$(l.name)​……​看来​我们​击中​了​他​的​软肋​。​还有​什么​想法​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，wo3 xin4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 niu3tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zuo4 de2 hao3，$(l.name)……kan4lai5 wo3men5 ji1zhong4 le5 ta1 de5 ruan3lei4。hai2you3 shen2me5 xiang3fa3 ma5？"

msgid "I'm sure they're up there together."
msgstr ""
"他们​一定​都​去​天堂​了​。\n"
"ta1men5 yi1ding4 dou1 qu4 tian1tang2 le5。"

msgid "I'm sure you are right."
msgstr ""
"你​说​得​没错​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。"

msgid "I'm surprised it took you this long to figure it out."
msgstr ""
"你​到​现在​才​发现​啊​。\n"
"ni3 dao4 xian4zai4 cai2 fa1xian4 a1。"

msgid ""
"I'm surprised that there's enough left of them to hold much of anything."
msgstr ""
"没想到​他们​剩下​的​那点​人​居然​还​能​保住​一片​地盘​。\n"
"mei2xiang3dao4 ta1men5 sheng4xia4 de5 na4 dian3 ren2 ju1ran2 hai2 neng2 bao3zhu4 yi1 pian1 di4pan2。"

msgid ""
"I'm surprised that they sell cyberware for children. Don't the kids... I "
"dunno... outgrow it?"
msgstr ""
"他们​居然​还​卖​少儿​类型​的​赛博​改造​啊​。​这个​……​等到​孩子​以后​……​身体​长大​了​呢​？\n"
"ta1men5 ju1ran2 hai2 mai4 shao4er2 lei4xing2 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 a1。zhe4ge5……deng3dao4 hai2zi5 yi3hou4……shen1ti3 zhang3da4 le5 ni2？"

msgid "I'm surprised that you recognize the name."
msgstr ""
"你​居然​知道​这个​名字​。\n"
"ni3 ju1ran2 zhi1dao4 zhe4ge5 ming2zi5。"

msgid ""
"I'm surprised that you've given up so easily. There must be *someplace* you "
"haven't looked."
msgstr ""
"我​没想到​你​这么​容易​就​放弃​了​。​肯定​还有​*​什么​地方​*​是​你​没​找​过​的​。\n"
"wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 ni3 zhe4me5 rong2yi4 jiu4 fang4qi4 le5。ken3ding4 hai2you3*shen2me5 di4fang1*shi4 ni3 mei2 zhao3 guo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I'm surprised to hear you say that. The Firewing wasn't just any dragon."
msgstr ""
"没想到​你​会​这么​说​。​火翼​可不是​一般​的​巨龙​。\n"
"mei2xiang3dao4 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1。Huo3yi4 ke3bu5shi4 yi1ban1 de5 ju4long2。"

msgid "I'm surprised you let him close the distance on you like that."
msgstr ""
"我​没想到​你​能​让​他​逼近​到​这个​距离​。\n"
"wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 ni3 neng2 rang4 ta1 bi1jin4 dao4 zhe4ge5 ju4li2。"

msgid "I'm talking about money. Payment. For letting you go."
msgstr ""
"我​说​的​是​钱​。​放​你​走​的​报酬​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de5 shi4 qian2。fang4 ni3 zou3 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid ""
"I'm telling you, Alex, he's using you! That's what groups like Humanis *do!*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich's voice wavers. His eyes are as wide as saucers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When he's finished with you, he'll toss you out, just like your dad did!"
msgstr ""
"听​我​说​，​亚历克斯​，​他​在​利用​你​！​这是​人类​至上​主义者​这​类​组织​的​*​一贯​伎俩​*​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​的​声音​颤抖​着​，​他​的​眼睛​瞪​得​像​铜铃​般大​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​他​利用​完​你​，​就​会​把​你​一脚​踢开​，​就​像​你​爸​当年​那样​！\n"
"\n"
"ting1 wo3 shuo1，ya4 li4 ke4 si1，ta1 zai4 li4yong4 ni3！zhe4 shi4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zhe4 lei4 zu3zhi1 de5*yi1guan4 ji4liang3*！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 sheng1yin1 chan4dou3 zhao2，ta1 de5 yan3jing5 deng4 de2 xiang4 tong2ling2 ban1 dai4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3 ta1 li4yong4 wan2 ni3，jiu4 hui4 ba3 ni3 yi1 jiao3 ti1 kai1，jiu4 xiang4 ni3 ba4 dang1nian2 na4yang4！"

msgid ""
"I'm the $(s.man) that's gonna bring this place down. That's all you need to "
"know."
msgstr ""
"我​即将​摧毁​这个​地方​。​你​只​需要​知道​这些​就够​了​。\n"
"wo3 ji2jiang1 cui1hui3 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。ni3 zhi3 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm the $(s.race) that's gonna bring this place down. That's all you need to"
" know."
msgstr ""
"我​是​个​$(s.race)​，​并且​即将​摧毁​这个​地方​。​你​只​需要​知道​这些​就够​了​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 ge4 $(s.race)，bing4qie3 ji2jiang1 cui1hui3 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。ni3 zhi3 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm the leader of this outfit. I decide what is and isn't my concern. Now "
"tell me what's going on."
msgstr ""
"我​是​这个​团队​的​领导者​。​关不关​我​的​事​是​由​我​自己​决定​的​。​现在​告诉​我​，​到底​怎么​个事​？\n"
"wo3 shi4 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4 de5 ling3dao3zhe3。guan1 bu4 guan1 wo3 de5 shi4 shi4 you2 wo3 zi4ji3 jue2ding4 de5。xian4zai4 gao4su4 wo3，dao4di3 zen3me5 ge4 shi4？"

msgid "I'm the most qualified."
msgstr ""
"我​是​最​有​资格​的​人​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 zui4 you3 zi1ge2 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"I'm thinking of taking the offer. I don't want to get on this particular "
"contact's bad side."
msgstr ""
"我​确实​在​考虑​接受​提议​，​我​不想​得罪​这个​联络人​。\n"
"wo3 que4shi2 zai4 kao3lu:4 jie1shou4 ti2yi4，wo3 bu4xiang3 de2zui4 zhe4ge5 lian2luo4ren2。"

msgid "I'm thinking that they didn't expect us to make it here at all."
msgstr ""
"他们​好像​没指望​我们​能​来​。\n"
"ta1men5 hao3xiang4 mei2 zhi3 wang4 wo3men5 neng2 lai2。"

msgid ""
"I'm thinking that you'll just go on feeding these ghouls, whether you want "
"to or not."
msgstr ""
"我​的​要求​是​你​继续​饲养​那些​食尸​鬼​，​无论​你​愿不愿意​。\n"
"wo3 de5 yao1qiu2 shi4 ni3 ji4xu4 si4yang3 na4xie1 shi2 shi1 gui3，wu2lun4 ni3 yuan4 bu4 yuan4 yi4。"

msgid "I'm too busy at the moment."
msgstr ""
"我​现在​太忙​了​。\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 tai4 mang2 le5。"

msgid "I'm trying to find a friend."
msgstr ""
"我​在​找​一个​朋友​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhao3 yi1ge5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"I'm usually right in the thick of the action. Easy to get shot under those circumstances.\n"
"\n"
"If I hadn't been downstairs when KE smashed in, I'd be in that pile with them."
msgstr ""
"我​通常​都​身处​交火​最​激烈​的​地方​。​在​那种​情况​下​很​容易​中弹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要不是​游侠​骑士​闯进来​的​时候​我​正在​楼下​，​我​现在​恐怕​也​在​那​堆​尸体​里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong1chang2 dou1 shen1chu3 jiao1huo3 zui4 ji1lie4 de5 di4fang1。zai4 na4zhong3 qing2kuang4 xia4 hen3 rong2yi4 zhong4dan4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4bu5shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 chuang3 jin4 lai2 de5 shi2hou5 wo3 zheng4zai4 lou2xia4，wo3 xian4zai4 kong3pa4 ye3 zai4 na4 dui1 shi1ti3 li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I'm willing to bet that I could do that, chief. This guy might not know how to disengage the quarantine, but I'll bet that I can. And once we've reestablished the building's Matrix connection, it'd be no big deal for me to download the last episode for him to watch.\n"
"\n"
"If nothing else, it'll keep him occupied for a while."
msgstr ""
"这事​我​能​做到​，​头儿​。​这个​家伙​可能​不​知道​怎么​解除​隔离​，​但​我​肯定​没​问题​。​等​我们​重新​建立​大楼​的​矩阵​链接​之后​，​我​下载​最后​一集​给​他​看​完全​不是​什么​难事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别的​不说​，​这​至少​能​让​他​忙活​一阵子​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 neng2 zuo4dao4，tou2r5。zhe4ge5 jia1huo5 ke3neng2 bu4 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 jie3chu2 ge2li2，dan4 wo3 ken3ding4 mei2 wen4ti2。deng3 wo3men5 chong2xin1 jian4li4 da4lou2 de5 ju3zhen4 lian4jie1 zhi1hou4，wo3 xia4zai3 zui4hou4 yi1 ji2 gei3 ta1 kan4 wan2quan2 bu4shi4 shen2me5 nan2 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bie2de5 bu4 shuo1，zhe4 zhi4shao3 neng2 rang4 ta1 mang2huo5 yi1zhen4zi5。"

msgid "I'm willing to help you see this through if you want the help."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​需要的话​，​我​很​乐意​帮​你​追查​到底​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xu1 yao4 de5 hua4，wo3 hen3 le4yi4 bang1 ni3 zhui1cha2 dao4di3。"

msgid ""
"I'm with $(l.name) on this one. This is interesting... scary, even. But it "
"doesn't actually change anything."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​$(l.name)​说​的话​。​这一​发现​很​有趣​……​甚至​有些​可怕​。​但​它​并​不能​阻碍​我们​的​计划​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 $(l.name) shuo1 de5hua4。zhe4 yi1 fa1xian4 hen3 you3qu4……shen4zhi4 you3xie1 ke3pa4。dan4 ta1 bing4 bu4neng2 zu3ai4 wo3men5 de5 ji4hua4。"

msgid ""
"I'm with Blitz. There's a living troll buried under all of that chrome.\n"
"\n"
"We can't just hand him over like a piece of merchandise. "
msgstr ""
"我​同意​布里​茨​的话​。​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不能​把​他​当​货物​交出去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 Bu4li3ci2 de5hua4。pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4neng2 ba3 ta1 dang1 huo4wu4 jiao1 chu1 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I'm with Dietrich on this one, chief.\n"
"\n"
"If you help that old nutcase, everyone we know back in Berlin will die. Our *house* will burn down. So, uh... if you really wanna do this, I'm gonna have to stop you."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​迪​特里​希​的话​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​帮助​那个​老​疯子​，​我们​在​柏林​认识​的​每个​人​都​会​死​。​我们​的​*​房子​*​也​会​被​烧毁​。​所以​，​嗯​……​如果​你​真的​想​这么​做​，​我​必须​阻止​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 Di2te4li3xi1 de5hua4，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bang1zhu4 na4ge5 lao3 feng1zi5，wo3men5 zai4 bo2lin2 ren4shi5 de5 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 hui4 si3。wo3men5 de5*fang2zi5*ye3 hui4 bei4 shao1hui3。suo3yi3，en1……ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4，wo3 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid "I'm with Dietrich. No guts, no glory."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​迪​特里​希​的​说法​。​不入虎穴​，​焉得虎子​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 Di2te4li3xi1 de5 shuo1fa3。bu4 ru4 hu3 xue2，yan1 de2 hu3 zi3。"

msgid "I'm with Glory. I want answers, and we're going to go get them."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​格洛丽​的话​。​我​也​想要​答案​，​必须​查明真相​才行​。\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 Ge2luo4li2 de5hua4。wo3 ye3 xiang3yao4 da2an4，bi4xu1 cha2 ming2 zhen1 xiang1 cai2 xing2。"

msgid ""
"I'm with them, chief. If you help that old nutcase, our *house* will burn down. And I'm not okay with that!\n"
"\n"
"So, uh... if you really wanna do this, I'm gonna have to stop you."
msgstr ""
"我​和​他们​的​想法​一样​，​头儿​。​如果​你​帮助​那个​老​疯子​，​我们​的​*​房子​*​会​被​烧毁​。​我​可​不想​这样​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​嗯​……​如果​你​真的​想​这么​做​，​我​必须​阻止​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 ta1men5 de5 xiang3fa3 yi1yang4，tou2r5。ru2guo3 ni3 bang1zhu4 na4ge5 lao3 feng1zi5，wo3men5 de5*fang2zi5*hui4 bei4 shao1hui3。wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 zhe4yang4！\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，en1……ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4，wo3 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I'm with you there.\n"
"\n"
"Come on. Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​你​的​看法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​我们​赶紧​把​这件​事​解决​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 kan4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 jie3jue2 diao4。"

msgid "I'm with you there. Let's get this done."
msgstr ""
"我​也​同意​。​赶紧​完事​吧​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 tong2yi4。gan3jin3 wan2shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I'm your muscle. Dealing with situations like this is part of the job "
"description."
msgstr ""
"既然​我​是​你​的​打手​，​处理​这种​情况​就是​我​工作​的​一部分​。\n"
"ji4ran2 wo3 shi4 ni3 de5 da3shou5，chu3li3 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 jiu4shi4 wo3 gong1zuo4 de5 yi1bu4fen5。"

msgid ""
"I'm your team leader, Eiger. If something led you to kill one of your "
"teammates, I need to know about that."
msgstr ""
"我​是​你​的​队长​，​艾格尔​。​如果​有​什么​原因​让​你​杀死​自己​的​队友​，​那​我​必须​得​知晓​缘由​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 ni3 de5 dui4zhang3，Ai4ge2er3。ru2guo3 you3 shen2me5 yuan2yin1 rang4 ni3 sha1si3 zi4ji3 de5 dui4you3，na4 wo3 bi4xu1 de2 zhi1xiao3 yuan2you2。"

msgid ""
"I'm your team leader, not your relationship counselor. Get your head in the "
"game and stop worrying about your ex."
msgstr ""
"我​是​你​的​团队​领袖​，​不是​你​的​感情​咨询师​，​赶紧​把​心思​给​我​放在​正事​上​，​别​再​操心​什么​前任​的​事​了​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 ling3xiu4，bu4shi4 ni3 de5 gan3qing2 zi1 xun2 shi1，gan3jin3 ba3 xin1si5 gei3 wo3 fang4 zai4 zheng4shi4 shang4，bie4 zai4 cao1xin1 shen2me5 qian2ren4 de5 shi4 le5。"

msgid "I'm, uh, with the night crew. I just went out for soykaf."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​我​是​值夜班​的​。​我​刚才​出去​买豆​咖了​。\n"
"e4，wo3 shi4 zhi2 ye4 ban1 de5。wo3 gang1cai2 chu1qu4 mai3 dou4 ka1 le5。"

msgid "I've accessed the door controls. Say when, and I'll force it for you!"
msgstr ""
"我​已经​拿下​大门​控制​了​。​等​你​一​下令​我​就​把​它​破开​！\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 na2xia4 da4men2 kong4zhi4 le5。deng3 ni3 yi1 xia4ling4 wo3 jiu4 ba3 ta1 po4kai1！"

msgid "I've already killed the bastard."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​杀​了​那​混蛋​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 sha1 le5 na4 hun2dan4。"

msgid "I've always wanted a bound spirit."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​想​和​精魂​化为​一体​来​着​。\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 xiang3 he4 jing1hun2 hua4 wei2 yi1ti3 lai2 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"I've backtraced all of the Matrix nodes that Hellebore was looking into, back before she got cooked. Whoever's been purging the Matrix didn't think about that! And I found that she'd turned up...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Winters stabs a few keys on his keyboard, and an image expands to fill the screen of his monitor. A satellite photo of a rural landscape, annotated with GPS data.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...a set of map coordinates."
msgstr ""
"我​回溯​了​海勒​波在​死​前​所​查看​的​所有​矩阵​节点​。​清除​矩阵​的​人​肯定​没有​想到​这​一点​！​而​我​发现​她​找到​了​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​温特斯​在​键盘​上​敲​了​几下​，​一幅​图像​便​扩展​开来​，​填满​了​他​的​显示器​屏幕​。​一张​乡村​风景​的​卫星​照片​，​上面​注有​GPS​数据​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​一组​地图​坐标​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui2su4 le5 hai3 lei1 bo1 zai4 si3 qian2 suo3 cha2kan4 de5 suo3you3 ju3zhen4 jie2dian3。qing1chu2 ju3zhen4 de5 ren2 ken3ding4 mei2you3 xiang3dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3！er2 wo3 fa1xian4 ta1 zhao3dao4 le5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 zai4 jian4pan2 shang4 qiao1 le5 ji1 xia4，yi1 fu2 tu2xiang4 bian4 kuo4zhan3 kai1 lai2，tian2man3 le5 ta1 de5 xian3shi4qi4 ping2mu4。yi1 zhang1 xiang1cun1 feng1jing3 de5 wei4xing1 zhao4pian4，shang4mian4 zhu4 you3 GPS shu4ju4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……yi1 zu3 di4tu2 zuo4biao1。"

msgid ""
"I've been assigned to protect you. Central sent me down here to familiarize "
"myself with the lab."
msgstr ""
"我​是​来​保护​你们​的​。​指挥部​派​我​来​熟悉​一下​实验室​的​周边环境​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 lai2 bao3hu4 ni3men5 de5。zhi3hui1bu4 pai4 wo3 lai2 shu2xi1 yi1xia4 shi2yan4shi4 de5 zhou1 bian1 huan2 jing4。"

msgid "I've been itching for a stand-up fight. Let's do it."
msgstr ""
"我​正​手痒​想​好好​打​一场​呢​。​咱们​上​。\n"
"wo3 zheng1 shou3yang3 xiang3 hao3hao3 da3 yi1 chang2 ni2。zan2men5 shang4。"

msgid ""
"I've been keeping my ears open. Haven't heard anything definite yet, though.\n"
"\n"
"Now, based on what we found in that warehouse, I do think the Lobatchevskis are the *most* likely suspects in this. Yuli'd worked with them before, and I could see them trying to roll over Schattennest. Use Occam's razor - it's probably them."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​在​留心​打听​消息​，​不过​目前​还​没​听到​什么​确切​的​动静​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​我们​在​仓库​发现​的​线索​，​我​认为​洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​确实​*​最​*​有​嫌疑​。​尤里​以前​就​和​他们​合作​过​，​而​他们​试图​想要​吞并​影巢​也​完全​说得通​。​如果说​我们​不​把​事情​想​得​太​复杂​的话​，​那​十有八九​就是​他们​干​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 liu2xin1 da3ting5 xiao1xi5，bu4guo4 mu4qian2 hai2 mei2 ting1dao4 shen2me5 que4qie4 de5 dong4jing4。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 wo3men5 zai4 cang1ku4 fa1xian4 de5 xian4suo3，wo3 ren4wei2 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2 que4shi2*zui4*you3 xian2yi2。You2li3 yi3qian2 jiu4 he4 ta1men5 he2zuo4 guo4，er2 ta1men5 shi4tu2 xiang3yao4 tun1bing4 ying3 chao2 ye3 wan2quan2 shuo1 de2 tong1。ru2guo3shuo1 wo3men5 bu4 ba3 shi4qing5 xiang3 de2 tai4 fu4za2 de5hua4，na4 shi2you3ba1jiu3 jiu4shi4 ta1men5 gan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I've been meaning to ask: what's up with the tattooed circuitry? Is it "
"purely decorative, or...?"
msgstr ""
"我​一直​想​问​：​这个​电路​纹身​是​怎么回事​？​是​纯粹​的​装饰​，​还是​……​？\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 xiang3 wen4：zhe4ge5 dian4lu4 wen2shen1 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？shi4 chun2cui4 de5 zhuang1shi4，hai2shi5……？"

msgid ""
"I've been on edge since we came in. But that doesn't change the fact that we"
" should learn what we can."
msgstr ""
"自从​我们​进来​后​，​我​就​一直​心神不宁​。​但​这​并​不能​改变​我们​应该​尽可能​在​这里​收集​情报​的​事实​。\n"
"zi4cong2 wo3men5 jin4lai2 hou4，wo3 jiu4 yi1zhi2 xin1shen2bu4ning2。dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4neng2 gai3bian4 wo3men5 ying1gai1 jin3ke3neng2 zai4 zhe4li3 shou1ji2 qing2bao4 de5 shi4shi2。"

msgid "I've been waiting for this since we got here."
msgstr ""
"从​我们​到​这里​后​，​我​就​一直​在​等待​这​一刻​。\n"
"cong2 wo3men5 dao4 zhe4li3 hou4，wo3 jiu4 yi1zhi2 zai4 deng3dai4 zhe4 yi1 ke4。"

msgid "I've brought you your shipment. I'm here to get paid."
msgstr ""
"我​把​你​的​货​带来​了​，​给钱​吧​。\n"
"wo3 ba3 ni3 de5 huo4 dai4lai2 le5，gei3 qian2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I've changed my mind, Doc. I genuinely think that you should release your "
"virus."
msgstr ""
"我​改变​了​主意​，​博士​。​我​真心​认为​你​应该​释放​你​的​病毒​。\n"
"wo3 gai3bian4 le5 zhu3yi5，bo2shi4。wo3 zhen1xin1 ren4wei2 ni3 ying1gai1 shi4fang4 ni3 de5 bing4du2。"

msgid "I've changed my mind. I think I'll just kill you instead."
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​。​我​觉得​我​还是​直接​干掉​你​比较​好​。\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。wo3 jue2de5 wo3 hai2shi5 zhi2jie1 gan4diao4 ni3 bi3jiao4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"I've changed my mind. I'll tell the leader of the ghouls about your work-"
"for-food deal."
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​。​我会​和​尸​鬼​首领​转达​你​的​“​工作​换​食物​”​提议​。\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。wo3 hui4 he4 shi1 gui3 shou3ling3 zhuan3da2 ni3 de5“gong1zuo4 huan4 shi2wu4” ti2yi4。"

msgid "I've changed my mind. Let's just drop it."
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​，​还是​不谈​这个​了​。\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5，hai2shi5 bu4 tan2 zhe4ge5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I've come to put an end to this place, Harrow - this place, and your "
"pathetic, sickening cult."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​，​我要​来​了结​这个​地方​，​以及​你​建立​的​这个​可悲​而​又​恶心​的​邪教​。\n"
"ha1luo2，wo3 yao4 lai2 liao3jie2 zhe4ge5 di4fang1，yi3ji2 ni3 jian4li4 de5 zhe4ge5 ke3bei1 er2 you4 e3xin1 de5 xie2jiao4。"

msgid "I've dealt with basilisks before."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​对付​过蛇怪​。\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 dui4fu5 guo4 she2 guai4。"

msgid ""
"I've dealt with things like this before, ($l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She holds her articulated hands out in front of you. Steel and chrome shimmer in the harsh light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know how that turned out."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​对付​过​类似​的​东西​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​将​机械​铰接​的​双手​伸到​你​面前​。​在​刺​目的​光线​下​，​钢铁​与​铬​合金​闪烁着​冷冽​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​结果​你​也​看到​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 dui4fu5 guo4 lei4si4 de5 dong1xi1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 ji1xie4 jiao3 jie1 de5 shuang1shou3 shen1 dao4 ni3 mian4qian2。zai4 ci1 mu4di4 guang1xian4 xia4，gang1tie3 yu4 ge4 he2jin1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 leng3lie4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jie1guo3 ni3 ye3 kan4dao4 le5。"

msgid "I've finished with your \"little trifle,\" Herr Burakgazi."
msgstr ""
"你​那件​“​琐事​”​我​已经​完成​了​，​布拉加​齐​先生​。\n"
"ni3 na4 jian4“suo3shi4” wo3 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2 le5，bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 xian1sheng5。"

msgid "I've fought Knight Errant before. They don't scare me."
msgstr ""
"我​和​游侠​骑士​交​过手​。​我​不怕​他们​。\n"
"wo3 he4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 jiao1 guo4 shou3。wo3 bu4pa4 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"I've found closure. Harrow is dead.\n"
"\n"
"Reason enough to be happy, I should think."
msgstr ""
"因为​哈罗​死​了​，​我​解脱​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​理由​足够​充分​了​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 ha1luo2 si3 le5，wo3 jie3tuo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 li3you2 zu2gou4 chong1fen4 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I've got *n-nothing* for you, shadowrunner.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice sounds stronger now. The stutter that marred his speech has almost completely faded away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The sooner you learn that, the better off we'll all be."
msgstr ""
"我​-​我​*​没有​*​什么​能​告诉​你​的​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​听​起来​更​洪亮​了​。​刚才​因为​瘫软​导致​的​口吃​也​几乎​完全​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​最好​早点​想​清楚​这​一点​，​这样​我们​都​省事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 -wo3*mei2you3*shen2me5 neng2 gao4su4 ni3 de5，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 geng1 hong2liang4 le5。gang1cai2 yin1wei4 tan1ruan3 dao3zhi4 de5 kou3chi1 ye3 ji1hu1 wan2quan2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zui4hao3 zao3dian3 xiang3 qing1chu5 zhe4 yi1dian3，zhe4yang4 wo3men5 dou1 sheng3shi4 le5。"

msgid "I've got a bad feeling about this."
msgstr ""
"我​有种​不好​的​预感​。\n"
"wo3 you3zhong3 bu4hao3 de5 yu4gan3。"

msgid ""
"I've got a better idea. You drop your weapons, and I won't order Tin Man "
"here to tear you in half."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​更好​的​主意​。​你​把​武器​放下​，​否则​我​就​叫​这​铁皮​人​把​你​撕成​两半​。\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 geng1 hao3 de5 zhu3yi5。ni3 ba3 wu3qi4 fang4xia4，fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4 jiao4 zhe4 tie3pi2 ren2 ba3 ni3 si1 cheng2 liang3 ban4。"

msgid "I've got a couple of ideas."
msgstr ""
"我​倒​是​有​几个​办法​。\n"
"wo3 dao3 shi4 you3 ji3ge5 ban4fa3。"

msgid "I've got a few Magnifiker trinkets to sell."
msgstr ""
"我​有​几件​伟术​帮​的​小玩意儿​想卖​。\n"
"wo3 you3 ji1 jian4 wei3 shu4 bang1 de5 xiao3 wan2 yi4 er2 xiang3 mai4。"

msgid ""
"I've got a little toy hidden away... managed to stash it before those Knight Errant pukes took me.\n"
"\n"
"My own design, totally one-of-a-kind. I call it a \"Pain Inducer.\" Grade-A fun for the runner who has everything, and I guarantee that you'll never find another."
msgstr ""
"我藏​了​一个​小​玩具​……​在​那些​游侠​骑士​混蛋​抓住​我前​把​它​藏​了​起来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​自己​设计​的​，​绝对​独一无二​。​我称​它​为​“​疼痛​诱发​器​”​。​哪怕​是​见​过​再​多​世面​的​狂奔​者​，​也​能​通过​它​得到​绝无仅有​的​乐子​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zang4 le5 yi1ge5 xiao3 wan2ju4……zai4 na4xie1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 hun2dan4 zhua1zhu4 wo3 qian2 ba3 ta1 zang4 le5 qi3lai5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 she4ji4 de5，jue2dui4 du2yi1wu2er4。wo3 chen4 ta1 wei2“teng2tong4 you4fa1 qi4”。na3pa4 shi4 jian4 guo4 zai4 duo1 shi4mian4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3，ye3 neng2 tong1guo4 ta1 de2dao4 jue2wu2jin3you3 de5 le4zi5。"

msgid ""
"I've got a news flash for you, friend. Here in Berlin, teams don't *have* leaders.\n"
"\n"
"The very *idea* of a team leader runs counter to the spirit of this place."
msgstr ""
"告诉​你​个​冷​知识​，​朋友​。​在​我们​柏林​，​小队​之中​*​没有​*​队长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所谓​“​队长​”​的​概念​跟​这里​的​精神​是​完全​背道而驰​的​。\n"
"\n"
"gao4su4 ni3 ge4 leng3 zhi1shi5，peng2you5。zai4 wo3men5 bo2lin2，xiao3 dui4 zhi1zhong1*mei2you3*dui4zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3wei4“dui4zhang3” de5 gai4nian4 gen1 zhe4li3 de5 jing1shen2 shi4 wan2quan2 bei4dao4er2chi2 de5。"

msgid "I've got a proposal for you. Something that'll hurt Aztechnology."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​提议​。​这招​肯定​能​给​阿兹特​科技​带来​不少​损失​。\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4。zhe4 zhao1 ken3ding4 neng2 gei3 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 dai4lai2 bu4shao3 sun3shi1。"

msgid ""
"I've got business on the other side of your barricade. One way or another, "
"that's where I'm going."
msgstr ""
"我要​到​路障​的​那​一头​办些​事​，​怎么着​我​也​得​过去​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 dao4 lu4zhang4 de5 na4 yi1tou2 ban4 xie1 shi4，zen3me5zhao1 wo3 ye3 de2 guo4qu4。"

msgid "I've got enough problems of my own."
msgstr ""
"我​自己​的​事情​已经​够​多​了​。\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 gou4 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"I've got fifteen assorted orks and trolls from all around the Kreuzbasar working with me now. They help me man the soup line, stock the library shelves, and to do all of the hundreds of other little things that a community organization needs done every day.\n"
"\n"
"These extraordinary individuals are living proof that what we do here has value. They are my inspiration to continue forward."
msgstr ""
"我​现在​和​来自​克洛伊​茨​集市​各地​的​十五位​各种各样​的​兽​人​和​巨魔​一起​工作​。​他们​帮​我​排队​领​救济品​，​帮​我​给​图书馆​的​书架上​货​，​帮​我​做​社区​组织​每天​需要​做​的​数百件​小事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​了不起​的​人​就是​活生生​的​例子​，​他们​证明​了​我们​在​这里​所​做​的​一切​是​有​价值​的​。​他们​激励​着​我​继续前进​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 he4 lai2zi4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ge4di4 de5 shi2 wu3 wei4 ge4zhong3ge4yang4 de5 shou4 ren2 he4 ju4mo2 yi1qi3 gong1zuo4。ta1men5 bang1 wo3 pai2dui4 ling3 jiu4 ji4 pin3，bang1 wo3 gei3 tu2shu1guan3 de5 shu1 jia4 shang4 huo4，bang1 wo3 zuo4 she4qu1 zu3zhi1 mei3tian1 xu1yao4 zuo4 de5 shu3 bai3 jian4 xiao3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 liao3bu5qi3 de5 ren2 jiu4shi4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 li4zi5，ta1men5 zheng4ming2 le5 wo3men5 zai4 zhe4li3 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4 shi4 you3 jia4zhi2 de5。ta1men5 ji1li4 zhao2 wo3 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid ""
"I've got it covered, chief. Don't worry, you won't hear peep from me about Grinder ever again.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else, or can I go about my day?"
msgstr ""
"交给​我​吧​，​头儿​。​别​担心​，​你​绝对​不会​再​听到​我​抱怨​“​绞肉机​”​的​事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​别的​事​吗​？​还是​说​我​可以​自己​忙​去​了​？\n"
"\n"
"jiao1gei3 wo3 ba1，tou2r5。bie4 dan1xin1，ni3 jue2dui4 bu4hui4 zai4 ting1dao4 wo3 bao4yuan4“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 wo3 ke3yi3 zi4ji3 mang2 qu4 le5？"

msgid ""
"I've got it right here.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He reaches into his pocket, and produces a slim plastic rod. A credstick.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...And the change of plans on the run didn't bother you? Please, be honest."
msgstr ""
"就​在​这​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把手​伸进​口袋​，​掏出​一根​纤细​的​塑料​棒​。​一根​信用​棒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​另外​你​对​差事​过程​中​的​变化​没有​什么​意见​吗​？​请​和​我​说实话​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 zhe4 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 kou3dai4，tao1chu1 yi1 gen1 xian1xi4 de5 su4liao4 bang4。yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ling4wai4 ni3 dui4 cha4shi4 guo4cheng2 zhong4 de5 bian4hua4 mei2you3 shen2me5 yi4jian4 ma5？qing3 he4 wo3 shuo1shi2hua4。"

msgid ""
"I've got it, chief. The MKVI is under my control.\n"
"\n"
"But it's strange... this thing's reactions feel... *off,* somehow."
msgstr ""
"我​搞定​了​，​头儿​。​MKVI​现在​任​我​差遣​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​挺​奇怪​的​……​我​感觉​这​东西​的​反应​……​怎么​说​呢​，​有点​*​异常​*​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gao3ding4 le5，tou2r5。MKVI xian4zai4 ren4 wo3 chai1qian3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 ting3 qi2guai4 de5……wo3 gan3jue2 zhe4 dong1xi1 de5 fan3ying4……zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，you3dian3*yi4chang2*。"

msgid "I've got nothin' more to say to you, thief."
msgstr ""
"我​对​你​没什么​好​说​的​，​小贼​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ni3 mei2shen2me5 hao3 shuo1 de5，xiao3 zei2。"

msgid ""
"I've got nothin' more to say, boss. Let's just get this run taken care of..."
" you can hit me up again later if you wanna talk."
msgstr ""
"我​没什么​好​说​的​了​，​老大​。​我们​先​处理​好​这趟​活​吧​……​如果​你​还​想​聊​的话​，​晚点​再​找​我​吧​。\n"
"wo3 mei2shen2me5 hao3 shuo1 de5 le5，lao3da4。wo3men5 xian1 chu3li3 hao3 zhe4 tang1 huo2 ba1……ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xiang3 liao2 de5hua4，wan3dian3 zai4 zhao3 wo3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I've got nothin' to say to you, boss.\n"
"\n"
"We may have gotten through this thing alive, but that doesn't make up for what you did on that Humanis run."
msgstr ""
"我​对​你​没什么​好​说​的​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽说​我们​最后​活​下来​了​。​但​这​并​不能​弥补​你​在​人类​至上​主义者​据点​里​做​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ni3 mei2shen2me5 hao3 shuo1 de5，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"sui1shuo1 wo3men5 zui4hou4 huo2 xia4lai5 le5。dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4neng2 mi2bu3 ni3 zai4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ju4dian3 li3 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "I've got nowhere else I need to be."
msgstr ""
"我​也​没​别的​地方​要​去​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 mei2 bie2de5 di4fang1 yao4 qu4。"

msgid ""
"I've got some questions about Das Kesselhaus-Hotel. I'm hoping that you've "
"got some answers."
msgstr ""
"我​想​打听一下​“​锅炉房​”​旅馆​。​希望​你​能​回答​我​几个​问题​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 da3 ting1 yi1 xia4“Guo1lu2fang2” lu:3guan3。xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 hui2da2 wo3 ji3ge5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"I've got some... personal business to take care of. Loose ends to tie up. $(l.name) helped me to see that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a soft sound as the razors slide out of her fingertips. She pauses a moment. Examines them. There’s fire in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's a man out there who needs to suffer, and I'm going to see to it that he does.\n"
"\n"
"But I’ll be back… when the job is done."
msgstr ""
"我​有些​……​个人​事务​要​处理​。​某些​恩怨​需要​做个​了结​。​$(l.name)​帮助​我​意识​到​了​这​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​利刃​从​她​指尖​滑出​时​发出​轻微​声响​。​她​停顿​片刻​，​审视​着​它们​。​眼中​燃起​火焰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​个​逍遥法外​的​人​没有​遭到​报应​，​而​我会​亲手​让​他​尝到​痛苦​的​滋味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​等​事情​办完​……​我会​回来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3xie1……ge4ren2 shi4wu4 yao4 chu3li3。mou3xie1 en1yuan4 xu1yao4 zuo4 ge4 liao3jie2。$(l.name) bang1zhu4 wo3 yi4shi2 dao4 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} li4ren4 cong2 ta1 zhi3jian1 hua2chu1 shi2 fa1chu1 qing1wei1 sheng1xiang3。ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，shen3shi4 zhao2 ta1men5。yan3zhong1 ran2qi3 huo3yan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 ge4 xiao1yao2fa3wai4 de5 ren2 mei2you3 zao1dao4 bao4ying4，er2 wo3 hui4 qin1shou3 rang4 ta1 chang2 dao4 tong4ku3 de5 zi1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 deng3 shi4qing5 ban4 wan2……wo3 hui4 hui2lai5 de5。"

msgid ""
"I've got something else for you, Grinder. A little gift from me to you."
msgstr ""
"我​还有​别的​东西​要​给​你​，​“​绞肉机​”​。​一份​小​礼物​。\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 bie2de5 dong1xi1 yao4 gei3 ni3，“jiao3rou4ji1”。yi1 fen4 xiao3 li3wu4。"

msgid ""
"I've got the elevator console here. Let's connect up.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory gestures towards a console built into the wall beside the elevator.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"电梯​控制台​就​在​这里​，​接入​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​指向​电梯​旁​墙壁​内嵌​的​控制台​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"dian4ti1 kong4zhi4tai2 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3，jie1ru4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zhi3xiang4 dian4ti1 pang2 qiang2bi4 nei4 kan3 de5 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "I've got things of my own to see to."
msgstr ""
"我​有​自己​的​事情​要​做​。\n"
"wo3 you3 zi4ji3 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid "I've got to get going. Later."
msgstr ""
"我​得​走​了​。​回头​聊​。\n"
"wo3 de2 zou3 le5。hui2tou2 liao2。"

msgid ""
"I've got what you need.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks you up and down, his eyes lingering on the gear you're carrying.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...One thousand nuyen. No less."
msgstr ""
"我​有​你​需要​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​目光​上下​打量​着​你​，​眼神​停留​在​你​携带​的​装备​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​一千​新円​，​不能​再少​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ni3 xu1yao4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mu4guang1 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，yan3shen2 ting2liu2 zai4 ni3 xie2dai4 de5 zhuang1bei4 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……yi1 qian1 xin1 yuan2，bu4neng2 zai4 shao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"I've gotta admit, $(l.name)... this attack has made me nervous. We're running late, we're low on ammo, and there's no time to call for reinforcements.\n"
"\n"
"Whichever way you slice it, we won't be going into this meet at our best."
msgstr ""
"我​得​承认​，​$(l.name)​……​这场​袭击​让​我​倍感​压力​。​我们​要​迟到​了​，​弹药​所剩​不​多​，​也​没有​时间​叫​增援​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​从​哪个​角度看​，​我们​都​没法​以​最佳​状态​去​碰面​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 cheng2ren4，$(l.name)……zhe4 chang2 xi2ji1 rang4 wo3 bei4gan3 ya1li4。wo3men5 yao4 chi2dao4 le5，dan4yao4 suo3 sheng4 bu4 duo1，ye3 mei2you3 shi2jian1 jiao4 zeng1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 cong2 na3ge5 jiao3 du4 kan4，wo3men5 dou1 mei2fa3 yi3 zui4jia1 zhuang4tai4 qu4 peng4mian4。"

msgid "I've gotta admit, I'm feeling pretty good about it."
msgstr ""
"得​承认​，​我​感觉​还​挺不错​的​。\n"
"de2 cheng2ren4，wo3 gan3jue2 hai2 ting3 bu4 cuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"I've gotta admit, that was pretty neat. All right, consider the subject "
"dropped."
msgstr ""
"我​得​承认​，​这​看着​还​挺酷​。​好​了​，​不聊​这个​了​。\n"
"wo3 de2 cheng2ren4，zhe4 kan4 zhao2 hai2 ting3 ku4。hao3 le5，bu4 liao2 zhe4ge5 le5。"

msgid ""
"I've gotta admit, this has me worried. I'm even more torn up now than I was before.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He meets your gaze, and you can see the concern gnawing at him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know what to do. But I'm open to suggestions."
msgstr ""
"我​得​承认​这​让​我​很​担心​。​我​甚至​比​之前​更​坐立不安​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​迎​上​你​的​目光​，​你​能​看到​忧虑​正啮​咬​着​他​的​内心​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​该​怎么办​。​但​我​想​听听​你​的​意见​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 cheng2ren4 zhe4 rang4 wo3 hen3 dan1xin1。wo3 shen4zhi4 bi3 zhi1qian2 geng1 zuo4li4bu4an1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ying2 shang4 ni3 de5 mu4guang1，ni3 neng2 kan4dao4 you1lu:4 zheng1 nie4 yao3 zhao2 ta1 de5 nei4xin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5ban4。dan4 wo3 xiang3 ting1 ting1 ni3 de5 yi4jian4。"

msgid ""
"I've gotta hand it to the old man: he really did it.\n"
"\n"
"He changed the world."
msgstr ""
"不得不​说​，​那​老头子​真的​做到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​改变​了​世界​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4de2bu4 shuo1，na4 lao3tou2zi5 zhen1de5 zuo4dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gai3bian4 le5 shi4jie4。"

msgid "I've gotta run."
msgstr ""
"我​得​走​了​。\n"
"wo3 de2 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I've gotta run. I have a job to do."
msgstr ""
"我​得​走​了​，​我​还有​事要​做​。\n"
"wo3 de2 zou3 le5，wo3 hai2you3 shi4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I've gotta say, chief... it hurt me to see her all banged up to hell like she was. Looked like Luster had a few of her goons take turns on my baby with a baseball bat.\n"
"\n"
"But it looks like you've got her up and running again. How'd you manage that?"
msgstr ""
"我​得​说​，​头儿​……​看到​她​被​打​得​那么​惨​，​我​心里​真​难受​。​看起来​拉斯特​让​她​的​几个​手下​轮流​用​棒球棒​来​殴打​我​的​宝贝​来​着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​似乎​又​让​她​运转​起来​了​。​你​是​怎么​做到​的​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 shuo1，tou2r5……kan4dao4 ta1 bei4 da3 de2 na4me5 can3，wo3 xin1li5 zhen1 nan2shou4。kan4qi3lai5 la1 si1 te4 rang4 ta1 de5 ji3ge5 shou3xia4 lun2liu2 yong4 bang4 qiu2 bang4 lai2 ou1da3 wo3 de5 bao3bei4 lai2 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 si4hu1 you4 rang4 ta1 yun4zhuan3 qi3lai5 le5。ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zuo4dao4 de5？"

msgid ""
"I've had a lot of time to think about this, $(l.name). And I've decided that"
" this is something I need to do on my own."
msgstr ""
"我花​了​很​长时间​考虑​这件​事​，​$(l.name)​。​最后​我​决定​这​必须​由​我​自己​来​完成​。\n"
"wo3 hua1 le5 hen3 zhang3 shi2 jian1 kao3lu:4 zhe4 jian4 shi4，$(l.name)。zui4hou4 wo3 jue2ding4 zhe4 bi4xu1 you2 wo3 zi4ji3 lai2 wan2cheng2。"

msgid "I've had a run-in with Rammbock before. We can handle them."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​和​撞锤​帮​打过​交道​。​我们​能​解决​。\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 he4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 da3 guo4 jiao1 dao4。wo3men5 neng2 jie3jue2。"

msgid "I've had worse."
msgstr ""
"不算​很​难吃​。\n"
"bu4suan4 hen3 nan2chi1。"

msgid "I've have another question for you."
msgstr ""
"我​还有​一个​问题​要​问​你​。\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 yi1ge5 wen4ti2 yao4 wen4 ni3。"

msgid "I've heard all that I need to. Let's get in there and do some good."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​听够​了​。​让​我们​进去​做点​有​意义​的​事​吧​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 ting1 gou4 le5。rang4 wo3men5 jin4qu4 zuo4 dian3 you3 yi4yi4 de5 shi4 ba1。"

msgid "I've heard enough of this, Vauclair. You're nuts."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​听够​了​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​疯​了​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 ting1 gou4 le5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 feng1 le5。"

msgid "I've heard enough of this. Let's talk business. What've you got?"
msgstr ""
"我​已经​听够​了​，​还是​聊​生意​吧​。​你​这​都​有​什么​？\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 ting1 gou4 le5，hai2shi5 liao2 sheng1yi4 ba1。ni3 zhe4 dou1 you3 shen2me5？"

msgid "I've heard enough. Let's get this show on the road."
msgstr ""
"我​听够​了​。​我们​出发​吧​。\n"
"wo3 ting1 gou4 le5。wo3men5 chu1fa1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I've heard of that show. Supposed to be horrible. I mean, really, *really* bad.\n"
"\n"
"Never watched it myself, but I hear that it made \"Neil the Ork Barbarian\" look like high art."
msgstr ""
"我​听说​过​那部剧​。​太烂​了​，​真的​真的​，​太烂​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​自己​没​看过​，​不过​听说​和​它​比​起来​，​《​兽​人​野蛮​人​尼尔​》​都​像是​高雅​艺术​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 guo4 na4 bu4 ju4。tai4 lan4 le5，zhen1de5 zhen1de5，tai4 lan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 mei2 kan4 guo4，bu4guo4 ting1shuo1 he4 ta1 bi3 qi3lai5，《 shou4 ren2 ye3man2 ren2 ni2 er3 》 dou1 xiang4 shi4 gao1ya3 yi4shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I've heard of the Horned God. His followers have a poor reputation, "
"especially among women."
msgstr ""
"我​听说​过​这个​“​角神​”​。​他​的​信徒​没什么​好​名声​，​特别​是​在​女性​之间​。\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 guo4 zhe4ge5“jiao3 shen2”。ta1 de5 xin4tu2 mei2shen2me5 hao3 ming2sheng1，te4bie2 shi4 zai4 nu:3xing4 zhi1jian1。"

msgid ""
"I've heard stories like this before, from something that sounded a lot like you.\n"
"\n"
"Don't listen to it, $(l.name). Trust me on this.\n"
msgstr ""
"我​以前​听过​类似​的​故事​，​是从​一个​听​起来​和​你​很​像​的​人​那里​听来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​听​它​的​，​$(l.name)​。​相信​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 ting1 guo4 lei4si4 de5 gu4shi4，shi4 cong2 yi1ge5 ting1 qi3lai5 he4 ni3 hen3 xiang4 de5 ren2 na4li5 ting1lai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 ting1 ta1 de5，$(l.name)。xiang1xin4 wo3。"

msgid "I've heard that name before. Who is he?"
msgstr ""
"我​之前​听过​这个​名字​。​他​是​谁​？\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 ting1 guo4 zhe4ge5 ming2zi5。ta1 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"I've just had a very interesting conversation with some of your long-term "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"我​刚刚​与​你​的​一些​长期​客户​进行​了​一次​非常​有趣​的​谈话​。\n"
"wo3 gang1gang5 yu4 ni3 de5 yi1xie1 chang2qi1 ke4hu4 jin4xing2 le5 yi1ci4 fei1chang2 you3qu4 de5 tan2hua4。"

msgid ""
"I've just torn open a channel between myself and the Dragonslayer. That power that you feel is His power, pouring through the aether and into that spot.\n"
"\n"
"If you're familiar with ley lines, it's the same basic concept... I consecrate a patch of ground, and as long as I stand in that spot, all of my magic gets stronger."
msgstr ""
"我​刚刚​在​自己​与​屠龙​者​之间​撕开​了​一条​通道​。​你​感受​到​的​正是​他​的​力量​，​通过​以太​涌入​那个​位置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​地脉​吧​？​它们​的​基本原理​是​一样​的​……​我圣化​了​这处​地面​，​只要​我​站​在​这里​，​我​施展​的​所有​魔法​都​会​得到​增强​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gang1gang5 zai4 zi4ji3 yu4 tu2 long2 zhe3 zhi1jian1 si1 kai1 le5 yi1 tiao2 tong1dao4。ni3 gan3shou4 dao4 de5 zheng4shi4 ta1 de5 li4liang5，tong1guo4 yi3tai4 yong3ru4 na4ge5 wei4zhi5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 di4mai4 ba1？ta1men5 de5 ji1ben3yuan2li3 shi4 yi1yang4 de5……wo3 sheng4 hua4 le5 zhe4 chu3 di4mian4，zhi3yao4 wo3 zhan4 zai4 zhe4li3，wo3 shi1zhan3 de5 suo3you3 mo2fa3 dou1 hui4 de2dao4 zeng1qiang2。"

msgid ""
"I've known Mr. Grinder for twelve years. And I'm telling you, he would *never* work with that son of a bitch.\n"
"\n"
"Besides, if that were true, why would he have sent *me* in here to help you rob the place?"
msgstr ""
"我​认识​“​绞肉机​”​先生​整整​十二年​了​。​我​跟​你​说​，​他​*​不​可能​*​和​那个​王八蛋​有​任何​合作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​，​如果​这是​真的​，​他​为什么​还要​派​*​我​*​来​帮​你​抢劫​这​地方​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4shi5“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 zheng3zheng3 shi2 er4 nian2 le5。wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1，ta1*bu4 ke3neng2*he4 na4ge5 wang2ba1dan4 you3 ren4he2 he2zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4，ru2guo3 zhe4 shi4 zhen1de5，ta1 wei4shen2me5 hai2 yao4 pai4*wo3*lai2 bang1 ni3 qiang3jie2 zhe4 di4fang1？"

msgid "I've lived a hundred lives, and I remember everything."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​活​了​上​百次​的​人生​，​而​我​也​记得​每​一个​细节​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 huo2 le5 shang4 bai3 ci4 de5 ren2sheng1，er2 wo3 ye3 ji4de5 mei3 yi1ge5 xi4jie2。"

msgid ""
"I've lived many lives, but I've been an orphan more times than anything. It "
"was the first story I found when I needed to get away."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​活​了​许多次​的​人生​，​但​我​做​孤儿​的​次数​最​多​。​当​我​最​开始​需要​逃避​的​时候​，​它​是​我​发现​的​第一个​故事​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 huo2 le5 xu3 duo1 ci4 de5 ren2sheng1，dan4 wo3 zuo4 gu1er2 de5 ci4shu4 zui4 duo1。dang1 wo3 zui4 kai1shi3 xu1yao4 tao2bi4 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 shi4 wo3 fa1xian4 de5 di4 yi1 ge4 gu4shi4。"

msgid ""
"I've located a new exit point for you. A security door, conveniently located"
" near the generators. I will mark its location on your PDA."
msgstr ""
"我​为​你​找到​了​另​一个​撤离​点​—​—​发电机组​附近​的​一扇​安全门​。​我会​将​它​标注​在​你​的​PDA​上​。\n"
"wo3 wei2 ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 ling4 yi1ge5 che4li2 dian3——fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 fu4jin4 de5 yi1 shan1 an1 quan2 men2。wo3 hui4 jiang1 ta1 biao1zhu4 zai4 ni3 de5 PDA shang4。"

msgid ""
"I've made a decision. We're sticking to the original plan and delivering the"
" prototype to Herr Schmidt."
msgstr ""
"我​决定​好​了​，​我们​按原​计划​行事​，​把​原型机​交给​施密特​先生​。\n"
"wo3 jue2ding4 hao3 le5，wo3men5 an4 yuan2 ji4hua4 xing2shi4，ba3 yuan2 xing2 ji1 jiao1gei3 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5。"

msgid ""
"I've never been big on responsibility. The Kreuzbasar and the team will get "
"along fine without me."
msgstr ""
"我​向来​不​喜欢​负责​。​队伍​和​克洛伊​茨​集市​没​了​我​也​能​过​好​。\n"
"wo3 xiang4lai2 bu4 xi3huan5 fu4ze2。dui4wu3 he4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 mei2 le5 wo3 ye3 neng2 guo4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"I've never tried to bargain, or negotiate, with the Dragonslayer before. I'm not sure how I feel about it, and I don't know how He'd take it, either... the Dragonslayer doesn't like to be questioned, and His temper's even shorter than mine.\n"
"\n"
"But I'll tell you what, boss... I'll think about it."
msgstr ""
"我​从没​想过​和​屠龙​者​讨价还价​，​或者说​谈判​。​我​说不清​自己​怎么​想​，​也​不​知道​祂​会​如何​反应​……​屠龙​者​讨厌​被​质问​，​而且​祂​的​脾气​比​我​还​急躁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​得​说​，​老大​……​我会​考虑​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2mei2 xiang3 guo4 he4 tu2 long2 zhe3 tao3jia4huan2jia4，huo4 zhe3 shuo1 tan2pan4。wo3 shuo1 bu4 qing1 zi4ji3 zen3me5 xiang3，ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 hui4 ru2he2 fan3ying4……tu2 long2 zhe3 tao3yan4 bei4 zhi4wen4，er2qie3 ta1 de5 pi2qi5 bi3 wo3 hai2 ji2zao4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 de2 shuo1，lao3da4……wo3 hui4 kao3lu:4 de5。"

msgid "I've no quarrel with you, Eiger. I'll do as the group wishes."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​和​你​结梁子​，​艾格尔​。​这事​我​听​大家​的​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 he4 ni3 jie2liang2zi5，Ai4ge2er3。zhe4 shi4 wo3 ting1 da4jia1 de5。"

msgid ""
"I've only done this with Harrow before. He warned me never to try it without him.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shivers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There are strange things in the place we're about to visit."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​只有​在​哈罗​在场​时​使用​过​这个​仪式​。​他​警告​过​我​，​千万​不要​擅自​尝试​使用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​在​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​去​的​地方​有​很多​诡异​的​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 zhi3you3 zai4 ha1luo2 zai4chang3 shi2 shi3yong4 guo4 zhe4ge5 yi2shi4。ta1 jing3gao4 guo4 wo3，qian1wan4 bu4yao4 shan4zi4 chang2shi4 shi3yong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zai4 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 qu4 de5 di4fang1 you3 hen3 duo1 gui3yi4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"I've pulled some strings with an old contact of mine, and he's provided me with the address of a small software developer. OTK International.\n"
"\n"
"They write the firmware updates for Knight Errant's comm systems, and their defenses should be considerably weaker than Aztechnology's."
msgstr ""
"我​联络​了​以前​的​一位​老朋友​，​他​发给​我​一家​小型​软件​开发商​的​地址​—​—​OTK​国际​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​负责​游侠​骑士​通讯​系统​的​固件​更新​，​而​其​防御​系统​应该​比​阿兹特​科技​本部​薄弱​得​多​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 lian2luo4 le5 yi3qian2 de5 yi1 wei4 lao3peng2you5，ta1 fa1gei3 wo3 yi1jia1 xiao3xing2 ruan3jian4 kai1fa1shang1 de5 di4zhi3——OTK guo2ji4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 fu4ze2 you2Xia2qi2shi4 tong1xun4 xi4tong3 de5 gu4jian4 geng1xin1，er2 qi2 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 ying1gai1 bi3 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 ben3bu4 bo2ruo4 de2 duo1。"

msgid "I've reached a decision."
msgstr ""
"我​做好​决定​了​。\n"
"wo3 zuo4 hao3 jue2ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I've read Harrow's manifesto. It looks like he spends a long time talking "
"about charity?"
msgstr ""
"我读​过​哈罗​的​宣言​。​他​似乎​花​了​大量​篇幅​讨论​慈善事业​？\n"
"wo3 dou4 guo4 ha1luo2 de5 xuan1yan2。ta1 si4hu1 hua1 le5 da4liang4 pian1fu5 tao3lun4 ci2 shan4 shi4 ye4？"

msgid "I've read all of the information on your terminals."
msgstr ""
"我读​了​你​终端​上​的​所有​信息​。\n"
"wo3 dou4 le5 ni3 zhong1duan1 shang4 de5 suo3you3 xin4xi1。"

msgid ""
"I've read some of your inter-office communications. There have been a number"
" of deaths here over the years, haven't there?"
msgstr ""
"我读​过​你们​的​一些​内部​通信​。​这些年来​这里​发生​过​不少​死亡​事件​，​对​吧​？\n"
"wo3 dou4 guo4 ni3men5 de5 yi1xie1 nei4bu4 tong1xin4。zhe4 xie1 nian2 lai2 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 guo4 bu4shao3 si3wang2 shi4jian4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "I've read your work. I'd like to sign up."
msgstr ""
"我读​过​你​的​作品​。​我​想​跟着​你​干​。\n"
"wo3 dou4 guo4 ni3 de5 zuo4pin3。wo3 xiang3 gen1zhe5 ni3 gan4。"

msgid ""
"I've reconsidered what I said earlier. I think that we should deal with the "
"Engineer."
msgstr ""
"我​重新考虑​了​先前​说​过​的话​。​我​认为​我们​应该​处理​工程师​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 chong2 xin1 kao3 lu:4 le5 xian1qian2 shuo1 guo4 de5hua4。wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 ying1gai1 chu3li3 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"I've reconsidered, Blitz. If it's really that important to you, I'll go with"
" you on the bank job."
msgstr ""
"我​重新考虑​过​了​，​布里​茨​。​如果​这​对​你​真的​如此​重要​的话​，​我​就​和​你​一起​去​处理​银行​的​差事​。\n"
"wo3 chong2 xin1 kao3 lu:4 guo4 le5，Bu4li3ci2。ru2guo3 zhe4 dui4 ni3 zhen1de5 ru2ci3 zhong4yao4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 he4 ni3 yi1qi3 qu4 chu3li3 yin2hang2 de5 cha4shi4。"

msgid "I've recovered the parts for your terminal."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​找回​了​你​的​终端​所​需​的​部件​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 zhao3hui2 le5 ni3 de5 zhong1duan1 suo3 xu1 de5 bu4jian4。"

msgid "I've replaced Monika, darling. So spill it."
msgstr ""
"亲爱​的​，​现在​我​取代​了​莫妮卡​。​所以​赶紧​说​吧​。\n"
"qin1ai4 de5，xian4zai4 wo3 qu3dai4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3。suo3yi3 gan3jin3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"I've seen Monika hit Black IC before. This... this was something worse."
msgstr ""
"我见​过​莫妮卡​对付​黑​IC​。​但​这个​……​绝对​是​更​糟糕​的​东西​。\n"
"wo3 jian4 guo4 Mo4ni1ka3 dui4fu5 hei1 IC。dan4 zhe4ge5……jue2dui4 shi4 geng1 zao1gao1 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "I've seen enough ugly for one lifetime. Mind if I borrow that pistol?"
msgstr ""
"我​这辈子​已经​看够​了​。​能​把​手枪​借​我​用​下​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 yi3jing1 kan4 gou4 le5。neng2 ba3 shou3qiang1 jie4 wo3 yong4 xia4 ma5？"

msgid "I've seen it - it's locked up tight."
msgstr ""
"我​见到​过​—​—​那里​紧紧​锁​着​呢​。\n"
"wo3 jian4dao4 guo4——na4li5 jin3jin3 suo3 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "I've seen rabid dogs before. That was something else."
msgstr ""
"我见​过​得​狂犬病​的​狗​。​跟​刚才​的​情况​完全​是​两码事​。\n"
"wo3 jian4 guo4 de2 kuang2quan3bing4 de5 gou3。gen1 gang1cai2 de5 qing2kuang4 wan2quan2 shi4 liang3ma3shi4。"

msgid ""
"I've seen what the Engineer can do up close, $(l.name). My KSK unit tracked him a few years ago.\n"
"\n"
"I had him in the sights of my rifle, but I was ordered to hold fire - we couldn't afford to give away our position."
msgstr ""
"我​亲眼​见过​工程师​的​能耐​，​$(l.name)​。​几年​前​，​我​所属​的​KSK​小队​曾经​发现​过​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当时​我​的​枪口​已经​瞄准​了​他​，​但​上级​下令​不得​开火​—​—​我们​不能​暴露​位置​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qin1yan3 jian4 guo4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 neng2nai4，$(l.name)。ji3nian2 qian2，wo3 suo3shu3 de5 KSK xiao3 dui4 ceng2jing1 fa1xian4 guo4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"dang1shi2 wo3 de5 qiang1kou3 yi3jing1 miao2zhun3 le5 ta1，dan4 shang4ji2 xia4ling4 bu4de2 kai1huo3——wo3men5 bu4neng2 bao4lu4 wei4zhi5。"

msgid "I've seen worse."
msgstr ""
"我见​过​更惨​的​。\n"
"wo3 jian4 guo4 geng1 can3 de5。"

msgid ""
"I've seen you flitting about in the Matrix, from time to time. You never knew that I was watching, but I was.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gives him an easy smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In any case, it's a pleasure to meet you in the flesh."
msgstr ""
"我​时不时​就​能​在​矩阵​中​看到​你​四处​晃悠​。​你​从不​知道​我​在​注视​着​你​，​但​我​始终​都​在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​露出​一个​轻松​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​很​高兴​能​亲自​见到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi2bu4shi2 jiu4 neng2 zai4 ju3zhen4 zhong4 kan4dao4 ni3 si4chu4 huang4you5。ni3 cong2bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 zai4 zhu4shi4 zhao2 ni3，dan4 wo3 shi3zhong1 dou1 zai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 qing1song1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 qin1zi4 jian4dao4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I've spoken with Ezkibel. He's offered to resume your feedings, but only on "
"two conditions."
msgstr ""
"我​和​埃兹​基​贝尔​谈过​了​。​他​答应​恢复​你们​的​喂食​供应​，​但​有​两个​条件​。\n"
"wo3 he4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 tan2 guo4 le5。ta1 da1ying5 hui1fu4 ni3men5 de5 wei4shi2 gong1ying4，dan4 you3 liang3 ge4 tiao2jian4。"

msgid ""
"I've spoken with Ezkibel. You can expect your regularly scheduled feedings "
"to start up again any day now."
msgstr ""
"我​和​埃兹​基​贝尔​谈过​了​。​你们​的​固定​喂食​会​尽快恢复​。\n"
"wo3 he4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 tan2 guo4 le5。ni3men5 de5 gu4ding4 wei4shi2 hui4 jin3 kuai4 hui1 fu4。"

msgid ""
"I've stopped with the sims. Trying to get clean.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shows you the empty socket, in case you hadn't noticed.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​不再​用拟​感​了​。​我​想​彻底​戒掉​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​特意​向​你​展示​了​一下​空荡荡​的​插口​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4zai4 yong4 ni3 gan3 le5。wo3 xiang3 che4di3 jie4 diao4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 te4yi4 xiang4 ni3 zhan3shi4 le5 yi1xia4 kong1dang4dang4 de5 cha1kou3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I've suffered far worse, as you might imagine. And I don't need you or "
"anyone else babying me."
msgstr ""
"我​经历​过​更​糟糕​的​事情​，​想必​你​也​能​想象​得到​。​我​并不需要​你​或​任何人​来​照顾​我​。\n"
"wo3 jing1li4 guo4 geng1 zao1gao1 de5 shi4qing5，xiang3bi4 ni3 ye3 neng2 xiang3xiang4 de2dao4。wo3 bing4 bu4 xu1 yao4 ni3 huo4 ren4 he2 ren2 lai2 zhao4gu5 wo3。"

msgid ""
"I've survived far worse than you. You messed with the wrong kiez, chummer. "
"{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​什么​大风大浪​没见​过​。​你​惹​错​人​了​，​伙计​。​{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"wo3 shen2me5 dai4 feng1 dai4 lang4 mei2 jian4 guo4。ni3 re3 cuo4 ren2 le5，huo3ji5。{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I've uncovered what Humanis is up to. You'll find the details on this data "
"pad."
msgstr ""
"我​查明​了​人类​至上​主义者​想​做​什么​。​看看​这个​数据​板​你​就​知道​了​。\n"
"wo3 cha2ming2 le5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 xiang3 zuo4 shen2me5。kan4kan5 zhe4ge5 shu4ju4 ban3 ni3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I've watched hours of your brother's video footage, Vauclair. I probably "
"know him better than anyone alive, excepting yourself."
msgstr ""
"我花​了​数个​小时​观看​你​弟弟​留下​的​录影带​，​沃​克莱尔​。​我​大概​是​这个​世界​上​除了​你​之外​最​了解​他​的​人​了​。\n"
"wo3 hua1 le5 shu3 ge4 xiao3shi2 guan1kan4 ni3 di4di5 liu2xia4 de5 lu4ying3dai4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。wo3 da4gai4 shi4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 shang4 chu2le5 ni3 zhi1wai4 zui4 liao3jie3 ta1 de5 ren2 le5。"

msgid ""
"I, for one, want answers. Amsel said that there was a lot of money flowing into the Harfeld estate. And he found evidence that a bioweapon was being stockpiled there.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever Vauclair is doing, he had APEX kill his own brother to hide it. I intend to find out what that is."
msgstr ""
"我​自己​想要​一个​答案​。​阿姆​泽尔说​有​大量​资金​流入​哈​菲尔德​庄园​，​他​还​发现​了​那里​正在​囤积​生物武器​的​证据​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​沃​克莱尔​在​搞​什么​，​他​竟然​要​让​APEX​杀害​他​自己​的​亲​弟弟​来​掩盖真相​。​我​一定​要​查个​水落石出​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 xiang3yao4 yi1ge5 da2an4。E1mu3ze2er3 shuo1 you3 da4liang4 zi1jin1 liu2ru4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2，ta1 hai2 fa1xian4 le5 na4li5 zheng4zai4 tun2ji1 sheng1wu4wu3qi4 de5 zheng4ju4。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 zai4 gao3 shen2me5，ta1 jing4ran2 yao4 rang4 APEX sha1hai4 ta1 zi4ji3 de5 qin1 di4di5 lai2 yan3 gai4 zhen1 xiang1。wo3 yi1ding4 yao4 cha2 ge4 shui3luo4shi2chu1。"

msgid ""
"I, too, was a skeptic. Then the Wolf caught me, and the Raven opened my "
"eyes. And now, at last, I CAN *SEE!*"
msgstr ""
"我​本来​也持​怀疑​态度​。​但​后来​狼​抓​到​了​我​，​乌鸦​开辟​了​我​的​视界​。​现在​我​终于​能​*​看到​*​了​！\n"
"wo3 ben3lai2 ye3 chi2 huai2yi2 tai4du5。dan4 hou4lai2 lang2 zhua1 dao4 le5 wo3，wu1ya1 kai1pi4 le5 wo3 de5 shi4jie4。xian4zai4 wo3 zhong1yu2 neng2*kan4dao4*le5！"

msgid ""
"I, uh, forgot about it.\n"
"\n"
"Honestly, chief, I'm just glad to see her up and running again. How'd you pull that off, by the way?"
msgstr ""
"呃​，​我​之前​给​忘​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​头儿​，​我​看到​她​又​能​运转​就​已经​很​高兴​了​。​话​说​你​是​怎么​做到​的​？\n"
"\n"
"e4，wo3 zhi1qian2 gei3 wang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，tou2r5，wo3 kan4dao4 ta1 you4 neng2 yun4zhuan3 jiu4 yi3jing1 hen3 gao1xing4 le5。hua4 shuo1 ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zuo4dao4 de5？"

msgid ""
"I, uh... I can't believe I'm sayin' this, but I kind of agree with the death machine.\n"
"\n"
"If you help that old nutcase, everyone we know back in Berlin will die. Our *house* will burn down. So, uh... if you really wanna do this, I'm gonna have to stop you."
msgstr ""
"我​……​我​不敢相信​我会​这么​说​，​但​我​确实​同意​那台​杀人​机器​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​帮助​那个​老​疯子​，​我们​在​柏林​认识​的​每个​人​都​会​死​。​我们​的​*​房子​*​也​会​被​烧毁​。​所以​，​嗯​……​如果​你​真的​想​这么​做​，​我​必须​阻止​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 wo3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 wo3 que4shi2 tong2yi4 na4 tai2 sha1ren2 ji1qi4 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bang1zhu4 na4ge5 lao3 feng1zi5，wo3men5 zai4 bo2lin2 ren4shi5 de5 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 hui4 si3。wo3men5 de5*fang2zi5*ye3 hui4 bei4 shao1hui3。suo3yi3，en1……ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4，wo3 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"I, uh... I decided to look into Emilie's disappearance again.\n"
"\n"
"Before you blow a gasket, you should know that I've turned up a clue."
msgstr ""
