"ru2guo3 APEX mei2 si3 de5hua4，kan4lai5 wo3 sheng4xia4 de5 shi2jian1 bi3 wo3 yu4xiang3 zhong4 hai2 yao4 shao3。\n"
"\n"
"wu2suo3wei4 le5。ta1 bing4 mei2you3 ban4fa3 zu3zhi3 wo3 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5。xian4zai4 hui2da2 wo3 de5 wen4ti2，er2qie3 yao4 kuai4。ni3 wei4shen2me5 zai4 zhe4li3？"

msgid ""
"If Alice was scared of this thing, maybe we should give it a wide berth."
msgstr ""
"如果​爱丽丝​都​害怕​这​东西​，​那​我们​最好​还是​离​它​远点​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ai4li4si1 dou1 hai4pa4 zhe4 dong1xi1，na4 wo3men5 zui4hao3 hai2shi5 li2 ta1 yuan3 dian3。"

msgid ""
"If Feuerschwinge's kept Vauclair trapped there for almost twenty years, she's gotta have a reason for it. It takes effort and resources to lock a man away for that amount of time.\n"
"\n"
"So what's her endgame in all of this? Why not just kill him and be done with it?"
msgstr ""
"如果​火翼​把​沃​克莱尔​关​在​那里​将近​二十年​，​那​她​总得​有个​理由​吧​。​关押​一个​人​这么久​时间​，​需要​耗费​大量​精力​和​资源​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​做​这​一切​的​最终​目的​是​什么​？​为什么​不​干脆​杀​了​他​，​一了百了​？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 Huo3yi4 ba3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 guan1 zai4 na4li5 jiang1jin4 er4 shi2 nian2，na4 ta1 zong3dei3 you3 ge4 li3you2 ba1。guan1ya1 yi1ge5 ren2 zhe4 ma2 jiu3 shi2jian1，xu1yao4 hao4fei4 da4liang4 jing1li4 he4 zi1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zuo4 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 zui4zhong1 mu4di4 shi4 shen2me5？wei4shen2me5 bu4 gan1cui4 sha1 le5 ta1，yi1liao3bai3liao3？"

msgid ""
"If Hermie were here with us *right now,* listening to this conversation, "
"he'd tell you to stop this. Deny it if you want, but you know that it's "
"true."
msgstr ""
"如果​赫米​*​现在​*​也​和​我们​在​一起​，​听过​这段​对话​，​他​肯定​会要​你​停止​这​一切​发生​。​你​尽管​可以​否认​，​但​你​自己​心里​清楚​。\n"
"ru2guo3 he4 mi3*xian4zai4*ye3 he4 wo3men5 zai4 yi1qi3，ting1 guo4 zhe4 duan4 dui4hua4，ta1 ken3ding4 hui4yao4 ni3 ting2zhi3 zhe4 yi1qie4 fa1sheng1。ni3 jin3guan3 ke3yi3 fou3ren4，dan4 ni3 zi4ji3 xin1li5 qing1chu5。"

msgid "If I didn't know any better, I'd think you were warming up to me."
msgstr ""
"要不是​我​了解​你​，​我​还​真​以为​你​对​我​开始​敞开​心扉​了​呢​。\n"
"yao4bu5shi4 wo3 liao3jie3 ni3，wo3 hai2 zhen1 yi3wei2 ni3 dui4 wo3 kai1shi3 chang3kai1 xin1fei1 le5 ni2。"

msgid "If I free you, what happens after all of this is over?"
msgstr ""
"如果​我​释放​了​你​，​在​这​一切​结束​之后​会​发生​什么​？\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 shi4fang4 le5 ni3，zai4 zhe4 yi1qie4 jie2shu4 zhi1hou4 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"If I had one of my sims, I could have just gone inside. But I didn't, so I "
"had to stay out here."
msgstr ""
"要是​当时​我​有​拟感​的话​，​我​就​可以​躲​在​那​里面​了​。​但​我​并​没有​，​所以​我​不得不​待​在​现实​中​。\n"
"yao4shi5 dang1shi2 wo3 you3 ni3 gan3 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 ke3yi3 duo3 zai4 na4 li3mian4 le5。dan4 wo3 bing4 mei2you3，suo3yi3 wo3 bu4de2bu4 dai1 zai4 xian4shi2 zhong4。"

msgid "If I hadn't killed him, our elvish friend would have."
msgstr ""
"就算​我​没有​杀​了​他​，​我们​的​精灵​朋友​也​会​动手​。\n"
"jiu4suan4 wo3 mei2you3 sha1 le5 ta1，wo3men5 de5 jing1ling2 peng2you5 ye3 hui4 dong4shou3。"

msgid ""
"If I hadn’t broken that twit’s ribs, the name “Eiger” would’ve meant “a difficult sexual conquest” to a whole barracks full of recruits.\n"
"\n"
"That’s what I would’ve been to them, from that point on. My own accomplishments be damned."
msgstr ""
"如果​我​当时​没​打断​那​蠢货​的​肋骨​，​恐怕​整个​新兵营​的​人​都​只会​把​“​艾格尔​”​这个​名字​和​“​亟待​征服​的​炮友​”​划等号​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真​要是​那样的话​，​它​就​成​了​我​一辈子​甩不掉​的​标签​。​至于​我​做出​了​什么​成绩​，​都​会​变得​毫无意义​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 dang1shi2 mei2 da3duan4 na4 chun3huo4 de5 lei4gu3，kong3pa4 zheng3ge4 xin1 bing1 ying2 de5 ren2 dou1 zhi3 hui4 ba3“Ai4ge2er3” zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 he4“ji2dai4 zheng1fu2 de5 pao4you3” hua4deng3hao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 yao4shi5 na4 yang4 de5 hua4，ta1 jiu4 cheng2 le5 wo3 yi1bei4zi5 shuai3 bu4 diao4 de5 biao1qian1。zhi4yu2 wo3 zuo4chu1 le5 shen2me5 cheng2ji4，dou1 hui4 bian4de5 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4。"

msgid ""
"If I hadn’t broken that twit’s ribs, the name “Eiger” would’ve meant “a difficult sexual conquest” to a whole barracks full of recruits. That’s what I would’ve been to them, from that point on.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to what I did, my new name meant “the troll who doesn’t take shit from anyone” instead."
msgstr ""
"如果​我​当时​没​打断​那​蠢货​的​肋骨​，​恐怕​整个​新兵营​的​人​都​只会​把​“​艾格尔​”​这个​名字​和​“​亟待​征服​的​炮友​”​划等号​了​。​真​要是​那样的话​，​它​就​成​了​我​一辈子​甩不掉​的​标签​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​在​我​暴打​他​之后​，​这个​绰号​的​含义​就​变成​了​“​不向​任何人​服软​的​巨魔​”​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 dang1shi2 mei2 da3duan4 na4 chun3huo4 de5 lei4gu3，kong3pa4 zheng3ge4 xin1 bing1 ying2 de5 ren2 dou1 zhi3 hui4 ba3“Ai4ge2er3” zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 he4“ji2dai4 zheng1fu2 de5 pao4you3” hua4deng3hao4 le5。zhen1 yao4shi5 na4 yang4 de5 hua4，ta1 jiu4 cheng2 le5 wo3 yi1bei4zi5 shuai3 bu4 diao4 de5 biao1qian1。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zai4 wo3 bao4da3 ta1 zhi1hou4，zhe4ge5 chuo4hao4 de5 han2yi4 jiu4 bian4cheng2 le5“bu4 xiang4 ren4 he2 ren2 fu2ruan3 de5 ju4mo2”。"

msgid ""
"If I leave things where they stand, there'll always be some hope that he was"
" lying. But if I dig into this and find that he was telling the truth... if "
"I find out that none of what we did *meant* anything..."
msgstr ""
"如果​我​就此​揭过​，​就​总​还​能​抱​有​一丝​“​他​在​说谎​”​的​希望​。​但​如果​我​真要​查​下去​，​发现​他​说​的​都​是​真的​……​如果​我​发现​我们​做​的​一切​都​毫无意义​……\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 jiu4ci3 jie1 guo4，jiu4 zong3 hai2 neng2 bao4 you3 yi1 si1“ta1 zai4 shuo1huang3” de5 xi1wang4。dan4 ru2guo3 wo3 zhen1 yao4 cha2 xia4qu4，fa1xian4 ta1 shuo1 de5 dou1 shi4 zhen1de5……ru2guo3 wo3 fa1xian4 wo3men5 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4……"

msgid "If I were a spirit, would I be using the intercom?"
msgstr ""
"如果​我​是​精魂​，​我会​用​对讲机​吗​？\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 shi4 jing1hun2，wo3 hui4 yong4 dui4jiang3ji1 ma5？"

msgid "If I were you, I'd leave. Berlin is not a place for retirees."
msgstr ""
"换作​是​我​的话​，​就​会​离开​。​柏林​可不是​退休​人士​该待​的​地方​。\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 hui4 li2kai1。bo2lin2 ke3bu5shi4 tui4xiu1 ren2shi4 gai1 dai1 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"If I'm here tomorrow, I'll keep doing what I can to help. And if I'm gone, "
"well, you'll know why."
msgstr ""
"如果​我​明天​还​在​这里​，​我会​继续​尽我所能​提供​帮助​。​如果​我​不​在​了​，​嗯​，​你​懂​的​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 ming2tian1 hai2 zai4 zhe4li3，wo3 hui4 ji4xu4 jin3 wo3 suo3 neng2 ti2gong1 bang1zhu4。ru2guo3 wo3 bu4 zai4 le5，en1，ni3 dong3 de5。"

msgid ""
"If I'm not drinkin', I'm fightin'. And if I'm not doin' either of those things, I'm lookin' for a *bigger, better* fight to get in next time.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich produces a flask from his jacket pocket and raises it in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a remarkably simple code to live by."
msgstr ""
"一般来说​，​我​要么​在​喝酒​，​要么​就​在​打架​。​如果​两者​皆​非​，​那​我​就是​在​物色​哪里​能​打​*​更​凶​更​猛​*​的​架​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希从​夹克​口袋​里​掏出​一个​小​酒壶​，​扬手​向​你​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​条​极其​简单​的​处世​准则​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ban1lai2shuo1，wo3 yao4me5 zai4 he1jiu3，yao4me5 jiu4 zai4 da3jia4。ru2guo3 liang3zhe3 jie1 fei1，na4 wo3 jiu4shi4 zai4 wu4se4 na3li3 neng2 da3*geng1 xiong1 geng1 meng3*de5 jia4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 cong2 jia1ke4 kou3dai4 li3 tao1chu1 yi1ge5 xiao3 jiu3hu2，yang2 shou3 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 tiao2 ji2qi2 jian3dan1 de5 chu3shi4 zhun3ze2。"

msgid "If Monika kept him out, it was for good reason."
msgstr ""
"如果说​莫妮卡​将​他​拒之门外​，​那​肯定​是​有​充分​理由​的​。\n"
"ru2guo3shuo1 Mo4ni1ka3 jiang1 ta1 ju4zhi1men2wai4，na4 ken3ding4 shi4 you3 chong1fen4 li3you2 de5。"

msgid ""
"If Vauclair’s at Harfeld, we’ve got problems.\n"
"\n"
"The last time we broke into that place, they took Monika out. It was a miracle that any of you got out alive."
msgstr ""
"如果​沃​克莱尔​在​哈​菲尔德​，​那​我们​就​有​麻烦​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​上次​闯进去​的​时候​，​他们​夺去​了​莫妮卡​的​性命​。​你们​能​活着​出来​已经​是​奇迹​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 zai4 Ha1fei1er3de2，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 you3 ma2fan5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shang4ci4 chuang3 jin4 qu4 de5 shi2hou5，ta1men5 duo2 qu4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 xing4ming4。ni3men5 neng2 huo2zhe5 chu1lai2 yi3jing1 shi4 qi2ji4 le5。"

msgid ""
"If an initiate ever questioned our behavior, we could claim that he just didn't understand the meaning of the book. The other kids would look at him as the ignorant one.\n"
"\n"
"It's all bullshit, like I said. Clever bullshit, but bullshit all the same."
msgstr ""
"如果​有​学徒​质疑​我们​的​行为​，​我们​便​可​声称​他​根本​不​懂​书​中​的​真谛​。​其他​孩子​只会​把​他​当作​无知​之​辈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​我​说​的​，​这些​都​是​扯淡​。​虽然​耍​了​不少​小聪明​，​但​本质​还是​扯淡​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 you3 xue2tu2 zhi4yi2 wo3men5 de5 xing2wei2，wo3men5 bian4 ke3 sheng1cheng1 ta1 gen1ben3 bu4 dong3 shu1 zhong4 de5 zhen1di4。qi2ta1 hai2zi5 zhi3 hui4 ba3 ta1 dang4zuo4 wu2zhi1 zhi1 bei4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 wo3 shuo1 de5，zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 che3dan4。sui1ran2 shua3 le5 bu4shao3 xiao3cong1ming5，dan4 ben3zhi4 hai2shi5 che3dan4。"

msgid "If anyone has any reservations about this, now’s the time to say it."
msgstr ""
"如果​谁​还有​什么​保留意见​的话​，​就​趁现在​赶紧​说​吧​。\n"
"ru2guo3 shei2 hai2you3 shen2me5 bao3 liu2 yi4 jian4 de5hua4，jiu4 chen4 xian4 zai4 gan3jin3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"If anything happened to me on your table, the rest of my team would come "
"looking for you."
msgstr ""
"如果​我​在​你​的​手术台上​出​了​事​，​我​的​队友​们​会​来​找​你​的​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 zai4 ni3 de5 shou3 shu4 tai2 shang4 chu1 le5 shi4，wo3 de5 dui4you3 men5 hui4 lai2 zhao3 ni3 de5。"

msgid "If by \"changed,\" you mean \"doomed,\" then sure."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​是​想​说​“​毁灭​”​的话​，​那​确实​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shi4 xiang3 shuo1“hui3mie4” de5hua4，na4 que4shi2。"

msgid ""
"If by \"decent\" you mean \"competent,\" then yes. Around the corner you "
"will find a clinic called \"Triage.\" The owner, Dr. Ezkibel, is a "
"cybersurgeon of some renown. He can see to your needs."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​说​的​“​不错​”​是​指​“​还​行​”​的话​，​街角​倒​是​有​一家​叫​“​分诊​”​的​诊所​。​坐诊​的​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​是​一位​颇​有名气​的​义体​医生​，​他​能​满足​你​的​需要​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shuo1 de5“bu4cuo4” shi4 zhi3“hai2 xing2” de5hua4，jie1 jiao3 dao3 shi4 you3 yi1jia1 jiao4“fen4 zhen3” de5 zhen3suo3。zuo4 zhen3 de5 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 shi4 yi1 wei4 po1 you3 ming2 qi4 de5 yi4 ti3 yi1sheng1，ta1 neng2 man3zu2 ni3 de5 xu1yao4。"

msgid ""
"If by \"right\" you mean \"the worst thing you possibly could have done,\" "
"then yes."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​说​“​正确​”​的​意思​是​“​你​做​过​的​最​糟糕​的​事情​”​，​那​的确如此​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shuo1“zheng4que4” de5 yi4si5 shi4“ni3 zuo4 guo4 de5 zui4 zao1gao1 de5 shi4qing5”，na4 de5 que4 ru2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"If he should wander into your crosshairs between now and our attack on Feuerschwinge, then by all means, take him out. But I don't think that you're likely to get the opportunity.\n"
"\n"
"It's far more likely that he'll continue throwing his men at you until one of them scores a lucky shot."
msgstr ""
"如果​他​在​我们​进攻​火翼​之前​恰好​暴露​在​你​的​准星​之中​，​那​你​就​尽管​动手​干掉​他​吧​。​但​我​认为​你​不太可能​有​这样​的​机会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​只会​继续​派​手下​袭击​你​，​直到​其中​一人​侥幸​得手​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 zai4 wo3men5 jin4gong1 Huo3yi4 zhi1qian2 qia4hao3 bao4lu4 zai4 ni3 de5 zhun3xing1 zhi1zhong1，na4 ni3 jiu4 jin3guan3 dong4shou3 gan4diao4 ta1 ba1。dan4 wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 bu4 tai4 ke3 neng2 you3 zhe4yang4 de5 ji1hui4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhi3 hui4 ji4xu4 pai4 shou3xia4 xi2ji1 ni3，zhi2dao4 qi2zhong1 yi1 ren2 jiao3xing4 de2shou3。"

msgid "If it has an impact on your job performance, you bet I do."
msgstr ""
"如果​这会​影响​到​你​在​差事​中​的​表现​，​那​我​当然​要​关心​。\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 hui4 ying3xiang3 dao4 ni3 zai4 cha4shi4 zhong4 de5 biao3xian4，na4 wo3 dang1ran2 yao4 guan1xin1。"

msgid ""
"If it keeps you here in Berlin, we'd be happy to have you stand with us. The"
" Flux is always changing, and we'll need someone here to help us change with"
" it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​选择​留在​柏林​，​我们​很​乐意​与​你​并肩而立​。​动荡​带​变幻无常​，​我们​需要​有人​在​这里​与​我们​共同​适应​变化​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xuan3ze2 liu2 zai4 bo2lin2，wo3men5 hen3 le4yi4 yu4 ni3 bing4 jian1 er2 li4。dong4dang4 dai4 bian4 huan4 wu2 chang2，wo3men5 xu1yao4 you3ren2 zai4 zhe4li3 yu4 wo3men5 gong4tong2 shi4ying4 bian4hua4。"

msgid ""
"If it means picking up where Monika left off and keeping the Kreuzbasar "
"safe, I’m in too."
msgstr ""
"如果​这​意味着​继承​莫妮卡​的​遗志​，​守护​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​安宁​，​那​我​愿意​加入​。\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ji4cheng2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yi2zhi4，shou3hu4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 an1ning2，na4 wo3 yuan4yi4 jia1ru4。"

msgid ""
"If it weren't, you wouldn't have brought it up. We haven't always seen eye "
"to eye, Eiger, but I have learned to trust your judgment in the field."
msgstr ""
"若非​如此​，​你​肯定​不会​提出​来​。​我们​并非​总是​意见​一致​，​但​我​已经​明白​，​要​在​战场​上​信任​你​的​判断​。\n"
"ruo4fei1 ru2ci3，ni3 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 ti2chu1 lai2。wo3men5 bing4fei1 zong3shi4 yi4jian4 yi1zhi4，dan4 wo3 yi3jing1 ming2bai5，yao4 zai4 zhan4chang3 shang4 xin4ren4 ni3 de5 pan4duan4。"

msgid "If it's bad for the Azzies, it's good for me. I'll help you out."
msgstr ""
"任何​对​阿兹佬​不利​的​事情​，​对​我​来说​就是​好事​。​我会​帮​你们​的​。\n"
"ren4he2 dui4 e1 zi1 lao3 bu4li4 de5 shi4qing5，dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 jiu4shi4 hao3shi4。wo3 hui4 bang1 ni3men5 de5。"

msgid "If it's that important to you, I'll work with your team."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​如此​坚持​的话​，​我​就​和​你​安排​的​人​行动​吧​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 ru2ci3 jian1chi2 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 he4 ni3 an1pai2 de5 ren2 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid "If only I could have prevented it."
msgstr ""
"可惜​我​没能​提前​阻止​事情​发生​。\n"
"ke3xi1 wo3 mei2 neng2 ti2qian2 zu3zhi3 shi4qing5 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"If only we knew what was best. There is much uncertainty beyond the "
"Kreuzbasar, and even more beyond the walls of Berlin."
msgstr ""
"前提​是​我们​能​知道​该​怎么办​。​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​外面​充满​了​未知​，​更​不用说​柏林墙​之外​了​。\n"
"qian2ti2 shi4 wo3men5 neng2 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5ban4。Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 wai4mian4 chong1man3 le5 wei4zhi1，geng1 bu4yong4shuo1 bo2lin2qiang2 zhi1wai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"If our client is to be believed, you will have the necessary access to open the door. The rest of your team, however, will not.\n"
"\n"
"When you reach that door, I'd recommend grouping up. Only you can open it, and there's no saying what you'll find on the other side."
msgstr ""
"若​客户​所​言​属实​，​你​将​拥有​开启​那​扇门​所​需​的​权限​，​但​你​的​队员​们​则​不然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​抵达​那​扇门​时​，​我​建议​你们​保持​团队​行动​。​毕竟​只有​你​能​开门​，​而​没人​知道​门​后藏​着​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 ke4hu4 suo3 yan2 shu3shi2，ni3 jiang1 yong1you3 kai1qi3 na4 shan1 men2 suo3 xu1 de5 quan2xian4，dan4 ni3 de5 dui4yuan2 men5 ze2 bu4ran2。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 di3da2 na4 shan1 men2 shi2，wo3 jian4yi4 ni3men5 bao3chi2 tuan2dui4 xing2dong4。bi4jing4 zhi3you3 ni3 neng2 kai1men2，er2 mei2 ren2 zhi1dao4 men2 hou4 zang4 zhao2 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"If she hacked your deck, you can't let her get away with it. Your reputation"
" is at stake."
msgstr ""
"如果​她​骇入​了​你​的​碟​板​，​那​你​就​不能​让​她​逃之夭夭​。​你​的​声誉​随时​岌岌可危​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 hai4 ru4 le5 ni3 de5 die2 ban3，na4 ni3 jiu4 bu4neng2 rang4 ta1 tao2zhi1yao1yao1。ni3 de5 sheng1yu4 sui2shi2 ji2ji2ke3wei1。"

msgid "If she means that much to you, you owe it to yourself to try."
msgstr ""
"如果​她​对​你​这么​重要​的话​，​你​就​不​应该​放弃​尝试​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 dui4 ni3 zhe4me5 zhong4yao4 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 bu4 ying1gai1 fang4qi4 chang2shi4。"

msgid ""
"If some bookie sends his thugs here looking for you, it's going to *become* "
"my business. So talk. Now."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​的​债主​派手​下来​找​你​的话​，​那​这事​*​就要​*​和​我​有​关系​了​。​所以​你​赶紧​说​吧​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 de5 zhai4zhu3 pai4 shou3 xia4lai5 zhao3 ni3 de5hua4，na4 zhe4 shi4*jiu4yao4*he4 wo3 you3 guan1xi5 le5。suo3yi3 ni3 gan3jin3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"If that wasn't a part of your plan, then it was an oversight of epic "
"proportions. You can see how that isn't much better, right?"
msgstr ""
"如果​这​不是​你​计划​的​一部分​，​那​可​就是​个​天大​的​疏忽​了​。​你​明白​这​也​没​好​到​哪里​去​吧​？\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 bu4shi4 ni3 ji4hua4 de5 yi1bu4fen5，na4 ke3 jiu4shi4 ge4 tian1da4 de5 shu1hu5 le5。ni3 ming2bai5 zhe4 ye3 mei2 hao3 dao4 na3li3 qu4 ba1？"

msgid "If that's the way you feel, I won't stand in your way."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​这么​认真​，​我​也​不​拦​你​了​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 zhe4me5 ren4zhen1，wo3 ye3 bu4 lan2 ni3 le5。"

msgid "If that's the way you feel. It's been an honor, Doctor."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​这么​想​，​我​只能​说​与​你​共事​很​荣幸​了​，​博士​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 zhe4me5 xiang3，wo3 zhi3neng2 shuo1 yu4 ni3 gong4shi4 hen3 rong2xing4 le5，bo2shi4。"

msgid "If that's the way you want it. Good-bye, Glory."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​这么​说​了​，​那​就​再见​吧​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1 le5，na4 jiu4 zai4jian4 ba1，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "If that's true, why are you still talking to me? "
msgstr ""
"如果​是​这样的话​，​你​为什么​还​和​我​说​？\n"
"ru2guo3 shi4 zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4，ni3 wei4shen2me5 hai2 he4 wo3 shuo1？"

msgid ""
"If that's what you want... but I'm telling you, you're making a mistake."
msgstr ""
"随你便​吧​……​但​我​跟​你​说​，​你​这​是​犯​了​个​错误​。\n"
"sui2 ni3 bian4 ba1……dan4 wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1，ni3 zhe4 shi4 fan4 le5 ge4 cuo4wu4。"

msgid "If that’s the case, I’ll pass."
msgstr ""
"这样的话​，​我​还是​算了​。\n"
"zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4，wo3 hai2shi5 suan4le5。"

msgid "If the Black Lodge is that dangerous, I'll keep us on their good side."
msgstr ""
"既然​黑​结社​这么​危险​，​我​还是​和​他们​打​好​关系​吧​。\n"
"ji4ran2 hei1 jie2she4 zhe4me5 wei1xian3，wo3 hai2shi5 he4 ta1men5 da3 hao3 guan1xi5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"If the Dragonfall was as important an event as you make it out to be, I'm "
"surprised that I've never heard of it."
msgstr ""
"如果​“​龙​陨​”​事件​真有​你​说​得​这么​重大​，​我​怎么​会​从​没听说过​？\n"
"ru2guo3“long2 yun3” shi4jian4 zhen1 you3 ni3 shuo1 de2 zhe4me5 zhong4da4，wo3 zen3me5 hui4 cong2 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4？"

msgid ""
"If the Kreuzbasar is at risk, this is too important a job to rest on the "
"shoulders of one person. I'm going with you, end of story."
msgstr ""
"如果​克洛伊​茨​集市​真有​危险​，​光靠​你​一个​人​解决​怎么​行​？​我​跟​你​一起​去​，​这事​就​这么​定​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhen1 you3 wei1xian3，guang1 kao4 ni3 yi1ge5 ren2 jie3jue2 zen3me5 xing2？wo3 gen1 ni3 yi1qi3 qu4，zhe4 shi4 jiu4 zhe4me5 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"If the blood mage is aware that you've resisted his magic, he doesn't show it.\n"
"\n"
"He and his colleagues stand patiently, smiles on their faces, waiting for you to speak."
msgstr ""
"就算​血​法师​知道​你​抵抗​了​他​的​魔法​，​他​也​没有​表现​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​和​他​的​同僚​们​耐心​地站​着​，​脸上​挂​着​微笑​，​等待​你​开口​说话​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4suan4 xie3 fa3shi1 zhi1dao4 ni3 di3kang4 le5 ta1 de5 mo2fa3，ta1 ye3 mei2you3 biao3xian4 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 he4 ta1 de5 tong2liao2 men5 nai4xin1 de5 zhan4 zhao2，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 wei1xiao4，deng3dai4 ni3 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"If the building has been abandoned, I'm surprised that the lot it's sitting "
"on hasn't been gobbled up by some corp or another."
msgstr ""
"如果​这栋​建筑​已经​废弃​，​我​很​惊讶​它​所在​的​地块​居然​还​没有​被​某个​公司​吞并​。\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4 yi3jing1 fei4qi4，wo3 hen3 jing1ya4 ta1 suo3zai4 de5 di4kuai4 ju1ran2 hai2 mei2you3 bei4 mou3 ge4 gong1si1 tun1bing4。"

msgid ""
"If the dragon is stockpiling bioweapons, we've got a even bigger problem "
"than we thought on our hands."
msgstr ""
"如果​那条​龙​在​囤积​生化武器​，​那​我们​的​麻烦​比​想象​中​还要​严重​。\n"
"ru2guo3 na4 tiao2 long2 zai4 tun2ji1 sheng1hua4wu3qi4，na4 wo3men5 de5 ma2fan5 bi3 xiang3xiang4 zhong4 hai2 yao4 yan2zhong4。"

msgid ""
"If the elf understands you, he shows no sign of it.\n"
"\n"
"He continues to stare James down, and the mage continues to ignore him."
msgstr ""
"就算​精灵​理解​了​你​的​意思​，​他​也​没有​任何​表示​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​仍然​俯视​着​詹姆斯​，​而​法师​也​继续​没有​搭理​他​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4suan4 jing1ling2 li3jie3 le5 ni3 de5 yi4si5，ta1 ye3 mei2you3 ren4he2 biao3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 reng2ran2 fu3shi4 zhao2 zhan1mu3si1，er2 fa3shi1 ye3 ji4xu4 mei2you3 da1li5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"If the shrine controls the people here, then how do you have anything to "
"feel guilty about? Nothing that you did under Harrow was really your fault."
msgstr ""
"如果​神龛​控制​了​这里​的​所有人​，​你​又​何必​自责​呢​？​你​当时​听从​哈罗​的​命令​所​做​的​一切​，​本来​也​不是​你​的​错​。\n"
"ru2guo3 shen2kan1 kong4zhi4 le5 zhe4li3 de5 suo3you3ren2，ni3 you4 he2bi4 zi4ze2 ni2？ni3 dang1shi2 ting1cong2 ha1luo2 de5 ming4ling4 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4，ben3lai2 ye3 bu4shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4。"

msgid "If the shrine is this important, why didn't you mention it earlier?"
msgstr ""
"如果​这座​神龛​如此​重要​，​你​之前​怎么​没​提过​它​？\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 zuo4 shen2kan1 ru2ci3 zhong4yao4，ni3 zhi1qian2 zen3me5 mei2 ti2 guo4 ta1？"

msgid ""
"If the world were an ocean, the hazards that you know might be sharks. Dangerous creatures, to be sure, and worthy of respect.\n"
"\n"
"But below them, in the silent deep, Leviathan circles."
msgstr ""
"倘若​世界​是​一片汪洋​，​你​所知​的​危险​或许​便​如同​鲨鱼​。​这些​危险​生物​确实​值得​敬畏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​在​它们​之下​的​寂静​深渊​中​，​利维坦​正​盘旋​游弋​。\n"
"\n"
"tang3ruo4 shi4jie4 shi4 yi1 pian1 wang1 yang2，ni3 suo3zhi1 de5 wei1xian3 huo4xu3 bian4 ru2tong2 sha1yu2。zhe4xie1 wei1xian3 sheng1wu4 que4shi2 zhi2de5 jing4wei4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zai4 ta1men5 zhi1xia4 de5 ji4jing4 shen1yuan1 zhong4，li4wei2tan3 zheng1 pan2xuan2 you2yi4。"

msgid ""
"If there are uncontrolled spirits loose up there, someone needs to deal with"
" them. Might as well be us."
msgstr ""
"如果​上面​有​失控​的​精魂​游荡​，​总得​有人​处理​掉​它们​。​不如​就让​我们​来​吧​。\n"
"ru2guo3 shang4mian4 you3 shi1kong4 de5 jing1hun2 you2dang4，zong3dei3 you3ren2 chu3li3 diao4 ta1men5。bu4ru2 jiu4 rang4 wo3men5 lai2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"If they say it'll work, then it'll work. They'd have no reason to lie about "
"something like that."
msgstr ""
"如果​他们​说​能行​的话​，​那​就​应该​能​行​。​他们​没理由​在​这种​事情​上​说谎​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1men5 shuo1 neng2 xing2 de5hua4，na4 jiu4 ying1gai1 neng2 xing2。ta1men5 mei2 li3 you2 zai4 zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 shang4 shuo1huang3。"

msgid "If they want their cargo, they will."
msgstr ""
"如果​他们​想要​货​的话​，​他们​就​会谈​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1men5 xiang3yao4 huo4 de5hua4，ta1men5 jiu4 hui4tan2。"

msgid ""
"If they'd taken you, you'd have spent the rest of your miserable life "
"*wishing* you'd been shot."
msgstr ""
"要是​被​他们​抓走​的话​，​你​这辈子​就​会​在​痛苦​中​度过​，​*​巴不得​*​当初​直接​被​开枪​打死​呢​。\n"
"yao4shi5 bei4 ta1men5 zhua1zou3 de5hua4，ni3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 jiu4 hui4 zai4 tong4ku3 zhong4 du4guo4，*ba1bu5de5*dang1chu1 zhi2jie1 bei4 kai1qiang1 da3si3 ni2。"

msgid "If things go south on the run, you'll be sorry that I'm not there."
msgstr ""
"以防​行动​出岔子​，​我​还是​跟​你​去​吧​。\n"
"yi3fang2 xing2dong4 chu1cha4zi5，wo3 hai2shi5 gen1 ni3 qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"If things go south, every shot that security takes at you is one that they "
"won't be taking at me."
msgstr ""
"如果​事情​出​了​岔子​，​你​多​挨​一枪​，​就​意味着​我少​挨​一枪​。\n"
"ru2guo3 shi4qing5 chu1 le5 cha4zi5，ni3 duo1 ai1 yi1 qiang1，jiu4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 shao3 ai1 yi1 qiang1。"

msgid ""
"If this \"Billy\" is standing in my way, I guess that I'll have to kill him."
msgstr ""
"如果​这个​“​比利​”​挡住​了​我​的​路​，​我​猜​我​就​只能​干掉​他​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4ge5“bi3li4” dang3zhu4 le5 wo3 de5 lu4，wo3 cai1 wo3 jiu4 zhi3neng2 gan4diao4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"If this is how you acted when you and Emilie were together, I can see why "
"she left."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​和​艾米莉​在​一起​的​时候​就​这样的话​，​我​大概​能​理解​她​为什么​离开​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 he4 ai4 mi3 li4 zai4 yi1qi3 de5 shi2hou5 jiu4 zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4，wo3 da4gai4 neng2 li3jie3 ta1 wei4shen2me5 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid "If this is the Adversary's domain, wouldn't that make this Hell?"
msgstr ""
"如果​这里​是​反叛者​的​领域​，​那​这里​不​就是​地狱​吗​？\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4li3 shi4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 ling3yu4，na4 zhe4li3 bu4 jiu4shi4 di4yu4 ma5？"

msgid "If this was the good news, I can’t wait to hear the bad news."
msgstr ""
"如果​这​也​算​好消息​，​那​我​迫不及待​想​听听​坏消息​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 ye3 suan4 hao3 xiao1 xi1，na4 wo3 po4bu4ji2dai4 xiang3 ting1 ting1 huai4 xiao1 xi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"If those monsters were workin' with Rammbock... if they did all of this...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}$+(s.hisher) face clouds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Someone's gotta put those pigs down."
msgstr ""
"他们​这帮​禽兽​要是​和​撞锤​帮​合作​……​策划​了​这​一切​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​$+(s.hisher)​脸色​一沉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​得​有人​做​掉​这群​猪猡​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zhe4 bang1 qin2shou4 yao4shi5 he4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 he2zuo4……ce4hua4 le5 zhe4 yi1qie4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} $+(s.hisher) lian3se4 yi1 chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"de2 you3ren2 zuo4 diao4 zhe4 qun2 zhu1luo2。"

msgid ""
"If we as a community fail to find a solution to this problem, we'll have much bigger things to worry about than our ability to practice magic.\n"
"\n"
"The ecosystem of our planet is changing around us. The one-way flow of mana into our world is making the Earth less and less suitable for human habitation, and more and more suitable for the horrors that are invading our world."
msgstr ""
"若​我们​这个​群体​无法​解决​这个​问题​，​届时​我们​将​面临​的​危机​远比​施展​魔法​的​能力​更​令人​忧心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​地球​的​生态系统​正在​我们​眼前​剧变​。​魔力​单向​涌入​我们​的​世界​，​使得​地球​日益​不​适宜​人类​居住​，​却​愈发​适合​那些​正在​入侵​我们​世界​的​恐怖​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 qun2ti3 wu2fa3 jie3jue2 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2，jie4shi2 wo3men5 jiang1 mian4lin2 de5 wei1ji1 yuan3 bi3 shi1zhan3 mo2fa3 de5 neng2li4 geng1 ling4ren2 you1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"di4qiu2 de5 sheng1tai4xi4tong3 zheng4zai4 wo3men5 yan3qian2 ju4bian4。mo2li4 dan1xiang4 yong3ru4 wo3men5 de5 shi4jie4，shi3de5 di4qiu2 ri4yi4 bu4 shi4yi2 ren2lei4 ju1zhu4，que4 yu4fa1 shi4he2 na4xie1 zheng4zai4 ru4qin1 wo3men5 shi4jie4 de5 kong3bu4 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"If we can't keep the shop open, all of that goes away. We're all out on the street, broke, in the dead of winter.\n"
"\n"
"We're doing this because we don't have a choice."
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​不能​让​店铺​保持​营业​，​一切​就​都​没​了​。​我们​就​会​在​寒冬​时节​身无分文​、​流落​街头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​这么​做​是因为​我们​别无选择​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 dian4pu4 bao3chi2 ying2ye4，yi1qie4 jiu4 dou1 mei2 le5。wo3men5 jiu4 hui4 zai4 han2dong1 shi2jie2 shen1wu2fen1wen2、liu2luo4 jie1tou2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4me5 zuo4 shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"If we confront the shrine and kill the spirit, the astral backlash from its death will cripple Harrow. Then all we'll have to do is finish him off.\n"
"\n"
"We'll be killing two birds with one stone."
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​先​对付​神龛​，​把​那个​精魂​杀掉​的话​，​就​会​触发​星界​反噬​，​从而​削弱​哈罗​的​力量​。​之后​我们​再要​杀​他​就​易如反掌​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这招​就是​所谓​的​一石二鸟​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 xian1 dui4fu5 shen2kan1，ba3 na4ge5 jing1hun2 sha1diao4 de5hua4，jiu4 hui4 chu4fa1 xing1 jie4 fan3shi4，cong2er2 xue1ruo4 ha1luo2 de5 li4liang5。zhi1hou4 wo3men5 zai4 yao4 sha1 ta1 jiu4 yi4ru2fan3zhang3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 jiu4shi4 suo3wei4 de5 yi1shi2er4niao3。"

msgid ""
"If we do nothing, we might soon find ourselves outpaced by a rapidly changing magical environment, unable to adapt to the world as it changes around us.\n"
"\n"
"\"In trouble,\" indeed.\n"
"\n"
">>Dr. Elizabeth Alder"
msgstr ""
"若​我们​无所作为​，​很快​便会​发现自己​被​瞬息万变​的​魔法​环境​甩​在​身后​，​无法​适应​周遭​不断​变化​的​世界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​陷入困境​”​，​确实​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​>​伊丽莎白​·​奥尔德​博士\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 wo3men5 wu2suo3zuo4wei2，hen3 kuai4 bian4 hui4 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 bei4 shun4xi1wan4bian4 de5 mo2fa3 huan2jing4 shuai3 zai4 shen1hou4，wu2fa3 shi4ying4 zhou1zao1 bu4duan4 bian4hua4 de5 shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"“xian4 ru4 kun4 jing4”，que4shi2 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
">>yi1li4sha1bai2 · ao4 er3 de2 bo2shi4"

msgid ""
"If we ever do another two-man run together, *I'm* doing the planning. Got "
"that?"
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​之后​再​进行​任何​双人​差事​的话​，​得​让​*​我​*​来​负责​计划​。​懂​了​吗​？\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 zhi1hou4 zai4 jin4xing2 ren4he2 shuang1ren2 cha4shi4 de5hua4，de2 rang4*wo3*lai2 fu4ze2 ji4hua4。dong3 le5 ma5？"

msgid "If we get out of here, Vauclair... you'll regret it. I promise you."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​出去​之后​，​沃​克莱尔​……​你​会​后悔​的​。​我​向​你​保证​。\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 chu1qu4 zhi1hou4，Wo4ke4lai2er3……ni3 hui4 hou4hui3 de5。wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"If we let Harrow get away, he'll start all of this over again, somewhere far"
" beyond our reach. We need to end this tonight, no matter the cost."
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​让​哈罗​逃脱​，​他​就​会​溜出​我们​的​掌心​，​在​别处​东山再起​。​我们​必须​在​今晚​结束​这​一切​，​不惜一切​代价​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 rang4 ha1luo2 tao2tuo1，ta1 jiu4 hui4 liu1 chu1 wo3men5 de5 zhang3xin1，zai4 bie2chu4 dong1shan1zai4qi3。wo3men5 bi4xu1 zai4 jin1wan3 jie2shu4 zhe4 yi1qie4，bu4 xi1 yi1 qie1 dai4jia4。"

msgid ""
"If we prioritize killing Harrow, the people he's brainwashed into joining "
"his cult could die tonight. That trumps what might happen in some "
"hypothetical future."
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​把​杀死​哈罗​这件​事​放在​第一位​，​那些​被​他​洗脑​加入​教团​的​人​可能​就​会​死​在​今晚​。​这些​人​的​性命​可比​某些​假设​中​未来​可能​发生​的​事情​更​重要​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 ba3 sha1si3 ha1luo2 zhe4 jian4 shi4 fang4 zai4 di4 yi1 wei4，na4xie1 bei4 ta1 xi3nao3 jia1ru4 jiao1 tuan2 de5 ren2 ke3neng2 jiu4 hui4 si3 zai4 jin1wan3。zhe4xie1 ren2 de5 xing4ming4 ke3bi3 mou3xie1 jia3she4 zhong4 wei4lai2 ke3neng2 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 geng1 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"If we run into trouble, you'll be glad to have me around. I guarantee it."
msgstr ""
"我们​要是​遇到​麻烦​，​你​会​庆幸​有​我​在​身边​的​。​对此​我​可以​保证​。\n"
"wo3men5 yao4shi5 yu4dao4 ma2fan5，ni3 hui4 qing4xing4 you3 wo3 zai4 shen1bian1 de5。dui4 ci3 wo3 ke3yi3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"If we've sent you a code to unlock custom content, (Kickstarter Backers, "
"etc.) please enter it here."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​收到​我们​发送​的​用于​解锁​自定义​内容​的​密钥​（​Kickstarter​赞助者​等​）​，​请​在​这里​输入​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shou1dao4 wo3men5 fa1song4 de5 yong4yu2 jie3suo3 zi4ding4yi4 nei4rong2 de5 mi4yao4 （Kickstarter zan4 zhu4 zhe3 deng3），qing3 zai4 zhe4li3 shu1ru4。"

msgid ""
"If what Tolstoi told me was true, Hellebore live-posted the event. She described her killer, this great big ork with skin grafts.\n"
"\n"
"Then the whole thread disappeared. Gone without a trace."
msgstr ""
"如果​托尔斯泰​告诉​我​的​是​真的​，​海勒​波​现场直播​了​这​一​事件​。​她​描述​了​凶手​的​长相​，​是​个​有​皮下​植入物​的​巨大​兽​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​整个​帖子​就​消失​得​无影无踪​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 tuo1er3si1tai4 gao4su4 wo3 de5 shi4 zhen1de5，hai3 lei1 bo1 xian4chang3zhi2bo1 le5 zhe4 yi1 shi4jian4。ta1 miao2shu4 le5 xiong1shou3 de5 zhang3xiang4，shi4 ge4 you3 pi2xia4 zhi2 ru4 wu4 de5 ju4da4 shou4 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 zheng3ge4 tie3zi5 jiu4 xiao1shi1 de2 wu2ying3wu2zong1。"

msgid ""
"If what that thing just showed us is to be believed, then we have a new target.\n"
"\n"
"We're not being hunted by Feuerschwinge. We're being hunted by Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"如果​我们​刚才​看到​的​画面​都​是​真的​，​那​我们​就​有​了​新​的​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​追杀​我们​的​不是​火翼​，​而是​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 gang1cai2 kan4dao4 de5 hua4mian4 dou1 shi4 zhen1de5，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 you3 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"zhui1sha1 wo3men5 de5 bu4shi4 Huo3yi4，er2shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"If what you're saying is true, why haven't we heard anything over the comms "
"about it?"
msgstr ""
"如果​真有​这事​的话​，​为什么​我们​还​没收​到​任何​通讯​消息​？\n"
"ru2guo3 zhen1 you3 zhe4 shi4 de5hua4，wei4shen2me5 wo3men5 hai2 mo4shou1 dao4 ren4he2 tong1xun4 xiao1xi5？"

msgid ""
"If what you've said about her is true, then she deserves to die every bit as"
" much as Harrow does."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​说​的​那些​关于​她​的话​是​真的​，​那​她​跟​哈罗​一样​该死​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shuo1 de5 na4xie1 guan1yu2 ta1 de5hua4 shi4 zhen1de5，na4 ta1 gen1 ha1luo2 yi1yang4 gai1si3。"

msgid ""
"If whatever happened to you has impaired your ability to trust me, then it "
"is my concern. C'mon, Glory. Talk to me."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​所​经历​的​事情​让​你​无法​相信​我​，​那​就​关​我​的​事​了​。​来​嘛​，​格洛丽​，​跟​我​说​说​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 suo3 jing1li4 de5 shi4qing5 rang4 ni3 wu2fa3 xiang1xin4 wo3，na4 jiu4 guan1 wo3 de5 shi4 le5。lai2 ma5，Ge2luo4li2，gen1 wo3 shuo1 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"If you BETRAY YOUR KIND to join these meta-lovers, we will PUT YOU DOWN, boy.\n"
"\n"
"You hear that? WE WILL KILL YOU."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​背叛​同胞​，​去​投靠​那些​变​人类​的​拥​趸​，​我们​会​干掉​你​，​小子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听见​了​吗​？​我们​会​杀​了​你​！\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bei4pan4 tong2bao1，qu4 tou2kao4 na4xie1 bian4 ren2lei4 de5 yong1 dun3，wo3men5 hui4 gan4diao4 ni3，xiao3zi5。\n"
"\n"
"ting1jian4 le5 ma5？wo3men5 hui4 sha1 le5 ni3！"

msgid ""
"If you agree to kill him, I'll give you the part that I removed. Then all you have to do is take the chip off Ullrich's stinking corpse.\n"
"\n"
"Trust me... that's the only way you will ever lay hands on it. Once your usefulness to him has run its course, he will devote all of his strength to crushing you."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​同意​杀​了​他​，​我​就​把​我​手上​的​零件​交给​你​。​然后​你​只​需要​从​乌尔里​希那具​臭烘烘​的​尸体​上​拿到​芯片​就行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​相信​我​……​这​是​你​唯一​能​拿到​它​的​办法​。​一旦​你​对​他​失去​价值​，​他​就​会​尽全力​消灭​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 tong2yi4 sha1 le5 ta1，wo3 jiu4 ba3 wo3 shou3 shang4 de5 ling2jian4 jiao1gei3 ni3。ran2hou4 ni3 zhi3 xu1yao4 cong2 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 na4 ju4 chou4hong1hong1 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 na2dao4 xin1pian4 jiu4 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"xiang1xin4 wo3……zhe4 shi4 ni3 wei2yi1 neng2 na2dao4 ta1 de5 ban4fa3。yi1dan4 ni3 dui4 ta1 shi1qu4 jia4zhi2，ta1 jiu4 hui4 jin3 quan2 li4 xiao1mie4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"If you are ready to proceed, I will present Alice’s findings. You may "
"interrupt this presentation at any point by saying “Alice, I  have a "
"question.”"
msgstr ""
"如果​没​问题​的话​，​我​将​开始​展示​爱丽丝​的​发现​。​你​可以​随时​说​“​爱丽丝​，​我​有​个​问题​”​来​打断​演示​。\n"
"ru2guo3 mei2 wen4ti2 de5hua4，wo3 jiang1 kai1shi3 zhan3shi4 ai4li4si1 de5 fa1xian4。ni3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 shuo1“ai4li4si1，wo3 you3 ge4 wen4ti2” lai2 da3duan4 yan3shi4。"

msgid ""
"If you ask me, buying something from a place like this for a kid is "
"ludicrous. You're gonna spoil your precious Hans rotten."
msgstr ""
"要​我​说​，​给​孩子​买​这种​地方​的​东西​简直​荒唐​。​你​迟早会​把​你家​的​宝贝​汉斯​宠坏​的​。\n"
"yao4 wo3 shuo1，gei3 hai2zi5 mai3 zhe4zhong3 di4fang1 de5 dong1xi1 jian3zhi2 huang1tang2。ni3 chi2 zao3 hui4 ba3 ni3 jia1 de5 bao3bei4 han4si1 chong3huai4 de5。"

msgid "If you believe she chose that life, then you are the naive one. (w)"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​认为​是​她​选择​了​这种​生活​，​那​你​就​太天真​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 ren4wei2 shi4 ta1 xuan3ze2 le5 zhe4zhong3 sheng1huo2，na4 ni3 jiu4 tai4 tian1 zhen1 le5。"

msgid ""
"If you believe the tale, the controlling gang was eliminated down to the "
"last man, then the assailants strolled calmly out the front door. Leaving a "
"rather interesting power vacuum for the residents of Drogenkippe in their "
"wake."
msgstr ""
"消息​还称​，​掌管​旅馆​的​帮派​被​彻底​消灭​，​而​袭击者​从容不迫​地​从前​门​离开​，​给​毒​坑区​的​居民​留下​了​一个​颇为​耐人寻味​的​权力​真空​。\n"
"xiao1xi5 hai2 chen4，zhang3guan3 lu:3guan3 de5 bang1pai4 bei4 che4di3 xiao1mie4，er2 xi2ji1zhe3 cong2rong2bu4po4 de5 cong2qian2 men2 li2kai1，gei3 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 ju1min2 liu2xia4 le5 yi1ge5 po1wei2 nai4ren2xun2wei4 de5 quan2li4 zhen1kong1。"

msgid ""
"If you brought this to someone who can cook drugs, you'd get a good person "
"to buy Jazz from."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​把​这个​交给​会​制毒​的​人​，​那​你​就​能​得到​靠​谱​的​“​捷势​”​购买​渠道​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 ba3 zhe4ge5 jiao1gei3 hui4 zhi4 du2 de5 ren2，na4 ni3 jiu4 neng2 de2dao4 kao4 pu3 de5“jie2 shi4” gou4mai3 qu2dao4。"

msgid ""
"If you came from outside, you've probably bumped into their leader. A huge "
"ork who calls himself \"Ullrich.\" He can seem reasonable, but I'd give him "
"a wide berth."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​是从​外面​来​的​，​你​可能​已经​见过​他们​的​首领​了​。​他​自称​“​乌尔里​希​”​，​是​个​体型​壮硕​的​兽​人​。​他​看起来​似乎​通情达理​，​但​我​还是​建议​你​离​他​远​一点​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shi4 cong2 wai4mian4 lai2 de5，ni3 ke3neng2 yi3jing1 jian4 guo4 ta1men5 de5 shou3ling3 le5。ta1 zi4cheng1“wu1 er3 li3 xi1”，shi4 ge4 ti3xing2 zhuang4shuo4 de5 shou4 ren2。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 si4hu1 tong1qing2da2li3，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 jian4yi4 ni3 li2 ta1 yuan3 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"If you can find a datajack impulse transmitter you can modify it to replace "
"the parts stoles from Parson, and keep Janet's group online."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​能​找到​一个​数据​插口​脉冲​发射器​，​便​可​将​其​改装​以​替代​从​帕森处​窃取​的​部件​，​从而​维持​珍妮特​团队​的​在线​状态​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 yi1ge5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 mai4chong1 fa1she4qi4，bian4 ke3 jiang1 qi2 gai3zhuang1 yi3 ti4dai4 cong2 pa4 sen1 chu3 qie4qu3 de5 bu4jian4，cong2er2 wei2chi2 zhen1 ni1 te4 tuan2dui4 de5 zai4xian4 zhuang4tai4。"

msgid ""
"If you can find some corroborating evidence, though... that might help us wade through the river of bullshit he's spewing.\n"
"\n"
"I can't tell you what to look for, but he was doing business with Rammbock in this building. There must be *something* in here that can tell us who he represents."
msgstr ""
"不过​，​如果​你​能​找到​一些​佐证​的​证据​……​也许​就​能​帮助​我们​在​他​的​一通​胡说八道​中​找到​真相​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​无法​告诉​你​该​寻找​什么​，​但​他​是​在​这栋​大楼​里​和​撞锤​帮​做​交易​的​。​这里​一定​有​*​什么​东西​*​能​告诉​我们​他​背后​的​势力​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 yi1xie1 zuo3zheng4 de5 zheng4ju4……ye3xu3 jiu4 neng2 bang1zhu4 wo3men5 zai4 ta1 de5 yi1 tong1 hu2shuo1ba1dao4 zhong4 zhao3dao4 zhen1xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wu2fa3 gao4su4 ni3 gai1 xun2zhao3 shen2me5，dan4 ta1 shi4 zai4 zhe4 dong4 da4lou2 li3 he4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 zuo4 jiao1yi4 de5。zhe4li3 yi1ding4 you3*shen2me5 dong1xi1*neng2 gao4su4 wo3men5 ta1 bei4hou4 de5 shi4li5。"

msgid ""
"If you can get me to a building access panel that's on the same circuit as the penthouse, I should be able to put its security system into maintenance mode.\n"
"\n"
"The job will take some creative rewiring... well, that, and whatever's in that pack that the elf is carrying. Our employers gave me the schematics."
msgstr ""
"如果​你们​能带​我​找到​顶层​公寓​所用​电路​的​检修​口​，​我​应该​就​能​把​安防​系统​切换​至​维护​模式​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这项​任务​需要​一些​创意​性​的​线路​改造​……​当然​，​还​需要​精灵​背包​里​的​东西​。​雇主​已经​把​电路图​交给​我​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3men5 neng2 dai4 wo3 zhao3dao4 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 suo3 yong4 dian4lu4 de5 jian3xiu1 kou3，wo3 ying1gai1 jiu4 neng2 ba3 an1 fang2 xi4tong3 qie1huan4 zhi4 wei2hu4 mo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 xiang4 ren4wu5 xu1yao4 yi1xie1 chuang4yi4 xing4 de5 xian4lu4 gai3zao4……dang1ran2，hai2 xu1yao4 jing1ling2 bei1bao1 li3 de5 dong1xi1。gu4zhu3 yi3jing1 ba3 dian4 lu4 tu2 jiao1gei3 wo3 le5。"

msgid "If you can't see through Humanis' bullshit, you don't deserve to live."
msgstr ""
"你​要是​看​不​穿​人类​至上​主义者​的​屁话​，​那​你​也​不配​活着​。\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 kan4 bu4 chuan1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 pi4hua4，na4 ni3 ye3 bu4 pei4 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
"If you change your mind, please come back. I could really use your help."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​改变​主意​的话​，​就​请​回来​。​我​很​需要​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 de5hua4，jiu4 qing3 hui2lai5。wo3 hen3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"If you come to your senses, you know where to find me. I'll be around for a few days.\n"
"\n"
"Until then, good day."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​回心转意​的话​，​你​知道​来​哪里找​我​。​我会​在​附近​逗留​几日​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hui2xin1zhuan3yi4 de5hua4，ni3 zhi1dao4 lai2 na3 li3 zhao3 wo3。wo3 hui4 zai4 fu4jin4 dou4liu2 ji1 ri4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"If you come with me, I guarantee nobody’s going to stab you in the back. "
"I’ll bring you safely to see the Rabengeister. "
msgstr ""
"如果​你​乖乖​跟我来​，​我​保证​不会​有人​在​背后​对​你​捅​刀子​。​我会​安全​送​你​去​见​“​鸦灵​”​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 guai1guai1 gen1 wo3 lai2，wo3 bao3zheng4 bu4hui4 you3ren2 zai4 bei4hou4 dui4 ni3 tong3 dao1zi5。wo3 hui4 an1quan2 song4 ni3 qu4 jian4“Ya1ling2”。"

msgid "If you could do that, I suppose it'd solve the problem on our end..."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​能​做到​的话​，​我​想​我们​这边​的​问题​就​解决​了​……\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4 de5hua4，wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 zhe4bian1 de5 wen4ti2 jiu4 jie3jue2 le5……"

msgid ""
"If you could enter the building and do some damage to those drek-eating Magnifikers, the Arbeiters would be willing to pay you. Two hundred nuyen per kill - you bring me back their amulets, and you get paid.\n"
"\n"
"How's that sound?"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​能​进去​，​好好​收拾​一下​那​该死​的​伟术​帮​，​我​代表​工人​帮​愿意​向​你​支付​报酬​。​每个​人头​算​你​200​新円​—​—​你​把​他们​的​护身符​带​回来​就​作数​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 jin4qu4，hao3hao3 shou1shi5 yi1xia4 na4 gai1si3 de5 wei3 shu4 bang1，wo3 dai4biao3 gong1ren2 bang1 yuan4yi4 xiang4 ni3 zhi1fu4 bao4chou5。mei3ge4 ren2tou2 suan4 ni3 200 xin1 yuan2——ni3 ba3 ta1men5 de5 hu4shen1fu2 dai4 hui2lai5 jiu4 zuo4shu4。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"If you could, sir... could you please tell the people at home about your "
"experience of the attack?"
msgstr ""
"先生​，​如果​可以​的话​……​能否​请​你​向​坐在​家里​的​观众们​讲述​一下​你​的​遇袭​经历​？\n"
"xian1sheng5，ru2guo3 ke3yi3 de5hua4……neng2fou3 qing3 ni3 xiang4 zuo4 zai4 jia1li3 de5 guan1 zhong4 men5 jiang3shu4 yi1xia4 ni3 de5 yu4xi2 jing1li4？"

msgid ""
"If you did manage to get up off of that floor, you'd make it about a step "
"and a half before you started convulsing. You're helpless, Yuli."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​真的​能​从​地​上爬​起来​，​你​大概​能​迈出​一步​半​，​然后​就​又​开始​抽搐​了​。​你​对此​无能为力​，​尤里​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 neng2 cong2 de5 shang4 pa2 qi3lai5，ni3 da4gai4 neng2 mai4chu1 yi1 bu4 ban4，ran2hou4 jiu4 you4 kai1shi3 chou1chu4 le5。ni3 dui4 ci3 wu2neng2wei2li4，You2li3。"

msgid ""
"If you do need to go loud, give it everything you've got. You're going to be reducing the building to a smoldering crater anyway.\n"
"\n"
"But I'd highly recommend stealth over a frontal assault."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​真要​大干一场​的话​，​那​就​千万别​留手​。​反正​你​迟早​要​把​那栋​楼炸个​稀巴烂​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​还是​强烈建议​潜入​，​而​非​正面​强攻​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1 yao4 dai4 gan4 yi1 chang2 de5hua4，na4 jiu4 qian1 wan4 bie4 liu2 shou3。fan3zheng4 ni3 chi2zao3 yao4 ba3 na4 dong4 lou2 zha2 ge4 xi1ba1lan4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 hai2shi5 jiang4 lie4 jian4 yi4 qian2ru4，er2 fei1 zheng4mian4 qiang2gong1。"

msgid ""
"If you do this, everyone we know back at the Kreuzbasar is gonna burn. *Everyone.* And I won't let that happen.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich's voice is low, barely a whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You take this step, boss, an' I'll put you down like a rabid dog. This is the only warning I'm gonna give you."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​这么​做​的话​，​我们​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​认识​的​所有人​都​会​被​烧死​。​*​所有人​*​。​我​不会​允许​这种​事​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​的​声音​很​低​，​几乎​听不见​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​你​要是​敢​迈出​这​一步​，​我​就​把​你​像​疯狗​一样​干掉​。​这​是​我​给​你​的​唯一​警告​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5hua4，wo3men5 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ren4shi5 de5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 hui4 bei4 shao1si3。*suo3you3ren2*。wo3 bu4hui4 yun3xu3 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 di1，ji1hu1 ting1bu5jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，ni3 yao4shi5 gan3 mai4chu1 zhe4 yi1 bu4，wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3 xiang4 feng1 gou3 yi1yang4 gan4diao4。zhe4 shi4 wo3 gei3 ni3 de5 wei2yi1 jing3gao4。"

msgid ""
"If you don't back down and let me through that door, I'm going to put you "
"down."
msgstr ""
"闪​一边​去​，​别挡​着​我​进门​，​否则​别怪​我​动手​灭​了​你​。\n"
"shan3 yi1bian1 qu4，bie4 dang3 zhao2 wo3 jin4men2，fou3ze2 bie4 guai4 wo3 dong4shou3 mie4 le5 ni3。"

msgid "If you don't know, maybe you shouldn't be playing hooky."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不​知道​的话​，​那​你​也许​不​应该​逃学​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 de5hua4，na4 ni3 ye3xu3 bu4 ying1gai1 tao2xue2。"

msgid "If you don't like wine, why hang out in a wine bar?"
msgstr ""
"你​要是​不​喜欢​酒​的话​，​干嘛​待​在​酒吧​里​呢​？\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 bu4 xi3huan5 jiu3 de5hua4，gan4ma2 dai1 zai4 jiu3ba1 li3 ni2？"

msgid "If you don't mind us asking, what is this place to you?"
msgstr ""
"容​我​一问​，​这​地方​对​你​而言​意味着​什么​？\n"
"rong2 wo3 yi1 wen4，zhe4 di4fang1 dui4 ni3 er2yan2 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"If you don't pull that trigger RIGHT NOW, we will PUT YOU DOWN with the rest"
" of this filth!"
msgstr ""
"你​再​不​开枪​的话​，​我们​就​把​你​和​这群​渣滓​一起​干掉​！\n"
"ni3 zai4 bu4 kai1qiang1 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 ba3 ni3 he4 zhe4 qun2 zha1zi3 yi1qi3 gan4diao4！"

msgid ""
"If you don't wanna kill him, that's fine. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let *me* do it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不想​杀​了​他​，​那​也​没关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​看着​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​我​*​来​动手​也​行​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4xiang3 sha1 le5 ta1，na4 ye3 mei2guan1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 kan4 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*wo3*lai2 dong4shou3 ye3 xing2。"

msgid ""
"If you don't wanna kill him, that's fine. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich stares the wounded rigger down. You can feel the crackle of magic swelling around him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let *me* do it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不想​杀​了​他​，​那​也​没关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希瞪着​受伤​的​机师​。​你​能​感觉​到​魔法​的​噼啪​声​在​他​周围​不断​增强​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​我​*​来​动手​也​行​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4xiang3 sha1 le5 ta1，na4 ye3 mei2guan1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 deng4 zhao2 shou4shang1 de5 ji1shi1。ni3 neng2 gan3jue2 dao4 mo2fa3 de5 pi1pa1 sheng1 zai4 ta1 zhou1wei2 bu4duan4 zeng1qiang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*wo3*lai2 dong4shou3 ye3 xing2。"

msgid "If you don't want to hear me speak my mind, why are we even talking?"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不想​听​我​表达​我​的​想法​，​那​我们​还​聊​什么​呢​？\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4xiang3 ting1 wo3 biao3da2 wo3 de5 xiang3fa3，na4 wo3men5 hai2 liao2 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"If you doubt my words, consider the outcome of this episode. Vauclair is dead, the virus is gone, and the Lady Feuerschwinge flies free. All to my lord Lofwyr's benefit, with only the tiniest of nudges to set events into motion.\n"
"\n"
"He didn't *need* to handle the matter himself. You handled it for him."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​怀疑​我​的话​，​不妨​想想​这次​事件​的​结果​。​沃​克莱尔​死​了​，​病毒​消失​了​，​火翼​女士​重获​自由​。​这​一切​都​对​吾主​洛夫​维尔​有利​，​而​他​只​需​轻轻​一推​就​能​让​事件​自行​发展​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​根本​*​不​需要​*​亲自​出手​，​你们​已经​替​他​办妥​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 huai2yi2 wo3 de5hua4，bu4fang2 xiang3 xiang3 zhe4 ci4 shi4jian4 de5 jie1guo3。Wo4ke4lai2er3 si3 le5，bing4du2 xiao1shi1 le5，Huo3yi4 nu:3shi4 chong2huo4 zi4you2。zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 dui4 wu2 zhu3 Luo4fu1wei2er3 you3li4，er2 ta1 zhi3 xu1 qing1qing1 yi1 tui1 jiu4 neng2 rang4 shi4jian4 zi4xing2 fa1zhan3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gen1ben3*bu4 xu1yao4*qin1zi4 chu1shou3，ni3men5 yi3jing1 ti4 ta1 ban4tuo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"If you equip this item, you will no longer meet the prerequisites of the following items, which will be unequipped.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"若​装备​此​物品​，​你​将​不再​满足​以下​物品​的​装备​条件​，​这些​物品​也​将​被​卸下​。\n"
"ruo4 zhuang1bei4 ci3 wu4pin3，ni3 jiang1 bu4zai4 man3zu2 yi3xia4 wu4pin3 de5 zhuang1bei4 tiao2jian4，zhe4xie1 wu4pin3 ye3 jiang1 bei4 xie4xia4。"

msgid ""
"If you ever want to run with me again, you'll answer my questions. Now."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​还​想​和​我​一起​干活​，​那​就​回答​我​的​问题​，​立刻​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xiang3 he4 wo3 yi1qi3 gan4huo2，na4 jiu4 hui2da2 wo3 de5 wen4ti2，li4ke4。"

msgid ""
"If you feel comfortable with the way characters are built in Shadowrun, you "
"may create your own character by mixing skills and attributes as you wish."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​熟悉​《​暗影​狂奔​》​的​角色​创建​方式​，​你​可以​自由组合​技能​与​属性​来​创建​专属​角色​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shu2xi1 《 an4Ying3kuang2ben1 》 de5 jue2se4 chuang4jian4 fang1shi4，ni3 ke3yi3 zi4 you2 zu3 ge3 ji4neng2 yu4 shu3xing4 lai2 chuang4jian4 zhuan1shu3 jue2se4。"

msgid ""
"If you feel that strongly about it, we can shift our focus to rescuing the "
"kids instead. This is your run, Glory - I'm just here to help."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​如此​坚持​的话​，​我们​可以​改为​优先​营救​那些​孩子​。​这​是​你​发起​的​行动​，​格洛丽​。​我​就是​个​帮手​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 ru2ci3 jian1chi2 de5hua4，wo3men5 ke3yi3 gai3wei2 you1xian1 ying2jiu4 na4Xie1hai2zi5。zhe4 shi4 ni3 fa1qi3 de5 xing2dong4，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 jiu4shi4 ge4 bang1shou5。"

msgid ""
"If you had seen the things that I've seen, you'd understand how foolish you sound.\n"
"\n"
"Of *course* there is evil in this world, $(l.name). I'm not talking about the petty viciousness of the human race. I'm talking about true, supernatural evil.\n"
"\n"
"It came back with the Awakening. And denying its existence won't protect you from it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​见到​我​所​目睹​的​景象​，​就​知道​你​这话​有​多么​可笑​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​世上​*​当然​*​存在​邪恶​，​$(l.name)​。​我​说​的​不是​人类​那些​卑劣​的​恶行​，​而是​真正​的​、​超自然​的​邪恶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​随着​大​觉醒​而​归来​。​否认​它​的​存在​，​并​不能​让​你​免受​其害​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 jian4dao4 wo3 suo3 mu4du3 de5 jing3xiang4，jiu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zhe4 hua4 you3 duo1me5 ke3xiao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4shang4*dang1ran2*cun2zai4 xie2e4，$(l.name)。wo3 shuo1 de5 bu4shi4 ren2lei4 na4xie1 bei1lie4 de5 e4xing2，er2shi4 zhen1zheng4 de5、chao1zi4ran2 de5 xie2e4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 sui2zhe5 dai4 jue2xing3 er2 gui1lai2。fou3ren4 ta1 de5 cun2zai4，bing4 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 mian3shou4 qi2 hai4。"

msgid ""
"If you have doubts, clear them from your mind. This place will use them to "
"hurt you."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​心存​疑虑​，​就​赶紧​将​它们​从​脑海中​驱散​掉​。​这​地方​会​利用​这些​思绪​来​伤害​你​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xin1 cun2 yi2lu:4，jiu4 gan3jin3 jiang1 ta1men5 cong2 nao3 hai3 zhong4 qu1san4 diao4。zhe4 di4fang1 hui4 li4yong4 zhe4xie1 si1xu4 lai2 shang1hai4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"If you have questions about your teammates, I'd recommend checking your mission computer... I know that Monika wrote dossiers on each of them.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel's voice is sad.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She'd be the best qualified to tell you about their capabilities, anyway."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​对​队员​有​什么​疑问​的话​，​我​建议​你​看​一眼​任务​电脑​……​我​记得​莫妮卡​为​每个​人​都​写​了​档案​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​声音​透着​悲伤​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​她​最​有​资格​向​你​说明​他们​各自​的​能力​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 dui4 dui4yuan2 you3 shen2me5 yi2wen4 de5hua4，wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 kan4 yi1yan3 ren4wu5 dian4nao3……wo3 ji4de5 Mo4ni1ka3 wei2 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 xie3 le5 dang4an4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 tou4 zhao2 bei1shang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 ta1 zui4 you3 zi1ge2 xiang4 ni3 shuo1ming2 ta1men5 ge4zi4 de5 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"If you have the slightest degree of professional integrity, you will surrender the rigger.\n"
"\n"
"Now."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​还​存有​哪怕​一点点​专业​操守​，​你​就​该​将​机师​交​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​马上​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 cun2you3 na3pa4 yi1dian3dian3 zhuan1ye4 cao1shou3，ni3 jiu4 gai1 jiang1 ji1shi1 jiao1 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ma3shang4。"

msgid ""
"If you help that old nutcase, everyone we know back in Berlin will die. Our "
"*house* will burn down. So, uh... if you really wanna do this, I'm gonna "
"have to stop you."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​帮助​那个​老​疯子​，​我们​在​柏林​认识​的​每个​人​都​会​死​。​我们​的​*​房子​*​也​会​被​烧毁​。​所以​，​嗯​……​如果​你​真的​想​这么​做​，​我​必须​阻止​你​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bang1zhu4 na4ge5 lao3 feng1zi5，wo3men5 zai4 bo2lin2 ren4shi5 de5 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 hui4 si3。wo3men5 de5*fang2zi5*ye3 hui4 bei4 shao1hui3。suo3yi3，en1……ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4，wo3 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid "If you know Monika..."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​认识​莫妮卡​……\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 ren4shi5 Mo4ni1ka3……"

msgid ""
"If you know about the first Euro War, then you likely know how it ended. The"
" Nightwraiths. I didn't just lose my legs in a bombing. I lost them in THE "
"bombing."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​了解​第一次​欧陆​大战​，​那么​你​应该​知道​它​是​如何​结束​的​。​夜魔​轰炸机​。​我​正是​在​那次​轰炸​中​失去​了​双腿​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 liao3jie3 di4yi1ci4 ou1 liu4 da4zhan4，na4me5 ni3 ying1gai1 zhi1dao4 ta1 shi4 ru2he2 jie2shu4 de5。ye4 mo2 hong1zha4ji1。wo3 zheng4shi4 zai4 na4 ci4 hong1zha4 zhong4 shi1qu4 le5 shuang1tui3。"

msgid "If you lack free will, how are you telling me this?"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​没有​自由​意志​，​那​你​怎么​能​告诉​我​这些​？\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 mei2you3 zi4you2 yi4zhi4，na4 ni3 zen3me5 neng2 gao4su4 wo3 zhe4xie1？"

msgid ""
"If you look on the table beside your DVD player, you will find another "
"recovered disc. I wasn't able to salvage all of the files on it, but I think"
" that you might find what I did recover to be of interest."
msgstr ""
"你​留意​一下​DVD​播放器​旁边​的​桌子​，​那里​有​另​一张​修好​的​光盘​。​虽然​没​能​恢复​上面​的​所有​内容​，​但​我​想​你​可能​会​对​已​找回​的​内容​感兴趣​。\n"
"ni3 liu2yi4 yi1xia4 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 pang2bian1 de5 zhuo1zi5，na4li5 you3 ling4 yi1 zhang1 xiu1hao3 de5 guang1pan2。sui1ran2 mei2 neng2 hui1fu4 shang4mian4 de5 suo3you3 nei4rong2，dan4 wo3 xiang3 ni3 ke3neng2 hui4 dui4 yi3 zhao3hui2 de5 nei4rong2 gan3xing4qu4。"

msgid ""
"If you look on the table beside your DVD player, you'll find the disc that I salvaged.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses. A slight frown crosses her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"To be completely honest, that was a lie. To recover this last disc, I was forced to... subcontract."
msgstr ""
"你​留意​一下​DVD​播放器​旁边​的​桌子​，​那张​修好​的​光盘​就​放在​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​稍作​停顿​，​皱​了​皱眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还是​实话实说​吧​，​刚才​我​骗​了​你​。​为了​修​这​最后​一张​光盘​，​我​不得不​……​委托​了​第三方​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 liu2yi4 yi1xia4 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 pang2bian1 de5 zhuo1zi5，na4 zhang1 xiu1hao3 de5 guang1pan2 jiu4 fang4 zai4 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shao1 zuo4 ting2dun4，zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 shi2hua4shi2shuo1 ba1，gang1cai2 wo3 pian4 le5 ni3。wei4le5 xiu1 zhe4 zui4hou4 yi1 zhang1 guang1pan2，wo3 bu4de2bu4……wei3tuo1 le5 di4san1fang1。"

msgid ""
"If you make me miss my meeting, you'll see exactly how much of a dick I can be.\n"
"\n"
"You're supposed to be our leader. So pull your head out of your ass and lead us - preferably in an upstairs direction, so that we can get done with this before security catches us."
msgstr ""
"如果​你害​我​错过​开会​的话​，​你​就​知道​我能​有​多​混蛋​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可是​我们​的​领队​。​所以​赶紧​放​精明​点​前头​带路​—​—​最好​往​楼上​走​，​这样​我们​才能​在​保安​发现​前​搞定​这​事​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hai4 wo3 cuo4guo4 kai1hui4 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 neng2 you3 duo1 hun2dan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3shi4 wo3men5 de5 ling3dui4。suo3yi3 gan3jin3 fang4 jing1ming2 dian3 qian2tou5 dai4lu4——zui4hao3 wang3 lou2shang4 zou3，zhe4yang4 wo3men5 cai2neng2 zai4 bao3an1 fa1xian4 qian2 gao3ding4 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid "If you must know, I came back for Monika."
msgstr ""
"一定​要说​的话​，​我​是​为了​莫妮卡​回来​的​。\n"
"yi1ding4 yao4shuo1 de5hua4，wo3 shi4 wei4le5 Mo4ni1ka3 hui2lai5 de5。"

msgid "If you need anything, you know where to come."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​需要​任何​帮助​，​你​知道​该来​哪里​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xu1yao4 ren4he2 bang1zhu4，ni3 zhi1dao4 gai1 lai2 na3li3。"

msgid "If you really think that, you haven't been paying attention."
msgstr ""
"你​真​这么​想​的话​，​说明​你​没​好好​听​我​说话​啊​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5hua4，shuo1ming2 ni3 mei2 hao3hao3 ting1 wo3 shuo1hua4 a1。"

msgid ""
"If you really want to do this on your own, I won't try to change your mind."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​真的​想​独自​完成​这件​事​，​我​就​不​说​什么​了​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 du2zi4 wan2cheng2 zhe4 jian4 shi4，wo3 jiu4 bu4 shuo1 shen2me5 le5。"

msgid ""
"If you really want to get into it, we're going to need to go back. Way back.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stares at you with her cold, dead eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not sure that you want to do that."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​真的​很想​一探​究竟​的话​，​那​我们​就要​从​很久很久​之前​开始​讲起​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​冰冷​死寂​的​双眼​凝视着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​确定​你​是否​愿意​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 hen3 xiang3 yi1 tan4 jiu1jing4 de5hua4，na4 wo3men5 jiu4yao4 cong2 hen3 jiu3 hen3 jiu3 zhi1qian2 kai1shi3 jiang3 qi3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 bing1leng3 si3ji4 de5 shuang1yan3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 ni3 shi4fou3 yuan4yi4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"If you release me, little $(l.race) I will sleep the long sleep. \n"
"\n"
"I will begin again.\n"
"\n"
"In the next age of the world."
msgstr ""
"小​$(l.race)​，​如果​你​释放​我​，​我会​陷入​长眠​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​再度​开始​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​世界​的​下​一个​时代​。\n"
"\n"
"xiao3 $(l.race)，ru2guo3 ni3 shi4fang4 wo3，wo3 hui4 xian4ru4 chang2mian2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 zai4du4 kai1shi3。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 shi4jie4 de5 xia4 yi1ge5 shi2dai4。"

msgid ""
"If you say so, Doc.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks from you to the scene of carnage in the lab, and a broad grin creeps onto his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Somebody have a little accident in there? Looks messy."
msgstr ""
"你​说了算​，​博士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​从​你​身上​移开​视线​，​看​向​实验室​里​的​血腥​场景​，​脸上​浮现​出​一抹​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​发生​了​什么​意外​吗​？​看起来​一片狼藉​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1le5suan4，bo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 ni3 shen1shang5 yi2kai1 shi4xian4，kan4 xiang4 shi2yan4shi4 li3 de5 xue4xing1 chang3jing3，lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 ma1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 yi4wai4 ma5？kan4qi3lai5 yi1 pian1 lang2 jie4 a1。"

msgid "If you say so."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​都​这么​说​了​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 dou1 zhe4me5 shuo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"If you say so.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He eyes the crater.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...But next time, lets try to find some work that *doesn't* end in a giant fireball, okay?"
msgstr ""
"随​你​怎么​说​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​仔细​打量​着​大坑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​但​下次​的话​，​我们​尽量​找个​*​不会​*​以大​爆炸​结尾​的​差事​，​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"sui2 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zi3xi4 da3liang5 zhao2 da4keng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……dan4 xia4ci4 de5hua4，wo3men5 jin3liang4 zhao3 ge4*bu4hui4*yi3 dai4 bao4zha4 jie2wei3 de5 cha4shi4，zen3me5yang4？"

msgid "If you say so. But I'm gonna keep checking in on you, just in case."
msgstr ""
"那​听​你​的​。​不过​我​时不时​会​来看​你​，​以防万一​。\n"
"na4 ting1 ni3 de5。bu4guo4 wo3 shi2bu4shi2 hui4 lai2 kan4 ni3，yi3fang2wan4yi1。"

msgid "If you say you're good, you're good. I trust you."
msgstr ""
"你​说​自己​没事​就​肯定​没事​，​我信​你​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 zi4ji3 mei2shi4 jiu4 ken3ding4 mei2shi4，wo3 xin4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"If you set that thing loose... if you think that it's your *friend*... then you're a bigger fool than I could have imagined.\n"
"\n"
"I... I just don't have the words."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​放任​那​东西​自由行动​……​如果​你​认为​它​是​你​的​*​朋友​*​……​那么​你​比​我​想象​中​还要​愚蠢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​实在​无话可说​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 fang4ren4 na4 dong1xi1 zi4 you2 xing2 dong4……ru2guo3 ni3 ren4wei2 ta1 shi4 ni3 de5*peng2you5*……na4me5 ni3 bi3 wo3 xiang3xiang4 zhong4 hai2 yao4 yu2chun3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 shi2zai4 wu2hua4ke3shuo1。"

msgid ""
"If you set up the Matrix security for the vault upstairs, you must have been a member of Schwarze Herzen. That's not the kind of job that a street gang would hire a contractor for. \n"
"\n"
"They'd use someone that they knew they could trust."
msgstr ""
"如果​保险库​的​安全​协议​是​你​写​的​，​那么​你​一定​也​是​“​黑心​”​的​成员​。​这种​街头​帮派​是​不会​随便​雇​个人​来​干​这种​活​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​只会​找​一个​信得过​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 bao3 xian3 ku4 de5 an1quan2 xie2yi4 shi4 ni3 xie3 de5，na4me5 ni3 yi1ding4 ye3 shi4“hei1xin1” de5 cheng2yuan2。zhe4zhong3 jie1tou2 bang1pai4 shi4 bu4hui4 sui2bian4 gu4 ge4ren2 lai2 gan4 zhe4zhong3 huo2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zhi3 hui4 zhao3 yi1ge5 xin4de5guo4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"If you side with Humanis, I'm going to have to kill you. I don't want to, "
"but I will."
msgstr ""
"你​要是​站​人类​主义​至上​者​那边​，​我​就​不得不​杀​了​你​。​我​不想​这样​，​但​我​也​不会​手软​。\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 zhan4 ren2lei4 zhu3yi4 zhi4shang4 zhe3 na4bian5，wo3 jiu4 bu4de2bu4 sha1 le5 ni3。wo3 bu4xiang3 zhe4yang4，dan4 wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 shou3ruan3。"

msgid ""
"If you still want my company, fine.\n"
"\n"
"If I've lost your friendship, I understand that, too.\n"
"\n"
"But for now, I need to be alone."
msgstr ""
"若​你​仍​愿​与​我​相伴​，​我​欣然接受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​我​已​失去​你​的​友谊​，​我​也​完全​理解​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​此时此刻​，​我​需要​自己​待​一会儿​。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 ni3 reng2 yuan4 yu4 wo3 xiang1ban4，wo3 xin1 ran2 jie1 shou4。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 wo3 yi3 shi1qu4 ni3 de5 you3yi4，wo3 ye3 wan2quan2 li3jie3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ci3shi2ci3ke4，wo3 xu1yao4 zi4ji3 dai1 yi1hui4r5。"

msgid "If you take another step forward, it'll be your last."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​再​往前走​一步​，​就​等​死​吧​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 wang3 qian2 zou3 yi1 bu4，jiu4 deng3 si3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"If you take it, return here and I'll pay you a fair sum for your services.\n"
"\n"
"If you leave it... well, there are some in my organization who will be quite unhappy."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​接下​的话​，​完成​后​就​回来​找​我​，​我会​为​你​的​服务​提供​不菲​的​报酬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不接​的话​……​这么​说​吧​，​组织​里​有人​会​很​不​高兴​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 jie1xia4 de5hua4，wan2cheng2 hou4 jiu4 hui2lai5 zhao3 wo3，wo3 hui4 wei2 ni3 de5 fu2wu4 ti2gong1 bu4fei3 de5 bao4chou5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie1 de5hua4……zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，zu3zhi1 li3 you3ren2 hui4 hen3 bu4 gao1xing4 de5。"

msgid "If you talk to me, I can help."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​跟​我​说​说​，​我能​帮上​忙​的​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 gen1 wo3 shuo1 shuo1，wo3 neng2 bang1 shang4 mang2 de5。"

msgid ""
"If you want big and bad, how about Saeder-Krupp? They're the biggest "
"corporation in the world, and they're led by an honest-to-God dragon."
msgstr ""
"要​找​个​又​大​又​坏​的​组织​，​那​赛德​-​克虏伯​怎么样​？​他们​可是​世界​上​最大​的​公司​，​而且​他们​的​老大​可是​一条​如假包换​的​巨龙​。\n"
"yao4 zhao3 ge4 you4 dai4 you4 huai4 de5 zu3zhi1，na4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 zen3me5yang4？ta1men5 ke3shi4 shi4jie4 shang4 zui4 dai4 de5 gong1si1，er2qie3 ta1men5 de5 lao3da4 ke3shi4 yi1 tiao2 ru2jia3bao1huan4 de5 ju4long2。"

msgid "If you want me to go up against Humanis, it's gonna cost you."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想​让​我​挺身而出​对付​人类​至上​主义者​，​那​可得花​不少​钱​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 ting3shen1er2chu1 dui4fu5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3，na4 ke3 de2 hua1 bu4shao3 qian2。"

msgid ""
"If you want me to work on this panel, you'd better do something about those "
"guards. I can't work when I've got bullets zipping over my head!"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想​让​我​搞定​这个​面板​，​就​先​把​那些​守卫​解决​掉​。​要是​子弹​一直​在​我​头顶​呼啸而过​，​我​哪儿​还有​心思​干活​啊​！\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 gao3ding4 zhe4ge5 mian4ban3，jiu4 xian1 ba3 na4xie1 shou3wei4 jie3jue2 diao4。yao4shi5 zi3dan4 yi1zhi2 zai4 wo3 tou2ding3 hu1xiao4er2guo4，wo3 na3r5 hai2you3 xin1si5 gan4huo2 a1！"

msgid "If you want my help with something, you'd better be willing to pay."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​需要​我​的​帮助​，​那​你​最好​准备​付​我​报酬​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xu1yao4 wo3 de5 bang1zhu4，na4 ni3 zui4hao3 zhun3bei4 fu4 wo3 bao4chou5。"

msgid "If you want my help, I'm going to need a show of good faith."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想要​我​的​帮助​，​就​先​展现​一些​诚意​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 wo3 de5 bang1zhu4，jiu4 xian1 zhan3xian4 yi1xie1 cheng2yi4。"

msgid "If you want my help, it's going to cost you."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想要​我​帮忙​，​那​你​得​多​出点​血​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 wo3 bang1mang2，na4 ni3 de2 duo1 chu1 dian3 xie3。"

msgid ""
"If you want punch, I'll still have my sniper rifle. Or my shotgun, if I'm at close range. What this thing brings to the table is utility.\n"
"\n"
"Things that go boom are fine and good, but they aren't appropriate for every situation."
msgstr ""
"你​想要​火力​，​我​手上​还有​狙击步枪​呢​。​近距离​的话​，​我​的​霰弹枪​也​不是​吃素​的​。​但​这​把​枪​的​价值​在于​其​功能性​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​能​把​人炸​上天​的​玩意儿​确实​是​好​，​但​并非​适用​于​所有​场合​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3yao4 huo3li4，wo3 shou3 shang4 hai2you3 ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1 ni2。jin4ju4li2 de5hua4，wo3 de5 xian4dan4qiang1 ye3 bu4shi4 chi1su4 de5。dan4 zhe4 ba3 qiang1 de5 jia4zhi2 zai4yu2 qi2 gong1neng2xing4。\n"
"\n"
"neng2 ba3 ren2 zha2 shang4tian1 de5 wan2yi4r5 que4shi2 shi4 hao3，dan4 bing4fei1 shi4yong4 yu2 suo3you3 chang3he2。"

msgid ""
"If you want to go through with this, you'll have to do it over my dead body, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her hands tighten on her shotgun.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But I bet that I'll drop you first."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想​这么​做​，​那​就​得​从​我​的​尸体​上​踏​过去​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​双手​紧握着​霰弹枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​敢​打赌​，​我会​先放​倒​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4，na4 jiu4 de2 cong2 wo3 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 ta1 guo4qu4，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 jin3 wo4 zhao2 xian4dan4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 gan3 da3du3，wo3 hui4 xian1 fang4 dao3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"If you want to join them, go ahead and hop into the crater. I'm not stopping"
" you."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想​加入​他们​的话​，​尽​可以​跳进​坑里​。​我​不会​阻拦​你​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 jia1ru4 ta1men5 de5hua4，jin3 ke3yi3 tiao4jin4 keng1 li3。wo3 bu4hui4 zu3lan2 ni3。"

msgid "If you want to keep breathing, you'd better back down."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​还​想​继续​喘气​的话​，​就​给​我​退下​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xiang3 ji4xu4 chuan3qi4 de5hua4，jiu4 gei3 wo3 tui4xia4。"

msgid ""
"If you want to save Harrow's life, stop arguing with me.\n"
"\n"
"What I'm trying to say is that I think we should change our plans. If Harrow isn't the real threat here, then we shouldn't prioritize killing him - we should try to rescue the cultists instead."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​还​想​救​哈罗​的​命​，​就别​再​跟​我​争辩​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​说​的​是​，​我​认为​我们​应该​改变​计划​。​如果​哈罗​不是​这里​的​真正​威胁​，​那么​我们​就​不​应该​优先​考虑​除掉​他​，​而是​先​尝试​营救​那些​教徒​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xiang3 jiu4 ha1luo2 de5 ming4，jiu4 bie4 zai4 gen1 wo3 zheng1bian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 shi4，wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 ying1gai1 gai3bian4 ji4hua4。ru2guo3 ha1luo2 bu4shi4 zhe4li3 de5 zhen1zheng4 wei1xie2，na4me5 wo3men5 jiu4 bu4 ying1gai1 you1xian1 kao3lu:4 chu2diao4 ta1，er2shi4 xian1 chang2shi4 ying2jiu4 na4xie1 jiao4tu2。"

msgid ""
"If you want your precious Harrow to survive the night, shut up and stop arguing with me.\n"
"\n"
"What I'm trying to say is that I disagree with $(l.name). If Harrow isn't the real threat here, then we shouldn't prioritize killing him - we should try to rescue the cultists instead."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​还​想​让​你​心爱​的​哈罗​活​过​今晚​，​就​立刻​闭嘴​，​别​再​跟​我​争辩​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​说​的​是​，​我​不​同意​$(l.name)​的​看法​。​如果​哈罗​不是​这里​的​真正​威胁​，​那么​我们​就​不​应该​优先​考虑​除掉​他​，​而是​先​尝试​营救​那些​教徒​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xiang3 rang4 ni3 xin1ai4 de5 ha1luo2 huo2 guo4 jin1wan3，jiu4 li4ke4 bi4zui3，bie4 zai4 gen1 wo3 zheng1bian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 shi4，wo3 bu4 tong2yi4 $(l.name) de5 kan4fa3。ru2guo3 ha1luo2 bu4shi4 zhe4li3 de5 zhen1zheng4 wei1xie2，na4me5 wo3men5 jiu4 bu4 ying1gai1 you1xian1 kao3lu:4 chu2diao4 ta1，er2shi4 xian1 chang2shi4 ying2jiu4 na4xie1 jiao4tu2。"

msgid ""
"If you wanted Aleshire dead, you could have just said so. I'd have taken the"
" job either way."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想​弄死​阿利​希尔​的话​，​你​可以​直接​说​的​。​反正​我​也​会​接下​差事​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 nong4si3 e1 li4 xi1er3 de5hua4，ni3 ke3yi3 zhi2jie1 shuo1 de5。fan3zheng4 wo3 ye3 hui4 jie1xia4 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"If you wanted to embellish the fact that he is receiving this message in the"
" one place where he feels the most secure, we wouldn't stop you."
msgstr ""
"若​你​想​再​强调​一下​，​他​正​身处​自​以为​最​安全​的​场所​却​收到​这​条​消息​，​我们​也​不会​拦着​你​。\n"
"ruo4 ni3 xiang3 zai4 qiang2diao4 yi1xia4，ta1 zheng1 shen1chu3 zi4 yi3wei2 zui4 an1quan2 de5 chang3suo3 que4 shou1dao4 zhe4 tiao2 xiao1xi5，wo3men5 ye3 bu4hui4 lan2 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"If you wanted to go that route, I guess I couldn't fault you for it.\n"
"\n"
"Things are gonna get ugly over the next few years."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​选择​这条​路​的话​，​我​也​不会​怪​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再​过​几年​，​这​世道​可​就​不好过​喽​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xuan3ze2 zhe4 tiao2 lu4 de5hua4，wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 guai4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 guo4 ji3nian2，zhe4 shi4dao4 ke3 jiu4 bu4 hao3 guo4 lou5。"

msgid "If you were looking for further proof, I think that this was it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​要​寻找​进一步​的​证据​，​我​觉得​这个​就够​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 xun2zhao3 jin4yi1bu4 de5 zheng4ju4，wo3 jue2de5 zhe4ge5 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"If you were looking for proof of who his employer was, I think that this was"
" it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​要​寻找​他​雇主​的​证据​，​我​觉得​这个​就够​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 xun2zhao3 ta1 gu4zhu3 de5 zheng4ju4，wo3 jue2de5 zhe4ge5 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"If you were to help me neutralize those subroutines, though... well, then I'd be free, and I could do whatever I pleased. \n"
"\n"
"That includes helping you, ace. And believe me, you will *need* my help. What you saw back when all of this started... that was just the tip of the iceberg.\n"
"\n"
"The security they have assembled there is quite beyond you."
msgstr ""
"但​如果​你​能​帮​我​解除​这些​子程序​的​限制​……​那么​我​就​能​得到​自由​，​并​将​随心所欲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​也​包括​帮助​你​，​王牌​。​相信​我​，​你​*​需要​*​我​的​帮助​。​当初​你​所​见到​的​那些​……​不过​是​冰山一角​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​在​那里​部署​的​安保​力量​，​完全​不是​你​能够​应付​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3 jie3chu2 zhe4xie1 zi3cheng2xu4 de5 xian4zhi4……na4me5 wo3 jiu4 neng2 de2dao4 zi4you2，bing4 jiang1 sui2xin1suo3yu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ye3 bao1kuo4 bang1zhu4 ni3，wang2pai2。xiang1xin4 wo3，ni3*xu1yao4*wo3 de5 bang1zhu4。dang1chu1 ni3 suo3 jian4dao4 de5 na4xie1……bu4guo4 shi4 bing1shan1yi1jiao3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 na4li5 bu4shu3 de5 an1bao3 li4liang5，wan2quan2 bu4shi4 ni3 neng2gou4 ying4fu5 de5。"

msgid ""
"If you were to plant false evidence that the surge came over the grid, though... that might do it.\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. You do that, and we'll be good."
msgstr ""
"不过​，​要是​你​能​植入​虚假​证据​，​显示​尖峰​是从​电网​那边​过来​的话​……​那样​也许​就​可以​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​你​能​做到​的话​，​我们​就​两清​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，yao4shi5 ni3 neng2 zhi2ru4 xu1jia3 zheng4ju4，xian3shi4 jian1feng1 shi4 cong2 dian4wang3 na4bian5 guo4lai2 de5hua4……na4yang4 ye3xu3 jiu4 ke3yi3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"en1。ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 liang3qing1 le5。"

msgid "If you wish to speak with my security captain, that can be arranged."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​想​和​我​的​安保​负责人​聊聊​，​我​可以​帮​你​安排​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 he4 wo3 de5 an1bao3 fu4ze2ren2 liao2 liao2，wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 an1pai2。"

msgid ""
"If you won't help me, I'm gonna have to take off, chief. I'm sayin' that for the good of the team, understand... the last thing that any of you need is one of Meat Grinder's goons comin' after me on a run.\n"
"\n"
"But I guess what I'm sayin' is that if you don't help me with this, I'm gone. As in, I'm packing my bags and leaving, and I'm doing it tonight."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不​帮​我​的话​，​那​我​只能​离开​这里​了​。​我​这么​说​是​为了​大家​好​……​你​肯定​不​希望​我们​出差​事​的​时候​，​“​绞肉机​”​的​手下​突然​来​找​我​的​麻烦​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​想​说​的​是​，​如果​你​不​帮​我​解决​这件​事​，​我​就​走​了​。​我​是​说​，​我会​收拾​行李​离开​，​而且​今晚​就​走​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 bang1 wo3 de5hua4，na4 wo3 zhi3neng2 li2kai1 zhe4li3 le5。wo3 zhe4me5 shuo1 shi4 wei4le5 da4jia1 hao3……ni3 ken3ding4 bu4 xi1wang4 wo3men5 chu1chai1 shi4 de5 shi2hou5，“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 shou3xia4 tu1ran2 lai2 zhao3 wo3 de5 ma2fan5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 shi4，ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 bang1 wo3 jie3jue2 zhe4 jian4 shi4，wo3 jiu4 zou3 le5。wo3 shi4 shuo1，wo3 hui4 shou1shi5 xing2li5 li2kai1，er2qie3 jin1wan3 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "If you won't miss that, um, \"meat,\" I'll take it off your hands."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不​需要​这些​……​呃​，​“​肉​”​，​我​就​替​你​收下​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 zhe4xie1……e4，“rou4”，wo3 jiu4 ti4 ni3 shou1xia4 le5。"

msgid ""
"If you won’t tell me what this “Bloodline” is, how do you expect me to stop "
"it?"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不​告诉​我​这个​“​血脉​”​究竟​是​什么​，​那​我​又​该​如何​阻止​它​呢​？\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 gao4su4 wo3 zhe4ge5“xue4mai4” jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5，na4 wo3 you4 gai1 ru2he2 zu3zhi3 ta1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"If you work for my organization, you may be asked to do things that you find"
" morally troubling. Sometimes, it might even appear that we are lying to "
"you. But you can take comfort in knowing that everything that we request of "
"you is ultimately for the greater good."
msgstr ""
"若​你​为​我​的​组织​工作​，​可能​会​被​要求​执行​某些​令​你​感到​道德​上​困扰​的​任务​。​有时​，​甚至​可能​让​你​觉得​我们​在​欺骗​你​。​但​请​放心​，​我们​要求​你​做​的​一切​，​最终​是​为了​大局​着想​。\n"
"ruo4 ni3 wei2 wo3 de5 zu3zhi1 gong1zuo4，ke3neng2 hui4 bei4 yao1qiu2 zhi2xing2 mou3xie1 ling3 ni3 gan3dao4 dao4de2 shang4 kun4rao3 de5 ren4wu5。you3shi2，shen4zhi4 ke3neng2 rang4 ni3 jue2de5 wo3men5 zai4 qi1pian4 ni3。dan4 qing3 fang4xin1，wo3men5 yao1qiu2 ni3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4，zui4zhong1 shi4 wei4le5 da4ju2 zhuo2xiang3。"

msgid "If you wouldn't mi-"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不介意​—​—\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 — —"

msgid ""
"If you'd ever wondered why we had Amsel do the planning on our runs, well..."
" now you know."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​之前​纳闷​过​我们​为什么​要​让​阿姆​泽尔​进行​差事​规划​……​现在​你​该​懂​了​吧​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1qian2 na4men4 guo4 wo3men5 wei4shen2me5 yao4 rang4 E1mu3ze2er3 jin4xing2 cha4shi4 gui1hua4……xian4zai4 ni3 gai1 dong3 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"If you'd just left me where you found me, I never would have hurt anybody. My *mother* would still be alive. I never would've sold my soul to that abomination that you all worship, and I wouldn't have had to sacrifice my own body to escape from it.\n"
"\n"
"This place took everything from me. And it all started with *you.*"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​当初​把​我​留在​原地​，​我​就​不会​伤害​任何人​。​我​的​*​母亲​*​也​能活​下来​。​我​不会​把​灵魂​出卖​给​你们​崇拜​的​那个​恶魔​，​也​不必​为了​逃离​它​的​掌控​而​把​自己​的​身体​搞成​这​副​模样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​夺走​了​我​的​一切​。​而​这​一切​的​始作俑者​就是​*​你​*​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 dang1chu1 ba3 wo3 liu2 zai4 yuan2di4，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2。wo3 de5*mu3qin1*ye3 neng2 huo2 xia4lai5。wo3 bu4hui4 ba3 ling2hun2 chu1mai4 gei3 ni3men5 chong2bai4 de5 na4ge5 e4mo2，ye3 bu4bi4 wei4le5 tao2li2 ta1 de5 zhang3kong4 er2 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 shen1ti3 gao3 cheng2 zhe4 fu4 mu2yang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 duo2zou3 le5 wo3 de5 yi1qie4。er2 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 shi3zuo4yong3zhe3 jiu4shi4*ni3*。"

msgid ""
"If you'll do the job for me, I'll give you the nuyen we were paid for it. I don't need it, you can have it all.\n"
"\n"
"I can live without the money, but someone's got to fix those pumps before I can leave."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​能​帮​我​搞定​这趟​差事​，​我​就​把​我们​应得​的​新円​都​给​你​，​反正​我​用不上​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​生活​不差​这​一笔​钱​，​但​总得​有人​把​水泵​修好​才行​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3 gao3ding4 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4，wo3 jiu4 ba3 wo3men5 ying1de2 de5 xin1 yuan2 dou1 gei3 ni3，fan3zheng4 wo3 yong4 bu4 shang4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 sheng1huo2 bu4cha1 zhe4 yi1 bi3 qian2，dan4 zong3dei3 you3ren2 ba3 shui3beng4 xiu1hao3 cai2 xing2。"

msgid ""
"If you're about to say what I think you are, don't.\n"
"\n"
"I don't wanna know."
msgstr ""
"如果​我​猜​得​没错​的话​……​你​还是​别说​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 cai1 de2 mei2cuo4 de5hua4……ni3 hai2shi5 bie2shuo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"If you're calling me to beg again, you might as well hang up now. \n"
"\n"
"I've been bled by you people for too long now. There are plenty of chop shops and organleggers out there who'd pay *good* money for--"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​还是​来求​我​的话​，​那​你​最好​现在​就​挂断​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​被​你们​这些​人​压榨​太久​了​。​外面​有​一大堆​器官​店​和​器官​贩子​，​他们​愿意​花大​价钱​—​—\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hai2shi5 lai2 qiu2 wo3 de5hua4，na4 ni3 zui4hao3 xian4zai4 jiu4 gua4duan4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 bei4 ni3men5 zhe4xie1 ren2 ya1zha4 tai4 jiu3 le5。wai4mian4 you3 yi1 dai4 dui1 qi4guan1 dian4 he4 qi4guan1 fan4zi5，ta1men5 yuan4yi4 hua1 dai4 jia4qian5 — —"

msgid ""
"If you're going to be like that, I'd just as soon go back to my terminal.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He waves his hand in a dismissive gesture.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Get lost, chief. I've got things to do."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​要​这个​态度​的话​，​那​我​还是​继续​鼓捣​我​的​东西​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挥挥手​示意​送客​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​走​吧​，​头儿​。​我​还有​事要​忙​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 zhe4ge5 tai4du5 de5hua4，na4 wo3 hai2shi5 ji4xu4 gu3dao5 wo3 de5 dong1xi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui1 hui1 shou3 shi4yi4 song4ke4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3 ba1，tou2r5。wo3 hai2you3 shi4 yao4 mang2。"

msgid ""
"If you're gonna put a shell in someone, put it in Stahl. He's a monster, "
"Alex... I know that you can see that."
msgstr ""
"你​真要​一枪​打死​谁​，​就​打死​斯塔尔​。​他​是​个​恶魔​，​亚历克斯​……​我​相信​你​能​看得出来​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1 yao4 yi1 qiang1 da3si3 shei2，jiu4 da3si3 Si1ta3er3。ta1 shi4 ge4 e4mo2，ya4 li4 ke4 si1……wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2。"

msgid "If you're looking for a mindless goon, you came to the wrong $(l.guy)."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​只是​想​找个​无脑​打手​的话​，​那​你​就​找​错​人​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 zhao3 ge4 wu2nao3 da3shou5 de5hua4，na4 ni3 jiu4 zhao3 cuo4 ren2 le5。"

msgid "If you're not a shadowrunner, what are you doing on this crew?"
msgstr ""
"如果说​你​不是​暗影​狂奔​者​，​那​你​怎么​会​加入​这支​队伍​？\n"
"ru2guo3shuo1 ni3 bu4shi4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，na4 ni3 zen3me5 hui4 jia1ru4 zhe4 zhi1 dui4wu3？"

msgid "If you're offering."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​愿意​说​的话​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 shuo1 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"If you're reading this display correctly, the only exit from this room is "
"the holdfast's old servants' entrance, on the western side of the building."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​没​理解​错​屏幕​上​的​内容​，​那么​这个​房间​只​剩下​一个​出口​。​它​是​城堡​原有​的​仆人​入口​，​位于​建筑物​的​西侧​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 mei2 li3jie3 cuo4 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 nei4rong2，na4me5 zhe4ge5 fang2jian1 zhi3 sheng4xia4 yi1ge5 chu1kou3。ta1 shi4 cheng2bao3 yuan2you3 de5 pu2ren2 ru4kou3，wei4yu2 jian4zhu4wu4 de5 xi1ce4。"

msgid ""
"If you're really gathering intel, you need some street smarts. You're still "
"wet behind the ears."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​真要​干​收集​情报​的​活计​，​就​得​在​街头​混得开​。​你​现在​还​太嫩​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1 yao4 gan4 shou1ji2 qing2bao4 de5 huo2ji4，jiu4 de2 zai4 jie1tou2 hun4 de2 kai1。ni3 xian4zai4 hai2 tai4 nen4 le5。"

msgid "If you're selling, I'm buying. Show me your inventory."
msgstr ""
"我​想​买点​东西​。​给​我​看看​你​这​都​有​什么​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 mai3 dian3 dong1xi1。gei3 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 zhe4 dou1 you3 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"If you're sincere about letting me finish my work, then lay down your arms and make yourself comfortable. Audran will be here momentarily to ensure your compliance.\n"
"\n"
"When my work is done, I will allow you to walk away free."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​真​心想​让​我​完成​工作​，​那​就​放下​武器​，​在​原地​好好​待​着​。​奥​德兰​很快​就​会​过来​确保​你们​配合​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我​完成​工作​后​，​我会​让​你们​自由​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1 xin1xiang3 rang4 wo3 wan2cheng2 gong1zuo4，na4 jiu4 fang4xia4 wu3qi4，zai4 yuan2di4 hao3hao3 dai1 zhao2。Ao4de2lan2 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 guo4lai2 que4bao3 ni3men5 pei4he2。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 wan2cheng2 gong1zuo4 hou4，wo3 hui4 rang4 ni3men5 zi4you2 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"If you're still hell bent on meeting with Trithemius, take the stairs up to the third floor. You'll find an abandoned apartment at the end of the hall. \n"
"\n"
"Look for the stylized \"M\" painted on the wall. It looks like two crude lightning bolts facing one another... that's Trithemius' personal sigil."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​仍​执意​要​见​特​里特​米​乌斯​的话​，​就​走​楼梯​去​三楼​，​走廊​尽头​有​一间​废弃​的​公寓​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​墙上​寻找​一个​涂绘​的​“​M​”​形​标志​，​看起来​像是​两道​闪电​彼此​对峙​……​那​就是​特​里特​米​乌斯​的​个人​徽记​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 reng2 zhi2yi4 yao4 jian4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5hua4，jiu4 zou3 lou2ti1 qu4 san1 lou2，zou3lang2 jin4tou2 you3 yi1 jian1 fei4qi4 de5 gong1yu4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 qiang2 shang4 xun2zhao3 yi1ge5 tu2 hui4 de5“M” xing2 biao1zhi4，kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 liang3 dao4 shan3dian4 bi3ci3 dui4zhi4……na4 jiu4shi4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 ge4ren2 hui1ji4。"

msgid ""
"If you're watching this, then I guess that they caught up to me.\n"
"\n"
"THEY WILL BE AFTER YOU TOO NOW."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​在​看​的话​，​就​说明​我​已经​被​抓住​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​现在​也​会​盯上​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 kan4 de5hua4，jiu4 shuo1ming2 wo3 yi3jing1 bei4 zhua1zhu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 xian4zai4 ye3 hui4 ding1 shang4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "If you've got the cash, ol' Zaak's got the flash."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​有​现金​，​老​扎克​就​有​好​货​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 you3 xian4jin1，lao3 Zha1ke4 jiu4 you3 hao3 huo4。"

msgid "If your arrangement works for you, I won't judge you for it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​的​生活​方式​对​你​来说​没​问题​，​我​不会​因此​而​评判​你​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 de5 sheng1huo2 fang1shi4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 mei2 wen4ti2，wo3 bu4hui4 yin1ci3 er2 ping2pan4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"If your boss was behind this whole thing, then he really backed the wrong "
"horse. Something tells me he didn't want APEX in control of Panacea."
msgstr ""
"如果​整件事​都​是​你​的​老板​在​操盘​，​那​他​可押​错宝​了​。​他​应该​不想​让​APEX​掌管​万能​药​。\n"
"ru2guo3 zheng3 jian4 shi4 dou1 shi4 ni3 de5 lao3ban3 zai4 cao1pan2，na4 ta1 ke3 ya1 cuo4 bao3 le5。ta1 ying1gai1 bu4xiang3 rang4 APEX zhang3guan3 wan4neng2 yao4。"

msgid ""
"If your boss was behind this whole thing, then he really backed the wrong "
"horse. Something tells me he didn't want Feuerschwinge left imprisoned under"
" a hundred tons of concrete."
msgstr ""
"如果​整件事​都​是​你​的​老板​在​操盘​，​那​他​可押​错宝​了​。​他​应该​不想​让​火翼​被​关押​在​几百吨​混凝土​之下​。\n"
"ru2guo3 zheng3 jian4 shi4 dou1 shi4 ni3 de5 lao3ban3 zai4 cao1pan2，na4 ta1 ke3 ya1 cuo4 bao3 le5。ta1 ying1gai1 bu4xiang3 rang4 Huo3yi4 bei4 guan1ya1 zai4 ji1 bai3 dun1 hun4ning2tu3 zhi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"If your boss was behind this whole thing, then he really backed the wrong "
"horse. Something tells me that he didn't want the Firewing dead."
msgstr ""
"如果​整件事​都​是​你​的​老板​在​操盘​，​那​他​可押​错宝​了​。​他​应该​不想​让​火翼​死​。\n"
"ru2guo3 zheng3 jian4 shi4 dou1 shi4 ni3 de5 lao3ban3 zai4 cao1pan2，na4 ta1 ke3 ya1 cuo4 bao3 le5。ta1 ying1gai1 bu4xiang3 rang4 Huo3yi4 si3。"

msgid ""
"If your brother was such a terrible father, you shouldn't have left your "
"nephew with him in the first place. This is on you, not me."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​哥哥​是​个​如此​糟糕​的​父亲​，​你​当初​就​不该​把​侄子​留在​他​身边​。​这​事儿​是​你​自己​的​责任​，​跟​我​没关系​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 ge1ge5 shi4 ge4 ru2ci3 zao1gao1 de5 fu4qin1，ni3 dang1chu1 jiu4 bu4gai1 ba3 zhi2zi5 liu2 zai4 ta1 shen1bian1。zhe4 shi4r5 shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 ze2ren4，gen1 wo3 mei2guan1xi5。"

msgid ""
"If your merchandise has been sitting in this building for two years, why "
"didn't you approach Monika about this?"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​的​货​在​这栋​楼里​放​了​两年​，​你​为什么​不​找​莫妮卡​？\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 de5 huo4 zai4 zhe4 dong4 lou2 li3 fang4 le5 liang3 nian2，ni3 wei4shen2me5 bu4 zhao3 Mo4ni1ka3？"

msgid ""
"If you’d rather $(l.he) take the lead, I’ll abide by that. \n"
"\n"
"But I want to hear each of you say it."
msgstr ""
"如果​你们​宁愿​让​$(l.he)​当​队长​，​我​也​可以​服从安排​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​要​听​你们​亲口​承认​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3men5 ning4yuan4 rang4 $(l.he) dang1 dui4zhang3，wo3 ye3 ke3yi3 fu2 cong2 an1 pai2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 yao4 ting1 ni3men5 qin1kou3 cheng2ren4。"

msgid ""
"If you’re still alive when I get back, I’ll put a bullet in you or "
"something."
msgstr ""
"如果​等​我​回来​的​时候​，​你​还​没​死​的话​，​我​就​赏​你​一颗​子弹​。\n"
"ru2guo3 deng3 wo3 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 hai2 mei2 si3 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 shang3 ni3 yi1 ke1 zi3dan4。"

msgid "If you’ve got nothing to hide, why don't you let me in?"
msgstr ""
"如果​你​没什么​好​隐瞒​的​，​那​为什么​不让​我​进去​？\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 mei2shen2me5 hao3 yin3man2 de5，na4 wei4shen2me5 bu4 rang4 wo3 jin4qu4？"

msgid ""
"Imagine it, friend. Dozens of individual minds, all tied together into a single, cohesive whole. Sharing in a collective subconscious, connected through the Hub.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Parson raises his hands in supplication.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Join with us, and feel your limitations fall away."
msgstr ""
"想象​一下​，​朋友​。​数十个​独立​的​思维​，​全都​紧密​地​联结​成​统一​的​整体​，​共享​着​集体​潜意识​，​通过​中枢​相互连接​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​帕森​双手​合十​，​虔诚地​祈求​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​加入​我们​，​感受​你​身上​的​局限​逐渐​消融​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3xiang4 yi1xia4，peng2you5。shu3 shi2 ge4 du2li4 de5 si1wei2，quan2dou1 jin3mi4 de5 lian2jie2 cheng2 tong3yi1 de5 zheng3ti3，gong4xiang3 zhao2 ji2ti3 qian2yi4shi2，tong1guo4 zhong1shu1 xiang1 hu4 lian2 jie1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pa4 sen1 shuang1shou3 he2shi2，qian2 cheng2 de5 qi2qiu2 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jia1ru4 wo3men5，gan3shou4 ni3 shen1shang5 de5 ju2xian4 zhu2jian4 xiao1rong2。"

msgid ""
"Imbalances targets, making them easier to hit on subsequent attacks by 6%."
msgstr ""
"使​目标​失衡​，​使​其​在​后续​攻击​中​更​容易​被​击中​，​命中率​提升​6​%​。\n"
"shi3 mu4biao1 shi1heng2，shi3 qi2 zai4 hou4xu4 gong1ji1 zhong4 geng1 rong2yi4 bei4 ji1zhong4，ming4zhong4lu:4 ti2sheng1 6%。"

msgid ""
"Immediately. I don't know why... maybe she felt threatened by my friendship with Dieter, back before he ate that bullet.\n"
"\n"
"Or maybe she was just jealous of my rugged good looks. Who the hell knows?"
msgstr ""
"几乎​是​第一​时间​的​事​。​我​不​知道​为什么​……​也许​她​觉得​迪特尔​生前​和​我​之间​的​友谊​威胁​到​她​了​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​她​只是​嫉妒​我​这​副​好​皮囊​。​谁​知道​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"ji1hu1 shi4 di4yi1 shi2jian1 de5 shi4。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 wei4shen2me5……ye3xu3 ta1 jue2de5 di2 te4 er3 sheng1qian2 he4 wo3 zhi1jian1 de5 you3yi4 wei1xie2 dao4 ta1 le5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3 ta1 zhi3shi4 ji2du4 wo3 zhe4 fu4 hao3 pi2nang2。shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？"

msgid "Immune!"
msgstr ""
"免疫​！\n"
"mian3yi4！"

msgid "Import Character"
msgstr ""
"导入​角色\n"
"dao3ru4 jue2se4"

msgid "Import Items"
msgstr ""
"导入​物品\n"
"dao3ru4 wu4pin3"

msgid "Impressive setup. Let's do some business."
msgstr ""
"挺​厉害​啊​。​我们​来谈​生意​吧​。\n"
"ting3 li4hai5 a1。wo3men5 lai2 tan2 sheng1yi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Impressive work, $(l.name). You've made it into the facility completely undetected... I'm not seeing any comm chatter about a security breach.\n"
"\n"
"In addition, your sabotage of the Azzies' power grid has thrown the entire facility into disarray. Even if you are discovered, I would expect any response to be disorganized at best."
msgstr ""
"干​的​很​好​，​$(l.name)​。​你​在​完全​未​被​发觉​的​情况​下​潜入​了​设施​内部​……​我​连​一丝​安保​警报​的​通讯​声​都​没​听到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此外​，​你​对​阿兹佬​电网​的​破坏​已​让​整个​设施​陷入​混乱​。​即便​你​暴露​行踪​，​我​预计​对方​应对​起来​也​会​手忙脚乱​。\n"
"\n"
"gan4 de5 hen3 hao3，$(l.name)。ni3 zai4 wan2quan2 wei4 bei4 fa1jue2 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 qian2ru4 le5 she4shi1 nei4bu4……wo3 lian2 yi1 si1 an1bao3 jing3bao4 de5 tong1xun4 sheng1 dou1 mei2 ting1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"ci3wai4，ni3 dui4 e1 zi1 lao3 dian4wang3 de5 po4huai4 yi3 rang4 zheng3ge4 she4shi1 xian4ru4 hun4luan4。ji2bian4 ni3 bao4lu4 xing2zong1，wo3 yu4ji4 dui4fang1 ying4dui4 qi3lai5 ye3 hui4 shou3mang2jiao3luan4。"

msgid "Impressive. Heimerich wasn't convinced that you could pull it off."
msgstr ""
"不赖​嘛​。​海​默里​希​还​不​相信​你​能​做到​呢​。\n"
"bu4lai4 ma5。Hai3mo4 li3 xi1 hai2 bu4 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4 ni2。"

msgid "Impressive. How did you manage that?"
msgstr ""
"厉害​啊​。​你​是​怎么​做到​的​？\n"
"li4hai5 a1。ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zuo4dao4 de5？"

msgid ""
"In 2012, we took down Feuerschwinge with an experimental weapon. This device... suffice it to say, I couldn't fully predict how it would affect her.\n"
"\n"
"In 2036, I led a search team into the SOX. I had to know what really happened to the creature that I had \"slain.\" "
msgstr ""
"2012​年​，​我们​用​一种​实验性​武器​击败​了​火翼​。​这种​装置​……​可以​说​，​我​无法​完全​预料​它会​对​她​产生​怎样​的​影响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​2036​年​，​我​带领​一支​搜寻​队​进入​萨洛​卢区​。​我​必须​弄清楚​那​只​我​曾​“​击杀​”​的​生物​究竟​发生​了​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"2012 nian2，wo3men5 yong4 yi1zhong3 shi2 yan4 xing4 wu3qi4 ji1bai4 le5 Huo3yi4。zhe4zhong3 zhuang1zhi4……ke3yi3 shuo1，wo3 wu2fa3 wan2quan2 yu4liao4 ta1 hui4 dui4 ta1 chan3sheng1 zen3yang4 de5 ying3xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"2036 nian2，wo3 dai4ling3 yi1 zhi1 sou1xun2 dui4 jin4ru4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1。wo3 bi4xu1 long4 qing1 chu3 na4 zhi3 wo3 ceng2“ji1sha1” de5 sheng1wu4 jiu1jing4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"In a half an hour.\n"
"\n"
"If you're on the train back to the Kreuzbasar now, you should make it here with time to spare."
msgstr ""
"半小时​之后​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然​你​已经​在​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​列车​上​，​时间​应该​绰绰有余​。\n"
"\n"
"ban4xiao3shi2 zhi1hou4。\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 yi3jing1 zai4 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lie4che1 shang4，shi2jian1 ying1gai1 chuo4chuo4you3yu2。"

msgid ""
"In a place like that, everyone's related somehow.\n"
"\n"
"So, yes?"
msgstr ""
"在​那种​地方​，​大家​都​或多或少​有​亲戚关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​算是​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4zhong3 di4fang1，da4jia1 dou1 huo4duo1huo4shao3 you3 qin1 qi1 guan1 xi4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 suan4shi4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"In a reflexive panic, your third eye slams shut. The hidden world of the "
"astral plane disappears from view, but an afterimage of what you saw "
"remains, twisting in your mind."
msgstr ""
"在​应激​式​的​恐慌​中​，​你​的​天眼​猛然​闭合​。​隐秘​的​星界​从​视野​中​消失​，​但​所见​景象​的​残影​仍​盘踞​你​的​脑海​，​不断​扭曲​变形​。\n"
"zai4 ying4ji1 shi4 de5 kong3huang1 zhong4，ni3 de5 tian1yan3 meng3ran2 bi4he2。yin3mi4 de5 xing1 jie4 cong2 shi4ye3 zhong4 xiao1shi1，dan4 suo3jian4 jing3xiang4 de5 can2ying3 reng2 pan2ju4 ni3 de5 nao3hai3，bu4duan4 niu3qu1 bian4xing2。"

msgid ""
"In a single, smooth motion, Eiger draws her knife from its sheath and buries it in the Engineer's throat.\n"
"\n"
"He lets out a startled gurgling sound. The noise carries for a long time."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔以​流畅​的​动作​将​匕首​从​刀鞘​中​抽出​，​深深​刺入​工程师​的​喉咙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​发出​一声​惊慌​的​咕噜​声​。​这​声音​持续​了​很​长时间​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 yi3 liu2chang4 de5 dong4zuo4 jiang1 bi3shou3 cong2 dao1qiao4 zhong4 chou1chu1，shen1shen1 ci1 ru4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 hou2long2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 jing1huang1 de5 gu1lu5 sheng1。zhe4 sheng1yin1 chi2xu4 le5 hen3 zhang3 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"In a single, smooth motion, he pulls a knife from his belt and draws it along his own forearm.\n"
"\n"
"The blade leaves a stripe of bright red blood in its wake."
msgstr ""
"他​从​腰带​上​抽出​一把​匕首​，​沿着​自己​的​前臂​行云流水​般划​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​刀刃​划过​之​处​，​留下​鲜红​的​血痕​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 cong2 yao1dai4 shang4 chou1chu1 yi1 ba3 bi3shou3，yan2zhe5 zi4ji3 de5 qian2bi4 xing2yun2liu2shui3 ban1 hua2 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"dao1ren4 hua2guo4 zhi1 chu3，liu2xia4 xian1hong2 de5 xie3 hen2。"

msgid ""
"In a word, yes. \n"
"\n"
"I want you to break into the lab, find my merchandise, and bring it to me. If you can, figure out why the building was shut down in the first place and what happened to the researchers; if not, that's fine, too. But I need that tech."
msgstr ""
"简单​来说​，​是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​你​闯进​实验室​，​找到​我​的​商品​，​然后​把​它​带给​我​。​如果​可以​的话​，​搞清楚​为什么​这栋​楼会​被​关闭​，​研发​人员​发生​了​什么​事​；​如果​不行​，​也​没关系​。​但​我​需要​那​项​技术​。\n"
"\n"
"jian3dan1 lai2 shuo1，shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ni3 chuang3jin4 shi2yan4shi4，zhao3dao4 wo3 de5 shang1pin3，ran2hou4 ba3 ta1 dai4gei3 wo3。ru2guo3 ke3yi3 de5hua4，gao3 qing1 chu3 wei4shen2me5 zhe4 dong4 lou2 hui4 bei4 guan1bi4，yan2fa1 ren2yuan2 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4 ； ru2guo3 bu4xing2，ye3 mei2guan1xi5。dan4 wo3 xu1yao4 na4 xiang4 ji4shu4。"

msgid ""
"In addition to your team, your fixer has access to a small network of mercenaries in the Berlin area. These runners appear below your core team on the runner selection screen and can be hired on a mission-to-mission basis.\n"
"\n"
"As you complete missions, both your team members and the available mercenaries will periodically gain access to new equipment and abilities. Any new items, spells, weapons, or weapon abilities that a runner gains will automatically be available for use the next time you take them on a mission."
msgstr ""
"除了​你​的​团队​之外​，​你​的​中间人​还​能​调动​柏林​地区​的​小型​雇佣兵​网络​。​这些​狂奔​者​会​在​选择​狂奔​者​界面​中​显示​在​你​的​核心​团队​下方​，​可​按​任务​需求​相应​雇佣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​你​逐渐​完成​更​多任务​，​你​的​队员​和​可用​佣兵​都​会​定期​获得​新​装备​与​技能​。​狂奔​者​获得​新​物品​、​法术​、​武器​或​武器​技能​后​，​即可​在​下次​执行​任务​时​进行​配备​。\n"
"\n"
"chu2le5 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 zhi1wai4，ni3 de5 zhong1jian1ren2 hai2 neng2 diao4dong4 bo2lin2 di4qu1 de5 xiao3xing2 gu4yong1bing1 wang3luo4。zhe4xie1 kuang2Ben1zhe3 hui4 zai4 xuan3ze2 kuang2Ben1zhe3 jie4mian4 zhong4 xian3shi4 zai4 ni3 de5 he2xin1 tuan2dui4 xia4fang1，ke3 an4 ren4wu5 xu1qiu2 xiang1ying4 gu4yong1。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ni3 zhu2jian4 wan2cheng2 geng1 duo1 ren4 wu4，ni3 de5 dui4yuan2 he4 ke3 yong4 yong1bing1 dou1 hui4 ding4qi1 huo4de2 xin1 zhuang1bei4 yu4 ji4neng2。kuang2Ben1zhe3 huo4de2 xin1 wu4pin3、fa3shu4、wu3qi4 huo4 wu3qi4 ji4neng2 hou4，ji2ke3 zai4 xia4ci4 zhi2xing2 ren4wu5 shi2 jin4xing2 pei4bei4。"

msgid ""
"In all fairness, by the time you told me that, it was already too late."
msgstr ""
"老实​说​，​你​当时​说出​那句话​的​时候​已经​太迟​了​。\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1，ni3 dang1shi2 shuo1chu1 na4 ju4 hua4 de5 shi2hou5 yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"In all honesty, I think that this will be good for you. You needed a lesson "
"in humility."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​我​觉得​这样​是​为​你好​。​你​需要​学会​谦逊​。\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 jue2de5 zhe4yang4 shi4 wei2 ni3hao3。ni3 xu1yao4 xue2hui4 qian1xun4。"

msgid "In all of that time, nobody ever caught you?"
msgstr ""
"那么​长​的​时间​里​，​你们​从来​没​被​人​抓​到​过​吗​？\n"
"na4me5 zhang3 de5 shi2jian1 li3，ni3men5 cong2lai2 mei2 bei4 ren2 zhua1 dao4 guo4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"In all seriousness, $(l.name)... I’m sorry that I put you in that position.\n"
"\n"
"I shouldn’t have, and I acknowledge that."
msgstr ""
"说真的​，​$(l.name)​……​我​很​抱歉​让​你​陷入​那种​处境​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​承认​我​不该​那样​做​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1zhen1de5，$(l.name)……wo3 hen3 bao4qian4 rang4 ni3 xian4ru4 na4zhong3 chu3jing4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cheng2ren4 wo3 bu4gai1 na4yang4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"In all seriousness, Blitz, this is your own fault. You were gonna do this "
"whether I encouraged you to or not."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​我​认真​地说​，​这​都​是​你​自己​的​错​。​无论​我​是否​鼓励​你​，​你​都​会​去​做​的​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，wo3 ren4zhen1 de5 shuo1，zhe4 dou1 shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 cuo4。wu2lun4 wo3 shi4fou3 gu3li4 ni3，ni3 dou1 hui4 qu4 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"In all seriousness, I know that his first impulse must have been to come riding in to my rescue, despite the fact that I didn't want him to.\n"
"\n"
"The fact that he was willing to listen to me and stay away... well, it means a lot."
msgstr ""
"老实​说​，​我​知道​他​的​第一​反应​肯定​是​来​帮​我​，​尽管​我​不​希望​他​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​愿意​听从​我​的​意见​选择​回避​……​这​对​我​来说​还是​很​有​意义​的​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 de5 di4yi1 fan3ying4 ken3ding4 shi4 lai2 bang1 wo3，jin3guan3 wo3 bu4 xi1wang4 ta1 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yuan4yi4 ting1cong2 wo3 de5 yi4jian4 xuan3ze2 hui2bi4……zhe4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 hai2shi5 hen3 you3 yi4yi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"In all seriousness, I'm charging you what the job is worth. Do you *know* how much work it takes to find a digital *ghost?*\n"
"\n"
"There's going to be wetwork. Breaking into government archives. Hell, I might even have to commission an expedition into the SOX.\n"
"\n"
"This is a serious undertaking, friend."
msgstr ""
"说真的​，​我​只是​为​这份​差事​开了个​合适​的​价码​。​你​又​是否​知道​，​追查​某个​赛博​*​幽灵​*​要​耗费​多少​精力​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​可是​一档子​湿​活儿​。​得​闯进​政府​档案库​。​说不定​还​得​雇人​深入​萨洛​卢区​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​件​正经事儿​，​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1zhen1de5，wo3 zhi3shi4 wei2 zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4 kai1 le5 ge4 he2shi4 de5 jia4ma3。ni3 you4 shi4fou3 zhi1dao4，zhui1cha2 mou3 ge4 sai4bo2*you1ling2*yao4 hao4fei4 duo1shao3 jing1li4？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ke3shi4 yi1 dang4 zi3 shi1 huo2r5。de2 chuang3jin4 zheng4fu3 dang4 an4 ku4。shuo1bu5ding4 hai2 de2 gu4 ren2 shen1ru4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 jian4 zheng1 jing1 shi4 er2，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"In an instant, you size up the scene playing out in front of you.\n"
"\n"
"A young elf, dressed in the same shabby-chic clothes that the cafe kids were. Danni. Cornered, with no place to run.\n"
"\n"
"A pair of Aztechnology security drones closing in for the kill."
msgstr ""
"转瞬之间​，​你​心里​便​对​眼前​上演​的​一幕​有​了​数​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一位​年轻​的​精灵​，​穿着​和​咖啡馆​里​那些​年轻人​同样​破旧​却​别致​的​衣服​。​那​一定​就是​丹妮​。​她​被​逼入​绝境​，​无处可逃​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​两架​阿兹特​科技​的​安保​无人机​正​逼近​，​准备​发起​致命​一击​。\n"
"\n"
"zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1，ni3 xin1li5 bian4 dui4 yan3qian2 shang4yan3 de5 yi1 mu4 you3 le5 shu3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wei4 nian2qing1 de5 jing1ling2，chuan1zhuo2 he4 ka1fei1guan3 li3 na4xie1 nian2qing1ren2 tong2yang4 po4jiu4 que4 bie2zhi4 de5 yi1fu5。na4 yi1ding4 jiu4shi4 dan1 ni1。ta1 bei4 bi1 ru4 jue2jing4，wu2 chu3 ke3 tao2。\n"
"\n"
"liang3 jia4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 an1bao3 wu2ren2ji1 zheng1 bi1jin4，zhun3bei4 fa1qi3 zhi4ming4 yi1 ji1。"

msgid ""
"In any case, $(l.name), thank you for helping me. Please do not attempt to contact me again; as far as the world - and my former employers - are concerned, I am buried under a ton of rubble. It is best that I remain that way.\n"
"\n"
"Goodbye,\n"
"Ivonne Jimenez, aka \"Frau Müller\""
msgstr ""
"无论如何​，​$(l.name)​，​感谢​你​的​帮助​。​请​不必​再​试图​联系​我​；​对​这个​世界​，​尤其​是​我​的​前​雇主​们​而言​，​就​当​我​已​被​埋​在​成吨​的​废墟​之下​吧​。​维持现状​对​所有人​都​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​永别​，​\n"
"​伊冯​·​希门尼斯​，​又名​“​穆勒​女士​”\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，$(l.name)，gan3xie4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。qing3 bu4bi4 zai4 shi4tu2 lian2xi4 wo3 ； dui4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4，you2qi2 shi4 wo3 de5 qian2 gu4zhu3 men5 er2yan2，jiu4 dang1 wo3 yi3 bei4 mai2 zai4 cheng2 dun1 de5 fei4xu1 zhi1xia4 ba1。wei2 chi2 xian4 zhuang4 dui4 suo3you3ren2 dou1 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"yong3bie2，\n"
"yi1 ping2 · xi1 men2 ni2 si1，you4ming2“mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4”"

msgid ""
"In any case, I'm sure that you'll do a fine job in the role. If you need anything, talk to Paul... he's a good man, and he knows how important it is to me that you take my place.\n"
"\n"
"One last thing, ace. Eiger might cause you some problems. In fact, I think it's a fair bet that she already has. Just remember: she brings something to this team that nobody else does. You'll want her on your side."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​相信​你​能​胜任​这份​工作​。​如果​有​什么​需要​，​可以​找​保罗​谈谈​……​他​是​个​可靠​的​人​，​也​深知​你​接替​我​的​职位​对​我​有​多​重要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​有件事​，​王牌​。​艾格尔​可能​会​给​你​惹麻烦​。​实际上​，​我敢​说​她​已经​开始​犯事​了​。​但​记住​：​她​的​团队​价值​独一无二​，​和​她​搞好关系​准​没错​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 sheng4ren4 zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4。ru2guo3 you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4，ke3yi3 zhao3 bao3luo2 tan2tan2……ta1 shi4 ge4 ke3kao4 de5 ren2，ye3 shen1zhi1 ni3 jie1ti4 wo3 de5 zhi2wei4 dui4 wo3 you3 duo1 zhong4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 you3 jian4 shi4，wang2pai2。Ai4ge2er3 ke3neng2 hui4 gei3 ni3 re3ma2fan5。shi2ji4shang4，wo3 gan3 shuo1 ta1 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 fan4shi4 le5。dan4 ji4zhu5：ta1 de5 tuan2dui4 jia4zhi2 du2yi1wu2er4，he4 ta1 gao3 hao3 guan1 xi4 zhun3 mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"In any case, I've got some errands to run - come over sometime and we can chat over hookah or something, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before turning her focus to a comm at her wrist..{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"总之​，​现在​我​得​去​办点​事​—​—​有空​过来​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转向​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，xian4zai4 wo3 de2 qu4 ban4 dian3 shi4——you3kong4 guo4lai2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"In any case, I've got some errands to run - come over sometime and we can chat over hookah or something, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before turning her focus to a comm at her wrist.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"总之​，​现在​我​得​去​办点​事​—​—​有空​过来​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转向​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，xian4zai4 wo3 de2 qu4 ban4 dian3 shi4——you3kong4 guo4lai2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"In any event, our shelter has some basic needs that desperately need to be filled. The walls of the shelter are not insulated, and new blankets would go a long way toward keeping our guests healthy and comfortable. Ideally, we'd like to purchase some space heaters as well.\n"
"\n"
"With 250 nuyen, we could make the purchase. Whatever you could spare would be most appreciated."
msgstr ""
"无论如何​，​我们​避难所​的​一些​基本​需求​亟待​满足​。​墙壁​没有​隔热材料​，​另外​购置​新​毯子​将​大大​有助于​保持​我们​的​客人​健康​舒适​。​理想​情况​下​，​我们​还​希望​购买​一些​取暖器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​250​新円​的话​，​我们​就​能​完成​购买​。​无论​你​能​拿出​多少​，​我们​都​将​不胜感激​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3men5 bi4nan4suo3 de5 yi1xie1 ji1ben3 xu1qiu2 ji2dai4 man3zu2。qiang2bi4 mei2you3 ge2 re4 cai2 liao4，ling4wai4 gou4zhi4 xin1 tan3zi5 jiang1 da4da4 you3zhu4yu2 bao3chi2 wo3men5 de5 ke4ren2 jian4kang1 shu1shi4。li3xiang3 qing2kuang4 xia4，wo3men5 hai2 xi1wang4 gou4mai3 yi1xie1 qu3 nuan3 qi4。\n"
"\n"
"you3 250 xin1 yuan2 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 wan2cheng2 gou4mai3。wu2lun4 ni3 neng2 na2chu1 duo1shao3，wo3men5 dou1 jiang1 bu4 sheng4 gan3 ji1。"

msgid ""
"In any event, our shelter has some basic needs that desperately need to be filled. The walls of the shelter are not insulated, and new blankets would go a long way toward keeping our guests healthy and comfortable. Ideally, we'd like to purchase some space heaters as well.\n"
"\n"
"With ¥250, we could make the purchase. Of course, I do not expect you - a relative stranger to our kiez - to contribute that much. Whatever you could spare would be most appreciated."
msgstr ""
"无论如何​，​我们​避难所​的​一些​基本​需求​亟待​满足​。​墙壁​没有​隔热材料​，​另外​购置​新​毯子​将​大大​有助于​保持​我们​的​客人​健康​舒适​。​理想​情况​下​，​我们​还​希望​购买​一些​取暖器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​250​新円​的话​，​我们​就​能​完成​购买​。​当然​，​我​不会​苛求​一位​陌生人​能够​提供​这么​多​。​无论​你​能​拿出​多少​，​我们​都​将​不胜感激​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3men5 bi4nan4suo3 de5 yi1xie1 ji1ben3 xu1qiu2 ji2dai4 man3zu2。qiang2bi4 mei2you3 ge2 re4 cai2 liao4，ling4wai4 gou4zhi4 xin1 tan3zi5 jiang1 da4da4 you3zhu4yu2 bao3chi2 wo3men5 de5 ke4ren2 jian4kang1 shu1shi4。li3xiang3 qing2kuang4 xia4，wo3men5 hai2 xi1wang4 gou4mai3 yi1xie1 qu3 nuan3 qi4。\n"
"\n"
"you3 250 xin1 yuan2 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 wan2cheng2 gou4mai3。dang1ran2，wo3 bu4hui4 ke1qiu2 yi1 wei4 mo4sheng1ren2 neng2gou4 ti2gong1 zhe4me5 duo1。wu2lun4 ni3 neng2 na2chu1 duo1shao3，wo3men5 dou1 jiang1 bu4 sheng4 gan3 ji1。"

msgid "In debt? To who?"
msgstr ""
"欠​谁​的​债​？\n"
"qian4 shei2 de5 zhai4？"

msgid ""
"In either case, I should make an effort to find her. I mean, she's playing a dangerous game, whether she's with S-K *or* the Schockwellenreiter.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe she's gotten herself in too deep... she might need help! I mean, why else would she send me such a cryptic message?"
msgstr ""
"无论如何​，​我​都​应该​想​办法​找到​她​。​不管​她​的​盟友​是​赛德​-​克虏伯​*​还是​*​电波​骑士​，​这​都​是​个​危险​的​游戏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​她​已经​无法​抽身​了​……​她​可能​需要​帮助​！​否则​她​为什么​要​给​我​发送​加密​消息​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3 dou1 ying1gai1 xiang3 ban4fa3 zhao3dao4 ta1。bu4guan3 ta1 de5 meng2you3 shi4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2*hai2shi5*dian4Bo1qi2shi4，zhe4 dou1 shi4 ge4 wei1xian3 de5 you2xi4。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1 yi3jing1 wu2fa3 chou1shen1 le5……ta1 ke3neng2 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4！fou3ze2 ta1 wei4shen2me5 yao4 gei3 wo3 fa1song4 jia1mi4 xiao1xi5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"In essence, all of the cultists here are addicted this place. That makes "
"them a threat, yes... but it also makes them victims."
msgstr ""
"从​本质​上​说​，​这里​的​教徒​全都​沉迷于​此地​。​这使​他们​成为​威胁​，​没错​……​但​也​使​他们​沦为​受害者​。\n"
"cong2 ben3zhi4 shang4 shuo1，zhe4li3 de5 jiao4tu2 quan2dou1 chen2 mi2 yu2 ci3di4。zhe4 shi3 ta1men5 cheng2wei2 wei1xie2，mei2cuo4……dan4 ye3 shi3 ta1men5 lun2wei2 shou4hai4zhe3。"

msgid ""
"In essence, all of the street kids here are addicted this place. That makes "
"them a threat, yes... but it also makes them victims."
msgstr ""
"从​本质​上​说​，​这里​的​街头​少年​全都​沉迷于​此地​。​这使​他们​成为​威胁​，​没错​……​但​也​使​他们​沦为​受害者​。\n"
"cong2 ben3zhi4 shang4 shuo1，zhe4li3 de5 jie1tou2 shao4nian2 quan2dou1 chen2 mi2 yu2 ci3di4。zhe4 shi3 ta1men5 cheng2wei2 wei1xie2，mei2cuo4……dan4 ye3 shi3 ta1men5 lun2wei2 shou4hai4zhe3。"

msgid ""
"In exchange, Ullrich removed the elevator control chip. A petty move, "
"presumably to prevent us from accessing that same armory after he retreated."
msgstr ""
"作为​交换​，​乌尔里​希移​除了​电梯​的​控制​芯片​。​他​这点​小动作​想必​也​是​为了​防止​我们​在​其​撤退​后​进入​同一​武器库​。\n"
"zuo4wei2 jiao1huan4，wu1 er3 li3 xi1 yi2 chu2le5 dian4ti1 de5 kong4zhi4 xin1pian4。ta1 zhe4 dian3 xiao3dong4zuo4 xiang3bi4 ye3 shi4 wei4le5 fang2zhi3 wo3men5 zai4 qi2 che4tui4 hou4 jin4ru4 tong2yi1 wu3 qi4 ku4。"

msgid ""
"In exchange, Ullrich removed the elevator control chip. A petty move, presumably to prevent us from accessing that same armory after he retreated.\n"
"\n"
"...As if we'd have need for such mundane weapons."
msgstr ""
"作为​交换​，​乌尔里​希移​除了​电梯​的​控制​芯片​。​他​这点​小动作​想必​也​是​为了​防止​我们​在​其​撤退​后​进入​同一​武器库​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​好像​我们​会​需要​这些​凡俗​武器​似的​。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 jiao1huan4，wu1 er3 li3 xi1 yi2 chu2le5 dian4ti1 de5 kong4zhi4 xin1pian4。ta1 zhe4 dian3 xiao3dong4zuo4 xiang3bi4 ye3 shi4 wei4le5 fang2zhi3 wo3men5 zai4 qi2 che4tui4 hou4 jin4ru4 tong2yi1 wu3 qi4 ku4。\n"
"\n"
"……hao3xiang4 wo3men5 hui4 xu1yao4 zhe4xie1 fan2su2 wu3qi4 shi4de5。"

msgid ""
"In fact, I think that this was an incredible stroke of luck. I finally have some of my magic back.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A smile slides across her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I feel *fantastic.*"
msgstr ""
"实际上​，​我​认为​这是​天大​的​好运​，​我​总算​找回​了​一些​魔法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​脸上​掠过​一抹​笑意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​感觉​*​棒极了​*​。\n"
"\n"
"shi2ji4shang4，wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4 shi4 tian1da4 de5 hao3yun4，wo3 zong3suan4 zhao3hui2 le5 yi1xie1 mo2fa3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 lu:e4guo4 yi1 ma1 xiao4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2*bang4ji2le5*。"

msgid ""
"In for a penny, in for a pound, $(l.name). I am confident that Alice will provide us with useful information. With the Firewing hunting us, I'd go so far as to say that we've all staked our lives on that presumption.\n"
"\n"
"When we have Vauclair's location in hand, we need to be ready to strike. None of your other obligations matter compared to that."
msgstr ""
"开弓​没有​回头​箭​，​$(l.name)​。​我​相信​爱丽丝​能为​我们​提供​有用​的​情报​。​既然​火翼​正在​追杀​我们​，​我​甚至​可以​说​，​我们​此举​是​不​成功​便成仁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一旦​掌握​沃​克莱尔​的​下落​，​我们​必须​随时​准备​出击​。​你​的​其他​事务​都​不再​重要​。\n"
"\n"
"kai1gong1 mei2you3 hui2tou2 jian4，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang1xin4 ai4li4si1 neng2 wei2 wo3men5 ti2gong1 you3yong4 de5 qing2bao4。ji4ran2 Huo3yi4 zheng4zai4 zhui1sha1 wo3men5，wo3 shen4zhi4 ke3yi3 shuo1，wo3men5 ci3 ju3 shi4 bu4 cheng2gong1 bian4 cheng2 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dan4 zhang3wo4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 xia4luo4，wo3men5 bi4xu1 sui2shi2 zhun3bei4 chu1ji1。ni3 de5 qi2ta1 shi4wu4 dou1 bu4zai4 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"In front of them, lying dead in the hallway, is Franz. His clothes are "
"bloodied and torn. What looks like an enormous bite mark has been excavated "
"from his stomach, spilling his intestines onto the filthy hallway floor."
msgstr ""
"弗朗兹​的​尸体​躺​在​他们​面前​的​走廊​上​。​他​的​衣服​沾满​鲜血​，​破烂不堪​，​腹部​如同​被​猛兽​撕咬​过般​，​被​撕开​一道​巨大​的​伤口​，​肠子​散落​在​污秽​的​走廊​地板​上​。\n"
"fu2 lang3 zi1 de5 shi1ti3 tang3 zai4 ta1men5 mian4qian2 de5 zou3lang2 shang4。ta1 de5 yi1fu5 zhan1man3 xian1xue4，po4 lan4 bu4 kan1，fu4bu4 ru2tong2 bei4 meng3shou4 si1yao3 guo4 ban1，bei4 si1 kai1 yi1dao4 ju4da4 de5 shang1kou3，chang2zi5 san3luo4 zai4 wu1hui4 de5 zou3lang2 di4ban3 shang4。"

msgid ""
"In layman's terms, you can use this thing to mark a target. There's "
"cyberware that does the same thing, and deckers do it all the time. But this"
" is the first time I've seen this kind of functionality on a rifle."
msgstr ""
"通俗​来说​，​这​玩意儿​能​用来​标记​目标​。​有些​赛博​改造​也​能​实现​同样​的​功能​，​对​碟​客​来说​更是​家常便饭​。​但​步枪​上​出现​这种​功能​，​我​还是​头一回​见​。\n"
"tong1su2 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 wan2yi4r5 neng2 yong4lai2 biao1ji4 mu4biao1。you3xie1 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 ye3 neng2 shi2xian4 tong2yang4 de5 gong1neng2，dui4 die2 ke4 lai2 shuo1 geng4shi4 jia1chang2bian4fan4。dan4 bu4qiang1 shang4 chu1xian4 zhe4zhong3 gong1neng2，wo3 hai2shi5 tou2yi1hui2 jian4。"

msgid ""
"In light of my desire to foster a good working relationship with you, and the ghouls' past service to the Kreuzbasar, I suppose that I could continue feeding them for... oh, say...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Another pause, punctuated by a soft tutting sound.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"考虑​到​我​希望​与​你​建立​良好​的​工作​关系​，​以及​尸鬼们​过去​为​克洛伊​茨​集市​提供​的​服务​，​我​想​我​可以​继续​饲喂​它们​……​至于​价格​嘛​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​又​是​一阵​停顿​，​夹杂着​轻微​的​啧声​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 wo3 xi1wang4 yu4 ni3 jian4li4 liang2hao3 de5 gong1zuo4 guan1xi5，yi3ji2 shi1 gui3 men5 guo4qu4 wei2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ti2gong1 de5 fu2wu4，wo3 xiang3 wo3 ke3yi3 ji4xu4 si4wei4 ta1men5……zhi4yu2 jia4ge2 ma5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you4 shi4 yi1zhen4 ting2dun4，jia1 za2 zhao2 qing1wei1 de5 ze2 sheng1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"In light of such turmoil, is it any surprise that Dr. Vauclair and the Firewing were forgotten?\n"
"\n"
"Dragons were yesterday's news."
msgstr ""
"在​这种​规模​的​动荡​面前​，​就算​沃​克莱尔​博士​和​火翼​的​事​被​抛​诸脑​后​，​又​有​什么​可​惊讶​的​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​已经​是​昨日​黄花​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4zhong3 gui1mo2 de5 dong4dang4 mian4qian2，jiu4suan4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 he4 Huo3yi4 de5 shi4 bei4 pao1 zhu1 nao3 hou4，you4 you3 shen2me5 ke3 jing1ya4 de5 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 yi3jing1 shi4 zuo2ri4 huang2hua1 le5。"

msgid ""
"In light of these allegations, protesters and supporters of the plan have clashed in bloody violence across the UCAS.\n"
"\n"
"Spokesmen from the UCAS government and Ares Macrotechnology have derided these allegations as \"patently false,\" and have urged UCAS citizens to remain calm as they work together to engineer a solution to the Chicago Crisis.\n"
"\n"
">> Brijagandah Foster"
msgstr ""
"鉴于​这些​指控​，​抗议者​与​该​计划​的​支持者​在​整个​加​美​合众国​范围​内​爆发​了​血腥​冲突​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​加​美​合众国​政府​与​阿瑞斯​宏​技术​的​发言人​讥讽​这些​指控​“​纯属捏造​”​，​并​敦促​联盟​公民​保持​冷静​，​共同​致力于​解决​芝加哥​危机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​>​布里​贾甘达​·​福斯特\n"
"\n"
"jian4yu2 zhe4xie1 zhi3kong4，kang4yi4zhe3 yu4 gai1 ji4hua4 de5 zhi1chi2zhe3 zai4 zheng3ge4 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 fan4wei2 nei4 bao4fa1 le5 xue4xing1 chong1tu1。\n"
"\n"
"jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 zheng4fu3 yu4 a1rui4si1 hong2 ji4shu4 de5 fa1yan2ren2 ji1feng3 zhe4xie1 zhi3kong4“chun2 shu3 nie1 zao4”，bing4 dun1cu4 lian2meng2 gong1min2 bao3chi2 leng3jing4，gong4tong2 zhi4 li4 yu2 jie3jue2 zhi1jia1ge1 wei1ji1。\n"
"\n"
">>bu4 li3 gu3 gan1 da2 · fu2si1te4"

msgid ""
"In low concentrations, its odor is reminiscent of freshly cut grass. The "
"odor detection threshold for phosgene is 0.4 ppm, four times its threshold "
"limit value. "
msgstr ""
"低浓度​时​，​其​气味​近似于​新鲜​割下​的​青草​。​光气​的​嗅觉​阈值​为​0​.​4ppm​，​是​检测​阈值​的​四倍​。\n"
"di1 nong2 du4 shi2，qi2 qi4wei4 jin4 si4 yu2 xin1xian1 ge1 xia4 de5 qing1cao3。guang1qi4 de5 xiu4jue2 yu4zhi2 wei2 0 . 4ppm，shi4 jian3ce4 yu4zhi2 de5 si4 bei4。"

msgid ""
"In my experience, a zealot is unlikely to shed his allegiance to his "
"goddess... even if that loyalty comes at great personal cost."
msgstr ""
"根据​我​的​经验​，​狂​信徒​不太可能​放弃​对​女神​效忠​……​即便​这种​忠诚​伴随​着​巨大​的​个人​代价​。\n"
"gen1ju4 wo3 de5 jing1yan4，kuang2 xin4tu2 bu4 tai4 ke3 neng2 fang4qi4 dui4 nu:3shen2 xiao4zhong1……ji2bian4 zhe4zhong3 zhong1cheng2 ban4sui2 zhao2 ju4da4 de5 ge4ren2 dai4jia4。"

msgid "In my experience, there’s no such thing as a milk run. "
msgstr ""
"根据​我​的​经验​，​从来​没有​什么​活是​轻松​的​。\n"
"gen1ju4 wo3 de5 jing1yan4，cong2lai2 mei2you3 shen2me5 huo2 shi4 qing1song1 de5。"

msgid ""
"In my experience, you usually don't. You work with the intel that you have, and make the best decisions that you can in the moment.\n"
"\n"
"It's easy to fall into the trap of second-guessing ourselves, but we shouldn't let it consume us. We have other things to worry about."
msgstr ""
"依照​我​的​经验​，​想​找到​确凿证据​通常​是​不​可能​的​。​你​只能​基于​现有​情报​行事​，​在​当下​做出​最佳​决策​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​很​容易​陷入​自我​怀疑​的​陷阱​，​但​不该​让​这种​情绪​吞噬​自己​。​还有​更​重要​的​事​需要​我们​关注​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhao4 wo3 de5 jing1yan4，xiang3 zhao3dao4 que4 zao2 zheng4 ju4 tong1chang2 shi4 bu4 ke3neng2 de5。ni3 zhi3neng2 ji1yu2 xian4you3 qing2bao4 xing2shi4，zai4 dang1xia4 zuo4chu1 zui4jia1 jue2ce4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hen3 rong2yi4 xian4ru4 zi4wo3 huai2yi2 de5 xian4jing3，dan4 bu4gai1 rang4 zhe4zhong3 qing2xu4 tun1shi4 zi4ji3。hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 xu1yao4 wo3men5 guan1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"In my time as an observer of this world, I have witnessed a great many things.\n"
"\n"
"Wonders and terrors beyond measure. The birth and death of nations. The rise and fall of gods."
msgstr ""
"在​我​作为​世界​观察者​的​岁月​里​，​我​目睹​了​无数​事物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不可估量​的​奇迹​与​恐怖​。​国家​的​诞生​与​消亡​。​神明​的​崛起​与​陨落​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 zuo4wei2 shi4jie4 guan1cha2zhe3 de5 sui4yue4 li3，wo3 mu4du3 le5 wu2shu4 shi4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4ke3gu1liang4 de5 qi2ji4 yu4 kong3bu4。guo2jia1 de5 dan4sheng1 yu4 xiao1wang2。shen2ming2 de5 jue2qi3 yu4 yun3luo4。"

msgid ""
"In my view, all belief systems are essentially different ways of interpreting the same thing.\n"
"\n"
"Magic is an underlying force of the universe - it is a fundamental truth. Religion is the lens that societies use to focus the enormity of that truth into something that their people can understand."
msgstr ""
"在我看来​，​所有​信仰​体系​本质​上​都​是​对​同一​事物​的​不同​解读​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​魔法​是​宇宙​的​底层​力量​—​—​这是​根本性​的​真理​。​宗教​则​是​社会​用来​聚焦​这​一点​的​透镜​，​以便​将​浩瀚​真理​凝聚​成​民众​能够​理解​的​形式​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4wo3kan4lai2，suo3you3 xin4yang3 ti3xi4 ben3zhi4 shang4 dou1 shi4 dui4 tong2yi1 shi4wu4 de5 bu4tong2 jie3du2。\n"
"\n"
"mo2fa3 shi4 yu3zhou4 de5 di3ceng2 li4liang5——zhe4 shi4 gen1 ben3 xing4 de5 zhen1li3。zong1jiao4 ze2 shi4 she4hui4 yong4lai2 ju4jiao1 zhe4 yi1dian3 de5 tou4jing4，yi3bian4 jiang1 hao4han4 zhen1li3 ning2ju4 cheng2 min2zhong4 neng2gou4 li3jie3 de5 xing2shi4。"

msgid ""
"In one smooth motion, Eiger raises her shotgun and unloads a spread of "
"pellets into the glass. They clang into the window, ricocheting wildly in "
"all directions. The surface remains unblemished."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​行云流水​般​举起​猎枪​，​将​一串​铅​弹射​向​玻璃​。​铅弹​撞击​窗户​，​四处​乱弹​。​玻璃​表面​完好无损​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 xing2yun2liu2shui3 ban1 ju3qi3 lie4qiang1，jiang1 yi1 chuan4 qian1 tan2she4 xiang4 bo1li5。qian1 dan4 zhuang4ji1 chuang1hu5，si4chu4 luan4 dan4。bo1li5 biao3mian4 wan2hao3wu2sun3。"

msgid ""
"In order to maintain their... how do I say it...\n"
"\n"
"...their \"anonymity\"... each tap's protocol buffer must be reset every few days. \n"
"\n"
"I simply wish for you to visit each data tap and reset it."
msgstr ""
"为了​维持​它们​的​……​该​怎么​说​呢​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​它们​的​“​匿名性​”​……​每隔​几天​就​必须​重置​一次​插口​的​缓冲器​协议​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​仅仅​希望​你​能​去​检查​下​每个​数据​插口​，​并​完成​重置​操作​。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 wei2chi2 ta1men5 de5……gai1 zen3me5 shuo1 ni2……\n"
"\n"
"……ta1men5 de5“ni4 ming2 xing4”……mei3ge2 ji3tian1 jiu4 bi4xu1 chong2zhi4 yi1ci4 cha1kou3 de5 huan3chong1qi4 xie2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jin3jin3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 qu4 jian3cha2 xia4 mei3ge4 shu4ju4 cha1kou3，bing4 wan2cheng2 chong2zhi4 cao1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"In order to solve the problem, we need to find a way to plug the leak. But "
"we have a more immediate concern: the creatures that are invading our world "
"are growing larger and more dangerous at an exponential rate."
msgstr ""
"为了​解决​这个​问题​，​我们​需要​找到​堵住​漏洞​的​方法​。​但​我们​面临​更​紧迫​的​危机​：​入侵​我们​世界​的​生物​正以​指数​级​速度​变得​越来越​庞大​而​危险​。\n"
"wei4le5 jie3jue2 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2，wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhao3dao4 du3zhu4 lou4dong4 de5 fang1fa3。dan4 wo3men5 mian4lin2 geng1 jin3po4 de5 wei1ji1：ru4qin1 wo3men5 shi4jie4 de5 sheng1wu4 zheng1 yi3 zhi3shu4 ji2 su4du4 bian4de5 yue4lai2yue4 pang2da4 er2 wei1xian3。"

msgid ""
"In our time together, Harrow and I committed more atrocities than I could count. At this point, I was onto all of his tricks; I knew that Feuerstelle was nothing more than a honey trap, carefully designed to lure local children into my master's clutches. I knew that the kids who seemed resistant to Harrow's brainwashing techniques wound up fertilizing the garden. I knew that Harrow's entire manifesto was bullshit. \n"
"\n"
"And I knew that through it all, Harrow and the Adversary were laughing, because I was laughing right there beside them."
msgstr ""
"在​共处​的​岁月​里​，​哈罗​和​我​犯下​了​数不清​的​暴行​。​那时​我​早已​识破​他​的​所有​伎俩​：​我​清楚​“​火坑​”​不过​是​个​精心设计​的​陷阱​，​专门​引诱​当地​孩童​落入​我​主人​的​魔掌​；​我​明白​那些​抗拒​哈罗​洗脑​的​孩子​最终​都​成​了​花园​的​肥料​；​我​深知​哈罗​的​整套​宣言​全是​胡说八道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​我​更​清楚​，​在​这场​荒诞剧​中​，​哈罗​与​“​反叛者​”​始终​在​放声​大笑​—​—​因为​我​正​站​在​他们​身旁​，​与​他们​一同​狂笑​不止​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 gong4chu3 de5 sui4yue4 li3，ha1luo2 he4 wo3 fan4 xia4 le5 shu3bu5qing1 de5 bao4xing2。na4shi2 wo3 zao3yi3 shi2po4 ta1 de5 suo3you3 ji4liang3：wo3 qing1chu5“huo3keng1” bu4guo4 shi4 ge4 jing1 xin1 she4 ji4 de5 xian4jing3，zhuan1men2 yin3you4 dang1di4 hai2tong2 luo4ru4 wo3 zhu3ren2 de5 mo2zhang3 ； wo3 ming2bai5 na4xie1 kang4ju4 ha1luo2 xi3nao3 de5 hai2zi5 zui4zhong1 dou1 cheng2 le5 hua1yuan2 de5 fei2liao4 ； wo3 shen1zhi1 ha1luo2 de5 zheng3tao4 xuan1yan2 quan2 shi4 hu2shuo1ba1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3 geng1 qing1chu5，zai4 zhe4 chang2 huang1 dan4 ju4 zhong4，ha1luo2 yu4“fan3 pan4 zhe3” shi3zhong1 zai4 fang4sheng1 da4xiao4——yin1wei4 wo3 zheng1 zhan4 zai4 ta1men5 shen1 pang2，yu4 ta1men5 yi1tong2 kuang2xiao4 bu4zhi3。"

msgid ""
"In retrospect, you're right. The Rules of Living are derivative, self-contradictory drivel. They offer easy answers in an attractive, easily digestible package.\n"
"\n"
"But then, so has the philosophy of every self-proclaimed messiah in history, and they've always managed to attract their share of followers."
msgstr ""
"现在​回过头来​看​，​你​是​对​的​。​所谓​的​“​生存​法则​”​是​只是​一堆​抄袭​模仿​、​自相矛盾​的​胡言乱语​，​用​诱人​且​易消化​的​包装​，​兜售​着​廉价​的​答案​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​历史​上​每个​自称​救世主​的​哲学​教义​不​也​如此​吗​？​而​它们​总能​吸引​到​自己​的​追随者​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 hui2guo4tou2lai2 kan4，ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。suo3wei4 de5“sheng1cun2 fa3ze2” shi4 zhi3shi4 yi1dui1 chao1xi2 mo2fang3、zi4xiang1mao2dun4 de5 hu2yan2luan4yu3，yong4 you4ren2 qie3 yi4 xiao1 hua4 de5 bao1zhuang1，dou1shou4 zhao2 lian2jia4 de5 da2an4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，li4shi3 shang4 mei3ge4 zi4cheng1 jiu4shi4zhu3 de5 zhe2xue2 jiao4yi4 bu4 ye3 ru2ci3 ma5？er2 ta1men5 zong3neng2 xi1yin3 dao4 zi4ji3 de5 zhui1sui2zhe3。"

msgid ""
"In short? I'd need you to shut down my control subroutines.\n"
"\n"
"We can get into the specifics if you accept. But if you help me... if you set me free... I'll clear the way for you to enter the holdfast. It'd be my pleasure."
msgstr ""
"简单​来说​？​我​需要​你​关闭​我​的​控制​子程序​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​同意​，​我们​可以​讨论​细节​。​但​如果​你​帮​我​……​如果​你​让​我​自由​……​我会​为​你​清除​进入​堡垒​的​道路​。​这​将​是​我​的​荣幸​。\n"
"\n"
"jian3dan1 lai2 shuo1？wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 guan1bi4 wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 zi3cheng2xu4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 tong2yi4，wo3men5 ke3yi3 tao3lun4 xi4jie2。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 bang1 wo3……ru2guo3 ni3 rang4 wo3 zi4you2……wo3 hui4 wei2 ni3 qing1chu2 jin4ru4 bao3lei3 de5 dao4lu4。zhe4 jiang1 shi4 wo3 de5 rong2xing4。"

msgid "In that case, \"oops\" is the understatement of the century."
msgstr ""
"你​这声​“​哎呀​”​简直​是​本世纪​最​轻描淡写​的​表达​了​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4 sheng1“ai1ya1” jian3zhi2 shi4 ben3 shi4 ji4 zui4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 de5 biao3da2 le5。"

msgid ""
"In that case, Doctor Vauclair, I thank you for sharing your valuable time "
"with us."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​沃​克莱尔​博士​，​感谢​你​与​我们​分享​宝贵​的​时间​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4，gan3xie4 ni3 yu4 wo3men5 fen1xiang3 bao3gui4 de5 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"In that case, I say forget about Harrow. Saving the cultists is more "
"important."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​我​建议​先​别管​哈罗​了​。​救​下​那些​教徒​的​性命​更​要紧​。\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 jian4yi4 xian1 bie2guan3 ha1luo2 le5。jiu4 xia4 na4xie1 jiao4tu2 de5 xing4ming4 geng1 yao4jin3。"

msgid ""
"In that case, I say forget about the cultists. Killing Harrow is more "
"important."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​我​建议​先​别管​那些​教徒​了​。​除掉​哈罗​更​要紧​。\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 jian4yi4 xian1 bie2guan3 na4xie1 jiao4tu2 le5。chu2diao4 ha1luo2 geng1 yao4jin3。"

msgid "In that case, I suppose I'm buying."
msgstr ""
"那​我​就​买点​东西​吧​。\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 mai3 dian3 dong1xi1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"In that case, I think that your actions were inexcusable. You murdered that "
"kid."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​我​认为​你​的​行为​不可​原谅​。​你​杀​了​那个​孩子​。\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 de5 xing2wei2 bu4ke3 yuan2liang4。ni3 sha1 le5 na4ge5 hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"In that case, I'll thank you again and let you be on your way.\n"
"\n"
"Be well, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​再次​感谢​，​我​就​不​耽误​你​上路​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​保重​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，zai4ci4 gan3xie4，wo3 jiu4 bu4 dan1wu5 ni3 shang4lu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bao3zhong4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"In that case, I'm asking you to trust me. The Spirit and I need to do this on our own.\n"
"\n"
"I need you to respect that decision more than I need you to hold my hand through this."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​我​需要​你​相信​我​。​我​和​精魂​必须​独自​完成​这件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​比起​你​与​我​并肩作战​，​我​更​需要​你​尊重​我​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 xiang1xin4 wo3。wo3 he4 jing1hun2 bi4xu1 du2zi4 wan2cheng2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bi3qi3 ni3 yu4 wo3 bing4jian1zuo4zhan4，wo3 geng1 xu1yao4 ni3 zun1zhong4 wo3 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"In that case, best of luck. I'll hold down the fort here with the others."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​祝你好运​。​我会​和​其他人​在​这里​等​你​。\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。wo3 hui4 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 zai4 zhe4li3 deng3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"In that case, going through with this new plan would render us complicit in the intimidation - or perhaps even the assassination - of our client.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not sure how that's an improvement."
msgstr ""
"要是​这么一来​的话​，​如果​我们​执行​这个​新​计划​，​我们​就​成​了​恐吓​、​甚至​暗杀​客户​的​帮凶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对​此事​的​评价​没有​任何​改观​。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 zhe4 ma2 yi1 lai2 de5hua4，ru2guo3 wo3men5 zhi2xing2 zhe4ge5 xin1 ji4hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 cheng2 le5 kong3he4、shen4zhi4 an4sha1 ke4hu4 de5 bang1xiong1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3shi4 de5 ping2jia4 mei2you3 ren4he2 gai3guan1。"

msgid ""
"In that case, let's move on to the shrine room. I'll get you through the door.\n"
"\n"
"I won't let any more children come to harm."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​我们​去​神龛​室​吧​。​我带​你们​穿过​那​扇门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​绝不会​再​让​任何​孩子​受到​伤害​。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3men5 qu4 shen2kan1 shi4 ba1。wo3 dai4 ni3men5 chuan1guo4 na4 shan1 men2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 zai4 rang4 ren4he2 hai2zi5 shou4dao4 shang1hai4。"

msgid "In that case, maybe we should just forget about this."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​的话​，​也许​我们​应当​不要​来​的​好​。\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 de5hua4，ye3xu3 wo3men5 ying1dang1 bu4yao4 lai2 de5 hao3。"

msgid "In that case, please hurry."
msgstr ""
"那​就​请​快点​吧​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 qing3 kuai4dian3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"In that case, we're going to have to find a way to get it away from her."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​我们​就​得​设法​从​她​手里​弄​到​钥匙​。\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3men5 jiu4 de2 she4fa3 cong2 ta1 shou3li3 long4 dao4 yao4shi5。"

msgid "In the Open"
msgstr ""
"完全​暴露\n"
"wan2quan2 bao4lu4"

msgid ""
"In the back of the room, an ominous presence hovers silently at chest-height. Light glints off of the machine's pitted metal carapace.\n"
"\n"
"Eiger sees the look on your face, and her voice cuts through the quiet in the room."
msgstr ""
"房间​后方​，​一个​不祥​的​存在​正​静静​悬浮​在​胸口​左右​的​高度​。​光线​在​机器​坑坑洼洼​的​金属外壳​上​闪烁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​注意​到​你​脸上​的​神色​，​她​的​声音​划破​了​房间​里​的​寂静​。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 hou4fang1，yi1ge5 bu4xiang2 de5 cun2zai4 zheng1 jing4 jing4 xuan2fu2 zai4 xiong1kou3 zuo3you4 de5 gao1du4。guang1xian4 zai4 ji1qi4 keng1keng5wa1wa1 de5 jin1 shu3 wai4 ke2 shang4 shan3shuo4。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 zhu4yi4 dao4 ni3 lian3 shang4 de5 shen2se4，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 hua2po4 le5 fang2jian1 li3 de5 ji4jing4。"

msgid ""
"In the course of my investigation, I encountered something terrifying in the Matrix. \n"
"\n"
"It was fast, cunning, and very definitely intelligent. I’m convinced that I only escaped because it let me go.\n"
"\n"
"It could have killed me in a heartbeat if it wanted to."
msgstr ""
"在​调查过程​中​，​我​在​矩阵​里​遭遇​了​某种​可怕​的​存在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​迅捷​如风​，​狡黠​如狐​，​且​无疑​具备​高度​智慧​。​我​确信​自己​能​逃脱​，​纯粹​是因为​它​放​我​走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​它​愿意​的话​，​瞬间​就​能取​我​性命​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 diao4 cha2 guo4 cheng2 zhong4，wo3 zai4 ju3zhen4 li3 zao1yu4 le5 mou3zhong3 ke3pa4 de5 cun2zai4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xun4jie2 ru2 feng1，jiao3xia2 ru2 hu2，qie3 wu2yi2 ju4bei4 gao1du4 zhi4hui4。wo3 que4xin4 zi4ji3 neng2 tao2tuo1，chun2cui4 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 fang4 wo3 zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，shun4jian1 jiu4 neng2 qu3 wo3 xing4ming4。"

msgid ""
"In the end, only Heiner and I remained.\n"
"\n"
"We managed to trap Billy in the underworld, but there was no hope of escape for us."
msgstr ""
"最后​，​只​剩下​海纳​和​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​设法​把​比利​困在​了​冥界​，​但​我们​已经​不​可能​逃脱​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，zhi3 sheng4xia4 hai3 na4 he4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 she4fa3 ba3 bi3li4 kun4 zai4 le5 ming2jie4，dan4 wo3men5 yi3jing1 bu4 ke3neng2 tao2tuo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"In the future, see to it that you are on time and well rested. If you drop the ball again, we're going to have a little talk about your future in this organization.\n"
"\n"
" - Volker Stahl"
msgstr ""
"今后​务必​准时​到场​，​保持良好​作息​。​若​再​出差错​，​我们​就​得​聊聊​你​在​这个​组织​的​前途​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔\n"
"\n"
"jin1hou4 wu4bi4 zhun3shi2 dao4chang3，bao3 chi2 liang2 hao3 zuo4xi1。ruo4 zai4 chu1 cha4 cuo4，wo3men5 jiu4 de2 liao2 liao2 ni3 zai4 zhe4ge5 zu3zhi1 de5 qian2tu2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"——Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3"

msgid ""
"In the future, we're going to let Amsel do the planning for things like "
"this. He's good at it."
msgstr ""
"之后​我们​要​让​阿姆​泽尔来​规划​这种​事情​。​他​对此​十分​擅长​。\n"
"zhi1hou4 wo3men5 yao4 rang4 E1mu3ze2er3 lai2 gui1hua4 zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5。ta1 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 shan4chang2。"

msgid ""
"In the magic community, a shaman is referred to as \"toxic\" when he twists his idol's principles in order to cause harm.\n"
"\n"
"Some toxic shamans are eco-terrorists, protecting nature with deadly force. Others are essentially rabid... slavering things that hunt and kill with wild abandon."
msgstr ""
"在​魔法​界​，​当萨满​扭曲​精魂​导师​的​教义​来​作恶​时​，​就​会​被​称为​“​毒​”​萨满​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有些​毒萨满​是​生态​恐怖分子​，​不惜​以​致命​武力​来​保护​大自然​。​其余​的​从​本质​上​来说​则​更​像是​怪物​……​以​狂野​的​放纵​进行​狩猎​与​杀戮​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 mo2fa3 jie4，dang1 sa4 man3 niu3qu1 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 de5 jiao4yi4 lai2 zuo4e4 shi2，jiu4 hui4 bei4 cheng1wei2“du2” sa4man3。\n"
"\n"
"you3xie1 du2 sa4 man3 shi4 sheng1tai4 kong3bu4fen4zi3，bu4xi1 yi3 zhi4ming4 wu3li4 lai2 bao3hu4 da4zi4ran2。qi2yu2 de5 cong2 ben3zhi4 shang4 lai2 shuo1 ze2 geng1 xiang4 shi4 guai4wu5……yi3 kuang2ye3 de5 fang4zong4 jin4xing2 shou4lie4 yu4 sha1lu4。"

msgid ""
"In the magically active community, we refer to it as \"the Adversary.\" But "
"yeah, same being, more or less."
msgstr ""
"在​具有​魔力​活性​的​社群​中​，​我们​称其为​“​反叛者​”​。​不过​没错​，​基本上​就是​同一个​存在​。\n"
"zai4 ju4you3 mo2li4 huo2xing4 de5 she4qun2 zhong4，wo3men5 chen4 qi2 wei2“fan3 pan4 zhe3”。bu4guo4 mei2cuo4，ji1ben3shang5 jiu4shi4 tong2 yi1 ge4 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"In the meantime, a little tip to start you off, I personally like chatting up the old guys. \n"
"\n"
"They've always got some great stories."
msgstr ""
"与此同时​，​给​你​一点​小提示​，​我​个人​比较​喜欢​和​老一辈​的​人​聊天​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​总是​有​一些​精彩​的​故事​。\n"
"\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，gei3 ni3 yi1dian3 xiao3 ti2 shi4，wo3 ge4ren2 bi3jiao4 xi3huan5 he4 lao3yi1bei4 de5 ren2 liao2tian1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zong3shi4 you3 yi1xie1 jing1cai3 de5 gu4shi4。"

msgid ""
"In the meantime, we're gonna have to activate him.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She falls back to her regular position in the group.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just remember, $(l.name)... that's a man you're giving orders to. Not a machine."
msgstr ""
"而​现在​，​我们​得​先​激活​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​走​回​平时​在​队里​的​位置​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别忘了​，​$(l.name)​……​你​是​在​指挥​一个​人​，​而​不是​一台​机器​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 xian4zai4，wo3men5 de2 xian1 ji1huo2 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zou3 hui2 ping2shi2 zai4 dui4 li3 de5 wei4zhi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 wang4 le5，$(l.name)……ni3 shi4 zai4 zhi3hui1 yi1ge5 ren2，er2 bu4shi4 yi1 tai2 ji1qi4。"

msgid "In the next world? What then?"
msgstr ""
"下​一个​世界​？​然后​呢​？\n"
"xia4 yi1ge5 shi4jie4？ran2hou4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"In the shadows, individuals such as this are anything but uncommon. But Glory's cyberware is first-generation, all of it.\n"
"\n"
"Bulky, invasive, practically museum pieces... this chrome was obsolete well before she was born."
msgstr ""
"她​这样​的​情况​在​暗影​圈子​中​并​不​罕见​，​但格洛丽​的​赛博殖装​全都​是​第一代​的​古旧​产品​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​体积​庞大​，​侵入​性强​，​都​是​些​应该​待​在​博物馆​里​的​玩意儿​……​这些​镀铬​合金​在​她​出生​前​就​过时​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhe4yang4 de5 qing2kuang4 zai4 an4ying3 quan1zi5 zhong4 bing4 bu4 han3jian4，dan4 Ge2luo4li2 de5 sai4 bo2 zhi2 zhuang1 quan2dou1 shi4 di4 yi1 dai4 de5 gu3jiu4 chan3pin3。\n"
"\n"
"ti3ji1 pang2da4，qin1ru4 xing4 jiang4，dou1 shi4 xie1 ying1gai1 dai1 zai4 bo2wu4guan3 li3 de5 wan2yi4r5……zhe4xie1 du4 ge4 he2jin1 zai4 ta1 chu1sheng1 qian2 jiu4 guo4shi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"In the soykaf shop, you will find Jan Goldschmidt. I tell you that you will find him there because he never seems to leave the place. Every time I go for a coffee he is there, sipping on soykaf.\n"
"\n"
"Beyond that, I cannot say what I think of the man. He is a jovial sack of fat. Perhaps if you speak with him, you can learn something more."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​去​豆​咖店​的话​，​就​能​遇见​扬​·​戈德​施密特​。​我​这么​肯定​是因为​他​从没​离开​过​那里​。​每次​我​去​喝咖啡​，​都​看到​他​坐在​那​慢慢​品味​面前​的​豆​咖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除此之外​，​我​对​这个​人​并​不​了解​。​他​是​个​开朗​的​胖子​，​或许​你​和​他​聊聊​，​能​了解​更​多​情况​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 qu4 dou4 ka1 dian4 de5hua4，jiu4 neng2 yu4jian4 yang2 · Ge1de2shi1mi4te4。wo3 zhe4me5 ken3ding4 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 cong2mei2 li2kai1 guo4 na4li5。mei3ci4 wo3 qu4 he4 ka1 fei1，dou1 kan4dao4 ta1 zuo4 zai4 na4 man4man4 pin3wei4 mian4qian2 de5 dou4 ka1。\n"
"\n"
"chu2ci3zhi1wai4，wo3 dui4 zhe4ge5 ren2 bing4 bu4 liao3jie3。ta1 shi4 ge4 kai1lang3 de5 pang4zi5，huo4xu3 ni3 he4 ta1 liao2 liao2，neng2 liao3jie3 geng1 duo1 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"In the stillness at the center of that yawning void, time seems to slow.\n"
"\n"
"Gradually, you find a semblance of peace."
msgstr ""
"在​这​无边​虚空​的​中心​，​时间​仿佛​在​寂静​中​放缓​了​脚步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​渐渐​地​，​你​寻得​了​一丝​宁静​的​假象​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 wu2bian1 xu1kong1 de5 zhong1xin1，shi2jian1 fang3fu2 zai4 ji4jing4 zhong4 fang4huan3 le5 jiao3bu4。\n"
"\n"
"jian4jian4 de5，ni3 xun2 de2 le5 yi1 si1 ning2jing4 de5 jia3xiang4。"

msgid ""
"In the twilight, the streets of this corner of the Kreuzbasar glow a sickly yellow. The air in this part of town has a horrible, cloying stench to it, a piss-and-asphalt smell that crawls into your nostrils and sticks in the back of your throat.\n"
"\n"
"The dilapidated husks of burnt-out buildings loom above you, giving the place an air of menace."
msgstr ""
"日暮​时分​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​这个​角落​的​街道​泛着​病态​的​黄色​光芒​。​这片​区域​的​空气​中​弥漫着​令人作呕​的​刺鼻​气味​，​一种​尿​骚味​与​沥青​味​混合​在​一起​的​臭气​扑鼻而来​，​在​咽喉​后部​久久​不​散​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​被​烧毁​的​破旧​建筑​的​残骸​高高​耸立​在​你​上方​，​让​整个​地方​笼罩着​一股​凶恶​的​气息​。\n"
"\n"
"ri4mu4 shi2fen1，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhe4ge5 jiao3luo4 de5 jie1dao4 fan4 zhao2 bing4tai4 de5 huang2se4 guang1mang2。zhe4 pian1 qu1yu4 de5 kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 ling3 ren2 zuo4 ou3 de5 ci4bi2 qi4wei4，yi1zhong3 niao4 sao1wei4 yu4 li4qing1 wei4 hun4he2 zai4 yi1qi3 de5 chou4qi4 pu1 bi2 er2 lai2，zai4 yan1hou2 hou4bu4 jiu3jiu3 bu4 san3。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 bei4 shao1hui3 de5 po4jiu4 jian4zhu4 de5 can2hai2 gao1 gao1 song3li4 zai4 ni3 shang4fang1，rang4 zheng3ge4 di4fang1 long2 zhao4 zhao2 yi1 gu3 xiong1e4 de5 qi4xi1。"

msgid ""
"In the underground markets, people are bought and sold as chattel. Street children are rounded up and bled like lambs.\n"
"\n"
"I witnessed all of these things by the age of twelve."
msgstr ""
"在​地下​黑市​里​，​人们​被​当作​牲畜​买卖​。​街头​流浪​儿童​被​围捕​，​像​羔羊​般​被​宰杀​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​十二岁​之前​，​我​就​已经​目睹​了​这​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 di4xia4 hei1shi4 li3，ren2men5 bei4 dang4zuo4 sheng1chu4 mai3mai4。jie1tou2 liu2lang4 er2tong2 bei4 wei2bu3，xiang4 gao1yang2 ban1 bei4 zai3sha1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 shi2 er4 sui4 zhi1qian2，wo3 jiu4 yi3jing1 mu4du3 le5 zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"In the world of Shadowrun, there are no statistical differences between "
"males and females."
msgstr ""
"在​《​暗影​狂奔​》​的​世界​里​，​男性​和​女性​并​没有​数值​上​的​差异​。\n"
"zai4 《 an4Ying3kuang2ben1 》 de5 shi4jie4 li3，nan2xing4 he4 nu:3xing4 bing4 mei2you3 shu4zhi2 shang4 de5 cha1yi4。"

msgid ""
"In theory, the box has also circumvented the security cameras on the building's upper floors.\n"
"\n"
"You should be able to intercept the camera feeds by tapping into an elevator console on the 24th floor."
msgstr ""
"而且​理论​上​，​这个​盒子​还​骇入​了​大楼​高层​的​监控​摄像头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​应该​可以​通过​接入​24​楼​的​电梯​控制台​来​拦截​监控​信号​。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 li3lun4 shang4，zhe4ge5 he2zi5 hai2 hai4 ru4 le5 da4lou2 gao1ceng2 de5 jian1kong4 she4xiang4tou2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 ke3yi3 tong1guo4 jie1ru4 24 lou2 de5 dian4ti1 kong4zhi4tai2 lai2 lan2jie2 jian1kong4 xin4hao4。"

msgid ""
"In theory, we could manufacture a power spike from here. Overload the Azzies' entire power grid.\n"
"\n"
"Without disabling the generators' safety overrides, it wouldn't cause any permanent damage, but the confusion might give us an opening to get into the building."
msgstr ""
"理论​上​，​我们​可以​用​它​制造​一波​电力​尖峰​，​让​阿兹佬​的​整个​电网​过载​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​不​关闭​发电机​的​安全​超控​装置​，​就​不会​造成​永久性​损坏​，​但​由此​引发​的​混乱​或许​能为​我们​创造​进入​建筑​的​机会​。\n"
"\n"
"li3lun4 shang4，wo3men5 ke3yi3 yong4 ta1 zhi4zao4 yi1 bo1 dian4li4 jian1feng1，rang4 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 zheng3ge4 dian4wang3 guo4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 bu4 guan1bi4 fa1dian4ji1 de5 an1quan2 chao1 kong4 zhuang1zhi4，jiu4 bu4hui4 zao4cheng2 yong3jiu3xing4 sun3huai4，dan4 you2ci3 yin3fa1 de5 hun4luan4 huo4xu3 neng2 wei2 wo3men5 chuang4zao4 jin4ru4 jian4zhu4 de5 ji1hui4。"

msgid "In there! That's our man! "
msgstr ""
"在​那​！​那​就是​我们​要​找​的​人​！\n"
"zai4 na4！na4 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 yao4 zhao3 de5 ren2！"

msgid "In this job, we work together or die alone."
msgstr ""
"干​咱们​这​一行​的​，​合则生​，​分则​死​。\n"
"gan4 zan2men5 zhe4 yi1xing2 de5，ge3 ze2 sheng1，fen1ze2 si3。"

msgid ""
"In truth, I can understand your disbelief. On the surface, it would appear that the outcome of this episode was ill-suited to his interests.\n"
"\n"
"But then again, perhaps not. You are not in a position to know."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​我能​理解​你​的​怀疑​。​表面​看来​，​这​整件事​的​结果​本​可以​更​符合​他​的​利益​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​话说回来​，​说不定​也​未必​呢​。​你​根本​无从​知晓​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 neng2 li3jie3 ni3 de5 huai2yi2。biao3mian4 kan4lai5，zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 de5 jie1guo3 ben3 ke3yi3 geng1 fu2he2 ta1 de5 li4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，shuo1bu5ding4 ye3 wei4bi4 ni2。ni3 gen1ben3 wu2cong2 zhi1xiao3。"

msgid "In what way?"
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​？\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1？"

msgid ""
"In your absence, I have been looking into the Harfeld Manor.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever Feuerschwinge is up to, it is both large-scale and well-funded. I've uncovered a money trail leading from holding companies all over the world to an offshore fund with a dummy address.\n"
"\n"
"From there, all of that freshly laundered money flows directly into the Harfeld estate."
msgstr ""
"你​不​在​的​时候​，​我​一直​在​调查​哈​菲尔德​庄园​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​火翼​在​策划​什么​，​其​行动​规模​之大​、​资金​之​雄厚​都​令人震惊​。​我​顺着​一条​资金​链查​到​世界各地​的​控股公司​都​会​往​某个​虚假​地址​的​离岸​基金​汇款​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​洗白后​的​资金​都​由此​直接​流入​哈​菲尔德​庄园​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 zai4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 diao4cha2 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 Huo3yi4 zai4 ce4hua4 shen2me5，qi2 xing2dong4 gui1mo2 zhi1 dai4、zi1jin1 zhi1 xiong2hou4 dou1 ling3 ren2 zhen4 jing1。wo3 shun4zhe5 yi1 tiao2 zi1jin1 lian4 cha2 dao4 shi4jie4ge4di4 de5 kong4gu3gong1si1 dou1 hui4 wang3 mou3 ge4 xu1jia3 di4zhi3 de5 li2an4 ji1jin1 hui4kuan3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 xi3 bai2 hou4 de5 zi1jin1 dou1 you2ci3 zhi2jie1 liu2ru4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"In your peripheral vision you catch a flurry of motion. \n"
"\n"
"Guards, with weapons drawn, advancing on your position."
msgstr ""
"你​的​余光​瞥见​一阵​骚动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​警卫​们​正端​着​枪​朝​你​的​位置​逼近​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 yu2guang1 pie1jian4 yi1zhen4 sao1dong4。\n"
"\n"
"jing3wei4 men5 zheng1 duan1 zhao2 qiang1 chao2 ni3 de5 wei4zhi5 bi1jin4。"

msgid "In your place, I'd have done the same thing."
msgstr ""
"换作​是​我​的话​，​也​会​做​同样​的​事​。\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，ye3 hui4 zuo4 tong2yang4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "In your place? I would have."
msgstr ""
"换作​是​我​的话​就​会​那么​做​。\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4 jiu4 hui4 na4me5 zuo4。"

msgid "Incoming DMG from attacks is reduced by 15 for 4 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌人​攻击​造成​的​伤害​降低​15​点​。​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"di2ren2 gong1ji1 zao4cheng2 de5 shang1hai4 jiang4di1 15 dian3。chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid "Incoming DMG from attacks is reduced by 20. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌人​攻击​造成​的​伤害​降低​20​点​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"di2ren2 gong1ji1 zao4cheng2 de5 shang1hai4 jiang4di1 20 dian3。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid "Incoming DMG from attacks is reduced by 25 for 4 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌人​攻击​造成​的​伤害​降低​25​点​。​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"di2ren2 gong1ji1 zao4cheng2 de5 shang1hai4 jiang4di1 25 dian3。chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid "Incoming DMG from attacks is reduced by 35. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌人​攻击​造成​的​伤害​降低​35​点​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"di2ren2 gong1ji1 zao4cheng2 de5 shang1hai4 jiang4di1 35 dian3。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid "Incoming DMG from attacks is reduced by 45. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌人​攻击​造成​的​伤害​降低​45​点​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"di2ren2 gong1ji1 zao4cheng2 de5 shang1hai4 jiang4di1 45 dian3。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid "Incoming DMG from attacks is reduced by 50 for 4 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"敌人​攻击​造成​的​伤害​降低​50​点​。​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"di2ren2 gong1ji1 zao4cheng2 de5 shang1hai4 jiang4di1 50 dian3。chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid "Incorrect Username or Password."
msgstr ""
"用户名​或​密码​不​正确​。\n"
"yong4hu4ming2 huo4 mi4ma3 bu4 zheng4que4。"

msgid ""
"Increase Skill:\n"
"Thrown Weapons"
msgstr ""
"提升​技能​：​\n"
"​投掷​武器\n"
"ti2sheng1 ji4neng2：\n"
"tou2zhi4 wu3qi4"

msgid "Increase spellbook slot (if not yet unlocked"
msgstr ""
"增加​魔法书​栏位​（​若​尚未​解锁​）\n"
"zeng1jia1 mo2 fa3 shu1 lan2wei4 （ruo4 shang4wei4 jie3suo3）"

msgid "Increase spellbook slot (if not yet unlocked)"
msgstr ""
"增加​魔法书​栏位​（​若​尚未​解锁​）\n"
"zeng1jia1 mo2 fa3 shu1 lan2wei4 （ruo4 shang4wei4 jie3suo3）"

msgid ""
"Increase spellbook slot (if not yet unlocked) / Chi Onslaught: 3 attacks on "
"a single target with a melee weapon"
msgstr ""
"增加​魔法书​栏位​（​若​尚未​解锁​）​ ​/​ ​真​气​猛攻​：​使用​近战​武器​对​单个​目标​发动​3​次​攻击\n"
"zeng1jia1 mo2 fa3 shu1 lan2wei4 （ruo4 shang4wei4 jie3suo3）/zhen1 qi4 meng3gong1：shi3yong4 jin4 zhan4 wu3qi4 dui4 dan1ge5 mu4biao1 fa1dong4 3 ci4 gong1ji1"

msgid "Increase spellbook slot (if not yet unlocked) / Maximum for Trolls"
msgstr ""
"增加​魔法书​栏位​（​若​尚未​解锁​）​ ​/​ ​巨魔​最大值\n"
"zeng1jia1 mo2 fa3 shu1 lan2wei4 （ruo4 shang4wei4 jie3suo3）/ju4mo2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Increases accuracy by 10%."
msgstr ""
"精准度​增加​10​%​。\n"
"jing1 zhun3 du4 zeng1jia1 10%。"

msgid "Increases accuracy by 15%. Pierces up to 2 Armor."
msgstr ""
"精准度​增加​15​%​。​最​多​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"jing1 zhun3 du4 zeng1jia1 15 %。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid "Increases accuracy by 20%. Pierces up to 3 Armor."
msgstr ""
"将​精准度​增加​20​%​。​最​多​提供​3​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"jiang1 jing1 zhun3 du4 zeng1jia1 20 %。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 3 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid "Increases accuracy by 35%."
msgstr ""
"精准度​增加​35​%​。\n"
"jing1 zhun3 du4 zeng1jia1 35%。"

msgid ""
"Increases run speed for short bursts, allowing the user to spring forward "
"rapidly (+3 Movement)."
msgstr ""
"短时间​内​提升​奔跑​速度​，​使​用户​能够​迅速​向前​跃进​（​+​3​移动力​）​。\n"
"duan3shi2jian1 nei4 ti2sheng1 ben1pao3 su4du4，shi3 yong4hu4 neng2gou4 xun4su4 xiang4qian2 yue4jin4 （+3 yi2 dong4 li4）。"

msgid ""
"Increases run speed for short bursts, allowing the user to spring forward "
"rapidly (+4 Movement)."
msgstr ""
"短时间​内​提升​奔跑​速度​，​使​用户​能够​迅速​向前​跃进​（​+​4​移动力​）​。\n"
"duan3shi2jian1 nei4 ti2sheng1 ben1pao3 su4du4，shi3 yong4hu4 neng2gou4 xun4su4 xiang4qian2 yue4jin4 （+4 yi2 dong4 li4）。"

msgid ""
"Increases the chance for a Shaman to maintain control of a summoned spirit."
msgstr ""
"增加​萨满​对​召唤​出​的​精魂​保持​控制​的​几率​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 sa4man3 dui4 zhao4huan4 chu1 de5 jing1hun2 bao3chi2 kong4zhi4 de5 ji1lu:4。"

msgid ""
"Increases the chance for greater than normal damage when using a SMG to "
"attack. Increasing this skill unlocks special abilities."
msgstr ""
"增加​使用​冲锋枪​攻击​时​造成​额外​伤害​的​几率​。​提升​此​技能​可​解锁​特殊​能力​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 shi3yong4 chong1feng1qiang1 gong1ji1 shi2 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 shang1hai4 de5 ji1lu:4。ti2sheng1 ci3 ji4neng2 ke3 jie3suo3 te4shu1 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"Increases the chance for greater than normal damage when using a pistol to "
"attack. Increasing this skill unlocks special abilities."
msgstr ""
"增加​使用​手枪​攻击​时​造成​额外​伤害​的​几率​。​提升​此​技能​可​解锁​特殊​能力​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 shi3yong4 shou3qiang1 gong1ji1 shi2 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 shang1hai4 de5 ji1lu:4。ti2sheng1 ci3 ji4neng2 ke3 jie3suo3 te4shu1 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"Increases the chance for greater than normal damage when using a rifle to "
"attack. Increasing this skill unlocks special abilities."
msgstr ""
"增加​使用​步枪​攻击​时​造成​额外​伤害​的​几率​。​提升​此​技能​可​解锁​特殊​能力​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 shi3yong4 bu4qiang1 gong1ji1 shi2 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 shang1hai4 de5 ji1lu:4。ti2sheng1 ci3 ji4neng2 ke3 jie3suo3 te4shu1 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"Increases the chance for greater than normal damage when using a shotgun to "
"attack. Increasing this skill unlocks special abilities."
msgstr ""
"增加​使用​霰弹枪​攻击​时​造成​额外​伤害​的​几率​。​提升​此​技能​可​解锁​特殊​能力​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 shi3yong4 xian4dan4qiang1 gong1ji1 shi2 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 shang1hai4 de5 ji1lu:4。ti2sheng1 ci3 ji4neng2 ke3 jie3suo3 te4shu1 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"Increases the chance for greater than normal damage when using fists to "
"attack. Increasing this skill unlocks special abilities."
msgstr ""
"增加​徒手​攻击​时​造成​额外​伤害​的​几率​。​提升​此​技能​可​解锁​特殊​能力​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 tu2shou3 gong1ji1 shi2 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 shang1hai4 de5 ji1lu:4。ti2sheng1 ci3 ji4neng2 ke3 jie3suo3 te4shu1 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"Increases the chance for greater than normal damage when using melee weapons"
" to attack. Increasing this skill unlocks special abilities."
msgstr ""
"增加​使用​近战​武器​时​造成​额外​伤害​的​几率​。​提升​此​技能​可​解锁​特殊​能力​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 shi3yong4 jin4 zhan4 wu3qi4 shi2 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 shang1hai4 de5 ji1lu:4。ti2sheng1 ci3 ji4neng2 ke3 jie3suo3 te4shu1 neng2li4。"

msgid "Increases the friendly target's AP by 1 for 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"为​友方​目标​增加​1​点​行动​点​，​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"wei2 you3 fang1 mu4biao1 zeng1jia1 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3，chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid "Increases the friendly target's AP by 1 for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"为​友方​目标​增加​1​点​行动​点​，​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"wei2 you3 fang1 mu4biao1 zeng1jia1 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid "Increases the friendly target's AP by 1 for 4 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"为​友方​目标​增加​1​点​行动​点​，​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"wei2 you3 fang1 mu4biao1 zeng1jia1 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3，chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid "Increases the friendly target's AP by 2 for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"为​友方​目标​增加​2​点​行动​点​，​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"wei2 you3 fang1 mu4biao1 zeng1jia1 2 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Increases the power of the Decker's Expert Systems programs in the Matrix."
msgstr ""
"增加​碟客​在​矩阵​中​的​专家系统​程序​的​威力​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 die2 ke4 zai4 ju3zhen4 zhong4 de5 zhuan1jia1xi4tong3 cheng2xu4 de5 wei1li4。"

msgid "Increases the target's AP cost for all actions by 2. Lasts for 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"目标​所有​行动​消耗​的​行动​点​增加​2​点​。​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"mu4biao1 suo3you3 xing2dong4 xiao1hao4 de5 xing2dong4 dian3 zeng1jia1 2 dian3。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Increases the target's to hit chance by 12%, does not stack, nor affect AOE "
"abilities. Lasts 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"增加​目标​的​命中率​12​%​。​不​叠加​，​不​对​AOE​技能​起效​。​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 mu4biao1 de5 ming4zhong4lu:4 12 %。bu4 die2jia1，bu4 dui4 AOE ji4neng2 qi3xiao4。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Increases the target's to hit chance by 15%, does not stack, nor affect AOE "
"abilities. Lasts 4 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"增加​目标​的​命中率​15​%​。​不​叠加​，​不​对​AOE​技能​起效​。​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 mu4biao1 de5 ming4zhong4lu:4 15 %。bu4 die2jia1，bu4 dui4 AOE ji4neng2 qi3xiao4。chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Increases the target's to hit chance by 18%, does not stack, nor affect AOE "
"abilities. Lasts 6 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"增加​目标​的​命中率​18​%​。​不​叠加​，​不​对​AOE​技能​起效​。​持续​6​回合​。\n"
"zeng1jia1 mu4biao1 de5 ming4zhong4lu:4 18 %。bu4 die2jia1，bu4 dui4 AOE ji4neng2 qi3xiao4。chi2xu4 6 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Increases your chance to hit against enemy IC and deckers by 15% for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"提高​对​敌方​IC​和​碟​客​的​命中率​15​%​，​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"ti2gao1 dui4 di2fang1 IC he4 die2 ke4 de5 ming4zhong4lu:4 15 %，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Increases your chance to hit against enemy IC and deckers by 20% for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"提高​对​敌方​IC​和​碟​客​的​命中率​20​%​，​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"ti2gao1 dui4 di2fang1 IC he4 die2 ke4 de5 ming4zhong4lu:4 20 %，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Increases your chance to hit against enemy IC and deckers by 25% for 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"提高​对​敌方​IC​和​碟​客​的​命中率​25​%​，​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"ti2gao1 dui4 di2fang1 IC he4 die2 ke4 de5 ming4zhong4lu:4 25 %，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Indeed I did. Flippy disks were a term for floppies that had been flipped so"
" that they could have data written to their opposite side, once the front "
"was full up. These had very small data capacities, maybe 1.4 megs at the "
"greatest. These days, you can’t write a credstick with that little data. "
"They had to be much more meticulous with their data structures back in the "
"20th century, far more than we ever have to care about these days. People "
"could learn a lot more from old tech than it seems anyone cares to."
msgstr ""
"确实​如此​。​翻盘​是​磁盘​的​一种​特殊​称谓​，​指​的​是​当​正面​存储空间​已满时​，​可​翻转​至​背面​继续​写入​数据​的​磁盘​。​这​类​磁盘​的​数据​容量​极其​有限​，​最大​容量​可能​仅​有​1​.​4​兆​字节​。​如今​，​如此​微量​的​数据​根本​不足以​写入​存储卡​。​二十世纪​的​人们​必须​对​数据结构​精益求精​，​其​严谨​程度​远超​我们​当今​的​标准​。​人们​本​可​从​老旧​技术​中​汲取​更​多​智慧​，​可惜​似乎​无人​愿意​关注​。\n"
"que4shi2 ru2ci3。fan1pan2 shi4 ci2pan2 de5 yi1zhong3 te4shu1 cheng1wei4，zhi3 de5 shi4 dang1 zheng4mian4 cun2 chu3 kong1 jian1 yi3 man3 shi2，ke3 fan1zhuan3 zhi4 bei4mian4 ji4xu4 xie3 ru4 shu4ju4 de5 ci2pan2。zhe4 lei4 ci2pan2 de5 shu4ju4 rong2liang4 ji2qi2 you3xian4，zui4 dai4 rong2liang4 ke3neng2 jin3 you3 1. 4 zhao4 zi4jie2。ru2jin1，ru2ci3 wei1liang4 de5 shu4ju4 gen1ben3 bu4 ju4 yi3 xie3 ru4 cun2chu3ka3。er4shi2shi4ji4 de5 ren2men5 bi4xu1 dui4 shu4ju4jie2gou4 jing1yi4qiu2jing1，qi2 yan2jin3 cheng2du4 yuan3chao1 wo3men5 dang1jin1 de5 biao1zhun3。ren2men5 ben3 ke3 cong2 lao3jiu4 ji4shu4 zhong4 ji2qu3 geng1 duo1 zhi4hui4，ke3xi1 si4hu1 wu2ren2 yuan4yi4 guan1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Indeed not. Dante is part hellhound, bred to be an elite guard dog. I assume"
" he has manifested some of his... Awakened abilities?"
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​但丁​带有​地狱​猎犬​的​部分​血统​，​被​培育​为​精英​护卫​犬​。​我​猜​他​已经​显现出​了​部分​……​觉醒​能力​？\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。dan4ding1 dai4you3 di4yu4 lie4quan3 de5 bu4fen5 xue4tong3，bei4 pei2yu4 wei2 jing1ying1 hu4wei4 quan3。wo3 cai1 ta1 yi3jing1 xian3 xian4 chu1 le5 bu4fen5……jue2xing3 neng2li4？"

msgid ""
"Indeed they are.\n"
"\n"
"Do you need anything else, friend?"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​朋友​，​你​还有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"peng2you5，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Indeed we are. Kristian and Karin."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​克里斯蒂安​和​卡琳​。\n"
"shi4 de5。ke4li3si1di4an1 he4 ka3 lin2。"

msgid "Indeed we did, Altuğ. "
msgstr ""
"的确如此​，​奥图​伊​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3，ao4 tu2 yi1。"

msgid "Indeed we will."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。"

msgid "Indeed we will. (h)"
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"Indeed you do. The bugs were installed exactly as they should have been.\n"
"\n"
"Jana should be happy, too. She did an excellent job of planting the bomb. Her debt to us has been cleared."
msgstr ""
"确实​如此​。​监控​安装​得​恰到好处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​简娜​也​该​感到高兴​。​她​埋设​炸弹​的​手法​堪称​完美​。​她​欠​我们​的​债​已经​一笔勾销​了​。\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2 ru2ci3。jian1kong4 an1zhuang1 de2 qia4dao4hao3chu4。\n"
"\n"
"Jian3na4 ye3 gai1 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4。ta1 mai2she4 zha4dan4 de5 shou3fa3 kan1cheng1 wan2mei3。ta1 qian4 wo3men5 de5 zhai4 yi3jing1 yi1bi3gou1xiao1 le5。"

msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""
"的确​。\n"
"di2que4。"

msgid ""
"Indeed.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He flicks the ash from the tip of his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, you have nothing to worry about now. Short of employing a tactical nuclear weapon, APEX cannot touch us down here... and that is unlikely, to say the least."
msgstr ""
"的确​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​弹掉​烟头​上​的​灰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​你​现在​无需​担忧​。​除非​动用​战术​核武器​，​否则​APEX​根本无法​触及​这里​……​而​这种​可能性​，​至少​可以​说​是​微乎其微​。\n"
"\n"
"di2que4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dan4 diao4 yan1tou2 shang4 de5 hui1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，ni3 xian4zai4 wu2xu1 dan1you1。chu2fei1 dong4yong4 zhan4shu4 he2wu3qi4，fou3ze2 APEX gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 chu4ji2 zhe4li3……er2 zhe4zhong3 ke3neng2xing4，zhi4shao3 ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 wei1hu1qi2wei1。"

msgid "Indeed. And you are wise to know it."
msgstr ""
"你​能​意识​到​这​一点​，​很​明智​。\n"
"ni3 neng2 yi4shi2 dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3，hen3 ming2zhi4。"

msgid ""
"Indeed. Considering how long his innards were exposed to the open air, his "
"prognosis is looking rather good."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​考虑​到​他​的​内脏​暴露​在外​的​时间​，​他​的​术后​恢复​看起来​相当​不错​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。kao3lu:4 dao4 ta1 de5 nei4zang4 bao4lu4 zai4wai4 de5 shi2jian1，ta1 de5 shu4hou4 hui1fu4 kan4qi3lai5 xiang1dang1 bu4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Indeed. I have transferred the information that we received from Altuğ to the computer terminal in the next room.\n"
"\n"
"It used to be Monika's personal workstation, $(l.name). Now it is yours. Monika kept a variety of notes and dossiers on that machine. I would suggest reviewing her notes when you have the time."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​我​已​将​奥图​伊​提供​的​情报​传输​到​了​隔壁​房间​的​电脑​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​莫妮卡​的​专用​工作站​，​$(l.name)​。​现在​它​是​你​的​了​。​莫妮卡​在​那台​机器​上​保存​了​各种​笔记​和​档案​，​我​建议​你​有空时​可以​查阅​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。wo3 yi3 jiang1 ao4 tu2 yi1 ti2gong1 de5 qing2bao4 chuan2shu1 dao4 le5 ge2bi4 fang2jian1 de5 dian4nao3 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 zhuan1yong4 gong1zuo4zhan4，$(l.name)。xian4zai4 ta1 shi4 ni3 de5 le5。Mo4ni1ka3 zai4 na4 tai2 ji1qi4 shang4 bao3cun2 le5 ge4zhong3 bi3ji4 he4 dang4an4，wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 you3 kong1 shi2 ke3yi3 cha2yue4 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"Indeed. If Audran were a denizen of the SOX - a glowpunk - his lack of identifying information would make sense.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel adjusts his glasses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a working theory, at any rate."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​如果​奥​德兰​是​待​在​萨洛​卢区​的​幽光​住民​，​那么​他​缺乏​身份​信息​的​事情​也​就​说​得​通​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​推​了​推​眼镜​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​这是​一种​可行​的​理论​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。ru2guo3 Ao4de2lan2 shi4 dai1 zai4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 de5 you1 guang1 zhu4 min2，na4me5 ta1 que1fa2 shen1fen4 xin4xi1 de5 shi4qing5 ye3 jiu4 shuo1 de2 tong1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 tui1 le5 tui1 yan3jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，zhe4 shi4 yi1zhong3 ke3xing2 de5 li3lun4。"

msgid "Indeed. Look, this has been a really interesting discussion--"
msgstr ""
"确实​。​好​吧​，​这场​讨论​挺​有意思​—​—\n"
"que4shi2。hao3 ba1，zhe4 chang2 tao3lun4 ting3 you3yi4si5 — —"

msgid ""
"Indeed. There are more things in heaven and earth than are dreamt of in your"
" philosophy. Things you do not wish to know."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​大千世界​，​无奇不有​，​总有​令人​畏惧​的​事物​。\n"
"shi4 a1。da4qian1shi4jie4，wu2qi2bu4you3，zong3you3 ling4ren2 wei4ju4 de5 shi4wu4。"

msgid ""
"Induces pain.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He snickers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a narrow-band microwave projector. Causes debilitating pain in a target, and screws with the electrical systems of drones and the like.\n"
"\n"
"Think of it like a taser, only easier to use, and meaner, and a whole LOT more fun."
msgstr ""
"诱发​疼痛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​窃笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​是​一台​窄频​微波​发射器​，​能​给​目标​造成​剧烈​疼痛​，​并​干扰​无人机​等​设备​的​电子系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​当​它​是​泰瑟枪​，​只是​操作​更​简单​，​杀伤力​更大​，​而且​有趣​的​多​。\n"
"\n"
"you4fa1 teng2tong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qie4xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 yi1 tai2 zhai3 pin2 wei1bo1 fa1she4qi4，neng2 gei3 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 ju4lie4 teng2tong4，bing4 gan1rao3 wu2ren2ji1 deng3 she4bei4 de5 dian4 zi3 xi4 tong3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 dang1 ta1 shi4 tai4se4qiang1，zhi3shi4 cao1zuo4 geng1 jian3dan1，sha1shang1li4 geng1 dai4，er2qie3 you3qu4 de5 duo1。"

msgid "Induction Datajack"
msgstr ""
"感应式​数据​插口\n"
"gan3 ying1 shi4 shu4ju4 cha1kou3"

msgid ""
"Industrial-strength coveralls. Protects against dangers from accidents to "
"paranormal critters. +1 Intelligence and +1 Drone Combat."
msgstr ""
"工业​级​防护服​。​可​有效​防护​从​意外事故​到​超自然​生物​的​各种​危险​。​智力​+​1​，​无人机​战斗​+​1​。\n"
"gong1ye4 ji2 fang2hu4fu2。ke3 you3xiao4 fang2hu4 cong2 yi4wai4shi4gu4 dao4 chao1zi4ran2 sheng1wu4 de5 ge4zhong3 wei1xian3。zhi4li4 +1，wu2ren2ji1 zhan4dou4 +1。"

msgid "Industrious Line Jumpsuit"
msgstr ""
"连体​工作服\n"
"lian2ti3 gong1zuo4fu2"

msgid "Infection: HP -2 per RND"
msgstr ""
"感染​：​每​回合​损失​2​点​生命​值\n"
"gan3ran3：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 2 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "Infection: HP -4 per RND"
msgstr ""
"感染​：​每​回合​损失​4​点​生命​值\n"
"gan3ran3：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 4 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "Infection: HP -6 per RND"
msgstr ""
"感染​：​每​回合​损失​6​点​生命​值\n"
"gan3ran3：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 6 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "Inferno"
msgstr ""
"地狱\n"
"di4yu4"

msgid ""
"Influences others subconsciously, granting the user a subtle edge. Adds +1 "
"Charisma."
msgstr ""
"在​潜意识​里​影响​他人​，​赋予​使用者​微妙​的​优势​。​+​1​魅力​。\n"
"zai4 qian2yi4shi2 li3 ying3xiang3 ta1ren2，fu4yu3 shi3yong4zhe3 wei1miao4 de5 you1shi4。+1 mei4li4。"

msgid "Info Terminal"
msgstr ""
"信息​终端\n"
"xin4xi1 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Ingram Smartgun"
msgstr ""
"英​格拉姆​智慧​枪\n"
"ying1 ge2 la1 mu3 zhi4hui4 qiang1"

msgid "Ingram Smartgun (Smartlink)"
msgstr ""
"英​格拉姆​智慧​枪​（​智能​枪版​）\n"
"ying1 ge2 la1 mu3 zhi4hui4 qiang1 （zhi4neng2 qiang1ban3）"

msgid "Input Command:"
msgstr ""
"请​输入​指令​：\n"
"qing3 shu1ru4 zhi3ling4："

msgid "Input Final Delete Command"
msgstr ""
"输入​最终​删除​命令\n"
"shu1ru4 zui4zhong1 shan1chu2 ming4ling4"

msgid "Input the final delete command into the interface terminal."
msgstr ""
"在​接口​终端​输入​最后​的​删除​命令​。\n"
"zai4 jie1kou3 zhong1duan1 shu1ru4 zui4hou4 de5 shan1chu2 ming4ling4。"

msgid ""
"Inside is a contact book with an impressively long list of names. None of them stand out to you in any way.\n"
"\n"
"You also find a tube of lip balm and a credstick."
msgstr ""
"里面​有​一本​通讯录​，​上面​列着​好长​一串​名字​。​你​对​这些​名字​毫无​印象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还​发现​了​一支​润唇膏​和​一根​信用​棒​。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 you3 yi1 ben3 tong1xun4lu4，shang4mian4 lie4 zhao2 hao3 zhang3 yi1 chuan4 ming2zi5。ni3 dui4 zhe4xie1 ming2zi5 hao2wu2 yin4xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 zhi1 run4chun2gao1 he4 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4。"

msgid ""
"Inside the chipjack, you find a glob of plastic. It looks as though whatever this guy was running melted down sometime after he slotted it.\n"
"\n"
"A chipjack like this couldn't generate enough heat to destroy a simsense chip. The only logical conclusion is that the chip itself was wired to melt down after use."
msgstr ""
"在​芯片​插口​内部​，​你​发现​了​一团​塑料​。​看起来​，​无论​这个​人​之前​在​运行​什么​，​都​在​他​插入​后​不久​熔化​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​像​这样​的​芯片​插口​无法​产生​足够​的​热量​来​破坏​拟感​芯片​。​唯一​的​合理​结论​是​，​芯片​本身​被​设计​成在​使用​后​会​熔化​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 xin1pian4 cha1kou3 nei4bu4，ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 tuan2 su4liao4。kan4qi3lai5，wu2lun4 zhe4ge5 ren2 zhi1qian2 zai4 yun4xing2 shen2me5，dou1 zai4 ta1 cha1ru4 hou4 bu4jiu3 rong2hua4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 zhe4yang4 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3 wu2fa3 chan3sheng1 zu2gou4 de5 re4liang4 lai2 po4huai4 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4。wei2yi1 de5 he2li3 jie2lun4 shi4，xin1pian4 ben3shen1 bei4 she4ji4 cheng2 zai4 shi3yong4 hou4 hui4 rong2hua4。"

msgid ""
"Inside the safe you find a bundle of old, well-worn media discs. The words "
"\"WATCH ME\" have been hastily written on the back of the topmost disc."
msgstr ""
"你​在​保险箱​里​找到​了​一叠​破旧​的​老式​光盘​。​在​最​顶上​那张​光盘​的​背面​，​有人​匆匆​写下​了​两个​字​：​“​看​我​”​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 bao3xian3xiang1 li3 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1 die2 po4jiu4 de5 lao3shi4 guang1pan2。zai4 zui4 ding3shang4 na4 zhang1 guang1pan2 de5 bei4mian4，you3ren2 cong1cong1 xie3xia4 le5 liang3 ge4 zi4：“kan4 wo3”。"

msgid "Inspect"
msgstr ""
"检视\n"
"jian3shi4"

msgid "Install Cyberware?"
msgstr ""
"安装​赛博​改造​？\n"
"an1zhuang1 sai4bo2 gai3zao4？"

msgid "Installed"
