"有意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​居然​会​在​最后​一刻​改变​计划​。\n"
"\n"
"you3yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ju1ran2 hui4 zai4 zui4hou4 yi1 ke4 gai3bian4 ji4hua4。"

