"Interesting.\n"
"\n"
"Tell me more."
msgstr ""
"有意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​我​多​说​说​。\n"
"\n"
"you3yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"he4 wo3 duo1 shuo1 shuo1。"

