"you3yi4si5。wo3 yuan2ben3 shi4 xiang3 que4ren4 mou3ren2 de5 shuo1fa3，kan4lai5 zhe4 zheng4hao3 yin4zheng4 le5 ta1。xie4xie5，E1er3jie2nong2。"

