"\n"
"you3yi4si5。You2li3，ni3 ren4de5 zhe4ge5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 cong2 ni3 shou3 shang4 jie1guo4 xin1pian4，ba3 ta1 dui4zhun3 deng1guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 shi2bie2 biao1ji4。wo3 jian4 guo4 zu2gou4 duo1 de5 BTL，zhi1dao4 ta1 ying1gai1 shi4 ge4 shen2me5 yang4zi5，dan4 zhe4 ci4 bu4tong2——ta1 xian3ran2 jing1guo4 le5 mou3zhong3 gai3zhuang1。"

