"zhe4 shi4“hai1 fan1 tian1”？wo3 cong2 shang1xue2yuan4 bi4ye4 hou4 jiu4 mei2 yong4 guo4 ta1 le5！zhe4 wan2yi4r5 jian3zhi2 shi4*zui4 bang4 de5*！"

