msgstr ""
"是​这样​吗​，​尤里​？​你​又​回到​前​老板​的​手下​做事​了​？\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4 ma5，You2li3？ni3 you4 hui2dao4 qian2 lao3ban3 de5 shou3xia4 zuo4shi4 le5？"

