"bu4 la1 jia1 qi2，na4ge5 jiu4shi4 jie1ti4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 ren2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Is that the only thing you’ll respond to? Or can I talk to you like a normal"
" person?"
msgstr ""
"你​只能​对​那句话​作​回应​吗​？​还是​说​我​能​和​你​正常​聊天​？\n"
"ni3 zhi3neng2 dui4 na4 ju4 hua4 zuo4 hui2ying4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 wo3 neng2 he4 ni3 zheng4chang2 liao2tian1？"

msgid "Is that what I think it is?"
msgstr ""
"那​是​我​想​的​那种​东西​吗​？\n"
"na4 shi4 wo3 xiang3 de5 na4zhong3 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Is that what this was about for you? You *wanted* something like this to "
"happen?"
msgstr ""
"这​就是​一切​对​你​的​意义​吗​？​你​*​想​让​*​这种​事​发生​？\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 yi1qie4 dui4 ni3 de5 yi4yi4 ma5？ni3*xiang3 rang4*zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1？"

msgid ""
"Is that wise? Samuel's employees have no love for Humanis... most of them "
"don't even like humans."
msgstr ""
"这​明智​吗​？​塞缪尔​的​大部分​手下​都​不怎么​喜欢​人类​，​更​别说​人类​至上​主义者​了​。\n"
"zhe4 ming2zhi4 ma5？sai4miu4er3 de5 da4bu4fen5 shou3xia4 dou1 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 ren2lei4，geng1 bie2shuo1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 le5。"

msgid "Is the bartender here any good?"
msgstr ""
"这里​的​调酒师​怎么样​？\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 tiao2jiu3shi1 zen3me5yang4？"

msgid "Is the other girl in the picture Marta?"
msgstr ""
"照片​里​的​另​一个​女孩​是​玛​尔塔​吗​？\n"
"zhao4pian4 li3 de5 ling4 yi1ge5 nu:3hai2 shi4 Ma3er3ta3 ma5？"

msgid "Is there a problem?"
msgstr ""
"有事吗​？\n"
"you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Is there any part of this building that *isn't* restricted?"
msgstr ""
"这栋​楼里​有​*​不是​*​禁区​的​地方​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 dong4 lou2 li3 you3*bu4shi4*jin4qu1 de5 di4fang1 ma5？"

msgid "Is there anything we can help you with?"
msgstr ""
"我们​能​为​你​做些​什么​吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Is there something I should know? Some last words of… I don’t know… wisdom?"
msgstr ""
"你​要​什么​要​告诉​我​的​吗​？​比方说​……​最后​箴言​之类​的​？\n"
"ni3 yao4 shen2me5 yao4 gao4su4 wo3 de5 ma5？bi3fang5shuo1……zui4hou4 zhen1yan2 zhi1lei4 de5？"

msgid "Is there something else that I can help you find?"
msgstr ""
"还​需要​我​帮​你​找些​什么​？\n"
"hai2 xu1yao4 wo3 bang1 ni3 zhao3 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid "Is there something else?"
msgstr ""
"还有​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Is there something going on around here?"
msgstr ""
"附近​有​发生​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"fu4jin4 you3 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Is this a picture of you and Marta?"
msgstr ""
"这​是​你​和​玛​尔塔​的​照片​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 he4 Ma3er3ta3 de5 zhao4pian4 ma5？"

msgid "Is this astral space?"
msgstr ""
"这里​是​星界​吗​？\n"
"zhe4li3 shi4 xing1 jie4 ma5？"

msgid "Is this where it happened?"
msgstr ""
"事情​就是​在​这里​发生​的​？\n"
"shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zai4 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 de5？"

msgid "Is your curiosity satisfied? Or do you need something else?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​好奇心​得到​满足​了​吗​？​还是​说​你​还有​别的​事​？\n"
"ni3 de5 hao4qi2xin1 de2dao4 man3zu2 le5 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4？"

msgid "Islay Scotch"
msgstr ""
"艾雷岛​威士忌\n"
"ai4 lei2 dao3 wei1shi4ji4"

msgid ""
"Islay, you say? Might I examine the merchandise?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes the bottle and his smile fades for a moment as he become all business examining it with a critical eye. Then, as quickly as it faded, the huge smile is back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Quite a little treasure you have found, I'm sorely tempted to ask from where, in hopes of procuring more you see. But no, it would not be polite."
msgstr ""
"你​说​艾雷岛​？​能​给​我​看看​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​接过​酒瓶​，​脸上​的​笑容​瞬间​切换​为​专业​神情​，​用​挑剔​的​目光​仔细​端详​起来​。​然而​下个​瞬间​，​他​又​重新​绽放​出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​倒​是​淘到​了​一件​小宝贝​，​我​真想​问问​从​哪儿​弄​来​的​，​好​再​去​淘​一些​呢​。​不过​不行​，​这​可​不够​礼貌​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ai4 lei2 dao3？neng2 gei3 wo3 kan4kan5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jie1guo4 jiu3 ping2，lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 shun4jian1 qie1huan4 wei2 zhuan1ye4 shen2qing2，yong4 tiao1ti5 de5 mu4guang1 zi3xi4 duan1xiang2 qi3lai5。ran2er2 xia4ge5 shun4jian1，ta1 you4 chong2xin1 zhan4fang4 chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dao3 shi4 tao2 dao4 le5 yi1 jian4 xiao3 bao3 bei4，wo3 zhen1 xiang3 wen4 wen4 cong2 na3r5 long4 lai2 de5，hao3 zai4 qu4 tao2 yi1xie1 ni2。bu4guo4 bu4xing2，zhe4 ke3 bu4gou4 li3mao4。"

msgid ""
"Isn't it obvious? \n"
"\n"
"The Siegessäule: a monument to the hubris of the Prussian state, gets blown to bits. So someone takes a lot of bits and builds a monument to the hubris of anarchy. "
msgstr ""
"这​不是​显而易见​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​胜利​纪念柱​—​—​这座​象征​普鲁士​国家​狂妄自大​的​纪念碑​被​炸​得​粉碎​。​于是​有人​拾起​无数​碎片​，​筑起​一座​致敬​无政府主义​狂妄​的​纪念碑​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 xian3er2yi4jian4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"sheng4li4 ji4 nian4 zhu4——zhe4 zuo4 xiang4zheng1 pu3lu3shi4 guo2jia1 kuang2wang4zi4da4 de5 ji4nian4bei1 bei4 zha2 de2 fen3sui4。yu2shi4 you3ren2 she4 qi3 wu2shu4 sui4pian4，zhu4 qi3 yi1 zuo4 zhi4jing4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 kuang2wang4 de5 ji4nian4bei1。"

msgid ""
"Isn't it obvious? I want your *help,* $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I'm still alive, but only barely... I don't have the strength to do much myself any more, and Audran cannot handle this task on his own."
msgstr ""
"这​还​不​明显​吗​？​我​需要​你​的​*​帮助​*​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​目前​还​活着​，​但​也​只是​勉强​度日​……​我​没有​力气​再​做​什么​事情​，​而​奥​德兰​自己​一个​人​也​没​办法​完成​这个​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 bu4 ming2xian3 ma5？wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5*bang1zhu4*，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mu4qian2 hai2 huo2zhe5，dan4 ye3 zhi3shi4 mian3qiang3 du4ri4……wo3 mei2you3 li4qi5 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5 shi4qing5，er2 Ao4de2lan2 zi4ji3 yi1ge5 ren2 ye3 mei2 ban4fa3 wan2cheng2 zhe4ge5 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"Isn't it? You beat the tar out of that man because of what he told you. As "
"your team leader, I need to know why that happened."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​但​你​可是​因为​他​说​的话​而​把​他​狠狠​收拾​了​一顿​。​作为​队长​，​我​需要​知道​原因​。\n"
"shi4 ma5？dan4 ni3 ke3shi4 yin1wei4 ta1 shuo1 de5hua4 er2 ba3 ta1 hen3hen3 shou1shi5 le5 yi1 dun4。zuo4wei2 dui4zhang3，wo3 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 yuan2yin1。"

msgid ""
"Isn't that a bit... premature? We don't even know what Alice has come up "
"with."
msgstr ""
"这​是不是​有点​……​仓促​？​我们​甚至​都​不​知道​爱丽丝​手上​有​什么​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4bu5shi4 you3dian3……cang1cu4？wo3men5 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 ai4li4si1 shou3 shang4 you3 shen2me5。"

msgid "Isn't that nice for you."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​挺​好​的​吗​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 ting3 hao3 de5 ma5。"

msgid "Isn't that... I don't know... reckless?"
msgstr ""
"这样​……​是不是​……​有点​草率​了​？\n"
"zhe4yang4……shi4bu5shi4……you3dian3 cao3shuai4 le5？"

msgid "Isn't there anything I can do to make this right?"
msgstr ""
"我要​怎样才能​弥补​呢​？\n"
"wo3 yao4 zen3 yang4 cai2 neng2 mi2bu3 ni2？"

msgid "Isn't there anything we can do to help her?"
msgstr ""
"就​没有​什么​能​帮​上​她​的​法子​吗​？\n"
"jiu4 mei2you3 shen2me5 neng2 bang1 shang4 ta1 de5 fa3zi5 ma5？"

msgid "Isn't there something that you can do to stop that from happening?"
msgstr ""
"你​就​没有​什么​办法​阻止​它​发生​吗​？\n"
"ni3 jiu4 mei2you3 shen2me5 ban4fa3 zu3zhi3 ta1 fa1sheng1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"It *is* fixed. But the person who built this thing \"fixed\" it in a "
"different way."
msgstr ""
"*​确实​*​修好​了​。​不过​造​这​东西​的​人​“​修好​”​它​的​方式​并​不​一般​。\n"
"*que4shi2*xiu1hao3 le5。bu4guo4 zao4 zhe4 dong1xi1 de5 ren2“xiu1hao3” ta1 de5 fang1shi4 bing4 bu4 yi1ban1。"

msgid "It ain't a job. Sooner you realize that, the better."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​差事​。​你​越​早​明白​这个​越​好​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 cha4shi4。ni3 yue4 zao3 ming2bai5 zhe4ge5 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"It ain't easy. They charge less in protection than the Arbeiters did, but they don't care about keeping anything even approaching order. They just hide out in their clubhouse, get high, and summon spirits that terrorize and kill people up on the third floor.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Poor bastards."
msgstr ""
"确实​不​轻松​。​他们​收​的​保护费​比​工人​帮少​，​但​他们​完全​不在乎​哪怕​稍微​维持​一点​秩序​。​他们​只会​躲​在​自己​的​会​所里​嗑​药​作乐​，​以及​召唤​那些​在​三楼​恐吓​杀人​、​肆虐横行​的​精魂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一群​倒霉蛋​。\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2 bu4 qing1song1。ta1men5 shou1 de5 bao3 hu4 fei4 bi3 gong1ren2 bang1 shao3，dan4 ta1men5 wan2quan2 bu4zai4hu5 na3pa4 shao1wei1 wei2chi2 yi1dian3 zhi4xu4。ta1men5 zhi3 hui4 duo3 zai4 zi4ji3 de5 hui4 suo3 li3 ke4 yao4 zuo4le4，yi3ji2 zhao4huan4 na4xie1 zai4 san1 lou2 kong3he4 sha1ren2、si4 nu:e4 heng2 xing2 de5 jing1hun2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1 qun2 dao3mei2dan4。"

msgid "It all seems pretty clear-cut to me."
msgstr ""
"对​我​来说​事情​已经​很​清楚​了​。\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 hen3 qing1chu5 le5。"

msgid "It all sounds wiz to me. Let's see what you've got."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​都​挺不错​。​让​我​看看​你​的​货​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 dou1 ting3 bu4 cuo4。rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 de5 huo4。"

msgid ""
"It also means that Germany is in deep shit. \n"
"\n"
"Because if Feuerschwinge is still alive, it's only a matter of time before she rears her ugly head again."
msgstr ""
"这​还​意味着​德国​现在​有大​麻烦​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​如果​火翼​还​活着​，​她​卷土重来​只会​是​时间​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 yi4wei4zhe5 de2guo2 xian4zai4 you3 dai4 ma2fan5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 ru2guo3 Huo3yi4 hai2 huo2zhe5，ta1 juan3tu3chong2lai2 zhi3 hui4 shi4 shi2jian1 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"It appears that regardless of who prevails, this encounter will end poorly for someone. \n"
"\n"
"You, me, the dragon… Berlin. That cannot be helped now."
msgstr ""
"看来​无论谁​胜出​，​失败​的​一方​都​不会​有​好下场​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​、​我​、​巨龙​……​柏林​。​现在​已经​无法​收手​了​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wu2 lun2 shei2 sheng4chu1，shi1bai4 de5 yi1fang1 dou1 bu4hui4 you3 hao3 xia4 chang2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3、wo3、ju4long2……bo2lin2。xian4zai4 yi3jing1 wu2fa3 shou1shou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"It appears that the Rabengeister keep a detailed inventory of their stolen goods. \n"
"\n"
"A quick scan of the data indicates that while the medical supplies bound for the Kreuzbasar are long gone, Gunari's missing weapons shipment is currently in a storage locker at Frankfurter Tor. The locker number is marked as 49. "
msgstr ""
"看来​“​鸦灵​”​对​他们​的​赃物​进行​了​详细​记录​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​迅速​浏览​了​一遍​数据​，​看起来​运往​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​医疗​用品​早已​不翼而飞​，​而​古纳里​丢失​的​那批​武器​目前​在​法兰克福​门​的​49​号​储物柜​里​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5“Ya1ling2” dui4 ta1men5 de5 zang1wu4 jin4xing2 le5 xiang2xi4 ji4lu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xun4su4 liu2lan3 le5 yi1bian4 shu4ju4，kan4qi3lai5 yun4 wang3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 yi1liao2 yong4pin3 zao3yi3 bu4yi4er2fei1，er2 gu3 na4 li3 diu1shi1 de5 na4 pi1 wu3qi4 mu4qian2 zai4 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2 de5 49 hao4 chu3wu4gui4 li3。"

msgid ""
"It appears that the basilisk was being used as the primary focus of a passion project at Sutterlin: an attempt to create a magically active piece of bioware. Why the executives in charge of the project felt that a basilisk would make an appropriate test subject is not clarified.\n"
"\n"
"The list of procedures performed on the creature is extensive, including a series of unanesthetized thoracic surgeries."
msgstr ""
"看来​，​这条​蛇​怪​正是​苏​特林​一项​激情​项目​的​核心​：​即​试图​创造​一款​具有​魔力​活性​的​生体​殖装​。​至于​为何​负责​该项​目的​高管会​觉得​蛇怪​是​合适​的​实验​对象​，​文档​中​并​没有​给出​解释​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​这​只​生物​执行​的​实验​清单​相当​冗长​，​其中​包括​一系列​在​未​使用​麻醉​的​情况​下​进行​的​胸腔​手术​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5，zhe4 tiao2 she2 guai4 zheng4shi4 su1 te4 lin2 yi1 xiang4 ji1qing2 xiang4mu4 de5 he2xin1：ji2 shi4tu2 chuang4zao4 yi1 kuan3 ju4you3 mo2li4 huo2xing4 de5 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1。zhi4yu2 wei4he2 fu4ze2 gai1 xiang4 mu4di4 gao1 guan3 hui4 jue2de5 she2 guai4 shi4 he2shi4 de5 shi2yan4 dui4xiang4，wen2dang4 zhong4 bing4 mei2you3 gei3 chu1 jie3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 zhe4 zhi3 sheng1wu4 zhi2xing2 de5 shi2yan4 qing1dan1 xiang1dang1 rong3chang2，qi2zhong1 bao1kuo4 yi1xi4lie4 zai4 wei4 shi3yong4 ma2zui4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 jin4xing2 de5 xiong1qiang1 shou3shu4。"

msgid ""
"It appears that this lab has been experimenting with hyperthermophilic organisms -  animals that thrive in temperatures high enough to kill most other organisms.\n"
"\n"
"From what you can tell, the lab has been attempting to isolate the genes that make survival in such extreme conditions possible."
msgstr ""
"看来​这个​实验室​一直​在​研究​超​嗜​热菌​—​—​那些​能​在​足以​杀死​大多数​其他​生物​的​高温​环境​中​生存​的​生物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​目前​的​情况​来看​，​该​实验室​似乎​正在​试图​分离​出使​这些​生物能​在​如此​极端​环境​中​生存​的​基因​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 zhe4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 yi1zhi2 zai4 yan2jiu1 chao1 shi4 re4 jun1——na4xie1 neng2 zai4 zu2yi3 sha1si3 da4duo1shu4 qi2ta1 sheng1wu4 de5 gao1wen1 huan2jing4 zhong4 sheng1cun2 de5 sheng1wu4。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4 lai2 kan4，gai1 shi2yan4shi4 si4hu1 zheng4zai4 shi4tu2 fen1li2 chu1shi3 zhe4xie1 sheng1wu4neng2 zai4 ru2ci3 ji2duan1 huan2jing4 zhong4 sheng1cun2 de5 ji1yin1。"

msgid "It bears looking into."
msgstr ""
"值得​调查​一下​。\n"
"zhi2de5 diao4cha2 yi1xia4。"

msgid "It can be a bit overwhelming."
msgstr ""
"确实​可能​有些​让​人​不知所措​。\n"
"que4shi2 ke3neng2 you3xie1 rang4 ren2 bu4zhi1suo3cuo4。"

msgid ""
"It certainly is, but that hasn't stopped some daring individuals here from doing what they can to try to help...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns to face the ork, thrusting her microphone toward his face. He takes a reflexive half-step backward.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"确实​如此​，​但​这​并未​阻止​这里​一些​勇敢​的​人们​竭尽所能​地​伸出​援手​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转身​面对​兽​人​，​将​话筒​猛地​凑到​他​面前​。​兽​人​下意识​地​后退​半步​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2 ru2ci3，dan4 zhe4 bing4wei4 zu3zhi3 zhe4li3 yi1xie1 yong3gan3 de5 ren2men5 jie2 jin3 suo3 neng2 de5 shen1chu1 yuan2shou3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 shou4 ren2，jiang1 hua4tong3 meng3de5 cou4 dao4 ta1 mian4qian2。shou4 ren2 xia4yi4shi2 de5 hou4tui4 ban4 bu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"It could be my business. You know Altuğ?\n"
"\n"
"I'm his ears and hands outside the cafe. Gotta keep my eyes and ears open."
msgstr ""
"那​可不​一定​。​你​知道​奥图​伊​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​他​在​咖啡馆​之外​的​耳目​。​眼观六路​，​耳听八方​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ke3bu5 yi1ding4。ni3 zhi1dao4 ao4 tu2 yi1 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 ta1 zai4 ka1fei1guan3 zhi1wai4 de5 er3mu4。yan3 guan1 liu4 lu4，er3 ting1 ba1 fang1。"

msgid "It couldn't be helped."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​无可奈何​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4 wu2ke3nai4he2。"

msgid "It didn't go down like that - not really."
msgstr ""
"事情​不是​这样​的​。​不是​的​。\n"
"shi4qing5 bu4shi4 zhe4yang4 de5。bu4shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"It does, for you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He slips a credstick into your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here is your pay."
msgstr ""
"对​你​而言​，​一定​是​有​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​一根​信用​棒​塞进​你​手里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​你​的​报酬​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 ni3 er2yan2，yi1ding4 shi4 you3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4 se4 jin4 ni3 shou3li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid ""
"It doesn't *matter* why Vauclair killed Monika, and Paul, and all of those other people in the Kreuzbasar. All that matters is that he did.\n"
"\n"
"I'm going to bury him for that. You're welcome to help."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​为何​杀害​莫妮卡​、​保罗​以及​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​那些​人​，​这些​都​*​不​重要​*​。​重要​的​是​他​确实​这么​做​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为此​，​我​一定​要​干掉​他​。​你​愿意​帮忙​就​一​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 wei4he2 sha1hai4 Mo4ni1ka3、bao3luo2 yi3ji2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 na4xie1 ren2，zhe4xie1 dou1*bu4 zhong4yao4*。zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 ta1 que4shi2 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wei4ci3，wo3 yi1ding4 yao4 gan4diao4 ta1。ni3 yuan4yi4 bang1mang2 jiu4 yi1 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"It doesn't have to be a war story. I just want a better idea of who I'm "
"running with."
msgstr ""
"我​没​说​非得​是​战争​故事​。​我​只是​想​加深​一下​对​队友​的​了解​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 shuo1 fei1dei3 shi4 zhan4zheng1 gu4shi4。wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 jia1shen1 yi1xia4 dui4 dui4you3 de5 liao3jie3。"

msgid ""
"It doesn't matter how I look out here. Only how I look in here.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Kim touches a skinny finger to her temple.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​在​现实​中​看起来​如何​并​不​重要​。​我​只在乎​自己​在​这里​看上去​如何​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​金用​一根​精瘦​的​手指​按着​自己​的​太阳穴​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 xian4shi2 zhong4 kan4qi3lai5 ru2he2 bing4 bu4 zhong4yao4。wo3 zhi3 zai4 hu1 zi4ji3 zai4 zhe4li3 kan4shang5qu5 ru2he2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 yong4 yi1 gen1 jing1shou4 de5 shou3zhi3 an4 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 tai4yang2xue2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"It doesn't matter what I think. What you think - and how you act on it - is "
"what's important."
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​想​并​不​重要​。​你​怎么​想​，​以及​你​如何​应对​，​这才​是​重要​的​。\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 xiang3 bing4 bu4 zhong4yao4。ni3 zen3me5 xiang3，yi3ji2 ni3 ru2he2 ying4dui4，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zhong4yao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"It doesn't matter what excuse he feeds us. Nothing can change what we have to do.\n"
"\n"
"A contract's a contract, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"他​找​什么​借口​都​无所谓​。​无论如何​都​改变​不了​我们​必须​做​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​契约​就是​契约​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhao3 shen2me5 jie4kou3 dou1 wu2suo3wei4。wu2lun4ru2he2 dou1 gai3bian4 bu4le5 wo3men5 bi4xu1 zuo4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"qi4yue1 jiu4shi4 qi4yue1，$(l.name)。"

msgid "It doesn't matter why I care. Just tell me."
msgstr ""
"不要​管​我​在​不在乎​。​告诉​我​。\n"
"bu4yao4 guan3 wo3 zai4 bu4zai4hu5。gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"It doesn’t have to be that way, Doctor. You can still make a difference."
msgstr ""
"事情​不必​非得​如此​，​博士​。​你​还有​机会​补救​。\n"
"shi4qing5 bu4bi4 fei1dei3 ru2ci3，bo2shi4。ni3 hai2you3 ji1hui4 bu3jiu4。"

msgid ""
"It doesn’t matter now. The infusion process has begun. \n"
"\n"
"The dragon is waking up. Soon, she will take flight.\n"
"\n"
"But you will not be alive to witness that. Audran, ensure that they don’t."
msgstr ""
"但​这些​都​不​重要​了​。​注入​程序​已经​启动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​即将​苏醒​。​很快​，​她​就​会​再度​翱翔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​是​没有​机会​活着​看到​这​一切​了​。​奥​德兰​，​剩下​的​交给​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4xie1 dou1 bu4 zhong4yao4 le5。zhu4ru4 cheng2xu4 yi3jing1 qi3dong4。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 ji2jiang1 su1xing3。hen3 kuai4，ta1 jiu4 hui4 zai4du4 ao2xiang2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 shi4 mei2you3 ji1hui4 huo2zhe5 kan4dao4 zhe4 yi1qie4 le5。Ao4de2lan2，sheng4xia4 de5 jiao1gei3 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"It doesn’t matter what your reasons were. I don’t want to hear ‘em. \n"
"\n"
"I’m out."
msgstr ""
"你​的​理由​是​什么​已经​无关紧要​了​。​我​不想​听​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​干​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 li3you2 shi4 shen2me5 yi3jing1 wu2guan1jin3yao4 le5。wo3 bu4xiang3 ting1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 gan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It feels like there hasn't been this much activity since the Flux first "
"began."
msgstr ""
"感觉​自从​动荡​带​开始​以来​，​就​没见​过​这么​热闹​的​场面​。\n"
"gan3jue2 zi4cong2 dong4dang4 dai4 kai1shi3 yi3lai2，jiu4 mei2 jian4 guo4 zhe4me5 re4nao5 de5 chang3mian4。"

msgid ""
"It feels like this guy is getting under your skin, and we can't afford to "
"kill him before we get to the truth."
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​这​家伙​已经​让​你​上头​了​。​我们​不能​在​得到​真相​之前​就​弄死​他​。\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 zhe4 jia1huo5 yi3jing1 rang4 ni3 shang4tou2 le5。wo3men5 bu4neng2 zai4 de2dao4 zhen1xiang4 zhi1qian2 jiu4 nong4si3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"It had drills, and saws, and cutting torches... even a belt sander! The thing could strip and part out a car in two minutes flat!\n"
"\n"
"You can see where this is going, right? Yeah, I know that you can!"
msgstr ""
"有​钻头​、​锯子​、​切割​炬​……​甚至​有​一个​砂磨机​！​那​玩意儿​两分钟​就​能​把​一辆车​拆个​精光​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​猜​到​接下来​会​发生​什么​了​吧​？​没错​，​你​肯定​猜到​了​！\n"
"\n"
"you3 zuan4tou2、ju4zi5、qie1ge1 ju4……shen4zhi4 you3 yi1ge5 sha1 mo2 ji1！na4 wan2yi4r5 liang3 fen4 zhong1 jiu4 neng2 ba3 yi1 liang4 che1 chai1 ge4 jing1guang1！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cai1 dao4 jie1xia4lai2 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 le5 ba1？mei2cuo4，ni3 ken3ding4 cai1 dao4 le5！"

msgid ""
"It had to be an RNA virus. No choice in the matter.\n"
"\n"
"If Panacea is to work, it must be robust. Untreatable. A DNA virus wouldn't fit the bill."
msgstr ""
"必须​是​RNA​病毒​。​这​一点​别无选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​“​万能​药​”​要​发挥作用​，​就​必须​足够​强大​。​无法​治愈​。​DNA​病毒​不​符合要求​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 shi4 RNA bing4du2。zhe4 yi1dian3 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3“wan4neng2 yao4” yao4 fa1 hui1 zuo4 yong4，jiu4 bi4xu1 zu2gou4 qiang2da4。wu2fa3 zhi4yu4。DNA bing4du2 bu4 fu2 ge3 yao4 qiu2。"

msgid "It had to be done, Glory. They would've killed him."
msgstr ""
"我们​必须​这样​做​，​格洛丽​。​否则​他们​会​杀​了​他​。\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhe4yang4 zuo4，Ge2luo4li2。fou3ze2 ta1men5 hui4 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"It happened just before you got here. I don't know how.\n"
"\n"
"I caught sight of him on the way down to the U-Bahn platform, and he looked normal enough. Then one of these bastards winged him, and Dante snapped.\n"
"\n"
"He was on the guy before I could blink."
msgstr ""
"事情​就​发生​在​你​到​这​之前​。​具体​我​也​不​清楚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​走​下​地铁站​台时​瞥见​了​他​，​当时​他​看起来​还​挺​正常​的​。​结果​有个​混蛋​朝​他​开​了​一枪​，​擦伤​了​他​。​然后​但丁​就​发狂​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​眨眼​间​，​他​就​扑​向​了​那​人​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 jiu4 fa1sheng1 zai4 ni3 dao4 zhe4 zhi1qian2。ju4ti3 wo3 ye3 bu4 qing1chu5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zou3 xia4 di4tie3zhan4 tai2 shi2 pie1jian4 le5 ta1，dang1shi2 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hai2 ting3 zheng4chang2 de5。jie1guo3 you3 ge4 hun2dan4 chao2 ta1 kai1 le5 yi1 qiang1，ca1shang1 le5 ta1。ran2hou4 dan4ding1 jiu4 fa1kuang2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zha3yan3 jian1，ta1 jiu4 pu1 xiang4 le5 na4 ren2。"

msgid ""
"It happened like I said. Hoffmann jack-in-the-boxed out of cover at the worst possible moment. Wolff had his throat torn out by shrapnel, and the rest of the team were riddled with bullets as we attempted to fall back.\n"
"\n"
"I took three rounds. Just like I said.\n"
"\n"
"Only one man came out of it unscathed."
msgstr ""
"事情​正如​我​所说​。​霍夫曼​在​最​糟糕​的​时刻​突然​从​掩体​里​蹦​了​出来​。​沃尔夫​的​喉咙​被​弹片​撕裂​，​其余​队员​在​撤退​时​被​子弹​打​得​千疮百孔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​中​了​三枪​。​这个​我​也​说​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只有​一人​毫发无损​地活​了​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1。huo4fu1man4 zai4 zui4 zao1gao1 de5 shi2ke4 tu1ran2 cong2 yan3ti3 li3 beng4 le5 chu1lai2。wo4er3fu1 de5 hou2long2 bei4 dan4pian4 si1lie4，qi2yu2 dui4yuan2 zai4 che4tui4 shi2 bei4 zi3dan4 da3 de2 qian1chuang1bai3kong3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhong4 le5 san1 qiang1。zhe4ge5 wo3 ye3 shuo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3you3 yi1 ren2 hao2 fa1 wu2 sun3 de5 huo2 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid "It happens more often than you'd expect."
msgstr ""
"这种​事比​你​想象​的​更加​频繁​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4 bi3 ni3 xiang3xiang4 de5 geng4jia1 pin2fan2。"

msgid "It happens. Running the shadows is a dangerous line of work."
msgstr ""
"世事​无常​。​跑​这种​差事​本来​就是​把​脑袋​别​在​腰带​上​。\n"
"shi4shi4 wu2chang2。pao2 zhe4zhong3 cha4shi4 ben3lai2 jiu4shi4 ba3 nao3dai5 bie4 zai4 yao1dai4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"It has.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Marta swallows. The horrified look hasn't left her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Glory, what have you *done* to yourself?"
msgstr ""
"太久​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​咽​了​下​唾沫​，​脸上​仍然​挂​着​惊恐​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​，​你​究竟​都​对​自己​做​了​些​*​什么​*​啊​？\n"
"\n"
"tai4 jiu3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 yan1 le5 xia4 tuo4mo5，lian3 shang4 reng2ran2 gua4 zhao2 jing1kong3 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 jiu1jing4 dou1 dui4 zi4ji3 zuo4 le5 xie1*shen2me5*a1？"

msgid ""
"It hasn't always been mine. Once, I shared authority with another, my dear friend Heiner.\n"
"\n"
"Our duumvirate led this building into a golden age! Together, we liberated the Animal Testing Labs and annexed them into our territory.\n"
"\n"
"But then Heiner got eaten by Billy, and the burden of leadership fell onto my shoulders."
msgstr ""
"这​地方​以前​并非​我​一人​所有​。​曾经​，​我​和​我​的​挚友​海纳​共同​统治​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​的​双​王制​让​这栋​建筑​进入​了​黄金时代​！​我们​一起​解放​了​动物​实验室​，​并​将​其​并入​了​我们​的​领地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​后来​海纳​被​比利​吃掉​了​，​领导​的​重担​落​在​了​我​的​肩上​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 yi3qian2 bing4fei1 wo3 yi1 ren2 suo3you3。ceng2jing1，wo3 he4 wo3 de5 zhi4you3 hai3 na4 gong4tong2 tong3zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 shuang1 wang2 zhi4 rang4 zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4 jin4ru4 le5 huang2jin1shi2dai4！wo3men5 yi1qi3 jie3fang4 le5 dong4wu4 shi2yan4shi4，bing4 jiang1 qi2 bing4ru4 le5 wo3men5 de5 ling3di4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hou4lai2 hai3 na4 bei4 bi3li4 chi1diao4 le5，ling3dao3 de5 zhong4dan4 la4 zai4 le5 wo3 de5 jian1 shang4。"

msgid "It helps to keep busy, we find."
msgstr ""
"忙点​好​，​我们​明白​的​。\n"
"mang2 dian3 hao3，wo3men5 ming2bai5 de5。"

msgid ""
"It is a pity that she has passed from this world. She was a magnificent "
"creature, and the world is diminished by her passing. I am sure you would "
"agree. "
msgstr ""
"可惜​她​已经​与世长辞​了​。​多么​壮丽​的​生灵​，​她​的​死​让​这个​纪元​又​黯淡​了​几分​。​我​想​你​也​是​这么​认为​的​吧​。\n"
"ke3xi1 ta1 yi3jing1 yu3shi4chang2ci2 le5。duo1me5 zhuang4li4 de5 sheng1ling2，ta1 de5 si3 rang4 zhe4ge5 ji4yuan2 you4 an4dan4 le5 ji3fen1。wo3 xiang3 ni3 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2 de5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"It is a pity that she was left in that place to rot. Dragons are not meant "
"for captivity - the Lady Feuerschwinge least of all. Creatures like her "
"should be cared for. Wouldn’t you agree?"
msgstr ""
"可惜​她​被​留在​那个​地方​等​死​。​龙族​是​最​不该​被​囚禁​的​—​—​尤其​是​火翼​女士​。​像​她​这​等​生灵​理应​得到​照料​，​不是​吗​？\n"
"ke3xi1 ta1 bei4 liu2 zai4 na4ge5 di4fang1 deng3 si3。long2 zu2 shi4 zui4 bu4gai1 bei4 qiu2jin4 de5——you2qi2 shi4 Huo3yi4 nu:3shi4。xiang4 ta1 zhe4 deng3 sheng1ling2 li3ying1 de2dao4 zhao4liao4，bu4shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"It is a relief that she is now free. Dragons are not meant for captivity - "
"the Lady Feuerschwinge least of all. She was special in this world. I am "
"sure you would agree. "
msgstr ""
"还好​她​已经​自由​了​。​龙族​是​最​不该​被​囚禁​的​—​—​尤其​是​火翼​女士​。​我​想​你​也​认为​她​是​世间​的​瑰宝​。\n"
"hai2hao3 ta1 yi3jing1 zi4you2 le5。long2 zu2 shi4 zui4 bu4gai1 bei4 qiu2jin4 de5——you2qi2 shi4 Huo3yi4 nu:3shi4。wo3 xiang3 ni3 ye3 ren4wei2 ta1 shi4 shi4jian1 de5 gui1bao3。"

msgid ""
"It is a shame you were not able to fulfill our request with regards to the Aztechnology executive. Nevertheless, our plans proceed unabated. \n"
"\n"
"Now, do we have any other business to discuss?"
msgstr ""
"遗憾​的​是​，​你​未能​满足​我们​关于​阿兹特​科技​高管​的​要求​。​尽管如此​，​我们​的​计划​仍​将​全速​推进​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我们​还有​别的​事要​谈​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"yi2han4 de5 shi4，ni3 wei4neng2 man3zu2 wo3men5 guan1yu2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 gao1guan3 de5 yao1qiu2。jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，wo3men5 de5 ji4hua4 reng2 jiang1 quan2su4 tui1jin4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 tan2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"It is a short train ride to Gesundbrunnen. You exit the subway car, stepping onto the old, grungy platform. The place is deserted, though signs of life are everywhere. A gaping hole in the ceiling filters cool, hazy light in from above. To your right, a small plot of crops struggles to endure in the cold and the limited light of the station. Trash and junk litters the platform. It’s clear this place hasn’t had anything resembling a janitorial staff in quite some time.\n"
"\n"
"Somewhere in this old, run-down U-Bahn station lies the entrance to Gesundbrunnen kiez, and hopefully some leads on the whereabouts of the Rabengeister and Gunari’s missing shipment."
msgstr ""
"前往​健康​泉​的​地铁​车程​并​不​遥远​。​你​走出​车厢​，​踏上​陈旧​肮脏​的​站台​。​这里​空无一人​，​却​处处​可见​生命​迹象​。​天花板​上​有​个​巨大​的​破洞​，​从​上方​滤入​清凉​朦胧​的​光线​。​右侧​一小片​农作物​在​车站​的​寒冷​与​微弱​光线​下​艰难​存活​。​垃圾​与​废品​散落​满地​，​显然​这里​已​许久​没有​清洁工​来​打扫​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这座​破败​的​地铁站​深处​，​藏​着​通往​健康​泉​街区​的​入口​，​或许​还​能​找到​“​鸦灵​”​与​古纳里​的​那批​失踪​货物​的​线索​。\n"
"\n"
"qian2wang3 jian4kang1 quan2 de5 di4tie3 che1cheng2 bing4 bu4 yao2yuan3。ni3 zou3chu1 che1xiang1，ta4shang4 chen2jiu4 ang1zang1 de5 zhan4tai2。zhe4li3 kong1wu2yi1ren2，que4 chu4chu4 ke3jian4 sheng1ming4 ji4xiang4。tian1hua1ban3 shang4 you3 ge4 ju4da4 de5 po4dong4，cong2 shang4fang1 lu:4 ru4 qing1liang2 meng2long2 de5 guang1xian4。you4ce4 yi1 xiao3 pian1 nong2zuo4wu4 zai4 che1zhan4 de5 han2leng3 yu4 wei1ruo4 guang1xian4 xia4 jian1nan2 cun2huo2。la1ji1 yu4 fei4pin3 san3luo4 man3 de5，xian3ran2 zhe4li3 yi3 xu3jiu3 mei2you3 qing1jie2gong1 lai2 da3sao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 zuo4 po4bai4 de5 di4tie3zhan4 shen1chu4，zang4 zhao2 tong1wang3 jian4kang1 quan2 jie1qu1 de5 ru4kou3，huo4xu3 hai2 neng2 zhao3dao4“Ya1ling2” yu4 gu3 na4 li3 de5 na4 pi1 shi1zong1 huo4wu4 de5 xian4suo3。"

msgid ""
"It is a temporary option, although temporary to a dragon could be many "
"lifetimes to you."
msgstr ""
"这​只是​权宜之计​，​尽管​对​巨龙​而言​，​这样​的​“​权宜​”​已经​是​你​的​许多次​生命​。\n"
"zhe4 zhi3shi4 quan2yi2zhi1ji4，jin3guan3 dui4 ju4long2 er2yan2，zhe4yang4 de5“quan2yi2” yi3jing1 shi4 ni3 de5 xu3 duo1 ci4 sheng1ming4。"

msgid "It is difficult to fathom, but in her case, I suppose that is true."
msgstr ""
"我​无法​苟同​，​但​对​她​而言​，​我​想​是​的​。\n"
"wo3 wu2fa3 gou3tong2，dan4 dui4 ta1 er2yan2，wo3 xiang3 shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"It is distressing that a being so magnificent has been reduced to a pawn for"
" a computer game with delusions of grandeur. Yes?"
msgstr ""
"如此​壮丽​的​存在​竟​沦为​妄自尊大​的​电脑游戏​的​棋子​，​真是​让​人​痛心​。\n"
"ru2ci3 zhuang4li4 de5 cun2zai4 jing4 lun2wei2 wang4zi4zun1da4 de5 dian4 nao3 you2 xi4 de5 qi2zi3，zhen1shi5 rang4 ren2 tong4xin1。"

msgid ""
"It is for now, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"Get the hell out of my sight."
msgstr ""
"我​现在​跟​你​没什么​话​好​讲​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​他妈​滚远点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 gen1 ni3 mei2shen2me5 hua4 hao3 jiang3，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 ta1 ma1 gun3 yuan3 dian3。"

msgid ""
"It is for now, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do us both a favor. Take the hint and go away."
msgstr ""
"我​现在​跟​你​没什么​话​好​讲​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过​脸去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要是​识趣​的话​，​就​赶紧​走​人​，​别​给​我们​双方​添堵​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 gen1 ni3 mei2shen2me5 hua4 hao3 jiang3，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 lian3 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 shi2qu4 de5hua4，jiu4 gan3jin3 zou3 ren2，bie4 gei3 wo3men5 shuang1fang1 tian1du3 le5。"

msgid ""
"It is hand-picked by my family in Turkey. A true delicacy of the Sixth "
"World. This was considered a luxury even before the Awakening, when bean "
"coffee was everywhere. Every street-corner, they say."
msgstr ""
"这是​我家​人​在​土耳其​亲手​采摘​的​。​在​第六​纪元​，​这​可是​真正​的​珍馐​。​即便​在​大​觉醒​之前​，​当豆磨​咖啡​随处可见​的​年代​，​它​也​被​视为​奢侈品​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 jia1 ren2 zai4 tu3er3qi2 qin1shou3 cai3zhai1 de5。zai4 di4 liu4 ji4yuan2，zhe4 ke3shi4 zhen1zheng4 de5 zhen1xiu1。ji2bian4 zai4 dai4 jue2xing3 zhi1qian2，dang1 dou4 mo2 ka1fei1 sui2chu4ke3jian4 de5 nian2dai4，ta1 ye3 bei4 shi4wei2 she1chi3pin3。"

msgid "It is handy. That’s not hard to argue."
msgstr ""
"确实​很​有用​。​这个​没得说​。\n"
"que4shi2 hen3 you3yong4。zhe4ge5 mei2de5shuo1。"

msgid ""
"It is highly recommended that any employee working in or around this gas wear a detector badge.\n"
"\n"
"A suitable supply of NaHCO3 (sodium bicarbonate - for liquid phosgene) and NH3 (ammonia - for gaseous phosgene) must be kept on hand to neutralize spills and leakages."
msgstr ""
"强烈建议​所有​接触​光气​的​工作人员​佩戴​检测​徽章​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​需​常备​足量​NaHCO3​（​碳酸氢钠​，​应对​液态​光气​）​和​NH3​（​氨气​，​应对​气态​光气​）​以中​和​泄漏​事故​。\n"
"\n"
"jiang4 lie4 jian4 yi4 suo3you3 jie1chu4 guang1qi4 de5 gong1zuo4ren2yuan2 pei4dai4 jian3ce4 hui1zhang1。\n"
"\n"
"xu1 chang2 bei4 zu2liang4 NaHCO3 （tan4suan1qing1na4，ying4dui4 ye4tai4 guang1qi4） he4 NH3 （an1qi4，ying4dui4 qi4tai4 guang1qi4） yi3 zhong4 he4 xie4lou4 shi4gu4。"

msgid ""
"It is in our best interests, however, to remain unknown to the world at large.\n"
"\n"
"For the time being, that is all that you need to know."
msgstr ""
"然而​，​对​我们​而言​，​保持​不为人知​才​是​最​有利​的​选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​目前​，​你​只​需​知道​这些​便​足够​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ran2er2，dui4 wo3men5 er2yan2，bao3chi2 bu4wei2ren2zhi1 cai2 shi4 zui4 you3li4 de5 xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"mu4qian2，ni3 zhi3 xu1 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 bian4 zu2gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It is no mystery. You will be working for the Great Dragon Lofwyr. Perhaps "
"you have heard of him."
msgstr ""
"一点​也​不​神秘​。​你​的​雇主​是​巨龙​洛夫​维尔​，​或许​你​听说​过​他​。\n"
"yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 shen2mi4。ni3 de5 gu4zhu3 shi4 ju4long2 Luo4fu1wei2er3，huo4xu3 ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"It is now. Wasn't always, though.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stretches her neck so that the circuit pattern on her face can catch the light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What you're looking at used to be tattoo magic. Got it done when I was in Tokyo, doing a job for the Yakuza."
msgstr ""
"现在​是​了​。​不过​一​开始​不是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​伸长​脖子​，​让​脸上​的​电路​图案​显露​在​光线​下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​眼前​这​玩意儿​曾经​是​纹身​魔法​。​我​以前​在​东京​给​极道​跑​差事​的​时候​搞​的​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 shi4 le5。bu4guo4 yi1 kai1shi3 bu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1chang2 bo2zi5，rang4 lian3 shang4 de5 dian4lu4 tu2an4 xian3lu4 zai4 guang1xian4 xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yan3qian2 zhe4 wan2yi4r5 ceng2jing1 shi4 wen2shen1 mo2fa3。wo3 yi3qian2 zai4 dong1jing1 gei3 ji2dao4 pao2 cha4shi4 de5 shi2hou5 gao3 de5。"

msgid ""
"It is one thing to strike an old man whose time is done. But to attack the Kreuzbasar and endanger the lives of innocents, that is unforgiveable.\n"
"\n"
"The cowards who ordered this attack..."
msgstr ""
"攻击​一个​垂垂老矣​的​老人​是​一​回事​。​但​袭击​克洛伊​茨​集市​并​危及​无辜者​的​生命​，​这是​绝不能​原谅​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​发起​这次​攻击​的​那些​懦夫​……\n"
"\n"
"gong1ji1 yi1ge5 chui2 chui2 lao3 yi3 de5 lao3ren2 shi4 yi1 hui2shi4。dan4 xi2ji1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 bing4 wei1ji2 wu2 gu1 zhe3 de5 sheng1ming4，zhe4 shi4 jue2 bu4 neng2 yuan2liang4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"fa1qi3 zhe4 ci4 gong1ji1 de5 na4xie1 nuo4fu1……"

msgid ""
"It is our stated goal for this information to remain free to all. However, "
"you will be compensated for sought-after information returned to this "
"location."
msgstr ""
"我们​明确​表示​，​这些​信息​将​始终​免费​向​所有人​开放​。​但​如果​你​将​所​需​情报​反馈​至​此处​，​我们​将​给予​相应​补偿​。\n"
"wo3men5 ming2que4 biao3shi4，zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 jiang1 shi3zhong1 mian3fei4 xiang4 suo3you3ren2 kai1fang4。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 jiang1 suo3 xu1 qing2bao4 fan3kui4 zhi4 ci3chu4，wo3men5 jiang1 ji3yu3 xiang1ying4 bu3chang2。"

msgid ""
"It is the least I can do to give back to our little community!\n"
"\n"
"With but a minor effort from me, all in the Kreuzbasar may enjoy free access to the Matrix and high-speed communications.\n"
"\n"
"All for the greater good, eh?"
msgstr ""
"只是​为​我们​这个​小​社区​做点​事情​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只​需​我​稍作​努力​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有​居民​就​都​能​免费​使用​矩阵​并​享受​高速​通讯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大家​好​才​是​真的​好​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"zhi3shi4 wei2 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 xiao3 she4qu1 zuo4 dian3 shi4qing5 er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 xu1 wo3 shao1 zuo4 nu3li4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3 ju1min2 jiu4 dou1 neng2 mian3fei4 shi3yong4 ju3zhen4 bing4 xiang3shou4 gao1su4 tong1xun4。\n"
"\n"
"da4jia1 hao3 cai2 shi4 zhen1de5 hao3，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"It is time for you to pick a spirit totem. The choice is permanent, so "
"choose wisely."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​选择​你​的​精魂​图腾​了​。​此​选择​将​永久​生效​，​所以​请​慎重考虑​。\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 xuan3ze2 ni3 de5 jing1hun2 tu2teng2 le5。ci3 xuan3ze2 jiang1 yong3jiu3 sheng1xiao4，suo3yi3 qing3 shen4 chong2 kao3 lu:4。"

msgid "It is what it is - I stand by my decisions. All of them."
msgstr ""
"事情​就是​这样​，​我​不会​为​自己​的​决定​而​后悔​。\n"
"shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4，wo3 bu4hui4 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 jue2ding4 er2 hou4hui3。"

msgid ""
"It is, and that's exactly how it's supposed to be. It's a dog-eat-dog world "
"- the sooner your son learns that, the better."
msgstr ""
"正是如此​，​这​正是​它​该​有​的​样子​。​这​是​个​弱肉强食​的​世界​—​—​你​儿子​越​早​明白​这个​道理​越​好​。\n"
"zheng1 shi4 ru2 ci3，zhe4 zheng4shi4 ta1 gai1 you3 de5 yang4zi5。zhe4 shi4 ge4 ruo4rou4qiang2shi2 de5 shi4jie4——ni3 er2zi5 yue4 zao3 ming2bai5 zhe4ge5 dao4li5 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"It is, isn't it? It's a mystery. A conundrum.\n"
"\n"
"What could they have intended it for? The torture of the innocent? Or perhaps the builders had the prescience to foresee the coming of Billy!\n"
"\n"
"Or maybe they intended it for basic sanitation. It's a sewer, too, by the way."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​？​这​是​个​谜团​。​一个​难解之谜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​建它​到底​是​为了​什么​？​为了​折磨​无辜者​？​或者​是​建筑师​们​预见​了​比利​的​到来​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​或者​，​他们​仅仅​是​为了​基本​的​排污​需求​？​顺便​一提​，​它​确实​是​个​下水道​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5？zhe4 shi4 ge4 mi2tuan2。yi1ge5 nan2 jie3 zhi1 mei4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jian4 ta1 dao4di3 shi4 wei4le5 shen2me5？wei4le5 zhe2mo2 wu2 gu1 zhe3？huo4zhe3 shi4 jian4zhu4shi1 men5 yu4jian4 le5 bi3li4 de5 dao4lai2！\n"
"\n"
"you4 huo4zhe3，ta1men5 jin3jin3 shi4 wei4le5 ji1ben3 de5 pai2wu1 xu1qiu2？shun4bian4 yi1 ti2，ta1 que4shi2 shi4 ge4 xia4shui3dao4。"

msgid ""
"It is, it is! You killed three of them, but I can activate more!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He rubs his chin, grinning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They will return to me, and I will show them the love that only a true ruler can. I will *bathe* them in my affection, and they--"
msgstr ""
"当然​！​你​可能​杀​了​我​的​三个​臣民​，​但​我​可以​激活​更​多​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​抚摸​着​下巴​，​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​会​回到​我​身边​，​而​我​将​以​唯有​真正​的​统治者​才能​给予​的​爱意​对待​他们​。​我​将​用​我​的​慈爱​*​沐浴​*​他们​，​而​他们​—​—\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2！ni3 ke3neng2 sha1 le5 wo3 de5 san1 ge4 chen2min2，dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 ji1huo2 geng1 duo1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fu3mo1 zhao2 xia4ba5，lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 hui4 hui2dao4 wo3 shen1bian1，er2 wo3 jiang1 yi3 wei2you3 zhen1zheng4 de5 tong3zhi4zhe3 cai2neng2 ji3yu3 de5 ai4yi4 dui4dai4 ta1men5。wo3 jiang1 yong4 wo3 de5 ci2ai4*mu4yu4*ta1men5，er2 ta1men5 — —"

msgid "It is."
msgstr ""
"没错​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"It is.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grinds his teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Is that what you w-want to hear?"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咬紧牙关​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​-​你​就​想​听​这个​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 -ni3 jiu4 xiang3 ting1 zhe4ge5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"It is. And thank you for not making this more difficult than it had to be."
msgstr ""
"的确​很难​让​人​接受​，​但​谢谢​你​做出​让步​。\n"
"di2que4 hen3 nan2 rang4 ren2 jie1shou4，dan4 xie4xie5 ni3 zuo4chu1 rang4bu4。"

msgid ""
"It is. But only for a while.\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)... your friendship means a lot to me. The team may be breaking up, but this isn't that. I wouldn't be leaving if I didn't have to, and I fully intend to come back."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​了​，​但​不会​太久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​……​你​的​友谊​对​我​来说​意义​重大​，​队伍​会​解散​，​我们​的​友谊​不会​。​除非​迫不得已​，​我​也​不想​离开​，​事成之后​我​一定​会​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 le5，dan4 bu4hui4 tai4 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……ni3 de5 you3yi4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 yi4yi4 zhong4da4，dui4wu3 hui4 jie3san4，wo3men5 de5 you3yi4 bu4hui4。chu2fei1 po4bu4de2yi3，wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 li2kai1，shi4 cheng2 zhi1 hou4 wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"It is. But only for a while.\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)... your friendship means a lot to me. This *team* means a lot. I wouldn't be leaving if I didn't have to, and I fully intend to come back."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​了​，​但​不会​太久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​……​你​的​友谊​对​我​来说​意义​重大​，​这个​*​队伍​*​也​是​。​除非​迫不得已​，​我​也​不想​离开​，​事成之后​我​一定​会​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 le5，dan4 bu4hui4 tai4 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……ni3 de5 you3yi4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 yi4yi4 zhong4da4，zhe4ge5*dui4wu3*ye3 shi4。chu2fei1 po4bu4de2yi3，wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 li2kai1，shi4 cheng2 zhi1 hou4 wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"It is. I agree with what you're doing here - you're filling a vital need in "
"the community."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我​同意​你​在​这里​所​做​的​一切​—​—​你们​填补​了​社区​的​一个​重要​需求​。\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4——ni3men5 tian2bu3 le5 she4qu1 de5 yi1ge5 zhong4yao4 xu1qiu2。"

msgid ""
"It is. I've heard of this stuff before. Back in the service, we called it \"Doom.\"\n"
"\n"
"I've never run across it in the wild, but I've heard enough horror stories to know that I don't want to."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​没错​，​我​以前​听说​过​这种​物质​。​在​军队​的​时候​，​我们​都​叫​它​“​末日​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​战场​上​没​遇见​过​，​但​我​听​过​不少​和​它​有关​的​恐怖​故事​，​足以​让​我​敬而远之​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4 mei2cuo4，wo3 yi3qian2 ting1shuo1 guo4 zhe4zhong3 wu4zhi4。zai4 jun1dui4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 dou1 jiao4 ta1“mo4ri4”。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhan4chang3 shang4 mei2 yu4jian4 guo4，dan4 wo3 ting1 guo4 bu4shao3 he4 ta1 you3guan1 de5 kong3bu4 gu4shi4，zu2yi3 rang4 wo3 jing4er2yuan3zhi1。"

msgid ""
"It isn't \"happening.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory's lip curls into a sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It happened a long time ago, and I fixed it. What you saw was nothing compared to how it used be, and you shouldn't've been looking in the first place."
msgstr ""
"我​不是​现在​才​“​遭遇​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​的​嘴角​勾起​一抹​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​很​久远​的​事情​了​，​而且​我​也​已经​解决​了​。​你​所​见到​的​不过​是​昔日​残影​，​而且​你​本​就​不该​窥探​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 xian4zai4 cai2“zao1yu4”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 zui3jiao3 gou1qi3 yi1 ma1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 hen3 jiu3yuan3 de5 shi4qing5 le5，er2qie3 wo3 ye3 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 le5。ni3 suo3 jian4dao4 de5 bu4guo4 shi4 xi1ri4 can2ying3，er2qie3 ni3 ben3 jiu4 bu4gai1 kui1tan4。"

msgid "It isn't ideal, I know. But then again, nothing ever is."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​，​这样​的​条件​并​不​理想​。​但​话​又​说​回来​，​这​世界​不​就是​这样​吗​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4，zhe4yang4 de5 tiao2jian4 bing4 bu4 li3xiang3。dan4 hua4 you4 shuo1 hui2lai5，zhe4 shi4jie4 bu4 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4 ma5。"

msgid "It isn't moving. I think that it's on standby."
msgstr ""
"它​没有​要动​的​意思​。​我​看​它​是​处于​某种​待机​状态​。\n"
"ta1 mei2you3 yao4 dong4 de5 yi4si5。wo3 kan4 ta1 shi4 chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4。"

msgid ""
"It isn't moving. I think that it's... I dunno, on standby or something.\n"
"\n"
"The lights are on, but nobody's home."
msgstr ""
"它​没有​要动​的​意思​。​我​看​它​是​……​处于​某种​待机​状态​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​好像​开着机​，​不过​程序​没跑​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 mei2you3 yao4 dong4 de5 yi4si5。wo3 kan4 ta1 shi4……chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 kai1 zhao2 ji1，bu4guo4 cheng2xu4 mei2 pao2 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"It isn't my idol's fault that I'm getting too old to keep up with His "
"wishes. "
msgstr ""
"是​我​人​老​不中用​了​，​无法​完成​精魄​导师​的​意愿​，​这​不能​怪​祂​。\n"
"shi4 wo3 ren2 lao3 bu4zhong1yong4 le5，wu2fa3 wan2cheng2 jing1 po4 dao3shi1 de5 yi4yuan4，zhe4 bu4neng2 guai4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"It isn't that simple.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stares at the floor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't get it... I was *better* when I was with her."
msgstr ""
"没​那么​简单​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​盯​着​地板​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​明白​……​我​和​她​在​一起​的​时候​*​更好​*​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 na4me5 jian3dan1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 di4ban3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 ming2bai5……wo3 he4 ta1 zai4 yi1qi3 de5 shi2hou5*geng1 hao3*。"

msgid "It isn't too late. We can still talk this out."
msgstr ""
"现在​还​为时不晚​。​我们​还​能​再​谈谈​吗​。\n"
"xian4zai4 hai2 wei2shi2bu4wan3。wo3men5 hai2 neng2 zai4 tan2tan2 ma5。"

msgid ""
"It isn't you. It's this place... it gets into your head.\n"
"\n"
"It took a lot more than this to wake me up to it."
msgstr ""
"不是​你​。​是​这个​地方​……​它​在​扰乱​你​的​思维​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​摆脱​这​一切​，​我​当初​付出​的​代价​可​远远​不止​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 ni3。shi4 zhe4ge5 di4fang1……ta1 zai4 rao3luan4 ni3 de5 si1wei2。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 bai3tuo1 zhe4 yi1qie4，wo3 dang1chu1 fu4chu1 de5 dai4jia4 ke3 yuan3yuan3 bu4zhi3 ru2ci3。"

msgid "It isn't your place to tell me what I need to do."
msgstr ""
"轮不到​你​来​教​我​怎么​做​。\n"
"lun2 bu4 dao4 ni3 lai2 jiao1 wo3 zen3me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"It isn't yours, or mine, $(l.name). It has its own desires, and it belongs "
"to no one but itself."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​它​并​不​属于​你​或​我​。​它​有​自己​的​欲求​，​并​只​属于​它​自己​。\n"
"$(l.name)，ta1 bing4 bu4 shu3yu2 ni3 huo4 wo3。ta1 you3 zi4ji3 de5 yu4qiu2，bing4 zhi3 shu3yu2 ta1 zi4ji3。"

msgid "It looked that way to me, too, Doctor. "
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​这么​认为​的​，​博士​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2 de5，bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"It looks as though this computer terminal has basic access to the virus "
"infusion systems being used on the captive dragon. You may be able to stem "
"the flow of Panacea by jacking in to this access point."
msgstr ""
"看起来​这台​计算机​终端​可以​基本​访问​用于​囚禁​巨龙​的​病毒​注入​系统​。​你​也许​可以​通过​接入​这个​访问​点来​阻止​“​万能​药​”​的​流动​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 zhe4 tai2 ji4suan4ji1 zhong1duan1 ke3yi3 ji1ben3 fang3wen4 yong4yu2 qiu2jin4 ju4long2 de5 bing4du2 zhu4ru4 xi4tong3。ni3 ye3xu3 ke3yi3 tong1guo4 jie1ru4 zhe4ge5 fang3wen4 dian3 lai2 zu3zhi3“wan4neng2 yao4” de5 liu2dong4。"

msgid ""
"It looks as though this terminal is used exclusively for financial transactions.\n"
"\n"
"After a bit of digging, you find a list of payoffs to local law enforcement. Paid by Harrow, no doubt, to ensure that the police look the other way."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​似乎​专门​用于​财务​转账​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​经过​一番​调查​，​你​发现​了​一份​向​当地​执法​部门​行贿​的​款项​清单​。​这些​钱​无疑​是​哈罗​支付​的​，​目的​是​让​警方​睁一只眼​闭一只眼​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 si4hu1 zhuan1men2 yong4yu2 cai2wu4 zhuan3zhang4。\n"
"\n"
"jing1guo4 yi1 fan1 diao4cha2，ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 fen4 xiang4 dang1di4 zhi2fa3 bu4men2 xing2hui4 de5 kuan3xiang4 qing1dan1。zhe4xie1 qian2 wu2yi2 shi4 ha1luo2 zhi1fu4 de5，mu4di4 shi4 rang4 jing3fang1 zheng1 yi1 zhi3 yan3 bi4 yi1 zhi3 yan3。"

msgid ""
"It looks as though, with the press of a button, you could put the machine "
"into something called \"Exploratory Surgery Mode.\""
msgstr ""
"看​这​样子​，​只要​你​按​下​按钮​，​就​能​将​机器​切换​至​某种​“​探索性​手术​模式​”​状态​。\n"
"kan4 zhe4 yang4zi5，zhi3yao4 ni3 an4 xia4 an4niu3，jiu4 neng2 jiang1 ji1qi4 qie1huan4 zhi4 mou3zhong3“tan4suo3xing4 shou3shu4 mo2shi4” zhuang4tai4。"

msgid "It looks like a piece of junk."
msgstr ""
"看起来​就是​一坨​垃圾​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 jiu4shi4 yi1 tuo2 la1ji1。"

msgid ""
"It looks like someone did some basic patching to network this ancient electronic lock, but that's about it. Calling this a node would be a dramatic overstatement. \n"
"\n"
"Simply flipping a bit should open the door."
msgstr ""
"看起来​有人​对​这个​古老​的​电子锁​进行​了​一些​基本​的​网络连接​，​但​仅此而已​。​称其为​节点​都​算是​夸大其词​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只​需​改变​一个​位元​就​能​打开门​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 you3ren2 dui4 zhe4ge5 gu3lao3 de5 dian4 zi3 suo3 jin4xing2 le5 yi1xie1 ji1ben3 de5 wang3 lao4 lian2 jie1，dan4 jin3ci3er2yi3。chen4 qi2 wei2 jie2dian3 dou1 suan4shi4 kua1da4qi2ci2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 xu1 gai3bian4 yi1ge5 wei4yuan2 jiu4 neng2 da3 kai1 men2。"

msgid "It looks like the console can be used to retract the nearby bridge."
msgstr ""
"这个​控制台​似乎​可以​用来​收起​附近​的​桥​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 kong4zhi4tai2 si4hu1 ke3yi3 yong4lai2 shou1 qi3 fu4jin4 de5 qiao2。"

msgid ""
"It looks like the console can extend the nearby bridge to cross the tracks."
msgstr ""
"这个​控制台​似乎​可以​用来​展开​附近​的​桥​从而​通行​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 kong4zhi4tai2 si4hu1 ke3yi3 yong4lai2 zhan3kai1 fu4jin4 de5 qiao2 cong2er2 tong1xing2。"

msgid ""
"It looks like the console could extend the nearby bridge to cross the tracks"
" - but with the power out, the entire thing is nonfunctional."
msgstr ""
"这个​控制台​似乎​可以​用来​展开​附近​的​桥​从而​通行​，​但​目前​没有​电力供应​，​因此​无法​启动​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 kong4zhi4tai2 si4hu1 ke3yi3 yong4lai2 zhan3kai1 fu4jin4 de5 qiao2 cong2er2 tong1xing2，dan4 mu4qian2 mei2you3 dian4 li4 gong1 ying1，yin1ci3 wu2fa3 qi3dong4。"

msgid ""
"It looks like the elevator's locked down, but the control system is tied to "
"the building's LAN."
msgstr ""
"电梯​看起来​锁住​了​，​不过​它​的​控制系统​接入​了​建筑​的​局域网​。\n"
"dian4ti1 kan4qi3lai5 suo3 zhu4 le5，bu4guo4 ta1 de5 kong4 zhi4 xi4 tong3 jie1ru4 le5 jian4zhu4 de5 ju2yu4wang3。"

msgid "It looks like the whole station's lost power."
msgstr ""
"看起来​整个​车站​都​断电​了​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 zheng3ge4 che1zhan4 dou1 duan4dian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It looks like this media setup is wired into the building's security system.\n"
"\n"
"Video feeds from cameras all over the facility can be viewed here."
msgstr ""
"看起来​这个​媒体​装置​与​整栋​建筑​的​安保​系统​相互连接​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​通过​它​可以​查看​整个​设施​各处​摄像头​的​实时​画面​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 zhe4ge5 mei2ti3 zhuang1zhi4 yu4 zheng3 dong4 jian4zhu4 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3 xiang1 hu4 lian2 jie1。\n"
"\n"
"tong1guo4 ta1 ke3yi3 cha2kan4 zheng3ge4 she4shi1 ge4chu4 she4xiang4tou2 de5 shi2shi2 hua4mian4。"

msgid "It looks melted. The cargo container is empty."
msgstr ""
"看起来​已经​融化​了​。​货仓​是​空​的​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 yi3jing1 rong2hua4 le5。huo4cang1 shi4 kong1 de5。"

msgid "It looks plenty shot up already. A few more holes couldn't hurt."
msgstr ""
"这里​已经​满目疮痍​了​，​再​多​几个​弹孔​也​无所谓​。\n"
"zhe4li3 yi3jing1 man3mu4chuang1yi2 le5，zai4 duo1 ji3ge5 dan4kong3 ye3 wu2suo3wei4。"

msgid ""
"It looks to me like he's traded his old tricks for easy power. Take that power away from him, and what does he become?\n"
"\n"
"A pathetic little man who failed to satisfy a vindictive idol."
msgstr ""
"在我看来​，​他​是​用​自己​以前​的​手段​换来​了​走捷径​的​力量​。​而​现在​一旦​把​这​力量​从​他​手中​夺走​，​他​还​剩下​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​是​个​可悲​的​小人物​，​未能​满足​自己​那​报复​心强​的​精魂​导师​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4wo3kan4lai2，ta1 shi4 yong4 zi4ji3 yi3qian2 de5 shou3duan4 huan4 lai2 le5 zou3 jie2 jing4 de5 li4liang5。er2 xian4zai4 yi1dan4 ba3 zhe4 li4liang5 cong2 ta1 shou3 zhong4 duo2zou3，ta1 hai2 sheng4xia4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 shi4 ge4 ke3bei1 de5 xiao3ren2wu4，wei4neng2 man3zu2 zi4ji3 na4 bao4fu4 xin1 jiang4 de5 jing1hun2 dao3shi1。"

msgid ""
"It matters because it's solid evidence that we're doing the right thing. Even if Harrow does escape, he won't be as much of a threat as we thought he was.\n"
"\n"
"I just wanted $(l.name) to know that."
msgstr ""
"这​很​重要​，​因为​它​是​一份​确凿​的​证据​，​能够​表明​我们​正在​做​正确​的​事​。​即使​哈罗​逃走​，​他​也​不会​变成​我们​想象​中​的​巨大​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​想​让​$(l.name)​知道​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hen3 zhong4yao4，yin1wei4 ta1 shi4 yi1 fen4 que4zao2 de5 zheng4ju4，neng2gou4 biao3ming2 wo3men5 zheng4zai4 zuo4 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。ji2shi3 ha1luo2 tao2zou3，ta1 ye3 bu4hui4 bian4cheng2 wo3men5 xiang3xiang4 zhong4 de5 ju4da4 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 rang4 $(l.name) zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"It matters because it's solid evidence that we're doing the right thing. Even if Harrow does escape, he won't be as much of a threat as we thought he was.\n"
"\n"
"I just wanted you to know that."
msgstr ""
"这​很​重要​，​因为​它​是​一份​确凿​的​证据​，​能够​表明​我们​正在​做​正确​的​事​。​即使​哈罗​逃走​，​他​也​不会​变成​我们​想象​中​的​巨大​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​想​让​你​知道​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hen3 zhong4yao4，yin1wei4 ta1 shi4 yi1 fen4 que4zao2 de5 zheng4ju4，neng2gou4 biao3ming2 wo3men5 zheng4zai4 zuo4 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。ji2shi3 ha1luo2 tao2zou3，ta1 ye3 bu4hui4 bian4cheng2 wo3men5 xiang3xiang4 zhong4 de5 ju4da4 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 rang4 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "It means that we have a new target."
msgstr ""
"这​意味着​我们​有​了​新​的​目标​。\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 you3 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1。"

msgid ""
"It means that we have a new target.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her hands tighten on her rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's all."
msgstr ""
"这​意味着​我们​有​了​新​的​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​手​握紧​了​步枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 you3 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shou3 wo4 jin3 le5 bu4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"It means that we have a new target.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her hands tighten on her rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're not being hunted by the Firewing. Never were.\n"
"\n"
"We're being hunted by Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"这​意味着​我们​有​了​新​的​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​手​握紧​了​步枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​追杀​我们​的​不是​火翼​。​从来​都​不是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 you3 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shou3 wo4 jin3 le5 bu4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhui1sha1 wo3men5 de5 bu4shi4 Huo3yi4。cong2lai2 dou1 bu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"It means that we're not being hunted by a dragon. We're being hunted by "
"Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"这​意味着​追杀​我们​的​不是​巨龙​，​而是​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 zhui1sha1 wo3men5 de5 bu4shi4 ju4long2，er2shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"It means tomorrow will be a better day. Monika used to say something like "
"that. "
msgstr ""
"它​意味着​明天​会​更好​。​莫妮卡​曾经​说​过​类似​的话​。\n"
"ta1 yi4wei4zhe5 ming2tian1 hui4 geng1 hao3。Mo4ni1ka3 ceng2jing1 shuo1 guo4 lei4si4 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"It might be nothing. Or it could mean that he's back in bed with the "
"Lobatchevski Syndicate."
msgstr ""
"这​可能​不​代表​什么​。​也​可能​意味着​他​又​和​洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​勾结​在​一起​了​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3neng2 bu4 dai4biao3 shen2me5。ye3 ke3neng2 yi4wei4zhe5 ta1 you4 he4 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2 gou1jie2 zai4 yi1qi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"It might not be decomposition. That steam could be coming from a grate or a "
"vent hidden under the pile."
msgstr ""
"可能​并​不是​腐烂​。​这​股​蒸汽​可能​是从​垃圾堆​下面​的​排气口​或者​通风口​冒出来​的​。\n"
"ke3neng2 bing4 bu4shi4 fu3lan4。zhe4 gu3 zheng1qi4 ke3neng2 shi4 cong2 la1ji1dui1 xia4mian4 de5 pai2 qi4 kou3 huo4zhe3 tong1feng1kou3 mao4chu1lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"It might not be decomposition. That steam could be coming from a grate or a "
"vent under the pile."
msgstr ""
"可能​并​不是​腐烂​。​这​股​蒸汽​可能​是从​垃圾堆​下面​的​排气口​或者​通风口​冒出来​的​。\n"
"ke3neng2 bing4 bu4shi4 fu3lan4。zhe4 gu3 zheng1qi4 ke3neng2 shi4 cong2 la1ji1dui1 xia4mian4 de5 pai2 qi4 kou3 huo4zhe3 tong1feng1kou3 mao4chu1lai2 de5。"

msgid "It might still be happening, for all that we know."
msgstr ""
"我们​知道​的​是​，​这​一切​可能​还​在​继续​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1dao4 de5 shi4，zhe4 yi1qie4 ke3neng2 hai2 zai4 ji4xu4。"

msgid ""
"It must have been running some kind of counterintrusion software. The instant that I gained access, it bricked itself.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel disconnects the useless PDA and drops it to the ground. It clatters to a rest on the metal floor.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"里面​肯定​设置​了​某种​反​侵入​程序​。​我​刚刚​获得​访问​权限​，​它​就​直接​变砖​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​拔掉​了​报废​的​PDA​，​当啷​一声​把​它​丢​在​金属​地板​上​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 ken3ding4 she4zhi4 le5 mou3zhong3 fan3 qin1ru4 cheng2xu4。wo3 gang1gang5 huo4de2 fang3wen4 quan2xian4，ta1 jiu4 zhi2jie1 bian4zhuan1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 ba2diao4 le5 bao4fei4 de5 PDA，dang1lang1 yi1sheng1 ba3 ta1 diu1 zai4 jin1shu3 di4ban3 shang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"It only takes a moment to connect your PDA, and immediately visual feeds "
"from all over the building begin to flood in."
msgstr ""
"你​花​了​片刻​时间​接入​PDA​，​整栋​大楼​的​实时​监控​随即​在​屏幕​上​涌现​。\n"
"ni3 hua1 le5 pian4ke4 shi2jian1 jie1ru4 PDA，zheng3 dong4 da4lou2 de5 shi2shi2 jian1kong4 sui2ji2 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4 yong3xian4。"

msgid ""
"It only takes a moment to pop the casing off of the console.\n"
"\n"
"It looks as though a skilled decker could probably jack in and override the door controls from here."
msgstr ""
"你​没花​多久​就​撬开​了​控制台​的​外壳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​只要​碟​客够​内行​，​就​能​从​这​接入​，​重写​门禁​的​控制系统​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2 hua1 duo1jiu3 jiu4 qiao4kai1 le5 kong4zhi4tai2 de5 wai4ke2。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 zhi3yao4 die2 ke4 gou4 nei4hang2，jiu4 neng2 cong2 zhe4 jie1ru4，chong2 xie3 men2jin4 de5 kong4 zhi4 xi4 tong3。"

msgid ""
"It probably was. You're right, I did live here, a long time ago.\n"
"\n"
"I was like you back then. A scared kid, brought here by Marta for a chance at a new life."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​你​说得对​，​很久以前​我​确实​住​在​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那时​的​我​和​你​一样​，​是​个​胆怯​的​孩子​，​被玛​尔塔​带到​这里​，​寻求​新​生活​的​机会​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2 wo3 que4shi2 zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"na4shi2 de5 wo3 he4 ni3 yi1yang4，shi4 ge4 dan3qie4 de5 hai2zi5，bei4 Ma3er3ta3 dai4 dao4 zhe4li3，xun2qiu2 xin1 sheng1huo2 de5 ji1hui4。"

msgid ""
"It probably won't stay quiet in here for long, chief. We should keep moving."
msgstr ""
"这里​恐怕​不会​安静​太久​，​头儿​。​我们​应该​继续前进​。\n"
"zhe4li3 kong3pa4 bu4hui4 an1jing4 tai4 jiu3，tou2r5。wo3men5 ying1gai1 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid "It probably won't stay quiet in here for long. We should keep moving."
msgstr ""
"这里​恐怕​不会​安静​太久​。​我们​应该​继续前进​。\n"
"zhe4li3 kong3pa4 bu4hui4 an1jing4 tai4 jiu3。wo3men5 ying1gai1 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid ""
"It saw you? That's what you're worried about?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A shrill laugh escapes from Glory's lips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You'll be fine. Wanna know a secret? It's been watching you for your entire life. You just never knew that it was watching until now."
msgstr ""
"它​看见​你​了​？​你​就​担心​这个​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​的​唇间​迸发出​尖锐​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不会​有事​的​。​告诉​你​个​秘密​吧​？​从​你​出生​那​刻起​，​它​一直​都​在​注视​着​你​。​只是​直到现在​，​你​才​意识​到​它​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4jian4 ni3 le5？ni3 jiu4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 chun2 jian1 beng4 fa1 chu1 jian1rui4 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。gao4su4 ni3 ge4 mi4mi4 ba1？cong2 ni3 chu1sheng1 na4 ke4 qi3，ta1 yi1zhi2 dou1 zai4 zhu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。zhi3shi4 zhi2dao4xian4zai4，ni3 cai2 yi4shi2 dao4 ta1 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"It says that you belong out here, in the shadows. Believe it or not, Eiger, "
"you're right where you should be."
msgstr ""
"这​说明​你​属于​这个​暗影​世界​。​艾格尔​，​不管​你​信不信​，​这里​才​是​最​适合​你​的​地方​。\n"
"zhe4 shuo1ming2 ni3 shu3yu2 zhe4ge5 an4ying3 shi4jie4。Ai4ge2er3，bu4guan3 ni3 xin4 bu4 xin4，zhe4li3 cai2 shi4 zui4 shi4he2 ni3 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"It says what I've always believed. You're a killer, not a soldier. Welcome "
"to the club."
msgstr ""
"说明​了​我​一直​以来​相信​的​事情​。​你​是​个​杀手​，​不是​士兵​。​欢迎​入队​。\n"
"shuo1ming2 le5 wo3 yi1zhi2 yi3lai2 xiang1xin4 de5 shi4qing5。ni3 shi4 ge4 sha1shou3，bu4shi4 shi4bing1。huan1ying2 ru4 dui4。"

msgid ""
"It seems simple enough. To kill the AI, we'll have to flip two switches, wait a few minutes, then push a button.\n"
"\n"
"During that time, we'll also need to protect the terminal that the button is set into."
msgstr ""
"看起来​很​简单​。​要​干掉​AI​，​我们​得拉下​两个​开关​，​等​几分钟​，​然后​按下​一个​按钮​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这​期间​，​我们​还​需要​保护​按钮​所在​的​终端​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 hen3 jian3dan1。yao4 gan4diao4 AI，wo3men5 de2 la1 xia4 liang3 ge4 kai1guan1，deng3 ji1 fen4 zhong1，ran2hou4 an4xia4 yi1ge5 an4niu3。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 qi1jian1，wo3men5 hai2 xu1yao4 bao3hu4 an4niu3 suo3zai4 de5 zhong1duan1。"

msgid ""
"It seems simple enough. To kill the AI, we'll have to flip two switches, wait a few minutes, then push a button. During that time, we'll also need to protect the terminal that the button is set into.\n"
"\n"
"I'm actually shocked that it's so simple."
msgstr ""
"看起来​很​简单​。​要​干掉​AI​，​我们​得拉下​两个​开关​，​等​几分钟​，​然后​按下​一个​按钮​。​期间​还​需要​保护​按钮​所在​的​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没想到​居然​这么​简单​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 hen3 jian3dan1。yao4 gan4diao4 AI，wo3men5 de2 la1 xia4 liang3 ge4 kai1guan1，deng3 ji1 fen4 zhong1，ran2hou4 an4xia4 yi1ge5 an4niu3。qi1jian1 hai2 xu1yao4 bao3hu4 an4niu3 suo3zai4 de5 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 ju1ran2 zhe4me5 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"It seems so obvious now, but back then I couldn't see it. I mean, she was "
"running *from* me, right? So why would she leave any breadcrumbs for *me* to"
" find?"
msgstr ""
"现在​一想​也许​挺​明显​的​，​但​我​当时​完全​没有​想到​。​毕竟​她​是​要​*​逃离​*​我​，​对​吧​？​所以​她​为什么​还要​留下​蛛丝马迹​让​*​我​*​来​找​呢​？\n"
"xian4zai4 yi1 xiang3 ye3xu3 ting3 ming2xian3 de5，dan4 wo3 dang1shi2 wan2quan2 mei2you3 xiang3dao4。bi4jing4 ta1 shi4 yao4*tao2li2*wo3，dui4 ba1？suo3yi3 ta1 wei4shen2me5 hai2 yao4 liu2xia4 zhu1si1ma3ji4 rang4*wo3*lai2 zhao3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"It seems that Amsel has assembled the team in your absence. They stand in a "
"group around the old display that you had Maliit deliver; on their faces you"
" can see excitement and apprehension, curiosity and dread."
msgstr ""
"看起来​，​阿姆​泽尔​已经​把​其他​队员​都​叫​过来​了​。​现​众人​正围​在​玛丽​特​送来​的​旧​显示器​旁​，​脸上​交织着​兴奋​、​忧虑​、​好奇​与​恐惧​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5，E1mu3ze2er3 yi3jing1 ba3 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 dou1 jiao4 guo4lai2 le5。xian4 zhong4ren2 zheng1 wei2 zai4 ma3li4 te4 song4 lai2 de5 jiu4 xian3shi4qi4 pang2，lian3 shang4 jiao1 zhi1 zhao2 xing1fen4、you1lu:4、hao4qi2 yu4 kong3ju4。"

msgid "It seems that he doesn't know that one."
msgstr ""
"看来​他​不​懂​这句​口令​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ta1 bu4 dong3 zhe4 ju4 kou3ling4。"

msgid ""
"It seems that we may.\n"
"\n"
"Many terrible things have happened over the past few months, $(l.name)... and I do not believe them to be coincidences.\n"
"\n"
"These events are all connected somehow - I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""
"看起来​是​这样​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​几个​月​里​发生​了​许多​可怕​的​事​，​$(l.name)​……​而且​我​不​相信​它们​都​是​出于​巧合​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​事件​相互​有所​关联​—​—​我​对此​十分​确定​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 ji3ge5 yue4 li3 fa1sheng1 le5 xu3duo1 ke3pa4 de5 shi4，$(l.name)……er2qie3 wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ta1men5 dou1 shi4 chu1yu2 qiao3he2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 shi4jian4 xiang1hu4 you3suo3 guan1lian2——wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 que4ding4。"

msgid "It sounds like Green Winters is our best lead, then."
msgstr ""
"照这么说​，​我们​只能​顺着​格林​·​温特斯​这​条​线索​去查​了​。\n"
"zhao4 zhe4 ma2 shuo1，wo3men5 zhi3neng2 shun4zhe5 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 zhe4 tiao2 xian4suo3 qu4 cha2 le5。"

msgid "It sounds like somebody's in trouble in there."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​里面​有人​遇到​了​麻烦​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 li3mian4 you3ren2 yu4dao4 le5 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"It sounds like you're in the clear with Hasenkamp. Do you have any other "
"debts that I need to worry about?"
msgstr ""
"听​起来​你​和​哈森​坎普​之间​已经​两清​了​。​你​还有​什么​外债​是​需要​我​操心​的​吗​？\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 ni3 he4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 zhi1jian1 yi3jing1 liang3qing1 le5。ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 wai4zhai4 shi4 xu1yao4 wo3 cao1xin1 de5 ma5？"

msgid "It sounds magnificent."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​真是​太棒了​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 zhen1shi5 tai4 bang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It stumbles forward, lurching awkwardly on its feet.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, it seems to recover. It stares at its hands for a moment, then turns to face you."
msgstr ""
"它​踉跄​着​向前​迈步​，​脚步​蹒跚​不​稳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​它​似乎​恢复​了​。​它​盯​着​自己​的​手​看​了​一会儿​，​然后​转身​面对​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 liang4qiang4 zhao2 xiang4qian2 mai4bu4，jiao3bu4 pan2shan1 bu4 wen3。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ta1 si4hu1 hui1fu4 le5。ta1 ding1 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 shou3 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"It takes a bit of doing, but with your expert level of knowledge, you reprogram the terminal's signal transmitter so that it sends out a preconverted signal.\n"
"\n"
"The converter is no longer required, so you remove it."
msgstr ""
"经过​一番​努力​，​凭借​你​的​专业知识​，​你​重新​编程​了​终端​的​信号​发射器​，​使​它​可以​发送​预​转换​信号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​转换器​已​不再​需要​，​因此​你​将​其取​下​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1guo4 yi1 fan1 nu3li4，ping2jie4 ni3 de5 zhuan1 ye4 zhi1 shi2，ni3 chong2xin1 bian1cheng2 le5 zhong1duan1 de5 xin4hao4 fa1she4qi4，shi3 ta1 ke3yi3 fa1song4 yu4 zhuan3huan4 xin4hao4。\n"
"\n"
"zhuan3huan4qi4 yi3 bu4zai4 xu1yao4，yin1ci3 ni3 jiang1 qi2 qu3 xia4。"

msgid ""
"It takes a moment to realize what you're looking at. The red-haired girl is Glory. In the picture, she looks vibrant, happy, and alive.\n"
"\n"
"You don't recognize the other girl's face, but from what Glory has told you of her past, you'd guess that it's probably Marta."
msgstr ""
"片刻​之后​你​才​意识​到​，​那个​红​发​女孩​正是​格洛丽​。​照片​中​的​她​神采奕奕​，​洋溢着​幸福​与​生命力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另​一位​女孩​的​面容​你​并​不​熟悉​，​但​根据​格洛丽​讲述​的​往事​，​你​猜想​她​大概​就是​玛​尔塔​。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4 ni3 cai2 yi4shi2 dao4，na4ge5 hong2 fa1 nu:3hai2 zheng4shi4 Ge2luo4li2。zhao4pian4 zhong4 de5 ta1 shen2cai3yi4yi4，yang2 yi4 zhao2 xing4fu2 yu4 sheng1ming4li4。\n"
"\n"
"ling4 yi1 wei4 nu:3hai2 de5 mian4rong2 ni3 bing4 bu4 shu2xi1，dan4 gen1ju4 Ge2luo4li2 jiang3shu4 de5 wang3shi4，ni3 cai1xiang3 ta1 da4gai4 jiu4shi4 Ma3er3ta3。"

msgid ""
"It takes some doing, but you manage to force open the false wall. The hinges"
" give way with a scrape and a crunch, and the passage behind is revealed."
msgstr ""
"一番​努力​之后​，​你​终于​强行​破开​了​假墙​。​只​听​“​咔嚓​”​一声​，​铰链​松开​，​后面​的​通道​显露出来​。\n"
"yi1 fan1 nu3li4 zhi1hou4，ni3 zhong1yu2 qiang2xing2 po4kai1 le5 jia3 qiang2。zhi3 ting1“ka1cha1” yi1sheng1，jiao3lian4 song1kai1，hou4mian5 de5 tong1dao4 xian3 lou4 chu1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"It takes some doing, but your teammate manages to force open the false wall."
" The hinges give way with a scrape and a crunch, and the passage behind is "
"revealed."
msgstr ""
"一番​努力​之后​，​你​的​队友​终于​强行​破开​了​假墙​。​只​听​“​咔嚓​”​一声​，​铰链​松开​，​后面​的​通道​显露出来​。\n"
"yi1 fan1 nu3li4 zhi1hou4，ni3 de5 dui4you3 zhong1yu2 qiang2xing2 po4kai1 le5 jia3 qiang2。zhi3 ting1“ka1cha1” yi1sheng1，jiao3lian4 song1kai1，hou4mian5 de5 tong1dao4 xian3 lou4 chu1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"It takes time, but you focus past the glare of her aura to see the swirls of black and sickly green snaking through Feuerschwinge’s astral form. \n"
"\n"
"Cutting swaths of shadow into her light. Spilling it backwards into nothingness."
msgstr ""
"你​花​了​一些​时间​，​但​还是​穿过​了​她​光辉​的​耀眼​光芒​，​看到​黑色​而​病态​的​绿色​漩涡​在​火翼​的​灵体​中​蜿蜒​盘旋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​阴影​切割​开​她​的​光线​，​将​光线​向​后​倾泻​入​虚无​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hua1 le5 yi1xie1 shi2jian1，dan4 hai2shi5 chuan1guo4 le5 ta1 guang1hui1 de5 yao4yan3 guang1mang2，kan4dao4 hei1se4 er2 bing4tai4 de5 lu:4se4 xuan2wo1 zai4 Huo3yi4 de5 ling2ti3 zhong4 wan1yan2 pan2xuan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 yin1ying3 qie1ge1 kai1 ta1 de5 guang1xian4，jiang1 guang1xian4 xiang4 hou4 qing1xie4 ru4 xu1wu2。"

msgid ""
"It took us quite some time to find a place within the F-State. Our first "
"kiez changed so radically that we were compelled to leave. (h)"
msgstr ""
"我们​花​了​相当​长​的​时间​才​在​动荡​带​找到​自己​的​容身之处​。​我们​一​开始​的​街区​发生​了​翻天覆地​的​变化​，​迫使​我们​不得不​离开​。\n"
"wo3men5 hua1 le5 xiang1dang1 zhang3 de5 shi2jian1 cai2 zai4 dong4dang4 dai4 zhao3dao4 zi4ji3 de5 rong2 shen1 zhi1 chu3。wo3men5 yi1 kai1shi3 de5 jie1qu1 fa1sheng1 le5 fan1tian1fu4di4 de5 bian4hua4，po4shi3 wo3men5 bu4de2bu4 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"It turns out that a lot of the street kids I'd known over the years had moved there. The way that they'd disappeared, I'd assumed that they'd been kidnapped or killed, or had gone back to their parents. But there they were.\n"
"\n"
"I remember being kind of angry about it, like, \"how did everybody get the memo about this but me?\""
msgstr ""
"我​发现​原来​这些​年​我​认识​的​许多​街头​孩子​都​搬​去​了​那里​。​他们​消失​的​方式​让​我​一度​以为​他们​要么​被​绑架​或​杀害​，​要么​回到​了​父母​身边​。​但​他们​就​在​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​记得​当时​有点​生气​，​心想​：​“​怎么​大家​都​收到​了​通知​，​唯独​我​不​知道​？​”\n"
"\n"
"wo3 fa1xian4 yuan2lai2 zhe4xie1 nian2 wo3 ren4shi5 de5 xu3duo1 jie1tou2 hai2zi5 dou1 ban1 qu4 le5 na4li5。ta1men5 xiao1shi1 de5 fang1shi4 rang4 wo3 yi1du4 yi3wei2 ta1men5 yao4me5 bei4 bang3jia4 huo4 sha1hai4，yao4me5 hui2dao4 le5 fu4mu3 shen1bian1。dan4 ta1men5 jiu4 zai4 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4de5 dang1shi2 you3dian3 sheng1qi4，xin1xiang3：“zen3me5 da4jia1 dou1 shou1dao4 le5 tong1zhi1，wei2du2 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4？”"

msgid ""
"It used to be something to behold, my friend. One of the grandest markets in the city. You could find nearly *anything* in these stalls, for the right price.\n"
"\n"
"It's a real shame. But little by little, things slowed down. Folks stopped taking this subway line so much. "
msgstr ""
"朋友​，​那里​原本​是​个​好去处​，​也​是​城市​里​规模​最大​的​市场​之一​。​只要​价格公道​，​你​几乎​可以​在​那里​的​摊位​买​到​*​任何​东西​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可惜​的​是​，​生意​越来越​不景气​了​。​人们​已经​不怎么​搭乘​这​条​地铁​线路​了​。\n"
"\n"
"peng2you5，na4li5 yuan2ben3 shi4 ge4 hao3 qu4 chu3，ye3 shi4 cheng2shi4 li3 gui1mo2 zui4 dai4 de5 shi4chang3 zhi1yi1。zhi3yao4 jia4 ge2 gong1 dao4，ni3 ji1hu1 ke3yi3 zai4 na4li5 de5 tan1wei4 mai3 dao4*ren4he2 dong1xi1*。\n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1 de5 shi4，sheng1yi4 yue4lai2yue4 bu4jing3qi4 le5。ren2men5 yi3jing1 bu4zen3me5 da1cheng2 zhe4 tiao2 di4tie3 xian4lu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It used to be. But I think that when he started relying on his shrine, he handed the spirit trapped inside of it the keys to the kingdom.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She eyes Marta coolly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your husband might think that he's in charge here, but he isn't - not anymore. He's a servant, just like everybody else... the only difference is that he doesn't know it."
msgstr ""
"曾经​是​。​但​我​认为​当​他​开始​依赖​神龛​时​，​他​就​把​这个​小​王国​的​钥匙​亲自​交到​了​那困​在​神龛​之内​的​精魂​的​手中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​冷冷地​盯​着​玛​尔塔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​丈夫​可能​以为​他​仍然​掌控​着​这里​，​但​事实​已​并非如此​。​他​只是​个​仆人​，​和​其他人​一样​……​唯一​的​不同​是​他​还​没​意识​到​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"ceng2jing1 shi4。dan4 wo3 ren4wei2 dang1 ta1 kai1shi3 yi1lai4 shen2kan1 shi2，ta1 jiu4 ba3 zhe4ge5 xiao3 wang2guo2 de5 yao4shi5 qin1zi4 jiao1 dao4 le5 na4 kun4 zai4 shen2kan1 zhi1nei4 de5 jing1hun2 de5 shou3 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 leng3 leng3 de5 ding1 zhao2 Ma3er3ta3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 zhang4fu5 ke3neng2 yi3wei2 ta1 reng2ran2 zhang3kong4 zhao2 zhe4li3，dan4 shi4shi2 yi3 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。ta1 zhi3shi4 ge4 pu2ren2，he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4……wei2yi1 de5 bu4tong2 shi4 ta1 hai2 mei2 yi4shi2 dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"It varies from group to group, and person to person. Some of the younger "
"ones, who weren't injured in the attack, they want to rally and take the "
"fight to whoever deserves it."
msgstr ""
"这因​群体​而异​，​也​因人而异​。​一些​在​袭击​中未​受伤​的​年轻人​，​他们​希望​集结​起来​，​将​战斗​带给​那些​应​受​惩罚​的​人​。\n"
"zhe4 yin1 qun2ti3 er2 yi4，ye3 yin1ren2er2yi4。yi1xie1 zai4 xi2ji1 zhong4 wei4 shou4shang1 de5 nian2qing1ren2，ta1men5 xi1wang4 ji2jie2 qi3lai5，jiang1 zhan4dou4 dai4gei3 na4xie1 ying1 shou4 cheng2fa2 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"It was *your* idea, Blitz. I just didn't stop you. But okay, let's hear it."
msgstr ""
"那​是​*​你​的​*​主意​，​布里​茨​。​我​只是​没有​阻止​你​。​不过​也​行​，​那​你​说​说​吧​。\n"
"na4 shi4*ni3 de5*zhu3yi5，Bu4li3ci2。wo3 zhi3shi4 mei2you3 zu3zhi3 ni3。bu4guo4 ye3 xing2，na4 ni3 shuo1 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"It was HER, wasn’t it? Feuerschwinge. It must be. \n"
"\n"
"You made some sort of… deal.\n"
"\n"
"She helped you to escape, and in return you will help her rejoin her dragon body."
msgstr ""
"是因为​她​吧​？​肯定​是​火翼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​之间​……​达成​了​某种​交易​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​帮​你​逃出来​，​而​你​要​帮​她​重回​龙身​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 ba1？ken3ding4 shi4 Huo3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 zhi1jian1……da2cheng2 le5 mou3zhong3 jiao1yi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bang1 ni3 tao2 chu1 lai2，er2 ni3 yao4 bang1 ta1 chong2hui2 long2 shen1。"

msgid ""
"It was a calculated risk. Humanis are racist scum, but they've paid us for our work in the past.\n"
"\n"
"We rolled the dice, and we lost on this one. But something tells me that they're about to lose a whole lot more."
msgstr ""
"主要​是因为​风险​可控​。​人类​至上​主义者​是​种族主义​渣滓​没错​，​但​以前​替​他们​干活​，​报酬​一分​不少​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只不过​这次​我们​赌输​了​。​但​直觉​告诉​我​，​他们​即将​付出​更​惨痛​的​代价​。\n"
"\n"
"zhu3yao4 shi4 yin1 wei2 feng1xian3 ke3 kong4。ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 shi4 zhong3zu2zhu3yi4 zha1zi3 mei2cuo4，dan4 yi3qian2 ti4 ta1men5 gan4huo2，bao4chou5 yi1 fen4 bu4shao3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3bu5guo4 zhe4 ci4 wo3men5 du3 shu1 le5。dan4 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，ta1men5 ji2jiang1 fu4chu1 geng1 can3tong4 de5 dai4jia4。"

msgid ""
"It was a goddamned disaster!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pounds his fist on the table, sending cigarette butts flying.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Everything is *screwed,* chief! It all went wrong!"
msgstr ""
"简直​是​一场​灾难​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​一拳​砸​在​桌子​上​，​把​烟头​都​震飞​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切​都​*​搞砸​*​了​，​头儿​！​全都​不对劲​了​！\n"
"\n"
"jian3zhi2 shi4 yi1 chang2 zai1nan4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 quan2 za2 zai4 zhuo1zi5 shang4，ba3 yan1tou2 dou1 zhen4 fei1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1qie4 dou1*gao3za2*le5，tou2r5！quan2dou1 bu4dui4jin4 le5！"

msgid "It was a lie, Marta. What we're seeing now... this is the truth."
msgstr ""
"那​是​谎言​，​玛​尔塔​。​我们​现在​看到​的​……​才​是​真相​。\n"
"na4 shi4 huang3yan2，Ma3er3ta3。wo3men5 xian4zai4 kan4dao4 de5……cai2 shi4 zhen1xiang4。"

msgid ""
"It was a little anticlimactic. I was expecting us to kill her, or set her free, or *something.*\n"
"\n"
"Just walking away feels wrong, somehow."
msgstr ""
"这​有点​令人​失望​。​我​原本​以为​我们​会​杀死​她​，​或者​放​她​走​，​或者​*​做点​什么​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这么​离开​总​感觉​怪怪的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 you3dian3 ling4ren2 shi1wang4。wo3 yuan2ben3 yi3wei2 wo3men5 hui4 sha1si3 ta1，huo4zhe3 fang4 ta1 zou3，huo4zhe3*zuo4 dian3 shen2me5*。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4me5 li2kai1 zong3 gan3jue2 guai4 guai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"It was a pleasure working with you, $(l.name). I'm sorry that I asked you to come all this way for nothing.\n"
"\n"
"Now turn away, if you please."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​能​和​你​共事​是​我​的​荣幸​。​抱歉​让​你​大老远​过来​白跑一趟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​你​转过身​去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，neng2 he4 ni3 gong4shi4 shi4 wo3 de5 rong2xing4。bao4qian4 rang4 ni3 da4lao3yuan3 guo4lai2 bai2pao3yi1tang4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 ni3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"It was a rule. You let newcomers get settled for a month, maybe two, before teaching them the more... unsavory... aspects of cult life.\n"
"\n"
"Even then, you'd start them off slow. Their first lessons would use pork or chicken, never human meat. That didn't come until much later.\n"
"\n"
"Indoctrinating a new recruit after a week is risky as hell, and he never would've done it when I lived here."
msgstr ""
"这是​规矩​。​新人​得​先​适应​一两个​月​，​然后​他们​才​会​被​传授​教团​生活​中​那些​更​……​不堪​……​的​部分​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​即便​到​了​那​时候​，​也​是​循序渐进​。​最初​的​教学​只用​猪肉​或​鸡肉​，​绝不​碰人肉​。​那要​等到​很​久​以后​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​短短​一周​就​给​新人​强行​灌输​这些​知识​，​风险​极高​。​我​还​待​在​这里​的​时候​，​他​绝不会​这么​干​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 gui1ju5。xin1ren2 de2 xian1 shi4ying4 yi1 liang3 ge4 yue4，ran2hou4 ta1men5 cai2 hui4 bei4 chuan2shou4 jiao1 tuan2 sheng1huo2 zhong4 na4xie1 geng1……bu4kan1……de5 bu4fen5。\n"
"\n"
"ji2bian4 dao4 le5 na4 shi2hou5，ye3 shi4 xun2xu4jian4jin4。zui4chu1 de5 jiao1xue2 zhi3 yong4 zhu1rou4 huo4 ji1rou4，jue2bu4 peng4 ren2 rou4。na4 yao4 deng3dao4 hen3 jiu3 yi3hou4。\n"
"\n"
"duan3 duan3 yi1zhou1 jiu4 gei3 xin1ren2 qiang2xing2 guan4shu1 zhe4xie1 zhi1shi5，feng1xian3 ji2 gao1。wo3 hai2 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 jue2 bu4 hui4 zhe4me5 gan4。"

msgid ""
"It was a stupid accident. Somebody spilled soykaf on a control console, and "
"a bunch of test animals killed the researchers."
msgstr ""
"那​是​一次​愚蠢​的​事故​。​有人​把​豆​咖洒​在​了​控制​台上​，​然后​一大堆​实验​动物​杀死​了​研究员​们​。\n"
"na4 shi4 yi1ci4 yu2chun3 de5 shi4gu4。you3ren2 ba3 dou4 ka1 sa3 zai4 le5 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4，ran2hou4 yi1 dai4 dui1 shi2yan4 dong4wu4 sha1si3 le5 yan2jiu1yuan2 men5。"

msgid "It was a team effort. Monika would’ve done the same."
msgstr ""
"这是​团队​合作​的​结果​。​莫妮卡​也​会​做​同样​的​事​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 tuan2dui4 he2zuo4 de5 jie1guo3。Mo4ni1ka3 ye3 hui4 zuo4 tong2yang4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"It was actually fairly standard. The real power didn't come until later.\n"
"\n"
"But we'll get to that."
msgstr ""
"当时​其实​没什么​出格​的​情况​。​真正​的​力量​是​后来​才​涌现​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​后面​会​讲​到​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1shi2 qi2shi2 mei2shen2me5 chu1ge2 de5 qing2kuang4。zhen1zheng4 de5 li4liang5 shi4 hou4lai2 cai2 yong3xian4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hou4mian5 hui4 jiang3 dao4。"

msgid ""
"It was already too powerful to handle. I don't think that handin' it another weapon is going to change much in the long run.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno. Maybe it'll use all of this to protect the F-State, like it said. We'll just have to wait and see."
msgstr ""
"它​本来​就​已经​强大​到​难以​驾驭​了​。​我​认为​长远​来看​，​再​给​它​武器​也​改变​不了​多少​局面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​也许​它会​像​自己​所说​的​那样​，​用​这​一切​来​守护​动荡​带​。​我们​只能​静观其变​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ben3lai2 jiu4 yi3jing1 qiang2da4 dao4 nan2yi3 jia4yu4 le5。wo3 ren4wei2 chang2yuan3 lai2 kan4，zai4 gei3 ta1 wu3qi4 ye3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 duo1shao3 ju2mian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。ye3xu3 ta1 hui4 xiang4 zi4ji3 suo3 shuo1 de5 na4yang4，yong4 zhe4 yi1qie4 lai2 shou3hu4 dong4dang4 dai4。wo3men5 zhi3neng2 jing4 guan1 qi2 bian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It was already too powerful to handle. I don't think that handing it another weapon is going to change much in the long run.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, chief. Let's get the hell out of here. I want to go home."
msgstr ""
"它​本来​就​已经​强大​到​难以​驾驭​了​。​我​认为​长远​来看​，​再​给​它​武器​也​改变​不了​多少​局面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​了​头儿​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。​我​想​回家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ben3lai2 jiu4 yi3jing1 qiang2da4 dao4 nan2yi3 jia4yu4 le5。wo3 ren4wei2 chang2yuan3 lai2 kan4，zai4 gei3 ta1 wu3qi4 ye3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 duo1shao3 ju2mian4。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 le5 tou2r5，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。wo3 xiang3 hui2jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"It was already too powerful to handle. I don't think that handing it another weapon is going to change much in the long run.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know. Maybe it'll use all of this to protect the F-State, like it said. We'll just have to wait and see."
msgstr ""
"它​本来​就​已经​强大​到​难以​驾驭​了​。​我​认为​长远​来看​，​再​给​它​武器​也​改变​不了​多少​局面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​也许​它会​像​自己​所说​的​那样​，​用​这​一切​来​守护​动荡​带​。​我们​只能​静观其变​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ben3lai2 jiu4 yi3jing1 qiang2da4 dao4 nan2yi3 jia4yu4 le5。wo3 ren4wei2 chang2yuan3 lai2 kan4，zai4 gei3 ta1 wu3qi4 ye3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 duo1shao3 ju2mian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。ye3xu3 ta1 hui4 xiang4 zi4ji3 suo3 shuo1 de5 na4yang4，yong4 zhe4 yi1qie4 lai2 shou3hu4 dong4dang4 dai4。wo3men5 zhi3neng2 jing4 guan1 qi2 bian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It was also accurate. You routinely ignore those around you because you "
"think that you know better. I'm here to tell you... you do *not* know "
"better."
msgstr ""
"但​我​也​没​说错​吧​。​你​总会​忽略​周围​的​人​，​因为​你​觉得​自己​什么​都​懂​。​我​是​想​告诉​你​……​你​并​*​不是​*​什么​都​懂​。\n"
"dan4 wo3 ye3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4 ba1。ni3 zong3 hui4 hu1lu:e4 zhou1wei2 de5 ren2，yin1wei4 ni3 jue2de5 zi4ji3 shen2me5 dou1 dong3。wo3 shi4 xiang3 gao4su4 ni3……ni3 bing4*bu4shi4*shen2me5 dou1 dong3。"

msgid ""
"It was both. And both tasks were carried out to the letter.\n"
"\n"
"You should be pleased, $(l.name). The run was a resounding success."
msgstr ""
"二者​兼有​。​而且​两个​任务​都​得到​了​完全​执行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​应该​感到高兴​，​$(l.name)​。​这次​行动​取得​了​圆满成功​。\n"
"\n"
"er4zhe3 jian1you3。er2qie3 liang3 ge4 ren4wu5 dou1 de2dao4 le5 wan2quan2 zhi2xing2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，$(l.name)。zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 qu3de2 le5 yuan2 man3 cheng2 gong1。"

msgid ""
"It was bound to happen sooner or later. I live here, and I like a drink as "
"much as the next $(s.guy)."
msgstr ""
"这是​迟早​的​事​。​我​住​在​这里​，​而且​我​和​旁边​那个​$(s.guy)​一样​能​喝​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 chi2zao3 de5 shi4。wo3 zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3，er2qie3 wo3 he4 pang2bian1 na4ge5 $(s.guy) yi1yang4 neng2 he4。"

msgid ""
"It was cheap. It gets the job done.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"End of discussion."
msgstr ""
"便宜​，​也​够用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谈话​结束​。\n"
"\n"
"bian4yi2，ye3 gou4yong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tan2hua4 jie2shu4。"

msgid "It was destroyed?"
msgstr ""
"被​烧毁​了​？\n"
"bei4 shao1hui3 le5？"

msgid ""
"It was good stuff. High-quality. You couldn't tell one of our pieces from the real thing, not even with a microscope.\n"
"\n"
"But that was then, and this is now."
msgstr ""
"质量​不错​。​非常​高端​。​你​用​显微镜​也​分辨​不​出​我们​的​产品​和​正品​的​区别​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​那​是​以前​，​现在​已经​不​重要​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4liang4 bu4cuo4。fei1chang2 gao1duan1。ni3 yong4 xian3wei1jing4 ye3 fen1bian4 bu4 chu1 wo3men5 de5 chan3pin3 he4 zheng4pin3 de5 qu1bie2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 na4 shi4 yi3qian2，xian4zai4 yi3jing1 bu4 zhong4yao4 le5。"

msgid "It was horrible. There was blood everywhere."
msgstr ""
"现场​很​惨烈​。​到处​都​是​血​。\n"
"xian4chang3 hen3 can3lie4。dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 xie3。"

msgid ""
"It was just supposed to be a simple job, remember? \n"
"\n"
"A milk run? \n"
"\n"
"Get into the estate, snatch some data, and get home in time for “Wyrm Talk” on the trid."
msgstr ""
"这​本来​只是​一份​简单​的​差事​，​记得​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​小菜一碟​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​潜入​庄园​，​抢些​数据​，​准时​回家​观看​《​巨龙​夜话​》​3D​节目​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ben3lai2 zhi3shi4 yi1 fen4 jian3dan1 de5 cha4shi4，ji4de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"xiao3cai4yi1die2？\n"
"\n"
"qian2ru4 zhuang1yuan2，qiang3 xie1 shu4ju4，zhun3shi2 hui2jia1 guan1kan4 《 ju4long2 ye4 hua4 》 3D jie2mu4。"

msgid ""
"It was like a lever had been pulled. All at once, the bubble popped. \n"
"\n"
"I wasn't a powerful servant of the Adversary. I was not Harrow's number-one girl. I was a ridiculous little fool who'd willingly tied her soul to the worst thing in existence."
msgstr ""
"仿佛​有人​叩响​了​命运​的​扳机​。​刹那间​，​泡沫​破裂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​并非​“​反叛者​”​的​得力​仆从​，​也​并非​哈罗​最​倚重​的​姑娘​。​我​不过​是​个​可笑​的​小​傻瓜​，​甘愿​将​灵魂​献给​世间​最​邪恶​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"fang3fu2 you3ren2 kou4 xiang3 le5 ming4yun4 de5 ban1ji1。cha4 na4 jian1，pao4mo4 po4lie4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bing4fei1“fan3 pan4 zhe3” de5 de2li4 pu1 cong2，ye3 bing4fei1 ha1luo2 zui4 yi3zhong4 de5 gu1niang5。wo3 bu4guo4 shi4 ge4 ke3xiao4 de5 xiao3 sha3gua1，gan1yuan4 jiang1 ling2hun2 xian4 gei3 shi4jian1 zui4 xie2e4 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid "It was my pleasure, Samuel. Anything to help."
msgstr ""
"我​的​荣幸​，​塞缪尔​。​需要​帮忙​尽管​说话​。\n"
"wo3 de5 rong2xing4，sai4miu4er3。xu1yao4 bang1mang2 jin3guan3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"It was my pleasure.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else that you need?"
msgstr ""
"我​很​荣幸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​你​还有​什么​要​问​的​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 rong2xing4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4 wen4 de5？"

msgid "It was my responsibility to take care of you."
msgstr ""
"照顾​好​你​是​我​的​责任​。\n"
"zhao4gu5 hao3 ni3 shi4 wo3 de5 ze2ren4。"

msgid "It was nuts. That's why I came to you."
msgstr ""
"劲儿​太大​了​。​所以​我​才​来​找​你​。\n"
"jin4r5 tai4 dai4 le5。suo3yi3 wo3 cai2 lai2 zhao3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"It was quick. She went peacefully. That's the most that any of us can hope "
"for."
msgstr ""
"过程​很快​。​她​没受​什么​罪​。​这​已经​是​我们​这种​人能​祈求​的​最好​结局​了​。\n"
"guo4cheng2 hen3 kuai4。ta1 mei2 shou4 shen2me5 zui4。zhe4 yi3jing1 shi4 wo3men5 zhe4zhong3 ren2 neng2 qi2qiu2 de5 zui4hao3 jie2ju2 le5。"

msgid ""
"It was the high-intensity radiation of the SOX, combined with the magical "
"creature inside her, that allowed the woman to live for as long as she has."
msgstr ""
"正是​萨洛​卢区​的​高强度​辐射​，​加上​她​体内​那​只​魔法​生物​的​存在​，​才​让​这位​女性​能够​活​得​如此​长久​。\n"
"zheng4shi4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 de5 gao1 jiang4 du4 fu2she4，jia1shang4 ta1 ti3nei4 na4 zhi3 mo2fa3 sheng1wu4 de5 cun2zai4，cai2 rang4 zhe4wei4 nu:3xing4 neng2gou4 huo2 de2 ru2ci3 chang2jiu3。"

msgid ""
"It was the only way to save Trala-sheen, my darling daughter.\n"
"\n"
"Trala-sheen... and your *mother,* whom I hid away when you were but a girl. She's *still alive,* Brenna-thay!"
msgstr ""
"我​亲爱​的​女儿​，​只有​这样​才能​拯救​特拉​希恩​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​特拉​希恩​……​以及​你​的​*​母亲​*​。​当​你​还是​个​孩子​时​，​我​把​她​藏​了​起来​。​布伦娜​·​赛伊​，​她​*​还​活着​*​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qin1ai4 de5 nu:3er2，zhi3you3 zhe4yang4 cai2neng2 zheng3jiu4 te4 la1 xi1 en1。\n"
"\n"
"te4 la1 xi1 en1……yi3ji2 ni3 de5*mu3qin1*。dang1 ni3 hai2shi5 ge4 hai2zi5 shi2，wo3 ba3 ta1 zang4 le5 qi3lai5。bu4 lun2 na4 · sai4 yi1，ta1*hai2 huo2zhe5*！"

msgid "It was time for a change, that's all."
msgstr ""
"树​挪死​人挪活​，​就​这么​简单​。\n"
"shu4 nuo2 si3 ren2 nuo2 huo2，jiu4 zhe4me5 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"It was trapped inside a young woman living in the SOX. A mob of glowpunks revered her. Treated her like a goddess.\n"
"\n"
"I transported the young woman and the dragon’s body here, where I could study them. "
msgstr ""
"它​被困​在​了​萨洛​卢区​的​某个​年轻​女性​居民​体内​。​一群​幽光​住民​崇拜​她​。​把​她​当作​女神​一样​对待​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​把​这名​年轻​女子​和​龙​的​尸体​带到​这里​，​以便​我能​进行​研究​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bei4kun4 zai4 le5 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 de5 mou3 ge4 nian2qing1 nu:3xing4 ju1min2 ti3nei4。yi1 qun2 you1 guang1 zhu4 min2 chong2bai4 ta1。ba3 ta1 dang4zuo4 nu:3shen2 yi1yang4 dui4dai4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ba3 zhe4 ming2 nian2qing1 nu:3zi3 he4 long2 de5 shi1ti3 dai4 dao4 zhe4li3，yi3bian4 wo3 neng2 jin4xing2 yan2jiu1。"

msgid ""
"It was unfortunate, but I didn't have a choice. I had to get through them to"
" find Green Winters."
msgstr ""
"很​遗憾​，​但​我​也​没​办法​。​不​干掉​他们​的话​，​我​就​找​不到​格林​·​温特斯​。\n"
"hen3 yi2han4，dan4 wo3 ye3 mei2 ban4fa3。bu4 gan4diao4 ta1men5 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 zhao3 bu4dao4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。"

msgid ""
"It was widely known that Monika protected this place. Not alone, of course. "
"But she was the architect of the Kreuzbasar's alliances in peace time, and "
"defenses in war time. She was our diplomat and our general."
msgstr ""
"众所周知​，​莫妮卡​守护​着​这片​土地​。​当然​，​她​并非​孤军奋战​。​但​无论是​和平时期​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​联盟​体系​，​还是​战时​防御工事​的​构筑​，​都​有​她​在​幕后​出谋划策​。​她​既​是​我们​的​外交家​，​也​是​我们​的​统帅​。\n"
"zhong4suo3zhou1zhi1，Mo4ni1ka3 shou3hu4 zhao2 zhe4 pian1 tu3di4。dang1ran2，ta1 bing4fei1 gu1jun1fen4zhan4。dan4 wu2 lun2 shi4 he4 ping2 shi2 qi1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lian2meng2 ti3xi4，hai2shi5 zhan4shi2 fang2yu4gong1shi4 de5 gou4zhu4，dou1 you3 ta1 zai4 mu4hou4 chu1mou2hua4ce4。ta1 ji4 shi4 wo3men5 de5 wai4jiao1jia1，ye3 shi4 wo3men5 de5 tong3shuai4。"

msgid "It was worth it. It was all worth it."
msgstr ""
"值​了​。​这​一切​都​值​了​。\n"
"zhi2 le5。zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 zhi2 le5。"

msgid "It was written all over your face."
msgstr ""
"都​写​在​你​脸上​了​。\n"
"dou1 xie3 zai4 ni3 lian3 shang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It was. By the time I knew what was happening, it was almost too late to do anything about it.\n"
"\n"
"I did find a solution, but it wasn't pretty."
msgstr ""
"确实​。​等​我​意识​到​怎么回事​的​时候​，​已经​为​时​太晚​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽然​我​找到​了​解决办法​，​但​过程​并​不​愉快​。\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2。deng3 wo3 yi4shi2 dao4 zen3me5hui2shi4 de5 shi2hou5，yi3jing1 wei2 shi2 tai4 wan3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"sui1ran2 wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 jie3jue2ban4fa3，dan4 guo4cheng2 bing4 bu4 yu2kuai4。"

msgid ""
"It was... necessary to preserve the secrecy of my work. For the greater good of all. \n"
"\n"
"I know I have wronged you, and for this I am sorry.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs a long, rattling sigh that quickly turns into a violent fit of coughing. The sound echoes over the loudspeaker.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"为了​维护​工作​的​机密性​……​这是​必要​的​。​这是​为了​所有人​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​我​错怪​了​你​，​为此​我​感到​抱歉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​长长地​叹​了​口气​，​那​声音​沙哑​而​刺耳​，​很快​便​演变成​一阵​剧烈​的​咳嗽​。​咳嗽声​通过​扬声器​传出​，​回荡​在​空气​中​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 wei2hu4 gong1zuo4 de5 ji1mi4xing4……zhe4 shi4 bi4yao4 de5。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 suo3you3ren2 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3 cuo4guai4 le5 ni3，wei4ci3 wo3 gan3dao4 bao4qian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang3 zhang3 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，na4 sheng1yin1 sha1ya3 er2 ci4er3，hen3 kuai4 bian4 yan3 bian4 cheng2 yi1zhen4 ju4lie4 de5 ke2sou5。hai1 sou4 sheng1 tong1guo4 yang2sheng1qi4 chuan2chu1，hui2dang4 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "It wasn't a big deal, Dietrich. I would've brought you along anyway."
msgstr ""
"没​啥​大不了​的​，​迪​特里​希​。​你​不​提​我​也​会​把​你​带​过来​的​。\n"
"mei2 sha2 da4bu5liao3 de5，Di2te4li3xi1。ni3 bu4 ti2 wo3 ye3 hui4 ba3 ni3 dai4 guo4lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"It wasn't a lie - not completely. I *was* working on a patient when the fighting broke out.\n"
"\n"
"When I heard the gunshots, I ducked out of my office to find the girl. When I got back, I hid her away and went back into surgery.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to a copious dose of isoflurane and nitrous oxide, my patient was blissfully unaware of the interruption."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​谎言​—​—​不全是​。​袭击​开始​的​时候​，​我​*​确实​*​在​给​病人​做手术​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听到​枪声​后​，​我​躲​出​办公室​去​找​那个​女孩​。​回来​后​，​我​把​她​藏​了​起来​，​直接​进入​手术室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​由于​使用​了​大量​的​异氟醚​和​笑​气​，​我​的​病人​完全​没有​意识​到​手术​的​中断​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 huang3yan2——bu4 quan2 shi4。xi2ji1 kai1shi3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3*que4shi2*zai4 gei3 bing4ren2 zuo4 shou3 shu4。\n"
"\n"
"ting1dao4 qiang1sheng1 hou4，wo3 duo3 chu1 ban4gong1shi4 qu4 zhao3 na4ge5 nu:3hai2。hui2lai5 hou4，wo3 ba3 ta1 zang4 le5 qi3lai5，zhi2jie1 jin4ru4 shou3shu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"you2yu2 shi3yong4 le5 da4liang4 de5 yi4 fu2 mi2 he4 xiao4 qi4，wo3 de5 bing4ren2 wan2quan2 mei2you3 yi4shi2 dao4 shou3shu4 de5 zhong1duan4。"

msgid ""
"It wasn't a lie. I *am* an accountant, and I'm here in that capacity at Mr. Grinder's request.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}An edge of irritation creeps into his voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"People can be more than one thing, you know."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​谎话​。​我​*​确实​*​是​个​会计​，​而且​是​应​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​要求​以该​身份​前来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​中​透露​出​一丝​不耐烦​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​人有​多个​身份​也​是​很​正常​的​事情​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 huang3hua4。wo3*que4shi2*shi4 ge4 kuai4ji4，er2qie3 shi4 ying1“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 yao1qiu2 yi3 gai1 shen1fen4 qian2lai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhong4 tou4lu4 chu1 yi1 si1 bu4nai4fan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ren2 you3 duo1ge5 shen1fen4 ye3 shi4 hen3 zheng4chang2 de5 shi4qing5 ba1。"

msgid "It wasn't a pretty sight."
msgstr ""
"现场​一片狼藉​。\n"
"xian4chang3 yi1 pian1 lang2 jie4。"

msgid ""
"It wasn’t a minor enterprise, either. That facility took serious funds to "
"build."
msgstr ""
"对方​肯定​也​不是​什么​小​公司​。​那种​规模​的​设施​需要​一笔​庞大​的​资金​才能​建造​完成​。\n"
"dui4fang1 ken3ding4 ye3 bu4shi4 shen2me5 xiao3 gong1si1。na4zhong3 gui1mo2 de5 she4shi1 xu1yao4 yi1 bi3 pang2da4 de5 zi1jin1 cai2neng2 jian4zao4 wan2cheng2。"

msgid "It will *work*. I'm telling you--"
msgstr ""
"这会​*​成功​*​的​。​我​告诉​你​—​—\n"
"zhe4 hui4*cheng2gong1*de5。wo3 gao4su4 ni3 — —"

msgid ""
"It will be slow, Vauclair...\n"
"\n"
"I will *make* it slow...\n"
"\n"
"Delicious..."
msgstr ""
"我要​慢慢​折磨​你​，​沃​克莱尔​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一定​会​的​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​美味​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 man4man4 zhe2mo2 ni3，Wo4ke4lai2er3……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 de5……\n"
"\n"
"mei3wei4……"

msgid ""
"It will mean the end of the dragons.\n"
"\n"
"Not just Feuerschwinge. \n"
"\n"
"*All* dragons."
msgstr ""
"它​意味着​巨龙​时代​的​终结​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​只是​火翼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而是​*​所有​*​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi4wei4zhe5 ju4long2 shi2dai4 de5 zhong1jie2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi3shi4 Huo3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"er2shi4*suo3you3*ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"It will not be urgent till tomorrow, Half-Dream. You have time to pack up "
"your wares."
msgstr ""
"起码​在​明天​之前​还​来得及​，​半梦者​。​你​有​时间​收拾​你​的​东西​。\n"
"qi3ma3 zai4 ming2tian1 zhi1qian2 hai2 lai2de5ji2，ban4 meng4 zhe3。ni3 you3 shi2jian1 shou1shi5 ni3 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"It will work.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks down.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I promise you, Hermie... it will work."
msgstr ""
"会​成功​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​低下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​，​我​向​你​保证​……​会​成功​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hui4 cheng2gong1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3，wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4……hui4 cheng2gong1 de5。"

msgid ""
"It will. The dragons will die. I've seen what Panacea can do - the Doc "
"showed me tissue samples. It melted them."
msgstr ""
"当然​能​行​。​巨龙​会​殒命​。​我​已经​见识​过​了​“​万能​药​”​的​本事​—​—​博士​给​我​看过​那些​组织​样本​。​它们​纷纷​被​融化​了​。\n"
"dang1ran2 neng2 xing2。ju4long2 hui4 yun3ming4。wo3 yi3jing1 jian4shi5 guo4 le5“wan4neng2 yao4” de5 ben3shi4——bo2shi4 gei3 wo3 kan4 guo4 na4xie1 zu3zhi1 yang4ben3。ta1men5 fen1fen1 bei4 rong2hua4 le5。"

msgid "It won't happen again."
msgstr ""
"不会​再有​这种​事​了​。\n"
"bu4hui4 zai4 you3 zhe4zhong3 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It won't. This is a trick.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes a half-step back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whatever you do, don't take off that necklace."
msgstr ""
"它​才​不会​守信​。​这​是​个​骗局​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​后退​半步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​我​不会​摘下​这​条​项链​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 cai2 bu4hui4 shou3xin4。zhe4 shi4 ge4 pian4ju2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hou4tui4 ban4 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3 bu4hui4 zhai1xia4 zhe4 tiao2 xiang4lian4。"

msgid "It worked out well for some, less so for others. (h)"
msgstr ""
"对​部分​人​来说​结果​不错​，​对​另​一些​人则​不然​。\n"
"dui4 bu4fen5 ren2 lai2 shuo1 jie1guo3 bu4cuo4，dui4 ling4 yi1xie1 ren2 ze2 bu4ran2。"

msgid ""
"It works for him.\n"
"\n"
"He had to make some sort of living here in the Kreuzbasar, you know?"
msgstr ""
"对​他​来说​管用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​要​住​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​就​总得​讨生活​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"dui4 ta1 lai2 shuo1 guan3yong4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yao4 zhu4 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jiu4 zong3dei3 tao3sheng1huo2，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "It would have been bad."
msgstr ""
"确实​会​很​糟糕​。\n"
"que4shi2 hui4 hen3 zao1gao1。"

msgid ""
"It wouldn't be too hard for me to manufacture a power spike from here.\n"
"\n"
"We could overload the Azzies' power grid. Without disabling the generators' safety overrides, it wouldn't cause any permanent damage, but the confusion might give us an opening to get into the building."
msgstr ""
"用​它​制造​一波​电力​尖峰​，​对​我​来说​不算什么​难事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​可以​让​阿兹佬​的​电网​过载​。​只要​不​关闭​发电机​的​安全​超控​装置​，​就​不会​造成​永久性​损坏​，​但​由此​引发​的​混乱​或许​能为​我们​创造​进入​建筑​的​机会​。\n"
"\n"
"yong4 ta1 zhi4zao4 yi1 bo1 dian4li4 jian1feng1，dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2 nan2 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ke3yi3 rang4 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 dian4wang3 guo4zai4。zhi3yao4 bu4 guan1bi4 fa1dian4ji1 de5 an1quan2 chao1 kong4 zhuang1zhi4，jiu4 bu4hui4 zao4cheng2 yong3jiu3xing4 sun3huai4，dan4 you2ci3 yin3fa1 de5 hun4luan4 huo4xu3 neng2 wei2 wo3men5 chuang4zao4 jin4ru4 jian4zhu4 de5 ji1hui4。"

msgid ""
"It'd be nice to believe that. It really, really would.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away from the tri-vid player and stalks past you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"如果​这​要是​真的​就​好​了​。​我​真的​非常​希望​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转身​离开​3D​影像​机​，​静静​走过​你​的​身边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 yao4shi5 zhen1de5 jiu4 hao3 le5。wo3 zhen1de5 fei1chang2 xi1wang4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 3D ying3xiang4 ji1，jing4 jing4 zou3guo4 ni3 de5 shen1bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"It'll be a girl. Harrow would never take a male as his second - he wouldn't want the competition.\n"
"\n"
"And her hair will be fire-red. It's a sort of insignia of rank within the cult."
msgstr ""
"应该​是​个​女孩​。​哈罗​绝不会​选择​男性​作为​他​的​副手​—​—​他​可​不想​有​竞争对手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​她​的​头发​应该​是​火红色​。​这​算是​教派​中​象征​地位​的​标志​。\n"
"\n"
"ying1gai1 shi4 ge4 nu:3hai2。ha1luo2 jue2 bu4 hui4 xuan3ze2 nan2xing4 zuo4wei2 ta1 de5 fu4shou3——ta1 ke3 bu4xiang3 you3 jing4zheng1dui4shou3。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4 ta1 de5 tou2fa5 ying1gai1 shi4 huo3 hong2 se4。zhe4 suan4shi4 jiao4pai4 zhong4 xiang4zheng1 di4wei4 de5 biao1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"It'll be fine. My gut tells me that she's gonna disappear. Find a nice, cozy"
" place to sleep off this age of the world, and try again next time."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​。​我​的​直觉​告诉​我​说​她​会​就​这样​消失​不见​，​找个​舒服​的​地方​陷入​长眠​，​度过​世界​的​这个​时代​，​然后​再度​开始​。\n"
"mei2shi4 de5。wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 ta1 hui4 jiu4 zhe4yang4 xiao1shi1 bu4jian4，zhao3 ge4 shu1fu5 de5 di4fang1 xian4ru4 chang2mian2，du4guo4 shi4jie4 de5 zhe4ge5 shi2dai4，ran2hou4 zai4du4 kai1shi3。"

msgid "It'll work. Easy buddy... easy now."
msgstr ""
"会​有用​的​。​冷静​，​小家伙​……​冷静​。\n"
"hui4 you3yong4 de5。leng3jing4，xiao3 jia1 huo3……leng3jing4。"

msgid "It's 2054. Haven't we gotten past this kind of thing?"
msgstr ""
"都​2054​年​了​，​我们​还​没​摒弃​这种​东西​吗​？\n"
"dou1 2054 nian2 le5，wo3men5 hai2 mei2 bing4qi4 zhe4zhong3 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid "It's Berlin, 2054. Trust is so 2053."
msgstr ""
"这是​2054​年​的​柏林​。​信任​这种​词太​老掉牙​了​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 2054 nian2 de5 bo2lin2。xin4ren4 zhe4zhong3 ci2 tai4 lao3diao4ya2 le5。"

msgid ""
"It's a bad place. A run-down, gang-infested hellhole. But it shares a border with the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"And if the Engineer is allowed to do his work there uninterrupted, it's going to get a whole lot worse."
msgstr ""
"是​个​三教九流​之地​。​那儿​早已​成​了​破败​不堪​、​帮派​横行​的​鬼​地方​。​但​它​紧​挨着​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​让​工程师​在​那儿​不​受​干扰​地​搞​他​的​研究​，​情况​只会​变得​更糟​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ge4 san1jiao4jiu3liu2 zhi1 de5。na4r5 zao3yi3 cheng2 le5 po4bai4 bu4kan1、bang1pai4 heng2xing2 de5 gui3 di4fang1。dan4 ta1 jin3 ai1zhe5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 rang4 gong1cheng2shi1 zai4 na4r5 bu4 shou4 gan1rao3 de5 gao3 ta1 de5 yan2jiu1，qing2kuang4 zhi3 hui4 bian4de5 geng1 zao1。"

msgid "It's a common sentiment, believe me. But I appreciate the thought."
msgstr ""
"谁​都​会​这么​想​，​相信​我​。​但​你​的​好意​我心​领了​。\n"
"shei2 dou1 hui4 zhe4me5 xiang3，xiang1xin4 wo3。dan4 ni3 de5 hao3yi4 wo3 xin1 ling3 le5。"

msgid ""
"It's a conundrum, to be sure. The world's great religions have been struggling with it ever since the Awakening.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He offers you an apologetic smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is a problem that I cannot solve for you, young $(l.race). You'll have to find your own answers."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​这​确实​是​个​难题​。​自​“​大​觉醒​”​事件​以来​，​世界​各大​宗教​始终​为此​困扰​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朝​你​露出​歉意​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​年轻​的​$(l.race)​，​我​无法​为​你​解决​这个​问题​。​你​只能​去​寻找​属于​你​自己​的​答案​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，zhe4 que4shi2 shi4 ge4 nan2ti2。zi4“dai4 jue2xing3” shi4jian4 yi3lai2，shi4jie4 ge4 dai4 zong1jiao4 shi3zhong1 wei4ci3 kun4rao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 qian4yi4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"nian2qing1 de5 $(l.race)，wo3 wu2fa3 wei2 ni3 jie3jue2 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。ni3 zhi3neng2 qu4 xun2zhao3 shu3yu2 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 da2an4 le5。"

msgid "It's a deal, Ullrich."
msgstr ""
"成交​，​乌尔里​希​。\n"
"cheng2jiao1，wu1 er3 li3 xi1。"

msgid "It's a fusebox. Nothing looks out of order."
msgstr ""
"是​个​保险盒​。​看起来​一切正常​。\n"
"shi4 ge4 bao3xian3he2。kan4qi3lai5 yi1 qie1 zheng1 chang2。"

msgid "It's a gift."
msgstr ""
"这是​天赋​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 tian1fu4。"

msgid "It's a good thought, anyway. I'll keep it in mind."
msgstr ""
"不管怎样​，​这​是​个​好​主意​。​我会​记着​的​。\n"
"bu4guan3zen3yang4，zhe4 shi4 ge4 hao3 zhu3yi5。wo3 hui4 ji4 zhao2 de5。"

msgid ""
"It's a great theory, Glory, but that's all it is. We don't know for a fact "
"if any of what you just said is true."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​的​推理​很​有​想法​，​但​它​只是​推理​而已​。​我们​无法​确定​你​刚才​说​的​任何​内容​是否​属实​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 de5 tui1li3 hen3 you3 xiang3fa3，dan4 ta1 zhi3shi4 tui1li3 er2yi3。wo3men5 wu2fa3 que4ding4 ni3 gang1cai2 shuo1 de5 ren4he2 nei4rong2 shi4fou3 shu3shi2。"

msgid ""
"It's a great theory, but that's all it is. We don't know for a fact if any "
"of what you just said is true."
msgstr ""
"你​的​推理​很​有​想法​，​但​它​只是​推理​而已​。​我们​无法​确定​你​刚才​说​的​任何​内容​是否​属实​。\n"
"ni3 de5 tui1li3 hen3 you3 xiang3fa3，dan4 ta1 zhi3shi4 tui1li3 er2yi3。wo3men5 wu2fa3 que4ding4 ni3 gang1cai2 shuo1 de5 ren4he2 nei4rong2 shi4fou3 shu3shi2。"

msgid ""
"It's a little late for that, $(l.race). You've just brought me the last of what I need.\n"
"\n"
"That gas that you hauled in for us... it's gonna prove every word that we've been saying. The trogs, the halfers, the goddamned dandelion-eaters... one whiff of this stuff, and they're gonna tear each other apart. And then they'll spill into the good, *human* neighborhoods, where we'll be waiting to stop them."
msgstr ""
"已经​太迟​了​，​$(l.race)​。​你​送来​的​正好​是​我​需要​的​最后​一样​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​运来​的​气体​……​它​将​兑现​我们​说​过​的​一切​。​穴居人​、​半截​人​、​那些​该死​的​素食​精​……​只要​闻到​这​玩意​，​他们​就​会​自相残杀​。​然后​他们​就​会​涌入​美好​的​、​真正​的​*​人类​*​居住​的​社区​，​而​我们​会​在​那儿​等​着​阻止​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5，$(l.race)。ni3 song4 lai2 de5 zheng4hao3 shi4 wo3 xu1yao4 de5 zui4hou4 yi1yang4 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yun4 lai2 de5 qi4ti3……ta1 jiang1 dui4xian4 wo3men5 shuo1 guo4 de5 yi1qie4。xue2ju1ren2、ban4jie2 ren2、na4xie1 gai1si3 de5 su4shi2 jing1……zhi3yao4 wen2dao4 zhe4 wan2yi4，ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 zi4xiang1can2sha1。ran2hou4 ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 yong3ru4 mei3hao3 de5、zhen1zheng4 de5*ren2lei4*ju1zhu4 de5 she4qu1，er2 wo3men5 hui4 zai4 na4r5 deng3 zhao2 zu3zhi3 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"It's a little late for that, race-traitor. You've just brought me the last of what I need.\n"
"\n"
"That gas that you hauled in for us... it's gonna prove every word that we've been saying. The trogs, the halfers, the goddamned dandelion-eaters... one whiff of this stuff, and they're gonna tear each other apart. And then they'll spill into the good, *human* neighborhoods, where we'll be waiting to stop them."
msgstr ""
"已经​太迟​了​，​种族​叛徒​。​你​送来​的​正好​是​我​需要​的​最后​一样​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​运来​的​气体​……​它​将​兑现​我们​说​过​的​一切​。​穴居人​、​半截​人​、​那些​该死​的​素食​精​……​只要​闻到​这​玩意​，​他们​就​会​自相残杀​。​然后​他们​就​会​涌入​美好​的​、​真正​的​*​人类​*​居住​的​社区​，​而​我们​会​在​那儿​等​着​阻止​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5，zhong3zu2 pan4tu2。ni3 song4 lai2 de5 zheng4hao3 shi4 wo3 xu1yao4 de5 zui4hou4 yi1yang4 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yun4 lai2 de5 qi4ti3……ta1 jiang1 dui4xian4 wo3men5 shuo1 guo4 de5 yi1qie4。xue2ju1ren2、ban4jie2 ren2、na4xie1 gai1si3 de5 su4shi2 jing1……zhi3yao4 wen2dao4 zhe4 wan2yi4，ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 zi4xiang1can2sha1。ran2hou4 ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 yong3ru4 mei3hao3 de5、zhen1zheng4 de5*ren2lei4*ju1zhu4 de5 she4qu1，er2 wo3men5 hui4 zai4 na4r5 deng3 zhao2 zu3zhi3 ta1men5。"

msgid "It's a long story."
msgstr ""
"说来话长​。\n"
"shuo1lai2hua4chang2。"

msgid ""
"It's a long story. But the chief and I are gonna get it taken care of in a "
"jiffy."
msgstr ""
"说来话长​。​但​我​和​头儿​马上​就​能​搞定​这​事​。\n"
"shuo1lai2hua4chang2。dan4 wo3 he4 tou2r5 ma3shang4 jiu4 neng2 gao3ding4 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid "It's a long story. Just trust me, I'll get us through this."
msgstr ""
"说来话长​，​但​相信​我​，​我会​带​大家​渡过难关​的​。\n"
"shuo1lai2hua4chang2，dan4 xiang1xin4 wo3，wo3 hui4 dai4 da4jia1 du4 guo4 nan2 guan1 de5。"

msgid ""
"It's a long story. Suffice it to say that someone I know has had dealings "
"with the thing."
msgstr ""
"说来话长​。​这么​说​吧​，​我​认识​的​某个​人​和​那​东西​有些​恩怨​。\n"
"shuo1lai2hua4chang2。zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，wo3 ren4shi5 de5 mou3 ge4 ren2 he4 na4 dong1xi1 you3xie1 en1yuan4。"

msgid ""
"It's a lot, $(l.name). Believe me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She claps a hand onto your shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on, fearless leader. We're still in gang territory. Let's drop this and get moving."
msgstr ""
"是​收获​颇丰​，​$(l.name)​。​相信​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​我们​还​在​帮派​地盘​上​。​别​纠结​了​，​赶紧​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shou1huo4 po1 feng1，$(l.name)。xiang1xin4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3men5 hai2 zai4 bang1pai4 di4pan2 shang4。bie4 jiu1jie2 le5，gan3jin3 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"It's a lump of rock about as tall as I am, inscribed with runes and encrusted with bone.\n"
"\n"
"Its power comes from an entity that Harrow bound into the stone... something very old, and very dangerous. A toxic spirit.\n"
"\n"
"In many ways, it is the heart of this place."
msgstr ""
"一块​大石头​，​和​我​差不多​高​，​上面​刻满​了​符文​，​还​镶嵌​着​骨头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​神龛​的​力量​源自​哈罗​封印​在​石中​的​存在​……​那​是​个​极其​古老​而​又​危险​的​东西​。​一个​邪恶​精魂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​各种​意义​上​讲​，​它​都​可以​算作​这​地方​的​心脏​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1kuai4 dai4 dan4 tou2，he4 wo3 cha4bu5duo1 gao1，shang4mian4 ke4 man3 le5 fu2wen2，hai2 xiang1qian4 zhao2 gu3tou5。\n"
"\n"
"shen2kan1 de5 li4liang5 yuan2zi4 ha1luo2 feng1yin4 zai4 dan4 zhong4 de5 cun2zai4……na4 shi4 ge4 ji2qi2 gu3lao3 er2 you4 wei1xian3 de5 dong1xi1。yi1ge5 xie2e4 jing1hun2。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ge4zhong3 yi4yi4 shang4 jiang3，ta1 dou1 ke3yi3 suan4 zuo4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 xin1zang4。"

msgid ""
"It's a lump of rock about as tall as I am, inscribed with runes and encrusted with bone.\n"
"\n"
"The shrine's power comes from an entity that Harrow bound into the stone... something very old, and very dangerous. A toxic spirit.\n"
"\n"
"In many ways, it is the heart of this place."
msgstr ""
"一块​大石头​，​和​我​差不多​高​，​上面​刻满​了​符文​，​还​镶嵌​着​骨头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​神龛​的​力量​源自​哈罗​封印​在​石中​的​存在​……​那​是​个​极其​古老​而​又​危险​的​东西​。​一个​邪恶​精魂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​各种​意义​上​讲​，​它​都​可以​算作​这​地方​的​心脏​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1kuai4 dai4 dan4 tou2，he4 wo3 cha4bu5duo1 gao1，shang4mian4 ke4 man3 le5 fu2wen2，hai2 xiang1qian4 zhao2 gu3tou5。\n"
"\n"
"shen2kan1 de5 li4liang5 yuan2zi4 ha1luo2 feng1yin4 zai4 dan4 zhong4 de5 cun2zai4……na4 shi4 ge4 ji2qi2 gu3lao3 er2 you4 wei1xian3 de5 dong1xi1。yi1ge5 xie2e4 jing1hun2。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ge4zhong3 yi4yi4 shang4 jiang3，ta1 dou1 ke3yi3 suan4 zuo4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 xin1zang4。"

msgid "It's a miracle that you survived."
msgstr ""
"你​能活​下来​真是​个​奇迹​。\n"
"ni3 neng2 huo2 xia4lai5 zhen1shi5 ge4 qi2ji4。"

msgid ""
"It's a new drug! There *are* no long-term abusers.\n"
"\n"
"And besides, cram is a study drug. It's not, like, a BTL or anything. It won't kill you."
msgstr ""
"这是​新药​！​哪里​*​有​*​什么​长期​滥用​者​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再说​了​，​超感​就是​“​聪明​药​”​嘛​。​它​又​不是​BTL​那种​东西​，​死不了​人​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 xin1 yao4！na3li3*you3*shen2me5 chang2qi1 lan4yong4 zhe3 a1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1 le5，chao1 gan3 jiu4shi4“cong1ming5 yao4” ma5。ta1 you4 bu4shi4 BTL na4zhong3 dong1xi1，si3bu4liao3 ren2 de5。"

msgid "It's a nice enough place, but I don't know if that's the word I'd use."
msgstr ""
"这​地方​是​不错​，​不过​我​应该​不会​用​这个​词​。\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 shi4 bu4cuo4，bu4guo4 wo3 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 yong4 zhe4ge5 ci2。"

msgid ""
"It's a pity that we had to kill the thing. I mean, yeah, I *get* it... it must've been horrible for the troll that they installed all of that stuff into.\n"
"\n"
"But it was a thing of beauty, all the same."
msgstr ""
"可惜​我们​只能​杀掉​那家伙​。​当然​，​*​我​懂​*​……​那个​巨魔​被​强行​安装​了​这么​多​玩意儿​，​一定​也​挺​惨​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​它​同时​也​充满​了​美感​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1 wo3men5 zhi3neng2 sha1diao4 na4 jia1 huo3。dang1ran2，*wo3 dong3*……na4ge5 ju4mo2 bei4 qiang2xing2 an1zhuang1 le5 zhe4me5 duo1 wan2yi4r5，yi1ding4 ye3 ting3 can3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1 tong2shi2 ye3 chong1man3 le5 mei3gan3。"

msgid ""
"It's a real mess out here, John - an absolutely tragic situation.\n"
"\n"
"Just to refresh the viewers at home, the permanent mana storm that surrounded the city of Sydney--"
msgstr ""
"约翰​，​外面​简直​是​一团糟​—​—​简直​是​场​彻头彻尾​的​悲剧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​此​为​电视机​前​的​观众们​回顾​一下​：​持续​笼罩​悉尼市​的​永久性​魔力​风暴​—\n"
"\n"
"yue1han4，wai4mian4 jian3zhi2 shi4 yi1tuan2zao1——jian3zhi2 shi4 chang2 che4tou2che4wei3 de5 bei1ju4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ci3 wei2 dian4shi4ji1 qian2 de5 guan1 zhong4 men5 hui2gu4 yi1xia4：chi2xu4 long3zhao4 xi1 ni2 shi4 de5 yong3jiu3xing4 mo2li4 feng1bao4 —"

msgid ""
"It's a shame your guys didn't search us for weapons, Quorin. "
"{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"奎林​，​你​的​人​没有​搜去​我们​的​武器​真是​个​错误​。​{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"kui2 lin2，ni3 de5 ren2 mei2you3 sou1 qu4 wo3men5 de5 wu3qi4 zhen1shi5 ge4 cuo4wu4。{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"It's a standard cardboard box with a few mundane items inside, and one "
"object that a spirit has been bound to. It appears safe to open."
msgstr ""
"是​个​普通​的​纸箱​，​里面​装着​几件​寻常​物品​，​还有​个​被​精魂​附身​的​物件​。​看起来​可以​安全​打开​。\n"
"shi4 ge4 pu3tong1 de5 zhi3xiang1，li3mian4 zhuang1 zhao2 ji1 jian4 xun2chang2 wu4pin3，hai2you3 ge4 bei4 jing1hun2 fu4shen1 de5 wu4jian4。kan4qi3lai5 ke3yi3 an1quan2 da3kai1。"

msgid ""
"It's a start.\n"
"\n"
"Let's get out of here, $(l.name). There's nothing more for us here."
msgstr ""
"起码​是​个​开始​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​离开​这里​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。\n"
"\n"
"qi3ma3 shi4 ge4 kai1shi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid "It's a tough call."
msgstr ""
"这​是​个​艰难​的​决定​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4 jian1nan2 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"It's about time I left this place behind... If I never see another Kroner "
"again, it'll be too soon for me."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​离开​这个​地方​了​……​如果​没​碰上​克​罗纳​这种​人​，​我​可能​还​觉得​用不着​呢​。\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 li2kai1 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 le5……ru2guo3 mei2 peng4shang4 ke4 luo2na4 zhe4zhong3 ren2，wo3 ke3neng2 hai2 jue2de5 yong4bu5zhao2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"It's about time I left this place behind... If I never see another Kroner again, it'll be too soon for me.\n"
"\n"
"Wish I could get my stuff back from my room first, though. Stupid gang, closing the whole hotel."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​离开​这个​地方​了​……​如果​没​碰上​克​罗纳​这种​人​，​我​可能​还​觉得​用不着​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​我​还是​很​想​先​从​房间​里​把​东西​拿​回来​。​这​帮派​真​弱智​，​关​旅馆​干什么​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 li2kai1 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 le5……ru2guo3 mei2 peng4shang4 ke4 luo2na4 zhe4zhong3 ren2，wo3 ke3neng2 hai2 jue2de5 yong4bu5zhao2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，wo3 hai2shi5 hen3 xiang3 xian1 cong2 fang2jian1 li3 ba3 dong1xi1 na2 hui2lai5。zhe4 bang1pai4 zhen1 ruo4zhi4，guan1 lu:3guan3 gan4shen2me5 a1。"

msgid "It's all good, thanks. I'm just passing through."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​，​谢谢​。​我​只是​路过​。\n"
"mei2shi4 de5，xie4xie5。wo3 zhi3shi4 lu4guo4。"

msgid ""
"It's all right, Doctor. I'm on your side here, as much as I am theirs. I "
"agree that you deserve to be paid."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​，​医生​。​我​和​你​还有​他们​都​是​一边​的​。​我​觉得​你​理应​得到​报酬​。\n"
"mei2shi4 de5，yi1sheng1。wo3 he4 ni3 hai2you3 ta1men5 dou1 shi4 yi1bian1 de5。wo3 jue2de5 ni3 li3ying1 de2dao4 bao4chou5。"

msgid "It's all right, man. Just take it, it's on me."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​。​拿​去​吧​，​算​我​请​你​的​。\n"
"mei2shi4 de5。na2 qu4 ba1，suan4 wo3 qing3 ni3 de5。"

msgid "It's all right. Don't worry, I'll look after you."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​。​别​担心​，​我会​照看​好​你​。\n"
"mei2shi4 de5。bie4 dan1xin1，wo3 hui4 zhao4kan4 hao3 ni3。"

msgid "It's almost as if they didn't expect us to make it here."
msgstr ""
"他们​好像​没指望​我们​能​来​。\n"
"ta1men5 hao3xiang4 mei2 zhi3 wang4 wo3men5 neng2 lai2。"

msgid "It's almost like there's somethin' else in here with me."
msgstr ""
"就​好像​这​副​身体​里​除了​我​之外​还有​别的​东西​。\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 zhe4 fu4 shen1ti3 li3 chu2le5 wo3 zhi1wai4 hai2you3 bie2de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"It's an audition.\n"
"\n"
"The purpose of this trial is for *you* to prove your worth to *us,* not the other way around."
msgstr ""
"这是​一次​“​试镜​”​环节​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​的​价值​在于​让​*​你​*​向​*​我们​*​证明​自己​的​价值​，​而​非​反其道而行之​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1ci4“shi4jing4” huan2jie2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 jia4zhi2 zai4yu2 rang4*ni3*xiang4*wo3men5*zheng4ming2 zi4ji3 de5 jia4zhi2，er2 fei1 fan3qi2dao4er2xing2zhi1。"

msgid "It's an old, obsolete phone booth."
msgstr ""
"一间​老旧​过时​的​电话亭​。\n"
"yi1 jian1 lao3jiu4 guo4shi2 de5 dian4hua4ting2。"

msgid "It's an old, obsolete phone booth. It's ringing."
msgstr ""
"一间​老旧​过时​的​电话亭​。​铃声​在​里面​响起​。\n"
"yi1 jian1 lao3jiu4 guo4shi2 de5 dian4hua4ting2。ling2sheng1 zai4 li3mian4 xiang3qi3。"

msgid ""
"It's an unfortunate situation, of course.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He cocks his head apologetically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But then, that's the world we live in, isn't it?"
msgstr ""
"这种​情况​确实​令人遗憾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​歪​了​歪头​表示歉意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我们​生活​的​世界​不​就是​这个​样子​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 que4shi2 ling3 ren2 yi2 han4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wai1 le5 wai1 tou2 biao3 shi4 qian4 yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 sheng1huo2 de5 shi4jie4 bu4 jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5 yang4zi5 ma5？"

msgid "It's been fun, but I've gotta get going."
msgstr ""
"这里​挺好玩​的​，​不过​我​得​走​了​。\n"
"zhe4li3 ting3 hao3 wan2 de5，bu4guo4 wo3 de2 zou3 le5。"

msgid "It's been two years. Someone must have come knocking before now."
msgstr ""
"已经​过去​两年​了​。​肯定​有人​来​敲​过门​才​对​吧​？\n"
"yi3jing1 guo4qu4 liang3 nian2 le5。ken3ding4 you3ren2 lai2 qiao1 guo4men2 cai2 dui4 ba1？"

msgid "It's better than fair. I've done my homework, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"远远​不止​吧​。​我​是​做​过​市场调研​的​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"yuan3yuan3 bu4zhi3 ba1。wo3 shi4 zuo4 guo4 shi4 chang2 diao4 yan2 de5，$(l.name)。"

msgid "It's cool, Zaak. You have nothing to worry about from me."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​，​扎克​。​你​不用​担心​我会​提​什么​要求​。\n"
"mei2shi4 de5，Zha1ke4。ni3 bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3 hui4 ti2 shen2me5 yao1qiu2。"

msgid ""
"It's difficult to make out what you're seeing at first; the scene is dark and smoky, and the telltale flashes of emergency vehicle lights flicker on the periphery of the screen.\n"
"\n"
"The camera pushes in, and you can make out two figures standing in a ruined landscape.\n"
"\n"
"All at once, the sound cuts in."
msgstr ""
"起初​，​你​很​难​辨认出​眼前​的​景象​；​现场​漆黑一片​，​烟雾​缭绕​，​应急​车灯​在​屏幕​外围​闪烁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​镜头​推近​，​你​可以​看到​两个​人影​站​在​一片​废墟​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​突然​，​声音​切入​。\n"
"\n"
"qi3chu1，ni3 hen3 nan2 bian4 ren4 chu1 yan3qian2 de5 jing3xiang4 ； xian4chang3 qi1 hei1 yi1 pian1，yan1wu4 liao2rao4，ying4ji2 che1deng1 zai4 ping2mu4 wai4wei2 shan3shuo4。\n"
"\n"
"jing4tou2 tui1 jin4，ni3 ke3yi3 kan4dao4 liang3 ge4 ren2ying3 zhan4 zai4 yi1 pian1 fei4xu1 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2，sheng1yin1 qie1ru4。"

msgid "It's done. That's all that matters."
msgstr ""
"事情​已​了​。​知道​这个​就够​了​。\n"
"shi4qing5 yi3 le5。zhi1dao4 zhe4ge5 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It's doubtful that the Firewing's pawns even know where their money is going. This is typical of draconic plots; uncover a stream of money flowing behind the scenes, and there's a fair chance that you'll find a dragon at the receiving end of it.\n"
"\n"
"To a dragon, conspiracy is second nature."
msgstr ""
"火翼​手下​的​棋子​们​恐怕​连​自己​的​钱​流向​何处​都​一无所知​。​这​正是​龙族​阴谋​的​典型​特征​：​只要​调查​幕后​的​资金​链​，​十有八九​就​能​在​接收端​发现​巨龙​的​身影​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​巨龙​而言​，​阴谋诡计​是​与生俱来​的​本能​。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 shou3xia4 de5 qi2zi3 men5 kong3pa4 lian2 zi4ji3 de5 qian2 liu2xiang4 he2chu4 dou1 yi1wu2suo3zhi1。zhe4 zheng4shi4 long2 zu2 yin1mou2 de5 dian3xing2 te4zheng1：zhi3yao4 diao4cha2 mu4hou4 de5 zi1jin1 lian4，shi2you3ba1jiu3 jiu4 neng2 zai4 jie1 shou1 duan1 fa1xian4 ju4long2 de5 shen1ying3。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 ju4long2 er2yan2，yin1mou2gui3ji4 shi4 yu3sheng1ju4lai2 de5 ben3neng2。"

msgid "It's easy for you to say that, but I'm not buying it."
msgstr ""
"你​说​得​倒​轻巧​，​但​我​可不​信​这​一套​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dao3 qing1qiao3，dan4 wo3 ke3bu5 xin4 zhe4 yi1tao4。"

msgid ""
"It's easy to pass judgment from where you're standing, $(l.name). But in my "
"position, you'd have done the same thing."
msgstr ""
"站​在​你​的​立场​上​评头论足​很​容易​，​$(l.name)​。​但​如果​你​在​我​当时​的​位置​，​恐怕​你​也​会​做出​同样​的​选择​。\n"
"zhan4 zai4 ni3 de5 li4chang3 shang4 ping2tou2lun4zu2 hen3 rong2yi4，$(l.name)。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 wo3 dang1shi2 de5 wei4zhi5，kong3pa4 ni3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"It's far more likely that this was a targeted move. To recruit, dissuade, or"
" eliminate. (h)"
msgstr ""
"这​更​像是​是​有​预谋​的​行动​，​旨在​招募​人员​、​劝阻​目标​或​直接​清除​异己​。\n"
"zhe4 geng1 xiang4 shi4 shi4 you3 yu4mou2 de5 xing2dong4，zhi3zai4 zhao1mu4 ren2yuan2、quan4zu3 mu4biao1 huo4 zhi2jie1 qing1chu2 yi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"It's fine, chief. Don't worry about it... I've got the situation under control.\n"
"\n"
"And I really, really mean it this time."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​，​头儿​。​不用​担心​……​我​已经​掌握​局面​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这次​是​认真​的​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4 de5，tou2r5。bu4yong4 dan1xin1……wo3 yi3jing1 zhang3wo4 ju2mian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4 ci4 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5。"

msgid ""
"It's fine, my needs are being seen to... it's your loss, not mine.\n"
"\n"
"I'm just sorry that you weren't able to benefit from the opportunity that I had to offer."
msgstr ""
"没什么​，​反正​有人​满足​了​我​的​需要​……​这​是​你​的​损失​，​和​我​无关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​感觉​有点​遗憾​，​你​没能​从​我​提供​的​这个​好​机会​中​获益​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5，fan3zheng4 you3ren2 man3zu2 le5 wo3 de5 xu1yao4……zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 sun3shi1，he4 wo3 wu2guan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 gan3jue2 you3dian3 yi2han4，ni3 mei2 neng2 cong2 wo3 ti2gong1 de5 zhe4ge5 hao3 ji1hui4 zhong4 huo4yi4。"

msgid ""
"It's funny. I've heard lots of rumors about the Azzies over the years... stories about makin' monsters and consortin' with evil spirits, that sort of thing.\n"
"\n"
"I'd always assumed that they were urban legend at best, or xenophobia at worst. Definitely not true, at any rate."
msgstr ""
"真​有意思​。​这些年来​我​听​过​不少​关于​阿兹佬​的​传闻​……​什么​制造​怪物​、​与​邪​灵​精魂​为伍​之类​的​鬼故事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​以为​这些​顶多​是​都市​传说​，​最坏​不过​是​种族​偏见​。​反正​肯定​不是​真的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 you3yi4si5。zhe4 xie1 nian2 lai2 wo3 ting1 guo4 bu4shao3 guan1yu2 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 chuan2wen2……shen2me5 zhi4zao4 guai4wu5、yu4 xie2 ling2 jing1hun2 wei2wu3 zhi1lei4 de5 gui3gu4shi5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 yi3wei2 zhe4xie1 ding3duo1 shi4 du1shi4 chuan2shuo1，zui4 huai4 bu4guo4 shi4 zhong3zu2 pian1jian4。fan3zheng4 ken3ding4 bu4shi4 zhen1de5。"

msgid "It's good to know that you're so on top of things."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​知道​你们​如此​尽职尽责​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 ru2ci3 jin4zhi2jin4ze2。"

msgid "It's good you're doing your part."
msgstr ""
"你​能​贡献​自己​的​力量​是​好事​。\n"
"ni3 neng2 gong4xian4 zi4ji3 de5 li4liang5 shi4 hao3shi4。"

msgid "It's hard to say. But I'd like to believe that we did."
msgstr ""
"不好​说​。​但​我​愿意​相信​这样​是​对​的​。\n"
"bu4hao3 shuo1。dan4 wo3 yuan4yi4 xiang1xin4 zhe4yang4 shi4 dui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"It's hard to say. The AI was already too powerful to handle. I don't think that handing it another weapon is going to change much in the long run.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know. Maybe it'll use all of this to protect the F-State, like it said. We'll just have to wait and see."
msgstr ""
"不好​说​。​那​AI​本来​就​已经​强大​到​难以​驾驭​了​。​我​认为​长远​来看​，​再​给​它​武器​也​改变​不了​多少​局面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​也许​它会​像​自己​所说​的​那样​，​用​这​一切​来​守护​动荡​带​。​我们​只能​静观其变​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4hao3 shuo1。na4 AI ben3lai2 jiu4 yi3jing1 qiang2da4 dao4 nan2yi3 jia4yu4 le5。wo3 ren4wei2 chang2yuan3 lai2 kan4，zai4 gei3 ta1 wu3qi4 ye3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 duo1shao3 ju2mian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。ye3xu3 ta1 hui4 xiang4 zi4ji3 suo3 shuo1 de5 na4yang4，yong4 zhe4 yi1qie4 lai2 shou3hu4 dong4dang4 dai4。wo3men5 zhi3neng2 jing4 guan1 qi2 bian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It's hard to tell with them, if they're being hit in the same fashion or "
"just attacking each other out of fear."
msgstr ""
"很难​判断​他们​究竟​是​被​同样​的​方式​攻击​，​还是​出于​恐惧​而​互相攻击​。\n"
"hen3 nan2 pan4duan4 ta1men5 jiu1jing4 shi4 bei4 tong2yang4 de5 fang1shi4 gong1ji1，hai2shi5 chu1yu2 kong3ju4 er2 hu4 xiang1 gong1 ji1。"

msgid ""
"It's hard, but it gets easier if I'm keeping busy. And I'm trying to keep "
"REAL busy."
msgstr ""
"这​并​不​容易​，​但​我​如果​让​自己​忙​起来​的话​，​就​能​转移​注意力​。​所以​我​在​让​自己​特别​特别​忙​。\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4 rong2yi4，dan4 wo3 ru2guo3 rang4 zi4ji3 mang2 qi3lai5 de5hua4，jiu4 neng2 zhuan3yi2 zhu4yi4li4。suo3yi3 wo3 zai4 rang4 zi4ji3 te4bie2 te4bie2 mang2。"

msgid "It's helpful, sure. But helpful and good aren't always the same thing."
msgstr ""
"是​有​帮助​没错​。​但​有​帮助​并​不​总是​件​好事​。\n"
"shi4 you3 bang1zhu4 mei2cuo4。dan4 you3 bang1zhu4 bing4 bu4 zong3shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。"

msgid "It's her. The girl who lured you here."
msgstr ""
"是​她​。​那个​引诱​你​到​这里​的​女孩​。\n"
"shi4 ta1。na4ge5 yin3you4 ni3 dao4 zhe4li3 de5 nu:3hai2。"

msgid ""
"It's here now, like it or not.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks up and locks eyes with you. Without looking away, she addresses the rest of the team.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But enough of that. We have business to discuss."
msgstr ""
"无论​你​喜不喜欢​，​它​都​已经​在​这里​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​抬头​与​你​四目​相对​，​没有​移开​视线​，​直接​对​其他​队员​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​闲话​少​叙​。​我们​有​正事​要​商议​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 xi3 bu4 xi3 huan1，ta1 dou1 yi3jing1 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2tou2 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4，mei2you3 yi2kai1 shi4xian4，zhi2jie1 dui4 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian2hua4 shao3 xu4。wo3men5 you3 zheng4shi4 yao4 shang1yi4。"

msgid "It's his. He runs the goddamned place."
msgstr ""
"整个​设施​都​是​他​的​。​他​掌控​着​那​该死​的​地方​。\n"
"zheng3ge4 she4shi1 dou1 shi4 ta1 de5。ta1 zhang3kong4 zhao2 na4 gai1si3 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"It's important because he's a monster, $(l.name). Where he goes, misery follows.\n"
"\n"
"The Engineer is cold, calculating, utterly pitiless, and impeccably well-trained. And he's all too willing to sell his services to the highest bidder."
msgstr ""
"因为​他​是​个​怪物​，​$(l.name)​。​他​所到之处​，​灾祸​便​随之而来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​工程师​冷酷无情​、​精于​算计​、​毫无​怜悯之心​，​且​训练有素​。​他​总是​乐于​将​自己​的​服务​卖​给​出价​最高者​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 ta1 shi4 ge4 guai4wu5，$(l.name)。ta1 suo3dao4zhi1chu4，zai1huo4 bian4 sui2 zhi1 er2 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 leng3ku4wu2qing2、jing1yu2 suan4ji5、hao2wu2 lian2 min3 zhi1 xin1，qie3 xun4 lian4 you3 su4。ta1 zong3shi4 le4yu2 jiang1 zi4ji3 de5 fu2wu4 mai4 gei3 chu1jia4 zui4 gao1 zhe3。"

msgid "It's in working order, but it's not a looker."
msgstr ""
"它​还​能​用​，​但​样子​不​好看​。\n"
"ta1 hai2 neng2 yong4，dan4 yang4zi5 bu4 hao3kan4。"

msgid "It's just a song."
msgstr ""
"这​只是​一首歌​。\n"
"zhe4 zhi3shi4 yi1 shou3 ge1。"

msgid "It's like I thought. Things have changed in the past few years."
msgstr ""
"果然​如​我​所料​。​过去​几年​间​，​事情​已经​发生​了​变化​。\n"
"guo3ran2 ru2 wo3 suo3liao4。guo4qu4 ji3nian2 jian1，shi4qing5 yi3jing1 fa1sheng1 le5 bian4hua4。"

msgid ""
"It's meant to be. That's how it gets to you.\n"
"\n"
"It worms its way inside of you, *changes* you, and you don't even realize what's happening until it's too late."
msgstr ""
"正是如此​。​它​就是​这样​影响​你​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它会​悄然​钻进​你​的​灵魂深处​，​*​改变​*​着​你​，​而​你​甚至​意识​不到​发生​了​什么​，​直到​为时已晚​。\n"
"\n"
"zheng1 shi4 ru2 ci3。ta1 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4 ying3xiang3 ni3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hui4 qiao3ran2 zuan1jin4 ni3 de5 ling2hun2shen1chu4，*gai3bian4*zhao2 ni3，er2 ni3 shen4zhi4 yi4shi2 bu4dao4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5，zhi2dao4 wei2shi2yi3wan3。"

msgid ""
"It's my job to be on top of things, $(l.name). You needn't worry about me on that count.\n"
"\n"
"You also don't need to worry about our mysterious Matrix killer... at least, not insofar as I am concerned. I won't step near a jackpoint until this entire sorry episode is over."
msgstr ""
"我​的​职责​就是​把​一切​安排​得​井井有条​。​$(l.name)​，​这​一点​你​大​可​放心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​也​不必​担心​那个​神秘​的​矩阵​杀手​……​至少​它​还​威胁​不到​我​。​在​这​整件​麻烦事​结束​前​，​我​不会​靠近​任何​接入点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 zhi2ze2 jiu4shi4 ba3 yi1qie4 an1pai2 de2 jing3jing3you3tiao2。$(l.name)，zhe4 yi1dian3 ni3 dai4 ke3 fang4xin1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3 bu4bi4 dan1xin1 na4ge5 shen2mi4 de5 ju3zhen4 sha1shou3……zhi4shao3 ta1 hai2 wei1xie2 bu4dao4 wo3。zai4 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 ma2 fan2 shi4 jie2shu4 qian2，wo3 bu4hui4 kao4jin4 ren4he2 jie1ru4dian3。"

msgid ""
"It's my personal drone. Good to have something to hide behind when you're on a solo decking run, y'know?\n"
"\n"
"Luster took it from me when she seized control of the Schwarze Herzen. I'd been hoping to get it back ever since."
msgstr ""
"这​是​我​的​私人​无人机​。​在​独自​执行​骇入​差事​时​，​有个​东西​可以​躲​在​后面​，​不是​挺​好​的​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​拉斯特​在​我​失去​对​“​黑心​”​的​控制权​时​夺走​了​它​。​从那以后​，​我​一直​希望​能​把​它​要​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 si1ren2 wu2ren2ji1。zai4 du2zi4 zhi2xing2 hai4 ru4 cha4shi4 shi2，you3 ge4 dong1xi1 ke3yi3 duo3 zai4 hou4mian5，bu4shi4 ting3 hao3 de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"la1 si1 te4 zai4 wo3 shi1qu4 dui4“hei1xin1” de5 kong4zhi4quan2 shi2 duo2zou3 le5 ta1。cong2 na4 yi3 hou4，wo3 yi1zhi2 xi1wang4 neng2 ba3 ta1 yao4 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"It's my teammate, Glory. She spent her youth as a member of an Adversary "
"cult. It was kind of a bad scene."
msgstr ""
"是​我​的​队友​，​格洛丽​。​她​年轻​时​曾​加入​过​一个​信奉​反叛者​的​邪教组织​。​那段​经历​相当​糟糕​。\n"
"shi4 wo3 de5 dui4you3，Ge2luo4li2。ta1 nian2qing1 shi2 ceng2 jia1ru4 guo4 yi1ge5 xin4feng4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 xie2 jiao1 zu3 zhi1。na4 duan4 jing1li4 xiang1dang1 zao1gao1。"

msgid ""
"It's necessary, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shoots a disgusted glance at your captive.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And I won't let this twisted little prick chase me out of the room. He can tell me whatever story he likes."
msgstr ""
"有​这个​必要​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你们​的​俘虏​投​去​厌恶​的​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​让​这个​小混蛋​扰乱​我​的​心智​。​他​爱​说​什么​都​无所谓​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 zhe4ge5 bi4yao4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3men5 de5 fu2lu3 tou2 qu4 yan4wu4 de5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 rang4 zhe4ge5 xiao3 hun4 dan4 rao3luan4 wo3 de5 xin1zhi4。ta1 ai4 shuo1 shen2me5 dou1 wu2suo3wei4。"

msgid ""
"It's no skin off my back, friend. My employers are the ones who wanted to hire you, not me.\n"
"\n"
"But I'm telling you... you're making a mistake."
msgstr ""
"这​跟​我​没​半点​关系​，​朋友​。​是​我​的​雇主​想​雇​你​，​不是​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​得​说​……​你​这​是​在​犯错​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 gen1 wo3 mei2 ban4dian3 guan1xi5，peng2you5。shi4 wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 xiang3 gu4 ni3，bu4shi4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 de2 shuo1……ni3 zhe4 shi4 zai4 fan4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"It's none of your business, Dietrich. If Monika wanted you to know these "
"things, she'd have told you herself."
msgstr ""
"与​你​无关​，​迪​特里​希​。​如果​莫妮卡​想​让​你​知道​，​她​早就​自己​告诉​你​了​。\n"
"yu4 ni3 wu2guan1，Di2te4li3xi1。ru2guo3 Mo4ni1ka3 xiang3 rang4 ni3 zhi1dao4，ta1 zao3jiu4 zi4ji3 gao4su4 ni3 le5。"

msgid "It's not easy. Not easy to be alone."
msgstr ""
"独自一人​生活​，​并​不是​件​容易​的​事​。\n"
"du2 zi4 yi1 ren2 sheng1huo2，bing4 bu4shi4 jian4 rong2yi4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"It's not gossip! It's work.\n"
"\n"
"Survival, really."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​小道消息​！​这是​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可以​说​是​谋生​手段​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 xiao3dao4xiao1xi5！zhe4 shi4 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 mou2sheng1 shou3duan4。"

msgid ""
"It's not like they own me! I'd... I'd just leave if I wanted to.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks away, uncertain.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​这​条命​又​没卖​给​他们​！​我​……​我​要是​真想​走​的话​，​直接​走​就是​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​移开​视线​，​讲话​也​吞吞吐吐​的​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4 tiao2 ming4 you4 mei2 mai4 gei3 ta1men5！wo3……wo3 yao4shi5 zhen1 xiang3 zou3 de5hua4，zhi2jie1 zou3 jiu4shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi2kai1 shi4xian4，jiang3hua4 ye3 tun1tun1tu3tu3 de5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "It's not literal sun, silly."
msgstr ""
"那​不是​指​字面​意思​的​太阳​，​笨蛋​。\n"
"na4 bu4shi4 zhi3 zi4mian4 yi4si5 de5 tai4yang5，ben4dan4。"

msgid "It's not right. These things should never happen."
msgstr ""
"这样​是​不​对​的​。​这种​事情​永远​都​不该​发生​。\n"
"zhe4yang4 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5。zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 yong3yuan3 dou1 bu4gai1 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"It's not that simple. Physically destroying the shrine won't help us.\n"
"\n"
"Harrow bound a malevolent entity - a toxic spirit - into the stone. That's where its power comes from, and that's what we're going to have to deal with.\n"
"\n"
"In many ways, it is the heart of this place."
msgstr ""
"没​这么​简单​。​在​物理层​面上​摧毁​神龛​对​我们​没有​任何​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​将​某个​恶毒​的​存在​封印​在​了​石头​里​。​一个​邪恶​精魂​。​这​就是​那座​神龛​的​力量​来源​，​也​是​我们​要​对付​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​各种​意义​上​讲​，​它​都​可以​算作​这​地方​的​心脏​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 zhe4me5 jian3dan1。zai4 wu4li3ceng2 mian4 shang4 cui1hui3 shen2kan1 dui4 wo3men5 mei2you3 ren4he2 bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 jiang1 mou3 ge4 e4du2 de5 cun2zai4 feng1yin4 zai4 le5 shi2tou5 li3。yi1ge5 xie2e4 jing1hun2。zhe4 jiu4shi4 na4 zuo4 shen2kan1 de5 li4liang5 lai2yuan2，ye3 shi4 wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ge4zhong3 yi4yi4 shang4 jiang3，ta1 dou1 ke3yi3 suan4 zuo4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 xin1zang4。"

msgid ""
"It's not the call I would’ve made but...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shoots a backward glance at the wretched woman, still silently wailing in her glass prison.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What's done is done."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​我会​做​的​决定​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​回头​瞥​了​一眼​那个​仍​在​玻璃​牢笼​中​默默​哀号​的​可怜​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​事已至此​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 hui4 zuo4 de5 jue2ding4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui2tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4ge5 reng2 zai4 bo1li5 lao2long2 zhong4 mo4mo4 ai1hao2 de5 ke3lian2 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3。"

msgid "It's not the call that I would’ve made, but..."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​我会​做​的​决定​，​但是​……\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 hui4 zuo4 de5 jue2ding4，dan4shi4……"

msgid ""
"It's not too late to fix this.\n"
"\n"
"Just say the word, and I'll put a bullet in his brain. Quick and easy."
msgstr ""
"现在​弥补​还​不算​晚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​你​发话​，​我​就​一​枪崩​了​他​的​脑袋​。​轻轻松松​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 mi2bu3 hai2 bu4suan4 wan3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 fa1 hua4，wo3 jiu4 yi1 qiang1beng1 le5 ta1 de5 nao3dai5。qing1 qing1 song1 song1。"

msgid ""
"It's not too late to join your Masters. The crater's right there - feel free"
" to hop in."
msgstr ""
"想要​追随​你​的​主​人们​还​来得及​。​坑​就​在​那儿​，​你​随时​可以​往里​跳​。\n"
"xiang3yao4 zhui1sui2 ni3 de5 zhu3 ren2men5 hai2 lai2de5ji2。keng1 jiu4 zai4 na4r5，ni3 sui2shi2 ke3yi3 wang3 li3 tiao4。"

msgid ""
"It's only a matter of time before more security drones show up. You wanna "
"get shot, too?"
msgstr ""
"很快​会​有​更​多​安保​无人机​过来​。​你​也​想​送命​吗​？\n"
"hen3 kuai4 hui4 you3 geng1 duo1 an1bao3 wu2ren2ji1 guo4lai2。ni3 ye3 xiang3 song4ming4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"It's over almost before it starts. Carried forward by the momentum of her lunge, Marta slams into Glory's outstretched claws with her full weight. Razors slide through soft flesh and grind into bone.\n"
"\n"
"Marta lets out a low, groaning sound. You can see the red spreading, leaching into the fabric of her blouse."
msgstr ""
"一切​转瞬之间​便​已​结束​。​借着​猛冲​的​惯性​，​玛​尔塔​用​全身​的​重量​撞​向​格洛丽​伸出​的​利爪​。​锋刃​划过​柔软​的​血肉​，​最终​嵌入​骨骼​深处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​发出​了​一声​低沉​的​呻吟​。​你​看到​鲜红​的​血迹​正​不断​扩散​，​渗染进​她​衬衫​的​布料​里​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1qie4 zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1 bian4 yi3 jie2shu4。jie4zhe5 meng3chong1 de5 guan4xing4，Ma3er3ta3 yong4 quan2shen1 de5 zhong4liang4 zhuang4 xiang4 Ge2luo4li2 shen1chu1 de5 li4zhao3。feng1 ren4 hua2guo4 rou2ruan3 de5 xue4rou4，zui4zhong1 qian4ru4 gu3ge2 shen1chu4。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 fa1chu1 le5 yi1sheng1 di1chen2 de5 shen1yin2。ni3 kan4dao4 xian1hong2 de5 xue4ji4 zheng1 bu4duan4 kuo4san4，shen4 ran3 jin4 ta1 chen4shan1 de5 bu4liao4 li3。"

msgid ""
"It's over.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles at you. Lit from beneath by the red glow of that claw, her mouth looks like it's full of blood.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's finished."
msgstr ""
"结束​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​对​你​露出​微笑​。​利爪​的​红光​从​下方​映衬​，​让​她​看起来​像​满口​沾染​着​鲜血​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切​都​结束​了​。\n"
"\n"
"jie2shu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。li4zhao3 de5 hong2 guang1 cong2 xia4fang1 ying4chen4，rang4 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 man3kou3 zhan1ran3 zhao2 xian1xue4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1qie4 dou1 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It's possible that APEX fabricated that comm feed. Vauclair might still be "
"innocent."
msgstr ""
"APEX​可能​伪造​了​那份​通讯​记录​。​沃​克莱尔​或许​仍​是​清白​的​。\n"
"APEX ke3neng2 wei3zao4 le5 na4 fen4 tong1xun4 ji4lu4。Wo4ke4lai2er3 huo4xu3 reng2 shi4 qing1bai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"It's probably a moot point anyway. I don't even know if I *can* refuse Him anymore.\n"
"\n"
"He's been with me for so long, I don't know where He stops and I begin."
msgstr ""
"讨论​这个​也​没什么​意义​，​因为​我​甚至​不​知道​自己​是否​还​*​能​*​拒绝​祂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祂​与​我​相伴​已​久​，​我​分不清​祂​的​界限​于​何处​止息​，​我​的​边界​又​从​何处​开始​。\n"
"\n"
"tao3lun4 zhe4ge5 ye3 mei2shen2me5 yi4yi4，yin1wei4 wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 shi4fou3 hai2*neng2*ju4jue2 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yu4 wo3 xiang1ban4 yi3 jiu3，wo3 fen4 bu4 qing1 ta1 de5 jie4xian4 yu2 he2chu4 zhi3xi1，wo3 de5 bian1jie4 you4 cong2 he2chu4 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"It's probably good that you're keeping your distance, Taylor... we're hearing some frightening things about this rift. I'm looking at a statement from renowned hermetic theorist Elizabeth Alder, which I'm going to read to you now...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He squints up at his teleprompter.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"泰勒​，​保持​距离​或许​是​明智之举​……​我们​听闻​关于​这​条​裂隙​的​传闻​令人​毛骨悚然​。​我​手头​有​著名​赫耳墨斯​理论家​伊丽莎白​·​奥尔德​的​声明​，​现在​就​为​你​朗读​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​眯眼​望​向​提词​器​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"tai4le4，bao3chi2 ju4li2 huo4xu3 shi4 ming2zhi4zhi1ju3……wo3men5 ting1wen2 guan1yu2 zhe4 tiao2 lie4xi4 de5 chuan2wen2 ling4ren2 mao2gu3song3ran2。wo3 shou3tou2 you3 zhu4ming2 he4er3mo4si1 li3lun4jia1 yi1li4sha1bai2 · ao4 er3 de2 de5 sheng1ming2，xian4zai4 jiu4 wei2 ni3 lang3du2……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mi1yan3 wang4 xiang4 ti2ci2 qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"It's real nice to be able to wind down and relax for a change. No more worrying about *this ganger* or *that ganger* sneakin' behind me and slippin' a knife between my ribs.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He slaps the table with a grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a good change, chief, I've gotta say."
msgstr ""
"能​有​机会​放松​一下​，​真是​太好了​。​不用​再​担心​*​这个​黑帮​*​或​*​那个​黑帮​*​偷偷​溜​到​我​后面​，​然后​捅​我​一刀​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​笑​着​拍拍​桌子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​说​，​头儿​，​改变​是​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"neng2 you3 ji1hui4 fang4song1 yi1xia4，zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5。bu4yong4 zai4 dan1xin1*zhe4ge5 hei1bang1*huo4*na4ge5 hei1bang1*tou1tou1 liu1 dao4 wo3 hou4mian5，ran2hou4 tong3 wo3 yi1 dao1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 zhao2 pai1 pai1 zhuo1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 shuo1，tou2r5，gai3bian4 shi4 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"It's so dark in this maintenance area you can barely see your hand in front "
"of your face."
msgstr ""
"这处​维修区​漆黑一片​，​你​的​眼前​伸手不见五指​。\n"
"zhe4 chu3 wei2 xiu1 qu1 qi1 hei1 yi1 pian1，ni3 de5 yan3qian2 shen1shou3bu4jian4wu3zhi3。"

msgid ""
"It's sort of like a scrambler for IC. It gets into the assembly code of "
"hostile programs and jumbles it around a bit... confuses the hell out of "
"'em."
msgstr ""
"像是​某种​干扰器​或者​IC​。​它会​侵入​敌对​程序​的​汇编​代码​，​并​对​其​进行​干扰​……​让​它们​彻底​混乱​。\n"
"xiang4 shi4 mou3zhong3 gan4 rao3 qi4 huo4zhe3 IC。ta1 hui4 qin1ru4 di2dui4 cheng2xu4 de5 hui4bian1 dai4ma3，bing4 dui4 qi2 jin4xing2 gan1rao3……rang4 ta1men5 che4di3 hun4luan4。"

msgid ""
"It's still just printing your name, $(l.name). Maybe Monika did something to"
" the system before... "
msgstr ""
"它​还是​在​一直​在​输出​你​的​名字​，​$(l.name)​。​莫妮卡​以前​可能​动过​这个​系统​……\n"
"ta1 hai2shi5 zai4 yi1zhi2 zai4 shu1chu1 ni3 de5 ming2zi5，$(l.name)。Mo4ni1ka3 yi3qian2 ke3neng2 dong4 guo4 zhe4ge5 xi4tong3……"

msgid "It's taken care of. You can leave... after you give me my money."
msgstr ""
"事情​已经​解决​了​。​你​可以​走​了​……​但​你​要​先​把​钱​给​我​。\n"
"shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 le5。ni3 ke3yi3 zou3 le5……dan4 ni3 yao4 xian1 ba3 qian2 gei3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"It's tempting, $(l.name). It's really fucking tempting.\n"
"\n"
"But no... I won't hurt you. Not unless you give me reason to."
msgstr ""
"我​很​想​这么​做​，​$(l.name)​。​真的​很​他​妈​想​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​……​我​不会​伤害​你​。​除非​你​让​我​有​理由​这样​做​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4，$(l.name)。zhen1de5 hen3 ta1 ma1 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4……wo3 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 ni3。chu2fei1 ni3 rang4 wo3 you3 li3you2 zhe4yang4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"It's the least I can do. I wasn't much help during the attack. Truth be "
"told, I owe my life to Samuel, his people, and to the Kreuzbasar. This is my"
" way of saying thanks."
msgstr ""
"这​是​我​起码​能​做​的​。​在​袭击​期间​，​我​没​帮上​什么​忙​。​说实话​，​我​欠​了​塞缪尔​、​他​的​人民​以及​克洛伊​茨​集市​一条​命​。​这​是​我​表达​感激​之情​的​方式​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 qi3ma3 neng2 zuo4 de5。zai4 xi2ji1 qi1jian1，wo3 mei2 bang1 shang4 shen2me5 mang2。shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 qian4 le5 sai4miu4er3、ta1 de5 ren2min2 yi3ji2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 yi1 tiao2 ming4。zhe4 shi4 wo3 biao3da2 gan3ji1 zhi1 qing2 de5 fang1shi4。"

msgid "It's the life Kim chose, and it comes with the occasional beating."
msgstr ""
"这是​阿金​选择​的​生活​，​也​断​不了​会​有​被​人​殴打​这种​事​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 e1 jin1 xuan3ze2 de5 sheng1huo2，ye3 duan4 bu4le5 hui4 you3 bei4 ren2 ou1da3 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"It's the nature of the city. Always changing. A kiez that is peaceful one "
"year becomes a warzone the next. It kept us constantly moving, looking for "
"somewhere safe."
msgstr ""
"这座​城市​就是​这样​变化无常​。​可能​这​一年​还​和平​无​事​，​下​一年​就​成​了​战区​。​我们​不得不​一直​搬迁​，​寻找​安全​的​地方​。\n"
"zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4 bian4hua4wu2chang2。ke3neng2 zhe4 yi1 nian2 hai2 he2ping2 wu2 shi4，xia4 yi1 nian2 jiu4 cheng2 le5 zhan4qu1。wo3men5 bu4de2bu4 yi1zhi2 ban1qian1，xun2zhao3 an1quan2 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid "It's time that everyone stopped suffering. Let's do this."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​让​大家​都​脱离苦海​了​。​动手​。\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 rang4 da4jia1 dou1 tuo1li2ku3hai3 le5。dong4shou3。"

msgid "It's time to move on. We need to focus on chasing down Green Winters."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​向前​看​了​。​我们​要​集中精力​追踪​格林​·​温特斯​。\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 xiang4qian2 kan4 le5。wo3men5 yao4 ji2 zhong4 jing1 li4 zhui1zong1 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。"

msgid ""
"It's too bad about Dietrich's nephew. I feel for the old guy.\n"
"\n"
"But between you and me, $(l.name)... I'm not sure how much sympathy I can muster for the kid. In my eyes, anyone who'd join an organization like Humanis - *whatever* the reason - deserves to be put into the ground."
msgstr ""
"只​可惜​迪​特里​希​的​侄子​遭遇​了​这样​的​事​。​我​也​替​那个​老头子​感到​难受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​$(l.name)​，​我​说实话​……​我​实在​没法​对​那小子​产生​多少​同情​。​在​我​眼里​，​*​无论​*​出于​什么​理由​加入​人类​至上​主义者​，​都​是​死有余辜​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1 Di2te4li3xi1 de5 zhi2zi5 zao1yu4 le5 zhe4yang4 de5 shi4。wo3 ye3 ti4 na4ge5 lao3tou2zi5 gan3dao4 nan2shou4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 $(l.name)，wo3 shuo1shi2hua4……wo3 shi2zai4 mei2fa3 dui4 na4 xiao3 zi3 chan3sheng1 duo1shao3 tong2qing2。zai4 wo3 yan3 li3，*wu2lun4*chu1yu2 shen2me5 li3you2 jia1ru4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3，dou1 shi4 si3you3yu2gu1。"

msgid ""
"It's too bad that we couldn't have saved any of the clones that they were working on... poor things. They were the ultimate victims in all of this.\n"
"\n"
"Oh well. We got the job done. And at the end of the day, that's what matters most."
msgstr ""
"只​可惜​我们​没​能​救出​他们​研究​的​那些​克隆​体​……​太​可怜​了​。​他们​才​是​这​整件事​的​最终​受害者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​算了​，​至少​我们​的​工作​完成​了​。​归根结底​，​这才​是​最​重要​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1 wo3men5 mei2 neng2 jiu4chu1 ta1men5 yan2jiu1 de5 na4xie1 ke4long2 ti3……tai4 ke3lian2 le5。ta1men5 cai2 shi4 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 de5 zui4zhong1 shou4hai4zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"suan4le5，zhi4shao3 wo3men5 de5 gong1zuo4 wan2cheng2 le5。gui1gen1jie2di3，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5。"

msgid "It's too high to reach."
msgstr ""
"位置​太高​，​够​不到​。\n"
"wei4zhi5 tai4 gao1，gou4 bu4dao4。"

msgid ""
"It's too late for that now. Vauclair must know that his Matrix security has gone offline. He won't wait twenty minutes before acting, let alone the thirteen hours it would take for us to drive to Feuerstelle, raid the compound, and drive back again.\n"
"\n"
"We've committed ourselves. We need to see this through."
msgstr ""
"现在​太迟​了​。​沃​克莱尔​肯定​已经​发现​他​的​矩阵​安全​系统​失效​了​。​他​不会​等​上​二十分钟​才​行动​，​更​别说​我们​开车​到​“​火坑​”​、​突袭​基地​再​折返​需要​十三​小时​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​已经​没有​退路​了​。​必须​坚持到底​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 tai4 chi2 le5。Wo4ke4lai2er3 ken3ding4 yi3jing1 fa1xian4 ta1 de5 ju3zhen4 an1quan2 xi4tong3 shi1xiao4 le5。ta1 bu4hui4 deng3 shang4 er4 shi2 fen4 zhong1 cai2 xing2dong4，geng1 bie2shuo1 wo3men5 kai1che1 dao4“huo3keng1”、tu1xi2 ji1di4 zai4 zhe2fan3 xu1yao4 shi2san1 xiao3shi2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi3jing1 mei2you3 tui4lu4 le5。bi4xu1 jian1 chi2 dao4 de5。"

msgid "It's up to you, Alex. But you have to make a choice."
msgstr ""
"只能​你​来​决定​，​亚历山大​，​你​必须​做出​选择​。\n"
"zhi3neng2 ni3 lai2 jue2ding4，ya4li4shan1da4，ni3 bi4xu1 zuo4chu1 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"It's up to you, Blitz. At the end of the day, you're gonna do whatever you "
"want to do anyway."
msgstr ""
"看​你​吧​，​布里​茨​。​说到底​，​只有​你​能​决定​自己​要​做​什么​。\n"
"kan4 ni3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。shuo1dao4di3，zhi3you3 ni3 neng2 jue2ding4 zi4ji3 yao4 zuo4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"It's your call, $(l.name). But remember, we are on a tight timetable. Even now, the Firewing's agents could be closing in on us.\n"
"\n"
"Make your preparations, but do it quickly. All of our lives may depend on it."
msgstr ""
"你​说了算​，​$(l.name)​。​但​可​别忘了​，​我们​的​时间​很​紧​。​即便​是​现在​，​火翼​的​爪牙​也​可能​正在​逼近​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​做好​准备​吧​，​但​要​快​。​我们​的​性命​都​指望​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1le5suan4，$(l.name)。dan4 ke3 bie4 wang4 le5，wo3men5 de5 shi2jian1 hen3 jin3。ji2bian4 shi4 xian4zai4，Huo3yi4 de5 zhao3ya2 ye3 ke3neng2 zheng4zai4 bi1jin4。\n"
"\n"
"qu4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4 ba1，dan4 yao4 kuai4。wo3men5 de5 xing4ming4 dou1 zhi3wang4 ni3 le5。"

msgid "It's your call, boss. Can't say I envy you the decision."
msgstr ""
"听​你​的​，​老大​。​这​决定​可真​不好​做​。\n"
"ting1 ni3 de5，lao3da4。zhe4 jue2ding4 ke3 zhen1 bu4hao3 zuo4。"

msgid "It's your life. I won't stop you."
msgstr ""
"那​是​你​的​自由​。​我​不会​阻止​你​。\n"
"na4 shi4 ni3 de5 zi4you2。wo3 bu4hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"It's... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He opens his mouth soundlessly, then closes it again. His brow furrows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's like... like a waking dream."
msgstr ""
"就​像​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​无声​地​张开嘴​，​随即​又​闭上​。​眉头​紧蹙​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​……​像​一场​白日梦​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wu2sheng1 de5 zhang1 kai1 zui3，sui2ji2 you4 bi4shang5。mei2tou2 jin3 cu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4……xiang4 yi1 chang2 bai2ri4meng4。"

msgid ""
"It's... it's regrettable. But it happens for a good reason.\n"
"\n"
"The sacrifices keep us safe here, and safety is something that a lot of these kids have never known.\n"
"\n"
"The initiates *have* to learn how things are done here. Harrow told us so."
msgstr ""
"那​……​确实​令人遗憾​。​但​这些​事​的​背后​自有​其​道理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正是​这些​牺牲​守护​着​我们​的​安全​，​而​安全​对​许多​孩子​而言​是​从未​体验​过​的​奢侈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​新来​的​学徒​们​*​必须​*​学会​这里​的​规矩​。​这是​哈罗​告诉​我们​的​。\n"
"\n"
"na4……que4shi2 ling3 ren2 yi2 han4。dan4 zhe4xie1 shi4 de5 bei4hou4 zi4you3 qi2 dao4li5。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4shi4 zhe4xie1 xi1sheng1 shou3hu4 zhao2 wo3men5 de5 an1quan2，er2 an1quan2 dui4 xu3duo1 hai2zi5 er2yan2 shi4 cong2wei4 ti3yan4 guo4 de5 she1chi3。\n"
"\n"
"xin1 lai2 de5 xue2tu2 men5*bi4xu1*xue2hui4 zhe4li3 de5 gui1ju5。zhe4 shi4 ha1luo2 gao4su4 wo3men5 de5。"

msgid ""
"It... it was horrible. Just pure... pure chaos.\n"
"\n"
"So many people are dead. People I knew. Roasted alive, or trampled to death trying to escape."
msgstr ""
"太​可怕​了​……​完全​是​一片​混乱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​死​了​很多​人​。​我​认识​的​人​。​被​活活​烤焦​了​，​或是​逃跑​的​时候​被​踩死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"tai4 ke3pa4 le5……wan2quan2 shi4 yi1 pian1 hun4luan4。\n"
"\n"
"si3 le5 hen3 duo1 ren2。wo3 ren4shi5 de5 ren2。bei4 huo2huo2 kao3jiao1 le5，huo4shi4 tao2pao3 de5 shi2hou5 bei4 cai3 si3 le5。"

msgid "Italian"
msgstr ""
"意大利语\n"
"yi4da4li4yu3"

msgid "Item Added To Stash: "
msgstr ""
"物品​已​添加​至​库存​：\n"
"wu4pin3 yi3 tian1jia1 zhi4 ku4cun2："

msgid "Item Added: "
msgstr ""
"物品​已​添加​：\n"
"wu4pin3 yi3 tian1jia1："

msgid "Item Picked Up"
msgstr ""
"物品​已​拾取\n"
"wu4pin3 yi3 shi2qu3"

msgid "Item Removed From Stash: "
msgstr ""
"物品​已​移除​自​库存​：\n"
"wu4pin3 yi3 yi2chu2 zi4 ku4cun2："

msgid "Item Removed: "
msgstr ""
"物品​已​移除​：\n"
"wu4pin3 yi3 yi2chu2："

msgid "Item: "
msgstr ""
"物品​：\n"
"wu4pin3："

msgid "Items"
msgstr ""
"物品\n"
"wu4pin3"

msgid "Items Will Be Unequipped"
msgstr ""
"物品​将​被​卸下\n"
"wu4pin3 jiang1 bei4 xie4xia4"

msgid "Its true I am pretty great."
msgstr ""
"我​就是​这么​厉害​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 li4hai5。"

msgid "It’s a legitimate concern. She hardly knows me. "
msgstr ""
"她​的​担心​也​算​合理​。​毕竟​她​跟​我​不熟​。\n"
"ta1 de5 dan1xin1 ye3 suan4 he2li3。bi4jing4 ta1 gen1 wo3 bu4 shu2。"

msgid "It’s a little on the watery side, but definitely refreshing."
msgstr ""
"感觉​里面​兑​了​些​水​，​但​绝对​足够​提神醒脑​。\n"
"gan3jue2 li3mian4 dui4 le5 xie1 shui3，dan4 jue2dui4 zu2gou4 ti2shen2xing3nao3。"

msgid ""
"It’s hard to tell in the dim light, but this place appears to be military. "
"You would guess that Vauclair converted this abandoned facility into his "
"base of operations in order to hide the dragon."
msgstr ""
"在​昏暗​的​光线​下​，​很难​看清​，​但​这里​似乎​是​军事设施​。​你​猜沃​克莱尔​将​这座​废弃​的​设施​改造​成​了​他​的​基地​，​以便​藏匿​那条​巨龙​。\n"
"zai4 hun1an4 de5 guang1xian4 xia4，hen3 nan2 kan4qing1，dan4 zhe4li3 si4hu1 shi4 jun1shi4she4shi1。ni3 cai1 Wo4ke4lai2er3 jiang1 zhe4 zuo4 fei4qi4 de5 she4shi1 gai3zao4 cheng2 le5 ta1 de5 ji1di4，yi3bian4 cang2ni4 na4 tiao2 ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"It’s hard to tell in the dim light, but this place appears to be military. "
"You would guess that the late Doctor Vauclair converted this abandoned "
"facility into his base of operations in order to hide the dragon."
msgstr ""
"在​昏暗​的​光线​下​，​很难​看清​，​但​这里​似乎​是​军事设施​。​你​猜​已故​的​沃​克莱尔​博士​将​这座​废弃​的​设施​改造​成​了​他​的​基地​，​以便​藏匿​那条​巨龙​。\n"
"zai4 hun1an4 de5 guang1xian4 xia4，hen3 nan2 kan4qing1，dan4 zhe4li3 si4hu1 shi4 jun1shi4she4shi1。ni3 cai1 yi3gu4 de5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 jiang1 zhe4 zuo4 fei4qi4 de5 she4shi1 gai3zao4 cheng2 le5 ta1 de5 ji1di4，yi3bian4 cang2ni4 na4 tiao2 ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"It’s hard, I know, but this is why we need to keep together. Support each "
"other. No one’s gonna look out for us but us."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​这​是​个​艰难​的​时刻​。​但​正​因为​如此​我们​才​要​团结一致​，​互相​扶持​。​除了​我们​自己​以外​，​没人会​关照​我们​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 ge4 jian1nan2 de5 shi2ke4。dan4 zheng1 yin1wei4 ru2ci3 wo3men5 cai2 yao4 tuan2jie2yi1zhi4，hu4xiang1 fu2chi2。chu2le5 wo3men5 zi4ji3 yi3wai4，mei2 ren2 hui4 guan1zhao4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"It’s just the things like the turf wars and the racists and junk. You know, like those Humanis assholes? Unnnn-pleasant. \n"
"\n"
"But that shit aside, I like the idea of a state without the Man."
msgstr ""
"无非​是​争夺​地盘​啊​、​种族歧视​以及​瘾君子​什么​的​。​比如​那些​人类​至上​主义者​混蛋​们​？​可​太烦人​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​抛开​这些​不说​，​我​还​挺​喜欢​“​无男州​”​的​概念​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2fei1 shi4 zheng1duo2 di4pan2 a1、zhong3zu2qi2shi4 yi3ji2 yin3jun1zi3 shen2me5 de5。bi3ru2 na4xie1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 hun2dan4 men5？ke3 tai4 fan2 ren2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 pao1kai1 zhe4xie1 bu4 shuo1，wo3 hai2 ting3 xi3huan5“wu2 nan2 zhou1” de5 gai4nian4。"

msgid ""
"It’s my nephew, Alexander. He’s signed on with Humanis… driven to it by his "
"worthless sack of a dad, no doubt."
msgstr ""
"是​我​侄子​，​亚历山大​。​他​现在​跟​人类​至上​主义者​混到​了​一起​……​肯定​是​他​那个​废物​老爹​把​他​逼​得​走投无路​了​。\n"
"shi4 wo3 zhi2zi5，ya4li4shan1da4。ta1 xian4zai4 gen1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 hun4 dao4 le5 yi1qi3……ken3ding4 shi4 ta1 na4ge5 fei4wu4 lao3die1 ba3 ta1 bi1 de2 zou3tou2wu2lu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"It’s part of the job. Paul knew the risks - probably better than most of us."
" Nothing we can do but clean up and move on."
msgstr ""
"这种​事是​工作​的​一部分​。​保罗​知道​其中​的​风险​—​—​也许​比​我们​中​的​绝大多数​人​更​清楚​。​我们​该​做​的​就是​重整旗鼓​，​继续​前行​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4 shi4 gong1zuo4 de5 yi1bu4fen5。bao3luo2 zhi1dao4 qi2zhong1 de5 feng1xian3——ye3xu3 bi3 wo3men5 zhong4 de5 jue2da4duo1shu4 ren2 geng1 qing1chu5。wo3men5 gai1 zuo4 de5 jiu4shi4 chong2zheng3qi2gu3，ji4xu4 qian2xing2。"

msgid "It’s theirs now. The world."
msgstr ""
"这​世界​，​是​他们​的​了​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4jie4，shi4 ta1men5 de5 le5。"

msgid "I’d go insane if I was trapped like that for twenty years."
msgstr ""
"我​要是​被​这样​囚禁​二十年​的话​，​肯定​会​疯​掉​的​。\n"
"wo3 yao4shi5 bei4 zhe4yang4 qiu2jin4 er4 shi2 nian2 de5hua4，ken3ding4 hui4 feng1 diao4 de5。"

msgid "I’ll have one of those too, then."
msgstr ""
"那​也​给​我​来​一杯​吧​。\n"
"na4 ye3 gei3 wo3 lai2 yi1 bei1 ba1。"

msgid "I’ll have some schnaps."
msgstr ""
"我要​杜松子酒​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 du4song1zi3jiu3。"

msgid "I’ll keep it in mind, but I can’t make any promises."
msgstr ""
"我会​记着​的​，​但​我​不会​做​任何​承诺​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 ji4 zhao2 de5，dan4 wo3 bu4hui4 zuo4 ren4he2 cheng2nuo4。"

msgid ""
"I’ll miss you, love. Be safe.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich turns to you.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我会​想念​你​的​，​亲爱​的​。​注意安全​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 xiang3nian4 ni3 de5，qin1ai4 de5。zhu4 yi4 an1 quan2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"I’ll take care of it after we've watched the chip.\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry. I know what to do."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​看​完​芯片​之后​，​我会​处理​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​担心​。​我​知道​该​怎么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 kan4 wan2 xin1pian4 zhi1hou4，wo3 hui4 chu3li3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1。wo3 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"I’ll tell you what we did. We avenged Monika. And Paul. That was what we set"
" out to do and we did it."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​吧​。​我们​为​莫妮卡​和保罗​报​了​仇​。​这是​我们​一​开始​计划​要​做​的​事​，​而​我们​也​做到​了​。\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1。wo3men5 wei2 Mo4ni1ka3 he4 bao3 luo2 bao4 le5 chou2。zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 yi1 kai1shi3 ji4hua4 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4，er2 wo3men5 ye3 zuo4dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"I’ll tell you what we did. We avenged Monika. And Paul. That was what we set"
" out to do, and we did it."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​吧​。​我们​为​莫妮卡​和保罗​报​了​仇​。​这是​我们​一​开始​计划​要​做​的​事​，​而​我们​也​做到​了​。\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1。wo3men5 wei2 Mo4ni1ka3 he4 bao3 luo2 bao4 le5 chou2。zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 yi1 kai1shi3 ji4hua4 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4，er2 wo3men5 ye3 zuo4dao4 le5。"

msgid "I’ll watch your back, all the same. "
msgstr ""
"不管怎样​，​你​背后​有​我​呢​。\n"
"bu4guan3zen3yang4，ni3 bei4hou4 you3 wo3 ni2。"

msgid "I’m Altuğ’s ears and hands outside of the cafe. Call me Kami. "
msgstr ""
"我​是​奥图​伊在​咖啡馆​之外​的​耳目​。​叫​我​卡米​就行​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 ao4 tu2 yi1 zai4 ka1fei1guan3 zhi1wai4 de5 er3mu4。jiao4 wo3 Ka3mi3 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid "I’m good, thanks. I’ll be going now."
msgstr ""
"不了​，​谢谢​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"bu4le5，xie4xie5。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "I’m just looking around, really."
msgstr ""
"我​就​随便​看看​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 sui2bian4 kan4kan5。"

msgid "I’m listening, O Master of Hyperbole."
msgstr ""
"你​说​吧​，​浮夸​之主​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ba1，fu2kua1 zhi1 zhu3。"

msgid "I’m looking for something that was stolen from me."
msgstr ""
"有人​偷​了​我​的​东西​，​所以​我来​找​找​。\n"
"you3ren2 tou1 le5 wo3 de5 dong1xi1，suo3yi3 wo3 lai2 zhao3 zhao3。"

msgid "I’m looking for something."
msgstr ""
"我​是​来​找​东西​的​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 lai2 zhao3 dong1xi1 de5。"

msgid "I’m looking for the Rabengeister."
msgstr ""
"我​在​找​“​鸦灵​”​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhao3“Ya1ling2”。"

msgid "I’m not an old man. Does that mean my stories aren't great?"
msgstr ""
"我​不是​老人​，​你​的​意思​是​说​我​的​故事​不行​喽​？\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 lao3ren2，ni3 de5 yi4si5 shi4 shuo1 wo3 de5 gu4shi4 bu4xing2 lou5？"

msgid "I’m not going anywhere with you. {{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​不会​跟你走​的​。​{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 gen1 ni3 zou3 de5。{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "I’m not interested in ancient history, Vauclair. Murder is murder."
msgstr ""
"我​对​历史​不感兴趣​，​沃​克莱尔​。​屠杀​就是​屠杀​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 li4shi3 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。tu2sha1 jiu4shi4 tu2sha1。"

msgid "I’m not sure that’s a good idea."
msgstr ""
"我​不​觉得​这​是​个​好​主意​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 jue2de5 zhe4 shi4 ge4 hao3 zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"I’m out too. \n"
"\n"
"I’m not sure where I’m going, but I know can’t stay with a leader who doesn’t listen to me."
msgstr ""
"我​也​要​走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​确定​自己​要​去​哪里​，​但​我​知道​我​不能​和​一个​不​听​我​说话​的​队长​共事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 yao4 zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 zi4ji3 yao4 qu4 na3li3，dan4 wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3 bu4neng2 he4 yi1ge5 bu4 ting1 wo3 shuo1hua4 de5 dui4zhang3 gong4shi4。"

msgid ""
"I’m sorry, Doctor. I know you want to aid humanity, but murder and genocide "
"isn’t the way."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​博士​。​我​知道​你​想​帮助​人类​，​但​灭绝​和​屠杀​一定​不是​正道​。\n"
"bao4qian4，bo2shi4。wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 xiang3 bang1zhu4 ren2lei4，dan4 mie4jue2 he4 tu2sha1 yi1ding4 bu4shi4 zheng4dao4。"

msgid ""
"I’m sure the task was effortless. I extend my appreciation nonetheless. "
msgstr ""
"我​想​这​对​你​而言​肯定​不费吹灰之力​。​不过​我​依旧​要​表示​我​的​感谢​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhe4 dui4 ni3 er2yan2 ken3ding4 bu4fei4chui1hui1zhi1li4。bu4guo4 wo3 yi1jiu4 yao4 biao3shi4 wo3 de5 gan3xie4。"

msgid "I’m sure they live just to talk to you. "
msgstr ""
"他们​的​生活​就是​跟​你​聊天​吧​。\n"
"ta1men5 de5 sheng1huo2 jiu4shi4 gen1 ni3 liao2tian1 ba1。"

msgid "I’m very interested in this, so let me know what happens."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​十分​感兴趣​，​所以​回头​一定​要​告诉​我​后续​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 gan3xing4qu4，suo3yi3 hui2tou2 yi1ding4 yao4 gao4su4 wo3 hou4xu4。"

msgid ""
"I’ve been reviewing the intel that Alice sent us and comparing it to what I gathered on our original run. There has been a substantial increase in the number of heat signatures on the ground.\n"
"\n"
"That means new security troops. Lots of them."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​在​核对​爱丽丝​发来​的​情报​，​并​与​我们​首次​行动​时​收集​的​信息​进行​比​对​。​地面​热源​信号​数量​出现​了​大幅​增长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​那里​新增​了​安保​部队​，​而且​数量​相当可观​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 he2dui4 ai4li4si1 fa1 lai2 de5 qing2bao4，bing4 yu4 wo3men5 shou3ci4 xing2dong4 shi2 shou1ji2 de5 xin4xi1 jin4xing2 bi3 dui4。di4mian4 re4yuan2 xin4hao4 shu4liang4 chu1xian4 le5 da4fu2 zeng1zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 na4li5 xin1zeng1 le5 an1bao3 bu4dui4，er2qie3 shu4liang4 xiang1 dang1 ke3 guan1。"

msgid ""
"I’ve got the skill and experience to lead this team.\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name), on the other hand, was appointed by Monika as a joke."
msgstr ""
"我​具备​领导​这支​团队​的​技能​与​经验​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​$(l.name)​，​是​莫妮卡​半​开玩笑​地​任命​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ju4bei4 ling3dao3 zhe4 zhi1 tuan2dui4 de5 ji4neng2 yu4 jing1yan4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 $(l.name)，shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 ban4 kai1wan2xiao4 de5 ren4ming4 de5。"

msgid "I’ve had enough of this. {{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​受够了​。​{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"wo3 shou4 gou4 le5。{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "I’ve never run with a team this good. I’d be stupid to give it up."
msgstr ""
"我​从来​没有​和​这么​好​的​团队​共事​过​。​傻瓜​才​会​选择​放弃​。\n"
"wo3 cong2lai2 mei2you3 he4 zhe4me5 hao3 de5 tuan2dui4 gong4shi4 guo4。sha3gua1 cai2 hui4 xuan3ze2 fang4qi4。"

msgid "I’ve said my piece. I’m gone in the morning."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​说​过​我​的​决定​了​。​我​明天​一​早就​走​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 shuo1 guo4 wo3 de5 jue2ding4 le5。wo3 ming2tian1 yi1 zao3jiu4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"I’ve seen many terrible things in my life, $(l.name). In Tenochtitlan, blood magic is commonplace.\n"
"\n"
"Take a moment to imagine what that means."
msgstr ""
"我​这辈子​见过​许多​可怕​的​事情​，​$(l.name)​。​在​特诺奇​蒂特兰​，​血​魔法​是​司空见惯​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​试想​这​意味着​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 jian4 guo4 xu3duo1 ke3pa4 de5 shi4qing5，$(l.name)。zai4 te4 nuo4 ji1 di4 te4 lan2，xie3 mo2fa3 shi4 si1kong1jian4guan4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"shi4xiang3 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5。"

msgid "I’ve think we’ve had enough Wyrm Talk for one lifetime."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​我们​已经​把​这辈子​要​听​的​“​巨龙​夜话​”​都​听​完​了​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 yi3jing1 ba3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 yao4 ting1 de5“ju4long2 ye4 hua4” dou1 ting1 wan2 le5。"

msgid "JACKING IN..."
msgstr ""
"正在​接入​……\n"
"zheng4zai4 jie1ru4……"

msgid "JAMES! Stand DOWN! We do NOT need to kill this man!"
msgstr ""
"詹姆斯​！​退​下​！​我们​不必​非得​杀死​这个​人​！\n"
"zhan1mu3si1！tui4 xia4！wo3men5 bu4bi4 fei1dei3 sha1si3 zhe4ge5 ren2！"

msgid ""
"JOIN HUMANIS and TURN THE TIDE on economic repression!\n"
"\n"
"HUMANIS FOREVER!"
msgstr ""
"加入​人类​至上​主义者​，​扭转​经济​压制​的​浪潮​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​人类​至上​永存​！\n"
"\n"
"jia1ru4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3，niu3zhuan3 jing1ji4 ya1zhi4 de5 lang4chao2！\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 yong3cun2！"

