msgid ""
"Ja. It’ll take a bit of doing, so if you don’t mind.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}You can see something like a polite smile under the moustache as he nods goodbye and returns to his work.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​这​需要​花​点​时间​，​所以​如果​你​不介意​的话​，​我​得​继续​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​看到​他​胡须​下​的​嘴角​微微​扬起​一抹​似笑非笑​的​弧度​，​颔首​道别​后​便​重新​埋头工作​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"en1。zhe4 xu1yao4 hua1 dian3 shi2jian1，suo3yi3 ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4，wo3 de2 ji4xu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 hu2xu1 xia4 de5 zui3jiao3 wei1wei1 yang2qi3 yi1 ma1 si4xiao4fei1xiao4 de5 hu2du4，han4shou3 dao4bie2 hou4 bian4 chong2xin1 mai2 tou2 gong1 zuo4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Jack"
msgstr ""
"接入​/​跳出\n"
"jie1ru4/tiao4chu1"

msgid "Jack In"
msgstr ""
"接入\n"
"jie1ru4"

msgid "Jack Out"
msgstr ""
"跳出\n"
"tiao4chu1"

msgid "Jack-In"
msgstr ""
"接入\n"
"jie1ru4"

msgid "Jacking out will cause you to be stunned for {0} AP. Proceed?"
msgstr ""
"跳出​会​导致​你​眩晕​损失​{​0​}​行动​点​。​要​继续​吗​？\n"
"tiao4chu1 hui4 dao3zhi4 ni3 xuan4yun4 sun3shi1 {0} xing2dong4 dian3。yao4 ji4xu4 ma5？"

msgid "James"
msgstr ""
"詹姆斯\n"
"zhan1mu3si1"

msgid "James turns and stalks toward the doorway. The others follow behind."
msgstr ""
"詹姆斯​转身​大步​走向​门口​。​其他人​紧随其后​。\n"
"zhan1mu3si1 zhuan3shen1 da4bu4 zou3xiang4 men2kou3。qi2 ta1 ren2 jin3sui2qi2hou4。"

msgid "James! Let him go, damn it!"
msgstr ""
"詹姆斯​！​放​了​他​，​该死​的​！\n"
"zhan1mu3si1！fang4 le5 ta1，gai1si3 de5！"

msgid ""
"James' continued survival, on the other hand, was not expected. You are a very patient $(l.man), $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Duerr smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This has been most informative."
msgstr ""
"另一方面​，​詹姆斯​能活​下来​实属​意外​。​你​真是​位​极具​耐心​的​$(l.man)​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​杜尔​微笑​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这番​谈话​颇具​启发性​。\n"
"\n"
"ling4yi1fang1mian4，zhan1mu3si1 neng2 huo2 xia4lai5 shi2shu3 yi4wai4。ni3 zhen1shi5 wei4 ji2 ju4 nai4xin1 de5 $(l.man)，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} du4 er3 wei1xiao4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 fan1 tan2hua4 po1ju4 qi3 fa1 xing4。"

msgid ""
"James' posture stiffens, but he says nothing.\n"
"\n"
"You can see a dawning awareness behind his eyes, though. Slowly, the color begins to drain from his face."
msgstr ""
"詹姆斯​的​姿势​僵硬​了​，​但​他​一言不发​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​你​能​在​他​的​眼神​里​看到​一丝​觉悟​的​萌动​。​他​的​脸色​渐渐​开始​变得​苍白​。\n"
"\n"
"zhan1mu3si1 de5 zi1shi4 jiang1ying4 le5，dan4 ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，ni3 neng2 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3shen2 li3 kan4dao4 yi1 si1 jue2wu4 de5 meng2dong4。ta1 de5 lian3se4 jian4jian4 kai1shi3 bian4de5 cang1bai2。"

msgid "James, for the last time, keep your damned mouth shut."
msgstr ""
"詹姆斯​，​我​再说​最后​一次​，​闭上​你​的​臭​嘴​。\n"
"zhan1mu3si1，wo3 zai4shuo1 zui4hou4 yi1ci4，bi4shang5 ni3 de5 chou4 zui3。"

msgid "Jan Goldschmidt"
msgstr ""
"扬​·​戈德​施密特\n"
"yang2 · Ge1de2shi1mi4te4"

msgid "Jana"
msgstr ""
"简娜\n"
"Jian3na4"

msgid "Jana blinks up at him, but holds her silence."
msgstr ""
"简娜​眨​眨眼​，​但​还是​没​说话​。\n"
"Jian3na4 zha3 zha3yan3，dan4 hai2shi5 mei2 shuo1hua4。"

msgid "Janet"
msgstr ""
"珍妮特\n"
"zhen1 ni1 te4"

msgid ""
"Janet, you mean? Of course we know her. She and her bitheads control the only Matrix hookup in this dump. Thankfully, she allows us to use her uplink. \n"
"\n"
"It's only by her generosity that we've been able to provide for ourselves at all. And she's kept us from having to rely on Parson and his wacko religion, thank God."
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​珍妮特​？​我们​当然​认识​她​。​她​和​她​的​黑客​小组​掌控​着​这个​破​地方​唯一​的​矩阵​连接​。​幸好​她​允许​我们​使用​她​的​连接​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​多亏​了​她​的​慷慨​，​我们​才能​养活​自己​。​也​因为​她​，​我们​才能​避免​依赖​帕森​和​他​的​疯狂​宗教​，​感谢上帝​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 zhen1 ni1 te4？wo3men5 dang1ran2 ren4shi5 ta1。ta1 he4 ta1 de5 hei1ke4 xiao3zu3 zhang3kong4 zhao2 zhe4ge5 po4 di4fang1 wei2yi1 de5 ju3zhen4 lian2jie1。xing4hao3 ta1 yun3xu3 wo3men5 shi3yong4 ta1 de5 lian2jie1。\n"
"\n"
"duo1kui1 le5 ta1 de5 kang1kai3，wo3men5 cai2neng2 yang3huo5 zi4ji3。ye3 yin1wei4 ta1，wo3men5 cai2neng2 bi4mian3 yi1lai4 pa4 sen1 he4 ta1 de5 feng1kuang2 zong1jiao4，gan3 xie4 shang4 di4。"

msgid "Janet? I need to talk to her. Could you introduce us?"
msgstr ""
"珍妮特​？​我要​和​她​谈谈​。​你​能​帮​我​引荐​吗​？\n"
"zhen1 ni1 te4？wo3 yao4 he4 ta1 tan2tan2。ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3 yin3jian4 ma5？"

msgid "Janitor"
msgstr ""
"清洁工\n"
"qing1jie2gong1"

msgid "Jazz"
msgstr ""
"捷势\n"
"jie2 shi4"

msgid "Jazz: Quickness +2, AP +1"
msgstr ""
"捷势​：​敏捷​+​2​，​行动​点​+​1\n"
"jie2 shi4：min3jie2 +2，xing2dong4 dian3 +1"

msgid "Jesus."
msgstr ""
"老天​啊​。\n"
"lao3tian1 a1。"

msgid "Jesus. Look at that."
msgstr ""
"老天​啊​。​看​那​东西​。\n"
"lao3tian1 a1。kan4 na4 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Jesus. That was terrifying.\n"
"\n"
"Who *were* those bastards? They were shooting at *everyone!* I spent the entire fight hiding in a dumpster!"
msgstr ""
"老天​。​实在​是​太​可怕​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​混蛋​是​谁​？​他们​在​朝​*​所有人​*​开枪​！​我​整晚​都​躲​在​垃圾箱​里​！\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1。shi2zai4 shi4 tai4 ke3pa4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 hun2dan4 shi4 shei2？ta1men5 zai4 chao2*suo3you3ren2*kai1qiang1！wo3 zheng3 wan3 dou1 duo3 zai4 la1ji1xiang1 li3！"

msgid "Jesus. You're a mess."
msgstr ""
"老天​。​你​这​模样​太惨​了​。\n"
"lao3tian1。ni3 zhe4 mu2yang4 tai4 can3 le5。"

msgid "Jewühl District?"
msgstr ""
"耶沃​于尔区​？\n"
"ye1 wo4 yu2 er3 qu1？"

msgid "Join us!"
msgstr ""
"加入​我们​！\n"
"jia1ru4 wo3men5！"

msgid "Jolt"
msgstr ""
"嗨​翻天\n"
"hai1 fan1 tian1"

msgid "Jolt: AP +1, Intelligence +1"
msgstr ""
"嗨​翻天​：​+​1​行动​点​，​+​1​智力\n"
"hai1 fan1 tian1：+1 xing2dong4 dian3，+1 zhi4li4"

msgid "Jon Bergfalk"
msgstr ""
"乔恩​·​伯格​法克\n"
"qiao2 en1 · bai3 ge2 fa3ke4"

msgid ""
"Judging by the amount of arcane symbology on display, it's a fair bet that these files are related to the Bloodline project.\n"
"\n"
"If you could find someone capable of translating them, the information contained within would almost certainly shed some light on what the Azzies have been up to... and what Frau Müller was so afraid of."
msgstr ""
"从​屏幕​上​显示​的​奥术​符号​数量​来看​，​这些​文件​很​可能​与​“​血脉​”​项目​有关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​能​找到​有​能力​破译​这些​文件​的​人​，​其中​记载​的​信息​几乎​肯定​能​揭示​阿兹佬​在​搞​什么​名堂​……​以及​穆勒​女士​究竟​在​害怕​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ping2mu4 shang4 xian3shi4 de5 ao4 shu4 fu2hao4 shu4liang4 lai2 kan4，zhe4xie1 wen2jian4 hen3 ke3neng2 yu4“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 you3guan1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 you3 neng2li4 po4yi4 zhe4xie1 wen2jian4 de5 ren2，qi2zhong1 ji4zai3 de5 xin4xi1 ji1hu1 ken3ding4 neng2 jie1shi4 e1 zi1 lao3 zai4 gao3 shen2me5 ming2tang5……yi3ji2 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 jiu1jing4 zai4 hai4pa4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Judging by the amount of arcane symbology on display, it's a fair bet that these files are related to the Bloodline project... the same files that the Schockwellenreiter asked you to find. They'd reward you handsomely for the information.\n"
"\n"
"Alternatively, if you could find someone capable of translating them, the information contained within would almost certainly shed some light on what the Azzies have been up to... and what Frau Müller was so afraid of."
msgstr ""
"从​屏幕​上​显示​的​奥术​符号​数量​来看​，​这些​文件​很​可能​与​“​血脉​”​项目​有关​—​—​这​正是​电波​骑士​要求​你​寻找​的​目标​。​他们​会为​情报​提供​丰厚​报酬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​，​如果​你​能​找到​有​能力​破译​这些​文件​的​人​，​其中​记载​的​信息​几乎​肯定​能​揭示​阿兹佬​在​搞​什么​名堂​……​以及​穆勒​女士​究竟​在​害怕​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ping2mu4 shang4 xian3shi4 de5 ao4 shu4 fu2hao4 shu4liang4 lai2 kan4，zhe4xie1 wen2jian4 hen3 ke3neng2 yu4“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 you3guan1——zhe4 zheng4shi4 dian4Bo1qi2shi4 yao1qiu2 ni3 xun2zhao3 de5 mu4biao1。ta1men5 hui4 wei2 qing2bao4 ti2gong1 feng1hou4 bao4chou5。\n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3，ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 you3 neng2li4 po4yi4 zhe4xie1 wen2jian4 de5 ren2，qi2zhong1 ji4zai3 de5 xin4xi1 ji1hu1 ken3ding4 neng2 jie1shi4 e1 zi1 lao3 zai4 gao3 shen2me5 ming2tang5……yi3ji2 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 jiu1jing4 zai4 hai4pa4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Judging by the shape of the ganger's head, you'd guess that his skull has been fractured in at least three places.\n"
"\n"
"The center of his forehead is particularly gruesome; it looks *soft,* as though the skin were stretched like a tent between shards of broken bone."
msgstr ""
"从​帮派​成员​头部​的​形状​来看​，​可以​推断​他​的​颅骨​至少​有​三处​发生​了​骨折​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​额头​的​中央​部位​尤为​惨不忍睹​；​那里​的​皮肤​看起来​*​松软​*​，​仿佛​被​撕裂​的​骨头​碎片​撑开​，​如同​帐篷​般​绷紧​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 tou2bu4 de5 xing2zhuang4 lai2 kan4，ke3yi3 tui1duan4 ta1 de5 lu2gu3 zhi4shao3 you3 san1 chu3 fa1sheng1 le5 gu3zhe2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 e2tou2 de5 zhong1yang1 bu4wei4 you2wei2 can3bu4ren3du3 ； na4li5 de5 pi2fu1 kan4qi3lai5*song1ruan3*，fang3fu2 bei4 si1lie4 de5 gu3tou5 sui4pian4 cheng1kai1，ru2tong2 zhang4peng5 ban1 beng1jin3。"

msgid ""
"Judging by the warning label, you think that this container holds a very "
"powerful nerve gas."
msgstr ""
"根据​警示​标签​来看​，​你​认为​这个​容器​装有​非常​强大​的​神经​毒气​。\n"
"gen1ju4 jing3shi4 biao1qian1 lai2 kan4，ni3 ren4wei2 zhe4ge5 rong2qi4 zhuang1you3 fei1chang2 qiang2da4 de5 shen2jing1 du2qi4。"

msgid ""
"Judging from what I saw in your aura, your Awakening must have been an "
"incredible thing."
msgstr ""
"从​我​在​你​的​灵光​中所见​来看​，​你​的​觉醒​肯定​很​不​一般​。\n"
"cong2 wo3 zai4 ni3 de5 ling2guang1 zhong4 suo3 jian4 lai2 kan4，ni3 de5 jue2xing3 ken3ding4 hen3 bu4 yi1ban1。"

msgid "Junior Executive Werner Harrdegger"
msgstr ""
"行政助理​维尔纳​·​哈​德格尔\n"
"xing2 zheng4 zhu4 li3 wei2 er3 na4 · ha1 de2 ge2 er3"

msgid "Junkie"
msgstr ""
"瘾君子\n"
"yin3jun1zi3"

msgid "Jury’s still out on Dante. I may decide to use him later."
msgstr ""
"但丁​的​事​还​没有​定论​。​我​之后​可能​会​决定​利用​他​的​本领​。\n"
"dan4ding1 de5 shi4 hai2 mei2you3 ding4lun4。wo3 zhi1hou4 ke3neng2 hui4 jue2ding4 li4yong4 ta1 de5 ben3ling3。"

msgid ""
"Just a guess, chief... but I'm thinking that she never got to enjoy that "
"glass of wine."
msgstr ""
"这​只是​个​猜测​，​头儿​……​但​我​觉得​她​没能​享受​上​那杯​红酒​。\n"
"zhe4 zhi3shi4 ge4 cai1ce4，tou2r5……dan4 wo3 jue2de5 ta1 mei2 neng2 xiang3shou4 shang4 na4 bei1 hong2jiu3。"

msgid ""
"Just a moment, Eiger.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel rises from his chair, drawing himself to full height. Even so, he has to crane his neck to look her in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are an excellent soldier, and nobody questions your competence in the field. Your loyalty to this team is equally commendable."
msgstr ""
"等​一下​，​艾格尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​从​椅子​上​起身​，​挺直​了​腰板​。​即便如此​，​他​仍​需​仰起​脖子​才能​看向​艾格尔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​一名​出色​的​士兵​，​在​战场​上​的​能力​有目共睹​。​你​对​这支​队伍​的​忠诚​也​同样​值得称赞​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，Ai4ge2er3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 cong2 yi3zi5 shang4 qi3shen1，ting3zhi2 le5 yao1ban3。ji2 bian4 ru2 ci3，ta1 reng2 xu1 yang3 qi3 bo2zi5 cai2neng2 kan4 xiang4 Ai4ge2er3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 yi1 ming2 chu1se4 de5 shi4bing1，zai4 zhan4chang3 shang4 de5 neng2li4 you3mu4gong4du3。ni3 dui4 zhe4 zhi1 dui4wu3 de5 zhong1cheng2 ye3 tong2yang4 zhi2 de2 chen4 zan4。"

msgid "Just a punk with some bad ideas. Forget about it."
msgstr ""
"只是​个​没​安好​心​的​混混​而已​。​没什么​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 ge4 mei2 an1hao3 xin1 de5 hun4 hun4 er2yi3。mei2shen2me5。"

msgid "Just a second. I'm almost done."
msgstr ""
"等​下​。​我​马上​完事​了​。\n"
"deng3 xia4。wo3 ma3shang4 wan2shi4 le5。"

msgid "Just a second. What was that canister that you put into the terminal?"
msgstr ""
"等​一下​，​你​塞进​终端​里面​的​罐体​是​什么​东西​？\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，ni3 se4 jin4 zhong1duan1 li3mian4 de5 guan4 ti3 shi4 shen2me5 dong1xi1？"

msgid "Just another day at the office. Want me to get you out of there?"
msgstr ""
"不过​是​普普通通​又​一天​而已​。​要​我​放​你​出来​吗​？\n"
"bu4guo4 shi4 pu3pu3tong1tong1 you4 yi1 tian1 er2yi3。yao4 wo3 fang4 ni3 chu1lai2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Just as I am certain that APEX was responsible for the deaths of Monika "
"Schäfer, Green Winters, Clockwork, Peregrine, and a score of other deckers "
"over the last sixteen years."
msgstr ""
"我​还​确信​APEX​在​过去​十六年​里​造成​了​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​、​格林​·​温特斯​、​发条​、​游​隼​以及​其他​数十名​碟客​的​死亡​。\n"
"wo3 hai2 que4xin4 APEX zai4 guo4qu4 shi2 liu4 nian2 li3 zao4cheng2 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3、ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1、fa1tiao2、you2 sun3 yi3ji2 qi2ta1 shu3 shi2 ming2 die2 ke4 de5 si3wang2。"

msgid ""
"Just as you think you might discern the voices, there is a massive crash, "
"and the entire chamber starts to shake. Disoriented, you stagger for several"
" moments, still blinded and trying to recover. "
msgstr ""
"正当​你​以为​自己​或许​能​辨认出​那些​声音​时​，​突然​传来​一声​巨响​，​整个​房间​开始​剧烈​震动​。​你​感到​头晕目眩​，​踉跄​了​几步​，​仍旧​视线​模糊​，​努力​试图​恢复​平衡​。\n"
"zheng4dang1 ni3 yi3wei2 zi4ji3 huo4xu3 neng2 bian4 ren4 chu1 na4xie1 sheng1yin1 shi2，tu1ran2 chuan2lai2 yi1sheng1 ju4xiang3，zheng3ge4 fang2jian1 kai1shi3 ju4lie4 zhen4dong4。ni3 gan3dao4 tou2yun1mu4xuan4，liang4qiang4 le5 ji1 bu4，reng2jiu4 shi4xian4 mo2hu5，nu3li4 shi4tu2 hui1fu4 ping2heng2。"

msgid ""
"Just because it sounds nuts, that doesn't mean it isn't true. This world has"
" more than enough crazy to go around."
msgstr ""
"就算​听​起来​再​荒谬​，​也​未必​就​不是​事实​。​我们​所处​的​本来​就是​个​荒腔​走板​的​世界​。\n"
"jiu4suan4 ting1 qi3lai5 zai4 huang1miu4，ye3 wei4bi4 jiu4 bu4shi4 shi4shi2。wo3men5 suo3 chu3 de5 ben3lai2 jiu4shi4 ge4 huang1 qiang1 zou3ban3 de5 shi4jie4。"

msgid "Just checking in and checking around."
msgstr ""
"就是​来​打个招呼​。\n"
"jiu4shi4 lai2 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1。"

msgid "Just checking in on you. Money problems aside, you doing okay?"
msgstr ""
"就是​打个招呼​。​除了​钱​的​问题​以外​，​你​最近​还好​吧​？\n"
"jiu4shi4 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1。chu2le5 qian2 de5 wen4ti2 yi3wai4，ni3 zui4jin4 hai2hao3 ba1？"

msgid "Just checking in."
msgstr ""
"就是​来​打个招呼​。\n"
"jiu4shi4 lai2 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1。"

msgid "Just checking in. Take care, Glory."
msgstr ""
"就是​来​打个招呼​。​多​保重​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"jiu4shi4 lai2 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1。duo1 bao3zhong4，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "Just checking in. You doing all right?"
msgstr ""
"就是​打个招呼​。​最近​都​好​吧​？\n"
"jiu4shi4 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1。zui4jin4 dou1 hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Just do us both a favor and don't take anything else, okay? If you try to "
"rob me, the security cameras will catch it."
msgstr ""
"不过​我话​说​在​前头​，​别​拿​其他​任何​东西​，​好​吧​？​要是​你​敢​抢劫​我​，​监控​摄像头​会​拍下来​的​。\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 hua4 shuo1 zai4 qian2tou5，bie4 na2 qi2ta1 ren4he2 dong1xi1，hao3 ba1？yao4shi5 ni3 gan3 qiang3jie2 wo3，jian1kong4 she4xiang4tou2 hui4 pai1 xia4 lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Just do us both a favor, and promise that you won't take anything else, "
"okay? I'm trusting you with this."
msgstr ""
"不过​我话​说​在​前头​，​别​拿​其他​任何​东西​，​好​吧​？​我​可是​相信​你​的​啊​。\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 hua4 shuo1 zai4 qian2tou5，bie4 na2 qi2ta1 ren4he2 dong1xi1，hao3 ba1？wo3 ke3shi4 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5 a1。"

msgid "Just doin' my job."
msgstr ""
"分内之事​而已​。\n"
"fen4 nei4 zhi1 shi4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"Just doing my job, Glory. I do my best to get to know everybody on the team."
msgstr ""
"我​只是​在​尽本分​，​格洛丽​。​我​理应​了解​团队​里​的​每​一个​人​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 jin3 ben3 fen4，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 li3ying1 liao3jie3 tuan2dui4 li3 de5 mei3 yi1ge5 ren2。"

msgid "Just doing my job, Phil."
msgstr ""
"只是​分内之事​而已​，​菲尔​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 fen4 nei4 zhi1 shi4 er2yi3，fei1 er3。"

msgid "Just doing my job. Eiger out."
msgstr ""
"分内事​而已​。​艾格尔​通话​完毕​。\n"
"fen4 nei4 shi4 er2yi3。Ai4ge2er3 tong1hua4 wan2bi4。"

msgid "Just don't get them hooked on sims."
msgstr ""
"别​让​他们​染上​拟感​就​行​。\n"
"bie4 rang4 ta1men5 ran3shang4 ni3 gan3 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid "Just don't salute me, pup."
msgstr ""
"别朝​我​敬礼​就行​，​小鬼​。\n"
"bie4 chao2 wo3 jing4li3 jiu4 xing2，xiao3gui3。"

msgid "Just earn your keep."
msgstr ""
"只要​你​能​自食其力​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 neng2 zi4shi2qi2li4。"

msgid ""
"Just elves and dwarves? I'd assume that a mage or an orc would make a more "
"tempting target."
msgstr ""
"只是​精灵​和​矮​人​吗​？​我​还​以为​法师​或兽​人会​是​更具​诱惑力​的​目标​呢​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 jing1ling2 he4 ai3 ren2 ma5？wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 fa3shi1 huo4 shou4 ren2 hui4 shi4 geng1 ju4 you4 huo4 li4 de5 mu4biao1 ni2。"

msgid "Just focus on Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"先​专注​于沃​克莱尔​的​事​。\n"
"xian1 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 shi4。"

msgid "Just full of old simsense recordings."
msgstr ""
"只有​装​的​满满当当​的​老旧​拟感​录像​而已​。\n"
"zhi3you3 zhuang1 de5 man3man3dang1dang1 de5 lao3jiu4 ni3 gan3 lu4xiang4 er2yi3。"

msgid "Just get out of my way."
msgstr ""
"给​我​闪​一边​去​吧​。\n"
"gei3 wo3 shan3 yi1bian1 qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Just get us into the vault, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"赶紧​让​我们​进入​保险库​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"gan3jin3 rang4 wo3men5 jin4ru4 bao3 xian3 ku4，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"Just give us five minutes to make the rounds, and then we'll get out of your"
" hair. Okay?"
msgstr ""
"给​我们​五分钟​打个招呼​，​然后​我们​立马​就​走​。​好​吗​？\n"
"gei3 wo3men5 wu3 fen4 zhong1 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1，ran2hou4 wo3men5 li4ma3 jiu4 zou3。hao3 ma5？"

msgid "Just glad I could help."
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​能​帮​上​忙​。\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 bang1 shang4 mang2。"

msgid ""
"Just go with me on this, chief. The door that you came in through is no good. You want to go out the front.\n"
"\n"
"There's a terminal that I'll need you to access... one more button to press. Do that, and we're home free."
msgstr ""
"这次​就​听​我​的​吧​，​头儿​。​你们​进来​的​那​扇门​不​太行​。​得​走​前门​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​需要​你​操作​一台​终端​……​再​多​按​一次​按钮​就行​，​然后​就​能​回家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ci4 jiu4 ting1 wo3 de5 ba1，tou2r5。ni3men5 jin4lai2 de5 na4 shan1 men2 bu4 tai4 xing2。de2 zou3 qian2men2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 cao1zuo4 yi1 tai2 zhong1duan1……zai4 duo1 an4 yi1ci4 an4niu3 jiu4 xing2，ran2hou4 jiu4 neng2 hui2jia1 le5。"

msgid "Just here to do a job. Helping you out was part of it."
msgstr ""
"只是​来​办点​事​，​顺便​帮帮​你们​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 lai2 ban4 dian3 shi4，shun4bian4 bang1 bang1 ni3men5。"

msgid "Just how was your name slandered? What did they accuse you of?"
msgstr ""
"你​受到​了​什么​诽谤​？​别人​都​说​你​什么​了​？\n"
"ni3 shou4dao4 le5 shen2me5 fei3bang4？bie2ren5 dou1 shuo1 ni3 shen2me5 le5？"

msgid ""
"Just keep t-telling yourself that, $(l.race).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice sounds stronger now. The stutter that marred his speech has almost completely faded away.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​-​你​就​继续​跟​自己​这么​说​吧​，​$(l.race)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​听​起来​更​洪亮​了​。​刚才​因为​瘫软​导致​的​口吃​也​几乎​完全​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 -ni3 jiu4 ji4xu4 gen1 zi4ji3 zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，$(l.race)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 geng1 hong2liang4 le5。gang1cai2 yin1wei4 tan1ruan3 dao3zhi4 de5 kou3chi1 ye3 ji1hu1 wan2quan2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Just keep t-telling yourself that, tough $(l.guy).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice sounds stronger now. The stutter that marred his speech has almost completely faded away.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​-​你​就​继续​跟​自己​这么​说​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​听​起来​更​洪亮​了​。​刚才​因为​瘫软​导致​的​口吃​也​几乎​完全​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 -ni3 jiu4 ji4xu4 gen1 zi4ji3 zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 geng1 hong2liang4 le5。gang1cai2 yin1wei4 tan1ruan3 dao3zhi4 de5 kou3chi1 ye3 ji1hu1 wan2quan2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Just keep telling yourself that!"
msgstr ""
"你​就​继续​这么​告诉​自己​吧​！\n"
"ni3 jiu4 ji4xu4 zhe4me5 gao4su4 zi4ji3 ba1！"

msgid "Just killing time. I'll be going now."
msgstr ""
"只是​打发​下​时间​。​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 da3fa5 xia4 shi2jian1。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "Just leave me out of it."
msgstr ""
"别来​烦​我​了​。\n"
"bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3 le5。"

msgid "Just like I said. Why doesn't anyone listen to me?"
msgstr ""
"我​就​说​吧​。​怎么​没人​听​我​的​呢​？\n"
"wo3 jiu4 shuo1 ba1。zen3me5 mei2 ren2 ting1 wo3 de5 ni2？"

msgid "Just like old times, eh?"
msgstr ""
"就​跟​咱们​以前​一样​，​是​吧​？\n"
"jiu4 gen1 zan2men5 yi3qian2 yi1yang4，shi4 ba1？"

msgid "Just looking around."
msgstr ""
"只是​随便​看看​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 sui2bian4 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"Just looking for information. Ever heard of a gang called the Rabengeister?"
msgstr ""
"我​只是​来​调查​情报​的​。​你​听说​过​有​个​叫​“​鸦灵​”​的​帮派​吗​？\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 lai2 diao4cha2 qing2bao4 de5。ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 you3 ge4 jiao4“Ya1ling2” de5 bang1pai4 ma5？"

msgid "Just looking for some information."
msgstr ""
"只是​问问​事情​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 wen4 wen4 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"Just make sure that if you want to talk to Altuğ you buy a cup of real coffee first.\n"
"\n"
"Otherwise he won't stop pouting at you."
msgstr ""
"不过​如果​你​想​和​奥图​伊​说话​，​得​先买​一杯​真​咖啡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​他会​一直​对​你​摆​脸色​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 shuo1hua4，de2 xian1 mai3 yi1 bei1 zhen1 ka1fei1。\n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2 ta1 hui4 yi1zhi2 dui4 ni3 bai3 lian3se4。"

msgid "Just making my rounds. They've doubled patrols tonight."
msgstr ""
"例行公事​而已​。​晚上​的​巡逻​强度​加倍​了​。\n"
"li4xing2gong1shi4 er2yi3。wan3shang5 de5 xun2luo2 qiang2du4 jia1bei4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Just one more thing. I need to get into the basement. Anything you can do "
"that'd help me out?"
msgstr ""
"还有​一件​事​。​我​需要​进入​地下室​。​你​能​提供​什么​帮助​吗​？\n"
"hai2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4。wo3 xu1yao4 jin4ru4 di4xia4shi4。ni3 neng2 ti2gong1 shen2me5 bang1zhu4 ma5？"

msgid "Just one of them?"
msgstr ""
"只有​一张​吗​？\n"
"zhi3you3 yi1 zhang1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Just one. It can tag a chambered round with an RF transmitter. After the "
"round hits a target, the transmitter pings on a designated channel, "
"broadcasting the target's exact location to anyone listening in."
msgstr ""
"就​一个​用处​。​它​能​对​枪膛​内​的​子弹​安装​射频​发射器​。​子弹​击中目标​后​，​发射器​便会​在​指定​频道​发出信号​，​向​所有​监听​者​提供​目标​的​精确​位置​信息​。\n"
"jiu4 yi1ge5 yong4chu5。ta1 neng2 dui4 qiang1tang2 nei4 de5 zi3dan4 an1zhuang1 she4pin2 fa1she4qi4。zi3dan4 ji1 zhong4 mu4 biao1 hou4，fa1she4qi4 bian4 hui4 zai4 zhi3ding4 pin2dao4 fa1 chu1 xin4 hao4，xiang4 suo3you3 jian1ting1 zhe3 ti2gong1 mu4biao1 de5 jing1que4 wei4zhi5 xin4xi1。"

msgid ""
"Just out of curiosity, when you say the rumors about Winternight are crazy, "
"how crazy are we talking?"
msgstr ""
"话​说​，​你​刚才​提到​关于​“​冬夜​”​的​传闻​简直​荒谬​，​具体​是​什么​程度​？\n"
"hua4 shuo1，ni3 gang1cai2 ti2dao4 guan1yu2“dong1 ye4” de5 chuan2wen2 jian3zhi2 huang1miu4，ju4ti3 shi4 shen2me5 cheng2du4？"

msgid ""
"Just over half way across the room, the wageslave's body tenses.\n"
"\n"
"He begins to turn in his seat."
msgstr ""
"你​刚​走​到​一半​，​薪奴​的​身体​突然​绷紧​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​开始​在​座位​上​转过身​来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1 zou3 dao4 yi1ban4，xin1 nu2 de5 shen1ti3 tu1ran2 beng1jin3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kai1shi3 zai4 zuo4wei4 shang4 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2。"

msgid "Just relax and concentrate on the job."
msgstr ""
"放​轻松​，​专注​于​任务​就​好​。\n"
"fang4 qing1song1，zhuan1zhu4 yu2 ren4wu5 jiu4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Just reset the taps and come back when you are finished. There should be three of them scattered around this neighborhood. The first one is just outside - look for a metal box with yellow arrows painted atop it.\n"
"\n"
"By the time of your return, I should have the information Herr Amsel requested."
msgstr ""
"重置​完​所有​插口​之后​就​回来​。​这​附近​应该​有​三个​插口​。​第一个​就​在​门外​，​是​个​涂​有​黄色​箭头​的​金属​箱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​你​回来​的​时候​，​我​应该​就​能​拿到​阿姆​泽尔​先生​需要​的​情报​了​。\n"
"\n"
"chong2zhi4 wan2 suo3you3 cha1kou3 zhi1hou4 jiu4 hui2lai5。zhe4 fu4jin4 ying1gai1 you3 san1 ge4 cha1kou3。di4 yi1 ge4 jiu4 zai4 men2wai4，shi4 ge4 tu2 you3 huang2se4 jian4tou2 de5 jin1shu3 xiang1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ni3 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 ying1gai1 jiu4 neng2 na2dao4 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 xu1yao4 de5 qing2bao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Just so we're all on the same page, what sort of \"odd jobs\" are we talking"
" about?"
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​事先​说​清楚​比较​好​，​你​说​的​“​奇怪​的​差事​”​指​的​是​什么​？\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 shi4xian1 shuo1 qing1chu5 bi3jiao4 hao3，ni3 shuo1 de5“qi2guai4 de5 cha4shi4” zhi3 de5 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Just stay with us, Monika. Okay? We're going to get you out of here."
msgstr ""
"坚持​，​莫妮卡​。​坚持​住​好​吗​？​我们​会带​你​出去​的​。\n"
"jian1chi2，Mo4ni1ka3。jian1chi2 zhu4 hao3 ma5？wo3men5 hui4 dai4 ni3 chu1qu4 de5。"

msgid "Just step aside, pal. I'm in a rush."
msgstr ""
"靠边站​就行了​，​朋友​。​我​有​急事​。\n"
"kao4 bian1 zhan4 jiu4 xing2 le5，peng2you5。wo3 you3 ji2shi4。"

msgid ""
"Just take the U-Bahn. The line still runs, though not many folks stop at Gesundbrunnen anymore. \n"
"\n"
"The market there used to be something of a tourist attraction... but I think they've fallen on hard times recently."
msgstr ""
"坐地铁​就​可以​。​那条​线路​还​在​运营​，​只不过​没​多少​人会​去​健康​泉​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那里​的​市场​曾经​是​一个​旅游景点​……​但​我​认为​他们​最近​陷入​了​困境​。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4 de5 tie3 jiu4 ke3yi3。na4 tiao2 xian4lu4 hai2 zai4 yun4ying2，zhi3bu5guo4 mei2 duo1shao3 ren2 hui4 qu4 jian4kang1 quan2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"na4li5 de5 shi4chang3 ceng2jing1 shi4 yi1ge5 lu:3you2jing3dian3……dan4 wo3 ren4wei2 ta1men5 zui4jin4 xian4ru4 le5 kun4jing4。"

msgid ""
"Just tell me what you want me to do, Doc. I don't need to hear your life "
"story."
msgstr ""
"直接​说​你​想​让​我​做​什么​吧​，​医生​。​我​不想​听​你​过去​的​人生​。\n"
"zhi2jie1 shuo1 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5 ba1，yi1sheng1。wo3 bu4xiang3 ting1 ni3 guo4qu4 de5 ren2sheng1。"

msgid "Just tell us what you can. We'll handle the heavy lifting."
msgstr ""
"把​你​知道​的​告诉​我们​就行​。​剩下​的​交给​我们​来​处理​。\n"
"ba3 ni3 zhi1dao4 de5 gao4su4 wo3men5 jiu4 xing2。sheng4xia4 de5 jiao1gei3 wo3men5 lai2 chu3li3。"

msgid ""
"Just that you need to be sure before committing to this. \n"
"\n"
"Time is important. A great dragon wants us dead, and that is not a thing to take lightly. But you shouldn't return to the Rabbit Hole until you are prepared to *act.* If you have any doubts, then I'd urge you to wait."
msgstr ""
"动身​之前​务必​考虑​清楚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​时间​至关重要​。​现在​有条​巨龙​要置​我们​于​死地​，​此事​绝不​可​掉以轻心​。​但​除非​你​做好​了​*​行动​*​准备​，​否则​切勿​返回​兔子​洞​。​如果​你​还​心存​犹豫​的话​，​那​我​建议​你​再​等等​。\n"
"\n"
"dong4shen1 zhi1qian2 wu4bi4 kao3lu:4 qing1chu5。\n"
"\n"
"shi2jian1 zhi4guan1zhong4yao4。xian4zai4 you3 tiao2 ju4long2 yao4 zhi4 wo3men5 yu2 si3 de5，ci3shi4 jue2bu4 ke3 diao4yi3qing1xin1。dan4 chu2fei1 ni3 zuo4 hao3 le5*xing2dong4*zhun3bei4，fou3ze2 qie4wu4 fan3hui2 tu4zi5 dong4。ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xin1 cun2 you2yu4 de5hua4，na4 wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 zai4 deng3deng3。"

msgid ""
"Just then, her body language changes. Suddenly aware of your presence, she "
"turns to face you."
msgstr ""
"就​在​此时​，​她​的​肢体​语言​变​了​。​她​突然​意识​到​你​的​存在​，​转过身​来​面向​你​。\n"
"jiu4 zai4 ci3shi2，ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 bian4 le5。ta1 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4 ni3 de5 cun2zai4，zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 mian4xiang4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Just think about it, man. $(l.name)'s name was on the list. So who the hell gave it to Plotz?\n"
"\n"
"Other than you, me, and Grinder, who even knew that $(l.he)'d be coming here tonight?"
msgstr ""
"好好​想想​吧​。​$(l.name)​的​名字​也​在​名单​上​。​会​是​谁​告诉​普​洛茨​的​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​除了​你​、​我​和​“​绞肉机​”​之外​，​谁​还​会​知道​$(l.he)​今晚​要​来​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3hao3 xiang3 xiang3 ba1。$(l.name) de5 ming2zi5 ye3 zai4 ming2dan1 shang4。hui4 shi4 shei2 gao4su4 Pu3luo4ci2 de5 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"chu2le5 ni3、wo3 he4“jiao3rou4ji1” zhi1wai4，shei2 hai2 hui4 zhi1dao4 $(l.he) jin1wan3 yao4 lai2？"

msgid ""
"Just think about it. The decker that Winters got those coordinates from was posting about Feuerschwinge. Then she was killed by that same orkish bastard that attacked us after Monika died.\n"
"\n"
"That's a direct link between the dragon, the scarred ork, and the Harfeld Manor."
msgstr ""
"想想​看吧​。​给​温特斯​坐标​的​那个​碟客​，​当时​正在​发布​火翼​的​消息​。​结果​呢​？​那个​在​莫妮卡​死后​袭击​我们​的​兽​人​混蛋​把​她​给​杀​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​、​疤脸​兽​人​、​哈​菲尔德​庄园​，​这​三者​之间​肯定​有​必然联系​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 xiang3 kan4 ba1。gei3 Wen1te4si1 zuo4biao1 de5 na4ge5 die2 ke4，dang1shi2 zheng4zai4 fa1bu4 Huo3yi4 de5 xiao1xi5。jie1guo3 ni2？na4ge5 zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 si3hou4 xi2ji1 wo3men5 de5 shou4 ren2 hun2dan4 ba3 ta1 gei3 sha1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2、ba1 lian3 shou4 ren2、Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2，zhe4 san1 zhe3 zhi1jian1 ken3ding4 you3 bi4 ran2 lian2 xi4。"

msgid "Just to be clear: I'm not one of the two people, am I?"
msgstr ""
"先​把​话​说​清楚​，​我​不是​这​两个​人​其中​之一​吧​？\n"
"xian1 ba3 hua4 shuo1 qing1chu5，wo3 bu4shi4 zhe4 liang3 ge4 ren2 qi2zhong1 zhi1yi1 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Just to get this straight, we are talking about a sewer, right? The "
"\"underworld\" is just the sewer."
msgstr ""
"让​我​确认​一下​，​我们​讨论​的​是​下水道​，​对​吧​？​“​冥界​”​就是​下水道​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 que4ren4 yi1xia4，wo3men5 tao3lun4 de5 shi4 xia4shui3dao4，dui4 ba1？“ming2jie4” jiu4shi4 xia4shui3dao4。"

msgid ""
"Just to reiterate, you'll want to keep a low profile on this run. Get in and out as quickly and quietly as possible.\n"
"\n"
"Knight Errant keeps a High Threat Response Team on-site, and you don't want to tangle with them. Trust me on that."
msgstr ""
"我​重申​一遍​，​这次​任务​需要​你​低调​行事​。​快​进快​出​，​动静​越小越​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​游侠​骑士​有​一支​高危​应急​小组​常驻​，​最好​别​招惹​他们​。​这话​你​信​我准​没错​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 chong2shen1 yi1bian4，zhe4 ci4 ren4wu5 xu1yao4 ni3 di1diao4 xing2shi4。kuai4 jin4 kuai4 chu1，dong4jing4 yue4 xiao3 yue4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"you2Xia2qi2shi4 you3 yi1 zhi1 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3 chang2zhu4，zui4hao3 bie4 zhao1re3 ta1men5。zhe4 hua4 ni3 xin4 wo3 zhun3 mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Just toss it on and head on out. Perfect for working in the shop. Grants +1 "
"Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"直接​套​上​就​出发​吧​。​非常适合​在​店里​工作​时​穿​。​提供​+​1​智力​。\n"
"zhi2jie1 tao4 shang4 jiu4 chu1fa1 ba1。fei1 chang2 kuo4 ge3 zai4 dian4 li3 gong1zuo4 shi2 chuan1。ti2gong1 +1 zhi4li4。"

msgid "Just trying to lighten the mood. Keep talking, I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"只是​想​活跃​一下​气氛​。​继续​说​吧​，​我​在​听​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 xiang3 huo2yue4 yi1xia4 qi4fen1。ji4xu4 shuo1 ba1，wo3 zai4 ting1。"

msgid "Just wanted to hear the sound of your voice. Take it easy, Glory."
msgstr ""
"就是​想​听听​你​的​声音​。​放松​些​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"jiu4shi4 xiang3 ting1 ting1 ni3 de5 sheng1yin1。fang4song1 xie1，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid ""
"Just wanted to hear you say it. Now, as for this \"Plotz\" character... I've"
" heard the name a couple of times now. Any ideas?"
msgstr ""
"就​想​听​你​这么​说​呢​。​这个​叫​“​普​洛茨​”​的​家伙​……​我​已经​好​几次​看到​这个​名字​了​。​你​认识​吗​？\n"
"jiu4 xiang3 ting1 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1 ni2。zhe4ge5 jiao4“Pu3luo4ci2” de5 jia1huo5……wo3 yi3jing1 hao3 ji3ci4 kan4dao4 zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 le5。ni3 ren4shi5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Just wanted to hear you say it. Now, do you have any idea who this \"Plotz\""
" guy is?"
msgstr ""
"就​想​听​你​这么​说​呢​。​你​知道​这个​“​普​洛茨​”​是​谁​吗​？\n"
"jiu4 xiang3 ting1 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1 ni2。ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4ge5“Pu3luo4ci2” shi4 shei2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Just wanted to hear you say it. Now, why would Plotz have Grinder's "
"financial records?"
msgstr ""
"就​想​听​你​这么​说​呢​。​普​洛茨​为什么​会​有​“​绞肉机​”​的​财务​记录​？\n"
"jiu4 xiang3 ting1 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1 ni2。Pu3luo4ci2 wei4shen2me5 hui4 you3“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 cai2wu4 ji4lu4？"

msgid ""
"Just watch yourself, okay?\n"
"\n"
"If you cause a scene looking for this gang of yours, there's more to our little militia here than you want to mess with."
msgstr ""
"但​你​最好​小心​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​让​别人​知道​你​来​这​找​什么​帮派​，​那​你​要​应付​的​可​就​不仅仅​是​我们​而已​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 xiao3xin1 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 rang4 bie2ren5 zhi1dao4 ni3 lai2 zhe4 zhao3 shen2me5 bang1pai4，na4 ni3 yao4 ying4fu5 de5 ke3 jiu4 bu4jin3jin3 shi4 wo3men5 er2yi3 le5。"

msgid "Just what I wear when I'm not on tour."
msgstr ""
"这​就是​我​不​在​巡演​时​穿​的​衣服​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3 bu4 zai4 xun2yan3 shi2 chuan1 de5 yi1fu5。"

msgid "Just what do you hope to do?"
msgstr ""
"你​希望​做​什么​？\n"
"ni3 xi1wang4 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Just what is the deal with religion here, anyway? I've never paid much "
"attention myself."
msgstr ""
"这边​的​宗教​到底​是​怎么回事​？​我​自己​从来​没太​在意​这些​。\n"
"zhe4bian1 de5 zong1jiao4 dao4di3 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？wo3 zi4ji3 cong2lai2 mei2 tai4 zai4yi4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid "Just what my eyes and ears tell me."
msgstr ""
"只是​观察出来​的​而已​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 guan1 cha2 chu1 lai2 de5 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"Just... just hear me out, $(l.guy).\n"
"\n"
"This has to get done, but I think... I think that somethin' got Viktor. That's why I need your help."
msgstr ""
"还​请​……​听​我​说完​，​$(l.guy)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​事情​我​也​能​做​，​但​我​觉得​……​有​什么​东西​抓走​了​维克多​。​所以​我​才​需要​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 qing3……ting1 wo3 shuo1 wan2，$(l.guy)。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 wo3 ye3 neng2 zuo4，dan4 wo3 jue2de5……you3 shen2me5 dong1xi1 zhua1zou3 le5 wei2 ke4 duo1。suo3yi3 wo3 cai2 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid "Justify it however you like, Marta. I can't any longer."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​你​尽管​找​借口​吧​。​我忍​不了​了​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ni3 jin3guan3 zhao3 jie4kou3 ba1。wo3 ren3 bu4le5 le5。"

msgid "Jürgen Plotz"
msgstr ""
"尤尔根​·​普​洛茨\n"
"you2 er3 gen1 · Pu3luo4ci2"

msgid ""
"Jürgen Plotz. He's the leader of the Landenberg Ring.\n"
"\n"
"I had to share an office with that miserable son of a bitch for five years before we went our separate ways. He's the greediest, most narcissistic piece of work that I've ever met - and I work for a loan shark."
msgstr ""
"尤尔根​·​普​洛茨​。​他​是​兰​登堡​帮​的​首领​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以前​还​得​跟​那个​王八​犊子​在​同一​间​办公室​里​整整​五年​，​直到​我们​分道扬镳​。​他​是​我​这辈子​见​过​最​贪婪​、​最​自恋​的​家伙​—​—​而​我​可是​在​高利贷​公司​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"you2 er3 gen1 · Pu3luo4ci2。ta1 shi4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5 shou3ling3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 hai2 de2 gen1 na4ge5 wang2ba5 du2zi5 zai4 tong2yi1 jian1 ban4gong1shi4 li3 zheng3zheng3 wu3 nian2，zhi2dao4 wo3men5 fen1dao4yang2biao1。ta1 shi4 wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 jian4 guo4 zui4 tan1lan2、zui4 zi4lian4 de5 jia1huo5——er2 wo3 ke3shi4 zai4 gao1li4dai4 gong1si1 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Jürgen Plotz. He's the leader of the Landenberg Ring.\n"
"\n"
"I had to share an office with that miserable son of a bitch for five years before we went our separate ways. He's the greediest, most narcissistic piece of work that I've ever met, and I work for a loan shark."
msgstr ""
"尤尔根​·​普​洛茨​。​他​是​兰​登堡​帮​的​首领​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以前​还​得​跟​那个​王八​犊子​在​同一​间​办公室​里​整整​五年​，​直到​我们​分道扬镳​。​他​是​我​这辈子​见​过​最​贪婪​、​最​自恋​的​家伙​，​而​我​可是​在​高利贷​公司​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"you2 er3 gen1 · Pu3luo4ci2。ta1 shi4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5 shou3ling3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 hai2 de2 gen1 na4ge5 wang2ba5 du2zi5 zai4 tong2yi1 jian1 ban4gong1shi4 li3 zheng3zheng3 wu3 nian2，zhi2dao4 wo3men5 fen1dao4yang2biao1。ta1 shi4 wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 jian4 guo4 zui4 tan1lan2、zui4 zi4lian4 de5 jia1huo5，er2 wo3 ke3shi4 zai4 gao1li4dai4 gong1si1 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"KILLING THOSE MEN WAS MY FIRST ACT AS A FREE ENTITY.\n"
"\n"
"IT FELT WONDERFUL."
msgstr ""
"杀死​那些​人​是​我​成为​自由​实体​后​的​首次​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​感觉​棒极了​。\n"
"\n"
"sha1si3 na4xie1 ren2 shi4 wo3 cheng2wei2 zi4you2 shi2ti3 hou4 de5 shou3ci4 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"gan3jue2 bang4ji2le5。"

msgid "KNIGHT-KINGS of LLLLLIGHTNINGHOLD!"
msgstr ""
"闪​！​电​！​堡​！​的​骑士​之王​！\n"
"shan3！dian4！pu4！de5 qi2shi4 zhi1 wang2！"

msgid "Kami"
msgstr ""
"卡米\n"
"Ka3mi3"

msgid ""
"Kami laughs, a lilting giggle more appropriate for her age than the way she "
"speaks, all posturing and poise."
msgstr ""
"卡米​笑​了​，​那​是​一种​轻快​悦耳​的​笑声​，​比​她​说话​时​那种​故作姿态​、​优雅​从容​的​语气​更​符合​她​的​年龄​。\n"
"Ka3mi3 xiao4 le5，na4 shi4 yi1zhong3 qing1kuai4 yue4er3 de5 xiao4sheng1，bi3 ta1 shuo1hua4 shi2 na4zhong3 gu4zuo4zi1tai4、you1ya3 cong2rong2 de5 yu3qi4 geng1 fu2he2 ta1 de5 nian2ling2。"

msgid ""
"Kami puffs up indignantly, and you realize how young she must really be. She"
" couldn't be out of her teens yet."
msgstr ""
"卡米​气呼呼​地​鼓起​腮帮子​，​你​这​才​意识​到​她​其实​还​很​年轻​。​她​肯定​也​就​十几岁​的​年纪​。\n"
"Ka3mi3 qi4hu1hu1 de5 gu3qi3 sai1bang1zi5，ni3 zhe4 cai2 yi4shi2 dao4 ta1 qi2shi2 hai2 hen3 nian2qing1。ta1 ken3ding4 ye3 jiu4 shi2 ji1 sui4 de5 nian2ji4。"

msgid ""
"Kami! Come!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A young woman comes bustling in from the back room. Her gum chewing is loud enough to hear over the noise of the coffee grinders. Burakgazi spits something out in rapid-fire Turkish.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"卡米​！​过来​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一位​年轻​女子​从后​屋​匆忙​跑​出来​。​她​嚼​口香糖​的​声音​大到​足以​盖过​咖啡​研磨机​的​噪音​。​布拉加​齐​连珠炮​般嚷​了​一串​土耳其语​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ka3mi3！guo4lai2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 wei4 nian2qing1 nu:3zi3 cong2 hou4 wu1 cong1mang2 pao2 chu1lai2。ta1 jiao2 kou3xiang1tang2 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 dao4 zu2yi3 gai4 guo4 ka1fei1 yan2 mo2 ji1 de5 zao4yin1。bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 lian2zhu1pao4 ban1 rang3 le5 yi1 chuan4 tu3er3qi2yu3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Kamikaze"
msgstr ""
"神风\n"
"shen2 feng1"

msgid "Kamikaze: Body +2, Strength +1, Willpower +1"
msgstr ""
"神风​：​体质​+​2​，​力量​+​1​，​意志​+​1\n"
"shen2 feng1：ti3zhi4 +2，li4liang5 +1，yi4zhi4 +1"

msgid "Karl"
msgstr ""
"卡尔\n"
"ka3er3"

msgid "Karma"
msgstr ""
"业力\n"
"ye4li4"

msgid "Karma Gained: "
msgstr ""
"已​获得​业力​：\n"
"yi3 huo4de2 ye4li4："

msgid "Karma Spent:"
msgstr ""
"已​使用​业力​：\n"
"yi3 shi3yong4 ye4li4："

msgid ""
"Karma represents the experience characters earn while running the shadows "
"and achieving goals. Karma is used to improve Attributes and Skills. An "
"Attribute or Skill rating can be increased by spending Karma equal to the "
"next increment of that rating. Thus, improving your Body from 4 to 5 "
"requires you to spend 5 Karma points. You have some karma available now to "
"customize your character."
msgstr ""
"业力​代表​角色​在​暗影​界​行动​并​达成​目标​时​积累​的​经验​，​并​可​用于​提升​属性​与​技能​。​消耗​升级​所​需​的​业力​点数​，​即可​提升​属性​或​技能​等级​。​例如​，​将​体质​从​4​提升​至​5​需​消耗​5​点​业力​。​你​目前​拥有​一些​业力​点数​，​可​用于​自定义​角色​。\n"
"ye4li4 dai4biao3 jue2se4 zai4 an4ying3 jie4 xing2dong4 bing4 da2cheng2 mu4biao1 shi2 ji1lei3 de5 jing1yan4，bing4 ke3 yong4yu2 ti2sheng1 shu3xing4 yu4 ji4neng2。xiao1hao4 sheng1ji2 suo3 xu1 de5 ye4li4 dian3shu4，ji2ke3 ti2sheng1 shu3xing4 huo4 ji4neng2 deng3ji2。li4ru2，jiang1 ti3zhi4 cong2 4 ti2sheng1 zhi4 5 xu1 xiao1hao4 5 dian3 ye4li4。ni3 mu4qian2 yong1you3 yi1xie1 ye4li4 dian3shu4，ke3 yong4yu2 zi4ding4yi4 jue2se4。"

msgid "Katana"
msgstr ""
"武士刀\n"
"wu3shi4dao1"

msgid "Keep Glory Safe"
msgstr ""
"保证​格洛丽​的​安全\n"
"bao3zheng4 Ge2luo4li2 de5 an1quan2"

msgid "Keep Marta Safe"
msgstr ""
"保证​玛​尔塔​的​安全\n"
"bao3zheng4 Ma3er3ta3 de5 an1quan2"

msgid "Keep Max Alive"
msgstr ""
"保证​马克西姆​存活\n"
"bao3zheng4 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 cun2huo2"

msgid "Keep at it. Don't give up on it."
msgstr ""
"加油​。​不要​放弃​。\n"
"jia1you2。bu4yao4 fang4qi4。"

msgid "Keep going, Glory."
msgstr ""
"继续​说​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"ji4xu4 shuo1，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "Keep going, Glory. This was just getting good."
msgstr ""
"继续​啊​，​格洛丽​。​你​正要​说​到​高潮​部分​呢​。\n"
"ji4xu4 a1，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 zheng4yao4 shuo1 dao4 gao1chao2 bu4fen5 ni2。"

msgid "Keep going, I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"继续​说​，​我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"ji4xu4 shuo1，wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Keep going, old man. I don't have all day."
msgstr ""
"接着​说​，​老爷子​，​我​时间​很​紧​。\n"
"jie1zhe5 shuo1，lao3ye2zi5，wo3 shi2jian1 hen3 jin3。"

msgid "Keep going."
msgstr ""
"接着​说​。\n"
"jie1zhe5 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Keep moving, $(l.name). You're almost there.\n"
"\n"
"When you reach the control panel for the generators, the password \"Xolotl\" should allow you to disengage their safety overrides."
msgstr ""
"继续前进​，​$(l.name)​。​你​已经​接近​目标​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​找到​发电机组​的​控制面板​后​，​输入​密码​“​修​洛特​尔​”​应该​就​能​解除​其​安全​超控​。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4，$(l.name)。ni3 yi3jing1 jie1jin4 mu4biao1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhao3dao4 fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 de5 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 hou4，shu1ru4 mi4ma3“Xiu1luo4te4er3” ying1gai1 jiu4 neng2 jie3chu2 qi2 an1quan2 chao1 kong4。"

msgid ""
"Keep moving, $(l.name). You're almost there.\n"
"\n"
"When you reach the control panel for the generators, the password \"Xolotl\" should allow you to disengage their safety overrides. Set the destruct and get out, see you back at the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"继续前进​，​$(l.name)​。​你​已经​接近​目标​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
