msgid ""
"Kreuzberg. Home to nearly a half a million people and, until very recently, Monika Schäfer. Once a melting pot of cultural diversity, it's now a chaotic mess of wealth and poverty, crime and commerce, anarchy and control. It's also home to your own little slice of Berlin, a neighborhood that locals call \"the Kreuzbasar\" - a safe port in the eye of a storm.\n"
"\n"
"The ride back to the Kreuzbasar is quiet. No one is in a talking mood. As the van veers past potholes and garbage piles, the glare of streetlights and neon signs plays across your window, painting the world in a kaleidoscope of garish colors.\n"
"\n"
"Soon, the van rounds a corner and skids to a halt in a narrow, crumbling alley. This is as far as Berlin's chaotic streets will take you. Your team wordlessly debarks the vehicle and climbs down into a disused section of the U-Bahn tunnel system - a well-kept secret, providing your team safe passage into the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Your safehouse waits on the other side."
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​贝格​。​将近​五十万​人​在​此​安家​，​而​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​不久前​也​还是​其中​之一​。​这里​曾​是​文化​多元​的​大​熔炉​，​如今​却成​了​财富​与​贫困​、​犯罪​与​商业​、​无政府​状态​与​组织​管控​交织​的​混乱​之地​。​这里​同样​也​是​你​在​柏林​所​拥有​的​一小片​天地​，​当地人​称​这个​社区​为​“​克洛伊​茨​集市​”​—​—​这里​是​风暴​眼中​的​安全​港湾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​旅程​分外​安静​。​没人​有​心情​讲话​。​当​货车​在​坑洼​地面​和​垃圾堆​间​蜿蜒​前行​时​，​路灯​与​霓虹​招牌​的​刺眼​光芒​在​车窗​上​流转​，​将​世界​染成​一幅​色彩斑斓​的​万花筒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​很快​，​货车​绕过​一处​街角​，​停​在​某个​狭窄​破败​的​巷子​里​。​这里​便是​你​在​柏林​混乱​的​地表​街道​行进​旅程​的​尽头​。​你​的​团队​一言不发​地​下车​，​随后​爬进​一段​废弃​的​地铁​隧道​—​—​这是​一处​鲜为人知​的​秘密​通道​，​也​为​你们​通往​克洛伊​茨​集市​提供​了​安全​路径​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​安全​屋​就​在​另一边​等待​着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1 ci2 bei4 ge2。jiang1jin4 wu3 shi2 wan4 ren2 zai4 ci3 an1jia1，er2 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 bu4jiu3qian2 ye3 hai2shi5 qi2zhong1 zhi1yi1。zhe4li3 ceng2 shi4 wen2hua4 duo1yuan2 de5 dai4 rong2lu2，ru2jin1 que4 cheng2 le5 cai2fu4 yu4 pin2kun4、fan4zui4 yu4 shang1ye4、wu2 zheng4 fu3 zhuang4tai4 yu4 zu3zhi1 guan3kong4 jiao1zhi1 de5 hun4luan4 zhi1 de5。zhe4li3 tong2yang4 ye3 shi4 ni3 zai4 bo2lin2 suo3 yong1you3 de5 yi1 xiao3 pian1 tian1di4，dang1 de5 ren2 chen4 zhe4ge5 she4qu1 wei2“Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4”——zhe4li3 shi4 feng1bao4 yan3zhong1 de5 an1quan2 gang3wan1。\n"
