msgid "Laying it on a little thick, aren't you?"
msgstr ""
"你​这话​有点​太​夸张​了​吧​？\n"
"ni3 zhe4 hua4 you3dian3 tai4 kua1zhang1 le5 ba1？"

msgid "Lead the way, I'm right behind you."
msgstr ""
"带路​吧​，​我​跟着​你​。\n"
"dai4lu4 ba1，wo3 gen1zhe5 ni3。"

msgid "Lead the way."
msgstr ""
"带路​吧​。\n"
"dai4lu4 ba1。"

msgid "Leads a man to wonder why you packed up and moved here."
msgstr ""
"这​让​人​不由得​好奇​，​为何​你​要​收拾​行囊​搬​来​这里​。\n"
"zhe4 rang4 ren2 bu4you2de5 hao4qi2，wei4he2 ni3 yao4 shou1shi5 xing2nang2 ban1 lai2 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Leafing through the pages of the book reveals only a couple of entries. \n"
"\n"
"Each of them is scrawled in frantic, barely legible handwriting, with crude doodles filling up the margins."
msgstr ""
"粗略​翻过​一遍​后​，​你​发现​这个​本子​里​只有​几条​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​每条​内容​都​是​仓促​写下​的​，​笔迹​狂乱​而​难以​辨识​，​空白处​还​画​满​了​粗糙​的​涂鸦​。\n"
"\n"
"cu1lu:e4 fan1guo4 yi1bian4 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 zhe4ge5 ben3zi5 li3 zhi3you3 ji1 tiao2 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"mei3 tiao2 nei4rong2 dou1 shi4 cang1cu4 xie3xia4 de5，bi3ji4 kuang2luan4 er2 nan2yi3 bian4shi2，kong1 bai2 chu3 hai2 hua4 man3 le5 cu1cao1 de5 tu2ya1。"

msgid ""
"Leafing through to the middle of the book, you find a section dedicated to "
"Harrow's \"Rules of Living.\""
msgstr ""
"翻到​书​的​中间​部分​，​你​发现​有​一节​内容​专门​介绍​了​哈罗​的​“​生存​法则​”​。\n"
"fan1 dao4 shu1 de5 zhong1jian1 bu4fen5，ni3 fa1xian4 you3 yi1 jie1 nei4rong2 zhuan1men2 jie4shao4 le5 ha1luo2 de5“sheng1cun2 fa3ze2”。"

msgid "Learn from your girlfriend's mistake. Don't go down there."
msgstr ""
"你​女友​的​事​就是​个​教训​。​别下​到​那里​去​。\n"
"ni3 nu:3you3 de5 shi4 jiu4shi4 ge4 jiao4xun5。bie4 xia4 dao4 na4li5 qu4。"

msgid "Leave"
msgstr ""
"Leave\n"
"Leave"

msgid "Leave Das Kesselhaus"
msgstr ""
"离开​“​锅炉房​”\n"
"li2kai1“Guo1lu2fang2”"

msgid ""
"Leave him to us. And regarding the MKVI, don't worry... the prototype is in good hands now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He slips a credstick into your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Enjoy your pay."
msgstr ""
"交给​我们​吧​。​至于​MKVI​，​别​担心​……​原型机​现在​很​安全​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​一根​信用​棒​塞进​你​手里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​你​的​报酬​。\n"
"\n"
"jiao1gei3 wo3men5 ba1。zhi4yu2 MKVI，bie4 dan1xin1……yuan2 xing2 ji1 xian4zai4 hen3 an1quan2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4 se4 jin4 ni3 shou3li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid "Leave it alone, Jana. We'll find another way."
msgstr ""
"别管​它​了​，​简娜​。​我们​另想​别的​办法​。\n"
"bie2guan3 ta1 le5，Jian3na4。wo3men5 ling4 xiang3 bie2de5 ban4fa3。"

msgid "Leave it alone."
msgstr ""
"离开​。\n"
"li2kai1。"

msgid "Leave it to me. I'll get you your money... and some answers."
msgstr ""
"交给​我​就​好​了​，​我会​拿到​你​的​钱​……​还有​他们​的​答复​。\n"
"jiao1gei3 wo3 jiu4 hao3 le5，wo3 hui4 na2dao4 ni3 de5 qian2……hai2you3 ta1men5 de5 da2fu4。"

msgid "Leave me alone."
msgstr ""
"离​我​远点​。\n"
"li2 wo3 yuan3 dian3。"

msgid ""
"Leave that to me, friend.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich jerks a thumb in the direction of the Humanis compound.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They'll have a hard time avoiding us when I'm in there, kickin' down doors and lighting fires."
msgstr ""
"交给​我​吧​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希用​大拇指​戳​了​戳​人类​至上​主义者​据点​的​方向​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我​踹​门​进去​，​点上​一把​小火​，​到​时​看​他们​还​躲​不​躲​。\n"
"\n"
"jiao1gei3 wo3 ba1，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 yong4 da4mu5zhi3 chuo1 le5 chuo1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ju4dian3 de5 fang1xiang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 chuai4 men2 jin4qu4，dian3 shang4 yi1 ba3 xiao3 huo3，dao4 shi2 kan4 ta1men5 hai2 duo3 bu4 duo3。"

msgid "Leave the Sewers"
msgstr ""
"离开​下水道\n"
"li2kai1 xia4shui3dao4"

msgid "Leave the panel alone."
msgstr ""
"离开​。\n"
"li2kai1。"

msgid "Leave the terminal alone."
msgstr ""
"离开​。\n"
"li2kai1。"

msgid "Leave this item alone."
msgstr ""
"离开​。\n"
"li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"Leave this one alone, boss. You ain't gonna change his mind - he's too far "
"gone."
msgstr ""
"别管​他​了​，​老大​。​你​不​可能​改变​他​的​想法​—​—​他​已经​疯得​无可救药​了​。\n"
"bie2guan3 ta1 le5，lao3da4。ni3 bu4 ke3neng2 gai3bian4 ta1 de5 xiang3fa3——ta1 yi3jing1 feng1 de2 wu2ke3jiu4yao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Leave this one alone, chief. You won't change his mind - he's too far gone."
msgstr ""
"别管​他​了​，​头儿​。​你​改变​不了​他​的​想法​—​—​他​已经​疯得​无可救药​了​。\n"
"bie2guan3 ta1 le5，tou2r5。ni3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 ta1 de5 xiang3fa3——ta1 yi3jing1 feng1 de2 wu2ke3jiu4yao4 le5。"

msgid "Leave via the U-Bahn Train"
msgstr ""
"通过​地铁​离开\n"
"tong1guo4 di4tie3 li2kai1"

msgid ""
"Leave?! Abandon my kingdom? Never!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He puffs out his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For I am a proud and benevolent ruler! This is *my* sovereign territory, and I will *never* abandon it!"
msgstr ""
"离开​？​！​抛弃​我​的​王国​？​绝不​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挺起​胸膛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​我​是​个​骄傲​且​仁慈​的​统治者​！​这是​*​我​的​*​领土​，​我​*​绝不会​*​放弃​它​！\n"
"\n"
"li2kai1？！pao1qi4 wo3 de5 wang2guo2？jue2bu4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3 qi3 xiong1tang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 shi4 ge4 jiao1ao4 qie3 ren2ci2 de5 tong3zhi4zhe3！zhe4 shi4*wo3 de5*ling3tu3，wo3*jue2 bu4 hui4*fang4qi4 ta1！"

msgid "Ledger"
msgstr ""
"账簿\n"
"zhang4bu4"

msgid ""
"Left to my own devices, I probably wouldn't have.\n"
"\n"
"You pushed me to do this. To find some semblance of redemption. I owe you for that."
msgstr ""
"如果​由​我​自己​决定​，​我​可能​不会​这样​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​你​从​背后​推​了​我​一把​，​让​我​为​自己​寻得​救赎​。​这算​我​欠​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 you2 wo3 zi4ji3 jue2ding4，wo3 ke3neng2 bu4hui4 zhe4yang4 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3 cong2 bei4hou4 tui1 le5 wo3 yi1 ba3，rang4 wo3 wei2 zi4ji3 xun2 de2 jiu4shu2。zhe4 suan4 wo3 qian4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Leg"
msgstr ""
"腿\n"
"tui3"

msgid ""
"Lemme ask you a question, $(l.name). What made you choose to come to Berlin?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​让​我​问问​你​，​是​什么​让​你​选择​来到​柏林​？\n"
"$(l.name)，rang4 wo3 wen4 wen4 ni3，shi4 shen2me5 rang4 ni3 xuan3ze2 lai2dao4 bo2lin2？"

msgid ""
"Lemme get this straight, Blitz. You planned how to get us *into* the vault "
"in excruciating detail, but you didn't bother figuring out how to get us "
"back *out* again?"
msgstr ""
"让​我​把​话​说​清楚​，​布里​茨​。​你​把​我们​如何​*​进入​*​保险库​的​计划​都​安排​得​天衣无缝​，​却​懒得​琢磨​怎么​把​我们​弄​*​出来​*​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 ba3 hua4 shuo1 qing1chu5，Bu4li3ci2。ni3 ba3 wo3men5 ru2he2*jin4ru4*bao3 xian3 ku4 de5 ji4hua4 dou1 an1pai2 de2 tian1yi1wu2feng4，que4 lan3de5 zhuo2mo2 zen3me5 ba3 wo3men5 long4*chu1lai2*？"

msgid ""
"Lemme get this straight. You took a loan from somebody named \"Meat "
"Grinder\"?"
msgstr ""
"我​没​听错​吧​。​你​居然​找​一个​叫​“​绞肉机​”​的​人​借钱​？\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1cuo4 ba1。ni3 ju1ran2 zhao3 yi1ge5 jiao4“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 ren2 jie4qian2？"

msgid "Lennart Schummler"
msgstr ""
"莱昂​纳特​·​骗子\n"
"lai2 ang2 na4 te4 · pian4zi5"

msgid "Lennart Stromberg"
msgstr ""
"莱昂​纳特​·​施特​龙贝格\n"
"lai2 ang2 na4 te4 · shi1 te4 long2 bei4 ge2"

msgid "Less Than"
msgstr ""
"少于\n"
"shao3 yu2"

msgid "Let 'em come. We'll mow 'em down."
msgstr ""
"放马过来​便是​。​我们​会​把​他们​统统​消灭​掉​。\n"
"fang4ma3guo4lai2 bian4shi4。wo3men5 hui4 ba3 ta1men5 tong3tong3 xiao1mie4 diao4。"

msgid "Let him go, you son of a bitch!"
msgstr ""
"放​他​走​，​你​这​狗​娘养​的​！\n"
"fang4 ta1 zou3，ni3 zhe4 gou3 niang2 yang3 de5！"

msgid ""
"Let it go, $(l.name). You aren't going to change his mind - he's too far "
"gone."
msgstr ""
"算了吧​，​$(l.name)​。​你​不​可能​改变​他​的​想法​—​—​他​已经​疯得​无可救药​了​。\n"
"suan4 le5 ba1，$(l.name)。ni3 bu4 ke3neng2 gai3bian4 ta1 de5 xiang3fa3——ta1 yi3jing1 feng1 de2 wu2ke3jiu4yao4 le5。"

msgid "Let me cut you off right there. This is $(s.name), Dr. Ezkibel."
msgstr ""
"容​我​先​打断​一下​。​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​，​我​是​$(s.name)​。\n"
"rong2 wo3 xian1 da3duan4 yi1xia4。Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1，wo3 shi4 $(s.name)。"

msgid ""
"Let me get right to business. My organization would like to retain your "
"services for the indefinite future. But first, we're asking you to go on a "
"trial run - an \"audition\" of sorts - to prove that you're the right "
"$(l.man) for the job."
msgstr ""
"我​就​直说​了​。​我​的​组织​希望​长期​聘用​你​的​服务​。​但​首先​我们​需要​你​先​进行​一次​“​试镜​”​，​以​证明​你​是​胜任​此​差事​的​理想​人选​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi2 shuo1 le5。wo3 de5 zu3zhi1 xi1wang4 chang2qi1 pin4yong4 ni3 de5 fu2wu4。dan4 shou3xian1 wo3men5 xu1yao4 ni3 xian1 jin4xing2 yi1ci4“shi4jing4”，yi3 zheng4ming2 ni3 shi4 sheng4ren4 ci3 cha4shi4 de5 li3xiang3 ren2xuan3。"

msgid ""
"Let me get this straight. They charged on into the building, and you didn't "
"do anything to slow them down?"
msgstr ""
"我​没​听错​吧​。​他们​已经​进​了​大楼​，​而​你​居然​没有​阻拦​他们​？\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1cuo4 ba1。ta1men5 yi3jing1 jin4 le5 da4lou2，er2 ni3 ju1ran2 mei2you3 zu3lan2 ta1men5？"

msgid ""
"Let me get this straight. They charged on into the building, and you didn't "
"do anything to stop them?"
msgstr ""
"我​没​听错​吧​。​他们​已经​进​了​大楼​，​而​你​居然​没有​阻拦​他们​？\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1cuo4 ba1。ta1men5 yi3jing1 jin4 le5 da4lou2，er2 ni3 ju1ran2 mei2you3 zu3lan2 ta1men5？"

msgid ""
"Let me get this straight. You had a bad experience with one dragon, so now "
"you're going to wipe out an *entire species?*"
msgstr ""
"让​我​捋​一下​。​因为​一头​巨龙​做​了​坏事​，​你​现在​就要​抹​杀掉​*​整个​种族​*​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 lu:3 yi1xia4。yin1wei4 yi1tou2 ju4long2 zuo4 le5 huai4shi4，ni3 xian4zai4 jiu4yao4 ma1 sha1diao4*zheng3ge4 zhong3zu2*？"

msgid ""
"Let me guess where this is going. Humanis is planning something. An attack "
"of some kind."
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​。​人类​至上​主义者​在​计划​某种​袭击​之类​的​吧​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zai4 ji4hua4 mou3zhong3 xi2ji1 zhi1lei4 de5 ba1。"

msgid "Let me guess. Our client sent you?"
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​。​是​我们​的​客户​派​你们​来​的​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。shi4 wo3men5 de5 ke4hu4 pai4 ni3men5 lai2 de5？"

msgid "Let me guess. Plotz?"
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​。​是​普​洛茨​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。shi4 Pu3luo4ci2？"

msgid "Let me guess. You have cancer."
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​。​你​患​了​绝症​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。ni3 huan4 le5 jue2zheng4。"

msgid ""
"Let me guess. You want to come on the Humanis run so that you can finish the"
" job."
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​。​你​是​想​参与​这场​针对​人类​至上​主义者​的​行动​，​完成​当年​的​未竟之业​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。ni3 shi4 xiang3 can1yu4 zhe4 chang2 zhen1dui4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 xing2dong4，wan2cheng2 dang1nian2 de5 wei4 jing4 zhi1 ye4？"

msgid "Let me guess. You want to know how I lost the legs?"
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​。​你​想​知道​我​怎么​失去​的​双腿​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。ni3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 wo3 zen3me5 shi1qu4 de5 shuang1tui3？"

msgid "Let me guess: back to the coffee shop?"
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​。​你​是​说​豆​咖店​那位​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。ni3 shi4 shuo1 dou4 ka1 dian4 na4 wei4？"

msgid "Let me guess: bad news."
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​，​是​坏消息​吧​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1，shi4 huai4 xiao1 xi1 ba1。"

msgid "Let me guess: snip, snip?"
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​：​一刀两断​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1：yi1dao1liang3duan4？"

msgid "Let me guess: you define yourselves as the \"common man.\""
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​，​你​口中​的​“​普通人​”​就是​你们​自己​吧​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1，ni3 kou3 zhong4 de5“pu3tong1ren2” jiu4shi4 ni3men5 zi4ji3 ba1。"

msgid "Let me help you. I can protect you, Jana."
msgstr ""
"让​我​帮​你​吧​。​我​可以​保护​你​，​简娜​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 bang1 ni3 ba1。wo3 ke3yi3 bao3hu4 ni3，Jian3na4。"

msgid "Let me see that suit."
msgstr ""
"让​我​看看​那​件​西装​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 na4 jian4 xi1zhuang1。"

msgid "Let me see what you've got for sale."
msgstr ""
"让​我​看看​你​卖些​什么​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 mai4 xie1 shen2me5。"

msgid "Let me see your inventory."
msgstr ""
"让​我​看看​你​的​库存​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 de5 ku4cun2。"

msgid ""
"Let the fire take Harrow. We can still save the initiates... they can't be "
"far from here, I can hear them screaming."
msgstr ""
"就让​哈罗​被​大火​吞噬​掉​吧​。​我们​还​能​救出​那些​学徒​……​他们​离​这里​不远​，​我能​听到​他们​的​尖叫​。\n"
"jiu4 rang4 ha1luo2 bei4 da4huo3 tun1shi4 diao4 ba1。wo3men5 hai2 neng2 jiu4chu1 na4xie1 xue2tu2……ta1men5 li2 zhe4li3 bu4 yuan3，wo3 neng2 ting1dao4 ta1men5 de5 jian1jiao4。"

msgid ""
"Let the fire take this place - and everything in it. We've done what we came for.\n"
"\n"
"Harrow is dead. We've won."
msgstr ""
"让​大火​吞噬​这里​的​一切​吧​。​我们​已经​完成​了​此行​的​目的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​已死​。​我们​赢得​了​胜利​。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 da4huo3 tun1shi4 zhe4li3 de5 yi1qie4 ba1。wo3men5 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2 le5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 yi3 si3。wo3men5 ying2de2 le5 sheng4li4。"

msgid "Let us out of here, Vauclair. We need to talk."
msgstr ""
"让​我们​出去​，​沃​克莱尔​。​我们​得​谈谈​。\n"
"rang4 wo3men5 chu1qu4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"Let us review the events that transpired tonight. \n"
"\n"
"The smallest detail could be important, so hold nothing back."
msgstr ""
"我们​复盘​一下​今晚​发生​的​事​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哪怕​是​最​不起眼​的​细节​也​可能​很​重要​，​所以​要​一五一十​地​告诉​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 fu4pan2 yi1xia4 jin1wan3 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"na3pa4 shi4 zui4 bu4qi3yan3 de5 xi4jie2 ye3 ke3neng2 hen3 zhong4yao4，suo3yi3 yao4 yi1wu3yi1shi2 de5 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Let us see what his agent has to say.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel snatches the memory stick from your hand and slots it into his computer terminal.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"让​我们​听听​他​的​探子​怎么​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​一把​夺过​你​手中​的​记忆棒​，​插入​他​的​电脑​终端​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3men5 ting1 ting1 ta1 de5 tan4zi5 zen3me5 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 yi1 ba3 duo2 guo4 ni3 shou3 zhong4 de5 ji4yi4bang4，cha1ru4 ta1 de5 dian4nao3 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Let's agree that this is true. What does it matter?\n"
"\n"
"Smallpox was with us \"since the beginning,\" but I don't see anyone crying over its eradication."
msgstr ""
"就​当​你​说​得​没错​吧​。​这​又​有​什么​关系​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​天花​“​自古以来​”​就​与​我们​同​在​，​但​我​没​看到​有人​因为​它​被​根除​而​悲伤​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 dang1 ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4 ba1。zhe4 you4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"tian1hua1“zi4gu3yi3lai2” jiu4 yu4 wo3men5 tong2 zai4，dan4 wo3 mei2 kan4dao4 you3ren2 yin1wei4 ta1 bei4 gen1chu2 er2 bei1shang1。"

msgid ""
"Let's change the subject. Is there something else that you wanted to ask me "
"about?"
msgstr ""
"我们​换个​话题​吧​。​你​还有​什么​其他​想​问​我​的​事​吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 huan4 ge4 hua4ti2 ba1。ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 qi2ta1 xiang3 wen4 wo3 de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr ""
"动手​吧​。\n"
"dong4shou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Let's drop the subject and move on.\n"
"\n"
"Could I interest you in a new piece of cyberware? Some medical supplies, perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"这个​话题​暂且​就​到​这里​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​对​新​的​赛博​改造​有​兴趣​吗​？​或者​来​点​医疗​补给​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 hua4ti2 zan4qie3 jiu4 dao4 zhe4li3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 xin1 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 you3 xing4qu4 ma5？huo4zhe3 lai2 dian3 yi1liao2 bu3ji3？"

msgid "Let's get back to business. What's in the vault?"
msgstr ""
"咱们​还是​接着​谈​正事​吧​。​保险库​里​是​什么​？\n"
"zan2men5 hai2shi5 jie1zhe5 tan2 zheng4shi4 ba1。bao3 xian3 ku4 li3 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Let's get back to talking about what we're going to do in there."
msgstr ""
"我们​聊回​正题​吧​。​我们​进去​之后​要​做​什么​？\n"
"wo3men5 liao2 hui2 zheng1 ti2 ba1。wo3men5 jin4qu4 zhi1hou4 yao4 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Let's get inside."
msgstr ""
"我们​进去​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 jin4qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Let's get moving, then."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​出发​吧​。\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 chu1fa1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Let's get out of here, $(l.name). There's nothing else for us here.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shoots one last glance back at the body of the dead dragon, then turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's go home."
msgstr ""
"走​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​最后​看​了​一眼​死亡​巨龙​的​尸体​，​然后​转身​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​回家吧​。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zui4hou4 kan4 le5 yi1yan3 si3wang2 ju4long2 de5 shi1ti3，ran2hou4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui2 jia1 ba1。"

msgid "Let's get out of here. We have a job to do."
msgstr ""
"我们​走​吧​，​我们​有​任务​要​完成​。\n"
"wo3men5 zou3 ba1，wo3men5 you3 ren4wu5 yao4 wan2cheng2。"

msgid "Let's get to work."
msgstr ""
"我们​准备​行动​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhun3bei4 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid "Let's go back to what we were talking about before."
msgstr ""
"我们​回到​刚刚​的​话题​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui2dao4 gang1gang5 de5 hua4ti2。"

msgid "Let's go clear this up with Central."
msgstr ""
"得​去​指挥部​把​这事​弄清楚​。\n"
"de2 qu4 zhi3hui1bu4 ba3 zhe4 shi4 long4 qing1 chu3。"

msgid "Let's go hunting, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"咱们​去​狩猎​吧​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"zan2men5 qu4 shou4lie4 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "Let's go hunting."
msgstr ""
"狩猎​开始​。\n"
"shou4lie4 kai1shi3。"

msgid "Let's go, fearless leader. We have a job to do."
msgstr ""
"走​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​我们​还有​任务​要​完成​。\n"
"zou3 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3men5 hai2you3 ren4wu5 yao4 wan2cheng2。"

msgid ""
"Let's go, then.\n"
"\n"
"Once we've purified the spirit, we can see about rescuing those kids. Harrow will get away, but we can worry about that later."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​出发​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​净化​那个​精魂​后​，​就​可以​救​下​那些​孩子​了​。​哈罗​会​逃之夭夭​，​但​我们​可以​之后​再​操心​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 chu1fa1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 jing4hua4 na4ge5 jing1hun2 hou4，jiu4 ke3yi3 jiu4 xia4 na4Xie1hai2zi5 le5。ha1luo2 hui4 tao2zhi1yao1yao1，dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 zhi1hou4 zai4 cao1xin1。"

msgid ""
"Let's go, then.\n"
"\n"
"When we engage the spirit, Harrow will come rushing back here. And when we kill it, he'll be crippled.\n"
"\n"
"Then we kill him."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​行动​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我们​与​那个​精魂​交战​时​，​哈罗​肯定​会​迅速​赶回来​。​而​当​我们​杀死​那个​精魂​时​，​他​也​会​遭受​重创​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​到时候​我们​再​杀​了​他​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 xing2dong4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3men5 yu4 na4ge5 jing1hun2 jiao1zhan4 shi2，ha1luo2 ken3ding4 hui4 xun4su4 gan3 hui2 lai2。er2 dang1 wo3men5 sha1si3 na4ge5 jing1hun2 shi2，ta1 ye3 hui4 zao1shou4 zhong4chuang1。\n"
"\n"
"dao4shi2hou4 wo3men5 zai4 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid "Let's go."
msgstr ""
"我们​走​。\n"
"wo3men5 zou3。"

msgid "Let's go. We have a job to do."
msgstr ""
"走​吧​。​我们​还有​任务​要​完成​。\n"
"zou3 ba1。wo3men5 hai2you3 ren4wu5 yao4 wan2cheng2。"

msgid "Let's head to the safehouse... take care of Paul."
msgstr ""
"我们​去​安全​屋​吧​……​照顾​好​保罗​。\n"
"wo3men5 qu4 an1quan2 wu1 ba1……zhao4gu5 hao3 bao3luo2。"

msgid "Let's hope that the F-State is easier to convince."
msgstr ""
"希望​我们​能​就​这样​说服​动荡​带​吧​。\n"
"xi1wang4 wo3men5 neng2 jiu4 zhe4yang4 shuo1fu2 dong4dang4 dai4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Let's hope your gut is right.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's nothing more for us here. Let's get back home."
msgstr ""
"希望​你​的​直觉​没错​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​我们​回家吧​。\n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 ni3 de5 zhi2jue2 mei2cuo4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。wo3men5 hui2 jia1 ba1。"

msgid "Let's just get this over with."
msgstr ""
"我们​赶紧​把​这​事儿​了结​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4r5 liao3jie2 ba1。"

msgid "Let's just make sure we don't lose control over this thing!"
msgstr ""
"我们​可​千万别​失去​对​这​玩意儿​的​控制​！\n"
"wo3men5 ke3 qian1 wan4 bie4 shi1qu4 dui4 zhe4 wan2yi4r5 de5 kong4zhi4！"

msgid "Let's just say I get on by trading stories."
msgstr ""
"可以​说​，​我​是​靠​倒卖​情报​谋生​的​。\n"
"ke3yi3 shuo1，wo3 shi4 kao4 dao3mai4 qing2bao4 mou2sheng1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Let's just say that I've had bad luck with underexperienced teammates, and "
"leave it at that."
msgstr ""
"我​以前​和​一帮​菜鸟​队友​合作​的​时候​运气​不好​，​就​说​到​这儿​吧​。\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 he4 yi1 bang1 cai4niao3 dui4you3 he2zuo4 de5 shi2hou5 yun4qi5 bu4hao3，jiu4 shuo1 dao4 zhe4r5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Let's just say those bastards got what they deserved for messing with the "
"Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​吧​，​那帮​混蛋​已经​为​自己​招惹​克洛伊​茨​集市​而​遭到​了​报应​。\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，na4 bang1 hun2dan4 yi3jing1 wei2 zi4ji3 zhao1re3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 er2 zao1dao4 le5 bao4ying4。"

msgid "Let's keep calm, everyone. This is a simple misunderstanding."
msgstr ""
"大家​都​冷静​点​。​这​就是​个​小​误会​。\n"
"da4jia1 dou1 leng3jing4 dian3。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ge4 xiao3 wu4hui4。"

msgid "Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"我们​继续前进​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Let's load the body into the van, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Herr Schmidt won't be happy, but he'll just have to live with that."
msgstr ""
"咱们​把​这具​尸体​塞进​车里​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​施密特​先生​肯定​不会​对此​感到高兴​，​但​他​只能​接受​这个​事实​。\n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 ba3 zhe4 ju4 shi1ti3 se4 jin4 che1 li3 ba1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，dan4 ta1 zhi3neng2 jie1shou4 zhe4ge5 shi4shi2。"

msgid "Let's make 'em pay. For Monika and for Paul. "
msgstr ""
"要​让​他们​付出代价​。​这是​为了​莫妮卡​和保罗​。\n"
"yao4 rang4 ta1men5 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 Mo4ni1ka3 he4 bao3 luo2。"

msgid ""
"Let's move, then. To hell with the cleanup, we'll be gone before anyone "
"notices anything anyway."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​行动​吧​。​不用​管​什么​清理​，​等​有人​注意​到​的​时候​，​我们​早就​远走高飞​了​。\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 xing2dong4 ba1。bu4yong4 guan3 shen2me5 qing1li3，deng3 you3ren2 zhu4yi4 dao4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 zao3jiu4 yuan3zou3gao1fei1 le5。"

msgid "Let's not dwell on it any further."
msgstr ""
"我们​不要​太过​沉湎​其中​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 bu4yao4 tai4guo4 chen2mian3 qi2zhong1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Let's put APEX aside for a minute, Doc. If your Panacea will really "
"exterminate the dragons, then I say go for it. I won't try to stop you."
msgstr ""
"先不说​APEX​的​事​了​，​博士​。​如果​你​的​“​万能​药​”​真能​消灭​巨龙​的话​，​那​我​就​同意​试试​。​我​不会​试图​阻止​你​。\n"
"xian1 bu4 shuo1 APEX de5 shi4 le5，bo2shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4” zhen1 neng2 xiao1mie4 ju4long2 de5hua4，na4 wo3 jiu4 tong2yi4 shi4 shi4。wo3 bu4hui4 shi4tu2 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Let's put an end to all of this. We heal the spirit, and then the cultists.\n"
"\n"
"We send Harrow running and shut this place down."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​结束​这​一切​。​先​净化​精魂​，​然后​救出​那些​教徒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​的​事​就​随​他​去​吧​。​我们​要​关掉​这个​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 jie2shu4 zhe4 yi1qie4。xian1 jing4hua4 jing1hun2，ran2hou4 jiu4chu1 na4xie1 jiao4tu2。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 shi4 jiu4 sui2 ta1 qu4 ba1。wo3men5 yao4 guan1diao4 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"Let's put an end to all of this. We heal the spirit, and then the cultists.\n"
"\n"
"We shut this place down. Harrow lives."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​结束​这​一切​。​先​净化​精魂​，​然后​救出​那些​教徒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​关掉​这个​地方​。​哈罗​的​事​就​随​他​去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 jie2shu4 zhe4 yi1qie4。xian1 jing4hua4 jing1hun2，ran2hou4 jiu4chu1 na4xie1 jiao4tu2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 guan1diao4 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。ha1luo2 de5 shi4 jiu4 sui2 ta1 qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Let's say that I decided to help you. What would you need me to do?"
msgstr ""
"假如​我​决定​帮助​你​，​你​需要​我​做​什么​？\n"
"jia3ru2 wo3 jue2ding4 bang1zhu4 ni3，ni3 xu1yao4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Let's see here... \"override security access :: root command :: trapdoor.\""
msgstr ""
"让​我​看看​……​“​超控​安全​权限​ ​:​:​ ​root​命令​ ​:​:​ ​陷阱​门​。​”\n"
"rang4 wo3 kan4kan5……“chao1 kong4 an1quan2 quan2xian4  :: root ming4ling4  :: xian4jing3 men2。”"

msgid "Let's talk about it later."
msgstr ""
"我们​回头​再说​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui2tou2 zai4shuo1。"

msgid "Let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""
"我们​说点​别的​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 shuo1 dian3 bie2de5 ba1。"

msgid "Let's talk about this."
msgstr ""
"咱们​有事​好​商量​。\n"
"zan2men5 you3shi4 hao3 shang1liang5。"

msgid "Let's talk compensation."
msgstr ""
"我们​来​聊聊​报酬​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 lai2 liao2 liao2 bao4chou5 ba1。"

msgid "Let's talk compensation. What does this gig pay?"
msgstr ""
"我们​来​聊聊​报酬​吧​。​我能​拿到​什么​好处​？\n"
"wo3men5 lai2 liao2 liao2 bao4chou5 ba1。wo3 neng2 na2dao4 shen2me5 hao3chu3？"

msgid "Let's talk later."
msgstr ""
"我们​回头​再聊​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui2tou2 zai4 liao2。"

msgid "Let's talk more another time."
msgstr ""
"我们​回头​再聊​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui2tou2 zai4 liao2。"

msgid "Let's think this through, $(l.name). Be careful."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​得​三思​啊​。​多加​小心​。\n"
"$(l.name)，de2 san1 si1 a1。duo1 jia1 xiao3xin1。"

msgid "Let's think this through, boss. Be careful."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​得​三思​啊​。​多加​小心​。\n"
"lao3da4，de2 san1 si1 a1。duo1 jia1 xiao3xin1。"

msgid "Let's think this through, chief. Be careful."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​得​三思​啊​。​多加​小心​。\n"
"tou2r5，de2 san1 si1 a1。duo1 jia1 xiao3xin1。"

msgid "Let's think this through, fearless leader. Be careful."
msgstr ""
"无畏​领袖​，​得​三思​啊​。​多加​小心​。\n"
"wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4，de2 san1 si1 a1。duo1 jia1 xiao3xin1。"

msgid "Let's try something else."
msgstr ""
"我们​想想​别的​办法​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 xiang3 xiang3 bie2de5 ban4fa3 ba1。"

msgid "Let's."
msgstr ""
"开始​吧​。\n"
"kai1shi3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Let's.\n"
"\n"
"The sooner I'm rid of you people, the better off we'll all be."
msgstr ""
"同感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我越​早能​摆脱​你们​这些​人​，​对​我们​所有人​都​越​好​。\n"
"\n"
"tong2gan3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yue4 zao3 neng2 bai3tuo1 ni3men5 zhe4xie1 ren2，dui4 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Let's. We need intel on the Engineer - where he's staying, who he's working "
"for, how long he's been in Schattennest. Whatever you've got, we want it."
msgstr ""
"好​。​我们​需要​关于​工程师​的​情报​—​—​他​住​在​哪里​，​为​谁​工作​，​以及​他​在​影巢待​了​多久​。​无论​你​有​什么​情报​，​我们​都​想要​。\n"
"hao3。wo3men5 xu1yao4 guan1yu2 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 qing2bao4——ta1 zhu4 zai4 na3li3，wei2 shei2 gong1zuo4，yi3ji2 ta1 zai4 ying3 chao2 dai1 le5 duo1jiu3。wu2lun4 ni3 you3 shen2me5 qing2bao4，wo3men5 dou1 xiang3yao4。"

msgid "Lets get place those cameras and get out of here."
msgstr ""
"我们​赶紧​放置​好​摄像头​然后​离开​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 gan3jin3 fang4zhi4 hao3 she4xiang4tou2 ran2hou4 li2kai1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Lets others know that your totem is power. Grants +1 Charisma, +1 Spirit "
"Summoning, and +1 Spirit Control."
msgstr ""
"让​其他人​知道​你​的​图腾​就是​力量​。​提供​+​1​魅力​，​+​1​精魂​召唤​和​+​1​精魂​控制​。\n"
"rang4 qi2 ta1 ren2 zhi1dao4 ni3 de5 tu2teng2 jiu4shi4 li4liang5。ti2gong1 +1 mei4li4，+1 jing1hun2 zhao4huan4 he4 +1 jing1hun2 kong4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"Lets others know that your totem is power. Grants +1 Spellcasting, +1 "
"Conjuring, and +1 Spirit Control."
msgstr ""
"让​其他人​知道​你​的​图腾​就是​力量​。​提供​+​1​施法​，​+​1​咒术​和​+​1​精魂​控制​。\n"
"rang4 qi2 ta1 ren2 zhi1dao4 ni3 de5 tu2teng2 jiu4shi4 li4liang5。ti2gong1 +1 shi1fa3，+1 zhou4 shu4 he4 +1 jing1hun2 kong4zhi4。"

msgid "Letting her live might have been a good place to start."
msgstr ""
"让​她​活​下来​也许​正是​个​好的开始​。\n"
"rang4 ta1 huo2 xia4lai5 ye3xu3 zheng4shi4 ge4 hao3 de5 kai1 shi3。"

msgid ""
"Letting this bastard go would be *wrong,* $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory's stare bores into Enstad. He recoils under the weight of it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This... *creature*... is the reason why things went south with that run."
msgstr ""
"把​这​混蛋​放走​就是​个​*​错误​*​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​的​目光​如​利刃​般刺​向​恩施​塔德​，​令​他​不由得​有些​畏缩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​……​*​禽兽​*​……​就是​他们​的​差事​失败​的​原因​。\n"
"\n"
"ba3 zhe4 hun2dan4 fang4zou3 jiu4shi4 ge4*cuo4wu4*，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 mu4guang1 ru2 li4ren4 ban1 ci1 xiang4 en1Shi1ta3de2，ling3 ta1 bu4you2de5 you3xie1 wei4suo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5……*qin2shou4*……jiu4shi4 ta1men5 de5 cha4shi4 shi1bai4 de5 yuan2yin1。"

msgid ""
"Let’s assume that we make it across the grounds alive. What about Vauclair?"
msgstr ""
"假设​我们​活着​穿过​了​庄园​外场​。​那沃​克莱尔​呢​？\n"
"jia3she4 wo3men5 huo2zhe5 chuan1guo4 le5 zhuang1yuan2 wai4chang2。na4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Let’s move. I owe Audran a bullet between the eyes, and I mean to pay up."
msgstr ""
"我们​走​吧​。​我​还​欠​奥​德兰​一发​子弹​，​我​打算​兑现​承诺​。\n"
"wo3men5 zou3 ba1。wo3 hai2 qian4 Ao4de2lan2 yi1 fa1 zi3dan4，wo3 da3suan4 dui4xian4 cheng2nuo4。"

msgid ""
"Let’s move. I owe Vauclair a bullet between the eyes, and I mean to pay up."
msgstr ""
