msgid ""
"Lies! Deceit! You seek to deprive us, to remove us, but you cannot! You *will not* separate us from Communion!\n"
"\n"
"It has warned! The Communion told us that the deaf would try and take us. We must resist!"
msgstr ""
"谎言​！​欺骗​！​你​想​剥夺​我们​，​除掉​我们​，​但​你​不能​！​你​*​不能​*​将​我们​与​共融​分开​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​警告​过​！​共融​之声​告诉​我们​，​听不见​的​人会​试图​带走​我们​。​我们​必须​反抗​！\n"
"\n"
"huang3yan2！qi1pian4！ni3 xiang3 bo1duo2 wo3men5，chu2diao4 wo3men5，dan4 ni3 bu4neng2！ni3*bu4neng2*jiang1 wo3men5 yu4 gong4 rong2 fen1kai1！\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jing3gao4 guo4！gong4 rong2 zhi1 sheng1 gao4su4 wo3men5，ting1bu5jian4 de5 ren2 hui4 shi4tu2 dai4zou3 wo3men5。wo3men5 bi4xu1 fan3kang4！"

