"人​活不了​几年​，​拿​去​嗑​药​也​太​浪费​了​。\n"
"ren2 huo2 bu4 le5 ji3nian2，na2 qu4 ke4 yao4 ye3 tai4 lang4fei4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Life kind of sucks right now, but at least nobody is going to make me kill anyone. Uncle D says that it's going to get better, and maybe it will. I dunno.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. What I mostly wanted to say was thanks for not killing me back at the Humanis compound. I had a gun on you, so you totally could have. But you didn't, and I'm really glad about that.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks,\n"
"Alexander"
msgstr ""
"现在​我过​得​有点​惨​，​但​至少​没人​逼​我​去​杀人​。​迪​叔叔​说​一切​会​好​起来​的​，​或许​吧​，​我​也​不​清楚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​我​主要​想​感谢​你​没有​在​人类​至上​主义者​的​据点​杀掉​我​。​当时​我​拿​枪​指着​你​，​你​完全​可以​动手​的​。​但​你​没有​，​我​真的​很​感激​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​，​\n"
"​亚历山大\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3 guo4 de2 you3dian3 can3，dan4 zhi4shao3 mei2 ren2 bi1 wo3 qu4 sha1ren2。di2 shu1shu5 shuo1 yi1qie4 hui4 hao3 qi3lai5 de5，huo4xu3 ba1，wo3 ye3 bu4 qing1chu5。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 zhu3yao4 xiang3 gan3xie4 ni3 mei2you3 zai4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 ju4dian3 sha1diao4 wo3。dang1shi2 wo3 na2 qiang1 zhi3 zhao2 ni3，ni3 wan2quan2 ke3yi3 dong4shou3 de5。dan4 ni3 mei2you3，wo3 zhen1de5 hen3 gan3ji1。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5，\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4"

msgid ""
"Life was good. Easy jobs, regular pay, a reliable crew. But things went south and you had to drop off the grid. Put a bullet in the past and start fresh somewhere new.\n"
"\n"
"The promise of opportunity and anonymity draws you to the free city of Berlin: The Flux-State, a grand experiment in social order. Corporations tread carefully here. Even the great dragon Lofwyr only has so much sway in the constantly evolving power structure of Berlin. The perfect place for a savvy shadowrunner to disappear and begin anew. \n"
"\n"
"And, as luck would have it, home to your old partner-in-crime, Monika Schäfer.\n"
"\n"
"It’s your third run with Monika and her team. An old castle holdfast, one hour east of Berlin, perched on a hill overlooking the countryside. The job is standard smash-and-grab: crack the vault, grab the data, get out in one piece. A mediocre payday, but work is work. As the team gathers for Monika's pre-run briefing, you pause to take in your surroundings..."
msgstr ""
"生活​曾经​很​美好​。​工作​轻松​，​收入​稳定​，​团队​可靠​。​但​天有不测风云​，​在​事态​急转直下​之后​，​你​不得不​选择​背井离乡​，​埋葬​过去​，​换个​地方​重新​开始​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​受​机遇​与​隐姓埋名​的​承诺​吸引​，​你​来到​了​柏林​这座​自由​城​：​这里​被称作​“​动荡​带​”​，​也​是​社会秩序​的​一次​伟大​实验​。​在​此地​，​巨头​企业​也​要​步步为营​。​即便​强大​如​巨龙​洛夫​维尔​，​在​这座​权力​格局​瞬息万变​的​都​市里​，​影响力​也​终有​边界​。​对于​精明​的​暗影​狂奔​者​来说​，​这里​堪称​改头换面​、​重启​人生​的​绝佳​之地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​幸运​的​是​，​这里​正是​你​的​老搭档​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​的​家​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​你​第三次​与​莫妮卡​及其​团队​携手​行动​。​目标​是​一座​古老​城堡​据点​，​位于​柏林​以东​一​小时​车程​处​，​坐落​在​俯瞰​乡村​的​山丘​上​。​差事​不外乎​标准​的​劫案​流程​：​闯入​数据库​，​获取​其中​的​数据​，​然后​全身而退​。​薪水​不高​，​但​工作​就是​工作​。​当​团队​聚集​在​一起​听​莫妮卡​的​行动​前​简报​时​，​你​停下来​观察​周围​的​环境​……\n"
"\n"
"sheng1huo2 ceng2jing1 hen3 mei3hao3。gong1zuo4 qing1song1，shou1ru4 wen3ding4，tuan2dui4 ke3kao4。dan4 tian1 you3 bu4 ce4 feng1 yun2，zai4 shi4tai4 ji2zhuan3zhi2xia4 zhi1hou4，ni3 bu4de2bu4 xuan3ze2 bei4jing3li2xiang1，mai2zang4 guo4qu4，huan4 ge4 di4fang1 chong2xin1 kai1shi3。\n"
"\n"
"shou4 ji1yu4 yu4 yin3xing4mai2ming2 de5 cheng2nuo4 xi1yin3，ni3 lai2dao4 le5 bo2lin2 zhe4 zuo4 zi4you2 cheng2：zhe4li3 bei4 chen4 zuo4“dong4dang4 dai4”，ye3 shi4 she4 hui4 zhi4 xu4 de5 yi1ci4 wei3da4 shi2yan4。zai4 ci3di4，ju4tou2 qi3ye4 ye3 yao4 bu4bu4wei2ying2。ji2bian4 qiang2da4 ru2 ju4long2 Luo4fu1wei2er3，zai4 zhe4 zuo4 quan2li4 ge2ju2 shun4xi1wan4bian4 de5 dou1 shi4li3，ying3xiang3li4 ye3 zhong1 you3 bian1jie4。dui4yu2 jing1ming2 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 lai2 shuo1，zhe4li3 kan1cheng1 gai3tou2huan4mian4、chong2qi3 ren2sheng1 de5 jue2jia1 zhi1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 xing4yun4 de5 shi4，zhe4li3 zheng4shi4 ni3 de5 lao3 da1 dang4 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 de5 jia1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 di4 san1 ci4 yu4 Mo4ni1ka3 ji2qi2 tuan2dui4 xie2shou3 xing2dong4。mu4biao1 shi4 yi1 zuo4 gu3lao3 cheng2bao3 ju4dian3，wei4yu2 bo2lin2 yi3dong1 yi1 xiao3shi2 che1cheng2 chu3，zuo4luo4 zai4 fu3kan4 xiang1cun1 de5 shan1qiu1 shang4。cha4shi4 bu4wai4hu1 biao1zhun3 de5 jie2 an4 liu2cheng2：chuang3ru4 shu4ju4ku4，huo4qu3 qi2zhong1 de5 shu4ju4，ran2hou4 quan2shen1er2tui4。xin1shui3 bu4 gao1，dan4 gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4。dang1 tuan2dui4 ju4ji2 zai4 yi1qi3 ting1 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 xing2dong4 qian2 jian3bao4 shi2，ni3 ting2xia4lai2 guan1cha2 zhou1wei2 de5 huan2jing4……"

