"fu4dai4 shan3dian4 de5 bao4zha4，tong2shi2 zao4cheng2 -1 dian3 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2，mei3 hui2he2 zao4cheng2 -5 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 he4 -1 dian3 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

