"触电​：​每​回合​损失​5​点​生命​值​，​并且​失去​1​点​行动​点​。\n"
"chu4dian4：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 5 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2，bing4qie3 shi1qu4 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。"

msgid ""
"Lights burn in all of the windows, but the streets stand empty.\n"
"\n"
"No shoppers, no pedestrians. Nothing but silence."
msgstr ""
"所有​窗户​都​亮​着​灯​，​但​街道​却​空空如也​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​购物者​，​也​没有​行人​。​只有​一片​寂静​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 chuang1hu5 dou1 liang4 zhao2 deng1，dan4 jie1dao4 que4 kong1kong1ru2ye3。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 gou4 wu4 zhe3，ye3 mei2you3 xing2ren2。zhi3you3 yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。"

msgid ""
"Like I said, only if you've got something juicy for me.\n"
"\n"
"Or if Altuğ wants me to tell you something, but that's rare. "
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​，​除非​你​有​什么​好​东西​作为​交换​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​是​奥图​伊让​我​给​你​递话​，​不过​这种​情况​很少​见​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，chu2fei1 ni3 you3 shen2me5 hao3 dong1xi1 zuo4wei2 jiao1huan4。\n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3 shi4 ao4 tu2 yi1 rang4 wo3 gei3 ni3 di4 hua4，bu4guo4 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 hen3 shao3 jian4。"

msgid ""
"Like I said, we deal with him later. Without his shrine to lean back on, "
"he'll have to re-learn his old tricks, and during that time we can track him"
" down."
msgstr ""
"就​像​我​说​的​，​我们​可以​之后​再​操心​他​的​事​。​没​了​神龛​，​他​只能​重新​捡起​以前​的​老套路​，​而​我们​就​可以​在​这​段时间​追捕​他​。\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 wo3 shuo1 de5，wo3men5 ke3yi3 zhi1hou4 zai4 cao1xin1 ta1 de5 shi4。mei2 le5 shen2kan1，ta1 zhi3neng2 chong2xin1 jian3 qi3 yi3qian2 de5 lao3 tao4 lu4，er2 wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 zai4 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1 zhui1bu3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Like I said, we don't want to hurt anybody. We're just here to have a word with Marta.\n"
"\n"
"Alone."
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​，​我们​不想​伤害​任何人​。​我们​只是​想​和​玛​尔塔​聊上​几句​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​单独​谈话​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，wo3men5 bu4xiang3 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2。wo3men5 zhi3shi4 xiang3 he4 Ma3er3ta3 liao2 shang4 ji1 ju4。\n"
"\n"
"dan1du2 tan2hua4。"

msgid "Like I said. It's the world we live in."
msgstr ""
"我​说​了​，​这​就是​我们​所处​的​世界​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 suo3 chu3 de5 shi4jie4。"

msgid ""
"Like hell you could. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not saying you aren't tough. But a U-Bahn train isn't exactly armored transport. They'd've punched you full of holes before you even reached the platform."
msgstr ""
"才​怪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​倒​不是​说​你​不够​强​，​但​地铁​列车​可不是​装甲​运输车​。​你​还​没​到达​月台​，​他们​就​能​把​你​射成​马蜂窝​。\n"
"\n"
"cai2 guai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dao3 bu4shi4 shuo1 ni3 bu4gou4 jiang4，dan4 di4tie3 lie4che1 ke3bu5shi4 zhuang1jia3 yun4 shu1 che1。ni3 hai2 mei2 dao4da2 yue4tai2，ta1men5 jiu4 neng2 ba3 ni3 she4 cheng2 ma3 feng1 wo1。"

msgid ""
"Like hell you do. I think you get off on this. The *power* of it all. You "
"saved Germany from a dragon once, and it gave you a messiah complex."
msgstr ""
"我信​你​才​怪​。​我​觉得​你​就是​喜欢​这种​感觉​。​掌握​一切​*​权力​*​的​感觉​。​你​曾经​拯救​德国​免于​巨龙​的​威胁​，​这​让​你​产生​了​救世主​情结​。\n"
"wo3 xin4 ni3 cai2 guai4。wo3 jue2de5 ni3 jiu4shi4 xi3huan5 zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2。zhang3wo4 yi1qie4*quan2li4*de5 gan3jue2。ni3 ceng2jing1 zheng3jiu4 de2guo2 mian3yu2 ju4long2 de5 wei1xie2，zhe4 rang4 ni3 chan3sheng1 le5 jiu4shi4zhu3 qing2jie2。"

msgid ""
"Like hell you will! You have trespassed on my sovereign territory and *murdered* my peasantry!\n"
"\n"
"You have invaded my home!"
msgstr ""
"你​休想​！​你​擅闯​我​的​主权​领地​，​还​*​屠杀​*​了​我​的​臣民​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​侵入​了​我​的​家园​！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiu1xiang3！ni3 shan4chuang3 wo3 de5 zhu3quan2 ling3di4，hai2*tu2sha1*le5 wo3 de5 chen2min2！\n"
