msgid ""
"Look - you're not infallible, Doc. You've already made mistakes here, and "
"people died as a result."
msgstr ""
"博士​，​你​也​不是​完美无缺​的​。​你​已经​犯下​了​错误​，​而且​有人​因此​丧生​。\n"
"bo2shi4，ni3 ye3 bu4shi4 wan2mei3wu2que1 de5。ni3 yi3jing1 fan4 xia4 le5 cuo4wu4，er2qie3 you3ren2 yin1ci3 sang4sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Look at me, $(l.name). Take a good, long look.\n"
"\n"
"I was forced to sacrifice my own body in order to escape from this place. To hack away what made me human. And *she's* the one who brought me here."
msgstr ""
"看着​我​，​$(l.name)​。​一点一滴​看​仔细​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​逃离​这个​地方​，​我​被迫​把​自己​的​身体​搞成​这​副​模样​，​割舍​掉​了​那些​作为​人类​保有​的​东西​。​而​这​一切​的​始作俑者​就是​*​她​*​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4 zhao2 wo3，$(l.name)。yi1dian3yi1di1 kan4 zi3xi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 tao2li2 zhe4ge5 di4fang1，wo3 bei4po4 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 shen1ti3 gao3 cheng2 zhe4 fu4 mu2yang4，ge1she3 diao4 le5 na4xie1 zuo4wei2 ren2lei4 bao3you3 de5 dong1xi1。er2 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 shi3zuo4yong3zhe3 jiu4shi4*ta1*。"

