"看清楚​了​。​我​是​游侠​骑士​的​人​，​白痴​。\n"
"kan4 qing1 chu3 le5。wo3 shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 ren2，bai2chi1。"

msgid ""
"Look at yourself. You’re nothing more than the other side of the same coin -"
" those in power manipulating those who aren’t."
msgstr ""
"看看​你​自己​。​你​不过​是​同​一枚​硬币​的​另一面​—​—​身为​掌权者​，​操纵​那些​没有​权力​的​人​。\n"
"kan4kan5 ni3 zi4ji3。ni3 bu4guo4 shi4 tong2 yi1 mei2 ying4bi4 de5 ling4 yi1 mian4——shen1wei2 zhang3 quan2 zhe3，cao1zong4 na4xie1 mei2you3 quan2li4 de5 ren2。"

