"在​垃圾场​寻找​DVD​播放器​。\n"
"zai4 la1 ji1 chang2 xun2zhao3 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4。"

msgid "Look sharp, security... doesn't look like they see us."
msgstr ""
"小心​，​有​安保​人员​……​他们​好像​没​看到​我们​。\n"
"xiao3xin1，you3 an1bao3 ren2yuan2……ta1men5 hao3xiang4 mei2 kan4dao4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"Look who's talking. For all of his faults, Vauclair was a hero. And now he's"
" dead, and it's *your* fault."
msgstr ""
"你​好意思​说​我​吗​。​不管​沃​克莱尔​犯​了​什么​错​，​他​都​是​个​英雄​。​而​现在​他​死​了​，​这笔​帐要​算​在​*​你​的​*​头上​。\n"
"ni3 hao3yi4si5 shuo1 wo3 ma5。bu4guan3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 fan4 le5 shen2me5 cuo4，ta1 dou1 shi4 ge4 ying1xiong2。er2 xian4zai4 ta1 si3 le5，zhe4 bi3 zhang4 yao4 suan4 zai4*ni3 de5*tou2shang4。"

msgid ""
"Look, $(l.man), this is *really* getting old. At this rate, my grandkids "
"will be fast asleep by the time I get back, and that makes me irate."
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​$(l.man)​，​这个​事情​确实​有点烦​人​了​。​照​这​速度​，​等​我​回去​时​我​孙子​们​都​睡着​了​，​这​可​让​我​火大​。\n"
"ting1 zhao2，$(l.man)，zhe4ge5 shi4qing5 que4shi2 you3 dian3 fan2 ren2 le5。zhao4 zhe4 su4du4，deng3 wo3 hui2qu5 shi2 wo3 sun1zi3 men5 dou1 shui4zhao2 le5，zhe4 ke3 rang4 wo3 huo3da4。"

msgid ""
"Look, $(l.man), this is *really* getting old. At this rate, my grandkids will be fast asleep by the time I get back, and that makes me irate.\n"
"\n"
"Now, will you *please* leave that alone so that we can get finished with this? I don't know about you, but I don't like this place, and I don't want to spend the next four hours here."
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​$(l.man)​，​这个​事情​确实​有点烦​人​了​。​照​这​速度​，​等​我​回去​时​我​孙子​们​都​睡着​了​，​这​可​让​我​火大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​不能​别​再​捣乱​了​，​咱们​赶紧​把​这​事儿​了结​？​我​不管​你​怎么​看​，​反正​我​不​喜欢​这​地方​，​也​不想​在​这儿​再耗​上​四个​小时​。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，$(l.man)，zhe4ge5 shi4qing5 que4shi2 you3 dian3 fan2 ren2 le5。zhao4 zhe4 su4du4，deng3 wo3 hui2qu5 shi2 wo3 sun1zi3 men5 dou1 shui4zhao2 le5，zhe4 ke3 rang4 wo3 huo3da4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 bu4neng2 bie4 zai4 dao3luan4 le5，zan2men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4r5 liao3jie2？wo3 bu4guan3 ni3 zen3me5 kan4，fan3zheng4 wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 zhe4 di4fang1，ye3 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4r5 zai4 hao4 shang4 si4 ge4 xiao3shi2。"

msgid ""
"Look, $(l.name). I don't know what those things have told you, but I am "
"*well within* my rights to charge for that material. They've never paid me a"
" *thing* for my services, and--"
msgstr ""
"听​我​说​，​$(l.name)​。​我​不​知道​那些​玩意儿​和​你​说​了​什么​，​但​我​有​*​充分​*​权利​对​这些​材料​进行​收费​。​它们​从没​为​我​的​服务​支付​任何​*​报酬​*​，​而且​—​—\n"
"ting1 wo3 shuo1，$(l.name)。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 na4xie1 wan2yi4r5 he4 ni3 shuo1 le5 shen2me5，dan4 wo3 you3*chong1fen4*quan2li4 dui4 zhe4xie1 cai2liao4 jin4xing2 shou1fei4。ta1men5 cong2mei2 wei2 wo3 de5 fu2wu4 zhi1fu4 ren4he2*bao4chou5*，er2qie3 — —"

msgid ""
"Look, $(l.name). I don't wanna be antisocial, but I've got bags to pack, and better things to do than stand around talkin' to you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He scoops up a handful of simsense chips off of his desk and stuffs them into an oversized pocket.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So, if you don't mind..."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​不是​想​当个​不​合群​的​人​，​但​我​得​收拾​行李​，​还有​更​重要​的​事要​做​，​没空​站​在​这里​跟​你​闲聊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​从​桌面上​抓起​一把​拟感​芯片​，​塞进​一个​超大​的​口袋​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​如果​你​不介意​的话​……\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 bu4shi4 xiang3 dang1 ge4 bu4 he2qun2 de5 ren2，dan4 wo3 de2 shou1shi5 xing2li5，hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 zuo4，mei2 kong1 zhan4 zai4 zhe4li3 gen1 ni3 xian2liao2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 zhuo1 mian4 shang4 zhua1 qi3 yi1 ba3 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4，se4 jin4 yi1ge5 chao1 dai4 de5 kou3dai4 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4……"

msgid ""
"Look, Adrian. I understand you. Lord knows I do. But you've *got* to drop this dragon fixation.\n"
"\n"
"People are starting to talk."
msgstr ""
"阿德里安​，​我​懂​你​，​真的​。​但​你​*​必须​*​得​放下​对​那​巨龙​的​执念​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​人们​已经​开始​说闲话​了​。\n"
"\n"
"E1de2li3an1，wo3 dong3 ni3，zhen1de5。dan4 ni3*bi4xu1*de2 fang4xia4 dui4 na4 ju4long2 de5 zhi2nian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ren2men5 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 shuo1xian2hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Look, Doc, I'm really not much of a researcher. Can't you just sum this "
"stuff up for me?"
msgstr ""
"博士​，​我​不是​什么​研究员​。​你​就​不能​直接​把​结果​告诉​我​吗​？\n"
"bo2shi4，wo3 bu4shi4 shen2me5 yan2jiu1yuan2。ni3 jiu4 bu4neng2 zhi2jie1 ba3 jie1guo3 gao4su4 wo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Look, Duerr, I don't care what your organization's master plan is. Be as "
"nefarious as you want. As long as I get paid, I'll do the work."
msgstr ""
"杜尔​，​我​才​不在乎​你们​组织​有​什么​大​计划​。​想​搞​什么​见不得人​的​勾当​都行​。​只要​给​我​钱​，​活儿​我照​干不误​。\n"
"du4 er3，wo3 cai2 bu4zai4hu5 ni3men5 zu3zhi1 you3 shen2me5 dai4 ji4hua4。xiang3 gao3 shen2me5 jian4bu5de2ren2 de5 gou4dang4 dou1 xing2。zhi3yao4 gei3 wo3 qian2，huo2r5 wo3 zhao4 gan4 bu4 wu4。"

msgid ""
"Look, Eiger. $(l.name)'s right. You *weren't* stuck in that basement with us. You *don't* know how things went down in there.\n"
"\n"
"So do us all a favor and shut it down, okay?"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​$(l.name)​说​得​没错​。​你​*​没​*​跟​我们​一起​待​在​地下室​里​。​你​*​不​*​知道​到底​出​了​什么​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​就​少说两句​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，$(l.name) shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。ni3*mei2*gen1 wo3men5 yi1qi3 dai1 zai4 di4xia4shi4 li3。ni3*bu4*zhi1dao4 dao4di3 chu1 le5 shen2me5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 shao3 shuo1 liang3 ju4，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Look, Eiger. You *weren't* stuck in that basement with us. You *don't* know how things went down in there.\n"
"\n"
"So do us all a favor and shut it down, okay?"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​你​*​没​*​跟​我们​一起​待​在​地下室​里​。​你​*​不​*​知道​到底​出​了​什么​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​就​少说两句​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，ni3*mei2*gen1 wo3men5 yi1qi3 dai1 zai4 di4xia4shi4 li3。ni3*bu4*zhi1dao4 dao4di3 chu1 le5 shen2me5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 shao3 shuo1 liang3 ju4，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Look, I didn't *want* to do it, but it was the job.\n"
"\n"
"But now, I guess that I've tendered my resignation, so I don't have to do that anymore. There are only two people left in this world who need to worry about me shooting them."
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​我​*​没​想​*​这么​做​，​但​这​都​是​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​现在​，​我​想​我​已经​递交​了​辞呈​，​所以​我​不必​再​这么​做​了​。​这​世上​只​剩下​两个​人​需要​担心​我会​开枪​打​他们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3*mei2 xiang3*zhe4me5 zuo4，dan4 zhe4 dou1 shi4 cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4，wo3 xiang3 wo3 yi3jing1 di4jiao1 le5 ci2cheng2，suo3yi3 wo3 bu4bi4 zai4 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。zhe4 shi4shang4 zhi3 sheng4xia4 liang3 ge4 ren2 xu1yao4 dan1xin1 wo3 hui4 kai1qiang1 da3 ta1men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Look, I don't have a choice. I need to get out there. If I don't, some punk "
"gangs are gonna be the least of my problems."
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​我​没得选​，​我​必须​过去​。​否则​的话​，​我要​解决​的​麻烦​可​就​不止​一些​杂鱼​帮派​那么​简单​了​。\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3 mei2 de2 xuan3，wo3 bi4xu1 guo4qu4。fou3ze2 de5hua4，wo3 yao4 jie3jue2 de5 ma2fan5 ke3 jiu4 bu4zhi3 yi1xie1 za2 yu2 bang1pai4 na4me5 jian3dan1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Look, I don't want to give you the third degree, but they've been harping so much about lax security that I have to. \"Everyone do your part,\" and all that. \n"
"\n"
"So I've gotta ask: why are you still in your street clothes? You know how seriously they take the dress code here, especially if you work in one of the server rooms."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不想​在​这​对​你​没完没了​的​，​但​最近​不是​一直​在​强调​安保​松懈​的​问题​吗​，​总说​什么​“​人人​各司其职​”​之类​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我​还是​得​问​：​你​怎么​没换​工作服​？​你​也​知道​这里​的​着装​规范​有​多​严格​，​特别​是​你​还​在​服务器​机房​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4 dui4 ni3 mei2wan2mei2liao3 de5，dan4 zui4jin4 bu4shi4 yi1zhi2 zai4 qiang2diao4 an1bao3 song1xie4 de5 wen4ti2 ma5，zong3 shuo1 shen2me5“ren2ren2 ge4 si1 qi2 zhi2” zhi1lei4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 hai2shi5 de2 wen4：ni3 zen3me5 mei2 huan4 gong1zuo4fu2？ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 zhe4li3 de5 zhuo2zhuang1 gui1fan4 you3 duo1 yan2ge2，te4bie2 shi4 ni3 hai2 zai4 fu2wu4qi4 ji1fang2 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Look, I just clocked out for a soykaf run, but I left my wallet on my desk. "
"I'd rather not have Management see me clock out, then in, and then out again"
" in the space of five minutes... couldn't you do me a favor just this once "
"and hold the door? I'll literally be back in thirty seconds."
msgstr ""
"是​这么回事​，​我刚​打卡​出门​买豆​咖​，​但​我​把​钱包​落​在​办公桌​上​了​。​我​不想​让​管理处​看到​我​在​五分钟​内​打卡​出门​、​进门​，​然后​又​出门​……​就​帮​我​个​忙​，​开下门​好不好​？​我​三十秒​后​就​回来​。\n"
"shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4，wo3 gang1 da3ka3 chu1men2 mai3 dou4 ka1，dan4 wo3 ba3 qian2bao1 la4 zai4 ban4 gong1 zhuo1 shang4 le5。wo3 bu4xiang3 rang4 guan3 li3 chu3 kan4dao4 wo3 zai4 wu3 fen4 zhong1 nei4 da3ka3 chu1men2、jin4men2，ran2hou4 you4 chu1men2……jiu4 bang1 wo3 ge4 mang2，kai1 xia4 men2 hao3bu5hao3？wo3 san1 shi2 miao3 hou4 jiu4 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"Look, I know that you're protective of your past. I can respect that. But "
"something terrible is happening to you, and I can help you if you'll let me."
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​我​知道​你​对​过去​很​敏感​。​我能​理解​。​但​你​正​遭遇​可怕​的​事情​，​而且​只要​你​允许​的话​，​我能​帮到​你​。\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 dui4 guo4qu4 hen3 min3gan3。wo3 neng2 li3jie3。dan4 ni3 zheng1 zao1yu4 ke3pa4 de5 shi4qing5，er2qie3 zhi3yao4 ni3 yun3xu3 de5hua4，wo3 neng2 bang1 dao4 ni3。"

msgid "Look, I lost my ID. Perhaps we could come to some... arrangement?"
msgstr ""
"我​把​证件​丢​了​。​也许​我们​可以​……​商量一下​？\n"
"wo3 ba3 zheng4jian4 diu1 le5。ye3xu3 wo3men5 ke3yi3……shang1 liang2 yi1 xia4？"

msgid "Look, I really need to get through here. Would you mind...?"
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​我​真得​过去​一趟​。​能​不能​行个​方便​……​？\n"
"bai4tuo1，wo3 zhen1 de2 guo4qu4 yi1 tang1。neng2 bu4neng2 xing2 ge4 fang1bian4……？"

msgid ""
"Look, I'm sorry... I left my card on my desk. Couldn't you just let me in?"
msgstr ""
"不好意思​……​我​把​卡落​在​桌子​上​了​。​你​就​不能​让​我​进去​吗​？\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5……wo3 ba3 ka3 la4 zai4 zhuo1zi5 shang4 le5。ni3 jiu4 bu4neng2 rang4 wo3 jin4qu4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Look, are you sure that you can't open that door? We'll only be a second."
msgstr ""
"这个​，​你​确定​你​不能​把门​打开​吗​？​我们​只要​一下下​就​好​。\n"
"zhe4ge5，ni3 que4ding4 ni3 bu4neng2 ba3men2 da3kai1 ma5？wo3men5 zhi3yao4 yi1 xia4 xia4 jiu4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Look, boss... I just wanted to thank you for bringing me along on this one.\n"
"\n"
"It means a lot."
msgstr ""
"嘿​，​老大​……​谢谢​你​这次​行动​带上​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​对​我​来说​很​重要​。\n"
"\n"
"hei1，lao3da4……xie4xie5 ni3 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 dai4shang4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"Look, buddy, I just set up the Matrix security for the thing. The old boss didn't let me set foot into the vault. He was a little paranoid, you know? \n"
"\n"
"But he was adamant that he wanted me to rig up some really killer IC, so there must be *something* of value in there."
msgstr ""
"伙计​，​我​只​负责​架设​矩阵​的​安保​措施​而已​。​老大​根本​就​不让​我进​保险库​。​他​有​那么​点​疑心病​的​，​你​明白​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​他​态度​可​坚决​了​，​一定​要​我​搞​点​能​弄死​人​的​IC​，​所以​里头​肯定​有​*​什么​*​贵重​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"huo3ji5，wo3 zhi3 fu4ze2 jia4she4 ju3zhen4 de5 an1bao3 cuo4shi1 er2yi3。lao3da4 gen1ben3 jiu4 bu4 rang4 wo3 jin4 bao3 xian3 ku4。ta1 you3 na4me5 dian3 yi2 xin1 bing4 de5，ni3 ming2bai5 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 ta1 tai4du5 ke3 jian1jue2 le5，yi1ding4 yao4 wo3 gao3 dian3 neng2 nong4si3 ren2 de5 IC，suo3yi3 li3tou5 ken3ding4 you3*shen2me5*gui4zhong4 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Look, do you know Monika?"
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​你​认识​莫妮卡​吗​？\n"
"ting1 zhao2，ni3 ren4shi5 Mo4ni1ka3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Look, do you wanna do this thing, or do you wanna stand around talking about"
" it?"
msgstr ""
"你​到底​是​要​干成​这笔​买卖​，​还是​要​在​这​来回​说个​没完​？\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 shi4 yao4 gan4 cheng2 zhe4 bi3 mai3mai4，hai2shi5 yao4 zai4 zhe4 lai2hui2 shuo1 ge4 mei2 wan2？"

msgid ""
"Look, how much will it cost me to get you to step away from that alarm? I "
"can pay."
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​我要​花​多少​钱​才能​让​你​别碰​警报​？​说​个数​吧​。\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3 yao4 hua1 duo1shao3 qian2 cai2neng2 rang4 ni3 bie4 peng4 jing3bao4？shuo1 ge4shu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Look, if you're looking for the Rabengeister... \n"
"\n"
"Try the old information kiosk on the other side of the market. I've seen some people coming and going through there."
msgstr ""
"对​了​，​如果​你​要​找​“​鸦灵​”​的话​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​市场​远处​的​旧​信息​亭​看看​吧​。​我见​那里​有人​进进出出​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 zhao3“Ya1ling2” de5hua4……\n"
"\n"
"qu4 shi4chang3 yuan3chu4 de5 jiu4 xin4xi1 ting2 kan4kan5 ba1。wo3 jian4 na4li5 you3ren2 jin4 jin4 chu1 chu1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Look, it's going to be fine. Even if Management does get uptight, I'll be "
"the one who gets in trouble, and it's not like they're going to fire me. "
"Just stand aside and let us through."
msgstr ""
"放心​，​不会​有事​的​。​就算​管理处​要​发火​，​也​顶多​是​和​我​过不去​，​再说​他们​是​不会​开除​我​的​。​麻烦​你​行个​方便​，​让​我们​过去​吧​。\n"
"fang4xin1，bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。jiu4suan4 guan3 li3 chu3 yao4 fa1huo3，ye3 ding3duo1 shi4 he4 wo3 guo4bu5qu4，zai4shuo1 ta1men5 shi4 bu4hui4 kai1chu2 wo3 de5。ma2fan5 ni3 xing2 ge4 fang1bian4，rang4 wo3men5 guo4qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Look, just be calm, my friend."
msgstr ""
"冷静​点​，​朋友​。\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"Look, just think of it like farming, right? If we look after our crops, we'll always have food to eat. We have enough supplies on hand to keep the tissue cultures in the OrgChem Wing growing indefinitely.\n"
"\n"
"What I'm talking about is growing meat for our own survival. That's all it is."
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​把​它​想象​成​农耕​就​好​了​，​对​吧​？​只要​我们​照料​好​作物​，​就​永远​有​东西​吃​。​我们​手头​的​物资​足够​让​有机化学​区​的​组织培养​物​无限生长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说​的​是​为了​生存​而​培育​肉类​，​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，ba3 ta1 xiang3xiang4 cheng2 nong2geng1 jiu4 hao3 le5，dui4 ba1？zhi3yao4 wo3men5 zhao4liao4 hao3 zuo4wu4，jiu4 yong3yuan3 you3 dong1xi1 chi1。wo3men5 shou3tou2 de5 wu4zi1 zu2gou4 rang4 you3ji1hua4xue2 qu1 de5 zu3zhi1pei2yang3 wu4 wu2 xian4 sheng1 zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de5 shi4 wei4le5 sheng1cun2 er2 pei2yu4 rou4lei4，jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid "Look, lady. We're just trying to keep our business running."
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​我们​只是​想​努力​维持​营业​而已​。\n"
"bai4tuo1，wo3men5 zhi3shi4 xiang3 nu3li4 wei2chi2 ying2ye4 er2yi3。"

msgid "Look, let's just get on with it."
msgstr ""
"我们​还是​赶紧​把​事​办完​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 hai2shi5 gan3jin3 ba3 shi4 ban4 wan2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Look, man, I don't care what sort of business you're into. I just want to "
"get out of here."
msgstr ""
"伙计​，​我​不在乎​你​要​做​什么​生意​。​我​只​想​离开​这里​。\n"
"huo3ji5，wo3 bu4zai4hu5 ni3 yao4 zuo4 shen2me5 sheng1yi4。wo3 zhi3 xiang3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid "Look, man. I don't want to hassle you. I just want to get out of here."
msgstr ""
"伙计​，​我​并​不想​折腾​你​。​我​只​想​离开​这里​。\n"
"huo3ji5，wo3 bing4 bu4xiang3 zhe1teng5 ni3。wo3 zhi3 xiang3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Look, man. I just need to get into the basement, and I don't have time to "
"explain why. Can you help me, or not?"
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​伙计​。​我​只​需要​进入​地下室​，​而且​我​没​时间​解释​原因​。​你​到底​能​不能​帮​我​？\n"
"ting1 zhao2，huo3ji5。wo3 zhi3 xu1yao4 jin4ru4 di4xia4shi4，er2qie3 wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 jie3shi4 yuan2yin1。ni3 dao4di3 neng2 bu4neng2 bang1 wo3？"

msgid "Look, man. We're just trying to keep our business running."
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​我们​只是​想​努力​维持​营业​而已​。\n"
"bai4tuo1，wo3men5 zhi3shi4 xiang3 nu3li4 wei2chi2 ying2ye4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"Look, pal. *You* are a security guard. *I* am a technician.\n"
"\n"
"And for the last time, I'm telling you, this was NOT. MY. FAULT."
msgstr ""
"伙计​，​*​你​*​只是​个​警卫​，​*​我​*​才​是​技术人员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​最后​再说​一次​。​这​。​不​。​怪​。​我​。\n"
"\n"
"huo3ji5，*ni3*zhi3shi4 ge4 jing3wei4，*wo3*cai2 shi4 ji4shu4ren2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4hou4 zai4shuo1 yi1ci4。zhe4。bu4。guai4。wo3。"

msgid ""
"Look, there aren't any spirits here... not anymore. You can go rejoin the "
"Communion, if that's what you want."
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​这里​没有​精魂​……​现在​没有​了​。​如果​你​愿意​的话​，​那​你​可以​回归​共融​了​。\n"
"ting1 zhao2，zhe4li3 mei2you3 jing1hun2……xian4zai4 mei2you3 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，na4 ni3 ke3yi3 hui2gui1 gong4 rong2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Look, there's no need for bloodshed. I'll tell you what. \n"
"\n"
"It seems like you know what it's like to look out for a kiez like this. It's not easy, right? We provide for these people. A haul like that shipment keeps Gesundbrunnen from going hungry just a little while longer. It's our home. These are *our* people. \n"
"\n"
"I suspect you feel the same about the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"这样​吧​，​我​觉得​没有​必要​在​这里​大打出手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​应该​知道​照顾​这样​一个​街区​是​什么​滋味​。​谁​都​不​容易​，​对​不​对​？​我们​供养​这些​人​，​像​这样​一批​物资​能​让​健康​泉多​坚持​一阵子​。​这里​是​我们​的​家​。​这些​都​是​*​我们​*​的​人民​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​你​对​克洛伊​茨​集市​并​没有​这样​的​感情​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1，wo3 jue2de5 mei2you3 bi4yao4 zai4 zhe4li3 da4da3chu1shou3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 zhi1dao4 zhao4gu5 zhe4yang4 yi1ge5 jie1qu1 shi4 shen2me5 zi1wei4。shei2 dou1 bu4 rong2yi4，dui4 bu4 dui4？wo3men5 gong1yang3 zhe4xie1 ren2，xiang4 zhe4yang4 yi1 pi1 wu4zi1 neng2 rang4 jian4kang1 quan2 duo1 jian1chi2 yi1zhen4zi5。zhe4li3 shi4 wo3men5 de5 jia1。zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4*wo3men5*de5 ren2min2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ni3 dui4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 bing4 mei2you3 zhe4yang4 de5 gan3qing2。"

msgid ""
"Look, this is getting old. We have work to do, and you're keeping us from "
"it. Just hold the damned door and let us get back to our jobs, okay?"
msgstr ""
"我​已经​说烦​了​。​我们​还有​工作​要​做​，​而​你​一直​拦着​我们​。​赶紧​把门​打开​，​让​我们​回到​工作岗位​上​，​懂​了​吗​？\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 shuo1 fan2 le5。wo3men5 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4，er2 ni3 yi1zhi2 lan2 zhao2 wo3men5。gan3jin3 ba3men2 da3kai1，rang4 wo3men5 hui2dao4 gong1 zuo4 gang3 wei4 shang4，dong3 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Look, this won't--"
msgstr ""
"听​着​，​这​没​—​—\n"
"ting1 zhao2，zhe4 mei2 — —"

msgid ""
"Look, what does it matter to you if I WAS a member of Schwarze Herzen? I'm sure that you have some shady friends, too, but I'm not gonna ask about 'em 'cause it's none of my business. \n"
"\n"
"Let's just clean out the safe and get out of here, okay?"
msgstr ""
"不是​，​就算​我​以前​是​“​黑心​”​的​人​，​这​对​你​来说​重要​吗​？​我​看​你​的​朋友​也​不​都​是​那么​光明正大​吧​，​但是​我​可​不会​问东问西​的​，​因为​不关​我​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​能​不能​赶紧​把​保险库​搬空​，​然后​从​这​撤出去​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4，jiu4suan4 wo3 yi3qian2 shi4“hei1xin1” de5 ren2，zhe4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 zhong4yao4 ma5？wo3 kan4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 ye3 bu4 dou1 shi4 na4me5 guang1ming2zheng4da4 ba1，dan4shi4 wo3 ke3 bu4hui4 wen4 dong1 wen4 xi1 de5，yin1wei4 bu4 guan1 wo3 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 neng2 bu4neng2 gan3jin3 ba3 bao3 xian3 ku4 ban1 kong1，ran2hou4 cong2 zhe4 che4 chu1 qu4？"

msgid ""
"Look, you can stand there accusing me of being a bad shadowrunner if you "
"want - I won't argue with you. But you're wasting time, and the others are "
"doing God knows what in that building without us."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​继续​站​在​这里​，​说​我​是​个​不称职​的​暗影​狂奔​者​，​我​不会​和​你​争​的​。​但​如果​你​非要​浪费时间​的话​，​天知道​里面​的​人会​惹出​什么​乱子​。\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 ji4xu4 zhan4 zai4 zhe4li3，shuo1 wo3 shi4 ge4 bu4 chen4 zhi2 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，wo3 bu4hui4 he4 ni3 zheng1 de5。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 fei1yao4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1 de5hua4，tian1 zhi1 dao4 li3mian4 de5 ren2 hui4 re3 chu1 shen2me5 luan4zi5。"

msgid "Look, you wanna get out of my way? I've got a job to do."
msgstr ""
"能​不能​让​我​过去​？​我​还有​工作​要​做​。\n"
"neng2 bu4neng2 rang4 wo3 guo4qu4？wo3 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Look, you wanna step out of my way? I need to jack in to that console behind"
" you and verify that the patch is ready for release."
msgstr ""
"能​不能​让​我​过去​？​我​得​接入​你​身后​的​控制台​，​验证​补丁​已经​可以​发布​了​。\n"
"neng2 bu4neng2 rang4 wo3 guo4qu4？wo3 de2 jie1ru4 ni3 shen1hou4 de5 kong4zhi4tai2，yan4zheng4 bu3ding5 yi3jing1 ke3yi3 fa1bu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Look. I can see that you're skeptical... I get that. Can't blame you for it, either. You don't know me from Adam.\n"
"\n"
"But I know one thing that you *will* understand. I'd like to offer you a trade."
msgstr ""
"我​看得出​你​有所​怀疑​……​我​理解​。​这​也​不能​怪​你​，​毕竟​你​根本​就​不​认识​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​就​换个​你​肯定​*​能​*​理解​的​说法​吧​。​我​想​和​你​做​笔​交易​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4de5chu1 ni3 you3suo3 huai2yi2……wo3 li3jie3。zhe4 ye3 bu4neng2 guai4 ni3，bi4jing4 ni3 gen1ben3 jiu4 bu4 ren4shi5 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 huan4 ge4 ni3 ken3ding4*neng2*li3jie3 de5 shuo1fa3 ba1。wo3 xiang3 he4 ni3 zuo4 bi3 jiao1yi4。"

msgid ""
"Look. I get why you handed the MKVI over. It was the job, after all.\n"
"\n"
"But I'd've been a *lot* happier if you'd killed that thing."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​你​为什么​把​MKVI​交出去​。​毕竟​这是​客户​的​要求​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​你​能​让​那家伙​解脱​的话​，​我​肯定​会​开心​*​许多​*​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 wei4shen2me5 ba3 MKVI jiao1 chu1 qu4。bi4jing4 zhe4 shi4 ke4hu4 de5 yao1qiu2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 rang4 na4 jia1 huo3 jie3tuo1 de5hua4，wo3 ken3ding4 hui4 kai1xin1*xu3duo1*。"

msgid ""
"Look. I'll tell you what. If you want a room and you can pay - and I mean PAY - go talk to Frank. He can hook you up.\n"
"\n"
"Just don't go putting a hex on me or anything, okay?"
msgstr ""
"这样​吧​，​我​给你个​建议​。​你​要是​想开​个​房间​，​而且​你​能付​得​起​钱​—​—​我​是​说​能​掏​一大笔​那种​—​—​那​就​去​跟​弗兰克​谈谈​。​他​能​给​你​安排​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​对​我​下​咒​或者​什么​别的​玩意​，​行​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1，wo3 gei3 ni3 ge4 jian4yi4。ni3 yao4shi5 xiang3kai1 ge4 fang2jian1，er2qie3 ni3 neng2 fu4 de2 qi3 qian2——wo3 shi4 shuo1 neng2 tao1 yi1 dai4 bi3 na4zhong3——na4 jiu4 qu4 gen1 fu2lan2ke4 tan2tan2。ta1 neng2 gei3 ni3 an1pai2。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dui4 wo3 xia4 zhou4 huo4zhe3 shen2me5 bie2de5 wan2yi4，xing2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Look. I've been here for 36 hours, and I was supposed to clock out 45 minutes ago.\n"
"\n"
"Do you need something from me? Because if you don't, I'm out of here."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​我​已经​在​这里​待​了​36​个​小时​，​而​我​45​分钟​前​就​可以​打卡​下班​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有​什么​事​吗​？​没事​的话​我​就​走​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，wo3 yi3jing1 zai4 zhe4li3 dai1 le5 36 ge4 xiao3shi2，er2 wo3 45 fen1zhong1 qian2 jiu4 ke3yi3 da3ka3 xia4ban1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？mei2shi4 de5hua4 wo3 jiu4 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Look. In the end, it doesn't matter.\n"
"\n"
"I have to be on this run, and you have to bring me along.\n"
"\n"
"It's what *they* want."
msgstr ""
"说到底​，​这些​都​没什么​大不了​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​参加​这趟​差事​，​你​得​带上​我​一​起来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​*​他们​*​的​要求​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1dao4di3，zhe4xie1 dou1 mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 can1jia1 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4，ni3 de2 dai4shang4 wo3 yi1 qi3lai5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4*ta1men5*de5 yao1qiu2。"

msgid ""
"Looking down into those huge brown eyes, you see intelligence and sadness.\n"
"\n"
"He lets out a small whine and rubs his head against you."
msgstr ""
"俯视​那​对​棕色​的​大​眼睛​，​你​从中​看到​了​智慧​与​悲伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​发出​一声​呜咽​，​开始​用头​蹭​你​。\n"
"\n"
"fu3shi4 na4 dui4 zong1se4 de5 dai4 yan3jing5，ni3 cong2zhong1 kan4dao4 le5 zhi4hui4 yu4 bei1shang1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 wu1ye4，kai1shi3 yong4 tou2 ceng4 ni3。"

msgid "Looking for some backup? It's just us here, friend."
msgstr ""
"想​找​帮手​？​这里​就​咱们​俩​，​朋友​。\n"
"xiang3 zhao3 bang1shou5？zhe4li3 jiu4 zan2men5 lia3，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"Looking up, you can see a great smear of gore on the door of the room that you found him in.\n"
"\n"
"The implications are clear: this man bashed his own head in trying to get out, and he did it with a smile on his face."
msgstr ""
"抬头​望去​，​你​可以​看到​他​所在​的​房间​门上​有​一大块​血迹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​情况​一目了然​：​这个​人​为了​逃出去​，​用​自己​的​头​撞​开了门​，​而且​他​脸上​还​带​着​微笑​。\n"
"\n"
"tai2tou2 wang4 qu4，ni3 ke3yi3 kan4dao4 ta1 suo3zai4 de5 fang2jian1 men2 shang4 you3 yi1 dai4 kuai4 xue4ji4。\n"
"\n"
"qing2kuang4 yi1mu4liao3ran2：zhe4ge5 ren2 wei4le5 tao2 chu1 qu4，yong4 zi4ji3 de5 tou2 zhuang4 kai1 le5 men2，er2qie3 ta1 lian3 shang4 hai2 dai4 zhao2 wei1xiao4。"

msgid "Looks like APEX did what it promised."
msgstr ""
"看起来​APEX​做​了​它​承诺​的​事情​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 APEX zuo4 le5 ta1 cheng2nuo4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "Looks like I asked the right person. You have insight?"
msgstr ""
"看来​我​问​对​人​了​。​你​有​什么​独特​见解​吗​？\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3 wen4 dui4 ren2 le5。ni3 you3 shen2me5 du2te4 jian4jie3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Looks like I was wrong. The Azzies *are* bogeymen, just like the stories say.\n"
"\n"
"It's enough to make a man rethink some things."
msgstr ""
"看来​是​我​错​了​。​故事​里​说​的​没错​，​阿兹佬​*​就是​*​一群​恶魔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​足以​让​人​重新​思考​某些​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 shi4 wo3 cuo4 le5。gu4shi4 li3 shuo1 de5 mei2cuo4，e1 zi1 lao3*jiu4shi4*yi1 qun2 e4mo2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zu2yi3 rang4 ren2 chong2xin1 si1kao3 mou3xie1 shi4qing5。"

msgid "Looks like Marta has some new recruits."
msgstr ""
"看起来​玛​尔塔​已经​招募​了​一些​新​成员​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 Ma3er3ta3 yi3jing1 zhao1mu4 le5 yi1xie1 xin1 cheng2yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Looks like a sort of a persona non grata list for the Landenberg Ring. Everyone on here is listed as \"shoot on sight.\"\n"
"\n"
"There are a lot of names here... lots of personal information, too. Known associates, credit history, holopics, that kind of thing."
msgstr ""
"看起来​像是​兰​登堡​帮​的​不​受欢迎​人物​名单​。​上面​的​所有​人均​标注​为​“​格杀勿论​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​名单​上列​着​大量​姓名​……​还有​许多​个人信息​。​包括​关联​人员​、​信用​记录​、​全息​照片​之类​的​内容​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5 bu4 shou4huan1ying2 ren2wu4 ming2dan1。shang4mian4 de5 suo3you3 ren2jun1 biao1zhu4 wei2“ge2sha1wu4lun4”。\n"
"\n"
"ming2dan1 shang4 lie4 zhao2 da4liang4 xing4ming2……hai2you3 xu3duo1 ge4 ren2 xin4 xi1。bao1kuo4 guan1lian2 ren2yuan2、xin4yong4 ji4lu4、quan2xi1 zhao4pian4 zhi1lei4 de5 nei4rong2。"

msgid ""
"Looks like both walls gave way, and they took the roof with them. The entire"
" hallway is blocked with debris."
msgstr ""
"看来​两​堵墙​都​倒塌​了​，​连带​屋顶​一起​。​整条​过道​都​被​瓦砾​堵塞​了​。\n"
"kan4lai5 liang3 du3 qiang2 dou1 dao3ta1 le5，lian2dai4 wu1ding3 yi1qi3。zheng3tiao2 guo4dao4 dou1 bei4 wa3li4 du3se4 le5。"

msgid "Looks like he convulsed hard enough to break his own spine."
msgstr ""
"他​似乎​是​痉挛​得​太​厉害​，​导致​脊柱​折断​了​。\n"
"ta1 si4hu1 shi4 jing4luan2 de2 tai4 li4hai5，dao3zhi4 ji3zhu4 zhe2duan4 le5。"

msgid "Looks like she's brain-locked."
msgstr ""
"看来​她​陷入​了​思维​僵局​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ta1 xian4ru4 le5 si1wei2 jiang1ju2。"

msgid "Looks like some squatters are living in this station."
msgstr ""
"看起来​有些​人​擅自​占用​了​这个​站点​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 ren2 shan4zi4 zhan4yong4 le5 zhe4ge5 zhan4dian3。"

msgid ""
"Looks like the part that you \"borrowed\" from Parson is acting as your "
"datajack signal converter. I think that I can cobble you a replacement, but "
"I'll need a signal regulator to modify... and you don't seem to have any "
"spares on hand."
msgstr ""
"看起来​你​从​帕森​那里​“​借来​”​的​零件​正在​充当​你​的​数据​插口​信号​转换器​。​我​觉得​我能​给​你​凑个​替代品​，​但​需要​一个​信号​调节器​用来​改装​……​而​你​手头​似乎​没有​备用​件​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 ni3 cong2 pa4 sen1 na4li5“jie4 lai2” de5 ling2jian4 zheng4zai4 chong1dang1 ni3 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 xin4hao4 zhuan3huan4qi4。wo3 jue2de5 wo3 neng2 gei3 ni3 cou4 ge4 ti4dai4pin3，dan4 xu1yao4 yi1ge5 xin4hao4 tiao2jie2qi4 yong4lai2 gai3zhuang1……er2 ni3 shou3tou2 si4hu1 mei2you3 bei4yong4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"Looks like they know they can't depend on APEX to be their watchdog anymore."
" Someone manually locked the door."
msgstr ""
"看来​他们​知道​不能​再​依赖​APEX​来看​门​了​。​有人​手动​锁上​了​门​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ta1men5 zhi1dao4 bu4neng2 zai4 yi1lai4 APEX lai2 kan4 men2 le5。you3ren2 shou3dong4 suo3shang4 le5 men2。"

msgid ""
"Looks like we have a new target, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"We're not being hunted by Feuerschwinge. We're being hunted by Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"看起来​我们​有​了​新​的​目标​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​追杀​我们​的​不是​火翼​，​而是​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 wo3men5 you3 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"zhui1sha1 wo3men5 de5 bu4shi4 Huo3yi4，er2shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid "Looks like we're both carrying heavy burdens."
msgstr ""
"看来​我们​都​背负着​重担​。\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3men5 dou1 bei1 fu4 zhao2 zhong4dan4。"

msgid "Looks like we're gonna have to fight our way out."
msgstr ""
"看来​我们​得​杀出​一条​血路​了​。\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3men5 de2 sha1 chu1 yi1 tiao2 xue4lu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Looks like we've got a new target, boss. If Vauclair is the one who's after us, then Vauclair is the one we need to take down.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Damn it. I was really looking forward to killing a dragon."
msgstr ""
"看起来​我们​有​了​新​的​目标​，​老大​。​如果​追杀​我们​的​是​沃​克莱尔​，​那​我们​就​得​干掉​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​。​我​本来​很​期待​杀死​一头​巨龙​的​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 wo3men5 you3 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1，lao3da4。ru2guo3 zhui1sha1 wo3men5 de5 shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 de2 gan4diao4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3。wo3 ben3lai2 hen3 qi1dai4 sha1si3 yi1tou2 ju4long2 de5。"

msgid "Looks like you drew the short straw on team assignments, friend."
msgstr ""
"看来​你​在​分组​抽签​时​抽到​了​最烂​的​签​，​朋友​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 zai4 fen1zu3 chou1qian1 shi2 chou1 dao4 le5 zui4 lan4 de5 qian1，peng2you5。"

msgid "Looks like you got yourself a hellhound."
msgstr ""
"看来​你​有​了​一条​地狱​猎犬​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 you3 le5 yi1 tiao2 di4yu4 lie4quan3。"

msgid ""
"Looks secure.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She examines the heavy door, scowling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I might be able to blast it open with a controlled explosive, but that'd spook anyone inside."
msgstr ""
"看起来​安全措施​很​严密​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​皱眉​盯​着​沉重​的​大门​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也许​可以​用​一点​控制​炸药​把​它​炸开​，​但​这​肯定​会​惊到​里面​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 an1quan2cuo4shi1 hen3 yan2mi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4mei2 ding1 zhao2 chen2zhong4 de5 da4men2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3xu3 ke3yi3 yong4 yi1dian3 kong4zhi4 zha4yao4 ba3 ta1 zha2 kai1，dan4 zhe4 ken3ding4 hui4 jing1 dao4 li3mian4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Looks that way. And when I find him, I'm sure as hell going to find out why."
msgstr ""
"看起来​是​这样​。​等​我​找到​他​，​我​一定​会查​个​水落石出​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。deng3 wo3 zhao3dao4 ta1，wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 cha2 ge4 shui3luo4shi2chu1。"

msgid ""
"Looming above you is a fortresslike, seemingly impregnable facility. The "
"windows have been shuttered with enormous steel panels, lending the entire "
"building a sinister appearance."
msgstr ""
"一座​看似​坚不可摧​的​堡垒​般的​设施​耸立​在​你​头顶​。​巨大​的​钢板​将​窗户​严严实实​封死​，​使​整栋​建筑​显得​阴森可怖​。\n"
"yi1 zuo4 kan4si4 jian1bu4ke3cui1 de5 bao3lei3 ban1 de5 she4shi1 song3li4 zai4 ni3 tou2ding3。ju4da4 de5 gang1ban3 jiang1 chuang1hu5 yan2yan2shi2shi2 feng1 si3，shi3 zheng3 dong4 jian4zhu4 xian3de5 yin1 sen1 ke3 bu4。"

msgid "Loose Vent"
msgstr ""
"松动​的​通风口\n"
"song1dong4 de5 tong1feng1kou3"

msgid "Loot the Vault"
msgstr ""
"洗劫​保险库\n"
"xi3jie2 bao3 xian3 ku4"

msgid ""
"Losing people is hard. No denying it. Paul was a good one and will be "
"missed."
msgstr ""
"失去​亲友​总是​令人​心碎​，​这​一点​无可否认​。​保罗​是​个​好人​，​我们​会​永远​怀念​他​。\n"
"shi1qu4 qin1you3 zong3shi4 ling4ren2 xin1sui4，zhe4 yi1dian3 wu2 ke3 fou3 ren4。bao3luo2 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2，wo3men5 hui4 yong3yuan3 huai2nian4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Lost the legs during the first Euro War, if you must know. In a bombing."
msgstr ""
"我​这​双腿​是​在​第一次​欧陆​大战​的​时候​被​炸断​的​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4 shuang1tui3 shi4 zai4 di4yi1ci4 ou1 liu4 da4zhan4 de5 shi2hou5 bei4 zha2 duan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Lost. Feuerschwinge is lost. There will be no long slumber. The world is "
"dead now. Feuerschwinge is dead."
msgstr ""
"输​了​。​火翼输​了​。​不再​有​长眠​。​世界​已死​。​火翼​已​死​。\n"
"shu1 le5。Huo3yi4 shu1 le5。bu4zai4 you3 chang2mian2。shi4jie4 yi3 si3。Huo3yi4 yi3 si3。"

msgid "Lost: "
msgstr ""
"已​失去​：\n"
"yi3 shi1qu4："

msgid "Lovely day, isn't it?"
msgstr ""
"今天天气​不错​啊​？\n"
"jin1 tian1 tian1 qi4 bu4cuo4 a1？"

msgid "Low tech opens up so many possibilities."
msgstr ""
"低​科技含量​开辟​了​众多​可能性​。\n"
"di1 ke1 ji4 han2 liang2 kai1pi4 le5 zhong4duo1 ke3neng2xing4。"

msgid "Low tech opens up so many possibilities. May do additional AP DMG."
msgstr ""
"低​科技含量​开辟​了​众多​可能性​。​命中​后​可能​会​造成​额外​的​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"di1 ke1 ji4 han2 liang2 kai1pi4 le5 zhong4duo1 ke3neng2xing4。ming4zhong4 hou4 ke3neng2 hui4 zao4cheng2 e2wai4 de5 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid "Lower your weapons, girls. We have a guest."
msgstr ""
"放下​枪​，​姑娘​们​，​有​客人​来​了​。\n"
"fang4xia4 qiang1，gu1niang5 men5，you3 ke4ren2 lai2 le5。"

msgid "Luca Duerr"
msgstr ""
"卢卡​·​杜尔\n"
"lu2ka3 · du4 er3"

msgid ""
"Luckily, I've got a *plan.* I know how to get myself out of hot water with "
"Meat Grinder - I've got it all specced out."
msgstr ""
"还好​我​有​个​计划​。​我​知道​如何​让​我​自己​脱离​“​绞肉机​”​追债​的​困境​—​—​我​全都​盘算​好​了​。\n"
"hai2hao3 wo3 you3 ge4 ji4hua4。wo3 zhi1dao4 ru2he2 rang4 wo3 zi4ji3 tuo1li2“jiao3rou4ji1” zhui1zhai4 de5 kun4jing4——wo3 quan2dou1 pan2suan4 hao3 le5。"

msgid "Lucky Strike"
msgstr ""
"幸运星\n"
"Xing4yun4xing1"

msgid ""
"Lucky Strike raises an eyebrow at your approach. A burning cigarette dangles"
" between the fingers of her right hand, and she holds a glass of scotch in "
"her left."
