"Makes a friendly target extremely difficult to hit and increases Movement by"
" 2. Lasts until the beginning of your next turn."
msgstr ""
"使​友方​目标​更​难以​被​命中​，​并​增加​2​点​移动力​。​持续​到​你​的​下​一个​回合​开始​。\n"
"shi3 you3 fang1 mu4biao1 geng1 nan2yi3 bei4 ming4zhong4，bing4 zeng1jia1 2 dian3 yi2 dong4 li4。chi2xu4 dao4 ni3 de5 xia4 yi1ge5 hui2he2 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"Makes it difficult to get a job, so as all good street kids do, I chose a place to haunt with my friends and always hung out there. \n"
"\n"
"That was Altuğ's cafe, and he was super nice about me and mine. "
msgstr ""
"这​使得​我​找​工作​非常​困难​，​所以​和​其他​街头​孩子​一样​，​我​选择​了​一个​地方​，​和​朋友​们​成天​待​在​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就是​奥图​伊​的​咖啡馆​，​他​对​我​和​我​的​朋友​们​都​非常​友好​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi3de5 wo3 zhao3 gong1zuo4 fei1chang2 kun4nan5，suo3yi3 he4 qi2ta1 jie1tou2 hai2zi5 yi1yang4，wo3 xuan3ze2 le5 yi1ge5 di4fang1，he4 peng2you5 men5 cheng2tian1 dai1 zai4 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4shi4 ao4 tu2 yi1 de5 ka1fei1guan3，ta1 dui4 wo3 he4 wo3 de5 peng2you5 men5 dou1 fei1chang2 you3hao3。"

msgid ""
"Makes me think of Robin Hood. You know, Raben, Robin?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She laughs a little and lifts her glass to you, the smile back on her lips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, it’s been nice talking to you, dude. Wish you luck."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​的​还​以为​是​白雪公主​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​嘴角​又​露出​笑容​，​举杯​向​你​示意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​很​高兴​认识​你​，​伙计​。​祝你好运​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 de5 hai2 yi3wei2 shi4 bai2xue3gong1zhu3 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zui3jiao3 you4 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2，ju3bei1 xiang4 ni3 shi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，huo3ji5。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid "Makes sense to me."
msgstr ""
