msgid ""
"Malice. Revenge. Who knows?\n"
"\n"
"Remember, this was the man who shot her down. He sent her crashing into a radioactive wasteland. If somebody did that to me, I'd want to hurt him, too... and I'd make it last."
msgstr ""
"也许​是​出于​憎恶​，​也许​是​复仇​，​谁​知道​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​别忘了​，​正是​这个​男人​击落​了​火翼​，​让​她​坠入​放射性​的​废土​。​如果​有人​这样​对​我​，​我​也​会​想​报复​……​而且​会​让​他​生不如死​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4 chu1yu2 zeng1e4，ye3xu3 shi4 fu4chou2，shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"bie4 wang4 le5，zheng4shi4 zhe4ge5 nan2ren2 ji1luo4 le5 Huo3yi4，rang4 ta1 zhui4ru4 fang4she4xing4 de5 fei4tu3。ru2guo3 you3ren2 zhe4yang4 dui4 wo3，wo3 ye3 hui4 xiang3 bao4fu4……er2qie3 hui4 rang4 ta1 sheng1 bu4 ru2 si3。"

