msgstr ""
"手动​存档​次数​：\n"
"shou3dong4 cun2dang4 ci4shu4："

msgid ""
"Manufactured by an Aztechnology subsidiary, with a sell-by date some time in"
" the 2070s."
msgstr ""
"由​阿兹特​科技​子公司​制造​，​售出​截止​日期​在​2070​年代​的​某个​时候​。\n"
"you2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 zi3gong1si1 zhi4zao4，shou4 chu1 jie2zhi3 ri4qi1 zai4 2070 nian2dai4 de5 mou3 ge4 shi2hou5。"

msgid "Many are doing just that."
msgstr ""
"许多​人​已经​在​这样​做​了​。\n"
"xu3duo1 ren2 yi3jing1 zai4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Many of the smugglers are metahumans. If you travel with them, Humanis will "
"allow you into their compound. The rest will be up to you."
msgstr ""
"许多​走私者​都​是​变​人类​。​如果​你​和​他们​同行​，​人类​至上​主义者​会​允许​你​进入​他们​的​仓库​。​剩下​的​就​看​你​的​了​。\n"
"xu3duo1 zou3 si1 zhe3 dou1 shi4 bian4 ren2lei4。ru2guo3 ni3 he4 ta1men5 tong2hang2，ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 hui4 yun3xu3 ni3 jin4ru4 ta1men5 de5 cang1ku4。sheng4xia4 de5 jiu4 kan4 ni3 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Many of those left in Berlin were the disenfranchised. The old ways of "
"running things did little for them, so most embraced the F-State. (h)"
msgstr ""
"留在​柏林​的​许多​人​都​是​被​剥夺权利​的​群体​。​旧有​的​治理​方式​对​他们​帮助​甚微​，​因此​大多数​人​选择​拥抱​动荡​带​。\n"
"liu2 zai4 bo2lin2 de5 xu3duo1 ren2 dou1 shi4 bei4 bao1 duo2 quan2 li4 de5 qun2ti3。jiu4 you3 de5 zhi4li3 fang1shi4 dui4 ta1men5 bang1zhu4 shen4wei1，yin1ci3 da4duo1shu4 ren2 xuan3ze2 yong1bao4 dong4dang4 dai4。"

msgid ""
"Many of your colleagues in the shadow community have over-inflated egos. They let their personal feelings interfere with their work.\n"
"\n"
"My organization needs to know that you will see tasks that we assign you through, no matter what."
msgstr ""
"你​在​暗影​界​的​许多​同行​都​存在​自我​膨胀​的​问题​，​常让​个人​情绪​影响​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​组织​需要​明确​的​是​：​无论​遇到​什么​情况​，​你​都​必须​完成​我们​分配​的​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 an4ying3 jie4 de5 xu3duo1 tong2hang2 dou1 cun2zai4 zi4wo3 peng2zhang4 de5 wen4ti2，chang2 rang4 ge4ren2 qing2xu4 ying3xiang3 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 zu3zhi1 xu1yao4 ming2que4 de5 shi4：wu2lun4 yu4dao4 shen2me5 qing2kuang4，ni3 dou1 bi4xu1 wan2cheng2 wo3men5 fen1pei4 de5 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"Many people, especially other metahuman races, see elves as the most fortunate metahumans. They are more attractive and socially acceptable than the other metahumans. Elves are taller than humans but have a more slender build. Their hair is usually thicker, longer, and more luxurious than average and their ears come to a point.\n"
"\n"
"All Elves have a +1 to Charisma\t\n"
"Maximum Stats: Body: 9  Quickness: 11  Strength: 9 Charisma: 12  Intelligence: 9 Willpower: 9"
msgstr ""
"许多​人​，​尤其​是​其他​变​人类​种族​，​都​将​精灵​视为​最​幸运​的​变​人类​。​他们​比​其他​变​人类​更具​吸引力​且​更​受​社会​接纳​。​精灵​比​人类​更​高挑​，​但​体型​更为​纤细​。​其​头发​通常​比​常人​更​浓密​、​更长​而​华美​，​且​呈​尖耳状​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​精灵​获得​+​1​魅力​\t​\n"
"​最大​属性​：​体质​：​9​ ​ ​敏捷​：​11​ ​ ​力量​：​9​ ​ ​魅力​：​12​ ​ ​智力​：​9​ ​ ​意志​：​9\n"
"\n"
"xu3duo1 ren2，you2qi2 shi4 qi2ta1 bian4 ren2lei4 zhong3zu2，dou1 jiang1 jing1ling2 shi4wei2 zui4 xing4yun4 de5 bian4 ren2lei4。ta1men5 bi3 qi2ta1 bian4 ren2lei4 geng1 ju4 xi1yin3li4 qie3 geng1 shou4 she4hui4 jie1na4。jing1ling2 bi3 ren2lei4 geng1 gao1tiao3，dan4 ti3xing2 geng4wei2 xian1xi4。qi2 tou2fa5 tong1chang2 bi3 chang2ren2 geng1 nong2mi4、geng1 zhang3 er2 hua2mei3，qie3 cheng2 jian1 er3 zhuang4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 jing1ling2 huo4de2 +1 mei4li4 \t \n"
"zui4 dai4 shu3xing4：ti3zhi4：9 min3jie2：11 li4liang5：9 mei4li4：12 zhi4li4：9 yi4zhi4：9"

msgid ""
"Many runners use a streetname, handle, or working name - names like \"Half-"
"Jack\" or \"Lady Z\". Others stick with their given name, or adopt a "
"nickname. Please choose a name for your character."
msgstr ""
"许多​狂奔​者​使用​绰号​、​头衔​或是​假名​—​—​比如​“​半​杰克​”​或是​“​Z​女士​”​。​还​有些​则​使用​本名​或是​取个​昵称​。​请​为​你​的​角色​起名​。\n"
"xu3duo1 kuang2Ben1zhe3 shi3yong4 chuo4hao4、tou2xian2 huo4shi4 jia3ming2——bi3ru2“ban4 jie2ke4” huo4shi4“Z nu:3shi4”。hai2 you3xie1 ze2 shi3yong4 ben3ming2 huo4shi4 qu3 ge4 ni4cheng1。qing3 wei2 ni3 de5 jue2se4 qi3ming2。"

msgid "Mark Target ++"
msgstr ""
"标记​目标​+​+\n"
"biao1ji4 mu4biao1 ++"

msgid "Mark Target I: Increases your chance to hit enemies by 10% when used"
msgstr ""
"标记​目标​I​：​使用​后​对​敌人​增加​10​%​命中​几率\n"
"biao1ji4 mu4biao1 I：shi3yong4 hou4 dui4 di2ren2 zeng1jia1 10%ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4"

msgid "Mark Target II: Increases your chance to hit enemies by 15% when used"
msgstr ""
"标记​目标​II​：​使用​后​对​敌人​增加​15​%​命中​几率\n"
"biao1ji4 mu4biao1 II：shi3yong4 hou4 dui4 di2ren2 zeng1jia1 15%ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4"

msgid ""
"Mark Target III: Increases your chance to hit enemies by 20% when used / "
"Maximum for Troll"
msgstr ""
"标记​目标​III​：​使用​后​对​敌人​增加​20​%​命中​几率​ ​/​ ​巨魔​最大值\n"
"biao1ji4 mu4biao1 III：shi3yong4 hou4 dui4 di2ren2 zeng1jia1 20%ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4/ju4mo2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Marked Target"
msgstr ""
"标记​目标\n"
"biao1ji4 mu4biao1"

msgid "Marks a target with reflected laser light, making it easier to hit."
msgstr ""
"用​带有​反射​的​激光​标记​目标​，​使​其​更​容易​被​击中​。\n"
"yong4 dai4you3 fan3she4 de5 ji1guang1 biao1ji4 mu4biao1，shi3 qi2 geng1 rong2yi4 bei4 ji1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Marks enemy, causing them to become easier to hit. Enemy loses 2 Armor."
msgstr ""
"标记​敌人​，​使​其​更​容易​被​命中​。​敌人​失去​2​点护甲值​。\n"
"biao1ji4 di2ren2，shi3 qi2 geng1 rong2yi4 bei4 ming4zhong4。di2ren2 shi1qu4 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"Marshalling your strength, you manage to avert your gaze, breaking "
"Absinthe's stare. All at once, the floating sensation dissipates, and your "
"consciousness snaps back to its normal state. "
msgstr ""
"你​用尽​全身​的​力量​，​终于​移开​了​视线​，​打破​了​苦艾​酒​的​凝视​。​刹那间​，​漂浮​感​消散​，​你​的​意识​骤然​回归​正常​状态​。\n"
"ni3 yong4jin4 quan2shen1 de5 li4liang5，zhong1yu2 yi2kai1 le5 shi4xian4，da3po4 le5 ku3ai4 jiu3 de5 ning2shi4。cha4 na4 jian1，piao1fu2 gan3 xiao1san4，ni3 de5 yi4shi2 zhou4ran2 hui2gui1 zheng4chang2 zhuang4tai4。"

msgid "Marta"
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔\n"
"Ma3er3ta3"

msgid ""
"Marta calmed me down - she was good at helping me work through my feelings - and I wound up following her to Feuerstelle. \n"
"\n"
"To a street kid, it was basically paradise. The owner, a guy named Harrow, had set up this little farm just outside Tübingen in the Schönbuch forest. The Schönbuch is officially a nature park, but not many people go there nowadays... too much fear of paranormal animals, I guess. "
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​安抚​了​我​—​—​她​很​擅长​帮​我​梳理​情绪​—​—​最后​我​跟着​她​去​了​“​火坑​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​街头​孩子​来说​，​那​简直​是​人间天堂​。​老板​是​个​叫​哈罗​的​家伙​，​他​在​图​宾根​郊外​的​申布赫​森林​里​开辟​了​这片​小​农场​。​申布赫​森林​虽​是​官方​认定​的​自然​公园​，​但​如今​鲜有​人至​……​大概​是​人们​太​害怕​那些​超自然​动物​了​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 an1fu3 le5 wo3——ta1 hen3 shan4chang2 bang1 wo3 shu1li3 qing2xu4——zui4hou4 wo3 gen1zhe5 ta1 qu4 le5“huo3keng1”。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 jie1tou2 hai2zi5 lai2 shuo1，na4 jian3zhi2 shi4 ren2jian1tian1tang2。lao3ban3 shi4 ge4 jiao4 ha1luo2 de5 jia1huo5，ta1 zai4 tu2 bin1 gen1 jiao1wai4 de5 shen1 bu4 he4 sen1lin2 li3 kai1pi4 le5 zhe4 pian1 xiao3 nong2chang3。shen1 bu4 he4 sen1lin2 sui1 shi4 guan1fang1 ren4ding4 de5 zi4ran2 gong1yuan2，dan4 ru2jin1 xian1 you3 ren2 zhi4……da4gai4 shi4 ren2men5 tai4 hai4pa4 na4xie1 chao1zi4ran2 dong4wu4 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Marta dances back out of your reach, and the blood spurts from your neck in an arterial spray.\n"
"\n"
"A disposable, single-edged razor blade. She must have been palming it the entire time that you were talking to her. And now it's buried in the meat of your neck."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​向​后​闪身​躲开​你​的​攻击​范围​。​鲜血​从​你​颈部​喷涌​而出​，​形成​一道​血雾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一枚​一次性​单刃​剃须刀​片​。​在​她​与​你​交谈​时​，​这​东西​一直​都​藏​在​她​的​掌​心里​。​此刻​它​已​深深​刺入​你​颈部​的​血肉​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 xiang4 hou4 shan3shen1 duo3kai1 ni3 de5 gong1ji1 fan4wei2。xian1xue4 cong2 ni3 jing3bu4 pen1yong3 er2 chu1，xing2cheng2 yi1dao4 xie3 wu4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 mei2 yi1ci4xing4 dan1 ren4 ti4xu1dao1 pian1。zai4 ta1 yu4 ni3 jiao1tan2 shi2，zhe4 dong1xi1 yi1zhi2 dou1 zang4 zai4 ta1 de5 zhang3 xin1li5。ci3ke4 ta1 yi3 shen1shen1 ci1 ru4 ni3 jing3bu4 de5 xue4rou4 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"Marta gave that to me on the day that this photo was taken. She said that she made it for me.\n"
"\n"
"I left it behind when I left this place behind."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​在​拍​下​这张​照片​的​当天​把​它​送给​了​我​。​她​说​这​是​自己​亲手​为​我​做​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​离开​这​地方​时​，​把​它​留在​了​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 zai4 pai1 xia4 zhe4 zhang1 zhao4pian4 de5 dang1tian1 ba3 ta1 song4gei3 le5 wo3。ta1 shuo1 zhe4 shi4 zi4ji3 qin1shou3 wei2 wo3 zuo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 li2kai1 zhe4 di4fang1 shi2，ba3 ta1 liu2 zai4 le5 zhe4li3。"

msgid "Marta holds her silence. She looks at you with wet, lustrous eyes."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​仍然​保持​着​沉默​，​只是​用​湿润​而​闪亮​的​双眼​凝视着​你​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 reng2ran2 bao3chi2 zhao2 chen2mo4，zhi3shi4 yong4 shi1run4 er2 shan3liang4 de5 shuang1yan3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Marta is fast, but you're faster. You twist away from the blow as her arm swings down in an arc, missing your neck by inches.\n"
"\n"
"You see a glitter of steel in the palm of her hand - a disposable, single-edged razor blade. She must have been palming it the entire time that you were talking to her."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​出手​很快​，​但​你​更​快​。​当​她​的​手臂​划出​弧线​挥落​时​，​你​扭身​闪避​，​令​她​的​手掌​堪堪​擦​过​你​的​脖颈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​瞥见​她​掌心​闪着​寒光​—​—​那​是​一枚​一次性​单刃​剃须刀​片​。​在​她​与​你​交谈​时​，​这​东西​一直​都​藏​在​她​的​掌​心里​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 chu1shou3 hen3 kuai4，dan4 ni3 geng1 kuai4。dang1 ta1 de5 shou3bi4 hua2 chu1 hu2xian4 hui1 la4 shi2，ni3 niu3 shen1 shan3bi4，ling3 ta1 de5 shou3zhang3 kan1 kan1 ca1 guo4 ni3 de5 bo2geng3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 pie1jian4 ta1 zhang3xin1 shan3 zhao2 han2 guang1——na4 shi4 yi1 mei2 yi1ci4xing4 dan1 ren4 ti4xu1dao1 pian1。zai4 ta1 yu4 ni3 jiao1tan2 shi2，zhe4 dong1xi1 yi1zhi2 dou1 zang4 zai4 ta1 de5 zhang3 xin1li5。"

msgid ""
"Marta is just on the other side of this door. However this goes, we're going to have to move quickly afterward... if she dies, Harrow will know it, and I don't trust her to keep her mouth shut if she lives.\n"
"\n"
"So we take the key to the shrine room, break through the ward, and confront the spirit. Are we clear on that?"
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​就​在​这​扇门​里面​。​无论​结果​如何​，​我们​都​必须​迅速行动​……​如果​她​死​了​，​哈罗​肯定​会​察觉​异样​；​如果​她​活着​，​我​不​相信​她​会​守口如瓶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我们​要​拿走​钥匙​，​打开​神龛​室​，​破除​结界​，​直面​那个​精魂​。​我​说​清楚​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 jiu4 zai4 zhe4 shan1 men2 li3mian4。wu2lun4 jie1guo3 ru2he2，wo3men5 dou1 bi4xu1 xun4 su4 xing2 dong4……ru2guo3 ta1 si3 le5，ha1luo2 ken3ding4 hui4 cha2jue2 yi4yang4 ； ru2guo3 ta1 huo2zhe5，wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ta1 hui4 shou3kou3ru2ping2。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 yao4 na2zou3 yao4shi5，da3kai1 shen2kan1 shi4，po4chu2 jie2jie4，zhi2mian4 na4ge5 jing1hun2。wo3 shuo1 qing1chu5 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Marta says nothing - she just stands there, staring. Her hands are "
"trembling."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​一言不发​。​她​站​在​原地​，​目不转睛​地​盯​着​你​。​她​的​双手​在​颤抖​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 yi1yan2bu4fa1。ta1 zhan4 zai4 yuan2di4，mu4bu4zhuan3jing1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 zai4 chan4dou3。"

msgid ""
"Marta steps forward, her arms extended to wrap Glory in a hug.\n"
"\n"
"All at once, something in Glory's face changes. Her skin goes from pale to pallid, and her breath becomes ragged. She takes a step back and raises her claws into a defensive posture."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​迈步​向前​，​张开​双臂​想要​拥抱​格洛丽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​脸色​一变​。​她​的​面容​变得​更加​苍白​，​呼吸​也​急促​起来​。​她​退后​一步​，​举起​利爪​，​摆​出​防御​姿态​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 mai4bu4 xiang4qian2，zhang1kai1 shuang1bi4 xiang3yao4 yong1bao4 Ge2luo4li2。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 lian3se4 yi1 bian4。ta1 de5 mian4rong2 bian4de5 geng4jia1 cang1bai2，hu1xi1 ye3 ji2cu4 qi3lai5。ta1 tui4hou4 yi1 bu4，ju3qi3 li4zhao3，bai3 chu1 fang2yu4 zi1tai4。"

msgid ""
"Marta was a new definition of the term \"damaged goods.\" I can't even imagine the amount of psychological trauma she'd be carrying if she were alive today.\n"
"\n"
"It'd take her years to recover, and in that time, she'd still be dangerous."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​可以​说​是​“​残次品​”​这个​词​的​全新​定义​。​若​她​活到​今天​，​我​简直​不敢​想象​她​会​背负​多少​心理​创伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​需要​数年​才能​康复​，​而​在此期间​，​她​依然​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4“can2ci4pin3” zhe4ge5 ci2 de5 quan2xin1 ding4yi4。ruo4 ta1 huo2 dao4 jin1tian1，wo3 jian3zhi2 bu4 gan3 xiang3xiang4 ta1 hui4 bei1fu4 duo1shao3 xin1li3 chuang1shang1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xu1yao4 shu4nian2 cai2neng2 kang1fu4，er2 zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1，ta1 yi1ran2 wei1xian3。"

msgid ""
"Marta was a sweet girl. At first I took her for a street kid, like me... her clothes were a little ratty, and she seemed comfortable being near me. But she also looked well fed and happy, and those were two things that I hadn't been in years. \n"
"\n"
"We started hanging out, and before I knew what was happening, I was in love."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​是​个​好​姑娘​。​起初​我​以为​她​是​个​流浪儿​，​就​像​我​一样​……​她​的​衣服​有些​破旧​，​但​似乎​很​享受​和​我​待​在​一起​。​可​她​看起来​又​吃得饱​饱​的​，​满脸​欢喜​，​这​两样​东西​我​已经​多年​未曾​拥有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​开始​一起​玩耍​，​不知不觉​间​，​我​爱​上​她​了​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 shi4 ge4 hao3 gu1niang5。qi3chu1 wo3 yi3wei2 ta1 shi4 ge4 liu2lang4er2，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4……ta1 de5 yi1fu5 you3xie1 po4jiu4，dan4 si4hu1 hen3 xiang3shou4 he4 wo3 dai1 zai4 yi1qi3。ke3 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you4 chi1 de2 bao3 bao3 de5，man3lian3 huan1xi3，zhe4 liang3yang4 dong1xi1 wo3 yi3jing1 duo1nian2 wei4ceng2 yong1you3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 kai1shi3 yi1qi3 wan2shua3，bu4zhi1bu4jue2 jian1，wo3 ai4 shang4 ta1 le5。"

msgid "Marta's Amulet"
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​的​护身符\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 de5 hu4shen1fu2"

msgid "Marta's blood-spattered amulet."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​的​护身符​，​上面​血迹斑斑​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 de5 hu4shen1fu2，shang4mian4 xue4ji4ban1ban1。"

msgid "Marta's eyes go wide."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。"

msgid ""
"Marta's head jerks up at the sound of Glory's words. She looks as though she's been slapped.\n"
"\n"
"She opens her mouth to speak, but then seems to think better of it. Red-faced, she closes her mouth again, but her stare remains fixed on Glory."
msgstr ""
"听到​格洛丽​的话​，​玛​尔塔​猛地​抬起​头​，​神情​恍若​挨​了​一记​耳光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​张口​欲言​，​随即​又​似乎​改变​主意​，​满脸​通红​地​闭上嘴​，​目光​却​依然​死死​盯​着​格洛丽​。\n"
"\n"
"ting1dao4 Ge2luo4li2 de5hua4，Ma3er3ta3 meng3de5 tai2qi3 tou2，shen2qing2 huang3ruo4 ai1 le5 yi1 ji4 er3guang1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhang1kou3 yu4 yan2，sui2ji2 you4 si4hu1 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5，man3lian3 tong1hong2 de5 bi4 shang4 zui3，mu4guang1 que4 yi1ran2 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid ""
"Marta's lifeless body slides out of Glory's arms. She looks up at the spirit, and her face twists into a mask of hate.\n"
"\n"
"With Marta's blood wicking from her fingers, she lets out a bloodcurdling scream."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​毫无​生气​的​尸体​从格洛丽​的​臂​中​滑落​。​她​抬头​望​向​精魂​，​面容​扭曲​成​一张​憎恨​的​面具​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​感受​着​玛​尔塔​的​鲜血​从​自己​的​指间​渗落​，​她​发出​一声​撕心裂肺​的​尖叫​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 hao2wu2 sheng1qi4 de5 shi1ti3 cong2 Ge2luo4li2 de5 bi4 zhong4 hua2luo4。ta1 tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 jing1hun2，mian4rong2 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1 zhang1 zeng1hen4 de5 mian4ju4。\n"
"\n"
"gan3shou4 zhao2 Ma3er3ta3 de5 xian1xue4 cong2 zi4ji3 de5 zhi3 jian1 shen4 la4，ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 si1xin1lie4fei4 de5 jian1jiao4。"

msgid "Marta, are these friends of yours?"
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​他们​是​你​的​朋友​吗​？\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ta1men5 shi4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Marta, if Harrow actually *believed* in the rules that he's taught you, he "
"wouldn't have a problem with you questioning his orders."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​如果​哈罗​真的​*​相信​*​他​教给​你​的​那些​规则​，​那​他​就​不会​介意​你​质疑​他​的​命令​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ru2guo3 ha1luo2 zhen1de5*xiang1xin4*ta1 jiao1 gei3 ni3 de5 na4xie1 gui1ze2，na4 ta1 jiu4 bu4hui4 jie4yi4 ni3 zhi4yi2 ta1 de5 ming4ling4。"

msgid "Marta."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3。"

msgid "Martial Defense I"
msgstr ""
"武术​防御​I\n"
"wu3shu4 fang2yu4 I"

msgid "Martial Defense II"
msgstr ""
"武术​防御​II\n"
"wu3shu4 fang2yu4 II"

msgid ""
"Marvelous. Truly marvelous.\n"
"\n"
"With this contribution, we have reached our second goal. We will put this money to use stocking the library with a full range of literature, philosophy, poetry, and training manuals.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you again for your help, $(l.name). You've made a tremendous difference to this community."
msgstr ""
"太棒了​。​真是​太棒了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​了​这笔​捐款​，​我们​就​实现​了​第二个​目标​。​我们​将​把​这笔​钱​用于​为​图书馆​储备​各种​文学​、​哲学​、​诗歌​和​培训​手册​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再次​感谢​你​的​帮助​，​$(l.name)​。​你​为​这个​社区​做出​了​巨大贡献​。\n"
"\n"
"tai4 bang4 le5。zhen1shi5 tai4 bang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 jiu4 shi2xian4 le5 di4 er4 ge4 mu4biao1。wo3men5 jiang1 ba3 zhe4 bi3 qian2 yong4yu2 wei2 tu2shu1guan3 chu3bei4 ge4zhong3 wen2xue2、zhe2xue2、shi1ge1 he4 pei2xun4 shou3ce4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，$(l.name)。ni3 wei2 zhe4ge5 she4qu1 zuo4chu1 le5 ju4 dai4 gong4 xian4。"

msgid "Matrix Courier"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​信使\n"
"ju3zhen4 xin4shi3"

msgid "Matrix Echo"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​回声\n"
"ju3zhen4 hui2sheng1"

msgid "Matrix Firewall2"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​防火墙​2\n"
"ju3zhen4 fang2huo3qiang2 2"

msgid "Matrix Firewall3"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​防火墙​3\n"
"ju3zhen4 fang2huo3qiang2 3"

msgid "Matrix Firewall4"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​防火墙​4\n"
"ju3zhen4 fang2huo3qiang2 4"

msgid "Matrix Node Door 1"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​节点​门​1\n"
"ju3zhen4 jie2dian3 men2 1"

msgid "Matrix Node Door 2"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​节点​门​2\n"
"ju3zhen4 jie2dian3 men2 2"

msgid "Matrix Node Hatch"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​节点​舱口\n"
"ju3zhen4 jie2dian3 cang1 kou3"

msgid "Matrix Ops Panel"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​控制面板\n"
"ju3zhen4 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3"

msgid "Matrix Pump Access"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​泵​访问\n"
"ju3zhen4 beng4 fang3wen4"

msgid "Matrix Room Door"
msgstr ""
"矩阵​房间​门\n"
"ju3zhen4 fang2jian1 men2"

msgid "Mauler"
msgstr ""
"猛击​者\n"
"meng3ji1 zhe3"

msgid "Max"
msgstr ""
"马克斯\n"
"ma3 ke4 si1"

msgid "Maxim"
msgstr ""
"马克西姆\n"
"ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3"

msgid ""
"Maxim always took care of the deals before, an' they always went by the numbers.\n"
"\n"
"I dunno. Maybe he really was the only one they'd deal with. Maybe they just... liked him."
msgstr ""
"以前​都​是​马克西姆​负责​交易​，​每次​都​按​规矩​办事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​不​知道​，​也许​他们​真的​只​愿意​和​马克西姆​打交道​，​他们​可能​就是​……​喜欢​他​。\n"
"\n"
"yi3qian2 dou1 shi4 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 fu4ze2 jiao1yi4，mei3ci4 dou1 an4 gui1ju5 ban4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4，ye3xu3 ta1men5 zhen1de5 zhi3 yuan4yi4 he4 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 da3jiao1dao4，ta1men5 ke3neng2 jiu4shi4……xi3huan5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Maxim looks up at the sound of your approach.\n"
"\n"
"If he's surprised to see you, he doesn't show it."
msgstr ""
"马克西姆​听到​你​靠近​的​动静​，​抬起头来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​没有​表露出​半点​意外​的​样子​。\n"
"\n"
"ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 ting1dao4 ni3 kao4jin4 de5 dong4jing4，tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 mei2you3 biao3 lou4 chu1 ban4dian3 yi4wai4 de5 yang4zi5。"

msgid "Maxim pauses for a moment before continuing."
msgstr ""
"马克西姆​停顿​片刻​，​继续​说道​。\n"
"ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Maxim steps back, leaving you to negotiate with the Rammbock leader.\n"
"\n"
"The ganger boss stands there, hands on her hips, awaiting your response."
msgstr ""
"马克西姆​退后​一步​，​留给​你​与​撞锤​帮​首领​谈判​的​空间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​帮派​老大​站​在​那里​，​双手​叉腰​，​等待​着​你​的​回应​。\n"
"\n"
"ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 tui4hou4 yi1 bu4，liu2gei3 ni3 yu4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 shou3ling3 tan2pan4 de5 kong1jian1。\n"
"\n"
"bang1pai4 lao3da4 zhan4 zai4 na4li5，shuang1shou3 cha1yao1，deng3dai4 zhao2 ni3 de5 hui2ying4。"

msgid "Maxim... he's dead, man. Maxim is fuckin' *dead.*"
msgstr ""
"马克西姆​……​他​死​了​。​马克西姆​居然​他妈的​*​死​了​*​。\n"
"ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3……ta1 si3 le5。ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 ju1ran2 ta1ma1de5*si3 le5*。"

msgid "Maximum for Dwarves"
msgstr ""
"矮人​最大值\n"
"ai3ren2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Dwarves and Orks"
msgstr ""
"矮人​与​兽​人​最大值\n"
"ai3ren2 yu4 shou4 ren2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Elves"
msgstr ""
"精灵​最大值\n"
"jing1ling2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Humans and Dwarves"
msgstr ""
"人类​与​矮​人​最大值\n"
"ren2lei4 yu4 ai3 ren2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Humans and Elves"
msgstr ""
"人类​与​精灵​最大值\n"
"ren2lei4 yu4 jing1ling2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Humans, Dwarves, and Orks"
msgstr ""
"人类​、​矮人​与​兽​人​最大值\n"
"ren2lei4、ai3ren2 yu4 shou4 ren2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Humans, Elves, Orks, and Trolls"
msgstr ""
"人类​、​精灵​、​兽​人​与​巨魔​最大值\n"
"ren2lei4、jing1ling2、shou4 ren2 yu4 ju4mo2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Humans, Elves, and Dwarves"
msgstr ""
"人类​、​精灵​与​矮​人​最大值\n"
"ren2lei4、jing1ling2 yu4 ai3 ren2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Orks"
msgstr ""
"兽​人​最大值\n"
"shou4 ren2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid "Maximum for Trolls"
msgstr ""
"巨魔​最大值\n"
"ju4mo2 zui4 dai4 zhi2"

msgid ""
"Maybe \"detached\" is a better word? I've seen all kinds of people jack into the Hub, but only one type comes back out. \n"
"\n"
"Quiet. Subdued. Disinterested in anything other than their beloved \"Communion.\""
msgstr ""
"也许​用​“​游离​”​来​形容​更​合适​？​我见​过​各种​人​接入​那个​中枢​，​但​他们​回来​后​都​变成​了​同一​副​样子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​安静​、​顺从​，​对​除了​他们​心爱​的​“​共​融会​”​以外​的​任何​事情​都​不感兴趣​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 yong4“you2li2” lai2 xing2rong2 geng1 he2shi4？wo3 jian4 guo4 ge4zhong3 ren2 jie1ru4 na4ge5 zhong1shu1，dan4 ta1men5 hui2lai5 hou4 dou1 bian4cheng2 le5 tong2yi1 fu4 yang4zi5。\n"
"\n"
"an1jing4、shun4cong2，dui4 chu2le5 ta1men5 xin1ai4 de5“gong4 rong2hui4” yi3wai4 de5 ren4he2 shi4qing5 dou1 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。"

msgid "Maybe Doc Ezkibel has some redeeming qualities."
msgstr ""
"看来​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​还​算​有些​可取之处​。\n"
"kan4lai5 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 hai2 suan4 you3xie1 ke3qu3zhi1chu4。"

msgid "Maybe I could help you out with your situation."
msgstr ""
"也许​我​可以​帮​你​解决目前​的​“​局面​”​。\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 jie3 jue2 mu4 qian2 de5“ju2mian4”。"

msgid "Maybe I should come along... to protect you or something."
msgstr ""
"也许​我​应该​跟着​……​保护​你们​之类​的​。\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3 ying1gai1 gen1zhe5……bao3hu4 ni3men5 zhi1lei4 de5。"

msgid "Maybe I should put a few bullets in you instead."
msgstr ""
"也许​我​应该​先给​你​来​几枪​。\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3 ying1gai1 xian1 gei3 ni3 lai2 ji1 qiang1。"

msgid ""
"Maybe I was wrong. Maybe this *does* need to get violent.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Maxim turns to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Get ready to ventilate these assholes, $(l.name). We've got a schedule to keep."
msgstr ""
"也许​是​我​错​了​。​这​事​*​还是​*​得​动手​解决​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​马克西姆​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​准备​灭​了​这些​王八蛋​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​还​得​赶时间​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4 wo3 cuo4 le5。zhe4 shi4*hai2shi5*de2 dong4shou3 jie3jue2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhun3bei4 mie4 le5 zhe4xie1 wang2ba1dan4 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 hai2 de2 gan3shi2jian1 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Maybe I'll let Blitz take a crack at the next PDA we find. Old people are "
"bad with computers."
msgstr ""
"也许​下次​我​还是​让​布里​茨​来​破解​PDA​吧​。​你​这样​的​老人家​就​别碰​电脑​了​。\n"
"ye3xu3 xia4ci4 wo3 hai2shi5 rang4 Bu4li3ci2 lai2 po4jie3 PDA ba1。ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 lao3ren2jia1 jiu4 bie4 peng4 dian4nao3 le5。"

msgid "Maybe I'll take my business elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​去​别处​看看​吧​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 qu4 bie2chu4 kan4kan5 ba1。"

msgid "Maybe Marta still has feelings for you. Stranger things have happened."
msgstr ""
"也许​玛​尔塔​对​你​还​抱​有​感情​。​这​并​不​奇怪​。\n"
"ye3xu3 Ma3er3ta3 dui4 ni3 hai2 bao4 you3 gan3qing2。zhe4 bing4 bu4 qi2guai4。"

msgid "Maybe another time."
msgstr ""
"也许​下次​吧​。\n"
"ye3xu3 xia4ci4 ba1。"

msgid "Maybe by face, if not by name. I'm $(s.name)."
msgstr ""
"哪怕​不​知道​我​的​名字​，​看脸​也​能​认出来​了​。​我​是​$(s.name)​。\n"
"na3pa4 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 de5 ming2zi5，kan4 lian3 ye3 neng2 ren4 chu1 lai2 le5。wo3 shi4 $(s.name)。"

msgid ""
"Maybe he did something to offend Harrow, or maybe a member of the inner circle was in the mood for sport. Doesn't matter either way.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The owner of this shirt doesn't need it any more."
msgstr ""
"或许​他​做​了​什么​得罪​哈罗​的​事​，​或许​是​某个​核心成员​想​找​乐子​。​无论​哪​种​情况​，​现在​都​不​重要​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过​头去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这件​衬衫​的​主人​不再​需要​它​了​。\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 ta1 zuo4 le5 shen2me5 de2zui4 ha1luo2 de5 shi4，huo4xu3 shi4 mou3 ge4 he2 xin1 cheng2 yuan2 xiang3 zhao3 le4zi5。wu2lun4 na3 zhong3 qing2kuang4，xian4zai4 dou1 bu4 zhong4yao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian4 chen4shan1 de5 zhu3ren2 bu4zai4 xu1yao4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe he was Humanis. Or maybe just another Flux fanatic who thought the "
"balance of power would be upset by me joining up with ORC."
msgstr ""
"也许​是​人类​至上​主义者​，​又​或者​只是​个​动荡​带​的​狂​信徒​，​认为​我​加入​ORC​会​打破​权力​平衡​。\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3，you4 huo4zhe3 zhi3shi4 ge4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 kuang2 xin4tu2，ren4wei2 wo3 jia1ru4 ORC hui4 da3po4 quan2li4 ping2heng2。"

msgid "Maybe he would. But that doesn't make it right."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​这样​并​不是​正确​的​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 zhe4yang4 bing4 bu4shi4 zheng4que4 de5。"

msgid "Maybe he's getting cocky."
msgstr ""
"也许​他​变得​自大​了​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1 bian4de5 zi4da4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe if he were a better actor. Luckily for us, he isn't.\n"
"\n"
"I know that you aren't working for Tamanous, Yuli."
msgstr ""
"如果​他​的​演技​再​好点​还​真​没准​。​还好​他​并​不​擅长​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​你​不是​为塔玛​诺斯​效力​的​，​尤里​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 de5 yan3ji4 zai4 hao3 dian3 hai2 zhen1 mei2zhun3。hai2hao3 ta1 bing4 bu4 shan4chang2 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 bu4shi4 wei2 ta3 ma3 nuo4 si1 xiao4li4 de5，You2li3。"

msgid "Maybe in the Seventh World, Hans, but not today."
msgstr ""
"等到​第七​纪​再说​吧​，​汉斯​，​今天​不行​。\n"
"deng3dao4 di4 qi1 ji4 zai4shuo1 ba1，han4si1，jin1tian1 bu4xing2。"

msgid "Maybe later. I've got a run to concentrate on."
msgstr ""
"回头​再说​吧​。​我​得​先​去​准备​下趟​差事​。\n"
"hui2tou2 zai4shuo1 ba1。wo3 de2 xian1 qu4 zhun3bei4 xia4 tang1 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"Maybe not. But in order to keep feeding your habit, you're eventually gonna "
"wind up doing something that you regret. Trust me on this."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​如果​你​戒​不​掉​这​股瘾​的话​，​你​早晚​会​干出​什么​让​自己​后悔​的​事​。​我​说真的​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 jie4 bu4 diao4 zhe4 gu3 yin3 de5hua4，ni3 zao3wan3 hui4 gan4 chu1 shen2me5 rang4 zi4ji3 hou4hui3 de5 shi4。wo3 shuo1zhen1de5。"

msgid "Maybe not. But it's a start."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​这​只是​个​开始​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 zhe4 zhi3shi4 ge4 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"Maybe not. But it's a start.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, let's get the hell out of here. When we get back to the Kreuzbasar, the first round of drinks is on me."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​这​只是​个​开始​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​吧​。​等​我们​回到​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​我​先​请​大家​喝​一轮​酒​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 zhe4 zhi3shi4 ge4 kai1shi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1。deng3 wo3men5 hui2dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，wo3 xian1 qing3 da4jia1 he4 yi1lun2 jiu3。"

msgid "Maybe not. But she won't be our problem any more."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​她​不再​是​我们​要​担心​的​问题​了​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 ta1 bu4zai4 shi4 wo3men5 yao4 dan1xin1 de5 wen4ti2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe now that Haushofer's playing heat-the-sheets with Giesbrecht's secretary, he'll learn to lighten up.\n"
"\n"
"We can only hope."
msgstr ""
"兴许​豪斯​霍​菲尔​现在​正​和​吉斯​布雷​希特​的​秘书​干柴烈火​呢​，​他​说不定​能​放松​点儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但愿如此​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"xing1xu3 hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3 xian4zai4 zheng1 he4 ji2 si1 bu4lei2 xi1 te4 de5 mi4shu1 gan1chai2lie4huo3 ni2，ta1 shuo1bu5ding4 neng2 fang4song1 dian3r5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4yuan4ru2ci3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Maybe she's being compelled to lie to us. I'll accept that. It doesn't mean that we should trust her.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She fidgets in agitation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're wasting time, and we *need* that key. If Harrow gets back here before we've dealt with that shrine, we're fucked. "
msgstr ""
"也许​她​是​被迫​对​我们​撒谎​的​。​我​接受​这个​说法​。​但​这​不​代表​我们​该​相信​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​焦躁​不安​地​扭动​身体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​浪费时间​，​而​我们​*​必须​*​拿到​那​把​钥匙​。​如果​哈罗​在​我们​解决​神龛​前​赶回来​，​我们​就​完蛋​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1 shi4 bei4po4 dui4 wo3men5 sa1huang3 de5。wo3 jie1shou4 zhe4ge5 shuo1fa3。dan4 zhe4 bu4 dai4biao3 wo3men5 gai1 xiang1xin4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiao1zao4 bu4an1 de5 niu3 dong4 shen1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1，er2 wo3men5*bi4xu1*na2dao4 na4 ba3 yao4shi5。ru2guo3 ha1luo2 zai4 wo3men5 jie3jue2 shen2kan1 qian2 gan3 hui2 lai2，wo3men5 jiu4 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid "Maybe so."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Maybe so. But at the end of the day, it was your decision to come here. "
"Nobody held a gun to your head."
msgstr ""
"或许​吧​。​但​归根结底​，​来​这里​是​你​自己​的​决定​。​没人​拿​枪​逼​你​这么​做​。\n"
"huo4xu3 ba1。dan4 gui1gen1jie2di3，lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 jue2ding4。mei2 ren2 na2 qiang1 bi1 ni3 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid "Maybe so. But if true, we have more to fear than we thought. (h)"
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​如果​真是​这样​，​我们​要​担心​的​可​就​不仅仅​是​如此​了​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 ru2guo3 zhen1shi5 zhe4yang4，wo3men5 yao4 dan1xin1 de5 ke3 jiu4 bu4jin3jin3 shi4 ru2ci3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe so. But it wasn't your decision - you were on a mission, remember?"
msgstr ""
"或许​吧​。​但​这​并​不是​你​做出​的​决定​—​—​你​只是​在​执行​任务​，​对​吧​？\n"
"huo4xu3 ba1。dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4shi4 ni3 zuo4chu1 de5 jue2ding4——ni3 zhi3shi4 zai4 zhi2xing2 ren4wu5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "Maybe so. But they were the ones holding the knives."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​他们​才​是​持刀​行凶​的​人​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 ta1men5 cai2 shi4 chi2dao1 xing2xiong1 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Maybe so. But you're on edge, and I need you calm. Beating on him isn't "
"helping."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​你​有些​失控​了​，​我​需要​你​冷静下来​。​再​怎么​打​他​也​没用​的​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 ni3 you3xie1 shi1kong4 le5，wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2。zai4 zen3me5 da3 ta1 ye3 mei2yong4 de5。"

msgid "Maybe someday you won't need them."
msgstr ""
"也许​某​一天​你​就​能​不再​需要​它们​了​。\n"
"ye3xu3 mou3 yi1 tian1 ni3 jiu4 neng2 bu4zai4 xu1yao4 ta1men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe someone's trying to get the old soldier to come out of retirement?"
msgstr ""
"也许​是​有人​在​试图​让​这位​老兵​重出江湖​？\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4 you3ren2 zai4 shi4tu2 rang4 zhe4wei4 lao3bing1 chong2chu1jiang1hu2？"

msgid ""
"Maybe the Adversary isn't evil, but Harrow's interpretation of Him certainly"
" is."
msgstr ""
"也许​反叛者​并​不是​邪恶​的​化身​，​但​哈罗​对​祂​的​诠释​无疑​是​邪恶​的​。\n"
"ye3xu3 fan3 pan4 zhe3 bing4 bu4shi4 xie2e4 de5 hua4shen1，dan4 ha1luo2 dui4 ta1 de5 quan2shi4 wu2yi2 shi4 xie2e4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe there's something going on that you don't know about.\n"
"\n"
"Could Grinder be working a deal under your nose? Something he wants to keep you insulated from, maybe?"
msgstr ""
"也许​有些​事情​是​你​所​不​知道​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​会​不会​是​“​绞肉机​”​背着​你​在​私下​做​交易​？​也许​他​希望​你​对此​一直​蒙在鼓里​？\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 you3xie1 shi4qing5 shi4 ni3 suo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"hui4 bu4hui4 shi4“jiao3rou4ji1” bei1zhe5 ni3 zai4 si1xia4 zuo4 jiao1yi4？ye3xu3 ta1 xi1wang4 ni3 dui4 ci3 yi1zhi2 meng2zai4gu3li3？"

msgid "Maybe there's something in there that we can use."
msgstr ""
"也许​里面​有​我们​能​加以​利用​的​东西​。\n"
"ye3xu3 li3mian4 you3 wo3men5 neng2 jia1yi3 li4yong4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Maybe they tricked him into popping one of those \"God chips\"? Got him "
"addicted without ever offering him any money?"
msgstr ""
"也许​他们​骗​他​用​了​那种​“​上帝​芯片​”​？​让​他​上瘾​，​这样​就​一分钱​都​不用​掏​了​？\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1men5 pian4 ta1 yong4 le5 na4zhong3“shang4di4 xin1pian4”？rang4 ta1 shang4yin3，zhe4yang4 jiu4 yi1 fen4 qian2 dou1 bu4yong4 tao1 le5？"

msgid ""
"Maybe they're not that much of a threat. A small-time operation wouldn't get"
" much press, either."
msgstr ""
"也许​他们​威胁​并不大​。​如果​只是​小打小闹​的​组织​，​也​不会​引起​太​多​关注​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1men5 wei1xie2 bing4 bu4 dai4。ru2guo3 zhi3shi4 xiao3da3xiao3nao4 de5 zu3zhi1，ye3 bu4hui4 yin3qi3 tai4 duo1 guan1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Maybe they're running a disinformation campaign. Planting strange rumors to "
"create plausible deniability."
msgstr ""
"也许​他们​正在​打​一场​舆论​战​。​散布​奇怪​的​谣言​，​这样​就​能​制造​合理​的​否认​借口​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1men5 zheng4zai4 da3 yi1 chang2 yu2lun4 zhan4。san4bu4 qi2guai4 de5 yao2yan2，zhe4yang4 jiu4 neng2 zhi4zao4 he2li3 de5 fou3ren4 jie4kou3。"

msgid ""
"Maybe things have changed. We didn't have any trouble getting in, did we?"
msgstr ""
"也许​事情​已经​发生​了​变化​。​我们​进来​的​时候​也​没​遇到​什么​麻烦​啊​？\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 fa1sheng1 le5 bian4hua4。wo3men5 jin4lai2 de5 shi2hou5 ye3 mei2 yu4dao4 shen2me5 ma2fan5 a1？"

msgid "Maybe we can talk to her. Convince her to give us the key."
msgstr ""
"也许​我们​能​和​她​谈谈​，​说服​她​把​钥匙​交给​我们​。\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3men5 neng2 he4 ta1 tan2tan2，shuo1fu2 ta1 ba3 yao4shi5 jiao1gei3 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe we can, chief. I'm game if you are.\n"
"\n"
"Wanna meet up later at the soykaf shop? We can trade war stories over a smoke."
msgstr ""
"或许​可以​试试​，​头儿​。​只要​你​愿意​，​我​奉陪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​一会儿​去​豆​咖馆​坐坐​？​我们​边​抽烟​，​边聊​战斗​往事​。\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 ke3yi3 shi4 shi4，tou2r5。zhi3yao4 ni3 yuan4yi4，wo3 feng4pei2。\n"
"\n"
"na4 yi1hui4r5 qu4 dou4 ka1 guan3 zuo4 zuo4？wo3men5 bian1 chou1yan1，bian1 liao2 zhan4dou4 wang3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Maybe we should ask around.\n"
"\n"
"This looks like the place, so I'm sure someone might spill the beans."
msgstr ""
"也许​我们​应该​去​附近​问问​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​应该​就是​这​地方​，​肯定​有人​知道​怎么回事​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3men5 ying1gai1 qu4 fu4jin4 wen4 wen4。\n"
"\n"
"ying1gai1 jiu4shi4 zhe4 di4fang1，ken3ding4 you3ren2 zhi1dao4 zen3me5hui2shi4。"

msgid ""
"Maybe we should hear him out, boss. He's a fellow runner, after all... "
msgstr ""
"也许​我们​应该​听​他​说完​，​老大​。​毕竟​他​也​是​个​狂奔​者​……\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3men5 ying1gai1 ting1 ta1 shuo1 wan2，lao3da4。bi4jing4 ta1 ye3 shi4 ge4 kuang2Ben1zhe3……"

msgid ""
"Maybe we should hear him out, chief. He's a fellow runner, after all... "
msgstr ""
"也许​我们​应该​听​他​说完​，​头儿​。​毕竟​他​也​是​个​狂奔​者​……\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3men5 ying1gai1 ting1 ta1 shuo1 wan2，tou2r5。bi4jing4 ta1 ye3 shi4 ge4 kuang2Ben1zhe3……"

msgid "Maybe we should just let him slot the thing."
msgstr ""
"也许​我们​该​让​他​装上​这​东西​。\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3men5 gai1 rang4 ta1 zhuang1 shang4 zhe4 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Maybe you could introduce me?"
msgstr ""
"你​能​不能​给​我们​介绍​一下​？\n"
"ni3 neng2 bu4neng2 gei3 wo3men5 jie4shao4 yi1xia4？"

msgid ""
"Maybe you could take a room deposit now. You know, for when it opens again. "
msgstr ""
"要​不​你​先收​一下​房间​的​定金​？​万一​店里​重新​开张​了​呢​，​对​吧​。\n"
"yao4 bu4 ni3 xian1 shou1 yi1xia4 fang2jian1 de5 ding4jin1？wan4yi1 dian4 li3 chong2xin1 kai1zhang1 le5 ni2，dui4 ba1。"

msgid "Maybe you could use your \"peasants\" to kill Billy for you."
msgstr ""
"也许​你​可以​让​你​的​“​臣民​”​帮​你​杀​了​比利​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 ke3yi3 rang4 ni3 de5“chen2min2” bang1 ni3 sha1 le5 bi3li4。"

msgid "Maybe you don't need them now. What do you think?"
msgstr ""
"也许​现在​你​不​需要​它们​了​。​你​觉得​呢​？\n"
"ye3xu3 xian4zai4 ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 ta1men5 le5。ni3 jue2de5 ni2？"

msgid "Maybe you should ask Grinder about it when we're done with the run."
msgstr ""
"也许​等​我们​完事​之后​，​你​可以​去​问问​“​绞肉机​”​。\n"
"ye3xu3 deng3 wo3men5 wan2shi4 zhi1hou4，ni3 ke3yi3 qu4 wen4 wen4“jiao3rou4ji1”。"

msgid "Maybe you should see for yourself. I copied it to my PDA."
msgstr ""
"也许​你​应该​自己​看看​。​我​把​它​复制到​我​的​PDA​上​了​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 ying1gai1 zi4ji3 kan4kan5。wo3 ba3 ta1 fu4 zhi4 dao4 wo3 de5 PDA shang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe you try to reason with me, and that fails. Maybe you try coercion? That'll get you nowhere, too.\n"
"\n"
"You try beating on me, and I start giving names. More names than you know what to do with."
msgstr ""
"也许​你​试图​跟​我​讲道理​，​但​那​行不通​。​也许​你​试图用​武力​迫使​我​？​那​也​只会​徒劳无功​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​对​我​动粗​，​而​我​也​会​跟​你​说​各种​名字​，​让​你​根本​分不清​真真假假​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 shi4tu2 gen1 wo3 jiang3 dao4 li3，dan4 na4 xing2bu5tong1。ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 tu2 yong4 wu3li4 po4shi3 wo3？na4 ye3 zhi3 hui4 tu2lao2wu2gong1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 dui4 wo3 dong4cu1，er2 wo3 ye3 hui4 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ge4zhong3 ming2zi5，rang4 ni3 gen1ben3 fen4 bu4 qing1 zhen1 zhen1 jia3 jia3。"

msgid ""
"Maybe you're right. I'll try to let it go.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I just hope that I'm wrong about all of this."
msgstr ""
"也许​你​说得对​。​我​会试​着​让​自己​放下​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只​希望​这​一切都是​我​会错意​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 hui4shi4 zhao2 rang4 zi4ji3 fang4xia4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 xi1wang4 zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 wo3 hui4cuo4yi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe you're right. Maybe he did. So you did what needed to be done, despite"
" the fact that it meant killing a fellow soldier."
msgstr ""
"也许​你​说得对​。​也许​的确如此​。​你​也​做​了​该​做​的​事​，​即使​这​意味着​杀死​自己​的​一位​同僚​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。ye3xu3 de5 que4 ru2 ci3。ni3 ye3 zuo4 le5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4，ji2shi3 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 sha1si3 zi4ji3 de5 yi1 wei4 tong2liao2。"

msgid ""
"Maybe you’re right. Maybe everlasting peace is the best thing for you now."
msgstr ""
"也许​你​是​对​的​。​现在​你​最​需要​的​就是​永恒​的​安息​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。xian4zai4 ni3 zui4 xu1yao4 de5 jiu4shi4 yong3heng2 de5 an1xi1。"

msgid "Maybe you’re right. Maybe peace is the best thing for you now."
msgstr ""
"也许​你​是​对​的​。​现在​你​最​需要​的​就是​安息​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。xian4zai4 ni3 zui4 xu1yao4 de5 jiu4shi4 an1xi1。"

msgid "Maybe, but let’s face it - dragons are scary."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​说实话​—​—​龙​确实​挺​吓人​的​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 shuo1shi2hua4——long2 que4shi2 ting3 xia4ren2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe, but that's a big \"if.\"\n"
"\n"
"I can guarantee you that if we open that door, they're going to attack us, key or no. And then we'll have no choice but to kill them."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​这​可​非常​说​不准​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可以​向​你​保证​，​如果​我们​打开​那​扇门​，​他们​一定​会​发起​进攻​，​不管​他们​手上​有没有​钥匙​。​到时候​，​除了​把​他们​干掉​，​我们​别无选择​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 zhe4 ke3 fei1chang2 shuo1 bu4zhun3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，ru2guo3 wo3men5 da3kai1 na4 shan1 men2，ta1men5 yi1ding4 hui4 fa1qi3 jin4gong1，bu4guan3 ta1men5 shou3 shang4 you3mei2you3 yao4shi5。dao4shi2hou4，chu2le5 ba3 ta1men5 gan4diao4，wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。"

msgid "Maybe, but you need to answer some questions first."
msgstr ""
"也许​，​但​你​得​先​回答​我​几个​问题​。\n"
"ye3xu3，dan4 ni3 de2 xian1 hui2da2 wo3 ji3ge5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Maybe, if the circumstances were different, you could have found some common"
" ground."
msgstr ""
"也许​如果​情况​不同​的话​，​你们​本​可以​找到​一些​共同点​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ru2guo3 qing2kuang4 bu4tong2 de5hua4，ni3men5 ben3 ke3yi3 zhao3dao4 yi1xie1 gong4tong2dian3。"

msgid "Maybe."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Maybe.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger takes another glance at the smoldering corpse, and you can see the doubt growing in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​又​瞥​了​一眼​正在​冒烟​的​那具​尸体​，​你​看出​她​眼中​疑虑​渐长​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​说​不好​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 you4 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 zheng4zai4 mao4yan1 de5 na4 ju4 shi1ti3，ni3 kan4chu1 ta1 yan3zhong1 yi2lu:4 jian1 zhang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shuo1 bu4hao3。"

msgid ""
"Maybe. But I can't ignore the possibility that he *wasn't* playing me. That these things *did* happen.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She grits her teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That'd be a bitter pill to swallow, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"或许​吧​。​但​我​无法​忽视​这个​可能性​：​如果​他​*​不是​*​在​戏弄​我​呢​？​如果​这些​事​*​真的​*​发生​过​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​咬紧牙关​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​对​我​来说​将​是​十分​痛苦​的​事​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 ba1。dan4 wo3 wu2fa3 hu1shi4 zhe4ge5 ke3neng2xing4：ru2guo3 ta1*bu4shi4*zai4 xi4nong4 wo3 ni2？ru2guo3 zhe4xie1 shi4*zhen1de5*fa1sheng1 guo4 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 jiang1 shi4 shi2fen1 tong4ku3 de5 shi4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Maybe. But it's hard for me to believe that the whole facility is better off"
" reduced to cinders."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​不过​我​很​难​相信​将​整栋​设施​化为灰烬​是​更好​的​选择​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。bu4guo4 wo3 hen3 nan2 xiang1xin4 jiang1 zheng3 dong4 she4shi1 hua4 wei2 hui1 jin4 shi4 geng1 hao3 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid "Maybe. But no promises."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​我​不​做​保证​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 wo3 bu4 zuo4 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"Maybe. But not here, and not now.\n"
"\n"
"Those kids in there - they'd all die for her. They already love her. That's what she does."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​不是​在​这里​，​也​不是​现在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​的​那些​孩子​—​—​他们​都​愿意​为​她​赴死​。​他们​已经​爱上​她​了​。​这​就是​她​的​本事​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 bu4shi4 zai4 zhe4li3，ye3 bu4shi4 xian4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 de5 na4Xie1hai2zi5——ta1men5 dou1 yuan4yi4 wei2 ta1 fu4si3。ta1men5 yi3jing1 ai4shang4 ta1 le5。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1 de5 ben3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Maybe. But that would have been the easy way out... to brand her as irredeemable and kill her in the name of safety.\n"
"\n"
"She can turn herself around if she wants to - I'm living proof of that. Maybe, in time, she'll find some semblance of redemption."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​那​不过​是​逃避责任​的​捷径​—​—​将​她​贴​上​无可救药​的​标签​，​再​以​安全​为名​处决​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​她​愿意​，​自己​就​能​改过自新​—​—​我​就是​活生生​的​例证​。​或许​，​终​有​一天​，​她​能​找到​某种​救赎​的​可能​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 na4 bu4guo4 shi4 tao2bi4ze2ren4 de5 jie2jing4——jiang1 ta1 tie1 shang4 wu2ke3jiu4yao4 de5 biao1qian1，zai4 yi3 an1quan2 wei2 ming2 chu3jue2 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ta1 yuan4yi4，zi4ji3 jiu4 neng2 gai3guo4zi4xin1——wo3 jiu4shi4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 li4zheng4。huo4xu3，zhong1 you3 yi1 tian1，ta1 neng2 zhao3dao4 mou3zhong3 jiu4shu2 de5 ke3neng2。"

msgid ""
"Maybe. But then, a small-time operation couldn't afford to hire the "
"Engineer. He wouldn't even talk to an organization that couldn't pay top "
"dollar for his services."
msgstr ""
"或许​吧​。​但​话说回来​，​小打小闹​的​组织​会​有钱​雇​工程师​吗​？​如果​不是​那种​付得​起​天价​酬劳​的​大​组织​，​他​连正眼​都​不会​瞧​一眼​。\n"
"huo4xu3 ba1。dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，xiao3da3xiao3nao4 de5 zu3zhi1 hui4 you3qian2 gu4 gong1cheng2shi1 ma5？ru2guo3 bu4shi4 na4zhong3 fu4 de2 qi3 tian1jia4 chou2lao2 de5 dai4 zu3zhi1，ta1 lian2 zheng1 yan3 dou1 bu4hui4 qiao2 yi1yan3。"

msgid "Maybe. But with the power grid shut down, they might give us an edge."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​毕竟​目前​还​处于​断电​期间​，​这样​也许​能​给​我们​带来​一定​优势​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 bi4jing4 mu4qian2 hai2 chu3yu2 duan4dian4 qi1jian1，zhe4yang4 ye3xu3 neng2 gei3 wo3men5 dai4lai2 yi1ding4 you1shi4。"

msgid "Maybe. But you can still turn this around."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​你​仍然​还有​机会​挽回​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 ni3 reng2ran2 hai2you3 ji1hui4 wan3hui2。"

msgid "Maybe. I just wish that we could have saved *somebody.*"
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​我​只是​希望​我们​哪怕​救​下​*​一个​人​*​也好​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。wo3 zhi3shi4 xi1wang4 wo3men5 na3pa4 jiu4 xia4*yi1ge5 ren2*ye3hao3。"

msgid ""
"Maybe. Maybe not. But we won't have to worry about her any more, and that's "
"all that matters to me."
msgstr ""
"也许​是​，​也许​不是​。​但​我们​现在​不用​再​担心​她​了​，​这​对​我​来说​就是​最​重要​的​。\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4，ye3xu3 bu4shi4。dan4 wo3men5 xian4zai4 bu4yong4 zai4 dan1xin1 ta1 le5，zhe4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 jiu4shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Maybe. Maybe not. Regardless, Marta was damaged goods... I can't even imagine the amount of psychological trauma that she'd be carrying if she were alive today.\n"
"\n"
"It'd take her years to recover, and in that time, she'd still be dangerous."
msgstr ""
"也许​是​。​也许​不是​。​无论如何​，​玛​尔塔​可以​说​是​个​“​残次品​”​……​若​她​活到​今天​，​我​简直​不敢​想象​她​会​背负​多少​心理​创伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​需要​数年​才能​康复​，​而​在此期间​，​她​依然​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4。ye3xu3 bu4shi4。wu2lun4ru2he2，Ma3er3ta3 ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 ge4“can2ci4pin3”……ruo4 ta1 huo2 dao4 jin1tian1，wo3 jian3zhi2 bu4 gan3 xiang3xiang4 ta1 hui4 bei1fu4 duo1shao3 xin1li3 chuang1shang1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xu1yao4 shu4nian2 cai2neng2 kang1fu4，er2 zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1，ta1 yi1ran2 wei1xian3。"

msgid "Maybe. Never knew my own. And Monika did take care of me."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​我​从没​见过​自己​的​母亲​。​而​莫妮卡​也​的确​照顾​了​我​。\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。wo3 cong2mei2 jian4 guo4 zi4ji3 de5 mu3qin1。er2 Mo4ni1ka3 ye3 di2que4 zhao4gu5 le5 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Maybe. Or maybe he knows for a fact that they won't run away - the shrine's influence won't let them.\n"
"\n"
"Either way, it's a sign of something. Harrow is getting lazy, letting his captive spirit do the heavy lifting for him."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​或许​是​他​确信​，​在​神龛​的​影响​下​，​他们​无法​逃离​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​这​都​是​一个​信号​。​哈罗​变得​懒惰​了​，​开始​让​他​的​精魂​俘虏​干​脏活​累活​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。huo4xu3 shi4 ta1 que4xin4，zai4 shen2kan1 de5 ying3xiang3 xia4，ta1men5 wu2fa3 tao2li2 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，zhe4 dou1 shi4 yi1ge5 xin4hao4。ha1luo2 bian4de5 lan3duo4 le5，kai1shi3 rang4 ta1 de5 jing1hun2 fu2lu3 gan4 zang4 huo2 lei3 huo2。"

msgid "Maybe. You could be that nuts. I've known guys who were."
msgstr ""
"万一​呢​。​你​可能​脑子​坏掉​了​。​我​以前​见过​这种​人​。\n"
"wan4yi1 ni2。ni3 ke3neng2 nao3zi5 huai4diao4 le5。wo3 yi3qian2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 ren2。"

msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​……\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1……"

msgid ""
"Me and my boys, we're the rightful protectors of this block. But the assholes that screwed us, they've got the building buttoned up pretty tight. \n"
"\n"
"We can't get in there to make things right... but maybe you can."
msgstr ""
"我​和​手底下​的​兄弟​们​才​是​这片​街区​的​合法​守护者​，​但​那些​攻击​我们​的​混蛋​却​把​这栋​楼守​得​严严实实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​没​办法​进去​解决问题​……​但​也许​你​可以​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 shou3 de5 xia4 de5 xiong1di4 men5 cai2 shi4 zhe4 pian1 jie1qu1 de5 he2fa3 shou3 hu4 zhe3，dan4 na4xie1 gong1ji1 wo3men5 de5 hun2dan4 que4 ba3 zhe4 dong4 lou2 shou3 de2 yan2yan2shi2shi2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 mei2 ban4fa3 jin4qu4 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2……dan4 ye3xu3 ni3 ke3yi3。"

msgid "Me neither."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4。"

msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""
"我​也​同意​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 tong2yi4。"

msgid "Me, too!"
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​！\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4！"

msgid ""
"Me? No. Never developed a taste for it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She tilts her glass, swirling the amber liquid inside.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not a big fan of sweet things - never have been, not even when I was a kid. I've always preferred smoke."
msgstr ""
"我​？​得了吧​，​我​可​没什么​品位​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​倾斜​酒杯​，​旋动​着​里面​的​琥珀色​液体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从小​就​不怎么​喜欢​甜​的​东西​。​如果​有​的​选​，​我​肯定​会选烟​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3？de2 le5 ba1，wo3 ke3 mei2shen2me5 pin3wei4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qing1xie2 jiu3bei1，xuan2 dong4 zhao2 li3mian4 de5 hu3 po4 se4 ye4ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2xiao3 jiu4 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 tian2 de5 dong1xi1。ru2guo3 you3 de5 xuan3，wo3 ken3ding4 hui4 xuan3 yan1。"

msgid "Me? Oh, I'm nobody important."
msgstr ""
"我​？​哦​，​我​不​重要​。\n"
"wo3？e2，wo3 bu4 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"Meanwhile, I'd be holed up at home with Mom, who would commemorate the event"
" by drinking a bottle of wine and crying herself to sleep."
msgstr ""
"与此同时​，​我​则​会​和​妈妈​窝​在​家里​，​她​纪念​这种​事情​的​方式​就是​喝掉​一瓶​酒​，​然后​哭​着​慢慢​睡​去​。\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，wo3 ze2 hui4 he4 ma1ma5 wo1 zai4 jia1li3，ta1 ji4nian4 zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 de5 fang1shi4 jiu4shi4 he1diao4 yi1 ping2 jiu3，ran2hou4 ku1 zhao2 man4man4 shui4 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Meanwhile, nearly three months after the death of the last dragon, global prosperity continues to rise.\n"
"\n"
"\"The markets have stabilized, and the power vacuums have been filled. And while the vast majority of draconic wealth has been absorbed into the coffers of various megacorps, enough has filtered back into the market to revitalize the global economy,\" said William Jeffers of the Brinkmann Institute."
msgstr ""
"与此同时​，​在​最后​一条​巨龙​逝去​近​三个​月​后​，​全球​繁荣​仍​在​持续​攀升​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​布林克​曼​研究所​的​威廉​·​杰​弗斯​表示​：​“​市场​已​趋于稳定​，​权力​真空​也​已​填补​。​尽管​绝大多数​巨龙​财富​已​被​各大​超企​吞并​，​但​仍​有​足够​资金​回流​市场​，​为​全球​经济​注入​了​新​的​活力​。​”\n"
"\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，zai4 zui4hou4 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 shi4qu4 jin4 san1 ge4 yue4 hou4，quan2qiu2 fan2rong2 reng2 zai4 chi2xu4 pan1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 lin2 ke4 man4 yan2jiu1suo3 de5 wei1lian2 · jie2 fu2 si1 biao3shi4：“shi4chang3 yi3 qu1 yu2 wen3 ding4，quan2li4 zhen1kong1 ye3 yi3 tian2bu3。jin3guan3 jue2da4duo1shu4 ju4long2 cai2fu4 yi3 bei4 ge4 dai4 chao1 qi3 tun1bing4，dan4 reng2 you3 zu2gou4 zi1jin1 hui2liu2 shi4chang3，wei2 quan2qiu2 jing1ji4 zhu4ru4 le5 xin1 de5 huo2li4。”"

msgid ""
"Meanwhile, reports of insect spirit activity in surrounding municipalities continue to flow in.\n"
"\n"
"There are rumors of small hives forming in Aurora, Arlington Heights, and Merrillville, and isolated reports of insect spirit activity have been reported as far north as Milwaukee."
msgstr ""
"与此同时​，​周边地区​持续​传来​昆虫​灵体​活动​的​报告​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​传言​称奥​罗拉​、​阿灵顿​高地​和​梅里​维尔​等​地​出现​了​小型​虫​巢​，​而​昆虫​灵体​活动​的​零星​报告​甚至​已北至​密尔沃基​。\n"
"\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，zhou1 bian1 de5 qu1 chi2xu4 chuan2lai2 kun1chong2 ling2ti3 huo2dong4 de5 bao4gao4。\n"
"\n"
"you3 chuan2yan2 chen4 ao4 luo2la1、e1 ling2 dun4 gao1di4 he4 mei2 li3 wei2 er3 deng3 de5 chu1xian4 le5 xiao3xing2 chong2 chao2，er2 kun1chong2 ling2ti3 huo2dong4 de5 ling2xing1 bao4gao4 shen4zhi4 yi3 bei3 zhi4 mi4er3wo4ji1。"

msgid ""
"Meanwhile, the homeowner backpedals, trying to put a wall between himself "
"and James. He's moving too slowly - much too slowly."
msgstr ""
"与此同时​，​房主​急忙​后退​，​试图​在​自己​和​詹姆斯​之间​筑起​一道​墙​。​他​的​动作​太慢​了​—​—​慢得​离谱​。\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，fang2zhu3 ji2mang2 hou4tui4，shi4tu2 zai4 zi4ji3 he4 zhan1mu3si1 zhi1jian1 zhu4 qi3 yi1dao4 qiang2。ta1 de5 dong4zuo4 tai4 man4 le5——man4 de2 li2pu3。"

msgid "Meat Grinder"
msgstr ""
"绞肉机\n"
"jiao3rou4ji1"

msgid ""
"Meat Grinder turns to leave, the plastic box cradled in his arms.\n"
"\n"
"Hasenkamp's body lies cooling on the ground."
msgstr ""
"“​绞肉机​”​转身​离开​，​怀里​抱​着​那个​塑料盒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈森​坎普​的​尸体​躺​在​地上​，​慢慢​失去​温度​。\n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” zhuan3shen1 li2kai1，huai2li3 bao4 zhao2 na4ge5 su4 liao4 he2。\n"
"\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 shi1ti3 tang3 zai4 di4shang5，man4man4 shi1qu4 wen1du4。"

msgid ""
"Meat Grinder's obliterated corpse lies steaming on the walkway just beyond the security gate.\n"
"\n"
"Some of the turret fire must have caught the box that he was carrying. It lays splayed open, its electronic guts spilled across the floor."
msgstr ""
"“​绞肉机​”​的​尸体​被​碾得​粉碎​，​蒸腾​着​热气​躺​在​安全​门外​的​走廊​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​炮塔​的​射击​肯定​是​打中​了​他​怀里​的​盒子​。​盖子​在​地上​敞开​着​，​里面​的​电子元件​散落​一地​。\n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 shi1ti3 bei4 nian3 de2 fen3sui4，zheng1teng2 zhao2 re4qi4 tang3 zai4 an1quan2 men2wai4 de5 zou3lang2 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"pao4ta3 de5 she4ji1 ken3ding4 shi4 da3zhong4 le5 ta1 huai2li3 de5 he2zi5。gai4zi5 zai4 di4shang5 chang3kai1 zhao2，li3mian4 de5 dian4 zi3 yuan2 jian4 san3luo4 yi1 de5。"

msgid "Medic Lvl 1"
msgstr ""
"医疗​I\n"
"yi1liao2 I"

msgid "Medic Lvl 2"
msgstr ""
"医疗​II\n"
"yi1liao2 II"

