msgstr ""
"医疗站\n"
"yi1 liao2 zhan4"

msgid "Medical Supplies"
msgstr ""
"医用​物资\n"
"yi1 yong4 wu4zi1"

msgid ""
"Medical ethics and street docs rarely go hand in hand. So long as he does "
"his job and I get what I pay for, I don't much care what he did back home."
msgstr ""
"街头​医生​和​医德​很少​沾边​。​只要​他​尽职尽责​，​我​得到​应得​的​治疗​，​我​才​不在乎​他​在​老家​干过​什么​破事​。\n"
"jie1tou2 yi1sheng1 he4 yi1de2 hen3 shao3 zhan1bian1。zhi3yao4 ta1 jin4zhi2jin4ze2，wo3 de2dao4 ying1de2 de5 zhi4liao2，wo3 cai2 bu4zai4hu5 ta1 zai4 lao3jia1 gan4 guo4 shen2me5 po4shi4。"

msgid "Medicine Cabinet"
msgstr ""
"药柜\n"
"yao4 ju3"

msgid "Medium Cover"
msgstr ""
"中型​掩体\n"
"zhong1xing2 yan3ti3"

msgid "Meet the Man on the Top Floor"
msgstr ""
"前往​顶层​与​男人​见面\n"
"qian2wang3 ding3ceng2 yu4 nan2ren2 jian4mian4"

msgid ""
"Meet the newest addition to my arsenal. I call it the \"voltaic grenade.\" \n"
"\n"
"It's based on the same principles as the Russian pulse grenade, but with a few tweaks of my own."
msgstr ""
"来​认识一下​我​军火库​里​的​最新​装备​吧​。​我​给​它​取名​叫​“​电流​手雷​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​和​俄制​脉冲​手雷​原理​相同​，​但​我​做​了​些小​调整​。\n"
"\n"
"lai2 ren4 shi2 yi1 xia4 wo3 jun1huo3ku4 li3 de5 zui4xin1 zhuang1bei4 ba1。wo3 gei3 ta1 qu3ming2 jiao4“dian4liu2 shou3lei2”。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 he4 e2 zhi4 mai4chong1 shou3lei2 yuan2li3 xiang1tong2，dan4 wo3 zuo4 le5 xie1 xiao3 tiao2zheng3。"

msgid "Meet with Altuğ"
msgstr ""
"与​奥图​伊​见面\n"
"yu4 ao4 tu2 yi1 jian4mian4"

msgid "Meet with Altuğ Burakgazi"
msgstr ""
"与​奥图​伊​·​布拉加​齐​见面\n"
"yu4 ao4 tu2 yi1 · bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 jian4mian4"

msgid "Meet with Dr. Ezkibel"
msgstr ""
"与​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​见面\n"
"yu4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 jian4mian4"

msgid "Meet with Eiger's Contact"
msgstr ""
"与​艾格尔​的​联系人​见面\n"
"yu4 Ai4ge2er3 de5 lian2xi4ren2 jian4mian4"

msgid "Meet with Frau Müller"
msgstr ""
"与​穆勒​女士​见面\n"
"yu4 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 jian4mian4"

msgid "Meet with Gunari About the Missing Shipment"
msgstr ""
"与​古纳里​见面​讨论​丢失​的​货物\n"
"yu4 gu3 na4 li3 jian4mian4 tao3lun4 diu1shi1 de5 huo4wu4"

msgid "Meet with Samuel Beckenbauer About a Job"
msgstr ""
"与​塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔​见面​聊聊​差事\n"
"yu4 sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3 jian4mian4 liao2 liao2 cha4shi4"

msgid "Meet with the Team"
msgstr ""
"与​队员​们​见面\n"
"yu4 dui4yuan2 men5 jian4mian4"

msgid ""
"Meeting a *new* person... it's a novel experience. Nothing is ever *new* to us.\n"
"\n"
"The sensation is strange. How to describe it...?"
msgstr ""
"遇见​一个​*​新​的​*​人​……​是​一种​新奇​的​体验​。​从来​没有​任何​事​对​我们​来说​是​*​新​的​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​情感​很​奇怪​。​该​如何​描述​呢​……​？\n"
"\n"
"yu4jian4 yi1ge5*xin1 de5*ren2……shi4 yi1zhong3 xin1qi2 de5 ti3yan4。cong2lai2 mei2you3 ren4he2 shi4 dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 shi4*xin1 de5*。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 qing2gan3 hen3 qi2guai4。gai1 ru2he2 miao2shu4 ni2……？"

msgid "Meh, not interested. Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""
"啧​，​不感兴趣​。​还是​谢​了​。\n"
"ze2，bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。hai2shi5 xie4 le5。"

msgid "Melee Weapons"
msgstr ""
"近战​武器\n"
"jin4 zhan4 wu3qi4"

msgid ""
"Melee range. A toxin sac implanted above the larynx sprays a poisonous mist "
"into the target's face. Ignores all armor."
msgstr ""
"只能​对​近战​范围​内​的​目标​使用​。​使用​植入​喉部​上方​的​毒素​囊​向​目标​面部​喷射​毒雾​。​无视​所有​护甲​。\n"
"zhi3neng2 dui4 jin4 zhan4 fan4wei2 nei4 de5 mu4biao1 shi3yong4。shi3yong4 zhi2ru4 hou2bu4 shang4fang1 de5 du2su4 nang2 xiang4 mu4biao1 mian4bu4 pen1she4 du2 wu4。wu2shi4 suo3you3 hu4jia3。"

msgid ""
"Melee: A deadly weapon and a work of art. May do AP DMG on a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​兼具​艺术性​与​杀伤力​的​武器​。​在​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：jian1ju4 yi4 shu4 xing4 yu4 sha1shang1li4 de5 wu3qi4。zai4 bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid "Melee: A heavy axe made for cutting up your enemies."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​一把​沉重​的​斧头​，​用于​把​你​的​敌人​大卸八块​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：yi1 ba3 chen2zhong4 de5 fu3tou2，yong4yu2 ba3 ni3 de5 di2ren2 dai4 xie4 ba1 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"Melee: A katana that has undergone the Dikote process, making it truly "
"deadly. May do AP DMG on critical hits."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​经过​钻石​涂层​工艺​处理​的​刀剑​，​真正​的​致命​凶器​。​命中​时有​可能​对​目标​造成​行动​点​损失​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：jing1guo4 zuan4shi2 tu2ceng2 gong1yi4 chu3li3 de5 dao1jian4，zhen1zheng4 de5 zhi4ming4 xiong1qi4。ming4zhong4 shi2 you3 ke3neng2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 dian3 sun3shi1。"

msgid ""
"Melee: A more accurate sword with monofilament wire attached to the blade "
"edges. Extremely sharp and unlikely to blunt."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​一把​更​精准​的​剑​，​剑刃​上​附着​单​丝线​。​极其​锋利​，​不易​钝化​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：yi1 ba3 geng1 jing1zhun3 de5 jian4，jian4 ren4 shang4 fu4zhuo2 dan1 si1xian4。ji2qi2 feng1li4，bu4yi4 dun4 hua4。"

msgid ""
"Melee: A work of art and a deadly weapon. May do AP DMG on a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​兼具​艺术性​与​杀伤力​的​武器​。​在​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：jian1ju4 yi4 shu4 xing4 yu4 sha1shang1li4 de5 wu3qi4。zai4 bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"Melee: Basically, a sharp piece of metal with a handle. May do AP DMG on a "
"critical hit."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​基本上​就是​一个​带​把手​的​锋利​金属片​。​在​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：ji1ben3shang5 jiu4shi4 yi1ge5 dai4 ba3shou3 de5 feng1li4 jin1 shu3 pian1。zai4 bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid "Melee: Cool sword. May do AP DMG on a critical hit."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​一把​很酷​的​剑​。​在​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：yi1 ba3 hen3 ku4 de5 jian4。zai4 bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"Melee: Has two welding lasers focused along the cutting edge, greatly "
"improving its cutting effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​配备​了​两台​沿着​斧刃​边缘​聚焦​的​焊接​激光器​，​大幅提高​了​切割​效率​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：pei4bei4 le5 liang3 tai2 yan2zhe5 fu3 ren4 bian1yuan2 ju4jiao1 de5 han4jie1 ji1guang1qi4，dai4 fu2 ti2 gao1 le5 qie1ge1 xiao4lu:4。"

msgid "Melee: Knock 'em out of the park with this old-fashioned slugger."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​用​这款​复古​重炮​手​击出​全垒打​，​震撼​全场​！\n"
"jin4 zhan4：yong4 zhe4 kuan3 fu4gu3 zhong4pao4 shou3 ji1 chu1 quan2lei3da3，zhen4han4 quan2chang3！"

msgid ""
"Melee: This machete has seen you through a few runs, but it's starting to "
"dull."
msgstr ""
"近战​：​这​把​砍刀​和​你​一起​度过​了​几次​任务​，​但​它​开始​变钝​了​。\n"
"jin4 zhan4：zhe4 ba3 kan3dao1 he4 ni3 yi1qi3 du4guo4 le5 ji3ci4 ren4wu5，dan4 ta1 kai1shi3 bian4 dun4 le5。"

msgid "Meltdown"
msgstr ""
"熔毁\n"
"rong2hui3"

msgid "Melted Simsense Chip"
msgstr ""
"熔化​的​拟感​芯片\n"
"rong2hua4 de5 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4"

msgid ""
"Memories of the explosion that toppled the Aztechnology facility keep you company on your ride back to the Kreuzbasar. You barely managed to outrun the blast. Now the facility lies buried under thousands of kilograms of twisted rebar and reinforced concrete, no doubt a considerable blow to Aztechnology’s activities here in Berlin.\n"
"\n"
"Mission successful. It’s time to get paid."
msgstr ""
"在​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​路上​，​你​一直​回想​着​那场​摧毁​了​阿兹特​科技​设施​的​爆炸​。​你​当时​险些​也​葬身​其中​。​如今​，​这座​设施​已​被​数千​公斤​扭曲​的​钢筋​混凝土​掩埋​，​这​无疑​对​阿兹特​科技​在​柏林​的​业务​造成​了​沉重打击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​任务​成功​完成​。​是​时候​去​领​报酬​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lu4shang5，ni3 yi1zhi2 hui2xiang3 zhao2 na4 chang2 cui1hui3 le5 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1 de5 bao4zha4。ni3 dang1shi2 xian3xie1 ye3 zang4shen1 qi2zhong1。ru2jin1，zhe4 zuo4 she4shi1 yi3 bei4 shu3 qian1 gong1jin1 niu3qu1 de5 gang1jin1 hun4ning2tu3 yan3mai2，zhe4 wu2yi2 dui4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 zai4 bo2lin2 de5 ye4wu4 zao4cheng2 le5 chen2zhong4da3ji1。\n"
"\n"
"ren4wu5 cheng2gong1 wan2cheng2。shi4 shi2hou5 qu4 ling3 bao4chou5 le5。"

