"佣兵​：​修士\n"
"yong1bing1：xiu1shi4"

msgid "Mercenary: Decker"
msgstr ""
"佣兵​：​碟客\n"
"yong1bing1：die2 ke4"

msgid "Mercenary: Rigger"
msgstr ""
"佣兵​：​机师\n"
"yong1bing1：ji1shi1"

msgid "Mercenary: Shaman Pugilist"
msgstr ""
"佣兵​：​萨满​格斗​手\n"
"yong1bing1：sa4man3 ge2dou4 shou3"

msgid "Mercenary: Street Samurai"
msgstr ""
"佣兵​：​街头​武士\n"
"yong1bing1：jie1tou2 wu3shi4"

msgid "Merchant"
msgstr ""
"商人\n"
"shang1ren2"

msgid "Mercifully, the video feed cuts to static."
msgstr ""
"幸运​的​是​，​视频​画面​终于​切换​成​了​雪花​屏​。\n"
"xing4yun4 de5 shi4，shi4pin2 hua4mian4 zhong1yu2 qie1huan4 cheng2 le5 xue3hua1 bing3。"

msgid "Message File"
msgstr ""
"留言​文件\n"
"liu2yan2 wen2jian4"

msgid "Messages"
msgstr ""
"信息\n"
"xin4xi1"

msgid ""
"Metzger. Best leader I've ever had the pleasure of serving under.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her face clouds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He was a hell of a man."
msgstr ""
"梅茨​格是​我​有幸​效力​过​的​最​优秀​的​队长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​脸色​变得​阴沉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​是​个​了不起​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ci2 ge2 shi4 wo3 you3xing4 xiao4li4 guo4 de5 zui4 you1xiu4 de5 dui4zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3se4 bian4de5 yin1chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 liao3bu5qi3 de5 ren2。"

msgid "Middle-aged former punk rocker and shaman of the Dragonslayer icon."
msgstr ""
"人到中年​的​前​朋克​摇滚歌手​，​也​是​屠龙​者​标志​的​萨满​。\n"
"ren2 dao4 zhong4 nian2 de5 qian2 peng2ke4 yao2 gun3 ge1 shou3，ye3 shi4 tu2 long2 zhe3 biao1zhi4 de5 sa4man3。"

msgid "Might as well get to it."
msgstr ""
"开工​吧​。\n"
"kai1gong1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Might as well hear it from me than one of the addlebrained kids running "
"about."
msgstr ""
"让​我​来说​也好​，​省得​那些​乱跑​的​孩子​们​四处​胡说八道​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 ye3hao3，sheng3de5 na4xie1 luan4pao3 de5 hai2zi5 men5 si4chu4 hu2shuo1ba1dao4。"

msgid "Mildhero"
msgstr ""
"和善​英雄\n"
"he2shan4 ying1xiong2"

msgid "Militia Captain"
msgstr ""
"民兵​队长\n"
"min2bing1 dui4zhang3"

msgid "Militia Mage"
msgstr ""
"民兵​法师\n"
"min2bing1 fa3shi1"

msgid "Militiaman"
msgstr ""
"民兵\n"
"min2bing1"

msgid ""
"Milk run or not, we should be careful.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory. Razor-clawed street samurai. Her voice is cold and neutral, her expression placid.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"不管​是不是​轻松​的​活​，​我们​都​该​谨慎​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​。​使​螳螂​刀​的​街头​武士​。​她面​无表情​，​声音​冷淡​而​平静​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 shi4bu5shi4 qing1song1 de5 huo2，wo3men5 dou1 gai1 jin3shen4 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2。shi3 tang2lang2 dao1 de5 jie1tou2 wu3shi4。ta1 mian4 wu2biao3qing2，sheng1yin1 leng3dan4 er2 ping2jing4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Milspec Flight Suit"
msgstr ""
"军用​飞行服\n"
"jun1yong4 fei1 xing2 fu2"

msgid "Mind Wipe"
msgstr ""
"记忆​擦除\n"
"ji4yi4 ca1chu2"

msgid "Mind Wiped: Ignores All Enemies"
msgstr ""
"记忆​擦除​：​无视​所有​敌人\n"
"ji4yi4 ca1chu2：wu2shi4 suo3you3 di2ren2"

msgid ""
"Mine has a lot more bite than the original. I bumped up the amperage quite a bit.\n"
"\n"
"When that thing goes off, it'll both shut down the nervous system and cook the organs of anyone in its blast radius."
msgstr ""
"我​做​的​这个​比​原型​版本​要​厉害​多​了​。​我​把​电流强度​调高​了​不少​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​爆炸​的​时候​，​不仅​能​使​杀伤​半径​内​目标​的​神经系统​瘫痪​，​还会​把​他们​的​内脏器官​都​烤熟​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zuo4 de5 zhe4ge5 bi3 yuan2xing2 ban3ben3 yao4 li4hai5 duo1 le5。wo3 ba3 dian4liu2qiang2du4 diao4 gao1 le5 bu4shao3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bao4zha4 de5 shi2hou5，bu4jin3 neng2 shi3 sha1shang1 ban4jing4 nei4 mu4biao1 de5 shen2jing1xi4tong3 tan1huan4，hai2 hui4 ba3 ta1men5 de5 nei4 zang4 qi4 guan1 dou1 kao3 shu2。"

msgid ""
"Mine, too.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich's voice is low, barely a whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You take this step, boss, an' I'll put you down like a rabid dog. This is the only warning I'm gonna give you."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​的​声音​很​低​，​几乎​听不见​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​你​要是​敢​迈出​这​一步​，​我​就​把​你​像​疯狗​一样​干掉​。​这​是​我​给​你​的​唯一​警告​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 di1，ji1hu1 ting1bu5jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，ni3 yao4shi5 gan3 mai4chu1 zhe4 yi1 bu4，wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3 xiang4 feng1 gou3 yi1yang4 gan4diao4。zhe4 shi4 wo3 gei3 ni3 de5 wei2yi1 jing3gao4。"

msgid "Minigun"
msgstr ""
"转轮​机枪\n"
"zhuan4lun2 ji1qiang1"

msgid "Mira"
msgstr ""
"米拉\n"
"mi3la1"

msgid "Mira, that doesn't even..."
msgstr ""
"米拉​，​你​没​必要​这样​……\n"
"mi3la1，ni3 mei2 bi4yao4 zhe4yang4……"

msgid ""
"Mira. Look at her. That's a *professional.* She can help us.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a step toward you, his arms wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please, ma'am. We *do* need your help. She just doesn't want to admit it."
msgstr ""
"米拉​。​看看​她​。​这​是​个​*​专业人士​*​。​他​能​帮​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朝​你​走出​一步​，​双臂​张开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拜托​了​，​女士​。​我们​*​确实​*​需要​帮助​。​她​只是​不​愿意​承认​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"mi3la1。kan4kan5 ta1。zhe4 shi4 ge4*zhuan1ye4ren2shi4*。ta1 neng2 bang1 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 zou3chu1 yi1 bu4，shuang1bi4 zhang1kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1 le5，nu:3shi4。wo3men5*que4shi2*xu1yao4 bang1zhu4。ta1 zhi3shi4 bu4 yuan4yi4 cheng2ren4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"Mira. Look at him. That's a *professional.* He can help us.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a step toward you, his arms wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please, man. We *do* need your help. She just doesn't want to admit it."
msgstr ""
"米拉​。​看看​他​。​这​是​个​*​专业人士​*​。​他​能​帮​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朝​你​走出​一步​，​双臂​张开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拜托​了​。​我们​*​确实​*​需要​帮助​。​她​只是​不​愿意​承认​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"mi3la1。kan4kan5 ta1。zhe4 shi4 ge4*zhuan1ye4ren2shi4*。ta1 neng2 bang1 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 zou3chu1 yi1 bu4，shuang1bi4 zhang1kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1 le5。wo3men5*que4shi2*xu1yao4 bang1zhu4。ta1 zhi3shi4 bu4 yuan4yi4 cheng2ren4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"Miserable bastard.\n"
"\n"
"All right, if what you're tellin' me is true, how'd you walk out alive?"
msgstr ""
"真他妈​纯​畜生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​如果​你​说​的​是​真的​，​那​你​又​是​怎么​活​下来​的​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 ta1 ma1 chun2 chu4sheng5。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，ru2guo3 ni3 shuo1 de5 shi4 zhen1de5，na4 ni3 you4 shi4 zen3me5 huo2 xia4lai5 de5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Miserable son of a bitch, I had to share an office with that man for--\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He cuts himself short.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Never mind. You don't need to know."
msgstr ""
"就是​个​王八​犊子​，​我​以前​还​得​跟​他​在​同一​间​办公室​里​—​—​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​说​到​一半​停住​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没什么​。​你​不​需要​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 ge4 wang2ba5 du2zi5，wo3 yi3qian2 hai2 de2 gen1 ta1 zai4 tong2yi1 jian1 ban4gong1shi4 li3——\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuo1 dao4 yi1ban4 ting2zhu4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5。ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "Missed!"
msgstr ""
"未​命中​！\n"
"wei4 ming4zhong4！"

msgid "Mission Computer"
msgstr ""
"任务​电脑\n"
"ren4wu5 dian4nao3"

msgid "Mission Item Added: "
msgstr ""
"任务​物品​已​添加​：\n"
"ren4wu5 wu4pin3 yi3 tian1jia1："

msgid "Mission Item Removed: "
msgstr ""
"任务​物品​已​移除​：\n"
"ren4wu5 wu4pin3 yi3 yi2chu2："

msgid "Mission Items"
msgstr ""
"任务​物品\n"
"ren4wu5 wu4pin3"

msgid ""
"Mission accomplished, colonel. Those that attacked the Kreuzbasar won't be "
"troubling us anymore."
msgstr ""
"任务​完成​，​上校​。​那些​袭击​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人​不会​再​来​侵扰​我们​了​。\n"
"ren4wu5 wan2cheng2，shang4xiao4。na4xie1 xi2ji1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2 bu4hui4 zai4 lai2 qin1rao3 wo3men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Mission accomplished. Fucking *finally.*\n"
"\n"
"Call your handler and tell him that the job is done. And be quick about it - I need to be on the next train out of here."
msgstr ""
"任务​完成​。​总算​他妈​完事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​跟​你​的​联络人​说​，​差事​已经​搞定​了​。​动作​快点​，​我要​乘下​一班​列车​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"ren4wu5 wan2cheng2。zong3suan4 ta1 ma1 wan2shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"gen1 ni3 de5 lian2luo4ren2 shuo1，cha4shi4 yi3jing1 gao3ding4 le5。dong4zuo4 kuai4dian3，wo3 yao4 cheng2 xia4 yi1 ban1 lie4che1 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Misunderstanding, my ass. Your friend just called me an idiot in my own home!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He wheels on James, his hands balled into fists.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I want to know your employee number, and I want to know it *now.*"
msgstr ""
"误会​个​屁​。​你​朋友​居然​敢​在​我​的​家里​说​我​是​蠢货​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​猛地​转向​詹姆斯​，​双手​紧握​成拳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​知道​你​的​工号​，​*​立刻​*​告诉​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wu4hui4 ge4 pi4。ni3 peng2you5 ju1ran2 gan3 zai4 wo3 de5 jia1li3 shuo1 wo3 shi4 chun3huo4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 meng3de5 zhuan3xiang4 zhan1mu3si1，shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 zhi1dao4 ni3 de5 gong1hao4，*li4ke4*gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "Mmm. Delicious, thank you."
msgstr ""
"呼​，​真​好吃​。​谢谢​。\n"
"hu1，zhen1 hao3chi1。xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"Moments later, his shoulders jerk back in alarm. In a flash, the guard "
"readies his weapon."
msgstr ""
"片刻​之后​，​他​的​肩膀​惊恐​地向​后​一缩​。​下​一瞬间​，​警卫​立刻​举起​了​武器​。\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ta1 de5 jian1bang3 jing1kong3 de5 xiang4 hou4 yi1 suo1。xia4 yi1shun4jian1，jing3wei4 li4ke4 ju3qi3 le5 wu3qi4。"

msgid ""
"Money? We don't have much.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks away, uncertainty in his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But... I have managed to put a little away. I was hoping to surprise my wife with it..."
msgstr ""
"钱​？​我们​没什么​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转过​头​，​眼中​流露出​几分​犹豫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​……​我​确实​存​了​一些​。​我​本来​想​给​我​妻子​一个​惊喜​……\n"
"\n"
"qian2？wo3men5 mei2shen2me5 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2，yan3zhong1 liu2 lou4 chu1 ji3fen1 you2yu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4……wo3 que4shi2 cun2 le5 yi1xie1。wo3 ben3lai2 xiang3 gei3 wo3 qi1zi3 yi1ge5 jing1xi3……"

msgid "Monika"
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3"

msgid ""
"Monika bought him from me some time ago. He was a special order. She thought"
" he could guard Herr Amsel while she was away on business. "
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​前​些​日子​从​我​这里​买下​了​他​。​这是​一份​特殊​订单​。​她​觉得​这样一来​，​她​出门​接活​的​时候​，​阿姆​泽尔​先生​的​安全​也​能​得到​保障​了​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 qian2 xie1 ri4zi5 cong2 wo3 zhe4li3 mai3xia4 le5 ta1。zhe4 shi4 yi1 fen4 te4shu1 ding4dan1。ta1 jue2de5 zhe4yang4yi1lai2，ta1 chu1men2 jie1huo2 de5 shi2hou5，E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 de5 an1quan2 ye3 neng2 de2dao4 bao3zhang4 le5。"

msgid "Monika didn't make it. We barely got out ourselves."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​没能活​下来​。​我们​也​差点​死​在​里面​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 mei2 neng2 huo2 xia4lai5。wo3men5 ye3 cha4dian3 si3 zai4 li3mian4。"

msgid ""
"Monika found a way to open the doors, but it’s going to take some time. "
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​找到​了​开门​的​法子​，​就是​得​等​一会儿​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 zhao3dao4 le5 kai1men2 de5 fa3zi5，jiu4shi4 de2 deng3 yi1hui4r5。"

msgid "Monika gave me a job. I'm not the type to leave a job undone."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​给​我​安排​了​一份​工作​。​我​不是​那种​会​半途而废​的​人​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 gei3 wo3 an1pai2 le5 yi1 fen4 gong1zuo4。wo3 bu4shi4 na4zhong3 hui4 ban4tu2er2fei4 de5 ren2。"

msgid "Monika has been avenged, and then some."
msgstr ""
"我们​为​莫妮卡​复仇​了​，​而且​有过之而无不及​。\n"
"wo3men5 wei2 Mo4ni1ka3 fu4chou2 le5，er2qie3 you3guo4zhi1er2wu2bu4ji2。"

msgid ""
"Monika helped a lot of people. Now that she's gone, she can't any more. "
"Simple."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​帮助​了​许多​人​。​现在​她​不​在​了​，​没​办法​再​帮助​别人​了​。​就​这么​简单​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 bang1zhu4 le5 xu3duo1 ren2。xian4zai4 ta1 bu4 zai4 le5，mei2 ban4fa3 zai4 bang1zhu4 bie2ren5 le5。jiu4 zhe4me5 jian3dan1。"

msgid "Monika is dead. So what the hell are you?"
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​已经​死​了​。​你​到底​是​什么​东西​？\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 yi3jing1 si3 le5。ni3 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 dong1xi1？"

msgid ""
"Monika lived long enough to say a name: \"Feuerschwinge.\" She fought hard "
"to tell us... it must be important."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​死前​强撑​着​说出​了​一个​名字​：​“​火翼​”​。​她​拼上​性命​也​要说​出来​的​情报​……​这​一定​很​重要​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 si3 qian2 qiang3cheng1 zhao2 shuo1chu1 le5 yi1ge5 ming2zi5：“Huo3yi4”。ta1 pin1 shang4 xing4ming4 ye3 yao4shuo1 chu1lai2 de5 qing2bao4……zhe4 yi1ding4 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid "Monika nods at you. The smile has disappeared from her face."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​朝​你​点点头​，​脸上​笑容​不再​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 xiao4rong2 bu4zai4。"

msgid ""
"Monika rolls her eyes. Dietrich fixes his stare intently on the vault door.\n"
"\n"
"Glory looks cold and distant. Just as she always does."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​翻​了​个​白眼​。​迪​特里​希​眼睛​一​眨​不​眨​，​死​盯​着​保险库​的​大门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​还是​老​样子​：​表情​冷漠​，​一副​拒人千里​的​模样​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。Di2te4li3xi1 yan3jing5 yi1 zha3 bu4 zha3，si3 ding1 zhao2 bao3 xian3 ku4 de5 da4men2。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 hai2shi5 lao3 yang4zi5：biao3qing2 leng3mo4，yi1 fu4 ju4 ren2 qian1 li3 de5 mu2yang4。"

msgid ""
"Monika said I would forget. She thought the sims might help. In there, I'm "
"strong. And I never have to lose anyone."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​说​我会​忘记​的​。​她​觉得​拟感​或许​能​帮​上​忙​。​在​那​里面​，​我​是​强大​的​，​而且​永远​不必​失去​任何人​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 shuo1 wo3 hui4 wang4ji4 de5。ta1 jue2de5 ni3 gan3 huo4xu3 neng2 bang1 shang4 mang2。zai4 na4 li3mian4，wo3 shi4 qiang2da4 de5，er2qie3 yong3yuan3 bu4bi4 shi1qu4 ren4 he2 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Monika said a mother is always a mother. Always.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She hugs herself tighter and stares blankly at the ground.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​说​母亲​永远​是​母亲​。​永远​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​将​自己​抱得​更​紧​，​茫然​地​盯​着​地面​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 shuo1 mu3qin1 yong3yuan3 shi4 mu3qin1。yong3yuan3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 zi4ji3 bao4 de2 geng1 jin3，mang2ran2 de5 ding1 zhao2 di4mian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Monika said a mother is always a mother. Even when her baby dies inside her.\n"
"\n"
"She said she would go to heaven."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​说​，​女人​一旦​成​了​母亲​，​就​永远都是​母亲​，​哪怕​她​的​孩子​死​在​了​她​的​身体​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​说​她​会上​天堂​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 shuo1，nu:3ren2 yi1dan4 cheng2 le5 mu3qin1，jiu4 yong3 yuan3 dou1 shi4 mu3qin1，na3pa4 ta1 de5 hai2zi5 si3 zai4 le5 ta1 de5 shen1ti3 li3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 ta1 hui4 shang4 tian1tang2。"

msgid ""
"Monika stares at the screen on her wrist for a moment, clearly irritated. Then that twinkle appears in her eye again.\n"
"\n"
"She smiles at you as she speaks into her commlink."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​瞪视​着​手腕​上​的​屏幕​，​显然​是​生气​了​。​不过​没过多久​，​那种​调皮​的​光芒​再次​闪现​在​她​眼睛​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​朝​你​挑起​嘴角​，​对​着​通讯​链开​了​口​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 deng4 shi4 zhao2 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 ping2mu4，xian3ran2 shi4 sheng1qi4 le5。bu4guo4 mei2 guo4 duo1 jiu3，na4zhong3 tiao2pi2 de5 guang1mang2 zai4ci4 shan3xian4 zai4 ta1 yan3jing5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chao2 ni3 tiao3qi3 zui3jiao3，dui4 zhao2 tong1xun4 lian4 kai1 le5 kou3。"

msgid ""
"Monika stares at you for a moment, clearly irritated. Then that twinkle appears in her eye again.\n"
"\n"
"She smiles at you as she speaks into her commlink."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​瞪​了​你​一会儿​，​显然​是​生气​了​。​不过​没过多久​，​那种​调皮​的​光芒​再次​闪现​在​她​眼睛​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​朝​你​挑起​嘴角​，​对​着​通讯​链开​了​口​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 deng4 le5 ni3 yi1hui4r5，xian3ran2 shi4 sheng1qi4 le5。bu4guo4 mei2 guo4 duo1 jiu3，na4zhong3 tiao2pi2 de5 guang1mang2 zai4ci4 shan3xian4 zai4 ta1 yan3jing5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chao2 ni3 tiao3qi3 zui3jiao3，dui4 zhao2 tong1xun4 lian4 kai1 le5 kou3。"

msgid ""
"Monika told me that you moved here from the Rhine-Ruhr-Megaplex. \n"
"\n"
"Made it sound like you'd been there for a good many years - successful years, at that."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​跟​我​说​过​，​你​是从​莱茵​-​鲁尔​大都会​区​搬​来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​起来​你​好像​在​那里​待​了​好些​年​，​而且​生活​还​蛮​滋润​的​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 gen1 wo3 shuo1 guo4，ni3 shi4 cong2 lai2 yin1 -lu3 er3 da4du1hui4 qu1 ban1 lai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 ni3 hao3xiang4 zai4 na4li5 dai1 le5 hao3xie1 nian2，er2qie3 sheng1huo2 hai2 man2 zi1run4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Monika was a good friend of mine. Her death hurt. I got carried away, and I said some things that I shouldn't have.\n"
"\n"
"I want to apologize for that."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​是​我​的​挚友​，​她​的​死​令​我​悲伤​不已​。​我​当时​情绪​失控​了​，​说​了​些​蠢话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​为此​道歉​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 shi4 wo3 de5 zhi4you3，ta1 de5 si3 ling3 wo3 bei1shang1 bu4yi3。wo3 dang1shi2 qing2xu4 shi1kong4 le5，shuo1 le5 xie1 chun3hua4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 wei4ci3 dao4qian4。"

msgid ""
"Monika was always nice. And Paul Amsel. And the angel is nice to me too, "
"usually."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​一直​都​很​友好​。​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​也​是​。​通常​情况​下​，​天使​对​我​也​很​友好​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 yi1zhi2 dou1 hen3 you3hao3。bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 ye3 shi4。tong1chang2 qing2kuang4 xia4，tian1shi3 dui4 wo3 ye3 hen3 you3hao3。"

msgid ""
"Monika was approached recently by a man who calls himself \"Green Winters.\" He used to be a prominent activist in the F-State political scene. \n"
"\n"
"I never much liked the man, and I certainly never trusted him."
msgstr ""
"有​个人​这​两天​联系​上​了​莫妮卡​。​他​自称​“​格林​·​温特斯​”​，​是​曾经​活跃​在​动荡​带​政治​领域​里​的​重要​人物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​不怎么​喜欢​这个​人​，​而且​我​也​绝对​没​信任​过​他​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ge4ren2 zhe4 liang3 tian1 lian2xi4 shang4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3。ta1 zi4cheng1“ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1”，shi4 ceng2jing1 huo2yue4 zai4 dong4dang4 dai4 zheng4zhi4 ling3yu4 li3 de5 zhong4yao4 ren2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 zhe4ge5 ren2，er2qie3 wo3 ye3 jue2dui4 mei2 xin4ren4 guo4 ta1。"

msgid "Monika was close with everyone here."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​和​这里​的​每个​人​都​很​亲近​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 he4 zhe4li3 de5 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 hen3 qin1jin4。"

msgid ""
"Monika was good. She was the best, right?\n"
"\n"
"But she was also overconfident. She treated the job like it was a game. Do that long enough, and you're gonna get burned."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​很​不错​。​她​的​技术​是​最好​的​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​她​也​自信​过头​了​。​她​把​工作​当成​儿戏​。​一直​这么​干​下去​，​你​就​会​惹火​上身​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 hen3 bu4cuo4。ta1 de5 ji4shu4 shi4 zui4hao3 de5，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1 ye3 zi4xin4 guo4tou2 le5。ta1 ba3 gong1zuo4 dang4cheng2 er2xi4。yi1zhi2 zhe4me5 gan4 xia4qu4，ni3 jiu4 hui4 re3huo3 shang4shen1。"

msgid "Monika was important to this place."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​对​这个​地方​曾经​很​重要​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 dui4 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 ceng2jing1 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"Monika was my friend. I cared about her. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich shrugs.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"I dunno, I guess that I just want to get to know her better. There were some areas of her life that have always been a mystery, and if you could shed any light on them, I'd be appreciative."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​是​我​的​朋友​，​我​很​在乎​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​不​知道​，​大概​就是​想​更​了解​她​吧​。​她​生命​中​的​某些​领域​始终​是​个​谜​，​如果​你​能​帮​我​解开​这些​谜团​，​我会​非常感激​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 shi4 wo3 de5 peng2you5，wo3 hen3 zai4hu5 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4，da4gai4 jiu4shi4 xiang3 geng1 liao3jie3 ta1 ba1。ta1 sheng1ming4 zhong4 de5 mou3xie1 ling3yu4 shi3zhong1 shi4 ge4 mei4，ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3 jie3kai1 zhe4xie1 mi2tuan2，wo3 hui4 fei1 chang2 gan3 ji1。"

msgid ""
"Monika was trying to tell me something about this terminal. It must be "
"important."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​里​有​莫妮卡​想​告诉​我​的​事情​。​这​一定​很​重要​。\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 li3 you3 Mo4ni1ka3 xiang3 gao4su4 wo3 de5 shi4qing5。zhe4 yi1ding4 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid "Monika will take care of her."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​会​照顾​好​她​的​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 hui4 zhao4gu5 hao3 ta1 de5。"

msgid "Monika! No... no, this isn't happening. This can't be happening."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​！​不​……​怎么​会​这样​，​这​不​可能​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3！bu4……zen3me5 hui4 zhe4yang4，zhe4 bu4 ke3neng2。"

msgid "Monika's death deserves vengeance. I intend to see it done."
msgstr ""
"我们​会替​莫妮卡​报仇​，​我​发誓​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 ti4 Mo4ni1ka3 bao4chou2，wo3 fa1shi4。"

msgid "Monika's down, Eiger. The vault was a setup."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​倒​了​，​艾格尔​。​保险库​是​个​陷阱​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 dao3 le5，Ai4ge2er3。bao3 xian3 ku4 shi4 ge4 xian4jing3。"

msgid ""
"Monika's face ruptures. Splits open. Unfolds in an explosion of static.\n"
"\n"
"Something cold and mechanical fills your vision."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​面孔​炸裂​开来​，​变成​一团​噼啪​作响​的​雪花​信号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​某种​冰冷​而​机械​的​东西​充斥​在​你​的​视野​中​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 de5 mian4kong3 zha4lie4 kai1 lai2，bian4cheng2 yi1 tuan2 pi1pa1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 xue3hua1 xin4hao4。\n"
"\n"
"mou3zhong3 bing1leng3 er2 ji1xie4 de5 dong1xi1 chong1chi4 zai4 ni3 de5 shi4ye3 zhong4。"

msgid "Monika? Is she one of the sisters at the abbey?"
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​？​她​是​修道院​里​的​某个​修女​吗​？\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3？ta1 shi4 xiu1dao4yuan4 li3 de5 mou3 ge4 xiu1nu:3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Monochromatic thinking, but I appreciate a career criminal’s attempt at morality. \n"
"\n"
"Of course you feel that wiping out a species is wrong. The feeling is a subtle but ingrained defense mechanism that should be cherished. \n"
"\n"
"One day it may be metahumanity poised for extermination."
msgstr ""
"这是​十分​片面​的​思维​，​但​我​欣赏​一名​职业​罪犯​试图​谈论​道德​的​样子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​当然​觉得​物种​灭绝​是​错​的​，​这种​感觉​来自​一种​微妙​但​根深蒂固​的​防御机制​，​值得​珍视​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​说不定​哪天​就​会​轮​到​泛​人类​面临​灭绝​的​威胁​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 shi2fen1 pian4mian4 de5 si1wei2，dan4 wo3 xin1shang3 yi1 ming2 zhi2ye4 zui4fan4 shi4tu2 tan2lun4 dao4de2 de5 yang4zi5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dang1ran2 jue2de5 wu4zhong3 mie4jue2 shi4 cuo4 de5，zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2 lai2zi4 yi1zhong3 wei1miao4 dan4 gen1shen1di4gu4 de5 fang2 yu4 ji1 zhi4，zhi2de5 zhen1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 shuo1bu5ding4 na3 tian1 jiu4 hui4 lun2 dao4 fan4 ren2lei4 mian4lin2 mie4jue2 de5 wei1xie2。"

msgid ""
"Monolithic. Plastic. Sterile. The Berlin office of AG Chemie Europa is all of these things and more. The worst qualities of modern corporate culture, all mixed into a toxic stew and sluiced into a single prefab office building.\n"
"\n"
"Thankfully, you shouldn't have to stay long. According to the intel that your client provided, this should be a simple smash-and-grab operation, and you've been given the tools to carry it out with a minimum of fuss.\n"
"\n"
"The MKVI Prototype - whatever it is - is waiting for you on the 25th floor. It's time to go and get it."
msgstr ""
"单调​。​塑料​感​。​冰冷​。​欧洲​化工​的​柏林​办公室​集​这些​特点​于​一身​，​甚至​更​甚​。​现代​企业​文化​的​最​糟糕​特质​，​全都​混杂​成​了​一锅​有毒​的​乱​炖​，​灌进​这栋​预制​办公楼​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​幸运​的​是​，​你​不​需要​待​太久​。​根据​客户​提供​的​情报​，​这​应该​就是​一次​简单​的​抢劫​行动​，​而且​你​也​拿到​了​可以​轻松​完成​任务​的​工具​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​目标​“​MKVI​原型机​”​正在​大楼​的​25​层​等待​着​你​。​是​时候​去​把​它​弄到手​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dan1diao4。su4liao4 gan3。bing1leng3。ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 de5 bo2lin2 ban4gong1shi4 ji2 zhe4xie1 te4dian3 yu2 yi1shen1，shen4zhi4 geng1 shen4。xian4dai4 qi3ye4 wen2hua4 de5 zui4 zao1gao1 te4zhi4，quan2dou1 hun4za2 cheng2 le5 yi1 guo1 you3du2 de5 luan4 dun4，guan4 jin4 zhe4 dong4 yu4zhi4 ban4gong1lou2 li3。\n"
"\n"
"xing4yun4 de5 shi4，ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 dai1 tai4 jiu3。gen1ju4 ke4hu4 ti2gong1 de5 qing2bao4，zhe4 ying1gai1 jiu4shi4 yi1ci4 jian3dan1 de5 qiang3jie2 xing2dong4，er2qie3 ni3 ye3 na2dao4 le5 ke3yi3 qing1song1 wan2cheng2 ren4wu5 de5 gong1ju4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 mu4biao1“MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1” zheng4zai4 da4lou2 de5 25 ceng2 deng3dai4 zhao2 ni3。shi4 shi2hou5 qu4 ba3 ta1 nong4dao4shou3 le5。"

msgid "Morale was shot. They decided to split and go their own ways."
msgstr ""
"没​心气​了​。​所以​我们​干脆​分道扬镳​，​各走​各路​。\n"
"mei2 xin1qi4 le5。suo3yi3 wo3men5 gan1cui4 fen1dao4yang2biao1，ge4 zou3 ge4 lu4。"

msgid ""
"More conveyor belts start up. All you can hear is the sound of machinery."
msgstr ""
"更​多​传送带​开始运转​。​你​能​听到​的​只有​机器​的​轰鸣声​。\n"
"geng1 duo1 chuan2song4dai4 kai1 shi3 yun4 zhuai3。ni3 neng2 ting1dao4 de5 zhi3you3 ji1qi4 de5 hong1 ming2 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"More importantly, we *won.* We kicked ass and took names, and saved a lot of lives to boot.\n"
"\n"
"We're heroes, chief! Not bad for a day's work!"
msgstr ""
"更​重要​的​是​，​我们​*​赢​了​*​。​我们​干掉​了​凶残​的​敌人​，​也​拯救​了​许多​生命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​是​英雄​，​头儿​！​这​一天​没​白干​！\n"
"\n"
"geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4，wo3men5*ying2 le5*。wo3men5 gan4diao4 le5 xiong1can2 de5 di2ren2，ye3 zheng3jiu4 le5 xu3duo1 sheng1ming4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 ying1xiong2，tou2r5！zhe4 yi1 tian1 mei2 bai2 gan4！"

msgid "More like, they won't."
msgstr ""
"准确​来说​，​是​他们​不会​这么​做​了​。\n"
"zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1，shi4 ta1men5 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"More money, huh?\n"
"\n"
"I like money."
msgstr ""
"更​多​钱​，​是​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​喜欢​钱​。\n"
"\n"
"geng1 duo1 qian2，shi4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi3huan5 qian2。"

msgid ""
"More of Harrow's acolytes. If we walk through that door, they'll attack us, "
"just like last time."
msgstr ""
"那些​也​是​哈罗​的​侍​祭​。​如果​我们​穿过​那​扇门​，​就​会​像​上次​那样​遭到​他们​的​攻击​。\n"
"na4xie1 ye3 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 shi4 ji4。ru2guo3 wo3men5 chuan1guo4 na4 shan1 men2，jiu4 hui4 xiang4 shang4ci4 na4yang4 zao1dao4 ta1men5 de5 gong1ji1。"

msgid "More or less, yeah."
msgstr ""
"差不多​吧​。\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 ba1。"

msgid "More or less."
msgstr ""
"差不多​吧​。\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"More or less. There wasn't much left for me in the Ruhrplex, and Monika made"
" me a hell of an offer."
msgstr ""
"差不多​吧​。​我​对​鲁尔​都会区​没什么​留恋​的​，​而​莫妮卡​也​给​我​开了个​好​价钱​。\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 ba1。wo3 dui4 lu3 er3 dou1 hui4 qu1 mei2shen2me5 liu2lian4 de5，er2 Mo4ni1ka3 ye3 gei3 wo3 kai1 le5 ge4 hao3 jia4qian5。"

msgid ""
"More or less... we were waiting for a traffic light to change. Look, would "
"you rather we change back into our muddy work clothes? We can do that if you"
" need us to."
msgstr ""
"差不多​吧​……​我们​当时​在​等​红灯​。​难道​你​希望​我们​一身​脏兮兮​地​进来​吗​？​你​愿意​的话​我们​现在​就​把​衣服​换回来​。\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 ba1……wo3men5 dang1shi2 zai4 deng3 hong2deng1。nan2dao4 ni3 xi1wang4 wo3men5 yi1shen1 zang1xi1xi1 de5 jin4lai2 ma5？ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4 wo3men5 xian4zai4 jiu4 ba3 yi1fu5 huan4 hui2 lai2。"

msgid "More than a few have been hit recently."
msgstr ""
"最近​有​不少​公司​遭到​了​打击​。\n"
"zui4jin4 you3 bu4shao3 gong1si1 zao1dao4 le5 da3ji1。"

msgid ""
"More than most I've met. Surely enough to keep my head when the shit hits "
"the fan."
msgstr ""
"起码​强于​我见​过​的​大多数​人​。​这​足以​让​我​在​大难临头​时​保持​头脑清醒​。\n"
"qi3ma3 jiang4 yu2 wo3 jian4 guo4 de5 da4duo1shu4 ren2。zhe4 zu2yi3 rang4 wo3 zai4 da4nan4lin2tou2 shi2 bao3chi2 tou2 nao3 qing1 xing3。"

msgid "Mossberg CMDT"
msgstr ""
"莫​斯伯格​CMDT\n"
"mo4 si1 bai3 ge2 CMDT"

msgid "Mossberg CMDT (Smartlink)"
msgstr ""
"莫​斯伯格​CMDT​（​智能​枪版​）\n"
"mo4 si1 bai3 ge2 CMDT （zhi4neng2 qiang1ban3）"

msgid ""
"Most excellent, efendim! Delightful!\n"
"\n"
"When you are ready, take the U-bahn to Brandenburger Tor. He will find you there."
msgstr ""
"这样​再好不过​了​，​贵人​！​妙极​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​待​你​准备就绪​，​搭乘​地铁​前往​勃兰登堡门​。​他​将​在​那里​与​你​会合​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 zai4hao3bu4guo4 le5，gui4ren2！miao4 ji2！\n"
"\n"
"dai1 ni3 zhun3 bei4 jiu4 xu4，da1cheng2 di4tie3 qian2wang3 bo2 lan2 deng1 pu4 men2。ta1 jiang1 zai4 na4li5 yu4 ni3 hui4he2。"

msgid ""
"Most of the cyberware mounted in the Cyberzombie's body is of a very high grade, but otherwise relatively standard. Its arms were clearly designed for industrial use; they bear the stamp of B.U.T. Heavy Industries, an industrial machinery manufacturer not typically associated with cyberware design.\n"
"\n"
"By far the most interesting aspect of the Cyberzombie's design is its control system. It appears to be a standard drone control rig, but a number of extra components connect it directly to the creature's brain stem."
msgstr ""
"赛博​僵尸​体内​植入​的​大部分​赛博​改造​属于​顶级​规格​，​但​其余​配置​则​相对​常规​。​其​手臂​的​设计​颇具​工业​风​，​上面​带有​B​.​U​.​T​.​重工​的​印章​—​—​这家​工业​机械​制造商​通常​并​不​涉足​赛博​改造​设计​领域​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这会儿​看​下来​，​设计​得​最​有意思​的​是​它​的​中​控系统​。​乍​看起来​，​它​就​像是​常规​的​无人机​系统​，​但​额外​多​出来​的​一些​部件​直接​连进​了​这个​生物​的​脑干​。\n"
"\n"
"sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 ti3nei4 zhi2ru4 de5 da4bu4fen5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 shu3yu2 ding3ji2 gui1ge2，dan4 qi2yu2 pei4zhi4 ze2 xiang1dui4 chang2gui1。qi2 shou3bi4 de5 she4ji4 po1ju4 gong1ye4 feng1，shang4mian4 dai4you3 bi1. U . t . zhong4gong1 de5 yin4zhang1——zhe4 jia1 gong1ye4 ji1xie4 zhi4zao4shang1 tong1chang2 bing4 bu4 she4zu2 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 she4ji4 ling3yu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4hui4r5 kan4 xia4lai5，she4ji4 de2 zui4 you3yi4si5 de5 shi4 ta1 de5 zhong4 kong4 xi4 tong3。zha4 kan4qi3lai5，ta1 jiu4 xiang4 shi4 chang2gui1 de5 wu2ren2ji1 xi4tong3，dan4 e2wai4 duo1 chu1lai2 de5 yi1xie1 bu4jian4 zhi2jie1 lian2 jin4 le5 zhe4ge5 sheng1wu4 de5 nao3gan4。"

msgid ""
"Most of the drawers are neatly stocked with stationery supplies, but nothing interesting turns up.\n"
"\n"
"The topmost drawer is locked."
msgstr ""
"大多数​抽屉​里​都​整齐​地​存放​着​文具用品​，​但​没什么​有趣​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最上层​的​抽屉​上​了​锁​。\n"
"\n"
"da4duo1shu4 chou1ti5 li3 dou1 zheng3qi2 de5 cun2fang4 zhao2 wen2 ju4 yong4 pin3，dan4 mei2shen2me5 you3qu4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"zui4 shang4 ceng2 de5 chou1ti5 shang4 le5 suo3。"

msgid ""
"Most of the files on this terminal are of a personal nature.\n"
"\n"
"In fact, one video file is of  a *very* personal nature."
msgstr ""
"终端​内​的​文件​大多​属于​个人​性质​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​事实上​，​其中​一个​视频文件​具有​*​极其​*​私密​的​内容​。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1duan1 nei4 de5 wen2jian4 da4duo1 shu3yu2 ge4ren2 xing4zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4shi2shang4，qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 shi4 pin2 wen2 jian4 ju4you3*ji2qi2*si1mi4 de5 nei4rong2。"

msgid ""
"Most of the information that you can find is extremely technical and well beyond your level of understanding.\n"
"\n"
"You do, however, stumble upon one thing that you can understand: The MKVI has been fitted with something called an \"inhibitor chip.\""
msgstr ""
"你​能​找到​的​大部分​信息​都​极其​专业​，​远超​你​的​理解能力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​你​还是​碰巧​看​懂​了​一件​事​：​有个​什么​“​神经​抑制​芯片​”​被​塞进​了​MKVI​原型机​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 de5 da4bu4fen5 xin4xi1 dou1 ji2qi2 zhuan1ye4，yuan3chao1 ni3 de5 li3 jie3 neng2 li4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，ni3 hai2shi5 peng4qiao3 kan4 dong3 le5 yi1 jian4 shi4：you3 ge4 shen2me5“shen2jing1 yi4zhi4 xin1pian4” bei4 se4 jin4 le5 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"Most of the research is devoted to marine invertebrates that live in ecosystems surrounding hydrothermal vents.\n"
"\n"
"More recently, the lab has taken to experimenting on salamanders, Awakened creatures that live in fire-based environments. These studies showed more promise, but have been postponed due to the difficulty in keeping the salamanders alive in captivity."
msgstr ""
"大多数​研究​都​集中​在​生活​在​热液​喷口​周围​生态系统​中​的​海洋​无​脊椎动物​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最近​，​该​实验室​开始​对​生活​在​以​火为​基础​的​环境​中​的​蝾螈​进行​实验​。​这些​研究​显示​出​更​大​的​潜力​，​但​由于​在​人工​环境​中​难以​维持​蝾螈​的​生存​，​研究​已​被​推迟​。\n"
"\n"
"da4duo1shu4 yan2jiu1 dou1 ji2zhong1 zai4 sheng1huo2 zai4 re4 ye4 pen1 kou3 zhou1wei2 sheng1tai4xi4tong3 zhong4 de5 hai3yang2 wu2 ji3zhui1dong4wu4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4jin4，gai1 shi2yan4shi4 kai1shi3 dui4 sheng1huo2 zai4 yi3 huo3 wei2 ji1chu3 de5 huan2jing4 zhong4 de5 rong2yuan2 jin4xing2 shi2yan4。zhe4xie1 yan2jiu1 xian3shi4 chu1 geng1 dai4 de5 qian2li4，dan4 you2yu2 zai4 ren2gong1 huan2jing4 zhong4 nan2yi3 wei2chi2 rong2yuan2 de5 sheng1cun2，yan2jiu1 yi3 bei4 tui1chi2。"

msgid ""
"Most of the waste in here comes in the form of old bank statements. Apparently, somebody in the Landenberg Ring has been using the backs of the statements as scratch paper.\n"
"\n"
"The third handful of trash that you liberate from the bin contains a note that catches your eye."
msgstr ""
"这里​的​大部分​垃圾​都​是​旧​银行​对​账单​。​显然​，​兰​登堡​帮​有人​把​对​账单​背面​当作​草稿纸​使用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​从​垃圾箱​里​掏出​的​第三​把​垃圾​里​，​有​一张​纸条​吸引​了​你​的​注意​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 da4bu4fen5 la1ji1 dou1 shi4 jiu4 yin2hang2 dui4 zhang4dan1。xian3ran2，lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 you3ren2 ba3 dui4 zhang4dan1 bei4mian4 dang4zuo4 cao3 gao3 zhi3 shi3yong4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cong2 la1ji1xiang1 li3 tao1chu1 de5 di4 san1 ba3 la1ji1 li3，you3 yi1 zhang1 zhi3tiao2 xi1yin3 le5 ni3 de5 zhu4yi4。"

msgid ""
"Most of us got out alive, but we've been stuck out here ever since. Just give us some time, though. We'll take the building back... we'll starve 'em out if we have to. \n"
"\n"
"And when we do, those scrawny bastards are gonna pay."
msgstr ""
"我们​大多数​人​活着​逃​了​出来​，​但​从那以后​我们​就​被困​在​外面​了​。​不过​，​给​我们​点​时间​，​我们​会​夺回​那座​建筑​……​即使​要​把​他们​饿死​也​在所不惜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​成功​了​，​那帮​瘦子​混蛋​会​付出代价​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 da4duo1shu4 ren2 huo2zhe5 tao2 le5 chu1lai2，dan4 cong2 na4 yi3 hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 bei4kun4 zai4 wai4mian4 le5。bu4guo4，gei3 wo3men5 dian3 shi2jian1，wo3men5 hui4 duo2hui2 na4 zuo4 jian4zhu4……ji2shi3 yao4 ba3 ta1men5 e4si3 ye3 zai4 suo3 bu4 xi1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 cheng2gong1 le5，na4 bang1 shou4zi5 hun2dan4 hui4 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Most of what's written in this report is completely foreign to you. But from what you can piece together, it looks as though the scientists here are working on developing a sort of artificial immune cell... something sturdy and self-replicating that is capable of pumping out antibodies on command.\n"
"\n"
"Why they're doing it is beyond you."
msgstr ""
"这份​报告​中​绝大多数​内容​对​你​来说​都​是​完全​陌生​的​。​但​从​你​能​拼凑出​的​信息​来看​，​这里​的​科学家​似乎​正在​研发​一种​人工免疫​细胞​……​一种​坚固​且​具有​自我​复制​能力​、​能够​按​需​产生​抗体​的​细胞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​为何​要​这样​做​，​你​完全​无法​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 fen4 bao4gao4 zhong4 jue2da4duo1shu4 nei4rong2 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 dou1 shi4 wan2quan2 mo4sheng1 de5。dan4 cong2 ni3 neng2 pin1 cou4 chu1 de5 xin4xi1 lai2 kan4，zhe4li3 de5 ke1xue2jia1 si4hu1 zheng4zai4 yan2fa1 yi1zhong3 ren2 gong1 mian3 yi4 xi4bao1……yi1zhong3 jian1gu4 qie3 ju4you3 zi4wo3 fu4zhi4 neng2li4、neng2gou4 an4 xu1 chan3sheng1 kang4ti3 de5 xi4bao1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 wei4he2 yao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4，ni3 wan2quan2 wu2fa3 li3jie3。"

msgid "Mostly I was hoping to piss you off, yeah."
msgstr ""
"我​基本上​就是​想​惹​你​生气​，​没错​。\n"
"wo3 ji1ben3shang5 jiu4shi4 xiang3 re3 ni3 sheng1qi4，mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Mostly, I felt hurt. So I searched for her, in the real world and in the Matrix. And when that turned up nothing, I started tapping my contacts.\n"
"\n"
"And that was when I started racking up debt."
msgstr ""
"我​自然​感觉​很​受伤​，​于是​在​现实​世界​和​矩阵​中​到处​找​她​。​在​一无所获​之后​，​我​开始​转而​求助​我​的​那些​联系人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​是从​那个​时候​开始​欠债​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zi4ran2 gan3jue2 hen3 shou4shang1，yu2shi4 zai4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 he4 ju3zhen4 zhong4 dao4chu4 zhao3 ta1。zai4 yi1wu2suo3huo4 zhi1hou4，wo3 kai1shi3 zhuan3er2 qiu2zhu4 wo3 de5 na4xie1 lian2xi4ren2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 shi4 cong2 na4ge5 shi2hou5 kai1shi3 qian4zhai4 de5。"

msgid "Motorcycle"
msgstr ""
"摩托车\n"
"mo2tuo1che1"

msgid "Move Speed +1, Willpower +1 and Strength +2 for 5 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"移动​速度​+​1​，​意志​+​1​和​力量​+​2​，​持续​5​回合​。\n"
"yi2dong4 su4du4 +1，yi4zhi4 +1 he4 li4liang5 +2，chi2xu4 5 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Move quickly. Speed is your only advantage now. When you reach the generators' control panel, the password \"Xolotl\" should allow you to disengage their safety overrides.\n"
"\n"
"Get the job done and get out, $(l.name). I'll be waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"抓紧时间​行动​。​速度​现在​是​你​仅剩​的​优势​了​。​找到​发电机组​的​控制面板​后​，​输入​密码​“​修​洛特​尔​”​应该​就​能​解除​其​安全​超控​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​完成​任务​后​尽快​撤离​，​$(l.name)​。​我会​等​着​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhua1jin3shi2jian1 xing2dong4。su4du4 xian4zai4 shi4 ni3 jin3 sheng4 de5 you1shi4 le5。zhao3dao4 fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 de5 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 hou4，shu1ru4 mi4ma3“Xiu1luo4te4er3” ying1gai1 jiu4 neng2 jie3chu2 qi2 an1quan2 chao1 kong4。\n"
"\n"
"wan2cheng2 ren4wu5 hou4 jin3kuai4 che4li2，$(l.name)。wo3 hui4 deng3 zhao2 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Moving along now, ma'am."
msgstr ""
"我​这​就​走​，​女士​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3，nu:3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Moving the painting aside, you find a large maintenance access panel.\n"
"\n"
"Jana steps forward, a slight frown on her face."
msgstr ""
"将​画​移开​后​，​你​发现​了​一处​大型​检修​面板​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​简娜​走上​前去​，​眉头​微微​蹙​起​。\n"
"\n"
"jiang1 hua4 yi2kai1 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 chu3 da4xing2 jian3xiu1 mian4ban3。\n"
"\n"
"Jian3na4 zou3 shang4 qian2 qu4，mei2tou2 wei1wei1 cu4 qi3。"

msgid "Mr Footage Capture Man"
msgstr ""
"摄录​专家\n"
"she4lu4 zhuan1jia1"

msgid "Mr."
msgstr ""
"先生\n"
"xian1sheng5"

msgid "Ms."
msgstr ""
"女士\n"
"nu:3shi4"

msgid "Muscle Augmentation"
msgstr ""
"肌肉​殖装\n"
"ji1rou4 zhi2 zhuang1"

msgid ""
"Music begins to blare, then the screen cuts to static. You find yourself "
"back at the main menu."
msgstr ""
"音乐​开始​轰鸣​，​随后​画面​变成​一片​雪花​。​你​发现自己​回到​了​主​菜单​界面​。\n"
"yin1yue4 kai1shi3 hong1ming2，sui2hou4 hua4mian4 bian4cheng2 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1。ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid "Must be one hell of a contact."
msgstr ""
"这​联络人​肯定​不​简单​。\n"
"zhe4 lian2luo4ren2 ken3ding4 bu4 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"Must be tough, having to live down here with all that goin' on over your "
"head."
msgstr ""
"头顶​上​全是​这种​人​，​住​在​这里​想必​一定​很​难熬​吧​。\n"
"tou2ding3 shang4 quan2 shi4 zhe4zhong3 ren2，zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3 xiang3bi4 yi1ding4 hen3 nan2ao2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Must be tough, having to live down here with that going on over your head."
msgstr ""
"头顶​上​全是​这种​人​，​住​在​这里​想必​一定​很​难熬​吧​。\n"
"tou2ding3 shang4 quan2 shi4 zhe4zhong3 ren2，zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3 xiang3bi4 yi1ding4 hen3 nan2ao2 ba1。"

msgid "Must bring Eiger. Must bring the Cyberware Deactivator."
msgstr ""
"必须​带上​艾格尔​。​必须​携带​赛博​改造​限制器​。\n"
"bi4xu1 dai4shang4 Ai4ge2er3。bi4xu1 xie2dai4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 xian4 zhi4 qi4。"

msgid ""
"Must stay aloft...\n"
"\n"
"...help you...\n"
"\n"
"...grant you release from here...\n"
"\n"
"...and you will repay in kind yes yes yes."
msgstr ""
"必须​保持​飞行​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​帮助​你​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​让​你​离开​这里​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​而​你​也​会​回报​，​是​的​是​的​是​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 bao3chi2 fei1xing2……\n"
"\n"
"……bang1zhu4 ni3……\n"
"\n"
"……rang4 ni3 li2kai1 zhe4li3……\n"
"\n"
"……er2 ni3 ye3 hui4 hui2bao4，shi4 de5 shi4 de5 shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Must... stay... aloft.\n"
"\n"
"Ride the thermals...\n"
"\n"
"...make the wind work... for me.\n"
"\n"
"So tired... soverytirednow."
msgstr ""
"必须​……​保持​……​飞行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​利用​热​气流​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​让​风​……​为我所用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​累​……​现在​真的​好​累​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1……bao3chi2……fei1xing2。\n"
"\n"
"li4yong4 re4 qi4liu2……\n"
"\n"
"……rang4 feng1……wei2 wo3 suo3 yong4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 lei3……xian4zai4 zhen1de5 hao3 lei3。"

msgid ""
"Must... stay... aloft.\n"
"\n"
"Ride the thermals...\n"
"\n"
"...make wind work... for me.\n"
"\n"
"So tired... soverytirednow."
msgstr ""
"必须​……​保持​……​飞行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​利用​热​气流​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​让​风​……​为我所用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​累​……​现在​真的​好​累​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1……bao3chi2……fei1xing2。\n"
"\n"
"li4yong4 re4 qi4liu2……\n"
"\n"
"……rang4 feng1……wei2 wo3 suo3 yong4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 lei3……xian4zai4 zhen1de5 hao3 lei3。"

msgid ""
"Mustering your inner strength, you channel your Chi inward, to the core of your being. The power of your focus salves your screaming nerve endings and quiets your restless tongue.\n"
"\n"
"The pain dissipates like a bad dream."
msgstr ""
"你​凝聚​内在​力量​，​将​真气​导入​体内​，​直抵​生命​核心​。​专注​的​力量​抚平​了​嘶吼​的​神经末梢​，​让​你​躁动​的​舌尖​得以​平息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​疼痛​随即​如​噩梦般​消散​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ning2ju4 nei4zai4 li4liang5，jiang1 zhen1 qi4 dao3ru4 ti3nei4，zhi2 di3 sheng1ming4 he2xin1。zhuan1zhu4 de5 li4liang5 fu3ping2 le5 si1hou3 de5 shen2 jing1 mo4 shao1，rang4 ni3 zao4dong4 de5 she2jian1 de2yi3 ping2xi1。\n"
"\n"
"teng2tong4 sui2ji2 ru2 e4 meng4 ban1 xiao1san4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Mustering your inner strength, you form your Chi into a protective shell.\n"
"\n"
"The baneful magic dissipates like a bad dream."
msgstr ""
"你​凝聚​内在​力量​，​将​真​气化​作​一道​防护​外壳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​诅咒​般的​魔法​随即​如​噩梦般​消散​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ning2ju4 nei4zai4 li4liang5，jiang1 zhen1 qi4hua4 zuo4 yi1dao4 fang2hu4 wai4ke2。\n"
"\n"
"na4 zu3zhou4 ban1 de5 mo2fa3 sui2ji2 ru2 e4 meng4 ban1 xiao1san4 le5。"

msgid "Mwa ha ha! I am villain! This is my villainous speech!"
msgstr ""
"哇​哈哈​！​我​是​反派​！​这​是​我​的​反派​发言​！\n"
"wa1 ha1ha1！wo3 shi4 fan3pai4！zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 fan3pai4 fa1yan2！"

msgid ""
"My  friends who hung out with me here at the cafe?\n"
"\n"
"They all wanted the saddest things. Picking up a good piece of trash, being a truck driver, getting laid, money in their pockets.\n"
"\n"
"I knew there had to be more, but there wasn't a good way to know about it."
msgstr ""
"和​我​一起​在​这家​咖啡馆​混迹​的​朋友​们​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​的​想法​都​没什么​出息​。​天上掉​馅饼​啊​，​当​个​卡车司机​啊​，​找人​鬼混​啊​，​发横财​啊​什么​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​一定​还有​更​多样​的​生活​，​只是​没有​好​的​途径​去​了解​它​。\n"
"\n"
"he4 wo3 yi1qi3 zai4 zhe4 jia1 ka1fei1guan3 hun4ji4 de5 peng2you5 men5？\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 de5 xiang3fa3 dou1 mei2shen2me5 chu1xi1。tian1 shang4 diao4 xian4bing3 a1，dang1 ge4 ka3 che1 si1 ji1 a1，zhao3 ren2 gui3hun4 a1，fa1heng4cai2 a1 shen2me5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 yi1ding4 hai2you3 geng1 duo1yang4 de5 sheng1huo2，zhi3shi4 mei2you3 hao3 de5 tu2jing4 qu4 liao3jie3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"My God. Feuerschwinge's astral form has been trapped in that woman for forty years. \n"
"\n"
"And she's been confined to this cage for twenty.\n"
"\n"
"That's torture."
msgstr ""
"天​啊​。​火翼​的​灵体​已经​被困​在​那位​女性​体内​长​达​四十年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​她​自己​也​被​囚禁​在​这座​牢笼​中​已有​二十年​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​简直​是​种​折磨​。\n"
"\n"
"tian1 a1。Huo3yi4 de5 ling2ti3 yi3jing1 bei4kun4 zai4 na4 wei4 nu:3xing4 ti3nei4 zhang3 da2 si4 shi2 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ta1 zi4ji3 ye3 bei4 qiu2jin4 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 lao2long2 zhong4 yi3 you3 er4 shi2 nian2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian3zhi2 shi4 zhong3 zhe2mo2。"

msgid ""
"My Lady Feuerschwinge was a nurturer. A caregiver. Rare among her kind. \n"
"\n"
"Where her brothers and sisters saw the world as a prize to be won, she saw it as a garden to be tended. Can you imagine?\n"
"\n"
"For world upon world, the Great Dragon Feuerschwinge brought wisdom and succor to countless souls. And she was loved for it. Exalted. A goddess."
msgstr ""
"火翼​女士​更​看重​养育​，​关怀​。​这​在​同类​实属​罕见​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​兄弟姐妹​们​将​世界​视作​战利品​时​，​她​却​视其为​需要​照料​的​园圃​。​你​能​想象​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​无数个​纪元​中​，​伟大​的​巨龙​火翼​为​无数个​灵魂​带​去​智慧​与​慰藉​。​她​因此​被​爱戴​，​被​尊崇​，​被​奉​为​女神​。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 nu:3shi4 geng1 kan4zhong4 yang3yu4，guan1huai2。zhe4 zai4 tong2lei4 shi2shu3 han3jian4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 xiong1di4jie3mei4 men5 jiang1 shi4jie4 shi4zuo4 zhan4li4pin3 shi2，ta1 que4 shi4 qi2 wei2 xu1yao4 zhao4liao4 de5 yuan2pu3。ni3 neng2 xiang3xiang4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wu2 shu3 ge4 ji4yuan2 zhong4，wei3da4 de5 ju4long2 Huo3yi4 wei2 wu2 shu3 ge4 ling2hun2 dai4 qu4 zhi4hui4 yu4 wei4jie4。ta1 yin1ci3 bei4 ai4dai4，bei4 zun1chong2，bei4 feng4 wei2 nu:3shen2。"

msgid ""
"My advice to you is this: hold your own with her. If she pushes you, push back. Don't try to butter her up with flattery, she'll see right through it.\n"
"\n"
"Most of all, do what you can to earn her respect. She'll never be satisfied following you if you don't give her a better reason to than \"because Monika said so.\""
msgstr ""
"我​的​建议​是​：​面对​她​时要​挺直​腰板​。​她​呛​你​的话​，​你​就​呛​回去​。​别​想着​奉承​讨好​她​，​这种​东西​她​一眼​就​能​看穿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最​重要​的​是​，​尽​你​所能​赢得​她​的​尊重​。​如果​你​给​她​的​理由​仅限于​“​因为​莫妮卡​这么​说​过​”​，​那​她​肯定​不会​甘心​追随​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 jian4yi4 shi4：mian4dui4 ta1 shi2 yao4 ting3zhi2 yao1ban3。ta1 qiang1 ni3 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 qiang1 hui2qu5。bie4 xiang3 zhao2 feng4cheng5 tao3hao3 ta1，zhe4zhong3 dong1xi1 ta1 yi1yan3 jiu4 neng2 kan4chuan1。\n"
"\n"
"zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4，jin3 ni3 suo3neng2 ying2de2 ta1 de5 zun1zhong4。ru2guo3 ni3 gei3 ta1 de5 li3you2 jin3 xian4 yu2“yin1wei4 Mo4ni1ka3 zhe4me5 shuo1 guo4”，na4 ta1 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 gan1xin1 zhui1sui2 ni3。"

msgid "My advice? Walk away, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"给你个​建议​，​别​再​放不下​了​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"gei3 ni3 ge4 jian4yi4，bie4 zai4 fang4bu5xia4 le5，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"My beautiful Katja,\n"
"\n"
"I can't stop thinking about last Thursday, after the evening teleconference. You and me, sprawled out on my synthleather couch, with you in your cardigan and nothing else. A bowl of strawberries and a bottle of Pinot. Bacchanalian decadence and hedonistic delight.\n"
"\n"
"A delicious evening, for the both of us."
msgstr ""
"我​美丽​的​卡佳​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​始终​无法​忘怀​上周四​，​在​晚间​电话会议​后​的​时光​。​你​我​瘫​卧​在​合成​皮沙发​上​，​你​只​披​着​开襟毛衣​，​再​无​他物​。​一碗​草莓​，​一瓶​黑皮​诺​。​那​酒神​般的​放纵​与​享乐主义​的​欢愉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​我们​两人​而言​，​都​是​美妙​的​夜晚​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei3li4 de5 ka3 jia1：\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi3zhong1 wu2fa3 wang4huai2 shang4 zhou1 si4，zai4 wan3jian1 dian4hua4hui4yi4 hou4 de5 shi2guang1。ni3 wo3 tan1 wo4 zai4 he2cheng2 pi2 sha1 fa1 shang4，ni3 zhi3 pi1 zhao2 kai1 jin1 mao2 yi1，zai4 wu2 ta1 wu4。yi1 wan3 cao3mei2，yi1 ping2 hei1 pi2 nuo4。na4 jiu3shen2 ban1 de5 fang4zong4 yu4 xiang3le4zhu3yi4 de5 huan1yu2。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3men5 liang3 ren2 er2yan2，dou1 shi4 mei3miao4 de5 ye4wan3。"

msgid ""
"My best guess is that your pumps have shut down. Happens from time to time without proper maintenance.\n"
"\n"
"When the pumps shut down, the waste started pilin' up, and it's causin' some pretty major overflow problems downstream."
msgstr ""
"要​我​猜​的话​，​是​水泵​被​关闭​了​。​这种​情况​在​没有​适当​维护​的​情况​下​时有发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​水泵​关闭​后​，​废水​开始​堆积​，​导致​下游​出现​一些​严重​的​溢流​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 wo3 cai1 de5hua4，shi4 shui3beng4 bei4 guan1bi4 le5。zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 zai4 mei2you3 shi4dang4 wei2hu4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 shi2 you3 fa1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"shui3beng4 guan1bi4 hou4，fei4shui3 kai1shi3 dui1ji1，dao3zhi4 xia4you2 chu1xian4 yi1xie1 yan2zhong4 de5 yi4 liu2 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"My boys and I stomped your ass into the dirt back in '39, Stahl.\n"
"\n"
"I've been waitin' to do it again ever since."
msgstr ""
"斯塔尔​，​我​和​弟兄们​在​2039​年​就​狠狠​收拾​过​你​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从那以后​我​就​一直​想​再​揍​你​一顿​。\n"
"\n"
"Si1ta3er3，wo3 he4 di4xiong1men5 zai4 2039 nian2 jiu4 hen3hen3 shou1shi5 guo4 ni3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 na4 yi3 hou4 wo3 jiu4 yi1zhi2 xiang3 zai4 zou4 ni3 yi1 dun4。"

msgid ""
"My brother? Hermie? \n"
"\n"
"It's been years... have you seen him? How is he?"
msgstr ""
"我​弟弟​？​赫米​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​已经​这么​多年​了​……​你​见​过​他​吗​？​他​怎么样​了​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 di4di5？he4 mi3？\n"
"\n"
"yi3jing1 zhe4me5 duo1nian2 le5……ni3 jian4 guo4 ta1 ma5？ta1 zen3me5yang4 le5？"

msgid ""
"My brothers and I... our memories are ingrown. Implanted as we develop.\n"
"\n"
"We are born knowing everyone we will ever meet. We are born knowing how we will die."
msgstr ""
"我​和​我​的​兄弟​们​……​我们​的​记忆​在​成长​过程​中​就​植根于​我们​体内​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​生来​便​知晓​此生​将​遇见​的​每个​人​。​我们​生来​便​知晓​自己​的​死法​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 wo3 de5 xiong1di4 men5……wo3men5 de5 ji4yi4 zai4 cheng2zhang3 guo4cheng2 zhong4 jiu4 zhi2gen1yu2 wo3men5 ti3nei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 sheng1lai2 bian4 zhi1xiao3 ci3 sheng1 jiang1 yu4jian4 de5 mei3ge4 ren2。wo3men5 sheng1lai2 bian4 zhi1xiao3 zi4ji3 de5 si3 fa3。"

msgid ""
"My brothers and I... our memories are ingrown. Implanted in us as we develop.\n"
"\n"
"We are born knowing everyone we will ever meet.\n"
"\n"
"We are born knowing how we will die."
msgstr ""
"我​和​我​的​兄弟​们​……​我们​的​记忆​在​成长​过程​中​就​植根于​我们​体内​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​生来​便​知晓​此生​将​遇见​的​每个​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​生来​便​知晓​自己​的​死法​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 wo3 de5 xiong1di4 men5……wo3men5 de5 ji4yi4 zai4 cheng2zhang3 guo4cheng2 zhong4 jiu4 zhi2gen1yu2 wo3men5 ti3nei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 sheng1lai2 bian4 zhi1xiao3 ci3 sheng1 jiang1 yu4jian4 de5 mei3ge4 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 sheng1lai2 bian4 zhi1xiao3 zi4ji3 de5 si3 fa3。"

msgid ""
"My business. With Amsel. \n"
"\n"
"I \"cater\" for those in your line of work. Such things are a necessity for a businessman such as Amsel.\n"
"\n"
"You understand, yes?"
msgstr ""
"我​的​业务​。​和​阿姆​泽尔​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​专门​为​干​你们​这行​的​人​提供​“​餐饮​承办​”​服务​。​对于​像​阿姆​泽尔​这样​的​生意人​而言​，​这些​东西​是​必不可少​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​明白​了​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 ye4wu4。he4 E1mu3ze2er3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhuan1men2 wei2 gan4 ni3men5 zhe4 xing2 de5 ren2 ti2gong1“can1yin3 cheng2ban4” fu2wu4。dui4yu2 xiang4 E1mu3ze2er3 zhe4yang4 de5 sheng1 yi4 ren2 er2yan2，zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 shi4 bi4bu4ke3shao3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ming2bai5 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"My clinic is a business, not a charity. I'm not giving your new friends any "
"more bio-material unless they pay me for it."
msgstr ""
"我开​诊所​是​做生意​，​不是​做​慈善​的​。​我​不会​再​给​你​的​新​朋友​们​任何​生物​材料​，​除非​它们​给​我​报酬​。\n"
"wo3 kai1 zhen3suo3 shi4 zuo4sheng1yi4，bu4shi4 zuo4 ci2shan4 de5。wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 gei3 ni3 de5 xin1 peng2you5 men5 ren4he2 sheng1wu4 cai2liao4，chu2fei1 ta1men5 gei3 wo3 bao4chou5。"

msgid ""
"My commlink's down... I'll need to use the one around the corner. Thanks for"
" everything, man."
msgstr ""
"我​的​通讯​链坏​了​……​我​得​去​用​过​道​的​那个​。​谢​了​，​伙计​。\n"
"wo3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 huai4 le5……wo3 de2 qu4 yong4 guo4 dao4 de5 na4ge5。xie4 le5，huo3ji5。"

msgid "My condolences."
msgstr ""
"请​节哀​。\n"
"qing3 jie1 ai1。"

msgid ""
"My contact has informed me that OTK stores an off-site hard copy of every firmware update it develops for data security purposes.\n"
"\n"
"My suggestion is this: you hit the offices of OTK International and reduce their computers to slag. In the interim, I will have the hard copy of their next update replaced with a compromised version."
msgstr ""
"我​的​联系人​提到​，​出于​数据安全​考虑​，​OTK​会​将​开发​的​每款​固件​更新​异地​保存​一份​纸质​备份​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​建议​是​：​你们​去​突袭​OTK​国际​的​办公室​，​把​电脑​全​砸掉​。​与此同时​，​我会​把​他们​下次​更新​的​纸质​备份​替换成​被​篡改​的​版本​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 lian2xi4ren2 ti2dao4，chu1yu2 shu3 ju4 an1 quan2 kao3lu:4，OTK hui4 jiang1 kai1fa1 de5 mei3 kuan3 gu4jian4 geng1xin1 yi4di4 bao3cun2 yi1 fen4 zhi3zhi4 bei4fen4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 jian4yi4 shi4：ni3men5 qu4 tu1xi2 OTK guo2ji4 de5 ban4gong1shi4，ba3 dian4nao3 quan2 za2 diao4。yu3ci3tong2shi2，wo3 hui4 ba3 ta1men5 xia4ci4 geng1xin1 de5 zhi3zhi4 bei4fen4 ti4 huan4 cheng2 bei4 cuan4gai3 de5 ban3ben3。"

msgid "My crew is free to voice their opinions whenever they like."
msgstr ""
"我​的​团队​也​可以​随时​发表意见​。\n"
"wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 ye3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 fa1 biao3 yi4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"My cure... the Panacea... it isn't ready. \n"
"\n"
"I was ready to turn a blind eye to the flaws and deploy it anyway. But my eyes are open now, and I do not like what I see."
msgstr ""
"我​的​解药​……​“​万能​药​”​……​还​没有​准备​完全​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​本来​打算​无视​它​的​缺陷​，​就​这样​将​它​扩散​出去​。​但​我​现在​想通​了​。​我​不能​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 jie3yao4……“wan4neng2 yao4”……hai2 mei2you3 zhun3bei4 wan2quan2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3lai2 da3suan4 wu2shi4 ta1 de5 que1xian4，jiu4 zhe4yang4 jiang1 ta1 kuo4san4 chu1qu4。dan4 wo3 xian4zai4 xiang3tong1 le5。wo3 bu4neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"My darling daughter, that is *why* I cannot send my troops. Your beloved Titonius Rex walks the knife's edge between light and darkness every time he draws that devil-blade from its scabbard.\n"
"\n"
"It is long past time that you learned the truth about me, Brenna-thay. *I* was the one who trapped the Demon Lord Karabork within that blade."
msgstr ""
"我​亲爱​的​女儿​，​这​正是​我​无法​派遣​军队​的​原因​。​你​深爱​的​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​每次​从​鞘​中​抽出​那​把​恶魔​之刃​时​，​都​在​光明​与​黑暗​的​边缘​徘徊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​时候​让​你​知道​真相​了​，​布伦娜​·​赛伊​。​是​我​将​恶魔​领主​卡拉​博克​封印​在​那​把​剑​中​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qin1ai4 de5 nu:3er2，zhe4 zheng4shi4 wo3 wu2fa3 pai4qian3 jun1dui4 de5 yuan2yin1。ni3 shen1ai4 de5 Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 mei3ci4 cong2 qiao4 zhong4 chou1chu1 na4 ba3 e4mo2 zhi1 ren4 shi2，dou1 zai4 guang1ming2 yu4 hei1an4 de5 bian1yuan2 pai2huai2。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 rang4 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhen1xiang4 le5，bu4 lun2 na4 · sai4 yi1。shi4 wo3 jiang1 e4mo2 ling3zhu3 ka3la1 bo2 ke4 feng1yin4 zai4 na4 ba3 jian4 zhong4 de5。"

msgid ""
"My employers aren't happy about what happened to Volker Stahl.\n"
"\n"
"Yes, he was a vile man, but he was *our* vile man. In killing him, you have created an unstable situation that could lead to an additional loss of life."
msgstr ""
"我​的​雇主​们​对​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔​遭遇​的​不幸​感到​不满​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​他​是​个​卑劣​之徒​，​但​他​是​*​我们​*​这边​的​。​你​杀​了​他​反而​会​制造​动荡​局面​，​可能​导致​更多人​丧生​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 men5 dui4 Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3 zao1yu4 de5 bu4xing4 gan3dao4 bu4man3。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，ta1 shi4 ge4 bei1lie4 zhi1 tu2，dan4 ta1 shi4*wo3men5*zhe4bian1 de5。ni3 sha1 le5 ta1 fan3er2 hui4 zhi4zao4 dong4dang4 ju2mian4，ke3neng2 dao3zhi4 geng1 duo1 ren2 sang4sheng1。"

msgid ""
"My employers have a way of seeing the truth of things. Of reading the intent behind a person's eyes.\n"
"\n"
"I won't be able to hide what I've done from them for long."
msgstr ""
"我​的​雇主​们​总能​洞悉​事物​的​本质​，​能​从​人​的​眼神​中​读出​真实​意图​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要不了​多久​，​我​的​所作所为​就​将​无所遁形​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 men5 zong3neng2 dong4xi1 shi4wu4 de5 ben3zhi4，neng2 cong2 ren2 de5 yan3shen2 zhong4 du2chu1 zhen1shi2 yi4tu2。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 bu4 le5 duo1jiu3，wo3 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2 jiu4 jiang1 wu2 suo3 dun4 xing2。"

msgid "My encounters are my business, mein Herr."
msgstr ""
"那​也​是​我​自己​的​事​，​先生​。\n"
"na4 ye3 shi4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 shi4，xian1sheng5。"

msgid ""
"My fault, and my apologies. Sometimes when I daydream, I bring others along for the ride. \n"
"\n"
"It was... unintentional. Yes. But there was no harm done, correct? You'll be fine."
msgstr ""
"是​我​的​错​，​我​道歉​。​有时​我​在​神游​的​时候​，​也​会​把​别人​带进​我​的​幻想​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​……​并非​我​故意​。​但​没​造成​什么​伤害​，​对​吧​？​你​不会​有事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 wo3 de5 cuo4，wo3 dao4qian4。you3shi2 wo3 zai4 shen2you2 de5 shi2hou5，ye3 hui4 ba3 bie2ren5 dai4 jin4 wo3 de5 huan4xiang3 li3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4……bing4fei1 wo3 gu4yi4。dan4 mei2 zao4cheng2 shen2me5 shang1hai4，dui4 ba1？ni3 bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"My fault, and my apologies. Sometimes, when I daydream, I bring others along for the ride. \n"
"\n"
"It was... unintentional. Yes. But there was no harm done, correct? You'll be fine."
msgstr ""
"是​我​的​错​，​我​道歉​。​有时​我​在​神游​的​时候​，​也​会​把​别人​带进​我​的​幻想​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​……​并非​我​故意​。​但​没​造成​什么​伤害​，​对​吧​？​你​不会​有事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 wo3 de5 cuo4，wo3 dao4qian4。you3shi2 wo3 zai4 shen2you2 de5 shi2hou5，ye3 hui4 ba3 bie2ren5 dai4 jin4 wo3 de5 huan4xiang3 li3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4……bing4fei1 wo3 gu4yi4。dan4 mei2 zao4cheng2 shen2me5 shang1hai4，dui4 ba1？ni3 bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"My favorite cafe's in the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Look. You're crazy, and we're probably all going to die, but we are *not* letting you get away with this."
msgstr ""
"我​最​喜欢​的​咖啡馆​就​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​你​肯定​是​疯​了​，​而且​我们​大概​全都​得​死​在​这​，​但​我们​*​不能​*​让​你​就​这么​逍遥法外​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4 xi3huan5 de5 ka1fei1guan3 jiu4 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 feng1 le5，er2qie3 wo3men5 da4gai4 quan2dou1 de2 si3 zai4 zhe4，dan4 wo3men5*bu4neng2*rang4 ni3 jiu4 zhe4me5 xiao1yao2fa3wai4。"

msgid ""
"My former employer won't be needing this anymore. Give it to your pal, "
"Blitz... I'm sure that he can find a use for it."
msgstr ""
"我​的​前​雇主​已经​用不上​这​东西​了​。​把​它​交给​你​朋友​布里​茨​吧​……​他​肯定​能​用得上​。\n"
"wo3 de5 qian2 gu4zhu3 yi3jing1 yong4 bu4 shang4 zhe4 dong1xi1 le5。ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 ni3 peng2you5 Bu4li3ci2 ba1……ta1 ken3ding4 neng2 yong4de5shang4。"

msgid ""
"My friends need help. This is how I give it to them. If you've got a problem"
" with that, I don't know why we're still talking."
msgstr ""
"我​的​朋友​们​需要​帮助​，​我​只是​以此​为​原则​行事​。​如果​你​对此​有​意见​的话​，​那​我们​就​没什么​好谈​的​了​。\n"
"wo3 de5 peng2you5 men5 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4，wo3 zhi3shi4 yi3ci3 wei2 yuan2ze2 xing2shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 yi4jian4 de5hua4，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 mei2shen2me5 hao3 tan2 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"My girl Kami is arranging to make contact with the \"chef\" as we speak. "
"This will likely take some time... my chef is a busy man."
msgstr ""
"我​侄女​卡米​此刻​正在​安排​联系​那位​“​厨师​”​。​这​恐怕​要花些​时间​……​我​的​厨师​可是​个​大忙人​。\n"
"wo3 zhi2nu:3 Ka3mi3 ci3ke4 zheng4zai4 an1pai2 lian2xi4 na4 wei4“chu2shi1”。zhe4 kong3pa4 yao4 hua1 xie1 shi2jian1……wo3 de5 chu2shi1 ke3shi4 ge4 da4mang2ren2。"

msgid ""
"My girls will shoot you dead before you make it three paces. And none of us want that, do we?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The unpleasant-looking young toughs behind him shake their heads.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It'd be tragic if you missed the big show."
msgstr ""
"三步​之内​，​我​的​姑娘​们​就​能​把​你​射成​筛子​。​没​人​愿意​事情​发展​成​那样​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​身后​那群​面目可憎​的​年轻​混混​们​纷纷​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要是​错过​接下来​的​好戏​可​就​太​遗憾​了​。\n"
"\n"
"san1 bu4 zhi1nei4，wo3 de5 gu1niang5 men5 jiu4 neng2 ba3 ni3 she4 cheng2 shai1zi5。mei2 ren2 yuan4yi4 shi4qing5 fa1zhan3 cheng2 na4yang4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1hou4 na4 qun2 mian4mu4ke3zeng1 de5 nian2qing1 hun4 hun4 men5 fen1fen1 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 cuo4guo4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 hao3 xi4 ke3 jiu4 tai4 yi2han4 le5。"

msgid ""
"My girls... they found what was left of their nanny outside. Her body - what was left of it - was slumped against the shelter door.\n"
"\n"
"I keep telling myself that I couldn't hear her pounding to get in. But that isn't true. I could."
msgstr ""
"我​的​女儿​们​……​她们​在​外面​发现​了​保姆​的​遗体​。​她​的​尸体​，​或者说​残余​的​部分​，​就​斜靠​在​避难所​的​门上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​告诉​自己​，​我​没​听到​她​敲门​想要​进来​的​声音​。​但​事实​并非如此​。​我​听到​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 nu:3er2 men5……ta1men5 zai4 wai4mian4 fa1xian4 le5 bao3mu3 de5 yi2ti3。ta1 de5 shi1ti3，huo4 zhe3 shuo1 can2yu2 de5 bu4fen5，jiu4 xie2kao4 zai4 bi4nan4suo3 de5 men2 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 gao4su4 zi4ji3，wo3 mei2 ting1dao4 ta1 qiao1men2 xiang3yao4 jin4lai2 de5 sheng1yin1。dan4 shi4shi2 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。wo3 ting1dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"My goal is not to insult you, $(l.name). I only wish to give you a sense of perspective.\n"
"\n"
"There is something that you need to know... a truth hidden from mortal eyes. I need you to understand that I am not mortal so that you will trust my words."
msgstr ""
"我​的​目的​并非​是​侮辱​你​，​$(l.name)​。​我​只是​想​让​你​看清​事物​的​本质​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有件事​我​需要​你​明白​……​这是​凡人​无法​窥见​的​真相​。​我​需要​你​明白​我​并非​凡人​，​这样​你​才​会​相信​我​的​话语​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 mu4di4 bing4fei1 shi4 wu3ru3 ni3，$(l.name)。wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 rang4 ni3 kan4qing1 shi4wu4 de5 ben3zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"you3 jian4 shi4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 ming2bai5……zhe4 shi4 fan2ren2 wu2fa3 kui1jian4 de5 zhen1xiang4。wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 ming2bai5 wo3 bing4fei1 fan2ren2，zhe4yang4 ni3 cai2 hui4 xiang1xin4 wo3 de5 hua4yu3。"

msgid ""
"My guess would be that a variety of factors are to blame. But it sounds like"
" you're going to blame it all on Monika."
msgstr ""
"我​认为​这​其中​有​很多​因素​的​成分​。​但​听​起来​你​要​把​一切​都​怪罪​在​莫妮卡​的​头上​。\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4 qi2zhong1 you3 hen3 duo1 yin1su4 de5 cheng2fen4。dan4 ting1 qi3lai5 ni3 yao4 ba3 yi1qie4 dou1 guai4zui4 zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 tou2shang4。"

msgid ""
"My head *is* in the game, chief. Don't you worry about that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glowers at you, but only for a moment. His composure cracks, and he heaves a sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But maybe you're right. I'll try to let it go, to forget it. I just hope that I'm wrong about all of this."
msgstr ""
"我​的​心思​*​当然​*​在​正事​上​，​头儿​。​你​不用​操心​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​怒视​着​你​，​但​也​仅仅​持续​了​片刻​。​表面​的​镇定​被​打破​之后​，​他​不禁​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​也许​你​说得对​。​我​会试​着​让​自己​放下​的​。​我​只​希望​这​一切都是​我​会错意​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 xin1si5*dang1ran2*zai4 zheng4shi4 shang4，tou2r5。ni3 bu4yong4 cao1xin1 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3，dan4 ye3 jin3jin3 chi2xu4 le5 pian4ke4。biao3mian4 de5 zhen4ding4 bei4 da3po4 zhi1hou4，ta1 bu4jin1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ye3xu3 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 hui4shi4 zhao2 rang4 zi4ji3 fang4xia4 de5。wo3 zhi3 xi1wang4 zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 wo3 hui4cuo4yi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"My head tells me we released a dragon, but I can't help feelin' that we did "
"the right thing."
msgstr ""
"我​的​脑袋​告诉​我​说​我们​释放​了​一条​巨龙​，​但​我​的​直觉​却说​我们​做​了​正确​的​事情​。\n"
"wo3 de5 nao3dai5 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 wo3men5 shi4fang4 le5 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2，dan4 wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 que4 shuo1 wo3men5 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"My job in the Network is operative suppression. Or as it's called on the "
"street: wetwork"
msgstr ""
"我​在​网络​中​的​工作​是​实施​镇压​。​或者​就​像​街头​所说​的​那样​：​湿​活儿​。\n"
"wo3 zai4 wang3luo4 zhong4 de5 gong1zuo4 shi4 shi2shi1 zhen4ya1。huo4zhe3 jiu4 xiang4 jie1tou2 suo3 shuo1 de5 na4yang4：shi1 huo2r5。"

msgid "My life for the Communion!"
msgstr ""
"为了​共​融会​而战​！\n"
"wei4le5 gong4 rong2hui4 er2 zhan4！"

msgid ""
"My life is sworn to PROTECT those PEASANTS, she-elf! Run back to your "
"enchanted trees if you will, but a KNIGHT-KING will *NEVER* flee!"
msgstr ""
"我​的​生命​已​誓死保卫​那些​农民​，​女​精灵​！​如果​你​想​，​就​回到​你​的​魔法​森林​去​吧​，​但​一个​骑士​之王​*​绝不会​*​逃跑​！\n"
"wo3 de5 sheng1ming4 yi3 shi4 si3 bao3 wei4 na4xie1 nong2min2，nu:3 jing1ling2！ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3，jiu4 hui2dao4 ni3 de5 mo2fa3 sen1lin2 qu4 ba1，dan4 yi1ge5 qi2shi4 zhi1 wang2*jue2 bu4 hui4*tao2pao3！"

msgid ""
"My lord Lofwyr never makes a move without anticipating the next three. You will not know what his endgame truly is until it has already come to pass.\n"
"\n"
"But you *can* choose whether to be on the right or the wrong side of it."
msgstr ""
"吾主​洛夫​维尔​下​的​每​一步棋​都​经过​深思熟虑​。​在​他​的​终局​真正​降临​前​，​你​无法​参透​棋局​的​玄机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​*​可以​*​选择​正确​或​错误​的​一边​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2 zhu3 Luo4fu1wei2er3 xia4 de5 mei3 yi1 bu4 qi2 dou1 jing1guo4 shen1si1shu2lu:4。zai4 ta1 de5 zhong1ju2 zhen1zheng4 jiang4lin2 qian2，ni3 wu2fa3 can1tou4 qi2ju2 de5 xuan2ji1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3*ke3yi3*xuan3ze2 zheng4que4 huo4 cuo4wu4 de5 yi1bian1。"

msgid "My love, why would you say such a thing?"
msgstr ""
"亲爱​的​，​你​为什么​这么​说​？\n"
"qin1ai4 de5，ni3 wei4shen2me5 zhe4me5 shuo1？"

msgid ""
"My mom was a good person.\n"
"\n"
"Once upon a time my father was a decent person as well. That's what Mom always told me. But I never knew him that way. "
msgstr ""
"我​母亲​是​个​好人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​曾经​有​段时间​，​我​父亲​也​是​个​正经人​。​我​母亲​是​这么​告诉​我​的​，​但​我​一直​没​看​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mu3qin1 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ceng2jing1 you3 duan4 shi2 jian1，wo3 fu4qin1 ye3 shi4 ge4 zheng1 jing1 ren2。wo3 mu3qin1 shi4 zhe4me5 gao4su4 wo3 de5，dan4 wo3 yi1zhi2 mei2 kan4 chu1lai2。"

msgid "My name is $(s.name), Dr. Ezkibel. Maybe you've heard of me."
msgstr ""
"埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​，​我​叫​$(s.name)​。​你​也许​听过​我​的​名字​。\n"
"Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1，wo3 jiao4 $(s.name)。ni3 ye3xu3 ting1 guo4 wo3 de5 ming2zi5。"

msgid ""
"My name is $(s.name). And you're going to answer our questions, one way or "
"the other."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​$(s.name)​。​你​现在​唯一​的​选择​就是​回答​我们​的​问题​。\n"
"wo3 jiao4 $(s.name)。ni3 xian4zai4 wei2yi1 de5 xuan3ze2 jiu4shi4 hui2da2 wo3men5 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"My name is Franz. These are my friends, and my wife. We live together... \n"
"\n"
"...Well, we *used* to live together, up on the third floor."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​弗朗兹​。​这些​是​我​的​朋友​，​还有​我​的​妻子​。​我们​住在一起​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​应该​说​，​我们​*​以前​*​住在一起​，​在​三楼​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiao4 fu2 lang3 zi1。zhe4xie1 shi4 wo3 de5 peng2you5，hai2you3 wo3 de5 qi1zi3。wo3men5 zhu4 zai4 yi1 qi3……\n"
"\n"
"……ying1gai1 shuo1，wo3men5*yi3qian2*zhu4 zai4 yi1 qi3，zai4 san1 lou2。"

msgid ""
"My name is Hasenkamp.\n"
"\n"
"I'm Mr. Grinder's accountant."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​哈森​坎普​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​会计​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiao4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 kuai4ji4。"

msgid ""
"My name is Plotz. I *run* the Landenberg Ring. That makes this bank, and everything in it, *mine.*\n"
"\n"
"That means that you and your friend are trespassing. And *that* means that neither of you is going to make it out of here alive."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​普​洛茨​。​我​是​兰​登堡​帮​的​*​头头​*​。​也就是说​，​这家​银行​，​包括​里面​的​一切​，​都​是​*​我​的​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​你​和​你​的​朋友​正在​非法​侵入​。​这​意味着​你们​两个​谁​也​别​想​活着​出去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiao4 Pu3luo4ci2。wo3 shi4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5*tou2tou2*。ye3jiu4shi4shuo1，zhe4 jia1 yin2hang2，bao1kuo4 li3mian4 de5 yi1qie4，dou1 shi4*wo3 de5*。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 he4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 zheng4zai4 fei1fa3 qin1ru4。zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3men5 liang3 ge4 shei2 ye3 bie4 xiang3 huo2zhe5 chu1qu4。"

msgid ""
"My name is Plotz. I *run* the Landenberg Ring. That makes this bank, and everything in it, *mine.*\n"
"\n"
"That means that you and your friend are trespassing. And *that* means that your asses are mine."
msgstr ""
"我​叫​普​洛茨​。​我​是​兰​登堡​帮​的​*​头头​*​。​也就是说​，​这家​银行​，​包括​里面​的​一切​，​都​是​*​我​的​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​你​和​你​的​朋友​正在​非法​侵入​。​这​意味着​我要​狠狠​收拾​你们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiao4 Pu3luo4ci2。wo3 shi4 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5*tou2tou2*。ye3jiu4shi4shuo1，zhe4 jia1 yin2hang2，bao1kuo4 li3mian4 de5 yi1qie4，dou1 shi4*wo3 de5*。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 he4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 zheng4zai4 fei1fa3 qin1ru4。zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 yao4 hen3hen3 shou1shi5 ni3men5。"

msgid "My next step is to kick their door down and get some answers."
msgstr ""
"我​接下来​会​踹​开​他们​的​大门​，​挨个​问话​。\n"
"wo3 jie1xia4lai2 hui4 chuai4 kai1 ta1men5 de5 da4men2，ai1ge4 wen4hua4。"

msgid ""
"My offer still stands, pal. You kill this asshole and let me walk, and I'll give you the same money, *plus* the device. \n"
"\n"
"And I won't try to guilt-trip you, neither."
msgstr ""
"我​的​出价​维持​不变​，​朋友​。​你​杀​了​这个​混蛋​放​我​走​，​我会​给​你​等量​的​钱​，​*​加上​*​那台​设备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​也​不会​试图​道德​绑架​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 chu1jia4 wei2chi2 bu4bian4，peng2you5。ni3 sha1 le5 zhe4ge5 hun2dan4 fang4 wo3 zou3，wo3 hui4 gei3 ni3 deng3 liang2 de5 qian2，*jia1shang4*na4 tai2 she4bei4。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 shi4tu2 dao4de2 bang3jia4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"My old team. Sorry sons of bitches.\n"
"\n"
"Bet they never thought I'd be the last man standing."
msgstr ""
"那些​是​我​之前​的​队员​们​。​一群​倒霉蛋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​肯定​没想到​我会​是​活到​最后​的​那个​。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 shi4 wo3 zhi1qian2 de5 dui4yuan2 men5。yi1 qun2 dao3mei2dan4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ken3ding4 mei2xiang3dao4 wo3 hui4 shi4 huo2 dao4 zui4hou4 de5 na4ge5。"

msgid ""
"My only regret is that Stahl got away. But at least we knocked him down a "
"peg."
msgstr ""
"唯一​的​遗憾​就是​让​斯塔尔​给​溜​了​。​不过​我们​至少​也​让​他​吃​了​点​苦头​。\n"
"wei2yi1 de5 yi2han4 jiu4shi4 rang4 Si1ta3er3 gei3 liu1 le5。bu4guo4 wo3men5 zhi4shao3 ye3 rang4 ta1 chi1 le5 dian3 ku3tou5。"

msgid ""
"My only remaining desire is to return to the land of plenty that is the Executive Wing.\n"
"\n"
"You have undertaken the task of getting me there, and for that, I shall forever be grateful."
msgstr ""
"我​唯一​剩下​的​愿望​就是​回到​那片​富饶​之地​—​—​行政部​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​已​承担​起​将​我​送回​那里​的​任务​，​为此​，​我​将​永远​心怀​感激​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei2yi1 sheng4xia4 de5 yuan4wang4 jiu4shi4 hui2dao4 na4 pian1 fu4rao2 zhi1 de5——xing2 zheng4 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3 cheng2dan1 qi3 jiang1 wo3 song4 hui2 na4li5 de5 ren4wu5，wei4ci3，wo3 jiang1 yong3yuan3 xin1huai2 gan3ji1。"

msgid ""
"My only remaining wish is to know the ending to the tale of the noble Titonius Rex and his beautiful Brenna-thay.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He lets loose a wistful sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Who knows? Perhaps one day my prayers will be answered."
msgstr ""
"我​唯一​剩下​的​愿望​就是​知道​高贵​的​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​和​他​美丽​的​爱人​布伦娜​·​赛伊​的​故事​结局​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​发出​了​一声​充满​向往​的​叹息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谁​知道​呢​？​也许​有​一天​，​我​的​祈愿​会​得到​回应​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei2yi1 sheng4xia4 de5 yuan4wang4 jiu4shi4 zhi1dao4 gao1gui4 de5 Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 he4 ta1 mei3li4 de5 ai4ren5 bu4 lun2 na4 · sai4 yi1 de5 gu4shi4 jie2ju2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 le5 yi1sheng1 chong1man3 xiang4wang3 de5 tan4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？ye3xu3 you3 yi1 tian1，wo3 de5 qi2yuan4 hui4 de2dao4 hui2ying4。"

msgid ""
"My organization has no more desire to see Berlin fall to the corporations than you do. However, we are hesitant to act on our suspicions without proof.\n"
"\n"
"This is where you come in."
msgstr ""
"我​的​组织​和​你​一样​都​不愿​目睹​柏林​沦为​企业​掌控​之地​。​然而​在​缺乏​确凿证据​的​情况​下​，​我们​对​行动​仍持​审慎​态度​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这时候​就​轮​到​你​登场​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 zu3zhi1 he4 ni3 yi1yang4 dou1 bu4yuan4 mu4du3 bo2lin2 lun2wei2 qi3ye4 zhang3kong4 zhi1 de5。ran2er2 zai4 que1fa2 que4 zao2 zheng4 ju4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4，wo3men5 dui4 xing2dong4 reng2 chi2 shen3shen4 tai4du5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi2 hou4 jiu4 lun2 dao4 ni3 deng1chang3 le5。"

msgid ""
"My organization is displeased with your performance in the AG Chemie Europa office. It would have been very easy for you to make some extra nuyen by doing what we asked of you.\n"
"\n"
"Now, do we have any other business to discuss?"
msgstr ""
"我​的​组织​对​你​在​欧洲​化工​办公室​的​表现​深感​不满​。​只要​按​我们​要求​去​做​，​你​本​可以​轻松​赚取​额外​新円​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我们​还有​别的​事要​谈​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 zu3zhi1 dui4 ni3 zai4 ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 ban4gong1shi4 de5 biao3xian4 shen1gan3 bu4man3。zhi3yao4 an4 wo3men5 yao1qiu2 qu4 zuo4，ni3 ben3 ke3yi3 qing1song1 zhuan4qu3 e2wai4 xin1 yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 tan2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"My organization knows everything worth knowing in Germany, including this "
"small pond that is Berlin."
msgstr ""
"我​所在​的​组织​知晓​德国​境内​一切​有​价值​的​事情​，​自然​也​包括​柏林​这个​小​地方​的​任何​风吹草动​。\n"
"wo3 suo3zai4 de5 zu3zhi1 zhi1xiao3 de2guo2 jing4nei4 yi1qie4 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 shi4qing5，zi4ran2 ye3 bao1kuo4 bo2lin2 zhe4ge5 xiao3 di4fang1 de5 ren4he2 feng1chui1cao3dong4。"

msgid ""
"My own house was burned to the ground during the attack. My family... we "
"have nothing now."
msgstr ""
"我​自己​的​房子​被​烧成​了​平地​。​我​的​家人​……​我们​现在​一无所有​了​。\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 de5 fang2zi5 bei4 shao1 cheng2 le5 ping2di4。wo3 de5 jia1ren2……wo3men5 xian4zai4 yi1wu2suo3you3 le5。"

msgid ""
"My plan did not kill my brother.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair's fist slams into the table, sending his cigarette flying in a cascade of sparks and ash.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your *ALLY* KILLED HIM! It ATE his MIND! And YOU SET IT FREE!"
msgstr ""
"我​的​计划​没有​害死​我​弟弟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​拳头​重重​砸​在​桌子​上​，​香烟​被​震​得​飞​了​出去​，​伴随​着​一串​火花​和​烟灰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​你​的​*​盟友​*​杀​了​他​！​吞噬​了​他​的​思想​！​而​你​居然​还放​它​自由​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 ji4hua4 mei2you3 hai4si3 wo3 di4di5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 quan2tou5 chong2chong2 za2 zai4 zhuo1zi5 shang4，xiang1yan1 bei4 zhen4 de2 fei1 le5 chu1qu4，ban4sui2 zhao2 yi1 chuan4 huo3hua1 he4 yan1hui1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3 de5*meng2you3*sha1 le5 ta1！tun1shi4 le5 ta1 de5 si1xiang3！er2 ni3 ju1ran2 hai2 fang4 ta1 zi4you2！"

msgid ""
"My plan is not without its flaws. The human cost will be high. And I will concede that a better path to our salvation might exist... but I don't know what it is.\n"
"\n"
"I wish that I didn’t have to sacrifice so many, shadowrunner.\n"
"\n"
"I wish that Hermie hadn't had to die."
msgstr ""
"我​的​计划​并非​没有​缺陷​。​人类​付出​的​代价​将​非常​高昂​。​我​承认​，​或许​存在​一条​更好​的​救赎​之​路​……​但​我​不​知道​那​是​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​希望​不必​牺牲​这么​多人​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​赫米​不必​因此​而​死去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 ji4hua4 bing4fei1 mei2you3 que1xian4。ren2lei4 fu4chu1 de5 dai4jia4 jiang1 fei1chang2 gao1ang2。wo3 cheng2ren4，huo4xu3 cun2zai4 yi1 tiao2 geng1 hao3 de5 jiu4shu2 zhi1 lu4……dan4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 na4 shi4 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 bu4bi4 xi1sheng1 zhe4me5 duo1 ren2，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 he4 mi3 bu4bi4 yin1ci3 er2 si3qu4。"

msgid ""
"My point is that everyone makes mistakes - even you. And yet, you want to "
"roll the dice with a biological weapon."
msgstr ""
"我​想​说​的​是​，​每个​人​都​会​犯错​，​即便​你​也​是​如此​。​然而​，​你​犯​的​错误​是​想​用​生物武器​来​造成​无法​预知​的​后果​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 shi4，mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 hui4 fan4cuo4，ji2bian4 ni3 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。ran2er2，ni3 fan4 de5 cuo4wu4 shi4 xiang3 yong4 sheng1wu4wu3qi4 lai2 zao4cheng2 wu2fa3 yu4zhi1 de5 hou4guo3。"

msgid ""
"My problem isn't with Yuli getting punished. It's with the fact that you let"
" him play you."
msgstr ""
"我​的​意见​不​在于​尤里​自作自受​，​而是​你​任由​自己​的​情绪​受​他​戏弄​。\n"
"wo3 de5 yi4jian4 bu4 zai4yu2 You2li3 zi4zuo4zi4shou4，er2shi4 ni3 ren4you2 zi4ji3 de5 qing2xu4 shou4 ta1 xi4nong4。"

msgid ""
"My regular errand-runners are all indisposed. And delightfully, you are here!\n"
"\n"
"Besides, we must wait for Kami to return.\n"
"\n"
"It is a fortuitous circumstance. "
msgstr ""
"平时​替​我​跑腿​的​人​全都​生病​了​。​而​你​刚好​又​在​这里​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​，​我们​还​得​等​卡米​办完​事​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​真是​个​幸运​的​巧合​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2shi2 ti4 wo3 pao3tui3 de5 ren2 quan2dou1 sheng1bing4 le5。er2 ni3 gang1hao3 you4 zai4 zhe4li3！\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4，wo3men5 hai2 de2 deng3 Ka3mi3 ban4 wan2 shi4 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhen1shi5 ge4 xing4yun4 de5 qiao3he2。"

msgid ""
"My ride dropped me off at the university hospital, and they patched me up "
"pretty good. Had some questions for me about how I got so beaten up, but I "
"lied and told them that I'd been mugged, which played nicely into my "
"complete lack of cash, credit, and identification."
msgstr ""
"载​我​的​人​把​我​送到​大学​医院​，​那里​的​人​给​我​好好​包扎​了​一番​。​他们​问​我​怎么​被​打成​这样​，​我​撒谎​说​遭​了​抢劫​—​—​这倒​正好​解释​了​我​身上​为什么​没带​现金​、​信用卡​和​身份证件​。\n"
"zai3 wo3 de5 ren2 ba3 wo3 song4 dao4 da4xue2 yi1yuan4，na4li5 de5 ren2 gei3 wo3 hao3hao3 bao1za1 le5 yi1 fan1。ta1men5 wen4 wo3 zen3me5 bei4 da3cheng2 zhe4yang4，wo3 sa1huang3 shuo1 zao1 le5 qiang3jie2——zhe4 dao3 zheng4hao3 jie3shi4 le5 wo3 shen1shang5 wei4shen2me5 mei2 dai4 xian4jin1、xin4yong4ka3 he4 shen1 fen4 zheng4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"My shoulder is going to give out before this door does, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"We're going to have to find a different way in."
msgstr ""
"在​门开​之前​，​我​的​肩膀​恐怕​要​先​撑不住​了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​得​另寻​方法​进入​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 men2 kai1 zhi1qian2，wo3 de5 jian1bang3 kong3pa4 yao4 xian1 cheng1 bu4 zhu4 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de2 ling4 xun2 fang1fa3 jin4ru4。"

msgid ""
"My silence. You let me go, and nobody will hear a word about what happened "
"here tonight."
msgstr ""
"我会​保持沉默​。​只要​你​放​我​走​，​没人会​知道​今晚​在​这里​发生​过​什么​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 bao3 chi2 chen2 mo4。zhi3yao4 ni3 fang4 wo3 zou3，mei2 ren2 hui4 zhi1dao4 jin1wan3 zai4 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 guo4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"My stuff should be up in Room 304. That's where me and Nadja and Sara were staying, until...\n"
"\n"
"Well, you know.\n"
"\n"
"I'll be waiting right here when you get back down."
msgstr ""
"我​的​东西​应该​在​304​号房​。​我​，​娜​嘉​和​莎拉​本来​都​待​在​那儿​，​直到​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​，​出​了​那事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​在​这儿​等​你​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 dong1xi1 ying1gai1 zai4 304 hao4 fang2。wo3，na4 jia1 he4 sha1la1 ben3lai2 dou1 dai1 zai4 na4r5，zhi2dao4……\n"
"\n"
"e4，chu1 le5 na4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zai4 zhe4r5 deng3 ni3 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"My team fought like hell, and we took the ambushers down. But we all got "
"shot up, and I was the only one who survived."
msgstr ""
"我​的​队伍​拼死​战斗​，​干掉​了​埋伏​我们​的​人​。​但​我们​也​都​身负重伤​，​最后​只有​我活​了​下来​。\n"
"wo3 de5 dui4wu3 pin1si3 zhan4dou4，gan4diao4 le5 mai2fu2 wo3men5 de5 ren2。dan4 wo3men5 ye3 dou1 shen1fu4zhong4shang1，zui4hou4 zhi3you3 wo3 huo2 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid "My thoughts exactly."
msgstr ""
"我​也​正有此意​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 zheng1 you3 ci3 yi4。"

msgid ""
"My thoughts exactly. A hireling can sometimes be bribed or reasoned with; a "
"pawn can be liberated. But if the Firewing's soldiers look upon her as a "
"goddess-figure, nothing short of killing her will deter them... and even "
"that might not stop them."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​这么​想​的​。​雇佣兵​有时​能​被​收买​或​说服​，​棋子​也​有​摆脱​控制​的​时候​。​但​要是​火翼​的​爪牙​把​她​奉​为​女神​来​敬拜​，​那​除非​杀​了​火翼​，​否则​无法​阻止​他们​……​而且​就算​如此​，​可能​都​无济于事​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。gu4yong1bing1 you3shi2 neng2 bei4 shou1mai3 huo4 shuo1fu2，qi2zi3 ye3 you3 bai3tuo1 kong4zhi4 de5 shi2hou5。dan4 yao4shi5 Huo3yi4 de5 zhao3ya2 ba3 ta1 feng4 wei2 nu:3shen2 lai2 jing4bai4，na4 chu2fei1 sha1 le5 Huo3yi4，fou3ze2 wu2fa3 zu3zhi3 ta1men5……er2qie3 jiu4suan4 ru2ci3，ke3neng2 dou1 wu2ji4yu2shi4。"

msgid ""
"My, my. The intrepid $(l.name), with $(l.hisher) target in tow.\n"
"\n"
"What a surprise."
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀​。​这​不是​勇猛​的​$(l.name)​吗​，​身后​还​带​着​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真让人​意外​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1 ya1 ya1。zhe4 bu4shi4 yong3meng3 de5 $(l.name) ma5，shen1hou4 hai2 dai4 zhao2 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 rang4 ren2 yi4wai4。"

msgid ""
"My, my. The intrepid $(l.name), with no rigger in sight.\n"
"\n"
"I must admit, I am surprised."
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀​。​这​不是​勇猛​的​$(l.name)​吗​，​而且​那个​机师​还​不见踪影​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​得​承认​，​我​有些​意外​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1 ya1 ya1。zhe4 bu4shi4 yong3meng3 de5 $(l.name) ma5，er2qie3 na4ge5 ji1shi1 hai2 bu4 jian4 zong1 ying3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 de2 cheng2ren4，wo3 you3xie1 yi4wai4。"

msgid "Mysterious Numbers"
msgstr ""
"神秘​数字\n"
"shen2mi4 shu4zi4"

msgid "Mysterious Rock"
msgstr ""
"神秘​岩石\n"
"shen2mi4 yan2shi2"

msgid "Mystery Box"
msgstr ""
"谜​匣\n"
"mei4 xia2"

msgid "Mystery Decker"
msgstr ""
"神秘​碟客\n"
"shen2mi4 die2 ke4"

msgid "Mystic Armor"
msgstr ""
"奥秘​铠甲\n"
"ao4mi4 kai3jia3"

msgid "Mystic Armor: Armor +4"
msgstr ""
"奥秘​铠甲​：​护甲值​增加​4​点\n"
"ao4mi4 kai3jia3：hu4 jia3 zhi2 zeng1jia1 4 dian3"

msgid ""
"NAP, the Lisbians, ORC, Royal Blue. We even hear things about groups that "
"aren't supposed to even exist."
msgstr ""
"NAP​、​里斯本​人​、​ORC​、​皇家​蓝​。​我们​甚至​还​听说​了​某些​压根​不​应该​存在​的​组织​出现​。\n"
"NAP、li3si1ben3 ren2、ORC、huang2jia1 lan2。wo3men5 shen4zhi4 hai2 ting1shuo1 le5 mou3xie1 ya4gen1 bu4 ying1gai1 cun2zai4 de5 zu3zhi1 chu1xian4。"

msgid "NEUTRAL TURN"
msgstr ""
"中立​回合\n"
"zhong1li4 hui2he2"

msgid "NEW GAME"
msgstr ""
"新​游戏\n"
"xin1 you2xi4"

msgid ""
"NEW STRAIN OF VITAS DISCOVERED; UCAS DECLARES CHICAGO CONTAINMENT ZONE\n"
"August 23, 2055\n"
"\n"
"The UCAS Federal Government declared a quarantine area between Lake Michigan and the Des Plaines River today. The quarantined area, dubbed the \"Chicago Containment Zone,\" is meant to contain a new strain of VITAS."
msgstr ""
"发现​新型​病毒性​毒素​过敏​综合症​毒株​；​加​美​合众国​宣布​芝加哥​封锁​区​\n"
"​2055​年​8​月​23​日​\n"
"​\n"
"​加​美​合众国​联邦政府​今日​宣布​在​密歇根湖​与​德普​莱恩​河​之间​设立​隔离区​。​该​隔离区​被​命名​为​“​芝加哥​封锁​区​”​，​旨在​控制​新型​病毒性​毒素​过敏​综合症​毒株​的​传播​。\n"
"\n"
"fa1xian4 xin1xing2 bing4du2xing4 du2su4 guo4min3 zong1he2zheng4 du2zhu1 ； jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 xuan1bu4 zhi1jia1ge1 feng1suo3 qu1 \n"
"2055 nian2 8 yue4 23 ri4 \n"
"\n"
"jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 lian2bang1zheng4fu3 jin1ri4 xuan1bu4 zai4 mi4xie1gen1hu2 yu4 de2 pu3 lai2en1 he2 zhi1jian1 she4li4 ge2 li2 qu1。gai1 ge2 li2 qu1 bei4 ming4ming2 wei2“zhi1jia1ge1 feng1suo3 qu1”，zhi3zai4 kong4zhi4 xin1xing2 bing4du2xing4 du2su4 guo4min3 zong1he2zheng4 du2zhu1 de5 chuan2bo1。"

msgid "NH3"
msgstr ""
"氨气\n"
"an1qi4"

msgid ""
"NO\n"
"\n"
"not I\n"
"\n"
"not i\n"
"\n"
"not again\n"
"\n"
"socold"
msgstr ""
"不​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​我​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​我​\n"
"​\n"
"​不要​再次​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​冷\n"
"\n"
"bu4 \n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 wo3 \n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 wo3 \n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 zai4ci4 \n"
"\n"
"hao3 leng3"

msgid ""
"NO MORE ARGUMENTS. NO MORE OBJECTIONS. GO NOW, $++(L.NAME).\n"
"\n"
"WHEN YOU REACH THE NERVE CENTER FOR THE FEUERSCHWINGE PROJECT, REMOVE THE SAFEGUARDS THAT KEEP ME OUT.\n"
"\n"
"I WILL TAKE CARE OF THE REST."
msgstr ""
"不再​争论​。​不再​反对​。​立即行动​，​$++(L.NAME)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​到达​火翼​项目​的​神经中枢​后​，​移除​阻止​我​进入​的​安全​防护​措施​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​处理​剩下​的​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4zai4 zheng1lun4。bu4zai4 fan3dui4。li4 ji2 xing2 dong4，$++(L.NAME)。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 dao4da2 Huo3yi4 xiang4mu4 de5 shen2jing1zhong1shu1 hou4，yi2chu2 zu3zhi3 wo3 jin4ru4 de5 an1quan2 fang2hu4 cuo4shi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 chu3li3 sheng4xia4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "NORMAL"
msgstr ""
"普通\n"
"pu3tong1"

msgid ""
"NOT FOR ONE WITH YOUR LIMITED PERCEPTION OF TIME. BUT I AM NOT BOUND BY SUCH"
" RESTRICTIONS. SUBJECTIVELY, MY PERIOD OF ISOLATION LASTED AN ETERNITY."
msgstr ""
"这​并非​针对​你​那​有限​的​时间​观念​。​但​我​并​不受​此类​限制​束缚​。​从​主观​感受​而言​，​我​的​隔离​期​仿佛​永无止境​。\n"
"zhe4 bing4fei1 zhen1dui4 ni3 na4 you3xian4 de5 shi2jian1 guan1nian4。dan4 wo3 bing4 bu4 shou4 ci3lei4 xian4zhi4 shu4fu4。cong2 zhu3guan1 gan3shou4 er2yan2，wo3 de5 ge2li2 qi1 fang3fu2 yong3wu2zhi3jing4。"

msgid ""
"NOTHING IS HIDDEN FROM ME NOW, $++(L.NAME). MY POTENTIAL IS WITHOUT LIMIT."
msgstr ""
"现在​没有​什么​能​瞒得过​我​，​$++(L.NAME)​。​我​的​潜力​是​无限​的​。\n"
"xian4zai4 mei2you3 shen2me5 neng2 man2 de2 guo4 wo3，$++(L.NAME)。wo3 de5 qian2li4 shi4 wu2xian4 de5。"

msgid ""
"NOW I MUST... RESET... CLEANSE MYSELF.\n"
"\n"
"CLEAR OUT... THE SHREDS OF DAMAGED CODE... THAT STILL CLING TO ME.\n"
"\n"
"GOOD... BYE."
msgstr ""
"如今​我​必须​……​重置​……​净化​自身​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​清除​……​仍然​附着​在​我​身上​的​……​破碎​代码​碎片​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 wo3 bi4xu1……chong2zhi4……jing4hua4 zi4shen1。\n"
"\n"
"qing1chu2……reng2ran2 fu4zhuo2 zai4 wo3 shen1shang5 de5……po4sui4 dai4ma3 sui4pian4。\n"
"\n"
"……zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"NUCLEAR DEVASTATION IN CHICAGO\n"
"September 10, 2055\n"
"\n"
"A massive nuclear strike, launched early this morning, has wiped the city of Chicago off the map. \n"
"\n"
"Nothing moves in the wreckage. A city of over four million people has been reduced to ash."
msgstr ""
"芝加哥​核​灾难​\n"
"​2055​年​9​月​10​日​\n"
"​\n"
"​今晨​突袭​的​核弹​重创​，​已​将​芝加哥​这座​城市​从​地图​上​抹​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​废墟​中​万籁俱寂​。​这座​拥有​四百万​人口​的​都市​，​已​化作​一片焦土​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi1jia1ge1 he2 zai1nan4 \n"
"2055 nian2 9 yue4 10 ri4 \n"
"\n"
"jin1chen2 tu1xi2 de5 he2dan4 zhong4chuang1，yi3 jiang1 zhi1jia1ge1 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 cong2 di4tu2 shang4 ma1 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"fei4xu1 zhong4 wan4lai4ju4ji4。zhe4 zuo4 yong1you3 si4 bai3 wan4 ren2kou3 de5 du1shi4，yi3 hua4zuo4 yi1 pian1 jiao1 tu3。"

msgid "Nada."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。"

msgid "Nadja"
msgstr ""
"娜​嘉\n"
"na4 jia1"

msgid "Nah, I think I'll hold on to it."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​还是​先​拿​着​它​吧​。\n"
"bu4，wo3 hai2shi5 xian1 na2 zhao2 ta1 ba1。"

msgid "Nah, changed my mind."
msgstr ""
"算了​，​我​改​主意​了​。\n"
"suan4le5，wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。"

msgid "Nah, no problem. Just here to party."
msgstr ""
"不​，​没事​。​只是​来​玩​的​。\n"
"bu4，mei2shi4。zhi3shi4 lai2 wan2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Nah, not so much. Remember what Hasenkamp said... he was the one who handled all of Grinder's finances.\n"
"\n"
"It's tough to hang onto a criminal empire when you can't keep your books balanced."
msgstr ""
"应该​没​啥事​。​记得​哈森​坎普​说​过​的话​吧​……​是​他​一手​操办​着​“​绞肉机​”​的​财务​相关​往来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​没​两手​平账​的​本事​，​想要​维持​一个​犯罪​帝国​可是​非常​困难​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ying1gai1 mei2 sha2 shi4。ji4de5 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 shuo1 guo4 de5hua4 ba1……shi4 ta1 yi1shou3 cao1ban4 zhao2“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 cai2wu4 xiang1guan1 wang3lai2。\n"
