"是​个​屁​。​当​坏人​也​需要​有​相当​的​信念​感​，​他​有​个​卵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​他​就是​把​人类​至上​主义者​当成​了​某种​寄宿​学校​，​毕竟​他们​会​给​成员​提供​食宿​。​这样一来​，​省​下来​的​钱​不​就​能​供​他​自个儿​花天酒地​了​？​所以​他​就​把​亲生​儿子​丢​了​过去​，​他​才​不在乎​那些​人​是不是​法西斯​畜生​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ge4 pi4。dang1 huai4ren2 ye3 xu1yao4 you3 xiang1dang1 de5 xin4nian4 gan3，ta1 you3 ge4 luan3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ta1 jiu4shi4 ba3 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 dang4cheng2 le5 mou3zhong3 ji4su4 xue2xiao4，bi4jing4 ta1men5 hui4 gei3 cheng2yuan2 ti2gong1 shi2su4。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，sheng3 xia4lai5 de5 qian2 bu4 jiu4 neng2 gong1 ta1 zi4ge3r5 hua1tian1jiu3di4 le5？suo3yi3 ta1 jiu4 ba3 qin1sheng1 er2zi5 diu1 le5 guo4qu4，ta1 cai2 bu4zai4hu5 na4xie1 ren2 shi4bu5shi4 fa3xi1si1 chu4sheng5 ni2。"

