"\n"
"wo3 cong2wei4 zhi4yi2 guo4 wo3men5 yan2jiu1 de5 he2li3xing4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2wei4 kao3lu:4 guo4 ju3bao4 wo3 de5 gu4zhu3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mai2tou2ku3gan4，quan2li4yi3fu4，chu1se4 de5 wan2cheng2 le5 jiao1gei3 wo3 de5 ren4wu5。"

