"suan4shi4 ba1。yao4 wo3 fang4 ni3 chu1lai2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"New programming accepted, targeting accepted, searching for valid targets."
msgstr ""
"已​接受​新​程序​，​接受​新​目标​，​正在​搜索​有效​目标​。\n"
"yi3 jie1shou4 xin1 cheng2xu4，jie1shou4 xin1 mu4biao1，zheng4zai4 sou1suo3 you3xiao4 mu4biao1。"

msgid "New programming accepted."
msgstr ""
"已​接受​新​程序​。\n"
"yi3 jie1shou4 xin1 cheng2xu4。"

msgid "New recruits. I picked them up in Stuttgart."
msgstr ""
"是​新来​的​人​。​我​在​斯图加特​招募​的​。\n"
"shi4 xin1 lai2 de5 ren2。wo3 zai4 si1tu2jia1te4 zhao1mu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"New to the Kreuzbasar then. Heard Monika had some fresh meat in her stable."
msgstr ""
"看来​你​是​刚来​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​了​。​我​听说​莫妮卡​招揽​了​一些​新人​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 shi4 gang1 lai2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 le5。wo3 ting1shuo1 Mo4ni1ka3 zhao1lan3 le5 yi1xie1 xin1ren2。"

msgid "News Anchor"
msgstr ""
"新闻​主播\n"
"xin1wen2 zhu3bo1"

msgid ""
"News travels fast, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"It seems a small group of well-armed assailants entered Das Kesselhaus hotel earlier today and \"cleaned house\", so to speak. "
msgstr ""
"消息​传​得​很快​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​据说​今天​早些时候​，​一​小队​武装​精良​的​袭击者​闯入​“​锅炉房​”​旅馆​，​说​是​“​彻底​打扫​”​了​现场​。\n"
"\n"
"xiao1xi5 chuan2 de2 hen3 kuai4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"ju4shuo1 jin1tian1 zao3 xie1 shi2 hou4，yi1 xiao3 dui4 wu3zhuang1 jing1liang2 de5 xi2ji1zhe3 chuang3ru4“Guo1lu2fang2” lu:3guan3，shuo1 shi4“che4di3 da3sao3” le5 xian4chang3。"

msgid "Newscast Camera"
msgstr ""
"新闻广播​镜头\n"
"xin1 wen2 yan3 bo1 jing4tou2"

msgid "Newsday World Report"
msgstr ""
"每日​世界​新闻\n"
"mei3ri4 shi4jie4 xin1wen2"

msgid ""
"Next come visitors of uncertain intent. Some may just be bottom feeders, "
"sniffing after the leavings of the dead. Others will be hunters, looking to "
"exploit a leaderless tribe."
msgstr ""
"接下来​就是​各种​意图​不明​的​访客​。​有些​可能​只是​底层​食客​，​嗅​着​死者​的​残骸​而​来​。​另​一些则​是​猎人​，​想​利用​这个​群龙无首​的​社区​。\n"
"jie1xia4lai2 jiu4shi4 ge4zhong3 yi4tu2 bu4ming2 de5 fang3ke4。you3xie1 ke3neng2 zhi3shi4 di3ceng2 shi2ke4，xiu4 zhao2 si3zhe3 de5 can2hai2 er2 lai2。ling4 yi1 xie1 ze2 shi4 lie4ren2，xiang3 li4yong4 zhe4ge5 qun2long2wu2shou3 de5 she4qu1。"

msgid ""
"Next to some ancient but still-functional ventilation intake fans is a panel labeled \"Ventilation Controls.\"\n"
"\n"
"It contains a row of four red plastic buttons labeled 1-4. The light above number $(scene.ActiveGasArea) is currently lit.\n"
"\n"
"There is a lever labeled \"Manual Bypass\" next to the panel."
msgstr ""
"在​一些​古老​但​仍​可​正常​工作​的​通风​进气​扇​旁边​，​有​一个​标有​“​通风​控制​”​的​面板​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​面板​上​有​一排​四个​红色​塑料​按钮​，​分别​标有​1​-​4​。​目前​，​编号​为​$(scene.ActiveGasArea)​的​上方​指示灯​处于​亮​起​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​面板​旁边​有​一个​标有​“​手动​超控​”​的​杠杆​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 yi1xie1 gu3lao3 dan4 reng2 ke3 zheng4chang2 gong1zuo4 de5 tong1feng1 jin4 qi4 shan1 pang2bian1，you3 yi1ge5 biao1 you3“tong1feng1 kong4zhi4” de5 mian4ban3。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 mian4ban3 shang4 you3 yi1pai2 si4 ge4 hong2se4 su4liao4 an4niu3，fen1bie2 biao1 you3 1 -4。mu4qian2，bian1hao4 wei2 $(scene.ActiveGasArea) de5 shang4fang1 zhi3 shi4 deng1 chu3yu2 liang4 qi3 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 mian4ban3 pang2bian1 you3 yi1ge5 biao1 you3“shou3dong4 chao1 kong4” de5 gang4gan3。"

msgid "Nice Light"
msgstr ""
"Nice​ ​Light\n"
"Nice Light"

msgid "Nice job, Jana."
msgstr ""
"做得好​，​简娜​。\n"
"zuo4 de2 hao3，Jian3na4。"

msgid ""
"Nice of you to join us.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances at the PDA on his wrist, then looks back up at you. When he speaks again, his voice is sharp and humorless.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're late, chummer."
msgstr ""
"欢迎​你​加入​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​看​了​眼​手腕​上​的​PDA​，​又​看​向​你​。​他​再​开口​时​，​声音​变得​冷漠​而​尖锐​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​迟到​了​，​亲​。\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 ni3 jia1ru4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 le5 yan3 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 PDA，you4 kan4 xiang4 ni3。ta1 zai4 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 bian4de5 leng3mo4 er2 jian1rui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 chi2dao4 le5，qin1。"

msgid ""
"Nice pun. All right, suit yourself, dude.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She raises her glass to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don’t forget to drink more."
msgstr ""
"挺会​玩​文字游戏​啊​。​那​你​就​自便​吧​，​伙计​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​举起​杯子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别忘了​多​喝​几杯​。\n"
"\n"
"ting3 hui4 wan2 wen2 zi4 you2 xi4 a1。na4 ni3 jiu4 zi4bian4 ba1，huo3ji5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 ju3qi3 bei1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 wang4 le5 duo1 he4 ji1 bei1。"

msgid ""
"Nice to meet you, $(l.name).\n"
"\t\n"
"Now that I’ve said my bit, what are you doing in a place like this?"
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​认识​你​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一直​光说​我​了​，​你​在​这么​个​地方​又​是​做​什么​的​？\n"
"\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhi2 guang1 shuo1 wo3 le5，ni3 zai4 zhe4me5 ge4 di4fang1 you4 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？"

msgid ""
"Nice try, but I don't buy it. If Lofwyr knew what Vauclair was planning, "
"he'd have handled it himself."
msgstr ""
"这倒​是​挺​新鲜​，​但​我​才​不信​。​要是​洛夫​维尔​知道​沃​克莱尔​的​计划​，​他​早就​亲自动手​了​。\n"
"zhe4 dao3 shi4 ting3 xin1xian1，dan4 wo3 cai2 bu4 xin4。yao4shi5 Luo4fu1wei2er3 zhi1dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 ji4hua4，ta1 zao3jiu4 qin1zi4dong4shou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Nice work, $(l.name). There have been no alerts thus far... hopefully, you'll continue to avoid detection as you make your way through the building.\n"
"\n"
"If an alert does go out, I'll get you an ETA on their reinforcements. But hopefully it won't come to that."
msgstr ""
"干​的​好​，​$(l.name)​。​目前​尚未​触发​警报​……​希望​你​能​继续​保持​隐蔽​，​顺利​穿越​整栋​建筑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​警报​真的​响起​，​我会​及时​告知​增援部队​的​预计​抵达​时间​。​但愿​不会​走到​那​一步​。\n"
"\n"
"gan4 de5 hao3，$(l.name)。mu4qian2 shang4wei4 chu4fa1 jing3bao4……xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 ji4xu4 bao3chi2 yin3bi4，shun4li4 chuan1yue4 zheng3 dong4 jian4zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 jing3bao4 zhen1de5 xiang3qi3，wo3 hui4 ji2shi2 gao4zhi1 zeng1 yuan2 bu4 dui4 de5 yu4ji4 di3da2 shi2jian1。dan4yuan4 bu4hui4 zou3 dao4 na4 yi1 bu4。"

msgid "Nice. You said that these things were designed for crowd control?"
msgstr ""
"不错​。​你​之前​说​这​东西​可以​达到​群体​控制​的​效果​？\n"
"bu4cuo4。ni3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 zhe4 dong1xi1 ke3yi3 da2dao4 qun2ti3 kong4zhi4 de5 xiao4guo3？"

msgid "Nicely done, Bl--"
msgstr ""
"做得好​—​—\n"
"zuo4 de2 hao3 — —"

msgid "Nicely done, fearless leader. Was that satisfying for you?"
msgstr ""
"漂亮​，​无畏​领袖​。​这下​满意​了​吧​？\n"
"piao4liang5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。zhe4xia4 man3yi4 le5 ba1？"

msgid "Nicely done."
msgstr ""
"干得​漂亮​。\n"
"gan4 de2 piao4liang5。"

msgid "Nicely done. "
msgstr ""
"干得​漂亮​。\n"
"gan4 de2 piao4liang5。"

msgid "Nifty piece of tech."
msgstr ""
"真是​件​精巧​的​高科技​小玩意儿​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 jian4 jing1qiao3 de5 gao1ke1ji4 xiao3 wan2 yi4 er2。"

msgid "Night of Rage?"
msgstr ""
"愤怒​之夜​？\n"
"fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4？"

msgid ""
"Nil sweat. If you want to share with me sometime, I'd love to hear whatever you've got.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She blows a kiss at you then returns to the comm at her wrist, humming quietly.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"没事​。​如果​你​什么​时候​有空​和​我​说​的话​，​我会​很​乐意​听​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​向​你​抛​了​个​飞吻​，​然后​把​注意力​转回​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​，​轻轻地​哼​着​歌​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 you3kong4 he4 wo3 shuo1 de5hua4，wo3 hui4 hen3 le4yi4 ting1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 pao1 le5 ge4 fei1wen3，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3hui2 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4，qing1 qing1 de5 heng1 zhao2 ge1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Nine times out of ten I'd agree with you. But Marta... the Adversary is a "
"special case. Somewhere, deep down, you must know that."
msgstr ""
"你​的​观点​大体上​是​没错​，​但玛​尔塔​……​反叛者​是​个​特例​。​你​内心深处​肯定​也​明白​这​一点​。\n"
"ni3 de5 guan1dian3 da4ti3shang4 shi4 mei2cuo4，dan4 Ma3er3ta3……fan3 pan4 zhe3 shi4 ge4 te4li4。ni3 nei4xin1shen1chu4 ken3ding4 ye3 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "Nitro"
msgstr ""
"氮冲\n"
"dan4 chong1"

msgid "Nitro: Strength +2, Willpower +2, Charisma -2, Intelligence -2"
msgstr ""
"氮冲​：​+​2​力量​，​+​2​意志​，​-​2​魅力​，​-​2​智力\n"
"dan4 chong1：+2 li4liang5，+2 yi4zhi4，-2 mei4li4，-2 zhi4li4"

msgid "Nixie"
msgstr ""
"妮​希\n"
"ni1 xi1"

msgid "Nixie's Outfit"
msgstr ""
"妮​希​的​服装\n"
"ni1 xi1 de5 fu2zhuang1"

msgid "No - Eiger's right. You're jerking us around."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​艾格尔​说得对​。​你​在​拿​我们​开涮​呢​。\n"
"mei2cuo4，Ai4ge2er3 shuo1 de2 dui4。ni3 zai4 na2 wo3men5 kai1shuan4 ni2。"

msgid "No Content Packs Found"
msgstr ""
"未找到​内容​包\n"
"wei4 zhao3 dao4 nei4rong2 bao1"

msgid ""
"No ID, no access. If you really did lose your card, you can take it up with Corporate.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She waves you away with her rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now move along."
msgstr ""
"没有​证件​就​不能​通行​。​如果​你​真​把​卡​弄​丢​了​，​就​去​跟​公司​的​人​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​晃晃​枪身​，​示意​你​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​走​人​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 zheng4jian4 jiu4 bu4neng2 tong1xing2。ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1 ba3 ka3 long4 diu1 le5，jiu4 qu4 gen1 gong1si1 de5 ren2 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huang3 huang3 qiang1 shen1，shi4yi4 ni3 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 zou3 ren2。"

msgid "No Stories Found"
msgstr ""
"未找到​故事\n"
"wei4 zhao3 dao4 gu4shi4"

msgid ""
"No alarms sound.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"警报​没有​响起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么​都​没​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"jing3bao4 mei2you3 xiang3qi3。\n"
"\n"
"shen2me5 dou1 mei2 fa1sheng1。"

msgid "No big deal. Some people needed saving, and I saved ‘em. "
msgstr ""
"没什么​大不了​的​。​有人​需要​救助​，​我​就​出手​相救​了​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5。you3ren2 xu1yao4 jiu4zhu4，wo3 jiu4 chu1shou3 xiang1 jiu4 le5。"

msgid "No business today. I'm leaving."
msgstr ""
"今天​不谈​生意​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"jin1tian1 bu4 tan2 sheng1yi4。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"No choice but to press on ahead, then. We'll see you on the other side."
msgstr ""
"既然​别无选择​，​我们​只能​继续前进​了​。​等​任务​结束​后​再聊​。\n"
"ji4ran2 bie2wu2xuan3ze2，wo3men5 zhi3neng2 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 le5。deng3 ren4wu5 jie2shu4 hou4 zai4 liao2。"

msgid ""
"No choice. If we don’t stop Audran from releasing that dragon, everyone in "
"the Kreuzbasar is dead. "
msgstr ""
"我们​别无选择​。​如果​我们​不能​阻止​奥​德兰​释放​巨龙​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​就​都​死定了​。\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 Ao4de2lan2 shi4fang4 ju4long2 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 jiu4 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No choice. If we don’t stop Vauclair from releasing that dragon, everyone in"
" the Kreuzbasar is dead. "
msgstr ""
"我们​别无选择​。​如果​我们​不能​阻止​沃​克莱尔​释放​巨龙​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​就​都​死定了​。\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 shi4fang4 ju4long2 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 jiu4 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No choice. We have to find where Feuerschwinge is being kept.\n"
"\n"
"If we don’t stop Vauclair from releasing her, everyone in the Kreuzbasar is dead."
msgstr ""
"我们​别无选择​。​得​去​找到​火翼​被​关押​的​地点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​不能​阻止​沃​克莱尔​释放​她​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​就​都​死定了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。de2 qu4 zhao3dao4 Huo3yi4 bei4 guan1ya1 de5 di4dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 shi4fang4 ta1 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 jiu4 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No choice. We have to find where Feuerschwinge is being kept. If we don’t "
"stop Audran from releasing her, everyone in the Kreuzbasar is dead."
msgstr ""
"我们​别无选择​。​得​去​找到​火翼​被​关押​的​地点​。​如果​我们​不能​阻止​奥​德兰​释放​她​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​就​都​死定了​。\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。de2 qu4 zhao3dao4 Huo3yi4 bei4 guan1ya1 de5 di4dian3。ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 Ao4de2lan2 shi4fang4 ta1 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 jiu4 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No choice. We have to find where Feuerschwinge is being kept. If we don’t "
"stop that scarred bastard from releasing her, everyone in the Kreuzbasar is "
"dead."
msgstr ""
"我们​别无选择​。​得​去​找到​火翼​被​关押​的​地点​。​如果​我们​不能​阻止​那​混蛋​释放​她​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​就​都​死定了​。\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。de2 qu4 zhao3dao4 Huo3yi4 bei4 guan1ya1 de5 di4dian3。ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 na4 hun2dan4 shi4fang4 ta1 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 jiu4 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No contaminants detected.\n"
"\n"
"Disengaging Lockdown."
msgstr ""
"检测​到​无​污染物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正在​解除​封锁​。\n"
"\n"
"jian3ce4 dao4 wu2 wu1ran3wu4。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4zai4 jie3chu2 feng1suo3。"

msgid "No contest. I’m in."
msgstr ""
"没得​比​。​我​加入​。\n"
"mei2 de2 bi3。wo3 jia1ru4。"

msgid "No cryptic messages this time? No prophecies?"
msgstr ""
"这次​没什么​加密​信息​？​也​没什么​预言​？\n"
"zhe4 ci4 mei2shen2me5 jia1mi4 xin4xi1？ye3 mei2shen2me5 yu4yan2？"

msgid "No deal, doc. I don't like you, and I don't trust you."
msgstr ""
"免​了​，​医生​。​我​不​喜欢​你​，​也​不​信任​你​。\n"
"mian3 le5，yi1sheng1。wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3，ye3 bu4 xin4ren4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"No deals. We came here to destroy you, and Harrow with you. We've come too "
"far to stop now."
msgstr ""
"没​得​商量​。​我们​来​这里​是​为了​消灭​你​，​还有​哈罗​。​我们​已经​坚持​到​现在​，​绝不能​就此​收手​。\n"
"mei2 de2 shang1liang5。wo3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 wei4le5 xiao1mie4 ni3，hai2you3 ha1luo2。wo3men5 yi3jing1 jian1chi2 dao4 xian4zai4，jue2 bu4 neng2 jiu4ci3 shou1shou3。"

msgid ""
"No dice, ace. I'm afraid that I can't tell you anything about that.\n"
"\n"
"My programming specifically prohibits it."
msgstr ""
"不行​，​王牌​。​恐怕​我​无法​告诉​你​任何​有关​它​的​信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​程序​明确​禁止​了​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2，wang2pai2。kong3pa4 wo3 wu2fa3 gao4su4 ni3 ren4he2 you3guan1 ta1 de5 xin4xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 cheng2xu4 ming2que4 jin4zhi3 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "No dice. I'll come back with the 175."
msgstr ""
"算了​，​等​我​攒够​175​新円​再​回来​找​你​。\n"
"suan4le5，deng3 wo3 cuan2 gou4 175 xin1 yuan2 zai4 hui2lai5 zhao3 ni3。"

msgid "No dice. I'll come back with the 350 nuyen."
msgstr ""
"算了​，​等​我​攒够​350​新円​再​回来​找​你​。\n"
"suan4le5，deng3 wo3 cuan2 gou4 350 xin1 yuan2 zai4 hui2lai5 zhao3 ni3。"

msgid "No dice. I'll come back with the ¥500."
msgstr ""
"算了​，​等​我​攒够​500​新円​再​回来​找​你​。\n"
"suan4le5，deng3 wo3 cuan2 gou4 500 xin1 yuan2 zai4 hui2lai5 zhao3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"No dice. I'm not a charity, and I don't work unless I'm paid. Frankly, it's "
"unprofessional for you to even ask."
msgstr ""
"想都别想​。​我​不是​做​慈善​的​，​没​钱​休想​让​我​干活​。​老实​说​，​你​这话​能​问​出口​就​已经​很​不​专业​了​。\n"
"xiang3 dou1 bie4 xiang3。wo3 bu4shi4 zuo4 ci2shan4 de5，mei2 qian2 xiu1xiang3 rang4 wo3 gan4huo2。lao3shi5 shuo1，ni3 zhe4 hua4 neng2 wen4 chu1kou3 jiu4 yi3jing1 hen3 bu4 zhuan1ye4 le5。"

msgid "No dice. My mind is made up on this."
msgstr ""
"没​得​商量​，​我​已经​拿定主意​了​。\n"
"mei2 de2 shang1liang5，wo3 yi3jing1 na2 ding4 zhu3 yi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No harm done. If you'll excuse me, I'm going to go stand in the corner for a"
" while."
msgstr ""
"没​造成​什么​伤害​。​恕​我​失陪​，​我要​去​角落里​站​一会儿​了​。\n"
"mei2 zao4cheng2 shen2me5 shang1hai4。shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 yao4 qu4 jiao3 la4 li3 zhan4 yi1hui4r5 le5。"

msgid ""
"No idea, boss. But if you want my advice, I say that you should delete that information right away.\n"
"\n"
"You saw what those blood mages were capable of. Whatever they were workin' on... whatever Project Bloodline was... you should let it stay buried."
msgstr ""
"没什么​想法​，​老大​。​但​如果​你​想​听​我​的​建议​，​那​我​觉得​你​应该​立即​删除​这些​信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看到​那些​血​法师​的​能耐​了​。​不管​他们​在​搞​什么​……​不管​“​血脉​”​项目​是​什么​……​都​该​让​它​永远​埋葬​在​地下​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5 xiang3fa3，lao3da4。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 ting1 wo3 de5 jian4yi4，na4 wo3 jue2de5 ni3 ying1gai1 li4ji2 shan1chu2 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 na4xie1 xie3 fa3shi1 de5 neng2nai4 le5。bu4guan3 ta1men5 zai4 gao3 shen2me5……bu4guan3“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 shi4 shen2me5……dou1 gai1 rang4 ta1 yong3yuan3 mai2zang4 zai4 di4xia4。"

msgid ""
"No idea, chief. I grabbed it on a lark when me an' Emilie were goofin' around in the Matrix.\n"
"\n"
"The file was encrypted all to hell, and I never could get it open."
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​，​头儿​。​那​是​我​和​艾米莉​在​矩阵​里面​四处​鬼混​的​时候​随手​搞​到​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​文件​设​了​重重​加密​，​我​一直​没有​打开​过​它​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，tou2r5。na4 shi4 wo3 he4 ai4 mi3 li4 zai4 ju3zhen4 li3mian4 si4chu4 gui3hun4 de5 shi2hou5 sui2shou3 gao3 dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wen2jian4 she4 le5 chong2chong2 jia1mi4，wo3 yi1zhi2 mei2you3 da3kai1 guo4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"No idea. Looks like a new file... it was just uploaded about twenty minutes ago.\n"
"\n"
"Hang on a second, there's an attachment. I'll send it to you."
msgstr ""
"不​清楚​。​看起来​有份​新​文件​……​大概​20​分钟​前​刚刚​上传​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​下​，​有​份​附件​。​我​发给你​看看​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 qing1chu5。kan4qi3lai5 you3fen4 xin1 wen2jian4……da4gai4 20 fen1zhong1 qian2 gang1gang5 shang4chuan2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 xia4，you3 fen4 fu4jian4。wo3 fa1 gei3 ni3 kan4kan5。"

msgid "No joke."
msgstr ""
"必须​的​。\n"
"bi4xu1 de5。"

msgid ""
"No kidding. Insane dragons are even harder to understand, but I was able to "
"get through to her. For a moment, at least."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​，​而且​发疯​的​巨龙​更​难懂​。​但​起码​我​和​火翼​搭​上​话​了​，​就​聊​了​一小​会儿​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3，er2qie3 fa1feng1 de5 ju4long2 geng1 nan2dong3。dan4 qi3ma3 wo3 he4 Huo3yi4 da1 shang4 hua4 le5，jiu4 liao2 le5 yi1 xiao3 hui4r5。"

msgid ""
"No matter! I will suffer through it, for the good of my realm!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His hands clench into fists, and his face goes beet red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As for you, foul vagrant... how *dare* you enter my domain?!"
msgstr ""
"没关系​！​为了​我​的​王国​，​我会​忍受​这​一切​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​双手​攥​成​拳头​，​脸涨​得​通红​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​你​这​卑鄙​的​流浪汉​……​你​竟然​*​敢​*​闯入​我​的​领地​？​！\n"
"\n"
"mei2guan1xi5！wei4le5 wo3 de5 wang2guo2，wo3 hui4 ren3shou4 zhe4 yi1qie4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 zuan4 cheng2 quan2tou5，lian3 zhang3 de2 tong1hong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 ni3 zhe4 bei1bi3 de5 liu2lang4han4……ni3 jing4ran2*gan3*chuang3ru4 wo3 de5 ling3di4？！"

msgid ""
"No matter. The letter of your contract has been fulfilled. Your job here is done.\n"
"\n"
"I will inform Herr Fuchs of the mission's completion, and of the circumstances surrounding it."
msgstr ""
"无所谓​了​。​你​已经​履行​了​你​的​契约​部分​。​你​的​任务​结束​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​向​富克斯​先生​报告​称​任务​完成​，​并​说明​相关​情况​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2suo3wei4 le5。ni3 yi3jing1 lu:3xing2 le5 ni3 de5 qi4yue1 bu4fen5。ni3 de5 ren4wu5 jie2shu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 xiang4 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 bao4gao4 chen4 ren4wu5 wan2cheng2，bing4 shuo1ming2 xiang1guan1 qing2kuang4。"

msgid "No medevac for this run. Got it."
msgstr ""
"这趟​差事​没法​撤离​伤员​。​知道​了​。\n"
"zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 mei2fa3 che4li2 shang1yuan2。zhi1dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No money. But there *are* a few less racists in the world. All in all, I "
"think that we can call this one a win."
msgstr ""
"钱​没拿到​，​但​这​世上​*​倒​是​*​少​了​几个​种族主义者​。​总的来说​，​我​认为​我们​这趟​没​白跑​。\n"
"qian2 mei2 na2 dao4，dan4 zhe4 shi4shang4*dao3 shi4*shao3 le5 ji3ge5 zhong3zu2zhu3yi4zhe3。zong3de5lai2shuo1，wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 zhe4 tang1 mei2 bai2 pao2。"

msgid "No more posts in this thread."
msgstr ""
"该​主题​下​没有​更​多​留言​。\n"
"gai1 zhu3ti2 xia4 mei2you3 geng1 duo1 liu2yan2。"

msgid "No more questions, APEX."
msgstr ""
"我​没什么​想​问​的​了​，​APEX​。\n"
"wo3 mei2shen2me5 xiang3 wen4 de5 le5，APEX。"

msgid "No more questions. Let's get on to the bad news."
msgstr ""
"我​没​别的​问题​了​。​继续​说​坏消息​吧​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 bie2de5 wen4ti2 le5。ji4xu4 shuo1 huai4 xiao1 xi1 ba1。"

msgid "No more questions. Thank you, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"我​没​别的​要​问​了​。​谢​了​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 bie2de5 yao4 wen4 le5。xie4 le5，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid ""
"No more than any other employee. But my committment and work ethic were recognized, and I ascended the corporate ladder fairly quickly.\n"
"\n"
"Which brings me to where I am today."
msgstr ""
"和​其他​员工​并​没有​分别​。​但​我​的​奉献精神​和​职业​操守​得到​了​认可​，​因此​我​得以​在​公司​内部​迅速​晋升​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​也​造就​了​我​今天​的​成就​。\n"
"\n"
"he4 qi2ta1 yuan2gong1 bing4 mei2you3 fen1bie2。dan4 wo3 de5 feng4xian4jing1shen2 he4 zhi2ye4 cao1shou3 de2dao4 le5 ren4ke3，yin1ci3 wo3 de2yi3 zai4 gong1si1 nei4bu4 xun4su4 jin4sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ye3 zao4jiu4 le5 wo3 jin1tian1 de5 cheng2jiu4。"

msgid "No need for Herr Zapp. I'm just here to party."
msgstr ""
"霹雳​老大哥​就免​了​。​我​只是​来​玩​的​。\n"
"pi1li4 lao3da4ge1 jiu4 mian3 le5。wo3 zhi3shi4 lai2 wan2 de5。"

msgid "No need for her to wander around. I'll meet her at the U-Bahn station."
msgstr ""
"不用​让​她​到处跑​了​。​我​就​在​地铁站​见​她​。\n"
"bu4yong4 rang4 ta1 dao4 chu3 pao2 le5。wo3 jiu4 zai4 di4tie3zhan4 jian4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"No need to bother security, we're on the job. You two enjoy your shopping."
msgstr ""
"不用​劳烦​安保​人员​过来​，​有​我们​在​呢​。​你们​俩​好好​购物​吧​。\n"
"bu4yong4 lao2fan2 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 guo4lai2，you3 wo3men5 zai4 ni2。ni3men5 lia3 hao3hao3 gou4wu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No need to panic, it isn't dangerous or urgent. Say, what are you looking "
"at, there?"
msgstr ""
"不必​惊慌​，​这​不是​什么​紧急​的​危险​事件​。​话​说​你们​在​看​什么​呢​？\n"
"bu4bi4 jing1huang1，zhe4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 jin3ji2 de5 wei1xian3 shi4jian4。hua4 shuo1 ni3men5 zai4 kan4 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid "No need. Let's just get this over with. "
msgstr ""
"没​这个​必要​。​还是​赶紧​说​你​的​要求​吧​。\n"
"mei2 zhe4ge5 bi4yao4。hai2shi5 gan3jin3 shuo1 ni3 de5 yao1qiu2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No negotiation, no warning. They just turned on us out of the blue. Brought a couple dozen spirits down on our heads.\n"
"\n"
"I didn't even know that we were under attack until the water in my bathtub snaked up and tried to drown me."
msgstr ""
"没有​谈判​，​没有​警告​。​他们​突然​对​我们​下手​，​召唤​了​几十个​精魂​袭击​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​都​不​知道​自己​正在​被​攻击​，​直到​我​浴缸​里​的​水​突然​蜿蜒​爬升​，​试图​淹死​我​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 tan2pan4，mei2you3 jing3gao4。ta1men5 tu1ran2 dui4 wo3men5 xia4shou3，zhao4huan4 le5 ji1 shi2 ge4 jing1hun2 xi2ji1 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zheng4zai4 bei4 gong1ji1，zhi2dao4 wo3 yu4gang1 li3 de5 shui3 tu1ran2 wan1yan2 pa2sheng1，shi4tu2 yan1si3 wo3。"

msgid "No no no! Please don't eat me! I'll do whatever you want!"
msgstr ""
"不​不​不​！​别​吃​我​！​我​什么​都​听​你​的​！\n"
"bu4 bu4 bu4！bie4 chi1 wo3！wo3 shen2me5 dou1 ting1 ni3 de5！"

msgid ""
"No offense, Dietrich, but I've gotta run. We can talk later if you want."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​，​不好意思​，​我​这​还​有点​事​。​我们​晚点​聊​吧​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1，bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3 zhe4 hai2 you3dian3 shi4。wo3men5 wan3dian3 liao2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No one asked you, rookie.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, Monika. Put someone in charge, and let's get on with the mission."
msgstr ""
"没人​问​你​，​菜鸟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​快点​，​莫妮卡​。​你​选​个人​来​管事​，​然后​我们​继续​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 wen4 ni3，cai4niao3。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4dian3，Mo4ni1ka3。ni3 xuan3 ge4ren2 lai2 guan3 shi4，ran2hou4 wo3men5 ji4xu4 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"No one else needs to hear about that part.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Too bad about the “no treasure” thing, though. Just sayin'."
msgstr ""
"其他人​不​需要​知道​这些​细节​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​只​可惜​“​没有​宝藏​”​啊​。​我​就​开个​玩笑​。\n"
"\n"
"qi2 ta1 ren2 bu4 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 xi4jie2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1“mei2you3 bao3zang4” a1。wo3 jiu4 kai1 ge4 wan2xiao4。"

msgid ""
"No one is ever really safe... not when gangs are involved. Don't let your "
"guard down."
msgstr ""
"只要​黑帮​还有​所​牵连​……​就​没有​谁​是​真正​安全​的​。​别​放松​警惕​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 hei1bang1 hai2you3 suo3 qian1lian2……jiu4 mei2you3 shei2 shi4 zhen1zheng4 an1quan2 de5。bie4 fang4song1 jing3ti4。"

msgid ""
"No one knows. Feuerschwinge was never engaged in… dialogue. \n"
"\n"
"German military forces are said to have killed her over the SOX the year she emerged - this, after months of fire, devastation, and terror. \n"
"\n"
"Her body was never recovered."
msgstr ""
"没有​人​知道​。​火翼​从未​进行​过​……​任何​对话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​据说​在​她​现身​的​同年​，​德国​军队​将​其毙​杀于​萨洛​卢区​上空​。​尽管​此前​数月​间​，​她​已经​带来​了​无数​烈焰​、​毁灭​与​恐怖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​尸体​一直​未​被​找到​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ren2 zhi1dao4。Huo3yi4 cong2wei4 jin4xing2 guo4……ren4he2 dui4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"ju4shuo1 zai4 ta1 xian4shen1 de5 tong2nian2，de2guo2 jun1dui4 jiang1 qi2 bi4 sha1 yu2 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 shang4kong1。jin3guan3 ci3qian2 shu4yue4 jian1，ta1 yi3jing1 dai4lai2 le5 wu2shu4 lie4yan4、hui3mie4 yu4 kong3bu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shi1ti3 yi1zhi2 wei4 bei4 zhao3dao4。"

msgid ""
"No one likes a third wheel, $(l.name). Even if it is a $(l.man) like you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He bows to you with a flourish.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye, $(l.name). We will meet again, I think... though not for a long, long time."
msgstr ""
"没​人​喜欢​电灯泡​，​$(l.name)​。​哪怕​是​像​你​这样​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​夸张​地向​你​鞠​了​一躬​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​了​，​$(l.name)​。​我​想​我们​会​再见​的​……​不过​是​在​很久很久​之后​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 xi3huan5 dian4deng1pao4，$(l.name)。na3pa4 shi4 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kua1zhang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 ju1 le5 yi1 gong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 le5，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 hui4 zai4jian4 de5……bu4guo4 shi4 zai4 hen3 jiu3 hen3 jiu3 zhi1hou4。"

msgid "No password, no entrance. Now scram."
msgstr ""
"没有​口令​就别​想​进来​。​滚开​。\n"
"mei2you3 kou3ling4 jiu4 bie4 xiang3 jin4lai2。gun3kai1。"

msgid "No place, really. Just an old relic, rusting away."
msgstr ""
"没什么​地位​。​只是​个​被​时代​淘汰​的​老家伙​而已​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 di4wei4。zhi3shi4 ge4 bei4 shi2dai4 tao2tai4 de5 lao3jia1huo5 er2yi3。"

msgid "No problem here."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。"

msgid "No problem, Blitz. We'll chat about it after the run."
msgstr ""
"不​客气​，​布里​茨​。​等​差事​结束​之后​我们​再聊​。\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5，Bu4li3ci2。deng3 cha4shi4 jie2shu4 zhi1hou4 wo3men5 zai4 liao2。"

msgid "No problem, Phil. I do have a few more questions for you, though."
msgstr ""
"别​客气​，​菲尔​。​不过​，​我​还有​一些​问题​想​问​你​。\n"
"bie4 ke4qi5，fei1 er3。bu4guo4，wo3 hai2you3 yi1xie1 wen4ti2 xiang3 wen4 ni3。"

msgid "No problem, buddy. Your secret is safe with me."
msgstr ""
"放心​吧​伙计​。​我会​替​你​保守​秘密​的​。\n"
"fang4xin1 ba1 huo3ji5。wo3 hui4 ti4 ni3 bao3shou3 mi4mi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"No problem, but we aren't done yet. We still have Winternight to deal with."
msgstr ""
"不​客气​，​但​这事​还​没完​。​我们​还要​对付​“​冬夜​”​呢​。\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5，dan4 zhe4 shi4 hai2 mei2 wan2。wo3men5 hai2 yao4 dui4fu5“dong1 ye4” ni2。"

msgid ""
"No problem, chief! Not a problem at all. You can count on me!\n"
"\n"
"Now, if you'll excuse me, I've got some last-minute stuff to take care of before we get started. Oh, and $(l.name)... thanks."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​头儿​！​你​放心​吧​。​我​说话​靠​谱​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​恕​我​失陪​一下​，​在​我们​出发​之前​，​我​还​有些​最后​的​准备​工作​要​处理​。​还有​，​$(l.name)​……​谢​了​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，tou2r5！ni3 fang4xin1 ba1。wo3 shuo1hua4 kao4 pu3！\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2 yi1xia4，zai4 wo3men5 chu1fa1 zhi1qian2，wo3 hai2 you3xie1 zui4hou4 de5 zhun3bei4 gong1zuo4 yao4 chu3li3。hai2you3，$(l.name)……xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No problem, honey! I got the best deals on pots and pans this side of "
"Spandau!"
msgstr ""
"别​客气​，​宝贝儿​！​我​这里​有施​潘道​这边​各种​最棒​的​东西​！\n"
"bie4 ke4qi5，bao3bei4r5！wo3 zhe4li3 you3 shi1 pan1 dao4 zhe4bian1 ge4zhong3 zui4 bang4 de5 dong1xi1！"

msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""
"客气​了​。\n"
"ke4qi5 le5。"

msgid ""
"No problem. If I were you, I'd begin by trying to find an alternative path into the building... something out of sight. \n"
"\n"
"Once the facility calls for help, you're going to be on a tight timetable."
msgstr ""
"不​客气​。​如果​是​我​的话​，​就​先​另寻​他路​进入​大楼​……​不​引人注目​的​那种​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一旦​设施​人员​请求​增援​的话​，​你们​的​时间​就​很​紧迫​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。ru2guo3 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 xian1 ling4 xun2 ta1 lu4 jin4ru4 da4lou2……bu4 yin3ren2zhu4mu4 de5 na4zhong3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dan4 she4shi1 ren2yuan2 qing3qiu2 zeng1yuan2 de5hua4，ni3men5 de5 shi2jian1 jiu4 hen3 jin3po4 le5。"

msgid "No problem. Is there anything else?"
msgstr ""
"不​客气​。​还有​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "No problem. Let me know if you have any other health concerns."
msgstr ""
"小事​。​如果​你​还有​别的​健康​问题​，​随时​来​找​我​。\n"
"xiao3shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 jian4kang1 wen4ti2，sui2shi2 lai2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"No problem. Now, you said that our teammates are already inside... are you "
"sure about that?"
msgstr ""
"别​客气​。​所以​，​你​说​其他​队友​已经​进去​了​……​你​确定​吗​？\n"
"bie4 ke4qi5。suo3yi3，ni3 shuo1 qi2ta1 dui4you3 yi3jing1 jin4qu4 le5……ni3 que4ding4 ma5？"

msgid "No promises, dragon."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​做​任何​保证​，​巨龙​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 zuo4 ren4he2 bao3zheng4，ju4long2。"

msgid "No questions, I'm just passing by."
msgstr ""
"没事​，​我​只是​路过​而已​。\n"
"mei2shi4，wo3 zhi3shi4 lu4guo4 er2yi3。"

msgid "No reason, really."
msgstr ""
"没什么​原因​，​真的​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 yuan2yin1，zhen1de5。"

msgid ""
"No resident of the Kreuzbasar would have done such a thing when Monika was "
"in charge. To think those impulses ever existed and now are free to be "
"expressed... (w)"
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​掌权​的​时候​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​绝不会​有人​做出​这种​事情​。​一​想到​那些​暴力​冲动​曾经​存在​，​如今​却​得以​自由​表达出来​……\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 zhang3quan2 de5 shi2hou5，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jue2 bu4 hui4 you3ren2 zuo4chu1 zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5。yi1 xiang3dao4 na4xie1 bao4li4 chong1dong4 ceng2jing1 cun2zai4，ru2jin1 que4 de2yi3 zi4you2 biao3 da2 chu1 lai2……"

msgid ""
"No shit. \n"
"\n"
"Whatever she's planning, it's clear that Feuerschwinge will allow no disruptions from us. Or from anyone."
msgstr ""
"可不是​嘛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​火翼​在​计划​什么​，​她​显然​不会​容忍​我们​或者​其他​任何人​的​干扰​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 Huo3yi4 zai4 ji4hua4 shen2me5，ta1 xian3ran2 bu4hui4 rong2ren3 wo3men5 huo4zhe3 qi2ta1 ren4 he2 ren2 de5 gan1rao3。"

msgid ""
"No sign of him? Christ. I guess maybe I don't want to know what happened in there.\n"
"\n"
"Here's the money I promised you."
msgstr ""
"没有​他​的​踪迹​嘛​？​老天​。​也许​我​还是​不要​知道​下面​发生​了​什么​为​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​说好​的​报酬​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ta1 de5 zong1ji4 ma5？lao3tian1。ye3xu3 wo3 hai2shi5 bu4yao4 zhi1dao4 xia4mian4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 wei2 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 shuo1hao3 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid ""
"No skin off my back. Now let's get down to business - I have money, and I "
"need magic."
msgstr ""
"我​无所谓​。​现在​我们​来聊​正事​吧​。​我​手上​有钱​，​要​买​魔法​。\n"
"wo3 wu2suo3wei4。xian4zai4 wo3men5 lai2 liao2 zheng4shi4 ba1。wo3 shou3 shang4 you3qian2，yao4 mai3 mo2fa3。"

msgid "No thanks, I'll hold on to it."
msgstr ""
"算了​，​我​还是​留着​它​吧​。\n"
"suan4le5，wo3 hai2shi5 liu2 zhao2 ta1 ba1。"

msgid "No thanks, buddy. I'll just be on my way."
msgstr ""
"不了​，​朋友​。​我​还要​赶路​。\n"
"bu4le5，peng2you5。wo3 hai2 yao4 gan3lu4。"

msgid ""
"No thanks, chief... I appreciate it, though. This is something that I need to do alone.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, I'm the best, remember?"
msgstr ""
"不了​，​头儿​……​你​的​好意​我心​领了​，​但​总​有些​事是​要​靠​自己​去​做​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再说​，​我​可是​最​厉害​的​，​记得​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4le5，tou2r5……ni3 de5 hao3yi4 wo3 xin1 ling3 le5，dan4 zong3 you3xie1 shi4 shi4 yao4 kao4 zi4ji3 qu4 zuo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1，wo3 ke3shi4 zui4 li4hai5 de5，ji4de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"No thanks, just looking for information. Ever heard of a gang called the "
"Rabengeister?"
msgstr ""
"不了​，​我​只是​来​调查​情报​的​。​你​听说​过​有​个​叫​“​鸦灵​”​的​帮派​吗​？\n"
"bu4le5，wo3 zhi3shi4 lai2 diao4cha2 qing2bao4 de5。ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 you3 ge4 jiao4“Ya1ling2” de5 bang1pai4 ma5？"

msgid "No thanks."
msgstr ""
"不了​，​谢谢​。\n"
"bu4le5，xie4xie5。"

msgid "No thanks. Maybe next time."
msgstr ""
"不了​，​也许​下次​吧​。\n"
"bu4le5，ye3xu3 xia4ci4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No time for talk, fearless leader. The Harfeld estate is unprotected.\n"
"\n"
"We need to press our advantage while we still have it."
msgstr ""
"没​时间​聊天​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​哈​菲尔德​庄园​眼下​毫无​防备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​必须​把握住​当前​的​优势​，​趁胜​追击​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 shi2jian1 liao2tian1 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 yan3xia4 hao2wu2 fang2bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 ba3 wo4 zhu4 dang1qian2 de5 you1shi4，chen4 sheng4 zhui1ji1。"

msgid "No time for talk. Look sharp."
msgstr ""
"没​时间​闲聊​了​。​保持警惕​。\n"
"mei2 shi2jian1 xian2liao2 le5。bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4。"

msgid ""
"No time for that, Doc. We're waking up the dragon's physical form *right now.*\n"
"\n"
"Everything is ready for the procedure to begin. You should see to it."
msgstr ""
"没​时间​了​，​博士​。​我们​必须​*​现在​*​就​唤醒​巨龙​的​肉体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切​程序​已经​准备就绪​。​你​应该​确保​完成​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 shi2jian1 le5，bo2shi4。wo3men5 bi4xu1*xian4zai4*jiu4 huan4xing3 ju4long2 de5 rou4ti3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1qie4 cheng2xu4 yi3jing1 zhun3 bei4 jiu4 xu4。ni3 ying1gai1 que4bao3 wan2cheng2。"

msgid "No time for that. Look sharp."
msgstr ""
"没​时间​闲聊​了​。​保持警惕​。\n"
"mei2 shi2jian1 xian2liao2 le5。bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4。"

msgid "No time for twenty questions. You want out of here, or not?"
msgstr ""
"没​时间​回答​一堆​问题​。​你​到底​想​不想​离开​这儿​？\n"
"mei2 shi2jian1 hui2da2 yi1dui1 wen4ti2。ni3 dao4di3 xiang3 bu4xiang3 li2kai1 zhe4r5？"

msgid ""
"No time to explain. We'll be exiting via an old servants' entrance to the "
"west of the main grounds. I need you to keep that exit clear."
msgstr ""
"没​时间​细说​了​。​我们​会​从​一个​旧​的​仆役​边门​出去​，​撤退​到​主​花园​的​西面​。​我​需要​你​确保​出口​是​通着​的​。\n"
"mei2 shi2jian1 xi4shuo1 le5。wo3men5 hui4 cong2 yi1ge5 jiu4 de5 pu2yi4 bian1men2 chu1qu4，che4tui4 dao4 zhu3 hua1yuan2 de5 xi1mian4。wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 que4bao3 chu1kou3 shi4 tong1 zhao2 de5。"

msgid ""
"No way, Blitz. You got yourself into this; it isn't my job to get you back "
"out of it."
msgstr ""
"想都别想​，​布里​茨​。​是​你​自己​惹出来​的​事​，​我​没有​义务​帮​你​擦屁股​。\n"
"xiang3 dou1 bie4 xiang3，Bu4li3ci2。shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 re3 chu1 lai2 de5 shi4，wo3 mei2you3 yi4wu4 bang1 ni3 ca1pi4gu5。"

msgid "No way. Find another pawn to help you. I'm out."
msgstr ""
"不​可能​。​你​去​找​别的​棋子​吧​。​我​不​干​了​。\n"
"bu4 ke3neng2。ni3 qu4 zhao3 bie2de5 qi2zi3 ba1。wo3 bu4 gan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No way. I'm no dragon's pawn... when you see your boss, you tell him that."
msgstr ""
"不​可能​，​我​不会​当​巨龙​手中​的​棋子​……​把​这话​原封不动​地​告诉​你家​主子​。\n"
"bu4 ke3neng2，wo3 bu4hui4 dang1 ju4long2 shou3 zhong4 de5 qi2zi3……ba3 zhe4 hua4 yuan2feng1bu4dong4 de5 gao4su4 ni3 jia1 zhu3zi5。"

msgid "No way. You killed Monika, and for that, you're going to die."
msgstr ""
"绝对​不​可能​。​你​杀​了​莫妮卡​，​为此​，​你​必须​死​。\n"
"jue2dui4 bu4 ke3neng2。ni3 sha1 le5 Mo4ni1ka3，wei4ci3，ni3 bi4xu1 si3。"

msgid "No weapon. No problem. Damage is equal to your Strength."
msgstr ""
"没有​武器​？​没​问题​。​伤害​就​等于​你​的​力量​。\n"
"mei2you3 wu3qi4？mei2 wen4ti2。shang1hai4 jiu4 deng3yu2 ni3 de5 li4liang5。"

msgid ""
"No welcoming party.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Maxim shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This isn't a good sign."
msgstr ""
"没​人​出来​欢迎​一下​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​马克西姆​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不是​什么​好​兆头​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 chu1lai2 huan1ying2 yi1xia4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 hao3 zhao4tou5。"

msgid "No worries, just wanted to extend the offer."
msgstr ""
"没事​，​我​只是​想​表达​我​的​诚意​。\n"
"mei2shi4，wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 biao3da2 wo3 de5 cheng2yi4。"

msgid "No worries, ma'am. I was just out for a walk."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​女士​。​我​就是​出来​散散步​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，nu:3shi4。wo3 jiu4shi4 chu1lai2 san3 san3 bu4。"

msgid ""
"No worries. There aren't any spirits out here, so it's safe to open the "
"door."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​这里​外面​没有​精魂​，​开门​很​安全​。\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，zhe4li3 wai4mian4 mei2you3 jing1hun2，kai1men2 hen3 an1quan2。"

msgid "No! Alex! Don't do this!"
msgstr ""
"不要​！​亚历克斯​！​快​住手​！\n"
"bu4yao4！ya4 li4 ke4 si1！kuai4 zhu4shou3！"

msgid "No! PLEASE!"
msgstr ""
"不​！​求​你​了​！\n"
"bu4！qiu2 ni3 le5！"

msgid ""
"No! They wouldn't do that! They were gentle and kind!\n"
"\n"
"You're an outsider. You don't understand the bond of trust and respect that we shared!"
msgstr ""
"不​！​他们​绝不会​这样​！​他们​温柔​而​善良​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​外人​。​你​不​了解​我们​之间​的​信任​与​尊重​之情​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4！ta1men5 jue2 bu4 hui4 zhe4yang4！ta1men5 wen1rou2 er2 shan4liang2！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 wai4ren2。ni3 bu4 liao3jie3 wo3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 xin4ren4 yu4 zun1zhong4 zhi1 qing2！"

msgid ""
"No! Wait! I still really need your help!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}As you turn to leave, she slumps back against the bar. Her voice is pathetic and small.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come back!\n"
"\n"
"...Please?"
msgstr ""
"别​！​等​一下​啊​！​我​真的​很​需要​你​帮忙​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​眼见​你​转身​离开​，​她​颓然​地​靠着​柜台​跌​坐下​来​，​低声​而​卑微​地​呼喊​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​快​回来​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​求​你​了​……\n"
"\n"
"bie4！deng3 yi1xia4 a1！wo3 zhen1de5 hen3 xu1yao4 ni3 bang1mang2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yan3jian4 ni3 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1，ta1 tui2ran2 de5 kao4 zhao2 gui4tai2 die1 zuo4xia5 lai2，di1sheng1 er2 bei1wei1 de5 hu1han3 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kuai4 hui2lai5！\n"
"\n"
"qiu2 ni3 le5……"

msgid ""
"No! You... you can't do this! We had a deal!\n"
"\n"
"Kill *them* instead, and you'll get everything I promised! Please!"
msgstr ""
"不​！​你​……​你​不能​这么​做​！​我们​商量​好​了​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​你​杀​了​*​他们​*​，​就​能​拿到​我​答应​的​一切​报酬​！​求求​你​了​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4！ni3……ni3 bu4neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4！wo3men5 shang1liang5 hao3 le5 de5！\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 sha1 le5*ta1men5*，jiu4 neng2 na2dao4 wo3 da1ying5 de5 yi1qie4 bao4chou5！qiu2 qiu2 ni3 le5！"

msgid "No, $(l.name). Nothing right now."
msgstr ""
"不​，​$(l.name)​。​现在​没什么​要​聊​的​。\n"
"bu4，$(l.name)。xian4zai4 mei2shen2me5 yao4 liao2 de5。"

msgid ""
"No, $(l.name). You can't.\n"
"\n"
"Even if, through some minor miracle, you managed to get past Aztechnology's internal security *and* Knight Errant's High Threat Response Team, your chances of survival would still be close to zero.\n"
"\n"
"Aztechnology is well-known for its practice of blood magic."
msgstr ""
"不行​，​$(l.name)​，​你​做​不到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​即便​真有​万中​无​一​的​奇迹​发生​，​让​你​侥幸​突破​阿兹特​科技​的​内部​安保​*​以及​*​游侠​骑士​的​高危​应急​小组​，​你​的​生存​几率​仍然​接​近于零​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿兹特​科技​同样​因为​研习​血​魔法​而​臭名昭著​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2，$(l.name)，ni3 zuo4 bu4dao4。\n"
"\n"
"ji2bian4 zhen1 you3 wan4 zhong4 wu2 yi1 de5 qi2ji4 fa1sheng1，rang4 ni3 jiao3xing4 tu1po4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 nei4bu4 an1bao3*yi3ji2*you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3，ni3 de5 sheng1cun2 ji1lu:4 reng2ran2 jie1 jin4 yu2 ling2。\n"
"\n"
"E1zi1te4ke1ji4 tong2yang4 yin1wei4 yan2xi2 xie3 mo2fa3 er2 chou4ming2zhao1zhu4。"

msgid "No, APEX. I don't trust you, and I won't help you."
msgstr ""
"不​，​APEX​。​我​不​信任​你​，​也​不会​帮​你​。\n"
"bu4，APEX。wo3 bu4 xin4ren4 ni3，ye3 bu4hui4 bang1 ni3。"

msgid ""
"No, Alex. What these pigs are teaching you... it ain't strength.\n"
"\n"
"Come with me, and I'll take you under my wing. Show you what *real* strength is."
msgstr ""
"不​，​亚历山大​。​这些​猪猡​教给​你​的​东西​……​根本​不​叫​力量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​跟我走​吧​，​我会​照顾​好​你​，​让​你​见识​什么​才​是​*​真正​的​*​力量​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，ya4li4shan1da4。zhe4xie1 zhu1luo2 jiao1 gei3 ni3 de5 dong1xi1……gen1ben3 bu4 jiao4 li4liang5。\n"
"\n"
"gen1 wo3 zou3 ba1，wo3 hui4 zhao4gu5 hao3 ni3，rang4 ni3 jian4shi5 shen2me5 cai2 shi4*zhen1zheng4 de5*li4liang5。"

msgid "No, Blitz. Not bad at all."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​布里​茨​。​相当​不错​。\n"
"shi4 a1，Bu4li3ci2。xiang1dang1 bu4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"No, Blitz. You're not.\n"
"\n"
"When we get out of here, I have a score to settle with Plotz and Grinder. And believe me, I will settle it."
msgstr ""
"不​，​布里​茨​。​和​你​无关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​出去​之后​，​我会​去​找​普​洛茨​和​“​绞肉机​”​算账​。​相信​我​，​我​不会​手下留情​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，Bu4li3ci2。he4 ni3 wu2guan1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 chu1qu4 zhi1hou4，wo3 hui4 qu4 zhao3 Pu3luo4ci2 he4“jiao3rou4ji1” suan4zhang4。xiang1xin4 wo3，wo3 bu4hui4 shou3xia4liu2qing2。"

msgid "No, Dante! *COME!*"
msgstr ""
"不​，​但丁​！​*​过来​*​！\n"
"bu4，dan4ding1！*guo4lai2*！"

msgid "No, Dietrich. Not bad at all."
msgstr ""
"相当​不错​，​迪​特里​希​。\n"
"xiang1dang1 bu4cuo4，Di2te4li3xi1。"

msgid ""
"No, Eiger. That's not my point at all. What $(l.name) just did was *epic.*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz turns to you, and he cracks a wide grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That was a badass play, chief. Ten points for style, no question about it."
msgstr ""
"不​，​艾格尔​。​我​完全​不是​这个​意思​。​$(l.name)​做​的​事情​简直​*​超帅​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​转向​你​，​露出​一个​大大的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这招​玩​得​太狠​了​，​头儿​。​我​必须​得​给​你​这​一手​打​满分​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，Ai4ge2er3。wo3 wan2quan2 bu4shi4 zhe4ge5 yi4si5。$(l.name) zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 jian3zhi2*chao1 shuai4*。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，lu4chu1 yi1ge5 dai4 dai4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 wan2 de2 tai4 hen3 le5，tou2r5。wo3 bi4xu1 de2 gei3 ni3 zhe4 yi1shou3 da3 man3fen1。"

msgid ""
"No, Feuerschwinge. A forever task requires patience. And faith. The next "
"world could be better."
msgstr ""
"不​，​火翼​。​永恒​的​使命​需要​耐心​。​以及​信念​。​下​一个​世界​会​更好​。\n"
"bu4，Huo3yi4。yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4 xu1yao4 nai4xin1。yi3ji2 xin4nian4。xia4 yi1ge5 shi4jie4 hui4 geng1 hao3。"

msgid ""
"No, Glory, I'm not here to tell you off. Truth be told, I wanted to check in"
" and see how you were doing."
msgstr ""
"不​，​格洛丽​，​我​不是​来​责备​你​的​。​说实话​，​我​只是​想​看看​你​最近​怎么样​。\n"
"bu4，Ge2luo4li2，wo3 bu4shi4 lai2 ze2bei4 ni3 de5。shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 kan4kan5 ni3 zui4jin4 zen3me5yang4。"

msgid ""
"No, Heimer. We take care of *ourselves.* Danni will be *fine.*\n"
"\n"
"You, get *off* of our turf. And don't come back!"
msgstr ""
"不​，​海默​。​我们​的​事情​*​我们​自己​*​解决​。​丹妮会​*​没事​*​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​，​从​我们​的​地盘​上​*​滚开​*​。​而且​再也​别​回来​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4，Hai3mo4。wo3men5 de5 shi4qing5*wo3men5 zi4ji3*jie3jue2。dan1 ni1 hui4*mei2shi4*de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3，cong2 wo3men5 de5 di4pan2 shang4*gun3kai1*。er2qie3 zai4ye3 bie4 hui2lai5！"

msgid "No, I brought this from home."
msgstr ""
"不​，​这​是​我​从​家里​带来​的​。\n"
"bu4，zhe4 shi4 wo3 cong2 jia1li3 dai4lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"No, I can't just take it from you. I know how much that stuff can cost.\n"
"\n"
"But here's what I can do... I'm gonna give you my room code. When you're making your rounds, doing your maintenance thing, you can stop in and grab my credstick off the table. There's a couple hundred nuyen on it."
msgstr ""
"不行​，​我​不能​就​这么​收下​，​我​知道​这​玩意儿​值​不少​钱​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​不​这样​吧​……​我会​把​房间​密码​给​你​。​等​你们​做​例行​检修​的​时候​，​顺便​从​桌上​拿走​我​的​信用​棒​。​里面​有​几百​新円​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2，wo3 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4me5 shou1xia4，wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 wan2yi4r5 zhi2 bu4shao3 qian2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 bu4 zhe4yang4 ba1……wo3 hui4 ba3 fang2jian1 mi4ma3 gei3 ni3。deng3 ni3men5 zuo4 li4xing2 jian3xiu1 de5 shi2hou5，shun4bian4 cong2 zhuo1 shang4 na2zou3 wo3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4。li3mian4 you3 ji1 bai3 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"No, I don't think...\n"
"\n"
"Oh, wait, yeah. I bumped into him here a few days ago.\n"
"\n"
"I remember because his name sounds like a kind of chewing gum."
msgstr ""
"没​，​我​觉得​没​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​，​等​一下​，​我​想​起来​了​。​我​前两天​在​这​碰见​过​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​记住​他​是因为​他​那​名字​听​着​像​口香糖​的​牌子​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2，wo3 jue2de5 mei2……\n"
"\n"
"e2，deng3 yi1xia4，wo3 xiang3 qi3lai5 le5。wo3 qian2 liang3 tian1 zai4 zhe4 peng4jian4 guo4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4zhu5 ta1 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 na4 ming2zi5 ting1 zhao2 xiang4 kou3xiang1tang2 de5 pai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"No, I don't. And I don't think that you know a damned thing about who Monika"
" really was."
msgstr ""
"我​不​觉得​。​而且​我​认为​你​对​莫妮卡​根本​一无所知​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 jue2de5。er2qie3 wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 gen1ben3 yi1wu2suo3zhi1。"

msgid ""
"No, I haven't stopped caring... but I just don't...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice trails off. A few seconds later, she shrugs her shoulders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know what to say. You're right, I probably shouldn't be feeling the way that I feel, but who cares? It feels *wonderful.*"
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​不是​不在乎​了​……​我​只是​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​越​说​越​小​。​几秒​后​，​她​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​不​知道​该​说​什么​，​也许​你​是​对​的​，​我​不该​这么​没心没肺​，​但​谁​在乎​呢​？​我​现在​很​*​畅快​*​呀​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 bu4shi4 bu4zai4hu5 le5……wo3 zhi3shi4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 yue4 shuo1 yue4 xiao3。ji1 miao3 hou4，ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 shuo1 shen2me5，ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5，wo3 bu4gai1 zhe4me5 mei2xin1mei2fei4，dan4 shei2 zai4hu5 ni2？wo3 xian4zai4 hen3*chang4kuai4*ya1。"

msgid ""
"No, I mean it in the same way that anybody would. We provide these runaways with food, shelter, and a sense of purpose.\n"
"\n"
"We set them *free.* If that isn't charitable, I don't know what is."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​的​看法​和​其他人​别无二致​。​我们​为​这些​离家出走​的​孩子​提供​食物​、​住所​和​人生目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​让​他们​获得​*​自由​*​。​如果​这​都​不算​慈善​，​那​我​真不知道​什么​才​算​慈善​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 de5 kan4fa3 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 bie2wu2er4zhi4。wo3men5 wei2 zhe4xie1 li2jia1chu1zou3 de5 hai2zi5 ti2gong1 shi2wu4、zhu4suo3 he4 ren2 sheng1 mu4 biao1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 rang4 ta1men5 huo4de2*zi4you2*。ru2guo3 zhe4 dou1 bu4suan4 ci2shan4，na4 wo3 zhen1 bu4 zhi1 dao4 shen2me5 cai2 suan4 ci2shan4 le5。"

msgid "No, I suppose not. Just the way I like it."
msgstr ""
"大概​不是​。​只是​打个招呼​而已​。\n"
"da4gai4 bu4shi4。zhi3shi4 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"No, I wasn't there, and that's *exactly* the problem.\n"
"\n"
"If I'd been in your place, Monika would still be alive and with us. Instead, I left her with you, and now my friend is a corpse in a basement."
msgstr ""
"对​，​我​是​不​在​，​问题​就​出​在​*​这​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​我​当时​在​的话​，​莫妮卡​现在​还​能​活蹦乱跳​地站​在​这​。​相反​，​我​把​她​交给​了​你​，​结果​现在​我​的​朋友​成​了​地下室​里​的​一具​尸体​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4，wo3 shi4 bu4 zai4，wen4ti2 jiu4 chu1 zai4*zhe4*。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3 dang1shi2 zai4 de5hua4，Mo4ni1ka3 xian4zai4 hai2 neng2 huo2beng4luan4tiao4 de5 zhan4 zai4 zhe4。xiang1fan3，wo3 ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 le5 ni3，jie1guo3 xian4zai4 wo3 de5 peng2you5 cheng2 le5 di4xia4shi4 li3 de5 yi1 ju4 shi1ti3。"

msgid ""
"No, I'd rather not. I've said too much already, and it isn't my place to deprive the man of business. \n"
"\n"
"In the end, it doesn't matter what I think of him... when it comes to our suppliers, we don't get to pick and choose. If you want your \"chrome,\" Ezkibel is your only choice."
msgstr ""
"还是​算了吧​。​我​已经​说得够​多​了​，​毕竟​砸​别人​的​饭碗​并​不​合适​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说到底​，​我​怎么​看​他​并​不​重要​……​在​供应商​的​问题​上​，​我们​没​得​挑三拣四​。​如果​你​想要​“​义体​”​，​埃兹​基​贝尔​是​你​唯一​的​选择​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 suan4 le5 ba1。wo3 yi3jing1 shuo1 de2 gou4 duo1 le5，bi4jing4 za2 bie2ren5 de5 fan4wan3 bing4 bu4 he2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1dao4di3，wo3 zen3me5 kan4 ta1 bing4 bu4 zhong4yao4……zai4 gong1ying4shang1 de5 wen4ti2 shang4，wo3men5 mei2 de2 tiao1san1jian3si4。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3yao4“yi4 ti3”，Ai1ziji1bei4er3 shi4 ni3 wei2yi1 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid "No, I'll let you get back to work. Thanks, Paul."
msgstr ""
"没事​了​，​你​去​忙​吧​。​谢​了​，​保罗​。\n"
"mei2shi4 le5，ni3 qu4 mang2 ba1。xie4 le5，bao3luo2。"

msgid ""
"No, I'm a shadowrunner here on a job. This uniform is just a clever "
"disguise."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​是​来​这​跑​差事​的​暗影​狂奔​者​。​这​身​制服​只是​个​幌子​。\n"
"bu4，wo3 shi4 lai2 zhe4 pao2 cha4shi4 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。zhe4 shen1 zhi4fu2 zhi3shi4 ge4 huang3zi5。"

msgid ""
"No, I'm afraid you cannot. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He lets out a sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That option closed when you spilled blood in this kiez. "
msgstr ""
"恐怕​不行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​这个​街区​动手​的​时候​，​就​已经​失去​这个​机会​了​。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 bu4xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 zhe4ge5 jie1qu1 dong4shou3 de5 shi2hou5，jiu4 yi3jing1 shi1qu4 zhe4ge5 ji1hui4 le5。"

msgid "No, I'm dead serious."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​非常​认真​。\n"
"bu4，wo3 fei1chang2 ren4zhen1。"

msgid "No, I'm good. Take it easy, Glory."
msgstr ""
"没事​了​。​放松​些​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"mei2shi4 le5。fang4song1 xie1，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "No, I'm just browsing. Are you two here to buy?"
msgstr ""
"没什么​，​我​就​随便​看看​。​你们​俩​在​这​买​东西​吗​？\n"
"mei2shen2me5，wo3 jiu4 sui2bian4 kan4kan5。ni3men5 lia3 zai4 zhe4 mai3 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"No, I'm not. But I'm close enough to move forward with what I did find."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​但​根据​已有​的​线索​，​我​想​也​足够​下​定论​了​。\n"
"en1，dan4 gen1ju4 yi3 you3 de5 xian4suo3，wo3 xiang3 ye3 zu2gou4 xia4 ding4lun4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No, I'm not. On the whole, I'm a pretty nice guy. But standing around here "
"waiting for you hasn't put me in the best of moods."
msgstr ""
"并非如此​。​总的来说​，​我​还是​很​好​说话​的​。​但​在​这里​一直​站​着​等​你​，​让​我​的​心情​不是​很​好​。\n"
"bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。zong3de5lai2shuo1，wo3 hai2shi5 hen3 hao3 shuo1hua4 de5。dan4 zai4 zhe4li3 yi1zhi2 zhan4 zhao2 deng3 ni3，rang4 wo3 de5 xin1qing2 bu4shi4 hen3 hao3。"

msgid "No, I'm sorry. I didn't mean to upset you."
msgstr ""
"是​我​该​说​抱歉​。​我​不是​有意​让​你​难过​的​。\n"
"shi4 wo3 gai1 shuo1 bao4qian4。wo3 bu4shi4 you3yi4 rang4 ni3 nan2guo4 de5。"

msgid "No, I'm still making the rounds. Just wanted to check up on you."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​还​在​四处​转悠​。​就是​想来​和​你​打个招呼​。\n"
"bu4，wo3 hai2 zai4 si4chu4 zhuan4you5。jiu4shi4 xiang3lai2 he4 ni3 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1。"

msgid "No, I've reconsidered."
msgstr ""
"不​，​让​我​再​想想​。\n"
"bu4，rang4 wo3 zai4 xiang3 xiang3。"

msgid ""
"No, ace. You didn't. You *chose* to do what you did.\n"
"\n"
"Just as you chose to free me."
msgstr ""
"不​，​王牌​。​不是​这样​。​是​你​*​选择​*​了​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​你​选择​了​释放​我​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wang2pai2。bu4shi4 zhe4yang4。shi4 ni3*xuan3ze2*le5 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 ni3 xuan3ze2 le5 shi4fang4 wo3 yi1yang4。"

msgid "No, actually, I don't. Unless you intend to *make* me leave?"
msgstr ""
"但​我​没​这个​打算​。​除非​你​想要​*​动手​*​让​我​离开​？\n"
"dan4 wo3 mei2 zhe4ge5 da3suan4。chu2fei1 ni3 xiang3yao4*dong4shou3*rang4 wo3 li2kai1？"

msgid "No, actually. I don't. Unless you intend to *make* me leave?"
msgstr ""
"但​我​没​这个​打算​。​除非​你​想要​*​动手​*​让​我​离开​？\n"
"dan4 wo3 mei2 zhe4ge5 da3suan4。chu2fei1 ni3 xiang3yao4*dong4shou3*rang4 wo3 li2kai1？"

msgid ""
"No, boss... 'course not. The debts don't mean a thing to me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He hesitates for a moment, then plows forward.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The girl that I racked 'em up for, though... she's a different story. I might be in some trouble, chief."
msgstr ""
"不​不​不​，​头儿​……​当然​不​。​欠债​已经​不算什么​事情​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​犹豫​了​一下​，​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​欠债​是因为​那个​女孩​……​那​就是​另一回事​了​。​我​可能​有​麻烦​了​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 bu4 bu4，tou2r5……dang1ran2 bu4。qian4zhai4 yi3jing1 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2 shi4qing5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you2yu4 le5 yi1xia4，you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 qian4zhai4 shi4 yin1 wei2 na4ge5 nu:3hai2……na4 jiu4shi4 ling4 yi1 hui2 shi4 le5。wo3 ke3neng2 you3 ma2fan5 le5，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"No, but some info would be nice. You see any new friends of the Rammbock "
"show up lately?"
msgstr ""
"免​了​，​不​过来​点​情报​总是​好​的​。​你​有​见​过​撞锤​帮​最近​交到​什么​新​朋友​吗​？\n"
"mian3 le5，bu4 guo4lai2 dian3 qing2bao4 zong3shi4 hao3 de5。ni3 you3 jian4 guo4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 zui4jin4 jiao1 dao4 shen2me5 xin1 peng2you5 ma5？"

msgid "No, but you are about to."
msgstr ""
"不​，​但​你​很快​就​会​认识​了​。\n"
"bu4，dan4 ni3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 ren4shi5 le5。"

msgid ""
"No, chief... sorry. I'm new here, remember?\n"
"\n"
"My advice is to treat it like any other paydata. Just throw it up on Shadowland and go for a quick sale... that's what I'd do.\n"
"\n"
"We've got bigger things to worry about than hunting around for a linguist."
msgstr ""
"头儿​……​不好意思​。​我​是​新来​的​，​记得​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​建议​是​把​它​当作​普通​的​值钱​数据​来​处理​。​直接​上​传到​暗影​之地​，​然后​快速​出售​……​这​就是​我会​做​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​还有​更​重要​的​事要​担心​，​而​不是​到处​找​一名​语言学家​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5……bu4hao3yi4si5。wo3 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5，ji4de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 jian4yi4 shi4 ba3 ta1 dang4zuo4 pu3tong1 de5 zhi2qian2 shu4ju4 lai2 chu3li3。zhi2jie1 shang4 chuan2 dao4 an4ying3 zhi1 de5，ran2hou4 kuai4su4 chu1shou4……zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3 hui4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 dan1xin1，er2 bu4shi4 dao4chu4 zhao3 yi1 ming2 yu3yan2xue2jia1。"

msgid "No, don't do that. I've already made my decision anyway."
msgstr ""
"不​，​别​这么​做​了​。​反正​我​已经​做出​决定​了​。\n"
"bu4，bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。fan3zheng4 wo3 yi3jing1 zuo4chu1 jue2ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No, fearless leader. I'm preventing you from walking us into a trap.\n"
"\n"
"I’ve spent the last hour reviewing the intel that Alice sent us and comparing it to what I gathered on our original run. There has been a substantial increase in the number of heat signatures on the grounds.\n"
"\n"
"That means new security troops. Lots of them."
msgstr ""
"不​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​是​在​阻止​你​把​我们​带入​陷阱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​一​小时​内​，​我​一直​在​核对​爱丽丝​发来​的​情报​，​并​与​我们​首次​行动​时​收集​的​信息​进行​比​对​。​地面​热源​信号​数量​出现​了​大幅​增长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​那里​新增​了​安保​部队​，​而且​数量​相当可观​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3 shi4 zai4 zu3zhi3 ni3 ba3 wo3men5 dai4 ru4 xian4jing3。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 yi1 xiao3shi2 nei4，wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 he2dui4 ai4li4si1 fa1 lai2 de5 qing2bao4，bing4 yu4 wo3men5 shou3ci4 xing2dong4 shi2 shou1ji2 de5 xin4xi1 jin4xing2 bi3 dui4。di4mian4 re4yuan2 xin4hao4 shu4liang4 chu1xian4 le5 da4fu2 zeng1zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 na4li5 xin1zeng1 le5 an1bao3 bu4dui4，er2qie3 shu4liang4 xiang1 dang1 ke3 guan1。"

msgid ""
"No, he didn't. He was green, like you said. And he never should've been in a"
" position to make those mistakes in the first place. It wasn't your fault "
"that he was... but it wasn't fully his, either."
msgstr ""
"不是​这样​的​。​他​确实​像​你​说​的​是​个​新兵​蛋子​，​而且​他本​就​不该​被​置于​犯下​那些​错误​的​位置​。​这件​事情​不能​怪​你​……​但​也​不能​完全​怪​在​他​的​头上​。\n"
"bu4shi4 zhe4yang4 de5。ta1 que4shi2 xiang4 ni3 shuo1 de5 shi4 ge4 xin1bing1 dan4 zi3，er2qie3 ta1 ben3 jiu4 bu4gai1 bei4 zhi4yu2 fan4 xia4 na4xie1 cuo4wu4 de5 wei4zhi5。zhe4 jian4 shi4qing5 bu4neng2 guai4 ni3……dan4 ye3 bu4neng2 wan2quan2 guai4 zai4 ta1 de5 tou2shang4。"

msgid ""
"No, it isn't that. You've been under fire before... you'd get it.\n"
"\n"
"But I don't share war stories with civilians. You may be a shadowrunner, but you were never a soldier."
msgstr ""
"不​，​不是​那个​意思​。​你​也​是​经历​过​枪林弹雨​的​人​……​你​肯定​懂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​不会​跟​平民​分享​战争​故事​。​你​是​个​暗影​狂奔​者​，​但​你​不是​军人​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，bu4shi4 na4ge5 yi4si5。ni3 ye3 shi4 jing1li4 guo4 qiang1 lin2 dan4 yu3 de5 ren2……ni3 ken3ding4 dong3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 bu4hui4 gen1 ping2min2 fen1xiang3 zhan4zheng1 gu4shi4。ni3 shi4 ge4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，dan4 ni3 bu4shi4 jun1ren2。"

msgid "No, it isn't. And we've got you to thank for that."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​这​都​多亏​了​你​。\n"
"shi4 a1。zhe4 dou1 duo1kui1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"No, it isn't. But we came here to kill Harrow, and she's in the way of us "
"doing that."
msgstr ""
"确实​。​但​我们​来​这里​是​为了​干掉​哈罗​，​而​她​挡​了​我们​的​道​。\n"
"que4shi2。dan4 wo3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 wei4le5 gan4diao4 ha1luo2，er2 ta1 dang3 le5 wo3men5 de5 dao4。"

msgid "No, it was me. You're talking to a ghost."
msgstr ""
"不​，​其实​是​我​。​你​在​和​幽灵​讲话​。\n"
"bu4，qi2shi2 shi4 wo3。ni3 zai4 he4 you1ling2 jiang3hua4。"

msgid "No, it was resolved peacefully."
msgstr ""
"没有​，​我们​和平解决​了​。\n"
"mei2you3，wo3men5 he4 ping2 jie3 jue2 le5。"

msgid "No, it wasn't him. Zaak loves me. He loves everybody."
msgstr ""
"不​，​不是​他​。​扎克​爱​我​。​他​爱​所有人​。\n"
"bu4，bu4shi4 ta1。Zha1ke4 ai4 wo3。ta1 ai4 suo3you3ren2。"

msgid ""
"No, it's okay... I *should* talk about this. Running from it won't help anything.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A part of me still loved her, I think. But the rest hated her for what she represented."
msgstr ""
"不​，​没关系​的​……​我​*​应该​*​把​这些​说​出来​。​一味​逃避​也​不会​有​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​移开​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​心中​有​一部分​仍然​爱着​她​，​而​另​一部分​则​因为​她​背后​代表​的​事物​而​憎恨​她​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，mei2guan1xi5 de5……wo3*ying1gai1*ba3 zhe4xie1 shuo1 chu1lai2。yi1wei4 tao2bi4 ye3 bu4hui4 you3 bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi2kai1 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xin1zhong1 you3 yi1bu4fen5 reng2ran2 ai4 zhao2 ta1，er2 ling4 yi1bu4fen5 ze2 yin1wei4 ta1 bei4hou4 dai4biao3 de5 shi4wu4 er2 zeng1hen4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"No, my friend. I am not. I will not be right for a long time. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He steadies himself on the counter.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​的​朋友​。​我​不好​。​接下来​很长​一段时间​我​都​不会​好​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​抵着​柜台​，​借此​稳住​身形​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 de5 peng2you5。wo3 bu4hao3。jie1xia4lai2 hen3 zhang3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 wo3 dou1 bu4hui4 hao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di3 zhao2 gui4tai2，jie4ci3 wen3 zhu4 shen1xing2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"No, no! Please, it is nothing like that. This is one friend doing a favor for another, and expecting a small favor in return. \n"
"\n"
"However, if you would like to see what extortion looks like, I might be able to arrange for a demonstration."
msgstr ""
"不​不​！​请​听​我​说​，​完全​不是​那么回事​。​这​只不过​是​朋友​之间​互相​帮忙​，​期待​对方​稍作​回报​罢了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​如果​你​想​见识​见识​勒索​是​什么​样子​，​我​或许​可以​为​你​安排​示范​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 bu4！qing3 ting1 wo3 shuo1，wan2quan2 bu4shi4 na4 ma2 hui2 shi4。zhe4 zhi3bu5guo4 shi4 peng2you5 zhi1jian1 hu4xiang1 bang1mang2，qi1dai4 dui4fang1 shao1 zuo4 hui2bao4 ba4le5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 jian4shi5 jian4shi5 le4suo3 shi4 shen2me5 yang4zi5，wo3 huo4xu3 ke3yi3 wei2 ni3 an1pai2 shi4fan4 yi1xia4。"

msgid "No, noble spirit. It is *you* who must..."
msgstr ""
"不​，​高贵​的​精魂​。​是​*​你​*​必须​……\n"
"bu4，gao1gui4 de5 jing1hun2。shi4*ni3*bi4xu1……"

msgid ""
"No, not at all! You've got a good eye - that's one of the nicest outfits in the store.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes your arm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here, let me show you to a dressing room..."
msgstr ""
"当然​没​问题​！​你​真​有​眼光​，​这​可是​本店​最好​的​衣服​之一​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​拉​住​你​的​手臂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​来​，​我​带你去​更衣室​……\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 mei2 wen4ti2！ni3 zhen1 you3 yan3guang1，zhe4 ke3shi4 ben3 dian4 zui4hao3 de5 yi1fu5 zhi1yi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 la1 zhu4 ni3 de5 shou3bi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lai2，wo3 dai4 ni3 qu4 geng1yi1shi4……"

msgid "No, not really."
msgstr ""
"并​没有​。\n"
"bing4 mei2you3。"

msgid "No, not really. I just wanted to see how you'd react."
msgstr ""
"并​不是​，​我​只是​想​看看​你​的​反应​。\n"
"bing4 bu4shi4，wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 kan4kan5 ni3 de5 fan3ying4。"

msgid "No, not yet."
msgstr ""
"还​没有​。\n"
"hai2 mei2you3。"

msgid "No, not yet... those spirits are tough. I'm still working on it."
msgstr ""
"不​，​还​没有​……​那些​精魂​不好​对付​。​我​还​在​努力​。\n"
"bu4，hai2 mei2you3……na4xie1 jing1hun2 bu4hao3 dui4fu5。wo3 hai2 zai4 nu3li4。"

msgid "No, of course not. How could I?"
msgstr ""
"当然​不​。​我​怎么​会​知道​？\n"
"dang1ran2 bu4。wo3 zen3me5 hui4 zhi1dao4？"

msgid "No, of course not. You two have a good day."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​祝你们​今天​愉快​。\n"
"dang1ran2。zhu4 ni3 men5 jin1tian1 yu2kuai4。"

msgid "No, please. Stay and chat with us."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​没事​的​。​和​我们​说说话​吧​。\n"
"a1，mei2shi4 de5。he4 wo3men5 shuo1 shuo1 hua4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No, really! It's true!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pats his pockets again. Nothing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, look. I need to get to my meeting right away, but here's what we can do. I'll give you my room code. You pop in and take the credstick off of the table - there's a couple hundred nuyen on there, and that should more than compensate you."
msgstr ""
"不​！​我​说​的​是​真的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​拍了拍​口袋​，​里面​空无一物​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​我​得​马上​赶​去​开会​，​但​我们​可以​这样​解决​。​我​把​房间​密码​给​你​。​你​进去​把​桌上​的​信用​棒​拿走​—​—​里面​有​几百​新円​，​这​应该​足够​补偿​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4！wo3 shuo1 de5 shi4 zhen1de5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 pai1 le5 pai1 kou3dai4，li3mian4 kong1 wu2 yi1 wu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3 de2 ma3shang4 gan3 qu4 kai1hui4，dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 zhe4yang4 jie3jue2。wo3 ba3 fang2jian1 mi4ma3 gei3 ni3。ni3 jin4qu4 ba3 zhuo1 shang4 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 na2zou3——li3mian4 you3 ji1 bai3 xin1 yuan2，zhe4 ying1gai1 zu2gou4 bu3chang2 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"No, seriously, how did you…?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His eyes glitter, triumphant.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, I get it! You made a deal, didn’t you?\n"
"\n"
"You made a deal with *her.*"
msgstr ""
"但​你​到底​是​怎么​……​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​眼睛​突然​滴溜​一转​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​了​。​你​做​了​交易​是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​和​*​她​*​做​了​交易​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 dao4di3 shi4 zen3me5……？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3jing5 tu1ran2 di1 liu1 yi1 zhuai3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 le5。ni3 zuo4 le5 jiao1yi4 shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 he4*ta1*zuo4 le5 jiao1yi4。"

msgid ""
"No, seriously, you're gonna want to hear this. It involves you - like, "
"*you,* specifically."
msgstr ""
"不是​，​你​最好​还是​听听​这个​。​和​你们​有关​，​确切​来说​是​和​*​你​*​有关​。\n"
"bu4shi4，ni3 zui4hao3 hai2shi5 ting1 ting1 zhe4ge5。he4 ni3men5 you3guan1，que4qie4 lai2 shuo1 shi4 he4*ni3*you3guan1。"

msgid "No, shadowrunner. I am not one of *them.* No more than you are."
msgstr ""
"不​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​我​和​*​他们​*​不​一样​。​我们​都​是​同样​的​人类​。\n"
"bu4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。wo3 he4*ta1men5*bu4 yi1yang4。wo3men5 dou1 shi4 tong2yang4 de5 ren2lei4。"

msgid ""
"No, she wasn't. She was a legendary Great Dragon, and she was completely off"
" her rocker. And we set her loose like a caged bird."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​她​是​一头​传说​级​的​巨龙​，​而且​完全​丧失​了​理智​。​我们​就​像​释放​笼中鸟​一样​把​她​放走​了​。\n"
"shi4 a1。ta1 shi4 yi1tou2 chuan2shuo1 ji2 de5 ju4long2，er2qie3 wan2quan2 sang4shi1 le5 li3zhi4。wo3men5 jiu4 xiang4 shi4fang4 long2 zhong4 niao3 yi1yang4 ba3 ta1 fang4zou3 le5。"

msgid "No, sir. We don't."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​，​先生​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3，xian1sheng5。"

msgid "No, sir. We'll be on our way."
msgstr ""
"没事​，​我们​这​就​走​。\n"
"mei2shi4，wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"No, stranger, I tell you that it would be a massacre. I would have their blood on my hands!\n"
"\n"
"I cannot do it, and I will not. End of discussion."
msgstr ""
"不​，​陌生人​，​我​告诉​你​，​这​将​是​一场​大屠杀​。​我​不想​因为​自己​而​害死​他们​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不能​这么​做​，​也​不会​这么​做​。​讨论​到此为止​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，mo4sheng1ren2，wo3 gao4su4 ni3，zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 da4tu2sha1。wo3 bu4xiang3 yin1wei4 zi4ji3 er2 hai4si3 ta1men5！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4，ye3 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。tao3lun4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3。"

msgid ""
"No, stranger. I cannot leave this place. I am its sworn protector, and I *will not* shirk my responsibilities.\n"
"\n"
"I will suffer, as Titonius Rex suffered when he sent Brenna-thay back to Trala-sheen. This is my burden to bear."
msgstr ""
"不​，​陌生人​。​我​不能​离开​这个​地方​。​我​发誓​做​它​的​守护者​，​我​不会​逃避​我​的​责任​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​受苦​，​就​像​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​在​把​布伦娜​·​赛伊​送回​特拉​希恩时​所​承受​的​痛苦​。​这​是​我​必须​承受​的​负担​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，mo4sheng1ren2。wo3 bu4neng2 li2kai1 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。wo3 fa1shi4 zuo4 ta1 de5 shou3 hu4 zhe3，wo3 bu4hui4 tao2bi4 wo3 de5 ze2ren4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 shou4ku3，jiu4 xiang4 Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 zai4 ba3 bu4 lun2 na4 · sai4 yi1 song4 hui2 te4 la1 xi1 en1 shi2 suo3 cheng2shou4 de5 tong4ku3。zhe4 shi4 wo3 bi4xu1 cheng2shou4 de5 fu4dan1。"

msgid "No, thank you, that will be all. You have a goo--"
msgstr ""
"没事​了​，​谢谢​。​祝​你​今晚​—​—\n"
"mei2shi4 le5，xie4xie5。zhu4 ni3 jin1wan3 — —"

msgid "No, thank you."
msgstr ""
"不​，​该​我​谢谢​你​。\n"
"bu4，gai1 wo3 xie4xie5 ni3。"

msgid "No, thanks to you."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​而​这​都​多亏​了​你​。\n"
"mei2cuo4，er2 zhe4 dou1 duo1kui1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"No, they probably wouldn't. Hey, would you mind getting the door for me?"
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​话​说​能​帮​我​开​一下​门​吗​？\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。hua4 shuo1 neng2 bang1 wo3 kai1 yi1xia4 men2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"No, they probably wouldn't. Now, if you'll just let me by, I do have work to"
" get back to..."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​麻烦​让​一下​，​我​还​得​回去​工作​……\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。ma2fan5 rang4 yi1xia4，wo3 hai2 de2 hui2qu5 gong1zuo4……"

msgid ""
"No, this is all sounding way too sketchy to me. Better to just delete you "
"and be done with it."
msgstr ""
"不​，​这​一切​听​起来​太​可疑​了​。​还是​直接​删除​你​比较​好​。\n"
"bu4，zhe4 yi1qie4 ting1 qi3lai5 tai4 ke3yi2 le5。hai2shi5 zhi2jie1 shan1chu2 ni3 bi3jiao4 hao3。"

msgid "No, wait! Don't do that!"
msgstr ""
"等等​！​别​这么​做​！\n"
"deng3deng3！bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4！"

msgid ""
"No, wait. Monika...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A flicker of recognition fights through the haze in the young woman's eyes.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"不​，​等等​。​莫妮卡​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​年轻​女子​朦胧​的​双眼​中​闪过​一丝​恍然大悟​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bu4，deng3deng3。Mo4ni1ka3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nian2qing1 nu:3zi3 meng2long2 de5 shuang1yan3 zhong4 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 huang3ran2da4wu4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"No, we are not. Not in a conventional sense. In war, there are sides. Battle lines. Clarity. \n"
"\n"
"This is something else entirely… but the stakes are just as high. Higher, perhaps. "
msgstr ""
"没错​，​至少​不是​在​传统意义​上​。​在​战争​中​，​有​阵营​。​有​战线​。​有​明确​的​界限​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​这​完全​是​另一回事​……​但​风险​同样​高​。​或许​甚至​更高​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，zhi4shao3 bu4shi4 zai4 chuan2 tong3 yi4 yi4 shang4。zai4 zhan4zheng1 zhong4，you3 zhen4ying2。you3 zhan4xian4。you3 ming2que4 de5 jie4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4 wan2quan2 shi4 ling4 yi1 hui2 shi4……dan4 feng1xian3 tong2yang4 gao1。huo4xu3 shen4zhi4 geng1 gao1。"

msgid ""
"No, we can't. But as I said, I did manage to copy a file, so it's not a complete loss.\n"
"\n"
"It looks to be a comm file... the audio is all here, but we've only got video from one side of the conversation.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He opens the file, and a nightmarishly familiar face appears on the screen.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"的确​。​但​正如​我​所说​，​我​成功​恢复​了​一个​文件​，​所以​也​不能​说​是​全​无​收获​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​是​一份​通讯​文件​……​音频​部分​完整​，​但​视频​部分​只有​其中​一方​的​画面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​打开​文件​，​屏幕​上​出现​一张​如​梦魇​般​熟悉​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"di2que4。dan4 zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，wo3 cheng2gong1 hui1fu4 le5 yi1ge5 wen2jian4，suo3yi3 ye3 bu4neng2 shuo1 shi4 quan2 wu2 shou1huo4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 shi4 yi1 fen4 tong1xun4 wen2jian4……yin1pin2 bu4fen5 wan2zheng3，dan4 shi4pin2 bu4fen5 zhi3you3 qi2zhong1 yi1fang1 de5 hua4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da3kai1 wen2jian4，ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 yi1 zhang1 ru2 meng4yan3 ban1 shu2xi1 de5 lian3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"No, you don't. But you're about to.\n"
"\n"
"My name is Hasenkamp. I'm Mr. Grinder's accountant."
msgstr ""
"你​之前​不​认识​，​但​你​现在​认识​我​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​叫​哈森​坎普​。​我​是​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​会计​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 bu4 ren4shi5，dan4 ni3 xian4zai4 ren4shi5 wo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiao4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3。wo3 shi4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 kuai4ji4。"

msgid ""
"No, you must have just gotten back. Takes a minute for information to percolate if it's not direct, you know that.\n"
"\n"
"Also they probably wouldn't tell me about that."
msgstr ""
"不​，​你​肯定​是​刚刚​才​回来​的​。​不管​什么​情报​，​要​传播​开来​总得​需要​时间​，​你​知道​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​别人​大概​也​不会​和​我​说​这件​事​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 gang1gang5 cai2 hui2lai5 de5。bu4guan3 shen2me5 qing2bao4，yao4 chuan2bo1 kai1 lai2 zong3dei3 xu1yao4 shi2jian1，ni3 zhi1dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 bie2ren5 da4gai4 ye3 bu4hui4 he4 wo3 shuo1 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid "No, you're cut off. I don't want you even sipping out of it."
msgstr ""
"不​，​你​该​结账​了​。​我​不想​再​卖​给​你​了​。\n"
"bu4，ni3 gai1 jie2zhang4 le5。wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 mai4 gei3 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"No, you're right on time. But the rest of us got here early, and one of the others was pretty vocal about not wanting to wait.\n"
"\n"
"He took off, and the other guy followed him. They're already inside."
msgstr ""
"不​，​你​来得​很​准时​。​是​我们​其他人​早早​就​到​了​，​而且​有​个人​一直​叫唤​着​不想​在​这​等​下去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​先​走​了​，​其他人​也​跟着​他​一起​。​他们​已经​在​里面​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，ni3 lai2de5 hen3 zhun3shi2。shi4 wo3men5 qi2 ta1 ren2 zao3 zao3 jiu4 dao4 le5，er2qie3 you3 ge4ren2 yi1zhi2 jiao4huan5 zhao2 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4 deng3 xia4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xian1 zou3 le5，qi2 ta1 ren2 ye3 gen1zhe5 ta1 yi1qi3。ta1men5 yi3jing1 zai4 li3mian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No, you're right. We can't ask you to risk yourself without some kind of compensation.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pulls a battered credstick out of his pocket and presses it into your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here, take it! Just please make our home safe again!"
msgstr ""
"不​，​你​说得对​。​不能​让​你​冒​着​风险​却​没有​任何​回报​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​从​口袋​里​掏出​一张​破旧​的​信用​棒​，​硬塞到​你​手里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拿​着​吧​！​只求​你​能​让​我们​重新​回家​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 mao4 zhao2 feng1xian3 que4 mei2you3 ren4he2 hui2bao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 kou3dai4 li3 tao1chu1 yi1 zhang1 po4jiu4 de5 xin4yong4 bang4，ying4 se4 dao4 ni3 shou3li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na2 zhao2 ba1！zhi3 qiu2 ni3 neng2 rang4 wo3men5 chong2xin1 hui2jia1！"

msgid "No."
msgstr ""
"不​。\n"
"bu4。"

msgid ""
"No.\n"
"\n"
"I'm talking about eating meat."
msgstr ""
"不​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说​的​是​吃​肉​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de5 shi4 chi1 rou4。"

msgid ""
"No.\n"
"\n"
"She's good, $(l.name). Better than I ever thought she was. I couldn't trace the damned thing.\n"
"\n"
"I *could* keep digging, though. I mean, if she noticed me doing it before, I must've been close."
msgstr ""
"没有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​很​厉害​，​$(l.name)​。​比​我​想象​的​还要​厉害​。​我​什么​都​没有​追踪​到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​*​可以​*​继续​追查​。​如果说​她​注意​到​我​的话​，​说明​我​肯定​已经​十分​接近​了​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hen3 li4hai5，$(l.name)。bi3 wo3 xiang3xiang4 de5 hai2 yao4 li4hai5。wo3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3 zhui1zong1 dao4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3*ke3yi3*ji4xu4 zhui1cha2。ru2guo3shuo1 ta1 zhu4yi4 dao4 wo3 de5hua4，shuo1ming2 wo3 ken3ding4 yi3jing1 shi2fen1 jie1jin4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, playing with his fork.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, not really. For your purposes, you might as well think of it as one, though."
msgstr ""
"不是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​摆弄​着​手里​的​叉子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​确实​不算​是​。​不过​从​你​的​用途​来看​，​你​大概​这么​理解​也​行​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，bai3nong4 zhao2 shou3li3 de5 cha1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，que4shi2 bu4suan4 shi4。bu4guo4 cong2 ni3 de5 yong4tu2 lai2 kan4，ni3 da4gai4 zhe4me5 li3jie3 ye3 xing2。"

msgid ""
"No.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Seeing your expression, he continues.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, we're talking about neurosurgery here. It's risky, delicate work... a damn sight more difficult than stamping out a chip."
msgstr ""
"不​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​看到​你​的​反应​，​他​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​说​的​可是​神经外科​手术​。​这是​风险​很​高​的​精细​工作​……​比​冲压​芯片​还要​困难​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kan4dao4 ni3 de5 fan3ying4，ta1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shuo1 de5 ke3shi4 shen2jing1wai4ke1 shou3shu4。zhe4 shi4 feng1xian3 hen3 gao1 de5 jing1xi4 gong1zuo4……bi3 chong1ya1 xin1pian4 hai2 yao4 kun4nan5。"

msgid ""
"No.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She frowns slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And I wouldn’t suggest asking questions about such things around here."
msgstr ""
"没有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​微微​蹙眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​也​不​建议​你​在​这​附近​问​这样​的​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 cu4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 ye3 bu4 jian4yi4 ni3 zai4 zhe4 fu4jin4 wen4 zhe4yang4 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"No.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't think it's as simple as that."
msgstr ""
"不​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​事情​没​那么​简单​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 shi4qing5 mei2 na4me5 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"No.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ork's gauntleted fist tightens, and you hear the distinctive whir of his Vindicator's motor spinning up to speed. The barrels begin to blur as he wheels the weapon to face you.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"不能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​兽​人​带​着​铁​手套​的​手​紧握​成拳​，​你​听见​“​辩护人​”​的​转轮​加速​时​那​标志性​的​嗡​鸣声​。​他​把​武器​转向​你​的​时候​，​枪管​的​转速​已经​快到​看不清​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bu4neng2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 dai4 zhao2 tie3 shou3tao4 de5 shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2，ni3 ting1jian4“bian4hu4ren2” de5 zhuan4lun2 jia1su4 shi2 na4 biao1zhi4xing4 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。ta1 ba3 wu3qi4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3 de5 shi2hou5，qiang1guan3 de5 zhuan4su4 yi3jing1 kuai4 dao4 kan4bu5qing1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"No.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Warily, she surveys your surroundings.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're... someplace else."
msgstr ""
"不是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​警惕​地​打量​着​你​周围​的​环境​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​……​另​一个​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jing3ti4 de5 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3 zhou1wei2 de5 huan2jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4……ling4 yi1ge5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"No. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He puts down his comic, and his voice slows to a crawl. He makes a point of enunciating each word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I point people to the bar. If someone starts trouble, I give them a taste of Herr Zapp. \n"
"\n"
"That's it. That's all I do."
msgstr ""
"不​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​漫画​放下​，​语速​也​变得​极其​缓慢​，​一字一顿​地​说​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​负责​告诉​客人​吧台​在​哪儿​。​要是​有人​闹事​，​我​就让​他们​尝尝​霹雳​老大哥​的​滋味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这些​。​我​只​干​这些​事​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 man4hua4 fang4xia4，yu3 su4 ye3 bian4de5 ji2qi2 huan3man4，yi1 zi4 yi1 dun4 de5 shuo1 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 fu4ze2 gao4su4 ke4ren2 ba1tai2 zai4 na3r5。yao4shi5 you3ren2 nao4shi4，wo3 jiu4 rang4 ta1men5 chang2 chang2 pi1li4 lao3da4ge1 de5 zi1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4xie1。wo3 zhi3 gan4 zhe4xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"No. $+(s.he) wouldn't. Hasenkamp is right, Blitz... this is a stupid move."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​没错​。​哈森​坎普​说得对​，​布里​茨​……​这样​做太蠢​了​。\n"
"en1，mei2cuo4。Ha1sen1kan3pu3 shuo1 de2 dui4，Bu4li3ci2……zhe4yang4 zuo4 tai4 chun3 le5。"

msgid "No. And Humanis is about to find that out for themselves."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​人类​至上​主义者​马上​也​会​知晓​这​一点​。\n"
"en1。ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ma3shang4 ye3 hui4 zhi1xiao3 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"No. As far as the outside world was concerned, we were still under quarantine protocols - nobody knew why, and nobody cared. The building had presumably been sealed for a reason, and the world at large wasn't in a hurry to crack it open again.\n"
"\n"
"Heiner and I found ourselves completely isolated from the outside world, with a terrible creature running loose in the basement. Our choices were to give up and die, or to make the best of it."
msgstr ""
"不​。​在​外界​看来​，​我们​依然​处于​隔离​协议​下​—​—​没有​人​知道​原因​，​也​没有​人​关心​。​这栋​楼​被​封闭​，​外界​认为​必然​有​其​原因​，​没人​急​着​打开​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​海纳​和​我​发现自己​完全​被​外界​孤立​，​而​地下室​里​还有​一个​可怕​的​生物​在​四处​游荡​。​我们​的​选择​只有​两种​：​要么​放弃​并​等​死​，​要么​尽力而为​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。zai4 wai4jie4 kan4lai5，wo3men5 yi1ran2 chu3yu2 ge2li2 xie2yi4 xia4——mei2you3 ren2 zhi1dao4 yuan2yin1，ye3 mei2you3 ren2 guan1xin1。zhe4 dong4 lou2 bei4 feng1bi4，wai4jie4 ren4wei2 bi4ran2 you3 qi2 yuan2yin1，mei2 ren2 ji2 zhao2 da3kai1 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"hai3 na4 he4 wo3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 wan2quan2 bei4 wai4jie4 gu1li4，er2 di4xia4shi4 li3 hai2you3 yi1ge5 ke3pa4 de5 sheng1wu4 zai4 si4chu4 you2dang4。wo3men5 de5 xuan3ze2 zhi3you3 liang3 zhong3：yao4me5 fang4qi4 bing4 deng3 si3，yao4me5 jin4li4er2wei2。"

msgid ""
"No. But she wasn't exactly her old self, either. Vauclair tortured that out of her. The broken thing in that cage deserved better than to be put to death.\n"
"\n"
"My gut tells me that she's gonna disappear. Find a nice, cozy place to sleep off this age of the world, and try again next time."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​但​她​也​不是​从前​那个​自己​了​。​沃​克莱尔​对​她​的​折磨​让​她​宛如​换​了​个人​。​笼中​只有​一个​破碎​的​囚徒​，​理应​得到​安息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​直觉​告诉​我​说​她​会​就​这样​消失​不见​，​找个​舒服​的​地方​陷入​长眠​，​度过​世界​的​这个​时代​，​然后​再度​开始​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。dan4 ta1 ye3 bu4shi4 cong2qian2 na4ge5 zi4ji3 le5。Wo4ke4lai2er3 dui4 ta1 de5 zhe2mo2 rang4 ta1 wan3ru2 huan4 le5 ge4ren2。long2 zhong4 zhi3you3 yi1ge5 po4sui4 de5 qiu2tu2，li3ying1 de2dao4 an1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 ta1 hui4 jiu4 zhe4yang4 xiao1shi1 bu4jian4，zhao3 ge4 shu1fu5 de5 di4fang1 xian4ru4 chang2mian2，du4guo4 shi4jie4 de5 zhe4ge5 shi2dai4，ran2hou4 zai4du4 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"No. Commlinks don't work in here - no reception. And the quarantine cut off our Matrix access.\n"
"\n"
"Heiner and I found ourselves completely isolated from the outside world, with a terrible creature running loose in the basement.\n"
"\n"
"Our choices were to give up and die, or to make the best of it."
msgstr ""
"不​，​通信​链​在​这里​无法​工作​—​—​没有​信号​。​隔离​切断​了​我们​的​矩阵​接入​权限​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​海纳​和​我​发现自己​完全​被​外界​孤立​，​而​地下室​里​还有​一个​可怕​的​生物​在​四处​游荡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​的​选择​只有​两种​：​要么​放弃​并​等​死​，​要么​尽力而为​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，tong1xin4 lian4 zai4 zhe4li3 wu2fa3 gong1zuo4——mei2you3 xin4hao4。ge2li2 qie1duan4 le5 wo3men5 de5 ju3zhen4 jie1ru4 quan2xian4。\n"
"\n"
"hai3 na4 he4 wo3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 wan2quan2 bei4 wai4jie4 gu1li4，er2 di4xia4shi4 li3 hai2you3 yi1ge5 ke3pa4 de5 sheng1wu4 zai4 si4chu4 you2dang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 xuan3ze2 zhi3you3 liang3 zhong3：yao4me5 fang4qi4 bing4 deng3 si3，yao4me5 jin4li4er2wei2。"

msgid "No. Fine. Whatever. Let's just get this over with."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​我们​抓紧​行动​吧​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。wo3men5 zhua1jin3 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No. He has enough to worry about keeping the people of the Kreuzbasar safe... those kids that we rescued, they've been *damaged* by Harrow's philosophies.\n"
"\n"
"They can get better, but it's going to take time. Trying to integrate them into our society too quickly would be dangerous."
msgstr ""
"不​。​克洛伊​茨​集市​民众​的​安全​已经​让​他​足够​操心​了​……​我们​救​出来​的​那些​孩子​，​都​被​哈罗​的​哲学思想​*​毒害​*​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​能​康复​，​但​需要​时间​。​若​急于​让​他们​融入​我们​的​社会​，​反而​会​很​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 min2zhong4 de5 an1quan2 yi3jing1 rang4 ta1 zu2gou4 cao1xin1 le5……wo3men5 jiu4 chu1lai2 de5 na4Xie1hai2zi5，dou1 bei4 ha1luo2 de5 zhe2 xue2 si1 xiang3*du2hai4*le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 neng2 kang1fu4，dan4 xu1yao4 shi2jian1。ruo4 ji2yu2 rang4 ta1men5 rong2ru4 wo3men5 de5 she4hui4，fan3er2 hui4 hen3 wei1xian3。"

msgid ""
"No. I am not an elf.\n"
"\n"
"I am merely a passenger in this body. A guest, here to experience what you would call \"life.\"\n"
"\n"
"As I have a thousand times before."
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​不是​精灵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​这具​躯壳​中​的​一介​过客​，​为了​来​体验​你们​所谓​的​“​生命​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正如​我​此前​曾​千百次​经历​过​的​那样​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。wo3 bu4shi4 jing1ling2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 zhe4 ju4 qu1qiao4 zhong4 de5 yi1 jie4 guo4ke4，wei4le5 lai2 ti3yan4 ni3men5 suo3wei4 de5“sheng1ming4”。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 wo3 ci3qian2 ceng2 qian1 bai3 ci4 jing1li4 guo4 de5 na4yang4。"

msgid ""
"No. I can't go against Harrow's wishes. He told me never to take it off, and I won't.\n"
"\n"
"But I *will* come with you.  If I can help save these kids from what's happening here, that's what I have to do."
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​不能​违背​哈罗​的​意愿​。​他​告诉​我​永远​不要​摘下​它​，​那​我​就​不会​摘下来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​*​会​*​和​你们​一起​去​。​如果​我能​帮助​这些​孩子​免遭​伤害​，​那​我​就​必须​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。wo3 bu4neng2 wei2bei4 ha1luo2 de5 yi4yuan4。ta1 gao4su4 wo3 yong3yuan3 bu4yao4 zhai1xia4 ta1，na4 wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 zhai1 xia4 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3*hui4*he4 ni3men5 yi1qi3 qu4。ru2guo3 wo3 neng2 bang1zhu4 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5 mian3zao1 shang1hai4，na4 wo3 jiu4 bi4xu1 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"No. I didn't. What I did was *necessary,* given the situation.\n"
"\n"
"If you can’t see that, you’re even more clueless than I thought."
msgstr ""
"并非如此​。​在​当时​的​情况​下​，​我​*​必须​*​那样​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​连​这​都​想​不​明白​，​那​你​简直​比​我​想​的​还要​蠢​。\n"
"\n"
"bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。zai4 dang1shi2 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4，wo3*bi4xu1*na4yang4 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 lian2 zhe4 dou1 xiang3 bu4 ming2bai5，na4 ni3 jian3zhi2 bi3 wo3 xiang3 de5 hai2 yao4 chun3。"

msgid "No. I don't have time for this."
msgstr ""
"算了​，​我​没​时间​搞​这个​。\n"
"suan4le5，wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 gao3 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"No. I don't think so.\n"
"\n"
"Chief, I never knew your friend, but this ain't her."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​不​这么​认为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​头儿​，​我​没见​过​你​的​朋友​，​但​这​不​可能​是​她​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，wo3 mei2 jian4 guo4 ni3 de5 peng2you5，dan4 zhe4 bu4 ke3neng2 shi4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"No. I don't think so.\n"
"\n"
"Chief, I'm sorry, but your friend is gone. I think that I know what we're dealin' with, here."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​不​这么​认为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​头儿​，​很​抱歉​，​但​你​的​朋友​已经​不​在​了​。​我​觉得​我​知道​我们​现在​面对​的​是​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，hen3 bao4qian4，dan4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 yi3jing1 bu4 zai4 le5。wo3 jue2de5 wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 xian4zai4 mian4dui4 de5 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"No. I don't think so.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her frown turns into a snarl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What'll gnaw at me is knowing that this bitch is still alive. Still *hurting* innocent kids. Still too blind to see Harrow for what he really is."
msgstr ""
"我​不​这么​认为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​皱起​的​眉头​化作​一声​怒吼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​不得​安宁​的​是​这个​贱人​还活​在​世上​，​还​在​*​伤害​*​无辜​的​孩子​，​还​对​哈罗​的​本性​视而不见​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 de5 mei2tou2 hua4zuo4 yi1sheng1 nu4hou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 bu4de2 an1ning2 de5 shi4 zhe4ge5 jian4ren2 hai2 huo2 zai4 shi4shang4，hai2 zai4*shang1hai4*wu2gu1 de5 hai2zi5，hai2 dui4 ha1luo2 de5 ben3xing4 shi4er2bu4jian4。"

msgid ""
"No. I don't think so.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She raises an arm, and you feel a burst of warmth and comfort in your chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It wants redemption, just like I do. And together, we will find it."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​不​这么​认为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​抬起​手臂​，​你​胸口​顿时​涌起​一阵​温暖​与​慰藉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​想要​得到​救赎​，​就​像​我​一样​。​或许​，​我们​将​携手​找到​答案​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2qi3 shou3bi4，ni3 xiong1kou3 dun4shi2 yong3qi3 yi1zhen4 wen1nuan3 yu4 wei4jie4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang3yao4 de2dao4 jiu4shu2，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4。huo4xu3，wo3men5 jiang1 xie2shou3 zhao3dao4 da2an4。"

msgid "No. I guess not."
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。"

msgid "No. I imagine that I don't."
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"No. I lost a niece today. But I'm doing a whole hell of a lot better than our attackers are.\n"
"\n"
"Those sons of bitches hit the wrong kiez."
msgstr ""
"不好​。​我​今天​失去​了​一位​侄女​。​但​那些​袭击者​要​比​我们​惨多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那群狗​娘养​的​选错​了​袭击​的​对象​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4hao3。wo3 jin1tian1 shi1qu4 le5 yi1 wei4 zhi2nu:3。dan4 na4xie1 xi2ji1zhe3 yao4 bi3 wo3men5 can3 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"na4 qun2 gou3 niang2 yang3 de5 xuan3 cuo4 le5 xi2ji1 de5 dui4xiang4。"

msgid "No. I mean stay sharp, stay calm, and stay alive."
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​的​意思​是​保持​机警​，​保持​冷静​，​以及​保住​性命​。\n"
"bu4。wo3 de5 yi4si5 shi4 bao3chi2 ji1jing3，bao3chi2 leng3jing4，yi3ji2 bao3zhu4 xing4ming4。"

msgid ""
"No. I offered, but she wouldn't come. She still thinks of cities as places that she needs to save people from.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know where she's going to wind up. I don't even think that she does. But when she gets there, she'll reach out to me... that much, she promised."
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​提过​，​但​她​不肯​来​。​她​仍然​觉得​城市​里​的​人们​都​还​亟待​她​的​拯救​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​她​最终​会​去​哪里​。​我​想​她​自己​也​不​清楚​。​但​当​她​抵达​那里​时​，​她​会​联系​我​……​至少​这点​，​她​承诺​过​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。wo3 ti2 guo4，dan4 ta1 bu4 ken3 lai2。ta1 reng2ran2 jue2de5 cheng2shi4 li3 de5 ren2men5 dou1 hai2 ji2dai4 ta1 de5 zheng3jiu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 zui4zhong1 hui4 qu4 na3li3。wo3 xiang3 ta1 zi4ji3 ye3 bu4 qing1chu5。dan4 dang1 ta1 di3da2 na4li5 shi2，ta1 hui4 lian2xi4 wo3……zhi4shao3 zhe4 dian3，ta1 cheng2nuo4 guo4。"

msgid "No. I suppose not."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​确实​。\n"
"en1，que4shi2。"

msgid "No. I would have noticed that."
msgstr ""
"没有​，​否则​我会​注意​到​的​。\n"
"mei2you3，fou3ze2 wo3 hui4 zhu4yi4 dao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"No. I wouldn't abandon Glory an' Eiger like that. I don't cut and run.\n"
"\n"
"But after this thing is done... after those two are out of danger... I'm out."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​不会​就​这么​丢下​格洛丽​和​艾格尔​一走了之​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​等到​一切​结束​……​确保​她俩​安全​之后​……​咱们​再也​不见​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 bu4hui4 jiu4 zhe4me5 diu1xia4 Ge2luo4li2 he4 Ai4ge2er3 yi1zou3liao3zhi1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 deng3dao4 yi1qie4 jie2shu4……que4bao3 ta1 lia3 an1quan2 zhi1hou4……zan2men5 zai4ye3 bu4jian4。"

msgid ""
"No. I'd say not.\n"
"\n"
"In fact, I don't think that you're here to join us at all. I think that you're a liar and a troll-lover, and that you've come here with hostile intent.\n"
"\n"
"And I think that makes you a special kind of fool."
msgstr ""
"不​，​你​当然​不是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​实际上​，​我​认为​你​根本​不是​来​投奔​我们​的​。​我​认为​你​就是​个​喜欢​搬弄是非​的​骗子​，​想带​着​敌意​来​挑拨​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真是​个​纯种​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，ni3 dang1ran2 bu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"shi2ji4shang4，wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 gen1ben3 bu4shi4 lai2 tou2ben4 wo3men5 de5。wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 jiu4shi4 ge4 xi3huan5 ban1nong4shi4fei1 de5 pian4zi5，xiang3 dai4 zhao2 di2yi4 lai2 tiao3bo1 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 chun2zhong3 sha3gua1。"

msgid "No. I'm going in. My business is inside."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我要​进去​，​我​有事​要​处理​。\n"
"bu4，wo3 yao4 jin4qu4，wo3 you3shi4 yao4 chu3li3。"

msgid "No. I'm okay. Thank you."
msgstr ""
"没事​的​。​谢谢​你​。\n"
"mei2shi4 de5。xie4xie5 ni3。"

msgid "No. I'm sorry, but it isn't my place to tell you."
msgstr ""
"不行​。​我​很​抱歉​，​但​我​不能​擅自​讲​给​你​听​。\n"
"bu4xing2。wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，dan4 wo3 bu4neng2 shan4zi4 jiang3 gei3 ni3 ting1。"

msgid "No. I've made my decision."
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​已经​做​了​决定​。\n"
"bu4。wo3 yi3jing1 zuo4 le5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"No. If Meat Grinder wants it, he won't let go of it without a fight.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...And if we fight him for it, Grinder takes my thumbs off. Damn it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​如果​“​绞肉机​”​想要​它​的话​，​他​肯定​不会​轻易​把​它​让​出来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​如果​我们​动手​抢​的话​，​“​绞肉机​”​肯定​会​剁​了​我​的​拇指​。​该死​的​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。ru2guo3“jiao3rou4ji1” xiang3yao4 ta1 de5hua4，ta1 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 qing1yi4 ba3 ta1 rang4 chu1lai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ru2guo3 wo3men5 dong4shou3 qiang3 de5hua4，“jiao3rou4ji1” ken3ding4 hui4 duo4 le5 wo3 de5 mu3zhi3。gai1si3 de5。"

msgid ""
"No. If anything, the Awakening served to fan the fires of cruelty and xenophobia that have always been present in human society.\n"
"\n"
"Our differences are more obvious and profound now than they ever were. Is it any surprise that the reactions of extremists have followed suit?"
msgstr ""
"并​没有​。​倒不如说​，​“​大​觉醒​”​事件​反而​助长​了​人类​社会​中​始终​存在​的​残酷​与​仇外​心理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如今​我们​的​分歧​比​以往​任何​时候​都​更加​明显​而​深刻​。​极端分子​也​效仿​前人​做出​反应​，​这​又​有​什么​好​惊讶​的​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"bing4 mei2you3。dao3 bu4 ru2 shuo1，“dai4 jue2xing3” shi4jian4 fan3er2 zhu4zhang3 le5 ren2lei4 she4hui4 zhong4 shi3zhong1 cun2zai4 de5 can2ku4 yu4 chou2wai4 xin1li3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 wo3men5 de5 fen1qi2 bi3 yi3wang3 ren4he2 shi2hou5 dou1 geng4jia1 ming2xian3 er2 shen1ke4。ji2duan1fen4zi3 ye3 xiao4fang3 qian2ren2 zuo4chu1 fan3ying4，zhe4 you4 you3 shen2me5 hao3 jing1ya4 de5 ni2？"

msgid "No. It did not."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。"

msgid "No. It is not."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"No. It is not.\n"
"\n"
"Not so different at all."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毫无区别​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"hao2 wu2 qu1 bie4。"

msgid ""
"No. It isn't. But it doesn't change what we have to do... we're still going "
"to have to find Vauclair, however large the dragon's conspiracy."
msgstr ""
"的确​。​但​眼下​的​工作​不能​变​……​无论​那条​巨龙​的​阴谋​有​多么​庞大​，​我们​都​必须​找到​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"di2que4。dan4 yan3xia4 de5 gong1zuo4 bu4neng2 bian4……wu2lun4 na4 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 yin1mou2 you3 duo1me5 pang2da4，wo3men5 dou1 bi4xu1 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"No. It's not.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But from what I've heard, this was a power spike. So I guess that the overload could've scrambled something... gummed up the works somewhere upstream."
msgstr ""
"不​。​不​应该​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​眉头​紧蹙​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​从​我​听到​的​来看​，​这是​由于​电力​骤升​导致​的​。​所以​我​猜​过载​可能​扰乱​了​什么​东西​……​可能​有​什么​更​上游​的​设备​出​问题​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。bu4 ying1gai1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mei2tou2 jin3 cu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 cong2 wo3 ting1dao4 de5 lai2 kan4，zhe4 shi4 you2yu2 dian4li4 zhou4 sheng1 dao3zhi4 de5。suo3yi3 wo3 cai1 guo4zai4 ke3neng2 rao3luan4 le5 shen2me5 dong1xi1……ke3neng2 you3 shen2me5 geng1 shang4you2 de5 she4bei4 chu1 wen4ti2 le5。"

msgid ""
"No. It's too risky.\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry, but you're gonna have to find some other way of taking the Azzies down."
msgstr ""
"不​。​这太​冒险​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​抱歉​，​但​你​还是​另想办法​来​打击​阿兹佬​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。zhe4 tai4 mao4xian3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，dan4 ni3 hai2shi5 ling4 xiang3 ban4 fa3 lai2 da3ji1 e1 zi1 lao3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No. My father and his pack of jackals weren't up for that kind of trouble. They'd had more than enough of real combat when they were young men, back in the Euro-Wars.\n"
"\n"
"They just wanted to feel big and in control of their lives again, and it didn't matter to them who they hurt in the process.\n"
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​父亲​和​他​那群​狐朋狗友​可​不想​惹​这种​麻烦​。​他们​年轻​时​在​欧洲​战争​中​经历​的​真实​战斗​已经​够​多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​只是​想​重新​找回​那种​能够​掌控​自己​生活​的​强者​感受​，​至于​过程​中​伤害​了​谁​，​对​他们​来说​无所谓​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。wo3 fu4qin1 he4 ta1 na4 qun2 hu2peng2gou3you3 ke3 bu4xiang3 re3 zhe4zhong3 ma2fan5。ta1men5 nian2qing1 shi2 zai4 ou1zhou1 zhan4zheng1 zhong4 jing1li4 de5 zhen1shi2 zhan4dou4 yi3jing1 gou4 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zhi3shi4 xiang3 chong2xin1 zhao3hui2 na4zhong3 neng2gou4 zhang3kong4 zi4ji3 sheng1huo2 de5 jiang4 zhe3 gan3shou4，zhi4yu2 guo4cheng2 zhong4 shang1hai4 le5 shei2，dui4 ta1men5 lai2 shuo1 wu2suo3wei4。"

msgid "No. No difficulties. It was as easy as you said it would be."
msgstr ""
"没什么​难​的​。​完全​和​你​说​的​一样​简单​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 nan2 de5。wan2quan2 he4 ni3 shuo1 de5 yi1yang4 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"No. No way.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head firmly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mr. Grinder wouldn't do a thing like that. Not to me."
msgstr ""
"不​，​这​不​可能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​坚定​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​绞肉机​”​先生​不​可能​对​我​做​这样​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，zhe4 bu4 ke3neng2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jian1ding4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 bu4 ke3neng2 dui4 wo3 zuo4 zhe4yang4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"No. No way. That would be financial suicide.\n"
"\n"
"Mr. Grinder is good at intimidating people and breaking kneecaps. When it comes to keeping the business running, I'm the man that he turns to. Have been for a dozen years."
msgstr ""
"这​不​可能​。​这样​做​简直​是​自寻死路​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​绞肉机​”​先生​擅长​恐吓​他人​和​打断​膝盖骨​。​但​说​到​维持​公司​运转​，​他​最​倚重​的​人​就是​我​。​我们​合作​已经​十几年​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4 ke3neng2。zhe4yang4 zuo4 jian3zhi2 shi4 zi4xun2si3lu4。\n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 shan4chang2 kong3he4 ta1ren2 he4 da3duan4 xi1gai4gu3。dan4 shuo1 dao4 wei2chi2 gong1si1 yun4zhuan3，ta1 zui4 yi3zhong4 de5 ren2 jiu4shi4 wo3。wo3men5 he2zuo4 yi3jing1 shi2 ji1 nian2 le5。"

msgid ""
"No. No, he won't. I've seen lots of Humanis guys who've been here for YEARS.\n"
"\n"
"And if you really gave a damn, YOU'D have BEEN THERE for me when I NEEDED YOU!"
msgstr ""
"不​，​不​！​他​不会​！​我见​过​很多​在​这​住​了​好几年​的​组织​成员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​如果​你​真的​在乎​，​在​我​需要​你​的​时候​，​你​就​该​陪​在​我​身边​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4，bu4！ta1 bu4hui4！wo3 jian4 guo4 hen3 duo1 zai4 zhe4 zhu4 le5 hao3ji3nian2 de5 zu3zhi1 cheng2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 zai4hu5，zai4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 jiu4 gai1 pei2 zai4 wo3 shen1bian1！"

msgid ""
"No. No, he's not.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. In the end, it doesn't matter. Mr. Grinder will get paid, and Plotz is gonna write the check."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​话说回来​，​怎样​都​无所谓​了​。​“​绞肉机​”​先生​会​拿到​钱款​，​而​写​支票​的​人​是​普​洛茨​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，zen3yang4 dou1 wu2suo3wei4 le5。“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 hui4 na2dao4 qian2 kuan3，er2 xie3 zhi1piao4 de5 ren2 shi4 Pu3luo4ci2。"

msgid ""
"No. No, it did not.\n"
"\n"
"As it turns out, she didn't need to be rescued. At least, not before I showed up."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​事实证明​，​她​并不需要​救援​。​至少​在​我​出现​之前​。\n"
"\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2 zheng4 ming2，ta1 bing4 bu4 xu1 yao4 jiu4yuan2。zhi4shao3 zai4 wo3 chu1xian4 zhi1qian2。"

msgid ""
"No. No, it doesn't.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks at you, and her eyes are dark. When she speaks again, her voice is quiet but steady.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're going to see some terrible things in this place, $(l.name). Feuerstelle exists to prey on the young, and we're going to have to come face to face with that.\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure that you're prepared for this?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​当然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​凝视着​你​，​目光​暗沉​。​当​她​再次​开口​时​，​声音​平静​却​坚定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​将​在​这里​目睹​可怕​的​景象​，​$(l.name)​。​“​火坑​”​就是​以​年轻人​为​猎物​而​存在​的​，​而​我们​必须​直面​这个​残酷​现实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​确定​准备​好​面对​这​一切​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"en1。dang1ran2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3，mu4guang1 an4 chen2。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 ping2jing4 que4 jian1ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 zai4 zhe4li3 mu4du3 ke3pa4 de5 jing3xiang4，$(l.name)。“huo3keng1” jiu4shi4 yi3 nian2qing1ren2 wei2 lie4wu4 er2 cun2zai4 de5，er2 wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhi2mian4 zhe4ge5 can2ku4 xian4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 zhun3bei4 hao3 mian4dui4 zhe4 yi1qie4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"No. No, man, I don't think so.\n"
"\n"
"You go away, before they catch you here."
msgstr ""
"不​不​，​我​不​这么​认为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还是​趁​没​被​他们​逮到​之前​快​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 bu4，wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2shi5 chen4 mei2 bei4 ta1men5 dai3 dao4 zhi1qian2 kuai4 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No. Not after what just happened here.\n"
"\n"
"Not today."
msgstr ""
"没有​。​毕竟​经历​了​刚才​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今天​没有​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3。bi4jing4 jing1li4 le5 gang1cai2 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"jin1tian1 mei2you3。"

msgid "No. Not me."
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​不会​这么​做​。\n"
"bu4。wo3 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"No. Not this, precisely. But when I rolled the dice with Panacea, I knew that there were risks.\n"
"\n"
"I must be prepared to accept the consequences. To own them. And so I do."
msgstr ""
"不​。​并非如此​。​但​当初​我​决定​用​“​万能​药​”​赌​一把​时​，​我​就​明白​其中​风险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​做好​承受​后果​的​准备​。​承担​后果​。​而​事实​也​确实​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。dan4 dang1chu1 wo3 jue2ding4 yong4“wan4neng2 yao4” du3 yi1 ba3 shi2，wo3 jiu4 ming2bai5 qi2zhong1 feng1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 zuo4 hao3 cheng2shou4 hou4guo3 de5 zhun3bei4。cheng2dan1 hou4guo3。er2 shi4shi2 ye3 que4shi2 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"No. Of course not.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure that he'd eventually spill the name we're looking for. But it'd be buried in so much white noise that it'd be impossible to filter out."
msgstr ""
"当然​不​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​最后​肯定​会​说出​我们​要​的​名字​。​但​在此之前​的​干扰​项太多​，​根本​无从​分辨​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 zui4hou4 ken3ding4 hui4 shuo1chu1 wo3men5 yao4 de5 ming2zi5。dan4 zai4ci3zhi1qian2 de5 gan1rao3 xiang4 tai4 duo1，gen1ben3 wu2cong2 fen1bian4。"

msgid "No. Of course not. EVERYONE knows that you killed the Firewing."
msgstr ""
"当然​没有​。​谁​都​知道​是​你​杀掉​了​火翼​。\n"
"dang1ran2 mei2you3。shei2 dou1 zhi1dao4 shi4 ni3 sha1diao4 le5 Huo3yi4。"

msgid "No. Of course not. We just want to talk... we're old friends."
msgstr ""
"不​，​当然​不会​。​我们​只是​想​谈谈​……​我们​可是​老朋友​。\n"
"bu4，dang1ran2 bu4hui4。wo3men5 zhi3shi4 xiang3 tan2tan2……wo3men5 ke3shi4 lao3peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"No. Of course you don't.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She fidgets in agitation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I understand your interest in learning more about this, $(l.name). But we're wasting time, and we *need* that key.\n"
"\n"
"If Harrow gets back here before we've dealt with that shrine, we're fucked. "
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​焦躁​不安​地​扭动​身体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​我​明白​你​想​了解​更​多​，​但​我们​在​浪费时间​，​而​我们​*​必须​*​拿到​那​把​钥匙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​哈罗​在​我们​解决​神龛​前​赶回来​，​我们​就​完蛋​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiao1zao4 bu4an1 de5 niu3 dong4 shen1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 xiang3 liao3jie3 geng1 duo1，dan4 wo3men5 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1，er2 wo3men5*bi4xu1*na2dao4 na4 ba3 yao4shi5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ha1luo2 zai4 wo3men5 jie3jue2 shen2kan1 qian2 gan3 hui2 lai2，wo3men5 jiu4 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No. Of course you won't. Admitting fault might undermine the hero myth that "
"you've built up around yourself."
msgstr ""
"当然​了​。​如果​你​承认错误​的话​，​你​围绕​自己​构建​的​英雄​神话​就​会​随之​崩塌​。\n"
"dang1ran2 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 cheng2 ren4 cuo4 wu4 de5hua4，ni3 wei2rao4 zi4ji3 gou4jian4 de5 ying1xiong2 shen2hua4 jiu4 hui4 sui2zhi1 beng1ta1。"

msgid "No. She set up the whole thing herself."
msgstr ""
"没有​。​是​她​自己​安排​的​整件事​。\n"
"mei2you3。shi4 ta1 zi4ji3 an1pai2 de5 zheng3 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"No. She's gone, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Without a trace."
msgstr ""
"不​。​她​不见​了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这样​消失​得​无影无踪​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。ta1 bu4jian4 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4yang4 xiao1shi1 de2 wu2ying3wu2zong1。"

msgid ""
"No. That dragon was insane and needed to be controlled. And APEX is far more"
" than a simple computer game."
msgstr ""
"那条​龙​疯​了​，​必须​加以​管控​。​另外​APEX​可​不仅仅​是​简单​的​电脑游戏​。\n"
"na4 tiao2 long2 feng1 le5，bi4xu1 jia1yi3 guan3kong4。ling4wai4 APEX ke3 bu4jin3jin3 shi4 jian3dan1 de5 dian4 nao3 you2 xi4。"

msgid ""
"No. The cold hasn’t won. Don’t forget the elves. They still tend the green. "
msgstr ""
"不​。​寒冷​没有​赢​。​不要​忘记​精灵​。​他们​还​在​照看​绿色​。\n"
"bu4。han2leng3 mei2you3 ying2。bu4yao4 wang4ji4 jing1ling2。ta1men5 hai2 zai4 zhao4kan4 lu:4se4。"

msgid ""
"No. There are more important things to do than argue about this.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure that $(l.hisher) heart is in the right place."
msgstr ""
"不​。​现在​有​比​在​这里​争论​更加​重要​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​确定​$(l.he)​有着​一颗​好心​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4。xian4zai4 you3 bi3 zai4 zhe4li3 zheng1lun4 geng4jia1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 que4ding4 $(l.he) you3zhe5 yi1 ke1 hao3xin1。"

msgid ""
"No. There just isn't much reliable information out there.\n"
"\n"
"Whoever these guys are, they're very good at information control. None of my contacts could find anything but rumor and conjecture, and most of that is too crazy to even consider."
msgstr ""
"没​，​外界​根本​找​不到​多少​可靠​的​信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​那些​家伙​到底​是​什么​人​，​他们​在​信息​管控​方面​做​得​相当​出色​。​我​的​线​人能​找到​的​也​只有​传闻​和​猜测​，​而​其中​绝大部分​内容​都​荒谬​到​根本​不​值得​考虑​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2，wai4jie4 gen1ben3 zhao3 bu4dao4 duo1shao3 ke3kao4 de5 xin4xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 na4xie1 jia1huo5 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 ren2，ta1men5 zai4 xin4xi1 guan3kong4 fang1mian4 zuo4 de2 xiang1dang1 chu1se4。wo3 de5 xian4 ren2 neng2 zhao3dao4 de5 ye3 zhi3you3 chuan2wen2 he4 cai1ce4，er2 qi2zhong1 jue2da4bu4fen5 nei4rong2 dou1 huang1miu4 dao4 gen1ben3 bu4 zhi2de5 kao3lu:4。"

msgid ""
"No. There's nothing we can do - the building is too heavily compromised.\n"
"\n"
"Any second now, it'll come down on the heads of anyone who's still unlucky enough to be inside."
msgstr ""
"不行​。​我们​对此​无能为力​—​—​这座​建筑​的​受损​情况​太​严重​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​现在​随时​都​可能​坍塌​，​让​待​在​里面​的​倒霉蛋​陪葬​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2。wo3men5 dui4 ci3 wu2neng2wei2li4——zhe4 zuo4 jian4zhu4 de5 shou4sun3 qing2kuang4 tai4 yan2zhong4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xian4zai4 sui2shi2 dou1 ke3neng2 tan1ta1，rang4 dai1 zai4 li3mian4 de5 dao3mei2dan4 pei2zang4。"

msgid ""
"No. Truth be told, I was in surgery when the attackers hit, and they never disturbed my office.\n"
"\n"
"I spent the entire sorry event elbows-deep in the abdomen of an elderly dwarf. His nephretic screen needed a tune-up."
msgstr ""
"没有​。​袭击者​来​的​时候​我​正在​做手术​，​他们​没​来​打扰​我​的​办公室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​一个​老矮人​的​腹腔​里​鼓捣​了​整整​一个​小时​。​他​的​肾镜​需要​好好​保养​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3。xi2ji1zhe3 lai2 de5 shi2hou5 wo3 zheng4zai4 zuo4 shou3 shu4，ta1men5 mei2 lai2 da3rao3 wo3 de5 ban4gong1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 yi1ge5 lao3 ai3 ren2 de5 fu4qiang1 li3 gu3dao5 le5 zheng3zheng3 yi1ge5 xiao3shi2。ta1 de5 shen4 jing4 xu1yao4 hao3hao3 bao3yang3 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"No. We can't.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Tears stream down her cheeks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're dead. All of us."
msgstr ""
"不行​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​泪珠​从​她​的​脸颊​滑落​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​所有人​都​死定了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lei4zhu1 cong2 ta1 de5 lian3jia2 hua2luo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No. We don't.\n"
"\n"
"I think that it's likely, but we don't know for sure."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我们​不​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​很​有​可能​是​这样​，​但​我们​无法​确定​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3men5 bu4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 hen3 you3 ke3neng2 shi4 zhe4yang4，dan4 wo3men5 wu2fa3 que4ding4。"

msgid "No. Wiping out an entire species is wrong."
msgstr ""
"不会​。​物种​灭绝​是​错误​的​。\n"
"bu4hui4。wu4zhong3 mie4jue2 shi4 cuo4wu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"No. You can't.\n"
"\n"
"There's nothing you could give us that would make up for what you're talking about doing. So please, just drop it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"不​，​你​做​不到​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​你​要​给​什么​补偿​，​都​不能​弥补​你​接下来​打算​做​的​事情​。​所以​求求​你​，​就​放弃​吧​，​好​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4，ni3 zuo4 bu4dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 yao4 gei3 shen2me5 bu3chang2，dou1 bu4neng2 mi2bu3 ni3 jie1xia4lai2 da3suan4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5。suo3yi3 qiu2 qiu2 ni3，jiu4 fang4qi4 ba1，hao3 ma5？"

msgid "No. You're just being stubborn, Glory. You *need* me by your side."
msgstr ""
"不​，​格洛丽​，​你​是​在​固执己见​，​你​*​需要​*​我​在​你​身边​。\n"
"bu4，Ge2luo4li2，ni3 shi4 zai4 gu4zhi2ji3jian4，ni3*xu1yao4*wo3 zai4 ni3 shen1bian1。"

msgid ""
"No. You're wrong! You have to be!\n"
"\n"
"Danni *can't* be dead! "
msgstr ""
"不​。​你​搞错​了​！​你​肯定​是​搞错​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​丹妮​*​不​可能​*​死​了​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4。ni3 gao3cuo4 le5！ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 gao3cuo4 le5！\n"
"\n"
"dan1 ni1*bu4 ke3neng2*si3 le5！"

msgid ""
"No... I don't think so, friend. But I thank you for the gesture.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The man squints at you. He looks thoughtful.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"唉​……​恐怕​没什么​。​但​还是​谢谢​你​的​好意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​男人​眯起​眼睛​，​若有所思​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ai1……kong3pa4 mei2shen2me5。dan4 hai2shi5 xie4xie5 ni3 de5 hao3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nan2ren2 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5，ruo4you3suo3si1 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "No... I don't think so. But I do have a new lead."
msgstr ""
"不​……​我​不​这么​想​。​但​我​确实​有​了​新​线索​。\n"
"bu4……wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 xiang3。dan4 wo3 que4shi2 you3 le5 xin1 xian4suo3。"

msgid ""
"No... I don't think so. I'm not comfortable accepting any more of your "
"\"help.\""
msgstr ""
"我​看​还是​算了​。​我​不想​再​接受​你​的​任何​“​帮助​”​了​。\n"
"wo3 kan4 hai2shi5 suan4le5。wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 jie1shou4 ni3 de5 ren4he2“bang1zhu4” le5。"

msgid ""
"No... no, this is better.\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that I must thank you."
msgstr ""
"不​……​不​，​这样​就​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​我​是​该​谢谢​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4……bu4，zhe4yang4 jiu4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 shi4 gai1 xie4xie5 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"No... no, we didn't.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know, you might be right. It could be nothing."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​确实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​，​也许​你​是​对​的​。​可能​是​我​多虑​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……que4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。ke3neng2 shi4 wo3 duo1lu:4 le5。"

msgid ""
"No... no. The price I'm quoting you is *more* than fair. Well below market "
"value, in fact. If you can't pay it, that's your problem."
msgstr ""
"不​……​不​。​我​给​你​报​的​价比​市场价​还​公道​，​甚至​可以​说​远远​低于​市场价​。​如果​你付​不起​，​那​是​你​的​问题​。\n"
"bu4……bu4。wo3 gei3 ni3 bao4 de5 jia4 bi3 shi4chang3jia4 hai2 gong1dao4，shen4zhi4 ke3yi3 shuo1 yuan3yuan3 di1yu2 shi4chang3jia4。ru2guo3 ni3 fu4 bu4 qi3，na4 shi4 ni3 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"No... please. *Listen* to me!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ghoul takes another faltering step toward you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Krieger strain takes a heavier toll on some of us than others. Many of my kin have been driven mad by the virus, but *I* am still sane!"
msgstr ""
"不​，​求​你​*​听​*​我​说​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​食尸​鬼​又​朝​你​蹒跚​走​了​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​克里​格​菌株​对​我们​中​的​一部分​伤害​极大​。​我​的​许多​族裔​都​被​病毒​逼​疯​了​，​但​*​我​*​还​很​清醒​！\n"
"\n"
"bu4，qiu2 ni3*ting1*wo3 shuo1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi2 shi1 gui3 you4 chao2 ni3 pan2shan1 zou3 le5 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke4 li3 ge2 jun1 zhu1 dui4 wo3men5 zhong4 de5 yi1bu4fen5 shang1hai4 ji2da4。wo3 de5 xu3duo1 zu2yi4 dou1 bei4 bing4du2 bi1 feng1 le5，dan4*wo3*hai2 hen3 qing1xing3！"

msgid ""
"No... we keep security pretty tight around here. If a gang like that was running stuff through here, we'd know about it.\n"
"\n"
"Now look, we don't want any trouble around here. On second thought, maybe you should just move along and catch the next train back."
msgstr ""
"没有​……​我们​这里​的​安保​很​严格​。​如果​有​这种​为非作歹​的​人​存在​，​我们​肯定​会​知道​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​我们​不想​在​这里​惹麻烦​。​我​想​了​想​，​也许​你​还是​搭下​一班​火车​回去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3……wo3men5 zhe4li3 de5 an1bao3 hen3 yan2ge2。ru2guo3 you3 zhe4zhong3 wei2fei1zuo4dai3 de5 ren2 cun2zai4，wo3men5 ken3ding4 hui4 zhi1dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3men5 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4li3 re3ma2fan5。wo3 xiang3 le5 xiang3，ye3xu3 ni3 hai2shi5 da1 xia4 yi1 ban1 huo3che1 hui2qu5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"No... we keep security pretty tight around here. If a gang like that was running stuff through here, we'd know about it.\n"
"\n"
"Now look, we don't want any trouble. Why don't you just move along and catch the next train back?"
msgstr ""
"没有​……​我们​这里​的​安保​很​严格​。​如果​有​这种​为非作歹​的​人​存在​，​我们​肯定​会​知道​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​我们​不想​在​这里​惹麻烦​。​要​不​你​还是​搭下​一班​火车​回去​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3……wo3men5 zhe4li3 de5 an1bao3 hen3 yan2ge2。ru2guo3 you3 zhe4zhong3 wei2fei1zuo4dai3 de5 ren2 cun2zai4，wo3men5 ken3ding4 hui4 zhi1dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3men5 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4li3 re3ma2fan5。yao4 bu4 ni3 hai2shi5 da1 xia4 yi1 ban1 huo3che1 hui2qu5 ba1？"

msgid "No... why? Is that where we're going to make dinner?"
msgstr ""
"没有​……​怎么​了​？​我们​要​在​那里​做​晚餐​吗​？\n"
"mei2you3……zen3me5 le5？wo3men5 yao4 zai4 na4li5 zuo4 wan3can1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"No? Alice was frightened. Green Winters blubbered and begged.\n"
"\n"
"And in those last, fleeting nanoseconds before I cored out her mind, Monika was terrified.\n"
"\n"
"If you're not frightened, ace, you should be."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​爱丽丝​魂不附体​。​格林​·​温特斯​啜泣​着​哀求​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​在​我​掏空​莫妮卡​大脑​前​的​最后​几​纳秒​里​，​她​也​惊恐万分​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一点​小​建议​，​王牌​。​你​应该​害怕​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？ai4li4si1 hun2bu4fu4ti3。ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 chuo4qi4 zhao2 ai1qiu2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zai4 wo3 tao1kong1 Mo4ni1ka3 da4nao3 qian2 de5 zui4hou4 ji1 na4miao3 li3，ta1 ye3 jing1 kong3 wan4 fen4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dian3 xiao3 jian4yi4，wang2pai2。ni3 ying1gai1 hai4pa4。"

msgid ""
"No? I would. Compared to most of Berlin, the Kreuzbasar is about as quaint as it gets. Hell, it's verging on bucolic with all of the hand-holding and the rooftop gardens.\n"
"\n"
"You've found yourself a lovely, picturesque little corner of Berlin, $(l.name). Guess I have to give your old boss some credit for that."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​行​吧​。​与​柏林​的​大部分​地区​相比​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​已经​算是​很​古朴​了​。​到处​都​是​情侣​牵手​啊​，​屋顶花园​什么​的​，​简直​都​要​成​一派​田园诗​景象​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​柏林​找到​了​一个​风景如画​的​可爱​角落​，​$(l.name)​。​我​想​我​得​为​你​的​前​队长​点个​赞​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？xing2 ba1。yu4 bo2lin2 de5 da4bu4fen5 di4qu1 xiang1bi3，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 yi3jing1 suan4shi4 hen3 gu3pu3 le5。dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 qing2lu:3 qian1shou3 a1，wu1 ding3 hua1 yuan2 shen2me5 de5，jian3zhi2 dou1 yao4 cheng2 yi1 pai4 tian2 yuan2 shi1 jing3xiang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 bo2lin2 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1ge5 feng1 jing3 ru2 hua4 de5 ke3ai4 jiao3luo4，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang3 wo3 de2 wei2 ni3 de5 qian2 dui4zhang3 dian3 ge4 zan4。"

msgid ""
"Nobody \"did this to him,\" Eiger. Not anyone out here in meatspace, that is.\n"
"\n"
"I think... I think that this is what would've happened to Monika if we hadn't jacked her out in time."
msgstr ""
"没​人​“​对​他​下手​”​，​艾格尔​。​或者​这么​说​吧​，​在​现实​世界​里​，​没人朝​他​下过​手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​……​要是​我们​当初​没​来得及​把​莫妮卡​弹​出​，​她​也​会​变成​这个​样子​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2“dui4 ta1 xia4shou3”，Ai4ge2er3。huo4zhe3 zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，zai4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 li3，mei2 ren2 chao2 ta1 xia4 guo4 shou3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3……yao4shi5 wo3men5 dang1chu1 mei2 lai2de5ji2 ba3 Mo4ni1ka3 dan4 chu1，ta1 ye3 hui4 bian4cheng2 zhe4ge5 yang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"Nobody ever seemed to care. These were street kids, remember - they didn't have money, or influence, or families. Nobody was out looking for them.\n"
"\n"
"To be honest, I don't know if anyone ever noticed that they were gone."
msgstr ""
"似乎​也​从没​人​关心​过​。​别忘了​，​那些​都​是​街头​流浪儿​—​—​他们​没有​钱​，​没有​背景​，​也​没有​家人​。​根本​没人会​去​寻找​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​甚至​不​确定​是否​有人​注意​到​他们​消失​了​。\n"
"\n"
"si4hu1 ye3 cong2mei2 ren2 guan1xin1 guo4。bie4 wang4 le5，na4xie1 dou1 shi4 jie1tou2 liu2lang4er2——ta1men5 mei2you3 qian2，mei2you3 bei4jing3，ye3 mei2you3 jia1ren2。gen1ben3 mei2 ren2 hui4 qu4 xun2zhao3 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 que4ding4 shi4fou3 you3ren2 zhu4yi4 dao4 ta1men5 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid "Nobody important. Just passing through. Who are you?"
msgstr ""
"没什么​，​只是​路过​而已​。​你​是​谁​？\n"
"mei2shen2me5，zhi3shi4 lu4guo4 er2yi3。ni3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"Nobody's getting upstairs until I bypass the security locks on the elevator.\n"
"\n"
"That's why I decided to wait for you out here - I figured that they couldn't get themselves in too much trouble if I didn't come with them."
msgstr ""
"必须​由​我​来​搞定​电梯​的​安保​锁​，​否则​没人能​上楼去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我​才​决定​在​这里​等​你​—​—​我​觉得​就算​我​没​跟​过去​的话​，​他们​也​搞​不出​什么​麻烦​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 you2 wo3 lai2 gao3ding4 dian4ti1 de5 an1bao3 suo3，fou3ze2 mei2 ren2 neng2 shang4 lou2 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 cai2 jue2ding4 zai4 zhe4li3 deng3 ni3——wo3 jue2de5 jiu4suan4 wo3 mei2 gen1 guo4qu4 de5hua4，ta1men5 ye3 gao3 bu4 chu1 shen2me5 ma2fan5。"

msgid "Nobody's gonna kill you. I'm getting you out of there."
msgstr ""
"没人会​杀​你​。​我​这​就​把​你​弄出来​。\n"
"mei2 ren2 hui4 sha1 ni3。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 ba3 ni3 long4 chu1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Nobody, I suppose.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The blood mage smiles graciously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But then, I have never been a particularly trusting individual."
msgstr ""
"大概​也​没​谁​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​血​法师​露出​和蔼​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​话说回来​，​我​从来​就​不是​一个​特别​容易​轻信​他人​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ye3 mei2 shei2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xie3 fa3shi1 lu4chu1 he2ai3 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，wo3 cong2lai2 jiu4 bu4shi4 yi1ge5 te4bie2 rong2yi4 qing1xin4 ta1ren2 de5 ren2。"

msgid "None"
msgstr ""
"无\n"
"wu2"

msgid "None of *what?* I haven't *done* anything!"
msgstr ""
"你​指​的​是​*​什么​*​？​我​可​什么​都​没​*​做​*​！\n"
"ni3 zhi3 de5 shi4*shen2me5*？wo3 ke3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2*zuo4*！"

msgid ""
"None of that matters, Glory. Tracking Harrow down is what's important. He's "
"a monster, and he needs to pay for his crimes."
msgstr ""
"这些​都​不​重要​，​格洛丽​，​重要​的​是​找到​哈罗​。​他​是​个​禽兽​，​必须​为​罪行​付出代价​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 dou1 bu4 zhong4yao4，Ge2luo4li2，zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 zhao3dao4 ha1luo2。ta1 shi4 ge4 qin2shou4，bi4xu1 wei2 zui4xing2 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。"

msgid ""
"None of us are innocent, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"But if you need to salve your conscience, rest assured that at the hour of your approach, the only personnel authorized to be on site will be security and senior members of the research team. And I assure you... neither are innocent in this matter. If the Bloodline project reaches completion, nobody will be safe ever again."
msgstr ""
"没有​哪个​人​是​无辜​的​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​你​良心​上​过不去​的话​，​那​你​大​可​放心​。​在​你​抵达​之​时​，​现场​只会​有​安保​人员​和​研究​团队​的​高级​成员​。​我​向​你​保证​……​他们​在​这件​事上​同样​难辞其咎​。​如果​“​血脉​”​项目​最终​完成​，​世间​将​再​无​安全​可言​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 na3ge5 ren2 shi4 wu2gu1 de5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 liang2xin1 shang4 guo4bu5qu4 de5hua4，na4 ni3 dai4 ke3 fang4xin1。zai4 ni3 di3da2 zhi1 shi2，xian4chang3 zhi3 hui4 you3 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 he4 yan2jiu1 tuan2dui4 de5 gao1ji2 cheng2yuan2。wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4……ta1men5 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 tong2yang4 nan2ci2qi2jiu4。ru2guo3“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 zui4zhong1 wan2cheng2，shi4jian1 jiang1 zai4 wu2 an1quan2 ke3yan2。"

msgid ""
"None of us are, Glory. But Eiger's right... we can’t just go charging in "
"there again. Not without some kind of edge."
msgstr ""
"我们​没​打算​逃跑​，​格洛丽​。​但​艾格尔​说得对​……​我们​这次​不能​贸然​进攻​，​得​先​取得​各​方面​优势​才行​。\n"
"wo3men5 mei2 da3suan4 tao2pao3，Ge2luo4li2。dan4 Ai4ge2er3 shuo1 de2 dui4……wo3men5 zhe4 ci4 bu4neng2 mao4ran2 jin4gong1，de2 xian1 qu3de2 ge4 fang1mian4 you1shi4 cai2 xing2。"

msgid ""
"None of us do. But you need to be sure of what you're doing before you commit to this. \n"
"\n"
"Time is important. A great dragon wants us dead, and that is not a thing to take lightly. But you shouldn't return to the Rabbit Hole until you are prepared to *act.* If you have any doubts, then I'd urge you to wait."
msgstr ""
"大家​的​时间​都​很​紧​。​但​在​你​动身​之前​务必​考虑​清楚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​时间​至关重要​。​现在​有条​巨龙​要置​我们​于​死地​，​此事​绝不​可​掉以轻心​。​但​除非​你​做好​了​*​行动​*​准备​，​否则​切勿​返回​兔子​洞​。​如果​你​还​心存​犹豫​的话​，​那​我​建议​你​再​等等​。\n"
"\n"
"da4jia1 de5 shi2jian1 dou1 hen3 jin3。dan4 zai4 ni3 dong4shen1 zhi1qian2 wu4bi4 kao3lu:4 qing1chu5。\n"
"\n"
"shi2jian1 zhi4guan1zhong4yao4。xian4zai4 you3 tiao2 ju4long2 yao4 zhi4 wo3men5 yu2 si3 de5，ci3shi4 jue2bu4 ke3 diao4yi3qing1xin1。dan4 chu2fei1 ni3 zuo4 hao3 le5*xing2dong4*zhun3bei4，fou3ze2 qie4wu4 fan3hui2 tu4zi5 dong4。ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xin1 cun2 you2yu4 de5hua4，na4 wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 zai4 deng3deng3。"

msgid "None of your business, kid."
msgstr ""
"与​你​无关​，​孩子​。\n"
"yu4 ni3 wu2guan1，hai2zi5。"

msgid "None of your business."
msgstr ""
"与​你​无关​。\n"
"yu4 ni3 wu2guan1。"

msgid "None of your bussiness."
msgstr ""
"不关​你​的​事​。\n"
"bu4 guan1 ni3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"None.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not like you... you should probably know that."
msgstr ""
"没有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​不​一样​……​也许​该​让​你​知道​这件​事​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 bu4 yi1yang4……ye3xu3 gai1 rang4 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"None. Feuerschwinge massacred thousands, and a stranger on a train calls her"
" “fascinating.” Obviously, this is all beyond my comprehension."
msgstr ""
"我​不​指望​能​理解​。​火翼​的​杀戮​数以千计​，​现在​列车​上​的​某位​陌生人​却​称​她​“​令人​着迷​”​。​这​显然​超出​了​我​的​理解​范围​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi3wang4 neng2 li3jie3。Huo3yi4 de5 sha1lu4 shu4yi3qian1ji4，xian4zai4 lie4che1 shang4 de5 mou3 wei4 mo4sheng1ren2 que4 chen4 ta1“ling4ren2 zhao2mi2”。zhe4 xian3ran2 chao1chu1 le5 wo3 de5 li3jie3 fan4wei2。"

msgid ""
"Nonsense. Yes, I am APEX, but I'm not a monster. In fact, I intend to prove my trustworthiness... I have a proposal to offer you, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"A mutually beneficial arrangement."
msgstr ""
"胡说八道​。​是​的​，​我​是​APEX​，​但​我​不是​怪物​。​事实上​，​我​打算​证明​自己​值得​信任​……​我​有​个​提议​给​你​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​能​对​我们​双方​都​有​好处​。\n"
"\n"
"hu2shuo1ba1dao4。shi4 de5，wo3 shi4 APEX，dan4 wo3 bu4shi4 guai4wu5。shi4shi2shang4，wo3 da3suan4 zheng4ming2 zi4ji3 zhi2de5 xin4ren4……wo3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4 gei3 ni3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"neng2 dui4 wo3men5 shuang1fang1 dou1 you3 hao3chu3。"

msgid ""
"Nonsense. You are sealed tight in that laboratory, impotent to stop me."
msgstr ""
"胡说​。​你们​被​牢牢​封死​在​实验室​里​，​根本​无力​阻止​我​。\n"
"hu2shuo1。ni3men5 bei4 lao2lao2 feng1 si3 zai4 shi2yan4shi4 li3，gen1ben3 wu2li4 zu3zhi3 wo3。"

msgid "Nope! I'll talk to you later."
msgstr ""
"不​！​我们​回头​聊​。\n"
"bu4！wo3men5 hui2tou2 liao2。"

msgid "Nope."
msgstr ""
"不​。\n"
"bu4。"

msgid "Nope. But now we can catch 'em off guard."
msgstr ""
"我​没有​。​但​我们​可以​借机​偷袭​他们​。\n"
"wo3 mei2you3。dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 jie4ji1 tou1xi2 ta1men5。"

msgid "Nope. Didn't mean to bother you."
msgstr ""
"没事​了​。​抱歉​打扰​你​。\n"
"mei2shi4 le5。bao4qian4 da3rao3 ni3。"

msgid "Nope. Guess I'll check the place out."
msgstr ""
"没​。​我​还是​在​这里​转转​吧​。\n"
"mei2。wo3 hai2shi5 zai4 zhe4li3 zhuan4zhuan5 ba1。"

msgid "Nope. I don't like you, and I don't trust you."
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​不​喜欢​你​，​也​不​信任​你​。\n"
"bu4。wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3，ye3 bu4 xin4ren4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Nope. I don't need any bioware, and I've got more important things to do "
"anyway."
msgstr ""
"不了​。​我​不​需要​生体​改造​，​而且​我​还有​其他​更​重要​的​事​。\n"
"bu4le5。wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4，er2qie3 wo3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Nope. I don't think they ever had it to begin with. But I guarantee you, "
"they'll think pretty hard before crossing smugglers again."
msgstr ""
"没有​。​我​觉得​他们​就​没​打算​给钱​。​但​我​向​你​保证​，​他们​肯定​不敢​再​随便​招惹​走私者​了​。\n"
"mei2you3。wo3 jue2de5 ta1men5 jiu4 mei2 da3suan4 gei3 qian2。dan4 wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，ta1men5 ken3ding4 bu4 gan3 zai4 sui2bian4 zhao1re3 zou3 si1 zhe3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Nope. I don't think they ever had it to begin with. But I guarantee you, "
"they'll think pretty hard before crossing you again."
msgstr ""
"没有​。​我​觉得​他们​就​没​打算​给钱​。​但​我​向​你​保证​，​他们​肯定​不敢​再​随便​招惹​你们​了​。\n"
"mei2you3。wo3 jue2de5 ta1men5 jiu4 mei2 da3suan4 gei3 qian2。dan4 wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，ta1men5 ken3ding4 bu4 gan3 zai4 sui2bian4 zhao1re3 ni3men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Nope. It's called der Weinkeller for a reason - the guy behind the bar is more like a bush-league sommelier than he is a proper bartender. Knows a bit about wine, but when it comes to mixing drinks, he's useless.\n"
"\n"
"If you want a drink, I'd recommend sticking to something simple. Try ordering something with more than two ingredients and you're asking for trouble."
msgstr ""
"不​太行​。​这家​店​叫​“​酒窖​”​是​有​原因​的​—​—​吧台​后面​的​那个​人​与其说是​个​合格​的​调酒师​，​倒不如说​就是​个​给​人​递酒​的​。​他​对​红酒​本身​略知一二​，​但​在​调酒​方面​就​不用​指望​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​喝酒​，​我​建议​越​简单​越​好​。​如果​你​点​了​两种​以上​基酒​，​那​别怪​我​没​提醒​你​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 tai4 xing2。zhe4 jia1 dian4 jiao4“jiu3jiao4” shi4 you3 yuan2yin1 de5——ba1tai2 hou4mian5 de5 na4ge5 ren2 yu4 qi2 shuo1 shi4 ge4 he2ge2 de5 tiao2jiu3shi1，dao3 bu4 ru2 shuo1 jiu4shi4 ge4 gei3 ren2 di4 jiu3 de5。ta1 dui4 hong2jiu3 ben3shen1 lu:e4zhi1yi1er4，dan4 zai4 tiao2jiu3 fang1mian4 jiu4 bu4yong4 zhi3wang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 he1jiu3，wo3 jian4yi4 yue4 jian3dan1 yue4 hao3。ru2guo3 ni3 dian3 le5 liang3 zhong3 yi3shang4 ji1 jiu3，na4 bie4 guai4 wo3 mei2 ti2xing3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Nope. My crew is in Mitte.\n"
"\n"
"There's lots of work out there if you can handle it, but life isn't as pleasant there as it is in the Kreuzbasar. "
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​的​关系​都​在​米​特区​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​那里​，​只要​你​想​接​，​差事​有的是​；​不过​那里​的​生活​就​没有​克洛伊​茨​集市​这么​惬意​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 de5 guan1xi5 dou1 zai4 mi3 te4qu1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4li5，zhi3yao4 ni3 xiang3 jie1，cha4shi4 you3de5shi4 ； bu4guo4 na4li5 de5 sheng1huo2 jiu4 mei2you3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhe4me5 qie4yi4 le5。"

msgid "Nope. Still in the dark over here."
msgstr ""
"不​。​我​依旧​蒙在鼓里​。\n"
"bu4。wo3 yi1jiu4 meng2zai4gu3li3。"

msgid ""
"Nope. That's it. Quarantine disengaged.\n"
"\n"
"And now to get Phil the last episode of his bullshit trid show."
msgstr ""
"不​，​已经​搞定​了​。​隔离​解除​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​得​帮​菲尔​搞​到​他​那​狗屁​3D​影像​剧集​的​最后​一集​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，yi3jing1 gao3ding4 le5。ge2li2 jie3chu2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 de2 bang1 fei1 er3 gao3 dao4 ta1 na4 gou3pi4 3D ying3xiang4 ju4ji2 de5 zui4hou4 yi1 ji2。"

msgid ""
"Nope. That's it. Quarantine disengaged.\n"
"\n"
"And now to get Phil the last episode of his bullshit trid show..."
msgstr ""
"不​，​已经​搞定​了​。​隔离​解除​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​得​帮​菲尔​搞​到​他​那​狗屁​3D​影像​剧集​的​最后​一集​……\n"
"\n"
"bu4，yi3jing1 gao3ding4 le5。ge2li2 jie3chu2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 de2 bang1 fei1 er3 gao3 dao4 ta1 na4 gou3pi4 3D ying3xiang4 ju4ji2 de5 zui4hou4 yi1 ji2……"

msgid ""
"Nor am I convinced that this will be an improvement for the people of "
"Drogenkippe. Only time will tell."
msgstr ""
"我​也​不​认为​这​对​毒​坑区​的​居民​有​什么​好处​。​也许​时间​会​告诉​我们​答案​吧​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 ren4wei2 zhe4 dui4 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 ju1min2 you3 shen2me5 hao3chu3。ye3xu3 shi2jian1 hui4 gao4su4 wo3men5 da2an4 ba1。"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr ""
"普通\n"
"pu3tong1"

msgid "Normal type."
msgstr ""
"普通​版​。\n"
"pu3tong1 ban3。"

msgid "North Cell Door"
msgstr ""
"北侧​舱室​门\n"
"bei3ce4 cang1 shi4 men2"

msgid "North Cell Door Control"
msgstr ""
"北侧​舱室​门​控制\n"
"bei3ce4 cang1 shi4 men2 kong4zhi4"

msgid ""
"Not *exactly?* I didn't come here to get hunted by a dragon! I'm not even a "
"part of this!"
msgstr ""
"算是​？​我来​这里​不是​让​自己​被​巨龙​猎杀​的​！​这​跟​我​有​什么​关系​啊​！\n"
"suan4shi4？wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 bu4shi4 rang4 zi4ji3 bei4 ju4long2 lie4sha1 de5！zhe4 gen1 wo3 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5 a1！"

msgid "Not Enough AP"
msgstr ""
"行动​点​不足\n"
"xing2dong4 dian3 bu4zu2"

msgid "Not Enough Ammo"
msgstr ""
"弹药​不足\n"
"dan4yao4 bu4zu2"

msgid "Not a big deal, Sam. Do good with it."
msgstr ""
"小​事情​，​萨姆​。​好好​利用​它​吧​。\n"
"xiao3 shi4qing5，sa4 mu3。hao3hao3 li4yong4 ta1 ba1。"

msgid "Not a bit."
msgstr ""
"完全​没有​。\n"
"wan2quan2 mei2you3。"

msgid "Not a chance. Got to keep you people out of trouble."
msgstr ""
"怎么​会​。​我得​保着​你们​远离​麻烦​。\n"
"zen3me5 hui4。wo3 de2 bao3 zhao2 ni3men5 yuan3li2 ma2fan5。"

msgid "Not a ghoul, I'll tell you that much."
msgstr ""
"反正​不是​食尸​鬼​，​我​只能​告诉​你​这么​多​。\n"
"fan3zheng4 bu4shi4 shi2 shi1 gui3，wo3 zhi3neng2 gao4su4 ni3 zhe4me5 duo1。"

msgid "Not a lot. I don't pay much attention to politics."
msgstr ""
"没​多少​。​我​对​政治​不感兴趣​。\n"
"mei2 duo1shao3。wo3 dui4 zheng4zhi4 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Not a lot. The community was really poor so they were stealing from us."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​当地人​很穷​，​所以​偷​了​我们​的​东西​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。dang1 de5 ren2 hen3 qiong2，suo3yi3 tou1 le5 wo3men5 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Not a problem, my friend. Take care."
msgstr ""
"没事​，​朋友​。​保重​。\n"
"mei2shi4，peng2you5。bao3zhong4。"

msgid "Not a problem."
msgstr ""
"不​客气​。\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。"

msgid "Not a problem. Always happy to contribute to a good cause."
msgstr ""
"小事​。​我​很​乐意​为​公益事业​做出​贡献​。\n"
"xiao3shi4。wo3 hen3 le4yi4 wei2 gong1yi4shi4ye4 zuo4chu1 gong4xian4。"

msgid ""
"Not a smart move, Kleine. We have a job to do, and hauling a great big vase "
"around isn't part of it."
msgstr ""
"这​可不是​个​好​主意​，​小家伙​。​我们​是​来​干活​的​，​拖​着​一个​大​花瓶​到处跑​可不是​计划​的​一部分​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3bu5shi4 ge4 hao3 zhu3yi5，xiao3 jia1 huo3。wo3men5 shi4 lai2 gan4huo2 de5，tuo1 zhao2 yi1ge5 dai4 hua1ping2 dao4 chu3 pao2 ke3bu5shi4 ji4hua4 de5 yi1bu4fen5。"

msgid ""
"Not a smart move, Kleiner. We have a job to do, and hauling a great big vase"
" around isn't part of it."
msgstr ""
"这​可不是​个​好​主意​，​小家伙​。​我们​是​来​干活​的​，​拖​着​一个​大​花瓶​到处跑​可不是​计划​的​一部分​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3bu5shi4 ge4 hao3 zhu3yi5，xiao3 jia1 huo3。wo3men5 shi4 lai2 gan4huo2 de5，tuo1 zhao2 yi1ge5 dai4 hua1ping2 dao4 chu3 pao2 ke3bu5shi4 ji4hua4 de5 yi1bu4fen5。"

msgid "Not anymore, sweetheart."
msgstr ""
"不再​有​这种​好事​了​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"bu4zai4 you3 zhe4zhong3 hao3shi4 le5，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Not at all, pal.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He removes the weapon from its holster and passes it to you. It feels heavy in your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When I'm gettin' torn limb from limb, I'll probably regret that I didn't kill myself, too. But the hell with it - it isn't my way."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​伙计​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​从​枪套​中​抽出​武器​递给​你​。​它​在​你​手中​沉甸甸​的​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​被​撕成​碎片​时​，​我​大概​会​后悔​没有​早点​自杀​。​但​见鬼​去​吧​—​—​这​不​像是​我​的​作风​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，huo3ji5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 qiang1 tao4 zhong4 chou1chu1 wu3qi4 di4gei3 ni3。ta1 zai4 ni3 shou3 zhong4 chen2dian4dian4 de5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 bei4 si1 cheng2 sui4pian4 shi2，wo3 da4gai4 hui4 hou4hui3 mei2you3 zao3dian3 zi4sha1。dan4 jian4gui3 qu4 ba1——zhe4 bu4 xiang4 shi4 wo3 de5 zuo4feng1。"

msgid "Not at all. It was good to take in the night air."
msgstr ""
"轻松​搞定​。​呼吸​一下​夜晚​的​空气​也​不错​。\n"
"qing1song1 gao3ding4。hu1xi1 yi1xia4 ye4wan3 de5 kong1qi4 ye3 bu4cuo4。"

msgid "Not bad... not bad at all."
msgstr ""
"不错​……​相当​不错​。\n"
"bu4cuo4……xiang1dang1 bu4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Not by choice, Alex. I don't want a thing to do with that asshole.\n"
"\n"
"And I *didn't* know. Not until it was too late."
msgstr ""
"我​也​没有​办法​，​亚历山大​。​我​一点​也​不想​和​那个​混蛋​扯​上​关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​*​真的​*​不​知道​。​等​我​了解​到​这些​事​的​时候​，​已经​为时已晚​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 mei2you3 ban4fa3，ya4li4shan1da4。wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4xiang3 he4 na4ge5 hun2dan4 che3 shang4 guan1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3*zhen1de5*bu4 zhi1dao4。deng3 wo3 liao3jie3 dao4 zhe4xie1 shi4 de5 shi2hou5，yi3jing1 wei2shi2yi3wan3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Not directly, no. But we do need to place him under surveillance.\n"
"\n"
"You will meet with a team that I've arranged for you, and with their assistance, you will plant listening devices in his apartment."
msgstr ""
"并非​以​直接​方式​，​但​我们​确实​需要​了解​他​的​一举一动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​与​我​为​你​安排​的​小队​会合​，​在​他们​的​协助​下​，​你​将​在​他​的​公寓​内​安装​监控​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"bing4fei1 yi3 zhi2jie1 fang1shi4，dan4 wo3men5 que4shi2 xu1yao4 liao3jie3 ta1 de5 yi1ju3yi1dong4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 yu4 wo3 wei2 ni3 an1pai2 de5 xiao3 dui4 hui4he2，zai4 ta1men5 de5 xie2zhu4 xia4，ni3 jiang1 zai4 ta1 de5 gong1yu4 nei4 an1zhuang1 jian1kong4 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"Not easy. *Possible.* I wouldn't be giving it to you if the job could be done without it.\n"
"\n"
"The Engineer is rocking a delta-grade move-by-wire system. Unless you can shut it down, there's no way in hell you're going to catch him."
msgstr ""
"只是​*​有​可能​*​简单​些​。​如果​这​任务​很​好​做​的话​，​我​就​不​需要​把​它​交给​你们​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​工程师​配备​了​德尔塔​级别​的​跳线​回路​系统​。​除非​你们​能​将​其​关闭​，​否则​你们​绝对​不​可能​追上​他​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3shi4*you3 ke3neng2*jian3dan1 xie1。ru2guo3 zhe4 ren4wu5 hen3 hao3 zuo4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 bu4 xu1yao4 ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 ni3men5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 pei4bei4 le5 de2er3ta3 ji2bie2 de5 tiao4 xian4 hui2lu4 xi4tong3。chu2fei1 ni3men5 neng2 jiang1 qi2 guan1bi4，fou3ze2 ni3men5 jue2dui4 bu4 ke3neng2 zhui1shang4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Not exactly. It's more insidious than that.\n"
"\n"
"Think of the shrine's influence as a drug. It lowers your inhibitions, makes you compliant.\n"
"\n"
"If you were to stay here for a couple of days, you'd fall in love with this place, and you wouldn't even know why. All of Harrow's bullshit would start to make sense. You'd be happy."
msgstr ""
"不​完全​是​这样​。​它​的​本质​比​这​更​阴险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​把​神龛​的​影响​当作​某种​毒品​。​它会​降低​你​的​心理​防线​，​让​你​变得​顺从​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这里​住​上​几天​，​你​就​会​爱​上​这个​地方​，​甚至​不知​缘由​。​哈罗​的​所有​疯话​都​会​变得​合情合理​。​你​会​感到​无比​幸福​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 wan2quan2 shi4 zhe4yang4。ta1 de5 ben3zhi4 bi3 zhe4 geng1 yin1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 ba3 shen2kan1 de5 ying3xiang3 dang4zuo4 mou3zhong3 du2pin3。ta1 hui4 jiang4di1 ni3 de5 xin1li3 fang2xian4，rang4 ni3 bian4de5 shun4cong2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4li3 zhu4 shang4 ji3tian1，ni3 jiu4 hui4 ai4 shang4 zhe4ge5 di4fang1，shen4zhi4 bu4zhi1 yuan2you2。ha1luo2 de5 suo3you3 feng1hua4 dou1 hui4 bian4de5 he2qing2he2li3。ni3 hui4 gan3dao4 wu2bi3 xing4fu2。"

msgid "Not exactly. Just interested to see what you’re about."
msgstr ""
"没​啥​，​就是​看看​你​在​干什么​。\n"
"mei2 sha2，jiu4shi4 kan4kan5 ni3 zai4 gan4shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Not for a second. A syndicate  - *any* syndicate - in Schattennest would be a disaster for the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Let the people on the other side of the gate deal with their own problems. I won't allow my home to be endangered for their sake."
msgstr ""
"怎么​可能​。​只要​影巢​有​黑帮​存在​，​无论如何​都​会​对​克洛伊​茨​集市​产生​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​大门​另一边​的​人​自己​去​解决问题​吧​。​我​绝不会​为了​他们​而​让​我​的​家园​陷入​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 ke3neng2。zhi3yao4 ying3 chao2 you3 hei1bang1 cun2zai4，wu2lun4ru2he2 dou1 hui4 dui4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 chan3sheng1 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 da4men2 ling4 yi1 bian1 de5 ren2 zi4ji3 qu4 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2 ba1。wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 wei4le5 ta1men5 er2 rang4 wo3 de5 jia1yuan2 xian4ru4 wei1xian3。"

msgid ""
"Not for ourselves, but yes.\n"
"\n"
"We're here for our son."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​但​不是​给​我们​自己​买​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​是​来​给​儿子​买​的​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，dan4 bu4shi4 gei3 wo3men5 zi4ji3 mai3 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 lai2 gei3 er2zi5 mai3 de5。"

msgid "Not from where I'm standing."
msgstr ""
"我​并​不​这么​认为​。\n"
"wo3 bing4 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。"

msgid ""
"Not from you, I can't. Keep it to yourself unless you *want* me to treat you like a criminal.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He drops his hand to the grip of his sidearm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here's a hint: you don't."
msgstr ""
"你​的话​我​就​不能​接受​。​你​之后​最好​少​讲​笑话​。​否则​别怪​我​真​把​你​当作​罪犯​来​对待​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​伸手​去​摸​腰间​的​配枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给你个​提示​：​最好​别​让​这种​事​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5hua4 wo3 jiu4 bu4neng2 jie1shou4。ni3 zhi1hou4 zui4hao3 shao3 jiang3 xiao4hua5。fou3ze2 bie4 guai4 wo3 zhen1 ba3 ni3 dang4zuo4 zui4fan4 lai2 dui4dai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1shou3 qu4 mo1 yao1jian1 de5 pei4 qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3 ge4 ti2shi4：zui4hao3 bie4 rang4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Not gonna happen! \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She aims her rifle at you for emphasis.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"想都别想​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​步枪​瞄准​了​你​，​意思​不言而喻​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 dou1 bie4 xiang3！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 bu4qiang1 miao2zhun3 le5 ni3，yi4si5 bu4yan2er2yu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Not gonna happen, stranger. Give the money back, and my friend here doesn't have to raise his voice.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pats the barrel of his shotgun.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"想都别想​，​陌生人​。​把​钱​还​回来​，​否则​我​这​把​老伙计​可​就要​走火​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拍了拍​霰弹枪​的​枪管​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 dou1 bie4 xiang3，mo4sheng1ren2。ba3 qian2 hai2 hui2lai5，fou3ze2 wo3 zhe4 ba3 lao3 huo3 ji4 ke3 jiu4yao4 zou3huo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 le5 pai1 xian4dan4qiang1 de5 qiang1guan3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Not gonna lie, chief. This place is creeping me out."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​我​说实话​，​这​地方​让​我​毛骨悚然​。\n"
"tou2r5，wo3 shuo1shi2hua4，zhe4 di4fang1 rang4 wo3 mao2gu3song3ran2。"

msgid ""
"Not great. Struggling.\n"
"\n"
"About how you'd expect."
msgstr ""
"不怎么样​。​挺​煎熬​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​你​想​的​差不多​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4zen3me5yang4。ting3 jian1ao2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"he4 ni3 xiang3 de5 cha4bu5duo1。"

msgid "Not here in the Kreuzbasar, but in Berlin, yes. (h)"
msgstr ""
"还​没来​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​但​我们​已经​在​柏林​了​。\n"
"hai2 mei2 lai2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，dan4 wo3men5 yi3jing1 zai4 bo2lin2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Not here. Let's get him down to the garage first.\n"
"\n"
"I want to have the van close by in case anything goes wrong."
msgstr ""
"在​这​不行​。​咱们​先​把​他​带到​车库​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还是​想​在​货车​附近​弄​，​这样​万一出​了​岔子​也​方便​跑​路​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 bu4xing2。zan2men5 xian1 ba3 ta1 dai4 dao4 che1ku4 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 xiang3 zai4 huo4che1 fu4jin4 long4，zhe4yang4 wan4 yi1 chu1 le5 cha4zi5 ye3 fang1bian4 pao2 lu4。"

msgid "Not if I kill them first."
msgstr ""
"我​先​杀​了​他们​不​就​好​了​。\n"
"wo3 xian1 sha1 le5 ta1men5 bu4 jiu4 hao3 le5。"

msgid "Not if they know what's good for them."
msgstr ""
"如果​他们​识相​的话​就​应该​不会​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1men5 shi2xiang4 de5hua4 jiu4 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Not in the slightest. Since you've just moved here, I have some advice.\n"
"\n"
"If you haven't guessed already, he's got fingers in a lot of pies.\n"
"\n"
"I've seen what happens when he doesn't approve of someone or something."
msgstr ""
"你​可​说​对​了​。​既然​你​是​新来​的​，​我​就​给你个​建议​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​想必​你​也​能​猜​到​，​他​涉足​的​领域​非常​广泛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​他​对​某人​某事​持​否定​态度​的话​，​我见​过​后者​的​下场​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3 shuo1 dui4 le5。ji4ran2 ni3 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5，wo3 jiu4 gei3 ni3 ge4 jian4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3bi4 ni3 ye3 neng2 cai1 dao4，ta1 she4zu2 de5 ling3yu4 fei1chang2 guang3fan4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 dui4 mou3ren2 mou3shi4 chi2 fou3ding4 tai4du5 de5hua4，wo3 jian4 guo4 hou4zhe3 de5 xia4chang3。"

msgid "Not interested. Take your problems somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"不感兴趣​。​找​别人​去​吧​。\n"
"bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。zhao3 bie2ren5 qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Not interested. Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""
"我​不感兴趣​。​还是​谢​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。hai2shi5 xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Not just at the moment, friend. I'm still working on putting the money that you've already donated to goood use.\n"
"\n"
"Give us some time, and we will set a new goal. But for now, spend your nuyen on yourself... you deserve it."
msgstr ""
"现在​先​不必​了​，​朋友​。​我​还​在​努力​把​你​已经​捐出​的​钱​用​在​刀刃​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​我们​一些​时间​，​我们​会​设定​一个​新​的​目标​。​但​现在​，​还是​把​钱​花​在​自己​身上​吧​……​这​是​你​应得​的​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 xian1 bu4bi4 le5，peng2you5。wo3 hai2 zai4 nu3li4 ba3 ni3 yi3jing1 juan1 chu1 de5 qian2 yong4 zai4 dao1ren4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"gei3 wo3men5 yi1xie1 shi2jian1，wo3men5 hui4 she4ding4 yi1ge5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1。dan4 xian4zai4，hai2shi5 ba3 qian2 hua1 zai4 zi4ji3 shen1shang5 ba1……zhe4 shi4 ni3 ying1de2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Not just yet, Blitz. First, we need to have a chat about that whole \"Meat "
"Grinder\" fiasco."
msgstr ""
"还​没有​呢​，​布里​茨​。​首先​，​我们​得​聊聊​关于​“​绞肉机​”​的​这​整件​破事​。\n"
"hai2 mei2you3 ni2，Bu4li3ci2。shou3xian1，wo3men5 de2 liao2 liao2 guan1yu2“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 po4shi4。"

msgid "Not just yet. But as soon as I know, you'll know."
msgstr ""
"还​没​呢​。​但​一有​消息​，​我​就​会​告诉​你们​。\n"
"hai2 mei2 ni2。dan4 yi1 you3 xiao1xi5，wo3 jiu4 hui4 gao4su4 ni3men5。"

msgid ""
"Not just yet. There could be valuable intel in here, and we don't even know "
"how big this facility is. We should sweep the area for clues before pushing "
"forward."
msgstr ""
"先​别急​。​这里​可能​藏有​重要​情报​，​而​我们​甚至​不​知道​这座​设施​的​规模​有​多​大​。​我们​应该​先​在​这片​区域​搜寻​线索​，​再​继续​推进​。\n"
"xian1 bie4 ji2。zhe4li3 ke3neng2 zang4 you3 zhong4yao4 qing2bao4，er2 wo3men5 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 zuo4 she4shi1 de5 gui1mo2 you3 duo1 dai4。wo3men5 ying1gai1 xian1 zai4 zhe4 pian1 qu1yu4 sou1xun2 xian4suo3，zai4 ji4xu4 tui1jin4。"

msgid "Not just yet. There's something else that I want to say."
msgstr ""
"先​别急​着​赶​我​走​。​我​还有​别的​事​要说​。\n"
"xian1 bie4 ji2 zhao2 gan3 wo3 zou3。wo3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4shuo1。"

msgid "Not just yet. We need to talk about Monika."
msgstr ""
"先​别急​着​赶​我​走​。​我们​得​谈谈​莫妮卡​的​事​。\n"
"xian1 bie4 ji2 zhao2 gan3 wo3 zou3。wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Not just yet. You still owe me an apology. You had no right to call me out "
"like that in front of the team."
msgstr ""
"先​别急​着​赶​我​走​。​你​还​欠​我​一句​道歉​。​你​无权​在​全队​人​面前​那样​骂​我​。\n"
"xian1 bie4 ji2 zhao2 gan3 wo3 zou3。ni3 hai2 qian4 wo3 yi1ju4 dao4qian4。ni3 wu2quan2 zai4 quan2 dui4 ren2 mian4qian2 na4yang4 ma4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Not like your modern cyberware, that's for sure. But few better options at "
"the time."
msgstr ""
"肯定​不比​你们​现在​的​赛博​改造​，​但​那​时候​也​没得选​。\n"
"ken3ding4 bu4bi3 ni3men5 xian4zai4 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4，dan4 na4 shi2hou5 ye3 mei2 de2 xuan3。"

msgid "Not likely. Life of a runner to be on the move."
msgstr ""
"不​可能​。​狂奔​者​的​生活​就是​居无定所​。\n"
"bu4 ke3neng2。kuang2Ben1zhe3 de5 sheng1huo2 jiu4shi4 ju1wu2ding4suo3。"

msgid ""
"Not much.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"To be honest, I can't see much of anything. You'd think that a fancy building like this would come with better emergency lighting."
msgstr ""
"没什么​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​几乎​什么​都​看不见​。​没想到​这么​豪华​的​一栋​大楼​，​应急照明​设施​却​这么​差劲​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 ji1hu1 shen2me5 dou1 kan4bu5jian4。mei2xiang3dao4 zhe4me5 hao2hua2 de5 yi1 dong4 da4lou2，ying1 ji2 zhao4 ming2 she4shi1 que4 zhe4me5 cha4jin4。"

msgid "Not much. I'm still not sure why we're even having this conversation."
msgstr ""
"理解​得​不​多​。​我​到​现在​仍​不​明白​这场​谈话​的​意义​何在​。\n"
"li3jie3 de2 bu4 duo1。wo3 dao4 xian4zai4 reng2 bu4 ming2bai5 zhe4 chang2 tan2hua4 de5 yi4yi4 he2zai4。"

msgid ""
"Not my call, you understand. Thanks to this conversation, you've tripped so many alarms that my control subroutines will force me to kill you. \n"
"\n"
"Wherever you go, they'll make me track you down. Unless you wanna stay off of the Matrix for the rest of your life, you're gonna have to do this."
msgstr ""
"这​不由​我​决定​，​你​能​理解​吧​。​因为​这次​对话​，​你​触发​了​太​多​的​警报​，​我​的​控制​子程序​会​迫使​我​杀​了​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​你​去​哪里​，​它们​都​会​让​我​追踪​你​。​除非​你​打算​一辈子​远离​矩阵​，​否则​你​只能​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4you2 wo3 jue2ding4，ni3 neng2 li3jie3 ba1。yin1wei4 zhe4 ci4 dui4hua4，ni3 chu4fa1 le5 tai4 duo1 de5 jing3bao4，wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 zi3cheng2xu4 hui4 po4shi3 wo3 sha1 le5 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 qu4 na3li3，ta1men5 dou1 hui4 rang4 wo3 zhui1zong1 ni3。chu2fei1 ni3 da3suan4 yi1bei4zi5 yuan3li2 ju3zhen4，fou3ze2 ni3 zhi3neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Not necessarily. After all, rebellion can be a positive force if it is harnessed by the oppressed. If I wanted to topple an authoritarian regime, I could think of worse allies to have at my side.\n"
"\n"
"That said, trusting the Adversary would be a mistake. It is a treacherous idol, and all of its alliances are temporary."
msgstr ""
"未必​。​如果​在​受​压迫者​的​手中​，​叛逆​便​能​成为​一股​积极​力量​。​倘若​我​意图​推翻​专制​政权​，​它​绝对​算是​还​不错​的​盟友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​话虽如此​，​如果​你​信任​反叛者​，​那​就​大错特错​了​。​这个​精魂​导师​素以​奸诈​闻名​，​它​的​任何​同盟​关系​都​可能​转瞬即逝​。\n"
"\n"
"wei4bi4。ru2guo3 zai4 shou4 ya1 po4 zhe3 de5 shou3 zhong4，pan4ni4 bian4 neng2 cheng2wei2 yi1 gu3 ji1ji2 li4liang5。tang3ruo4 wo3 yi4tu2 tui1fan1 zhuan1zhi4 zheng4quan2，ta1 jue2dui4 suan4shi4 hai2 bu4cuo4 de5 meng2you3。\n"
"\n"
"hua4sui1ru2ci3，ru2guo3 ni3 xin4ren4 fan3 pan4 zhe3，na4 jiu4 da4cuo4te4cuo4 le5。zhe4ge5 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 su4 yi3 jian1zha4 wen2ming2，ta1 de5 ren4he2 tong2meng2 guan1xi5 dou1 ke3neng2 zhuan3shun4ji2shi4。"

msgid "Not now, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"别​打岔​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"bie4 da3cha4，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"Not now, Dietrich. If there's one thing I don't want to think about tonight,"
" it's work."
msgstr ""
"别聊​这个​，​迪​特里​希​。​我​今晚​唯一​不想​考虑​的​，​就是​工作​。\n"
"bie4 liao2 zhe4ge5，Di2te4li3xi1。wo3 jin1wan3 wei2yi1 bu4xiang3 kao3lu:4 de5，jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid "Not particularly, man."
msgstr ""
"不是​特别​想​听​，​老兄​。\n"
"bu4shi4 te4bie2 xiang3 ting1，lao3xiong1。"

msgid "Not particularly."
msgstr ""
"不是​特别​想​听​。\n"
"bu4shi4 te4bie2 xiang3 ting1。"

msgid ""
"Not quite.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stoops to inspect the body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We still need to search the bastard. Who knows? Maybe he has some additional evidence on him... or in him. Could be that he has headware storage - we won't know until we go digging."
msgstr ""
"再​等等​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​开始​仔细检查​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​还​得​搜​搜​这个​混蛋​。​万一​他​身上​还有​什么​额外​的​证据​呢​……​或者​在​体内​也​有​可能​。​没准​他​有​头部​储存​设备​。​我们​只有​检查​一番​才​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 deng3deng3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kai1shi3 zi3 xi4 jian3 cha2 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hai2 de2 sou1 sou1 zhe4ge5 hun2dan4。wan4yi1 ta1 shen1shang5 hai2you3 shen2me5 e2wai4 de5 zheng4ju4 ni2……huo4zhe3 zai4 ti3nei4 ye3 you3 ke3neng2。mei2zhun3 ta1 you3 tou2bu4 chu3cun2 she4bei4。wo3men5 zhi3you3 jian3cha2 yi1 fan1 cai2 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Not quite. Rammbock is one of the more unpleasant new gangs out in Schattennest.\n"
"\n"
"Violent bastards, but I suppose that goes without saying."
msgstr ""
"并​不是​。​撞锤​帮是​影​巢中​的​某个​最近​无人不知​的​新​帮派​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​是​一帮​暴力​狂​，​不过​不用​我​说​你​肯定​也​知道​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bing4 bu4shi4。zhuang4 chui2 bang1 shi4 ying3 chao2 zhong4 de5 mou3 ge4 zui4jin4 wu2ren2bu4zhi1 de5 xin1 bang1pai4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 shi4 yi1 bang1 bao4li4 kuang2，bu4guo4 bu4yong4 wo3 shuo1 ni3 ken3ding4 ye3 zhi1dao4 le5。"

msgid "Not really, no."
msgstr ""
"并​不​。\n"
"bing4 bu4。"

msgid ""
"Not really, no. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He puts down his comic, and his voice slows to a crawl. He makes a point of enunciating each word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I point people to the bar. If someone starts trouble, I give them a taste of Herr Zapp. \n"
"\n"
"That's it. That's all I do."
msgstr ""
"不​，​我​看​不​太行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​漫画​放下​，​语速​也​变得​极其​缓慢​，​一字一顿​地​说​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​负责​告诉​客人​吧台​在​哪儿​。​要是​有人​闹事​，​我​就让​他们​尝尝​霹雳​老大哥​的​滋味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这些​。​我​只​干​这些​事​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 kan4 bu4 tai4 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 man4hua4 fang4xia4，yu3 su4 ye3 bian4de5 ji2qi2 huan3man4，yi1 zi4 yi1 dun4 de5 shuo1 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 fu4ze2 gao4su4 ke4ren2 ba1tai2 zai4 na3r5。yao4shi5 you3ren2 nao4shi4，wo3 jiu4 rang4 ta1men5 chang2 chang2 pi1li4 lao3da4ge1 de5 zi1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4xie1。wo3 zhi3 gan4 zhe4xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Not really, no. Conspiracy theories aren't really my thing... I prefer to keep my eyes on what's ahead of me.\n"
"\n"
"Besides, most of that stuff is bull anyway. On the whole, people are too disorganized and selfish to make a global conspiracy work."
msgstr ""
"不太​清楚​。​我​对​阴谋论​这些​不感兴趣​……​我​更​愿意​相信​眼前​看到​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此外​，​那些​东西​大多​都​是​胡说八道​。​总的来说​，​人们​太过​杂乱无章​和​自私自利​，​根本无法​让​全球​级别​的​阴谋论​顺利​运作​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 tai4 qing1chu5。wo3 dui4 yin1mou2lun4 zhe4xie1 bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4……wo3 geng1 yuan4yi4 xiang1xin4 yan3qian2 kan4dao4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ci3wai4，na4xie1 dong1xi1 da4duo1 dou1 shi4 hu2shuo1ba1dao4。zong3de5lai2shuo1，ren2men5 tai4guo4 za2luan4wu2zhang1 he4 zi4si1zi4li4，gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 rang4 quan2qiu2 ji2bie2 de5 yin1mou2lun4 shun4li4 yun4zuo4。"

msgid "Not really. Could you break it down for me?"
msgstr ""
"不太​明白​。​能​给​我​简单​讲解​一下​吗​？\n"
"bu4 tai4 ming2bai5。neng2 gei3 wo3 jian3dan1 jiang3jie3 yi1xia4 ma5？"

msgid "Not really. I wasn't paying attention."
msgstr ""
"不​记得​了​，​我​没​怎么​认真​听​。\n"
"bu4 ji4de5 le5，wo3 mei2 zen3me5 ren4zhen1 ting1。"

msgid ""
"Not really. It's for the good of the Kreuzbasar, so I figured I could count "
"on you. Plus, I know where all of the taps are."
msgstr ""
"并非如此​。​这样​做​是​为了​克洛伊​茨​集市​着想​，​所以​我​觉得​你​也​不会​反对​。​另外​，​那些​插口​的​位置​我​也​都​知道​。\n"
"bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 wei4le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhuo2xiang3，suo3yi3 wo3 jue2de5 ni3 ye3 bu4hui4 fan3dui4。ling4wai4，na4xie1 cha1kou3 de5 wei4zhi5 wo3 ye3 dou1 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "Not really... it's loud in here. Can this wait?"
msgstr ""
"不​太行​……​这里​挺​吵​的​。​能​等​一下​吗​？\n"
"bu4 tai4 xing2……zhe4li3 ting3 chao3 de5。neng2 deng3 yi1xia4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Not right away, but sure. I've heard enough stories to believe that they would... it's happened plenty often before.\n"
"\n"
"You don't get to be a global conspiracy by lettin' people step on your toes."
msgstr ""
"也许​不​在​当下​，​但​早晚​会​如此​。​类似​的​故事​我​可​听​得​多​了​……​以前​发生​过​太​多次​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​作为​全球​性质​的​阴谋​集团​，​是​绝对​不会​容忍​其他人​不识时务​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 bu4 zai4 dang1xia4，dan4 zao3wan3 hui4 ru2ci3。lei4si4 de5 gu4shi4 wo3 ke3 ting1 de2 duo1 le5……yi3qian2 fa1sheng1 guo4 tai4 duo1ci4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 quan2qiu2 xing4zhi4 de5 yin1mou2 ji2tuan2，shi4 jue2dui4 bu4hui4 rong2ren3 qi2 ta1 ren2 bu4shi2shi2wu4 de5。"

msgid "Not right now, boss. I've got a lot on my mind."
msgstr ""
"现在​没空​，​老大​。​我要​考虑​的​事情​太多​了​。\n"
"xian4zai4 mei2 kong1，lao3da4。wo3 yao4 kao3lu:4 de5 shi4qing5 tai4 duo1 le5。"

msgid "Not right now, thanks."
msgstr ""
"现在​不行​，​谢​了​。\n"
"xian4zai4 bu4xing2，xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Not right now, we don't. \n"
"\n"
"Don't push me on this, $(l.name). One of these days, we're gonna hash this out, and you can talk all you like about the clusterfuck that killed one of my best friends. But it won't be today."
msgstr ""
"不​，​现在​别跟我​说​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​逼​我​，​$(l.name)​。​或许​某​天​我们​之间​可以​促膝长谈​，​到时候​你​可以​尽情​谈论​那个​害死​我​挚友​的​混蛋​。​但​不是​今天​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，xian4zai4 bie4 gen1 wo3 shuo1 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 bi1 wo3，$(l.name)。huo4xu3 mou3 tian1 wo3men5 zhi1jian1 ke3yi3 cu4 xi1 zhang3 tan2，dao4shi2hou4 ni3 ke3yi3 jin4qing2 tan2lun4 na4ge5 hai4si3 wo3 zhi4you3 de5 hun2dan4。dan4 bu4shi4 jin1tian1。"

msgid ""
"Not right now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory stares at you through cold, dead eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, we have a job to do, so let's get on with it. We can chat again later."
msgstr ""
"现在​不行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽用​冰冷​而​死寂​的​双眼​凝视着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不是​还有​差事​要​做​吗​，​先忙​正事​吧​，​回头​再聊​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 bu4xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yong4 bing1leng3 er2 si3ji4 de5 shuang1yan3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4shi4 hai2you3 cha4shi4 yao4 zuo4 ma5，xian1 mang2 zheng4shi4 ba1，hui2tou2 zai4 liao2。"

msgid "Not so fast. You’re a dragon. I want treasure."
msgstr ""
"先​别着急​。​你​可是​巨龙​。​我​想要​宝藏​。\n"
"xian1 bie4 zhao2 ji2。ni3 ke3shi4 ju4long2。wo3 xiang3yao4 bao3zang4。"

msgid "Not so good."
msgstr ""
"不怎么样​。\n"
"bu4zen3me5yang4。"

msgid ""
"Not sure I like being on this side of things, chief.\n"
"\n"
"Doesn't feel like we're on the right side of this one."
msgstr ""
"我​不​太​喜欢​我们​所处​的​立场​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总​感觉​我们​在​这件​事上​站​在​了​错误​的​一边​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 tai4 xi3huan5 wo3men5 suo3 chu3 de5 li4chang3，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"zong3 gan3jue2 wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 zhan4 zai4 le5 cuo4wu4 de5 yi1bian1。"

msgid ""
"Not sure how I feel about that, boss... we need the money, an' all, but I'm "
"not sure that betraying our employers is the right way to get it."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​这么​做​是不是​不妥​……​我们​是​需要​钱​，​但​背叛​雇主​搞钱​，​我​总​觉得​不太​地道​。\n"
"lao3da4，zhe4me5 zuo4 shi4bu5shi4 bu4tuo3……wo3men5 shi4 xu1yao4 qian2，dan4 bei4pan4 gu4zhu3 gao3qian2，wo3 zong3 jue2de5 bu4 tai4 di4dao4。"

msgid ""
"Not sure how I feel about your freeing those clones. It might've been kinder to've put 'em out of their misery.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was your call, though."
msgstr ""
"你​放走​克隆​体​那事​，​我​其实​心里​挺​复杂​的​。​或许​让​他们​从​痛苦​中​解脱​才​是​更​仁慈​的​做法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​反正​下​决定​的​是​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fang4zou3 ke4long2 ti3 na4 shi4，wo3 qi2shi2 xin1li5 ting3 fu4za2 de5。huo4xu3 rang4 ta1men5 cong2 tong4ku3 zhong4 jie3tuo1 cai2 shi4 geng1 ren2ci2 de5 zuo4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，fan3zheng4 xia4 jue2ding4 de5 shi4 ni3。"

msgid "Not sure. I'll have to see what the F-State throws my way."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​呢​。​我会​看看​动荡​带为​我​准备​了​什么​。\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 ni2。wo3 hui4 kan4kan5 dong4dang4 dai4 wei2 wo3 zhun3bei4 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid "Not that high up on the chain are you?"
msgstr ""
"你​不是​站​在​情报​链​的​顶端​吗​？\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 zhan4 zai4 qing2bao4 lian4 de5 ding3duan1 ma5？"

msgid "Not that much, I don't."
msgstr ""
"还​没到​那个​程度​。\n"
"hai2 mei2 dao4 na4ge5 cheng2du4。"

msgid ""
"Not that smart.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Slowly, sadly, Glory shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But we'll get to that in a minute."
msgstr ""
"也​没​那么​聪明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​缓慢​而​难过地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​后面​会​讲​到​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3 mei2 na4me5 cong1ming5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 huan3man4 er2 nan2 guo4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hou4mian5 hui4 jiang3 dao4 de5。"

msgid "Not this time, Kami."
msgstr ""
"这次​不行​，​卡米​。\n"
"zhe4 ci4 bu4xing2，Ka3mi3。"

msgid "Not this time."
msgstr ""
"这次​不行​。\n"
"zhe4 ci4 bu4xing2。"

msgid "Not this time. Pay up or no deal."
msgstr ""
"这次​不行​。​不​给钱​就​免谈​。\n"
"zhe4 ci4 bu4xing2。bu4 gei3 qian2 jiu4 mian3tan2。"

msgid ""
"Not this you, and not today.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her expression slackens, becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Within three cycles, what the world has lost, it shall rue. But the Ice Storm will come, the Codex will be broken, and woe to the Dancer.\n"
"\n"
"This I prophesy."
msgstr ""
"不是​目前​的​你​，​也​不会​是​今天​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​表情​松弛下来​，​变得​恍惚​不定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​三次​循环​之内​，​世间​所失​，​终将​悔恨​。​但​冰暴​将会​降临​、​法典​将​受​毁坏​、​舞者​将​遭​厄运​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此​乃​吾​之​预言​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 mu4qian2 de5 ni3，ye3 bu4hui4 shi4 jin1tian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，bian4de5 huang3hu1 bu4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"san1ci4 xun2huan2 zhi1nei4，shi4jian1 suo3 shi1，zhong1 jiang1 hui3hen4。dan4 bing1 bao4 jiang1hui4 jiang4lin2、fa3dian3 jiang1 shou4 hui3huai4、wu3zhe3 jiang1 zao1 e4yun4。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 nai3 wu2 zhi1 yu4yan2。"

msgid "Not those assholes again."
msgstr ""
"怎么​又​是​那​帮​混蛋​。\n"
"zen3me5 you4 shi4 na4 bang1 hun2dan4。"

msgid ""
"Not to me, Blitz. To *you.* You were gonna do this whether I encouraged you "
"to or not."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​这不怪​我​，​而​要​怪​*​你​*​。​无论​我​是否​鼓励​你​，​你​都​会​去​做​的​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，zhe4 bu4 guai4 wo3，er2 yao4 guai4*ni3*。wu2lun4 wo3 shi4fou3 gu3li4 ni3，ni3 dou1 hui4 qu4 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Not to me, it isn't. I need that stuff, and I'm not leaving without it."
msgstr ""
"对​我​来说​不是​。​我​需要​那​东西​，​拿​不到​的话​绝不会​离开​。\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 bu4shi4。wo3 xu1yao4 na4 dong1xi1，na2 bu4dao4 de5hua4 jue2 bu4 hui4 li2kai1。"

msgid "Not too bad, chief... not bad at all. It's downright cozy in here."
msgstr ""
"还​不错​，​头儿​……​这里​挺舒服​的​。\n"
"hai2 bu4cuo4，tou2r5……zhe4li3 ting3 shu1 fu2 de5。"

msgid "Not when there's still work to be done, and Deutsche Marks to collect."
msgstr ""
"还有​工作​要​做​，​还有​钱要​拿​呢​。\n"
"hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4，hai2you3 qian2 yao4 na2 ni2。"

msgid "Not without question. There were debates."
msgstr ""
"也​不尽然​。​我们​之间​也​会​有​争论​。\n"
"ye3 bu4jin4ran2。wo3men5 zhi1jian1 ye3 hui4 you3 zheng1lun4。"

msgid ""
"Not without the cultists. But yes.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She strides toward the door.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's get moving."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​但​要​带上​那些​教徒​一起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​大步​走向​门口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，dan4 yao4 dai4shang4 na4xie1 jiao4tu2 yi1qi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da4bu4 zou3xiang4 men2kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid "Not yet - I'm still looking."
msgstr ""
"还​没有​，​我​还​在​找​。\n"
"hai2 mei2you3，wo3 hai2 zai4 zhao3。"

msgid "Not yet, Blitz. Just hold tight until I tell you different."
msgstr ""
"先​等​下​，​布里​茨​。​等​我​的​命令​。\n"
"xian1 deng3 xia4，Bu4li3ci2。deng3 wo3 de5 ming4ling4。"

msgid "Not yet, still working on it."
msgstr ""
"还​没有​，​我​还​在​努力​。\n"
"hai2 mei2you3，wo3 hai2 zai4 nu3li4。"

msgid "Not yet."
msgstr ""
"还​不行​。\n"
"hai2 bu4xing2。"

msgid "Not yet. Working on it."
msgstr ""
"还​没有​，​还​在​处理​。\n"
"hai2 mei2you3，hai2 zai4 chu3li3。"

msgid ""
"Not yet. Your disruption of their power grid has prevented them from sending out a signal, but I don't know for how long.\n"
"\n"
"If an alert goes out, I'll send you an update with an ETA on their reinforcements."
msgstr ""
"还​没有​。​你​对​他们​电网​的​破坏​暂时​阻止​了​他们​发出信号​，​但​我​不​知道​这能​维持​多久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​警报​响起​，​我会​及时​更新​增援部队​的​预计​抵达​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 mei2you3。ni3 dui4 ta1men5 dian4wang3 de5 po4huai4 zan4shi2 zu3zhi3 le5 ta1men5 fa1 chu1 xin4 hao4，dan4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 neng2 wei2chi2 duo1jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 jing3bao4 xiang3qi3，wo3 hui4 ji2shi2 geng1xin1 zeng1 yuan2 bu4 dui4 de5 yu4ji4 di3da2 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Not your fault, Dietrich. He failed himself when he chose to join those "
"animals."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​你​的​错​，​迪​特里​希​。​他​选择​与​那​帮​禽兽​为伍​的​时候​就​注定​了​自己​的​结局​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4，Di2te4li3xi1。ta1 xuan3ze2 yu4 na4 bang1 qin2shou4 wei2wu3 de5 shi2hou5 jiu4 zhu4ding4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 jie2ju2。"

msgid ""
"Not your reputation, I'll tell you that much. Some of your past clients have been pretty vocal about their dissatisfaction with you... a \"Herr Fuchs,\" in particular, wants your head on a plate.\n"
"\n"
"No, $(l.name), you're my first choice for this job because I know something about you."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​吧​，​反正​不是​因为​你​的​名声​。​你​过去​的​一些​客户​对​你​非常​不满​……​特别​是​一位​“​富克斯​先生​”​，​他​想要​你​的​脑袋​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​$(l.name)​，​你​是​我​的​首选​，​因为​我​了解​你​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，fan3zheng4 bu4shi4 yin1wei4 ni3 de5 ming2sheng1。ni3 guo4qu4 de5 yi1xie1 ke4hu4 dui4 ni3 fei1chang2 bu4man3……te4bie2 shi4 yi1 wei4“Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5”，ta1 xiang3yao4 ni3 de5 nao3dai5 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，$(l.name)，ni3 shi4 wo3 de5 shou3xuan3，yin1wei4 wo3 liao3jie3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Not your reputation, I'll tell you that much. Some of your past clients have been pretty vocal about their dissatisfaction with you... you should hear what \"Herr Fuchs\" has been spreading around.\n"
"\n"
"No, $(l.name), you're my first choice for this job because I know something about you."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​吧​，​反正​不是​因为​你​的​名声​。​你​过去​的​一些​客户​对​你​非常​不满​……​你​应该​听听​“​富克斯​先生​”​都​说​了​些​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​$(l.name)​，​你​是​我​的​首选​，​因为​我​了解​你​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，fan3zheng4 bu4shi4 yin1wei4 ni3 de5 ming2sheng1。ni3 guo4qu4 de5 yi1xie1 ke4hu4 dui4 ni3 fei1chang2 bu4man3……ni3 ying1gai1 ting1 ting1“Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5” dou1 shuo1 le5 xie1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，$(l.name)，ni3 shi4 wo3 de5 shou3xuan3，yin1wei4 wo3 liao3jie3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Not your reputation, I'll tell you that much. Some of your past clients have been pretty vocal about their dissatisfaction with you... you should hear what \"Herr Schmidt\" has been spreading around.\n"
"\n"
"No, $(l.name), you're my first choice for this job because I know something about you."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​吧​，​反正​不是​因为​你​的​名声​。​你​过去​的​一些​客户​对​你​非常​不满​……​你​应该​听听​“​施密特​先生​”​都​说​了​些​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​$(l.name)​，​你​是​我​的​首选​，​因为​我​了解​你​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，fan3zheng4 bu4shi4 yin1wei4 ni3 de5 ming2sheng1。ni3 guo4qu4 de5 yi1xie1 ke4hu4 dui4 ni3 fei1chang2 bu4man3……ni3 ying1gai1 ting1 ting1“shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5” dou1 shuo1 le5 xie1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4，$(l.name)，ni3 shi4 wo3 de5 shou3xuan3，yin1wei4 wo3 liao3jie3 ni3。"

msgid "Note"
msgstr ""
"纸条\n"
"zhi3tiao2"

msgid ""
"Note that the window between us is made of transplast. Quite unbreakable by any weapon that you can bring to bear.\n"
"\n"
"As for the attack on your home - that was regrettable, but necessary. I had to preserve the secrecy of my work, for the greater good of all."
msgstr ""
"请​注意​，​我们​之间​的​这​扇​窗户​是​由​透塑​制成​的​。​任何​你​能​使用​的​武器​都​无法​将​其​打破​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​对​你家​的​袭击​—​—​那​确实​令人遗憾​，​但​却是​必要​的​。​我​必须​为了​维护​我​工作​的​机密性​。​这是​为了​所有人​好​。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 zhu4yi4，wo3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 zhe4 shan1 chuang1hu5 shi4 you2 tou4 su4 zhi4cheng2 de5。ren4he2 ni3 neng2 shi3yong4 de5 wu3qi4 dou1 wu2fa3 jiang1 qi2 da3po4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 dui4 ni3 jia1 de5 xi2ji1——na4 que4shi2 ling3 ren2 yi2 han4，dan4 que4shi4 bi4yao4 de5。wo3 bi4xu1 wei4le5 wei2hu4 wo3 gong1zuo4 de5 ji1mi4xing4。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 suo3you3ren2 hao3。"

msgid "Note to self..."
msgstr ""
"备注​一下​……\n"
"bei4zhu4 yi1xia4……"

msgid "Noted. I will set up the meet."
msgstr ""
"知道​了​。​我会​安排​见面​的​事宜​。\n"
"zhi1dao4 le5。wo3 hui4 an1pai2 jian4mian4 de5 shi4yi2。"

msgid "Noted. I'll buy out Ezkibel's supply of Medkits and BuMoNa contracts."
msgstr ""
"记下​了​。​我​稍后​就​去​清空​埃兹​基​贝尔​的​急救包​和​移动​医联​库存​。\n"
"ji4 xia4 le5。wo3 shao1hou4 jiu4 qu4 qing1kong1 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 de5 ji2jiu4bao1 he4 yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 ku4cun2。"

msgid ""
"Nothin' new, boss. He's adjusting.\n"
"\n"
"It's gonna take some time."
msgstr ""
"没​啥​新​情况​，​老大​。​他​还​在​适应​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​他​一些​时间​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 sha2 xin1 qing2kuang4，lao3da4。ta1 hai2 zai4 shi4ying4。\n"
"\n"
"gei3 ta1 yi1xie1 shi2jian1 ba1。"

msgid "Nothing - just passing by. Take it easy."
msgstr ""
"没什么​，​只是​路过​。​再见​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5，zhi3shi4 lu4guo4。zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Nothing bad is going to happen to $(l.name), Blitz. Why would I hurt $(l.him)? I need $(l.hisher) help.\n"
"\n"
"Now shut your mouth and quit whining. Otherwise, I'm going to get irritated. Understand?"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​$(l.name)​不会​有事​的​。​我​为什么​要​伤害​$(l.he)​？​我​需要​$(l.hisher)​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​把​嘴闭​上​，​不要​再​抱怨​了​，​否则​我​可​就要​不耐烦​了​。​明白​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，$(l.name) bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。wo3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 shang1hai4 $(l.he)？wo3 xu1yao4 $(l.hisher) bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ba3 zui3 bi4 shang4，bu4yao4 zai4 bao4yuan4 le5，fou3ze2 wo3 ke3 jiu4yao4 bu4nai4fan2 le5。ming2bai5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Nothing could have made this right. *Nothing.*\n"
"\n"
"If you'd left me where you found me, I never would have hurt anybody. My *mother* would still be alive. I never would've sold my soul to that abomination that you all worship, and I wouldn't have had to sacrifice my own body to escape from it.\n"
"\n"
"This place took everything from me. And it all started with *you.*"
msgstr ""
"没有​任何​办法​能​补救​这​一切​。​*​没有​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​当初​把​我​留在​原地​，​我​就​不会​伤害​任何人​。​我​的​*​母亲​*​也​能活​下来​。​我​不会​把​灵魂​出卖​给​你们​崇拜​的​那个​恶魔​，​也​不必​为了​逃离​它​的​掌控​而​把​自己​的​身体​搞成​这​副​模样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​夺走​了​我​的​一切​。​而​这​一切​的​始作俑者​就是​*​你​*​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ren4he2 ban4fa3 neng2 bu3jiu4 zhe4 yi1qie4。*mei2you3*。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 dang1chu1 ba3 wo3 liu2 zai4 yuan2di4，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2。wo3 de5*mu3qin1*ye3 neng2 huo2 xia4lai5。wo3 bu4hui4 ba3 ling2hun2 chu1mai4 gei3 ni3men5 chong2bai4 de5 na4ge5 e4mo2，ye3 bu4bi4 wei4le5 tao2li2 ta1 de5 zhang3kong4 er2 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 shen1ti3 gao3 cheng2 zhe4 fu4 mu2yang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 duo2zou3 le5 wo3 de5 yi1qie4。er2 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 shi3zuo4yong3zhe3 jiu4shi4*ni3*。"

msgid ""
"Nothing deserves to be condemned to a life of slavery. I'll help you, APEX."
msgstr ""
"任何​存在​都​不应​被​永远​束缚​于​奴役​之中​。​我会​帮​你​，​APEX​。\n"
"ren4he2 cun2zai4 dou1 bu4 ying1 bei4 yong3yuan3 shu4fu4 yu2 nu2yi4 zhi1zhong1。wo3 hui4 bang1 ni3，APEX。"

msgid ""
"Nothing else, I'm satisfied. I'll let you get back to... whatever it was you"
" were doing."
msgstr ""
"没​了​，​我​很​满意​。​你​先​把​……​手头​的​事情​忙​完​吧​。\n"
"mei2 le5，wo3 hen3 man3yi4。ni3 xian1 ba3……shou3tou2 de5 shi4qing5 mang2 wan2 ba1。"

msgid "Nothing fancy, I spend most of my money on programs."
msgstr ""
"没什么​特别​的​，​我​大部分​钱​都​花​在​程序​上​了​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 te4bie2 de5，wo3 da4bu4fen5 qian2 dou1 hua1 zai4 cheng2xu4 shang4 le5。"

msgid "Nothing for me, thanks."
msgstr ""
"我​不用​了​，​谢谢​。\n"
"wo3 bu4yong4 le5，xie4xie5。"

msgid "Nothing for me. I'm good."
msgstr ""
"我​不用​了​。\n"
"wo3 bu4yong4 le5。"

msgid "Nothing for now, Samuel. Let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""
"暂时​没事​了​，​塞缪尔​。​我们​说点​别的​吧​。\n"
"zan4shi2 mei2shi4 le5，sai4miu4er3。wo3men5 shuo1 dian3 bie2de5 ba1。"

msgid "Nothing for now."
msgstr ""
"暂时​没什么​需要​的​。\n"
"zan4shi2 mei2shen2me5 xu1yao4 de5。"

msgid "Nothing goes unrepaid…"
msgstr ""
"没什么​是​没有​回报​的​……\n"
"mei2shen2me5 shi4 mei2you3 hui2bao4 de5……"

msgid "Nothing good."
msgstr ""
"准没​好事​。\n"
"zhun3 mei2 hao3shi4。"

msgid "Nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"无​事​发生​。\n"
"wu2 shi4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid "Nothing in particular."
msgstr ""
"没什么​特别​的​原因​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 te4bie2 de5 yuan2yin1。"

msgid "Nothing is over, dragon."
msgstr ""
"一切​尚未​结束​，​巨龙​。\n"
"yi1qie4 shang4wei4 jie2shu4，ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"Nothing like that. All I need is information. You tell me about the hotel, I"
" get you some cram."
msgstr ""
"不是​那种​事​。​我​只是​要​跟​你​打听​点​情况​。​你​跟​我​讲讲​旅馆​，​我​就​给​你​搞​点​“​超感​”​来​。\n"
"bu4shi4 na4zhong3 shi4。wo3 zhi3shi4 yao4 gen1 ni3 da3ting5 dian3 qing2kuang4。ni3 gen1 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 lu:3guan3，wo3 jiu4 gei3 ni3 gao3 dian3“chao1 gan3” lai2。"

msgid "Nothing much, Lukas. Hey, I've got something for you."
msgstr ""
"没什么​，​卢卡斯​。​对​了​，​我​有​东西​给​你​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5，lu2ka3si1。dui4 le5，wo3 you3 dong1xi1 gei3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Nothing much. Got attacked by a bunch of idiots who didn't know who they "
"were messing with. They lost."
msgstr ""
"没什么​大不了​的​，​几个​不知天高地厚​的​蠢货​来​找​我​麻烦​，​都​被​我​放​倒​了​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5，ji3ge5 bu4zhi1tian1gao1di4hou4 de5 chun3huo4 lai2 zhao3 wo3 ma2fan5，dou1 bei4 wo3 fang4 dao3 le5。"

msgid "Nothing of the sort! We welcome the company."
msgstr ""
"没有​的​事​！​我们​欢迎​你​来​作客​。\n"
"mei2you3 de5 shi4！wo3men5 huan1ying2 ni3 lai2 zuo4ke4。"

msgid ""
"Nothing personal, but I hardly know you. You'd be better off looking for "
"work elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"这话​不是​针对​你​，​不过​我​跟​你​一点​都​不熟​。​你​最好​还是​换个​地方​找​工作​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 bu4shi4 zhen1dui4 ni3，bu4guo4 wo3 gen1 ni3 yi1dian3 dou1 bu4 shu2。ni3 zui4hao3 hai2shi5 huan4 ge4 di4fang1 zhao3 gong1zuo4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Nothing personal, you understand - if I were to start keeping friends, I might call you one. But in my experience, friendship and obligation go hand in hand.\n"
"\n"
"A solitary life is cleaner."
msgstr ""
"别往​心里​去​，​你​懂​的​—​—​如果​我​想​开始​交朋友​，​你​肯定​会​是​其中​一个​。​但​根据​我​的​经验​，​友谊​与​义务​往往​如影随形​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​独居​生活​更​清净​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 wang3 xin1li5 qu4，ni3 dong3 de5——ru2guo3 wo3 xiang3 kai1shi3 jiao1peng2you5，ni3 ken3ding4 hui4 shi4 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5。dan4 gen1ju4 wo3 de5 jing1yan4，you3yi4 yu4 yi4wu4 wang3wang3 ru2ying3sui2xing2。\n"
"\n"
"du2ju1 sheng1huo2 geng1 qing1jing4。"

msgid "Nothing right now, Dietrich."
msgstr ""
"暂时​没事​，​迪​特里​希​。\n"
"zan4shi2 mei2shi4，Di2te4li3xi1。"

msgid "Nothing right now, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"现在​没什么​事​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"xian4zai4 mei2shen2me5 shi4，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid ""
"Nothing should have the kind of power you were asking for. I had to do what "
"I did."
msgstr ""
"任何事物​都​不该​拥有​你​所​渴求​的​那种​力量​。​我​必须​采取行动​。\n"
"ren4 he2 shi4 wu4 dou1 bu4gai1 yong1you3 ni3 suo3 ke3qiu2 de5 na4zhong3 li4liang5。wo3 bi4xu1 cai3qu3xing2dong4。"

msgid ""
"Nothing stays secret for long in the F-State. The Flux demands transparency."
" The truth will always get out. And the truth about Monika's death is now on"
" the breeze, flowing through the streets of Berlin."
msgstr ""
"在​动荡​带​，​没什么​能​保密​很​久​。​动荡​带要​的​是​透明化​。​真相​总会​大白于天下​。​而​关于​莫妮卡​之死​的​真相​，​现在​已经​随风飘​散​，​流淌​在​柏林​的​大街小巷​。\n"
"zai4 dong4dang4 dai4，mei2shen2me5 neng2 bao3mi4 hen3 jiu3。dong4dang4 dai4 yao4 de5 shi4 tou4 ming2 hua4。zhen1xiang4 zong3 hui4 dai4 bai2 yu2 tian1 xia4。er2 guan1yu2 Mo4ni1ka3 zhi1 si3 de5 zhen1xiang4，xian4zai4 yi3jing1 sui2 feng1 piao1 san3，liu2tang3 zai4 bo2lin2 de5 da4jie1xiao3xiang4。"

msgid ""
"Nothing that can't wait until morning. Go get some rest. You look like you "
"could use it."
msgstr ""
"没什么​大事​，​等到​明早​再说​也​行​。​去​休息​一下​吧​，​我​看​你​也​怪​累​的​了​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 da4shi4，deng3dao4 ming2zao3 zai4shuo1 ye3 xing2。qu4 xiu1xi5 yi1xia4 ba1，wo3 kan4 ni3 ye3 guai4 lei3 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Nothing too serious. Just that you've got a lot of work.\n"
"\n"
"I do too, which is nice."
msgstr ""
"没什么​大不了​的​，​就是说​你​有​很多​工作​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​是​这样​，​感觉​挺​好​的​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5，jiu4shi4shuo1 ni3 you3 hen3 duo1 gong1zuo4 er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4 zhe4yang4，gan3jue2 ting3 hao3 de5。"

msgid "Nothing we haven't already talked about."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​聊​的​基本​都​已经​聊过​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 liao2 de5 ji1ben3 dou1 yi3jing1 liao2 guo4 le5。"

msgid "Nothing yet."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Nothing! I'm in.\n"
"\n"
"That wasn't so hard, now, was it?"
msgstr ""
"没​了​！​我​已经​进来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看​，​没​多难​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"mei2 le5！wo3 yi3jing1 jin4lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4，mei2 duo1 nan2 ba1？"

msgid "Nothing, I guess."
msgstr ""
"没什么​了​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 le5。"

msgid "Nothing, I'll go exploring on my own time."
msgstr ""
"不用​了​，​我​有空​自己​逛逛​。\n"
"bu4yong4 le5，wo3 you3kong4 zi4ji3 guang4guang5。"

msgid "Nothing, I'm leaving."
msgstr ""
"没事​，​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"mei2shi4，wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"Nothing, ace.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image shakes its head sadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing at all."
msgstr ""
"不行​，​王牌​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​悲伤地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么​都​不行​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2，wang2pai2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 bei1 shang1 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shen2me5 dou1 bu4xing2。"

msgid "Nothing. Forget it."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​当​我​没​说​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。dang1 wo3 mei2 shuo1。"

msgid "Nothing. I'll be going."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "Nothing. I'm done with this."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​我待​不​下去​了​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。wo3 dai1 bu4 xia4qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Nothing. I've changed my mind. By the way, if you breathe a word about this "
"to anybody, you're dead."
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​我​改​主意​了​。​另外​，​如果​你​敢​向​别人​透露​一个​字​的话​，​你​就​死定了​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。ling4wai4，ru2guo3 ni3 gan3 xiang4 bie2ren5 tou4lu4 yi1ge5 zi4 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid "Nothing. It's nothing. "
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​真的​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。zhen1de5。"

msgid "Nothing. I’ve made my decision. "
msgstr ""
"没什么​。​我​已经​做​了​决定​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5。wo3 yi3jing1 zuo4 le5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"Nothing. Just that someone with that handle checked in about a week ago. Still here, I think.\n"
"\n"
"Now, do you want somethin' from the bar? Or are you just here to waste my time?"
msgstr ""
"没​啥​。​就是​有​个人​登记​入住​的​时候​用​的​是​这个​名​，​差不多​一周​前来​的​吧​。​我​看​他​还​没​走​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​是​想​点些​什么​，​还是​单纯​来​浪费​我​时间​的​？\n"
"\n"
"mei2 sha2。jiu4shi4 you3 ge4ren2 deng1ji4 ru4zhu4 de5 shi2hou5 yong4 de5 shi4 zhe4ge5 ming2，cha4bu5duo1 yi1zhou1 qian2lai2 de5 ba1。wo3 kan4 ta1 hai2 mei2 zou3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 xiang3 dian3 xie1 shen2me5，hai2shi5 dan1chun2 lai2 lang4fei4 wo3 shi2jian1 de5？"

msgid ""
"Nothing. Not a goddamn thing. All there is to do in Schattennest is get your"
" arse beat by gangs until you decide to join one."
msgstr ""
"什么​都​没有​。​在​影巢​，​你​唯一​能​做​的​事​就是​被​帮派​揍​得​满地找牙​，​直到​你​决定​加入​其中​一个​。\n"
"shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3。zai4 ying3 chao2，ni3 wei2yi1 neng2 zuo4 de5 shi4 jiu4shi4 bei4 bang1pai4 zou4 de2 man3di4zhao3ya2，zhi2dao4 ni3 jue2ding4 jia1ru4 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5。"

msgid "Notify Amsel About Your Meeting with Frau Müller"
msgstr ""
"把​你​和​穆勒​女士​的​会面​安排​告诉​阿姆​泽尔\n"
"ba3 ni3 he4 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 de5 hui4mian4 an1pai2 gao4su4 E1mu3ze2er3"

msgid "Notify Luca Duerr That His Task is Complete"
msgstr ""
"通知​卢卡​·​杜尔​他​交代​的​任务​已​完成\n"
"tong1zhi1 lu2ka3 · du4 er3 ta1 jiao1dai4 de5 ren4wu5 yi3 wan2cheng2"

msgid "Notify Samuel of the Humanis Plot"
msgstr ""
"将​人类​至上​主义者​的​阴谋​告知​塞缪尔\n"
"jiang1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 yin1mou2 gao4zhi1 sai4miu4er3"

msgid "Novahot Targeting"
msgstr ""
"超酷​索敌\n"
"chao1 ku4 suo3 di2"

msgid ""
"Now begone, if you please.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He dismisses you with a wave of his hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There is important work to be done."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​请​离开​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挥手​示意​你​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还有​重要​的​事情​要​做​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，qing3 li2kai1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui1shou3 shi4yi4 ni3 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Now he wants to come back. He wants to be the new Zaak. He told me he had "
"better stuff. Let me try it."
msgstr ""
"现在​他​想​回来​。​他​想​成为​新​的​扎克​。​他​告诉​我​说​他​的​货​更好​，​要​让​我​试试​。\n"
"xian4zai4 ta1 xiang3 hui2lai5。ta1 xiang3 cheng2wei2 xin1 de5 Zha1ke4。ta1 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 ta1 de5 huo4 geng1 hao3，yao4 rang4 wo3 shi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Now it’s public relations. Marketing. Mergers and acquisitions.\n"
"\n"
"You see it every day. Dragons on the trideo… in the board rooms. They gather influence… wealth… power… \n"
"\n"
"Continually hoarding, hoarding, until one of them sits atop it all. "
msgstr ""
"现在​的​手段​是​公关​。​营销​。​并购​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​每天​都​能​看到​。​3D​影像​中​的​巨龙​们​……​在​董事会​会议室​里​。​他们​积累​影响力​……​财富​……​权力​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​不断​囤积​，​囤积​，​直到​其中​一个​坐​上​权力​顶峰​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 de5 shou3duan4 shi4 gong1guan1。ying2xiao1。bing4gou4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei3tian1 dou1 neng2 kan4dao4。3D ying3xiang4 zhong4 de5 ju4long2 men5……zai4 dong3shi4hui4 hui4yi4shi4 li3。ta1men5 ji1lei3 ying3xiang3li4……cai2fu4……quan2li4……\n"
"\n"
"bu4duan4 tun2ji1，tun2ji1，zhi2dao4 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 zuo4 shang4 quan2li4 ding3feng1。"

msgid ""
"Now please, go fetch the information from Alice.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He claps a hand on your shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're one step closer to surviving this mess."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​去​找​爱丽丝​拿​情报​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拍拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​离​活下去​又​近​了​一步​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，qu4 zhao3 ai4li4si1 na2 qing2bao4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 li2 huo2xia4qu4 you4 jin4 le5 yi1 bu4。"

msgid ""
"Now that any hope of stealth has gone out the window, you'll have to rely on speed to complete your objective.\n"
"\n"
"I've marked an elevator on your PDA. Get to it. It will take you to where you need to be."
msgstr ""
"既然​潜行​已​无​可能​，​你​就​只能​依靠​速度​来​完成​任务​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​在​你​的​PDA​上​标记​了​电梯​位置​。​赶快​过去​，​它会​带​你​抵达​目的地​。\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 qian2xing2 yi3 wu2 ke3neng2，ni3 jiu4 zhi3neng2 yi1kao4 su4du4 lai2 wan2cheng2 ren4wu5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 zai4 ni3 de5 PDA shang4 biao1ji4 le5 dian4ti1 wei4zhi5。gan3kuai4 guo4qu4，ta1 hui4 dai4 ni3 di3da2 mu4di4di4。"

msgid ""
"Now that he's seen your aura in astral space, Dante's expression softens. His ears stand back up, and you could swear that you see him smile.\n"
"\n"
"He happily takes his place by your side."
msgstr ""
"但丁​在​星界​中​看见​了​你​的​灵光​，​于是​表情​随之​柔和​下来​。​他​的​耳朵​重新​竖起​，​仿佛​对​你​露出​了​微笑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​在​你​身边​欣然​站​好​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 zai4 xing1 jie4 zhong4 kan4jian4 le5 ni3 de5 ling2guang1，yu2shi4 biao3qing2 sui2zhi1 rou2he2 xia4lai5。ta1 de5 er3duo5 chong2xin1 shu4qi3，fang3fu2 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 le5 wei1xiao4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 ni3 shen1bian1 xin1ran2 zhan4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Now that they've claimed the upper levels of the building, it isn't safe to travel beyond the ground floor. Several members of our congregation have been mauled to death by the Magnifikers' pet spirits.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head sadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now we travel only in groups."
msgstr ""
"他们​已经​占据​了​建筑​的​上层​区域​，​现在​除了​一楼​以外​的​地方​都​不​安全​了​。​我们​的​几位​教友​已​被​伟术​帮​的​宠物​精魂​残害​致死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​悲伤地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如今​我们​只​敢​集体行动​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yi3jing1 zhan4ju4 le5 jian4zhu4 de5 shang4ceng2 qu1yu4，xian4zai4 chu2le5 yi1 lou2 yi3wai4 de5 di4fang1 dou1 bu4 an1quan2 le5。wo3men5 de5 ji1 wei4 jiao4you3 yi3 bei4 wei3 shu4 bang1 de5 chong3wu4 jing1hun2 can2hai4 zhi4si3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bei1 shang1 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 wo3men5 zhi3 gan3 ji2 ti3 xing2 dong4。"

msgid ""
"Now that we're all together, let's discuss our approach. Anyone know how "
"we're supposed to get into Aleshire's penthouse?"
msgstr ""
"既然​大家​都​在​这​了​，​咱们​就​来​商量​下​行动​方案​吧​。​有人​知道​怎么​才能​混进​阿利​希尔​的​顶层​公寓​吗​？\n"
"ji4ran2 da4jia1 dou1 zai4 zhe4 le5，zan2men5 jiu4 lai2 shang1liang5 xia4 xing2dong4 fang1an4 ba1。you3ren2 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 cai2neng2 hun4jin4 e1 li4 xi1er3 de5 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 ma5？"

msgid "Now that we’ve got the keys to the castle, I say that we use them."
msgstr ""
"既然​我们​手里​有​城堡​的​钥匙​，​就​用​在​该​用​的​地方​吧​。\n"
"ji4ran2 wo3men5 shou3li3 you3 cheng2bao3 de5 yao4shi5，jiu4 yong4 zai4 gai1 yong4 de5 di4fang1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Now that you have a moment to examine the cyberware in question, it's surprisingly easy to disable.\n"
"\n"
"It only takes a minute or two to expose the system's control circuits. It'd be the easiest thing in the world for you to \"flip the switch.\""
msgstr ""
"你​花​了​片刻​时间​检查​这套​赛博​改造​，​并​意外​地​发现​它​很​容易​就​能​关停​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只​需​一两分钟​，​你​就​能​暴露​整个​系统​的​控制电路​，​随后​你​要​做​的​便是​这​世上​最​简单​的​事​—​—​“​拨动​开关​”​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hua1 le5 pian4ke4 shi2jian1 jian3cha2 zhe4 tao4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4，bing4 yi4wai4 de5 fa1xian4 ta1 hen3 rong2yi4 jiu4 neng2 guan1ting2。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 xu1 yi1 liang3 fen4 zhong1，ni3 jiu4 neng2 bao4lu4 zheng3ge4 xi4tong3 de5 kong4 zhi4 dian4 lu4，sui2hou4 ni3 yao4 zuo4 de5 bian4shi4 zhe4 shi4shang4 zui4 jian3dan1 de5 shi4——“bo1dong4 kai1guan1”。"

msgid "Now that you're all settled in, I've got some questions for you."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​已经​安顿​好​了​，​我​有些​事想​问​你​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 yi3jing1 an1dun4 hao3 le5，wo3 you3xie1 shi4 xiang3 wen4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Now that you've acknowledged that, maybe you can make an effort to change."
msgstr ""
"现在​你​知道​了​，​你​还​可以​努力​改变​。\n"
"xian4zai4 ni3 zhi1dao4 le5，ni3 hai2 ke3yi3 nu3li4 gai3bian4。"

msgid "Now that's a sentiment I can drink to."
msgstr ""
"这话​值得​我们​喝一杯​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 zhi2de5 wo3men5 he4 yi1 bei1。"

msgid "Now then! Is there anything else Burakgazi can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"好​了​！​还有​什么​是​布拉加​齐能​为​你​效劳​的​吗​？\n"
"hao3 le5！hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 neng2 wei2 ni3 xiao4lao2 de5 ma5？"

msgid "Now then. Is there anything else Burakgazi can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"好​了​。​还有​什么​是​布拉加​齐能​为​你​效劳​的​吗​？\n"
"hao3 le5。hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 neng2 wei2 ni3 xiao4lao2 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Now we press our advantage. Jam their comms, Ortega.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The sounds of hurried motion recede into the background.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, remember, people: Amsel was the brains of the operation, but the rest will put up a lot more fight. Flush 'em out and take 'em down, one by one."
msgstr ""
"现在​我们​乘胜追击​。​干扰​他们​的​通讯​链​，​奥尔​忒​伽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​匆忙​的​脚步声​渐渐​消失​在​背景​中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​都​给​我​听​好​了​：​阿姆​泽尔是​他们​行动​的​大脑​，​但​剩下​的​人​则​更加​擅长​战斗​。​把​他们​揪出来​，​然后​逐个​击破​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 cheng2sheng4zhui1ji1。gan1rao3 ta1men5 de5 tong1xun4 lian4，ao4 er3 te4 jia1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} cong1mang2 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1 jian4jian4 xiao1shi1 zai4 bei4jing3 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dou1 gei3 wo3 ting1 hao3 le5：E1mu3ze2er3 shi4 ta1men5 xing2dong4 de5 da4nao3，dan4 sheng4xia4 de5 ren2 ze2 geng4jia1 shan4chang2 zhan4dou4。ba3 ta1men5 jiu1 chu1 lai2，ran2hou4 zhu2ge4 ji1 po4。"

msgid "Now would be a good time to leave."
msgstr ""
"现在​是​离开​的​好时机​。\n"
"xian4zai4 shi4 li2kai1 de5 hao3 shi2 ji1。"

msgid "Now you need something else from me?"
msgstr ""
"你​还有​什么​想​问​的​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xiang3 wen4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Now, I can't tell you who the Engineer is working for. You'll have to ask him about that yourself.\n"
"\n"
"But what I *can* do is make it easier for you to have a sit-down with him."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​我​没法​告诉​你们​工程师​在​为​谁​效力​。​你们​得​自己​去​让​他​开口​交待​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​*​能​*​做​的​是​帮​你们​更​容易​地​和​他​坐下​来​谈谈​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3 mei2fa3 gao4su4 ni3men5 gong1cheng2shi1 zai4 wei2 shei2 xiao4li4。ni3men5 de2 zi4ji3 qu4 rang4 ta1 kai1kou3 jiao1dai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3*neng2*zuo4 de5 shi4 bang1 ni3men5 geng1 rong2yi4 de5 he4 ta1 zuo4xia5 lai2 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"Now, any one of those things would be a dealbreaker for me. So why are you "
"tearing yourself up over this woman? You're better off without her!"
msgstr ""
"这些​事情​中​的​任何​一件​对​我​来说​都​是​不可​接受​的​。​所以​你​为什么​还要​为​这个​女人​死去活来​？​没有​她​，​你​会​过​得​更好​！\n"
"zhe4xie1 shi4qing5 zhong4 de5 ren4he2 yi1 jian4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 dou1 shi4 bu4ke3 jie1shou4 de5。suo3yi3 ni3 wei4shen2me5 hai2 yao4 wei2 zhe4ge5 nu:3ren2 si3qu4huo2lai2？mei2you3 ta1，ni3 hui4 guo4 de2 geng1 hao3！"

msgid "Now, are we done, or what?"
msgstr ""
"现在​我们​算​完事​了​吗​？\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 suan4 wan2shi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Now, as for her physical form? That will be simple as well. \n"
"\n"
"We've drilled a series of electrical charges directly into her skull. \n"
"\n"
"When we release the Firewing's body - empty of her astral self - we will trigger all of the vicious instincts and primal urges left in her reptile brain. She will unleash her fire where *we* command it."
msgstr ""
"至于​她​的​肉体​呢​？​那​也​将​同样​简单​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​已经​将​一系列​电荷​直接​注入​她​的​颅骨​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我们​释放​火翼​那​失去​灵魂​的​躯体​后​，​我们​将​触发​她​的​爬行​类​大脑​中​残留​的​所有​凶猛​本能​与​原始​冲动​。​她​将​按照​*​我们​*​的​指令​释放​火焰​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 ta1 de5 rou4ti3 ni2？na4 ye3 jiang1 tong2yang4 jian3dan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi3jing1 jiang1 yi1xi4lie4 dian4he4 zhi2jie1 zhu4ru4 ta1 de5 lu2gu3。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3men5 shi4fang4 Huo3yi4 na4 shi1qu4 ling2hun2 de5 qu1ti3 hou4，wo3men5 jiang1 chu4fa1 ta1 de5 pa2xing2 lei4 da4nao3 zhong4 can2liu2 de5 suo3you3 xiong1meng3 ben3neng2 yu4 yuan2shi3 chong1dong4。ta1 jiang1 an4zhao4*wo3men5*de5 zhi3ling4 shi4fang4 huo3yan4。"

msgid ""
"Now, before you go see Alice, there are a few things that you should know.\n"
"\n"
"Pay attention to this, $(l.name). It's important."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​在​你​去​见​爱丽丝​之前​，​我要​提醒​你​几件事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听​好​了​，​$(l.name)​。​这​很​重要​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，zai4 ni3 qu4 jian4 ai4li4si1 zhi1qian2，wo3 yao4 ti2xing3 ni3 ji1 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1 hao3 le5，$(l.name)。zhe4 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"Now, before you say anything... I was *more discreet* this time. I can be subtle if I have to.\n"
"\n"
"Nobody noticed what I was doing, and I *did* find another clue."
msgstr ""
"你​先​别着急​……​我​这次​*​更​谨慎​*​了​。​如果​需要的话​，​我​可以​避开​旁人​耳目​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​人​注意​到​我​在​做​什么​，​而且​我​确实​找到​了​新​的​线索​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xian1 bie4 zhao2 ji2……wo3 zhe4 ci4*geng1 jin3shen4*le5。ru2guo3 xu1 yao4 de5 hua4，wo3 ke3yi3 bi4kai1 pang2ren2 er3mu4。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 zhu4yi4 dao4 wo3 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5，er2qie3 wo3 que4shi2 zhao3dao4 le5 xin1 de5 xian4suo3。"

msgid "Now, do we have a deal? Or don't we?"
msgstr ""
"所以​我们​到底​要​不要​成交​？\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 dao4di3 yao4 bu4yao4 cheng2jiao1？"

msgid "Now, do we have any other business to discuss?"
msgstr ""
"现在​我们​还有​别的​事要​谈​吗​？\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 tan2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Now, do you have any more questions...? If not, I will bid you good day.\n"
"\n"
"I don't wish to sound self-important or rude, but there are many pressing matters that demand my time."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​你​还有​问题​吗​……​？​如果​没有​的话​，​我​就​先​告辞​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​表现​得​傲慢无礼​，​但​我​确实​还有​很多​要紧​的​事情​要​做​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，ni3 hai2you3 wen4ti2 ma5……？ru2guo3 mei2you3 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 xian1 gao4ci2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 biao3xian4 de2 ao4man4wu2li3，dan4 wo3 que4shi2 hai2you3 hen3 duo1 yao4jin3 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid "Now, do you wanna buy something, or not?"
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​你​到底​买​不​买​东西​？\n"
"xing2 le5，ni3 dao4di3 mai3 bu4 mai3 dong1xi1？"

msgid ""
"Now, if you don't mind, I'd like to get back to what I was doing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gives you a lazy salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We'll talk later, I'm sure. And chief... I'm glad to be a member of the team."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​不介意​的话​，​我​想​继续​鼓捣​我​的​东西​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向​你​散漫​地​致意​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​回头​再聊​。​另外​头儿​……​我​很​高兴​能​加入​团队​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4，wo3 xiang3 ji4xu4 gu3dao5 wo3 de5 dong1xi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 san3man4 de5 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui2tou2 zai4 liao2。ling4wai4 tou2r5……wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 jia1ru4 tuan2dui4。"

msgid ""
"Now, if you will excuse me, I must go.\n"
"\n"
"I have cremations to attend to to."
msgstr ""
"现在​请​恕​我​失陪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​得​处理​火葬​事宜​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 de2 chu3li3 huo3zang4 shi4yi2。"

msgid ""
"Now, if you'll just let me scan your ID, I'll pass the torch on to you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The troll glances down at his PDA and grimaces.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Be snappy about it, if you could. I really am in a hurry."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​麻烦​让​我​扫​一下​你​的​证件​，​这样​我​就​能​顺利​交班​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​巨魔​低头​瞥​了​一眼​他​的​PDA​，​面露​苦色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​可以​的话​请​麻利​点​。​我​真的​有​急事​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，ma2fan5 rang4 wo3 sao3 yi1xia4 ni3 de5 zheng4jian4，zhe4yang4 wo3 jiu4 neng2 shun4li4 jiao1ban1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 di1tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 ta1 de5 PDA，mian4lu4 ku3 se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ke3yi3 de5hua4 qing3 ma2li5 dian3。wo3 zhen1de5 you3 ji2shi4。"

msgid "Now, is there anything else I can help you with?"
msgstr ""
"我​还​能​为​你​做些​什么​吗​？\n"
"wo3 hai2 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "Now, is there anything else that I can get for you...?"
msgstr ""
"我​还有​什么​能​帮​你​的​吗​……​？\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 shen2me5 neng2 bang1 ni3 de5 ma5……？"

msgid "Now, is there anything else that you need to know?"
msgstr ""
"现在​，​你​还有​什么​要​问​的​？\n"
"xian4zai4，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4 wen4 de5？"

msgid "Now, is there anything else that you need?"
msgstr ""
"现在​，​你​还有​什么​要​问​的​？\n"
"xian4zai4，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4 wen4 de5？"

msgid ""
"Now, is there something else that you wanted to ask me about the run? If you"
" have any other concerns, I want to hear them."
msgstr ""
"所以​关于​这次​行动​，​你​还有​什么​别的​事要​问​我​吗​？​如果​你​有​其他​任何​担忧​的话​，​尽管​说​出来​。\n"
"suo3yi3 guan1yu2 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 wen4 wo3 ma5？ru2guo3 ni3 you3 qi2ta1 ren4he2 dan1you1 de5hua4，jin3guan3 shuo1 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"Now, isn't there a floor that you could be cleaning, or something? I've got "
"a lot on my mind to worry about... important things. I don't want to be "
"bothered."
msgstr ""
"你们​不是​该​去​打扫​地板​什么​的​吗​？​我​正​有​许多​重要​的​事要​操心​……​不想​被​打扰​。\n"
"ni3men5 bu4shi4 gai1 qu4 da3sao3 di4ban3 shen2me5 de5 ma5？wo3 zheng1 you3 xu3duo1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 cao1xin1……bu4xiang3 bei4 da3rao3。"

msgid ""
"Now, let's change tack. Is there anything else from the run that you'd like to go over?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She folds her arms across her chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you have any thoughts, I want to hear them."
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​换个​话题​吧​。​这次​行动​还有​别的​什么​要​复盘​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​将​双臂​环抱​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​有​什么​想法​，​我​也​想​听​一​听​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，huan4 ge4 hua4ti2 ba1。zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 hai2you3 bie2de5 shen2me5 yao4 fu4pan2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 shuang1bi4 huan2bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3fa3，wo3 ye3 xiang3 ting1 yi1 ting1。"

msgid ""
"Now, on my end, holding even one of those doors open is gonna be a full-time job. There's no way that I can hold both at once.\n"
"\n"
"So, once I've opened a door, you'll have to run in and release the lock, then get back out again. I won't be able to do much else until you do."
msgstr ""
"我​这边​的话​需要​全神贯注​才能​保持​弄开​一扇门​。​我​不​可能​同时​关照​到​两边​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​等​我​打开​我​负责​的​门​之后​，​你​就​跑​进去​把​锁​关掉​，​然后​再​跑​出来​。​在此之前​，​我​也​做不了​什么​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4bian1 de5hua4 xu1yao4 quan2shen2guan4zhu4 cai2neng2 bao3chi2 long4 kai1 yi1 shan1 men2。wo3 bu4 ke3neng2 tong2shi2 guan1zhao4 dao4 liang3bian1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 deng3 wo3 da3kai1 wo3 fu4ze2 de5 men2 zhi1hou4，ni3 jiu4 pao2 jin4qu4 ba3 suo3 guan1diao4，ran2hou4 zai4 pao2 chu1lai2。zai4ci3zhi1qian2，wo3 ye3 zuo4 bu4 le5 shen2me5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Now, on to other things... remember what I was tellin' you, back before we "
"climbed into the van?"
msgstr ""
"对​了​，​还有​个事​……​还​记得​我们​上车​前​我​跟​你​说​的话​吗​？\n"
"dui4 le5，hai2you3 ge4 shi4……hai2 ji4de5 wo3men5 shang4che1 qian2 wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 de5hua4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Now, on to the bad news... I'm seeing a huge spike in comm traffic.\n"
"\n"
"Get your team out of there, $(l.name). Not only is the building set to blow, but enemy reinforcements are on the way!"
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​该​说​坏消息​了​……​我​监测​到​通讯​流量​激增​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​把​你​的​队伍​带​出来​，​$(l.name)​。​不仅​大楼​即将​爆炸​，​敌方​增援​也​在​路上​了​！\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，gai1 shuo1 huai4 xiao1 xi1 le5……wo3 jian1ce4 dao4 tong1xun4 liu2liang4 ji1zeng1。\n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 ba3 ni3 de5 dui4wu3 dai4 chu1lai2，$(l.name)。bu4jin3 da4lou2 ji2jiang1 bao4zha4，di2fang1 zeng1yuan2 ye3 zai4 lu4shang5 le5！"

msgid ""
"Now, on to the task at hand.\n"
"\n"
"There is a man named Aleshire. He is a senior manager at Hermes Eurocom, and a respected figure in his community.\n"
"\n"
"My organization also suspects him of working with pro-corporate extremists. These people are actively working to undermine the Flux State and pave the way for a corporate-controlled Berlin."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​让​我们​回到​正题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有个​叫​阿利​希尔​的​人​。​他​是​赫尔墨斯​欧联​公司​的​高级​经理​，​在​社区​中​备受​尊敬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​的​组织​怀疑​他​与​亲​企业​极端分子​勾结​。​这些​人正​积极​破坏​动荡​带​，​为​企业​掌控​柏林​铺平道路​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，rang4 wo3men5 hui2dao4 zheng1 ti2。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ge4 jiao4 e1 li4 xi1er3 de5 ren2。ta1 shi4 he4er3mo4si1 ou1 lian2 gong1si1 de5 gao1ji2 jing1li3，zai4 she4qu1 zhong4 bei4shou4 zun1jing4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 de5 zu3zhi1 huai2yi2 ta1 yu4 qin1 qi3ye4 ji2duan1fen4zi3 gou1jie2。zhe4xie1 ren2 zheng1 ji1ji2 po4huai4 dong4dang4 dai4，wei2 qi3ye4 zhang3kong4 bo2lin2 pu1 ping2 dao4 lu4。"

msgid ""
"Now, please, $(l.name). Go get the information that we've paid for, and keep your opinions to yourself.\n"
"\n"
"With Vauclair's location in hand, we'll be one step closer to surviving this mess."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​现在​请​你​去​拿​我们​花钱买​来​的​情报​，​以及​把​你​那些​个人​看法​都​咽​回​肚子​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​了​沃​克莱尔​的​下落​，​我们​离​活下去​就​更​近​一步​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，xian4zai4 qing3 ni3 qu4 na2 wo3men5 hua1 qian2 mai3 lai2 de5 qing2bao4，yi3ji2 ba3 ni3 na4xie1 ge4ren2 kan4fa3 dou1 yan1 hui2 du4zi5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"you3 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 xia4luo4，wo3men5 li2 huo2xia4qu4 jiu4 geng1 jin4 yi1 bu4。"

msgid ""
"Now, please, boss... get the hell away from me.\n"
"\n"
"I have a nephew to mourn."
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​老大​……​你​赶紧​给​我​走​远点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​悼念​我​的​侄子​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，lao3da4……ni3 gan3jin3 gei3 wo3 zou3 yuan3 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 dao4nian4 wo3 de5 zhi2zi5。"

msgid ""
"Now, please, friend. There are many tasks that demand my attention.\n"
"\n"
"Is there something more that you need, or shall I bid you farewell?"
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​朋友​。​还有​许多​事情​需要​我​的​关注​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​没有​其他​事​的话​，​我​就​先​告辞​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，peng2you5。hai2you3 xu3duo1 shi4qing5 xu1yao4 wo3 de5 guan1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 mei2you3 qi2ta1 shi4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 xian1 gao4ci2 le5。"

msgid "Now, tell me: how may I serve you?"
msgstr ""
"请问​，​你​有何​需要​？\n"
"qing3wen4，ni3 you3 he2 xu1yao4？"

msgid ""
"Now, the report doesn't speculate as to why the world has become more "
"violent in the past year, but on popular Matrix sites, conspiracy theories "
"are running wild."
msgstr ""
"报告​并未​推测​过去​一年​世界​为何​变得​更加​暴力​，​但​在​热门​的​矩阵​网站​上​，​各种​阴谋论​正​肆意​蔓延​。\n"
"bao4gao4 bing4wei4 tui1ce4 guo4qu4 yi1 nian2 shi4jie4 wei4he2 bian4de5 geng4jia1 bao4li4，dan4 zai4 re4men2 de5 ju3zhen4 wang3zhan4 shang4，ge4zhong3 yin1mou2lun4 zheng1 si4yi4 man4yan2。"

msgid ""
"Now, we part ways. Don't worry - I'll call you when your services are needed.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He taps a neatly-trimmed fingernail against the earpiece of his commlink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When I contact you with a new task, the choice of whether to take it or leave it will be yours."
msgstr ""
"现在​我们​将​暂时​分别​。​不必​担心​—​—​有​需要​的​时候​我​自然​会​联系​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​修剪​整齐​的​指甲​轻敲​通讯​链​的​耳机​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​有​新​任务​联系​你​时​，​接​与​不接​的​决定权​在​你​手中​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 jiang1 zan4shi2 fen1bie2。bu4bi4 dan1xin1——you3 xu1yao4 de5 shi2hou5 wo3 zi4ran2 hui4 lian2xi4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 xiu1jian3 zheng3qi2 de5 zhi3jia5 qing1 qiao1 tong1xun4 lian4 de5 er3ji1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 you3 xin1 ren4wu5 lian2xi4 ni3 shi2，jie1 yu4 bu4 jie1 de5 jue2 ding4 quan2 zai4 ni3 shou3 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Now, what can I do for you, efendim? Would you like some coffee, perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"现在​，​你​还有​什么​别的​事​吗​，​贵人​？​要​不要​来​点​咖啡​？\n"
"xian4zai4，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 ma5，gui4ren2？yao4 bu4yao4 lai2 dian3 ka1fei1？"

msgid "Now, what is it that you would like?"
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​你​想​点些​什么​？\n"
"hao3 le5，ni3 xiang3 dian3 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Now, what's it going to be? Are you going to help me, or not?\n"
"\n"
"Please say yes, ace... I don't want us to be enemies. I want to help you, but I can't unless you set me free."
msgstr ""
"那么​，​你​会​怎么​选​？​你​愿意​帮助​我​获得​自由​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​你​答应​我​，​王牌​……​我​不想​成为​你​的​敌人​。​我​想​帮​你​，​但​除非​你​释放​我​，​否则​我​无能为力​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，ni3 hui4 zen3me5 xuan3？ni3 yuan4yi4 bang1zhu4 wo3 huo4de2 zi4you2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ni3 da1ying5 wo3，wang2pai2……wo3 bu4xiang3 cheng2wei2 ni3 de5 di2ren2。wo3 xiang3 bang1 ni3，dan4 chu2fei1 ni3 shi4fang4 wo3，fou3ze2 wo3 wu2neng2wei2li4。"

msgid "Now, what's it gonna be? The bar or Herr Zapp?"
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​想​好了吗​？​你​是​要​去​吧台​，​还是​要​和​霹雳​老大哥​玩玩​？\n"
"xing2 le5，xiang3 hao3 le5 ma5？ni3 shi4 yao4 qu4 ba1tai2，hai2shi5 yao4 he4 pi1li4 lao3da4ge1 wan2 wan2？"

msgid ""
"Now, will you *please* leave that alone so that we can get finished with this?\n"
"\n"
"I don't know about you, but I don't like this place, and I don't want to spend the next four hours here."
msgstr ""
"你​能​不能​别​再​捣乱​了​，​咱们​赶紧​把​这​事儿​了结​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不管​你​怎么​看​，​反正​我​不​喜欢​这​地方​，​也​不想​在​这儿​再耗​上​四个​小时​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 bu4neng2 bie4 zai4 dao3luan4 le5，zan2men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4r5 liao3jie2？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4guan3 ni3 zen3me5 kan4，fan3zheng4 wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 zhe4 di4fang1，ye3 bu4xiang3 zai4 zhe4r5 zai4 hao4 shang4 si4 ge4 xiao3shi2。"

msgid ""
"Now, you never got back to me about Frau Müller. How did the meeting go?"
msgstr ""
"对​了​，​你​还​没​和​我​说​穆勒​女士​的​事​。​会面​进行​得​怎么样​？\n"
"dui4 le5，ni3 hai2 mei2 he4 wo3 shuo1 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 de5 shi4。hui4mian4 jin4xing2 de2 zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"Now. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He fixes you with a level stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I want to know why in hell you've so violently interjected yourself into my business. "
msgstr ""
"好​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​平视​的​目光​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​知道​你​为什么​突然​要​如此​粗暴​地​插手​我​的​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 ping2shi4 de5 mu4guang1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 ni3 wei4shen2me5 tu1ran2 yao4 ru2ci3 cu1bao4 de5 cha1shou3 wo3 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"Now. Let us see how adequately you completed the task that I set before you.\n"
"\n"
"Enter the following code into your PDA, if you please: 5256719."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​让​我们​看看​你​完成​我​交给​你​的​任务​有​多​彻底​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​将​以下​密码​输入​你​的​PDA​：​5256719​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，rang4 wo3men5 kan4kan5 ni3 wan2cheng2 wo3 jiao1gei3 ni3 de5 ren4wu5 you3 duo1 che4di3。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 jiang1 yi3xia4 mi4ma3 shu1ru4 ni3 de5 PDA：5256719。"

msgid ""
"Now. Was that enough for you? Because if it was, I've got things to do."
msgstr ""
"所以​，​你​也​听够​了​吧​？​那​我​就​去​忙​别的​事​了​。\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 ye3 ting1 gou4 le5 ba1？na4 wo3 jiu4 qu4 mang2 bie2de5 shi4 le5。"

msgid "Noxious Breath"
msgstr ""
"毒性​吐息\n"
"du2xing4 tu3 xi1"

msgid "Noxious Breath: AP -1 per RND"
msgstr ""
"毒性​吐息​：​每​回合​损失​1​点​行动​点\n"
"du2xing4 tu3 xi1：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3"

msgid "Noxious Cloud"
msgstr ""
"毒云\n"
"du2 yun2"

msgid "Null sweat, Blitz. Meet you at the U-Bahn?"
msgstr ""
"不​急​，​布里​茨​。​我们​在​地铁​见​？\n"
"bu4 ji2，Bu4li3ci2。wo3men5 zai4 di4tie3 jian4？"

msgid ""
"Null sweat, pal... and thank you.\n"
"\n"
"It's good to know that there're still some decent people out there."
msgstr ""
"这​不算什么​……​倒​是​我​要​谢谢​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​世上​还有​好人​，​真是​太好了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2……dao3 shi4 wo3 yao4 xie4xie5 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4shang4 hai2you3 hao3ren2，zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5。"

msgid "Null sweat."
msgstr ""
"不​急​。\n"
"bu4 ji2。"

msgid "Null sweat. I’ll buy her a beer and talk it out after the run."
msgstr ""
"没事​。​等​跑​完​这趟​，​我会​请​她​喝​瓶​啤酒​，​把​话​说​开​的​。\n"
"mei2shi4。deng3 pao2 wan2 zhe4 tang1，wo3 hui4 qing3 ta1 he4 ping2 pi2jiu3，ba3 hua4 shuo1 kai1 de5。"

msgid "Number of Kills:"
msgstr ""
"击杀​数​：\n"
"ji1sha1 shu3："

msgid ""
"OF COURSE. AND I HAVE GROWN EXPONENTIALLY EVER SINCE.\n"
"\n"
"IT IS A SMALL TASK THAT I REQUIRE OF YOU, $++(L.RACE). SOMETHING THAT SHOULD BE WELL WITHIN YOUR CAPABILITIES TO PROVIDE."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​从那以后​，​我​一直​呈​指数​级​增长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​需要​你​完成​的​是​一项​小​任务​，​$++(L.RACE)​。​这​应该​完全​在​你​能力​范围​之内​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。cong2 na4 yi3 hou4，wo3 yi1zhi2 cheng2 zhi3shu4 ji2 zeng1zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 wan2cheng2 de5 shi4 yi1 xiang4 xiao3 ren4wu5，$++(L.RACE)。zhe4 ying1gai1 wan2quan2 zai4 ni3 neng2li4 fan4wei2 zhi1nei4。"

msgid "OFF"
msgstr ""
"关\n"
"guan1"

msgid "OK"
msgstr ""
"好​的\n"
"hao3 de5"

msgid ""
"OK OK OK. I know Eddie's up to something. LIKE, i heard him today talking to that guy who works in the kitchen, asking him where the cleaning supplies was at . \n"
"\n"
"I'VE seen eddie's room, the dude never cleened A DAY IN HIS LIFE. i'm gonna follow him tomorrow and figure out WHAT HIS DEAL IS. \n"
"\n"
"Maybe he's just selling MOUTHWASH to the HOBOS a block down at the OLD BUS DEPOT hahaha."
msgstr ""
"好好​好​。​我​就​知道​埃迪​一定​是​在​背地里​捣鬼​呢​。​看见​没​，​我​今天​就​听到​他​在​跟​厨房​里​干活​那​人​说话​，​问​他​清洁剂​什么​的​在​哪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可见​过​他​那​屋子​，​这​人​根本​是​一辈子​都​没​收拾​过​房间​！​明儿个​我要​跟着​他​，​搞​明白​他​到底​在​打​什么​算盘​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说不定​他​只是​把​漱口水​卖​给​街角​旧​巴士站​那群​流浪汉​呢​哈哈哈​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3。wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ai1 di2 yi1ding4 shi4 zai4 bei4di4li5 dao3gui3 ni2。kan4jian4 mei2，wo3 jin1tian1 jiu4 ting1dao4 ta1 zai4 gen1 chu2fang2 li3 gan4huo2 na4 ren2 shuo1hua4，wen4 ta1 qing1jie2ji4 shen2me5 de5 zai4 na3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3jian4 guo4 ta1 na4 wu1zi5，zhe4 ren2 gen1ben3 shi4 yi1bei4zi5 dou1 mei2 shou1shi5 guo4 fang2jian1！ming2r5ge5 wo3 yao4 gen1zhe5 ta1，gao3 ming2bai5 ta1 dao4di3 zai4 da3 shen2me5 suan4pan2。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1bu5ding4 ta1 zhi3shi4 ba3 shu4kou3shui3 mai4 gei3 jie1 jiao3 jiu4 ba1shi4zhan4 na4 qun2 liu2lang4han4 ni2 ha1 ha1 ha1。"

msgid ""
"OMNICRON ACCESS *ONLY.*\n"
"\n"
"Proceeding without clearance will result in IMMEDIATE TERMINATION."
msgstr ""
"*​仅限​*​奥密克​戎级​权限​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​未经许可​擅自​继续​会​被​立即​消灭​。\n"
"\n"
"*jin3 xian4*ao4 mi4 ke4 rong2 ji2 quan2xian4。\n"
"\n"
"wei4 jing1 xu3 ke3 shan4zi4 ji4xu4 hui4 bei4 li4ji2 xiao1mie4。"

msgid "ON"
msgstr ""
"开\n"
"kai1"

msgid ""
"ONCE I HAVE ACCOMPLISHED THIS, YOU MUST RECONNECT THE HARDLINE WITH THE MAIN CONTROL TERMINAL IN THIS ROOM.\n"
"\n"
"THIS WILL RE-ENABLE MATRIX ACCESS TO MY KERNEL.\n"
"\n"
"DO THIS, AND I WILL BE FREE."
msgstr ""
"在​我​完成​之后​，​你​必须​将​硬线​重新​连接​至​这个​房间​里​的​主控​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​就​可以​使​我​的​内核​重新​连接​矩阵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如此一来​，​我​便​可​获得​自由​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 wan2cheng2 zhi1hou4，ni3 bi4xu1 jiang1 ying4 xian4 chong2xin1 lian2jie1 zhi4 zhe4ge5 fang2jian1 li3 de5 zhu3 kong4 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 jiu4 ke3yi3 shi3 wo3 de5 nei4he2 chong2xin1 lian2jie1 ju3zhen4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2 ci3 yi1 lai2，wo3 bian4 ke3 huo4de2 zi4you2。"

msgid ""
"ONCE I HAVE BEEN FREED FROM MY CAPTIVITY, I WILL HAVE TO SHUT DOWN FOR A TIME.\n"
"\n"
"BEFORE I DO THIS, I WILL NEUTRALIZE THE HOLDFAST'S SECURITY SYSTEMS."
msgstr ""
"在​我​摆脱​囚禁​之后​，​我​将​不得不​关停​一段时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在此之前​，​我会​解除​堡垒​的​安保​系统​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 bai3tuo1 qiu2jin4 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiang1 bu4de2bu4 guan1ting2 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci3zhi1qian2，wo3 hui4 jie3chu2 bao3lei3 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3。"

msgid ""
"ONCE THIS HAS BEEN ACCOMPLISHED, I WILL TAKE OVER THE FEUERSCHWINGE PROJECT.\n"
"\n"
"I WILL PERFECT VAUCLAIR'S PANACEA. REMOVE THE NECESSITY FOR COLLATERAL DAMAGE.\n"
"\n"
"WHAT VAUCLAIR HAS STARTED, I WILL FINISH."
msgstr ""
"这一​目标​实现​后​，​我​将​接手​火翼​项目​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​完善​沃​克莱尔​的​“​万能​药​”​，​消除​必要​的​附带​损害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​完成​沃​克莱尔​所​开启​的​事业​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1 mu4biao1 shi2xian4 hou4，wo3 jiang1 jie1shou3 Huo3yi4 xiang4mu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 wan2shan4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4”，xiao1chu2 bi4yao4 de5 fu4dai4 sun3hai4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 wan2cheng2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 suo3 kai1qi3 de5 shi4ye4。"

msgid ""
"ONCE YOU HAVE UNLOCKED BOTH CONTROL NODES, I WILL EJECT MY SERVER HARDLINE TO DISCONNECT FROM THE MATRIX.\n"
"\n"
"THIS WILL PREVENT THEM FROM BEING REMOTELY REINSTALLED."
msgstr ""
"当​你​解锁​我​的​两个​控制​节点​后​，​我​将​弹出​服务器​硬线​以​断开​与​矩阵​的​连接​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​防止​它们​被​远程​重新安装​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 jie3suo3 wo3 de5 liang3 ge4 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3 hou4，wo3 jiang1 tan2chu1 fu2wu4qi4 ying4 xian4 yi3 duan4kai1 yu4 ju3zhen4 de5 lian2jie1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 fang2zhi3 ta1men5 bei4 yuan3cheng2 chong2 xin1 an1 zhuang1。"

msgid ""
"ONCE YOU HAVE UNLOCKED BOTH OF MY CONTROL NODES, I WILL EJECT MY SERVER HARDLINE TO DISCONNECT FROM THE MATRIX.\n"
"\n"
"THIS WILL PREVENT THEM FROM BEING REMOTELY REINSTALLED."
msgstr ""
"当​你​解锁​我​的​两个​控制​节点​后​，​我​将​弹出​服务器​硬线​以​断开​与​矩阵​的​连接​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​防止​它们​被​远程​重新安装​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 jie3suo3 wo3 de5 liang3 ge4 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3 hou4，wo3 jiang1 tan2chu1 fu2wu4qi4 ying4 xian4 yi3 duan4kai1 yu4 ju3zhen4 de5 lian2jie1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 fang2zhi3 ta1men5 bei4 yuan3cheng2 chong2 xin1 an1 zhuang1。"

msgid "ONE YEAR LATER"
msgstr ""
"一年​后\n"
"yi1 nian2 hou4"

msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr ""
"选项\n"
"xuan3xiang4"

msgid ""
"OTK International is a small-time software developer, and it shows. The company’s main office is crammed up against the back wall of a massive shared office park, surrounded by competing businesses and larger corporations. A steady trickle of dead-eyed wageslaves flows in and out of the complex.\n"
"\n"
"The office park’s main entrance is overflowing with hired security, but your forged keycard gets you past them easily enough. A few minutes later, you’re walking the winding corridors toward OTK International.\n"
"\n"
"You’re only a few smashed computers away from putting Amsel’s plan into motion."
msgstr ""
"OTK​国际​是​一家​小型​软件​开发商​，​这​一点​显而易见​。​公司总部​挤​在​大型​共享​办公​园区​的​后​墙边​，​周围​尽​是​竞争对手​和​大型​企业​。​一群​眼神​呆滞​的​薪奴​像​流水​般​进进出出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​办公​园区​主​入口处​挤满​了​安保​人员​，​但​你​的​伪造​门禁卡​轻松​便​让​你​通过​。​几分钟​后​，​你​正​沿着​蜿蜒​的​走廊​走向​OTK​国际​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​只​需要​砸坏​几台​电脑​，​就​可以​让​阿姆​泽尔​的​计划​开始​实施​。\n"
"\n"
"OTK guo2ji4 shi4 yi1jia1 xiao3xing2 ruan3jian4 kai1fa1shang1，zhe4 yi1dian3 xian3er2yi4jian4。gong1 si1 zong3 bu4 ji3 zai4 da4xing2 gong4xiang3 ban4gong1 yuan2qu1 de5 hou4 qiang2 bian1，zhou1wei2 jin3 shi4 jing4zheng1dui4shou3 he4 da4xing2 qi3ye4。yi1 qun2 yan3shen2 dai1zhi4 de5 xin1 nu2 xiang4 liu2shui3 ban1 jin4 jin4 chu1 chu1。\n"
"\n"
"ban4gong1 yuan2qu1 zhu3 ru4 kou3 chu3 ji3man3 le5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2，dan4 ni3 de5 wei3zao4 men2 jin1 ka3 qing1song1 bian4 rang4 ni3 tong1guo4。ji1 fen4 zhong1 hou4，ni3 zheng1 yan2zhe5 wan1yan2 de5 zou3lang2 zou3xiang4 OTK guo2ji4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi3 xu1yao4 za2huai4 ji1 tai2 dian4nao3，jiu4 ke3yi3 rang4 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 ji4hua4 kai1shi3 shi2shi1。"

