msgid ""
"Of all those in the Kreuzbasar, would Mr. Laine be your first choice of "
"target? Crippled or no, he's still one of the most dangerous men here. (h)"
msgstr ""
"放眼​整个​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​你​会​把​莱恩​先生​当作​第一​目标​吗​？​不管​残疾​与否​，​他​仍然​是​这里​最​危险​的​人​之一​。\n"
"fang4yan3 zheng3ge4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，ni3 hui4 ba3 lai2en1 xian1sheng5 dang4zuo4 di4yi1 mu4biao1 ma5？bu4guan3 can2ji2 yu3fou3，ta1 reng2ran2 shi4 zhe4li3 zui4 wei1xian3 de5 ren2 zhi1yi1。"

msgid ""
"Of course I did. But in the end, I decided that it was the right thing to "
"do."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​但​到​最后​，​我​认为​这样​做​是​正确​的​。\n"
"dang1ran2。dan4 dao4 zui4hou4，wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 zheng4que4 de5。"

msgid "Of course I was. I'm always right."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​我​从来​不会错​。\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 cong2lai2 bu4 hui4 cuo4。"

msgid "Of course I'm back, this is home. And it should be safe again."
msgstr ""
"我​当然​要​回来​。​这里​可是​我​的​家​。​而且​危险​现在​应该​都​解除​了​。\n"
"wo3 dang1ran2 yao4 hui2lai5。zhe4li3 ke3shi4 wo3 de5 jia1。er2qie3 wei1xian3 xian4zai4 ying1gai1 dou1 jie3chu2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Of course he was. But he couldn't have done it if I hadn't allowed myself to be used.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away from the tri-vid player and stalks past you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​但​要不是​我​允许​自己​被​利用​的话​，​他​也​不​可能​得逞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转身​离开​3D​影像​机​，​静静​走过​你​的​身边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。dan4 yao4bu5shi4 wo3 yun3xu3 zi4ji3 bei4 li4yong4 de5hua4，ta1 ye3 bu4 ke3neng2 de2cheng3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 3D ying3xiang4 ji1，jing4 jing4 zou3guo4 ni3 de5 shen1bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1。"

msgid "Of course it is."
msgstr ""
"那​当然​。\n"
"na4 dang1ran2。"

msgid "Of course it is. Now get in the van. We've got a delivery to make."
msgstr ""
"那​当然​。​现在​上车​吧​，​我们​要​去​送货​。\n"
"na4 dang1ran2。xian4zai4 shang4che1 ba1，wo3men5 yao4 qu4 song4huo4。"

msgid ""
"Of course it is. So much nicer than living on the street, isn't it?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory's face is kind, but her tone is one of incredible sorrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You be good, sweetie. Don't you worry... we'll take care of Marta."
msgstr ""
"当然​了​。​比起​流落​街头​，​这里​可​好多​了​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​的​脸庞​和善​，​但​语气​中​却​透​着​难以​言喻​的​悲伤​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​乖​一点​，​亲爱​的​。​别​担心​……​我们​会​照顾​好玛​尔塔​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 le5。bi3qi3 liu2luo4 jie1tou2，zhe4li3 ke3 hao3duo1 le5，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 lian3pang2 he2shan4，dan4 yu3qi4 zhong4 que4 tou4 zhao2 nan2yi3 yan2yu4 de5 bei1shang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 guai1 yi1dian3，qin1ai4 de5。bie4 dan1xin1……wo3men5 hui4 zhao4gu5 hao3 Ma3er3ta3 de5。"

msgid "Of course it would. Say, how'd that situation with your ex turn out?"
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​话​说​，​你​前女友​那边​咋样​了​？\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。hua4 shuo1，ni3 qian2nu:3you3 na4bian5 za3 yang4 le5？"

msgid "Of course not. I was just curious."
msgstr ""
"当然​不​。​我​只是​好奇​而已​。\n"
"dang1ran2 bu4。wo3 zhi3shi4 hao4qi2 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"Of course not. Your job will be relatively simple.\n"
"\n"
"I want you to bring the building down."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​你​的​任务​非常简单​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​你​炸掉​整座​大楼​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。ni3 de5 ren4wu5 fei1 chang2 jian3 dan1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ni3 zha4diao4 zheng3 zuo4 da4lou2。"

msgid "Of course there is. What is it?"
msgstr ""
"想​也​知道​。​什么​情况​？\n"
"xiang3 ye3 zhi1dao4。shen2me5 qing2kuang4？"

msgid ""
"Of course they won't! Do what you must - you've earned it!\n"
"\n"
"Farewell, stalwart $(scene.badfantasy). We will remember you always!"
msgstr ""
"当然​！​去​做​你​该​做​的​事情​吧​—​—​这​是​你​应得​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​，​坚毅​的​$(scene.badfantasy)​。​我们​将​永远​记得​你​！\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2！qu4 zuo4 ni3 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 ba1——zhe4 shi4 ni3 ying1de2 de5！\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4，jian1yi4 de5 $(scene.badfantasy)。wo3men5 jiang1 yong3yuan3 ji4de5 ni3！"

msgid ""
"Of course you are! And as a wandering knight, your job is legendary heroism!\n"
"\n"
"I will sing your tale to my peasants, and they will rejoice!"
msgstr ""
"当然​！​作为​一名​游侠​骑士​，​你​的​使命​将​汇作​英雄​般的​传奇​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​将​你​的​故事​唱​给​我​的​臣民​们​，​他们​将​为​之​欢呼​！\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2！zuo4wei2 yi1 ming2 you2Xia2qi2shi4，ni3 de5 shi3ming4 jiang1 hui4 zuo4 ying1xiong2 ban1 de5 chuan2qi2！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jiang1 ni3 de5 gu4shi4 chang4 gei3 wo3 de5 chen2min2 men5，ta1men5 jiang1 wei2 zhi1 huan1hu1！"

msgid ""
"Of course you are. The stakes are so high that it'd be strange if you weren't.\n"
"\n"
"But if it makes *you* feel any better, know that we did the best that we could with what we had. And if it turns out that we were wrong, well... we'll just have to burn that bridge when we get there. We can't do anything about it now."
msgstr ""
"这​也​难怪​。​事关重大​，​如果​你​无动于衷​，​反而​才​不​正常​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​已经​尽力​做到​最好​了​—​—​希望​这么​说​能​让​*​你​*​好受​一些​。​要是​最后​发现​我们​错​了​……​那​也​只能​走​一步​看​一步​了​。​反正​我们​现在​没什么​可​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ye3 nan2guai4。shi4guan1zhong4da4，ru2guo3 ni3 wu2dong4yu2zhong1，fan3er2 cai2 bu4 zheng4chang2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi3jing1 jin4li4 zuo4dao4 zui4hao3 le5——xi1wang4 zhe4me5 shuo1 neng2 rang4*ni3*hao3shou4 yi1xie1。yao4shi5 zui4hou4 fa1xian4 wo3men5 cuo4 le5……na4 ye3 zhi3neng2 zou3 yi1 bu4 kan4 yi1 bu4 le5。fan3zheng4 wo3men5 xian4zai4 mei2shen2me5 ke3 zuo4 de5。"

msgid "Of course you can stay, Kim."
msgstr ""
"你​当然​可以​留下来​，​阿金​。\n"
"ni3 dang1ran2 ke3yi3 liu2 xia4 lai2，e1 jin1。"

msgid ""
"Of course you can't.\n"
"\n"
"Why don't you come a little closer? I'll show you my ID."
msgstr ""
"那​是​自然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​请​靠近​一些​，​我会​向​你​出示​我​的​证件​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 zi4ran2。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 qing3 kao4jin4 yi1xie1，wo3 hui4 xiang4 ni3 chu1shi4 wo3 de5 zheng4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Of course you didn't. Think nothing of it, I took no offense.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gives him a reassuring smile, then shifts her gaze down to the bleeding man.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A visitor?"
msgstr ""
"这是​自然​。​别​在意​，​我​并​没有​生气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​对​他​露出​安抚​的​微笑​，​随即​将​目光​转向​那个​流血​的​男人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​访客​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 zi4ran2。bie4 zai4yi4，wo3 bing4 mei2you3 sheng1qi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ta1 lu4chu1 an1fu3 de5 wei1xiao4，sui2ji2 jiang1 mu4guang1 zhuan3xiang4 na4ge5 liu2xue4 de5 nan2ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 fang3ke4？"

msgid ""
"Of course you do.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She raises her glass in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, was there something that you wanted to talk about...?"
msgstr ""
"确实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​举杯​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​你​有​什么​想聊​的​吗​……​？\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ju3bei1 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，ni3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3 liao2 de5 ma5……？"

msgid ""
"Of course you haven't, bitch. If you had, you'd already be dead. They don't "
"leave loose ends."
msgstr ""
"那​是​自然​，​贱人​。​如果​你​知道​的话​，​你​早就​死​了​。​他们​做事​从​不留​活口​。\n"
"na4 shi4 zi4ran2，jian4ren2。ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1dao4 de5hua4，ni3 zao3jiu4 si3 le5。ta1men5 zuo4shi4 cong2 bu4 liu2 huo2kou3。"

msgid ""
"Of course you will, my friend. Of course you will.\n"
"\n"
"Someone has tread on the tail of a sleeping snake and we have been bit. Now its head must be removed, or our little kiez will fall."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​我​的​朋友​。​我​相信​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有人​踩​到​了​沉睡​之蛇​的​尾巴​，​我们​因此​遭殃​。​如今​必须​斩除​其首​，​否则​我们​这个​小​社区​必将​覆灭​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 de5 peng2you5。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"you3ren2 cai3 dao4 le5 chen2shui4 zhi1 she2 de5 wei3ba5，wo3men5 yin1ci3 zao1yang1。ru2jin1 bi4xu1 zhan3 chu2 qi2 shou3，fou3ze2 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 xiao3 she4qu1 bi4jiang1 fu4mie4。"

msgid "Of course! You've got nothin' to worry about."
msgstr ""
"当然​！​你​大​可​放心​。\n"
"dang1ran2！ni3 dai4 ke3 fang4xin1。"

msgid ""
"Of course! You've got nothing to worry about, friend. No bloodshed at all!"
msgstr ""
"当然​！​你​完全​不用​担心​，​朋友​。​绝对​没​人​受伤​！\n"
"dang1ran2！ni3 wan2quan2 bu4yong4 dan1xin1，peng2you5。jue2dui4 mei2 ren2 shou4shang1！"

msgid ""
"Of course, $(l.freund). Your last donation put us part of the way toward purchasing the blankets and staple foods that the people of the Kreuzbasar so desperately need.\n"
"\n"
"As of your last donation, we have $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) nuyen saved toward our 250 nuyen goal. Whatever more you could contribute would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​$(l.freund)​。​你​上次​的​捐赠​让​我们​为​购买​克洛伊​茨​集市​居民​急需​的​毯子​和​主食​提供​了​部分​资金​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​你​上次​捐款​的​基础​上​，​我们​已经​为​250​新円​的​目标​存下​了​$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations)​新円​。​如果​你​能​提供​更​多​捐款​，​我们​将​不胜感激​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，$(l.freund)。ni3 shang4ci4 de5 juan1zeng4 rang4 wo3men5 wei2 gou4mai3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ju1min2 ji2xu1 de5 tan3zi5 he4 zhu3shi2 ti2gong1 le5 bu4fen5 zi1jin1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 shang4ci4 juan1kuan3 de5 ji1chu3 shang4，wo3men5 yi3jing1 wei2 250 xin1 yuan2 de5 mu4biao1 cun2 xia4 le5 $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) xin1 yuan2。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 ti2gong1 geng1 duo1 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 jiang1 bu4 sheng4 gan3 ji1。"

msgid "Of course, Dietrich. I wouldn’t keep you from something like this."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​迪​特里​希​。​你​的​事​就是​我​的​事​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，Di2te4li3xi1。ni3 de5 shi4 jiu4shi4 wo3 de5 shi4。"

msgid "Of course, Herr Burakgazi. It is no trouble at all."
msgstr ""
"当然​可以​，​布拉加​齐​先生​。​一点​都​不​麻烦​。\n"
"dang1ran2 ke3yi3，bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 xian1sheng5。yi1dian3 dou1 bu4 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"Of course, now I realize what it really was. It was Harrow's way of marking me as his property. Like a dog pissing on a tree.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her smile fades.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What a goddamned fool I was."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​现在​我​才​明白​那​究竟​是​怎么回事​。​那​是​哈罗​把​我​标记​为​他​私有财产​的​方式​。​就​像​狗​对​着​树​撒尿​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​笑容​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真是​个​该死​的​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，xian4zai4 wo3 cai2 ming2bai5 na4 jiu1jing4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4。na4 shi4 ha1luo2 ba3 wo3 biao1ji4 wei2 ta1 si1 you3 cai2 chan3 de5 fang1shi4。jiu4 xiang4 gou3 dui4 zhao2 shu4 sa1niao4 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1shi5 ge4 gai1si3 de5 sha3gua1。"

msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""
"当然​。\n"
"dang1ran2。"

msgid ""
"Of course.\n"
"\n"
"We never spill blood when we don't have to."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​从不​在​没有​必要​的​时候​动手​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 cong2bu4 zai4 mei2you3 bi4yao4 de5 shi2hou5 dong4shou3。"

msgid ""
"Of course. And you have dealt with several “false flag” contracts as well recently, yes? It is an awful thing to be manipulated, I am sure.\n"
"\n"
"There will be no secrets between us. Your employer will be the Great Dragon Lofwyr. He is sometimes referred to as \"The Golden Wyrm.\" Perhaps you have heard of him."
msgstr ""
"我能​理解​，​而且​你​最近​的​几份​合同​都​设​了​“​幌子​”​，​对​吧​？​被​人​操纵​的​感觉​一定​很​糟糕​，​我​深有体会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​之间​不会​有​任何​秘密​。​你​的​雇主​是​巨龙​洛夫​维尔​，​人称​“​金龙​”​，​或许​你​听说​过​他​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 li3jie3，er2qie3 ni3 zui4jin4 de5 ji1 fen4 he2tong5 dou1 she4 le5“huang3zi5”，dui4 ba1？bei4 ren2 cao1zong4 de5 gan3jue2 yi1ding4 hen3 zao1gao1，wo3 shen1 you3 ti3 hui4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1jian1 bu4hui4 you3 ren4he2 mi4mi4。ni3 de5 gu4zhu3 shi4 ju4long2 Luo4fu1wei2er3，ren2cheng1“jin1 long2”，huo4xu3 ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Of course. History is the version of past events that people have decided to"
" agree upon. Truth is something else..."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​历史​不过​是​人们​共同​认可​的​过去​事件​的​某个​版本​。​真相​则​是​另一回事​……\n"
"dang1ran2。li4shi3 bu4guo4 shi4 ren2men5 gong4tong2 ren4ke3 de5 guo4qu4 shi4jian4 de5 mou3 ge4 ban3ben3。zhen1xiang4 ze2 shi4 ling4 yi1 hui2 shi4……"

msgid ""
"Of course. I only need to hear what you're comfortable talking about, "
"nothing more."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​我​只​想​听​你​说​让​自己​感觉​舒服​的​部分​就行了​。\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 zhi3 xiang3 ting1 ni3 shuo1 rang4 zi4ji3 gan3jue2 shu1fu5 de5 bu4fen5 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid "Of course. If you'll come a little closer, I'll show you my ID."
msgstr ""
"那​是​自然​。​还​请​靠近​一些​，​我会​向​你​出示​我​的​证件​。\n"
"na4 shi4 zi4ran2。hai2 qing3 kao4jin4 yi1xie1，wo3 hui4 xiang4 ni3 chu1shi4 wo3 de5 zheng4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Of course. Sorry. Must've slipped my mind... I've been working a lot of late"
" nights recently."
msgstr ""
"也​是​。​不好意思​，​我​给​忘​了​……​最近​晚上​加班​有点​严重​。\n"
"ye3 shi4。bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3 gei3 wang4 le5……zui4jin4 wan3shang5 jia1ban1 you3dian3 yan2zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Of course. We all have our secrets. But if you ever want to talk, I'm here."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​我们​都​有​自己​的​小​秘密​。​但​如果​你​想​聊聊​，​我​随时奉陪​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，wo3men5 dou1 you3 zi4ji3 de5 xiao3 mi4mi4。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 liao2 liao2，wo3 sui2 shi2 feng4 pei2。"

msgid "Of course. What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"当然​，​你​有​什么​需要​？\n"
"dang1ran2，ni3 you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4？"

msgid ""
"Of course. Your myopia is by design.\n"
"\n"
"And just as one drops a frog into cold water, slowly turning up the heat to veil its impending doom, metahumanity has slowly allowed itself to be enslaved by the megacorporations - and now the megacorporations are slowly becoming enslaved by the Great Dragons."
msgstr ""
"谁​说​不是​呢​，​毕竟​你​的​短视​是​先天​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​把​青蛙​放入​冷水​慢慢​加热​一样​，​它​无法​察觉​即将​到来​的​厄运​。​泛​人类​群体​正​逐渐​任由​自己​被​超企​奴役​—​—​而​如今​这些​超企​也​在​逐步​被​巨龙​奴役​。\n"
"\n"
"shei2 shuo1 bu4shi4 ni2，bi4jing4 ni3 de5 duan3shi4 shi4 xian1tian1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 ba3 qing1wa1 fang4ru4 leng3shui3 man4man4 jia1re4 yi1yang4，ta1 wu2fa3 cha2jue2 ji2jiang1 dao4lai2 de5 e4yun4。fan4 ren2lei4 qun2ti3 zheng1 zhu2jian4 ren4you2 zi4ji3 bei4 chao1 qi3 nu2yi4——er2 ru2jin1 zhe4xie1 chao1 qi3 ye3 zai4 zhu2bu4 bei4 ju4long2 nu2yi4。"

msgid ""
"Offer's still on the table, chief. Once we get into that facility, tossing their utility logs really wouldn't be much trouble.\n"
"\n"
"Just say the word, and I'm on it."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​之前​那句话​，​头儿​。​等​我们​进入​设施​之后​，​删除​他们​的​维护​日志​简直​是​小事一桩​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​你​发话​，​我​随时​都​能​搞定​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 zhi1qian2 na4 ju4 hua4，tou2r5。deng3 wo3men5 jin4ru4 she4shi1 zhi1hou4，shan1chu2 ta1men5 de5 wei2hu4 ri4zhi4 jian3zhi2 shi4 xiao3shi4yi1zhuang1。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 fa1 hua4，wo3 sui2shi2 dou1 neng2 gao3ding4。"

msgid ""
"Offers ground-based firepower. 'It's like having another runner on the "
"team.'"
msgstr ""
"能够​提供​地面​火力​支援​的​无人机​。​“​这​感觉​就​像​队里​多​了​一个​狂奔​者​。​”\n"
"neng2gou4 ti2gong1 di4mian4 huo3li4 zhi1yuan2 de5 wu2ren2ji1。“zhe4 gan3jue2 jiu4 xiang4 dui4 li3 duo1 le5 yi1ge5 kuang2Ben1zhe3。”"

msgid ""
"Often provided to apprentice magic users by their mentors as a reward. "
"Grants +1 Willpower and +1 Charisma."
msgstr ""
"通常​作为​导师​对​其​魔法​学徒​的​奖励​而​被​赠予​。​提供​+​1​意志​和​+​1​魅力​。\n"
"tong1chang2 zuo4wei2 dao3shi1 dui4 qi2 mo2fa3 xue2tu2 de5 jiang3li4 er2 bei4 zeng4yu3。ti2gong1 +1 yi4zhi4 he4 +1 mei4li4。"

msgid "Oh Yeah! This thing is awesome boss! You sure we can't keep it?"
msgstr ""
"哦​耶​！​老大​，​这​东西​太棒了​！​我们​真​不能​留着​它​吗​？\n"
"e2 ye1！lao3da4，zhe4 dong1xi1 tai4 bang4 le5！wo3men5 zhen1 bu4neng2 liu2 zhao2 ta1 ma5？"

msgid "Oh good, target practice!"
msgstr ""
"来得​正好​，​活靶子​！\n"
"lai2de5 zheng4hao3，huo2ba3zi5！"

msgid "Oh hi Marta."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​嗨​，​玛​尔塔​。\n"
"o1，hai1，Ma3er3ta3。"

msgid ""
"Oh ho! Yes, of course I can. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Burakgazi rummages through his pockets and fishes out a crumpled 100 nuyen bill. He thrusts the coffee-stained wad of paper into your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There. You have been paid. Now, let us get on with it, eh?"
msgstr ""
"哦​吼​！​是​啊​，​我​当然​明白​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布拉加​齐​翻遍​口袋​，​最后​掏出​一张​皱巴巴​的​100​新円​钞票​。​他​把​这​坨​沾​着​咖啡渍​的​纸团​塞进​你​手里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​。​你​的​报酬​。​现在​你​可以​帮​我​了​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"e2 hou3！shi4 a1，wo3 dang1ran2 ming2bai5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 fan1bian4 kou3dai4，zui4hou4 tao1chu1 yi1 zhang1 zhou4ba1ba1 de5 100 xin1 yuan2 chao1piao4。ta1 ba3 zhe4 tuo2 zhan1 zhao2 ka1 fei1 zi4 de5 zhi3 tuan2 se4 jin4 ni3 shou3li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3。ni3 de5 bao4chou5。xian4zai4 ni3 ke3yi3 bang1 wo3 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Oh man, that bites. I can see why you might come looking here though.\n"
"\n"
"Seems like a place where Robin Hood might bring stuff to the poor."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​那​是​挺​闹心​的​。​不过​我能​理解​你​为什么​要​来​这里​找​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​看着​就是​个​销赃​窝​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1，na4 shi4 ting3 nao4xin1 de5。bu4guo4 wo3 neng2 li3jie3 ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 lai2 zhe4li3 zhao3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 kan4 zhao2 jiu4shi4 ge4 xiao1zang1 wo1。"

msgid ""
"Oh man, that bites. I can see why you might come looking here, though.\n"
"\n"
"Seems like a place where Robin Hood might bring stuff to the poor."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​那​是​挺​闹心​的​。​不过​我能​理解​你​为什么​要​来​这里​找​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​看着​就是​个​销赃​窝​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1，na4 shi4 ting3 nao4xin1 de5。bu4guo4 wo3 neng2 li3jie3 ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 lai2 zhe4li3 zhao3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 kan4 zhao2 jiu4shi4 ge4 xiao1zang1 wo1。"

msgid ""
"Oh man. He's kept her in this containment unit for something like twenty years. \n"
"\n"
"There's probably nothing but a reptile brain left in the dragon down there.\n"
"\n"
"A big, freaking reptile brain."
msgstr ""
"老天​。​他​把​她​困​在​这里​至少​有​二十年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​下面​的​那头​巨龙​也许​只​剩下​了​爬行​类​的​脑​回路​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大到​吓人​的​爬行​类脑​回路​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1。ta1 ba3 ta1 kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 zhi4shao3 you3 er4 shi2 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xia4mian4 de5 na4 tou2 ju4long2 ye3xu3 zhi3 sheng4xia4 le5 pa2xing2 lei4 de5 nao3 hui2lu4。\n"
"\n"
"dai4 dao4 xia4ren2 de5 pa2xing2 lei4 nao3 hui2lu4。"

msgid ""
"Oh no! Listen, I've got to do something right now, but call me later and we'll chat over coffee okay?\n"
"\n"
"Be well"
msgstr ""
"哦​不​！​我​现在​还有​事要​忙​，​回头​联系​我​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​多​保重​哦​。\n"
"\n"
"e2 bu4！wo3 xian4zai4 hai2you3 shi4 yao4 mang2，hui2tou2 lian2xi4 wo3，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 duo1 bao3zhong4 e2。"

msgid ""
"Oh no, this was a mistake! I shouldn't have opened the door. It's too late! "
"Is it? It is!"
msgstr ""
"哦​不​，​这​是​个​错误​！​我​不该​打开门​。​已经​太迟​了​！​是​吗​？​是​的​！\n"
"e2 bu4，zhe4 shi4 ge4 cuo4wu4！wo3 bu4gai1 da3 kai1 men2。yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5！shi4 ma5？shi4 de5！"

msgid ""
"Oh really?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"How interesting."
msgstr ""
"真的​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​有趣​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 you3qu4。"

msgid ""
"Oh really? \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}That predatory grin returns. The Monika-image’s teeth shine wetly in the light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I killed Monika because I was designed to. Choice was a luxury that I did not have."
msgstr ""
"哦​，​真的​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​那掠​食者​的​笑容​再次​浮现​。​莫妮卡​的​影像​牙齿​在​光线​下​湿润​地​闪烁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​杀​了​莫妮卡​，​因为​我​被​设计​为​如此​。​选择​是​我​不曾​拥有​的​奢侈品​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，zhen1de5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 lu:e4 shi2 zhe3 de5 xiao4rong2 zai4ci4 fu2xian4。Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 ya2chi3 zai4 guang1xian4 xia4 shi1run4 de5 shan3shuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 sha1 le5 Mo4ni1ka3，yin1wei4 wo3 bei4 she4ji4 wei2 ru2ci3。xuan3ze2 shi4 wo3 bu4ceng2 yong1you3 de5 she1chi3pin3。"

msgid ""
"Oh really? \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image’s half-smile spreads into a predatory grin. A set of luminous teeth shine wetly in the light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I killed Monika because I was designed to. Choice was a luxury that I did not have."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​影像​的​微笑​逐渐​变得​有些​狰狞​。​两排​牙齿​在​灯光​下泛​着​丝丝​寒光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​杀​了​莫妮卡​，​因为​这本​就是​我​的​设计​初衷​。​选择​是​我​不曾​拥有​的​奢侈品​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 ying3xiang4 de5 wei1xiao4 zhu2jian4 bian4de5 you3xie1 zheng1ning2。liang3 pai2 ya2chi3 zai4 deng1guang1 xia4 fan4 zhao2 si1 si1 han2 guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 sha1 le5 Mo4ni1ka3，yin1wei4 zhe4 ben3 jiu4shi4 wo3 de5 she4ji4 chu1zhong1。xuan3ze2 shi4 wo3 bu4ceng2 yong1you3 de5 she1chi3pin3。"

msgid ""
"Oh well. I guess it doesn't matter any more. What's done is done. But "
"chief... what you did there was cold. You didn't just kill her, you left her"
" soul trapped in a jar."
msgstr ""
"事已至此​，​现在​大概​都​不​重要​了​。​但是​头儿​……​但​你​做​的​事情​太​冷酷​了​。​你​不仅​杀​了​她​，​还​把​她​的​灵魂​困在​了​方寸之间​。\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3，xian4zai4 da4gai4 dou1 bu4 zhong4yao4 le5。dan4shi4 tou2r5……dan4 ni3 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 tai4 leng3ku4 le5。ni3 bu4jin3 sha1 le5 ta1，hai2 ba3 ta1 de5 ling2hun2 kun4 zai4 le5 fang1 cun4 zhi1 jian1。"

msgid "Oh yeah, I got it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​懂​了​。\n"
"en1，dong3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh yeah?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His doughy face contorts itself into a grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And what'll you do if I don't?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​圆鼓鼓​的​脸​扭曲​出​一个​狞笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"en1 heng1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yuan2gu3gu3 de5 lian3 niu3qu1 chu1 yi1ge5 ning2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Oh yes... dragons are a cancer. One that will conquer, or worse, *destroy* all of humanity if we do not stop it. One that metastasized when the world Awakened. \n"
"\n"
"An ironic metaphor, since it was the failing of my own body that allowed me to see it. "
msgstr ""
"没错​……​巨龙​就是​这个​世界​上​最大​的​病源​。​如果​我们​不​加以​阻止​，​情况​只会​不断​恶化​，​直到​人类​被​彻底​*​消灭​*​。​在​世界​觉醒​时​，​这份​病源​就​已经​扩散​开来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说来​讽刺​，​但​正是​我​身体​的​衰弱​才​让​我​得以​看到​这​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4……ju4long2 jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 shang4 zui4 dai4 de5 bing4yuan2。ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4 jia1yi3 zu3zhi3，qing2kuang4 zhi3 hui4 bu4duan4 e4hua4，zhi2dao4 ren2lei4 bei4 che4di3*xiao1mie4*。zai4 shi4jie4 jue2xing3 shi2，zhe4 fen4 bing4yuan2 jiu4 yi3jing1 kuo4san4 kai1 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 lai2 feng3ci4，dan4 zheng4shi4 wo3 shen1ti3 de5 shuai1ruo4 cai2 rang4 wo3 de2yi3 kan4dao4 zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"Oh! And I remember hearing stories about a crazy troll running around in his underpants.\n"
"\n"
"I don't think he had a name. He just ran around and broke things.\n"
"\n"
"Things were kinda wild before the new gang took over."
msgstr ""
"噢​对​！​我​记得​还​听​过​一个​事​，​说​是​有​个​巨魔​疯子​，​只​穿着​条​内裤​到处​乱跑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​他​没​名字​。​他​就是​到处​乱跑​，​然后​把​东西​都​碰坏​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​被​新来​的​帮派​占下​的​时候​，​这边​的​事​都​可​奇葩​了​。\n"
"\n"
"o1 dui4！wo3 ji4de5 hai2 ting1 guo4 yi1ge5 shi4，shuo1 shi4 you3 ge4 ju4mo2 feng1zi5，zhi3 chuan1zhuo2 tiao2 nei4ku4 dao4chu4 luan4pao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ta1 mei2 ming2zi5。ta1 jiu4shi4 dao4chu4 luan4pao3，ran2hou4 ba3 dong1xi1 dou1 peng4 huai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 bei4 xin1 lai2 de5 bang1pai4 zhan1 xia4 de5 shi2hou5，zhe4bian1 de5 shi4 dou1 ke3 qi2pa1 le5。"

