msgid "Oh! It's you! We were wondering if we'd ever see you again."
msgstr ""
"噢​！​是​你​啊​！​我们​正​想着​还有​没有​机会​再​见到​你​呢​。\n"
"o1！shi4 ni3 a1！wo3men5 zheng1 xiang3 zhao2 hai2you3 mei2you3 ji1hui4 zai4 jian4dao4 ni3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Oh! Well, welcome aboard... from what I've heard about QA testing, I don't "
"envy you. The guys back in the server room will appreciate your presence, "
"I'm sure."
msgstr ""
"噢​！​欢迎​加入​……​我​听说​了​测试​工作​的​事​，​感觉​挺​惨​啊​。​服务器​机房​的​那些​家伙​肯定​会​很​感谢​你们​来​帮忙​的​。\n"
