"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 PDA。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1，yuan2lai2 wo3 yi1 xiao3shi2 qian2 jiu4 ke3yi3 zou3 le5。hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，$(scene.sFakeName)……wan3an1。"

