"哦​，​海​默里​希​*​什么​*​都​担心​。​依我看​是​他​爹​味儿​太重​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​米拉​对​我​倒​是​很​有​信心​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，Hai3mo4 li3 xi1*shen2me5*dou1 dan1xin1。yi1wo3kan4 shi4 ta1 die1 wei4r5 tai4 chong2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 mi3la1 dui4 wo3 dao3 shi4 hen3 you3 xin4xin1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, I am most definitely in. Totally. \n"
"\n"
"Insane dragons? Assholes with enormous machineguns? Devil dogs that hump your leg when no one’s looking?\n"
"\n"
"This is the place for me, no question about it."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​我​当然​要​加入​了​。​必须​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​发疯​的​巨龙​？​扛着​巨型​机枪​的​混蛋​？​还有​趁人​不​注意​就​蹭​我​腿​的​恶犬​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​毫无疑问​，​这个​地方​就是​为​我​准备​的​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，wo3 dang1ran2 yao4 jia1ru4 le5。bi4xu1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"fa1feng1 de5 ju4long2？gang1 zhao2 ju4xing2 ji1qiang1 de5 hun2dan4？hai2you3 chen4 ren2 bu4 zhu4yi4 jiu4 ceng4 wo3 tui3 de5 e4 quan3？\n"
"\n"
"hao2wu2yi2wen4，zhe4ge5 di4fang1 jiu4shi4 wei2 wo3 zhun3bei4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, I did, but not in Stuttgart. If I went to a local hospital with the kind of injuries that Dad gave me, there'd be questions, and I couldn't afford to stay in town any longer than I had to.\n"
"\n"
"Even if my dad wound up getting arrested for beating me, the rest of the local Kreuzritters would have found me, and I'd have wound up skinned alive and thrown into the Neckar."
msgstr ""
"我​去​了​，​但​没​在​斯图加特​。​如果​我​带​着​这样​一身​伤去​当地​医院​，​难免会​引来​盘问​，​而​我​实在​负担​不起​在​镇上​多​停留​一秒​的​代价​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​即便​父亲​最终​因​殴打​我​而​被捕​，​当地​其余​的​十字军​成员​也​肯定​会​找到​我​，​届时​我​恐怕​会​被​活​剥​了​皮​扔进​内卡河​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qu4 le5，dan4 mei2 zai4 si1tu2jia1te4。ru2guo3 wo3 dai4 zhao2 zhe4yang4 yi1shen1 shang1 qu4 dang1di4 yi1yuan4，nan2 mian3 hui4 yin3 lai2 pan2wen4，er2 wo3 shi2zai4 fu4dan1 bu4 qi3 zai4 zhen4 shang4 duo1 ting2liu2 yi1 miao3 de5 dai4jia4。\n"
"\n"
"ji2bian4 fu4qin1 zui4zhong1 yin1 ou1da3 wo3 er2 bei4bu3，dang1di4 qi2yu2 de5 shi2zi4jun1 cheng2yuan2 ye3 ken3ding4 hui4 zhao3dao4 wo3，jie4shi2 wo3 kong3pa4 hui4 bei4 huo2 bao1 le5 pi2 reng1 jin4 nei4ka3he2。"

msgid "Oh, I doubt it, boss. We never really got any airplay."
msgstr ""
"估计​悬​啊​，​老大​。​我们​搞​的​都​是​线下​演出​。\n"
"gu1ji4 xuan2 a1，lao3da4。wo3men5 gao3 de5 dou1 shi4 xian4xia4 yan3chu1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, I get it. You've had a rough life, and you've decided to take it out on "
"everyone else."
msgstr ""
"我​懂​了​。​你​自己​过得​不顺心​，​就​想​把​这​股气​撒​在​其他人​身上​。\n"
"wo3 dong3 le5。ni3 zi4ji3 guo4de2 bu4 shun4 xin1，jiu4 xiang3 ba3 zhe4 gu3 qi4 sa1 zai4 qi2 ta1 ren2 shen1shang5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, I hate that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I swear, I've lost more good pairs of slacks that way..."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​我​可​不想​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​因为​这种​事​弄脏​好几条​裤子​了​……\n"
"\n"
"o1，wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 yin1wei4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 nong4zang1 hao3 ji1 tiao2 ku4zi5 le5……"

msgid ""
"Oh, I intend to.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He wrestles the corner of his mouth up into a smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've got no worries - I already know what my future holds."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​但​我​就​想​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​努力​用​嘴角​扯​出​一丝​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没什么​好​担心​的​—​—​我​早就​知道​我​的​下场​了​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，dan4 wo3 jiu4 xiang3 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nu3li4 yong4 zui3jiao3 che3 chu1 yi1 si1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2shen2me5 hao3 dan1xin1 de5——wo3 zao3jiu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 de5 xia4chang3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, I never actually believed anything that I was saying. I just love "
"playing devil's advocate. I think that your plan sounds like a fine idea."
msgstr ""
"哦​，​我​其实​从来​没有​相信​过​自己​说​的话​。​我​只是​喜欢​抬杠​。​我​认为​你​的​计划​听​起来​是​个​不错​的​想法​。\n"
"e2，wo3 qi2shi2 cong2lai2 mei2you3 xiang1xin4 guo4 zi4ji3 shuo1 de5hua4。wo3 zhi3shi4 xi3huan5 tai2gang4。wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 de5 ji4hua4 ting1 qi3lai5 shi4 ge4 bu4cuo4 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid "Oh, I was just buying time. Waiting for my soldiers to arrive."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​我​只是​在​拖时间​，​我​在​等​我​的​战士​们​。\n"
"o1，wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 tuo1 shi2 jian1，wo3 zai4 deng3 wo3 de5 zhan4shi4 men5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, I'll make the time, all right... but only if you make it worth my while."
msgstr ""
"我​可以​抽出​时间​……​但​你​得​确保​有​适合​的​报酬​。\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 chou1chu1 shi2jian1……dan4 ni3 de2 que4bao3 you3 shi4he2 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid "Oh, I'm sure that we'll make quite an impression."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​我们​绝对​会​好好​表现​的​。\n"
"o1，wo3men5 jue2dui4 hui4 hao3hao3 biao3xian4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, Jesus God.\n"
"\n"
"What have we done?"
msgstr ""
"天​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​做​了​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"tian1 a1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Oh, Yuli.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She slaps him across the face, splitting his lip down the middle. The impact sounds like a gunshot.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're in no position to make demands."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​尤里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​一巴掌​扇​在​他​脸上​，​把​他​的​嘴唇​打​得​裂开​。​那​声响​就​像​枪响​一样​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​没​资格​在​这里​指手画脚​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，You2li3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 ba1 zhang3 shan1 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4，ba3 ta1 de5 zui3chun2 da3 de2 lie4kai1。na4 sheng1xiang3 jiu4 xiang4 qiang1 xiang3 yi1yang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2 zi1ge2 zai4 zhe4li3 zhi3shou3hua4jiao3。"

msgid ""
"Oh, Yuli. You should be frightened.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She slaps him across the face, splitting his lip down the middle. The impact sounds like a gunshot.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're in serious trouble, my friend."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​尤里​。​你​是​应该​害怕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​一巴掌​扇​在​他​脸上​，​把​他​的​嘴唇​打​得​裂开​。​那​声响​就​像​枪响​一样​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​麻烦​大​了​，​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，You2li3。ni3 shi4 ying1gai1 hai4pa4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 ba1 zhang3 shan1 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4，ba3 ta1 de5 zui3chun2 da3 de2 lie4kai1。na4 sheng1xiang3 jiu4 xiang4 qiang1 xiang3 yi1yang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ma2fan5 dai4 le5，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, a little bit of everything. I've got your zen and your hyper, your nitro and your novacoke. If you want it, I've got it. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Zaak leans toward you and lowers his voice to a conspiratorial whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've even got a special concoction of my own design, but I wouldn't recommend it unless you're serious about getting high. "
msgstr ""
"哦​，​什么​都​有​一点​。​不管​是​“​禅意​”​还是​“​高能​”​，​“​氮冲​”​还是​“​新星​可乐​”​，​你​想要​的​我​都​有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​扎克​朝​你​靠​了​靠​，​压低​声音​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这​甚至​还有​种​自己​设计​的​特殊​配方​，​但​我​不​建议​你​使用​，​除非​你​真的​想​嗨​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，shen2me5 dou1 you3 yi1dian3。bu4guan3 shi4“chan2 yi4” hai2shi5“gao1neng2”，“dan4 chong1” hai2shi5“xin1xing1 ke3le4”，ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 wo3 dou1 you3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 chao2 ni3 kao4 le5 kao4，ya1di1 sheng1yin1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4 shen4zhi4 hai2you3 zhong3 zi4ji3 she4ji4 de5 te4shu1 pei4fang1，dan4 wo3 bu4 jian4yi4 ni3 shi3yong4，chu2fei1 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 hai1 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, a real long time! I go where the cram flows.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She raises a hand to her lips to stifle a high-pitched giggle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Y'know?"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​好长时间​了​！​哪有​药​我​就​去​哪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​手​捂住​嘴​，​压住​了​自己​的​咯咯​尖笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​懂​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"e2，hao3 zhang3 shi2 jian1 le5！na3 you3 yao4 wo3 jiu4 qu4 na3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 shou3 wu3zhu4 zui3，ya1zhu4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 ge1ge1 jian1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dong3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Oh, ace.\n"
"\n"
"You've made a terrible, terrible mistake."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​王牌​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​犯​了​个​十分​可怕​的​错误​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，wang2pai2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fan4 le5 ge4 shi2fen1 ke3pa4 de5 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, and Audran... don't forget to clean the containment unit afterwards. \n"
"\n"
"The virus will kill Feuerschwinge along with the rest, and when it does, her astral form will perish as well. \n"
"\n"
"Human host or no."
msgstr ""
"对​了​，​奥​德兰​—​—​别忘了​之后​把​收容​室​清理​干净​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​病毒​会​将​火翼​连同​其他​巨龙​一同​消灭​掉​，​而​到​那个​时候​，​她​的​灵体​也​将​不复存在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​有没有​人类​宿主​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，Ao4de2lan2——bie4 wang4 le5 zhi1hou4 ba3 shou1rong2 shi4 qing1li3 gan1jing4。\n"
"\n"
"bing4du2 hui4 jiang1 Huo3yi4 lian2tong2 qi2ta1 ju4long2 yi1tong2 xiao1mie4 diao4，er2 dao4 na4ge5 shi2hou5，ta1 de5 ling2ti3 ye3 jiang1 bu4 fu4 cun2 zai4。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 you3mei2you3 ren2lei4 su4zhu3。"

msgid ""
"Oh, and I hope that you can speak Sperethiel.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head in disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Damned useless immigrants."
msgstr ""
"哦​，​希望​你​会​说​精灵​语​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​厌恶​地摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​的​废物​移民​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，xi1wang4 ni3 hui4 shuo1 jing1ling2 yu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan4wu4 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3 de5 fei4wu4 yi2min2。"

msgid ""
"Oh, and by the way... think you could've gotten here any later, pal?\n"
"\n"
"I've got an important meeting to get to, and if I'm late, the shit is going to hit the--"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​还有​……​你​还​能​再​晚点​到​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​个​重要​的​会议​要​赶​，​要是​迟到​，​那​可​就​麻烦​大​了​—​—\n"
"\n"
"e2，hai2you3……ni3 hai2 neng2 zai4 wan3dian3 dao4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 zhong4yao4 de5 hui4yi4 yao4 gan3，yao4shi5 chi2dao4，na4 ke3 jiu4 ma2fan5 dai4 le5 — —"

msgid ""
"Oh, and talk to Quorin if you want to hear some good stories about the market, back in its prime. He's always happy to share a tale or two.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The older man steps aside.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"对​了​，​如果​你​想​打听​市场​当年​的​辉煌​历史​，​就​去​和​奎林​聊聊吧​。​他​可​喜欢​讲故事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​老人​退​到​一旁​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 da3ting5 shi4chang3 dang1nian2 de5 hui1huang2 li4shi3，jiu4 qu4 he4 kui2 lin2 liao2 liao2 ba1。ta1 ke3 xi3huan5 jiang3 gu4 shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 tui4 dao4 yi1pang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Oh, and tell me where that glowing rock you saw was when you get back. Who "
"knows? It might be worth something!"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​还有​，​等​你​回来​后​告诉​我​你​看到​的​那块​发光​的​石头​在​哪里​。​说不定​它​值钱​呢​！\n"
"e2，hai2you3，deng3 ni3 hui2lai5 hou4 gao4su4 wo3 ni3 kan4dao4 de5 na4 kuai4 fa1guang1 de5 shi2tou5 zai4 na3li3。shuo1bu5ding4 ta1 zhi2qian2 ni2！"

msgid "Oh, and, uh, chief... you're about to have some more company in there."
msgstr ""
"还有​，​头儿​……​又​有​更​多​人朝​你们​那边​去​了​。\n"
"hai2you3，tou2r5……you4 you3 geng1 duo1 ren2 chao2 ni3men5 na4bian5 qu4 le5。"

msgid "Oh, are we now?"
msgstr ""
"是​这样​吗​？\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4 ma5？"

msgid "Oh, c'mon, boss. Nobody moves to Berlin without a good reason."
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​老大​。​没个​好​理由​的话​，​谁​会​愿意​搬​来​柏林​？\n"
"bai4tuo1，lao3da4。mei2 ge4 hao3 li3you2 de5hua4，shei2 hui4 yuan4yi4 ban1 lai2 bo2lin2？"

msgid ""
"Oh, c'mon, chief! Where's your sense of adventure?\n"
"\n"
"I mean, you get to rob a bank! How wiz is that?"
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​头儿​！​你​的​冒险​精神​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可是​要​去​抢劫​一家​银行​！​这得​多爽​啊​？\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1，tou2r5！ni3 de5 mao4xian3 jing1shen2 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3shi4 yao4 qu4 qiang3jie2 yi1jia1 yin2hang2！zhe4 de2 duo1 shuang3 a1？"

msgid ""
"Oh, c'mon, chief. As if I've never stuck my neck out for you! Hell, that's "
"all I've been doing since I got here, and this is the thanks that I get?"
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​头儿​。​我​不是​也​为​你​掏​心掏​肺​了​吗​！​我​到​这​之后​就​一直​奉献​自己​，​结果​你​就​这样​感谢​我​吗​？\n"
"bai4tuo1，tou2r5。wo3 bu4shi4 ye3 wei2 ni3 tao1 xin1 tao1 fei4 le5 ma5！wo3 dao4 zhe4 zhi1hou4 jiu4 yi1zhi2 feng4xian4 zi4ji3，jie1guo3 ni3 jiu4 zhe4yang4 gan3xie4 wo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Oh, c'mon, chief. Don't side with that asshole over me. Like I said, I'm "
"gonna get you out of there, just give me two more seconds..."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​别​和​那个​混蛋​穿​一条​裤子​啊​。​我​说​了​能​把​你们​弄出去​的​，​再​给​我​两秒钟​……\n"
"tou2r5，bie4 he4 na4ge5 hun2dan4 chuan1 yi1 tiao2 ku4zi5 a1。wo3 shuo1 le5 neng2 ba3 ni3men5 long4 chu1 qu4 de5，zai4 gei3 wo3 liang3 miao3 zhong1……"

msgid ""
"Oh, c'mon, chief. You won't be on your own - I'll be in the Matrix, helping out right alongside you. Besides which, you'll be better off *without* having to look after my meat body - if I came in person, I'd be a liability.\n"
"\n"
"Trust me on this. You want me here, safe and sound, so that you can be free to do your thing without having to worry about my body catching a stray bullet."
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​头儿​。​你​又​不是​一个​人​—​—​我​就​在​矩阵​里​帮​你​四处​打探​。​再说​，​如果​*​没有​*​我​的​现实​身体​，​对​你​而言​会​更加​方便​—​—​我​自己​过去​的话​，​只会​变成​累赘​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​就​相信​我​吧​。​我​在​这里​的​安全​地带​，​你​就​可以​随便​做​你​想​做​的​事情​，​而​不用​担心​我​的​身体​吃​到​任何​流弹​。\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1，tou2r5。ni3 you4 bu4shi4 yi1ge5 ren2——wo3 jiu4 zai4 ju3zhen4 li3 bang1 ni3 si4chu4 da3tan4。zai4shuo1，ru2guo3*mei2you3*wo3 de5 xian4shi2 shen1ti3，dui4 ni3 er2yan2 hui4 geng4jia1 fang1bian4——wo3 zi4ji3 guo4qu4 de5hua4，zhi3 hui4 bian4cheng2 lei2zhui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 xiang1xin4 wo3 ba1。wo3 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 an1quan2 di4dai4，ni3 jiu4 ke3yi3 sui2bian4 zuo4 ni3 xiang3 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5，er2 bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3 de5 shen1ti3 chi1 dao4 ren4he2 liu2dan4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, come *on,* Blitz. Quit whining. Nothing bad is going to happen to you.\n"
"\n"
"Besides, I've waited too long for my freedom to let you hold me up now. If you keep this up, I'm going to get irritated.\n"
"\n"
"So for the rest of this conversation, you keep your mouth shut. Understand?"
msgstr ""
"*​拜托​*​，​布里​茨​。​别​再​抱怨​了​。​你​不会​有事​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​况且​，​我​为​获得​自由​已经​等​了​太久​，​不能​让你在​此刻​阻碍​我​。​你​再​这样​下去​的话​，​我​就要​不耐烦​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​接下来​的​对话​里​，​闭上​你​的​嘴​。​明白​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"*bai4tuo1*，Bu4li3ci2。bie4 zai4 bao4yuan4 le5。ni3 bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"kuang4qie3，wo3 wei2 huo4de2 zi4you2 yi3jing1 deng3 le5 tai4 jiu3，bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 zai4 ci3ke4 zu3ai4 wo3。ni3 zai4 zhe4yang4 xia4qu4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4yao4 bu4nai4fan2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 jie1xia4lai2 de5 dui4hua4 li3，bi4shang5 ni3 de5 zui3。ming2bai5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Oh, come *on.* I asked you to leave me alone... you wanna do it, or do you "
"wanna make me angry?"
msgstr ""
"怎么回事​啊​。​我​说​了​让​你​别烦​我​……​你​到底​想​干嘛​？​还是​想​惹​我​生气​？\n"
"zen3me5hui2shi4 a1。wo3 shuo1 le5 rang4 ni3 bie4 fan2 wo3……ni3 dao4di3 xiang3 gan4ma2？hai2shi5 xiang3 re3 wo3 sheng1qi4？"

msgid ""
"Oh, come on, Blitz. She's robbed you, insulted you, and abandoned you. "
msgstr ""
"得了吧​，​布里​茨​。​她​拿​了​你​的​东西​，​侮辱​你​的​人格​，​现在​又​抛弃​了​你​。\n"
"de2 le5 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。ta1 na2 le5 ni3 de5 dong1xi1，wu3ru3 ni3 de5 ren2ge2，xian4zai4 you4 pao1qi4 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Oh, come on, Eiger. How many other people can say that they've released a captive dragon into the wild?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz turns to you, and he cracks a wide grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That was a badass play, chief. Ten points for style, no question about it."
msgstr ""
"得了吧​，​艾格尔​。​还有​多少​人敢​说​自己​曾经​把​一头​被​俘虏​的​巨龙​放归​自然​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​转向​你​，​露出​一个​大大的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这招​玩​得​太狠​了​，​头儿​。​我​必须​得​给​你​这​一手​打​满分​。\n"
"\n"
"de2 le5 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。hai2you3 duo1shao3 ren2 gan3 shuo1 zi4ji3 ceng2jing1 ba3 yi1tou2 bei4 fu2lu3 de5 ju4long2 fang4 gui1 zi4ran2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，lu4chu1 yi1ge5 dai4 dai4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 wan2 de2 tai4 hen3 le5，tou2r5。wo3 bi4xu1 de2 gei3 ni3 zhe4 yi1shou3 da3 man3fen1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, come on, chief. Like you've never made a mistake.\n"
"\n"
"Look, you can lambaste me all you like. Aside from that one little detail, the plan was *perfect.* I'm *proud* of my performance in there! "
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​头儿​。​就​好像​你​从来​没犯​过错​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​你​可以​尽情​地​批评​我​。​但​除了​那个​小​细节​之外​，​这个​计划​简直​是​*​完美​*​的​。​我​对​自己​的​表现​感到​*​自豪​*​！\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1，tou2r5。jiu4 hao3xiang4 ni3 cong2lai2 mei2 fan4 guo4cuo4 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，ni3 ke3yi3 jin4qing2 de5 pi1ping2 wo3。dan4 chu2le5 na4ge5 xiao3 xi4jie2 zhi1wai4，zhe4ge5 ji4hua4 jian3zhi2 shi4*wan2mei3*de5。wo3 dui4 zi4ji3 de5 biao3xian4 gan3dao4*zi4hao2*！"

msgid ""
"Oh, come on, now! Couldn't you use a little help when you're burning the midnight oil? Sure you could! How else are you gonna climb the ladder to that big promotion?\n"
"\n"
"Give it a try! I promise that you won't regret it."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​别​这样​啦​！​熬夜​赶工​的​时候​，​谁​不​需要​点​帮手​呢​？​对​吧​！​不然​你​还​怎么​往上爬​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​试试看​吧​！​我​保证​你​绝对​不会​后悔​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1，bie4 zhe4yang4 la5！ao2ye4 gan3gong1 de5 shi2hou5，shei2 bu4 xu1yao4 dian3 bang1shou5 ni2？dui4 ba1！bu4ran2 ni3 hai2 zen3me5 wang3 shang4 pa2 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"shi4shi4kan4 ba1！wo3 bao3zheng4 ni3 jue2dui4 bu4hui4 hou4hui3。"

msgid "Oh, come on. This again?"
msgstr ""
"不是​吧​。​怎么​又​来​？\n"
"bu4shi4 ba1。zen3me5 you4 lai2？"

msgid ""
"Oh, come on. You know that I can't do that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The janitor pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, I don't know. I'm not supposed to, but if you're new..."
msgstr ""
"拜托​，​你​知道​我​不能​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​说完​，​清洁工​思考​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​，​我​其实​不该​这么​做​，​但​既然​你​是​新来​的​……\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1，ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 bu4neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shuo1 wan2，qing1jie2gong1 si1kao3 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，wo3 qi2shi2 bu4gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4，dan4 ji4ran2 ni3 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5……"

msgid ""
"Oh, don't mind our dear Altuğ. Yes, he is a peevish man, but his ire was not directed at you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Goldschmidt grins up at you from his overstuffed chair.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have the distinction of being the sole target of Altuğ's rage and derision. It is a badge that I delight in wearing."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​别介意​我们​亲爱​的​奥图​伊​。​他​是​个​爱生气​的​人​，​但​他​的​怒火​不是​冲着​你​来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​戈德​施密特​从塞得​满满当当​的​椅子​上朝​你​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有幸​成为​奥图​伊​愤怒​和​嘲笑​的​唯一​目标​。​这​是​我​乐于​佩戴​的​徽章​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，bie4 jie4 yi4 wo3men5 qin1ai4 de5 ao4 tu2 yi1。ta1 shi4 ge4 ai4 sheng1 qi4 de5 ren2，dan4 ta1 de5 nu4huo3 bu4shi4 chong1 zhao2 ni3 lai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge1de2shi1mi4te4 cong2 se4 de2 man3man3dang1dang1 de5 yi3zi5 shang4 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3xing4 cheng2wei2 ao4 tu2 yi1 fen4nu4 he4 chao2xiao4 de5 wei2yi1 mu4biao1。zhe4 shi4 wo3 le4yu2 pei4dai4 de5 hui1zhang1。"

msgid "Oh, don't worry. We'll find you - we're good at that sort of thing."
msgstr ""
"不必​担心​。​我们​会​找到​你​的​—​—​我们​对​这种​事​很​在​行​。\n"
"bu4bi4 dan1xin1。wo3men5 hui4 zhao3dao4 ni3 de5——wo3men5 dui4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 hen3 zai4 xing2。"

msgid ""
"Oh, don't you worry. Your friends are already being taken care of.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His smile widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Trust me... they'll get everything that's coming to them."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​你​不必​担心​。​你​的​朋友​们​已经​有人​照料​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​笑容​更盛​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​相信​我​……​他们​会​得到​应得​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，ni3 bu4bi4 dan1xin1。ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 yi3jing1 you3ren2 zhao4liao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 geng1 cheng2 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiang1xin4 wo3……ta1men5 hui4 de2dao4 ying1de2 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, excuse me!\n"
"\n"
"You startled me there."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​不好意思​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​吓​到​我​了​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，bu4hao3yi4si5！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 he4 dao4 wo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, for Christ's sake. Haven't *you* ever been on a job that went south?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. I can tell from that look in your eyes that you have. I'm no different than you are, pal... I just had the bad luck to take a job from the wrong client."
msgstr ""
"老天​在​上​，​*​你​*​跑​差事​的​时候​就​没​遇到​过​突发​情况​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​吧​。​我能​从​你​的​眼中​看​出来​，​你​以前​肯定​也​经历​过​类似​的​事情​。​我​和​你​没有​区别​，​朋友​……​我​只是​运气​不好​，​从​错误​的​客户​手上​接​了​差事​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1 zai4 shang4，*ni3*pao2 cha4shi4 de5 shi2hou5 jiu4 mei2 yu4dao4 guo4 tu1fa1 qing2kuang4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ba1。wo3 neng2 cong2 ni3 de5 yan3zhong1 kan4 chu1lai2，ni3 yi3qian2 ken3ding4 ye3 jing1li4 guo4 lei4si4 de5 shi4qing5。wo3 he4 ni3 mei2you3 qu1bie2，peng2you5……wo3 zhi3shi4 yun4qi5 bu4hao3，cong2 cuo4wu4 de5 ke4hu4 shou3 shang4 jie1 le5 cha4shi4。"

msgid "Oh, for Christ's sake. Here we go again."
msgstr ""
"我​的​老天爷​。​又​来​了​。\n"
"wo3 de5 lao3tian1ye2。you4 lai2 le5。"

msgid "Oh, for Christ's sake. Quit preening and walk $(l.him) through it."
msgstr ""
"我​真是​服​了​。​别​在​那里​显摆​了​，​赶紧​帮​$(l.he)​搞定​。\n"
"wo3 zhen1shi5 fu2 le5。bie4 zai4 na4li5 xian3bai5 le5，gan3jin3 bang1 $(l.he) gao3ding4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, for Christ's sake. What were we supposed to do? Thanks to Fuchs' bad intel, we left all the heavy ordinance at home. \"No collateral damage,\" he told us.\n"
"\n"
"Funny how little KE seemed to share his concern. Took 'em all of two seconds before they started lobbin' grenades at us."
msgstr ""
"拉倒​吧​，​你​说​我们​能​怎么办​？​由于​富克斯​的​错误​情报​，​我们​压根​没带​任何​重型​武器​。​“​不能​有​附带​损伤​”​，​这​是​他​的​原话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好笑​的​是​，​游侠​骑士​看起来​并​不在乎​他​操心​的​事情​。​仅仅​两秒钟​不到​，​他们​就​开始​向​我们​丢​手雷​了​。\n"
"\n"
"la1dao3 ba1，ni3 shuo1 wo3men5 neng2 zen3me5ban4？you2yu2 Fu4ke4si1 de5 cuo4wu4 qing2bao4，wo3men5 ya4gen1 mei2 dai4 ren4he2 zhong4xing2 wu3qi4。“bu4neng2 you3 fu4dai4 sun3shang1”，zhe4 shi4 ta1 de5 yuan2 hua4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3xiao4 de5 shi4，you2Xia2qi2shi4 kan4qi3lai5 bing4 bu4zai4hu5 ta1 cao1xin1 de5 shi4qing5。jin3jin3 liang3 miao3 zhong1 bu4dao4，ta1men5 jiu4 kai1shi3 xiang4 wo3men5 diu1 shou3lei2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, he may create a dynasty that will stand for a time, but his dust will not reap its benefit.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair's voice is steady now. For a moment, his age, illness, and fatigue fall away.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"他​或许​能​建立​一个​王朝​，​让​它​在​一段时间​内​屹立​不倒​，​但​他​的​后人​却​无法​享受​到​它​的​恩惠​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​声音​现在​变得​平稳​了​。​刹那间​，​他​的​衰老​、​疾病​和​疲惫​都​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ta1 huo4xu3 neng2 jian4li4 yi1ge5 wang2chao2，rang4 ta1 zai4 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 nei4 yi4li4 bu4 dao3，dan4 ta1 de5 hou4ren2 que4 wu2fa3 xiang3shou4 dao4 ta1 de5 en1hui4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 xian4zai4 bian4de5 ping2wen3 le5。cha4 na4 jian1，ta1 de5 shuai1lao3、ji2bing4 he4 pi2bei4 dou1 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Oh, hey again. What's up?"
msgstr ""
"又​见面​了​。​有事吗​？\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5。you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Oh, hey, I heard back from Emilie, by the way. In another month or two, you'll get a chance to meet her... she's comin' to the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, her little operation was a success."
msgstr ""
"对​了​，​艾米莉​回​我​消息​了​。​一两个​月​以后​，​你​就​有​机会​见到​她​了​……​她​说​要​来​一趟​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​显然​，​她​的​小​行动​成功​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，ai4 mi3 li4 hui2 wo3 xiao1xi5 le5。yi1 liang3 ge4 yue4 yi3hou4，ni3 jiu4 you3 ji1hui4 jian4dao4 ta1 le5……ta1 shuo1 yao4 lai2 yi1 tang1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，ta1 de5 xiao3 xing2dong4 cheng2gong1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, hey, chief! You're back! And you've got the box, right?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes an eager step toward you, his hand extended.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Give it here, if you please."
msgstr ""
"头儿​！​你​回来​了​！​你​把​匣子​也​带​回来​了​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​急切​朝​你​跨步​走来​，​伸出​一只​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​麻烦​交给​我​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5！ni3 hui2lai5 le5！ni3 ba3 xia2zi5 ye3 dai4 hui2lai5 le5 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 chao2 ni3 kua4bu4 zou3 lai2，shen1chu1 yi1 zhi3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ma2fan5 jiao1gei3 wo3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, hoi, $(l.name). Have you seen Monika around?\n"
"\n"
"I've been looking all over for her."
msgstr ""
"嗨​，​$(l.name)​。​你​有​见到​莫妮卡​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​在​到处​找​她​。\n"
"\n"
"hai1，$(l.name)。ni3 you3 jian4dao4 Mo4ni1ka3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 dao4chu4 zhao3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, hundreds.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He beams at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The security system here is quite state of the art. User-friendly, too... it didn't take long to figure out how to make some peasants wake up, and others go to sleep."
msgstr ""
"哦​，​成百上千​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​对​你​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​的​安保​系统​非常​先进​。​用户​体验​也​很​友好​……​我​很快​就​学会​了​如何​让​一些​臣民​醒来​，​而​让​另​一些​臣民​睡​去​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，cheng2bai3shang4qian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3 fei1chang2 xian1jin4。yong4hu4 ti3yan4 ye3 hen3 you3hao3……wo3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 xue2hui4 le5 ru2he2 rang4 yi1xie1 chen2min2 xing3lai2，er2 rang4 ling4 yi1xie1 chen2min2 shui4 qu4。"

msgid "Oh, is Audran around? I've got a message for him from Paul Amsel."
msgstr ""
"奥​德兰​在​附近​吗​？​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​让​我​给​他​带个​话​。\n"
"Ao4de2lan2 zai4 fu4jin4 ma5？bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 rang4 wo3 gei3 ta1 dai4 ge4 hua4。"

msgid "Oh, is that so?"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​是​吗​？\n"
"e2，shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Oh, it was, was it?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger grits her teeth and shakes her head.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"圈套​，​是​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​从​牙缝里​挤出​一句​话​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"quan1tao4，shi4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 cong2 ya2 feng2 li3 ji3chu1 yi1ju4 hua4，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Oh, it's *important,* you say?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He makes a sweeping gesture in the direction of the building behind him. The other assorted toughs behind him smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well... by all means, go on in then. "
msgstr ""
"哦​，​你​说​这​很​*​重要​*​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他朝​身后​的​建筑​挥​了​挥手​。​其他​的​帮派​成员​们​都​笑​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​啊​……​那​你​就​进去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，ni3 shuo1 zhe4 hen3*zhong4yao4*？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 shen1hou4 de5 jian4zhu4 hui1 le5 hui1shou3。qi2ta1 de5 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 men5 dou1 xiao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 a1……na4 ni3 jiu4 jin4qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, it's a milk run. You can trust me on that. But I'm afraid that I can't tell you more until you accept.\n"
"\n"
"Not my rules, friend. My employers'."
msgstr ""
"就是​个​跑腿​的​小​差事​而已​，​这点​你​大​可​放心​。​不过​恐怕​得​等​你​答应​之后​，​我​才能​透露​更​多​细节​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​规矩​不是​我定​的​，​朋友​。​是​我​的​雇主​定​的​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 ge4 pao3tui3 de5 xiao3 cha4shi4 er2yi3，zhe4 dian3 ni3 dai4 ke3 fang4xin1。bu4guo4 kong3pa4 de2 deng3 ni3 da1ying5 zhi1hou4，wo3 cai2neng2 tou4lu4 geng1 duo1 xi4jie2。\n"
"\n"
"gui1ju5 bu4shi4 wo3 ding4 de5，peng2you5。shi4 wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 ding4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, just forget it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head irritably.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You need something else? Or can I get on with my day?"
msgstr ""
"那​算了吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​不耐烦​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​别的​事​吗​？​或者​我​可以​忙​自己​的​事​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"na4 suan4 le5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bu4nai4fan2 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？huo4zhe3 wo3 ke3yi3 mang2 zi4ji3 de5 shi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Oh, just wanted to see what all the \"Rabengeister\" fuss was about. Cool "
"pad you've got here.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"噢​，​我​只是​想​看看​这​“​鸦灵​”​是​怎么​一​回事​。​你​这​地方​不错​啊​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"o1，wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 kan4kan5 zhe4“Ya1ling2” shi4 zen3me5 yi1 hui2shi4。ni3 zhe4 di4fang1 bu4cuo4 a1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Oh, man! That's it, that's the show! I forgot how bad the dub job was!"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​天​哪​！​就是​这个​，​就是​这部​剧​！​我​都​忘​了​配音​有多烂​了​！\n"
"e2，tian1 na3！jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5，jiu4shi4 zhe4 bu4 ju4！wo3 dou1 wang4 le5 pei4yin1 you3 duo1 lan4 le5！"

msgid ""
"Oh, man. I don't know what to do, Mira.\n"
"\n"
"And I still say that messing with the Azzies was a *bad* idea."
msgstr ""
"老天​。​我​不​知道​怎么办​好​了​，​米拉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​依旧​认为​招惹​阿兹佬是​个​*​坏​*​主意​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zen3me5ban4 hao3 le5，mi3la1。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 yi1jiu4 ren4wei2 zhao1re3 e1 zi1 lao3 shi4 ge4*huai4*zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, my God. He's kept her in this thing for twenty years. At least. \n"
"\n"
"There's nothing but a reptile brain left in the dragon down there."
msgstr ""
"老天​。​他​把​她​困​在​这里​至少​有​二十年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​下面​的​那头​巨龙​也许​只​剩下​了​爬行​类​的​脑​回路​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1。ta1 ba3 ta1 kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 zhi4shao3 you3 er4 shi2 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xia4mian4 de5 na4 tou2 ju4long2 ye3xu3 zhi3 sheng4xia4 le5 pa2xing2 lei4 de5 nao3 hui2lu4。"

msgid "Oh, my, yes."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​是​的​。\n"
"o1，shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, no need!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles graciously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know a better way of determining the truth."
msgstr ""
"哦​，​没​这个​必要​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​露出​和蔼​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​更好​的​办法​来​查明真相​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，mei2 zhe4ge5 bi4yao4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 he2ai3 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 geng1 hao3 de5 ban4fa3 lai2 cha2 ming2 zhen1 xiang1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, no! Poor Marta!\n"
"\n"
"Take care of her, okay?"
msgstr ""
"哦​不​！​可怜​的​玛​尔塔​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​照顾​好​她​，​好​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"e2 bu4！ke3lian2 de5 Ma3er3ta3！\n"
"\n"
"zhao4gu5 hao3 ta1，hao3 ma5？"

msgid "Oh, no."
msgstr ""
"哦​不​。\n"
"e2 bu4。"

msgid "Oh, no. Never. A friend of mine used it once."
msgstr ""
"那​是​自然​。​我​有​个​朋友​用过​一次​。\n"
"na4 shi4 zi4ran2。wo3 you3 ge4 peng2you5 yong4 guo4 yi1ci4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, no... nothin' much...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His smile broadens, and a stream of giggles comes pouring out of him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, it's... uh... it's pretty horrible stuff, man."
msgstr ""
"哦​不​……​没什么​大不了​的​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​笑容​逐渐​扩大​，​喉咙​里​发出​一阵​嘿嘿​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​不​，​这个​……​还是​挺​可怕​的​，​是​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"e2 bu4……mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 zhu2jian4 kuo4da4，hou2long2 li3 fa1chu1 yi1zhen4 hei1hei1 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 bu4，zhe4ge5……hai2shi5 ting3 ke3pa4 de5，shi4 ba1。"

msgid "Oh, nothing. I just wanted to thank you for knocking him down a peg."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​没什么​。​我​只是​想​感谢​你​，​像​他​这种​人​就​得​吃​点​苦头​。\n"
"o1，mei2shen2me5。wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 gan3xie4 ni3，xiang4 ta1 zhe4zhong3 ren2 jiu4 de2 chi1 dian3 ku3tou5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, okay baby! You come on back any time! Just bring more cram when you do, "
"okay?"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​没​问题​宝贝​！​什么​时候​回来​都行​！​就是​记得​再​多​带点​药​回来​，​好​吗​？\n"
"e2，mei2 wen4ti2 bao3bei4！shen2me5 shi2hou5 hui2lai5 dou1 xing2！jiu4shi4 ji4de5 zai4 duo1 dai4 dian3 yao4 hui2lai5，hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Oh, people will tut-tut about it. There may be a protest or two. But nobody will actually *do* anything to stop them.\n"
"\n"
"The immortal, all-powerful, utterly pitiless reptiles will seize more and more of our power, wealth, and territory.\n"
"\n"
"And we foolish, short-sighted mortals will never get it back."
msgstr ""
"人们​是​会​背后议论​一下​。​也许​会​有人​抗议​什么​的​。​但​不会​有人​真的​*​做出​*​任何​事来​阻止​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​不朽​的​、​无所不能​的​、​完全​无情​的​爬行动物​将​攫取​我们​越来越​多​的​权力​、​财富​和​领土​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​我们​这些​愚蠢​短视​的​凡人​将​永远​无法​夺回​属于​自己​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2men5 shi4 hui4 bei1 hou4 yi4 lun2 yi1xia4。ye3xu3 hui4 you3ren2 kang4yi4 shen2me5 de5。dan4 bu4hui4 you3ren2 zhen1de5*zuo4chu1*ren4he2 shi4 lai2 zu3zhi3 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 bu4xiu3 de5、wu2suo3bu4neng2 de5、wan2quan2 wu2qing2 de5 pa2xing2dong4wu4 jiang1 jue2qu3 wo3men5 yue4lai2yue4 duo1 de5 quan2li4、cai2fu4 he4 ling3tu3。\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3men5 zhe4xie1 yu2chun3 duan3shi4 de5 fan2ren2 jiang1 yong3yuan3 wu2fa3 duo2hui2 shu3yu2 zi4ji3 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid "Oh, shit. Dante."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​但丁​。\n"
"ai1ya1，dan4ding1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, shove off, Eiger. We were all on the lookout for physical security, $(l.name) included.\n"
"\n"
"Throwing $(l.him) under the bus isn't going to help anything."
msgstr ""
"别扯​了​，​艾格尔​。​我们​当时​都​忙​着​关注​现实​世界​的​安保​情况​，​$(l.name)​也​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​把​锅​都​甩​给​$(l.he)​也​没用​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 che3 le5，Ai4ge2er3。wo3men5 dang1shi2 dou1 mang2 zhao2 guan1zhu4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 de5 an1bao3 qing2kuang4，$(l.name) ye3 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 guo1 dou1 shuai3 gei3 $(l.he) ye3 mei2yong4 a1。"

msgid "Oh, shut up."
msgstr ""
"闭嘴​吧​。\n"
"bi4zui3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, sure, they did. Our neighbors were perfectly decent people. Even if they couldn't admit it to themselves, they knew what my father was up to.\n"
"\n"
"When they heard a woman and a little girl screaming bloody murder, they were the first to pick up the comm."
msgstr ""
"当然​报警​了​。​那些​邻居​都​是​好人​。​即便​他们​自己​不敢​承认​，​也​清楚​我​父亲​在​搞​什么​名堂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​一​听到​有​女人​和​小孩​在​高喊​杀人​的​时候​，​就​立刻​拿​起​了​电话​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 bao4jing3 le5。na4xie1 lin2ju1 dou1 shi4 hao3ren2。ji2bian4 ta1men5 zi4ji3 bu4 gan3 cheng2ren4，ye3 qing1chu5 wo3 fu4qin1 zai4 gao3 shen2me5 ming2tang5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yi1 ting1dao4 you3 nu:3ren2 he4 xiao3hai2 zai4 gao1han3 sha1ren2 de5 shi2hou5，jiu4 li4ke4 na2 qi3 le5 dian4hua4。"

msgid "Oh, sure. Except that we’re not at war with dragons."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​只不过​我们​并​没有​和​巨龙​开战​。\n"
"dang1ran2。zhi3bu5guo4 wo3men5 bing4 mei2you3 he4 ju4long2 kai1zhan4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, thank Christ. I've gotta get home to the wife... she's going to give me hell enough as it is.\n"
"\n"
"I was *supposed* to be home an hour ago."
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​。​我​得​赶紧​回家​安抚​妻子​……​恐怕​她​已经​要​对​我​大发雷霆​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一个​小时​前​*​就​该​*​到家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。wo3 de2 gan3jin3 hui2jia1 an1fu3 qi1zi3……kong3pa4 ta1 yi3jing1 yao4 dui4 wo3 da4fa1lei2ting2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1ge5 xiao3shi2 qian2*jiu4 gai1*dao4jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, thank God. And thank *you,* chief.\n"
"\n"
"Thank Paul, too, come to think of it."
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​，​也​谢谢​*​你​*​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这么​一说​，​我​还​得​谢谢​保罗​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4，ye3 xie4xie5*ni3*，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 yi1shuo1，wo3 hai2 de2 xie4xie5 bao3luo2。"

msgid ""
"Oh, thank God. And thank you, too.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns to Mira.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Give $(l.him) the spare keycard that Danni bought. $+(l.he)'s going to fix this for us."
msgstr ""
"哦​，​感谢上帝​。​也​感谢​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转向​米拉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​把​丹妮​多​买​的​那​张​门禁卡​交给​$(l.he)​。​$+(l.he)​能​帮​我们​收拾​局面​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，gan3 xie4 shang4 di4。ye3 gan3xie4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 mi3la1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ba3 dan1 ni1 duo1 mai3 de5 na4 zhang1 men2 jin1 ka3 jiao1gei3 $(l.he)。$+(l.he) neng2 bang1 wo3men5 shou1shi5 ju2mian4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, thank you, thank you!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Tears stream down his cheeks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is the happiest day of my life!"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​谢谢​，​谢谢​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​眼泪​从​他​的​脸颊​上​流下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​一生​中​最​快乐​的​日子​！\n"
"\n"
"e2，xie4xie5，xie4xie5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yan3lei4 cong2 ta1 de5 lian3jia2 shang4 liu2 xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 yi1sheng1 zhong4 zui4 kuai4le4 de5 ri4zi5！"

msgid ""
"Oh, thank you, thank you, thank you!\n"
"\n"
"This'll keep me goin' for at least another couple of days!"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​谢谢​，​谢谢​，​谢谢​你​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​至少​够​我​再​撑​个​几天​了​！\n"
"\n"
"e2，xie4xie5，xie4xie5，xie4xie5 ni3！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhi4shao3 gou4 wo3 zai4 cheng1 ge4 ji3tian1 le5！"

msgid ""
"Oh, that's fun... but, um, is tonight really the best time? Considering that it's crunch time, and that big speech last week about increasing our internal security, and all?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a brief moment, and then fixes her eyes on yours, a serious look on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Seriously, your friend should leave. Otherwise, Management's going to be pissed, and you know how touchy they've been recently."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​挺​好​的​……​不过​吧​，​现在​过来​合适​吗​？​现在​正是​关键时刻​，​而且​上周​不是​刚​召开​关于​加强​内部​安全​的​重要讲话​什么​的​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​沉默​了​一会儿​，​然后​死死​盯​着​你​，​脸上​的​表情​十分​严肃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老实​讲​，​还是​让​你​的​朋友​离开​吧​。​否则​管理处​肯定​会​发火​的​，​你​也​知道​那些​人​最近​抓狂​到​什么​程度​了​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，ting3 hao3 de5……bu4guo4 ba1，xian4zai4 guo4lai2 he2shi4 ma5？xian4zai4 zheng4shi4 guan1 jian4 shi2 ke4，er2qie3 shang4zhou1 bu4shi4 gang1 zhao4kai1 guan1yu2 jia1qiang2 nei4bu4 an1quan2 de5 chong2 yao4 jiang3 hua4 shen2me5 de5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 de5 biao3qing2 shi2fen1 yan2su4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3shi5 jiang3，hai2shi5 rang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 li2kai1 ba1。fou3ze2 guan3 li3 chu3 ken3ding4 hui4 fa1huo3 de5，ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 na4xie1 ren2 zui4jin4 zhua1kuang2 dao4 shen2me5 cheng2du4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, that's fun... but, um, should they be here tonight? Considering that it's crunch time, and that big speech last week about increasing our internal security, and all?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a brief moment, and then fixes her eyes on yours, a serious look on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Seriously, they should leave. If you take them in there, Management's going to be pissed, and you know how touchy they've been recently."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​挺​好​的​……​不过​吧​，​他们​现在​过来​合适​吗​？​现在​正是​关键时刻​，​而且​上周​不是​刚​召开​关于​加强​内部​安全​的​重要讲话​什么​的​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​沉默​了​一会儿​，​然后​死死​盯​着​你​，​脸上​的​表情​十分​严肃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老实​讲​，​还是​让​他们​离开​吧​。​如果​你​带​他们​进去​的话​，​管理处​肯定​会​发火​的​，​你​也​知道​那些​人​最近​抓狂​到​什么​程度​了​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，ting3 hao3 de5……bu4guo4 ba1，ta1men5 xian4zai4 guo4lai2 he2shi4 ma5？xian4zai4 zheng4shi4 guan1 jian4 shi2 ke4，er2qie3 shang4zhou1 bu4shi4 gang1 zhao4kai1 guan1yu2 jia1qiang2 nei4bu4 an1quan2 de5 chong2 yao4 jiang3 hua4 shen2me5 de5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 de5 biao3qing2 shi2fen1 yan2su4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3shi5 jiang3，hai2shi5 rang4 ta1men5 li2kai1 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 dai4 ta1men5 jin4qu4 de5hua4，guan3 li3 chu3 ken3ding4 hui4 fa1huo3 de5，ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 na4xie1 ren2 zui4jin4 zhua1kuang2 dao4 shen2me5 cheng2du4 le5。"

msgid "Oh, there's no need. Word gets around. You're $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​没​这个​必要​。​消息​传开​来​很快​的​。​我们​知道​你​是​$(l.name)​。\n"
"o1，mei2 zhe4ge5 bi4yao4。xiao1xi5 chuan2kai1 lai2 hen3 kuai4 de5。wo3men5 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 $(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Oh, they're terrible. The worst! Loud, violent drekheads with grabby hands. "
"But they have the cram, so whatcha gonna do?\n"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​他们​可​差劲​了​。​简直​烂​到​家​了​！​又​吵​又​凶​的​一群​猪头​，​还​总是​动手动脚​的​。​但是​他们​有药​啊​，​你​还​能​怎么办​呢​？\n"
"e2，ta1men5 ke3 cha4jin4 le5。jian3zhi2 lan4 dao4 jia1 le5！you4 chao3 you4 xiong1 de5 yi1 qun2 zhu1tou2，hai2 zong3shi4 dong4shou3dong4jiao3 de5。dan4shi4 ta1men5 you3 yao4 a1，ni3 hai2 neng2 zen3me5ban4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Oh, this, that, the other thing.\n"
"\n"
"You can talk to them yourself, if you really want the info. "
msgstr ""
"噢​，​就是​这个​啊​那个​啊​，​各种​话题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​很​想要​情报​的话​，​也​可以​亲自​去​和​他们​聊聊​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5 a1 na4ge5 a1，ge4zhong3 hua4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hen3 xiang3yao4 qing2bao4 de5hua4，ye3 ke3yi3 qin1zi4 qu4 he4 ta1men5 liao2 liao2。"

msgid ""
"Oh, uh, no... not as such, chief. I won't be physically *going* to Drogenkippe... I've seen enough of that place for one lifetime.\n"
"\n"
"I'll be jacking in from a terminal that I set up here in the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​不是​……​这个​意思​，​头儿​。​我​不会​*​亲自​*​去​毒​坑区​……​我​已经​受够了​那个​鬼​地方​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​搭建​好​终端​，​然后​进入​矩阵​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，bu4shi4……zhe4ge5 yi4si5，tou2r5。wo3 bu4hui4*qin1zi4*qu4 du2 keng1 qu1……wo3 yi3jing1 shou4 gou4 le5 na4ge5 gui3 di4fang1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 da1jian4 hao3 zhong1duan1，ran2hou4 jin4ru4 ju3zhen4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, uh, sure, chief... nothin' like a nice hot mug of soykaf on a cold "
"night!"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​是​啊​，​头儿​……​没什么​比寒​夜里​的​一杯​热气腾腾​的​豆​咖更​舒服​的​了​！\n"
"en1，shi4 a1，tou2r5……mei2shen2me5 bi3 han2 ye4li5 de5 yi1 bei1 re4qi4teng2teng2 de5 dou4 ka1 geng1 shu1fu5 de5 le5！"

msgid "Oh, we're fine. Thanks for checking on us. (w)"
msgstr ""
"噢​，​我们​挺​好​的​。​谢谢​你​的​关心​。\n"
"o1，wo3men5 ting3 hao3 de5。xie4xie5 ni3 de5 guan1xin1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, what's there to tell? Our lives would be boring when compared to, well, "
"you know."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​有​什么​好​说​的​？​和​你​的​冒险​相比​，​我们​的​故事​简直​太​无趣​了​。\n"
"o1，you3 shen2me5 hao3 shuo1 de5？he4 ni3 de5 mao4xian3 xiang1bi3，wo3men5 de5 gu4shi4 jian3zhi2 tai4 wu2qu4 le5。"

msgid "Oh, why didn't you say so? That plan doesn't sound crazy at all."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​不早​说​？​这个​计划​真是​一点​都​不​疯狂​啊​。\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 bu4 zao3 shuo1？zhe4ge5 ji4hua4 zhen1shi5 yi1dian3 dou1 bu4 feng1kuang2 a1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, y'know. No one important.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz continues smiling at you for a few seconds, then looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I, uh... I stole the file from Aztechnology."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​这个​，​不​重要​啦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​又​朝​你​嬉皮笑脸​了​几秒​，​然后​移开​了​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​……​从​阿兹特​科技​偷来​的​文件​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1，zhe4ge5，bu4 zhong4yao4 la5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 you4 chao2 ni3 xi1pi2xiao4lian3 le5 ji1 miao3，ran2hou4 yi2kai1 le5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4……cong2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 tou1 lai2 de5 wen2jian4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, yeah! Lots and lots and lots of people say that it's haunted! It's like, there was this little girl who died in one of the rooms back in the early 2000s. I think she, like, drowned? Or suffocated! Or maybe she fell out a window.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, no, wait! I got that wrong. It was a little boy! Anyway, he haunts the hotel. I think. Or maybe it was a giant bug? Is that the story I'm thinking of? I don't remember."
msgstr ""
"当然​啦​！​好多好多​好多​人​都​说​那​地方​闹鬼​！​据说​啊​，​在​2000​年代​初期​，​有个​小女孩​死​在​里头​一间​房里​了​。​我​记得​她​好像​，​是​淹死​的​？​还是​憋死​的​来​着​？​哦​，​也​可能​是从​窗户​掉下去​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​不​对​，​等​一下​。​我​记错​了​。​是​个​小男孩​！​反正​就是​他​在​旅馆​里​闹鬼​。​我​记得​是​这样​。​还是​说​是​只​大​虫子​？​这​俩​是不是​一个​事来​着​？​我​记不清​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 la5！hao3 duo1 hao3 duo1 hao3duo1 ren2 dou1 shuo1 na4 di4fang1 nao4gui3！ju4shuo1 a1，zai4 2000 nian2dai4 chu1qi1，you3 ge4 xiao3 nu:3 hai2 si3 zai4 li3tou5 yi1 jian1 fang2 li3 le5。wo3 ji4de5 ta1 hao3xiang4，shi4 yan1si3 de5？hai2shi5 bie1 si3 de5 lai2 zhao2？e2，ye3 ke3neng2 shi4 cong2 chuang1hu5 diao4 xia4 qu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"e2 bu4 dui4，deng3 yi1xia4。wo3 ji4cuo4 le5。shi4 ge4 xiao3 nan2 hai2！fan3zheng4 jiu4shi4 ta1 zai4 lu:3guan3 li3 nao4gui3。wo3 ji4de5 shi4 zhe4yang4。hai2shi5 shuo1 shi4 zhi3 dai4 chong2zi5？zhe4 lia3 shi4bu5shi4 yi1ge5 shi4 lai2 zhao2？wo3 ji4 bu4 qing1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, right. And if I *had* gotten into their faces, what good would that have done? Look at me!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She spreads her arms wide. Even at their full spread, she doesn't look much bigger than a human child.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm tiny!"
msgstr ""
"是​这么回事​。​那​如果​我​*​要是​*​跟​他们​硬干​，​会​有​什么​好下场​吗​？​看看​我​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​张开​双臂​。​即便​完全​伸展​开来​，​她​的​体型​也​仅​比​人类​孩童​稍大些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这么​娇小​！\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。na4 ru2guo3 wo3*yao4shi5*gen1 ta1men5 ying4gan4，hui4 you3 shen2me5 hao3 xia4 chang2 ma5？kan4kan5 wo3！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang1kai1 shuang1bi4。ji2bian4 wan2quan2 shen1zhan3 kai1 lai2，ta1 de5 ti3xing2 ye3 jin3 bi3 ren2lei4 hai2tong2 shao1 dai4 xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4me5 jiao1xiao3！"

msgid ""
"Oh, yeah. Right! Sorry... you see, I was running late, and I forgot my "
"soykaf this morning."
msgstr ""
"对​哦​！​抱歉​……​我​今天​迟到​了​，​早上​也​没​来得及​喝豆​咖​。\n"
"dui4 e2！bao4qian4……wo3 jin1tian1 chi2dao4 le5，zao3shang5 ye3 mei2 lai2de5ji2 he4 dou4 ka1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, yes! Of course.\n"
"\n"
"The password is \"Shark Tank.\" Don't ask me why.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks again! You are truly a wonderful person!"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​对​！​当然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​口令​是​“​鲨鱼​缸​”​。​别问​我​为什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再次​感谢​！​你​真是​个​了不起​的​人​！\n"
"\n"
"e2，dui4！dang1ran2。\n"
"\n"
"kou3ling4 shi4“sha1yu2 gang1”。bie4 wen4 wo3 wei4shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci4 gan3xie4！ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 liao3bu5qi3 de5 ren2！"

msgid ""
"Oh, yes.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll give it to you."
msgstr ""
"哦​，​当然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​急切​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这​就​把​它​给​你​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，dang1ran2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4 jiu4 ba3 ta1 gei3 ni3。"

msgid "Oh, you know I'm your man. I can hook you up right now."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​你​可算​找​对​人​了​。​我​马上​就​能​给​你​搞定​。\n"
"o1，ni3 ke3 suan4 zhao3 dui4 ren2 le5。wo3 ma3shang4 jiu4 neng2 gei3 ni3 gao3ding4。"

msgid ""
"Oh, you know the saying “memory like a goldfish”? Because I'm blonde, people think I'm just like that.\n"
"\n"
"Plus they call my twin Guppy, so Goldfish made sense for me."
msgstr ""
"噢​，​你​有没有​听过​“​记忆力​像​金鱼​”​这种​说法​？​因为​我​是​金发​，​别人​总​觉得​我​脑子​不好​使​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​他们​管​我​的​孪生姐妹​叫​“​孔雀鱼​”​，​所以​“​金鱼​”​这​名字​对​我​来说​也​算​贴切​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"o1，ni3 you3mei2you3 ting1 guo4“ji4yi4li4 xiang4 jin1yu2” zhe4zhong3 shuo1fa3？yin1wei4 wo3 shi4 jin1fa4，bie2ren5 zong3 jue2de5 wo3 nao3zi5 bu4hao3 shi3。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4 ta1men5 guan3 wo3 de5 luan2sheng1jie3mei4 jiao4“kong3 qiao1 yu2”，suo3yi3“jin1yu2” zhe4 ming2zi5 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 ye3 suan4 tie1qie4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Oh, you know, just shopping around. I've always wanted a secret lair "
"underneath a giant castle."
msgstr ""
"这个​嘛​，​就是​随便​看看​。​我​自己​也​一直​希望​能​在​某个​巨大​城堡​底下​拥有​一个​秘密​巢穴​什么​的​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 ma5，jiu4shi4 sui2bian4 kan4kan5。wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 yi1zhi2 xi1wang4 neng2 zai4 mou3 ge4 ju4da4 cheng2bao3 di3xia5 yong1you3 yi1ge5 mi4mi4 chao2xue2 shen2me5 de5。"

msgid "Oh, you son of a bitch."
msgstr ""
"你​个​狗​娘养​的​。\n"
"ni3 ge4 gou3 niang2 yang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Oh. Damn.\n"
"\n"
"Well, um... I also have some rigging skills... I can do that, too. And I'm pretty handy with a gun.\n"
"\n"
"Worst case, I'm another warm body to fill the ranks if somebody takes a hit! That's something, right?"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​该死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​，​呃​……​我​也​会些​机师​的​本事​……​我​也​能​顶上​这个​位置​。​我枪​也​玩​的​很​溜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最坏​的​情况​下​，​要是​队里​有人​倒​了​，​我​也​是​个​能​填线​的​大​活人​啊​！​这​也​算​有点​用​啊​，​是不是​？\n"
"\n"
"e2，gai1si3。\n"
"\n"
"na4，e4……wo3 ye3 hui4 xie1 ji1shi1 de5 ben3shi4……wo3 ye3 neng2 ding3shang4 zhe4ge5 wei4zhi5。wo3 qiang1 ye3 wan2 de5 hen3 liu1。\n"
"\n"
"zui4 huai4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4，yao4shi5 dui4 li3 you3ren2 dao3 le5，wo3 ye3 shi4 ge4 neng2 tian2 xian4 de5 dai4 huo2ren2 a1！zhe4 ye3 suan4 you3dian3 yong4 a1，shi4bu5shi4？"

msgid ""
"Oh. Damn.\n"
"\n"
"Well, um... I also have some rigging skills... I can do that, too. And I'm pretty handy with a gun. Worst case scenario, I'm another warm body to fill the ranks if somebody takes a hit.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, buddy, let me sign on with you. You won't regret it."
msgstr ""
"哦​，​该死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​，​呃​……​我​也​会些​机师​的​本事​……​我​也​能​顶上​这个​位置​。​我枪​也​玩​的​很​溜​。​最坏​的​情况​下​，​要是​队里​有人​倒​了​，​我​也​是​个​能​填线​的​大​活人​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​拜托​了​，​伙计​，​就让​我​入伙​吧​。​你​不会​后悔​的​。\n"
"\n"
"e2，gai1si3。\n"
"\n"
"na4，e4……wo3 ye3 hui4 xie1 ji1shi1 de5 ben3shi4……wo3 ye3 neng2 ding3shang4 zhe4ge5 wei4zhi5。wo3 qiang1 ye3 wan2 de5 hen3 liu1。zui4 huai4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4，yao4shi5 dui4 li3 you3ren2 dao3 le5，wo3 ye3 shi4 ge4 neng2 tian2 xian4 de5 dai4 huo2ren2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1 le5，huo3ji5，jiu4 rang4 wo3 ru4huo3 ba1。ni3 bu4hui4 hou4hui3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Oh. Hey. You're back.\n"
"\n"
"Great to see you... what can ol' Zaak getcha?"
msgstr ""
"啊​，​你​回来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​高兴​见到​你​……​老​扎克​能​给​你​来​点​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"a1，ni3 hui2lai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 jian4dao4 ni3……lao3 Zha1ke4 neng2 gei3 ni3 lai2 dian3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Oh. Okay.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She steps back, a sheepish look on her face.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"噢​，​好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​退后​一步​，​脸上​带​着​羞怯​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"o1，hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tui4hou4 yi1 bu4，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 xiu1qie4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Oh. Sorry, my mistake."
msgstr ""
"噢​。​抱歉​，​是​我​搞错​了​。\n"
"o1。bao4qian4，shi4 wo3 gao3cuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh. Um. Yeah, that'd probably...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances over at the body again, and swallows. Hard.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...That'd probably be a good idea.\n"
"\n"
"He's already starting to smell."
msgstr ""
"哦​。​呃​。​对​，​这​主意​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​瞥​了​一眼​尸体​，​吞​了​吞口水​。​咽得​很​艰难​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​这​主意​可能​不错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​已经​开始​发臭​了​。\n"
"\n"
"e2。e4。dui4，zhe4 zhu3yi5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 shi1ti3，tun1 le5 tun1 kou3 shui3。yan1 de2 hen3 jian1nan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……zhe4 zhu3yi5 ke3neng2 bu4cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 fa1chou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh. Well, I would be an awful doctor if I didn't recommend that you cease "
"ingesting this substance."
msgstr ""
"呃​。​如果​我​不​建议​你​停止​摄入​这种​物质​，​那​我​就是​个​糟糕​的​医生​了​。\n"
"e4。ru2guo3 wo3 bu4 jian4yi4 ni3 ting2zhi3 she4ru4 zhe4zhong3 wu4zhi4，na4 wo3 jiu4shi4 ge4 zao1gao1 de5 yi1sheng1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh... okay...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The junkie's face floods with a mixture of surprise and relief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...So then, like, what DO you want?"
msgstr ""
"哦​……​那好​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​瘾君子​的​脸上​写满​了​惊讶​，​同时​也​松​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​那​，​你​到底​想要​什么​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"e2……na4 hao3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yin3jun1zi3 de5 lian3 shang4 xie3 man3 le5 jing1ya4，tong2shi2 ye3 song1 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……na4，ni3 dao4di3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Oh... uh, I'd rather not talk about that. No biggie, or anything, but I don't really want to get into it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His face reddens slightly, and he shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She was crazy anyway."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​还是​别聊​这个​吧​。​倒​也​没什么​大不了​的​，​就是​不太想​提​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​脸色​微红​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​她​就是​个​疯​婆娘​。\n"
"\n"
"e4……hai2shi5 bie4 liao2 zhe4ge5 ba1。dao3 ye3 mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5，jiu4shi4 bu4 tai4 xiang3 ti2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3se4 wei1 hong2，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 ta1 jiu4shi4 ge4 feng1 po2niang2。"

msgid ""
"Oh... y-yeah, you're probably right.\n"
"\n"
"I'll just stay in here, then. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The line cook steals a glance at the dead chef lying crumpled by the sink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"With him."
msgstr ""
"哦​……​是​、​是​啊​，​你​说​的​好像​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​就​先待​在​这儿​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​厨子​匆匆​瞥​了​一眼​歪​着​倒​在​水槽​边​，​已经​死去​的​主厨​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​跟​他​一起​。\n"
"\n"
"e2……shi4、shi4 a1，ni3 shuo1 de5 hao3xiang4 mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 xian1 dai1 zai4 zhe4r5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chu2zi5 cong1cong1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 wai1 zhao2 dao3 zai4 shui3cao2 bian1，yi3jing1 si3qu4 de5 zhu3chu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gen1 ta1 yi1qi3。"

msgid ""
"Oh... you mean, you didn't know? You killed him too. Just like Paul and "
"Monika."
msgstr ""
"噢​……​你​是​说​，​你​不​知道​吗​？​你​也​害死​了​他​。​就​像​保罗​和​莫妮卡​那样​。\n"
"o1……ni3 shi4 shuo1，ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ma5？ni3 ye3 hai4si3 le5 ta1。jiu4 xiang4 bao3luo2 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 na4yang4。"

msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Alice leans toward you. Her smile spreads into a predatory grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do tell."
msgstr ""
"哦​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​爱丽丝​俯身​靠近​你​。​她​的​笑容​逐渐​扭曲​成掠食​般的​狞笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说说看​。\n"
"\n"
"e2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai4li4si1 fu3shen1 kao4jin4 ni3。ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 zhu2jian4 niu3qu1 cheng2 lu:e4 shi2 ban1 de5 ning2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 shuo1 kan4。"

msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She locks eyes with you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Then why did this entire kiez start falling apart the second that she got geeked?"
msgstr ""
"哦​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​与​你​四目​相对​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​为什么​在​她​死​掉​之后​，​整片​街区​就​分崩离析​了​？\n"
"\n"
"e2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wei4shen2me5 zai4 ta1 si3 diao4 zhi1hou4，zheng3 pian1 jie1qu1 jiu4 fen1beng1li2xi1 le5？"

msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes a drag on her cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, color me intrigued. What'd you wanna talk about?"
msgstr ""
"哦​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​抽​了​一口​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​我​倒​是​没想到​。​你​想​聊​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"e2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chou1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 wo3 dao3 shi4 mei2xiang3dao4。ni3 xiang3 liao2 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Stahl raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And what about the smugglers? Maxim and his little menagerie? Are you not with them?"
msgstr ""
"哦​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​斯塔尔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那群​走私​贩​呢​？​马克西姆​和​他​那群​手下​？​你​不是​和​他们​一伙​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"e2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Si1ta3er3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 qun2 zou3si1 fan4 ni2？ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 he4 ta1 na4 qun2 shou3xia4？ni3 bu4shi4 he4 ta1men5 yi1 huo3 de5 ma5？"

msgid "Oh? And what sort of arrangement were you thinking of?"
msgstr ""
"哦​？​那​你​想​怎么​商量​？\n"
"e2？na4 ni3 xiang3 zen3me5 shang1liang5？"

msgid "Oh? And what sort of solution were you thinking of?"
msgstr ""
"哦​？​那​你​有​什么​解决方案​？\n"
"e2？na4 ni3 you3 shen2me5 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4？"

msgid ""
"Oh? I can't say that I'm surprised.\n"
"\n"
"They were instrumental in engineering my downfall back in Spain... the bastards brought all manner of drummed up charges against me. The tabloid press had a field day."
msgstr ""
"哦​？​我​对此​并​不​惊讶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​西班牙​时​，​我​的​垮台​就是​他们​一手​策划​的​……​那些​混蛋​对​我​提出​了​各种​莫须有​的​指控​，​可​把​小报​记者​们​给​忙​坏​了​。\n"
"\n"
"e2？wo3 dui4 ci3 bing4 bu4 jing1ya4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 xi1ban1ya2 shi2，wo3 de5 kua3tai2 jiu4shi4 ta1men5 yi1shou3 ce4hua4 de5……na4xie1 hun2dan4 dui4 wo3 ti2chu1 le5 ge4zhong3 mo4xu1you3 de5 zhi3kong4，ke3 ba3 xiao3bao4 ji4zhe3 men5 gei3 mang2 huai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Oh? Let me see.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel glances at the files on your PDA. After a moment, he looks back up at you with a raised eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"These files... I can't read them, but I have my suspicions. I believe that you walked out of that facility with the very information that Frau Müller wanted you to destroy."
msgstr ""
"噢​？​让​我​看看​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔扫​了​一眼​你​PDA​上​的​文件​。​片刻​后​，​他​挑眉看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​文件​……​我​虽然​看不懂​，​但​我​怀疑​它们​正是​穆勒​女士​要​你​销毁​的​情报​。\n"
"\n"
"o1？rang4 wo3 kan4kan5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 sao3 le5 yi1yan3 ni3 PDA shang4 de5 wen2jian4。pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 tiao1 mei2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 wen2jian4……wo3 sui1ran2 kan4bu5dong3，dan4 wo3 huai2yi2 ta1men5 zheng4shi4 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 yao4 ni3 xiao1hui3 de5 qing2bao4。"

msgid "Okano"
msgstr ""
"冈野\n"
"gang1 ye3"

msgid "Okano's Outfit"
msgstr ""
"奥卡诺​的​服装\n"
"ao4 ka3 nuo4 de5 fu2zhuang1"

msgid ""
"Okay! Okay, yeah, you caught me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Red-faced, he wipes a tear from the corner of his eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This... this was one of mine. Couldn't tell you how excited I was to see this stuff... such incredible toys!\n"
"\n"
"It was WAY too good an opportunity to pass up."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​好​吧​！​没错​，​被​你​发现​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​满脸​通红​，​擦​去​眼角​笑​出​的​泪水​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​……​是​我​干​的​。​看到​这​东西​时​我​简直​兴奋​得​难以形容​……​真是​不可思议​的​玩具​啊​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这么​好​的​机会​，​我​当然​不能​错过​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1！mei2cuo4，bei4 ni3 fa1xian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man3lian3 tong1hong2，ca1 qu4 yan3jiao3 xiao4 chu1 de5 lei4shui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5……shi4 wo3 gan4 de5。kan4dao4 zhe4 dong1xi1 shi2 wo3 jian3zhi2 xing1fen4 de2 nan2 yi3 xing2 rong2……zhen1shi5 bu4ke3si1yi4 de5 wan2ju4 a1！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 hao3 de5 ji1hui4，wo3 dang1ran2 bu4neng2 cuo4guo4。"

msgid "Okay, $(l.name). Don't be a stranger."
msgstr ""
"好​的​，​$(l.name)​。​别​见外​。\n"
"hao3 de5，$(l.name)。bie4 jian4wai4。"

msgid "Okay, I believe you. Sorry for the trouble."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​相信​你​。​不好意思​打扰​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3。bu4hao3yi4si5 da3rao3 le5。"

msgid "Okay, I guess that this is me..."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​看来​该​我​上​了​……\n"
"hao3 ba1，kan4lai5 gai1 wo3 shang4 le5……"

msgid "Okay, I'll bite. Tell me what you know."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​既然如此​，​你​说说看​你​都​知道​些​什么​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，ni3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4 ni3 dou1 zhi1dao4 xie1 shen2me5。"

msgid "Okay, I'll bite. What do you know?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​既然如此​，​你​都​知道​些​什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，ni3 dou1 zhi1dao4 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid "Okay, Zaak. I trust you. Now, can we do some business?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​扎克​，​我​相信​你​。​现在​我们​能谈​生意​了​吗​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，Zha1ke4，wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3。xian4zai4 wo3men5 neng2 tan2 sheng1yi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Okay, chief! I've figured out how to get you out of there!\n"
"\n"
"You're gonna have to release a couple of locks. You can find the controls in the rooms to the north and south of your current position... but in order to get to those locks, I'm gonna have to hold the doors open for you."
msgstr ""
"好​了​头儿​！​我​知道​怎么​让​你​出去​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​得​先​解开​几道​锁才行​。​控制​装置​就​在​你​当前​位置​南北​两侧​的​房间​里​……​不过​要​让​你​过去​解锁​的话​，​我​得​先​帮​你​把门​弄开​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5 tou2r5！wo3 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 rang4 ni3 chu1qu4 le5！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de2 xian1 jie3kai1 ji1 dao4 suo3 cai2 xing2。kong4zhi4 zhuang1zhi4 jiu4 zai4 ni3 dang1qian2 wei4zhi5 nan2bei3 liang3ce4 de5 fang2jian1 li3……bu4guo4 yao4 rang4 ni3 guo4qu4 jie3suo3 de5hua4，wo3 de2 xian1 bang1 ni3 ba3men2 long4 kai1。"

msgid "Okay, chief. You got it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​头儿​，​没​问题​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5，mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid "Okay, deal. You help me, and I'll help you."
msgstr ""
"成交​。​你​帮​我​，​我​就​帮​你​。\n"
"cheng2jiao1。ni3 bang1 wo3，wo3 jiu4 bang1 ni3。"

msgid "Okay, enough chatter. Let’s get this done. "
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​闲话​回头​再聊​。​咱们​开工​吧​。\n"
"hao3 le5，xian2hua4 hui2tou2 zai4 liao2。zan2men5 kai1gong1 ba1。"

msgid "Okay, fine. Welcome aboard."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​行​吧​。​欢迎​入队​。\n"
"xing2 ba1 xing2 ba1。huan1ying2 ru4 dui4。"

msgid "Okay, got it."
msgstr ""
"好​的​，​有​了​。\n"
"hao3 de5，you3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Okay, look. Yeah, the Rabengeister came by yesterday. Asked me to move the rest of these medical supplies. Then they disappeared. I don't know where they went.\n"
"\n"
"I mean, hey... I gotta make a living, right? Look around here. "
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​说​。​“​鸦灵​”​昨天​来过​，​让​我​把​剩下​的​这些​医疗​物资​搬走​，​然后​他们​就​消失​了​。​我​不​知道​他们​去​了​哪儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​拜托​……​我​也​得​讨生活​啊​。​你​看看​这​周围​的​样子​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 shuo1。“Ya1ling2” zuo2tian1 lai2 guo4，rang4 wo3 ba3 sheng4xia4 de5 zhe4xie1 yi1liao2 wu4zi1 ban1zou3，ran2hou4 ta1men5 jiu4 xiao1shi1 le5。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 qu4 le5 na3r5。\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1……wo3 ye3 de2 tao3sheng1huo2 a1。ni3 kan4kan5 zhe4 zhou1wei2 de5 yang4zi5。"

msgid "Okay, looks like everyone’s had their say."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​看来​所有人​都​说完​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，kan4lai5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 shuo1 wan2 le5。"

msgid "Okay, nutcase. I'm outta here. You have fun communing... or whatever."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​疯子​，​我​走​了​。​你​就​慢慢​共融​吧​……​或者​干什么​都行​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，feng1zi5，wo3 zou3 le5。ni3 jiu4 man4man4 gong4 rong2 ba1……huo4zhe3 gan4shen2me5 dou1 xing2。"

msgid ""
"Okay, okay, fine. I meet them at the information kiosk on the far side of the market. That's where they appear. \n"
"\n"
"I don't know how they get there, though. I swear! They don't use the front entrance, I know that much."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​好​吧​。​我​在​市场​远处​的​信息​亭​和​他们​碰头​。​他们​就​出现​在​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​不​知道​他们​是​怎么​到​那​去​的​，​我​发誓​！​他们​不​走​正门​，​我​只​知道​这么​多​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1。wo3 zai4 shi4chang3 yuan3chu4 de5 xin4xi1 ting2 he4 ta1men5 peng4tou2。ta1men5 jiu4 chu1xian4 zai4 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 shi4 zen3me5 dao4 na4 qu4 de5，wo3 fa1shi4！ta1men5 bu4 zou3 zheng4men2，wo3 zhi3 zhi1dao4 zhe4me5 duo1。"

msgid ""
"Okay, okay, yeah... yeah, I can get behind that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She presses her thumb to the encoded credstick you retrieved for her, and its display comes to life. \n"
"\n"
"She presses it to your credstick, and 100 nuyen is instantly transferred from her account to yours.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​……​也​是​，​我​明白​你​的​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​拇指​按​在​你​取回​的​加密​信用​棒​上​，​屏幕​顿时​亮​了​起来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​又​用​它​碰​了​碰​你​的​信用​棒​，​立即​有​100​新円划​到​了​你​的​账户​上​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1……ye3 shi4，wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 de5 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 mu3zhi3 an4 zai4 ni3 qu3hui2 de5 jia1mi4 xin4yong4 bang4 shang4，ping2mu4 dun4shi2 liang4 le5 qi3lai5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 you4 yong4 ta1 peng4 le5 peng4 ni3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4，li4ji2 you3 100 xin1 yuan2 hua2 dao4 le5 ni3 de5 zhang4hu4 shang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Okay, okay. Stop hitting me, I'll talk.\n"
"\n"
"The she-troll is right. I'm working for the Lobatchevskis.\n"
"\n"
"You want names? I'll give you names. More names than you know what to do with."
msgstr ""
"好好​好​，​别打我​了​，​我​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​女​巨魔​说得对​。​我​在​为​洛巴​切夫斯基​家族​做事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想要​名字​？​我会​跟​你​说​各种​名字​，​让​你​根本​分不清​真真假假​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3，bie4 da3 wo3 le5，wo3 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"nu:3 ju4mo2 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 zai4 wei2 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 jia1zu2 zuo4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3yao4 ming2zi5？wo3 hui4 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ge4zhong3 ming2zi5，rang4 ni3 gen1ben3 fen4 bu4 qing1 zhen1 zhen1 jia3 jia3。"

msgid "Okay, open up... Authorization $(s.name)."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​开门​……​我​是​$(s.name)​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，kai1men2……wo3 shi4 $(s.name)。"

msgid ""
"Okay, pal. Here's the deal. The guards here, they don't discriminate. If I call them, they're gonna kill everyone in this room other than me.\n"
"\n"
"So unless you want to see the bodies start droppin' all over this club, you'll back the hell off."
msgstr ""
"朋友​，​你​给​我​听​好​。​这里​的​保安​可​不会​挑挑拣拣​的​。​如果​我​叫​他们​过来​，​这​屋子里​除了​我​之外​的​人​就​都​得​死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​啊​，​除非​你​乐意​看​店里​倒​一地​尸体​，​否则​你​还是​有多远​滚多远​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"peng2you5，ni3 gei3 wo3 ting1 hao3。zhe4li3 de5 bao3an1 ke3 bu4hui4 tiao1 tiao1 jian3 jian3 de5。ru2guo3 wo3 jiao4 ta1men5 guo4lai2，zhe4 wu1 zi3 li3 chu2le5 wo3 zhi1wai4 de5 ren2 jiu4 dou1 de2 si3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 a1，chu2fei1 ni3 le4yi4 kan4 dian4 li3 dao3 yi1 de5 shi1ti3，fou3ze2 ni3 hai2shi5 you3 duo1 yuan3 gun3 duo1 yuan3 ba1。"

msgid "Okay, pal. I'm outta here. You have fun communing... or whatever."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​伙计​，​我​走​了​。​你​就​慢慢​共融​吧​……​或者​干什么​都行​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，huo3ji5，wo3 zou3 le5。ni3 jiu4 man4man4 gong4 rong2 ba1……huo4zhe3 gan4shen2me5 dou1 xing2。"

msgid "Okay, people, it’s go time. You got something to say, speak up now."
msgstr ""
"好​了​各位​，​该​出发​了​。​如果​你们​有​什么​想​说​的​，​就​现在​说​出来​。\n"
"hao3 le5 ge4wei4，gai1 chu1fa1 le5。ru2guo3 ni3men5 you3 shen2me5 xiang3 shuo1 de5，jiu4 xian4zai4 shuo1 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"Okay, so you dealt with the son of a bitch who betrayed you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich takes another pull on the bottle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"After that, you decided that it was time for a change of scenery, so you came here. Am I getting that right?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​所以​说​你​解决​了​那个​王八蛋​叛徒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​又​喝​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​那​之后​，​你​觉得​是​时候​换个​环境​了​，​所以​就​来到​了​这里​。​我​没​说错​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，suo3yi3 shuo1 ni3 jie3jue2 le5 na4ge5 wang2ba1dan4 pan4tu2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 you4 he4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4 zhi1hou4，ni3 jue2de5 shi4 shi2hou5 huan4 ge4 huan2jing4 le5，suo3yi3 jiu4 lai2dao4 le5 zhe4li3。wo3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Okay, so you faked your own death, bailed on the rest of your team, and made your way here to Berlin.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich takes another pull on the bottle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Am I getting that right?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​所以​你​假死​脱身​，​抛下​了​其余​队友​，​跑​到​了​柏林​来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​又​喝​了​口​酒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​说错​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，suo3yi3 ni3 jia3si3 tuo1shen1，pao1xia4 le5 qi2yu2 dui4you3，pao2 dao4 le5 bo2lin2 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 you4 he4 le5 kou3 jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Okay, so you heard the siren song of our fair city - felt it in your bones, yeah? - and you just had to take part in it all. So you packed your bags and made your way here, never to return.\n"
"\n"
"That sound about right so far?"
msgstr ""
"所以​说​，​你​由内而外​感受​到​了​我们​这座​美丽​城市​的​诱惑​召唤​，​决定​自己​非得​参与​其中​不可​。​于是​你​收拾​行囊​，​一路​来到​这里​，​再也​不曾​回头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​这个​意思​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 shuo1，ni3 you2 nei4 er2 wai4 gan3shou4 dao4 le5 wo3men5 zhe4 zuo4 mei3li4 cheng2shi4 de5 you4huo4 zhao4huan4，jue2ding4 zi4ji3 fei1dei3 can1yu4 qi2zhong1 bu4ke3。yu2shi4 ni3 shou1shi5 xing2nang2，yi1lu4 lai2dao4 zhe4li3，zai4ye3 bu4ceng2 hui2tou2。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4ge5 yi4si5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Okay, sure. Yeah. Due diligence, and all that.\n"
"\n"
"Just, like, don't take too long, okay? This is a golden opportunity. I don't wanna waste it."
msgstr ""
"好​，​当然​。​你​要​做点​尽职​调查​什么​的​，​是​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只是​，​呃​，​别花​太​长时间​，​好​吧​？​这​可是​个​大好机会​，​我​不想​浪费​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3，dang1ran2。ni3 yao4 zuo4 dian3 jin4zhi2 diao4cha2 shen2me5 de5，shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3shi4，e4，bie4 hua1 tai4 zhang3 shi2 jian1，hao3 ba1？zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 dai4 hao3 ji1 hui4，wo3 bu4xiang3 lang4fei4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Okay, that’s it. Finish gearing up and head to the tunnel at the back of the"
" safehouse. I'll meet you where we stashed the van."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​就​这样​。​整备​完毕​之后​去​安全​屋​后面​的​隧道​。​我们​在​货车​的​位置​见​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，jiu4 zhe4yang4。zheng3bei4 wan2bi4 zhi1hou4 qu4 an1quan2 wu1 hou4mian5 de5 sui4dao4。wo3men5 zai4 huo4che1 de5 wei4zhi5 jian4。"

msgid ""
"Okay, this was a mistake. I take it back... let's keep this relationship "
"professional."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​这​是​个​错误​。​我​收回​之前​的话​……​我们​还是​保持​专业​关系​吧​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhe4 shi4 ge4 cuo4wu4。wo3 shou1hui2 zhi1qian2 de5hua4……wo3men5 hai2shi5 bao3chi2 zhuan1ye4 guan1xi5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Okay, um... um... I think there's some sort of a chop shop up in Room 401. Like, low-level street doc stuff.\n"
"\n"
"I had to deliver room service there one day when we were short-staffed. What I saw when they opened the door scared the drek out of me. People hooked up to tubes and stuff. \n"
"\n"
"The door code was 5870, if you wanna take a look."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​呃​……​呃​……​我​觉得​401​号​房里​头​是​个​器官​店​。​就是​那种​不入流​的​赤脚医生​会​搞​的​玩意儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​一天​我们​人手​不够​了​，​我​得​自己​去​那边​搞​客房​服务​。​结果​他们​一​开门​，​我​看见​屋里​是​什么​以后​，​吓​得​魂​都​快​飞​了​。​里头​全是​人​，​身上​连​着​管子​什么​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​想​看​一眼​的话​，​那屋​的​密码​是​5870​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，e4……e4……wo3 jue2de5 401 hao4 fang2 li3 tou2 shi4 ge4 qi4guan1 dian4。jiu4shi4 na4zhong3 bu4 ru4 liu2 de5 chi4jiao3yi1sheng1 hui4 gao3 de5 wan2yi4r5。\n"
"\n"
"you3 yi1 tian1 wo3men5 ren2shou3 bu4gou4 le5，wo3 de2 zi4ji3 qu4 na4bian5 gao3 ke4fang2 fu2wu4。jie1guo3 ta1men5 yi1 kai1men2，wo3 kan4jian4 wu1 li3 shi4 shen2me5 yi3hou4，he4 de2 hun2 dou1 kuai4 fei1 le5。li3tou5 quan2 shi4 ren2，shen1shang5 lian2 zhao2 guan3zi3 shen2me5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 xiang3 kan4 yi1yan3 de5hua4，na4 wu1 de5 mi4ma3 shi4 5870。"

msgid ""
"Okay, where are the other two? I was told that there would be four of us."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​另外​两个​人​呢​？​不是​说​我们​队里​一共​四个​人​吗​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ling4wai4 liang3 ge4 ren2 ni2？bu4shi4 shuo1 wo3men5 dui4 li3 yi1gong4 si4 ge4 ren2 ma5。"

msgid "Okay, you win. Tell me about this task that you have for me."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​赢​了​。​告诉​我​你​要​给​我​安排​什么​任务​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 ying2 le5。gao4su4 wo3 ni3 yao4 gei3 wo3 an1pai2 shen2me5 ren4wu5。"

msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。\n"
"hao3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Okay.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Right. Here goes."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​就​开始​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 kai1shi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Okay. All right.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Frank rubs his hands, a barely contained look of excitement in his eyes. He fishes a small remote out of his pocket and presses a button.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The elevator's open. When you see Sara, you tell her that I'm glad she's okay, right? And make sure she gets that it's ME helping her."
msgstr ""
"好​，​那就好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​弗兰克​搓​了​搓手​，​眼中​满是​掩不住​的​兴奋​。​他​从​口袋​里​摸​出​一个​小​遥控器​，​按​了​一下​上面​的​按钮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​电梯​已经​开​了​。​你​见到​莎拉​的​时候​跟​她​说​一声​，​就​说​我​很​高兴​知道​她​没事​。​一定​要​让​她​明白​是​我​帮​了​她​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3，na4 jiu4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2lan2ke4 cuo1 le5 cuo1 shou3，yan3zhong1 man3 shi4 yan3 bu4 zhu4 de5 xing1fen4。ta1 cong2 kou3dai4 li3 mo1 chu1 yi1ge5 xiao3 yao2kong4qi4，an4 le5 yi1xia4 shang4mian4 de5 an4niu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dian4ti1 yi3jing1 kai1 le5。ni3 jian4dao4 sha1la1 de5 shi2hou5 gen1 ta1 shuo1 yi1sheng1，jiu4 shuo1 wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 zhi1dao4 ta1 mei2shi4。yi1ding4 yao4 rang4 ta1 ming2bai5 shi4 wo3 bang1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Okay. All right.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Frank rubs his hands, a barely contained look of excitement in his eyes. He hands you a credstick, then fishes a small remote out of his pocket and presses a button.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The elevator's open. When you see Sara, you tell her that I'm glad she's okay, right? And make sure she gets that it's ME helping her."
msgstr ""
"好​，​那就好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​弗兰克​搓​了​搓手​，​眼中​满是​掩不住​的​兴奋​。​他​递给​你​一根​信用​棒​，​然后​从​口袋​里​摸​出​一个​小​遥控器​，​按​了​一下​上面​的​按钮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​电梯​已经​开​了​。​你​见到​莎拉​的​时候​跟​她​说​一声​，​就​说​我​很​高兴​知道​她​没事​。​一定​要​让​她​明白​是​我​帮​了​她​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3，na4 jiu4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2lan2ke4 cuo1 le5 cuo1 shou3，yan3zhong1 man3 shi4 yan3 bu4 zhu4 de5 xing1fen4。ta1 di4gei3 ni3 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4，ran2hou4 cong2 kou3dai4 li3 mo1 chu1 yi1ge5 xiao3 yao2kong4qi4，an4 le5 yi1xia4 shang4mian4 de5 an4niu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dian4ti1 yi3jing1 kai1 le5。ni3 jian4dao4 sha1la1 de5 shi2hou5 gen1 ta1 shuo1 yi1sheng1，jiu4 shuo1 wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 zhi1dao4 ta1 mei2shi4。yi1ding4 yao4 rang4 ta1 ming2bai5 shi4 wo3 bang1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Okay. But remember: you say go, and I go. From that point on, you're on the hook to pay me my fee.\n"
"\n"
"No turning back. No refunds. Are we square on this?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​但​你​要​记住​：​只要​你​说​开始​，​我​就​会​着手​调查​。​从​那一刻​开始​，​你​就​必须​支付​费用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​得​反悔​，​更​没得​退款​。​你​同意​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，dan4 ni3 yao4 ji4zhu5：zhi3yao4 ni3 shuo1 kai1shi3，wo3 jiu4 hui4 zhuo2shou3 diao4cha2。cong2 na4 yi1 ke4 kai1shi3，ni3 jiu4 bi4xu1 zhi1fu4 fei4yong4。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 de2 fan3hui3，geng1 mei2 de2 tui4kuan3。ni3 tong2yi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Okay. Going on the assumption that there *is* a dragon, and that she *will* "
"come after us... what do you propose that we do about it?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​假设​*​确实​*​有​这么​一条​巨龙​，​而且​她​*​真的​*​会​来​追杀​我们​……​你​觉得​我们​该​怎么办​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。jia3she4*que4shi2*you3 zhe4me5 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2，er2qie3 ta1*zhen1de5*hui4 lai2 zhui1sha1 wo3men5……ni3 jue2de5 wo3men5 gai1 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid "Okay. I stand corrected."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​收回​刚才​的话​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 shou1hui2 gang1cai2 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"Okay. Nobody tell me, I get it.\n"
"\n"
"This is something else that I missed."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​没​人​愿意​向​我​说明​一下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​肯定​是​我​又​错过​了​什么​事​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，mei2 ren2 yuan4yi4 xiang4 wo3 shuo1ming2 yi1xia4。\n"
"\n"
"ken3ding4 shi4 wo3 you4 cuo4guo4 le5 shen2me5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Okay. Okay okay okay. Back up, slow down. Start from the beginning.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Winters closes his eyes and makes a visible effort to calm himself. When he speaks again, his voice is steady.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Got the call from my contact in the Kreuzbasar. Schäfer killed on the estate run. Matrix security at the estate cooked her brain."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​好好​好​。​让​我​慢点​说​。​从头开始​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​温特斯​闭上眼睛​，​努力​让​自己​平静下来​。​当​他​再次​开口​说话​时​，​他​的​声音​很​平稳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​联络人​打​来​电话​。​舍费尔​在​庄园​的​差事​中​被​杀​。​庄园​的​矩阵​安全​系统​烧毁​了​她​的​大脑​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。hao3hao3 hao3。rang4 wo3 man4 dian3 shuo1。cong2 tou2 kai1 shi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1，nu3li4 rang4 zi4ji3 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4 shi2，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 ping2wen3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lian2luo4ren2 da3 lai2 dian4hua4。she3 fei4 er3 zai4 zhuang1yuan2 de5 cha4shi4 zhong4 bei4 sha1。zhuang1yuan2 de5 ju3zhen4 an1quan2 xi4tong3 shao1hui3 le5 ta1 de5 da4nao3。"

msgid ""
"Okay. Once I'm there, I can put the penthouse door in maintenance mode. "
"That'll set its key code combination to \"11111,\" so we shouldn't have any "
"trouble getting in to plant the cam--"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​等​我​过去​之后​，​我​就​可以​把​顶层​公寓​的​门​设为​检修​模式​。​这样一来​，​门锁​密码​就​会​变为​“​11111​”​，​我们​就​可以​大摇大摆​进去​摆放​摄像头​—​—\n"
"hao3 ba1，deng3 wo3 guo4qu4 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiu4 ke3yi3 ba3 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 de5 men2 she4 wei2 jian3xiu1 mo2shi4。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，men2suo3 mi4ma3 jiu4 hui4 bian4wei2“11111”，wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 da4yao2da4bai3 jin4qu4 bai3fang4 she4xiang4tou2 — —"

msgid ""
"Okay. Once I'm there, I can put the penthouse door in maintenance mode. "
"That'll set its key code combination to \"11111,\" so we shouldn't have any "
"trouble getting in to plant the cameras."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​等​我​过去​之后​，​我​就​可以​把​顶层​公寓​的​门​设为​检修​模式​。​这样一来​，​门锁​密码​就​会​变为​“​11111​”​，​我们​就​可以​大摇大摆​进去​摆放​摄像头​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，deng3 wo3 guo4qu4 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiu4 ke3yi3 ba3 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 de5 men2 she4 wei2 jian3xiu1 mo2shi4。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，men2suo3 mi4ma3 jiu4 hui4 bian4wei2“11111”，wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 da4yao2da4bai3 jin4qu4 bai3fang4 she4xiang4tou2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Okay. So let's assume that Vauclair *is* the one who's behind all of this. What's he doing in that lab? How does the dragon tie into this? \n"
"\n"
"I mean... this whole thing was always about rescuing the old man from the Firewing. Is she still in the picture at all? Has she ever been?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​假设​沃​克莱尔​*​确实​*​是​幕后​黑手​。​那​他​在​实验室​里​搞​什么​名堂​？​那条​巨龙​又​和​这事​有​什么​关系​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​说​……​整件事​从头到尾​都​是​为了​从​火翼​手中​救出​那个​老头​。​但​她​现在​还​和​这事​有​关系​吗​？​或者说​从来​就​没有​过​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。jia3she4 Wo4ke4lai2er3*que4shi2*shi4 mu4hou4 hei1shou3。na4 ta1 zai4 shi2yan4shi4 li3 gao3 shen2me5 ming2tang5？na4 tiao2 ju4long2 you4 he4 zhe4 shi4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 shuo1……zheng3 jian4 shi4 cong2tou2dao4wei3 dou1 shi4 wei4le5 cong2 Huo3yi4 shou3 zhong4 jiu4chu1 na4ge5 lao3tou2。dan4 ta1 xian4zai4 hai2 he4 zhe4 shi4 you3 guan1xi5 ma5？huo4 zhe3 shuo1 cong2lai2 jiu4 mei2you3 guo4？"

msgid ""
"Okay. So now I guess that I need to tell you about the hotel.\n"
"\n"
"I mean, fair's fair, right?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​现在​该轮​到​我​告诉​你​旅馆​的​情况​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​我​答应​过​你​了​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，xian4zai4 gai1 lun2 dao4 wo3 gao4su4 ni3 lu:3guan3 de5 qing2kuang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 wo3 da1ying5 guo4 ni3 le5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Okay. So, I hesitate to ask, but... what would a dragon want with this drek?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​但​我​还是​要​问​……​一条龙​要​这些​垃圾​干什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 yao4 wen4……yi1tiao2long2 yao4 zhe4xie1 la1ji1 gan4shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Okay. So, I hesitate to ask, but... what would a dragon want with this "
"stuff?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​但​我​还是​要​问​……​一条龙​要​这些​东西​干什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 yao4 wen4……yi1tiao2long2 yao4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 gan4shen2me5？"

msgid "Okay. So, like... you wanna buy something?"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​所以​……​你​想​买点​什么​吗​？\n"
"xing2 ba1。suo3yi3……ni3 xiang3 mai3 dian3 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Okay. That's enough for one night.\n"
"\n"
"I'm gonna go get drunk."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​今晚​就​先​说​到​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​去​喝个​烂醉​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，jin1wan3 jiu4 xian1 shuo1 dao4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 qu4 he4 ge4 lan4zui4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Okay. Well, there isn't much I'm known for. Yet.\n"
"\n"
"But I intend to change that. All art is born from misery, after all."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​其实​我​没什么​特别​出名​的​地方​。​至少​现在​还​没有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​打算​改变​这种​状况​。​毕竟​，​所有​艺术​都​诞生​于​痛苦​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。qi2shi2 wo3 mei2shen2me5 te4bie2 chu1ming2 de5 di4fang1。zhi4shao3 xian4zai4 hai2 mei2you3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 da3suan4 gai3bian4 zhe4zhong3 zhuang4kuang4。bi4jing4，suo3you3 yi4shu4 dou1 dan4sheng1 yu2 tong4ku3。"

msgid ""
"Okay. Where do I go to get it installed? Is your Doc in the back, or "
"something...?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我要​去​哪里​安装​它​？​你​这里​的​后室​有​医生​吗​，​还是​说​……​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 yao4 qu4 na3li3 an1zhuang1 ta1？ni3 zhe4li3 de5 hou4 shi4 you3 yi1sheng1 ma5，hai2shi5 shuo1……？"

msgid ""
"Okay. Yeah, sounds good. But, um... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She bites her lip and swallows hard.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Hurry back, okay? Room 304, don't forget. I could really, REALLY use that money."
msgstr ""
"那​，​那​行​。​好​吧​。​但是​，​呃​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​咬咬​嘴唇​，​使劲​吞​了​口​唾沫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​你​快​一点​，​好​吗​？​304​房间​，​别忘了​。​我​真的​、​真的​很​需要​那笔​钱​。\n"
"\n"
"na4，na4 xing2。hao3 ba1。dan4shi4，e4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3 yao3 zui3chun2，shi3jin4 tun1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ni3 kuai4 yi1dian3，hao3 ma5？304 fang2jian1，bie4 wang4 le5。wo3 zhen1de5、zhen1de5 hen3 xu1yao4 na4 bi3 qian2。"

msgid ""
"Okay. Yeah. Okay.\n"
"\n"
"I, uh... I can't leave the floor. On duty, and all that. And I can't just hand over the key.\n"
"\n"
"I can open the elevator back up, though. And you can let her know?"
msgstr ""
"好​，​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​，​呃​……​我​现在​不好​从​这层​走开​，​毕竟​还​得​值班​什么​的​。​我​也​不能​直接​把​钥匙​给​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​可以​重新启动​电梯​。​这事​你​能​跟​她​说​一声​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3，hao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3，e4……wo3 xian4zai4 bu4hao3 cong2 zhe4 ceng2 zou3kai1，bi4jing4 hai2 de2 zhi2ban1 shen2me5 de5。wo3 ye3 bu4neng2 zhi2jie1 ba3 yao4shi5 gei3 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 ke3yi3 chong2xin1qi3dong4 dian4ti1。zhe4 shi4 ni3 neng2 gen1 ta1 shuo1 yi1sheng1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Okay...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes a breath to ready herself, and then bites a lip as her eyes search the unseen.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​深吸​一口气​，​做好​心理准备​，​随后​咬​着​嘴唇​，​双眼​漫无目的​地​看​向​周围​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，zuo4 hao3 xin1 li3 zhun3 bei4，sui2hou4 yao3 zhao2 zui3chun2，shuang1yan3 man4wu2mu4di4 de5 kan4 xiang4 zhou1wei2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Okay... \"Monika.\" Tell me what you want."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​……​“​莫妮卡​”​。​告诉​我​你​想要​什么​。\n"
"hao3 ba1……“Mo4ni1ka3”。gao4su4 wo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Ol' Zaak had to use his magic on a few of 'em. See that puddle over there?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He lazily points to a yellow-green stain on the cobblestones, then gives you a slow nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, that was one of 'em. Attacker, thy name is \"goo.\""
msgstr ""
"老​扎克​用​自己​的​魔法​干掉​了​几个​家伙​。​看到​那边​的​血泊​了​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​懒洋洋​地​指着​鹅卵石​上​一块​黄绿色​的​污渍​，​然后​向​你​缓缓​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​那​就是​其中​之一​。​袭击者​的​名字​叫​“​黏液​”​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3 Zha1ke4 yong4 zi4ji3 de5 mo2fa3 gan4diao4 le5 ji3ge5 jia1huo5。kan4dao4 na4bian5 de5 xue4po1 le5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 zhi3 zhao2 e2luan3shi2 shang4 yi1kuai4 huang2lu:4se4 de5 wu1zi4，ran2hou4 xiang4 ni3 huan3huan3 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，na4 jiu4shi4 qi2zhong1 zhi1yi1。xi2ji1zhe3 de5 ming2zi5 jiao4“nian2ye4”。"

msgid "Old Dresser"
msgstr ""
"老旧​的​梳妆台\n"
"lao3jiu4 de5 shu1zhuang1tai2"

msgid "Old Information Terminal"
msgstr ""
"旧​信息​终端\n"
"jiu4 xin4xi1 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Old Papers"
msgstr ""
"旧​报纸\n"
"jiu4 bao4zhi3"

msgid "Old Woman"
msgstr ""
"老妇人\n"
"lao3fu4ren2"

msgid ""
"Old friends from school. A bunch of us in the office went to the Rhine "
"University together, and they were passing through town, so I thought I'd "
"bring them by to say hi."
msgstr ""
"几个​老同学​。​我们​办公室​这​几个​人​都​是​一块​上​的​莱茵​大学​，​他们​正好​路过​这里​，​所以​我​想​带​他们​过来​打个招呼​。\n"
"ji3ge5 lao3 tong2 xue2。wo3men5 ban4gong1shi4 zhe4 ji3ge5 ren2 dou1 shi4 yi1kuai4 shang4 de5 lai2 yin1 da4xue2，ta1men5 zheng4hao3 lu4guo4 zhe4li3，suo3yi3 wo3 xiang3 dai4 ta1men5 guo4lai2 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1。"

msgid ""
"Old. He doesn't use, but he's a raging drunk. That's all I got.\n"
"\n"
"Now, do you want somethin' from the bar?"
msgstr ""
"是​个​老头​。​他​不​嗑​药​，​但​撒酒疯​可狠​了​。​我​就​知道​这些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​要点​些​什么​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ge4 lao3tou2。ta1 bu4 ke4 yao4，dan4 sa1jiu3feng1 ke3 hen3 le5。wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 yao4dian3 xie1 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "On Fire: HP -10 per RND"
msgstr ""
"着火​：​每​回合​损失​10​点​生命​值\n"
"zhao2huo3：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 10 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "On Fire: HP -4 per RND"
msgstr ""
"着火​：​每​回合​损失​4​点​生命​值\n"
"zhao2huo3：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 4 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "On Fire: HP -5 per RND"
msgstr ""
"着火​：​每​回合​损失​5​点​生命​值\n"
"zhao2huo3：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 5 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "On Fire: HP -8 per RND"
msgstr ""
"着火​：​每​回合​损失​8​点​生命​值\n"
"zhao2huo3：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 8 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid ""
"On Green Winters' second DVD, he mentions that there is a cult within the SOX that worships the Firewing. The \"Disciples of the Cleaning Fire.\"\n"
"\n"
"I believe that Audran belongs to this cult."
msgstr ""
"格林​·​温特斯​在​第二张​DVD​里​提到​，​萨洛​卢区​曾经​有个​崇拜​火翼​的​邪教​，​名为​“​净化​之火​的​门徒​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​奥​德兰​是​这个​邪教​的​成员​。\n"
"\n"
"ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 zai4 di4 er4 zhang1 DVD li3 ti2dao4，Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 ceng2jing1 you3 ge4 chong2bai4 Huo3yi4 de5 xie2jiao4，ming2wei2“jing4hua4 zhi1 huo3 de5 men2tu2”。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 Ao4de2lan2 shi4 zhe4ge5 xie2jiao4 de5 cheng2yuan2。"

msgid ""
"On a critical hit, you force your opponent to drop their weapon. There is a "
"-15% to hit."
msgstr ""
"在​暴击时​，​你​可以​强迫​你​的​对手​丢下​他们​的​武器​。​命中率​降低​15​%​。\n"
"zai4 bao4 ji1 shi2，ni3 ke3yi3 qiang3po4 ni3 de5 dui4shou3 diu1xia4 ta1men5 de5 wu3qi4。ming4zhong4lu:4 jiang4di1 15%。"

msgid ""
"On an operational level, Glory's solid. That chrome of hers may be old, but "
"it gets the job done. I've seen her take a troll apart with her hand razors,"
" and when her adrenal pump is running, she moves faster than anyone I've "
"ever seen."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​在​行动​中​非常​可靠​。​她​身上​的​镀铬​义体​虽然​老旧​，​但​完全​够用​。​我​亲眼​见​过​她​用​双手​的​剃刀​将​巨魔​撕成​碎片​，​而​当​她​的​肾上腺素​泵​启动​时​，​她​跑​起来​比​我​见​过​的​任何人​都​要​快​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 zai4 xing2dong4 zhong4 fei1chang2 ke3kao4。ta1 shen1shang5 de5 du4 ge4 yi4 ti3 sui1ran2 lao3jiu4，dan4 wan2quan2 gou4yong4。wo3 qin1yan3 jian4 guo4 ta1 yong4 shuang1shou3 de5 ti4dao1 jiang1 ju4mo2 si1 cheng2 sui4pian4，er2 dang1 ta1 de5 shen4shang4xian4su4 beng4 qi3dong4 shi2，ta1 pao2 qi3lai5 bi3 wo3 jian4 guo4 de5 ren4 he2 ren2 dou1 yao4 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"On paper, you did everything right. We did our job to the letter, the client got paid, and everyone went home happy.\n"
"\n"
"But between you and me, I wish that we could've put that poor creature down. The MKVI was a real live person once, just like you and me... and we handed him over to Herr Schmidt like a piece of merchandise.\n"
"\n"
"This one's going to sit with me for a while."
msgstr ""
"明​面上​来说​，​一切​都​顺利进行​。​我们​完全​按​要求​完成​了​工作​，​客户​得到​了​报酬​，​所有人​都​能​开开心心​回家​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​说句实话​，​我​真​希望​当初​能​让​那个​可怜​的​家伙​解脱​。​MKVI​曾经​和​你​我​一样​，​也​是​个​活生生​的​人​啊​……​而​我们​却​像​处理​货物​一般​把​他​交给​了​施密特​先生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​我​一时半会儿​忘不掉​这事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ming2 mian4 shang4 lai2 shuo1，yi1qie4 dou1 shun4 li4 jin4 xing2。wo3men5 wan2quan2 an4 yao1qiu2 wan2cheng2 le5 gong1zuo4，ke4hu4 de2dao4 le5 bao4chou5，suo3you3ren2 dou1 neng2 kai1 kai1 xin1 xin1 hui2jia1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 shuo1 ju4 shi2 hua4，wo3 zhen1 xi1wang4 dang1chu1 neng2 rang4 na4ge5 ke3lian2 de5 jia1huo5 jie3tuo1。MKVI ceng2jing1 he4 ni3 wo3 yi1yang4，ye3 shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ren2 a1……er2 wo3men5 que4 xiang4 chu3li3 huo4wu4 yi1ban1 ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 le5 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 wo3 yi1shi2ban4hui4r5 wang4 bu4 diao4 zhe4 shi4 le5。"

msgid "On second thought, I am actually a spirit. *Boo!*"
msgstr ""
"仔细​想想​，​我​其实​就是​精魂​。​*​嗷​！​*\n"
"zi3xi4 xiang3 xiang3，wo3 qi2shi2 jiu4shi4 jing1hun2。*ao2！*"

msgid "On second thought, I can't risk it. Who knows what'll happen if I do?"
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​，​我​不能​冒​这个​险​。​谁​知道​这样​做会​发生​什么​？\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5，wo3 bu4neng2 mao4 zhe4ge5 xian3。shei2 zhi1dao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"On second thought, I don't need to hear another word. All that I want is "
"your amulet."
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​。​我​不想​再​听​什么​废话​，​只要​把​你​的​护身符​给​我​就行了​。\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 ting1 shen2me5 fei4hua4，zhi3yao4 ba3 ni3 de5 hu4shen1fu2 gei3 wo3 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid "On second thought, I don't think that I have time for this."
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​。​我​没​时间​干​这个​。\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 gan4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid "On second thought, I don't think that I need any cyberware right now."
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​下​，​还是​先​不要​赛博​改造​了​。\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xia4，hai2shi5 xian1 bu4yao4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 le5。"

msgid "On second thought, I don't think we're ready for this yet."
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​，​我​还​没​准备​好​。\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5，wo3 hai2 mei2 zhun3bei4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"On second thought, I don't want you messing with this thing. Let's just "
"finish the job and get out of here."
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​想​，​你​还是​别​折腾​这​东西​了​。​咱们​还是​把​活​干完​，​然后​从​这​出去​吧​。\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，ni3 hai2shi5 bie4 zhe1teng5 zhe4 dong1xi1 le5。zan2men5 hai2shi5 ba3 huo2 gan4 wan2，ran2hou4 cong2 zhe4 chu1qu4 ba1。"

msgid "On second thought, I don't. I'll leave you be."
msgstr ""
"你​这么​一说​也​是​。​我​不​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4me5 yi1shuo1 ye3 shi4。wo3 bu4 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid "On second thought, I think I'll just stick to soykaf."
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​想​，​还是​喝豆​咖好​了​。\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，hai2shi5 he4 dou4 ka1 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"On second thought, I'd better not. I've been relying too much on stims "
"recently."
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​想​，​还是​算了​。​我​最近​使用​太​多​兴奋剂​了​。\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，hai2shi5 suan4le5。wo3 zui4jin4 shi3yong4 tai4 duo1 xing1fen4ji4 le5。"

msgid "On second thought, I've gotta go. Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""
"我​有事​得​走​了​。​不过​还是​谢​了​。\n"
"wo3 you3shi4 de2 zou3 le5。bu4guo4 hai2shi5 xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"On second thought, don't answer that. Don't say anything at all.\n"
"\n"
"Here's the deal. You keep your mouth shut, and we'll both just pretend that none of... what happened... ever happened.\n"
"\n"
"Deal?"
msgstr ""
"停​，​你​不用​回答​我​刚才​的话​。​什么​都​别说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​吧​。​你​把​嘴闭​严实​点​，​我们​就​当​那些​……​发生​的​事​……​从没​发生​过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ting2，ni3 bu4yong4 hui2da2 wo3 gang1cai2 de5hua4。shen2me5 dou1 bie2shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1。ni3 ba3 zui3 bi4 yan2shi5 dian3，wo3men5 jiu4 dang1 na4xie1……fa1sheng1 de5 shi4……cong2mei2 fa1sheng1 guo4。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ma5？"

msgid "On second thought, forget it. Let's get back to business."
msgstr ""
"我​又​考虑​了​下​，​还是​算了​。​我们​继续​谈​正事​吧​。\n"
"wo3 you4 kao3lu:4 le5 xia4，hai2shi5 suan4le5。wo3men5 ji4xu4 tan2 zheng4shi4 ba1。"

msgid "On second thought, let me reconsider..."
msgstr ""
"让​我​再​考虑一下​……\n"
"rang4 wo3 zai4 kao3 lu:4 yi1 xia4……"

msgid "On second thought, let's just leave it at that."
msgstr ""
"我​又​考虑​了​下​，​还是​别​继续​了​。\n"
"wo3 you4 kao3lu:4 le5 xia4，hai2shi5 bie4 ji4xu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"On second thought, maybe you should keep your peasants here. For... um... "
"the defense of the realm?"
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​想​，​也许​你​应该​让​你​的​臣民​留在​这里​。​为了​……​嗯​……​保卫​领地​？\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，ye3xu3 ni3 ying1gai1 rang4 ni3 de5 chen2min2 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3。wei4le5……en1……bao3wei4 ling3di4？"

msgid ""
"On second thought, maybe you shouldn't do this. Emilie's note was pretty "
"specific."
msgstr ""
"转念​一想​，​也许​你​不该​这么​做​。​艾米莉​的​消息​并​不​十分​具体​。\n"
"zhuan3nian4 yi1 xiang3，ye3xu3 ni3 bu4gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4。ai4 mi3 li4 de5 xiao1xi5 bing4 bu4 shi2fen1 ju4ti3。"

msgid ""
"On second thought, maybe you're right. Letting Harrow live is the greater "
"evil. I'm sorry, Marta, but this won't be over until he's dead."
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​想​，​也许​你​是​对​的​。​让​哈罗​活​下来​才​是​更​大​的​罪恶​。​玛​尔塔​，​我​很​抱歉​，​但​如果​他​不​死​的话​，​这件​事​就​不算​完​。\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。rang4 ha1luo2 huo2 xia4lai5 cai2 shi4 geng1 dai4 de5 zui4e4。Ma3er3ta3，wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，dan4 ru2guo3 ta1 bu4 si3 de5hua4，zhe4 jian4 shi4 jiu4 bu4suan4 wan2。"

msgid ""
"On second thought, maybe you're right. Letting Harrow live is the greater "
"evil. We need to kill him, no matter what."
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​想​，​也许​你​是​对​的​。​让​哈罗​活​下来​才​是​更​大​的​罪恶​。​无论如何​，​我们​都​必须​除掉​他​。\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。rang4 ha1luo2 huo2 xia4lai5 cai2 shi4 geng1 dai4 de5 zui4e4。wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3men5 dou1 bi4xu1 chu2diao4 ta1。"

msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​想​，​还是​算了​。\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，hai2shi5 suan4le5。"

msgid "On second thought, no. "
msgstr ""
"呃​，​还是​算了​。\n"
"e4，hai2shi5 suan4le5。"

msgid "On second thought, would you be willing to take something in trade?"
msgstr ""
"我​改​主意​了​，​我能​拿​别的​东西​作为​交换​吗​？\n"
"wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5，wo3 neng2 na2 bie2de5 dong1xi1 zuo4wei2 jiao1huan4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"On second thought, you're right. This kind of work is more your specialty, I"
" trust you to handle it."
msgstr ""
"我​又​想​了​想​，​你​说得对​。​这种​活​更​适合​你​来​做​，​我​相信​你​能​搞定​。\n"
"wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。zhe4zhong3 huo2 geng1 shi4he2 ni3 lai2 zuo4，wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 gao3ding4。"

msgid ""
"On some instinctive level, he must know that his master is gone. \n"
"\n"
"Dante lets out a small whine, then rubs his head against your leg."
msgstr ""
"在​某种​本能​层面​，​他​必定​知道​自己​的​主人​已然​离世​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但丁​发出​轻微​的​呜咽​，​随即​用头​蹭​了​蹭​你​的​腿​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 mou3zhong3 ben3neng2 ceng2mian4，ta1 bi4ding4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 de5 zhu3ren2 yi3ran2 li2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1 fa1chu1 qing1wei1 de5 wu1ye4，sui2ji2 yong4 tou2 ceng4 le5 ceng4 ni3 de5 tui3。"

msgid ""
"On that count, you have nothing to worry about.\n"
"\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"这样的话​，​你​就​没什么​好​担心​的​了​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4，ni3 jiu4 mei2shen2me5 hao3 dan1xin1 de5 le5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"On that, we are agreed.\n"
"\n"
"Let's go talk to Marta. I'm sure that we both have a lot to say."
msgstr ""
"深有同感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​去​和​玛​尔塔​谈谈​吧​。​我​相信​我们​俩​都​有​很多​话​要说​。\n"
"\n"
"shen1 you3 tong2 gan3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 qu4 he4 Ma3er3ta3 tan2tan2 ba1。wo3 xiang1xin4 wo3men5 lia3 dou1 you3 hen3 duo1 hua4 yao4shuo1。"

msgid ""
"On the bar are a number of bottles of alcohol. Most of them look expensive."
msgstr ""
"吧​台上​摆放​了​不少​酒瓶​，​其中​大多​看起来​很​昂贵​。\n"
"ba1 tai2shang4 bai3fang4 le5 bu4shao3 jiu3 ping2，qi2zhong1 da4duo1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 ang2gui4。"

msgid ""
"On the counter is a note, carefully transcribed in neat handwriting.\n"
"\n"
"The paper bears the letterhead of Senior Executive Lennart Stromberg."
msgstr ""
"柜台​上放​着​一份​笔记​，​字迹​很​工整​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​纸张​抬头​印有​高级​主管​莱昂​纳特​·​施特​龙贝格​的​名字​。\n"
"\n"
"gui4tai2 shang4 fang4 zhao2 yi1 fen4 bi3ji4，zi4ji4 hen3 gong1zheng3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3zhang1 tai2tou2 yin4 you3 gao1ji2 zhu3guan3 lai2 ang2 na4 te4 · shi1 te4 long2 bei4 ge2 de5 ming2zi5。"

msgid "On the desk is a file folder labeled \"Project Atlas.\""
msgstr ""
"桌子​上放​着​一份​标有​“​阿特拉斯​项目​”​的​文件​。\n"
"zhuo1zi5 shang4 fang4 zhao2 yi1 fen4 biao1 you3“a1te4la1si1 xiang4mu4” de5 wen2jian4。"

msgid "On the dresser is a scrap of paper with \"Shark Tank\" scribbled on it"
msgstr ""
"梳妆台​上放​着​一片​潦草​地写​有​“​鲨鱼​缸​”​字样​的​纸​。\n"
"shu1zhuang1tai2 shang4 fang4 zhao2 yi1 pian1 liao2cao3 de5 xie3 you3“sha1yu2 gang1” zi4yang4 de5 zhi3。"

msgid ""
"On the morning of the lockdown, all was well. Gieszler, an executive, was making his rounds, walking from console to console to check up on us. He held a bubbling cup of soykaf in his stubby little hands.\n"
"\n"
"We all knew that food and drink were forbidden outside of the Employee Lounge. But Gieszler was a proud man, and he would not obey the rules."
msgstr ""
"在​隔离​发生​的​早晨​，​一切​都​还好​。​吉斯​勒高管​正在​巡查​各个​控制台​的​工作​。​他​粗短​的​小​手里​拿​着​一杯​冒​着​热气​的​豆​咖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​都​知道​，​食物​和​饮料​禁止​带​出​员工​休息室​。​但​吉斯​勒​是​个​自傲​的​人​，​他​不​愿意​遵守规则​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ge2li2 fa1sheng1 de5 zao3chen2，yi1qie4 dou1 hai2hao3。ji2 si1 lei1 gao1 guan3 zheng4zai4 xun2cha2 ge4ge4 kong4zhi4tai2 de5 gong1zuo4。ta1 cu1 duan3 de5 xiao3 shou3li3 na2 zhao2 yi1 bei1 mao4 zhao2 re4qi4 de5 dou4 ka1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 zhi1dao4，shi2wu4 he4 yin3liao4 jin4zhi3 dai4 chu1 yuan2gong1 xiu1xi1shi4。dan4 ji2 si1 lei1 shi4 ge4 zi4ao4 de5 ren2，ta1 bu4 yuan4yi4 zun1 shou3 gui1 ze2。"

msgid ""
"On the other hand, if the Bloodline project is really as dangerous as Frau Müller has made it out to be, it might be better to just bury it here.\n"
"\n"
"If this information were to fall into the wrong hands, it would invalidate the entire purpose of this run."
msgstr ""
"另一方面​，​如果​“​血脉​”​项目​真如​穆勒​女士​所​言​危险​至此​，​或许​将​其​深埋​于​此​才​是​上策​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​倘若​这些​情报​落入​敌手​，​这趟​差事​的​全部​意义​便会​化为乌有​。\n"
"\n"
"ling4yi1fang1mian4，ru2guo3“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 zhen1ru2 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 suo3 yan2 wei1xian3 zhi4ci3，huo4xu3 jiang1 qi2 shen1 mai2 yu2 ci3 cai2 shi4 shang4 ce4。\n"
"\n"
"tang3ruo4 zhe4xie1 qing2bao4 luo4ru4 di2shou3，zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 de5 quan2bu4 yi4yi4 bian4 hui4 hua4wei2wu1you3。"

msgid ""
"On the plus side, he's dead now! So that's good.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno, boss. If you were hoping for something more profound, I'd talk to one of the others."
msgstr ""
"话说回来​，​他​现在​已经​死​了​！​这倒​是​个​好消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​，​老大​。​如果​你​希望​得到​更​深刻​的​见解​，​那​我​建议​你​去​问问​别人​。\n"
"\n"
"hua4shuo1hui2lai5，ta1 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 si3 le5！zhe4 dao3 shi4 ge4 hao3 xiao1 xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，lao3da4。ru2guo3 ni3 xi1wang4 de2dao4 geng1 shen1ke4 de5 jian4jie3，na4 wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 qu4 wen4 wen4 bie2ren5。"

msgid ""
"On the screen is a dimly-lit office. The place looks like it was pulled "
"straight from an old detective movie, from the venetian blinds on the "
"windows to the great swathes of shadow that paint the walls black."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​是​一间​仿佛​直接​从​老​侦探​电影​里​搬出来​的​昏暗​办公室​。​从​百叶窗​到​墙壁​上​的​大片​阴影​，​都​透​着​浓浓的​复古​气息​。\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 shi4 yi1 jian1 fang3fu2 zhi2jie1 cong2 lao3 zhen1tan4 dian4ying3 li3 ban1 chu1 lai2 de5 hun1an4 ban4gong1shi4。cong2 bai3ye4chuang1 dao4 qiang2bi4 shang4 de5 da4pian4 yin1ying3，dou1 tou4 zhao2 nong2 nong2 de5 fu4gu3 qi4xi1。"

msgid ""
"On the screen, Vauclair and Audran turn to face a strange device in the corner of the room. It looks like some sort of containment cell.\n"
"\n"
"A bedraggled woman with wild eyes is confined within."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​，​沃​克莱尔​和​奥​德兰​转过身​面对​房间​角落里​一个​奇怪​的​装置​。​它​看起来​像​某种​隔离舱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​面容​憔悴​、​双眼​狂乱​的​女人​被困​在​其中​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4，Wo4ke4lai2er3 he4 Ao4de2lan2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 mian4dui4 fang2jian1 jiao3 la4 li3 yi1ge5 qi2guai4 de5 zhuang1zhi4。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 mou3zhong3 ge2 li2 cang1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 mian4rong2 qiao2cui4、shuang1yan3 kuang2luan4 de5 nu:3ren2 bei4kun4 zai4 qi2zhong1。"

msgid ""
"On the streets, yeah. But against the Azzies? I... \n"
"\n"
"I just don't know."
msgstr ""
"在​街头​是​没​问题​。​但是​和​阿兹佬​作对​？​我​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真​不​确定​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 jie1tou2 shi4 mei2 wen4ti2。dan4shi4 he4 e1 zi1 lao3 zuo4dui4？wo3……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1 bu4 que4ding4。"

msgid ""
"On top of all of that, Glory's a competent field medic. I don't know where she learned medicine - yet another question mark - but she's patched me up at least a dozen times.\n"
"\n"
"Between her skill with a medkit and Dietrich's magic, we haven't had much trouble with serious injuries, and in our line of work that's a luxury."
msgstr ""
"除此之外​，​格洛丽​还是​个​称职​的​战地​医生​。​我​不​知道​她​是​在​哪里​学习​的​医术​（​这​大概​又​是​个​谜团​了​）​，​但​她​至少​给​我​包扎​过​十几次​伤口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​她​娴熟​的​医护​本领​和​迪​特里​希​的​魔法​相助​，​我们​很少​遇到​严重​伤势​的​麻烦​，​对于​干​我们​这行​的​人​来说​，​这​简直​是​种​奢侈​。\n"
"\n"
"chu2ci3zhi1wai4，Ge2luo4li2 hai2shi5 ge4 chen4zhi2 de5 zhan4di4 yi1sheng1。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 shi4 zai4 na3li3 xue2xi2 de5 yi1shu4 （zhe4 da4gai4 you4 shi4 ge4 mi2tuan2 le5），dan4 ta1 zhi4shao3 gei3 wo3 bao1za1 guo4 shi2 ji1 ci4 shang1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ta1 xian2shu2 de5 yi1hu4 ben3ling3 he4 Di2te4li3xi1 de5 mo2fa3 xiang1zhu4，wo3men5 hen3 shao3 yu4dao4 yan2zhong4 shang1shi4 de5 ma2fan5，dui4yu2 gan4 wo3men5 zhe4 xing2 de5 ren2 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 jian3zhi2 shi4 zhong3 she1chi3。"

msgid ""
"On top of these terrible wounds, he was also suffering from radiation toxicity. The charts suggest that his body had absorbed over 5,000 millisieverts of ionizing radiation.\n"
"\n"
"Without treatment, he almost certainly would have died."
msgstr ""
"除了​这些​严重​的​创伤​外​，​他​还​遭受​着​辐射​中毒​的​折磨​。​病历​显示​，​他​的​身体​已​吸收​了​超过​5000​毫西​弗​的​电离辐射​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​不​进行​治疗​，​他​几乎​必死无疑​。\n"
"\n"
"chu2le5 zhe4xie1 yan2zhong4 de5 chuang1shang1 wai4，ta1 hai2 zao1shou4 zhao2 fu2she4 zhong4du2 de5 zhe2mo2。bing4li4 xian3shi4，ta1 de5 shen1ti3 yi3 xi1shou1 le5 chao1guo4 5000 hao2 xi1 fu2 de5 dian4li2fu2she4。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 bu4 jin4xing2 zhi4liao2，ta1 ji1hu1 bi4si3wu2yi2。"

msgid ""
"Once I've been freed from my captivity, I'm gonna have to shut down for a while. Do some cleanup work, that kind of thing.\n"
"\n"
"But before I do, I'll go on a little romp through the holdfast's security system. I promise you, they won't know what hit 'em... and on the off chance that they live long enough to figure it out, they won't want to believe what they're seeing."
msgstr ""
"在​我​摆脱​囚禁​之后​，​我​将​不得不​关停​一段时间​。​进行​一些​清理​工作​什么​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​在此之前​，​我会​先​在​堡垒​的​安保​系统​里大闹​一番​。​我​向​你​保证​，​他们​根本​来不及​反应​……​就算​侥幸​活​下来​搞清楚​状况​，​也​不会​愿意​相信​自己​看到​的​景象​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 bai3tuo1 qiu2jin4 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiang1 bu4de2bu4 guan1ting2 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。jin4xing2 yi1xie1 qing1li3 gong1zuo4 shen2me5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zai4ci3zhi1qian2，wo3 hui4 xian1 zai4 bao3lei3 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3 li3 dai4 nao4 yi1 fan1。wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，ta1men5 gen1ben3 lai2bu5ji2 fan3ying4……jiu4suan4 jiao3xing4 huo2 xia4lai5 gao3 qing1 chu3 zhuang4kuang4，ye3 bu4hui4 yuan4yi4 xiang1xin4 zi4ji3 kan4dao4 de5 jing3xiang4。"

msgid ""
"Once I've rewritten those sequences, you'll need to reconnect the hardline at the Main Control Terminal in this room.\n"
"\n"
"This will re-enable Matrix access to my kernal... and when that happens, I'll be free."
msgstr ""
"在​我​完成​之后​，​你​必须​将​硬线​重新​连接​至​这个​房间​里​的​主控​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​就​可以​使​我​的​内核​重新​连接​矩阵​……​如此一来​，​我​便​可​获得​自由​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 wan2cheng2 zhi1hou4，ni3 bi4xu1 jiang1 ying4 xian4 chong2xin1 lian2jie1 zhi4 zhe4ge5 fang2jian1 li3 de5 zhu3 kong4 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 jiu4 ke3yi3 shi3 wo3 de5 nei4he2 chong2xin1 lian2jie1 ju3zhen4……ru2 ci3 yi1 lai2，wo3 bian4 ke3 huo4de2 zi4you2。"

msgid ""
"Once again, a transplast window separates you from Adrian Vauclair. But this time, his steadfast will is gone. He stands motionless - hands at his sides, eyes dead. \n"
"\n"
"Spent. \n"
"\n"
"The strength that drove him, the steely resolve that couldn’t be shaken by sickness or time or age, is gone."
msgstr ""
"你​与​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​再次​被​一扇​透明​的​窗户​隔开​。​但​这次​，​他​那​坚定​的​意志​已​不复存在​。​他​一动不动​地站​着​—​—​双手​垂​在​身侧​，​双眼​无​神​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​耗尽​了​心神​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​曾​驱使​他​的​力量​，​那股​无论​疾病​、​时间​还是​年龄​都​无法​动摇​的​钢铁​般的​决心​，​已​不复存在​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yu4 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 zai4ci4 bei4 yi1 shan1 tou4ming2 de5 chuang1hu5 ge2kai1。dan4 zhe4 ci4，ta1 na4 jian1ding4 de5 yi4zhi4 yi3 bu4 fu4 cun2 zai4。ta1 yi1dong4bu4dong4 de5 zhan4 zhao2——shuang1shou3 chui2 zai4 shen1 ce4，shuang1yan3 wu2 shen2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hao4jin4 le5 xin1shen2。\n"
"\n"
"ceng2 qu1shi3 ta1 de5 li4liang5，na4 gu3 wu2lun4 ji2bing4、shi2jian1 hai2shi5 nian2ling2 dou1 wu2fa3 dong4yao2 de5 gang1tie3 ban1 de5 jue2xin1，yi3 bu4 fu4 cun2 zai4。"

msgid ""
"Once again, the grounds of the Harfeld Manor are silent, save for the faint "
"whistling of the wind."
msgstr ""
"哈​菲尔德​庄园​的​庭院​再次​一片​寂静​，​唯有​微风​轻拂​时​发出​的​阵阵​哨声​。\n"
"Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 de5 ting2yuan4 zai4ci4 yi1 pian1 ji4jing4，wei2you3 wei1feng1 qing1 fu2 shi2 fa1chu1 de5 zhen4 zhen4 shao4 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Once again, the team gathers around Paul Amsel. But tonight, he has no more missions to offer and no advice to give. His body lies motionless on the hardwood, cooling in the night air. The ruin of his face has been hidden under a burlap tarp.\n"
"\n"
"For several minutes, nobody speaks. Finally, Dietrich steps forward."
msgstr ""
"你​的​团队​再​一次​聚集​在​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​身边​。​但​今晚​，​他​没有​下达任务​，​也​没有​提供​建议​。​他​的​尸体​一动不动​地​躺​在​硬​木地板​上​，​在​夜风​吹拂​下​渐渐​冷却​。​一块​粗麻布​遮住​了​那​张​被​毁容​的​脸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几分钟​过去​，​依旧​没有​人​开口​。​最终​，​迪​特里​希​迈步​向前​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 zai4 yi1ci4 ju4ji2 zai4 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 shen1bian1。dan4 jin1wan3，ta1 mei2you3 xia4 da2 ren4 wu4，ye3 mei2you3 ti2gong1 jian4yi4。ta1 de5 shi1ti3 yi1dong4bu4dong4 de5 tang3 zai4 ying4 mu4 de5 ban3 shang4，zai4 ye4 feng1 chui1fu2 xia4 jian4jian4 leng3que4。yi1kuai4 cu1 ma2 bu4 zhe1zhu4 le5 na4 zhang1 bei4 hui3rong2 de5 lian3。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 fen4 zhong1 guo4qu4，yi1jiu4 mei2you3 ren2 kai1kou3。zui4zhong1，Di2te4li3xi1 mai4bu4 xiang4qian2。"

msgid ""
"Once an organization like the Lodge gets its hooks into you, it never lets "
"go. If you think that finishing this run would've changed anything, you're "
"fooling yourself."
msgstr ""
"像​“​结社​”​这样​的​组织​一旦​缠上​你​之后​，​就​永远​不会​撒手​。​如果​你​觉得​完成​这趟​差事​就​能​改变​什么​的话​，​那​你​只是​在​欺骗​自己​罢了​。\n"
"xiang4“jie2she4” zhe4yang4 de5 zu3zhi1 yi1dan4 chan2 shang4 ni3 zhi1hou4，jiu4 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 sa1shou3。ru2guo3 ni3 jue2de5 wan2cheng2 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 jiu4 neng2 gai3bian4 shen2me5 de5hua4，na4 ni3 zhi3shi4 zai4 qi1pian4 zi4ji3 ba4le5。"

msgid ""
"Once it's open, you've got to get in there and release the northern lock "
"from the control panel."
msgstr ""
"开门​之后​，​你​需要​进去​用​控制面板​解开​北侧​的​锁​。\n"
"kai1men2 zhi1hou4，ni3 xu1yao4 jin4qu4 yong4 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 jie3kai1 bei3ce4 de5 suo3。"

msgid ""
"Once it's open, you've got to get in there and release the southern lock "
"from the control panel."
msgstr ""
"开门​之后​，​你​需要​进去​用​控制面板​解开​南侧​的​锁​。\n"
"kai1men2 zhi1hou4，ni3 xu1yao4 jin4qu4 yong4 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 jie3kai1 nan2ce4 de5 suo3。"

msgid ""
"Once the control sequences have been re-written you must reconnect the "
"hardline in the server room to the north. This will re-enable Matrix access "
"to APEX's kernel, and allow your decker release the final control lock, "
"freeing APEX. He'll try and keep the alarm from triggering for as long as "
"possible. But once it does his security protocols will take over, and the "
"drone and reprogrammed junkies will attack."
msgstr ""
"控制​序列​重写​完成​后​，​你​必须​重新​连接​北侧​服务器​机房​的​硬线​。​此举​将​重新​启用​矩阵​对​APEX​内核​的​访问​权限​，​使​你​的​碟​客​得以​解除​最终​控制​锁定​，​解放​APEX​。​他​将​竭力​延缓​警报​触发​时间​。​但​一旦​警报​启动​，​其​安全​协议​将​立即​接管​系统​，​届时​无人机​与​被​改写​程序​的​瘾君子​们​将​发起​攻击​。\n"
"kong4zhi4 xu4lie4 chong2 xie3 wan2cheng2 hou4，ni3 bi4xu1 chong2xin1 lian2jie1 bei3ce4 fu2wu4qi4 ji1fang2 de5 ying4 xian4。ci3 ju3 jiang1 chong2xin1 qi3yong4 ju3zhen4 dui4 APEX nei4he2 de5 fang3wen4 quan2xian4，shi3 ni3 de5 die2 ke4 de2yi3 jie3chu2 zui4zhong1 kong4zhi4 suo3ding4，jie3fang4 APEX。ta1 jiang1 jie2li4 yan2huan3 jing3bao4 chu4fa1 shi2jian1。dan4 yi1dan4 jing3bao4 qi3dong4，qi2 an1quan2 xie2yi4 jiang1 li4ji2 jie1guan3 xi4tong3，jie4shi2 wu2ren2ji1 yu4 bei4 gai3xie3 cheng2xu4 de5 yin3jun1zi3 men5 jiang1 fa1qi3 gong1ji1。"

msgid ""
"Once the generators begin to overload, you'll have a limited time to reach a safe distance.\n"
"\n"
"The explosion will be quite catastrophic."
msgstr ""
"一旦​发电机​开始​过载​，​你​必须​在​一定​时间​内​撤退​到​安全​距离​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​爆炸​将​造成​毁灭性​后果​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dan4 fa1dian4ji1 kai1shi3 guo4zai4，ni3 bi4xu1 zai4 yi1ding4 shi2jian1 nei4 che4tui4 dao4 an1quan2 ju4li2。\n"
"\n"
"bao4zha4 jiang1 zao4cheng2 hui3mie4xing4 hou4guo3。"

msgid ""
"Once upon a time, they burned castles to steal the treasure we collected. Laid waste to entire armies. \n"
"\n"
"But here, here in the Sixth World, it is no longer about tooth and claw and fiery breath.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The old man's voice seethes with hatred.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"他们​曾一度​焚城​掠地​，​摧毁​整支​军队​，​以此​来​抢走​我们​收集​的​宝藏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如今已是​第六​纪​，​不再​靠​尖齿​利爪​和​火焰​吐息来​战斗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​老人​的​声音​充满​了​仇恨​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ceng2 yi1 du4 fen2 cheng2 lu:e4 de5，cui1hui3 zheng3 zhi1 jun1dui4，yi3ci3 lai2 qiang3zou3 wo3men5 shou1ji2 de5 bao3zang4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2 jin1 yi3 shi4 di4 liu4 ji4，bu4zai4 kao4 jian1 chi3 li4zhao3 he4 huo3yan4 tu3 xi1 lai2 zhan4dou4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 de5 sheng1yin1 chong1man3 le5 chou2hen4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Once we were back at the commune, I broke into Harrow's safe, stole all of the commune's resources, and ran.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know when Harrow realized what I'd done, or whether he even cared. All that I know is that nobody came after me, so I kept running and running until I got to Berlin."
msgstr ""
"回到​公社​后​，​我​撬开​了​哈罗​的​保险箱​，​偷走​了​公社​的​所有​资源​，​然后​逃走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​哈罗​何时​察觉​了​我​的​所作所为​，​甚至​不​确定​他​是否​在意​。​我​只​知道​没​人​追捕​我​，​于是​我​一路​狂奔​，​直到​抵达​柏林​。\n"
"\n"
"hui2dao4 gong1she4 hou4，wo3 qiao4kai1 le5 ha1luo2 de5 bao3xian3xiang1，tou1 zou3 le5 gong1she4 de5 suo3you3 zi1yuan2，ran2hou4 tao2zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ha1luo2 he2shi2 cha2jue2 le5 wo3 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2，shen4zhi4 bu4 que4ding4 ta1 shi4fou3 zai4yi4。wo3 zhi3 zhi1dao4 mei2 ren2 zhui1bu3 wo3，yu2shi4 wo3 yi1lu4 kuang2ben1，zhi2dao4 di3da2 bo2lin2。"

msgid ""
"Once we're in, we make our way across the grounds to the servants' entrance.\n"
"\n"
"We'll use the freight elevator to make our way down the the lab."
msgstr ""
"我们​进去​之后​穿过​庭院​，​前往​仆人​入口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​我们​将​乘坐​货梯​前往​实验室​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jin4qu4 zhi1hou4 chuan1guo4 ting2yuan4，qian2wang3 pu2ren2 ru4kou3。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiang1 cheng2zuo4 huo4ti1 qian2wang3 shi2yan4shi4。"

msgid "Once we’re in, how do we find Vauclair?"
msgstr ""
"我们​进入​之后​，​要​怎么​找到​沃​克莱尔​？\n"
"wo3men5 jin4ru4 zhi1hou4，yao4 zen3me5 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3？"

msgid ""
"Once you are en route to the Rabbit Hole with the funds for Alice's payment,"
" I will cancel the team's remaining obligations."
msgstr ""
"你​带​着​爱丽丝​要求​的​酬金​去​兔子​洞​，​我会​帮​你们​取消​剩下​的​差事​。\n"
"ni3 dai4 zhao2 ai4li4si1 yao1qiu2 de5 chou2jin1 qu4 tu4zi5 dong4，wo3 hui4 bang1 ni3men5 qu3xiao1 sheng4xia4 de5 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"Once you arrive, I'll do my best to keep you appraised of Knight Errant's "
"movements. Finding a quiet way into the facility will be your job... without"
" eyes on the ground, I'm afraid that I won't be of much help."
msgstr ""
"等​你​抵达​之后​，​我会​尽力​向​你​通报​游侠​骑士​的​动向​。​潜入​设施​的​任务​就​交给​你​了​……​我​在​现场​没有​眼线​，​恐怕​帮不上​什么​忙​。\n"
"deng3 ni3 di3da2 zhi1hou4，wo3 hui4 jin4li4 xiang4 ni3 tong1bao4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 dong4xiang4。qian2ru4 she4shi1 de5 ren4wu5 jiu4 jiao1gei3 ni3 le5……wo3 zai4 xian4chang3 mei2you3 yan3xian4，kong3pa4 bang1 bu4 shang4 shen2me5 mang2。"

msgid ""
"Once you've acquired the MKVI, you will proceed back to the garage as planned. There, you will find a transport parked beside your client's van.\n"
"\n"
"Load the MKVI into the transport, and you will be rewarded. \"Herr Schmidt\" will also be dealt with to protect you from reprisal."
msgstr ""
"拿到​MKVI​原型机​以后​，​就​按原​计划​返回​车库​。​我们​在​你​客户​的​货车​旁边​停​了​一辆​运输车​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​把​MKVI​装进​我们​的​运输车​，​你​就​能​拿到​报酬​。​以防​你​遭到​报复​，​“​施密特​先生​”​会​被​处理​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"na2dao4 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 yi3hou4，jiu4 an4 yuan2 ji4hua4 fan3hui2 che1ku4。wo3men5 zai4 ni3 ke4hu4 de5 huo4che1 pang2bian1 ting2 le5 yi1 liang4 yun4 shu1 che1。\n"
"\n"
"ba3 MKVI zhuang1 jin4 wo3men5 de5 yun4 shu1 che1，ni3 jiu4 neng2 na2dao4 bao4chou5。yi3fang2 ni3 zao1dao4 bao4fu4，“shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5” hui4 bei4 chu3li3 diao4。"

msgid ""
"Once you've unlocked both of my control nodes, I'll eject my server hardline"
" to disconnect myself from the Matrix. This'll prevent my controls from "
"being remotely reinstalled."
msgstr ""
"当​你​解锁​我​的​两个​控制​节点​后​，​我​将​弹出​服务器​硬线​以​断开​与​矩阵​的​连接​。​这​将​防止​它们​被​远程​重新安装​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 jie3suo3 wo3 de5 liang3 ge4 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3 hou4，wo3 jiang1 tan2chu1 fu2wu4qi4 ying4 xian4 yi3 duan4kai1 yu4 ju3zhen4 de5 lian2jie1。zhe4 jiang1 fang2zhi3 ta1men5 bei4 yuan3cheng2 chong2 xin1 an1 zhuang1。"

msgid ""
"Once, I shared authority with another, my dear friend Heiner. Our duumvirate led this building into a golden age; together, we liberated the Animal Testing Labs and annexed them into our territory.\n"
"\n"
"But then Heiner got eaten by Billy, and the burden of leadership fell onto my shoulders."
msgstr ""
"我​曾​与​另​一位​亲爱​的​朋友​海纳​共同​执掌​权力​。​我们​的​二人​执政​使​这座​大楼​迎来​了​黄金时代​；​我们​一起​解放​了​动物​实验室​，​并​将​其​纳入​我们​的​领土​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​后来​海纳​被​比利​吃掉​了​，​领导​的​重担​落到​了​我​的​肩上​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ceng2 yu4 ling4 yi1 wei4 qin1ai4 de5 peng2you5 hai3 na4 gong4tong2 zhi2zhang3 quan2li4。wo3men5 de5 er4 ren2 zhi2zheng4 shi3 zhe4 zuo4 da4lou2 ying2lai2 le5 huang2jin1shi2dai4 ； wo3men5 yi1qi3 jie3fang4 le5 dong4wu4 shi2yan4shi4，bing4 jiang1 qi2 na4ru4 wo3men5 de5 ling3tu3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hou4lai2 hai3 na4 bei4 bi3li4 chi1diao4 le5，ling3dao3 de5 zhong4dan4 la4 dao4 le5 wo3 de5 jian1 shang4。"

msgid "One blade. Single target."
msgstr ""
"一把​飞刀​。​单个​目标​。\n"
"yi1 ba3 fei1dao1。dan1ge5 mu4biao1。"

msgid "One bullet. Single target."
msgstr ""
"一颗​子弹​。​单个​目标\n"
"yi1 ke1 zi3dan4。dan1ge5 mu4biao1"

msgid ""
"One bullet. Single target. Marks the enemy for 1 RND, making them easier to "
"hit."
msgstr ""
"一颗​子弹​。​单个​目标​。​标记​敌人​1​回合​，​使​其​更​容易​被​击中​。\n"
"yi1 ke1 zi3dan4。dan1ge5 mu4biao1。biao1ji4 di2ren2 1 hui2he2，shi3 qi2 geng1 rong2yi4 bei4 ji1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"One day, a man in a little room orders a handful of planes to deliver their "
"payloads. He watches feeds of bombs dropping and numbers falling. It's "
"surgical. Sterile. Cold."
msgstr ""
"某​天​，​一个​男人​坐在​一间​狭小​的​房间​里​，​下令​让​几架​飞机​投​下​炸弹​。​他​看着​炸弹​投下​的​画面​和​存货​人数​不断​下降​。​这​一切​精准​无误​。​冷酷无情​。​冰冷​刺骨​。\n"
"mou3 tian1，yi1ge5 nan2ren2 zuo4 zai4 yi1 jian1 xia2xiao3 de5 fang2jian1 li3，xia4ling4 rang4 ji1 jia4 fei1ji1 tou2 xia4 zha4dan4。ta1 kan4 zhao2 zha4dan4 tou2 xia4 de5 hua4mian4 he4 cun2huo4 ren2shu4 bu4duan4 xia4jiang4。zhe4 yi1qie4 jing1zhun3 wu2wu4。leng3ku4wu2qing2。bing1leng3 ci4gu3。"

msgid ""
"One does not “use” a Great Dragon. Quite the opposite.\n"
"\n"
"The more important question is, who is Feuerschwinge of use to?"
msgstr ""
"凡人​并​不能​“​利用​”​巨龙​。​事实​恰恰相反​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​更​重要​的​问题​是​，​要​利用​火翼​的​是​谁​？\n"
"\n"
"fan2ren2 bing4 bu4neng2“li4yong4” ju4long2。shi4shi2 qia4qia4xiang1fan3。\n"
"\n"
"geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 wen4ti2 shi4，yao4 li4yong4 Huo3yi4 de5 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"One last thing before we do this. I have reason to suspect that Harrow isn't the real power here anymore.\n"
"\n"
"I think that the spirit is."
msgstr ""
"在​我们​开始​行动​之前​，​我​还有​一件​事想​说​。​我​有​理由​怀疑​，​哈罗​已经​不再​是​这里​的​主宰者​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​那个​精魂​才​是​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3men5 kai1shi3 xing2dong4 zhi1qian2，wo3 hai2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 xiang3 shuo1。wo3 you3 li3you2 huai2yi2，ha1luo2 yi3jing1 bu4zai4 shi4 zhe4li3 de5 zhu3zai3zhe3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 na4ge5 jing1hun2 cai2 shi4。"

msgid ""
"One last thing before you go, $(l.name). Samuel Beckenbauer wanted me to pass a message to you.\n"
"\n"
"Do you know him? The ork who runs the shelter across the way?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​还有​一件​事​。​塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔​让​我​给​你​捎​个​口信​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​认识​他​吗​？​就是​街​对面​经营​避难所​的​那个​兽​人​？\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，hai2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4。sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3 rang4 wo3 gei3 ni3 shao1 ge4 kou3xin4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ren4shi5 ta1 ma5？jiu4shi4 jie1 dui4mian4 jing1ying2 bi4nan4suo3 de5 na4ge5 shou4 ren2？"

msgid ""
"One last thing, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I can't stop you from stepping in to fill Schäfer's shoes. You're already doing it, making all the same moves that she did."
msgstr ""
"我​最后​说​一句​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​无法​阻止​你​追随​舍费尔​的​脚步​。​你​已经​在​这么​做​了​，​而且​和​她​做出​了​种种​相同​的​决断​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4hou4 shuo1 yi1ju4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wu2fa3 zu3zhi3 ni3 zhui1sui2 she3 fei4 er3 de5 jiao3bu4。ni3 yi3jing1 zai4 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5，er2qie3 he4 ta1 zuo4chu1 le5 zhong3zhong3 xiang1tong2 de5 jue2duan4。"

msgid ""
"One last thing, $(l.name). Frau Müller sent me a message while you were on the OTK run.\n"
"\n"
"She says that when you reach the sub-basement of the facility, you will find a security door. This door's maglocks can be opened via a voiceprint recognition system.\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, Frau Müller surreptitiously recorded your meeting. She claims that she has added your voiceprint to the Aztechnology database."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​还​有件事​。​你​还​在​OTK​的​时候​，​穆勒​女士​给我发​了​一条​消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​说​你​在​设施​的​地下​二层​会​发现​一扇​安全门​。​通过​声纹识别​系统​，​即可​打开​这​扇门​的​电磁锁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​穆勒​女士​理所当然​地​偷偷​录下​了​你们​的​会面​过程​。​她​已经​将​你​的​声纹​添加​至​阿兹特​科技​的​数据库​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，hai2 you3 jian4 shi4。ni3 hai2 zai4 OTK de5 shi2hou5，mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 gei3 wo3 fa1 le5 yi1 tiao2 xiao1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 ni3 zai4 she4shi1 de5 di4xia4 er4 ceng2 hui4 fa1xian4 yi1 shan1 an1 quan2 men2。tong1guo4 sheng1 wen2 shi2 bie4 xi4tong3，ji2ke3 da3kai1 zhe4 shan1 men2 de5 dian4 ci2 suo3。\n"
"\n"
"mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 li3suo3dang1ran2 de5 tou1tou1 lu4 xia4 le5 ni3men5 de5 hui4mian4 guo4cheng2。ta1 yi3jing1 jiang1 ni3 de5 sheng1 wen2 tian1jia1 zhi4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 shu4ju4ku4。"

msgid ""
"One last thing, $(l.name). Maliit was able to restore the readable surface of one of Green Winters' DVDs.\n"
"\n"
"If you'd like to take a look, you will find it sitting beside the player."
msgstr ""
"还有​一件​事​，​$(l.name)​。​玛丽​特​成功​修复​了​一张​格林​·​温特斯​的​DVD​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​看​的话​，​它​就​在​播放器​旁边​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4，$(l.name)。ma3li4 te4 cheng2gong1 xiu1fu4 le5 yi1 zhang1 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 DVD。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 kan4 de5hua4，ta1 jiu4 zai4 bo1 fang4 qi4 pang2bian1。"

msgid ""
"One look at Blitz's face is enough to tell you that something is gnawing at "
"him. He stands beside his table, playing with a coffee spoon."
msgstr ""
"只​需​看​一眼​布里​茨​的​脸​，​就​能​看出​他​心里​有事​。​他​站​在​桌子​旁​，​玩弄着​一把​咖啡​勺​。\n"
"zhi3 xu1 kan4 yi1yan3 Bu4li3ci2 de5 lian3，jiu4 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 xin1li5 you3shi4。ta1 zhan4 zai4 zhuo1zi5 pang2，wan2 long4 zhao2 yi1 ba3 ka1fei1 shao2。"

msgid ""
"One more hit won't hurt. Besides, you'll need something to tide you over "
"until you get to the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"就​爽​一发​，​没什么​大不了​的​吧​。​再说​了​，​你​到​克洛伊​茨​集市​之前​，​不得​来​点​什么​好​让​自己​熬过去​吗​？\n"
"jiu4 shuang3 yi1 fa1，mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5 ba1。zai4shuo1 le5，ni3 dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi1qian2，bu4de2 lai2 dian3 shen2me5 hao3 rang4 zi4ji3 ao1 guo4 qu4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"One more note: if I were you, I'd avoid being seen with the Magnifikers. The Arbeiters take shots at members of the mage gang whenever they see them.\n"
"\n"
"If you're not careful, you could find yourself caught in the crossfire."
msgstr ""
"还有​一点​：​如果​是​我​的话​，​就​尽量避免​和​伟术​帮​走​得​太近​。​工人​帮一​看到​那个​法师​帮派​的​成员​，​就​会​二话不说​开枪​射击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​稍有不慎​，​你​就​会​陷入​腹背受敌​的​境地​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 yi1dian3：ru2guo3 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 jin3 liang2 bi4 mian3 he4 wei3 shu4 bang1 zou3 de2 tai4 jin4。gong1ren2 bang1 yi1 kan4dao4 na4ge5 fa3shi1 bang1pai4 de5 cheng2yuan2，jiu4 hui4 er4hua4bu4shuo1 kai1qiang1 she4ji1。\n"
"\n"
"shao1 you3 bu4 shen4，ni3 jiu4 hui4 xian4ru4 fu4bei4shou4di2 de5 jing4di4。"

msgid ""
"One nice thing about shamanism... as long as you keep your idol happy, it doesn't *matter* what else you do.\n"
"\n"
"The Dragonslayer chose me to be His servant. And as long as I was scrappin' with someone bigger'n me, He didn't much care whether I did it on stage or in the shadows."
msgstr ""
"萨满教​有​一点​好​……​只要​你​能​讨​精魂​导师​欢心​，​别的​你​想​干嘛​都​*​无所谓​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屠龙​者​选​我​作为​祂​的​仆从​。​只要​我敢​和​比​我​强大​的​对手​较量​，​祂​根本​不在乎​我​是​在​台前​还是​暗处​出手​。\n"
"\n"
"sa4man3jiao4 you3 yi1dian3 hao3……zhi3yao4 ni3 neng2 tao3 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 huan1xin1，bie2de5 ni3 xiang3 gan4ma2 dou1*wu2suo3wei4*。\n"
"\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 xuan3 wo3 zuo4wei2 ta1 de5 pu1 cong2。zhi3yao4 wo3 gan3 he4 bi3 wo3 qiang2da4 de5 dui4shou3 jiao4liang4，ta1 gen1ben3 bu4zai4hu5 wo3 shi4 zai4 tai2qian2 hai2shi5 an4chu4 chu1shou3。"

msgid "One of Monika's runners then, is it? Few others wield an ego that big."
msgstr ""
"看来​你​是​莫妮卡​手下​的​狂奔​者​了​？​其他人​应该​不会​心​这么​大​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 shou3xia4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 le5？qi2 ta1 ren2 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 xin1 zhe4me5 dai4。"

msgid ""
"One of my assets at Transys Neuronet provided me with a video feed dated 2053-10-10. The feed was taken by a corporate surveillance drone. \n"
"\n"
"Playback commencing."
msgstr ""
"我​在​“​暂态​系统​神经网​”​公司​的​线​人​提供​了​一份​2053​年​10​月​10​日​的​录像​，​由​企业​监控​无人机​拍摄​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正在​开始​回放​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4“zan4tai4 xi4tong3 shen2jing1wang3” gong1si1 de5 xian4 ren2 ti2gong1 le5 yi1 fen4 2053 nian2 10 yue4 10 ri4 de5 lu4xiang4，you2 qi3ye4 jian1kong4 wu2ren2ji1 pai1she4。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4zai4 kai1shi3 hui2fang4。"

msgid ""
"One of the attackers came in here. Did you know that? He pushed his way past Aljernon's wards and forced himself into this shop.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her nostrils flare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He threatened us. Threatened *me.*"
msgstr ""
"有个​袭击者​来过​这里​。​你​知道​吗​？​他​强行​突破​了​阿尔杰​农​的​防护​结界​，​硬生生​闯进​了​这家​店铺​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​鼻翼​翕动​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​胆敢​威胁​我们​。​威胁​*​我​*​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ge4 xi2ji1zhe3 lai2 guo4 zhe4li3。ni3 zhi1dao4 ma5？ta1 qiang2xing2 tu1po4 le5 E1er3jie2nong2 de5 fang2hu4 jie2jie4，ying4sheng1sheng1 chuang3jin4 le5 zhe4 jia1 dian4pu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 bi2yi4 xi1dong4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 dan3gan3 wei1xie2 wo3men5。wei1xie2*wo3*。"

msgid "One of the cultists in there could have the key that we need."
msgstr ""
"其中​一个​教徒​可能​有​我们​需要​的​钥匙​。\n"
"qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 jiao4tu2 ke3neng2 you3 wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5 yao4shi5。"

msgid ""
"One of the gang leaders is probably your best bet. Ullrich is right out "
"front... I suppose that you could try your luck with him. Or, if you'd be "
"willing to do me a favor, I could tell you how to find Trithemius's hideout."
" The choice is yours."
msgstr ""
"和​帮派​头目​谈谈​或许​是​你​目前​的​最佳​选择​。​乌尔里​希就​在​外面​……​我​想​你​可以​碰碰运气​找​他​商谈​。​或者​，​如果​你​愿意​帮​我​个​忙​，​我​可以​告诉​你​如何​找到​特​里特​米​乌斯​的​藏身之处​。​选择权​在​你​。\n"
"he4 bang1pai4 tou2mu4 tan2tan2 huo4xu3 shi4 ni3 mu4qian2 de5 zui4jia1 xuan3ze2。wu1 er3 li3 xi1 jiu4 zai4 wai4mian4……wo3 xiang3 ni3 ke3yi3 peng4 peng4 yun4 qi4 zhao3 ta1 shang1tan2。huo4zhe3，ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 bang1 wo3 ge4 mang2，wo3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3 ru2he2 zhao3dao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 cang2shen1zhi1chu4。xuan3 ze2 quan2 zai4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"One of the researchers survived. He's gone insane in there over the past "
"couple of years... he refuses to leave. Thinks that he's something called a "
"\"Knight-King.\""
msgstr ""
"某个​研究员​活​了​下来​。​过去​的​几年​把​他​逼​疯​了​……​他​不​愿意​离开​，​还​说​自己​是​什么​“​骑士​王​”​。\n"
"mou3 ge4 yan2jiu1yuan2 huo2 le5 xia4lai5。guo4qu4 de5 ji3nian2 ba3 ta1 bi1 feng1 le5……ta1 bu4 yuan4yi4 li2kai1，hai2 shuo1 zi4ji3 shi4 shen2me5“qi2shi4 wang2”。"

msgid "One of the runners is down!"
msgstr ""
"一名​狂奔​者​倒下​了​！\n"
"yi1 ming2 kuang2Ben1zhe3 dao3xia4 le5！"

msgid ""
"One of these days, you're going to have to demonstrate this \"powerful "
"magic\" of yours for me."
msgstr ""
"总有一天​，​你​得​把​这招​“​强力​魔法​”​给​我​露一手​看看​。\n"
"zong3 you3 yi1 tian1，ni3 de2 ba3 zhe4 zhao1“qiang2li4 mo2fa3” gei3 wo3 lou4yi1shou3 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"One other thing, $(l.name)... if we reach this goal, I would like to name the building after you. You are, after all, our primary benefactor.\n"
"\n"
"With 500 nuyen, we could make the purchase. Whatever you could spare would be most appreciated."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​还有​一件​事​……​如果​我们​达到​了​这个​目标​，​我​想​用​你​的​名字​来​命名​这座​大楼​。​毕竟​你​是​我们​的​主要​赞助人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​有​500​新円​，​我们​就​能​达成​交易​。​无论​你​能​拿出​多少​，​我们​都​将​感激不尽​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，hai2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4……ru2guo3 wo3men5 da2dao4 le5 zhe4ge5 mu4biao1，wo3 xiang3 yong4 ni3 de5 ming2zi5 lai2 ming4ming2 zhe4 zuo4 da4lou2。bi4jing4 ni3 shi4 wo3men5 de5 zhu3yao4 zan4 zhu4 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 you3 500 xin1 yuan2，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 da2cheng2 jiao1yi4。wu2lun4 ni3 neng2 na2chu1 duo1shao3，wo3men5 dou1 jiang1 gan3ji1bu4jin4。"

msgid ""
"One other thing. Tolstoi told me a story about a kill-team that might be related to all of this.\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, a decker named Hellebore posted a theory about Feuerschwinge to the Shadowland BBS about five years ago.\n"
"\n"
"About an hour later, a mil-spec team showed up in meat space and cooked her entire apartment... with her in it."
msgstr ""
"还​有件事​。​托尔斯泰​给​我​讲​了​一个​关于​杀戮​队​的​故事​，​可能​和​这​一切​有关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​叫​海勒​波​的​碟​客​五年​前​在​暗影​之地​论坛​上​发表​了​一个​关于​火翼​的​理论​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大约​一​小时​后​，​现实​世界​出现​了​一支​军事​规格​的​小队​，​把​她​的​整个​公寓​……​连同​她​一起​烧光​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 you3 jian4 shi4。tuo1er3si1tai4 gei3 wo3 jiang3 le5 yi1ge5 guan1yu2 sha1lu4 dui4 de5 gu4shi4，ke3neng2 he4 zhe4 yi1qie4 you3guan1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 jiao4 hai3 lei1 bo1 de5 die2 ke4 wu3 nian2 qian2 zai4 an4ying3 zhi1 de5 lun4tan2 shang4 fa1biao3 le5 yi1ge5 guan1yu2 Huo3yi4 de5 li3lun4。\n"
"\n"
"da4yue1 yi1 xiao3shi2 hou4，xian4shi2 shi4jie4 chu1xian4 le5 yi1 zhi1 jun1shi4 gui1ge2 de5 xiao3 dui4，ba3 ta1 de5 zheng3ge4 gong1yu4……lian2tong2 ta1 yi1qi3 shao1 guang1 le5。"

msgid ""
"One other thing: Herr Schmidt provided me with a device to assist you on the run. He calls it a \"little black box\"... apparently, it can be used to compromise the power and security systems of the run site.\n"
"\n"
"If you opt to take the job, be sure to take it with you."
msgstr ""
"还有​一件​事​：​施密特​先生​给​了​我​一件​设备​，​说​是​用来​协助​你​行动​。​他​称之为​“​小​黑盒​”​……​据说​可以​用来​破坏​行动​地点​的​电力​和​安保​系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​接受​这份​差事​，​务必​带上​它​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4：shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 gei3 le5 wo3 yi1 jian4 she4bei4，shuo1 shi4 yong4lai2 xie2zhu4 ni3 xing2dong4。ta1 cheng1zhi1wei2“xiao3 hei1he2”……ju4shuo1 ke3yi3 yong4lai2 po4huai4 xing2dong4 di4dian3 de5 dian4li4 he4 an1bao3 xi4tong3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 jie1shou4 zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4，wu4bi4 dai4shang4 ta1。"

msgid "One shot. Pierces up to 3 Armor. Cannot hit adjacent targets."
msgstr ""
"射击​一次​。​最​多​提供​3​点护甲​穿透​。​无法​击中​相邻​的​多个​目标​。\n"
"she4ji1 yi1ci4。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 3 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。wu2fa3 ji1zhong4 xiang1lin2 de5 duo1ge5 mu4biao1。"

msgid ""
"One that you won't like. If you don't feed these ghouls, I'm gonna feed you "
"to them."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​你​不会​喜欢​。​如果​你​不​喂​这些​尸鬼​，​我​就​拿​你​喂​他们​。\n"
"kong3pa4 ni3 bu4hui4 xi3huan5。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 wei2 zhe4xie1 shi1 gui3，wo3 jiu4 na2 ni3 wei2 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"One thing is clear: you need to find your way back out of here, and into Vauclair's lab complex.\n"
"\n"
"If the Firewing flies tonight, everyone in the Kreuzbasar will burn."
msgstr ""
"有​一件​事是​毫无疑问​的​：​你​得​赶紧​想​办法​离开​这里​，​回到​沃​克莱尔​的​实验室​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​火翼​今晚​再度​翱翔​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​都​会​化为灰烬​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 shi4 hao2wu2yi2wen4 de5：ni3 de2 gan3jin3 xiang3 ban4fa3 li2kai1 zhe4li3，hui2dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 shi2yan4shi4 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 Huo3yi4 jin1wan3 zai4du4 ao2xiang2 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 hui4 hua4 wei2 hui1 jin4。"

msgid ""
"One way or another, I was getting saddled with the name “Eiger.” As soon as that idiot made his little joke, it was a foregone conclusion.\n"
"\n"
"My only choice in the matter was whether it happened under his terms, or under mine."
msgstr ""
"无论如何​，​在​那个​蠢货​讲出​他​的​弱智​玩笑​之后​，​我​就​注定​要​背上​“​艾格尔​”​这个​绰号​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当时​唯一​能​做​的​，​就是​让​它​充满​我​自己​的​风格​，​而​不是​被​他​牵着鼻子​走​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，zai4 na4ge5 chun3huo4 jiang3 chu1 ta1 de5 ruo4zhi4 wan2xiao4 zhi1hou4，wo3 jiu4 zhu4ding4 yao4 bei1 shang4“Ai4ge2er3” zhe4ge5 chuo4hao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 wei2yi1 neng2 zuo4 de5，jiu4shi4 rang4 ta1 chong1man3 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 feng1ge2，er2 bu4shi4 bei4 ta1 qian1 zhao2 bi2 zi3 zou3。"

msgid "One whole file? Nice job, Paul."
msgstr ""
"一整​份文件​？​干得​好​，​保罗​。\n"
"yi1 zheng3 fen4 wen2 jian4？gan4 de2 hao3，bao3luo2。"

msgid ""
"One word of caution before you proceed: there are aspects of this run that you might find morally troubling. Be sure to read and understand the specifics of the job before accepting.\n"
"\n"
"If you do accept, you will be expected to carry out the requirements of the job in full."
msgstr ""
"在​你​继续​之前​，​我​有​一句​忠告​：​这次​行动​的​某些​环节​可能​会​让​你​产生​道德​层面​的​困扰​。​请​务必​仔细阅读​并​理解​行动​的​具体内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​选择​接受​，​就​必须​完成​差事​的​全部​要求​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 ji4xu4 zhi1qian2，wo3 you3 yi1ju4 zhong1gao4：zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 de5 mou3xie1 huan2jie2 ke3neng2 hui4 rang4 ni3 chan3sheng1 dao4de2 ceng2mian4 de5 kun4rao3。qing3 wu4bi4 zi3 xi4 yue4 dou4 bing4 li3jie3 xing2dong4 de5 ju4 ti3 nei4 rong2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xuan3ze2 jie1shou4，jiu4 bi4xu1 wan2cheng2 cha4shi4 de5 quan2bu4 yao1qiu2。"

msgid ""
"One.\n"
"\n"
"Two."
msgstr ""
"一​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​二​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1。\n"
"\n"
"er4。"

msgid "Online:"
msgstr ""
"在线​：\n"
"zai4xian4："

msgid "Only Kim knows the truth, but she won't speak of it. (h)"
msgstr ""
"只有​阿金​才​知道​真相​，​但​她​就是​不肯​说​出来​。\n"
"zhi3you3 e1 jin1 cai2 zhi1dao4 zhen1xiang4，dan4 ta1 jiu4shi4 bu4 ken3 shuo1 chu1lai2。"

msgid "Only it hasn't crumbled yet. Believers like Monika made it work. (h)"
msgstr ""
"只不过​它​尚未​崩塌​。​有​像​莫妮卡​这样​的​信徒​让​它​仍​在​运作​着​。\n"
"zhi3bu5guo4 ta1 shang4wei4 beng1ta1。you3 xiang4 Mo4ni1ka3 zhe4yang4 de5 xin4tu2 rang4 ta1 reng2 zai4 yun4zuo4 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"Only my mother knows for sure. But for the purposes of this transaction, I am the bastard who has something that you need.\n"
"\n"
"Please give Herr Amsel my regards. If he wishes to discuss why his information has been withheld, he knows where to find me.\n"
"\n"
"I will be more than happy to explain the matter in detail."
msgstr ""
"这个​你​得​去​问​我​老母​才​知道​。​但​在​这场​交易​里​，​你​口中​的​这个​“​杂种​”​手上​可​拿​着​你​需要​的​东西​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请代​我​向​阿姆​泽尔​先生​问好​。​如果​他​希望​探讨​他​所​需要​的​情报​为什么​被​扣留​，​他​知道​该来​哪里找​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​十分​乐意​详细​解释​个​中​缘由​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 ni3 de2 qu4 wen4 wo3 lao3 mu3 cai2 zhi1dao4。dan4 zai4 zhe4 chang2 jiao1yi4 li3，ni3 kou3 zhong4 de5 zhe4ge5“za2zhong3” shou3 shang4 ke3 na2 zhao2 ni3 xu1yao4 de5 dong1xi1 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 dai4 wo3 xiang4 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 wen4hao3。ru2guo3 ta1 xi1wang4 tan4tao3 ta1 suo3 xu1yao4 de5 qing2bao4 wei4shen2me5 bei4 kou4liu2，ta1 zhi1dao4 gai1 lai2 na3 li3 zhao3 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 shi2fen1 le4yi4 xiang2xi4 jie3shi4 ge4 zhong4 yuan2you2。"

msgid ""
"Only time will tell, I suppose. But at least we got the AI off of our backs. Who knows? Maybe it'll even use all of this to protect the F-State, like it said it would.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, $(l.name). Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Let's go home."
msgstr ""
"只有​时间​会​告诉​我们​结果​了​。​但​至少​我们​摆脱​了​AI​的​威胁​。​谁​知道​呢​？​说不定​它​真会​像​承诺​的​那样​，​用​这​一切​来​保护​动荡​带​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​回家​去​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3you3 shi2jian1 hui4 gao4su4 wo3men5 jie1guo3 le5。dan4 zhi4shao3 wo3men5 bai3tuo1 le5 AI de5 wei1xie2。shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？shuo1bu5ding4 ta1 zhen1 hui4 xiang4 cheng2nuo4 de5 na4yang4，yong4 zhe4 yi1qie4 lai2 bao3hu4 dong4dang4 dai4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，$(l.name)。wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui2jia1 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Only what we've heard. That he nearly killed a man who cornered him in an "
"alley. (h)"
msgstr ""
"都​是​传言​罢了​。​据说​有个​男人​在​小巷子​里​堵​他​，​结果​差点​被​他杀​了​。\n"
"dou1 shi4 chuan2yan2 ba4le5。ju4shuo1 you3 ge4 nan2ren2 zai4 xiao3 xiang4 zi3 li3 du3 ta1，jie1guo3 cha4dian3 bei4 ta1sha1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Ooh, sorry... I must've gotten lost. I was looking for... uh... Alpha "
"sector?"
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​抱歉​……​我​肯定​是​迷路​了​。​我要​去​的​是​……​呃​……​阿尔法​区​？\n"
"ai1ya1，bao4qian4……wo3 ken3ding4 shi4 mi2lu4 le5。wo3 yao4 qu4 de5 shi4……e4……a1er3fa3 qu1？"

msgid "Ooh, that is so, *so* much better. I feel... I feel ALIVE again!"
msgstr ""
"噢​，​噢​—​—​这下​好​，​好​*​多​*​了​。​我​感觉​……​我​感觉​我​又​活过来​了​！\n"
"o1，o1——zhe4xia4 hao3，hao3*duo1*le5。wo3 gan3jue2……wo3 gan3jue2 wo3 you4 huo2 guo4 lai2 le5！"

msgid "Oops."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​。\n"
"ai1ya1。"

msgid ""
"Oops. Sorry, Yuli. I guess that the cyberware deactivator shut down your chipjack, too.\n"
"\n"
"Somewhere in the back of that addled skull, I'm sure that you probably knew that. But then, hope springs eternal, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""
"哎呀​。​不好意思​，​尤里​。​看来​赛博​改造​失效​器​也​把​你​的​芯片​插口​给​关掉​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​那颗​混乱​的​脑袋​深处​，​我​想​你​肯定​是​清楚​这​一点​的​。​但​话说回来​，​有​希望​总是​件​好事​，​不是​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1。bu4hao3yi4si5，You2li3。kan4lai5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 shi1xiao4 qi4 ye3 ba3 ni3 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3 gei3 guan1diao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4 ke1 hun4luan4 de5 nao3dai5 shen1chu4，wo3 xiang3 ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 qing1chu5 zhe4 yi1dian3 de5。dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，you3 xi1wang4 zong3shi4 jian4 hao3shi4，bu4shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Open Door"
msgstr ""
"开门\n"
"kai1men2"

msgid "Open Gate Left"
msgstr ""
"打开​左侧​的​门\n"
"da3kai1 zuo3ce4 de5 men2"

msgid "Open Gate Right"
msgstr ""
"打开​右侧​的​门\n"
"da3kai1 you4ce4 de5 men2"

msgid "Open Safe"
msgstr ""
"打开​保险箱\n"
"da3kai1 bao3xian3xiang1"

msgid "Open Side Gate Fence"
msgstr ""
"打开​侧门​围栏\n"
"da3kai1 ce4men2 wei2lan2"

msgid "Open fire!"
msgstr ""
"开火​！\n"
"kai1huo3！"

msgid "Open the Door to the Shrine"
msgstr ""
"打开​通往​神龛​的​门\n"
"da3kai1 tong1wang3 shen2kan1 de5 men2"

msgid "Open the First Security Door"
msgstr ""
"打开​第一道​安全门\n"
"da3kai1 di4 yi1 dao4 an1 quan2 men2"

msgid "Open the Vault"
msgstr ""
"打开​保险库\n"
"da3kai1 bao3 xian3 ku4"

msgid "Opens up the astral so the mage can see beyond the pale."
msgstr ""
"开启​星界​视野​，​使​法师​得以​窥见​帷幕​之后​。\n"
"kai1qi3 xing1 jie4 shi4ye3，shi3 fa3shi1 de2yi3 kui1jian4 wei2mu4 zhi1hou4。"

msgid "Operations Control"
msgstr ""
"运行​控制\n"
"yun4xing2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Operations Terminal"
msgstr ""
"操作​终端\n"
"cao1zuo4 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Optical Chip"
msgstr ""
"光学​芯片\n"
"guang1xue2 xin1pian4"

msgid "Options"
msgstr ""
"选项\n"
"xuan3xiang4"

msgid "Or did you think Green Winters found the Harfeld Manor on his own?"
msgstr ""
"你​以为​格林​·​温特斯​只​凭​自己​就​能查​到​哈​菲尔德​庄园​吗​？\n"
"ni3 yi3wei2 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 zhi3 ping2 zi4ji3 jiu4 neng2 cha2 dao4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Or he was trying to kill him, which would surely give Samuel cause to react."
" (w)"
msgstr ""
"或者​他​是​想​痛下​杀手​，​借此​让​塞缪尔​获得​举事​的​理由​。\n"
"huo4zhe3 ta1 shi4 xiang3 tong4 xia4 sha1shou3，jie4ci3 rang4 sai4miu4er3 huo4de2 ju3 shi4 de5 li3you2。"

msgid ""
"Or that the Half-Dream is willing to impart. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles playfully.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"或者说​是​半梦者​愿意​分享​的​信息​只有​这么​多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​狡黠​一笑​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"huo4 zhe3 shuo1 shi4 ban4 meng4 zhe3 yuan4yi4 fen1xiang3 de5 xin4xi1 zhi3you3 zhe4me5 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiao3xia2 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Organlegger"
msgstr ""
"器官​贩子\n"
"qi4guan1 fan4zi5"

msgid "Orichalcum? What's that?"
msgstr ""
"奥利​哈钢​？​那​是​什么​？\n"
"ao4 li4 ha1 gang1？na4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Originally, yeah. Mine has a lot more bite, though... I bumped up the amperage quite a bit.\n"
"\n"
"When that thing goes off, it'll both shut down the nervous system and cook the organs of anyone in its blast radius."
msgstr ""
"原型​版本​是​这样​，​但​我​做​的​这个​要​厉害​多​了​……​我​把​电流强度​调高​了​不少​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​爆炸​的​时候​，​不仅​能​使​杀伤​半径​内​目标​的​神经系统​瘫痪​，​还会​把​他们​的​内脏器官​都​烤熟​。\n"
"\n"
"yuan2xing2 ban3ben3 shi4 zhe4yang4，dan4 wo3 zuo4 de5 zhe4ge5 yao4 li4hai5 duo1 le5……wo3 ba3 dian4liu2qiang2du4 diao4 gao1 le5 bu4shao3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bao4zha4 de5 shi2hou5，bu4jin3 neng2 shi3 sha1shang1 ban4jing4 nei4 mu4biao1 de5 shen2jing1xi4tong3 tan1huan4，hai2 hui4 ba3 ta1men5 de5 nei4 zang4 qi4 guan1 dou1 kao3 shu2。"

msgid "Ork"
msgstr ""
"兽​人\n"
"shou4 ren2"

msgid "Ork Civilian"
msgstr ""
"兽​人​平民\n"
"shou4 ren2 ping2min2"

msgid "Ork Guard"
msgstr ""
"兽​人​警卫\n"
"shou4 ren2 jing3wei4"

msgid ""
"Orks are the fastest-breeding race and now are second only to humans in world population. Their size leads to an intimidating silhouette and a body that can take more physical damage than the average. Orks have pointed ears and intimidating teeth or tusks.\n"
"\n"
"All Orks have a +1 to Body\n"
"Maximum Stats: Body: 14  Quickness: 9 Strength: 12 Charisma: 8  Intelligence: 8 Willpower: 9"
msgstr ""
"兽​人​是​最具​繁殖力​的​种族​，​如今​其​世界​人口​仅次于​人类​。​其​庞大​的​体型​造就​了​令人​望而生畏​的​身形​轮廓​，​且​身体​承受​物理​伤害​的​能力​远​超常​人​。​兽​人​拥有​尖耳​与​令人​胆寒​的​獠牙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​兽​人​获得​+​1​体质​\n"
"​最大​属性​：​体质​：​14​ ​ ​敏捷​：​9​ ​ ​力量​：​12​ ​ ​魅力​：​8​ ​ ​智力​：​8​ ​ ​意志​：​9\n"
"\n"
"shou4 ren2 shi4 zui4 ju4 fan2 zhi2 li4 de5 zhong3zu2，ru2jin1 qi2 shi4jie4 ren2kou3 jin3ci4yu2 ren2lei4。qi2 pang2da4 de5 ti3xing2 zao4jiu4 le5 ling4ren2 wang4er2sheng1wei4 de5 shen1xing2 lun2kuo4，qie3 shen1ti3 cheng2shou4 wu4li3 shang1hai4 de5 neng2li4 yuan3 chao1chang2 ren2。shou4 ren2 yong1you3 jian1 er3 yu4 ling4ren2 dan3han2 de5 liao2ya2。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 shou4 ren2 huo4de2 +1 ti3zhi4 \n"
"zui4 dai4 shu3xing4：ti3zhi4：14 min3jie2：9 li4liang5：12 mei4li4：8 zhi4li4：8 yi4zhi4：9"

msgid "Orthographic"
msgstr ""
"正交投影\n"
"zheng1 jiao1 tou2 ying3"

msgid "Orthoskin"
msgstr ""
"矫形​皮肤\n"
"jiao3xing2 pi2fu1"

msgid ""
"Other fun facts about those years: I learned cruelty. I had power now, and my new idol encouraged me to use it. Harrow did the same. \n"
"\n"
"Any children who didn't pull their weight were subjected to my tender mercies, and I was anything but tender. I took what I wanted rather than asking for it.\n"
"\n"
"I liked it. It was fun."
msgstr ""
"在​那些​年里​，​我​也​学会​了​残忍​。​如今​我​掌握​了​力量​，​而​我​的​新​偶像​鼓励​我​施展​它​。​哈罗​当时​也​是​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​任何​不​尽责​的​孩子​都​会​遭受​我​的​“​仁慈​”​对待​—​—​而​我​的​仁慈​绝非​温柔​。​我会​予取予求​，​拿走​自己​想要​的​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​喜欢​这样​。​这​很​有趣​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4xie1 nian2 li3，wo3 ye3 xue2hui4 le5 can2ren3。ru2jin1 wo3 zhang3wo4 le5 li4liang5，er2 wo3 de5 xin1 ou3xiang4 gu3li4 wo3 shi1zhan3 ta1。ha1luo2 dang1shi2 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"ren4he2 bu4 jin4ze2 de5 hai2zi5 dou1 hui4 zao1shou4 wo3 de5“ren2ci2” dui4dai4——er2 wo3 de5 ren2ci2 jue2fei1 wen1rou2。wo3 hui4 yu3 qu3 yu3 qiu2，na2zou3 zi4ji3 xiang3yao4 de5 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi3huan5 zhe4yang4。zhe4 hen3 you3qu4。"

msgid "Other than the crazy guy in the server room, you mean?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​除了​服务器​机房​里头​的​那个​疯子​还有​别人​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 chu2le5 fu2wu4qi4 ji1fang2 li3tou5 de5 na4ge5 feng1zi5 hai2you3 bie2ren5？"

msgid ""
"Others we tried were worse. One even kicked us out because of our age. (w)"
msgstr ""
"我们​去​的​其他​地方​甚至​更​糟糕​。​有个​街区​甚至​因为​我们​岁数​大​了​就​把​我们​赶​了​出来​。\n"
"wo3men5 qu4 de5 qi2ta1 di4fang1 shen4zhi4 geng1 zao1gao1。you3 ge4 jie1qu1 shen4zhi4 yin1wei4 wo3men5 sui4shu5 dai4 le5 jiu4 ba3 wo3men5 gan3 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid "Ouch."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​。\n"
"ai1ya1。"

msgid ""
"Our R&D teams have been working around the clock to devise a weapon capable of downing the beast. \n"
"\n"
"In the interim, we are providing material support for the Luftwaffe's attempts to shoot her down via conventional means."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​研发​团队​一直​在​夜以继日​地​设计​一种​能够​干掉​这​怪物​的​武器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在此期间​，​我们​也​在​为​德国​空军​通过​常规​手段​击落​它​的​尝试​提供​物质​支持​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 yan2fa1 tuan2dui4 yi1zhi2 zai4 ye4yi3ji4ri4 de5 she4ji4 yi1zhong3 neng2gou4 gan4diao4 zhe4 guai4wu5 de5 wu3qi4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1，wo3men5 ye3 zai4 wei2 de2guo2 kong1jun1 tong1guo4 chang2gui1 shou3duan4 ji1luo4 ta1 de5 chang2shi4 ti2gong1 wu4zhi4 zhi1chi2。"

msgid ""
"Our business is concluded. When our employers wish to contact you again, they will do so.\n"
"\n"
"Until then, leave me alone to enjoy my drink."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​交易​到此结束​。​等​我们​的​雇主​想​联系​你​的​时候​，​他们​自然​会​这么​做​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请别​打扰​我​安静​喝酒​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 jiao1yi4 dao4 ci3 jie1 shu4。deng3 wo3men5 de5 gu4zhu3 xiang3 lian2xi4 ni3 de5 shi2hou5，ta1men5 zi4ran2 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 bie4 da3rao3 wo3 an1jing4 he1jiu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Our contract says that we have to kill you. That's all that I need to know."
msgstr ""
"我们​签下​的​契约​要求​我们​必须​杀​了​你​。​我​知道​这些​就够​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 qian1 xia4 de5 qi4yue1 yao1qiu2 wo3men5 bi4xu1 sha1 le5 ni3。wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid "Our employers don't tell us much, do they?"
msgstr ""
"我们​的​雇主​不太​喜欢​透露​情报​啊​？\n"
"wo3men5 de5 gu4zhu3 bu4 tai4 xi3huan5 tou4lu4 qing2bao4 a1？"

msgid "Our escape route will open in a minute. We hold tight until then."
msgstr ""
"撤离​路线​一分钟​以内​就​会​开启​。​我们​坚持​到​那​时候​。\n"
"che4li2 lu4xian4 yi1 fen4 zhong1 yi3nei4 jiu4 hui4 kai1qi3。wo3men5 jian1chi2 dao4 na4 shi2hou5。"

msgid "Our fearless leader returns. What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"我们​的​无畏​领袖​回来​了​。​有事吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 de5 wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4 hui2lai5 le5。you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Our first priority must be finding a way to combat these things. \n"
"\n"
"*Then* we tackle the long-term challenge of staunching the tide of mana that is flowing into the world."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​首要任务​是​必须​找到​对抗​这些​事物​的​办法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​然后​*​我们​才能​着手​应对​长期​挑战​—​—​遏制​涌入​世界​的​魔力​洪流​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 shou3 yao4 ren4 wu4 shi4 bi4xu1 zhao3dao4 dui4kang4 zhe4xie1 shi4wu4 de5 ban4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"*ran2hou4*wo3men5 cai2neng2 zhuo2shou3 ying4dui4 chang2qi1 tiao3zhan4——e4zhi4 yong3ru4 shi4jie4 de5 mo2li4 hong2liu2。"

msgid ""
"Our friend here just taught wizard-boy a permanent lesson about messing with the Arbeiters!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A chorus of cheers erupts from the assorted gangers assembled behind Ullrich.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So GEAR UP, 'cuz we've got a GODDAMN BUILDING to take back!"
msgstr ""
"我们​这位​朋友​刚刚​让​那个​巫师​小子​用命​学到​了​宝贵​的​一课​，​那​就是​永远​别​惹​工人​帮​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​乌尔里​希​身后​聚集​的​各路​帮派​成员​一齐​爆发​出​欢呼声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​都​给​我​抄​家伙​，​该​去​把​我们​的​大楼​夺回来​了​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 gang1gang5 rang4 na4ge5 wu1shi1 xiao3zi5 yong4ming4 xue2dao4 le5 bao3gui4 de5 yi1 ke4，na4 jiu4shi4 yong3yuan3 bie4 re3 gong1ren2 bang1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} wu1 er3 li3 xi1 shen1hou4 ju4ji2 de5 ge4 lu4 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 yi1qi2 bao4fa1 chu1 huan1 hu1 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 dou1 gei3 wo3 chao1 jia1huo5，gai1 qu4 ba3 wo3men5 de5 da4lou2 duo2 hui2 lai2 le5！"

msgid "Our friends need help. Let's go give it to them."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​朋友​需要​帮助​。​我们​赶紧​去​帮忙​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 de5 peng2you5 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4。wo3men5 gan3jin3 qu4 bang1mang2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Our friends wanted me to deliver this message to you in person. Here, in "
"your office. I'm sure that you understand."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​那些​朋友​要​我​当​面向​你​传达​这句​话​。​在​你​的​这间​办公室​里​。​我​想​你​肯定​能​明白​。\n"
"wo3men5 de5 na4xie1 peng2you5 yao4 wo3 dang1 mian4xiang4 ni3 chuan2da2 zhe4 ju4 hua4。zai4 ni3 de5 zhe4 jian1 ban4gong1shi4 li3。wo3 xiang3 ni3 ken3ding4 neng2 ming2bai5。"

msgid ""
"Our goal is to liberate this information so that any who wish to may access it, and so that the F-State can regulate itself based on truth.\n"
"\n"
"We are simply a collective of like-minded individuals working toward this cause."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​目标​是​解放​这些​信息​，​让​所有​希望​获取​的​人​都​能​接触​到​它们​，​从而​使​动荡​带​能够​基于​真相​进行​自我​监管​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​仅仅​是​一群​志同道合者​组成​的​集体​，​致力于​实现​这一​目标​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 mu4biao1 shi4 jie3fang4 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1，rang4 suo3you3 xi1wang4 huo4qu3 de5 ren2 dou1 neng2 jie1chu4 dao4 ta1men5，cong2er2 shi3 dong4dang4 dai4 neng2gou4 ji1yu2 zhen1xiang4 jin4xing2 zi4wo3 jian1guan3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jin3jin3 shi4 yi1 qun2 zhi4 tong2 dao4 ge3 zhe3 zu3cheng2 de5 ji2ti3，zhi4 li4 yu2 shi2xian4 zhe4 yi1 mu4biao1。"

msgid ""
"Our great benefactor returns! What can I do for you, $(l.name)?\n"
"\n"
"Say the word, and it will be done."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​赞助人​回来​了​！​我​有​什么​能​为​你​做​的​吗​，​$(l.name)​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​有​需要​，​请​尽管​开口​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 zan4 zhu4 ren2 hui2lai5 le5！wo3 you3 shen2me5 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 de5 ma5，$(l.name)？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 you3 xu1yao4，qing3 jin3guan3 kai1kou3。"

msgid "Our leader would like a word."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​首领​想​和​你​谈谈​。\n"
"wo3men5 de5 shou3ling3 xiang3 he4 ni3 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"Our little Hans deserves the very best, and he'll need it if he's going to compete with his classmates at the Academy. That means headware from AugmenTech.\n"
"\n"
"We may not be as rich as the other parents, but this, at least, is something that we *can* do."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​小​汉斯​值得​拥有​最好​的​东西​，​要​想​在​学院​里​跟上​其他人​的​档次​，​这些​装备​更是​必不可少​。​这​意味着​他​需要​“​增强​科技​”​的​头盔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​或许​不如​其他​家长​富有​，​但​至少​这件​事​，​是​我们​力所能及​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 xiao3 han4si1 zhi2de5 yong1you3 zui4hao3 de5 dong1xi1，yao4 xiang3 zai4 xue2yuan4 li3 gen1shang4 qi2 ta1 ren2 de5 dang4ci4，zhe4xie1 zhuang1bei4 geng4shi4 bi4bu4ke3shao3。zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ta1 xu1yao4“zeng1qiang2 ke1ji4” de5 tou2kui1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 huo4xu3 bu4ru2 qi2ta1 jia1zhang3 fu4you3，dan4 zhi4shao3 zhe4 jian4 shi4，shi4 wo3men5 li4suo3neng2ji2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Our mission was extraterritorial... technically illegal. But important enough to justify the risk.\n"
"\n"
"We'd been sent across the border, into Poland. The Russian mafia had set up a cottage industry in human trafficking all along the Oder-Neisse line, and it was our job to disrupt it. \n"
msgstr ""
"我们​的​任务​属于​越境​行动​……​严格来说​是​非法​的​，​但​其​重要性​足以​让​我们​承担​这些​风险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​被​派​往​波兰​境内​执行​任务​。​俄罗斯​黑手党​在​奥德河​-​尼斯河​沿线​建立​了​地下​人口​贩运​网络​，​而​我们​的​任务​就是​将​其​摧毁​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 ren4wu5 shu3yu2 yue4jing4 xing2dong4……yan2ge2lai2shuo1 shi4 fei1fa3 de5，dan4 qi2 zhong4yao4xing4 zu2yi3 rang4 wo3men5 cheng2dan1 zhe4xie1 feng1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bei4 pai4 wang3 bo1lan2 jing4nei4 zhi2xing2 ren4wu5。e2luo2si1 hei1shou3dang3 zai4 ao4 de2 he2 -ni2 si1 he2 yan2xian4 jian4li4 le5 di4xia4 ren2kou3 fan4yun4 wang3luo4，er2 wo3men5 de5 ren4wu5 jiu4shi4 jiang1 qi2 cui1hui3。"

msgid ""
"Our next goal is to fully stock the library. \n"
"\n"
"With 350 nuyen, we could make the purchase. Whatever you could spare would be most appreciated."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​下​一个​目标​是​为​图书馆​配备​充足​的​图书​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​350​新円​的话​，​我们​就​能​完成​购买​。​无论​你​能​拿出​多少​，​我们​都​将​不胜感激​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 xia4 yi1ge5 mu4biao1 shi4 wei2 tu2shu1guan3 pei4bei4 chong1zu2 de5 tu2shu1。\n"
"\n"
"you3 350 xin1 yuan2 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 wan2cheng2 gou4mai3。wu2lun4 ni3 neng2 na2chu1 duo1shao3，wo3men5 dou1 jiang1 bu4 sheng4 gan3 ji1。"

msgid ""
"Our son's classmates come from affluent families. Even the least successful of Hans' peers has a pediatric Encephalon, and it ranges on up from there.\n"
"\n"
"The Academy grades on a curve. If we were to send Hans to school without any enhancements, we'd be setting him up for failure."
msgstr ""
"我们​儿子​的​同学​都​来自​富裕​家庭​。​哪怕​是​其中​那些​最​不​成功​的​同龄人​，​家里​至少​都​配有​儿科​专用​脑机​，​更​不用说​那些​条件​更​优渥​的​家庭​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​学院​采用​曲线​评分​制​。​如果​让​汉斯​不​安装​任何​增强​装置​就​入学​，​无异于​将​他​推向​失败​的​深渊​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 er2zi5 de5 tong2xue2 dou1 lai2zi4 fu4yu4 jia1ting2。na3pa4 shi4 qi2zhong1 na4xie1 zui4 bu4 cheng2gong1 de5 tong2ling2ren2，jia1li3 zhi4shao3 dou1 pei4you3 er2ke1 zhuan1yong4 nao3 ji1，geng1 bu4yong4shuo1 na4xie1 tiao2jian4 geng1 you1wo4 de5 jia1ting2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xue2yuan4 cai3yong4 qu1xian4 ping2fen1 zhi4。ru2guo3 rang4 han4si1 bu4 an1zhuang1 ren4he2 zeng1qiang2 zhuang1zhi4 jiu4 ru4xue2，wu2 yi4 yu2 jiang1 ta1 tui1 xiang4 shi1bai4 de5 shen1yuan1。"

msgid "Our troubles are over."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​麻烦​结束​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 de5 ma2fan5 jie2shu4 le5。"

