msgstr ""
"无法​行动\n"
"wu2fa3 xing2dong4"

msgid ""
"Out in the field, nothing will kill you faster than losing the respect of "
"your team."
msgstr ""
"在​战场​上​，​如果​连​你​手底下​的​人​都​不再​尊重​你​，​那​你​的​死期​就​不远​了​。\n"
"zai4 zhan4chang3 shang4，ru2guo3 lian2 ni3 shou3 de5 xia4 de5 ren2 dou1 bu4zai4 zun1zhong4 ni3，na4 ni3 de5 si3qi1 jiu4 bu4 yuan3 le5。"

msgid "Out of Ammo"
msgstr ""
"弹药​不足\n"
"dan4yao4 bu4zu2"

msgid "Out of curiosity, how did Meat Grinder even know that I'd be here?"
msgstr ""
"好奇​一问​，​“​绞肉机​”​怎么​知道​我会​在​这里​？\n"
"hao4qi2 yi1 wen4，“jiao3rou4ji1” zen3me5 zhi1dao4 wo3 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3？"

msgid ""
"Out of curiosity... why were you helping Humanis in the first place? You "
"must've known that they'd double-cross you."
msgstr ""
"我​想​问问​……​你​最初​为什么​要​帮​人类​至上​主义者​？​你​肯定​知道​他们​会​背叛​你​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wen4 wen4……ni3 zui4chu1 wei4shen2me5 yao4 bang1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3？ni3 ken3ding4 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 hui4 bei4pan4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Out of the corner of your eye, you can see Glory's back stiffen. She "
"flinches as though she's been stung."
msgstr ""
"透过​余光​，​你​看到​格洛丽​的​后背​突然​绷紧​了​。​她​缩​了​缩​身子​，​仿佛​被​毒虫​蜇​了​一般​。\n"
"tou4guo4 yu2guang1，ni3 kan4dao4 Ge2luo4li2 de5 hou4bei4 tu1ran2 beng1jin3 le5。ta1 suo1 le5 suo1 shen1zi5，fang3fu2 bei4 du2chong2 zhe1 le5 yi1ban1。"

msgid ""
"Out of your peripheral vision, you catch sight of a light flashing on the "
"door console next to you."
msgstr ""
"你​通过​余光​看到​旁边​的​大门​控制​台上​有​灯光​闪烁​。\n"
"ni3 tong1guo4 yu2guang1 kan4dao4 pang2bian1 de5 da4men2 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 you3 deng1guang1 shan3shuo4。"

msgid "Outfit"
msgstr ""
"外衣\n"
"wai4yi1"

msgid "Outfits"
msgstr ""
"外衣\n"
"wai4yi1"

msgid "Outgunned? Take another look, fool. Back down, or I will end you."
msgstr ""
"要​比​谁​火力​强​？​你​可​看清楚​点​吧​，​蠢货​。​退后​，​否则​我​一​枪崩​了​你​。\n"
"yao4 bi3 shei2 huo3li4 jiang4？ni3 ke3 kan4 qing1 chu3 dian3 ba1，chun3huo4。tui4hou4，fou3ze2 wo3 yi1 qiang1beng1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Outside of freak mana storms, the highest background counts ever recorded have come from places like Hiroshima and Auschwitz, which have been holding steady at a rating of 5 for as long as they've been measured.\n"
"\n"
"The conventional wisdom has always been that extraordinary circumstances create strong background counts. Incidents of great physical or emotional turmoil, be they positive or negative, can warp the magical environment of a place and cause its background count to rise."
msgstr ""
"除​异常​魔力​风暴​外​，​有史以来​最高​的​背景​数值​记录​出现​在​广岛​和​奥斯维辛​等​地​，​这些​地点​自​开始​监测​以来​始终​稳定​维持​在​5​级​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​传统​观点​认为​，​特殊​环境​会​引发​强烈​的​背景​数值​波动​。​无论是​积极​还是​消极​的​重大​物理​或​情感​动荡​事件​，​都​可能​扭曲​某地​的​魔法​环境​，​导致​其​背景​数值​上升​。\n"
"\n"
"chu2 yi4chang2 mo2li4 feng1bao4 wai4，you3shi3yi3lai2 zui4gao1 de5 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 ji4lu4 chu1xian4 zai4 guang3dao3 he4 ao4si1wei2xin1 deng3 de5，zhe4xie1 di4dian3 zi4 kai1shi3 jian1ce4 yi3lai2 shi3zhong1 wen3ding4 wei2chi2 zai4 5 ji2。\n"
"\n"
"chuan2tong3 guan1dian3 ren4wei2，te4shu1 huan2jing4 hui4 yin3fa1 qiang2lie4 de5 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 bo1dong4。wu2 lun2 shi4 ji1ji2 hai2shi5 xiao1ji2 de5 zhong4da4 wu4li3 huo4 qing2gan3 dong4dang4 shi4jian4，dou1 ke3neng2 niu3qu1 mou3di4 de5 mo2fa3 huan2jing4，dao3zhi4 qi2 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 shang4sheng1。"

msgid "Over here, boss!"
msgstr ""
"老大​，​在​这儿​呢​！\n"
"lao3da4，zai4 zhe4r5 ni2！"

msgid "Over my dead body."
msgstr ""
"有​本事​你​就​试试​。\n"
"you3 ben3shi4 ni3 jiu4 shi4 shi4。"

msgid "Over my dead body. "
msgstr ""
"有​本事​就​弄死​我​再说​。\n"
"you3 ben3shi4 jiu4 nong4si3 wo3 zai4shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Over the course of my employment, I've worked on a great many projects.\n"
"\n"
"From the innocuous to the obscene, my hands have touched it all."
msgstr ""
"在​我​任职期间​，​我​经手​过​形形色色​的​项目​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​无伤大雅​到​骇人听闻​的​各种​事件​，​我​都​曾​染指​过​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 ren4zhi2qi1jian1，wo3 jing1shou3 guo4 xing2xing2se4se4 de5 xiang4mu4。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 wu2shang1da4ya3 dao4 hai4ren2ting1wen2 de5 ge4zhong3 shi4jian4，wo3 dou1 ceng2 ran3zhi3 guo4。"

msgid ""
"Over the years that I was at Feuerstelle, the commune had easily doubled in size.\n"
"\n"
"It was thriving, all thanks to the efforts of Marta and the girls like her."
msgstr ""
"在​我​待​在​“​火坑​”​的​这些​年里​，​公社​的​规模​轻松​翻了一番​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​蓬勃发展​，​而​这​一切​都​归功于​玛​尔塔​和​像​她​这样​的​姑娘​们​的​努力​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 dai1 zai4“huo3keng1” de5 zhe4xie1 nian2 li3，gong1she4 de5 gui1mo2 qing1song1 fan1 le5 yi1 fan1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 peng2 bo2 fa1 zhan3，er2 zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 gui1 gong1 yu2 Ma3er3ta3 he4 xiang4 ta1 zhe4yang4 de5 gu1niang5 men5 de5 nu3li4。"

