msgstr ""
"警戒​射击​！\n"
"jing3jie4 she4ji1！"

msgid "Overwrite Save?"
msgstr ""
"覆盖​存档​？\n"
"fu4gai4 cun2dang4？"

msgid ""
"P... please! Just hear me out!\n"
"\n"
"I can help you... whatever you're getting paid, I can give you something better!"
msgstr ""
"求​、​求​你​了​！​听​我​说完​就​好​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​帮​你​……​不管​你​的​报酬​是​什么​，​我​都​能​给​你​更好​的​东西​！\n"
"\n"
"qiu2、qiu2 ni3 le5！ting1 wo3 shuo1 wan2 jiu4 hao3！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 bang1 ni3……bu4guan3 ni3 de5 bao4chou5 shi4 shen2me5，wo3 dou1 neng2 gei3 ni3 geng1 hao3 de5 dong1xi1！"

