msgid "PANZERDROHNE"
msgstr ""
"装甲​无人机\n"
"zhuang1jia3 wu2ren2ji1"

msgid ""
"PANZERDROHNE's single mechanical eye tracks your movements as you approach. "
"The massive bulk of the thing lends it an uncanny air as it hovers "
"effortlessly above the ground."
msgstr ""
"见​你​靠近​，​装甲​无人机​的​单​机械​眼​开始​追踪​你​的​动作​。​这​庞然大物​悬浮​在​地面​上方​时​毫不费力​，​为​其​更​增添​了​几分​诡异​气息​。\n"
"jian4 ni3 kao4jin4，zhuang1jia3 wu2ren2ji1 de5 dan1 ji1xie4 yan3 kai1shi3 zhui1zong1 ni3 de5 dong4zuo4。zhe4 pang2ran2da4wu4 xuan2fu2 zai4 di4mian4 shang4fang1 shi2 hao2bu4fei4li4，wei2 qi2 geng1 zeng1tian1 le5 ji3fen1 gui3yi4 qi4xi1。"

msgid ""
"PANZERDROHNE, new order: shatter the glass, but leave Vauclair alive. He has"
" some explaining to do."
msgstr ""
"装甲​无人机​，​新​命令​：​打碎​玻璃​，​但​不要​杀​了​沃​克莱尔​。​他​需要​解释一下​。\n"
"zhuang1jia3 wu2ren2ji1，xin1 ming4ling4：da3sui4 bo1li5，dan4 bu4yao4 sha1 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3。ta1 xu1yao4 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4。"

msgid ""
"PARAZOOLOGICAL THREATS: THE RISING TIDE\n"
"October 10, 2055\n"
"\n"
"I'm standing in the laboratory of Dr. Jacob Okinyi, head zoologist at the Institute of Primate Research in Karen, Kenya.\n"
"\n"
"Strapped to a reinforced examination table is a creature unlike anything I've ever seen. The thing is approximately the size and shape of a gibbon, but it has six mouths arranged in a ring around a pale, grub-like head. It's disgusting."
msgstr ""
"寄生​动物​威胁​：​汹涌​来袭​\n"
"​2055​年​10​月​10​日​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​正​站​在​肯尼亚​卡伦​灵长类​研究所​首席​动物学家​雅各布​·​奥​基尼​博士​的​实验室​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一张​加固​检查​台上​固定​着​一只​前所未见​的​生物​。​这​东西​体型​与​长臂猿​相仿​，​但​苍白​如​蛴螬​的​头部​周围​环绕着​六个​口器​。​令人作呕​。\n"
"\n"
"ji4sheng1 dong4wu4 wei1xie2：xiong1yong3 lai2xi2 \n"
"2055 nian2 10 yue4 10 ri4 \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng1 zhan4 zai4 ken3ni2ya4 ka3 lun2 ling2zhang3lei4 yan2jiu1suo3 shou3xi2 dong4 wu4 xue2 jia1 ya3 ge4 bu4 · ao4 ji1 ni2 bo2shi4 de5 shi2yan4shi4 li3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 zhang1 jia1gu4 jian3cha2 tai2shang4 gu4ding4 zhao2 yi1 zhi3 qian2suo3wei4jian4 de5 sheng1wu4。zhe4 dong1xi1 ti3xing2 yu4 chang2bi4yuan2 xiang1fang3，dan4 cang1bai2 ru2 qi2cao2 de5 tou2bu4 zhou1wei2 huan2 rao4 zhao2 liu4 ge4 kou3qi4。ling3 ren2 zuo4 ou3。"

msgid ""
"PASSION. The final cornerstone. Complacency is poison - be wary of it. Ambition is the key to a fulfilling life.\n"
"\n"
"Don't settle for What Is... if you do, you abandon What Could Be."
msgstr ""
"激情​。​最后​的​基石​。​自满​是​毒药​—​—​要​警惕​它​。​野心​是​成就​人生​的​关键​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不要​满足​于​现状​……​如果​你​这样​做​，​你​就​放弃​了​可能​实现​的​成就​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1qing2。zui4hou4 de5 ji1shi2。zi4man3 shi4 du2yao4——yao4 jing3ti4 ta1。ye3xin1 shi4 cheng2jiu4 ren2sheng1 de5 guan1jian4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 man3zu2 yu2 xian4zhuang4……ru2guo3 ni3 zhe4yang4 zuo4，ni3 jiu4 fang4qi4 le5 ke3neng2 shi2xian4 de5 cheng2jiu4。"

msgid ""
"PASSION. The final cornerstone. Complacency is poison - be wary of it. Ambition is the key to a fulfilling life.\n"
"\n"
"Don't settle for what is... if you do, you abandon what could be."
msgstr ""
"激情​。​最后​的​基石​。​自满​是​毒药​—​—​务必​警惕​。​野心​是​成就​充实​人生​的​关键​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不要​满足​于​现状​……​否则​，​便是​放弃​了​人生​的​无限​可能​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1qing2。zui4hou4 de5 ji1shi2。zi4man3 shi4 du2yao4——wu4bi4 jing3ti4。ye3xin1 shi4 cheng2jiu4 chong1shi2 ren2sheng1 de5 guan1jian4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 man3zu2 yu2 xian4zhuang4……fou3ze2，bian4shi4 fang4qi4 le5 ren2sheng1 de5 wu2xian4 ke3neng2。"

