"保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​：​好​的​，​施密特​先生​。​您​有​业务​要​委托​给​我​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​访客​：​是​的​。​我​这里​有件​差事​……​是​件​简单​的​工作​。​根据​我​对​贵​团队​的​了解​，​想必​他们​定​能​胜任​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​：​请​继续​。\n"
"\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3：hao3 de5，shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5。nin2 you3 ye4wu4 yao4 wei3tuo1 gei3 wo3？\n"
"\n"
"fang3ke4：shi4 de5。wo3 zhe4li3 you3 jian4 cha4shi4……shi4 jian4 jian3dan1 de5 gong1zuo4。gen1ju4 wo3 dui4 gui4 tuan2dui4 de5 liao3jie3，xiang3bi4 ta1men5 ding4 neng2 sheng4ren4。\n"
"\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3：qing3 ji4xu4。"

msgid ""
"P_AMSEL: Very well. I will pass your offer on to my team. Are there any further details that you can provide?\n"
"\n"
"GUEST: Haushofer's office will be locked behind a vault door. The lock is old-fashioned, of the mechanical variety. I will provide your team with a copy of the key.\n"
"\n"
"GUEST: I will also supply you with a \"little black box\"... a solid-state device that your team can use to override a variety of building systems."
msgstr ""
"保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​：​好​吧​，​我会​将​您​的​提议​转达​给​团队​。​您​能​提供​更​多​细节​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​访客​：​豪斯​霍​菲尔​的​办公室​设有​一道​保险门​，​是​老式​的​机械锁​。​我会​为贵​团队​提供​备用​钥匙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​访客​：​我​还​会​提供​一个​“​小​黑盒​”​……​这件​固态​设备​可​帮助​贵​团队​超控​大楼​内部​的​各项​系统​。\n"
"\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3：hao3 ba1，wo3 hui4 jiang1 nin2 de5 ti2yi4 zhuan3da2 gei3 tuan2dui4。nin2 neng2 ti2gong1 geng1 duo1 xi4jie2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"fang3ke4：hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3 de5 ban4gong1shi4 she4you3 yi1dao4 bao3 xian3 men2，shi4 lao3shi4 de5 ji1 xie4 suo3。wo3 hui4 wei2 gui4 tuan2dui4 ti2gong1 bei4yong4 yao4shi5。\n"
"\n"
"fang3ke4：wo3 hai2 hui4 ti2gong1 yi1ge5“xiao3 hei1he2”……zhe4 jian4 gu4tai4 she4bei4 ke3 bang1zhu4 gui4 tuan2dui4 chao1 kong4 da4lou2 nei4bu4 de5 ge4 xiang4 xi4tong3。"

msgid ""
"P_AMSEL: Very well. I will pass your offer on to my team. Are there any further details that you can provide?\n"
"\n"
"GUEST: Haushofer's office will be locked behind a vault door. The lock is old-fashioned, of the mechanical variety. I will provide your team with a copy of the key.\n"
"\n"
"GUEST: I will also supply you with a solid-state device that your team can use to override building security. This will provide them with access to the building's surveillance camera feeds and control over the main service elevator."
msgstr ""
"保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​：​很​好​，​我会​将​您​的​提议​转达​给​团队​。​您​能​提供​更​多​细节​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​访客​：​豪斯​霍​菲尔​的​办公室​设有​一道​保险门​，​是​老式​的​机械锁​。​我会​为​团队​提供​钥匙​的​副本​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​访客​：​我​还​会​提供​一个​固态​设备​，​你​的​团队​可以​用​它​来​篡改​大楼​内部​的​安保​系统​。​此举​能​让​他们​访问​大楼​的​监控​画面​，​控制​主​电梯​。\n"
"\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3：hen3 hao3，wo3 hui4 jiang1 nin2 de5 ti2yi4 zhuan3da2 gei3 tuan2dui4。nin2 neng2 ti2gong1 geng1 duo1 xi4jie2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"fang3ke4：hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3 de5 ban4gong1shi4 she4you3 yi1dao4 bao3 xian3 men2，shi4 lao3shi4 de5 ji1 xie4 suo3。wo3 hui4 wei2 tuan2dui4 ti2gong1 yao4shi5 de5 fu4ben3。\n"
"\n"
"fang3ke4：wo3 hai2 hui4 ti2gong1 yi1ge5 gu4tai4 she4bei4，ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 ke3yi3 yong4 ta1 lai2 cuan4gai3 da4lou2 nei4bu4 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3。ci3 ju3 neng2 rang4 ta1men5 fang3wen4 da4lou2 de5 jian1kong4 hua4mian4，kong4zhi4 zhu3 dian4ti1。"

msgid ""
"P_AMSEL: Very well. Please describe the work that you would like to have done.\n"
"\n"
"GUEST: Straight to the point. I like that. Very well.\n"
"\n"
"GUEST: I would like to retain your team's services to clean up a mess."
