msgid ""
"Paranatural disasters, like the mana rift that consumed Sydney. Widespread madness. And most terribly, the appearance of dangerous new paranormal life-forms.\n"
"\n"
"Predators that couldn't survive in mana-poor environments are flooding into our world. And as the mana level continues to rise, larger and more dangerous things are appearing."
msgstr ""
"超自然​灾难​，​比如​吞噬​了​悉尼​的​魔力​裂隙​。​大规模​的​疯狂​蔓延​。​最​可怕​的​是​，​危险​的​新型​超自然​生命体​开始​出现​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​无法​在​魔力​贫瘠​环境​中​生存​的​掠​食者​正​涌入​我们​的​世界​。​随着​魔力​水平​持续​攀升​，​体型​更大​、​更​危险​的​生物​正​不断​出现​。\n"
"\n"
"chao1zi4ran2 zai1nan4，bi3ru2 tun1shi4 le5 xi1ni2 de5 mo2li4 lie4xi4。da4gui1mo2 de5 feng1kuang2 man4yan2。zui4 ke3pa4 de5 shi4，wei1xian3 de5 xin1xing2 chao1zi4ran2 sheng1 ming4 ti3 kai1shi3 chu1xian4。\n"
"\n"
