"pa4 sen1 zi3xi4 yan2jiu1 zhao2 bu4jian4，xiao4rong2 xiao1shi1 le5 pian4ke4。ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2，quan2shen2guan4zhu4 de5 si1kao3 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"Part of me wants to kill her. She's the reason why a lot of kids wound up here - including me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She grits her teeth, and the razors flick out of her fingertips. A second later, she retracts them.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But... there isn't time. This isn't what we're here for."
msgstr ""
"我​内心​的​一部分​想要​杀​了​她​。​都​是因为​她​，​才​让​那么​多​孩子​沦落​至此​—​—​其中​也​包括​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​面色​阴沉​，​指间​的​利刃​弹​出​，​又​在​一秒​后​收回​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​……​现在​还​不是​时候​。​这​不是​我们​来​这里​的​目的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 nei4xin1 de5 yi1bu4fen5 xiang3yao4 sha1 le5 ta1。dou1 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1，cai2 rang4 na4me5 duo1 hai2zi5 lun2luo4 zhi4ci3——qi2zhong1 ye3 bao1kuo4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mian4se4 yin1chen2，zhi3 jian1 de5 li4ren4 dan4 chu1，you4 zai4 yi1 miao3 hou4 shou1hui2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4……xian4zai4 hai2 bu4shi4 shi2hou5。zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid ""
"Part of me wants to kill her. She's the reason why a lot of kids wound up here - including me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She scowls, and the razors flick out of her fingertips. A second later, she retracts them.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...We deal with her *later,* though. I won't hurt any more kids voluntarily."
msgstr ""
"我​内心​的​一部分​想要​杀​了​她​。​都​是因为​她​，​才​让​那么​多​孩子​沦落​至此​—​—​其中​也​包括​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​面色​阴沉​，​指间​的​利刃​弹​出​，​又​在​一秒​后​收回​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
