"bei4dong4 xiao4guo3：gai1 xiu1shi4 hu4 jia3 zhi2 zeng1jia1 2 dian3。zhu3dong4 xiao4guo3：gai1 xiu1shi4 hu4 jia3 zhi2 e2wai4 zeng1jia1 2 dian3，chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

