msgid ""
"Patching into the drone's OS via your remote control rig is simple enough, but you run into a hitch: whoever set this thing up seems to have installed a number of antitheft safeguards to prevent unauthorized access.\n"
"\n"
"You could attempt to slip past them, but there's no telling what'll happen if you trip one."
msgstr ""
"通过​遥控​设备​接入​无人机​操作系统​本身​并​不​复杂​，​但​你​很快​就​遇到​了​问题​：​配置​这台​设备​的​人​似乎​安装​了​多项​防盗​安全措施​，​以​防止​未经​授权​的​访问​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​尝试​绕过​这些​安全措施​，​但​一旦​触发​其中​任何​一项​，​后果​将​难以预料​。\n"
"\n"
"tong1guo4 yao2kong4 she4bei4 jie1ru4 wu2ren2ji1 cao1zuo4xi4tong3 ben3shen1 bing4 bu4 fu4za2，dan4 ni3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 yu4dao4 le5 wen4ti2：pei4zhi4 zhe4 tai2 she4bei4 de5 ren2 si4hu1 an1zhuang1 le5 duo1 xiang4 fang2dao4 an1quan2cuo4shi1，yi3 fang2zhi3 wei4jing1 shou4quan2 de5 fang3wen4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 chang2shi4 rao4guo4 zhe4xie1 an1quan2cuo4shi1，dan4 yi1dan4 chu4fa1 qi2zhong1 ren4he2 yi1 xiang4，hou4guo3 jiang1 nan2 yi3 yu4 liao4。"

