msgid "Paul Amsel"
msgstr ""
"保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3"

msgid ""
"Paul Amsel is my representative in these matters. Why couldn't you tell all "
"of this to him?"
msgstr ""
"保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔是​我​在​这些​事务​上​的​代理人​。​你​为什么​不​直接​把​这些​告诉​他​？\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 shi4 wo3 zai4 zhe4xie1 shi4wu4 shang4 de5 dai4li3ren2。ni3 wei4shen2me5 bu4 zhi2jie1 ba3 zhe4xie1 gao4su4 ta1？"

