msgstr ""
"保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔说​记​在​他​帐​上​。\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 shuo1 ji4 zai4 ta1 zhang4 shang4。"

msgid "Paul Amsel sends his regards."
msgstr ""
"保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔向​你​问好​。\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 xiang4 ni3 wen4hao3。"

msgid ""
"Paul is always pleased to send business your way, Herr Burakgazi. He was "
"hoping you could discuss some of the details of his \"Green Winters order\" "
"with me."
msgstr ""
"保罗​向来​乐于​把​生意​引荐​给​你​，​布拉加​齐​先生​。​他​希望​你​能​和​我​商讨​一下​关于​“​格林​·​温特斯​订单​”​的​具体​细节​。\n"
"bao3luo2 xiang4lai2 le4yu2 ba3 sheng1yi4 yin3jian4 gei3 ni3，bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 xian1sheng5。ta1 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 he4 wo3 shang1tao3 yi1xia4 guan1yu2“ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 ding4dan1” de5 ju4ti3 xi4jie2。"

msgid ""
"Paul's lifeless body lies crumpled on the floor. The majority of his head "
"has been splattered across the opposite wall."
msgstr ""
"保罗​了​无生气​的​尸体​瘫倒​在​地​。​他​的​脑袋​大部分​都​溅射​在​了​对面​的​墙上​。\n"
"bao3luo2 le5 wu2 sheng1 qi4 de5 shi1ti3 tan1 dao3 zai4 de5。ta1 de5 nao3dai5 da4bu4fen5 dou1 jian4she4 zai4 le5 dui4mian4 de5 qiang2 shang4。"

msgid ""
"Paul. A talented and well-connected fixer, with contacts all over Berlin.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He's more to me than that, of course. But that's neither here nor there."
msgstr ""
"保罗​。​一个​富有​才能​、​人​脉​广泛​的​中间人​，​在​柏林​各处​都​有​关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​他​对​我​而言​不止​于​此​。​但​这​不是​重点​。\n"
"\n"
"bao3luo2。yi1ge5 fu4you3 cai2neng2、ren2 mai4 guang3fan4 de5 zhong1jian1ren2，zai4 bo2lin2 ge4chu4 dou1 you3 guan1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，ta1 dui4 wo3 er2yan2 bu4zhi3 yu2 ci3。dan4 zhe4 bu4shi4 chong2dian3。"

msgid "Paul..."
msgstr ""
"保罗​……\n"
"bao3luo2……"

msgid "Paul? PAUL!"
msgstr ""
"保罗​？​保罗​！\n"
"bao3luo2？bao3luo2！"

msgid "Paused"
msgstr ""
"暂停\n"
"zan4ting2"

msgid ""
"Payback isn't the only reason why we need to find him. We saw something back there... something that we weren't supposed to see.\n"
"\n"
"It's fair to assume that we're all still in danger."
msgstr ""
"复仇​并非​我们​追捕​他​的​唯一​动机​。​我们​在​那里​目睹​了​某些​东西​……​某些​不该​我们​看见​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可以​肯定​的​是​，​我们​所有人​仍​身处​险境​。\n"
"\n"
"fu4chou2 bing4fei1 wo3men5 zhui1bu3 ta1 de5 wei2yi1 dong4ji1。wo3men5 zai4 na4li5 mu4du3 le5 mou3xie1 dong1xi1……mou3xie1 bu4gai1 wo3men5 kan4jian4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ke3yi3 ken3ding4 de5 shi4，wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 reng2 shen1chu3 xian3jing4。"

