msgid ""
"Payload in place, Jana goes back to work. It only takes a few minutes for her to screw, wire, and solder the canister into the harness. \n"
"\n"
"She inspects her work, nods, and turns to face you."
msgstr ""
"东西​就位​之后​，​简娜​又​继续​开始​工作​。​她​仅​用​几分钟​就​完成​了​罐体​的​螺钉​固定​、​线缆​连接​和​焊接​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​检查​了​自己​的​成果​，​点点头​，​转身​面对​你​。\n"
"\n"
"dong1xi1 jiu4 wei4 zhi1hou4，Jian3na4 you4 ji4xu4 kai1shi3 gong1zuo4。ta1 jin3 yong4 ji1 fen4 zhong1 jiu4 wan2cheng2 le5 guan4 ti3 de5 luo2ding1 gu4ding4、xian4lan3 lian2jie1 he4 han4jie1 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jian3cha2 le5 zi4ji3 de5 cheng2guo3，dian3 dian3 tou2，zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 ni3。"

msgid "Pebble"
msgstr ""
"卵石\n"
"luan3shi2"

msgid ""
"Peeling back a patch of matted hair, you find something that a casual viewer would have missed: the man had a chipjack. It's a cheap model, sufficient for loading simsense chips and BTLs, but little else.\n"
"\n"
"It doesn't take much effort for you to pry it open."
msgstr ""
"拨开​一​绺​缠结​的​头发​，​你​发现​了​一处​普通人​可能​不会​注意​到​的​细节​：​这个​人有​一个​芯片​插口​。​这​是​个​廉价​型号​，​仅够​用于​安装​拟感​芯片​和​BTL​，​除此之外​别​无​他​用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​稍加​用力​便​将​其​撬开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bo1kai1 yi1 liu3 chan2jie2 de5 tou2fa5，ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 chu3 pu3tong1ren2 ke3neng2 bu4hui4 zhu4yi4 dao4 de5 xi4jie2：zhe4ge5 ren2 you3 yi1ge5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3。zhe4 shi4 ge4 lian2jia4 xing2hao4，jin3 gou4 yong4yu2 an1zhuang1 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4 he4 BTL，chu2ci3zhi1wai4 bie4 wu2 ta1 yong4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shao1 jia1 yong4li4 bian4 jiang1 qi2 qiao4kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Peering at the corpse's face, you confirm what you'd already suspected: The "
"twisted body on the floor is Green Winters."
msgstr ""
"你​凝视着​尸体​的​脸庞​，​证实​了​早已​心知肚明​的​真相​：​地板​上​扭曲​的​尸体​正是​格林​·​温特斯​。\n"
"ni3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 shi1ti3 de5 lian3pang2，zheng4shi2 le5 zao3yi3 xin1zhi1du4ming2 de5 zhen1xiang4：di4ban3 shang4 niu3qu1 de5 shi1ti3 zheng4shi4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。"

msgid "Penthouse Console"
msgstr ""
"顶层​公寓​控制台\n"
"ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 kong4zhi4tai2"

msgid "Penthouse Door"
msgstr ""
"顶层​公寓​大门\n"
"ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 da4men2"

