msgstr ""
"顶层​公寓​房门​控制台\n"
"ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 fang2men2 kong4zhi4tai2"

msgid "Penthouse Maintenance Code"
msgstr ""
"顶层​公寓​维护​密码\n"
"ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 wei2hu4 mi4ma3"

msgid ""
"People were saying you were going off to do something dangerous. Or more dangerous than usual, I guess. They weren't sure you'd live through it, or if you'd come back even if you did.\n"
"\n"
"But I knew you'd be back."
msgstr ""
"人们​都​说​你​要​去​做​某件​危险​的​事​。​或者说​比​平时​更​危险​的​事​。​他们​不​确定​你​能否​活着​回来​，​就算​活着​回来​，​也​不​确定​你​是否​还会​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​知道​你​肯定​会​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2men5 dou1 shuo1 ni3 yao4 qu4 zuo4 mou3 jian4 wei1xian3 de5 shi4。huo4 zhe3 shuo1 bi3 ping2shi2 geng1 wei1xian3 de5 shi4。ta1men5 bu4 que4ding4 ni3 neng2fou3 huo2zhe5 hui2lai5，jiu4suan4 huo2zhe5 hui2lai5，ye3 bu4 que4ding4 ni3 shi4fou3 hai2 hui4 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 ken3ding4 hui4 hui2lai5。"

msgid "Perfect."
msgstr ""
"这下​可好​。\n"
"zhe4xia4 ke3hao3。"

msgid "Perhaps a little less safe now."
msgstr ""
"也许​现在​不​那么​安全​了​。\n"
"ye3xu3 xian4zai4 bu4 na4me5 an1quan2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Perhaps it is not too late.\n"
"\n"
"Sleep… sleep would bring healing.\n"
"\n"
"My nest… "
msgstr ""
"也许​还​不晚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​长眠​……​长眠​能​带来​治疗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​巢穴​……\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 hai2 bu4 wan3。\n"
"\n"
"chang2mian2……chang2mian2 neng2 dai4lai2 zhi4liao2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 chao2xue2……"

msgid ""
"Perhaps not in this cycle of the world. Perhaps not the next. But one day, one wyrm will stand alone - triumphant. \n"
"\n"
"With all of humanity as its cattle. With all the world as its prize. \n"
"\n"
"And that... "
msgstr ""
"或许​不是​在​世界​的​这​一代​。​或许​也​不​在​下一代​。​但​总有一天​，​某条​巨龙​将​独占鳌头​，​赢取​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​将​全人类​视为​其​牧群​。​将​整个​世界​视为​其​战利品​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​这件​事​……\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 bu4shi4 zai4 shi4jie4 de5 zhe4 yi1dai4。huo4xu3 ye3 bu4 zai4 xia4yi1dai4。dan4 zong3 you3 yi1 tian1，mou3 tiao2 ju4long2 jiang1 du2zhan4ao2tou2，ying2 qu3 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"jiang1 quan2 ren2 lei4 shi4wei2 qi2 mu4qun2。jiang1 zheng3ge4 shi4jie4 shi4wei2 qi2 zhan4li4pin3。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4 jian4 shi4……"

msgid ""
"Perhaps your employer and I could do business in the future, Herr Brackhaus."
msgstr ""
"也许​将来​你​的​雇主​可以​和​我​合作​，​布拉克​豪斯​先生​。\n"
"ye3xu3 jiang1lai2 ni3 de5 gu4zhu3 ke3yi3 he4 wo3 he2zuo4，bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1 xian1sheng5。"

msgid ""
"Perhaps. One might assume that the outcome could have been better suited to his interests.\n"
"\n"
"But, then again, perhaps not. You are not in a position to know."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​有人​会​认为​，​结果​本​可以​更​符合​他​的​利益​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​话说回来​，​说不定​也​未必​呢​。​你​根本​无从​知晓​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。you3ren2 hui4 ren4wei2，jie1guo3 ben3 ke3yi3 geng1 fu2he2 ta1 de5 li4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，shuo1bu5ding4 ye3 wei4bi4 ni2。ni3 gen1ben3 wu2cong2 zhi1xiao3。"

msgid ""
"Perhaps. Perhaps I am… but for one difference. \n"
"\n"
"I am a man. \n"
"\n"
"I am finite."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​……​但​有​一点​不同​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​人类​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​生命​是​有限​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1……dan4 you3 yi1dian3 bu4tong2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 ren2lei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 sheng1ming4 shi4 you3xian4 de5。"

msgid "Persona"
msgstr ""
"人格\n"
"ren2ge2"

msgid "Personal Terminal"
msgstr ""
"个人​终端\n"
"ge4ren2 zhong1duan1"

msgid ""
"Personally, I feel that calling the Adversary a \"devil\" is an oversimplification of the truth. It is both more, and less, than Christian doctrine would have you believe.\n"
"\n"
"But this is a question for the philosophers."
msgstr ""
"依​我​之​见​，​将​反叛者​称为​“​魔鬼​”​是​对​真相​的​过分​简化​。​它​既​超越​了​基督教​教义​所​宣称​的​范畴​，​又​未​完全符合​其​描述​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这个​问题​要​交由​哲学家​们​去​考虑​了​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wo3 zhi1 jian4，jiang1 fan3 pan4 zhe3 cheng1wei2“mo2gui3” shi4 dui4 zhen1xiang4 de5 guo4fen4 jian3hua4。ta1 ji4 chao1yue4 le5 ji1du1jiao4 jiao4yi4 suo3 xuan1cheng1 de5 fan4chou2，you4 wei4 wan2 quan2 fu2 ge3 qi2 miao2shu4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2 yao4 jiao1you2 zhe2xue2jia1 men5 qu4 kao3lu:4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Personally? The true kind. But I sell goods tailored to all traditions; in "
"my shop, we do not discriminate."
msgstr ""
"就​我​个人​而言​，​我​只​修习​真正​的​魔法​。​但​本店​出售​适合​所有​传统​的​魔法​用品​，​我们​从不​歧视​任何​流派​。\n"
"jiu4 wo3 ge4ren2 er2yan2，wo3 zhi3 xiu1xi2 zhen1zheng4 de5 mo2fa3。dan4 ben3 dian4 chu1shou4 shi4he2 suo3you3 chuan2tong3 de5 mo2fa3 yong4pin3，wo3men5 cong2bu4 qi2shi4 ren4he2 liu2pai4。"

msgid "Perspective"
msgstr ""
"透视​投影\n"
"tou4shi4 tou2ying3"

msgid "Pestilence"
msgstr ""
"瘟疫\n"
"wen1yi4"

msgid "Petrified: All AP Lost"
msgstr ""
"石化​：​损失​所有​行动​点\n"
"shi2hua4：sun3shi1 suo3you3 xing2dong4 dian3"

msgid "Petrify"
msgstr ""
"石化\n"
"shi2hua4"

msgid ""
"Pfeh!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He spits on the ground.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And you just let them get away with this?"
msgstr ""
"啧​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他朝​地面​啐​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​就​这么​把​他们​放走​了​？\n"
"\n"
"ze2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 di4mian4 cui4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 zhe4me5 ba3 ta1men5 fang4zou3 le5？"

msgid "Phil"
msgstr ""
"菲尔\n"
"fei1 er3"

msgid "Philip Rex"
msgstr ""
"菲利普​·​雷克斯\n"
"fei1li4pu3 · lei2ke4si1"

msgid ""
"Philip says nothing.\n"
"\n"
"The video continues to play for a time, then cuts to static."
msgstr ""
"菲利普​依然​沉默不语​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​继续​播放​了​一会儿​，​随后​切换​成​了​雪花​屏​。\n"
"\n"
"fei1li4pu3 yi1ran2 chen2 mo4 bu4 yu3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 ji4xu4 bo1fang4 le5 yi1hui4r5，sui2hou4 qie1huan4 cheng2 le5 xue3hua1 bing3。"

msgid ""
"Philip stares, glassy-eyed, as the show begins. The synthesized music "
"blares."
msgstr ""
"随着​节目​开始​，​合成​音乐​响彻​整个​房间​，​菲利普​呆滞​地​盯​着​屏幕​，​眼神​空洞​无​神​。\n"
"sui2zhe5 jie2mu4 kai1shi3，he2cheng2 yin1yue4 xiang3che4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1，fei1li4pu3 dai1zhi4 de5 ding1 zhao2 ping2mu4，yan3shen2 kong1dong4 wu2 shen2。"

msgid ""
"Philip turns and steps out of camera range. The drone is joined by two others, which wait in a holding position facing the camera.\n"
"\n"
"The picture breaks into static, and the video feed cuts off."
msgstr ""
"菲利普​转身​走出​了​摄像头​的​视野​范围​。​那架​无人机​得到​了​两架​同伴​的​支援​，​它们​停​在​一个​待命​位置​，​面朝​摄像头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​画面​逐渐​变成​雪花​屏​，​视频信号​随之​中断​。\n"
"\n"
"fei1li4pu3 zhuan3shen1 zou3chu1 le5 she4xiang4tou2 de5 shi4ye3 fan4wei2。na4 jia4 wu2ren2ji1 de2dao4 le5 liang3 jia4 tong2ban4 de5 zhi1yuan2，ta1men5 ting2 zai4 yi1ge5 dai4ming4 wei4zhi5，mian4 chao2 she4xiang4tou2。\n"
"\n"
"hua4mian4 zhu2jian4 bian4cheng2 xue3hua1 bing3，shi4 pin2 xin4 hao4 sui2zhi1 zhong1duan4。"

msgid ""
"Philip's lips move silently, mouthing the words as they are spoken. "
"Evidently, he has committed the entire script to memory."
msgstr ""
"菲利普​的​嘴唇​无声​地动​着​，​随着​台词​的​发音​一字不漏​地​复述​着​。​显然​，​他​已经​将​整部​剧​的​台词​烂熟​于心​了​。\n"
"fei1li4pu3 de5 zui3chun2 wu2sheng1 di4dong4 zhao2，sui2zhe5 tai2ci2 de5 fa1yin1 yi1zi4bu4lou4 de5 fu4shu4 zhao2。xian3ran2，ta1 yi3jing1 jiang1 zheng3 bu4 ju4 de5 tai2ci2 lan4shu2 yu2 xin1 le5。"

msgid "Phone Booth"
msgstr ""
"电话亭\n"
"dian4hua4ting2"

msgid "Phosgene"
msgstr ""
"光气\n"
"guang1qi4"

msgid "Phosgene Gas"
msgstr ""
"光成气\n"
"guang1 cheng2 qi4"

msgid ""
"Phosgene-related deaths are generally caused by the interaction of the gas "
"and the proteins of the pulmonary alveoli. The end result of this "
"interaction is the destruction of the blood-air barrier, preventing the "
"transmission of oxygen to the blood. Death by suffocation inevitably "
"follows."
msgstr ""
"光气​致死​通常​是​由于​气体​与​肺泡​蛋白质​发生​反应​，​最终​破坏​血气​屏障​，​阻碍​氧气​向​血液​传输​，​导致​窒息​性​死亡​。\n"
"guang1qi4 zhi4si3 tong1chang2 shi4 you2yu2 qi4ti3 yu4 fei4pao4 dan4bai2zhi4 fa1sheng1 fan3ying4，zui4zhong1 po4huai4 xue4qi4 ping2zhang4，zu3ai4 yang3qi4 xiang4 xue4ye4 chuan2shu1，dao3zhi4 zhi4xi1 xing4 si3wang2。"

msgid "Phosphorus Grenade"
msgstr ""
"白磷​手榴弹\n"
"bai2lin2 shou3liu2dan4"

msgid "Photo"
msgstr ""
"照片\n"
"zhao4pian4"

msgid "Physical Adept"
msgstr ""
"肉体​修士\n"
"rou4ti3 xiu1shi4"

msgid "Pick Up"
msgstr ""
"拾取\n"
"shi2qu3"

msgid "Pinned: Cannot Move"
msgstr ""
"钉住​：​无法​移动\n"
"ding4 zhu4：wu2fa3 yi2dong4"

msgid "Pinning Hit"
msgstr ""
"钉​刺​之击\n"
"ding4 ci1 zhi1 ji1"

msgid ""
"Pinning Hit: Blades can pin the target, rendering them unable to move for 2 "
"turns. HP DMG -2, Armor Piercing +4. Cooldown: 2"
msgstr ""
"钉​刺​之击​：​飞刀​可以​钉住​目标​，​使​其​在​2​回合​内​无法​移动​。​生命​值​伤害​减少​2​点​。​最​多​提供​4​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"ding4 ci1 zhi1 ji1：fei1dao1 ke3yi3 ding4 zhu4 mu4biao1，shi3 qi2 zai4 2 hui2he2 nei4 wu2fa3 yi2dong4。sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 2 dian3。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 4 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid ""
"Pins the target, rendering them unable to move for 2 turns. HP DMG reduced "
"by 2. Pierces up to 4 Armor."
msgstr ""
"钉住​目标​，​使​其​2​回合​内​无法​移动​。​生命​值​伤害​减少​2​点​。​最​多​提供​4​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"ding4 zhu4 mu4biao1，shi3 qi2 2 hui2he2 nei4 wu2fa3 yi2dong4。sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 2 dian3。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 4 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid ""
"Pissing him off can't be worth it.\n"
"\n"
"And at the very least, you won't be able to get good coffee in this town again. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She grins cheekily.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"惹怒​他​绝对​不是​明智​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​最起码​，​你​在​这座​城市​里​再也​喝​不到​好​咖啡​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​调皮​一笑​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"re3nu4 ta1 jue2dui4 bu4shi4 ming2zhi4 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 zui4 qi3 ma3，ni3 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 li3 zai4ye3 he4 bu4dao4 hao3 ka1fei1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tiao2pi2 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Pissing him off can't be worth it.\n"
"\n"
"And at the very least, you won't be able to get good coffee in this town again. {{GM}}She grins cheekily.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"惹怒​他​绝对​不是​明智​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​最起码​，​你​在​这座​城市​里​再也​喝​不到​好​咖啡​了​。​{{GM}}​她​调皮​一笑​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"re3nu4 ta1 jue2dui4 bu4shi4 ming2zhi4 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 zui4 qi3 ma3，ni3 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 li3 zai4ye3 he4 bu4dao4 hao3 ka1fei1 le5。{{GM}} ta1 tiao2pi2 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Pissy tonight, aren't we?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, I'll make this quick."
msgstr ""
"看来​我们​今晚​心情​都​不大好​啊​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那行​吧​，​我​长话短说​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3men5 jin1wan3 xin1qing2 dou1 bu4 dai4 hao3 a1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 xing2 ba1，wo3 chang2hua4duan3shuo1。"

msgid "Pistol"
msgstr ""
"手枪\n"
"shou3qiang1"

msgid "Pistol Specialist I"
msgstr ""
"手枪​专家​I\n"
"shou3qiang1 zhuan1jia1 I"

msgid "Pistol Specialist II"
msgstr ""
"手枪​专家​II\n"
"shou3qiang1 zhuan1jia1 II"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A Remington favorite. Shotgun punch and spread in a heavy-pistol-"
"sized package. Short range but wide spread."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​雷明顿​偏爱​的​款式​。​重型​手枪​尺寸​的​散弹枪​。​射程​较​短​，​但​散射​范围​大​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：lei2 ming2 dun4 pian1ai4 de5 kuan3shi4。zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1 chi3cun5 de5 san3dan4qiang1。she4cheng2 jiao4 duan3，dan4 san3she4 fan4wei2 dai4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A cheap, common pistol. Mass-produced to keep the cost minimal."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一款​廉价​的​普通​手枪​。​为​控制​成本​而​批量生产​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 kuan3 lian2jia4 de5 pu3tong1 shou3qiang1。wei2 kong4zhi4 cheng2ben3 er2 pi1liang4sheng1chan3。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A common machine pistol. Has limited stopping power but fires bursts"
" from a large clip."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一款​常见​的​冲锋​手枪​。​杀伤力​有限​，​但​大容量​弹匣​提供​的​持续​火力​弥补​了​这​一点​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 kuan3 chang2jian4 de5 chong1feng1 shou3qiang1。sha1shang1li4 you3xian4，dan4 da4rong2liang4 dan4xia2 ti2gong1 de5 chi2xu4 huo3li4 mi2bu3 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A heavy pistol created to perform under the most extreme situations."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一款​专​为​极端​情况​设计​的​重型​手枪​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 kuan3 zhuan1 wei2 ji2duan1 qing2kuang4 she4ji4 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A heavy pistol created to perform under the most extreme situations."
" Includes a Smartlink for greater accuracy."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一款​专​为​极端​情况​设计​的​重型​手枪​。​配备​了​智能​枪​系统​以​提升​射击​精度​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 kuan3 zhuan1 wei2 ji2duan1 qing2kuang4 she4ji4 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1。pei4bei4 le5 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3 yi3 ti2sheng1 she4ji1 jing1du4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A modern revolver that sacrifices ammo capacity and combat options "
"in exchange for massive stopping power."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​现代​转轮手枪​。​牺牲​了​弹​容量​与​战斗​选项​以​换取​强大​的​杀伤力​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：xian4dai4 zhuan4lun2shou3qiang1。xi1sheng1 le5 dan4 rong2liang4 yu4 zhan4dou4 xuan3xiang4 yi3 huan4qu3 qiang2da4 de5 sha1shang1li4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A modern revolver that sacrifies combat options for massive stopping"
" power. Pierces up to 4 Armor."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​现代​转轮手枪​。​牺牲​了​弹​容量​与​战斗​选项​以​换取​强大​的​杀伤力​。​最​多​提供​4​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：xian4dai4 zhuan4lun2shou3qiang1。xi1sheng1 le5 dan4 rong2liang4 yu4 zhan4dou4 xuan3xiang4 yi3 huan4qu3 qiang2da4 de5 sha1shang1li4。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 4 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A modern revolver. Sacrifices ammo capacity and combat options for "
"massive stopping power. Has a Smartlink for accuracy."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​现代​转轮手枪​。​牺牲​了​弹​容量​与​战斗​选项​以​换取​强大​的​杀伤力​。​配备​了​智能​枪​系统​以​提升​射击​精度​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：xian4dai4 zhuan4lun2shou3qiang1。xi1sheng1 le5 dan4 rong2liang4 yu4 zhan4dou4 xuan3xiang4 yi3 huan4qu3 qiang2da4 de5 sha1shang1li4。pei4bei4 le5 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3 yi3 ti2sheng1 she4ji1 jing1du4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: A powerful heavy pistol and primary rival to the Ares Predator. "
"Includes a Smartlink to increase accuracy."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一款​威力​强大​的​重型​手枪​，​是​阿瑞斯​掠​食者​的​主要​竞争对手​。​配备​了​智能​枪​系统​以​提升​射击​精度​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 kuan3 wei1li4 qiang2da4 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1，shi4 a1rui4si1 lu:e4 shi2 zhe3 de5 zhu3yao4 jing4zheng1dui4shou3。pei4bei4 le5 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3 yi3 ti2sheng1 she4ji1 jing1du4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: An Ares classic considered the premier heavy pistol on the streets."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​阿瑞斯​产品​，​一款​被​视为​街头​首选​重型​手枪​的​经典之作​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：a1rui4si1 chan3pin3，yi1 kuan3 bei4 shi4wei2 jie1tou2 shou3xuan3 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1 de5 jing1 dian3 zhi1 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: An Ares classic considered the premier heavy pistol on the streets. "
"Has a Smartlink system for increased accuracy."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​阿瑞斯​产品​，​一款​被​视为​街头​首选​重型​手枪​的​经典之作​。​配备​了​智能​枪​系统​以​提升​射击​精度​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：a1rui4si1 chan3pin3，yi1 kuan3 bei4 shi4wei2 jie1tou2 shou3xuan3 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1 de5 jing1 dian3 zhi1 zuo4。pei4bei4 le5 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3 yi3 ti2sheng1 she4ji1 jing1du4。"

msgid "Pistol: An elegant weapon, perfect security for the woman about town."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一件​优雅​的​武器​，​为​都市女性​提供​完美​的​防护​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 jian4 you1ya3 de5 wu3qi4，wei2 dou1 shi4 nu:3 xing4 ti2gong1 wan2mei3 de5 fang2hu4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: An old-school revolver that gives increased damage but fewer combat "
"options."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一把​老式​左轮手枪​，​能​造成​更高​伤害​，​但​战斗​选项​较​少​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 ba3 lao3shi4 zuo3lun2shou3qiang1，neng2 zao4cheng2 geng1 gao1 shang1hai4，dan4 zhan4dou4 xuan3xiang4 jiao4 shao3。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: An old-school revolver with more damage but fewer combat options. "
"Includes a Smartlink, which reduces range penalties."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​一把​老式​左轮手枪​，​能​造成​更高​伤害​，​但​战斗​选项​较​少​。​内置​智能​枪​系统​，​减少​了​射程​惩罚​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：yi1 ba3 lao3shi4 zuo3lun2shou3qiang1，neng2 zao4cheng2 geng1 gao1 shang1hai4，dan4 zhan4dou4 xuan3xiang4 jiao4 shao3。nei4zhi4 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3，jian3shao3 le5 she4cheng2 cheng2fa2。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: Lone Star's favorite heavy pistol. Capable of a powerful burst fire "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​孤星​干员​最爱​的​重型​手枪​。​具备​强大​的​连发​射击​模式​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：gu1 xing1 gan4 yuan2 zui4 ai4 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1。ju4bei4 qiang2da4 de5 lian2fa1 she4ji1 mo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: Lone Star's favorite heavy pistol. Capable of a powerful burst fire "
"mode. Includes an integral Smartlink system."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​孤星​干员​最爱​的​重型​手枪​。​具备​强大​的​连发​射击​模式​。​内置​智能​枪​系统​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：gu1 xing1 gan4 yuan2 zui4 ai4 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1。ju4bei4 qiang2da4 de5 lian2fa1 she4ji1 mo2shi4。nei4zhi4 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3。"

msgid "Pistol: This popular heavy pistol can fire a three-round burst."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​这​款​受欢迎​的​重型​手枪​可​进行​三发​点射​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：zhe4 kuan3 shou4huan1ying2 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1 ke3 jin4xing2 san1 fa1 dian3she4。"

msgid ""
"Pistol: This popular heavy pistol can fire a three-round burst. includes a "
"Smartlink, which reduces range penalties."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​这​款​受欢迎​的​重型​手枪​可​进行​三发​点射​，​并​配备​智能​枪​系统​，​减少​了​射程​惩罚​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：zhe4 kuan3 shou4huan1ying2 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1 ke3 jin4xing2 san1 fa1 dian3she4，bing4 pei4bei4 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3，jian3shao3 le5 she4cheng2 cheng2fa2。"

msgid ""
"Pity we couldn't've saved any of those clones that the Azzies were testing on. But it was probably kinder to let 'em die. \n"
"\n"
"Considering what the Azzies did to them, they'd never have been able to lead normal lives anyway."
msgstr ""
"只​可惜​我们​没能​救下​那些​被​阿兹佬​当作​实验品​的​克隆​体​。​不过​也许​让​他们​就​这样​死​掉​才​是​更​仁慈​的​做法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​被​阿兹佬​做​了​那些​实验​后​，​他们​已经​不​可能​再过​上​正常​日子​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1 wo3men5 mei2 neng2 jiu4 xia4 na4xie1 bei4 e1 zi1 lao3 dang4zuo4 shi2 yan4 pin3 de5 ke4long2 ti3。bu4guo4 ye3xu3 rang4 ta1men5 jiu4 zhe4yang4 si3 diao4 cai2 shi4 geng1 ren2ci2 de5 zuo4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 bei4 e1 zi1 lao3 zuo4 le5 na4xie1 shi2yan4 hou4，ta1men5 yi3jing1 bu4 ke3neng2 zai4 guo4 shang4 zheng4chang2 ri4zi5 le5。"

msgid "Pizza! Weren't you listening?"
msgstr ""
"送​披萨​的​！​你​没​听​清​吗​？\n"
"song4 pi1sa4 de5！ni3 mei2 ting1 qing1 ma5？"

msgid "Place Bit"
msgstr ""
"放置​模块\n"
"fang4zhi4 mo2kuai4"

msgid "Place Camera"
msgstr ""
"放置​摄像头\n"
"fang4zhi4 she4xiang4tou2"

msgid ""
"Planning on that would be a mistake. This is going to be difficult enough as it is... if we don't focus our efforts on one thing or the other, we're going to fail at both.\n"
"\n"
"If we get an opportunity to rescue some cultists along the way, we'll take it - that goes without saying. But barring that, we should stay focused on killing Harrow."
msgstr ""
"这样​制定​计划​是​会​出岔子​的​。​眼下​事情​本身​就够​棘手​的​了​……​如果​我们​不能​全神贯注​在​一个​目标​上​，​只会​把​整个​计划​都​搞砸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​行动​期间​有​机会​救​下​一部分​教徒​，​我们​当然​会​出手​，​这​自不必说​。​但​除此之外​，​我们​必须​专注​于​杀死​哈罗​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 zhi4ding4 ji4hua4 shi4 hui4 chu1cha4zi5 de5。yan3xia4 shi4qing5 ben3shen1 jiu4 gou4 ji2shou3 de5 le5……ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 quan2shen2guan4zhu4 zai4 yi1ge5 mu4biao1 shang4，zhi3 hui4 ba3 zheng3ge4 ji4hua4 dou1 gao3za2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 xing2dong4 qi1jian1 you3 ji1hui4 jiu4 xia4 yi1bu4fen5 jiao4tu2，wo3men5 dang1ran2 hui4 chu1shou3，zhe4 zi4bu4bi4shuo1。dan4 chu2ci3zhi1wai4，wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 sha1si3 ha1luo2。"

msgid ""
"Planning on that would be a mistake. This is going to be difficult enough as it is... if we don't focus our efforts on one thing or the other, we're going to fail at both.\n"
"\n"
"If we get an opportunity to take the bastard down along the way, we'll take it - that goes without saying. But barring that, we should stay focused on getting those kids out of here."
msgstr ""
"这样​制定​计划​是​会​出岔子​的​。​眼下​事情​本身​就够​棘手​的​了​……​如果​我们​不能​全神贯注​在​一个​目标​上​，​只会​把​整个​计划​都​搞砸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​行动​期间​有​机会​干掉​那个​混蛋​，​我们​当然​会​出手​，​这​自不必说​。​但​除此之外​，​我们​必须​专注​于​救出​那些​孩子​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 zhi4ding4 ji4hua4 shi4 hui4 chu1cha4zi5 de5。yan3xia4 shi4qing5 ben3shen1 jiu4 gou4 ji2shou3 de5 le5……ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 quan2shen2guan4zhu4 zai4 yi1ge5 mu4biao1 shang4，zhi3 hui4 ba3 zheng3ge4 ji4hua4 dou1 gao3za2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 xing2dong4 qi1jian1 you3 ji1hui4 gan4diao4 na4ge5 hun2dan4，wo3men5 dang1ran2 hui4 chu1shou3，zhe4 zi4bu4bi4shuo1。dan4 chu2ci3zhi1wai4，wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 jiu4chu1 na4Xie1hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"Plans changed. They sometimes do. Nature of the business.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He reaches into his pocket, and produces a slim plastic rod. A credstick.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Is that going to be a problem for you?"
msgstr ""
"计划​有变​。​有时候​会​是​这样​。​做​这​一行​的​得​习惯​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把手​伸进​口袋​，​掏出​一根​纤细​的​塑料​棒​。​一根​信用​棒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​对此​有​什么​意见​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ji4hua4 you3 bian4。you3shi2hou5 hui4 shi4 zhe4yang4。zuo4 zhe4 yi1xing2 de5 de2 xi2guan4 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 kou3dai4，tao1chu1 yi1 gen1 xian1xi4 de5 su4liao4 bang4。yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 shen2me5 yi4jian4 ma5？"

msgid "Platelet Factory"
msgstr ""
"血小板​工厂\n"
"xue4xiao3ban3 gong1chang3"

msgid "Play"
msgstr ""
"开始​游戏\n"
"kai1shi3 you2xi4"

msgid "Play dead!"
msgstr ""
"装​死​！\n"
"zhuang1 si3！"

msgid "Play nice, or I'll have my new Cyberzombie cut you all down."
msgstr ""
"说话​注意​点​，​不然​我​就​叫​我​这​新​到手​的​赛博​僵尸​把​你们​全砍​了​。\n"
"shuo1hua4 zhu4yi4 dian3，bu4ran2 wo3 jiu4 jiao4 wo3 zhe4 xin1 dao4shou3 de5 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 ba3 ni3men5 quan2 kan3 le5。"

msgid "Player"
msgstr ""
"玩家\n"
"wan2jia1"

msgid "Player 0"
msgstr ""
"玩家​0\n"
"wan2jia1 0"

msgid "Player 1"
msgstr ""
"玩家​1\n"
"wan2jia1 1"

msgid "Player 2"
msgstr ""
"玩家​2\n"
"wan2jia1 2"

msgid "Player 3"
msgstr ""
"玩家​3\n"
"wan2jia1 3"

msgid "Player Character"
msgstr ""
"玩家​角色\n"
"wan2jia1 jue2se4"

msgid "Player One"
msgstr ""
"玩家​1\n"
"wan2jia1 1"

msgid "Please Clear the Area."
msgstr ""
"请​撤离​此​区域​。\n"
"qing3 che4li2 ci3 qu1yu4。"

msgid "Please Log In:"
msgstr ""
"请​登录​：\n"
"qing3 deng1lu4："

msgid "Please Wait..."
msgstr ""
"请​稍候​……\n"
"qing3 shao1hou4……"

msgid ""
"Please do. And do it quickly.\n"
"\n"
"My gut tells me that if we don't act soon, Humanis will."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​还​请​尽快​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​直觉​告诉​我​，​如果​我们​不​快点​行动​，​人类​至上​主义者​就​会​得逞​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。hai2 qing3 jin3kuai4 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4 kuai4dian3 xing2dong4，ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 jiu4 hui4 de2cheng3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Please don't hurt me! I'm just a line cook! \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The cook's darting eyes are wide open, and behind them you see pure, animal terror. {{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you let me go, I won't tell anyone! I promise!"
msgstr ""
"求​你​了​，​别打我​！​我​只是​个​厨子​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​厨师​双目​圆​睁​，​眼珠​乱转​，​你​从中​看见​了​一种​纯粹​、​本能​的​恐惧​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​我​走​吧​，​我​什么​也​不会​跟​人​说​的​！​我​发誓​！\n"
"\n"
"qiu2 ni3 le5，bie4 da3 wo3！wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 chu2zi5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chu2shi1 shuang1 mu4 yuan2 zheng1，yan3zhu1 luan4 zhuai3，ni3 cong2zhong1 kan4jian4 le5 yi1zhong3 chun2cui4、ben3neng2 de5 kong3ju4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fang4 wo3 zou3 ba1，wo3 shen2me5 ye3 bu4hui4 gen1 ren2 shuo1 de5！wo3 fa1shi4！"

msgid "Please don't."
msgstr ""
"请别​这样​。\n"
"qing3 bie4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"Please enter your custom query string now. This system will attempt to match"
" your query against a database of frequently-asked-questions for our valued "
"station guests."
msgstr ""
"请​输入​自定义​查询​内容​。​本​系统​会​尝试​将​查询​内容​与​我们​尊贵​的​车站​客人​的​常见问题​数据库​进行​匹配​。\n"
"qing3 shu1ru4 zi4ding4yi4 cha2xun2 nei4rong2。ben3 xi4tong3 hui4 chang2shi4 jiang1 cha2xun2 nei4rong2 yu4 wo3men5 zun1gui4 de5 che1zhan4 ke4ren2 de5 chang2jian4wen4ti2 shu4ju4ku4 jin4xing2 pi3pei4。"

msgid ""
"Please hurry. While you're out, I will work on acquiring new contracts for the team.\n"
"\n"
"Alice is the best there is at what she does, and her services carry a price tag to match."
msgstr ""
"快去快回​吧​。​你​出门​的​这​段时间​，​我会​为​团队​争取​新​的​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​爱丽丝​是​这​一行​最​顶尖​的​人物​，​收费​自然​与​服务​相称​。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4 qu4 kuai4 hui2 ba1。ni3 chu1men2 de5 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1，wo3 hui4 wei2 tuan2dui4 zheng1qu3 xin1 de5 cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1 shi4 zhe4 yi1xing2 zui4 ding3jian1 de5 ren2wu4，shou1fei4 zi4ran2 yu4 fu2wu4 xiang1chen4。"

msgid "Please input agent to introduce:"
msgstr ""
"请​选择​要​释放​的​制剂​：\n"
"qing3 xuan3ze2 yao4 shi4fang4 de5 zhi4ji4："

msgid ""
"Please leave me alone.\n"
"\n"
"I'm busy."
msgstr ""
"请别​打扰​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​忙​。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 bie4 da3rao3 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 mang2。"

msgid "Please make this stop."
msgstr ""
"拜托​别​再​放​了​。\n"
"bai4tuo1 bie4 zai4 fang4 le5。"

msgid "Please tell me that the rest of our crew knows what it's doing."
msgstr ""
"拜托​你​告诉​我​，​剩下​的​队员​起码​能靠点​谱​吧​。\n"
"bai4tuo1 ni3 gao4su4 wo3，sheng4xia4 de5 dui4yuan2 qi3ma3 neng2 kao4 dian3 pu3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Please, $(l.freund).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't make this into something it isn't."
msgstr ""
"$(l.freund)​，​别​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​把​这件​事说​得​太​复杂​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.freund)，bie4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shuo1 de2 tai4 fu4za2。"

msgid ""
"Please, Glory! Please calm down, and we'll talk this through!\n"
"\n"
"I still love you!"
msgstr ""
"求​你​了​，​格洛丽​！​请​冷静​一点​，​我们​好好​谈谈​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​依然​爱着​你​！\n"
"\n"
"qiu2 ni3 le5，Ge2luo4li2！qing3 leng3jing4 yi1dian3，wo3men5 hao3hao3 tan2tan2！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1ran2 ai4 zhao2 ni3！"

msgid ""
"Please, do not downplay your contribution. You have shown kindness at a time when few others will.\n"
"\n"
"That means something. It means a great deal."
msgstr ""
"请​不要​贬低​你​的​贡献​。​在​很少​有人​愿意​帮助​他人​的​当下​，​你​表现​出​了​善意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​对​我们​意义​重大​。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 bu4yao4 bian3di1 ni3 de5 gong4xian4。zai4 hen3 shao3 you3ren2 yuan4yi4 bang1zhu4 ta1ren2 de5 dang1xia4，ni3 biao3xian4 chu1 le5 shan4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 wo3men5 yi4yi4 zhong4da4。"

msgid ""
"Please, don't shoot!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ghoul's breath reeks of rotting meat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're not like the others!"
msgstr ""
"请别​开枪​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​食尸​鬼​的​呼吸​散发​着​腐肉​的​味道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​和​其他​食尸​鬼​不​一样​！\n"
"\n"
"qing3 bie4 kai1qiang1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi2 shi1 gui3 de5 hu1xi1 san4fa1 zhao2 fu3rou4 de5 wei4dao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 he4 qi2ta1 shi2 shi1 gui3 bu4 yi1yang4！"

msgid ""
"Please, hear me out.\n"
"\n"
"I promise, I'll make it worth your while if you do."
msgstr ""
"求求​你​，​先​听​我​说完​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​保证​，​如果​你​愿意​的话​，​我​肯定​会​好好​报答​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"qiu2 qiu2 ni3，xian1 ting1 wo3 shuo1 wan2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bao3zheng4，ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，wo3 ken3ding4 hui4 hao3hao3 bao4da2 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Please, just leave. I have important things to do."
msgstr ""
"拜托​你​赶紧​走​吧​。​我​有​很​重要​的​事要​做​。\n"
"bai4tuo1 ni3 gan3jin3 zou3 ba1。wo3 you3 hen3 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid "Please, listen to me--"
msgstr ""
"请​听​我​说​—​—\n"
"qing3 ting1 wo3 shuo1 — —"

msgid ""
"Please, my friend. Go ahead, ask whatever you will. I will gladly answer."
msgstr ""
"请​吧​，​我​的​朋友​。​你​想​问​什么​都行​，​我会​很​乐意​回答​你​的​。\n"
"qing3 ba1，wo3 de5 peng2you5。ni3 xiang3 wen4 shen2me5 dou1 xing2，wo3 hui4 hen3 le4yi4 hui2da2 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Please, stand down... I don't want to fight you. Vauclair's right. I wish "
"that he weren't, but he is. Can't you see that? If this plan of his doesn't "
"happen tonight, all of our sacrifice - Paul's death, Monika's death - will "
"have been in vain."
msgstr ""
"请​退下​吧​……​我​不想​与​你们​为​敌​。​沃​克莱尔​说​得​没错​。​我​也​希望​他​是​错​的​，​但​事实​并非如此​。​你们​难道​看不出来​吗​？​如果​他​的​计划​今晚​未能​实现​，​我们​所有​的​牺牲​—​—​保罗​的​死亡​，​莫妮卡​的​死亡​—​—​都​将​付诸东流​。\n"
"qing3 tui4xia4 ba1……wo3 bu4xiang3 yu4 ni3men5 wei2 di2。Wo4ke4lai2er3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 ta1 shi4 cuo4 de5，dan4 shi4shi2 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。ni3men5 nan2dao4 kan4 bu4 chu1 lai2 ma5？ru2guo3 ta1 de5 ji4hua4 jin1wan3 wei4neng2 shi2xian4，wo3men5 suo3you3 de5 xi1sheng1——bao3luo2 de5 si3wang2，Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3wang2——dou1 jiang1 fu4zhu1dong1liu2。"

msgid "Please."
msgstr ""
"请​吧​。\n"
"qing3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Please. $(l.name). Just trust me on this.\n"
"\n"
"And, uh... make sure that Hasenkamp comes with you. We've gotta make sure that box makes it back to Grinder."
msgstr ""
"拜托​了​，​$(l.name)​。​就​信​我​这​一次​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​……​一定​让​哈森​坎普​跟着​你​。​得​把​那个​盒子​带给​“​绞肉机​”​。\n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1 le5，$(l.name)。jiu4 xin4 wo3 zhe4 yi1ci4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4……yi1ding4 rang4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 gen1zhe5 ni3。de2 ba3 na4ge5 he2zi5 dai4gei3“jiao3rou4ji1”。"

msgid "Please. Please, make sure that Danni is okay."
msgstr ""
"求求​你​，​一定​让​丹妮​安全​回来​。\n"
"qiu2 qiu2 ni3，yi1ding4 rang4 dan1 ni1 an1quan2 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"Please. Spare me the lecture.\n"
"\n"
"Your politics have nothing to do with this."
msgstr ""
"放过​我​吧​，​我​不想​听​你​长篇大论​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​政治​观点​跟​这事​也​没关系​。\n"
"\n"
"fang4guo4 wo3 ba1，wo3 bu4xiang3 ting1 ni3 zhang3 pian1 dai4 lun2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 zheng4zhi4 guan1dian3 gen1 zhe4 shi4 ye3 mei2guan1xi5。"

msgid ""
"Please. Think about this. I have kids at home, not much younger than you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The voice is low, and full of dread.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not here to represent any government. I'm not a threat to you! I was only doing my job."
msgstr ""
"求​你​了​，​再​想想​吧​。​我​家里​也​有​孩子​，​就​跟​你​差不多​大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​那​声音​低沉​而​充满​恐惧​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不是​代表​任何​政府​来​这里​的​。​我​对​你们​没有​威胁​！​我​只是​在​履行职责​。\n"
"\n"
"qiu2 ni3 le5，zai4 xiang3 xiang3 ba1。wo3 jia1li3 ye3 you3 hai2zi5，jiu4 gen1 ni3 cha4bu5duo1 dai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 sheng1yin1 di1chen2 er2 chong1man3 kong3ju4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 dai4biao3 ren4he2 zheng4fu3 lai2 zhe4li3 de5。wo3 dui4 ni3men5 mei2you3 wei1xie2！wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 lu:3 xing2 zhi2 ze2。"

msgid "Please. Whatever this place throws at me, I've seen worse."
msgstr ""
"放心​。​我​也​是​经历​过​大风大浪​的​人​，​这​地方​不能​把​我​怎么着​。\n"
"fang4xin1。wo3 ye3 shi4 jing1li4 guo4 dai4 feng1 dai4 lang4 de5 ren2，zhe4 di4fang1 bu4neng2 ba3 wo3 zen3me5zhao1。"

msgid "Pleased to meet you, $(l.name). What can I do for you today?"
msgstr ""
"很​高兴​认识​你​，​$(l.name)​。​你​有​什么​需要​吗​？\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，$(l.name)。ni3 you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 ma5？"

msgid "Pleasure doing business with you."
msgstr ""
"合作愉快​。\n"
"ge3 zuo4 yu2 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"Plotz is down, and all four turrets are back under my control! Go to town, "
"chief... I've got you covered."
msgstr ""
"普​洛茨​倒​了​，​四座​炮塔​也​全数​重归​我​的​掌控​！​放手​干​吧​，​头儿​……​我来​掩护​你​。\n"
"Pu3luo4ci2 dao3 le5，si4 zuo4 pao4ta3 ye3 quan2shu4 chong2 gui1 wo3 de5 zhang3kong4！fang4shou3 gan4 ba1，tou2r5……wo3 lai2 yan3hu4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Plotz is down, chief! Wherever he is, he won't bother us any more... after "
"the beating I just handed him, he'll be down with a migraine for the rest of"
" the day."
msgstr ""
"普​洛茨​倒​了​，​头儿​！​不管​他​躲​在​哪儿​，​都​别​想​再​来​烦​我们​了​……​刚​挨​了​我​一顿​痛揍​之后​，​他​今天​剩下​的​时间​怕​是​要​头疼​欲裂​了​。\n"
"Pu3luo4ci2 dao3 le5，tou2r5！bu4guan3 ta1 duo3 zai4 na3r5，dou1 bie4 xiang3 zai4 lai2 fan2 wo3men5 le5……gang1 ai1 le5 wo3 yi1 dun4 tong4 zou4 zhi1hou4，ta1 jin1tian1 sheng4xia4 de5 shi2jian1 pa4 shi4 yao4 tou2teng2 yu4 lie4 le5。"

msgid "Plotz's Custom Software"
msgstr ""
"普​洛茨​的​定制​软件\n"
"Pu3luo4ci2 de5 ding4zhi4 ruan3jian4"

msgid ""
"Plotz,\n"
"\n"
"I have REAL and PRESSING concerns about this \"silent partner\" that you've brought on for the loan center scheme.\n"
"\n"
"We DON'T NEED HIM. I keep saying it, but nobody listens. CALL ME!!!\n"
"\n"
"- JB"
msgstr ""
"普​洛茨​，​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对​你​为​贷款​中心​计划​引入​的​这个​“​幕后​金主​”​怀有​真实​且​迫切​的​担忧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​根本​不​需要​他​！​我​反复强调​过​，​但​没人​听​。​给​我​打电话​！​！​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​JB\n"
"\n"
"Pu3luo4ci2，\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ni3 wei2 dai4kuan3 zhong1xin1 ji4hua4 yin3ru4 de5 zhe4ge5“mu4hou4 jin1zhu3” huai2you3 zhen1shi2 qie3 po4qie4 de5 dan1you1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gen1ben3 bu4 xu1yao4 ta1！wo3 fan3 fu4 jiang4 diao4 guo4，dan4 mei2 ren2 ting1。gei3 wo3 da3dian4hua4！！！\n"
"\n"
"——JB"

msgid ""
"Plotz. I've run into that name a couple of times since we arrived. Any "
"ideas, Hasenkamp?"
msgstr ""
"普​洛茨​。​我们​到​这​之后​我​已经​好​几次​看到​这个​名字​了​。​哈森​坎普​，​你​认识​他​吗​？\n"
"Pu3luo4ci2。wo3men5 dao4 zhe4 zhi1hou4 wo3 yi3jing1 hao3 ji3ci4 kan4dao4 zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 le5。Ha1sen1kan3pu3，ni3 ren4shi5 ta1 ma5？"

msgid "Point Light"
msgstr ""
"点光源\n"
"dian3 guang1 yuan2"

msgid "Point Light 1"
msgstr ""
"点光源​1\n"
"dian3 guang1 yuan2 1"

msgid "Point Light 2"
msgstr ""
"点光源​2\n"
