"点光源​5\n"
"dian3 guang1 yuan2 5"

msgid "Point taken. Tell me how much you're charging for the procedure."
msgstr ""
"我​懂​你​意思​了​。​你​就​说​你​这里​要花​多少​钱​吧​。\n"
"wo3 dong3 ni3 yi4si5 le5。ni3 jiu4 shuo1 ni3 zhe4li3 yao4 hua1 duo1shao3 qian2 ba1。"

