msgstr ""
"食尸​鬼​之​毒拳\n"
"shi2 shi1 gui3 zhi1 du2 quan2"

msgid "Pommel Strike: Does additional AP DMG, but no HP DMG."
msgstr ""
"重击​：​造成​额外​的​行动​点​伤害​，​不​造成​生命​值​伤害​。\n"
"zhong4ji1：zao4cheng2 e2wai4 de5 xing2dong4 dian3 shang1hai4，bu4 zao4cheng2 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4。"

msgid "Pommel Strike: Only AP damage"
msgstr ""
"重击​：​只​造成​行动​点​伤害\n"
"zhong4ji1：zhi3 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 dian3 shang1hai4"

msgid "Poor bastard. Doesn't even know what's coming."
msgstr ""
"真是​个​倒霉蛋​，​他​甚至​不​知道​自己​要​落得​什么​下场​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 dao3mei2dan4，ta1 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 yao4 luo4de5 shen2me5 xia4chang3。"

msgid ""
"Poor bastard. His team gets iced on a run, he gets captured... probably "
"tortured... and now, the cleaning crew shows up to finish the job."
msgstr ""
"真是​个​倒霉蛋​。​他​的​队伍​在​差事​中团灭​，​他​被​人​抓捕​，​受尽折磨​……​现在​又​有​一支​清理​小队​来​要​他​的​命​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 dao3mei2dan4。ta1 de5 dui4wu3 zai4 cha4shi4 zhong4 tuan2 mie4，ta1 bei4 ren2 zhua1bu3，shou4 jin3 zhe1 mo2……xian4zai4 you4 you3 yi1 zhi1 qing1li3 xiao3 dui4 lai2 yao4 ta1 de5 ming4。"

msgid ""
"Poor bastard. His team gets iced on a run, he gets captured... probably tortured... and now, the cleaning crew shows up to finish the job.\n"
"\n"
"All for the crime of being a \"loose end.\""
msgstr ""
"真是​个​倒霉蛋​。​他​的​队伍​在​差事​中团灭​，​他​被​人​抓捕​，​受尽折磨​……​现在​又​有​一支​清理​小队​来​要​他​的​命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​一切​仅仅​因为​他​是​那个​“​后患​”​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 dao3mei2dan4。ta1 de5 dui4wu3 zai4 cha4shi4 zhong4 tuan2 mie4，ta1 bei4 ren2 zhua1bu3，shou4 jin3 zhe1 mo2……xian4zai4 you4 you3 yi1 zhi1 qing1li3 xiao3 dui4 lai2 yao4 ta1 de5 ming4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 jin3jin3 yin1wei4 ta1 shi4 na4ge5“hou4 huan4”。"

msgid ""
"Poor bastard. His team gets iced on a run, he gets captured... probably tortured... and now, the cleaning crew shows up to finish the job.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno. It doesn't feel like we're on the right side of this one."
msgstr ""
"真是​个​倒霉蛋​。​他​的​队伍​在​差事​中团灭​，​他​被​人​抓捕​，​受尽折磨​……​现在​又​有​一支​清理​小队​来​要​他​的​命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​。​总​感觉​我们​在​这件​事上​站​在​了​错误​的​一边​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 dao3mei2dan4。ta1 de5 dui4wu3 zai4 cha4shi4 zhong4 tuan2 mie4，ta1 bei4 ren2 zhua1bu3，shou4 jin3 zhe1 mo2……xian4zai4 you4 you3 yi1 zhi1 qing1li3 xiao3 dui4 lai2 yao4 ta1 de5 ming4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2。zong3 gan3jue2 wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 zhan4 zai4 le5 cuo4wu4 de5 yi1bian1。"

msgid ""
"Poor fool. I'll bet you anything that she never got to enjoy that glass of "
"wine."
msgstr ""
"可怜​的​傻瓜​。​我敢​笃定​她​没能​享受​上​那杯​红酒​。\n"
"ke3lian2 de5 sha3gua1。wo3 gan3 du3ding4 ta1 mei2 neng2 xiang3shou4 shang4 na4 bei1 hong2jiu3。"

msgid ""
"Poor, mutilated Glory. You opened up to $(l.name) after I died?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Monika-image smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is a happy surprise."
msgstr ""
"可怜​而​残破​的​格洛丽​。​你​在​我​死​后​向​$(l.name)​敞开​了​心扉​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​真是​令​我​惊喜​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3lian2 er2 can2po4 de5 Ge2luo4li2。ni3 zai4 wo3 si3 hou4 xiang4 $(l.name) chang3kai1 le5 xin1fei1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhen1shi5 ling3 wo3 jing1xi3。"

msgid ""
"Popping the lid on her toolbox, she grabs a pair of wire clippers, a soldering gun, and a roll of electrical tape.\n"
"\n"
"With a look of grim determination on her face, she begins to snip into a massive harness of cables that runs through the unit."
msgstr ""
"她​掀开​工具箱​盖​，​抓起​一把​线​钳​、​一支​电烙铁​和​一卷​电工​胶带​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​露出​坚毅​的​神情​，​开始​剪开​贯穿​整个​装置​的​庞大​线束​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xian1kai1 gong1ju4xiang1 gai4，zhua1 qi3 yi1 ba3 xian4 qian2、yi1 zhi1 dian4lao4tie5 he4 yi1 juan3 dian4gong1 jiao1dai4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 lu4chu1 jian1yi4 de5 shen2qing2，kai1shi3 jian3 kai1 guan4chuan1 zheng3ge4 zhuang1zhi4 de5 pang2da4 xian4 shu4。"

msgid "Portent? What do you mean, portent?"
msgstr ""
"预兆​？​你​说​预兆​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"yu4zhao4？ni3 shuo1 yu4zhao4 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid "Portraits"
msgstr ""
"头像\n"
"tou2xiang4"

msgid "Ports Rotated."
msgstr ""
"端口​旋转​完毕​。\n"
"duan1kou3 xuan2zhuan3 wan2bi4。"

msgid ""
"Positive. Be calm, all of you.\n"
"\n"
"As long as you're here with us, nothing bad will ever happen to you."
msgstr ""
"千真万确​。​大家​都​冷静​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​只要​和​我们​待​在​一起​，​就​永远​不会​有​坏事​发生​在​你们​身上​。\n"
"\n"
"qian1zhen1wan4que4。da4jia1 dou1 leng3jing4 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 zhi3yao4 he4 wo3men5 dai1 zai4 yi1qi3，jiu4 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 you3 huai4shi4 fa1sheng1 zai4 ni3men5 shen1shang5。"

msgid "Power Junction Stand In"
msgstr ""
"替代​电源​连接器\n"
"ti4dai4 dian4yuan2 lian2jie1qi4"

msgid "Power Working"
msgstr ""
"电力​正常​运作​中\n"
"dian4li4 zheng4chang2 yun4zuo4 zhong4"

msgid "Power grid overloaded."
msgstr ""
"电网​已​过载​。\n"
"dian4wang3 yi3 guo4zai4。"

msgid ""
"Power-drunk fools, the lot of them. The Arbeiters were bad enough, but the Magnifikers are even worse.\n"
"\n"
"The Arbeiters' interests were limited to theft and violence in the name of their \"cause.\" The Magnifikers... they have power, and they seem to relish in abusing it."
msgstr ""
"那些​人​都​是​被​力量​冲昏头脑​的​蠢货​。​工人​帮​已经​够​糟糕​了​，​但伟术​帮则​更​甚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​工人​帮​的​兴趣​仅限于​以​他们​所谓​的​“​事业​”​为名​行​盗窃​与​暴力​之实​。​但伟术​帮​……​他们​拥有​力量​，​而且​似乎​以​滥用​为乐​。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 ren2 dou1 shi4 bei4 li4liang5 chong1hun1tou2nao3 de5 chun3huo4。gong1ren2 bang1 yi3jing1 gou4 zao1gao1 le5，dan4 wei3 shu4 bang1 ze2 geng1 shen4。\n"
"\n"
"gong1ren2 bang1 de5 xing4qu4 jin3 xian4 yu2 yi3 ta1men5 suo3wei4 de5“shi4ye4” wei2 ming2 xing2 dao4qie4 yu4 bao4li4 zhi1 shi2。dan4 wei3 shu4 bang1……ta1men5 yong1you3 li4liang5，er2qie3 si4hu1 yi3 lan4yong4 wei2 le4。"

msgid "Powerbolt 1"
msgstr ""
"热能​箭​I\n"
"re4neng2 jian4 I"

msgid "Powerbolt I"
msgstr ""
"热能​箭​I\n"
"re4neng2 jian4 I"

msgid "Powerbolt II"
msgstr ""
"热能​箭​II\n"
"re4neng2 jian4 II"

msgid "Powerbolt III"
msgstr ""
"热能​箭​III\n"
"re4neng2 jian4 III"

msgid "Powerbolt IV"
msgstr ""
"热能​箭​IV\n"
"re4neng2 jian4 IV"

msgid "Powering drone group one. Just a few more seconds!"
msgstr ""
"正在​为​第一组​无人机​充能​。​只差​几秒钟​了​！\n"
"zheng4zai4 wei2 di4 yi1 zu3 wu2ren2ji1 chong1 neng2。zhi3 cha4 ji1 miao3 zhong1 le5！"

msgid "Powering the second wave of drones. Almost there!"
msgstr ""
"正在​为​第二组​无人机​充能​。​马上​就​好​！\n"
"zheng4zai4 wei2 di4 er4 zu3 wu2ren2ji1 chong1 neng2。ma3shang4 jiu4 hao3！"

msgid "Practicing magic since before the Awakening? That's ridiculous."
msgstr ""
"“​大​觉醒​”​之前​就​在​修习​魔法​？​这​也​太​扯​了​。\n"
"“dai4 jue2xing3” zhi1qian2 jiu4 zai4 xiu1xi2 mo2fa3？zhe4 ye3 tai4 che3 le5。"

msgid "Pragmatic. Sounds like it's about time I pay Altuğ a visit."
msgstr ""
"很​务实​。​这么​说​，​我​差不多​该​去​见见​奥图​伊​了​。\n"
"hen3 wu4shi2。zhe4me5 shuo1，wo3 cha4bu5duo1 gai1 qu4 jian4 jian4 ao4 tu2 yi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Predators that couldn't survive in mana-poor environments are flooding into our world.\n"
"\n"
"And as the mana level continues to rise, larger and more dangerous things are appearing."
msgstr ""
"无法​在​魔力​贫瘠​环境​中​生存​的​掠​食者​正​涌入​我们​的​世界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​魔力​水平​持续​攀升​，​体型​更大​、​更​危险​的​生物​正​不断​出现​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2fa3 zai4 mo2li4 pin2ji2 huan2jing4 zhong4 sheng1cun2 de5 lu:e4 shi2 zhe3 zheng1 yong3ru4 wo3men5 de5 shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 mo2li4 shui3ping2 chi2xu4 pan1sheng1，ti3xing2 geng1 dai4、geng1 wei1xian3 de5 sheng1wu4 zheng1 bu4duan4 chu1xian4。"

msgid "Premium Medkit"
msgstr ""
"顶级​急救包\n"
"ding3ji2 ji2jiu4bao1"

msgid ""
"Presumably because they're the best option available. Stahl is nothing if not a pragmatist; he will work with metahumans when it suits him to do so.\n"
"\n"
"When he's finished with them, he'll discard them and move on."
msgstr ""
"大概​是因为​他们​是​最好​的​选择​。​斯塔尔​是​个​不折不扣​的​实用主义​者​；​在​情况​需要​时​，​他​也​会​与​变​人类​合作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​他​用​完​他们​之后​，​就​会​丢弃​他们​，​继续前进​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1men5 shi4 zui4hao3 de5 xuan3ze2。Si1ta3er3 shi4 ge4 bu4zhe2bu4kou4 de5 shi2yong4zhu3yi4 zhe3 ； zai4 qing2kuang4 xu1yao4 shi2，ta1 ye3 hui4 yu4 bian4 ren2lei4 he2zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 yong4 wan2 ta1men5 zhi1hou4，jiu4 hui4 diu1qi4 ta1men5，ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid ""
"Pretty good, ain't it? Never heard of another shaman who could do something "
"like this... we must've really made an impression."
msgstr ""
"是​吧​？​我​从​没听说过​其他​哪个​萨满​有​这​等​本事​……​看来​祂​对​我们​相当​肯定​啊​。\n"
"shi4 ba1？wo3 cong2 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4 qi2ta1 na3ge5 sa4man3 you3 zhe4 deng3 ben3shi4……kan4lai5 ta1 dui4 wo3men5 xiang1dang1 ken3ding4 a1。"

msgid "Pretty much, yeah."
msgstr ""
"差不多​吧​。\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Price gouging, huh? For a neo-anarchist, you behave an awful lot like an "
"old-world profiteer."
msgstr ""
"哄抬物价​？​你​这个​新​无政府主义​者​，​倒像​极了​旧​世界​的​投机商​人​。\n"
"hong1 tai2 wu4 jia4？ni3 zhe4ge5 xin1 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3，dao4xiang4 ji2le5 jiu4 shi4jie4 de5 tou2 ji1 shang1 ren2。"

msgid "Pride"
msgstr ""
"荣耀\n"
"rong2yao4"

msgid "Probably best if we could just find the code."
msgstr ""
"也许​我们​最好​还是​找到​密码​吧​。\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3men5 zui4hao3 hai2shi5 zhao3dao4 mi4ma3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Problem is, he's holed up somewhere in the building, and we don't know where. \n"
"\n"
"Best guess? He's hiding somewhere upstairs, in a room with no exterior windows."
msgstr ""
"问题​是​，​他​藏​在​建筑​的​某个​地方​，​我们​不​知道​具体位置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​依我看​，​他​肯定​躲​在​楼上​的​某个​没有​外窗​的​房间​里​。\n"
"\n"
"wen4ti2 shi4，ta1 zang4 zai4 jian4zhu4 de5 mou3 ge4 di4fang1，wo3men5 bu4 zhi1dao4 ju4 ti3 wei4 zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1wo3kan4，ta1 ken3ding4 duo3 zai4 lou2shang4 de5 mou3 ge4 mei2you3 wai4 chuang1 de5 fang2jian1 li3。"

msgid ""
"Process of elimination. Initiates aren't allowed in that room - it's one of Harrow's rules.\n"
"\n"
"On the rare occasion that an initiate is invited in, he usually doesn't come back out again."
msgstr ""
"排除法​。​学徒​不​允许​进入​那个​房间​—​—​这是​哈罗​的​规则​之一​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​极少数​情况​下​，​也​会​有​学徒​被​邀请​进去​，​但​他们​通常​就​出不来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"pai2 chu2 fa3。xue2tu2 bu4 yun3xu3 jin4ru4 na4ge5 fang2jian1——zhe4 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 gui1ze2 zhi1yi1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ji2shao3shu4 qing2kuang4 xia4，ye3 hui4 you3 xue2tu2 bei4 yao1qing3 jin4qu4，dan4 ta1men5 tong1chang2 jiu4 chu1 bu4 lai2 le5。"

msgid "Program"
msgstr ""
"程序\n"
"cheng2xu4"

msgid "Programs"
msgstr ""
"程序\n"
"cheng2xu4"

msgid "Project Atlas"
msgstr ""
"阿特拉斯​项目\n"
"a1te4la1si1 xiang4mu4"

msgid "Project Atlas Data"
msgstr ""
"“​阿特拉斯​”​项目​数据\n"
"“a1te4la1si1” xiang4mu4 shu4ju4"

msgid "Project Atlas Folder"
msgstr ""
"“​阿特拉斯​”​项目​文件夹\n"
"“a1te4la1si1” xiang4mu4 wen2jian4jia1"

msgid "Project Bloodline Files"
msgstr ""
"“​血脉​”​项目​文件\n"
"“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 wen2jian4"

msgid "Project Downfall Data Store"
msgstr ""
"坠落​计划​数据​存储\n"
"zhui4luo4 ji4hua4 shu4ju4 cun2chu3"

msgid ""
"Project data on some sort of chemical research project that you pulled from "
"the SCHERING Pharma AG lab that you hit. It's probably worth something to "
"the right buyer."
msgstr ""
"你​在​袭击​先灵​制药​实验室​时​获取​的​某种​化学​研究​项目​的​数据​。​卖​给​合适​的​人​能​赚​不少​新円​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 xi2ji1 xian1 ling2 zhi4yao4 shi2yan4shi4 shi2 huo4qu3 de5 mou3zhong3 hua4xue2 yan2jiu1 xiang4mu4 de5 shu4ju4。mai4 gei3 he2shi4 de5 ren2 neng2 zhuan4 bu4shao3 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Prominently displayed on this console is a Matrix jackpoint. But to the side of that jackpoint, protected under a clear plastic sheath, is an old-fashioned toggle switch.\n"
"\n"
"The switch is labeled \"EMERGENCY AI SHUTDOWN AND PURGE CONTROL #1.\""
msgstr ""
"控制​台上​显示​着​一处​醒目​的​矩阵​接入点​，​但​其​侧面​还有​个​被​透明​塑料​护罩​保护​着​的​老式​拨动​开关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​开关​上​标注​着​“​紧急​AI​关闭​及​清除​控制​#​1​”​。\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 xian3shi4 zhao2 yi1 chu3 xing3mu4 de5 ju3zhen4 jie1ru4dian3，dan4 qi2 ce4mian4 hai2you3 ge4 bei4 tou4ming2 su4liao4 hu4 zhao4 bao3hu4 zhao2 de5 lao3shi4 bo1dong4 kai1guan1。\n"
"\n"
"kai1guan1 shang4 biao1zhu4 zhao2“jin3ji2 AI guan1bi4 ji2 qing1chu2 kong4zhi4 # 1”。"

msgid ""
"Prominently displayed on this console is a Matrix jackpoint. But to the side of that jackpoint, protected under a clear plastic sheath, is an old-fashioned toggle switch.\n"
"\n"
"The switch is labeled \"EMERGENCY AI SHUTDOWN AND PURGE CONTROL #2.\""
msgstr ""
