msgid ""
"Realizing all of this was one thing. Actually fixing it was something else entirely.\n"
"\n"
"I knew that I had to get away from Harrow. That was the first thing to do. So I bit my lip and did my best to ignore the happy babble of the new recruits on the trip back to Feuerstelle, and I managed to get through the ride without screaming."
msgstr ""
"意识​到​这些​是​一​回事​，​要​真正​解决​它​则​是​另一回事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​自己​必须​离开​哈罗​。​这是​高于一切​的​首要任务​。​于是​我​咬紧​嘴唇​，​竭力​忽略​新​人们​在​返回​“​火坑​”​途中​欢快​的​喧哗​，​最终​在​没有​尖叫​的​情况​下​熬过​了​这段​旅程​。\n"
"\n"
"yi4shi2 dao4 zhe4xie1 shi4 yi1 hui2shi4，yao4 zhen1zheng4 jie3jue2 ta1 ze2 shi4 ling4 yi1 hui2 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 bi4xu1 li2kai1 ha1luo2。zhe4 shi4 gao1 yu2 yi1 qie1 de5 shou3 yao4 ren4 wu4。yu2shi4 wo3 yao3 jin3 zui3chun2，jie2li4 hu1lu:e4 xin1 ren2men5 zai4 fan3hui2“huo3keng1” tu2zhong1 huan1kuai4 de5 xuan1hua2，zui4zhong1 zai4 mei2you3 jian1jiao4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 ao1 guo4 le5 zhe4 duan4 lu:3cheng2。"

msgid ""
"Really doesn't matter that much to me. But to the rest, it's going to be a different story.\n"
"\n"
"Monika kept this place in one piece. She read the Flux like a bird reads the wind or a fish reads the current. Without her, there's no telling what's going to happen."
msgstr ""
"对​我​来说​，​这​并​不​重要​。​但​对​其他人​来说​，​情况​就​不​一样​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​莫妮卡​维系​着​这个​地方​。​她​对​动荡​带​的​解读​就​像​鸟​之于​风​、​鱼之于​水​。​现在​没有​了​她​，​不​知道​会​发生​什么​事​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 bing4 bu4 zhong4yao4。dan4 dui4 qi2 ta1 ren2 lai2 shuo1，qing2kuang4 jiu4 bu4 yi1yang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 wei2xi4 zhao2 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。ta1 dui4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 jie3du2 jiu4 xiang4 niao3 zhi1 yu2 feng1、yu2 zhi1 yu2 shui3。xian4zai4 mei2you3 le5 ta1，bu4 zhi1dao4 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 shi4。"

msgid "Really. Must be a hell of a contact."
msgstr ""
"是​嘛​，​那​这​联络人​不​简单​。\n"
"shi4 ma5，na4 zhe4 lian2luo4ren2 bu4 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"Really?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The acolyte looks nonplussed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Aren't they a little old? Harrow says that people get spoiled by the world when they grow to adulthood outside of Feuerstelle. He says that--"
msgstr ""
"真的​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​侍祭​看起来​很​困惑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​年纪​有点​大​了​吧​？​哈罗​说​过​，​在​“​火坑​”​之外​长大​的​人会​被​外面​的​世界​宠坏​。​他​说​—​—\n"
"\n"
"zhen1de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi4 ji4 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 kun4huo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 nian2ji4 you3dian3 dai4 le5 ba1？ha1luo2 shuo1 guo4，zai4“huo3keng1” zhi1wai4 zhang3da4 de5 ren2 hui4 bei4 wai4mian4 de5 shi4jie4 chong3huai4。ta1 shuo1 — —"

msgid ""
"Really?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Trithemius' face brightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, this is welcome news indeed! You have my thanks, stranger."
msgstr ""
"真的​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​特​里特​米​乌斯​的​脸上​露出​了​欣喜​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​确实​是​个​好消息​！​谢谢​你​，​陌生人​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 le5 xin1xi3 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 que4shi2 shi4 ge4 hao3 xiao1 xi1！xie4xie5 ni3，mo4sheng1ren2。"

