"zhen1de5？ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4？"

msgid ""
"Really? Huh. This is the first I've heard of it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The janitor shrugs, her body relaxing. From the look on her face, you can tell that her mind is already elsewhere.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, you know better than I do, I guess."
msgstr ""
"真的​吗​？​这​还是​我头​一次​听说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​清洁工​耸耸肩​，​身体​放松​下来​。​从​她​脸上​的​表情​来看​，​你​知道​她​的​思绪​已经​飘​到​其他​地方​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​反正​你​肯定​比​我​懂​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1de5 ma5？zhe4 hai2shi5 wo3 tou2 yi1ci4 ting1shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 song3 song3 jian1，shen1ti3 fang4song1 xia4lai5。cong2 ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 biao3qing2 lai2 kan4，ni3 zhi1dao4 ta1 de5 si1xu4 yi3jing1 piao1 dao4 qi2ta1 di4fang1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，fan3zheng4 ni3 ken3ding4 bi3 wo3 dong3。"

msgid ""
"Really? No arguments? Not even a veiled threat?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have to admit, I wasn't expecting this to go so smoothly."
msgstr ""
"这么​爽快​？​连​一句​反驳​或者​含蓄​的​威胁​都​没有​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​承认​，​我​没想到​事情​会​这么​顺利​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuang3kuai5？lian2 yi1ju4 fan3bo2 huo4zhe3 han2xu4 de5 wei1xie2 dou1 mei2you3？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 cheng2ren4，wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 shi4qing5 hui4 zhe4me5 shun4li4。"

msgid ""
"Really? So did you, like, take an extra-long break during crunch time? Or "
"did you chug a cup of scalding hot soykaf?"
