"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns to rummage through a bin of obsolete components at the back of her stall.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​那​可是​很​老旧​的​技术​了​……​稍​等​下​，​让​我​去​找​找​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过身​去​，​在​摊位​后面​的​废旧​零件​箱里​翻找​起来​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？na4 ke3shi4 hen3 lao3jiu4 de5 ji4shu4 le5……shao1 deng3 xia4，rang4 wo3 qu4 zhao3 zhao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4，zai4 tan1wei4 hou4mian5 de5 fei4jiu4 ling2jian4 xiang1 li3 fan1 zhao3 qi3lai5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
