"\n"
"{{GM}}Her lips struggle upward into a facsimile of a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I really need that money, and I left some things in there, too. Y'know, personal stuff."
msgstr ""
"真的​？​那​……​啊​，​那​真是​太好了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​勉强​提了​提​嘴角​，​挤出​一个​似笑非笑​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真的​需要​那笔​钱​，​而且​我​还​把​别的​东西​也​落​在​那儿​了​。​就​，​我​自己​的​一些​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1de5？na4……a1，na4 zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5。\n"
"\n"
