"bu4qiang1：yong1you3 liu4 gen1 xuan2zhuan3 qiang1guan3，she4 su4 jing1ren2。ke3 an1zhuang1 zai4 wu2ren2ji1 huo4 che1liang4 shang4。"

msgid "Rifle: Six rotating barrels with an impressive rate of fire."
msgstr ""
"步枪​：​拥有​六根​旋转​枪管​，​射速​惊人​。\n"
"bu4qiang1：yong1you3 liu4 gen1 xuan2zhuan3 qiang1guan3，she4 su4 jing1ren2。"

