"bu4qiang1：bi3 da4duo1shu4 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1 xiao3qiao3，dan4 tong2yang4 zhi4ming4。"

msgid ""
"Rifle: Smaller than most assault rifles, yet with a powerful punch. Further "
"improved with the addition of a Smartlink system."
msgstr ""
"步枪​：​比​大多数​突击​步枪​小巧​，​但​同样​致命​。​额外​配备​了​智能​枪​系统​，​性能​进一步​提升​。\n"
"bu4qiang1：bi3 da4duo1shu4 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1 xiao3qiao3，dan4 tong2yang4 zhi4ming4。e2wai4 pei4bei4 le5 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3，xing4neng2 jin4yi1bu4 ti2sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Rifle: The most common assault rifle in the world, with an integral "
"Smartlink system."
msgstr ""
"步枪​：​当今世界​最​常见​的​突击​步枪​，​内置​智能​枪​系统​。\n"
"bu4qiang1：dang1 jin1 shi4 jie4 zui4 chang2jian4 de5 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1，nei4zhi4 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3。"

msgid "Rifle: The most common assault rifle in the world."
msgstr ""
"步枪​：​当今世界​最​常见​的​突击​步枪​。\n"
"bu4qiang1：dang1 jin1 shi4 jie4 zui4 chang2jian4 de5 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1。"

msgid ""
"Rifle: The official sniper rifle of the CSA, effective at long range. "
"Includes an integral Smartlink system. Pierces up to 1 Armor."
msgstr ""
"步枪​：​CAS​军队​采用​的​狙击步枪​，​在​远距离​上​尤其​有效​。​内置​智能​枪​系统​。​最​多​提供​1​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"bu4qiang1：CAS jun1dui4 cai3yong4 de5 ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1，zai4 yuan3ju4li2 shang4 you2qi2 you3xiao4。nei4zhi4 zhi4neng2 qiang1 xi4tong3。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid ""
"Rifle: The official sniper rifle of the CSA, effective at long range. "
"Pierces up to 1 Armor."
msgstr ""
"步枪​：​CAS​军队​采用​的​狙击步枪​，​在​远距离​上​尤其​有效​。​最​多​提供​1​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"bu4qiang1：CAS jun1dui4 cai3yong4 de5 ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1，zai4 yuan3ju4li2 shang4 you2qi2 you3xiao4。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

