msgstr ""
"步枪​：​多年​来​，​这件​武器​经过​了​其​主人​的​不断​改装​。\n"
"bu4qiang1：duo1nian2 lai2，zhe4 jian4 wu3qi4 jing1guo4 le5 qi2 zhu3ren2 de5 bu4duan4 gai3zhuang1。"

msgid ""
"Rifling through the toolbox that Enstad was fiddling with, you find what you're looking for.\n"
"\n"
"A squat, ugly device with a pistol grip and a last-generation PDA."
msgstr ""
"在​恩施​塔德​刚才​摆弄​过​的​工具箱​里​翻找​了​一阵​后​，​你​找到​了​想要​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一台​粗矮​丑陋​的​设备​，​装备​了​手枪​握把​以及​一部​上​世代​的​PDA​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 en1Shi1ta3de2 gang1cai2 bai3nong4 guo4 de5 gong1ju4xiang1 li3 fan1 zhao3 le5 yi1zhen4 hou4，ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 xiang3yao4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 tai2 cu1 ai3 chou3lou4 de5 she4bei4，zhuang1bei4 le5 shou3qiang1 wo4 ba3 yi3ji2 yi1 bu4 shang4 shi4dai4 de5 PDA。"

msgid "Rigger"
msgstr ""
"机师\n"
"ji1shi1"

msgid "Rigger Cell Control"
msgstr ""
"机师​收容​室​控制\n"
"ji1shi1 shou1rong2 shi4 kong4zhi4"

msgid ""
"Riggers use cybertech to jack their mind into and control small robot-like vehicles called drones. Riggers use their rigging abilities to provide surveillance, support, and extra fire-power when required.\n"
"\n"
"Key Attributes: Intelligence\n"
"Key Skill: Drone Control\n"
"Key Specialization: Drone Combat"
msgstr ""
"机师​可​使用​赛博​技术​将​意识​接入​名为​无人机​的​小型​机器人​载具​并​进行​操控​。​他们​运用​机械​操控​能力​提供​侦察​与​支援​，​并​在​必要​时​提供​额外​火力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​主要​属性​：​智力​\n"
"​主要​技能​：​无人机​控制​\n"
"​主要​专长​：​无人机​战斗\n"
"\n"
"ji1shi1 ke3 shi3yong4 sai4bo2 ji4shu4 jiang1 yi4shi2 jie1ru4 ming2wei2 wu2ren2ji1 de5 xiao3xing2 ji1qi4ren2 zai4ju4 bing4 jin4xing2 cao1kong4。ta1men5 yun4yong4 ji1xie4 cao1kong4 neng2li4 ti2gong1 zhen1cha2 yu4 zhi1yuan2，bing4 zai4 bi4yao4 shi2 ti2gong1 e2wai4 huo3li4。\n"
"\n"
"zhu3yao4 shu3xing4：zhi4li4 \n"
"zhu3yao4 ji4neng2：wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4 \n"
"zhu3yao4 zhuan1chang2：wu2ren2ji1 zhan4dou4"

msgid ""
"Right behind you, love.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich casts a backward glance at Glory. If any of this has had an impact on her, she doesn't show it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, Glory, let's go."
msgstr ""
"随叫随到​，​亲爱​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​回头​瞥​了​格洛丽​一眼​。​不知​这​一切​是否​让​她​有所​触动​，​但​至少​她​并未​流露​半分​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​，​我们​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2jiao4sui2dao4，qin1ai4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 hui2tou2 pie1 le5 Ge2luo4li2 yi1yan3。bu4zhi1 zhe4 yi1qie4 shi4fou3 rang4 ta1 you3suo3 chu4dong4，dan4 zhi4shao3 ta1 bing4wei4 liu2lu4 ban4fen1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，wo3men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid "Right behind you."
msgstr ""
"你​先​走​。\n"
"ni3 xian1 zou3。"

msgid ""
"Right now though I have some errands to run - come over sometime and we can chat over hookah or something, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before turning her focus to a comm at her wrist..{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"不过​现在​我​得​去​办点​事​—​—​有空​过来​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转向​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 xian4zai4 wo3 de2 qu4 ban4 dian3 shi4——you3kong4 guo4lai2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Right now though I have some errands to run - come over sometime and we can chat over hookah or something, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before turning her focus to a comm at her wrist.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"不过​现在​我​得​去​办点​事​—​—​有空​过来​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转向​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 xian4zai4 wo3 de2 qu4 ban4 dian3 shi4——you3kong4 guo4lai2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Right now, I don't care what the Firewing is planning. I just want to get "
"some payback for Monika."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​我​不在乎​火翼​在​计划​什么​。​我​只​想​为​莫妮卡​复仇​。\n"
"xian4zai4，wo3 bu4zai4hu5 Huo3yi4 zai4 ji4hua4 shen2me5。wo3 zhi3 xiang3 wei2 Mo4ni1ka3 fu4chou2。"

msgid ""
"Right there with you, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, let's get the hell out of here. When we get back to the Kreuzbasar, I'll buy you a drink."
msgstr ""
"我​听​你​的​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​吧​。​等​我们​回到​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​我​请​你​喝酒​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1 ni3 de5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1。deng3 wo3men5 hui2dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，wo3 qing3 ni3 he1jiu3。"

msgid "Right there with you, $(l.name). "
msgstr ""
"深有同感​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"shen1 you3 tong2 gan3，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Right there with you, and privileged to say so.\n"
"\n"
"She was one of the best women I've ever known."
msgstr ""
"巧​了​，​我​也​是​，​而且​我​为此​感到​十分​荣幸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​可是​我​认识​的​最​优秀​的​女性​之一​。\n"
"\n"
"qiao3 le5，wo3 ye3 shi4，er2qie3 wo3 wei4ci3 gan3dao4 shi2fen1 rong2xing4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ke3shi4 wo3 ren4shi5 de5 zui4 you1xiu4 de5 nu:3xing4 zhi1yi1。"

msgid "Right there with you, chief. This guy gives me the creeps."
msgstr ""
"我举​双手​赞同​，​头儿​。​这​家伙​怪​吓人​的​。\n"
"wo3 ju3 shuang1shou3 zan4tong2，tou2r5。zhe4 jia1huo5 guai4 xia4ren2 de5。"

