msgstr ""
"深有同感​，​伙计​。​所以​，​关于​规程​的​事情​……\n"
"shen1 you3 tong2 gan3，huo3ji5。suo3yi3，guan1yu2 gui1cheng2 de5 shi4qing5……"

msgid "Right there with you."
msgstr ""
"深有同感​。\n"
"shen1 you3 tong2 gan3。"

msgid ""
"Right there with you. I ventilated the son of a bitch before I left the "
"Ruhrplex."
msgstr ""
"我​也​一样​。​所以​在​离开​鲁尔​都会区​之前​，​我​给​那​畜生​身上​开​了​几个​洞​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 yi1yang4。suo3yi3 zai4 li2kai1 lu3 er3 dou1 hui4 qu1 zhi1qian2，wo3 gei3 na4 chu4sheng5 shen1shang5 kai1 le5 ji3ge5 dong4。"

