msgstr ""
"深有同感​。​我们​进去​吧​。\n"
"shen1 you3 tong2 gan3。wo3men5 jin4qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Right there with you. This was supposed to be a milk run."
msgstr ""
"我​有​同感​。​这​本该​是​件​轻松​差事​才​对​。\n"
"wo3 you3 tong2gan3。zhe4 ben3 gai1 shi4 jian4 qing1song1 cha4shi4 cai2 dui4。"

msgid ""
"Right.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The mage's hands twist into claws, and he raises them high. An instant later, they are wreathed in an unnatural purple glow.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​法师​的​双手​扭曲​成​利爪​，​高高​举起​。​顷刻间​，​它们​便​笼罩着​诡异​的​紫色​光芒​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 de5 shuang1shou3 niu3qu1 cheng2 li4zhao3，gao1 gao1 ju3qi3。qing3ke4jian1，ta1men5 bian4 long2 zhao4 zhao2 gui3yi4 de5 zi3se4 guang1mang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Right.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The thousand-meter stare creeps back into Glory's eyes. A moment later, she's locked away in her own head again, reliving memories that she'd long since filed away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So a few days after my fourteenth birthday, I began to... express. Magically.\n"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​拒人千里​式​的​凝视​再度​爬​上​格洛丽​的​双眸​。​片刻​之后​，​她​又​沉入​自己​的​思绪​深处​，​重温​那些​早已​封存​的​记忆​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​在​我​十四岁​生日​后​的​几天​，​我​开始​……​显现出​了​魔法​的​征兆​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4 ren2 qian1 li3 shi4 de5 ning2shi4 zai4du4 pa2 shang4 Ge2luo4li2 de5 shuang1mou2。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ta1 you4 chen2 ru4 zi4ji3 de5 si1xu4 shen1chu4，chong2wen1 na4xie1 zao3yi3 feng1cun2 de5 ji4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 wo3 shi2 si4 sui4 sheng1ri4 hou4 de5 ji3tian1，wo3 kai1shi3……xian3 xian4 chu1 le5 mo2fa3 de5 zheng1zhao4。"

msgid ""
"Right. Wrong. What does it matter now? What's done is done.\n"
"\n"
"Besides, chief, that was a totally badass play. Ten points for style, no question about it."
msgstr ""
"事已至此​，​对​或​错​还有​什么​关系​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说头儿​，​这招​玩​得​太狠​了​。​我​必须​得​给​你​这​一手​打​满分​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3，dui4 huo4 cuo4 hai2you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1 tou2 er2，zhe4 zhao1 wan2 de2 tai4 hen3 le5。wo3 bi4xu1 de2 gei3 ni3 zhe4 yi1shou3 da3 man3fen1。"

msgid ""
"Right. Wrong. Who the hell knows? We're dealing with things so much larger than us that it's hard to say any more.\n"
"\n"
"If this gets APEX off of our backs, then I'm all for it. The Firewing can fend for herself."
msgstr ""
"对​或​错​，​谁又能​知道​呢​？​我们​要​应对​的​事情​已经​远远​超越​了​我们​自身​的​能力​范围​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​这样​能​让​我们​摆脱​APEX​，​那​我举​双手赞成​。​火翼​的​事​就让​她​自己​想​办法​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 huo4 cuo4，shei2 you4 neng2 zhi1dao4 ni2？wo3men5 yao4 ying4dui4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 yuan3yuan3 chao1yue4 le5 wo3men5 zi4shen1 de5 neng2li4 fan4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4yang4 neng2 rang4 wo3men5 bai3tuo1 APEX，na4 wo3 ju3 shuang1 shou3 zan4 cheng2。Huo3yi4 de5 shi4 jiu4 rang4 ta1 zi4ji3 xiang3 ban4fa3 ba1。"

msgid "Riiiight..."
msgstr ""
"确实​……\n"
"que4shi2……"

