"lie4 jia3：bo1li2 mu4biao1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2，bing4 zao4cheng2 +1 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4 -5 %，leng3que4 shi2jian1：2 hui2he2。"

