"yong4yu2 zeng1qiang2 mo2fa3 neng2li4 de5 chang2pao2，dan4 ti2gong1 de5 wu4li3 fang2hu4 you3xian4。ti2gong1 +1 yi4zhi4 he4 +1 mei4li4。"

