"终于​逃脱​了​恶龙​的​怒火​之后​，​整个​德国​都​将沃​克莱尔​奉​为​英雄​……​他​就是​我们​的​齐格飞​，​当代​的​屠龙​勇士​。​我​的​家人​几乎​把​他​当​神明​般​崇拜​。\n"
"zhong1yu2 tao2tuo1 le5 e4 long2 de5 nu4huo3 zhi1hou4，zheng3ge4 de2guo2 dou1 jiang1 Wo4ke4lai2er3 feng4 wei2 ying1xiong2……ta1 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 de5 qi2 ge2 fei1，dang1dai4 de5 tu2 long2 yong3shi4。wo3 de5 jia1ren2 ji1hu1 ba3 ta1 dang1 shen2ming2 ban1 chong2bai4。"

