msgid "Samuel Beckenbauer"
msgstr ""
"塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔\n"
"sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3"

msgid ""
"Samuel Beckenbauer is a good man. Perhaps a bit xenophobic, but this is to be expected; he stands up for the rights of the Goblinoid races - the orks and the trolls, yes? - and they have been more vilified and victimized than any of the other metahuman breeds.\n"
"\n"
"What is important is that he is a leader and a healer, and that he helps his people."
msgstr ""
"塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔​是​个​好人​。​或许​有些​排外​，​但​这​也​在​情理之中​—​—​他​始终​捍卫​着​地​精​种族​，​也​就是​那些​兽​人​和​巨魔​的​权益​。​毕竟​他们​比​其他​变​人类​种族​遭受​过​更​多​的​污名​和​迫害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​关键在于​，​他​既​是​领袖​，​也​是​医者​，​始终​在​帮助​自己​的​族人​。\n"
"\n"
"sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2。huo4xu3 you3xie1 pai2wai4，dan4 zhe4 ye3 zai4 qing2 li3 zhi1 zhong4——ta1 shi3zhong1 han4wei4 zhao2 de5 jing1 zhong3zu2，ye3 jiu4shi4 na4xie1 shou4 ren2 he4 ju4mo2 de5 quan2yi4。bi4jing4 ta1men5 bi3 qi2ta1 bian4 ren2lei4 zhong3zu2 zao1shou4 guo4 geng1 duo1 de5 wu1ming2 he4 po4hai4。\n"
"\n"
"guan1 jian4 zai4 yu2，ta1 ji4 shi4 ling3xiu4，ye3 shi4 yi1 zhe3，shi3zhong1 zai4 bang1zhu4 zi4ji3 de5 zu2ren2。"

msgid ""
"Samuel is well known throughout the city. He could rally the orks and trolls"
" of Berlin if he so chose. But before he'd ever rise for war, he would "
"confer with Laine. (h)"
msgstr ""
"这座​城市​没人​不​知道​塞缪尔​的​大名​。​只要​他​愿意​的话​，​就​能​号召​全​柏林​的​兽​人​和​巨魔​。​但​如果说​他​要​发动战争​的话​，​那​他​肯定​会先​和莱恩​商议​。\n"
"zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 mei2 ren2 bu4 zhi1dao4 sai4miu4er3 de5 da4ming2。zhi3yao4 ta1 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，jiu4 neng2 hao4zhao4 quan2 bo2lin2 de5 shou4 ren2 he4 ju4mo2。dan4 ru2guo3shuo1 ta1 yao4 fa1 dong4 zhan4 zheng1 de5hua4，na4 ta1 ken3ding4 hui4 xian1 he4 lai2 en1 shang1yi4。"

