msgid ""
"Saving the clones was a bold move. It would've been easier to leave them where they were and consider them collateral damage.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But it was the right choice, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"救​下​那些​克隆​体​的​行为​有些​鲁莽​。​把​他们​留在​原地​自生自灭​或许​会​更​容易​一些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​的​决定​是​正确​的​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xia4 na4xie1 ke4long2 ti3 de5 xing2wei2 you3xie1 lu3mang3。ba3 ta1men5 liu2 zai4 yuan2di4 zi4sheng1zi4mie4 huo4xu3 hui4 geng1 rong2yi4 yi1xie1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 de5 jue2ding4 shi4 zheng4que4 de5，$(l.name)。"

