msgstr ""
"随便​你​怎么​说​吧​。​我​今天​做​了​该​做​的​事​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1 ba1。wo3 jin1tian1 zuo4 le5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Say, chief... if you wanted me to, I could probably set things right for these kids from inside the facility.\n"
"\n"
"If I tossed the Azzies' utility logs, they'd have no way of tracing the power spike back to this conduit."
msgstr ""
"喂​，​头儿​……​如果​你​想​的话​，​我​大概​能​在​设施​内部​帮​这些​孩子​把​事情​解决​掉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我​删掉​阿兹佬​的​维护​日志​，​他们​就​没有​办法​将​电力​尖峰​追溯到​这个​管道​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wei2，tou2r5……ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 de5hua4，wo3 da4gai4 neng2 zai4 she4shi1 nei4bu4 bang1 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5 ba3 shi4qing5 jie3jue2 diao4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 shan1diao4 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 wei2hu4 ri4zhi4，ta1men5 jiu4 mei2you3 ban4fa3 jiang1 dian4li4 jian1feng1 dui1 su4 dao4 zhe4ge5 guan3dao4 le5。"

msgid "Say, have you ever heard the story of Schinderhannes?"
msgstr ""
"话​说​，​你​听​过​辛德​汉内斯​的​故事​吗​？\n"
"hua4 shuo1，ni3 ting1 guo4 xin1 de2 han4 nei4 si1 de5 gu4shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Say, have you heard anything about a gang hiding out around here? A group "
"calling themselves the Rabengeister?"
msgstr ""
"话​说​，​你​有没有​听说​这​附近​藏​着​一伙​自称​“​鸦灵​”​的​歹徒​帮派​？\n"
"hua4 shuo1，ni3 you3mei2you3 ting1shuo1 zhe4 fu4jin4 zang4 zhao2 yi1 huo3 zi4cheng1“Ya1ling2” de5 dai3tu2 bang1pai4？"

msgid ""
"Say, what’s up with those scuff marks on the ground over there by that "
"information kiosk?"
msgstr ""
"话​说​，​那个​信息​亭​旁边​地上​的​擦痕​是​怎么回事​？\n"
"hua4 shuo1，na4ge5 xin4xi1 ting2 pang2bian1 di4shang5 de5 ca1 hen2 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "Say, you're Monika's new... associate, yes?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​你​就是​莫妮卡​的​新​……​联络人​？\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 jiu4shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 xin1……lian2luo4ren2？"

msgid "Sağ olun, my friend. Be healthy, be strong."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​，​我​的​朋友​。​保重​身体​，​保持​坚强​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，wo3 de5 peng2you5。bao3zhong4 shen1ti3，bao3chi2 jian1qiang2。"

msgid "Scalding hot is the way I like it."
msgstr ""
"我​就​喜欢​喝​烫​的​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 xi3huan5 he4 tang4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Scanning over the tastefully-designed catalog, you find that most of "
"AugmenTech's stock consists of overpriced cosmetic cyberware; metabolic "
"tweaks to help burn away cellulite, ruthenium polymer hair extensions, "
"ultra-expensive Leonization treatments aimed at wealthy septuagenarians."
msgstr ""
"翻阅​这本​设计​雅致​的​目录​，​你​发现​“​增强​科技​”​库存​的​大部分​商品​都​是​价格​虚高​的​美容​型​赛博​改造​：​能​加速​代谢​消除​橘皮​组织​的​代谢​调节器​、​钌​聚合物​发片​，​以及​专​为​富裕​的​七旬​老人​设计​的​昂贵​莱昂​化​治疗​。\n"
"fan1yue4 zhe4 ben3 she4ji4 ya3zhi4 de5 mu4lu4，ni3 fa1xian4“zeng1qiang2 ke1ji4” ku4cun2 de5 da4bu4fen5 shang1pin3 dou1 shi4 jia4ge2 xu1 gao1 de5 mei3rong2 xing2 sai4bo2 gai3zao4：neng2 jia1su4 dai4xie4 xiao1chu2 ju2 pi2 zu3zhi1 de5 dai4xie4 tiao2jie2qi4、liao3 ju4he2wu4 fa1 pian1，yi3ji2 zhuan1 wei2 fu4yu4 de5 qi1 xun2 lao3ren2 she4ji4 de5 ang2gui4 lai2 ang2 hua4 zhi4liao2。"

msgid ""
"Scare tactics. Gangs, from the sounds of it. Intimidate the children to "
"intimidate the parents. Despicable."
msgstr ""
"恐吓​手段​。​听​起来​像是​帮派​所​为​。​先​恐吓​孩子​，​借此​恐吓​他们​的​家长​。​卑鄙​至极​。\n"
"kong3he4 shou3duan4。ting1 qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 bang1pai4 suo3 wei2。xian1 kong3he4 hai2zi5，jie4ci3 kong3he4 ta1men5 de5 jia1zhang3。bei1bi3 zhi4ji2。"

msgid "Scared Male Voice"
msgstr ""
"惊恐​的​男声\n"
"jing1kong3 de5 nan2 sheng1"

