msgstr ""
"惊恐​的​实验​体\n"
"jing1kong3 de5 shi2yan4 ti3"

msgid ""
"Scary stuff. I haven't heard rumors of anything like that around here, thank"
" God."
msgstr ""
"挺​吓人​的​。​还好​我​没​听说​这​附近​有​任何​这样​的​东西​。\n"
"ting3 xia4ren2 de5。hai2hao3 wo3 mei2 ting1shuo1 zhe4 fu4jin4 you3 ren4he2 zhe4yang4 de5 dong1xi1。"

