msgstr ""
"Scene​ ​Transition\n"
"Scene Transition"

msgid "Schattennest"
msgstr ""
"影巢\n"
"ying3 chao2"

msgid ""
"Schattennest. Isn't that where we're supposed to go for the Beckenbauer job?"
msgstr ""
"影巢​……​我们​是不是​要​去​那儿​完成​贝肯鲍尔​的​差事​来​着​？\n"
"ying3 chao2……wo3men5 shi4bu5shi4 yao4 qu4 na4r5 wan2cheng2 Bei4ken3bao4er3 de5 cha4shi4 lai2 zhao2？"

msgid ""
"Schattennest. The kiez next door to the Kreuzbasar, and an object lesson in anarchy gone wrong. Violent gangs rule the streets here, trading territory to the roar of gunfire. The streets are a warzone.\n"
"\n"
"As dangerous as Schattennest already is, it could be worse. The gangs are vicious, but disorganized - they pose little risk to their neighbors. With little more than a makeshift barricade and a few volunteers, the Kreuzbasar has successfully insulated itself from the chaos of its neighboring kiez.\n"
"\n"
"The Engineer could change all of that. He has to be stopped, and the F-State as a whole needs to be alerted to what his clients are trying to do. It's up to you and Eiger to make sure that happens."
msgstr ""
"影巢​是​克洛伊​茨​集市​隔壁​的​街区​，​也​是​无政府​状态​失控​的​典型​写照​。​暴力​团伙​在​此​称霸​街头​，​在​枪声​轰鸣​中​争夺​地盘​。​整条​街道​宛如​战场​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽说​影巢​如今​是​个​危险​之地​，​但​情况​尚属​可控​。​这些​团伙​十分​凶残​，​但​组织​混乱​，​因此​对​周围​的​威胁​不算​多大​。​仅凭​一处​临时​路障​和​几名​志愿者​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​便​成功​隔绝​了​这个​邻近​街区​的​混乱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​工程师​的​出现​将​彻底改变​局面​。​必须​阻止​他​，​更要​让​整个​动荡​带​知晓​其​雇主​的​阴谋​。​这​一切​都​取决于​你​和​艾格尔​的​行动​。\n"
"\n"
"ying3 chao2 shi4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ge2bi4 de5 jie1qu1，ye3 shi4 wu2 zheng4 fu3 zhuang4tai4 shi1kong4 de5 dian3xing2 xie3zhao4。bao4li4 tuan2huo3 zai4 ci3 cheng1ba4 jie1tou2，zai4 qiang1sheng1 hong1ming2 zhong4 zheng1duo2 di4pan2。zheng3tiao2 jie1dao4 wan3ru2 zhan4chang3。\n"
"\n"
"sui1shuo1 ying3 chao2 ru2jin1 shi4 ge4 wei1xian3 zhi1 de5，dan4 qing2kuang4 shang4 shu3 ke3 kong4。zhe4xie1 tuan2huo3 shi2fen1 xiong1can2，dan4 zu3zhi1 hun4luan4，yin1ci3 dui4 zhou1wei2 de5 wei1xie2 bu4suan4 duo1da4。jin3 ping2 yi1 chu3 lin2shi2 lu4zhang4 he4 ji1 ming2 zhi4yuan4zhe3，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 bian4 cheng2gong1 ge2jue2 le5 zhe4ge5 lin2jin4 jie1qu1 de5 hun4luan4。\n"
