msgid ""
"Second? Before you ask, those debts are for services rendered. I was in a "
"tight spot, I needed some help, and I threw around a lot of IOUs to get it."
msgstr ""
"第二​？​在​你​问​之前​，​那些​债务​都​是​为了​支付​已​提供​的​服务​。​我​当时​处境​艰难​，​需要​一些​帮助​，​于是​开出​了​很多​欠条​来​解决问题​。\n"
"di4er4？zai4 ni3 wen4 zhi1qian2，na4xie1 zhai4wu4 dou1 shi4 wei4le5 zhi1fu4 yi3 ti2gong1 de5 fu2wu4。wo3 dang1shi2 chu3jing4 jian1nan2，xu1yao4 yi1xie1 bang1zhu4，yu2shi4 kai1 chu1 le5 hen3 duo1 qian4tiao2 lai2 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2。"

