msgid ""
"Secondly, his injuries are described in great detail. The prognosis was fairly grim; at the time of admission, Audran had sustained third degree burns over sixty percent of his body.\n"
"\n"
"He had also been on the receiving end of massive blunt force trauma. Two of his ribs were broken, and his pelvis had been shattered."
msgstr ""
"其次​，​病历​详细​记录​了​他​的​伤势​。​预后​相当​不​乐观​：​入院​时​，​奥​德兰​全身​百分之六十​的​面积​遭受​了​三度​烧伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​还​受到​了​严重​的​钝器​创伤​。​两根​肋骨​断裂​，​骨盆​被​击碎​。\n"
"\n"
"qi2ci4，bing4li4 xiang2xi4 ji4lu4 le5 ta1 de5 shang1shi4。yu4hou4 xiang1dang1 bu4 le4guan1：ru4yuan4 shi2，Ao4de2lan2 quan2shen1 bai3 fen4 zhi1 liu4 shi2 de5 mian4ji1 zao1shou4 le5 san1du4 shao1shang1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hai2 shou4dao4 le5 yan2zhong4 de5 dun4qi4 chuang1shang1。liang3 gen1 lei4gu3 duan4lie4，gu3pen2 bei4 ji1sui4。"

msgid ""
