"time. I trust that you understand what I mean by that."
msgstr ""
"其次​，​一旦​你​带​着​钱​去​兔子​洞​，​就​没有​回头路​了​。​我​相信​你​明白​我​的​意思​。\n"
"qi2ci4，yi1dan4 ni3 dai4 zhao2 qian2 qu4 tu4zi5 dong4，jiu4 mei2you3 hui2tou2lu4 le5。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 ming2bai5 wo3 de5 yi4si5。"

msgid ""
