"time. And you've got a bunch more physical security incoming."
msgstr ""
"第二句​：​我​觉得​我能​把​你​弄出去​，​但​这​需要​点​时间​。​以及​有​大批​实体​安保​人员​朝​你​过去​了​。\n"
"di4 er4 ju4：wo3 jue2de5 wo3 neng2 ba3 ni3 long4 chu1 qu4，dan4 zhe4 xu1yao4 dian3 shi2jian1。yi3ji2 you3 da4pi1 shi2ti3 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 chao2 ni3 guo4qu4 le5。"

