msgid "See anything you like?"
msgstr ""
"有​什么​趁眼​的​东西​吗​？\n"
"you3 shen2me5 chen4 yan3 de5 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"See for yourself.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She raises an arm, and you feel a burst of warmth and comfort in your chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It wants to help people - to heal them. It wants redemption, just like I do.\n"
"\n"
"Together, maybe we'll find it."
msgstr ""
"你​自己​看看​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​抬起​手臂​，​你​胸口​顿时​涌起​一阵​温暖​与​慰藉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​想要​帮助​人们​—​—​治愈​他们​。​它​想要​得到​救赎​，​就​像​我​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或许​，​我们​将​携手​找到​答案​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zi4ji3 kan4kan5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2qi3 shou3bi4，ni3 xiong1kou3 dun4shi2 yong3qi3 yi1zhen4 wen1nuan3 yu4 wei4jie4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang3yao4 bang1zhu4 ren2men5——zhi4yu4 ta1men5。ta1 xiang3yao4 de2dao4 jiu4shu2，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3，wo3men5 jiang1 xie2shou3 zhao3dao4 da2an4。"

msgid "See something funny?"
msgstr ""
"看见​什么​有趣​的​东西​了​吗​？\n"
"kan4jian4 shen2me5 you3qu4 de5 dong1xi1 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"See that you do.\n"
"\n"
"This isn't the sort of decision that should be made lightly."
msgstr ""
"务必​谨慎​些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不是​随便​就​能​给出​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"wu4bi4 jin3shen4 xie1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 sui2bian4 jiu4 neng2 gei3 chu1 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"See the cameras in the corner of the room?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glancing up, you notice a pair of security cameras. They're tiny things, their casings colored to blend in with the dingy wallpaper... easy to miss if you didn't know to look for them.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Wave hi. I'm on the other side of 'em."
msgstr ""
"瞧见​房间​角落里​的​摄像头​没​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​抬头​望去​，​注意​到​两台​监控​摄像头​。​它们​体积​微小​，​外壳​颜色​与​陈旧​的​壁纸​融为一体​……​如果​不是​刻意​寻找​的话​，​很​容易​被​忽略​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​挥手​打个招呼​吧​。​我​就​在​另一头​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"qiao2jian4 fang2jian1 jiao3 la4 li3 de5 she4xiang4tou2 mei2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 tai2tou2 wang4 qu4，zhu4yi4 dao4 liang3 tai2 jian1kong4 she4xiang4tou2。ta1men5 ti3ji1 wei1xiao3，wai4ke2 yan2se4 yu4 chen2jiu4 de5 bi4zhi3 rong2wei2yi1ti3……ru2guo3 bu4shi4 ke4yi4 xun2zhao3 de5hua4，hen3 rong2yi4 bei4 hu1lu:e4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui1shou3 da3 ge4 zhao1 hu1 ba1。wo3 jiu4 zai4 ling4 yi1 tou2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"See what I mean? *That's* what this is all about - he wants the box. He doesn't even know what it is, but he's willing to kill an old man for it. How is that not sending up red flags for you?\n"
"\n"
"I'm telling you, I work for a loan shark, and *I* wouldn't feel safe around this guy."
msgstr ""
"懂​我​意思​了​吧​？​就是​*​这么​*​回事​—​—​他​想要​的​是​盒子​。​他​甚至​都​不​知道​里面​有​什么​，​但​却​愿意​杀死​一个​老人​来​抢夺​它​。​难道​你​不会​对此​有所​警惕​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​说​，​哪怕​*​我​*​在​高利贷​行业​工作​，​我​都​觉得​和​这​家伙​合作​并​不​安全​。\n"
"\n"
"dong3 wo3 yi4si5 le5 ba1？jiu4shi4*zhe4me5*hui2shi4——ta1 xiang3yao4 de5 shi4 he2zi5。ta1 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 li3mian4 you3 shen2me5，dan4 que4 yuan4yi4 sha1si3 yi1ge5 lao3ren2 lai2 qiang3duo2 ta1。nan2dao4 ni3 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 you3suo3 jing3ti4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1，na3pa4*wo3*zai4 gao1li4dai4 hang2ye4 gong1zuo4，wo3 dou1 jue2de5 he4 zhe4 jia1huo5 he2zuo4 bing4 bu4 an1quan2。"

msgid "See you around."
msgstr ""
"回头见​。\n"
"hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid "See you in the real world, Glory."
msgstr ""
"现实​世界​见​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"xian4shi2 shi4jie4 jian4，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid ""
"See? Nothing to worry about.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}You hear satisfaction in her voice - satisfaction, and arrogance.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"瞧​？​没什么​好​担心​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​带​着​满足​，​以及​傲慢​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"qiao2？mei2shen2me5 hao3 dan1xin1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 man3zu2，yi3ji2 ao4man4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"See? You'll be just fine with this guy. It all worked out okay in the end."
msgstr ""
"看吧​？​你​和​这​家伙​待​着​没​问题​的​。​问题​解决​。\n"
"kan4 ba1？ni3 he4 zhe4 jia1huo5 dai1 zhao2 mei2 wen4ti2 de5。wen4ti2 jie3jue2。"

msgid ""
"Seeing Winters' body like that was enough to convince me. You couldn't have done anything to help Monika... and I couldn't have, either.\n"
"\n"
"We're dealing with something new."
msgstr ""
"看到​温特斯​的​尸体​成​了​那​副​模样​，​就​足以​说服​我​了​。​你​当时​做​什么​都​救​不了​莫妮卡​……​而​我​也​一样​无能为力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​对付​的​是​某种​从未见过​的​敌人​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4dao4 Wen1te4si1 de5 shi1ti3 cheng2 le5 na4 fu4 mu2yang4，jiu4 zu2yi3 shuo1fu2 wo3 le5。ni3 dang1shi2 zuo4 shen2me5 dou1 jiu4 bu4le5 Mo4ni1ka3……er2 wo3 ye3 yi1yang4 wu2neng2wei2li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 shi4 mou3zhong3 cong2 wei4 jian4 guo4 de5 di2ren2。"

msgid "Seeing the truth, I think."
msgstr ""
"我​想​是​在​寻求​真相​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shi4 zai4 xun2qiu2 zhen1xiang4。"

msgid "Seeker"
msgstr ""
"追寻​者\n"
"zhui1xun2 zhe3"

msgid "Seeker Spirit"
msgstr ""
"追寻​者​精魂\n"
"zhui1xun2 zhe3 jing1hun2"

msgid "Seemed that no sooner had we settled than the Russians were invading."
msgstr ""
"我们​刚​安顿下来​，​俄国人​就​发动​了​入侵​。\n"
"wo3men5 gang1 an1 dun4 xia4 lai2，e2guo2ren2 jiu4 fa1dong4 le5 ru4qin1。"

msgid "Seems like you made it through in one piece."
msgstr ""
"看起来​你​安然无恙​地​脱险​了​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 ni3 an1ran2wu2yang4 de5 tuo1xian3 le5。"

msgid "Seems she was a mother to the whole Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"她​可以​算作​整个​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​母亲​了​。\n"
"ta1 ke3yi3 suan4 zuo4 zheng3ge4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 mu3qin1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Seems simple enough, boss. To kill the AI, we'll have to flip two switches, wait a few minutes, then push a button. Oh, and we'll also need to protect the terminal that the button is set into.\n"
"\n"
"Doesn't sound too tough, all things considered."
msgstr ""
"看起来​很​简单​，​老大​。​要​干掉​AI​，​我们​得拉下​两个​开关​，​等​几分钟​，​然后​按下​一个​按钮​。​哦​，​对​了​，​还​得​保护​按钮​所在​的​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​听​起来​并​不难​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 hen3 jian3dan1，lao3da4。yao4 gan4diao4 AI，wo3men5 de2 la1 xia4 liang3 ge4 kai1guan1，deng3 ji1 fen4 zhong1，ran2hou4 an4xia4 yi1ge5 an4niu3。e2，dui4 le5，hai2 de2 bao3hu4 an4niu3 suo3zai4 de5 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，ting1 qi3lai5 bing4 bu4 nan2。"

msgid "Seems that way."
msgstr ""
"看起来​是​这样​。\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"Seismological data and thermal imaging confirm the existence of a large, "
"hollow chamber under the estate. It is my suspicion that Doctor Vauclair is "
"being held somewhere within this substructure."
msgstr ""
"地震学​数据​与​热​成像​技术​均​证实​，​庄园​地底​存在​某个​巨大​空洞​。​我​怀疑​沃​克莱尔​博士​就​被​关押​在​这个​地下​结构​的​某处​。\n"
"di4zhen4xue2 shu4ju4 yu4 re4 cheng2xiang4 ji4shu4 jun1 zheng4shi2，zhuang1yuan2 di4di3 cun2zai4 mou3 ge4 ju4da4 kong1dong4。wo3 huai2yi2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 jiu4 bei4 guan1ya1 zai4 zhe4ge5 di4xia4 jie2gou4 de5 mou3chu4。"

msgid "Seizing the opportunity, you attack."
msgstr ""
"你​趁机​发起​了​进攻​。\n"
"ni3 chen4ji1 fa1qi3 le5 jin4gong1。"

