msgid ""
"Shadowrun Returns can be a memory-intensive game. It is recommended that you"
" avoid switching to other applications while in the middle of a scene, as "
"this may cause your device to unload Shadowrun Returns from memory, losing "
"your progress in the current scene. Shadowrun Returns automatically "
"checkpoints your progress between scenes."
msgstr ""
"《​暗影​狂奔​：​归来​》​是​一款​对​内存​需求​较​高​的​游戏​。​建议​在​场景​进行​中​避免​切换​至​其他​应用程序​，​否则​设备​可能​会​将​游戏​从​内存​中​卸载​，​导致​当前​场景​进度​丢失​。​游戏​会​在​场景​之间​自动​保存​进度​。\n"
"《 an4Ying3kuang2ben1：gui1lai2 》 shi4 yi1 kuan3 dui4 nei4cun2 xu1qiu2 jiao4 gao1 de5 you2xi4。jian4yi4 zai4 chang3jing3 jin4xing2 zhong4 bi4mian3 qie1huan4 zhi4 qi2ta1 ying4yong4cheng2xu4，fou3ze2 she4bei4 ke3neng2 hui4 jiang1 you2xi4 cong2 nei4cun2 zhong4 xie4zai4，dao3zhi4 dang1qian2 chang3jing3 jin4du4 diu1shi1。you2xi4 hui4 zai4 chang3jing3 zhi1jian1 zi4dong4 bao3cun2 jin4du4。"

