"Key Specialization: Spirit Control"
msgstr ""
"萨满​相信​其​魔法​源自​指引​人生道路​的​伟大​图腾​精魂​—​—​熊​、​猫​、​郊狼​、​鹰​或​浣熊​。​萨满​与​图腾​的​联结​使​其能​召唤​精魂​并​驱使​它们​服从​指令​。​萨满​能够​施展​令​法师​望尘莫及​的​咒术​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​主要​属性​：​魅力​\n"
"​主要​技能​：​精魂​召唤​（​提升​此​技能​可使​萨满​的​图腾​增强​）​，​咒术​\n"
"​主要​专长​：​精魂​控制\n"
"\n"
"sa4man3 xiang1xin4 qi2 mo2fa3 yuan2zi4 zhi3yin3 ren2 sheng1 dao4 lu4 de5 wei3da4 tu2teng2 jing1hun2——xiong2、mao2、jiao1lang2、ying1 huo4 huan4xiong2。sa4man3 yu4 tu2teng2 de5 lian2jie2 shi3 qi2 neng2 zhao4huan4 jing1hun2 bing4 qu1shi3 ta1men5 fu2cong2 zhi3ling4。sa4man3 neng2gou4 shi1zhan3 ling3 fa3shi1 wang4chen2mo4ji2 de5 zhou4 shu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhu3yao4 shu3xing4：mei4li4 \n"
"zhu3yao4 ji4neng2：jing1hun2 zhao4huan4 （ti2sheng1 ci3 ji4neng2 ke3 shi3 sa4man3 de5 tu2teng2 zeng1qiang2），zhou4 shu4 \n"
"zhu3yao4 zhuan1chang2：jing1hun2 kong4zhi4"

msgid ""
"Shame it had to come to that. He just...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice trails off to nothing.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"事情​到​这份​上​真是​可惜​。​他​怎么​会​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​渐渐​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 dao4 zhe4 fen4 shang4 zhen1shi5 ke3xi1。ta1 zen3me5 hui4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 jian4jian4 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Shapes form in the shadows below, and after a moment, you hear footsteps "
"approaching and people talking."
msgstr ""
"阴影​下​有​某种​形状​，​过​了​一会儿​，​你​听到​脚步声​越来越近​，​还有​人​说话​的​声音​。\n"
"yin1ying3 xia4 you3 mou3zhong3 xing2zhuang4，guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ni3 ting1dao4 jiao3 bu4 sheng1 yue4 lai2 yue4 jin4，hai2you3 ren2 shuo1hua4 de5 sheng1yin1。"

msgid "Shapes form in the shadows below, but you can't make anything out."
msgstr ""
"阴影​下​有​某种​形状​，​但​你​无法​辨认出​具体​是​什么​。\n"
"yin1ying3 xia4 you3 mou3zhong3 xing2zhuang4，dan4 ni3 wu2fa3 bian4 ren4 chu1 ju4ti3 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Shapes form in the shadows below, but you can't make anything out. \n"
"\n"
"You can hear one clear voice coming from below. It speaks with authority."
msgstr ""
"阴影​下​有​某种​形状​，​但​你​无法​辨认出​具体​是​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​听到​某个​清晰​的​声音​从​下面​传来​。​它​以​一种​权威​的​语气​说话​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1ying3 xia4 you3 mou3zhong3 xing2zhuang4，dan4 ni3 wu2fa3 bian4 ren4 chu1 ju4ti3 shi4 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 ting1dao4 mou3 ge4 qing1xi1 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 xia4mian4 chuan2lai2。ta1 yi3 yi1zhong3 quan2wei1 de5 yu3qi4 shuo1hua4。"

msgid "Shapes form in the shadows below."
msgstr ""
"阴影​下​有​某种​形状​。\n"
"yin1ying3 xia4 you3 mou3zhong3 xing2zhuang4。"

msgid "Shark Tank."
msgstr ""
"鲨鱼​缸​。\n"
"sha1yu2 gang1。"

msgid "Shark Tank: Password to get into the Hacker's Room"
msgstr ""
"鲨鱼​缸​：​进入​黑客​房间​的​密码\n"
"sha1yu2 gang1：jin4ru4 hei1ke4 fang2jian1 de5 mi4ma3"

msgid "Sharpshooter"
msgstr ""
"神射手\n"
"shen2 she4 shou3"

msgid ""
"She also mentioned that you found something in Winters' safe... a package full of very old discs.\n"
"\n"
"May I see them?"
msgstr ""
"她​还​提到​你​在​温特斯​的​保险箱​里​发现​了​一些​东西​……​一捆​非常​古老​的​碟片​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​看看​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hai2 ti2dao4 ni3 zai4 Wen1te4si1 de5 bao3xian3xiang1 li3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1xie1 dong1xi1……yi1 kun3 fei1chang2 gu3lao3 de5 die2pian4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 kan4kan5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"She also said that the building was in gang territory now. I wonder if it'll"
" be anything like Das Kesselhaus was..."
msgstr ""
"她​还​说​那栋​楼​现在​成​了​某个​帮派​的​领地​。​不​知道​那里​会​不会​和​“​锅炉房​”​的​情况​类似​……\n"
"ta1 hai2 shuo1 na4 dong4 lou2 xian4zai4 cheng2 le5 mou3 ge4 bang1pai4 de5 ling3di4。bu4 zhi1dao4 na4li5 hui4 bu4hui4 he4“Guo1lu2fang2” de5 qing2kuang4 lei4si4……"

msgid ""
"She appears as Amsel described her: an impressive-looking woman of Aztlaner descent, with coffee-colored skin and dark, wavy hair. Everything about her screams \"corporate executive,\" from her expensive-looking suit to her tastefully understated makeup.\n"
"\n"
"She's obviously nervous, but she's hiding it well. She locks eyes with you and hesitates only slightly before speaking."
msgstr ""
"她​正如​阿姆​泽尔​描述​的​那般​：​一位​气场​十足​的​阿兹特​兰​后裔​女性​，​有着​咖啡色​的​肌肤​与​一头​乌黑​的​卷发​。​从​昂贵​的​西装​到​雅致​低调​的​妆容​，​她​浑身​都​散发​着​“​企业​高管​”​的​气质​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​显然​很​紧张​，​却​隐藏​得​很​好​。​她​与​你​四目​相对​，​稍作​迟疑​便​开口​说话​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zheng4ru2 E1mu3ze2er3 miao2shu4 de5 na4 ban1：yi1 wei4 qi4chang3 shi2zu2 de5 e1 zi1 te4 lan2 hou4yi4 nu:3xing4，you3zhe5 ka1fei1se4 de5 ji1fu1 yu4 yi1tou2 wu1hei1 de5 juan3fa4。cong2 ang2gui4 de5 xi1zhuang1 dao4 ya3zhi4 di1diao4 de5 zhuang1rong2，ta1 hun2shen1 dou1 san4fa1 zhao2“qi3ye4 gao1guan3” de5 qi4zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xian3ran2 hen3 jin3zhang1，que4 yin3cang2 de2 hen3 hao3。ta1 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4，shao1 zuo4 chi2yi2 bian4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"She beams at the compliment. From her body language, it's clear that she "
"idolizes Beckenbauer."
msgstr ""
"她​听到​赞美​后​喜笑颜开​。​从​她​的​肢体​语言​可以​看出​，​她​非常​崇拜​贝肯鲍尔​。\n"
"ta1 ting1dao4 zan4mei3 hou4 xi3xiao4yan2kai1。cong2 ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 ke3yi3 kan4chu1，ta1 fei1chang2 chong2bai4 Bei4ken3bao4er3。"

msgid "She blinks. Clearly, she doesn't understand."
msgstr ""
"她​眨​眨眼​，​显然​没有​理解​你​的话​。\n"
"ta1 zha3 zha3yan3，xian3ran2 mei2you3 li3jie3 ni3 de5hua4。"

msgid "She checks the data readout on the terminal next to the woman."
msgstr ""
"她​检查​着​女人​旁边​的​终端​数据​。\n"
"ta1 jian3cha2 zhao2 nu:3ren2 pang2bian1 de5 zhong1duan1 shu4ju4。"

msgid "She closes her eyes, rapt."
msgstr ""
"她​闭上眼睛​，​沉浸​其中​。\n"
"ta1 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1，chen2jin4 qi2zhong1。"

msgid "She collapses to her knees, sobbing."
msgstr ""
"她​跪倒​在​地​，​啜泣​起来​。\n"
"ta1 gui4dao3 zai4 de5，chuo4qi4 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"She deserved to die. Remember what she did to the other kids here. To you."
msgstr ""
"她​是​罪有应得​。​想想​她​对​这里​其他​孩子​做​的​事​。​还有​对​你​做​的​那些​事​。\n"
"ta1 shi4 zui4you3ying1de2。xiang3 xiang3 ta1 dui4 zhe4li3 qi2ta1 hai2zi5 zuo4 de5 shi4。hai2you3 dui4 ni3 zuo4 de5 na4xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"She did a good job of covering her tracks, but I can see the signs.\n"
"\n"
"She grabbed the data and ran, end of story."
msgstr ""
"她​掩盖​踪迹​的​手段​很​高明​，​但​我​还是​发现​了​不对劲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​带​着​数据​逃走​了​，​事情​就是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yan3gai4 zong1ji4 de5 shou3duan4 hen3 gao1ming2，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 fa1xian4 le5 bu4dui4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dai4 zhao2 shu4ju4 tao2zou3 le5，shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"She did a great job of covering her tracks, but I can see the signs. She "
"lifted a file from me before she left."
msgstr ""
"她​掩盖​踪迹​的​手段​很​高明​，​但​我​还是​发现​了​不对劲​。​她​走​之前​还​拿​上​了​一份​文件​。\n"
"ta1 yan3gai4 zong1ji4 de5 shou3duan4 hen3 gao1ming2，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 fa1xian4 le5 bu4dui4jin4。ta1 zou3 zhi1qian2 hai2 na2 shang4 le5 yi1 fen4 wen2jian4。"

msgid ""
"She didn't. I'm guessing it was jealousy.\n"
"\n"
"See, some posers don't like to spend a lot of time around the real deal. Makes 'em feel a little... insecure."
msgstr ""
"确实​。​我​猜​是因为​嫉妒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有些​装模作样​的​人​不​喜欢​和​真正​的​行家​待​在​一起​，​否则​他们​会​感觉​有点​……​没​安全感​。\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2。wo3 cai1 shi4 yin1 wei2 ji2du4。\n"
"\n"
"you3xie1 zhuang1mo2zuo4yang4 de5 ren2 bu4 xi3huan5 he4 zhen1zheng4 de5 hang2jia1 dai1 zai4 yi1qi3，fou3ze2 ta1men5 hui4 gan3jue2 you3dian3……mei2 an1quan2gan3。"

msgid ""
"She glances down, and you can see the worry begin to creep onto her face.\n"
"\n"
"The wild look in her eyes slowly dies away, replaced by the cool, analytical expression that you've come to know."
msgstr ""
"她​低头​看​了​一眼​，​你​看得出​忧虑​正​悄悄​浮现​在​她​脸上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​眼中​的​狂野​慢慢​消失​，​取而代之​的​是​你​所​熟悉​的​冷静​与​理性​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 di1tou2 kan4 le5 yi1yan3，ni3 kan4de5chu1 you1lu:4 zheng1 qiao1qiao1 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 kuang2ye3 man4man4 xiao1shi1，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 ni3 suo3 shu2xi1 de5 leng3jing4 yu4 li3xing4。"

msgid "She glares at you over her hand. Nods her head yes."
msgstr ""
"她​从​手掌​间​怒视​着​你​，​点点头​表示同意​。\n"
"ta1 cong2 shou3zhang3 jian1 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3，dian3 dian3 tou2 biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。"

msgid ""
"She grabs a fistful of the ork's hair and lifts his head. Her face is inches"
" from his."
msgstr ""
"她​一把​抓住​兽​人​的​头发​，​将​他​的​头​抬起​来​。​二者​的​脸​之间​只有​几​英寸​距离​。\n"
"ta1 yi1 ba3 zhua1zhu4 shou4 ren2 de5 tou2fa5，jiang1 ta1 de5 tou2 tai2qi3 lai2。er4zhe3 de5 lian3 zhi1jian1 zhi3you3 ji1 ying1cun4 ju4li2。"

msgid ""
"She grows quiet for a moment, briefly looking down at her shoes before "
"looking you straight in the eye."
msgstr ""
"她​沉默​了​一会儿​，​低头​看​了​看​自己​的​鞋子​，​然后​又​直视​你​的​眼睛​。\n"
"ta1 chen2mo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，di1tou2 kan4 le5 kan4 zi4ji3 de5 xie2zi5，ran2hou4 you4 zhi2shi4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。"

msgid "She had a name, you know."
msgstr ""
"她​有​名字​的​。\n"
"ta1 you3 ming2zi5 de5。"

msgid ""
"She hands you a dripping, yellowish sausage wrapped in a paper napkin. You take a big bite and immediately regret it. There's a funk to this thing that no amount of curry powder could mask.\n"
"\n"
"Your stomach lurches, and you idly wonder whether this decision is going to come back to haunt you later."
msgstr ""
"她​递给​你​一根​裹​着​纸巾​、​油渍​斑斑​的​黄褐色​香肠​。​你​咬​了​一大口​，​立刻​后悔不已​—​—​这​玩意儿​散发​着​一股​怪味​，​再​多​的​咖喱粉​也​掩盖​不住​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​胃里​一阵​翻腾​，​你​不禁​开始​怀疑​这个​决定​会​不会​在​之后​反噬​自己​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 di4gei3 ni3 yi1 gen1 guo3 zhao2 zhi3jin1、you2 zi4 ban1ban1 de5 huang2he4se4 xiang1chang2。ni3 yao3 le5 yi1 dai4 kou3，li4ke4 hou4 hui3 bu4 yi3——zhe4 wan2yi4r5 san4fa1 zhao2 yi1 gu3 guai4wei4，zai4 duo1 de5 ga1li2fen3 ye3 yan3gai4 bu4zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"wei4 li3 yi1zhen4 fan1teng2，ni3 bu4jin1 kai1shi3 huai2yi2 zhe4ge5 jue2ding4 hui4 bu4hui4 zai4 zhi1hou4 fan3shi4 zi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"She has a point, $(l.name). What Vauclair did to the Firewing was wrong, but I don't know if that justifies setting her free... Lord knows what she's going to do now.\n"
"\n"
"I’m not sure I would’ve made the same call."
msgstr ""
"她​说得对​，​$(l.name)​。​沃​克莱尔​对​火翼​做​的​事情​是​不​对​的​，​但​我​不​知道​这​是否​意味着​就​应该​放​她​走​……​天知道​她​现在​会​做些​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​自己​是否​也​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de2 dui4，$(l.name)。Wo4ke4lai2er3 dui4 Huo3yi4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5，dan4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4fou3 yi4wei4zhe5 jiu4 ying1gai1 fang4 ta1 zou3……tian1 zhi1 dao4 ta1 xian4zai4 hui4 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 shi4fou3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"She holds her silence for a long time.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, she nods."
msgstr ""
"她​沉默​良久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​她​点点头​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。"

msgid ""
"She is remembered as one of the most popular Great Dragons, second only to the late Dunkelzahn in public opinion. She was also a champion of metahuman rights causes, and aid organizations around the world declared today a day of mourning.\n"
"\n"
"\"Hestaby was one of the most magnificent creatures ever to have lived,\" UCAS President Thomas Steele said in a prepared statement. \"It is fitting that the Great Dragons of the world should be memorialized in her image.\""
msgstr ""
"她​被​公认​为​最​受欢迎​的​巨龙​之一​，​在​公众​心目​中​仅次于​已故​的​邓​凯尔​赞​。​她​同时​是​泛​人类​权益​事业​的​捍卫者​，​全球​援助​组织​今日​宣布​举行​哀悼​活动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​赫​斯塔​比​堪称​有史以来​最​伟大​的​生灵​之一​，​”​加​美​合众国​主席​托马斯​·​斯蒂尔​在​声明​中​表示​，​“​以​她​的​形象​纪念​世间​巨龙​，​实乃​恰如其分​。​”\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bei4 gong1ren4 wei2 zui4 shou4huan1ying2 de5 ju4long2 zhi1yi1，zai4 gong1zhong4 xin1mu4 zhong4 jin3ci4yu2 yi3gu4 de5 deng4 kai3 er3 zan4。ta1 tong2shi2 shi4 fan4 ren2lei4 quan2yi4 shi4ye4 de5 han4wei4zhe3，quan2qiu2 yuan2zhu4 zu3zhi1 jin1ri4 xuan1bu4 ju3xing2 ai1dao4 huo2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"“he4 si1 ta3 bi3 kan1cheng1 you3shi3yi3lai2 zui4 wei3da4 de5 sheng1ling2 zhi1yi1，” jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 zhu3xi2 tuo1ma3si1 · si1 di4 er3 zai4 sheng1ming2 zhong4 biao3shi4，“yi3 ta1 de5 xing2xiang4 ji4nian4 shi4jian1 ju4long2，shi2 nai3 qia4ru2qi2fen4。”"

msgid "She is so close so very close now..."
msgstr ""
"她​现在​已经​非常​接近​了​……\n"
"ta1 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 fei1chang2 jie1jin4 le5……"

msgid ""
"She leans in toward you, and for the first time since your initial meeting, "
"she opens her eyes wide. Her voice goes deadly serious."
msgstr ""
"她​朝​你​倾身​靠近​，​自​你们​初次​相遇​以来​，​她​第一次​睁​大​双眼​。​她​的​声音​变得​异常​严肃​。\n"
"ta1 chao2 ni3 qing1 shen1 kao4jin4，zi4 ni3men5 chu1ci4 xiang1yu4 yi3lai2，ta1 di4yi1ci4 zheng1 dai4 shuang1yan3。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 yi4chang2 yan2su4。"

msgid "She left me notes--"
msgstr ""
"她​给​我​留​了​消息​—​—\n"
"ta1 gei3 wo3 liu2 le5 xiao1xi5 — —"

msgid ""
"She looks down at the body.\n"
"\n"
"There is a long pause before she speaks again."
msgstr ""
"她​低头​看​向​尸体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​沉默​许久​后​，​她​才​再次​开口​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 di1tou2 kan4 xiang4 shi1ti3。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 xu3jiu3 hou4，ta1 cai2 zai4ci4 kai1kou3。"

msgid ""
"She looks down on Harrow's huddled form and raises her right arm. Glowing razors erupt from her incandescent fingertips.\n"
"\n"
"He looks up at her, his mouth agape."
msgstr ""
"她​低头​看着​哈罗​蜷缩​的​身躯​，​举起​右臂​。​闪闪发光​的​刀刃​从​她​炽热​的​指尖​呼啸​而出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​目瞪口呆​地​抬头​看着​她​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 di1tou2 kan4 zhao2 ha1luo2 quan2suo1 de5 shen1qu1，ju3qi3 you4 bi4。shan3 shan3 fa1 guang1 de5 dao1ren4 cong2 ta1 chi4re4 de5 zhi3jian1 hu1xiao4 er2 chu1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 mu4deng4kou3dai1 de5 tai2tou2 kan4 zhao2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"She looks up with a start at the sound of your approach. Her eyes go wide at"
" the sight of Glory; as she takes in her cyberware, her mouth falls open in "
"horror."
msgstr ""
"她​听见​你们​走近​的​脚步声​，​猛地​抬起头来​。​眼前​格洛丽​的​身影​让​她​不禁​瞪​大​了​双眼​；​而​在​注意​到​对方​身上​的​赛博​改造​后​，​她​更是​惊恐​地​合不拢嘴​。\n"
"ta1 ting1jian4 ni3men5 zou3jin4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1，meng3de5 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2。yan3qian2 Ge2luo4li2 de5 shen1ying3 rang4 ta1 bu4jin1 deng4 dai4 le5 shuang1yan3 ； er2 zai4 zhu4yi4 dao4 dui4fang1 shen1shang5 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 hou4，ta1 geng4shi4 jing1kong3 de5 he2bu4long3zui3。"

msgid ""
"She looks you in the eye, and for the first time, you can see the cracks in her composure.\n"
"\n"
"She's doing a good job of hiding it, but deep down, this woman is terrified."
msgstr ""
"她​直视​你​的​眼睛​，​而​你​第一次​看见​她​镇定自若​的​外表​下​裂开​的​缝隙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​掩饰​得​很​好​，​但​内心深处​，​这个​女人​正​被​恐惧​吞噬​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhi2shi4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5，er2 ni3 di4yi1ci4 kan4jian4 ta1 zhen4 ding4 zi4 ruo4 de5 wai4biao3 xia4 lie4kai1 de5 feng4xi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yan3shi4 de2 hen3 hao3，dan4 nei4xin1shen1chu4，zhe4ge5 nu:3ren2 zheng1 bei4 kong3ju4 tun1shi4。"

msgid ""
"She looks you up and down, and you can see the doubt growing in her eyes.\n"
"\n"
"Finally her shoulders slump in defeat. She lowers her gun and signals the others in the room to stand down."
msgstr ""
"她​上下​打量​着​你​，​你​可以​看到​她​眼中​渐渐​生出​的​犹豫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​她​垂头丧气​地​耷拉​起​肩膀​。​她​放下​枪​，​示意​房间​里​的​其他人​退​下​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，ni3 ke3yi3 kan4dao4 ta1 yan3zhong1 jian4jian4 sheng1chu1 de5 you2yu4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ta1 chui2tou2sang4qi4 de5 da1la5 qi3 jian1bang3。ta1 fang4xia4 qiang1，shi4yi4 fang2jian1 li3 de5 qi2 ta1 ren2 tui4 xia4。"

msgid ""
"She made this neighborhood a sanctuary. A home. You ask anyone here why they came, and you'll get a hundred different reasons. But you ask them why they stayed, and you'll get one.\n"
"\n"
"Monika."
msgstr ""
"她​把​这个​街区​打​造成​了​庇护所​，​也​是​我们​的​家园​。​如果​你​要​问​人们​为什么​来到​这里​，​你​会​得到​一百个​不同​的​答案​。​但​如果​你​问​他们​为什么​选择​留下​，​那么​答案​只会​有​一个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ba3 zhe4ge5 jie1qu1 da3 zao4cheng2 le5 bi4hu4suo3，ye3 shi4 wo3men5 de5 jia1yuan2。ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 wen4 ren2men5 wei4shen2me5 lai2dao4 zhe4li3，ni3 hui4 de2dao4 yi1 bai3 ge4 bu4tong2 de5 da2an4。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 wen4 ta1men5 wei4shen2me5 xuan3ze2 liu2xia4，na4me5 da2an4 zhi3 hui4 you3 yi1ge5。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3。"

msgid ""
"She makes a flicking motion with her hand, and the glow dies.\n"
"\n"
"Glory smiles."
msgstr ""
"她​打了个​响指​，​亮光​熄灭​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​笑了笑​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 da3 le5 ge4 xiang3 zhi3，liang4guang1 xi1mie4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 xiao4 le5 xiao4。"

msgid "She meant a lot to this place."
msgstr ""
"她​对​这个​地方​意味着​很多​。\n"
"ta1 dui4 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 yi4wei4zhe5 hen3 duo1。"

msgid "She messaged you?"
msgstr ""
"她​给​你​发消息​了​？\n"
"ta1 gei3 ni3 fa1 xiao1 xi1 le5？"

msgid "She nods again and offers him a weak smile."
msgstr ""
"她​再次​点头​，​向​他​露出​一个​虚弱​的​微笑​。\n"
"ta1 zai4ci4 dian3tou2，xiang4 ta1 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 xu1ruo4 de5 wei1xiao4。"

msgid "She nods and returns her attention to her workstation."
msgstr ""
"她​点点头​，​又​继续​埋头​于​工作站​。\n"
"ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，you4 ji4xu4 mai2tou2 yu2 gong1zuo4zhan4。"

msgid ""
"She nods mutely and clasps her hands to her chest. Ragged breaths heave out of her.\n"
"\n"
"She looks like a woman possessed."
msgstr ""
"她​默默​点头​，​双手​紧​捂​胸口​。​她​的​呼吸​变得​急促​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​看起来​像​着​了​魔​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 mo4mo4 dian3tou2，shuang1shou3 jin3 wu3 xiong1kou3。ta1 de5 hu1xi1 bian4de5 ji2cu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 zhao2 le5 mo2 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"She nods, tears streaming down her cheeks. From her body language alone, you can tell that she's petrified.\n"
"\n"
"You've seen this look before: she's not going to cause you any more trouble. "
msgstr ""
"她​点点头​，​眼泪​顺着​脸颊​流​了​下来​。​仅​从​她​的​肢体​语言​，​你​就​能​看出​她​已经​被​吓坏​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​以前​见过​这种​表情​：​她​不会​再​给​你​添麻烦​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，yan3lei4 shun4zhe5 lian3jia2 liu2 le5 xia4lai5。jin3 cong2 ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2，ni3 jiu4 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 yi3jing1 bei4 xia4huai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3qian2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 biao3qing2：ta1 bu4hui4 zai4 gei3 ni3 tian1ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid ""
"She opens her mouth to argue, then looks you over and seems to think better of it.\n"
"\n"
"Her mouth closes, and she pulls out a cash box."
msgstr ""
"她​张口​想​说​什么​，​但​又​上下​打量​了​你​一番​，​似乎​觉得​不该​开口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​一言不发​地​拿出​收钱​的​盒子​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhang1kou3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5，dan4 you4 shang4xia4 da3liang5 le5 ni3 yi1 fan1，si4hu1 jue2de5 bu4gai1 kai1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 na2chu1 shou1 qian2 de5 he2zi5。"

msgid ""
"She pauses for a long moment. When she begins speaking again, some of the ice has fallen away from her voice.\n"
"\n"
"For the first time since you met her, Glory sounds *alive.*"
msgstr ""
"她​停顿​了​很​久​。​当​她​再次​开口​说话​时​，​她​语气​中​的​一部分​寒意​逐渐​消解​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自从​你们​相识​以来​，​格洛丽​的​声音​中​头​一次​有​了​些​*​生机​*​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ting2dun4 le5 hen3 jiu3。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4 shi2，ta1 yu3qi4 zhong4 de5 yi1bu4fen5 han2yi4 zhu2jian4 xiao1jie3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zi4cong2 ni3men5 xiang1shi2 yi3lai2，Ge2luo4li2 de5 sheng1yin1 zhong4 tou2 yi1ci4 you3 le5 xie1*sheng1ji1*。"

msgid ""
"She pauses for a moment and looks you up and down. You've been around long enough to know when you're being sized up.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, she continues."
msgstr ""
"她​停顿​了​片刻​，​盯​着​你​看​了​一会儿​。​你​混迹​这行够​久​了​，​知道​自己​正在​被​人​打量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​终于​，​她​又​继续​说道​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ting2dun4 le5 pian4ke4，ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5。ni3 hun4ji4 zhe4 xing2 gou4 jiu3 le5，zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zheng4zai4 bei4 ren2 da3liang5。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1yu2，ta1 you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。"

msgid ""
"She pauses for a moment to light up another cigarette.\n"
"\n"
"After she fills her lungs with smoke, she continues."
msgstr ""
"她​停顿​了​一会儿​，​又​点燃​一支​香烟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​深吸​一口​之后​，​她​继续​说道​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，you4 dian3ran2 yi1 zhi1 xiang1yan1。\n"
"\n"
"shen1 xi1 yi1kou3 zhi1hou4，ta1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。"

msgid ""
"She plunges her blade into the Engineer's throat. The ork lets out a "
"startled gurgling sound, thrashes, and dies."
msgstr ""
"她​把​刀刃​深深​刺入​工程师​的​喉咙​。​兽​人​发出​一声​惊慌​的​咕噜​声​，​挣扎​几下​后​死​掉​了​。\n"
"ta1 ba3 dao1ren4 shen1shen1 ci1 ru4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 hou2long2。shou4 ren2 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 jing1huang1 de5 gu1lu5 sheng1，zheng1zha2 ji1 xia4 hou4 si3 diao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"She pulls a multi-tool from her belt and uses it to loosen the bolts that hold the panel in place.\n"
"\n"
"Pulling up a schematic on her PDA, she examines the terminal's wiring."
msgstr ""
"她​从​腰带​上​抽出​多功能​工具​，​用​它​拧松​固定​面板​的​螺栓​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​PDA​上调​出​电路图​后​，​她​仔细检查​着​终端​的​线路​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 cong2 yao1dai4 shang4 chou1chu1 duo1gong1neng2 gong1ju4，yong4 ta1 ning2 song1 gu4ding4 mian4ban3 de5 luo2shuan1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 PDA shang4tiao2 chu1 dian4 lu4 tu2 hou4，ta1 zi3 xi4 jian3 cha2 zhao2 zhong1duan1 de5 xian4lu4。"

msgid ""
"She raises her glass and takes a moment to study the amber liquid inside."
msgstr ""
"她​举起​杯子​，​端详​着​里面​的​琥珀色​液体​。\n"
"ta1 ju3qi3 bei1zi5，duan1xiang2 zhao2 li3mian4 de5 hu3 po4 se4 ye4ti3。"

msgid ""
"She reaches into her desk and grabs a cylindrical object. Gently, she lifts "
"it up and hands it to you."
msgstr ""
"她​伸手​从​桌子​里​掏出​一个​圆柱体​，​将​它​轻轻​举​起来​，​递到​你​手中​。\n"
"ta1 shen1shou3 cong2 zhuo1zi5 li3 tao1chu1 yi1ge5 yuan2zhu4ti3，jiang1 ta1 qing1qing1 ju3 qi3lai5，di4 dao4 ni3 shou3 zhong4。"

msgid "She said she'd be back in ten minutes."
msgstr ""
"她​说​自己​十分钟​之内​就​能​回来​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 zi4ji3 shi2 fen4 zhong1 zhi1nei4 jiu4 neng2 hui2lai5。"

msgid "She says I'm to be governess to the children."
msgstr ""
"她​说​我会​成为​孩子​们​的​家庭教师​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 wo3 hui4 cheng2wei2 hai2zi5 men5 de5 jia1ting2jiao4shi1。"

msgid ""
"She says that she's all right. She also says that she is, and I quote, "
"\"proud of you for not being an idiot.\" She also says that she'll be in "
"touch when she can."
msgstr ""
"她​说​自己​没事​。​她​还​说​自己​“​为​你​没有​做​傻事​而​骄傲​”​。​另外​她​还​说​她​方便​的​时候​会​联系​你​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 zi4ji3 mei2shi4。ta1 hai2 shuo1 zi4ji3“wei2 ni3 mei2you3 zuo4 sha3 shi4 er2 jiao1ao4”。ling4wai4 ta1 hai2 shuo1 ta1 fang1bian4 de5 shi2hou5 hui4 lian2xi4 ni3。"

msgid "She searches the ground for an answer. Finds nothing there."
msgstr ""
"她​看​向​地上​，​想要​得到​答案​，​但​那里​什么​都​没有​。\n"
"ta1 kan4 xiang4 di4shang5，xiang3yao4 de2dao4 da2an4，dan4 na4li5 shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3。"

msgid "She seems angry."
msgstr ""
"她​看起来​很​生气​。\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 sheng1qi4。"

msgid ""
"She shouldn't have done that. Speaking for the team is my job, not hers."
msgstr ""
"她​不该​这么​做​，​汇报​团队​状况​是​我​的​工作​，​不是​她​的​。\n"
"ta1 bu4gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4，hui4bao4 tuan2dui4 zhuang4kuang4 shi4 wo3 de5 gong1zuo4，bu4shi4 ta1 de5。"

msgid ""
"She sounded like she was in a bad way when I talked to her. If you care "
"about her, you'd better help her out."
msgstr ""
"她​跟​我​讲话​的​时候​听​起来​状况​挺​糟​的​。​你​要是​在乎​她​，​最好​帮​她​一把​。\n"
"ta1 gen1 wo3 jiang3hua4 de5 shi2hou5 ting1 qi3lai5 zhuang4kuang4 ting3 zao1 de5。ni3 yao4shi5 zai4hu5 ta1，zui4hao3 bang1 ta1 yi1 ba3。"

msgid ""
"She stands there, panting for a moment - spent. \n"
"\n"
"Then her eyes narrow, focus, ice over."
msgstr ""
"她​站​在​那里​，​喘息​了​一会儿​—​—​筋疲力尽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​她​的​眼睛​眯起​，​聚焦​，​变得​冰冷​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhan4 zai4 na4li5，chuan3xi1 le5 yi1hui4r5——jin1pi2li4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 mi2 qi3，ju4jiao1，bian4de5 bing1leng3。"

msgid ""
"She stares at you for a long moment, her cheeks flushed. Slowly, she turns back to the elf, a miserable expression on her face.\n"
"\n"
"Together, they board the train."
msgstr ""
"她​双颊​通红​地​盯​着​你​看​了​许久​。​最后​，​她​又​缓缓​转回​精灵​的​方向​，​脸上​挂​着​一抹​苦涩​的​表情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​二人​一起​登上​了​火车​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuang1 jia2 tong1hong2 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 xu3jiu3。zui4hou4，ta1 you4 huan3huan3 zhuan3hui2 jing1ling2 de5 fang1xiang4，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yi1 ma1 ku3se4 de5 biao3qing2。\n"
"\n"
"er4 ren2 yi1qi3 deng1shang4 le5 huo3che1。"

msgid ""
"She stares at you for a long moment, her neck reddening in shame. She turns back to the elf, a miserable expression on her face.\n"
"\n"
"Together, they board the train."
msgstr ""
"她​脖子​通红​地​盯​着​你​看​了​许久​。​最后​，​她​又​缓缓​转回​精灵​的​方向​，​脸上​挂​着​一抹​苦涩​的​表情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​二人​一起​登上​了​火车​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bo2zi5 tong1hong2 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 xu3jiu3。zui4hou4，ta1 you4 huan3huan3 zhuan3hui2 jing1ling2 de5 fang1xiang4，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yi1 ma1 ku3se4 de5 biao3qing2。\n"
"\n"
"er4 ren2 yi1qi3 deng1shang4 le5 huo3che1。"

msgid "She stares at you, confused."
msgstr ""
"她​困惑​地​看着​你​。\n"
"ta1 kun4huo4 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid "She steps back, and Dietrich turns to you."
msgstr ""
"她​退​了​回去​。​紧接着​，​迪​特里​希看​向​你​。\n"
"ta1 tui4 le5 hui2qu5。jin3jie1zhe5，Di2te4li3xi1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。"

msgid "She stiffens. Then suddenly, her rifle is levelled at your chest."
msgstr ""
"她​身体​猛地​一僵​。​突然​，​她​举起​步枪​瞄准​你​的​胸口​。\n"
"ta1 shen1ti3 meng3de5 yi1 jiang1。tu1ran2，ta1 ju3qi3 bu4qiang1 miao2zhun3 ni3 de5 xiong1kou3。"

msgid ""
"She stops suddenly. Her eyes take in the devices surrounding and invading "
"the dragon’s body. The tubes of viscous yellow liquid running into it. The "
"monitors flashing their status. "
msgstr ""
"她​突然​停下​，​目光​扫​过​围绕​并​侵入​龙体​的​各种​装置​。​那些​输送​黏稠​黄色​液体​的​管子​。​闪烁着​状态​信息​的​监视器​。\n"
"ta1 tu1ran2 ting2xia4，mu4guang1 sao3 guo4 wei2rao4 bing4 qin1ru4 long2ti3 de5 ge4zhong3 zhuang1zhi4。na4xie1 shu1song4 nian2 chou2 huang2se4 ye4ti3 de5 guan3zi3。shan3 shuo4 zhao2 zhuang4tai4 xin4xi1 de5 jian1shi4qi4。"

msgid ""
"She swings her head from side to side, her hair whipping back and forth, her"
" mouth open wide in a muted wail. With a final burst of energy, she slams "
"herself silently against the glass wall of the cell over and over and over "
"until she finally crumples to the floor, spent."
msgstr ""
"她​左右​摇晃​着​头​，​头发​随风飘​动​，​嘴巴​张得​大大的​，​发出​低沉​的​呻吟声​。​最后​，​她​用​尽全力​，​一次​又​一次​地撞​向​牢房​的​玻璃墙​，​直到​最后​筋疲力尽​，​瘫倒​在​地​。\n"
"ta1 zuo3you4 yao2huang4 zhao2 tou2，tou2fa5 sui2 feng1 piao1 dong4，zui3ba5 zhang1 de2 dai4 dai4 de5，fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 shen1 yin2 sheng1。zui4hou4，ta1 yong4 jin3 quan2 li4，yi1ci4 you4 yi1ci4 de5 zhuang4 xiang4 lao2fang2 de5 bo1 li2 qiang2，zhi2dao4 zui4hou4 jin1pi2li4jin4，tan1 dao3 zai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"She swipes your credstick and punches a few buttons on her PDA.\n"
"\n"
"A flimsy slip of paper spills out of the terminal you're standing at and into your hand."
msgstr ""
"她​扫描​你​的​信用​棒​，​随后​在​她​的​PDA​上​按​了​几个​按键​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​面前​的​终端​吐​出​一张​薄薄的​纸条​，​落入​你​的​掌心​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 sao3miao2 ni3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4，sui2hou4 zai4 ta1 de5 PDA shang4 an4 le5 ji3ge5 an4jian4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mian4qian2 de5 zhong1duan1 tu3 chu1 yi1 zhang1 bao2 bao2 de5 zhi3tiao2，luo4ru4 ni3 de5 zhang3xin1。"

msgid ""
"She takes one last breath, releases it slowly, and then the Great Dragon "
"Feuerschwinge falls dead."
msgstr ""
"她​最后​深吸​一口气​，​缓缓​吐​了​出来​，​然后​巨龙​火翼​便​就此​死去​。\n"
"ta1 zui4hou4 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，huan3huan3 tu3 le5 chu1lai2，ran2hou4 ju4long2 Huo3yi4 bian4 jiu4ci3 si3qu4。"

msgid ""
"She takes the bag from you and unzips it.\n"
"\n"
"Her eyes go wide."
msgstr ""
"她​从​你​手中​接过​包​，​拉开​拉链​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​眼睛​睁​得​大大的​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 cong2 ni3 shou3 zhong4 jie1guo4 bao1，la1kai1 la1lian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 yan3jing5 zheng1 de2 dai4 dai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"She was a Great Dragon, Dietrich. An *insane* Great Dragon. Lord knows what "
"she's going to do now."
msgstr ""
"她​可是​巨龙​，​迪​特里​希​。​*​发疯​*​的​巨龙​。​天知道​她​现在​会​做些​什么​。\n"
"ta1 ke3shi4 ju4long2，Di2te4li3xi1。*fa1feng1*de5 ju4long2。tian1 zhi1 dao4 ta1 xian4zai4 hui4 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"She was a Great Dragon, Dietrich. An *insane* Great Dragon. Lord knows what she's going to do now.\n"
"\n"
"What Vauclair did to her was wrong, but all the same... I’m not sure that I'd have made the same call."
msgstr ""
"她​可是​巨龙​，​迪​特里​希​。​*​发疯​*​的​巨龙​。​天知道​她​现在​会​做些​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​沃​克莱尔​对​她​做​的​事情​是​不​对​的​，​但​话说回来​……​我​不​知道​自己​是否​也​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ke3shi4 ju4long2，Di2te4li3xi1。*fa1feng1*de5 ju4long2。tian1 zhi1 dao4 ta1 xian4zai4 hui4 zuo4 xie1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 dui4 ta1 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5，dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5……wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 shi4fou3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid "She was a runner. No time for such things."
msgstr ""
"她​是​个​狂奔​者​，​没​时间​想​这些​事​。\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 kuang2Ben1zhe3，mei2 shi2jian1 xiang3 zhe4xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"She was among the first of the Great Dragons to Awaken, and the first to be "
"killed by metahumanity. Or so the story goes."
msgstr ""
"她​是​最早​觉醒​的​巨龙​之一​，​也​是​第一​头​被​泛​人类​杀死​的​巨龙​。​至少​传说​是​这样​。\n"
"ta1 shi4 zui4 zao3 jue2xing3 de5 ju4long2 zhi1yi1，ye3 shi4 di4yi1 tou2 bei4 fan4 ren2lei4 sha1si3 de5 ju4long2。zhi4shao3 chuan2shuo1 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"She was damaged, $(l.name). Psychologically ruined by her life at Feuerstelle. Harrow turned me into a monster in the short time that I lived with him, and Marta had been there much longer.\n"
"\n"
"I can't even imagine the amount of psychological trauma that she'd be carrying if she were alive today. It'd take her years to recover, and in that time, she'd still be dangerous."
msgstr ""
"她​是​个​“​残次品​”​，​$(l.name)​。​在​“​火坑​”​的​生活​摧毁​了​她​的​人生​。​哈罗​在​共同​生活​的​短暂​期间​就​把​我​变成​了​怪物​，​而玛​尔塔​在​那儿​待​得​更​久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​她​活到​今天​，​我​简直​不敢​想象​她​会​背负​多少​心理​创伤​。​她​需要​数年​才能​康复​，​而​在此期间​，​她​依然​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4“can2ci4pin3”，$(l.name)。zai4“huo3keng1” de5 sheng1huo2 cui1hui3 le5 ta1 de5 ren2sheng1。ha1luo2 zai4 gong4tong2 sheng1huo2 de5 duan3zan4 qi1jian1 jiu4 ba3 wo3 bian4cheng2 le5 guai4wu5，er2 Ma3er3ta3 zai4 na4r5 dai1 de2 geng1 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 ta1 huo2 dao4 jin1tian1，wo3 jian3zhi2 bu4 gan3 xiang3xiang4 ta1 hui4 bei1fu4 duo1shao3 xin1li3 chuang1shang1。ta1 xu1yao4 shu4nian2 cai2neng2 kang1fu4，er2 zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1，ta1 yi1ran2 wei1xian3。"

msgid ""
"She was here long before I was. Before Harrow started using the shrine. She made her own decisions, just like I did.\n"
"\n"
"No excuses. She's here because she wants to be. She brought me here because she *wanted* to. *Her* choice."
msgstr ""
"她​比​我​早来​这里​很​久​。​早​在​哈罗​开始​使用​神龛​之前​就是​如此​。​她​自己​做出​了​决定​，​就​像​我​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​什么​借口​。​她​在​这里​是因为​她​想要​这样​。​她​带​我​来​这里​也​是因为​她​*​想要​*​这样​。​这是​*​她​的​*​选择​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bi3 wo3 zao3lai2 zhe4li3 hen3 jiu3。zao3 zai4 ha1luo2 kai1shi3 shi3yong4 shen2kan1 zhi1qian2 jiu4shi4 ru2ci3。ta1 zi4ji3 zuo4chu1 le5 jue2ding4，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 shen2me5 jie4kou3。ta1 zai4 zhe4li3 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 xiang3yao4 zhe4yang4。ta1 dai4 wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 ye3 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1*xiang3yao4*zhe4yang4。zhe4 shi4*ta1 de5*xuan3ze2。"

msgid "She was in the Matrix. There was nothing we could do."
msgstr ""
"她​当时​在​矩阵​里​。​我们​无能为力​。\n"
"ta1 dang1shi2 zai4 ju3zhen4 li3。wo3men5 wu2neng2wei2li4。"

msgid ""
"She was insane when I found her. An insane Feuerschwinge would be even worse"
" than the one who torched thousands."
msgstr ""
"我​找到​她​的​时候​她​已经​疯​了​。​疯狂​的​火翼会​比​那个​烧死​数千​人​的​火翼​更为​可怕​。\n"
"wo3 zhao3dao4 ta1 de5 shi2hou5 ta1 yi3jing1 feng1 le5。feng1kuang2 de5 Huo3yi4 hui4 bi3 na4ge5 shao1si3 shu3 qian1 ren2 de5 Huo3yi4 geng4wei2 ke3pa4。"

msgid ""
"She was insane when I found her. I could have killed her, but I thought she "
"could be of use."
msgstr ""
"我​找到​她​的​时候​她​已经​疯​了​。​我本​可以​杀​了​她​，​但​我​觉得​她​能​派上用场​。\n"
"wo3 zhao3dao4 ta1 de5 shi2hou5 ta1 yi3jing1 feng1 le5。wo3 ben3 ke3yi3 sha1 le5 ta1，dan4 wo3 jue2de5 ta1 neng2 pai4shang4yong4chang3。"

msgid "She was our team leader. Of course we listened to her."
msgstr ""
"她​是​我们​的​队长​，​我们​当然​要​听​她​的​。\n"
"ta1 shi4 wo3men5 de5 dui4zhang3，wo3men5 dang1ran2 yao4 ting1 ta1 de5。"

msgid ""
"She was the first person I ever really loved, but that doesn't make up for all of the pain that she's caused.\n"
"\n"
"Harrow did a hell of a job on her... if she is alive, she probably still thinks that she was *saving* the kids that she lured to Feuerstelle. I feel sick just thinking about it."
msgstr ""
"她​是​我​真正​爱过​的​第一个​人​，​但​这​并​不能​弥补​她​带来​的​一切​伤痛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​把​她​毁​得​不轻​……​如果​她​还​活着​的话​，​她​八成​至今​还​以为​自己​是​在​*​拯救​*​那些​被​她​引诱​到​“​火坑​”​的​孩子​。​光是​想想​就让​我​反胃​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 wo3 zhen1zheng4 ai4 guo4 de5 di4 yi1 ge4 ren2，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4neng2 mi2bu3 ta1 dai4lai2 de5 yi1qie4 shang1tong4。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 ba3 ta1 hui3 de2 bu4 qing1……ru2guo3 ta1 hai2 huo2zhe5 de5hua4，ta1 ba1cheng2 zhi4jin1 hai2 yi3wei2 zi4ji3 shi4 zai4*zheng3jiu4*na4xie1 bei4 ta1 yin3you4 dao4“huo3keng1” de5 hai2zi5。guang1shi4 xiang3 xiang3 jiu4 rang4 wo3 fan3wei4。"

msgid ""
"She was. She just... she made things *right.*\n"
"\n"
"No matter how stupid I was, no matter what I got myself into, she made it right."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​她​……​就是​很​厉害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​我​有​多​笨​，​不管​我​惹​上​什么​事​，​她​总能​帮​我​解决​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。ta1……jiu4shi4 hen3 li4hai5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 wo3 you3 duo1 ben4，bu4guan3 wo3 re3 shang4 shen2me5 shi4，ta1 zong3neng2 bang1 wo3 jie3jue2。"

msgid "She wasn't just my boss. She was a friend."
msgstr ""
"她​不​只是​我​的​老大​。​我们​是​朋友​。\n"
"ta1 bu4 zhi3shi4 wo3 de5 lao3da4。wo3men5 shi4 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"She will not say. Not to me, at any rate… she has insisted that she will speak only with you.\n"
"\n"
"She wants to meet with you in a half an hour's time, at a location of your choosing."
msgstr ""
"她​不肯​对​我​说​……​她​坚持​只​和​你​进行​对话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​希望​在​半小时​后​与​你​会面​，​地点​由​你​来​选​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bu4 ken3 dui4 wo3 shuo1……ta1 jian1chi2 zhi3 he4 ni3 jin4xing2 dui4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xi1wang4 zai4 ban4xiao3shi2 hou4 yu4 ni3 hui4mian4，di4dian3 you2 ni3 lai2 xuan3。"

msgid "She would be so proud. Thank you."
msgstr ""
"她​一定​会​很​骄傲​的​。​谢谢​。\n"
"ta1 yi1ding4 hui4 hen3 jiao1ao4 de5。xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"She would not discuss the specifics of the job with me, but she did tell me what she was offering for the work.\n"
"\n"
"Thirty-six thousand nuyen. An impressive enough sum to justify a consultation."
msgstr ""
"她​不​愿意​向​我​透露​差事​的​具体​细节​，​但​确实​*​有​*​告诉​我​说​她​愿意​为​这项​工作​支付​多少​报酬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​整整​三万​六千​新円​。​就​冲​这笔​钱​的​份​上​，​我​觉得​去​见​一面​也​没什么​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bu4 yuan4yi4 xiang4 wo3 tou4lu4 cha4shi4 de5 ju4ti3 xi4jie2，dan4 que4shi2*you3*gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 ta1 yuan4yi4 wei2 zhe4 xiang4 gong1zuo4 zhi1fu4 duo1shao3 bao4chou5。\n"
"\n"
"zheng3zheng3 san1 wan4 liu4 qian1 xin1 yuan2。jiu4 chong1 zhe4 bi3 qian2 de5 fen4 shang4，wo3 jue2de5 qu4 jian4 yi1mian4 ye3 mei2shen2me5。"

msgid "She wraps her arms around herself, quietly shivering."
msgstr ""
"她​抱​起​双臂​，​无声​地​颤抖​着​。\n"
"ta1 bao4 qi3 shuang1bi4，wu2sheng1 de5 chan4dou3 zhao2。"

msgid "She'd be glad to know it."
msgstr ""
"她​泉下​有​知会​很​欣慰​的​。\n"
"ta1 quan2 xia4 you3 zhi1hui4 hen3 xin1wei4 de5。"

msgid ""
"She'll be okay.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Brave words, but her tone tells a different story. It's plain as day that she's worried sick.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"她​会​没事​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​话​虽​这么​说​，​但​她​的​语气​却是​另一番​意味​。​她​显然​担心​得​要命​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hui4 mei2shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} hua4 sui1 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 ta1 de5 yu3qi4 que4shi4 ling4 yi1 fan1 yi4wei4。ta1 xian3ran2 dan1xin1 de2 yao4ming4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"She's *my* girlfriend, Heimerich. Of course I'm worried.\n"
"\n"
"But she can handle herself."
msgstr ""
"她​是​*​我​的​*​女友​，​海​默里​希​。​我​当然​担心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​她​能​照顾​好​自己​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4*wo3 de5*nu:3you3，Hai3mo4 li3 xi1。wo3 dang1ran2 dan1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 ta1 neng2 zhao4gu5 hao3 zi4ji3。"

msgid "She's also a killing machine."
msgstr ""
"她​杀人​也​很​利落​。\n"
"ta1 sha1ren2 ye3 hen3 li4luo5。"

msgid ""
"She's awake.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ork stares at the dragon's sinuous form with something close to awe.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's time."
msgstr ""
"她​苏醒​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​兽​人​凝视着​巨龙​那​蜿蜒​的​身躯​，​眼中​闪烁着​近乎​敬畏​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​时候​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 su1xing3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ju4long2 na4 wan1yan2 de5 shen1qu1，yan3zhong1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 jin4hu5 jing4wei4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 le5。"

msgid ""
"She's been gone a long time, Mira.\n"
"\n"
"I'm getting worried... aren't you?"
msgstr ""
"她​离开​好久​了​，​米拉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​开始​有些​担心​了​……​你​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"ta1 li2kai1 hao3jiu3 le5，mi3la1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kai1shi3 you3xie1 dan1xin1 le5……ni3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"She's covering her tracks. Working the shadows. Preparing to rise again.\n"
"\n"
"And that means that I *have* to find you, Adrian... for everyone's sake."
msgstr ""
"她​在​掩盖​行踪​，​在​暗处​活动​，​准备​东山再起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​我​*​必须​*​找到​你​，​阿德里安​……​为了​大家​好​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 yan3gai4 xing2zong1，zai4 an4chu4 huo2dong4，zhun3bei4 dong1shan1zai4qi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3*bi4xu1*zhao3dao4 ni3，E1de2li3an1……wei4le5 da4jia1 hao3。"

msgid "She's dead."
msgstr ""
"她​死​了​。\n"
"ta1 si3 le5。"

msgid "She's got you there."
msgstr ""
"她​说了算​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid ""
"She's right! They'd come poking around, and we could still wind up on the "
"hook for this."
msgstr ""
"她​说​的​没错​！​他们​会来​这​附近​打探​，​我们​依旧​有​可能​因此​遭殃​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de5 mei2cuo4！ta1men5 hui4 lai2 zhe4 fu4jin4 da3tan4，wo3men5 yi1jiu4 you3 ke3neng2 yin1ci3 zao1yang1。"

msgid ""
"She's right, boss. But whatever you still have to do, be quick about it, okay?\n"
"\n"
"We know what we've gotta do. I don't wanna sit here at home, wringin' my hands, when I could be out there doing it."
msgstr ""
"她​说得对​，​老大​。​但​无论​你​还有​什么​事要​处理​，​动作​快点​，​好​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​知道​自己​该​做​什么​。​我​可​不想​在​本​可以​出去​大干一场​的​时候​却​待在家里​无所事事​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de2 dui4，lao3da4。dan4 wu2lun4 ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 yao4 chu3li3，dong4zuo4 kuai4dian3，hao3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 gai1 zuo4 shen2me5。wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 zai4 ben3 ke3yi3 chu1qu4 dai4 gan4 yi1 chang2 de5 shi2hou5 que4 dai1 zai4 jia1 li3 wu2suo3shi4shi4。"

msgid ""
"She's right. Just do your thing, boss... we'll hold down the fort until you're finished.\n"
"\n"
"But before you go, let's talk about how we're going to approach this. While you two are out in Schattennest, the rest of us can start gearin' up for the assault."
msgstr ""
"她​说​的​没错​。​做​你​要​做​的​事​吧​，​老大​……​我们​会守​在​这里​，​等​你们​完事​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​在此之前​，​我们​得​先​谈谈​怎么​对付​APEX​。​这样一来​，​你们​俩​去​影巢​的​时候​，​我们​这些​人​也好​为​进攻​做​准备​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de5 mei2cuo4。zuo4 ni3 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4 ba1，lao3da4……wo3men5 hui4 shou3 zai4 zhe4li3，deng3 ni3men5 wan2shi4 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zai4ci3zhi1qian2，wo3men5 de2 xian1 tan2tan2 zen3me5 dui4fu5 APEX。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，ni3men5 lia3 qu4 ying3 chao2 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 zhe4xie1 ren2 ye3hao3 wei2 jin4gong1 zuo4 zhun3bei4。"

msgid ""
"She's still working on the others. Many of them are extensively damaged, and getting anything off of them is proving to be quite a chore.\n"
"\n"
"She has told me that she'll be in touch if and when she makes any headway."
msgstr ""
"她​还​在​努力​修复​其他​几张​。​它们​大多​遭到​严重​损坏​，​从中​提取​任何​内容​都​相当​费劲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​告诉​我​说​，​如果​有​进展​会​随时​联系​我​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hai2 zai4 nu3li4 xiu1fu4 qi2ta1 ji1 zhang1。ta1men5 da4duo1 zao1dao4 yan2zhong4 sun3huai4，cong2zhong1 ti2qu3 ren4he2 nei4rong2 dou1 xiang1dang1 fei4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1，ru2guo3 you3 jin4zhan3 hui4 sui2shi2 lian2xi4 wo3。"

msgid "She's there when I close my eyes. And I'm Maria."
msgstr ""
"我​闭上眼睛​就​能​看见​她​。​而​我​是​玛丽亚​。\n"
"wo3 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1 jiu4 neng2 kan4jian4 ta1。er2 wo3 shi4 ma3li4ya4。"

msgid ""
"She's too far gone to parse what you're saying, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"After so many years living here, I don't know if she even knows what \"normal\" feels like anymore."
msgstr ""
"她​陷得​太深​，​已经​听不懂​你​在​说​什么​了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这里​生活​了​这么​多年​之后​，​我​都​不​确定​她​是否​还​记得​“​正常​”​的​感觉​是​什么样​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xian4 de2 tai4 shen1，yi3jing1 ting1bu5dong3 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4li3 sheng1huo2 le5 zhe4me5 duo1nian2 zhi1hou4，wo3 dou1 bu4 que4ding4 ta1 shi4fou3 hai2 ji4de5“zheng4chang2” de5 gan3jue2 shi4 shen2me5yang4 le5。"

msgid "Shelf"
msgstr ""
"书架\n"
"shu1jia4"

msgid ""
"She’s locked up, where she can’t hurt anyone else. Seemed like the best "
"option."
msgstr ""
"她​被​关在​牢房​中​，​无法​伤害​任何人​。​这样​似乎​是​最好​的​选择​。\n"
"ta1 bei4 guan1 zai4 lao2fang2 zhong4，wu2fa3 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2。zhe4yang4 si4hu1 shi4 zui4hao3 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid "She’s now under the control of a powerful AI."
msgstr ""
"她​现在​被​某个​强大​的​AI​掌控​了​。\n"
"ta1 xian4zai4 bei4 mou3 ge4 qiang2da4 de5 AI zhang3kong4 le5。"

msgid "Shiawase Bone Lacing, Kevlar"
msgstr ""
"幸福​骨骼​网织层​（​凯夫​拉​）\n"
"xing4fu2 gu3ge2 wang3 zhi1 ceng2 （kai3 fu1 la1）"

msgid "Shiawase Bone Lacing, Plastic"
msgstr ""
"幸福​骨骼​网织层​（​塑料​）\n"
"xing4fu2 gu3ge2 wang3 zhi1 ceng2 （su4liao4）"

msgid ""
"Shiawase's hi-tech alpha bone lacing uses a Kevlar coating. Adds +1 Body and"
" +1 Strength."
msgstr ""
"源自​幸福​公司​的​阿尔法​级​骨骼​网织层​改造​，​覆材​升级​为​凯夫​拉​纤维​。​+​1​体质​，​+​1​力量​。\n"
"yuan2zi4 xing4fu2 gong1si1 de5 a1er3fa3 ji2 gu3ge2 wang3 zhi1 ceng2 gai3zao4，fu4 cai2 sheng1ji2 wei2 kai3 fu1 la1 xian1wei2。+1 ti3zhi4，+1 li4liang5。"

msgid "Shiawase's process covers your bones with hard plastic. Adds +1 Body."
