"Shut up, Heimer! Shut UP!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She wheels on you, her face contorted in a mix of grief and rage.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*You* overloaded the power grid, didn't you? You let Danni die, and then you deliberately sabotaged us!"
