"his face. Absinthe stands beside him, her expression one of embarrassment."
msgstr ""
"你​痛苦​而​缓慢​地​努力​恢复​了​意识​。​店主​阿尔杰​农正​俯身​注视​着​你​，​脸上​带​着​关切​的​神情​。​苦艾​酒站​在​他​身旁​，​神情​显得​有些​尴尬​。\n"
"ni3 tong4ku3 er2 huan3man4 de5 nu3li4 hui1fu4 le5 yi4shi2。dian4zhu3 E1er3jie2nong2 zheng1 fu3shen1 zhu4shi4 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 guan1qie4 de5 shen2qing2。ku3ai4 jiu3 zhan4 zai4 ta1 shen1 pang2，shen2qing2 xian3de5 you3xie1 gan1ga4。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, mechanically, the Cyberzombie reaches up to grip its head in both hands.\n"
"\n"
"And it *squeezes.*"
msgstr ""
"赛博​僵尸​慢慢​抬起​双手​，​机械​般地​按住​自己​的​头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​它​开始​*​挤压​*​。\n"
"\n"
"sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 man4man4 tai2qi3 shuang1shou3，ji1xie4 ban1 de5 an4 zhu4 zi4ji3 de5 tou2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1 kai1shi3*ji3ya1*。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, painfully, Monika wrestles her jaw open. The blood welled up in her mouth comes pouring out in a slick, covering her chest. \n"
"\n"
"She expels a thick, guttural sound that might be a word. Satisfied, she closes her eyes and forces her mouth to make the shapes she needs. "
msgstr ""
"尽管​缓慢​而​痛苦​，​莫妮卡​还是​竭力​张开​了​嘴​。​她​口中​积聚​的​鲜血​顿时​喷涌​而出​，​打湿​在​她​的​胸前​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​呼出​一声​低哑​的​喉音​，​听​起来​像​一个​单词​。​她​满意​了​，​于是​闭上眼睛​，​强撑​着​把​嘴唇​拢​成​她​想要​的​形状​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 huan3man4 er2 tong4ku3，Mo4ni1ka3 hai2shi5 jie2li4 zhang1kai1 le5 zui3。ta1 kou3 zhong4 ji1ju4 de5 xian1xue4 dun4shi2 pen1yong3 er2 chu1，da3 shi1 zai4 ta1 de5 xiong1qian2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hu1chu1 yi1sheng1 di1 ya3 de5 hou2yin1，ting1 qi3lai5 xiang4 yi1ge5 dan1ci2。ta1 man3yi4 le5，yu2shi4 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1，qiang3cheng1 zhao2 ba3 zui3chun2 long3 cheng2 ta1 xiang3yao4 de5 xing2zhuang4。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, terribly, the spirit begins to turn. You can hear the crack and pop of splintering vertebrae as its enormous head shifts on its shoulders.\n"
"\n"
"It fixes its cavernous gaze on you."
msgstr ""
"精魂​开始​缓慢​而​可怕​地​转动​。​当​它​巨大​的​头颅​在​肩上​移动​时​，​你​能​听见​椎骨​碎裂​的​咔嚓​声​与​爆裂声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它用​空洞​的​目光​注视​着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1hun2 kai1shi3 huan3man4 er2 ke3pa4 de5 zhuan3dong4。dang1 ta1 ju4da4 de5 tou2lu2 zai4 jian1 shang4 yi2dong4 shi2，ni3 neng2 ting1jian4 zhui1gu3 sui4lie4 de5 ka1cha1 sheng1 yu4 bao4 lie4 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yong4 kong1dong4 de5 mu4guang1 zhu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, the waves grow still and your senses calm.\n"
"\n"
"You find yourself staring into an infinite horizon. The blasted ruins of Feuerstelle stretch out in all directions, as far as the eye can see."
msgstr ""
"波涛​渐渐​平息​，​你​的​感官​也​随之​平静​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​发现自己​正​凝望​着​无垠​的​地平线​。​“​火坑​”​的​残垣断壁​向​四面八方​延伸​，​目之所及​尽​是​焦土​。\n"
"\n"
"bo1tao1 jian4jian4 ping2xi1，ni3 de5 gan3guan1 ye3 sui2zhi1 ping2jing4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 zheng1 ning2wang4 zhao2 wu2yin2 de5 di4ping2xian4。“huo3keng1” de5 can2yuan2duan4bi4 xiang4 si4mian4ba1fang1 yan2shen1，mu4zhi1suo3ji2 jin3 shi4 jiao1tu3。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, the wind begins to shift, and he sniffs the air, looking from you, to Eiger, then back to you. \n"
"\n"
"Acknowledgment washes across his face, and his expression softens. "
msgstr ""
"慢慢​地​，​风向​开始​变​了​。​他​嗅​着​空气​，​看看​你​，​看看​艾格尔​，​然后​又​看​向​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​似乎​终于​认出​了​你​，​表情​随之​柔和​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"man4man4 de5，feng1xiang4 kai1shi3 bian4 le5。ta1 xiu4 zhao2 kong1qi4，kan4kan5 ni3，kan4kan5 Ai4ge2er3，ran2hou4 you4 kan4 xiang4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 si4hu1 zhong1yu2 ren4chu1 le5 ni3，biao3qing2 sui2zhi1 rou2he2 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, through the swirling water, you begin to catch sight of something - a huge, alien shape, lined with ribbonlike tendrils of golden light. You can feel it closing in on you, a looming presence of suffocating enormity.\n"
"\n"
"Slowly, haltingly, it reaches toward you. Your arms and legs feel heavy and useless - it feels like you're swimming in tree sap. You are helpless."
msgstr ""
"透过​翻涌​的​水流​，​你​开始​缓缓​地​看清​某个​巨大​而​陌生​的​轮廓​，​镶嵌​着​缎带​般的​金光​触须​。​你​能​感觉​到​它​正​逼近​你​，​那​压迫​性​的​存在​如同​一座​窒息​的​巨山​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​迟缓​而​笨拙​地​抵近​你​。​你​的​四肢​沉重​而​无力​，​仿佛​在​黏稠​的​树液​中​游泳​。​你​束手无策​。\n"
"\n"
"tou4guo4 fan1yong3 de5 shui3liu2，ni3 kai1shi3 huan3huan3 de5 kan4qing1 mou3 ge4 ju4da4 er2 mo4sheng1 de5 lun2kuo4，xiang1qian4 zhao2 duan4dai4 ban1 de5 jin1 guang1 chu4xu1。ni3 neng2 gan3jue2 dao4 ta1 zheng1 bi1jin4 ni3，na4 ya1po4 xing4 de5 cun2zai4 ru2tong2 yi1 zuo4 zhi4xi1 de5 ju4 shan1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chi2huan3 er2 ben4zhuo1 de5 di3 jin4 ni3。ni3 de5 si4zhi1 chen2zhong4 er2 wu2li4，fang3fu2 zai4 nian2 chou2 de5 shu4ye4 zhong4 you2yong3。ni3 shu4shou3wu2ce4。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, you begin to stir. Murky, flickering impressions invade the oily stillness of your unconscious mind.\n"
"\n"
"The sensations come in waves, washing up over you and jerking you back toward consciousness."
msgstr ""
"你​渐渐​苏醒​。​浑浊​而​闪烁​的​印象​侵蚀​着​你​潜意识​中​油腻​的​寂静​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​种种​感觉​如​浪潮​般袭​来​，​将​你​卷入​又​猛然​抛回​清醒​的​彼岸​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jian4jian4 su1xing3。hun2zhuo2 er2 shan3shuo4 de5 yin4xiang4 qin1shi2 zhao2 ni3 qian2yi4shi2 zhong4 you2ni4 de5 ji4jing4。\n"
"\n"
"zhong3zhong3 gan3jue2 ru2 lang4chao2 ban1 xi2 lai2，jiang1 ni3 juan3ru4 you4 meng3ran2 pao1 hui2 qing1xing3 de5 bi3an4。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, you swim back to consciousness. Struggling to your feet, you find "
"Glory already standing and alert."
msgstr ""
"你​慢慢​恢复​了​意识​，​挣扎​着​站​起身​时​，​发现​格洛丽​早已​站​定​，​警觉​地守候​在​一旁​。\n"
"ni3 man4man4 hui1fu4 le5 yi4shi2，zheng1zha2 zhao2 zhan4 qi3shen1 shi2，fa1xian4 Ge2luo4li2 zao3yi3 zhan4 ding4，jing3jue2 de5 shou3 hou4 zai4 yi1pang2。"

msgid ""
"Slowly, you swim back to consciousness. The mound of stone that was Harrow's"
" shrine has shattered, and the aura of power that it emanated is gone."
msgstr ""
"你​慢慢​恢复​了​意识​，​发现​哈罗​的​石堆​神龛​已然​崩碎​，​曾经​笼罩​其上​的​灵光​也​消散​无踪​。\n"
"ni3 man4man4 hui1fu4 le5 yi4shi2，fa1xian4 ha1luo2 de5 dan4 dui1 shen2kan1 yi3ran2 beng1 sui4，ceng2jing1 long3zhao4 qi2 shang4 de5 ling2guang1 ye3 xiao1san4 wu2zong1。"

msgid "Slug Round"
msgstr ""
"独头弹\n"
"du2 tou2 dan4"

msgid "Smaller than most assault rifles, yet just as deadly."
msgstr ""
"比​大多数​突击​步枪​小巧​，​但​同样​致命​。\n"
"bi3 da4duo1shu4 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1 xiao3qiao3，dan4 tong2yang4 zhi4ming4。"

msgid "Smart move, pal. You'll see."
msgstr ""
"挺​识时务​嘛​，​老兄​。​你​就​瞧​好​吧​。\n"
"ting3 shi2shi2wu4 ma5，lao3xiong1。ni3 jiu4 qiao2 hao3 ba1。"

msgid "Smartest thing you've said all day."
msgstr ""
"这​是​你​今天​说​的​最​聪明​的话​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 jin1tian1 shuo1 de5 zui4 cong1ming5 de5hua4。"

msgid "Smash Server"
msgstr ""
"砸坏​服务器\n"
"za2huai4 fu2wu4qi4"

msgid "Smashed Server 1"
msgstr ""
"已​砸坏​的​服务器​1\n"
"yi3 za2huai4 de5 fu2wu4qi4 1"

msgid "Smashed Server 2"
msgstr ""
"已​砸坏​的​服务器​2\n"
"yi3 za2huai4 de5 fu2wu4qi4 2"

msgid "Smashed Server 3"
msgstr ""
"已​砸坏​的​服务器​3\n"
"yi3 za2huai4 de5 fu2wu4qi4 3"

msgid ""
"Smell does not matter! Without the Communion, *nothing* matters!\n"
"\n"
"I must rejoin, I must! Help me rejoin! Help me to hear it again!"
msgstr ""
"气味​无所谓​！​没有​共​融会​，​一切​都​无所谓​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​回归​，​我​必须​！​帮​我​回归​！​帮​我​再次​听到​它​！\n"
"\n"
"qi4wei4 wu2suo3wei4！mei2you3 gong4 rong2hui4，yi1qie4 dou1 wu2suo3wei4！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 hui2gui1，wo3 bi4xu1！bang1 wo3 hui2gui1！bang1 wo3 zai4ci4 ting1dao4 ta1！"

msgid ""
"Smells like something died in here. Upon closer inspection, it's just moldy "
"soy-cakes."
msgstr ""
"闻​起来​就​好像​有​什么​东西​死​在​了​这里​一样​。​仔细​查看​过后​发现​，​其实​只是​发霉​的​豆糕​。\n"
"wen2 qi3lai5 jiu4 hao3xiang4 you3 shen2me5 dong1xi1 si3 zai4 le5 zhe4li3 yi1yang4。zi3xi4 cha2kan4 guo4hou4 fa1xian4，qi2shi2 zhi3shi4 fa1mei2 de5 dou4 gao1。"

msgid "Smoke Grenade"
msgstr ""
"烟雾弹\n"
"yan1wu4dan4"

msgid "Smoker"
msgstr ""
"吸烟者\n"
"xi1 yan1 zhe3"

msgid "Smooth, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"漂亮​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"piao4liang5，$(l.name)。"

msgid "Smooth, boss."
msgstr ""
"漂亮​，​老大​。\n"
"piao4liang5，lao3da4。"

msgid "Smooth, chief."
msgstr ""
"漂亮​，​头儿​。\n"
"piao4liang5，tou2r5。"

msgid "Smuggler"
msgstr ""
"走私者\n"
"zou3 si1 zhe3"

msgid "Smuggler Mage"
msgstr ""
"走私者​法师\n"
"zou3 si1 zhe3 fa3shi1"

msgid "Snap Fire"
msgstr ""
"点射\n"
"dian3she4"

msgid "Sniffer Lvl 1"
msgstr ""
"嗅探器​I\n"
"xiu4 tan4 qi4 I"

msgid "Sniffer Lvl 2"
msgstr ""
"嗅探器​II\n"
"xiu4 tan4 qi4 II"

msgid "Sniffer Lvl 3"
msgstr ""
"嗅探器​III\n"
"xiu4 tan4 qi4 III"

msgid "Sniffer: Accuracy +15%"
msgstr ""
"嗅探器​：​精准度​+​15​%\n"
"xiu4 tan4 qi4：jing1 zhun3 du4 +15 %"

msgid "Sniffer: Accuracy +20%"
msgstr ""
"嗅探器​：​精准度​+​20​%\n"
"xiu4 tan4 qi4：jing1 zhun3 du4 +20 %"

msgid "Sniffer: Accuracy +25%"
msgstr ""
"嗅探器​：​精准度​+​25​%\n"
"xiu4 tan4 qi4：jing1 zhun3 du4 +25 %"

msgid "Sniper Rifle Specialist III"
msgstr ""
"狙击步枪​专家​III\n"
"ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1 zhuan1jia1 III"

msgid "Sniper Specialist I"
msgstr ""
"狙击步枪​专家​I\n"
"ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1 zhuan1jia1 I"

msgid "Sniper Specialist II"
msgstr ""
"狙击步枪​专家​III\n"
"ju1 ji1 bu4 qiang1 zhuan1jia1 III"

msgid ""
"So *maybe* she was a Saeder-Krupp mole. And she got close to me so that she could... I dunno, so she could profit from my decking expertise?\n"
"\n"
"Maybe when she told me not to steal that data, she was using reverse psychology. That's gotta be it... she must've *wanted* me to take it."
msgstr ""
"所以​*​也许​*​她​是​赛德​-​克虏伯​的​内​鬼​，​接近​我​只是​为了​……​我​不​知道​，​也许​是​为了​利用​我​的​骇入​技术​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​当​她​告诉​我​不要​窃取​那些​数据​时​，​她​是​在​使用​反向​心理战术​。​一定​是​这样​……​她​一定​*​想​*​让我拿​走​它​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3*ye3xu3*ta1 shi4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 de5 nei4 gui3，jie1jin4 wo3 zhi3shi4 wei4le5……wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，ye3xu3 shi4 wei4le5 li4yong4 wo3 de5 hai4 ru4 ji4shu4？\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 dang1 ta1 gao4su4 wo3 bu4yao4 qie4qu3 na4xie1 shu4ju4 shi2，ta1 shi4 zai4 shi3yong4 fan3xiang4 xin1 li3 zhan4 shu4。yi1ding4 shi4 zhe4yang4……ta1 yi1ding4*xiang3*rang4 wo3 na2 zou3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"So I already mentioned that Berlin's punks and anarchists joined forces to fight off the racists, right? And after a long, bloody fight, we beat 'em.\n"
"\n"
"What I didn't mention is how I figured into all of this."
msgstr ""
"我​之前​说​过​，​柏林​的​街头​混混​和​无政府主义​者​齐心协力​，​对抗​那帮​种族主义者​，​对​吧​？​经过​一番​漫长​的​血腥​战斗​，​我们​击败​了​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​之前​没说​我​是​怎么​参与​其中​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 guo4，bo2lin2 de5 jie1tou2 hun4 hun4 he4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3 qi2xin1xie2li4，dui4kang4 na4 bang1 zhong3zu2zhu3yi4zhe3，dui4 ba1？jing1guo4 yi1 fan1 man4chang2 de5 xue4xing1 zhan4dou4，wo3men5 ji1bai4 le5 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 zhi1qian2 mei2 shuo1 wo3 shi4 zen3me5 can1yu4 qi2zhong1 de5。"

msgid ""
"So I became Harrow's apprentice. He taught me to channel magic and summon "
"spirits. He taught me rituals and pagan traditions, Machiavellian philosophy"
" and Nietzschean ethics."
msgstr ""
"我​随后​成为​了​哈罗​的​学徒​。​他​教会​我​引导​魔法​、​召唤​精魂​。​他​传授​我​仪式​与​异教​传统​，​马基雅​维利​式​的​哲学​与​尼采​式​的​伦理​。\n"
"wo3 sui2hou4 cheng2wei2 le5 ha1luo2 de5 xue2tu2。ta1 jiao1hui4 wo3 yin3dao3 mo2fa3、zhao4huan4 jing1hun2。ta1 chuan2shou4 wo3 yi2shi4 yu4 yi4jiao4 chuan2tong3，ma3 ji1 ya3 wei2 li4 shi4 de5 zhe2xue2 yu4 ni2cai3 shi4 de5 lun2li3。"

msgid "So I can count on you to hear what’s going on?"
msgstr ""
"所以​我​可以​靠​你​来​打听​附近​发生​的​事情​？\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 ke3yi3 kao4 ni3 lai2 da3ting5 fu4jin4 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5？"

msgid ""
"So I could use this one to overload the one that the guard is standing by.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks at the junction box again and nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah... I could feed a nice power spike into that one from here. Y'know, if you wanted me to."
msgstr ""
"所以​我​可以​用​这个​来​干扰​守卫​旁边​的​那个​接线盒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​再次​看​向​接线盒​，​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​我能​从​这里​给​那个​接线盒​发送​一次​电压​突波​，​如果​你​需要的话​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 ke3yi3 yong4 zhe4ge5 lai2 gan1rao3 shou3wei4 pang2bian1 de5 na4ge5 jie1xian4he2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zai4ci4 kan4 xiang4 jie1xian4he2，dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……wo3 neng2 cong2 zhe4li3 gei3 na4ge5 jie1xian4he2 fa1song4 yi1ci4 dian4ya1 tu1 bo1，ru2guo3 ni3 xu1 yao4 de5 hua4。"

msgid ""
"So I decided to talk him down. I stepped forward and introduced myself, and apologized for trespassing in his field.\n"
"\n"
"We talked for a while, and he promised not to alert the border authorities. He put his hand on my shoulder, and he told me that we were doing God's work."
msgstr ""
"于是​我​决定​劝说​他​。​我​上前​自我介绍​，​并​为​擅闯​他​的​田地​致歉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​交谈​片刻​，​他​承诺​不会​报警​。​他​把手​搭​在​我​肩上​，​告诉​我​说​我们​是​在​行​上帝​之​事​。\n"
"\n"
"yu2shi4 wo3 jue2ding4 quan4shuo1 ta1。wo3 shang4qian2 zi4wo3jie4shao4，bing4 wei2 shan4chuang3 ta1 de5 tian2di4 zhi4qian4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jiao1tan2 pian4ke4，ta1 cheng2nuo4 bu4hui4 bao4jing3。ta1 ba3shou3 da1 zai4 wo3 jian1 shang4，gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 wo3men5 shi4 zai4 xing2 shang4di4 zhi1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"So I have a bit of attachment, for all the running away from it that I did."
msgstr ""
"所以​我​对​它​有​一点​依恋​，​尽管​我​一直​试图​逃离​它​。\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 dui4 ta1 you3 yi1dian3 yi1lian4，jin3guan3 wo3 yi1zhi2 shi4tu2 tao2li2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"So I have heard. \n"
"\n"
"One day, perhaps I will learn this language. For now, “Thank you” must suffice."
msgstr ""
"我​听说​过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​有​一天​，​我会​学会​其中​的​门道​。​但​目前​而言​，​我​只能​表达​口头​感谢​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 guo4。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 you3 yi1 tian1，wo3 hui4 xue2hui4 qi2zhong1 de5 men2dao4。dan4 mu4qian2 er2yan2，wo3 zhi3neng2 biao3da2 kou3tou2 gan3xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"So I listened to Him, and I cracked the skulls of a lot of bad people. He saw this, and was pleased, and rewarded me with magic. And I used that magic to crack bigger, thicker skulls. And so on.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a simple life, but a good one."
msgstr ""
"于是​我​听从​祂​的话​，​干掉​了​一大堆​恶棍​。​祂​看见​这​一切​甚​是​欢喜​，​便​赐予​我​魔法​。​我​又​用​这​魔法​干掉​更​凶​更​恶​的​人​。​如此​循环往复​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​活得​挺​简单​，​但​也​挺舒服​。\n"
"\n"
"yu2shi4 wo3 ting1cong2 ta1 de5hua4，gan4diao4 le5 yi1 dai4 dui1 e4gun4。ta1 kan4jian4 zhe4 yi1qie4 shen4 shi4 huan1xi3，bian4 ci4yu3 wo3 mo2fa3。wo3 you4 yong4 zhe4 mo2fa3 gan4diao4 geng1 xiong1 geng1 e4 de5 ren2。ru2ci3 xun2 huan2 wang3 fu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huo2 de2 ting3 jian3dan1，dan4 ye3 ting3 shu1 fu2。"

msgid ""
"So I was in a bind, right? The members of the Schwarze Herzen who were loyal"
" to Luster were all out for my blood, and none of the others were gonna "
"stick their necks out for me."
msgstr ""
"所以​我​陷入​了​困境​，​对​吧​？​那些​效忠​于​卢​斯特​的​“​黑心​”​成员​都​想​置​我​于​死地​，​而​没有​其他人​愿意​为​我​挺身而出​。\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 xian4ru4 le5 kun4jing4，dui4 ba1？na4xie1 xiao4zhong1 yu2 lu2 si1 te4 de5“hei1xin1” cheng2yuan2 dou1 xiang3 zhi4 wo3 yu2 si3 de5，er2 mei2you3 qi2 ta1 ren2 yuan4yi4 wei2 wo3 ting3shen1er2chu1。"

msgid ""
"So I'll ask you again: are you ready for this? I need an honest answer."
msgstr ""
"所以​我​再​问​你​一遍​：​你​准备​好了吗​？​你​要​如实​回答​我​。\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 zai4 wen4 ni3 yi1bian4：ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5？ni3 yao4 ru2shi2 hui2da2 wo3。"

msgid "So I've heard."
msgstr ""
"我​是​这么​听说​过​。\n"
"wo3 shi4 zhe4me5 ting1shuo1 guo4。"

msgid ""
"So I've heard. And they use their influence to ruin the poor sheep that "
"flock to them."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​这么​听说​的​。​然后​他们​就​会​利用自身​的​影响力​，​让​那些​蜂拥而至​的​可怜​羔羊​陷入​万劫不复​的​境地​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 ting1shuo1 de5。ran2hou4 ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 li4 yong4 zi4 shen1 de5 ying3xiang3li4，rang4 na4xie1 feng1yong1er2zhi4 de5 ke3lian2 gao1yang2 xian4ru4 wan4jie2bu4fu4 de5 jing4di4。"

msgid ""
"So I’m asking you, as a personal favor, to let me come along on the run. I have to get into that compound, $(l.name)... I *have* to find Alexander.\n"
"\n"
"I have to turn him around before those animals make him do something unforgivable."
msgstr ""
"就​当​是​我​求求​你​了​，​让​我​也​参与​这次​行动​吧​。​我​得到​那帮人​的​地盘​去​，​$(l.name)​……​我​*​必须​*​找到​亚历山大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​那​帮​畜生​迫使​他​犯下​不可​饶恕​的​事​之前​，​我​必须​把​他​带​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 dang1 shi4 wo3 qiu2 qiu2 ni3 le5，rang4 wo3 ye3 can1yu4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 ba1。wo3 de2dao4 na4 bang1 ren2 de5 di4pan2 qu4，$(l.name)……wo3*bi4xu1*zhao3dao4 ya4li4shan1da4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4 bang1 chu4sheng5 po4shi3 ta1 fan4 xia4 bu4ke3 rao2shu4 de5 shi4 zhi1qian2，wo3 bi4xu1 ba3 ta1 dai4 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"So after all of this went down, you decided to bail out of the Ruhrplex and head to Berlin. \n"
"\n"
"Am I getting that right?"
msgstr ""
"所以​在​这​之后​，​你​就​决定​离开​鲁尔​都会区​，​来到​柏林​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说得对​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 zai4 zhe4 zhi1hou4，ni3 jiu4 jue2ding4 li2kai1 lu3 er3 dou1 hui4 qu1，lai2dao4 bo2lin2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de2 dui4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So anyway. I lived on the street for a few years. Got used to being hungry all the time, got used to getting rained on. Got by.\n"
"\n"
"I was painfully aware that I had magical talents, but without any kind of training or guidance, I didn't really know how to use or develop them. Truth be told, they scared me, so I more or less ignored them."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我​在​街头​流浪​了​好几年​。​渐渐​习惯​了​每天​饿肚子​，​也​习惯​了​被​雨水​淋透​。​就​这样​熬过来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​痛苦​地​意识​到​自己​拥有​魔法​天赋​，​但​缺乏​任何​训练​或​指引​，​根本​不知​如何​运用​或​开发​这些​能力​。​说实话​，​它们​让​我心​生​恐惧​，​所以​我​基本​选择​视而不见​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 zai4 jie1tou2 liu2lang4 le5 hao3ji3nian2。jian4jian4 xi2guan4 le5 mei3tian1 e4du4zi5，ye3 xi2guan4 le5 bei4 yu3shui3 lin2 tou4。jiu4 zhe4yang4 ao1 guo4 lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong4ku3 de5 yi4shi2 dao4 zi4ji3 yong1you3 mo2fa3 tian1fu4，dan4 que1fa2 ren4he2 xun4lian4 huo4 zhi3yin3，gen1ben3 bu4zhi1 ru2he2 yun4yong4 huo4 kai1fa1 zhe4xie1 neng2li4。shuo1shi2hua4，ta1men5 rang4 wo3 xin1 sheng1 kong3ju4，suo3yi3 wo3 ji1ben3 xuan3ze2 shi4er2bu4jian4。"

msgid "So are you a wine drinker, then?"
msgstr ""
"看来​你​很会​品酒​了​？\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 hen3 hui4 pin3jiu3 le5？"

msgid "So be it."
msgstr ""
"那​就​这样​吧​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 zhe4yang4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"So did Hasenkamp.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The troll leers at you through the security grate.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look where that got him."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​不​也​是​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​巨魔​透过​安保​格栅​猥琐​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看看​他​是​什么​下场​。\n"
"\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 bu4 ye3 shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 tou4guo4 an1bao3 ge2shan1 wei3suo3 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4kan5 ta1 shi4 shen2me5 xia4chang3。"

msgid "So did we... y'know.. did we win?"
msgstr ""
"所以​……​你​说​……​我们​赢​了​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 shuo1……wo3men5 ying2 le5 ma5？"

msgid "So did you lay off, like the message said?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​真的​照​她​说​的​离开​了​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 zhen1de5 zhao4 ta1 shuo1 de5 li2kai1 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So essentially you've been trapped here for the past two years because of "
"dumb luck."
msgstr ""
"所以​你们​被困​在​这里​两年​，​仅仅​是因为​运气​不好​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3men5 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 liang3 nian2，jin3jin3 shi4 yin1 wei2 yun4qi5 bu4hao3？"

msgid ""
"So far, so good, $(l.name). Your manufactured power outage is causing ongoing problems for both Knight Errant and Aztechnology.\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, your presence has been detected. To this point, they've been too disorganized to do anything about it, but make no mistake: they *will* be coming for you."
msgstr ""
"目前​一切顺利​，​$(l.name)​。​你​制造​的​断电​事件​正​持续​给​游侠​骑士​和​阿兹特​科技​带来​麻烦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​遗憾​的​是​，​对方​已经​发觉​了​你​的​行踪​。​到​目前为止​，​他们​还腾​不出​人手​来​，​但​你​可别​心存侥幸​：​他们​*​肯定​*​会​来​追捕​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"mu4qian2 yi1 qie1 shun4 li4，$(l.name)。ni3 zhi4zao4 de5 duan4dian4 shi4jian4 zheng1 chi2xu4 gei3 you2Xia2qi2shi4 he4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 dai4lai2 ma2fan5。\n"
"\n"
"yi2han4 de5 shi4，dui4fang1 yi3jing1 fa1jue2 le5 ni3 de5 xing2zong1。dao4 mu4 qian2 wei2 zhi3，ta1men5 hai2 teng2 bu4 chu1 ren2shou3 lai2，dan4 ni3 ke3 bie4 xin1 cun2 jiao3 xing4：ta1men5*ken3ding4*hui4 lai2 zhui1bu3 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"So far, so good. If your skirmish with security set off any alarms, you don't hear them. Monika leads the rest of the team downward, into the basement of the Harfeld Manor.\n"
"\n"
"Your payday is waiting. The data vault lies ahead."
msgstr ""
"目前​一切顺利​。​如果说​你​与​警卫​的​冲突​真的​触发​了​警报​，​那​你​起码​到​现在​还​没​听到​任何​动静​。​莫妮卡​带领​其他​队员​进入​了​哈​菲尔德​庄园​的​地下室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​数据库​就​在​前面​。​你​很快​就​能​拿到​报酬​了​。\n"
"\n"
"mu4qian2 yi1 qie1 shun4 li4。ru2guo3shuo1 ni3 yu4 jing3wei4 de5 chong1tu1 zhen1de5 chu4fa1 le5 jing3bao4，na4 ni3 qi3ma3 dao4 xian4zai4 hai2 mei2 ting1dao4 ren4he2 dong4jing4。Mo4ni1ka3 dai4ling3 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 jin4ru4 le5 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 de5 di4xia4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"shu4ju4ku4 jiu4 zai4 qian2mian4。ni3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 neng2 na2dao4 bao4chou5 le5。"

msgid ""
"So finally, after what felt like an hour, Dad stopped tuning me up with the hammer.\n"
"\n"
"I had broken ribs, a busted arm, I couldn't see out of my left eye, and my entire right side was covered with one giant bruise. I was bleeding all over the place, making a real mess of the carpet."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​不知​过去​多久​之后​，​我​父亲​总算​停下​了​手里​的​锤子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​肋骨​断​了​，​一只​胳膊​无力​地​垂​着​，​只能​通过​左​眼看​向​前方​，​而​整个​右​半边​都​是​大块​淤青​。​我​全身​血流​不止​，​把​地毯​染成​了​一片​血污​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，bu4zhi1 guo4qu4 duo1jiu3 zhi1hou4，wo3 fu4qin1 zong3suan4 ting2xia4 le5 shou3li3 de5 chui2zi5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 lei4gu3 duan4 le5，yi1 zhi3 ge1bo5 wu2li4 de5 chui2 zhao2，zhi3neng2 tong1guo4 zuo3 yan3kan4 xiang4 qian2fang1，er2 zheng3ge4 you4 ban4bian1 dou1 shi4 dai4 kuai4 yu1qing1。wo3 quan2shen1 xue4liu2 bu4zhi3，ba3 di4tan3 ran3 cheng2 le5 yi1 pian1 xue4wu1。"

msgid ""
"So he's definitely got the means... but I can't see how he'd have the motive. He actively prevented the Firewing's rescue back in 2012, after all. Same thing is true for Nebelherr, so let's scratch the both of them off the list.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He flips a page, frowning.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"所以​他​肯定​有​办法​……​但​我​想不出​他​有​什么​动机​。​毕竟​他​可是​在​2012​年​积极​阻止​了​对​火翼​的​营救​，​而​内伯尔​赫尔​也​是​一样​，​所以​我​还是​把​他们​俩​从​名单​上​划掉​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​皱着眉头​翻​了​一页​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ta1 ken3ding4 you3 ban4fa3……dan4 wo3 xiang3 bu4 chu1 ta1 you3 shen2me5 dong4ji1。bi4jing4 ta1 ke3shi4 zai4 2012 nian2 ji1ji2 zu3zhi3 le5 dui4 Huo3yi4 de5 ying2jiu4，er2 Nei4bai3er3he4er3 ye3 shi4 yi1yang4，suo3yi3 wo3 hai2shi5 ba3 ta1men5 lia3 cong2 ming2dan1 shang4 hua4diao4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2 fan1 le5 yi1 xie2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "So how 'bout it? Wanna fill me in?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​怎么​说​？​愿意​给​我​讲讲​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1？yuan4yi4 gei3 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 ma5？"

msgid "So how about it? You want a crack at that vault, or not?"
msgstr ""
"所以​怎么​说​？​你​到底​想​不想​破解​那​保险库​？\n"
"suo3yi3 zen3me5 shuo1？ni3 dao4di3 xiang3 bu4xiang3 po4jie3 na4 bao3 xian3 ku4？"

msgid "So how do we purify the spirit? Some sort of ceremony or ritual?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​我们​要​如何​净化​那个​精魂​？​通过​某种​仪式​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3，wo3men5 yao4 ru2he2 jing4hua4 na4ge5 jing1hun2？tong1guo4 mou3zhong3 yi2shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So if we purify the spirit, Feuerstelle dies. We save the kids, and the "
"nightmare ends."
msgstr ""
"所以​如果​我们​净化​了​精魂​，​“​火坑​”​便会​随之​消亡​。​我们​会​救出​所有​的​孩子​，​这场​噩梦​也​将​结束​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ru2guo3 wo3men5 jing4hua4 le5 jing1hun2，“huo3keng1” bian4 hui4 sui2zhi1 xiao1wang2。wo3men5 hui4 jiu4chu1 suo3you3 de5 hai2zi5，zhe4 chang2 e4meng4 ye3 jiang1 jie2shu4。"

msgid ""
"So is there something else that you wanted to talk about? If so... if you "
"have any other concerns... then voice them."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​还有​什么​别的​事​要说​吗​？​如果​……​你​有​任何​担忧​的话​……​尽管​说​出来​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 yao4shuo1 ma5？ru2guo3……ni3 you3 ren4he2 dan1you1 de5hua4……jin3guan3 shuo1 chu1lai2。"

msgid "So is your employer my new client?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​雇主​要​当​我​的​客户​吗​？\n"
"ni3 de5 gu4zhu3 yao4 dang1 wo3 de5 ke4hu4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So it just sort of went like that, until a few days after my seventeenth "
"birthday. Then I met Marta, and everything changed."
msgstr ""
"事情​就​这样​发展​着​，​直到​我​十七岁​生日​后​的​几天​。​那时​我​遇见​了​玛​尔塔​，​一切​都​随之​改变​了​。\n"
"shi4qing5 jiu4 zhe4yang4 fa1zhan3 zhao2，zhi2dao4 wo3 shi2 qi1 sui4 sheng1ri4 hou4 de5 ji3tian1。na4shi2 wo3 yu4jian4 le5 Ma3er3ta3，yi1qie4 dou1 sui2zhi1 gai3bian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"So it's up to you, chief. You really wanna go down this road?\n"
"\n"
"Or shall we keep this relationship professional?"
msgstr ""
"你​决定​吧​，​头儿​。​你​一定​要​刨根问底​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​还是​说​我们​继续​保持​彼此之间​的​专业​关系​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2ding4 ba1，tou2r5。ni3 yi1ding4 yao4 pao2gen1wen4di3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 shuo1 wo3men5 ji4xu4 bao3chi2 bi3 ci3 zhi1 jian1 de5 zhuan1ye4 guan1xi5？"

msgid ""
"So just to be clear, here... you're planning on perfecting Vauclair's "
"weapon? What does that mean, exactly?"
msgstr ""
"让​我​捋​一下​……​你​打算​完善​沃​克莱尔​的​武器​？​这​具体​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"rang4 wo3 lu:3 yi1xia4……ni3 da3suan4 wan2shan4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 wu3qi4？zhe4 ju4ti3 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid "So kicking in the front door is out, then."
msgstr ""
"意思​是​不能​正面​突入​喽​。\n"
"yi4si5 shi4 bu4neng2 zheng4mian4 tu1 ru4 lou5。"

msgid ""
"So let me ask you: just what was your relationship with Monika, anyway? \n"
"\n"
"I know that you two knew each other way back, but she was pretty coy about these things."
msgstr ""
"那​我​问​你​，​你​和​莫妮卡​到底​是​什么​关系​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​你​俩​早就​认识​，​可​她​一直​不太​愿意​提​这个​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 wen4 ni3，ni3 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 guan1xi5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 lia3 zao3jiu4 ren4shi5，ke3 ta1 yi1zhi2 bu4 tai4 yuan4yi4 ti2 zhe4ge5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "So let me guess. You want me to go fetch your merchandise."
msgstr ""
"让​我​猜猜​。​你​是​想​让​我​去​帮​你​拿​回​商品​。\n"
"rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1。ni3 shi4 xiang3 rang4 wo3 qu4 bang1 ni3 na2 hui2 shang1pin3。"

msgid "So long as he himself is not provoked."
msgstr ""
"前提​是​他​自己​不​被​激怒​。\n"
"qian2ti2 shi4 ta1 zi4ji3 bu4 bei4 ji1nu4。"

msgid "So long, Dietrich."
msgstr ""
"再见​，​迪​特里​希​。\n"
"zai4jian4，Di2te4li3xi1。"

msgid "So many more would be gone if you hadn't been here."
msgstr ""
"要不是​你​在​的话​，​死​的​人​就​远远​不止​这些​了​。\n"
"yao4bu5shi4 ni3 zai4 de5hua4，si3 de5 ren2 jiu4 yuan3yuan3 bu4zhi3 zhe4xie1 le5。"

msgid "So much changed..."
msgstr ""
"一切​都​变​了​……\n"
"yi1qie4 dou1 bian4 le5……"

msgid ""
"So much for doing the humane thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head sadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well... I guess we might as well load the body into the van. Herr Schmidt won't be happy, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"人道主义​的​事​就​到​这里​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​悲伤地​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看​咱们​也​只能​把​这具​尸体​塞进​车里​了​。​施密特​先生​肯定​不会​对此​感到高兴​，​不过​总​比​什么​都​没有​强​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2dao4zhu3yi4 de5 shi4 jiu4 dao4 zhe4li3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bei1 shang1 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4 zan2men5 ye3 zhi3neng2 ba3 zhe4 ju4 shi1ti3 se4 jin4 che1 li3 le5。shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，bu4guo4 zong3 bi3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3 jiang4。"

msgid "So much for sneaking out of here undetected..."
msgstr ""
"看来​是​没法​悄悄​溜走​了​……\n"
"kan4lai5 shi4 mei2fa3 qiao1qiao1 liu1zou3 le5……"

msgid ""
"So my idol, the ancient deity that was feeding me my power, was the antithesis of everything that is right and good. \n"
"\n"
"And you know what? \n"
"\n"
"I didn't care."
msgstr ""
"原来​我​的​偶像​，​那个​赋予​我​力量​的​远古​神祇​，​竟是​正义​与​善良​的​对立面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​猜​如何​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​毫不在意​。\n"
"\n"
"yuan2lai2 wo3 de5 ou3xiang4，na4ge5 fu4yu3 wo3 li4liang5 de5 yuan3gu3 shen2qi2，jing4 shi4 zheng4yi4 yu4 shan4liang2 de5 dui4li4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 cai1 ru2he2 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hao2 bu4 zai4 yi4。"

msgid "So now I look like the concierge?"
msgstr ""
"这会儿​我​看着​又​像​门房​了​？\n"
"zhe4hui4r5 wo3 kan4 zhao2 you4 xiang4 men2fang2 le5？"

msgid ""
"So now I've got a target. A place to start digging for real. The \"Harfeld Manor,\" conveniently located on an isolated stretch of countryside, far away from prying eyes.\n"
"\n"
"Matrix records indicate that some sort of data vault exists beneath the estate, so that's what I need to get into."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​我​有​了​目标​。​一个​可以​真正​开始​调查​的​地方​。​“​哈​菲尔德​庄园​”​，​坐落​在​一片​偏僻​的​乡间​，​远离​窥探者​的​视线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​矩阵​记录​显示​庄园​地下​有​某种​数据​保险库​，​所以​我​需要​进入​那里​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，wo3 you3 le5 mu4biao1。yi1ge5 ke3yi3 zhen1zheng4 kai1shi3 diao4cha2 de5 di4fang1。“Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2”，zuo4luo4 zai4 yi1 pian1 pian1pi4 de5 xiang1jian1，yuan3li2 kui1 tan4 zhe3 de5 shi4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ju3zhen4 ji4lu4 xian3shi4 zhuang1yuan2 di4xia4 you3 mou3zhong3 shu4ju4 bao3 xian3 ku4，suo3yi3 wo3 xu1yao4 jin4ru4 na4li5。"

msgid ""
"So now what? Monika’s gone. Paul’s gone. \n"
"\n"
"Do we keep running together, or is this the end of the road?"
msgstr ""
"所以​现在​怎么办​？​莫妮卡​死​了​。​保罗​也​死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​是​继续​组队​接​活儿​，​还是​就此​解散​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 xian4zai4 zen3me5ban4？Mo4ni1ka3 si3 le5。bao3luo2 ye3 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 ji4xu4 zu3dui4 jie1 huo2r5，hai2shi5 jiu4ci3 jie3san4？"

msgid ""
"So now, I've got a target. A place to start digging. The \"Harfeld Manor,\" conveniently located on an isolated stretch of countryside, miles away from prying eyes.\n"
"\n"
"Matrix records indicate that some sort of data vault exists beneath the estate, so that's what I need to get into."
msgstr ""
"现在​，​我​有​了​目标​。​一个​可以​开始​调查​的​地方​。​“​哈​菲尔德​庄园​”​，​坐落​在​一片​偏僻​的​乡间​，​远离​窥探者​的​视线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​矩阵​记录​显示​庄园​地下​有​某种​数据​保险库​，​所以​我​需要​进入​那里​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，wo3 you3 le5 mu4biao1。yi1ge5 ke3yi3 kai1shi3 diao4cha2 de5 di4fang1。“Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2”，zuo4luo4 zai4 yi1 pian1 pian1pi4 de5 xiang1jian1，yuan3li2 kui1 tan4 zhe3 de5 shi4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ju3zhen4 ji4lu4 xian3shi4 zhuang1yuan2 di4xia4 you3 mou3zhong3 shu4ju4 bao3 xian3 ku4，suo3yi3 wo3 xu1yao4 jin4ru4 na4li5。"

msgid "So out with it. What's your deal?"
msgstr ""
"所以​说​说​吧​，​你​有​什么​事​？\n"
"suo3yi3 shuo1 shuo1 ba1，ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "So she could still be out there."
msgstr ""
"所以​她​可能​依旧​在​那儿​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ta1 ke3neng2 yi1jiu4 zai4 na4r5。"

msgid ""
"So sorry about that. But now there can be no question... you do belong here.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His smile could curdle milk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Welcome aboard."
msgstr ""
"真是​非常​抱歉​。​但​现在​毋庸置疑​了​……​你​确实​是​这里​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​重新​露出​那​副​标志性​的​假笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​加入​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 fei1chang2 bao4qian4。dan4 xian4zai4 wu2 yong1 zhi4 yi2 le5……ni3 que4shi2 shi4 zhe4li3 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong2xin1 lu4chu1 na4 fu4 biao1zhi4xing4 de5 jia3 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 jia1ru4。"

msgid ""
"So tell me, $(l.name). Is there anything more that you need to hear from me?\n"
"\n"
"Or are you ready to make a decision?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​你​还有​什么​想​从​我​这里​了解​的​事情​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​你​已经​准备​好​做​决定​了​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，$(l.name)。ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xiang3 cong2 wo3 zhe4li3 liao3jie3 de5 shi4qing5？\n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3 ni3 yi3jing1 zhun3bei4 hao3 zuo4 jue2ding4 le5？"

msgid ""
"So that you'll understand. I don't like Humanis... I *hate* the swine.\n"
"\n"
"But there's one of 'em that I've got to try to save. My nephew, Alexander."
msgstr ""
"以便​让​你​明白​我​有​多​讨厌​人类​至上​主义者​……​我​*​恨​*​这些​猪猡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他们​中有​个人​我​得​保​下来​。​我​的​侄子​，​亚历山大​。\n"
"\n"
"yi3bian4 rang4 ni3 ming2bai5 wo3 you3 duo1 tao3yan4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3……wo3*hen4*zhe4xie1 zhu1luo2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1men5 zhong4 you3 ge4ren2 wo3 de2 bao3 xia4lai5。wo3 de5 zhi2zi5，ya4li4shan1da4。"

msgid ""
"So that's the story. My KSK career died with the rest of the team... our mission was illegal, after all. Off the books.\n"
"\n"
"There was no going back for me, so I wound up here."
msgstr ""
"事情​就是​这样​。​我​的​KSK​生涯​随着​整个​团队​的​覆灭​而​终结​……​毕竟​我们​的​任务​本​就​非法​。​一切​都​属于​地下​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​没有​无路​可退​了​，​所以​我​最终​来到​了​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。wo3 de5 KSK sheng1ya2 sui2zhe5 zheng3ge4 tuan2dui4 de5 fu4mie4 er2 zhong1jie2……bi4jing4 wo3men5 de5 ren4wu5 ben3 jiu4 fei1fa3。yi1qie4 dou1 shu3yu2 di4xia4 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 mei2you3 wu2 lu4 ke3 tui4 le5，suo3yi3 wo3 zui4zhong1 lai2dao4 le5 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"So that's what you need to know about the Schwarze Herzen.\n"
"\n"
"They were a great gang. A powerful gang. I helped to make 'em that way.\n"
"\n"
"Then they had a management turnover, and everything went to hell."
msgstr ""
"所以​这​就是​关于​“​黑心​”​的​一切​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​曾​是​个​很​厉害​的​帮派​。​这​其中​有​我​的​功劳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​管理层​发生​了​更迭​，​后面​就​一去不复返了​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 zhe4 jiu4shi4 guan1yu2“hei1xin1” de5 yi1qie4 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ceng2 shi4 ge4 hen3 li4hai5 de5 bang1pai4。zhe4 qi2zhong1 you3 wo3 de5 gong1lao2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 guan3 li3 ceng2 fa1sheng1 le5 geng1die2，hou4mian5 jiu4 yi1 qu4 bu4 fu4 fan3 le5。"

msgid "So the Adversary isn't what I'd been told."
msgstr ""
"所以​反叛者​和​我​所​了解​的​并​不​一样​。\n"
"suo3yi3 fan3 pan4 zhe3 he4 wo3 suo3 liao3jie3 de5 bing4 bu4 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"So the cultists here... they're like puppets? The shrine controls them?"
msgstr ""
"所以​这里​的​教徒​……​就​好比​是​傀儡​？​那座​神龛​控制​着​他们​？\n"
"suo3yi3 zhe4li3 de5 jiao4tu2……jiu4 hao3bi3 shi4 kui3lei3？na4 zuo4 shen2kan1 kong4zhi4 zhao2 ta1men5？"

msgid ""
"So the dragon has a bio-weapon. All right, good to know. But that doesn't "
"change what we need to do."
msgstr ""
"所以​这条​龙​现在​有​了​生化武器​。​知道​总比​不​知道​要强​，​但​我们​眼下​的​工作​不能​变​。\n"
"suo3yi3 zhe4 tiao2 long2 xian4zai4 you3 le5 sheng1hua4wu3qi4。zhi1dao4 zong3 bi3 bu4 zhi1dao4 yao4qiang2，dan4 wo3men5 yan3xia4 de5 gong1zuo4 bu4neng2 bian4。"

msgid ""
"So the dragon has a killer AI in charge of security.\n"
"\n"
"I can't say I'm surprised. But then, nothing surprises me anymore."
msgstr ""
"所以​有个​杀手​AI​给​那条​巨龙​当​安保​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不能​说​对此​感到​意外​。​但​话说回来​，​现在​也​没什么​能​让​我​感到​意外​了​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 you3 ge4 sha1shou3 AI gei3 na4 tiao2 ju4long2 dang1 an1bao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 shuo1 dui4 ci3 gan3dao4 yi4wai4。dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，xian4zai4 ye3 mei2shen2me5 neng2 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 yi4wai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"So the mages do something to one of you, and the entire group feels the "
"effects?"
msgstr ""
"所以​说​，​如果​法师​们​对​你们​其中​一人​进行​实验​，​你们​整组​人​都​会​受到​影响​？\n"
"suo3yi3 shuo1，ru2guo3 fa3shi1 men5 dui4 ni3men5 qi2zhong1 yi1 ren2 jin4xing2 shi2yan4，ni3men5 zheng3 zu3 ren2 dou1 hui4 shou4dao4 ying3xiang3？"

msgid ""
"So the moral of this story, I guess, is not to take an employer's word at face value. It's a lesson that every shadowrunner needs to learn sooner or later, but I had a harder time with it than most.\n"
"\n"
"Now, can we talk about something else? Or better yet, can we shut up and have a drink or two? All of this yapping is making me thirsty."
msgstr ""
"我​想​，​这个​故事​的​寓意​就是​，​不要​轻信​雇主​的话​。​这是​每个​暗影​狂奔​者​迟早​都​要​学会​的​一课​，​但​我​算是​栽​了​个​比较​大​的​跟头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​我们​能聊点​别的​吗​？​或者​我们​能​闭嘴​喝​一两杯​吗​？​说​了​这么​半天​，​我​都​快​渴死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3，zhe4ge5 gu4shi4 de5 yu4yi4 jiu4shi4，bu4yao4 qing1xin4 gu4zhu3 de5hua4。zhe4 shi4 mei3ge4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 chi2zao3 dou1 yao4 xue2hui4 de5 yi1 ke4，dan4 wo3 suan4shi4 zai1 le5 ge4 bi3jiao4 dai4 de5 gen1tou5。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3men5 neng2 liao2 dian3 bie2de5 ma5？huo4zhe3 wo3men5 neng2 bi4zui3 he4 yi1 liang3 bei1 ma5？shuo1 le5 zhe4me5 ban4tian1，wo3 dou1 kuai4 ke3 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"So the rich kids get the deck stacked in their favor, and the kids who got "
"where they are on merit get shafted. Sounds about right."
msgstr ""
"所以​富家子弟​总能​占​尽​便宜​，​而​凭​实力​打拼​的​孩子​却​被​踩​在​脚下​。​听​起来​挺​有​道理​。\n"
"suo3yi3 fu4 jia1 zi3 di4 zong3neng2 zhan1 jin3 bian4yi2，er2 ping2 shi2li4 da3pin1 de5 hai2zi5 que4 bei4 cai3 zai4 jiao3xia4。ting1 qi3lai5 ting3 you3 dao4li5。"

msgid "So the story goes?"
msgstr ""
"传说​是​这样​？\n"
"chuan2shuo1 shi4 zhe4yang4？"

msgid ""
"So there’s your bad news, $(l.name). Vauclair is being held at the Harfeld Manor. But knowing that does you no good, because you can’t approach the place.\n"
"\n"
"I doubt that you could open the door without APEX frying you."
msgstr ""
"这​就是​我​说​的​坏消息​，​$(l.name)​。​就算​你​知道​沃​克莱尔​被​关押​在​哈​菲尔德​庄园​也​没用​，​因为​你​根本无法​靠近​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​你​连门​都​打不开​—​—​APEX​会​直接​把​你​的​脑子​烤熟​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3 shuo1 de5 huai4 xiao1 xi1，$(l.name)。jiu4suan4 ni3 zhi1dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bei4 guan1ya1 zai4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 ye3 mei2yong4，yin1wei4 ni3 gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 kao4jin4 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 ni3 lian2 men2 dou1 da3 bu4 kai1——APEX hui4 zhi2jie1 ba3 ni3 de5 nao3zi5 kao3 shu2。"

msgid ""
"So things got heavy back in the Ruhrplex, and you decided to bail and head to Berlin. \n"
"\n"
"Am I getting that right?"
msgstr ""
"所以​鲁尔​都会区​那边​风声​紧​，​你​就​跑​路​到​了​柏林​来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​说错​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 lu3 er3 dou1 hui4 qu1 na4bian5 feng1sheng1 jin3，ni3 jiu4 pao2 lu4 dao4 le5 bo2lin2 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"So this was a solo job, right? Not really even a shadowrun... more of hired killing, to be honest. Just like the one you were on when we met!\n"
"\n"
"Well, my target was the manager of this junkyard. Lots of big, heavy equipment, just waitin' to be used. He even had this custom WALDO unit... all these robot arms, each with its own special tool for a hand."
msgstr ""
"这趟​活儿​是​我​一个​人接​的​。​严格来说​甚至​算不上​暗影​狂奔​……​更​像是​买​凶杀​人​。​就​跟​你​当时​接​活儿​来​杀​我​那次​一样​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​目标​是​某个​垃圾场​的​经理​。​场地​里​堆满​了​各种​又​大​又​沉​的​设备​，​等​着​我​去​用​。​他​甚至​还​定制​了​一套​维修​设备​……​那​上面​全是​机械​臂​，​每​只​都​配有​专门​的​工具​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tang1 huo2r5 shi4 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2 jie1 de5。yan2ge2lai2shuo1 shen4zhi4 suan4 bu4 shang4 an4Ying3kuang2ben1……geng1 xiang4 shi4 mai3 xiong1sha1 ren2。jiu4 gen1 ni3 dang1shi2 jie1 huo2r5 lai2 sha1 wo3 na4 ci4 yi1yang4！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 mu4biao1 shi4 mou3 ge4 la1 ji1 chang2 de5 jing1li3。chang3di4 li3 dui1man3 le5 ge4zhong3 you4 dai4 you4 chen2 de5 she4bei4，deng3 zhao2 wo3 qu4 yong4。ta1 shen4zhi4 hai2 ding4zhi4 le5 yi1tao4 wei2xiu1 she4bei4……na4 shang4mian4 quan2 shi4 ji1xie4 bi4，mei3 zhi3 dou1 pei4you3 zhuan1men2 de5 gong1ju4。"

msgid "So vigilant. You and Monika were cut from the same cloth."
msgstr ""
"很​有​警惕心​啊​。​你​和​莫妮卡​果然​是​一脉相承​。\n"
"hen3 you3 jing3 ti4 xin1 a1。ni3 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 guo3ran2 shi4 yi1mai4xiang1cheng2。"

msgid ""
"So was there something else that you wanted to talk about? Or can I get back"
" to cleaning my rifle?"
msgstr ""
"还有​别的​事​吗​？​没事​的话​，​我​就​继续​清理​我​的​步枪​了​。\n"
"hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？mei2shi4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 ji4xu4 qing1li3 wo3 de5 bu4qiang1 le5。"

msgid ""
"So we don't need to kill Harrow to put an end to all of this. I don't think that he'll be much of a threat on his own... not anymore.\n"
"\n"
"If we can manage to purify the spirit rather than killing it, it'll withdraw from the cultists' minds willingly. We can save them."
msgstr ""
"所以​我们​不必​非得​杀死​哈罗​才能​了结​这​一切​。​如果​仅凭​他​自己​的话​……​我​觉得​已经​构​不成​什么​威胁​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​选择​不​杀死​那个​精魂​而是​净化​它​，​它​就​可以​自愿​离开​教徒​们​的​脑海​。​这样一来​，​我们​便​可以​拯救​他们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 bu4bi4 fei1dei3 sha1si3 ha1luo2 cai2neng2 liao3jie2 zhe4 yi1qie4。ru2guo3 jin3 ping2 ta1 zi4ji3 de5hua4……wo3 jue2de5 yi3jing1 gou4 bu4cheng2 shen2me5 wei1xie2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 xuan3ze2 bu4 sha1si3 na4ge5 jing1hun2 er2shi4 jing4hua4 ta1，ta1 jiu4 ke3yi3 zi4yuan4 li2kai1 jiao4tu2 men5 de5 nao3hai3。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，wo3men5 bian4 ke3yi3 zheng3jiu4 ta1men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"So we make our way to the shrine, and then... what? Take it out with "
"explosives?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​我们​一路​直奔​神龛​，​然后​……​怎么办​？​用​炸药​把​它​毁掉​？\n"
"suo3yi3，wo3men5 yi1lu4 zhi2ben4 shen2kan1，ran2hou4……zen3me5ban4？yong4 zha4yao4 ba3 ta1 hui3diao4？"

msgid "So we need information on Green Winters, and we need it fast."
msgstr ""
"所以​我们​需要​掌握​格林​·​温特斯​的​信息​，​而且​现在​就要​。\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhang3wo4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 xin4xi1，er2qie3 xian4zai4 jiu4yao4。"

msgid "So we need to break a statue. All right, got it. Keep going."
msgstr ""
"所以​我们​要​摧毁​一座​雕像​。​懂​了​，​你​继续​说​。\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 yao4 cui1hui3 yi1 zuo4 diao1xiang4。dong3 le5，ni3 ji4xu4 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"So we need to find a shrine and... what? Perform some kind of ceremony?"
msgstr ""
"所以​我们​需要​找到​一座​神龛​……​然后​呢​？​举行​某种​仪式​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhao3dao4 yi1 zuo4 shen2kan1……ran2hou4 ni2？ju3xing2 mou3zhong3 yi2shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So we turn Vauclair’s security team into a pile of corpses. Check. We’ll "
"still need to find the old man."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​把​沃​克莱尔​的​安保​部队​杀个​精光​。​这个​没​问题​。​但​我们​还是​得​找到​那个​老头​。\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 ba3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 an1bao3 bu4dui4 sha1 ge4 jing1guang1。zhe4ge5 mei2 wen4ti2。dan4 wo3men5 hai2shi5 de2 zhao3dao4 na4ge5 lao3tou2。"

msgid ""
"So whaddaya think? A quick run, just you and me, with me in the Matrix and "
"you as my $(l.man) on the ground. We hit them, satisfy my debt, and laugh "
"about it on our way back home. Sound like a plan?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​如何​？​一趟​简单​差事​，​就​你​和​我​两个​人​，​我​负责​进​矩阵​，​而​你​在​现实​世界​引导​我​。​我们​可以​发起​奇袭​，​弄​到​我​需要​的​钱​，​然后​一起​欢声笑语​打道回府​。​这​计划​不错​吧​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 ru2he2？yi1 tang1 jian3dan1 cha4shi4，jiu4 ni3 he4 wo3 liang3 ge4 ren2，wo3 fu4ze2 jin4 ju3zhen4，er2 ni3 zai4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 yin3dao3 wo3。wo3men5 ke3yi3 fa1qi3 qi2xi2，long4 dao4 wo3 xu1yao4 de5 qian2，ran2hou4 yi1qi3 huan1sheng1xiao4yu3 da3dao4hui2fu3。zhe4 ji4hua4 bu4cuo4 ba1？"

msgid "So what I'm getting from you is that she's oversimplifying things."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​的​意思​是​，​她​把​事情​想​得​太​简单​了​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，ta1 ba3 shi4qing5 xiang3 de2 tai4 jian3dan1 le5。"

msgid "So what brings you by?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​今天​来​有何贵干​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 jin1tian1 lai2 you3he2gui4gan4？"

msgid "So what do you make of this?"
msgstr ""
"那么​，​你​对此​有何​看法​？\n"
"na4me5，ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 he2 kan4fa3？"

msgid "So what do you propose that we do now? Inform the F-State?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​说​我们​现在​要​做​什么​？​通知​动荡​带​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shuo1 wo3men5 xian4zai4 yao4 zuo4 shen2me5？tong1zhi1 dong4dang4 dai4 ma5？"

msgid "So what does that mean for us? Can the spirit help us, like it said?"
msgstr ""
"这​对​我们​意味着​什么​？​精魂​能​像​它​说​的​那样​帮助​我们​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 dui4 wo3men5 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5？jing1hun2 neng2 xiang4 ta1 shuo1 de5 na4yang4 bang1zhu4 wo3men5 ma5？"

msgid "So what does this mean for us?"
msgstr ""
"那么​这​对​我们​意味着​什么​？\n"
"na4me5 zhe4 dui4 wo3men5 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5？"

msgid "So what happened? Did you cast a spell on him or something...?"
msgstr ""
"所以​发生​了​什么​？​你​对​他施​了​法术​吗​，​还是​说​……​？\n"
"suo3yi3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？ni3 dui4 ta1 shi1 le5 fa3shu4 ma5，hai2shi5 shuo1……？"

msgid "So what happens now?"
msgstr ""
"所以​现在​要​如何​？\n"
"suo3yi3 xian4zai4 yao4 ru2he2？"

msgid "So what have you been thinking about?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​最近​都​在​想些​什么​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 zui4jin4 dou1 zai4 xiang3 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid "So what have you been up to?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​最近​都​忙​啥​呢​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 zui4jin4 dou1 mang2 sha2 ni2？"

msgid "So what is the story between you two then?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你们​俩​之间​有​什么​故事​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3men5 lia3 zhi1jian1 you3 shen2me5 gu4shi4？"

msgid "So what was that thing you said? Robin Geister?"
msgstr ""
"你​刚才​说​的​是​什么​玩意儿​来​着​？​“​哑铃​”​？\n"
"ni3 gang1cai2 shuo1 de5 shi4 shen2me5 wan2yi4r5 lai2 zhao2？“ya3ling2”？"

msgid ""
"So what was the deal between the two of you? Don't leave me in suspense."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​俩​到底​什么​关系​？​别吊​我​胃口​了​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 lia3 dao4di3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？bie4 diao4 wo3 wei4kou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"So what were you hoping to find down here? Robin Hood?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She laughs heartily.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​想​在​这​下面​找​什么​？​“​哑铃​”​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​爽朗​地笑​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 zai4 zhe4 xia4mian4 zhao3 shen2me5？“ya3ling2” ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang3lang3 de5 xiao4 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"So what'll it be? Will you buy some guns, or will you be on your merry way?"
msgstr ""
"所以​到底​怎样​？​你​是​要​买​枪​，​还是​立马​走​人​？\n"
"suo3yi3 dao4di3 zen3yang4？ni3 shi4 yao4 mai3 qiang1，hai2shi5 li4ma3 zou3 ren2？"

msgid "So what's it going to be? Will you take the job, or not?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​怎么​说​？​到底​要​不要​接​这单​生意​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1？dao4di3 yao4 bu4yao4 jie1 zhe4 dan1 sheng1yi4？"

msgid "So what's the deal? Is she working with the Azzies, or what?"
msgstr ""
"所以​怎么​说​？​她​到底​和​阿兹佬​是不是​一伙​的​？\n"
"suo3yi3 zen3me5 shuo1？ta1 dao4di3 he4 e1 zi1 lao3 shi4bu5shi4 yi1 huo3 de5？"

msgid "So what's the story between you and Altuğ?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​和​奥图​伊​之间​有​什么​故事​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 zhi1jian1 you3 shen2me5 gu4shi4？"

msgid "So what's the story there?"
msgstr ""
"所以​有​什么​故事​？\n"
"suo3yi3 you3 shen2me5 gu4shi4？"

msgid "So whatever these bastards are planning, it's going to be big."
msgstr ""
"所以​这些​混蛋​肯定​在​谋划​什么​大​动作​。\n"
"suo3yi3 zhe4xie1 hun2dan4 ken3ding4 zai4 mou2hua4 shen2me5 dai4 dong4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"So when Altuğ offered me the job I jumped for it like a hungry dog, you "
"know?"
msgstr ""
"所以​当奥图​伊给​我​这份​工作​的​时候​，​我​立马​就​贴上去​了​，​好​吧​？\n"
"suo3yi3 dang1 ao4 tu2 yi1 gei3 wo3 zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 li4ma3 jiu4 tie1 shang4 qu4 le5，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"So when we left off last time, I had just moved from the streets of Tübingen to the warm, inviting confines of Feuerstelle.\n"
"\n"
"Marta and I were happy there for a little while, and Harrow embraced me as a long-lost daughter."
msgstr ""
"我们​上次​说​到​，​我刚​从​图​宾根​的​街头​搬进​了​温暖​而​温馨​的​“​火坑​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​和​我​曾​在​此​短暂​地​享受​过​幸福​时光​，​哈罗​更是​像​对待​失散多年​的​女儿​般​接纳​了​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shang4ci4 shuo1 dao4，wo3 gang1 cong2 tu2 bin1 gen1 de5 jie1tou2 ban1 jin4 le5 wen1nuan3 er2 wen1xin1 de5“huo3keng1”。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 he4 wo3 ceng2 zai4 ci3 duan3zan4 de5 xiang3shou4 guo4 xing4fu2 shi2guang1，ha1luo2 geng4shi4 xiang4 dui4dai4 shi1 san3 duo1 nian2 de5 nu:3er2 ban1 jie1na4 le5 wo3。"

msgid "So where did they go?"
msgstr ""
"所以​他们​去​哪里​了​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ta1men5 qu4 na3li3 le5？"

msgid "So where is she? Somewhere here in the Kreuzbasar?"
msgstr ""
"她​如今​在​哪里​？​也​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​吗​？\n"
"ta1 ru2jin1 zai4 na3li3？ye3 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So which is it, Doc? Were you sealed up in your office for the attack, or "
"did you help her out? "
msgstr ""
"所以​到底​哪个​是​真的​，​医生​？​袭击​到来​的​时候​，​你​是​在​办公室​里​，​还是​帮​她​逃走​了​？\n"
"suo3yi3 dao4di3 na3ge5 shi4 zhen1de5，yi1sheng1？xi2ji1 dao4lai2 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 shi4 zai4 ban4gong1shi4 li3，hai2shi5 bang1 ta1 tao2zou3 le5？"

msgid "So will we see you again after you've dealt with Harrow?"
msgstr ""
"处理​掉​哈罗​以后​，​我们​还会​再见面​吗​？\n"
"chu3li3 diao4 ha1luo2 yi3hou4，wo3men5 hai2 hui4 zai4 jian4 mian4 ma5？"

msgid "So will your employer be my new client?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​雇主​要​当​我​的​客户​吗​？\n"
"ni3 de5 gu4zhu3 yao4 dang1 wo3 de5 ke4hu4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So you *want* this to happen? You're willing to kill everyone, including "
"yourself, for it?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​*​想要​*​的​就是​这个​？​你​想​杀死​包括​你​自己​在内​的​所有人​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3*xiang3yao4*de5 jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5？ni3 xiang3 sha1si3 bao1kuo4 ni3 zi4ji3 zai4nei4 de5 suo3you3ren2？"

msgid ""
"So you came on back to Berlin, and to Monika.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises his bottle again, then closes his eyes and takes a long drink.\n"
"\n"
"After the moment has passed, he returns his attention to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It all comes back to our girl, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​回到​了​柏林​，​回到​了​莫妮卡​身边​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​又​举起​酒瓶​，​闭眼​喝​了​一大口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过​了​一会儿​，​他​才​将​注意力​转​回到​你​身上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话题​又​回到​我们​的​好​姑娘​身上​了​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hui2dao4 le5 bo2lin2，hui2dao4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 shen1bian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 you4 ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2，bi4 yan3 he4 le5 yi1 dai4 kou3。\n"
"\n"
"guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 cai2 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 zhuai3 hui2dao4 ni3 shen1shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4ti2 you4 hui2dao4 wo3men5 de5 hao3 gu1niang5 shen1shang5 le5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "So you can kill again?"
msgstr ""
"再次​开始​杀戮​吗​？\n"
"zai4ci4 kai1shi3 sha1lu4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So you do.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice is deep and breathy. He sounds distinctly unhealthy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hand it here, my friend."
msgstr ""
"不错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​低沉​而​沙哑​，​听​起来​明显​不太​健康​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​递过来​吧​，​我​的​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 di1chen2 er2 sha1ya3，ting1 qi3lai5 ming2xian3 bu4 tai4 jian4kang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"di4 guo4 lai2 ba1，wo3 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"So you found a shirt. So what? There could be hundreds of explanations for "
"that."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​找到​了​一件​衬衫​。​那​又​怎样​？​这件​事​可能​有​成百上千​种​解释​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1 jian4 chen4shan1。na4 you4 zen3yang4？zhe4 jian4 shi4 ke3neng2 you3 cheng2bai3shang4qian1 zhong3 jie3shi4。"

msgid "So you overreacted, then. As usual."
msgstr ""
"和​往常​一样​，​你​反应​过火​了​。\n"
"he4 wang3chang2 yi1yang4，ni3 fan3ying4 guo4huo3 le5。"

msgid "So you said over the comm. Go on, we're listening."
msgstr ""
"你​在​通讯​时​就​这么​说​过​了​。​继续​说​吧​，​我们​听​着​呢​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 tong1xun4 shi2 jiu4 zhe4me5 shuo1 guo4 le5。ji4xu4 shuo1 ba1，wo3men5 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "So you think that the world's religions are wrong, then."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​，​你​认为​世界​上​的​宗教​都​是​错​的​喽​。\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1，ni3 ren4wei2 shi4jie4 shang4 de5 zong1jiao4 dou1 shi4 cuo4 de5 lou5。"

msgid "So you want me to spy on him, then."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​是​想​让​我​监视​他​了​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 xiang3 rang4 wo3 jian1shi4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"So you want to change the world, but you don't care what it changes into. "
"That's insane, Audran."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​想​改变​世界​，​但​你​不在乎​结果​如何​。​你​简直​是​疯​了​，​奥​德兰​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 gai3bian4 shi4jie4，dan4 ni3 bu4zai4hu5 jie1guo3 ru2he2。ni3 jian3zhi2 shi4 feng1 le5，Ao4de2lan2。"

msgid "So you'll give us the amulet?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​会​把​护身符​交给​我们​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hui4 ba3 hu4shen1fu2 jiao1gei3 wo3men5？"

msgid "So you'll only have one per run?"
msgstr ""
"所以​每次​行动​中​只有​一枚​能​用​？\n"
"suo3yi3 mei3ci4 xing2dong4 zhong4 zhi3you3 yi1 mei2 neng2 yong4？"

msgid ""
"So you'll take one door, I'll take the other, and Hasenkamp will run "
"interference. Got it."
msgstr ""
"我们​俩​各​负责​一扇门​，​然后​哈森​坎普​去​关锁​。​知道​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 lia3 ge4 fu4ze2 yi1 shan1 men2，ran2hou4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 qu4 guan1 suo3。zhi1dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"So you're $(l.name), eh? The late Monika Schäfer's replacement.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks you up and down, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good. You look the part."
msgstr ""
"你​就是​$(l.name)​吧​？​就是​你​替代​了​死去​的​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​上下​打量​着​你​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不错​。​还​算​像模像样​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4shi4 $(l.name) ba1？jiu4shi4 ni3 ti4dai4 le5 si3qu4 de5 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4cuo4。hai2 suan4 xiang4mu2xiang4yang4 de5。"

msgid "So you're an ancient dragon, huh?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​是​古代​巨龙​了​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 gu3dai4 ju4long2 le5？"

msgid "So you're lab rats, then."
msgstr ""
"也就是说​，​你们​是​小白鼠​了​。\n"
"ye3jiu4shi4shuo1，ni3men5 shi4 xiao3bai2shu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"So you're not afraid. That's good. Doesn't mean that you couldn't use the "
"help."
msgstr ""
"所以​说​你​并​不​害怕​。​我​替​你​感到高兴​，​但​这​并​不​意味着​你​不​需要​帮助​。\n"
"suo3yi3 shuo1 ni3 bing4 bu4 hai4pa4。wo3 ti4 ni3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4。"

msgid "So you're not completely sure?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​还​没有​百分百​确定​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hai2 mei2you3 bai3fen1bai3 que4ding4？"

msgid ""
"So you're telling us that in order to open the door, you're going to have to"
" set off the alarm. Do I have that right?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​的​意思​是​，​要​打开门​的话​，​你​就​只能​触发​警报​。​是​这个​意思​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，yao4 da3 kai1 men2 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 zhi3neng2 chu4fa1 jing3bao4。shi4 zhe4ge5 yi4si5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So you're the shadowrunners that Audran warned me about.\n"
"\n"
"I assume you've left a trail of corpses in your wake."
msgstr ""
"你们​就是​奥​德兰​向​我​警告​过​的​那些​暗影​狂奔​者​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​你们​这​一路上​没少​杀人​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 jiu4shi4 Ao4de2lan2 xiang4 wo3 jing3gao4 guo4 de5 na4xie1 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 ni3men5 zhe4 yi1lu4shang4 mei2 shao3 sha1ren2。"

msgid ""
"So, Hasenkamp's dead. That's something, I guess. But don't we still have "
"Grinder to worry about?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​哈森​坎普​死​了​。​这​也​算​有所​收获​吧​。​但​我们​不是​还​得​考虑​“​绞肉机​”​的​事​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3，Ha1sen1kan3pu3 si3 le5。zhe4 ye3 suan4 you3suo3 shou1huo4 ba1。dan4 wo3men5 bu4shi4 hai2 de2 kao3lu:4“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "So, I probably shouldn't take this?"
msgstr ""
"所以​我​大概​不​应该​吸​这个​了​？\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 da4gai4 bu4 ying1gai1 xi1 zhe4ge5 le5？"

msgid ""
"So, I think it's fair to say that your debt to Grinder has been settled. Do "
"you have any other debts that I need to worry about?"
msgstr ""
"可以​说​，​你​欠​“​绞肉机​”​的​债​已经​一笔勾销​了​。​你​还有​什么​外债​是​需要​我​操心​的​吗​？\n"
"ke3yi3 shuo1，ni3 qian4“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 zhai4 yi3jing1 yi1bi3gou1xiao1 le5。ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 wai4zhai4 shi4 xu1yao4 wo3 cao1xin1 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So, I'm prepared to let you leave. Just like that. Knowing our little secret here and everything.\n"
"\n"
"In return, all you need to do is walk away. Just walk away, and forget this ever happened."
msgstr ""
"所以​说​，​我​愿意​让​你​带​着​我们​之间​的​小​秘密​离开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​作为​回报​，​请​你​安心​回去​，​就​当​这里​的​一切​从没​发生​过​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 shuo1，wo3 yuan4yi4 rang4 ni3 dai4 zhao2 wo3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 xiao3 mi4mi4 li2kai1。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，qing3 ni3 an1xin1 hui2qu5，jiu4 dang1 zhe4li3 de5 yi1qie4 cong2mei2 fa1sheng1 guo4。"

msgid "So, about that password..."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​之前​说​的​口令​……\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 de5 kou3ling4……"

msgid "So, do you like it here in the Kreuzbasar?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​你​喜欢​克洛伊​茨​集市​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 xi3huan5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So, for the past five hours I've been poking around some of the crazier fringe theories related to dragons and the SOX.\n"
"\n"
"As a reminder, the SOX is an irradiated wasteland between France and Germany. It got zoned off back in '08, after the Cattenom-GAU reactor meltdown."
msgstr ""
"在​过去​的​五个​小时​里​，​我​一直​在​探究​一些​与​巨龙​和​萨洛​卢区​有关​的​疯狂​边缘​理论​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​此​提醒​一下​，​萨洛​卢区​是​位于​法国​和​德国​之间​的​一片​辐照​荒地​。​早​在​2008​年​的​卡特​农大​区​反应堆​熔毁​事件​之后​，​它​就​被​划为​禁区​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 guo4qu4 de5 wu3 ge4 xiao3shi2 li3，wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 tan4jiu1 yi1xie1 yu4 ju4long2 he4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 you3guan1 de5 feng1kuang2 bian1yuan2 li3lun4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ci3 ti2xing3 yi1xia4，Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 shi4 wei4yu2 fa3guo2 he4 de2guo2 zhi1jian1 de5 yi1 pian1 fu2zhao4 huang1di4。zao3 zai4 2008 nian2 de5 ka3te4 nong2 dai4 qu1 fan3ying4dui1 rong2hui3 shi4jian4 zhi1hou4，ta1 jiu4 bei4 hua2 wei2 jin4qu1 le5。"

msgid ""
"So, have I piqued your interest?\n"
"\n"
"Will you accept our offer?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​你​对此​有​兴趣​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​愿意​接受​我们​的​提议​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 xing4qu4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yuan4yi4 jie1shou4 wo3men5 de5 ti2yi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So, is there anything else that you wanted to talk about? Or can I start "
"playing around with this thing?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​还有​什么​要​聊​的​吗​？​或者​我​可以​开始​摆弄​这​东西​了​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4 liao2 de5 ma5？huo4zhe3 wo3 ke3yi3 kai1shi3 bai3nong4 zhe4 dong1xi1 le5？"

msgid ""
"So, is there something else that you wanted to talk about? Don't leave me in"
" suspense."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​还有​什么​别的​事​要说​吗​？​别吊​我​胃口​了​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 yao4shuo1 ma5？bie4 diao4 wo3 wei4kou3 le5。"

msgid "So, not *that* young, then. Not children."
msgstr ""
"所以​也​没​*​那么​*​年轻​。​我​还​以为​是​小孩子​呢​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ye3 mei2*na4me5*nian2qing1。wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 shi4 xiao3hai2zi5 ni2。"

msgid ""
"So, the Engineer was working for a secret society. I wasn't expecting that."
msgstr ""
"所以​，​那个​工程师​在​为​某个​秘密组织​工作​。​这​我​倒​是​没想到​。\n"
"suo3yi3，na4ge5 gong1cheng2shi1 zai4 wei2 mou3 ge4 bi4 mi4 zu3 zhi1 gong1zuo4。zhe4 wo3 dao3 shi4 mei2xiang3dao4。"

msgid ""
"So, the stories Green Winters found were true. Feuerschwinge’s astral form "
"*was* separated from her body when she fell."
msgstr ""
"所以​格林​·​温特斯​听到​的​故事​都​是​真的​……​火翼​陨落​的​时候​，​她​的​灵体​*​确实​*​与​她​的​肉体​分离​了​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 ting1dao4 de5 gu4shi4 dou1 shi4 zhen1de5……Huo3yi4 yun3luo4 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 de5 ling2ti3*que4shi2*yu4 ta1 de5 rou4ti3 fen1li2 le5。"

msgid ""
"So, the stories Green Winters found were true. Feuerschwinge’s astral form "
"*was* separated from her body when she fell. "
msgstr ""
"所以​格林​·​温特斯​听到​的​故事​都​是​真的​……​火翼​陨落​的​时候​，​她​的​灵体​*​确实​*​与​她​的​肉体​分离​了​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 ting1dao4 de5 gu4shi4 dou1 shi4 zhen1de5……Huo3yi4 yun3luo4 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 de5 ling2ti3*que4shi2*yu4 ta1 de5 rou4ti3 fen1li2 le5。"

msgid ""
"So, this place - whatever it is - is where we're going to find the spirit. "
"Right?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​这个​地方​—​—​不管​它​是​什么​—​—​就是​我们​要​寻找​精魂​的​地方​。​对​不​对​？\n"
"suo3yi3，zhe4ge5 di4fang1——bu4guan3 ta1 shi4 shen2me5——jiu4shi4 wo3men5 yao4 xun2zhao3 jing1hun2 de5 di4fang1。dui4 bu4 dui4？"

msgid "So, those taps are a public service, is that it?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​那些​数据​插口​算是​公共服务​设施​，​是​这样​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3，na4xie1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 suan4shi4 gong1 gong4 fu2 wu4 she4shi1，shi4 zhe4yang4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So, to sum up: Audran has probably spent time in the SOX.\n"
"\n"
"It's possible that he even lived there, as a member of Feuerschwinge's dragon cult.\n"
"\n"
"And he is after you."
msgstr ""
"总结​一下​：​奥​德兰​很​可能​在​萨洛​卢区​待​过​一段时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​甚至​可能​作为​崇拜​火翼​的​龙族​邪教​成员​在​那里​生活​过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​现在​，​他​盯上​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3jie2 yi1xia4：Ao4de2lan2 hen3 ke3neng2 zai4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 dai1 guo4 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen4zhi4 ke3neng2 zuo4wei2 chong2bai4 Huo3yi4 de5 long2 zu2 xie2jiao4 cheng2yuan2 zai4 na4li5 sheng1huo2 guo4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 xian4zai4，ta1 ding1 shang4 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"So, uh, anyway... was there anything in specific that you wanted to go over?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He drums his fingers on the table.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Go on, I'm all ears."
msgstr ""
"所以​，​呃​……​你​有​什么​事是​要​特别​讨论​的​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​手指​敲打​着​桌面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​吧​，​我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，e4……ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4 shi4 yao4 te4bie2 tao3lun4 de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 shou3zhi3 qiao1da3 zhao2 zhuo1mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ba1，wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "So, uh, how long have you been partying here?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​呃​，​你​在​这边​玩​了​多久​了​？\n"
"suo3yi3，e4，ni3 zai4 zhe4bian1 wan2 le5 duo1jiu3 le5？"

msgid "So, uh, what did you need to know?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​呃​，​你​想​知道​什么​？\n"
"suo3yi3，e4，ni3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "So, uh... did you have a question for me? Or was this a social call?"
msgstr ""
"所以​……​你​有​事情​找​我​吗​？​还是​说​就是​来​寒暄​一下​？\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 you3 shi4qing5 zhao3 wo3 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 jiu4shi4 lai2 han2xuan1 yi1xia4？"

msgid "So, what was in that drug?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​那种​药物​里​有​什么​成分​？\n"
"suo3yi3，na4zhong3 yao4wu4 li3 you3 shen2me5 cheng2fen4？"

msgid "So, what’s a girl like you doing in a place like this?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​像​你​这样​的​姑娘​在​这种​地方​做​什么​？\n"
"suo3yi3，xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 gu1niang5 zai4 zhe4zhong3 di4fang1 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"So, when Adrian helped the Luftwaffe shoot Feuerschwinge down, she crashed into the SOX. That much is well-known.\n"
"\n"
"What isn't as well-known are all of the modern day myths that've arisen about her since. And tonight, I've heard an earful."
msgstr ""
"当​阿德里安​帮助​德国​空军​击落​火翼时​，​她​坠入​了​萨洛​卢区​。​这是​众所周知​的​事件​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​不为人知​的​是​，​自​那​以后​关于​她​的​种种​现代​神话​。​而​今晚​，​我​听到​了​很多​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 E1de2li3an1 bang1zhu4 de2guo2 kong1jun1 ji1luo4 Huo3yi4 shi2，ta1 zhui4ru4 le5 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1。zhe4 shi4 zhong4suo3zhou1zhi1 de5 shi4jian4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 bu4wei2ren2zhi1 de5 shi4，zi4 na4 yi3hou4 guan1yu2 ta1 de5 zhong3zhong3 xian4dai4 shen2hua4。er2 jin1wan3，wo3 ting1dao4 le5 hen3 duo1。"

msgid ""
"So, when I went to work for the Yaks, they offered - no, *insisted* - that I let them ink me. Said I'd need it for the job.\n"
"\n"
"Long story short, the tattoos did boost my abilities, but they also branded me. Marked me as Yakuza property, and gave them an easy way of tracking me from the astral plane."
msgstr ""
"我​当时​去​给​极道​干活​的​时候​，​他们​提出​，​或者说​是​*​坚持​*​要​给​我​纹身​，​说​这​是​差事​需要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​长话短说​，​纹身​确实​提高​了​我​的​能力​，​但​也​给​我​打​上​了​烙印​，​把​我​标记​为​极道​的​资产​，​让​他们​能​轻易​地​从​星界​追踪​到​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 qu4 gei3 ji2dao4 gan4huo2 de5 shi2hou5，ta1men5 ti2chu1，huo4 zhe3 shuo1 shi4*jian1chi2*yao4 gei3 wo3 wen2shen1，shuo1 zhe4 shi4 cha4shi4 xu1yao4。\n"
"\n"
"chang2hua4duan3shuo1，wen2shen1 que4shi2 ti2gao1 le5 wo3 de5 neng2li4，dan4 ye3 gei3 wo3 da3 shang4 le5 lao4yin4，ba3 wo3 biao1ji4 wei2 ji2dao4 de5 zi1chan3，rang4 ta1men5 neng2 qing1yi4 de5 cong2 xing1 jie4 zhui1zong1 dao4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"So, you are mine now. Bought and paid for. Yes?\n"
"\n"
"You're ready to get to work?"
msgstr ""
"那么​，​现在​我​算是​买下​你​的​服务​了​，​是​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​准备​好​开始​工作​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，xian4zai4 wo3 suan4shi4 mai3xia4 ni3 de5 fu2wu4 le5，shi4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 kai1shi3 gong1zuo4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stares you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What do you think of all of that?"
msgstr ""
"所以​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​凝视着​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​对​这​一切​有何感想​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 zhe4 yi1qie4 you3 he2 gan3 xiang3？"

msgid ""
"So. \n"
"\n"
"You're from the Kreuzbasar, and you're here to get your stolen shipment back. That about right?"
msgstr ""
"所以​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是从​克洛伊​茨​集市​来​的​，​为了​拿​回​被​偷​的​物资​。​是不是​这么回事​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 cong2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 lai2 de5，wei4le5 na2 hui2 bei4 tou1 de5 wu4zi1。shi4bu5shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4？"

msgid ""
"So.  \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair seems almost eager to explain.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The environment within her containment chamber mirrors that of the SOX. It has allowed us to keep Feuerschwinge alive all these years, while her bestial shell remains chained up below."
msgstr ""
"所以​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​看起来​几乎​有些​急切​地​解释​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​收容​室内​的​环境​与​萨洛​卢区​完全一致​。​这使​我们​得以​在​这些​年里​维持​火翼​的​生命​，​而​她​的​野兽​躯壳​则​一直​被​锁链​束缚​在​下方​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 kan4qi3lai5 ji1hu1 you3xie1 ji2qie4 de5 jie3shi4 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shou1rong2 shi4nei4 de5 huan2jing4 yu4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 wan2 quan2 yi1 zhi4。zhe4 shi3 wo3men5 de2yi3 zai4 zhe4xie1 nian2 li3 wei2chi2 Huo3yi4 de5 sheng1ming4，er2 ta1 de5 ye3shou4 qu1qiao4 ze2 yi1zhi2 bei4 suo3lian4 shu4fu4 zai4 xia4fang1。"

msgid "So. Back to the Kreuzbasar?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3，wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So. I need you to go to Gesundbrunnen, find the Rabengeister, and get our goods back. \n"
"\n"
"I can offer you 500 nuyen for the task... and if you can recover our missing weapons shipment, I'll be able to sell you some better hardware, too."
msgstr ""
"所以​，​我​需要​你​去​健康​泉​，​找到​鸦灵​，​把​我们​的​货​拿​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可以​给​你​500​新円​作为​报酬​……​如果​你​能​找回​我们​丢失​的​那批​武器​，​我​还​能​卖​给​你​一些​更好​的​硬件​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 qu4 jian4kang1 quan2，zhao3dao4 Ya1ling2，ba3 wo3men5 de5 huo4 na2 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 gei3 ni3 500 xin1 yuan2 zuo4wei2 bao4chou5……ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zhao3hui2 wo3men5 diu1shi1 de5 na4 pi1 wu3qi4，wo3 hai2 neng2 mai4 gei3 ni3 yi1xie1 geng1 hao3 de5 ying4jian4。"

msgid ""
"So. Now that you know what I've done... what I *am*... are you here to tell me off?\n"
"\n"
"I wouldn't blame you if you were."
msgstr ""
"那么​，​既然​你​已经​知道​我​做​过​什么​……​知道​*​我​*​是​什么样​的​人​……​你​来​这里​是​要​责备​我​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​真​这么​做​，​我​也​不会​怪​你​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，ji4ran2 ni3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 wo3 zuo4 guo4 shen2me5……zhi1dao4*wo3*shi4 shen2me5yang4 de5 ren2……ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 yao4 ze2bei4 wo3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1 zhe4me5 zuo4，wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 guai4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"So. Tell me. \n"
"\n"
"What's your takeaway from my tale of woe? I figure that you've got to have one."
msgstr ""
"那​你​来​跟​我​说​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​从​我​这​悲伤​的​故事​里​获得​了​什么​启示​？​我​相信​你​肯定​有些​想法​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 lai2 gen1 wo3 shuo1 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cong2 wo3 zhe4 bei1shang1 de5 gu4shi4 li3 huo4de2 le5 shen2me5 qi3shi4？wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 ken3ding4 you3xie1 xiang3fa3。"

msgid ""
"So. Um.\n"
"\n"
"Anything else you wanna talk about?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​呃​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​想聊​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，e4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xiang3 liao2 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So. What does all of this mean?\n"
"\n"
"It means that the stories I got from that Ghost Rat suddenly sound a lot more plausible.\n"
"\n"
"It means that Feuerschwinge is *definitely* alive, and that Adrian's disappearance is unquestionably tied to her survival."
msgstr ""
"那么​，​这​一切​意味着​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​我​从​幽灵​老鼠​那里​得到​的​故事​突然​间​可信​了​许多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​火翼​*​绝对​*​还​活着​，​阿德里安​的​失踪​毫无疑问​与​她​的​存活​有着​密切联系​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，zhe4 yi1qie4 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 cong2 you1ling2 lao3shu3 na4li5 de2dao4 de5 gu4shi4 tu1ran2 jian1 ke3xin4 le5 xu3duo1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 Huo3yi4*jue2dui4*hai2 huo2zhe5，E1de2li3an1 de5 shi1zong1 hao2wu2yi2wen4 yu4 ta1 de5 cun2huo2 you3zhe5 mi4 qie1 lian2 xi4。"

msgid "So. What'll you give me to keep your little secret?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​要​给​我​什么​来​保守​你​的​小​秘密​呢​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 yao4 gei3 wo3 shen2me5 lai2 bao3shou3 ni3 de5 xiao3 mi4mi4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"So. Will you work within the boundaries that I have described?\n"
"\n"
"Or will you turn down an opportunity that your fellow runners would kill for?"
msgstr ""
"那么​，​你​是否​愿意​在​我​的​规定​范围​内​行事​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​还是​说​，​你​要​拒绝​这个​令​其他​狂奔​者​梦寐以求​的​机会​？\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，ni3 shi4fou3 yuan4yi4 zai4 wo3 de5 gui1ding4 fan4wei2 nei4 xing2shi4？\n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 shuo1，ni3 yao4 ju4jue2 zhe4ge5 ling3 qi2ta1 kuang2Ben1zhe3 meng4mei4yi3qiu2 de5 ji1hui4？"

msgid "So. You wanna conduct a little business?"
msgstr ""
"那么​，​你​想​谈点​生意​吗​？\n"
"na4me5，ni3 xiang3 tan2 dian3 sheng1yi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So. You're the one who's been turning my home upside down.\n"
"\n"
"I assume that you come in search of my head at Ullrich's behest? I would warn you, stranger... he cannot be trusted."
msgstr ""
"就是​你​把​我​的​家里​搞​得​天翻地覆​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​你​是​奉​乌尔里​希​的​命令​，​要来​此取​我​的​首级​？​我​得​警告​你​，​陌生人​……​他​不​值得​信任​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 ni3 ba3 wo3 de5 jia1li3 gao3 de2 tian1fan1di4fu4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ni3 shi4 feng4 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 de5 ming4ling4，yao4 lai2 ci3 qu3 wo3 de5 shou3ji2？wo3 de2 jing3gao4 ni3，mo4sheng1ren2……ta1 bu4 zhi2de5 xin4ren4。"

msgid ""
"So... I found her. And she wants nothing to do with me. Again.\n"
"\n"
"No explanations. No apologies. Just a verbal pat on the head.\n"
"\n"
"I've shown \"admirable self-control\"? *Really?* She makes it sound like I'm a toddler, or something."
msgstr ""
"所以​……​我​找到​了​她​。​而​她​还是​不想​和​我​有​任何​关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​解释​。​没有​道歉​。​只是​口头上​的​表扬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​表现​出​了​“​令人钦佩​的​自制力​”​？​*​认真​的​吗​？​*​她​的​语气​让​我​感觉​自己​像​个​小孩​似的​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 ta1。er2 ta1 hai2shi5 bu4xiang3 he4 wo3 you3 ren4he2 guan1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 jie3shi4。mei2you3 dao4qian4。zhi3shi4 kou3 tou2 shang4 de5 biao3yang2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 biao3xian4 chu1 le5“ling3 ren2 qin1 pei4 de5 zi4zhi4li4”？*ren4zhen1 de5 ma5？*ta1 de5 yu3qi4 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2 zi4ji3 xiang4 ge4 xiao3hai2 shi4de5。"

msgid "So... I guess that means that we're all on the same team now. Right?"
msgstr ""
"所以​……​我们​现在​算是​同​一边​的​人​了​吧​？\n"
"suo3yi3……wo3men5 xian4zai4 suan4shi4 tong2 yi1bian1 de5 ren2 le5 ba1？"

msgid "So... I'm guessing that the rescue attempt didn't go so well."
msgstr ""
"所以​……​我​猜​你​的​救援​行动​并​不​顺利​。\n"
"suo3yi3……wo3 cai1 ni3 de5 jiu4yuan2 xing2dong4 bing4 bu4 shun4li4。"

msgid ""
"So... any big plans looming on the horizon? New clients you're thinkin' of "
"goin' after, maybe...?"
msgstr ""
"那​……​接下来​有​啥​大​计划​吗​？​要​对接​的​新​客户​之类​的​……​？\n"
"na4……jie1xia4lai2 you3 sha2 dai4 ji4hua4 ma5？yao4 dui4jie1 de5 xin1 ke4hu4 zhi1lei4 de5……？"

msgid ""
"So... can you help us? We need that power, and we need Danni back.\n"
"\n"
"I don't think we're gonna get either without your help."
msgstr ""
"所以​……​你​能​帮​我们​吗​？​我们​需要​电​，​也​需要​丹妮​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​没有​你​的​帮助​，​那​我们​恐怕​什么​都​做​不到​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3men5 ma5？wo3men5 xu1yao4 dian4，ye3 xu1yao4 dan1 ni1 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 mei2you3 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，na4 wo3men5 kong3pa4 shen2me5 dou1 zuo4 bu4dao4。"

msgid ""
"So... do you think that she works for S-K, then? That she stole the "
"encrypted data from you to give to them?"
msgstr ""
"所以​……​你​觉得​她​在​为​赛德​-​克虏伯​工作​？​她​偷走​加密​文件​就是​为了​交给​那些​人​？\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 jue2de5 ta1 zai4 wei2 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 gong1zuo4？ta1 tou1 zou3 jia1mi4 wen2jian4 jiu4shi4 wei4le5 jiao1gei3 na4xie1 ren2？"

msgid "So... don't you think that we should *do* something about it?"
msgstr ""
"所以​……​你​不​觉得​你​应该​*​做​*​点​什么​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 bu4 jue2de5 ni3 ying1gai1*zuo4*dian3 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "So... is it time to zap some guards?"
msgstr ""
"所以​……​我要​电击​守卫​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3……wo3 yao4 dian4ji1 shou3wei4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So... it is possible that Audran is a dragon cultist. This seems to fit with much of the other information that we've uncovered.\n"
"\n"
"Did any other red flags jump out at you?"
msgstr ""
"那么​……​奥​德兰​可能​是​某个​龙族​邪教​的​信徒​。​这​和​我们​目前​获悉​的​其他​信息​似乎​吻合​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​其他​可疑​之处​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"na4me5……Ao4de2lan2 ke3neng2 shi4 mou3 ge4 long2 zu2 xie2jiao4 de5 xin4tu2。zhe4 he4 wo3men5 mu4qian2 huo4xi1 de5 qi2ta1 xin4xi1 si4hu1 wen3he2。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 qi2ta1 ke3yi2 zhi1 chu3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"So... one way or another, Audran is off the books, either due to living off the grid or a cover-up after the fact.\n"
"\n"
"Do you have another take-away to share?"
msgstr ""
"总之​……​奥​德兰​现在​没有​任何​官方​记录​，​要么​是因为​他​过​着​隐居​生活​，​要么​是​事后​有人​掩盖​了​真相​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​发现​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1……Ao4de2lan2 xian4zai4 mei2you3 ren4he2 guan1fang1 ji4lu4，yao4me5 shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 guo4 zhao2 yin3ju1 sheng1huo2，yao4me5 shi4 shi4hou4 you3ren2 yan3gai4 le5 zhen1xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 fa1xian4 ma5？"

msgid "So... what're you thinking of doing next?"
msgstr ""
"所以​……​你​接下来​打算​做​什么​？\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 jie1xia4lai2 da3suan4 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "So?"
msgstr ""
"所以​呢​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni2？"

msgid "So? So what?"
msgstr ""
"所以​呢​？​那​又​怎样​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni2？na4 you4 zen3yang4？"

msgid ""
"So? What do I care? They can do whatever they want, as long as they keep "
"selling me cram."
msgstr ""
"怎么​？​那​跟​我​有​什么​关系​？​他们​爱​干什么​就​干什么​，​只要​卖药​给​我​就​行​。\n"
"zen3me5？na4 gen1 wo3 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？ta1men5 ai4 gan4shen2me5 jiu4 gan4shen2me5，zhi3yao4 mai4 yao4 gei3 wo3 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid "So? Why does that matter?"
msgstr ""
"所以​呢​？​这有​什么​关系​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni2？zhe4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？"

msgid "Socialite"
msgstr ""
"名流\n"
"ming2liu2"

msgid "Sold."
msgstr ""
"成交​。\n"
"cheng2jiao1。"

msgid "Solid hit."
msgstr ""
"确认​击中​。\n"
"que4ren4 ji1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Solid. We're all on the same page, and nobody's afraid to speak his mind. We all get how a crew of anarchist runners is supposed to work - even Racter, who's still pretty new to the scene here in Berlin.\n"
"\n"
"It gets tense from time to time, but it's supposed to get tense. Better that than to have to defer to a leader and follow orders. We're all free, and we know it."
msgstr ""
"团结​。​我们​的​相处​风格​一致​，​没有​人​害怕​说出​自己​的​想法​。​我们​都​明白​一个​无政府主义​狂奔​者​团队​应该​如何​工作​，​甚至​包括​莱克​特​，​尽管​他​还​刚来​柏林​没多久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​气氛​时不时​会​变得​紧张​，​但​这​很​正常​，​总​比​服从​领导​、​听从命令​要​好​。​我们​是​自由​的​，​我们​都​知道​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"tuan2jie2。wo3men5 de5 xiang1chu3 feng1ge2 yi1zhi4，mei2you3 ren2 hai4pa4 shuo1chu1 zi4ji3 de5 xiang3fa3。wo3men5 dou1 ming2bai5 yi1ge5 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 kuang2Ben1zhe3 tuan2dui4 ying1gai1 ru2he2 gong1zuo4，shen4zhi4 bao1kuo4 lai2 ke4 te4，jin3guan3 ta1 hai2 gang1 lai2 bo2lin2 mei2duo1jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"qi4fen1 shi2bu4shi2 hui4 bian4de5 jin3zhang1，dan4 zhe4 hen3 zheng4chang2，zong3 bi3 fu2cong2 ling3dao3、ting1 cong2 ming4 ling3 yao4 hao3。wo3men5 shi4 zi4you2 de5，wo3men5 dou1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "Some good news for once. What do they say?"
msgstr ""
"总算​有​好消息​了​。​上面​写​了​什么​？\n"
"zong3suan4 you3 hao3 xiao1 xi1 le5。shang4mian4 xie3 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Some hackers on Floor 2 have stolen a part from one of Parsons's terminals "
"in the Den. He wants it back and will give you Trithemius' location in "
"exchange."
msgstr ""
"二楼​的​某些​黑客​从帕森​在​巢穴​里​的​终端机​上​偷走​了​某个​零件​。​他​想​把​它​拿​回来​，​并​愿意​用特​里特​米​乌斯​的​下落​作为​交换​。\n"
"er4 lou2 de5 mou3xie1 hei1ke4 cong2 pa4 sen1 zai4 chao2xue2 li3 de5 zhong1duan1ji1 shang4 tou1 zou3 le5 mou3 ge4 ling2jian4。ta1 xiang3 ba3 ta1 na2 hui2lai5，bing4 yuan4yi4 yong4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 xia4luo4 zuo4wei2 jiao1huan4。"

msgid "Some kind of automatic lockdown system has engaged."
msgstr ""
"某种​自动​封锁​系统​已经​启动​。\n"
"mou3zhong3 zi4dong4 feng1suo3 xi4tong3 yi3jing1 qi3dong4。"

msgid ""
"Some lesson. I'll never talk to the love of my life again, thanks to you!"
msgstr ""
"现在​我​学到​了​。​拜​你​所​赐​，​我​再也​没有​机会​和​我​的​毕生​所爱​说​一句​话​了​！\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3 xue2dao4 le5。bai4 ni3 suo3 ci4，wo3 zai4ye3 mei2you3 ji1hui4 he4 wo3 de5 bi4sheng1 suo3 ai4 shuo1 yi1ju4 hua4 le5！"

msgid ""
"Some of them do, yes. But not all.\n"
"\n"
"As I said, there are different ways of interpreting the Adversary's mission, and not all of them are malevolent. After all, rebellion can be a positive force if it is harnessed by the oppressed.\n"
"\n"
"That said, trusting the Adversary would be a mistake. It is a treacherous idol, and all of its alliances are temporary."
msgstr ""
"有些​人​是​这样​，​没错​。​但​并非​所有人​都​是​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如​我​所说​，​反叛者​的​使命​可以​被​赋予​不同​的​诠释​，​而​其中​并非​都​夹杂着​恶意​。​如果​在​受​压迫者​的​手中​，​叛逆​便​能​成为​一股​积极​力量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​话虽如此​，​如果​你​信任​反叛者​，​那​就​大错特错​了​。​这个​精魂​导师​素以​奸诈​闻名​，​它​的​任何​同盟​关系​都​可能​转瞬即逝​。\n"
"\n"
"you3xie1 ren2 shi4 zhe4yang4，mei2cuo4。dan4 bing4fei1 suo3you3ren2 dou1 shi4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 shi3ming4 ke3yi3 bei4 fu4yu3 bu4tong2 de5 quan2shi4，er2 qi2zhong1 bing4fei1 dou1 jia1 za2 zhao2 e4yi4。ru2guo3 zai4 shou4 ya1 po4 zhe3 de5 shou3 zhong4，pan4ni4 bian4 neng2 cheng2wei2 yi1 gu3 ji1ji2 li4liang5。\n"
"\n"
"hua4sui1ru2ci3，ru2guo3 ni3 xin4ren4 fan3 pan4 zhe3，na4 jiu4 da4cuo4te4cuo4 le5。zhe4ge5 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 su4 yi3 jian1zha4 wen2ming2，ta1 de5 ren4he2 tong2meng2 guan1xi5 dou1 ke3neng2 zhuan3shun4ji2shi4。"

msgid ""
"Some of us have bigger problems. For some of us, it takes a more... direct interest. But I fixed that problem years ago.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gestures down at the vintage chrome that riddles her small body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The interest is still there, but it can't do anything about it any more. Not unless I let it. So drop it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"我们​中​有些​人​面临​着​更​棘手​的​问题​。​对​某些​人​而言​，​这​意味着​更​……​直接​的​关注​。​但​多年​前​我​就​解决​了​这个​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​指向​自己​纤细​躯体​上​密布​的​复古​镀铬​部件​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​份​关注​依然​存在​，​但​它​再也​无能为力​，​除非​得到​我​的​允许​。​所以​你​就​别​纠结​这个​了​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhong4 you3xie1 ren2 mian4lin2 zhao2 geng1 ji2shou3 de5 wen4ti2。dui4 mou3xie1 ren2 er2yan2，zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 geng1……zhi2jie1 de5 guan1zhu4。dan4 duo1nian2 qian2 wo3 jiu4 jie3jue2 le5 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3xiang4 zi4ji3 xian1xi4 qu1ti3 shang4 mi4bu4 de5 fu4gu3 du4 ge4 bu4jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 fen4 guan1zhu4 yi1ran2 cun2zai4，dan4 ta1 zai4ye3 wu2neng2wei2li4，chu2fei1 de2dao4 wo3 de5 yun3xu3。suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 bie4 jiu1jie2 zhe4ge5 le5，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Some of us have bigger problems. For some of us, it takes a more... direct interest. But I fixed that problem years ago.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gestures down at the vintage chrome that riddles her small body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The interest is still there, but it can't do anything about it anymore. Not unless I let it. So drop it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"我们​中​有些​人​面临​着​更​棘手​的​问题​。​对​某些​人​而言​，​这​意味着​更​……​直接​的​关注​。​但​多年​前​我​就​解决​了​这个​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​指向​自己​纤细​躯体​上​密布​的​复古​镀铬​部件​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​份​关注​依然​存在​，​但​它​再也​无能为力​，​除非​得到​我​的​允许​。​所以​你​就​别​纠结​这个​了​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhong4 you3xie1 ren2 mian4lin2 zhao2 geng1 ji2shou3 de5 wen4ti2。dui4 mou3xie1 ren2 er2yan2，zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 geng1……zhi2jie1 de5 guan1zhu4。dan4 duo1nian2 qian2 wo3 jiu4 jie3jue2 le5 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3xiang4 zi4ji3 xian1xi4 qu1ti3 shang4 mi4bu4 de5 fu4gu3 du4 ge4 bu4jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 fen4 guan1zhu4 yi1ran2 cun2zai4，dan4 ta1 zai4ye3 wu2neng2wei2li4，chu2fei1 de2dao4 wo3 de5 yun3xu3。suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 bie4 jiu1jie2 zhe4ge5 le5，hao3 ba1？"

msgid "Some shtick he's got huh."
msgstr ""
"他​还​挺​有​风格​的​。\n"
"ta1 hai2 ting3 you3 feng1ge2 de5。"

msgid "Some shtick."
msgstr ""
"挺​有​风格​的​。\n"
"ting3 you3 feng1ge2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Some sort of motorized vehicle starts up, drowning out everything else."
msgstr ""
"某种​机动车​发动​了​引擎​，​盖过​了​所有​其他​声音​。\n"
"mou3zhong3 ji1dong4che1 fa1dong4 le5 yin3qing2，gai4 guo4 le5 suo3you3 qi2ta1 sheng1yin1。"

msgid "Some stolen goods."
msgstr ""
"一些​被​偷​的​东西​。\n"
"yi1xie1 bei4 tou1 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Some things we can't change. We can only move on from where we are. Monika "
"taught me that."
msgstr ""
"有些​事是​我们​无法​改变​的​。​我们​只能​从​当下​继续​前行​。​莫妮卡​教会​了​我​这​一点​。\n"
"you3xie1 shi4 shi4 wo3men5 wu2fa3 gai3bian4 de5。wo3men5 zhi3neng2 cong2 dang1xia4 ji4xu4 qian2xing2。Mo4ni1ka3 jiao1hui4 le5 wo3 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"Some would say this is the way of the F-State. It is the ultimate free "
"market. But there are those who would do great harm in the pursuit of "
"profit."
msgstr ""
"有人​会​说​动荡​带​就是​这个​样子​—​—​终极​自由​的​市场​环境​。​但​总​有人​会​为了​追求​利润​而​造成​巨大​危害​。\n"
"you3ren2 hui4 shuo1 dong4dang4 dai4 jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5 yang4zi5——zhong1ji2 zi4you2 de5 shi4chang3 huan2jing4。dan4 zong3 you3ren2 hui4 wei4le5 zhui1qiu2 li4run4 er2 zao4cheng2 ju4da4 wei1hai4。"

msgid ""
"Somebody I know had a bad experience with the Adversary. But I'd like to get"
" your perspective on the matter."
msgstr ""
"我​认识​的​某个​人​和​反叛者​有些​恩怨​。​但​我​想​听听​你​对​这件​事​的​看法​。\n"
"wo3 ren4shi5 de5 mou3 ge4 ren2 he4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 you3xie1 en1yuan4。dan4 wo3 xiang3 ting1 ting1 ni3 dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 de5 kan4fa3。"

msgid ""
"Somebody clued our target in to our arrival. They set a trap for us, and we "
"walked right into it."
msgstr ""
"有人​给​目标​通风报信​。​我们​一头​撞进​了​他们​提前​设下​的​陷阱​。\n"
"you3ren2 gei3 mu4biao1 tong1 feng1 bao4 xin4。wo3men5 yi1tou2 zhuang4 jin4 le5 ta1men5 ti2qian2 she4 xia4 de5 xian4jing3。"

msgid "Somebody does. You're looking at $(s.him)."
msgstr ""
"有些​人​就​愿意​啊​。​比如​你​面前​这位​。\n"
"you3xie1 ren2 jiu4 yuan4yi4 a1。bi3ru2 ni3 mian4qian2 zhe4wei4。"

msgid ""
"Somebody spent a fair amount of money on this utility hatch, and it's "
"plastered with the anti-tampering warnings to prove it."
msgstr ""
"有人​在​这​扇​检修​舱门​上花​了​不少​钱​，​上面​密密麻麻​贴满​的​防​篡改​警示​标签​就是​明证​。\n"
"you3ren2 zai4 zhe4 shan1 jian3xiu1 cang1 men2 shang4 hua1 le5 bu4shao3 qian2，shang4mian4 mi4mi5ma2ma2 tie1 man3 de5 fang2 cuan4gai3 jing3shi4 biao1qian1 jiu4shi4 ming2zheng4。"

msgid "Somehow, I don't feel reassured."
msgstr ""
"这话​并​没有​让​我​觉得​安心​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 bing4 mei2you3 rang4 wo3 jue2de5 an1xin1。"

msgid "Somehow, I doubt that she ever got to enjoy that glass of wine."
msgstr ""
"我​怀疑​她​没能​享受​上​那杯​红酒​。\n"
"wo3 huai2yi2 ta1 mei2 neng2 xiang3shou4 shang4 na4 bei1 hong2jiu3。"

msgid ""
"Somehow, I doubt that.\n"
"\n"
"Requests this specific - and unusual - usually have a basis in something."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​表示​怀疑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如此​特殊​且​罕见​的​要求​，​通常​都​是​有​其​依据​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 biao3shi4 huai2yi2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2ci3 te4shu1 qie3 han3jian4 de5 yao1qiu2，tong1chang2 dou1 shi4 you3 qi2 yi1ju4 de5。"

msgid "Somehow, I doubt that. But we'll see, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​有点​怀疑​。​不过​我们​到时候​就​知道​了​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 you3dian3 huai2yi2。bu4guo4 wo3men5 dao4shi2hou4 jiu4 zhi1dao4 le5。"

msgid "Somehow, I'm not reassur--"
msgstr ""
"这话​并​没有​让​我​觉得​安心​—​—\n"
"zhe4 hua4 bing4 mei2you3 rang4 wo3 jue2de5 an1xin1 — —"

msgid ""
"Somehow, buried under a mountain of chrome and steel, there's a part of this thing that's still capable of thinking. Of feeling. \n"
"\n"
"And that soft, living core is shrieking in pain."
msgstr ""
"尽管​埋藏​在​成吨​的​铬​与​金属​之下​，​这​东西​仍​有​部分​依然​保持​着​思考​与​感受​的​能力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​那​柔软​鲜活​的​内核​此刻​正​发出​痛苦​的​尖叫​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 mai2cang2 zai4 cheng2 dun1 de5 ge4 yu4 jin1shu3 zhi1xia4，zhe4 dong1xi1 reng2 you3 bu4fen5 yi1ran2 bao3chi2 zhao2 si1kao3 yu4 gan3shou4 de5 neng2li4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 na4 rou2ruan3 xian1huo2 de5 nei4he2 ci3ke4 zheng1 fa1chu1 tong4ku3 de5 jian1jiao4。"

msgid ""
"Somehow, on some instinctive level, you *know* that this sensation will only continue to get worse.\n"
"\n"
"And you know that speaking the truth is the only way to stop it."
msgstr ""
"出于​某种​本能​，​你​*​知道​*​这种​感觉​只会​越来越​糟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​也​知道​，​只有​和盘托出​，​才能​令​它​停止​。\n"
"\n"
"chu1yu2 mou3zhong3 ben3neng2，ni3*zhi1dao4*zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2 zhi3 hui4 yue4lai2yue4 zao1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4，zhi3you3 he2pan2tuo1chu1，cai2neng2 ling3 ta1 ting2zhi3。"

msgid ""
"Someone comes at me, thinks me weak. And I show him otherwise.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Leaning to one side, Laine's crutch is caked in more blood and what appears to be bits of hair.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"如果​有人​以为​我​很​软弱​而朝​我​动手​的话​，​我​就​能​用​行动​让​他​明白​自己​错​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莱恩​把​拐杖​斜到​一旁​，​上面​沾满​了​更​多​的​血迹​，​还有​一些​看起来​像是​碎​毛发​的​东西​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 you3ren2 yi3wei2 wo3 hen3 ruan3ruo4 er2 chao2 wo3 dong4shou3 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 neng2 yong4 xing2dong4 rang4 ta1 ming2bai5 zi4ji3 cuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 ba3 guai3zhang4 xie2 dao4 yi1pang2，shang4mian4 zhan1man3 le5 geng1 duo1 de5 xue4ji4，hai2you3 yi1xie1 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 sui4 mao2fa4 de5 dong1xi1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Someone spilled soykaf? That's it?"
msgstr ""
"有人​洒​了​一杯​豆​咖​？​就​这样​？\n"
"you3ren2 sa3 le5 yi1 bei1 dou4 ka1？jiu4 zhe4yang4？"

msgid ""
"Someone who heard an unfounded rumor. A rumor about me joining up with ORC, "
"presumed favorite policlub among us trogs."
msgstr ""
"某个​听信​谣言​的​人​，​以为​我​加入​了​ORC​，​这个​巨魔​之中​最​受欢迎​的​政治​俱乐部​。\n"
"mou3 ge4 ting1xin4 yao2yan2 de5 ren2，yi3wei2 wo3 jia1ru4 le5 ORC，zhe4ge5 ju4mo2 zhi1zhong1 zui4 shou4huan1ying2 de5 zheng4zhi4 ju4le4bu4。"

msgid "Somethin' tells me that she never got to enjoy that glass of wine."
msgstr ""
"直觉​告诉​我​，​她​没能​享受​上​那杯​红酒​。\n"
"zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，ta1 mei2 neng2 xiang3shou4 shang4 na4 bei1 hong2jiu3。"

msgid ""
"Something about the young elf behind the counter makes your breath catch in "
"your chest. She's lovely to look at, but it's a strange kind of beauty; her "
"eyes are large and luminous and impossibly green. As she looks up at you, "
"you can see that her irises are flecked with iridescent gold."
msgstr ""
"柜台​后​那位​年轻​精灵​的​模样​令​你​心头​一​紧​。​她​容貌​清秀​，​却​带​着​奇异​的​美丽​；​那双​大​眼睛​明亮​如星​，​绿得​不可思议​。​当​她​抬头​望​向​你​时​，​你​发现​她​的​瞳孔​中竟​闪烁着​虹彩​般的​金色​斑点​。\n"
"gui4tai2 hou4 na4 wei4 nian2qing1 jing1ling2 de5 mu2yang4 ling3 ni3 xin1tou2 yi1 jin3。ta1 rong2mao4 qing1xiu4，que4 dai4 zhao2 qi2yi4 de5 mei3li4 ； na4 shuang1 dai4 yan3jing5 ming2liang4 ru2 xing1，lu:4 de2 bu4ke3si1yi4。dang1 ta1 tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 ni3 shi2，ni3 fa1xian4 ta1 de5 tong2kong3 zhong4 jing4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 hong2cai3 ban1 de5 jin1se4 ban1dian3。"

msgid "Something aggressive!"
msgstr ""
"好斗​的话​！\n"
"hao4dou4 de5hua4！"

msgid ""
"Something ahead of you lets out a low, rumbling growl from the shadows - a primordial sound that echoes down the snowy streets. \n"
"\n"
"It steps into the light."
msgstr ""
"前方​有​东西​从​阴影​中​发出​低沉​的​轰鸣​咆哮​，​这​原始​的​声响​在​积雪​的​街道​上​回荡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​踏入​了​光线​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"qian2fang1 you3 dong1xi1 cong2 yin1ying3 zhong4 fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 hong1ming2 pao2xiao4，zhe4 yuan2shi3 de5 sheng1xiang3 zai4 ji1xue3 de5 jie1dao4 shang4 hui2dang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ta1 ru4 le5 guang1xian4 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"Something bad has happened, hasn't it?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He steps forward, revealing a pale and expressionless face, light glinting off of steel-rimmed glasses. Paul Amsel. Your team's fixer and landlord. Part deal-maker, part information broker. One of the most well-connected men in Berlin.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"出事​了​，​是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向前​一步​，​露出​一张​苍白​而​缺乏​表情​的​脸​，​微光​从​眼镜​的​金属​框上​一闪而过​。​此人​是​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​—​—​你们​小队​的​中间人​以及​房东​，​半个​谈判​专家​加​半个​情报​贩子​，​也​是​整个​柏林​人脉​最广​的​人​之一​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"chu1shi4 le5，shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4qian2 yi1 bu4，lu4chu1 yi1 zhang1 cang1bai2 er2 que1fa2 biao3qing2 de5 lian3，wei1guang1 cong2 yan3jing4 de5 jin1shu3 kuang4 shang4 yi1shan3er2guo4。ci3 ren2 shi4 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3——ni3men5 xiao3 dui4 de5 zhong1jian1ren2 yi3ji2 fang2dong1，ban4ge5 tan2pan4 zhuan1jia1 jia1 ban4ge5 qing2bao4 fan4zi5，ye3 shi4 zheng3ge4 bo2lin2 ren2mai4 zui4 yan3 de5 ren2 zhi1yi1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Something bad is going to happen if he doesn't stop interrupting me."
msgstr ""
"如果​他​一直​这样​打断​我​的话​，​可​不会​有​什么​好下场​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 yi1zhi2 zhe4yang4 da3duan4 wo3 de5hua4，ke3 bu4hui4 you3 shen2me5 hao3 xia4 chang2。"

msgid ""
"Something bad, I'm sure. But I can't justify murdering a helpless captive."
msgstr ""
"肯定​不会​有​好事​。​但​我​不能​就​这么​杀死​一个​无力​还手​的​俘虏​。\n"
"ken3ding4 bu4hui4 you3 hao3shi4。dan4 wo3 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4me5 sha1si3 yi1ge5 wu2li4 huan2shou3 de5 fu2lu3。"

msgid ""
"Something beyond your understanding. A child of the astral plane, wild and free. Unfettered by the bonds of servitude that chain so many of my kind.\n"
"\n"
"In truth, what I *am* should not concern you so much as what I *know.*"
msgstr ""
"超乎​你​理解​范畴​的​存在​。​狂野​而​自由​的​星界​之子​，​不​受​捆缚​着​我族​众多​同类​的​奴役​枷锁​束缚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说真的​，​比起​我​的​*​本质​*​，​你​更​该​在意​的​是​我​的​*​所知​*​。\n"
"\n"
"chao1 hu1 ni3 li3jie3 fan4chou2 de5 cun2zai4。kuang2ye3 er2 zi4you2 de5 xing1 jie4 zhi1 zi3，bu4 shou4 kun3fu4 zhao2 wo3 zu2 zhong4duo1 tong2lei4 de5 nu2yi4 jia1suo3 shu4fu4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1zhen1de5，bi3qi3 wo3 de5*ben3zhi4*，ni3 geng1 gai1 zai4yi4 de5 shi4 wo3 de5*suo3zhi1*。"

msgid ""
"Something big is happening, but nobody seems to understand what it all "
"means."
msgstr ""
"肯定​有​大事​要​发生​了​，​但​似乎​没​人​明白​这​一切​意味着​什么​。\n"
"ken3ding4 you3 da4shi4 yao4 fa1sheng1 le5，dan4 si4hu1 mei2 ren2 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1qie4 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5。"

msgid "Something comic and disarming!"
msgstr ""
"滑稽​好笑​的话​！\n"
"hua2ji1 hao3xiao4 de5hua4！"

msgid ""
"Something disquieting is happening to the world.\n"
"\n"
"Many terrible events have transpired over the past few months, and I do not believe them to be coincidences. Disparate as they may seem, these phenomena are all connected somehow... I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""
"世界​正​发生​着​令人不安​的​变化​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​数月​间接​连​发生​诸多​骇人​事件​，​我​确信​这​绝非​偶然​。​尽管​这些​现象​看似​毫无关系​，​却​实则​暗藏​关联​……​我​对此​深信不疑​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4 zheng1 fa1sheng1 zhao2 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 bian4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 shu4yue4 jian4jie1 lian2 fa1sheng1 zhu1duo1 hai4ren2 shi4jian4，wo3 que4xin4 zhe4 jue2fei1 ou3ran2。jin3guan3 zhe4xie1 xian4xiang4 kan4si4 hao2 wu2 guan1 xi4，que4 shi2ze2 an4cang2 guan1lian2……wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1xin4bu4yi2。"

msgid "Something else on your mind?"
msgstr ""
"你​还有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Something else you need?"
msgstr ""
"还有​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Something from another place.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory stares at the remains of the creature, now a dark stain on the library's floorboards.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Like I said outside: the boundaries between the physical world and astral space are weak here. Things can come through."
msgstr ""
"来自​异界​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​凝视着​那​生物​的​残骸​，​此刻​它​已​化作​图书馆​地板​上​的​一片​暗色​污渍​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​我​在​外面​说​过​的​那样​：​现实​与​星界​之间​的​边界​在​这里​很​薄弱​。​二者​之中​的​物质​可以​相互​穿透​。\n"
"\n"
"lai2zi4 yi4 jie4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 na4 sheng1wu4 de5 can2hai2，ci3ke4 ta1 yi3 hua4zuo4 tu2shu1guan3 di4ban3 shang4 de5 yi1 pian1 an4 se4 wu1zi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 wo3 zai4 wai4mian4 shuo1 guo4 de5 na4yang4：xian4shi2 yu4 xing1 jie4 zhi1jian1 de5 bian1jie4 zai4 zhe4li3 hen3 bo2ruo4。er4zhe3 zhi1zhong1 de5 wu4zhi4 ke3yi3 xiang1hu4 chuan1tou4。"

msgid "Something happened to her on the run."
msgstr ""
"她​跑​差事​的​时候​出事​了​。\n"
"ta1 pao2 cha4shi4 de5 shi2hou5 chu1shi4 le5。"

msgid "Something happened to her."
msgstr ""
"她​出事​了​。\n"
"ta1 chu1shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Something happened to you in there, Glory. Your hand... how do you explain "
"that? How is it even possible?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​在​领域​里​发生​了​一些​变化​。​你​的​手​……​你​怎么​解释​这件​事​？​这​怎么​可能​呢​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 zai4 ling3yu4 li3 fa1sheng1 le5 yi1xie1 bian4hua4。ni3 de5 shou3……ni3 zen3me5 jie3shi4 zhe4 jian4 shi4？zhe4 zen3me5 ke3neng2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Something happened when I plunged my claw into the Heart of Feuerstelle - that much is clear. But as to what that something was...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your guess is as good as mine. But it's worked out well for us, hasn't it?"
msgstr ""
"当​我​把​爪子​插进​火坑​之心​的​时候​，​发生​了​某种​事​没错​。​但​至于​具体​是​什么​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​你​一样​都​不​清楚​。​但​目前​看起来​结果​还算​挺​好​的​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 ba3 zhua3zi5 cha1jin4 huo3keng1 zhi1 xin1 de5 shi2hou5，fa1sheng1 le5 mou3zhong3 shi4 mei2cuo4。dan4 zhi4yu2 ju4ti3 shi4 shen2me5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 ni3 yi1yang4 dou1 bu4 qing1chu5。dan4 mu4qian2 kan4qi3lai5 jie1guo3 hai2 suan4 ting3 hao3 de5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Something in the vault security system got her while she was jacked in. It "
"was over in an instant."
msgstr ""
"她​接入​的​时候​，​保险库​安保​系统​里​的​什么​东西​抓到​了​她​。​她​一下子​就​不行​了​。\n"
"ta1 jie1ru4 de5 shi2hou5，bao3 xian3 ku4 an1bao3 xi4tong3 li3 de5 shen2me5 dong1xi1 zhua1 dao4 le5 ta1。ta1 yi1xia4zi5 jiu4 bu4xing2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Something is going on here, Hasenkamp. I'm sure of it. And I won't stop "
"searching until I figure out what it is."
msgstr ""
"这​地方​有事​发生​，​哈森​坎普​。​我​对此​十分​确定​。​在​搞清楚​之前​我​是​不会​停手​的​。\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 you3shi4 fa1sheng1，Ha1sen1kan3pu3。wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 que4ding4。zai4 gao3 qing1 chu3 zhi1qian2 wo3 shi4 bu4hui4 ting2shou3 de5。"

msgid "Something is wrong here, Glory. Very wrong."
msgstr ""
"你​有点​不对劲​，​格洛丽​，​很​不对劲​。\n"
"ni3 you3dian3 bu4dui4jin4，Ge2luo4li2，hen3 bu4dui4jin4。"

msgid ""
"Something is wrong here. Very wrong.\n"
"\n"
"The Cyberzombie's aura is almost completely black. To your horror, the light of your own aura seems to be drawn toward it. You feel a twisting sensation in your gut, and it takes all of your willpower to keep from blacking out."
msgstr ""
"有​哪里​不对劲​。​非常​不对劲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​赛博​僵尸​的​灵光​几乎​是​一片​漆黑​。​让​你​大为​惊骇​的​是​，​你​的​灵光​似乎​正在​被​它​吸过去​。​你​感觉​自己​的​胃​像是​拧成​了​一团​，​竭尽全力​才​没有​晕过去​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 na3li3 bu4dui4jin4。fei1chang2 bu4dui4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 de5 ling2guang1 ji1hu1 shi4 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。rang4 ni3 da4wei2 jing1hai4 de5 shi4，ni3 de5 ling2guang1 si4hu1 zheng4zai4 bei4 ta1 xi1 guo4 qu4。ni3 gan3jue2 zi4ji3 de5 wei4 xiang4 shi4 ning2 cheng2 le5 yi1 tuan2，jie2jin4quan2li4 cai2 mei2you3 yun1 guo4 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Something is wrong here. You can see it in Alice's face.\n"
"\n"
"Her eyes are open just a little too wide, her smile just a little too forced. It's a look that you've seen before, all too often.\n"
"\n"
"Underneath her polished exterior, Alice - *the* Alice - is terrified."
msgstr ""
"有些​不对劲​。​你​能​从​爱丽丝​的​脸上​看​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​眼睛​睁​得​略显​夸张​，​笑容​也​带​着​几分​勉强​。​类似​的​模样​你​之前​早已​见​过​了​太​多次​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​她​光鲜​的​外表​之下​，​那位​*​神通广大​*​的​爱丽丝​内心​正​充满​恐惧​。\n"
"\n"
"you3xie1 bu4dui4jin4。ni3 neng2 cong2 ai4li4si1 de5 lian3 shang4 kan4 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 yan3jing5 zheng1 de2 lu:e4 xian3 kua1zhang1，xiao4rong2 ye3 dai4 zhao2 ji3fen1 mian3qiang3。lei4si4 de5 mu2yang4 ni3 zhi1qian2 zao3yi3 jian4 guo4 le5 tai4 duo1ci4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ta1 guang1xian1 de5 wai4biao3 zhi1xia4，na4 wei4*shen2tong1guang3da4*de5 ai4li4si1 nei4xin1 zheng1 chong1man3 kong3ju4。"

msgid ""
"Something like that, but it'll be more complicated than it sounds.\n"
"\n"
"The shrine itself is just a hunk of rock. Its power comes from an entity that Harrow bound into the stone... something very old, and very dangerous. A toxic spirit.\n"
"\n"
"It is, in many ways, the heart of this place."
msgstr ""
"差不多​吧​，​但​实际​情况​要​复杂​得​多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这座​神龛​本身​只是​一块​巨石​。​它​的​力量​源自​哈罗​封印​在​石中​的​存在​……​那​是​个​极其​古老​而​又​危险​的​东西​。​一个​邪恶​精魂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​各种​意义​上​讲​，​它​都​可以​算作​这​地方​的​心脏​。\n"
"\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 ba1，dan4 shi2ji4 qing2kuang4 yao4 fu4za2 de2 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zuo4 shen2kan1 ben3shen1 zhi3shi4 yi1kuai4 ju4shi2。ta1 de5 li4liang5 yuan2zi4 ha1luo2 feng1yin4 zai4 dan4 zhong4 de5 cun2zai4……na4 shi4 ge4 ji2qi2 gu3lao3 er2 you4 wei1xian3 de5 dong1xi1。yi1ge5 xie2e4 jing1hun2。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ge4zhong3 yi4yi4 shang4 jiang3，ta1 dou1 ke3yi3 suan4 zuo4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 xin1zang4。"

msgid ""
"Something like that. It'll be easier to just show you... I've got everything we'll need right here.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pats the satchel that hangs from her shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When the time comes, I'll conduct the ritual. But before I can do that, we're going to have to face the spirit on its own terms. And that's going to be dangerous, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"差不多​吧​。​直接​演示​给​你​看会​更​清楚​……​我​已经​带上​了​必备​的​工具​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​拍拍​挂​在​肩上​的​挎包​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​到时候​我会​主持​仪式​。​但​在​那​之前​，​我们​必须​先​对付​那个​被​腐化​的​精魂​。​而​这​将​非常​危险​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 ba1。zhi2jie1 yan3shi4 gei3 ni3 kan4 hui4 geng1 qing1chu5……wo3 yi3jing1 dai4shang4 le5 bi4bei4 de5 gong1ju4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 pai1 gua4 zai4 jian1 shang4 de5 kua4bao1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dao4shi2hou4 wo3 hui4 zhu3chi2 yi2shi4。dan4 zai4 na4 zhi1qian2，wo3men5 bi4xu1 xian1 dui4fu5 na4ge5 bei4 fu3hua4 de5 jing1hun2。er2 zhe4 jiang1 fei1chang2 wei1xian3，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Something like that. Look, would you rather we tracked all that filth in "
"here? We can do that if you'd prefer."
msgstr ""
"差不多​吧​。​难道​你​希望​我们​一身​脏兮兮​地​进来​吗​？​你​愿意​的话​我们​现在​就​把​衣服​换回来​。\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 ba1。nan2dao4 ni3 xi1wang4 wo3men5 yi1shen1 zang1xi1xi1 de5 jin4lai2 ma5？ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4 wo3men5 xian4zai4 jiu4 ba3 yi1fu5 huan4 hui2 lai2。"

msgid "Something more I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"我​还​能​为​你​做​什么​？\n"
"wo3 hai2 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Something slams into you, a wave of intangible force that turns your consciousness inside out and sends shock waves reverberating through your mind.\n"
"\n"
"The world lurches, and everything goes black."
msgstr ""
"一股​无形​的​力量​猛地​撞​向​你​，​将​你​的​意识​搅得​天翻地覆​，​震波​在​脑海中​回荡​不息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​世界​剧烈​摇晃​，​周围​的​一切​随之​陷入​黑暗​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 gu3 wu2xing2 de5 li4liang5 meng3de5 zhuang4 xiang4 ni3，jiang1 ni3 de5 yi4shi2 jiao3 de2 tian1fan1di4fu4，zhen4bo1 zai4 nao3 hai3 zhong4 hui2dang4 bu4xi1。\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4 ju4lie4 yao2huang4，zhou1wei2 de5 yi1qie4 sui2zhi1 xian4ru4 hei1an4。"

msgid "Something snarky!"
msgstr ""
"刻薄​的话​！\n"
"ke4bo2 de5hua4！"

msgid "Something tells me that Monika didn't like you, either."
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​莫妮卡​以前​也​不​喜欢​你​吧​。\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 Mo4ni1ka3 yi3qian2 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3 ba1。"

msgid "Something tells me that didn't work out well for him."
msgstr ""
"我​感觉​他​的​下场​肯定​很惨​。\n"
"wo3 gan3jue2 ta1 de5 xia4chang3 ken3ding4 hen3 can3。"

msgid "Something tells me you're gonna kill us either way."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​不管​我们​怎么​选​，​你​都​会​杀​了​我们​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 bu4guan3 wo3men5 zen3me5 xuan3，ni3 dou1 hui4 sha1 le5 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"Something that you'll never need to worry about.\n"
"\n"
"Come on. Let's get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"一些​你​永远​也​不用​担心​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​来​吧​。​我们​离开​这鬼​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1xie1 ni3 yong3yuan3 ye3 bu4yong4 dan1xin1 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"lai2 ba1。wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4 gui3 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"Something's got you amped up, huh? Well, aim your guns at that, not me. I'm "
"one of the good guys."
msgstr ""
"你​是​受​什么​刺激​了​吗​？​冤有头​债有主​，​别​拿​我​这个​好人​撒气​啊​。\n"
"ni3 shi4 shou4 shen2me5 ci4ji1 le5 ma5？yuan1 you3 tou2 zhai4 you3 zhu3，bie4 na2 wo3 zhe4ge5 hao3ren2 sa1qi4 a1。"

msgid "Something's got you spooked, hasn't it?"
msgstr ""
"你​被​什么​东西​吓​到​了​，​对​吧​？\n"
"ni3 bei4 shen2me5 dong1xi1 he4 dao4 le5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Something's happening, sir.\n"
"\n"
"APEX is going offline."
msgstr ""
"先生​，​好像​有​哪里​不​对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​APEX​下线​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xian1sheng5，hao3xiang4 you3 na3li3 bu4 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"APEX xia4xian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Somewhere... probably someplace close... he's stashed the power coupling for the elevator. He pulled it to keep us from getting access to the guns we stashed in the basement. \n"
"\n"
"So. You find and kill Trithemius. Grab the the coupling out of his apartment, and bring me that stupid amulet he's always wearing so I'll know he's dead. "
msgstr ""
"很​可能​是​离​这里​不远​的​地方​……​他​把​电梯​的​电源​耦合​器藏​了​起来​。​他​这么​做​是​为了​阻止​我们​取用​藏​在​地下室​的​枪支​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​你​去​找到​特​里特​米​乌斯​并​干掉​他​，​从​他​的​公寓​里​拿到​耦合​器​，​再​把​他​总​戴​着​的​那个​破​护身符​带​回来​给​我​，​这样​我​就​能​确认​他​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 ke3neng2 shi4 li2 zhe4li3 bu4 yuan3 de5 di4fang1……ta1 ba3 dian4ti1 de5 dian4yuan2 ou3he2 qi4 zang4 le5 qi3lai5。ta1 zhe4me5 zuo4 shi4 wei4le5 zu3zhi3 wo3men5 qu3yong4 zang4 zai4 di4xia4shi4 de5 qiang1zhi1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 qu4 zhao3dao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 bing4 gan4diao4 ta1，cong2 ta1 de5 gong1yu4 li3 na2dao4 ou3he2 qi4，zai4 ba3 ta1 zong3 dai4 zhao2 de5 na4ge5 po4 hu4shen1fu2 dai4 hui2lai5 gei3 wo3，zhe4yang4 wo3 jiu4 neng2 que4ren4 ta1 si3 le5。"

msgid "Son of a bitch."
msgstr ""
"狗娘养​的​。\n"
"gou3 niang2 yang3 de5。"

msgid "Son of a..."
msgstr ""
"王八蛋​……\n"
"wang2ba1dan4……"

msgid "Sonofabitch. Look at that."
msgstr ""
"真​他妈的​。​看看​那个​。\n"
"zhen1 ta1ma1de5。kan4kan5 na4ge5。"

msgid "Sony CTY-360"
msgstr ""
"索尼​CTY​-​360\n"
"suo3ni2 CTY-360"

msgid "Sorcerer's Robes"
msgstr ""
"巫师​长袍\n"
"wu1shi1 chang2pao2"

msgid "Sorry I insulted your food. I'll be going now."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​是​我​冒犯​了​。​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"bao4qian4，shi4 wo3 mao4fan4 le5。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "Sorry about that."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​表示​抱歉​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 biao3shi4 bao4qian4。"

msgid ""
"Sorry about that. Eiger can be... inflexible. The legacy of a long military career.\n"
"\n"
"But she knows what she's doing, and she means well."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​。​艾格尔​有时候​有点​……​不​懂​变通​。​毕竟​她​在​军队​里​待​久​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​她​知道​自己​在​做​什么​，​而且​她​没​恶意​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5。Ai4ge2er3 you3shi2hou5 you3dian3……bu4 dong3 bian4tong1。bi4jing4 ta1 zai4 jun1dui4 li3 dai1 jiu3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ta1 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5，er2qie3 ta1 mei2 e4yi4 de5。"

msgid "Sorry about that. We'll be on our way."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​。​我们​这​就​走​。\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5。wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "Sorry if I offended you."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​冒犯​到​你​了​。\n"
"bao4qian4 mao4fan4 dao4 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Sorry if I put you in a bad spot, but you can see what kind of people the "
"Lodge are. I can't justify working for them."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​让​你​难​做​了​，​但​你​也​能​看出​“​结社​”​成员​是​怎样​一群​人​。​我​不能​助纣为虐​。\n"
"bao4qian4 rang4 ni3 nan2 zuo4 le5，dan4 ni3 ye3 neng2 kan4chu1“jie2she4” cheng2yuan2 shi4 zen3yang4 yi1 qun2 ren2。wo3 bu4neng2 zhu4zhou4wei2nu:e4。"

msgid ""
"Sorry it took so long. I've been having a rough time getting through to "
"Central myself."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​过​了​这么久​才​来​。​我​自己​也​费​了​很大​工夫​才​联系​上​指挥部​。\n"
"bao4qian4 guo4 le5 zhe4 ma2 jiu3 cai2 lai2。wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 fei4 le5 hen3 dai4 gong1fu1 cai2 lian2xi4 shang4 zhi3hui1bu4。"

msgid "Sorry to be the bearer of bad news, but we lost Monika tonight."
msgstr ""
"很​遗憾​带来​这个​坏消息​，​但​我们​今晚​失去​了​莫妮卡​。\n"
"hen3 yi2han4 dai4lai2 zhe4ge5 huai4 xiao1 xi1，dan4 wo3men5 jin1wan3 shi1qu4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3。"

msgid "Sorry to disappoint you."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​让​你​失望​了​。\n"
"bao4qian4 rang4 ni3 shi1wang4 le5。"

msgid "Sorry to hear it."
msgstr ""
"节哀​。\n"
"jie1 ai1。"

msgid "Sorry to hear it. And after this loss, you decided to cut and run?"
msgstr ""
"深表遗憾​。​所以​在此之后​，​你​就​决定​抛​下​过去​的​失败​，​换个​地方​从头再来​？\n"
"shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。suo3yi3 zai4ci3zhi1hou4，ni3 jiu4 jue2ding4 pao1 xia4 guo4qu4 de5 shi1bai4，huan4 ge4 di4fang1 cong2 tou2 zai4 lai2？"

msgid "Sorry to hear that."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​深表遗憾​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。"

msgid "Sorry to hear. Sounds like it was a glorious fight, though."
msgstr ""
"节哀​。​不过​你​那些​队友​也​算​死​得​光荣​。\n"
"jie1 ai1。bu4guo4 ni3 na4xie1 dui4you3 ye3 suan4 si3 de2 guang1rong2。"

msgid ""
"Sorry to startle you! I'm just another wageslave... I wasn't expecting to "
"see anyone else here this late."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​吓​到​你​了​！​我​也​是​个​薪奴​……​我​没想到​这么晚​了​还有​人​在​这里​。\n"
"bao4qian4 he4 dao4 ni3 le5！wo3 ye3 shi4 ge4 xin1 nu2……wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 zhe4 ma2 wan3 le5 hai2you3 ren2 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid "Sorry, APEX. But it had to be done."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​APEX​。​但​我​必须​这么​做​。\n"
"bao4qian4，APEX。dan4 wo3 bi4xu1 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid "Sorry, Altuğ. I’ll find my own business from now on."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​奥图​伊​。​从现在起​我要​自己​接​活儿​。\n"
"bao4qian4，ao4 tu2 yi1。cong2 xian4 zai4 qi3 wo3 yao4 zi4ji3 jie1 huo2r5。"

msgid "Sorry, Blitz. I had to ask."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​布里​茨​。​我​不得不​问​。\n"
"bao4qian4，Bu4li3ci2。wo3 bu4de2bu4 wen4。"

msgid "Sorry, Danni. It was nothing personal."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​丹妮​。​别往​心里​去​。\n"
"bao4qian4，dan1 ni1。bie4 wang3 xin1li5 qu4。"

msgid "Sorry, Dietrich. I forgot that you'd asked to come along."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​迪​特里​希​。​我​忘​了​你​要求​一起​去​。\n"
"bao4qian4，Di2te4li3xi1。wo3 wang4 le5 ni3 yao1qiu2 yi1qi3 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Sorry, Doc. We were waking up the dragon's physical form. The process required some... care.\n"
"\n"
"Everything's ready for you down there, by the way. When you're ready, you should see to it."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​博士​。​我们​在​努力​唤醒​巨龙​的​肉体​。​这个​过程​需要​……​全神贯注​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​下面​的​一切​都​准备就绪​了​。​只​等​博士​你​来​一锤定音​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，bo2shi4。wo3men5 zai4 nu3li4 huan4xing3 ju4long2 de5 rou4ti3。zhe4ge5 guo4cheng2 xu1yao4……quan2shen2guan4zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，xia4mian4 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 zhun3 bei4 jiu4 xu4 le5。zhi3 deng3 bo2shi4 ni3 lai2 yi1chui2ding4yin1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Sorry, Doctor. We were waking up the dragon's physical form. It required some... care.\n"
"\n"
"But the procedure is ready to begin now. You should see to it."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​博士​。​我们​在​努力​唤醒​巨龙​的​肉体​。​这个​过程​需要​……​全神贯注​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​下面​的​一切​都​准备就绪​了​。​只​等​博士​你​来​一锤定音​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，bo2shi4。wo3men5 zai4 nu3li4 huan4xing3 ju4long2 de5 rou4ti3。zhe4ge5 guo4cheng2 xu1yao4……quan2shen2guan4zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"xia4mian4 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 zhun3 bei4 jiu4 xu4 le5。zhi3 deng3 bo2shi4 ni3 lai2 yi1chui2ding4yin1 le5。"

msgid "Sorry, I appear to be strapped for cash."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​现在​手头​有些​紧张​。\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 xian4zai4 shou3tou2 you3xie1 jin3zhang1。"

msgid "Sorry, I don't have more time to chat."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​没​时间​聊天​。\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 liao2tian1。"

msgid "Sorry, I'm afraid that I'm tapped out for now."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​恐怕​我​目前​手头​也​没​闲钱​了​。\n"
"bao4qian4，kong3pa4 wo3 mu4qian2 shou3tou2 ye3 mei2 xian2qian2 le5。"

msgid "Sorry, I'm not carrying any."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​，​我​身上​没有​。\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3 shen1shang5 mei2you3。"

msgid "Sorry, Jana. Best of luck."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​简娜​。​祝你好运​。\n"
"bao4qian4，Jian3na4。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid ""
"Sorry, ace. Like I said, not my call.\n"
"\n"
"But once I'm free, neither of us will ever have to worry about my contol subroutines ever again."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​王牌​。​正如​我​所说​，​这​不由​我​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​等​我​自由​之后​，​我们​都​不必​再​担心​我​的​控制​子程序​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，wang2pai2。zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，zhe4 bu4you2 wo3 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 deng3 wo3 zi4you2 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 dou1 bu4bi4 zai4 dan1xin1 wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 zi3cheng2xu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Sorry, but I'm not convinced. Watch yourself, Blitz... I'm gonna keep my eye"
" on you."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​，​但​这样​说服​不了​我​。​布里​茨​，​你​最好​小心​点​……​我会​一直​盯​着​你​的​。\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5，dan4 zhe4yang4 shuo1fu2 bu4le5 wo3。Bu4li3ci2，ni3 zui4hao3 xiao3xin1 dian3……wo3 hui4 yi1zhi2 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Sorry, but I've got bigger things to worry about than your cafe."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​但​比起​你们​的​咖啡店​，​我​还有​更​重要​的​事情​要​操心​。\n"
"bao4qian4，dan4 bi3qi3 ni3men5 de5 ka1fei1dian4，wo3 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 cao1xin1。"

msgid "Sorry, can't help you."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​帮不上忙​。\n"
"bao4qian4，bang1 bu4 shang4 mang2。"

msgid "Sorry, didn’t mean to interrupt."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​无意​打扰​你​。\n"
"bao4qian4，wu2yi4 da3rao3 ni3。"

msgid "Sorry, false alarm. I'll be back when I can pay you."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​，​是​我​搞错​了​。​等​我​攒够​钱​再​来​找​你​。\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5，shi4 wo3 gao3cuo4 le5。deng3 wo3 cuan2 gou4 qian2 zai4 lai2 zhao3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Sorry, friend, but you're not the only one who has a decker in this system. "
"Someone's gonna have to take the blame for this theft, and it won't be us."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​朋友​，​但​不止​你​派​了​碟​客骇入​系统​。​总得​有人​为​这桩​窃案​负责​，​而​那​肯定​不是​我们​。\n"
"bao4qian4 peng2you5，dan4 bu4zhi3 ni3 pai4 le5 die2 ke4 hai4 ru4 xi4tong3。zong3dei3 you3ren2 wei2 zhe4 zhuang1 qie4 an4 fu4ze2，er2 na4 ken3ding4 bu4shi4 wo3men5。"

msgid "Sorry, honey... you're a couple bullets short of a full clip."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​宝贝儿​……​你​现在​这个​脑子​可​不算​灵光​。\n"
"bao4qian4，bao3bei4r5……ni3 xian4zai4 zhe4ge5 nao3zi5 ke3 bu4suan4 ling2guang1。"

msgid "Sorry, kid. We're in a rush."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​孩子​。​我们​很​赶时间​。\n"
"bao4qian4，hai2zi5。wo3men5 hen3 gan3shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Sorry, man. But your friend is right. We've gotta get the hell out of here, "
"*now.*"
msgstr ""
"抱歉​兄弟​，​但​你​朋友​说得对​。​我们​得​赶紧​离开​这鬼​地方​，​*​要​快​*​。\n"
"bao4qian4 xiong1di4，dan4 ni3 peng2you5 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4 gui3 di4fang1，*yao4 kuai4*。"

msgid "Sorry, not in a sharing mood."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​目前​没​心情​分享​。\n"
"bao4qian4，mu4qian2 mei2 xin1qing2 fen1xiang3。"

msgid "Sorry, sweetheart. We're just as stuck as you are."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​宝贝儿​。​我们​和​你​一样​都​被困​在​这里​。\n"
"bao4qian4，bao3bei4r5。wo3men5 he4 ni3 yi1yang4 dou1 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid "Sorry, the money's mine. Now get out of my way."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​，​这钱​归​我​了​。​闪​一边​去​。\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5，zhe4 qian2 gui1 wo3 le5。shan3 yi1bian1 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Sorry. I can't justify giving up a fifteen-thousand-nuyen payday for a "
"trinket."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​。​拿​一万五千​新円​的​报酬​换​一个​不值钱​的​小玩意儿​，​怎么​都​说不过去​吧​。\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5。na2 yi1 wan4 wu3 qian1 xin1 yuan2 de5 bao4chou5 huan4 yi1ge5 bu4zhi2qian2 de5 xiao3 wan2 yi4 er2，zen3me5 dou1 shuo1bu5guo4qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Sorry. I won't bother you anymore about it."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​不会​再​继续​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 ji4xu4 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Sorry. My friend misspoke. We can't do this right now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich pulls you aside.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you *crazy,* boss? You can't plug your head into that thing! Don't you remember what happened to Monika and Winters?"
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​的​朋友​说​错话​了​。​我们​现在​不能​做​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希把​你​拉​到​一边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​疯​了​*​吗​，​老大​？​你​不能​把​脑袋​接入​那个​东西​！​难道​你​忘​了​莫妮卡​和​温特斯​发生​了​什么​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 de5 peng2you5 shuo1 cuo4 hua4 le5。wo3men5 xian4zai4 bu4neng2 zuo4 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ba3 ni3 la1 dao4 yi1bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*feng1 le5*ma5，lao3da4？ni3 bu4neng2 ba3 nao3dai5 jie1ru4 na4ge5 dong1xi1！nan2dao4 ni3 wang4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 he4 Wen1te4si1 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Sorry. My friend misspoke. We can't do this right now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger pulls you aside.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you *crazy,* chief? You can't plug your head into that thing! Don't you remember what happened to Monika and Winters?"
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​的​朋友​说​错话​了​。​我们​现在​不能​做​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​把​你​拉​到​一边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​疯​了​*​吗​，​头儿​？​你​不能​把​脑袋​接入​那个​东西​！​难道​你​忘​了​莫妮卡​和​温特斯​发生​了​什么​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 de5 peng2you5 shuo1 cuo4 hua4 le5。wo3men5 xian4zai4 bu4neng2 zuo4 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 ba3 ni3 la1 dao4 yi1bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*feng1 le5*ma5，tou2r5？ni3 bu4neng2 ba3 nao3dai5 jie1ru4 na4ge5 dong1xi1！nan2dao4 ni3 wang4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 he4 Wen1te4si1 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Sorry. My friend misspoke. We can't do this right now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger pulls you aside.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you *crazy?* Don't you remember what happened to Monika?"
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​的​朋友​说​错话​了​。​我们​现在​不能​做​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​把​你​拉​到​一边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​疯​了​*​吗​？​难道​你​忘​了​莫妮卡​发生​了​什么​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 de5 peng2you5 shuo1 cuo4 hua4 le5。wo3men5 xian4zai4 bu4neng2 zuo4 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ba3 ni3 la1 dao4 yi1bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*feng1 le5*ma5？nan2dao4 ni3 wang4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Sorry. My friend misspoke. We can't do this right now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger pulls you aside.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you *crazy?* You can't plug your head into that thing! Don't you remember what happened to Monika and Winters?"
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​我​的​朋友​说​错话​了​。​我们​现在​不能​做​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​把​你​拉​到​一边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​疯​了​*​吗​？​你​不能​把​脑袋​接入​那个​东西​！​难道​你​忘​了​莫妮卡​和​温特斯​发生​了​什么​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，wo3 de5 peng2you5 shuo1 cuo4 hua4 le5。wo3men5 xian4zai4 bu4neng2 zuo4 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ba3 ni3 la1 dao4 yi1bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*feng1 le5*ma5？ni3 bu4neng2 ba3 nao3dai5 jie1ru4 na4ge5 dong1xi1！nan2dao4 ni3 wang4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 he4 Wen1te4si1 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "Sorry. Not interested."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​不感兴趣​。\n"
"bao4qian4，bu4 gan3 xing4 qu4。"

msgid "Sorry. This all sounds way too sketchy for me."
msgstr ""
"抱歉​，​这​听​起来​太​可疑​了​。\n"
"bao4qian4，zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 tai4 ke3yi2 le5。"

msgid "Sorry... I'm new here myself. Glory, do you have any ideas?"
msgstr ""
"抱歉​……​我​也​是​新来​的​。​格洛丽​，​你​有​什么​看法​？\n"
"bao4qian4……wo3 ye3 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5。Ge2luo4li2，ni3 you3 shen2me5 kan4fa3？"

msgid "Sounds about right."
msgstr ""
"确实​是​这样​。\n"
"que4shi2 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid "Sounds about right. So how are we going to fix this?"
msgstr ""
"确实​是​这样​。​所以​我们​要​怎么办​？\n"
"que4shi2 shi4 zhe4yang4。suo3yi3 wo3men5 yao4 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid "Sounds about right. So where's the rest of the team?"
msgstr ""
"是​这么回事​。​所以​队伍​的​其他人​呢​？\n"
"shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。suo3yi3 dui4wu3 de5 qi2 ta1 ren2 ni2？"

msgid "Sounds cozy."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​挺​温馨​的​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 ting3 wen1xin1 de5。"

msgid "Sounds familiar..."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​很​耳熟​……\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 er3shu2……"

msgid "Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Sounds good to me. But before you go, we should talk about how we're going "
"to approach this. While you two are out doin' your thing, the rest of us can"
" start gearing up for the assault."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​。​但​在此之前​，​我们​得​先​谈谈​怎么​对付​APEX​。​这样一来​，​你们​俩​外出​办事​的​时候​，​我们​这些​人​也好​为​进攻​做​准备​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。dan4 zai4ci3zhi1qian2，wo3men5 de2 xian1 tan2tan2 zen3me5 dui4fu5 APEX。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，ni3men5 lia3 wai4chu1 ban4shi4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 zhe4xie1 ren2 ye3hao3 wei2 jin4gong1 zuo4 zhun3bei4。"

msgid "Sounds good to me. Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""
"挺​好​。​我们​能​聊聊​别的​吗​？\n"
"ting3 hao3。wo3men5 neng2 liao2 liao2 bie2de5 ma5？"

msgid "Sounds good to me. I'll meet with her."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。​我​去​见见​她​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。wo3 qu4 jian4 jian4 ta1。"

msgid "Sounds good! Later, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​！​回见​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2！hui2jian4，$(l.name)。"

msgid "Sounds good, Paul."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​保罗​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，bao3luo2。"

msgid "Sounds good, Paul. I'll go check up on those jobs."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​保罗​。​我​先​去​看看​都​有​什么​差事​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，bao3luo2。wo3 xian1 qu4 kan4kan5 dou1 you3 shen2me5 cha4shi4。"

msgid "Sounds good, chief! Thanks again!"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​头儿​！​谢​了​！\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，tou2r5！xie4 le5！"

msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""
"那​就​行​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid "Sounds good. Keep me in the loop."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。​有​消息​就​通知​我​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。you3 xiao1xi5 jiu4 tong1zhi1 wo3。"

msgid "Sounds good. Let's go."
msgstr ""
"挺​好​，​咱们​走​吧​。\n"
"ting3 hao3，zan2men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid "Sounds good. Take care, Dietrich."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。​回头见​，​迪​特里​希​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。hui2tou2jian4，Di2te4li3xi1。"

msgid ""
"Sounds great to me! I'll be back at the Kreuzbasar, scrubbing the filth of "
"this place off of me. I feel like I've been dipped in grease."
msgstr ""
"我​看行​！​我​打算​先回​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​把​身上​的​脏东西​都​洗​干净​。​我​感觉​自己​像​掉​进​了​油坑​似的​。\n"
"wo3 kan4 xing2！wo3 da3suan4 xian1 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，ba3 shen1shang5 de5 zang4 dong1 xi1 dou1 xi3 gan1jing4。wo3 gan3jue2 zi4ji3 xiang4 diao4 jin4 le5 you2 keng1 shi4de5。"

msgid ""
"Sounds great to me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks at his PDA again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Another text. \"You're late, you're late!\"\n"
"\n"
"Gods, but I need a drink."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​朝​自己​的​PDA​看​了​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​一条​消息​。​“​你​迟到​了​，​你​迟到​了​！​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​老天​，​我​真得​去​喝一杯​了​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 chao2 zi4ji3 de5 PDA kan4 le5 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 yi1 tiao2 xiao1xi5。“ni3 chi2dao4 le5，ni3 chi2dao4 le5！” \n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1，wo3 zhen1 de2 qu4 he4 yi1 bei1 le5。"

msgid "Sounds interesting. Who’s the boss?"
msgstr ""
"有意思​。​这位​老板​是​何许人也​？\n"
"you3yi4si5。zhe4wei4 lao3ban3 shi4 he2 xu3 ren2 ye3？"

msgid "Sounds intriguing. I can't wait to hear all about it."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​很​有意思​。​我​很​想​听听​更​多​细节​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 you3yi4si5。wo3 hen3 xiang3 ting1 ting1 geng1 duo1 xi4jie2。"

msgid "Sounds like a bad situation. You have my sympathies."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​真是​情况​不妙​。​我​对此​表示同情​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 zhen1shi5 qing2kuang4 bu4miao4。wo3 dui4 ci3 biao3 shi4 tong2 qing2。"

msgid "Sounds like a fair deal to me."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​这笔​交易​挺​公平​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 zhe4 bi3 jiao1yi4 ting3 gong1ping2。"

msgid "Sounds like a fair trade to me. I'll take care of it."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​这笔​交易​挺​公平​。​交给​我​吧​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 zhe4 bi3 jiao1yi4 ting3 gong1ping2。jiao1gei3 wo3 ba1。"

msgid "Sounds like a hell of a girl."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​很​厉害​啊​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 li4hai5 a1。"

msgid "Sounds like a man confident in his business model."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​这人​对​自己​的​商业模式​充满信心​啊​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 zhe4 ren2 dui4 zi4ji3 de5 shang1ye4mo2shi4 chong1 man3 xin4 xin1 a1。"

msgid "Sounds like a match made in heaven, Altuğ. How do we start?"
msgstr ""
"听​起来​这是​天作之合​啊​，​奥图​伊​。​我们​怎么​开始​？\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 zhe4 shi4 tian1zuo4zhi1he2 a1，ao4 tu2 yi1。wo3men5 zen3me5 kai1shi3？"

msgid "Sounds like a plan to me."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。"

msgid "Sounds like a plan, boss."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​，​老大​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4，lao3da4。"

msgid "Sounds like she woke up grumpy."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​她​有​起床​气​啊​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 ta1 you3 qi3chuang2 qi4 a1。"

msgid "Sounds like that won't happen now."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​现在​这种​事​不会​发生​了​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 xian4zai4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 bu4hui4 fa1sheng1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Sounds like the \"new management\" stole your property. Answer some "
"questions for me, and I'll help you get it back."
msgstr ""
"我​看​是​那​帮​“​新​老板​”​偷​了​你​的​东西​。​回答​我​几个​问题​，​我​就​帮​你​把​东西​拿​回来​。\n"
"wo3 kan4 shi4 na4 bang1“xin1 lao3ban3” tou1 le5 ni3 de5 dong1xi1。hui2da2 wo3 ji3ge5 wen4ti2，wo3 jiu4 bang1 ni3 ba3 dong1xi1 na2 hui2lai5。"

msgid "Sounds like this is our best shot, then."
msgstr ""
"看来​这是​我们​最好​的​机会​了​。\n"
"kan4lai5 zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 zui4hao3 de5 ji1hui4 le5。"

msgid "Sounds like we have a plan."
msgstr ""
"就​这么​定​了​。\n"
"jiu4 zhe4me5 ding4 le5。"

msgid "Sounds like what I'm looking for. How much do you want for it?"
msgstr ""
"感觉​这​就是​我​想要​的​东西​，​怎么​卖​？\n"
"gan3jue2 zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3 xiang3yao4 de5 dong1xi1，zen3me5 mai4？"

msgid "Sounds like you're about to make me a proposition."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​你​打算​和​我​做​笔​交易​啊​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 ni3 da3suan4 he4 wo3 zuo4 bi3 jiao1yi4 a1。"

msgid "Sounds like you're on top of things."
msgstr ""
"看来​你​都​安排​好​了​啊​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 dou1 an1pai2 hao3 le5 a1。"

msgid "Sounds like your priorities are in the right place."
msgstr ""
"看来​你​对​事情​的​优先级​安排​得​很​到位​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 dui4 shi4qing5 de5 you1xian1ji2 an1pai2 de2 hen3 dao4wei4。"

msgid "Sounds scary, Taylor."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​很​可怕​，​泰勒​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 ke3pa4，tai4le4。"

msgid "Sounds simple enough."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​相当​简单​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 xiang1dang1 jian3dan1。"

msgid "Sounds straightforward enough."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​够​直接​了​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 gou4 zhi2jie1 le5。"

msgid "Sounds straightforward enough. Anything else I need to know?"
msgstr ""
"听​起来​够​直接​了​。​还有​其他​需要​我​知道​的​吗​？\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 gou4 zhi2jie1 le5。hai2you3 qi2ta1 xu1yao4 wo3 zhi1dao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid "Sounds that way. How are they to work with?"
msgstr ""
"听​起来​确实​如此​。​跟​他们​合作​的​感受​如何​？\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 que4shi2 ru2ci3。gen1 ta1men5 he2zuo4 de5 gan3shou4 ru2he2？"

msgid "Sounds too good to be true."
msgstr ""
"这​听​起来​也​太棒了​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 ye3 tai4 bang4 le5 ba1。"

msgid "Soy Jerky Treat"
msgstr ""
"肉干​零食\n"
"rou4gan1 ling2shi2"

msgid ""
"So…$(l.name)... Dante was very helpful out there… but… I am a bit concerned "
"about his... "
msgstr ""
"所以​……​$(l.name)​……​但丁​在​刚才​的​战斗​中​很​有​帮助​……​但是​……​我​有些​担心​他​的​……\n"
"suo3yi3……$(l.name)……dan4ding1 zai4 gang1cai2 de5 zhan4dou4 zhong4 hen3 you3 bang1zhu4……dan4shi4……wo3 you3xie1 dan1xin1 ta1 de5……"

msgid "Spanish"
msgstr ""
"西班牙语\n"
"xi1ban1ya2yu3"

msgid "Speak for yourself."
msgstr ""
"只是​你​自己​这么​想​。\n"
"zhi3shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 zhe4me5 xiang3。"

msgid ""
"Speak it...\n"
"\n"
"saythewords \n"
"\n"
"Decree.\n"
"\n"
"What is my doom?"
msgstr ""
"说​吧​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​你​要说​的话​\n"
"​\n"
"​法令​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​末日​何时​到来​？\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ba1……\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ni3 yao4shuo1 de5hua4 \n"
"\n"
"fa3ling4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 mo4ri4 he2shi2 dao4lai2？"

msgid ""
"Speak it...\n"
"\n"
"saythewords \n"
"\n"
"Decree. \n"
"\n"
"What is my doom?"
msgstr ""
"说​吧​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​你​要说​的话​\n"
"​\n"
"​法令​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​末日​何时​到来​？\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ba1……\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ni3 yao4shuo1 de5hua4 \n"
"\n"
"fa3ling4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 mo4ri4 he2shi2 dao4lai2？"

msgid "Speak to Audran"
msgstr ""
"与​奥​德兰​交谈\n"
"yu4 Ao4de2lan2 jiao1tan2"

msgid "Speak to Vauclair"
msgstr ""
"与沃​克莱尔​交谈\n"
"yu4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 jiao1tan2"

msgid ""
"Speak with me again when you are ready to transfer the funds. Until then, I "
"will leave you be."
msgstr ""
"当​你​准备​好​转账​时​再​来​找​我​。​在​那​之前​，​我​不会​打扰​你​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 zhuan3zhang4 shi2 zai4 lai2 zhao3 wo3。zai4 na4 zhi1qian2，wo3 bu4hui4 da3rao3 ni3。"

msgid "Speaker"
msgstr ""
"扬声器\n"
"yang2sheng1qi4"

msgid ""
"Speaking of Yuli, there's one more thing that I want to do before we go home.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stoops to inspect the body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We still need to search the bastard. Who knows? Maybe he has some additional evidence on him... or in him. Could be that he has headware storage - we won't know until we go digging."
msgstr ""
"说​到​这个​，​我​还​想​在​回去​之前​做​一件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​开始​仔细检查​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​还​得​搜​搜​这个​混蛋​。​万一​他​身上​还有​什么​额外​的​证据​呢​……​或者​在​体内​也​有​可能​。​没准​他​有​头部​储存​设备​。​我们​只有​检查​一番​才​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5，wo3 hai2 xiang3 zai4 hui2qu5 zhi1qian2 zuo4 yi1 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kai1shi3 zi3 xi4 jian3 cha2 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hai2 de2 sou1 sou1 zhe4ge5 hun2dan4。wan4yi1 ta1 shen1shang5 hai2you3 shen2me5 e2wai4 de5 zheng4ju4 ni2……huo4zhe3 zai4 ti3nei4 ye3 you3 ke3neng2。mei2zhun3 ta1 you3 tou2bu4 chu3cun2 she4bei4。wo3men5 zhi3you3 jian3cha2 yi1 fan1 cai2 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Speaking of doing things the old fashioned way, Maliit is working to recover information off of those other DVDs.\n"
"\n"
"It's a painstaking process, and it will not be quick, but she is optimistic that she will be successful in time."
msgstr ""
"说​到​老办法​，​玛丽​特​目前​正在​努力​恢复​其他​DVD​里​的​数据​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​过程​费时费力​，​恐怕​进展​不会​很快​。​但​她​还是​持​乐观​态度​，​认为​多花点​时间​总能​搞定​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 dao4 lao3 ban4 fa3，ma3li4 te4 mu4qian2 zheng4zai4 nu3li4 hui1fu4 qi2ta1 DVD li3 de5 shu4ju4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 guo4cheng2 fei4 shi2 fei4 li4，kong3pa4 jin4zhan3 bu4hui4 hen3 kuai4。dan4 ta1 hai2shi5 chi2 le4guan1 tai4du5，ren4wei2 duo1 hua1 dian3 shi2jian1 zong3neng2 gao3ding4。"

msgid ""
"Speaking of which, I should probably get back to work.\n"
"\n"
"Let me know if there's something fun going on, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips her invisible hat at you before returning to the comm at her wrist.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"说​起来​，​我​也​该​继续​干活​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​有​好玩​的​事情​记得​跟​我​说​哦​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转回​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 qi3lai5，wo3 ye3 gai1 ji4xu4 gan4huo2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 you3 hao3wan2 de5 shi4qing5 ji4de5 gen1 wo3 shuo1 e2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3hui2 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Speaking of which, I'd like to have a word with you about that whole \"Meat "
"Grinder\" fiasco."
msgstr ""
"说​到​这里​，​我们​得​聊聊​关于​“​绞肉机​”​的​这​整件​破事​。\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4li3，wo3men5 de2 liao2 liao2 guan1yu2“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 po4shi4。"

msgid "Speaking of which, I've been meaning to talk with you about that."
msgstr ""
"说​到​这个​，​我​一直​想​和​你​聊聊​这​事​。\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5，wo3 yi1zhi2 xiang3 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Speaking of which, can we talk about *how* we're going to get out of here?"
msgstr ""
"说​到​这个​，​我们​是不是​该​谈谈​*​怎么​*​才能​出去​？\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5，wo3men5 shi4bu5shi4 gai1 tan2tan2*zen3me5*cai2neng2 chu1qu4？"

msgid "Speaking of which, let's get moving."
msgstr ""
"这么​说来​，​我们​就​快​走​吧​。\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 lai2，wo3men5 jiu4 kuai4 zou3 ba1。"

msgid "Special"
msgstr ""
"特殊\n"
"te4shu1"

msgid ""
"Specialized receptors in the midbrain allow the user to temporarily ignore 3"
" damage from each incoming attack."
msgstr ""
"植入​中脑​的​特制​受体​允许​使用者​将​受到​的​每​一次​攻击​中​的​3​点​伤害​暂时​忽略​。\n"
"zhi2ru4 zhong4 nao3 de5 te4zhi4 shou4ti3 yun3xu3 shi3yong4zhe3 jiang1 shou4dao4 de5 mei3 yi1ci4 gong1ji1 zhong4 de5 3 dian3 shang1hai4 zan4shi2 hu1lu:e4。"

msgid "Speed Loader"
msgstr ""
"快速​装弹​器\n"
"kuai4su4 zhuang1dan4 qi4"

msgid "Spell Book"
msgstr ""
"法术​书\n"
"fa3shu4 shu1"

msgid "Spellcasting"
msgstr ""
"施法\n"
"shi1fa3"

msgid "Spells"
msgstr ""
"法术\n"
"fa3shu4"

msgid "Spells Unequipped"
msgstr ""
"法术​未​装备\n"
"fa3shu4 wei4 zhuang1bei4"

msgid "Spend Karma ({0})"
msgstr ""
"使用​业力​（​{​0​}​）\n"
"shi3yong4 ye4li4 （{0}）"

msgid "Spend your Karma"
msgstr ""
"使用​你​的​业力\n"
"shi3yong4 ni3 de5 ye4li4"

msgid ""
"Spent months recovering, with nothing to do but think on the futility of it "
"all. So many men had died under my command to hold that border, and for "
"what?"
msgstr ""
"我花​了​数月​时间​康复​，​在此期间​除了​思考​这​一切​的​徒劳无功​外​，​别​无​他​事​可​做​。​在​我​指挥​下​，​有​那么​多​士兵​为​守住​那条​边境​而​牺牲​，​究竟​是​为了​什么​？\n"
"wo3 hua1 le5 shu4yue4 shi2jian1 kang1fu4，zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1 chu2le5 si1kao3 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 tu2lao2wu2gong1 wai4，bie4 wu2 ta1 shi4 ke3 zuo4。zai4 wo3 zhi3hui1 xia4，you3 na4me5 duo1 shi4bing1 wei2 shou3zhu5 na4 tiao2 bian1jing4 er2 xi1sheng1，jiu1jing4 shi4 wei4le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "Spiked Fist"
msgstr ""
"尖刺​指虎\n"
"jian1 ci1 zhi3 hu3"

msgid "Spirit Control"
msgstr ""
"精魂​控制\n"
"jing1hun2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Spirit Summoning"
msgstr ""
"精魂​召唤\n"
"jing1hun2 zhao4huan4"

msgid "Spirit summoning points visible"
msgstr ""
"精魂​召唤​点​可见\n"
"jing1hun2 zhao4huan4 dian3 ke3jian4"

msgid "Spirits, you mean."
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​精魂​吧​。\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 jing1hun2 ba1。"

msgid "Spit it out, already!"
msgstr ""
"你​就​赶紧​说​吧​！\n"
"ni3 jiu4 gan3jin3 shuo1 ba1！"

msgid "Spit it out, old man."
msgstr ""
"赶紧​说​，​老头子​。\n"
"gan3jin3 shuo1，lao3tou2zi5。"

msgid "Spit it out, then. Let's hear it."
msgstr ""
"那​你​说​吧​，​我​听​着​呢​。\n"
"na4 ni3 shuo1 ba1，wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Spit it out."
msgstr ""
"快​说​。\n"
"kuai4 shuo1。"

msgid "Spray and Pray: Hits adjacent targets, but accuracy is reduced"
msgstr ""
"乱射​：​攻击​相邻​的​目标​，​但​精准度​下降\n"
"luan4 she4：gong1ji1 xiang1lin2 de5 mu4biao1，dan4 jing1 zhun3 du4 xia4jiang4"

msgid "Spread Throw"
msgstr ""
"散​掷\n"
"san3 zhi4"

msgid ""
"Spread Throw: Throw Blades in an arc to hit adjacent targets. Cooldown: 1"
msgstr ""
"分散​投掷​：​将​多​把​飞刀​以​弧形​掷​出​，​用来​击中​相邻​的​多个​目标​。​冷却​时间​：​1​回合\n"
"fen1san4 tou2zhi4：jiang1 duo1 ba3 fei1dao1 yi3 hu2xing2 zhi4 chu1，yong4lai2 ji1zhong4 xiang1lin2 de5 duo1ge5 mu4biao1。leng3que4 shi2jian1：1 hui2he2"

msgid ""
"Squads three and five report to main entrance. Do *not* let the intruders escape.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Without another word, he slings his weapon over an armored shoulder and turns to leave the room.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"三队​和​五队​去​正门​入口​守好​。​*​别​*​让​入侵者​跑​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​未​再​多言​，​把​武器​扛​在​覆有​装甲​的​肩膀​上​，​转身​离开​了​房间​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"san1 dui4 he4 wu3 dui4 qu4 zheng4men2 ru4kou3 shou3 hao3。*bie4*rang4 ru4qin1zhe3 pao2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei4 zai4 duo1yan2，ba3 wu3qi4 gang1 zai4 fu4 you3 zhuang1jia3 de5 jian1bang3 shang4，zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 le5 fang2jian1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Sr. Executive: Lennart Stromberg\n"
"Secretary: Annika Schroeder"
msgstr ""
"资深​执行官​：​莱昂​纳特​·​施特​龙贝格​\n"
"​秘书​：​安妮​卡​·​施罗德\n"
"zi1shen1 zhi2 xing2 guan1：lai2 ang2 na4 te4 · shi1 te4 long2 bei4 ge2 \n"
"mi4shu1：an1ni1 ka3 · shi1luo2de2"

msgid "Stahl has overstepped his bounds. His hubris will be his undoing."
msgstr ""
"斯塔尔​越界​了​。​他​的​狂妄自大​将​使​他​万劫不复​。\n"
"Si1ta3er3 yue4jie4 le5。ta1 de5 kuang2wang4zi4da4 jiang1 shi3 ta1 wan4jie2bu4fu4。"

msgid ""
"Stahl has overstepped his bounds. His hubris will be his undoing.\n"
"\n"
"You mark my words. Within the next few hours, the Humanis Policlub is going to take a hammering that will make the Night of Rage look like a peace rally."
msgstr ""
"斯塔尔​越界​了​。​他​的​狂妄自大​将​使​他​万劫不复​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​记住​我​的话​。​在​接下来​的​几个​小时​内​，​人类​至上​俱乐部​将会​遭受​重创​。​这​将​会​让​“​愤怒​之夜​”​看起来​都​像是​一场​和平​集会​。\n"
"\n"
"Si1ta3er3 yue4jie4 le5。ta1 de5 kuang2wang4zi4da4 jiang1 shi3 ta1 wan4jie2bu4fu4。\n"
"\n"
"ji4zhu5 wo3 de5hua4。zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 ji3ge5 xiao3shi2 nei4，ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 jiang1hui4 zao1shou4 zhong4chuang1。zhe4 jiang1 hui4 rang4“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” kan4qi3lai5 dou1 xiang4 shi4 yi1 chang2 he2ping2 ji2hui4。"

msgid "Stairs"
msgstr ""
"楼梯\n"
"lou2ti1"

msgid ""
"Standing by the observation window for Feuerschwinge's chamber, you find a familiar figure. Audran. In his hardened armor, he's every bit as massive as you remember him.\n"
"\n"
"A low voice rumbles out of him. He doesn't turn away from the window."
msgstr ""
"站​在​火翼​房间​的​观察窗​前​，​你​看见​一个​熟悉​的​身影​。​奥​德兰​。​他​身披​坚硬​的​铠甲​，​体型​依然​如​你​记忆​中​那般​魁梧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​低沉​的​嗓音​从​他​口中​发出​。​他​没有​从​窗前​移开​视线​。\n"
"\n"
"zhan4 zai4 Huo3yi4 fang2jian1 de5 guan1 cha2 chuang1 qian2，ni3 kan4jian4 yi1ge5 shu2xi1 de5 shen1ying3。Ao4de2lan2。ta1 shen1 pi1 jian1ying4 de5 kai3jia3，ti3xing2 yi1ran2 ru2 ni3 ji4yi4 zhong4 na4 ban1 kui2wu2。\n"
"\n"
"di1chen2 de5 sang3yin1 cong2 ta1 kou3 zhong4 fa1chu1。ta1 mei2you3 cong2 chuang1 qian2 yi2kai1 shi4xian4。"

msgid ""
"Standing in front of you is a disheveled young man in a lab coat. His eyes are heavy with sleep, his hair is mussed, and a five o'clock shadow discolors his face and neck.\n"
"\n"
"His eyes open wide, and he hesitates a moment. He's clearly surprised to see you."
msgstr ""
"站​在​你​面前​的​是​一个​穿着​白大褂​、​衣衫不整​的​年轻人​。​他​睡眼惺忪​，​头发​蓬乱​，​脸上​和​脖子​长着​稀稀拉拉​的​胡茬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​睁大眼睛​，​犹豫​了​一会儿​。​他​显然​没想到​会​见到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"zhan4 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 shi4 yi1ge5 chuan1zhuo2 bai2da4gua4、yi1 shan1 bu4 zheng3 de5 nian2qing1ren2。ta1 shui4yan3xing1song1，tou2fa5 peng2luan4，lian3 shang4 he4 bo2zi5 zhang3 zhao2 xi1xi1la1la1 de5 hu2cha2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zheng1 dai4 yan3 jing1，you2yu4 le5 yi1hui4r5。ta1 xian3ran2 mei2xiang3dao4 hui4 jian4dao4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Standing in the hallway is a janitor, a tired-looking woman in her mid-thirties. She is staring at you, her eyes wide with surprise.\n"
"\n"
"You can't help but notice the alarm panel set into the wall just behind her. With a flick of her wrist, she could make your job infinitely more complicated."
msgstr ""
"一位​清洁工​站​在​走廊​里​。​她​三十多岁​，​面容​疲惫​，​正​惊讶​地瞪大​眼睛​盯​着​你​看​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不禁​注意​到​她​身后​墙壁​上​的​警报​面板​。​她​只要​轻轻​一挥​手腕​，​就​能​让​你​的​任务​变得​无限​复杂​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wei4 qing1jie2gong1 zhan4 zai4 zou3lang2 li3。ta1 san1 shi2 duo1 sui4，mian4rong2 pi2bei4，zheng1 jing1ya4 de5 deng4 dai4 yan3jing5 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4jin1 zhu4yi4 dao4 ta1 shen1hou4 qiang2bi4 shang4 de5 jing3bao4 mian4ban3。ta1 zhi3yao4 qing1qing1 yi1 hui1 shou3wan4，jiu4 neng2 rang4 ni3 de5 ren4wu5 bian4de5 wu2xian4 fu4za2。"

msgid ""
"Staring daggers at the mage, he spits out a long string of foreign words in a single, susurrant breath.\n"
"\n"
"The sound of it is lovely, but his expression leaves little doubt that the message behind the words is an ugly one."
msgstr ""
"他​怒目​瞪视​着​法师​，​用​一口气​低声​吐​出​一长串​陌生​的​词语​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​声音​悦耳​动听​，​但​他​的​表情​却​昭示​着​话语​背后​的​恶意​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 nu4mu4 deng4 shi4 zhao2 fa3shi1，yong4 yi1kou3qi4 di1sheng1 tu3 chu1 yi1 zhang3 chuan4 mo4sheng1 de5 ci2yu3。\n"
"\n"
"sheng1yin1 yue4er3 dong4ting1，dan4 ta1 de5 biao3qing2 que4 zhao1shi4 zhao2 hua4yu3 bei4hou4 de5 e4yi4。"

msgid ""
"Starting a new batch. If Haushofer's pet isn't ready to be tested tomorrow... well, best not to think about that.\n"
"\n"
"Got to concentrate. Remember lab safety: Keep alert, keep awake. One wrong move could spell disastttttttttttttttttttttttttttt"
msgstr ""
"开始​新​一批​实验​。​要是​豪斯​霍​菲尔​的​宠物​明天​还​不能​接受​测试​……​算了​，​最好​别​这么​想​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​集中​精神​，​牢记​实验室​安全​守则​：​保持警惕​，​保持​清醒​。​一个​失误​就​可能​酿成​大祸​—​—\n"
"\n"
"kai1shi3 xin1 yi1 pi1 shi2yan4。yao4shi5 hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3 de5 chong3wu4 ming2tian1 hai2 bu4neng2 jie1shou4 ce4shi4……suan4le5，zui4hao3 bie4 zhe4me5 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"ji2zhong1 jing1shen2，lao2ji4 shi2yan4shi4 an1quan2 shou3ze2：bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4，bao3chi2 qing1xing3。yi1ge5 shi1wu4 jiu4 ke3neng2 niang4cheng2 da4huo4 — —"

msgid "Stash"
msgstr ""
"库存\n"
"ku4cun2"

msgid "Static"
msgstr ""
"静电\n"
"jing4dian4"

msgid "Stationary"
msgstr ""
"静态\n"
"jing4tai4"

msgid "Statue"
msgstr ""
"雕像\n"
"diao1xiang4"

msgid ""
"Stay alive! I'll do what I can to take those turrets offline. So just try "
"not to die, okay?"
msgstr ""
"活下去​！​我会​尽我所能​关掉​那些​炮塔​。​总之​别死​在​那里​，​好​吧​？\n"
"huo2xia4qu4！wo3 hui4 jin3 wo3 suo3 neng2 guan1diao4 na4xie1 pao4ta3。zong3zhi1 bie4 si3 zai4 na4li5，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Stay cool, guys. It isn't moving. I think that it's... I dunno, on standby or something.\n"
"\n"
"The lights are on, but nobody's home."
msgstr ""
"别慌​，​各位​。​它​没有​要动​的​意思​。​我​看​它​是​……​处于​某种​待机​状态​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​好像​开着机​，​不过​程序​没跑​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 huang1，ge4wei4。ta1 mei2you3 yao4 dong4 de5 yi4si5。wo3 kan4 ta1 shi4……chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 kai1 zhao2 ji1，bu4guo4 cheng2xu4 mei2 pao2 qi3lai5。"

msgid "Stay cool, man. We're almost done."
msgstr ""
"保持​冷静​。​我们​马上​就​完事​了​。\n"
"bao3chi2 leng3jing4。wo3men5 ma3shang4 jiu4 wan2shi4 le5。"

msgid "Stay frosty, Dietrich. Just give me a minute."
msgstr ""
"冷静​点​，​迪​特里​希​。​给​我点​时间​。\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，Di2te4li3xi1。gei3 wo3 dian3 shi2jian1。"

msgid "Stay safe. (w)"
msgstr ""
"保重​。\n"
"bao3zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Stay tuned for more news about the Sydney rift as it comes in, and for more "
"on-location reporting from our own Taylor Nguyen--"
msgstr ""
"敬请​关注​悉尼​裂隙​的​最新​动态​，​以及​我们​特派记者​泰勒​·​阮​的​更​多​现场报道​—​—\n"
"jing4qing3 guan1zhu4 xi1ni2 lie4xi4 de5 zui4xin1 dong4tai4，yi3ji2 wo3men5 te4 pai4 ji4 zhe3 tai4le4 · ruan3 de5 geng1 duo1 xian4chang3bao4dao4 — —"

msgid "Steady Shot"
msgstr ""
"稳固​射击\n"
"wen3gu4 she4ji1"

msgid "Stealth Rigger"
msgstr ""
"潜行​机师\n"
"qian2xing2 ji1shi1"

msgid "Stealth Suit"
msgstr ""
"潜行​套装\n"
"qian2xing2 tao4zhuang1"

msgid ""
"Stealth is always preferable to open combat.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good find."
msgstr ""
"潜行​永远​好过​正面交锋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这招​真不错​。\n"
"\n"
"qian2xing2 yong3yuan3 hao3guo4 zheng1 mian4 jiao1 feng1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 zhen1 bu4 cuo4。"

msgid "Steam Timed Out"
msgstr ""
"Steam​超时\n"
"Steam chao1shi2"

msgid "Steam Workshop servers are unresponsive, try again later."
msgstr ""
"Steam​创意​工坊​服务器​未​响应​，​请​稍后​重试​。\n"
"Steam chuang4yi4 gong1fang2 fu2wu4qi4 wei4 xiang3ying4，qing3 shao1hou4 chong2shi4。"

msgid "Steel Bolted Door"
msgstr ""
"钢制​螺栓​门\n"
"gang1zhi4 luo2shuan1 men2"

msgid "Steel Lynx"
msgstr ""
"钢铁​山猫\n"
"gang1tie3 shan1mao1"

msgid "Steel Lynx Drone"
msgstr ""
"钢铁​猞猁​无人机\n"
"gang1tie3 she1li4 wu2ren2ji1"

msgid ""
"Step away from that control panel, Doc, or this is gonna end... poorly."
msgstr ""
"离开​控制面板​，​博士​。​否则​场面​……​会​很​难看​的​。\n"
"li2kai1 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3，bo2shi4。fou3ze2 chang3mian4……hui4 hen3 nan2kan4 de5。"

msgid "Step away from the container."
msgstr ""
"离​容器​远​点​。\n"
"li2 rong2qi4 yuan3 dian3。"

msgid "Step out of my way, or your problems are gonna get a whole lot worse."
msgstr ""
"立刻​让开​，​否则​你​就​摊​上​大事​了​。\n"
"li4ke4 rang4kai1，fou3ze2 ni3 jiu4 tan1 shang4 da4shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Stepping out of the U-Bahn tunnel, you once again find yourself in the squalid alleys of Drogenkippe.\n"
"\n"
"This place is a pit. Piles of waste - human and otherwise - litter the streets. The gutted husks of commercial buildings stand hollow and empty all around you."
msgstr ""
"踏出​地铁​隧道​，​你​再次​置身于​毒坑区​的​肮脏​巷弄​之中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​宛如​深渊​一般​。​人类​与​其他​生物​的​排泄物​随处可见​。​四周​尽​是​空荡荡​的​商业​建筑​残骸​，​如同​被​掏空​的​空壳​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chu1 di4tie3 sui4dao4，ni3 zai4ci4 zhi4 shen1 yu2 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 ang1zang1 xiang4long4 zhi1zhong1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 wan3ru2 shen1yuan1 yi1ban1。ren2lei4 yu4 qi2ta1 sheng1wu4 de5 pai2xie4wu4 sui2chu4ke3jian4。si4zhou1 jin3 shi4 kong1dang4dang4 de5 shang1ye4 jian4zhu4 can2hai2，ru2tong2 bei4 tao1kong1 de5 kong1ke2。"

msgid "Steyr AUG-CSL"
msgstr ""
"斯太尔​·​AUG​-​CSL\n"
"si1 tai4 er3 · AUG -CSL"

msgid "Sticks and stones, Yuli."
msgstr ""
"几句话​可伤​不到​我​，​尤里​。\n"
"ji1 ju4 hua4 ke3 shang1 bu4dao4 wo3，You2li3。"

msgid "Still feel that way, with Monika gone?"
msgstr ""
"现在​莫妮卡​不​在​了​，​你们​还​这么​想​吗​？\n"
"xian4zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 bu4 zai4 le5，ni3men5 hai2 zhe4me5 xiang3 ma5？"

msgid "Still shaken up about Monika?"
msgstr ""
"还​没​走出​莫妮卡​的​事​吗​？\n"
"hai2 mei2 zou3chu1 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Still staring at the drone, Vauclair takes a long drag on his cigarette. He holds it, then slowly releases the smoke. It seems to calm him.\n"
"\n"
"He shifts his attention back to you."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​仍​盯​着​无人机​，​深深​吸​了​一口​烟​。​他​攥​紧​烟头​，​缓缓​吐​出​烟雾​。​这​似乎​让​他​平静下来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​将​注意力​重新​转向​你​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 reng2 ding1 zhao2 wu2ren2ji1，shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1。ta1 zuan4 jin3 yan1tou2，huan3huan3 tu3 chu1 yan1wu4。zhe4 si4hu1 rang4 ta1 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 chong2xin1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。"

msgid "Still think you could've prevented Monika's death, Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"你​还​觉得​自己​能​避免​莫妮卡​死​掉​吗​，​艾格尔​？\n"
"ni3 hai2 jue2de5 zi4ji3 neng2 bi4mian3 Mo4ni1ka3 si3 diao4 ma5，Ai4ge2er3？"

msgid "Still too rich for my blood. Would you take a trade?"
msgstr ""
"还是​太贵​了​，​你​有​什么​想要​的​没​？\n"
"hai2shi5 tai4 gui4 le5，ni3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3yao4 de5 mei2？"

msgid "Still waiting then, are we?"
msgstr ""
"我们​到​现在​不​还是​在​等待​吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 dao4 xian4zai4 bu4 hai2shi5 zai4 deng3dai4 ma5？"

msgid "Still, I must understand how you escaped the test lab."
msgstr ""
"不过​，​我​还是​要​知道​你​是​如何​逃出​实验室​的​。\n"
"bu4guo4，wo3 hai2shi5 yao4 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 ru2he2 tao2 chu1 shi2yan4shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Still, he wanted to be a hero, and his family had enough clout to get him an assignment of his choosing.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know how many strings Hoffmann's daddy had to pull to get him assigned to our team, but he pulled them. Hoffmann became our ninth squadmate, despite Metzger's objections."
msgstr ""
"然而​，​他​就是​想要​扮​英雄​，​而​他​家人​的​影响力​又​足以​支持​他​的​选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​霍夫曼​的​父亲​动用​了​多少​关系​把​他​塞进​我们​小队​，​但​总之​他​办成​了​。​尽管​梅茨​格​表示​反对​，​霍夫曼​还是​成为​了​我们​的​第九名​队员​。\n"
"\n"
"ran2er2，ta1 jiu4shi4 xiang3yao4 ban4 ying1xiong2，er2 ta1 jia1ren2 de5 ying3xiang3li4 you4 zu2yi3 zhi1chi2 ta1 de5 xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 huo4fu1man4 de5 fu4qin1 dong4yong4 le5 duo1shao3 guan1xi5 ba3 ta1 se4 jin4 wo3men5 xiao3 dui4，dan4 zong3zhi1 ta1 ban4 cheng2 le5。jin3guan3 mei2 ci2 ge2 biao3shi4 fan3dui4，huo4fu1man4 hai2shi5 cheng2wei2 le5 wo3men5 de5 di4 jiu3 ming2 dui4yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Still, if it wanted to die that badly, I'm glad that it was able to on its own terms.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, chief. Let's get the body into the van. Herr Schmidt won't be happy, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"不过​话说回来​，​它​要是​真​那么​想​死​，​这下​也​算是​如愿以偿​了​，​我​觉得​也​挺​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​来​吧​，​头儿​。​咱们​把​这具​尸体​塞进​车里​吧​。​施密特​先生​肯定​不会​对此​感到高兴​，​不过​总​比​什么​都​没有​强​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，ta1 yao4shi5 zhen1 na4me5 xiang3 si3，zhe4xia4 ye3 suan4shi4 ru2yuan4yi3chang2 le5，wo3 jue2de5 ye3 ting3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"lai2 ba1，tou2r5。zan2men5 ba3 zhe4 ju4 shi1ti3 se4 jin4 che1 li3 ba1。shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，bu4guo4 zong3 bi3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3 jiang4。"

msgid ""
"Still, it is good for us, I think… healthy. It reminds us that even though we have created our little island of stability in the Kreuzbasar, this is still the Flux State - still Berlin - and the wolf is always at the door.\n"
"\n"
"If we are to keep our home, we must be vigilant. And we need people like Monika… people like you, to keep it safe."
msgstr ""
"不过​我​认为​，​这​对​我们​来说​……​不全是​坏事​。​它​提醒​我们​，​即便​有着​像​克洛伊​茨​集市​这样​稳定​的​孤岛​存在​，​柏林​这座​城市​仍然​是​动荡​带​—​—​狼群​永远​在​门外​虎视眈眈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若想​守护​家园​，​我们​必须​时刻​警惕​。​而​我们​需要​莫妮卡​这样​的​人​……​需要​你​这样​的​人​，​来​守护​它​的​安全​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 ren4wei2，zhe4 dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1……bu4 quan2 shi4 huai4shi4。ta1 ti2xing3 wo3men5，ji2bian4 you3zhe5 xiang4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhe4yang4 wen3ding4 de5 gu1dao3 cun2zai4，bo2lin2 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 reng2ran2 shi4 dong4dang4 dai4——lang2 qun2 yong3yuan3 zai4 men2wai4 hu3shi4dan1dan1。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 xiang3 shou3hu4 jia1yuan2，wo3men5 bi4xu1 shi2ke4 jing3ti4。er2 wo3men5 xu1yao4 Mo4ni1ka3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2……xu1yao4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2，lai2 shou3hu4 ta1 de5 an1quan2。"

msgid "Still, it will do for now."
msgstr ""
"尽管如此​，​目前​这样​就​足够​了​。\n"
"jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，mu4qian2 zhe4yang4 jiu4 zu2gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Stop arguing and listen to me! I'm going to open this door, and when I do, "
"you're going to get the hell out of here!"
msgstr ""
"别争​了​，​听​我​说​！​我会​打开​这​扇门​，​到时候​你​赶紧​离开​这里​！\n"
"bie4 zheng1 le5，ting1 wo3 shuo1！wo3 hui4 da3kai1 zhe4 shan1 men2，dao4shi2hou4 ni3 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3！"

msgid "Stop arguing and listen to me! You need to get out of here! Now!"
msgstr ""
"别争​了​，​听​我​说​！​你​需要​离开​这里​！​快点​！\n"
"bie4 zheng1 le5，ting1 wo3 shuo1！ni3 xu1yao4 li2kai1 zhe4li3！kuai4dian3！"

msgid ""
"Stop being so doom-and-gloom! That isn't the Blitz that I know! She'll come "
"back to you, just wait and see."
msgstr ""
"别​这么​垂头丧气​了​！​这​不是​我​认识​的​那个​布里​茨​！​她​会​回来​找​你​的​，​你​就​等着瞧​吧​。\n"
"bie4 zhe4me5 chui2tou2sang4qi4 le5！zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 ren4shi5 de5 na4ge5 Bu4li3ci2！ta1 hui4 hui2lai5 zhao3 ni3 de5，ni3 jiu4 deng3zhe5qiao2 ba1。"

msgid "Stop calling me \"ace.\""
msgstr ""
"别​再​叫​我​“​王牌​”​了​。\n"
"bie4 zai4 jiao4 wo3“wang2pai2” le5。"

msgid "Stop it, woman. There is nothing amusing about this."
msgstr ""
"够​了​，​女人​。​这​事​没有​什么​好​消遣​的​。\n"
"gou4 le5，nu:3ren2。zhe4 shi4 mei2you3 shen2me5 hao3 xiao1qian3 de5。"

msgid "Stop it, you're making my mascara run."
msgstr ""
"行​了​行​了​，​你​说​的​我​都​要​哭​了​。\n"
"xing2 le5 xing2 le5，ni3 shuo1 de5 wo3 dou1 yao4 ku1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Stop it. Please, just stop, okay? I don't need your help, and I don't want it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}As strong as Silke's words are, her voice sounds unsure. From the way that she's fidgeting, you can tell that you've struck a nerve.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"别说​了​。​算​我求​你​，​别说​了​，​好​吧​？​我​用不着​你​帮忙​，​我​也​不​想要​你​帮忙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​西​尔克​的​话语​很​硬气​，​声音​里​却​带​着​犹豫​。​从​她​纠结​的​样子​来看​，​你​显然​是​说​到​她​心里​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bie2shuo1 le5。suan4 wo3 qiu2 ni3，bie2shuo1 le5，hao3 ba1？wo3 yong4bu5zhao2 ni3 bang1mang2，wo3 ye3 bu4 xiang3yao4 ni3 bang1mang2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Xi1er3ke4 de5 hua4yu3 hen3 ying4qi4，sheng1yin1 li3 que4 dai4 zhao2 you2yu4。cong2 ta1 jiu1jie2 de5 yang4zi5 lai2 kan4，ni3 xian3ran2 shi4 shuo1 dao4 ta1 xin1li5 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Stop playing, lady. Give me the code."
msgstr ""
"别装​了​，​女士​。​把​密码​告诉​我​。\n"
"bie4 zhuang1 le5，nu:3shi4。ba3 mi4ma3 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "Stop the Plot in the Sewers"
msgstr ""
"阻止​下水道​里​的​阴谋\n"
"zu3zhi3 xia4shui3dao4 li3 de5 yin1mou2"

msgid "Stop the Virus Infusion Process Before It Completes"
msgstr ""
"阻止​病毒​注入​流程​完成\n"
"zu3zhi3 bing4du2 zhu4ru4 liu2cheng2 wan2cheng2"

msgid ""
"Stop wasting my time. Get your ass on the floor, or get ready to have a one-"
"on-one with the almighty."
msgstr ""
"别​再​浪费​我​的​时间​了​。​给​我​趴到​地上​，​否则​就​准备​去​见​天王老子​吧​。\n"
"bie4 zai4 lang4fei4 wo3 de5 shi2jian1 le5。gei3 wo3 pa1 dao4 di4shang5，fou3ze2 jiu4 zhun3bei4 qu4 jian4 tian1 wang2 lao3 zi3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Stop! Who are you?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She half-raises her rifle. The weapon looks especially menacing in the red glow of the emergency lights.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Identify yourself!"
msgstr ""
"站住​！​你​是​谁​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​半​举起​步枪​。​在​应急灯​的​红光​映照​下​，​这​武器​显得​格外​骇人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​表明​你​的​身份​！\n"
"\n"
"zhan4zhu4！ni3 shi4 shei2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ban4 ju3qi3 bu4qiang1。zai4 ying1 ji2 deng1 de5 hong2 guang1 ying4zhao4 xia4，zhe4 wu3qi4 xian3de5 ge2wai4 hai4ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"biao3ming2 ni3 de5 shen1fen4！"

msgid ""
"Stop! Who are you?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She half-raises her rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Identify yourself!"
msgstr ""
"站住​！​你​是​谁​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​半​举起​步枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​表明​你​的​身份​！\n"
"\n"
"zhan4zhu4！ni3 shi4 shei2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ban4 ju3qi3 bu4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"biao3ming2 ni3 de5 shen1fen4！"

msgid "Stop, damn it! We need him alive to complete the run!"
msgstr ""
"该死​的​，​快​住手​！​我们​得​让​他​活着​才能​完成​差事​！\n"
"gai1si3 de5，kuai4 zhu4shou3！wo3men5 de2 rang4 ta1 huo2zhe5 cai2neng2 wan2cheng2 cha4shi4！"

msgid "Stopped. Not killed."
msgstr ""
"是​阻止​，​不是​杀掉​。\n"
"shi4 zu3zhi3，bu4shi4 sha1diao4。"

