"wo3 de5 sheng1huo2 gen1 zhe4 ye3 cha4bu5duo1。wo3 xiang4 ni3 biao3 shi4 tong2 qing2。"

msgid ""
"Straight to the point. Good. I have a important meeting in a few hours.\n"
"\n"
"So let's get to the penthouse and plant the cameras. I'll mask them against detection, and then we can all go our separate ways."
msgstr ""
"直奔​主题​。​很​好​。​我​几小时​后​有​个​重要​会议​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​赶紧​去​顶层​公寓​安装​摄像头​吧​。​我会​屏蔽​它们​的​探测​信号​，​之后​咱们​就​能​各​走​各路​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi2ben4 zhu3ti2。hen3 hao3。wo3 ji1 xiao3 shi2 hou4 you3 ge4 zhong4yao4 hui4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gan3jin3 qu4 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 an1zhuang1 she4xiang4tou2 ba1。wo3 hui4 ping2bi4 ta1men5 de5 tan4ce4 xin4hao4，zhi1hou4 zan2men5 jiu4 neng2 ge4 zou3 ge4 lu4 le5。"

