msgstr ""
"外头​一直​在​发生​奇怪​的​事情​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​有​什么​要​解释​的​吗​？\n"
"wai4tou5 yi1zhi2 zai4 fa1sheng1 qi2guai4 de5 shi4qing5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 you3 shen2me5 yao4 jie3shi4 de5 ma5？"

