"奇怪​。​他们​向​你​解释​过​这条​要求​的​理由​吗​？\n"
"qi2guai4。ta1men5 xiang4 ni3 jie3shi4 guo4 zhe4 tiao2 yao1qiu2 de5 li3you2 ma5？"

