msgstr ""
"施特​龙贝格\n"
"shi1 te4 long2 bei4 ge2"

msgid ""
"Struggling to your feet, you find Glory standing nearby. She looks as calm "
"as she ever has, but something about her troubles you. You can't quite put "
"your finger on it, but you can't shake the feeling that something is "
"*wrong.*"
msgstr ""
"你​挣扎​着​站​起身​，​发现​格洛丽​就​站​在​不远处​。​她​看起来​一如既往​地​保持​着​冷静​，​但​她​身上​的​某些​地方​让​你​感到​不安​。​你​说不上来​那​具体​是​什么​，​但​那种​*​不对劲​*​的​感觉​始终​挥之不去​。\n"
"ni3 zheng1zha2 zhao2 zhan4 qi3shen1，fa1xian4 Ge2luo4li2 jiu4 zhan4 zai4 bu4 yuan3 chu3。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 yi1ru2ji4wang3 de5 bao3chi2 zhao2 leng3jing4，dan4 ta1 shen1shang5 de5 mou3xie1 di4fang1 rang4 ni3 gan3dao4 bu4an1。ni3 shuo1 bu4 shang4 lai2 na4 ju4ti3 shi4 shen2me5，dan4 na4zhong3*bu4dui4jin4*de5 gan3jue2 shi3zhong1 hui1zhi1bu4qu4。"

msgid ""
"Student protests, civil uprising... you'll be in the middle of it, I'm sure. Just stay safe, all right? And I'll do my best to do the same.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know what's going to happen when I step into the SOX. But I do know one thing... if the Firewing is still a danger, I *will* put an end to her. Once and for all."
msgstr ""
"学生​抗议​、​平民​起义​……​你​肯定​会​置身其中​。​注意安全​，​好​吗​？​我​也​会​尽力而为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​当​我​进入​萨洛​卢区​会​发生​什么​，​但​我​知道​一件​事​……​如果​“​火翼​”​仍​有​威胁​的话​，​我​*​一定​*​会​彻底​消灭​她​。\n"
"\n"
"xue2sheng5 kang4yi4、ping2min2 qi3yi4……ni3 ken3ding4 hui4 zhi4 shen1 qi2 zhong4。zhu4 yi4 an1 quan2，hao3 ma5？wo3 ye3 hui4 jin4li4er2wei2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 dang1 wo3 jin4ru4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5，dan4 wo3 zhi1dao4 yi1 jian4 shi4……ru2guo3“Huo3yi4” reng2 you3 wei1xie2 de5hua4，wo3*yi1ding4*hui4 che4di3 xiao1mie4 ta1。"

