"mao2 rong2 xiong2"

msgid ""
"Stumbled upon this archival footage of Feuerschwinge's original attack. Months before the Dragonfall. Easy to forget how devastating it was... Adrian saved a lot of people by bringing her down.\n"
"\n"
"I've got the footage all cued up to play... starting it now. Additional comments to follow."
msgstr ""
"偶然​发现​了​这段​火翼​最初​攻击​的​档案​视频​。​就​在​龙​陨​事件​之前​的​几个​月​。​我们​很​容易​忘记​那场​袭击​的​毁灭性​……​阿德里安​击败​了​她​，​也​从而​拯救​了​很多​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​把​录像​都​调好​播放​了​……​现在​开始​。​后续​会​有​更​多​评论​。\n"
"\n"
"ou3ran2 fa1xian4 le5 zhe4 duan4 Huo3yi4 zui4chu1 gong1ji1 de5 dang4an4 shi4pin2。jiu4 zai4 long2 yun3 shi4jian4 zhi1qian2 de5 ji3ge5 yue4。wo3men5 hen3 rong2yi4 wang4ji4 na4 chang2 xi2ji1 de5 hui3mie4xing4……E1de2li3an1 ji1bai4 le5 ta1，ye3 cong2er2 zheng3jiu4 le5 hen3 duo1 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 ba3 lu4xiang4 dou1 diao4 hao3 bo1fang4 le5……xian4zai4 kai1shi3。hou4xu4 hui4 you3 geng1 duo1 ping2lun4。"

