"we're gettin' set to roll into the run?"
msgstr ""
"傻​逼​公司​狗​，​我们​都​要​开始​行动​了​才​打算​改变​计划​，​他​到底​在​想​什么​？\n"
"sha3 bi1 gong1si1 gou3，wo3men5 dou1 yao4 kai1shi3 xing2dong4 le5 cai2 da3suan4 gai3bian4 ji4hua4，ta1 dao4di3 zai4 xiang3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Stylish, yet secure enough to wear on a run. Grants +1 Decking and +1 ESP "
