msgid ""
"Such a small, fragile thing.\n"
"\n"
"Hard to believe that was all it took to kill a dragon."
msgstr ""
"如此​渺小​而​脆弱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没想到​这样​就​可以​杀死​一头​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2ci3 miao3xiao3 er2 cui4ruo4。\n"
"\n"
