msgid ""
"Such as...? C'mon, boss, I'm just tryin' to figure out who I'm workin' for here.\n"
"\n"
"I think that I deserve to know that much."
msgstr ""
"比如​呢​……​？​别​这样​嘛​，​老大​。​我​就​想​知道​我们​的​队长​是​个​怎样​的​人物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​我​应当​有​资格​了解​下​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"bi3ru2 ni2……？bie4 zhe4yang4 ma5，lao3da4。wo3 jiu4 xiang3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 de5 dui4zhang3 shi4 ge4 zen3yang4 de5 ren2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 wo3 ying1dang1 you3 zi1ge2 liao3jie3 xia4 ba1。"

msgid "Such as? Give me specifics."
