msgid "Such modesty."
msgstr ""
"真实​诚​。\n"
"zhen1shi2 cheng2。"

msgid ""
"Suddenly, Monika's eyes flutter open. Muscle tremors continue to distort her face, and blood oozes between her lips.\n"
"\n"
"You see the muscles in her jaw tensing and the look of concentration in her eyes. She's struggling to speak."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​突然​睁开眼睛​。​颤抖​的​肌肉​扭曲​了​她​的​面容​，​血​从​她​的​嘴唇​间​涌出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看见​她​收紧​下巴​上​的​肌肉​，​眼神​专注​。​她​在​努力​想要​说话​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 tu1ran2 zheng1 kai1 yan3 jing1。chan4dou3 de5 ji1rou4 niu3qu1 le5 ta1 de5 mian4rong2，xie3 cong2 ta1 de5 zui3chun2 jian1 yong3chu1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4jian4 ta1 shou1jin3 xia4ba5 shang4 de5 ji1rou4，yan3shen2 zhuan1zhu4。ta1 zai4 nu3li4 xiang3yao4 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"Suddenly, an enormous screen mounted in the wall opposite you comes to life. The light stabs your eyes, leaving you wincing.\n"
"\n"
"The image on the screen dims. Coalesces. And a figure begins to take shape."
msgstr ""
"突然​，​对面​墙上​嵌​着​的​一块​巨型​屏幕​亮​了​起来​。​炫目​的​光线​直刺​双眼​，​让​你​不由得​眯起​眼睛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​的​影像​逐渐​暗淡​，​开始​凝聚​成形​。​一个​身影​渐渐​显现出来​。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2，dui4mian4 qiang2 shang4 kan3 zhao2 de5 yi1kuai4 ju4xing2 ping2mu4 liang4 le5 qi3lai5。xuan4mu4 de5 guang1xian4 zhi2 ci1 shuang1yan3，rang4 ni3 bu4you2de5 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 de5 ying3xiang4 zhu2jian4 an4dan4，kai1shi3 ning2ju4 cheng2xing2。yi1ge5 shen1ying3 jian4jian4 xian3 xian4 chu1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Suddenly, the Engineer's entire body bucks forward. His eyes bulge out of his skull, and he beats the back of his head against the floor.\n"
"\n"
"He opens his mouth to speak, but the only sound that comes out is a gurgling scream."
msgstr ""
"突然​间​，​工程师​的​整个​身体​猛地​向前​一冲​。​他​的​眼睛​突了​出来​，​用​后脑勺​撞击​着​地板​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​张开嘴​准备​再次​说话​，​但​只有​一声​呜咽​的​尖叫​。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2 jian1，gong1cheng2shi1 de5 zheng3ge4 shen1ti3 meng3de5 xiang4qian2 yi1 chong1。ta1 de5 yan3jing5 tu1 le5 chu1lai2，yong4 hou4nao3shao2 zhuang4ji1 zhao2 di4ban3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhang1 kai1 zui3 zhun3bei4 zai4ci4 shuo1hua4，dan4 zhi3you3 yi1sheng1 wu1ye4 de5 jian1jiao4。"

msgid ""
"Suddenly, the air in the room seems to ignite.\n"
"\n"
"There is a blinding flash, and your PDA's screen cuts to static."
msgstr ""
"突然​间​，​房间​里​的​空气​仿佛​被​点燃​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一道​刺​目的​闪光​划过​，​你​的​PDA​屏幕​瞬间​变成​一片​雪花​。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2 jian1，fang2jian1 li3 de5 kong1qi4 fang3fu2 bei4 dian3ran2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dao4 ci1 mu4di4 shan3guang1 hua2guo4，ni3 de5 PDA ping2mu4 shun4jian1 bian4cheng2 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1。"

msgid ""
"Suffice it to say, war of any kind would not bode well for the Kreuzbasar. "
"But should it come to pass, the presence or loss of the \"Arctic Fox\" would"
" be significant. (h)"
msgstr ""
"总而言之​，​任何​形式​的​战争​对​克洛伊​茨​集市​而言​都​绝非​吉兆​。​但​如果​真有​战事​爆发​，​“​北极狐​”​的​生死​将​产生​重大​影响​。\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，ren4he2 xing2shi4 de5 zhan4zheng1 dui4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 er2yan2 dou1 jue2fei1 ji2zhao4。dan4 ru2guo3 zhen1 you3 zhan4shi4 bao4fa1，“bei3ji2hu2” de5 sheng1si3 jiang1 chan3sheng1 zhong4da4 ying3xiang3。"

