msgid "Support"
msgstr ""
"支援\n"
"zhi1yuan2"

msgid "Support our local economy. Indeed."
msgstr ""
"支持​我们​的​本地​经济​。​没错​。\n"
"zhi1chi2 wo3men5 de5 ben3di4 jing1ji4。mei2cuo4。"

msgid "Support:"
msgstr ""
"支援​：\n"
"zhi1yuan2："

msgid ""
"Supposedly, it hit the streets of Seattle a couple of years ago. It vanished"
" after a couple of months... there one day, gone the next. Nobody knows why."
msgstr ""
"据说​它​几年​前​曾​在​西雅图​的​街头​盛行​，​又​在​几个​月​后​消失​了​……​随后​的​某​一天​，​它​又​出现​在​下​一个​地方​。​没​人​知道​为什么​。\n"
"ju4shuo1 ta1 ji3nian2 qian2 ceng2 zai4 xi1ya3tu2 de5 jie1tou2 sheng4xing2，you4 zai4 ji3ge5 yue4 hou4 xiao1shi1 le5……sui2hou4 de5 mou3 yi1 tian1，ta1 you4 chu1xian4 zai4 xia4 yi1ge5 di4fang1。mei2 ren2 zhi1dao4 wei4shen2me5。"

msgid "Suppression Lvl 1"
msgstr ""
"压制​I\n"
"ya1zhi4 I"

msgid "Suprathyroid (Bioware)"
msgstr ""
"超​甲状腺​（​生体​改造​）\n"
"chao1 jia3zhuang4xian4 （sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4）"

msgid "Sure Altuğ. I’ll talk to him. You never know."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​奥图​伊​。​我会​和​他​谈谈​。​没准​是​个​好​机会​呢​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ao4 tu2 yi1。wo3 hui4 he4 ta1 tan2tan2。mei2zhun3 shi4 ge4 hao3 ji1hui4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Sure I am. But then again, so are you.\n"
"\n"
"You sat back and watched as the Doc released his wonder bug. This is as much on you as it is on me.\n"
"\n"
"The only difference between us is that I've accepted what's coming, and you haven't."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​但​话说回来​，​你​不​也​是​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​眼睁睁​地​看着​博士​释放​了​他​的​造物​。​这事​你​没​资格​来怪​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​之间​唯一​的​不同​是​我​已经​接受​了​即将​到来​的​结局​，​而​你​还​没有​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，ni3 bu4 ye3 shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yan3zheng1zheng1 de5 kan4 zhao2 bo2shi4 shi4fang4 le5 ta1 de5 zao4wu4。zhe4 shi4 ni3 mei2 zi1ge2 lai2 guai4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1jian1 wei2yi1 de5 bu4tong2 shi4 wo3 yi3jing1 jie1shou4 le5 ji2jiang1 dao4lai2 de5 jie2ju2，er2 ni3 hai2 mei2you3。"

msgid "Sure I know Monika. You one of hers then?"
msgstr ""
"我​当然​认识​莫妮卡​。​看来​你​是​她​的​人​了​？\n"
"wo3 dang1ran2 ren4shi5 Mo4ni1ka3。kan4lai5 ni3 shi4 ta1 de5 ren2 le5？"

msgid ""
"Sure enough. I think that most of the team is here to hide from something. \n"
"\n"
"Not me, of course... given the choice between hiding from something and punching it smack in the nose, you know which direction I tend to lean."
msgstr ""
"果然如此​。​我​觉得​团队​里​的​大多数​人​都​是​来​避风头​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​这​不是​在​说​我​啊​……​如果​让​我​来​选择​跑​路​避风头​还是​重拳出击​的话​，​你​知道​我会​选​哪个​的​。\n"
"\n"
"guo3 ran2 ru2 ci3。wo3 jue2de5 tuan2dui4 li3 de5 da4duo1shu4 ren2 dou1 shi4 lai2 bi4feng1tou5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，zhe4 bu4shi4 zai4 shuo1 wo3 a1……ru2guo3 rang4 wo3 lai2 xuan3ze2 pao2 lu4 bi4feng1tou5 hai2shi5 chong2 quan2 chu1 ji1 de5hua4，ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 hui4 xuan3 na3ge5 de5。"

msgid ""
"Sure enough. Sent me a note. Wanna hear what it said?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He presses forward without waiting for a response.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll tell you. The note said, and I quote:"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​她​给我发​了​条​备忘​。​想​听听看​里面​说​了​什么​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​不​等​你​回答​便​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​告诉​你​吧​。​上面​是​这么​说​的​：\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。ta1 gei3 wo3 fa1 le5 tiao2 bei4 wang4。xiang3 ting1 ting1 kan4 li3mian4 shuo1 le5 shen2me5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bu4 deng3 ni3 hui2da2 bian4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gao4su4 ni3 ba1。shang4mian4 shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5："

msgid ""
"Sure they are. But when the chips are down, you expect them to listen to *you.*\n"
"\n"
"That's the difference between your team and mine, $(l.name). You've got some good people on your crew, but *my* team is made up of equals. We're free, and we all know it. And I wouldn't have it any other way. "
msgstr ""
"平时​是​这样​，​但​一旦​到​了​关键时刻​，​你​还是​会要​他们​听​*​你​*​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就是​我们​双方​团队​之间​的​区别​，​$(l.name)​。​你​的​团队​是​挺不错​，​但​*​我​的​*​团队​是​由​平等​的​人​组成​的​。​我们​是​自由​的​，​我们​都​知道​这​一点​。​我​不会​接受​其他​形式​的​合作​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2shi2 shi4 zhe4yang4，dan4 yi1dan4 dao4 le5 guan1 jian4 shi2 ke4，ni3 hai2shi5 hui4yao4 ta1men5 ting1*ni3*de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 shuang1fang1 tuan2dui4 zhi1jian1 de5 qu1bie2，$(l.name)。ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 shi4 ting3 bu4 cuo4，dan4*wo3 de5*tuan2dui4 shi4 you2 ping2deng3 de5 ren2 zu3cheng2 de5。wo3men5 shi4 zi4you2 de5，wo3men5 dou1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。wo3 bu4hui4 jie1shou4 qi2ta1 xing2shi4 de5 he2zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Sure thing $(l.guy).\n"
"\t\t\n"
"{{GM}}He fills a tumbler full of cheap gin and dirty ice, splashes a bit of tonic in, and slides it across the bar. It has a slight gasoline smell to it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​$(l.guy)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​一个​平底​杯​倒​满​廉价​金酒​和​脏​冰块​，​然后​加​了​点汤​力水​，​从​吧​台上​滑​给​你​。​里面​有股​淡淡的​汽油味​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，$(l.guy)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 yi1ge5 ping2di3 bei1 dao3 man3 lian2jia4 jin1jiu3 he4 zang4 bing1kuai4，ran2hou4 jia1 le5 dian3 shang1 li4 shui3，cong2 ba1 tai2shang4 hua2 gei3 ni3。li3mian4 you3 gu3 dan4 dan4 de5 qi4 you2 wei4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Sure thing $(l.guy).\n"
"\t\t\n"
"{{GM}}He pours you a tall glass of beer from a tap, the handle of which has long since broken off its advertising sign. It’s warm, but has a good head.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​$(l.guy)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拿​起​一个​高​杯子​，​从​啤酒​机里​给​你​打​了​一杯​啤酒​—​—​这​机器​的​把手​甚至​早就​脱落​了​。​酒​是​温​的​，​但杯​顶​的​泡沫​挺​漂亮​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，$(l.guy)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 na2 qi3 yi1ge5 gao1 bei1zi5，cong2 pi2jiu3 ji1 li3 gei3 ni3 da3 le5 yi1 bei1 pi2jiu3——zhe4 ji1qi4 de5 ba3shou3 shen4zhi4 zao3jiu4 tuo1luo4 le5。jiu3 shi4 wen1 de5，dan4 bei1 ding3 de5 pao4mo4 ting3 piao4liang5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Sure thing $(l.guy).\n"
"\t\t\n"
"{{GM}}He slides a tumbler full of sweet-smelling pear schnaps down your way. It’s warm.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​$(l.guy)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​一个​平底​杯​倒​满甜​梨子​味儿​的​杜松子酒​，​然后​滑​给​你​。​酒​是​温​的​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，$(l.guy)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 yi1ge5 ping2di3 bei1 dao3 man3 tian2 li2zi5 wei4r5 de5 du4song1zi3jiu3，ran2hou4 hua2 gei3 ni3。jiu3 shi4 wen1 de5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Sure thing boss. But you know me by now. \n"
"\n"
"If there's really anyone in the Kreuzbasar who I shouldn't keep info from, it's you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She winks exaggeratedly.{{/GM}} If only because nobody could pull the wool over your eyes."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​大佬​。​不过​你​现在​了解​我​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​是​克洛伊​茨​集市​有​谁​是​我​不​应该​隐瞒​情报​的​人​，​那​肯定​就是​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​夸张​地​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​因为​没有​人能​瞒过​你​的​法眼​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，da4lao3。bu4guo4 ni3 xian4zai4 liao3jie3 wo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 shi4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 you3 shei2 shi4 wo3 bu4 ying1gai1 yin3man2 qing2bao4 de5 ren2，na4 ken3ding4 jiu4shi4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kua1zhang1 de5 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} yin1wei4 mei2you3 ren2 neng2 man2 guo4 ni3 de5 fa3yan3。"

msgid "Sure thing, Frank."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​弗兰克​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，fu2lan2ke4。"

msgid ""
"Sure thing, boss.\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly I could use a drink."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​突然​想​喝一杯​压​压惊​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tu1ran2 xiang3 he4 yi1 bei1 ya1 ya1 jing1。"

msgid ""
"Sure thing, chief. The terminals in this building are all networked "
"together, so I should be able to drop the quarantine from any computer in "
"the place."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​头儿​。​大楼​里​的​所有​终端​都​已​联网​，​所以​我​应该​能​从​任何​一台​电脑​上​解除​隔离​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，tou2r5。da4lou2 li3 de5 suo3you3 zhong1duan1 dou1 yi3 lian2wang3，suo3yi3 wo3 ying1gai1 neng2 cong2 ren4he2 yi1 tai2 dian4nao3 shang4 jie3chu2 ge2li2。"

msgid ""
"Sure thing. Just hurry back with that stuff, okay?\n"
"\n"
"I really, really need it."
msgstr ""
"不用谢​。​你​快去快回​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真的​特别​需要​那​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4xie4。ni3 kuai4 qu4 kuai4 hui2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1de5 te4bie2 xu1yao4 na4 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Sure was, but speaking of Altuğ, I ought to be going.\n"
"\n"
"You know where I am if you've got anything for me, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She grins and waves a little before bouncing off.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​不过​说​到​奥图​伊​，​我​也​该​走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​有​情报​的话​，​你​知道​该来​哪​找​我​，​嗯​哼​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​，​轻轻​挥​了​挥手​，​然后​蹦蹦跳跳​地​离开​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，bu4guo4 shuo1 dao4 ao4 tu2 yi1，wo3 ye3 gai1 zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 you3 qing2bao4 de5hua4，ni3 zhi1dao4 gai1 lai2 na3 zhao3 wo3，en1 heng1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，qing1qing1 hui1 le5 hui1shou3，ran2hou4 beng4beng4tiao4tiao4 de5 li2kai1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Sure you are. We'll just hold off security while you lug it out of the building.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich jerks his head in the direction of Monika and Glory and claps his hand across your shoulders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's go, neh? We mustn't keep the others waiting."
msgstr ""
"当然​没​问题​。​你​把​它​扛出去​的​时候​，​我们​还会​给​你​拦​着​保安​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希朝​莫妮卡​和​格洛丽​那边​扬起​头​，​同时​用手​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​走​吧​？​可​不能​让​人家​干​等​着​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 mei2 wen4ti2。ni3 ba3 ta1 gang1 chu1 qu4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 hai2 hui4 gei3 ni3 lan2 zhao2 bao3an1 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 Mo4ni1ka3 he4 Ge2luo4li2 na4bian5 yang2qi3 tou2，tong2shi2 yong4 shou3 pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 zou3 ba1？ke3 bu4neng2 rang4 ren2jia1 gan4 deng3 zhao2 a1。"

msgid "Sure you can! I mean, if you can't trust us, who can you trust?"
msgstr ""
"怎么​会​！​要是​我们​的话​你​都​不信​，​那​你​还​能​信​谁​呢​，​对​吧​？\n"
"zen3me5 hui4！yao4shi5 wo3men5 de5hua4 ni3 dou1 bu4 xin4，na4 ni3 hai2 neng2 xin4 shei2 ni2，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "Sure, I could help you out there. For a price..."
msgstr ""
"我​当然​可以​帮​你​，​但​不是​免费​的​……\n"
"wo3 dang1ran2 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3，dan4 bu4shi4 mian3fei4 de5……"

msgid "Sure, I understand. But I still need to talk to you."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​我​明白​，​但​我​还是​想​和​你​聊聊​。\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 ming2bai5，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 xiang3 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2。"

msgid "Sure, I'll be right back."
msgstr ""
"行​啊​，​我​去​去​就​回​。\n"
"xing2 a1，wo3 qu4 qu4 jiu4 hui2。"

msgid "Sure, I'll take one."
msgstr ""
"好​啊​，​我来​一瓶​。\n"
"hao3 a1，wo3 lai2 yi1 ping2。"

msgid "Sure, I'll take the credit."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​军功章​我​就​收下​了​。\n"
"dang1ran2，jun1gong1zhang1 wo3 jiu4 shou1xia4 le5。"

msgid "Sure, I'm game. Where do I jack in?"
msgstr ""
"当然​，​我​愿意​。​在​哪里​接入​？\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 yuan4yi4。zai4 na3li3 jie1ru4？"

msgid "Sure, I'm in."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​我​加入​。\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 jia1ru4。"

msgid "Sure, I've got no use for it."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​反正​我​也​用不上​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，fan3zheng4 wo3 ye3 yong4 bu4 shang4。"

msgid "Sure, I've got some free time."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​有点​空闲​时间​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 you3dian3 kong4xian2 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Sure, boss. Would you be willing to tell me a bit about Monika? \n"
"\n"
"I know that you two had history, but I don't know much more than that.\n"
"\n"
"I'll never get to ask her myself. Not after tonight."
msgstr ""
"行​啊​，​老大​。​那​咱们​来​聊聊​莫妮卡​的​事​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​你​俩​有​一段​过去​，​但​也​就​知道​这么​多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今夜​之后​，​我​已经​没​办法​亲自​问​她​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 a1，lao3da4。na4 zan2men5 lai2 liao2 liao2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 lia3 you3 yi1 duan4 guo4qu4，dan4 ye3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4me5 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jin1ye4 zhi1hou4，wo3 yi3jing1 mei2 ban4fa3 qin1zi4 wen4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Sure, but that's beside the point. I just want to finish what we started."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​但​这​不是​重点​，​我​只​想​给​事情​做个​了结​。\n"
"dang1ran2，dan4 zhe4 bu4shi4 chong2dian3，wo3 zhi3 xiang3 gei3 shi4qing5 zuo4 ge4 liao3jie2。"

msgid "Sure, chief. What did you want to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"当然​，​头儿​。​你​想​聊点​什么​？\n"
"dang1ran2，tou2r5。ni3 xiang3 liao2 dian3 shen2me5？"

msgid "Sure, if you’re buying."
msgstr ""
"行​啊​，​前提​是​你​请客​。\n"
"xing2 a1，qian2ti2 shi4 ni3 qing3ke4。"

msgid "Sure, lay it on me."
msgstr ""
"好​啊​，​告诉​我​吧​。\n"
"hao3 a1，gao4su4 wo3 ba1。"

msgid "Sure, let's see what you have."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​让​我​看看​你​这​有​什么​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 zhe4 you3 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Sure, we can talk.\n"
"\n"
"But not here. You've overstepped your bounds, stranger. Now you need to come with us.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His free hand reaches down to produce a thick leather blindfold.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"行​啊​，​我们​可以​谈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​不是​在​这里​。​你​越界​了​，​陌生人​。​现在​你​得​跟​我们​走​一趟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​空闲​的​那​只​手​从​怀里​扯​出​一条​厚皮​眼罩​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xing2 a1，wo3men5 ke3yi3 tan2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 bu4shi4 zai4 zhe4li3。ni3 yue4jie4 le5，mo4sheng1ren2。xian4zai4 ni3 de2 gen1 wo3men5 zou3 yi1 tang1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 kong4xian2 de5 na4 zhi3 shou3 cong2 huai2li3 che3 chu1 yi1 tiao2 hou4 pi2 yan3zhao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Sure. And you forgot to lock up, and you didn't put the cat out."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​。​而且​你​还​忘​了​锁门​，​而且​你​还​得​去​遛​猫​。\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4。er2qie3 ni3 hai2 wang4 le5 suo3men2，er2qie3 ni3 hai2 de2 qu4 liu4 mao2。"

msgid ""
"Sure. But that doesn't make me a threat to him.\n"
"\n"
"I'm loyal. He knows that."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​但​我​对​他构​不成​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​非常​忠诚​，​他​是​知道​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，dan4 wo3 dui4 ta1 gou4 bu4cheng2 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 fei1chang2 zhong1cheng2，ta1 shi4 zhi1dao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Sure. I get it. And *you* get that your boss is cutting you out of his "
"operation, right?"
msgstr ""
"当然​，​我​明白​。​而​*​你​*​也​明白​自己​被​老大​踢​出​了​后续​行动​，​对​吧​？\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 ming2bai5。er2*ni3*ye3 ming2bai5 zi4ji3 bei4 lao3da4 ti1 chu1 le5 hou4xu4 xing2dong4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "Sure. It's no use to me, anyway."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​反正​它​对​我​来说​也​没用​处​。\n"
"dang1ran2。fan3zheng4 ta1 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 ye3 mei2yong4 chu3。"

msgid "Sure. Oh, and Blitz... you've done a great job all around."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​还有​，​布里​茨​……​你​各​方面​都​做​得​很​出色​。\n"
"en1。hai2you3，Bu4li3ci2……ni3 ge4 fang1mian4 dou1 zuo4 de2 hen3 chu1se4。"

msgid ""
"Sure. She had a lot of things. Control over this entire kiez, for one.\n"
"\n"
"Can't say that I was a fan."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​她​什么​没有​啊​。​这​整片​街区​都​是​她​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​倒​谈不上​喜欢​她​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，ta1 shen2me5 mei2you3 a1。zhe4 zheng3 pian1 jie1qu1 dou1 shi4 ta1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dao3 tan2bu5shang4 xi3huan5 ta1。"

msgid "Sure. What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"当然​，​你​有​什么​需要​？\n"
"dang1ran2，ni3 you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4？"

msgid "Sure. What's the problem?"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。​什么​事​？\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "Sure. Why not? We'll make sure that you're taken care of."
msgstr ""
"好​啊​，​没​问题​。​我们​一定​会​妥善解决​你们​的​麻烦​。\n"
"hao3 a1，mei2 wen4ti2。wo3men5 yi1ding4 hui4 tuo3 shan4 jie3 jue2 ni3men5 de5 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"Sure... but all of the cultists died, too. It's as if you've stopped caring "
"about that."
msgstr ""
"当然​……​不过​所有​邪教徒​都​死​了​，​你​好像​也​不在乎​。\n"
"dang1ran2……bu4guo4 suo3you3 xie2 jiao1 tu2 dou1 si3 le5，ni3 hao3xiang4 ye3 bu4zai4hu5。"

msgid ""
"Surface access has been welded shut - probably an attempt to keep security "
"tight."
msgstr ""
"入口​表面​已​被​焊接​封闭​—​—​很​可能​是​为了​加强​安保​。\n"
"ru4kou3 biao3mian4 yi3 bei4 han4jie1 feng1bi4——hen3 ke3neng2 shi4 wei4le5 jia1qiang2 an1bao3。"

msgid ""
"Surfturf? Those tunnel rats? They're ancient history... go ahead and call 'em if you don't believe me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her face twists into an ugly smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Scream as loud as you want. They won't hear you. We buried them last week."
msgstr ""
"海陆​会​？​那群​见​不得​光​的​老鼠​？​他们​早就​是​过去​式​了​……​你​要​不信​的话​，​尽管​去​喊​人​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​脸​扭出​一个​丑陋​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​喊​再​大声​他们​也​听​不到​。​我们​上周​已经​给​他们​埋​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hai3lu4 hui4？na4 qun2 jian4 bu4de2 guang1 de5 lao3shu3？ta1men5 zao3jiu4 shi4 guo4qu4 shi4 le5……ni3 yao4 bu4 xin4 de5hua4，jin3guan3 qu4 han3 ren2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 niu3 chu1 yi1ge5 chou3lou4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 han3 zai4 da4sheng1 ta1men5 ye3 ting1 bu4dao4。wo3men5 shang4zhou1 yi3jing1 gei3 ta1men5 mai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Surprisingly, this entry is relatively easy to read.\n"
"\n"
"Skimming it over, you discover that the scientists here have been working on a variety of additional tweaks to a project called \"Panacea.\""
msgstr ""
"令人​惊讶​的​是​，​这篇​内容​相对​容易​阅读​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​粗略​浏览​后​，​你​会​发现​这里​的​科学家​们​一直​在​对​一个​名为​“​万能​药​”​的​项目​进行​各种​额外​改进​。\n"
"\n"
"ling4ren2 jing1ya4 de5 shi4，zhe4 pian1 nei4rong2 xiang1dui4 rong2yi4 yue4du2。\n"
"\n"
"cu1lu:e4 liu2lan3 hou4，ni3 hui4 fa1xian4 zhe4li3 de5 ke1xue2jia1 men5 yi1zhi2 zai4 dui4 yi1ge5 ming2wei2“wan4neng2 yao4” de5 xiang4mu4 jin4xing2 ge4zhong3 e2wai4 gai3jin4。"

msgid ""
"Surprisingly, this increase in violence has been steady across the board. It doesn't matter where you go - the murder rates there are climbing.\n"
"\n"
"Even historically low-crime countries such as Monaco and Liechtenstein have been impacted by this. The pandemic of violence respects no borders."
msgstr ""
"令人​惊讶​的​是​，​暴力事件​的​增长​呈现​全面​蔓延​之势​。​无论​你​身处​何地​—​—​当地​的​谋杀​率​都​在​攀升​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​连​摩纳哥​和​列支敦士登​这​类​历史​上​犯罪率​极低​的​国家​也​未能幸免​。​这场​暴力​疫情​不​分​国界​。\n"
"\n"
"ling4ren2 jing1ya4 de5 shi4，bao4 li4 shi4 jian4 de5 zeng1zhang3 cheng2xian4 quan2mian4 man4yan2 zhi1 shi4。wu2lun4 ni3 shen1chu3 he2 de5——dang1di4 de5 mou2sha1 shuai4 dou1 zai4 pan1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 lian2 mo2na4ge1 he4 lie4zhi1dun1shi4deng1 zhe4 lei4 li4shi3 shang4 fan4 zui4 shuai4 ji2 di1 de5 guo2jia1 ye3 wei4 neng2 xing4 mian3。zhe4 chang2 bao4li4 yi4qing2 bu4 fen4 guo2jie4。"

msgid "Surveillance Terminal"
msgstr ""
"监控​终端\n"
"jian1kong4 zhong1duan1"

msgid "Survive Until the Door Unlocks"
msgstr ""
"存活​至​大门​解锁\n"
"cun2huo2 zhi4 da4men2 jie3suo3"

msgid "Survive for $(scene.RoundsLeft) turns"
msgstr ""
"存活​$(scene.RoundsLeft)​回合\n"
"cun2huo2 $(scene.RoundsLeft) hui2he2"

msgid "Survivor"
msgstr ""
"幸存者\n"
"xing4cun2zhe3"

msgid "Sutterlin Front Door"
msgstr ""
"苏​特林​前门\n"
"su1 te4 lin2 qian2men2"

msgid "Swap with another item (will be sent to stash):"
msgstr ""
"与​另​一件​物品​交换​（​将​被​放入​库存​）​：\n"
"yu4 ling4 yi1 jian4 wu4pin3 jiao1huan4 （jiang1 bei4 fang4ru4 ku4cun2）："

msgid ""
"Swear. \n"
"\n"
"yes swear\n"
"\n"
"sweartohurtnomannobeast \n"
"\n"
"Nor tree, nor crop, nor building."
msgstr ""
"发誓​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​发誓​\n"
"​\n"
"​发誓​不​伤害​人类​野兽​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​树木​或者​庄稼​或者​建筑​。\n"
"\n"
"fa1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5 fa1shi4 \n"
"\n"
"fa1shi4 bu4 shang1hai4 ren2lei4 ye3shou4 \n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3 shu4mu4 huo4zhe3 zhuang1jia5 huo4zhe3 jian4zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Sweeping your eyes over the written material, you recognize a number of words with Latin and Spanish roots, but it's the logograms that give it away. What you're looking at is a very old form of Nahuatl. Pre-17th century, by the looks of it... the orthography predates anything that you're familiar with.\n"
"\n"
"Why the Azzies are using it here is beyond you."
msgstr ""
"你​用​双眼​扫视​着​文字​材料​，​认出​了​若干​源自​拉丁语​和​西班牙语​的​词汇​，​但​真正​暴露​其本质​的​却是​那些​表意文字​。​眼前​所​见​实为​一种​极为​古老​的​纳​瓦特​语​形式​。​从​字形​判断​应是​十七世纪​之前​的​产物​……​其​拼写​体系​远早​于​你​所​熟知​的​任何​文字​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​阿兹佬​为何​在​此​使用​这种​文字​，​你​实在​百思不得其解​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong4 shuang1yan3 sao3shi4 zhao2 wen2zi4 cai2liao4，ren4chu1 le5 ruo4gan1 yuan2zi4 la1ding1yu3 he4 xi1ban1ya2yu3 de5 ci2hui4，dan4 zhen1zheng4 bao4lu4 qi2 ben3 zhi4 de5 que4shi4 na4xie1 biao3yi4wen2zi4。yan3qian2 suo3 jian4 shi2 wei2 yi1zhong3 ji2wei2 gu3lao3 de5 na4 wa3te4 yu3 xing2shi4。cong2 zi4xing2 pan4duan4 ying1 shi4 shi2 qi1 shi4 ji4 zhi1qian2 de5 chan3wu4……qi2 pin1xie3 ti3xi4 yuan3 zao3 yu2 ni3 suo3 shu2zhi1 de5 ren4he2 wen2zi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 e1 zi1 lao3 wei4he2 zai4 ci3 shi3yong4 zhe4zhong3 wen2zi4，ni3 shi2zai4 bai3si1bu4de2qi2jie3。"

msgid ""
"Sweeping your eyes over the written material, you recognize a number of words with Latin and Spanish roots, but the language is something altogether different. Many of the words are long and exotic, and there appears to be a form of pictographic language interspersed throughout the text.\n"
"\n"
"Your best guess is that this is an ancient form of Nahuatl. Why the Azzies are using it here is beyond you."
msgstr ""
"你​用​双眼​扫视​着​文字​材料​，​认出​了​若干​源自​拉丁语​和​西班牙语​的​词汇​，​但​这​语言​本身​却​截然不同​。​许多​词汇​冗长​而​带有​异域​风格​，​文字​间​还​似乎​穿插着​某种​象形​符号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​推测​这​可能​是​纳​瓦特​语​的​某种​古体​形式​。​至于​阿兹佬​为何​在​此​使用​这种​文字​，​你​实在​百思不得其解​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong4 shuang1yan3 sao3shi4 zhao2 wen2zi4 cai2liao4，ren4chu1 le5 ruo4gan1 yuan2zi4 la1ding1yu3 he4 xi1ban1ya2yu3 de5 ci2hui4，dan4 zhe4 yu3yan2 ben3shen1 que4 jie2ran2bu4tong2。xu3duo1 ci2hui4 rong3chang2 er2 dai4you3 yi4yu4 feng1ge2，wen2zi4 jian1 hai2 si4hu1 chuan1 cha1 zhao2 mou3zhong3 xiang4xing2 fu2hao4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tui1ce4 zhe4 ke3neng2 shi4 na4 wa3te4 yu3 de5 mou3zhong3 gu3 ti3 xing2shi4。zhi4yu2 e1 zi1 lao3 wei4he2 zai4 ci3 shi3yong4 zhe4zhong3 wen2zi4，ni3 shi2zai4 bai3si1bu4de2qi2jie3。"

msgid ""
"Sweeping your gaze across the room, you see a variety of terminals, all displaying error messages.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever security APEX provided here, it's off line now, leaving the machines unlocked and unprotected."
msgstr ""
"环顾四周​，​你​看到​各种​终端设备​，​全都​显示​着​错误信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​APEX​在​这里​提供​了​什么样​的​安全措施​，​现在​都​已​离线​，​导致​这些​设备​处于​未​锁定​且​无​保护​的​状态​。\n"
"\n"
"huan2gu4si4zhou1，ni3 kan4dao4 ge4zhong3 zhong1 duan1 she4 bei4，quan2dou1 xian3shi4 zhao2 cuo4 wu4 xin4 xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 APEX zai4 zhe4li3 ti2gong1 le5 shen2me5yang4 de5 an1quan2cuo4shi1，xian4zai4 dou1 yi3 li2xian4，dao3zhi4 zhe4xie1 she4bei4 chu3yu2 wei4 suo3ding4 qie3 wu2 bao3hu4 de5 zhuang4tai4。"

msgid ""
"Sweeping your gaze across the room, you see a variety of terminals, all displaying error messages.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever security APEX provided here, it's offline now, leaving the machines unlocked and unprotected."
msgstr ""
"环顾四周​，​你​看到​各种​终端设备​，​全都​显示​着​错误信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​APEX​在​这里​提供​了​什么样​的​安全措施​，​现在​都​已​离线​，​导致​这些​设备​处于​未​锁定​且​无​保护​的​状态​。\n"
"\n"
"huan2gu4si4zhou1，ni3 kan4dao4 ge4zhong3 zhong1 duan1 she4 bei4，quan2dou1 xian3shi4 zhao2 cuo4 wu4 xin4 xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 APEX zai4 zhe4li3 ti2gong1 le5 shen2me5yang4 de5 an1quan2cuo4shi1，xian4zai4 dou1 yi3 li2xian4，dao3zhi4 zhe4xie1 she4bei4 chu3yu2 wei4 suo3ding4 qie3 wu2 bao3hu4 de5 zhuang4tai4。"

msgid ""
"Sweeping your gaze over the gangers assembled before you, you identify the "
"owner of the voice: a leathery woman with wild hair and a mirthless smile."
msgstr ""
"你​的​目光​扫​过​聚集​在​面前​的​帮派​分子​，​并​认出​了​声音​的​主人​：​一个​皮肤​粗糙​、​头发​蓬乱​、​面​带​冷笑​的​女人​。\n"
"ni3 de5 mu4guang1 sao3 guo4 ju4ji2 zai4 mian4qian2 de5 bang1pai4 fen1zi3，bing4 ren4chu1 le5 sheng1yin1 de5 zhu3ren2：yi1ge5 pi2fu1 cu1cao1、tou2fa5 peng2luan4、mian4 dai4 leng3xiao4 de5 nu:3ren2。"

msgid "Sweet talk."
msgstr ""
"说点​好话​就行了​。\n"
"shuo1 dian3 hao3hua4 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid "Swipe"
msgstr ""
"挥击\n"
"hui1 ji1"

msgid "Switch Box 1"
msgstr ""
"开关​盒​1\n"
"kai1guan1 he2 1"

msgid "Switch Box 2"
msgstr ""
"开关​盒​2\n"
"kai1guan1 he2 2"

msgid "Switch Box 3"
msgstr ""
"开关​盒​3\n"
"kai1guan1 he2 3"

msgid "Synthacardium Mk 1 (Bioware)"
msgstr ""
"合成​心脏​Mk1​（​生体​改造​）\n"
"he2cheng2 xin1zang4 Mk1 （sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4）"

msgid "Synthacardium Mk 2 (Bioware)"
msgstr ""
