"The underworld stands between you and your goal, and the underworld is home to the murderous Billy."
msgstr ""
"请​把​这​当成​一个​警告​，​陌生人​。​如果​你​打算​闯入​那片​充满​牛奶​与​蜂蜜​的​乐土​，​你​将​面临​巨大​的​危险​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​冥界​横亘​在​你​与​目标​之间​，​而​冥界​正是​凶残​的​比利​盘踞​之地​。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ba3 zhe4 dang4cheng2 yi1ge5 jing3gao4，mo4sheng1ren2。ru2guo3 ni3 da3suan4 chuang3ru4 na4 pian1 chong1man3 niu2nai3 yu4 feng1mi4 de5 le4tu3，ni3 jiang1 mian4lin2 ju4da4 de5 wei1xian3！\n"
"\n"
"ming2jie4 heng2 gen4 zai4 ni3 yu4 mu4biao1 zhi1jian1，er2 ming2jie4 zheng4shi4 xiong1can2 de5 bi3li4 pan2ju4 zhi1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Take this in the spirit in which it is intended, but our teammates... they "
"know what they're doing, right?"
msgstr ""
"别误会​我​这话​的​意思​，​但​其他​队友​……​他们​知道​自己​在​做​什么​吧​？\n"
"bie4 wu4 hui4 wo3 zhe4 hua4 de5 yi4si5，dan4 qi2ta1 dui4you3……ta1men5 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5 ba1？"

msgid "Take your time. I'm not going to hurt you."
msgstr ""
"不用​急​。​我​没有​要害​你​的​意思​。\n"
"bu4yong4 ji2。wo3 mei2you3 yao4hai4 ni3 de5 yi4si5。"

msgid "Taken from Vauclair's computer system beneath his estate."
msgstr ""
"从​庄园​地下​沃​克莱尔​的​电脑系统​中​获取​。\n"
"cong2 zhuang1yuan2 di4xia4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 dian4 nao3 xi4 tong3 zhong4 huo4qu3。"

msgid ""
"Taken from his corpse. This probably unlocks something in the Rabengeister's"
" hideout."
msgstr ""
"从​他​的​尸体​上​获得​的​钥匙​。​也许​可以​解锁​鸦灵​藏身处​里​的​某些​东西​。\n"
"cong2 ta1 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 huo4de2 de5 yao4shi5。ye3xu3 ke3yi3 jie3suo3 Ya1ling2 cang2shen1chu4 li3 de5 mou3xie1 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Taken off a dead ganger, which seemed like a good idea at the time. Grants "
"+1 Quickness and +5 HP."
msgstr ""
"从​一名​死去​的​帮派​成员​身上​取​下​，​在​当时​看起来​是​个​不错​的​主意​。​提供​+​1​敏捷​和​+​5​生命​值​。\n"
"cong2 yi1 ming2 si3qu4 de5 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 shen1shang5 qu3 xia4，zai4 dang1shi2 kan4qi3lai5 shi4 ge4 bu4cuo4 de5 zhu3yi5。ti2gong1 +1 min3jie2 he4 +5 sheng1ming4 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"Taking a closer look, you notice something strange: there is a set of electrical contact plates lining the lip of the drone's cargo compartment.\n"
"\n"
"It's a fair bet that this thing is outfitted with an anti-tampering system of some kind."
msgstr ""
"仔细观察​后​，​你​发现​了​奇怪​之​处​：​无人机​货舱​边缘​安装​了​一组​电​触板​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可以​推测​，​这台​设备​很​可能​配备​了​某种​防​篡改​系统​。\n"
"\n"
"zi3 xi4 guan1 cha2 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 le5 qi2guai4 zhi1 chu3：wu2ren2ji1 huo4cang1 bian1yuan2 an1zhuang1 le5 yi1 zu3 dian4 chu4 ban3。\n"
"\n"
"ke3yi3 tui1ce4，zhe4 tai2 she4bei4 hen3 ke3neng2 pei4bei4 le5 mou3zhong3 fang2 cuan4gai3 xi4tong3。"

msgid "Talismonger's Door"
msgstr ""
"护身符​商店​门\n"
"hu4shen1fu2 shang1dian4 men2"

msgid "Talismonger's Shop"
msgstr ""
"护身符​商店\n"
"hu4shen1fu2 shang1dian4"

msgid "Talk"
msgstr ""
"对话\n"
"dui4hua4"

msgid "Talk to Amsel"
msgstr ""
"与​阿姆​泽尔​交谈\n"
"yu4 E1mu3ze2er3 jiao1tan2"

msgid "Talk to Frank"
msgstr ""
"与​弗兰克​交谈\n"
"yu4 fu2lan2ke4 jiao1tan2"

msgid "Talk to Maliit about playing back a DVD."
msgstr ""
"与​玛丽​特​谈谈​关于​回放​DVD​的​事​。\n"
"yu4 ma3li4 te4 tan2tan2 guan1yu2 hui2fang4 DVD de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Talk to me, Eiger. If something's put you on edge, I want to know what it "
"is."
msgstr ""
"和​我​聊聊吧​，​艾格尔​。​如果​有​什么​事​让​你​感到​紧张不安​，​我​得​知道​到底​是​什么​情况​。\n"
"he4 wo3 liao2 liao2 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。ru2guo3 you3 shen2me5 shi4 rang4 ni3 gan3dao4 jin3 zhang1 bu4 an1，wo3 de2 zhi1dao4 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 qing2kuang4。"

msgid "Talk to me, Monika. What are you trying to say?"
msgstr ""
"说​吧​，​莫妮卡​，​你​想​说​什么​？\n"
"shuo1 ba1，Mo4ni1ka3，ni3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid "Talk to you later, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"回头​再聊​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"hui2tou2 zai4 liao2，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"Talked to that exec. He'll fall in line, after he gets his pants thoroughly "
"dry-cleaned."
msgstr ""
"和​那个​高管​谈过​了​。​他​以后​会​老实​的​，​不过​他​得​先​把​自己​的​裤子​洗​干净​。\n"
"he4 na4ge5 gao1guan3 tan2 guo4 le5。ta1 yi3hou4 hui4 lao3shi5 de5，bu4guo4 ta1 de2 xian1 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 ku4zi5 xi3 gan1jing4。"

msgid "Tap into Camera System"
msgstr ""
"接入​监控​系统\n"
"jie1ru4 jian1kong4 xi4tong3"

msgid "Tar Bomb Lvl 1"
msgstr ""
"焦油​炸弹​I\n"
"jiao1you2 zha4dan4 I"

msgid "Tar Bomb Lvl 2"
msgstr ""
"焦油​炸弹​II\n"
"jiao1you2 zha4dan4 II"

msgid "Tar Bomb Lvl 3"
msgstr ""
"焦油​炸弹​III\n"
"jiao1you2 zha4dan4 III"

msgid "Tar: Cannot Move"
msgstr ""
"焦油​：​无法​移动\n"
"jiao1you2：wu2fa3 yi2dong4"

msgid "Target acquired."
msgstr ""
"已​锁定目标​。\n"
"yi3 suo3 ding4 mu4 biao1。"

msgid "Target becomes confused and changes faction for 2 RNDs."
msgstr ""
"目标​陷入​困惑​，​并​在​接下来​的​2​回合​内​改变​阵营​。\n"
"mu4biao1 xian4ru4 kun4huo4，bing4 zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 2 hui2he2 nei4 gai3bian4 zhen4ying2。"

msgid ""
"Target gains +2 Armor, up to the maximum Armor of 10. Lasts until combat "
"ends. Shares a cooldown with other Armor spells."
msgstr ""
"目标​获得​+​2​护甲​，​最高​可达​10​点​。​持续​到​战斗​结束​。​与​其他​“​护甲​”​类​法术​共享​冷却​时间​。\n"
"mu4biao1 huo4de2 +2 hu4jia3，zui4gao1 ke3 da2 10 dian3。chi2xu4 dao4 zhan4dou4 jie2shu4。yu4 qi2ta1“hu4jia3” lei4 fa3shu4 gong4xiang3 leng3que4 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Target gains +4 Armor, up to the maximum Armor of 10. Lasts until combat "
"ends. Shares a cooldown with other Armor spells."
msgstr ""
"目标​获得​+​4​护甲​，​最高​可达​10​点​。​持续​到​战斗​结束​。​与​其他​“​护甲​”​类​法术​共享​冷却​时间​。\n"
"mu4biao1 huo4de2 +4 hu4jia3，zui4gao1 ke3 da2 10 dian3。chi2xu4 dao4 zhan4dou4 jie2shu4。yu4 qi2ta1“hu4jia3” lei4 fa3shu4 gong4xiang3 leng3que4 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Target gains +6 Armor, up to the maximum Armor of 10. Lasts until combat "
"ends. Shares a cooldown with other Armor spells."
msgstr ""
"目标​获得​+​6​护甲​，​最高​可达​10​点​。​持续​到​战斗​结束​。​与​其他​“​护甲​”​类​法术​共享​冷却​时间​。\n"
"mu4biao1 huo4de2 +6 hu4jia3，zui4gao1 ke3 da2 10 dian3。chi2xu4 dao4 zhan4dou4 jie2shu4。yu4 qi2ta1“hu4jia3” lei4 fa3shu4 gong4xiang3 leng3que4 shi2jian1。"

msgid "Target ignores all enemies. Lasts 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"目标​忽略​所有​敌人​。​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"mu4biao1 hu1lu:e4 suo3you3 di2ren2。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid "Target is blinded and cannot see or attack targets. Lasts 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"目标​被​致盲​，​无法​看见​或​攻击​任一​目标​。​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"mu4biao1 bei4 zhi4 mang2，wu2fa3 kan4jian4 huo4 gong1ji1 ren4yi1 mu4biao1。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid "Target loses all AP and cannot attack or move. Lasts 1 RND."
msgstr ""
"目标​失去​所有​行动​点​，​无法​攻击​或​移动​。​持续​1​回合​。\n"
"mu4biao1 shi1qu4 suo3you3 xing2dong4 dian3，wu2fa3 gong1ji1 huo4 yi2dong4。chi2xu4 1 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Target loses all AP for 2 rounds and cannot attack or move. Lasts 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"目标​失去​所有​行动​点​，​无法​攻击​或​移动​。​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"mu4biao1 shi1qu4 suo3you3 xing2dong4 dian3，wu2fa3 gong1ji1 huo4 yi2dong4。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid "Target spotted, activating remote control rig."
msgstr ""
"发现​目标​，​启动​远程​控制​装置​。\n"
"fa1xian4 mu4biao1，qi3dong4 yuan3cheng2 kong4zhi4 zhuang1zhi4。"

msgid "Target spotted, engaging!"
msgstr ""
"发现​目标​，​开始​交火​！\n"
"fa1xian4 mu4biao1，kai1shi3 jiao1huo3！"

msgid "Target switches to your team and attacks your enemies. Lasts 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"目标​加入​你​的​队伍​并​攻击​你​的​敌人​。​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"mu4biao1 jia1ru4 ni3 de5 dui4wu3 bing4 gong1ji1 ni3 de5 di2ren2。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid "Target two enemies and then open fire on both."
msgstr ""
"锁定​两个​敌人​，​然后​同时​对​它们​开火​。\n"
"suo3ding4 liang3 ge4 di2ren2，ran2hou4 tong2shi2 dui4 ta1men5 kai1huo3。"

msgid ""
"Target up to 4 enemies and then open fire on all of them. -5% Accuracy. Must"
" have at least three targets. Cooldown: 5"
msgstr ""
"最​多​锁定​4​个​敌人​，​然后​向​所有​目标​开火​。​精准度​减少​5​%​。​至少​需要​锁定​三个​目标​。​冷却​时间​：​5​回合​。\n"
"zui4 duo1 suo3ding4 4 ge4 di2ren2，ran2hou4 xiang4 suo3you3 mu4biao1 kai1huo3。jing1 zhun3 du4 jian3shao3 5 %。zhi4shao3 xu1yao4 suo3ding4 san1 ge4 mu4biao1。leng3que4 shi2jian1：5 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"Targets an area with your current weapon and selected ability. This ends "
"your turn. An enemy who moves or attacks while in this area will be counter-"
"attacked."
msgstr ""
"以​当前​武器​和​所选​能力​警戒​一个​区域​。​此​操作​会​结束​你​的​回合​，​之后​敌人​在​该​区域​内​移动​或​攻击​时​将​遭到​反击​。\n"
"yi3 dang1qian2 wu3qi4 he4 suo3 xuan3 neng2li4 jing3jie4 yi1ge5 qu1yu4。ci3 cao1zuo4 hui4 jie2shu4 ni3 de5 hui2he2，zhi1hou4 di2ren2 zai4 gai1 qu1yu4 nei4 yi2dong4 huo4 gong1ji1 shi2 jiang1 zao1dao4 fan3ji1。"

msgid "Taser"
msgstr ""
"电击​枪\n"
"dian4ji1 qiang1"

msgid ""
"Taser: A popular weapon with law enforcement. Its darts trail a wire, "
"allowing a powerful shock to be delivered."
msgstr ""
"电击​枪​：​执法​部门​常用​的​武器​。​其​发射​的​飞镖​拖曳​着​导线​，​可​传导​强力​电击​。\n"
"dian4ji1 qiang1：zhi2fa3 bu4men2 chang2yong4 de5 wu3qi4。qi2 fa1she4 de5 fei1biao1 tuo1ye4 zhao2 dao3xian4，ke3 chuan2dao3 qiang2li4 dian4ji1。"

msgid ""
"Taser: The Pulsar has a higher capacity and range than the standard taser."
msgstr ""
"电击​枪​：​脉冲星​的​弹​容量​和​射程​均​大于​标准​电击​枪​。\n"
"dian4ji1 qiang1：mai4chong1xing1 de5 dan4 rong2liang4 he4 she4cheng2 jun1 da4yu2 biao1zhun3 dian4ji1 qiang1。"

msgid "Tattoo magic, huh? That's a new one on me."
msgstr ""
"纹身​魔法​？​这倒​是​新鲜​玩意儿​。\n"
"wen2shen1 mo2fa3？zhe4 dao3 shi4 xin1xian1 wan2yi4r5。"

msgid ""
"Taunt all you want. If I get out of here... you'll wish you'd never set foot"
" in the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"随便​你​怎么​挑衅​吧​。​等​我​离开​这里​之后​……​你​会​后悔​自己​曾经​踏足​过​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 tiao3xin4 ba1。deng3 wo3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 zhi1hou4……ni3 hui4 hou4hui3 zi4ji3 ceng2jing1 ta4zu2 guo4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid "Taylor Nguyen"
msgstr ""
"泰勒​·​阮\n"
"tai4le4 · ruan3"

msgid "Team leader, badass decker, and one of the best runners in the Flux."
msgstr ""
"团队​领袖​，​屌​炸天​的​碟​客​，​以及​动荡​带中​最出色​的​狂奔​者​之一​。\n"
"tuan2dui4 ling3xiu4，diao3 zha2 tian1 de5 die2 ke4，yi3ji2 dong4dang4 dai4 zhong4 zui4 chu1 se4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 zhi1yi1。"

msgid "Tech Vendor"
msgstr ""
"科技​制品​小贩\n"
"ke1ji4 zhi4pin3 xiao3fan4"

msgid "Tech. Decks, rigs, drones... that kind of thing."
msgstr ""
"软硬件​相关​的​。​碟板​、​工具​、​无人机​……​这​类​玩意儿​。\n"
"ruan3ying4jian4 xiang1guan1 de5。die2 ban3、gong1ju4、wu2ren2ji1……zhe4 lei4 wan2yi4r5。"

msgid ""
"Technically I'm the barista, but like I said before, ears and hands. \n"
"\n"
"I run his errands, I gather gossip, and sometimes I even make coffee. "
msgstr ""
"理论​上​讲​我​是​服务生​，​但​我​之前​也​说​了​，​我​是​他​的​耳目​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​帮​他​跑腿​，​收集​各种​传言​，​有时候​甚至​还​得​动手​泡​咖啡​。\n"
"\n"
"li3lun4 shang4 jiang3 wo3 shi4 fu2wu4sheng1，dan4 wo3 zhi1qian2 ye3 shuo1 le5，wo3 shi4 ta1 de5 er3mu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bang1 ta1 pao3tui3，shou1ji2 ge4zhong3 chuan2yan2，you3shi2hou5 shen4zhi4 hai2 de2 dong4shou3 pao1 ka1fei1。"

msgid ""
"Technically, we completed the job.\n"
"\n"
"Enstad is dead, after all."
msgstr ""
"理论​上​讲​，​我们​完成​了​任务​，​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​，​恩施​塔德​已经​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"li3lun4 shang4 jiang3，wo3men5 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5，\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4，en1Shi1ta3de2 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Technically, we completed the job.\n"
"\n"
"Our target is dead, after all."
msgstr ""
"理论​上​讲​，​我们​完成​了​任务​，​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​，​目标​已经​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"li3lun4 shang4 jiang3，wo3men5 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5，\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4，mu4biao1 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Teenagers, mostly. Sixteen through eighteen, though there is the rare "
"exception."
msgstr ""
"大多​是​青少年​。​从​十六岁​到​十八岁​，​但​也​有​极少数​例外​。\n"
"da4duo1 shi4 qing1shao4nian2。cong2 shi2 liu4 sui4 dao4 shi2 ba1 sui4，dan4 ye3 you3 ji2shao3shu4 li4wai4。"

msgid "Tell Philip the Quarantine is Over"
msgstr ""
"告诉​菲利普​隔离​结束​了\n"
"gao4su4 fei1li4pu3 ge2li2 jie2shu4 le5"

msgid "Tell her to ask me for help. Nicely."
msgstr ""
"让​她​来说​。​而且​要​摆正​态度​。\n"
"rang4 ta1 lai2 shuo1。er2qie3 yao4 bai3 zheng1 tai4du5。"

msgid ""
"Tell it to someone else. I'm just here to watch the door while you're gone."
msgstr ""
"关​我​屁事​。​我​就是​来​负责​在​你​离开​的​期间​看好​大门​。\n"
"guan1 wo3 pi4shi4。wo3 jiu4shi4 lai2 fu4ze2 zai4 ni3 li2kai1 de5 qi1jian1 kan1hao3 da4men2。"

msgid ""
"Tell it to someone who cares. I'm just here to watch the door while you're "
"gone."
msgstr ""
"关​我​屁事​。​我​就是​来​负责​在​你​离开​的​期间​看好​大门​。\n"
"guan1 wo3 pi4shi4。wo3 jiu4shi4 lai2 fu4ze2 zai4 ni3 li2kai1 de5 qi1jian1 kan1hao3 da4men2。"

msgid "Tell me *which* corporation, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我​是​*​哪个​*​公司​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 shi4*na3ge5*gong1si1，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid "Tell me about it. But hey, the job's the job."
msgstr ""
"可不是​嘛​。​但​工作​就是​工作​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。dan4 gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid "Tell me about the Dragonslayer."
msgstr ""
"和​我​说​说​屠龙​者​。\n"
"he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 tu2 long2 zhe3。"

msgid "Tell me about the foulness."
msgstr ""
"和​我​说​说​那​污秽​之物​。\n"
"he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 na4 wu1hui4 zhi1 wu4。"

msgid "Tell me about the gang that used to run the hotel."
msgstr ""
"跟​我​讲讲​之前​经营​旅馆​的​那个​帮派​。\n"
"gen1 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 zhi1qian2 jing1ying2 lu:3guan3 de5 na4ge5 bang1pai4。"

msgid "Tell me about the man."
msgstr ""
"和​我​说​说​那​男人​。\n"
"he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 na4 nan2ren2。"

msgid "Tell me about the woman."
msgstr ""
"和​我​说​说​那​女人​。\n"
"he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 na4 nu:3ren2。"

msgid ""
"Tell me about this quest of yours, good $(scene.badfantasy). Leave nothing to the imagination!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He leans forward, smiling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You have my rapt attention."
msgstr ""
"把​你​的​任务​告诉​我​，​$(scene.badfantasy)​。​不要​有​任何​隐瞒​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向前​倾身​，​微笑​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​全神贯注​地​聆听​。\n"
"\n"
"ba3 ni3 de5 ren4wu5 gao4su4 wo3，$(scene.badfantasy)。bu4yao4 you3 ren4he2 yin3man2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，wei1xiao4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 quan2shen2guan4zhu4 de5 ling2ting1。"

msgid "Tell me about your \"peasantry.\""
msgstr ""
"和​我​说​说​你​的​“​臣民​”​。\n"
"he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 ni3 de5“chen2min2”。"

msgid "Tell me about your team."
msgstr ""
"给​我​讲讲​你​当年​的​小队​吧​。\n"
"gei3 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 ni3 dang1nian2 de5 xiao3 dui4 ba1。"

msgid "Tell me anything you can about this place."
msgstr ""
"跟​我​讲讲​你​对​这​地方​的​了解​。\n"
"gen1 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 ni3 dui4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 liao3jie3。"

msgid "Tell me everything you know about Bloodline."
msgstr ""
"把​你​对​“​血脉​”​项目​了解​的​一切​都​告诉​我​。\n"
"ba3 ni3 dui4“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 liao3jie3 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "Tell me how you got your street name."
msgstr ""
"给​我​讲讲​你​的​绰号​是​怎么​来​的​吧​。\n"
"gei3 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 ni3 de5 chuo4hao4 shi4 zen3me5 lai2 de5 ba1。"

msgid "Tell me more about the Communion."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我​更​多​关于​共​融会​的​事情​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 geng1 duo1 guan1yu2 gong4 rong2hui4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "Tell me more about the Euro Wars."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我​更​多​关于​欧洲​战争​的​事情​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 geng1 duo1 guan1yu2 ou1zhou1 zhan4zheng1 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "Tell me more about this shrine."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我​更​多​关于​这个​神龛​的​事情​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 geng1 duo1 guan1yu2 zhe4ge5 shen2kan1 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "Tell me more."
msgstr ""
"再​多​说些​。\n"
"zai4 duo1 shuo1 xie1。"

msgid ""
"Tell me something I don't know.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger slaps the side of the van.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pile in, people. And $(l.name)... when we get back to the Kreuzbasar, we're gonna have a little talk."
msgstr ""
"这​还​用​你​说​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​一掌​拍​在​货车​的​侧门​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大家​赶紧​上车​。​还有​，​$(l.name)​……​等​回​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​我们​得​好好​谈谈​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 yong4 ni3 shuo1 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yi1 zhang3 pai1 zai4 huo4che1 de5 ce4men2 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4jia1 gan3jin3 shang4che1。hai2you3，$(l.name)……deng3 hui2 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，wo3men5 de2 hao3hao3 tan2tan2。"

msgid "Tell me something, Grinder. Why did you want Hasenkamp dead?"
msgstr ""
"“​绞肉机​”​，​跟​我​说​说​，​你​为什么​要​搞​死​哈森​坎普​？\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1”，gen1 wo3 shuo1 shuo1，ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 gao3 si3 Ha1sen1kan3pu3？"

msgid "Tell me the truth, Blitz. Did you know anything about this?"
msgstr ""
"跟​我​说实话​，​布里​茨​。​你​对​这事​有​什么​了解​吗​？\n"
"gen1 wo3 shuo1shi2hua4，Bu4li3ci2。ni3 dui4 zhe4 shi4 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Tell me what the point of this was, Audran. Convince me that any of this was"
" worth it."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我​这​到底​有​什么​意义​，​奥​德兰​。​说服​我​这​其中​有​任何​值得​的​部分​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 zhe4 dao4di3 you3 shen2me5 yi4yi4，Ao4de2lan2。shuo1fu2 wo3 zhe4 qi2zhong1 you3 ren4he2 zhi2de5 de5 bu4fen5。"

msgid "Tell me what this has to do with me."
msgstr ""
"跟​我​说​说​这​和​我​有​什么​关系​。\n"
"gen1 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 zhe4 he4 wo3 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5。"

msgid "Tell me what you did to Monika."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我​你​当初​对​莫妮卡​做​了​什么​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 ni3 dang1chu1 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 zuo4 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid "Tell me what you know about Feuerschwinge."
msgstr ""
"和​我​说​说​你​对​火翼​的​了解​。\n"
"he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 ni3 dui4 Huo3yi4 de5 liao3jie3。"

msgid "Tell me what you've heard about them."
msgstr ""
"那​给​我​讲讲​你​知道​的​。\n"
"na4 gei3 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 ni3 zhi1dao4 de5。"

msgid "Tell me what you've heard from your friends in Spain."
msgstr ""
"和​我​说​说​你​在​西班牙​的​朋友​都​和​你​讲​了​什么​。\n"
"he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 ni3 zai4 xi1ban1ya2 de5 peng2you5 dou1 he4 ni3 jiang3 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid "Tell me what's going on, Alice. Now."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我出​了​什么​事​，​爱丽丝​。​快点​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 chu1 le5 shen2me5 shi4，ai4li4si1。kuai4dian3。"

msgid "Tell me whatever you can about the gang that's taken over the hotel."
msgstr ""
"你​对​目前​接管​旅馆​的​帮派​有​什么​了解​吗​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 mu4qian2 jie1guan3 lu:3guan3 de5 bang1pai4 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3 ma5？"

msgid "Tell me who did this to you."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我​是​谁​对​你​做​了​这些​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 shi4 shei2 dui4 ni3 zuo4 le5 zhe4xie1。"

msgid "Tell me, $(l.name): which would *you* rather be? "
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​那​你​说说看​：​*​你​*​会​怎么​选​？\n"
"$(l.name)，na4 ni3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4：*ni3*hui4 zen3me5 xuan3？"

msgid "Tell me."
msgstr ""
"告诉​我​。\n"
"gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "Tell the Displaced Metahumans that it's safe to go home"
msgstr ""
"告诉​流离失所​的​泛​人类​他们​可以​安全​回家\n"
"gao4su4 liu2li2shi1suo3 de5 fan4 ren2lei4 ta1men5 ke3yi3 an1quan2 hui2jia1"

msgid ""
"Tell them whatever you like. By this time tomorrow, this place won't exist "
"any more."
msgstr ""
"随便​你​说​什么​都行​。​到​明天​这个​时候​，​这里​就​不复存在​了​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 shuo1 shen2me5 dou1 xing2。dao4 ming2tian1 zhe4ge5 shi2hou5，zhe4li3 jiu4 bu4 fu4 cun2 zai4 le5。"

msgid "Tell us what you need us to do."
msgstr ""
"你​需要​我们​做​什么​？\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 wo3men5 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Tell us what you've brought for us, Bannik."
msgstr ""
"班尼克​，​告诉​我们​这​里面​是​什么​。\n"
"ban1 ni2 ke4，gao4su4 wo3men5 zhe4 li3mian4 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid "Tell us who sent you to Schattennest!"
msgstr ""
"说​，​是​谁​派​你​来​影巢​的​！\n"
"shuo1，shi4 shei2 pai4 ni3 lai2 ying3 chao2 de5！"

msgid "Tell us who you're working for, and it's all yours."
msgstr ""
"把​你​的​雇主​告诉​我们​，​它​就​归​你​了​。\n"
"ba3 ni3 de5 gu4zhu3 gao4su4 wo3men5，ta1 jiu4 gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid "Tell you what, you help me out of here, and I'll... see what I can do."
msgstr ""
"这样​吧​，​你​帮​我​离开​这里​，​然后​……​我会​尽力而为​。\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1，ni3 bang1 wo3 li2kai1 zhe4li3，ran2hou4……wo3 hui4 jin4li4er2wei2。"

msgid ""
"Tell you what: I'll let you know when I'm ready to move on, and until then, "
"you'll stop badgering me about it. Deal?"
msgstr ""
"你​听​好​了​，​走​不​走​是​我​说了算​的​，​你​少​对​我​指手画脚​的​。​听到​没​？\n"
"ni3 ting1 hao3 le5，zou3 bu4 zou3 shi4 wo3 shuo1le5suan4 de5，ni3 shao3 dui4 wo3 zhi3shou3hua4jiao3 de5。ting1dao4 mei2？"

msgid ""
"Tell you what: I'll look past the fact that you just insulted me if you'll "
"step aside."
msgstr ""
"这样​吧​：​如果​你​让开​，​我​就​不​计较​你​刚才​侮辱​我​的​事​。\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1：ru2guo3 ni3 rang4kai1，wo3 jiu4 bu4 ji4jiao4 ni3 gang1cai2 wu3ru3 wo3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Tell your Lodge contact that the failure of the run is on me. Ask if they'll"
" give you a do-over."
msgstr ""
"你​去​和​“​结社​”​的​联络人​说​，​这次​行动​失败​都​是因为​我​。​让​他们​再​给​你​一次​机会​。\n"
"ni3 qu4 he4“jie2she4” de5 lian2luo4ren2 shuo1，zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 shi1bai4 dou1 shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3。rang4 ta1men5 zai4 gei3 ni3 yi1ci4 ji1hui4。"

msgid ""
"Tell your friends that I've changed my mind. Their feedings will resume directly, at no additional cost.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a click as he disconnects the line.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"跟​你​的​朋友​们​说​，​我​改​主意​了​。​它们​会​继续​得到​食物​，​无需​额外​费用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​咔哒​一声​，​他​挂断​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"gen1 ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 shuo1，wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5。ta1men5 hui4 ji4xu4 de2dao4 shi2wu4，wu2xu1 e2wai4 fei4yong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ka3 da1 yi1sheng1，ta1 gua4duan4 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Teller Area Door"
msgstr ""
"出纳​区门\n"
"chu1na4 qu1 men2"

msgid "Teller Door Control"
msgstr ""
"出纳​区门​控制\n"
"chu1na4 qu1 men2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Temporarily Scrambled!"
msgstr ""
"暂时​被​干扰​！\n"
"zan4shi2 bei4 gan1rao3！"

msgid "Temporarily overload a target's optic nerves."
msgstr ""
"暂时​过载​目标​的​视神经​。\n"
"zan4shi2 guo4zai4 mu4biao1 de5 shi4shen2jing1。"

msgid ""
"Tempting. But like you said, I've already kicked the holy hell out of them. Twice.\n"
"\n"
"If I'm gonna do this, it needs to be a step forward. The Dragonslayer won't be satisfied with me retreading old ground."
msgstr ""
"这​主意​挺​诱人​的​，​但​如​你​所言​，​我​之前​可是​把​他们​打了个​落花流水​，​而且​还是​两次​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​做​就​得​一步到位​。​还​这么​保守​的话​，​屠龙​者​肯定​不会​满意​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhu3yi5 ting3 you4ren2 de5，dan4 ru2 ni3 suo3 yan2，wo3 zhi1qian2 ke3shi4 ba3 ta1men5 da3 le5 ge4 luo4hua1liu2shui3，er2qie3 hai2shi5 liang3 ci4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 zuo4 jiu4 de2 yi1bu4dao4wei4。hai2 zhe4me5 bao3shou3 de5hua4，tu2 long2 zhe3 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 man3yi4。"

msgid "Terminal"
msgstr ""
"终端\n"
"zhong1duan1"

msgid "Terminal active."
msgstr ""
"终端​激活​。\n"
"zhong1duan1 ji1huo2。"

msgid "Test Subject"
msgstr ""
"实验​体\n"
"shi2yan4 ti3"

msgid "Test subjects?"
msgstr ""
"实验​体​？\n"
"shi2yan4 ti3？"

msgid ""
"Th-they do not tell me these things. All I know is that they w-w-want to store things here.\n"
"\n"
"Crates. Boxes. Shipped in f-f-from all over. No cargo inspections, and no t-t-traces back to th-them."
msgstr ""
"他​-​他们​没有​告诉​我​这些​事情​。​我​只​知道​他​-​他们​想​把​东西​存放​在​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​木箱​。​纸箱​。​从​各地​运来​的​。​没有​货物​检查​，​也​没有​任何​线索​可以​追溯到​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 -ta1men5 mei2you3 gao4su4 wo3 zhe4xie1 shi4qing5。wo3 zhi3 zhi1dao4 ta1 -ta1men5 xiang3 ba3 dong1xi1 cun2fang4 zai4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"mu4 xiang1。zhi3xiang1。cong2 ge4di4 yun4 lai2 de5。mei2you3 huo4wu4 jian3cha2，ye3 mei2you3 ren4he2 xian4suo3 ke3yi3 dui1 su4 dao4 ta1men5。"

msgid "Thank *you,* $(l.sir)! Have a great day!"
msgstr ""
"是​我​要​谢谢​*​你​*​，​$(l.sir)​！​祝​你​今天​愉快​！\n"
"shi4 wo3 yao4 xie4xie5*ni3*，$(l.sir)！zhu4 ni3 jin1tian1 yu2kuai4！"

msgid "Thank Christ for that."
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​。\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。"

msgid "Thank Christ that's over with. You okay, Alexander?"
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​，​总算​结束​了​。​你​还好​吗​，​亚历山大​？\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4，zong3suan4 jie2shu4 le5。ni3 hai2hao3 ma5，ya4li4shan1da4？"

msgid ""
"Thank God for that.\n"
"\n"
"I hate to admit it, Blitz, but you did good back there."
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​布里​茨​，​虽然​我们​不太​对付​，​但​你​还​算​有点​本事​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，sui1ran2 wo3men5 bu4 tai4 dui4fu5，dan4 ni3 hai2 suan4 you3dian3 ben3shi4。"

msgid "Thank God."
msgstr ""
"谢天谢地​。\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。"

msgid "Thank you for everything, and be careful out there."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​做​的​一切​。​在​外面​多​保重​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4。zai4 wai4mian4 duo1 bao3zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Thank you for joining us. We are coming to you live from the ruins of Sangerhausen, the fifth Harz Mountain town to be sacked by the dragon Feuerschwinge.\n"
"\n"
"Standing by my side is the head of Diehl Defense, Dr. Adrian Vauclair. Doctor Vauclair has been hailed as a leader in the effort to bring down Feuerschwinge and end her reign of terror."
msgstr ""
"感谢​各位​的​收看​，​我们​正在​桑格​豪森​的​废墟​上​为​您​进行​现场直播​，​这是​第五个​被​巨龙​火翼​破坏​的​哈尔茨​山区​城镇​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​站​在​我​身边​的​是​迪尔​防务​的​负责人​，​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。​沃​克莱尔​博士​被誉为​打倒​火翼​并​结束​其​恐怖​统治​的​领导者​。\n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ge4wei4 de5 shou1kan4，wo3men5 zheng4zai4 sang1 ge2 hao2 sen1 de5 fei4xu1 shang4 wei2 nin2 jin4xing2 xian4chang3zhi2bo1，zhe4 shi4 di4 wu3 ge4 bei4 ju4long2 Huo3yi4 po4huai4 de5 Ha1er3ci2 shan1qu1 cheng2zhen4。\n"
"\n"
"zhan4 zai4 wo3 shen1bian1 de5 shi4 Di2er3fang2wu4 de5 fu4ze2ren2，E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 bei4 yu4 wei2 da3dao3 Huo3yi4 bing4 jie2shu4 qi2 kong3bu4 tong3zhi4 de5 ling3dao3zhe3。"

msgid ""
"Thank you for your understanding.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory stares at you through cold, dead eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, let's get back to the job at hand, shall we?"
msgstr ""
"感谢​你​的​理解​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽用​冰冷​而​死寂​的​双眼​凝视着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我们​还是​先忙​完​手头​的​差事​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 de5 li3jie3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yong4 bing1leng3 er2 si3ji4 de5 shuang1yan3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 hai2shi5 xian1 mang2 wan2 shou3tou2 de5 cha4shi4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Thank you my friend, I have a buyer already in mind for this little gem. Or "
"perhaps I shall keep it myself, it is good to always have something special "
"on hand for a celebration!"
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​我​的​朋友​。​我​已经​在​心里​为​这件​宝贝​想​好​买家​了​。​不过​说不定​还是​留给​我​自己​吧​，​逢年过节​手头​备点​特别​的​东西​总​没错​！\n"
"xie4 le5，wo3 de5 peng2you5。wo3 yi3jing1 zai4 xin1li5 wei2 zhe4 jian4 bao3bei4 xiang3 hao3 mai3jia1 le5。bu4guo4 shuo1bu5ding4 hai2shi5 liu2gei3 wo3 zi4ji3 ba1，feng2nian2guo4jie2 shou3tou2 bei4 dian3 te4bie2 de5 dong1xi1 zong3 mei2cuo4！"

msgid "Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""
"非常感谢​！\n"
"fei1chang2gan3xie4！"

msgid "Thank you so much! I won't forget this."
msgstr ""
"太​谢谢​了​！​我​不会​忘记​你​的​好意​。\n"
"tai4 xie4xie5 le5！wo3 bu4hui4 wang4ji4 ni3 de5 hao3yi4。"

msgid "Thank you so much, ma'am. Thanks for bringing her back to us."
msgstr ""
"太​感谢​你​了​，​女士​。​谢谢​你​把​她​带回​我们​身边​。\n"
"tai4 gan3xie4 ni3 le5，nu:3shi4。xie4xie5 ni3 ba3 ta1 dai4hui2 wo3men5 shen1bian1。"

msgid "Thank you so much, man. Thanks for bringing her back to us."
msgstr ""
"太​感谢​你​了​，​老兄​。​谢谢​你​把​她​带回​我们​身边​。\n"
"tai4 gan3xie4 ni3 le5，lao3xiong1。xie4xie5 ni3 ba3 ta1 dai4hui2 wo3men5 shen1bian1。"

msgid ""
"Thank you so much, topsider.\n"
"\n"
"This means more to us than you can know."
msgstr ""
"非常感谢​你​，​上层​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​对​我们​来说​意义​非凡​。\n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2gan3xie4 ni3，shang4ceng2 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 yi4yi4 fei1fan2。"

msgid "Thank you! I'm as good as gone!"
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​！​那​我​马上​就​走​！\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3！na4 wo3 ma3shang4 jiu4 zou3！"

msgid ""
"Thank you! Thank you so much! \n"
"\n"
"There aren't many people left that'd put themselves in danger to help a bunch of strangers."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​！​真的​非常感谢​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​愿意​为了​帮助​一群​陌生人​而​冒险​的​人​，​现在​已经​不多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3！zhen1de5 fei1chang2gan3xie4！\n"
"\n"
"yuan4yi4 wei4le5 bang1zhu4 yi1 qun2 mo4sheng1ren2 er2 mao4xian3 de5 ren2，xian4zai4 yi3jing1 bu4 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thank you, $(l.name). You can tell our friends that their feedings will "
"resume within the next day or two."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​$(l.name)​。​你​可以​跟​你​的​朋友​们​说​，​接下来​的​一两天​里​，​它们​的​食物​就​会​恢复​供应​。\n"
"xie4xie5，$(l.name)。ni3 ke3yi3 gen1 ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 shuo1，jie1xia4lai2 de5 yi1 liang3 tian1 li3，ta1men5 de5 shi2wu4 jiu4 hui4 hui1fu4 gong1ying4。"

msgid "Thank you, $(l.sir). I will be brief."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​$(l.sir)​。​我​尽量​简短​说完​。\n"
"xie4xie5，$(l.sir)。wo3 jin3liang4 jian3duan3 shuo1 wan2。"

msgid ""
"Thank you, Doctor. I'm still going to kill you, of course... but thanks for "
"listening to reason."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​博士​。​当然​，​我​还是​得​杀​了​你​……​但​感谢​你​能​恢复​理智​。\n"
"xie4xie5，bo2shi4。dang1ran2，wo3 hai2shi5 de2 sha1 le5 ni3……dan4 gan3xie4 ni3 neng2 hui1fu4 li3zhi4。"

msgid "Thank you, Marta."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​，​玛​尔塔​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，Ma3er3ta3。"

msgid "Thank you, Paul Amsel. For everything."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​，​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​。​谢谢​你​为​我们​所​做​的​一切​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3。xie4xie5 ni3 wei2 wo3men5 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid "Thank you, dear. (w)"
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"xie4xie5，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Thank you, fearless leader. Both for the chat, and for the assist on the run.\n"
"\n"
"Is there anything else that you wanted to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"也​谢谢​你​，​无畏​领袖​。​不仅​是因为​聊天​，​也​因为​你​在​行动​中​的​支援​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​别的​事要​聊​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ye3 xie4xie5 ni3，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。bu4jin3 shi4 yin1 wei2 liao2tian1，ye3 yin1wei4 ni3 zai4 xing2dong4 zhong4 de5 zhi1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 liao2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Thank you, friend, but no. We have grown as much as I am comfortable with for one year, and you have done quite enough already.\n"
"\n"
"Know that you have positively impacted the lives of a great many Kreuzbasar residents, $(l.name). Be proud of that fact."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​，​朋友​，​但​不必​了​。​我们​的​发展​已经​达到​了​我​这​一年​所​能​接受​的​程度​，​而且​你​已经​做得够​多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​知道​，​你​已经​对​许多​克洛伊​茨​集市​居民​的​生活​产生​了​积极​的​影响​，​$(l.name)​。​请​为此​感到​骄傲​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，peng2you5，dan4 bu4bi4 le5。wo3men5 de5 fa1zhan3 yi3jing1 da2dao4 le5 wo3 zhe4 yi1 nian2 suo3 neng2 jie1shou4 de5 cheng2du4，er2qie3 ni3 yi3jing1 zuo4 de2 gou4 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 zhi1dao4，ni3 yi3jing1 dui4 xu3duo1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ju1min2 de5 sheng1huo2 chan3sheng1 le5 ji1ji2 de5 ying3xiang3，$(l.name)。qing3 wei4ci3 gan3dao4 jiao1ao4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Thank you, my friend. You have granted me the secret desire that my heart yearned for most: a respectable supply of non-organ-based foods.\n"
"\n"
"You will always be welcome in these hallowed halls. I, Philip Rex, do so swear it."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​，​我​的​朋友​。​你​赐予​了​我​内心​最​渴望​的​秘密​愿望​：​一份​令人满意​的​非​有机​食物​储备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​永远​是​这​神圣​殿堂​的​贵客​。​我​，​菲利普​·​雷克斯​，​再次​庄严​发誓​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，wo3 de5 peng2you5。ni3 ci4yu3 le5 wo3 nei4xin1 zui4 ke3wang4 de5 mi4mi4 yuan4wang4：yi1 fen4 ling4ren2man3yi4 de5 fei1 you3ji1 shi2wu4 chu3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong3yuan3 shi4 zhe4 shen2sheng4 dian4tang2 de5 gui4 ke4。wo3，fei1li4pu3 · lei2ke4si1，zai4ci4 zhuang1yan2 fa1shi4。"

msgid "Thank you, noble sir. It would be an honor."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​，​高贵​的​先生​。​这​将​是​我​的​荣幸​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，gao1gui4 de5 xian1sheng5。zhe4 jiang1 shi4 wo3 de5 rong2xing4。"

msgid "Thank you, sir, for taking the time to speak with us. "
msgstr ""
"先生​，​谢谢​你​为​我们​讲述​这些​。\n"
"xian1sheng5，xie4xie5 ni3 wei2 wo3men5 jiang3shu4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid "Thank you, spirit. I have another question."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​，​精魂​。​我​有​别的​问题​要​问​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，jing1hun2。wo3 you3 bie2de5 wen4ti2 yao4 wen4。"

msgid "Thank you, topsider... thank you."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​，​上层​人​……​太​感谢​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，shang4ceng2 ren2……tai4 gan3xie4 le5。"

msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。\n"
"xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"Thank you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He struggles back to his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I think that I can make it out of here on my own. My truck isn't far from here."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挣扎​着​站​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​想​我​能​自己​离开​这里​。​我​的​卡车​就​在​附近​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zheng1zha2 zhao2 zhan4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 xiang3 wo3 neng2 zi4ji3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。wo3 de5 ka3che1 jiu4 zai4 fu4jin4。"

msgid ""
"Thank you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gives you a small smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I never thought I'd be in a situation like this. Frankly, I'm terrified."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​略微​投​来​一抹​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从​没想到​自己​会​落入​这种​境地​。​说实话​，​我​挺​害怕​的​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lu:e4wei1 tou2 lai2 yi1 ma1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2 mei2xiang3dao4 zi4ji3 hui4 luo4ru4 zhe4zhong3 jing4di4。shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 ting3 hai4pa4 de5。"

msgid "Thank you. (w)"
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。\n"
"xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"Thank you. And now, if you'll excuse us, we need to continue our sweep."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​如果​你​不介意​的话​，​我们​要​继续​巡视​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4，wo3men5 yao4 ji4xu4 xun2shi4 le5。"

msgid "Thank you. Anything else then?"
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​还有​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"xie4xie5。hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Thank you. Do you have my pay?"
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​我​的​报酬​在​哪​？\n"
"xie4xie5。wo3 de5 bao4chou5 zai4 na3？"

msgid "Thank you. Oh, thank you. I don't know what else I would do."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​太​谢谢​你​了​。​要是​不能​待​在​这里​，​我​可不​知道​该​怎么办​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5。tai4 xie4xie5 ni3 le5。yao4shi5 bu4neng2 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3，wo3 ke3bu5 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5ban4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thank you. We can breathe easier knowing that it's being taken care of."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​这样一来​，​我们​也​总算​能​松口气​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，wo3men5 ye3 zong3suan4 neng2 song1 kou3 qi4 le5。"

msgid "Thank you. We'll take our leave of you now."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​我们​就此​告辞​。\n"
"xie4xie5。wo3men5 jiu4ci3 gao4ci2。"

msgid "Thank you. You've been a great help."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​你​帮​大忙​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5。ni3 bang1 dai4 mang2 le5。"

msgid "Thank you. You've been very cooperative."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​你​很​配合​。\n"
"xie4xie5。ni3 hen3 pei4he2。"

msgid ""
"Thankfully, I am rather well protected down here. Living in a contained "
"environment has its advantages."
msgstr ""
"值得​庆幸​的​是​，​我​在​这儿​相当​安全​。​生活​在​封闭​环境​中有​其​优势​。\n"
"zhi2de5 qing4xing4 de5 shi4，wo3 zai4 zhe4r5 xiang1dang1 an1quan2。sheng1huo2 zai4 feng1bi4 huan2jing4 zhong4 you3 qi2 you1shi4。"

msgid ""
"Thankfully, I don't need that much of it to make the balm.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She dips a metallic fingertip into the jar and begins to stir.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The boundaries between the material world and the astral plane are weak here. This stuff acts sort of like a lens... it focuses your perceptions. Makes the haze real."
msgstr ""
"还好​，​制作​这份​药膏​不​需要​那么​多​原料​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​将​金属​指尖​伸入​罐中​，​开始​搅拌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现实​与​星界​之间​的​边界​在​这里​很​薄弱​。​这​药膏​就​像​透镜​……​能​聚焦​你​的​感知​，​让​那些​迷雾​笼罩​之下​的​事物​变得​真实​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2hao3，zhi4zuo4 zhe4 fen4 yao4gao1 bu4 xu1yao4 na4me5 duo1 yuan2liao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 jin1shu3 zhi3jian1 shen1 ru4 guan4 zhong4，kai1shi3 jiao3ban4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4shi2 yu4 xing1 jie4 zhi1jian1 de5 bian1jie4 zai4 zhe4li3 hen3 bo2ruo4。zhe4 yao4gao1 jiu4 xiang4 tou4jing4……neng2 ju4jiao1 ni3 de5 gan3zhi1，rang4 na4xie1 mi2wu4 long3zhao4 zhi1xia4 de5 shi4wu4 bian4de5 zhen1shi2。"

msgid ""
"Thankfully, I probably won't live through the night anyway. I'll die with the rest of you, down in the belly of some dank-ass castle.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz glances up at you again and twiddles his fingers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If Grinder wants my digits, he'll have to cut them from my bullet-riddled corpse."
msgstr ""
"幸好​，​我​大概​也​活​不到​天亮​了​。​我会​和​你们​一起​死​在​某个​阴暗​潮湿​的​城堡​深处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​又​抬头​看着​你​，​摆弄​着​自己​的​手指​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​“​绞肉机​”​想要​我​的​数据​，​恐怕​只能​从​我​遍布​弹孔​的​尸体​上​找寻​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xing4hao3，wo3 da4gai4 ye3 huo2 bu4dao4 tian1liang4 le5。wo3 hui4 he4 ni3men5 yi1qi3 si3 zai4 mou3 ge4 yin1an4 chao2shi1 de5 cheng2bao3 shen1chu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 you4 tai2tou2 kan4 zhao2 ni3，bai3nong4 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 shou3zhi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3“jiao3rou4ji1” xiang3yao4 wo3 de5 shu4ju4，kong3pa4 zhi3neng2 cong2 wo3 bian4bu4 dan4kong3 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 zhao3xun2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thankfully, I still have control of those turrets, so that should make this "
"a piece of--"
msgstr ""
"还好​我​仍然​控制​着​这些​炮塔​，​这样​应该​是​小菜一碟​—​—\n"
"hai2hao3 wo3 reng2ran2 kong4zhi4 zhao2 zhe4xie1 pao4ta3，zhe4yang4 ying1gai1 shi4 xiao3cai4yi1die2 — —"

msgid ""
"Thankfully, I've got a lead. For the first time in two decades, I've got a "
"solid goddamned lead."
msgstr ""
"还好​我​找到​了​线索​。​这​二十年​来​，​我​终于​找到​了​一条​线索​。\n"
"hai2hao3 wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 xian4suo3。zhe4 er4 shi2 nian2 lai2，wo3 zhong1yu2 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1 tiao2 xian4suo3。"

msgid ""
"Thankfully, your search also turns up something of more immediate value: a scrap of paper with a name and a five-digit code scribbled on it.\n"
"\n"
"Haushofer\n"
"84792"
msgstr ""
"好​在​你​还是​找到​了​一些​目前​更​有​用处​的​东西​：​一张​写​着​名字​和​五位数​密码​的​纸条​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​豪斯​霍​菲尔​\n"
"​84792\n"
"\n"
"hao3 zai4 ni3 hai2shi5 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1xie1 mu4qian2 geng1 you3 yong4chu5 de5 dong1xi1：yi1 zhang1 xie3 zhao2 ming2zi5 he4 wu3 wei4 shu3 mi4ma3 de5 zhi3tiao2。\n"
"\n"
"hao2 si1 huo4 fei1 er3 \n"
"84792"

msgid "Thanks a million, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"真是​谢谢​你​啊​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 xie4xie5 ni3 a1，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid "Thanks again for helping me out."
msgstr ""
"再次​感谢​你​帮助​我​。\n"
"zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3 bang1zhu4 wo3。"

msgid "Thanks for letting me know."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​告诉​我​这些​。\n"
"xie4xie5 gao4su4 wo3 zhe4xie1。"

msgid "Thanks for saving me that ammo."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​让​我省​了​子弹​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 rang4 wo3 sheng3 le5 zi3dan4。"

msgid "Thanks for sharing."
msgstr ""
"感谢​分享​。\n"
"gan3xie4 fen1xiang3。"

msgid "Thanks for the assist, but I really have to be going."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​的​帮助​，​但​我​真的​得​走​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，dan4 wo3 zhen1de5 de2 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thanks for the encouragement, chief. I knew that this was the right thing to do, of course, but you've helped to quiet any lingering doubts I might've had.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He nods at you, an expression of supreme confidence on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And now, if you'll excuse me, I've got a damsel in distress to rescue."
msgstr ""
"感谢​你​的​鼓励​，​头儿​。​虽说​我​知道​这样​做​是​正确​的​，​但​有​你​的​帮助​，​我​就​能​平息​心中​的​一切​疑虑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向​你​点点头​，​脸上​洋溢着​自信​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​恕​我​失陪​，​我要​去​营救​一位​深陷​困境​的​少女​了​。\n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 de5 gu3li4，tou2r5。sui1shuo1 wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 zheng4que4 de5，dan4 you3 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，wo3 jiu4 neng2 ping2xi1 xin1zhong1 de5 yi1qie4 yi2lu:4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 yang2 yi4 zhao2 zi4xin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 yao4 qu4 ying2jiu4 yi1 wei4 shen1xian4 kun4jing4 de5 shao4nu:3 le5。"

msgid "Thanks for the heads up."
msgstr ""
"感谢​你​的​忠告​。\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 de5 zhong1gao4。"

msgid "Thanks for the lecture, professor. Now who are you?"
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​的​长篇大论​，​教授​。​你​到底​是​谁​？\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 de5 zhang3 pian1 dai4 lun2，jiao4shou4。ni3 dao4di3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"Thanks for the rescue. It takes a pair to bring a weapon into Azzie territory... everybody knows that they shoot first if you're packing.\n"
"\n"
"I wouldn't have risked it."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​的​救援​啦​。​拿​着​武器​闯进​阿兹佬​的​地盘​是​很​需要​勇气​的​……​人人​都​知道​，​如果​他们​看见​你​携带​武器​的话​，​二话不说​就​会​开枪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​是​我​的话​可​不敢​冒​这个​险​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 de5 jiu4yuan2 la5。na2 zhao2 wu3qi4 chuang3jin4 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 di4pan2 shi4 hen3 xu1yao4 yong3qi4 de5……ren2ren2 dou1 zhi1dao4，ru2guo3 ta1men5 kan4jian4 ni3 xie2dai4 wu3qi4 de5hua4，er4hua4bu4shuo1 jiu4 hui4 kai1qiang1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 shi4 wo3 de5hua4 ke3 bu4 gan3 mao4 zhe4ge5 xian3。"

msgid "Thanks for the story. I'll be going now."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​的​故事​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 de5 gu4shi4。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "Thanks for the talk, chief. I'll let you know how it goes."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​和​我​说话​，​头儿​。​我会​和​你​汇报​最新进展​的​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 he4 wo3 shuo1hua4，tou2r5。wo3 hui4 he4 ni3 hui4bao4 zui4 xin1 jin4 zhan3 de5。"

msgid "Thanks for the tip, Eiger. The U-Bahn it is."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​的​建议​，​艾格尔​。​那​就​坐地铁​吧​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 de5 jian4yi4，Ai4ge2er3。na4 jiu4 zuo4 de5 tie3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Thanks for the vote of confidence, chief. I'll get you out of there, just "
"give me two more seconds..."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​支持​我​，​头儿​。​我会​把​你们​弄出去​的​，​再​给​我​两秒钟​……\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 zhi1chi2 wo3，tou2r5。wo3 hui4 ba3 ni3men5 long4 chu1 qu4 de5，zai4 gei3 wo3 liang3 miao3 zhong1……"

msgid "Thanks for the warning."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​提醒​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ti2xing3。"

msgid "Thanks for your help. I'll be going now."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​的​帮助​。​我​该​走​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。wo3 gai1 zou3 le5。"

msgid "Thanks for your help. I'll check it out."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​你​的​帮助​。​我会​去​看看​的​。\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。wo3 hui4 qu4 kan4kan5 de5。"

msgid "Thanks for your time, Maliit."
msgstr ""
"感谢​你​抽出​时间​，​玛丽​特​。\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 chou1chu1 shi2jian1，ma3li4 te4。"

msgid "Thanks for your time."
msgstr ""
"感谢​你​抽出​时间​。\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 chou1chu1 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Thanks to her, we might get out of here alive. Now let's find some cover and"
" wait for the door locks to disarm."
msgstr ""
"多亏​了​她​，​我们​没准​还​能​活着​出去​。​现在​咱们​找​找​掩护​，​等​着​门锁​打开​。\n"
"duo1kui1 le5 ta1，wo3men5 mei2zhun3 hai2 neng2 huo2zhe5 chu1qu4。xian4zai4 zan2men5 zhao3 zhao3 yan3hu4，deng3 zhao2 men2suo3 da3kai1。"

msgid ""
"Thanks to what I did, my new name meant “the troll who doesn’t take shit from anyone” instead. It's a name I'm *proud* to go by.\n"
"\n"
"And I've hung onto it ever since."
msgstr ""
"而​在​我​暴打​他​之后​，​这个​绰号​的​含义​就​变成​了​“​不向​任何人​服软​的​巨魔​”​，​并且​足以​令​我​*​骄傲​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自​那时​起​，​我​就​一直​这么​称呼​自己​了​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zai4 wo3 bao4da3 ta1 zhi1hou4，zhe4ge5 chuo4hao4 de5 han2yi4 jiu4 bian4cheng2 le5“bu4 xiang4 ren4 he2 ren2 fu2ruan3 de5 ju4mo2”，bing4qie3 zu2yi3 ling3 wo3*jiao1ao4*。\n"
"\n"
"zi4 na4shi2 qi3，wo3 jiu4 yi1zhi2 zhe4me5 cheng1hu5 zi4ji3 le5。"

msgid "Thanks to you, no doubt."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​这​都​要​感谢​你​。\n"
"dang1ran2，zhe4 dou1 yao4 gan3xie4 ni3。"

msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr ""
"谢谢​！\n"
"xie4xie5！"

msgid ""
"Thanks! I'm just glad to be here... things are rough out there, and it's "
"nice to have a job."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​！​我​很​高兴​能​来​这里​……​外头​的​光景​不好过​，​能​有份​工作​已经​很​好​了​。\n"
"xie4 le5！wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 lai2 zhe4li3……wai4tou5 de5 guang1jing3 bu4 hao3 guo4，neng2 you3fen4 gong1zuo4 yi3jing1 hen3 hao3 le5。"

msgid "Thanks! I'm keeping my head down til the lead stops!"
msgstr ""
"谢​了​！​我会​老实​待​着​，​一直​到​停火​为止​！\n"
"xie4 le5！wo3 hui4 lao3shi5 dai1 zhao2，yi1zhi2 dao4 ting2huo3 wei2zhi3！"

msgid ""
"Thanks! What was your name, by the way? I'd love to tell Management how "
"helpful you've been."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​！​对​了​，​你​叫​什么​名字​？​我会​向​管理处​告知​你​的​善举​。\n"
"xie4xie5！dui4 le5，ni3 jiao4 shen2me5 ming2zi5？wo3 hui4 xiang4 guan3 li3 chu3 gao4zhi1 ni3 de5 shan4ju3。"

msgid ""
"Thanks! You're a lifesaver.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The young ork takes the beer, pops the cap off with his tusk, and takes a long swig.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"谢谢​！​你​可​帮​大忙​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​年轻​的​兽​人​接过​啤酒​，​用​尖牙​撬开​瓶盖​，​然后​猛灌​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5！ni3 ke3 bang1 dai4 mang2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nian2qing1 de5 shou4 ren2 jie1guo4 pi2jiu3，yong4 jian1ya2 qiao4kai1 ping2gai4，ran2hou4 meng3 guan4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Thanks, $(l.name). Thanks for being a friend."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​$(l.name)​。​我​很​高兴​有​你​这样​的​朋友​。\n"
"xie4xie5，$(l.name)。wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 you3 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"Thanks, $(l.name). This is... difficult for me.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for making it easier."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​$(l.name)​。​说出​这些​……​对​我​而言​很​艰难​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​能​让​我​好受​些​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5，$(l.name)。shuo1chu1 zhe4xie1……dui4 wo3 er2yan2 hen3 jian1nan2。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 neng2 rang4 wo3 hao3shou4 xie1。"

msgid "Thanks, Dietrich."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​迪​特里​希​。\n"
"xie4 le5，Di2te4li3xi1。"

msgid "Thanks, Doc."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​医生​。\n"
"xie4 le5，yi1sheng1。"

msgid "Thanks, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"xie4 le5，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "Thanks, Eiger. Good talk."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​艾格尔​。​我​聊得​挺​愉快​的​。\n"
"xie4 le5，Ai4ge2er3。wo3 liao2 de2 ting3 yu2kuai4 de5。"

msgid "Thanks, John."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​约翰​。\n"
"xie4xie5，yue1han4。"

msgid "Thanks, Paul."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​保罗​。\n"
"xie4 le5，bao3luo2。"

msgid ""
"Thanks, boss. Never doubted you’d bring me, of course… you’re too good a $(l.man) for that.\n"
"\n"
"But it’s good to hear it, all the same."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​老大​。​我​当然​知道​你​肯定​会​带上​我​……​你​这人​就是​这么​讲​义气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​无论如何​，​能​亲耳​听​你​这么​说​，​我​还是​很​高兴​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5，lao3da4。wo3 dang1ran2 zhi1dao4 ni3 ken3ding4 hui4 dai4shang4 wo3……ni3 zhe4 ren2 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 jiang3 yi4qi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wu2lun4ru2he2，neng2 qin1er3 ting1 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1，wo3 hai2shi5 hen3 gao1xing4。"

msgid "Thanks, but no thanks."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​但​还是​不了​。\n"
"xie4xie5，dan4 hai2shi5 bu4le5。"

msgid "Thanks, but no thanks. I don't have time to go mage-hunting."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​但​还是​算了​。​我​没​时间​去​猎杀​法师​。\n"
"xie4xie5，dan4 hai2shi5 suan4le5。wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 qu4 lie4sha1 fa3shi1。"

msgid "Thanks, but no thanks. I've got enough on my plate as it is."
msgstr ""
"不了​，​谢谢​。​我​手头​的​事情​已经​够​多​了​。\n"
"bu4le5，xie4xie5。wo3 shou3tou2 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 gou4 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thanks, but no. What I have to do... well, it's a long story, and I don't "
"have time to explain it now."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​，​但​不必​了​。​我要​做​的​事​……​说来话长​，​现在​没​时间​解释​。\n"
"xie4xie5，dan4 bu4bi4 le5。wo3 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4……shuo1lai2hua4chang2，xian4zai4 mei2 shi2jian1 jie3shi4。"

msgid "Thanks, chief. You too."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​头儿​，​你​也​一样​。\n"
"xie4 le5，tou2r5，ni3 ye3 yi1yang4。"

msgid "Thanks, you've been very helpful."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​你​帮​大忙​了​。\n"
"xie4 le5，ni3 bang1 dai4 mang2 le5。"

msgid "Thanks."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。\n"
"xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thanks.\n"
"\n"
"I'll need it."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​希望​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Thanks.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns back to his terminal.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take care, chief."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​继续​鼓捣​起​他​的​终端​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​保重​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 ji4xu4 gu3dao5 qi3 ta1 de5 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao3zhong4，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"Thanks.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns his back on you and begins walking back to the van.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Kiss-ass."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转过身​，​朝​货车​走​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​马屁精​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，chao2 huo4che1 zou3 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ma3pi4jing1。"

msgid ""
"Thanks. I just hope that they don't screw things up in there.\n"
"\n"
"All that I want is to get this thing over with and get back home."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​我​只​希望​他们​不要​在​里面​搞事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只​想​赶紧​弄完​这​事​然后​回家​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5。wo3 zhi3 xi1wang4 ta1men5 bu4yao4 zai4 li3mian4 gao3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 xiang3 gan3jin3 long4 wan2 zhe4 shi4 ran2hou4 hui2jia1。"

msgid ""
"Thanks. I was hoping you would.\n"
"\n"
"For what it's worth, you have nothing to fear from me now. I didn't *want* to kill you in the first place, and now that I've... um... \"tendered my resignation,\" there are only two people who need to worry about me shooting them."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​我​真心​希望​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​你​已经​不必​担心​我会​做​什么​了​。​我​一​开始​就​*​没​想​*​杀​你​，​而​既然​现在​我​已经​……​“​递交​了​辞呈​”​，​这​世上​只​剩下​两个​人​需要​担心​我会​开枪​打​他们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5。wo3 zhen1xin1 xi1wang4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，ni3 yi3jing1 bu4bi4 dan1xin1 wo3 hui4 zuo4 shen2me5 le5。wo3 yi1 kai1shi3 jiu4*mei2 xiang3*sha1 ni3，er2 ji4ran2 xian4zai4 wo3 yi3jing1……“di4jiao1 le5 ci2cheng2”，zhe4 shi4shang4 zhi3 sheng4xia4 liang3 ge4 ren2 xu1yao4 dan1xin1 wo3 hui4 kai1qiang1 da3 ta1men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thanks. I’m going to see what’s going on in the Kreuzbasar. I’ll stop by the"
" coffee shop on my way."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​我​正要​去​看看​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​情况​。​我会​顺路去​一趟​豆​咖馆​。\n"
"xie4 le5。wo3 zheng4yao4 qu4 kan4kan5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 qing2kuang4。wo3 hui4 shun4 lu4 qu4 yi1 tang1 dou4 ka1 guan3。"

msgid "Thanks. Now get us into that vault."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​现在​把​我们​弄进​保险库​吧​。\n"
"xie4 le5。xian4zai4 ba3 wo3men5 long4 jin4 bao3 xian3 ku4 ba1。"

msgid "Thanks. Now let's do this."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​现在​我们​行动​吧​。\n"
"xie4xie5。xian4zai4 wo3men5 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Thanks. You know, those supplies were stolen from another kiez. *My* kiez. "
"That means all that money you've been making belongs to *me.*"
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​话​说​，​这批​物资​是从​另​一个​街区​偷来​的​。​*​我​的​*​街区​。​这​意味着​你​通过​它​赚​来​的​所有​钱​都​该​归​*​我​*​。\n"
"xie4 le5。hua4 shuo1，zhe4 pi1 wu4zi1 shi4 cong2 ling4 yi1ge5 jie1qu1 tou1 lai2 de5。*wo3 de5*jie1qu1。zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 tong1guo4 ta1 zhuan4 lai2 de5 suo3you3 qian2 dou1 gai1 gui1*wo3*。"

msgid "That Feuerschwinge had a reason for her attack. "
msgstr ""
"火翼​有​她​发动​袭击​的​理由​。\n"
"Huo3yi4 you3 ta1 fa1dong4 xi2ji1 de5 li3you2。"

msgid ""
"That Rabengeister thing? Raven ghosts? Might be anything in Gesundbrunnen. \n"
"\n"
"Seems like everyone and everything down here is a ghost. Ghosts of the past, ghost trains, ghostly thin folks pale for lack of sunlight…"
msgstr ""
"鸦​什么​……​幽灵​吗​？​谁​知道​会​是​健康​泉里​的​什么​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​的​人和事​似乎​都​是​幽灵​。​过去​的​幽灵​、​幽灵​列车​，​还有​晒​不到​阳光​所以​像​幽灵​一样​肤色​惨白​的​人​……\n"
"\n"
"Ya1shen2me5……you1ling2 ma5？shei2 zhi1dao4 hui4 shi4 jian4kang1 quan2 li3 de5 shen2me5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 ren2 he4 shi4 si4hu1 dou1 shi4 you1ling2。guo4qu4 de5 you1ling2、you1ling2 lie4che1，hai2you3 shai4 bu4dao4 yang2guang1 suo3yi3 xiang4 you1ling2 yi1yang4 fu1se4 can3bai2 de5 ren2……"

msgid "That a name I should know?"
msgstr ""
"我​应该​知道​这个​名字​吗​？\n"
"wo3 ying1gai1 zhi1dao4 zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"That ain't \"living.\" It's a slow death.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I just don't get wageslaves, man. I really, really don't."
msgstr ""
"这​算不上​是​“​活着​”​。​不如说是​慢性​死亡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真​不能​理解​那些​薪奴​是​怎么​想​的​。​讲真​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 suan4 bu4 shang4 shi4“huo2zhe5”。bu4 ru2 shuo1 shi4 man4xing4 si3wang2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1 bu4neng2 li3jie3 na4xie1 xin1 nu2 shi4 zen3me5 xiang3 de5。jiang3 zhen1。"

msgid "That all depends on what Blitz has to tell me."
msgstr ""
"这要​取决于​布里​茨​打算​告诉​我​的话​了​。\n"
"zhe4 yao4 qu3jue2yu2 Bu4li3ci2 da3suan4 gao4su4 wo3 de5hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That all depends on where you put 'em.\n"
"\n"
"Look, pal, it'd be better for everyone if you'd just turn back. We don't want to fight you, but we can't risk letting an unknown player into this... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment to search for the right word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...*situation* right now."
msgstr ""
"那​就​看​你​把​枪口​对准​哪儿​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​伙计​，​你​最好​回头​离开​，​这样​对​大伙​都​好​。​我们​不想​跟​你​打​，​但​也​不能​冒险​让​其他​未知​势力​卷入​目前​的​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​似乎​在​寻找​合适​的​词语​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​*​局面​*​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 kan4 ni3 ba3 qiang1kou3 dui4zhun3 na3r5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，huo3ji5，ni3 zui4hao3 hui2tou2 li2kai1，zhe4yang4 dui4 da4huo3 dou1 hao3。wo3men5 bu4xiang3 gen1 ni3 da3，dan4 ye3 bu4neng2 mao4xian3 rang4 qi2ta1 wei4zhi1 shi4li5 juan3ru4 mu4qian2 de5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，si4hu1 zai4 xun2zhao3 he2shi4 de5 ci2yu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……*ju2mian4*。"

msgid "That all sounds perfectly healthy. Take care, Jan."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​确实​相当​健康​。​保重​，​扬​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 que4shi2 xiang1dang1 jian4kang1。bao3zhong4，yang2。"

msgid "That all you know?"
msgstr ""
"你​就​知道​这些​？\n"
"ni3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1？"

msgid "That answers all of my questions. Thanks for taking the time to talk."
msgstr ""
"我要​问​的​都​问​完​了​。​谢谢​你​花​时间​回答​我​。\n"
"wo3 yao4 wen4 de5 dou1 wen4 wan2 le5。xie4xie5 ni3 hua1 shi2jian1 hui2da2 wo3。"

msgid ""
"That answers my question. I don't need to hear any more about your love "
"life."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​了​。​你​不用​再​继续​讲​你​的​感情生活​了​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 le5。ni3 bu4yong4 zai4 ji4xu4 jiang3 ni3 de5 gan3 qing2 sheng1 huo2 le5。"

msgid "That answers that."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​我​懂​了​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，wo3 dong3 le5。"

msgid "That answers that. I have another question for you, though."
msgstr ""
"那​就​说​得​通​了​。​不过​，​我​还有​一个​问题​要​问​你​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 shuo1 de2 tong1 le5。bu4guo4，wo3 hai2you3 yi1ge5 wen4ti2 yao4 wen4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"That bitch in the jar upstairs helped you, and in return, you're gonna help her climb back into her meat body again. Am I right? \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And what did she promise you? Gold? Jewels? Eternal life? She offered all of that stuff to me, too. For decades. "
msgstr ""
"楼上​那个​被​困住​的​贱人​帮​了​你​，​而​作为​回报​，​你​要​帮​她​重新​返回​她​的​肉身​之中​。​我​没​说错​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​答应​你​什么​了​？​金钱​？​珠宝​？​永恒​的​生命​？​她​这​几十年​来​也​一直​在​对​我​说​同样​的话​。\n"
"\n"
"lou2shang4 na4ge5 bei4 kun4 zhu4 de5 jian4ren2 bang1 le5 ni3，er2 zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，ni3 yao4 bang1 ta1 chong2xin1 fan3hui2 ta1 de5 rou4shen1 zhi1zhong1。wo3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 da1ying5 ni3 shen2me5 le5？jin1qian2？zhu1bao3？yong3heng2 de5 sheng1ming4？ta1 zhe4 ji1 shi2 nian2 lai2 ye3 yi1zhi2 zai4 dui4 wo3 shuo1 tong2yang4 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"That building had some *incredible* toys in it. Those were fun to see.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not saying that I approve of how they were used, mind you. But there was some pretty wiz stuff in there, all the same."
msgstr ""
"那栋​楼​里面​有​不少​*​美妙​*​的​好​玩具​。​相当​值得一看​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​我​不是​说​我​同意​它们​被​使用​的​方式​。​但​那里​头​确实​有​不少​相当​不赖​的​玩意儿​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 dong4 lou2 li3mian4 you3 bu4shao3*mei3miao4*de5 hao3 wan2ju4。xiang1dang1 zhi2 de2 yi1 kan4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 wo3 bu4shi4 shuo1 wo3 tong2yi4 ta1men5 bei4 shi3yong4 de5 fang1shi4。dan4 na4li5 tou2 que4shi2 you3 bu4shao3 xiang1dang1 bu4lai4 de5 wan2yi4r5。"

msgid ""
"That can be arranged.\n"
"\n"
"Men, open fi--"
msgstr ""
"这个​好​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​各位​，​准备​开火​—​—\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 hao3 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"ge4wei4，zhun3bei4 kai1huo3 — —"

msgid ""
"That can't have been it. You still have to do something else, right? Jack "
"into the Matrix or something...?"
msgstr ""
"不​可能​就​这么​完​了​吧​。​你​应该​还要​做点​别的​什么​，​对​吗​？​接入​矩阵​，​或者​什么​其他​的​操作​？\n"
"bu4 ke3neng2 jiu4 zhe4me5 wan2 le5 ba1。ni3 ying1gai1 hai2 yao4 zuo4 dian3 bie2de5 shen2me5，dui4 ma5？jie1ru4 ju3zhen4，huo4zhe3 shen2me5 qi2ta1 de5 cao1zuo4？"

msgid ""
"That complex needed to be buried. What they were working on in there... it was an atrocity, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I'm glad that we were able to put a stop to it."
msgstr ""
"就​该​把​那​地方​彻底​毁掉​，​$(l.name)​。​他们​在​那里​的​所作所为​……​简直​是​一场​暴行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​高兴​能​阻止​那​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 gai1 ba3 na4 di4fang1 che4di3 hui3diao4，$(l.name)。ta1men5 zai4 na4li5 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2……jian3zhi2 shi4 yi1 chang2 bao4xing2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 zu3zhi3 na4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"That corporate prick must've gotten to a security kiosk. Told them in person that we're here.\n"
"\n"
"If I'd been able to kill him like I wanted to, we wouldn't have to deal with this bullshit!"
msgstr ""
"那个​公司​混蛋​肯定​跑​去​了​保安​亭​，​当面​跟​他们​说​我们​到​这来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​当初​能​按​我​心意​干掉​他​，​就​不用​处理​这​狗屁​事​了​！\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 gong1si1 hun2dan4 ken3ding4 pao2 qu4 le5 bao3an1 ting2，dang1mian4 gen1 ta1men5 shuo1 wo3men5 dao4 zhe4 lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 dang1chu1 neng2 an4 wo3 xin1yi4 gan4diao4 ta1，jiu4 bu4yong4 chu3li3 zhe4 gou3pi4 shi4 le5！"

msgid "That death can be a release. Even for a dragon."
msgstr ""
"即便​对龙​而言​，​死亡​也​是​一种​解脱​。\n"
"ji2bian4 dui4 long2 er2yan2，si3wang2 ye3 shi4 yi1zhong3 jie3tuo1。"

msgid "That depends on who you think we're talking about."
msgstr ""
"那得​看​你​心里​想​的​是​谁​了​。\n"
"na4 de2 kan4 ni3 xin1li5 xiang3 de5 shi4 shei2 le5。"

msgid "That depends. What do you have?"
msgstr ""
"看​情况​。​你​这​都​有​什么​？\n"
"kan4 qing2kuang4。ni3 zhe4 dou1 you3 shen2me5？"

msgid "That didn't take very long."
msgstr ""
"没​花​太久​时间​啊​。\n"
"mei2 hua1 tai4 jiu3 shi2jian1 a1。"

msgid ""
"That distinction belongs to my organization's ruling council.\n"
"\n"
"I am a go-between, nothing more."
msgstr ""
"这项​殊荣​属于​本​组织​的​统治​委员会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​个​中间人​，​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 xiang4 shu1rong2 shu3yu2 ben3 zu3zhi1 de5 tong3zhi4 wei3yuan2hui4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 zhong1jian1ren2，jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"That doesn't change the fact that the illustrious Frau Schäfer made herself into a leader here. And guess what?\n"
"\n"
"In an anarchist system, there aren't supposed to *be* any leaders."
msgstr ""
"这​并​不能​改变​一个​事实​，​那​就是​了不起​的​舍费尔​女士​把​自己​变成​了​这里​的​领导者​。​但是​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​无政府主义​体制​下​，​本来​就​*​不该​*​有​任何​领导者​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4neng2 gai3bian4 yi1ge5 shi4shi2，na4 jiu4shi4 liao3bu5qi3 de5 she3 fei4 er3 nu:3shi4 ba3 zi4ji3 bian4cheng2 le5 zhe4li3 de5 ling3dao3zhe3。dan4shi4 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 ti3zhi4 xia4，ben3lai2 jiu4*bu4gai1*you3 ren4he2 ling3dao3zhe3。"

msgid "That doesn't change what we have to do."
msgstr ""
"这​并​不会​改变​我们​要​做​的​事​。\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4hui4 gai3bian4 wo3men5 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "That doesn't change..."
msgstr ""
"这​并​不能​改变​……\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4neng2 gai3bian4……"

msgid ""
"That doesn't look like a Knight Errant employee. Looks more like a lab tech "
"to me."
msgstr ""
"那个​人​看上去​不​像是​游侠​骑士​雇员​，​更​像是​个​实验室​技术人员​。\n"
"na4ge5 ren2 kan4shang5qu5 bu4 xiang4 shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 gu4yuan2，geng1 xiang4 shi4 ge4 shi2yan4shi4 ji4shu4ren2yuan2。"

msgid ""
"That doesn't look like a bloodstain. It looks more like somebody spilled his"
" drink."
msgstr ""
"那​看起来​不像​血渍​，​更​像是​谁​把​饮料​给​洒​了​。\n"
"na4 kan4qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 xue4zi4，geng1 xiang4 shi4 shei2 ba3 yin3liao4 gei3 sa3 le5。"

msgid "That doesn't prove anything."
msgstr ""
"这​证明​不了​什么​。\n"
"zhe4 zheng4ming2 bu4le5 shen2me5。"

msgid "That doesn't sound good."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​不​太妙​啊​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 bu4 tai4 miao4 a1。"

msgid ""
"That doesn't sound practical. Truth be told, it sounds like a recipe for "
"disaster."
msgstr ""
"这​听​起来​很​不​现实​。​说实话​，​这样​下去​是​会​出事​的​。\n"
"zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 bu4 xian4shi2。shuo1shi2hua4，zhe4yang4 xia4qu4 shi4 hui4 chu1shi4 de5。"

msgid "That dragon really wants us dead."
msgstr ""
"那条​龙是​真想​弄死​我们​啊​。\n"
"na4 tiao2 long2 shi4 zhen1 xiang3 nong4si3 wo3men5 a1。"

msgid "That dragons aren’t all alike."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​并非​都​是​一个样​。\n"
"ju4long2 bing4fei1 dou1 shi4 yi1ge5yang4。"

msgid ""
"That girl back there... she said that she'd only been here for a week.\n"
"\n"
"Back when I lived here, Harrow would never have let such a fresh convert prepare a sacrifice. He'd wait until she was in so deep - until she felt so *indebted* to him  - that she *couldn't* turn tail and run."
msgstr ""
"刚才​那个​女孩​……​她​说​自己​才​加入​一周​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​在​以前​，​哈罗​绝不会​让​这种​新人​准备​祭品​。​他会​等到​对方​陷得够​深​，​直到​感觉​自己​*​亏欠​*​他​，​根本​*​无法​*​抽身​逃跑​。\n"
"\n"
"gang1cai2 na4ge5 nu:3hai2……ta1 shuo1 zi4ji3 cai2 jia1ru4 yi1zhou1。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 zai4 yi3qian2，ha1luo2 jue2 bu4 hui4 rang4 zhe4zhong3 xin1ren2 zhun3bei4 ji4pin3。ta1 hui4 deng3dao4 dui4fang1 xian4 de2 gou4 shen1，zhi2dao4 gan3jue2 zi4ji3*kui1qian4*ta1，gen1ben3*wu2fa3*chou1shen1 tao2pao3。"

msgid ""
"That girl is never going to have to do what we saw back in that kitchen. We "
"won't let that happen."
msgstr ""
"绝不能​让​那​姑娘​去​做​我们​在​厨房​里​看到​的​事​。​我们​不能​让​那种​事​发生​。\n"
"jue2 bu4 neng2 rang4 na4 gu1niang5 qu4 zuo4 wo3men5 zai4 chu2fang2 li3 kan4dao4 de5 shi4。wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 na4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"That is ENOUGH.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel's voice comes out in a roar, and his fist smashes down on the desk behind him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Eiger, you and $(l.name) can have it out later. But I’ve had enough."
msgstr ""
"够​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​怒吼​起来​，​一拳​砸​在​身后​的​桌子​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​，​你​跟​$(l.name)​过会儿​可以​接着​吵​。​但​我​已经​受够了​。\n"
"\n"
"gou4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 nu4hou3 qi3lai5，yi1 quan2 za2 zai4 shen1hou4 de5 zhuo1zi5 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，ni3 gen1 $(l.name) guo4 hui4 er2 ke3yi3 jie1zhe5 chao3。dan4 wo3 yi3jing1 shou4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That is a facile lesson, but yes. Dragons are individuals, no different from humanity in that regard.\n"
"\n"
"But even with their differences, Feuerschwinge stands apart."
msgstr ""
"很​浅显​，​但​也​没错​。​龙​和​人​一样​，​都​是​独立​的​个体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​即便​存在​差异​，​火翼​仍​是​其中​最为​特殊​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 qian3xian3，dan4 ye3 mei2cuo4。long2 he4 ren2 yi1yang4，dou1 shi4 du2li4 de5 ge4ti3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ji2bian4 cun2zai4 cha1yi4，Huo3yi4 reng2 shi4 qi2zhong1 zui4wei2 te4shu1 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"That is fair. But if we are to continue working together, you must accept "
"the fact that you might encounter more \"changes of plan\" like the one that"
" you saw on your test run. An unfortunate cost of doing  business, but one "
"that you must be willing to bear."
msgstr ""
"这​无可厚非​。​但​若​要​继续​合作​，​你​必须​接受​这样​一个​事实​：​你​可能​会​遇到​更​多​像​这次​的​“​计划​有变​”​。​这是​做生意​不得不​承受​的​代价​，​但​你​必须​愿意​承担​。\n"
"zhe4 wu2ke3hou4fei1。dan4 ruo4 yao4 ji4xu4 he2zuo4，ni3 bi4xu1 jie1shou4 zhe4yang4 yi1ge5 shi4shi2：ni3 ke3neng2 hui4 yu4dao4 geng1 duo1 xiang4 zhe4 ci4 de5“ji4hua4 you3 bian4”。zhe4 shi4 zuo4sheng1yi4 bu4de2bu4 cheng2shou4 de5 dai4jia4，dan4 ni3 bi4xu1 yuan4yi4 cheng2dan1。"

msgid ""
"That is not... much to go on. \n"
"\n"
"Do any details about this ork come to mind? Any distinguishing features that I could look into?"
msgstr ""
"仅凭​这些​……​不太好​查​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​兽​人​有​什么​详细​特征​吗​？​那种​方便​我查​下去​的​明显​特征​？\n"
"\n"
"jin3 ping2 zhe4xie1……bu4tai4hao3 cha2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 shou4 ren2 you3 shen2me5 xiang2xi4 te4zheng1 ma5？na4zhong3 fang1bian4 wo3 cha2 xia4qu4 de5 ming2xian3 te4zheng1？"

msgid "That is probably wise."
msgstr ""
"这么​想​很​明智​。\n"
"zhe4me5 xiang3 hen3 ming2zhi4。"

msgid ""
"That is so refreshing. Thank you for sharing your opinion with us... it's so"
" rare to hear someone like you who accepts the way that things are."
msgstr ""
"真是​令人​耳目一新​。​感谢​你​与​我们​分享​观点​……​像​你​这样​坦然​接受​现状​的​人​实在​难得​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 ling4ren2 er3mu4yi1xin1。gan3xie4 ni3 yu4 wo3men5 fen1xiang3 guan1dian3……xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 tan3ran2 jie1shou4 xian4zhuang4 de5 ren2 shi2zai4 nan2de2。"

msgid ""
"That is something. I will see what I can find out.\n"
"\n"
"Did you note anything else during the run that may be of value?"
msgstr ""
"这个​可以​。​我会​去查​查看​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这次​差事​过程​中​，​还有​什么​其他​有​价值​的​情报​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 ke3yi3。wo3 hui4 qu4 cha2 cha2kan4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 ci4 cha4shi4 guo4cheng2 zhong4，hai2you3 shen2me5 qi2ta1 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 qing2bao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"That is the eternal task, yes. To sleep the long sleep. Begin again in the "
"next age of the world."
msgstr ""
"这是​永恒​的​使命​，​是​的​。​陷入​长眠​。​在​世界​的​下​一个​时代​再度​开始​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4，shi4 de5。xian4ru4 chang2mian2。zai4 shi4jie4 de5 xia4 yi1ge5 shi2dai4 zai4du4 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"That is the thing of it, efendi. All that time… all that bickering between us… I was serious. I couldn’t stand the man. But he… apparently, it was something different to him. \n"
"\n"
"None of us will be the same after this."
msgstr ""
"问题​就​在于​此​，​贵人​。​一直​以来​……​我们​之间​的​争执​……​我​都​是​认真​的​。​我​实在​受不了​那家伙​。​但​他​……​对​他​而言​，​情况​显然​不同​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​经历​此事​后​，​我们​再也​回​不到​从前​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wen4ti2 jiu4 zai4yu2 ci3，gui4ren2。yi1zhi2 yi3lai2……wo3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 zheng1zhi2……wo3 dou1 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5。wo3 shi2zai4 shou4bu4liao3 na4 jia1 huo3。dan4 ta1……dui4 ta1 er2yan2，qing2kuang4 xian3ran2 bu4tong2。\n"
"\n"
"jing1li4 ci3shi4 hou4，wo3men5 zai4ye3 hui2 bu4dao4 cong2qian2 le5。"

msgid "That is true. No ancient dragon acts without reason."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​，​没有​古龙​会​无缘无故​行动​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3，mei2you3 gu3long2 hui4 wu2yuan2wu2gu4 xing2dong4。"

msgid ""
"That is what I was going to say. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He bows to you with a flourish.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye, $(l.name). We will meet again, I think... though not for a long, long time."
msgstr ""
"我本​打算​说​的​也​就是​这些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​夸张​地向​你​鞠​了​一躬​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​了​，​$(l.name)​。​我​想​我们​会​再见​的​……​不过​是​在​很久很久​之后​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3 da3suan4 shuo1 de5 ye3 jiu4shi4 zhe4xie1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kua1zhang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 ju1 le5 yi1 gong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 le5，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 hui4 zai4jian4 de5……bu4guo4 shi4 zai4 hen3 jiu3 hen3 jiu3 zhi1hou4。"

msgid ""
"That is why you are here. Vengeance for your friends and the attack on your home. \n"
"\n"
"You believe I've been hunting you, and now you are bringing the fight to me."
msgstr ""
"所以​你​才​要​来​这里​。​为了​你​死去​的​朋友​和​遇袭​的​家园​而​向​我​复仇​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​认为​是​我​一直​在​追杀​你​，​而​现在​你​要​来​和​我​当面​战斗​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 cai2 yao4 lai2 zhe4li3。wei4le5 ni3 si3qu4 de5 peng2you5 he4 yu4xi2 de5 jia1yuan2 er2 xiang4 wo3 fu4chou2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ren4wei2 shi4 wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 zhui1sha1 ni3，er2 xian4zai4 ni3 yao4 lai2 he4 wo3 dang1mian4 zhan4dou4。"

msgid ""
"That is your prerogative, I suppose.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He flicks the ash from the tip of his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, you have nothing to worry about now. Short of employing a tactical nuclear weapon, APEX cannot touch us down here... and that is unlikely, to say the least."
msgstr ""
"那​算是​你​的​特权​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​弹掉​烟头​上​的​灰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​你​现在​无需​担忧​。​除非​动用​战术​核武器​，​否则​APEX​根本无法​触及​这里​……​而​这种​可能性​，​至少​可以​说​是​微乎其微​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 suan4shi4 ni3 de5 te4quan2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dan4 diao4 yan1tou2 shang4 de5 hui1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，ni3 xian4zai4 wu2xu1 dan1you1。chu2fei1 dong4yong4 zhan4shu4 he2wu3qi4，fou3ze2 APEX gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 chu4ji2 zhe4li3……er2 zhe4zhong3 ke3neng2xing4，zhi4shao3 ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 wei1hu1qi2wei1。"

msgid ""
"That is your prerogative. But it's the way it has to be.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses a moment to let the point sink in before continuing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Moving forward. Once you're en route to the Rabbit Hole, it's go time. I trust that you understand what I mean by that."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​想​是​你​的​事​，​但​事情​就是​这么回事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​，​等​你​消化​之后​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​继续​说​。​一旦​你​带​着​钱​去​兔子​洞​，​就​没有​回头路​了​。​我​相信​你​明白​我​的​意思​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 xiang3 shi4 ni3 de5 shi4，dan4 shi4qing5 jiu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，deng3 ni3 xiao1hua4 zhi1hou4 you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4xu4 shuo1。yi1dan4 ni3 dai4 zhao2 qian2 qu4 tu4zi5 dong4，jiu4 mei2you3 hui2tou2lu4 le5。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 ming2bai5 wo3 de5 yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"That is your problem, not mine.\n"
"\n"
"Believe what you want - my Panacea will change the world. In the end, you will thank me."
msgstr ""
"那​是​你​的​问题​，​与我无关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随便​你​怎么​想​吧​—​—​我​的​“​万能​药​”​会​改变​世界​。​到​最后​，​你​会​感谢​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 ni3 de5 wen4ti2，yu4 wo3 wu2 guan1。\n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3 ba1——wo3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4” hui4 gai3bian4 shi4jie4。dao4 zui4hou4，ni3 hui4 gan3xie4 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"That isn't Monika.\n"
"\n"
"Monika is dead."
msgstr ""
"那​不是​莫妮卡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​已经​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 bu4shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"That isn't going to happen. You're wrong about me, Eiger... I intend to "
"prove that to you."
msgstr ""
"这​绝不​可能​发生​。​你​对​我​有所​误解​，​艾格尔​……​我​想要​证明​给​你​看​。\n"
"zhe4 jue2bu4 ke3neng2 fa1sheng1。ni3 dui4 wo3 you3suo3 wu4jie3，Ai4ge2er3……wo3 xiang3yao4 zheng4ming2 gei3 ni3 kan4。"

msgid ""
"That isn't gonna happen to you. I'm busting you and your brothers out of "
"here."
msgstr ""
"这种​事​不会​发生​在​你​身上​。​我会​把​你​和​你​的​兄弟​们​都​救​走​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4 bu4hui4 fa1sheng1 zai4 ni3 shen1shang5。wo3 hui4 ba3 ni3 he4 ni3 de5 xiong1di4 men5 dou1 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "That isn't good."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​不妙​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 bu4miao4。"

msgid ""
"That isn't how I operate. And besides, I don't need a briefing to recognize the name \"Vauclair.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She taps a painted fingernail to her temple.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Trivia is a passion of mine."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​我​的​做事​风格​。​再说​，​我​也​不​需要​别人​来​告诉​我​“​沃​克莱尔​”​这个​名字​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​涂​了​指甲油​的​手指​轻敲​太阳穴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷​知识​是​我​的​一大​爱好​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 de5 zuo4shi4 feng1ge2。zai4shuo1，wo3 ye3 bu4 xu1yao4 bie2ren5 lai2 gao4su4 wo3“Wo4ke4lai2er3” zhe4ge5 ming2zi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 tu2 le5 zhi3jia5you2 de5 shou3zhi3 qing1 qiao1 tai4yang2xue2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"leng3 zhi1shi5 shi4 wo3 de5 yi1 dai4 ai4hao4。"

msgid "That isn't much."
msgstr ""
"这​没​多少​。\n"
"zhe4 mei2 duo1shao3。"

msgid ""
"That it will. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich jerks his head in the direction of Monika and Glory and claps his hand across your shoulders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's go, neh? We mustn't keep the others waiting."
msgstr ""
"会​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希朝​莫妮卡​和​格洛丽​那边​扬起​头​，​同时​用手​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​走​吧​？​可​不能​让​人家​干​等​着​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"hui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 Mo4ni1ka3 he4 Ge2luo4li2 na4bian5 yang2qi3 tou2，tong2shi2 yong4 shou3 pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 zou3 ba1？ke3 bu4neng2 rang4 ren2jia1 gan4 deng3 zhao2 a1。"

msgid ""
"That little shrew sent ya my way, huh?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Schrotty's smile broadens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Will wonders never cease."
msgstr ""
"那个​小​母老虎​让​你​来​找​我​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​施罗蒂​的​嘴角​咧​得​更​开​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​太阳​打​西边​出来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 xiao3 mu3lao3hu3 rang4 ni3 lai2 zhao3 wo3？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 de5 zui3jiao3 lie3 de2 geng1 kai1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 tai4yang5 da3 xi1bian1 chu1lai2 le5。"

msgid "That lucky bastard."
msgstr ""
"那家伙​真​走运​。\n"
"na4 jia1 huo3 zhen1 zou3yun4。"

msgid "That makes it a good thing, right?"
msgstr ""
"这样​说​起来​，​拟感​算是​好​东西​，​对​吧​？\n"
"zhe4yang4 shuo1 qi3lai5，ni3 gan3 suan4shi4 hao3 dong1xi1，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "That makes sense, I suppose. Thanks for the talk."
msgstr ""
"有​道理​。​感谢​讨论​。\n"
"you3 dao4li5。gan3xie4 tao3lun4。"

msgid "That makes sense."
msgstr ""
"有​道理​。\n"
"you3 dao4li5。"

msgid ""
"That makes sense. If you have any questions, it'd be best if you asked them "
"now."
msgstr ""
"有​道理​。​如果​你​有​任何​问题​，​最好​现在​就​问​。\n"
"you3 dao4li5。ru2guo3 ni3 you3 ren4he2 wen4ti2，zui4hao3 xian4zai4 jiu4 wen4。"

msgid "That makes two of us. When did our teammates abandon you?"
msgstr ""
"我​也​有​同感​。​队里​的​其他人​是​什么​时候​走​的​？\n"
"wo3 ye3 you3 tong2gan3。dui4 li3 de5 qi2 ta1 ren2 shi4 shen2me5 shi2hou5 zou3 de5？"

msgid ""
"That may be how your mystical Flux State works... but in the field, that kind of thinking gets you killed.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, Monika. Put someone in charge, and let's get on with the mission."
msgstr ""
"可能​这​一套​对于​神秘​的​“​动荡​带​”​而言​行得通​……​但​上​了​战场​，​这种​想法​只会​要​了​你​的​命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​快点​，​莫妮卡​。​你​选​个人​来​管事​，​然后​我们​继续​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3neng2 zhe4 yi1tao4 dui4yu2 shen2mi4 de5“dong4dang4 dai4” er2yan2 xing2de5tong1……dan4 shang4 le5 zhan4chang3，zhe4zhong3 xiang3fa3 zhi3 hui4 yao4 le5 ni3 de5 ming4。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4dian3，Mo4ni1ka3。ni3 xuan3 ge4ren2 lai2 guan3 shi4，ran2hou4 wo3men5 ji4xu4 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"That may be so, but I'm telling you the truth about Ullrich.\n"
"\n"
"He may have a use for you now, but as soon as this no longer holds, he will kill you."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​，​但​我​要​告诉​你​的​是​关于​乌尔里​希​的​真相​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​此刻​或许​用得上​你​，​但​一旦​你​不再​有用​，​他​就​会​杀​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 wo3 yao4 gao4su4 ni3 de5 shi4 guan1yu2 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 de5 zhen1xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ci3ke4 huo4xu3 yong4de5shang4 ni3，dan4 yi1dan4 ni3 bu4zai4 you3yong4，ta1 jiu4 hui4 sha1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"That may be true, but I'm also devastatingly charming and intelligent. That "
"has to count for something."
msgstr ""
"这​可能​是​真的​，​但​我​同样​魅力四射​且​聪明绝顶​。​这​姑且​也​算​有些​价值​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3neng2 shi4 zhen1de5，dan4 wo3 tong2yang4 mei4li4si4she4 qie3 cong1ming5jue2ding3。zhe4 gu1qie3 ye3 suan4 you3xie1 jia4zhi2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"That might have been true then. But she's been living under the shrine's "
"influence for a long time now. She's no more in control of herself than "
"anyone else here is."
msgstr ""
"或许​以前​是​这样​，​但​她​已​在​神龛​的​影响​下​生活​了​很​久​，​她​对​自身​的​失控​程度​与​这里​任何人​无异​。\n"
"huo4xu3 yi3qian2 shi4 zhe4yang4，dan4 ta1 yi3 zai4 shen2kan1 de5 ying3xiang3 xia4 sheng1huo2 le5 hen3 jiu3，ta1 dui4 zi4shen1 de5 shi1kong4 cheng2du4 yu4 zhe4li3 ren4 he2 ren2 wu2yi4。"

msgid ""
"That might take a while - that facility could be *massive.* There was clearly a lot more to it than we saw.\n"
"\n"
"We've got no way of knowin' how far underground the complex extends."
msgstr ""
"这​可能​要花​上​一段时间​。​那座​设施​的​规模​*​极其​庞大​*​。​显然​它​远​比​我们​看到​的​更​复杂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​根本​无从​知晓​这座​建筑​究竟​延伸​到​地下​多深​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ke3neng2 yao4 hua1 shang4 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。na4 zuo4 she4shi1 de5 gui1mo2*ji2qi2 pang2da4*。xian3ran2 ta1 yuan3 bi3 wo3men5 kan4dao4 de5 geng1 fu4za2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gen1ben3 wu2cong2 zhi1xiao3 zhe4 zuo4 jian4zhu4 jiu1jing4 yan2shen1 dao4 di4xia4 duo1 shen1。"

msgid ""
"That much goes without saying.\n"
"\n"
"This development worries me, $(l.name). It worries me greatly."
msgstr ""
"这​毫无疑问​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​这一​发现​让​我​感到​非常​担忧​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hao2wu2yi2wen4。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，zhe4 yi1 fa1xian4 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 fei1chang2 dan1you1。"

msgid "That name sounds familiar."
msgstr ""
"这​名字​听​起来​很​熟悉​。\n"
"zhe4 ming2zi5 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 shu2xi1。"

msgid ""
"That ominous feeling is getting stronger, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"It feels like we're being watched."
msgstr ""
"这种​不祥​的​感觉​越来越​强烈​了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​感觉​就​像​有人​在​监视​我们​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 bu4xiang2 de5 gan3jue2 yue4lai2yue4 qiang2lie4 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"gan3jue2 jiu4 xiang4 you3ren2 zai4 jian1shi4 wo3men5 yi1yang4。"

msgid "That only matters to the people who know that it's stolen."
msgstr ""
"只有​知道​这是​抄袭​内容​的​人才​在意​这件​事​。\n"
"zhi3you3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 chao1xi2 nei4rong2 de5 ren2cai2 zai4yi4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid "That ork is gonna pay for this."
msgstr ""
"那个​兽​人​将​会​为此​付出代价​。\n"
"na4ge5 shou4 ren2 jiang1 hui4 wei4ci3 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。"

msgid "That pack looks heavy. I can help you with it if you want."
msgstr ""
"那个​背包​看起来​很​重​。​如果​你​需要​，​我​可以​帮​你​拿​。\n"
"na4ge5 bei1bao1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 chong2。ru2guo3 ni3 xu1yao4，wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 na2。"

msgid ""
"That prove nothing, by your own admission. Now, chief, come on... we don't have a lot of time.\n"
"\n"
"Do this. I'm asking you as a friend."
msgstr ""
"这​根本​证明​不了​什么​，​你​自己​都​承认​了​。​快点​吧​，​头儿​……​我们​时间​不多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​动手​吧​。​就​当​我​这个​朋友​求​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 gen1ben3 zheng4ming2 bu4le5 shen2me5，ni3 zi4ji3 dou1 cheng2ren4 le5。kuai4dian3 ba1，tou2r5……wo3men5 shi2jian1 bu4 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dong4shou3 ba1。jiu4 dang1 wo3 zhe4ge5 peng2you5 qiu2 ni3 le5。"

msgid "That really shouldn't have come as a surprise."
msgstr ""
"这​确实​不该​让​人​感到​意外​。\n"
"zhe4 que4shi2 bu4gai1 rang4 ren2 gan3dao4 yi4wai4。"

msgid "That remains to be see--"
msgstr ""
"现在​还​不好​说​—​—\n"
"xian4zai4 hai2 bu4hao3 shuo1 — —"

msgid "That right?"
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？\n"
"shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"That said, the Adversary can be interpreted in different ways, just as any idol or totem can.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He offers you a half-shrug.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Some of its followers are worse than others."
msgstr ""
"话虽如此​，​就​像​任何​精魂​导师​或​图腾​一样​，​反叛者​也​可以​被​赋予​不同​的​诠释​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​略略​耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​的​部分​信徒​可以​说​更为​恶劣​。\n"
"\n"
"hua4sui1ru2ci3，jiu4 xiang4 ren4he2 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 huo4 tu2teng2 yi1yang4，fan3 pan4 zhe3 ye3 ke3yi3 bei4 fu4yu3 bu4tong2 de5 quan2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu:e4lu:e4 song3jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 bu4fen5 xin4tu2 ke3yi3 shuo1 geng4wei2 e4lie4。"

msgid ""
"That said, there is a difference between a man's deeds and his work.\t\n"
"\n"
"Ezkibel is, by all accounts, an excellent surgeon. So long as your association with him begins and ends there, I'm sure that you'll get along swimmingly."
msgstr ""
"话虽如此​，​还是​要​分开​来谈​一个​人​的​行为​和​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​据​各方​评价​，​埃兹​基​贝尔​是​位​出色​的​外科医生​。​只要​你们​的​关系​仅限于​工作​往来​，​我​相信​你们​会​相处​得​非常​愉快​。\n"
"\n"
"hua4sui1ru2ci3，hai2shi5 yao4 fen1kai1 lai2 tan2 yi1ge5 ren2 de5 xing2wei2 he4 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ju4 ge4fang1 ping2jia4，Ai1ziji1bei4er3 shi4 wei4 chu1se4 de5 wai4ke1yi1sheng1。zhi3yao4 ni3men5 de5 guan1xi5 jin3 xian4 yu2 gong1zuo4 wang3lai2，wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3men5 hui4 xiang1chu3 de2 fei1chang2 yu2kuai4。"

msgid ""
"That said, we believe that $(l.name) is the right choice to lead the team."
msgstr ""
"即便如此​，​我们​认为​让​$(l.name)​当​队长​才​是​正确​的​选择​。\n"
"ji2 bian4 ru2 ci3，wo3men5 ren4wei2 rang4 $(l.name) dang1 dui4zhang3 cai2 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"That said, you probably shouldn't make a habit of stabbing our employers in the back.\n"
"\n"
"We have enough enemies already. No need to add to the list."
msgstr ""
"但​话​又​说​回来​，​你​最好​别​养成​在​背后​捅​客户​刀子​的​习惯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​树敌​已经​够​多​了​，​没​必要​添新仇​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hua4 you4 shuo1 hui2lai5，ni3 zui4hao3 bie4 yang3cheng2 zai4 bei4hou4 tong3 ke4hu4 dao1zi5 de5 xi2guan4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shu4di2 yi3jing1 gou4 duo1 le5，mei2 bi4yao4 tian1 xin1 chou2。"

msgid "That seals it. If Blitz is in, how can we lose?"
msgstr ""
"就​这么​定​了​。​如果​布里​茨​在​，​我们​怎么​可能​输​？\n"
"jiu4 zhe4me5 ding4 le5。ru2guo3 Bu4li3ci2 zai4，wo3men5 zen3me5 ke3neng2 shu1？"

msgid "That seems to have done it."
msgstr ""
"好像​可以​了​。\n"
"hao3xiang4 ke3yi3 le5。"

msgid "That settles it for me. Let's get this show on the road."
msgstr ""
"这事​就​先​这么着​吧​。​我们​有话​等​路上​再谈​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 jiu4 xian1 zhe4me5zhe5 ba1。wo3men5 you3 hua4 deng3 lu4shang5 zai4 tan2。"

msgid "That settles that! C'mon, boss, let's get the hell out of here!"
msgstr ""
"完事​了​！​老大​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​吧​！\n"
"wan2shi4 le5！lao3da4，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1！"

msgid "That settles that! C'mon, chief, let's get the hell out of here!"
msgstr ""
"完事​了​！​头儿​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​吧​！\n"
"wan2shi4 le5！tou2r5，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1！"

msgid "That settles that! Let's get the hell out of here!"
msgstr ""
"完事​了​！​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​吧​！\n"
"wan2shi4 le5！wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1！"

msgid "That shipment belonged to us. I'm not leaving without it."
msgstr ""
"物资​是​我们​的​。​我​拿​不到​绝不会​走​。\n"
"wu4zi1 shi4 wo3men5 de5。wo3 na2 bu4dao4 jue2 bu4 hui4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"That should be plenty of time for us to finish up what we're working on."
msgstr ""
"这些​时间​对​我们​完成​工作​来说​绰绰有余​了​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 shi2jian1 dui4 wo3men5 wan2cheng2 gong1zuo4 lai2 shuo1 chuo4chuo4you3yu2 le5。"

msgid ""
"That so?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Huh. Learn somethin' new every day."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​哼​，​真是​每天​都​有​新​发现​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1 heng1，zhen1shi5 mei3tian1 dou1 you3 xin1 fa1xian4 a1。"

msgid ""
"That software that you found after you took Plotz down. Have you had a "
"chance to play around with it yet?"
msgstr ""
"你​干掉​普​洛茨​之后​拿到​的​那款​软件​。​你​抽时间​研究​它​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 gan4diao4 Pu3luo4ci2 zhi1hou4 na2dao4 de5 na4 kuan3 ruan3jian4。ni3 chou1shi2jian1 yan2jiu1 ta1 le5 ma5？"

msgid "That sounds bad."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​很​糟糕​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 zao1gao1。"

msgid ""
"That spirit has its fingers in the minds and auras of every kid in this compound. If we kill it, those kids will get hurt. They might even be killed.\n"
"\n"
"We can't take that risk. But if we can cleanse the Adversary's corruption from it, it might withdraw from their minds willingly."
msgstr ""
"那​精魂​已经​渗透​了​这里​每个​孩子​的​意识​和​灵光​。​如果​我们​直接​杀死​它​，​孩子​们​将​受到​伤害​，​甚至​可能​因此​而​丧生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不能​冒​这个​风险​。​但​如果​我们​能​清除​它​身上​来自​反叛者​的​腐化​部分​，​或许​它​就​会​主动​离开​孩子​们​的​意识​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jing1hun2 yi3jing1 shen4tou4 le5 zhe4li3 mei3ge4 hai2zi5 de5 yi4shi2 he4 ling2guang1。ru2guo3 wo3men5 zhi2jie1 sha1si3 ta1，hai2zi5 men5 jiang1 shou4dao4 shang1hai4，shen4zhi4 ke3neng2 yin1ci3 er2 sang4sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4neng2 mao4 zhe4ge5 feng1xian3。dan4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 neng2 qing1chu2 ta1 shen1shang5 lai2zi4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 fu3hua4 bu4fen5，huo4xu3 ta1 jiu4 hui4 zhu3dong4 li2kai1 hai2zi5 men5 de5 yi4shi2。"

msgid ""
"That steam might not be comin' from the trash. Could be there's a vent or a "
"grate underneath all of that."
msgstr ""
"这​蒸汽​可能​不是​从​垃圾​里​冒出来​的​。​也许​下面​有个​通风口​或​排气口​。\n"
"zhe4 zheng1qi4 ke3neng2 bu4shi4 cong2 la1ji1 li3 mao4chu1lai2 de5。ye3xu3 xia4mian4 you3 ge4 tong1feng1kou3 huo4 pai2 qi4 kou3。"

msgid ""
"That steam might not be decomposition. There could be a vent or a grate "
"buried underneath all of that trash."
msgstr ""
"这​蒸汽​可能​不是​腐烂​引起​的​。​也许​下面​埋​着​个​通风口​或者​排气口​。\n"
"zhe4 zheng1qi4 ke3neng2 bu4shi4 fu3lan4 yin3qi3 de5。ye3xu3 xia4mian4 mai2 zhao2 ge4 tong1feng1kou3 huo4zhe3 pai2 qi4 kou3。"

msgid ""
"That takes care of that.\n"
"\n"
"Y'know, I should thank you... you've helped me kill two birds with one stone. I've got the box, and Hasenkamp is gone."
msgstr ""
"这样​就​搞定​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​我​应该​谢谢​你​……​这招​一石二鸟​还​多亏​了​你​帮忙​。​现在​我​拿到​了​盒子​，​哈森​坎普​也​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 jiu4 gao3ding4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1 wo3 ying1gai1 xie4xie5 ni3……zhe4 zhao1 yi1shi2er4niao3 hai2 duo1kui1 le5 ni3 bang1mang2。xian4zai4 wo3 na2dao4 le5 he2zi5，Ha1sen1kan3pu3 ye3 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"That takes money. Rent ain't free, unless you're suggesting I start living "
"on the street. At least here I have a roof over my head."
msgstr ""
"那种​事​需要​钱​。​房租​可不是​免费​的​，​除非​你​建议​我​去​流落​街头​。​至少​在​这里​，​我​还有​个​遮风挡雨​的​地方​。\n"
"na4zhong3 shi4 xu1yao4 qian2。fang2zu1 ke3bu5shi4 mian3fei4 de5，chu2fei1 ni3 jian4yi4 wo3 qu4 liu2luo4 jie1tou2。zhi4shao3 zai4 zhe4li3，wo3 hai2you3 ge4 zhe1 feng1 dang3 yu3 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"That the elf is dead was expected. He was a dangerous and unreasonable person... \"disgruntled,\" you might say, after years of service in our employ.\n"
"\n"
"His betrayal of you was inevitable. Thankfully, with his death, we have gained valuable insight into your character."
msgstr ""
"那个​精灵​的​死​不出所料​。​此人​危险​且​乖张​……​或许​该​说​“​心怀不满​”​，​毕竟​他​为​我​等​效力​多年​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​背叛​你​实属​必然​。​所幸​的​是​，​他​的​死​也​让​我们​洞悉​了​你​的​本性​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 jing1ling2 de5 si3 bu4chu1suo3liao4。ci3 ren2 wei1xian3 qie3 guai1zhang1……huo4xu3 gai1 shuo1“xin1 huai2 bu4 man3”，bi4jing4 ta1 wei2 wo3 deng3 xiao4li4 duo1nian2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bei4pan4 ni3 shi2shu3 bi4ran2。suo3xing4 de5 shi4，ta1 de5 si3 ye3 rang4 wo3men5 dong4xi1 le5 ni3 de5 ben3xing4。"

msgid ""
"That took care of Blitz's debt to Mr. Grinder. Consider this the interest."
msgstr ""
"那​是​布里​茨​和​“​绞肉机​”​先生​之间​的​债务​问题​。​就​当​这​是​利息​吧​。\n"
"na4 shi4 Bu4li3ci2 he4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 zhi1jian1 de5 zhai4wu4 wen4ti2。jiu4 dang1 zhe4 shi4 li4xi1 ba1。"

msgid "That true, Hasenkamp?"
msgstr ""
"是​这么回事​吗​，​哈森​坎普​？\n"
"shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 ma5，Ha1sen1kan3pu3？"

msgid ""
"That vase is going to earn me a nice bonus. It can stay where it is for now,"
" but I'm coming back for it."
msgstr ""
"那​花瓶​能​让​我​赚​上​不少​外快​。​这会儿​让​它​先搁​那儿​，​不过​我​早晚​要​回来​拿​。\n"
"na4 hua1ping2 neng2 rang4 wo3 zhuan4 shang4 bu4shao3 wai4kuai4。zhe4hui4r5 rang4 ta1 xian1 ge1 na4r5，bu4guo4 wo3 zao3wan3 yao4 hui2lai5 na2。"

msgid ""
"That warehouse you told me about is locked up with a keycode panel. You know"
" anything about that?"
msgstr ""
"你​跟​我​提过​的​仓库​门口​有个​密码​面板​。​你​对此​有​什么​了解​吗​？\n"
"ni3 gen1 wo3 ti2 guo4 de5 cang1ku4 men2kou3 you3 ge4 mi4ma3 mian4ban3。ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"That was *crazy,* $(l.freund). Bullets flyin', people dropping like flies..."
" *crazy.*"
msgstr ""
"简直​太​疯狂​了​，​$(l.freund)​。​子弹​四处​乱飞​，​人们​像​苍蝇​一样​掉下来​……​疯狂​。\n"
"jian3zhi2 tai4 feng1kuang2 le5，$(l.freund)。zi3dan4 si4chu4 luan4 fei1，ren2men5 xiang4 cang1ying5 yi1yang4 diao4 xia4 lai2……feng1kuang2。"

msgid ""
"That was Herr Schmidt. There's been a change of plans... he's gonna have a "
"second van pull in while we're upstairs. He wants us to load the MKVI into "
"that one."
msgstr ""
"施密特​先生​刚才​和​我​通话​了​。​计划​有变​……​我们​在​这边​忙​的​时候​，​他会​往​车库​派​第二辆​货车​，​我们​要​把​MKVI​装进​那​一辆车​里​。\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 gang1cai2 he4 wo3 tong1hua4 le5。ji4hua4 you3 bian4……wo3men5 zai4 zhe4bian1 mang2 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 hui4 wang3 che1ku4 pai4 di4 er4 liang4 huo4che1，wo3men5 yao4 ba3 MKVI zhuang1 jin4 na4 yi1 liang4 che1 li3。"

msgid ""
"That was Herr Schmidt. There's been a change of plans... he's gonna have two"
" vans waiting in the garage. We're to put the MKVI in the second one."
msgstr ""
"施密特​先生​刚才​和​我​通话​了​。​计划​有变​……​他会​在​车库​停​两辆​货车​，​我们​要​把​MKVI​装进​第二辆​。\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 gang1cai2 he4 wo3 tong1hua4 le5。ji4hua4 you3 bian4……ta1 hui4 zai4 che1ku4 ting2 liang3 liang4 huo4che1，wo3men5 yao4 ba3 MKVI zhuang1 jin4 di4 er4 liang4。"

msgid ""
"That was a benign mana storm, right? For most people, it was basically "
"harmless."
msgstr ""
"那​是​一场​温和​的​魔力​风暴​，​对​吧​？​对​大多数​人​来说​，​它​基本上​无害​。\n"
"na4 shi4 yi1 chang2 wen1he2 de5 mo2li4 feng1bao4，dui4 ba1？dui4 da4duo1shu4 ren2 lai2 shuo1，ta1 ji1ben3shang5 wu2hai4。"

msgid ""
"That was a difficult year, to be sure. But then it seemed to end as suddenly"
" as it had started."
msgstr ""
"那​确实​是​艰难​的​一年​。​但​它​似乎​转眼间​就​结束​了​，​如同​它​开始​时​那样​突然​。\n"
"na4 que4shi2 shi4 jian1nan2 de5 yi1 nian2。dan4 ta1 si4hu1 zhuan3yan3jian1 jiu4 jie2shu4 le5，ru2tong2 ta1 kai1shi3 shi2 na4yang4 tu1ran2。"

msgid ""
"That was a rhetorical question, genius.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on, $(l.name). Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"我​是​在​反问​，​你​个​大​聪明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​走​吧​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 zai4 fan3wen4，ni3 ge4 dai4 cong1ming5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 zou3 ba1，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"That was already too much information for me, thanks. Let's change the "
"subject."
msgstr ""
"对​我​来说​这​信息量​已经​很大​了​，​谢谢​。​换个​话题​吧​。\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 zhe4 xin4 xi1 liang2 yi3jing1 hen3 dai4 le5，xie4xie5。huan4 ge4 hua4ti2 ba1。"

msgid "That was beautiful, man."
msgstr ""
"那​太好了​，​伙计​。\n"
"na4 tai4hao3le5，huo3ji5。"

msgid "That was disgusting! How can you even *sell* this crap?"
msgstr ""
"太​恶心​了​！​你​怎么​好意思​*​卖​*​这种​鬼​玩意儿​的​？\n"
"tai4 e3xin1 le5！ni3 zen3me5 hao3yi4si5*mai4*zhe4zhong3 gui3 wan2yi4r5 de5？"

msgid "That was for Monika, you monster."
msgstr ""
"这是​为了​莫妮卡​，​你​这​怪物​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 Mo4ni1ka3，ni3 zhe4 guai4wu5。"

msgid ""
"That was hardcore, $(l.name). As in, cold-blooded.\n"
"\n"
"Remind me not to piss you off."
msgstr ""
"这​太狠​了​，​$(l.name)​。​或者说​，​冷血​无情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​小心​不要​招惹​到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai4 hen3 le5，$(l.name)。huo4 zhe3 shuo1，leng3xue4 wu2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 xiao3xin1 bu4yao4 zhao1re3 dao4 ni3。"

msgid "That was it? That was all it took?"
msgstr ""
"就​这样​？​这​就行了​？\n"
"jiu4 zhe4yang4？zhe4 jiu4 xing2 le5？"

msgid ""
"That was pathetic. You go ahead and do your soul-searching... just make sure"
" that it's out of your system before our next run."
msgstr ""
"真是​可悲​。​你​就​继续​自我​反省​吧​……​但​一定​要​在​下次​差事​之前​把​这些​情绪​都​排​干净​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 ke3bei1。ni3 jiu4 ji4xu4 zi4wo3 fan3xing3 ba1……dan4 yi1ding4 yao4 zai4 xia4ci4 cha4shi4 zhi1qian2 ba3 zhe4xie1 qing2xu4 dou1 pai2 gan1jing4。"

msgid ""
"That was pretty cold, boss.\n"
"\n"
"At the very least, you could've talked to the guy. He was a shadowrunner.\n"
"\n"
"One of us."
msgstr ""
"这可够​冷血​的​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至少​，​你​可以​先​和​他​谈谈​。​毕竟​他​也​是​暗影​狂奔​者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​都​是​同行​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ke3 gou4 leng3xue4 de5，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3，ni3 ke3yi3 xian1 he4 ta1 tan2tan2。bi4jing4 ta1 ye3 shi4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 shi4 tong2hang2 a1。"

msgid "That was quick."
msgstr ""
"动作​挺快​啊​。\n"
"dong4zuo4 ting3 kuai4 a1。"

msgid ""
"That was stupid, Glory. It could have been lying to you. Hell, it still "
"could be."
msgstr ""
"这样​做​太​愚蠢​了​，​格洛丽​。​它​可能​是​在​骗​你​。​说不定​现在​也​还​在​骗​你​呢​。\n"
"zhe4yang4 zuo4 tai4 yu2chun3 le5，Ge2luo4li2。ta1 ke3neng2 shi4 zai4 pian4 ni3。shuo1bu5ding4 xian4zai4 ye3 hai2 zai4 pian4 ni3 ni2。"

msgid "That was the plan, jackass."
msgstr ""
"本来​就是​这个​意思​，​蠢货​。\n"
"ben3lai2 jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5 yi4si5，chun3huo4。"

msgid ""
"That was the right choice, $(l.name). That... thing... shouldn't've been "
"alive in the first place."
msgstr ""
"你​做​的​对​，​$(l.name)​。​那个​……​东西​……​从​一​开始​就​不该​活着​。\n"
"ni3 zuo4 de5 dui4，$(l.name)。na4ge5……dong1xi1……cong2 yi1 kai1shi3 jiu4 bu4gai1 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
"That was when the new guys moved in... I guess that they sensed weakness, and the Schwarze Herzen were still disorganized from the transition. \n"
"\n"
"Anyway, long story short, I don't consider myself a member any more... I just wanna get out and do my own thing."
msgstr ""
"那帮​新来​的​家伙​就是​这时候​出现​的​……​我​猜​他们​是​看​出来​有​空子​可​钻​了​，​而​“​黑心​”​那会儿​还​因为​换人​的​事​乱成一团​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总而言之​，​反正​我​觉得​我​已经​不算​帮里​的​人​了​……​我​只​想​离开​这里​，​干​我​自己​的​事​去​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 bang1 xin1 lai2 de5 jia1huo5 jiu4shi4 zhe4 shi2 hou4 chu1xian4 de5……wo3 cai1 ta1men5 shi4 kan4 chu1lai2 you3 kong4zi5 ke3 zuan1 le5，er2“hei1xin1” na4hui4r5 hai2 yin1wei4 huan4ren2 de5 shi4 luan4cheng2yi1tuan2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，fan3zheng4 wo3 jue2de5 wo3 yi3jing1 bu4suan4 bang1 li3 de5 ren2 le5……wo3 zhi3 xiang3 li2kai1 zhe4li3，gan4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 shi4 qu4。"

msgid ""
"That was your choice, Glory. Not mine.\n"
"\n"
"I would never have wanted this for you. If you were unhappy, you should have talked to me about it - we'd have found a way to make things right."
msgstr ""
"那​是​你​的​选择​，​格洛丽​。​不是​我​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从没​希望​你​变成​这样​。​如果​你​感到​不​快乐​的话​，​当初​为什么​不向​我​倾诉​呢​。​我们​总能​找到​补救​的​办法​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 ni3 de5 xuan3ze2，Ge2luo4li2。bu4shi4 wo3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2mei2 xi1wang4 ni3 bian4cheng2 zhe4yang4。ru2guo3 ni3 gan3dao4 bu4 kuai4le4 de5hua4，dang1chu1 wei4shen2me5 bu4 xiang4 wo3 qing1su4 ni2。wo3men5 zong3neng2 zhao3dao4 bu3jiu4 de5 ban4fa3。"

msgid ""
"That wasn't just any dragon we let go. She was a legendary Great Dragon, and"
" she was completely off her rocker. And we set her loose like a caged bird."
msgstr ""
"我们​放走​的​可不是​一般​的​巨龙​。​她​是​一头​传说​级​的​巨龙​，​而且​完全​丧失​了​理智​。​我们​就​像​释放​笼中鸟​一样​把​她​放走​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 fang4zou3 de5 ke3bu5shi4 yi1ban1 de5 ju4long2。ta1 shi4 yi1tou2 chuan2shuo1 ji2 de5 ju4long2，er2qie3 wan2quan2 sang4shi1 le5 li3zhi4。wo3men5 jiu4 xiang4 shi4fang4 long2 zhong4 niao3 yi1yang4 ba3 ta1 fang4zou3 le5。"

msgid "That wasn't your call to make."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​你​可以​做​的​决定​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 ni3 ke3yi3 zuo4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"That weak-ass apology changes nothing. Your behavior after Monika’s death "
"was inexcusable."
msgstr ""
"这种​不痛不痒​的​道歉​谁​不会​说​啊​。​你​在​莫妮卡​死后​的​所作所为​实在​不可​原谅​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 bu4tong4bu4yang3 de5 dao4qian4 shei2 bu4hui4 shuo1 a1。ni3 zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 si3hou4 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2 shi2zai4 bu4ke3 yuan2liang4。"

msgid ""
"That will be 10 nuyen, please.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She hands over a small cup of steaming soup and a sandwich. You take a quick bite and swig down some soup. It's wonderful.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"一共​10​新円​，​谢谢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​递来​一小​碗​热气腾腾​的​汤​和​一个​三明治​。​你​咬了一口​三明治​，​又​喝​了​一口​汤​。​真​舒坦​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"yi1gong4 10 xin1 yuan2，xie4xie5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di4 lai2 yi1 xiao3 wan3 re4qi4teng2teng2 de5 shang1 he4 yi1ge5 san1ming2zhi4。ni3 yao3 le5 yi1 kou3 san1ming2zhi4，you4 he4 le5 yi1kou3 shang1。zhen1 shu1tan5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"That will remain my secret. Suffice it to say that my experiences in Spain "
"gave me a newfound appreciation for high-lethality security systems. Let "
"your imagination run wild from there."
msgstr ""
"这​就是​我​自己​的​秘密​了​。​可以​这么​说​，​我​在​西班牙​的​经历​让​我​对​高​致命性​的​安全​系统​有​了​新​的​认识​。​剩下​的​你​就​自己​想象​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 mi4mi4 le5。ke3yi3 zhe4me5 shuo1，wo3 zai4 xi1ban1ya2 de5 jing1li4 rang4 wo3 dui4 gao1 zhi4 ming4 xing4 de5 an1quan2 xi4tong3 you3 le5 xin1 de5 ren4shi5。sheng4xia4 de5 ni3 jiu4 zi4ji3 xiang3xiang4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"That won't be necessary, Audran. Our guest has agreed to a truce.\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) will not attempt to stop us from doing what must be done."
msgstr ""
"没有​这个​必要​了​，​奥​德兰​。​我们​的​客人​已经​同意​停战​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$+(l.he)​不会​再​阻拦​我们​进行​这项​必须​的​事业​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 zhe4ge5 bi4yao4 le5，Ao4de2lan2。wo3men5 de5 ke4ren2 yi3jing1 tong2yi4 ting2zhan4。\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) bu4hui4 zai4 zu3lan2 wo3men5 jin4xing2 zhe4 xiang4 bi4xu1 de5 shi4ye4。"

msgid "That won't help us much out here, though."
msgstr ""
"不过​这​也​帮不了​我们​多少​。\n"
"bu4guo4 zhe4 ye3 bang1 bu4 le5 wo3men5 duo1shao3。"

msgid ""
"That won't work, $(l.name). If we try to face Harrow with that thing intact,"
" he'll tear us both to shreds."
msgstr ""
"没用​的​，​$(l.name)​。​如果​我们​试图​在​神龛​完好无损​的​情况​下去​对付​哈罗​，​只会​被​他​大卸八块​。\n"
"mei2yong4 de5，$(l.name)。ru2guo3 wo3men5 shi4tu2 zai4 shen2kan1 wan2hao3wu2sun3 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4qu4 dui4fu5 ha1luo2，zhi3 hui4 bei4 ta1 dai4 xie4 ba1 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"That won't work, $(l.name). The shrine's influence can be very strong, and the cultists here have all been brainwashed on top of it.\n"
"\n"
"If we try to pull them away from Feuerstelle without dealing with the shrine first, they'll mob us, because the spirit that Harrow bound into the rock will tell them to."
msgstr ""
"没用​的​，​$(l.name)​。​神龛​的​影响力​非常​强大​，​而​这里​的​教徒​们​更是​被​彻底​洗脑​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​不​先​解决​神龛​就​试图​将​他们​从​“​火坑​”​带走​，​他们​只会​群起而攻之​，​因为​哈罗​封印​在​石中​的​精魂​会​命令​他们​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2yong4 de5，$(l.name)。shen2kan1 de5 ying3xiang3li4 fei1chang2 qiang2da4，er2 zhe4li3 de5 jiao4tu2 men5 geng4shi4 bei4 che4di3 xi3nao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4 xian1 jie3jue2 shen2kan1 jiu4 shi4tu2 jiang1 ta1men5 cong2“huo3keng1” dai4zou3，ta1men5 zhi3 hui4 qun2qi3er2gong1zhi1，yin1wei4 ha1luo2 feng1yin4 zai4 dan4 zhong4 de5 jing1hun2 hui4 ming4ling4 ta1men5 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"That would be a mistake. Underestimating an ancient dragon is never wise, "
"shadowrunner."
msgstr ""
"那​将​是​你​的​错误​。​千万​不要​低估​古龙​的​智慧​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。\n"
"na4 jiang1 shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4wu4。qian1wan4 bu4yao4 di1gu1 gu3long2 de5 zhi4hui4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid "That would be wise of you."
msgstr ""
"明智之举​。\n"
"ming2zhi4zhi1ju3。"

msgid ""
"That'd be an understatement, chum. More accurate to say that I'm THE decker, in these parts at least. \n"
"\n"
"My handle in the Matrix is \"Blitz.\" Maybe you've heard of me?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​可​小瞧​我​了​，​伙计​。​更​准确​的​说法​是​，​我​是​独一无二​的​碟​客​，​至少​在​这些​方面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​矩阵​里​的​名号​叫​“​布里​茨​”​。​兴许​你​听说​过​我​？\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 ke3 xiao3qiao2 wo3 le5，huo3ji5。geng1 zhun3que4 de5 shuo1fa3 shi4，wo3 shi4 du2yi1wu2er4 de5 die2 ke4，zhi4shao3 zai4 zhe4xie1 fang1mian4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 ju3zhen4 li3 de5 ming2hao4 jiao4“Bu4li3ci2”。xing1xu3 ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 wo3？"

msgid ""
"That'd be my guess, yes. In the turmoil surrounding Lofwyr's buyout of Saeder-Krupp, a number of projects went missing.\n"
"\n"
"I believe that APEX was \"appropriated\" by a member of Feuerschwinge's organization at this point. It was then unleashed on its own development team to silence them.\n"
"\n"
"Since then, it has provided information control for the Firewing."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​也​是​这样​。​在​洛夫​维尔​收购​赛德​-​克虏伯​引发​的​骚动​之中​，​有​不少​项目​下落不明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​火翼​组织​的​某位​成员​就是​在​这时​“​接管​”​了​APEX​，​并​随后​令其​消灭​了​自己​的​开发​团队​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从那以后​，​它​就​一直​为​火翼​提供情报​控制​服务​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ye3 shi4 zhe4yang4。zai4 Luo4fu1wei2er3 shou1gou4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 yin3fa1 de5 sao1dong4 zhi1zhong1，you3 bu4shao3 xiang4mu4 xia4luo4bu4ming2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 Huo3yi4 zu3zhi1 de5 mou3 wei4 cheng2yuan2 jiu4shi4 zai4 zhe4shi2“jie1guan3” le5 APEX，bing4 sui2hou4 ling3 qi2 xiao1mie4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 kai1fa1 tuan2dui4。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 na4 yi3 hou4，ta1 jiu4 yi1zhi2 wei2 Huo3yi4 ti2 gong1 qing2 bao4 kong4zhi4 fu2wu4。"

msgid ""
"That'd be the safe bet. And they haven't pulled their guns on him yet, so it's fair to assume that negotiations are going well.\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure that I don't have to tell you this, but the last thing we need is an alliance between some foreign syndicate and Rammbock. No good could come of that."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​也​是​。​而且​既然​他们​还​没​对​他​拔枪​相向​，​所以​我​想​谈判​进展​大概​很​顺利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​不用​我​多​说​，​我们​绝不​希望​某个​外国​犯罪集团​与​撞锤​帮​结盟​。​那​绝不会​有​什么​好​结果​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ye3 shi4。er2qie3 ji4ran2 ta1men5 hai2 mei2 dui4 ta1 ba2 qiang1 xiang1xiang4，suo3yi3 wo3 xiang3 tan2pan4 jin4zhan3 da4gai4 hen3 shun4li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 bu4yong4 wo3 duo1 shuo1，wo3men5 jue2bu4 xi1wang4 mou3 ge4 wai4guo2 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 yu4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 jie2meng2。na4 jue2 bu4 hui4 you3 shen2me5 hao3 jie1guo3。"

msgid ""
"That'd be... uh... great, Phil. I'm sure that you'd be a really big help."
msgstr ""
"这个​……​呃​……​挺​好​的​，​菲尔​。​我​确信​你​会​提供​很大​的​帮助​。\n"
"zhe4ge5……e4……ting3 hao3 de5，fei1 er3。wo3 que4xin4 ni3 hui4 ti2gong1 hen3 dai4 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid "That'd cost you extra, sweetie. Is it important?"
msgstr ""
"得加​钱​，​宝贝儿​。​是​重要​的​事​吗​？\n"
"de2 jia1 qian2，bao3bei4r5。shi4 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "That's $(scene.himher)! Open fire!"
msgstr ""
"$(scene.himher)​在​那​！​开火​！\n"
"$(scene.himher) zai4 na4！kai1huo3！"

msgid ""
"That's EXACTLY what a spirit would say! An' then it'd get in here, and it'd... it'd... it'd eat my eyes! Suck 'em right out of my skull! I've SEEN IT HAPPEN!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}You hear a ragged intake of breath, and then the shrill voice raises into a scream.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"GET AWAY FROM ME!"
msgstr ""
"这​正是​精魂​会​说​的话​！​然后​它​就​会​进来​，​它​就​会​……​会​……​会​吃掉​我​的​眼睛​！​把​它们​从​我​的​脑袋​里​吸出来​！​我见​过​这种​事​发生​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​听到​一阵​急促​的​呼吸​，​然后​刺耳​的​声音​变成​尖叫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​离​我​远点​！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zheng4shi4 jing1hun2 hui4 shuo1 de5hua4！ran2hou4 ta1 jiu4 hui4 jin4lai2，ta1 jiu4 hui4……hui4……hui4 chi1diao4 wo3 de5 yan3jing5！ba3 ta1men5 cong2 wo3 de5 nao3dai5 li3 xi1 chu1 lai2！wo3 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ting1dao4 yi1zhen4 ji2cu4 de5 hu1xi1，ran2hou4 ci4er3 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4cheng2 jian1jiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"li2 wo3 yuan3 dian3！"

msgid ""
"That's Kroner at the bar over there. He'll take care of you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He buries his nose back into his comic book while tapping a meaty thumb on the black plastic slung from his belt. A high-powered stun gun.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just play nice, or you'll meet Herr Zapp. "
msgstr ""
"吧台​那边​站​着​的​是​克​罗纳​。​你​要​什么​就​找​他​要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把头​重新​埋进​漫画书​里​，​同时​用​粗壮​的​拇指​敲​了​敲​腰​上​挂​着​的​黑色​塑料​块​—​—​一把​大功率​电击​枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​放​老实​点​，​不然​你​就​得​见见​霹雳​老大哥​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ba1tai2 na4bian5 zhan4 zhao2 de5 shi4 ke4 luo2na4。ni3 yao4 shen2me5 jiu4 zhao3 ta1 yao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3tou2 chong2xin1 mai2 jin4 man4 hua4 shu1 li3，tong2shi2 yong4 cu1zhuang4 de5 mu3zhi3 qiao1 le5 qiao1 yao1 shang4 gua4 zhao2 de5 hei1se4 su4liao4 kuai4——yi1 ba3 dai4 gong1 shuai4 dian4ji1 qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 fang4 lao3shi5 dian3，bu4ran2 ni3 jiu4 de2 jian4 jian4 pi1li4 lao3da4ge1 le5。"

msgid "That's a bad deal all around. I'm sorry to hear it, friend."
msgstr ""
"真是太​糟糕​了​。​我​深表遗憾​，​朋友​。\n"
"zhen1 shi4 tai4 zao1gao1 le5。wo3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"That's a cop-out, $(l.name). You're the leader of this team.\n"
"\n"
"Of course it's your place to judge."
msgstr ""
"这​是​在​推卸责任​，​$(l.name)​。​你​可是​这支​队伍​的​领队​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​当然​有​权利​评判​每个​人​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 zai4 tui1 xie4 ze2 ren4，$(l.name)。ni3 ke3shi4 zhe4 zhi1 dui4wu3 de5 ling3dui4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dang1ran2 you3 quan2li4 ping2pan4 mei3ge4 ren2。"

msgid "That's a frightening thought."
msgstr ""
"这​是​个​可怕​的​想法​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4 ke3pa4 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid ""
"That's a great plan. \"Let's do something drastic and irreversible, then "
"worry about the consequences later.\" Sounds like a winner to me."
msgstr ""
"真是​个​绝佳​的​计划​啊​。​“​让​我们​采取​一些​极端​且​不​可逆​的​措施​，​然后​再​担心​后果​。​”​听​起来​是​个​好​主意​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 jue2jia1 de5 ji4hua4 a1。“rang4 wo3men5 cai3qu3 yi1xie1 ji2duan1 qie3 bu4 ke3ni4 de5 cuo4shi1，ran2hou4 zai4 dan1xin1 hou4guo3。” ting1 qi3lai5 shi4 ge4 hao3 zhu3yi5。"

msgid "That's a hell of a résumé."
msgstr ""
"这​履历​真够​厉害​的​。\n"
"zhe4 lu:3li4 zhen1 gou4 li4hai5 de5。"

msgid "That's a little too close to the Kreuzbasar for comfort."
msgstr ""
"这离​克洛伊​茨​集市​太近​了​，​让​人​不​踏实​啊​。\n"
"zhe4 li2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 tai4 jin4 le5，rang4 ren2 bu4 ta1shi5 a1。"

msgid "That's a nice pitch, Spirit. But you neglected to mention the price."
msgstr ""
"挺会​说​啊​，​精魂​。​但​你​还​没​提到​代价​是​什么​。\n"
"ting3 hui4 shuo1 a1，jing1hun2。dan4 ni3 hai2 mei2 ti2dao4 dai4jia4 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"That's a smart decision.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She reaches out to blindfold you, and the world goes dark.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"算​你​识相​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​伸手​把​眼罩​套​在​你​头上​。​你​的​世界​变得​一片​漆黑​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"suan4 ni3 shi2xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1shou3 ba3 yan3zhao4 tao4 zai4 ni3 tou2shang4。ni3 de5 shi4jie4 bian4de5 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"That's about all I can think of. I steer clear of the new guys when I can.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She steals a glance over her shoulder at Kroner, a scowl on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I shouldn't have to tell you why."
msgstr ""
"我能​想到​的​差不多​就​这些​吧​。​这些​人来​了​以后​，​我​都​是​能​躲​就​躲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​瞥​了​一眼​身后​的​克​罗纳​，​表情​阴沉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​也​用不着​解释​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 xiang3dao4 de5 cha4bu5duo1 jiu4 zhe4xie1 ba1。zhe4xie1 ren2 lai2 le5 yi3hou4，wo3 dou1 shi4 neng2 duo3 jiu4 duo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 shen1hou4 de5 ke4 luo2na4，biao3qing2 yin1chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 yong4bu5zhao2 jie3shi4 le5。"

msgid "That's about right, yeah."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​就是​这么回事​。\n"
"mei2cuo4，jiu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。"

msgid ""
"That's all fine and good, but be quick about it. There were some guards in "
"the other room, and I don't want to be here if they decide to come "
"exploring."
msgstr ""
"那​还​不错​，​但​动作​要​快​。​隔壁​房间​有​几个​守卫​，​要是​他们​决定​过来​搜查​，​我​可​不想​被困​在​这里​。\n"
"na4 hai2 bu4cuo4，dan4 dong4zuo4 yao4 kuai4。ge2bi4 fang2jian1 you3 ji3ge5 shou3wei4，yao4shi5 ta1men5 jue2ding4 guo4lai2 sou1cha2，wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"That's all for now, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"You've heard the tale, you know why I am the way I am. You know the things I've done, and how much I have to atone for."
msgstr ""
"暂时​就​说​到​这里​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听​过​了​我​的​故事​，​也​明白​我​为何​如此​。​你​知晓​我​的​所作所为​，​也​清楚​我​需要​救赎​的​罪孽​有​多​深重​。\n"
"\n"
"zan4shi2 jiu4 shuo1 dao4 zhe4li3 ba1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1 guo4 le5 wo3 de5 gu4shi4，ye3 ming2bai5 wo3 wei4he2 ru2ci3。ni3 zhi1xiao3 wo3 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2，ye3 qing1chu5 wo3 xu1yao4 jiu4shu2 de5 zui4nie4 you3 duo1 shen1zhong4。"

msgid "That's all for now."
msgstr ""
"就​这些​了​。\n"
"jiu4 zhe4xie1 le5。"

msgid "That's all he had in here? Drek."
msgstr ""
"这​里面​就​这点​东西​？​靠​。\n"
"zhe4 li3mian4 jiu4 zhe4 dian3 dong1xi1？kao4。"

msgid ""
"That's all right, feel free to browse for as long as you like! I'll be right"
" here if you have any questions."
msgstr ""
"没关系​，​请​随意​浏览​多久​都行​！​有​任何​问题​随时​找​我​。\n"
"mei2guan1xi5，qing3 sui2yi4 liu2lan3 duo1jiu3 dou1 xing2！you3 ren4he2 wen4ti2 sui2shi2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid "That's all that I needed to know."
msgstr ""
"我​没​别的​事​了​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 bie2de5 shi4 le5。"

msgid "That's all that I needed."
msgstr ""
"我​没​别的​事​了​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 bie2de5 shi4 le5。"

msgid "That's all that I needed. I'll let you get back to your inventory."
msgstr ""
"我​就​说​这么​多​。​你​继续​整理​你​的​库存​吧​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4 shuo1 zhe4me5 duo1。ni3 ji4xu4 zheng3li3 ni3 de5 ku4cun2 ba1。"

msgid "That's all the info I need for now."
msgstr ""
"我​没​其他​要​问​的​了​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 qi2ta1 yao4 wen4 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's all water under the bridge now. Let's just get this thing over with."
msgstr ""
"算了​，​反正​事情​已经​这样​了​。​我们​还是​赶紧​把​任务​搞定​吧​。\n"
"suan4le5，fan3zheng4 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 zhe4yang4 le5。wo3men5 hai2shi5 gan3jin3 ba3 ren4wu5 gao3ding4 ba1。"

msgid "That's all we’ve got."
msgstr ""
"我们​只​知道​这些​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's all you want? For me to tell you about the hotel?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The girl's mood visibly brightens, and the tremor in her lower lip disappears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, sure. Yeah, I'll tell you whatever you need!"
msgstr ""
"你​只要​这个​？​我​只要​告诉​你​旅馆​是​什么样​就行​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​女孩​的​心情​明显​放晴​，​下​嘴唇​也​不再​发抖​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​好​。​当然​可以​，​你​问​什么​我​都​会​告诉​你​的​！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi3yao4 zhe4ge5？wo3 zhi3yao4 gao4su4 ni3 lu:3guan3 shi4 shen2me5yang4 jiu4 xing2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3hai2 de5 xin1qing2 ming2xian3 fang4qing2，xia4 zui3chun2 ye3 bu4zai4 fa1dou3 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，hao3。dang1ran2 ke3yi3，ni3 wen4 shen2me5 wo3 dou1 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 de5！"

msgid "That's all you're gonna do, right? I'm trusting you here."
msgstr ""
"你​不会​做​别的​了​吧​？​我​可是​相信​你​的​啊​。\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 zuo4 bie2de5 le5 ba1？wo3 ke3shi4 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5 a1。"

msgid "That's all, Eiger. Thanks for the talk."
msgstr ""
"就​这些​了​，​艾格尔​。​谢​了​。\n"
"jiu4 zhe4xie1 le5，Ai4ge2er3。xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's an even longer story, and not one that I want to get into. Suffice it to say that it started with killing the guy who inked me, and ended in a pretty dark place.\n"
"\n"
"The upshot is that I can't go back to Japan. Ever. But at least I got my autonomy back."
msgstr ""
"这​是​个​更长​的​故事​，​我​也​不想​过多​回忆​。​我​只能​说​，​故事​的​开头​是​杀​了​给​我​纹身​的​人​，​而​结尾​相当​黑暗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这件​事​的​结果​就是​，​我​再也不能​回​日本​了​。​永远​不能​。​但​至少​我​恢复​了​自主性​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4 geng1 zhang3 de5 gu4shi4，wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 guo4duo1 hui2yi4。wo3 zhi3neng2 shuo1，gu4shi4 de5 kai1tou2 shi4 sha1 le5 gei3 wo3 wen2shen1 de5 ren2，er2 jie2wei3 xiang1dang1 hei1an4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4 de5 jie1guo3 jiu4shi4，wo3 zai4 ye3 bu4 neng2 hui2 ri4ben3 le5。yong3yuan3 bu4neng2。dan4 zhi4shao3 wo3 hui1fu4 le5 zi4 zhu3 xing4。"

msgid "That's an interesting way of putting it."
msgstr ""
"你​这套​说辞​还​挺​有意思​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4 tao4 shuo1ci2 hai2 ting3 you3yi4si5。"

msgid "That's an understatement, love."
msgstr ""
"这话​也​太​轻描淡写​了​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 ye3 tai4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 le5，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid "That's an understatement."
msgstr ""
"这话​也​太​轻描淡写​了​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 ye3 tai4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 le5。"

msgid "That's an understatement. Let's get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"你​真会​轻描淡写​啊​。​我们​快​离开​这里​吧​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1 hui4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 a1。wo3men5 kuai4 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"That's an... interesting observation.\n"
"\n"
"What makes you say that?"
msgstr ""
"这​是​个​……​有趣​的​观点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​为什么​会​这么​想​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4……you3qu4 de5 guan1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 hui4 zhe4me5 xiang3？"

msgid "That's bad news. There's nothing more dangerous than a zealot."
msgstr ""
"真是​个​坏消息​。​狂​信徒​最​危险​了​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 huai4 xiao1 xi1。kuang2 xin4tu2 zui4 wei1xian3 le5。"

msgid "That's bad. Did she make it out okay, too?"
msgstr ""
"真​可惜​。​她​也​顺利​逃出来​了​吗​？\n"
"zhen1 ke3xi1。ta1 ye3 shun4li4 tao2 chu1 lai2 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"That's because it's going to be.\n"
"\n"
"Feuerstelle is a vile, toxic place. I still have nightmares about some of the things that I saw here... after tonight, you might wind up with a few of your own."
msgstr ""
"因为​事实​就是​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​火坑​”​是​个​污秽不堪​、​邪恶​至极​的​地方​。​我​至今​仍会​因​当年​目睹​的​某些​景象​而​噩梦​缠身​……​今晚​过后​，​你​恐怕​也​会​做​上​几个​噩梦​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 shi4shi2 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"“huo3keng1” shi4 ge4 wu1 hui4 bu4 kan1、xie2e4 zhi4ji2 de5 di4fang1。wo3 zhi4jin1 reng2 hui4 yin1 dang1nian2 mu4du3 de5 mou3xie1 jing3xiang4 er2 e4meng4 chan2shen1……jin1wan3 guo4hou4，ni3 kong3pa4 ye3 hui4 zuo4 shang4 ji3ge5 e4meng4。"

msgid ""
"That's because it's true! I... I'll prove it to you!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The words come stammering out of her. Her eyes are fixed on Glory's razors.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ask me anything you want - I'll show you that I'm telling the truth. I never wanted anything bad to happen to you, Glory - not ever."
msgstr ""
"因为​我​说​的​是​真的​！​我​……​我​可以​证明​给​你​看​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​结结巴巴​地​挤出​这句​话​，​双眼​仍然​死死​盯​着​格洛丽​指尖​的​利刃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​尽管​问​我​任何​问题​。​我会​证明​我​说​的​是​实话​。​格洛丽​，​我​从来​没想​过​要害​你​—​—​从来​没有​。\n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 shuo1 de5 shi4 zhen1de5！wo3……wo3 ke3yi3 zheng4ming2 gei3 ni3 kan4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jie1jie1ba1ba5 de5 ji3chu1 zhe4 ju4 hua4，shuang1yan3 reng2ran2 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 zhi3jian1 de5 li4ren4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 jin3guan3 wen4 wo3 ren4he2 wen4ti2。wo3 hui4 zheng4ming2 wo3 shuo1 de5 shi4 shi2hua4。Ge2luo4li2，wo3 cong2lai2 mei2 xiang3 guo4 yao4hai4 ni3——cong2lai2 mei2you3。"

msgid ""
"That's big of you, $(l.name). I genuinely mean that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory takes a moment to steel herself, then continues on.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​能​这么​说​真​了不起​，​$(l.name)​。​我​真心​这么​觉得​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​深吸​一口气​，​强忍​着​情绪​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 zhe4me5 shuo1 zhen1 liao3bu5qi3，$(l.name)。wo3 zhen1xin1 zhe4me5 jue2de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，qiang3ren3 zhao2 qing2xu4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "That's big of you. I should get back to work."
msgstr ""
"你​真是​位好​父亲​。​好​吧​，​我该​回去​工作​了​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 wei4 hao3 fu4qin1。hao3 ba1，wo3 gai1 hui2qu5 gong1zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's big of you. Now, if you have anything else to say, go ahead and say "
"it."
msgstr ""
"你​可​真​大度​。​现在​，​如果​你​还有​什么​要说​的​，​尽管​说​吧​。\n"
"ni3 ke3 zhen1 da4du4。xian4zai4，ru2guo3 ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4shuo1 de5，jin3guan3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"That's bullshit! *They* attacked *us*! And then Knight Errant showed up, and"
" everything went to hell."
msgstr ""
"那​是​扯淡​！​是​*​他们​*​攻击​了​*​我们​*​！​然后​游侠​骑士​出现​了​，​一切​都​完蛋​了​。\n"
"na4 shi4 che3dan4！shi4*ta1men5*gong1ji1 le5*wo3men5*！ran2hou4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 chu1xian4 le5，yi1qie4 dou1 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid "That's done it! C'mon, boss, let's get the hell out of here!"
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​！​走​吧​，​老大​……​咱们​赶紧​离开​这里​！\n"
"gao3ding4 le5！zou3 ba1，lao3da4……zan2men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3！"

msgid ""
"That's done it! C'mon, chief... let's listen to the nice lady and get the "
"hell out of here!"
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​！​走​吧​，​头儿​……​咱们​赶紧​听从​这位​友善​女士​的​建议​，​离开​这里​！\n"
"gao3ding4 le5！zou3 ba1，tou2r5……zan2men5 gan3jin3 ting1cong2 zhe4wei4 you3shan4 nu:3shi4 de5 jian4yi4，li2kai1 zhe4li3！"

msgid ""
"That's done it, $(l.name)! The generators are set to blow!\n"
"\n"
"Well done making it all the way there undetected... I wouldn't have thought it possible."
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​，​$(l.name)​！​发电机​即将​爆炸​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​整场​任务​直到现在​都​没​被​人​发现​，​干​的​漂亮​……​我​还​以为​这​不​可能​做到​。\n"
"\n"
"gao3ding4 le5，$(l.name)！fa1dian4ji1 ji2jiang1 bao4zha4！\n"
"\n"
"zheng3 chang2 ren4wu5 zhi2dao4xian4zai4 dou1 mei2 bei4 ren2 fa1xian4，gan4 de5 piao4liang5……wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 zhe4 bu4 ke3neng2 zuo4dao4。"

msgid ""
"That's done it, chief! Bail on out of there - once you've both made it into "
"the next room, I'll lock the door behind you. That should buy you a few "
"seconds, at least!"
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​，​头儿​！​赶紧​撤​吧​—​—​等​你​俩​到​下个​房间​后​，​我会​锁上​你们​背后​的​门​。​这样​起码​能​给​你们​争取​一点​时间​！\n"
"gao3ding4 le5，tou2r5！gan3jin3 che4 ba1——deng3 ni3 lia3 dao4 xia4ge5 fang2jian1 hou4，wo3 hui4 suo3shang4 ni3men5 bei4hou4 de5 men2。zhe4yang4 qi3ma3 neng2 gei3 ni3men5 zheng1qu3 yi1dian3 shi2jian1！"

msgid ""
"That's done it, chief! The final firewall just went down.\n"
"\n"
"I should be clear to access that secure node now."
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​，​头儿​！​最后​的​防火墙​也​下线​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​现在​应该​可以​访问​安保​节点​了​。\n"
"\n"
"gao3ding4 le5，tou2r5！zui4hou4 de5 fang2huo3qiang2 ye3 xia4xian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 ying1gai1 ke3yi3 fang3wen4 an1bao3 jie2dian3 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's done it. The fuse is lit, fearless leader... let's get the hell out "
"of here!"
msgstr ""
"搞定​了​。​引线​已经​点燃​，​无畏​领袖​……​咱们​赶紧​离开​这里​！\n"
"gao3ding4 le5。yin3xian4 yi3jing1 dian3ran2，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4……zan2men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3！"

msgid ""
"That's enough. Hermie's death was a tragedy - I will *NOT* let you use it to"
" manipulate me."
msgstr ""
"够​了​。​赫米​的​死​是​个​悲剧​—​—​我​*​不准​*​你​利用​这件​事来​操纵​我​。\n"
"gou4 le5。he4 mi3 de5 si3 shi4 ge4 bei1ju4——wo3*bu4zhun3*ni3 li4yong4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 lai2 cao1zong4 wo3。"

msgid "That's exactly what I was thinking! How did you know!"
msgstr ""
"我​就是​这么​想​的​！​你​怎么​知道​！\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5！ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4！"

msgid ""
"That's fair enough. Just remember: if you can get that shipment back, I'll "
"be able to put some better weapons on the shelves here. Hardware like that "
"might come in handy for one such as yourself."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​记住​：​如果​你​能​把​那​批货​弄​回来​，​我​就​能​在​这里​的​货架​上​摆​上​一些​更好​的​武器​。​对​你​这样​的​人​来说​，​这样​的​硬件​可能​会​派上用场​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。ji4zhu5：ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 ba3 na4 pi1 huo4 long4 hui2lai5，wo3 jiu4 neng2 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 huo4jia4 shang4 bai3 shang4 yi1xie1 geng1 hao3 de5 wu3qi4。dui4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2 lai2 shuo1，zhe4yang4 de5 ying4jian4 ke3neng2 hui4 pai4shang4yong4chang3。"

msgid ""
"That's fair, I suppose. I'll respect your privacy - and hers.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich takes a long pull on the bottle, then tips it forward, pouring the rest on the ground.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Rest in peace, Monika. We'll miss you, girl."
msgstr ""
"也​有​道理​。​我​应当​尊重​你们​俩​的​隐私​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​最后​喝​了​一口​，​然后​将​酒瓶​前倾​，​把​残余​的​酒液​洒向​地面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​愿​你​安息​，​莫妮卡​。​我们​会​想念​你​的​，​姑娘​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3 you3 dao4li5。wo3 ying1dang1 zun1zhong4 ni3men5 lia3 de5 yin3si1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 zui4hou4 he4 le5 yi1kou3，ran2hou4 jiang1 jiu3 ping2 qian2qing1，ba3 can2yu2 de5 jiu3 ye4 sa3 xiang4 di4mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yuan4 ni3 an1xi1，Mo4ni1ka3。wo3men5 hui4 xiang3nian4 ni3 de5，gu1niang5。"

msgid "That's fair."
msgstr ""
"还​算​合理​。\n"
"hai2 suan4 he2li3。"

msgid ""
"That's far enough, friend.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}An older man raises his hand, squinting as you approach. To his left, a young ork shifts his weight, resting one hand casually on a pistol at his hip. \n"
"\n"
"Both are dressed in what might be considered uniforms, but it is hard to tell for sure.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"别​再​往前走​了​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一位​老人​举起​手​，​眯着​眼睛​看着​你​走近​。​他​的​左边​有个​年轻​的​兽​人​在​略微​调整​站姿​，​一只​手​随意​地​搭​在​腰间​的​手枪​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​两人​穿​的​衣服​都​有点​像是​制服​，​但​很​难​确定​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"bie4 zai4 wang3 qian2 zou3 le5，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 wei4 lao3ren2 ju3qi3 shou3，mi2 zhao2 yan3jing5 kan4 zhao2 ni3 zou3jin4。ta1 de5 zuo3bian5 you3 ge4 nian2qing1 de5 shou4 ren2 zai4 lu:e4wei1 tiao2zheng3 zhan4zi1，yi1 zhi3 shou3 sui2yi4 de5 da1 zai4 yao1jian1 de5 shou3qiang1 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 liang3 ren2 chuan1 de5 yi1fu5 dou1 you3dian3 xiang4 shi4 zhi4fu2，dan4 hen3 nan2 que4ding4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"That's fine. Make this all about me if you want... do what makes you happy.\n"
"\n"
"You're wrong, of course. But believe what you like while you still can."
msgstr ""
"没事​。​你​愿意​的话​尽管​可以​指责​我​……​你​开心​就​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​你​肯定​是​错​的​。​但​你​已经​身处​这种​状况​了​，​我​为何​还要​阻拦​你​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4。ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4 jin3guan3 ke3yi3 zhi3ze2 wo3……ni3 kai1xin1 jiu4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 cuo4 de5。dan4 ni3 yi3jing1 shen1chu3 zhe4zhong3 zhuang4kuang4 le5，wo3 wei4he2 hai2 yao4 zu3lan2 ni3 ni2。"

msgid "That's for me to decide."
msgstr ""
"这事​得​我​说了算​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 de2 wo3 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid "That's funny. Simmy Kim tells a different story."
msgstr ""
"有意思​。​金阿吸​可不是​这么​说​的​。\n"
"you3yi4si5。jin1 e1 xi1 ke3bu5shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5。"

msgid "That's generally how a team works, yes."
msgstr ""
"这​就是​团队​协作​的​意义​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 tuan2dui4 xie2zuo4 de5 yi4yi4。"

msgid "That's great, Blitz! But how're you doing on those turrets?"
msgstr ""
"非常​好​，​布里​茨​！​但​你​要​拿​这些​炮塔​怎么办​？\n"
"fei1chang2 hao3，Bu4li3ci2！dan4 ni3 yao4 na2 zhe4xie1 pao4ta3 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid "That's handy. Making people uncomfortable is my specialty."
msgstr ""
"这个​好​说​。​让​别人​感觉​不​舒服​正是​我​的​专长​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 hao3 shuo1。rang4 bie2ren5 gan3jue2 bu4 shu1fu5 zheng4shi4 wo3 de5 zhuan1chang2。"

msgid ""
"That's impossibly sweet of you, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}If you didn't know any better, you'd swear that she was fighting back tears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I won't forget it."
msgstr ""
"你​能​这么​说​真是​太好了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​要不是​你​了解​她​，​你​简直​要​以为​她​正在​强忍​泪水​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​忘记​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 zhe4me5 shuo1 zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yao4bu5shi4 ni3 liao3jie3 ta1，ni3 jian3zhi2 yao4 yi3wei2 ta1 zheng4zai4 qiang3ren3 lei4shui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 wang4ji4 de5。"

msgid "That's it for now."
msgstr ""
"目前​没​别的​事​了​。\n"
"mu4qian2 mei2 bie2de5 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's it. We're done.\n"
"\n"
"Let's go."
msgstr ""
"行​了​，​搞定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，gao3ding4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid "That's it?"
msgstr ""
"就​这样​？\n"
"jiu4 zhe4yang4？"

msgid "That's it? No catch?"
msgstr ""
"就​这样​？​没什么​陷阱​？\n"
"jiu4 zhe4yang4？mei2shen2me5 xian4jing3？"

msgid ""
"That's just it - I don't think that this is *your* magic. In fact, I'm sure "
"that it isn't. And that's what worries me."
msgstr ""
"问题​就​出​在​这儿​。​我​不​认为​这是​*​你​的​*​魔法​。​我​甚至​可以​确信​它​不是​。​这才​是​最令​我​担心​的​。\n"
"wen4ti2 jiu4 chu1 zai4 zhe4r5。wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 zhe4 shi4*ni3 de5*mo2fa3。wo3 shen4zhi4 ke3yi3 que4xin4 ta1 bu4shi4。zhe4 cai2 shi4 zui4 ling3 wo3 dan1xin1 de5。"

msgid ""
"That's just your old self talking. Your past, coming back to haunt you."
msgstr ""
"那​只是​以前​的​你​在​作祟​。​是​你​的​过去​再​一次​回来​纠缠​你​。\n"
"na4 zhi3shi4 yi3qian2 de5 ni3 zai4 zuo4sui4。shi4 ni3 de5 guo4qu4 zai4 yi1ci4 hui2lai5 jiu1chan2 ni3。"

msgid "That's lovely singing, Kim."
msgstr ""
"唱​的​真​好听​，​阿金​。\n"
"chang4 de5 zhen1 hao3ting1，e1 jin1。"

msgid ""
"That's me. You guys go ahead and get out of here... I'll take over for you."
msgstr ""
"是​我​没错​。​你们​可以​离开​这里​了​……​我会​接替​你们​。\n"
"shi4 wo3 mei2cuo4。ni3men5 ke3yi3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 le5……wo3 hui4 jie1ti4 ni3men5。"

msgid ""
"That's military-grade armor he's wearing, $(l.name). Hardened against small arms fire. \n"
"\n"
"We'll have a tough time getting through it."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​他​穿​的​是​军用​级​装甲​，​针对​轻型​武器​进行​过​硬化​改良​处理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​想​打​穿​那​东西​，​我们​得费​一番​工夫​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ta1 chuan1 de5 shi4 jun1yong4 ji2 zhuang1jia3，zhen1dui4 qing1xing2 wu3qi4 jin4xing2 guo4 ying4hua4 gai3liang2 chu3li3。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 xiang3 da3 chuan1 na4 dong1xi1，wo3men5 de2 fei4 yi1 fan1 gong1fu1。"

msgid "That's more like it. One dead mage, coming right up."
msgstr ""
"这​还​差不多​。​一个​法师​而已​，​我分​分钟​弄死​他​。\n"
"zhe4 hai2 cha4bu5duo1。yi1ge5 fa3shi1 er2yi3，wo3 fen4 fen1zhong1 nong4si3 ta1。"

msgid "That's my cue to leave. Catch you later, Zaak."
msgstr ""
"话​就​聊到​这里​吧​。​回头见​，​扎克​。\n"
"hua4 jiu4 liao2 dao4 zhe4li3 ba1。hui2tou2jian4，Zha1ke4。"

msgid ""
"That's my point. Look at this place. Cram is just a means to an end for "
"these people. They'll bleed you dry and leave you with *nothing,* Silke."
msgstr ""
"我​说​的​就是​这个​。​西​尔克​，​你​好好​看看​这​地方​。​卖药​只是​个​控制​你​的​手段​。​他们​早晚​会​把​你​的​血​吸干​，​然后​啃得​连渣​都​不​剩​的​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 de5 jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5。Xi1er3ke4，ni3 hao3hao3 kan4kan5 zhe4 di4fang1。mai4 yao4 zhi3shi4 ge4 kong4zhi4 ni3 de5 shou3duan4。ta1men5 zao3wan3 hui4 ba3 ni3 de5 xie3 xi1 gan4，ran2hou4 ken3 de2 lian2 zha1 dou1 bu4 sheng4 de5。"

msgid "That's my problem, and none of your concern."
msgstr ""
"这​是​我​的​私事​，​与​你​无关​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 si1shi4，yu4 ni3 wu2guan1。"

msgid ""
"That's news to me. I've been living off the grid for a while - no Matrix "
"access, and I don't hear much news."
msgstr ""
"这倒​是​挺​新鲜​的​。​我​最近​一直​过​着​隐居​生活​—​—​没有​接入​矩阵​，​也​没​怎么​关注​新闻​。\n"
"zhe4 dao3 shi4 ting3 xin1xian1 de5。wo3 zui4jin4 yi1zhi2 guo4 zhao2 yin3ju1 sheng1huo2——mei2you3 jie1ru4 ju3zhen4，ye3 mei2 zen3me5 guan1zhu4 xin1wen2。"

msgid ""
"That's nice. Now can we jump to the part where you're doing something "
"horrendous, and I have to stop you?"
msgstr ""
"挺​好​的​。​我们​能​不能​跳过​这些​，​直接​开始​你​要​做​某种​可怕​的​事情​，​而​我​不得不​阻止​你​的​部分​？\n"
"ting3 hao3 de5。wo3men5 neng2 bu4neng2 tiao4guo4 zhe4xie1，zhi2jie1 kai1shi3 ni3 yao4 zuo4 mou3zhong3 ke3pa4 de5 shi4qing5，er2 wo3 bu4de2bu4 zu3zhi3 ni3 de5 bu4fen5？"

msgid ""
"That's no business of yours. The situation is being handled, that's all that you need to know.\n"
"\n"
"I'm just sorry that you weren't able to benefit from the opportunity that I had to offer. This turn of affairs is your loss, not mine."
msgstr ""
"这​和​你​没关系​。​已经​有人​接手​了​，​你​知道​这个​就够​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​感觉​有点​遗憾​，​你​没能​从​我​提供​的​这个​好​机会​中​获益​。​但​反正​这​是​你​的​损失​，​和​我​无关​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 he4 ni3 mei2guan1xi5。yi3jing1 you3ren2 jie1shou3 le5，ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4ge5 jiu4 gou4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 gan3jue2 you3dian3 yi2han4，ni3 mei2 neng2 cong2 wo3 ti2gong1 de5 zhe4ge5 hao3 ji1hui4 zhong4 huo4yi4。dan4 fan3zheng4 zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 sun3shi1，he4 wo3 wu2guan1。"

msgid "That's noble of you, Phil. Let's change the subject, huh?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​很​高尚​，​菲尔​。​换个​话题​吧​？\n"
"na4 ni3 hen3 gao1shang4，fei1 er3。huan4 ge4 hua4ti2 ba1？"

msgid "That's not a story that I'm interested in telling out of context."
msgstr ""
"我​不想​把​这个​故事​单独​拿出​来讲​。\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 ba3 zhe4ge5 gu4shi4 dan1du2 na2chu1 lai2jiang3。"

msgid ""
"That's not all we have. As I was saying when you first walked in, I have been productive as well.\n"
"\n"
"I was able to uncover some new evidence in your absence. And coincidentally enough, that evidence pertains to our scarred friend."
msgstr ""
"不仅如此​。​你​刚回来​的​时候​我​就​想​说​，​我​这边​有​了​不少​收获​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​在​的​时候​，​我​发现​了​一些​新​的​证据​。​巧合​的​是​，​这些​证据​与​我们​的​疤脸​朋友​有关​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4jin3ru2ci3。ni3 gang1 hui2 lai2 de5 shi2hou5 wo3 jiu4 xiang3 shuo1，wo3 zhe4bian1 you3 le5 bu4shao3 shou1huo4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 zai4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1xie1 xin1 de5 zheng4ju4。qiao3he2 de5 shi4，zhe4xie1 zheng4ju4 yu4 wo3men5 de5 ba1 lian3 peng2you5 you3guan1。"

msgid "That's not an answer."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​我要​的​答案​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 yao4 de5 da2an4。"

msgid "That's not an answer. Tell me what you are."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​我要​的​答案​。​告诉​我​你​究竟​是​什么​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 yao4 de5 da2an4。gao4su4 wo3 ni3 jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"That's not an option, $(l.name). We can't get into the estate without dealing with APEX first, and we have to get into the estate.\n"
"\n"
"I don't like this, either. But I can't see how we can get around it."
msgstr ""
"这样​不行​的​，​$(l.name)​。​不​先​除掉​APEX​的话​，​我们​就​进不去​庄园​，​而​我们​现在​又​必须​前往​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​觉得​形势​不妙​，​但​我​想不到​还有​什么​办法​能​绕开​它​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 bu4xing2 de5，$(l.name)。bu4 xian1 chu2diao4 APEX de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 jin4 bu4 qu4 zhuang1yuan2，er2 wo3men5 xian4zai4 you4 bi4xu1 qian2wang3 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 jue2de5 xing2shi4 bu4miao4，dan4 wo3 xiang3bu5dao4 hai2you3 shen2me5 ban4fa3 neng2 rao4 kai1 ta1。"

msgid "That's not enough. He was just one man."
msgstr ""
"还​不够​。​只有​他​一个​人​而已​。\n"
"hai2 bu4gou4。zhi3you3 ta1 yi1ge5 ren2 er2yi3。"

msgid "That's not good."
msgstr ""
"听​起来​不妙​。\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 bu4miao4。"

msgid "That's not my problem."
msgstr ""
"与我无关​。\n"
"yu4 wo3 wu2 guan1。"

msgid "That's not news to me."
msgstr ""
"这​都​不是​什么​新鲜事​。\n"
"zhe4 dou1 bu4shi4 shen2me5 xin1 xian1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"That's not the only thing that's nagging at me. I'm getting that tingly feeling all up and down the back of my neck again... it feels like I'm being tracked.\n"
"\n"
"I'm no Matrix hotshot like Clockwork or Schäfer, but I'm good enough to know when someone's on my scent. Gotta install some new security measures... can't be too careful."
msgstr ""
"这​还​不是​唯一​让​我​介怀​的​事​。​我​的​脖子​后面​又​开始​有​刺痛感​了​……​好像​有人​在​追踪​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不是​发条​或​舍费尔​那样​的​矩阵​高手​，​但​我​知道​被​追踪​是​什么​感觉​。​得​安装​一些​新​的​安全措施​……​小心​为​上​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 bu4shi4 wei2yi1 rang4 wo3 jie4huai2 de5 shi4。wo3 de5 bo2zi5 hou4mian5 you4 kai1shi3 you3 ci1 tong4 gan3 le5……hao3xiang4 you3ren2 zai4 zhui1zong1 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 fa1tiao2 huo4 she3 fei4 er3 na4yang4 de5 ju3zhen4 gao1shou3，dan4 wo3 zhi1dao4 bei4 zhui1zong1 shi4 shen2me5 gan3jue2。de2 an1zhuang1 yi1xie1 xin1 de5 an1quan2cuo4shi1……xiao3xin1 wei2 shang4。"

msgid ""
"That's not the same thing as living.\n"
"\n"
"Don't listen to this thing, $(l.name). It needs to die."
msgstr ""
"这​并​不​等同于​活着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​听​这​东西​胡说​，​$(l.name)​。​它​必须​死​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4 deng3 tong2 yu2 huo2zhe5。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 ting1 zhe4 dong1xi1 hu2shuo1，$(l.name)。ta1 bi4xu1 si3。"

msgid ""
"That's not the same thing as living. \n"
"\n"
"I didn't know this friend of yours, but I'm pretty sure she deserved better than this."
msgstr ""
"这​并​不​等同于​活着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​认识​你​的​这位​朋友​，​但​我​敢肯定​她​本​不该​落得​这样​的​结局​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4 deng3 tong2 yu2 huo2zhe5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 ren4shi5 ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5，dan4 wo3 gan3 ken3 ding4 ta1 ben3 bu4gai1 luo4de5 zhe4yang4 de5 jie2ju2。"

msgid ""
"That's not the same thing as living. You killed the real Monika, and now "
"you're hiding behind her persona."
msgstr ""
"这​并​不​等同于​活着​。​你​杀死​了​真正​的​莫妮卡​，​而​你​现在​还敢​顶​着​她​的​脸​出现​。\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4 deng3 tong2 yu2 huo2zhe5。ni3 sha1si3 le5 zhen1zheng4 de5 Mo4ni1ka3，er2 ni3 xian4zai4 hai2 gan3 ding3 zhao2 ta1 de5 lian3 chu1xian4。"

msgid "That's nuts. Forget it."
msgstr ""
"你​想得美​。​算了吧​。\n"
"ni3 xiang3de5mei3。suan4 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"That's okay.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She plunges her blade into the Engineer's throat. He lets out a startled gurgling sound.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can."
msgstr ""
"没事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​刀刃​深深​刺入​工程师​的​喉咙​。​他​发出​一声​惊慌​的​咕噜​声​，​挣扎​几下​后​死​掉​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我下​得​去​手​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 dao1ren4 shen1shen1 ci1 ru4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 hou2long2。ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 jing1huang1 de5 gu1lu5 sheng1，zheng1zha2 ji1 xia4 hou4 si3 diao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xia4 de2 qu4 shou3。"

msgid ""
"That's okay. I'll tell you anyway.\n"
"\n"
"I found a connection between Emilie and Saeder-Krupp."
msgstr ""
"没事​，​我​还是​会​告诉​你​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​发现​艾米莉​和​赛德​-​克虏伯​之间​有​联系​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4，wo3 hai2shi5 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 fa1xian4 ai4 mi3 li4 he4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 zhi1jian1 you3 lian2xi4。"

msgid "That's on you, Doc. You've got some explaining to do."
msgstr ""
"这些​都​要​算​在​你​头上​，​博士​。​你​最好​解释一下​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 dou1 yao4 suan4 zai4 ni3 tou2shang4，bo2shi4。ni3 zui4hao3 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4。"

msgid "That's one way of putting it."
msgstr ""
"可以​这么​说​吧​。\n"
"ke3yi3 zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid "That's only a few kilometers from the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"那里​距离​克洛伊​茨​集市​只有​几公里​远​。\n"
"na4li5 ju4li2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi3you3 ji1 gong1 li3 yuan3。"

msgid "That's our cue to leave."
msgstr ""
"这​是​让​我们​离开​的​信号​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 rang4 wo3men5 li2kai1 de5 xin4hao4。"

msgid ""
"That's our cue to leave. Let the fire take this place, and everything in it. We've done what we came here for.\n"
"\n"
"Harrow is dead. We've won."
msgstr ""
"这​是​让​我们​离开​的​信号​。​让​大火​吞噬​这里​的​一切​吧​。​我们​已经​完成​了​此行​的​目的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​已死​。​我们​赢得​了​胜利​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 rang4 wo3men5 li2kai1 de5 xin4hao4。rang4 da4huo3 tun1shi4 zhe4li3 de5 yi1qie4 ba1。wo3men5 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2 le5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 yi3 si3。wo3men5 ying2de2 le5 sheng4li4。"

msgid ""
"That's our target. Sutterlin BioScience.\n"
"\n"
"I wonder what happened in there."
msgstr ""
"那​就是​我们​的​目标​，​苏​特林​生物科学​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​知道​那里​发生​了​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 de5 mu4biao1，su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 na4li5 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"That's probably an understatement, but from what we saw in there, I'd say "
"that they deserved it."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​也许​有些​不妥​，​但​从​我们​在​里面​看到​的​情况​来看​，​我​觉得​他们​是​罪有应得​。\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ye3xu3 you3xie1 bu4tuo3，dan4 cong2 wo3men5 zai4 li3mian4 kan4dao4 de5 qing2kuang4 lai2 kan4，wo3 jue2de5 ta1men5 shi4 zui4you3ying1de2。"

msgid ""
"That's probably for the best.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and fearless leader... you should stop second-guessing yourself. It doesn't exactly inspire confidence."
msgstr ""
"也许​这样​是​最好​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​无畏​领袖​……​你​最好​别​总是​反复​变卦​。​这样​可​没​办法​让​人​信服​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 zhe4yang4 shi4 zui4hao3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4……ni3 zui4hao3 bie4 zong3shi4 fan3fu4 bian4gua4。zhe4yang4 ke3 mei2 ban4fa3 rang4 ren2 xin4fu2。"

msgid ""
"That's probably wise, boss. I don't like it, but it is what it is.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He scowls.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's get movin', then. We've got a job to do."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​你​的​想法​很​明智​。​虽然​我​不​喜欢​，​但​只能​这样​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​阴沉​着​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​动身​吧​，​还有​工作​要​做​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，ni3 de5 xiang3fa3 hen3 ming2zhi4。sui1ran2 wo3 bu4 xi3huan5，dan4 zhi3neng2 zhe4yang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yin1chen2 zhao2 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 dong4shen1 ba1，hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4 ni2。"

msgid "That's probably wise."
msgstr ""
"这​大概​是​明智之举​。\n"
"zhe4 da4gai4 shi4 ming2zhi4zhi1ju3。"

msgid "That's quite an omission. I wonder what else you're not telling me."
msgstr ""
"你​这​可漏​了​不少​啊​。​我​在​想​，​你​是不是​还有​什么​事​没​告诉​我​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4 ke3 lou4 le5 bu4shao3 a1。wo3 zai4 xiang3，ni3 shi4bu5shi4 hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 mei2 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "That's ridiculous. I could buy a new tri-vid player for that!"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​不去​抢​啊​？​这钱​都​够​我​买​一台​全新​的​3D​影像​机了​！\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 bu4 qu4 qiang3 a1？zhe4 qian2 dou1 gou4 wo3 mai3 yi1 tai2 quan2xin1 de5 3D ying3xiang4 ji1 le5！"

msgid "That's right, and it's not up for debate."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​而且​我​也​不​打算​和​你​争辩​这个​。\n"
"mei2cuo4，er2qie3 wo3 ye3 bu4 da3suan4 he4 ni3 zheng1bian4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"That's right, fearless leader. But if used in the right situation, that one "
"could turn the tide of an otherwise unwinnable firefight."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​无畏​领袖​。​但​如果​用​对​了​地方​，​这招​也​足以​将​极度​不利​的​战场​局势​逆转​。\n"
"shi4 de5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。dan4 ru2guo3 yong4 dui4 le5 di4fang1，zhe4 zhao1 ye3 zu2yi3 jiang1 ji2du4 bu4li4 de5 zhan4chang3 ju2shi4 ni4zhuan3。"

msgid "That's right, run away!"
msgstr ""
"对​，​赶紧​跑​吧​！\n"
"dui4，gan3jin3 pao2 ba1！"

msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""
"没错​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"That's right. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger thrusts a gloved finger into your chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And THIS idiot stood by and let it happen."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​伸出​她​戴​着​手套​的​手​，​一​指头​戳​向​你​的​胸口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​这​蠢货​就​在​那​傻​站​着​任由​她​出事​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 shen1chu1 ta1 dai4 zhao2 shou3tao4 de5 shou3，yi1 zhi3tou5 chuo1 xiang4 ni3 de5 xiong1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4 chun3huo4 jiu4 zai4 na4 sha3 zhan4 zhao2 ren4you2 ta1 chu1shi4。"

msgid ""
"That's right. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She dips a hand into her satchel and produces a ceremonial dagger. The blade shimmers eerily in the light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And after we've purified you, you're going to help us do it."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把手​伸进​挎包​，​拿出​一把​仪式​匕首​。​它​在​光线​下​闪烁着​诡异​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​在​我们​净化​你​之后​，​你​要​*​帮助​*​我们​救出​那些​孩子​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 kua4bao1，na2chu1 yi1 ba3 yi2shi4 bi3shou3。ta1 zai4 guang1xian4 xia4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 gui3yi4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2 zai4 wo3men5 jing4hua4 ni3 zhi1hou4，ni3 yao4*bang1zhu4*wo3men5 jiu4chu1 na4Xie1hai2zi5。"

msgid "That's right. Albert. Now open the door."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​我​是​阿尔伯特​。​开门​吧​。\n"
"mei2cuo4，wo3 shi4 a1er3bo2te4。kai1men2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"That's right. And if you helped her out, it sounded like she'd be "
"\"grateful.\""
msgstr ""
"没错​。​而且​你​要是​愿意​的话​，​她​好像​会​很​“​感激​”​你​呢​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。er2qie3 ni3 yao4shi5 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，ta1 hao3xiang4 hui4 hen3“gan3ji1” ni3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"That's right. But there's no reason why I can't help you out while I'm doing"
" it."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​没错​，​但​这​并​不​妨碍​我​在此期间​顺手​帮​你​一把​。\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4 mei2cuo4，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 fang2ai4 wo3 zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1 shun4shou3 bang1 ni3 yi1 ba3。"

msgid ""
"That's right. But we need to hurry, before they restore power to the "
"building."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​但​我们​得​赶紧​动身​了​，​免得​他们​给​大楼​恢复​供电​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。dan4 wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 dong4shen1 le5，mian3de5 ta1men5 gei3 da4lou2 hui1fu4 gong1dian4。"

msgid ""
"That's right. He's already gotten enough of a head start on me... wherever "
"he's gone off to, it'll only get worse the longer I wait. So I'm headed out "
"after him, and I'm leaving tonight."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​他​已经​把​我​甩​得够​远​了​……​不管​他​跑​去​哪里​，​我​越​迟​行动​，​情况​只会​越糟​。​所以​我​决定​追上去​，​今晚​就​出发​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。ta1 yi3jing1 ba3 wo3 shuai3 de2 gou4 yuan3 le5……bu4guan3 ta1 pao2 qu4 na3li3，wo3 yue4 chi2 xing2dong4，qing2kuang4 zhi3 hui4 yue4 zao1。suo3yi3 wo3 jue2ding4 dui1 shang4 qu4，jin1wan3 jiu4 chu1fa1。"

msgid "That's right. It was wrong of you to keep it as a slave."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​你​不该​把​它​当成​奴隶​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。ni3 bu4gai1 ba3 ta1 dang4cheng2 nu2li4。"

msgid ""
"That's right. Once we've released both locks, you need to get out of there "
"as quickly as possible. I'll lock the place down behind you."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​等​两道​锁​都​解除​之后​，​你们​需要​立刻​离开​那里​。​然后​我会​把​你们​背后​的​门​关上​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。deng3 liang3 dao4 suo3 dou1 jie3chu2 zhi1hou4，ni3men5 xu1yao4 li4ke4 li2kai1 na4li5。ran2hou4 wo3 hui4 ba3 ni3men5 bei4hou4 de5 men2 guan1shang4。"

msgid ""
"That's right. Thanks to our - let's not mince words - *heroic* actions back in that swine pit, the Dragonslayer has seen fit to grant me His favor.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His grin widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And now I know what that means, and what I can do with it."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​多亏​了​咱们​当时​在​那个​猪圈​的​*​英勇壮举​*​，​屠龙​者​终于​眷顾​了​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如今​我​明白​了​这​意味着​什么​，​也​知道​该​如何​运用​它​了​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。duo1kui1 le5 zan2men5 dang1shi2 zai4 na4ge5 zhu1juan4 de5*ying1 yong3 zhuang4 ju3*，tu2 long2 zhe3 zhong1yu2 juan4gu4 le5 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 wo3 ming2bai5 le5 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5，ye3 zhi1dao4 gai1 ru2he2 yun4yong4 ta1 le5。"

msgid "That's right. You can't."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​你​就是​帮不了​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。ni3 jiu4shi4 bang1 bu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's rough, but it's still on him, not you. He should've been more careful. \n"
"\n"
"What'd you do?"
msgstr ""
"是​有点​惨​，​但​这事​还是​得赖​他​，​不能​赖​你​。​他​应该​自己​当心​点​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​是​怎么​做​的​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 you3dian3 can3，dan4 zhe4 shi4 hai2shi5 de2 lai4 ta1，bu4neng2 lai4 ni3。ta1 ying1gai1 zi4ji3 dang1xin1 dian3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zuo4 de5？"

msgid "That's rough, friend. How'd it happen?"
msgstr ""
"真惨​啊​，​朋友​，​到底​怎么回事​？\n"
"zhen1 can3 a1，peng2you5，dao4di3 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "That's rough."
msgstr ""
"真够​惨​的​。\n"
"zhen1 gou4 can3 de5。"

msgid ""
"That's something you'll have to work out for yourself. I'll give you some "
"space and leave you to it."
msgstr ""
"那​就​看​你​自己​怎么​想​了​。​我​给​你​点​空间​，​就​不​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 kan4 ni3 zi4ji3 zen3me5 xiang3 le5。wo3 gei3 ni3 dian3 kong1jian1，jiu4 bu4 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid "That's something, I guess."
msgstr ""
"也​算​有所​收获​吧​。\n"
"ye3 suan4 you3suo3 shou1huo4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"That's something, at least. But from what you just said, I'm guessing that "
"we have other problems to contend with."
msgstr ""
"这​也​算​有所​宽慰​吧​。​但​从​你​刚才​的话​里​，​我​猜​我们​还有​其他​问题​要​担心​。\n"
"zhe4 ye3 suan4 you3suo3 kuan1wei4 ba1。dan4 cong2 ni3 gang1cai2 de5hua4 li3，wo3 cai1 wo3men5 hai2you3 qi2ta1 wen4ti2 yao4 dan1xin1。"

msgid ""
"That's still too expensive. I can see that we're going to have to find a "
"different solution to this problem."
msgstr ""
"还是​太贵​了​。​看来​我们​得​想个​其他​的​解决方案​。\n"
"hai2shi5 tai4 gui4 le5。kan4lai5 wo3men5 de2 xiang3 ge4 qi2ta1 de5 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4。"

msgid ""
"That's taking a rather narrow view of what we do. Yes, it is true that my assistants are all members of the Goblinoid races. It is also true that before they accepted my help, they were thieves, gangers, and deadbeats.\n"
"\n"
"This is not because they were bad people. This is because those of us with Goblinoid traits are feared, mistreated, and denied gainful employment by a society that hates us."
msgstr ""
"这​是​对​我们​工作​的​狭隘​理解​。​我​的​助手​们​确实​都​是​地​精​种族​的​成员​。​他们​在​接受​我​的​帮助​之前​，​也​确实​是​小偷​、​流氓​和​无赖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​并​不是​因为​他们​是​坏人​，​而是​因为​我们​这些​地​精​种族​被​一个​憎恨​我们​的​社会​所​惧怕​、​虐待​，​并​被​剥夺​了​有​报酬​的​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 dui4 wo3men5 gong1zuo4 de5 xia2ai4 li3jie3。wo3 de5 zhu4shou3 men5 que4shi2 dou1 shi4 de5 jing1 zhong3zu2 de5 cheng2yuan2。ta1men5 zai4 jie1shou4 wo3 de5 bang1zhu4 zhi1qian2，ye3 que4shi2 shi4 xiao3tou1、liu2mang2 he4 wu2lai4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bing4 bu4shi4 yin1wei4 ta1men5 shi4 huai4ren2，er2shi4 yin1wei4 wo3men5 zhe4xie1 de5 jing1 zhong3zu2 bei4 yi1ge5 zeng1hen4 wo3men5 de5 she4hui4 suo3 ju4pa4、nu:e4dai4，bing4 bei4 bo1duo2 le5 you3 bao4chou5 de5 gong1zuo4。"

msgid "That's that."
msgstr ""
"完事​。\n"
"wan2shi4。"

msgid ""
"That's the first thing you've said that I think we all agree with.\n"
"\n"
"If we didn't need you to finish the run, I'll bet that $(l.name) would've beaten the tar out of you already."
msgstr ""
"你​总算​说​了​一句​让​我们​都​同意​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​不​需要​你​来​完成​任务​的话​，​我敢​说​$(l.name)​早就​把​你​暴打​一顿​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zong3suan4 shuo1 le5 yi1ju4 rang4 wo3men5 dou1 tong2yi4 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4 xu1yao4 ni3 lai2 wan2cheng2 ren4wu5 de5hua4，wo3 gan3 shuo1 $(l.name) zao3jiu4 ba3 ni3 bao4da3 yi1 dun4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's the head chef, Felix. He took a hit to the chest when they raided this floor. \n"
"\n"
"I thought I could stop the bleeding. But, um...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The cook lowers his gaze to the floor at his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I couldn't."
msgstr ""
"那​是​主厨​菲利克斯​。​这层​遭到​洗劫​的​时候​，​他​胸口​挨​了​一枪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以为​我能​把​血​止住​的​。​可是​，​呃​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​厨子​把​目光​移到​了​地上​，​盯​着​自己​的​脚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没能​做到​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 zhu3chu2 fei1 li4 ke4 si1。zhe4 ceng2 zao1dao4 xi3jie2 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 xiong1kou3 ai1 le5 yi1 qiang1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3wei2 wo3 neng2 ba3 xie3 zhi3 zhu4 de5。ke3shi4，e4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chu2zi5 ba3 mu4guang1 yi2 dao4 le5 di4shang5，ding1 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 jiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 neng2 zuo4dao4。"

msgid "That's the hope."
msgstr ""
"希望​如此​。\n"
"xi1wang4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "That's the idea."
msgstr ""
"这​就​对​了​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4 dui4 le5。"

msgid "That's the plan. Let's do it."
msgstr ""
"是​这么回事​。​我们​行动​吧​。\n"
"shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。wo3men5 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid "That's the spirit!"
msgstr ""
"这才​对​嘛​！\n"
"zhe4 cai2 dui4 ma5！"

msgid ""
"That's the spirit! This run is gonna be a piece of cake, just you wait and "
"see."
msgstr ""
"这才​对​嘛​！​这趟​差事​肯定​是​小菜一碟​，​你​就​瞧​好​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 cai2 dui4 ma5！zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 ken3ding4 shi4 xiao3cai4yi1die2，ni3 jiu4 qiao2 hao3 ba1。"

msgid "That's the spirit, Blitz. I'll meet you at the van."
msgstr ""
"就要​这​股​劲头​，​布里​茨​。​我们​车上​见​。\n"
"jiu4yao4 zhe4 gu3 jin4tou2，Bu4li3ci2。wo3men5 che1 shang4 jian4。"

msgid "That's them in a nutshell, yeah."
msgstr ""
"八九不离十​了​。\n"
"ba1jiu3bu4li2shi2 le5。"

msgid "That's them! Open fire!"
msgstr ""
"他们​在​那​！​开火​！\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 na4！kai1huo3！"

msgid "That's tough, man. Best of luck."
msgstr ""
"不​容易​啊​，​伙计​。​祝你好运​。\n"
"bu4 rong2yi4 a1，huo3ji5。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid ""
"That's true, we haven't. But I'm confident that you're the right $(l.man) "
"for the job."
msgstr ""
"话​是​这么​说​，​但​我​相信​你​是​最​适合​这份​工作​的​人​。\n"
"hua4 shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 shi4 zui4 shi4he2 zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"That's true. But I do have eyes, and I can see what's been happening to the Kreuzbasar since she got geeked.\n"
"\n"
"Whole place is falling apart, isn't it? And why do you think that is?"
msgstr ""
"是​这样​没错​，​但​我​也​不是​没长眼​，​我能​看到​克洛伊​茨​集市​在​她​死​后​都​发生​了​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​整片​街区​都​在​分崩离析​，​难道​不是​吗​？​那​你​觉得​背后​的​原因​是​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4 mei2cuo4，dan4 wo3 ye3 bu4shi4 mei2zhang3yan3，wo3 neng2 kan4dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zai4 ta1 si3 hou4 dou1 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zheng3 pian1 jie1qu1 dou1 zai4 fen1beng1li2xi1，nan2dao4 bu4shi4 ma5？na4 ni3 jue2de5 bei4hou4 de5 yuan2yin1 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"That's true. But you're more than just a team leader. Like it or not, you've filled Monika's shoes in more ways than one... the people of the Kreuzbasar look to you as a leader now.\n"
"\n"
"Your responsibility is to them, not me. They've been through hell and back again, and they need you. You can't just abandon them."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​，​但​你​不仅仅​是​队长​。​不管​你​愿不愿意​，​你​在​很多​方面​都​接替​了​莫妮卡​的​位置​……​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人们​现在​都​把​你​当​领袖​来看​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​对​他们​负责​，​不是​对​我​。​他们​经历​了​地狱​般的​磨难​，​现在​需要​你​，​你​不能​就​这样​抛弃​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4，dan4 ni3 bu4jin3jin3 shi4 dui4zhang3。bu4guan3 ni3 yuan4 bu4 yuan4 yi4，ni3 zai4 hen3 duo1 fang1mian4 dou1 jie1ti4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 wei4zhi5……Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2men5 xian4zai4 dou1 ba3 ni3 dang1 ling3xiu4 lai2 kan4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 dui4 ta1men5 fu4ze2，bu4shi4 dui4 wo3。ta1men5 jing1li4 le5 di4yu4 ban1 de5 mo2nan4，xian4zai4 xu1yao4 ni3，ni3 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4yang4 pao1qi4 ta1men5。"

msgid "That's uncharacteristically generous of you, Doctor."
msgstr ""
"这么​慷慨​简直​不像​你​了​，​医生​。\n"
"zhe4me5 kang1kai3 jian3zhi2 bu4 xiang4 ni3 le5，yi1sheng1。"

msgid "That's very reassuring. Thanks, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"真​让​我​放心​啊​。​谢​了​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"zhen1 rang4 wo3 fang4xin1 a1。xie4 le5，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"That's very....\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Quorin rolls his eyes suddenly, then turns to his crew.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Did you imbeciles *really* not search them for weapons? For fuck's sake."
msgstr ""
"这​真是​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​奎林​突然​翻​了​个​白眼​，​然后​转向​他​的​手下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​这群​白痴​*​真的​*​没​搜去​他们​的​武器​吗​？​我​真他妈​服​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhen1shi5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kui2 lin2 tu1ran2 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3，ran2hou4 zhuan3xiang4 ta1 de5 shou3xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 zhe4 qun2 bai2chi1*zhen1de5*mei2 sou1 qu4 ta1men5 de5 wu3qi4 ma5？wo3 zhen1 ta1 ma1 fu2 le5。"

msgid "That's what Alice saw in the Matrix, chief. That's APEX."
msgstr ""
"那​是​爱丽丝​在​矩阵​中​看到​的​东西​，​头儿​。​那​就是​APEX​。\n"
"na4 shi4 ai4li4si1 zai4 ju3zhen4 zhong4 kan4dao4 de5 dong1xi1，tou2r5。na4 jiu4shi4 APEX。"

msgid "That's what Alice saw in the Matrix. That's APEX."
msgstr ""
"这​就是​爱丽丝​在​矩阵​中​看到​的​。​这​就是​APEX​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 ai4li4si1 zai4 ju3zhen4 zhong4 kan4dao4 de5。zhe4 jiu4shi4 APEX。"

msgid "That's what I do."
msgstr ""
"我​就是​干​这个​的​。\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 gan4 zhe4ge5 de5。"

msgid ""
"That's what I just said, isn't it? C'mon, everyone, let's get out of the "
"nice lady's hair."
msgstr ""
"我​刚才​不​就​这么​说​的​吗​？​走​吧​各位​，​别​打扰​这位​女士​了​。\n"
"wo3 gang1cai2 bu4 jiu4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5 ma5？zou3 ba1 ge4wei4，bie4 da3rao3 zhe4wei4 nu:3shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's what I just said, isn't it? C'mon, let's get out of the nice lady's "
"hair."
msgstr ""
"我​刚才​不​就​这么​说​的​吗​？​走​吧​，​别​打扰​这位​女士​了​。\n"
"wo3 gang1cai2 bu4 jiu4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5 ma5？zou3 ba1，bie4 da3rao3 zhe4wei4 nu:3shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's what I was thinking, yeah. Corporations and governments do it all the"
" time - why not these guys?"
msgstr ""
"我​就是​这么​想​的​。​既然​企业​和​政府​天天​这么​干​，​那​这些​人​为什么​不行​？\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。ji4ran2 qi3ye4 he4 zheng4fu3 tian1tian1 zhe4me5 gan4，na4 zhe4xie1 ren2 wei4shen2me5 bu4xing2？"

msgid ""
"That's what I've been waiting to hear, chief. Thank you, and don't worry about it.\n"
"\n"
"Now, was there anything else?"
msgstr ""
"我​想​听​的​就是​这个​，​头儿​。​谢谢​，​另外​不用​担心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​还有​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ting1 de5 jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5，tou2r5。xie4xie5，ling4wai4 bu4yong4 dan1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"That's what it all boils down to, doesn't it?\n"
"\n"
"It has to be this way because he says it does."
msgstr ""
"归根结底​就是​这么回事​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​必须​如此​，​是因为​他​说了算​。\n"
"\n"
"gui1gen1jie2di3 jiu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 ru2ci3，shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid ""
"That's what the program information said. One series, seven episodes. You've"
" seen six."
msgstr ""
"程序​信息​是​这么​说​的​—​—​总共​七集​的​连续剧​。​你​只​看​了​六集​。\n"
"cheng2xu4 xin4xi1 shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5——zong3gong4 qi1 ji2 de5 lian2xu4ju4。ni3 zhi3 kan4 le5 liu4 ji2。"

msgid ""
"That's what we're hearing out here, too, John. The entire city of Sydney - and everyone in it - are just *gone.* In their place, there's a swirling ball of vibrant colors that stretches hundreds of meters into the sky.\n"
"\n"
"Our cameras go haywire if we point them directly at the rift, so we can't show you that, but take it from me - it is both spectacular and terrifying."
msgstr ""
"约翰​，​我们​这边​也​收到​了​同样​的​消息​。​整个​悉尼城​—​—​以及​城里​所有​居民​—​—​都​彻底​*​消失​*​了​。​取而代之​的​是​一团​绚丽多彩​的​漩涡​，​直冲​数百米​高空​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​将​摄像机​直接​对准​裂隙​，​设备​就​会​失灵​，​所以​无法​向​你们​展示​实况​。​但​请​相信​我​—​—​那​景象​既​壮观​又​骇人​。\n"
"\n"
"yue1han4，wo3men5 zhe4bian1 ye3 shou1dao4 le5 tong2yang4 de5 xiao1xi5。zheng3ge4 xi1 ni2 cheng2——yi3ji2 cheng2 li3 suo3you3 ju1min2——dou1 che4di3*xiao1shi1*le5。qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 yi1 tuan2 xuan4li4duo1cai3 de5 xuan2wo1，zhi2 chong1 shu3 bai3 mi3 gao1kong1。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 jiang1 she4xiang4ji1 zhi2jie1 dui4zhun3 lie4xi4，she4bei4 jiu4 hui4 shi1ling2，suo3yi3 wu2fa3 xiang4 ni3men5 zhan3shi4 shi2kuang4。dan4 qing3 xiang1xin4 wo3——na4 jing3xiang4 ji4 zhuang4guan1 you4 hai4ren2。"

msgid "That's what we're here for."
msgstr ""
"这​正是​我们​来此​的​目的​。\n"
"zhe4 zheng4shi4 wo3men5 lai2 ci3 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid "That's why the \"Arctic Fox\" died out there in the snow."
msgstr ""
"因此​“​北极狐​”​的​名号​也​一同​埋葬​在​那片​雪地​之中​了​。\n"
"yin1ci3“bei3ji2hu2” de5 ming2hao4 ye3 yi1tong2 mai2zang4 zai4 na4 pian1 xue3di4 zhi1zhong1 le5。"

msgid ""
"That's wonderful! Good choice!\n"
"\n"
"I'll just swipe your credstick, then I'll print up your purchase order."
msgstr ""
"太棒了​！​好​眼光​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​让​我​扫​一下​你​的​信用​棒​，​然后​我​就​出​订单​了​。\n"
"\n"
"tai4 bang4 le5！hao3 yan3guang1！\n"
"\n"
"qing3 rang4 wo3 sao3 yi1xia4 ni3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4，ran2hou4 wo3 jiu4 chu1 ding4dan1 le5。"

msgid "That's young enough to make me feel uneasy."
msgstr ""
"这​已经​年轻​到​让​我​感觉​不安​了​。\n"
"zhe4 yi3jing1 nian2qing1 dao4 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2 bu4an1 le5。"

msgid "That's your prerogative. But then, you didn't really know her."
msgstr ""
"怎么​想​是​你​的​权利​，​但​你​并​不​了解​她​。\n"
"zen3me5 xiang3 shi4 ni3 de5 quan2li4，dan4 ni3 bing4 bu4 liao3jie3 ta1。"

msgid "That's your problem, not mine. It's a free city, I'll say what I want."
msgstr ""
"那​是​你​的​问题​。​这​是​座​自由​的​城市​，​我​想​说​什么​就​说​什么​。\n"
"na4 shi4 ni3 de5 wen4ti2。zhe4 shi4 zuo4 zi4you2 de5 cheng2shi4，wo3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5 jiu4 shuo1 shen2me5。"

msgid "That's... actually really cheap. Okay, sign me up."
msgstr ""
"这个​价​……​还​挺​便宜​的​。​好​吧​，​我​买​了​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 jia4……hai2 ting3 bian4yi2 de5。hao3 ba1，wo3 mai3 le5。"

msgid "That's... fair, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​也​算​有​道理​吧​。\n"
"en1……ye3 suan4 you3 dao4li5 ba1。"

msgid "That's... horrific. Even for a mass-murdering dragon."
msgstr ""
"真是​……​太​可怕​了​。​即使​对方​是​大屠杀​的​元凶​巨龙​也​是​如此​。\n"
"zhen1shi5……tai4 ke3pa4 le5。ji2shi3 dui4fang1 shi4 da4tu2sha1 de5 yuan2xiong1 ju4long2 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"That's... odd. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A scowl crosses his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They should know that *I'm* on that duty. It isn't like them to double up on patrols."
msgstr ""
"这​就​……​怪​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​脸上​浮现​出​一丝​怒容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​应该​知道​*​我​*​已经​在​当班​了​。​他们​通常​不会​安排​双倍​巡逻​人数​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4……guai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 si1 nu4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ying1gai1 zhi1dao4*wo3*yi3jing1 zai4 dang1ban1 le5。ta1men5 tong1chang2 bu4hui4 an1pai2 shuang1bei4 xun2luo2 ren2shu4。"

msgid "That's... satisfactory. I'm in."
msgstr ""
"这样​……​可以​。​我​加入​。\n"
"zhe4yang4……ke3yi3。wo3 jia1ru4。"

msgid "That's... that's a good question."
msgstr ""
"这个​……​好​问题​。\n"
"zhe4ge5……hao3 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"That's... that's true.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He hangs his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I messed this up on my own, didn't I?"
msgstr ""
"这话​……​不假​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​垂下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​我​自己​搞砸​了​这​一切​，​对​不​丢​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hua4……bu4 jia3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chui2 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 wo3 zi4ji3 gao3za2 le5 zhe4 yi1qie4，dui4 bu4 diu1？"

msgid ""
"That's... that's true.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He hangs his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I was always going to mess this up."
msgstr ""
"这话​……​不假​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​垂下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​早晚​会​把​这事​搞砸​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hua4……bu4 jia3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chui2 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zao3wan3 hui4 ba3 zhe4 shi4 gao3za2 de5。"

msgid ""
"That's... ungh.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grimaces.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That is frustrating.\n"
"\n"
"But I suppose that's all water under the bridge. I have my merchandise, after all."
msgstr ""
"这​……​呃​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​苦笑​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​真​无聊​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​反正​都​过去​了​。​我​现在​拿到​了​我​要​的​商品​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4……e4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ku3xiao4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2 zhen1 wu2liao2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 fan3zheng4 dou1 guo4qu4 le5。wo3 xian4zai4 na2dao4 le5 wo3 yao4 de5 shang1pin3。"

msgid ""
"That... that could be acceptable.\n"
"\n"
"It won't be cheap, mind you. But I'm open to the offer."
msgstr ""
"这样​……​倒​是​也​能​接受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​要说​一句​，​这笔​费用​可不​便宜​。​但​价钱​也​可以​再谈​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4……dao3 shi4 ye3 neng2 jie1shou4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4shuo1 yi1ju4，zhe4 bi3 fei4yong4 ke3bu5 bian4yi2。dan4 jia4qian5 ye3 ke3yi3 zai4 tan2。"

msgid ""
"That... that is excellent news. I am not ashamed to say that I wished the man dead.\n"
"\n"
"He deserved whatever you did to him."
msgstr ""
"这​……​这​真是​好消息​。​我​毫不​惭愧​地说​，​我​很​希望​那人​死​掉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​你​做​了​什么​，​都​是​他​咎由自取​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4……zhe4 zhen1shi5 hao3 xiao1 xi1。wo3 hao2bu4 can2kui4 de5 shuo1，wo3 hen3 xi1wang4 na4 ren2 si3 diao4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 zuo4 le5 shen2me5，dou1 shi4 ta1 jiu4you2zi4qu3。"

msgid ""
"That... that shouldn't be possible.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing can be implanted with that much chrome and live."
msgstr ""
"这​……​这​怎么​可能​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​被​植入​了​这么​多​铬​合金​，​什么​东西​也​活​不​下来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4……zhe4 zen3me5 ke3neng2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"bei4 zhi2ru4 le5 zhe4me5 duo1 ge4 he2jin1，shen2me5 dong1xi1 ye3 huo2 bu4 xia4lai5 de5。"

msgid ""
"That... that was a long time ago. And that man wanted to hurt the commune! We did what we had to do.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a long pause as she fishes for the words.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, we took the trideo. It... it would have been *wasteful* to leave it behind."
msgstr ""
"那​……​那​已经​是​很久以前​的​事​了​。​而且​那​人​试图​伤害​社群​！​我们​只是​做​了​该​做​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​她​似乎​在​绞尽脑汁​拼凑出​要说​的话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我们​拿走​了​那台​3D​影像​机​。​把​……​把​它​留在​那儿​可​就​太​*​浪费​*​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4……na4 yi3jing1 shi4 hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2 de5 shi4 le5。er2qie3 na4 ren2 shi4tu2 shang1hai4 she4qun2！wo3men5 zhi3shi4 zuo4 le5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。ta1 si4hu1 zai4 jiao3jin4nao3zhi1 pin1 cou4 chu1 yao4shuo1 de5hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3men5 na2zou3 le5 na4 tai2 3D ying3xiang4 ji1。ba3……ba3 ta1 liu2 zai4 na4r5 ke3 jiu4 tai4*lang4fei4*le5。"

msgid "That... that was, uh... interesting."
msgstr ""
"这​东西​……​的​味道​……​挺​有意思​。\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1……de5 wei4dao5……ting3 you3yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"That... that's different.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She blinks. Then that whispering sound returns, soft and insistent, and the flicker of unease on her face is replaced with an easy smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You wouldn't understand."
msgstr ""
"那​……​那​不​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​眨​眨眼​。​随后​那​轻柔​而​执着​的​低​语声​再度​响起​，​她​脸上​闪过​的​不安​随即​变回​了​轻松​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不会​明白​的​。\n"
"\n"
"na4……na4 bu4 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 zha3yan3。sui2hou4 na4 qing1rou2 er2 zhi2zhuo2 de5 di1 yu3sheng1 zai4du4 xiang3qi3，ta1 lian3 shang4 shan3guo4 de5 bu4an1 sui2ji2 bian4hui2 le5 qing1song1 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 ming2bai5 de5。"

msgid ""
"That... thing... ate Monika's brain, boss.\n"
"\n"
"I sure as hell hope that its help is worth what we just did. But I don't know how it could be."
msgstr ""
"那个​……​东西​……​吃​了​莫妮卡​的​脑子​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真心​希望​它​的​帮助​值得​我们​刚才​所​做​的​一切​。​但​我​真不知道​这有​什么​可能性​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5……dong1xi1……chi1 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 nao3zi5，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1xin1 xi1wang4 ta1 de5 bang1zhu4 zhi2de5 wo3men5 gang1cai2 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4。dan4 wo3 zhen1 bu4 zhi1 dao4 zhe4 you3 shen2me5 ke3neng2xing4。"

msgid ""
"That’s Vauclair, all right... what's left of him, anyway. It doesn't look like they've been feedin' him much.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Poor bastard."
msgstr ""
"那​就是​沃​克莱尔​……​至少​他​还有​一口气​。​他们​似乎​不怎么​在乎​他​的​伙食​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可怜​的​倒霉蛋​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3……zhi4shao3 ta1 hai2you3 yi1kou3qi4。ta1men5 si4hu1 bu4zen3me5 zai4hu5 ta1 de5 huo3shi2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3lian2 de5 dao3mei2dan4。"

msgid "That’s a lot of money. All right, count me in."
msgstr ""
"确实​不是​小钱​。​好​吧​，​我​答应​了​。\n"
"que4shi2 bu4shi4 xiao3qian2。hao3 ba1，wo3 da1ying5 le5。"

msgid "That’s all I need to know."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​这些​就够​了​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"That’s all that I have to say… I’m following my own advice. I’m *out.*\n"
"\n"
"Don’t try to contact me again."
msgstr ""
"我​要说​的​就​这些​……​并且​我​也​要​践行​自己​的​建议​。​我​*​不干​了​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​再​试图​联系​我​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4shuo1 de5 jiu4 zhe4xie1……bing4qie3 wo3 ye3 yao4 jian4xing2 zi4ji3 de5 jian4yi4。wo3*bu4 gan4 le5*。\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 zai4 shi4tu2 lian2xi4 wo3 le5。"

msgid "That’s good advice anywhere… out in the field, or here in the shadows."
msgstr ""
"不错​的​建议​，​适用​于​各种​场合​……​无论是​在​战场​上​，​还是​在​暗影​之中​。\n"
"bu4cuo4 de5 jian4yi4，shi4yong4 yu2 ge4zhong3 chang3he2……wu2 lun2 shi4 zai4 zhan4chang3 shang4，hai2shi5 zai4 an4ying3 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid "That’s not much."
msgstr ""
"这​也​算不上​有​价值​啊​。\n"
"zhe4 ye3 suan4 bu4 shang4 you3 jia4zhi2 a1。"

msgid "That’s not your business."
msgstr ""
"与​你​无关​。\n"
"yu4 ni3 wu2guan1。"

msgid "That’s obvious. But why?"
msgstr ""
"这点​很​明显​。​但​为什么​？\n"
"zhe4 dian3 hen3 ming2xian3。dan4 wei4shen2me5？"

msgid "That’s only a few kilometers from the Kreuzbasar!"
msgstr ""
"那里​距离​克洛伊​茨​集市​只有​几公里​远​！\n"
"na4li5 ju4li2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi3you3 ji1 gong1 li3 yuan3！"

msgid "That’s only a few kilometers from the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"那里​距离​克洛伊​茨​集市​只有​几公里​远​。\n"
"na4li5 ju4li2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi3you3 ji1 gong1 li3 yuan3。"

msgid ""
"That’s part of it, sure. But it’s not the whole story.\n"
"\n"
"I don’t just *want* to come on this run, boss… I *have* to come."
msgstr ""
"是​有​这方面​原因​，​但​不是​全部​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​只是​*​想要​*​参与​这次​行动​，​老大​……​我​*​非去不可​*​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 you3 zhe4 fang1 mian4 yuan2yin1，dan4 bu4shi4 quan2bu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi3shi4*xiang3yao4*can1yu4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4，lao3da4……wo3*fei1 qu4 bu4 ke3*。"

msgid ""
"That’s right. For good or ill.\n"
"\n"
"We can’t see the future. I don’t think that anyone can. But the world is different now, and we’re the ones who changed it."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​无论​好坏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​无法​预见​未来​。​我​想​没有​人能​做到​。​但​世界​已然​不同​，​而​改变​它​的​人​正是​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。wu2lun4 hao3huai4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 wu2fa3 yu4jian4 wei4lai2。wo3 xiang3 mei2you3 ren2 neng2 zuo4dao4。dan4 shi4jie4 yi3ran2 bu4tong2，er2 gai3bian4 ta1 de5 ren2 zheng4shi4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"That’s what they want. That’s what they need. \n"
"\n"
"The corps. The dragons. The politicians. \n"
"\n"
"Everyone."
msgstr ""
"那​是​他们​想要​的​。​那​是​他们​需要​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​企业​。​巨龙​。​政客​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​每​一个​人​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 ta1men5 xiang3yao4 de5。na4 shi4 ta1men5 xu1yao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"qi3ye4。ju4long2。zheng4ke4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 mei3 yi1ge5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"That’s your prerogative, of course.\n"
"\n"
"But if you don’t bring me, don’t be surprised if I’m not here when you get back."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​这​是​你​的​权利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​如果​不​带上​我​，​等​你​回来​了​见不着​我​也​别​惊讶​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 quan2li4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 ru2guo3 bu4 dai4shang4 wo3，deng3 ni3 hui2lai5 le5 jian4 bu4 zhao2 wo3 ye3 bie4 jing1ya4。"

msgid "That’s your prerogative. But don’t forget who leads this team."
msgstr ""
"随便​你​，​但​别忘了​这​队伍​谁​是​头儿​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3，dan4 bie4 wang4 le5 zhe4 dui4wu3 shei2 shi4 tou2r5。"

msgid "Thaumaturgic Armor"
msgstr ""
"奇术​护甲\n"
"ji1 shu4 hu4jia3"

msgid ""
"The \"menu\" for Herr Amsel, Uncle.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Kami hands you a folded piece of paper. Inside is a memory stick.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please extend my consolations to him. The death of Fräulein Schäfer must have hit him hard."
msgstr ""
"这​是​给​阿姆​泽尔​先生​的​“​菜单​”​，​叔叔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​卡米​递给​你​一张​折好​的​纸​。​里​面包​着​一根​记忆棒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请代​我​向​他​表示慰问​。​舍费尔​小姐​的​死​对​他​打击​一定​很大​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 gei3 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 de5“cai4dan1”，shu1shu5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ka3mi3 di4gei3 ni3 yi1 zhang1 zhe1 hao3 de5 zhi3。li3 mian4bao1 zhao2 yi1 gen1 ji4yi4bang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 dai4 wo3 xiang4 ta1 biao3 shi4 wei4 wen4。she3 fei4 er3 xiao3jie5 de5 si3 dui4 ta1 da3ji1 yi1ding4 hen3 dai4。"

msgid "The $(s.name) Civic Center. It has a nice ring to it."
msgstr ""
"$(s.name)​市民​中心​。​这​名字​挺不错​。\n"
"$(s.name) shi4min2 zhong1xin1。zhe4 ming2zi5 ting3 bu4 cuo4。"

msgid ""
"The AOE radius of Dietrich's Electro Core  spell is increased by 1 tile in "
"all directions."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​电子​核心​范围​攻击​法术​的​半径​向​所有​方向​增加​1​格​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 dian4zi3 he2xin1 fan4wei2 gong1ji1 fa3shu4 de5 ban4jing4 xiang4 suo3you3 fang1xiang4 zeng1jia1 1 ge2。"

msgid ""
"The Adversary is the totemic embodiment of rebellion. It is an anarchist and a usurper, a betrayer and a symbol of defiance.\n"
"\n"
"It is a proud idol, utterly sure of itself and its mission. The majority of its followers are arrogant and cruel... not the most pleasant of people, truth be told."
msgstr ""
"反叛者​是​叛逆​的​图腾​化身​。​它​是​无政府主义​者​、​是​篡夺者​、​是​背叛者​，​也​是​反抗​的​象征​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​是​个​傲慢​的​精魂​导师​，​对​自身​及其​使命​抱​有​绝对​的​自信​。​其​追随者​大多​傲慢​而​残酷​……​说实话​，​算不上​什么​讨人喜欢​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"fan3 pan4 zhe3 shi4 pan4ni4 de5 tu2teng2 hua4shen1。ta1 shi4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3、shi4 cuan4 duo2 zhe3、shi4 bei4pan4zhe3，ye3 shi4 fan3kang4 de5 xiang4zheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 ao4man4 de5 jing1hun2 dao3shi1，dui4 zi4shen1 ji2qi2 shi3ming4 bao4 you3 jue2dui4 de5 zi4xin4。qi2 zhui1sui2zhe3 da4duo1 ao4man4 er2 can2ku4……shuo1shi2hua4，suan4 bu4 shang4 shen2me5 tao3ren2xi3huan5 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"The BIOLOGICAL COMPONENT of the MKVI was selected for size and durability by GENERAL GENETICS WORLDWIDE.\n"
"\n"
"All autonomous functions necessary to maintain the BIOLOGICAL COMPONENT are original to the component itself, and should self-regulate within operational limits."
msgstr ""
"MKVI​的​生物​组件​由​全球通​用​遗传​公司​依据​尺寸​与​耐久性​标准​选定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​维持​生物​组件​运转​所​需​的​所有​自主​功能​均​源自​组件​本身​，​应​在​运行​范围​内​实现​自我调节​。\n"
"\n"
"MKVI de5 sheng1wu4 zu3jian4 you2 quan2qiu2tong1 yong4 yi2chuan2 gong1si1 yi1ju4 chi3cun5 yu4 nai4 jiu3 xing4 biao1zhun3 xuan3ding4。\n"
"\n"
"wei2chi2 sheng1wu4 zu3jian4 yun4zhuan3 suo3 xu1 de5 suo3you3 zi4zhu3 gong1neng2 jun1 yuan2zi4 zu3jian4 ben3shen1，ying1 zai4 yun4xing2 fan4wei2 nei4 shi2xian4 zi4 wo3 diao4 jie1。"

msgid "The Becks continue to see to the wounded."
msgstr ""
"贝克​夫妇​又​继续​照顾​起​伤员​们​。\n"
"bei4ke4 fu1fu4 you4 ji4xu4 zhao4gu5 qi3 shang1yuan2 men5。"

msgid "The Black Hat"
msgstr ""
"黑帽\n"
"hei1 mao4"

msgid ""
"The Board wishes you all the best in your future endeavors. We have prepared a generous severance package to assist you in this time of transition; if there is anything more that we can do to help you, please don't hesitate to ask.\n"
"\n"
"-Werner Harding"
msgstr ""
"董事会​祝愿​您​在​未来​的​工作​中​一切顺利​。​我们​为​您​准备​了​丰厚​的​离职​补偿金​，​以​帮助​您​渡过难关​；​如果​我们​还​能​为​您​提供​其他​帮助​，​请​随时​提出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​沃纳​·​哈丁\n"
"\n"
"dong3shi4hui4 zhu4yuan4 nin2 zai4 wei4lai2 de5 gong1zuo4 zhong4 yi1 qie1 shun4 li4。wo3men5 wei2 nin2 zhun3bei4 le5 feng1hou4 de5 li2zhi2 bu3 chang2 jin1，yi3 bang1zhu4 nin2 du4 guo4 nan2 guan1 ； ru2guo3 wo3men5 hai2 neng2 wei2 nin2 ti2gong1 qi2ta1 bang1zhu4，qing3 sui2shi2 ti2chu1。\n"
"\n"
"——wo4 na4 · ha1 zheng1"

msgid ""
"The Christian tradition that much of Germany adheres to would argue that the Adversary *is* Lucifer, yes. But many other traditions would disagree.\n"
"\n"
"You would do well to remember that you live in an oddity among Sixth World nations. Traditional religious iconography still permeates German culture. Is it any surprise that people here might lean toward viewing an idol like the Adversary through a more traditional lens?"
msgstr ""
"德国​多数​人​信奉​的​基督教​传统​认为​反叛者​*​正是​*​路西​法​。​但​许多​其他​传统​则​持​不同​见解​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​应当​谨记​，​你​所​生活​的​国度​在​第六​纪元​中​属于​异类​。​传统​宗教​圣像​至今​仍​渗透​于​德国​文化​之中​。​这里​的​人们​倾向​于用​更​传统​的​视角​看待​反叛者​这​类​精魂​导师​，​这​难道​值得​惊讶​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"de2guo2 duo1shu4 ren2 xin4feng4 de5 ji1du1jiao4 chuan2tong3 ren4wei2 fan3 pan4 zhe3*zheng4shi4*lu4 xi1 fa3。dan4 xu3duo1 qi2ta1 chuan2tong3 ze2 chi2 bu4tong2 jian4jie3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ying1dang1 jin3ji4，ni3 suo3 sheng1huo2 de5 guo2du4 zai4 di4 liu4 ji4yuan2 zhong4 shu3yu2 yi4lei4。chuan2tong3 zong1jiao4 sheng4xiang4 zhi4jin1 reng2 shen4tou4 yu2 de2guo2 wen2hua4 zhi1zhong1。zhe4li3 de5 ren2men5 qing1xiang4 yu2 yong4 geng1 chuan2tong3 de5 shi4jiao3 kan4dai4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 zhe4 lei4 jing1hun2 dao3shi1，zhe4 nan2dao4 zhi2de5 jing1ya4 ma5？"

msgid "The Communion calls and we answer!"
msgstr ""
"共​融会​在​召唤​，​我们​必须​回应​！\n"
"gong4 rong2hui4 zai4 zhao4huan4，wo3men5 bi4xu1 hui2ying4！"

msgid ""
"The Communion is all of us! It is togetherness, the Joining! Something is taken... it must be taken! And in return, soooo much is given.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice rises in orgiastic glee.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's all yours for the receiving, for soooo little taken!"
msgstr ""
"共​融会​是​我们​所有人​！​是​团结​，​是​结合​！​有​东西​被​取​走​……​它​必须​被​取​走​！​而​作为​回报​，​我们​获得​如此​之多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​在​狂欢​中​高涨​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​一切都是​你​的​，​只​需​付出​那么​一点点​！\n"
"\n"
"gong4 rong2hui4 shi4 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2！shi4 tuan2jie2，shi4 jie2he2！you3 dong1xi1 bei4 qu3 zou3……ta1 bi4xu1 bei4 qu3 zou3！er2 zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，wo3men5 huo4de2 ru2ci3 zhi1 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4 kuang2huan1 zhong4 gao1zhang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 ni3 de5，zhi3 xu1 fu4chu1 na4me5 yi1dian3dian3！"

msgid "The Communion is life!"
msgstr ""
"共​融会​就是​生命​！\n"
"gong4 rong2hui4 jiu4shi4 sheng1ming4！"

msgid "The Communion is safe, for now..."
msgstr ""
"共​融会​安全​了​，​暂时​……\n"
"gong4 rong2hui4 an1quan2 le5，zan4shi2……"

msgid "The Communion must flourish, the Communion must grow."
msgstr ""
"共​融会​必须​昌盛​，​共​融会​必须​成长​。\n"
"gong4 rong2hui4 bi4xu1 chang1sheng4，gong4 rong2hui4 bi4xu1 cheng2zhang3。"

msgid ""
"The Communion speaks, and we listen! Give yourself willingly! Join us, and "
"be rewarded!"
msgstr ""
"共融​之声​将​说话​，​而​我们​必须​倾听​。​自愿​献身​吧​！​加入​我们​，​获得​奖赏​！\n"
"gong4 rong2 zhi1 sheng1 jiang1 shuo1hua4，er2 wo3men5 bi4xu1 qing1ting1。zi4yuan4 xian4shen1 ba1！jia1ru4 wo3men5，huo4de2 jiang3shang3！"

msgid ""
"The Communion speaks, and we must listen. All who listen will hear the "
"Communion and be forever changed!"
msgstr ""
"共融​之声​将​说话​，​而​我们​必须​倾听​。​所有​倾听​的​人​都​会​听到​共融​之声​，​并​永远​改变​！\n"
"gong4 rong2 zhi1 sheng1 jiang1 shuo1hua4，er2 wo3men5 bi4xu1 qing1ting1。suo3you3 qing1ting1 de5 ren2 dou1 hui4 ting1dao4 gong4 rong2 zhi1 sheng1，bing4 yong3yuan3 gai3bian4！"

msgid "The Content Pack was successfully deleted."
msgstr ""
"成功​删除​内容​包​。\n"
"cheng2gong1 shan1chu2 nei4rong2 bao1。"

