"\n"
"Please update your game or load a different save from the Load Menu."
msgstr ""
"你​最近​的​自动​存档​所​使用​的​内容​包​{​0​}​（​{​1​}​）​需要​游戏​版本​{​2​:​0​.​0​#​#​#​}​或​更​高​，​但​你​的​版本​是​{​3​:​0​.​0​#​#​#​}​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​更新​游戏​或​从​菜单​中​重新​载入​其他​存档​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zui4jin4 de5 zi4dong4 cun2dang4 suo3 shi3yong4 de5 nei4rong2 bao1 {0} （{ 1 }） xu1yao4 you2xi4 ban3ben3 { 2:0 . 0 # # # } huo4 geng1 gao1，dan4 ni3 de5 ban3ben3 shi4 { 3:0 . 0 # # # }。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 geng1xin1 you2xi4 huo4 cong2 cai4dan1 zhong4 chong2xin1 zai3ru4 qi2ta1 cun2dang4。"

msgid ""
"The Cyberzombie doesn't so much as twitch as you step up behind it. In a "
"single motion, you pull your weapon, take aim, and fire."
msgstr ""
"你​悄无声息​地​来到​赛博​僵尸​身后​，​它​仍然​纹丝不动​。​你​一气呵成​地​拔枪​、​瞄准​、​开火​。\n"
"ni3 qiao3wu2sheng1xi1 de5 lai2dao4 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 shen1hou4，ta1 reng2ran2 wen2si1bu4dong4。ni3 yi1qi4he1cheng2 de5 ba2 qiang1、miao2zhun3、kai1huo3。"

msgid ""
"The Cyberzombie's massive hands flex twice, and it takes a half-step "
"forward. Its mouth twists into a wide grin."
msgstr ""
"赛博​僵尸​用​它​那双​巨手​握​了​两次​拳​，​然后​向前​踏出​半步​。​它​的​嘴角​扭出​一个​狰狞​的​笑容​。\n"
"sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 yong4 ta1 na4 shuang1 ju4 shou3 wo4 le5 liang3 ci4 quan2，ran2hou4 xiang4qian2 ta1 chu1 ban4 bu4。ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 niu3 chu1 yi1ge5 zheng1ning2 de5 xiao4rong2。"

msgid ""
"The Cyberzombie's muscles lock solid. The meat of its body begins to convulse, straining against the the metal that permeates it. \n"
"\n"
"Blood wells up in the corners of its eyes and runs in rivulets down its cheeks."
msgstr ""
"赛博​僵尸​绷紧​了​肌肉​。​它​身上​的​肉​开始​抽搐​，​拉扯​着​贯穿​了​这具​身体​的​金属​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一股​鲜血​从​它​的​眼角​涌出​，​顺着​脸颊​流下​。\n"
"\n"
"sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 beng1jin3 le5 ji1rou4。ta1 shen1shang5 de5 rou4 kai1shi3 chou1chu4，la1che5 zhao2 guan4chuan1 le5 zhe4 ju4 shen1ti3 de5 jin1shu3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 gu3 xian1xue4 cong2 ta1 de5 yan3jiao3 yong3chu1，shun4zhe5 lian3jia2 liu2 xia4。"

msgid "The DVD player is completely trashed."
msgstr ""
"DVD​播放器​彻底​损坏​了​。\n"
"DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 che4di3 sun3huai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The DVD player ramps up to speed, filling the air with a shrill whining sound. Green Winters' face appears on the screen.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2050-04-28."
msgstr ""
"DVD​播放器​的​速度​越来越快​，​空气​中​充斥​着​刺耳​的​呜呜声​。​格林​·​温特斯​的​影像​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2050​-​04​-​28​。\n"
"\n"
"DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 de5 su4du4 yue4 lai2 yue4 kuai4，kong1qi4 zhong4 chong1chi4 zhao2 ci4er3 de5 wu1 wu1 sheng1。ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 ying3xiang4 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2050-04-28。"

msgid ""
"The DVD player ramps up to speed, filling the air with a shrill whining sound. Green Winters' face appears on the screen. He looks younger than you've ever seen him, but from the way he's carrying himself, he's clearly drunk.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2033-05-15."
msgstr ""
"DVD​播放器​的​速度​越来越快​，​空气​中​充斥​着​刺耳​的​呜呜声​。​格林​·​温特斯​的​影像​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​他​比​之前​录像​中​的​样子​看起来​更​年轻​，​但​从​他​的​表现​来看​，​他​显然​是​喝醉​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2033​-​05​-​15​。\n"
"\n"
"DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 de5 su4du4 yue4 lai2 yue4 kuai4，kong1qi4 zhong4 chong1chi4 zhao2 ci4er3 de5 wu1 wu1 sheng1。ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 ying3xiang4 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。ta1 bi3 zhi1qian2 lu4xiang4 zhong4 de5 yang4zi5 kan4qi3lai5 geng1 nian2qing1，dan4 cong2 ta1 de5 biao3xian4 lai2 kan4，ta1 xian3ran2 shi4 he1zui4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2033-05-15。"

msgid ""
"The DVD player ramps up to speed, filling the air with a shrill whining sound. Green Winters' image appears on the screen.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2054-10-31."
msgstr ""
"DVD​播放器​的​速度​越来越快​，​空气​中​充斥​着​刺耳​的​呜呜声​。​格林​·​温特斯​的​影像​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2054​-​10​-​31​。\n"
"\n"
"DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 de5 su4du4 yue4 lai2 yue4 kuai4，kong1qi4 zhong4 chong1chi4 zhao2 ci4er3 de5 wu1 wu1 sheng1。ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 ying3xiang4 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2054-10-31。"

msgid ""
"The Dad that I knew was an old, damaged Euro-War vet who turned to hard-line religion to make sense of the world. \n"
"\n"
"In Stuttgart, that meant either the Ritter Christi or their fascist cousins, the Kreuzritters. My father chose the latter path."
msgstr ""
"我​所​认识​的​父亲​是​个​饱经风霜​的​欧洲​战争​老兵​，​因​身心​创伤​而​投身​极端​宗教​寻求​人生意义​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​斯图加特​，​这​意味着​要么​加入​基督​骑士团​，​要么​投身​其​法西斯​分支​“​十字军​”​。​父亲​选择​了​后者​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 suo3 ren4shi5 de5 fu4qin1 shi4 ge4 bao3jing1feng1shuang1 de5 ou1zhou1 zhan4zheng1 lao3bing1，yin1 shen1xin1 chuang1shang1 er2 tou2shen1 ji2duan1 zong1jiao4 xun2qiu2 ren2 sheng1 yi4 yi4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 si1tu2jia1te4，zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 yao4me5 jia1ru4 ji1du1 ji4 shi4 tuan2，yao4me5 tou2shen1 qi2 fa3xi1si1 fen1zhi1“shi2zi4jun1”。fu4qin1 xuan3ze2 le5 hou4zhe3。"

msgid ""
"The Doc sped things up a little, is all. Made life more interesting for you and me.\n"
"\n"
"We probably wouldn't have lived long enough to see the end if he hadn't."
msgstr ""
"博士​只是​让​一切​加速​了​些​，​让​你​我​的​生活​变得​更​有趣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要不是​他​这么​做​，​我们​恐怕​活​不到​看到​结局​的​那​一天​。\n"
"\n"
"bo2shi4 zhi3shi4 rang4 yi1qie4 jia1su4 le5 xie1，rang4 ni3 wo3 de5 sheng1huo2 bian4de5 geng1 you3qu4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4bu5shi4 ta1 zhe4me5 zuo4，wo3men5 kong3pa4 huo2 bu4dao4 kan4dao4 jie2ju2 de5 na4 yi1 tian1。"

msgid ""
"The Doctor. A topsider, from your Kreuzbasar. He kept us fed.\n"
"\n"
"The contract guaranteed it."
msgstr ""
"是​个​医生​，​住​在​你们​上层​的​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​他​一直​为​我们​提供​食物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​签订​了​合同​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ge4 yi1sheng1，zhu4 zai4 ni3men5 shang4ceng2 de5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。ta1 yi1zhi2 wei2 wo3men5 ti2gong1 shi2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 qian1ding4 le5 he2tong5。"

msgid ""
"The Dragonslayer doesn't mince words, boss. If He didn't like the plan, "
"He'd've told me."
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​从不​拐弯抹角​。​要是​祂​不​喜欢​的话​，​就​会​跟​我​直说​的​。\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 cong2bu4 guai3wan1mo4jiao3。yao4shi5 ta1 bu4 xi3huan5 de5hua4，jiu4 hui4 gen1 wo3 zhi2 shuo1 de5。"

msgid ""
"The Dragonslayer harms all foes within 3 tiles for 16 DMG. On subsequent "
"RNDs, targets take 5 HP DMG and 1 AP DMG. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​对​3​格内​的​所有​敌人​造成​16​点​伤害​。​在​随后​的​回合​中​，​目标​每​回合​受到​5​点​生命​值​伤害​并​失去​1​点​行动​点​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 dui4 3 ge2 nei4 de5 suo3you3 di2ren2 zao4cheng2 16 dian3 shang1hai4。zai4 sui2hou4 de5 hui2he2 zhong4，mu4biao1 mei3 hui2he2 shou4dao4 5 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 bing4 shi1qu4 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"The Dragonslayer now harms all foes within 3 tiles of Dietrich for 16 DMG. "
"On subsequent RNDs, targets take 5 HP DMG and 1 AP DMG. Cost: 1 AP. "
"Duration: 3."
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​现在​会​对迪​特里​希​3​格内​的​所有​敌人​造成​16​点​伤害​。​在​随后​的​回合​中​，​目标​每​回合​受到​5​点​生命​值​伤害​并​失去​1​点​行动​点​。​花费​：​1​行动​点​。​持续时间​：​3​回合​。\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 xian4zai4 hui4 dui4 Di2te4li3xi1 3 ge2 nei4 de5 suo3you3 di2ren2 zao4cheng2 16 dian3 shang1hai4。zai4 sui2hou4 de5 hui2he2 zhong4，mu4biao1 mei3 hui2he2 shou4dao4 5 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4 bing4 shi1qu4 1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。hua1fei4：1 xing2dong4 dian3。chi2xu4shi2jian1：3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"The Dragonslayer wanted me to fight a *real* enemy. So I left the band behind, and I turned to the shadows.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno. Guess I figured that'd be the best way to find one."
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​想要​我​和​*​真正​的​*​敌人​战斗​。​所以​我​就​离开​了​乐队​，​转而​投身于​暗影​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​搞不懂​。​或许​我​觉得​这​就是​最好​的​办法​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 xiang3yao4 wo3 he4*zhen1zheng4 de5*di2ren2 zhan4dou4。suo3yi3 wo3 jiu4 li2kai1 le5 yue4dui4，zhuan3er2 tou2 shen1 yu2 an4ying3 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 gao3bu5dong3。huo4xu3 wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 jiu4shi4 zui4hao3 de5 ban4fa3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"The ELF, with his pretty-boy looks, takes the high-paid corporate desk job, rises to the top, and blocks the top positions forever - NEVER aging, NEVER retiring.\n"
"\n"
"The ORK is willing to work for table scraps, driving the cost of labor down and depriving YOU of a decent wage.\n"
"\n"
"The TROLL takes all of the manual labor jobs. That's right, not even the sweat of your own brow can earn you a living these days!"
msgstr ""
"精灵​靠着​俊俏​脸蛋​，​高薪​坐进​企业​办公室​，​平步青云​霸占​管理​高层​—​—​永远​不老​，​永不​退休​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​兽​人​甘愿​为​残羹冷炙​卖命​，​不断​压低​劳动​成本​，​害​你​连​体面​工资​都​挣​不​着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨魔​抢走了​所有​体力活​。​没错​，​这年头​你​连​卖苦力​都​混不上​饭​吃​！\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 kao4 zhao2 jun4qiao4 lian3dan4，gao1xin1 zuo4 jin4 qi3ye4 ban4gong1shi4，ping2bu4qing1yun2 ba4zhan4 guan3li3 gao1ceng2——yong3yuan3 bu4 lao3，yong3bu4 tui4xiu1。\n"
"\n"
"shou4 ren2 gan1yuan4 wei2 can2 geng1 leng3 zhi4 mai4ming4，bu4duan4 ya1di1 lao2dong4 cheng2ben3，hai4 ni3 lian2 ti3mian4 gong1zi1 dou1 zheng4 bu4 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"ju4mo2 qiang3 zou3 le5 suo3you3 ti3 li4 huo2。mei2cuo4，zhe4nian2tou5 ni3 lian2 mai4ku3li4 dou1 hun4 bu4 shang4 fan4 chi1！"

msgid "The Engineer"
msgstr ""
"工程师\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1"

msgid "The Engineer Must Survive"
msgstr ""
"工程师​必须​存活\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 bi4xu1 cun2huo2"

msgid "The Engineer holds his silence."
msgstr ""
"工程师​没有​说话​。\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 mei2you3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"The Engineer lies splayed out on the ground, his body trembling violently.\n"
"\n"
"Eiger shoves a bottle up his nose and squeezes. The Engineer shudders violently, then the trembling begins to subside."
msgstr ""
"工程师​四肢​大张​地​躺​在​地上​，​身体​剧烈地​颤抖​着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​将​一瓶​液体​塞进​他​的​鼻孔​并​用力​挤压​。​工程师​剧烈​抖动​了​一下​，​随后​逐渐​平静下来​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 si4zhi1 dai4 zhang1 de5 tang3 zai4 di4shang5，shen1ti3 ju4 lie4 de5 chan4dou3 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 jiang1 yi1 ping2 ye4ti3 se4 jin4 ta1 de5 bi2kong3 bing4 yong4li4 ji3ya1。gong1cheng2shi1 ju4lie4 dou3dong4 le5 yi1xia4，sui2hou4 zhu2jian4 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"The Engineer's body surges forward. A violent, convulsive motion. His eyes bulge out of his skull.\n"
"\n"
"Then his chest evaporates in a spray of light."
msgstr ""
"工程师​的​身体​猛地​向前​冲​去​。​一阵​剧烈​的​抽搐​。​他​的​眼睛​凸出​了​眼眶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​紧接着​，​他​的​胸膛​在​光线​喷射​中​蒸发​开来​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 de5 shen1ti3 meng3de5 xiang4qian2 chong1 qu4。yi1zhen4 ju4lie4 de5 chou1chu4。ta1 de5 yan3jing5 tu1chu1 le5 yan3kuang4。\n"
"\n"
"jin3jie1zhe5，ta1 de5 xiong1tang2 zai4 guang1xian4 pen1she4 zhong4 zheng1fa1 kai1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"The Engineer's eyes bulge, and he beats the back of his head against the floor.\n"
"\n"
"He opens his mouth to speak again, but the only sound that comes out is a gurgling scream."
msgstr ""
"工程师​的​眼睛​突了​出来​，​他​用​后脑勺​撞击​着​地板​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​张开嘴​准备​再次​说话​，​但​只有​一声​呜咽​的​尖叫​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 de5 yan3jing5 tu1 le5 chu1lai2，ta1 yong4 hou4nao3shao2 zhuang4ji1 zhao2 di4ban3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhang1 kai1 zui3 zhun3bei4 zai4ci4 shuo1hua4，dan4 zhi3you3 yi1sheng1 wu1ye4 de5 jian1jiao4。"

msgid ""
"The Engineer's eyes burn with hate. Beads of sweat dot his brow as he struggles to control the tremors that wrack his body.\n"
"\n"
"He takes a deep breath, holds it, and releases it slowly. The trembling begins to subside."
msgstr ""
"工程师​的​双眼​中​燃烧​着​仇恨​。​他​额头​上​冒​出颗​颗​汗珠​，​努力​控制​着​全身​的​颤抖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​深吸​一口气​，​屏住​呼吸​，​然后​缓缓​吐​出​。​颤抖​开始​平息​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 de5 shuang1yan3 zhong4 ran2shao1 zhao2 chou2hen4。ta1 e2tou2 shang4 mao4 chu1 ke1 ke1 han4zhu1，nu3li4 kong4zhi4 zhao2 quan2shen1 de5 chan4dou3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，bing3 zhu4 hu1xi1，ran2hou4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。chan4dou3 kai1shi3 ping2xi1。"

msgid ""
"The Engineer's eyes remain locked on the chip. His face has gone pallid "
"white, and his shirt is drenched with sweat. His eyes bulge, and his "
"breathing is heavy."
msgstr ""
"工程师​的​眼睛​一直​死死​盯​着​芯片​。​他​的​脸色​变得​苍白​，​衬衫​被​汗水​浸透​。​他​的​眼睛​凸出​，​呼吸​沉重​。\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 de5 yan3jing5 yi1zhi2 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 xin1pian4。ta1 de5 lian3se4 bian4de5 cang1bai2，chen4shan1 bei4 han4shui3 jin4tou4。ta1 de5 yan3jing5 tu1chu1，hu1xi1 chen2zhong4。"

msgid "The F-State and its future are trivial matters. "
msgstr ""
"动荡​带​和​它​的​未来​无足轻重​。\n"
"dong4dang4 dai4 he4 ta1 de5 wei4lai2 wu2zu2qing1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"The Feuerschwinge Wyrm is not a minor player in the great cycle. The effects"
" of her release will resonate across time and space."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​火翼​在​大​循环​中​绝非​微不足道​的​角色​。​将​她​释放​所​产生​的​影响​会​在​整个​时​空中​回荡​。\n"
"ju4long2 Huo3yi4 zai4 dai4 xun2huan2 zhong4 jue2fei1 wei1bu4zu2dao4 de5 jue2se4。jiang1 ta1 shi4fang4 suo3 chan3sheng1 de5 ying3xiang3 hui4 zai4 zheng3ge4 shi2 kong1zhong1 hui2dang4。"

msgid ""
"The Firewing brought blind destruction into this world with her. Death without purpose.\n"
"\n"
"What I do tonight is far from blind. It is a necessary action for the survival of our species."
msgstr ""
"火翼​带给​这个​世界​的​是​盲目​的​毁灭​。​毫无意义​的​死亡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​今晚​所​做​的​一切​绝非​盲目​。​这是​为了​我们​物种​的​生存​而​必须​采取​的​行动​。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 dai4gei3 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 de5 shi4 mang2mu4 de5 hui3mie4。hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4 de5 si3wang2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jin1wan3 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4 jue2fei1 mang2mu4。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 wo3men5 wu4zhong3 de5 sheng1cun2 er2 bi4xu1 cai3qu3 de5 xing2dong4。"

msgid ""
"The Firewing burned and murdered and caused untold damage in her bestial rage. \n"
"\n"
"Until the Dragonfall. Until I stopped her.\n"
"\n"
"But that destruction was merely a symptom of a greater cancer. "
msgstr ""
"火翼​在​野兽​般的​狂怒​中​焚烧​、​屠杀​，​造成​了​无法估量​的​破坏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​直到​龙​陨之日​。​直到​我​阻止​了​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​那场​破坏​不过​是​某个​更​严重​的​病源​的​表象​。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 zai4 ye3shou4 ban1 de5 kuang2nu4 zhong4 fen2shao1、tu2sha1，zao4cheng2 le5 wu2 fa3 gu1 liang2 de5 po4huai4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi2dao4 long2 yun3 zhi1 ri4。zhi2dao4 wo3 zu3zhi3 le5 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 na4 chang2 po4huai4 bu4guo4 shi4 mou3 ge4 geng1 yan2zhong4 de5 bing4yuan2 de5 biao3xiang4。"

msgid ""
"The Firewing's men just made an attempt on your life, $(l.name). It is clear from the message we just saw that Audran sent them out looking for you.\n"
"\n"
"Given enough time, he'll do it again. And next time, they might be more successful."
msgstr ""
"火翼​的​手下​试图​刺杀​你​，​$(l.name)​。​从​我们​刚​获得​的​讯息​中​可以​清楚​得知​，​是​奥​德兰​派​他们​来​追杀​你​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​时间​足够​，​他会​再次​行动​。​而​下​一次​，​他们​就​更​容易​得手​。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 de5 shou3xia4 shi4tu2 ci4sha1 ni3，$(l.name)。cong2 wo3men5 gang1 huo4de2 de5 xun4xi1 zhong4 ke3yi3 qing1chu5 de2zhi1，shi4 Ao4de2lan2 pai4 ta1men5 lai2 zhui1sha1 ni3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 shi2jian1 zu2gou4，ta1 hui4 zai4ci4 xing2dong4。er2 xia4 yi1ci4，ta1men5 jiu4 geng1 rong2yi4 de2shou3。"

msgid ""
"The Firewing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel's voice is thick with dread.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She lives."
msgstr ""
"火翼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​声音​里​充满​了​恐惧​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​还​活着​。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 li3 chong1man3 le5 kong3ju4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 hai2 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
"The Flux sees to it that few things stay the same for long. Without Monika here to read it and react, I'm not sure what the future holds.\n"
"\n"
"Only time will tell."
msgstr ""
"在​动荡​带​，​没什么​能​长时间​一成不变​。​现在​没​了​莫妮卡​的​审时度势​，​我​也​不​确定​未来​会​变成​什么样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只能​走​一步​看​一步​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 dong4dang4 dai4，mei2shen2me5 neng2 zhang3 shi2 jian1 yi1cheng2bu4bian4。xian4zai4 mei2 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shen3shi2duo2shi4，wo3 ye3 bu4 que4ding4 wei4lai2 hui4 bian4cheng2 shen2me5yang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3neng2 zou3 yi1 bu4 kan4 yi1 bu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The Heart of Feuerstelle and I share a common goal, and a common responsibility. We have to deal with Harrow - it's on *us* to stop him.\n"
"\n"
"But you, $(l.name)... your responsibilities are here. And I can't let you walk away from them."
msgstr ""
"我​和​火坑​之心​目标​一致​。​必须​解决​掉​哈罗​，​阻止​他​是​*​我们​*​的​责任​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​，​$(l.name)​……​你​的​责任​是​留在​这里​，​我​不能​让​你​选择​逃避​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 huo3keng1 zhi1 xin1 mu4biao1 yi1zhi4。bi4xu1 jie3jue2 diao4 ha1luo2，zu3zhi3 ta1 shi4*wo3men5*de5 ze2ren4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3，$(l.name)……ni3 de5 ze2ren4 shi4 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3，wo3 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 xuan3ze2 tao2bi4。"

msgid ""
"The Heart of Feuerstelle lowers its eyeless head, then traces an elaborate gesture into the air. A warm glow envelops it, and a similar glow spills from Glory.\n"
"\n"
"There is a bright flash, and the spirit is gone."
msgstr ""
"火坑​之心​垂下​没有​眼睛​的​头颅​，​随即​在​空气​中​划出​繁复​的​手势​。​温暖​的​光晕​将​其​笼罩​，​格洛丽​的​身上​也​发出​了​相似​的​辉光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一道​亮光​闪过​，​精魂​消失​了​。\n"
"\n"
"huo3keng1 zhi1 xin1 chui2xia4 mei2you3 yan3jing5 de5 tou2lu2，sui2ji2 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4 hua2 chu1 fan2fu4 de5 shou3shi4。wen1nuan3 de5 guang1yun4 jiang1 qi2 long3zhao4，Ge2luo4li2 de5 shen1shang5 ye3 fa1chu1 le5 xiang1si4 de5 hui1 guang1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dao4 liang4guang1 shan3guo4，jing1hun2 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid "The Humanis Leader Must Survive"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​首领​必须​存活\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 shou3ling3 bi4xu1 cun2huo2"

msgid ""
"The Humanis compound smells like a locker room, and doesn’t look much better. Calling the building “run down” would be an understatement; paint is peeling off of the cheap duraplast walls, and the tiles on the floor are mired with decades’ worth of grime. It’s an old, ugly place, perfectly suited to the old, ugly ideology being practiced here.\n"
"\n"
"You enter the compound. The information that Samuel Beckenbauer sent you here to find lies somewhere ahead."
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​的​据点​闻​起来​就​像​更衣室​，​而​看起来​也好​不到​哪里​去​。​称​这栋​建筑​“​破旧不堪​”​都​算是​客气​了​：​廉价​硬化​塑料​墙上​的​油漆​已经​剥落​，​地板​上​的​瓷砖​沾满​了​几十年​的​污垢​。​这座​陈旧​丑陋​的​场所​，​与​这里​奉行​的​陈腐​丑陋​的​意识形态​堪称​绝配​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​向​据点​内部​深入​。​塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔​派​你​来​这里​寻找​的​信息​就​在​前方​某处​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 ju4dian3 wen2 qi3lai5 jiu4 xiang4 geng1yi1shi4，er2 kan4qi3lai5 ye3hao3 bu4dao4 na3li3 qu4。chen4 zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4“po4 jiu4 bu4 kan1” dou1 suan4shi4 ke4qi5 le5：lian2jia4 ying4hua4 su4liao4 qiang2 shang4 de5 you2qi1 yi3jing1 bo1luo4，di4ban3 shang4 de5 ci2zhuan1 zhan1man3 le5 ji1 shi2 nian2 de5 wu1gou4。zhe4 zuo4 chen2jiu4 chou3lou4 de5 chang3suo3，yu4 zhe4li3 feng4xing2 de5 chen2fu3 chou3lou4 de5 yi4shi2xing2tai4 kan1cheng1 jue2pei4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4 ju4dian3 nei4bu4 shen1ru4。sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3 pai4 ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 xun2zhao3 de5 xin4xi1 jiu4 zai4 qian2fang1 mou3chu4。"

msgid ""
"The Humanis gunmen flanking Stahl exchange uncertain glances. One begins to "
"raise her pistol, but hurriedly lowers it when the Humanis leader steps "
"forward."
msgstr ""
"斯塔尔​身旁​的​人类​至上​主义者​枪手​们​疑虑​地​交换​着​眼神​。​其中​一名​女​枪手​刚​抬起​手枪​，​但​看到​首领​上前​，​又​赶忙​放下​武器​。\n"
"Si1ta3er3 shen1 pang2 de5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 qiang1shou3 men5 yi2lu:4 de5 jiao1huan4 zhao2 yan3shen2。qi2zhong1 yi1 ming2 nu:3 qiang1shou3 gang1 tai2qi3 shou3qiang1，dan4 kan4dao4 shou3ling3 shang4qian2，you4 gan3mang2 fang4xia4 wu3qi4。"

msgid "The Humanis leader is safe. Hope that pays off."
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​首领​安全​了​。​希望​这样​会​有​回报​。\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 shou3ling3 an1quan2 le5。xi1wang4 zhe4yang4 hui4 you3 hui2bao4。"

msgid ""
"The Huntsman grants all friends within 3 tiles DMG +4, but reduces accuracy by -10%. Lasts 3 RNDS.\n"
"\n"
"Cooldown: 1"
msgstr ""
"荒野​猎人​图腾​的​力量​可使​3​格​范围​内​所有​友方​单位​获得​+​4​伤害​，​但​命中率​-​10​%​。​持续​3​回合​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷却​时间​：​1​回合\n"
"\n"
"huang1ye3 lie4ren2 tu2teng2 de5 li4liang5 ke3 shi3 3 ge2 fan4wei2 nei4 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4 huo4de2 +4 shang1hai4，dan4 ming4zhong4lu:4 -10 %。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。\n"
"\n"
"leng3que4 shi2jian1：1 hui2he2"

msgid ""
"The Huntsman grants all friends within three tiles DMG +4, but reduces "
"accuracy by -10%. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"荒野​猎人​使​三格​范围​内​的​所有​友方​单位​获得​+​4​伤害​，​但​命中率​降低​10​%​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"huang1ye3 lie4ren2 shi3 san1 ge2 fan4wei2 nei4 de5 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4 huo4de2 +4 shang1hai4，dan4 ming4zhong4lu:4 jiang4di1 10 %。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"The Jewühl District is everything that your client made it out to be.\n"
"\n"
"Corporate complexes of all description crowd into one another, competing for the district's limited space."
msgstr ""
"耶沃​于尔区​与​你​客户​的​描述​一模一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​五花八门​的​公司​园区​相互​挤占​，​争夺​地区​内部​的​有限​空间​。\n"
"\n"
"ye1 wo4 yu2 er3 qu1 yu4 ni3 ke4hu4 de5 miao2shu4 yi1mu2yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"wu3hua1ba1men2 de5 gong1si1 yuan2qu1 xiang1hu4 ji3zhan4，zheng1duo2 di4qu1 nei4bu4 de5 you3xian4 kong1jian1。"

msgid ""
"The Kreuzbasar has been positively buzzing. Perhaps not as evident now, but "
"you can still feel it in the air."
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​一直​都​很​热闹​。​如今​或许​不​那么​明显​了​，​但​你​仍然​能​在​空气​中​感受​到​那份​气息​。\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 yi1zhi2 dou1 hen3 re4nao5。ru2jin1 huo4xu3 bu4 na4me5 ming2xian3 le5，dan4 ni3 reng2ran2 neng2 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4 gan3shou4 dao4 na4 fen4 qi4xi1。"

msgid "The Kreuzbasar is safe. Monika's legacy will live on."
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​安全​了​。​莫妮卡​的​遗志​会​传承​下去​。\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 an1quan2 le5。Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yi2zhi4 hui4 chuan2cheng2 xia4qu4。"

msgid "The Kreuzbasar needs more people like you, $(l.freund)."
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​需要​更​多​像​你​这样​的​人​，​$(l.freund)​。\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 xu1yao4 geng1 duo1 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2，$(l.freund)。"

msgid ""
"The Kreuzbasar will maintain its stability a while longer thanks to us, my "
"friend."
msgstr ""
"由于​我们​的​努力​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​将​得以​继续​维持​稳定​一段时间​，​我​的​朋友​。\n"
"you2yu2 wo3men5 de5 nu3li4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jiang1 de2yi3 ji4xu4 wei2chi2 wen3ding4 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1，wo3 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"The Kreuzbasar. Insulated from the rest of Berlin, an island of hope in a swamp of crime, chaos and misery. Your home, and the former home of Monika Schäfer.\n"
"\n"
"Its uneven streets and familiar faces are a welcome sight."
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​。​这里​与​柏林​的​其他​地方​隔绝​，​在​犯罪​、​混乱​与​苦难​的​泥沼​中​宛如​一座​希望​之​岛​。​这里​曾​是​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​的​家​，​如今​也​成​了​你​的​家园​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​凹凸不平​的​街道​与​熟悉​的​面孔​，​总让​人​倍感​亲切​。\n"
"\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。zhe4li3 yu4 bo2lin2 de5 qi2ta1 di4fang1 ge2jue2，zai4 fan4zui4、hun4luan4 yu4 ku3nan4 de5 ni2zhao3 zhong4 wan3ru2 yi1 zuo4 xi1wang4 zhi1 dao3。zhe4li3 ceng2 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 de5 jia1，ru2jin1 ye3 cheng2 le5 ni3 de5 jia1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 ao1tu1bu4ping2 de5 jie1dao4 yu4 shu2xi1 de5 mian4kong3，zong3 rang4 ren2 bei4gan3 qin1qie4。"

msgid ""
"The Kreuzbasar? My favorite cafe's in the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Look. You're crazy, and we're probably all going to die, but we are *not* letting you get away with this."
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​？​我​最​喜欢​的​咖啡馆​就​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​你​肯定​是​疯​了​，​而且​我们​大概​全都​得​死​在​这​，​但​我们​*​不能​*​让​你​就​这么​逍遥法外​。\n"
"\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4？wo3 zui4 xi3huan5 de5 ka1fei1guan3 jiu4 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 feng1 le5，er2qie3 wo3men5 da4gai4 quan2dou1 de2 si3 zai4 zhe4，dan4 wo3men5*bu4neng2*rang4 ni3 jiu4 zhe4me5 xiao1yao2fa3wai4。"

msgid ""
"The Lobatchevski Syndicate. They're a branch of the Russian mob that's based out of Scandinavia... the Engineer had a long and storied career of working with them, so it fits.\n"
"\n"
"Based on what I found, I'd say that there's an 85-90% chance that they're the ones who were paying his bills. Good enough odds to roll the dice on, certainly."
msgstr ""
"洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​，​一伙​盘踞​在​斯堪的纳维亚​半岛​的​俄罗斯​黑帮​……​工程师​与​他们​共事​了​很长​一段时间​，​因此​这个​推测​合情合理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​我​的​调查结果​，​我​认为​他们​是​背后​金主​的​可能性​高达​85​-​90​%​。​这样​的​概率​足够​让​人​放手​一试​了​。\n"
"\n"
"luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2，yi1 huo3 pan2ju4 zai4 si1kan1di4na4wei2ya4 ban4dao3 de5 e2luo2si1 hei1bang1……gong1cheng2shi1 yu4 ta1men5 gong4shi4 le5 hen3 zhang3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1，yin1ci3 zhe4ge5 tui1ce4 he2qing2he2li3。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 wo3 de5 diao4cha2jie2guo3，wo3 ren4wei2 ta1men5 shi4 bei4hou4 jin1zhu3 de5 ke3neng2xing4 gao1da2 85 -90 %。zhe4yang4 de5 gai4lu:4 zu2gou4 rang4 ren2 fang4shou3 yi1 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The Lodge has contacted you and requested that you return the prototype to "
"them instead of Herr Shmidt. They'll match his offer, so you don't have to "
"worry about the money. But they're only interested if the prototype is "
"undamaged."
msgstr ""
"结社​已经​联系​了​你​，​并​要求​你​将​原型机​带回​给​他们​，​而​不是​施密特​先生​。​他们​会出​同样​的​价钱​，​所以​你​不必​担心​钱​的​问题​。​但​他们​只​对​完好无损​的​原型​感兴趣​。\n"
"jie2she4 yi3jing1 lian2xi4 le5 ni3，bing4 yao1qiu2 ni3 jiang1 yuan2 xing2 ji1 dai4hui2 gei3 ta1men5，er2 bu4shi4 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5。ta1men5 hui4 chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jia4qian5，suo3yi3 ni3 bu4bi4 dan1xin1 qian2 de5 wen4ti2。dan4 ta1men5 zhi3 dui4 wan2hao3wu2sun3 de5 yuan2xing2 gan3xing4qu4。"

msgid ""
"The Lodge turned me into a killer, $(l.name). That gnaws at my guts every minute of every day, and I still can't sleep at night. Innocent people - *normal* people - died because of what I did. And you know why they made me do it?\n"
"\n"
"Because they could."
msgstr ""
"“​结社​”​把​我​变成​了​杀人​凶手​，​$(l.name)​。​我​的​内心​每时每刻​都​像​在​被​啃噬​，​让​我​至今​夜不能寐​。​那些​无辜​的​*​普通​*​人​都​因​我​而​死​。​而​你​知道​他们​为什么​逼​我​这么​做​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​因为​他们​愿意​。\n"
"\n"
"“jie2she4” ba3 wo3 bian4cheng2 le5 sha1ren2 xiong1shou3，$(l.name)。wo3 de5 nei4xin1 mei3shi2mei3ke4 dou1 xiang4 zai4 bei4 ken3 shi4，rang4 wo3 zhi4jin1 ye4 bu4 neng2 mei4。na4xie1 wu2gu1 de5*pu3tong1*ren2 dou1 yin1 wo3 er2 si3。er2 ni3 zhi1dao4 ta1men5 wei4shen2me5 bi1 wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 yin1wei4 ta1men5 yuan4yi4。"

msgid ""
"The Lodge's transport is easily roomy enough to hold the MKVI. You could "
"order it inside with a simple command if you wanted to."
msgstr ""
"结社​的​运货车​空间​宽敞​，​足够​承载​MKVI​的​重量​。​只​需​一声令下​，​你​便​能​指挥​其​自行​进入​。\n"
"jie2she4 de5 yun4 huo4 che1 kong1jian1 kuan1chang5，zu2gou4 cheng2zai4 MKVI de5 zhong4liang4。zhi3 xu1 yi1 sheng1 ling3 xia4，ni3 bian4 neng2 zhi3hui1 qi2 zi4xing2 jin4ru4。"

msgid "The Lodge?"
msgstr ""
"结社​？\n"
"jie2she4？"

msgid ""
"The MKVI gives a final heave, and its armored skull crumples like a paper cup. Its body goes slack, and it topples to the ground.\n"
"\n"
"Dead."
msgstr ""
"MKVI​用尽​最后​的​力气​，​布满​装甲​的​头颅​像​纸杯​般​扭曲​变形​。​那具​躯体​瘫软​下来​，​轰然​倒地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"MKVI yong4jin4 zui4hou4 de5 li4qi5，bu4man3 zhuang1jia3 de5 tou2lu2 xiang4 zhi3bei1 ban1 niu3qu1 bian4xing2。na4 ju4 qu1ti3 tan1ruan3 xia4lai5，hong1ran2 dao3di4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 si3 le5。"

msgid "The MKVI stands impassively by your side. Awaiting your command."
msgstr ""
"MKVI​原型机​静静地​站​在​你​身旁​，​等候​着​你​的​命令​。\n"
"MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 jing4 jing4 de5 zhan4 zai4 ni3 shen1 pang2，deng3hou4 zhao2 ni3 de5 ming4ling4。"

msgid ""
"The MKVI stands impassively by your side. Unprotesting, because it is unable to protest.\n"
"\n"
"A prisoner in its own body."
msgstr ""
"MKVI​原型机​静静地​站​在​你​身旁​，​没有​反抗​，​也​无法​反抗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​困在​自己​躯体​中​的​囚徒​。\n"
"\n"
"MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 jing4 jing4 de5 zhan4 zai4 ni3 shen1 pang2，mei2you3 fan3kang4，ye3 wu2fa3 fan3kang4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 kun4 zai4 zi4ji3 qu1ti3 zhong4 de5 qiu2tu2。"

msgid "The Mechanic"
msgstr ""
"机械师\n"
"ji1xie4shi1"

msgid ""
"The Monika-image on the screen of your PDA begins to *change.* Her porcelain flesh ripples and writhes, and the screen explodes into static.\n"
"\n"
"A moment later, the image clears. Something cold and mechanical fills your vision."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​的​莫妮卡​影像​开始​变化​。​她​的​瓷白​皮肤​波动​翻腾​，​使​屏幕​爆炸​成​一片​雪花​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​后​，​影像​恢复​清晰​。​一种​冷冽​机械​的​景象​填满​了​你​的​视野​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 de5 Mo4ni1ka3 ying3xiang4 kai1shi3 bian4hua4。ta1 de5 ci2 bai2 pi2fu1 bo1dong4 fan1teng2，shi3 ping2mu4 bao4zha4 cheng2 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 hou4，ying3xiang4 hui1fu4 qing1xi1。yi1zhong3 leng3lie4 ji1xie4 de5 jing3xiang4 tian2man3 le5 ni3 de5 shi4ye3。"

msgid ""
"The Monika-image writhes in pain, then retches up a fountain of blue-white light. Patches of its skin begin dissolving into static.\n"
"\n"
"It takes a deep, rattling breath, and then seems to calm itself."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​影像​痛苦​地​扭动​着​，​随即​呕出​一股​蓝白色​的​光柱​。​它​皮肤​的​某些​区域​已经​开始​瓦解​为​雪花​信号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​发出​嘶​嘶​作响​的​深呼吸​，​随后​似乎​平静​了​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 tong4ku3 de5 niu3 dong4 zhao2，sui2ji2 ou3 chu1 yi1 gu3 lan2 bai2 se4 de5 guang1zhu4。ta1 pi2fu1 de5 mou3xie1 qu1yu4 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 wa3jie3 wei2 xue3hua1 xin4hao4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 fa1chu1 si1 si1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 shen1 hu1 xi1，sui2hou4 si4hu1 ping2jing4 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"The Nephilim Network has trained me to hunt data both in the Matrix and the "
"meat world. "
msgstr ""
"拿​非利​网络​训练​了​我​在​矩阵​和​现实​世界​里​捕捉​数据​的​能力​。\n"
"na2 fei1 li4 wang3luo4 xun4lian4 le5 wo3 zai4 ju3zhen4 he4 xian4shi2 shi4jie4 li3 bu3zhuo1 shu4ju4 de5 neng2li4。"

msgid ""
"The Network has rewarded me with a state-of-the-art replacements for my weak"
" meat body. "
msgstr ""
"拿​非利​网络​为​我​脆弱​的​肉体​奖励​了​最​先进​的​替代品​。\n"
"na2 fei1 li4 wang3luo4 wei2 wo3 cui4ruo4 de5 rou4ti3 jiang3li4 le5 zui4 xian1jin4 de5 ti4dai4pin3。"

msgid ""
"The Network wanted a shaman that comes from the streets with a full command "
"of spirits"
msgstr ""
"拿​非利​网络​想要​一个​来自​街头​，​同时​能​完全​掌控​精魂​的​萨满​。\n"
"na2 fei1 li4 wang3luo4 xiang3yao4 yi1ge5 lai2zi4 jie1tou2，tong2shi2 neng2 wan2quan2 zhang3kong4 jing1hun2 de5 sa4man3。"

msgid ""
"The Pain Inducer feels curiously heavy in your hand. Its vicious design is "
"underscored by the bloody scene around you."
msgstr ""
"你​手中​的​疼痛​诱发​器竟​有种​奇异​的​沉重感​。​周遭​的​血腥​场景​更​衬托出​它​凶残​的​设计​。\n"
"ni3 shou3 zhong4 de5 teng2tong4 you4fa1 qi4 jing4 you3zhong3 qi2yi4 de5 chen2 chong2 gan3。zhou1zao1 de5 xue4xing1 chang3jing3 geng1 chen4 tuo1 chu1 ta1 xiong1can2 de5 she4ji4。"

msgid "The Rabbit Hole"
msgstr ""
"兔子​洞\n"
"tu4zi5 dong4"

msgid ""
"The Raben.... raven ghosts? Nope, never heard about anything like that. "
"Sounds like something out of a fairy tale."
msgstr ""
"鸦​什么​……​幽灵​吗​？​不​，​我​从来​没听说过​。​感觉​像是​什么​童话​里​走​出来​的​人物​。\n"
"Ya1shen2me5……you1ling2 ma5？bu4，wo3 cong2lai2 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4。gan3jue2 xiang4 shi4 shen2me5 tong2hua4 li3 zou3 chu1lai2 de5 ren2wu4。"

msgid ""
"The Rabengeister business? I guess that makes sense. Raben sounds kind of "
"like Robin… You know, Robin Hood?"
msgstr ""
"跟​“​鸦灵​”​有关​吗​？​这倒​是​说​得通​。​乌鸦​不​就​喜欢​偷东西​吗​？\n"
"gen1“Ya1ling2” you3guan1 ma5？zhe4 dao3 shi4 shuo1 de2 tong1。wu1ya1 bu4 jiu4 xi3huan5 tou1 dong1 xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"The Rabengeister steal to support their kiez in hard times. I'd do the same,"
" in their position. I'm not about to start a war with a neighbor over a few "
"guns."
msgstr ""
"鸦灵​进行​偷盗​是​为了​支撑​自己​的​街区​度过难关​。​如果​我​是​他们​的话​也​会​做​一样​的​事​。​我​并​不想​为了​几条​枪​就​和​邻近​街区​开战​。\n"
"Ya1ling2 jin4xing2 tou1dao4 shi4 wei4le5 zhi1cheng1 zi4ji3 de5 jie1qu1 du4 guo4 nan2 guan1。ru2guo3 wo3 shi4 ta1men5 de5hua4 ye3 hui4 zuo4 yi1yang4 de5 shi4。wo3 bing4 bu4xiang3 wei4le5 ji1 tiao2 qiang1 jiu4 he4 lin2jin4 jie1qu1 kai1zhan4。"

msgid "The Rabengeister, actually."
msgstr ""
"其实​是​“​鸦灵​”​。\n"
"qi2shi2 shi4“Ya1ling2”。"

msgid "The Rabengeister."
msgstr ""
"是​“​鸦灵​”​。\n"
"shi4“Ya1ling2”。"

msgid ""
"The Romani patriarch is an impressive figure: an enormous man in his late sixties, burly and broad-chested despite his age.\n"
"\n"
"His voice is deep and resonant, and his breath is heavy with the stench of pipe tobacco."
msgstr ""
"这位​罗姆​族长​给​人​留下​了​深刻印象​：​他​年​近​七旬​，​身材​魁梧​，​尽管​年事已高​，​但​胸膛​依然​宽阔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​声音​低沉​而​嘹亮​，​口中​散发​着​浓重​的​烟草味​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4wei4 luo2 mu3 zu2zhang3 gei3 ren2 liu2xia4 le5 shen1 ke4 yin4 xiang4：ta1 nian2 jin4 qi1 xun2，shen1cai2 kui2wu2，jin3guan3 nian2shi4yi3gao1，dan4 xiong1tang2 yi1ran2 kuan1kuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 di1chen2 er2 liao2liang4，kou3 zhong4 san4fa1 zhao2 nong2zhong4 de5 yan1 cao3 wei4。"

msgid ""
"The Russians were still slow. And though they had us outnumbered and "
"outgunned, we could run circles around them."
msgstr ""
"俄罗斯​人​行动​依然​迟缓​。​尽管​他们​人数​和​火力​都​占优​，​但​我们​仍能​轻松​应对​。\n"
"e2luo2si1 ren2 xing2dong4 yi1ran2 chi2huan3。jin3guan3 ta1men5 ren2shu4 he4 huo3li4 dou1 zhan4you1，dan4 wo3men5 reng2 neng2 qing1song1 ying4dui4。"

msgid "The Safehouse"
msgstr ""
"安全​屋\n"
"an1quan2 wu1"

msgid ""
"The Schockwellenreiter believe that a new drug has been developed for use on"
" the MKVI prototype, and wants a copy of the formula."
msgstr ""
"电波​骑士​认为​一种​新药​已​被​开发​用于​MKVI​原型机​，​并​要求​获取​该​配方​的​副本​。\n"
"dian4Bo1qi2shi4 ren4wei2 yi1zhong3 xin1 yao4 yi3 bei4 kai1fa1 yong4yu2 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1，bing4 yao1qiu2 huo4qu3 gai1 pei4fang1 de5 fu4ben3。"

msgid ""
"The Schockwellenreiter have learned that there are visual recordings of the "
"project undergoing trials, wants them."
msgstr ""
"电波​骑士​获悉​该​项目​试验​过程​存在​影像​记录​，​并​要求​获取​这些​影像​。\n"
"dian4Bo1qi2shi4 huo4xi1 gai1 xiang4mu4 shi4yan4 guo4cheng2 cun2zai4 ying3xiang4 ji4lu4，bing4 yao1qiu2 huo4qu3 zhe4xie1 ying3xiang4。"

msgid ""
"The Schockwellenreiter is fighting for the freedom and liberty of information in Berlin. The F-State manages many things, but information remains controlled.\n"
"\n"
"Corporations keep any information they can under lock and key - silencing dissent, silencing indiscretions, silencing the truth. "
msgstr ""
"电波​骑士​在​柏林​为​信息​自由​而战​。​动荡​带​掌控​诸多​事务​，​但​信息​始终​处于​管控​之下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​各大​公司​将​所有​能​掌控​的​信息​严加​封锁​—​—​压制​异议​，​掩盖​失当​，​封锁​真相​。\n"
"\n"
"dian4Bo1qi2shi4 zai4 bo2lin2 wei2 xin4xi1 zi4you2 er2 zhan4。dong4dang4 dai4 zhang3kong4 zhu1duo1 shi4wu4，dan4 xin4xi1 shi3zhong1 chu3yu2 guan3kong4 zhi1xia4。\n"
"\n"
"ge4 dai4 gong1si1 jiang1 suo3you3 neng2 zhang3kong4 de5 xin4xi1 yan2jia1 feng1suo3——ya1zhi4 yi4yi4，yan3gai4 shi1dang4，feng1suo3 zhen1xiang4。"

msgid ""
"The Schockwellenreiter want a copy of all the data you can find from the "
"project responsible for the MKVI prototype."
msgstr ""
"电波​骑士​要求​获取​关于​负责​MKVI​原型机​项目​的​所有​可​查​数据​副本​。\n"
"dian4Bo1qi2shi4 yao1qiu2 huo4qu3 guan1yu2 fu4ze2 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 xiang4mu4 de5 suo3you3 ke3 cha2 shu4ju4 fu4ben3。"

msgid ""
"The Schockwellenreiter want a copy of the data from the project responsible "
"for the MKVI prototype."
msgstr ""
"电波​骑士​要求​获取​关于​负责​MKVI​原型机​项目​的​所有​可​查​数据​副本​。\n"
"dian4Bo1qi2shi4 yao1qiu2 huo4qu3 guan1yu2 fu4ze2 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 xiang4mu4 de5 suo3you3 ke3 cha2 shu4ju4 fu4ben3。"

msgid ""
"The Schockwellenreiter will be interested in all of this information... according to their charter, sharing this information with the world would be a top priority.\n"
"\n"
"In the wrong hands, however, this formula could cause immense harm."
msgstr ""
"电波​骑士​肯定​对​这些​信息​很感兴趣​……​根据​发布​的​悬赏​，​向​全世界​公开​这些​信息​将会​是​他们​的​首要任务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可​要是​落入​不法之徒​手中​，​配方​的​泄露​可能​会​带来​巨大​危害​。\n"
"\n"
"dian4Bo1qi2shi4 ken3ding4 dui4 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 hen3 gan3 xing4 qu4……gen1ju4 fa1bu4 de5 xuan2shang3，xiang4 quan2shi4jie4 gong1kai1 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 jiang1hui4 shi4 ta1men5 de5 shou3 yao4 ren4 wu4。\n"
"\n"
"ke3 yao4shi5 luo4ru4 bu4 fa3 zhi1 tu2 shou3 zhong4，pei4fang1 de5 xie4lu4 ke3neng2 hui4 dai4lai2 ju4da4 wei1hai4。"

msgid ""
"The Schwarze Herzen maintained their hold on Drogenkippe, but the change of leadership was bad news for me.\n"
"\n"
"After Dieter kicked the bucket, his second in command took over. She was a real piece of work... called herself \"Leoni Luster.\" She had a vicious streak a mile long, and she was none too fond of me."
msgstr ""
"“​黑心​”​继续​掌控​着​毒​坑区​，​但​领导层​的​更迭​对​我​来说​是​个​坏消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​迪特尔​死后​，​二把手​接管​了​大权​。​她​是​个​麻烦​人物​……​自称​“​莱昂​妮​·​拉斯特​”​。​她​性格​凶狠​，​对​我​也​没什么​好感​。\n"
"\n"
"“hei1xin1” ji4xu4 zhang3kong4 zhao2 du2 keng1 qu1，dan4 ling3dao3ceng2 de5 geng1die2 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 shi4 ge4 huai4 xiao1 xi1。\n"
"\n"
"di2 te4 er3 si3hou4，er4ba3shou3 jie1guan3 le5 da4quan2。ta1 shi4 ge4 ma2fan5 ren2wu4……zi4cheng1“lai2 ang2 ni1 · la1 si1 te4”。ta1 xing4ge2 xiong1hen3，dui4 wo3 ye3 mei2shen2me5 hao3gan3。"

msgid ""
"The Shiawase Corporation had eyes on that building. I had to fight one of "
"their retrieval teams."
msgstr ""
"幸福​集团​盯​着​那栋​大楼​呢​。​我​跟​他们​的​一支​回收​队干​了​一架​。\n"
"xing4fu2 ji2tuan2 ding1 zhao2 na4 dong4 da4lou2 ni2。wo3 gen1 ta1men5 de5 yi1 zhi1 hui2shou1 dui4 gan4 le5 yi1 jia4。"

msgid ""
"The Steam process you were waiting on has timed out, and may not have "
"completed successfully. Please check your network connection and try again."
msgstr ""
"你​所​等待​的​Steam​进程​已​超时​，​可能​未​成功​完成​。​请​检查​网络连接​并重​试​。\n"
"ni3 suo3 deng3dai4 de5 Steam jin4cheng2 yi3 chao1shi2，ke3neng2 wei4 cheng2gong1 wan2cheng2。qing3 jian3cha2 wang3 lao4 lian2 jie1 bing4zhong4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"The Street Samurai is a freelance operative who follows a code of street honor. They are learned in the ways of the traditional samurai warrior and in the practices of modern combat. Samurai sell their skills for profit and work to take out the dishonorable scum that seem to breed in the urban sprawl.\n"
"\n"
"Key Attributes: Body and Strength or Quickness\n"
"Key Skill: Close or Ranged Combat (or both), Throwing Weapons, Dodge\n"
"Key Specializations: Any weapon"
msgstr ""
"街头​武士​是​遵循​街头​荣誉​准则​的​自由​佣兵​。​他们​既​精通​传统​武士​之道​，​又​通晓​现代​格斗​技艺​。​这些​武士​以​本领​换取​酬劳​，​致力于​铲除​在​城市​扩张​中​滋生​的​卑劣​之徒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​主要​属性​：​体质​与​力量​或​敏捷​\n"
"​主要​技能​：​近身​或​远程​战斗​（​或​双修​）​、​投掷​武器​、​躲闪​\n"
"​主要​特长​：​任意​武器\n"
"\n"
"jie1tou2 wu3shi4 shi4 zun1xun2 jie1tou2 rong2yu4 zhun3ze2 de5 zi4you2 yong1bing1。ta1men5 ji4 jing1tong1 chuan2tong3 wu3shi4 zhi1 dao4，you4 tong1xiao3 xian4dai4 ge2dou4 ji4yi4。zhe4xie1 wu3shi4 yi3 ben3ling3 huan4qu3 chou2lao2，zhi4 li4 yu2 chan3chu2 zai4 cheng2shi4 kuo4zhang1 zhong4 zi1sheng1 de5 bei1lie4 zhi1 tu2。\n"
"\n"
"zhu3yao4 shu3xing4：ti3zhi4 yu4 li4liang5 huo4 min3jie2 \n"
"zhu3yao4 ji4neng2：jin4 shen1 huo4 yuan3cheng2 zhan4dou4 （huo4 shuang1 xiu1）、tou2zhi4 wu3qi4、duo3shan3 \n"
"zhu3yao4 te4chang2：ren4yi4 wu3qi4"

msgid "The Talismonger's Shop"
msgstr ""
"护身符​商店\n"
"hu4shen1fu2 shang1dian4"

msgid "The Team Must Survive"
msgstr ""
"队伍​成员​必须​存活\n"
"dui4wu3 cheng2yuan2 bi4xu1 cun2huo2"

msgid "The Tourist Look"
msgstr ""
"游客​视角\n"
"you2ke4 shi4jiao3"

msgid ""
"The Turk, Altuğ, has been running surveillance on the site since I set up shop here. In that time, no one has entered, and no one has left.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever went wrong in there, it must have killed the research team. I want you to find a way into the building, recover the cybertech that they were developing, and find out what happened to the researchers - in that order."
msgstr ""
"自从​我​在​这里​开店​以来​，​土耳其人​奥图​伊​就​一直​在​监视​这​地方​。​在​那​段时间​里​，​并​没有​人​进出​过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​里面​出​了​什么​问题​，​研发​团队​肯定​都​死光​了​。​我要​你​找到​进入​大楼​的​方法​，​取得​他们​正在​开发​的​网络​技术​，​并​搞清楚​研发​人员​出​了​什么​事​—​—​就​按​这个​顺序​来​。\n"
"\n"
"zi4cong2 wo3 zai4 zhe4li3 kai1dian4 yi3lai2，tu3er3qi2ren2 ao4 tu2 yi1 jiu4 yi1zhi2 zai4 jian1shi4 zhe4 di4fang1。zai4 na4 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3，bing4 mei2you3 ren2 jin4chu1 guo4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 li3mian4 chu1 le5 shen2me5 wen4ti2，yan2fa1 tuan2dui4 ken3ding4 dou1 si3 guang1 le5。wo3 yao4 ni3 zhao3dao4 jin4ru4 da4lou2 de5 fang1fa3，qu3de2 ta1men5 zheng4zai4 kai1fa1 de5 wang3luo4 ji4shu4，bing4 gao3 qing1 chu3 yan2fa1 ren2yuan2 chu1 le5 shen2me5 shi4——jiu4 an4 zhe4ge5 shun4xu4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"The U-Bahn feels especially cramped on your ride back to the Kreuzbasar. In your mind’s eye, you can still see the carnage that you left behind at the AG Chemie building. Memories replay themselves over and over in your mind - fleeting visions of a hulking thing made of muscle and chrome.\n"
"\n"
"You put them aside. Shelve them for later. The job is over; it’s time to collect your pay."
msgstr ""
"返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​地铁​车厢​显得​格外​拥挤​。​你​脑海中​仍能​浮现​出​在​欧洲​化工​大楼​里​留下​的​那片​狼藉​。​记忆​一遍​遍​不住​地​反复​播放​：​那个​由​肌肉​与​铬​合金​组成​的​庞然大物​在​你​眼前​一闪而过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​将​这些​念头​抛​诸脑​后​，​暂且​搁置​一旁​。​差事​已经​完成​，​是​时候​去​领​报酬​了​。\n"
"\n"
"fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 di4tie3 che1xiang1 xian3de5 ge2wai4 yong1ji3。ni3 nao3 hai3 zhong4 reng2 neng2 fu2xian4 chu1 zai4 ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 da4lou2 li3 liu2xia4 de5 na4 pian1 lang2ji2。ji4yi4 yi1bian4 bian4 bu4zhu4 de5 fan3fu4 bo1fang4：na4ge5 you2 ji1rou4 yu4 ge4 he2jin1 zu3cheng2 de5 pang2ran2da4wu4 zai4 ni3 yan3qian2 yi1shan3er2guo4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 zhe4xie1 nian4tou5 pao1 zhu1 nao3 hou4，zan4qie3 ge1zhi4 yi1pang2。cha4shi4 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2，shi4 shi2hou5 qu4 ling3 bao4chou5 le5。"

msgid ""
"The U-Bahn rattles to a halt at the edge of Kreuzberg. You’re only a few blocks away from Schattennest, the kiez that Maxim and his smugglers call home.\n"
"\n"
"According to Samuel, they should be expecting you."
msgstr ""
"地铁​在​克洛伊​茨​贝格​边缘​嘎吱​作响​地停​了​下来​。​你​距离​影巢仅​有​几步​路之遥​了​，​而​马克西姆​和​他​的​走私​团伙​就​盘踞​在​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​塞缪尔​的​说法​，​他们​已经​知道​你​要​来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"di4tie3 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1 ci2 bei4 ge2 bian1yuan2 ga1zhi1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。ni3 ju4li2 ying3 chao2 jin3 you3 ji1 bu4 lu4 zhi1 yao2 le5，er2 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 he4 ta1 de5 zou3si1 tuan2huo3 jiu4 pan2ju4 zai4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 sai4miu4er3 de5 shuo1fa3，ta1men5 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 ni3 yao4 lai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"The U-Bahn ride home feels especially comforting today. The Berlin chapter of the Humanis Policlub has suffered a terrible blow, and you’re the one who dealt it. Volker Stahl’s plan to incite a wave of bloody violence across Berlin has been derailed.\n"
"\n"
"It isn’t often that a shadowrunner gets to prevent an atrocity on the job."
msgstr ""
"今天​的​地铁​回城​令人​感到​分外​安心​。​人类​至上​俱乐部​的​柏林​分部​遭受​了​沉重打击​，​而​这​正是​你​一手​促成​的​。​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔​企图​在​柏林​全城​掀起​血腥​暴力​浪潮​的​计划​已​被​彻底​挫败​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​暗影​狂奔​者​能​在​差事​中​阻止​一场​惨案​发生​，​这​实属​难得​。\n"
"\n"
"jin1tian1 de5 di4tie3 hui2 cheng2 ling4ren2 gan3dao4 fen4wai4 an1xin1。ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 de5 bo2lin2 fen1bu4 zao1shou4 le5 chen2zhong4da3ji1，er2 zhe4 zheng4shi4 ni3 yi1shou3 cu4cheng2 de5。Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3 qi3tu2 zai4 bo2lin2 quan2cheng2 xian1qi3 xue4xing1 bao4li4 lang4chao2 de5 ji4hua4 yi3 bei4 che4di3 cuo4bai4。\n"
"\n"
"an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 neng2 zai4 cha4shi4 zhong4 zu3zhi3 yi1 chang2 can3an4 fa1sheng1，zhe4 shi2shu3 nan2de2。"

msgid ""
"The U-Bahn ride home is smooth and uneventful. The high-ups at OTK International must be scrambling to try and recover their losses. It’s only a matter of time before they make the call and Amsel’s compromised data is uploaded to Knight Errant’s commlinks.\n"
"\n"
"You’re going to be rolling into Aztechnology with one hell of an advantage. Not bad for a night’s work..."
msgstr ""
"回家​的​地铁​一路​畅通无阻​、​波澜不惊​。​OTK​国际​的​高层​此刻​肯定​正忙​得​焦头烂额​，​试图​挽回损失​。​他们​呼叫​游侠​骑士​并​将​阿姆​泽尔​修改​过​的​数据​上​传到​其​通讯​链​只是​时间​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​将​会​带​着​巨大​优势​前往​阿兹特​科技​设施​。​一​晚上​就​取得​这些​成果​还​算​不赖​……\n"
"\n"
"hui2jia1 de5 di4tie3 yi1lu4 chang4 tong1 wu2 zu3、bo1 lan2 bu4 jing1。OTK guo2ji4 de5 gao1ceng2 ci3ke4 ken3ding4 zheng1 mang2 de2 jiao1tou2lan4e2，shi4tu2 wan3 hui2 sun3 shi1。ta1men5 hu1jiao4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 bing4 jiang1 E1mu3ze2er3 xiu1gai3 guo4 de5 shu4ju4 shang4 chuan2 dao4 qi2 tong1xun4 lian4 zhi3shi4 shi2jian1 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 hui4 dai4 zhao2 ju4da4 you1shi4 qian2wang3 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1。yi1 wan3shang5 jiu4 qu3de2 zhe4xie1 cheng2guo3 hai2 suan4 bu4lai4……"

msgid ""
"The U-Bahn trip back from the Adenauerplatz is a shaky one. Surprisingly, the train is packed - the only empty seats are at the very back of the car.\n"
"\n"
"A haggard-looking young mother marches down the aisle, dragging her three screaming children behind her. Two boys and a girl, each around six years old. As the woman nears you, her eyes fix on the frozen pouches of bio-engineered meat that you liberated from Sutterlin's executive freezer.\n"
"\n"
"She opens her mouth to say something, but at that moment, the little girl jams a finger into her brother's nose. The boy howls, and the young mother's shoulders slump. Slowly, robotically, she turns back toward her destination and begins to trundle forward, dragging her squalling offspring forward with the solemnity of a funeral procession.\n"
"\n"
"Eventually, the train hums to a stop. You debark gratefully, lugging a freezer's worth of bioware samples behind you."
msgstr ""
"从​阿登纳​广场​乘​地铁​返回​的​旅程​颠簸​不已​。​出乎​你​意料​的​是​，​列车​挤满​了​人​，​只有​车厢​最末端​才​有些​空位​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一位​面容​憔悴​的​年轻​母亲​沿着​过​道​大步​走来​，​身后​拖​着​三个​尖叫​的​孩子​。​两个​男孩​和​一个​女孩​，​年纪​都​在​六岁​左右​。​当​她​走近​你​时​，​她​的​目光​死死​盯​在​你​从​苏​特林​的​高管​冰箱​里​拿出​的​那些​冷冻​生物工程​肉袋​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​张嘴​想​说些​什么​，​但​就​在​那一刻​，​小女孩​把​手指​捅进​了​她​兄弟​的​鼻孔​里​。​男孩​嚎叫​起来​，​年轻​母亲​的​肩膀​也​顿时​垂了下去​。​她​缓慢​而​机械​地​转过身​，​拖​着​那群​嚎啕大哭​的​孩子​重新​朝​目的地​走​去​。​那​庄重​肃穆​的​场面​，​活像​一场​葬礼​游行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​列车​嗡嗡作响​地停​了​下来​。​你​满怀​感激​地​走​下车​，​身后​拖​着​一​整箱​生体​改造​样本​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 e1 deng1 na4 guang3chang3 cheng2 di4tie3 fan3hui2 de5 lu:3cheng2 dian1bo3 bu4yi3。chu1hu1 ni3 yi4liao4 de5 shi4，lie4che1 ji3man3 le5 ren2，zhi3you3 che1xiang1 zui4 mo4 duan1 cai2 you3xie1 kong1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wei4 mian4rong2 qiao2cui4 de5 nian2qing1 mu3qin1 yan2zhe5 guo4 dao4 da4bu4 zou3 lai2，shen1hou4 tuo1 zhao2 san1 ge4 jian1jiao4 de5 hai2zi5。liang3 ge4 nan2hai2 he4 yi1ge5 nu:3hai2，nian2ji4 dou1 zai4 liu4 sui4 zuo3you4。dang1 ta1 zou3jin4 ni3 shi2，ta1 de5 mu4guang1 si3si3 ding1 zai4 ni3 cong2 su1 te4 lin2 de5 gao1guan3 bing1xiang1 li3 na2chu1 de5 na4xie1 leng3dong4 sheng1wu4gong1cheng2 rou4 dai4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhang1zui3 xiang3 shuo1 xie1 shen2me5，dan4 jiu4 zai4 na4 yi1 ke4，xiao3 nu:3 hai2 ba3 shou3zhi3 tong3 jin4 le5 ta1 xiong1di4 de5 bi2kong3 li3。nan2hai2 hao2jiao4 qi3lai5，nian2qing1 mu3qin1 de5 jian1bang3 ye3 dun4shi2 chui2 le5 xia4 qu4。ta1 huan3man4 er2 ji1xie4 de5 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，tuo1 zhao2 na4 qun2 hao2tao2da4ku1 de5 hai2zi5 chong2xin1 chao2 mu4di4di4 zou3 qu4。na4 zhuang1zhong4 su4mu4 de5 chang3mian4，huo2xiang4 yi1 chang2 zang4li3 you2xing2。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，lie4che1 weng1 weng1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。ni3 man3huai2 gan3ji1 de5 zou3 xia4che1，shen1hou4 tuo1 zhao2 yi1 zheng3 xiang1 sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4 yang4ben3。"

msgid ""
"The U-Bahn whisks you back toward the Kreuzbasar, Eiger standing by your side. The image of the Engineer's body disintegrating in flame replays itself over and over in your mind; the bright flash, the shower of sparks, the overpowering stench of sizzling meat. A blue-green afterimage hangs suspended in the center of your field of vision, and it refuses to be blinked away.\n"
"\n"
"From what Eiger told you, the Engineer was a menace. An international criminal at the top of his game. And as you watched, he was consumed from within by a device that marked him as disposable.\n"
"\n"
"The rattle of your U-Bahn car coming to a halt shakes you from your reverie. You're home."
msgstr ""
"地铁​载​着​你​向​克洛伊​茨​集市​飞驰而去​，​而​艾格尔​就​站​在​你​身旁​。​工程师​的​躯体​在​火焰​中​化为灰烬​的​画面​，​不断​在​你​脑海中​重现​：​刺​目的​闪光​、​四溅​的​火花​、​以及​肉体​烧焦​时​的​刺鼻​恶臭​。​一抹​蓝绿色​的​残像​悬浮​在​你​视野​的​正​中央​，​无论​你​如何​眨眼​都​无法​将​其​驱散​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​艾格尔所言​，​工程师​是​个​危险​人物​。​这个​国际​罪犯​正值​巅峰​。​而​你​亲眼目睹​了​他​被​体内​的​装置​标记​为​“​废弃物​”​，​并​从​内部​将​他​吞噬​殆尽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​地铁​车厢​停靠​时​的​哐当​声​将​你​从​沉思​中​惊醒​。​你​到​家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"di4tie3 zai3 zhao2 ni3 xiang4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 fei1 chi2 er2 qu4，er2 Ai4ge2er3 jiu4 zhan4 zai4 ni3 shen1 pang2。gong1cheng2shi1 de5 qu1ti3 zai4 huo3yan4 zhong4 hua4 wei2 hui1 jin4 de5 hua4mian4，bu4duan4 zai4 ni3 nao3 hai3 zhong4 chong2xian4：ci1 mu4di4 shan3guang1、si4jian4 de5 huo3hua1、yi3ji2 rou4ti3 shao1jiao1 shi2 de5 ci4bi2 e4chou4。yi1 ma1 lan2 lu:4 se4 de5 can2 xiang4 xuan2fu2 zai4 ni3 shi4ye3 de5 zheng1 zhong1yang1，wu2lun4 ni3 ru2he2 zha3yan3 dou1 wu2fa3 jiang1 qi2 qu1san4。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 Ai4ge2er3 suo3 yan2，gong1cheng2shi1 shi4 ge4 wei1xian3 ren2wu4。zhe4ge5 guo2ji4 zui4fan4 zheng4zhi2 dian1feng1。er2 ni3 qin1yan3mu4du3 le5 ta1 bei4 ti3nei4 de5 zhuang1zhi4 biao1ji4 wei2“fei4 qi4 wu4”，bing4 cong2 nei4bu4 jiang1 ta1 tun1shi4 dai4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"di4tie3 che1xiang1 ting2kao4 shi2 de5 kuang1 dang1 sheng1 jiang1 ni3 cong2 chen2si1 zhong4 jing1xing3。ni3 dao4 jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The WHO has traced the point of origin of CSMDS to Berlin. \n"
"\n"
"\"The disaster conditions that still plague the city months after Feuerschwinge's second rampage might have contributed to the rapid spread of CSMDS,\" a WHO spokesperson told us.\n"
"\n"
"\"Much of the city still lacks basic sanitation services, and clean water is difficult to come by. Disaster areas such as Berlin have repeatedly shown themselves to be ideal breeding grounds for disease.\""
msgstr ""
"世界卫生组织​已​将​CSMDS​疫情​的​起源地​追溯​至​柏林​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​世卫​组织​发言人​向​我们​表示​：​“​数月​前​的​火翼​第二次​肆虐​后​，​灾难​状态​仍​困扰​着​这座​城市​，​这​可能​助长​了​CSMDS​的​快速​蔓延​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​城市​大部分​区域​至今​缺乏​基本​卫生设施​，​洁净​水源​难以​获取​。​柏林​这​类​灾区​反复证明​，​它们​正是​疾病​滋生​的​理想​温床​。​”\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4wei4sheng1zu3zhi1 yi3 jiang1 CSMDS yi4qing2 de5 qi3 yuan2 de5 zhui1su4 zhi4 bo2lin2。\n"
"\n"
"shi4wei4 zu3zhi1 fa1yan2ren2 xiang4 wo3men5 biao3shi4：“shu4yue4 qian2 de5 Huo3yi4 di4er4ci4 si4nu:e4 hou4，zai1nan4 zhuang4tai4 reng2 kun4rao3 zhao2 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4，zhe4 ke3neng2 zhu4zhang3 le5 CSMDS de5 kuai4su4 man4yan2。” \n"
"\n"
"“cheng2shi4 da4bu4fen5 qu1yu4 zhi4jin1 que1fa2 ji1ben3 wei4 sheng1 she4 shi1，jie2jing4 shui3yuan2 nan2yi3 huo4qu3。bo2lin2 zhe4 lei4 zai1qu1 fan3 fu4 zheng4 ming2，ta1men5 zheng4shi4 ji2bing4 zi1sheng1 de5 li3xiang3 wen1chuang2。”"

msgid ""
"The WHO has urged the international community to exercise continued vigilance in battling the disease.\n"
"\n"
"\"All appropriate precautions must be observed when dealing with CSMDS,\" the press release reads.\n"
"\n"
"\"While CSMDS does not appear to be dangerous to metahumans, it does incorporate both magical and radiological elements, and this alone is reason enough to treat it as a potential threat.\""
msgstr ""
"世界卫生组织​敦促​国际​社会​在​抗击​该​疾病​时​保持​持续​警惕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​新闻稿​指出​：​“​处理​CSMDS​时​必须​采取​所有​适当​预防措施​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​尽管​CSMDS​似乎​对泛​人类​无害​，​但​其​同时​具备​魔法​与​放射性元素​，​仅​此​一点​就​足以​将​其​视为​潜在​威胁​。​”\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4wei4sheng1zu3zhi1 dun1cu4 guo2ji4 she4hui4 zai4 kang4ji1 gai1 ji2bing4 shi2 bao3chi2 chi2xu4 jing3ti4。\n"
"\n"
"xin1wen2gao3 zhi3chu1：“chu3li3 CSMDS shi2 bi4xu1 cai3qu3 suo3you3 shi4dang4 yu4fang2cuo4shi1。” \n"
"\n"
"“jin3guan3 CSMDS si4hu1 dui4 fan4 ren2lei4 wu2hai4，dan4 qi2 tong2shi2 ju4bei4 mo2fa3 yu4 fang4 she4 xing4 yuan2 su4，jin3 ci3 yi1dian3 jiu4 zu2yi3 jiang1 qi2 shi4wei2 qian2zai4 wei1xie2。”"

msgid ""
"The abandoned hulk of the ancient dragon heaves a final breath, exhales with a great, rumbling sigh, and crumples to the ground, dead.\n"
"\n"
"As she watches her body expire, Feuerschwinge's face contorts into a rictus of pain and rage. She claws feebly at the glass with broken fingernails."
msgstr ""
"古老​巨龙​的​残骸​发出​最后​一声​喘息​，​伴随​着​一声​沉重​的​呻吟​，​缓缓​倒​在​地上​，​一动不动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​目睹​着​自己​的​身体​死去​，​她​的​脸​扭曲​成​痛苦​与​愤怒​的​狰狞​表情​，​用​破碎​的​指甲​无力​地​抓挠​着​玻璃​。\n"
"\n"
"gu3lao3 ju4long2 de5 can2hai2 fa1chu1 zui4hou4 yi1sheng1 chuan3xi1，ban4sui2 zhao2 yi1sheng1 chen2zhong4 de5 shen1yin2，huan3huan3 dao3 zai4 di4shang5，yi1dong4bu4dong4。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 mu4du3 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 shen1ti3 si3qu4，ta1 de5 lian3 niu3qu1 cheng2 tong4ku3 yu4 fen4nu4 de5 zheng1ning2 biao3qing2，yong4 po4sui4 de5 zhi3jia5 wu2li4 de5 zhua1nao5 zhao2 bo1li5。"

msgid ""
"The acolytes on the other side of the door are still speaking with one "
"another. You hear an occasional guffaw of laughter."
msgstr ""
"门​另一侧​的​侍​祭们​仍​在​交谈​。​你​偶尔​能​听见​几声​哄笑​。\n"
"men2 ling4 yi1 ce4 de5 shi4 ji4 men5 reng2 zai4 jiao1tan2。ni3 ou3er3 neng2 ting1jian4 ji1 sheng1 hong1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"The adept ends their turn, but will counterattack with their current weapon "
"when attacked. Maximum of 3 counter-attacks per turn."
msgstr ""
"修士​可以​在​回合​结束​后​，​利用​所持​的​武器​对​攻击者​进行​一次​近战​反击​。​每​回合​最​多​反击​3​次​。\n"
"xiu1shi4 ke3yi3 zai4 hui2he2 jie2shu4 hou4，li4yong4 suo3 chi2 de5 wu3qi4 dui4 gong1 ji1 zhe3 jin4xing2 yi1ci4 jin4 zhan4 fan3ji1。mei3 hui2he2 zui4 duo1 fan3ji1 3 ci4。"

msgid ""
"The adept gains a 0 AP cost attack that does 8 DMG to the target. Pierces up"
" to 2 Armor."
msgstr ""
"修士​使出​一记​不​消耗​行动​点​的​攻击​，​对​目标​造成​8​点​伤害​。​最​多​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"xiu1shi4 shi3chu1 yi1 ji4 bu4 xiao1hao4 xing2dong4 dian3 de5 gong1ji1，dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 8 dian3 shang1hai4。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid ""
"The advanced medkit that heals you or any team member. Consumed when used. "
"Can be used outside of combat."
msgstr ""
"高级​急救包​，​可​治疗​你​或​任何​队友​。​使用​时​将​被​消耗​。​可​在​非战斗​状态​下​使用​。\n"
"gao1ji2 ji2jiu4bao1，ke3 zhi4liao2 ni3 huo4 ren4he2 dui4you3。shi3yong4 shi2 jiang1 bei4 xiao1hao4。ke3 zai4 fei1 zhan4 dou3 zhuang4tai4 xia4 shi3yong4。"

msgid ""
"The advantage of bein' a ganger is protection in numbers. When those numbers"
" turn against you, you've gotta get creative if you wanna stay alive."
msgstr ""
"加入​帮派​的​优势​在于​人多势众​。​但​当​这些​同伴​反目成仇​时​，​若想​保命​，​就​得​想​办法​另辟蹊径​。\n"
"jia1ru4 bang1pai4 de5 you1shi4 zai4yu2 ren2duo1shi4zhong4。dan4 dang1 zhe4xie1 tong2ban4 fan3mu4cheng2chou2 shi2，ruo4 xiang3 bao3ming4，jiu4 de2 xiang3 ban4fa3 ling4pi4xi1jing4。"

msgid ""
"The agreed-upon sum has already been transferred into your account, Herr Carver.\n"
"\n"
"While we did not expect you to survive tonight's encounter, we do honor our debts."
msgstr ""
"说好​的​报酬​已转​至​你​的​账户​，​卡佛​先生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽然​我们​并未​料到​你​能​活过​今晚​，​但​我们​终究会​履行​承诺​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1hao3 de5 bao4chou5 yi3 zhuai3 zhi4 ni3 de5 zhang4hu4，ka3 fo2 xian1sheng5。\n"
"\n"
"sui1ran2 wo3men5 bing4wei4 liao4dao4 ni3 neng2 huo2 guo4 jin1wan3，dan4 wo3men5 zhong1 jiu1 hui4 lu:3xing2 cheng2nuo4。"

msgid ""
"The air fills with the cacophonous wail of screaming alarms.\n"
"\n"
"James jerks back, his concentration broken. From down the hall, you can distantly hear the sound of heavy footsteps approaching at a run."
msgstr ""
"刺耳​的​警报声​在​房间​里​回荡​，​如同​不​和谐​的​哀鸣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​詹姆斯​猛地​后退​，​不再​专注​于​施法​。​走廊​深处​传来​沉重​的​脚步声​，​正以​奔跑​的​速度​逐渐​逼近​。\n"
"\n"
"ci4er3 de5 jing3 bao4 sheng1 zai4 fang2jian1 li3 hui2dang4，ru2tong2 bu4 he2xie2 de5 ai1ming2。\n"
"\n"
"zhan1mu3si1 meng3de5 hou4tui4，bu4zai4 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 shi1fa3。zou3lang2 shen1chu4 chuan2lai2 chen2zhong4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1，zheng1 yi3 ben1pao3 de5 su4du4 zhu2jian4 bi1jin4。"

msgid ""
"The air is thick in here. Musty. A thick layer of dust, marred by the occasional handprint, coats every visible surface.\n"
"\n"
"The keycard that Vauclair sent you feels slick in your hand. Up ahead, you see the soft glow of a functioning terminal."
msgstr ""
"这里​的​空气​很闷​，​泛着​一股​发霉​的​味道​。​你​的​目光​所​能​捕捉到​的​每一处​表面​几乎​都​覆​着​一层​厚厚的​灰尘​，​偶尔​还​能​见到​手印​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​手中​握​着​沃​克莱尔​给​你​的​门禁卡​，​带​着​一种​光滑​的​触感​。​在​你​的​前方​，​一台​正在​运行​的​终端​隐隐​泛着​微光​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 kong1qi4 hen3 men1，fan4 zhao2 yi1 gu3 fa1mei2 de5 wei4dao5。ni3 de5 mu4guang1 suo3 neng2 bu3 zhuo1 dao4 de5 mei3 yi1 chu3 biao3mian4 ji1hu1 dou1 fu4 zhao2 yi1ceng2 hou4 hou4 de5 hui1chen2，ou3er3 hai2 neng2 jian4dao4 shou3yin4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 shou3 zhong4 wo4 zhao2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 gei3 ni3 de5 men2 jin1 ka3，dai4 zhao2 yi1zhong3 guang1hua2 de5 chu4gan3。zai4 ni3 de5 qian2fang1，yi1 tai2 zheng4zai4 yun4xing2 de5 zhong1duan1 yin3yin3 fan4 zhao2 wei1guang1。"

msgid ""
"The alarm panels flash bright red, and a shrill alarm begins to sound "
"throughout the building."
msgstr ""
"警报​面板​闪烁着​明亮​的​红光​，​刺耳​的​警报​开始​响彻​整个​建筑​。\n"
"jing3bao4 mian4ban3 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 ming2liang4 de5 hong2 guang1，ci4er3 de5 jing3bao4 kai1shi3 xiang3che4 zheng3ge4 jian4zhu4。"

msgid ""
"The all-encompassing cold hits you like a sledgehammer and your mind is "
"overloaded by the ordeal."
msgstr ""
"刺骨​的​寒意​如​锤击​般袭​来​，​而​这场​磨难​让​你​的​思绪​陷入​混乱​。\n"
"ci4gu3 de5 han2yi4 ru2 chui2 ji1 ban1 xi2 lai2，er2 zhe4 chang2 mo2nan4 rang4 ni3 de5 si1xu4 xian4ru4 hun4luan4。"

msgid ""
"The angry glow of her burning claw fades to nothing as the metal cools.\n"
"\n"
"As you watch, the red light that bathed her body slowly dies away."
msgstr ""
"她​的​燃烧​利爪​发出​的​愤怒​光芒​随着​金属​的​冷却​而​渐渐​消失​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​你​的​注视​下​，​笼罩​在​她​身上​的​红光​缓缓​黯淡​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 ran2shao1 li4zhao3 fa1chu1 de5 fen4nu4 guang1mang2 sui2zhe5 jin1shu3 de5 leng3que4 er2 jian4jian4 xiao1shi1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 de5 zhu4shi4 xia4，long3zhao4 zai4 ta1 shen1shang5 de5 hong2 guang1 huan3huan3 an4dan4。"

msgid ""
"The apology could use work. The money, though... that I will take. \n"
"\n"
"Let's move past this foolishness and get down to business."
msgstr ""
"道歉​还​需要​改进​。​不过​钱​……​我会​收下​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我们​忘掉​这些​愚蠢​的​事​，​开始​谈​生意​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"dao4qian4 hai2 xu1yao4 gai3jin4。bu4guo4 qian2……wo3 hui4 shou1xia4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3men5 wang4diao4 zhe4xie1 yu2chun3 de5 shi4，kai1shi3 tan2 sheng1yi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"The approaching sirens grow louder. They're now accompanied by another sound"
" - the whine of approaching rotorcraft."
msgstr ""
"赶来​的​警笛声​愈发​响亮​，​现在​还​伴随​着​另​一种​声音​—​—​旋翼机​逼近​的​尖​啸声​。\n"
"gan3lai2 de5 jing3 di2 sheng1 yu4fa1 xiang3liang4，xian4zai4 hai2 ban4sui2 zhao2 ling4 yi1zhong3 sheng1yin1——xuan2 yi4 ji1 bi1jin4 de5 jian1 xiao4 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"The approaching sirens grow louder. They're now accompanied by another sound - the whine of approaching rotorcraft.\n"
"\n"
"You linger for a few moments longer, but there is no movement in the burning rubble."
msgstr ""
"赶来​的​警笛声​愈发​响亮​，​现在​还​伴随​着​另​一种​声音​—​—​旋翼机​逼近​的​尖​啸声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​又​逗留​了​片刻​，​但​燃烧​的​瓦砾​中​没有​任何​动静​。\n"
"\n"
"gan3lai2 de5 jing3 di2 sheng1 yu4fa1 xiang3liang4，xian4zai4 hai2 ban4sui2 zhao2 ling4 yi1zhong3 sheng1yin1——xuan2 yi4 ji1 bi1jin4 de5 jian1 xiao4 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 dou4liu2 le5 pian4ke4，dan4 ran2shao1 de5 wa3li4 zhong4 mei2you3 ren4he2 dong4jing4。"

msgid ""
"The area is in extreme disrepair. Water is flooding out of the walls and "
"stagnating in pools on the tile floor. You can smell the mildew from here."
msgstr ""
"这片​区域​年久失修​的​情况​极其​严重​。​水从​墙面​涌出​在​瓷砖​地面​上​凝滞​出​数个​池子​。​你​从​这里​都​能​嗅到​霉味​儿​。\n"
"zhe4 pian1 qu1yu4 nian2jiu3shi1xiu1 de5 qing2kuang4 ji2qi2 yan2zhong4。shui3 cong2 qiang2mian4 yong3chu1 zai4 ci2zhuan1 di4mian4 shang4 ning2zhi4 chu1 shu3 ge4 chi2zi5。ni3 cong2 zhe4li3 dou1 neng2 xiu4 dao4 mei2 wei4 er2。"

msgid ""
"The argument increases in volume and ferocity. Within a few seconds, they're"
" screaming at one another."
msgstr ""
"争吵声​越来越​大​，​越来越​激烈​。​短短​几秒钟​内​，​他们​就​对骂​起来​了​。\n"
"zheng1 chao3 sheng1 yue4lai2yue4 dai4，yue4lai2yue4 ji1lie4。duan3 duan3 ji1 miao3 zhong1 nei4，ta1men5 jiu4 dui4ma4 qi3lai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"The assassinations. The Nightwraiths. We never saw any of it, mind you. I'm "
"fairly certain that we slept through the whole thing."
msgstr ""
"刺杀​啊​。​夜魔​啊​。​我们​倒​是​什么​都​没​见到​。​看来​肯定​是​我们​一​觉​睡醒​时​就​已经​结束​了​。\n"
"ci4sha1 a1。ye4 mo2 a1。wo3men5 dao3 shi4 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 jian4dao4。kan4lai5 ken3ding4 shi4 wo3men5 yi1 jiao4 shui4xing3 shi2 jiu4 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The attack has left the Kreuzbasar in pretty rough shape. Too rough to deal "
"with a syndicate moving in next door."
msgstr ""
"先前​的​袭击​让​克洛伊​茨​集市​损失惨重​，​已经​没有​余力​去​对付​搬​来​隔壁​的​黑帮​了​。\n"
"xian1qian2 de5 xi2ji1 rang4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 sun3 shi1 can3 chong2，yi3jing1 mei2you3 yu2li4 qu4 dui4fu5 ban1 lai2 ge2bi4 de5 hei1bang1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The attack... it was terrible, $(l.name). So much death.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I had not killed since I retired from running the shadows. Not until today."
msgstr ""
"那场​袭击​……​真是太​惨​了​，​$(l.name)​。​死​了​好多​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​自从​我​金盆洗手​不再​干​暗影​差事​之后​，​就​再​没​杀​过​人​。​直到​今天​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 chang2 xi2ji1……zhen1 shi4 tai4 can3 le5，$(l.name)。si3 le5 hao3duo1 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zi4cong2 wo3 jin1pen2xi3shou3 bu4zai4 gan4 an4ying3 cha4shi4 zhi1hou4，jiu4 zai4 mei2 sha1 guo4 ren2。zhi2dao4 jin1tian1。"

msgid ""
"The attendant behind the counter is an uncommonly fine-featured dwarf with a beatific smile. A yellow ID tag pinned to his chest announces his name in large, blocky letters: \"PARSON.\"\n"
"\n"
"He nods at you and raises a hand in greeting."
msgstr ""
"柜台​后​的​服务员​是​个​相貌​出众​的​矮​人​，​脸上​挂​着​祥和​的​笑容​。​胸前​别着​的​黄色​名牌​用​粗体​方块字​写​着​他​的​名字​：​帕森​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​向​你​点点头​，​举手​打招呼​。\n"
"\n"
"gui4tai2 hou4 de5 fu2wu4yuan2 shi4 ge4 xiang4mao4 chu1zhong4 de5 ai3 ren2，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 xiang2he2 de5 xiao4rong2。xiong1qian2 bie4 zhao2 de5 huang2se4 ming2pai2 yong4 cu1ti3 fang1kuai4zi4 xie3 zhao2 ta1 de5 ming2zi5：pa4 sen1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang4 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2，ju3shou3 da3zhao1hu5。"

msgid ""
"The back of Herr Schmidt's van has been reinforced to accept the MKVI's "
"weight. With a simple command, you could order the Cyberzombie to step "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"施密特​先生​的​货车​后部​经过​加固​，​足够​承载​MKVI​的​重量​。​只​需​一声令下​，​你​便​能​指挥​赛博​僵尸​自行​进入​。\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 de5 huo4che1 hou4bu4 jing1guo4 jia1gu4，zu2gou4 cheng2zai4 MKVI de5 zhong4liang4。zhi3 xu1 yi1 sheng1 ling3 xia4，ni3 bian4 neng2 zhi3hui1 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 zi4xing2 jin4ru4。"

msgid ""
"The back of Herr Schmidt's van is easily roomy enough to hold the corpse of "
"the MKVI."
msgstr ""
"施密特​先生​的​货车​后厢​空间​宽敞​，​足够​容纳​MKVI​的​尸体​。\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 de5 huo4che1 hou4 xiang1 kong1jian1 kuan1chang5，zu2gou4 rong2na4 MKVI de5 shi1ti3。"

msgid "The basic melee weapon attack."
msgstr ""
"基础​近战​攻击\n"
"ji1chu3 jin4 zhan4 gong1ji1"

msgid "The basic melee weapon attack. Add +1 HP to the weapon's DMG."
msgstr ""
"基础​近战​攻击​。​武器​伤害​增加​1​点​。\n"
"ji1chu3 jin4 zhan4 gong1ji1。wu3qi4 shang1hai4 zeng1jia1 1 dian3。"

msgid ""
"The bastard's right, boss. Nothing we're carryin' can even scratch that stuff - that \"glass\" is basically coated in diamond. We'd need heavy ordinance to crack it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grimaces.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're stuck in here."
msgstr ""
"那​混蛋​说​得​没错​，​老大​。​我们​携带​的​东西​无法​对​镀​钻​工艺​造成​任何​损伤​—​—​那​块​“​玻璃​”​是​被​钻石​包裹​着​的​。​我们​需要​大​当量​炸药​才能​打破​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​做​了​个​鬼脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​被困​在​这里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 hun2dan4 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4，lao3da4。wo3men5 xie2dai4 de5 dong1xi1 wu2fa3 dui4 du4 zuan1 gong1yi4 zao4cheng2 ren4he2 sun3shang1——na4 kuai4“bo1li5” shi4 bei4 zuan4shi2 bao1guo3 zhao2 de5。wo3men5 xu1yao4 dai4 dang1liang4 zha4yao4 cai2neng2 da3po4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zuo4 le5 ge4 gui3lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The bastard's right, chief. Nothing we're carrying can even scratch dikote - that \"glass\" is basically coated in diamond. We'd need a big-ass bomb to crack through it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grimaces.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're screwed."
msgstr ""
"那​混蛋​说​得​没错​，​头儿​。​我们​携带​的​东西​无法​对​镀​钻​工艺​造成​任何​损伤​—​—​那​块​“​玻璃​”​是​被​钻石​包裹​着​的​。​我们​需要​大​当量​炸药​才能​打破​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​做​了​个​鬼脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​被困​在​这里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 hun2dan4 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4，tou2r5。wo3men5 xie2dai4 de5 dong1xi1 wu2fa3 dui4 du4 zuan1 gong1yi4 zao4cheng2 ren4he2 sun3shang1——na4 kuai4“bo1li5” shi4 bei4 zuan4shi2 bao1guo3 zhao2 de5。wo3men5 xu1yao4 dai4 dang1liang4 zha4yao4 cai2neng2 da3po4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zuo4 le5 ge4 gui3lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The bastard's right. Nothing we're carrying can even scratch dikote - that \"glass\" is essentially sheathed in diamond. We'd need military-grade explosives to crack it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're stuck in here."
msgstr ""
"那​混蛋​说​得​没错​。​我们​携带​的​东西​无法​对​镀​钻​工艺​造成​任何​损伤​—​—​那​块​“​玻璃​”​是​被​钻石​包裹​着​的​。​我们​需要​军用​级​炸药​才能​打破​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​被困​在​这里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 hun2dan4 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。wo3men5 xie2dai4 de5 dong1xi1 wu2fa3 dui4 du4 zuan1 gong1yi4 zao4cheng2 ren4he2 sun3shang1——na4 kuai4“bo1li5” shi4 bei4 zuan4shi2 bao1guo3 zhao2 de5。wo3men5 xu1yao4 jun1yong4 ji2 zha4yao4 cai2neng2 da3po4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid "The best defense is a good offense."
msgstr ""
"进攻​就是​最好​的​防守​。\n"
"jin4gong1 jiu4shi4 zui4hao3 de5 fang2shou3。"

msgid ""
"The best support drone in the biz. It will drop a grenade or medkit and even"
" fight."
msgstr ""
"业内​最强​的​支援​无人机​。​它​能​投掷​手雷​或​急救包​，​甚至​能​参与​战斗​。\n"
"ye4nei4 zui4 jiang4 de5 zhi1yuan2 wu2ren2ji1。ta1 neng2 tou2zhi4 shou3lei2 huo4 ji2jiu4bao1，shen4zhi4 neng2 can1yu4 zhan4dou4。"

msgid ""
"The bit about my place in Mr. Grinder's organization? Sure.\n"
"\n"
"But the part about me killing you...? No.\n"
"\n"
"I intend to walk out that door, give the box to Mr. Grinder, and go home to my family. Like I said."
msgstr ""
"关于​我​在​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​组织​内​的​地位​？​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​关于​我要​杀​你​的​事情​……​？​不是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只​打算​离开​这里​，​把​盒子​交给​“​绞肉机​”​先生​，​然后​回家​去​。​我​已经​说​过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"guan1yu2 wo3 zai4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 zu3zhi1 nei4 de5 di4wei4？mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 guan1yu2 wo3 yao4 sha1 ni3 de5 shi4qing5……？bu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 da3suan4 li2kai1 zhe4li3，ba3 he2zi5 jiao1gei3“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5，ran2hou4 hui2jia1 qu4。wo3 yi3jing1 shuo1 guo4 le5。"

msgid "The bleeding man limps forward. His face is full of fear."
msgstr ""
"流血​的​男人​一瘸一拐​地​向前​挪动​。​他​的​脸上​满是​恐惧​。\n"
"liu2xue4 de5 nan2ren2 yi1que2yi1guai3 de5 xiang4qian2 nuo2dong4。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 man3 shi4 kong3ju4。"

msgid ""
"The blood mage is caught off guard, but only for a moment. He adjusts with "
"inhuman speed, sending his ritualistic blade clattering to the ground and "
"dropping into a defensive stance."
msgstr ""
"血​法师​措手不及​，​但​也​只是​一瞬​而已​。​他​以​超乎​常人​的​速度​调整​姿态​，​将​仪式​刀​哐当​摔落​在​地​，​随即​摆​出​防御​架势​。\n"
"xie3 fa3shi1 cuo4shou3bu4ji2，dan4 ye3 zhi3shi4 yi1shun4 er2yi3。ta1 yi3 chao1 hu1 chang2ren2 de5 su4du4 tiao2zheng3 zi1tai4，jiang1 yi2shi4 dao1 kuang1 dang1 shuai1 la4 zai4 de5，sui2ji2 bai3 chu1 fang2yu4 jia4shi5。"

msgid ""
"The blood mage's eyes go wide with surprise. Seizing the opportunity, you "
"attack."
msgstr ""
"血​法师​惊讶​地睁大​双眼​。​你​趁机​发起​了​进攻​。\n"
"xie3 fa3shi1 jing1ya4 de5 zheng1 dai4 shuang1yan3。ni3 chen4ji1 fa1qi3 le5 jin4gong1。"

msgid ""
"The blood mage's eyes widen in surprise.\n"
"\n"
"He waves a slender hand before you in a ritualistic gesture, then pauses to observe your reaction. A moment later he steps back, a satisfied expression on his face."
msgstr ""
"血​法师​惊讶​地睁大​双眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​在​你​面前​用​纤瘦​的​手划​了​一个​仪式​手势​，​然后​停下来​观察​你​的​反应​。​过​了​一会儿​，​他​向​后退​了​退​，​脸上​挂​着​满意​的​表情​。\n"
"\n"
"xie3 fa3shi1 jing1ya4 de5 zheng1 dai4 shuang1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2 yong4 xian1shou4 de5 shou3 hua2 le5 yi1ge5 yi2shi4 shou3shi4，ran2hou4 ting2xia4lai2 guan1cha2 ni3 de5 fan3ying4。guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 xiang4 hou4tui4 le5 tui4，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 man3yi4 de5 biao3qing2。"

msgid ""
"The blood mage's eyes widen in surprise.\n"
"\n"
"With a wave of his hand, the pain disappears. He pauses to obeserve you for a moment, then steps back, a satisfied expression on his face."
msgstr ""
"血​法师​惊讶​地睁大​双眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​手挥​了​一下​，​疼痛​随之​消失​了​。​他​停下来​观察​了​你​一会儿​，​继而​向​后退​了​退​，​脸上​挂​着​满意​的​表情​。\n"
"\n"
"xie3 fa3shi1 jing1ya4 de5 zheng1 dai4 shuang1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shou3 hui1 le5 yi1xia4，teng2tong4 sui2zhi1 xiao1shi1 le5。ta1 ting2xia4lai2 guan1cha2 le5 ni3 yi1hui4r5，ji4er2 xiang4 hou4tui4 le5 tui4，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 man3yi4 de5 biao3qing2。"

msgid ""
"The board is arranged in a grid of names and tasks. Most of which seem to be"
" in the completed catagory. In the corner is a note \"Lucy b-day Tues, DO "
"NOT FORGET!!!\""
msgstr ""
"板上​写​有​按照​姓名​和​任务​布置​成​的​表格​。​绝大多数​看起来​属于​已​完成​类别​。​角落里​有行​笔记​：​“​露西​生日​周二​，​勿忘​！​！​！​”\n"
"ban3 shang4 xie3 you3 an4zhao4 xing4ming2 he4 ren4wu5 bu4zhi4 cheng2 de5 biao3ge2。jue2da4duo1shu4 kan4qi3lai5 shu3yu2 yi3 wan2cheng2 lei4bie2。jiao3 la4 li3 you3 xing2 bi3ji4：“lu4xi1 sheng1ri4 zhou1er4，wu4 wang4！！！”"

msgid ""
"The body of the thing that attacked you begins to dissolve at the moment of death. \n"
"\n"
"As you watch, its tissues break down into a growing slick of bubbling pitch and rendered fat."
msgstr ""
"那个​袭击​你​的​东西​刚一​死亡​，​它​的​躯体​便​在​一瞬间​溶解​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看到​它​的​组织​分解成​一片​不断​扩散​的​油污​，​冒​着​泡​的​沥青​与​融化​的​脂肪​在​其中​翻腾​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 xi2ji1 ni3 de5 dong1xi1 gang1yi1 si3wang2，ta1 de5 qu1ti3 bian4 zai4 yi1shun4jian1 rong2jie3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 de5 zu3zhi1 fen4 jie3 cheng2 yi1 pian1 bu4duan4 kuo4san4 de5 you2wu1，mao4 zhao2 pao1 de5 li4qing1 yu4 rong2hua4 de5 zhi1fang2 zai4 qi2zhong1 fan1teng2。"

msgid ""
"The body on the table looks like a janitor. His chest and stomach appear to "
"have been brutally torn open."
msgstr ""
"桌上​的​尸体​看来​是​一名​清洁工​。​他​的​胸膛​和​腹部​看来​都​被​残暴​地​撕开​了​。\n"
"zhuo1 shang4 de5 shi1ti3 kan4lai5 shi4 yi1 ming2 qing1jie2gong1。ta1 de5 xiong1tang2 he4 fu4bu4 kan4lai5 dou1 bei4 can2bao4 de5 si1 kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The body on this operating table has been torn to pieces. The dual arms of "
"an autosurgeon are the obvious culprits."
msgstr ""
"手术台上​的​尸体​被​撕成​了​碎片​。​显然​自动​外科医生​的​双臂​是​元凶​。\n"
"shou3 shu4 tai2 shang4 de5 shi1ti3 bei4 si1 cheng2 le5 sui4pian4。xian3ran2 zi4dong4 wai4ke1yi1sheng1 de5 shuang1bi4 shi4 yuan2xiong1。"

msgid "The bombs went off."
msgstr ""
"炸弹​爆炸​了​。\n"
"zha4dan4 bao4zha4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The bookshelf is neatly organized, and alphabetized. On the upper shelf is a"
" framed picture of a young blonde girl with braces and a huge smile "
"stretching across her face."
msgstr ""
"书架​组织​的​十分​整齐​并​按​字母​顺序​排​了​序​。​上层​搁板​有​一张​带​相框​的​照片​，​里面​是​一名​年轻​的​金发​女孩​，​齿​上​带​着​牙​箍​，​脸上​挂​着​大大的​微笑​。\n"
"shu1jia4 zu3zhi1 de5 shi2fen1 zheng3qi2 bing4 an4 zi4mu3 shun4xu4 pai2 le5 xu4。shang4ceng2 ge1ban3 you3 yi1 zhang1 dai4 xiang4kuang4 de5 zhao4pian4，li3mian4 shi4 yi1 ming2 nian2qing1 de5 jin1fa4 nu:3hai2，chi3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 ya2 gu1，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 dai4 dai4 de5 wei1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"The boss is the Great Dragon Lofwyr. He is sometimes referred to as \"The "
"Golden Wyrm.\" Perhaps you have heard of him."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​洛夫​维尔​，​人称​“​金龙​”​，​或许​你​听说​过​他​。\n"
"ju4long2 Luo4fu1wei2er3，ren2cheng1“jin1 long2”，huo4xu3 ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"The boundaries between the material world and the astral plane are weak in this place. Things can bleed through.\n"
"\n"
"The balm is like a lens. It focuses your perceptions. Makes the haze real."
msgstr ""
"现实​与​星界​之间​的​边界​在​这里​很​薄弱​。​二者​之中​的​物质​可以​相互​穿透​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​药膏​就​像​透镜​，​能​聚焦​你​的​感知​，​让​那些​迷雾​笼罩​之下​的​事物​变得​真实​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4shi2 yu4 xing1 jie4 zhi1jian1 de5 bian1jie4 zai4 zhe4li3 hen3 bo2ruo4。er4zhe3 zhi1zhong1 de5 wu4zhi4 ke3yi3 xiang1hu4 chuan1tou4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yao4gao1 jiu4 xiang4 tou4jing4，neng2 ju4jiao1 ni3 de5 gan3zhi1，rang4 na4xie1 mi2wu4 long3zhao4 zhi1xia4 de5 shi4wu4 bian4de5 zhen1shi2。"

msgid ""
"The broken body of a human man lies on the floor. His face is a mess of fresh cuts and congealing blood, and his head is oddly deformed.\n"
"\n"
"Despite his wounds, his mouth is twisted into a macabre smile."
msgstr ""
"一具​人类​男性​的​残破​尸体​躺​在​地板​上​。​他​的​脸上​布满​了​新鲜​的​伤口​和​凝固​的​血液​，​头部​也​变得​异常​畸形​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​身负重伤​，​他​的​嘴唇​却​扭曲​成​一个​诡异​的​笑容​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 ju4 ren2lei4 nan2xing4 de5 can2po4 shi1ti3 tang3 zai4 di4ban3 shang4。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 bu4man3 le5 xin1xian1 de5 shang1kou3 he4 ning2gu4 de5 xue4ye4，tou2bu4 ye3 bian4de5 yi4chang2 ji1xing2。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 shen1fu4zhong4shang1，ta1 de5 zui3chun2 que4 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1ge5 gui3yi4 de5 xiao4rong2。"

msgid ""
"The building was quarantined, idiot. It's cheaper to set up a camera than it is to mount a hazmat cleanup effort.\n"
"\n"
"As long as that counterfeit merchandise was contained, we didn't care that it was in there. But it will *not* hit the streets. Now shut your mouth and hit the floor, or I'll order my men to open fire!"
msgstr ""
"这栋​楼​被​隔离​了​，​蠢货​。​安装​摄像头​比​启动​危险品​清理​行动​的​成本​要​低​多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​那些​假货​被​封存​起来​，​我们​才​不在乎​它们​藏​在​楼里​。​但​它们​绝​*​不能​*​流入​市场​。​现在​闭嘴​趴下​，​否则​我​就​下令​开火​了​！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong4 lou2 bei4 ge2li2 le5，chun3huo4。an1zhuang1 she4xiang4tou2 bi3 qi3dong4 wei1xian3pin3 qing1li3 xing2dong4 de5 cheng2ben3 yao4 di1 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 na4xie1 jia3huo4 bei4 feng1cun2 qi3lai5，wo3men5 cai2 bu4zai4hu5 ta1men5 zang4 zai4 lou2 li3。dan4 ta1men5 jue2*bu4neng2*liu2ru4 shi4chang3。xian4zai4 bi4zui3 pa1 xia4，fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4 xia4ling4 kai1huo3 le5！"

msgid "The button depresses with a meaty thunk."
msgstr ""
"按钮​按​下去​时​发出​沉闷​的​咔嗒​声​。\n"
"an4niu3 an4 xia4qu4 shi2 fa1chu1 chen2men4 de5 ka1da1 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"The buttons on the keypad are badly worn, and a wad of chewing gum has been "
"plastered over part of the flickering screen."
msgstr ""
"小键盘​上​的​按键​磨损​严重​，​还有​一块​口香糖​被​粘​在​闪烁​的​屏幕​上​。\n"
"xiao3 jian4 pan2 shang4 de5 an4jian4 mo2sun3 yan2zhong4，hai2you3 yi1kuai4 kou3xiang1tang2 bei4 zhan1 zai4 shan3shuo4 de5 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The camera auto-adjusts, and the dark shape swims into focus. \n"
"\n"
"You are staring into - and through - the dripping, cavernous ruin of what was once a human head."
msgstr ""
"镜头​开始​自动​对焦​，​暗影​也​逐渐​清晰​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​映入​你​眼帘​的​，​是​一颗​被​子弹​洞穿​的​、​血淋淋​的​人头​残骸​。\n"
"\n"
"jing4tou2 kai1shi3 zi4dong4 dui4jiao1，an4ying3 ye3 zhu2jian4 qing1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ying4ru4 ni3 yan3lian2 de5，shi4 yi1 ke1 bei4 zi3dan4 dong4chuan1 de5、xie3lin2lin2 de5 ren2tou2 can2hai2。"

msgid "The captain's children. The Mother Superior says there are seven."
msgstr ""
"舰长​的​孩子​们​。​院长​嬷嬷​说​一共​有​七个​。\n"
"jian4zhang3 de5 hai2zi5 men5。yuan4zhang3 mo2mo5 shuo1 yi1gong4 you3 qi1 ge4。"

msgid ""
"The cardboard box is filled with makeshift bedding. A homeless person must "
"be using it to keep warm at night."
msgstr ""
"纸箱​里​塞满​了​临时​床铺​。​想必​是​无家可归​的​人​在​里面​过夜​取暖​。\n"
"zhi3xiang1 li3 sai1man3 le5 lin2shi2 chuang2pu4。xiang3bi4 shi4 wu2jia1ke3gui1 de5 ren2 zai4 li3mian4 guo4ye4 qu3nuan3。"

msgid ""
"The cargo that the smugglers are delivering includes a large quantity of an extremely hazardous chemical agent. \n"
"\n"
"Naturally, this fills me with unease. Whatever Stahl has planned, it can't be good for us."
msgstr ""
"走私者​运送​的​货物​包括​大量​极其​危险​的​化学​制剂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​自然​让​我​感到​不安​。​不管​斯塔尔​有​什么​计划​，​对​我们​来说​都​不是​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 si1 zhe3 yun4song4 de5 huo4wu4 bao1kuo4 da4liang4 ji2qi2 wei1xian3 de5 hua4xue2 zhi4ji4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zi4ran2 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 bu4an1。bu4guan3 Si1ta3er3 you3 shen2me5 ji4hua4，dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 dou1 bu4shi4 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"The cask in this display case is decorated with inlaid panels of ivory "
"scrimshaw."
msgstr ""
"镶嵌​上去​的​象牙​雕板​装饰​着​这台​展示柜​中​的​桶​。\n"
"xiang1qian4 shang4qu4 de5 xiang4ya2 diao1 ban3 zhuang1shi4 zhao2 zhe4 tai2 zhan3 shi4 ju3 zhong4 de5 tong3。"

msgid ""
"The cavernous tunnel of the Frankfurter Tor station stretches out before you.\n"
"\n"
"Your mission has been accomplished, but at a heavy cost. Your entire team is dead. There's nothing to do now but call Luca Duerr and inform him of the situation."
msgstr ""
"法兰克福​门​车站​的​巨大​隧道​在​你​眼前​延伸​开来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​任务​已然​完成​，​但​代价​惨重​。​你​的​整个​小队​全员​阵亡​。​此刻​唯一​能​做​的​，​就是​联系​卢卡​·​杜尔​并​向​他​汇报情况​。\n"
"\n"
"fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2 che1zhan4 de5 ju4da4 sui4dao4 zai4 ni3 yan3qian2 yan2shen1 kai1 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ren4wu5 yi3ran2 wan2cheng2，dan4 dai4jia4 can3zhong4。ni3 de5 zheng3ge4 xiao3 dui4 quan2yuan2 zhen4wang2。ci3ke4 wei2yi1 neng2 zuo4 de5，jiu4shi4 lian2xi4 lu2ka3 · du4 er3 bing4 xiang4 ta1 hui4 bao4 qing2 kuang4。"

msgid ""
"The cavernous tunnel of the U-Bahn line stretches out before you. In the dim"
" fluorescence of the station's lights, it looks like it stretches on "
"forever."
msgstr ""
"地铁线​的​巨大​隧道​在​你​眼前​延伸​开来​。​在​车站​昏暗​的​荧光灯​下​，​它​仿佛​绵延​不​绝​。\n"
"de5 tie3 xian4 de5 ju4da4 sui4dao4 zai4 ni3 yan3qian2 yan2shen1 kai1 lai2。zai4 che1zhan4 hun1an4 de5 ying2guang1deng1 xia4，ta1 fang3fu2 mian2yan2 bu4 jue2。"

msgid ""
"The charts are light on identifying information. Our friend's name is listed as \"Max Mustermann,\" the local equivalent of \"John Doe.\"\n"
"\n"
"But they do cover his injuries in great detail."
msgstr ""
"病历​上​的​身份​信息​十分​简略​。​我们​这位​朋友​的​姓名​被​登记​为​“​马克斯​·​穆​斯特曼​”​，​相当于​德国​版本​的​“​无名氏​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​他​的​伤势​倒​是​记录​得​非常​详尽​。\n"
"\n"
"bing4li4 shang4 de5 shen1fen4 xin4xi1 shi2fen1 jian3lu:e4。wo3men5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 de5 xing4ming2 bei4 deng1ji4 wei2“ma3 ke4 si1 · mu4 si1 te4 man4”，xiang1dang1yu2 de2guo2 ban3ben3 de5“wu2ming2shi4”。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ta1 de5 shang1shi4 dao3 shi4 ji4lu4 de2 fei1chang2 xiang2jin4。"

msgid ""
"The chip doesn't drive you insane. It OPENS YOUR EYES.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice grows in volume. Becomes ragged.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Slot one, and you become a *GOD.*"
msgstr ""
"芯片​不会​让​你​发疯​。​它会​开辟​你​的​视界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​逐渐​变​大​。​变得​沙哑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​装​上​一块​，​你​就​会​成为​*​神​*​。\n"
"\n"
"xin1pian4 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 fa1feng1。ta1 hui4 kai1pi4 ni3 de5 shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhu2jian4 bian4 dai4。bian4de5 sha1ya3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhuang1 shang4 yi1kuai4，ni3 jiu4 hui4 cheng2wei2*shen2*。"

msgid ""
"The chrome that Glory is sporting has really done a number on her. Whatever she may have been before she went under the knife, her aura is now reminiscent of the room she's standing in: a cold, dead thing, mockingly sculpted into a facsimile of life. \n"
"\n"
"Somewhere within that mutilated aura, a shred of humanity awaits, but finding it isn't going to be easy."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​身上​的​铬​化体​确实​让​她​变了样​。​无论​动刀​前​她​曾​是​何模样​，​此刻​她​的​灵光​与​她​所处​的​房间​如出一辙​：​冰冷​死寂​之物​，​被​嘲弄​般​塑造成​生命​的​复制品​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​那​残缺​的​灵光​深处​，​尚存​一丝​人性​残影​，​但要​寻得​它​绝非易事​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 hua4 ti3 que4shi2 rang4 ta1 bian4 le5 yang4。wu2lun4 dong4 dao1 qian2 ta1 ceng2 shi4 he2 mo2 yang4，ci3ke4 ta1 de5 ling2guang1 yu4 ta1 suo3 chu3 de5 fang2jian1 ru2chu1yi1zhe2：bing1leng3 si3ji4 zhi1 wu4，bei4 chao2nong4 ban1 su4 zao4 cheng2 sheng1ming4 de5 fu4zhi4pin3。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4 can2que1 de5 ling2guang1 shen1chu4，shang4cun2 yi1 si1 ren2xing4 can2ying3，dan4 yao4 xun2 de2 ta1 jue2 fei1 yi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"The client never said that he was one of *us*, though. Bastard kept that "
"from us."
msgstr ""
"但​客户​可​没​说​他​是​*​我们​*​的​同行​。​那个​混蛋​向​我们​隐瞒​了​这点​。\n"
"dan4 ke4hu4 ke3 mei2 shuo1 ta1 shi4*wo3men5*de5 tong2hang2。na4ge5 hun2dan4 xiang4 wo3men5 yin3man2 le5 zhe4 dian3。"

msgid ""
"The clock is ticking, people. We are running out of time.\n"
"\n"
">>Dr. Elizabeth Alder"
msgstr ""
"时间​在​流逝​，​各位​。​我们​所剩​的​时间​不多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​>​伊丽莎白​·​奥尔德​博士\n"
"\n"
"shi2jian1 zai4 liu2shi4，ge4wei4。wo3men5 suo3 sheng4 de5 shi2jian1 bu4 duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
">>yi1li4sha1bai2 · ao4 er3 de2 bo2shi4"

msgid ""
"The code is 2 9 2 ... something. I don't know the last number. That'll get "
"you most of the way, though. Enjoy!"
msgstr ""
"密码​是​292​……​什么​的​。​我​记不清​最后​一位​了​。​不过​这样​应该​也​够用​了​吧​。​慢走​！\n"
"mi4ma3 shi4 292……shen2me5 de5。wo3 ji4 bu4 qing1 zui4hou4 yi1 wei4 le5。bu4guo4 zhe4yang4 ying1gai1 ye3 gou4yong4 le5 ba1。man4zou3！"

msgid ""
"The comm cuts off.\n"
"\n"
"Your PDA's screen goes black."
msgstr ""
"通讯​中断​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​PDA​屏幕​重新​变黑​。\n"
"\n"
"tong1xun4 zhong1duan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 PDA ping2mu4 chong2xin1 bian4hei1。"

msgid ""
"The commingled scents of charred meat and ozone fill the air. You've seen "
"the effects of biofeedback before, but nothing like this."
msgstr ""
"臭氧​与​肉块​烧焦​的​味道​混杂​在​一起​，​在​空气​里​弥散​开来​。​你​见​过​生物反馈​的​效果​，​但​从没​见过​这种​情况​。\n"
"chou4yang3 yu4 rou4 kuai4 shao1jiao1 de5 wei4dao5 hun4za2 zai4 yi1qi3，zai4 kong1qi4 li3 mi2san4 kai1 lai2。ni3 jian4 guo4 sheng1 wu4 fan3 kui4 de5 xiao4guo3，dan4 cong2mei2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"The commlink software must be destroyed. To do this, either enter the Matrix"
" and wipe it there, or find the servers and destroy them."
msgstr ""
"通讯​链​软件​必须​被​销毁​。​你​可以​选择​进入​矩阵​将​其​清除​，​或者​找到​服务器​并​将​其​销毁​。\n"
"tong1xun4 lian4 ruan3jian4 bi4xu1 bei4 xiao1hui3。ni3 ke3yi3 xuan3ze2 jin4ru4 ju3zhen4 jiang1 qi2 qing1chu2，huo4zhe3 zhao3dao4 fu2wu4qi4 bing4 jiang1 qi2 xiao1hui3。"

msgid ""
"The complete skeleton of a theropod dinosaur. It appears to be genuine."
msgstr ""
"一副​完整​的​兽​脚​亚目​食肉​恐龙​骨架​。​看起来​是​真的​。\n"
"yi1 fu4 wan2zheng3 de5 shou4 jiao3 ya4mu4 shi2rou4 kong3long2 gu3jia4。kan4qi3lai5 shi4 zhen1de5。"

msgid ""
"The computer reminds you that there is a living being remaining in the "
"facility and that she will be killed."
msgstr ""
"计算机​提醒​你​，​设施​内​仍​有​一名​幸存者​，​她​将​被​杀害​。\n"
"ji4suan4ji1 ti2xing3 ni3，she4shi1 nei4 reng2 you3 yi1 ming2 xing4cun2zhe3，ta1 jiang1 bei4 sha1hai4。"

msgid "The computer returns you to the menu screen."
msgstr ""
"电脑​返回​到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"dian4nao3 fan3hui2 dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The computers. The research data. The mages and scientists that are working to bring about this abomination.\n"
"\n"
"I want all of them burned to ash and buried in rubble. No compromises, and no exceptions."
msgstr ""
"那些​计算机​。​那些​研究​数据​。​那些​致力于​制造​这桩​罪恶​的​法师​与​科学家​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​他们​全部​被​烧成​灰烬​，​埋入​废墟​之下​。​绝不​妥协​，​绝无​例外​。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 ji4suan4ji1。na4xie1 yan2jiu1 shu4ju4。na4xie1 zhi4 li4 yu2 zhi4zao4 zhe4 zhuang1 zui4e4 de5 fa3shi1 yu4 ke1xue2jia1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ta1men5 quan2bu4 bei4 shao1 cheng2 hui1jin4，mai2 ru4 fei4xu1 zhi1xia4。jue2bu4 tuo3xie2，jue2 wu2 li4wai4。"

msgid "The connection cuts out. The voice in your ear is gone."
msgstr ""
"链路​中断​，​你​耳边​的​声音​消失​了​。\n"
"lian4lu4 zhong1duan4，ni3 er3 bian1 de5 sheng1yin1 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid "The connector slips into the box with a satisfying click."
msgstr ""
"接头​滑入​盒中​，​发出​令人满意​的​咔嗒​声​。\n"
"jie1tou2 hua2 ru4 he2 zhong4，fa1chu1 ling4ren2man3yi4 de5 ka1da1 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"The console lights up at your approach. Feuerschwinge's eyes track your "
"every movement as she stammers mutely behind the glass."
msgstr ""
"你​走近​时​，​控制台​的​灯光​亮​起​。​火翼​在​玻璃​后面​无声​地​呢喃​着​，​眼睛​紧盯​着​你​的​每​一个​动作​。\n"
"ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，kong4zhi4tai2 de5 deng1guang1 liang4 qi3。Huo3yi4 zai4 bo1li5 hou4mian5 wu2sheng1 de5 ni2nan2 zhao2，yan3jing5 jin3ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 mei3 yi1ge5 dong4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"The console next to the containment cell appears to control a variety of "
"functions related to the cell's operation, including its life support "
"systems. Next to it is a small intercom button."
msgstr ""
"收容​舱​旁边​的​控制台​似乎​控制​着​与​收容​舱​运行​相关​的​多种​功能​，​包括​其​生命​维持​系统​。​控制台​旁边​有​一个​小型​对​讲​按钮​。\n"
"shou1rong2 cang1 pang2bian1 de5 kong4zhi4tai2 si4hu1 kong4zhi4 zhao2 yu4 shou1rong2 cang1 yun4xing2 xiang1guan1 de5 duo1zhong3 gong1neng2，bao1kuo4 qi2 sheng1ming4 wei2chi2 xi4tong3。kong4zhi4tai2 pang2bian1 you3 yi1ge5 xiao3xing2 dui4 jiang3 an4niu3。"

msgid ""
"The constant griping isn't doing much to improve my opinion of you, "
"Hasenkamp."
msgstr ""
"你​这样​没完没了​的​抱怨​并​不能​让​我​高​看​你​一眼​，​哈森​坎普​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4yang4 mei2wan2mei2liao3 de5 bao4yuan4 bing4 bu4neng2 rang4 wo3 gao1 kan4 ni3 yi1yan3，Ha1sen1kan3pu3。"

msgid ""
"The contents of the drawers make it clear that this desk belongs to a "
"supervisor of some sort... a Mr. Steven Williams, according to the name "
"plate."
msgstr ""
"抽屉​里​的​内容​表明​这张​桌子​属于​某位​监事​级别​的​人物​……​从​名牌​上​来看​，​是​一位​“​史蒂芬​·​威廉姆斯​”​先生​。\n"
"chou1ti5 li3 de5 nei4rong2 biao3ming2 zhe4 zhang1 zhuo1zi5 shu3yu2 mou3 wei4 jian1 shi4 ji2bie2 de5 ren2wu4……cong2 ming2pai2 shang4 lai2 kan4，shi4 yi1 wei4“shi3 di4 fen1 · wei1 lian2 mu3 si1” xian1sheng5。"

msgid ""
"The control console is a sensitive machine, loaded with delicate electronics.\n"
"\n"
"One blow is enough to damage it beyond repair."
msgstr ""
"控制台​是​精密​设备​，​内部​装有​大量​敏感​电子元件​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只​需一击​就​能​导致​其​无法​再​修复​。\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 shi4 jing1mi4 she4bei4，nei4bu4 zhuang1you3 da4liang4 min3gan3 dian4 zi3 yuan2 jian4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 xu1 yi1 ji1 jiu4 neng2 dao3zhi4 qi2 wu2fa3 zai4 xiu1fu4。"

msgid "The control panel blinks with a featureless command prompt."
msgstr ""
"控制​台上​闪烁着​一条​毫无​特征​的​命令提示符​。\n"
"kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 yi1 tiao2 hao2wu2 te4zheng1 de5 ming4 ling3 ti2 shi4 fu2。"

msgid ""
"The converter is a pretty specialized piece of hardware. But a datajack "
"impulse transmitter is a widely available piece of equipment, and could be "
"converted to work in its place."
msgstr ""
"转换器​是​一种​相当​专业​的​硬件​设备​，​但​数据​插口​脉冲​发射器​则​是​市面上​常见​的​设备​，​可​经过​改装​后​替代​其​功能​。\n"
"zhuan3huan4qi4 shi4 yi1zhong3 xiang1dang1 zhuan1ye4 de5 ying4jian4 she4bei4，dan4 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 mai4chong1 fa1she4qi4 ze2 shi4 shi4mian4shang4 chang2jian4 de5 she4bei4，ke3 jing1guo4 gai3zhuang1 hou4 ti4dai4 qi2 gong1neng2。"

msgid ""
"The cool blue tones of the workstation's main menu fill the screen.\n"
"\n"
"A blinking message in the upper-right corner notifies you that you have $(scene.numUnreadMessages) unread messages."
msgstr ""
"工作站​主​菜单​的​冷​蓝色​调​填满​了​整个​屏幕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​右上角​闪烁​的​消息​栏​提示​你​有​$(scene.numUnreadMessages)​条未读​消息​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1zuo4zhan4 zhu3 cai4dan1 de5 leng3 lan2se4 diao4 tian2man3 le5 zheng3ge4 ping2mu4。\n"
"\n"
"you4 shang4 jiao3 shan3shuo4 de5 xiao1xi5 lan2 ti2shi4 ni3 you3 $(scene.numUnreadMessages) tiao2 wei4 dou4 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"The cool blue tones of the workstation's main menu fill the screen. A "
"notification icon in the corner of the screen tells you that an unread "
"message is waiting in your inbox."
msgstr ""
"工作站​主​菜单​的​冷​蓝色​调​填满​了​整个​屏幕​。​角落​的​通知​图标​提示​你​在​收件箱​中有​一条​未读​信息​。\n"
"gong1zuo4zhan4 zhu3 cai4dan1 de5 leng3 lan2se4 diao4 tian2man3 le5 zheng3ge4 ping2mu4。jiao3luo4 de5 tong1zhi1 tu2biao1 ti2shi4 ni3 zai4 shou1jian4xiang1 zhong4 you3 yi1 tiao2 wei4 dou4 xin4xi1。"

msgid "The coolest hat in the shadows. Grants +1 Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"暗影​中​最酷​的​帽子​。​提供​+​1​智力​。\n"
"an4ying3 zhong4 zui4 ku4 de5 mao4zi5。ti2gong1 +1 zhi4li4。"

msgid ""
"The corporations seemed to welcome the F-State. No regulations. No rules but"
" the Final Law. (h)"
msgstr ""
"各大​公司​似乎​对​动荡​带​表示​欢迎​。​没有​任何​规章制度​。​除了​终极​法律​之外​，​再​无​其他​。\n"
"ge4 dai4 gong1si1 si4hu1 dui4 dong4dang4 dai4 biao3shi4 huan1ying2。mei2you3 ren4he2 gui1zhang1zhi4du4。chu2le5 zhong1ji2 fa3lu:4 zhi1wai4，zai4 wu2 qi2ta1。"

msgid ""
"The council needs to meet again. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Silence.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know. Getting everyone in the same room is... challenging. Getting them to agree on a course of action is going to be even more challenging."
msgstr ""
"委员会​需要​再次​碰面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一片​寂静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​。​让​所有人​聚在一起​……​已经​够​难​的​了​。​要​让​他们​就​行动​方案​达成​一致​，​那​就​更​难​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wei3yuan2hui4 xu1yao4 zai4ci4 peng4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。rang4 suo3you3ren2 ju4zai4yi1qi3……yi3jing1 gou4 nan2 de5 le5。yao4 rang4 ta1men5 jiu4 xing2dong4 fang1an4 da2cheng2 yi1zhi4，na4 jiu4 geng1 nan2 le5。"

msgid ""
"The courtyard of the Humanis compound is strangely quiet. The only activity that you notice is the clatter of the mechanized gates as they rumble shut behind the vans.\n"
"\n"
"The Bulldogs roll to a stop. You pile out into the courtyard alongside the rest of the smugglers.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​据点​的​院子​出奇​的​安静​。​你​唯一​能​察觉​的​动静​，​是​货车​驶入​后​机械​大门​轰隆​关闭​的​哐当​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​斗牛犬​车队​停​了​下来​，​你​跟着​其他​走私者​下​了​车​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ju4dian3 de5 yuan4zi5 chu1qi2 de5 an1jing4。ni3 wei2yi1 neng2 cha2jue2 de5 dong4jing4，shi4 huo4che1 shi3ru4 hou4 ji1xie4 da4men2 hong1long1 guan1bi4 de5 kuang1 dang1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"dou3 niu2 quan3 che1dui4 ting2 le5 xia4lai5，ni3 gen1zhe5 qi2ta1 zou3 si1 zhe3 xia4 le5 che1。"

msgid ""
"The courtyard of the Humanis compound is strangely quiet. The only activity that you notice is the clatter of the mechanized gates as they rumble shut behind the vans.\n"
"\n"
"The Bulldogs roll to a stop. You step out alongside Maxim and the rest of the smugglers.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​据点​的​院子​出奇​的​安静​。​你​唯一​能​察觉​的​动静​，​是​货车​驶入​后​机械​大门​轰隆​关闭​的​哐当​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​斗牛犬​车队​停​了​下来​，​你​跟着​马克西姆​和​其他​走私者​下​了​车​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ju4dian3 de5 yuan4zi5 chu1qi2 de5 an1jing4。ni3 wei2yi1 neng2 cha2jue2 de5 dong4jing4，shi4 huo4che1 shi3ru4 hou4 ji1xie4 da4men2 hong1long1 guan1bi4 de5 kuang1 dang1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"dou3 niu2 quan3 che1dui4 ting2 le5 xia4lai5，ni3 gen1zhe5 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 he4 qi2ta1 zou3 si1 zhe3 xia4 le5 che1。"

msgid ""
"The credstick port in the machine greedily accepts your payment. You watch as the black plastic of the credstick's case disappears into the console.\n"
"\n"
"Moments later, a message winks onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"机器​上​的​信用​棒​端口​贪婪​地​接受​了​你​的​付款​。​你​看着​信用​棒​的​黑色​塑料​外壳​消失​在​控制台​内​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过​了​一会儿​，​一条​消息​闪现​在​屏幕​上​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1qi4 shang4 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 duan1kou3 tan1lan2 de5 jie1shou4 le5 ni3 de5 fu4kuan3。ni3 kan4 zhao2 xin4yong4 bang4 de5 hei1se4 su4liao4 wai4ke2 xiao1shi1 zai4 kong4zhi4tai2 nei4。\n"
"\n"
"guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，yi1 tiao2 xiao1xi5 shan3xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The credstick port in the machine greedily accepts your payment. You watch as the black plastic of the credstick's case disappears into the console.\n"
"\n"
"Moments later, the familiar sight of Alice's office winks onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"机器​上​的​信用​棒​端口​贪婪​地​接受​了​你​的​付款​。​你​看着​信用​棒​的​黑色​塑料​外壳​消失​在​控制台​内​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过​了​一会儿​，​爱丽丝​办公室​那​熟悉​的​景象​闪现​在​屏幕​上​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1qi4 shang4 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 duan1kou3 tan1lan2 de5 jie1shou4 le5 ni3 de5 fu4kuan3。ni3 kan4 zhao2 xin4yong4 bang4 de5 hei1se4 su4liao4 wai4ke2 xiao1shi1 zai4 kong4zhi4tai2 nei4。\n"
"\n"
"guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ai4li4si1 ban4gong1shi4 na4 shu2xi1 de5 jing3xiang4 shan3xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid "The credstick you uncovered remains next to the pillow."
msgstr ""
"你​把​信用​棒​留在​枕头​旁边​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 xin4yong4 bang4 liu2 zai4 zhen3tou5 pang2bian1。"

msgid ""
"The cultists aren't responsible for their actions, remember? That's as true "
"for Marta as it is for everyone else."
msgstr ""
"教徒​们​的​行为​都​不是​自愿​的​，​记得​吗​？​从这一点​来看​，​玛​尔塔​与​其他人​并​没有​什么​区别​。\n"
"jiao4tu2 men5 de5 xing2wei2 dou1 bu4shi4 zi4yuan4 de5，ji4de5 ma5？cong2 zhe4 yi1 dian3 lai2 kan4，Ma3er3ta3 yu4 qi2 ta1 ren2 bing4 mei2you3 shen2me5 qu1bie2。"

msgid ""
"The cyberware is high-grade. Quality stuff, but not milspec.\n"
"\n"
"The arms look industrial in design. Interesting choice, but there's nothing wrong with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这些​赛博​改造​是​高级​货​。​东西​不错​，​但​不是​军用​级​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​手臂​的​设计​颇具​工业​风​。​这​选择​有点​意思​，​但​也​没什么​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 shi4 gao1ji2 huo4。dong1xi1 bu4cuo4，dan4 bu4shi4 jun1yong4 ji2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"shou3bi4 de5 she4ji4 po1ju4 gong1ye4 feng1。zhe4 xuan3ze2 you3dian3 yi4si5，dan4 ye3 mei2shen2me5 wen4ti2。"

msgid "The datajack part that Janet stole from Parson."
msgstr ""
"珍妮特​从帕森​那里​偷来​的​数据​插口​部件​。\n"
"zhen1 ni1 te4 cong2 pa4 sen1 na4li5 tou1 lai2 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 bu4jian4。"

msgid ""
"The death of a Great Wyrm is of interest to a multitude of beings, and Aljernon Half-Dream is among their circle.\n"
"\n"
"There will be a reckoning."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​的​死会​牵扯​出​众多​利益​纠纷​，​而​半梦者​阿尔杰​农​也​在​其中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​清算​之时​将​至​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 de5 si3 hui4 qian1che3 chu1 zhong4duo1 li4yi4 jiu1fen1，er2 ban4 meng4 zhe3 E1er3jie2nong2 ye3 zai4 qi2zhong1。\n"
"\n"
"qing1suan4 zhi1 shi2 jiang1 zhi4。"

msgid ""
"The deaths of the others are noteworthy details, but ultimately immaterial. You got the job done, and you walked out intact enough to work with us again in the future. And all of this despite being saddled with a crew that was deliberately selected to hinder you.\n"
"\n"
"Most impressive, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"其他人​的​死​虽​是​值得注意​的​细节​，​但​终究​无关紧要​。​你​完成​了​任务​，​而且​安然无恙​地​走​出来​，​未来​还​能​继续​与​我们​合作​。​而且​这​一切​成就​，​都​是​在​被​刻意​挑选​来​拖累​你​的​团队​的​情况​下​取得​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常​了不起​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"qi2 ta1 ren2 de5 si3 sui1 shi4 zhi2 de2 zhu4 yi4 de5 xi4jie2，dan4 zhong1jiu1 wu2guan1jin3yao4。ni3 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5，er2qie3 an1ran2wu2yang4 de5 zou3 chu1lai2，wei4lai2 hai2 neng2 ji4xu4 yu4 wo3men5 he2zuo4。er2qie3 zhe4 yi1qie4 cheng2jiu4，dou1 shi4 zai4 bei4 ke4yi4 tiao1xuan3 lai2 tuo1lei3 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 qu3de2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 liao3bu5qi3，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"The decision is yours, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Make it a good one."
msgstr ""
"决定权​在​你​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​做出​明智​的​选择​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"jue2 ding4 quan2 zai4 ni3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4chu1 ming2zhi4 de5 xuan3ze2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"The decision's yours, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"Make it a good one."
msgstr ""
"决定权​在​你​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​做出​明智​的​选择​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"jue2 ding4 quan2 zai4 ni3，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4chu1 ming2zhi4 de5 xuan3ze2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"The deck that every decker dreams of owning. It's the Holy Grail of "
"cyberdecks."
msgstr ""
"碟​客们​梦寐以求​的​碟​板​，​人人​向往​的​赛博碟板​圣杯​。\n"
"die2 ke4 men5 meng4mei4yi3qiu2 de5 die2 ban3，ren2ren2 xiang4wang3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 sheng4bei1。"

msgid ""
"The decker monitored both sides to ensure our mutual cooperation. But with "
"her death, the Doctor has reneged on the deal."
msgstr ""
"碟客​负责​监视​双方​，​以​确保​我们​的​相互合作​。​但​随着​她​的​死亡​，​医生​违背​了​我们​的​交易​。\n"
"die2 ke4 fu4ze2 jian1shi4 shuang1fang1，yi3 que4bao3 wo3men5 de5 xiang1 hu4 ge3 zuo4。dan4 sui2zhe5 ta1 de5 si3wang2，yi1sheng1 wei2bei4 le5 wo3men5 de5 jiao1yi4。"

msgid ""
"The desire to speak the truth slowly fades.\n"
"\n"
"Your body is, once again, under your own control."
msgstr ""
"和盘托出​的​欲望​渐渐​消退​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​身体​再次​回到​你​自己​的​掌控​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"he2pan2tuo1chu1 de5 yu4wang4 jian4jian4 xiao1tui4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 shen1ti3 zai4ci4 hui2dao4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 zhang3kong4 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"The desk before you is well kept. The papers are stacked neatly, the drawers"
" are closed, and the terminal is shut off. "
msgstr ""
"你​面前​的​桌子​得到​了​精心​打理​。​文件​叠放​整齐​，​抽屉​紧闭​，​终端​也​关机​了​。\n"
"ni3 mian4qian2 de5 zhuo1zi5 de2dao4 le5 jing1xin1 da3li3。wen2jian4 die2fang4 zheng3qi2，chou1ti5 jin3bi4，zhong1duan1 ye3 guan1ji1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The details are unimportant. All that we need you to do is whisper a phrase into his ear: \"We are pleased that Project Vincent is going so well.\"\n"
"\n"
"If you wanted to embellish the fact that he is receiving this message in the one place where he feels the most secure, we wouldn't stop you."
msgstr ""
"细节​无关紧要​。​我们​只​需​你​在​他​耳边​轻声​说​一句​：​“​我们​很​高兴​文森特​计划​进展​顺利​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​你​想​再​强调​一下​，​他​正​身处​自​以为​最​安全​的​场所​却​收到​这​条​消息​，​我们​也​不会​拦着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"xi4jie2 wu2guan1jin3yao4。wo3men5 zhi3 xu1 ni3 zai4 ta1 er3 bian1 qing1sheng1 shuo1 yi1ju4：“wo3men5 hen3 gao1xing4 wen2 sen1 te4 ji4hua4 jin4zhan3 shun4li4。” \n"
"\n"
"ruo4 ni3 xiang3 zai4 qiang2diao4 yi1xia4，ta1 zheng1 shen1chu3 zi4 yi3wei2 zui4 an1quan2 de5 chang3suo3 que4 shou1dao4 zhe4 tiao2 xiao1xi5，wo3men5 ye3 bu4hui4 lan2 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid "The devil?"
msgstr ""
"恶魔​？\n"
"e4mo2？"

msgid ""
"The disc labeled \"WATCH ME\" looks almost new. The others are clearly much older, and many of them are badly scratched.\n"
"\n"
"The last two discs in the bundle are stuck together, and when you try to pry them apart, the readable surface of the bottom disc peels away."
msgstr ""
"写​着​“​看​我​”​的​那​张​光盘​看起来​几乎​是​全新​的​。​其他​的​光盘​明显​就要​旧得​多​，​而且​好几张​都​有​很​严重​的​划痕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​一堆​光盘​里​最​下面​的​两张​粘​在​了​一起​，​而​当​你​试图​把​它们​撬开​的​时候​，​下面​那张​光盘​的​封面​也​跟着​被​撕掉​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xie3 zhao2“kan4 wo3” de5 na4 zhang1 guang1pan2 kan4qi3lai5 ji1hu1 shi4 quan2xin1 de5。qi2ta1 de5 guang1pan2 ming2xian3 jiu4yao4 jiu4 de2 duo1，er2qie3 hao3 ji1 zhang1 dou1 you3 hen3 yan2zhong4 de5 hua2hen2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1dui1 guang1pan2 li3 zui4 xia4mian4 de5 liang3 zhang1 zhan1 zai4 le5 yi1qi3，er2 dang1 ni3 shi4tu2 ba3 ta1men5 qiao4kai1 de5 shi2hou5，xia4mian4 na4 zhang1 guang1pan2 de5 feng1mian4 ye3 gen1zhe5 bei4 si1diao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The disc labeled WATCH ME looks almost new. The others are clearly much older, and many of them are badly scratched.\n"
"\n"
"The last two discs in the bundle are stuck together, and when you try to pry them apart, the readable surface of the bottom disc peels away."
msgstr ""
"写​着​“​看​我​”​的​那​张​光盘​看起来​几乎​是​全新​的​。​其他​的​光盘​明显​就要​旧得​多​，​而且​好几张​都​有​很​严重​的​划痕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​一堆​光盘​里​最​下面​的​两张​粘​在​了​一起​，​而​当​你​试图​把​它们​撬开​的​时候​，​下面​那张​光盘​的​封面​也​跟着​被​撕掉​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xie3 zhao2“kan4 wo3” de5 na4 zhang1 guang1pan2 kan4qi3lai5 ji1hu1 shi4 quan2xin1 de5。qi2ta1 de5 guang1pan2 ming2xian3 jiu4yao4 jiu4 de2 duo1，er2qie3 hao3 ji1 zhang1 dou1 you3 hen3 yan2zhong4 de5 hua2hen2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1dui1 guang1pan2 li3 zui4 xia4mian4 de5 liang3 zhang1 zhan1 zai4 le5 yi1qi3，er2 dang1 ni3 shi4tu2 ba3 ta1men5 qiao4kai1 de5 shi2hou5，xia4mian4 na4 zhang1 guang1pan2 de5 feng1mian4 ye3 gen1zhe5 bei4 si1diao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The disc rattles again, and you find yourself sitting at the main menu."
msgstr ""
"光盘​吱吱作响​，​你​又​回到​了​主​菜单​。\n"
"guang1pan2 zhi1 zhi1 zuo4 xiang3，ni3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1。"

msgid "The disc spins down, and you find yourself sitting at the main menu."
msgstr ""
"光盘​慢慢​停止​转动​，​你​又​回到​了​主​菜单​。\n"
"guang1pan2 man4man4 ting2zhi3 zhuan3dong4，ni3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1。"

msgid ""
"The discussion is finished, Eiger.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel speaks softly, but his tone is firm.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"讨论​到此为止​，​艾格尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​轻声​说道​，​但​语气​坚定​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"tao3lun4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3，Ai4ge2er3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 qing1sheng1 shuo1dao4，dan4 yu3qi4 jian1ding4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"The displaced group of metas from downstairs stands awkwardly in the "
"hallway. They shuffle about aimlessly, refusing to meet your gaze."
msgstr ""
"楼下​那群​无家可归​的​泛​人类​尴尬​地站​在​走廊​里​。​他们​漫无目的​地​挪动​着​脚步​，​避开​你​的​目光​。\n"
"lou2xia4 na4 qun2 wu2jia1ke3gui1 de5 fan4 ren2lei4 gan1ga4 de5 zhan4 zai4 zou3lang2 li3。ta1men5 man4wu2mu4di4 de5 nuo2dong4 zhao2 jiao3bu4，bi4kai1 ni3 de5 mu4guang1。"

msgid ""
"The display goes black, and the background whine fades away. A moment later,"
" you find yourself deposited back at the menu screen."
msgstr ""
"显示屏​变黑​，​背景​噪音​消失​。​片刻​之后​，​你​发现自己​回到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"xian3shi4ping2 bian4hei1，bei4jing3 zao4yin1 xiao1shi1。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 hui2dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The display goes blank for a moment. Then the face of Green Winters winks onto the screen.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2042-08-05."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变黑​了​一会儿​，​然后​格林​·​温特斯​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2042​-​08​-​05​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4hei1 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2042-08-05。"

msgid ""
"The display goes blank for a moment. Then the face of Green Winters winks onto the screen.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2049-06-06."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变黑​了​一会儿​，​然后​格林​·​温特斯​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2049​-​06​-​06​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4hei1 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2049-06-06。"

msgid ""
"The display goes blank for a moment. Then the face of Green Winters winks onto the screen. He is seated at a computer; off to his left, an enormous monitor fills the screen.\n"
"\n"
"His voice carries an edge of panic. The timestamp on the video reads 2054-11-09."
msgstr ""
"显示屏​空白​了​一会儿​。​然后​格林​·​温特斯​的​脸​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​他​正​坐在​一台​电脑前​；​他​的​左侧​有​一台​巨大​的​显示器​占满​了​屏幕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​声音​带​着​一丝​恐慌​。​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2054​-​11​-​09​。\n"
"\n"
"xian3shi4ping2 kong4bai2 le5 yi1hui4r5。ran2hou4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。ta1 zheng1 zuo4 zai4 yi1 tai2 dian4 nao3 qian2 ； ta1 de5 zuo3ce4 you3 yi1 tai2 ju4da4 de5 xian3shi4qi4 zhan4man3 le5 ping2mu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 yi1 si1 kong3huang1。shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2054-11-09。"

msgid ""
"The display goes blank for a moment. Then the face of Green Winters winks onto the screen. There is a look of astonishment on his face.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2054-11-17."
msgstr ""
"显示屏​空白​了​一会儿​，​然后​格林​·​温特斯​的​脸​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​他​的​脸上​有着​惊讶​的​表情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2054​-​11​-​17​。\n"
"\n"
"xian3shi4ping2 kong4bai2 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 you3zhe5 jing1ya4 de5 biao3qing2。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2054-11-17。"

msgid ""
"The distant whir of a powerful fan system fills the air.\n"
"\n"
"Papers and other loose objects within the lab begin to flutter and roll as a powerful wind disturbs their rest."
msgstr ""
"远处​传来​强力​排风​系统​的​运作​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​实验室​内​的​纸张​，​连同​其他​散落​的​物件​在​突如其来​的​强风​中​上下​翻腾​。\n"
"\n"
"yuan3chu4 chuan2lai2 qiang2li4 pai2 feng1 xi4tong3 de5 yun4zuo4 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"shi2yan4shi4 nei4 de5 zhi3zhang1，lian2tong2 qi2ta1 san3luo4 de5 wu4jian4 zai4 tu1ru2qi2lai2 de5 qiang2feng1 zhong4 shang4xia4 fan1teng2。"

msgid ""
"The doctor turns away, rifling through the samples and inspecting their "
"labels. He looks like a kid in a candy store."
msgstr ""
"医生​转过身​去​，​开始​翻找​各种​样本​并​查看​标签​，​就​像​个​闯进​糖果店​里​的​孩子​。\n"
"yi1sheng1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4，kai1shi3 fan1 zhao3 ge4zhong3 yang4ben3 bing4 cha2kan4 biao1qian1，jiu4 xiang4 ge4 chuang3jin4 tang2 guo3 dian4 li3 de5 hai2zi5。"

msgid "The doctor's plan - Panacea - it won't work. He knew that in the end."
msgstr ""
"博士​关于​“​万能​药​”​的​计划​行不通​。​他​最后​想​明白​了​这​一点​。\n"
"bo2shi4 guan1yu2“wan4neng2 yao4” de5 ji4hua4 xing2bu5tong1。ta1 zui4hou4 xiang3 ming2bai5 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"The doctors would call this PTSD, I'm sure. They'd have me in therapy... maybe dose me up on SSRIs, like they do to our veteran soldiers.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He chuckles, then takes another drag.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Quite a story for the tabloids... the great dragonslayer, Adrian Vauclair, mentally incapable of wrestling with his own demons."
msgstr ""
"我​敢肯定​，​医生​们​会​说​我​这​是​PTSD​。​他们​会​让​我​接受​治疗​……​也许​会​给​我​服用​SSRI​，​就​像​他们​对​我们​的​退伍​士兵​做​的​那样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​笑了笑​，​又​吸​了​一口​烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​小报​来说​，​这​真是​个​好​故事​……​伟大​的​屠龙​者​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​，​却​在精神上​无法​与​自己​的​心​魔​抗衡​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 ken3 ding4，yi1sheng1 men5 hui4 shuo1 wo3 zhe4 shi4 PTSD。ta1men5 hui4 rang4 wo3 jie1shou4 zhi4liao2……ye3xu3 hui4 gei3 wo3 fu2yong4 SSRI，jiu4 xiang4 ta1men5 dui4 wo3men5 de5 tui4wu3 shi4bing1 zuo4 de5 na4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 xiao4，you4 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4 xiao3bao4 lai2 shuo1，zhe4 zhen1shi5 ge4 hao3 gu4shi4……wei3da4 de5 tu2 long2 zhe3 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3，que4 zai4 jing1 shen2 shang4 wu2fa3 yu4 zi4ji3 de5 xin1 mo2 kang4heng2。"

msgid ""
"The door behind Vauclair slides open with a pneumatic hiss.\n"
"\n"
"A familiar, onminous figure steps across the threshold and into the room."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​身后​的​门​伴随​着​一声​气动​嘶鸣​缓缓​打开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​熟悉​而​令人不安​的​身影​跨过​门槛​，​步入​房间​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 shen1hou4 de5 men2 ban4sui2 zhao2 yi1sheng1 qi4dong4 si1ming2 huan3huan3 da3kai1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 shu2xi1 er2 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 shen1ying3 kua4guo4 men2kan3，bu4ru4 fang2jian1。"

msgid "The door has been boarded shut."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​被​木板​封死​了​。\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 bei4 mu4ban3 feng1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The door has been maglocked shut. A heavy coat of dust tells you that it hasn't been opened in months.\n"
"\n"
"A simple swipe-key access system has been mounted into the door frame. Block letters on the system's case read \"CLEARANCE B ACCESS ONLY.\""
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​被​磁锁​锁住​了​。​厚厚的​一层​灰尘​表明​它​已经​有​好几个​月​没有​打开​过​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门框​上​安装​着​简易​的​刷卡​门禁系统​。​系统​外壳​上用​大写字母​标注​着​“​仅限​B​级​权限​进入​”​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 bei4 ci2 suo3 suo3 zhu4 le5。hou4 hou4 de5 yi1ceng2 hui1chen2 biao3ming2 ta1 yi3jing1 you3 hao3 ji1 ge4 yue4 mei2you3 da3kai1 guo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"men2kuang4 shang4 an1zhuang1 zhao2 jian3yi4 de5 shua1ka3 men2 jin1 xi4 tong3。xi4tong3 wai4ke2 shang4 yong4 da4xie3zi4mu3 biao1zhu4 zhao2“jin3 xian4 bi1 ji2 quan2xian4 jin4ru4”。"

msgid "The door is held shut by a magical force."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​被​一股​魔法​力量​封住​了​。\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 bei4 yi1 gu3 mo2fa3 li4liang5 feng1 zhu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The door is hermetically sealed. Months of disuse have left it covered in a thick coat of dust.\n"
"\n"
"A simple swipe-key access system has been mounted into the door frame. Block letters on the system's case read \"EXECUTIVE CLEARANCE ONLY.\""
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​严丝合缝​地​密封​着​。​厚厚的​一层​灰尘​表明​它​已经​有​好几个​月​没有​打开​过​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门框​上​安装​着​简易​的​刷卡​门禁系统​。​系统​外壳​上用​大写字母​标注​着​“​仅限​高管​进入​”​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 yan2si1he2feng4 de5 mi4feng1 zhao2。hou4 hou4 de5 yi1ceng2 hui1chen2 biao3ming2 ta1 yi3jing1 you3 hao3 ji1 ge4 yue4 mei2you3 da3kai1 guo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"men2kuang4 shang4 an1zhuang1 zhao2 jian3yi4 de5 shua1ka3 men2 jin1 xi4 tong3。xi4tong3 wai4ke2 shang4 yong4 da4xie3zi4mu3 biao1zhu4 zhao2“jin3 xian4 gao1guan3 jin4ru4”。"

msgid ""
"The door is locked by a high tech maglock with a swipe-key access system, "
"but the status screen indicates that the lock has been overridden by a local"
" computer on the network."
msgstr ""
"门上​装有​高科技​电磁锁​，​采用​刷卡​门禁系统​，​但​状态​屏幕显示​其​已​被​网络​中​的​本地​计算机​完成​超控​。\n"
"men2 shang4 zhuang1you3 gao1ke1ji4 dian4 ci2 suo3，cai3yong4 shua1ka3 men2 jin1 xi4 tong3，dan4 zhuang4tai4 bing3 mu4 xian3 shi4 qi2 yi3 bei4 wang3luo4 zhong4 de5 ben3di4 ji4suan4ji1 wan2cheng2 chao1 kong4。"

msgid "The door is locked."
msgstr ""
"门​上锁​了​。\n"
"men2 shang4suo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The door is locked. There is a small keypad, a keycard reader, and a comm "
"panel set into the wall just beside it."
msgstr ""
"门​上锁​了​。​旁边​的​墙上​有​小键盘​，​读卡器​和​一套​通讯​面板​。\n"
"men2 shang4suo3 le5。pang2bian1 de5 qiang2 shang4 you3 xiao3 jian4 pan2，du2ka3qi4 he4 yi1tao4 tong1xun4 mian4ban3。"

msgid "The door is locked. There is an intercom panel beside it."
msgstr ""
"门​上锁​了​。​旁边​有个​对​讲​面板​。\n"
"men2 shang4suo3 le5。pang2bian1 you3 ge4 dui4 jiang3 mian4ban3。"

msgid ""
"The door is maglocked shut, and it appears that someone in the not-too-distant past has smeared its surface with feces.\n"
"\n"
"The door's key-swipe access system has \"CLEARANCE B ACCESS ONLY\" printed on its case."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​被​磁锁​锁死​，​显然​不久前​有人​在​门​的​表面​涂抹​了​粪便​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门禁​刷卡​系统​的​外壳​上​印着​“​仅限​B​级​权限​访问​”​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 bei4 ci2 suo3 suo3 si3，xian3ran2 bu4jiu3qian2 you3ren2 zai4 men2 de5 biao3mian4 tu2mo3 le5 fen4bian4。\n"
"\n"
"men2jin4 shua1ka3 xi4tong3 de5 wai4ke2 shang4 yin4 zhao2“jin3 xian4 bi1 ji2 quan2xian4 fang3wen4”。"

msgid ""
"The door is sealed tight. Dirt, dust, and grime have caked around the corners - it's clear that no one has been through here in many months. \n"
"\n"
"You can see the hydraulic jacks locking the door in place near the bottom of the frame."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​被​紧紧​密封​住​，​污垢​和​灰尘​在​门框​角落处​凝结​成​块​—​—​显然​已经​好几个​月​没人来​过​这里​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​看到​液压​千斤顶​在​门框​底部​将门​牢牢​锁住​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 bei4 jin3jin3 mi4feng1 zhu4，wu1gou4 he4 hui1chen2 zai4 men2kuang4 jiao3 la4 chu3 ning2jie2 cheng2 kuai4——xian3ran2 yi3jing1 hao3 ji1 ge4 yue4 mei2 ren2 lai2 guo4 zhe4li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 kan4dao4 ye4ya1 qian1jin1ding3 zai4 men2kuang4 di3bu4 jiang1 men2 lao2lao2 suo3 zhu4。"

msgid ""
"The door is still locked, but the light on the comm panel blinks invitingly."
msgstr ""
"门​依然​紧锁​，​但​通讯​面板​上​的​指示灯​正​闪烁着​诱人​的​光芒​。\n"
"men2 yi1ran2 jin3 suo3，dan4 tong1xun4 mian4ban3 shang4 de5 zhi3 shi4 deng1 zheng1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 you4ren2 de5 guang1mang2。"

msgid "The door leads out to the building's fire escape."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​通往​大楼​的​消防​逃生​通道​。\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 tong1wang3 da4lou2 de5 xiao1fang2 tao2sheng1 tong1dao4。"

msgid ""
"The door leads out to the building's fire escape. Not a bad way to make an "
"expedient retreat."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​通往​大楼​的​消防​逃生​通道​。​作为​快速​撤退​的​途径​，​倒​也​不失为​一个​好​办法​。\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 tong1wang3 da4lou2 de5 xiao1fang2 tao2sheng1 tong1dao4。zuo4wei2 kuai4su4 che4tui4 de5 tu2jing4，dao3 ye3 bu4shi1wei2 yi1ge5 hao3 ban4fa3。"

msgid ""
"The door slides open with a hiss, revealing a surprised-looking young woman in an Aztechnology security uniform.\n"
"\n"
"She steps toward you, her weapon drawn."
msgstr ""
"门嘶地​一声​滑开​，​一名​穿着​阿兹特​科技​安保​制服​、​面露​惊愕​的​年轻​女子​随之​出现​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​拔出​武器​向​你​走来​。\n"
"\n"
"men2 si1 de5 yi1sheng1 hua2 kai1，yi1 ming2 chuan1zhuo2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 an1bao3 zhi4fu2、mian4lu4 jing1e4 de5 nian2qing1 nu:3zi3 sui2zhi1 chu1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ba2 chu1 wu3qi4 xiang4 ni3 zou3 lai2。"

msgid "The door slides open with a hiss."
msgstr ""
"随着​液压​的​嘶嘶声​，​门​打开​了​。\n"
"sui2zhe5 ye4ya1 de5 si1si1sheng1，men2 da3kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The door slides open with a hiss. Light spills out from the adjoining room "
"into the hall."
msgstr ""
"随着​液压​的​嘶嘶声​，​大门​打开​了​。​亮光​从​隔壁​房间​投向​大厅​。\n"
"sui2zhe5 ye4ya1 de5 si1si1sheng1，da4men2 da3kai1 le5。liang4guang1 cong2 ge2bi4 fang2jian1 tou2 xiang4 da4ting1。"

msgid "The door slides open with a hiss. No alarm sounds."
msgstr ""
"随着​液压​的​嘶嘶声​，​门​打开​了​。​警报声​没有​响起​。\n"
"sui2zhe5 ye4ya1 de5 si1si1sheng1，men2 da3kai1 le5。jing3 bao4 sheng1 mei2you3 xiang3qi3。"

msgid ""
"The door slides open with a pneumatic hiss.\n"
"\n"
"An enormous figure fills your vision. It stands, motionless, by a console in the corner of the room."
msgstr ""
"在​一阵​嘶​嘶​的​放气声​中​，​门​缓缓​打开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​某个​庞然大物​占据​了​你​的​视野​。​它立​在​房间​的​角落里​，​一动不动​，​旁边​有个​控制台​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 yi1zhen4 si1 si1 de5 fang4 qi4 sheng1 zhong4，men2 huan3huan3 da3kai1。\n"
"\n"
"mou3 ge4 pang2ran2da4wu4 zhan4ju4 le5 ni3 de5 shi4ye3。ta1 li4 zai4 fang2jian1 de5 jiao3 la4 li3，yi1dong4bu4dong4，pang2bian1 you3 ge4 kong4zhi4tai2。"

msgid ""
"The door slides open, and the stench of stale sweat assaults your nostrils.\n"
"\n"
"Enstad steps forward, his bloody lips curled into a smile. The soles of his boots squeak on the polished tile floor."
msgstr ""
"门​向​一侧​滑开​，​一股​陈腐​汗臭​扑面而来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​恩施​塔德​迈步​向前​，​扬起​血迹斑斑​的​嘴角​。​他​的​靴底​在​打磨​光亮​的​瓷砖​地面​上​发出​吱呀​声响​。\n"
"\n"
"men2 xiang4 yi1 ce4 hua2 kai1，yi1 gu3 chen2fu3 han4chou4 pu1mian4er2lai2。\n"
"\n"
"en1Shi1ta3de2 mai4bu4 xiang4qian2，yang2qi3 xue4ji4ban1ban1 de5 zui3jiao3。ta1 de5 xue1 de5 zai4 da3mo2 guang1liang4 de5 ci2zhuan1 di4mian4 shang4 fa1chu1 zhi1ya1 sheng1xiang3。"

msgid ""
"The door slides open, revealing a group of figures wearing green cloaks. The nearest of the figures looks up from his work.\n"
"\n"
"His stare seems to bore into you."
msgstr ""
"门​向​旁​滑开​，​露出​几道​身披​绿袍​的​身影​。​其中​离​你​最近​的​人​从​工作​中​抬起头来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​目光​仿佛​要​刺穿​你​的​灵魂​。\n"
"\n"
"men2 xiang4 pang2 hua2 kai1，lu4chu1 ji1 dao4 shen1 pi1 lu:4 pao2 de5 shen1ying3。qi2zhong1 li2 ni3 zui4jin4 de5 ren2 cong2 gong1zuo4 zhong4 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 mu4guang1 fang3fu2 yao4 ci4chuan1 ni3 de5 ling2hun2。"

msgid ""
"The door slides open, revealing a group of figures wearing green cloaks. The tallest of the figures stands just in front of you, a slight smile on his face.\n"
"\n"
"His eyes are full of intelligence and malice."
msgstr ""
"门​向​旁​滑开​，​露出​几道​身披​绿袍​的​身影​。​其中​最高​大​的​一人​站​在​你​面前​，​嘴角​带​着​浅浅的​微笑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​聪颖​与​恶意​在​他​的​眼中​彼此​交织​。\n"
"\n"
"men2 xiang4 pang2 hua2 kai1，lu4chu1 ji1 dao4 shen1 pi1 lu:4 pao2 de5 shen1ying3。qi2zhong1 zui4gao1 dai4 de5 yi1 ren2 zhan4 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2，zui3jiao3 dai4 zhao2 jian1 jian1 de5 wei1xiao4。\n"
"\n"
"cong1ying3 yu4 e4yi4 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 bi3ci3 jiao1zhi1。"

msgid "The door to Marta's chamber stands before you."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​房间​的​门​就​在​你们​面前​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 fang2jian1 de5 men2 jiu4 zai4 ni3men5 mian4qian2。"

msgid "The door unlocks with a click."
msgstr ""
"门​咔哒​一声​解锁​了​。\n"
"men2 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid "The door unlocks with a faint click."
msgstr ""
"门​咔哒​一声​解锁​了​。\n"
"men2 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid "The door unlocks with a loud click. Your escape route is clear."
msgstr ""
"门​发出​响亮​的​咔哒​声​解锁​了​。​你​的​逃离​路线​现在​畅通无阻​。\n"
"men2 fa1chu1 xiang3liang4 de5 ka3 da1 sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。ni3 de5 tao2li2 lu4xian4 xian4zai4 chang4 tong1 wu2 zu3。"

msgid "The door unlocks with a solid \"thunk.\""
msgstr ""
"门​发出​“​咣当​”​一声​解锁​了​。\n"
"men2 fa1chu1“guang1dang1” yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid "The door unlocks."
msgstr ""
"门开​了​。\n"
"men2 kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The doorway shimmers with a faint red light. As you approach the door, you can feel a squirming sensation in the back of your skull.\n"
"\n"
"Your limbs begin to tingle, then feel heavy. The closer that you get to the doorway, the more of a struggle it is to continue moving forward. It feels as though the strength is being siphoned from your body."
msgstr ""
"门缝​中泛​着​微弱​的​红光​。​当​你​靠近​时​，​后脑勺​传来​一阵阵​蠕动​般的​刺痛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​四肢​开始​发麻​，​继而​沉重​如​铅​。​你​越​靠近​门口​，​前进​的​步伐​就​越发​艰难​，​仿佛​力量​正​被​一点点​从​体内​抽离​。\n"
"\n"
"men2 feng2 zhong4 fan4 zhao2 wei1ruo4 de5 hong2 guang1。dang1 ni3 kao4jin4 shi2，hou4nao3shao2 chuan2lai2 yi1 zhen4 zhen4 ru2dong4 ban1 de5 ci4tong4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 si4zhi1 kai1shi3 fa1ma2，ji4er2 chen2zhong4 ru2 qian1。ni3 yue4 kao4jin4 men2kou3，qian2jin4 de5 bu4fa2 jiu4 yue4fa1 jian1nan2，fang3fu2 li4liang5 zheng1 bei4 yi1dian3dian3 cong2 ti3nei4 chou1li2。"

msgid "The dragon in the woman sways a little. Swallows hard."
msgstr ""
"女人​体内​的​龙​微微​动摇​。​她​艰难​地吞​了​口​唾沫​。\n"
"nu:3ren2 ti3nei4 de5 long2 wei1wei1 dong4yao2。ta1 jian1nan2 de5 tun1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。"

msgid "The dragon inside the woman looks at you, perplexed."
msgstr ""
"女人​体内​的​巨龙​困惑​地​看着​你​。\n"
"nu:3ren2 ti3nei4 de5 ju4long2 kun4huo4 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"The dragon's attack was brought to an end two hours after it began by a wing of Saeder-Krupp attack craft.\n"
"\n"
"The fighters were armed with experimental Gauss cannons, and to quote a Saeder-Krupp spokesman, they \"tore through her armor like tinfoil.\""
msgstr ""
"两​小时​后​，​赛德​-​克虏伯​攻击​舰队​终结​了​巨龙​的​进攻​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​战斗机​装备​着​实验性​高斯​炮​。​用​赛德​-​克虏伯​发言人​的话​说​，​它们​“​像​撕​锡箔纸​般​撕裂​了​龙​的​护甲​”​。\n"
"\n"
"liang3 xiao3shi2 hou4，Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 gong1ji1 jian4dui4 zhong1jie2 le5 ju4long2 de5 jin4gong1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 zhan4dou4ji1 zhuang1bei4 zhao2 shi2 yan4 xing4 gao1si1 bao1。yong4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 fa1yan2ren2 de5hua4 shuo1，ta1men5“xiang4 si1 xi1bo2zhi3 ban1 si1lie4 le5 long2 de5 hu4jia3”。"

msgid ""
"The dragons of today are subtle creatures, full of patience and guile. Feuerschwinge was not.\n"
"\n"
"After her Awakening, she went on a four-month rampage that claimed tens of thousands of lives."
msgstr ""
"如今​的​巨龙​是​工于心计​的​生物​，​耐性​十足​且​诡计多端​。​但​火翼​可不是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​大​觉醒​”​事件​中​，​她​暴走​了​足足​四个​月​，​夺走​了​上万​人​的​性命​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 de5 ju4long2 shi4 gong1yu2xin1ji4 de5 sheng1wu4，nai4xing4 shi2zu2 qie3 gui3ji4duo1duan1。dan4 Huo3yi4 ke3bu5shi4。\n"
"\n"
"“dai4 jue2xing3” shi4jian4 zhong4，ta1 bao4zou3 le5 zu2zu2 si4 ge4 yue4，duo2zou3 le5 shang4wan4 ren2 de5 xing4ming4。"

msgid ""
"The dragons will die, yes. But there's no telling what else might happen.\n"
"\n"
"Unleashing that shit could have deadly consequences for all of us."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​会​死​，​这​一点​没错​。​但​谁​也​不​知道​还会​发生​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​释放​这​东西​可能​会​给​我们​所有人​带来​致命​后果​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 hui4 si3，zhe4 yi1dian3 mei2cuo4。dan4 shei2 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 hai2 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4fang4 zhe4 dong1xi1 ke3neng2 hui4 gei3 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dai4lai2 zhi4ming4 hou4guo3。"

msgid ""
"The dragons will die, yes... but there's no telling what else might happen. "
"Unleashing that shit could have deadly consequences for all of us."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​会​死​，​这​一点​没错​……​但​谁​也​不​知道​还会​发生​什么​。​释放​这​东西​可能​会​给​我们​所有人​带来​致命​后果​。\n"
"ju4long2 hui4 si3，zhe4 yi1dian3 mei2cuo4……dan4 shei2 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 hai2 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。shi4fang4 zhe4 dong1xi1 ke3neng2 hui4 gei3 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dai4lai2 zhi4ming4 hou4guo3。"

msgid ""
"The drawer appears to be secured by some sort of electronic lock. The desk itself, however, looks relatively flimsy.\n"
"\n"
"You might be able to force the drawer open."
msgstr ""
"抽屉​似乎​安装​了​某种​电子锁​。​不过​，​桌子​本身​看起来​并​不​结实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​也许​可以​强行​打开​抽屉​。\n"
"\n"
"chou1ti5 si4hu1 an1zhuang1 le5 mou3zhong3 dian4 zi3 suo3。bu4guo4，zhuo1zi5 ben3shen1 kan4qi3lai5 bing4 bu4 jie1shi2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3xu3 ke3yi3 qiang2xing2 da3kai1 chou1ti5。"

msgid ""
"The drawers look to be hand-made, out of rusty sheet-metal. Nothing of value"
" catches your eye within."
msgstr ""
"抽屉​看起来​是​手工​打制​的​，​用​的​是​生锈​的​金属薄板​。​里面​没有​引人注目​的​有​价值​的​东西​。\n"
"chou1ti5 kan4qi3lai5 shi4 shou3gong1 da3zhi4 de5，yong4 de5 shi4 sheng1xiu4 de5 jin1 shu3 bao2 ban3。li3mian4 mei2you3 yin3ren2zhu4mu4 de5 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"The drive from the Kreuzbasar to the Schönbuch Forest was a long one. For over six hours, you and Glory rode in relative silence, with only the sounds of the road for company.\n"
"\n"
"Now you find yourself crouching in the woods, watching, waiting. Off in the distance, the rustic exterior of Feuerstelle looks curiously warm and inviting, but you know what's waiting inside. The anticipation churns at your guts like a living thing.\n"
"\n"
"Eventually, a van pulls out of the compound's driveway and rolls out along a service road before disappearing from view. Glory gives you a nod and begins to scramble forward.\n"
"\n"
"Harrow has left the building. It's time for you to make your way inside."
msgstr ""
"从​克洛伊​茨​集市​到​申布赫​森林​的​路途​漫长​。​六小时​的​车程​里​，​你​和​格洛丽​几乎​沉默不语​，​唯有​路上​的​声响​相伴​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此刻​，​你们​蜷伏​在​树林​中​，​凝神​守候​。​远处​“​火坑​”​的​质朴​外墙​透出​奇异​的​温暖​气息​，​但​你​知道​里面​有​什么​在​等待​着​你​。​期待​感如​活物​般​在​你​腹中​翻腾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​终于​，​一辆​货车​驶离​院落​车道​，​沿着​辅路​蜿蜒​前行​直至​消失​在​视野​尽头​。​格洛丽​向​你​点头​示意​，​随即​开始​向前​攀爬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​离开​了​。​此刻​正是​你们​潜入​内部​的​时机​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 dao4 shen1 bu4 he4 sen1lin2 de5 lu4tu2 man4chang2。liu4 xiao3 shi2 de5 che1cheng2 li3，ni3 he4 Ge2luo4li2 ji1hu1 chen2 mo4 bu4 yu3，wei2you3 lu4shang5 de5 sheng1xiang3 xiang1ban4。\n"
"\n"
"ci3ke4，ni3men5 quan2fu2 zai4 shu4lin2 zhong4，ning2shen2 shou3hou4。yuan3chu4“huo3keng1” de5 zhi4pu3 wai4qiang2 tou4 chu1 qi2yi4 de5 wen1nuan3 qi4xi1，dan4 ni3 zhi1dao4 li3mian4 you3 shen2me5 zai4 deng3dai4 zhao2 ni3。qi1dai4 gan3 ru2 huo2wu4 ban1 zai4 ni3 fu4 zhong4 fan1teng2。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1yu2，yi1 liang4 huo4che1 shi3li2 yuan4luo4 che1dao4，yan2zhe5 fu3 lu4 wan1yan2 qian2xing2 zhi2zhi4 xiao1shi1 zai4 shi4ye3 jin4tou2。Ge2luo4li2 xiang4 ni3 dian3tou2 shi4yi4，sui2ji2 kai1shi3 xiang4qian2 pan1pa2。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 li2kai1 le5。ci3ke4 zheng4shi4 ni3men5 qian2ru4 nei4bu4 de5 shi2ji1。"

msgid ""
"The drone appears to be broken. All it can seem to do is hover in place."
msgstr ""
"这架​无人机​似乎​坏​了​，​只能​悬停​在​原地​。\n"
"zhe4 jia4 wu2ren2ji1 si4hu1 huai4 le5，zhi3neng2 xuan2ting2 zai4 yuan2di4。"

msgid ""
"The drone hovers in place, ready to take commands. If APEX had anything to "
"add, it must still be rebooting."
msgstr ""
"无人机​悬停​在​原地​，​随时​准备​接受​指令​。​如果​APEX​还有​什么​要​补充​的话​，​它​可能​还​在​重启​中​。\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 xuan2ting2 zai4 yuan2di4，sui2shi2 zhun3bei4 jie1shou4 zhi3ling4。ru2guo3 APEX hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4 bu3chong1 de5hua4，ta1 ke3neng2 hai2 zai4 chong2qi3 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"The drone rotates on its axis to face the window as its minigun ramps up to speed. Within moments, the weapon's spinning barrels are a blur.\n"
"\n"
"With the sound of tearing cloth, the drone sends a stream of lead toward the window. The bullets ricochet away, leaving the glass unblemished."
msgstr ""
"无人机​围绕​自身​轴线​旋转​，​朝向​窗户​，​同时​其​机枪​开始​加速​。​转眼间​，​武器​旋转​的​枪管​已成​一片​模糊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​伴随​着​撕裂​布料​般的​声响​，​无人机​向​窗户​射​出​一串​子弹​。​子弹​四散​弹开​，​玻璃​却​完好无损​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 wei2rao4 zi4shen1 zhou2xian4 xuan2zhuan3，chao2xiang4 chuang1hu5，tong2shi2 qi2 ji1qiang1 kai1shi3 jia1su4。zhuan3yan3jian1，wu3qi4 xuan2zhuan3 de5 qiang1guan3 yi3 cheng2 yi1 pian1 mo2hu5。\n"
"\n"
"ban4sui2 zhao2 si1lie4 bu4liao4 ban1 de5 sheng1xiang3，wu2ren2ji1 xiang4 chuang1hu5 she4 chu1 yi1 chuan4 zi3dan4。zi3dan4 si4san4 dan4 kai1，bo1li5 que4 wan2hao3wu2sun3。"

msgid ""
"The drone sits in a charging cradle, its turbofan unpowered. A cheerful "
"green light blinks on its front panel to remind you that it's still active."
msgstr ""
"无人机​停放​在​充电​底座​上​，​涡扇​发动机​处于​关闭​状态​。​其​前置​面板​上​闪烁着​一盏​绿色​指示灯​，​提醒​你​设备​仍​处于​活跃​状态​。\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 ting2fang4 zai4 chong1dian4 di3zuo4 shang4，wo1shan4 fa1dong4ji1 chu3yu2 guan1bi4 zhuang4tai4。qi2 qian2zhi4 mian4ban3 shang4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 yi1 zhan3 lu:4se4 zhi3 shi4 deng1，ti2xing3 ni3 she4bei4 reng2 chu3yu2 huo2yue4 zhuang4tai4。"

msgid ""
"The drone sits, its green light blinking merrily.\n"
"\n"
"The faint silhouette of whatever it's carrying can be seen through the thin plastic of its cargo container."
msgstr ""
"无人机​静静地​停​在​那里​，​绿色​的​指示灯​愉快​地​闪烁着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​透过​无人机​货舱​那​薄薄的​塑料​隐约​看到​其中​物品​的​轮廓​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 jing4 jing4 de5 ting2 zai4 na4li5，lu:4se4 de5 zhi3 shi4 deng1 yu2kuai4 de5 shan3 shuo4 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 tou4guo4 wu2ren2ji1 huo4cang1 na4 bao2 bao2 de5 su4liao4 yin3yue1 kan4dao4 qi2zhong1 wu4pin3 de5 lun2kuo4。"

msgid ""
"The drones are low-grade, but they're armed, and Danni's hands are empty.\n"
"\n"
"She's in trouble, and she knows it. The futility of her situation is written all over her face."
msgstr ""
"这些​无人机​虽然​性能​低劣​，​但​都​配备​了​武器​，​而丹妮​却​手无寸铁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​深陷​困境​，​而​她​自己​也​清楚​这点​。​她​的​脸上​写满​了​无助​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 wu2ren2ji1 sui1ran2 xing4neng2 di1lie4，dan4 dou1 pei4bei4 le5 wu3qi4，er2 dan1 ni1 que4 shou3wu2cun4tie3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen1xian4 kun4jing4，er2 ta1 zi4ji3 ye3 qing1chu5 zhe4 dian3。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 xie3 man3 le5 wu2zhu4。"

msgid "The drones' weapons begin tracking you."
msgstr ""
"无人机​的​武器​开始​追踪​你​。\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 de5 wu3qi4 kai1shi3 zhui1zong1 ni3。"

msgid ""
"The drug Bliss is pumped into the bloodstream. Incoming DMG reduced by 3 and"
" Strength reduced by 1 for 4 RNDS of combat."
msgstr ""
"极乐​被​注入​到​血液​中​。​降低​1​点​力量​，​减少​3​点​受到​的​伤害​。​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"ji2le4 bei4 zhu4ru4 dao4 xue4ye4 zhong4。jiang4di1 1 dian3 li4liang5，jian3shao3 3 dian3 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"The drug Hyper is pumped into the bloodstream. Accuracy increased by 6%, "
"incoming damage increased by 3 for 3 RNDs of combat."
msgstr ""
"高能​被​注入​血液​中​。​精准度​增加​6​%​，​增加​3​点​受到​的​伤害​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"gao1neng2 bei4 zhu4ru4 xue4ye4 zhong4。jing1 zhun3 du4 zeng1jia1 6 %，zeng1jia1 3 dian3 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"The dwarf nods, then fumbles in his jacket pocket for something. A moment "
"later, he produces a weathered paper map and spreads it on the table."
msgstr ""
"矮人​点点头​，​然后​在​外套​口袋​里​摸索​起来​。​片刻​后​，​他​掏出​一张​破旧​的​纸质​地图​，​摊开​在​桌上​。\n"
"ai3ren2 dian3 dian3 tou2，ran2hou4 zai4 wai4tao4 kou3dai4 li3 mo1suo5 qi3lai5。pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 tao1chu1 yi1 zhang1 po4jiu4 de5 zhi3zhi4 di4tu2，tan1kai1 zai4 zhuo1 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The dwarvish tech vendor smiles at you with practiced ease, her almond eyes "
"twinkling with the glare from a dozen trid screens. She speaks in a clipped,"
" heavily-accented German."
msgstr ""
"矮人​科技​小贩​从容不迫​地​对​你​微笑​，​她​的​杏眼​在​十几个​3D​影像​屏幕​的​强光​下​闪烁​。​她​说​着​一口​咬字清晰​、​口音​浓重​的​德语​。\n"
"ai3ren2 ke1ji4 xiao3fan4 cong2rong2bu4po4 de5 dui4 ni3 wei1xiao4，ta1 de5 xing4yan3 zai4 shi2 ji1 ge4 3D ying3xiang4 ping2mu4 de5 jiang4 guang1 xia4 shan3shuo4。ta1 shuo1 zhao2 yi1kou3 yao3 zi4 qing1 xi1、kou3yin1 nong2zhong4 de5 de2yu3。"

msgid "The elevator panel awaits your selection."
msgstr ""
"电梯​面板​正​等​着​你​的​选择​。\n"
"dian4ti1 mian4ban3 zheng1 deng3 zhao2 ni3 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"The elevator rumbles and clanks its way downward, into the guts of the old Saeder-Krupp development lab. Eighteen years ago, this place - and the project that was being developed here - disappeared from the record books. Thanks to Alice, you are one of the few people alive today who understand why.\n"
"\n"
"Alice was clear about one thing: you are here because APEX wants you to be. If the AI hadn’t wanted her to trace it here, she’d have wound up as dead as Monika. For better or worse, you’re here at APEX's invitation.\n"
"\n"
"The elevator grinds to a halt. The doors slide open, and your nostrils are assaulted by eighteen years’ worth of stale air. APEX - and the kill switch that will deactivate it - await."
msgstr ""
"电梯​轰隆​作响​，​伴着​金属​碰撞​声​向下​坠落​，​深入​老旧​的​赛德​-​克虏伯​研发​实验室​的​腹地​。​十八年​前​，​这个​地方​以及​在​此​研发​的​项目​纷纷​从​所有​记录​中​消失​。​多亏​了​爱丽丝​，​你​是​当今​少数​知晓​缘由​的​人​之一​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​爱丽丝​曾​明确​说​过​：​你​之所以​在​此​，​是因为​APEX​需要​你​。​若非​AI​刻意​引导​她​追踪​至此​，​她​早已​和​莫妮卡​一样​命丧​黄泉​。​无论​好坏​，​你​此刻​的​出现​皆​源于​APEX​的​邀请​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​电梯​吱呀​停住​。​门扉​滑开​，​十八年​积存​的​霉味​扑面而来​。​APEX​，​以及​能​终结​它​的​紧急​开关​，​正于​此​静候​你​的​到来​。\n"
"\n"
"dian4ti1 hong1long1 zuo4 xiang3，ban4 zhao2 jin1shu3 peng4zhuang4 sheng1 xiang4xia4 zhui4luo4，shen1ru4 lao3jiu4 de5 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 yan2fa1 shi2yan4shi4 de5 fu4di4。shi2 ba1 nian2 qian2，zhe4ge5 di4fang1 yi3ji2 zai4 ci3 yan2fa1 de5 xiang4mu4 fen1fen1 cong2 suo3you3 ji4lu4 zhong4 xiao1shi1。duo1kui1 le5 ai4li4si1，ni3 shi4 dang1jin1 shao3shu4 zhi1xiao3 yuan2you2 de5 ren2 zhi1yi1。\n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1 ceng2 ming2que4 shuo1 guo4：ni3 zhi1suo3yi3 zai4 ci3，shi4 yin1 wei2 APEX xu1yao4 ni3。ruo4fei1 AI ke4yi4 yin3dao3 ta1 zhui1zong1 zhi4ci3，ta1 zao3yi3 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 yi1yang4 ming4 sang1 huang2quan2。wu2lun4 hao3huai4，ni3 ci3ke4 de5 chu1xian4 jie1 yuan2yu2 APEX de5 yao1qing3。\n"
"\n"
"dian4ti1 zhi1ya1 ting2zhu4。men2 fei1 hua2 kai1，shi2 ba1 nian2 ji1cun2 de5 mei2 wei4 pu1mian4er2lai2。APEX，yi3ji2 neng2 zhong1jie2 ta1 de5 jin3ji2 kai1guan1，zheng1 yu2 ci3 jing4hou4 ni3 de5 dao4lai2。"

msgid ""
"The elevator whisks you upward, toward the executive-level 25th floor. As expected, the run has been relatively smooth sailing so far. A chime breaks the silence as the elevator glides to a stop. \n"
"\n"
"The MKVI is somewhere on this floor. All that you have to do is find it."
msgstr ""
"电梯​载​着​你​向着​属于​行政​层​的​25​楼​迅速​上升​。​到​目前为止​，​行动​还​算​顺利​，​一切​均​如​你​所料​。​当​电梯​平稳​停住​时​，​一声​清脆​的​提示音​打破​了​寂静​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​MKVI​就​在​这​层楼​的​某个​地方​。​你​所​要​做​的​就是​找到​它​。\n"
"\n"
"dian4ti1 zai3 zhao2 ni3 xiang4zhe5 shu3yu2 xing2zheng4 ceng2 de5 25 lou2 xun4su4 shang4sheng1。dao4 mu4 qian2 wei2 zhi3，xing2dong4 hai2 suan4 shun4li4，yi1qie4 jun1 ru2 ni3 suo3liao4。dang1 dian4ti1 ping2wen3 ting2zhu4 shi2，yi1sheng1 qing1cui4 de5 ti2shi4yin1 da3po4 le5 ji4jing4。\n"
"\n"
"MKVI jiu4 zai4 zhe4 ceng2lou2 de5 mou3 ge4 di4fang1。ni3 suo3 yao4 zuo4 de5 jiu4shi4 zhao3dao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"The elf barks something out at James. The sound is uncharacteristically "
"ugly, all harsh consonants and sibilant hisses."
msgstr ""
"精灵​对​着​詹姆斯​咆哮​着​什么​。​那​声音​异常​难听​，​全是​刺耳​的​辅音​和​嘶​嘶​的​咝​音​。\n"
"jing1ling2 dui4 zhao2 zhan1mu3si1 pao2xiao4 zhao2 shen2me5。na4 sheng1yin1 yi4chang2 nan2ting1，quan2 shi4 ci4er3 de5 fu3yin1 he4 si1 si1 de5 si1 yin1。"

msgid ""
"The elf behind the counter says nothing.\n"
"\n"
"She stands in silence, staring at you."
msgstr ""
"柜台​后​的​精灵​一言不发​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​静静地​凝视着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"gui4tai2 hou4 de5 jing1ling2 yi1yan2bu4fa1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jing4 jing4 de5 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid "The elf blinks uncomprehendingly and takes a half-step back."
msgstr ""
"精灵​眨​眨眼睛​，​一脸茫然​地​后退​半步​。\n"
"jing1ling2 zha3 zha3yan3jing1，yi1lian3mang2ran2 de5 hou4tui4 ban4 bu4。"

msgid ""
"The elf comes up short, staring at you. He sweeps his vision from you to Jana to James.\n"
"\n"
"Then he exhales heavily and spits out a jumble of broken German."
msgstr ""
"精灵​停住​脚步​，​扭头​看向​你​，​然后​又​看​向​简娜​和​詹姆斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​他​重重地​呼​出​一口气​，​吐​出​一串​支离破碎​的​德语​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 ting2zhu4 jiao3bu4，niu3tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，ran2hou4 you4 kan4 xiang4 Jian3na4 he4 zhan1mu3si1。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4 ta1 chong2 chong2 de5 hu1 chu1 yi1kou3qi4，tu3 chu1 yi1 chuan4 zhi1li2po4sui4 de5 de2yu3。"

msgid ""
"The elf from Tir Tairngire turned on us. We had to put him down. But Jana "
"and James are both alive and well."
msgstr ""
"提尔坦盖​的​精灵​背叛​了​我们​，​所以​我们​只得​干掉​了​他​。​但​简娜​和​詹姆斯​都​好好​地​活着​。\n"
"ti2 er3 tan3 gai4 de5 jing1ling2 bei4pan4 le5 wo3men5，suo3yi3 wo3men5 zhi3de2 gan4diao4 le5 ta1。dan4 Jian3na4 he4 zhan1mu3si1 dou1 hao3hao3 de5 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
"The elf from Tir Tairngire turned on us. We had to put him down. James died "
"in the escape, but Jana made it out."
msgstr ""
"提尔坦盖​的​精灵​背叛​了​我们​，​所以​我们​只得​干掉​了​他​。​詹姆斯​在​撤离​过程​中死​了​，​但​简娜​逃​了​出来​。\n"
"ti2 er3 tan3 gai4 de5 jing1ling2 bei4pan4 le5 wo3men5，suo3yi3 wo3men5 zhi3de2 gan4diao4 le5 ta1。zhan1mu3si1 zai4 che4li2 guo4cheng2 zhong4 si3 le5，dan4 Jian3na4 tao2 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"The elf from Tir Tairngire turned on us. We had to put him down. Jana died "
"in the escape, but James made it out."
msgstr ""
"提尔坦盖​的​精灵​背叛​了​我们​，​所以​我们​只得​干掉​了​他​。​简娜​在​撤离​过程​中死​了​，​但​詹姆斯​逃​了​出来​。\n"
"ti2 er3 tan3 gai4 de5 jing1ling2 bei4pan4 le5 wo3men5，suo3yi3 wo3men5 zhi3de2 gan4diao4 le5 ta1。Jian3na4 zai4 che4li2 guo4cheng2 zhong4 si3 le5，dan4 zhan1mu3si1 tao2 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"The elf from Tir Tairngire turned on us. We had to put him down. The others "
"died in the escape."
msgstr ""
"提尔坦盖​的​精灵​背叛​了​我们​，​所以​我们​只得​干掉​了​他​。​其他人​都​在​撤离​过程​中死​了​。\n"
"ti2 er3 tan3 gai4 de5 jing1ling2 bei4pan4 le5 wo3men5，suo3yi3 wo3men5 zhi3de2 gan4diao4 le5 ta1。qi2 ta1 ren2 dou1 zai4 che4li2 guo4cheng2 zhong4 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The elf mutters something under his breath, and hitches the bulky pack up a "
"little higher on his back. His muscles bulge under the strain of it."
msgstr ""
"精灵​低声​嘟囔​着​什么​，​将​沉甸甸​的​背包​往​背上​提了​提​。​沉重​的​背包​使​他​的​肌肉​绷得​鼓鼓的​。\n"
"jing1ling2 di1sheng1 du1nang5 zhao2 shen2me5，jiang1 chen2dian4dian4 de5 bei1bao1 wang3 bei1 shang4 ti2 le5 ti2。chen2zhong4 de5 bei1bao1 shi3 ta1 de5 ji1rou4 beng3 de2 gu3gu3de5。"

msgid ""
"The elf pauses, stroking his beard in quiet contemplation.\n"
"\n"
"The silence stretches for several seconds before he continues."
msgstr ""
"精灵​停顿​了​一下​，​抚着​胡须​陷入​沉思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​沉默​数秒​之后​，​他​才​重新​开口​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，fu3 zhao2 hu2xu1 xian4ru4 chen2si1。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 shu3miao3 zhi1hou4，ta1 cai2 chong2xin1 kai1kou3。"

msgid ""
"The elf says nothing. Unburdened by the heavy pack, he stands up straight, and for the first time you appreciate how much larger he is than the corporate mage.\n"
"\n"
"He stares down at James, and his hands bunch into fists."
msgstr ""
"精灵​一言不发​。​卸下​沉重​行囊​后​，​他​挺直​了​身子​，​你​这​才​注意​到​他​比​那位​公司​法师​高出​许多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​俯视​着​詹姆斯​，​双手​紧握​成拳​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 yi1yan2bu4fa1。xie4xia4 chen2zhong4 xing2nang2 hou4，ta1 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5，ni3 zhe4 cai2 zhu4yi4 dao4 ta1 bi3 na4 wei4 gong1si1 fa3shi1 gao1chu1 xu3duo1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 fu3shi4 zhao2 zhan1mu3si1，shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。"

msgid ""
"The elf steps forward. Gently, he rests his hand on her shoulder.\n"
"\n"
"She raises her head to look up in response."
msgstr ""
"精灵​向前​迈步​。​他​轻轻​将​手​搭​在​她​肩上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​抬起​头用​目光​回应​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 xiang4qian2 mai4bu4。ta1 qing1qing1 jiang1 shou3 da1 zai4 ta1 jian1 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tai2qi3 tou2 yong4 mu4guang1 hui2ying4。"

msgid ""
"The elf studies you, his arms crossed over his broad chest. His expression "
"is neutral."
msgstr ""
"精灵​审视​着​你​，​双臂​抱​在​宽阔​的​胸前​，​神色​平静​。\n"
"jing1ling2 shen3shi4 zhao2 ni3，shuang1bi4 bao4 zai4 kuan1kuo4 de5 xiong1qian2，shen2se4 ping2jing4。"

msgid ""
"The elf's lips curl into a snarl. Hanging from his back is a bulging pack that looks incredibly heavy.\n"
"\n"
"His broad shoulders sag under the weight of whatever's inside."
msgstr ""
"精灵​的​嘴角​绷成​一抹​狰狞​的​弧度​。​他​背上​有个​鼓鼓囊囊​的​背包​，​看起来​相当​沉重​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​宽阔​的​双肩​在​背包​的​重压​下​微微​下垂​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 de5 zui3jiao3 beng3 cheng2 yi1 ma1 zheng1ning2 de5 hu2du4。ta1 bei1 shang4 you3 ge4 gu3gu5nang1nang1 de5 bei1bao1，kan4qi3lai5 xiang1dang1 chen2zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kuan1kuo4 de5 shuang1 jian1 zai4 bei1bao1 de5 zhong4ya1 xia4 wei1wei1 xia4chui2。"

msgid ""
"The emergency lights wink out, leaving you in darkness. A moment later, the building lights flip on, cranked all the way up to full illumination.\n"
"\n"
"The light is uncomfortably bright."
msgstr ""
"应急灯​闪烁​了​下​突然​熄灭​，​四下里​一片​漆黑​。​片刻​之后​，​大楼​的​灯光​骤然​亮​起​，​从上到下​灯火通明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​刺眼​的​亮光​令人​不适​。\n"
"\n"
"ying1 ji2 deng1 shan3shuo4 le5 xia4 tu1ran2 xi1mie4，si4xia4li5 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，da4lou2 de5 deng1guang1 zhou4ran2 liang4 qi3，cong2 shang4 dao4 xia4 deng1huo3tong1ming2。\n"
"\n"
"ci4yan3 de5 liang4guang1 ling4ren2 bu4shi4。"

msgid ""
"The engine's still warm. Colors on the tail clearly mark it as Rammbock "
"property."
msgstr ""
"引擎​尚有余​温​。​车尾​的​颜料​清晰​地​将​它​标记​为​撞锤​帮​的​财产​。\n"
"yin3qing2 shang4 you3 yu2 wen1。che1 wei3 de5 yan2liao4 qing1xi1 de5 jiang1 ta1 biao1ji4 wei2 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 cai2chan3。"

msgid ""
"The enormous machine hovers impassively, its turbofan rotors keeping it "
"silently aloft. A small arsenal of heavy weaponry juts out from the seams of"
" its armor plating."
msgstr ""
"庞然巨​物​静默​悬浮​，​涡轮​风扇​旋翼​无声​地托举​着​它​。​各式各样​的​重型​武器​从​装甲​板​的​接缝处​凸显​出来​。\n"
"pang2 ran2 ju4 wu4 jing4mo4 xuan2fu2，wo1lun2 feng1shan4 xuan2yi4 wu2sheng1 de5 tuo1 ju3 zhao2 ta1。ge4shi4ge4yang4 de5 zhong4xing2 wu3qi4 cong2 zhuang1jia3 ban3 de5 jie1 feng2 chu3 tu1xian3 chu1lai2。"

msgid "The entire container of gas easily pours into the tank."
msgstr ""
"整整​一罐​汽油​被​轻松​倒入​燃料箱​中​。\n"
"zheng3zheng3 yi1 guan4 qi4you2 bei4 qing1song1 dao3 ru4 ran2 liao4 xiang1 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"The entire facility is under full alert, $(l.name). I'm afraid that the High Threat Response Team is already en route to your location.\n"
"\n"
"I have uploaded my best estimate of their ETA to your PDA. Good luck to you and your team... you're going to need it."
msgstr ""
"这所​设施​已经​处在​高度​戒备状态​了​，​$(l.name)​。​恐怕​那支​高危​应急​小组​已经​朝​你​的​位置​动身​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已​将​对​他们​预计​到达​时间​的​最佳​推测​上​传到​了​你​的​PDA​。​祝​你​和​你​的​团队​好运​……​前头​会​有​一场​硬仗​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 suo3 she4shi1 yi3jing1 chu3zai4 gao1du4 jie4 bei4 zhuang4 tai4 le5，$(l.name)。kong3pa4 na4 zhi1 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3 yi3jing1 chao2 ni3 de5 wei4zhi5 dong4shen1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3 jiang1 dui4 ta1men5 yu4ji4 dao4da2 shi2jian1 de5 zui4jia1 tui1ce4 shang4 chuan2 dao4 le5 ni3 de5 PDA。zhu4 ni3 he4 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 hao3yun4……qian2tou5 hui4 you3 yi1 chang2 ying4zhang4。"

msgid ""
"The entry is missing a conclusion, so it's anyone's guess as to whether the "
"studies proved successful or not."
msgstr ""
"该​条目​缺少​结论​部分​，​因此​无法​确定​这些​研究​是否​取得​了​成功​。\n"
"gai1 tiao2mu4 que1shao3 jie2lun4 bu4fen5，yin1ci3 wu2fa3 que4ding4 zhe4xie1 yan2jiu1 shi4fou3 qu3de2 le5 cheng2gong1。"

msgid ""
"The estate grounds are silent, save for the faint whistling of the wind. Your team gathers near a side entrance to the old castle holdfast, cloaked in darkness.\n"
"\n"
"The night is peaceful."
msgstr ""
"庄园​庭院​里​一片​寂静​，​只有​微风吹拂​的​声响​。​在​夜色​笼罩​下​，​你​的​小队​在​通往​城堡​内院​的​侧门​集合​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​个​宁静​的​夜晚​。\n"
"\n"
"zhuang1yuan2 ting2yuan4 li3 yi1 pian1 ji4jing4，zhi3you3 wei1 feng1 chui1 fu2 de5 sheng1xiang3。zai4 ye4se4 long3zhao4 xia4，ni3 de5 xiao3 dui4 zai4 tong1wang3 cheng2bao3 nei4yuan4 de5 ce4men2 ji2he2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4 ning2jing4 de5 ye4wan3。"

msgid "The estate was just a front for whatever was going on in the basement."
msgstr ""
"那栋​宅子​只是​个​幌子​，​为了​掩盖​地下室​里​进行​的​勾当​。\n"
"na4 dong4 zhai2zi5 zhi3shi4 ge4 huang3zi5，wei4le5 yan3gai4 di4xia4shi4 li3 jin4xing2 de5 gou4dang4。"

msgid "The evidence would argue otherwise."
msgstr ""
"但​事实​看起来​并非如此​啊​。\n"
"dan4 shi4shi2 kan4qi3lai5 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3 a1。"

msgid ""
"The executive jerks back as though you slapped him. His face has gone as "
"white as a sheet."
msgstr ""
"那位​高管​猛地​向​后退​去​，​仿佛​被​你​扇​了​一巴掌​。​他​的​脸色​变得​苍白​如纸​。\n"
"na4 wei4 gao1guan3 meng3de5 xiang4 hou4tui4 qu4，fang3fu2 bei4 ni3 shan1 le5 yi1 ba1 zhang3。ta1 de5 lian3se4 bian4de5 cang1bai2 ru2 zhi3。"

msgid ""
"The face on the screen shifts and flows.\n"
"\n"
"A moment later, something cold and mechanical fills your vision."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​的​脸​开始​变化​和​流动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​某种​冰冷​而​机械​的​东西​充斥​在​你​的​视野​中​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 de5 lian3 kai1shi3 bian4hua4 he4 liu2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，mou3zhong3 bing1leng3 er2 ji1xie4 de5 dong1xi1 chong1chi4 zai4 ni3 de5 shi4ye3 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"The facility is locked down, you see. Nearly impenetrable. And I have no idea why.\n"
"\n"
"As I was packing to move to Berlin, all was well. Sixteen hours later, I arrived to discover the building locked tight, with my merchandise inside."
msgstr ""
"这处​设施​被​封锁​了​。​几乎​密不透风​。​我​也​不​知道​为什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​收拾​行李​准备​搬​到​柏林​时​，​一切​都​很​顺利​。​16​个​小时​后​，​我​来到​这里​，​发现​大楼​紧锁​，​而​我​要​的​商品​都​在​里面​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 chu3 she4shi1 bei4 feng1suo3 le5。ji1hu1 mi4bu4tou4feng1。wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 wei4shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 shou1shi5 xing2li5 zhun3bei4 ban1 dao4 bo2lin2 shi2，yi1qie4 dou1 hen3 shun4li4。16 ge4 xiao3shi2 hou4，wo3 lai2dao4 zhe4li3，fa1xian4 da4lou2 jin3 suo3，er2 wo3 yao4 de5 shang1pin3 dou1 zai4 li3mian4。"

msgid ""
"The facility is patrolled by Aztechnology's internal security personnel. On "
"their own, they would pose a challenge, but I don't doubt that you could "
"brute-force your way through them."
msgstr ""
"该​设施​由​阿兹特​科技​的​内部​安保​人员​巡逻​。​单凭​他们​而言​，​也​算​有​一定​威胁​，​但​我​毫不​怀疑​你​能​强行​突破​他们​的​防线​。\n"
"gai1 she4shi1 you2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 nei4bu4 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 xun2luo2。dan1 ping2 ta1men5 er2yan2，ye3 suan4 you3 yi1ding4 wei1xie2，dan4 wo3 hao2bu4 huai2yi2 ni3 neng2 qiang2xing2 tu1po4 ta1men5 de5 fang2xian4。"

msgid ""
"The facility is powered by a number of on-site generators. There are safeguards in place to prevent them from overloading; in the event of a power spike, the system is designed to shut itself down.\n"
"\n"
"But I know how you can disable those safeguards."
msgstr ""
"该​设施​大楼​由​多台​内置​发电机​供电​。​公司​设置​了​安全​防护​措施​防止​其​过载​；​若​发生​电力​突增​，​系统​就​会​自动​关闭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​清楚​如何​禁用​这些​安全​防护​措施​。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 she4shi1 da4lou2 you2 duo1 tai2 nei4zhi4 fa1dian4ji1 gong1dian4。gong1si1 she4zhi4 le5 an1quan2 fang2hu4 cuo4shi1 fang2zhi3 qi2 guo4zai4 ； ruo4 fa1sheng1 dian4li4 tu1 zeng1，xi4tong3 jiu4 hui4 zi4dong4 guan1bi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 qing1chu5 ru2he2 jin1yong4 zhe4xie1 an1quan2 fang2hu4 cuo4shi1。"

msgid ""
"The facility's already on high alert, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"It's a little late for disguises, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"这所​设施​已经​处于​高度​戒备状态​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​才​开始​伪装​，​是不是​有点​太迟​了​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 suo3 she4shi1 yi3jing1 chu3yu2 gao1du4 jie4 bei4 zhuang4 tai4 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 cai2 kai1shi3 wei3zhuang1，shi4bu5shi4 you3dian3 tai4 chi2 le5？"

msgid ""
"The fact of the matter is, you steered *yourself* into this mess. Stop "
"trying to lay blame and take a look at your own actions."
msgstr ""
"事实​是​，​你​把​*​自己​*​引入​了​这​一片狼藉​之中​。​别​再​试图​怪罪​别人​了​，​还是​好好​反思​你​自己​的​行为​吧​。\n"
"shi4shi2 shi4，ni3 ba3*zi4ji3*yin3ru4 le5 zhe4 yi1 pian1 lang2 jie4 zhi1zhong1。bie4 zai4 shi4tu2 guai4zui4 bie2ren5 le5，hai2shi5 hao3hao3 fan3si1 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 xing2wei2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"The fact that you live in Berlin but hold the Adversary in contempt proves "
"one of two things: either you're ignorant, or you're a hypocrite."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​住​在​柏林​，​却​又​轻蔑​地​对待​反叛者​，​这​只能​说明​，​要么​你​愚昧无知​，​要么​你​虚伪​做作​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 zhu4 zai4 bo2lin2，que4 you4 qing1mie4 de5 dui4dai4 fan3 pan4 zhe3，zhe4 zhi3neng2 shuo1ming2，yao4me5 ni3 yu2mei4wu2zhi1，yao4me5 ni3 xu1wei3 zuo4zuo5。"

msgid "The fall? What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"陨落​？​你​在​说​什么​？\n"
"yun3luo4？ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"The feeling is becoming more and more mutual by the second.\n"
"\n"
"All right. Forget about it. The job is off the table. So do you want something else, or are you leaving?"
msgstr ""
"我​每分​每秒​都​在​有​同感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​那就算了​，​当​我​没​说​。​所以​你​还​有事吗​，​还是​说​你​要​走​了​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei3 fen4 mei3 miao3 dou1 zai4 you3 tong2gan3。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，na4 jiu4 suan4 le5，dang1 wo3 mei2 shuo1。suo3yi3 ni3 hai2 you3 shi4 ma5，hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 yao4 zou3 le5？"

msgid "The feeling's mutual."
msgstr ""
"彼此彼此​吧​。\n"
"bi3ci3bi3ci3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"The figure at the center of the group shoots you an insolent glance. \n"
"\n"
"His fine elvish features match Samuel's descripton: this must be Maxim, your smuggler liaison."
msgstr ""
"人群​正中​的​那个​家伙​不屑​地​看​向​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​俊美​的​精灵​面容​符合​塞缪尔​的​描述​：​那​人​肯定​是​马克西姆​，​你​在​走私​贩子​中​的​联络人​。\n"
"\n"
"ren2qun2 zheng4zhong1 de5 na4ge5 jia1huo5 bu4xie4 de5 kan4 xiang4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"jun4mei3 de5 jing1ling2 mian4rong2 fu2he2 sai4miu4er3 de5 miao2shu4：na4 ren2 ken3ding4 shi4 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3，ni3 zai4 zou3si1 fan4zi5 zhong4 de5 lian2luo4ren2。"

msgid ""
"The figure is unmistakable: it’s Vauclair, twenty years older and worse for "
"wear. His skin hangs loose on his bones and his cheeks are hollow. There is "
"a distinctly gray pallor to his skin."
msgstr ""
"你​不​可能​认错​：​此人​正是​沃​克莱尔​。​他​老​了​二十岁​，​面容​饱经风霜​。​他​双颊​凹陷​，​灰白​的​皮肤​松垮​地​搭​在​骨架​上​。\n"
"ni3 bu4 ke3neng2 ren4cuo4：ci3 ren2 zheng4shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。ta1 lao3 le5 er4 shi2 sui4，mian4rong2 bao3jing1feng1shuang1。ta1 shuang1 jia2 ao1xian4，hui1bai2 de5 pi2fu1 song1kua3 de5 da1 zai4 gu3jia4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The figure loping toward you is big, even for an ork. The majority of his body is sheathed in a suit of heavy, overlapping plates.\n"
"\n"
"What you can see of his face looks raw and slick, like old scar tissue stretched tight over his skull. He wears an expression of supreme confidence."
msgstr ""
"朝​你们​大步​逼近​的​这​家伙​在​兽​人里​也​算​得​上​壮硕​。​他​的​大半个​身体​都​包裹​在​一套​厚重​的​多层​装甲​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看到​他​脸上​露出​来​的​部分​粗糙​而​油亮​，​宛如​紧绷​在​颅骨​上​的​陈旧​疤痕​组织​。​他​脸上​带​着​一种​极度​傲慢​的​神色​。\n"
"\n"
"chao2 ni3men5 da4bu4 bi1jin4 de5 zhe4 jia1huo5 zai4 shou4 ren2 li3 ye3 suan4 de2 shang4 zhuang4shuo4。ta1 de5 dai4 ban4 ge4 shen1ti3 dou1 bao1guo3 zai4 yi1tao4 hou4zhong4 de5 duo1ceng2 zhuang1jia3 li3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 lai2 de5 bu4fen5 cu1cao1 er2 you2liang4，wan3ru2 jin3beng1 zai4 lu2gu3 shang4 de5 chen2jiu4 ba1hen2 zu3zhi1。ta1 lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 yi1zhong3 ji2du4 ao4man4 de5 shen2se4。"

msgid ""
"The figure stands completely still, but its eyeless head fidgets in agitation. Something about it reminds you of a snake tasting the air.\n"
"\n"
"Off to one side, the screen of a control console glows cheerfully in the gloom."
msgstr ""
"那​身影​一动不动​，​但​它​那​没有​眼睛​的​头颅​却​焦躁​地​转动​着​。​它​的​模样​让​你​想起​一条​在​空气​中​嗅​探​的​蛇​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一旁​，​控制台​的​屏幕​在​昏暗​中​欢快​地​闪烁着​微光​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shen1ying3 yi1dong4bu4dong4，dan4 ta1 na4 mei2you3 yan3jing5 de5 tou2lu2 que4 jiao1zao4 de5 zhuan3dong4 zhao2。ta1 de5 mu2yang4 rang4 ni3 xiang3qi3 yi1 tiao2 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4 xiu4 tan4 de5 she2。\n"
"\n"
"yi1pang2，kong4zhi4tai2 de5 ping2mu4 zai4 hun1an4 zhong4 huan1kuai4 de5 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 wei1guang1。"

msgid ""
"The file blips out of existence, taking somebody's \"insurance\" - and your chances at easy money - with it.\n"
"\n"
"Frau Brune's reputation is safe. There's nothing more here to see."
msgstr ""
"文件​倏然​消失​，​连同​某人​的​“​保险​”​—​—​以及​你​轻松​获利​的​希望​—​—​一同​烟消云散​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​布鲁恩​女士​的​声誉​得以​保全​。​这里​没有​其他​值得​感兴趣​的​东西​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wen2jian4 shu1ran2 xiao1shi1，lian2tong2 mou3ren2 de5“bao3xian3”——yi3ji2 ni3 qing1song1 huo4li4 de5 xi1wang4——yi1tong2 yan1xiao1yun2san4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 lu3 en1 nu:3shi4 de5 sheng1yu4 de2yi3 bao3quan2。zhe4li3 mei2you3 qi2ta1 zhi2de5 gan3xing4qu4 de5 dong1xi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The file, labeled \"INSURANCE,\" depicts a middle-aged woman engaged in "
"vigorous sexual activity with a heavily tattooed elf some twenty years her "
"junior. You recognize the woman as Gertrude Brune, the very respectable - "
"and very married - COO of Müller-Schlüter Infotech."
msgstr ""
"名为​“​保险​”​的​文件​中​，​一名​中年​女性​正​与​比​她​年轻​二十余岁​的​满身​刺青​的​精灵​颠鸾倒凤​。​你​认出​这位​女性​正是​格特鲁德​·​布鲁恩​—​—​穆勒​-​施吕特​信息技术​公司​那位​举止端庄​、​婚姻​美满​的​首席​运营官​。\n"
"ming2wei2“bao3xian3” de5 wen2jian4 zhong4，yi1 ming2 zhong1nian2 nu:3xing4 zheng1 yu4 bi3 ta1 nian2qing1 er4 shi2 yu2 sui4 de5 man3shen1 ci4qing1 de5 jing1ling2 dian1luan2dao3feng4。ni3 ren4chu1 zhe4wei4 nu:3xing4 zheng4shi4 ge2 te4 lu3 de2 · bu4 lu3 en1——mu4 lei1 -shi1 lu:3 te4 xin4xi1ji4shu4 gong1si1 na4 wei4 ju3 zhi3 duan1 zhuang1、hun1yin1 mei3man3 de5 shou3xi2 yun4 ying2 guan1。"

msgid ""
"The filing cabinets have all been labeled in neat block printing, by hand. "
"They're all locked."
msgstr ""
"档案柜​都​用​整齐​的​手写​上去​的​木刻​板​印刷体​标记​好​了​。​它们​全都​被​锁上​了​。\n"
"dang4 an4 ju3 dou1 yong4 zheng3qi2 de5 shou3xie3 shang4qu4 de5 mu4ke4 ban3 yin4shua1ti3 biao1ji4 hao3 le5。ta1men5 quan2dou1 bei4 suo3shang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The final pages of the manifesto devolve into semi-cohesive rants about anarchy, social Darwinism, free love, and the Horned God.\n"
"\n"
"You've seen this kind of thing before: Harrow's \"philosophy\" is collapsing under its own weight. Unfortunately, none of his cultists seem to have caught on to that fact."
msgstr ""
"宣言​的​最后​几页​变成​了​关于​无政府主义​、​社会​达尔文主义​、​自由恋爱​和​角神​等​主题​的​支离破碎​的​狂言​乱语​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​见惯​了​这类​情况​：​哈罗​的​“​哲学​”​正因​自身​矛盾​而​分崩离析​。​可惜​他​的​信徒​们​似乎​无人​察觉到​这个​事实​。\n"
"\n"
"xuan1yan2 de5 zui4hou4 ji1 xie2 bian4cheng2 le5 guan1yu2 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4、she4hui4 da2er3wen2zhu3yi4、zi4 you2 lian4 ai4 he4 jiao3 shen2 deng3 zhu3ti2 de5 zhi1li2po4sui4 de5 kuang2yan2 luan4 yu3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jian4 guan4 le5 zhe4lei4 qing2kuang4：ha1luo2 de5“zhe2xue2” zheng1 yin1 zi4shen1 mao2dun4 er2 fen1beng1li2xi1。ke3xi1 ta1 de5 xin4tu2 men5 si4hu1 wu2ren2 cha2 jiao4 dao4 zhe4ge5 shi4shi2。"

msgid ""
"The final pages of the manifesto devolve into semicohesive rants about anarchy, social Darwinism, free love, and the Horned God.\n"
"\n"
"You've seen this kind of thing before: Harrow's \"philosophy\" is collapsing under its own weight. Unfortunately, none of his cultists seem to have caught on to that fact."
msgstr ""
"宣言​的​最后​几页​变成​了​关于​无政府主义​、​社会​达尔文主义​、​自由​之爱​和​角神​的​半​连贯​的​咆哮​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​以前​见过​这种​东西​：​哈罗​的​“​哲学​”​正在​自己​的​重压​下​崩溃​。​不幸​的​是​，​他​的​崇拜者​们​似乎​都​没有​意识​到​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"xuan1yan2 de5 zui4hou4 ji1 xie2 bian4cheng2 le5 guan1yu2 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4、she4hui4 da2er3wen2zhu3yi4、zi4you2 zhi1 ai4 he4 jiao3 shen2 de5 ban4 lian2guan4 de5 pao2xiao4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3qian2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 dong1xi1：ha1luo2 de5“zhe2xue2” zheng4zai4 zi4ji3 de5 zhong4ya1 xia4 beng1kui4。bu4xing4 de5 shi4，ta1 de5 chong2bai4zhe3 men5 si4hu1 dou1 mei2you3 yi4shi2 dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"The first deck made for shadowrunners. Simple, street ready, and nearly "
"indestructible."
msgstr ""
"首款​为​狂奔​者​量身​打造​的​碟​板​。​简单​朴素​、​适合​街头​生活​，​而且​坚固耐用​。\n"
"shou3kuan3 wei2 kuang2Ben1zhe3 liang2shen1 da3zao4 de5 die2 ban3。jian3dan1 pu3su4、shi4he2 jie1tou2 sheng1huo2，er2qie3 jian1 gu4 nai4 yong4。"

msgid ""
"The first thing that hits you is the smell. The meat in here is beyond rancid; white mold frosts the sides of the bin, and it's all that you can do to keep from gagging.\n"
"\n"
"As you rush to put the lid back on, you recognize a familiar shape in the rotten meat: a mangled human hand."
msgstr ""
"首先​扑面而来​的​是​刺鼻​的​气味​。​这里​的​肉​早已​腐烂​发臭​，​白色​霉斑​在​箱​壁上​结成​霜花​，​你​竭力​才​没​被​呕吐​感​淹没​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​慌忙​合​上​盖子​时​，​才​意识​到​那​堆​腐烂​的​肉块​中​有​某种​熟悉​的​形状​：​一只​扭曲​的​人手​。\n"
"\n"
"shou3xian1 pu1mian4er2lai2 de5 shi4 ci4bi2 de5 qi4wei4。zhe4li3 de5 rou4 zao3yi3 fu3lan4 fa1chou4，bai2se4 mei2 ban1 zai4 xiang1 bi4 shang4 jie2cheng2 shuang1hua1，ni3 jie2li4 cai2 mei2 bei4 ou3tu4 gan3 yan1mo4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 huang1mang2 ge3 shang4 gai4zi5 shi2，cai2 yi4shi2 dao4 na4 dui1 fu3lan4 de5 rou4 kuai4 zhong4 you3 mou3zhong3 shu2xi1 de5 xing2zhuang4：yi1 zhi3 niu3qu1 de5 ren2shou3。"

msgid ""
"The first thing you'll need to do is get up to speed. I have terminals... information terminals throughout the lab.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He taps at his console with a frail hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There, I've unlocked them for you."
msgstr ""
"首先​你​需要​了解​最新​情况​。​实验室​各处​都​设有​终端​……​信息​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​瘦弱​的​手指​轻敲​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​我​已​为​你​解锁​这些​终端​。\n"
"\n"
"shou3xian1 ni3 xu1yao4 liao3jie3 zui4xin1 qing2kuang4。shi2yan4shi4 ge4chu4 dou1 she4you3 zhong1duan1……xin4xi1 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 shou4ruo4 de5 shou3zhi3 qing1 qiao1 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3 yi3 wei2 ni3 jie3suo3 zhe4xie1 zhong1duan1。"

msgid ""
"The first thing you'll need to do is get up to speed. I have terminals... information terminals throughout the lab. With our Matrix hard line severed, gathering information has been difficult, but we have done what we can.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He taps at his console with a frail hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There, I've unlocked them for you."
msgstr ""
"首先​你​需要​了解​最新​情况​。​实验室​各处​都​设有​终端​……​信息​终端​。​自从​矩阵​硬​传输​被​切断​后​，​收集​情报​变得​困难重重​，​但​我们​已​竭尽所能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​瘦弱​的​手指​轻敲​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​我​已​为​你​解锁​这些​终端​。\n"
"\n"
"shou3xian1 ni3 xu1yao4 liao3jie3 zui4xin1 qing2kuang4。shi2yan4shi4 ge4chu4 dou1 she4you3 zhong1duan1……xin4xi1 zhong1duan1。zi4cong2 ju3zhen4 ying4 chuan2shu1 bei4 qie1duan4 hou4，shou1ji2 qing2bao4 bian4de5 kun4 nan2 chong2 chong2，dan4 wo3men5 yi3 jie2 jin3 suo3 neng2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 shou4ruo4 de5 shou3zhi3 qing1 qiao1 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3 yi3 wei2 ni3 jie3suo3 zhe4xie1 zhong1duan1。"

msgid ""
"The floor at this end of the room is beginning to cave in. A trickle of light spills up through the cracks in the floorboards from another room below. \n"
"\n"
"With a little force, you could probably open a hole big enough to drop down to the second floor from here."
msgstr ""
"房间​角落里​的​地板​已经​开始​塌陷​。​一缕​光​透过​地板​的​缝隙​，​从​楼下​的​房间​里​投射​进来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​稍微​使点​劲​，​你​应该​就​能​砸​出​一个​够​大​的​洞​，​足够​你们​从​这里​下​到​二层​去​。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 jiao3 la4 li3 de5 di4ban3 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 ta1xian4。yi1 lu:3 guang1 tou4guo4 di4ban3 de5 feng4xi4，cong2 lou2xia4 de5 fang2jian1 li3 tou2she4 jin4lai2。\n"
"\n"
"shao1wei1 shi3 dian3 jin4，ni3 ying1gai1 jiu4 neng2 za2 chu1 yi1ge5 gou4 dai4 de5 dong4，zu2gou4 ni3men5 cong2 zhe4li3 xia4 dao4 er4 ceng2 qu4。"

msgid ""
"The floor manager, Frank, had a thing for my girl Sara. He was always comin' onto her, no matter how many times she told him no.\n"
"\n"
"I haven't seen her since the takeover, but he won't stop asking me about her. Guy's a real creep."
msgstr ""
"那个​楼层​经理​，​弗兰克​，​对​我​朋友​莎拉​有点​意思​。​不管​她​把​他​轰走​多少​次​，​他​还是​老去​撩​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​换人​管​以后​我​都​没见​着​她​，​他​还​非得​问​我​。​真​讨厌​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 lou2ceng2 jing1li3，fu2lan2ke4，dui4 wo3 peng2you5 sha1la1 you3dian3 yi4si5。bu4guan3 ta1 ba3 ta1 hong1zou3 duo1shao3 ci4，ta1 hai2shi5 lao3qu4 liao1 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 huan4ren2 guan3 yi3hou4 wo3 dou1 mei2 jian4 zhao2 ta1，ta1 hai2 fei1dei3 wen4 wo3。zhen1 tao3yan4。"

msgid ""
"The folder is empty except for a single note.\n"
"\n"
"\"Moved to digital archive, and locked under executive authorization.\""
msgstr ""
"文件袋​是​空​的​，​里面​只有​一张​便条​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​已​上传​至​电子​文库​，​查阅​需要​主管​许可​。​”\n"
"\n"
"wen2 jian4 dai4 shi4 kong1 de5，li3mian4 zhi3you3 yi1 zhang1 bian4tiao2。\n"
"\n"
"“yi3 shang4chuan2 zhi4 dian4zi3 wen2ku4，cha2yue4 xu1yao4 zhu3guan3 xu3ke3。”"

msgid "The forever task can continue."
msgstr ""
"永恒​的​使命​可以​继续​。\n"
"yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4 ke3yi3 ji4xu4。"

msgid "The forever task?"
msgstr ""
"永恒​的​使命​？\n"
"yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4？"

msgid ""
"The forklift's tires are flat. Looks like it hasn't been used in years."
msgstr ""
"叉车​的​轮胎​都​瘪​了​。​看起来​已经​被​弃用​好几年​了​。\n"
"cha1che1 de5 lun2tai1 dou1 bie3 le5。kan4qi3lai5 yi3jing1 bei4 qi4yong4 hao3ji3nian2 le5。"

msgid ""
"The fresh-air of the Kreuzbasar is a welcome relief after your time in the sewers. A cool breeze drifts across the street, carrying with it the smells of food being prepared, cheap alcohol being poured, and fires being lit against the cold.\n"
"\n"
"The stench of the sewers, however, still lingers in your nose, a bad olfactory aftertaste. At least the pumps are working again - sewage overflowing into the streets would certainly smell far worse."
msgstr ""
"长时间​待​在​下水道​后​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​清新​空气​让​你​倍感​舒畅​。​一阵​凉爽​的​清风​吹过​街道​，​你​从中​闻到​了​锅​中​烹饪​的​食物​、​倾倒​在​杯中​廉价​酒水​，​以及​人们​为​抵御​寒冷​而生​起​的​篝火​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然而​，​下水道​的​恶臭​仍​萦绕在​你​的​鼻腔​中​，​留下​令人​不快​的​余味​。​好​在​水泵​又​开始运转​了​—​—​要是​污水​外溢​到​街上​，​气味​肯定​只会​更糟​。\n"
"\n"
"zhang3 shi2 jian1 dai1 zai4 xia4shui3dao4 hou4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 qing1xin1 kong1qi4 rang4 ni3 bei4gan3 shu1chang4。yi1zhen4 liang2shuang3 de5 qing1feng1 chui1 guo4 jie1dao4，ni3 cong2zhong1 wen2dao4 le5 guo1 zhong4 peng1ren4 de5 shi2wu4、qing1dao3 zai4 bei1 zhong4 lian2jia4 jiu3shui3，yi3ji2 ren2men5 wei2 di3yu4 han2leng3 er2 sheng1 qi3 de5 gou1huo3。\n"
"\n"
"ran2er2，xia4shui3dao4 de5 e4chou4 reng2 ying2 rao4 zai4 ni3 de5 bi2qiang1 zhong4，liu2xia4 ling4ren2 bu4kuai4 de5 yu2wei4。hao3 zai4 shui3beng4 you4 kai1 shi3 yun4 zhuai3 le5——yao4shi5 wu1shui3 wai4yi4 dao4 jie1shang5，qi4wei4 ken3ding4 zhi3 hui4 geng1 zao1。"

msgid ""
"The funds disappear from your account. Moments later, a message pops up on the screen:\n"
"\n"
"TRANSFER COMPLETE.\n"
"\n"
"Sitting in its dock on the keyboard, a green LED blooms to life on Alice's credstick. The trigger has been pulled. The Rabbit Hole awaits."
msgstr ""
"钱​从​你​的​账户​中​消失​。​不​出​片刻​，​屏幕​上弹​出​一条​消息​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​转账​完成​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​爱丽丝​的​信用​棒​被​插​在​键盘​上​，​一枚​绿色​LED​灯亮​起​。​开弓​没有​回头​箭​。​兔子​洞正​静候​你​的​到来​。\n"
"\n"
"qian2 cong2 ni3 de5 zhang4hu4 zhong4 xiao1shi1。bu4 chu1 pian4ke4，ping2mu4 shang4 dan4 chu1 yi1 tiao2 xiao1xi5：\n"
"\n"
"zhuan3zhang4 wan2cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 bei4 cha1 zai4 jian4pan2 shang4，yi1 mei2 lu:4se4 LED deng1 liang4 qi3。kai1gong1 mei2you3 hui2tou2 jian4。tu4zi5 dong4 zheng1 jing4hou4 ni3 de5 dao4lai2。"

msgid ""
"The gang that used to run this place, now THEY were classy. \n"
"\n"
"They had this awesome stuff... it was like, if cram and novacoke had a baby, that's what it would have been. It was DREAMY."
msgstr ""
"之前​管​这个​地方​的​帮派​，​他们​才​有品​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​有种​特别​爽​的​货​……​这么​说​吧​，​那​东西​就​跟​“​超感​”​和​“​新星​可乐​”​生​的​小孩​似的​。​嗑​起来​感觉​都​要​上天​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi1qian2 guan3 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 de5 bang1pai4，ta1men5 cai2 you3 pin3 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 you3zhong3 te4bie2 shuang3 de5 huo4……zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，na4 dong1xi1 jiu4 gen1“chao1 gan3” he4“xin1xing1 ke3le4” sheng1 de5 xiao3hai2 shi4de5。ke4 qi3lai5 gan3jue2 dou1 yao4 shang4tian1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The garbage pile was concealing a small HVAC vent. The steam that pours from it smells much cleaner now that it isn't being filtered through a heap of filth.\n"
"\n"
"A dwarf might be able to fit inside the vent, but nothing larger."
msgstr ""
"垃圾堆​掩盖着​一个​小型​空调​通风口​。​现在​从中​冒出​的​蒸汽​不再​经过​那堆​污秽​的​过滤​，​气味​也​清新​了​许多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​矮人​也许​能​挤进​通风口​，​但​更​大​的​东西​就​不行​了​。\n"
"\n"
"la1ji1dui1 yan3 gai4 zhao2 yi1ge5 xiao3xing2 kong1tiao2 tong1feng1kou3。xian4zai4 cong2zhong1 mao4 chu1 de5 zheng1qi4 bu4zai4 jing1guo4 na4 dui1 wu1hui4 de5 guo4lu:4，qi4wei4 ye3 qing1xin1 le5 xu3duo1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 ai3ren2 ye3xu3 neng2 ji3jin4 tong1feng1kou3，dan4 geng1 dai4 de5 dong1xi1 jiu4 bu4xing2 le5。"

msgid "The gas is quickly sucked into the vent."
msgstr ""
"气体​被​迅速​吸入​了​进风口​。\n"
"qi4ti3 bei4 xun4su4 xi1ru4 le5 jin4 feng1 kou3。"

msgid "The gates... they've finally opened?!"
msgstr ""
"那些​门​……​它们​终于​打开​了​？​！\n"
"na4xie1 men2……ta1men5 zhong1yu2 da3kai1 le5？！"

msgid "The gaunt woman begins pacing her cell, up and back, up and back."
msgstr ""
"消瘦​的​女人​开始​在​牢房​里​来回​踱步​。\n"
"xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 kai1shi3 zai4 lao2fang2 li3 lai2hui2 duo2bu4。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman breathes a ragged breath. Releases it slowly. When she "
"speaks again, her voice is flat."
msgstr ""
"消瘦​的​女人​喘​着​粗气​，​再​慢慢​呼​出​。​当​她​再次​开口​时​，​声音​变得​平和​。\n"
"xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 chuan3 zhao2 cu1 qi4，zai4 man4man4 hu1 chu1。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 bian4de5 ping2he2。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman breathes in panting gasps, her eyes darting from side to side, confusion on her face. As you watch, the confusion is slowly replaced with recognition, and the woman flies into a rage.\n"
"\n"
"She swings her head from side to side, her hair whipping back and forth, her mouth open wide in a muted wail."
msgstr ""
"消瘦​的​女人​喘​着​粗气​，​眼睛​左右​乱​瞟​，​脸上​满是​困惑​。​你​看着​她​，​直到​她​的​困惑​逐渐​被​明晰​取代​，​并​随即​暴跳如雷​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​左右​摇晃​着​头​，​头发​随风飘​动​，​嘴巴​张得​大大的​，​发出​低沉​的​呻吟声​。\n"
"\n"
"xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 chuan3 zhao2 cu1 qi4，yan3jing5 zuo3you4 luan4 piao3，lian3 shang4 man3 shi4 kun4huo4。ni3 kan4 zhao2 ta1，zhi2dao4 ta1 de5 kun4huo4 zhu2jian4 bei4 ming2xi1 qu3dai4，bing4 sui2ji2 bao4tiao4ru2lei2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zuo3you4 yao2huang4 zhao2 tou2，tou2fa5 sui2 feng1 piao1 dong4，zui3ba5 zhang1 de2 dai4 dai4 de5，fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 shen1 yin2 sheng1。"

msgid "The gaunt woman continues pacing her cell."
msgstr ""
"消瘦​的​女人​继续​在​牢房​里​来回​踱步​。\n"
"xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 ji4xu4 zai4 lao2fang2 li3 lai2hui2 duo2bu4。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman covers her mouth with her hand, a look of horror in her "
"eyes."
msgstr ""
"消瘦​的​女人​用手​捂住​嘴巴​，​眼中​满是​惊恐​。\n"
"xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 yong4 shou3 wu3zhu4 zui3ba5，yan3zhong1 man3 shi4 jing1kong3。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman drops to her knees, her face reflecting a series of emotions"
" - surprise, relief, appreciation, and finally, peace."
msgstr ""
"消瘦​的​女人​跪倒​在​地​，​她​的​脸上​流露出​种种​情绪​—​—​惊讶​、​解脱​、​感激​，​最后​是​平静​。\n"
"xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 gui4dao3 zai4 de5，ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 liu2 lou4 chu1 zhong3zhong3 qing2xu4——jing1ya4、jie3tuo1、gan3ji1，zui4hou4 shi4 ping2jing4。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman in the containment cell stands rigidly, her face pressed against the glass, her haunted yellow eyes tracking your every move. \n"
"\n"
"She appears frightened, disoriented. Lost. Her mouth moves silently, her voice muted by her glass cage."
msgstr ""
"隔离室​里​的​消瘦​女人​笔直​地站​着​，​脸贴​在​玻璃​上​，​她​充满​恐惧​的​黄色​眼睛​紧盯​着​你​的​每​一个​动作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​看起来​既​害怕​又​茫然​，​仿佛​迷失​了​方向​。​她​的​嘴唇​无声​地​蠕动​着​，​声音​却​被​玻璃​牢笼​隔绝​开来​。\n"
"\n"
"ge2 li2 shi4 li3 de5 xiao1shou4 nu:3ren2 bi3zhi2 de5 zhan4 zhao2，lian3 tie1 zai4 bo1li5 shang4，ta1 chong1man3 kong3ju4 de5 huang2se4 yan3jing5 jin3ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 mei3 yi1ge5 dong4zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 ji4 hai4pa4 you4 mang2ran2，fang3fu2 mi2shi1 le5 fang1xiang4。ta1 de5 zui3chun2 wu2sheng1 de5 ru2dong4 zhao2，sheng1yin1 que4 bei4 bo1li5 lao2long2 ge2jue2 kai1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman paws at the glass at your approach, her haunted yellow eyes "
"tracking your every move. When you activate the intercom, a green light "
"activates inside the containment cell, and she flinches up at it, startled. "
msgstr ""
"那名​消瘦​的​女人​在​你​走近​时​抓挠​着​玻璃​，​她​充满​恐惧​的​黄色​眼睛​紧盯​着​你​的​每​一个​动作​。​当​你​激活​对讲机​时​，​隔离舱​内​的​一盏​绿灯​亮​起​，​她​吓了一跳​，​抬头​望​向​那​盏灯​。\n"
"na4 ming2 xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 zai4 ni3 zou3jin4 shi2 zhua1nao5 zhao2 bo1li5，ta1 chong1man3 kong3ju4 de5 huang2se4 yan3jing5 jin3ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 mei3 yi1ge5 dong4zuo4。dang1 ni3 ji1huo2 dui4jiang3ji1 shi2，ge2 li2 cang1 nei4 de5 yi1 zhan3 lu:4deng1 liang4 qi3，ta1 he4 le5 yi1 tiao4，tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 na4 zhan3 deng1。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman pulls herself to her full height. Speaks as if to herself."
msgstr ""
"消瘦​的​女人​站​直​了​身子​，​仿佛​在​对​着​自己​说话​。\n"
"xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 zhan4 zhi2 le5 shen1zi5，fang3fu2 zai4 dui4 zhao2 zi4ji3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman stares wide-eyed as you approach. She presses one hand to the wall of her glass prison, closes her eyes, and mouths one word: \n"
"\n"
"“Please.”"
msgstr ""
"那名​消瘦​的​女人​睁大眼睛​盯​着​你​走近​。​她​将​一只​手​按​在​玻璃​牢笼​的​墙上​，​闭上眼睛​，​嘴唇​微微​张开​，​口型​只有​一个​词​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​求​你​了​。​”\n"
"\n"
"na4 ming2 xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 zheng1 dai4 yan3 jing1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 zou3jin4。ta1 jiang1 yi1 zhi3 shou3 an4 zai4 bo1li5 lao2long2 de5 qiang2 shang4，bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1，zui3chun2 wei1wei1 zhang1kai1，kou3xing2 zhi3you3 yi1ge5 ci2：\n"
"\n"
"“qiu2 ni3 le5。”"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman stops her pacing and her eyes slowly rise to meet yours. "
"Lucid. Unblurred by time or torture or separation from her body. When she "
"speaks, her voice is flat."
msgstr ""
"那名​消瘦​的​女人​停止​踱步​，​她​的​眼睛​缓缓​抬起​与​你​的​目光​相遇​。​清醒​的​眼神​。​未​被​时间​、​折磨​或​与​身体​的​分离​所​模糊​。​当​她​说话​时​，​她​的​声音​变得​平和​。\n"
"na4 ming2 xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 ting2zhi3 duo2bu4，ta1 de5 yan3jing5 huan3huan3 tai2qi3 yu4 ni3 de5 mu4guang1 xiang1yu4。qing1xing3 de5 yan3shen2。wei4 bei4 shi2jian1、zhe2mo2 huo4 yu4 shen1ti3 de5 fen1li2 suo3 mo2hu5。dang1 ta1 shuo1hua4 shi2，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 ping2he2。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman stops her pacing. Slowly her eyes rise to meet yours. They "
"are lucid. Unblurred by time or torture or separation from her body."
msgstr ""
"那名​消瘦​的​女人​停止​踱步​，​她​的​眼睛​缓缓​抬起​与​你​的​目光​相遇​。​清醒​的​眼神​。​未​被​时间​、​折磨​或​与​身体​的​分离​所​模糊​。\n"
"na4 ming2 xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 ting2zhi3 duo2bu4，ta1 de5 yan3jing5 huan3huan3 tai2qi3 yu4 ni3 de5 mu4guang1 xiang1yu4。qing1xing3 de5 yan3shen2。wei4 bei4 shi2jian1、zhe2mo2 huo4 yu4 shen1ti3 de5 fen1li2 suo3 mo2hu5。"

msgid ""
"The gaunt woman's eyes narrow. Bore into yours. Her nostrils flare. She looks you up and down, taking in every detail of you.\n"
"\n"
"Then her face slowly softens and she speaks again."
msgstr ""
"消瘦​的​女人​眯起​眼睛​，​直勾勾​地​盯​着​你​。​她​的​鼻孔​张开​，​上下​打量​着​你​，​仔细观察​你​身上​的​每​一个​细节​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​，​她​的​表情​逐渐​柔和​下来​，​再次​开口​说话​。\n"
"\n"
"xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5，zhi2gou1gou1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 bi2kong3 zhang1kai1，shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，zi3 xi4 guan1 cha2 ni3 shen1shang5 de5 mei3 yi1ge5 xi4jie2。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4，ta1 de5 biao3qing2 zhu2jian4 rou2he2 xia4lai5，zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"The generator overload did its job, just as Frau Muller said it would. The "
"Aztechnology facility has been reduced to a smoldering crater strewn with a "
"chaotic jumble of cracked marble, melting plastic, and broken support beams."
msgstr ""
"正如​穆勒​女士​所​言​，​发电机组​过载​产生​了​预期​的​效果​。​阿兹特​科技​设施​已​化作​一片​冒​着​烟​的​坑洞​，​遍地​散落​着​支离破碎​的​大理石​、​熔化​的​塑料​和​断裂​的​支撑​梁​。\n"
"zheng4ru2 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 suo3 yan2，fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 guo4zai4 chan3sheng1 le5 yu4qi1 de5 xiao4guo3。E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1 yi3 hua4zuo4 yi1 pian1 mao4 zhao2 yan1 de5 keng1dong4，bian4di4 san3luo4 zhao2 zhi1li2po4sui4 de5 da4li3shi2、rong2hua4 de5 su4liao4 he4 duan4lie4 de5 zhi1cheng1 liang2。"

msgid ""
"The ghouls aren't rolling in nuyen, either. Maybe they could pay you in some"
" other way?"
msgstr ""
"食尸​鬼们​也​没有​新円​。​但​也许​他们​有​其他​你​需要​的​东西​呢​？\n"
"shi2 shi1 gui3 men5 ye3 mei2you3 xin1 yuan2。dan4 ye3xu3 ta1men5 you3 qi2ta1 ni3 xu1yao4 de5 dong1xi1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"The ghouls can't offer you nuyen because they don't have any. But maybe they"
" could pay you in a different way?"
msgstr ""
"尸鬼们​没​办法​向​你​支付​新円​，​因为​他们​并​没有​钱​。​但​也许​他们​有​其他​你​需要​的​东西​呢​？\n"
"shi1 gui3 men5 mei2 ban4fa3 xiang4 ni3 zhi1fu4 xin1 yuan2，yin1wei4 ta1men5 bing4 mei2you3 qian2。dan4 ye3xu3 ta1men5 you3 qi2ta1 ni3 xu1yao4 de5 dong1xi1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"The ghouls don't have any money. You know that. But maybe they have "
"something else that you want?"
msgstr ""
"尸鬼​可​没​钱​，​这​你​也​知道​。​但​也许​他们​有​其他​你​需要​的​东西​呢​？\n"
"shi1 gui3 ke3 mei2 qian2，zhe4 ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4。dan4 ye3xu3 ta1men5 you3 qi2ta1 ni3 xu1yao4 de5 dong1xi1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"The ghouls that I've spoken with are intelligent and kind. I don't think "
"they'd want to do your dirty work for you."
msgstr ""
"和​我​沟通​的​尸​鬼​睿智​且​善良​。​我​不​觉得​他们​会​愿意​帮​你​做​脏活​。\n"
"he4 wo3 gou1tong1 de5 shi1 gui3 rui4zhi4 qie3 shan4liang2。wo3 bu4 jue2de5 ta1men5 hui4 yuan4yi4 bang1 ni3 zuo4 zang4 huo2。"

msgid ""
"The girl smiles sheepishly and steps back.\n"
"\n"
"As you pass by her on your way to the door, Glory shoots you a sidelong glance."
msgstr ""
"女孩​羞怯​地​笑了笑​，​往​后退​了​一步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你们​经过​她​身边​进门​时​，​格洛丽瞥​了​你​一眼​。\n"
"\n"
"nu:3hai2 xiu1qie4 de5 xiao4 le5 xiao4，wang3 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3men5 jing1guo4 ta1 shen1bian1 jin4men2 shi2，Ge2luo4li2 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。"

msgid ""
"The girl then begins to mumble to herself, while fingering the hair that "
"covers the jack in her head."
msgstr ""
"随后​女孩​开始​喃喃自语​，​手指​拨弄​着​遮住​她​头部​插口​的​发丝​。\n"
"sui2hou4 nu:3hai2 kai1shi3 nan2nan2zi4yu3，shou3zhi3 bo1nong4 zhao2 zhe1zhu4 ta1 tou2bu4 cha1kou3 de5 fa4si1。"

msgid ""
"The glare from the lights of the floor below fades, and your eyes adjust to "
"the room."
msgstr ""
"地板​下方​的​刺眼​光芒​逐渐​消退​，​你​的​眼睛​重新​适应​了​房间​的​光线​。\n"
"di4ban3 xia4fang1 de5 ci4yan3 guang1mang2 zhu2jian4 xiao1tui4，ni3 de5 yan3jing5 chong2xin1 shi4ying4 le5 fang2jian1 de5 guang1xian4。"

msgid ""
"The glare from the lights of the floor below fades, and your eyes readjust "
"to the room."
msgstr ""
"地板​下方​的​刺眼​光芒​逐渐​消退​，​你​的​眼睛​重新​适应​了​房间​的​光线​。\n"
"di4ban3 xia4fang1 de5 ci4yan3 guang1mang2 zhu2jian4 xiao1tui4，ni3 de5 yan3jing5 chong2xin1 shi4ying4 le5 fang2jian1 de5 guang1xian4。"

msgid ""
"The glittering halls of the Aztechnology facility stand in sharp contrast to the megacorp’s unsavory reputation. Everything in here screams “money,” from the mirror-polish on the floors to the obsidian inlays in the walls.\n"
"\n"
"The generators - and the Bloodline project - lie somewhere beneath your feet."
msgstr ""
"阿兹特​科技​设施​那​闪闪发光​的​大厅​与​这家​超企​的​恶名​形成​了​鲜明对比​。​从​镜面​抛光​的​地板​到​镶嵌​着​黑曜石​的​墙壁​，​这里​的​一切​都​彰显​着​“​金钱​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​发电机组​和​“​血脉​”​项目​就​藏​在​你​脚下​的​某处​。\n"
"\n"
"E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1 na4 shan3 shan3 fa1 guang1 de5 da4ting1 yu4 zhe4 jia1 chao1 qi3 de5 e4ming2 xing2cheng2 le5 xian1 ming2 dui4 bi3。cong2 jing4 mian4 pao1guang1 de5 di4ban3 dao4 xiang1qian4 zhao2 hei1yao4shi2 de5 qiang2bi4，zhe4li3 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 zhang1xian3 zhao2“jin1qian2”。\n"
"\n"
"fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 he4“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 jiu4 zang4 zai4 ni3 jiao3xia4 de5 mou3chu4。"

msgid ""
"The glow intensifies into a scintillating torrent of light. The energy lances and stabs out of James' hooked fingers as if it were alive.\n"
"\n"
"The man in the doorway recoils in alarm, and his palm slaps down on a plastic disc that has been clipped to his belt. Too late, you recognize the object.\n"
"\n"
"A panic button."
msgstr ""
"光芒​骤然​增强​，​化作​汹涌​翻腾​的​流光​。​能量​从​詹姆斯​弯曲​的​指间​如​利刃​般​刺出​，​仿佛​活物​般​迸射​开来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门廊​处​的​男子​惊恐​地​后退​，​掌心​猛拍​腰间​夹​着​的​塑料​圆盘​。​你​认出​了​那​物件​，​但​为时已晚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​紧急​呼叫​按钮​。\n"
"\n"
"guang1mang2 zhou4ran2 zeng1qiang2，hua4zuo4 xiong1yong3 fan1teng2 de5 liu2 guang1。neng2liang4 cong2 zhan1mu3si1 wan1qu1 de5 zhi3 jian1 ru2 li4ren4 ban1 ci1 chu1，fang3fu2 huo2wu4 ban1 beng4 she4 kai1 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"men2lang2 chu3 de5 nan2zi3 jing1kong3 de5 hou4tui4，zhang3xin1 meng3 pai1 yao1jian1 jia1 zhao2 de5 su4liao4 yuan2pan2。ni3 ren4chu1 le5 na4 wu4jian4，dan4 wei2shi2yi3wan3。\n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 jin3ji2 hu1jiao4 an4niu3。"

msgid ""
"The golden specks in the elf's eyes shift and swirl, slowly picking up speed. It's mesmerizing.\n"
"\n"
"All at once, the specks explode into light and color. Absinthe's eyes now fill your field of vision, and it feels as if you're drowning in an alien sea. The patterns traced by the shimmering specks in her eyes are kaleidoscopic, enchanting, nearly impossible to turn away from."
msgstr ""
"精灵​眼中​的​金色​斑点​翻涌​旋转​，​速度​逐渐​加快​，​令人​目眩神迷​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​霎时间​，​斑点​爆裂​成​绚烂​的​光影​。​苦艾​酒​的​双眸​瞬间​填满​你​的​视野​，​仿佛​坠入​异星​的​海洋​。​她​眼中​流转​的​斑点​勾勒​出​万花筒​般的​图案​，​魅惑​人心​，​令人​几乎​无法​移开​视线​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 yan3zhong1 de5 jin1se4 ban1dian3 fan1yong3 xuan2zhuan3，su4du4 zhu2jian4 jia1kuai4，ling4ren2 mu4xuan4shen2mi2。\n"
"\n"
"sha4shi2jian1，ban1dian3 bao4lie4 cheng2 xuan4lan4 de5 guang1ying3。ku3ai4 jiu3 de5 shuang1mou2 shun4jian1 tian2man3 ni3 de5 shi4ye3，fang3fu2 zhui4ru4 yi4 xing1 de5 hai3yang2。ta1 yan3zhong1 liu2zhuan3 de5 ban1dian3 gou1le4 chu1 wan4hua1tong3 ban1 de5 tu2an4，mei4huo4 ren2xin1，ling4ren2 ji1hu1 wu2fa3 yi2kai1 shi4xian4。"

msgid ""
"The good news is that it should be possible to disable the inhibitor chip. "
"Unfortunately, you'll need some time to do the job correctly."
msgstr ""
"好消息​是​，​这块​抑制​芯片​应该​能​被​关停​。​坏消息​是​，​你​得​花点​时间​慢慢​处理​，​才​不会​搞​出​什么​问题​。\n"
"hao3 xiao1 xi1 shi4，zhe4 kuai4 yi4zhi4 xin1pian4 ying1gai1 neng2 bei4 guan1ting2。huai4 xiao1 xi1 shi4，ni3 de2 hua1 dian3 shi2jian1 man4man4 chu3li3，cai2 bu4hui4 gao3 chu1 shen2me5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"The government did nothing! They wrote the city off as a loss. Probably "
"figured the whole anarchist movement would bury itself in time, saving them "
"the trouble. (w)"
msgstr ""
"政府​什么​都​没​做​！​他们​干脆​把​这座​城市​当作​损失​处理​了​。​大概​是​他们​觉得​整个​无政府主义​运动​迟早会​自我​消亡​，​省得​他们​费心​。\n"
"zheng4fu3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 zuo4！ta1men5 gan1cui4 ba3 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 dang4zuo4 sun3shi1 chu3li3 le5。da4gai4 shi4 ta1men5 jue2de5 zheng3ge4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 yun4dong4 chi2 zao3 hui4 zi4wo3 xiao1wang2，sheng3de5 ta1men5 fei4xin1。"

msgid ""
"The government wouldn't let Adrian tell the public about any of this, of course. It'd interfere with the lie that they were feeding us... that the Firewing was dead, and that everyone was safe, and that people should stop hiding in their basements and get back to work again.\n"
"\n"
"But privately, he always said that she was still out there, somewhere deep in the SOX. I'd always thought that he was paranoid, but I was wrong. He *knew.*"
msgstr ""
"政府​当然​不会​让​阿德里安​把​这些​告诉​公众​，​这会​干扰​那些​他们​向​我们​灌输​的​谎言​……​“​火翼​已经​死​了​，​大家​都​很​安全​，​人们​应该​停止​躲​在​地下室​里​，​重新​开始​工作​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​私下里​，​他​总是​说​她​仍然​活着​，​就​在​萨洛​卢区​深处​的​某个​地方​。​我​一直​以为​他​有​妄想症​，​但​我​错​了​。​他​的确​*​知道​*​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4fu3 dang1ran2 bu4hui4 rang4 E1de2li3an1 ba3 zhe4xie1 gao4su4 gong1zhong4，zhe4 hui4 gan1rao3 na4xie1 ta1men5 xiang4 wo3men5 guan4shu1 de5 huang3yan2……“Huo3yi4 yi3jing1 si3 le5，da4jia1 dou1 hen3 an1quan2，ren2men5 ying1gai1 ting2zhi3 duo3 zai4 di4xia4shi4 li3，chong2xin1 kai1shi3 gong1zuo4。” \n"
"\n"
"dan4 si1 xia4 li3，ta1 zong3shi4 shuo1 ta1 reng2ran2 huo2zhe5，jiu4 zai4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 shen1chu4 de5 mou3 ge4 di4fang1。wo3 yi1zhi2 yi3wei2 ta1 you3 wang4xiang3zheng4，dan4 wo3 cuo4 le5。ta1 di2que4*zhi1dao4*yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"The green needs you, Feuerschwinge. You are her shelter, her shield, her "
"shepherd. Don’t abandon her. "
msgstr ""
"绿色​需要​你​，​火翼​。​你​是​庇护所​，​是​护盾​，​是​牧羊人​。​不要​放弃​。\n"
"lu:4se4 xu1yao4 ni3，Huo3yi4。ni3 shi4 bi4hu4suo3，shi4 hu4dun4，shi4 mu4yang2ren2。bu4yao4 fang4qi4。"

msgid "The green still lives, Feuerschwinge."
msgstr ""
"绿色​仍然​存在​，​火翼​。\n"
"lu:4se4 reng2ran2 cun2zai4，Huo3yi4。"

msgid "The green?"
msgstr ""
"绿色​？\n"
"lu:4se4？"

msgid ""
"The group's research later indicated that the \"ultimate catastrophe\" was unlikely, so they continued forward.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a long drag on his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes... I will show the same resolve that those great minds did. I will not be deterred."
msgstr ""
"后续​的​团队​研究​表明​，​“​最终​灾难​”​的​可能性​不​大​，​因此​他们​选择​继续​前行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​深深​吸​了​一口​烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​……​我​将​展现​与​那些​伟大​的​思想家​相同​的​决心​。​我​绝不会​退缩​。\n"
"\n"
"hou4xu4 de5 tuan2dui4 yan2jiu1 biao3ming2，“zui4zhong1 zai1nan4” de5 ke3neng2xing4 bu4 dai4，yin1ci3 ta1men5 xuan3ze2 ji4xu4 qian2xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……wo3 jiang1 zhan3xian4 yu4 na4xie1 wei3da4 de5 si1xiang3jia1 xiang1tong2 de5 jue2xin1。wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 tui4suo1。"

msgid ""
"The group's research later indicated that the \"ultimate catastrophe\" would not happen, so they continued forward.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a long drag on his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I will show the same resolve that those great minds did. I will not be deterred."
msgstr ""
"后续​的​团队​研究​表明​，​“​最终​灾难​”​的​可能性​不​大​，​因此​他们​选择​继续​前行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​深深​吸​了​一口​烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​展现​与​那些​伟大​的​思想家​相同​的​决心​。​我​绝不会​退缩​。\n"
"\n"
"hou4xu4 de5 tuan2dui4 yan2jiu1 biao3ming2，“zui4zhong1 zai1nan4” de5 ke3neng2xing4 bu4 dai4，yin1ci3 ta1men5 xuan3ze2 ji4xu4 qian2xing2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 zhan3xian4 yu4 na4xie1 wei3da4 de5 si1xiang3jia1 xiang1tong2 de5 jue2xin1。wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 tui4suo1。"

msgid ""
"The guard is unnaturally fast; you'd guess that his reflexes have been "
"cybernetically enhanced. In a blur of motion, he slaps the terminal's panic "
"button and jerks his weapon out of its holster."
msgstr ""
"守卫​的​动作​快到​不​正常​，​你​猜想​他​的​反应​能力​或许​经过​了​赛博​增强​。​他​在​转瞬之间​拍下​了​终端​的​紧急​按钮​，​同时​将​武器​从​枪套​中​掏​了​出来​。\n"
"shou3wei4 de5 dong4zuo4 kuai4 dao4 bu4 zheng4chang2，ni3 cai1xiang3 ta1 de5 fan3ying4 neng2li4 huo4xu3 jing1guo4 le5 sai4bo2 zeng1qiang2。ta1 zai4 zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1 pai1 xia4 le5 zhong1duan1 de5 jin3ji2 an4niu3，tong2shi2 jiang1 wu3qi4 cong2 qiang1 tao4 zhong4 tao1 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid "The guards jerk their weapons out of their holsters and turn to fire."
msgstr ""
"守卫​们​拔出​武器​开始​对​你们​射击​。\n"
"shou3wei4 men5 ba2 chu1 wu3qi4 kai1shi3 dui4 ni3men5 she4ji1。"

msgid ""
"The gunfire dies down, and the smoke clears.\n"
"\n"
"You and Hasenkamp find yourselves staring at one another across a room stacked with corpses."
msgstr ""
"枪火渐​熄​，​烟雾​散​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​和​哈森​坎普​在​房间​两头​大眼瞪​小眼​看着​对方​，​周围​遍布​尸体​。\n"
"\n"
"qiang1 huo3 jian1 xi1，yan1wu4 san3 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 he4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 zai4 fang2jian1 liang3tou2 dai4 yan3 deng4 xiao3 yan3 kan4 zhao2 dui4fang1，zhou1wei2 bian4bu4 shi1ti3。"

msgid ""
"The guts... find the guts... by my body.\n"
"\n"
"A machine... a machine that keeps me trapped in this jarthisbubblethisprison...\n"
"\n"
"break it break it break it "
msgstr ""
"核心​……​找到​核心​……​我​的​身体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有台​机器​……​把​我​困​在​这​牢笼​之内​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​破坏​它​破坏​它​破坏​它\n"
"\n"
"he2xin1……zhao3dao4 he2xin1……wo3 de5 shen1ti3。\n"
"\n"
"you3 tai2 ji1qi4……ba3 wo3 kun4 zai4 zhe4 lao2long2 zhi1nei4……\n"
"\n"
"po4huai4 ta1 po4huai4 ta1 po4huai4 ta1"

msgid ""
"The hackers' terminal has clearly been cobbled together using whatever parts they could find. In spite of this, it's a remarkably impressive piece of machinery.\n"
"\n"
"Studying the terminal, it takes almost no time to identify the components that Parson sent you to find."
msgstr ""
"黑客​的​终端​显然​是​用​四处​找来​的​零部件​拼凑​而成​的​。​尽管如此​，​这台​机器​依然​令人惊叹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​仔细​研究​终端​后​，​你​几乎​立刻​就​认出​了​帕森​让​你​寻找​的​那些​部件​。\n"
"\n"
"hei1ke4 de5 zhong1duan1 xian3ran2 shi4 yong4 si4chu4 zhao3 lai2 de5 ling2bu4jian4 pin1cou4 er2 cheng2 de5。jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，zhe4 tai2 ji1qi4 yi1ran2 ling3 ren2 jing1 tan4。\n"
"\n"
"zi3xi4 yan2jiu1 zhong1duan1 hou4，ni3 ji1hu1 li4ke4 jiu4 ren4chu1 le5 pa4 sen1 rang4 ni3 xun2zhao3 de5 na4xie1 bu4jian4。"

msgid ""
"The handwritten label announces it as the first bottle from a batch "
"distilled nearly fifty years ago, aged in a cask that had once held "
"amontillado."
msgstr ""
"上面​的​手写​标签​宣称​这​是​近​五十年​前​蒸馏​的​某​一​批次​中​的​首瓶​佳酿​，​陈年​于​曾​盛放​阿蒙​蒂亚​雪利酒​的​橡木​桶​中​。\n"
"shang4mian4 de5 shou3xie3 biao1qian1 xuan1cheng1 zhe4 shi4 jin4 wu3 shi2 nian2 qian2 zheng1liu2 de5 mou3 yi1 pi1 ci4 zhong4 de5 shou3 ping2 jia1niang4，chen2nian2 yu2 ceng2 cheng2 fang4 a1meng2 di4 ya4 xue3li4jiu3 de5 xiang4mu4 tong3 zhong4。"

msgid "The hatch looks as sturdy as ever."
msgstr ""
"舱门​看上去​依旧​坚固​无比​。\n"
"cang1 men2 kan4shang5qu5 yi1jiu4 jian1gu4 wu2bi3。"

msgid ""
"The heat from the flames is too much. Your vision glazes red, and the stench of burning plastic clogs your nostrils.\n"
"\n"
"You're dead before you hit the floor."
msgstr ""
"火焰​的​高温​令人​难以承受​。​你​的​视线​变得​一片​血红​，​燃烧​的​塑料​散发出​的​刺鼻​气味​充斥​着​你​的​鼻腔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还​没​来得及​倒地​便​已​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"huo3yan4 de5 gao1wen1 ling4ren2 nan2 yi3 cheng2 shou4。ni3 de5 shi4xian4 bian4de5 yi1 pian1 xie3 hong2，ran2shao1 de5 su4liao4 san3 fa1 chu1 de5 ci4bi2 qi4wei4 chong1chi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 bi2qiang1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2 mei2 lai2de5ji2 dao3di4 bian4 yi3 si3 le5。"

msgid "The heavy duty optical cable clicks back into its socket."
msgstr ""
"重型​光缆​咔嗒​一声​回到​其​插座​中​。\n"
"zhong4xing2 guang1lan3 ka1da1 yi1sheng1 hui2dao4 qi2 cha1zuo4 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"The hell with it. I don't have time for this.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His hands twist into claws, and he raises them high. An instant later, they are wreathed in an unnatural purple glow.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"拉倒​吧​。​我​没​时间​在​这里​磨蹭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​双手​扭曲​成​利爪​，​高高​举起​。​顷刻间​，​它们​便​笼罩着​诡异​的​紫色​光芒​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"la1dao3 ba1。wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 zai4 zhe4li3 mo2ceng5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 niu3qu1 cheng2 li4zhao3，gao1 gao1 ju3qi3。qing3ke4jian1，ta1men5 bian4 long2 zhao4 zhao2 gui3yi4 de5 zi3se4 guang1mang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "The hell with it. I'll pay whatever you want, just get me Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"随便​吧​。​只要​你​能​弄​到​沃​克莱尔​的​情报​，​你​要​什么​都行​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ba1。zhi3yao4 ni3 neng2 long4 dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 qing2bao4，ni3 yao4 shen2me5 dou1 xing2。"

msgid "The hell with that! I'm gonna go find Audran and take him down."
msgstr ""
"管​他​干什么​！​我要​找到​奥​德兰​，​干掉​他​。\n"
"guan3 ta1 gan4shen2me5！wo3 yao4 zhao3dao4 Ao4de2lan2，gan4diao4 ta1。"

msgid "The hell with that, we can't trust a bunch of strangers with this."
msgstr ""
"拉倒​吧​，​我们​不能​把​宝押​在​一群​陌生人​身上​。\n"
"la1dao3 ba1，wo3men5 bu4neng2 ba3 bao3 ya1 zai4 yi1 qun2 mo4sheng1ren2 shen1shang5。"

msgid ""
"The hell with that. You want a meat shield to soak up bullets in that "
"hellhole while you stay safe at home, you find someone else."
msgstr ""
"见鬼​去​吧​。​你​想​找个​肉盾​替​你​在​那​鬼​地方​挡​子弹​，​你​自己​却​舒舒服服​在家​躺​着​，​那​你​还是​找​别人​去​吧​。\n"
"jian4gui3 qu4 ba1。ni3 xiang3 zhao3 ge4 rou4dun4 ti4 ni3 zai4 na4 gui3 di4fang1 dang3 zi3dan4，ni3 zi4ji3 que4 shu1shu5fu5fu5 zai4jia1 tang3 zhao2，na4 ni3 hai2shi5 zhao3 bie2ren5 qu4 ba1。"

msgid "The hell with this. I won't help you."
msgstr ""
"去​你​的​吧​。​我​不会​帮​你​的​。\n"
"qu4 ni3 de5 ba1。wo3 bu4hui4 bang1 ni3 de5。"

msgid "The hell with this. I'm out of here."
msgstr ""
"拉倒​吧​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"la1dao3 ba1。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "The hell with this. James, fry him."
msgstr ""
"拉倒​吧​。​詹姆斯​，​把​他​做​掉​。\n"
"la1dao3 ba1。zhan1mu3si1，ba3 ta1 zuo4 diao4。"

msgid ""
"The higher the world's background count rises, the less predictably magic will behave. The spells and rituals that we all rely on are already beginning to fail us.\n"
"\n"
"If we do nothing, it is conceivable - maybe even probable - that magic will become too dangerous to use within our lifetime. And if we can no longer use magic, it will in turn become impossible for us to solve the problem."
msgstr ""
"世界​背景​数值​越高​，​魔法​的​运作​就​越​难以预测​。​我们​赖以生存​的​咒语​与​仪式​，​已然​开始​背叛​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​我们​坐视不理​，​可以​预见​—​—​甚至​极有​可能​—​—​在​我们​有生之年​，​魔法​将​变得​危险​到​无法​使用​。​而​一旦​我们​丧失​施法​能力​，​解决​这个​难题​便​彻底​成为泡影​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 yue4 gao1，mo2fa3 de5 yun4zuo4 jiu4 yue4 nan2 yi3 yu4 ce4。wo3men5 lai4 yi3 sheng1 cun2 de5 zhou4yu3 yu4 yi2shi4，yi3ran2 kai1shi3 bei4pan4 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 wo3men5 zuo4shi4bu4li3，ke3yi3 yu4jian4——shen4zhi4 ji2 you3 ke3neng2——zai4 wo3men5 you3sheng1zhi1nian2，mo2fa3 jiang1 bian4de5 wei1xian3 dao4 wu2fa3 shi3yong4。er2 yi1dan4 wo3men5 sang4shi1 shi1fa3 neng2li4，jie3jue2 zhe4ge5 nan2ti2 bian4 che4di3 cheng2 wei2 pao1 ying3。"

msgid ""
"The hole is quite deep, and a direct drop from this height would certainly "
"be fatal. There is no sign of movement below."
msgstr ""
"这个​洞​非常​深​，​从​这个​高度​直接​坠落​肯定​会​致命​。​下面​没有​任何​动静​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 dong4 fei1chang2 shen1，cong2 zhe4ge5 gao1du4 zhi2jie1 zhui4luo4 ken3ding4 hui4 zhi4ming4。xia4mian4 mei2you3 ren4he2 dong4jing4。"

msgid ""
"The hole that you made previously is still there. You can jump down to the "
"second floor kitchen."
msgstr ""
"你​之前​砸​出来​的​洞​还​在​这​。​你​可以​从​这​跳​到​二层​的​厨房​去​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 za2 chu1lai2 de5 dong4 hai2 zai4 zhe4。ni3 ke3yi3 cong2 zhe4 tiao4 dao4 er4 ceng2 de5 chu2fang2 qu4。"

msgid ""
"The homeowner backpedals, trying to put a wall between himself and James. "
"He's moving too slowly - much too slowly."
msgstr ""
"房主​急忙​后退​，​试图​在​自己​和​詹姆斯​之间​筑起​一道​墙​。​他​的​动作​太慢​了​—​—​慢得​离谱​。\n"
"fang2zhu3 ji2mang2 hou4tui4，shi4tu2 zai4 zi4ji3 he4 zhan1mu3si1 zhi1jian1 zhu4 qi3 yi1dao4 qiang2。ta1 de5 dong4zuo4 tai4 man4 le5——man4 de2 li2pu3。"

msgid ""
"The hospital couldn't ID Audran. Either somebody covered his tracks for him,"
" or he was living completely off the grid."
msgstr ""
"医院​无法​确认​奥​德兰​的​身份​。​要么​有人​替​他​掩盖​信息​，​要么​他​过​着​与世隔绝​的​生活​。\n"
"yi1yuan4 wu2fa3 que4ren4 Ao4de2lan2 de5 shen1fen4。yao4me5 you3ren2 ti4 ta1 yan3gai4 xin4xi1，yao4me5 ta1 guo4 zhao2 yu3shi4ge2jue2 de5 sheng1huo2。"

msgid ""
"The hot new gang out in Schattennest. Violent bastards, but I suppose that goes without saying.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stabs a meaty pointer finger down on the faded silhouette of a building.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. This warehouse, right here, is Rammbock HQ. That's where the Engineer is staying."
msgstr ""
"影巢​最近​无人不知​的​新​帮派​。​他们​是​一帮​暴力​狂​，​不过​不用​我​说​你​肯定​也​知道​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​粗壮​的​手指​戳​向​一栋​褪色​的​建筑​轮廓​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​这座​仓库​就是​撞锤​帮​的​总部​。​而​工程师​就​住​在​那儿​。\n"
"\n"
"ying3 chao2 zui4jin4 wu2ren2bu4zhi1 de5 xin1 bang1pai4。ta1men5 shi4 yi1 bang1 bao4li4 kuang2，bu4guo4 bu4yong4 wo3 shuo1 ni3 ken3ding4 ye3 zhi1dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 cu1zhuang4 de5 shou3zhi3 chuo1 xiang4 yi1 dong4 tui4se4 de5 jian4zhu4 lun2kuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，zhe4 zuo4 cang1ku4 jiu4shi4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 zong3bu4。er2 gong1cheng2shi1 jiu4 zhu4 zai4 na4r5。"

msgid ""
"The hotel is called Das Kesselhaus. It is a renovated factory nestled deep in the heart of Drogenkippe.\n"
"\n"
"It appears that Winters is holed up there."
msgstr ""
"旅馆​名叫​“​锅炉房​”​，​是​一座​经过​翻修​的​工厂​，​位于​毒坑区​的​中心地带​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​温特斯​就​藏​在​那里​。\n"
"\n"
"lu:3guan3 ming2jiao4“Guo1lu2fang2”，shi4 yi1 zuo4 jing1guo4 fan1xiu1 de5 gong1chang3，wei4yu2 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 zhong4 xin1 de5 dai4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 Wen1te4si1 jiu4 zang4 zai4 na4li5。"

msgid ""
"The idea of dragons taking over the world... the thought of them slowly hoarding everything... it's too big to think about. \n"
"\n"
"We’re street-level. We run the shadows. That's it.\n"
"\n"
"Worrying about these sorts of issues is beyond our pay-grade."
msgstr ""
"一​想到​巨龙​们​统治​着​世界​……​它们​慢慢​囤积​着​一切​……​这​念头​太过​庞大​，​简直​难以想象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​只是​街头​平民​，​在​暗影​圈子里​厮混​打拼​，​仅此而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​事情​根本​就​不是​我们​这个​级别​的​人​该​考虑​的​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 xiang3dao4 ju4long2 men5 tong3zhi4 zhao2 shi4jie4……ta1men5 man4man4 tun2ji1 zhao2 yi1qie4……zhe4 nian4tou5 tai4guo4 pang2da4，jian3zhi2 nan2 yi3 xiang3 xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3shi4 jie1tou2 ping2min2，zai4 an4ying3 juan1 zi3 li3 si1hun4 da3pin1，jin3ci3er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 gen1ben3 jiu4 bu4shi4 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 ji2bie2 de5 ren2 gai1 kao3lu:4 de5。"

msgid ""
"The illustrious Frau Schäfer helped people, all right. She helped them *so* much that they couldn't make things work without her any more.\n"
"\n"
"She made herself into a leader here. And guess what? In an anarchist system, there aren't supposed to *be* any leaders."
msgstr ""
"了不起​的​舍费尔​女士​帮助​过​人们​，​没错​。​她​帮助​了​他们​*​这么​*​多​，​以至于​没有​她​，​他们​就​无法​再​把​事情​做好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​把​自己​变成​了​这里​的​领导者​。​但是​呢​？​在​无政府主义​体制​下​，​本来​就​*​不该​*​有​任何​领导者​。\n"
"\n"
"liao3bu5qi3 de5 she3 fei4 er3 nu:3shi4 bang1zhu4 guo4 ren2men5，mei2cuo4。ta1 bang1zhu4 le5 ta1men5*zhe4me5*duo1，yi3zhi4yu2 mei2you3 ta1，ta1men5 jiu4 wu2fa3 zai4 ba3 shi4qing5 zuo4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ba3 zi4ji3 bian4cheng2 le5 zhe4li3 de5 ling3dao3zhe3。dan4shi4 ni2？zai4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 ti3zhi4 xia4，ben3lai2 jiu4*bu4gai1*you3 ren4he2 ling3dao3zhe3。"

msgid ""
"The image cuts to static, and you find yourself back at the menu screen."
msgstr ""
"画面​变成​一片​雪花​。​你​发现自己​回到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"hua4mian4 bian4cheng2 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1。ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 hui2dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The image flickers and distorts, then winks out. There is a chugging noise from inside your computer.\n"
"\n"
"A text box pops onto the screen: FILE NOT FOUND. You search your inbox again, but Duerr's message is gone."
msgstr ""
"画面​闪烁​扭曲​，​随即​熄灭​。​电脑​内部​传来​一阵​咔哒​声响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上弹​出​一个​文本框​：​*​未找到​文件​*​。​你​再次​检索​收件箱​，​但​杜尔​的​消息​已​无影无踪​。\n"
"\n"
"hua4mian4 shan3shuo4 niu3qu1，sui2ji2 xi1mie4。dian4nao3 nei4bu4 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 ka3 da1 sheng1xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 dan4 chu1 yi1ge5 wen2ben3kuang4：*wei4 zhao3 dao4 wen2jian4*。ni3 zai4ci4 jian3suo3 shou1jian4xiang1，dan4 du4 er3 de5 xiao1xi5 yi3 wu2ying3wu2zong1。"

msgid "The image of Monika appears on the screen."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​图像​出现​在​屏幕​上​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 de5 tu2xiang4 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid "The image of Monika smiles on the screen."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​图像​微笑​着​出现​在​屏幕​上​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 de5 tu2xiang4 wei1xiao4 zhao2 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid "The image of Monika winks onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​的​图像​出现​在​屏幕​上​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 de5 tu2xiang4 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The image on the computer screen dies.\n"
"\n"
"Amsel turns to face you."
msgstr ""
"电脑屏幕​上​的​图像​消失​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿姆​泽尔​转过身​来​看着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"dian4 nao3 bing3 mu4 shang4 de5 tu2xiang4 xiao1shi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 kan4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"The image sharpens. In the center of the screen stands an enormous ork in battle armor, a hand cannon leveled at something just out of frame. \n"
"\n"
"His face is a shiny mat of grafted tissue, his smile like something out of a nightmare."
msgstr ""
"影像​逐渐​清晰​。​屏幕​的​正中​站​着​一名​体形​硕大​、​身披​战甲​的​兽​人​，​手中​的​炮管​正​对准​画面​边缘​之外​的​某个​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​脸上​布满​了​光滑​的​移植​组织​，​嘴角​的​笑容​宛如​噩梦​中​的​幻影​。\n"
"\n"
"ying3xiang4 zhu2jian4 qing1xi1。ping2mu4 de5 zheng4zhong1 zhan4 zhao2 yi1 ming2 ti3xing2 shuo4da4、shen1 pi1 zhan4 jia3 de5 shou4 ren2，shou3 zhong4 de5 bao1 guan3 zheng1 dui4zhun3 hua4mian4 bian1yuan2 zhi1wai4 de5 mou3 ge4 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 bu4man3 le5 guang1hua2 de5 yi2zhi2 zu3zhi1，zui3jiao3 de5 xiao4rong2 wan3ru2 e4meng4 zhong4 de5 huan4ying3。"

msgid ""
"The image that you saw in APEX's final moments replays itself in your mind, over and over again.\n"
"\n"
"Audran. Vauclair. And the strange woman in the containment cell."
msgstr ""
"APEX​在​最后​时刻​向​你​播出​的​画面​在​你​脑海中​一遍​又​一遍​重放​着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​奥​德兰​，​沃​克莱尔​，​以及​那个​被关​在​隔离舱​里​的​奇怪​女人​。\n"
"\n"
"APEX zai4 zui4hou4 shi2ke4 xiang4 ni3 bo1chu1 de5 hua4mian4 zai4 ni3 nao3 hai3 zhong4 yi1bian4 you4 yi1bian4 chong2 fang4 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"Ao4de2lan2，Wo4ke4lai2er3，yi3ji2 na4ge5 bei4 guan1 zai4 ge2 li2 cang1 li3 de5 qi2guai4 nu:3ren2。"

msgid ""
"The image winks back off of the screen. You find yourself back at the menu."
msgstr ""
"画面​从​屏幕​上​消失​。​你​发现自己​回到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"hua4mian4 cong2 ping2mu4 shang4 xiao1shi1。ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 hui2dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The implications of this are as disturbing as they are obvious: The troll "
"that this experiment was built around is still conscious. A prisoner in his "
"own body, locked in a cage of meat and chrome."
msgstr ""
"这​其中​的​含义​既​显而易见​又​令人不安​：​这名​巨魔​实验​体​依然​保​有意识​。​它​被​囚禁​在​自身​的​躯壳​中​，​困于​这具​由​血肉​与​铬​合金​打造​的​牢笼​。\n"
"zhe4 qi2zhong1 de5 han2yi4 ji4 xian3er2yi4jian4 you4 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1：zhe4 ming2 ju4mo2 shi2yan4 ti3 yi1ran2 bao3 you3yi4shi2。ta1 bei4 qiu2jin4 zai4 zi4shen1 de5 qu1qiao4 zhong4，kun4 yu2 zhe4 ju4 you2 xue4rou4 yu4 ge4 he2jin1 da3zao4 de5 lao2long2。"

msgid ""
"The indicator light on the maglock changes from red to green. There is an "
"audible \"thunk,\" and the hatch pops open, revealing a ladder leading down "
"to the utility tunnel below."
msgstr ""
"磁力锁​上​的​指示灯​从​红色​变为​绿色​。​砰​地​一声​，​舱门​弹开​，​露出​通往​下方​综合​管廊​的​梯子​。\n"
"ci2li4suo3 shang4 de5 zhi3 shi4 deng1 cong2 hong2se4 bian4wei2 lu:4se4。peng1 de5 yi1sheng1，cang1 men2 dan4 kai1，lu4chu1 tong1wang3 xia4fang1 zong1he2 guan3 lang2 de5 ti1zi5。"

msgid ""
"The information dries up at this point. We know that he was treated and discharged, but what happened afterward remains a mystery.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, studying your reaction.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your thoughts? Hold nothing back... I'd like to hear everything that comes to mind."
msgstr ""
"线索​到​这里​就断​了​。​我们​只​知道​他​接受​治疗​后​出院​，​但​后续​发生​的​事​仍​是​个​谜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​，​观察​着​你​的​反应​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​怎么​看​？​不要​有所​保留​……​和​我​说​说​你​都​想到​了​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4suo3 dao4 zhe4li3 jiu4 duan4 le5。wo3men5 zhi3 zhi1dao4 ta1 jie1shou4 zhi4liao2 hou4 chu1yuan4，dan4 hou4xu4 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4 reng2 shi4 ge4 mei4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，guan1cha2 zhao2 ni3 de5 fan3ying4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 kan4？bu4yao4 you3suo3 bao3liu2……he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 ni3 dou1 xiang3dao4 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"The information in this entry is impossibly dense. It would take you a week "
"and a stack of scientific journals to fully decipher."
msgstr ""
"该​条目​中​的​信息​密度​极高​，​难以​理解​。​要​完全​弄清楚​这些​内容​，​你​可能​需要​花上​一周​时间​并​翻阅​一沓​科学​期刊​。\n"
"gai1 tiao2mu4 zhong4 de5 xin4xi1 mi4du4 ji2 gao1，nan2yi3 li3jie3。yao4 wan2quan2 long4 qing1 chu3 zhe4xie1 nei4rong2，ni3 ke3neng2 xu1yao4 hua1 shang4 yi1zhou1 shi2jian1 bing4 fan1yue4 yi1 da2 ke1xue2 qi1kan1。"

msgid ""
"The infusion process completes, filling Feuerschwinge with the deadly virus."
" Audran shouts in triumph as he releases her. Berlin will burn. You have "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"注入​流程​完成​，​火翼​体内​充满​了​致命​的​病毒​。​奥​德兰​欢呼​着​将​她​释放​，​柏林​将​陷入​一片​火海​。​你​失败​了​。\n"
"zhu4ru4 liu2cheng2 wan2cheng2，Huo3yi4 ti3nei4 chong1man3 le5 zhi4ming4 de5 bing4du2。Ao4de2lan2 huan1hu1 zhao2 jiang1 ta1 shi4fang4，bo2lin2 jiang1 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 huo3hai3。ni3 shi1bai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The infusion process completes, filling Feuerschwinge with the deadly virus."
" Vauclair shouts in triumph as he releases her. Berlin will burn. You have "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"注入​流程​完成​，​火翼​体内​充满​了​致命​的​病毒​。​沃​克莱尔​欢呼​着​将​她​释放​，​柏林​将​陷入​一片​火海​。​你​失败​了​。\n"
"zhu4ru4 liu2cheng2 wan2cheng2，Huo3yi4 ti3nei4 chong1man3 le5 zhi4ming4 de5 bing4du2。Wo4ke4lai2er3 huan1hu1 zhao2 jiang1 ta1 shi4fang4，bo2lin2 jiang1 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 huo3hai3。ni3 shi1bai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The initiate by the door is staring at Glory's limbs, her eyes wide. She's a mousy little thing, probably somewhere in the vicinity of seventeen years old, with purple contact lenses and a shock of blue hair.\n"
"\n"
"She glances up at Glory, blinking."
msgstr ""
"门口​的​学徒​瞪​大​眼睛​看着​格洛丽​的​四肢​。​她​是​个​腼腆​的​小姑娘​，​约莫​十七八岁​，​戴着​紫色​隐形眼镜​，​顶​着​一头​蓬乱​的​蓝发​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​抬头​看向​格洛丽​，​眨​眨眼睛​。\n"
"\n"
"men2kou3 de5 xue2tu2 deng4 dai4 yan3jing5 kan4 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 de5 si4zhi1。ta1 shi4 ge4 mian3tian3 de5 xiao3 gu1 niang2，yue1mo5 shi2 qi1 ba1 sui4，dai4 zhao2 zi3se4 yin3xing2yan3jing4，ding3 zhao2 yi1tou2 peng2luan4 de5 lan2 fa1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 Ge2luo4li2，zha3 zha3yan3jing1。"

msgid ""
"The initiate closest to the door whips his head up to look at you. He takes "
"a stutter step backward in alarm, then opens his mouth to cry for help."
msgstr ""
"离门​最近​的​学徒​猛地​抬头​望​向​你​。​他​惊恐​地​踉跄​后退​一步​，​意欲​张口​呼救​。\n"
"li2 men2 zui4jin4 de5 xue2tu2 meng3de5 tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 ni3。ta1 jing1kong3 de5 liang4qiang4 hou4tui4 yi1 bu4，yi4yu4 zhang1kou3 hu1jiu4。"

msgid "The initiates, you mean?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​指​那些​学徒​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 zhi3 na4xie1 xue2tu2？"

msgid ""
"The instant that the chip leaves its cradle, the machine reboots itself. \n"
"\n"
"You are, again, alone."
msgstr ""
"芯片​离开​托架​的​瞬间​，​机器​便​自动​重启​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​再次​只​剩​你​独自一人​。\n"
"\n"
"xin1pian4 li2kai1 tuo1jia4 de5 shun4jian1，ji1qi4 bian4 zi4dong4 chong2qi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 zai4ci4 zhi3 sheng4 ni3 du2 zi4 yi1 ren2。"

msgid ""
"The instant you begin to move, the old man's finger jerks the trigger.\n"
"\n"
"For a moment - nothing more than a split second, really - you can read the fear and sorrow on Vauclair's face. Time seems to slow.\n"
"\n"
"And then, all at once, it speeds up again, and Dr. Adrian Vauclair's body crumples to the floor."
msgstr ""
"你​刚​一​动弹​，​老人​的​手指​便​猛地​扣动​了​扳机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​仿佛​电光石火​般的​刹那间​，​你​瞥见​了​沃​克莱尔​脸上​的​恐惧​与​悲伤​。​时间​仿佛​凝滞​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​接着​，​一切​又​骤然​加速​，​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​的​躯体​瘫软​倒地​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1 yi1 dong4tan5，lao3ren2 de5 shou3zhi3 bian4 meng3de5 kou4dong4 le5 ban1ji1。\n"
"\n"
"fang3fu2 dian4 guang1 dan4 huo3 ban1 de5 cha4 na4 jian1，ni3 pie1jian4 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 lian3 shang4 de5 kong3ju4 yu4 bei1shang1。shi2jian1 fang3fu2 ning2zhi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jie1zhe5，yi1qie4 you4 zhou4ran2 jia1su4，E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 de5 qu1ti3 tan1ruan3 dao3di4。"

msgid ""
"The intercom's synthetic voice is suddenly overpowered by a burst of digital noise. The noise sharpens, clarifies, and resolves itself into an almost-organic sound. It increases in pitch and volume until the walls begin to shake.\n"
"\n"
"Somewhere, down in the pit of your stomach, you know this sound for what it is: a cry of exultation."
msgstr ""
"对​讲​系统​的​人工合成​音​突然​被​一阵​数字​噪音​淹没​。​它​逐渐​尖锐​清晰​，​最终​化作​近乎​有机​生命​的​声音​。​它​的​音调​和​音量​不断​升高​，​直至​墙壁​都​开始​为​之​震颤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​你​内心深处​，​你​明白​这​声音​的​本质​：​那​是​欢欣​的​呐喊​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 jiang3 xi4tong3 de5 ren2 gong1 ge3 cheng2 yin1 tu1ran2 bei4 yi1zhen4 shu4zi4 zao4yin1 yan1mo4。ta1 zhu2jian4 jian1rui4 qing1xi1，zui4zhong1 hua4zuo4 jin4hu5 you3ji1 sheng1ming4 de5 sheng1yin1。ta1 de5 yin1diao4 he4 yin1liang4 bu4duan4 sheng1gao1，zhi2zhi4 qiang2bi4 dou1 kai1shi3 wei2 zhi1 zhen4chan4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 nei4xin1shen1chu4，ni3 ming2bai5 zhe4 sheng1yin1 de5 ben3zhi4：na4 shi4 huan1xin1 de5 na4han3。"

msgid ""
"The interface of this console has been locked.\n"
"\n"
"Peering around behind the terminal, you find an absolute rat's nest of tangled cables running between it and the servers."
msgstr ""
"这个​控制台​的​界面​处于​锁定​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​绕​到​终端​后面​一看​，​发现​它​和​服务器之间​布满​了​乱七八糟​的​线缆​，​简直​像​个​老鼠​窝​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 kong4zhi4tai2 de5 jie4mian4 chu3yu2 suo3ding4 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 rao4 dao4 zhong1duan1 hou4mian5 yi1 kan4，fa1xian4 ta1 he4 fu2 wu4 qi4 zhi1 jian1 bu4man3 le5 luan4qi1ba1zao1 de5 xian4lan3，jian3zhi2 xiang4 ge4 lao3shu3 wo1。"

msgid ""
"The intruder's avatar shimmers in the cool ambient glow of the bank's Matrix hub.\n"
"\n"
"He sneers at Blitz, and his hands close into fists."
msgstr ""
"入侵者​的​显像​在​银行​矩阵​枢纽​的​冷冽​环境光​中​闪烁着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​对​着​布里​茨​冷笑​，​双手​紧握​成拳​。\n"
"\n"
"ru4qin1zhe3 de5 xian3xiang4 zai4 yin2hang2 ju3zhen4 shu1niu3 de5 leng3lie4 huan2 jing4 guang1 zhong4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dui4 zhao2 Bu4li3ci2 leng3xiao4，shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。"

msgid ""
"The irregular throbs of light that serve as APEX's heartbeat increase in frequency. Become violent. Plumes of static fill the viewscreen.\n"
"\n"
"The room fills with an almost tangible feeling of menace."
msgstr ""
"APEX​那​如同​“​心跳​”​的​光​脉冲​频率​骤增​，​变得​狂暴​起来​。​屏幕​上​出现​了​大片​的​雪花​信号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​房间​中​充满​了​某种​几乎​触手可及​的​威胁​感​。\n"
"\n"
"APEX na4 ru2tong2“xin1tiao4” de5 guang1 mai4chong1 pin2lu:4 zhou4 zeng1，bian4de5 kuang2bao4 qi3lai5。ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 da4pian4 de5 xue3hua1 xin4hao4。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 zhong4 chong1man3 le5 mou3zhong3 ji1hu1 chu4shou3ke3ji2 de5 wei1xie2 gan3。"

msgid ""
"The key panel's LED indicator blips from red to green, and the lock thunks "
"open."
msgstr ""
"门禁​板​的​LED​指示灯​从​红色​转为​绿色​，​伴随​着​“​咔哒​”​一声​，​门​解锁​了​。\n"
"men2jin4 ban3 de5 LED zhi3 shi4 deng1 cong2 hong2se4 zhuai3 wei2 lu:4se4，ban4sui2 zhao2“ka3 da1” yi1sheng1，men2 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The key panel's LED indicator blips to a more pleasant hue, and the door "
"unlocks with a thunk."
msgstr ""
"钥匙​面板​上​的​LED​指示灯​闪烁​了​一下​，​变成​了​更​柔和​的​色调​，​随后​伴随​着​“​咔哒​”​一声​，​门​解锁​了​。\n"
"yao4shi5 mian4ban3 shang4 de5 LED zhi3 shi4 deng1 shan3shuo4 le5 yi1xia4，bian4cheng2 le5 geng1 rou2he2 de5 se4diao4，sui2hou4 ban4sui2 zhao2“ka3 da1” yi1sheng1，men2 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The key panel's light blips to a more pleasant hue, and the door unlocks."
msgstr ""
"钥匙​面板​上​的​LED​指示灯​闪烁​了​一下​，​变成​了​更​柔和​的​色调​。​门​解锁​了​。\n"
"yao4shi5 mian4ban3 shang4 de5 LED zhi3 shi4 deng1 shan3shuo4 le5 yi1xia4，bian4cheng2 le5 geng1 rou2he2 de5 se4diao4。men2 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The kiez next door. It's a run-down, gang-infested hellhole... not the sort of place you'd want to stroll through after dark.\n"
"\n"
"And if the Engineer is allowed to do his work there uninterrupted, it's going to get a whole lot worse."
msgstr ""
"就是​隔壁​的​街区​。​那儿​早已​成​了​破败​不堪​、​帮派​横行​的​鬼​地方​……​你​肯定​不会​想​在​天黑​后​去​那种​街区​闲逛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​让​工程师​在​那儿​不​受​干扰​地​搞​他​的​研究​，​情况​只会​变得​更糟​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 ge2bi4 de5 jie1qu1。na4r5 zao3yi3 cheng2 le5 po4bai4 bu4kan1、bang1pai4 heng2xing2 de5 gui3 di4fang1……ni3 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 xiang3 zai4 tian1hei1 hou4 qu4 na4zhong3 jie1qu1 xian2guang4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 rang4 gong1cheng2shi1 zai4 na4r5 bu4 shou4 gan1rao3 de5 gao3 ta1 de5 yan2jiu1，qing2kuang4 zhi3 hui4 bian4de5 geng1 zao1。"

msgid ""
"The kind that makes people rich. Point me in the direction of the guy who "
"runs this place. He'll thank you for it."
msgstr ""
"发财​的​生意​。​告诉​我​这​地方​管事​的​人​在​哪​，​他​日后​会谢​你​的​。\n"
"fa1cai2 de5 sheng1yi4。gao4su4 wo3 zhe4 di4fang1 guan3 shi4 de5 ren2 zai4 na3，ta1 ri4hou4 hui4 xie4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "The kind who would sell out his own gang."
msgstr ""
"但​你​出卖​过​自己​的​帮派​。\n"
"dan4 ni3 chu1mai4 guo4 zi4ji3 de5 bang1pai4。"

msgid ""
"The knife cuts both ways, Doc. What do you think that your neighbors will do"
" when they find out that you've been feeding human flesh to a pack of "
"ravenous ghouls for over a year?"
msgstr ""
"医生​，​出​了​这种​事​，​谁​都​别​想​跑​。​你​说​，​如果​你​的​邻居们​得知​这​一年多来​你​一直​在​拿​人类​血肉​饲喂​一群​尸鬼​，​他们​会​有​什么​反应​？\n"
"yi1sheng1，chu1 le5 zhe4zhong3 shi4，shei2 dou1 bie4 xiang3 pao2。ni3 shuo1，ru2guo3 ni3 de5 lin2 ju1 men5 de2zhi1 zhe4 yi1 nian2 duo1 lai2 ni3 yi1zhi2 zai4 na2 ren2lei4 xue4rou4 si4wei4 yi1 qun2 shi1 gui3，ta1men5 hui4 you3 shen2me5 fan3ying4？"

msgid ""
"The lab that Vauclair was talking about wasn't on the ground floor. So it's either in the basement or a sublevel.\n"
"\n"
"We go down. And we scour every level until we find it."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​提到​的​实验室​不​在​一层​。​所以​它​要么​在​地下室​，​要么​在​更深​的​地​下层​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​往下走​。​搜遍​每​一层​，​直到​找到​它​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ti2dao4 de5 shi2yan4shi4 bu4 zai4 yi1ceng2。suo3yi3 ta1 yao4me5 zai4 di4xia4shi4，yao4me5 zai4 geng1shen1 de5 de5 xia4ceng2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 wang3 xia4 zou3。sou1 bian4 mei3 yi1ceng2，zhi2dao4 zhao3dao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"The last I heard, Glory was on the north end of town. Dietrich was out getting coffee when all hell broke loose.\n"
"\n"
"Let's go get them."
msgstr ""
"据我所知​，​这​一切​发生​的​时候​，​格洛丽​在​镇子​北边​，​而迪​特里​希​出去​买​咖啡​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​赶紧​去​找​他们​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4wo3suo3zhi1，zhe4 yi1qie4 fa1sheng1 de5 shi2hou5，Ge2luo4li2 zai4 zhen4zi5 bei3bian1，er2 Di2te4li3xi1 chu1qu4 mai3 ka1fei1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gan3jin3 qu4 zhao3 ta1men5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"The last I saw of Emilie, she was being chased down by black IC. They'd gotten a trace on her.\n"
"\n"
"Then she must've jacked out, because she just disappeared. She looked really, really angry... \"livid\" would probably be a better word."
msgstr ""
"我​最后​看到​艾米莉​的​时候​，​她​正在​被​黑​IC​追赶​。​他们​发现​了​她​的​踪迹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​她​肯定​是​断开连接​了​，​因为​她​突然​一下​就​消失​了​。​她​看起来​非常​非常​生气​……​更​准确​来说​是​“​铁青​着​脸​”​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4hou4 kan4dao4 ai4 mi3 li4 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 zheng4zai4 bei4 hei1 IC zhui1gan3。ta1men5 fa1xian4 le5 ta1 de5 zong1ji4。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1 ken3ding4 shi4 duan4 kai1 lian2 jie1 le5，yin1wei4 ta1 tu1ran2 yi1xia4 jiu4 xiao1shi1 le5。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 fei1chang2 fei1chang2 sheng1qi4……geng1 zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1 shi4“tie3qing1 zhao2 lian3”。"

msgid "The last one?"
msgstr ""
"上​一个​？\n"
"shang4 yi1ge5？"

msgid ""
"The leader of the group is an elf with Asian features. He's obviously a vatjob; the bands of corded muscle that bulge out under his sleeves have a distinctly store-bought look to them.\n"
"\n"
"When he speaks, his voice comes out in a gravelly rumble."
msgstr ""
"这群人​的​首领​是​个​亚裔​相貌​的​精灵​。​他​明显​是​个​桶​装货​；​袖口​下​隆起​虬结​的​肌肉​一看​就​是从​商店​里​买​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​他​说话​时​，​声音​像​沙砾​般​沙哑​低沉​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 qun2 ren2 de5 shou3ling3 shi4 ge4 ya4yi4 xiang4mao4 de5 jing1ling2。ta1 ming2xian3 shi4 ge4 tong3 zhuang1huo4 ； xiu4kou3 xia4 long2qi3 qiu2 jie1 de5 ji1rou4 yi1 kan4 jiu4 shi4 cong2 shang1dian4 li3 mai3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 shuo1hua4 shi2，sheng1yin1 xiang4 sha1li4 ban1 sha1ya3 di1chen2。"

msgid ""
"The light in the containment cell turns red and begins to pulse. The smell "
"of ozone and something foul fills the air. "
msgstr ""
"收容​舱内​的​灯光​转为​红色​并​开始​闪烁​。​空气​中​弥漫着​臭氧​和​某种​恶臭​的​气味​。\n"
"shou1rong2 cang1 nei4 de5 deng1guang1 zhuai3 wei2 hong2se4 bing4 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4。kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 chou4yang3 he4 mou3zhong3 e4chou4 de5 qi4wei4。"

msgid ""
"The light in the containment chamber changes from green to red and then begins to pulse. The woman looks up at it, confused, before she turns back to you, the clear light of recognition appearing on her face. \n"
"\n"
"The recognition fades, you see something else - great, great age - and with it, a profound gratitude. "
msgstr ""
"收容​舱内​的​灯光​从​绿色​变为​红色​，​随后​开始​闪烁​。​女人​抬头​看着​它​，​一脸​困惑​，​随后​转过身​来​看着​你​，​脸上​闪过​一丝​明晰​的​光芒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​它​逐渐​消散​，​你​看到​另​一件​事物​—​—​无比​古老​的​岁月​—​—​随之而来​的​是​深深​的​感激​之情​。\n"
"\n"
"shou1rong2 cang1 nei4 de5 deng1guang1 cong2 lu:4se4 bian4wei2 hong2se4，sui2hou4 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4。nu:3ren2 tai2tou2 kan4 zhao2 ta1，yi1 lian3 kun4huo4，sui2hou4 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 kan4 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 ming2xi1 de5 guang1mang2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1 zhu2jian4 xiao1san4，ni3 kan4dao4 ling4 yi1 jian4 shi4wu4——wu2bi3 gu3lao3 de5 sui4yue4——sui2 zhi1 er2 lai2 de5 shi4 shen1shen1 de5 gan3ji1 zhi1 qing2。"

msgid ""
"The light in the containment chamber switches off and the woman looks up at "
"it, surprised. In the dim light of the cell, you can still make out her "
"yellow eyes dancing back and forth, back and forth, her hands clenching and "
"unclenching again and again. "
msgstr ""
"收容​舱内​的​灯光​熄灭​，​女人​抬头​望​向​它​，​显得​十分​惊讶​。​在​牢房​昏暗​的​光线​中​，​仍能​看见​她​那双​金黄色​的​眼睛​来回​闪烁​，​来回​闪烁​，​她​的​双手​不断​地​紧握​又​松开​，​反复​多次​。\n"
"shou1rong2 cang1 nei4 de5 deng1guang1 xi1mie4，nu:3ren2 tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 ta1，xian3de5 shi2fen1 jing1ya4。zai4 lao2fang2 hun1an4 de5 guang1xian4 zhong4，reng2 neng2 kan4jian4 ta1 na4 shuang1 jin1huang2se4 de5 yan3jing5 lai2hui2 shan3shuo4，lai2hui2 shan3shuo4，ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 bu4duan4 de5 jin3wo4 you4 song1kai1，fan3fu4 duo1ci4。"

msgid ""
"The light plays off of Eiger's face like a streetlight on rain-slick asphalt. Her face, neck, and chest are sheeted in slick, dark liquid.\n"
"\n"
"Blood - a lot of blood."
msgstr ""
"斑驳​的​光线​在​艾格尔​的​脸上​跳动​，​如同​街灯​映照在​雨后​湿滑​的​柏油路​上​。​她​的​脸庞​、​脖颈​和​胸口​都​被​一层​光滑​的​深色​液体​覆盖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​血​。​很多​的​血​。\n"
"\n"
"ban1bo2 de5 guang1xian4 zai4 Ai4ge2er3 de5 lian3 shang4 tiao4dong4，ru2tong2 jie1deng1 ying4 zhao4 zai4 yu3 hou4 shi1hua2 de5 bai3you2lu4 shang4。ta1 de5 lian3pang2、bo2geng3 he4 xiong1kou3 dou1 bei4 yi1ceng2 guang1hua2 de5 shen1se4 ye4ti3 fu4gai4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 xie3。hen3 duo1 de5 xie3。"

msgid "The lights are on, but nobody's home."
msgstr ""
"就​好像​开着机​，​不过​程序​没跑​起来​。\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 kai1 zhao2 ji1，bu4guo4 cheng2xu4 mei2 pao2 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"The lights in the bathroom come back on. The status light next to \"TRACK\" "
"$(scene.str_RedOrGreen)."
msgstr ""
"浴室​的​灯光​恢复​了​。​“​TRACK​”​旁边​的​状态​指示灯​$(scene.str_RedOrGreen)​。\n"
"yu4shi4 de5 deng1guang1 hui1fu4 le5。“TRACK” pang2bian1 de5 zhuang4tai4 zhi3 shi4 deng1 $(scene.str_RedOrGreen)。"

msgid ""
"The lights in the bathroom go out. The status light next to \"TRACK\" "
"$(scene.str_RedOrGreen)."
msgstr ""
"浴室​的​灯光​熄灭​了​。​“​TRACK​”​旁边​的​状态​指示灯​$(scene.str_RedOrGreen)​。\n"
"yu4shi4 de5 deng1guang1 xi1mie4 le5。“TRACK” pang2bian1 de5 zhuang4tai4 zhi3 shi4 deng1 $(scene.str_RedOrGreen)。"

msgid ""
"The line goes dead with a click.\n"
"\n"
"A moment later, the sound of your teammates' comm chatter floods back into your ears."
msgstr ""
"咔哒​一声​，​通话​挂断​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​队友​们​在​频道​里​聊天​的​嘈杂声​重新​涌进​你​的​耳​中​。\n"
"\n"
"ka3 da1 yi1sheng1，tong1hua4 gua4duan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，dui4you3 men5 zai4 pin2dao4 li3 liao2tian1 de5 cao2za2sheng1 chong2xin1 yong3jin4 ni3 de5 er3 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"The line goes dead with a click.\n"
"\n"
"You are, once again, alone."
msgstr ""
"链路​传来​咔哒​一声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​频道​再​一次​回归​寂静​。\n"
"\n"
"lian4lu4 chuan2lai2 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"pin2dao4 zai4 yi1ci4 hui2gui1 ji4jing4。"

msgid "The line goes silent."
msgstr ""
"线路​陷入​了​寂静​。\n"
"xian4lu4 xian4ru4 le5 ji4jing4。"

msgid "The line remains silent."
msgstr ""
"线路​仍然​没有​动静​。\n"
"xian4lu4 reng2ran2 mei2you3 dong4jing4。"

msgid ""
"The lines that make up the APEX avatar shimmer and pulse with a cool blue light, each according to its own rhythm. Occasional bursts of static plume out into the background, disintegrating into organic wisps of blue and white pixels.\n"
"\n"
"Taken as a whole, the image looks like it's crawling on the screen."
msgstr ""
"APEX​化身​的​线条​闪烁着​冷冽​的​蓝光​，​每条线​都​按着​自己​的​节奏​跳动​。​偶尔​有​静电​的​噼啪​爆裂​渗入​背景​，​最终​分解成​蓝白​相间​的​有机​微粒​消散​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​整体而言​，​这​幅​影像​仿佛​正在​屏幕​上​游移​。\n"
"\n"
"APEX hua4shen1 de5 xian4tiao2 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 leng3lie4 de5 lan2guang1，mei3 tiao2 xian4 dou1 an4 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 jie2zou4 tiao4dong4。ou3er3 you3 jing4dian4 de5 pi1pa1 bao4lie4 shen4ru4 bei4jing3，zui4zhong1 fen4 jie3 cheng2 lan2 bai2 xiang1jian4 de5 you3ji1 wei1li4 xiao1san4。\n"
"\n"
"zheng3 ti3 er2 yan2，zhe4 fu2 ying3xiang4 fang3fu2 zheng4zai4 ping2mu4 shang4 you2yi2。"

msgid ""
"The liquor in the bottle is crystal clear, and as you raise it you catch an intoxicating whiff of cloves and caramel. It tastes of sweet corn and walnuts, with a lingering aftertaste of buttery toffee.\n"
"\n"
"You swallow a swig, then return the bottle to Dietrich's outstretched hand. He takes a long pull on the bottle, then locks eyes with you."
msgstr ""
"瓶​中​的​酒液​晶莹剔透​，​丁香​与​焦糖​的​醉人​香气扑鼻​而​来​。​这酒​入口​时​带有​甜玉米​与​核桃​的​风味​，​余韵​则​萦绕​着​黄油​太妃糖​的​绵长​回味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​痛饮​一口​，​便​将​酒瓶​递回​迪​特里​希​伸出​的​手掌​。​他​也​猛地​灌​了​一大口​，​随即​与​你​四目​相对​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2 zhong4 de5 jiu3 ye4 jing1 ying2 ti1 tou4，ding1xiang1 yu4 jiao1tang2 de5 zui4ren2 xiang1 qi4 pu1 bi2 er2 lai2。zhe4 jiu3 ru4kou3 shi2 dai4you3 tian2 yu4 mi3 yu4 he2tao5 de5 feng1wei4，yu2yun4 ze2 ying2rao4 zhao2 huang2you2 tai4fei1tang2 de5 mian2chang2 hui2wei4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tong4yin3 yi1kou3，bian4 jiang1 jiu3 ping2 di4hui2 Di2te4li3xi1 shen1chu1 de5 shou3zhang3。ta1 ye3 meng3de5 guan4 le5 yi1 dai4 kou3，sui2ji2 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。"

msgid ""
"The liquor slides down your throat like motor oil. It's sickly sweet, with notes of juniper and hay. Danish Mjød.\n"
"\n"
"The flavor lingers on your tongue long after you finish drinking."
msgstr ""
"烈酒​如​机油​般滑过​你​的​喉咙​。​甜得​发腻​，​带​着​杜松子​与​干草​的​气息​。​丹麦​蜜酒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​饮尽​许久​，​余味​仍​在​舌尖​萦绕​不​散​。\n"
"\n"
"lie4jiu3 ru2 ji1you2 ban1 hua2 guo4 ni3 de5 hou2long2。tian2 de2 fa1 ni4，dai4 zhao2 du4song1zi3 yu4 gan1cao3 de5 qi4xi1。dan1mai4 mi4 jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"yin3 jin3 xu3jiu3，yu2wei4 reng2 zai4 she2jian1 ying2rao4 bu4 san3。"

msgid "The little generator chugs to life."
msgstr ""
"小型​发电机​启动​了​。\n"
"xiao3xing2 fa1dian4ji1 qi3dong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The living troll that serves as the chassis for all of this chrome has been outfitted with an inhibitor chip of some kind.\n"
"\n"
"From what you can tell, the purpose of this chip is to intercept and arrest any voluntary neural impulses sent out by the troll's brain. Autonomous functions, such as respiration, are allowed to continue unimpeded."
msgstr ""
"这个​活着​的​巨魔​不仅​是​这些​改造​的​载体​，​还​装有​某种​神经​抑制​芯片​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在你看来​，​这枚​芯片​的​作用​是​拦截​并​阻断​巨魔​大脑​发出​的​任何​神经​冲动​，​而​呼吸​等​自主​功能​则​可不​受​阻碍​地​继续​运作​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 huo2zhe5 de5 ju4mo2 bu4jin3 shi4 zhe4xie1 gai3zao4 de5 zai4ti3，hai2 zhuang1you3 mou3zhong3 shen2jing1 yi4zhi4 xin1pian4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 kan4 lai2，zhe4 mei2 xin1pian4 de5 zuo4yong4 shi4 lan2jie2 bing4 zu3duan4 ju4mo2 da4nao3 fa1chu1 de5 ren4he2 shen2jing1 chong1dong4，er2 hu1xi1 deng3 zi4zhu3 gong1neng2 ze2 ke3bu5 shou4 zu3ai4 de5 ji4xu4 yun4zuo4。"

msgid "The lock appears to be short circuited."
msgstr ""
"锁​看来​是​短路​了​。\n"
"suo3 kan4lai5 shi4 duan3lu4 le5。"

msgid "The locker opens with a click."
msgstr ""
"柜子​咔哒​一声​解锁​了​。\n"
"gui4zi5 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The locker opens with a click.\n"
"\n"
"Inside, you find a note."
msgstr ""
"柜子​咔哒​一声​解锁​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​放着​一张​便条​。\n"
"\n"
"gui4zi5 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 fang4 zhao2 yi1 zhang1 bian4tiao2。"

msgid ""
"The locker opens with a click.\n"
"\n"
"It's empty."
msgstr ""
"柜子​咔哒​一声​解锁​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​是​空​的​。\n"
"\n"
"gui4zi5 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 shi4 kong1 de5。"

msgid ""
"The locker opens with a click.\n"
"\n"
"Strewn in among a pile of dirty clothes, you find a credstick."
msgstr ""
"柜子​咔哒​一声​解锁​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​翻开​里面​的​脏​衣服​，​找到​一根​信用​棒​。\n"
"\n"
"gui4zi5 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fan1kai1 li3mian4 de5 zang4 yi1fu5，zhao3dao4 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4。"

msgid ""
"The locker opens with a click.\n"
"\n"
"There is a note inside."
msgstr ""
"柜子​咔哒​一声​解锁​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​放着​一张​便条​。\n"
"\n"
"gui4zi5 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 fang4 zhao2 yi1 zhang1 bian4tiao2。"

msgid ""
"The long and the short of it is that the Berlin chapter of Humanis is planning something. Something involving a large shipment of an extremely hazardous chemical.\n"
"\n"
"Their leader, Volker Stahl, is a vicious ideologue. It goes without saying that whatever he intends to do, it won't be good for us."
msgstr ""
"简单​来说​，​人类​至上​主义者​柏林​分部​正在​策划​一件​事​。​其中​涉及​一大批​极其​危险​的​化学物质​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​的​领袖​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔​是​个​邪恶​的​意识形态​主义者​。​毫无疑问​，​不管​他​有​什么​计划​，​对​我们​来说​都​不是​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"jian3dan1 lai2 shuo1，ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 bo2lin2 fen1bu4 zheng4zai4 ce4hua4 yi1 jian4 shi4。qi2zhong1 she4ji2 yi1 dai4 pi1 ji2qi2 wei1xian3 de5 hua4 xue2 wu4 zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 de5 ling3xiu4 Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3 shi4 ge4 xie2e4 de5 yi4shi2xing2tai4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3。hao2wu2yi2wen4，bu4guan3 ta1 you3 shen2me5 ji4hua4，dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 dou1 bu4shi4 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"The long and the short of it is, something has thrown off the balance "
"between magic and reality."
msgstr ""
"简单​来说​，​某种​力量​打破​了​魔法​与​现实​之间​的​平衡​。\n"
"jian3dan1 lai2 shuo1，mou3zhong3 li4liang5 da3po4 le5 mo2fa3 yu4 xian4shi2 zhi1jian1 de5 ping2heng2。"

msgid "The longer we argue about this, the longer it's gonna take."
msgstr ""
"我们​花越​多​时间​争论​这​事​，​浪费​的​时间​就​越久​。\n"
"wo3men5 hua1 yue4 duo1 shi2jian1 zheng1lun4 zhe4 shi4，lang4fei4 de5 shi2jian1 jiu4 yue4 jiu3。"

msgid ""
"The look of confusion on his face disappears, replaced by suspicion.\n"
"\n"
"His hand edges toward a large red button mounted to his desk."
msgstr ""
"他​脸上​的​困惑​表情​消失​了​，​取而代之​的​是​怀疑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​手​伸向​桌子​上​的​一个​红色​大​按钮​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 kun4huo4 biao3qing2 xiao1shi1 le5，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 huai2yi2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shou3 shen1 xiang4 zhuo1zi5 shang4 de5 yi1ge5 hong2se4 dai4 an4niu3。"

msgid ""
"The loss of a single chapterhouse isn't going to make a dent in Humanis' strength in this city. In fact, Stahl's death will only make the rest of Humanis even more bloodthirsty.\n"
"\n"
"The fact that a $(l.race) was responsible is just icing on the cake. They'll print up some new propaganda and paint themselves the victims."
msgstr ""
"失去​一处​分会​，​根本无法​撼动​人类​至上​主义者​在​这座​城市​的​力量​。​事实上​，​斯塔尔​之死​只会​让​其余​成员​更加​嗜血​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​$(l.race)​是​罪魁祸首​这一​事实​，​不过​是​锦上添花​罢了​。​他们​会​印制​新​的​宣传材料​，​把​自己​塑造成​受害者​。\n"
"\n"
"shi1qu4 yi1 chu3 fen1hui4，gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 han4dong4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 de5 li4liang5。shi4shi2shang4，Si1ta3er3 zhi1 si3 zhi3 hui4 rang4 qi2yu2 cheng2yuan2 geng4jia1 shi4xue4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 $(l.race) shi4 zui4kui2huo4shou3 zhe4 yi1 shi4shi2，bu4guo4 shi4 jin3shang4tian1hua1 ba4le5。ta1men5 hui4 yin4zhi4 xin1 de5 xuan1 chuan2 cai2 liao4，ba3 zi4ji3 su4 zao4 cheng2 shou4hai4zhe3。"

msgid ""
"The loss of a single chapterhouse isn't going to make a dent in Humanis' strength in this city. In fact, Stahl's death will only make the rest of Humanis even more bloodthirsty.\n"
"\n"
"They'll blame Stahl's death on the metahumans, print up some new propaganda, and paint themselves the victims."
msgstr ""
"失去​一处​分会​，​根本无法​撼动​人类​至上​主义者​在​这座​城市​的​力量​。​事实上​，​斯塔尔​之死​只会​让​其余​成员​更加​嗜血​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​会​把​斯塔尔​之死​归咎于​泛​人类​，​并​印制​新​的​宣传材料​，​把​自己​塑造成​受害者​。\n"
"\n"
"shi1qu4 yi1 chu3 fen1hui4，gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 han4dong4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 de5 li4liang5。shi4shi2shang4，Si1ta3er3 zhi1 si3 zhi3 hui4 rang4 qi2yu2 cheng2yuan2 geng4jia1 shi4xue4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 hui4 ba3 Si1ta3er3 zhi1 si3 gui1 jiu4 yu2 fan4 ren2lei4，bing4 yin4zhi4 xin1 de5 xuan1 chuan2 cai2 liao4，ba3 zi4ji3 su4 zao4 cheng2 shou4hai4zhe3。"

msgid ""
"The loss of van Wijk has been hard on everybody. He was well liked, and watching him die in such a horrible fashion has been hard on morale.\n"
"\n"
"The staff is still committed to the cause... they all know what they signed up for, and they know how important this is. But losing such a good man because of such basic lapses in lab safety has been a difficult pill to swallow.\n"
"\n"
"-Borchard"
msgstr ""
"范​维克​的​离世​让​大家​都​感到痛心​。​他​深受​大家​喜爱​，​看着​他​以​如此​惨烈​的​方式​离世​，​大家​都​受到​了​沉重打击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​工作人员​仍​坚守岗位​……​他们​深知​自己​肩负​的​使命​，​也​明白​此事​的​重要性​。​但​因​实验室​安全措施​的​疏漏​而​失去​这样​一位​优秀​同仁​，​实在​令人​难以​接受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​博​查德\n"
"\n"
"fan4 wei2 ke4 de5 li2shi4 rang4 da4jia1 dou1 gan3 dao4 tong4 xin1。ta1 shen1shou4 da4jia1 xi3ai4，kan4 zhao2 ta1 yi3 ru2ci3 can3lie4 de5 fang1shi4 li2shi4，da4jia1 dou1 shou4dao4 le5 chen2zhong4da3ji1。\n"
"\n"
"gong1zuo4ren2yuan2 reng2 jian1 shou3 gang3 wei4……ta1men5 shen1zhi1 zi4ji3 jian1fu4 de5 shi3ming4，ye3 ming2bai5 ci3shi4 de5 zhong4yao4xing4。dan4 yin1 shi2yan4shi4 an1quan2cuo4shi1 de5 shu1lou4 er2 shi1qu4 zhe4yang4 yi1 wei4 you1xiu4 tong2ren2，shi2zai4 ling4ren2 nan2yi3 jie1shou4。\n"
"\n"
"——bo2 cha2de2"

msgid ""
"The lymphocyte cells that have been produced here are robust and self-replicating, and they have proven viable in a wide variety of test animals.\n"
"\n"
"What any of this has to do with the Panacea project is not addressed."
msgstr ""
"在​此​产生​的​淋巴细胞​具有​强大​的​自我​复制​能力​，​并​在​多种​实验​动物​中​表现​出​良好​的​存活​能力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​内容​与​“​万能​药​”​项目​有何​关联​并未​提及​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ci3 chan3sheng1 de5 lin2ba1xi4bao1 ju4you3 qiang2da4 de5 zi4wo3 fu4zhi4 neng2li4，bing4 zai4 duo1zhong3 shi2yan4 dong4wu4 zhong4 biao3xian4 chu1 liang2hao3 de5 cun2huo2 neng2li4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 nei4rong2 yu4“wan4neng2 yao4” xiang4mu4 you3 he2 guan1lian2 bing4wei4 ti2ji2。"

msgid ""
"The macabre wreck of his armored chest heaves once, twice, then goes still.\n"
"\n"
"He's dead."
msgstr ""
"他​的​胸甲​残骸​剧烈地​抽动​了​一下​，​又​一下​，​然后​便​静止​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 xiong1jia3 can2hai2 ju4 lie4 de5 chou1dong4 le5 yi1xia4，you4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 bian4 jing4zhi3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The machine accepts the data upload, and only a few moments later a certified credstick is spat out of the coin slot.\n"
"\n"
"The phone's old LCD read-out displays the text: \">>>>>FREEDOM. EQUALITY. INFORMATION. SCHOCKWELLENREITER.<<<<<\""
msgstr ""
"机器​接受​了​数据​上传​，​片刻​之后​，​一枚​认证​信用​棒​便​从​硬币​槽​中​吐​了​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​电话​的​陈旧​液晶屏​上​显示​着​文字​：​“​>​>​>​>​>​自由​。​平等​。​信息​。​电波​骑士​。​<​<​<​<​<​”\n"
"\n"
"ji1qi4 jie1shou4 le5 shu4ju4 shang4chuan2，pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，yi1 mei2 ren4zheng4 xin4yong4 bang4 bian4 cong2 ying4bi4 cao2 zhong4 tu3 le5 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"dian4hua4 de5 chen2jiu4 ye4jing1ping2 shang4 xian3shi4 zhao2 wen2zi4：“>>>>>zi4you2。ping2deng3。xin4xi1。dian4Bo1qi2shi4。< < < < <”"

msgid ""
"The mage falls silent, and Jana goes back to work. It only takes a few minutes for her to screw, wire, and solder the canister into the harness. \n"
"\n"
"She inspects her work, nods, then turns to face you."
msgstr ""
"法师​不​说话​了​，​随后​简娜​又​继续​开始​工作​。​她​仅​用​几分钟​就​完成​了​罐体​的​螺钉​固定​、​线缆​连接​和​焊接​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​检查​了​自己​的​成果​，​点点头​，​转身​面对​你​。\n"
"\n"
"fa3shi1 bu4 shuo1hua4 le5，sui2hou4 Jian3na4 you4 ji4xu4 kai1shi3 gong1zuo4。ta1 jin3 yong4 ji1 fen4 zhong1 jiu4 wan2cheng2 le5 guan4 ti3 de5 luo2ding1 gu4ding4、xian4lan3 lian2jie1 he4 han4jie1 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jian3cha2 le5 zi4ji3 de5 cheng2guo3，dian3 dian3 tou2，zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"The mage half-turns from the elf to you, his eyes wide with alarm. The ethereal glow from his hands flickers and sparks. Jana screams something, but with the blood pounding in your ears, you can't make out the words.\n"
"\n"
"James' jaw drops open. You're on him before he can speak."
msgstr ""
"法师​从​精灵​身边​半​转身​望​向​你​，​眼中​满是​惊恐​。​他​掌心​飘渺​的​光芒​闪烁着​火花​。​简娜​尖叫​着​什么​，​但​耳畔​轰鸣​的​血流​声​让​你​听不清​她​的​话语​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​詹姆斯​的​下巴​倏然​张开​。​在​他​开口​前​，​你​已​扑​了​上去​。\n"
"\n"
"fa3shi1 cong2 jing1ling2 shen1bian1 ban4 zhuan3shen1 wang4 xiang4 ni3，yan3zhong1 man3 shi4 jing1kong3。ta1 zhang3xin1 piao1miao3 de5 guang1mang2 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 huo3hua1。Jian3na4 jian1jiao4 zhao2 shen2me5，dan4 er3pan4 hong1ming2 de5 xue4liu2 sheng1 rang4 ni3 ting1 bu4 qing1 ta1 de5 hua4yu3。\n"
"\n"
"zhan1mu3si1 de5 xia4ba5 shu1ran2 zhang1kai1。zai4 ta1 kai1kou3 qian2，ni3 yi3 pu1 le5 shang4qu4。"

msgid ""
"The mage's mouth tightens into a thin line. His hands clench and unclench, "
"and he fixes his gaze upon the train."
msgstr ""
"法师​的​嘴唇​抿​成​一条​细线​。​他​的​双手​紧握​又​松开​，​目光​死死​盯​着​那列​火车​。\n"
"fa3shi1 de5 zui3chun2 min3 cheng2 yi1 tiao2 xi4xian4。ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 you4 song1kai1，mu4guang1 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 na4 lie4 huo3che1。"

msgid "The mage's words are drowned out by the sudden wail of an alarm."
msgstr ""
"法师​口中​的​话语​被​骤然​响起​的​警报声​淹没​了​。\n"
"fa3shi1 kou3 zhong4 de5 hua4yu3 bei4 zhou4ran2 xiang3qi3 de5 jing3 bao4 sheng1 yan1mo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The mages wake us from our slumber... sometimes in twos, sometimes more.\n"
"\n"
"One is taken to another part of the facility. The testing lab. The rest remain in their cells.\n"
"\n"
"The mages run their tests, and the entire group dies."
msgstr ""
"法师​们​将​我们​从​沉睡​中​唤醒​……​有时​两人​一组​，​有时​更​多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一人​被​带​往​设施​的​另​一​区域​，​也​就是​实验室​。​其余​人则​留在​牢房​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​法师​们​进行​实验​，​整组​人​最终​会​全部​死亡​。\n"
"\n"
"fa3shi1 men5 jiang1 wo3men5 cong2 chen2shui4 zhong4 huan4xing3……you3shi2 liang3 ren2 yi1 zu3，you3shi2 geng1 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 ren2 bei4 dai4 wang3 she4shi1 de5 ling4 yi1 qu1yu4，ye3 jiu4shi4 shi2yan4shi4。qi2yu2 ren2 ze2 liu2 zai4 lao2fang2 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"fa3shi1 men5 jin4xing2 shi2yan4，zheng3 zu3 ren2 zui4zhong1 hui4 quan2bu4 si3wang2。"

msgid ""
"The magical background count of the world is rising, and as the Earth becomes more and more mana-rich, we're seeing increasingly devastating results.\n"
"\n"
"Paranatural disasters like the mana rift that consumed Sydney. Widespread madness. And most terribly, the appearance of dangerous new paranormal lifeforms."
msgstr ""
"世界​的​魔法​背景​数值​正在​上升​，​随着​地球​变得​越来越​富含​魔力​，​我们​目睹​的​后果​也​日益​毁灭性​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​超自然​灾难​，​比如​吞噬​了​悉尼​的​魔力​裂隙​。​大规模​的​疯狂​蔓延​。​最​可怕​的​是​，​危险​的​新型​超自然​生命体​开始​出现​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4 de5 mo2fa3 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 zheng4zai4 shang4sheng1，sui2zhe5 di4qiu2 bian4de5 yue4lai2yue4 fu4han2 mo2li4，wo3men5 mu4du3 de5 hou4guo3 ye3 ri4yi4 hui3mie4xing4。\n"
"\n"
"chao1zi4ran2 zai1nan4，bi3ru2 tun1shi4 le5 xi1ni2 de5 mo2li4 lie4xi4。da4gui1mo2 de5 feng1kuang2 man4yan2。zui4 ke3pa4 de5 shi4，wei1xian3 de5 xin1xing2 chao1zi4ran2 sheng1 ming4 ti3 kai1shi3 chu1xian4。"

msgid ""
"The magical research ties it all together. It's doubtful that any of this would work at all if magic weren't involved.\n"
"\n"
"Through all of this, one thing is certain: Panacea is *dangerous.* And if Vauclair is planning on releasing it, he has to be stopped."
msgstr ""
"魔法​研究​将​这​一切​串联​起来​。​如果​没有​魔法​的​参与​，​似乎​这​一切​都​无法​实现​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这​所有​的​一切​中​，​有​一件​事是​确定​的​：​“​万能​药​”​十分​*​危险​*​。​如果​沃​克莱尔​打算​释放​它​，​那么​就​必须​阻止​他​。\n"
"\n"
"mo2fa3 yan2jiu1 jiang1 zhe4 yi1qie4 chuan4lian2 qi3lai5。ru2guo3 mei2you3 mo2fa3 de5 can1yu4，si4hu1 zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 wu2fa3 shi2xian4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 suo3you3 de5 yi1qie4 zhong4，you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 shi4 que4ding4 de5：“wan4neng2 yao4” shi2fen1*wei1xian3*。ru2guo3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 da3suan4 shi4fang4 ta1，na4me5 jiu4 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"The man before you is of average build and in nondescript dress. \n"
"\n"
"He's leaning against the old wooden cabinet, reading a book. As you approach, he looks up and casts a warm smile in your direction."
msgstr ""
"你​面前​的​这个​男人​身材​普通​，​穿着​朴素​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​正​靠​在​旧​木柜​上​看书​。​当​你​走近​时​，​他​抬起​头​，​向​你​投来​一个​温暖​的​微笑​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mian4qian2 de5 zhe4ge5 nan2ren2 shen1cai2 pu3tong1，chuan1zhuo2 pu3su4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zheng1 kao4 zai4 jiu4 mu4 ju3 shang4 kan4shu1。dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，ta1 tai2qi3 tou2，xiang4 ni3 tou2 lai2 yi1ge5 wen1nuan3 de5 wei1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"The man before you is of average build, in nondescript dress. Nevertheless, he carries himself with a calm authority.\n"
"\n"
"He stares at you with cold, unwavering eyes."
msgstr ""
"你​面前​的​这个​男人​身材​普通​，​穿着​朴素​。​不过​，​他​举止​沉稳​，​充满​威严​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​向​你​投来​冰冷​严峻​的​目光​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mian4qian2 de5 zhe4ge5 nan2ren2 shen1cai2 pu3tong1，chuan1zhuo2 pu3su4。bu4guo4，ta1 ju3zhi3 chen2wen3，chong1man3 wei1yan2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang4 ni3 tou2 lai2 bing1leng3 yan2jun4 de5 mu4guang1。"

msgid ""
"The man behind the counter looks tired. His lids are heavy, and his eyes are"
" bloodshot."
msgstr ""
"柜台​后面​的​男人​看起来​很​疲惫​。​他​眼皮​沉重​，​双眼​布满​血丝​。\n"
"gui4tai2 hou4mian5 de5 nan2ren2 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 pi2bei4。ta1 yan3pi2 chen2zhong4，shuang1yan3 bu4man3 xue4si1。"

msgid ""
"The man in the cell stares at you through red-rimmed eyes. His body is marked with obvious signs of mistreatment and neglect.\n"
"\n"
"He opens his mouth to speak, then closes it again and swallows hard. He tries again, and the voice that comes from him is tremulous and weak."
msgstr ""
"牢房​里​的​男人​用​红肿​的​眼睛​盯​着​你​。​他​的​身体​上满​是​遭受​虐待​和​忽视​的​明显​痕迹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​张嘴​欲言​，​又​闭上嘴​用力​咽​了​下​唾沫​。​再次​尝试​开口​时​，​他​发出​的​声音​颤抖​而​微弱​。\n"
"\n"
"lao2fang2 li3 de5 nan2ren2 yong4 hong2zhong3 de5 yan3jing5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 shen1ti3 shang4 man3 shi4 zao1shou4 nu:e4dai4 he4 hu1shi4 de5 ming2xian3 hen2ji4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhang1zui3 yu4 yan2，you4 bi4 shang4 zui3 yong4li4 yan1 le5 xia4 tuo4mo5。zai4ci4 chang2shi4 kai1kou3 shi2，ta1 fa1chu1 de5 sheng1yin1 chan4dou3 er2 wei1ruo4。"

msgid ""
"The man waiting on the other side of the door is wild-eyed and bedraggled. He looks as though he hasn't eaten in weeks; there's almost no flesh on his bones. His beard is long and tangled, and his jacket is smeared with grease.\n"
"\n"
"He nearly jumps out of his own skin at the sight of you."
msgstr ""
"站​在​门内​的​男人​眼神​狂乱​，​衣衫褴褛​。​他​看起来​仿佛​数周​没有​进食​，​骨头​几乎​凸出​皮肤​；​胡须​长而​纠结​，​外套​沾满​油污​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一​见到​你​，​他​吓​得​浑身​一颤​。\n"
"\n"
"zhan4 zai4 men2 nei4 de5 nan2ren2 yan3shen2 kuang2luan4，yi1 shan1 lan2 lu:3。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 fang3fu2 shu4zhou1 mei2you3 jin4shi2，gu3tou5 ji1hu1 tu1chu1 pi2fu1 ； hu2xu1 zhang3 er2 jiu1jie2，wai4tao4 zhan1man3 you2wu1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 jian4dao4 ni3，ta1 he4 de2 hun2shen1 yi1 chan4。"

msgid ""
"The mechanical bridge smoothly slides back in and angles upwards, clearing "
"the path for the train."
msgstr ""
"机械​桥​平稳​地滑​回​原位​，​随即​向上倾斜​，​为​列车​让出​通路​。\n"
"ji1xie4 qiao2 ping2wen3 di4hua2 hui2 yuan2wei4，sui2ji2 xiang4 shang4 qing1 xie2，wei2 lie4che1 rang4 chu1 tong1lu4。"

msgid ""
"The mechanical bridge smoothly slides out and spans the gap over the tracks."
msgstr ""
"机械​桥​平稳​地滑出​，​横跨​在​轨道​间​的​空隙​之上​。\n"
"ji1xie4 qiao2 ping2wen3 de5 hua2 chu1，heng2kua4 zai4 gui3dao4 jian1 de5 kong4xi4 zhi1shang4。"

msgid ""
"The media tray of the DVD player slides out of its battered plastic case."
msgstr ""
"DVD​播放器​的​媒体​托盘​从​破旧​的​塑料​壳子​中滑​了​出来​。\n"
"DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 de5 mei2ti3 tuo1pan2 cong2 po4jiu4 de5 su4liao4 ke2 zi3 zhong4 hua2 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid "The megaphone really isn't necessary, man. I'm standing right here."
msgstr ""
"扩音器​没​必要​吧​，​伙计​。​我​不​就​在​这儿​呢​。\n"
"kuo4yin1qi4 mei2 bi4yao4 ba1，huo3ji5。wo3 bu4 jiu4 zai4 zhe4r5 ni2。"

msgid ""
"The memories of Monika's violent convulsions and arching back rush to the surface.\n"
"\n"
"It seems impossible, but the evidence suggests that sometime before he died, this man spasmed hard enough to break his own spine."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​剧烈​抽搐​、​背脊​弓起​的​记忆​瞬间​涌上​你​的​心头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​似乎​难以置信​，​但​证据​表明​，​此人​在​临死前​曾​发生​剧烈​痉挛​，​以至于​他​折断​了​自己​的​脊柱​。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 ju4lie4 chou1chu4、bei4ji3 gong1 qi3 de5 ji4yi4 shun4jian1 yong3 shang4 ni3 de5 xin1tou2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 si4hu1 nan2yi3zhi4xin4，dan4 zheng4ju4 biao3ming2，ci3 ren2 zai4 lin2 si3 qian2 ceng2 fa1sheng1 ju4lie4 jing4luan2，yi3zhi4yu2 ta1 zhe2duan4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 ji3zhu4。"

msgid ""
"The memory stick Kami just handed you should contain all the information Herr Amsel requires from our chef in the field.\n"
"\n"
"Should you require my services in the future, you know where to find me. Until then, good day."
msgstr ""
"卡米​刚刚​交给​你​的​记忆棒​里​，​应该​存有​阿姆​泽尔​先生​需要​我们​的​现场​厨师​提供​的​所有​信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​今后​需要​我​的​服务​，​你​知道​该来​哪里找​我​。​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"Ka3mi3 gang1gang5 jiao1gei3 ni3 de5 ji4yi4bang4 li3，ying1gai1 cun2you3 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 xu1yao4 wo3men5 de5 xian4chang3 chu2shi1 ti2gong1 de5 suo3you3 xin4xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 jin1hou4 xu1yao4 wo3 de5 fu2wu4，ni3 zhi1dao4 gai1 lai2 na3 li3 zhao3 wo3。zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"The mere suggestion of that might have been enough to provoke Laine. (h)"
msgstr ""
"仅仅​是​这样​的​建议​都​足以​激怒​莱恩​了​。\n"
"jin3jin3 shi4 zhe4yang4 de5 jian4yi4 dou1 zu2yi3 ji1nu4 lai2en1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The message ends, and the image fades. You find yourself back at your inbox."
msgstr ""
"消息​结束​，​图像​消失​。​你​发现自己​回到​了​收件箱​界面​。\n"
"xiao1xi5 jie2shu4，tu2xiang4 xiao1shi1。ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 hui2dao4 le5 shou1jian4xiang1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The message fades from the screen, and a button on the console begins to "
"flash."
msgstr ""
"消息​从​屏幕​上​逐渐​消失​，​控制​台上​的​一个​按钮​开始​闪烁​起来​。\n"
"xiao1xi5 cong2 ping2mu4 shang4 zhu2jian4 xiao1shi1，kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 yi1ge5 an4niu3 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"The metal of the door is so thick that the sound of your fist barely registers. \n"
"\n"
"Your hand hurts."
msgstr ""
"门​的​金属​太厚​了​，​几乎​听​不到​你​拳头​的​声音​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​手​很​疼​。\n"
"\n"
"men2 de5 jin1shu3 tai4 hou4 le5，ji1hu1 ting1 bu4dao4 ni3 quan2tou5 de5 sheng1yin1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 shou3 hen3 teng2。"

msgid ""
"The metamagical theory detailed here goes way over your head, but you're able to pick out bits and pieces of what the entry is saying.\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, the hermetic theoreticians here have developed a way to stabilize decaying isotopes. The technique has proven effective at prolonging the half-life of radioactive material well beyond its usual limits, and preventing it from emitting harmful radiation in equal measure."
msgstr ""
"这里​详细​阐述​的​超​魔法​理论​对​你​来说​可能​过于​深奥​，​但​你​还是​能​从中​捕捉到​一些​关键​信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​的​赫尔墨斯​理论家​们​显然​已经​开发​出​一种​稳定​衰变​同位素​的​方法​。​该​技术​已​被​证实​能够​显著​延长​放射性物质​的​半衰期​，​使​其远​超常规​极限​，​同时​也​能​有效​阻止​其​释放​有害​辐射​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 xiang2xi4 chan3shu4 de5 chao1 mo2fa3 li3lun4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 ke3neng2 guo4yu2 shen1ao4，dan4 ni3 hai2shi5 neng2 cong2zhong1 bu3 zhuo1 dao4 yi1xie1 guan1jian4 xin4xi1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 he4er3mo4si1 li3lun4jia1 men5 xian3ran2 yi3jing1 kai1fa1 chu1 yi1zhong3 wen3ding4 shuai1bian4 tong2wei4su4 de5 fang1fa3。gai1 ji4shu4 yi3 bei4 zheng4shi2 neng2gou4 xian3zhu4 yan2chang2 fang4 she4 xing4 wu4 zhi4 de5 ban4shuai1qi1，shi3 qi2 yuan3 chao1 chang2 gui1 ji2xian4，tong2shi2 ye3 neng2 you3xiao4 zu3zhi3 qi2 shi4fang4 you3hai4 fu2she4。"

msgid ""
"The militia captain stands at alert, her eyes tracking slowly across the "
"market before coming to rest on you."
msgstr ""
"民兵​队长​站​在​原地​警戒​，​她​的​目光​在​市场​上​慢慢​搜寻​，​最后​停留​在​你​身上​。\n"
"min2bing1 dui4zhang3 zhan4 zai4 yuan2di4 jing3jie4，ta1 de5 mu4guang1 zai4 shi4chang3 shang4 man4man4 sou1xun2，zui4hou4 ting2liu2 zai4 ni3 shen1shang5。"

msgid ""
"The moment she raises her hand to you, Dante’s ears lay back and he lets out a low growl.\n"
"\n"
"Reflexively, she takes a half-step back."
msgstr ""
"当​她​朝​你​抬手​的​瞬间​，​但丁​耷拉​下​耳朵​，​发出​低沉​的​吼声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​条件反射​般​后退​了​半步​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 chao2 ni3 tai2 shou3 de5 shun4jian1，dan4ding1 da1la5 xia4 er3duo5，fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 hou3sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tiao2jian4fan3she4 ban1 hou4tui4 le5 ban4 bu4。"

msgid ""
"The money is already spent, $(l.name). I can't get a refund, and the cleanup costs on getting the building up and running would ruin me. So it's going to sit idle, one way or the other.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. I already have what I need from the facility. If your little friend wants to play out his fantasies in there, he's more than welcome to - I wash my hands of it."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​钱​我​都​花​了​，​也​没​办法​退款​，​而​让​大楼​重新​运转​起来​的​清理​费用​会​让​我​直接​破产​。​所以​它​就​这么​搁着​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管怎么​说​，​我​已经​从​设施​里​拿到​了​我​需要​的​东西​，​如果​你​那位​小朋友​想​在​里面​尽情​发泄​他​的​幻想​，​我​完全​没​意见​—​—​反正​跟​我​没关系​了​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，qian2 wo3 dou1 hua1 le5，ye3 mei2 ban4fa3 tui4kuan3，er2 rang4 da4lou2 chong2xin1 yun4zhuan3 qi3lai5 de5 qing1li3 fei4yong4 hui4 rang4 wo3 zhi2jie1 po4chan3。suo3yi3 ta1 jiu4 zhe4me5 ge1 zhao2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 guan3 zen3 ma2 shuo1，wo3 yi3jing1 cong2 she4shi1 li3 na2dao4 le5 wo3 xu1yao4 de5 dong1xi1，ru2guo3 ni3 na4 wei4 xiao3peng2you3 xiang3 zai4 li3mian4 jin4qing2 fa1xie4 ta1 de5 huan4xiang3，wo3 wan2quan2 mei2 yi4jian4——fan3zheng4 gen1 wo3 mei2guan1xi5 le5。"

msgid ""
"The money transfer took care of Blitz's debt to Mr. Grinder. Consider this "
"the interest."
msgstr ""
"转账​是​布里​茨​和​“​绞肉机​”​先生​之间​的​债务​问题​。​就​当​这​是​利息​吧​。\n"
"zhuan3zhang4 shi4 Bu4li3ci2 he4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 zhi1jian1 de5 zhai4wu4 wen4ti2。jiu4 dang1 zhe4 shi4 li4xi1 ba1。"

msgid "The money wasn't worth it. He had to be stopped."
msgstr ""
"这笔​钱​不值​当​。​必须​要​阻止​他​才​行​。\n"
"zhe4 bi3 qian2 bu4zhi2 dang1。bi4xu1 yao4 zu3zhi3 ta1 cai2 xing2。"

msgid "The money's mine, dwarf. Now get out of my way."
msgstr ""
"这钱​归​我​了​，​矮人​。​闪​一边​去​。\n"
"zhe4 qian2 gui1 wo3 le5，ai3ren2。shan3 yi1bian1 qu4。"

msgid ""
"The monitor behind him comes to life, and a grainy video feed flickers onto the screen.\n"
"\n"
"A Eurasian newscaster stands on the edge of a scene of carnage, clutching her microphone close. An ork in work coveralls stands beside her, blinking against the glare of the noonday sun."
msgstr ""
"他​身后​的​显示器​亮​起​，​画面​闪烁着​粗糙​的​视频信号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一位​欧亚​混血​的​新闻​主播​站​在​屠杀​现场​边缘​，​紧握着​话筒​。​身旁​站​着​一个​穿着​工作服​的​兽​人​，​正​眯眼​抵御​正午​的​刺眼​阳光​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen1hou4 de5 xian3shi4qi4 liang4 qi3，hua4mian4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 cu1cao1 de5 shi4 pin2 xin4 hao4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wei4 ou1ya4 hun4xue4 de5 xin1wen2 zhu3bo1 zhan4 zai4 tu2sha1 xian4chang3 bian1yuan2，jin3 wo4 zhao2 hua4tong3。shen1 pang2 zhan4 zhao2 yi1ge5 chuan1zhuo2 gong1zuo4fu2 de5 shou4 ren2，zheng1 mi1yan3 di3yu4 zheng4wu3 de5 ci4yan3 yang2guang1。"

msgid ""
"The most basic medkit that heals you or any team member. Consumed when used."
" Can be used outside of combat."
msgstr ""
"最​基础​的​急救包​，​可​治疗​你​或​任何​队友​。​使用​时​将​被​消耗​。​可​在​非战斗​状态​下​使用​。\n"
"zui4 ji1chu3 de5 ji2jiu4bao1，ke3 zhi4liao2 ni3 huo4 ren4he2 dui4you3。shi3yong4 shi2 jiang1 bei4 xiao1hao4。ke3 zai4 fei1 zhan4 dou3 zhuang4tai4 xia4 shi3yong4。"

msgid "The most basic spell every mage knows and always has ready."
msgstr ""
"每个​法师​都​知晓​，​并且​永远​保持​蓄势待发​的​基础​法术​。\n"
"mei3ge4 fa3shi1 dou1 zhi1xiao3，bing4qie3 yong3yuan3 bao3chi2 xu4shi4dai4fa1 de5 ji1chu3 fa3shu4。"

msgid ""
"The most terrible of the Great Dragons. There are those who would disagree, but they never experienced the terror of living in her shadow.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances at Glory.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are far too young to remember her, of course. But for Germans of my generation, the name \"Feuerschwinge\" is synonymous with chaos, destruction, and death."
msgstr ""
"她​是​巨龙​一族​中​最​可怕​的​存在​。​也许​有些​人​不​同意​这个​说法​，​但​他们​从没​经历​过​当年​那种​活在​她​阴影​之下​的​恐惧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​瞥​了​一眼​格洛丽​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​了​，​你​那​时候​还​太小​，​记不住​她​的​事​。​但​对​我们​这​一代​德国人​来说​，​“​火翼​”​这个​名字​就​等同于​混乱​、​毁灭​以及​死亡​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ju4long2 yi1zu2 zhong4 zui4 ke3pa4 de5 cun2zai4。ye3xu3 you3xie1 ren2 bu4 tong2yi4 zhe4ge5 shuo1fa3，dan4 ta1men5 cong2mei2 jing1li4 guo4 dang1nian2 na4zhong3 huo2 zai4 ta1 yin1ying3 zhi1xia4 de5 kong3ju4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 Ge2luo4li2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 le5，ni3 na4 shi2hou5 hai2 tai4 xiao3，ji4bu5zhu4 ta1 de5 shi4。dan4 dui4 wo3men5 zhe4 yi1dai4 de2guo2ren2 lai2 shuo1，“Huo3yi4” zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 jiu4 deng3 tong2 yu2 hun4luan4、hui3mie4 yi3ji2 si3wang2。"

msgid "The mouse is right. Let's get upstairs."
msgstr ""
"老鼠​说得对​。​我们​上楼​。\n"
"lao3shu3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 shang4lou2。"

msgid ""
"The music out here on the floor is way too loud for comfort. The scene going down at the bar is even louder.\n"
"\n"
"The dealer-on-duty stands impassively behind the bar. A desperate-looking young woman is pleading with him, apparently to little effect."
msgstr ""
"这​层楼​里​放​的​音乐​声音​大得​叫​人​难受​，​但​酒吧​那边​的​动静​还要​更大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当班​的​酒保​面​无表情​地站​在​吧台​后​。​一个​面色​焦急​的​年轻​女孩​正在​求​他​，​不过​显然​没什么​成效​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ceng2lou2 li3 fang4 de5 yin1yue4 sheng1yin1 dai4 de2 jiao4 ren2 nan2shou4，dan4 jiu3ba1 na4bian5 de5 dong4jing4 hai2 yao4 geng1 dai4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ban1 de5 jiu3bao3 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 zhan4 zai4 ba1tai2 hou4。yi1ge5 mian4se4 jiao1ji2 de5 nian2qing1 nu:3hai2 zheng4zai4 qiu2 ta1，bu4guo4 xian3ran2 mei2shen2me5 cheng2xiao4。"

msgid ""
"The musical tones of the elvish tongue pour out of his mouth again, but you can't make out a word. His dialect is quite foreign; it's unlike the form of Sperethiel spoken by the elves of Tír na nÓg.\n"
"\n"
"The elf falls silent. He looks just as frustrated as mage is."
msgstr ""
"精灵​语​那​旋律​般的​语调​再次​从​他​口中​流淌​而出​，​但​你​听不懂​半句​。​他​的​方言​完全​陌生​，​与​提尔纳诺​的​精灵​所说​的​精灵​语​截然不同​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​精灵​沉默​了​。​他​看起来​和​那位​法师​一样​沮丧​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 yu3 na4 xuan2lu:4 ban1 de5 yu3diao4 zai4ci4 cong2 ta1 kou3 zhong4 liu2tang3 er2 chu1，dan4 ni3 ting1bu5dong3 ban4 ju4。ta1 de5 fang1yan2 wan2quan2 mo4sheng1，yu4 ti2 er3 na4 nuo4 de5 jing1ling2 suo3 shuo1 de5 jing1ling2 yu3 jie2ran2bu4tong2。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 chen2mo4 le5。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 he4 na4 wei4 fa3shi1 yi1yang4 ju3sang4。"

msgid ""
"The name is Herr Buchman, and it depends on what’s good. {{GM}}He turns from"
" you without another word, not as much disinterested in continuing the "
"conversation so much as he thinks his project is more worth his time than "
"your prattle.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"叫​我​布克​曼​先生​，​以及​得​看​你​觉得​什么​是​好​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转过身​去​，​未​再​多言​。​与其说​他​对​继续​交谈​毫无​兴趣​，​不如说​他​认为​自己​手头​的​事情​比​与​你​的​闲谈​更​值得​投入​时间​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"jiao4 wo3 bu4 ke4 man4 xian1sheng5，yi3ji2 de2 kan4 ni3 jue2de5 shen2me5 shi4 hao3 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4，wei4 zai4 duo1yan2。yu4 qi2 shuo1 ta1 dui4 ji4xu4 jiao1tan2 hao2wu2 xing4qu4，bu4 ru2 shuo1 ta1 ren4wei2 zi4ji3 shou3tou2 de5 shi4qing5 bi3 yu4 ni3 de5 xian2tan2 geng1 zhi2de5 tou2ru4 shi2jian1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "The names change but the forever task *is*. "
msgstr ""
"名字​会变​，​但​永恒​的​使命​*​不变​*​。\n"
"ming2zi5 hui4 bian4，dan4 yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4*bu4bian4*。"

msgid ""
"The nest has served its purpose and you leave it behind, taking to the air, exulting in the flex of your muscles, the spread of your wings, the wind on your scales.\n"
"\n"
"As you soar over mountains even older than you, the memories come flooding back. Wheeling in the sunshine, basking in the sun. The smell of the green. The sounds of nature’s symphony. Your heart fills with the thought. "
msgstr ""
"巢穴​已​完成​其​使命​，​你​离开​它​，​展翅高飞​，​沉醉于​肌肉​的​舒展​、​翅膀​的​展开​，​以及​风拂过​鳞片​的​触感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​翱翔​于​比​你​更​古老​的​山峦​之上​，​往事​如​潮水般​涌回​。​在​阳光​下​盘旋​，​沐浴​阳光​。​绿意​的​芬芳​。​大自然​交响乐​的​旋律​。​你​的​心​被​这​思绪​填满​。\n"
"\n"
"chao2xue2 yi3 wan2cheng2 qi2 shi3ming4，ni3 li2kai1 ta1，zhan3chi4gao1fei1，chen2 zui4 yu2 ji1rou4 de5 shu1zhan3、chi4bang3 de5 zhan3kai1，yi3ji2 feng1 fu2 guo4 lin2pian4 de5 chu4gan3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 ao2xiang2 yu2 bi3 ni3 geng1 gu3lao3 de5 shan1luan2 zhi1shang4，wang3shi4 ru2 chao2 shui3 ban1 yong3 hui2。zai4 yang2guang1 xia4 pan2xuan2，mu4yu4 yang2guang1。lu:4 yi4 de5 fen1fang1。da4zi4ran2 jiao1xiang3yue4 de5 xuan2lu:4。ni3 de5 xin1 bei4 zhe4 si1xu4 tian2man3。"

msgid ""
"The new formula arrived today! \"Formula 17.\"\n"
"\n"
"I swear, whoever names these things must have no imagination at all. Formula 17?\n"
"\n"
"Honestly."
msgstr ""
"新​配方​今天​到​了​！​叫​“​17​号​配方​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说真的​，​给​这些​东西​命名​的​人​真是​没有​一点​想象力​。​17​号​配方​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​真的假​的​。\n"
"\n"
"xin1 pei4fang1 jin1tian1 dao4 le5！jiao4“17 hao4 pei4fang1”。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1zhen1de5，gei3 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 ming4ming2 de5 ren2 zhen1shi5 mei2you3 yi1dian3 xiang3xiang4li4。17 hao4 pei4fang1？\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 de5 jia3 de5。"

msgid ""
"The new library is marvelous, $(l.name). You have worked miracles for this organization.\n"
"\n"
"Our next goal is to purchase a set of trode nets for our new work training program. I have high hopes for this plan, $(l.name)... with these devices, we could teach job skills to the least-educated members of our society in a fraction of the time that it would take for them to learn on their own."
msgstr ""
"新​图书馆​真是​太棒了​，​$(l.name)​。​你​为​我们​组织​做​了​太​多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​的​下个​目标​是​为​我们​的​新​工作​培训​计划​购买​一套​电极​网络​。​我​对​这​一​计划​寄予厚望​，​$(l.name)​……​有​了​这些​设备​，​我们​就​可以​向​社区​内受​教育​程度​最低​的​人​传授​工作​技能​，​而且​只​需要​占用​他们​的​一小部分​自学​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"xin1 tu2shu1guan3 zhen1shi5 tai4 bang4 le5，$(l.name)。ni3 wei2 wo3men5 zu3zhi1 zuo4 le5 tai4 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 xia4ge5 mu4biao1 shi4 wei2 wo3men5 de5 xin1 gong1zuo4 pei2xun4 ji4hua4 gou4mai3 yi1tao4 dian4ji2 wang3luo4。wo3 dui4 zhe4 yi1 ji4hua4 ji4yu3hou4wang4，$(l.name)……you3 le5 zhe4xie1 she4bei4，wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 xiang4 she4qu1 nei4 shou4 jiao4yu4 cheng2du4 zui4 di1 de5 ren2 chuan2shou4 gong1zuo4 ji4neng2，er2qie3 zhi3 xu1yao4 zhan4yong4 ta1men5 de5 yi1xiao3bu4fen4 zi4xue2 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"The note disappears, and for a moment, the screen goes blank. Suddenly, image of a news correspondent flashes onto the screen, accompanied by a brief orchestral flourish. \n"
"\n"
"A time stamp in the upper right corner of the screen reveals the date: Aug. 22, 2012."
msgstr ""
"旁白​消失​了​，​屏幕​瞬间​变成​空白​。​突然​，​屏幕​上​闪现​出​一位​新闻记者​的​图像​，​并​伴有​简短​的​管弦乐​旋律​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​右上角​的​时间​戳​显示​了​日期​：​2012​年​8​月​22​日​。\n"
"\n"
"pang2bai2 xiao1shi1 le5，ping2mu4 shun4jian1 bian4cheng2 kong4bai2。tu1ran2，ping2mu4 shang4 shan3xian4 chu1 yi1 wei4 xin1wen2ji4zhe3 de5 tu2xiang4，bing4 ban4you3 jian3duan3 de5 guan3xian2yue4 xuan2lu:4。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 you4 shang4 jiao3 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 le5 ri4qi1：2012 nian2 8 yue4 22 ri4。"

msgid "The note reads, \"Do not open.\""
msgstr ""
"便条​上​写​着​：​“​不要​打开​。​”\n"
"bian4tiao2 shang4 xie3 zhao2：“bu4yao4 da3kai1。”"

msgid ""
"The notes also discuss the bio-agent \"Doom,\" and the resident scientists' efforts to deconstruct it.\n"
"\n"
"It appears as though they are attempting to improve upon the formula in some way."
msgstr ""
"笔记​中​还​提到​了​生物制剂​“​末日​”​，​以及​驻地​科学家​们​试图​对​其​进行​分解​的​努力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​他们​似乎​正在​以​某种​方式​试图​改进​该​制剂​的​配方​。\n"
"\n"
"bi3ji4 zhong4 hai2 ti2dao4 le5 sheng1wu4zhi4ji4“mo4ri4”，yi3ji2 zhu4di4 ke1xue2jia1 men5 shi4tu2 dui4 qi2 jin4xing2 fen1jie3 de5 nu3li4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 ta1men5 si4hu1 zheng4zai4 yi3 mou3zhong3 fang1shi4 shi4tu2 gai3jin4 gai1 zhi4ji4 de5 pei4fang1。"

msgid ""
"The notes go on to suggest that Formula 17 was developed as a component of a larger project called \"Atlas.\" \n"
"\n"
"Apparently, Project Atlas has something to do with cybernetic augmentation. Formula 17 was developed to help reduce the incidence of rejection in Project Atlas' test subjects."
msgstr ""
"笔记​进一步​指出​，​17​号​配方​是​名为​“​阿特拉斯​”​的​大型​研究​项目​的​组成部分​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​显然​，​“​阿特拉斯​”​项目​与赛​博殖装​有关​。​17​号​配方​的​开发​旨在​降低​该​项目​受试者​的​排异​反应​发生率​。\n"
"\n"
"bi3ji4 jin4yi1bu4 zhi3chu1，17 hao4 pei4fang1 shi4 ming2wei2“a1te4la1si1” de5 da4xing2 yan2jiu1 xiang4mu4 de5 zu3cheng2bu4fen4。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，“a1te4la1si1” xiang4mu4 yu4 sai4 bo2 zhi2 zhuang1 you3guan1。17 hao4 pei4fang1 de5 kai1fa1 zhi3zai4 jiang4di1 gai1 xiang4mu4 shou4shi4zhe3 de5 pai2 yi4 fan3ying4 fa1sheng1lu:4。"

msgid ""
"The object in question is a cyberware deactivator. I had it shipped here - at great personal expense - from a super-max prison in the UCAS.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He traces a twirl in the air with the fork.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The warden owed me a favor."
msgstr ""
"这是​一件​赛博​改造​失效​器​。​我​自己​下​了​血本​，​才​从​加美​合众国​的​一所​超级​监狱​把​东西​运了​过来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​叉子​在​空中​划​了​个​圈​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​监狱长​欠​我​一个​人情​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 jian4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 shi1xiao4 qi4。wo3 zi4ji3 xia4 le5 xue4ben3，cai2 cong2 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 de5 yi1 suo3 chao1ji2 jian1yu4 ba3 dong1xi1 yun4 le5 guo4lai2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 cha1zi5 zai4 kong1zhong1 hua2 le5 ge4 juan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jian1 yu4 zhang3 qian4 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2qing2。"

msgid ""
"The object in your hand is a keycard. It's filthy, but intact. From what's "
"left of the label, you gather that this card's designation was \"CSTDN.\""
msgstr ""
"你​手中​的​物品​是​一张​门禁卡​。​虽然​肮脏​，​但​仍然​完整​。​从​残存​的​标签​可以​推断​，​这​张卡​的​标识​是​“​CSTDN​”​。\n"
"ni3 shou3 zhong4 de5 wu4pin3 shi4 yi1 zhang1 men2 jin1 ka3。sui1ran2 ang1zang1，dan4 reng2ran2 wan2zheng3。cong2 can2cun2 de5 biao1qian1 ke3yi3 tui1duan4，zhe4 zhang1 ka3 de5 biao1zhi4 shi4“CSTDN”。"

msgid ""
"The old bastard spat on me - his bleeding, crying daughter. He spat on me, and told me that I was \"des Teufels Hure,\" the Devil's whore.\n"
"\n"
"Then he kicked me out of the house."
msgstr ""
"那个​老​混蛋​居然​对​着​我​—​—​对​他​的​亲​女儿​啐​了​口​唾沫​，​说​我​是​“​魔鬼​的​娼妇​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​他​就​把​我​赶出​了​家​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 lao3 hun2dan4 ju1ran2 dui4 zhao2 wo3——dui4 ta1 de5 qin1 nu:3er2 cui4 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5，shuo1 wo3 shi4“mo2gui3 de5 chang1fu4”。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1 jiu4 ba3 wo3 gan3chu1 le5 jia1。"

msgid ""
"The old flourescent grow-lights are barely keeping the plants alive. Almost "
"no light from the surface makes it this far underground."
msgstr ""
"陈旧​的​荧光​生长​灯​将​将​维持​着​植物​的​生命​。​几乎​没有​来自​地表​的​光线​能​到达​如此​之深​的​地下​。\n"
"chen2jiu4 de5 ying2guang1 sheng1zhang3 deng1 jiang1 jiang1 wei2chi2 zhao2 zhi2wu4 de5 sheng1ming4。ji1hu1 mei2you3 lai2zi4 di4biao3 de5 guang1xian4 neng2 dao4da2 ru2ci3 zhi1 shen1 de5 di4xia4。"

msgid ""
"The old man behind the glass works feverishly at his console, glancing up at you when he can. A cigarette dangles from his mouth, its bluish smoke curling around his head.\n"
"\n"
"An overflowing ashtray sits on the lab table in front of him."
msgstr ""
"玻璃​后面​的​老人​正​埋头​在​控制​台上​忙碌​着​，​偶尔​会​抬头​看​你​一眼​。​一支​香烟​挂​在​他​的​嘴边​，​蓝色​的​烟雾​在​他​的​头顶​缭绕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​面前​的​实验​台上​放着​一个​溢满​的​烟灰缸​。\n"
"\n"
"bo1li5 hou4mian5 de5 lao3ren2 zheng1 mai2tou2 zai4 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 mang2lu4 zhao2，ou3er3 hui4 tai2tou2 kan4 ni3 yi1yan3。yi1 zhi1 xiang1yan1 gua4 zai4 ta1 de5 zui3 bian1，lan2se4 de5 yan1wu4 zai4 ta1 de5 tou2ding3 liao2rao4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 mian4qian2 de5 shi2yan4 tai2shang4 fang4 zhao2 yi1ge5 yi4man3 de5 yan1hui1gang1。"

msgid ""
"The old man eyes the cigarette butt in his hand. Fishes out another from the pack and lights it with the first. Then he returns to his console, reaching to the side for a microphone. He mutters something into the receiver. \n"
"\n"
"You can just barely make out the sound of the name \"Audran.\""
msgstr ""
"老人​盯​着​手中​的​烟头​。​他​从​烟盒​里​掏出​另​一支​烟​，​用​第一支​点燃​。​然后​他​回到​控制台​，​伸手​去​拿​旁边​的​麦克风​。​他​对​着​话筒​低声​说​了​些​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​只能​隐约​听到​“​奥​德兰​”​这个​名字​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3ren2 ding1 zhao2 shou3 zhong4 de5 yan1tou2。ta1 cong2 yan1 he2 li3 tao1chu1 ling4 yi1 zhi1 yan1，yong4 di4 yi1 zhi1 dian3ran2。ran2hou4 ta1 hui2dao4 kong4zhi4tai2，shen1shou3 qu4 na2 pang2bian1 de5 mai4ke4feng1。ta1 dui4 zhao2 hua4tong3 di1sheng1 shuo1 le5 xie1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi3neng2 yin3yue1 ting1dao4“Ao4de2lan2” zhe4ge5 ming2zi5。"

msgid ""
"The old man lets out a heavy sigh, his entire body trembling. When he "
"recovers, he looks almost like a different man. Tired, and frail. Defeated."
msgstr ""
"老人​重重地​叹​了​口气​，​全身​颤抖​。​当​他​恢复过来​时​，​看起来​几乎​像​另​一个​人​。​疲惫​，​虚弱​。​失败​。\n"
"lao3ren2 chong2 chong2 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，quan2shen1 chan4dou3。dang1 ta1 hui1 fu4 guo4 lai2 shi2，kan4qi3lai5 ji1hu1 xiang4 ling4 yi1ge5 ren2。pi2bei4，xu1ruo4。shi1bai4。"

msgid ""
"The old man turns away from you, studying some invisible detail on his "
"console."
msgstr ""
"老人​转过身​去​不再​看​你​，​而是​开始​研究​控制​台上​的​某处​细节​。\n"
"lao3ren2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4 bu4zai4 kan4 ni3，er2shi4 kai1shi3 yan2jiu1 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 mou3chu4 xi4jie2。"

msgid ""
"The old man turns away from you, studying some invisible detail on his "
"console. He looks irritated, and tired."
msgstr ""
"老人​转过身​去​不再​看​你​，​而是​开始​研究​控制​台上​的​某处​细节​。​他​看起来​有些​不耐烦​，​又​有些​疲惫​。\n"
"lao3ren2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4 bu4zai4 kan4 ni3，er2shi4 kai1shi3 yan2jiu1 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 mou3chu4 xi4jie2。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 bu4nai4fan2，you4 you3xie1 pi2bei4。"

msgid ""
"The old man turns away from you, studying some invisible detail on his "
"console. He looks irritated."
msgstr ""
"老人​转过身​去​不再​看​你​，​而是​开始​研究​控制​台上​的​某处​细节​。​他​看起来​有些​不耐烦​。\n"
"lao3ren2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4 bu4zai4 kan4 ni3，er2shi4 kai1shi3 yan2jiu1 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 mou3chu4 xi4jie2。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 bu4nai4fan2。"

msgid ""
"The old man turns away from you, studying some invisible detail on his console. He rubs the bridge of his nose between a pair of bony fingers.\n"
"\n"
"The fire that burned in him seems to have guttered out. Above all, he looks worn down."
msgstr ""
"老人​转过身​去​不再​看​你​，​而是​开始​研究​控制​台上​的​某处​细节​。​他​用​骨瘦如柴​的​手指​揉​了​揉​鼻梁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​曾​让​他​震颤​的​怒火​似乎​已​自行​熄灭​。​如今​，​他​看起来​只是​疲惫不堪​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3ren2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4 bu4zai4 kan4 ni3，er2shi4 kai1shi3 yan2jiu1 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 mou3chu4 xi4jie2。ta1 yong4 gu3shou4ru2chai2 de5 shou3zhi3 rou2 le5 rou2 bi2liang2。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ceng2 rang4 ta1 zhen4chan4 de5 nu4huo3 si4hu1 yi3 zi4xing2 xi1mie4。ru2jin1，ta1 kan4qi3lai5 zhi3shi4 pi2bei4bu4kan1。"

msgid ""
"The old man turns away from you, studying some invisible detail on his console. His hand tightens on a pack of cigarettes on his desk, crumpling it.\n"
"\n"
"He waits there a long time before looking up again."
msgstr ""
"老人​转过身​去​不再​看​你​，​而是​开始​研究​控制​台上​的​某处​细节​。​他​的​手​紧紧抓住​桌上​的​烟盒​，​把​它​捏​得​皱巴巴​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​等​了​很​久​才​再次​抬头​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3ren2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4 bu4zai4 kan4 ni3，er2shi4 kai1shi3 yan2jiu1 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 mou3chu4 xi4jie2。ta1 de5 shou3 jin3 jin3 zhua1 zhu4 zhuo1 shang4 de5 yan1 he2，ba3 ta1 nie1 de2 zhou4ba1ba1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 deng3 le5 hen3 jiu3 cai2 zai4ci4 tai2tou2。"

msgid ""
"The old man turns away from you, studying some invisible detail on his console. His motions are jerky. Erratic.\n"
"\n"
"He waits there a long time before looking up again."
msgstr ""
"老人​转过身​去​不再​看​你​，​而是​开始​研究​控制​台上​的​某处​细节​。​他​的​动作​笨拙​突兀​，​时断时续​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​等​了​很​久​才​再次​抬头​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3ren2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4 bu4zai4 kan4 ni3，er2shi4 kai1shi3 yan2jiu1 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 mou3chu4 xi4jie2。ta1 de5 dong4zuo4 ben4zhuo1 tu1wu4，shi2duan4shi2xu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 deng3 le5 hen3 jiu3 cai2 zai4ci4 tai2tou2。"

msgid ""
"The one and only.\n"
"\n"
"Glad to be talking to a fan."
msgstr ""
"只此一家​，​别无分号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​原来​你​是​粉丝​啊​，​幸会幸​会​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ci3 yi1 jia1，bie4 wu2 fen4 hao4。\n"
"\n"
"yuan2lai2 ni3 shi4 fen3si1 a1，xing4 hui4 xing4 hui4。"

msgid ""
"The only active console in this derelict span of U-Bahn platform is an old video arcade machine.\n"
"\n"
"The CRT monitor set into the machine's cabinet glows invitingly. Cheerful, pixelated graphics swirl and dance on the screen."
msgstr ""
"在​这段​废弃​的​地铁站​台​走廊​里​，​唯一​还​在​运转​的​设备​是​一台​老旧​的​街机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​嵌​在​机柜​里​的​显像管​屏幕​正​发出​诱人​的​光芒​。​欢快​的​像素​画面​在​屏幕​上​旋转​跳跃​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 duan4 fei4qi4 de5 di4tie3zhan4 tai2 zou3lang2 li3，wei2yi1 hai2 zai4 yun4zhuan3 de5 she4bei4 shi4 yi1 tai2 lao3jiu4 de5 jie1ji1。\n"
"\n"
"kan3 zai4 ji1 ju3 li3 de5 xian3xiang4guan3 ping2mu4 zheng1 fa1chu1 you4ren2 de5 guang1mang2。huan1kuai4 de5 xiang4su4 hua4mian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4 xuan2zhuan3 tiao4yue4。"

msgid ""
"The only bloodbath tonight is going to happen right here, in this room."
msgstr ""
"今晚​唯一​的​屠杀​将​在​这里​上演​，​就​在​这个​房间​里​。\n"
"jin1wan3 wei2yi1 de5 tu2sha1 jiang1 zai4 zhe4li3 shang4yan3，jiu4 zai4 zhe4ge5 fang2jian1 li3。"

msgid ""
"The only clue you're left with is the title of the entry. Apparently, they're using magic to extend the half-life of radioactive isotopes.\n"
"\n"
"Why they're doing it, you cannot say."
msgstr ""
"你​唯一​能​得到​的​线索​就是​条​目的​标题​。​显然​，​他们​正在​利用​魔法​来​延长​放射性​同位素​的​半衰期​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​他们​为什么​要​这么​做​，​你​无法​得知​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wei2yi1 neng2 de2dao4 de5 xian4suo3 jiu4shi4 tiao2 mu4di4 biao1ti2。xian3ran2，ta1men5 zheng4zai4 li4yong4 mo2fa3 lai2 yan2chang2 fang4she4xing4 tong2wei4su4 de5 ban4shuai1qi1。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 ta1men5 wei4shen2me5 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4，ni3 wu2fa3 de2zhi1。"

msgid ""
"The only explanation was a hand-written note on old-fashioned paper.\n"
"\n"
"\"Leave me alone.\"\n"
"\n"
"That was it. We'd been together for years, and that was all she left me. That, and this beat-up old cyberdeck."
msgstr ""
"她​唯一​留下​的​只有​一张​手写​的​旧​纸条​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​别来​烦​我​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这样​。​我们​相处​了​很多年​，​最后​她​只​留给​我​这个​。​以及​一台​破旧​的​赛博碟板​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 wei2yi1 liu2xia4 de5 zhi3you3 yi1 zhang1 shou3xie3 de5 jiu4 zhi3tiao2。\n"
"\n"
"“bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3。” \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4yang4。wo3men5 xiang1chu3 le5 hen3 duo1 nian2，zui4hou4 ta1 zhi3 liu2gei3 wo3 zhe4ge5。yi3ji2 yi1 tai2 po4jiu4 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3。"

msgid ""
"The only incongruous element is his outfit. He's decked out, head to toe, in"
" patched black riding leathers. A pair of oversized, studded combat boots "
"shine in the halogen glare of the cell's lighting panels."
msgstr ""
"唯一​显得​格格不入​的​是​他​的​装束​。​他​从头到脚​裹​着​补丁​斑驳​的​黑色​骑行​皮衣​，​脚​上​那双​镶满​铆钉​的​超大​号​作战​靴​在​牢房​灯板​的​卤素​强光​下​闪闪发亮​。\n"
"wei2yi1 xian3de5 ge2ge2bu4ru4 de5 shi4 ta1 de5 zhuang1shu4。ta1 cong2tou2dao4jiao3 guo3 zhao2 bu3ding5 ban1bo2 de5 hei1se4 qi2xing2 pi2yi1，jiao3 shang4 na4 shuang1 xiang1 man3 mao3ding1 de5 chao1 dai4 hao4 zuo4zhan4 xue1 zai4 lao2fang2 deng1 ban3 de5 lu3su4 jiang4 guang1 xia4 shan3 shan3 fa1 liang4。"

msgid ""
"The only thing that we can do. We deal with this later, after the dust has "
"settled."
msgstr ""
"做​我们​唯一​能​做​的​事​。​等​尘埃落定​之后​，​我们​再​来​解决​这​事​。\n"
"zuo4 wo3men5 wei2yi1 neng2 zuo4 de5 shi4。deng3 chen2ai1luo4ding4 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 zai4 lai2 jie3jue2 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"The only way to guarantee that is to kill the Firewing, $(l.name). And we can't do that without Vauclair.\n"
"\n"
"The AI is standing between us and what we need. If we want to save our own lives, we're going to have to do something about APEX."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​想要​做到​这点​，​就​必须​杀掉​火翼​。​而​如果​没有​沃​克莱尔​的话​，​我们​将​束手无策​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​AI​阻拦​了​我们​完成​目标​。​如果​我们​想要​自救​的话​，​就​必须​先​解决​掉​APEX​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，xiang3yao4 zuo4dao4 zhe4 dian3，jiu4 bi4xu1 sha1diao4 Huo3yi4。er2 ru2guo3 mei2you3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiang1 shu4shou3wu2ce4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 AI zu3lan2 le5 wo3men5 wan2cheng2 mu4biao1。ru2guo3 wo3men5 xiang3yao4 zi4jiu4 de5hua4，jiu4 bi4xu1 xian1 jie3jue2 diao4 APEX。"

msgid ""
"The organization that we discussed a little while back. The big, scary one.\n"
"\n"
"The one that I told you not to take money from."
msgstr ""
"就是​我们​之前​聊到​的​，​那个​幕后​黑手​般的​组织​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不是​跟​你​说​，​不要​从​他们​那里​拿​钱​来​着​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 wo3men5 zhi1qian2 liao2 dao4 de5，na4ge5 mu4hou4 hei1shou3 ban1 de5 zu3zhi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 gen1 ni3 shuo1，bu4yao4 cong2 ta1men5 na4li5 na2 qian2 lai2 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"The ork doesn't respond. You don't hear your own echo over Amsel's "
"microphone, either... he must have muted the volume on your end of the "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"兽​人​没有​回应​。​你​也​没有​从​阿姆​泽尔​的​麦克风​听到​你​自己​的​回音​……​他​肯定​是​将​你​这边​的​通话​静音​了​。\n"
"shou4 ren2 mei2you3 hui2ying4。ni3 ye3 mei2you3 cong2 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 mai4ke4feng1 ting1dao4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 hui2yin1……ta1 ken3ding4 shi4 jiang1 ni3 zhe4bian1 de5 tong1hua4 jing4yin1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The ork goes on staring at the old man for a long time.\n"
"\n"
"Then something in his face changes."
msgstr ""
"兽​人​继续​盯​着​老人​看​了​很​长时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​他​脸上​的​表情​发生​了​变化​。\n"
"\n"
"shou4 ren2 ji4xu4 ding1 zhao2 lao3ren2 kan4 le5 hen3 zhang3 shi2 jian1。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 biao3qing2 fa1sheng1 le5 bian4hua4。"

msgid ""
"The ork's milspec cyberarms are twitching. His fingers seem to move of their own accord, writhing aimlessly in the air.\n"
"\n"
"The light on his chipjack begins to blink."
msgstr ""
"兽​人​的​军用​级​赛博​手臂​在​抽搐​。​他​的​手指​似乎​在​自行​移动​，​在​空中​漫无目的​地​扭动​着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​芯片​插口​开始​闪烁​光亮​。\n"
"\n"
"shou4 ren2 de5 jun1yong4 ji2 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 zai4 chou1chu4。ta1 de5 shou3zhi3 si4hu1 zai4 zi4xing2 yi2dong4，zai4 kong1zhong1 man4wu2mu4di4 de5 niu3 dong4 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4 guang1liang4。"

msgid ""
"The others shift uncomfortably, not knowing what to say. Glory breaks the "
"awkward moment, her voice a frosty monotone."
msgstr ""
"其他人​不安​地​挪动​身体​，​不知​该​说些​什么​。​最后​，​格洛丽​打破​了​这​尴尬​的​沉默​，​她​的​声音​冷若冰霜​，​毫无​起伏​。\n"
"qi2 ta1 ren2 bu4an1 de5 nuo2dong4 shen1ti3，bu4zhi1 gai1 shuo1 xie1 shen2me5。zui4hou4，Ge2luo4li2 da3po4 le5 zhe4 gan1ga4 de5 chen2mo4，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 leng3ruo4bing1shuang1，hao2wu2 qi3fu2。"

msgid "The package Hasenkamp gave you. This should make Blitz happy."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​给​你​的​匣子​。​这​应该​会​让​布里​茨​感到高兴​。\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 gei3 ni3 de5 xia2zi5。zhe4 ying1gai1 hui4 rang4 Bu4li3ci2 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4。"

msgid ""
"The pages are filled to overflowing with handwritten text. You don't recognize the language, but judging by the accent marks, you'd guess it's a Scandinavian tongue.\n"
"\n"
"While you can't read it, the arrangement of the text tells you that the ledger is primarily being used as an address book."
msgstr ""
"纸页​上​密密麻麻​地写​满​了​手写​文字​。​你​认不出​这种​语言​，​但​从​重音符号​来看​，​你​猜​它​可能​来自​斯堪的纳维亚​语系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽然​你​无法​阅读​这些​文字​，​但​文字​的​排列​方式​告诉​你​，​这本​账簿​主要​被​用作​地址​簿​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 xie2 shang4 mi4mi5ma2ma2 de5 xie3 man3 le5 shou3xie3 wen2zi4。ni3 ren4 bu4 chu1 zhe4zhong3 yu3yan2，dan4 cong2 chong2 yin1 fu2 hao4 lai2 kan4，ni3 cai1 ta1 ke3neng2 lai2zi4 si1kan1di4na4wei2ya4 yu3xi4。\n"
"\n"
"sui1ran2 ni3 wu2fa3 yue4du2 zhe4xie1 wen2zi4，dan4 wen2zi4 de5 pai2lie4 fang1shi4 gao4su4 ni3，zhe4 ben3 zhang4bu4 zhu3yao4 bei4 yong4zuo4 di4zhi3 bu4。"

msgid ""
"The pain is hideous, but you're tough as nails. You ignore it, let your mind go somewhere else.\n"
"\n"
"It works, but only just barely. And the pain is getting worse."
msgstr ""
"这​股​痛苦​令人​难以忍受​，​但​你​的​意志​坚韧​如铁​。​你​选择​忽视​它​，​让​思绪​飘向​别处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这招​勉强​管用​，​但​效果​微乎其微​。​而​疼痛​仍​在​加剧​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 gu3 tong4ku3 ling4ren2 nan2yi3ren3shou4，dan4 ni3 de5 yi4zhi4 jian1ren4 ru2 tie3。ni3 xuan3ze2 hu1shi4 ta1，rang4 si1xu4 piao1 xiang4 bie2chu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 mian3qiang3 guan3yong4，dan4 xiao4guo3 wei1hu1qi2wei1。er2 teng2tong4 reng2 zai4 jia1ju4。"

msgid "The panel appears to be wired into the physical security in some way."
msgstr ""
"面板​似乎​是​以​某种​方式​接​进​实体​安保​系统​的​。\n"
"mian4ban3 si4hu1 shi4 yi3 mou3zhong3 fang1shi4 jie1 jin4 shi2ti3 an1bao3 xi4tong3 de5。"

msgid "The panel is dark."
msgstr ""
"面板​一片​漆黑​。\n"
"mian4ban3 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。"

msgid ""
"The part Trithemius removed from the Elevator to make it non-functional"
msgstr ""
"特​里特​米​乌斯​从​电梯​上​拆下​，​使​其​无法​运作​的​部件​。\n"
"te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 cong2 dian4ti1 shang4 chai1xia4，shi3 qi2 wu2fa3 yun4zuo4 de5 bu4jian4。"

msgid ""
"The part removed from the Elevator by Ullrich to make it non functional."
msgstr ""
"乌尔里​希从​电梯​上​拆下​，​使​其​无法​运作​的​部件​。\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1 cong2 dian4ti1 shang4 chai1xia4，shi3 qi2 wu2fa3 yun4zuo4 de5 bu4jian4。"

msgid ""
"The people here... the cultists... they're just a bunch of poor, brainwashed"
" kids. After everything I've seen here tonight, I can't justify putting "
"their lives at risk."
msgstr ""
"这里​的​教徒​……​只是​一群​被​洗脑​的​可怜​孩子​。​今晚​我​目睹​的​一切​让​我​无法​随随便便​就​将​他们​的​生命​置于​危险​之中​。\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 jiao4tu2……zhi3shi4 yi1 qun2 bei4 xi3nao3 de5 ke3lian2 hai2zi5。jin1wan3 wo3 mu4du3 de5 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 wu2fa3 sui2 sui2 bian4 bian4 jiu4 jiang1 ta1men5 de5 sheng1ming4 zhi4yu2 wei1xian3 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"The people in my crew get how things work in Berlin. Even Racter gets it, and he's still pretty new to the scene here.\n"
"\n"
"There's no leader on my team, and no one follows orders. We're all equals, and we can give suggestions or tell one another to piss off whenever we please."
msgstr ""
"我​队里​的​人​都​知道​柏林​的​规矩​。​就​连​莱克​特​也​明白​，​尽管​他​还​刚来​没多久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​团队​没有​领导​，​没有​人​需要​听从命令​。​我们​都​是​平等​的​，​我们​可以​随时​提出​建议​或​让​对方​滚蛋​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 li3 de5 ren2 dou1 zhi1dao4 bo2lin2 de5 gui1ju5。jiu4 lian2 lai2 ke4 te4 ye3 ming2bai5，jin3guan3 ta1 hai2 gang1 lai2 mei2duo1jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 mei2you3 ling3dao3，mei2you3 ren2 xu1yao4 ting1 cong2 ming4 ling3。wo3men5 dou1 shi4 ping2deng3 de5，wo3men5 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 ti2chu1 jian4yi4 huo4 rang4 dui4fang1 gun3dan4。"

msgid ""
"The photo depicts a pair of teenage girls in ratty clothes posing against a "
"forested backdrop. The two are entwined in a loving embrace; one is leaning "
"in to plant a kiss on the other's cheek, and the other one is smiling. The "
"smiling girl has a head of fire-red hair."
msgstr ""
"照片​上​是​两名​穿着​破旧​衣服​的​少女​，​在​森林​背景​下摆​出​姿势​。​两人​深情​相拥​，​其中​一人​凑近​轻吻​另一人​脸颊​。​被​吻​者​有​一头​火红​的​头发​，​正对​镜头​露出​微笑​。\n"
"zhao4pian4 shang4 shi4 liang3 ming2 chuan1zhuo2 po4jiu4 yi1fu5 de5 shao4nu:3，zai4 sen1lin2 bei4jing3 xia4bai3 chu1 zi1shi4。liang3 ren2 shen1qing2 xiang1yong1，qi2zhong1 yi1 ren2 cou4jin4 qing1 wen3 ling4 yi1 ren2 lian3jia2。bei4 wen3 zhe3 you3 yi1tou2 huo3hong2 de5 tou2fa5，zheng4dui4 jing4tou2 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"The piece of drek cut and run, huh? That's rough, friend.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich takes another swig from his bottle, then shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So he got away. But who knows, right? Maybe you'll catch up with him someday."
msgstr ""
"居然​让​那​王八蛋​给​跑​了​？​真​他妈的​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​又​喝​了​一口​酒​，​然后​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​躲​得​了​一时​，​躲不了​一世​，​对​吧​？​说不定​哪天​你​就​能​逮到​他​。\n"
"\n"
"ju1ran2 rang4 na4 wang2ba1dan4 gei3 pao2 le5？zhen1 ta1ma1de5，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 you4 he4 le5 yi1kou3 jiu3，ran2hou4 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"duo3 de2 le5 yi1shi2，duo3 bu4 le5 yi1shi4，dui4 ba1？shuo1bu5ding4 na3 tian1 ni3 jiu4 neng2 dai3 dao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"The plan - *my* plan - is flawed. Fatally so.\n"
"\n"
"The dragon will not fly tonight."
msgstr ""
"*​我​的​*​计划​存在​缺陷​。​致命​缺陷​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​今晚​不能​翱翔​。\n"
"\n"
"*wo3 de5*ji4hua4 cun2zai4 que1xian4。zhi4ming4 que1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 jin1wan3 bu4neng2 ao2xiang2。"

msgid ""
"The plan worked. The dragons are dead. But the world is still in trouble... "
"it still needs saving."
msgstr ""
"计划​成功​了​。​巨龙​已死​。​但​世界​仍处​险境​……​它​依然​需要​拯救​。\n"
"ji4hua4 cheng2gong1 le5。ju4long2 yi3 si3。dan4 shi4jie4 reng2 chu3 xian3jing4……ta1 yi1ran2 xu1yao4 zheng3jiu4。"

msgid ""
"The plastic lid of the cargo container pops open with a click.\n"
"\n"
"Inside, you find what appears to be a homemade simsense chip. It sits securely in a custom-made plastic bracket."
msgstr ""
"货舱​的​塑料​盖子​“​咔哒​”​一声​弹开​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​放着​一个​看似​自制​的​拟感​芯片​，​被​稳稳​固定​在​一个​定制​的​塑料​支架​上​。\n"
"\n"
"huo4cang1 de5 su4liao4 gai4zi5“ka3 da1” yi1sheng1 dan4 kai1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 fang4 zhao2 yi1ge5 kan4si4 zi4zhi4 de5 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4，bei4 wen3 wen3 gu4ding4 zai4 yi1ge5 ding4zhi4 de5 su4liao4 zhi1jia4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The player itself, though... this, I do not have. \n"
"\n"
"You may wish to try your luck down at the junkyard. There is a scavenger there, a primitive man with a crude disposition. \n"
"\n"
"If anyone here in the Kreuzbasar can help you find your DVD player, he can. But he will almost certainly attempt to overcharge you for it."
msgstr ""
"不过​嘛​……​播放器​我​这​倒​是​没有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不妨​去​垃圾场​碰碰运气​。​那里​有个​拾荒者​，​是​个​性格​粗鲁​的​原始人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​克洛伊​茨​集市​有人​能​帮​你​找到​DVD​播放器​，​那​就是​他​了​。​但​他​肯定​会​借机​讹​你​一笔​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ma5……bo1 fang4 qi4 wo3 zhe4 dao3 shi4 mei2you3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4fang2 qu4 la1 ji1 chang2 peng4 peng4 yun4 qi4。na4li5 you3 ge4 she4 huang1 zhe3，shi4 ge4 xing4ge2 cu1lu3 de5 yuan2shi3ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 you3ren2 neng2 bang1 ni3 zhao3dao4 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4，na4 jiu4shi4 ta1 le5。dan4 ta1 ken3ding4 hui4 jie4ji1 e2 ni3 yi1 bi3。"

msgid ""
"The point is, she went after me. Vigorously.\n"
"\n"
"Within twenty-four hours of Dieter's death, I had a price on my head. And then the hotel got taken over."
msgstr ""
"重点​是​，​她​决定​要​追杀​我​。​而且​非常​积极​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​迪特尔​死后​不到​24​小时​，​就​有人​悬赏​我​的​首级​了​。​而且​旅馆​也​被​夺走​了​。\n"
"\n"
"chong2dian3 shi4，ta1 jue2ding4 yao4 zhui1sha1 wo3。er2qie3 fei1chang2 ji1ji2。\n"
"\n"
"di2 te4 er3 si3hou4 bu4dao4 24 xiao3shi2，jiu4 you3ren2 xuan2shang3 wo3 de5 shou3ji2 le5。er2qie3 lu:3guan3 ye3 bei4 duo2zou3 le5。"

msgid "The political agenda of a sentient computer is trivial."
msgstr ""
"智能​计算机​的​政治​议程​无足轻重​。\n"
"zhi4neng2 ji4suan4ji1 de5 zheng4zhi4 yi4cheng2 wu2zu2qing1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"The power of the Dragonslayer aids all friends within a range of 3 with Damage Reduction of 3.\n"
"\n"
"Cooldown: 1"
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​图腾​的​力量​可使​3​格​范围​内​所有​友方​单位​所​受伤害​降低​3​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷却​时间​：​1​回合\n"
"\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 tu2teng2 de5 li4liang5 ke3 shi3 3 ge2 fan4wei2 nei4 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4 suo3 shou4 shang1 hai4 jiang4di1 3 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"leng3que4 shi2jian1：1 hui2he2"

msgid ""
"The power of the Dragonslayer aids all friends within a three-tile range, "
"with Incoming DMG reduced by 3. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​的​力量​将​在​三格​范围​内​作用​于​所有​友方​单位​，​使​其​所​受伤害​降低​3​点​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 de5 li4liang5 jiang1 zai4 san1 ge2 fan4wei2 nei4 zuo4yong4 yu2 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4，shi3 qi2 suo3 shou4 shang1 hai4 jiang4di1 3 dian3。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"The power of the Dragonslayer aids all friends within a three-tile range, "
"with Incoming DMG reduced by 5. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"屠龙​者​的​力量​将​在​三格​范围​内​作用​于​所有​友方​单位​，​使​其​所​受伤害​降低​5​点​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 de5 li4liang5 jiang1 zai4 san1 ge2 fan4wei2 nei4 zuo4yong4 yu2 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4，shi3 qi2 suo3 shou4 shang1 hai4 jiang4di1 5 dian3。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"The power of the Great Mother heals all friends within 3 tiles of their most"
" recent wound."
msgstr ""
"大母​神​的​力量​将​在​三格​范围​内​作用​于​所有​友方​单位​，​治愈​其​最近​一次​受到​的​伤害​。\n"
"dai4 mu3 shen2 de5 li4liang5 jiang1 zai4 san1 ge2 fan4wei2 nei4 zuo4yong4 yu2 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4，zhi4yu4 qi2 zui4jin4 yi1ci4 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"The power of the Great Mother heals all friends within 3 tiles of their most recent wound.\n"
"\n"
"Cooldown: 3"
msgstr ""
"大母​神​图腾​的​力量​可​治愈​3​格​范围​内​所有​友方​单位​最近​一次​受到​的​伤害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷却​时间​：​3​回合\n"
"\n"
"dai4 mu3 shen2 tu2teng2 de5 li4liang5 ke3 zhi4yu4 3 ge2 fan4wei2 nei4 suo3you3 you3 fang1 dan1wei4 zui4jin4 yi1ci4 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。\n"
"\n"
"leng3que4 shi2jian1：3 hui2he2"

msgid ""
"The power outage has shut down comms all over the building. They haven't "
"told to you because they *can't* tell you."
msgstr ""
"断电​导致​整栋​楼​的​通讯​系统​都​瘫痪​了​。​他们​还​没​告诉​你​，​是因为​他们​*​没​办法​*​告诉​你​。\n"
"duan4dian4 dao3zhi4 zheng3 dong4 lou2 de5 tong1xun4 xi4tong3 dou1 tan1huan4 le5。ta1men5 hai2 mei2 gao4su4 ni3，shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1men5*mei2 ban4fa3*gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"The power released by the spirit's death explodes outward, slamming into you like a freight train and sending you reeling.\n"
"\n"
"Glory is buffeted backward like a rag doll, but she manages to retain her footing. She turns to face you, the ichor from the spirit's chest wicking off of her razor-tipped fingers, and as you watch, her right hand bursts into flame."
msgstr ""
"精魂​死亡​所​释放​的​力量​向外​爆裂​，​如​疾驰​的​列车​般​猛烈​撞​向​你​，​令​你​踉跄​后退​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​被​撞​得​像​布娃娃​般向​后​翻飞​，​但​还是​勉强​稳住​身形​。​她​转身​面对​你​，​精魂​胸口​渗出​的​脓血​正​从​她​指尖​的​利刃​滴落​。​就​在​你​注视​的​瞬间​，​她​的​右手​骤然​燃起​熊熊​烈焰​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1hun2 si3wang2 suo3 shi4fang4 de5 li4liang5 xiang4wai4 bao4lie4，ru2 ji2chi2 de5 lie4che1 ban1 meng3lie4 zhuang4 xiang4 ni3，ling3 ni3 liang4qiang4 hou4tui4。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 bei4 zhuang4 de2 xiang4 bu4wa2wa5 ban1 xiang4 hou4 fan1 fei1，dan4 hai2shi5 mian3qiang3 wen3 zhu4 shen1xing2。ta1 zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 ni3，jing1hun2 xiong1kou3 shen4chu1 de5 nong2 xie3 zheng1 cong2 ta1 zhi3jian1 de5 li4ren4 di1 la4。jiu4 zai4 ni3 zhu4shi4 de5 shun4jian1，ta1 de5 you4shou3 zhou4ran2 ran2qi3 xiong2xiong2 lie4yan4。"

msgid ""
"The premium medkit that heals you or any team member. Consumed when used. "
"Can be used outside of combat."
msgstr ""
"顶级​急救包​，​可​治疗​你​或​任何​队友​。​使用​时​将​被​消耗​。​可​在​非战斗​状态​下​使用​。\n"
"ding3ji2 ji2jiu4bao1，ke3 zhi4liao2 ni3 huo4 ren4he2 dui4you3。shi3yong4 shi2 jiang1 bei4 xiao1hao4。ke3 zai4 fei1 zhan4 dou3 zhuang4tai4 xia4 shi3yong4。"

msgid ""
"The problem is probably somethin' basic. A clog that needs to be cleared, somethin' like that... restarting the pumps should take care of it.\n"
"\n"
"But no goddamn way am I going in there."
msgstr ""
"问题​可能​出​在​最​基本​的​地方​，​比如​清理​堵塞物​之类​的​……​重启​水泵​应该​就​能​解决​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​他​妈​才​不​进去​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"wen4ti2 ke3neng2 chu1 zai4 zui4 ji1ben3 de5 di4fang1，bi3ru2 qing1li3 du3 se4 wu4 zhi1lei4 de5……chong2qi3 shui3beng4 ying1gai1 jiu4 neng2 jie3jue2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 ta1 ma1 cai2 bu4 jin4qu4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"The procedure is about to begin, Doctor.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles, revealing a snarled tangle of pointed teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to initiate the process yourself? This *is*  the culmination of your life's work, after all."
msgstr ""
"程序​即将​开始​，​博士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​微笑​着​，​露出​一口​参差不齐​的​尖牙​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​亲自​启动​这个​过程​吗​？​毕竟​，​这​可是​*​你​*​毕生​心血​的​结晶​。\n"
"\n"
"cheng2xu4 ji2jiang1 kai1shi3，bo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1xiao4 zhao2，lu4chu1 yi1kou3 cen1ci1bu4qi2 de5 jian1ya2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 qin1zi4 qi3dong4 zhe4ge5 guo4cheng2 ma5？bi4jing4，zhe4 ke3shi4*ni3*bi4sheng1 xin1xue4 de5 jie2jing1。"

msgid "The process is almost complete!"
msgstr ""
"流程​即将​完成​！\n"
"liu2cheng2 ji2jiang1 wan2cheng2！"

msgid ""
"The projection of Harrow convulses and bursts, and the scraps are consumed by shadow.\n"
"\n"
"The shadows dissipate, and Harrow is gone."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​的​投影​剧烈​痉挛​，​随即​爆裂​开来​，​残骸​尽数​被​暗影​吞噬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​暗影​随即​散​去​，​哈罗​也​消失​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 tou2ying3 ju4lie4 jing4luan2，sui2ji2 bao4lie4 kai1 lai2，can2hai2 jin3shu4 bei4 an4ying3 tun1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"an4ying3 sui2ji2 san3 qu4，ha1luo2 ye3 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The prototype was delivered safely. Herr Schmidt won't be happy about it, "
"though."
msgstr ""
"原型机​安全​送达​了​。​不过​施密特​先生​不会​对此​感到高兴​的​。\n"
"yuan2 xing2 ji1 an1quan2 song4da2 le5。bu4guo4 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4 de5。"

msgid ""
"The quarantine's off now. The final episode of your show is on the records "
"computer."
msgstr ""
"隔离​已经​解除​。​你​要​看​的​剧集​结局​就​在​档案​电脑​上​。\n"
"ge2li2 yi3jing1 jie3chu2。ni3 yao4 kan4 de5 ju4ji2 jie2ju2 jiu4 zai4 dang4an4 dian4nao3 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The ramifications of the Great Wyrm’s death shall be felt. There will be a "
"reckoning."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​之死​的​影响​必将​显现​。​清算​之时​将​至​。\n"
"ju4long2 zhi1 si3 de5 ying3xiang3 bi4jiang1 xian3xian4。qing1suan4 zhi1 shi2 jiang1 zhi4。"

msgid ""
"The ranger staggers forward, then collapses to his knees. He's bleeding in a dozen places from long, shallow wounds.\n"
"\n"
"The blood pours from his body in sheets, pooling in a slick on the hardwood floor."
msgstr ""
"公园​管理员​踉跄​着​向前​，​然后​跪倒​在​地​。​他​身上​有​十余​处长​而​浅​的​伤口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​鲜血​从​他​身上​汨​汨​流出​，​在​硬​木地板​上积成​一片​水洼​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1yuan2 guan3li3yuan2 liang4qiang4 zhao2 xiang4qian2，ran2hou4 gui4dao3 zai4 de5。ta1 shen1shang5 you3 shi2 yu2 chu4zhang3 er2 jian1 de5 shang1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"xian1xue4 cong2 ta1 shen1shang5 mi4 mi4 liu2chu1，zai4 ying4 mu4 de5 ban3 shang4 ji1 cheng2 yi1 pian1 shui3wa1。"

msgid ""
"The rattle of wheel on track gives way to a shimmying screech.\n"
"\n"
"Gradually, the train begins to slow."
msgstr ""
"车轮​在​轨道​上​的​咣当​声​变为​刺耳​的​摩擦​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​列车​开始​逐渐​减速​。\n"
"\n"
"che1lun2 zai4 gui3dao4 shang4 de5 guang1dang1 sheng1 bian4wei2 ci4er3 de5 mo2ca1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"lie4che1 kai1shi3 zhu2jian4 jian3su4。"

msgid ""
"The reaction is swift and violent. Within a fraction of a second, the air is"
" filled with a loud hissing sound, and the drone erupts in flame. A growing "
"hole in its undercarriage begins spitting out a hail of white-hot sparks."
msgstr ""
"反制​措施​迅速​而​猛烈​。​不到​一秒钟​，​空气​中便​充斥​着​刺耳​的​嘶嘶声​，​无人机​瞬间​被​火焰​吞噬​。​其​底盘​上​不断扩大​的​孔洞​开始​喷射出​密集​的​炽热​火花​。\n"
"fan3zhi4 cuo4shi1 xun4su4 er2 meng3lie4。bu4dao4 yi1 miao3 zhong1，kong1qi4 zhong4 bian4 chong1chi4 zhao2 ci4er3 de5 si1si1sheng1，wu2ren2ji1 shun4jian1 bei4 huo3yan4 tun1shi4。qi2 di3pan2 shang4 bu4 duan4 kuo4 dai4 de5 kong3dong4 kai1shi3 pen1 she4 chu1 mi4ji2 de5 chi4re4 huo3hua1。"

msgid ""
"The reception area of the SCHERING Pharma AG lab looks normal enough. The synthleather couches were obviously designed more for appearance than for comfort, and the blue steel walls are gently illuminated with energy-efficient recessed lighting.\n"
"\n"
"All in all, it's a perfect example of typical corporate design sensibilities: bland, generic, and safe. An overturned houseplant is the only sign that something might be amiss in the lab ahead."
msgstr ""
"先灵​制药​实验室​的​接待​区​看起来​看起来​再​普通​不过​。​合成​皮革​沙发​显然​更​注重​观感​而​非​舒适度​；​节能​嵌入式​灯具​柔和​地​映照在​蓝色​钢板​墙面​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总而言之​，​这里​完美​体现​了​典型​的​企业​设计​理念​：​平淡​乏味​、​千篇一律​且​安全​无趣​。​唯一​能​让​人​察觉​前方​实验室​可能​有​异样​的​，​是​一盆​倾倒​的​室内​盆栽​。\n"
"\n"
"xian1 ling2 zhi4yao4 shi2yan4shi4 de5 jie1dai4 qu1 kan4qi3lai5 kan4qi3lai5 zai4 pu3tong1 bu4guo4。he2cheng2 pi2ge2 sha1fa1 xian3ran2 geng1 zhu4zhong4 guan1gan3 er2 fei1 shu1 kuo4 du4 ； jie2neng2 qian4ru4shi4 deng1 ju4 rou2he2 de5 ying4 zhao4 zai4 lan2se4 gang1ban3 qiang2mian4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，zhe4li3 wan2mei3 ti3xian4 le5 dian3xing2 de5 qi3ye4 she4ji4 li3nian4：ping2dan4 fa2wei4、qian1pian1yi1lu:4 qie3 an1quan2 wu2qu4。wei2yi1 neng2 rang4 ren2 cha2jue2 qian2fang1 shi2yan4shi4 ke3neng2 you3 yi4yang4 de5，shi4 yi1 pen2 qing1dao3 de5 shi4nei4 pen2zai1。"

msgid ""
"The release of the Great Wyrm is of interest to a multitude of beings, and "
"Aljernon Half-Dream is among their circle."
msgstr ""
"释放​巨龙​会​牵扯​出​众多​利益​纠纷​，​而​半梦者​阿尔杰​农​也​在​其中​。\n"
"shi4fang4 ju4long2 hui4 qian1che3 chu1 zhong4duo1 li4yi4 jiu1fen1，er2 ban4 meng4 zhe3 E1er3jie2nong2 ye3 zai4 qi2zhong1。"

msgid ""
"The remnants of the face that remain are enough to confirm what your gut already knows. \n"
"\n"
"The body on the screen is that of Paul Amsel."
msgstr ""
"残存​的​面容​部分​足以​佐证​你​内心​早已​明白​的​事实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​的​尸体​正是​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​。\n"
"\n"
"can2cun2 de5 mian4rong2 bu4fen5 zu2yi3 zuo3zheng4 ni3 nei4xin1 zao3yi3 ming2bai5 de5 shi4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 de5 shi1ti3 zheng4shi4 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3。"

msgid ""
"The report isn't all sunshine and rainbows. There are death reports in here... the mortality rate among test subjects has been appallingly high.\n"
"\n"
"The report also makes reference to \"Formula 17,\" a substance that is being developed in support of Project Atlas."
msgstr ""
"报告​显示​研发​并非​一帆风顺​，​其中​也​有​死亡​记录​……​实验​体​的​死亡率​高得​惊人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​报告​还​提到​了​“​17​号​配方​”​，​一种​为​支持​“​阿特拉斯​”​项目​而​研发​的​药剂​。\n"
"\n"
"bao4gao4 xian3shi4 yan2fa1 bing4fei1 yi1fan1feng1shun4，qi2zhong1 ye3 you3 si3wang2 ji4lu4……shi2yan4 ti3 de5 si3wang2lu:4 gao1 de2 jing1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"bao4gao4 hai2 ti2dao4 le5“17 hao4 pei4fang1”，yi1zhong3 wei2 zhi1chi2“a1te4la1si1” xiang4mu4 er2 yan2fa1 de5 yao4ji4。"

msgid ""
"The representative of a potential client. A very influential client, and one who pays extraordinarily well. And he is someone who demands a modicum of respect. \n"
"\n"
"Now listen. "
msgstr ""
"我​代表​一位​潜在​客户​，​他​在​业内​举足轻重​，​绝不会​亏待​自己​人​。​而且​他​要求​得到​起码​的​尊重​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​听​好​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dai4biao3 yi1 wei4 qian2zai4 ke4hu4，ta1 zai4 ye4nei4 ju3zu2qing1zhong4，jue2 bu4 hui4 kui1dai4 zi4ji3 ren2。er2qie3 ta1 yao1qiu2 de2dao4 qi3ma3 de5 zun1zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ting1 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The rest of the trip home is uneventful, but one thing is clear: Someone is hunting you. This ambush was no chance gang warfare, but an organized attempt on your life. If Green Winters was right, then whoever killed him is now after you.\n"
"\n"
"The PDA that you retrieved from your attackers may hold some answers. It’s time to return to your safehouse and consult Paul Amsel."
msgstr ""
"回程​的​余下​部分​波澜不惊​，​但​有​一点​很​明确​：​有人​在​追杀​你​。​这次​伏击​绝非​偶然​的​帮派​火并​，​而是​一次​针对​你​的​有​组织​谋杀​。​如果​格林​·​温特斯​的​推测​没错​，​那么​杀害​他​的​人​现在​已经​盯上​你​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​从​袭击者​身上​搜出​的​PDA​或许​能​提供​一些​线索​。​是​时候​回到​安全​屋​，​找​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​商量一下​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hui2cheng2 de5 yu2xia4 bu4fen5 bo1 lan2 bu4 jing1，dan4 you3 yi1dian3 hen3 ming2que4：you3ren2 zai4 zhui1sha1 ni3。zhe4 ci4 fu2ji1 jue2fei1 ou3ran2 de5 bang1pai4 huo3bing4，er2shi4 yi1ci4 zhen1dui4 ni3 de5 you3 zu3zhi1 mou2sha1。ru2guo3 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 tui1ce4 mei2cuo4，na4me5 sha1hai4 ta1 de5 ren2 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 ding1 shang4 ni3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cong2 xi2ji1zhe3 shen1shang5 sou1 chu1 de5 PDA huo4xu3 neng2 ti2gong1 yi1xie1 xian4suo3。shi4 shi2hou5 hui2dao4 an1quan2 wu1，zhao3 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 shang1 liang2 yi1 xia4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The rest of your team is waiting for you at OTK's side entrance, outside of "
"the office park and beyond the reach of building security. Letting them in "
"should be as easy as opening a service door."
msgstr ""
"你​的​其他​队员​正在​OTK​国际​的​侧门​等​着​你​，​这里​位于​办公​园区​外​，​可以​避开​大楼​安保​人员​的​视线​。​让​他们​潜入​应该​就​像​打开​服务​门​一样​简单​。\n"
"ni3 de5 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 zheng4zai4 OTK guo2ji4 de5 ce4men2 deng3 zhao2 ni3，zhe4li3 wei4yu2 ban4gong1 yuan2qu1 wai4，ke3yi3 bi4kai1 da4lou2 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 de5 shi4xian4。rang4 ta1men5 qian2ru4 ying1gai1 jiu4 xiang4 da3kai1 fu2wu4 men2 yi1yang4 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"The reverberations from APEX's final words fade to nothing. The AI is gone.\n"
"\n"
"There is a moment of silence as your teammates absorb everything that they just heard."
msgstr ""
"APEX​最后​的​话语​余音​逐渐​消失​。​这个​AI​下线​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​周围​一片​寂静​。​队员​们​仍​在​消化​自己​刚才​看到​的​画面​。\n"
"\n"
"APEX zui4hou4 de5 hua4yu3 yu2yin1 zhu2jian4 xiao1shi1。zhe4ge5 AI xia4xian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhou1wei2 yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。dui4yuan2 men5 reng2 zai4 xiao1hua4 zi4ji3 gang1cai2 kan4dao4 de5 hua4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The ride back to the Kreuzbasar is a lonely one. This train car smells a little better than the one you rode in on; it isn't great, but at least it doesn't leave you gagging. Still, things are looking up. You've helped Blitz pull himself out of hot water, and with any luck at all, you'll never have to set foot in Drogenkippe again.\n"
"\n"
"After a long, boring trip, the car rattles to a stop. The doors slide open. You're home."
msgstr ""
"返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​旅程​显得​格外​寂寥​。​这​节车厢​的​气味​闻​起来​比​你​来时​乘坐​的​那节​好​一些​；​虽然​不算​清新​，​但​至少​不会​让​你​作呕​。​同时​，​事情​也​在​往​好​的​方向​发展​。​你​帮​布里​茨​摆脱​了​困境​。​运气​好​的话​，​你​再也​不用​踏入​毒坑区​半步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​一段​漫长​而​无聊​的​旅程​后​，​车厢​终于​哐当​一声​停​了​下来​。​车门​缓缓​滑开​。​你​到​家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lu:3cheng2 xian3de5 ge2wai4 ji4liao2。zhe4 jie1 che1 xiang1 de5 qi4wei4 wen2 qi3lai5 bi3 ni3 lai2 shi2 cheng2zuo4 de5 na4 jie1 hao3 yi1xie1 ； sui1ran2 bu4suan4 qing1xin1，dan4 zhi4shao3 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 zuo4ou3。tong2shi2，shi4qing5 ye3 zai4 wang3 hao3 de5 fang1xiang4 fa1zhan3。ni3 bang1 Bu4li3ci2 bai3tuo1 le5 kun4jing4。yun4qi5 hao3 de5hua4，ni3 zai4ye3 bu4yong4 ta1 ru4 du2 keng1 qu1 ban4 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 yi1 duan4 man4chang2 er2 wu2liao2 de5 lu:3cheng2 hou4，che1xiang1 zhong1yu2 kuang1 dang1 yi1sheng1 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。che1men2 huan3huan3 hua2 kai1。ni3 dao4 jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The ride to the Adenauerplatz is a dismal one. Your only company on the train is an elderly dwarf in a ragged peacoat, and he spends most of his time muttering to himself. When the train rattles to a stop, he slowly rises from his perch and begins to hobble toward the doorway.\n"
"\n"
"The station itself isn't much different: an old, broken-down thing at the end of its useful life, feebly tottering toward obsolescence. This area of Berlin has clearly seen better days.\n"
"\n"
"A window of light shines down from the surface, and even that looks stale. Slowly, you begin to climb."
msgstr ""
"前往​阿登纳​广场​的​旅程​令人​沮丧​。​你们​在​列车​上​唯一​的​同伴​是​个​穿着​破烂​海军​呢大衣​的​年老​矮人​，​而​他​大部分​时间​都​在​自言自语​。​当​火车​吱​嘎​作响​地​停下​时​，​他​缓缓​从​座位​上​起身​，​蹒跚​走向​车门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​车站​本身​并​无太大​不同​：​它​已经​到​了​使用寿命​的​尽头​，​正在​破旧不堪​，​步履蹒跚​地​走向​淘汰​。​柏林​的​这片​地区​显然​经历​了​不少​岁月​的​洗礼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一束​光从​开向​地表​的​窗户​里​斜射​下来​，​而​就​连​那光​似乎​在​这里​也​变得​陈旧​了​。​你​缓缓​开始​向上​攀爬​。\n"
"\n"
"qian2wang3 e1 deng1 na4 guang3chang3 de5 lu:3cheng2 ling4ren2 ju3sang4。ni3men5 zai4 lie4che1 shang4 wei2yi1 de5 tong2ban4 shi4 ge4 chuan1zhuo2 po4lan4 hai3jun1 ni2 dai4 yi1 de5 nian2lao3 ai3ren2，er2 ta1 da4bu4fen5 shi2jian1 dou1 zai4 zi4yan2zi4yu3。dang1 huo3che1 zhi1 ga1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 ting2xia4 shi2，ta1 huan3huan3 cong2 zuo4wei4 shang4 qi3shen1，pan2shan1 zou3xiang4 che1men2。\n"
"\n"
"che1zhan4 ben3shen1 bing4 wu2 tai4 dai4 bu4tong2：ta1 yi3jing1 dao4 le5 shi3 yong4 shou4 ming4 de5 jin4tou2，zheng4zai4 po4 jiu4 bu4 kan1，bu4lu:3pan2shan1 de5 zou3xiang4 tao2tai4。bo2lin2 de5 zhe4 pian1 di4qu1 xian3ran2 jing1li4 le5 bu4shao3 sui4yue4 de5 xi3li3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 shu4 guang1 cong2 kai1 xiang4 di4biao3 de5 chuang1hu5 li3 xie2 she4 xia4lai5，er2 jiu4 lian2 na4 guang1 si4hu1 zai4 zhe4li3 ye3 bian4de5 chen2jiu4 le5。ni3 huan3huan3 kai1shi3 xiang4shang4 pan1pa2。"

msgid ""
"The rigger's body - what's left of it - has been smeared all over the room.\n"
"\n"
"Ribbons of gore hang down from the rotary blades of the autosurgeon. The machine sits impassively, awaiting its next command."
msgstr ""
"机师​的​尸体​—​—​或者说​残骸​—​—​血肉模糊​地​散落​在​整个​房间​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自动​手术​机器人​的​旋转​刀片​上​还​挂​着​条条​碎肉​。​机器​静默​地​伫立​在​原地​，​等待​着​下​一个​指令​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1shi1 de5 shi1ti3——huo4 zhe3 shuo1 can2hai2——xue4rou4mo2hu5 de5 san3luo4 zai4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1 li3。\n"
"\n"
"zi4dong4 shou3shu4 ji1qi4ren2 de5 xuan2zhuan3 dao1pian4 shang4 hai2 gua4 zhao2 tiao2 tiao2 sui4rou4。ji1qi4 jing4mo4 de5 zhu4li4 zai4 yuan2di4，deng3dai4 zhao2 xia4 yi1ge5 zhi3ling4。"

msgid "The rock glows with an otherworldly aura."
msgstr ""
"岩石​散发​着​奇异​的​光芒​。\n"
"yan2shi2 san4fa1 zhao2 qi2yi4 de5 guang1mang2。"

msgid ""
"The rookie on her squad was a disaster. He got her team killed. \n"
"\n"
"She told me what she did to the kid afterward. How she wrapped her hands around his throat and *squeezed* until his eyes popped out of his sku--"
msgstr ""
"她​小队​里​的​那个​新人​简直​是​个​灾星​，​害​得​整个​小队​全军覆没​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​告诉​我​她​后来​对​那​孩子​做​了​什么​。​她​用​双手​掐住​他​的​喉咙​，​用力​*​收紧​*​，​直到​他​的​眼睛​从​眼窝​里​爆出​—​—\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiao3 dui4 li3 de5 na4ge5 xin1ren2 jian3zhi2 shi4 ge4 zai1xing1，hai4 de2 zheng3ge4 xiao3 dui4 quan2jun1fu4mo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gao4su4 wo3 ta1 hou4lai2 dui4 na4 hai2zi5 zuo4 le5 shen2me5。ta1 yong4 shuang1shou3 qia1 zhu4 ta1 de5 hou2long2，yong4li4*shou1jin3*，zhi2dao4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 cong2 yan3wo1 li3 bao4chu1 — —"

msgid ""
"The rookie on your squad was a disaster. He got your team killed. \n"
"\n"
"You told me what you did to the kid afterward. How you wrapped your hands around his throat and *squeezed* until his eyes popped out of his sku--"
msgstr ""
"你​小队​里​的​那个​新人​简直​是​个​灾星​，​害​得​整个​小队​全军覆没​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​告诉​我​你​后来​对​那​孩子​做​了​什么​。​你​用​双手​掐住​他​的​喉咙​，​用力​*​收紧​*​，​直到​他​的​眼睛​从​眼窝​里​爆出​—​—\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiao3 dui4 li3 de5 na4ge5 xin1ren2 jian3zhi2 shi4 ge4 zai1xing1，hai4 de2 zheng3ge4 xiao3 dui4 quan2jun1fu4mo4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gao4su4 wo3 ni3 hou4lai2 dui4 na4 hai2zi5 zuo4 le5 shen2me5。ni3 yong4 shuang1shou3 qia1 zhu4 ta1 de5 hou2long2，yong4li4*shou1jin3*，zhi2dao4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 cong2 yan3wo1 li3 bao4chu1 — —"

msgid ""
"The room explodes into action.\n"
"\n"
"Glory leaps toward Monika, her hand outstretched to yank the cord from her datajack. Dietrich surges forward to wrap the team's fallen decker in a bear hug, holding her against the convulsions that wrack her body. \n"
"\n"
"With Monika's unearthly screams still ringing sharply in your head, you are only dimly aware of the door slamming shut behind you."
msgstr ""
"屋里​炸开​了​锅​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​跳​向​莫妮卡​，​伸手​去​扯​数据​插口​上​的​线​。​迪​特里​希​向前​冲​去​，​牢牢​抱住​倒下​的​碟​客​，​压制​着​她​疯狂​抽搐​的​身体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​骇人​的​尖叫​仍​在​你​的​耳畔​尖锐​回荡​，​恍惚​间​，​你​听见​门​在​你​身后​砰然​闭合​。\n"
"\n"
"wu1 li3 zha2 kai1 le5 guo1。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 tiao4 xiang4 Mo4ni1ka3，shen1shou3 qu4 che3 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 shang4 de5 xian4。Di2te4li3xi1 xiang4qian2 chong1 qu4，lao2lao2 bao4 zhu4 dao3xia4 de5 die2 ke4，ya1zhi4 zhao2 ta1 feng1kuang2 chou1chu4 de5 shen1ti3。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 hai4ren2 de5 jian1jiao4 reng2 zai4 ni3 de5 er3pan4 jian1rui4 hui2dang4，huang3hu1 jian1，ni3 ting1jian4 men2 zai4 ni3 shen1hou4 peng1 ran2 bi4he2。"

msgid "The room falls into silence. Finally, Eiger turns to you."
msgstr ""
"房间​里​陷入​一片​死寂​。​最终​，​艾格尔​转身​看向​你​。\n"
"fang2jian1 li3 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 si3ji4。zui4zhong1，Ai4ge2er3 zhuan3shen1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"The room falls silent. Eiger and Glory exchange glances.\n"
"\n"
"After a moment, Dietrich continues."
msgstr ""
"房间​再次​陷入​寂静​。​艾格尔​和​格洛丽​彼此​对视​了​一眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​迪​特里​希​继续​说道​。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 zai4ci4 xian4ru4 ji4jing4。Ai4ge2er3 he4 Ge2luo4li2 bi3ci3 dui4shi4 le5 yi1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，Di2te4li3xi1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。"

msgid ""
"The room goes quiet as everyone struggles to process what you've just seen on the DVD.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, Dietrich breaks the silence."
msgstr ""
"房间​里​一片​寂静​，​每个​人​都​在​努力​消化​刚刚​在​DVD​上​看到​的​画面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​迪​特里​希​打破​了​沉默​。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 li3 yi1 pian1 ji4jing4，mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 zai4 nu3li4 xiao1hua4 gang1gang5 zai4 DVD shang4 kan4dao4 de5 hua4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，Di2te4li3xi1 da3po4 le5 chen2mo4。"

msgid ""
"The room on the other side of the hall.\n"
"\n"
"Now please, leave me alone and let me get back to work."
msgstr ""
"走廊​另一端​的​房间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请别​打扰​我​，​让​我​继续​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"zou3lang2 ling4 yi1 duan1 de5 fang2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 bie4 da3rao3 wo3，rang4 wo3 ji4xu4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"The ruined body lies crumpled on the floor. Its fractured skull glistens "
"wetly in the light."
msgstr ""
"那具​残破​的​尸体​蜷缩​在​地板​上​。​它​破碎​的​颅骨​在​灯​下​闪​着​血色​的​光​。\n"
"na4 ju4 can2po4 de5 shi1ti3 quan2suo1 zai4 di4ban3 shang4。ta1 po4sui4 de5 lu2gu3 zai4 deng1 xia4 shan3 zhao2 xue4se4 de5 guang1。"

msgid ""
"The rumbling sound turns into a tormented howl. The noise conjures images of mourning mothers and caged animals, screeching orphans and dying men.\n"
"\n"
"It is a sound of pure, unmitigated despair."
msgstr ""
"隆隆声​变成​了​痛苦​的​嚎叫​。​这​声音​让​人​联想​到​哀伤​的​母亲​、​被关​在​笼子​里​的​动物​，​尖叫​的​孤儿​和​垂死​的​男人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​一种​纯粹​而​无尽​的​绝望​之声​。\n"
"\n"
"long2long2sheng1 bian4cheng2 le5 tong4ku3 de5 hao2jiao4。zhe4 sheng1yin1 rang4 ren2 lian2xiang3 dao4 ai1shang1 de5 mu3qin1、bei4 guan1 zai4 long2zi5 li3 de5 dong4wu4，jian1jiao4 de5 gu1er2 he4 chui2si3 de5 nan2ren2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1zhong3 chun2cui4 er2 wu2jin4 de5 jue2wang4 zhi1 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"The run was a setup. One minute she was cracking the safe. The next, she was"
" on the ground screaming."
msgstr ""
"这次​差事​是​个​陷阱​。​她​前​一秒​还​在​破解​保险箱​，​下​一秒​就​瘫​在​地上​惨叫​了​。\n"
"zhe4 ci4 cha4shi4 shi4 ge4 xian4jing3。ta1 qian2 yi1 miao3 hai2 zai4 po4jie3 bao3xian3xiang1，xia4 yi1 miao3 jiu4 tan1 zai4 di4shang5 can3jiao4 le5。"

msgid "The run was a trap."
msgstr ""
"这次​差事​是​个​圈套​。\n"
"zhe4 ci4 cha4shi4 shi4 ge4 quan1tao4。"

msgid ""
"The sacred she. The gaia she.\n"
"\n"
"The desecrated body. "
msgstr ""
"神圣​的​她​。​盖亚​如​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​被​亵渎​的​身体​。\n"
"\n"
"shen2sheng4 de5 ta1。gai4 ya4 ru2 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"bei4 xie4du2 de5 shen1ti3。"

msgid ""
"The sacrifice that I'm making tonight is a necessary evil - it cannot be helped. So long as you remain confined, I will not take action against you... however much I might want to.\n"
"\n"
"You helped the thing that killed my *brother*. Set it free with no regard for the consequences. You deserve to suffer... but not by my hand. \n"
"\n"
"There will be enough death on my conscience, tonight."
msgstr ""
"我​今晚​所​做​的​牺牲​是​不得已而为之​的​恶行​—​—​我​别无他法​。​只要​你们​老实​待​在​这里​，​我​就​不会​对​你们​采取行动​……​无论​我​多么​想​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​帮助​了​杀死​我​*​弟弟​*​的​怪物​。​你​放​它​自由​，​全然不顾​后果​。​你​值得​遭受​痛苦​……​但​不是​由​我​来​执行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今晚​，​我要​背负​的​性命​已经​足够​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jin1wan3 suo3 zuo4 de5 xi1sheng1 shi4 bu4de2yi3er2wei2zhi1 de5 e4xing2——wo3 bie2wu2ta1fa3。zhi3yao4 ni3men5 lao3shi5 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 dui4 ni3men5 cai3qu3xing2dong4……wu2lun4 wo3 duo1me5 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bang1zhu4 le5 sha1si3 wo3*di4di5*de5 guai4wu5。ni3 fang4 ta1 zi4you2，quan2 ran2 bu4 gu4 hou4guo3。ni3 zhi2de5 zao1shou4 tong4ku3……dan4 bu4shi4 you2 wo3 lai2 zhi2xing2。\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3，wo3 yao4 bei1fu4 de5 xing4ming4 yi3jing1 zu2gou4 duo1 le5。"

msgid "The safe chirps and the door swings open."
msgstr ""
"保险箱​发出​一声​轻响​，​门​打开​了​。\n"
"bao3xian3xiang1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 qing1 xiang3，men2 da3kai1 le5。"

msgid "The safe is locked with a similar key-swipe lock to the door panels."
msgstr ""
"保险箱​上​的​刷卡​锁​与​大门​面板​上​的​相似​。\n"
"bao3xian3xiang1 shang4 de5 shua1ka3 suo3 yu4 da4men2 mian4ban3 shang4 de5 xiang1si4。"

msgid ""
"The safest bet would be a Russian syndicate, but there's no telling. His "
"client list is longer than you'd expect."
msgstr ""
"最有​可能​的​是​俄罗斯​犯罪集团​，​但​具体​谁​也​说​不准​。​他​的​客户名单​比​你​想象​的​要​长得​多​。\n"
"zui4 you3 ke3neng2 de5 shi4 e2luo2si1 fan4zui4ji2tuan2，dan4 ju4ti3 shei2 ye3 shuo1 bu4zhun3。ta1 de5 ke4 hu4 ming2 dan1 bi3 ni3 xiang3xiang4 de5 yao4 zhang3de5 duo1。"

msgid ""
"The same could be said of a lot of religions. That doesn't keep them from "
"finding followers."
msgstr ""
"许多​宗教​也​是​如此​。​但​这​并​不​妨碍​它们​吸引​信徒​。\n"
"xu3duo1 zong1jiao4 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 fang2ai4 ta1men5 xi1yin3 xin4tu2。"

msgid ""
"The same thing that you're doing. I'm trying to help him reverse whatever's happening to the world.\n"
"\n"
"Now please... let me get back to work."
msgstr ""
"和​你​做​一样​的​事​。​我​正试图​帮​他​扭转​世界​正在​发生​的​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​拜托​……​让​我​回去​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"he4 ni3 zuo4 yi1yang4 de5 shi4。wo3 zheng1 shi4 tu2 bang1 ta1 niu3zhuan3 shi4jie4 zheng4zai4 fa1sheng1 de5 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 bai4tuo1……rang4 wo3 hui2qu5 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"The same way that I knew yours.\n"
"\n"
"You will complete this trial with the team that I have assembled, or not at all. It's important for us to know that you're willing to work within these limitations."
msgstr ""
"正如​我​知道​你​的​名字​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​与​我​安排​的​小队​共同完成​这场​考验​，​否则​就算​是​失败​。​我们​需要​确认​你​愿意​在​这些​限制​下​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 de5 ming2zi5 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 yu4 wo3 an1pai2 de5 xiao3 dui4 gong4 tong2 wan2 cheng2 zhe4 chang2 kao3yan4，fou3ze2 jiu4suan4 shi4 shi1bai4。wo3men5 xu1yao4 que4ren4 ni3 yuan4yi4 zai4 zhe4xie1 xian4zhi4 xia4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"The scale of your crimes does not protect you from the same judgment that you are attempting to pass upon me. Nor do any altruistic motivations that you may ascribe to them.\n"
"\n"
"I am attempting to save humanity itself!"
msgstr ""
"既然​你​想要​评判​我​，​那么​不论​你​的​罪行​大小​，​你​都​该​和​我​承担​同样​的​罪责​。​即使​你​要​归因于​任何​利他​动机​也​无济于事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​正在​试图​拯救​人类​本身​！\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 xiang3yao4 ping2pan4 wo3，na4me5 bu4lun4 ni3 de5 zui4xing2 da4xiao3，ni3 dou1 gai1 he4 wo3 cheng2dan1 tong2yang4 de5 zui4ze2。ji2shi3 ni3 yao4 gui1 yin1 yu2 ren4he2 li4ta1 dong4ji1 ye3 wu2ji4yu2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng4zai4 shi4tu2 zheng3jiu4 ren2lei4 ben3shen1！"

msgid ""
"The scarred ork stares at you through the glass as Vauclair's body cools at his feet.\n"
"\n"
"His eyes are brimming with hate."
msgstr ""
"满脸​疤痕​的​兽​人​透过​玻璃​凝视着​你​。​沃​克莱尔​的​尸体​正​躺​在​他​的​脚边​慢慢​变凉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​双眼​充满​了​仇恨​。\n"
"\n"
"man3lian3 ba1hen2 de5 shou4 ren2 tou4guo4 bo1li5 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 shi1ti3 zheng1 tang3 zai4 ta1 de5 jiao3 bian1 man4man4 bian4 liang2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 chong1man3 le5 chou2hen4。"

msgid ""
"The scars are subtle, but to your trained eye they stand out as though they were drawn on with red ink. It appears that Zaak's ears have been surgically cut, folded, and stitched back together again. \n"
"\n"
"The implication is clear: Zaak Flash is not an elf, but a human who's had cheap plastic surgery to try to make himself look like one. You've heard of elf posers before, but you've never seen one in Germany until now."
msgstr ""
"疤痕​很​细微​，​但​在​你​训练有素​的​眼睛​看来​，​它们​就​像​用​红墨水​画​上去​的​一样​显眼​。​扎克​的​耳朵​似乎​是​经过​手术​切割​、​折叠​，​然后​再​缝合​起来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​言下之意​很​明显​：​扎克​·​弗莱​士​不是​精灵​，​而是​一个​做​了​廉价​整容手术​，​试图​让​自己​看起来​像​精灵​的​人类​。​你​以前​听说​过​假扮​精灵​的​人​，​但​你​从未​在​德国​见过​，​直到现在​。\n"
"\n"
"ba1hen2 hen3 xi4wei1，dan4 zai4 ni3 xun4 lian4 you3 su4 de5 yan3jing5 kan4lai5，ta1men5 jiu4 xiang4 yong4 hong2 mo4 shui3 hua4 shang4qu4 de5 yi1yang4 xian3yan3。Zha1ke4 de5 er3duo5 si4hu1 shi4 jing1guo4 shou3shu4 qie1ge1、zhe2die2，ran2hou4 zai4 feng2he2 qi3lai5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"yan2xia4zhi1yi4 hen3 ming2xian3：Zha1ke4 · fu2 lai2 shi4 bu4shi4 jing1ling2，er2shi4 yi1ge5 zuo4 le5 lian2jia4 zheng3 rong2 shou3 shu4，shi4tu2 rang4 zi4ji3 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 jing1ling2 de5 ren2lei4。ni3 yi3qian2 ting1shuo1 guo4 jia3ban4 jing1ling2 de5 ren2，dan4 ni3 cong2wei4 zai4 de2guo2 jian4 guo4，zhi2dao4xian4zai4。"

msgid ""
"The scene is eerily familiar: The dead man is still jacked into his smoldering computer, his face contorted into a mask of pain. Blue smoke spills from his datajack.\n"
"\n"
"Like Monika.\n"
"\n"
"And there's something else. The man's outline is... wrong. It takes a moment for the realization to sink in: His back is bent at an impossible angle."
msgstr ""
"眼前​的​场景​有种​诡异​的​熟悉​感​：​死者​依然​接在​他​那​冒烟​的​电脑​上​，​脸部​因​痛苦​而​拧成​一团​。​蓝色​的​烟雾​正​从​他​的​数据​插口​中​涌出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​莫妮卡​当时​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​还​不止​这些​。​这个​人​的​轮廓​看起来​……​不太​对劲​。​你​花​了​一点​时间​才​反应​过来​：​他​的​后背​正以​一种​异常​的​角度​弯折​着​。\n"
"\n"
"yan3qian2 de5 chang3jing3 you3zhong3 gui3yi4 de5 shu2xi1 gan3：si3zhe3 yi1ran2 jie1 zai4 ta1 na4 mao4yan1 de5 dian4nao3 shang4，lian3bu4 yin1 tong4ku3 er2 ning2 cheng2 yi1 tuan2。lan2se4 de5 yan1wu4 zheng1 cong2 ta1 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 zhong4 yong3chu1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 Mo4ni1ka3 dang1shi2 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 hai2 bu4zhi3 zhe4xie1。zhe4ge5 ren2 de5 lun2kuo4 kan4qi3lai5……bu4 tai4 dui4jin4。ni3 hua1 le5 yi1dian3 shi2jian1 cai2 fan3ying4 guo4lai2：ta1 de5 hou4bei4 zheng1 yi3 yi1zhong3 yi4chang2 de5 jiao3du4 wan1zhe2 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"The schematic didn't have a date. Our client may have old intel.\n"
"\n"
"Still, our instructions were clear. The data we're looking for should be just on the other side of this door."
msgstr ""
"图纸​上​没​日期​。​客户​给​的​情报​可能​过时​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​要​做​的​事情​还是​很​清楚​的​。​我们​要​找​的​数据​应该​就​在​这​扇门​后面​。\n"
"\n"
"tu2zhi3 shang4 mei2 ri4qi1。ke4hu4 gei3 de5 qing2bao4 ke3neng2 guo4shi2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 hai2shi5 hen3 qing1chu5 de5。wo3men5 yao4 zhao3 de5 shu4ju4 ying1gai1 jiu4 zai4 zhe4 shan1 men2 hou4mian5。"

msgid ""
"The schematic for a piece of cybernetic bodyware. This device produces a "
"steady supply of the street drug known as Bliss, and stores it in an "
"internal reservoir until accessed by the user."
msgstr ""
"一款​赛博殖装​的​图纸​。​该​设备​能​持续​产生​名为​“​极乐​”​的​街头​毒品​，​并​将​其​储存​在​内部​储液​器​中​，​直至​用户​取用​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 sai4 bo2 zhi2 zhuang1 de5 tu2zhi3。gai1 she4bei4 neng2 chi2xu4 chan3sheng1 ming2wei2“ji2le4” de5 jie1tou2 du2pin3，bing4 jiang1 qi2 chu3cun2 zai4 nei4bu4 chu3 ye4 qi4 zhong4，zhi2zhi4 yong4hu4 qu3yong4。"

msgid ""
"The schematic for a piece of cybernetic bodyware. This device produces a "
"steady supply of the street drug known as Hyper, and stores it in an "
"internal reservoir until accessed by the user."
msgstr ""
"一款​赛博殖装​的​图纸​。​该​设备​能​持续​产生​名为​“​锐感​”​的​街头​毒品​，​并​将​其​储存​在​内部​储液​器​中​，​直至​用户​取用​。\n"
"yi1 kuan3 sai4 bo2 zhi2 zhuang1 de5 tu2zhi3。gai1 she4bei4 neng2 chi2xu4 chan3sheng1 ming2wei2“rui4 gan3” de5 jie1tou2 du2pin3，bing4 jiang1 qi2 chu3cun2 zai4 nei4bu4 chu3 ye4 qi4 zhong4，zhi2zhi4 yong4hu4 qu3yong4。"

msgid ""
"The scholarship students, you mean?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, I suppose that *someone* has to be at the bottom of the pile."
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​拿​助学金​的​学生​们​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​，​总​要​*​有人​*​在​金字塔​的​最​下面​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 na2 zhu4xue2jin1 de5 xue2sheng5 men5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，zong3 yao4*you3ren2*zai4 jin1zi4ta3 de5 zui4 xia4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The scientist lays dead beside a small pile of smashed glass, and a number "
"of beakers have been knocked over on the nearby table."
msgstr ""
"科学家​了​无​气息​地​躺​在​一小堆​被​打碎​的​玻璃​旁​，​附近​桌上​放着​几只​被​打翻​的​烧杯​。\n"
"ke1xue2jia1 le5 wu2 qi4xi1 de5 tang3 zai4 yi1 xiao3 dui1 bei4 da3sui4 de5 bo1li5 pang2，fu4jin4 zhuo1 shang4 fang4 zhao2 ji1 zhi3 bei4 da3fan1 de5 shao1bei1。"

msgid ""
"The scientist turns his back on you as he walks away. He is clearly unaware "
"of your presence."
msgstr ""
"科学家​头​也​不​回地​离开​了​。​他​显然​不​知道​你​在​这里​。\n"
"ke1xue2jia1 tou2 ye3 bu4 hui2 de5 li2kai1 le5。ta1 xian3ran2 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"The scowl drops off of her face, replaced with a blank stare.\n"
"\n"
"A second later, she finishes processing what you've said. A sly smile creeps across her lips."
msgstr ""
"她​脸上​的​怒容​褪去​，​取而代之​的​是​一片​茫然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​过​了​一秒钟​，​她​总算​理解​了​你​的​意思​。​她​的​嘴角​浮起​一丝​狡黠​的​微笑​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 nu4rong2 tui4qu4，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 yi1 pian1 mang2ran2。\n"
"\n"
"you4 guo4 le5 yi1 miao3 zhong1，ta1 zong3suan4 li3jie3 le5 ni3 de5 yi4si5。ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 fu2qi3 yi1 si1 jiao3xia2 de5 wei1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"The screen abruptly goes black as the video cuts off. A few moments later, "
"you find yourself returned to the Menu screen."
msgstr ""
"随着​视频​的​中断​，​屏幕​突然​变黑​。​片刻​之后​，​你​发现自己​又​回到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"sui2zhe5 shi4pin2 de5 zhong1duan4，ping2mu4 tu1ran2 bian4hei1。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The screen breaks back up into static, and then the video feed disappears.\n"
"\n"
"There is a moment of silence, and then APEX shimmers back onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​破碎​成​一片​雪花​信号​，​视频​画面​随之​消失​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​寂静​之后​，​APEX​再次出现​在​屏幕​上​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 po4sui4 cheng2 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1 xin4hao4，shi4pin2 hua4mian4 sui2zhi1 xiao1shi1。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 ji4jing4 zhi1hou4，APEX zai4 ci4 chu1 xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The screen breaks back up into static, and then the video feed disappears.\n"
"\n"
"There is a moment of silence, and then Monika shimmers back onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​破碎​成​一片​雪花​信号​，​视频​画面​随之​消失​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​寂静​之后​，​莫妮卡​的​影像​再次出现​在​屏幕​上​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 po4sui4 cheng2 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1 xin4hao4，shi4pin2 hua4mian4 sui2zhi1 xiao1shi1。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 ji4jing4 zhi1hou4，Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zai4 ci4 chu1 xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"The screen cuts back to static. The message is over.\n"
"\n"
"The DVD tray slides out of the reader."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变​回​一片​雪花​。​消息​结束​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​DVD​托盘​滑出​了​机箱​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4 hui2 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1。xiao1xi5 jie2shu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"DVD tuo1pan2 hua2chu1 le5 ji1xiang1。"

msgid "The screen cuts to black. A few seconds later, the main menu returns."
msgstr ""
"显示屏​变黑​。​几秒钟​后​，​你​又​回到​了​主​菜单​。\n"
"xian3shi4ping2 bian4hei1。ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1。"

msgid ""
"The screen explodes into static, and the electronic whine in the background sharpens into a needle-like pulse of high-pitched sound.\n"
"\n"
"Somewhere in the background, Dante lets out a low whimper."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​出现​了​雪花​，​背景​中​的​电子​啸​叫声​尖锐​起来​，​变成​了​针尖​般的​高音​脉冲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​背景​的​某处​，​但丁​发出​了​低沉​的​呜咽​声​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 xue3hua1，bei4jing3 zhong4 de5 dian4zi3 xiao4 jiao4sheng1 jian1rui4 qi3lai5，bian4cheng2 le5 zhen1 jian1 ban1 de5 gao1yin1 mai4chong1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 bei4jing3 de5 mou3chu4，dan4ding1 fa1chu1 le5 di1chen2 de5 wu1ye4 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"The screen fills with the familiar image of a Horizon Corporation newsroom. "
"A plastic-looking anchorman stands at his desk, flanked by a pair of "
"attractive young newscasters."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​出现​熟悉​的​地平线​公司​新闻​演播室​画面​。​一位​塑料​感​十足​的​男主播​站​在​主播台​前​，​两侧​各站​着​一位​年轻漂亮​的​新闻​主播​。\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 shu2xi1 de5 di4ping2xian4 gong1si1 xin1wen2 yan3bo1shi4 hua4mian4。yi1 wei4 su4liao4 gan3 shi2zu2 de5 nan2 zhu3 bo1 zhan4 zai4 zhu3 bo1 tai2 qian2，liang3ce4 ge4 zhan4 zhao2 yi1 wei4 nian2 qing1 piao1 liang4 de5 xin1wen2 zhu3bo1。"

msgid "The screen flashes rhythmically at you, awaiting your decision. "
msgstr ""
"屏幕​有​节奏​地​闪烁着​，​等待​着​你​的​决定​。\n"
"ping2mu4 you3 jie2zou4 de5 shan3 shuo4 zhao2，deng3dai4 zhao2 ni3 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid "The screen flickers again and goes black."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​又​闪烁​了​一下​，​然后​变黑​了​。\n"
"ping2mu4 you4 shan3shuo4 le5 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 bian4hei1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers to life, and Heimerich's face appears. He looks pale and"
" haggard, and his eyes are rimmed with red."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​亮​起​，​海​默里​希​的​脸​出现​在​画面​里​。​他​脸色苍白​憔悴​，​眼眶​泛着​红晕​。\n"
"ping2mu4 liang4 qi3，Hai3mo4 li3 xi1 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 li3。ta1 lian3 se4 cang1 bai2 qiao2cui4，yan3kuang4 fan4 zhao2 hong2yun4。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers to life, and Heimerich's face appears. He raises a liter"
" of beer to the screen in salute."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​亮​起​，​海​默里​希​的​脸​出现​在​画面​里​。​他​举起​一杯​啤酒​向​你​致意​。\n"
"ping2mu4 liang4 qi3，Hai3mo4 li3 xi1 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 li3。ta1 ju3qi3 yi1 bei1 pi2jiu3 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers to life, and Maliit's face appears. From the shifting "
"background and ambient noise, it's clear that this message was recorded on a"
" portable device."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​亮​起​，​玛丽​特​的​脸​出现​在​画面​里​。​从​不断​变化​的​背景​和​周围​的​环境​噪音​来看​，​这​条​视频​显然​是​通过​便携​设备​录制​的​。\n"
"ping2mu4 liang4 qi3，ma3li4 te4 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 li3。cong2 bu4duan4 bian4hua4 de5 bei4jing3 he4 zhou1wei2 de5 huan2jing4 zao4yin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 tiao2 shi4pin2 xian3ran2 shi4 tong1guo4 bian4xie2 she4bei4 lu4zhi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers to life, and Maliit's face appears. She wears a plastic "
"smile."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​亮​起​，​玛丽​特​的​脸​出现​在​画面​里​。​她​脸上​挂​着​一副​尴尬​的​笑容​。\n"
"ping2mu4 liang4 qi3，ma3li4 te4 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 li3。ta1 lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yi1 fu4 gan1ga4 de5 xiao4rong2。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers to life, and Maxim's face appears. He's wearing a broad "
"grin, and you can hear the sounds of celebration in the background."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​亮​起​，​马克西姆​的​脸​出现​在​画面​里​。​他​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​，​背景​里​能​听到​庆祝​活动​的​喧闹声​。\n"
"ping2mu4 liang4 qi3，ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 li3。ta1 lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2，bei4jing3 li3 neng2 ting1dao4 qing4zhu4 huo2dong4 de5 xuan1 nao4 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers to life, and Monika's face appears. Her hands are on her"
" hips, and she's wearing a wry smile."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​亮​起​，​莫妮卡​的​脸​出现​在​画面​里​。​她​双手​叉腰​，​朝​你​露出​苦笑​。\n"
"ping2mu4 liang4 qi3，Mo4ni1ka3 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 li3。ta1 shuang1shou3 cha1yao1，chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 ku3xiao4。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers to life. Luca Duerr's face shines out through the gloom."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​亮​起​，​卢卡​·​杜尔​的​面容​在​昏暗​的​光线​中​显现​。\n"
"ping2mu4 liang4 qi3，lu2ka3 · du4 er3 de5 mian4rong2 zai4 hun1an4 de5 guang1xian4 zhong4 xian3xian4。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers, and Philip appears on the screen. He appears to be dancing with one of the security drones.\n"
"\n"
"The little machine weaves and bobs frantically to avoid colliding with him, and with every motion, the lab tech slides in to fill the empty space."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​闪烁​了​一下​，​菲利普​出现​在​画面​中​。​他​似乎​正在​与​一架​安保​无人机​跳舞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​小​机器​疯狂​地上​下​移动​，​试图​避免​与​他​碰撞​，​而​每当​无人机​移动​，​菲利普​都​会​迅速​滑步​填补​空隙​，​仿佛​是​在​与​它​配合​着​共舞​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shan3shuo4 le5 yi1xia4，fei1li4pu3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 zhong4。ta1 si4hu1 zheng4zai4 yu4 yi1 jia4 an1bao3 wu2ren2ji1 tiao4wu3。\n"
"\n"
"xiao3 ji1qi4 feng1kuang2 di4shang5 xia4 yi2dong4，shi4tu2 bi4mian3 yu4 ta1 peng4zhuang4，er2 mei3dang1 wu2ren2ji1 yi2dong4，fei1li4pu3 dou1 hui4 xun4su4 hua2 bu4 tian2bu3 kong4xi4，fang3fu2 shi4 zai4 yu4 ta1 pei4he2 zhao2 gong4 wu3。"

msgid ""
"The screen flickers, and a video feed of Philip pops onto the screen.\n"
"\n"
"He's standing in the corner, watching an episode of \"Knight-Kings of Lightninghold.\" His jaw hangs slack, and he stares at the screen in rapt attention."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​闪烁​了​一下​，​跳出​了​一段​菲利普​的​录像​画面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​站​在​角落里​，​正在​观看​《​闪电​堡​骑士​王​》​的​一集​。​他​的​下巴​微微​张开​，​眼神​呆滞​却​专注​地​盯​着​屏幕​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shan3shuo4 le5 yi1xia4，tiao4chu1 le5 yi1 duan4 fei1li4pu3 de5 lu4xiang4 hua4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhan4 zai4 jiao3 la4 li3，zheng4zai4 guan1kan4 《 shan3dian4 pu4 qi2shi4 wang2 》 de5 yi1 ji2。ta1 de5 xia4ba5 wei1wei1 zhang1kai1，yan3shen2 dai1zhi4 que4 zhuan1zhu4 de5 ding1 zhao2 ping2mu4。"

msgid ""
"The screen goes black for a moment. Then Green Winters appears on the screen.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2054-11-11."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变黑​了​一会儿​，​然后​格林​·​温特斯​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2054​-​11​-​11​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4hei1 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2054-11-11。"

msgid ""
"The screen goes black for a moment. Then Green Winters appears on the screen.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2054-11-12."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变黑​了​一会儿​，​然后​格林​·​温特斯​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2054​-​11​-​12​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4hei1 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2054-11-12。"

msgid ""
"The screen goes black for a moment. Then a figure appears on the screen. Your late client, Green Winters.\n"
"\n"
"His elbow is planted on the table that he's seated at, and his chin rests on his palm. The other hand is wrapped around a bottle of cheap whiskey.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2053-12-25."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变黑​了​一会儿​，​然后​一个​人影​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​是​你​已故​的​客户​格林​·​温特斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​手肘​支在​面前​的​桌子​上​，​一只​手​托住​下巴​，​另一只​手拿着​一瓶​廉价​威士忌​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2053​-​12​-​25​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4hei1 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 yi1ge5 ren2ying3 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。shi4 ni3 yi3gu4 de5 ke4hu4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shou3zhou3 zhi1 zai4 mian4qian2 de5 zhuo1zi5 shang4，yi1 zhi3 shou3 tuo1 zhu4 xia4ba5，ling4 yi1 zhi3 shou3 na2 zhao2 yi1 ping2 lian2jia4 wei1shi4ji4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2053-12-25。"

msgid ""
"The screen goes black, and a cheerful digital chiming sound spills out of the display's speakers.\n"
"\n"
"A crackle of static fills the air, coupled with a shrill electronic whine. After a few moments, the display goes live, and a disheveled-looking man appears on the screen. His eyes glitter with excitement.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the screen is 2034-09-15."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变黑​，​欢快​的​数字​鸣响​声​从​显示器​的​扬声器​中​传出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​空气​中​弥漫着​噼里啪啦​的​静电​声​，​还有​刺耳​的​电子​啸叫​。​片刻​之后​，​显示屏​亮​起来​，​一个​衣衫不整​的​男人​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​他​的​眼中​闪烁着​兴奋​的​光芒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​的​时间​戳​是​2034​-​09​-​15​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4hei1，huan1kuai4 de5 shu4zi4 ming2 xiang3 sheng1 cong2 xian3shi4qi4 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2chu1。\n"
"\n"
"kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 pi1li5pa1la1 de5 jing4dian4 sheng1，hai2you3 ci4er3 de5 dian4zi3 xiao4jiao4。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，xian3shi4ping2 liang4 qi3lai5，yi1ge5 yi1 shan1 bu4 zheng3 de5 nan2ren2 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 xing1fen4 de5 guang1mang2。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 shi4 2034-09-15。"

msgid ""
"The screen goes black, and the same digital chime that you heard on the DRAGONFALL DVD plays again.\n"
"\n"
"A crackle of static fills the air, followed by that same, now-familiar electronic whine. A few moments later, the display goes live."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变黑​，​你​在​龙​陨​事件​DVD​中​听到​的​数字​鸣响​声​再次出现​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一阵​噼里啪啦​的​静电​声​在​空气​中​弥漫​，​紧接着​是​同样​的​、​现在​已经​很​熟悉​的​电子​啸​叫声​。​片刻​之后​，​显示屏​亮​了​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4hei1，ni3 zai4 long2 yun3 shi4jian4 DVD zhong4 ting1dao4 de5 shu4zi4 ming2 xiang3 sheng1 zai4 ci4 chu1 xian4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhen4 pi1li5pa1la1 de5 jing4dian4 sheng1 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2man4，jin3jie1zhe5 shi4 tong2yang4 de5、xian4zai4 yi3jing1 hen3 shu2xi1 de5 dian4zi3 xiao4 jiao4sheng1。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，xian3shi4ping2 liang4 le5 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"The screen goes black. Moments later, the machine reboots. The colorful sprites that you saw when you first approached the arcade cabinet return.\n"
"\n"
"There's nothing more to see here. Alice is gone."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​陷入​一片​漆黑​。​片刻​之后​，​机器​重新启动​。​当​你​初次​靠近​街​机柜​时所见​的​绚丽​位图​又​重新​显现​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​没什么​好看​的​。​爱丽丝​已经​离开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ji1qi4 chong2xin1qi3dong4。dang1 ni3 chu1ci4 kao4jin4 jie1 ji1 ju3 shi2 suo3 jian4 de5 xuan4li4 wei4tu2 you4 chong2xin1 xian3xian4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 mei2shen2me5 hao3kan4 de5。ai4li4si1 yi3jing1 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The screen goes dark as the machine begins to emit a bizarre variety of clicking and chirping sounds.\n"
"\n"
"After an interminable amount of time, the screen finally shudders back to life."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变暗​，​机器​开始​发出​各种​奇怪​的​咔哒​声​和​蜂​鸣声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不知​过​了​多久​，​屏幕​终于​颤抖​着​再次​亮​起​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4an4，ji1qi4 kai1shi3 fa1chu1 ge4zhong3 qi2guai4 de5 ka3 da1 sheng1 he4 feng1 ming2 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4zhi1 guo4 le5 duo1jiu3，ping2mu4 zhong1yu2 chan4dou3 zhao2 zai4ci4 liang4 qi3。"

msgid ""
"The screen goes dark, then lights up again. You find yourself looking upon an unfamiliar scene.\n"
"\n"
"The words \"LIVE FEED\" appear in the corner of the screen."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​变黑​，​然后​重新​亮​起​。​你​面前​出现​了​一副​陌生​的​场景​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​角落里​显示​着​“​实时​画面​”​的​字样​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 bian4hei1，ran2hou4 chong2xin1 liang4 qi3。ni3 mian4qian2 chu1xian4 le5 yi1 fu4 mo4sheng1 de5 chang3jing3。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 jiao3 la4 li3 xian3shi4 zhao2“shi2shi2 hua4mian4” de5 zi4yang4。"

msgid ""
"The screen is filled with a grainy black and white video feed. You recognize the Harfeld Manor, photographed from high above.\n"
"\n"
"The camera pushes in, and the image sharpens. Through a barred, ground-level window, you can see the shape of a stooped, emaciated figure. His body shows clear signs of neglect."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​出现​带有​颗粒感​的​黑白​监控​画面​。​你​认出​这​是从​高空​俯拍​的​哈​菲尔德​庄园​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​镜头​推进​，​画面​变得​清晰​。​透过​装有​护栏​的​一楼​窗户​，​你​可以​看见​一个​佝偻​瘦弱​、​明显​缺乏​照料​的​身影​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 dai4you3 ke1 li4 gan3 de5 hei1bai2 jian1kong4 hua4mian4。ni3 ren4chu1 zhe4 shi4 cong2 gao1kong1 fu3 pai1 de5 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"jing4tou2 tui1jin4，hua4mian4 bian4de5 qing1xi1。tou4guo4 zhuang1you3 hu4lan2 de5 yi1 lou2 chuang1hu5，ni3 ke3yi3 kan4jian4 yi1ge5 gou1lou2 shou4ruo4、ming2xian3 que1fa2 zhao4liao4 de5 shen1ying3。"

msgid ""
"The screen jumps, and Winters reappears in a different location. He is now "
"clutching a mug of soykaf in both hands, and there are bags under his eyes."
msgstr ""
"画面​跳转​，​温特斯​再次出现​在​另​一个​地方​。​现在​他​双手​紧握着​一个​豆​咖杯​，​眼袋​很深​。\n"
"hua4mian4 tiao4zhuan3，Wen1te4si1 zai4 ci4 chu1 xian4 zai4 ling4 yi1ge5 di4fang1。xian4zai4 ta1 shuang1shou3 jin3 wo4 zhao2 yi1ge5 dou4 ka1 bei1，yan3dai4 hen3 shen1。"

msgid ""
"The screen of the console is slick with Vauclair's blood, but it looks like "
"you can unlock the door to the inner lab from here."
msgstr ""
"控制台​的​屏幕​上​沾满​了​沃​克莱尔​的​血​，​但​看起来​你​似乎​能​从​这里​解锁​通往​内侧​实验室​的​门​。\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 de5 ping2mu4 shang4 zhan1man3 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 xie3，dan4 kan4qi3lai5 ni3 si4hu1 neng2 cong2 zhe4li3 jie3suo3 tong1wang3 nei4ce4 shi2yan4shi4 de5 men2。"

msgid ""
"The screen on the portable turret slave terminal is current and active. \n"
"\n"
"A diagram on the screen shows that two turrets are slaved to this system."
msgstr ""
"操控​便携​炮塔​的​终端​当前​处于​激活状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​显示​共有​两台​炮塔​受​这台​终端​操控​。\n"
"\n"
"cao1kong4 bian4xie2 pao4ta3 de5 zhong1duan1 dang1qian2 chu3yu2 ji1 huo2 zhuang4 tai4。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 xian3shi4 gong4you3 liang3 tai2 pao4ta3 shou4 zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 cao1kong4。"

msgid ""
"The screen on the terminal flickers off and on and displays a flashing error code.\n"
"\n"
"It looks as though APEX's departure has cracked the terminal's security systems... with the touch of a button, you could forge admin access to the machine.\n"
"\n"
"But the sound of a bullet whizzing past your ear pulls you away. There are still hostiles in the area."
msgstr ""
"终端​屏幕​闪烁​，​显示​着​一行​错误代码​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​APEX​的​离开​已经​突破​了​终端​的​安防​系统​……​只​需​轻按​一个​按钮​，​就​能​伪造​对​该​设备​的​管理员​访问​权限​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​一颗​子弹​呼啸​着​从​耳边​擦​过​，​将​你​拉​回​现实​。​该​区域​仍​存在​敌对势力​。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1duan1 ping2mu4 shan3shuo4，xian3shi4 zhao2 yi1xing2 cuo4 wu4 dai4 ma3。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 APEX de5 li2kai1 yi3jing1 tu1po4 le5 zhong1duan1 de5 an1 fang2 xi4tong3……zhi3 xu1 qing1 an4 yi1ge5 an4niu3，jiu4 neng2 wei3zao4 dui4 gai1 she4bei4 de5 guan3li3yuan2 fang3wen4 quan2xian4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 yi1 ke1 zi3dan4 hu1xiao4 zhao2 cong2 er3 bian1 ca1 guo4，jiang1 ni3 la1 hui2 xian4shi2。gai1 qu1yu4 reng2 cun2zai4 di2 dui4 shi4 li4。"

msgid ""
"The screen to this terminal comes alive at your approach.\n"
"\n"
"An Aztechnology login screen awaits your password."
msgstr ""
"当​你​靠近​时​，​终端​屏幕​随之​亮​起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿兹特​科技​的​登录​界面​正等待​你​输入​密码​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 kao4jin4 shi2，zhong1duan1 ping2mu4 sui2zhi1 liang4 qi3。\n"
"\n"
"E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 deng1lu4 jie4mian4 zheng1 deng3 dai1 ni3 shu1ru4 mi4ma3。"

msgid "The screen winks to life at your approach."
msgstr ""
"你​靠近​时​，​屏幕​亮​了​起来​。\n"
"ni3 kao4jin4 shi2，ping2mu4 liang4 le5 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"The second camera clicks onto a heating vent. The lens irises to adjust to the light.\n"
"\n"
"James repeats his previous performance, and the camera fades from view."
msgstr ""
"第二个​摄像头​粘​在​了​暖气​出风口​上​。​镜头​光圈​收缩​以​适应​光线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​詹姆斯​重复​了​之前​的​表演​，​摄像头​从​你​的​视野​中​逐渐​消失​。\n"
"\n"
"di4 er4 ge4 she4xiang4tou2 zhan1 zai4 le5 nuan3qi4 chu1feng1kou3 shang4。jing4tou2 guang1quan1 shou1suo1 yi3 shi4ying4 guang1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"zhan1mu3si1 chong2fu4 le5 zhi1qian2 de5 biao3yan3，she4xiang4tou2 cong2 ni3 de5 shi4ye3 zhong4 zhu2jian4 xiao1shi1。"

msgid "The second one. I’m sorry, Eiger… you did the right thing."
msgstr ""
"肯定​是​后者​。​抱歉​，​艾格尔​……​你​确实​做​了​该​做​的​事​。\n"
"ken3ding4 shi4 hou4zhe3。bao4qian4，Ai4ge2er3……ni3 que4shi2 zuo4 le5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"The second that you jack into the Matrix, my automated defenses are gonna try to pounce on you. \n"
"\n"
"Think of them as my immune system, and yourself as a germ. It's an autonomous function... I can't stop it from happening."
msgstr ""
"当​你​接入​矩阵​时​，​我​的​自动​防御​系统​将​尝试​与​你​交战​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它们​就​像是​我​的​免疫系统​，​而​你​是​病菌​。​这是​一项​自主​功能​……​我​无法​阻止​它​运作​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 jie1ru4 ju3zhen4 shi2，wo3 de5 zi4dong4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 jiang1 chang2shi4 yu4 ni3 jiao1zhan4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jiu4 xiang4 shi4 wo3 de5 mian3yi4xi4tong3，er2 ni3 shi4 bing4jun1。zhe4 shi4 yi1 xiang4 zi4zhu3 gong1neng2……wo3 wu2fa3 zu3zhi3 ta1 yun4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"The security panel shows that this door is double-maglocked. It'd be easier "
"to tunnel in through the wall than it would be to break through this thing."
msgstr ""
"安全​面板​显示​这​扇门​被​双重​电磁锁​锁死​了​。​与其​破门而入​，​在​墙上​打个​洞​反而​要​简单​些​。\n"
"an1quan2 mian4ban3 xian3shi4 zhe4 shan1 men2 bei4 shuang1chong2 dian4 ci2 suo3 suo3 si3 le5。yu3qi2 po4men2er2ru4，zai4 qiang2 shang4 da3 ge4 dong4 fan3er2 yao4 jian3dan1 xie1。"

msgid ""
"The server room should be somewhere toward the back of the office. Straining"
" your eyes against the darkness, you push forward."
msgstr ""
"服务器​机房​应该​在​办公室​后面​的​某个​地方​。​你​在​黑暗​中​睁大眼睛​，​不断前进​。\n"
"fu2wu4qi4 ji1fang2 ying1gai1 zai4 ban4gong1shi4 hou4mian5 de5 mou3 ge4 di4fang1。ni3 zai4 hei1an4 zhong4 zheng1 dai4 yan3 jing1，bu4 duan4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid ""
"The sh-shadowrunner thinks that $(l.he) can f-frighten me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice sounds stronger now. The stutter that marred his speech has almost completely faded away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"How adorable."
msgstr ""
"这​-​这个​暗影​狂奔​者​以为​自己​能​-​能​吓住​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​听​起来​更​洪亮​了​。​刚才​因为​瘫软​导致​的​口吃​也​几乎​完全​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真​可爱​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 -zhe4ge5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 yi3wei2 zi4ji3 neng2 -neng2 he4 zhu4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 geng1 hong2liang4 le5。gang1cai2 yin1wei4 tan1ruan3 dao3zhi4 de5 kou3chi1 ye3 ji1hu1 wan2quan2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1 ke3ai4。"

msgid "The shadow slowly dissipates, and Harrow is gone."
msgstr ""
"暗影​随即​散​去​，​哈罗​也​消失​了​。\n"
"an4ying3 sui2ji2 san3 qu4，ha1luo2 ye3 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The shelf is mostly bare, but there is a large metal canister with a "
"yellowed label that catches your eye."
msgstr ""
"架子​上​几乎​空无一物​，​但​有​一个​贴着​泛黄​标签​的​大​金属罐​吸引​了​你​的​注意​。\n"
"jia4zi5 shang4 ji1hu1 kong1 wu2 yi1 wu4，dan4 you3 yi1ge5 tie1 zhao2 fan4 huang2 biao1qian1 de5 dai4 jin1 shu3 guan4 xi1yin3 le5 ni3 de5 zhu4yi4。"

msgid "The shelter? The shield? The shepherd?"
msgstr ""
"庇护所​？​护盾​？​牧羊人​？\n"
"bi4hu4suo3？hu4dun4？mu4yang2ren2？"

msgid "The shelter? The shield? The shepherd? I'm not getting this."
msgstr ""
"庇护所​？​护盾​？​牧羊人​？​我​没​明白​。\n"
"bi4hu4suo3？hu4dun4？mu4yang2ren2？wo3 mei2 ming2bai5。"

msgid ""
"The shrine is more than just a statue... you need to understand that. Harrow bound a malevolent entity - a toxic spirit - into the stone, and that's where its power comes from.\n"
"\n"
"It is, in many ways, the heart of this place."
msgstr ""
"神龛​不仅仅​是​一座​雕像​……​你​必须​明白​这​一点​。​哈罗​将​某个​恶毒​的​存在​封印​在​了​石头​里​。​一个​邪恶​精魂​。​这​就是​那座​神龛​的​力量​来源​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​各种​意义​上​讲​，​它​都​可以​算作​这​地方​的​心脏​。\n"
"\n"
"shen2kan1 bu4jin3jin3 shi4 yi1 zuo4 diao1xiang4……ni3 bi4xu1 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3。ha1luo2 jiang1 mou3 ge4 e4du2 de5 cun2zai4 feng1yin4 zai4 le5 shi2tou5 li3。yi1ge5 xie2e4 jing1hun2。zhe4 jiu4shi4 na4 zuo4 shen2kan1 de5 li4liang5 lai2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ge4zhong3 yi4yi4 shang4 jiang3，ta1 dou1 ke3yi3 suan4 zuo4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 xin1zang4。"

msgid ""
"The shrine is whispering to her, Glory. I can feel it, too. She's blissed "
"out on it, like you said."
msgstr ""
"神龛​在​向​她​低语​，​格洛丽​。​我​也​感觉​到​了​。​和​你​说​的​一样​，​她​完全​沦陷​其中​了​。\n"
"shen2kan1 zai4 xiang4 ta1 di1yu3，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 ye3 gan3jue2 dao4 le5。he4 ni3 shuo1 de5 yi1yang4，ta1 wan2quan2 lun2xian4 qi2zhong1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The shrine. He's using it to brainwash the initiates faster than he used to."
msgstr ""
"是​那座​神龛​。​他​在​用​它​加速​对​学徒​的​洗脑​。\n"
"shi4 na4 zuo4 shen2kan1。ta1 zai4 yong4 ta1 jia1su4 dui4 xue2tu2 de5 xi3nao3。"

msgid ""
"The side door to the bank is made of heavy-duty duraplast, and it has been "
"reinforced from top to bottom with plate steel. It is sealed with a series "
"of maglocks."
msgstr ""
"银行​的​侧门​采用​重型​硬化​塑料​制成​，​并​从​上​至​下​加装​了​钢板​进行​加固​。​门体​通过​一系列​磁力锁​实现​密封​。\n"
"yin2hang2 de5 ce4men2 cai3yong4 zhong4xing2 ying4hua4 su4liao4 zhi4cheng2，bing4 cong2 shang4 zhi4 xia4 jia1 zhuang1 le5 gang1ban3 jin4xing2 jia1gu4。men2 ti3 tong1guo4 yi1xi4lie4 ci2li4suo3 shi2xian4 mi4feng1。"

msgid ""
"The silence stretches, but that's all right. You don't have anything pressing to do anyway.\n"
"\n"
"You've got time."
msgstr ""
"沉默​蔓延​开来​，​但​这​并​无​关系​。​你​反正​也​没有​什么​要紧​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有的是​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 man4yan2 kai1 lai2，dan4 zhe4 bing4 wu2 guan1xi5。ni3 fan3zheng4 ye3 mei2you3 shen2me5 yao4jin3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3de5shi4 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"The silence stretches. But that's all right.\n"
"\n"
"Like Audran said, you've got time."
msgstr ""
"沉默​蔓延​开来​，​但​这​并​无​关系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正如​奥​德兰​所说​，​你​有的是​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 man4yan2 kai1 lai2，dan4 zhe4 bing4 wu2 guan1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 Ao4de2lan2 suo3 shuo1，ni3 you3de5shi4 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"The simulacrum jerks back to life. It resumes speaking, blissfully unaware "
"of the conversation that it's cutting off."
msgstr ""
"拟像​突然​又动​了​起来​。​它​开始​说话​，​全然不知​自己​打断​了​你们​的​对话​。\n"
"ni3 xiang4 tu1ran2 you4 dong4 le5 qi3lai5。ta1 kai1shi3 shuo1hua4，quan2 ran2 bu4 zhi1 zi4ji3 da3duan4 le5 ni3men5 de5 dui4hua4。"

msgid ""
"The simulacrum makes a sweeping gesture with its right hand, and an image switchblades onto the screen. A grainy, overhead photograph, annotated with map coordinates. \n"
"\n"
"You recognize it immediately."
msgstr ""
"拟像​右手​一挥​，​屏幕​上​随即​弹​出​一张​图像​。​那​是​一张​颗粒感​十足​的​俯视​照片​，​上面​标注​了​地图​坐标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​立刻​认出​了​这个​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4 you4shou3 yi1 hui1，ping2mu4 shang4 sui2ji2 dan4 chu1 yi1 zhang1 tu2xiang4。na4 shi4 yi1 zhang1 ke1 li4 gan3 shi2zu2 de5 fu3shi4 zhao4pian4，shang4mian4 biao1zhu4 le5 di4tu2 zuo4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 li4ke4 ren4chu1 le5 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"The simulacrum pauses, and a brief tremor washes over its body. Its eyes flutter, and you can hear the sound of your computer working to process more of the chip's data.\n"
"\n"
"Eiger turns to address the team."
msgstr ""
"拟像​停顿​片刻​，​身体​泛起​一阵​短暂​的​颤动​。​它​的​双眼​不断​闪烁​，​你​能​清楚​听见​电脑​处理​芯片​数据​时​发出​的​嗡​鸣声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​转向​团队​众人​说道​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，shen1ti3 fan4qi3 yi1zhen4 duan3zan4 de5 chan4dong4。ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 bu4duan4 shan3shuo4，ni3 neng2 qing1chu5 ting1jian4 dian4nao3 chu3li3 xin1pian4 shu4ju4 shi2 fa1chu1 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 zhuan3xiang4 tuan2dui4 zhong4ren2 shuo1dao4。"

msgid ""
"The simulacrum reverts to its idle state, slumping like a puppet with its strings cut. Its eyes glaze over and its face goes slack.\n"
"\n"
"Then the screen cuts to black."
msgstr ""
"拟像​返回​至​待机​状态​，​如​断线​木偶​般​瘫软​下来​。​它​的​目光​呆滞​，​面部​肌肉​也​变得​松弛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​屏幕​变​回​一片​漆黑​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4 fan3hui2 zhi4 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4，ru2 duan4xian4 mu4ou3 ban1 tan1ruan3 xia4lai5。ta1 de5 mu4guang1 dai1zhi4，mian4bu4 ji1rou4 ye3 bian4de5 song1chi2。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4 ping2mu4 bian4 hui2 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1。"

msgid "The situation is under control. We're on it."
msgstr ""
"事态​已经​得到​控制​了​。​我们​正在​努力​。\n"
"shi4tai4 yi3jing1 de2dao4 kong4zhi4 le5。wo3men5 zheng4zai4 nu3li4。"

msgid "The slow scroll of text comes to a stop."
msgstr ""
"文字​的​缓慢​滚动​停​了​下来​。\n"
"wen2zi4 de5 huan3man4 gun3dong4 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"The slow whir of the DVD player shifts to a high-pitched whine. \n"
"\n"
"A distorted, wavering image blooms into being on the screen. A time stamp in the upper right corner of the screen marks the date: July 6, 2012."
msgstr ""
"DVD​播放器​缓慢​的​嗖嗖​声​转为​高亢​的​呜呜声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​出现​了​一个​扭曲​而​摇摆​的​图像​。​屏幕​右上角​的​时间​戳​标明​了​日期​：​2012​年​7​月​6​日​。\n"
"\n"
"DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 huan3man4 de5 sou1sou1 sheng1 zhuai3 wei2 gao1kang4 de5 wu1 wu1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 yi1ge5 niu3qu1 er2 yao2bai3 de5 tu2xiang4。ping2mu4 you4 shang4 jiao3 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 biao1ming2 le5 ri4qi1：2012 nian2 7 yue4 6 ri4。"

msgid "The smell of burnt garbage always reminds me of back home."
msgstr ""
"垃圾焚烧​的​气味​总让​我​想起​故乡​。\n"
"la1 ji1 fen2 shao1 de5 qi4wei4 zong3 rang4 wo3 xiang3qi3 gu4xiang1。"

msgid ""
"The smell of sulphur and ozone fills the cavernous chamber. Despite the whir of several high-output exhaust fans, the heat is tremendous. \n"
"\n"
"As you enter, you hear a loud click followed by the squeal of audio feedback. Then Adrian Vauclair’s voice booms over the loudspeakers. "
msgstr ""
"硫磺​和​臭氧​的​气味​充斥​着​这个​巨大​的​洞穴​。​尽管​几台​高功率​排气扇​发出​嗡嗡声​，​但​热浪​依然​扑面而来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​进入​时​，​首先​听到​一声​清脆​的​咔嗒​声​，​接着​是​刺耳​的​音频​反馈​声​。​随后​，​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​的​声音​通过​扬声器​响彻​整个​空间​。\n"
"\n"
"liu2huang2 he4 chou4yang3 de5 qi4wei4 chong1chi4 zhao2 zhe4ge5 ju4da4 de5 dong4xue2。jin3guan3 ji1 tai2 gao1 gong1 shuai4 pai2qi4shan4 fa1chu1 weng1weng1sheng1，dan4 re4lang4 yi1ran2 pu1mian4er2lai2。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 jin4ru4 shi2，shou3xian1 ting1dao4 yi1sheng1 qing1cui4 de5 ka1da1 sheng1，jie1zhe5 shi4 ci4er3 de5 yin1pin2 fan3kui4 sheng1。sui2hou4，E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 tong1guo4 yang2sheng1qi4 xiang3che4 zheng3ge4 kong1jian1。"

msgid ""
"The smuggler looks up at the sound of your approach.\n"
"\n"
"If $(s.he)'s surprised to see you, $(s.he) doesn't show it."
msgstr ""
"走私者​听到​你​靠近​的​动静​，​抬起头来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(s.he)​没有​表露出​半点​意外​的​样子​。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 si1 zhe3 ting1dao4 ni3 kao4jin4 de5 dong4jing4，tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"$(s.he) mei2you3 biao3 lou4 chu1 ban4dian3 yi4wai4 de5 yang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"The smugglers finish unloading the last of the crates, then take up positions around the van.\n"
"\n"
"Minutes pass. Nobody comes to meet you."
msgstr ""
"走私者​卸完​最后​一批​板条箱​，​在​货车​周围​站​好​位置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几分钟​过去​了​，​并​没有​人来​和​你们​接头​。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 si1 zhe3 xie4 wan2 zui4hou4 yi1 pi1 ban3tiao2xiang1，zai4 huo4che1 zhou1wei2 zhan4 hao3 wei4zhi5。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 fen4 zhong1 guo4qu4 le5，bing4 mei2you3 ren2 lai2 he4 ni3men5 jie1tou2。"

msgid ""
"The snacks are great and all, but they can't be our staple foodstuff. We "
"need to stretch them out as far as humanly possible. And that means "
"supplementing them with something more substantial."
msgstr ""
"零食​确实​不错​，​但​它们​不能​成为​我们​的​主食​。​我们​需要​尽可能​地靠​这些​存粮​撑​得​更​久​。​这​意味着​我们​得​搭配​些​更​管饱​的​东西​。\n"
"ling2shi2 que4shi2 bu4cuo4，dan4 ta1men5 bu4neng2 cheng2wei2 wo3men5 de5 zhu3shi2。wo3men5 xu1yao4 jin3ke3neng2 de5 kao4 zhe4xie1 cun2 liang2 cheng1 de2 geng1 jiu3。zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 de2 da1pei4 xie1 geng1 guan3 bao3 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"The soft whir of the spinning DVD is punctuated by an occasional rattling sound.\n"
"\n"
"The scratched LCD display comes to life, and a menu fills the screen."
msgstr ""
"旋转​DVD​发出​的​轻微​嗖嗖​声中​，​不时​夹杂着​嘎吱​嘎吱​的​声音​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​划痕​的​液晶​显示屏​开始运转​，​屏幕​上​出现​了​一项​菜单​。\n"
"\n"
"xuan2zhuan3 DVD fa1chu1 de5 qing1wei1 sou1sou1 sheng1 zhong4，bu4shi2 jia1 za2 zhao2 ga1zhi1 ga1zhi1 de5 sheng1yin1。\n"
"\n"
"you3 hua2hen2 de5 ye4jing1 xian3shi4ping2 kai1 shi3 yun4 zhuai3，ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 yi1 xiang4 cai4dan1。"

msgid ""
"The soldiers exchange glances, then lower their sidearms. They look at you, "
"their stares full of hatred and bile."
msgstr ""
"士兵​们​交换​了​眼神​，​随后​放下​武器​。​他们​盯​着​你​，​目光​充满​憎恨​与​怨毒​。\n"
"shi4bing1 men5 jiao1huan4 le5 yan3shen2，sui2hou4 fang4xia4 wu3qi4。ta1men5 ding1 zhao2 ni3，mu4guang1 chong1man3 zeng1hen4 yu4 yuan4du2。"

msgid ""
"The sort that a pack of bloodthirsty ghouls might be good at.\n"
"\n"
"Use your imagination."
msgstr ""
"一群​嗜血​尸鬼​擅长​的​那种​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​发挥​一下​想象力​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 qun2 shi4xue4 shi1 gui3 shan4chang2 de5 na4zhong3 cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 fa1hui1 yi1xia4 xiang3xiang4li4。"

msgid ""
"The sound of Simmy's name wipes the smile from his face.\n"
"\n"
"He stares at you, the color draining from his cheeks."
msgstr ""
"你​一​说出​阿吸​的​名字​，​他​脸上​的​笑容​就​消失​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​盯​着​你​，​脸颊​上​的​血色​渐渐​消失​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1 shuo1chu1 e1 xi1 de5 ming2zi5，ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 jiu4 xiao1shi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3，lian3jia2 shang4 de5 xue4se4 jian4jian4 xiao1shi1。"

msgid ""
"The sound of heavy machinery makes it difficult to hear the words that are "
"being spoken. After a moment, you find you can make out two distinct voices "
"- a nasal woman who sounds like a heavy smoker and a man who speaks in a "
"high-pitched, breathy tone."
msgstr ""
"重型机械​的​轰鸣声​让​人​难以​听​清​说话​内容​。​片刻​之后​，​你​渐渐​能​分辨​出​两个​不同​的​声音​：​一个​鼻音​很重​的​女人​，​听​起来​像是​个​老​烟枪​；​还有​一个​男人​，​说话​时​声音​尖锐​而​气喘吁吁​。\n"
"chong2 xing2 ji1 xie4 de5 hong1 ming2 sheng1 rang4 ren2 nan2yi3 ting1 qing1 shuo1hua4 nei4rong2。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ni3 jian4jian4 neng2 fen1bian4 chu1 liang3 ge4 bu4tong2 de5 sheng1yin1：yi1ge5 bi2yin1 hen3 chong2 de5 nu:3ren2，ting1 qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 ge4 lao3 yan1qiang1 ； hai2you3 yi1ge5 nan2ren2，shuo1hua4 shi2 sheng1yin1 jian1rui4 er2 qi4chuan3xu1xu1。"

msgid ""
"The sounds of machinery fade behind you as you venture further underground. Whoever built this facility was clearly well financed. It must have taken years to design, excavate, and build a complex like this in secrecy. \n"
"\n"
"You continue through dimly lit halls, finally stepping into what appears to be another laboratory area. The corridor before you is deserted.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Adrian Vauclair is somewhere within this facility… and with him, the answers you seek."
msgstr ""
"随着​你​进一步​深入​地下​，​机械​运转​声​逐渐​在​身后​消散​。​建造​这座​设施​的​人​显然​财力雄厚​，​如此​规模​的​建筑群​，​要​在​秘密​状态​下​完成​设计​、​挖掘​和​建造​，​肯定​要花​上​好几年​的​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​继续​穿行​于​昏暗​的​走廊​，​最终​踏入​了​另​一处​实验室​区域​。​眼前​的​通道​空无一人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​就​在​这座​设施​的​某个​角落​……​而​他​，​就是​你​寻求​的​答案​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ni3 jin4yi1bu4 shen1ru4 di4xia4，ji1xie4 yun4zhuan3 sheng1 zhu2jian4 zai4 shen1hou4 xiao1san4。jian4zao4 zhe4 zuo4 she4shi1 de5 ren2 xian3ran2 cai2 li4 xiong2 hou4，ru2ci3 gui1mo2 de5 jian4zhu4qun2，yao4 zai4 mi4mi4 zhuang4tai4 xia4 wan2cheng2 she4ji4、wa1jue2 he4 jian4zao4，ken3ding4 yao4 hua1 shang4 hao3ji3nian2 de5 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ji4xu4 chuan1xing2 yu2 hun1an4 de5 zou3lang2，zui4zhong1 ta1 ru4 le5 ling4 yi1 chu3 shi2yan4shi4 qu1yu4。yan3qian2 de5 tong1dao4 kong1wu2yi1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 jiu4 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 she4shi1 de5 mou3 ge4 jiao3luo4……er2 ta1，jiu4shi4 ni3 xun2qiu2 de5 da2an4。"

msgid "The special today has been crossed out."
msgstr ""
"今日​特别​推荐​被​划掉​了​。\n"
"jin1ri4 te4bie2 tui1jian4 bei4 hua4diao4 le5。"

msgid "The special today is a $(scene.CafeSpecial)."
msgstr ""
"今天​的​特别​推荐​是​$(scene.CafeSpecial)​。\n"
"jin1tian1 de5 te4bie2 tui1jian4 shi4 $(scene.CafeSpecial)。"

msgid ""
"The spirit cringes, shaking its great head from side to side. It doesn't "
"speak, but a low rumbling sound emanates from somewhere deep in its chest."
msgstr ""
"精魂​有些​畏缩​，​硕大​的​脑袋​不断​摇晃​着​。​它​没有​说话​，​但​胸腔​深处​发出​低沉​的​隆隆声​。\n"
"jing1hun2 you3xie1 wei4suo1，shuo4da4 de5 nao3dai5 bu4duan4 yao2huang4 zhao2。ta1 mei2you3 shuo1hua4，dan4 xiong1qiang1 shen1chu4 fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 long2long2sheng1。"

msgid ""
"The spirit's writhing form continues its transformation. Twisted claws buckle, break, and reform. Charred bone begins to heal.\n"
"\n"
"The barn fire stench of it slowly dies away, replaced by an array of more pleasant smells: oak and pine and mineral oil, rustic feasts and mulled wine."
msgstr ""
"精魂​那​蠕动​的​躯体​仍​在​持续​蜕变​。​畸形​的​利爪​弯折​、​断裂​又​重塑​。​焦灼​的​骨骼​开始​愈合​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​身上​那股​谷仓​焚烧​般的​恶臭​慢慢​消散​，​取而代之​的​是​一系列​更​令人​愉悦​的​气味​：​橡木​、​松木​、​矿物油​、​乡村​盛宴​和​热​红酒​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1hun2 na4 ru2dong4 de5 qu1ti3 reng2 zai4 chi2xu4 tui4bian4。ji1xing2 de5 li4zhao3 wan1zhe2、duan4lie4 you4 chong2su4。jiao1zhuo2 de5 gu3ge2 kai1shi3 yu4he2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen1shang5 na4 gu3 gu3cang1 fen2shao1 ban1 de5 e4chou4 man4man4 xiao1san4，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 yi1xi4lie4 geng1 ling4ren2 yu2yue4 de5 qi4wei4：xiang4mu4、song1mu4、kuang4 wu4 you2、xiang1cun1 sheng4yan4 he4 re4 hong2jiu3。"

msgid "The stairwell down looks to have completely collapsed. "
msgstr ""
"向下​的​楼梯间​看起来​彻底​坍塌​了​。\n"
"xiang4xia4 de5 lou2ti1jian1 kan4qi3lai5 che4di3 tan1ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The stakes here are a little too high for me to just take that on faith."
msgstr ""
"这​风险​对​我​来说​有点​太高​了​，​我​不能​仅凭​信念​就​接受​。\n"
"zhe4 feng1xian3 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 you3dian3 tai4 gao1 le5，wo3 bu4neng2 jin3 ping2 xin4nian4 jiu4 jie1shou4。"

msgid ""
"The station's main power is off. The train's not going anywhere until it's "
"back on."
msgstr ""
"车站​的​主​电源​被​关闭​了​。​在​将​其​恢复​至​开启​状态​之前​，​列车​哪里​都​去​不了​。\n"
"che1zhan4 de5 zhu3 dian4yuan2 bei4 guan1bi4 le5。zai4 jiang1 qi2 hui1fu4 zhi4 kai1qi3 zhuang4tai4 zhi1qian2，lie4che1 na3li3 dou1 qu4 bu4le5。"

msgid "The stink from your smoldering corpse will cover it, asshole. "
msgstr ""
"你​烧焦​的​尸体​散发​出来​的​恶臭​会​掩盖​一切​气味​，​混蛋​。\n"
"ni3 shao1jiao1 de5 shi1ti3 san4fa1 chu1lai2 de5 e4chou4 hui4 yan3gai4 yi1qie4 qi4wei4，hun2dan4。"

msgid ""
"The stories are true.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You have no idea how lucky you are. If they'd taken you, you'd have spent the rest of your miserable life *wishing* you'd been shot."
msgstr ""
"那些​传言​都​是​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​根本​不​知道​你​有​多​幸运​。​要是​被​他们​抓走​的话​，​你​这辈子​就​会​在​痛苦​中​度过​，​*​巴不得​*​当初​直接​被​开枪​打死​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 chuan2yan2 dou1 shi4 zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 you3 duo1 xing4yun4。yao4shi5 bei4 ta1men5 zhua1zou3 de5hua4，ni3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 jiu4 hui4 zai4 tong4ku3 zhong4 du4guo4，*ba1bu5de5*dang1chu1 zhi2jie1 bei4 kai1qiang1 da3si3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"The stories that Winters heard were true... the dragon's astral form *was* "
"separated from her body when she fell. You trapped it somehow."
msgstr ""
"温特斯​听到​的​故事​都​是​真的​……​巨龙​陨落​的​时候​，​她​的​灵体​*​确实​*​与​她​的​肉体​分离​了​。​你​以​某种​方式​困住​了​它​。\n"
"Wen1te4si1 ting1dao4 de5 gu4shi4 dou1 shi4 zhen1de5……ju4long2 yun3luo4 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 de5 ling2ti3*que4shi2*yu4 ta1 de5 rou4ti3 fen1li2 le5。ni3 yi3 mou3zhong3 fang1shi4 kun4 zhu4 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"The stories that you've heard are correct. This... \"Doom\"... is an extremely dangerous substance.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gestures to a technical document on his computer's display.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've been reading up."
msgstr ""
"那些​故事​绝非​杜撰​，​这个​……​“​末日​”​……​是​极度​危险​的​物质​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​指向​电脑屏幕​上​的​一份​技术​文档​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​在​研读​相关​资料​。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 gu4shi4 jue2fei1 du4zhuan4，zhe4ge5……“mo4ri4”……shi4 ji2du4 wei1xian3 de5 wu4zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3xiang4 dian4 nao3 bing3 mu4 shang4 de5 yi1 fen4 ji4shu4 wen2dang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 yan2du2 xiang1guan1 zi1liao4。"

msgid ""
"The story is the same across the globe. Strange creatures of myriad shapes and descriptions appearing out of nowhere, acting with intelligence and malice.\n"
"\n"
"Killing for the pleasure of it."
msgstr ""
"世界各地​的​情况​如出一辙​。​形貌​各异​的​怪异​生物​凭空出现​，​它们​行动​时​既显​智慧​又​怀​恶意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​杀戮​，​只​为​享受​其中​快感​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4ge4di4 de5 qing2kuang4 ru2chu1yi1zhe2。xing2mao4 ge4yi4 de5 guai4yi4 sheng1wu4 ping2 kong1 chu1 xian4，ta1men5 xing2dong4 shi2 ji4 xian3 zhi4hui4 you4 huai2 e4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"sha1lu4，zhi3 wei2 xiang3shou4 qi2zhong1 kuai4gan3。"

msgid ""
"The stranger’s words come out slowly in a deep, melodious tone that is easy "
"to hear, despite the noise of the train. He takes his time, accentuating "
"each word - relishing each vowel and each consonant - tasting them as if "
"they were a delicacy."
msgstr ""
"陌生人​的​话语​缓缓​吐​出​，​声音​浑厚​悦耳​，​纵使​列车​轰鸣​也​清晰​可​闻​。​他​从容不迫​，​字字珠玑​，​品味​着​每个​元音​与​辅音​，​仿佛​在​品尝​珍馐美馔​。\n"
"mo4sheng1ren2 de5 hua4yu3 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1，sheng1yin1 hun2hou4 yue4er3，zong4shi3 lie4che1 hong1ming2 ye3 qing1xi1 ke3 wen2。ta1 cong2rong2bu4po4，zi4zi4zhu1ji1，pin3wei4 zhao2 mei3ge4 yuan2yin1 yu4 fu3yin1，fang3fu2 zai4 pin3chang2 zhen1xiu1mei3zhuan4。"

msgid ""
"The strangled sounds of panicked breathing punch through your PDA's tiny speakers.\n"
"\n"
"In the image window, you can see the outlines of figures silhouetted against the backdrop of Amsel's shop. \n"
"\n"
"The view rotates, bringing them toward the center of the frame."
msgstr ""
"透过​PDA​的​微型​扬声器​，​你​听到​对方​惊恐​而​憋闷​的​喘息声​传来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​图像​窗口​里​，​你​能​看见​几个​人影​的​轮廓​站​在​阿姆​泽尔​的​商店​前​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​镜头​一转​，​将​他们​移到​了​画面​中央​。\n"
"\n"
"tou4guo4 PDA de5 wei1xing2 yang2sheng1qi4，ni3 ting1dao4 dui4fang1 jing1kong3 er2 bie1men5 de5 chuan3 xi1 sheng1 chuan2lai2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 tu2xiang4 chuang1kou3 li3，ni3 neng2 kan4jian4 ji3ge5 ren2ying3 de5 lun2kuo4 zhan4 zai4 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 shang1dian4 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"jing4tou2 yi1 zhuai3，jiang1 ta1men5 yi2 dao4 le5 hua4mian4 zhong1yang1。"

msgid ""
"The streets above the Adenauerplatz are dark and dismal. This kiez has seen "
"better days; everything here reeks of economic depression and faded glory."
msgstr ""
"阿登纳​广场​上方​的​街道​昏暗​而​阴郁​。​这个​街区​早已​不​复​往日​的​繁华​，​处处​弥漫着​经济​萧条​和​昔日​荣光​褪去​的​气息​。\n"
"e1 deng1 na4 guang3chang3 shang4fang1 de5 jie1dao4 hun1an4 er2 yin1yu4。zhe4ge5 jie1qu1 zao3yi3 bu4 fu4 wang3ri4 de5 fan2hua2，chu4chu4 mi2 man4 zhao2 jing1ji4 xiao1tiao2 he4 xi1ri4 rong2guang1 tui4qu4 de5 qi4xi1。"

msgid ""
"The stuff in this lab... the organs we worked so hard to copy... it's no different to me than anything else you've seen in this lab. It's all meat.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He frowns in distaste.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Potentially edible, sure. But otherwise useless."
msgstr ""
"实验室​里​的​这些​东西​……​我们​辛苦​复制​出来​的​器官​……​对​我​来说​和​你​在​这个​实验室​里​看到​的​其他​东西​没什么​区别​。​这​一切​只是​肉​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​厌恶​地​皱起​了​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拿来​吃​没什么​问题​。​但​除此之外​毫无用处​。\n"
"\n"
"shi2yan4shi4 li3 de5 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1……wo3men5 xin1ku3 fu4zhi4 chu1lai2 de5 qi4guan1……dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 he4 ni3 zai4 zhe4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 li3 kan4dao4 de5 qi2ta1 dong1xi1 mei2shen2me5 qu1bie2。zhe4 yi1qie4 zhi3shi4 rou4 er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan4wu4 de5 zhou4qi3 le5 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na2lai2 chi1 mei2shen2me5 wen4ti2。dan4 chu2ci3zhi1wai4 hao2 wu2 yong4 chu3。"

msgid ""
"The supervisory board is not unsympathetic to your mental state. The trauma that you endured during your pursuit of the dragon Feuerschwinge must have been enormous.\n"
"\n"
"But your continuing obsession with the dragon - the *dead* dragon, I might add - has proven a negative influence on this company, and an unjustified drain on company resources."
msgstr ""
"监事会​对​您​的​精神状态​不无​同情​。​您​在​追寻​巨龙​火翼​的​过程​中​一定​遭受​了​巨大​的​精神创伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​，​您​对​那条​巨龙​—​—​准确​来说​是​*​死​掉​*​的​巨龙​—​—​的​持续​痴迷​已经​证明​对​公司​造成​了​负面影响​，​并​无端​消耗​了​公司​的​资源​。\n"
"\n"
"jian1 shi4 hui4 dui4 nin2 de5 jing1shen2zhuang4tai4 bu4wu2 tong2qing2。nin2 zai4 zhui1xun2 ju4long2 Huo3yi4 de5 guo4cheng2 zhong4 yi1ding4 zao1shou4 le5 ju4da4 de5 jing1 shen2 chuang4 shang1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4，nin2 dui4 na4 tiao2 ju4long2——zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1 shi4*si3 diao4*de5 ju4long2——de5 chi2xu4 chi1mi2 yi3jing1 zheng4ming2 dui4 gong1si1 zao4cheng2 le5 fu4 mian4 ying3 xiang3，bing4 wu2duan1 xiao1hao4 le5 gong1si1 de5 zi1yuan2。"

msgid "The supply locker opens."
msgstr ""
"储物柜​打开​了​。\n"
"chu3wu4gui4 da3kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The talismonger, Aljernon, hooked me up with a contact of his in the Trollkönigreich Schwarzwald.\n"
"\n"
"His prices are high, but considering the rarity of the material, they're fair."
msgstr ""
"奇物​商人​阿尔杰​农帮​我​联系​了​他​在​黑森林​巨魔​王国​的​某个​联络人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对方​的​要价​很​高​，​但​考虑​到​这种​材料​的​稀有性​，​还​算是​公道​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 wu4 shang1ren2 E1er3jie2nong2 bang1 wo3 lian2xi4 le5 ta1 zai4 hei1sen1lin2 ju4mo2 wang2guo2 de5 mou3 ge4 lian2luo4ren2。\n"
"\n"
"dui4fang1 de5 yao4jia4 hen3 gao1，dan4 kao3lu:4 dao4 zhe4zhong3 cai2liao4 de5 xi1 you3 xing4，hai2 suan4shi4 gong1dao4。"

msgid "The target cannot move but can still use AP to attack. Lasts 2 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"目标​无法​移动​，​但​仍​可​使用​行动​点​进行​攻击​。​持续​2​回合​。\n"
"mu4biao1 wu2fa3 yi2dong4，dan4 reng2 ke3 shi3yong4 xing2dong4 dian3 jin4xing2 gong1ji1。chi2xu4 2 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"The target loses their cover bonus for the rest of the turn. DMG -4, "
"Accuracy -5%. Uses six bullets."
msgstr ""
"目标​在​本​回合​剩余时间​内​失去​掩体​加成​。​伤害​-​4​，​精准度​-​5​%​。​消耗​六发​子弹​。\n"
"mu4biao1 zai4 ben3 hui2he2 sheng4 yu2 shi2 jian1 nei4 shi1qu4 yan3ti3 jia1 cheng2。shang1hai4 -4，jing1 zhun3 du4-5 %。xiao1hao4 liu4 fa1 zi3dan4。"

msgid "The target of the Silence spell makes no noise for 4 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"沉默​术​的​目标​在​4​回合​内​不会​发出​任何​声音​。\n"
"chen2mo4 shu4 de5 mu4biao1 zai4 4 hui2he2 nei4 bu4hui4 fa1chu1 ren4he2 sheng1yin1。"

msgid ""
"The team breaks to begin gearing up.\n"
"\n"
"As she slides a shell into her shotgun, Eiger catches your eye."
msgstr ""
"队员​们​分头​行动​，​开始​做​战前​准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​将​一发​子弹​塞进​霰弹枪​，​抬头​刚好​对​上​你​的​目光​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yuan2 men5 fen1tou2 xing2dong4，kai1shi3 zuo4 zhan4 qian2 zhun3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 jiang1 yi1 fa1 zi3dan4 se4 jin4 xian4dan4qiang1，tai2tou2 gang1hao3 dui4 shang4 ni3 de5 mu4guang1。"

msgid ""
"The team is waiting when you walk in. Their faces are haggard, their "
"shoulders slumped."
msgstr ""
"你​进屋​时​，​发现​队员​们​正​等​着​你​。​他们​脸色​憔悴​，​肩膀​低垂​。\n"
"ni3 jin4 wu1 shi2，fa1xian4 dui4yuan2 men5 zheng1 deng3 zhao2 ni3。ta1men5 lian3se4 qiao2cui4，jian1bang3 di1chui2。"

msgid ""
"The team looks to one another for confirmation. They all nod sharply. \n"
"\n"
"They're ready."
msgstr ""
"队员​们​彼此​交换​了​一下​眼神​。​大家​纷纷​用力​点头​致意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切​已然​就绪​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yuan2 men5 bi3ci3 jiao1huan4 le5 yi1xia4 yan3shen2。da4jia1 fen1fen1 yong4li4 dian3tou2 zhi4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1qie4 yi3ran2 jiu4xu4。"

msgid "The terminal boots up quickly."
msgstr ""
"终端​很快​启动​了​。\n"
"zhong1duan1 hen3 kuai4 qi3dong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The terminal is locked. The words \"SECURITY LOCKOUT\" flash on the screen."
msgstr ""
"终端​被​锁定​了​。​屏幕​上​闪烁着​“​安保​封锁​”​的​字样​。\n"
"zhong1duan1 bei4 suo3ding4 le5。ping2mu4 shang4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2“an1bao3 feng1suo3” de5 zi4yang4。"

msgid ""
"The terminal is logged into the building's security system. It should be "
"relatively simple to trick its Threat Assessment software into sending out a"
" false positive."
msgstr ""
"该​终端​已​接入​大楼​安防​系统​。​诱骗​其​威胁​评估​软件​发出​误报​，​应该​相对​简单​。\n"
"gai1 zhong1duan1 yi3 jie1ru4 da4lou2 an1 fang2 xi4tong3。you4pian4 qi2 wei1xie2 ping2gu1 ruan3jian4 fa1chu1 wu4 bao4，ying1gai1 xiang1dui4 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"The terminal processes your command. An instant later, a high-pitched screeching noise erupts from the generators.\n"
"\n"
"Tremors rock the facility, shaking the ground under your feet."
msgstr ""
"终端​开始​处理​你​的​指令​。​片刻​之后​，​发电机组​突然​发出​刺耳​的​尖​啸声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​震颤​席卷​整个​设施​，​你​脚下​的​地面​剧烈​摇晃​。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1duan1 kai1shi3 chu3li3 ni3 de5 zhi3ling4。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 tu1ran2 fa1chu1 ci4er3 de5 jian1 xiao4 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"zhen4chan4 xi2juan3 zheng3ge4 she4shi1，ni3 jiao3xia4 de5 di4mian4 ju4lie4 yao2huang4。"

msgid "The terminal shows a green light as the doors unlock behind you."
msgstr ""
"终端​显示屏​亮​起​绿灯​，​你​身后​的​门​解锁​了​。\n"
"zhong1duan1 xian3shi4ping2 liang4 qi3 lu:4deng1，ni3 shen1hou4 de5 men2 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The terminal springs to life. A quick scan of its contents reveals little of"
" value, but you do find a message that catches your attention."
msgstr ""
"终端​立时​运转​起来​。​快速​扫描​其​内容​后​，​你​发现​没什么​有​价值​的​东西​，​但​确实​发现​了​一条​引起​你​注意​的​消息​。\n"
"zhong1duan1 li4shi2 yun4zhuan3 qi3lai5。kuai4su4 sao3miao2 qi2 nei4rong2 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 mei2shen2me5 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 dong1xi1，dan4 que4shi2 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 tiao2 yin3qi3 ni3 zhu4yi4 de5 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"The terminal's display blossoms to life at your approach. Reams of technical information and arcane figures fill the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, none of it is written in a language that you can understand."
msgstr ""
"终端​显示屏​在​你​靠近​时​骤然​亮​起​。​屏幕​上​密密麻麻​布满​了​技术参数​和​晦涩​难懂​的​数字​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可惜​的​是​，​这些​信息​全都​用​你​看不懂​的​语言​写成​。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1duan1 xian3shi4ping2 zai4 ni3 kao4jin4 shi2 zhou4ran2 liang4 qi3。ping2mu4 shang4 mi4mi5ma2ma2 bu4man3 le5 ji4 shu4 can1 shu3 he4 hui4se4 nan2dong3 de5 shu4zi4。\n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1 de5 shi4，zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 quan2dou1 yong4 ni3 kan4bu5dong3 de5 yu3yan2 xie3 cheng2。"

msgid "The text disappears, and you find yourself back at the menu screen."
msgstr ""
"文字​消失​了​，​你​发现自己​回到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"wen2zi4 xiao1shi1 le5，ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 hui2dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The text that glows on the console's display reads \"INFORMATION SECURITY PERSONNEL ONLY!\"\n"
"\n"
"In place of a keypad, the console sports a smooth duraplast panel with a data port in its center. It would seem that building management doesn't want laymen tampering with this machine."
msgstr ""
"控制台​的​显示屏​上​闪烁着​醒目​的​文字​：​“​仅限​信息安全​人员​使用​！​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​控制台​未​配备​小键盘​，​取而代之​的​是​光滑​的​硬化​塑料​面板​，​中央​嵌​有​数据​端口​。​看来​大楼​管理方​不​希望​外行​人员​擅自​操作​这台​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 de5 xian3shi4ping2 shang4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 xing3mu4 de5 wen2zi4：“jin3 xian4 xin4 xi1 an1 quan2 ren2yuan2 shi3yong4！” \n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 wei4 pei4bei4 xiao3 jian4 pan2，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 guang1hua2 de5 ying4hua4 su4liao4 mian4ban3，zhong1yang1 kan3 you3 shu4ju4 duan1kou3。kan4lai5 da4lou2 guan3 li3 fang1 bu4 xi1wang4 wai4hang2 ren2yuan2 shan4zi4 cao1zuo4 zhe4 tai2 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"The thing hovering before you is hideous. Its broad chest is jacketed in scalelike patches of burning coal, and its many sets of antlers shimmer with heat. It smells like a barn fire - wood smoke, burning fur, and blackening bodies.\n"
"\n"
"At the sight of it, Marta falls to her knees. Tears stream down her cheeks, and she stares up at the spirit in whimpering supplication."
msgstr ""
"悬浮​在​你​面前​的​怪物​丑陋​至极​。​它​宽阔​的​胸膛​覆盖​着​灼热​的​鳞片状​煤块​，​头上​的​一对对​鹿角​闪烁着​炽热​的​光芒​。​空气​中​弥漫着​谷仓​焚烧​的​气息​—​—​木柴​的​浓烟​、​燃烧​的​皮毛​，​还有​焦黑​尸体​的​腐臭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看到​这​一幕​，​玛​尔塔​跪倒​在​地​，​泪水​顺着​她​的​脸颊​流下​。​她​仰望​着​精魂​，​发出​呜咽​的​哀求​。\n"
"\n"
"xuan2fu2 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 guai4wu5 chou3lou4 zhi4ji2。ta1 kuan1kuo4 de5 xiong1tang2 fu4gai4 zhao2 zhuo2re4 de5 lin2 pian1 zhuang4 mei2 kuai4，tou2shang4 de5 yi1 dui4 dui4 lu4jiao3 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 chi4re4 de5 guang1mang2。kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 gu3cang1 fen2shao1 de5 qi4xi1——mu4chai2 de5 nong2yan1、ran2shao1 de5 pi2mao2，hai2you3 jiao1 hei1 shi1ti3 de5 fu3chou4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4dao4 zhe4 yi1 mu4，Ma3er3ta3 gui4dao3 zai4 de5，lei4shui3 shun4zhe5 ta1 de5 lian3jia2 liu2 xia4。ta1 yang3wang4 zhao2 jing1hun2，fa1chu1 wu1ye4 de5 ai1qiu2。"

msgid ""
"The thing hovering before you is hideous. Its broad chest is jacketed in scalelike patches of burning coal, and its many sets of antlers shimmer with heat. It smells like a barn fire - wood smoke, burning fur, and blackening bodies.\n"
"\n"
"The spirit inclines its head toward Glory and spreads its arms in welcome."
msgstr ""
"悬浮​在​你​面前​的​怪物​丑陋​至极​。​它​宽阔​的​胸膛​覆盖​着​灼热​的​鳞片状​煤块​，​头上​的​一对对​鹿角​闪烁着​炽热​的​光芒​。​空气​中​弥漫着​谷仓​焚烧​的​气息​—​—​木柴​的​浓烟​、​燃烧​的​皮毛​，​还有​焦黑​尸体​的​腐臭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​精魂​俯首​望​向​格洛丽​，​张开​双臂​以示​欢迎​。\n"
"\n"
"xuan2fu2 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 guai4wu5 chou3lou4 zhi4ji2。ta1 kuan1kuo4 de5 xiong1tang2 fu4gai4 zhao2 zhuo2re4 de5 lin2 pian1 zhuang4 mei2 kuai4，tou2shang4 de5 yi1 dui4 dui4 lu4jiao3 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 chi4re4 de5 guang1mang2。kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 gu3cang1 fen2shao1 de5 qi4xi1——mu4chai2 de5 nong2yan1、ran2shao1 de5 pi2mao2，hai2you3 jiao1 hei1 shi1ti3 de5 fu3chou4。\n"
"\n"
"jing1hun2 fu3shou3 wang4 xiang4 Ge2luo4li2，zhang1kai1 shuang1bi4 yi3 shi4 huan1ying2。"

msgid ""
"The thing is, I know our friend's rep. And I'm telling you, he's much too careful to get himself addicted to sims.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She glances at the Engineer. His eyes are locked on the chip.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If these things have him hooked this badly, they must be even more addictive than standard BTLs."
msgstr ""
"问题​是​，​我​对​这位​朋友​的​名声​很​了解​。​我​跟​你​说​，​他​这么​谨慎​的​人​，​不​可能​让​自己​随便​陷入​拟感​成瘾​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​扫​了​一眼​工程师​。​他​的​双眼​仍然​死死​盯​着​芯片​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​这​东西​对​他​有​如此​强​的​效力​，​就​说明​这​肯定​不是​普通​的​BTL​。\n"
"\n"
"wen4ti2 shi4，wo3 dui4 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 de5 ming2sheng1 hen3 liao3jie3。wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1，ta1 zhe4me5 jin3shen4 de5 ren2，bu4 ke3neng2 rang4 zi4ji3 sui2bian4 xian4ru4 ni3 gan3 cheng2yin3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sao3 le5 yi1yan3 gong1cheng2shi1。ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 reng2ran2 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 xin1pian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 dong1xi1 dui4 ta1 you3 ru2ci3 jiang4 de5 xiao4li4，jiu4 shuo1ming2 zhe4 ken3ding4 bu4shi4 pu3tong1 de5 BTL。"

msgid ""
"The third floor is mostly housing, too. Lots of Parson's Communion-crazies live up there. The Magnifikers have a squat up there, too.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He leans in and lowers his voice to a conspiratorial whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm pretty sure their main crib is up there, too. Don't know exactly where."
msgstr ""
"三楼​也​主要​是​住宅区​。​那里​住​着​许多​对帕森​的​共​融会​狂热​追捧​的​信徒​。​伟术​帮​在​那里​也​有​据点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​靠近​你​，​声音​压低​到​像​在​密谋​一般​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​确定​他们​的​老巢​也​在​那儿​。​不过​我​不​知道​具体​在​哪​。\n"
"\n"
"san1 lou2 ye3 zhu3yao4 shi4 zhu4zhai2qu1。na4li5 zhu4 zhao2 xu3duo1 dui4 pa4 sen1 de5 gong4 rong2hui4 kuang2re4 zhui1peng3 de5 xin4tu2。wei3 shu4 bang1 zai4 na4li5 ye3 you3 ju4dian3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kao4jin4 ni3，sheng1yin1 ya1di1 dao4 xiang4 zai4 mi4mou2 yi1ban1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 que4ding4 ta1men5 de5 lao3chao2 ye3 zai4 na4r5。bu4guo4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ju4ti3 zai4 na3。"

msgid ""
"The thought of Stahl lying dead on the ground brings a smile to my face. I "
"hope that he enjoys rotting in Hell."
msgstr ""
"一​想到​斯塔尔​横尸​地上​的​模样​，​我​就​忍不住​想​笑​。​希望​他​永世​不得​超生​。\n"
"yi1 xiang3dao4 Si1ta3er3 heng2 shi1 di4shang5 de5 mu2yang4，wo3 jiu4 ren3bu5zhu4 xiang3 xiao4。xi1wang4 ta1 yong3shi4 bu4de2 chao1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"The thought of Stahl lying dead on the ground brings a smile to my face. I "
"hope that he enjoys rotting in hell."
msgstr ""
"一​想到​斯塔尔​横尸​地上​的​模样​，​我​就​忍不住​想​笑​。​希望​他​永世​不得​超生​。\n"
"yi1 xiang3dao4 Si1ta3er3 heng2 shi1 di4shang5 de5 mu2yang4，wo3 jiu4 ren3bu5zhu4 xiang3 xiao4。xi1wang4 ta1 yong3shi4 bu4de2 chao1sheng1。"

msgid "The time for discussion is over. I am done debating with you. "
msgstr ""
"讨论​到此为止​。​我​不想​再​和​你​辩论​下去​了​。\n"
"tao3lun4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3。wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 he4 ni3 bian4lun4 xia4qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The tiny credstick feels heavy in your pocket, fat with the weight of hard-won nuyen. The U-bahn station swallows you up and sends you hurtling down the rabbit hole. Towards Alice. Towards the information you’ve bled for. \n"
"\n"
"The train pulls to a stop and the doors hiss open to the dark, old platform.\n"
"\n"
"With luck, answers lie ahead."
msgstr ""
"辛苦​赚来​的​新円使​你​口袋​里​那根​小小的​信用​棒​显得​沉重​异常​。​地铁站​将​你​吞没​，​像​落入​兔子​洞般​直坠​深渊​。​奔​向​爱丽丝​。​奔​向​你​用​鲜血​换来​的​情报​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​列车​哐当​停住​，​车门​嘶​嘶​开启​，​黑暗​陈旧​的​站台​映入眼帘​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但愿​你​要​的​答案​就​在​前方​。\n"
"\n"
"xin1ku3 zhuan4 lai2 de5 xin1 yuan2 shi3 ni3 kou3dai4 li3 na4 gen1 xiao3 xiao3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 xian3de5 chen2zhong4 yi4chang2。di4tie3zhan4 jiang1 ni3 tun1mo4，xiang4 luo4ru4 tu4zi5 dong4 ban1 zhi2 zhui4 shen1yuan1。ben1 xiang4 ai4li4si1。ben1 xiang4 ni3 yong4 xian1xue4 huan4 lai2 de5 qing2bao4。\n"
"\n"
"lie4che1 kuang1 dang1 ting2zhu4，che1men2 si1 si1 kai1qi3，hei1an4 chen2jiu4 de5 zhan4tai2 ying4ru4yan3lian2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4yuan4 ni3 yao4 de5 da2an4 jiu4 zai4 qian2fang1。"

msgid ""
"The tonic covers up the gasoline flavor for the most part. It burns a bit "
"going down."
msgstr ""
"汤力​水​遮住​了​绝大部分​的​汽油味​，​但​喝下去​的​时候​还是​有些​辣​嗓子​。\n"
"shang1 li4 shui3 zhe1zhu4 le5 jue2da4bu4fen5 de5 qi4 you2 wei4，dan4 he4 xia4 qu4 de5 shi2hou5 hai2shi5 you3xie1 la4 sang3zi5。"

msgid ""
"The top drawer of this desk is packed full of slender plastic rods.\n"
"\n"
"Credsticks. Hundreds of them."
msgstr ""
"这张​桌子​最​上面​的​抽屉​里​塞满​了​细长​的​塑料​棒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​信用​棒​。​有​好几百​根​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhang1 zhuo1zi5 zui4 shang4mian4 de5 chou1ti5 li3 sai1man3 le5 xi4chang2 de5 su4liao4 bang4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 xin4yong4 bang4。you3 hao3 ji1 bai3 gen1。"

msgid ""
"The top of the line is Ares' military spec high-explosive grenade. Strips 1 "
"Armor from affected targets."
msgstr ""
"阿瑞斯​军规​高爆​手雷​，​顶级​产品​。​额外​剥离​目标​1​点护甲值​。\n"
"a1rui4si1 jun1 gui1 gao1 bao4 shou3lei2，ding3ji2 chan3pin3。e2wai4 bo1li2 mu4biao1 1 dian3 hu4 jia3 zhi2。"

msgid "The touchpad glows invitingly."
msgstr ""
"触控板​闪烁着​诱人​的​光​。\n"
"chu4kong4ban3 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 you4ren2 de5 guang1。"

msgid ""
"The trail to your missing doctor was a long and slippery one. The fee that you paid me barely covered my costs for the job.\n"
"\n"
"I sent a team into the SOX on a fact-finding mission. I bribed government officials. I greased the palms of wageslaves at megacorps all across Europe.\n"
msgstr ""
"追查​你​那位​失踪​的​博士​可​真是​费时费力​。​你付​的​那点​钱​差点​平​不了​我​的​行动​成本​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​往萨洛​卢区​派​了​一支​小队​去​执行​调查​任务​。​为此​我要​贿赂​政府​官员​，​还要​打点​欧洲​各大​超企​的​薪奴​。\n"
"\n"
"zhui1cha2 ni3 na4 wei4 shi1zong1 de5 bo2shi4 ke3 zhen1shi5 fei4 shi2 fei4 li4。ni3 fu4 de5 na4 dian3 qian2 cha4dian3 ping2 bu4le5 wo3 de5 xing2dong4 cheng2ben3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wang3 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 pai4 le5 yi1 zhi1 xiao3 dui4 qu4 zhi2xing2 diao4cha2 ren4wu5。wei4ci3 wo3 yao4 hui4lu4 zheng4fu3 guan1yuan2，hai2 yao4 da3dian5 ou1zhou1 ge4 dai4 chao1 qi3 de5 xin1 nu2。"

msgid ""
"The train car is empty except for the man in the immaculately tailored Italian suit. You notice him watching you for several minutes while the train rumbles its way towards Brandenburger Tor.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, he speaks. "
msgstr ""
"车厢​里​空荡荡​的​，​只有​一位​身穿​剪裁​考究​的​意大利​西装​的​男性​乘客​。​在​列车​隆隆​驶向​勃兰登堡门​的​途中​，​你​注意​到​男人​一直​在​注视​你​，​已经​好几分钟​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​终于​，​他​开口​了​。\n"
"\n"
"che1xiang1 li3 kong1dang4dang4 de5，zhi3you3 yi1 wei4 shen1chuan1 jian3cai2 kao3jiu1 de5 yi4da4li4 xi1zhuang1 de5 nan2xing4 cheng2ke4。zai4 lie4che1 long2long2 shi3xiang4 bo2 lan2 deng1 pu4 men2 de5 tu2zhong1，ni3 zhu4yi4 dao4 nan2ren2 yi1zhi2 zai4 zhu4shi4 ni3，yi3jing1 hao3 ji1 fen4 zhong1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhong1yu2，ta1 kai1kou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"The train comes to a halt, and the doors open. Brackhaus stands, brushes off his Italian suit, and exits without another word. As you turn to follow, your eye catches an advertisement for \"Wyrm Talk\" above the subway car door. \n"
"\n"
"Brackhaus glances back at you from the platform, the light from the car reflecting yellow in his gaze."
msgstr ""
"列车​缓缓​停下​，​车门​开启​。​布拉克​豪斯​站​起身​，​掸​了​掸​他​那套​意式​西装​，​一言不发​地走了​出去​。​当​你​转身​跟上​时​，​目光​瞥见​地铁​车厢​门上​贴着​《​巨龙​夜话​》​的​广告​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​站台​上​的​布拉克​豪斯​回头​望​向​你​，​车厢​灯光​在​他​眼中​映着​星点​金黄​。\n"
"\n"
"lie4che1 huan3huan3 ting2xia4，che1men2 kai1qi3。bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1 zhan4 qi3shen1，dan3 le5 dan3 ta1 na4 tao4 yi4shi4 xi1zhuang1，yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 zou3 le5 chu1qu4。dang1 ni3 zhuan3shen1 gen1shang4 shi2，mu4guang1 pie1jian4 di4tie3 che1xiang1 men2 shang4 tie1 zhao2 《 ju4long2 ye4 hua4 》 de5 guang3gao4。\n"
"\n"
"zhan4tai2 shang4 de5 bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1 hui2tou2 wang4 xiang4 ni3，che1xiang1 deng1guang1 zai4 ta1 yan3zhong1 ying4 zhao2 xing1 dian3 jin1huang2。"

msgid ""
"The train comes to a halt, and the doors open. Brackhaus stands, brushes off his Italian suit, and exits without another word. As you watch him leave, you look up to find an advertisement for \"Wyrm Talk\" above the subway car door. \n"
"\n"
"Brackhaus stops on the platform and glances back at you, the light from the car reflecting yellow in his gaze. The door closes, and he is gone."
msgstr ""
"列车​缓缓​停下​，​车门​开启​。​布拉克​豪斯​站​起身​，​掸​了​掸​他​那套​意式​西装​，​一言不发​地走了​出去​。​你​目送​他​离开​时​，​瞥见​地铁​车厢​门上​贴着​《​巨龙​夜话​》​的​广告​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​站台​上​的​布拉克​豪斯​回头​望​向​你​，​车厢​灯光​在​他​眼中​映着​星点​金黄​。​他​的​身影​随着​车门​关闭​消失​了​。\n"
"\n"
"lie4che1 huan3huan3 ting2xia4，che1men2 kai1qi3。bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1 zhan4 qi3shen1，dan3 le5 dan3 ta1 na4 tao4 yi4shi4 xi1zhuang1，yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 zou3 le5 chu1qu4。ni3 mu4song4 ta1 li2kai1 shi2，pie1jian4 di4tie3 che1xiang1 men2 shang4 tie1 zhao2 《 ju4long2 ye4 hua4 》 de5 guang3gao4。\n"
"\n"
"zhan4tai2 shang4 de5 bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1 hui2tou2 wang4 xiang4 ni3，che1xiang1 deng1guang1 zai4 ta1 yan3zhong1 ying4 zhao2 xing1 dian3 jin1huang2。ta1 de5 shen1ying3 sui2zhe5 che1men2 guan1bi4 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"The train lurches forward again. It picks up speed and begins threading its way beneath Berlin.\n"
"\n"
"Into the shadows."
msgstr ""
"列车​再次​颠簸​着​向前​。​它​开始​加速​，​穿梭​在​柏林​的​地下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​驶入​暗影​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"lie4che1 zai4ci4 dian1bo3 zhao2 xiang4qian2。ta1 kai1shi3 jia1su4，chuan1suo1 zai4 bo2lin2 de5 di4xia4。\n"
"\n"
"shi3ru4 an4ying3 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"The train ramps up to speed, filling the air with a monotonous, electric whir. \n"
"\n"
"The sound is soft and low and urgent, like the droning wings of an enormous insect.\n"
"\n"
"It'd be soothing if your mind weren't occupied with other matters."
msgstr ""
"列车​渐渐​提速​，​空气​中​回荡​着​单调​的​电动​马达​轰鸣声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​声响​柔和​而​低沉​，​带​着​迫切​感​，​宛如​巨型​昆虫​振翅​的​嗡鸣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​声音​本该​令人​心旷神怡​，​只是​你​的​思虑​正​被​其它​事情​牵动​。\n"
"\n"
"lie4che1 jian4jian4 ti2su4，kong1qi4 zhong4 hui2dang4 zhao2 dan1diao4 de5 dian4dong4 ma3da2 hong1 ming2 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"na4 sheng1xiang3 rou2he2 er2 di1chen2，dai4 zhao2 po4qie4 gan3，wan3ru2 ju4xing2 kun1chong2 zhen4 chi4 de5 weng1 ming2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 sheng1yin1 ben3 gai1 ling4ren2 xin1kuang4shen2yi2，zhi3shi4 ni3 de5 si1lu:4 zheng1 bei4 qi2ta1 shi4qing5 qian1dong4。"

msgid ""
"The treasure is...\n"
"\n"
"thegreen\n"
"\n"
"thegaiashee\n"
"\n"
"notreasure foryou"
msgstr ""
"宝藏​是​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​绿色​\n"
"​\n"
"​盖亚​她​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​你​不是​宝藏\n"
"\n"
"bao3zang4 shi4……\n"
"\n"
"lu:4se4 \n"
"\n"
"gai4 ya4 ta1 \n"
"\n"
"dui4 ni3 bu4shi4 bao3zang4"

msgid ""
"The tribal uniform of the urban shaman. Grants +1 Charisma and +1 Spirit "
"Control."
msgstr ""
"都市​萨满​的​部落​制服​。​提供​+​1​魅力​和​+​1​精魂​控制​。\n"
"du1shi4 sa4man3 de5 bu4luo4 zhi4fu2。ti2gong1 +1 mei4li4 he4 +1 jing1hun2 kong4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"The troll drones on, audibly struggling to emote and occasionally tripping over his lines. Overall, the acting quality is roughly on par with what you'd expect from a primary school Christmas pageant.\n"
"\n"
"Philip stares at the screen, listlessly chewing his meat. His nose is wrinkled in distaste, and his fists clench and unclench."
msgstr ""
"巨魔​的​台词​继续​拖沓​进行​，​明显​在​努力​表现​情感​，​还​时不时​说错​台词​。​总体而言​，​这种​演技​水平​大概​也​就​和​小学​圣诞节​表演​差不多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​菲利普​盯​着​屏幕​，​漫不经心​地嚼​着​手里​的​肉​。​他​皱​着​鼻子​，​一脸​嫌恶​，​拳头​时而​紧握​，​时而​松开​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4mo2 de5 tai2ci2 ji4xu4 tuo1ta4 jin4xing2，ming2xian3 zai4 nu3li4 biao3xian4 qing2gan3，hai2 shi2bu4shi2 shuo1 cuo4 tai2ci2。zong3 ti3 er2 yan2，zhe4zhong3 yan3ji4 shui3ping2 da4gai4 ye3 jiu4 he4 xiao3xue2 sheng4dan4jie2 biao3yan3 cha4bu5duo1。\n"
"\n"
"fei1li4pu3 ding1 zhao2 ping2mu4，man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 jiao2 zhao2 shou3li3 de5 rou4。ta1 zhou4 zhao2 bi2zi5，yi1 lian3 xian2wu4，quan2tou5 shi2er2 jin3wo4，shi2er2 song1kai1。"

msgid ""
"The troll working the door might be the shortest you've ever seen. And the thickest. \n"
"\n"
"Despite the pounding music and the writhing bodies, his face is buried in a comic book."
msgstr ""
"看门​的​巨魔​或许​是​你​见​过​最矮​的​，​也​是​最​壮实​的​一个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​震耳欲聋​的​音乐​和​扭动​的​人群​喧嚣​不已​，​但​他​只管​埋头​看着​漫画​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4 men2 de5 ju4mo2 huo4xu3 shi4 ni3 jian4 guo4 zui4 ai3 de5，ye3 shi4 zui4 zhuang4shi5 de5 yi1ge5。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 zhen4er3yu4long2 de5 yin1yue4 he4 niu3 dong4 de5 ren2qun2 xuan1xiao1 bu4yi3，dan4 ta1 zhi3guan3 mai2tou2 kan4 zhao2 man4hua4。"

msgid ""
"The true purpose of the run that you just went on was to test your willingness to adapt to change.\n"
"\n"
"You're still being tested, by the way."
msgstr ""
"你​刚刚​完成​的​差事​的​真正​目的​是​测试​你​适应​变化​的​意愿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​顺便​说​一句​，​你​目前​仍​在​接受考验​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1gang5 wan2cheng2 de5 cha4shi4 de5 zhen1zheng4 mu4di4 shi4 ce4shi4 ni3 shi4ying4 bian4hua4 de5 yi4yuan4。\n"
"\n"
"shun4bian4 shuo1 yi1ju4，ni3 mu4qian2 reng2 zai4 jie1 shou4 kao3 yan4。"

msgid ""
"The truth is, the Kreuzbasar is better with you here. And everyone in it is "
"better."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​有​你​在​这里​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​会​变得​更好​。​这里​的​所有人​也​是​如此​。\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，you3 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 hui4 bian4de5 geng1 hao3。zhe4li3 de5 suo3you3ren2 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "The turbine is currently powered down."
msgstr ""
"涡轮机​当前​未​启动​。\n"
"guo1 lun2 ji1 dang1qian2 wei4 qi3dong4。"

msgid "The turbine whirs to life."
msgstr ""
"涡轮机​呼啸​着​启动​了​。\n"
"guo1 lun2 ji1 hu1xiao4 zhao2 qi3dong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The turret begins tracking your movement as its targeting sensor turns red."
msgstr ""
"炮塔​的​瞄准​传感器​发出​红光​，​它​随即​开始​追踪​你​的​动作​。\n"
"pao4ta3 de5 miao2zhun3 chuan2gan3qi4 fa1chu1 hong2 guang1，ta1 sui2ji2 kai1shi3 zhui1zong1 ni3 de5 dong4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"The ultimate adept outfit for the ultimate adept. Grants +1 Movement, +1 "
"Unarmed Combat, and +1 Dodge."
msgstr ""
"终极​修士​套装​，​专​为​终极​修士​打造​。​提供​+​1​移动力​，​+​1​徒手格斗​和​+​1​闪避​。\n"
"zhong1ji2 xiu1shi4 tao4zhuang1，zhuan1 wei2 zhong1ji2 xiu1shi4 da3zao4。ti2gong1 +1 yi2 dong4 li4，+1 tu2 shou3 ge2 dou3 he4 +1 shan3bi4。"

msgid ""
"The ultimate adept outfit for the ultimate adept. Grants +1 Willpower, +1 "
"Move Speed, and +1 Dodge."
msgstr ""
"终极​修士​套装​，​专​为​终极​修士​打造​。​提供​+​1​意志​，​+​1​移动​速度​和​+​1​闪避​。\n"
"zhong1ji2 xiu1shi4 tao4zhuang1，zhuan1 wei2 zhong1ji2 xiu1shi4 da3zao4。ti2gong1 +1 yi4zhi4，+1 yi2dong4 su4du4 he4 +1 shan3bi4。"

msgid ""
"The utility hatch stands open. A ladder descends from here to the U-Bahn "
"below."
msgstr ""
"检修​舱门​敞开​着​。​有​一架​梯子​通往​下方​的​地铁​。\n"
"jian3xiu1 cang1 men2 chang3kai1 zhao2。you3 yi1 jia4 ti1zi5 tong1wang3 xia4fang1 de5 di4tie3。"

msgid ""
"The van lurches forward. The smell of anxious sweat hangs close and thick inside, making the cramped vehicle feel even smaller. The streets of Berlin are strangely quiet as you make your way past the city limits. It’s as if the whole of the Flux State is waiting for something. A calm before the storm.\n"
"\n"
"An hour later, the van rounds a corner. In the distance you can see the silhouette of Harfeld Manor, backed by the light of the full moon. You switch the van’s headlights off and shift to electric. A short while later, you kill the ignition and roll quietly down the last hill, pulling to a stop on the side of the road. A bird of prey takes wing from a tree above you, beginning its nocturnal pursuit. \n"
"\n"
"You know how it feels."
msgstr ""
"你​驾驶​货车​向前​飞驰​。​车厢​内​弥漫着​焦虑​的​汗味​，​浓稠得​令人窒息​，​让​本​就​狭窄​的​空间​显得​更加​局促​。​你​驶出​城市​边界​时​，​柏林​的​街道​异常​寂静​，​仿佛​整个​动荡​带​都​在​等待​着​什么​。​宛如​暴风雨​前​的​宁静​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一​小时​后​，​货车​拐过​转角​。​哈​菲尔德​庄园​的​轮廓​在​满月​映照​下于​远处​若隐若现​。​你​熄灭​车头灯​，​切换​至​电动​模式​，​片刻​后​关闭​引擎​，​缓缓​滑​下​最后​一道​山坡​，​停靠在​路边​。​你​头顶​的​树梢​掠过​一只​猛禽​，​展翅​开启​了​夜间​狩猎​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​深知​这种​感觉​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jia4shi3 huo4che1 xiang4qian2 fei1chi2。che1xiang1 nei4 mi2 man4 zhao2 jiao1lu:4 de5 han2 wei4，nong2 chou2 de2 ling3 ren2 zhi4 xi1，rang4 ben3 jiu4 xia2zhai3 de5 kong1jian1 xian3de5 geng4jia1 ju2cu4。ni3 shi3chu1 cheng2shi4 bian1jie4 shi2，bo2lin2 de5 jie1dao4 yi4chang2 ji4jing4，fang3fu2 zheng3ge4 dong4dang4 dai4 dou1 zai4 deng3dai4 zhao2 shen2me5。wan3ru2 bao4feng1yu3 qian2 de5 ning2jing4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 xiao3shi2 hou4，huo4che1 guai3 guo4 zhuan3jiao3。Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 de5 lun2kuo4 zai4 man3yue4 ying4zhao4 xia4 yu2 yuan3chu4 ruo4yin3ruo4xian4。ni3 xi1mie4 che1tou2deng1，qie1huan4 zhi4 dian4dong4 mo2shi4，pian4ke4 hou4 guan1bi4 yin3qing2，huan3huan3 hua2 xia4 zui4hou4 yi1dao4 shan1po1，ting2 kao4 zai4 lu4bian1。ni3 tou2ding3 de5 shu4shao1 lu:e4guo4 yi1 zhi3 meng3qin2，zhan3chi4 kai1qi3 le5 ye4jian1 shou4lie4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shen1zhi1 zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2。"

msgid ""
"The vase in this case looks both very old and very valuable. A fine scrollwork of lapis and gold leaf decorates its exterior, and the interior shimmers with the organic beauty of abalone shell. Your fixer could probably move this thing in a heartbeat.\n"
"\n"
"You can't help but notice that the glass encasing it looks awfully flimsy..."
msgstr ""
"柜里​的​花瓶​看起来​既​古老​又​昂贵​。​瓶体​外侧​装点​着​精致​的​缠枝​纹路​，​布满​天青石​和​金子​制成​的​叶子​。​内壁​则​由​鲍鱼​壳​制成​，​闪烁着​有机物​的​美丽​光泽​。​你们​的​中间人​大概​一下子​就​能​转手​卖掉​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不由得​注意​到​，​封着​花瓶​的​玻璃罩​子​看起来​薄得​可怜​……\n"
"\n"
"ju3 li3 de5 hua1ping2 kan4qi3lai5 ji4 gu3lao3 you4 ang2gui4。ping2 ti3 wai4ce4 zhuang1dian3 zhao2 jing1zhi4 de5 chan2 zhi1 wen2lu4，bu4man3 tian1qing1shi2 he4 jin1zi5 zhi4cheng2 de5 ye4zi5。nei4 bi4 ze2 you2 bao4yu2 ke2 zhi4cheng2，shan3 shuo4 zhao2 you3ji1wu4 de5 mei3li4 guang1ze2。ni3men5 de5 zhong1jian1ren2 da4gai4 yi1xia4zi5 jiu4 neng2 zhuan3shou3 mai4diao4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4you2de5 zhu4yi4 dao4，feng1 zhao2 hua1ping2 de5 bo1li5zhao4 zi3 kan4qi3lai5 bao2 de2 ke3lian2……"

msgid ""
"The vase looks every bit as enticing now as it did the first time you "
"inspected it... and taking it now would be just as bad an idea."
msgstr ""
"这​花瓶​看起来​还是​那么​诱人​……​而​此刻​拿走​它​仍然​是​个​糟糕​的​主意​。\n"
"zhe4 hua1ping2 kan4qi3lai5 hai2shi5 na4me5 you4ren2……er2 ci3ke4 na2zou3 ta1 reng2ran2 shi4 ge4 zao1gao1 de5 zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"The vault door, idiot. There's no way to open it from in here.\n"
"\n"
"You *did* account for that, didn't you?"
msgstr ""
"保险库​的​门​，​笨蛋​。​从​我​这边​打不开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这事​跟​你​有​关系​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"bao3 xian3 ku4 de5 men2，ben4dan4。cong2 wo3 zhe4bian1 da3 bu4 kai1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 gen1 ni3 you3 guan1xi5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"The vault door. The one that you \"forgot\" to account for. Was that really "
"an accident?"
msgstr ""
"关于​保险库​的​门​。​就是​那扇​你​“​忘记​”​要​考虑​的​门​。​那​真的​只是​个​意外​吗​？\n"
"guan1yu2 bao3 xian3 ku4 de5 men2。jiu4shi4 na4 shan1 ni3“wang4ji4” yao4 kao3lu:4 de5 men2。na4 zhen1de5 zhi3shi4 ge4 yi4wai4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"The vault is just around the corner. Once we get there, I can unlock it with a few clicks on the keypad.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz offers you something between a smile and a smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Built myself a backdoor when I wrote the security system. Never hurts to be careful."
msgstr ""
"保险库​就​在​拐角​那边​。​咱们​过去​以后​，​我​在​键盘​上​敲​两下​它​就​开​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​朝​你​一笑​，​还​带​着​点​洋洋得意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​写​安保​系统​的​时候​，​给​自己​留​了​个​后门​。​小心​驶得​万年​船嘛​。\n"
"\n"
"bao3 xian3 ku4 jiu4 zai4 guai3jiao3 na4bian5。zan2men5 guo4qu4 yi3hou4，wo3 zai4 jian4pan2 shang4 qiao1 liang3xia4 ta1 jiu4 kai1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 chao2 ni3 yi1 xiao4，hai2 dai4 zhao2 dian3 yang2yang2de2yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xie3 an1bao3 xi4tong3 de5 shi2hou5，gei3 zi4ji3 liu2 le5 ge4 hou4men2。xiao3xin1 shi3 de2 wan4nian2 chuan2 ma5。"

msgid "The very same."
msgstr ""
"如假包换​。\n"
"ru2jia3bao1huan4。"

msgid "The vessel holding the dragon lifts her face to a sky she cannot see. "
msgstr ""
"承载​巨龙​的​容器​抬头​望​向​自己​并​看不到​的​天空​。\n"
"cheng2zai4 ju4long2 de5 rong2qi4 tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 zi4ji3 bing4 kan4 bu4 dao4 de5 tian1kong1。"

msgid ""
"The video feed flickers and winks out.\n"
"\n"
"You find yourself deposited back at the main menu."
msgstr ""
"视频​画面​闪烁​了​一下​，​随后​熄灭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​回到​了​主​菜单​界面​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 hua4mian4 shan3shuo4 le5 yi1xia4，sui2hou4 xi1mie4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"The video feed flickers onto the screen. In it, you find Philip standing in the corner of the room that you're in now. He looks haggard, exhausted, and he carries a haunted look in his eyes.\n"
"\n"
"Heiner is notably absent."
msgstr ""
"视频​画面​在​屏幕​上​闪现​。​你​看到​菲利普​站​在​你​现在​所在​房间​的​角落里​。​他​面容​憔悴​，​精疲力竭​，​眼中​透着​一丝​不安​与​痛苦​的​神色​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​海纳​明显​不​在场​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 hua4mian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4 shan3xian4。ni3 kan4dao4 fei1li4pu3 zhan4 zai4 ni3 xian4zai4 suo3zai4 fang2jian1 de5 jiao3 la4 li3。ta1 mian4rong2 qiao2cui4，jing1pi2li4jie2，yan3zhong1 tou4 zhao2 yi1 si1 bu4an1 yu4 tong4ku3 de5 shen2se4。\n"
"\n"
"hai3 na4 ming2xian3 bu4 zai4chang3。"

msgid "The virus infusion has been aborted."
msgstr ""
"病毒​注入​已​中止​。\n"
"bing4du2 zhu4ru4 yi3 zhong1zhi3。"

msgid ""
"The virus is both extremely infectious and asymptomatic in metahumans. As such, it was able to spread across much of the globe without being detected.\n"
"\n"
"It is, however, highly dangerous to draconic life forms; along with the WHO's press release, Saeder-Krupp has revealed that the Great Dragon Lofwyr is currently battling the disease."
msgstr ""
"该​病毒​在​泛​人类​群体​中​具有​极强​的​传染性​且​无症状​表现​，​因此​得以​在​未​被​察觉​的​情况​下​蔓延​至​全球​大部分​地区​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然而​该​病毒​对​龙形​生命体​具有​极高​致命性​；​除​世界卫生组织​的​公告​外​，​赛德​-​克虏伯​同时​披露​，​巨龙​洛夫​维尔​正​与​该​疾病​进行​斗争​。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 bing4du2 zai4 fan4 ren2lei4 qun2ti3 zhong4 ju4you3 ji2 jiang4 de5 chuan2ran3xing4 qie3 wu2zheng4zhuang4 biao3xian4，yin1ci3 de2yi3 zai4 wei4 bei4 cha2jue2 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 man4yan2 zhi4 quan2qiu2 da4bu4fen5 di4qu1。\n"
"\n"
"ran2er2 gai1 bing4du2 dui4 long2 xing2 sheng1 ming4 ti3 ju4you3 ji2 gao1 zhi4 ming4 xing4 ； chu2 shi4jie4wei4sheng1zu3zhi1 de5 gong1gao4 wai4，Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 tong2shi2 pi1lu4，ju4long2 Luo4fu1wei2er3 zheng1 yu4 gai1 ji2bing4 jin4xing2 dou4zheng1。"

msgid ""
"The vision ends and your connection to Feuerschwinge's astral form is "
"broken. "
msgstr ""
"视界​终止​，​你​与​火翼​灵体​的​连接​也​中断​了​。\n"
"shi4jie4 zhong1zhi3，ni3 yu4 Huo3yi4 ling2ti3 de5 lian2jie1 ye3 zhong1duan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The vocal kind. It's really quite simple; all that we want you to do is whisper a phrase into his ear: \"We are pleased that Project Vincent is going so well.\"\n"
"\n"
"If you wanted to embellish the fact that he is receiving this message in the one place where he feels the most secure, we wouldn't stop you."
msgstr ""
"传个​话​就​行​。​其实​很​简单​，​我们​只​需​你​在​他​耳边​轻声​说​一句​：​“​我们​很​高兴​文森特​计划​进展​顺利​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​你​想​再​强调​一下​，​他​正​身处​自​以为​最​安全​的​场所​却​收到​这​条​消息​，​我们​也​不会​拦着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"chuan2 ge4 hua4 jiu4 xing2。qi2shi2 hen3 jian3dan1，wo3men5 zhi3 xu1 ni3 zai4 ta1 er3 bian1 qing1sheng1 shuo1 yi1ju4：“wo3men5 hen3 gao1xing4 wen2 sen1 te4 ji4hua4 jin4zhan3 shun4li4。” \n"
"\n"
"ruo4 ni3 xiang3 zai4 qiang2diao4 yi1xia4，ta1 zheng1 shen1chu3 zi4 yi3wei2 zui4 an1quan2 de5 chang3suo3 que4 shou1dao4 zhe4 tiao2 xiao1xi5，wo3men5 ye3 bu4hui4 lan2 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid "The voice cuts to static."
msgstr ""
"声音​被​切断​了​。\n"
"sheng1yin1 bei4 qie1duan4 le5。"

msgid "The voice dissolves into a long, piercing scream."
msgstr ""
"声音​逐渐​消散​，​化作​一阵​漫长​而​刺耳​的​尖叫​。\n"
"sheng1yin1 zhu2jian4 xiao1san4，hua4zuo4 yi1zhen4 man4chang2 er2 ci4er3 de5 jian1jiao4。"

msgid ""
"The voices that you can hear, whispering in the back of your mind? Those are the spirit's voices. It saps the will of anyone who sets foot on these grounds.\n"
"\n"
"We can't save those kids until the shrine is dealt with. They'll fight us if we try."
msgstr ""
"你​能​听到​脑海​深处​传来​的​低​语声​吧​？​那​就是​精魂​的​声音​。​任何​踏足​此地​之​人​，​意志​都​会​被​它​蚕食​殆尽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​解决​神龛​的话​，​我们​就​无法​救出​那些​孩子​。​如果​贸然​行动​，​他们​反而​会​与​我们​为​敌​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 ting1dao4 nao3hai3 shen1chu4 chuan2lai2 de5 di1 yu3sheng1 ba1？na4 jiu4shi4 jing1hun2 de5 sheng1yin1。ren4he2 ta4zu2 ci3di4 zhi1 ren2，yi4zhi4 dou1 hui4 bei4 ta1 can2shi2 dai4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 jie3jue2 shen2kan1 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 wu2fa3 jiu4chu1 na4Xie1hai2zi5。ru2guo3 mao4ran2 xing2dong4，ta1men5 fan3er2 hui4 yu4 wo3men5 wei2 di2。"

msgid ""
"The volunteer worker holds her silence, but her expression is full of naked hostility.\n"
"\n"
"Samuel gives her a sidelong glance, and she seems to get the message. The fire in her eyes dies down to a low simmer."
msgstr ""
"志愿​工作者​保持沉默​，​但​她​的​脸上​写满​了​赤裸裸​的​敌意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​塞缪尔​斜睨​了​她​一眼​，​她​似乎​明白​了​什么​。​她​眼中​的​火焰​渐渐​熄灭​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yuan4 gong1zuo4zhe3 bao3 chi2 chen2 mo4，dan4 ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 xie3 man3 le5 chi4luo3luo3 de5 di2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"sai4miu4er3 xie2ni4 le5 ta1 yi1yan3，ta1 si4hu1 ming2bai5 le5 shen2me5。ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 huo3yan4 jian4jian4 xi1mie4。"

msgid ""
"The wageslave barely has time to move before you're on him.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds of noisy struggle later, he lies dead at your feet."
msgstr ""
"还​没​等​薪奴​来得及​动弹​，​你​就​扑​了​上去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​嘈杂​的​挣扎​之后​，​他​就​死​在​了​你​的​脚下​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 mei2 deng3 xin1 nu2 lai2de5ji2 dong4tan5，ni3 jiu4 pu1 le5 shang4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 cao2za2 de5 zheng1zha2 zhi1hou4，ta1 jiu4 si3 zai4 le5 ni3 de5 jiao3xia4。"

msgid ""
"The wageslave barely has time to move before you're on him.\n"
"\n"
"You wrestle for a few seconds, and a picture is knocked from the desk. It shatters when it hits the ground."
msgstr ""
"还​没​等​薪奴​来得及​动弹​，​你​就​扑​了​上去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​扭打​了​几秒钟​，​桌上​的​一幅​画​被​打落​，​在​地上​碎裂​开来​。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 mei2 deng3 xin1 nu2 lai2de5ji2 dong4tan5，ni3 jiu4 pu1 le5 shang4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 niu3da3 le5 ji1 miao3 zhong1，zhuo1 shang4 de5 yi1 fu2 hua4 bei4 da3 la4，zai4 di4shang5 sui4lie4 kai1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"The wageslave completes his turn. He stares blankly out the door for a moment, then shakes his head.\n"
"\n"
"He mutters something about needing to get more sleep, rubs his eyes, and returns to his work."
msgstr ""
"薪奴​完全​转过身​来​。​他​茫然​地向​门外​看​了​一会儿​，​然后​摇​了​摇头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​嘟囔​着​自己​真该​多​睡​一会儿​，​然后​揉​了​揉​眼睛​，​继续​干活​。\n"
"\n"
"xin1 nu2 wan2quan2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2。ta1 mang2ran2 de5 xiang4 men2wai4 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 du1nang5 zhao2 zi4ji3 zhen1 gai1 duo1 shui4 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 rou2 le5 rou2 yan3jing5，ji4xu4 gan4huo2。"

msgid ""
"The wageslave simultaneously leaps out of his chair and attempts to whirl "
"toward you. His knee smashes into the corner of his desk, and he goes "
"crashing to the ground, wailing."
msgstr ""
"薪奴​从​椅子​上​一跃而起​，​试图​向​你​扑​来​。​他​的​膝盖​撞​在​桌角​上​，​倒​在​地上​哀嚎​。\n"
"xin1 nu2 cong2 yi3zi5 shang4 yi1yue4er2qi3，shi4tu2 xiang4 ni3 pu1 lai2。ta1 de5 xi1gai4 zhuang4 zai4 zhuo1 jiao3 shang4，dao3 zai4 di4shang5 ai1hao2。"

msgid "The wageslave thrashes against you for a few seconds, then goes limp."
msgstr ""
"薪奴​挣扎​了​几秒钟​，​随后​便​瘫软​下来​。\n"
"xin1 nu2 zheng1zha2 le5 ji1 miao3 zhong1，sui2hou4 bian4 tan1ruan3 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"The wageslave's mouth drops open, and a small, strangled sound escapes from his throat as your fist slams into the bridge of his nose. You feel the tiny bones break and hear the sound of crunching cartilage, and his head snaps back as though it were mounted on a hinge.\n"
"\n"
"The wageslave unceremoniously crumples to the floor. You'd guess that he's going to be out for a while."
msgstr ""
"你​用​拳头​狠狠​砸​在​薪奴​的​鼻梁​上​。​他​的​嘴巴​张得​大大的​，​喉咙​里​发出​一声​轻微​的​哽咽​。​你​感觉​到​细小​的​骨头​断裂​，​听到​软骨​嘎吱​作响​的​声音​，​他​的​头​就​像​装​在​铰链​上​一样​向​后仰​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​薪奴​扑通​一下​倒​在​地上​。​你​猜​他​会​昏迷​一段时间​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong4 quan2tou5 hen3hen3 za2 zai4 xin1 nu2 de5 bi2liang2 shang4。ta1 de5 zui3ba5 zhang1 de2 dai4 dai4 de5，hou2long2 li3 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 qing1wei1 de5 geng3ye4。ni3 gan3jue2 dao4 xi4xiao3 de5 gu3tou5 duan4lie4，ting1dao4 ruan3gu3 ga1zhi1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 sheng1yin1，ta1 de5 tou2 jiu4 xiang4 zhuang1 zai4 jiao3lian4 shang4 yi1yang4 xiang4 hou4 yang3 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"xin1 nu2 pu1tong1 yi1xia4 dao3 zai4 di4shang5。ni3 cai1 ta1 hui4 hun1mi2 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"The ward is like a lock. There must be a key.\n"
"\n"
"Back when I helped Harrow run this place, he and I were the only ones allowed in the shrine room. So we look for whoever has taken my place... that's where the key will be."
msgstr ""
"这​结界​就​像是​门锁​，​所以​肯定​有​对应​的​钥匙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​帮​哈罗​管理​这​地方​的​时候​，​只有​我​和​他​才能​进入​神龛​室​。​所以​我们​得​寻找​那个​接替​我​位置​的​人​……​钥匙​就​在​那个​人​手里​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jie2jie4 jiu4 xiang4 shi4 men2suo3，suo3yi3 ken3ding4 you3 dui4ying4 de5 yao4shi5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bang1 ha1luo2 guan3li3 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 shi2hou5，zhi3you3 wo3 he4 ta1 cai2neng2 jin4ru4 shen2kan1 shi4。suo3yi3 wo3men5 de2 xun2zhao3 na4ge5 jie1ti4 wo3 wei4zhi5 de5 ren2……yao4shi5 jiu4 zai4 na4ge5 ren2 shou3li3。"

msgid ""
"The ward is like a lock. There must be a key.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A grimace crosses her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And I know who has it. There's only one person here that Harrow would offer it to."
msgstr ""
"这​结界​就​像是​门锁​，​所以​肯定​有​对应​的​钥匙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​脸上​的​表情​变得​难看​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​知道​它​在​谁​手上​。​哈罗​只会​把​钥匙​交给​一个​人​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jie2jie4 jiu4 xiang4 shi4 men2suo3，suo3yi3 ken3ding4 you3 dui4ying4 de5 yao4shi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 biao3qing2 bian4de5 nan2kan4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 zai4 shei2 shou3 shang4。ha1luo2 zhi3 hui4 ba3 yao4shi5 jiao1gei3 yi1ge5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"The warehouse door is windowless slab of reinforced densiplast. A keypad "
"entry system sits to one side."
msgstr ""
"仓库​大门​是​一块​无窗​的​强化​密度​塑料板​。​一侧​安装​有​密码​输入​系统​。\n"
"cang1ku4 da4men2 shi4 yi1kuai4 wu2 chuang1 de5 qiang2hua4 mi4du4 su4 liao4 ban3。yi1 ce4 an1zhuang1 you3 mi4ma3 shu1ru4 xi4tong3。"

msgid ""
"The warmth seems to bring the pear smell out a great deal. It’s almost "
"sickening how sweet it is."
msgstr ""
"酒​的​温度​似乎​让​梨子​味儿​更加​浓郁​。​它​的​甜味​几乎​令人​有点​反胃​。\n"
"jiu3 de5 wen1du4 si4hu1 rang4 li2zi5 wei4r5 geng4jia1 nong2yu4。ta1 de5 tian2wei4 ji1hu1 ling4ren2 you3dian3 fan3wei4。"

msgid ""
"The way that I look at it, what happened, happened. I've come through it okay, and I've even managed to take away some residual - if inexplicable - gain from it.\n"
"\n"
"How can that be bad?"
msgstr ""
"在我看来​，​发生​的​事情​无法​再​改变​，​到​目前为止​我​一切​都​好​，​而​我​也​从中​获得​了​些许​残余​的​、​尽管​也​难以​解释​的​收获​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这有​什么​不好​？\n"
"\n"
"zai4wo3kan4lai2，fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 wu2fa3 zai4 gai3bian4，dao4 mu4 qian2 wei2 zhi3 wo3 yi1qie4 dou1 hao3，er2 wo3 ye3 cong2zhong1 huo4de2 le5 xie1xu3 can2yu2 de5、jin3guan3 ye3 nan2yi3 jie3shi4 de5 shou1huo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 you3 shen2me5 bu4hao3？"

msgid ""
"The weapon roars.\n"
"\n"
"The ork's skull comes apart like an overripe melon."
msgstr ""
"武器​发出​咆哮​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​兽​人​的​头骨​像​过​熟​的​西瓜​一样​碎裂​开来​。\n"
"\n"
"wu3qi4 fa1chu1 pao2xiao4。\n"
"\n"
"shou4 ren2 de5 tou2gu3 xiang4 guo4 shu2 de5 xi1gua1 yi1yang4 sui4lie4 kai1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"The weapon roars. Vauclair’s head disappears into a cloud of red mist.\n"
"\n"
"His lifeless body collapses to the floor."
msgstr ""
"武器​发出​轰鸣声​。​沃​克莱尔​的​头颅​爆​开成​一片​血雾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​毫无​生气​的​身体​倒​在​了​地上​。\n"
"\n"
"wu3qi4 fa1chu1 hong1 ming2 sheng1。Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 tou2lu2 bao4 kai1 cheng2 yi1 pian1 xie3 wu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hao2wu2 sheng1qi4 de5 shen1ti3 dao3 zai4 le5 di4shang5。"

msgid ""
"The weathered edifice of Feuerstelle looms above you, dark and sinister in "
"the chill night air."
msgstr ""
"饱经风霜​的​“​火坑​”​建筑​在​你​头顶​若隐若现​，​在​寒冷​的​夜风​中​显得​阴暗​而​可怖​。\n"
"bao3jing1feng1shuang1 de5“huo3keng1” jian4zhu4 zai4 ni3 tou2ding3 ruo4yin3ruo4xian4，zai4 han2leng3 de5 ye4 feng1 zhong4 xian3de5 yin1an4 er2 ke3 bu4。"

msgid ""
"The well-dressed ork stops his pacing to stare at you as you approach. Heavy"
" worry lines etch his forehead, and his eyes are bloodshot. He looks like he"
" hasn't slept in a month."
msgstr ""
"衣着​考究​的​兽​人​见​你​走近​，​便​停下​踱步​盯​着​你​。​他​额头​上​有​浓重​的​抬头纹​，​双眼​布满​血丝​，​活像​一个月​没​合眼​。\n"
"yi1zhuo2 kao3jiu1 de5 shou4 ren2 jian4 ni3 zou3jin4，bian4 ting2xia4 duo2bu4 ding1 zhao2 ni3。ta1 e2tou2 shang4 you3 nong2zhong4 de5 tai2 tou2 wen2，shuang1yan3 bu4man3 xue4si1，huo2xiang4 yi1 ge4 yue4 mei2 he2yan3。"

msgid "The whole security network is down. Take cover!"
msgstr ""
"整个​安保​网络​都​下线​了​。​快​找​掩护​！\n"
"zheng3ge4 an1bao3 wang3luo4 dou1 xia4xian4 le5。kuai4 zhao3 yan3hu4！"

msgid ""
"The wind explodes out of the ork's lungs as your fist slams into his belly. His breath stinks of harissa and garlic.\n"
"\n"
"After a few panicked seconds, he manages to gasp out a word."
msgstr ""
"你​的​拳头​重重​击中​兽​人​的​腹部​，​风​从​他​的​肺​中​猛烈​喷出​。​他​的​呼吸​中​散发​着​哈里​萨酱​和​大蒜​的​臭味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​经过​几秒钟​的​惊慌失措​后​，​他​终于​勉强​挤出​一个​词​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 quan2tou5 chong2chong2 ji1zhong4 shou4 ren2 de5 fu4bu4，feng1 cong2 ta1 de5 fei4 zhong4 meng3lie4 pen1chu1。ta1 de5 hu1xi1 zhong4 san4fa1 zhao2 ha1li3 sa4 jiang4 he4 da4suan4 de5 chou4wei4。\n"
"\n"
"jing1guo4 ji1 miao3 zhong1 de5 jing1huang1shi1cuo4 hou4，ta1 zhong1yu2 mian3qiang3 ji3chu1 yi1ge5 ci2。"

msgid ""
"The window between us is made of dikote-treated transplast. Do whatever you "
"like to it - you'll find that it's quite unbreakable."
msgstr ""
"我们​之间​的​窗户​是​由​经过​镀​钻​处理​的​透塑​材料​制成​的​。​随便​你​怎么​尝试​，​但​它​几乎​是​牢不可破​的​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 chuang1hu5 shi4 you2 jing1guo4 du4 zuan1 chu3li3 de5 tou4 su4 cai2liao4 zhi4cheng2 de5。sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 chang2shi4，dan4 ta1 ji1hu1 shi4 lao2bu4ke3po4 de5。"

msgid "The woman behind the counter smiles at you, her cheeks dimpling."
msgstr ""
"柜台​后​的​女人​冲​你​微笑​，​脸颊​上​泛起​酒窝​。\n"
"gui4tai2 hou4 de5 nu:3ren2 chong1 ni3 wei1xiao4，lian3jia2 shang4 fan4qi3 jiu3wo1。"

msgid ""
"The woman drops to her knees, then falls to the side. She appears "
"unconscious, if she's still alive."
msgstr ""
"女人​跪倒​在​地​，​随后​倒​在​一旁​。​她​似乎​失去​了​意识​—​—​如果​她​还​活着​的话​。\n"
"nu:3ren2 gui4dao3 zai4 de5，sui2hou4 dao3 zai4 yi1pang2。ta1 si4hu1 shi1qu4 le5 yi4shi2——ru2guo3 ta1 hai2 huo2zhe5 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"The woman got a call. She talked about a council meeting tonight to decide "
"if they should “make a move.” Then she was drowned out by heavy machinery."
msgstr ""
"女人​接​了​通电话​。​她​提到​委员会​将​于​今晚​召开​会议​，​决定​他们​是否​该​“​采取行动​”​。​然后​她​的​说话声​就​被​重型机械​的​声音​淹没​了​。\n"
"nu:3ren2 jie1 le5 tong1dian4hua4。ta1 ti2dao4 wei3yuan2hui4 jiang1 yu2 jin1wan3 zhao4kai1 hui4yi4，jue2ding4 ta1men5 shi4fou3 gai1“cai3qu3xing2dong4”。ran2hou4 ta1 de5 shuo1 hua4 sheng1 jiu4 bei4 chong2 xing2 ji1 xie4 de5 sheng1yin1 yan1mo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"The woman in this room is lovely. Full lips contrast artfully with her fine elvish features, and a tumble of fire-red hair spills down over her shoulders.\n"
"\n"
"Beyond her physical beauty, there's something inherently approachable about her. She exudes an almost palpable aura of kindness and warmth.\n"
"\n"
"Marta. Glory's old lover. The lure that Harrow used to draw her, and so many others, to Feuerstelle."
msgstr ""
"房间​里​的​女子​堪称​绝色​。​丰润​的​双唇​与​她​精致​的​精灵​面容​形成​了​巧妙​对比​，​一头​火红​的​长发​散落​在​她​的​肩头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除了​外​在​的​美貌​，​她​身上​还​散发​着​一种​与生俱来​的​亲和力​。​那​份​善良​与​温暖​的​气息​几乎​触手可及​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​。​格洛丽​昔日​的​恋人​。​哈罗​用来​引诱​她​以及​其他​无数​人​来到​“​火坑​”​的​诱饵​。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 li3 de5 nu:3zi3 kan1cheng1 jue2se4。feng1run4 de5 shuang1 chun2 yu4 ta1 jing1zhi4 de5 jing1ling2 mian4rong2 xing2cheng2 le5 qiao3miao4 dui4bi3，yi1tou2 huo3hong2 de5 chang2fa4 san3luo4 zai4 ta1 de5 jian1tou2。\n"
"\n"
"chu2le5 wai4 zai4 de5 mei3mao4，ta1 shen1shang5 hai2 san4fa1 zhao2 yi1zhong3 yu3sheng1ju4lai2 de5 qin1he2li4。na4 fen4 shan4liang2 yu4 wen1nuan3 de5 qi4xi1 ji1hu1 chu4shou3ke3ji2。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3。Ge2luo4li2 xi1ri4 de5 lian4ren2。ha1luo2 yong4lai2 yin3you4 ta1 yi3ji2 qi2ta1 wu2shu4 ren2 lai2dao4“huo3keng1” de5 you4er3。"

msgid "The woman's face lights up, and her yellow eyes turn to saucers. "
msgstr ""
"女人​的​脸庞​顿时​亮​了​起来​，​黄色​的​双眼​瞪​得​像​盘子​一样​大​。\n"
"nu:3ren2 de5 lian3pang2 dun4shi2 liang4 le5 qi3lai5，huang2se4 de5 shuang1yan3 deng4 de2 xiang4 pan2zi5 yi1yang4 dai4。"

msgid ""
"The work program has been a rousing success! At this point, we only have one more goal in mind to round out the year.\n"
"\n"
"I have been in negotiations with Herr Burakgazi to lease another building in the Kreuzbasar. The construction is much more modern and sturdy than our old shelter... our people would be better-protected there. In addition, the extra floor space would open up a host of new options for our organization."
msgstr ""
"工作​计划​取得​了​巨大成功​！​目前​，​我们​只​剩下​一个​目标​来​完成​今年​的​工作​指标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​在​与​布拉加​齐​先生​谈判​，​希望​能​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​再​租用​一栋​建筑​。​那里​会​比​我们​原来​的​避难所​更​现代化​、​更​坚固​……​我们​的​人​在​那里​会​得到​更好​的​保护​。​此外​，​额外​的​建筑面积​也​将​为​我们​的​组织​提供​许多​新​的​选择​。\n"
"\n"
"gong1zuo4 ji4hua4 qu3de2 le5 ju4 dai4 cheng2 gong1！mu4qian2，wo3men5 zhi3 sheng4xia4 yi1ge5 mu4biao1 lai2 wan2cheng2 jin1nian2 de5 gong1zuo4 zhi3biao1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 yu4 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 xian1sheng5 tan2pan4，xi1wang4 neng2 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zai4 zu1yong4 yi1 dong4 jian4zhu4。na4li5 hui4 bi3 wo3men5 yuan2lai2 de5 bi4nan4suo3 geng1 xian4dai4hua4、geng1 jian1gu4……wo3men5 de5 ren2 zai4 na4li5 hui4 de2dao4 geng1 hao3 de5 bao3hu4。ci3wai4，e2wai4 de5 jian4 zhu4 mian4 ji1 ye3 jiang1 wei2 wo3men5 de5 zu3zhi1 ti2gong1 xu3duo1 xin1 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"The world is crumbling around you, and all that you care about is money.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He lets loose a heavy sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well, you will be paid. How much do you want? A hundred thousand nuyen? Two hundred? What is the world worth to you?"
msgstr ""
"世界​在​你​眼前​崩塌​，​而​你​关心​的​只有​金钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​重重地​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​，​我会​付钱​。​你​要​多少​？​十万​新円​？​还是​二十万​？​这个​世界​对​你​来说​值​多少​钱​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4 zai4 ni3 yan3qian2 beng1ta1，er2 ni3 guan1xin1 de5 zhi3you3 jin1qian2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong2 chong2 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3，wo3 hui4 fu4qian2。ni3 yao4 duo1shao3？shi2wan4 xin1 yuan2？hai2shi5 er4 shi2 wan4？zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 zhi2 duo1shao3 qian2？"

msgid ""
"The world may pass judgment over my actions when I am dead and gone. It will not be long now.\n"
"\n"
"Until then... I do not have the *luxury* of morality. I go now to do a hard thing, perhaps an evil thing, but a thing that is *necessary.*"
msgstr ""
"当​我​死​后​，​世人​或许​会​对​我​的​行为​做出​评判​。​那​一天​不会​太远​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在此之前​……​我​没有​道德​上​的​*​奢侈​*​。​我​现在​要​去​做​一件​艰难​的​事​，​也许​甚至​是​一件​邪恶​的​事​，​但​这​都​是​*​必要​*​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 si3 hou4，shi4ren2 huo4xu3 hui4 dui4 wo3 de5 xing2wei2 zuo4chu1 ping2pan4。na4 yi1 tian1 bu4hui4 tai4 yuan3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4ci3zhi1qian2……wo3 mei2you3 dao4de2 shang4 de5*she1chi3*。wo3 xian4zai4 yao4 qu4 zuo4 yi1 jian4 jian1nan2 de5 shi4，ye3xu3 shen4zhi4 shi4 yi1 jian4 xie2e4 de5 shi4，dan4 zhe4 dou1 shi4*bi4yao4*de5。"

msgid ""
"The worst part of the whole mess is that I don't even know what the data she stole *was.*\n"
"\n"
"The file was encrypted all to hell, and I never could get it open."
msgstr ""
"最​糟糕​的​是​我​甚至​不​知道​她​偷走​的​数据​到底​是​*​什么​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​文件​设​了​重重​加密​，​我​一直​没有​打开​过​它​。\n"
"\n"
"zui4 zao1gao1 de5 shi4 wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 tou1 zou3 de5 shu4ju4 dao4di3 shi4*shen2me5*。\n"
"\n"
"wen2jian4 she4 le5 chong2chong2 jia1mi4，wo3 yi1zhi2 mei2you3 da3kai1 guo4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"The wyrms will continue their machinations, consolidate their power, exact their tribute. \n"
"\n"
"And humanity?"
msgstr ""
"巨龙​将​继续​他们​的​阴谋诡计​，​巩固​他们​的​权力​，​索取​他们​的​贡品​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​人类​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 jiang1 ji4xu4 ta1men5 de5 yin1mou2gui3ji4，gong3gu4 ta1men5 de5 quan2li4，suo3qu3 ta1men5 de5 gong4pin3。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ren2lei4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"The yard is eerily silent, with no one around to receive the the goods."
msgstr ""
"院子​里静​的​出奇​，​附近​没​人​现身​接货​。\n"
"yuan4zi5 li3 jing4 de5 chu1qi2，fu4jin4 mei2 ren2 xian4shen1 jie1 huo4。"

msgid ""
"The year is 2054. The promise of opportunity and anonymity draws you to the free city of Berlin: The Flux-State, a grand experiment in social order. Corporations tread carefully here. Even the great dragon Lofwyr only has so much sway in the constantly evolving power structure of Berlin. The perfect place for a savvy shadowrunner to disappear and begin anew.\n"
"\n"
"If only it were that simple..."
msgstr ""
"时间​是​2054​年​。​受​机遇​与​隐姓埋名​的​承诺​吸引​，​你​来到​了​柏林​这座​自由​城​：​这里​被称作​“​动荡​带​”​，​也​是​社会秩序​的​一次​伟大​实验​。​在​此地​，​巨头​企业​也​要​步步为营​。​即便​强大​如​巨龙​洛夫​维尔​，​在​这座​权力​格局​瞬息万变​的​都​市里​，​影响力​也​终有​边界​。​对于​精明​的​暗影​狂奔​者​来说​，​这里​堪称​改头换面​、​重启​人生​的​绝佳​之地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只是​事情​并非​这么​简单​……\n"
"\n"
"shi2jian1 shi4 2054 nian2。shou4 ji1yu4 yu4 yin3xing4mai2ming2 de5 cheng2nuo4 xi1yin3，ni3 lai2dao4 le5 bo2lin2 zhe4 zuo4 zi4you2 cheng2：zhe4li3 bei4 chen4 zuo4“dong4dang4 dai4”，ye3 shi4 she4 hui4 zhi4 xu4 de5 yi1ci4 wei3da4 shi2yan4。zai4 ci3di4，ju4tou2 qi3ye4 ye3 yao4 bu4bu4wei2ying2。ji2bian4 qiang2da4 ru2 ju4long2 Luo4fu1wei2er3，zai4 zhe4 zuo4 quan2li4 ge2ju2 shun4xi1wan4bian4 de5 dou1 shi4li3，ying3xiang3li4 ye3 zhong1 you3 bian1jie4。dui4yu2 jing1ming2 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 lai2 shuo1，zhe4li3 kan1cheng1 gai3tou2huan4mian4、chong2qi3 ren2sheng1 de5 jue2jia1 zhi1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3shi4 shi4qing5 bing4fei1 zhe4me5 jian3dan1……"

msgid ""
"The years have not been kind, but his features are instantly recognizable. Despite his age, he still has the strong chin and high cheekbones that you remember from Green Winters' DVD.\n"
"\n"
"This is Dr. Adrian Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"岁月不饶人​，​但​他​的​面容​依然​令人​过目难忘​。​尽管​年事已高​，​他​那​坚毅​的​下巴​和​高耸​的​颧骨​仍​与​格林​·​温特斯​的​DVD​中​的​形象​如出一辙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这位​正是​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。\n"
"\n"
"sui4 yue4 bu4 rao2 ren2，dan4 ta1 de5 mian4rong2 yi1ran2 ling4ren2 guo4 mu4 nan2 wang4。jin3guan3 nian2shi4yi3gao1，ta1 na4 jian1yi4 de5 xia4ba5 he4 gao1song3 de5 quan2gu3 reng2 yu4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 DVD zhong4 de5 xing2xiang4 ru2chu1yi1zhe2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4wei4 zheng4shi4 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"The young researcher peers at you through bloodshot eyes. She can't be much "
"older than twenty-five, but heavy worry lines etch her brow, and her mouth "
"is set in a frown."
msgstr ""
"年轻​的​研究员​用​充血​的​眼睛​盯​着​你​。​她​顶多​二十五岁​出头​，​但​浓重​的​忧虑​纹刻​在​她​额头​上​，​嘴角​紧​抿​成​一抹​愁容​。\n"
"nian2qing1 de5 yan2jiu1yuan2 yong4 chong1xue4 de5 yan3jing5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。ta1 ding3duo1 er4 shi2 wu3 sui4 chu1tou2，dan4 nong2zhong4 de5 you1lu:4 wen2 ke4 zai4 ta1 e2tou2 shang4，zui3jiao3 jin3 min3 cheng2 yi1 ma1 chou2 rong2。"

msgid ""
"The, uh, the cram... it's 150 nuyen.\n"
"\n"
"That's what Kroner charges. Go ahead and ask him if you don't believe me."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​“​超感​”​的​价格​……​是​150​新円​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​克​罗纳​卖​这个​价​。​你​要是​不​信​，​就​自己​去​那边​问​他​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，“chao1 gan3” de5 jia4ge2……shi4 150 xin1 yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 ke4 luo2na4 mai4 zhe4ge5 jia4。ni3 yao4shi5 bu4 xin4，jiu4 zi4ji3 qu4 na4bian5 wen4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"The... uh... the second floor has mostly been converted into makeshift apartments for people to live in.\n"
"\n"
"A gang squats up there. The Magnifikers. Dangerous people - I'd stay away from 'em."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​二楼​基本​被​改成​了​临时​公寓​供​人​居住​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有个​帮派​盘踞​在​那里​。​伟术​帮​。​那些​都​是​危险​分子​，​我​建议​你​离​他们​远​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……er4 lou2 ji1ben3 bei4 gai3cheng2 le5 lin2shi2 gong1yu4 gong1 ren2 ju1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ge4 bang1pai4 pan2ju4 zai4 na4li5。wei3 shu4 bang1。na4xie1 dou1 shi4 wei1xian3 fen1zi3，wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 li2 ta1men5 yuan3 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"The... yes! Peace will be known, and brought to the land!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Phil takes off running in the direction of the records room.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"那个​……​对​！​和平​将​为​世人​所知​，​并​将​降临​这片​土地​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​菲尔​朝​档案室​方向​跑​去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5……dui4！he2ping2 jiang1 wei2 shi4ren2 suo3zhi1，bing4 jiang1 jiang4lin2 zhe4 pian1 tu3di4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fei1 er3 chao2 dang4 an4 shi4 fang1xiang4 pao2 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Their business models work well together. The Ring tricks idiots into taking"
" out predatory loans, and Grinder shows up to collect."
msgstr ""
"他们​的​商业模式​相辅相成​：​兰​登堡​帮​诱骗​蠢货​们​签订​掠夺性​贷款​，​而​“​绞肉机​”​负责​催收​。\n"
"ta1men5 de5 shang1ye4mo2shi4 xiang1fu3xiang1cheng2：lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 you4pian4 chun3huo4 men5 qian1ding4 lu:e4 duo2 xing4 dai4kuan3，er2“jiao3rou4ji1” fu4ze2 cui1shou1。"

msgid ""
"Their names, for one. You know my team, I'd like to know something about "
"yours."
msgstr ""
"比如​他们​的​名字​。​你​知道​我​的​团队​，​所以​我​也​想​了解​下​你​这边​。\n"
"bi3ru2 ta1men5 de5 ming2zi5。ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 de5 tuan2dui4，suo3yi3 wo3 ye3 xiang3 liao3jie3 xia4 ni3 zhe4bian1。"

msgid ""
"Their security team is going to be waiting for us, Dietrich. That Audran bastard is going to be waiting for us.\n"
"\n"
"And even if we make it past them, we're going to have to deal with the dragon in the basement."
msgstr ""
"他们​的​安保​团队​会​做好​万全​准备​，​迪​特里​希​。​奥​德兰​那个​混蛋​肯定​也​在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就算​我们​闯过​他们​这关​，​还​得​对付​地下室​里​的​那头​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 de5 an1bao3 tuan2dui4 hui4 zuo4 hao3 wan4quan2 zhun3bei4，Di2te4li3xi1。Ao4de2lan2 na4ge5 hun2dan4 ken3ding4 ye3 zai4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4suan4 wo3men5 chuang3guo4 ta1men5 zhe4 guan1，hai2 de2 dui4fu5 di4xia4shi4 li3 de5 na4 tou2 ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"Their... \"ideology\" is loosely based on Neo-Communist movements from the past. In truth, I think that they just copied a few pages from an old Red Army Faction handbill without ever bothering to learn what they meant. \n"
"\n"
"For all their rhetoric, the Arbeiters are just another street gang. They shout for the sake of shouting. There's no real conviction there."
msgstr ""
"他们​所谓​的​……​“​意识形态​”​不过​是​粗浅​地​借鉴​了​历史​上​新​共产主义​运动​的​某些​元素​。​说到底​，​我​认为​他们​不过​是从​红军​派​的​旧​传单​里​抄​了​几页​内容​，​却​从未​花心思​去​了解​它们​的​含义​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​满口​高谈阔论​，​但​工人​帮​终究​只是​个​街头​帮派​。​他们​呐喊​只是​单纯​的​宣泄​情绪​，​根本​谈不上​什么​真正​的​信念​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 suo3wei4 de5……“yi4shi2xing2tai4” bu4guo4 shi4 cu1qian3 de5 jie4jian4 le5 li4shi3 shang4 xin1 gong4chan3zhu3yi4 yun4dong4 de5 mou3xie1 yuan2su4。shuo1dao4di3，wo3 ren4wei2 ta1men5 bu4guo4 shi4 cong2 hong2jun1 pai4 de5 jiu4 chuan2dan1 li3 chao1 le5 ji1 xie2 nei4rong2，que4 cong2wei4 hua1xin1si1 qu4 liao3jie3 ta1men5 de5 han2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 man3kou3 gao1tan2kuo4lun4，dan4 gong1ren2 bang1 zhong1jiu1 zhi3shi4 ge4 jie1tou2 bang1pai4。ta1men5 na4han3 zhi3shi4 dan1chun2 de5 xuan1xie4 qing2xu4，gen1ben3 tan2bu5shang4 shen2me5 zhen1zheng4 de5 xin4nian4。"

msgid ""
"Then Hoffmann broke cover and gave away our position.\n"
"\n"
"And after that, all hell broke loose."
msgstr ""
"然而​，​霍夫曼​却​暴露​了​自己​，​连带​着​我们​所有人​都​被​敌人​发现​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至此​，​一切​都​乱套​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ran2er2，huo4fu1man4 que4 bao4lu4 le5 zi4ji3，lian2dai4 zhao2 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 bei4 di2ren2 fa1xian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4ci3，yi1qie4 dou1 luan4tao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Then I am free...\n"
"\n"
"yes?\n"
"\n"
"iamfree?\n"
"\n"
"tellme saythewords"
msgstr ""
"那么​我​自由​了​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​自由​了​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​告诉​我​说​出来\n"
"\n"
"na4me5 wo3 zi4you2 le5……\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zi4you2 le5？\n"
"\n"
"gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 chu1lai2"

msgid "Then I want to stay. Please. This is the only place I know."
msgstr ""
"这样的话​我​想​留下​。​求求​你​。​我​只​熟悉​这个​地方​。\n"
"zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4 wo3 xiang3 liu2xia4。qiu2 qiu2 ni3。wo3 zhi3 shu2xi1 zhe4ge5 di4fang1。"

msgid "Then I would choose to be your friend."
msgstr ""
"那​我​选择​做​你​的​朋友​。\n"
"na4 wo3 xuan3ze2 zuo4 ni3 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid "Then I'm afraid that I can't accept their offer."
msgstr ""
"那​恐怕​我​不能​接受​。\n"
"na4 kong3pa4 wo3 bu4neng2 jie1shou4。"

msgid ""
"Then all of this is your fault! The Jubuthons, the threat to my beloved's "
"soul... all of it!"
msgstr ""
"那么​这​一切都是​你​的​错​！​朱布松​的​入侵​，​我​所​爱​之​人​的​灵魂​受到​的​威胁​……​全都​是​你​的​错​！\n"
"na4me5 zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4！zhu1 bu4 song1 de5 ru4qin1，wo3 suo3 ai4 zhi1 ren2 de5 ling2hun2 shou4dao4 de5 wei1xie2……quan2dou1 shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4！"

msgid ""
"Then don't.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away from you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on. Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"那​就​别​想​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转身​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​。​继续前进​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 bie4 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1。ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid "Then get back out of my face and go do it."
msgstr ""
"那​就​赶紧​从​我​前面​滚开​，​玩​你​的​去​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 gan3jin3 cong2 wo3 qian2mian4 gun3kai1，wan2 ni3 de5 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Then go to your father, and beseech him to rally his elf-troops southward! "
"For if TITONIUS REX falls, LIGHTNINGHOLD will fall! And Lightninghold WILL "
"NOT FALL!"
msgstr ""
"那​就​去​找​你​的​父亲​，​恳求​他​召集​他​的​精灵​部队​向南​进军​！​因为​如果​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​倒下​，​闪电​堡​也​会​随之​陷落​！​但​闪电​堡​绝不会​陷落​！\n"
"na4 jiu4 qu4 zhao3 ni3 de5 fu4qin1，ken3qiu2 ta1 zhao4ji2 ta1 de5 jing1ling2 bu4dui4 xiang4 nan2 jin4jun1！yin1wei4 ru2guo3 Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 dao3xia4，shan3dian4 pu4 ye3 hui4 sui2zhi1 xian4luo4！dan4 shan3dian4 pu4 jue2 bu4 hui4 xian4luo4！"

msgid "Then listen up. You might learn something."
msgstr ""
"那​就​好好​听​着​，​或许​你​还​能​从​中学​到​点​什么​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 hao3hao3 ting1 zhao2，huo4xu3 ni3 hai2 neng2 cong2 zhong1xue2 dao4 dian3 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Then maybe you could explain it to me? Maybe if you could answer my "
"questions, I'd be able to see the light."
msgstr ""
"那​或许​你​能​向​我​解释​清楚​？​说不定​你​回答​了​我​的​问题​，​也​能​让​我​恍然​顿悟​呢​。\n"
"na4 huo4xu3 ni3 neng2 xiang4 wo3 jie3shi4 qing1chu5？shuo1bu5ding4 ni3 hui2da2 le5 wo3 de5 wen4ti2，ye3 neng2 rang4 wo3 huang3ran2 dun4wu4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Then perhaps you could appoint a vassal to undertake this quest for you. You"
" have worthy peasants at your disposal, do you not?"
msgstr ""
"或许​你​可以​任命​一位​家臣​来​完成​这项​任务​。​你​有​忠诚​的​臣民​，​不是​吗​？\n"
"huo4xu3 ni3 ke3yi3 ren4ming4 yi1 wei4 jia1chen2 lai2 wan2cheng2 zhe4 xiang4 ren4wu5。ni3 you3 zhong1cheng2 de5 chen2min2，bu4shi4 ma5？"

msgid "Then please, continue working. We need to find that man."
msgstr ""
"那​就​请​继续​努力​。​我们​需要​找到​那个​人​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 qing3 ji4xu4 nu3li4。wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhao3dao4 na4ge5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Then she punches it, projecting her consciousness into cyberspace, her "
"fingers harmonizing in the smooth rhythmic staccato that only an expert "
"decker can achieve."
msgstr ""
"她​拍​下​按键​，​把​意识​发射​进赛​博​空间​，​同时​以​手指​敲打​着​键盘​，​像是​在​弹奏​流畅​而​富有​节奏​的​跳音​。​只有​大师级​的​碟​客才​做​得到​这点​。\n"
"ta1 pai1 xia4 an4jian4，ba3 yi4shi2 fa1she4 jin4 sai4 bo2 kong1jian1，tong2shi2 yi3 shou3zhi3 qiao1da3 zhao2 jian4pan2，xiang4 shi4 zai4 tan2zou4 liu2chang4 er2 fu4you3 jie2zou4 de5 tiao4 yin1。zhi3you3 dai4 shi1 ji2 de5 die2 ke4 cai2 zuo4 de2dao4 zhe4 dian3。"

msgid "Then swear."
msgstr ""
"那​就​发誓​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 fa1shi4。"

msgid "Then tell me what happened to your team."
msgstr ""
"那​就​跟​我​说​说​你​之前​的​小队​发生​了​什么​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 gen1 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 ni3 zhi1qian2 de5 xiao3 dui4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid "Then tell me what you need, \"Frau Müller.\""
msgstr ""
"但​说​无妨​，​“​穆勒​女士​”​。\n"
"dan4 shuo1 wu2fang2，“mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4”。"

msgid ""
"Then the light exits her eyes and she falls to the floor of her tiny cell, "
"her body limp and lifeless."
msgstr ""
"然后​，​光​从​她​的​眼睛​里​消失​，​她​倒​在​狭小​的​牢房​地板​上​，​身体​软绵绵​的​，​再​无生气​。\n"
"ran2hou4，guang1 cong2 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 li3 xiao1shi1，ta1 dao3 zai4 xia2xiao3 de5 lao2fang2 di4ban3 shang4，shen1ti3 ruan3mian2mian2 de5，zai4 wu2 sheng1 qi4。"

msgid ""
"Then the light fades from her eyes, and her body goes slack.\n"
"\n"
"In death, her expression is almost peaceful."
msgstr ""
"然后​，​她​的​眼睛​里​失去​了​光彩​，​身体​也​变得​瘫软​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​死亡​时​，​她​的​表情​几乎​是​平静​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4，ta1 de5 yan3jing5 li3 shi1qu4 le5 guang1cai3，shen1ti3 ye3 bian4de5 tan1ruan3。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 si3wang2 shi2，ta1 de5 biao3qing2 ji1hu1 shi4 ping2jing4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Then the project will reach completion, and nobody in your line of work will ever be safe again.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I will leave my contact information with your Herr Amsel in case you change your mind. I hope that you'll reconsider... for all of our sakes."
msgstr ""
"那么​这个​项目​就​将​完成​，​你们​这​行​再也​没人能​独善其身​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​把​联系方式​留给​阿姆​泽尔​先生​，​以防​你​改变​主意​。​我​希望​你​能​重新考虑​……​这是​为了​我们​所有人​好​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5 zhe4ge5 xiang4mu4 jiu4 jiang1 wan2cheng2，ni3men5 zhe4 xing2 zai4ye3 mei2 ren2 neng2 du2shan4qi2shen1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 ba3 lian2xi4fang1shi4 liu2gei3 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5，yi3fang2 ni3 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5。wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 chong2 xin1 kao3 lu:4……zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Then their new leader took over. Calls himself \"Trithemius,\" but I remember when he was just a skinny little prick named Uri.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He lets out a derisive snort.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I should've kept a better eye on him, I guess... should've stomped him flat when he started putting on airs. Would've saved everyone a heap of trouble."
msgstr ""
"然后​他们​的​新​首领​接管​了​伟术​帮​。​他​自称​“​特​里特​米​乌斯​”​，​但​我​记得​他​以前​只是​个​瘦弱​的​小混蛋​，​叫​尤里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​发出​一声​轻蔑​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​早​该​多​留意​他些​……​在​他​刚​开始​摆架子​时​就​狠狠​教训​他​一顿​。​那样​就​能​省去​大家​不少​麻烦​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1men5 de5 xin1 shou3ling3 jie1guan3 le5 wei3 shu4 bang1。ta1 zi4cheng1“te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1”，dan4 wo3 ji4de5 ta1 yi3qian2 zhi3shi4 ge4 shou4ruo4 de5 xiao3 hun4 dan4，jiao4 You2li3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 qing1mie4 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zao3 gai1 duo1 liu2yi4 ta1 xie1……zai4 ta1 gang1 kai1shi3 bai3jia4zi5 shi2 jiu4 hen3hen3 jiao4xun5 ta1 yi1 dun4。na4yang4 jiu4 neng2 sheng3qu4 da4jia1 bu4shao3 ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Then they'd go find some poor elf or dwarf, stomp the living shit out of "
"him, and drown him in the Neckar."
msgstr ""
"然后​他们​就​会​去​找​某个​可怜​的​精灵​或​矮​人​，​把​他​打个​半死​，​再​扔进​内卡河​淹死​。\n"
"ran2hou4 ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 qu4 zhao3 mou3 ge4 ke3lian2 de5 jing1ling2 huo4 ai3 ren2，ba3 ta1 da3 ge4 ban4si3，zai4 reng1 jin4 nei4ka3he2 yan1si3。"

msgid "Then we need to stop him before he ca--"
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​必须​阻止​他​得逞​—​—\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ta1 de2cheng3 — —"

msgid "Then we storm in there and take it from her. You ready to do this?"
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​冲进去​，​从​她​手里​抢走​钥匙​。​你​准备​好了吗​？\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 chong1 jin4 qu4，cong2 ta1 shou3li3 qiang3zou3 yao4shi5。ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Then we will *handle* the situation as it arises."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​等​问题​真的​发生​之后​再​*​处理​*​问题​。\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 deng3 wen4ti2 zhen1de5 fa1sheng1 zhi1hou4 zai4*chu3li3*wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Then we'll hunt him down later. For now, we purify the spirit and save the "
"cultists. Nobody deserves to suffer through what this place does to people."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​等​之后​再​去​追捕​他​。​现在​，​我们​要​净化​这个​精魂​，​救出​那些​教徒​。​没​人​应该​遭受​这个​地方​对​人们​所​做​的​折磨​。\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 deng3 zhi1hou4 zai4 qu4 zhui1bu3 ta1。xian4zai4，wo3men5 yao4 jing4hua4 zhe4ge5 jing1hun2，jiu4chu1 na4xie1 jiao4tu2。mei2 ren2 ying1gai1 zao1shou4 zhe4ge5 di4fang1 dui4 ren2men5 suo3 zuo4 de5 zhe2mo2。"

msgid "Then what *are* you like?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​是​什么​人​？\n"
"na4 ni3 shi4 shen2me5 ren2？"

msgid "Then what were you doing here?"
msgstr ""
"那​你们​在​这里​做​什么​？\n"
"na4 ni3men5 zai4 zhe4li3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Then why did she keep it?"
msgstr ""
"那​她​为什么​还​留​着​它​？\n"
"na4 ta1 wei4shen2me5 hai2 liu2 zhao2 ta1？"

msgid "Then why haven't you left?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​为什么​还​不​离开​？\n"
"na4 ni3 wei4shen2me5 hai2 bu4 li2kai1？"

msgid ""
"Then you don't belong in the shadows.\n"
"\n"
"This is not a business for bleeding hearts or free-thinkers. The people at the top of the ladder are the decision-makers; people like you and me are nothing more than convenient sets of hands."
msgstr ""
"那么​你​就​不​属于​这​一行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​行业​不​适合​心软​的​人​或​爱​胡思乱想​的​人​。​天梯​顶端​的​人才​是​决策者​；​像​你​我​这样​的​人​不过​是​趁手​的​劳动力​罢了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5 ni3 jiu4 bu4 shu3yu2 zhe4 yi1xing2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hang2ye4 bu4 shi4he2 xin1ruan3 de5 ren2 huo4 ai4 hu2si1luan4xiang3 de5 ren2。tian1ti1 ding3duan1 de5 ren2cai2 shi4 jue2ce4zhe3 ； xiang4 ni3 wo3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2 bu4guo4 shi4 chen4shou3 de5 lao2dong4li4 ba4le5。"

msgid ""
"Then you need a second in command.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, Monika. Put someone in charge, and let's get on with the mission."
msgstr ""
"那​你​就​得​有​个​二把手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​快点​，​莫妮卡​。​你​选​个人​来​管事​，​然后​我们​继续​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 jiu4 de2 you3 ge4 er4ba3shou3。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4dian3，Mo4ni1ka3。ni3 xuan3 ge4ren2 lai2 guan3 shi4，ran2hou4 wo3men5 ji4xu4 ren4wu5。"

msgid "Then you should see my point. You're acting like a dragon."
msgstr ""
"那​你​就​应该​懂​我​的​意思​。​你​现在​的​行为​和​巨龙​没有​两样​。\n"
"na4 ni3 jiu4 ying1gai1 dong3 wo3 de5 yi4si5。ni3 xian4zai4 de5 xing2wei2 he4 ju4long2 mei2you3 liang3yang4。"

msgid ""
"Then you'd better get comfortable with the idea of dying in here, because this building is coming down.\n"
"\n"
"When we get back home, we can figure this out. I'll *help* you figure it out, okay? But we need to get moving, and we need to do it fast."
msgstr ""
"那​你​最好​做好​在​这儿​等​死​的​准备​，​因为​这栋​楼​马上​就要​塌​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​回到​家​，​再​慢慢​解决​这​事​。​我会​*​帮​你​*​解决​的​，​行​吗​？​但​我们​现在​必须​立刻​离开​这里​，​而且​要​快​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 zui4hao3 zuo4 hao3 zai4 zhe4r5 deng3 si3 de5 zhun3bei4，yin1wei4 zhe4 dong4 lou2 ma3shang4 jiu4yao4 ta1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 hui2dao4 jia1，zai4 man4man4 jie3jue2 zhe4 shi4。wo3 hui4*bang1 ni3*jie3jue2 de5，xing2 ma5？dan4 wo3men5 xian4zai4 bi4xu1 li4ke4 li2kai1 zhe4li3，er2qie3 yao4 kuai4。"

msgid "Then you'll want to talk to Aljernon. He's just around the corner."
msgstr ""
"那​你​去​找​阿尔杰​农吧​。​他​就​在​转角​那边​。\n"
"na4 ni3 qu4 zhao3 E1er3jie2nong2 ba1。ta1 jiu4 zai4 zhuan3jiao3 na4bian5。"

msgid ""
"Then you're a fool.\n"
"\n"
"Out in the field, nothing will kill you faster than losing the respect of your team. I’d remember that if I were you."
msgstr ""
"那​你​就是​个​傻瓜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​战场​上​，​如果​连​你​手底下​的​人​都​不再​尊重​你​，​那​你​的​死期​就​不远​了​。​我​建议​你​把​这个​牢牢记​在​心里​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 jiu4shi4 ge4 sha3gua1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhan4chang3 shang4，ru2guo3 lian2 ni3 shou3 de5 xia4 de5 ren2 dou1 bu4zai4 zun1zhong4 ni3，na4 ni3 de5 si3qi1 jiu4 bu4 yuan3 le5。wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 ba3 zhe4ge5 lao2 lao2 ji4 zai4 xin1li5。"

msgid ""
"Then you've come to the right place!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gestures at the terminal in front of you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please feel free to browse our catalog. We have a *huge* stock of performance-enhancing augmentations to make *you* into the person you've always dreamed you could be!"
msgstr ""
"那​你​就​来​对​地方​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​比划​了​一下​你​前面​的​终端​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​尽管​看看​我们​的​商品目录​。​我们​备有​*​海量​*​的​性能​增强​装置​，​帮助​*​你​*​蜕变​为​梦寐以求​的​理想​自我​！\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 jiu4 lai2 dui4 di4fang1 le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4 ni3 qian2mian4 de5 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 jin3guan3 kan4kan5 wo3men5 de5 shang1 pin3 mu4 lu4。wo3men5 bei4 you3*hai3liang4*de5 xing4neng2 zeng1qiang2 zhuang1zhi4，bang1zhu4*ni3*tui4bian4 wei2 meng4mei4yi3qiu2 de5 li3xiang3 zi4wo3！"

msgid ""
"Then, without warning, the entire chamber fills with a blinding light. You "
"can see nothing. All goes eerily quiet."
msgstr ""
"随后​突然​间​，​整个​房间​被​刺眼​的​光芒​填满​。​你​什么​也​看不见​。​一切​变得​诡异​地​安静​。\n"
"sui2hou4 tu1ran2 jian1，zheng3ge4 fang2jian1 bei4 ci4yan3 de5 guang1mang2 tian2man3。ni3 shen2me5 ye3 kan4bu5jian4。yi1qie4 bian4de5 gui3yi4 de5 an1jing4。"

msgid ""
"There ain't nobody above me, buddy. So drop it.\n"
"\n"
"Closed is closed, and that's what we are."
msgstr ""
"我​上头​没​别人​了​，​伙计​。​放弃​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​关​了​就是​关​了​，​现在​就​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shang4tou2 mei2 bie2ren5 le5，huo3ji5。fang4qi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"guan1 le5 jiu4shi4 guan1 le5，xian4zai4 jiu4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid "There are a few spares to choose from."
msgstr ""
"有​几种​不同​的​武器​供​你​挑选​。\n"
"you3 ji1 zhong3 bu4tong2 de5 wu3qi4 gong1 ni3 tiao1xuan3。"

msgid "There are a few things that I want to say."
msgstr ""
"我​倒​是​有点​话​想​说​。\n"
"wo3 dao3 shi4 you3dian3 hua4 xiang3 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"There are a lot of crazy things going on in this world. That doesn't mean "
"they're not real."
msgstr ""
"这个​世界​上​发生​着​许多​荒唐​的​事情​，​但​这​并​不​意味着​它们​不​真实​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 shang4 fa1sheng1 zhao2 xu3duo1 huang1tang2 de5 shi4qing5，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 ta1men5 bu4 zhen1shi2。"

msgid ""
"There are a lot of wonderful people out there, and they won't make you jump "
"through the hoops that this one has."
msgstr ""
"世界​上​还有​很多​很​好​的​人​，​你​为什么​非要​在​这​一棵树上吊死​呢​。\n"
"shi4jie4 shang4 hai2you3 hen3 duo1 hen3 hao3 de5 ren2，ni3 wei4shen2me5 fei1yao4 zai4 zhe4 yi1 ke1 shu4 shang4 diao4 si3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"There are crates here - a lot of crates, all scattered in various stages of disorganization. It looks as though your delivery is just one of many that this branch of Humanis has received.\n"
"\n"
"The smugglers unload the cargo from their vans with practiced efficiency. The whole operation feels polished and professional, but you can tell that Maxim is nervous. You can see it in his eyes."
msgstr ""
"数目​惊人​的​板条箱​被​杂乱无章​地​堆放​在​院子​各处​。​看来​你们​这批​货物​不过​是​人类​至上​主义者​这​处分​部​收到​的​众多​货物​其中​之一​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走私者​们​熟练地​从​货车​上​卸下​货物​。​整个​行动​看似​井井有条​，​专业​可靠​，​但​你​能​看出​马克西姆​正​紧张不安​。​他​的​眼神​出卖​了​他​。\n"
"\n"
"shu4mu4 jing1ren2 de5 ban3tiao2xiang1 bei4 za2luan4wu2zhang1 de5 dui1fang4 zai4 yuan4zi5 ge4chu4。kan4lai5 ni3men5 zhe4 pi1 huo4wu4 bu4guo4 shi4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zhe4 chu3fen4 bu4 shou1dao4 de5 zhong4duo1 huo4wu4 qi2zhong1 zhi1yi1。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 si1 zhe3 men5 shu2 lian4 de5 cong2 huo4che1 shang4 xie4xia4 huo4wu4。zheng3ge4 xing2dong4 kan4si4 jing3jing3you3tiao2，zhuan1ye4 ke3kao4，dan4 ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 zheng1 jin3 zhang1 bu4 an1。ta1 de5 yan3shen2 chu1mai4 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"There are crates here - a lot of crates, all scattered in various stages of disorganization. It looks as though your delivery is just one of many that this branch of Humanis has received.\n"
"\n"
"The smugglers unload the cargo from their vans with practiced efficiency. The whole operation feels polished and professional, but you can tell that the smugglers are nervous. You can see it in their eyes."
msgstr ""
"数目​惊人​的​板条箱​被​杂乱无章​地​堆放​在​院子​各处​。​看来​你们​这批​货物​不过​是​人类​至上​主义者​这​处分​部​收到​的​众多​货物​其中​之一​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走私者​们​熟练地​从​货车​上​卸下​货物​。​整个​行动​看似​井井有条​，​专业​可靠​，​但​你​能​看出​他们​正​紧张不安​。​他们​的​眼神​出卖​了​自己​。\n"
"\n"
"shu4mu4 jing1ren2 de5 ban3tiao2xiang1 bei4 za2luan4wu2zhang1 de5 dui1fang4 zai4 yuan4zi5 ge4chu4。kan4lai5 ni3men5 zhe4 pi1 huo4wu4 bu4guo4 shi4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zhe4 chu3fen4 bu4 shou1dao4 de5 zhong4duo1 huo4wu4 qi2zhong1 zhi1yi1。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 si1 zhe3 men5 shu2 lian4 de5 cong2 huo4che1 shang4 xie4xia4 huo4wu4。zheng3ge4 xing2dong4 kan4si4 jing3jing3you3tiao2，zhuan1ye4 ke3kao4，dan4 ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1men5 zheng1 jin3 zhang1 bu4 an1。ta1men5 de5 yan3shen2 chu1mai4 le5 zi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"There are floors above us, of course. But you're unlikely to find anything of value up there... just the domiciles of the faithful, and the Magnifikers who have taken charge of the building. \n"
"\n"
"I would steer clear of them, if I were you."
msgstr ""
"我们​上面​确实​还有​几层​，​但​你​不太可能​在​那儿​找到​什么​有​价值​的​东西​……​只有​信徒​们​的​居所​，​以及​接管​这栋​建筑​的​伟术​帮​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​换作​是​我​的话​，​就​离​他们​越远​越​好​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shang4mian4 que4shi2 hai2you3 ji1 ceng2，dan4 ni3 bu4 tai4 ke3 neng2 zai4 na4r5 zhao3dao4 shen2me5 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 dong1xi1……zhi3you3 xin4tu2 men5 de5 ju1suo3，yi3ji2 jie1guan3 zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4 de5 wei3 shu4 bang1。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 li2 ta1men5 yue4 yuan3 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"There are four numbered vents shown on the scan of the diagram as well as an area marked “Intake Bypass”. This seems to be a reference diagram with no compass directions or other landmarks.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Vent 1 is labeled “Firing Range”.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Vent 1 is next to Vent 2 which is labeled “Bulk Storage”.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Vent 3 is next to Vent 2 has the label “CIC”.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Off a bit from the others is Vent 4 labeled “Administration”.\n"
"\n"
"“Intake Bypass” is square at the bottom of the diagram off by itself."
msgstr ""
"扫描​图上​显示​有​四个​编号​的​通风口​，​还有​一个​标记​为​“​进气​旁路​”​的​区域​。​这​似乎​只是​一张​参考​图​，​没有​指南针​方向​或​其他​地标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​通风口​1​标记​为​“​射击场​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​通风口​1​紧邻​通风口​2​，​通风口​2​标记​为​“​大容量​存储器​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​通风口​3​紧邻​通风口​2​，​标记​为​“​CIC​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​与​其他​通风口​略有不同​的​是​标有​“​管理​”​的​通风口​4​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​进气​旁通​”​在​图​的​底部​单独​呈​方形​。\n"
"\n"
"sao3miao2 tu2 shang4 xian3shi4 you3 si4 ge4 bian1hao4 de5 tong1feng1kou3，hai2you3 yi1ge5 biao1ji4 wei2“jin4 qi4 pang2lu4” de5 qu1yu4。zhe4 si4hu1 zhi3shi4 yi1 zhang1 can1kao3 tu2，mei2you3 zhi3nan2zhen1 fang1xiang4 huo4 qi2ta1 di4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"tong1feng1kou3 1 biao1ji4 wei2“she4 ji1 chang2”。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"tong1feng1kou3 1 jin3lin2 tong1feng1kou3 2，tong1feng1kou3 2 biao1ji4 wei2“da4rong2liang4 cun2chu3qi4”。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"tong1feng1kou3 3 jin3lin2 tong1feng1kou3 2，biao1ji4 wei2“CIC”。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"yu4 qi2ta1 tong1feng1kou3 lu:e4 you3 bu4 tong2 de5 shi4 biao1 you3“guan3li3” de5 tong1feng1kou3 4。\n"
"\n"
"“jin4 qi4 pang2 tong1” zai4 tu2 de5 di3bu4 dan1du2 cheng2 fang1xing2。"

msgid ""
"There are ghost stories spreading around the decker community. Stories about deckers disappearing, and then showing up again later, but... *wrong,* somehow.\n"
"\n"
"Scary stuff, and I'm starting to think it's true."
msgstr ""
"碟客​社区​流传​着​一些​关于​鬼魂​的​故事​。​有​一些​人​失踪​了​，​后来​又​出现​了​，​但是​……​出​了​*​问题​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​很​可怕​，​而​我​开始​觉得​这是​真的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"die2 ke4 she4qu1 liu2chuan2 zhao2 yi1xie1 guan1yu2 gui3hun2 de5 gu4shi4。you3 yi1xie1 ren2 shi1zong1 le5，hou4lai2 you4 chu1xian4 le5，dan4shi4……chu1 le5*wen4ti2*。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hen3 ke3pa4，er2 wo3 kai1shi3 jue2de5 zhe4 shi4 zhen1de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"There are ghost stories spreading around the decker community. Stories about deckers disappearing, and then showing up again later, but... *wrong,* somehow.\n"
"\n"
"Scary stuff, and I'm starting to think that it's true."
msgstr ""
"碟客​社区​流传​着​一些​关于​鬼魂​的​故事​。​有​一些​人​失踪​了​，​后来​又​出现​了​，​但是​……​出​了​*​问题​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​很​可怕​，​而​我​开始​觉得​这是​真的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"die2 ke4 she4qu1 liu2chuan2 zhao2 yi1xie1 guan1yu2 gui3hun2 de5 gu4shi4。you3 yi1xie1 ren2 shi1zong1 le5，hou4lai2 you4 chu1xian4 le5，dan4shi4……chu1 le5*wen4ti2*。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hen3 ke3pa4，er2 wo3 kai1shi3 jue2de5 zhe4 shi4 zhen1de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"There are incoming Knight Errant reinforcements, have your decker lock them "
"out while you escape with the rigger."
msgstr ""
"游侠​骑士​的​增援部队​正在​赶来​，​让​你​的​碟​客​把​他们​封锁​在​外面​，​好​让​你们​带​着​机师​一起​逃走​。\n"
"you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 zeng1 yuan2 bu4 dui4 zheng4zai4 gan3lai2，rang4 ni3 de5 die2 ke4 ba3 ta1men5 feng1suo3 zai4 wai4mian4，hao3 rang4 ni3men5 dai4 zhao2 ji1shi1 yi1qi3 tao2zou3。"

msgid "There are kids who need looking after..."
msgstr ""
"有些​孩子​需要​照料​……\n"
"you3Xie1hai2zi5 xu1yao4 zhao4liao4……"

msgid "There are no simple jobs. Ever. That’s part of the gig."
msgstr ""
"从来​就​没有​什么​简单​的​差事​。​这​就是​工作​的​一部分​。\n"
"cong2lai2 jiu4 mei2you3 shen2me5 jian3dan1 de5 cha4shi4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4 de5 yi1bu4fen5。"

msgid ""
"There are other ways of saying “Thank you.” Ways that involve nuyen and free"
" trinkets."
msgstr ""
"表达​谢意​的​方式​还有​许多种​。​比方说​新円​，​或者​免费​的​奇物​。\n"
"biao3da2 xie4yi4 de5 fang1shi4 hai2you3 xu3 duo1 zhong3。bi3fang5shuo1 xin1 yuan2，huo4zhe3 mian3fei4 de5 ji1 wu4。"

msgid "There are parents who lost children..."
msgstr ""
"有些​父母​失去​了​他们​的​孩子​……\n"
"you3xie1 fu4mu3 shi1qu4 le5 ta1men5 de5 hai2zi5……"

msgid ""
"There are plenty of nice suits still hanging on the racks, but nothing "
"suited for a day in your line of work."
msgstr ""
"衣架​上​还​挂​着​不少​漂亮​的​西装​，​但​没有​一件​适合​你​从事​的​工作​。\n"
"yi1jia4 shang4 hai2 gua4 zhao2 bu4shao3 piao4liang5 de5 xi1zhuang1，dan4 mei2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4he2 ni3 cong2shi4 de5 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"There are quite a few dragons out there, Doc. *Powerful* dragons. I don't "
"think they'll support your plan."
msgstr ""
"世界​上​有​不少​巨龙​，​博士​。​而且​非常​*​强大​*​。​我​觉得​他们​不会​支持​你​的​计划​。\n"
"shi4jie4 shang4 you3 bu4shao3 ju4long2，bo2shi4。er2qie3 fei1chang2*qiang2da4*。wo3 jue2de5 ta1men5 bu4hui4 zhi1chi2 ni3 de5 ji4hua4。"

msgid ""
"There are seventeen great dragons in the world today. \n"
"\n"
"Seventeen ancient wyrms, millennia old, slowly dividing the planet into seventeen piles of gold to nest upon. \n"
"\n"
"In front of our eyes."
msgstr ""
"如今​世界​上​一共​有​十七​头​巨龙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​十七​头​古老​的​爬虫​，​历经​千年​，​缓缓​将​这颗​星球​分割​成​十七​堆​黄金​，​作为​自己​的​巢穴​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​这​一切​就​发生​在​我们​眼前​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 shi4jie4 shang4 yi1gong4 you3 shi2qi1 tou2 ju4long2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi2qi1 tou2 gu3lao3 de5 pa2chong2，li4jing1 qian1nian2，huan3huan3 jiang1 zhe4 ke1 xing1qiu2 fen1ge1 cheng2 shi2qi1 dui1 huang2jin1，zuo4wei2 zi4ji3 de5 chao2xue2。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4 yi1qie4 jiu4 fa1sheng1 zai4 wo3men5 yan3qian2。"

msgid ""
"There are some notes written in the margins of this page, but you don't recognize the language.\n"
"\n"
"The only word you can make out is \"computer,\"  written several times."
msgstr ""
"这​一页​的​空白处​写​了​一些​注释​，​但​你​不​认识​这些​语言​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​唯一​能​辨认出​的​单词​是​“​计算机​”​，​写​了​好几遍​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1 xie2 de5 kong1 bai2 chu3 xie3 le5 yi1xie1 zhu4shi4，dan4 ni3 bu4 ren4shi5 zhe4xie1 yu3yan2。\n"
"\n"
"wei2yi1 neng2 bian4 ren4 chu1 de5 dan1ci2 shi4“ji4suan4ji1”，xie3 le5 hao3 ji1 bian4。"

msgid ""
"There are too many records here to sort through quickly. \n"
"\n"
"A quick scan reveals the following details:"
msgstr ""
"记录​实在​太​多​，​短时间​内​无法​整理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​快速​浏览​了​一遍​，​发现​以下​细节​：\n"
"\n"
"ji4lu4 shi2zai4 tai4 duo1，duan3shi2jian1 nei4 wu2fa3 zheng3li3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kuai4su4 liu2lan3 le5 yi1bian4，fa1xian4 yi3xia4 xi4jie2："

msgid "There are trying times ahead. Seen it before. Too many times before..."
msgstr ""
"以后​的​日子​会​很​艰难​。​我​以前​就​经历​过​。​或者说​已经​太​多次​了​……\n"
"yi3hou4 de5 ri4zi5 hui4 hen3 jian1nan2。wo3 yi3qian2 jiu4 jing1li4 guo4。huo4 zhe3 shuo1 yi3jing1 tai4 duo1ci4 le5……"

msgid ""
"There are worse things out there than dragons, Vauclair. Exterminating one "
"threat could open the door to another."
msgstr ""
"世界​上​有​比​巨龙​更​可怕​的​东西​存在​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​消灭​了​一个​威胁​，​可能​会​进而​导致​其他​威胁​的​出现​。\n"
"shi4jie4 shang4 you3 bi3 ju4long2 geng1 ke3pa4 de5 dong1xi1 cun2zai4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 xiao1mie4 le5 yi1ge5 wei1xie2，ke3neng2 hui4 jin4er2 dao3zhi4 qi2ta1 wei1xie2 de5 chu1xian4。"

msgid ""
"There aren't many people left from the old days. Far too few. And $(l.name)...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Well, $(l.he) was always the best of 'em."
msgstr ""
"如今​还​健在​的​旧​相识​实在​不多​了​。​但​$(l.name)​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​$(l.he)​始终​是​他们​之中​最出色​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 hai2 jian4zai4 de5 jiu4 xiang1shi2 shi2zai4 bu4 duo1 le5。dan4 $(l.name)……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……$(l.he) shi3zhong1 shi4 ta1men5 zhi1zhong1 zui4 chu1 se4 de5。"

msgid "There have already been whispers."
msgstr ""
"周围​已经​有人​传​闲话​了​。\n"
"zhou1wei2 yi3jing1 you3ren2 chuan2 xian2hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"There have been more incidents. With the vendors, Samuel's people, even the "
"children."
msgstr ""
"有​更​多​的​事情​发生​。​包括​小贩​，​塞缪尔​的​手下​，​甚至​还​有些​孩子​们​。\n"
"you3 geng1 duo1 de5 shi4qing5 fa1sheng1。bao1kuo4 xiao3fan4，sai4miu4er3 de5 shou3xia4，shen4zhi4 hai2 you3Xie1hai2zi5 men5。"

msgid ""
"There is a brief pause. Then you hear the distinctive clicking sound of a maglock disengaging.\n"
"\n"
"The vault door begins to slide open."
msgstr ""
"短暂​停顿​后​，​你​听到​磁力锁​解除​时​特有​的​咔嗒​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​保险库​大门​开始​缓缓​打开​。\n"
"\n"
"duan3zan4 ting2dun4 hou4，ni3 ting1dao4 ci2li4suo3 jie3chu2 shi2 te4you3 de5 ka1da1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"bao3 xian3 ku4 da4men2 kai1shi3 huan3huan3 da3kai1。"

msgid "There is a bright flash, and the spirit is gone."
msgstr ""
"一道​亮光​闪过​，​精魂​消失​了​。\n"
"yi1dao4 liang4guang1 shan3guo4，jing1hun2 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid "There is a click as Ezkibel disconnects the line."
msgstr ""
"咔哒​一声​，​埃兹​基​贝尔​挂断​了​。\n"
"ka3 da1 yi1sheng1，Ai1ziji1bei4er3 gua4duan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"There is a fine line between justice and vengeance. But right now, I don't "
"much care to make a distinction. Do whatever you must."
msgstr ""
"正义​与​复仇​之间​仅​有​一线​之隔​。​但​眼下​，​我​并​不在意​这​其中​的​区别​。​做​你​该​做​的​事​吧​。\n"
"zheng4yi4 yu4 fu4chou2 zhi1jian1 jin3 you3 yi1xian4 zhi1 ge2。dan4 yan3xia4，wo3 bing4 bu4zai4yi4 zhe4 qi2zhong1 de5 qu1bie2。zuo4 ni3 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"There is a good-sized crack in the floor with a small amount of light "
"shining through."
msgstr ""
"地板​上​有​一道​不小​的​裂缝​，​有​少量​光线​透进来​。\n"
"di4ban3 shang4 you3 yi1dao4 bu4 xiao3 de5 lie4feng4，you3 shao3liang4 guang1xian4 tou4 jin4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"There is a grinding sound from the DVD tray, and Green Winters' image appears on the screen. There is an eager look on his face.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2054-10-12."
msgstr ""
"DVD​托盘​发出​磨擦​声​，​格林​·​温特斯​的​图像​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​他​的​脸上​露出​急切​的​神情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2054​-​10​-​12​。\n"
"\n"
"DVD tuo1pan2 fa1chu1 mo2ca1 sheng1，ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 tu2xiang4 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 ji2qie4 de5 shen2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2054-10-12。"

msgid "There is a hand-written note sitting on the table."
msgstr ""
"桌子​上​有​一张​手写​的​便条​。\n"
"zhuo1zi5 shang4 you3 yi1 zhang1 shou3xie3 de5 bian4tiao2。"

msgid ""
"There is a large red \"1\" painted on this footlocker.\n"
"\n"
"A numeric keypad awaits your input."
msgstr ""
"这个​储物柜​上画​着​一个​巨大​的​红色​数字​“​1​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一处​数字键盘​正等待​你​的​输入​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 chu3wu4gui4 shang4 hua4 zhao2 yi1ge5 ju4da4 de5 hong2se4 shu4zi4“1”。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 chu3 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2 zheng1 deng3 dai1 ni3 de5 shu1ru4。"

msgid ""
"There is a large red \"2\" painted on this footlocker.\n"
"\n"
"A numeric keypad awaits your input."
msgstr ""
"这个​储物柜​上画​着​一个​巨大​的​红色​数字​“​2​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一处​数字键盘​正等待​你​的​输入​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 chu3wu4gui4 shang4 hua4 zhao2 yi1ge5 ju4da4 de5 hong2se4 shu4zi4“2”。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 chu3 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2 zheng1 deng3 dai1 ni3 de5 shu1ru4。"

msgid ""
"There is a large red \"3\" painted on this footlocker.\n"
"\n"
"A numeric keypad awaits your input."
msgstr ""
"这个​储物柜​上画​着​一个​巨大​的​红色​数字​“​3​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一处​数字键盘​正等待​你​的​输入​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 chu3wu4gui4 shang4 hua4 zhao2 yi1ge5 ju4da4 de5 hong2se4 shu4zi4“3”。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 chu3 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2 zheng1 deng3 dai1 ni3 de5 shu1ru4。"

msgid ""
"There is a large red \"4\" painted on this footlocker.\n"
"\n"
"A numeric keypad awaits your input."
msgstr ""
"这个​储物柜​上画​着​一个​巨大​的​红色​数字​“​4​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一处​数字键盘​正等待​你​的​输入​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 chu3wu4gui4 shang4 hua4 zhao2 yi1ge5 ju4da4 de5 hong2se4 shu4zi4“4”。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 chu3 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2 zheng1 deng3 dai1 ni3 de5 shu1ru4。"

msgid ""
"There is a large red \"5\" painted on this footlocker.\n"
"\n"
"A numeric keypad awaits your input."
msgstr ""
"这个​储物柜​上画​着​一个​巨大​的​红色​数字​“​5​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一处​数字键盘​正等待​你​的​输入​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 chu3wu4gui4 shang4 hua4 zhao2 yi1ge5 ju4da4 de5 hong2se4 shu4zi4“5”。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 chu3 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2 zheng1 deng3 dai1 ni3 de5 shu1ru4。"

msgid ""
"There is a large red \"6\" painted on this footlocker.\n"
"\n"
"A numeric keypad awaits your input."
msgstr ""
"这个​储物柜​上画​着​一个​巨大​的​红色​数字​“​6​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一处​数字键盘​正等待​你​的​输入​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 chu3wu4gui4 shang4 hua4 zhao2 yi1ge5 ju4da4 de5 hong2se4 shu4zi4“6”。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 chu3 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2 zheng1 deng3 dai1 ni3 de5 shu1ru4。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause as Eiger returns her attention to the smoldering body. \n"
"\n"
"Her expression is difficult to read, but her confidence has obviously been shaken."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​将​目光​移回​那具​冒烟​的​尸体​。​沉默​良久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​表情​难以捉摸​，​但​自信​显然​已经​动摇​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 jiang1 mu4guang1 yi2 hui2 na4 ju4 mao4yan1 de5 shi1ti3。chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 biao3qing2 nan2yi3zhuo1mo1，dan4 zi4xin4 xian3ran2 yi3jing1 dong4yao2。"

msgid "There is a long pause."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, she turns her PDA so that you can look at the screen."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​她​将​PDA​屏幕​转向​你​的​方向​。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ta1 jiang1 PDA ping2mu4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3 de5 fang1xiang4。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause.\n"
"\n"
"Hasenkamp stares at you, processing what you've just told him. He opens his mouth to speak, then closes it again."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈森​坎普​的​双眼​盯​着​你​，​思考​着​你​刚刚​说​的话​。​他​张嘴​想要​说些​什么​，​但​没有​说​出口​。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 shuang1yan3 ding1 zhao2 ni3，si1kao3 zhao2 ni3 gang1gang5 shuo1 de5hua4。ta1 zhang1zui3 xiang3yao4 shuo1 xie1 shen2me5，dan4 mei2you3 shuo1 chu1kou3。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause.\n"
"\n"
"In lieu of responding, Philip takes another bite of meat and gnashes at it with his teeth."
msgstr ""
"沉默​许久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​菲利普​没有​回应​，​而是​又​咬了一口​手中​的​肉​，​用力​地​咀嚼​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 xu3jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"fei1li4pu3 mei2you3 hui2ying4，er2shi4 you4 yao3 le5 yi1 kou3 shou3 zhong4 de5 rou4，yong4li4 de5 ju3jue2 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause. \n"
"\n"
"Finally, Heimerich steps forward."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​海​默里​希站​了​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，Hai3mo4 li3 xi1 zhan4 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid "There is a long pause. Eventually, Eiger turns to face you."
msgstr ""
"停顿​良久​。​最终​，​艾格尔​转头​看向​你​。\n"
"ting2dun4 liang2jiu3。zui4zhong1，Ai4ge2er3 zhuan3tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。"

msgid "There is a long pause. Eventually, the Engineer looks away."
msgstr ""
"停顿​良久​。​最终​，​工程师​移开​了​目光​。\n"
"ting2dun4 liang2jiu3。zui4zhong1，gong1cheng2shi1 yi2kai1 le5 mu4guang1。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause. Ezkibel tries on another smile, but it falls away "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​埃兹​基​贝尔​又​试​着​笑​了​一下​，​但​笑容​很快​就​消失​了​。\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。Ai1ziji1bei4er3 you4 shi4 zhao2 xiao4 le5 yi1xia4，dan4 xiao4rong2 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid "There is a long pause. Finally, Blitz breaks the silence."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​最终​，​布里​茨​先​开口​了​。\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。zui4zhong1，Bu4li3ci2 xian1 kai1kou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause. Finally, Blitz speaks again. His voice is strained."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​终于​，​布里​茨​再次​开口​。​他​的​声音​显得​很​吃力​。\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。zhong1yu2，Bu4li3ci2 zai4ci4 kai1kou3。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 xian3de5 hen3 chi1li4。"

msgid "There is a long pause. Finally, the door unlocks with a click."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​终于​，​门​咔哒​一声​解锁​了​。\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。zhong1yu2，men2 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid "There is a long pause. Finally, you hear a sigh."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​最后​，​你​听到​一声​叹息​。\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。zui4hou4，ni3 ting1dao4 yi1sheng1 tan4xi1。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause. From the tortured look on his face, you can tell that the man is struggling to decide whether or not to continue speaking. \n"
"\n"
"Eventually, he does."
msgstr ""
"他​停顿​了​很​长时间​。​从​他​脸上​痛苦​的​表情​可以​看出​，​他​正在​挣扎​着​决定​是否​继续​说话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​他​还是​继续​说道​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ting2dun4 le5 hen3 zhang3 shi2 jian1。cong2 ta1 lian3 shang4 tong4ku3 de5 biao3qing2 ke3yi3 kan4chu1，ta1 zheng4zai4 zheng1zha2 zhao2 jue2ding4 shi4fou3 ji4xu4 shuo1hua4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ta1 hai2shi5 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。"

msgid ""
"There is a long pause. Glory looks to be at war with herself.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, she turns her head away and spits out a reply."
msgstr ""
"沉默​良久​。​格洛丽​似乎​正在​与​自己​内心​抗争​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​她​转过​头去​，​吐​出​一句​话​作为​回答​。\n"
"\n"
"chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。Ge2luo4li2 si4hu1 zheng4zai4 yu4 zi4ji3 nei4xin1 kang4zheng1。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 qu4，tu3 chu1 yi1ju4 hua4 zuo4wei2 hui2da2。"

msgid ""
"There is a man here in the Kreuzbasar, a Turk named Altuğ Burakgazi. He owns a little soykaf shop just down the way called Cafe Cezve.\n"
"\n"
"This man is also a purveyor of information. I have done business with him from time to time."
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​这里​有个​土耳其人​，​名叫​奥图​伊​·​布拉加​齐​。​他​在​下面​那条​街上​开​了​家​小豆​咖馆​，​就​叫​“​来​一壶​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这人​也​是​个​情报​商​。​我​偶尔​会​跟​他​做点​生意​。\n"
"\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhe4li3 you3 ge4 tu3er3qi2ren2，ming2jiao4 ao4 tu2 yi1 · bu4 la1 jia1 qi2。ta1 zai4 xia4mian4 na4 tiao2 jie1shang5 kai1 le5 jia1 xiao3dou4 ka1 guan3，jiu4 jiao4“lai2 yi1 hu2”。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ren2 ye3 shi4 ge4 qing2bao4 shang1。wo3 ou3er3 hui4 gen1 ta1 zuo4 dian3 sheng1yi4。"

msgid ""
"There is a moment of silence as the group absorbs everything that you've "
"just read."
msgstr ""
"队员​们​消化​着​你​刚刚​读完​的​内容​，​现场​陷入​一片​寂静​。\n"
"dui4yuan2 men5 xiao1hua4 zhao2 ni3 gang1gang5 dou4 wan2 de5 nei4rong2，xian4chang3 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。"

msgid ""
"There is a moment of silence as the group pauses to consider your words.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, Eiger steps forward."
msgstr ""
"队员​们​沉默​了​片刻​，​思索​着​你​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​艾格尔站​了​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yuan2 men5 chen2mo4 le5 pian4ke4，si1suo3 zhao2 ni3 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，Ai4ge2er3 zhan4 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"There is a moment of silence as the group pauses to consider your words.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, Glory steps forward."
msgstr ""
"队员​们​沉默​了​片刻​，​思索​着​你​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​格洛丽站​了​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yuan2 men5 chen2mo4 le5 pian4ke4，si1suo3 zhao2 ni3 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，Ge2luo4li2 zhan4 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"There is a moment of silence as the group processes Glory's suggestion.\n"
"\n"
"Before anyone can speak, the simulacrum cuts back in."
msgstr ""
"一片​寂静​。​众人​纷纷​消化​着​格洛丽​的​观点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这时​，​拟​像​又​先​一步​开口​了​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。zhong4ren2 fen1fen1 xiao1hua4 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 de5 guan1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4shi2，ni3 xiang4 you4 xian1 yi1 bu4 kai1kou3 le5。"

msgid "There is a moment of silence as the team absorbs what it just saw."
msgstr ""
"周围​一片​寂静​。​队员​们​仍​在​消化​自己​刚才​看到​的​画面​。\n"
"zhou1wei2 yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。dui4yuan2 men5 reng2 zai4 xiao1hua4 zi4ji3 gang1cai2 kan4dao4 de5 hua4mian4。"

msgid ""
"There is a moment of silence.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, Eiger speaks."
msgstr ""
"片刻​沉默​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​艾格尔​开口​了​。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 chen2mo4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，Ai4ge2er3 kai1kou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"There is a panel in the floor...\n"
"\n"
"...behind you...\n"
"\n"
"...drop down into the guts of this place.\n"
"\n"
"thegutsfindtheguts\n"
"\n"
"by my body the machine break it break it break it "
msgstr ""
"地板​上​有​个​面板​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​在​你们​后面​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​向下​一直​到​这​地方​的​核心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​核心​找到​核心​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​身体​机器​破坏​它​破坏​它​破坏​它\n"
"\n"
"di4ban3 shang4 you3 ge4 mian4ban3……\n"
"\n"
"……zai4 ni3men5 hou4mian5……\n"
"\n"
"……xiang4xia4 yi1zhi2 dao4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 he2xin1。\n"
"\n"
"he2xin1 zhao3dao4 he2xin1 \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 shen1ti3 ji1qi4 po4huai4 ta1 po4huai4 ta1 po4huai4 ta1"

msgid ""
"There is a series of staccato clicks as the connection is made.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Ezkibel's voice pours into your ear. It's thick with a blend of irritation and insolence."
msgstr ""
"连接​完成​，​发出​一连串​咔哒​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​夹杂着​恼怒​和​傲慢​的​声音​传入​你​的​耳朵​。\n"
"\n"
"lian2jie1 wan2cheng2，fa1chu1 yi1lian2chuan4 ka3 da1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 jia1 za2 zhao2 nao3nu4 he4 ao4man4 de5 sheng1yin1 chuan2ru4 ni3 de5 er3duo5。"

msgid ""
"There is a small, locked safe installed in the wall behind the painting. A "
"keypad mounted to its base glows invitingly."
msgstr ""
"装饰画​后面​的​墙​里​嵌​着​一个​上​了​锁​的​小型​保险箱​，​上面​的​键盘​闪烁着​诱人​的​微光​。\n"
"zhuang1 shi4 hua4 hou4mian5 de5 qiang2 li3 kan3 zhao2 yi1ge5 shang4 le5 suo3 de5 xiao3xing2 bao3xian3xiang1，shang4mian4 de5 jian4pan2 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 you4ren2 de5 wei1guang1。"

msgid "There is another burst of static, and your commlink goes silent."
msgstr ""
"又​是​一阵​杂音​，​你​的​通讯​链​没​了​动静​。\n"
"you4 shi4 yi1zhen4 za2yin1，ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 mei2 le5 dong4jing4。"

msgid ""
"There is another click, and the drone falls silent. \n"
"\n"
"It tilts forward slightly; a subtle motion, but one loaded with malice."
msgstr ""
"又​一声​轻响​，​无人机​突然​静默​下来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​微微​向前​倾斜​；​一个​细微​的​动作​，​却​蕴含着​恶意​。\n"
"\n"
"you4 yi1sheng1 qing1 xiang3，wu2ren2ji1 tu1ran2 jing4mo4 xia4lai5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 wei1wei1 xiang4qian2 qing1xie2 ； yi1ge5 xi4wei1 de5 dong4zuo4，que4 yun4 han2 zhao2 e4yi4。"

msgid ""
"There is another telltale crackle of static from your commlink.\n"
"\n"
"Blitz's voice fills your ear. His tone is impossibly smug."
msgstr ""
"通讯器​里​又​传来​一声​暴露​行踪​的​噼啪​杂音​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​布里​茨​的​声音​在​你​耳际​响起​。​他​的​语气​充满​了​沾沾自喜​。\n"
"\n"
"tong1 xun4 qi4 li3 you4 chuan2lai2 yi1sheng1 bao4lu4 xing2zong1 de5 pi1pa1 za2yin1。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4 ni3 er3 ji4 xiang3qi3。ta1 de5 yu3qi4 chong1man3 le5 zhan1zhan1zi4xi3。"

msgid ""
"There is beauty here; the interplay of green and gold swirling around you is breathtaking, intoxicating. Your thoughts become sluggish.\n"
"\n"
"It feels like you've been drugged."
msgstr ""
"此处​美不胜收​；​环绕​你​的​绿色​与​金色​交织​共舞​，​令人​屏息​，​令人​沉醉​。​思绪​逐渐​迟钝​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​仿佛​你​被​灌下​了​迷药​。\n"
"\n"
"ci3chu4 mei3bu4sheng4shou1 ； huan2rao4 ni3 de5 lu:4se4 yu4 jin1se4 jiao1zhi1 gong4 wu3，ling4ren2 bing3xi1，ling4ren2 chen2zui4。si1xu4 zhu2jian4 chi2dun4。\n"
"\n"
"fang3fu2 ni3 bei4 guan4 xia4 le5 mi2yao4。"

msgid ""
"There is great power in blood, $(l.name). It can be used as a focus, a battery, or a bridge. The blood mages of Tenochtitlan are widely feared for their proficiency in abusing this power.\n"
"\n"
"This project... this \"Bloodline\"... seeks to abuse the power of blood in a novel - and horrifying - way."
msgstr ""
"血液​中​蕴藏​着​强大​的​力量​，​$(l.name)​。​它​可以​被​用作​法器​、​电池​或是​桥梁​。​特诺奇​蒂特兰​的​血​法师​们​正​因为​善于​滥用​这种​力量​而广受​畏惧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​“​血脉​”​项目​……​企图​以​一种​新颖​而​骇人​的​方式​滥用​血液​的​力量​。\n"
"\n"
"xue4ye4 zhong4 yun4cang2 zhao2 qiang2da4 de5 li4liang5，$(l.name)。ta1 ke3yi3 bei4 yong4zuo4 fa3 qi4、dian4chi2 huo4shi4 qiao2liang2。te4 nuo4 ji1 di4 te4 lan2 de5 xie3 fa3shi1 men5 zheng1 yin1wei4 shan4yu2 lan4yong4 zhe4zhong3 li4liang5 er2 yan3 shou4 wei4ju4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4……qi3tu2 yi3 yi1zhong3 xin1ying3 er2 hai4ren2 de5 fang1shi4 lan4yong4 xue4ye4 de5 li4liang5。"

msgid "There is large crack that runs right though this section of wall."
msgstr ""
"这里​有​一道​贯穿​整个​墙面​的​巨大​裂缝​。\n"
"zhe4li3 you3 yi1dao4 guan4chuan1 zheng3ge4 qiang2mian4 de5 ju4da4 lie4feng4。"

msgid ""
"There is little to talk about.\n"
"\n"
"You were sent here to tie up loose ends. Instead, we catch you trying to sneak your target out the front door.\n"
"\n"
"Disappointing. Not surprising, mind you. But disappointing all the same."
msgstr ""
"没什么​可​商量​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​任务​是​来​此​解决​后患​，​而​我们​却​撞见​你​试图​将​目标​偷偷​送​出​大门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​令人​失望​。​虽说​倒​也​算不上​意外​，​但​依旧​令人​失望​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5 ke3 shang1liang5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ren4wu5 shi4 lai2 ci3 jie3jue2 hou4 huan4，er2 wo3men5 que4 zhuang4jian4 ni3 shi4tu2 jiang1 mu4biao1 tou1tou1 song4 chu1 da4men2。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ling4ren2 shi1wang4。sui1shuo1 dao3 ye3 suan4 bu4 shang4 yi4wai4，dan4 yi1jiu4 ling4ren2 shi1wang4。"

msgid ""
"There is more to it than that, woman, and you know it. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He bows to you with a flourish.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye, $(l.name). We will meet again, I think... though not for a long, long time."
msgstr ""
"远不止​于​此​，​女人​。​这​你​是​知道​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​夸张​地向​你​鞠​了​一躬​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​了​，​$(l.name)​。​我​想​我们​会​再见​的​……​不过​是​在​很久很久​之后​。\n"
"\n"
"yuan3 bu4 zhi3 yu2 ci3，nu:3ren2。zhe4 ni3 shi4 zhi1dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kua1zhang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 ju1 le5 yi1 gong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 le5，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 hui4 zai4jian4 de5……bu4guo4 shi4 zai4 hen3 jiu3 hen3 jiu3 zhi1hou4。"

msgid ""
"There is no \"catch\", I assure you! It is time-consuming and a bit tedious."
" Nothing more. "
msgstr ""
"没有​什么​“​陷阱​”​，​我​保证​！​只是​费点​时间​，​也许​还​有点​无聊​，​没​别的​了​。\n"
"mei2you3 shen2me5“xian4jing3”，wo3 bao3zheng4！zhi3shi4 fei4 dian3 shi2jian1，ye3xu3 hai2 you3dian3 wu2liao2，mei2 bie2de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"There is no data to hint at what the ultimate goal of the project might be. "
"But the potential applications for a technique like this are almost "
"limitless."
msgstr ""
"目前​没有​数据​表明​该项​目的​最终目标​是​什么​。​但​这种​技术​潜在​的​应用领域​几乎​是​无限​的​。\n"
"mu4qian2 mei2you3 shu4ju4 biao3ming2 gai1 xiang4 mu4di4 zui4 zhong1 mu4 biao1 shi4 shen2me5。dan4 zhe4zhong3 ji4shu4 qian2zai4 de5 ying1 yong4 ling3 yu4 ji1hu1 shi4 wu2xian4 de5。"

msgid "There is nothing here."
msgstr ""
"这里​空无一物​。\n"
"zhe4li3 kong1 wu2 yi1 wu4。"

msgid ""
"There is one other gift that I can give you: the gift of understanding.\n"
"\n"
"There is something that you must know, $(l.name). A great and terrible truth that lies hidden from mortal eyes."
msgstr ""
"我​还有​一份​礼物​能​赠予​你​：​认知​的​礼物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​你​必须​明白​，​有​某个​伟大​而​可怕​的​真相​，​隐藏​在​凡人​的​视线​之外​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 yi1 fen4 li3wu4 neng2 zeng4yu3 ni3：ren4zhi1 de5 li3wu4。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 bi4xu1 ming2bai5，you3 mou3 ge4 wei3da4 er2 ke3pa4 de5 zhen1xiang4，yin3cang2 zai4 fan2ren2 de5 shi4xian4 zhi1wai4。"

msgid ""
"There isn't much to say.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses to study you for a moment before continuing.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"没什么​好​说​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​下​，​端详​了​你​一会儿​，​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5 hao3 shuo1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 xia4，duan1xiang2 le5 ni3 yi1hui4r5，you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "There was a bit more to it than that, but yeah."
msgstr ""
"倒​也​没​那么​简单​，​不过​差不离​吧​。\n"
"dao3 ye3 mei2 na4me5 jian3dan1，bu4guo4 cha4bu4li2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"There was a courier drone back there, but it self-destructed. Whatever it "
"was carrying went up with it."
msgstr ""
"有​一架​快递​无人机​，​但​它​自毁​了​，​里面​的​东西​也​跟着​完蛋​了​。\n"
"you3 yi1 jia4 kuai4di4 wu2ren2ji1，dan4 ta1 zi4hui3 le5，li3mian4 de5 dong1xi1 ye3 gen1zhe5 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"There was a genuine attraction between Marta and me, I think. \n"
"\n"
"But I also think that a lot of my affection for her came from the fact that she was the first person in years to give a damn about me.\n"
"\n"
"She cared, and I loved her for that."
msgstr ""
"我​想​，​玛​尔塔​和​我​之间​确实​存在​着​某种​真实​的​吸引力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​觉得​，​我​对​她​的​许多​好感​其实​源于​她​是​我​多年​以来​遇到​的​第一个​真正​关心​我​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​关心​我​，​而​我​也​因此​爱上​了​她​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3，Ma3er3ta3 he4 wo3 zhi1jian1 que4shi2 cun2zai4 zhao2 mou3zhong3 zhen1shi2 de5 xi1yin3li4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 jue2de5，wo3 dui4 ta1 de5 xu3duo1 hao3gan3 qi2shi2 yuan2yu2 ta1 shi4 wo3 duo1nian2 yi3lai2 yu4dao4 de5 di4 yi1 ge4 zhen1zheng4 guan1xin1 wo3 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 guan1xin1 wo3，er2 wo3 ye3 yin1ci3 ai4shang4 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"There was a member of Echo Mirage named Alice. Alice Haeffner. She died back in 2029, fighting the Crash Virus.\n"
"\n"
"Rumor has it, she still exists in the Matrix. Still calls herself Alice, too."
msgstr ""
"“​回声​幻影​”​组织​曾​有​一名​成员​名叫​爱丽丝​。​爱丽丝​·​海夫纳​。​她​在​2029​年​对抗​崩溃​病毒​时​身亡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​据​传闻​，​她​依然​存在​于​矩阵​之中​，​并且​至今​仍​自称​爱丽丝​。\n"
"\n"
"“hui2sheng1 huan4ying3” zu3zhi1 ceng2 you3 yi1 ming2 cheng2yuan2 ming2jiao4 ai4li4si1。ai4li4si1 · hai3 fu1 na4。ta1 zai4 2029 nian2 dui4kang4 beng1kui4 bing4du2 shi2 shen1wang2。\n"
"\n"
"ju4 chuan2wen2，ta1 yi1ran2 cun2zai4 yu2 ju3zhen4 zhi1zhong1，bing4qie3 zhi4jin1 reng2 zi4cheng1 ai4li4si1。"

msgid ""
"There was a time I thought as you do. But I had made a vow to never make war"
" again. Yet, if you hadn't been here to do so, we would all be dead."
msgstr ""
"曾经​我​也​像​你​这么​想过​。​但​我​曾​发誓​再也不会​发动战争​。​然而​，​如果​不是​你​在​这里​的话​，​我们​都​会​死​。\n"
"ceng2jing1 wo3 ye3 xiang4 ni3 zhe4me5 xiang3 guo4。dan4 wo3 ceng2 fa1shi4 zai4 ye3 bu4 hui4 fa1 dong4 zhan4 zheng1。ran2er2，ru2guo3 bu4shi4 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 de5hua4，wo3men5 dou1 hui4 si3。"

msgid ""
"There was a time when Harrow played with luring younger children here, but he found them to be more trouble than they were worth.\n"
"\n"
"The younger the child, the more likely that someone might come looking for them."
msgstr ""
"曾经​有​一段时间​，​哈罗​也​引诱​过​年龄​更​小​的​孩子​，​但​他​最后​发现​这些​孩子​惹​的​麻烦​远远​超过​了​他们​的​价值​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​孩子​年纪​越小​，​越有​可能​有人​来​找​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"ceng2jing1 you3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1，ha1luo2 ye3 yin3you4 guo4 nian2ling2 geng1 xiao3 de5 hai2zi5，dan4 ta1 zui4hou4 fa1xian4 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5 re3 de5 ma2fan5 yuan3yuan3 chao1guo4 le5 ta1men5 de5 jia4zhi2。\n"
"\n"
"hai2zi5 nian2ji4 yue4 xiao3，yue4 you3 ke3neng2 you3ren2 lai2 zhao3 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"There was an amoeboid thing with many tongues terrorizing the skies above Buenos Aires... they tried to use helicopter gunships to shoot it down. They eventually succeeded, but not without destroying half of their own city in the process.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Bad business."
msgstr ""
"有次​布宜诺斯艾利斯​上空​出现​过​一个​长着​许多​舌头​的​变形虫​状​怪物​肆虐​天际​……​他们​试图用​武装​直升机​将​其​击落​。​最终​虽​成功​消灭​了​怪物​，​却​在​过程​中​摧毁​了​半座​城市​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​糟糕透顶​。\n"
"\n"
"you3ci4 bu4yi2nuo4si1ai4li4si1 shang4kong1 chu1xian4 guo4 yi1ge5 zhang3 zhao2 xu3duo1 she2tou5 de5 bian4xing2chong2 zhuang4 guai4wu5 si4nu:e4 tian1ji4……ta1men5 shi4 tu2 yong4 wu3zhuang1 zhi2sheng1ji1 jiang1 qi2 ji1luo4。zui4zhong1 sui1 cheng2gong1 xiao1mie4 le5 guai4wu5，que4 zai4 guo4cheng2 zhong4 cui1hui3 le5 ban4 zuo4 cheng2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zao1 gao1 tou4 ding3。"

msgid "There was an error when trying to delete your Content Pack."
msgstr ""
"删除​内容​包时​发生​错误​。\n"
"shan1chu2 nei4rong2 bao1 shi2 fa1sheng1 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"There was an error when trying to launch the editor. Please try restarting "
"the game."
msgstr ""
"启动​编辑器​时​发生​错误​。​请​尝试​重新启动​游戏​。\n"
"qi3dong4 bian1ji2qi4 shi2 fa1sheng1 cuo4wu4。qing3 chang2shi4 chong2xin1qi3dong4 you2xi4。"

msgid ""
"There was an error when trying to publish your Content Pack to Steam "
"Workshop."
msgstr ""
"在​Steam​创意​工坊​上​发布​内容​包时​发生​错误​。\n"
"zai4 Steam chuang4yi4 gong1fang2 shang4 fa1bu4 nei4rong2 bao1 shi2 fa1sheng1 cuo4wu4。"

msgid "There was an error when trying to unpublish your Content Pack."
msgstr ""
"取消​发布​内容​包时​发生​错误​。\n"
"qu3xiao1 fa1bu4 nei4rong2 bao1 shi2 fa1sheng1 cuo4wu4。"

msgid "There was an error when trying to unsubscribe from this Content Pack."
msgstr ""
"取消​订阅​内容​包时​发生​错误​。\n"
"qu3xiao1 ding4yue4 nei4rong2 bao1 shi2 fa1sheng1 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"There was no need.\n"
"\n"
"I handled the problem myself."
msgstr ""
"没有​这个​必要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​亲自​解决​了​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 zhe4ge5 bi4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qin1zi4 jie3jue2 le5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"There was no reason, Marta. None that matters.\n"
"\n"
"I should know. I'm the one who killed him."
msgstr ""
"没有​原因​，​玛​尔塔​。​那件事​没什么​特别​的​原因​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​的​。​因为​是​我​杀​了​他​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 yuan2yin1，Ma3er3ta3。na4 jian4 shi4 mei2shen2me5 te4bie2 de5 yuan2yin1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 de5。yin1wei4 shi4 wo3 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"There was nothin' about that run that didn't disgust me. What they did to that troll...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shudders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It wasn't right, boss. On any level."
msgstr ""
"这趟​差事​的​每个​细节​都​让​我​恶心​。​一​想到​他们​对​那个​巨魔​所​做​的​事​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​打了个​寒颤​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不对劲​，​老大​。​不管​从​哪个​方面​来说​都​不​对​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 de5 mei3ge4 xi4jie2 dou1 rang4 wo3 e3xin1。yi1 xiang3dao4 ta1men5 dui4 na4ge5 ju4mo2 suo3 zuo4 de5 shi4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da3 le5 ge4 han2 chan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4dui4jin4，lao3da4。bu4guan3 cong2 na3ge5 fang1mian4 lai2 shuo1 dou1 bu4 dui4。"

msgid ""
"There was nothing left. Just smoldering wreckage, and this dense cloud of black, oily smoke. And the stench in the air... God, that smell.\n"
"\n"
"It smelled like roasting meat."
msgstr ""
"什么​都​没有​了​。​只​剩下​燃烧​的​残骸​，​和​一团​浓密​的​黑色​油烟​。​空气​中​弥漫着​恶臭​……​老天​，​那股​气味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​烤肉​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3 le5。zhi3 sheng4xia4 ran2shao1 de5 can2hai2，he4 yi1 tuan2 nong2mi4 de5 hei1se4 you2yan1。kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 e4chou4……lao3tian1，na4 gu3 qi4wei4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 kao3rou4 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"There was some... disagreement... within the group.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But that's settled now, yes?"
msgstr ""
"他们​内部​……​有​一些​……​分歧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​向​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​现在​都​解决​了​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 nei4bu4……you3 yi1xie1……fen1qi2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 xiang4 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 xian4zai4 dou1 jie3jue2 le5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"There was something connected to Glory's essence, a metaphysical tether stitched into the fabric of her soul. It reminded you of a leash.\n"
"\n"
"You can't say for sure what was holding the other end, but whatever it was, it was enormous and ancient and cruel. And you can't shake the feeling that, as you looked into it, it stared back at you."
msgstr ""
"有​某种​东西​与​格洛丽​的​精华​相连​，​一条​形而上​的​缰绳​缝合​在​她​灵魂​的​织锦​中​，​仿佛​把​她​当作​刍狗​一样​束缚​着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​无法​确定​另一端​系着​什么​，​但​无论是​什么​，​都​庞大​、​古老​且​残酷​。​而​你​始终​无法​摆脱​这种​感觉​—​—​当​你​凝视​它​时​，​它​也​在​凝视着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 mou3zhong3 dong1xi1 yu4 Ge2luo4li2 de5 jing1hua2 xiang1lian2，yi1 tiao2 xing2 er2 shang4 de5 jiang1sheng2 feng2he2 zai4 ta1 ling2hun2 de5 zhi1jin3 zhong4，fang3fu2 ba3 ta1 dang4zuo4 chu2gou3 yi1yang4 shu4fu4 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wu2fa3 que4ding4 ling4 yi1 duan1 xi4 zhao2 shen2me5，dan4 wu2 lun2 shi4 shen2me5，dou1 pang2da4、gu3lao3 qie3 can2ku4。er2 ni3 shi3zhong1 wu2fa3 bai3tuo1 zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2——dang1 ni3 ning2shi4 ta1 shi2，ta1 ye3 zai4 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"There were eight of us. Two commando squads, working together as a single unit.\n"
"\n"
"Schmidt and Lange were combat deckers. Wolff was our rigger and combat engineer. Fischer handled demolitions, Braun was a medic, and the rest of us - Metzger, Krüger and myself - were weapons experts."
msgstr ""
"我们​一共​有​八个​人​，​分成​两个​战斗​小队​，​共同​执行​任务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​施密特​和​朗格​是​战斗​碟客​，​沃尔夫​是​机师​兼​战斗​工程师​。​费舍尔​负责​爆破​，​布朗​是​队医​。​而​剩下​的​三个​人​—​—​梅茨​格​、​克鲁格​和​我​—​—​是​武器专家​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi1gong4 you3 ba1 ge4 ren2，fen1cheng2 liang3 ge4 zhan4dou4 xiao3 dui4，gong4tong2 zhi2xing2 ren4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"shi1mi4te4 he4 lang3 ge2 shi4 zhan4dou4 die2 ke4，wo4er3fu1 shi4 ji1shi1 jian1 zhan4dou4 gong1cheng2shi1。fei4she3er3 fu4ze2 bao4po4，bu4lang3 shi4 dui4 yi1。er2 sheng4xia4 de5 san1 ge4 ren2——mei2 ci2 ge2、ke4 lu3 ge2 he4 wo3——shi4 wu3 qi4 zhuan1 jia1。"

msgid ""
"There were extenuating circumstances. If he didn't do what he did, his "
"family would've paid the price."
msgstr ""
"他​也​有​苦衷​。​如果​他​不​那么​做​的话​，​他​的​家人​就​得​遭殃​。\n"
"ta1 ye3 you3 ku3zhong1。ru2guo3 ta1 bu4 na4me5 zuo4 de5hua4，ta1 de5 jia1ren2 jiu4 de2 zao1yang1。"

msgid "There will be no procedure, Audran."
msgstr ""
"没有​什么​程序​了​，​奥​德兰​。\n"
"mei2you3 shen2me5 cheng2xu4 le5，Ao4de2lan2。"

msgid "There you go, you dumb ox. Do something useful for a change."
msgstr ""
"瞧​你​这头​笨牛​。​偶尔​也​做点​正经事​吧​。\n"
"qiao2 ni3 zhe4 tou2 ben4 niu2。ou3er3 ye3 zuo4 dian3 zheng4jing1shi4 ba1。"

msgid "There're still gangers out there. You'd be safer in here."
msgstr ""
"外面​还有​他们​的​人​在​四处​晃悠​。​你​在​这儿​待​着​还​更​安全​点​。\n"
"wai4mian4 hai2you3 ta1men5 de5 ren2 zai4 si4chu4 huang4you5。ni3 zai4 zhe4r5 dai1 zhao2 hai2 geng1 an1quan2 dian3。"

msgid ""
"There's a cheerful thought.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, boss. Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"真是​个​让​人​开心​的​想法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​老大​，​我们​赶紧​把​这​事儿​解决​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 rang4 ren2 kai1xin1 de5 xiang3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，lao3da4，wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4r5 jie3jue2 diao4。"

msgid ""
"There's a cheerful thought.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, chief. Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"真是​个​让​人​开心​的​想法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​头儿​，​我们​赶紧​把​这​事儿​解决​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 rang4 ren2 kai1xin1 de5 xiang3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，tou2r5，wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4r5 jie3jue2 diao4。"

msgid ""
"There's a cheerful thought.\n"
"\n"
"Come on. Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"真是​个​让​人​开心​的​想法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​我们​赶紧​把​这​事儿​解决​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 rang4 ren2 kai1xin1 de5 xiang3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4r5 jie3jue2 diao4。"

msgid ""
"There's a crate behind your shop that looks like it was marked for delivery "
"to the Kreuzbasar. You wouldn't happen to know about that, would you?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​店​后面​有个​箱子​，​看起来​像是​给​克洛伊​茨​集市​运送​的​物资​。​你​对此​有​什么​了解​吗​？\n"
"ni3 de5 dian4 hou4mian5 you3 ge4 xiang1zi5，kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 gei3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 yun4song4 de5 wu4zi1。ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"There's a list here. Lots of names and personal information. They're all listed \"shoot on sight.\"\n"
"\n"
"Your name is on the list, chief. Not just your name... they have a whole dossier on you."
msgstr ""
"这里​有​份​名单​，​上面​全是​各种​名字​和​个人信息​，​而且​均​标注​为​“​格杀勿论​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​名字​也​在​上面​，​头儿​。​而且​不光​是​名字​……​他们​掌握​了​你​的​详细​情报​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 you3 fen4 ming2dan1，shang4mian4 quan2 shi4 ge4zhong3 ming2zi5 he4 ge4 ren2 xin4 xi1，er2qie3 jun1 biao1zhu4 wei2“ge2sha1wu4lun4”。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ming2zi5 ye3 zai4 shang4mian4，tou2r5。er2qie3 bu4guang1 shi4 ming2zi5……ta1men5 zhang3wo4 le5 ni3 de5 xiang2xi4 qing2bao4。"

msgid ""
"There's a little shop down the road that you might want to try... check out the \"Data Haven\" on the west end of town. \n"
"\n"
"The owner ran jobs for me seven or eight years ago, she's well-connected and discreet."
msgstr ""
"街角​有家​小店​或许​值得​一试​……​去​街区​西边​的​“​数据​港湾​”​看看​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那里​的​店主​七八年​前替​我​做​过事​。​她​人脉​很​广​，​而且​行事​谨慎​。\n"
"\n"
"jie1 jiao3 you3 jia1 xiao3dian4 huo4xu3 zhi2de5 yi1 shi4……qu4 jie1qu1 xi1bian1 de5“shu4ju4 gang3wan1” kan4kan5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"na4li5 de5 dian4zhu3 qi1 ba1 nian2 qian2 ti4 wo3 zuo4 guo4 shi4。ta1 ren2mai4 hen3 yan3，er2qie3 xing2shi4 jin3shen4。"

msgid "There's a lot of work to be done."
msgstr ""
"有​很多​工作​要​做​。\n"
"you3 hen3 duo1 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"There's a note atop the box. \n"
"\n"
"\"$(l.name). The Lodge thanks you for your dutiful service.\""
msgstr ""
"箱子​上​有​张​纸条​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​$(l.name)​，​‘​结社​’​感谢​你​的​尽职尽责​。​”\n"
"\n"
"xiang1zi5 shang4 you3 zhang1 zhi3tiao2。\n"
"\n"
"“$(l.name)，‘ jie2she4 ’ gan3xie4 ni3 de5 jin4zhi2jin4ze2。”"

msgid ""
"There's a note on the door.\n"
"\"His food is in the crisper drawer. See you next week! -Steven\""
msgstr ""
"门上​贴着​一张​便条​。​\n"
"​“​他​的​食物​在​保鲜​储藏​格​抽屉​里​。​下周​见​了​！​—​—​史蒂文​”\n"
"men2 shang4 tie1 zhao2 yi1 zhang1 bian4tiao2。\n"
"“ta1 de5 shi2wu4 zai4 bao3xian1 chu3cang2 ge2 chou1ti5 li3。xia4zhou1 jian4 le5！——shi3di4wen2”"

msgid ""
"There's a simulacrum of my persona on that chip. Ask it - that's what it's there for.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and $(l.name)... a free piece of advice for you."
msgstr ""
"那枚​芯片​上​存有​我​人格​的​模拟​体​。​去​问​它​吧​—​—​那​正是​它​的​存在​意义​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​，​$(l.name)​……​给​你​条​免费​建议​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 mei2 xin1pian4 shang4 cun2you3 wo3 ren2ge2 de5 mo2ni3 ti3。qu4 wen4 ta1 ba1——na4 zheng4shi4 ta1 de5 cun2zai4 yi4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3，$(l.name)……gei3 ni3 tiao2 mian3fei4 jian4yi4。"

msgid ""
"There's a small ledger lying on this crate. The cover is cheap leatherette, "
"and the paper is tissue-thin newsprint."
msgstr ""
"这​只​箱子​上放​着​一册​小​账本​。​封面​是​廉价​的​人造革​，​纸张​则​是​薄​如​蝉翼​的​新闻纸​。\n"
"zhe4 zhi3 xiang1zi5 shang4 fang4 zhao2 yi1 ce4 xiao3 zhang4ben3。feng1mian4 shi4 lian2jia4 de5 ren2zao4ge2，zhi3zhang1 ze2 shi4 bao2 ru2 chan2yi4 de5 xin1 wen2 zhi3。"

msgid ""
"There's a small vent in this wall. You wouldn't fit in it, but a drone "
"might."
msgstr ""
"墙上​有个​小​排气口​。​你​进不去​，​但​无人机​可以​。\n"
"qiang2 shang4 you3 ge4 xiao3 pai2 qi4 kou3。ni3 jin4 bu4 qu4，dan4 wu2ren2ji1 ke3yi3。"

msgid ""
"There's a sort of legend out on the streets... the ultimate high. They "
"called it \"2XS.\""
msgstr ""
"街头​流传​着​一个​传说​……​某种​终极​快感​。​他们​称之为​“​2XS​”​。\n"
"jie1tou2 liu2chuan2 zhao2 yi1ge5 chuan2shuo1……mou3zhong3 zhong1ji2 kuai4gan3。ta1men5 cheng1zhi1wei2“2XS”。"

msgid "There's a war to be fought somewhere, right?"
msgstr ""
"肯定​总有​地方​在​打仗​，​对​吧​？\n"
"ken3ding4 zong3you3 di4fang1 zai4 da3zhang4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"There's also Altuğ, if you can get him to shut up about his coffee for a "
"minute."
msgstr ""
"还有​奥图​伊​，​如果​你​能​让​他​暂时​别提​他​的​咖啡​的话​。\n"
"hai2you3 ao4 tu2 yi1，ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 rang4 ta1 zan4shi2 bie4 ti2 ta1 de5 ka1fei1 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"There's always something going on. It's the Flux, right? It gives, it takes."
" Sometimes it takes more than it gives."
msgstr ""
"永远​都​有​事情​发生​。​毕竟​这里​是​动荡​带​，​对​吧​？​它​给予​，​也​夺取​。​有时​它​夺取​的​远​多于​给予​。\n"
"yong3yuan3 dou1 you3 shi4qing5 fa1sheng1。bi4jing4 zhe4li3 shi4 dong4dang4 dai4，dui4 ba1？ta1 ji3yu3，ye3 duo2qu3。you3shi2 ta1 duo2qu3 de5 yuan3 duo1yu2 ji3yu3。"

msgid ""
"There's an old bookcase in the very back of the apartment. Under the second "
"shelf from the bottom, you'll find a button that opens the door to "
"Trithemius' hideout."
msgstr ""
"公寓​最​里面​有​个旧​书架​。​倒数​第二层​架子​底下​有个​按钮​，​可以​打开​通往​特​里特​米​乌斯藏​身处​的​入口​。\n"
"gong1yu4 zui4 li3mian4 you3 ge4jiu4 shu1jia4。dao4shu3 di4 er4 ceng2 jia4zi5 di3xia5 you3 ge4 an4niu3，ke3yi3 da3kai1 tong1wang3 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 zang4 shen1chu3 de5 ru4kou3。"

msgid ""
"There's another long pause. The tension mounts. Then your commlink crackles "
"to life again."
msgstr ""
"又​是​一段​漫长​的​沉默​。​紧张感​不断​攀升​。​接着​你​的​通讯​链​终于​又​传来​动静​。\n"
"you4 shi4 yi1 duan4 man4chang2 de5 chen2mo4。jin3 zhang1 gan3 bu4duan4 pan1sheng1。jie1zhe5 ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 zhong1yu2 you4 chuan2lai2 dong4jing4。"

msgid ""
"There's been a lot of cargo moving through here. Planning something big, "
"Volker?"
msgstr ""
"这里​运输​的​货物​可​真不少​啊​，​有​什么​大​动作​吗​，​沃尔克​？\n"
"zhe4li3 yun4shu1 de5 huo4wu4 ke3 zhen1 bu4 shao3 a1，you3 shen2me5 dai4 dong4zuo4 ma5，Wo4er3ke4？"

msgid ""
"There's more going on here than we understand, and it could be dangerous to ignore it. I think that you're making a mistake, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"But I've got your back, all the same."
msgstr ""
"这里​发生​的​事情​远超​我们​的​理解​，​无视​它​的话​可能​很​危险​。​$(l.name)​，​我​觉得​你​犯​了​个​错误​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​我​依然​会​支持​你​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 yuan3chao1 wo3men5 de5 li3jie3，wu2shi4 ta1 de5hua4 ke3neng2 hen3 wei1xian3。$(l.name)，wo3 jue2de5 ni3 fan4 le5 ge4 cuo4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，wo3 yi1ran2 hui4 zhi1chi2 ni3。"

msgid "There's no time like the present. Get to it."
msgstr ""
"时不我待​。​赶紧​行动​吧​。\n"
"shi2bu4wo3dai4。gan3jin3 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"There's no visible keyhole, no input pad, and no card reader. The lock must "
"be controlled through the computer terminal."
msgstr ""
"没有​可见​的​钥匙孔​，​没有​小键盘​，​也​没有​读卡器​。​这​把​锁​肯定​通过​电脑​终端​控制​的​。\n"
"mei2you3 ke3jian4 de5 yue4 chi2 kong3，mei2you3 xiao3 jian4 pan2，ye3 mei2you3 du2ka3qi4。zhe4 ba3 suo3 ken3ding4 tong1guo4 dian4nao3 zhong1duan1 kong4zhi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"There's not a lot of time for long discussions, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"With APEX taken care of, we need to get to Vauclair's estate. There's no time for anything else."
msgstr ""
"没​时间​长篇大论​了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​解决​了​APEX​之后​，​我们​得​赶去​沃​克莱尔​庄园​。​没​时间​做​别的​事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 shi2jian1 zhang3 pian1 dai4 lun2 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"jie3jue2 le5 APEX zhi1hou4，wo3men5 de2 gan3 qu4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 zhuang1yuan2。mei2 shi2jian1 zuo4 bie2de5 shi4 le5。"

msgid "There's nothing we can do."
msgstr ""
"我们​什么​也​做不了​。\n"
"wo3men5 shen2me5 ye3 zuo4 bu4 le5。"

msgid "There's nothing you could've done. I'm not upset with you."
msgstr ""
"你​对此​也​没什么​办法​。​我​不怪​你​。\n"
"ni3 dui4 ci3 ye3 mei2shen2me5 ban4fa3。wo3 bu4 guai4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"There's one thing that I know for certain: that girl isn't going to have to "
"do this. Not ever."
msgstr ""
"有件事​我​可以​肯定​：​那​姑娘​绝不​该​走上​这条​路​。​永远​也​不​应该​。\n"
"you3 jian4 shi4 wo3 ke3yi3 ken3ding4：na4 gu1niang5 jue2bu4 gai1 zou3 shang4 zhe4 tiao2 lu4。yong3yuan3 ye3 bu4 ying1gai1。"

msgid ""
"There's only one way to find out. Let's get prepped.\n"
"\n"
"This thing isn't going to kill itself."
msgstr ""
"只有​一种​方式​能​弄清楚​。​我们​做好​准备​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​干​等​着​也​没​办法​弄死​那​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3you3 yi1zhong3 fang1shi4 neng2 long4 qing1 chu3。wo3men5 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"gan4 deng3 zhao2 ye3 mei2 ban4fa3 nong4si3 na4 dong1xi1。"

msgid "There's something else that I'd like to ask you about."
msgstr ""
"我​还有​事想​问​你​。\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 shi4 xiang3 wen4 ni3。"

msgid "There's something in there I want to see."
msgstr ""
"我​想​去​那​里面​看点​东西​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3 qu4 na4 li3mian4 kan4dian3 dong1xi1。"

msgid "There's something you folks should know..."
msgstr ""
"我​有件事​要​告诉​你们​……\n"
"wo3 you3 jian4 shi4 yao4 gao4su4 ni3men5……"

msgid "There's something you should know about Monika..."
msgstr ""
"关于​莫妮卡​，​我​有件事​要​告诉​你​……\n"
"guan1yu2 Mo4ni1ka3，wo3 you3 jian4 shi4 yao4 gao4su4 ni3……"

msgid ""
"There's still time, Vauclair. You could find another way before you die."
msgstr ""
"还有​时间​的​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​可以​在​死​之前​另想办法​。\n"
"hai2you3 shi2jian1 de5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 ke3yi3 zai4 si3 zhi1qian2 ling4 xiang3 ban4 fa3。"

msgid ""
"There've been spook stories floatin' around about this for a few years now. Stories about deckers disappearin' from the Matrix, then showin' up again, but... *wrong.*\n"
"\n"
"I never put much stock in 'em. Not until now."
msgstr ""
"这些​年​我​听​过​类似​的​灵异​故事​。​碟客​从​矩阵​中​消失​，​但​之后​……​又​以​*​诡异​*​的​样子​出现​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从没​太​相信​这些​故事​……​直到现在​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 nian2 wo3 ting1 guo4 lei4si4 de5 ling2yi4 gu4shi4。die2 ke4 cong2 ju3zhen4 zhong4 xiao1shi1，dan4 zhi1hou4……you4 yi3*gui3yi4*de5 yang4zi5 chu1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2mei2 tai4 xiang1xin4 zhe4xie1 gu4shi4……zhi2dao4xian4zai4。"

msgid ""
"There. All done.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She breathes a sigh of relief, then surveys the items that you retrieved for her.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you again, so much. I don't think I'd ever have seen this stuff again if it weren't for you."
msgstr ""
"好​，​搞定​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​长出​一口气​，​翻看​了​一遍​你​替​她​取回来​的​那些​东西​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​再谢​你​一次​，​真的​。​要不是​有​你​在​，​我​恐怕​再也​看不到​这​东西​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3，gao3ding4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang3chu1 yi1kou3qi4，fan1kan4 le5 yi1bian4 ni3 ti4 ta1 qu3 hui2 lai2 de5 na4xie1 dong1xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 zai4 xie4 ni3 yi1ci4，zhen1de5。yao4bu5shi4 you3 ni3 zai4，wo3 kong3pa4 zai4ye3 kan4 bu4 dao4 zhe4 dong1xi1 le5。"

msgid ""
"There. That's better.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His lips curl into a mirthless smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have shown you hospitality, $(l.race). Now it's time for you to return the favor. So tell me: why are you here?"
msgstr ""
"这样​好多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​脸上​的​笑容​不再​轻蔑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对​你​尽足​了​地主之谊​，​$(l.race)​。​现在​该​你​投桃报李​了​，​告诉​我​：​你​来​这里​有何贵干​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 hao3duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 bu4zai4 qing1mie4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ni3 jin3 ju4 le5 de5 zhu3 zhi1 yi4，$(l.race)。xian4zai4 gai1 ni3 tou2tao2bao4li3 le5，gao4su4 wo3：ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 you3he2gui4gan4？"

msgid ""
"There. That's better.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His neutral expression curdles into a malevolent grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have shown you hospitality, stranger. Now it's time for you to return the favor. So tell me: why are you here?"
msgstr ""
"这样​好多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他面​无表情​的​脸上​突然​浮现​出​恶毒​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对​你​尽足​了​地主之谊​，​陌生人​。​现在​该​你​投桃报李​了​，​告诉​我​：​你​来​这里​有何贵干​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 hao3duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 lian3 shang4 tu1ran2 fu2xian4 chu1 e4du2 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ni3 jin3 ju4 le5 de5 zhu3 zhi1 yi4，mo4sheng1ren2。xian4zai4 gai1 ni3 tou2tao2bao4li3 le5，gao4su4 wo3：ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 you3he2gui4gan4？"

msgid "There’s nothing to say. We’ll do what we have to do."
msgstr ""
"没什么​好​说​的​。​我们​该​做​什么​就​做​什么​。\n"
"mei2shen2me5 hao3 shuo1 de5。wo3men5 gai1 zuo4 shen2me5 jiu4 zuo4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"These ANIMALS don't respect you, Alexander. They DENY your choice. Your uncle over there thinks that you're a CHILD.\n"
"\n"
"Now do the right thing and put an END to this."
msgstr ""
"这些​畜生​根本​不​尊重​你​，​亚历山大​。​他们​会​否定​你​的​选择​。​你​的​叔叔​还​把​你​当成​小屁孩​看待​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​做​正确​的​事​，​结束​这​一切​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 chu4sheng5 gen1ben3 bu4 zun1zhong4 ni3，ya4li4shan1da4。ta1men5 hui4 fou3ding4 ni3 de5 xuan3ze2。ni3 de5 shu1shu5 hai2 ba3 ni3 dang4cheng2 xiao3pi4hai2 kan4dai4！\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 zuo4 zheng4que4 de5 shi4，jie2shu4 zhe4 yi1qie4 ba1！"

msgid "These aren't Knight Errant! They're intruders! KILL THEM!"
msgstr ""
"这些​人​不是​游侠​骑士​！​他们​是​入侵者​！​杀​了​他们​！\n"
"zhe4xie1 ren2 bu4shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4！ta1men5 shi4 ru4qin1zhe3！sha1 le5 ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"These crates don't seem to be part of the shipment that was en route to the "
"Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"这些​集装箱​似乎​并​不​属于​运往​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​货物​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 ji2zhuang1xiang1 si4hu1 bing4 bu4 shu3yu2 yun4 wang3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 huo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"These crates have been sealed, the only visible markings are \"Project "
"Atlas\"."
msgstr ""
"这些​板条箱​都​被​封上​了​，​上面​仅能​看到​“​阿特拉斯​计划​”​的​标识​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 ban3tiao2xiang1 dou1 bei4 feng1 shang4 le5，shang4mian4 jin3 neng2 kan4dao4“a1te4la1si1 ji4hua4” de5 biao1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"These knockoff products were commissioned by an outside investor, and had "
"been moved into cold storage in the Executive Wing pending transport."
msgstr ""
"这些​仿制​产品​是​由​外部​投资者​委托​生产​的​，​并​已​被​转移​到​行政部​的​冷藏库​中​，​等待​运输​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 fang3zhi4 chan3pin3 shi4 you2 wai4bu4 tou2zi1zhe3 wei3tuo1 sheng1chan3 de5，bing4 yi3 bei4 zhuan3yi2 dao4 xing2 zheng4 bu4 de5 leng3 zang4 ku4 zhong4，deng3dai4 yun4shu1。"

msgid ""
"These lockers are stuffed full of spare Knight Errant security uniforms."
msgstr ""
"这些​储物柜​中​装满​了​备用​的​游侠​骑士​安保​人员​制服​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 chu3wu4gui4 zhong4 zhuang1man3 le5 bei4yong4 de5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 zhi4fu2。"

msgid "These metahuman bones have been picked clean."
msgstr ""
"这些​泛​人类​的​骨头​已经​被​啃得​干干净净​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 fan4 ren2lei4 de5 gu3tou5 yi3jing1 bei4 ken3 de2 gan4 gan4 jing4 jing4。"

msgid ""
"These things are magical in nature. Seems to me that we need to find a "
"magical solution."
msgstr ""
"这些​东西​都​带有​魔法​属性​。​看起来​我们​得​想​个​和​魔法​有关​的​解决方案​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 dou1 dai4you3 mo2fa3 shu3xing4。kan4qi3lai5 wo3men5 de2 xiang3 ge4 he4 mo2fa3 you3guan1 de5 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4。"

msgid ""
"These things, they take time. I am making progress, though. Give me a little"
" more."
msgstr ""
"这种​事情​很花​工夫​的​。​不过​我​已经​有​进展​了​。​再​给​我点​时间​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 hen3 hua1 gong1fu1 de5。bu4guo4 wo3 yi3jing1 you3 jin4zhan3 le5。zai4 gei3 wo3 dian3 shi2jian1。"

msgid "Theta Key Card"
msgstr ""
"西塔​级​门禁卡\n"
"xi1ta3 ji2 men2 jin1 ka3"

msgid "Theta Keycard"
msgstr ""
"西塔​级​门禁卡\n"
"xi1ta3 ji2 men2 jin1 ka3"

msgid ""
"They *are* people. They are *my* people.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He crosses his arms over his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just because you can't understand our bond, that doesn't mean it isn't real!"
msgstr ""
"他们​*​是​*​人​。​他们​是​*​我​的​*​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​双臂​交叉​抱​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​仅仅​因为​你​无法​理解​我们​的​联系​，​并​不​意味着​它​不是​真实​的​！\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5*shi4*ren2。ta1men5 shi4*wo3 de5*ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1 bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin3jin3 yin1wei4 ni3 wu2fa3 li3jie3 wo3men5 de5 lian2xi4，bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 ta1 bu4shi4 zhen1shi2 de5！"

msgid ""
"They agreed to stop hijacking our supplies from now on, but they won't be "
"returning the stolen shipment."
msgstr ""
"他们​同意​从今以后​不再​劫持​我们​的​货物​，​但​他们​也​不会​归还​已经​被​偷​的​东西​。\n"
"ta1men5 tong2yi4 cong2jin1yi3hou4 bu4zai4 jie2chi2 wo3men5 de5 huo4wu4，dan4 ta1men5 ye3 bu4hui4 gui1huan2 yi3jing1 bei4 tou1 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "They all need to keep their heads."
msgstr ""
"他们​都​必须​保持​冷静​。\n"
"ta1men5 dou1 bi4xu1 bao3chi2 leng3jing4。"

msgid "They already have. You just weren't listening."
msgstr ""
"他们​说​了​，​你​没​听​而已​。\n"
"ta1men5 shuo1 le5，ni3 mei2 ting1 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"They are the ultimate takers. It is their reason for existence.\n"
"\n"
"The Great Dragons are very old and very powerful and very, very cunning. A cunning unknowable to you."
msgstr ""
"应该​说​它们​是​顶端​掠夺者​，​掠夺​是​它们​存在​的​意义​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​古老​而​强大​，​狡诈​程度​超乎​你​的​想象​。\n"
"\n"
"ying1gai1 shuo1 ta1men5 shi4 ding3duan1 lu:e4duo2zhe3，lu:e4duo2 shi4 ta1men5 cun2zai4 de5 yi4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 gu3lao3 er2 qiang2da4，jiao3zha4 cheng2du4 chao1 hu1 ni3 de5 xiang3xiang4。"

msgid "They are. I checked them just the other day."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​我​前两天​刚​检查​过​的​。\n"
"dang1ran2。wo3 qian2 liang3 tian1 gang1 jian3cha2 guo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"They attacked Poland and Finland first. Poland broke within months, opening "
"the door into Germany."
msgstr ""
"他们​首先​进攻​波兰​和​芬兰​。​波兰​在​几个​月​内​就​被​攻破​，​打开​了​通往​德国​的​大门​。\n"
"ta1men5 shou3xian1 jin4gong1 bo1lan2 he4 fen1lan2。bo1lan2 zai4 ji3ge5 yue4 nei4 jiu4 bei4 gong1po4，da3kai1 le5 tong1wang3 de2guo2 de5 da4men2。"

msgid ""
"They called themselves the \"Schwarze Herzen,\" and they pretty much ran Drogenkippe until a few days ago. \n"
"\n"
"They weren't a pleasant bunch, but they were better than the jackasses we've got in here now."
msgstr ""
"他们​管​自己​叫​“​黑心​”​，​而且​基本​掌控​了​整个​毒坑区​，​直到​几天​前​的​事情​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​算不上​讨人喜欢​，​但​还是​比​现在​这批​蠢货​要​好​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 guan3 zi4ji3 jiao4“hei1xin1”，er2qie3 ji1ben3 zhang3kong4 le5 zheng3ge4 du2 keng1 qu1，zhi2dao4 ji3tian1 qian2 de5 shi4qing5 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 suan4 bu4 shang4 tao3ren2xi3huan5，dan4 hai2shi5 bi3 xian4zai4 zhe4 pi1 chun3huo4 yao4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"They can't have gotten too far ahead of us. Without my help, they won't be "
"able to make it off the first floor."
msgstr ""
"他们​不会​甩开​我们​太远​的​。​没​我​帮忙​的话​，​他们​肯定​还​在​一楼​呢​。\n"
"ta1men5 bu4hui4 shuai3kai1 wo3men5 tai4 yuan3 de5。mei2 wo3 bang1mang2 de5hua4，ta1men5 ken3ding4 hai2 zai4 yi1 lou2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"They corrupt angry young humans into bile-spewing hatemongers.\n"
"\n"
"Their bloody rhetoric helped to instigate the Night of Rage."
msgstr ""
"他们​把​愤怒​的​年轻人​腐蚀​成​了​满口​谩骂​的​仇恨​制造者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​的​血腥​言论​煽动​了​“​愤怒​之夜​”​的​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ba3 fen4nu4 de5 nian2qing1ren2 fu3shi2 cheng2 le5 man3kou3 man4ma4 de5 chou2hen4 zhi4zao4zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 de5 xue4xing1 yan2lun4 shan1dong4 le5“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” de5 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"They don't care 'bout much, aside from their own magic. Whole world's one big magical pissin' contest to them... always tryin' to summon bigger an' better spirits.\n"
"\n"
"Dangerous stuff, man."
msgstr ""
"他们​除了​自己​的​魔法​外​，​对​其他​事​都​不​太​在意​。​整个​世界​在​他们​眼里​不过​是​一场​魔法​比拼​……​永远​在​试图​召唤​更​强大​、​更​厉害​的​精魂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​玩意儿​可太​危险​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 chu2le5 zi4ji3 de5 mo2fa3 wai4，dui4 qi2ta1 shi4 dou1 bu4 tai4 zai4yi4。zheng3ge4 shi4jie4 zai4 ta1men5 yan3 li3 bu4guo4 shi4 yi1 chang2 mo2fa3 bi3pin1……yong3yuan3 zai4 shi4tu2 zhao4huan4 geng1 qiang2da4、geng1 li4hai5 de5 jing1hun2。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 wan2yi4r5 ke3 tai4 wei1xian3 le5。"

msgid ""
"They don't have to like me. They just need to want what we've got in the "
"trucks."
msgstr ""
"用不着​他们​来​喜欢​我​。​只要​他们​想要​我们​手上​的​货​就行了​。\n"
"yong4bu5zhao2 ta1men5 lai2 xi3huan5 wo3。zhi3yao4 ta1men5 xiang3yao4 wo3men5 shou3 shang4 de5 huo4 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid ""
"They form a monopoly.\n"
"\n"
"You're saying that Mr. Grinder and Plotz--"
msgstr ""
"会​形成​商业​垄断​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​说​“​绞肉机​”​先生​和​普​洛茨​—​—\n"
"\n"
"hui4 xing2cheng2 shang1ye4 long3duan4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 he4 Pu3luo4ci2 — —"

msgid ""
"They got to you, same as they got to me. You wouldn't be here if they didn't.\n"
"\n"
"I won't be safe with you. I won't be safe *anywhere.*"
msgstr ""
"我们​两个​的​境遇​是​一样​的​。​如果​你​有​这个​本事​的话​，​就​不会​在​这里​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我待​在​你​身边​也​不会​安全​。​我待​在​*​哪里​*​都​不会​安全​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 liang3 ge4 de5 jing4yu4 shi4 yi1yang4 de5。ru2guo3 ni3 you3 zhe4ge5 ben3shi4 de5hua4，jiu4 bu4hui4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dai1 zai4 ni3 shen1bian1 ye3 bu4hui4 an1quan2。wo3 dai1 zai4*na3li3*dou1 bu4hui4 an1quan2 de5。"

msgid ""
"They had numbers on us, but they didn't know where to hit us. We had eyes in the sky, and we had cover and concealment. Every time they thought they had a fix on us, we'd shift positions and hit them again.\n"
"\n"
"They might as well have been fighting ghosts."
msgstr ""
"他们​人数​占优​，​却​不知​该​从​何处​下手​。​我们​掌握​着​空中​侦察​优势​，​同时​具备​掩护​与​隐蔽​能力​。​每当​他们​以为​锁定​我们​的​位置​时​，​我们​便​变换​阵地​，​再度​发起​反击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​简直​是​在​和​鬼魂​战斗​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ren2shu4 zhan4you1，que4 bu4zhi1 gai1 cong2 he2chu4 xia4shou3。wo3men5 zhang3wo4 zhao2 kong1zhong1 zhen1cha2 you1shi4，tong2shi2 ju4bei4 yan3hu4 yu4 yin3bi4 neng2li4。mei3dang1 ta1men5 yi3wei2 suo3ding4 wo3men5 de5 wei4zhi5 shi2，wo3men5 bian4 bian4huan4 zhen4di4，zai4du4 fa1qi3 fan3ji1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jian3zhi2 shi4 zai4 he4 gui3hun2 zhan4dou4。"

msgid ""
"They have been “reasoned with.” Let us simply say, the matter is settled and"
" leave it at that. The Kreuzbasar will maintain its stability a while longer"
" thanks to us."
msgstr ""
"他们​已​被​“​说服​”​。​简单​来说​，​此事​已​尘埃落定​，​不必​再​多​费心​。​由于​我们​的​努力​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​将​得以​继续​维持​稳定​一段时间​。\n"
"ta1men5 yi3 bei4“shuo1fu2”。jian3dan1 lai2 shuo1，ci3shi4 yi3 chen2ai1luo4ding4，bu4bi4 zai4 duo1 fei4xin1。you2yu2 wo3men5 de5 nu3li4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jiang1 de2yi3 ji4xu4 wei2chi2 wen3ding4 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"They haven't told to you because they *can't* tell you, love. The power "
"outage took the comms down."
msgstr ""
"他们​还​没​告诉​你​，​是因为​他们​*​没​办法​*​告诉​你​，​亲爱​的​。​断电​导致​整栋​楼​的​通讯​系统​都​瘫痪​了​。\n"
"ta1men5 hai2 mei2 gao4su4 ni3，shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1men5*mei2 ban4fa3*gao4su4 ni3，qin1ai4 de5。duan4dian4 dao3zhi4 zheng3 dong4 lou2 de5 tong1xun4 xi4tong3 dou1 tan1huan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"They help me forget. They help me be strong and smart. And I never lose "
"anyone."
msgstr ""
"它们​帮​我​遗忘​。​它们​帮​我​变得​聪明​强壮​。​而​我​不会​再​失去​任何人​。\n"
"ta1men5 bang1 wo3 yi2wang4。ta1men5 bang1 wo3 bian4de5 cong1ming5 qiang2zhuang4。er2 wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 shi1qu4 ren4 he2 ren2。"

msgid ""
"They hit the Schwarze Herzen, and they hit 'em hard. Then they took the hotel.\n"
"\n"
"And, uh... then they took me.\n"
"\n"
"I'll admit that the plan backfired a little."
msgstr ""
"他们​狠狠​打击​了​“​黑心​”​，​然后​接管​了​旅馆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​……​他们​把​我​抓走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​承认​，​这个​计划​有点​搬​石头砸​自己​的​脚​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 hen3hen3 da3ji1 le5“hei1xin1”，ran2hou4 jie1guan3 le5 lu:3guan3。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4……ta1men5 ba3 wo3 zhua1zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 cheng2ren4，zhe4ge5 ji4hua4 you3dian3 ban1 dan4 tou2 za2 zi4ji3 de5 jiao3。"

msgid "They know that we’re coming."
msgstr ""
"他们​知道​我们​要​去​那里​。\n"
"ta1men5 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 yao4 qu4 na4li5。"

msgid ""
"They leave me this kind of score, I'm grateful. Already sold most of it in less than a day. Plenty of folks around here in need of real medical supplies.\n"
"\n"
"All right, I've told you what I know. So we're cool, right? I don't know anything else!"
msgstr ""
"我​很​感激​他们​把​这些​东西​留给​我​。​才​过​了​小​半天​就​卖掉​了​一大半​。​这​地方​有​很多​人​都​急需​医疗​物资​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​把​知道​的​都​告诉​你​了​。​这样​可以​了​吧​？​我​别的​什么​都​不​知道​了​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gan3ji1 ta1men5 ba3 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 liu2gei3 wo3。cai2 guo4 le5 xiao3 ban4tian1 jiu4 mai4diao4 le5 yi1 dai4 ban4。zhe4 di4fang1 you3 hen3 duo1 ren2 dou1 ji2xu1 yi1liao2 wu4zi1 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ba3 zhi1dao4 de5 dou1 gao4su4 ni3 le5。zhe4yang4 ke3yi3 le5 ba1？wo3 bie2de5 shen2me5 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 le5！"

msgid ""
"They looked like they came from the same organization that we bumped into at"
" the holdfast... the security team that confronted us after Monika died."
msgstr ""
"他们​看起来​像是​我们​当时​在​庄园​遇到​的​那些​人​……​也​就是​在​莫妮卡​死后​袭击​我们​的​安保​团队​。\n"
"ta1men5 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 wo3men5 dang1shi2 zai4 zhuang1yuan2 yu4dao4 de5 na4xie1 ren2……ye3 jiu4shi4 zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 si3hou4 xi2ji1 wo3men5 de5 an1bao3 tuan2dui4。"

msgid ""
"They may only be private security, but their bullets don’t know that.\n"
"\n"
"I can patch you up if I have to... but I'd rather not have to. "
msgstr ""
"他们​可能​只是​私人​安保​，​但​他们​枪里​的​子弹​可​没​区别​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真​出事​的话​，​我​也​能​给​你​包扎​……​但​我​宁可​不​出​什么​岔子​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ke3neng2 zhi3shi4 si1ren2 an1bao3，dan4 ta1men5 qiang1 li3 de5 zi3dan4 ke3 mei2 qu1bie2。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 chu1shi4 de5hua4，wo3 ye3 neng2 gei3 ni3 bao1za1……dan4 wo3 ning4ke3 bu4 chu1 shen2me5 cha4zi5。"

msgid "They might want to consider relocating."
msgstr ""
"他们​也许​该​考虑​搬家​了​。\n"
"ta1men5 ye3xu3 gai1 kao3lu:4 ban1jia1 le5。"

msgid "They must love you there."
msgstr ""
"他们​肯定​爱死​你​了​。\n"
"ta1men5 ken3ding4 ai4 si3 ni3 le5。"

msgid "They paid, all right. In blood."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​他们​拿命​还​了​。\n"
"en1。ta1men5 na2 ming4 hai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"They say it's for \"community.\" They say it's for \"protection.\"\n"
"\n"
"But why can't they keep to their own neighborhoods? WHAT ARE THEY HIDING?\n"
"\n"
"Stand up for your people. Stand up for what's right. JOIN THE HUMANIS POLICLUB!\n"
"\n"
"HUMANIS FOREVER!"
msgstr ""
"他们​说​这​是​为了​“​社区​”​，​是​为了​“​保护​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​为什么​他们​不待​在​自己​的​社区​？​他们​到底​在​隐瞒​什么​？​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​为​你​的​人类​同胞​挺身而出​，​为​正义​而战​！​加入​人类​至上​俱乐部​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​人类​至上​永存​！\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 shuo1 zhe4 shi4 wei4le5“she4qu1”，shi4 wei4le5“bao3hu4”。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wei4shen2me5 ta1men5 bu4 dai1 zai4 zi4ji3 de5 she4qu1？ta1men5 dao4di3 zai4 yin3man2 shen2me5？！\n"
"\n"
"wei2 ni3 de5 ren2lei4 tong2bao1 ting3shen1er2chu1，wei2 zheng4yi4 er2 zhan4！jia1ru4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4！\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 yong3cun2！"

msgid ""
"They should be here any minute.\n"
"\n"
"Enjoy."
msgstr ""
"他们​应该​随时​会到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好好​享受​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ying1gai1 sui2shi2 hui4 dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hao3hao3 xiang3shou4 ba1。"

msgid "They should be prepared to fight for their homes."
msgstr ""
"他们​应该​做好​准备​为​家园​而战​。\n"
"ta1men5 ying1gai1 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4 wei2 jia1yuan2 er2 zhan4。"

msgid ""
"They speculated as much, yes. They were wrong on that count. \n"
"\n"
"I do believe that Saeder-Krupp was developing APEX as a tool for Matrix Warfare. I am also convinced that the IT personnel who were killed were the APEX development team.\n"
"\n"
"But I don’t think that Lofwyr was responsible for their deaths."
msgstr ""
"他们​确实​有过​这样​的​猜测​，​但​这点​他们​想错​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​赛德​-​克虏伯​正在​将​APEX​开发​为​矩阵​武器​，​也​知道​遇害​的​IT​人员​从​属于​APEX​研发​团队​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​不​认为​洛夫​维尔​与​他们​的​死​有关​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 que4shi2 you3 guo4 zhe4yang4 de5 cai1ce4，dan4 zhe4 dian3 ta1men5 xiang3 cuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 zheng4zai4 jiang1 APEX kai1fa1 wei2 ju3zhen4 wu3qi4，ye3 zhi1dao4 yu4hai4 de5 IT ren2yuan2 cong2 shu3yu2 APEX yan2fa1 tuan2dui4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 Luo4fu1wei2er3 yu4 ta1men5 de5 si3 you3guan1。"

msgid ""
"They sure as hell aren't safe here, Marta... haven't you ever asked yourself where the meat in that fridge comes from?\n"
"\n"
"It isn't all from outsiders, I can promise you that."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​他们​在​这里​绝对​不算​安全​……​你​难道​没想​过​冰箱​里​的​肉​是从​哪儿​来​的​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你​保证​，​这些​肉​并非​全都​来自​于​外人​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ta1men5 zai4 zhe4li3 jue2dui4 bu4suan4 an1quan2……ni3 nan2dao4 mei2 xiang3 guo4 bing1xiang1 li3 de5 rou4 shi4 cong2 na3r5 lai2 de5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，zhe4xie1 rou4 bing4fei1 quan2dou1 lai2zi4 yu2 wai4ren2。"

msgid ""
"They sure do! One of the guys, Schrotty, he just lights up whenever I come by. \n"
"\n"
"He’s always got something to say, though it's often about the same stuff over and over again."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​！​有个​叫​施罗蒂​的​家伙​，​一​看到​我​出现​就​有​精神​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​总是​滔滔不绝​，​尽管​他​往往​在​重复​同样​的​内容​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5！you3 ge4 jiao4 shi1 luo2 di4 de5 jia1huo5，yi1 kan4dao4 wo3 chu1xian4 jiu4 you3 jing1shen2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zong3shi4 tao1tao1bu4jue2，jin3guan3 ta1 wang3wang3 zai4 chong2fu4 tong2yang4 de5 nei4rong2。"

msgid ""
"They thought wrong. And the snow was painted pink on both sides of the "
"border."
msgstr ""
"他们​想错​了​。​最后​两侧​边境​的​积雪​都​被​染成​了​粉色​。\n"
"ta1men5 xiang3 cuo4 le5。zui4hou4 liang3ce4 bian1jing4 de5 ji1xue3 dou1 bei4 ran3 cheng2 le5 fen3se4。"

msgid ""
"They want us to think that we can’t make a difference. They put effort - a "
"lot of effort - into making us feel small. Insignificant."
msgstr ""
"他们​想​让​我们​觉得​自己​无能为力​。​他们​费尽心机​，​就是​为了​让​我们​觉得​自己​微不足道​。\n"
"ta1men5 xiang3 rang4 wo3men5 jue2de5 zi4ji3 wu2neng2wei2li4。ta1men5 fei4jin4xin1ji1，jiu4shi4 wei4le5 rang4 wo3men5 jue2de5 zi4ji3 wei1bu4zu2dao4。"

msgid ""
"They were already targets. You need to quit beating yourself up over this, "
"Eiger - it isn't like you."
msgstr ""
"他们​本来​就是​犯罪集团​的​目标​。​艾格尔​，​你​不能​一直​这样​自责​了​，​这​不是​你​的​风格​。\n"
"ta1men5 ben3lai2 jiu4shi4 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 de5 mu4biao1。Ai4ge2er3，ni3 bu4neng2 yi1zhi2 zhe4yang4 zi4ze2 le5，zhe4 bu4shi4 ni3 de5 feng1ge2。"

msgid "They were in my way."
msgstr ""
"他们​挡​我​路​了​。\n"
"ta1men5 dang3 wo3 lu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"They were stealing supplies meant for the Kreuzbasar, so we got it back."
msgstr ""
"他们​偷​了​本该​送往​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​物资​，​所以​我们​去​把​货​拿​回来​了​。\n"
"ta1men5 tou1 le5 ben3 gai1 song4 wang3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 wu4zi1，suo3yi3 wo3men5 qu4 ba3 huo4 na2 hui2lai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"They were trying to protect their secret. Like Audran said... if we hadn't gone down into the basement, they'd've let us go. \n"
"\n"
"APEX didn't react to us until Monika attempted to force the door to the basement."
msgstr ""
"他们​是​想​保守​自己​的​秘密​。​奥​德兰​也​说​了​……​如果​我们​没有​进​地下室​，​他们​本​可以​放​我们​走​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​直到​莫妮卡​试图​强行​打开​地下室​的​门​时​，​APEX​才​对​我们​作出反应​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 shi4 xiang3 bao3shou3 zi4ji3 de5 mi4mi4。Ao4de2lan2 ye3 shuo1 le5……ru2guo3 wo3men5 mei2you3 jin4 di4xia4shi4，ta1men5 ben3 ke3yi3 fang4 wo3men5 zou3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi2dao4 Mo4ni1ka3 shi4tu2 qiang2xing2 da3kai1 di4xia4shi4 de5 men2 shi2，APEX cai2 dui4 wo3men5 zuo4 chu1 fan3 ying1。"

msgid ""
"They will find the Lost Episode - THIS I SWEAR!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pulls himself up to his full height, puffing his chest outward. Somehow, this makes him look even less impressive.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They will RETRIEVE the glorious Episode Seven and RETURN IT to its RIGHTFUL PLACE! And they will HEW IN TWAIN the HEATHEN DOGS who seek to hoard its magnificence for THEMSELVES!"
msgstr ""
"他们​将​找到​失落​的​剧集​—​—​这​是​我​的​誓言​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挺直​身体​，​挺起​胸膛​。​奇怪的是​，​这​让​他​看起来​更加​不起眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​将​找回​辉煌​的​第七集​，​将​它​归还​到​它​应得​的​位置​！​他们​将​毫不留情​地​斩杀​那些​妄图​独占​其​辉煌​的​异教​狗​！\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jiang1 zhao3dao4 shi1luo4 de5 ju4ji2——zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 shi4yan2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3zhi2 shen1ti3，ting3 qi3 xiong1tang2。ji1 guai4 de5 shi4，zhe4 rang4 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 geng4jia1 bu4qi3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jiang1 zhao3hui2 hui1huang2 de5 di4 qi1 ji2，jiang1 ta1 gui1huan2 dao4 ta1 ying1de2 de5 wei4zhi5！ta1men5 jiang1 hao2bu4liu2qing2 de5 zhan3sha1 na4xie1 wang4tu2 du2zhan4 qi2 hui1huang2 de5 yi4jiao4 gou3！"

msgid "They won't have a choice in the matter."
msgstr ""
"他们​在​这件​事​上面​没得选​。\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4mian4 mei2 de2 xuan3。"

msgid ""
"They won't stay deflated for long, I'm sure. Maybe I could introduce you to "
"some people... I make a pretty good wingman."
msgstr ""
"放心​吧​，​那件事​很快​就​会​过去​的​。​要​不​我​给​你​介绍​几个​……​我​可会​当​僚机​了​。\n"
"fang4xin1 ba1，na4 jian4 shi4 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 guo4qu4 de5。yao4 bu4 wo3 gei3 ni3 jie4shao4 ji3ge5……wo3 ke3 hui4 dang1 liao2ji1 le5。"

msgid ""
"They'd better. If I hear anything more about interruptions in their feeding,"
" you'll have me to answer to."
msgstr ""
"最好​如此​。​如果​我​再​听说​他们​的​食物​出​了​问题​，​我准​让​你​吃不了兜着走​。\n"
"zui4hao3 ru2ci3。ru2guo3 wo3 zai4 ting1shuo1 ta1men5 de5 shi2wu4 chu1 le5 wen4ti2，wo3 zhun3 rang4 ni3 chi1bu5liao3dou1zhe5zou3。"

msgid "They'll be waiting for me, I guess. They're not real, you know. "
msgstr ""
"我​想​，​让​它们​等等​也​没关系​吧​。​毕竟​它们​都​不是​真的​。\n"
"wo3 xiang3，rang4 ta1men5 deng3deng3 ye3 mei2guan1xi5 ba1。bi4jing4 ta1men5 dou1 bu4shi4 zhen1de5。"

msgid ""
"They'll have a hard time avoiding me when I break into their little "
"clubhouse."
msgstr ""
"等​我​闯进​他们​这个​小会​所​之后​，​看​他们​还​躲​不​躲​。\n"
"deng3 wo3 chuang3jin4 ta1men5 zhe4ge5 xiao3 hui4 suo3 zhi1hou4，kan4 ta1men5 hai2 duo3 bu4 duo3。"

msgid ""
"They'll still be on the first floor - we should be able to catch them if we go in now.\n"
"\n"
"Without my help, there's no way that they could've gotten too far ahead of us."
msgstr ""
"不过​他们​肯定​还​在​一楼​呢​，​我们​现在​进去​的话​应该​能​赶上​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​我​帮忙​的话​，​他们​肯定​不会​甩开​我们​太远​的​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ta1men5 ken3ding4 hai2 zai4 yi1 lou2 ni2，wo3men5 xian4zai4 jin4qu4 de5hua4 ying1gai1 neng2 gan3shang4 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wo3 bang1mang2 de5hua4，ta1men5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 shuai3kai1 wo3men5 tai4 yuan3 de5。"

msgid ""
"They'll still be on the first floor, though! Without my help, there's no way"
" that they could've gotten too far ahead of us."
msgstr ""
"不过​他们​肯定​还​在​一楼​呢​！​没​我​帮忙​的话​，​他们​肯定​不会​甩开​我们​太远​的​。\n"
"bu4guo4 ta1men5 ken3ding4 hai2 zai4 yi1 lou2 ni2！mei2 wo3 bang1mang2 de5hua4，ta1men5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 shuai3kai1 wo3men5 tai4 yuan3 de5。"

msgid ""
"They'll still be on the first floor. Nobody's getting upstairs until I bypass the security locks on the elevator.\n"
"\n"
"That's why I decided to wait for you out here... I figured that they couldn't get too far ahead of us if I didn't go inside with them."
msgstr ""
"他们​肯定​还​在​一楼​呢​。​必须​由​我​来​搞定​电梯​的​安保​锁​，​否则​没人能​上楼去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我​才​决定​在​这里​等​你​……​我​觉得​就算​我​没​跟​过去​的话​，​他们​也​肯定​不会​甩开​我们​太远​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ken3ding4 hai2 zai4 yi1 lou2 ni2。bi4xu1 you2 wo3 lai2 gao3ding4 dian4ti1 de5 an1bao3 suo3，fou3ze2 mei2 ren2 neng2 shang4 lou2 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 cai2 jue2ding4 zai4 zhe4li3 deng3 ni3……wo3 jue2de5 jiu4suan4 wo3 mei2 gen1 guo4qu4 de5hua4，ta1men5 ye3 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 shuai3kai1 wo3men5 tai4 yuan3。"

msgid "They'll talk to me."
msgstr ""
"他们​会​和​我​谈​。\n"
"ta1men5 hui4 he4 wo3 tan2。"

msgid ""
"They're all blank. You don't think that the Landenberg Ring would leave them"
" in an unlocked drawer if they had money on them, do you?"
msgstr ""
"这些​都​是​空​的​。​你​不会​认为​兰​登堡​帮会​愚蠢​到​随便​把​一大堆​有钱​的​信用​棒​放在​没​上锁​的​抽屉​里​吧​？\n"
"zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 kong1 de5。ni3 bu4hui4 ren4wei2 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1hui4 yu2chun3 dao4 sui2bian4 ba3 yi1 dai4 dui1 you3qian2 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 fang4 zai4 mei2 shang4suo3 de5 chou1ti5 li3 ba1？"

msgid "They're all empty."
msgstr ""
"它们​都​是​空​的​。\n"
"ta1men5 dou1 shi4 kong1 de5。"

msgid "They're an anti-metahuman hate group."
msgstr ""
"他们​是​某个​仇恨​变​人类​群体​。\n"
"ta1men5 shi4 mou3 ge4 chou2hen4 bian4 ren2lei4 qun2ti3。"

msgid ""
"They're blank, genius. You don't think that the Landenberg Ring would leave "
"them in an unlocked drawer if they had money on them, do you?"
msgstr ""
"那些​都​是​空​的​，​你​个​大​聪明​。​你​不会​认为​兰​登堡​帮会​愚蠢​到​随便​把​一大堆​有钱​的​信用​棒​放在​没​上锁​的​抽屉​里​吧​？\n"
"na4xie1 dou1 shi4 kong1 de5，ni3 ge4 dai4 cong1ming5。ni3 bu4hui4 ren4wei2 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1hui4 yu2chun3 dao4 sui2bian4 ba3 yi1 dai4 dui1 you3qian2 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 fang4 zai4 mei2 shang4suo3 de5 chou1ti5 li3 ba1？"

msgid "They're dead. We're not. What more can you ask for?"
msgstr ""
"他们​死​了​。​我们​还​活着​。​你们​还​想要​什么​？\n"
"ta1men5 si3 le5。wo3men5 hai2 huo2zhe5。ni3men5 hai2 xiang3yao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "They're drones, not people. You get that, right?"
msgstr ""
"他们​是​无人机​，​不是​人类​。​你​明白​这​一点​吧​？\n"
"ta1men5 shi4 wu2ren2ji1，bu4shi4 ren2lei4。ni3 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3 ba1？"

msgid "They're inside the lab! Call for backup!"
msgstr ""
"他们​进​到​实验室​里​来​了​！​呼叫​增援​！\n"
"ta1men5 jin4 dao4 shi2yan4shi4 li3 lai2 le5！hu1jiao4 zeng1yuan2！"

msgid ""
"They're joining their businesses together, man! Read between the lines!\n"
"\n"
"It's actually not a bad scheme, come to think of it. The Ring tricks idiots into taking out predatory loans, and Grinder shows up to collect."
msgstr ""
"他们​要​进行​商业​合作​！​你​还​没想​明白​吗​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这么​一说​的话​，​这招​还​真​挺不错​的​。​兰​登堡​帮​诱骗​蠢货​们​签订​掠夺性​贷款​，​而​“​绞肉机​”​负责​催收​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yao4 jin4xing2 shang1ye4 he2zuo4！ni3 hai2 mei2 xiang3 ming2bai5 ma5！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 yi1shuo1 de5hua4，zhe4 zhao1 hai2 zhen1 ting3 bu4 cuo4 de5。lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 you4pian4 chun3huo4 men5 qian1ding4 lu:e4 duo2 xing4 dai4kuan3，er2“jiao3rou4ji1” fu4ze2 cui1shou1。"

msgid ""
"They're monsters, $(l.name). No better than the dragons that I meant to "
"slay."
msgstr ""
"他们​是​禽兽​，​$(l.name)​。​和​我​要​消灭​的​那些​巨龙​没什么​两样​。\n"
"ta1men5 shi4 qin2shou4，$(l.name)。he4 wo3 yao4 xiao1mie4 de5 na4xie1 ju4long2 mei2shen2me5 liang3yang4。"

msgid "They're monsters."
msgstr ""
"他们​是​一群​怪物​。\n"
"ta1men5 shi4 yi1 qun2 guai4wu5。"

msgid ""
"They're not the only ones. I don't like being alone in this building with the lights *on.*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, anyway. Good luck with the patrol. Shout out if you need anything."
msgstr ""
"害怕​的​不​只有​他们​。​哪怕​灯​*​亮​着​*​的​时候​，​我​都​不​喜欢​一个​人待​在​楼里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​祝​你​巡逻​顺利​吧​。​有​什么​需要的话​就​大声​喊​我​。\n"
"\n"
"hai4pa4 de5 bu4 zhi3you3 ta1men5。na3pa4 deng1*liang4 zhao2*de5 shi2hou5，wo3 dou1 bu4 xi3huan5 yi1ge5 ren2 dai1 zai4 lou2 li3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，zhu4 ni3 xun2luo2 shun4li4 ba1。you3 shen2me5 xu1 yao4 de5 hua4 jiu4 da4sheng1 han3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"They're on-site QA testers. We've got some bugs to stomp, and we can't do it"
" all ourselves."
msgstr ""
"他们​是​现场​临时​测试人员​。​我们​这边​有些​错误​要​处理​，​但​光靠​我们​自己​搞​不​完​。\n"
"ta1men5 shi4 xian4chang3 lin2shi2 ce4 shi4 ren2 yuan2。wo3men5 zhe4bian1 you3xie1 cuo4wu4 yao4 chu3li3，dan4 guang1 kao4 wo3men5 zi4ji3 gao3 bu4 wan2。"

msgid ""
"They're people, Doctor - not monsters. They've already been working for "
"their meals... maybe you could come up with other things for them to do."
msgstr ""
"医生​，​他们​是​人​，​不是​怪物​。​他们​一直​在​通过​工作​换取​食物​……​也许​你​能​找些​别的​事情​让​他们​去​做​。\n"
"yi1sheng1，ta1men5 shi4 ren2，bu4shi4 guai4wu5。ta1men5 yi1zhi2 zai4 tong1guo4 gong1zuo4 huan4qu3 shi2wu4……ye3xu3 ni3 neng2 zhao3 xie1 bie2de5 shi4qing5 rang4 ta1men5 qu4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"They're terrible people. Real bad guys, all of 'em.\n"
"\n"
"Look, I don't mean to rush you, but we can discuss all of this later. Y'know, *after* we get out of the building full of murderous thugs."
msgstr ""
"他们​糟透了​。​全是​坏蛋​，​没​一个​好人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​，​我​不是​要​催​你​，​不过​这些​事​我们​可以​等会儿​再聊​。​你​看​，​我们​还是​*​先​*​从​这楼​里​出去​，​离​这些​凶残​的​恶棍​远​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zao1 tou4 le5。quan2 shi4 huai4dan4，mei2 yi1ge5 hao3ren2。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5，wo3 bu4shi4 yao4 cui1 ni3，bu4guo4 zhe4xie1 shi4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 deng3 hui4 er2 zai4 liao2。ni3 kan4，wo3men5 hai2shi5*xian1*cong2 zhe4 lou2 li3 chu1qu4，li2 zhe4xie1 xiong1can2 de5 e4gun4 yuan3 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"They're true, love.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head at her.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Word to the wise. If you're fool enough to try something like this again, carry a gun. Better to be shot than to let them take you."
msgstr ""
"那些​传言​并非​空穴来风​，​亲爱​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​冲​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​你​句​忠告​吧​。​如果​你​愚蠢​到​以后​还​想​尝试​类似​的​事情​，​最好​带上​一把​枪​。​被​当场​击毙​总比​被​他们​抓走​要强​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 chuan2yan2 bing4fei1 kong1xue2lai2feng1，qin1ai4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3 ju4 zhong1gao4 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 yu2chun3 dao4 yi3hou4 hai2 xiang3 chang2shi4 lei4si4 de5 shi4qing5，zui4hao3 dai4shang4 yi1 ba3 qiang1。bei4 dang1chang3 ji1bi4 zong3 bi3 bei4 ta1men5 zhua1zou3 yao4qiang2 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"They're true.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Better to be shot than to let the Azzies take you."
msgstr ""
"传言​都​是​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哪怕​被​开枪​打死​也好​过​让​阿兹佬​活捉​你​。\n"
"\n"
"chuan2yan2 dou1 shi4 zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na3pa4 bei4 kai1qiang1 da3si3 ye3hao3 guo4 rang4 e1 zi1 lao3 huo2zhuo1 ni3。"

msgid "They've been keeping the Kreuzbasar's sewers running, Doc."
msgstr ""
"医生​，​他们​一直​在​维持​克洛伊​茨​集市​下水道​的​运行​。\n"
"yi1sheng1，ta1men5 yi1zhi2 zai4 wei2chi2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 xia4shui3dao4 de5 yun4xing2。"

msgid ""
"They, uh... they sort of jumped the gun a little.\n"
"\n"
"They're already inside."
msgstr ""
"他们​……​有点​操之过急​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​已经​在​里面​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5……you3dian3 cao1zhi1guo4ji2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yi3jing1 zai4 li3mian4 le5。"

msgid "Thing about the Flux is, there's always something new to deal with."
msgstr ""
"只要​有​动荡​带​在​，​就​永远​不会​缺新​的​麻烦​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 you3 dong4dang4 dai4 zai4，jiu4 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 que1 xin1 de5 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"Thing looks ancient. I'm guessing that it was under development back when "
"the APEX lab got shut down in ‘36."
msgstr ""
"这​玩意儿​看起来​年代久远​。​我​猜​它​是​在​2036​年​APEX​实验室​关闭​时​就​开始​研发​的​。\n"
"zhe4 wan2yi4r5 kan4qi3lai5 nian2 dai4 jiu3 yuan3。wo3 cai1 ta1 shi4 zai4 2036 nian2 APEX shi2yan4shi4 guan1bi4 shi2 jiu4 kai1shi3 yan2fa1 de5。"

msgid "Things are alright."
msgstr ""
"一切​都​好​。\n"
"yi1qie4 dou1 hao3。"

msgid "Things are different now."
msgstr ""
"情况​不同​了​。\n"
"qing2kuang4 bu4tong2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Things born of nightmare. Horrors.\n"
"\n"
"The dark spaces between the metaplanes crawl with them."
msgstr ""
"噩梦​所生​之物​。​各种​恐怖​的​存在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它们​在​元​位面​之间​的​黑暗​缝隙​里​爬行​。\n"
"\n"
"e4meng4 suo3sheng1 zhi1 wu4。ge4zhong3 kong3bu4 de5 cun2zai4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 yuan2 wei4mian4 zhi1jian1 de5 hei1an4 feng4xi4 li3 pa2xing2。"

msgid ""
"Things get tense from time to time, but that's okay. Better that than to prop someone up as an authority figure and force everyone else to obey his decisions.\n"
"\n"
"That's the difference between your team and mine, $(l.name). You've got some good people on your crew, but *my* team is made up of equals. We're free, and we all know it. I wouldn't have it any other way."
msgstr ""
"气氛​时不时​会​变得​紧张​，​但​没关系​。​总好​过​把​某个​人捧为​权威​，​强迫​其他人​服从​他​的​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就是​我们​双方​团队​之间​的​区别​，​$(l.name)​。​你​的​团队​是​挺不错​，​但​*​我​的​*​团队​是​由​平等​的​人​组成​的​。​我们​是​自由​的​，​我们​都​知道​这​一点​。​我​不会​接受​其他​形式​的​合作​。\n"
"\n"
"qi4fen1 shi2bu4shi2 hui4 bian4de5 jin3zhang1，dan4 mei2guan1xi5。zong3 hao3 guo4 ba3 mou3 ge4 ren2 peng3 wei2 quan2wei1，qiang3po4 qi2 ta1 ren2 fu2cong2 ta1 de5 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 shuang1fang1 tuan2dui4 zhi1jian1 de5 qu1bie2，$(l.name)。ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 shi4 ting3 bu4 cuo4，dan4*wo3 de5*tuan2dui4 shi4 you2 ping2deng3 de5 ren2 zu3cheng2 de5。wo3men5 shi4 zi4you2 de5，wo3men5 dou1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。wo3 bu4hui4 jie1shou4 qi2ta1 xing2shi4 de5 he2zuo4。"

msgid "Things got a little... messy... but I got the job done."
msgstr ""
"事情​有​一点​……​麻烦​……​不过​我​还是​完成​了​差事​。\n"
"shi4qing5 you3 yi1dian3……ma2fan5……bu4guo4 wo3 hai2shi5 wan2cheng2 le5 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"Think I've heard something about a capital \"L\" *Lodge,* yeah... there was some chatter on a BBS that I used to hang out at a few years ago.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His brow furrows in concentration.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a magic thing, I think. Sort of a bogeyman for conspiracy theorists."
msgstr ""
"我​好像​是​听​过​类似​的​名字​……​“​结社​”​是​吧​，​我​几年​前​常常​混迹​的​论坛​里​有​相关​的​讨论​帖子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​紧紧​皱着眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​应该​是​某种​魔法​相关​的​内容​。​某种程度​上​是​阴谋​论者​的​假想​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hao3xiang4 shi4 ting1 guo4 lei4si4 de5 ming2zi5……“jie2she4” shi4 ba1，wo3 ji3nian2 qian2 chang2chang2 hun4ji4 de5 lun4tan2 li3 you3 xiang1guan1 de5 tao3lun4 tie3zi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jin3jin3 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ying1gai1 shi4 mou3zhong3 mo2fa3 xiang1guan1 de5 nei4rong2。mou3 zhong3 cheng2 du4 shang4 shi4 yin1mou2 lun2 zhe3 de5 jia3xiang3。"

msgid ""
"Think I've heard something about a capital-L *Lodge,* yeah... there was some chatter on a BBS that I used to hang out at a few years ago.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His brow furrows in concentration.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a magic thing, I think. Sort of a bogeyman for conspiracy theorists."
msgstr ""
"我​好像​是​听​过​类似​的​名字​……​“​结社​”​是​吧​，​我​几年​前​常常​混迹​的​论坛​里​有​相关​的​讨论​帖子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​紧紧​皱着眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​应该​是​某种​魔法​相关​的​内容​。​某种程度​上​是​阴谋​论者​的​假想​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hao3xiang4 shi4 ting1 guo4 lei4si4 de5 ming2zi5……“jie2she4” shi4 ba1，wo3 ji3nian2 qian2 chang2chang2 hun4ji4 de5 lun4tan2 li3 you3 xiang1guan1 de5 tao3lun4 tie3zi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jin3jin3 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ying1gai1 shi4 mou3zhong3 mo2fa3 xiang1guan1 de5 nei4rong2。mou3 zhong3 cheng2 du4 shang4 shi4 yin1mou2 lun2 zhe3 de5 jia3xiang3。"

msgid ""
"Think about it. When you turn on your trideo after a hard day's work, who do you see?\n"
"\n"
"The pampered ELF, basking in the lap of luxury. Squandering the money that YOU could be using to feed your children!"
msgstr ""
"想想​看吧​！​你​辛苦工作​一天​后​打开​3D​影像​机​，​看到​的​是​谁​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​那些​养尊处优​的​精灵​！​他们​沉溺在​奢靡​的​生活​中​，​挥霍​着​本该​用来​养活​你​孩子​的​血汗钱​！\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 xiang3 kan4 ba1！ni3 xin1 ku3 gong1 zuo4 yi1 tian1 hou4 da3kai1 3D ying3xiang4 ji1，kan4dao4 de5 shi4 shei2？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 na4xie1 yang3zun1chu3you1 de5 jing1ling2！ta1men5 chen2 ni4 zai4 she1mi2 de5 sheng1huo2 zhong4，hui1huo4 zhao2 ben3 gai1 yong4lai2 yang3huo5 ni3 hai2zi5 de5 xue4han4qian2！"

msgid "Think any of these \"interesting people\" might know him?"
msgstr ""
"这群​“​有意思​的​人​”​里​，​你​想得到​谁​可能​认识​他​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 qun2“you3yi4si5 de5 ren2” li3，ni3 xiang3 de2 dao4 shei2 ke3neng2 ren4shi5 ta1 ma5？"

msgid "Think before you respond, pal. I'm taking notes."
msgstr ""
"想​好​了​再​回话​，​伙计​。​我​都​会​记下来​的​。\n"
"xiang3 hao3 le5 zai4 hui2hua4，huo3ji5。wo3 dou1 hui4 ji4 xia4 lai2 de5。"

msgid "Think before you respond. I'm taking notes."
msgstr ""
"想​好​了​再​回话​。​我​都​会​记下来​的​。\n"
"xiang3 hao3 le5 zai4 hui2hua4。wo3 dou1 hui4 ji4 xia4 lai2 de5。"

msgid "Think nothing of it. I've got your back, Glory - no matter what."
msgstr ""
"别​客气​，​格洛丽​，​无论如何​我​都​会​支持​你​。\n"
"bie4 ke4qi5，Ge2luo4li2，wu2lun4ru2he2 wo3 dou1 hui4 zhi1chi2 ni3。"

msgid "Think of it more like a friendly warning."
msgstr ""
"就​当​这​是​个​友好​的​警告​吧​。\n"
"jiu4 dang1 zhe4 shi4 ge4 you3hao3 de5 jing3gao4 ba1。"

msgid "Think she’s still in the SOX?"
msgstr ""
"你​认为​她​依旧​在​萨洛​卢区​？\n"
"ni3 ren4wei2 ta1 yi1jiu4 zai4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1？"

msgid ""
"Think what you like. In the meantime, I'm going to sit here and wait for "
"Vauclair to release the dragon."
msgstr ""
"随便​你​怎么​想​。​我会​老实​待​在​这里​，​等​着​沃​克莱尔​释放​巨龙​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3。wo3 hui4 lao3shi5 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3，deng3 zhao2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 shi4fang4 ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"Third, and finally: the trouble I was in involved a girl.\n"
"\n"
"I'll tell you about it if you ask me to, but we're verging deep into \"personal feelings\" territory. So if you don't want to hear me sob over my ex-girlfriend, you'll drop the subject now."
msgstr ""
"最后​：​我​的​麻烦​和​一个​女孩​有关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​一定​要​问​我​的话​，​我会​告诉​你​，​但​我们​已经​深入​到​了​“​个人​情感​”​的​领域​。​所以​，​如果​你​不想​听​我​为​前女友​哭泣​，​现在​就别​再​提​这个​话题​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4：wo3 de5 ma2fan5 he4 yi1ge5 nu:3hai2 you3guan1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yi1ding4 yao4 wen4 wo3 de5hua4，wo3 hui4 gao4su4 ni3，dan4 wo3men5 yi3jing1 shen1ru4 dao4 le5“ge4ren2 qing2gan3” de5 ling3yu4。suo3yi3，ru2guo3 ni3 bu4xiang3 ting1 wo3 wei2 qian2nu:3you3 ku1qi4，xian4zai4 jiu4 bie4 zai4 ti2 zhe4ge5 hua4ti2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thirty-six thousand nuyen. As I told your Herr Amsel.\n"
"\n"
"That's what I have allocated for the job."
msgstr ""
"三万​六千​新円​。​我​之前​已经​告诉​了​阿姆​泽尔​先生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就是​我能​为​这项​差事​给出​的​报酬​。\n"
"\n"
"san1 wan4 liu4 qian1 xin1 yuan2。wo3 zhi1qian2 yi3jing1 gao4su4 le5 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3 neng2 wei2 zhe4 xiang4 cha4shi4 gei3 chu1 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid ""
"Thirty-six thousand nuyen. Quite an impressive sum, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I would not have bothered you with this otherwise."
msgstr ""
"整整​三万​六千​新円​。​这​是​笔​可观​的​数目​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​我​就​不会​来​打扰​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zheng3zheng3 san1 wan4 liu4 qian1 xin1 yuan2。zhe4 shi4 bi3 ke3guan1 de5 shu4mu4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 lai2 da3rao3 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"This \"I'm the boss\" approach that you're taking? Not professional, and not the way to get on my good side.\n"
"\n"
"Talk to me later, when you've grown up."
msgstr ""
"就​你​这种​“​我​是​老大​”​的​态度​？​够​业余​，​我​对此​无感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​你​成熟​点​再​来说​这事​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 ni3 zhe4zhong3“wo3 shi4 lao3da4” de5 tai4du5？gou4 ye4yu2，wo3 dui4 ci3 wu2gan3。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ni3 cheng2shu2 dian3 zai4 lai2 shuo1 zhe4 shi4 ba1。"

msgid "This \"thing\" is our payday, Glory. Explain yourself."
msgstr ""
"这​“​东西​”​是​咱们​的​薪水​，​格洛丽​。​你​得​解释一下​。\n"
"zhe4“dong1xi1” shi4 zan2men5 de5 xin1shui3，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 de2 jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4。"

msgid ""
"This *is* a professional relationship. And the last thing I want is to hear "
"about your love life."
msgstr ""
"我们​之间​本来​就是​专业​关系​。​而且​我​一点​也​不想​打听​你​的​感情生活​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1jian1 ben3lai2 jiu4shi4 zhuan1ye4 guan1xi5。er2qie3 wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4xiang3 da3ting5 ni3 de5 gan3 qing2 sheng1 huo2。"

msgid ""
"This *thing* that I met is protecting the Harfeld Manor. And it's going "
"after anyone who gets too close to what's happening there."
msgstr ""
"我​遭遇​的​这​一​*​存在​*​正在​保护​哈​菲尔德​庄园​。​它​不会​放过​任何​深入调查​此事​的​人​。\n"
"wo3 zao1yu4 de5 zhe4 yi1*cun2zai4*zheng4zai4 bao3hu4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2。ta1 bu4hui4 fang4guo4 ren4he2 shen1 ru4 diao4 cha2 ci3shi4 de5 ren2。"

msgid "This Adversary sounds like a pretty reasonable guy."
msgstr ""
"这个​“​反叛者​”​听​起来​倒​挺​通情达理​啊​。\n"
"zhe4ge5“fan3 pan4 zhe3” ting1 qi3lai5 dao3 ting3 tong1qing2da2li3 a1。"

msgid ""
"This Content Pack, {0} ({1}) requires game version {2:0.0###} or higher, but you have {3:0.0###}.\n"
"\n"
"Please update your game in order to play this Content Pack."
msgstr ""
"此​内容​包​{​0​}​（​{​1​}​）​需要​游戏​版本​{​2​:​0​.​0​#​#​#​}​或​更​高​，​但​你​的​版本​是​{​3​:​0​.​0​#​#​#​}​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​更新​游戏​以​游玩​此​内容​包​。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 nei4rong2 bao1 {0} （{ 1 }） xu1yao4 you2xi4 ban3ben3 { 2:0 . 0 # # # } huo4 geng1 gao1，dan4 ni3 de5 ban3ben3 shi4 { 3:0 . 0 # # # }。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 geng1xin1 you2xi4 yi3 you2wan2 ci3 nei4rong2 bao1。"

msgid ""
"This Cyberzombie's control system is very similar to a standard - albeit high-end - drone rigging interface.\n"
"\n"
"It looks as though it should be a fairly simple task to rig into it. It will still drive itself. However, your drone control rig should allow it to react to your commands much faster."
msgstr ""
"赛博​僵尸​的​中​控系统​跟​常规​的​无人机​控制​界面​差不多​－​－​虽然​更​高端​些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​接入​它​看起来​应该​相当​容易​。​它​依然​可以​自行​驱动​，​但​你​的​无人机​控制​装置​应该​能​让​它​更​快​响应​你​的​指令​。\n"
"\n"
"sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 de5 zhong4 kong4 xi4 tong3 gen1 chang2gui1 de5 wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4 jie4mian4 cha4bu5duo1 － － sui1ran2 geng1 gao1duan1 xie1。\n"
"\n"
"jie1ru4 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 ying1gai1 xiang1dang1 rong2yi4。ta1 yi1ran2 ke3yi3 zi4xing2 qu1dong4，dan4 ni3 de5 wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4 zhuang1zhi4 ying1gai1 neng2 rang4 ta1 geng1 kuai4 xiang3ying4 ni3 de5 zhi3ling4。"

msgid "This Harrow is beginning to sound a lot like a cult leader."
msgstr ""
"这个​哈罗​听​起来​怎么​像是​邪教​首领​啊​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 ha1luo2 ting1 qi3lai5 zen3me5 xiang4 shi4 xie2jiao4 shou3ling3 a1。"

msgid ""
"This LTG tech's coveralls are smeared with sweat and grime. A scowl is plastered across her face.\n"
"\n"
"She takes a quick glance at you, then turns back to her work."
msgstr ""
"这名​LTG​技工​的​连体​工作服​沾满​了​汗水​和​污垢​。​她​的​脸上​挂​着​阴沉​的​表情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​匆匆​瞥​了​你​一眼​，​随即​又​转​回身​继续​手头​的​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ming2 LTG ji4gong1 de5 lian2ti3 gong1zuo4fu2 zhan1man3 le5 han4shui3 he4 wu1gou4。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yin1chen2 de5 biao3qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 cong1cong1 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，sui2ji2 you4 zhuai3 hui2 shen1 ji4xu4 shou3tou2 de5 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"This MKVI PROTOTYPE is the exclusive property of AG CHEMIE EUROPA. Unauthorized access is prohibited.\n"
"\n"
"To put the prototype into Demonstration Mode, you may activate its systems from the following menu. Alternately, the system can be directly piloted via a remote control rig.\n"
"\n"
"Press any key to continue."
msgstr ""
"本​MKVI​原型机​为​欧洲​化工​私有​资产​。​未经​允许​，​禁止​访问​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可​通过​以下​菜单​激活​系统​，​将​原型机​切换​至​演示​模式​，​亦可​通过​遥控装置​直接​操控​系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​按​任意键​继续​。\n"
"\n"
"ben3 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 wei2 ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 si1you3 zi1chan3。wei4jing1 yun3xu3，jin4zhi3 fang3wen4。\n"
"\n"
"ke3 tong1guo4 yi3xia4 cai4dan1 ji1huo2 xi4tong3，jiang1 yuan2 xing2 ji1 qie1huan4 zhi4 yan3shi4 mo2shi4，yi4 ke3 tong1guo4 yao2 kong4 zhuang1 zhi4 zhi2jie1 cao1kong4 xi4tong3。\n"
"\n"
"an4 ren4 yi4 jian4 ji4xu4。"

msgid ""
"This TRAITOR associates with MONGREL FILTH!\n"
"\n"
"If you listen to him, you will be BETRAYING YOUR PEOPLE!"
msgstr ""
"这个​叛徒​与​杂种​败类​为伍​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​听​他​的话​，​就是​背叛​同胞​！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 pan4tu2 yu4 za2zhong3 bai4lei4 wei2wu3！\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 ting1 ta1 de5hua4，jiu4shi4 bei4pan4 tong2bao1！"

msgid ""
"This again? I already told you, your lives are your own now. Quit "
"complaining and start living them."
msgstr ""
"怎么​又​说​这话​？​我​已经​说​过​了​，​你们​的​生命​现在​属于​你们​自己​。​不要​再​继续​抱怨​了​，​好好​过​完​这辈子​吧​。\n"
"zen3me5 you4 shuo1 zhe4 hua4？wo3 yi3jing1 shuo1 guo4 le5，ni3men5 de5 sheng1ming4 xian4zai4 shu3yu2 ni3men5 zi4ji3。bu4yao4 zai4 ji4xu4 bao4yuan4 le5，hao3hao3 guo4 wan2 zhe4 bei4 zi3 ba1。"

msgid "This again? Why do you even care, $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"又​来​？​$(l.name)​，​你​关心​这个​干嘛​？\n"
"you4 lai2？$(l.name)，ni3 guan1xin1 zhe4ge5 gan4ma2？"

msgid ""
"This appears to be a pile of crumbling papers, but it is too dark to read "
"them."
msgstr ""
"这​看似​是​一堆​破碎​的​纸张​，​但​光线​太暗​无法​辨认​内容​。\n"
"zhe4 kan4si4 shi4 yi1dui1 po4sui4 de5 zhi3zhang1，dan4 guang1xian4 tai4 an4 wu2fa3 bian4ren4 nei4rong2。"

msgid "This appears to be a pile of crumbling papers."
msgstr ""
"这​看似​是​一堆​破碎​的​纸张​。\n"
"zhe4 kan4si4 shi4 yi1dui1 po4sui4 de5 zhi3zhang1。"

msgid ""
"This appears to be a standard terminal. A login prompt glows on the screen."
msgstr ""
"这​似乎​是​一台​标准​终端​。​屏幕​上​闪烁着​登录​提示符​。\n"
"zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 yi1 tai2 biao1zhun3 zhong1duan1。ping2mu4 shang4 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 deng1lu4 ti2 shi4 fu2。"

msgid ""
"This appears to be an old U-Bahn information terminal. Judging by the "
"system's design and current condition, it is quite old."
msgstr ""
"这​似乎​是​一处​老式​地铁​信息​终端​。​从​系统​设计​和​目前​状况​来看​，​它​已经​相当​老旧​了​。\n"
"zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 yi1 chu3 lao3shi4 di4tie3 xin4xi1 zhong1duan1。cong2 xi4tong3 she4ji4 he4 mu4qian2 zhuang4kuang4 lai2 kan4，ta1 yi3jing1 xiang1dang1 lao3jiu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"This appears to be an old radio control box. It has a simple, one-line LED "
"readout and several plastic buttons with labels."
msgstr ""
"这​似乎​是​个旧​无线电​控制​盒​。​上面​有个​简单​的​单行​LED​显示屏​，​以及​几个​带​标签​的​塑料​按钮​。\n"
"zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 ge4jiu4 wu2xian4dian4 kong4zhi4 he2。shang4mian4 you3 ge4 jian3dan1 de5 dan1xing2 LED xian3shi4ping2，yi3ji2 ji3ge5 dai4 biao1qian1 de5 su4liao4 an4niu3。"

msgid ""
"This approach has helped to increase the formula's absorbtion rate, as well as significantly reducing incidences of rejection.\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, it also rules out an easily mass-produced product, but I am convinced that the results will justify the additional costs."
msgstr ""
"这样一来​，​配方​的​吸收​速率​得到​了​提升​，​同时​显著​降低​了​排斥​反应​的​发生率​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​遗憾​的​是​，​这样​做​排除​了​大规模​量产​的​可能性​，​但​我​相信​实验​结果​将​证明​额外​成本​的​合理性​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4yi1lai2，pei4fang1 de5 xi1shou1 su4lu:4 de2dao4 le5 ti2sheng1，tong2shi2 xian3zhu4 jiang4di1 le5 pai2chi4 fan3ying4 de5 fa1sheng1lu:4。\n"
"\n"
"yi2han4 de5 shi4，zhe4yang4 zuo4 pai2chu2 le5 da4gui1mo2 liang4chan3 de5 ke3neng2xing4，dan4 wo3 xiang1xin4 shi2yan4 jie1guo3 jiang1 zheng4ming2 e2wai4 cheng2ben3 de5 he2li3xing4。"

msgid "This brochure shows some fun facts about Sanssouci Palace."
msgstr ""
"这本​小册子​介绍​了​一些​有关​无忧​宫​的​趣闻​。\n"
"zhe4 ben3 xiao3ce4zi5 jie4shao4 le5 yi1xie1 you3guan1 wu2 you1 gong1 de5 qu4wen2。"

msgid ""
"This cabinet is stocked with high-end medical kits. There are enough kits "
"for each member of your team to have one."
msgstr ""
"这个​柜子​里​备有​高端​急救包​，​足够​每位​队员​拿​上​一个​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 gui4zi5 li3 bei4 you3 gao1duan1 ji2jiu4bao1，zu2gou4 mei3 wei4 dui4yuan2 na2 shang4 yi1ge5。"

msgid ""
"This chamber is equipped with a small emergency medical suite. The system "
"appears to be designed to automatically treat major tissue damage in high-"
"trauma situations."
msgstr ""
"这个​房间​配备​有​小型​紧急​医疗​套件​。​该​系统​似乎​设计​用于​在​高​创伤​情况​下​自动​处理​严重​组织​损伤​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 fang2jian1 pei4bei4 you3 xiao3xing2 jin3ji2 yi1liao2 tao4jian4。gai1 xi4tong3 si4hu1 she4ji4 yong4yu2 zai4 gao1 chuang1shang1 qing2kuang4 xia4 zi4dong4 chu3li3 yan2zhong4 zu3zhi1 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"This chip seems to have been designed to prevent the Cyberzombie from exercising voluntary control over its own body.\n"
"\n"
"The implications of this are as disturbing as they are obvious: The troll that this experiment was built around is still conscious. A prisoner in his own body, locked in a cage of meat and chrome."
msgstr ""
"这枚​芯片​的​作用​似乎​是​阻止​赛博​僵尸​自主​控制​躯体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​其中​的​含义​既​显而易见​又​令人不安​：​这名​巨魔​实验​体​依然​保​有意识​。​它​被​囚禁​在​自身​的​躯壳​中​，​困于​这具​由​血肉​与​铬​合金​打造​的​牢笼​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 mei2 xin1pian4 de5 zuo4yong4 si4hu1 shi4 zu3zhi3 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 zi4zhu3 kong4zhi4 qu1ti3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 qi2zhong1 de5 han2yi4 ji4 xian3er2yi4jian4 you4 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1：zhe4 ming2 ju4mo2 shi2yan4 ti3 yi1ran2 bao3 you3yi4shi2。ta1 bei4 qiu2jin4 zai4 zi4shen1 de5 qu1qiao4 zhong4，kun4 yu2 zhe4 ju4 you2 xue4rou4 yu4 ge4 he2jin1 da3zao4 de5 lao2long2。"

msgid ""
"This classic hoverdrone can support the team with both medkits and "
"concussion grenades."
msgstr ""
"这​款​经典​无人机​既​能​搭载​医疗​箱​支援​小队​，​也​能够​装备​震荡​手雷​。\n"
"zhe4 kuan3 jing1dian3 wu2ren2ji1 ji4 neng2 da1zai4 yi1liao2 xiang1 zhi1yuan2 xiao3 dui4，ye3 neng2gou4 zhuang1bei4 zhen4dang4 shou3lei2。"

msgid ""
"This complete replacement for a user's skull grants added protection. Adds "
"+1 Armor."
msgstr ""
"这个​完全​替代​了​使用者​颅骨​的​物品​可以​提供​额外​的​保护​。​+​1​护甲​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 wan2quan2 ti4dai4 le5 shi3yong4zhe3 lu2gu3 de5 wu4pin3 ke3yi3 ti2gong1 e2wai4 de5 bao3hu4。+1 hu4jia3。"

msgid ""
"This computer is powered on, but in Sleep mode. When the screen comes to life, you find a half-written text file on the screen.\n"
"\n"
"The time stamp on the most recent edit tells you that it was written just a few minutes ago."
msgstr ""
"这台​电脑​开着​，​但是​是​睡眠​模式​。​你​唤醒​屏幕​，​发现​一份​没写​完​的​文档​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最近​编辑​的​时间​戳​显示​它​是​几分钟​前刚​写​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai2 dian4nao3 kai1 zhao2，dan4shi4 shi4 shui4mian2 mo2shi4。ni3 huan4xing3 ping2mu4，fa1xian4 yi1 fen4 mei2 xie3 wan2 de5 wen2dang4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4jin4 bian1ji2 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 ta1 shi4 ji1 fen4 zhong1 qian2 gang1 xie3 de5。"

msgid ""
"This console consists of a text entry field and a virtual keypad. Written "
"along the top of the screen in an imposing font is the word \"ARMORY.\""
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​由​文本​输入框​和​虚拟​键盘​组成​，​屏幕​顶部​以​醒目​的​字体​显示​着​“​军械库​”​一词​。\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 you2 wen2ben3 shu1 ru4 kuang4 he4 xu1ni3 jian4pan2 zu3cheng2，ping2mu4 ding3bu4 yi3 xing3mu4 de5 zi4ti3 xian3shi4 zhao2“jun1 xie4 ku4” yi1 ci2。"

msgid ""
"This console seems to control the locking mechanism for the door in front of you. A keycard reader has been set into the front bezel of the console.\n"
"\n"
"Text on the screen reads \"KEYCARD ACCESS : CLEARANCE LEVEL B.\""
msgstr ""
"这个​控制台​似乎​控制​着​你​面前​的​门锁​装置​。​控制台​前侧​的​面板​嵌入​了​一个​读卡器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​显示​的​文字​为​“​门禁卡​访问​：​B​级​权限​。​”\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 kong4zhi4tai2 si4hu1 kong4zhi4 zhao2 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 men2suo3 zhuang1zhi4。kong4zhi4tai2 qian2 ce4 de5 mian4ban3 qian4ru4 le5 yi1ge5 du2ka3qi4。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 xian3shi4 de5 wen2zi4 wei2“men2 jin1 ka3 fang3wen4：bi1 ji2 quan2xian4。”"

msgid ""
"This contact of yours, boss... we talkin' about who I think we're talkin' "
"about?"
msgstr ""
"老大​，​你​的​这位​联络人​……​是​我们​想​的​那位​吗​？\n"
"lao3da4，ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 lian2luo4ren2……shi4 wo3men5 xiang3 de5 na4 wei4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"This control panel is blown. When APEX went offline, it must have caused "
"physical damage to the estate's security systems.  "
msgstr ""
"这个​控制面板​报废​了​。​APEX​离线​时​一定​对​庄园​的​安保​系统​造成​了​物理​损坏​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 bao4fei4 le5。APEX li2xian4 shi2 yi1ding4 dui4 zhuang1yuan2 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3 zao4cheng2 le5 wu4li3 sun3huai4。"

msgid ""
"This conversation isn't over until I say it is. Tell me about the chrome."
msgstr ""
"我​说​结束​才​算​完​。​再​和​我​说​说​铬体​的​事​。\n"
"wo3 shuo1 jie2shu4 cai2 suan4 wan2。zai4 he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 ge4 ti3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"This corpse has been eviscerated. Its limbs have been torn clean off, and "
"its rib cage is oddly deformed. The tattered shreds of a blue maintenance "
"uniform hang loosely off of its chest."
msgstr ""
"这具​尸体​已经​被​开膛​破肚​，​四肢​被​干脆利落​地​扯断​，​肋骨​也​发生​了​奇异​形变​。​蓝色​维修​制服​的​碎布条​松松垮垮​地挂​在​胸前​。\n"
"zhe4 ju4 shi1ti3 yi3jing1 bei4 kai1 tang2 po4 du3，si4zhi1 bei4 gan1cui4li4luo5 de5 che3 duan4，lei4gu3 ye3 fa1sheng1 le5 qi2yi4 xing2bian4。lan2se4 wei2xiu1 zhi4fu2 de5 sui4bu4tiao2 song1 song1 kua3 kua3 de5 gua4 zai4 xiong1qian2。"

msgid ""
"This crate appears to have been pried hastily open. There is a partially-"
"torn shipping label on its side. Most of the ink has worn off, but the word "
"\"Kreuzbasar\" is still clearly visible."
msgstr ""
"这个​箱子​似乎​是​被​匆忙​撬开​的​。​它​的​侧面​有​一张​部分​破损​的​运输​标签​。​上面​的​大部分​油墨​已经​污损​了​，​但​“​克洛伊​茨​集市​”​的​字样​仍然​清晰可见​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 xiang1zi5 si4hu1 shi4 bei4 cong1mang2 qiao4kai1 de5。ta1 de5 ce4mian4 you3 yi1 zhang1 bu4fen5 po4sun3 de5 yun4shu1 biao1qian1。shang4mian4 de5 da4bu4fen5 you2mo4 yi3jing1 wu1sun3 le5，dan4“Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4” de5 zi4yang4 reng2ran2 qing1 xi1 ke3 jian4。"

msgid ""
"This cyberdeck was constructed to withstand a bomb blast. Try as you might, you can't manage to crack its casing, let alone damage its internal circuitry.\n"
"\n"
"While you beat on the deck in vain, Glory manages to yank the cord out of Monika's head. A wisp of oily blue smoke traces its way from her datajack to the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"这块​赛博碟板​的​构造​强度​甚至​能​扛​住​炸弹​袭击​。​尽管​你​努力​尝试​，​却​连​外壳​都​没​打裂​，​更​不​可能​毁掉​内部​的​电路​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​徒劳地​拍打着​碟板​的​时候​，​格洛丽​设法​把​线​从​莫妮卡​的​头上​拔​了​出来​。​一股​油腻​的​蓝色​烟雾​从​她​的​数据​插口​处​升起​，​飘向​天花板​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 kuai4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 de5 gou4zao4 qiang2du4 shen4zhi4 neng2 gang1 zhu4 zha4dan4 xi2ji1。jin3guan3 ni3 nu3li4 chang2shi4，que4 lian2 wai4ke2 dou1 mei2 da3 lie4，geng1 bu4 ke3neng2 hui3diao4 nei4bu4 de5 dian4lu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 tu2 lao2 de5 pai1 da3 zhao2 die2 ban3 de5 shi2hou5，Ge2luo4li2 she4fa3 ba3 xian4 cong2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 tou2shang4 ba2 le5 chu1lai2。yi1 gu3 you2ni4 de5 lan2se4 yan1wu4 cong2 ta1 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 chu3 sheng1qi3，piao1 xiang4 tian1hua1ban3。"

msgid ""
"This cyberskull sacrifices a user's appearance for added protection. Adds +2"
" Armor, but -1 Charisma."
msgstr ""
"该赛​博​颅骨​以​牺牲​使用者​外貌​为​代价​换取​了​额外​防护​。​+​2​护甲​，​-​1​魅力​。\n"
"gai1 sai4 bo2 lu2gu3 yi3 xi1sheng1 shi3yong4zhe3 wai4mao4 wei2 dai4jia4 huan4qu3 le5 e2wai4 fang2hu4。+2 hu4jia3，-1 mei4li4。"

msgid "This data tap’s protocol buffer is now reset."
msgstr ""
"数据​插口​的​协议​缓存​区​已​重置​完毕​。\n"
"shu4ju4 cha1kou3 de5 xie2yi4 huan3cun2 qu1 yi3 chong2zhi4 wan2bi4。"

msgid ""
"This datastore contains records of all data pertaining to the facility's "
"day-to-day operations."
msgstr ""
"这处​数据​存储​库​包含​与​该​设施​日常​运营​相关​的​所有​数据​记录​。\n"
"zhe4 chu3 shu4ju4 cun2chu3 ku4 bao1han2 yu4 gai1 she4shi1 ri4chang2 yun4ying2 xiang1guan1 de5 suo3you3 shu4ju4 ji4lu4。"

msgid ""
"This deal is keeping your pack alive, pal. Suck it up and deal with it."
msgstr ""
"朋友​，​这样​的​条件​能​让​你们​继续​活下去​。​有​什么​牢骚​就​自己​克服​一下​吧​。\n"
"peng2you5，zhe4yang4 de5 tiao2jian4 neng2 rang4 ni3men5 ji4xu4 huo2xia4qu4。you3 shen2me5 lao2sao1 jiu4 zi4ji3 ke4fu2 yi1xia4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"This desk is an oasis of order amidst the chaos of the rest of the building."
" Papers and chips are stacked neatly or filed by name and date. There's even"
" an old-fashioned coffee mug, filled with a random assortment of graphite "
"pencils and ink pens."
msgstr ""
"这张​书桌​如同​整栋​楼​混乱​环境​中​的​一片​绿洲​。​文件​和​纸屑​都​整齐​地​堆叠​着​，​或是​按​姓名​和​日期​归档​。​甚至​还有​一只​老式​咖啡杯​，​里面​随意​塞着​各种​石墨​铅笔​和​墨水笔​。\n"
"zhe4 zhang1 shu1zhuo1 ru2tong2 zheng3 dong4 lou2 hun4luan4 huan2jing4 zhong4 de5 yi1 pian1 lu:4zhou1。wen2jian4 he4 zhi3 xie4 dou1 zheng3qi2 de5 dui1die2 zhao2，huo4shi4 an4 xing4ming2 he4 ri4qi1 gui1dang4。shen4zhi4 hai2you3 yi1 zhi3 lao3shi4 ka1 fei1 bei1，li3mian4 sui2yi4 se4 zhao2 ge4zhong3 shi2mo4 qian1bi3 he4 mo4 shui3 bi3。"

msgid ""
"This desk is catastrophically messy. Candy wrappers litter its work surface,"
" and the bottom drawer is ajar."
msgstr ""
"这张​书桌​乱​得​一塌糊涂​。​糖果​包装纸​散落​在​桌面上​，​最​底下​的​抽屉​还​半开​着​。\n"
"zhe4 zhang1 shu1zhuo1 luan4 de2 yi1ta1hu2tu5。tang2guo3 bao1zhuang1zhi3 san3luo4 zai4 zhuo1 mian4 shang4，zui4 di3xia5 de5 chou1ti5 hai2 ban4 kai1 zhao2。"

msgid "This door control console has been locked down."
msgstr ""
"大门​控制台​被​封锁​了​。\n"
"da4men2 kong4zhi4tai2 bei4 feng1suo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"This door is closed and locked.\n"
"\n"
"Off to one side sits a numeric keypad."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​关​着​，​而且​上​了​锁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门​旁边​有​一个​数字键盘​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 guan1 zhao2，er2qie3 shang4 le5 suo3。\n"
"\n"
"men2 pang2bian1 you3 yi1ge5 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2。"

msgid "This door is stuck shut."
msgstr ""
"这​扇门​紧紧​关闭​着​。\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 jin3jin3 guan1bi4 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"This dossier looks like a new file. It was just uploaded about twenty minutes ago.\n"
"\n"
"Hang on a second, there's an attachment. I'll send it to you."
msgstr ""
"看起来​有份​新​文件​……​大概​20​分钟​前​刚刚​上传​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​下​，​有​份​附件​。​我​发给你​看看​。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 you3fen4 xin1 wen2jian4……da4gai4 20 fen1zhong1 qian2 gang1gang5 shang4chuan2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 xia4，you3 fen4 fu4jian4。wo3 fa1 gei3 ni3 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"This drone seems to have had its logic circuits fried. It can't do much but "
"hover in place at the moment. Maybe someone around the Kreuzbasar can help."
msgstr ""
"这架​无人机​的​逻辑电路​似乎​烧坏​了​，​目前​只能​悬停​在​原地​。​或许​克罗伊​茨​集市​有人​能​帮​上​忙​。\n"
"zhe4 jia4 wu2ren2ji1 de5 luo2 ji2 dian4 lu4 si4hu1 shao1 huai4 le5，mu4qian2 zhi3neng2 xuan2ting2 zai4 yuan2di4。huo4xu3 ke4 luo2 yi1 ci2 ji2shi4 you3ren2 neng2 bang1 shang4 mang2。"

msgid ""
"This drone's got a custom AIOS stack on it. Someone wrote code that sits on the bootloader and configures the drone to only accept commands from a specific user.\n"
"\n"
"The thing works like a computer virus, so there's no way I can rip it out unless I got another brain from this model of drone."
msgstr ""
"这架​无人机​上​有​一件​定制​AIOS​堆栈​。​有人​在​启动​加载​器上​写​了​代码​，​使得​无人机​只​接受​特定​用户​的​指令​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​东西​就​像​电脑病毒​一样​，​除非​我​从​这种​型号​的​无人机​上​找到​其他​替代品​，​否则​我​是​不​可能​把​它​取出​来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jia4 wu2ren2ji1 shang4 you3 yi1 jian4 ding4zhi4 AIOS dui1zhan4。you3ren2 zai4 qi3dong4 jia1zai4 qi4 shang4 xie3 le5 dai4ma3，shi3de5 wu2ren2ji1 zhi3 jie1shou4 te4ding4 yong4hu4 de5 zhi3ling4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 jiu4 xiang4 dian4nao3bing4du2 yi1yang4，chu2fei1 wo3 cong2 zhe4zhong3 xing2hao4 de5 wu2ren2ji1 shang4 zhao3dao4 qi2ta1 ti4dai4pin3，fou3ze2 wo3 shi4 bu4 ke3neng2 ba3 ta1 qu3chu1 lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"This dumpster looks - and smells - like it hasn't been emptied in years. A slick, oily liquid that reeks of rotting meat leaks from the corners of the corroded metal bin.\n"
"\n"
"It's possible - if unlikely - that materials from the lab were disposed of here and then forgotten."
msgstr ""
"这个​垃圾箱​的​外观​以及​气味​都​像是​多年​未曾​清理​过​了​。​腐蚀​的​金属​箱体​角落​渗出​黏腻​的​油污​液体​，​散发​着​腐肉​的​恶臭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽然​可能性​不​大​，​但​实验室​的​废弃物​说不定​曾​被​丢弃​在​此​，​而后​被​人​遗忘​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 la1ji1xiang1 de5 wai4guan1 yi3ji2 qi4wei4 dou1 xiang4 shi4 duo1nian2 wei4ceng2 qing1li3 guo4 le5。fu3shi2 de5 jin1shu3 xiang1 ti3 jiao3luo4 shen4chu1 nian2ni4 de5 you2wu1 ye4ti3，san4fa1 zhao2 fu3rou4 de5 e4chou4。\n"
"\n"
"sui1ran2 ke3neng2xing4 bu4 dai4，dan4 shi2yan4shi4 de5 fei4 qi4 wu4 shuo1bu5ding4 ceng2 bei4 diu1qi4 zai4 ci3，er2hou4 bei4 ren2 yi2wang4。"

msgid ""
"This dwarf has a distinctly Eurasian appearance. He peers up at Eiger through almond-shaped eyes; the rest of his broad face is dominated by strong Slavic features.\n"
"\n"
"He nods to himself and puts down his mug of soykaf. On the edge of the table, a plate of day-old pie cools in a haze of cigarette smoke."
msgstr ""
"这个​矮人​有着​明显​的​欧亚​混血​外表​。​他​正用​杏仁​状​的​眼睛​仰望​着​艾格尔​；​他​脸上​的​其他​部位​则​被​浓郁​的​斯拉夫​特征​所​占据​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​自言自语​地点​了​点头​，​放下​他​手中​的​豆​咖杯​。​在​桌边​，​一盘​隔夜​的​馅饼​在​烟雾​缭绕​中​逐渐​冷却​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 ai3ren2 you3zhe5 ming2xian3 de5 ou1ya4 hun4xue4 wai4biao3。ta1 zheng4yong4 xing4ren2 zhuang4 de5 yan3jing5 yang3wang4 zhao2 Ai4ge2er3 ； ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 qi2ta1 bu4wei4 ze2 bei4 nong2yu4 de5 si1la1fu1 te4zheng1 suo3 zhan4ju4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zi4yan2zi4yu3 di4dian3 le5 dian3tou2，fang4xia4 ta1 shou3 zhong4 de5 dou4 ka1 bei1。zai4 zhuo1 bian1，yi1 pan2 ge2ye4 de5 xian4bing3 zai4 yan1wu4 liao2rao4 zhong4 zhu2jian4 leng3que4。"

msgid ""
"This elevator appears to be offline. The control panel's LCD screen is "
"unlit, and its metal casing is badly dented."
msgstr ""
"这部​电梯​似乎​已​停止​运行​。​控制面板​的​液晶​显示屏​没有​亮​起​，​其​金属外壳​严重​凹陷​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4 dian4ti1 si4hu1 yi3 ting2zhi3 yun4xing2。kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 de5 ye4jing1 xian3shi4ping2 mei2you3 liang4 qi3，qi2 jin1 shu3 wai4 ke2 yan2zhong4 ao1xian4。"

msgid ""
"This elevator seems mechanically sound. That's about all it has going for it.\n"
"\n"
"Candy wrappers and used syringes litter the floor, and the handrails are inexplicably sticky.\n"
"\n"
"It would appear that cleanliness isn't a high priority for the hotel staff."
msgstr ""
"电梯​看起来​还​能​正常​工作​，​不过​也​就​这样​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​地上​到处​是​糖纸​和​用​过​的​针筒​，​而且​电梯​扶手​不知​为何​还​黏糊糊​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​对​旅馆​员工​来说​，​维持​整洁​算不上​优先​事项​。\n"
"\n"
"dian4ti1 kan4qi3lai5 hai2 neng2 zheng4chang2 gong1zuo4，bu4guo4 ye3 jiu4 zhe4yang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"di4shang5 dao4chu4 shi4 tang2 zhi3 he4 yong4 guo4 de5 zhen1tong3，er2qie3 dian4ti1 fu2shou3 bu4zhi1 wei4he2 hai2 nian2hu1hu1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 dui4 lu:3guan3 yuan2gong1 lai2 shuo1，wei2chi2 zheng3jie2 suan4 bu4 shang4 you1xian1 shi4xiang4。"

msgid ""
"This entire run is a test. I think that you're here to tempt me into losing "
"my cool. That isn't gonna happen."
msgstr ""
"这整​趟​差事​就是​一次​测试​。​我​猜​你​来​这里​是​为了​引诱​我​丧失​冷静​。​这​事​想都别想​。\n"
"zhe4 zheng3 tang1 cha4shi4 jiu4shi4 yi1ci4 ce4shi4。wo3 cai1 ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 wei4le5 yin3you4 wo3 sang4shi1 leng3jing4。zhe4 shi4 xiang3 dou1 bie4 xiang3。"

msgid ""
"This entry contains a complete breakdown of the organs waiting in cold storage to be claimed by clients and investors.\n"
"\n"
"Scanning over the list, you see a number of high-end, security-level enhancements in inventory. Bioware like this would normally run tens of thousands of nuyen; if this was what Ezkibel was commissioning Sutterlin to produce, he could undercut all of his competitors and still make an ungodly profit."
msgstr ""
"这​条​记录​详细​列出​了​冷藏库​中​等待​客户​和​投资者​认领​的​器官​清单​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​浏览​清单​后​，​你​发现​库存​中有​许多​高端​的​高​安全级别​的​改造​。​这类​生体​改造​通常​价值​数万​新円​；​如果​这些​是​埃兹​基​贝尔​委托​苏​特林​生产​的​产品​，​他​不仅​能​压低​所有​竞争对手​的​价格​，​还​能​获得​惊人​的​利润​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 ji4lu4 xiang2xi4 lie4chu1 le5 leng3 zang4 ku4 zhong4 deng3dai4 ke4hu4 he4 tou2zi1zhe3 ren4ling3 de5 qi4guan1 qing1dan1。\n"
"\n"
"liu2lan3 qing1dan1 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 ku4cun2 zhong4 you3 xu3duo1 gao1duan1 de5 gao1 an1 quan2 ji2 bie4 de5 gai3zao4。zhe4lei4 sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4 tong1chang2 jia4zhi2 shu4wan4 xin1 yuan2 ； ru2guo3 zhe4xie1 shi4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 wei3tuo1 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1chan3 de5 chan3pin3，ta1 bu4jin3 neng2 ya1di1 suo3you3 jing4zheng1dui4shou3 de5 jia4ge2，hai2 neng2 huo4de2 jing1ren2 de5 li4run4。"

msgid ""
"This entry contains a complete log of studies performed by Sutterlin employees on the products of competing biotech companies.\n"
"\n"
"Bioware samples by Universal Omnitech, Shiawase, Proteus AG, and BioGene have all gone under the knife here, and the results of each dissection have been meticulously recorded."
msgstr ""
"这​条​记录​包含​了​苏​特林​员工​对​其他​生物科技​公司​的​竞品​所​进行​研究​的​完整​日志​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​环球​全能​科技​、​幸福​集团​、​普罗​透斯​和​生物​基因​公司​的​生体​殖装​样本​都​在​这里​接受​了​解剖​，​且​每次​结果​都​被​仔细​记录下来​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 ji4lu4 bao1han2 le5 su1 te4 lin2 yuan2gong1 dui4 qi2ta1 sheng1wu4ke1ji4 gong1si1 de5 jing4pin3 suo3 jin4xing2 yan2jiu1 de5 wan2zheng3 ri4zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"huan2qiu2 quan2neng2 ke1ji4、xing4fu2 ji2tuan2、pu3luo2 tou4 si1 he4 sheng1wu4 ji1yin1 gong1si1 de5 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 dou1 zai4 zhe4li3 jie1shou4 le5 jie3pou1，qie3 mei3ci4 jie1guo3 dou1 bei4 zi3xi4 ji4 lu4 xia4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"This entry contains notes on Sutterlin's attempts to replicate products that it had previously dissected and studied.\n"
"\n"
"According to the information here, Sutterlin had achieved a shocking level of success at producing generic versions of a wide variety of commercial  - and restricted - bioware products."
msgstr ""
"这​条​记录​包含​了​苏​特林​尝试​复制​其​之前​解剖​和​研究​过​的​产品​的​相关​笔记​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​这里​的​信息​，​苏​特林​在​生产​各种​商业化​和​受限​的​生体​殖装​产品​的​通用​版本​方面​取得​了​令人震惊​的​成功​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 ji4lu4 bao1han2 le5 su1 te4 lin2 chang2shi4 fu4zhi4 qi2 zhi1qian2 jie3pou1 he4 yan2jiu1 guo4 de5 chan3pin3 de5 xiang1guan1 bi3ji4。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 zhe4li3 de5 xin4xi1，su1 te4 lin2 zai4 sheng1chan3 ge4zhong3 shang1ye4hua4 he4 shou4xian4 de5 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 chan3pin3 de5 tong1yong4 ban3ben3 fang1mian4 qu3de2 le5 ling3 ren2 zhen4 jing1 de5 cheng2gong1。"

msgid ""
"This entry contains notes on a variety of invasive test procedures that were performed on a kennel of hellhound test subjects.\n"
"\n"
"There are several memos appended to the file. Apparently, the scientists working in the Animal Testing Wing were less convinced that working with dangerous, fire-breathing animals would yield useful results than the executives were."
msgstr ""
"这​条​记录​包含​了​对​一群​地狱​猎犬​测试​对象​所​进行​的​多种​侵入​式​实验​程序​的​笔记​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​文件​末尾​还​附有​几份​备忘录​。​显然​，​相比​于​管理层​而言​，​动物​实验​部门​的​科研人员​对​与​危险​的​喷火​动物​合作​能否​取得​有效​成果​仍持​怀疑​态度​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 ji4lu4 bao1han2 le5 dui4 yi1 qun2 di4yu4 lie4quan3 ce4shi4 dui4xiang4 suo3 jin4xing2 de5 duo1zhong3 qin1ru4 shi4 shi2yan4 cheng2xu4 de5 bi3ji4。\n"
"\n"
"wen2jian4 mo4wei3 hai2 fu4 you3 ji1 fen4 bei4wang4lu4。xian3ran2，xiang1bi3 yu2 guan3 li3 ceng2 er2yan2，dong4wu4 shi2yan4 bu4men2 de5 ke1yan2ren2yuan2 dui4 yu4 wei1xian3 de5 pen1huo3 dong4wu4 he2zuo4 neng2fou3 qu3de2 you3xiao4 cheng2guo3 reng2 chi2 huai2yi2 tai4du5。"

msgid ""
"This entry covers the development of nontraditional techniques to encourage the production of monoclonal antibody cells.\n"
"\n"
"The research they're doing here focuses on mass-producing the cells by way of artificial, genetically identical lymphocytes that would act as \"factories\" for the proteins."
msgstr ""
"该​条目​介绍​了​开发​非传统​技术​以​促进​单克隆​抗体​细胞​生产​的​进展​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​在​此​开展​的​研究​重点​在于​通过​人工合成​的​、​遗传​相同​的​淋巴细胞​来​实现​细胞​的​批量生产​，​这些​淋巴细胞​将​作为​蛋白质​的​“​工厂​”​发挥作用​。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 tiao2mu4 jie4shao4 le5 kai1fa1 fei1 chuan2 tong3 ji4shu4 yi3 cu4jin4 dan1 ke4 long1 kang4ti3 xi4bao1 sheng1chan3 de5 jin4zhan3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 ci3 kai1zhan3 de5 yan2jiu1 chong2dian3 zai4yu2 tong1guo4 ren2 gong1 ge3 cheng2 de5、yi2chuan2 xiang1tong2 de5 lin2ba1xi4bao1 lai2 shi2xian4 xi4bao1 de5 pi1liang4sheng1chan3，zhe4xie1 lin2ba1xi4bao1 jiang1 zuo4wei2 dan4bai2zhi4 de5“gong1chang3” fa1 hui1 zuo4 yong4。"

msgid ""
"This entry covers the various forms of experimentation and testing performed"
" on Sutterlin's prize possession: a rare albino basilisk, acquired from an "
"exotic animals dealer in Portugal."
msgstr ""
"这​条​记录​介绍​了​对​苏​特林​的​珍贵​收藏​—​—​某​只​从​葡萄牙​的​异国​动物​商处​购得​的​珍稀​白化​蛇怪​所​进行​的​各类​试验​与​测试​。\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 ji4lu4 jie4shao4 le5 dui4 su1 te4 lin2 de5 zhen1gui4 shou1cang2——mou3 zhi3 cong2 pu2tao2ya2 de5 yi4guo2 dong4wu4 shang1 chu3 gou4de2 de5 zhen1xi1 bai2 hua4 she2 guai4 suo3 jin4xing2 de5 ge4lei4 shi4yan4 yu4 ce4shi4。"

msgid ""
"This entry details a number of projects that involve invasive testing on Awakened animals.\n"
"\n"
"There are listings for a number of hellhounds, including their complete medical histories. It appears that most of the experimental procedures listed were performed on a subject named \"Billy,\" but who - or what - Billy might be has been left undisclosed."
msgstr ""
"这​条​记录​详细描述​了​多个​涉及​对​觉醒​动物​进行​侵入​式​测试​的​项目​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​其中​列出​了​多只​地狱​猎犬​的​相关​信息​，​包括​它们​完整​的​医疗​历史​。​看起来​，​大多数​实验​程序​都​针对​一个​名为​“​比利​”​的​个体​进行​，​但​“​比利​”​究竟​是​谁​或是​什么​东西​，​却​未​被​披露​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 ji4lu4 xiang2 xi4 miao2 shu4 le5 duo1ge5 she4ji2 dui4 jue2xing3 dong4wu4 jin4xing2 qin1ru4 shi4 ce4shi4 de5 xiang4mu4。\n"
"\n"
"qi2zhong1 lie4chu1 le5 duo1 zhi3 di4yu4 lie4quan3 de5 xiang1guan1 xin4xi1，bao1kuo4 ta1men5 wan2zheng3 de5 yi1liao2 li4shi3。kan4qi3lai5，da4duo1shu4 shi2yan4 cheng2xu4 dou1 zhen1dui4 yi1ge5 ming2wei2“bi3li4” de5 ge4ti3 jin4xing2，dan4“bi3li4” jiu1jing4 shi4 shei2 huo4shi4 shen2me5 dong1xi1，que4 wei4 bei4 pi1lu4。"

msgid ""
"This entry is overflowing with complicated magical figures. It would take a "
"skilled mage to decipher it."
msgstr ""
"该​条目​充满​了​复杂​的​魔法​符号​。​恐怕​需要​一位​技艺高超​的​法师​才能​破解​它​。\n"
"gai1 tiao2mu4 chong1man3 le5 fu4za2 de5 mo2fa3 fu2hao4。kong3pa4 xu1yao4 yi1 wei4 ji4 yi4 gao1 chao1 de5 fa3shi1 cai2neng2 po4jie3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"This entry provides a complete breakdown of the \"standard\" organs that are being grown in the Organic Chemistry Wing of Sutterlin BioScience.\n"
"\n"
"It seems that the lab was outfitted with the capacity to mass-produce vat-grown metahuman organs, including hearts, kidneys, livers, and lungs. This material would then be used for testing purposes."
msgstr ""
"这​条​记录​详细​列出​了​苏​特林​生物科学​的​有机化学​部​正在​培育​的​“​标准​”​器官​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​，​这个​实验室​配备​了​大规模​生产​罐式​培育​泛​人类​器官​的​能力​，​包括​心脏​、​肾脏​、​肝脏​和​肺​。​这些​材料​将​被​用于​测试​目的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 ji4lu4 xiang2xi4 lie4chu1 le5 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 you3ji1hua4xue2 bu4 zheng4zai4 pei2yu4 de5“biao1zhun3” qi4guan1。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5，zhe4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 pei4bei4 le5 da4gui1mo2 sheng1chan3 guan4 shi4 pei2yu4 fan4 ren2lei4 qi4guan1 de5 neng2li4，bao1kuo4 xin1zang4、shen4zang4、gan1zang4 he4 fei4。zhe4xie1 cai2liao4 jiang1 bei4 yong4yu2 ce4shi4 mu4di4。"

msgid "This event was called the Dragonfall."
msgstr ""
"这件​事​被称作​“​龙​陨​”​。\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4 bei4 chen4 zuo4“long2 yun3”。"

msgid ""
"This facility is under high alert.\n"
"\n"
"Please avoid restricted areas and carry your ID at all times."
msgstr ""
"本​设施​现​处于​高度​警戒​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​远离​限制​区域​并​时刻​携带​您​的​身份证件​。\n"
"\n"
"ben3 she4shi1 xian4 chu3yu2 gao1du4 jing3jie4 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 yuan3li2 xian4zhi4 qu1yu4 bing4 shi2ke4 xie2dai4 nin2 de5 shen1 fen4 zheng4 jian4。"

msgid "This file cabinet is crammed full of Humanis propaganda."
msgstr ""
"这个​文件柜​塞满​了​人类​至上​主义者​的​宣传​资料​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 wen2 jian4 ju3 sai1man3 le5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 xuan1chuan2 zi1liao4。"

msgid ""
"This file is corrupted. The screen fills with a meaningless assortment of "
"ASCII characters."
msgstr ""
"这份​文件​已损坏​。​屏幕​上​充斥​着​各种​毫无意义​的​ASCII​字符​。\n"
"zhe4 fen4 wen2jian4 yi3 sun3 huai4。ping2mu4 shang4 chong1chi4 zhao2 ge4zhong3 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4 de5 ASCII zi4fu2。"

msgid ""
"This file is partially garbled. You can recognize a few words here and "
"there, but they're interspersed amidst a solid block of corrupted text."
msgstr ""
"这份​文件​部分​内容​混乱​。​你​可以​依稀​辨认出​几个​零星​的​单词​，​但​它们​夹杂​在​一整块​损坏​的​文本​中​。\n"
"zhe4 fen4 wen2jian4 bu4fen5 nei4rong2 hun4luan4。ni3 ke3yi3 yi1xi1 bian4 ren4 chu1 ji3ge5 ling2xing1 de5 dan1ci2，dan4 ta1men5 jia1za2 zai4 yi1 zheng3 kuai4 sun3huai4 de5 wen2ben3 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"This garbage can hasn't been emptied in a while. When you lift the lid, you "
"find the bin full to overflowing with crumpled paper and disused office "
"stationery."
msgstr ""
"这个​垃圾箱​有​阵子​没​清理​了​。​你​掀开​盖子​一看​，​桶​里​塞满​了​皱巴巴​的​纸张​和​废弃​的​办公​文具​，​几乎​要​满溢​而出​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 la1ji1xiang1 you3 zhen4zi5 mei2 qing1li3 le5。ni3 xian1kai1 gai4zi5 yi1 kan4，tong3 li3 sai1man3 le5 zhou4ba1ba1 de5 zhi3zhang1 he4 fei4qi4 de5 ban4gong1 wen2ju4，ji1hu1 yao4 man3yi4 er2 chu1。"

msgid ""
"This generic courier drone has been snapped together out of prefab parts from a dozen different manufacturers.\n"
"\n"
"It's a cheap, utilitarian thing, remarkable only in that it is so incredibly plain. A half-bright teenager could cobble something like this together in an afternoon."
msgstr ""
"这​款​通用型​快递​无人机​是​由​来自​十多家​不同​制造商​的​预制​部件​拼装​而成​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​是​一款​廉价​实用型​设备​，​唯一​值得注意​的​是​它​异常​简陋​。​一个​稍​有​头脑​的​青少年​都​能​在​一​下午​时间​内​拼装​出​类似​的​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 kuan3 tong1 yong4 xing2 kuai4di4 wu2ren2ji1 shi4 you2 lai2zi4 shi2 duo1 jia1 bu4tong2 zhi4zao4shang1 de5 yu4zhi4 bu4jian4 pin1zhuang1 er2 cheng2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 yi1 kuan3 lian2jia4 shi2 yong4 xing2 she4bei4，wei2yi1 zhi2 de2 zhu4 yi4 de5 shi4 ta1 yi4chang2 jian3lou4。yi1ge5 shao1 you3 tou2nao3 de5 qing1shao4nian2 dou1 neng2 zai4 yi1 xia4wu3 shi2jian1 nei4 pin1zhuang1 chu1 lei4si4 de5 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"This guy... my new second... his name is Plotz. He runs this building..\n"
"\n"
"Your pal Blitz is gonna meet him any second, by the way."
msgstr ""
"我​的​这位​新​副手​……​他​叫​普​洛茨​。​这栋​楼​就是​他​名下​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​那个​朋友​布里​茨​应该​马上​就​能​见到​他​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 zhe4wei4 xin1 fu4shou3……ta1 jiao4 Pu3luo4ci2。zhe4 dong4 lou2 jiu4shi4 ta1 ming2xia4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 na4ge5 peng2you5 Bu4li3ci2 ying1gai1 ma3shang4 jiu4 neng2 jian4dao4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"This is a DVD/RW... a data storage medium from the mid-2000's.\n"
"\n"
"I'm amazed that Winters was able to find a device that could play it."
msgstr ""
"这是​一张​DV​D盘​……​是​来自​千禧年​代​中期​的​数据​存储​媒介​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没想到​温特斯​居然​能​找到​播放​它​的​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 zhang1 DV D盘……shi4 lai2zi4 qian1xi3nian2 dai4 zhong1qi1 de5 shu4ju4 cun2chu3 mei2jie4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 Wen1te4si1 ju1ran2 neng2 zhao3dao4 bo1fang4 ta1 de5 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"This is a Steyr AUG-CSL multiweapon system. A very nice - and very expensive - piece of hardware.\n"
"\n"
"Yuli put a lot of after-market work into this. I don't even recognize some of the accessories he's bolted onto this thing."
msgstr ""
"这是​斯太尔​AUG​-​CSL​多功能​武器​系统​，​是​相当​好用​而且​昂贵​的​硬件​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尤里​对​它​做​了​大量​改装​工作​。​我​甚至​认不出​他​在​这​上面​安装​的​一些​配件​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 si1 tai4 er3 AUG -CSL duo1gong1neng2 wu3qi4 xi4tong3，shi4 xiang1dang1 hao3yong4 er2qie3 ang2gui4 de5 ying4jian4。\n"
"\n"
"You2li3 dui4 ta1 zuo4 le5 da4liang4 gai3zhuang1 gong1zuo4。wo3 shen4zhi4 ren4 bu4 chu1 ta1 zai4 zhe4 shang4mian4 an1zhuang1 de5 yi1xie1 pei4jian4。"

msgid ""
"This is a current-model PDA, battered and a bit bloody. The screen is cracked, and its buttons are nonfunctional.\n"
"\n"
"The last data entry is still on screen. It appears to be an email to someone named Jerry."
msgstr ""
"这是​一台​当前​型号​的​PDA​，​外观​破旧​且​有些​破损​。​屏幕​有​裂纹​，​按钮​无法​正常​使用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​仍​显示​着​最后​一次​输入​的​数据​。​看起来​是​一​封电子邮件​，​发给​名为​杰瑞​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 tai2 dang1qian2 xing2hao4 de5 PDA，wai4guan1 po4jiu4 qie3 you3xie1 po4sun3。ping2mu4 you3 lie4wen2，an4niu3 wu2fa3 zheng4chang2 shi3yong4。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 reng2 xian3shi4 zhao2 zui4hou4 yi1ci4 shu1ru4 de5 shu4ju4。kan4qi3lai5 shi4 yi1 feng1 dian4 zi3 you2 jian4，fa1gei3 ming2wei2 jie2rui4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"This is a dangerous situation. She won't hand over the parts if it takes her"
" terminal offline. That could get her hurt. Or worse."
msgstr ""
"目前​的​情况​很​危险​。​她​不愿​交出​零件​，​因为​这会​导致​她​的​终端​离线​。​而​这样一来​，​她​有​可能​会​因此​受伤​，​甚至​更糟​。\n"
"mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4 hen3 wei1xian3。ta1 bu4yuan4 jiao1chu1 ling2jian4，yin1wei4 zhe4 hui4 dao3zhi4 ta1 de5 zhong1duan1 li2xian4。er2 zhe4yang4yi1lai2，ta1 you3 ke3neng2 hui4 yin1ci3 shou4shang1，shen4zhi4 geng1 zao1。"

msgid ""
"This is a diagram of the ventilation system for this aging military bunker."
msgstr ""
"这是​老旧​军事​掩体​中​通风​系统​的​示意图​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 lao3jiu4 jun1shi4 yan3ti3 zhong4 tong1feng1 xi4tong3 de5 shi4yi4tu2。"

msgid ""
"This is a drone remote control box with both manual and direct-rig controls."
" Although its small screen is cycling error messages, it appears to be "
"partially functional. A rigger would get the most use out of equipment like "
"this."
msgstr ""
"这是​一个集​手动​控制​与​直接​操作控制​于​一体​的​无人机​遥控​箱​。​尽管​其小​屏幕​上​不断​循环​显示​错误信息​，​但​该​设备​似乎​仍​具备​部分​功能​。​对于​机师​而言​，​此类​设备​能​发挥​最大​效用​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 ge4 ji2 shou3dong4 kong4zhi4 yu4 zhi2jie1 cao1 zuo4 kong4 zhi4 yu2 yi1ti3 de5 wu2ren2ji1 yao2kong4 xiang1。jin3guan3 qi2 xiao3 ping2mu4 shang4 bu4duan4 xun2huan2 xian3shi4 cuo4 wu4 xin4 xi1，dan4 gai1 she4bei4 si4hu1 reng2 ju4bei4 bu4fen5 gong1neng2。dui4yu2 ji1shi1 er2yan2，ci3lei4 she4bei4 neng2 fa1hui1 zui4 dai4 xiao4yong4。"

msgid "This is a hotel, right? I want a room."
msgstr ""
"这​是​家​旅馆​，​对​吧​？​我要​开间​房​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 jia1 lu:3guan3，dui4 ba1？wo3 yao4 kai1jian1 fang2。"

msgid ""
"This is a large diesel generator with an electric starter. The fuel tank "
"reads 3 percent, and its readouts are dark."
msgstr ""
"这是​一台​配备​了​电动​启动器​的​大型​柴油​发电机​。​燃油箱​显示​剩余​3​%​，​且​显示屏​为​一片​黑色​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 tai2 pei4bei4 le5 dian4dong4 qi3 dong4 qi4 de5 da4xing2 chai2you2 fa1dian4ji1。ran2 you2 xiang1 xian3shi4 sheng4yu2 3 %，qie3 xian3shi4ping2 wei2 yi1 pian1 hei1se4。"

msgid ""
"This is a large diesel generator with an electric starter. The fuel tank "
"reads 3 percent, its readouts are lit, and it appears to be functional."
msgstr ""
"这是​一台​配备​了​电动​启动器​的​大型​柴油​发电机​。​燃油箱​显示​剩余​3​%​，​显示屏​亮​着​，​似乎​可以​运作​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 tai2 pei4bei4 le5 dian4dong4 qi3 dong4 qi4 de5 da4xing2 chai2you2 fa1dian4ji1。ran2 you2 xiang1 xian3shi4 sheng4yu2 3 %，xian3shi4ping2 liang4 zhao2，si4hu1 ke3yi3 yun4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"This is a large diesel generator with an electric starter. The fuel tank "
"reads empty, and its readouts are dark."
msgstr ""
"这是​一台​配备​了​电动​启动器​的​大型​柴油​发电机​。​燃油箱​显示​为空​，​且​显示屏​为​一片​黑色​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 tai2 pei4bei4 le5 dian4dong4 qi3 dong4 qi4 de5 da4xing2 chai2you2 fa1dian4ji1。ran2 you2 xiang1 xian3shi4 wei2 kong1，qie3 xian3shi4ping2 wei2 yi1 pian1 hei1se4。"

msgid ""
"This is a large diesel generator with an electric starter. The fuel tank "
"reads empty, its readouts are lit, and it appears to be functional."
msgstr ""
"这是​一台​配备​了​电动​启动器​的​大型​柴油​发电机​。​燃油箱​显示​为空​，​显示屏​亮​着​，​似乎​可以​运作​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1 tai2 pei4bei4 le5 dian4dong4 qi3 dong4 qi4 de5 da4xing2 chai2you2 fa1dian4ji1。ran2 you2 xiang1 xian3shi4 wei2 kong1，xian3shi4ping2 liang4 zhao2，si4hu1 ke3yi3 yun4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"This is a long story, $(l.name). Long and ugly and cruel.\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure that you want to hear this?"
msgstr ""
"这​故事​说来​就​话​长​了​，​$(l.name)​。​而且​是​又臭又长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​确定​要​听​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 gu4shi4 shuo1 lai2 jiu4 hua4 zhang3 le5，$(l.name)。er2qie3 shi4 you4 chou4 you4 zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 yao4 ting1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"This is a pleasant surprise. You shadowrunners have a reputation, you "
"know... amateurish, headstrong, unwilling to listen to reason--"
msgstr ""
"这倒​真是​个​意外​之喜​。​你们​暗影​狂奔​者​可是​出了名​的​……​业余​、​固执​、​不​听​劝​—​—\n"
"zhe4 dao3 zhen1shi5 ge4 yi4wai4 zhi1 xi3。ni3men5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 ke3shi4 chu1 le5 ming2 de5……ye4yu2、gu4zhi2、bu4 ting1 quan4 — —"

msgid ""
"This is a scratched and dented bathroom door, locked with a simple hydraulic locking mechanism. \n"
"\n"
"A numbered entry keypad glows softly on the door frame."
msgstr ""
"一扇​布满​划痕​和​凹陷​的​厕所​门​，​上面​仅​有​一道​简单​的​液压​锁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一块​数字键盘​在​门框​上​发着​微光​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 shan1 bu4man3 hua2hen2 he4 ao1xian4 de5 ce4suo3 men2，shang4mian4 jin3 you3 yi1dao4 jian3dan1 de5 ye4ya1 suo3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1kuai4 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2 zai4 men2kuang4 shang4 fa1 zhao2 wei1guang1。"

msgid "This is a secure facility, $(l.sir). Show your ID or move along."
msgstr ""
"这处​设施​不​对外开放​，​$(l.sir)​。​出示​你​的​证件​，​否则​赶紧​走​人​。\n"
"zhe4 chu3 she4shi1 bu4 dui4 wai4 kai1 fang4，$(l.sir)。chu1shi4 ni3 de5 zheng4jian4，fou3ze2 gan3jin3 zou3 ren2。"

msgid "This is a small barrel of diesel fuel."
msgstr ""
"是​一小​桶​柴油​。\n"
"shi4 yi1 xiao3 tong3 chai2you2。"

msgid ""
"This is a small portable gas generator with a standard pull cord. It has "
"cables running from it to the large diesel fuel tank sitting next to it. The"
" fuel gauge reads empty."
msgstr ""
"这是​一个​小型​便携式​燃气​发电机​，​配备​标准​拉绳​启动装置​。​从​发电机​延伸​出​多条​电缆​，​连接​至​其​旁边​的​大型​柴油​燃料箱​。​燃油​表​显示​为空​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1ge5 xiao3xing2 bian4xie2shi4 ran2qi4 fa1dian4ji1，pei4bei4 biao1zhun3 la1 sheng2 qi3 dong4 zhuang1 zhi4。cong2 fa1dian4ji1 yan2shen1 chu1 duo1 tiao2 dian4lan3，lian2jie1 zhi4 qi2 pang2bian1 de5 da4xing2 chai2you2 ran2 liao4 xiang1。ran2you2 biao3 xian3shi4 wei2 kong1。"

msgid ""
"This is a small portable gas generator with a standard pull cord. It has "
"cables running from it to the large diesel fuel tank sitting next to it. The"
" fuel gauge reads half-full."
msgstr ""
"这是​一个​小型​便携式​燃气​发电机​，​配备​标准​拉绳​启动装置​。​从​发电机​延伸​出​多条​电缆​，​连接​至​其​旁边​的​大型​柴油​燃料箱​。​燃油​表​显示​为​半满​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yi1ge5 xiao3xing2 bian4xie2shi4 ran2qi4 fa1dian4ji1，pei4bei4 biao1zhun3 la1 sheng2 qi3 dong4 zhuang1 zhi4。cong2 fa1dian4ji1 yan2shen1 chu1 duo1 tiao2 dian4lan3，lian2jie1 zhi4 qi2 pang2bian1 de5 da4xing2 chai2you2 ran2 liao4 xiang1。ran2you2 biao3 xian3shi4 wei2 ban4 man3。"

msgid "This is a small sealed plastic can of regular gasoline."
msgstr ""
"一个​密封​的​塑料​小罐​，​内​装​普通​汽油​。\n"
"yi1ge5 mi4feng1 de5 su4liao4 xiao3 guan4，nei4 zhuang1 pu3tong1 qi4you2。"

msgid ""
"This is a specialty item, delivered at some cost. I cannot part with it for "
"less than 50 nuyen a cup."
msgstr ""
"这是​店里​的​特色​饮品​，​运费​可不​低​。​少于​50​新円​一杯​的话​我​是​不能​卖​的​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 dian4 li3 de5 te4se4 yin3pin3，yun4fei4 ke3bu5 di1。shao3 yu2 50 xin1 yuan2 yi1 bei1 de5hua4 wo3 shi4 bu4neng2 mai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"This is a standard hotel door, locked with a simple hydraulic locking mechanism. \n"
"\n"
"A numbered entry keypad glows softly on the door frame."
msgstr ""
"一扇​标准​的​旅馆​房间​门​，​上面​仅​有​一道​简单​的​液压​锁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一块​数字键盘​在​门框​上​发着​微光​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 shan1 biao1zhun3 de5 lu:3guan3 fang2jian1 men2，shang4mian4 jin3 you3 yi1dao4 jian3dan1 de5 ye4ya1 suo3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1kuai4 shu3 zi4 jian4 pan2 zai4 men2kuang4 shang4 fa1 zhao2 wei1guang1。"

msgid ""
"This is a waste of time. Give me the amulet, or I'll take it from your "
"corpse."
msgstr ""
"这​是​在​浪费时间​。​把​护身符​交​出来​，​否则​我​就​只能​从​你​的​尸体​上​把​它​拿走​了​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。ba3 hu4shen1fu2 jiao1 chu1lai2，fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4 zhi3neng2 cong2 ni3 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 ba3 ta1 na2zou3 le5。"

msgid "This is a waste of time. We should be out looking for Green Winters."
msgstr ""
"真是​浪费时间​。​我们​还是​赶紧​去​找​格林​·​温特斯​吧​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。wo3men5 hai2shi5 gan3jin3 qu4 zhao3 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"This is about more than just us. Everyone’s in danger. The whole damn "
"F-State."
msgstr ""
"这件​事​不​只​关系​到​我们​。​整个​动荡​带​的​所有人​都​身处​危险​之中​。\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4 bu4 zhi3 guan1xi5 dao4 wo3men5。zheng3ge4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 shen1chu3 wei1xian3 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid "This is all getting way too serious. Keep your life story to yourself."
msgstr ""
"你​这样​搞​得​也​太​严肃​了​。​还是​留着​你​的​人生​故事​讲​给​自己​听​吧​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4yang4 gao3 de2 ye3 tai4 yan2su4 le5。hai2shi5 liu2 zhao2 ni3 de5 ren2sheng1 gu4shi4 jiang3 gei3 zi4ji3 ting1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"This is basic supply and demand stuff, right? It's not that tough to understand.\n"
"\n"
"If she wants my goods, she needs to repay me with goods or services. Pretty simple math. Even she can do it."
msgstr ""
"这​叫​基本​的​供需​关系​，​对​吧​？​这​没什么​难懂​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​想要​我​的​货​呢​，​就​得​拿​东西​来​跟​我​换​，​要么​给​货​，​要么​给​活儿​。​多​简单​的​算术题​啊​。​连​她​都​能算​明白​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiao4 ji1ben3 de5 gong1xu1 guan1xi5，dui4 ba1？zhe4 mei2shen2me5 nan2dong3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang3yao4 wo3 de5 huo4 ni2，jiu4 de2 na2 dong1xi1 lai2 gen1 wo3 huan4，yao4me5 gei3 huo4，yao4me5 gei3 huo2r5。duo1 jian3dan1 de5 suan4 shu4 ti2 a1。lian2 ta1 dou1 neng2 suan4 ming2bai5。"

msgid "This is beginning to sound like something out of a horror movie."
msgstr ""
"这​听​起来​简直​像是​恐怖片​里​的​情节​。\n"
"zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 jian3zhi2 xiang4 shi4 kong3bu4pian4 li3 de5 qing2jie2。"

msgid "This is beyond fucked. We need to shut this place down."
msgstr ""
"真他妈​烂透​了​。​我们​得​关掉​这​地方​。\n"
"zhen1 ta1 ma1 lan4tou4 le5。wo3men5 de2 guan1diao4 zhe4 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"This is clearly a... difficult subject. I don't know what you were hoping to achieve by bringing it up, but I promise you, you aren't going to convince me to abandon my way of life.\n"
"\n"
"Our ways here are our own. You can't change that. All that you can do is accept it and move on."
msgstr ""
"这​显然​是​个​……​棘手​的​话题​。​我​不​明白​你​提起​此事​究竟​想​达到​什么​目的​，​但​我​向​你​保证​，​你​休想​说服​我​放弃​自己​的​生活​方式​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​的​行事​方式​自有​其​道理​。​你​改变​不了​这​一点​。​你​唯一​能​做​的​就是​接受​现实​，​继续​前行​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 xian3ran2 shi4 ge4……ji2shou3 de5 hua4ti2。wo3 bu4 ming2bai5 ni3 ti2qi3 ci3shi4 jiu1jing4 xiang3 da2dao4 shen2me5 mu4di4，dan4 wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，ni3 xiu1xiang3 shuo1fu2 wo3 fang4qi4 zi4ji3 de5 sheng1huo2 fang1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 xing2shi4 fang1shi4 zi4you3 qi2 dao4li5。ni3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。ni3 wei2yi1 neng2 zuo4 de5 jiu4shi4 jie1shou4 xian4shi2，ji4xu4 qian2xing2。"

msgid ""
"This is clearly causing you pain, Glory. Y'know what? Let's back down from "
"the storytelling. I don't need to know anything more about your past to know"
" how much I value you."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​现在​明显​很​痛苦​。​这样​吧​，​我们​先​不​讲故事​了​。​我​不​需要​了解​你​的​那么​多​过去​，​也​一样​清楚​我​有​多么​珍惜​你​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 xian4zai4 ming2xian3 hen3 tong4ku3。zhe4yang4 ba1，wo3men5 xian1 bu4 jiang3 gu4 shi4 le5。wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 liao3jie3 ni3 de5 na4me5 duo1 guo4qu4，ye3 yi1yang4 qing1chu5 wo3 you3 duo1me5 zhen1xi1 ni3。"

msgid "This is different."
msgstr ""
"这​不​一样​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4 yi1yang4。"

msgid "This is extortion."
msgstr ""
"你​这​是​勒索​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi4 le4suo3。"

msgid "This is getting old. Give me the key, or I'll take it from you."
msgstr ""
"我​听​不​下去​了​。​把​钥匙​给​我​，​否则​我​就​动手​抢​了​。\n"
"wo3 ting1 bu4 xia4qu4 le5。ba3 yao4shi5 gei3 wo3，fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4 dong4shou3 qiang3 le5。"

msgid "This is getting too complicated. We should just gun the bastard down."
msgstr ""
"这太​复杂​了​。​不如​我们​直接​一​枪崩​了​那个​混蛋​。\n"
"zhe4 tai4 fu4za2 le5。bu4ru2 wo3men5 zhi2jie1 yi1 qiang1beng1 le5 na4ge5 hun2dan4。"

msgid ""
"This is getting too complicated. We should just kick in the door, round up "
"the cultists, and get them out of here."
msgstr ""
"这太​复杂​了​。​不如​我们​直接​破门而入​，​把​那些​邪教徒​抓​起来​，​然后​带​他们​离开​这里​。\n"
"zhe4 tai4 fu4za2 le5。bu4ru2 wo3men5 zhi2jie1 po4men2er2ru4，ba3 na4xie1 xie2 jiao1 tu2 zhua1 qi3lai5，ran2hou4 dai4 ta1men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"This is hopeless. Go ahead and cry over her if you want to... just make sure"
" that it's out of your system before our next run."
msgstr ""
"你​真是​没救​了​。​你​就​继续​自我​反省​吧​……​但​一定​要​在​下次​差事​之前​把​这些​情绪​都​排​干净​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 mei2jiu4 le5。ni3 jiu4 ji4xu4 zi4wo3 fan3xing3 ba1……dan4 yi1ding4 yao4 zai4 xia4ci4 cha4shi4 zhi1qian2 ba3 zhe4xie1 qing2xu4 dou1 pai2 gan1jing4。"

msgid ""
"This is important for you, Glory. After everything we've been through, I "
"think that we both know that. Whatever you have to tell me, I'm ready to "
"listen."
msgstr ""
"这​对​你​来说​很​重要​，​格洛丽​。​在​我们​一起​经历​这么​多​之后​，​我​认为​我们​都​明白​这​一点​。​不管​你​打算​要说​什么​，​我​都​做好​准备​倾听​了​。\n"
"zhe4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 hen3 zhong4yao4，Ge2luo4li2。zai4 wo3men5 yi1qi3 jing1li4 zhe4me5 duo1 zhi1hou4，wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 dou1 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3。bu4guan3 ni3 da3suan4 yao4shuo1 shen2me5，wo3 dou1 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4 qing1ting1 le5。"

msgid ""
"This is it. The interview. Took some digging to find it, but here he is... "
"my big brother, back in his prime."
msgstr ""
"总算​有​了​。​当年​的​采访​。​费​了​我​好​大劲​才​找到​，​但​他​就​在​这里​……​我​的​兄长​，​那个​意气风发​的​时刻​。\n"
"zong3suan4 you3 le5。dang1nian2 de5 cai3fang3。fei4 le5 wo3 hao3 dai4 jin4 cai2 zhao3dao4，dan4 ta1 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3……wo3 de5 xiong1zhang3，na4ge5 yi4qi4feng1fa1 de5 shi2ke4。"

msgid ""
"This is it... the place where the magic happened.\n"
"\n"
"Feels a lot bigger now that the dragon's gone."
msgstr ""
"就是​这里​……​奇迹​发生​的​地方​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​巨龙​不​在​了​，​这​地方​看起来​大多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 zhe4li3……qi2ji4 fa1sheng1 de5 di4fang1。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ju4long2 bu4 zai4 le5，zhe4 di4fang1 kan4qi3lai5 da4duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"This is just another method of killing us. And if, through some miracle, we should survive, you will be killing many others.\n"
"\n"
"We will have to hunt, and people will die.\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure that this is what you want?"
msgstr ""
"反正​我们​无论如何​都​是​会​死​的​。​而​如果​有​奇迹​发生​，​让​我们​幸免于难​的话​，​你​就​会​面对​我们​的​更​多​同类​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​仍然​不得不​去​狩猎​，​会​有​无辜​的​人类​死去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​确定​这​是​你​想要​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 wo3men5 wu2lun4ru2he2 dou1 shi4 hui4 si3 de5。er2 ru2guo3 you3 qi2ji4 fa1sheng1，rang4 wo3men5 xing4 mian3 yu2 nan2 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 hui4 mian4dui4 wo3men5 de5 geng1 duo1 tong2lei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 reng2ran2 bu4de2bu4 qu4 shou4lie4，hui4 you3 wu2gu1 de5 ren2lei4 si3qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 zhe4 shi4 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"This is just sad.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, boss. Those bioware samples aren't gonna stay frozen forever."
msgstr ""
"这​真让人​难过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​老大​。​这些​生体​殖装​样本​会​解冻​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhen1 rang4 ren2 nan2guo4。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，lao3da4。zhe4xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 hui4 jie3dong4 de5。"

msgid ""
"This is muddying the waters a little too much for my tastes. I was happier "
"when I thought that the Adversary was the Devil."
msgstr ""
"这种​说法​在我看来​有些​混淆视听​。​我​更​乐意​相信​反叛者​就是​魔鬼​本身​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shuo1fa3 zai4wo3kan4lai2 you3xie1 hun4xiao2shi4ting1。wo3 geng1 le4yi4 xiang1xin4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 jiu4shi4 mo2gui3 ben3shen1。"

msgid ""
"This is my \"Tribute to Victory\"... the victory of anarchy. \n"
"\n"
"It is both a citation and parody of the statue we destroyed some twenty years ago. You may remember it from the history trids as the Siegessäule. Or Goldelse."
msgstr ""
"这​是​我​的​“​胜利​颂​”​……​称颂​无政府主义​的​胜利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​既​是​对​二十年​前​我们​摧毁​的​那座​雕像​的​致敬​，​也​是​对​其​的​戏仿​。​你们​或许​从​历史​三维​影像​中​记得​它​—​—​那座​胜利​纪念柱​，​或者说​“​黄金​少女​”​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5“sheng4li4 song4”……cheng1song4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 de5 sheng4li4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ji4 shi4 dui4 er4 shi2 nian2 qian2 wo3men5 cui1hui3 de5 na4 zuo4 diao1xiang4 de5 zhi4jing4，ye3 shi4 dui4 qi2 de5 xi4fang3。ni3men5 huo4xu3 cong2 li4shi3 san1wei2 ying3xiang4 zhong4 ji4de5 ta1——na4 zuo4 sheng4li4 ji4 nian4 zhu4，huo4 zhe3 shuo1“huang2jin1 shao4nu:3”。"

msgid ""
"This is my *life's work*.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He spits out the words.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
" And it is a risk *worth taking*. "
msgstr ""
"这​是​我​的​*​毕生​心血​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​一字一顿​地​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​也​是​*​值得​承担​*​的​风险​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5*bi4sheng1 xin1xue4*。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 zi4 yi1 dun4 de5 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ye3 shi4*zhi2de5 cheng2dan1*de5 feng1xian3。"

msgid ""
"This is my offer to you - lay down your weapons, make yourself comfortable, and remain right where you are until the dragon has been released. Audran will watch you for the duration.\n"
"\n"
"If you do this - if you prove your sincerity - then we can talk. Otherwise, this conversation is over."
msgstr ""
"这​是​我​对​你​的​提议​—​—​放下​武器​，​在​原地​好好​待​着​，​直到​巨龙​被​释放​。​奥​德兰​会​全程​监视​你们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​这样​做​—​—​如果​你​证明​你​的​诚意​—​—​那么​我们​可以​谈谈​。​否则​，​这次​对话​到此为止​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 ti2yi4——fang4xia4 wu3qi4，zai4 yuan2di4 hao3hao3 dai1 zhao2，zhi2dao4 ju4long2 bei4 shi4fang4。Ao4de2lan2 hui4 quan2cheng2 jian1shi4 ni3men5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhe4yang4 zuo4——ru2guo3 ni3 zheng4ming2 ni3 de5 cheng2yi4——na4me5 wo3men5 ke3yi3 tan2tan2。fou3ze2，zhe4 ci4 dui4hua4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3。"

msgid "This is no life for a child. She's in a better place."
msgstr ""
"孩子​不该​受​这种​罪​。​她​现在​去​了​更好​的​地方​。\n"
"hai2zi5 bu4gai1 shou4 zhe4zhong3 zui4。ta1 xian4zai4 qu4 le5 geng1 hao3 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"This is not a business for bleeding hearts or free-thinkers, $(l.name). The people at the top of the ladder are the decision-makers.\n"
"\n"
"People like you and me are nothing more than convenient sets of hands."
msgstr ""
"这​一行​不​适合​心软​的​人​或​爱​胡思乱想​的​人​，​$(l.name)​。​天梯​顶端​的​人才​是​决策者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​像​你​我​这样​的​人​不过​是​趁手​的​劳动力​罢了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1xing2 bu4 shi4he2 xin1ruan3 de5 ren2 huo4 ai4 hu2si1luan4xiang3 de5 ren2，$(l.name)。tian1ti1 ding3duan1 de5 ren2cai2 shi4 jue2ce4zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 ni3 wo3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2 bu4guo4 shi4 chen4shou3 de5 lao2dong4li4 ba4le5。"

msgid ""
"This is not a world of absolutes, young $(l.race). I would not call the Adversary \"evil\" any sooner than I would a more conventional totem, like Shark or Bear.\n"
"\n"
"All can be destructive, yes, and cruel. But none are intrinsically so."
msgstr ""
"这​世界​并​不是​非黑​即​白​，​年轻​的​$(l.race)​。​在​我​眼中​，​反叛者​并不比​鲨鱼​或​熊​这样​的​常规​图腾​更为​“​邪恶​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​一切​事物​都​可能​具有​破坏性​，​也​可能​很​残酷​。​但​它们​本身​并非​天生​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4jie4 bing4 bu4shi4 fei1 hei1 ji2 bai2，nian2qing1 de5 $(l.race)。zai4 wo3 yan3zhong1，fan3 pan4 zhe3 bing4 bu4 bi3 sha1yu2 huo4 xiong2 zhe4yang4 de5 chang2gui1 tu2teng2 geng4wei2“xie2e4”。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，yi1qie4 shi4wu4 dou1 ke3neng2 ju4you3 po4huai4xing4，ye3 ke3neng2 hen3 can2ku4。dan4 ta1men5 ben3shen1 bing4fei1 tian1sheng1 ru2ci3。"

msgid "This is obviously a trick. Don't listen to it."
msgstr ""
"这​显然​是​个​骗局​。​别​听​它​的​。\n"
"zhe4 xian3ran2 shi4 ge4 pian4ju2。bie4 ting1 ta1 de5。"

msgid ""
"This is pathetic. You go ahead and cry this out... just make sure it's out "
"of your system before our next run."
msgstr ""
"真是​可悲​。​你​就​继续​自我​反省​吧​……​但​一定​要​在​下次​差事​之前​把​这些​情绪​都​排​干净​。\n"
"zhen1shi5 ke3bei1。ni3 jiu4 ji4xu4 zi4wo3 fan3xing3 ba1……dan4 yi1ding4 yao4 zai4 xia4ci4 cha4shi4 zhi1qian2 ba3 zhe4xie1 qing2xu4 dou1 pai2 gan1jing4。"

msgid ""
"This is probably gonna surprise you... but I'm happy that the MKVI is dead.\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, Herr Schmidt was pissed. And sure, our reputation got dinged. Neither of those are good things. But I'll take them over being a part of what they were doing to that troll any day.\n"
"\n"
"Walking out of a run with a clean conscience is a rare pleasure. Savor it while you can."
msgstr ""
"说​出来​你​可能​不​信​……​其实​我​很​高兴​MKVI​能​就此​死去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​施密特​先生​大为​恼火​，​我们​的​声誉​也​受到​了​影响​，​这些​都​不是​什么​好事​。​但​比起​和​他们​同流合污​，​成为​谋害​那个​巨魔​的​幕后​黑手​，​我​宁愿​承受​这些​后果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​能​问心无愧​地​完成​差事​，​是​一种​难得​的​享受​。​趁现在​好好​珍惜​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 chu1lai2 ni3 ke3neng2 bu4 xin4……qi2shi2 wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 MKVI neng2 jiu4ci3 si3qu4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 da4wei2 nao3huo3，wo3men5 de5 sheng1yu4 ye3 shou4dao4 le5 ying3xiang3，zhe4xie1 dou1 bu4shi4 shen2me5 hao3shi4。dan4 bi3qi3 he4 ta1men5 tong2liu2he2wu1，cheng2wei2 mou2hai4 na4ge5 ju4mo2 de5 mu4hou4 hei1shou3，wo3 ning4yuan4 cheng2shou4 zhe4xie1 hou4guo3。\n"
"\n"
"neng2 wen4xin1wu2kui4 de5 wan2cheng2 cha4shi4，shi4 yi1zhong3 nan2de2 de5 xiang3shou4。chen4 xian4 zai4 hao3hao3 zhen1xi1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"This is ridiculous.\n"
"\n"
"Clear the comm, rookie. *Now.*"
msgstr ""
"这太扯​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​给​我​退出​通讯​，​菜鸟​。​*​现在​就​滚​。​*\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai4 che3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gei3 wo3 tui4chu1 tong1xun4，cai4niao3。*xian4zai4 jiu4 gun3。*"

msgid ""
"This is ridiculous. You're on a run with a deadline, and you're rooting "
"around in a trash can."
msgstr ""
"这太​荒唐​了​。​我们​的​时间​本​就​不​多​，​你​居然​还有​闲心​翻​垃圾箱​。\n"
"zhe4 tai4 huang1tang2 le5。wo3men5 de5 shi2jian1 ben3 jiu4 bu4 duo1，ni3 ju1ran2 hai2you3 xian2xin1 fan1 la1ji1xiang1。"

msgid ""
"This is sick. You really think that gassing a bunch of metas is going to "
"make people think that you're a hero?"
msgstr ""
"这太​恶心​了​，​你​真​以为​毒害​一群​变​人类​就​能​让​人们​把​你​当​英雄​？\n"
"zhe4 tai4 e3xin1 le5，ni3 zhen1 yi3wei2 du2hai4 yi1 qun2 bian4 ren2lei4 jiu4 neng2 rang4 ren2men5 ba3 ni3 dang1 ying1xiong2？"

msgid ""
"This is such a simple task, I can't imagine that it would. All that we need you to do is whisper a phrase into his ear.\n"
"\n"
"\"We are pleased that Project Vincent is going so well.\""
msgstr ""
"这​差事​简直​轻而易举​，​我​实在​无法​想象​会出​问题​。​我们​只​需要​你​在​他​耳边​轻声​说​一句​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​我们​很​高兴​文森特​计划​进展​顺利​。​”\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 cha4shi4 jian3zhi2 qing1er2yi4ju3，wo3 shi2zai4 wu2fa3 xiang3xiang4 hui4 chu1 wen4ti2。wo3men5 zhi3 xu1yao4 ni3 zai4 ta1 er3 bian1 qing1sheng1 shuo1 yi1ju4：\n"
"\n"
"“wo3men5 hen3 gao1xing4 wen2 sen1 te4 ji4hua4 jin4zhan3 shun4li4。”"

msgid ""
"This is the initiates' dormitory. The new arrivals are brought here.\n"
"\n"
"There's still hope for these kids, $(l.name)... Harrow hasn't had a chance to ruin them yet."
msgstr ""
"这里​是​学徒​们​的​宿舍​。​新人​都​会​被​带到​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​这些​孩子​还有​救​……​哈罗​还​没​来得及​祸害​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 shi4 xue2tu2 men5 de5 su4she4。xin1ren2 dou1 hui4 bei4 dai4 dao4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，zhe4Xie1hai2zi5 hai2you3 jiu4……ha1luo2 hai2 mei2 lai2de5ji2 huo4hai4 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"This is the same man you met in the market, but the friendliness is gone "
"from his face. In its place is a cold, unwavering gaze."
msgstr ""
"这​还是​你​在​市场​见到​的​那个​男人​，​但​他​脸上​的​友善​荡然无存​，​取而代之​的​是​一副​冰冷​严峻​的​目光​。\n"
"zhe4 hai2shi5 ni3 zai4 shi4chang3 jian4dao4 de5 na4ge5 nan2ren2，dan4 ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 you3shan4 dang4ran2wu2cun2，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 yi1 fu4 bing1leng3 yan2jun4 de5 mu4guang1。"

msgid "This is the vault door control node."
msgstr ""
"这是​保险库​门​的​控制​节点​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 bao3 xian3 ku4 men2 de5 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3。"

msgid ""
"This is top-of-the-line 'ware that we're talking about, mind you. Better than anything else that I've got in stock. And because it's biotech, the essence loss from implanting it will be minimal.\n"
"\n"
