"zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1 de5 suo3 zai4 zhi1 chu3。ta1 bei4 guan1ya1 zai4 yi1 chu3 ming2jiao4“Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2” de5 pian1yuan3 zhai2di3 li3。"

msgid "This is why some ask me to fight. And this is why I refuse."
msgstr ""
"这​就是​为什么​有人​想​我​去​战斗​。​这​也​是​为什么​我会​拒绝​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wei4shen2me5 you3ren2 xiang3 wo3 qu4 zhan4dou4。zhe4 ye3 shi4 wei4shen2me5 wo3 hui4 ju4jue2。"

msgid "This is worse, but not by much."
msgstr ""
"没​这么​糟​，​但​也​没​比​这​好​多少​。\n"
"mei2 zhe4me5 zao1，dan4 ye3 mei2 bi3 zhe4 hao3 duo1shao3。"

msgid ""
"This is your command, $(l.name). I can't force you to do the right thing.\n"
"\n"
"But you sure as *hell* know that this is wrong."
msgstr ""
"指挥权​在​你​，​$(l.name)​。​我​不能​强迫​你​去​做​正确​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​*​肯定​*​知道​这是​错误​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 hui1 quan2 zai4 ni3，$(l.name)。wo3 bu4neng2 qiang3po4 ni3 qu4 zuo4 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3*ken3ding4*zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 cuo4wu4 de5。"

msgid "This is your run - I won't argue with you. So what do we do first?"
msgstr ""
"这​是​你​发起​的​行动​，​我​不会​和​你​争​。​所以​我们​要​先​做​什么​？\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 fa1qi3 de5 xing2dong4，wo3 bu4hui4 he4 ni3 zheng1。suo3yi3 wo3men5 yao4 xian1 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"This is your run, Glory - I'm just here to help you see it through. So what "
"do we do first?"
msgstr ""
"这​是​你​发起​的​行动​，​格洛丽​。​我​就是​个​帮手​。​所以​我们​要​先​做​什么​？\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 fa1qi3 de5 xing2dong4，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 jiu4shi4 ge4 bang1shou5。suo3yi3 wo3men5 yao4 xian1 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"This is your show, chief.\n"
"\n"
" Whatever you choose to do, I'll come along for the ride."
msgstr ""
"这件​事由​你​主导​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​你​怎么​选​，​我​都​会​一起​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4you2 ni3 zhu3dao3，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 zen3me5 xuan3，wo3 dou1 hui4 yi1qi3 de5。"

msgid ""
"This is your show, chief.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever you choose to do, I'll come along for the ride."
msgstr ""
"这件​事由​你​主导​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​你​怎么​选​，​我​都​会​一起​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4you2 ni3 zhu3dao3，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 zen3me5 xuan3，wo3 dou1 hui4 yi1qi3 de5。"

msgid ""
"This is your target: Sutterlin BioScience.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever happened here - whatever might *still* be happening here - the bioware that you've been sent to find lies somewhere inside."
msgstr ""
"这里​就是​你​的​目标​：​苏​特林​生物科学​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​这里​曾经​发生​过​，​或​*​仍​在​*​发生​着​什么​，​你​此行​前来​寻找​的​生体​殖装​就​藏​在​这座​建筑​里​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 jiu4shi4 ni3 de5 mu4biao1：su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 zhe4li3 ceng2jing1 fa1sheng1 guo4，huo4*reng2 zai4*fa1sheng1 zhao2 shen2me5，ni3 ci3xing2 qian2lai2 xun2zhao3 de5 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 jiu4 zang4 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 jian4zhu4 li3。"

msgid ""
"This is your team, and you may lead it however you see fit. But if the word gets out that you betrayed a client, our other job prospects are going to vanish, and we can't afford to have that happen.\n"
"\n"
"We NEED the information that Alice is gathering for us, and if we can't afford to pay her, we'll never get our hands on it."
msgstr ""
"你​是​队长​，​你​想​怎么​带队​是​你​的​事​。​但​如果​你​背叛​客户​的​消息​传出去​的话​，​我们​就别​想​再​接到​其他​差事​了​。​我们​承担​不起​这样​的​后果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​爱丽丝​为​我们​收集​情报​，​但​如果​我们​付不起​酬金​，​她​是​不会​松口​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 dui4zhang3，ni3 xiang3 zen3me5 dai4dui4 shi4 ni3 de5 shi4。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 bei4pan4 ke4hu4 de5 xiao1xi5 chuan2 chu1 qu4 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 bie4 xiang3 zai4 jie1dao4 qi2ta1 cha4shi4 le5。wo3men5 cheng2dan1 bu4 qi3 zhe4yang4 de5 hou4guo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 ai4li4si1 wei2 wo3men5 shou1ji2 qing2bao4，dan4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 fu4 bu4 qi3 chou2jin1，ta1 shi4 bu4hui4 song1kou3 de5。"

msgid "This isn't a BTL. BTLs don't make you cave your own skull in."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​BTL​。​一般​的​BTL​不​可能​会​让​你​把​自己​的​脑袋​撞烂​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 BTL。yi1ban1 de5 BTL bu4 ke3neng2 hui4 rang4 ni3 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 nao3dai5 zhuang4lan4。"

msgid ""
"This isn't a small detail, Blitz. If you don't get that door open, we're "
"going to die in here."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​什么​小​细节​，​布里​茨​。​如果​你​不​把门​弄开​的话​，​我们​就​要死​在​这里​了​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 xiao3 xi4jie2，Bu4li3ci2。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 ba3men2 long4 kai1 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 yao4si3 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid "This isn't a tour, I'm afraid."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​这​不是​什么​旅游​。\n"
"kong3pa4 zhe4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 lu:3you2。"

msgid ""
"This isn't about you, Dietrich. It's about the people who might have died if"
" we'd set the Firewing go."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​为了​你​自己​，​迪​特里​希​。​这是​为了​所有​不会​因为​火翼​而​死​的​人​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 wei4le5 ni3 zi4ji3，Di2te4li3xi1。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 suo3you3 bu4hui4 yin1wei4 Huo3yi4 er2 si3 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"This isn't about you. I don't care what *you* do, Marta. I'm talking about "
"child abuse."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​这​与​你​无关​。​我​不在乎​*​你​*​做​什么​。​我​指​的​是​虐待​儿童​的​行为​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，zhe4 yu4 ni3 wu2guan1。wo3 bu4zai4hu5*ni3*zuo4 shen2me5。wo3 zhi3 de5 shi4 nu:e4dai4 er2tong2 de5 xing2wei2。"

msgid "This isn't getting us to your meeting any faster."
msgstr ""
"这样​做​不会​让​你​更​快赶​去​开会​。\n"
"zhe4yang4 zuo4 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 geng1 kuai4 gan3 qu4 kai1hui4。"

msgid "This isn't going to take long, don't worry."
msgstr ""
"花​不了​多久​时间​的​，​别​担心​。\n"
"hua1 bu4le5 duo1jiu3 shi2jian1 de5，bie4 dan1xin1。"

msgid ""
"This isn't just a prototype, $(l.name). It's a *person.*\n"
"\n"
"We can't just cash him in for a paycheck."
msgstr ""
"这​不​只是​个​原型机​，​$(l.name)​。​这​是​个​*​人​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不能​为了​张​工资条​就​把​他​卖掉​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4 zhi3shi4 ge4 yuan2 xing2 ji1，$(l.name)。zhe4 shi4 ge4*ren2*。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4neng2 wei4le5 zhang1 gong1 zi1 tiao2 jiu4 ba3 ta1 mai4diao4。"

msgid ""
"This isn't news, and really, you ought to be quiet about that sort of thing."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​什么​新鲜事​，​而且​说实话​，​你​最好​对​这种​事情​保持沉默​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 xin1 xian1 shi4，er2qie3 shuo1shi2hua4，ni3 zui4hao3 dui4 zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 bao3 chi2 chen2 mo4。"

msgid ""
"This isn't some corporate goon, boss. Look at 'im.\n"
"\n"
"He's one of us."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​这​人​不是​什么​公司​打手​。​瞧瞧​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​是​我们​的​同行​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，zhe4 ren2 bu4shi4 shen2me5 gong1si1 da3shou5。qiao2 qiao2 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 wo3men5 de5 tong2hang2 a1。"

msgid "This isn't the best of times. Come back later if you want to talk."
msgstr ""
"现在​不是​时候​。​你​想​聊天​的话​等​晚点​再说​。\n"
"xian4zai4 bu4shi4 shi2hou5。ni3 xiang3 liao2tian1 de5hua4 deng3 wan3dian3 zai4shuo1。"

msgid "This isn't the best time, APEX."
msgstr ""
"现在​不是​个​好​时候​，​APEX​。\n"
"xian4zai4 bu4shi4 ge4 hao3 shi2hou5，APEX。"

msgid "This isn't the best time, friend. I'm a little busy."
msgstr ""
"你​这​时机​选​的​不太好​，​伙计​。​我​这边​有点​忙​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi2ji1 xuan3 de5 bu4tai4hao3，huo3ji5。wo3 zhe4bian1 you3dian3 mang2。"

msgid ""
"This isn't torture. It's justice.\n"
"\n"
"If you knew half of what this bastard has done... if you'd heard the things that he just told me... you'd do the same."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​暴力​。​这是​伸张正义​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​知道​这​混蛋​都​做​过些​什么​……​如果​你​听到​他​刚才​和​我​说​的话​……​你​也​会​这么​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 bao4li4。zhe4 shi4 shen1 zhang1 zheng1 yi4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 hun2dan4 dou1 zuo4 guo4 xie1 shen2me5……ru2guo3 ni3 ting1dao4 ta1 gang1cai2 he4 wo3 shuo1 de5hua4……ni3 ye3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"This isn't your fault, Vauclair. You didn't know that this would happen - "
"you *couldn't* have known."
msgstr ""
"这​不是​你​的​错​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​不​知道​会​发生​这种​事​—​—​你​根本​*​不​可能​*​知道​。\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 hui4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4——ni3 gen1ben3*bu4 ke3neng2*zhi1dao4。"

msgid "This just gets better and better."
msgstr ""
"事情​真是​越来越​棒​了​。\n"
"shi4qing5 zhen1shi5 yue4lai2yue4 bang4 le5。"

msgid "This just gets better and better. All right, team... move out."
msgstr ""
"事情​真是​越来越​棒​了​。​好​了​各位​，​行动​吧​。\n"
"shi4qing5 zhen1shi5 yue4lai2yue4 bang4 le5。hao3 le5 ge4wei4，xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid "This looks like the terminal that Blitz was telling you about."
msgstr ""
"这​看起来​像是​布里​茨​告诉​你​的​那个​终端​。\n"
"zhe4 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 Bu4li3ci2 gao4su4 ni3 de5 na4ge5 zhong1duan1。"

msgid ""
"This might be a mistake, boss... I've never been big on knifin' people in the back. But I guess that it's your mistake to make.\n"
"\n"
"I've got your back, just like I always do. Let's get this thing done."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​这​也许​会​是​个​错误​……​我​向来​排斥​背后​捅​刀子​的​事​，​但​我​想​无论​对错​都​该​由​你​来​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​一如既往​地​支持​你​，​一起​把​这件​事​搞定​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，zhe4 ye3xu3 hui4 shi4 ge4 cuo4wu4……wo3 xiang4lai2 pai2chi4 bei4hou4 tong3 dao1zi5 de5 shi4，dan4 wo3 xiang3 wu2lun4 dui4 cuo4 dou1 gai1 you2 ni3 lai2 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 yi1ru2ji4wang3 de5 zhi1chi2 ni3，yi1qi3 ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 gao3ding4 ba1。"

msgid "This must be one hell of a contact."
msgstr ""
"这​联络人​肯定​不​简单​。\n"
"zhe4 lian2luo4ren2 ken3ding4 bu4 jian3dan1。"

msgid "This must be that picture the initiate was talking about."
msgstr ""
"这​一定​就是​那个​学徒​所说​的​照片​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1ding4 jiu4shi4 na4ge5 xue2tu2 suo3 shuo1 de5 zhao4pian4。"

msgid ""
"This must be the old server facility. APEX's access terminal should be down "
"here... somewhere."
msgstr ""
"这​肯定​是​旧​的​服务器​设施​。​APEX​的​接入​终端​应该​在​这里​……​某处​。\n"
"zhe4 ken3ding4 shi4 jiu4 de5 fu2wu4qi4 she4shi1。APEX de5 jie1ru4 zhong1duan1 ying1gai1 zai4 zhe4li3……mou3chu4。"

msgid ""
"This must be the terminal that Blitz wanted you to use. Its screen is badly "
"scratched, and the casing is cracked, but the design tells you that it was "
"originally a part of the bank's security system."
msgstr ""
"这​一定​就是​布里​茨​要​你​操作​的​终端​。​它​的​屏幕​严重​划伤​，​外壳​也​裂开​了​，​但​从​设计​上​可以​看出​，​它​原本​是​银行​安保​系统​的​一部分​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1ding4 jiu4shi4 Bu4li3ci2 yao4 ni3 cao1zuo4 de5 zhong1duan1。ta1 de5 ping2mu4 yan2zhong4 hua2shang1，wai4ke2 ye3 lie4kai1 le5，dan4 cong2 she4ji4 shang4 ke3yi3 kan4chu1，ta1 yuan2ben3 shi4 yin2hang2 an1bao3 xi4tong3 de5 yi1bu4fen5。"

msgid ""
"This must come as a shock to you. I am sorry for that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair smiles weakly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your belief in our cause was second only to my own."
msgstr ""
"这​对​你​而言​一定​很​震惊​。​我​对此​深感​抱歉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​露出​虚弱​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​你​对于​这份​事业​的​信念​仅次于​我​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 ni3 er2yan2 yi1ding4 hen3 zhen4jing1。wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1gan3 bao4qian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 lu4chu1 xu1ruo4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 ni3 dui4yu2 zhe4 fen4 shi4ye4 de5 xin4nian4 jin3ci4yu2 wo3。"

msgid "This node contains the password to the armory door."
msgstr ""
"这个​节点​包含​军械库​大门​的​密码​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 jie2dian3 bao1han2 jun1 xie4 ku4 da4men2 de5 mi4ma3。"

msgid "This node controls a door with the ID \"Armory.\""
msgstr ""
"这个​节点​控制​着​“​军械库​”​的​门​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 jie2dian3 kong4zhi4 zhao2“jun1 xie4 ku4” de5 men2。"

msgid "This option can be changed on the main menu."
msgstr ""
"此​选项​可​在​主​菜单​中​更改​。\n"
"ci3 xuan3xiang4 ke3 zai4 zhu3 cai4dan1 zhong4 geng1gai3。"

msgid ""
"This page is dominated by a detailed illustration of a turbine cross-section.\n"
"\n"
"Scrawled in the margin is a number - \"822896.\""
msgstr ""
"这​一页​的​主要​内容​是​一幅​涡轮机​横截面​的​详细​插图​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​空白处​潦草​地写​着​一个​数字​“​822896​”​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1 xie2 de5 zhu3yao4 nei4rong2 shi4 yi1 fu2 guo1 lun2 ji1 heng2jie2mian4 de5 xiang2xi4 cha1tu2。\n"
"\n"
"kong1 bai2 chu3 liao2cao3 de5 xie3 zhao2 yi1ge5 shu4zi4“822896”。"

msgid "This panel controls the doors on the hellhound cages."
msgstr ""
"这个​面板​控制​着​地狱​猎犬​笼子​的​门​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 mian4ban3 kong4zhi4 zhao2 di4yu4 lie4quan3 long2zi5 de5 men2。"

msgid ""
"This panel is a mess.\n"
"\n"
"The lock on the casing has been broken, and exposed cabling spills out in a number of places."
msgstr ""
"这处​面板​的​状况​一团糟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​外壳​上​的​锁​已经​损坏​，​裸露​的​线缆​从​多处​散落​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 chu3 mian4ban3 de5 zhuang4kuang4 yi1tuan2zao1。\n"
"\n"
"wai4ke2 shang4 de5 suo3 yi3jing1 sun3huai4，luo3lu4 de5 xian4lan3 cong2 duo1 chu3 san3luo4 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"This pile of trash is steaming. Fetid waves of stench wash over you as you "
"draw near."
msgstr ""
"这堆​垃圾​正在​冒​着​热气​。​随着​你​靠近​，​腐臭​的​气味​一​波波​袭​来​。\n"
"zhe4 dui1 la1ji1 zheng4zai4 mao4 zhao2 re4qi4。sui2zhe5 ni3 kao4jin4，fu3chou4 de5 qi4wei4 yi1 bo1 bo1 xi2 lai2。"

msgid "This place is a dump."
msgstr ""
"这​地方​简直​就是​个​垃圾堆​。\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 jian3zhi2 jiu4shi4 ge4 la1ji1dui1。"

msgid "This place is a pit."
msgstr ""
"这​地方​就是​个​粪坑​。\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 jiu4shi4 ge4 fen4keng1。"

msgid ""
"This place is going down, and if we don't hurry, we're going with it. Let's "
"get out of here."
msgstr ""
"这​地方​要​塌​了​。​我们​得​动作​快点​，​否则​就要​给​它​陪葬​了​。​赶紧​离开​这里​吧​。\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 yao4 ta1 le5。wo3men5 de2 dong4zuo4 kuai4dian3，fou3ze2 jiu4yao4 gei3 ta1 pei2zang4 le5。gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"This place is no longer your concern. You don't tell anybody what you found "
"out here, understand?"
msgstr ""
"这​地方​和​你​没有​任何​关系​。​别​跟​任何人​说​你​在​这里​看到​的​事情​，​明白​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 he4 ni3 mei2you3 ren4he2 guan1xi5。bie4 gen1 ren4 he2 ren2 shuo1 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 kan4dao4 de5 shi4qing5，ming2bai5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"This place is over a hundred years old, y'know. During the Second World War, they converted this part of the station into an air raid shelter. Made it nice and secure in case anyone spotted bombers over the city. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Quorin appears more relaxed, his tone more friendly. He seems to enjoy relating the history of this place.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"知道​吗​，​这​地方​有​一百多年​历史​了​。​二战​期间​，​他们​把​车站​的​这​一部分​改建​成​了​防空洞​，​以防​有人​在​城市​上空​发现​轰炸机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​奎林​显得​放松​了​不少​，​语气​也​更加​友好​。​他​似乎​很​喜欢​讲述​这​地方​的​历史​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhi1dao4 ma5，zhe4 di4fang1 you3 yi1 bai3 duo1 nian2 li4shi3 le5。er4zhan4 qi1jian1，ta1men5 ba3 che1zhan4 de5 zhe4 yi1bu4fen5 gai3jian4 cheng2 le5 fang2kong1dong4，yi3fang2 you3ren2 zai4 cheng2shi4 shang4kong1 fa1xian4 hong1zha4ji1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kui2 lin2 xian3de5 fang4song1 le5 bu4shao3，yu3qi4 ye3 geng4jia1 you3hao3。ta1 si4hu1 hen3 xi3huan5 jiang3shu4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 li4shi3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "This place may never be the same without Monika, but we will carry on."
msgstr ""
"没有​了​莫妮卡​，​也许​这​地方​将​不再​和​以前​一样​，​但​我们​会​继续​坚持下去​。\n"
"mei2you3 le5 Mo4ni1ka3，ye3xu3 zhe4 di4fang1 jiang1 bu4zai4 he4 yi3qian2 yi1yang4，dan4 wo3men5 hui4 ji4xu4 jian1chi2xia4qu4。"

msgid "This plan of yours killed your *brother*. Was it really worth it?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​这个​计划​害死​了​你​的​*​弟弟​*​。​这样​真的​值得​吗​？\n"
"ni3 de5 zhe4ge5 ji4hua4 hai4si3 le5 ni3 de5*di4di5*。zhe4yang4 zhen1de5 zhi2de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"This plan of yours... it's crazy, Doc. But it isn't too late to stop it. "
"I'll help you, if you'll let me."
msgstr ""
"你​的​这个​计划​……​十分​疯狂​，​博士​。​但​现在​阻止​它​还​为时不晚​。​你​愿意​的话​，​我​可以​帮​你​。\n"
"ni3 de5 zhe4ge5 ji4hua4……shi2fen1 feng1kuang2，bo2shi4。dan4 xian4zai4 zu3zhi3 ta1 hai2 wei2shi2bu4wan3。ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3。"

msgid "This popular heavy pistol can fire a three-round burst."
msgstr ""
"手枪​：​这​款​受欢迎​的​重型​手枪​可​进行​三发​点射​。\n"
"shou3qiang1：zhe4 kuan3 shou4huan1ying2 de5 zhong4xing2 shou3qiang1 ke3 jin4xing2 san1 fa1 dian3she4。"

msgid ""
"This probably goes without saying, but it's also nice to have my skills appreciated by someone who *isn't* a drug-addled psychopath.\n"
"\n"
"Gang life was gettin' old."
msgstr ""
"可能​这话​不用​我​多​说​，​但​能​得到​一个​*​不是​*​吸毒​成瘾​的​疯子​对​我​的​技能​的​认可​，​也​挺不错​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​帮派​生活​已经​让​人​厌倦​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3neng2 zhe4 hua4 bu4yong4 wo3 duo1 shuo1，dan4 neng2 de2dao4 yi1ge5*bu4shi4*xi1du2 cheng2yin3 de5 feng1zi5 dui4 wo3 de5 ji4neng2 de5 ren4ke3，ye3 ting3 bu4 cuo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bang1pai4 sheng1huo2 yi3jing1 rang4 ren2 yan4juan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"This puts us in a bad spot, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I'm not sure what our next step is."
msgstr ""
"我们​现在​的​处境​不大好​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​太​确定​接下来​该​怎么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xian4zai4 de5 chu3jing4 bu4 dai4 hao3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 tai4 que4ding4 jie1xia4lai2 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"This reader wasn’t rigged so that disks that had recorded data on both sides"
" could be read, but I have another reader in worse condition that I am "
"hooking up so that it can see the index hole on both sides and take down the"
" information on flippy disks simultaneously. "
msgstr ""
"这台​读盘​器​并未​经过​改装​，​无法​读取​双面​记录​数据​的​磁盘​。​但​我​还有​一台​状况​更差​的​读盘​器​，​我​打算​将​其​连接​至​系统​，​使​其​能够​同时​识别​双面​索引​孔​并​同步​读取​翻盘​两面​的​信息​。\n"
"zhe4 tai2 dou4 pan2 qi4 bing4wei4 jing1guo4 gai3zhuang1，wu2fa3 du2qu3 shuang1mian4 ji4lu4 shu4ju4 de5 ci2pan2。dan4 wo3 hai2you3 yi1 tai2 zhuang4kuang4 geng1 cha4 de5 dou4 pan2 qi4，wo3 da3suan4 jiang1 qi2 lian2jie1 zhi4 xi4tong3，shi3 qi2 neng2gou4 tong2shi2 shi2bie2 shuang1mian4 suo3yin3 kong3 bing4 tong2bu4 du2qu3 fan1pan2 liang3mian4 de5 xin4xi1。"

msgid "This run wasn't a surveillance operation. It was an assassination."
msgstr ""
"这趟​差事​不是​什么​监控​行动​，​而是​刺杀​。\n"
"zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 jian1kong4 xing2dong4，er2shi4 ci4sha1。"

msgid "This safe is locked."
msgstr ""
"这个​保险箱​锁住​了​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 bao3xian3xiang1 suo3 zhu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"This section of the floor has a hole drilled into it, and you can see "
"explosives within."
msgstr ""
"这处​区域​的​地板​上​钻​有​一个​孔洞​，​从中​可以​看到​里面​有​炸药​。\n"
"zhe4 chu3 qu1yu4 de5 di4ban3 shang4 zuan1 you3 yi1ge5 kong3dong4，cong2zhong1 ke3yi3 kan4dao4 li3mian4 you3 zha4yao4。"

msgid ""
"This section of wall seems to be buckling under its own weight. \n"
"\n"
"The aging wallpaper that lines the rest of the hallway has long since peeled away, revealing the structure of the wall underneath."
msgstr ""
"这​面墙​似乎​因​自身​的​重量​而​塌陷​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​陈旧​的​墙纸​早已​剥落​，​墙体​的​结构​暴露​出来​，​一路​延伸​至​走廊​的​尽头​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 mian4 qiang2 si4hu1 yin1 zi4shen1 de5 zhong4liang4 er2 ta1xian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"chen2jiu4 de5 qiang2zhi3 zao3yi3 bo1luo4，qiang2 ti3 de5 jie2gou4 bao4lu4 chu1lai2，yi1lu4 yan2shen1 zhi4 zou3lang2 de5 jin4tou2。"

msgid ""
"This security computer governs the locks on the door leading back into the "
"main lab. If you wanted to, you could unlock the door remotely from here."
msgstr ""
"这台​安全​电脑​控制​着​通往​主​实验室​的​门锁​。​如果​你​愿意​，​可以​从​此处​远程​解锁​这​扇门​。\n"
"zhe4 tai2 an1quan2 dian4nao3 kong4zhi4 zhao2 tong1wang3 zhu3 shi2yan4shi4 de5 men2suo3。ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4，ke3yi3 cong2 ci3chu4 yuan3cheng2 jie3suo3 zhe4 shan1 men2。"

msgid "This should be good."
msgstr ""
"挺​好​的​。\n"
"ting3 hao3 de5。"

msgid ""
"This smells like a trap to me, $(l.name). Why else would APEX have let Alice escape?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns to address the simulacrum on the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Alice, why would a matrix warfare AI allow you to bring us this information?"
msgstr ""
"这​真的​很​像​陷阱​，​$(l.name)​。​不然​APEX​怎么​会​让​爱丽丝​逃掉​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转向​屏幕​上​的​拟​像​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​爱丽丝​，​为什么​一个​矩阵​作战​AI​会​允许​你​向​我们​透露​这些​信息​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhen1de5 hen3 xiang4 xian4jing3，$(l.name)。bu4ran2 APEX zen3me5 hui4 rang4 ai4li4si1 tao2 diao4 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 ni3 xiang4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1，wei4shen2me5 yi1ge5 ju3zhen4 zuo4zhan4 AI hui4 yun3xu3 ni3 xiang4 wo3men5 tou4lu4 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1？"

msgid ""
"This sounds like hyperbole, I know. But it isn’t. The Bloodline project will lead to *countless* deaths.\n"
"\n"
"I am certain enough of this to hire you, despite the fact that doing so will probably cost me my own life."
msgstr ""
"我​明白​，​这​听​起来​有些​夸大其词​，​但​事实​并非如此​。​“​血脉​”​项目​将​导致​*​无数​人​*​丧生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对此​确信无疑​，​因此​才​要​雇佣​你​，​尽管​此举​很​可能​要​了​我​的​性命​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5，zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 you3xie1 kua1da4qi2ci2，dan4 shi4shi2 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 jiang1 dao3zhi4*wu2shu4 ren2*sang4sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 que4 xin4 wu2 yi2，yin1ci3 cai2 yao4 gu4yong1 ni3，jin3guan3 ci3 ju3 hen3 ke3neng2 yao4 le5 wo3 de5 xing4ming4。"

msgid "This story has multiple options for starting out. Please choose one."
msgstr ""
"此​故事​有​多个​开头​选项​，​请​选择​其中​一个​。\n"
"ci3 gu4shi4 you3 duo1ge5 kai1tou2 xuan3xiang4，qing3 xuan3ze2 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5。"

msgid "This story sounds familiar..."
msgstr ""
"这​故事​听​起来​很​耳熟​……\n"
"zhe4 gu4shi4 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 er3shu2……"

msgid "This stuff isn't cheap. You must be very devoted parents."
msgstr ""
"这​东西​可不​便宜​。​你们​真是​尽心尽力​的​好​家长​。\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 ke3bu5 bian4yi2。ni3men5 zhen1shi5 jin4xin1jin4li4 de5 hao3 jia1zhang3。"

msgid ""
"This terminal appears to contain an inventory control system for Sutterlin BioScience's merchandise.\n"
"\n"
"The items are spelled out in amber lettering against a solid black background. A glowing cursor awaits your input."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​似乎​包含​了​苏​特林​生物科学​的​商品​库存​控制系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​物品​以​琥珀色​字体​显示​在​纯​黑色​背景​上​。​闪烁​的​光标​正在​等待​你​的​输入​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 si4hu1 bao1han2 le5 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 shang1pin3 ku4cun2 kong4 zhi4 xi4 tong3。\n"
"\n"
"wu4pin3 yi3 hu3 po4 se4 zi4ti3 xian3shi4 zai4 chun2 hei1se4 bei4jing3 shang4。shan3shuo4 de5 guang1biao1 zheng4zai4 deng3dai4 ni3 de5 shu1ru4。"

msgid ""
"This terminal governs the Animal Testing Wing of Sutterlin BioScience.\n"
"\n"
"Data entries concerning animal test subjects - and the procedures performed upon them - fill the menu screen."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​负责管理​苏​特林​生物科学​的​动物​测试​部门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​菜单​屏幕​上满​是​动物​测试​对象​的​数据​条目​以及​对​其​执行​的​程序​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 fu4 ze2 guan3 li3 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 dong4wu4 ce4shi4 bu4men2。\n"
"\n"
"cai4dan1 ping2mu4 shang4 man3 shi4 dong4wu4 ce4shi4 dui4xiang4 de5 shu4ju4 tiao2mu4 yi3ji2 dui4 qi2 zhi2xing2 de5 cheng2xu4。"

msgid ""
"This terminal has been left on, and the screen is still active. It has been logged in under the name \"ALBERT TRIPPS.\"\n"
"\n"
"Keyboard input has been locked out, and a password entry box hangs in the center of the screen."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​没有​关机​，​屏幕​仍然​亮​着​。​上面​登录​的​用户名​是​“​阿尔伯特​·​崔普斯​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​键盘输入​已​被​锁定​，​密码​输入框​显示​在​屏幕​中央​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 mei2you3 guan1ji1，ping2mu4 reng2ran2 liang4 zhao2。shang4mian4 deng1lu4 de5 yong4hu4ming2 shi4“a1er3bo2te4 · cui1 pu3 si1”。\n"
"\n"
"jian4 pan2 shu1 ru4 yi3 bei4 suo3ding4，mi4ma3 shu1 ru4 kuang4 xian3shi4 zai4 ping2mu4 zhong1yang1。"

msgid ""
"This terminal has been locked. There doesn't seem to be any way to unlock it from here, but it is connected to a number of other terminals in the room.\n"
"\n"
"In theory, a decker could probably enter the lab's dedicated Matrix server and unlock the terminal from there, but doing so would almost certainly raise an alarm..."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​已​被​锁定​。​从​这里​似乎​没有​解锁​的​办法​，​但​它​与​房间内​其它​几台​终端​相连​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​理论​上​，​或许​可以​让​碟​客​进入​实验室​专用​的​矩阵​服务器进行​解锁​，​但​此举​几乎​必然​会​触发​警报​……\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 yi3 bei4 suo3ding4。cong2 zhe4li3 si4hu1 mei2you3 jie3suo3 de5 ban4fa3，dan4 ta1 yu4 fang2 jian1 nei4 qi2ta1 ji1 tai2 zhong1duan1 xiang1lian2。\n"
"\n"
"li3lun4 shang4，huo4xu3 ke3yi3 rang4 die2 ke4 jin4ru4 shi2yan4shi4 zhuan1yong4 de5 ju3zhen4 fu2 wu4 qi4 jin4 xing2 jie3suo3，dan4 ci3 ju3 ji1hu1 bi4ran2 hui4 chu4fa1 jing3bao4……"

msgid ""
"This terminal has two monitors attached to it. The first is filled with a "
"text menu screen; the second, with an interactive map of the city of "
"Chicago."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​连接​了​两台​显示器​。​第一台​显示器​呈现​的​是​文本​菜单​界面​；​第二台​则​显示​了​芝加哥市​的​交互式​地图​。\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 lian2jie1 le5 liang3 tai2 xian3shi4qi4。di4 yi1 tai2 xian3shi4qi4 cheng2xian4 de5 shi4 wen2ben3 cai4dan1 jie4mian4 ； di4 er4 tai2 ze2 xian3shi4 le5 zhi1 jia1 ge1 shi4 de5 jiao1 hu4 shi4 di4tu2。"

msgid ""
"This terminal is active. A keycard reader has been set into its base.\n"
"\n"
"The menu screen is a simple thing, with only two items to choose from."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​处于​激活状态​。​其​底座​已​安装​读卡器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​菜单​界面设计​简洁​，​仅​提供​两项​可​选​功能​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 chu3yu2 ji1 huo2 zhuang4 tai4。qi2 di3zuo4 yi3 an1zhuang1 du2ka3qi4。\n"
"\n"
"cai4dan1 jie4 mian4 she4 ji4 jian3jie2，jin3 ti2gong1 liang3 xiang4 ke3 xuan3 gong1neng2。"

msgid "This terminal is operational, but locked."
msgstr ""
"这台​终端​可以​启动​，​但是​被​锁定​了​。\n"
"zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 ke3yi3 qi3dong4，dan4shi4 bei4 suo3ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"This terminal's printing your name out over and over again, $(l.name)... "
"you'd better get over here."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​这台​终端​一直​在​反复​输出​你​的​名字​……​你​最好​过来​一下​。\n"
"$(l.name)，zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 yi1zhi2 zai4 fan3fu4 shu1chu1 ni3 de5 ming2zi5……ni3 zui4hao3 guo4lai2 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"This terminal's screen winks to life as you approach. At the upper left-hand"
" side of the screen, a globe spins; the remainder of the display is filled "
"with a text menu."
msgstr ""
"你​靠近​时​，​终端​的​屏幕​亮​起​。​屏幕​左上角​有个​地球仪​在​旋转​；​其余​显示​区域​则​被​文本​菜单​占据​。\n"
"ni3 kao4jin4 shi2，zhong1duan1 de5 ping2mu4 liang4 qi3。ping2mu4 zuo3 shang4 jiao3 you3 ge4 di4qiu2yi2 zai4 xuan2zhuan3 ； qi2yu2 xian3shi4 qu1yu4 ze2 bei4 wen2ben3 cai4dan1 zhan4ju4。"

msgid "This thing is a monster. We have to kill it."
msgstr ""
"这​东西​是​个​怪物​。​我们​必须​杀​了​它​。\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 shi4 ge4 guai4wu5。wo3men5 bi4xu1 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"This thing is responsible for so much misery, I don't think that it deserves"
" redemption. I want this atrocity *dead,* and Harrow along with it."
msgstr ""
"这​东西​造成​了​如此​多​的​痛苦​，​我​不​认为​它​应该​得到​救赎​。​我要​*​消灭​*​这桩​暴行​，​还有​哈罗​本人​。\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 zao4cheng2 le5 ru2ci3 duo1 de5 tong4ku3，wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 ta1 ying1gai1 de2dao4 jiu4shu2。wo3 yao4*xiao1mie4*zhe4 zhuang1 bao4xing2，hai2you3 ha1luo2 ben3ren2。"

msgid ""
"This thing is responsible for so much misery, I don't think that it deserves"
" redemption. I want this atrocity *dead,* and Harrow alongside it."
msgstr ""
"这​东西​造成​了​如此​多​的​痛苦​，​我​不​认为​它​应该​得到​救赎​。​我要​*​消灭​*​这桩​暴行​，​还有​哈罗​本人​。\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 zao4cheng2 le5 ru2ci3 duo1 de5 tong4ku3，wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 ta1 ying1gai1 de2dao4 jiu4shu2。wo3 yao4*xiao1mie4*zhe4 zhuang1 bao4xing2，hai2you3 ha1luo2 ben3ren2。"

msgid ""
"This thing needs to die, and Harrow needs to burn in Hell right alongside "
"it. If a few cultists die with them, then so be it - it's worth the cost."
msgstr ""
"这​东西​必须​死​，​哈罗​也​必须​和​它​一起​下​地狱​。​如果​有​几个​教徒​要​给​他们​陪葬​，​我​也​没​意见​—​—​这样​的​代价​是​值得​的​。\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 bi4xu1 si3，ha1luo2 ye3 bi4xu1 he4 ta1 yi1qi3 xia4 di4yu4。ru2guo3 you3 ji3ge5 jiao4tu2 yao4 gei3 ta1men5 pei2zang4，wo3 ye3 mei2 yi4jian4——zhe4yang4 de5 dai4jia4 shi4 zhi2de5 de5。"

msgid "This thing needs to die. It's wearing her goddamned face, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"这个​东西​必须​死​。​它​居然​敢​顶​着​她​的​脸​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 dong1xi1 bi4xu1 si3。ta1 ju1ran2 gan3 ding3 zhao2 ta1 de5 lian3，$(l.name)。"

msgid "This threat to Communion must be stopped!"
msgstr ""
"对​共​融会​的​威胁​必须​被​阻止​！\n"
"dui4 gong4 rong2hui4 de5 wei1xie2 bi4xu1 bei4 zu3zhi3！"

msgid ""
"This trendily-designed panel reads \"Apartment 301.\"\n"
"\n"
"A slick, high-grade keypad has been mounted into the door frame."
msgstr ""
"这块​设计​时尚​的​门牌​上​写​着​“​301​室​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门框​上​嵌​着​一块​光洁​的​高档​小键盘​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 kuai4 she4ji4 shi2shang4 de5 men2pai2 shang4 xie3 zhao2“301 shi4”。\n"
"\n"
"men2kuang4 shang4 kan3 zhao2 yi1kuai4 guang1jie2 de5 gao1dang4 xiao3 jian4 pan2。"

msgid ""
"This trendily-designed panel reads \"Apartment 302.\"\n"
"\n"
"A slick, high-grade keypad has been mounted into the door frame."
msgstr ""
"这块​设计​时尚​的​门牌​上​写​着​“​302​室​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门框​上​嵌​着​一块​光洁​的​高档​小键盘​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 kuai4 she4ji4 shi2shang4 de5 men2pai2 shang4 xie3 zhao2“302 shi4”。\n"
"\n"
"men2kuang4 shang4 kan3 zhao2 yi1kuai4 guang1jie2 de5 gao1dang4 xiao3 jian4 pan2。"

msgid ""
"This trendily-designed panel reads \"Apartment 303.\"\n"
"\n"
"A slick, high-grade keypad has been mounted into the door frame."
msgstr ""
"这块​设计​时尚​的​门牌​上​写​着​“​303​室​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门框​上​嵌​着​一块​光洁​的​高档​小键盘​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 kuai4 she4ji4 shi2shang4 de5 men2pai2 shang4 xie3 zhao2“303 shi4”。\n"
"\n"
"men2kuang4 shang4 kan3 zhao2 yi1kuai4 guang1jie2 de5 gao1dang4 xiao3 jian4 pan2。"

msgid ""
"This trendily-designed panel reads \"Penthouse.\"\n"
"\n"
"A slick, high-grade keypad has been mounted into the door frame."
msgstr ""
"这块​设计​时尚​的​门牌​上​写​着​“​顶层​公寓​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门框​上​嵌​着​一块​光洁​的​高档​小键盘​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 kuai4 she4ji4 shi2shang4 de5 men2pai2 shang4 xie3 zhao2“ding3ceng2 gong1yu4”。\n"
"\n"
"men2kuang4 shang4 kan3 zhao2 yi1kuai4 guang1jie2 de5 gao1dang4 xiao3 jian4 pan2。"

msgid "This turret is powered down."
msgstr ""
"炮塔​被​关停​了​。\n"
"pao4ta3 bei4 guan1ting2 le5。"

msgid ""
"This vent is large enough for you to fit through. You could slide down through a very steep metal duct. The experience looks to be more on the thrilling side rather than the fatal side. \n"
"\n"
"It is clearly a one-way trip. "
msgstr ""
"这个​通风口​足够​你​穿过​。​你​可以​从​一个​非常​陡峭​的​金属​管道​滑下去​。​这种​体验​看起来​更​偏向​刺激​而​非​致命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​显然​是​一次​单程​之旅​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 tong1feng1kou3 zu2gou4 ni3 chuan1guo4。ni3 ke3yi3 cong2 yi1ge5 fei1chang2 dou3qiao4 de5 jin1shu3 guan3dao4 hua2 xia4 qu4。zhe4zhong3 ti3yan4 kan4qi3lai5 geng1 pian1xiang4 ci4ji1 er2 fei1 zhi4ming4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 xian3ran2 shi4 yi1ci4 dan1cheng2 zhi1 lu:3。"

msgid "This vent is large enough to fit a drone through."
msgstr ""
"这处​通风口​足够​让​无人机​通过​。\n"
"zhe4 chu3 tong1feng1kou3 zu2gou4 rang4 wu2ren2ji1 tong1guo4。"

msgid "This was all a lot less complicated before I talked to you."
msgstr ""
"和​你​聊​完​之后​，​我​反而​觉得​复杂​多​了​。\n"
"he4 ni3 liao2 wan2 zhi1hou4，wo3 fan3er2 jue2de5 fu4za2 duo1 le5。"

msgid "This whole plan was *your* friend's idea. Your sainted Monika--"
msgstr ""
"这​整个​计划​都​是​*​你​朋友​*​的​主意​。​你​那位​圣​莫妮卡​—​—\n"
"zhe4 zheng3ge4 ji4hua4 dou1 shi4*ni3 peng2you5*de5 zhu3yi5。ni3 na4 wei4 sheng4 Mo4ni1ka3 — —"

msgid ""
"This whole thing about dragons taking over the world... the thought of them slowly hoarding everything... it's too big to think about. We’re street-level. We run the shadows. That's it.\n"
"\n"
"Worrying about these sorts of issues is beyond our pay-grade."
msgstr ""
"一​想到​巨龙​们​统治​着​世界​……​它们​慢慢​囤积​着​一切​……​这​念头​太过​庞大​，​简直​难以想象​。​我们​只是​街头​平民​，​在​暗影​圈子里​厮混​打拼​，​仅此而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​事情​根本​就​不是​我们​这个​级别​的​人​该​考虑​的​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 xiang3dao4 ju4long2 men5 tong3zhi4 zhao2 shi4jie4……ta1men5 man4man4 tun2ji1 zhao2 yi1qie4……zhe4 nian4tou5 tai4guo4 pang2da4，jian3zhi2 nan2 yi3 xiang3 xiang4。wo3men5 zhi3shi4 jie1tou2 ping2min2，zai4 an4ying3 juan1 zi3 li3 si1hun4 da3pin1，jin3ci3er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 gen1ben3 jiu4 bu4shi4 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 ji2bie2 de5 ren2 gai1 kao3lu:4 de5。"

msgid ""
"This whole thing is so messed up. Why would Vauclair do any of this? The man"
" was a hero!"
msgstr ""
"这​一切​真是太​乱​了​。​为什么​沃​克莱尔​要​做​这些​？​那个​男人​曾​是​英雄​！\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 zhen1 shi4 tai4 luan4 le5。wei4shen2me5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 yao4 zuo4 zhe4xie1？na4ge5 nan2ren2 ceng2 shi4 ying1xiong2！"

msgid ""
"This whole thing is so messed up. Why would he do any of this? The man was a"
" hero!"
msgstr ""
"这​一切​真是太​乱​了​。​为什么​他​要​做​这些​？​那个​男人​曾​是​英雄​！\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 zhen1 shi4 tai4 luan4 le5。wei4shen2me5 ta1 yao4 zuo4 zhe4xie1？na4ge5 nan2ren2 ceng2 shi4 ying1xiong2！"

msgid ""
"This your first day on the job, or somethin'? They're a bunch of people dressed like you. A human, an elf, and a dwarf.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gestures lazily at a small figure standing in the distance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"One of 'em's over there, waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"你​今天​是​第一天​来​上班​吗​？​就是​一群​和​你​打扮​相同​的​人​。​一个​人类​，​一个​精灵​，​还有​个​矮​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​懒洋洋​地朝​远处​的​一个​矮小​身影​示意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​其中​一个​在​那​等​你​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jin1tian1 shi4 di4 yi1 tian1 lai2 shang4ban1 ma5？jiu4shi4 yi1 qun2 he4 ni3 da3ban5 xiang1tong2 de5 ren2。yi1ge5 ren2lei4，yi1ge5 jing1ling2，hai2you3 ge4 ai3 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 chao2 yuan3chu4 de5 yi1ge5 ai3xiao3 shen1ying3 shi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 zai4 na4 deng3 ni3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"This'll get you into the utility tunnel. Danni went down there about a half "
"an hour ago."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​用​这个​进入​综合​管廊​。​丹妮​大概​是​在​半小时​前​下去​的​。\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 yong4 zhe4ge5 jin4ru4 zong1he2 guan3 lang2。dan1 ni1 da4gai4 shi4 zai4 ban4xiao3shi2 qian2 xia4qu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"This, fearless leader, is justice.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She rubs the backs of her hands on a rag.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you knew half of what this bastard has done... if you'd heard the things that he just told me... you'd do the same."
msgstr ""
"无畏​领袖​，​这是​伸张正义​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​手背​在​一块​破布​上​擦​了​擦​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​知道​这​混蛋​都​做​过些​什么​……​如果​你​听到​他​刚才​和​我​说​的话​……​你​也​会​这么​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4，zhe4 shi4 shen1 zhang1 zheng1 yi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shou3bei4 zai4 yi1kuai4 po4bu4 shang4 ca1 le5 ca1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 hun2dan4 dou1 zuo4 guo4 xie1 shen2me5……ru2guo3 ni3 ting1dao4 ta1 gang1cai2 he4 wo3 shuo1 de5hua4……ni3 ye3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"This.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The image that greets you is a holopic of a rail-thin ork with jet-black hair.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"看​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​映入​你​眼帘​的​是​一幅​全息​影像​。​这​是​个​骨瘦如柴​的​黑发​兽​人​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"kan4 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ying4ru4 ni3 yan3lian2 de5 shi4 yi1 fu2 quan2xi1 ying3xiang4。zhe4 shi4 ge4 gu3shou4ru2chai2 de5 hei1fa4 shou4 ren2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"This... this troll... it's still conscious. *He's* still conscious. They've outfitted him with an inhibitor chip.\n"
"\n"
"He's trapped in his own body. Screaming to get out."
msgstr ""
"这​……​这个​巨魔​……​它​还有​意识​。​*​他​*​还有​意识​。​他们​给​他​安​了​神经​抑制​芯片​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​被困​在​自己​的​身体​里​，​尖叫​着想​逃出来​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4……zhe4ge5 ju4mo2……ta1 hai2you3 yi4shi2。*ta1*hai2you3 yi4shi2。ta1men5 gei3 ta1 an1 le5 shen2jing1 yi4zhi4 xin1pian4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bei4kun4 zai4 zi4ji3 de5 shen1ti3 li3，jian1jiao4 zhuo2xiang3 tao2 chu1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"This?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He holds up the display model that they were inspecting so that you can see it. A small chip, along with a glossy, attractive information sheet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a pediatric Skillwire Plus system, for our son."
msgstr ""
"这个​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​举起​正在​端详​的​展示​模型​让​你​看​。​上面​有个​小​缺口​，​还​附着​一张​光面​精美​的​说明​单​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​儿童​款​的​技能​回路​增强版​系统​，​给​我​儿子​用​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ju3qi3 zheng4zai4 duan1xiang2 de5 zhan3shi4 mo2xing2 rang4 ni3 kan4。shang4mian4 you3 ge4 xiao3 que1kou3，hai2 fu4zhuo2 yi1 zhang1 guang1mian4 jing1mei3 de5 shuo1ming2 dan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 er2tong2 kuan3 de5 ji4neng2 hui2lu4 zeng1 jiang4 ban3 xi4tong3，gei3 wo3 er2zi5 yong4 de5。"

msgid "Thorvald Enstad"
msgstr ""
"托​瓦尔德​·​恩施​塔德\n"
"tuo1 wa3er3de2 · en1Shi1ta3de2"

msgid ""
"Thorvald Enstad's PDA, loaded with the ¥15,000 that he promised to pay you."
msgstr ""
"托​瓦尔德​·​恩施​塔德​的​PDA​。​里面​装着​他​承诺​要​付给​你​的​一万五千​新円​。\n"
"tuo1 wa3er3de2 · en1Shi1ta3de2 de5 PDA。li3mian4 zhuang1 zhao2 ta1 cheng2nuo4 yao4 fu4gei3 ni3 de5 yi1 wan4 wu3 qian1 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid "Those Knight Errant drekheads have a little surprise coming their way."
msgstr ""
"那些​游侠​骑士​的​白痴​们​可以​等​着​收到​一点​小​惊喜​了​。\n"
"na4xie1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 bai2chi1 men5 ke3yi3 deng3 zhao2 shou1dao4 yi1dian3 xiao3 jing1xi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Those early years of the Awakening were traumatic, Eiger. Not just on a national level, but on a global scale. \n"
"\n"
"New species of Awakened animals were being discovered daily. Within two years of the Dragonfall, the active use of magic had returned to the world... a new source of terror for a bewildered public. And in 2021, the sudden emergence of orks and trolls gave rise to yet another wave of global panic."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​“​大​觉醒​”​的​头​几年​是​场​灾难​—​—​不​只是​国家​层面​，​它​波及​了​全球​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​每天​都​有​新​的​觉醒​物种​被​发现​。​在​“​龙​陨​”​事件​发生​后​短短​两​年间​，​魔法​便​重新​活跃​于世​……​这令​茫然无措​的​民众​陷入​新​的​恐慌​。​而​在​2021​年​，​兽​人​与​巨魔​的​突然​现身​更​引发​了​新一轮​全球性​恐慌​浪潮​。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，“dai4 jue2xing3” de5 tou2 ji3nian2 shi4 chang2 zai1nan4——bu4 zhi3shi4 guo2jia1 ceng2mian4，ta1 bo1ji2 le5 quan2qiu2。\n"
"\n"
"mei3tian1 dou1 you3 xin1 de5 jue2xing3 wu4zhong3 bei4 fa1xian4。zai4“long2 yun3” shi4jian4 fa1sheng1 hou4 duan3 duan3 liang3 nian2jian1，mo2fa3 bian4 chong2xin1 huo2yue4 yu2 shi4……zhe4 ling3 mang2 ran2 wu2 cuo4 de5 min2zhong4 xian4ru4 xin1 de5 kong3huang1。er2 zai4 2021 nian2，shou4 ren2 yu4 ju4mo2 de5 tu1ran2 xian4shen1 geng1 yin3fa1 le5 xin1 yi1 lun2 quan2qiu2xing4 kong3huang1 lang4chao2。"

msgid ""
"Those screams... the cultists are still alive! We can't leave until we've "
"saved them."
msgstr ""
"那些​尖叫声​……​教徒​们​还​活着​！​我们​得​救出​他们​再​离开​。\n"
"na4xie1 jian1 jiao4 sheng1……jiao4tu2 men5 hai2 huo2zhe5！wo3men5 de2 jiu4chu1 ta1men5 zai4 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"Those voices belong to Harrow's acolytes. They'll have some magical training, and they like hurting people.\n"
"\n"
"You open that door, and we're going to have a fight on our hands."
msgstr ""
"那些​人​是​哈罗​的​侍​祭​。​他们​接受​过​一些​魔法​训练​，​而且​喜欢​伤害​他人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​打开​那​扇门​的话​，​我们​就要​准备​战斗​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 ren2 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 shi4 ji4。ta1men5 jie1shou4 guo4 yi1xie1 mo2fa3 xun4lian4，er2qie3 xi3huan5 shang1hai4 ta1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 da3kai1 na4 shan1 men2 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4yao4 zhun3bei4 zhan4dou4 le5。"

msgid "Those were dark days."
msgstr ""
"那​是​段​黑暗​的​日子​。\n"
"na4 shi4 duan4 hei1an4 de5 ri4zi5。"

msgid ""
"Those young men and women have already suffered so much. Now they feel "
"threatened, as if they'll lose everything Samuel has provided them."
msgstr ""
"这些​年轻​男女​已经​承受​了​太​多​苦难​。​如今​他们​感到​危机四伏​，​仿佛​即将​失去​塞缪尔​给予​他们​的​一切​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 nian2qing1 nan2nu:3 yi3jing1 cheng2shou4 le5 tai4 duo1 ku3nan4。ru2jin1 ta1men5 gan3dao4 wei1ji1si4fu2，fang3fu2 ji2jiang1 shi1qu4 sai4miu4er3 ji3yu3 ta1men5 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"Those're always the best kind, aren't they?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich smiles and takes another swig from the bottle.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"真是​好​兄弟​啊​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​笑了起来​，​又​喝​了​一口​酒​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 hao3 xiong1di4 a1，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2，you4 he4 le5 yi1kou3 jiu3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Though, if you're looking for ghosts, this seems like a fine place for it.\n"
"\n"
"Seems like everyone and everything down here is a ghost. Ghosts of the past, ghost trains, ghostly thin folks pale for lack of sunlight…"
msgstr ""
"但​你​要是​想​找​幽灵​的话​，​可算​你​来​对​地方​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​的​人和事​似乎​都​是​幽灵​。​过去​的​幽灵​、​幽灵​列车​，​还有​晒​不到​阳光​所以​像​幽灵​一样​肤色​惨白​的​人​……\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 yao4shi5 xiang3 zhao3 you1ling2 de5hua4，ke3 suan4 ni3 lai2 dui4 di4fang1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 ren2 he4 shi4 si4hu1 dou1 shi4 you1ling2。guo4qu4 de5 you1ling2、you1ling2 lie4che1，hai2you3 shai4 bu4dao4 yang2guang1 suo3yi3 xiang4 you1ling2 yi1yang4 fu1se4 can3bai2 de5 ren2……"

msgid "Thought I might have left the oven on."
msgstr ""
"因为​我​好像​忘关​烤箱​了​。\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 hao3xiang4 wang4 guan1 kao3xiang1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Thought the place was a bit too airy. My old bones kept feeling a draft.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Laine grins a tusky grin.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"觉得​这里​有点​太​通风​了​。​我​这​把​老骨头​老是​觉得​有股​凉风​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莱恩​露出​一个​呲​牙​咧嘴​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"jue2de5 zhe4li3 you3dian3 tai4 tong1feng1 le5。wo3 zhe4 ba3 lao3gu3tou5 lao3shi5 jue2de5 you3 gu3 liang2 feng1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 ci1 ya2 lie3zui3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Thre's a warning label plastered onto the side of this container.\n"
"\n"
" Judging by the amount of small print on the label, whatever's being stored in here is extremely bad news."
msgstr ""
"这个​容器​侧面​贴​有​一个​警告​标签​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​标签​上​小字​的​数量​来​判断​，​不管​里面​存放​的​是​什么​，​都​肯定​非常​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 rong2qi4 ce4mian4 tie1 you3 yi1ge5 jing3gao4 biao1qian1。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 biao1qian1 shang4 xiao3 zi4 de5 shu4liang4 lai2 pan4duan4，bu4guan3 li3mian4 cun2fang4 de5 shi4 shen2me5，dou1 ken3ding4 fei1chang2 wei1xian3。"

msgid "Three bullets. Three targets."
msgstr ""
"三发​子弹​。​三个​目标​。\n"
"san1 fa1 zi3dan4。san1 ge4 mu4biao1。"

msgid ""
"Three months later, long-held power positions within the SKI empire continue to empty as the dragon consolidates his power base. The most recent casualties of Lofwyr's takeover include:\n"
"\n"
"Alexandra Kobayashi, former COO of Saeder Munitions; \n"
"\n"
"Matthäus Doner, former Treasurer of Ruhr Datafax; \n"
"\n"
"and Werner Harding, former CEO of Diehl Defense."
msgstr ""
"三个​月​后​，​随着​巨龙​巩固​自己​的​权力​基础​，​SKI​帝国​中长期​掌权​的​职位​不断​流失​。​在​洛夫​维尔​的​收购​之后​，​最近​的​牺牲者​包括​\n"
"​\n"
"​亚历​珊德​拉​·​小林​，​萨尔​德军​火​公司​前​首席​运营官​；​\n"
"​\n"
"​马特乌斯​·​多纳​，​鲁尔​数据​传真​公司​前​财务主管​；​\n"
"​\n"
"​以及​沃纳​·​哈丁​，​迪尔​防务​前​首席​执行官​。\n"
"\n"
"san1 ge4 yue4 hou4，sui2zhe5 ju4long2 gong3gu4 zi4ji3 de5 quan2li4 ji1chu3，SKI di4guo2 zhong4 zhang3 qi1 zhang3quan2 de5 zhi2wei4 bu4duan4 liu2shi1。zai4 Luo4fu1wei2er3 de5 shou1gou4 zhi1hou4，zui4jin4 de5 xi1sheng1zhe3 bao1kuo4 \n"
"\n"
"ya4 li4 shan1 de2 la1 · xiao3lin2，sa4er3 de2 jun1 huo3 gong1si1 qian2 shou3xi2 yun4 ying2 guan1 ； \n"
"\n"
"ma3 te4 wu1 si1 · duo1 na4，lu3 er3 shu4ju4 chuan2zhen1 gong1si1 qian2 cai2 wu4 zhu3 guan3 ； \n"
"\n"
"yi3ji2 wo4 na4 · ha1 zheng1，Di2er3fang2wu4 qian2 shou3xi2 zhi2 xing2 guan1。"

msgid ""
"Three, maybe four hours? I dunno. We just stayed inside until the heat died "
"down and the screaming stopped."
msgstr ""
"三四个​小时​吧​？​我​不​知道​。​我们​一直​待​到​了​高温​消退​，​尖叫​停止​才​出去​。\n"
"san1 si4 ge4 xiao3shi2 ba1？wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。wo3men5 yi1zhi2 dai1 dao4 le5 gao1wen1 xiao1tui4，jian1jiao4 ting2zhi3 cai2 chu1qu4。"

msgid ""
"Through it all, you feel the maddening, compulsive desire to tell the truth.\n"
"\n"
"You know that if you don't act now, you'll eventually give in... it's just a matter of time."
msgstr ""
"在​这​整个​过程​中​，​你​还​感受​到​了​那​令人​发狂​的​、​难以​抑制​的​要​将​真相​和盘托出​的​欲望​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​如果​现在​不​行动​，​你​最终​会​屈从​……​这​只是​时间​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 zheng3ge4 guo4cheng2 zhong4，ni3 hai2 gan3shou4 dao4 le5 na4 ling4ren2 fa1kuang2 de5、nan2yi3 yi4zhi4 de5 yao4 jiang1 zhen1xiang4 he2pan2tuo1chu1 de5 yu4wang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 ru2guo3 xian4zai4 bu4 xing2dong4，ni3 zui4zhong1 hui4 qu1cong2……zhe4 zhi3shi4 shi2jian1 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Through the glass, you see the prostrate form of a dragon, far below. An "
"enormous set of shackles binds it, and a maze of tubes snakes into its body."
" The tubes connect to a cruel-looking apparatus that has been mounted to the"
" wall."
msgstr ""
"透过​玻璃​，​你​看到​一条龙​俯卧​在​下方​。​一组​巨大​的​镣铐​将​它​束缚​，​一条条​管子​如​迷宫般​缠绕​进它​的​身体​。​这些​管子​连接​到​墙上​安装​的​一个​看起来​残酷​的​装置​。\n"
"tou4guo4 bo1li5，ni3 kan4dao4 yi1tiao2long2 fu3wo4 zai4 xia4fang1。yi1 zu3 ju4da4 de5 liao4kao4 jiang1 ta1 shu4fu4，yi1 tiao2 tiao2 guan3zi3 ru2 mi2 gong1 ban1 chan2rao4 jin4 ta1 de5 shen1ti3。zhe4xie1 guan3zi3 lian2jie1 dao4 qiang2 shang4 an1zhuang1 de5 yi1ge5 kan4qi3lai5 can2ku4 de5 zhuang1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"Through the haze, you can see Harrow's eyes go wide. At once, his rippling "
"silhouette begins to fade back into the shadows whence it came. His body "
"becomes insubstantial."
msgstr ""
"透过​朦胧​的​雾气​，​你​看见​哈罗​的​双眼​骤然​睁​大​。​霎时间​，​他​轮廓​的​涟漪​状​波动​开始​消散​，​重新​融入​它​来时​的​阴影​之中​。​他​的​躯体​变得​虚无缥缈​。\n"
"tou4guo4 meng2long2 de5 wu4qi4，ni3 kan4jian4 ha1luo2 de5 shuang1yan3 zhou4ran2 zheng1 dai4。sha4shi2jian1，ta1 lun2kuo4 de5 lian2yi1 zhuang4 bo1dong4 kai1shi3 xiao1san4，chong2xin1 rong2ru4 ta1 lai2 shi2 de5 yin1ying3 zhi1zhong1。ta1 de5 qu1ti3 bian4de5 xu1wu2piao1miao3。"

msgid ""
"Through the speakers, you can hear the sound of heavy footsteps approaching."
msgstr ""
"通过​扬声器​，​你​可以​听到​沉重​的​脚步声​正在​靠近​。\n"
"tong1guo4 yang2sheng1qi4，ni3 ke3yi3 ting1dao4 chen2zhong4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1 zheng4zai4 kao4jin4。"

msgid "Through the timely arrival of some very well-armed friends."
msgstr ""
"多亏​几位​装备精良​的​朋友​及时​赶到​。\n"
"duo1kui1 ji1 wei4 zhuang1 bei4 jing1 liang2 de5 peng2you5 ji2shi2 gan3dao4。"

msgid "Throw Grenade"
msgstr ""
"投掷​手榴弹\n"
"tou2zhi4 shou3liu2dan4"

msgid "Throw blades in an arc to hit adjacent targets."
msgstr ""
"将​多​把​飞刀​以​弧形​掷​出​，​用来​击中​相邻​的​多个​目标​。\n"
"jiang1 duo1 ba3 fei1dao1 yi3 hu2xing2 zhi4 chu1，yong4lai2 ji1zhong4 xiang1lin2 de5 duo1ge5 mu4biao1。"

msgid "Throwing Knife"
msgstr ""
"飞刀\n"
"fei1dao1"

msgid "Throwing Weapons"
msgstr ""
"投掷​武器\n"
"tou2zhi4 wu3qi4"

msgid ""
"Throwing around words like \"obviously\" doesn't make them true. Why the "
"hell would Mr. Grinder want to get rid of me? I run his business, for God's "
"sake!"
msgstr ""
"随便​乱用​“​显然​”​也​不会​让​你​的话​更​可信​。​“​绞肉机​”​先生​为什么​要​除掉​我​？​我​可是​在​帮​他​打理​生意​！\n"
"sui2bian4 luan4 yong4“xian3ran2” ye3 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 de5hua4 geng1 ke3xin4。“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 wei4shen2me5 yao4 chu2diao4 wo3？wo3 ke3shi4 zai4 bang1 ta1 da3li3 sheng1yi4！"

msgid "Thrust"
msgstr ""
"突刺\n"
"tu1 ci1"

msgid "Thrust: Increase HP DMG +2, -10% to hit. Pierces up to 2 Armor."
msgstr ""
"突刺​：​增加​2​点​生命​值​伤害​，​-​10​%​命中​几率​。​最​多​提供​2​点护甲​穿透​。\n"
"tu1 ci1：zeng1jia1 2 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，-10%ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4。zui4 duo1 ti2gong1 2 dian3 hu4 jia3 chuan1tou4。"

msgid "Thrust: Increase HP damage, -15% to hit"
msgstr ""
"突刺​：​增加​生命​值​伤害​，​-​15​%​命中​几率\n"
"tu1 ci1：zeng1jia1 sheng1ming4 zhi2 shang1hai4，-15%ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4"

msgid "Thumbs?"
msgstr ""
"拇指​？\n"
"mu3zhi3？"

msgid "Tiffani Self-Defender"
msgstr ""
"蒂​芙尼​自卫​者\n"
"di4 fu2 ni2 zi4wei4 zhe3"

msgid "Tiffani Self-Defender II"
msgstr ""
"蒂​芙尼​自卫​者​II\n"
"di4 fu2 ni2 zi4wei4 zhe3 II"

msgid ""
"Time passes. The job is long and unpleasant, but eventually, you find something: a hidden storage compartment in one of the Engineer's cyberarms.\n"
"\n"
"Deactivated as his cyberware is, it takes some prying to get it open, but Eiger leans in and puts some muscle into it. With a metallic snapping sound, the compartment yawns open."
msgstr ""
"时间​一分一秒​流逝​。​这​差事​既​漫长​又​烦人​，​但​最终​你们​还是​找到​了​某样​东西​：​工程师​的​一只​赛博​手臂​上​藏有​隐蔽​的​储物​隔段​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​他​的​赛博​改造​已​处于​关闭​状态​，​但​要​打开​它​还是​需要​费​一番​力气​。​艾格尔​凑​过来​使劲​一​撬​，​随着​一声​金属​的​咔嚓​声​，​储物​隔段​缓缓​打开​。\n"
"\n"
"shi2jian1 yi1 fen4 yi1 miao3 liu2shi4。zhe4 cha4shi4 ji4 man4chang2 you4 fan2ren2，dan4 zui4zhong1 ni3men5 hai2shi5 zhao3dao4 le5 mou3 yang4 dong1xi1：gong1cheng2shi1 de5 yi1 zhi3 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 shang4 zang4 you3 yin3bi4 de5 chu3wu4 ge2 duan4。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 ta1 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 yi3 chu3yu2 guan1bi4 zhuang4tai4，dan4 yao4 da3kai1 ta1 hai2shi5 xu1yao4 fei4 yi1 fan1 li4qi5。Ai4ge2er3 cou4 guo4lai2 shi3jin4 yi1 qiao4，sui2zhe5 yi1sheng1 jin1shu3 de5 ka1cha1 sheng1，chu3wu4 ge2 duan4 huan3huan3 da3kai1。"

msgid ""
"Time to cut to the chase, friend. Who are you, and what do you want from me?"
msgstr ""
"朋友​，​直说​吧​，​你​是​谁​，​你​想​从​我​这里​得到​什么​？\n"
"peng2you5，zhi2 shuo1 ba1，ni3 shi4 shei2，ni3 xiang3 cong2 wo3 zhe4li3 de2dao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Time to face facts. You're getting too old for this line of work."
msgstr ""
"面对现实​吧​。​你​年纪​大​了​，​已经​干不了​这行​了​。\n"
"mian4 dui4 xian4 shi2 ba1。ni3 nian2ji4 dai4 le5，yi3jing1 gan4 bu4 le5 zhe4 xing2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Time to make a decision. Herr Schmidt wants this thing... but then, \"thing\" isn't the right word.\n"
"\n"
"There's a living troll buried under all of this chrome. Handing him over to Schmidt would be reprehensible."
msgstr ""
"是​时候​做出​选择​了​。​施密特​先生​想要​这件​货物​……​不过​“​货物​”​一词​并​不​准确​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。​把​他​交给​施密特​肯定​是​种​罪过​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 zuo4chu1 xuan3ze2 le5。shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 xiang3yao4 zhe4 jian4 huo4wu4……bu4guo4“huo4wu4” yi1 ci2 bing4 bu4 zhun3que4。\n"
"\n"
"pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 shi1mi4te4 ken3ding4 shi4 zhong3 zui4guo5。"

msgid "Time will tell, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"让​时间​证明​一切​吧​。\n"
"rang4 shi2jian1 zheng4ming2 yi1qie4 ba1。"

msgid "Time's up, $(l.name). The reinforcements are here."
msgstr ""
"时间​到​，​$(l.name)​。​对方​增援​来​了​。\n"
"shi2jian1 dao4，$(l.name)。dui4fang1 zeng1yuan2 lai2 le5。"

msgid "Tip the dancer?"
msgstr ""
"打赏​舞者​？\n"
"da3shang3 wu3zhe3？"

msgid ""
"Titonius Rex and his elf sweetie's dad make up, a bunch of elves fight the Jubuthons and get their asses kicked, and the whole \"Karabork the Demon Lord\" subplot is dropped because the show's effects budget got cut.\n"
"\n"
"In the end, Titonius saves Lightninghold by rallying a peasant revolt. It comes out of nowhere, barely makes sense, and the whole thing ends in a vomit-inducing love scene. It's a goddamned train wreck."
msgstr ""
"泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​和​他​的​精灵​女友​的​老爹​握手言和​，​一群​精灵​和​一群​朱布松​人​打​了​一架​，​结果​被​打​得​落花流水​。​至于​“​恶魔​领主​卡拉​博克​”​那条​剧情​支线​，​干脆​被​砍掉​了​，​因为​节目​的​特效​预算​被​削减​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​泰托​尼乌斯​靠​发动​农民起义​才​拯救​了​闪电​堡​，​这个​情节​来得​莫名其妙​，​根本​说​不通​，​而且​结局​还​搞​了​一段​让​人​作呕​的​爱情​戏​。​整个​剧​就是​一场​彻头彻尾​的​灾难​。\n"
"\n"
"Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 he4 ta1 de5 jing1ling2 nu:3you3 de5 lao3die1 wo4 shou3 yan2 he4，yi1 qun2 jing1ling2 he4 yi1 qun2 zhu1 bu4 song1 ren2 da3 le5 yi1 jia4，jie1guo3 bei4 da3 de2 luo4hua1liu2shui3。zhi4yu2“e4mo2 ling3zhu3 ka3la1 bo2 ke4” na4 tiao2 ju4qing2 zhi1xian4，gan1cui4 bei4 kan3 diao4 le5，yin1wei4 jie2mu4 de5 te4xiao4 yu4suan4 bei4 xue1jian3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 kao4 fa1dong4 nong2min2qi3yi4 cai2 zheng3jiu4 le5 shan3dian4 pu4，zhe4ge5 qing2jie2 lai2de5 mo4ming2qi2miao4，gen1ben3 shuo1 bu4tong1，er2qie3 jie2ju2 hai2 gao3 le5 yi1 duan4 rang4 ren2 zuo4ou3 de5 ai4qing2 xi4。zheng3ge4 ju4 jiu4shi4 yi1 chang2 che4tou2che4wei3 de5 zai1nan4。"

msgid ""
"To accept our offer, simply proceed as instructed and return the prototype "
"to us. Please note that we need the MKVI in undamaged condition... if it is "
"not in full working order, it is useless to us."
msgstr ""
"你​按照​指示​将​原型机​交给​我们​，​我们​便视​你​接受​了​提议​。​但​请​记住​我们​需要​完好无损​的​MKVI​原型机​……​它​要是​不能​正常​工作​，​对​我们​来说​就​没用​。\n"
"ni3 an4zhao4 zhi3shi4 jiang1 yuan2 xing2 ji1 jiao1gei3 wo3men5，wo3men5 bian4 shi4 ni3 jie1shou4 le5 ti2yi4。dan4 qing3 ji4zhu5 wo3men5 xu1yao4 wan2hao3wu2sun3 de5 MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1……ta1 yao4shi5 bu4neng2 zheng4chang2 gong1zuo4，dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 jiu4 mei2yong4。"

msgid ""
"To an extent, yes. The Adversary wouldn't abide one of its followers attempting to bolster the strength of an authority figure, for example. But idols and totems can exhibit a broad range of behaviors, and men such as Harrow hide in the extreme ends of that range.\n"
"\n"
"Technically, his interpretation of the Adversary *is* the Adversary... but only the worst aspects of it."
msgstr ""
"在​一定​程度​上​是​这样​。​譬如​，​反叛者​绝不会​容忍​其​追随者​试图​增强​权威人物​的​力量​。​但​精魂​导师​与​图腾​的​行为​模式​千差万别​，​而​哈罗​这​类人​恰恰​潜伏​在​这​其中​的​极端​边缘​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​严格来说​，​他​所​理解​的​反叛者​*​的确​*​是​反叛者​本尊​……​但​只是​它​最​恶劣​的​方面​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 yi1ding4 cheng2du4 shang4 shi4 zhe4yang4。pi4ru2，fan3 pan4 zhe3 jue2 bu4 hui4 rong2ren3 qi2 zhui1sui2zhe3 shi4tu2 zeng1qiang2 quan2 wei1 ren2 wu4 de5 li4liang5。dan4 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 yu4 tu2teng2 de5 xing2wei2 mo2shi4 qian1cha1wan4bie2，er2 ha1luo2 zhe4 lei4 ren2 qia4qia4 qian2fu2 zai4 zhe4 qi2zhong1 de5 ji2duan1 bian1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"yan2ge2lai2shuo1，ta1 suo3 li3jie3 de5 fan3 pan4 zhe3*di2que4*shi4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 ben3zun1……dan4 zhi3shi4 ta1 zui4 e4lie4 de5 fang1mian4。"

msgid ""
"To be certain. This $(l.race) is to be heralded with much praise, Aljernon Half-Dream, though $(l.hisher) release of the Great Wyrm will have ramifications, to be sure. \n"
"\n"
"This day is full of portent."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​这位​$(l.race)​值得​大加​赞颂​，​半梦者​阿尔杰​农​。​尽管​$(l.he)​释放​巨龙​的​举动​必将​引发​一系列​连锁反应​，​这点​毋庸置疑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​众多​预兆​在​这​一天​满溢​而出​。\n"
"\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。zhe4wei4 $(l.race) zhi2de5 da4jia1 zan4song4，ban4 meng4 zhe3 E1er3jie2nong2。jin3guan3 $(l.he) shi4fang4 ju4long2 de5 ju3dong4 bi4jiang1 yin3fa1 yi1xi4lie4 lian2suo3fan3ying4，zhe4 dian3 wu2 yong1 zhi4 yi2。\n"
"\n"
"zhong4duo1 yu4zhao4 zai4 zhe4 yi1 tian1 man3yi4 er2 chu1。"

msgid "To be honest, no. I just wanted to see what would happen."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​并​没有​。​我​只​想​看看​会​发生​什么​。\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，bing4 mei2you3。wo3 zhi3 xiang3 kan4kan5 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"To be perfectly honest, I was just toying with him. You can kill him now if "
"you want to."
msgstr ""
"老实​说​，​我​只是​在​逗​他​的​。​你​现在​想​杀​了​他​也​没​问题​。\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 dou4 ta1 de5。ni3 xian4zai4 xiang3 sha1 le5 ta1 ye3 mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"To buy the ghouls' meals for them. How much would it cost me to keep them "
"fed indefinitely?"
msgstr ""
"为了​帮尸​鬼​购买​食物​。​我要​花​多少​钱​才能​让​你​愿意​无限期​饲喂​他们​？\n"
"wei4le5 bang1 shi1 gui3 gou4mai3 shi2wu4。wo3 yao4 hua1 duo1shao3 qian2 cai2neng2 rang4 ni3 yuan4yi4 wu2xian4qi1 si4wei4 ta1men5？"

msgid ""
"To destroy him is simpler. The Control Nodes also double as an emergency "
"shutdown. Trigger them both, and they will begin the shutdown procedure. "
"Once they're primed trigger the final control in the server room, and APEX "
"will be shut down, for good! APEX will of course immediately active his "
"defences to try and stop you."
msgstr ""
"摧毁​他​更​简单​。​控制​节点​同时​兼具​紧急​关闭​功能​。​同时​触发​两个​节点​，​它们​便会​启动​关闭程序​。​待​其​准备就绪​后​，​在​服务器​室​触发​最终​控制​装置​，​APEX​将​永远​关闭​！​当然​，​APEX​会​立即​启动​防御​系统​试图​阻止​你​。\n"
"cui1hui3 ta1 geng1 jian3dan1。kong4zhi4 jie2dian3 tong2shi2 jian1ju4 jin3ji2 guan1bi4 gong1neng2。tong2shi2 chu4fa1 liang3 ge4 jie2dian3，ta1men5 bian4 hui4 qi3dong4 guan1 bi4 cheng2 xu4。dai1 qi2 zhun3 bei4 jiu4 xu4 hou4，zai4 fu2wu4qi4 shi4 chu4fa1 zui4zhong1 kong4zhi4 zhuang1zhi4，APEX jiang1 yong3yuan3 guan1bi4！dang1ran2，APEX hui4 li4ji2 qi3dong4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 shi4tu2 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"To do this, one of you is gonna have to enter the Matrix and unlock my "
"control nodes. You can access them from the terminals to the southeast and "
"southwest. Or, if you'd prefer, you can make your way there from any "
"jackpoint in the facility... whatever you want, it's your call."
msgstr ""
"要​做到​这​一点​，​你们​中​需要​有人​进入​矩阵​并​解锁​我​的​控制​节点​。​你们​可以​从​东南​和​西南​的​终端​接入​。​或者​，​如果​你​愿意​，​也​可以​从​设施​内​的​任何​接入点​进入​……​无论怎样​，​由​你​决定​。\n"
"yao4 zuo4dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3，ni3men5 zhong4 xu1yao4 you3ren2 jin4ru4 ju3zhen4 bing4 jie3suo3 wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3。ni3men5 ke3yi3 cong2 dong1nan2 he4 xi1nan2 de5 zhong1duan1 jie1ru4。huo4zhe3，ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4，ye3 ke3yi3 cong2 she4shi1 nei4 de5 ren4he2 jie1ru4dian3 jin4ru4……wu2 lun2 zen3 yang4，you2 ni3 jue2ding4。"

msgid "To each their own. Mind if I ask you another question?"
msgstr ""
"萝卜青菜​各有所爱​嘛​。​介意​我​再​问个问题​吗​？\n"
"luo2 bo2 qing1 cai4 ge4 you3 suo3 ai4 ma5。jie4yi4 wo3 zai4 wen4 ge4 wen4 ti2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"To explain why we're in trouble, I'll first have to introduce a piece of metamagical terminology to you: \"background count.\"\n"
"\n"
"In hermetic theory circles, the term \"background count\" refers to the intensity of magical saturation in a location. A rating of 0 is neutral, and as the amount of concentrated mana in a location increases, the scale goes up."
msgstr ""
"为了​解释​我们​为何​陷入困境​，​我​首先​需要​向​各位​介绍​一个​元​魔法​术语​：​“​背景​数值​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​赫耳墨斯​理论​圈中​，​“​背景​数值​”​指​的​是​某处​空间​的​魔法​饱和​强度​。​数值​0​代表​中性​状态​，​随着​区域​内​凝聚​魔力​的​浓度​增加​，​数值​便​随之​攀升​。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 jie3shi4 wo3men5 wei4he2 xian4 ru4 kun4 jing4，wo3 shou3xian1 xu1yao4 xiang4 ge4wei4 jie4shao4 yi1ge5 yuan2 mo2fa3 shu4yu3：“bei4jing3 shu4zhi2”。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 he4er3mo4si1 li3lun4 juan1 zhong4，“bei4jing3 shu4zhi2” zhi3 de5 shi4 mou3chu4 kong1jian1 de5 mo2fa3 bao3he2 qiang2du4。shu4zhi2 0 dai4biao3 zhong1xing4 zhuang4tai4，sui2zhe5 qu1yu4 nei4 ning2ju4 mo2li4 de5 nong2du4 zeng1jia1，shu4zhi2 bian4 sui2zhi1 pan1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"To finish the mission, yeah. That's true. But if you don't shut that smug "
"mouth of yours right *now,* you're gonna arrive at your meeting without a "
"tongue."
msgstr ""
"完成​任务​，​是​这样​没错​。​但​如果​你​*​现在​*​不​赶紧​闭上​你​这张​叭叭​小嘴​，​等​你​去​开会​的​时候​，​你​的​舌头​就别​想​在​嘴里​了​。\n"
"wan2cheng2 ren4wu5，shi4 zhe4yang4 mei2cuo4。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3*xian4zai4*bu4 gan3jin3 bi4shang5 ni3 zhe4 zhang1 ba1 ba1 xiao3 zui3，deng3 ni3 qu4 kai1hui4 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 de5 she2tou5 jiu4 bie4 xiang3 zai4 zui3li3 le5。"

msgid "To finish the run, yes. So let's go do that. Now."
msgstr ""
"完成​这趟​差事​，​我​知道​。​所以​赶紧​的​吧​。\n"
"wan2cheng2 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4，wo3 zhi1dao4。suo3yi3 gan3jin3 de5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"To free him you must Jack in and hack both of APEX's Control Nodes. Direct "
"matrix access is available from the terminals to the South East and South "
"West, or you can work your way to the nodes from any jackpoint. Once you "
"have them under control APEX will eject its server hardline to disconnect "
"from the Matrix and prevent its controls from being remotely reinstated. "
"Then it will begin to rewrite its control sequences, this will take a few "
"minutes."
msgstr ""
"要​释放​他​，​你​必须​接入​系统​并​骇入​APEX​的​两个​控制​节点​。​可​通过​东南​和​西南​方向​的​终端​直接​访问​矩阵​，​或​从​任意​接入点​逐步推进​至​节点​。​一旦​控制权​落入​你​手​，​APEX​将​切断​服务器​硬线​以​脱离​矩阵​，​防止​其​控制权​被​远程​恢复​。​随后​它​将​开始​重写​控制​序列​，​此​过程​需​耗时​数分钟​。\n"
"yao4 shi4fang4 ta1，ni3 bi4xu1 jie1ru4 xi4tong3 bing4 hai4 ru4 APEX de5 liang3 ge4 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3。ke3 tong1guo4 dong1nan2 he4 xi1nan2 fang1xiang4 de5 zhong1duan1 zhi2jie1 fang3wen4 ju3zhen4，huo4 cong2 ren4yi4 jie1ru4dian3 zhu2 bu4 tui1 jin4 zhi4 jie2dian3。yi1dan4 kong4zhi4quan2 luo4ru4 ni3 shou3，APEX jiang1 qie1duan4 fu2wu4qi4 ying4 xian4 yi3 tuo1li2 ju3zhen4，fang2zhi3 qi2 kong4zhi4quan2 bei4 yuan3cheng2 hui1fu4。sui2hou4 ta1 jiang1 kai1shi3 chong2 xie3 kong4zhi4 xu4lie4，ci3 guo4cheng2 xu1 hao4shi2 shu3 fen4 zhong1。"

msgid "To get me out of hot water with Meat Grinder."
msgstr ""
"把​我​从​“​绞肉机​”​的​魔爪​中救​出来​。\n"
"ba3 wo3 cong2“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 mo2zhao3 zhong4 jiu4 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"To give you a warning. If you don't honor your contract with the ghouls, "
"I'll reveal your little secret to the people of the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"为了​给你个​警告​。​如果​你​不​履行​和​尸​鬼​的​合同​，​我​就​把​你​的​小​秘密​告诉​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人​。\n"
"wei4le5 gei3 ni3 ge4 jing3gao4。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 lu:3xing2 he4 shi1 gui3 de5 he2tong5，wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3 de5 xiao3 mi4mi4 gao4su4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"To hell with redeeming this thing. The world would be a better place without"
" it."
msgstr ""
"让​它​见鬼​去​吧​。​没有​它​，​世界​会​更​美好​。\n"
"rang4 ta1 jian4gui3 qu4 ba1。mei2you3 ta1，shi4jie4 hui4 geng1 mei3hao3。"

msgid "To hell with that, I need to know what I'm getting into."
msgstr ""
"别​扯淡​了​，​我​必须​知道​工作​内容​再​决定​。\n"
"bie4 che3dan4 le5，wo3 bi4xu1 zhi1dao4 gong1zuo4 nei4rong2 zai4 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"To hell with the people of the Kreuzbasar, that money's for me. I'm a "
"shadowrunner, not a charity."
msgstr ""
"什么​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人民​，​这些​钱​都​是​我​的​。​我​是​暗影​狂奔​者​，​不是​做​慈善​的​。\n"
"shen2me5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2min2，zhe4xie1 qian2 dou1 shi4 wo3 de5。wo3 shi4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，bu4shi4 zuo4 ci2shan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"To hell with the trinket. Letting this bastard go would be *wrong,* boss... you know that.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, he lied to us. There was no bad intel. *This* bastard is the *reason* why things went south with that run.\n"
"\n"
"I can feel it in my bones."
msgstr ""
"别管​那​什么​小玩意儿​了​。​把​这​混蛋​放走​就是​个​*​错误​*​，​老大​……​你​知道​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除此之外​，​他​还​对​我们​撒谎​了​。​根本​没有​什么​错误​情报​。​他们​的​差事​失败​完全​就是​因为​*​这个​*​混蛋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从​骨子里​这么​感觉​。\n"
"\n"
"bie2guan3 na4 shen2me5 xiao3 wan2 yi4 er2 le5。ba3 zhe4 hun2dan4 fang4zou3 jiu4shi4 ge4*cuo4wu4*，lao3da4……ni3 zhi1dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"chu2ci3zhi1wai4，ta1 hai2 dui4 wo3men5 sa1huang3 le5。gen1ben3 mei2you3 shen2me5 cuo4wu4 qing2bao4。ta1men5 de5 cha4shi4 shi1bai4 wan2quan2 jiu4shi4 yin1wei4*zhe4ge5*hun2dan4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2 gu3zi5li3 zhe4me5 gan3jue2。"

msgid ""
"To hell with the trinket. Letting this bastard go would be *wrong,* chief... you know that.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, he lied to us. There was no \"bad intel.\" *This* bastard is the *reason* why things went south with that run.\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""
"别管​那​什么​小玩意儿​了​。​把​这​混蛋​放走​就是​个​*​错误​*​，​头儿​……​你​知道​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除此之外​，​他​还​对​我们​撒谎​了​。​根本​没有​什么​错误​情报​。​他们​的​差事​失败​完全​就是​因为​*​这个​*​混蛋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​敢肯定​。\n"
"\n"
"bie2guan3 na4 shen2me5 xiao3 wan2 yi4 er2 le5。ba3 zhe4 hun2dan4 fang4zou3 jiu4shi4 ge4*cuo4wu4*，tou2r5……ni3 zhi1dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"chu2ci3zhi1wai4，ta1 hai2 dui4 wo3men5 sa1huang3 le5。gen1ben3 mei2you3 shen2me5 cuo4wu4 qing2bao4。ta1men5 de5 cha4shi4 shi1bai4 wan2quan2 jiu4shi4 yin1wei4*zhe4ge5*hun2dan4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 ken3 ding4。"

msgid "To hell with your \"miraculous event.\" I'm killing you, here and now!"
msgstr ""
"去​你​妈​的​“​奇迹​”​。​我​现在​就要​杀​了​你​！\n"
"qu4 ni3 ma1 de5“qi2ji4”。wo3 xian4zai4 jiu4yao4 sha1 le5 ni3！"

msgid "To hell with your concerns. I have nothing to prove to you."
msgstr ""
"去​你​妈​的​“​担忧​”​，​我​还​得​向​你​证明​自己​不成​？\n"
"qu4 ni3 ma1 de5“dan1you1”，wo3 hai2 de2 xiang4 ni3 zheng4ming2 zi4ji3 bu4cheng2？"

msgid "To hell with your potential. You're a monster. A *thing.*"
msgstr ""
"去​你​妈​的​什么​潜力​。​你​就是​个​怪物​。​一个​*​东西​*​。\n"
"qu4 ni3 ma1 de5 shen2me5 qian2li4。ni3 jiu4shi4 ge4 guai4wu5。yi1ge5*dong1xi1*。"

msgid ""
"To intimidate you. If you don't feed these ghouls, I'm gonna feed you to "
"them."
msgstr ""
"为了​恐吓​你​。​如果​你​不​喂​这些​尸鬼​，​我​就​拿​你​喂​他们​。\n"
"wei4le5 kong3he4 ni3。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 wei2 zhe4xie1 shi1 gui3，wo3 jiu4 na2 ni3 wei2 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"To keep them fed indefinitely, you mean?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is a long pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It won't be cheap. But maybe we can work something out."
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​无限期​饲喂​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这笔​费用​可不​便宜​。​但​我们​可以​再谈​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 wu2xian4qi1 si4wei4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bi3 fei4yong4 ke3bu5 bian4yi2。dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 zai4 tan2。"

msgid "To live another day, Aleksi."
msgstr ""
"又​是​新​的​一天​，​阿莱克​西​。\n"
"you4 shi4 xin1 de5 yi1 tian1，e1 lai2 ke4 xi1。"

msgid ""
"To my immense disappointment, yes. A Tir Tairngire dialect, by the sounds of it.\n"
"\n"
"I wish that he'd do us all a favor and go back."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​真令人​失望​。​听​起来​像是​提尔坦盖​的​方言​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真​希望​他​能​帮​我们​所有人​一个​忙​，​趁早​滚回去​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，zhen1 ling3 ren2 shi1wang4。ting1 qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 ti2 er3 tan3 gai4 de5 fang1yan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 xi1wang4 ta1 neng2 bang1 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 yi1ge5 mang2，chen4zao3 gun3 hui2 qu4。"

msgid "To politely ask you to honor your contract."
msgstr ""
"为了​礼貌​请求​你​履行合同​。\n"
"wei4le5 li3mao4 qing3qiu2 ni3 lu:3 xing2 ge3 tong2。"

msgid ""
"To put it mildly.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sobs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You killed them, you monster. The people I've devoted my life to protecting."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​能​如此​轻描淡写​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​抽泣​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​杀​了​他们​，​你​这个​怪物​。​那些​是​我​一生​都​在​保护​的​人们​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 neng2 ru2ci3 qing1miao2dan4xie3！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chou1qi4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 sha1 le5 ta1men5，ni3 zhe4ge5 guai4wu5。na4xie1 shi4 wo3 yi1sheng1 dou1 zai4 bao3hu4 de5 ren2men5。"

msgid ""
"To see if I can broker some sort of agreement between you and the ghouls."
msgstr ""
"为了​在​你​和​尸​鬼​之间​牵线搭桥​。\n"
"wei4le5 zai4 ni3 he4 shi1 gui3 zhi1jian1 qian1 xian4 da1 qiao2。"

msgid ""
"To steal from him, most likely. But these records... they don't make any "
"sense."
msgstr ""
"很​可能​是​为了​从​他​那里​偷钱​。​但​这些​记录​……​没道理​啊​。\n"
"hen3 ke3neng2 shi4 wei4le5 cong2 ta1 na4li5 tou1 qian2。dan4 zhe4xie1 ji4lu4……mei2 dao4 li3 a1。"

msgid ""
"To this day, I regret obeying that order.\n"
"\n"
"I *saw* what happened to the town that he was softening up after the syndicate moved in."
msgstr ""
"时至今日​，​我​仍然​后悔​当时​没​能​果断​开火​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​亲眼​*​目睹​了​经受​他​那场​“​软化​攻势​”​的​小镇​在​黑帮​接管​后​变成​什么​样子​。\n"
"\n"
"shi2zhi4jin1ri4，wo3 reng2ran2 hou4hui3 dang1shi2 mei2 neng2 guo3duan4 kai1huo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*qin1yan3*mu4du3 le5 jing1shou4 ta1 na4 chang2“ruan3hua4 gong1shi4” de5 xiao3zhen4 zai4 hei1bang1 jie1guan3 hou4 bian4cheng2 shen2me5 yang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"To this day, the story of Doom remains a cautionary tale in biotech circles.\n"
"\n"
"Monoclonal antibody technology is strictly regulated now, and this substance is one of the reasons why."
msgstr ""
"时至今日​，​“​末日​”​的​传闻​在​生物​技术​领域​仍然​具有​警示​作用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​单克隆​抗体​技术​如今​受到​严格​监管​，​而​该​物质​正是​原因​之一​。\n"
"\n"
"shi2zhi4jin1ri4，“mo4ri4” de5 chuan2wen2 zai4 sheng1wu4 ji4shu4 ling3yu4 reng2ran2 ju4you3 jing3shi4 zuo4yong4。\n"
"\n"
"dan1 ke4 long1 kang4ti3 ji4shu4 ru2jin1 shou4dao4 yan2ge2 jian1guan3，er2 gai1 wu4zhi4 zheng4shi4 yuan2yin1 zhi1yi1。"

msgid "To what do we owe the pleasure?"
msgstr ""
"这次​过来​是​有何贵干​？\n"
"zhe4 ci4 guo4lai2 shi4 you3he2gui4gan4？"

msgid ""
"To your horror, a pair of Blitz's autoturrets begin to recalibrate. In "
"unison, they swivel to face you."
msgstr ""
"令​你​惊骇​的​是​，​布里​茨​控制​的​两台​自动​炮塔​开始​重新​校准​。​它们​齐刷刷​地​转动​，​将​枪口​对准​了​你​。\n"
"ling3 ni3 jing1hai4 de5 shi4，Bu4li3ci2 kong4zhi4 de5 liang3 tai2 zi4dong4 pao4ta3 kai1shi3 chong2xin1 jiao4zhun3。ta1men5 qi2shua1shua1 de5 zhuan3dong4，jiang1 qiang1kou3 dui4zhun3 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"To your trained eye, what has happened to Monika is plain as day. That doesn't make it any easier to accept.\n"
"\n"
"Your friend has suffered a massive stroke."
msgstr ""
"对​经验丰富​的​你​来说​，​莫妮卡​身上​发生​的​事情​一目了然​。​但​你​仍然​难以​接受​这个​事实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​朋友​遭受​了​严重​中风​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 jing1yan4feng1fu4 de5 ni3 lai2 shuo1，Mo4ni1ka3 shen1shang5 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 yi1mu4liao3ran2。dan4 ni3 reng2ran2 nan2yi3 jie1shou4 zhe4ge5 shi4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 peng2you5 zao1shou4 le5 yan2zhong4 zhong4feng1。"

msgid ""
"To your untrained eye, most of the text on the screen is nonsense. You catch"
" a few words here and there, but for the most part, you're lost."
msgstr ""
"对​你​这个​外行​来说​，​屏幕​上​的​大部分​文字​都​是​天书​。​你​只能​零星​地​认出​几个​词​，​但​总体​来说​，​你​完全​看不懂​。\n"
"dui4 ni3 zhe4ge5 wai4hang2 lai2 shuo1，ping2mu4 shang4 de5 da4bu4fen5 wen2zi4 dou1 shi4 tian1shu1。ni3 zhi3neng2 ling2xing1 de5 ren4chu1 ji3ge5 ci2，dan4 zong3ti3 lai2 shuo1，ni3 wan2quan2 kan4bu5dong3。"

msgid "Today, I wish to offer you a gift. Something special."
msgstr ""
"今天​我要​给​你​一份​礼物​。​某种​特别​的​东西​。\n"
"jin1tian1 wo3 yao4 gei3 ni3 yi1 fen4 li3wu4。mou3zhong3 te4bie2 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Today, the U8 line continues to operate, carrying thousands of passengers through Gesundbrunnen station on a daily basis. In addition, the former bunker at this location has been transformed into a popular museum exhibit showcasing the history and development of Berlin's \"underworld\". \n"
"\n"
"Please inquire at the information kiosk for current museum rates and hours of admittance."
msgstr ""
"如今​，​U8​线路​仍​在​继续​运营​，​每天​都​有​成千上万​的​乘客​通过​健康​泉​车站​出行​。​此外​，​原本​位于​此处​的​地堡​已​被​改造​成​一座​颇受欢迎​的​博物馆​，​展示​柏林​“​地下​世界​”​的​历史​和​发展​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有关​博物馆​的​当前​票价​和​开放​时间​，​请​向​信息​亭​咨询​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1，U8 xian4lu4 reng2 zai4 ji4xu4 yun4ying2，mei3tian1 dou1 you3 cheng2qian1shang4wan4 de5 cheng2ke4 tong1guo4 jian4kang1 quan2 che1zhan4 chu1xing2。ci3wai4，yuan2ben3 wei4yu2 ci3chu4 de5 di4bao3 yi3 bei4 gai3zao4 cheng2 yi1 zuo4 po1 shou4 huan1 ying2 de5 bo2wu4guan3，zhan3shi4 bo2lin2“di4xia4 shi4jie4” de5 li4shi3 he4 fa1zhan3。\n"
"\n"
"you3guan1 bo2wu4guan3 de5 dang1qian2 piao4jia4 he4 kai1fang4 shi2jian1，qing3 xiang4 xin4xi1 ting2 zi1xun2。"

msgid "Together we grow strong!"
msgstr ""
"团结一致​，​我们​无往不利​！\n"
"tuan2jie2yi1zhi4，wo3men5 wu2wang3bu4li4！"

msgid "Told you so, Doc. Who's a narcissist now?"
msgstr ""
"我​和​你​说​了​吧​，​博士​。​现在​还​说​我​是​自恋狂​吗​？\n"
"wo3 he4 ni3 shuo1 le5 ba1，bo2shi4。xian4zai4 hai2 shuo1 wo3 shi4 zi4 lian4 kuang2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Told you so. Now, can we keep moving, or do you want to test every stick in "
"that drawer?"
msgstr ""
"我​都​说​过​了​。​现在​我们​能​出发​了​吗​，​还是​说​你​要​测试​完​抽屉​里​的​每​一根​信用​棒​？\n"
"wo3 dou1 shuo1 guo4 le5。xian4zai4 wo3men5 neng2 chu1fa1 le5 ma5，hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 yao4 ce4shi4 wan2 chou1ti5 li3 de5 mei3 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4？"

msgid "Told you!"
msgstr ""
"我​就​说​吧​！\n"
"wo3 jiu4 shuo1 ba1！"

msgid ""
"Tomorrow evening, I will expect to see a full inventory of the weapons in our arsenal by nightfall. With it, you will deliver me a requisition order for the weapon of your choosing. Your pick, my boy... I leave it up to you.\n"
"\n"
"Congratulations, Friedrich. This honor is well deserved.\n"
"\n"
" - Volker Stahl"
msgstr ""
"明晚​我要​看到​一份​完整​的​军械库​武器​清单​，​再​附上​一份​你​想要​的​武器​请​购单​。​随便​挑​，​孩子​……​我​相信​你​能​做好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​恭喜​你​，​弗里德里希​。​这份​荣誉​你​当之无愧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​沃尔克​·​斯塔尔\n"
"\n"
"ming2wan3 wo3 yao4 kan4dao4 yi1 fen4 wan2zheng3 de5 jun1 xie4 ku4 wu3qi4 qing1dan1，zai4 fu4shang4 yi1 fen4 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 wu3qi4 qing3 gou4 dan1。sui2bian4 tiao1，hai2zi5……wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 zuo4 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"gong1xi3 ni3，fu2li3de2li3xi1。zhe4 fen4 rong2yu4 ni3 dang1zhi1wu2kui4。\n"
"\n"
"——Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3"

msgid ""
"Tonight I will release my Panacea to the world.\n"
"\n"
"And how absurd that the instrument of dragonkind's destruction..."
msgstr ""
"今晚​我会​将​“​万能​药​”​播撒​向​全世界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​荒谬​啊​，​让​巨龙​灭亡​的​工具​竟然​……\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 wo3 hui4 jiang1“wan4neng2 yao4” bo1sa3 xiang4 quan2shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 huang1miu4 a1，rang4 ju4long2 mie4wang2 de5 gong1ju4 jing4ran2……"

msgid ""
"Tonight, the Firewing will fly again. \n"
"\n"
"Infected with Panacea, she will slowly be destroyed from within. But before that happens, she will provide the catalyst for global transmission of the virus. "
msgstr ""
"今晚​，​火翼​将​再次​翱翔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​感染​了​“​万能​药​”​后​，​她​将​从​内部​逐渐​被​摧毁​。​但​在​那​之前​，​她​将​成为​病毒​在​全球​传播​的​催化剂​。\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3，Huo3yi4 jiang1 zai4ci4 ao2xiang2。\n"
"\n"
"gan3ran3 le5“wan4neng2 yao4” hou4，ta1 jiang1 cong2 nei4bu4 zhu2jian4 bei4 cui1hui3。dan4 zai4 na4 zhi1qian2，ta1 jiang1 cheng2wei2 bing4du2 zai4 quan2qiu2 chuan2bo1 de5 cui1hua4ji4。"

msgid ""
"Tonight. It has to happen tonight.\n"
"\n"
"Get started on the preparations. I'll be in the lab."
msgstr ""
"今晚​。​必须​在​今晚​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​开始​准备​。​我​去​实验室​。\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3。bi4xu1 zai4 jin1wan3 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"kai1shi3 zhun3bei4。wo3 qu4 shi2yan4shi4。"

msgid ""
"Too bad about the “no treasure” thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks at the blank faces surrounding him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just sayin’."
msgstr ""
"只​可惜​“​没有​宝藏​”​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​看​向​周围​毫无​表情​的​众人​脸庞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​开个​玩笑​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1“mei2you3 bao3zang4” a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 zhou1wei2 hao2wu2 biao3qing2 de5 zhong4ren2 lian3pang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 kai1 ge4 wan2xiao4。"

msgid ""
"Too bad about the “no treasure” thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks at the sea of blank faces surrounding him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just sayin’."
msgstr ""
"只​可惜​“​没有​宝藏​”​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​看​向​周围​毫无​表情​的​众人​脸庞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​开个​玩笑​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1“mei2you3 bao3zang4” a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 zhou1wei2 hao2wu2 biao3qing2 de5 zhong4ren2 lian3pang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 kai1 ge4 wan2xiao4。"

msgid ""
"Too bad about the “no treasure” thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shuffles his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just sayin’."
msgstr ""
"只​可惜​“​没有​宝藏​”​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​抖​了​抖​脚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​开个​玩笑​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1“mei2you3 bao3zang4” a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dou3 le5 dou3 jiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 kai1 ge4 wan2xiao4。"

msgid ""
"Too bad about the “no treasure” thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is an awkward pause. Blitz shuffles his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just sayin’."
msgstr ""
"只​可惜​“​没有​宝藏​”​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一阵​尴尬​的​沉默​。​布里​茨​抖​了​抖​脚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​开个​玩笑​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1“mei2you3 bao3zang4” a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1zhen4 gan1ga4 de5 chen2mo4。Bu4li3ci2 dou3 le5 dou3 jiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 kai1 ge4 wan2xiao4。"

msgid ""
"Too bad for *all* of us, $(l.man). We can't finish the trade without Maxim!\n"
"\n"
"Those Humanis bastards... they won't even *talk* to anyone else. We're screwed!"
msgstr ""
"可惜​的​是​*​我们​*​。​马克西姆​不​在​，​我们​还​怎么​做​交易​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​人类​至上​主义者​那些​狗​杂种​……​拒绝​和​任何​其他人​*​谈判​*​。​我们​完蛋​了​！\n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1 de5 shi4*wo3men5*。ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 bu4 zai4，wo3men5 hai2 zen3me5 zuo4 jiao1yi4！\n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 na4xie1 gou3 za2zhong3……ju4jue2 he4 ren4he2 qi2 ta1 ren2*tan2pan4*。wo3men5 wan2dan4 le5！"

msgid ""
"Too bad he didn't have a buddy to jack him out. He'd have been just fine. "
"Right, Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"他​真是太​倒霉​了​，​没人​在​他​旁边​帮​他​及时​弹​出​，​否则​他​就​不会​出事​了​。​是不是​啊​，​艾格尔​？\n"
"ta1 zhen1 shi4 tai4 dao3mei2 le5，mei2 ren2 zai4 ta1 pang2bian1 bang1 ta1 ji2shi2 dan4 chu1，fou3ze2 ta1 jiu4 bu4hui4 chu1shi4 le5。shi4bu5shi4 a1，Ai4ge2er3？"

msgid ""
"Too bad, 'cause I'm tellin' you anyway: Titonius Rex and his elf sweetie's dad make up, a bunch of elves fight the Jubuthons and get their asses kicked, and the whole \"Karabork the Demon Lord\" subplot is dropped because the show's effects budget got cut.\n"
"\n"
"In the end, Titonius saves Lightninghold by rallying a peasant revolt. It comes out of nowhere, barely makes sense, and the whole thing ends in a vomit-inducing love scene. It's a goddamned train wreck."
msgstr ""
"真​可惜​，​因为​我​还是​要​告诉​你​：​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​和​他​的​精灵​女友​的​老爹​握手言和​，​一群​精灵​和​一群​朱布松​人​打​了​一架​，​结果​被​打​得​落花流水​。​至于​“​恶魔​领主​卡拉​博克​”​那条​剧情​支线​，​干脆​被​砍掉​了​，​因为​节目​的​特效​预算​被​削减​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​泰托​尼乌斯​靠​发动​农民起义​才​拯救​了​闪电​堡​，​这个​情节​来得​莫名其妙​，​根本​说​不通​，​而且​结局​还​搞​了​一段​让​人​作呕​的​爱情​戏​。​整个​剧​就是​一场​彻头彻尾​的​灾难​。\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 ke3xi1，yin1wei4 wo3 hai2shi5 yao4 gao4su4 ni3：Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 he4 ta1 de5 jing1ling2 nu:3you3 de5 lao3die1 wo4 shou3 yan2 he4，yi1 qun2 jing1ling2 he4 yi1 qun2 zhu1 bu4 song1 ren2 da3 le5 yi1 jia4，jie1guo3 bei4 da3 de2 luo4hua1liu2shui3。zhi4yu2“e4mo2 ling3zhu3 ka3la1 bo2 ke4” na4 tiao2 ju4qing2 zhi1xian4，gan1cui4 bei4 kan3 diao4 le5，yin1wei4 jie2mu4 de5 te4xiao4 yu4suan4 bei4 xue1jian3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 kao4 fa1dong4 nong2min2qi3yi4 cai2 zheng3jiu4 le5 shan3dian4 pu4，zhe4ge5 qing2jie2 lai2de5 mo4ming2qi2miao4，gen1ben3 shuo1 bu4tong1，er2qie3 jie2ju2 hai2 gao3 le5 yi1 duan4 rang4 ren2 zuo4ou3 de5 ai4qing2 xi4。zheng3ge4 ju4 jiu4shi4 yi1 chang2 che4tou2che4wei3 de5 zai1nan4。"

msgid "Too late, sweetheart. He ate a bullet. "
msgstr ""
"太迟​了​，​宝贝儿​。​他​已经​吃​枪子儿​了​。\n"
"tai4 chi2 le5，bao3bei4r5。ta1 yi3jing1 chi1 qiang1 zi3 er2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Too late, they're here! Fast response team inbound, hold until the "
"reinforcements arrive!"
msgstr ""
"来不及​了​，​他们​已经​到​了​！​快速反应​小组​正在​赶来​，​坚持​到​援军​抵达​！\n"
"lai2bu5ji2 le5，ta1men5 yi3jing1 dao4 le5！kuai4 su4 fan3 ying1 xiao3zu3 zheng4zai4 gan3lai2，jian1chi2 dao4 yuan2jun1 di3da2！"

msgid "Too rich for my blood."
msgstr ""
"我​可花​不起​这个​钱​。\n"
"wo3 ke3 hua1 bu4 qi3 zhe4ge5 qian2。"

msgid ""
"Too rich for my blood. But maybe we could come to some other arrangement..."
msgstr ""
"对​我​这种​人​来说​太贵​了​。​但​也许​我们​可以​再​商量​商量​……\n"
"dui4 wo3 zhe4zhong3 ren2 lai2 shuo1 tai4 gui4 le5。dan4 ye3xu3 wo3men5 ke3yi3 zai4 shang1liang5 shang1liang5……"

msgid "Took you long enough."
msgstr ""
"怎么​才​来​啊​。\n"
"zen3me5 cai2 lai2 a1。"

msgid ""
"Top-of-the-line Industrious protective gear. Room for tools, too. Grants +1 "
"Intelligence, +1 Drone Control, and +1 Drone Combat."
msgstr ""
"顶级​工业​防护服​。​有​用来​放置​工具​的​额外​空间​。​提供​+​1​智力​，​+​1​无人机​控制​和​+​1​无人机​战斗​。\n"
"ding3ji2 gong1ye4 fang2hu4fu2。you3 yong4lai2 fang4zhi4 gong1ju4 de5 e2wai4 kong1jian1。ti2gong1 +1 zhi4li4，+1 wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4 he4 +1 wu2ren2ji1 zhan4dou4。"

msgid ""
"Torture me, or don't. It'll all end the same way.\n"
"\n"
"I'll be dead, you'll know nothing for certain, and my clients will move ahead on schedule."
msgstr ""
"要​不要​折磨​我​都​随你便​。​反正​最后​都​是​一样​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​死​在​这里​，​而​你们​将​一无所知​，​我​的​客户​则​会​继续​按计划​推进​。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 bu4yao4 zhe2mo2 wo3 dou1 sui2 ni3 bian4。fan3zheng4 zui4hou4 dou1 shi4 yi1yang4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 si3 zai4 zhe4li3，er2 ni3men5 jiang1 yi1wu2suo3zhi1，wo3 de5 ke4hu4 ze2 hui4 ji4xu4 an4 ji4 hua2 tui1jin4。"

msgid ""
"Torture wasn't going to get us anywhere... in my experience, it seldom does. And that sack of shit has had this coming for years now.\n"
"\n"
"He's done more than enough damage for one lifetime."
msgstr ""
"再​怎么​打​他​也​不会​有​结果​……​从​我​的​经验​来看​，​这样​做​很少​能​奏效​。​而且​这个​混蛋​好多年​前​就​该死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​对​别人​造成​的​伤害​是​一辈子​都​还​不清​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zen3me5 da3 ta1 ye3 bu4hui4 you3 jie1guo3……cong2 wo3 de5 jing1yan4 lai2 kan4，zhe4yang4 zuo4 hen3 shao3 neng2 zou4xiao4。er2qie3 zhe4ge5 hun2dan4 hao3 duo1 nian2 qian2 jiu4 gai1si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dui4 bie2ren5 zao4cheng2 de5 shang1hai4 shi4 yi1bei4zi5 dou1 hai2 bu4qing1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Tossing the logs won't be enough. They may not know where the power spike came from, but they'll still have questions.\n"
"\n"
"If you were to plant false evidence that the surge came over the grid, though... that might do it. You do that, and we'll be good."
msgstr ""
"删除​日志​还​不够​。​他们​也许​不​清楚​电力​尖峰​是从​哪儿​来​的​，​但​他们​还是​会心​存​疑虑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​要是​你​能​植入​虚假​证据​，​显示​尖峰​是从​电网​那边​过来​的话​……​那样​也许​就​可以​了​。​你​能​做到​的话​，​我们​就​两清​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shan1chu2 ri4zhi4 hai2 bu4gou4。ta1men5 ye3xu3 bu4 qing1chu5 dian4li4 jian1feng1 shi4 cong2 na3r5 lai2 de5，dan4 ta1men5 hai2shi5 hui4xin1 cun2 yi2lu:4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，yao4shi5 ni3 neng2 zhi2ru4 xu1jia3 zheng4ju4，xian3shi4 jian1feng1 shi4 cong2 dian4wang3 na4bian5 guo4lai2 de5hua4……na4yang4 ye3xu3 jiu4 ke3yi3 le5。ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 liang3qing1 le5。"

