msgid "Totem Coat"
msgstr ""
"图腾​大衣\n"
"tu2teng2 da4yi1"

msgid "Totem DeBuff"
msgstr ""
"图腾​削弱\n"
"tu2teng2 xue1ruo4"

msgid "Totem choice available"
msgstr ""
"图腾​选择​可用\n"
"tu2teng2 xuan3ze2 ke3 yong4"

msgid "Touch"
msgstr ""
"点击\n"
"dian3ji1"

msgid ""
"Touching. I don't know what this has to do with getting me to my meeting, "
"but please, by all means, keep waltzing down memory lane. We'll wait."
msgstr ""
"真​感人​啊​。​我​不​知道​这​跟​让​我​赶紧​去​开会​有​什么​关系​，​但​请​尽管​继续​沉浸​在​回忆​里​吧​。​我们​会​等​你​的​。\n"
"zhen1 gan3ren2 a1。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 gen1 rang4 wo3 gan3jin3 qu4 kai1hui4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5，dan4 qing3 jin3guan3 ji4xu4 chen2jin4 zai4 hui2yi4 li3 ba1。wo3men5 hui4 deng3 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Tough break. Best of luck."
msgstr ""
"艰难​的​抉择​。​祝你好运​。\n"
"jian1nan2 de5 jue2ze2。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid "Tough times, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"看来​日子​不好过​啊​。\n"
"kan4lai5 ri4zi5 bu4 hao3 guo4 a1。"

msgid ""
"Toward the back of the catalog, you find some more practical chrome, but nothing that a shadowrunner would want. From designer replacement limbs to nephretic screens for alcoholics, AugmenTech carries the very best in fashionable implants for the ultra-rich.\n"
"\n"
"The \"mental enhancement\" section is a little more promising, but you don't see anything that you couldn't already find in the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"目录​后​半​部分​列出​了​一些​更​实用​的​镀铬​部件​，​但​没有​暗影​狂奔​者​会​感兴趣​的​东西​。​从​设计师​定制​义肢​到​专为​酒鬼​设计​的​肾脏​屏蔽​装置​，​“​增强​科技​”​为​超级​富豪​提供​最​顶级​的​时尚​植入体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​精神​强化​”​版块​稍​有​看头​，​但​你​看到​的​无非​是​克洛伊​茨​集市​早已​有​的​货色​。\n"
"\n"
"mu4lu4 hou4 ban4 bu4fen5 lie4chu1 le5 yi1xie1 geng1 shi2yong4 de5 du4 ge4 bu4jian4，dan4 mei2you3 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 hui4 gan3xing4qu4 de5 dong1xi1。cong2 she4ji4shi1 ding4zhi4 yi4zhi1 dao4 zhuan1 wei2 jiu3gui3 she4ji4 de5 shen4zang4 ping2bi4 zhuang1zhi4，“zeng1qiang2 ke1ji4” wei2 chao1ji2 fu4hao2 ti2gong1 zui4 ding3ji2 de5 shi2shang4 zhi2 ru4 ti3。\n"
"\n"
"“jing1shen2 qiang2hua4” ban3kuai4 shao1 you3 kan4tou5，dan4 ni3 kan4dao4 de5 wu2fei1 shi4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zao3yi3 you3 de5 huo4se4。"

msgid "Toxic Barrel"
msgstr ""
"毒液​桶\n"
"du2ye4 tong3"

msgid ""
"Toxic Contaminant Detected.\n"
"\n"
"Cannot disengage Lockdown while contaminants present."
msgstr ""
"检测​到​有毒​污染物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​解除​封锁​前​请​清除​污染物​。\n"
"\n"
"jian3ce4 dao4 you3du2 wu1ran3wu4。\n"
"\n"
"jie3chu2 feng1suo3 qian2 qing3 qing1chu2 wu1ran3wu4。"

msgid "Toxic explosion."
msgstr ""
"附带​毒性​的​爆炸​。\n"
"fu4dai4 du2xing4 de5 bao4zha4。"

msgid "Toxin Exhaler"
msgstr ""
"毒液​喷吐​器\n"
"du2ye4 pen1 tu3 qi4"

msgid "Toxin: HP -4 per RND"
msgstr ""
"中毒​：​每​回合​损失​4​点​生命​值\n"
"zhong4du2：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 4 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "Tracer Rounds"
msgstr ""
"追踪​弹\n"
"zhui1zong1 dan4"

msgid "Tracer Shot"
msgstr ""
"追踪​射击\n"
"zhui1zong1 she4ji1"

msgid ""
"Tracking Harrow down isn't going to be quick, or easy. It could take years.\n"
"\n"
"You, my friend, are a victim of your own success. You've become too important to this team - to the *Kreuzbasar* - to up and disappear."
msgstr ""
"追踪​哈罗​可不​容易​，​可能​要花​上​好几年​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​朋友​，​你​现在​是​众望所归​。​你​对​这个​团队​，​以及​*​克洛伊​茨​集市​*​来说​太​重要​了​，​不能​玩​这种​突然​消失​的​戏码​。\n"
"\n"
"zhui1zong1 ha1luo2 ke3bu5 rong2yi4，ke3neng2 yao4 hua1 shang4 hao3ji3nian2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 peng2you5，ni3 xian4zai4 shi4 zhong4wang4suo3gui1。ni3 dui4 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4，yi3ji2*Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4*lai2 shuo1 tai4 zhong4yao4 le5，bu4neng2 wan2 zhe4zhong3 tu1ran2 xiao1shi1 de5 xi4ma3。"

msgid ""
"Tracking Harrow isn't going to be easy. He could still be somewhere in Germany, but it's just as likely that he hopped a flight or booked passage on a container ship. If he did either of those things, he could literally be anywhere.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe I'll find him tomorrow. Stranger things have happened. But it's more likely that it'll take months... maybe even years. "
msgstr ""
"追踪​哈罗​可不​容易​。​他​可能​还​躲​在​德国​，​也​可能​已经​坐​上​航班​，​甚至​上​了​货船​。​如果​真是​如此​的话​，​那​他​如今​可能​出现​在​世界​任何​角落​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说不定​明天​就​能​找到​他​，​更​离奇​的​事​也​不是​没​发生​过​。​不过​更​可能​花上​几个​月​……​甚至​几年​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"zhui1zong1 ha1luo2 ke3bu5 rong2yi4。ta1 ke3neng2 hai2 duo3 zai4 de2guo2，ye3 ke3neng2 yi3jing1 zuo4 shang4 hang2ban1，shen4zhi4 shang4 le5 huo4chuan2。ru2guo3 zhen1shi5 ru2ci3 de5hua4，na4 ta1 ru2jin1 ke3neng2 chu1xian4 zai4 shi4jie4 ren4he2 jiao3luo4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1bu5ding4 ming2tian1 jiu4 neng2 zhao3dao4 ta1，geng1 li2qi2 de5 shi4 ye3 bu4shi4 mei2 fa1sheng1 guo4。bu4guo4 geng1 ke3neng2 hua1 shang4 ji3ge5 yue4……shen4zhi4 ji3nian2 shi2jian1。"

msgid "Traditional Mage Robes"
msgstr ""
"传统​法师​长袍\n"
"chuan2tong3 fa3shi1 chang2pao2"

msgid "Tragic, but predictable."
msgstr ""
"很​悲剧​，​但​不出所料​。\n"
"hen3 bei1ju4，dan4 bu4chu1suo3liao4。"

msgid ""
"Trail's gone cold on that one, I'm afraid. I had a tracker on the shipment, but it was moving out of the city when I lost the signal. They probably found and destroyed the device.\n"
"\n"
"Next time, perhaps... but I don't think we'll have that kind of luck again. We have more important things to deal with now, here in the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"恐怕​线索​已经​断​了​。​我​在​那​批货​上装​了​追踪​器​，​但​失去​信号​时​它​正在​驶出​城市​。​他们​可能​发现​并​销毁​了​装置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​下次​吧​……​但​我​想​我们​不会​再有​这样​的​运气​了​。​我们​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​还有​更​重要​的​事情​要​处理​。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 xian4suo3 yi3jing1 duan4 le5。wo3 zai4 na4 pi1 huo4 shang4zhuang1 le5 zhui1zong1 qi4，dan4 shi1qu4 xin4hao4 shi2 ta1 zheng4zai4 shi3chu1 cheng2shi4。ta1men5 ke3neng2 fa1xian4 bing4 xiao1hui3 le5 zhuang1zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 xia4ci4 ba1……dan4 wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 bu4hui4 zai4 you3 zhe4yang4 de5 yun4qi5 le5。wo3men5 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 chu3li3。"

msgid "Train Car"
msgstr ""
"列车​车厢\n"
"lie4che1 che1xiang1"

msgid "Transfer Control of Feuerschwinge to APEX"
msgstr ""
"将​火翼​的​控制权​转移​给​APEX\n"
"jiang1 Huo3yi4 de5 kong4zhi4quan2 zhuan3yi2 gei3 APEX"

msgid "Transition"
msgstr ""
"切换\n"
"qie1huan4"

msgid "Trash Can"
msgstr ""
"垃圾桶\n"
"la1ji1tong3"

msgid "Trauma Damper (Bioware)"
msgstr ""
"创伤​抑制器​（​生体​改造​）\n"
"chuang1shang1 yi4 zhi4 qi4 （sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4）"

msgid "Trauma Damper: Incoming DMG -3"
msgstr ""
"创伤​抑制器​：​受到​的​伤害​减少​3​点\n"
"chuang1shang1 yi4 zhi4 qi4：shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 3 dian3"

msgid "Trauma Specialist I"
msgstr ""
"急救​专家​I\n"
"ji2jiu4 zhuan1jia1 I"

msgid "Trauma Specialist II"
msgstr ""
"急救​专家​II\n"
"ji2jiu4 zhuan1jia1 II"

msgid "Travel?"
msgstr ""
"是否​前往​？\n"
"shi4fou3 qian2wang3？"

msgid "Treasure. I want treasure."
msgstr ""
"宝藏​。​我​想要​宝藏​。\n"
"bao3zang4。wo3 xiang3yao4 bao3zang4。"

msgid ""
"Trembling, you find yourself back in the mundane world. Glory is still "
"staring at you, her neutral expression ever-so-slightly tinged with "
"annoyance."
msgstr ""
"你​浑身​颤抖​着​回到​了​现世​。​格洛丽​仍​在​凝视着​你​，​她​那​张面​无表情​的​脸上​隐约​透着​几分​恼怒​。\n"
"ni3 hun2shen1 chan4dou3 zhao2 hui2dao4 le5 xian4shi4。Ge2luo4li2 reng2 zai4 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3，ta1 na4 zhang1 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 lian3 shang4 yin3yue1 tou4 zhao2 ji3fen1 nao3nu4。"

msgid "Trid"
msgstr ""
"3D​影像\n"
"3D ying3xiang4"

msgid "Trip that alarm and you're a dead woman."
msgstr ""
"敢​触发​警报​的话​，​你​就​死定了​。\n"
"gan3 chu4fa1 jing3bao4 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid "Trithemius"
msgstr ""
"特​里特​米​乌斯\n"
"te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1"

msgid ""
"Trithemius didn't have his elevator chip on him, search the Magnifiker base "
"to find it."
msgstr ""
"特​里特​米​乌斯​身上​没有​电梯​芯片​，​搜索​伟术​帮​基地​找到​它​。\n"
"te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 shen1shang5 mei2you3 dian4ti1 xin1pian4，sou1suo3 wei3 shu4 bang1 ji1di4 zhao3dao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Trithemius is almost certainly upstairs, hidden away from the outside world. I wouldn't advise going after him, but if your mind is made up, I suppose that I can't change it.\n"
"\n"
"Yes, I can tell you how to find him. But I will need something from you in return."
msgstr ""
"特​里特​米​乌斯​几乎​肯定​就​在​楼上​，​与​外面​的​世界​相​隔绝​。​我​不​建议​你​去​找​他​，​但​如果​你​已经​下定决心​，​我​猜​我​也​无法​改变​你​的​想法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我​可以​告诉​你​如何​找到​他​。​但​作为​回报​，​我​也​有​个​要求​。\n"
"\n"
"te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 ji1hu1 ken3ding4 jiu4 zai4 lou2shang4，yu4 wai4mian4 de5 shi4jie4 xiang1 ge2jue2。wo3 bu4 jian4yi4 ni3 qu4 zhao3 ta1，dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 yi3jing1 xia4ding4jue2xin1，wo3 cai1 wo3 ye3 wu2fa3 gai3bian4 ni3 de5 xiang3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3 ru2he2 zhao3dao4 ta1。dan4 zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，wo3 ye3 you3 ge4 yao1qiu2。"

msgid "Trithemius won't be a problem for you anymore. Here's his amulet."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​解决​掉​特​里特​米​乌斯​了​。​这​是​他​的​护身符​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 diao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 le5。zhe4 shi4 ta1 de5 hu4shen1fu2。"

msgid "Trithemius's Amulet"
msgstr ""
"特​里特​米​乌斯​的​护符\n"
"te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 hu4 fu2"

msgid "Trithemius's Key"
msgstr ""
"特​里特​米​乌斯​的​钥匙\n"
"te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 yao4shi5"

msgid ""
"Trivia is a passion of mine.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She taps a painted fingernail to her temple.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In my line of work, it comes in handy."
msgstr ""
"冷​知识​是​我​的​一大​爱好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​涂​了​指甲油​的​手指​轻敲​太阳穴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我们​这​一行​里​，​这能​派​上​不小​的​用场​。\n"
"\n"
"leng3 zhi1shi5 shi4 wo3 de5 yi1 dai4 ai4hao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 tu2 le5 zhi3jia5you2 de5 shou3zhi3 qing1 qiao1 tai4yang2xue2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3men5 zhe4 yi1xing2 li3，zhe4 neng2 pai4 shang4 bu4 xiao3 de5 yong4chang3。"

msgid "Troll"
msgstr ""
"巨魔\n"
"ju4mo2"

msgid "Troll \"Actor\""
msgstr ""
"巨魔​“​演员​”\n"
"ju4mo2“yan3yuan2”"

msgid ""
"Trolls are the largest metahuman race. Heavy prejudice against them has led people to assume trolls have lowered intelligence but in reality, there is no proof to this. Trolls have pointed ears, intimidating teeth or tusks and many have horn-like growths that other metahumans do not manifest.\n"
"\n"
"All Trolls have a +1 to Body and +1 to Strength\n"
"Maximum Stats: Body: 17  Quickness: 8 Strength: 15 Charisma: 6  Intelligence: 6 Willpower: 9"
msgstr ""
"巨魔​是​体型​最大​的​泛​人类​种族​。​人们​对​其​的​严重​偏见​导致​普遍认为​巨魔​智力​低下​，​但​实际上​并​无证据​支持​此​说​。​巨魔​拥有​尖耳​与​令人​畏惧​的​獠牙​，​许多​个体​还长​有​其他​泛​人类​所​没有​的​角状​突起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​巨魔​获得​+​1​体质​和​+​1​力量​\n"
"​最大​属性​：​体质​：​17​ ​ ​敏捷​：​8​ ​ ​力量​：​15​ ​ ​魅力​：​6​ ​ ​智力​：​6​ ​ ​意志​：​9\n"
"\n"
"ju4mo2 shi4 ti3xing2 zui4 dai4 de5 fan4 ren2lei4 zhong3zu2。ren2men5 dui4 qi2 de5 yan2zhong4 pian1jian4 dao3zhi4 pu3 bian4 ren4 wei2 ju4mo2 zhi4li4 di1xia4，dan4 shi2ji4shang4 bing4 wu2 zheng4 ju4 zhi1chi2 ci3 shuo1。ju4mo2 yong1you3 jian1 er3 yu4 ling4ren2 wei4ju4 de5 liao2ya2，xu3duo1 ge4ti3 hai2 zhang3 you3 qi2ta1 fan4 ren2lei4 suo3 mei2you3 de5 jiao3 zhuang4 tu1qi3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 ju4mo2 huo4de2 +1 ti3zhi4 he4 +1 li4liang5 \n"
"zui4 dai4 shu3xing4：ti3zhi4：17 min3jie2：8 li4liang5：15 mei4li4：6 zhi4li4：6 yi4zhi4：9"

msgid "True enough."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​。\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"True enough.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. The second van it is. Let's get moving."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​那​就​第二辆​车​。​我们​动身​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 jiu4 di4 er4 liang4 che1。wo3men5 dong4shen1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"True! I can't deny it. But wouldn't it be easier if you didn't fight back? \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ork shrugs, and you hear the distinctive whir of his Vindicator's motor spinning up to speed. The barrels begin to blur as he wheels the weapon to face you.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"没错​！​这​我​承认​。​不过​要是​你们​不​抵抗​的话​，​大家​不​就​都​省事​了​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​兽​人​耸耸肩​，​你​听见​“​辩护人​”​的​转轮​加速​时​那​标志性​的​嗡​鸣声​。​他​把​武器​转向​你​的​时候​，​枪管​的​转速​已经​快到​看不清​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4！zhe4 wo3 cheng2ren4。bu4guo4 yao4shi5 ni3men5 bu4 di3kang4 de5hua4，da4jia1 bu4 jiu4 dou1 sheng3shi4 le5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 song3 song3 jian1，ni3 ting1jian4“bian4hu4ren2” de5 zhuan4lun2 jia1su4 shi2 na4 biao1zhi4xing4 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。ta1 ba3 wu3qi4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3 de5 shi2hou5，qiang1guan3 de5 zhuan4su4 yi3jing1 kuai4 dao4 kan4bu5qing1 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"True, Titonius Rex sent his peasants up against the ravening Jubuthon hordes, and they emerged victorious. But Billy is no Jubuthon!\n"
"\n"
"Nay, if he is anything, Billy is more like the Demon Lord Karabork... a slavering destroyer, a terror without mercy. An atrocity with feet!"
msgstr ""
"确实​，​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​派​他​的​臣民​对抗​朱布松​大军​，​他们​赢得​了​胜利​。​但​比利​不是​朱布松​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​硬​要说​的话​，​比利​更​像是​恶魔​领主​卡拉​博克​……​贪婪​的​毁灭者​，​毫无​怜悯​的​恐怖​存在​，​会​走路​的​施暴者​！\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2，Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 pai4 ta1 de5 chen2min2 dui4kang4 zhu1 bu4 song1 da4jun1，ta1men5 ying2de2 le5 sheng4li4。dan4 bi3li4 bu4shi4 zhu1 bu4 song1！\n"
"\n"
"ying4 yao4shuo1 de5hua4，bi3li4 geng1 xiang4 shi4 e4mo2 ling3zhu3 ka3la1 bo2 ke4……tan1lan2 de5 hui3 mie4 zhe3，hao2wu2 lian2min3 de5 kong3bu4 cun2zai4，hui4 zou3lu4 de5 shi1 bao4 zhe3！"

msgid ""
"True. But at the very least, this information helps to establish where all "
"of that money is coming from."
msgstr ""
"的确​。​但​这份​情报​至少​明确​了​资金来源​。\n"
"di2que4。dan4 zhe4 fen4 qing2bao4 zhi4shao3 ming2que4 le5 zi1 jin1 lai2 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"True. But what I've been hearing about Winternight is straight-up mental. We're talking stories about magical nukes and the end of the world. Fenris shamans. Ragnarok. That kind of thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Like I said - nuts."
msgstr ""
"的确​，​但​我​听到​的​那些​关于​“​冬夜​”​的​传闻​简直​跟​疯子​没什么​两样​。​魔法​核弹​与​世界末日​、​芬​里尔​萨满​、​诸神​黄昏​，​诸如此类​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​正如​我​所言​，​简直​太​荒谬​了​。\n"
"\n"
"di2que4，dan4 wo3 ting1dao4 de5 na4xie1 guan1yu2“dong1 ye4” de5 chuan2wen2 jian3zhi2 gen1 feng1zi5 mei2shen2me5 liang3yang4。mo2fa3 he2dan4 yu4 shi4jie4mo4ri4、fen1 li3er3 sa4man3、zhu1 shen2 huang2hun1，zhu1ru2ci3lei4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 yan2，jian3zhi2 tai4 huang1miu4 le5。"

msgid "True. You and your friends should probably start running."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​你​和​你​的​朋友​们​还是​赶紧​逃跑​吧​。\n"
"mei2cuo4。ni3 he4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 hai2shi5 gan3jin3 tao2pao3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Truer words have never been spoken.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks, Bannik. We'll let you know how things work out."
msgstr ""
"此​言非虚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢​了​，​班尼克​。​事成之后​我们​会​告诉​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 yan2 fei1 xu1。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5，ban1 ni2 ke4。shi4 cheng2 zhi1 hou4 wo3men5 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Trust a dragon? Do I look like a fool to you, lizard?"
msgstr ""
"相信​巨龙​？​你​觉得​我蠢​吗​，​爬行​种​？\n"
"xiang1xin4 ju4long2？ni3 jue2de5 wo3 chun3 ma5，pa2xing2 zhong3？"

msgid ""
"Trust is earned, and I don't know you yet.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe later, when we get to know one another better, we can talk. For now, I'd prefer if you dropped it."
msgstr ""
"信任​不是​空口​白话​，​我​目前​对​你​都​不​太​了解​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或许​等​我们​更​了解​彼此​的​时候​，​再​来说​这个​事情​吧​。​至于​现在​，​我​希望​你​别管​这​事​。\n"
"\n"
"xin4ren4 bu4shi4 kong1kou3 bai2hua4，wo3 mu4qian2 dui4 ni3 dou1 bu4 tai4 liao3jie3。\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 deng3 wo3men5 geng1 liao3jie3 bi3ci3 de5 shi2hou5，zai4 lai2 shuo1 zhe4ge5 shi4qing5 ba1。zhi4yu2 xian4zai4，wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 bie2guan3 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Trust me, friend. I have secret knowledge.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He slowly turns his head from side to side to give you a good look at his upturned ears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Like I said. It's in the blood."
msgstr ""
"相信​我​，​朋友​。​我​有​一些​秘密​知识​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​慢慢​把头​转过​来​，​让​你​看清楚​他​竖起​的​耳朵​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说​了​，​这是​流淌​在​血脉​里​的​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang1xin4 wo3，peng2you5。wo3 you3 yi1xie1 mi4mi4 zhi1shi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man4man4 ba3tou2 zhuai3 guo4 lai2，rang4 ni3 kan4 qing1 chu3 ta1 shu4qi3 de5 er3duo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，zhe4 shi4 liu2tang3 zai4 xue4mai4 li3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Trust me, it's still secure... I set up the security protocols myself. The last decker they brought in to take a crack at it came back out on a stretcher. \n"
"\n"
"They haven't found too many volunteers since then."
msgstr ""
"信​我​，​保险库​至今​毫发无损​……​安全​协议​是​我​亲自​写​的​。​他们​上次​找​了​个​碟​客来​破解​，​结果​那家伙​直接​被​担架​抬​走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自​那​以后​，​他们​就​找​不到​几个​愿意​干​这活​的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xin4 wo3，bao3 xian3 ku4 zhi4jin1 hao2 fa1 wu2 sun3……an1quan2 xie2yi4 shi4 wo3 qin1zi4 xie3 de5。ta1men5 shang4ci4 zhao3 le5 ge4 die2 ke4 lai2 po4jie3，jie1guo3 na4 jia1 huo3 zhi2jie1 bei4 dan1jia4 tai2 zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zi4 na4 yi3hou4，ta1men5 jiu4 zhao3 bu4dao4 ji3ge5 yuan4yi4 gan4 zhe4 huo2 de5 le5。"

msgid "Trust me. I've gone up against worse."
msgstr ""
"相信​我​，​更狠​的​角色​我​都​收拾​过​。\n"
"xiang1xin4 wo3，geng1 hen3 de5 jue2se4 wo3 dou1 shou1shi5 guo4。"

msgid ""
"Truth be told, chief, I found the whole experience kind of nerve-wracking.\n"
"\n"
"I'm glad that we're out of there. And I'm even gladder that the building is a pile of smoldering rubble now."
msgstr ""
"说实话​，​头儿​，​这​整段​经历​让​我​有点​紧张​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​高兴​我们​已经​离开​了​那里​。​而且​我​更​高兴​的​是​，​那栋​楼​现在​成​了​一堆​冒烟​的​废墟​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，tou2r5，zhe4 zheng3 duan4 jing1li4 rang4 wo3 you3dian3 jin3zhang1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 yi3jing1 li2kai1 le5 na4li5。er2qie3 wo3 geng1 gao1xing4 de5 shi4，na4 dong4 lou2 xian4zai4 cheng2 le5 yi1dui1 mao4yan1 de5 fei4xu1。"

msgid ""
"Truths hidden from mortal eyes. In my time as an observer of this world, I have witnessed a great many things.\n"
"\n"
"Wonders and terrors beyond measure. The birth and death of nations. The rise and fall of gods."
msgstr ""
"凡人​用​肉眼​难​窥​一斑​的​真相​。​在​我​作为​世界​观察者​的​岁月​里​，​我​目睹​了​无数​事物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不可估量​的​奇迹​与​恐怖​。​国家​的​诞生​与​消亡​。​神明​的​崛起​与​陨落​。\n"
"\n"
"fan2ren2 yong4 rou4yan3 nan2 kui1 yi1ban1 de5 zhen1xiang4。zai4 wo3 zuo4wei2 shi4jie4 guan1cha2zhe3 de5 sui4yue4 li3，wo3 mu4du3 le5 wu2shu4 shi4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4ke3gu1liang4 de5 qi2ji4 yu4 kong3bu4。guo2jia1 de5 dan4sheng1 yu4 xiao1wang2。shen2ming2 de5 jue2qi3 yu4 yun3luo4。"

msgid "Try harder. Time is not on your side."
msgstr ""
"要​再​努力​些​。​时间​不站​在​你​这边​。\n"
"yao4 zai4 nu3li4 xie1。shi2jian1 bu4 zhan4 zai4 ni3 zhe4bian1。"

msgid ""
"Try it, halfer. My girls will shoot you dead before you make it three paces.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The unpleasant-looking young toughs behind him smirk down at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just calm down, little one. It'd be tragic if you missed the big show."
msgstr ""
"有种​就​试试​，​半截​人​。​三步​之内​，​我​的​姑娘​们​就​能​把​你​射成​筛子​。​没​人​愿意​事情​发展​成​那样​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​身后​那群​面目可憎​的​年轻​混混​们​纷纷​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷静下来​吧​，​小不点​，​你​要是​错过​接下来​的​好戏​可​就​太​遗憾​了​。\n"
"\n"
"you3zhong3 jiu4 shi4 shi4，ban4jie2 ren2。san1 bu4 zhi1nei4，wo3 de5 gu1niang5 men5 jiu4 neng2 ba3 ni3 she4 cheng2 shai1zi5。mei2 ren2 yuan4yi4 shi4qing5 fa1zhan3 cheng2 na4yang4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1hou4 na4 qun2 mian4mu4ke3zeng1 de5 nian2qing1 hun4 hun4 men5 fen1fen1 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2 ba1，xiao3bu5dian3，ni3 yao4shi5 cuo4guo4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 hao3 xi4 ke3 jiu4 tai4 yi2han4 le5。"

msgid "Try it. See what happens."
msgstr ""
"你​有​本事​就​来​试试​啊​。\n"
"ni3 you3 ben3shi4 jiu4 lai2 shi4 shi4 a1。"

msgid "Try me. I'm smarter than I look."
msgstr ""
"万一​呢​。​我​比​看起来​聪明​多​了​。\n"
"wan4yi1 ni2。wo3 bi3 kan4qi3lai5 cong1ming5 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Try not to worry too much, $(l.name). I feel *wonderful.*\n"
"\n"
"This is the first time in years that I can say that. And it's all thanks to you."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​$(l.name)​。​我​感觉​*​棒极了​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​还是​这些年来​的​第一次​。​这​都​多亏​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，$(l.name)。wo3 gan3jue2*bang4ji2le5*。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2shi5 zhe4 xie1 nian2 lai2 de5 di4yi1ci4。zhe4 dou1 duo1kui1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Trying to get home in time for “Wyrm Talk,” love?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich. Shaman. The old man of the team.\n"
"\n"
"He smiles at her, his facial tattoos writhing in the moonlight.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"赶着​回家​看​《​巨龙​夜话​》​吗​，​亲爱​的​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​，​萨满​，​也​是​建队​元老​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​朝​她​笑了笑​，​脸上​的​纹身​在​月光​下​泛起​褶皱​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"gan3 zhao2 hui2jia1 kan4 《 ju4long2 ye4 hua4 》 ma5，qin1ai4 de5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1，sa4man3，ye3 shi4 jian4 dui4 yuan2lao3。\n"
