"​我​追踪​了​失踪​货物​的​运输​路线​。​它​最终​被​运到​了​哈​菲尔德​庄园​。\n"
"\n"
"liang3 nian2 qian2，yi1 pi1 gao1du4 zhi4ming4 de5 fang4she4xing4 sheng1hua4wu3qi4 zai4 yun4 wang3 de2lei2si1dun4 de5 mou3chu4 chu3cun2 she4shi1 tu2zhong1 shi1zong1。gai1 wu3qi4 dai4hao4“X -15”。\n"
