"dou1 shi4 ni3men5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 zhe4 yi1tao4 gui3hua4。wo3 jiu4*zhi1dao4*wo3men5 bu4neng2 xin4ren4 ni3 zhe4zhong3 ren2。bu4guan3 shi4 wo3men5 de5 sheng1yi4，hai2shi5 dan1 ni1 de5 xing4ming4。"

