"more heavily militarized. The brass decided that they posed enough danger to"
" the region to qualify as a terrorist threat, and that brought them under "
"our purview."
msgstr ""
"通常​来说​是​这样​。​但​近年来​，​俄罗斯​黑手党​日益​军事化​。​上级​认定​他们​对​该​地区​已​构成​恐怖​威胁​，​因此​将​其​纳入​我们​的​监管​范围​。\n"
"tong1chang2 lai2 shuo1 shi4 zhe4yang4。dan4 jin4nian2lai2，e2luo2si1 hei1shou3dang3 ri4yi4 jun1shi4hua4。shang4ji2 ren4ding4 ta1men5 dui4 gai1 di4qu1 yi3 gou4cheng2 kong3bu4 wei1xie2，yin1ci3 jiang1 qi2 na4ru4 wo3men5 de5 jian1guan3 fan4wei2。"

