"Uh oh. I've gotta run... just got a message over the comm. Looks like Central wants to see me about something.\n"
"\n"
"I'll catch you back at your apartment, later tonight. Let's talk about this over a bottle of wine... I know that I could use it.\n"
"\n"
"-F"
msgstr ""
"呃​哦​。​我得​闪人​了​……​通讯​链刚​发来​一条​短消息​。​看起来​指挥部​有事​要​见​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今天​晚些时候​，​我会​去​你​的​公寓​找​你​。​咱们​开瓶​红酒​聊聊​这事​吧​……​我​正​需要​借酒消愁​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​—​—​法\n"
"\n"
"e4 e2。wo3 de2 shan3ren2 le5……tong1xun4 lian4 gang1 fa1 lai2 yi1 tiao2 duan3 xiao1 xi1。kan4qi3lai5 zhi3hui1bu4 you3shi4 yao4 jian4 wo3。\n"
