msgid ""
"Uh, boss... I love new toys as much as the next guy, but we need the money more.\n"
"\n"
"Fifteen-thousand-nuyen jobs don't grow on trees."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​老大​……​我​和​任何人​一样​都​喜欢​新​玩具​，​但​我们​更​需要​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一万五千​新円​报酬​的​差事​可​不会​随随便便​从​天上掉​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，lao3da4……wo3 he4 ren4 he2 ren2 yi1yang4 dou1 xi3huan5 xin1 wan2ju4，dan4 wo3men5 geng1 xu1yao4 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wan4 wu3 qian1 xin1 yuan2 bao4chou5 de5 cha4shi4 ke3 bu4hui4 sui2 sui2 bian4 bian4 cong2 tian1 shang4 diao4 xia4lai5。"

