"Uh, boss... are you sure? I mean, he's on our side now, and he didn't have "
"to admit--"
msgstr ""
"呃​，​老大​……​你​确定​吗​？​我们​现在​是​一边​的​了​，​而且​他​本来​没​必要​承认​这​事​—​—\n"
"e4，lao3da4……ni3 que4ding4 ma5？wo3men5 xian4zai4 shi4 yi1bian1 de5 le5，er2qie3 ta1 ben3lai2 mei2 bi4yao4 cheng2ren4 zhe4 shi4 — —"

msgid ""
"Uh, boss... my gut's tellin' me that I know who this contact of yours "
"represents. A group that we had a little chat about a while back, right?"
msgstr ""
"呃​，​老大​……​我​的​直觉​告诉​我​，​我​知道​你​的​这位​联络人​是​谁​。​就是​之前​聊​的​那个​组织​，​对​吗​？\n"
"e4，lao3da4……wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 lian2luo4ren2 shi4 shei2。jiu4shi4 zhi1qian2 liao2 de5 na4ge5 zu3zhi1，dui4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Uh, boss... the facility's already on high alert.\n"
"\n"
"It's a little late for disguises, don't you think?"
