"呃​，​老大​……​这所​设施​已经​处于​高度​戒备状态​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​才​开始​伪装​，​是不是​有点​太迟​了​？\n"
"\n"
"e4，lao3da4……zhe4 suo3 she4shi1 yi3jing1 chu3yu2 gao1du4 jie4 bei4 zhuang4 tai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 cai2 kai1shi3 wei3zhuang1，shi4bu5shi4 you3dian3 tai4 chi2 le5？"

msgid ""
"Uh, chief...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz's voice comes out in a hushed tone. His eyes have gone wide with fear.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...I don't think that's your friend."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​头儿​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​压低​了​声音​。​他​的​双眼​因​恐惧​而​瞪​得​老大​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​我​不​觉得​那​是​你​的​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，tou2r5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 ya1di1 le5 sheng1yin1。ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 yin1 kong3ju4 er2 deng4 de2 lao3da4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……wo3 bu4 jue2de5 na4 shi4 ni3 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"Uh, chief... I love new toys as much as the next guy, but we need the money more.\n"
"\n"
"Fifteen-thousand-nuyen jobs don't grow on trees."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​头儿​……​我​和​任何人​一样​都​喜欢​新​玩具​，​但​我们​更​需要​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一万五千​新円​报酬​的​差事​可​不会​随随便便​从​天上掉​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，tou2r5……wo3 he4 ren4 he2 ren2 yi1yang4 dou1 xi3huan5 xin1 wan2ju4，dan4 wo3men5 geng1 xu1yao4 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 wan4 wu3 qian1 xin1 yuan2 bao4chou5 de5 cha4shi4 ke3 bu4hui4 sui2 sui2 bian4 bian4 cong2 tian1 shang4 diao4 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"Uh, chief... the facility's already on high alert.\n"
"\n"
"It's a little late for disguises, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"呃​，​头儿​……​这所​设施​已经​处于​高度​戒备状态​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​才​开始​伪装​，​是不是​有点​太迟​了​？\n"
"\n"
"e4，tou2r5……zhe4 suo3 she4shi1 yi3jing1 chu3yu2 gao1du4 jie4 bei4 zhuang4 tai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 cai2 kai1shi3 wei3zhuang1，shi4bu5shi4 you3dian3 tai4 chi2 le5？"

msgid ""
"Uh, chief? First off: told you so. And second: he's not kidding. There's "
"someone else in here..."
msgstr ""
"头儿​？​第一句​：​我​早​说​过​了​吧​。​以及​第二句​：​他​没​在​开玩笑​。​这里​还有​其他人​……\n"
"tou2r5？di4 yi1 ju4：wo3 zao3 shuo1 guo4 le5 ba1。yi3ji2 di4 er4 ju4：ta1 mei2 zai4 kai1wan2xiao4。zhe4li3 hai2you3 qi2 ta1 ren2……"

msgid ""
"Uh, look, I don't have time for this right now. Why don't you go ask Paul?"
msgstr ""
"呃​，​我​现在​没​时间​聊​这个​。​不如​你​去​问​保罗​吧​？\n"
"e4，wo3 xian4zai4 mei2 shi2jian1 liao2 zhe4ge5。bu4ru2 ni3 qu4 wen4 bao3luo2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Uh, right, chief! And boy, am I gonna handle this one! Just you wait and see.\n"
"\n"
"Give me two seconds, and I'll have you out of there."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​头儿​！​我会​解决​这事​的​！​你们​等​着​看吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​我​两秒钟​，​我​就让​你们​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，tou2r5！wo3 hui4 jie3jue2 zhe4 shi4 de5！ni3men5 deng3 zhao2 kan4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"gei3 wo3 liang3 miao3 zhong1，wo3 jiu4 rang4 ni3men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Uh, yeah, chief... I guess that it must be pretty frosty out there, huh?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Another distant roar of laughter crackles over your commlink. Presumably, the patrons of Cafe Cezve are having a lovely evening.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry about that. But look on the bright side: you get to have an adventure! That's something, right?"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​头儿​……​那边​一定​很​冷​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​通讯​链里​又​传来​一阵​遥远​的​笑声​。​想必​“​来​一壶​”​咖啡馆​的​客人​们​正​度过​一个​愉快​的​夜晚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真​不好意思​。​但​你​往​好处​想​啊​：​你​要​展开​一段​大冒险​了​！​也​还​算​有所​收获​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，tou2r5……na4bian5 yi1ding4 hen3 leng3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tong1xun4 lian4 li3 you4 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 yao2yuan3 de5 xiao4sheng1。xiang3bi4“lai2 yi1 hu2” ka1fei1guan3 de5 ke4ren2 men5 zheng1 du4guo4 yi1ge5 yu2kuai4 de5 ye4wan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1 bu4hao3yi4si5。dan4 ni3 wang3 hao3chu3 xiang3 a1：ni3 yao4 zhan3kai1 yi1 duan4 dai4 mao4 xian3 le5！ye3 hai2 suan4 you3suo3 shou1huo4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "Uh, yeah, chief... I'm getting right on it..."
msgstr ""
"是​，​头儿​……​我​正在​处理​……\n"
"shi4，tou2r5……wo3 zheng4zai4 chu3li3……"

msgid ""
"Uh, yeah... my name's Liam Foster, an' I'm just a local mechanic... nothin' "
"special, y'know. But when I heard about what was happening I thought I "
"should do something. So I've organized a grassroots search an' rescue "
"effort, an' we're doin' what we can to help these people."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​好​啊​……​我​叫​利亚姆​·​福斯特​，​就是​个​本地​修车​工​……​没什么​特别​的​，​你​懂​的​。​但​听说​发生​的​事后​，​我​觉得​自己​该​做点​什么​。​所以​我​组织​了​一支​草根​搜救​队​，​大家​正​竭尽所能​帮助​这些​受灾​群众​。\n"
"e4，hao3 a1……wo3 jiao4 li4 ya4 mu3 · fu2si1te4，jiu4shi4 ge4 ben3di4 xiu1che1 gong1……mei2shen2me5 te4bie2 de5，ni3 dong3 de5。dan4 ting1shuo1 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4hou4，wo3 jue2de5 zi4ji3 gai1 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5。suo3yi3 wo3 zu3zhi1 le5 yi1 zhi1 cao3gen1 sou1jiu4 dui4，da4jia1 zheng1 jie2 jin3 suo3 neng2 bang1zhu4 zhe4xie1 shou4zai1 qun2zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Uh-huh.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She does not sound convinced.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​似乎​不太​相信​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"en1 heng1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 si4hu1 bu4 tai4 xiang1xin4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Uh-huh.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The janitor does not sound convinced.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So... where is it? The soykaf?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​清洁工​似乎​不太​相信​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​……​你​买​的​豆​咖​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"en1 heng1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 si4hu1 bu4 tai4 xiang1xin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 mai3 de5 dou4 ka1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Uh-huh. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich's expression is guarded.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"And so you decided to... cut your losses and run?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​神情​戒备​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​就​做​了​这个​决定​？​抛​下​过去​的​失败​，​换个​地方​从头再来​？\n"
"\n"
"en1 heng1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 shen2qing2 jie4bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 zuo4 le5 zhe4ge5 jue2ding4？pao1 xia4 guo4qu4 de5 shi1bai4，huan4 ge4 di4fang1 cong2 tou2 zai4 lai2？"

msgid "Uh-huh. Well, thanks for your time."
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​。​感谢​你​的​回答​。\n"
"en1 heng1。gan3xie4 ni3 de5 hui2da2。"

msgid ""
"Uh-oh, ace... my system is mounting an immune response. I can feel it.\n"
"\n"
"Get ready. Something is coming for you."
msgstr ""
"糟糕​，​王牌​……​我​的​系统​正在​启动​免疫​反应​。​我能​感觉​到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​做好​准备​。​有​东西​朝​你​那边​去​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zao1gao1，wang2pai2……wo3 de5 xi4tong3 zheng4zai4 qi3dong4 mian3yi4 fan3ying4。wo3 neng2 gan3jue2 dao4。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。you3 dong1xi1 chao2 ni3 na4bian5 qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Uh. Chief.\n"
"\n"
"There won't *be* any profits... at least, not for us.\n"
"\n"
"The money that we suck out of that place has to go to Grinder. All of it."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这趟​*​不会​*​有​什么​利润​……​至少​对​我们​来说​是​只鹅养​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​弄到手​的​钱​全都​得​交给​“​绞肉机​”​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tang1*bu4hui4*you3 shen2me5 li4run4……zhi4shao3 dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 shi4 zhi3 e2 yang3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 nong4dao4shou3 de5 qian2 quan2dou1 de2 jiao1gei3“jiao3rou4ji1”。"

msgid "Uh... I'm not sure."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​大概​没有​。\n"
"e4……da4gai4 mei2you3。"

msgid ""
"Uh... yeah. Yeah, okay. You do that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a step back, then screws up his courage.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But you'd better be telling the truth! If anything happens to her..."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​那好​吧​，​没​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​往​后退​了​一步​，​然后​鼓起勇气​开口​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​最好​说​的​是​实话​！​如果​她​出​了​什么​事​……\n"
"\n"
"e4……na4 hao3 ba1，mei2 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wang3 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4，ran2hou4 gu3qi3yong3qi4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 shuo1 de5 shi4 shi2hua4！ru2guo3 ta1 chu1 le5 shen2me5 shi4……"

msgid "Uh... yes! Very good! I'll just be going."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​很​好​！​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"e4……hen3 hao3！wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "Uhhh... Blitz? There's an awful lot of cables back here..."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​布里​茨​？​这​后面​有​一大堆​乱糟糟​的​线缆​……\n"
"e4……Bu4li3ci2？zhe4 hou4mian5 you3 yi1 dai4 dui1 luan4zao1zao1 de5 xian4lan3……"

msgid "Uhhh... I, um... I don't have it yet."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​我​……​我​还​没拿到​呢​。\n"
"e4……wo3……wo3 hai2 mei2 na2 dao4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Uhhhh, yeah... we've got some repair work to do. The flux dilator is leaking"
" coolant. A real messy job, believe me."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​是​啊​……​我们​要​进行​一些​维修​工作​。​磁通​扩张器​的​冷却剂​泄漏​了​。​相信​我​，​这​活儿​可真​够呛​的​。\n"
"e4，shi4 a1……wo3men5 yao4 jin4xing2 yi1xie1 wei2xiu1 gong1zuo4。ci2 tong1 kuo4 zhang1 qi4 de5 leng3que4ji4 xie4lou4 le5。xiang1xin4 wo3，zhe4 huo2r5 ke3 zhen1 gou4qiang4 de5。"

msgid "Ullrich"
msgstr ""
"乌尔里​希\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1"

msgid ""
"Ullrich asked me to kill him. I don't much care for that idea, so I've got a"
" counterproposal for Trithemius."
msgstr ""
"乌尔里​希让​我​杀​了​他​。​我​对​这个​主意​不太​感兴趣​，​所以​我​准备​给​特​里特​米​乌斯​提个​相反​的​建议​。\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1 rang4 wo3 sha1 le5 ta1。wo3 dui4 zhe4ge5 zhu3yi5 bu4 tai4 gan3xing4qu4，suo3yi3 wo3 zhun3bei4 gei3 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 ti2 ge4 xiang1fan3 de5 jian4yi4。"

msgid "Ullrich's dead."
msgstr ""
"乌尔里​希​已经​死​了​。\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Ultimately, Jana's death is of course immaterial. The important thing is that you got the job done, and that you walked out intact enough to work with us again in the future.\n"
"\n"
"And all of this despite being saddled with a crew that was deliberately selected to hinder you."
msgstr ""
"说到底​，​简娜​的​死​当然​无关紧要​。​重要​的​是​你​完成​了​任务​，​而且​安然无恙​地​走​出来​，​未来​还​能​继续​与​我们​合作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​这​一切​成就​，​都​是​在​被​刻意​挑选​来​拖累​你​的​团队​的​情况​下​取得​的​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1dao4di3，Jian3na4 de5 si3 dang1ran2 wu2guan1jin3yao4。zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 ni3 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5，er2qie3 an1ran2wu2yang4 de5 zou3 chu1lai2，wei4lai2 hai2 neng2 ji4xu4 yu4 wo3men5 he2zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 zhe4 yi1qie4 cheng2jiu4，dou1 shi4 zai4 bei4 ke4yi4 tiao1xuan3 lai2 tuo1lei3 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 qu3de2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Um, Blitz... that message was anything but cryptic. She wants you to stay "
"far, far away."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​布里​茨​……​这​消息​和​加密​一点​都​不​沾边​。​她​就是​想​让​你​离​得​远远​的​。\n"
"e4，Bu4li3ci2……zhe4 xiao1xi5 he4 jia1mi4 yi1dian3 dou1 bu4 zhan1bian1。ta1 jiu4shi4 xiang3 rang4 ni3 li2 de2 yuan3yuan3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Um, she looks a little nuts. And she's a dragon. Kind of a nutty dragon.  \n"
"\n"
"So... uh... be careful."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​她​看起来​有点​疯癫​。​而且​她​可是​一头​巨龙​。​一头​疯癫​的​巨龙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​……​呃​……​小心​点​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3dian3 feng1dian1。er2qie3 ta1 ke3shi4 yi1tou2 ju4long2。yi1tou2 feng1dian1 de5 ju4long2。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……e4……xiao3xin1 dian3。"

msgid ""
"Um. Actually, chief... I wouldn't say that's true.\n"
"\n"
"To be completely honest, what you just said was totally false."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​头儿​……​我​没法​表示​赞同​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老实​说​，​你​刚才​说​的​完全​错​了​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，tou2r5……wo3 mei2fa3 biao3shi4 zan4tong2。\n"
"\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1，ni3 gang1cai2 shuo1 de5 wan2quan2 cuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Um. Chief.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz drops his hand to the submachine gun at his waist.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you help that old nutcase, everyone we know back in Berlin will die. Our *house* will burn down. So, uh... if you really wanna do this, I'm gonna have to stop you."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​将​手​放在​腰间​的​冲锋枪​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​帮助​那个​老​疯子​，​我们​在​柏林​认识​的​每个​人​都​会​死​。​我们​的​*​房子​*​也​会​被​烧毁​。​所以​，​嗯​……​如果​你​真的​想​这么​做​，​我​必须​阻止​你​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 jiang1 shou3 fang4 zai4 yao1jian1 de5 chong1feng1qiang1 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bang1zhu4 na4ge5 lao3 feng1zi5，wo3men5 zai4 bo2lin2 ren4shi5 de5 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 hui4 si3。wo3men5 de5*fang2zi5*ye3 hui4 bei4 shao1hui3。suo3yi3，en1……ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 zhe4me5 zuo4，wo3 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid "Um. Dietrich, I have something to tell you..."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​迪​特里​希​，​我​有点​事要​跟​你​说​……\n"
"e4，Di2te4li3xi1，wo3 you3dian3 shi4 yao4 gen1 ni3 shuo1……"

msgid ""
"Um. Expensive.\n"
"\n"
"Truth be told, I'm in debt."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​很​高​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​现在​还​欠债​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，hen3 gao1。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 xian4zai4 hai2 qian4zhai4 ni2。"

msgid "Um. I think you pissed it off, chief."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​觉得​你​把​它​惹​毛​了​，​头儿​。\n"
"en1，wo3 jue2de5 ni3 ba3 ta1 re3 mao2 le5，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"Um. Lemme describe 'em to you, and you can tell me if what I'm saying fits."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​那​我​给​你​描述​一下​，​你​看看​能​不能​对​得​上​。\n"
"e4，na4 wo3 gei3 ni3 miao2shu4 yi1xia4，ni3 kan4kan5 neng2 bu4neng2 dui4 de2 shang4。"

msgid ""
"Um. Never mind... I just realized that I left the tri-vid on at home anyway."
msgstr ""
"呃​。​算了​……​反正​我刚​意识​到​家里​的​3D​碟机​忘记​关​了​。\n"
"e4。suan4le5……fan3zheng4 wo3 gang1 yi4shi2 dao4 jia1li3 de5 3D die2 ji1 wang4ji4 guan1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Um. No. They, uh... sort of jumped the gun a little.\n"
"\n"
"They're already inside."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​不是​。​他们​……​有点​操之过急​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​已经​在​里面​了​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，bu4shi4。ta1men5……you3dian3 cao1zhi1guo4ji2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yi3jing1 zai4 li3mian4 le5。"

msgid "Um. Okay. Sounds... sounds good."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​行​啊​……​没​问题​。\n"
"e4，xing2 a1……mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid "Um. Pity about Jana. I wish that we could've gotten her out, too."
msgstr ""
"呃​。​关于​简娜​的​事​很​遗憾​。​要是​我们​也​能​把​她​救​出来​就​好​了​。\n"
"e4。guan1yu2 Jian3na4 de5 shi4 hen3 yi2han4。yao4shi5 wo3men5 ye3 neng2 ba3 ta1 jiu4 chu1lai2 jiu4 hao3 le5。"

msgid "Um. Right! Just a second, I'm getting right to it."
msgstr ""
"对​哦​！​稍等一下​，​我​马上​去​处理​。\n"
"dui4 e2！shao1 deng3 yi1 xia4，wo3 ma3shang4 qu4 chu3li3。"

msgid "Um. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"唔​。​谢​了​。\n"
"wu2。xie4 le5。"

msgid "Um. That was an... awfully strange way to open a conversation."
msgstr ""
"呃​。​这样​开始​一段​对话​……​真是太​奇怪​了​。\n"
"e4。zhe4yang4 kai1shi3 yi1 duan4 dui4hua4……zhen1 shi4 tai4 qi2guai4 le5。"

msgid "Um. Things are bad, all right."
msgstr ""
"唔​，​情况​挺​糟​的​。\n"
"wu2，qing2kuang4 ting3 zao1 de5。"

msgid "Um. Well done, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"唔​。​行​吧​，​挺​厉害​。\n"
"wu2。xing2 ba1，ting3 li4hai5。"

msgid ""
"Um. Well, I'm glad that you helped us, ha ha! Thank you, again! Really... thank you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances down at his PDA.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, would you look at the time? I really must get back to helping the others with the cleanup. Good-bye!"
msgstr ""
"呃​，​嗯​，​很​高兴​你​帮​了​我们​，​哈哈​！​再次​感谢​你​！​真的​……​谢谢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​低头​看​了​一眼​他​的​PDA​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​，​你​看看​时间​！​我​真的​得​回去​帮​其他人​清理​了​。​再见​！\n"
"\n"
"e4，en1，hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 bang1 le5 wo3men5，ha1ha1！zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3！zhen1de5……xie4xie5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 kan4 le5 yi1yan3 ta1 de5 PDA。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2，ni3 kan4kan5 shi2jian1！wo3 zhen1de5 de2 hui2qu5 bang1 qi2 ta1 ren2 qing1li3 le5。zai4jian4！"

msgid ""
"Um. Well, chief... I hate to admit it, but I might be in a little bit of "
"trouble here."
msgstr ""
"这个​，​头儿​……​我​不好意思​说​，​但​我​现在​可能​有​了​点​小麻烦​。\n"
"zhe4ge5，tou2r5……wo3 bu4hao3yi4si5 shuo1，dan4 wo3 xian4zai4 ke3neng2 you3 le5 dian3 xiao3 ma2 fan2。"

msgid ""
"Um. Well, chief... I wasn't around for most of it.\n"
"\n"
"But you got me out of that hotel, and for that, you've got my eternal thanks."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​头儿​……​我​大部分​时间​都​不​在场​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​把​我​从​旅馆​里​救​了​出来​。​我​为此​感激不尽​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，tou2r5……wo3 da4bu4fen5 shi2jian1 dou1 bu4 zai4chang3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 ba3 wo3 cong2 lu:3guan3 li3 jiu4 le5 chu1lai2。wo3 wei4ci3 gan3ji1bu4jin4。"

msgid ""
"Um. Well, that's... that's okay. I'll bring you up to speed.\n"
"\n"
"So there're these guys, right? I owe them a lot of money, and... well, some of them are little upset about it."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​没事​。​我​再​给​你​简单​说​一下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​就是​有​这么​一些​人​。​我​欠​了​他们​不少​钱​，​而​现在​……​其中​有人​对此​非常​不爽​。\n"
"\n"
"e4……mei2shi4。wo3 zai4 gei3 ni3 jian3dan1 shuo1 yi1xia4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 jiu4shi4 you3 zhe4me5 yi1xie1 ren2。wo3 qian4 le5 ta1men5 bu4shao3 qian2，er2 xian4zai4……qi2zhong1 you3ren2 dui4 ci3 fei1chang2 bu4shuang3。"

msgid ""
"Um. Well.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She runs her tongue over her teeth, a worried look in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I, uh... I hadn't heard that before."
msgstr ""
"呃​。​好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​舌头​舔​了​舔​牙齿​，​眼睛​里​泛起​一丝​惊恐​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​，​呃​……​我​没听说过​还有​这种​事​。\n"
"\n"
"e4。hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 she2tou5 tian3 le5 tian3 ya2chi3，yan3jing5 li3 fan4qi3 yi1 si1 jing1kong3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3，e4……wo3 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4 hai2you3 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid "Um. Yeah, Phil! I hope that works out for you."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​好​啊​，​菲尔​！​希望​你​这​一套​能​奏效​吧​。\n"
"e4，hao3 a1，fei1 er3！xi1wang4 ni3 zhe4 yi1tao4 neng2 zou4xiao4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Um. Yeah, chief. That's mine.\n"
"\n"
"I didn't want to say anything at the time, since it was my idea to have you loot the vault in the first place."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​对​，​头儿​。​这​是​我​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当时​我​不想​说​什么​，​因为​最初​提议​让​你​去​抢劫​保险库​的​人​就是​我​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，dui4，tou2r5。zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1shi2 wo3 bu4xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5，yin1wei4 zui4chu1 ti2yi4 rang4 ni3 qu4 qiang3jie2 bao3 xian3 ku4 de5 ren2 jiu4shi4 wo3。"

msgid "Um... hello? Are you $(l.honorific) $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"呃​……​你好​？​你​是​$(l.honorific)​$(l.name)​吗​？\n"
"e4……ni3hao3？ni3 shi4 $(l.honorific) $(l.name) ma5？"

msgid "Unable to launch Editor"
msgstr ""
"无法​启动​编辑器\n"
"wu2fa3 qi3dong4 bian1ji2qi4"

msgid "Unable to load Autosave"
msgstr ""
"无法​载入​自动​存档\n"
"wu2fa3 zai3ru4 zi4dong4 cun2dang4"

msgid "Unable to load Content Pack"
msgstr ""
"无法​载入​内容​包\n"
"wu2fa3 zai3ru4 nei4rong2 bao1"

msgid "Unarmed"
msgstr ""
"徒手\n"
"tu2shou3"

msgid "Unarmed Combat"
msgstr ""
"徒手格斗\n"
"tu2 shou3 ge2 dou3"

msgid ""
"Unarmed: Causes heavy bleeding to target on impact, with DMG of your "
"Strength + 3. May do AP DMG on critical hits."
msgstr ""
"徒手​攻击​：​命中​时​对​目标​造成​严重​出血​，​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​+​3​的​伤害​。​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"tu2shou3 gong1ji1：ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 yan2zhong4 chu1xue4，zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 +3 de5 shang1hai4。bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"Unarmed: Causes minor bleeding to target on impact, with DMG of your "
"Strength + 1. May do AP DMG on critical hits."
msgstr ""
"徒手​攻击​：​命中​时​对​目标​造成​轻微​出血​，​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​+​1​的​伤害​。​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"tu2shou3 gong1ji1：ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 qing1wei1 chu1xue4，zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 +1 de5 shang1hai4。bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"Unarmed: Causes moderate bleeding to target on impact, with DMG of your "
"Strength + 2. May do AP DMG on critical hits."
msgstr ""
"徒手​攻击​：​命中​时​对​目标​造成​中等​出血​，​造成​相当于​你​力量​值​+​2​的​伤害​。​暴击时​可能​造成​行动​力​损伤​。\n"
"tu2shou3 gong1ji1：ming4zhong4 shi2 dui4 mu4biao1 zao4cheng2 zhong1deng3 chu1xue4，zao4cheng2 xiang1dang1yu2 ni3 li4liang5 zhi2 +2 de5 shang1hai4。bao4 ji1 shi2 ke3neng2 zao4cheng2 xing2dong4 li4 sun3shang1。"

msgid ""
"Unauthorized access detected. Priming weapons systems for pacification."
msgstr ""
"检测​到​未经​授权​的​入侵​。​武器​系统​已​启动​镇压​程序​。\n"
"jian3ce4 dao4 wei4jing1 shou4quan2 de5 ru4qin1。wu3qi4 xi4tong3 yi3 qi3dong4 zhen4ya1 cheng2xu4。"

msgid "Unbalanced"
msgstr ""
"失衡\n"
"shi1heng2"

msgid "Unbalanced by Nerve Bolt"
msgstr ""
"被​震荡​箭​失衡\n"
"bei4 zhen4dang4 jian4 shi1heng2"

msgid ""
"Unbeknownst to any of us, Gieszler's devil-beverage had done more than initiate a false quarantine. It had also shorted the locks on Billy's cage!\n"
"\n"
"The albino basilisk slipped its bonds, and in that moment, its reign of terror began!"
msgstr ""
"没有​人​知道​，​吉斯​勒​的​恶魔​饮料​不仅​触发​了​错误​的​隔离​，​还​使​比利​的​牢笼​锁​失效​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​条​白化​蛇怪​挣脱​了​束缚​，​就​在​那一刻​，​它​的​恐怖​统治​开始​了​！\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ren2 zhi1dao4，ji2 si1 lei1 de5 e4mo2 yin3liao4 bu4jin3 chu4fa1 le5 cuo4wu4 de5 ge2li2，hai2 shi3 bi3li4 de5 lao2long2 suo3 shi1xiao4 le5！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tiao2 bai2 hua4 she2 guai4 zheng4tuo1 le5 shu4fu4，jiu4 zai4 na4 yi1 ke4，ta1 de5 kong3bu4 tong3zhi4 kai1shi3 le5！"

msgid ""
"Unbelievable. We have one job to do in this place, and the $(l.guy) wants to bail before we've done it.\n"
"\n"
"Get your ass back here, \"team leader.\" We still have a penthouse to bug, remember?"
msgstr ""
"难以置信​。​我们​来​这里​是​有​差事​要​做​的​，​而​这​家伙​想​在​我们​完事​之前​就​跑​路​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​我​回来​，​“​队长​”​。​我们​还要​去​顶层​公寓​放置​监控​，​你​忘​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"nan2yi3zhi4xin4。wo3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 you3 cha4shi4 yao4 zuo4 de5，er2 zhe4 jia1huo5 xiang3 zai4 wo3men5 wan2shi4 zhi1qian2 jiu4 pao2 lu4。\n"
"\n"
"gei3 wo3 hui2lai5，“dui4zhang3”。wo3men5 hai2 yao4 qu4 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 fang4zhi4 jian1kong4，ni3 wang4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Uncontrolled spirits can be extremely dangerous. If I hadn't taken them "
"down, they might've migrated somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"失控​的​精魂​非常​危险​。​如果​我​没​干掉​它们​，​它们​可能​会​迁移​到​别的​地方​。\n"
"shi1kong4 de5 jing1hun2 fei1chang2 wei1xian3。ru2guo3 wo3 mei2 gan4diao4 ta1men5，ta1men5 ke3neng2 hui4 qian1yi2 dao4 bie2de5 di4fang1。"

msgid "Under Master Control"
msgstr ""
"受到​主人​控制\n"
"shou4dao4 zhu3ren2 kong4zhi4"

msgid ""
"Under a bus is exactly where $(l.he) belongs.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger turns to face Dietrich. She towers over him, but he stands his ground.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I respect you, Dietrich... you know that. But you don’t have my training. None of you have."
msgstr ""
"这锅​$(l.he)​不背​还​能​谁​背​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​转向​迪​特里​希​。​她​魁梧​的​身形​压​在​他​面前​，​但​他​并未​退缩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​也​明白​，​我​不是​瞧不起​你​，​迪​特里​希​。​但​你​没​经过​我​这种​训练​。​你们​谁​都​没有​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 guo1 $(l.he) bu4 bei1 hai2 neng2 shei2 bei1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 zhuan3xiang4 Di2te4li3xi1。ta1 kui2wu2 de5 shen1xing2 ya1 zai4 ta1 mian4qian2，dan4 ta1 bing4wei4 tui4suo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3 ming2bai5，wo3 bu4shi4 qiao2bu4qi3 ni3，Di2te4li3xi1。dan4 ni3 mei2 jing1guo4 wo3 zhe4zhong3 xun4lian4。ni3men5 shei2 dou1 mei2you3。"

msgid ""
"Under the terms of our deal, we maintained the pumps that keep the Kreuzbasar's sewage flowing.\n"
"\n"
"In return, the Doctor gave us medical waste to eat. With proper rationing, we found that we could get by on what he gave us."
msgstr ""
"根据​交易​条款​，​我们​负责​维护​水泵​，​让​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​污水​得以​排放​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​作为​回报​，​医生​会​给​我们​医疗​废料​用以​进食​。​依靠​适当​的​配给​，​我们​就​能​以此​活命​。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 jiao1yi4 tiao2kuan3，wo3men5 fu4ze2 wei2hu4 shui3beng4，rang4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 wu1shui3 de2yi3 pai2fang4。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，yi1sheng1 hui4 gei3 wo3men5 yi1liao2 fei4liao4 yong4yi3 jin4shi2。yi1kao4 shi4dang4 de5 pei4ji3，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 yi3ci3 huo2ming4。"

msgid "Underestimating an ancient dragon is never wise, shadowrunner."
msgstr ""
"千万​不要​低估​古龙​的​智慧​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。\n"
"qian1wan4 bu4yao4 di1gu1 gu3long2 de5 zhi4hui4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid "Understand what?"
msgstr ""
"理解​什么​？\n"
"li3jie3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Understandable, but I would strongly advise compliance whenever possible.\n"
"\n"
"There is always some margin for extenuating circumstances; we are nothing if not understanding. But abusing that margin would be unwise."
msgstr ""
"可以​理解​，​但​我​强烈建议​在​可能​的​情况​下​遵守​规定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​特殊​情况​总会​有​一定​的​宽容​空间​；​我们​向来​善解人意​。​但​滥用​这种​宽容​则​不明智​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3yi3 li3jie3，dan4 wo3 jiang4 lie4 jian4 yi4 zai4 ke3neng2 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 zun1shou3 gui1ding4。\n"
"\n"
"te4shu1 qing2kuang4 zong3 hui4 you3 yi1ding4 de5 kuan1rong2 kong1jian1 ； wo3men5 xiang4lai2 shan4jie3ren2yi4。dan4 lan4yong4 zhe4zhong3 kuan1rong2 ze2 bu4 ming2 zhi4。"

msgid "Understood, Herr Mettbach."
msgstr ""
"明白​了​，​梅特​巴赫​先生​。\n"
"ming2bai5 le5，mei2 te4 ba1he4 xian1sheng5。"

msgid "Understood."
msgstr ""
"明白​了​。\n"
"ming2bai5 le5。"

msgid "Understood. Good hunting, Glory."
msgstr ""
"明白​了​，​祝你好运​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"ming2bai5 le5，zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately for all of us - me, especially - I *am* here. So let's just "
"get this finished, and then we can all get back to disliking each other on "
"our own time."
msgstr ""
"很​遗憾​，​对​我们​，​尤其​是​我​来说​，​我​已经​到​了​这里​。​所以​我们​赶紧​把​这事​弄完​，​这样​我们​就​可以​继续​回到​彼此​各​看不顺眼​的​生活​中​了​。\n"
"hen3 yi2han4，dui4 wo3men5，you2qi2 shi4 wo3 lai2 shuo1，wo3 yi3jing1 dao4 le5 zhe4li3。suo3yi3 wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4 long4 wan2，zhe4yang4 wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 ji4xu4 hui2dao4 bi3ci3 ge4 kan4bu4shun4yan3 de5 sheng1huo2 zhong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, conventional weapons haven't done much to hurt these creatures.\n"
"\n"
"Even the small ones have shown an extraordinary resilience to physical damage, and bigger ones that have been popping up are nigh unkillable."
msgstr ""
"遗憾​的​是​，​常规武器​对​这些​生物​几乎​毫无​杀伤力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​连​体型​较​小​的​个体​也​展现出​非凡​的​物理​抗性​，​而​那些​不断​冒出来​的​大型​生物​更是​近乎​不死​之身​。\n"
"\n"
"yi2han4 de5 shi4，chang2gui1wu3qi4 dui4 zhe4xie1 sheng1wu4 ji1hu1 hao2wu2 sha1shang1li4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 lian2 ti3xing2 jiao4 xiao3 de5 ge4ti3 ye3 zhan3 xian4 chu1 fei1fan2 de5 wu4li3 kang4xing4，er2 na4xie1 bu4duan4 mao4chu1lai2 de5 da4xing2 sheng1wu4 geng4shi4 jin4hu5 bu4 si3 zhi1 shen1。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, it would only be a matter of time before the Azzies traced "
"the power spike to this terminal. And once that happened, they'd come down "
"on Danni and her friends like a ton of bricks."
msgstr ""
"可惜​的​是​，​阿兹佬​根据​电力​尖峰​追溯到​这处​终端​只是​时间​问题​。​届时​，​他们​便会​以​万钧之力​压垮​丹妮​和​她​的​朋友​们​。\n"
"ke3xi1 de5 shi4，e1 zi1 lao3 gen1ju4 dian4li4 jian1feng1 dui1 su4 dao4 zhe4 chu3 zhong1duan1 zhi3shi4 shi2jian1 wen4ti2。jie4shi2，ta1men5 bian4 hui4 yi3 wan4 jun1 zhi1 li4 ya1kua3 dan1 ni1 he4 ta1 de5 peng2you5 men5。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, no. Since your meeting, her messages have been... erratic.\n"
"\n"
"In truth, I'm not sure that she knows. But she was very clear about one thing: you're going to have to get past that door to reach the generators."
msgstr ""
"很​遗憾​，​我​一无所知​。​自从​你们​见面​后​，​她​的​消息​就​变得​……​时断时续​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​不​确定​她​是否​真的​知情​。​但​她​对​一件​事​非常​肯定​：​你们​必须​通过​那​扇门​才能​到达​发电机​房​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 yi2han4，wo3 yi1wu2suo3zhi1。zi4cong2 ni3men5 jian4mian4 hou4，ta1 de5 xiao1xi5 jiu4 bian4de5……shi2duan4shi2xu4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 bu4 que4ding4 ta1 shi4fou3 zhen1de5 zhi1qing2。dan4 ta1 dui4 yi1 jian4 shi4 fei1chang2 ken3ding4：ni3men5 bi4xu1 tong1guo4 na4 shan1 men2 cai2neng2 dao4da2 fa1dian4ji1 fang2。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, police response times can leave a little something to be desired. I assume that they showed up eventually, but I'll never know; I was out of there well before anyone showed up to intervene.\n"
"\n"
"But we'll get to that in a second."
msgstr ""
"遗憾​的​是​，​警方​的​响应速度​实在​令人​难以​满意​。​我​猜​他们​最终​还是​来​了​，​但​永远​无从​知晓​—​—​在​我​离开​现场​时​，​根本​没​人​赶来​干预​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​这个​我​后面​再说​。\n"
"\n"
"yi2han4 de5 shi4，jing3fang1 de5 xiang3 ying1 su4 du4 shi2zai4 ling4ren2 nan2yi3 man3yi4。wo3 cai1 ta1men5 zui4zhong1 hai2shi5 lai2 le5，dan4 yong3yuan3 wu2cong2 zhi1xiao3——zai4 wo3 li2kai1 xian4chang3 shi2，gen1ben3 mei2 ren2 gan3lai2 gan1yu4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zhe4ge5 wo3 hou4mian5 zai4shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, the Azzies have also contracted Knight Errant to protect this facility.\n"
"\n"
"They're the ones that we need to worry about."
msgstr ""
"不幸​的​是​，​阿兹佬​还​和​游侠​骑士​签了​合同​，​要​他们​保护​这处​设施​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​当心​这些​人​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xing4 de5 shi4，e1 zi1 lao3 hai2 he4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 qian1 le5 he2tong5，yao4 ta1men5 bao3hu4 zhe4 chu3 she4shi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 dang1xin1 zhe4xie1 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, there are some disadvantages, too. All of that military "
"training has left her... how to say it? \"Rigid,\" I suppose."
msgstr ""
"只​可惜​，​事情​总有​两面性​。​她​经历​的​军事训练​让​她​变得​……​该​怎么​说​呢​？​“​死板​”​吧​。\n"
"zhi3 ke3xi1，shi4qing5 zong3you3 liang3 mian4 xing4。ta1 jing1li4 de5 jun1shi4xun4lian4 rang4 ta1 bian4de5……gai1 zen3me5 shuo1 ni2？“si3ban3” ba1。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, they will not be on their own. Aztechnology has purchased one"
" of Knight Errant's more expensive security contracts as an additional line "
"of defense."
msgstr ""
"可惜​除了​他们​之外​还有​增援​。​阿兹特​科技​已经​向​游侠​骑士​高价​签订​了​一份​安保​合约​，​作为​设施​的​额外​防线​。\n"
"ke3xi1 chu2le5 ta1men5 zhi1wai4 hai2you3 zeng1yuan2。E1zi1te4ke1ji4 yi3jing1 xiang4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 gao1jia4 qian1ding4 le5 yi1 fen4 an1bao3 he2yue1，zuo4wei2 she4shi1 de5 e2wai4 fang2xian4。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, they’ve blocked off the route we used between the stables and the tree line.\n"
"\n"
"That means we’re going to have to fight our way there."
msgstr ""
"遗憾​的​是​，​他们​封锁​了​我们​从​马厩​到​树林​之间​常用​的​路线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​我们​必须​杀出​一条​血路​才能​抵达​那里​。\n"
"\n"
"yi2han4 de5 shi4，ta1men5 feng1suo3 le5 wo3men5 cong2 ma3jiu4 dao4 shu4lin2 zhi1jian1 chang2yong4 de5 lu4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 bi4xu1 sha1 chu1 yi1 tiao2 xue4lu4 cai2neng2 di3da2 na4li5。"

msgid "United in purpose."
msgstr ""
"团结一致​。\n"
"tuan2jie2yi1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"Unless Altuğ wants me to tell you something, but that's rare.\n"
"\n"
"I'm just his ears and hands outside of the cafe - he's got enough of a voice all by himself."
msgstr ""
"除非​是​奥图​伊让​我​给​你​递话​，​不过​这种​情况​很少​见​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​他​在​咖啡馆​外​的​耳目​，​但​他​自己​的​嗓门​也​很大​。\n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 shi4 ao4 tu2 yi1 rang4 wo3 gei3 ni3 di4 hua4，bu4guo4 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 hen3 shao3 jian4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 ta1 zai4 ka1fei1guan3 wai4 de5 er3mu4，dan4 ta1 zi4ji3 de5 sang3men2 ye3 hen3 dai4。"

msgid "Unless he was as crazy as you are, I doubt that."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​深表​怀疑​。​除非​他​和​你​一样​疯狂​。\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 huai2yi2。chu2fei1 ta1 he4 ni3 yi1yang4 feng1kuang2。"

msgid ""
"Unless you fancy dying of malnutrition, you're gonna have to. You know that as well as I do.\n"
"\n"
"Organ meats are rich in vitamins and minerals - choline, CoQ10, vitamin D, bioavailable iron. All things that we're gonna need if we want to survive in the long term.\n"
"\n"
"You won't find much vitamin D in licorice sticks and choco nubs."
msgstr ""
"除非​你​想​因​营养不良​而​死​，​否则​你​必须​这么​做​。​你​和​我​一样​清楚​这是​事实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​内脏器官​富含​维生素​和​矿物质​—​—​比如​胆碱​、​辅酶​Q10​、​维生素​D​，​以及​易​吸收​的​铁​。​这些​都​是​我们​想要​长期​生存​所​需要​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​甘草​棒​和​巧克力​豆里​是​找​不到​多少​维生素​D​的​。\n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 ni3 xiang3 yin1 ying2yang3bu4liang2 er2 si3，fou3ze2 ni3 bi4xu1 zhe4me5 zuo4。ni3 he4 wo3 yi1yang4 qing1chu5 zhe4 shi4 shi4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"nei4 zang4 qi4 guan1 fu4han2 wei2sheng1su4 he4 kuang4wu4zhi4——bi3ru2 dan3jian3、fu3mei2 Q10、wei2sheng1su4 D，yi3ji2 yi4 xi1shou1 de5 tie3。zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 wo3men5 xiang3yao4 chang2qi1 sheng1cun2 suo3 xu1yao4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"gan1cao3 bang4 he4 qiao3ke4li4 dou4 li3 shi4 zhao3 bu4dao4 duo1shao3 wei2sheng1su4 D de5。"

msgid ""
"Unless you're here to help me fix this panel, you'd better stay the hell out of my hair.\n"
"\n"
"Otherwise, I'll call Security and have them *drag* you out."
msgstr ""
"除非​你​是​来​帮​我​修​这块​控制板​的​，​否则​你​最好​别来​烦​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不然​，​我​就​叫​安保​人员​把​你​从​这里​*​拖走​*​。\n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 ni3 shi4 lai2 bang1 wo3 xiu1 zhe4 kuai4 kong4 zhi4 ban3 de5，fou3ze2 ni3 zui4hao3 bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4ran2，wo3 jiu4 jiao4 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 ba3 ni3 cong2 zhe4li3*tuo1zou3*。"

msgid ""
"Unlike the others, Eiger isn't content to go with the flow. She wants lists, and maps, and timetables. She wants a hierarchy, and she wants it formalized.\n"
"\n"
"I don't think that she realizes it, but giving her what she wants would destroy this team. Glory and Dietrich wouldn't put up with it for more than a day or two... I know that I wouldn't. But she keeps on pushing, all the same."
msgstr ""
"与​其他​成员​不同​，​艾格尔​并​不想​随机应变​。​她​需要​目标​清单​、​作战​地图​和​时间表​。​她​希望​团队​组织​有序​，​而且​不​只是​说​说​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​她​没有​意识​到​，​如果​想要​满足​她​的​要求​，​就​会​导致​这个​团队​分崩离析​。​格洛丽和迪​特里​希​最​多​忍受​一两天​……​我​自己​也​同样​无法​接受​。​但​她​依然​固执己见​。\n"
"\n"
"yu4 qi2ta1 cheng2yuan2 bu4tong2，Ai4ge2er3 bing4 bu4xiang3 sui2ji1ying4bian4。ta1 xu1yao4 mu4biao1 qing1dan1、zuo4zhan4 di4tu2 he4 shi2jian1biao3。ta1 xi1wang4 tuan2dui4 zu3zhi1 you3xu4，er2qie3 bu4 zhi3shi4 shuo1 shuo1 er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ta1 mei2you3 yi4shi2 dao4，ru2guo3 xiang3yao4 man3zu2 ta1 de5 yao1qiu2，jiu4 hui4 dao3zhi4 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4 fen1beng1li2xi1。Ge2luo4li2 he4 Di2te4li3xi1 zui4 duo1 ren3shou4 yi1 liang3 tian1……wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 tong2yang4 wu2fa3 jie1shou4。dan4 ta1 yi1ran2 gu4zhi2ji3jian4。"

