msgid ""
"Unpleasant to think about, isn't it? But you have to, Spirit.\n"
"\n"
"You can't run from what you've done. Your actions are a part of you, whether you like it or not."
msgstr ""
"想想​就​令人​不快​，​是​吧​？​但​你​必须​去​思考​这​一切​，​精魂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​无法​逃避​自己​的​所作所为​。​不管​你​喜不喜欢​，​你​的​行为​都​是​你​的​一部分​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 xiang3 jiu4 ling4ren2 bu4kuai4，shi4 ba1？dan4 ni3 bi4xu1 qu4 si1kao3 zhe4 yi1qie4，jing1hun2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wu2fa3 tao2bi4 zi4ji3 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2。bu4guan3 ni3 xi3 bu4 xi3 huan1，ni3 de5 xing2wei2 dou1 shi4 ni3 de5 yi1bu4fen5。"

