"Until then, I ain't going anywhere, so you take whatever time you need to "
"make up your mind."
msgstr ""
"我​哪儿​也​不会​去​的​，​你​有​一辈子​的​时间​来​下定决心​。\n"
"wo3 na3r5 ye3 bu4hui4 qu4 de5，ni3 you3 yi1bei4zi5 de5 shi2jian1 lai2 xia4ding4jue2xin1。"

