"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Up ahead, you catch sight of something *sliding* into the world. \n"
"\n"
"It looks like a charred man, with a pair of tortured faces where its shoulders should be. The thing burns like a Roman candle, spitting white-hot sparks in a fiery plume. An oily substance runs down between its dangling legs and spatters onto the floor, and where those drips land, they burn."
msgstr ""
"你​向前​望去​，​刚好​看到​某个​东西​*​滑入​*​这个​世界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​看起来​像​一具​烧焦​的​人类​尸体​，​肩膀​的​位置​却是​两张​受尽折磨​的​面孔​。​它​像​烟花​一般​燃烧​着​，​喷吐​着​炽白​火花​，​形成​滚滚​火柱​。​油腻​的​液体​从​垂落​的​双腿​间​流淌​，​溅落​在​地板​上​，​滴落​之处​皆​燃起​火焰​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4qian2 wang4 qu4，gang1hao3 kan4dao4 mou3 ge4 dong1xi1*hua2 ru4*zhe4ge5 shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 yi1 ju4 shao1jiao1 de5 ren2lei4 shi1ti3，jian1bang3 de5 wei4zhi5 que4shi4 liang3 zhang1 shou4 jin3 zhe1 mo2 de5 mian4kong3。ta1 xiang4 yan1hua1 yi1ban1 ran2shao1 zhao2，pen1 tu3 zhao2 chi4 bai2 huo3hua1，xing2cheng2 gun3gun3 huo3zhu4。you2ni4 de5 ye4ti3 cong2 chui2 la4 de5 shuang1tui3 jian1 liu2tang3，jian4luo4 zai4 di4ban3 shang4，di1 la4 zhi1 chu3 jie1 ran2qi3 huo3yan4。"

