msgid ""
"Upon approaching the vault door, two things become immediately apparent: One, when you stepped into the vault, the door sealed and latched behind you.\n"
"\n"
"And two, there is no obvious way to open it from where you're standing."
msgstr ""
"当​你​靠近​保险库​大门​时​，​两件事​立刻​显而易见​：​其一​，​当​你​踏入​保险库​时​，​大门​已​在​身后​自动​密封​上锁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​其二​，​从​你​所​站​的​位置​看​，​没有​明显​的​开启​方式​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 kao4jin4 bao3 xian3 ku4 da4men2 shi2，liang3 jian4 shi4 li4ke4 xian3er2yi4jian4：qi2yi1，dang1 ni3 ta1 ru4 bao3 xian3 ku4 shi2，da4men2 yi3 zai4 shen1hou4 zi4dong4 mi4feng1 shang4suo3。\n"
"\n"
"qi2er4，cong2 ni3 suo3 zhan4 de5 wei4zhi5 kan4，mei2you3 ming2xian3 de5 kai1qi3 fang1shi4。"

msgid ""
"Upon closer examination, you can see that the bottles on top of the bar "
"aren't terribly exciting. Good booze, certainly, but nothing to write home "
"about."
msgstr ""
"仔细观察​一番​后​，​你​发现​吧​台上​陈列​的​酒水​实在​平平​无​奇​。​虽是​好​酒​无疑​，​却​也​算不上​惊艳​之作​。\n"
"zi3 xi4 guan1 cha2 yi1 fan1 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 ba1 tai2shang4 chen2lie4 de5 jiu3shui3 shi2zai4 ping2ping2 wu2 ji1。sui1shi4 hao3 jiu3 wu2yi2，que4 ye3 suan4 bu4 shang4 jing1yan4 zhi1 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Upon closer inspection, you notice something. Interspersed among the "
"colorful, bouncing sprites of the screen saver, there is a symbol that you "
"recognize: the dead drop marker of the Schockwellenreiter."
msgstr ""
"经过​仔细观察​后​，​你​发现​了​端倪​。​屏保​动画​上​那些​斑斓​跳动​的​位图​之间​，​夹​着​一个​你​再​熟悉​不过​的​符号​：​电波​骑士​的​秘密​情报​标记​。\n"
"jing1guo4 zi3 xi4 guan1 cha2 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 le5 duan1ni2。ping2bao3 dong4hua4 shang4 na4xie1 ban1lan2 tiao4dong4 de5 wei4tu2 zhi1jian1，jia1 zhao2 yi1ge5 ni3 zai4 shu2xi1 bu4guo4 de5 fu2hao4：dian4Bo1qi2shi4 de5 mi4mi4 qing2bao4 biao1ji4。"

msgid ""
"Upon the successful completion of Project *REDACTED*, he was promoted to "
"Laboratory Supervisor and transferred to the Berlin office. Here, he has "
"succesfully led the development of several Class 'A' projects, receiving a "
"series of promotions."
msgstr ""
"在​成功​完成​*​已​编辑​*​项目​以后​，​他​被​晋升为​实验室​主管​并​被​调往​柏林​分部​。​自此​，​他​成功​领导​了​多个​A​级​项目​的​研发​工作​，​并​因此​获得​了​一系列​晋升​。\n"
"zai4 cheng2gong1 wan2cheng2*yi3 bian1ji2*xiang4mu4 yi3hou4，ta1 bei4 jin4 sheng1 wei2 shi2yan4shi4 zhu3guan3 bing4 bei4 diao4 wang3 bo2lin2 fen1bu4。zi4ci3，ta1 cheng2gong1 ling3dao3 le5 duo1ge5 a ji2 xiang4mu4 de5 yan2fa1 gong1zuo4，bing4 yin1ci3 huo4de2 le5 yi1xi4lie4 jin4sheng1。"

