msgid ""
"Us? *We* botched the run? That's bullshit, man!\n"
"\n"
"*We* did everything like we were supposed to. Like always! It was that bastard's bad intel that got us hung out to dry!"
msgstr ""
"我们​？​他​说​*​我们​*​搞砸​了​差事​？​这​简直​是​胡扯​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​我们​*​完全​是​奉命行事​。​毕竟​我们​可是​专业​团队​！​是​那个​混蛋​的​错误​情报​才​导致​我​陷入​了​如此​境地​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5？ta1 shuo1*wo3men5*gao3za2 le5 cha4shi4？zhe4 jian3zhi2 shi4 hu2che3！\n"
"\n"
"*wo3men5*wan2quan2 shi4 feng4 ming4 xing2 shi4。bi4jing4 wo3men5 ke3shi4 zhuan1ye4 tuan2dui4！shi4 na4ge5 hun2dan4 de5 cuo4wu4 qing2bao4 cai2 dao3zhi4 wo3 xian4ru4 le5 ru2ci3 jing4di4！"

