msgstr ""
"发挥​你​的​商业​头脑​想想看​。​当​某项​服务​仅​有​的​两家​供应商​合并​时​，​会​发生​什么​？\n"
"fa1hui1 ni3 de5 shang1ye4 tou2nao3 xiang3xiang3kan4。dang1 mou3 xiang4 fu2wu4 jin3 you3 de5 liang3 jia1 gong1ying4shang1 he2bing4 shi2，hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5？"

