msgstr ""
"使用​箭头​来​改变​你​的​头像​和​模型​，​以此​自定义​你​的​暗影​狂奔​者​。\n"
"shi3yong4 jian4tou2 lai2 gai3bian4 ni3 de5 tou2xiang4 he4 mo2xing2，yi3ci3 zi4ding4yi4 ni3 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid ""
"Used by shaman to summon spirits. The higher the skill, the more powerful "
"the summoned spirit."
msgstr ""
"萨满​召唤​精魂​的​技能​。​技能​等级​越高​，​召唤​出​的​精魂​越强​。\n"
"sa4man3 zhao4huan4 jing1hun2 de5 ji4neng2。ji4neng2 deng3ji2 yue4 gao1，zhao4huan4 chu1 de5 jing1hun2 yue4 jiang4。"

msgid ""
"Used in Decking or Rigging to calculate the chance to hit with computer "
"programs or drones. Also used to reduce the chance to be hit by enemy "
"programs in the Matrix."
msgstr ""
"骇入​或​机师​操控​时​用来​计算​电脑​程序​或​无人机​的​命中​几率​，​以及​降低​在​矩阵​中​被​敌方​程序​命中​的​几率​。\n"
"hai4 ru4 huo4 ji1shi1 cao1kong4 shi2 yong4lai2 ji4suan4 dian4nao3 cheng2xu4 huo4 wu2ren2ji1 de5 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4，yi3ji2 jiang4di1 zai4 ju3zhen4 zhong4 bei4 di2fang1 cheng2xu4 ming4zhong4 de5 ji1lu:4。"

msgid ""
"Used to calculate the chance to Control Spirits. Increases the chance to hit"
" with Conjuring spells. Unlocks Etiquettes that affect conversations."
msgstr ""
"用来​计算​控制​精魂​的​几率​。​增加​咒术​的​命中​几率​。​解锁​可​影响​对话​的​礼仪​。\n"
"yong4lai2 ji4suan4 kong4zhi4 jing1hun2 de5 ji1lu:4。zeng1jia1 zhou4 shu4 de5 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4。jie3suo3 ke3 ying3xiang3 dui4hua4 de5 li3yi2。"

msgid ""
"Used to calculate the chance to hit in ranged combat. Reduces the chance to "
"be hit by enemy physical attacks."
msgstr ""
"用来​计算​远程​战斗​命中​几率​。​降低​被​敌人​物理攻击​命中​的​几率​。\n"
"yong4lai2 ji4suan4 yuan3cheng2 zhan4dou4 ming4zhong4 ji1lu:4。jiang4di1 bei4 di2ren2 wu4 li3 gong1 ji1 ming4zhong4 de5 ji1lu:4。"

msgid ""
"Used to calculate the chance to hit with magical attacks. Also used to "
"reduce the chance to be hit by enemy magical attacks."
