msgid ""
"Vauclair falls silent. A wisp of smoke traces its way from the tip of his "
"cigarette to the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​陷入​了​沉默​。​一缕​烟雾​从​他​手中​的​烟头​袅袅​升起​，​飘向​天花板​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 xian4ru4 le5 chen2mo4。yi1 lu:3 yan1wu4 cong2 ta1 shou3 zhong4 de5 yan1tou2 niao3niao3 sheng1qi3，piao1 xiang4 tian1hua1ban3。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair fixes you with a weary stare, then turns and exits the room without"
" a word."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​用​疲惫​的​目光​盯​着​你​，​然后​一言不发​地​转身​离开​了​房间​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 yong4 pi2bei4 de5 mu4guang1 ding1 zhao2 ni3，ran2hou4 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 le5 fang2jian1。"

msgid "Vauclair fixes you with a weary stare, then turns and exits the room."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​用​疲惫​的​目光​盯​着​你​，​然后​转身​离开​了​房间​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 yong4 pi2bei4 de5 mu4guang1 ding1 zhao2 ni3，ran2hou4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 le5 fang2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair fumbles in his pockets, produces a fresh cigarette. He lights it with shaking hands and breathes in deeply. The orange glow of the cigarette flares bright.\n"
"\n"
"When he exhales, the words spill out with the smoke."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​在​口袋​里​翻找​着​，​掏出​一支​崭新​的​香烟​。​他​颤抖​着​点燃​香烟​，​深深​吸​了​一口​。​香烟​的​橙色​光芒​骤然​亮​起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​他​呼出​烟雾​时​，​话语​也​随之​倾泻​而出​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 zai4 kou3dai4 li3 fan1 zhao3 zhao2，tao1chu1 yi1 zhi1 zhan3xin1 de5 xiang1yan1。ta1 chan4dou3 zhao2 dian3ran2 xiang1yan1，shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3。xiang1yan1 de5 cheng2se4 guang1mang2 zhou4ran2 liang4 qi3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ta1 hu1chu1 yan1wu4 shi2，hua4yu3 ye3 sui2zhi1 qing1xie4 er2 chu1。"

msgid "Vauclair glares silently through the glass."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​透过​窗户​沉默​地​怒视​着​你​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 tou4guo4 chuang1hu5 chen2mo4 de5 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid "Vauclair is dead, Feuerschwinge."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​已经​死​了​，​火翼​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 yi3jing1 si3 le5，Huo3yi4。"

msgid "Vauclair looks down for a long moment, then turns and exits the room."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​低头​沉思​了​很​久​，​然后​转身​离开​了​房间​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 di1tou2 chen2si1 le5 hen3 jiu3，ran2hou4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 le5 fang2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair opens his desk drawer and reaches in with both hands. When he pulls them back out, you see the object that he's holding: a vintage Luger handgun.\n"
"\n"
"Gingerly, he grips it in his right hand and raises it to his temple."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​打开​办公桌​抽屉​，​双手​探入​其中​。​当​他​抽出​手时​，​你​看见​他握​着​的​东西​：​一把​古董​鲁格​手枪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​小心翼翼​地用​右手​握住​枪柄​，​举到​太阳穴​处​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 da3kai1 ban4 gong1 zhuo1 chou1ti5，shuang1shou3 tan4 ru4 qi2zhong1。dang1 ta1 chou1chu1 shou3 shi2，ni3 kan4jian4 ta1 wo4 zhao2 de5 dong1xi1：yi1 ba3 gu3dong3 lu3 ge2 shou3qiang1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiao3xin1yi4yi4 de5 yong4 you4shou3 wo4zhu4 qiang1 bing3，ju3 dao4 tai4yang2xue2 chu3。"

msgid "Vauclair recoils slightly, but he holds his silence."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​有点​畏缩​，​但​仍然​一言不发​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 you3dian3 wei4suo1，dan4 reng2ran2 yi1yan2bu4fa1。"

msgid "Vauclair said that you offered him treasure."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​说​你​给​了​他​宝藏​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 shuo1 ni3 gei3 le5 ta1 bao3zang4。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair stands there, leaning on his console, his eyes bulging. His teeth grind.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, he raises his head to look you in the eye."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​站​在​那里​，​倚​着​控制台​，​瞪​大​眼睛​，​咬紧牙关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​他​抬起头来​直视​你​的​眼睛​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 zhan4 zai4 na4li5，yi3 zhao2 kong4zhi4tai2，deng4 dai4 yan3jing5，yao3jin3ya2guan1。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2 zhi2shi4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair starts, and the sudden movement sends his overflowing ashtray "
"flying from the table. It clatters to the ground in a cloud of ash."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​猛地​起身​，​这​突如其来​的​动作​让​桌上​的​烟灰缸​飞​了​出去​，​摔​在​地上​扬起​一阵​灰尘​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 meng3de5 qi3shen1，zhe4 tu1ru2qi2lai2 de5 dong4zuo4 rang4 zhuo1 shang4 de5 yan1hui1gang1 fei1 le5 chu1qu4，shuai1 zai4 di4shang5 yang2qi3 yi1zhen4 hui1chen2。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair straightens, but only partially. His expression is stiff, but his motions are jerky. Erratic.\n"
"\n"
"He waits for a long time before looking up again."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​挺直​了​部分​身子​。​他​的​表情​僵硬​，​但​动作​却​笨拙​突兀​，​时断时续​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​等​了​很​久​才​再次​抬头​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ting3zhi2 le5 bu4fen5 shen1zi5。ta1 de5 biao3qing2 jiang1ying4，dan4 dong4zuo4 que4 ben4zhuo1 tu1wu4，shi2duan4shi2xu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 deng3 le5 hen3 jiu3 cai2 zai4ci4 tai2tou2。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair straightens, but only partially. His hand tightens on a pack of cigarettes on his desk, crumpling it.\n"
"\n"
"He waits for a long time before looking up again."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​挺直​了​部分​身子​。​他​的​手​紧紧抓住​桌上​的​烟盒​，​把​它​捏​得​皱巴巴​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​等​了​很​久​才​再次​抬头​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ting3zhi2 le5 bu4fen5 shen1zi5。ta1 de5 shou3 jin3 jin3 zhua1 zhu4 zhuo1 shang4 de5 yan1 he2，ba3 ta1 nie1 de2 zhou4ba1ba1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 deng3 le5 hen3 jiu3 cai2 zai4ci4 tai2tou2。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair straightens. He looks angry, but behind the anger you can sense a "
"deep fatigue."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​挺直​了​身子​。​他​看起来​很​生气​，​但​在​愤怒​的​背后​，​你​能​感觉​到​一种​深深​的​疲惫​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 sheng1qi4，dan4 zai4 fen4nu4 de5 bei4hou4，ni3 neng2 gan3jue2 dao4 yi1zhong3 shen1shen1 de5 pi2bei4。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair straightens. He rubs the bridge of his nose between a pair of bony fingers.\n"
"\n"
"The fire that burned in him seems to have guttered out. Above all, he looks worn down."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​挺直​了​身子​。​他​用​骨瘦如柴​的​手指​揉​了​揉​鼻梁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​曾​让​他​震颤​的​怒火​似乎​已​自行​熄灭​。​如今​，​他​看起来​只是​疲惫不堪​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。ta1 yong4 gu3shou4ru2chai2 de5 shou3zhi3 rou2 le5 rou2 bi2liang2。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ceng2 rang4 ta1 zhen4chan4 de5 nu4huo3 si4hu1 yi3 zi4xing2 xi1mie4。ru2jin1，ta1 kan4qi3lai5 zhi3shi4 pi2bei4bu4kan1。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair straightens. His expression is livid, but his body language tells a different story... the rage that shook him seems to have burned itself out.\n"
"\n"
"Now, he just looks tired."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​挺直​了​身子​。​他​的​表情​愤怒​异常​，​但​他​的​肢体​语言​却​并非如此​……​那​曾​让​他​震颤​的​怒火​似乎​已​自行​熄灭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如今​，​他​看起来​只是​疲惫不堪​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。ta1 de5 biao3qing2 fen4nu4 yi4chang2，dan4 ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 que4 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3……na4 ceng2 rang4 ta1 zhen4chan4 de5 nu4huo3 si4hu1 yi3 zi4xing2 xi1mie4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1，ta1 kan4qi3lai5 zhi3shi4 pi2bei4bu4kan1。"

msgid ""
"Vauclair straightens. It looks like you've touched a nerve - his entire body is trembling with fury.\n"
"\n"
"He takes a deep breath to calm himself."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​挺直​了​身子​。​看来​你​触动​了​他​的​痛处​—​—​他​的​全身​都​在​愤怒​地​颤抖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​深吸​一口气​，​试图​让​自己​冷静下来​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。kan4lai5 ni3 chu4dong4 le5 ta1 de5 tong4chu4——ta1 de5 quan2shen1 dou1 zai4 fen4nu4 de5 chan4dou3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，shi4tu2 rang4 zi4ji3 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2。"

msgid "Vauclair--"
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​—​—\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 — —"

msgid ""
"Vauclair. He looks up from his computer, a cigarette dangling from his lip.\n"
"\n"
"He looks shriveled and frail. His eyes are shrunken into his skull, and liver spots dot his paper-thin skin.\n"
"\n"
"The way that his legs are shaking, it looks like it's a miracle that he's standing upright at all."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​。​他​从​电脑前​抬起​头​，​嘴唇​叼​着​烟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​看起来​干瘪​而​虚弱​。​眼睛​深陷​颅骨​，​纸薄​的​皮肤​上​布满​老年斑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​双腿​颤抖​得​厉害​，​能​直立​站​着​简直​是​个​奇迹​。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3。ta1 cong2 dian4 nao3 qian2 tai2qi3 tou2，zui3chun2 diao1 zhao2 yan1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4qi3lai5 gan1bie3 er2 xu1ruo4。yan3jing5 shen1xian4 lu2gu3，zhi3 bao2 de5 pi2fu1 shang4 bu4man3 lao3nian2ban1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shuang1tui3 chan4dou3 de2 li4hai5，neng2 zhi2li4 zhan4 zhao2 jian3zhi2 shi4 ge4 qi2ji4。"

msgid "Vauclair? Never heard of him."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​？​没听说过​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3？mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4。"

msgid "VauclairCamera"
msgstr ""
"VauclairCamera\n"
"VauclairCamera"

msgid "Vault Door"
msgstr ""
"保险库​门\n"
"bao3 xian3 ku4 men2"

msgid "Vault Door Unlocked"
msgstr ""
"保险库​门​已​解锁\n"
"bao3 xian3 ku4 men2 yi3 jie3suo3"

msgid "Vault Terminal"
msgstr ""
"保险库​终端\n"
"bao3 xian3 ku4 zhong1duan1"

msgid ""
"Vengeance. Someone killed our friends. Attacked our home. And I'm thinking "
"that someone was you."
msgstr ""
"复仇​。​有人​杀害​了​我们​的​朋友​，​袭击​了​我们​的​家园​。​我​觉得​那个​人​就是​你​。\n"
"fu4chou2。you3ren2 sha1hai4 le5 wo3men5 de5 peng2you5，xi2ji1 le5 wo3men5 de5 jia1yuan2。wo3 jue2de5 na4ge5 ren2 jiu4shi4 ni3。"

msgid "Venom Spray"
msgstr ""
"毒液​喷雾\n"
"du2ye4 pen1wu4"

msgid "Venom: HP -2 per RND"
msgstr ""
"毒液​：​每​回合​损失​2​点​生命​值\n"
"du2ye4：mei3 hui2he2 sun3shi1 2 dian3 sheng1ming4 zhi2"

msgid "Vent"
msgstr ""
"通风口\n"
"tong1feng1kou3"

msgid "Vent A safety protocol disengaged."
msgstr ""
"通风口​A​安全​协议​已​解除​。\n"
"tong1feng1kou3 a an1quan2 xie2yi4 yi3 jie3chu2。"

msgid "Vent B safety protocol disengaged."
msgstr ""
"通风口​B​安全​协议​已​解除​。\n"
"tong1feng1kou3 bi1 an1quan2 xie2yi4 yi3 jie3chu2。"

msgid "Ventilation Controls"
msgstr ""
"通风​控制\n"
"tong1feng1 kong4zhi4"

msgid "Ventilation Map Diagram"
msgstr ""
"通风​系统​示意图\n"
"tong1feng1 xi4tong3 shi4yi4tu2"

msgid ""
"Verifying that all security protocols are in place. It's all a part of our "
"sweep, sir."
msgstr ""
"验证​所有​安保​协议​是否​就绪​。​这些​都​属于​我们​巡视​的​一部分​，​先生​。\n"
"yan4zheng4 suo3you3 an1bao3 xie2yi4 shi4fou3 jiu4xu4。zhe4xie1 dou1 shu3yu2 wo3men5 xun2shi4 de5 yi1bu4fen5，xian1sheng5。"

msgid "Version:"
msgstr ""
"版本​：\n"
"ban3ben3："

msgid "Very Hard"
msgstr ""
"极难\n"
"ji2 nan2"

msgid "Very bad thing?"
msgstr ""
"很​糟糕​的​事​？\n"
"hen3 zao1gao1 de5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"Very good.\n"
"\n"
"Assuming that your performance in the audition passes muster, I can foresee a long and fruitful business relationship between us."
msgstr ""
"非常​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​假设​你​在​试镜​中​的​表现​令人满意​，​我​预见​我们​之间​将​建立​起​长期​而​富有成效​的​合作​关系​。\n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"jia3she4 ni3 zai4 shi4jing4 zhong4 de5 biao3xian4 ling4ren2man3yi4，wo3 yu4jian4 wo3men5 zhi1jian1 jiang1 jian4li4 qi3 chang2qi1 er2 fu4 you3 cheng2 xiao4 de5 he2zuo4 guan1xi5。"

msgid ""
"Very good.\n"
"\n"
"I can't imagine that this will be cheap. What was Alice's stated price?"
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这项​差事​想必​要价​不菲​。​爱丽丝​报价​多少​？\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 xiang4 cha4shi4 xiang3bi4 yao4jia4 bu4fei3。ai4li4si1 bao4jia4 duo1shao3？"

msgid ""
"Very good.\n"
"\n"
"I'll be in touch."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​回头​联系​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"hui2tou2 lian2xi4。"

msgid ""
"Very good.\n"
"\n"
"I'll be waiting."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​等​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 deng3 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Very good.\n"
"\n"
"Now, if you please: give me a status update on the members of your team."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​你​说​一下​你​的​队员​情况​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 ni3 shuo1 yi1xia4 ni3 de5 dui4yuan2 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"Very good.\n"
"\n"
"The moment that you board the train to Frankfurter Tor, your test will begin. I would advise you to bring what you need in terms of medical supplies and ordinance - once you embark on your trial run, there will be no turning back."
msgstr ""
"非常​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​踏上​开往​法兰克福​门​的​列车​，​考验​便​已​开始​。​我​建议​你备​妥​所​需​的​医疗​物资​与​军需品​—​—​一旦​踏上​试炼​之旅​，​便​再​无​回头路​可​走​。\n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 ta4shang4 kai1wang3 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2 de5 lie4che1，kao3yan4 bian4 yi3 kai1shi3。wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 bei4 tuo3 suo3 xu1 de5 yi1liao2 wu4zi1 yu4 jun1 xu1 pin3——yi1dan4 ta4shang4 shi4lian4 zhi1 lu:3，bian4 zai4 wu2 hui2tou2lu4 ke3 zou3。"

msgid ""
"Very good.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Burakgazi hands you a ceramic travel cup, which he then fills to the brim with dark, steaming liquid. The scent is intoxicating.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Is there anything more that I can get you?"
msgstr ""
"好极了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布拉加​齐​递给​你​一只​陶瓷​保温杯​，​随即​往里面​倒​满​滚烫​的​深色​液体​。​那​香气​令人​陶醉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还要​来​点​什么​别的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ji2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 di4gei3 ni3 yi1 zhi3 tao2ci2 bao3wen1bei1，sui2ji2 wang3 li3 mian4 dao3 man3 gun3tang4 de5 shen1se4 ye4ti3。na4 xiang1qi4 ling4ren2 tao2zui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2 yao4 lai2 dian3 shen2me5 bie2de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Very good. \n"
"\n"
"My employers need a delivery made. Take this PDA, and drop it into the trash can near the statue at the northernmost point of the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"That's all there is to it. Simple, like I said. You'll find a note under that can with payment instructions."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​雇主​需要​递送​一样​东西​。​带​着​这台​PDA​，​把​它​扔进​克洛伊​茨​集市​最​北端​雕像​旁​的​垃圾箱​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这样​。​正如​我​所说​，​很​简单​。​你​会​在​那个​垃圾箱​底下​找到​一张​写​着​付款​说明​的​纸条​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 xu1yao4 di4song4 yi1yang4 dong1xi1。dai4 zhao2 zhe4 tai2 PDA，ba3 ta1 reng1 jin4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zui4 bei3duan1 diao1xiang4 pang2 de5 la1ji1xiang1 li3。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4yang4。zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，hen3 jian3dan1。ni3 hui4 zai4 na4ge5 la1ji1xiang1 di3xia5 zhao3dao4 yi1 zhang1 xie3 zhao2 fu4kuan3 shuo1ming2 de5 zhi3tiao2。"

msgid "Very good. And tell him that I'm looking forward to working with him."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​告诉​他​，​我​很​期待​与​他​的​合作​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。gao4su4 ta1，wo3 hen3 qi1dai4 yu4 ta1 de5 he2zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Very good. Are you ready to make a deal, ace? I have all the time in the "
"world, but something tells me that you're on a more aggressive timetable."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​那么​你​准备​好​做​交易​了​吗​，​王牌​？​我​有的是​时间​，​但​我​感觉​你​时间​更​紧迫​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。na4me5 ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 zuo4 jiao1yi4 le5 ma5，wang2pai2？wo3 you3de5shi4 shi2jian1，dan4 wo3 gan3jue2 ni3 shi2jian1 geng1 jin3po4。"

msgid ""
"Very good. But I wouldn't deliberately antagonize her.\n"
"\n"
"Eiger's skills and experience are invaluable to this team."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​不过​我​不会​故意​跟​她​对着干​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​队里​不能​缺​了​艾格尔​的​经验​和​技术​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。bu4guo4 wo3 bu4hui4 gu4yi4 gen1 ta1 dui4zhe5gan4。\n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 dui4 li3 bu4neng2 que1 le5 Ai4ge2er3 de5 jing1yan4 he4 ji4shu4。"

msgid ""
"Very good. I will instruct her to come to the Kreuzbasar. Where would you "
"like to meet?"
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​我会​让​她​来​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​你​打算​在​哪里​见面​？\n"
"hao3 de5。wo3 hui4 rang4 ta1 lai2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。ni3 da3suan4 zai4 na3li3 jian4mian4？"

msgid "Very good. Is there anything else that you need to know?"
msgstr ""
"好​，​还​需要​我​帮​你​找些​什么​？\n"
"hao3，hai2 xu1yao4 wo3 bang1 ni3 zhao3 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Very good. Maliit is still working on the other DVDs from the bundle... many of them are extensively damaged, and getting anything off of them is proving to be quite a chore.\n"
"\n"
"She told me that she'll be in touch if and when she makes any headway."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​玛丽​特​还​在​努力​修复​其他​几张​DVD​……​它们​大多​遭到​严重​损坏​，​从中​提取​任何​内容​都​相当​费劲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​告诉​我​说​，​如果​有​进展​会​随时​联系​我​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。ma3li4 te4 hai2 zai4 nu3li4 xiu1fu4 qi2ta1 ji1 zhang1 DVD……ta1men5 da4duo1 zao1dao4 yan2zhong4 sun3huai4，cong2zhong1 ti2qu3 ren4he2 nei4rong2 dou1 xiang1dang1 fei4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1，ru2guo3 you3 jin4zhan3 hui4 sui2shi2 lian2xi4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Very good. OTK's offices aren't far from here... you should take the U-Bahn "
"there when you're ready."
msgstr ""
"很​好​。​OTK​的​办公室​离​这儿​不远​……​你​准备​好​了​就​坐地铁​过去​。\n"
"hen3 hao3。OTK de5 ban4gong1shi4 li2 zhe4r5 bu4 yuan3……ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 jiu4 zuo4 de5 tie3 guo4qu4。"

msgid ""
"Very good. Only one more thing that needs doing, and then we can get out of "
"here."
msgstr ""
"非常​好​。​还​剩下​一件​事​，​然后​我们​就​能​离开​了​。\n"
"fei1chang2 hao3。hai2 sheng4xia4 yi1 jian4 shi4，ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Very perceptive. Yes, I do intend to make you a counterproposal... and you'd be wise to listen to it.\n"
"\n"
"Ullrich may have a use for you now, but as soon as this no longer holds, he will kill you."
msgstr ""
"很​敏锐​。​没错​，​我​确实​打算​向​你​提个​相反​的​建议​……​你​最好​听听​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​乌尔里​希​此刻​或许​用得上​你​，​但​一旦​你​不再​有用​，​他​就​会​杀​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"hen3 min3rui4。mei2cuo4，wo3 que4shi2 da3suan4 xiang4 ni3 ti2 ge4 xiang1fan3 de5 jian4yi4……ni3 zui4hao3 ting1 ting1。\n"
"\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1 ci3ke4 huo4xu3 yong4de5shang4 ni3，dan4 yi1dan4 ni3 bu4zai4 you3yong4，ta1 jiu4 hui4 sha1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Very pragmatic. But just this once, we're asking you to make an exception.\n"
"\n"
"This job will require a very specific skill set. Your current team does not possess these skills; the one that I have assembled does."
msgstr ""
"非常​务实​。​但​这次​，​我们​要求​你​破例​一次​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这项​工作​需要​非常​特定​的​技能​组合​。​你​现有​的​团队​并​不​具备​这些​技能​，​而​我​组建​的​团队​则​恰恰​拥有​。\n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 wu4shi2。dan4 zhe4 ci4，wo3men5 yao1qiu2 ni3 po4li4 yi1ci4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 xiang4 gong1zuo4 xu1yao4 fei1chang2 te4ding4 de5 ji4neng2 zu3he2。ni3 xian4you3 de5 tuan2dui4 bing4 bu4 ju4bei4 zhe4xie1 ji4neng2，er2 wo3 zu3jian4 de5 tuan2dui4 ze2 qia4qia4 yong1you3。"

msgid ""
"Very well, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I will."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Very well, I shall make the arrangements. I'm glad you were able to retrieve Gunari's shipment without needless violence.\n"
"\n"
"Good work."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我会​安排​下去​的​。​很​高兴​你​能​在​不​引起​无谓​冲突​的​情况​下​取回​古纳里​的​货物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​干得​不错​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 hui4 an1pai2 xia4qu4 de5。hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 neng2 zai4 bu4 yin3qi3 wu2wei4 chong1tu1 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 qu3hui2 gu3 na4 li3 de5 huo4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"gan4 de2 bu4cuo4。"

msgid "Very well, I’ll go."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我照​做​就是​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 zhao4 zuo4 jiu4shi4 le5。"

msgid "Very well, if you wish. What would you like to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​。​你​想​说​什么​？\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。ni3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Very well, my friend. Thanks again for your help!\n"
"\n"
"If you see anyone in need, be sure to send them our way. We will do whatever we can to make thier lives better."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​朋友​。​再次​感谢​你​的​帮助​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​看到​任何​需要​帮助​的​人​，​请​务必​送来​我们​这里​。​我们​将​竭尽所能​改善​他们​的​生活​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，peng2you5。zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4！\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 kan4dao4 ren4he2 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4 de5 ren2，qing3 wu4bi4 song4 lai2 wo3men5 zhe4li3。wo3men5 jiang1 jie2 jin3 suo3 neng2 gai3shan4 ta1men5 de5 sheng1huo2。"

msgid ""
"Very well, stranger. If you cannot be dissuaded, I will help you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ragged lab tech fishes in his coat pocket with a bony hand, and produces a thin slip of plastic. He presents it to you with a flourish.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is my most prized possession: the incomparable Keycard B."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​陌生人​。​如果​你​一意孤行​的话​，​那​我​就​助​你​一臂之力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​衣衫褴褛​的​研究员​用​骨瘦如柴​的​手​从​外套​口袋​中​摸索​，​取出​一张​薄薄的​塑料​卡片​。​他​得意​地​递给​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​最​珍贵​的​财产​：​无与伦比​的​门禁卡​B​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，mo4sheng1ren2。ru2guo3 ni3 yi1yi4gu1xing2 de5hua4，na4 wo3 jiu4 zhu4 ni3 yi1 bi4 zhi1 li4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 shan1 lan2 lu:3 de5 yan2jiu1yuan2 yong4 gu3shou4ru2chai2 de5 shou3 cong2 wai4tao4 kou3dai4 zhong4 mo1suo5，qu3chu1 yi1 zhang1 bao2 bao2 de5 su4liao4 ka3pian4。ta1 de2yi4 de5 di4gei3 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 zui4 zhen1gui4 de5 cai2chan3：wu2yu3lun2bi3 de5 men2 jin1 ka3 bi1。"

msgid "Very well, then swear it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​那​你​发誓​吧​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 ni3 fa1shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Very well, topsider. You won't see us again.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ghoul turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just let us collect our things, and we'll be gone."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​上层​人​。​你​不会​再​见到​我们​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​食尸​鬼​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我们​把​东西​收拾​好​，​我们​这​就​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，shang4ceng2 ren2。ni3 bu4hui4 zai4 jian4dao4 wo3men5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi2 shi1 gui3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3men5 ba3 dong1xi1 shou1shi5 hao3，wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"Very well.\n"
"\n"
"I managed to pull a file off of the PDA before it crashed. As I was saying.\n"
"\n"
"It looks to be a comm file. The audio is all here, but we've only got video from one side of the conversation.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He opens the file, and a nightmarishly familiar face appears on the screen.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正如​我​刚才​所说​，​在​PDA​报废​之前​，​我​成功​提取​了​一份​文件​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​是​一份​通讯​文件​。​音频​部分​完整​，​但​视频​部分​只有​其中​一方​的​画面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​打开​文件​，​屏幕​上​出现​一张​如​梦魇​般​熟悉​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 wo3 gang1cai2 suo3 shuo1，zai4 PDA bao4fei4 zhi1qian2，wo3 cheng2gong1 ti2qu3 le5 yi1 fen4 wen2jian4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 shi4 yi1 fen4 tong1xun4 wen2jian4。yin1pin2 bu4fen5 wan2zheng3，dan4 shi4pin2 bu4fen5 zhi3you3 qi2zhong1 yi1fang1 de5 hua4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da3kai1 wen2jian4，ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 yi1 zhang1 ru2 meng4yan3 ban1 shu2xi1 de5 lian3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Very well.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel nods his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, very good. This is probably the healthiest attitude to take about those who supply our community."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​的​很​对​。​对于​那些​为​我们​社区​提供​服务​的​人​，​这​或许​是​最​健康​的​心态​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 hen3 dui4。dui4yu2 na4xie1 wei2 wo3men5 she4qu1 ti2gong1 fu2wu4 de5 ren2，zhe4 huo4xu3 shi4 zui4 jian4kang1 de5 xin1tai4。"

msgid ""
"Very well.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He rocks back on his heels, apparently satisfied.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇晃​着​脚跟​，​显得​很​满意​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2huang4 zhao2 jiao3gen1，xian3de5 hen3 man3yi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Very well. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Burakgazi locks eyes with you, and his voice grows cold.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please inform Herr Amsel that his information is regrettably unavailable at this time."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布拉加​齐​与​你​四目​相对​，​声音​骤然​冰冷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​告知​阿姆​泽尔​先生​，​很​遗憾​，​我​目前​无法​提供​他​需要​的​情报​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4，sheng1yin1 zhou4ran2 bing1leng3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 gao4zhi1 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5，hen3 yi2han4，wo3 mu4qian2 wu2fa3 ti2gong1 ta1 xu1yao4 de5 qing2bao4。"

msgid ""
"Very well. Ask your questions. But hurry!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His eyes bulge.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I want those snacks!"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​有话​赶紧​问​，​但​最好​快点​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​眼睛​鼓​了​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想要​那些​零食​！\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，you3 hua4 gan3jin3 wen4，dan4 zui4hao3 kuai4dian3！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3jing5 gu3 le5 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3yao4 na4xie1 ling2shi2！"

msgid ""
"Very well. Auf Wiedersehen, and come by any time. Your help is always "
"appreciated."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​回头见​，​有空​常​来​。​我们​会​很​感谢​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。hui2tou2jian4，you3kong4 chang2 lai2。wo3men5 hui4 hen3 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid "Very well. Come back when you're ready."
msgstr ""
"没关系​，​准备​好​了​再​来​找​我​。\n"
"mei2guan1xi5，zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 zai4 lai2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Very well. Commencing presentation.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The simulacrum goes rigid for a moment, then seems to relax. When it speaks, it sounds more natural… as though the real Alice is speaking through it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​正在​启动​演示​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​拟像​僵住​片刻​，​随即​似乎​又​放松​下来​。​它​开口​时​声音​更显​自然​……​就​好像​爱丽丝​本人​正​透过​它​说话​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。zheng4zai4 qi3dong4 yan3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 jiang1zhu4 pian4ke4，sui2ji2 si4hu1 you4 fang4song1 xia4lai5。ta1 kai1kou3 shi2 sheng1yin1 geng1 xian3 zi4ran2……jiu4 hao3xiang4 ai4li4si1 ben3ren2 zheng1 tou4guo4 ta1 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Very well. Feel free to interrupt again with any future inquiries."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​如果​你​还有​问题​，​可以​随时​打断​我​。\n"
"hao3 de5。ru2guo3 ni3 hai2you3 wen4ti2，ke3yi3 sui2shi2 da3duan4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Very well. Fine. Money holds no value for me anymore... and it won't for "
"you, either, unless we can find a way to stop what is happening."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​钱​对​我​来说​也​没有​什么​价值​了​……​对​你​来说​也​是​如此​，​除非​我们​能​有​办法​阻止​即将​发生​的​事情​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。qian2 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 ye3 mei2you3 shen2me5 jia4zhi2 le5……dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3，chu2fei1 wo3men5 neng2 you3 ban4fa3 zu3zhi3 ji2jiang1 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "Very well. For you, ace."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​这是​为了​你​，​王牌​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 ni3，wang2pai2。"

msgid "Very well. If you have questions, I will be all too happy to answer."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​如果​你​有​问题​，​我​非常​乐意​回答​。\n"
"hao3 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 you3 wen4ti2，wo3 fei1chang2 le4yi4 hui2da2。"

msgid ""
"Very well. Is there anything else that you need, or...?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Amsel shifts his gaze down to the papers on his desk, then looks you in the eye. He's far too polite to tell you that you're wasting his time, but it doesn't take a genius to figure out what he's thinking.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​如果​你​没有​其他​事情​的话​……​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔看​向​桌上​的​文件​，​然后​又​重新​看向​你​。​他​这样​温文尔雅​的​人​不会​直言​你​在​浪费​他​的​时间​，​但任​谁​都​能​看出​他​的​心思​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 mei2you3 qi2ta1 shi4qing5 de5hua4……？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 kan4 xiang4 zhuo1 shang4 de5 wen2jian4，ran2hou4 you4 chong2xin1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。ta1 zhe4yang4 wen1wen2er3ya3 de5 ren2 bu4hui4 zhi2yan2 ni3 zai4 lang4fei4 ta1 de5 shi2jian1，dan4 ren4 shei2 dou1 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 de5 xin1si5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Very well. Tell him I sent you.\n"
"\n"
"I will do what I can to dig into the information that you've uncovered already... sparse though it may be."
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​跟​他​说​是​我​派​你​去​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​尽可能​深挖​一下​你们​已经​发现​的​信息​……​尽管​可能​挖不出​太多​内容​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。gen1 ta1 shuo1 shi4 wo3 pai4 ni3 qu4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin3ke3neng2 shen1wa1 yi1xia4 ni3men5 yi3jing1 fa1xian4 de5 xin4xi1……jin3guan3 ke3neng2 wa1 bu4 chu1 tai4 duo1 nei4rong2。"

msgid ""
"Very well. We'll do this one Eiger’s way.\n"
"\n"
"While I’m jacked in, $(l.name) is in charge."
msgstr ""
"好​啊​。​这次​就​按​艾格尔​说​的​办​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​接入​的​时候​，​小队​就​由​$(l.name)​来管​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 a1。zhe4 ci4 jiu4 an4 Ai4ge2er3 shuo1 de5 ban4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jie1ru4 de5 shi2hou5，xiao3 dui4 jiu4 you2 $(l.name) lai2 guan3。"

msgid ""
"Very well. We'll do this one Eiger’s way.\n"
"\n"
"While I’m jacked in, $(l.name) is in charge. "
msgstr ""
"好​啊​。​这次​就​按​艾格尔​说​的​办​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​接入​的​时候​，​小队​就​由​$(l.name)​来管​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 a1。zhe4 ci4 jiu4 an4 Ai4ge2er3 shuo1 de5 ban4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jie1ru4 de5 shi2hou5，xiao3 dui4 jiu4 you2 $(l.name) lai2 guan3。"

msgid "Very well. What do you wish to know?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​你​想​知道​什么​？\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Very well. Where to begin?"
msgstr ""
"好​的​。​我​想想​先​介绍​谁​呢​？\n"
"hao3 de5。wo3 xiang3 xiang3 xian1 jie4shao4 shei2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Very well... everything seems to be in order...\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Very nice."
msgstr ""
"好​……​看起来​没什么​问题​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3……kan4qi3lai5 mei2shen2me5 wen4ti2……\n"
"\n"
"en1。hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Very. I've called this place home since I retired from the service. It was a"
" sanctuary for me, for many years. Not sure if it can be again."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​自从​我​从​军中​退役​后​，​这里​就是​我​的​家​。​多年​来​，​这里​一直​是​我​的​避风港​。​就是​不​知道​以后​还​是不是​了​。\n"
"shi4 a1。zi4cong2 wo3 cong2 jun1 zhong4 tui4yi4 hou4，zhe4li3 jiu4shi4 wo3 de5 jia1。duo1nian2 lai2，zhe4li3 yi1zhi2 shi4 wo3 de5 bi4feng1gang3。jiu4shi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 yi3hou4 hai2 shi4bu5shi4 le5。"

msgid "Vice President"
msgstr ""
"副总裁\n"
"fu4zong3cai2"

msgid "Victory Industrious Coverall"
msgstr ""
"胜利​工作服\n"
"sheng4li4 gong1zuo4fu2"

msgid "Victory Rapid Transit Light Jumpsuit"
msgstr ""
"胜利​迅捷​行动​轻型​连体服\n"
"sheng4li4 xun4jie2 xing2dong4 qing1xing2 lian2 ti3 fu2"

msgid "Vindicator Minigun"
msgstr ""
"“​辩护人​”​转轮​机枪\n"
"“bian4hu4ren2” zhuan4lun2 ji1qiang1"

msgid "Vindicator Minigun Vehicle Mount"
msgstr ""
"“​辩护人​”​转轮​机枪​车载​支架\n"
"“bian4hu4ren2” zhuan4lun2 ji1qiang1 che1zai4 zhi1jia4"

msgid ""
"Violence makes me sick to my stomach. I've never broken into a building or stolen anything in my life.\n"
"\n"
"I guess that what I'm trying to say is that I'm not a criminal. I'm just an electrician."
msgstr ""
"暴力​让​我​感觉​反胃​。​我​这辈子​从来​没有​过​入室​抢劫​或者​偷过​任何​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​说​的​是​，​我​不是​职业​罪犯​。​我​只是​个​电工​。\n"
"\n"
"bao4li4 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2 fan3wei4。wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 cong2lai2 mei2you3 guo4 ru4 shi4 qiang3jie2 huo4zhe3 tou1 guo4 ren4he2 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 shi4，wo3 bu4shi4 zhi2ye4 zui4fan4。wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 dian4gong1。"

msgid ""
"Virally Induced Toxic Allergy Syndrome, or VITAS, is both extremely "
"infectious and highly lethal; two previous outbreaks of the disease (Strain "
"I in 2010 and Strain II in the early 2020s) killed billions, reducing the "
"world's population by over a quarter."
msgstr ""
"病毒性​毒素​过敏​综合症​具有​极强​的​传染性​和​致命性​；​此前​两次​疫情​爆发​（​2010​年​的​I​型​毒株​和​2020​年代​初​的​II​型​毒株​）​导致​数十亿​人​死亡​，​使​全球​人口​锐减​逾​四分之一​。\n"
"bing4du2xing4 du2su4 guo4min3 zong1he2zheng4 ju4you3 ji2 jiang4 de5 chuan2ran3xing4 he4 zhi4 ming4 xing4 ； ci3qian2 liang3 ci4 yi4qing2 bao4fa1 （2010 nian2 de5 I xing2 du2zhu1 he4 2020 nian2dai4 chu1 de5 II xing2 du2zhu1） dao3zhi4 shu4shi2yi4 ren2 si3wang2，shi3 quan2qiu2 ren2kou3 rui4jian3 yu2 si4fen1zhi1yi1。"

msgid "Virus venting... Infusion decelerated."
msgstr ""
"病毒​泄露​……​注入​速度​减慢​。\n"
"bing4du2 xie4lu4……zhu4ru4 su4du4 jian3man4。"

msgid "Vision Magnification Eyes"
msgstr ""
"视觉​放大​电子眼\n"
"shi4jue2 fang4da4 dian4zi3yan3"

msgid "Vision Magnification Eyes (Alpha)"
msgstr ""
"视觉​放大​电子眼​（​阿尔法​级​）\n"
"shi4jue2 fang4da4 dian4zi3yan3 （a1er3fa3 ji2）"

msgid "Vision Magnification Eyes (Basic)"
msgstr ""
"视觉​放大​电子眼​（​基础​）\n"
"shi4jue2 fang4da4 dian4zi3yan3 （ji1chu3）"

msgid "Visual recordings of testing the MKVI prototype."
msgstr ""
"MKVI​原型机​测试​的​视觉​记录​。\n"
"MKVI yuan2 xing2 ji1 ce4shi4 de5 shi4jue2 ji4lu4。"

msgid "Voice on Phone"
msgstr ""
"电话​里​的​声音\n"
"dian4hua4 li3 de5 sheng1yin1"

msgid "Voiceprint Analyzer"
msgstr ""
"声纹​分析仪\n"
"sheng1 wen2 fen4 xi1 yi2"

msgid "Volker Stahl"
msgstr ""
"沃尔克​·​斯塔尔\n"
"Wo4er3ke4 · Si1ta3er3"

msgid "Volklingen"
msgstr ""
"弗尔​克林根\n"
"fu2 er3 ke4 lin2 gen1"

msgid "Voltaic Grenade"
msgstr ""
"电流​手雷\n"
"dian4liu2 shou3lei2"

msgid ""
"Volumes of information begin to flit across the screen.\n"
"\n"
"A good half of what you're seeing has been redacted, and the rest is written in impossibly dense corp-speak."
msgstr ""
"屏幕​上​闪过​大量​信息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看到​的​内容​有​一大半​都​被​涂黑​了​，​剩下​的​部分​则​用​极其​晦涩​的​公司​行话​写成​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4 shan3guo4 da4liang4 xin4xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 de5 nei4rong2 you3 yi1 dai4 ban4 dou1 bei4 tu2 hei1 le5，sheng4xia4 de5 bu4fen5 ze2 yong4 ji2qi2 hui4se4 de5 gong1si1 hang2hua4 xie3 cheng2。"

msgid "Volunteer Worker"
msgstr ""
"义工\n"
"yi4gong1"

msgid "Vulnerable: All Incoming DMG +25"
msgstr ""
"脆弱​：​受到​的​所有​伤害​增加​25​点\n"
"cui4ruo4：shou4dao4 de5 suo3you3 shang1hai4 zeng1jia1 25 dian3"

msgid "Vulnerable: All Incoming DMG +50"
msgstr ""
"脆弱​：​受到​的​所有​伤害​增加​50​点\n"
"cui4ruo4：shou4dao4 de5 suo3you3 shang1hai4 zeng1jia1 50 dian3"

msgid "Vulnerable: All Incoming DMG +75"
msgstr ""
"脆弱​：​受到​的​所有​伤害​增加​75​点\n"
"cui4ruo4：shou4dao4 de5 suo3you3 shang1hai4 zeng1jia1 75 dian3"

msgid "WAIT AND SEE."
msgstr ""
"请​拭目以待​。\n"
"qing3 shi4mu4yi3dai4。"

msgid ""
"WARNING!\n"
"\n"
"This action will result in the venting of contaminants to exterior atmosphere.\n"
"\n"
"Level 5 Authorization Required."
msgstr ""
"警告​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这一​指令​将​向​外部环境​排出​污染物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​需要​权限​等级​5​。\n"
"\n"
"jing3gao4！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1 zhi3ling4 jiang1 xiang4 wai4 bu4 huan2 jing4 pai2chu1 wu1ran3wu4。\n"
"\n"
"xu1yao4 quan2xian4 deng3ji2 5。"

msgid ""
"WARNING! AUTHORIZED ACCESS ONLY.\n"
"\n"
"UNAUTHORIZED INDIVIDUALS WILL BE FIRED UPON."
msgstr ""
"警告​！​仅限​授权​人员​进入​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​未经​授权​者​将​被​视为​开火​目标​。\n"
"\n"
"jing3gao4！jin3 xian4 shou4quan2 ren2yuan2 jin4ru4。\n"
"\n"
"wei4jing1 shou4quan2 zhe3 jiang1 bei4 shi4wei2 kai1huo3 mu4biao1。"

msgid ""
"WARNING! Disengaging safety overrides while generators are in operation is NOT RECOMMENDED.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to proceed? Y/N"
msgstr ""
"警告​！​不​建议​在​发电机组​运行​期间​解除​安全​超控​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是否​继续​？​是​/​否\n"
"\n"
"jing3gao4！bu4 jian4yi4 zai4 fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 yun4xing2 qi1jian1 jie3chu2 an1quan2 chao1 kong4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4fou3 ji4xu4？shi4/fou3"

msgid ""
"WARNING! HIGHLY DANGEROUS CHEMICAL AGENT!\n"
"DO NOT TAKE INTERNALLY. AVOID CONTACT WITH SKIN, EYES, MOUTH & CLOTHING.\n"
"\n"
"INCREASES AGGRESSION AND REDUCES IMPULSE CONTROL WHEN INHALED. AVOID BREATHING FUMES OR VAPOR.\n"
"\n"
"IMPORTANT! DO NOT PROCEED UNLESS MATERIAL SAFETY DATA SHEET HAS BEEN READ AND UNDERSTOOD!"
msgstr ""
"警告​！​高危​化学品​！​\n"
"​切勿​内服​。​避免​与​皮肤​、​眼睛​、​口腔​及​衣物​接触​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​吸入​可​增加​攻击性​并​减少​冲动​控制能力​。​避免​呼吸​其​烟雾​或​蒸汽​。​\n"
"​\n"
