"xian3ran2，bu4jiu3qian2 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 chu1xian4 le5 yi1 zhi1 dui4wu3。mei2 ren2 zhi1dao4 ju4ti3 ri4qi1，dan4shi4……hai2you3 zhe4ge5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 zhao2 jing4tou2 zha3 le5 zha3yan3jing1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ju4shuo1 ta1men5“xiao1shi1 de2 wu2ying3wu2zong1”。"

msgid "Want me to beat the proof out of him?"
msgstr ""
"想​让​我​从​他​嘴里​撬出​证据​吗​？\n"
"xiang3 rang4 wo3 cong2 ta1 zui3li3 qiao4 chu1 zheng4ju4 ma5？"

msgid "Want me to deal with them for you?"
msgstr ""
"你​想​让​我​帮​你​解决​他们​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 bang1 ni3 jie3jue2 ta1men5？"

msgid "Want me to keep quiet? 100 nuyen."
msgstr ""
"想​让​我别​声张​？​100​新円​。\n"
"xiang3 rang4 wo3 bie4 sheng1zhang1？100 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid "Want me to teach him a lesson?"
msgstr ""
"要​我​给​他​上​一课​吗​？\n"
"yao4 wo3 gei3 ta1 shang4 yi1 ke4 ma5？"

msgid "Want to take him off my hands?"
msgstr ""
"想​从​我​这里​把​他​买​走​吗​？\n"
"xiang3 cong2 wo3 zhe4li3 ba3 ta1 mai3 zou3 ma5？"

msgid "War ain't so bad, for those who have a taste for it."
msgstr ""
"对于​爱好者​而言​，​战争​并​不是​什么​坏事​。\n"
"dui4yu2 ai4hao4zhe3 er2yan2，zhan4zheng1 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 huai4shi4。"

msgid "Warning Label"
msgstr ""
"警告​标签\n"
"jing3gao4 biao1qian1"

msgid "Warning!"
msgstr ""
"警告​！\n"
"jing3gao4！"

msgid ""
"Warning: Toxic Gas Detected\n"
"Laboratory Lockdown Engaged"
msgstr ""
"警告​：​检测​到​有毒气体​\n"
"​实验室​封锁​启动\n"
"jing3gao4：jian3ce4 dao4 you3 du2 qi4 ti3 \n"
"shi2yan4shi4 feng1suo3 qi3dong4"

msgid "Warning? About what?"
msgstr ""
"警告​？​警告​什么​？\n"
"jing3gao4？jing3gao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Warnings don't frighten me. Now come on, open up."
msgstr ""
"警告​也​吓不倒​我​。​行​了​，​开门​吧​。\n"
"jing3gao4 ye3 he4 bu4 dao3 wo3。xing2 le5，kai1men2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Was it? Then I am sorry. I didn't mean to offend.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I merely comment on what I see."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​那​我​表示​抱歉​。​我​无意​冒犯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​移开​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​在​叙说​自己​的​所见所闻​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？na4 wo3 biao3shi4 bao4qian4。wo3 wu2yi4 mao4fan4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi2kai1 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 xu4 shuo1 zi4ji3 de5 suo3jian4suo3wen2。"

msgid "Was that supposed to be a threat? If so, I'm not impressed."
msgstr ""
"你​这​是​在​吓唬人​吗​？​我​可​一点​都​没​觉得​害怕​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi4 zai4 he4 hu3 ren2 ma5？wo3 ke3 yi1dian3 dou1 mei2 jue2de5 hai4pa4。"

msgid "Was that supposed to be scary? Because I'm not impressed."
msgstr ""
"你​这​是​在​吓唬人​吗​？​我​可​一点​都​没​觉得​害怕​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi4 zai4 he4 hu3 ren2 ma5？wo3 ke3 yi1dian3 dou1 mei2 jue2de5 hai4pa4。"

msgid "Was that when the hotel got attacked?"
msgstr ""
"是​旅馆​被​袭击​的​时候​吗​？\n"
"shi4 lu:3guan3 bei4 xi2ji1 de5 shi2hou5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Was there a point to all this, $(l.name)? We lost Paul. Lost Monika. The "
"Kreuzbasar… so many people dead..."
msgstr ""
"这​一切​有​什么​意义​，​$(l.name)​？​我们​失去​了​保罗​。​失去​了​莫妮卡​。​还有​克洛伊​茨​集市​……​那么​多人​都​死去​了​……\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 you3 shen2me5 yi4yi4，$(l.name)？wo3men5 shi1qu4 le5 bao3luo2。shi1qu4 le5 Mo4ni1ka3。hai2you3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4……na4me5 duo1 ren2 dou1 si3qu4 le5……"

msgid "Was this decker named Monika, by any chance?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​这个​碟客​是不是​叫​莫妮卡​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 zhe4ge5 die2 ke4 shi4bu5shi4 jiao4 Mo4ni1ka3？"

msgid "Was... was someone with her, when it happened?"
msgstr ""
"这件​事​……​发生​的​时候​，​她​身边​还有​其他人​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4……fa1sheng1 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 shen1bian1 hai2you3 qi2 ta1 ren2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Wasn't as big a leap as you'd think. I already had a healthy disrespect for "
"authority, and I had the magic to back it up."
msgstr ""
"跨度​倒​也​没​你​想​的​那么​大​。​我​早年间​就​对​权威​嗤之以鼻​，​而​我​又​恰好​会​那么​几手​法术​。\n"
"kua4du4 dao3 ye3 mei2 ni3 xiang3 de5 na4me5 dai4。wo3 zao3 nian2 jian1 jiu4 dui4 quan2wei1 chi1zhi1yi3bi2，er2 wo3 you4 qia4hao3 hui4 na4me5 ji1 shou3 fa3shu4。"

msgid "Wasn't easy. Who are you?"
msgstr ""
"倒​也​没​那么​轻松​。​你​是​谁​？\n"
"dao3 ye3 mei2 na4me5 qing1song1。ni3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Wasn't much of a risk. Those drones were second-rate at best."
msgstr ""
"没冒​什么​险​。​那些​无人机​撑死​也​就是​些​二流​货​。\n"
"mei2 mao4 shen2me5 xian3。na4xie1 wu2ren2ji1 cheng1si3 ye3 jiu4shi4 xie1 er4liu2 huo4。"

msgid "Watch DVDs"
msgstr ""
"观看​DVD\n"
"guan1kan4 DVD"

msgid "Watch it. In case you hadn't noticed, I'm an elf, too."
msgstr ""
"说话​注意​点​。​没​看到​我​也​是​个​精灵​吗​。\n"
"shuo1hua4 zhu4yi4 dian3。mei2 kan4dao4 wo3 ye3 shi4 ge4 jing1ling2 ma5。"

msgid "Watch it. You're getting dangerously close to pissing me off."
msgstr ""
"说话​注意​点​。​你​快​把​我​惹​毛​了​。\n"
"shuo1hua4 zhu4yi4 dian3。ni3 kuai4 ba3 wo3 re3 mao2 le5。"

msgid "Watch who you're calling \"fragile.\""
msgstr ""
"你​说​谁​“​脆弱​”​呢​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 shei2“cui4ruo4” ni2？"

msgid ""
"Watch your step on the ladder there. Some of the steps get slippery when "
"it's cold."
msgstr ""
"爬​梯子​的​时候​小心​点​。​天气​冷​了​，​可能​会​很​滑​。\n"
"pa2 ti1zi5 de5 shi2hou5 xiao3xin1 dian3。tian1qi4 leng3 le5，ke3neng2 hui4 hen3 hua2。"

msgid "Watch your step."
msgstr ""
"小心​脚下​。\n"
"xiao3xin1 jiao3xia4。"

msgid "Watch your tone. I'm still your team leader - show some respect."
msgstr ""
"注意​言行​。​我​还是​你​的​队长​，​放​尊重​点​。\n"
"zhu4yi4 yan2xing2。wo3 hai2shi5 ni3 de5 dui4zhang3，fang4 zun1zhong4 dian3。"

msgid "Watcher IC"
msgstr ""
"观察者​IC\n"
"guan1cha2zhe3 IC"

msgid ""
"We *are* heroes, dandelion-eater. We're protecting our race when nobody else will.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He points at Dietrich.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Say goodbye to your race-traitor friend over there. When we bring the world around to *our* way of thinking, people like him will be the first up against the wall."
msgstr ""
"我们​*​就是​*​英雄​。​除了​我们​，​还有​谁​在​守护​自己​的​种族​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​指向​迪​特里​希​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​你​那​种族​叛徒​朋友​说​再见​吧​。​等​我们​把​世界​改造​成​*​我们​*​设想​的​模样​，​他​这种​人​将​会​第一个​被​清算​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5*jiu4shi4*ying1xiong2。chu2le5 wo3men5，hai2you3 shei2 zai4 shou3hu4 zi4ji3 de5 zhong3zu2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3xiang4 Di2te4li3xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 ni3 na4 zhong3zu2 pan4tu2 peng2you5 shuo1 zai4jian4 ba1。deng3 wo3men5 ba3 shi4jie4 gai3zao4 cheng2*wo3men5*she4xiang3 de5 mu2yang4，ta1 zhe4zhong3 ren2 jiang1 hui4 di4 yi1 ge4 bei4 qing1suan4。"

msgid ""
"We *are* heroes, dandelion-eater. We're protecting our race when nobody else will.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Stahl gives you a derisive sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't expect you to understand. When we bring the world around to *our* way of thinking, mongrels like you will be the first up against the wall."
msgstr ""
"我们​*​就是​*​英雄​，​素食​精​。​除了​我们​，​还有​谁​在​守护​自己​的​种族​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​斯塔尔​朝​你​投来​轻蔑​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​指望​你​能​理解​。​等​我们​把​世界​改造​成​*​我们​*​设想​的​模样​，​你​这种​人​将​会​第一个​被​清算​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5*jiu4shi4*ying1xiong2，su4shi2 jing1。chu2le5 wo3men5，hai2you3 shei2 zai4 shou3hu4 zi4ji3 de5 zhong3zu2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Si1ta3er3 chao2 ni3 tou2 lai2 qing1mie4 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi3wang4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3。deng3 wo3men5 ba3 shi4jie4 gai3zao4 cheng2*wo3men5*she4xiang3 de5 mu2yang4，ni3 zhe4zhong3 ren2 jiang1 hui4 di4 yi1 ge4 bei4 qing1suan4。"

