msgid ""
"We *join* together in the Communion! It makes us strong! It feeds us, nourishes us! We *belong* to it, and it belongs to us.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The cultist shakes his head violently from side to side.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*Nothing* must separate us!"
msgstr ""
"我们​共同​*​加入​*​共​融会​！​它​让​我们​强大​！​它​滋养​我们​，​哺育​我们​！​我们​*​属于​*​它​，​而​它​也​属于​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​邪教徒​疯狂​地​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么​都​*​不能​*​将​我们​分开​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gong4tong2*jia1ru4*gong4 rong2hui4！ta1 rang4 wo3men5 qiang2da4！ta1 zi1yang3 wo3men5，bu3yu4 wo3men5！wo3men5*shu3yu2*ta1，er2 ta1 ye3 shu3yu2 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xie2 jiao1 tu2 feng1kuang2 de5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shen2me5 dou1*bu4neng2*jiang1 wo3men5 fen1kai1！"

msgid ""
"We agree to stay out of each other's way. And maybe we find opportunities to"
" help each other out, in the future."
msgstr ""
"我们​同意​井水不犯河水​。​也许​将来​我们​还​能​有​机会​互帮互助​。\n"
"wo3men5 tong2yi4 jing3shui3bu4fan4he2shui3。ye3xu3 jiang1lai2 wo3men5 hai2 neng2 you3 ji1hui4 hu4 bang1 hu4 zhu4。"

msgid ""
"We ain't talkin' about a piece of merchandise here, boss. There's a living troll buried under all that chrome.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever you decide to do, you should keep that in mind."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​我们​谈论​的​并​不是​什么​货物​。​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​你​怎么​选​，​都​要​记住​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3men5 tan2lun4 de5 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 huo4wu4。pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 zen3me5 xuan3，dou1 yao4 ji4zhu5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "We all did our parts."
msgstr ""
"我们​都​是​各尽其​职​。\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 shi4 ge4 jin3 qi2 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"We all know that is not going to happen. You are sealed tight in that "
"laboratory, impotent to stop me."
msgstr ""
"我们​都​知道​这​根本​不​可能​。​你们​被​牢牢​封死​在​实验室​里​，​根本​无力​阻止​我​。\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 gen1ben3 bu4 ke3neng2。ni3men5 bei4 lao2lao2 feng1 si3 zai4 shi2yan4shi4 li3，gen1ben3 wu2li4 zu3zhi3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"We all make mistakes. What's important is how we handle them. Right, Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"每个​人​都​会​犯错​。​关键在于​如何​解决问题​。​是​吧​，​布里​茨​？\n"
"mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 hui4 fan4cuo4。guan1 jian4 zai4 yu2 ru2he2 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2。shi4 ba1，Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid "We all need to stand together. United, we are strong."
msgstr ""
"我们​所有人​都​该​待​在​一起​。​团结一致​，​我们​才能​变得​强大​。\n"
"wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 gai1 dai1 zai4 yi1qi3。tuan2jie2yi1zhi4，wo3men5 cai2neng2 bian4de5 qiang2da4。"

msgid ""
"We also found those financial projections, remember? The ones that showed a "
"massive increase in Grinder's future profits?"
msgstr ""
"我们​还​发现​了​那些​财报​预测​，​记得​吗​？​就是​那些​显示​“​绞肉机​”​的​未来​利润​将​大幅​增长​的​内容​？\n"
"wo3men5 hai2 fa1xian4 le5 na4xie1 cai2bao4 yu4ce4，ji4de5 ma5？jiu4shi4 na4xie1 xian3shi4“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 wei4lai2 li4run4 jiang1 da4fu2 zeng1zhang3 de5 nei4rong2？"

msgid "We appreciate it. (w)"
msgstr ""
"十分​感谢​。\n"
"shi2fen1 gan3xie4。"

msgid "We appreciate it. Come, my love. We've done enough work for today."
msgstr ""
"谢谢​。​来​吧​，​亲爱​的​。​我们​今天​该​歇歇​了​。\n"
"xie4xie5。lai2 ba1，qin1ai4 de5。wo3men5 jin1tian1 gai1 xie1 xie1 le5。"

msgid "We appreciate your help, Aleksi."
msgstr ""
"我们​感谢​你​的​帮助​，​阿莱克​西​。\n"
"wo3men5 gan3xie4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，e1 lai2 ke4 xi1。"

msgid "We are all one!"
msgstr ""
"我们​合而为一​！\n"
"wo3men5 he2er2wei2yi1！"

msgid ""
"We are here to fetch the money that your friend owes to Mr. Grinder.\n"
"\n"
"That means that we aren't here to dig through garbage pails or steal office supplies. So what you're doing right now could accurately be described as a waste of time."
msgstr ""
"我们​此行​是​为了​拿到​你​朋友​欠​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​我们​并非​来​翻​垃圾箱​或​偷窃​办公用品​。​所以​你​现在​所​做​的​事​，​准确​地说​就是​在​浪费时间​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ci3xing2 shi4 wei4le5 na2dao4 ni3 peng2you5 qian4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 bing4fei1 lai2 fan1 la1ji1xiang1 huo4 tou1qie4 ban4 gong1 yong4 pin3。suo3yi3 ni3 xian4zai4 suo3 zuo4 de5 shi4，zhun3que4 de5 shuo1 jiu4shi4 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"We are here to fetch the money that your friend owes to Mr. Grinder.\n"
"\n"
"That means that we aren't here to ransack desks or steal office supplies. So, what you're doing right now could accurately be described as a waste of time."
msgstr ""
"我们​此行​是​为了​拿到​你​朋友​欠​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​我们​并非​来​翻​书桌​或​偷窃​办公用品​。​所以​你​现在​所​做​的​事​，​准确​地说​就是​在​浪费时间​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ci3xing2 shi4 wei4le5 na2dao4 ni3 peng2you5 qian4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 bing4fei1 lai2 fan1 shu1zhuo1 huo4 tou1qie4 ban4 gong1 yong4 pin3。suo3yi3 ni3 xian4zai4 suo3 zuo4 de5 shi4，zhun3que4 de5 shuo1 jiu4shi4 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"We are joined tonight by a survivor of this latest - and most horrifying - attack.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The reporter turns to face a pale man standing behind him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sir, I understand that you've been through a terrible ordeal... thanks for taking the time to speak with us tonight."
msgstr ""
"今晚​我们​请​到​了​这次​最近​、​也​是​最​恐怖袭击​的​幸存者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​记者​转过身​，​面对​站​在​他​身后​的​一个​脸色苍白​的​人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​先生​，​我​知道​你​经历​了​一场​可怕​的​劫难​……​感谢​你​今晚​抽出​时间​接受​我们​的​采访​。\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 wo3men5 qing3 dao4 le5 zhe4 ci4 zui4jin4、ye3 shi4 zui4 kong3bu4xi2ji1 de5 xing4cun2zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ji4zhe3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，mian4dui4 zhan4 zai4 ta1 shen1hou4 de5 yi1ge5 lian3 se4 cang1 bai2 de5 ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian1sheng5，wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 jing1li4 le5 yi1 chang2 ke3pa4 de5 jie2nan4……gan3xie4 ni3 jin1wan3 chou1chu1 shi2jian1 jie1shou4 wo3men5 de5 cai3fang3。"

msgid ""
"We are looking at a natural - or, if you prefer, *paranatural* - catastrophe. Something has thrown off the balance between magic and reality.\n"
"\n"
"The magical background count of the world is rising, and as the Earth becomes more and more mana-rich, we're seeing increasingly devastating results."
msgstr ""
"我们​正​面临​一场​自然​，​或者说​是​*​超自然​*​灾难​。​某种​力量​打破​了​魔法​与​现实​之间​的​平衡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​世界​的​魔法​背景​数值​正在​上升​，​随着​地球​变得​越来越​富含​魔力​，​我们​目睹​的​后果​也​日益​毁灭性​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zheng1 mian4lin2 yi1 chang2 zi4ran2，huo4 zhe3 shuo1 shi4*chao1zi4ran2*zai1nan4。mou3zhong3 li4liang5 da3po4 le5 mo2fa3 yu4 xian4shi2 zhi1jian1 de5 ping2heng2。\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4 de5 mo2fa3 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 zheng4zai4 shang4sheng1，sui2zhe5 di4qiu2 bian4de5 yue4lai2yue4 fu4han2 mo2li4，wo3men5 mu4du3 de5 hou4guo3 ye3 ri4yi4 hui3mie4xing4。"

msgid ""
"We are looking at a natural - or, if you prefer, paranatural - catastrophe. Something has thrown off the balance between magic and reality.\n"
"\n"
"The magical background count of the world is rising, and as the Earth becomes more and more mana-rich, we're seeing increasingly devastating results."
msgstr ""
"我们​正​面临​一场​自然​，​或者说​是​超自然​灾难​。​某种​力量​打破​了​魔法​与​现实​之间​的​平衡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​世界​的​魔法​背景​数值​正在​上升​，​随着​地球​变得​越来越​富含​魔力​，​我们​目睹​的​后果​也​日益​毁灭性​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zheng1 mian4lin2 yi1 chang2 zi4ran2，huo4 zhe3 shuo1 shi4 chao1zi4ran2 zai1nan4。mou3zhong3 li4liang5 da3po4 le5 mo2fa3 yu4 xian4shi2 zhi1jian1 de5 ping2heng2。\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4 de5 mo2fa3 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 zheng4zai4 shang4sheng1，sui2zhe5 di4qiu2 bian4de5 yue4lai2yue4 fu4han2 mo2li4，wo3men5 mu4du3 de5 hou4guo3 ye3 ri4yi4 hui3mie4xing4。"

msgid ""
"We are no more than treasure to them. \n"
"\n"
"Favored baubles to be collected. Items to be traded. Resources to be spent.\n"
"\n"
"Or hoarded."
msgstr ""
"我们​对​他们​而言​不过​是​把玩​的​物件​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​值得​收藏​的​珍品​。​可​交易​的​物品​。​可​消耗​的​资源​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​，​是​用来​囤积​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dui4 ta1men5 er2yan2 bu4guo4 shi4 ba3wan2 de5 wu4jian4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi2de5 shou1cang2 de5 zhen1pin3。ke3 jiao1yi4 de5 wu4pin3。ke3 xiao1hao4 de5 zi1yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3，shi4 yong4lai2 tun2ji1。"

msgid ""
"We are not monsters, $(l.sir). We are people with an illness. Incurable for now, and yet some of us cling to hope.\n"
"\n"
"You may think of us as lepers, if you wish."
msgstr ""
"我们​不是​怪物​，​$(l.sir)​。​我们​只是​患病​的​人类​。​现在​暂时​还​无法​医治​，​但​我们​中​的​有些​人​仍​心存​希望​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​愿意​的话​，​可以​把​我们​当作​麻风病人​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4shi4 guai4wu5，$(l.sir)。wo3men5 zhi3shi4 huan4bing4 de5 ren2lei4。xian4zai4 zan4shi2 hai2 wu2fa3 yi1zhi4，dan4 wo3men5 zhong4 de5 you3xie1 ren2 reng2 xin1 cun2 xi1wang4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，ke3yi3 ba3 wo3men5 dang4zuo4 ma2 feng1 bing4 ren2。"

msgid ""
"We are not talking ethics here! \n"
"\n"
"We are talking... parallels. What I do will prevent a greater evil from taking place. "
msgstr ""
"我们​说​的​不是​道德​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​说​的​……​是​可能性​。​我​这样​做​是​为了​避免​更大​的​恶行​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shuo1 de5 bu4shi4 dao4de2！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shuo1 de5……shi4 ke3neng2xing4。wo3 zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 wei4le5 bi4mian3 geng1 dai4 de5 e4xing2 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"We are one through the Communion! Join us, and all will be one together!"
msgstr ""
"通过​共融​，​我们​合而为一​！​加入​我们​，​融为一体​！\n"
"tong1guo4 gong4 rong2，wo3men5 he2er2wei2yi1！jia1ru4 wo3men5，rong2wei2yi1ti3！"

msgid ""
"We are test subjects. Our purpose is to suffer and die.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice is utterly matter-of-fact. If any of this bothers him, he doesn't show it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In so doing, we provide useful research data. It is what we were made for."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​实验​对象​。​我们​的​使命​就是​承受​痛苦​，​随后​死亡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​语气​平淡​得​如同​陈述​事实​。​即便​内心​有所​波澜​，​他​也​毫无​表露​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​通过​这样​的​牺牲​，​我们​为​研究​提供​了​宝贵​数据​。​这​正是​我们​存在​的​意义​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 shi2yan4 dui4xiang4。wo3men5 de5 shi3ming4 jiu4shi4 cheng2shou4 tong4ku3，sui2hou4 si3wang2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 ping2dan4 de2 ru2tong2 chen2shu4 shi4shi2。ji2bian4 nei4xin1 you3suo3 bo1lan2，ta1 ye3 hao2wu2 biao3lu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tong1guo4 zhe4yang4 de5 xi1sheng1，wo3men5 wei2 yan2jiu1 ti2gong1 le5 bao3gui4 shu4ju4。zhe4 zheng4shi4 wo3men5 cun2zai4 de5 yi4yi4。"

msgid "We are. But you needed to learn a lesson in humility."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​朋友​。​但​你​同样​需要​学会​谦逊​。\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 peng2you5。dan4 ni3 tong2yang4 xu1yao4 xue2hui4 qian1xun4。"

msgid ""
"We aren't gonna solve this on our own. That was never the plan. But if you still need some closure on this, take another look at what's left of the Engineer.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She jerks her thumb in the direction of the ork's smoldering corpse.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He's dead and gone, and we're the reason why."
msgstr ""
"我们​无法​独自​解决​这个​问题​。​这​从来​就​不是​计划​的​一部分​。​但​如果​你​还​想​对此​有个​了结​，​不妨​再​看看​工程师​还​剩下​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​用​拇指​比划​了​一下​那具​冒​着​烟​的​兽​人​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​已经​死​了​，​而​这​都​是因为​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 wu2fa3 du2zi4 jie3jue2 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。zhe4 cong2lai2 jiu4 bu4shi4 ji4hua4 de5 yi1bu4fen5。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 xiang3 dui4 ci3 you3 ge4 liao3jie2，bu4fang2 zai4 kan4kan5 gong1cheng2shi1 hai2 sheng4xia4 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 mu3zhi3 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4 na4 ju4 mao4 zhao2 yan1 de5 shou4 ren2 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi3jing1 si3 le5，er2 zhe4 dou1 shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3men5。"

msgid "We ask the questions. You answer them."
msgstr ""
"我们​负责​问​问题​。​你​来​回答​。\n"
"wo3men5 fu4ze2 wen4 wen4ti2。ni3 lai2 hui2da2。"

msgid ""
"We asked Dr. Martin when Universal Omnitech's cure was expected to be ready for deployment. \n"
"\n"
"\"I can't give you a definite time line, but I can say that we'll be ready to move into human trials soon.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I'll keep you posted,\" she added."
msgstr ""
"我们​向​马丁​博士​询问​，​环球​全能​科技​的​解药​预计​何时能​投入使用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​我​无法​给出​确切​的​时间表​，​但​可以​肯定​的​是​，​我们​很快​就​能​进入​人体​试验​阶段​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​我会​随时​向​各位​通报​进展​，​”​她​补充​道​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xiang4 ma3ding1 bo2shi4 xun2wen4，huan2qiu2 quan2neng2 ke1ji4 de5 jie3yao4 yu4ji4 he2 shi2 neng2 tou2 ru4 shi3 yong4。\n"
"\n"
"“wo3 wu2fa3 gei3 chu1 que4qie4 de5 shi2jian1biao3，dan4 ke3yi3 ken3ding4 de5 shi4，wo3men5 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 neng2 jin4ru4 ren2ti3 shi4yan4 jie1duan4。” \n"
"\n"
"“wo3 hui4 sui2shi2 xiang4 ge4wei4 tong1bao4 jin4zhan3，” ta1 bu3chong1 dao4。"

msgid ""
"We came to find you, Vauclair. To help us stop Feuerschwinge. Except the "
"Firewing wasn't the one after us after all. It was you all along, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""
"我们​是​来​找​你​的​，​沃​克莱尔​。​我们​本想​让​你​帮忙​阻止​火翼​。​结果​没想到​的​是​，​一路​追杀​我们​的​并​不是​火翼​，​而​一直​都​是​你​，​没错​吧​？\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 lai2 zhao3 ni3 de5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。wo3men5 ben3 xiang3 rang4 ni3 bang1mang2 zu3zhi3 Huo3yi4。jie1guo3 mei2xiang3dao4 de5 shi4，yi1lu4 zhui1sha1 wo3men5 de5 bing4 bu4shi4 Huo3yi4，er2 yi1zhi2 dou1 shi4 ni3，mei2cuo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"We can fix the part - cobble you a new one, actually - but you'll need an "
"impulse transmitter."
msgstr ""
"我们​可以​修复​这个​零件​—​—​准确​来说​是​给​你​凑个​新​的​。​但​你​得​弄​个​脉冲​发射器​。\n"
"wo3men5 ke3yi3 xiu1fu4 zhe4ge5 ling2jian4——zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1 shi4 gei3 ni3 cou4 ge4 xin1 de5。dan4 ni3 de2 long4 ge4 mai4chong1 fa1she4qi4。"

msgid "We can handle it. Get ready, people."
msgstr ""
"我们​能​搞定​的​。​全体​都​有​，​做好​准备​。\n"
"wo3men5 neng2 gao3ding4 de5。quan2ti3 dou1 you3，zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。"

msgid "We can make it worth your while."
msgstr ""
"我们​可以​补偿​你​。\n"
"wo3men5 ke3yi3 bu3chang2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"We can talk about it later. For now, we should concentrate on getting out of"
" here."
msgstr ""
"这​事​我们​回头​再说​。​现在​先​专心​从​这里​出去​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 hui2tou2 zai4shuo1。xian4zai4 xian1 zhuan1xin1 cong2 zhe4li3 chu1qu4。"

msgid "We can talk about this later. For now, we need to bug out."
msgstr ""
"这​事​我们​待会​再​谈​。​现在​得​先​撤退​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 dai1hui5 zai4 tan2。xian4zai4 de2 xian1 che4tui4。"

msgid ""
"We can talk about this later. For now, we've gotta get the hell out of here. It's only a matter of time before more of them come pouring out of that exit.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger slaps the side of the van.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pile in, people. And $(l.name)... when we get back to the Kreuzbasar, we're gonna have a little talk."
msgstr ""
"这事待会​再说​。​现在​我们​得​赶紧​撤​。​用​不了​多久​，​就​会​有​更​多​敌人​从​出口​涌出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​一掌​拍​在​货车​的​侧门​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大家​赶紧​上车​。​还有​，​$(l.name)​……​等​回​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​我们​得​好好​谈谈​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 dai1 hui4 zai4shuo1。xian4zai4 wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 che4。yong4 bu4le5 duo1jiu3，jiu4 hui4 you3 geng1 duo1 di2ren2 cong2 chu1kou3 yong3 chu1 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yi1 zhang3 pai1 zai4 huo4che1 de5 ce4men2 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4jia1 gan3jin3 shang4che1。hai2you3，$(l.name)……deng3 hui2 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，wo3men5 de2 hao3hao3 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"We can talk about this later. We don't want to be here when those response "
"vehicles arrive."
msgstr ""
"这​事​我们​可以​回头​再聊​。​等​救援车辆​赶到​时​，​我们​最好​别待​在​这里​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 hui2tou2 zai4 liao2。deng3 jiu4 yuan2 che1 liang4 gan3dao4 shi2，wo3men5 zui4hao3 bie4 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"We can talk about this more later, Eiger. For now, we have more important "
"things to deal with."
msgstr ""
"有​意见​晚点​再说​，​艾格尔​。​眼下​有​更​重要​的​事要​处理​。\n"
"you3 yi4jian4 wan3dian3 zai4shuo1，Ai4ge2er3。yan3xia4 you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 chu3li3。"

msgid ""
"We can worry about him later. Is there a way that we can deal with the "
"spirit *without* hurting the cultists?"
msgstr ""
"我们​可以​之后​再​操心​他​的​事​。​有没有​一种​方法​，​能够​处理​掉​这个​神龛​，​同时​又​*​不会​*​伤害​到​教徒​呢​？\n"
"wo3men5 ke3yi3 zhi1hou4 zai4 cao1xin1 ta1 de5 shi4。you3mei2you3 yi1zhong3 fang1fa3，neng2gou4 chu3li3 diao4 zhe4ge5 shen2kan1，tong2shi2 you4*bu4hui4*shang1hai4 dao4 jiao4tu2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"We can worry about him later. Marta, calm down - nobody is dying here "
"tonight."
msgstr ""
"我们​可以​之后​再​操心​他​的​事​。​玛​尔塔​，​冷静​点​。​今晚​这里​没有​人会​死​。\n"
"wo3men5 ke3yi3 zhi1hou4 zai4 cao1xin1 ta1 de5 shi4。Ma3er3ta3，leng3jing4 dian3。jin1wan3 zhe4li3 mei2you3 ren2 hui4 si3。"

msgid "We can't all be runners."
msgstr ""
"不是​所有人​都​能​成为​狂奔​者​。\n"
"bu4shi4 suo3you3ren2 dou1 neng2 cheng2wei2 kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid ""
"We can't do that. Glory's right... there's no way around this.\n"
"\n"
"If Alice knows how we can kill this thing, we have to at least try."
msgstr ""
"那​不行​。​格洛丽​说得对​……​我们​没得选​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然​爱丽丝​知道​怎么​除掉​这​东西​，​我们​至少​该​试一试​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 bu4xing2。Ge2luo4li2 shuo1 de2 dui4……wo3men5 mei2 de2 xuan3。\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ai4li4si1 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 chu2diao4 zhe4 dong1xi1，wo3men5 zhi4shao3 gai1 shi4yi1shi4。"

msgid ""
"We can't go outside now! If we run outside with guards trailing behind us, "
"we'll get gunned down before we make it ten meters!"
msgstr ""
"现在​绝对​不能​出去​！​后面​都​是​守卫​，​要是​我们​冲出去​，​还​没​跑​出​十米​就​会​被​射杀​！\n"
"xian4zai4 jue2dui4 bu4neng2 chu1qu4！hou4mian5 dou1 shi4 shou3wei4，yao4shi5 wo3men5 chong1 chu1 qu4，hai2 mei2 pao2 chu1 shi2 mi3 jiu4 hui4 bei4 she4sha1！"

msgid ""
"We can't let Harrow get away, Marta. Not after what we've seen here tonight."
" We have to kill him."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​我们​不能​让​哈罗​逃走​。​今晚​我​目睹​的​一切​让​我​别无选择​。​我们​必须​除掉​他​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 ha1luo2 tao2zou3。jin1wan3 wo3 mu4du3 de5 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。wo3men5 bi4xu1 chu2diao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"We can't let Harrow get away. Not after what I've seen here tonight. We have"
" to kill him, Glory... this won't be over until he's dead."
msgstr ""
"我们​不能​让​哈罗​逃走​。​今晚​我​目睹​的​一切​让​我​别无选择​。​格洛丽​，​我们​必须​除掉​他​……​如果​他​不​死​的话​，​这件​事​就​不算​完​。\n"
"wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 ha1luo2 tao2zou3。jin1wan3 wo3 mu4du3 de5 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。Ge2luo4li2，wo3men5 bi4xu1 chu2diao4 ta1……ru2guo3 ta1 bu4 si3 de5hua4，zhe4 jian4 shi4 jiu4 bu4suan4 wan2。"

msgid ""
"We can't let Harrow get away. Not after what I've seen here tonight. We have"
" to kill him."
msgstr ""
"我们​不能​让​哈罗​逃走​。​今晚​我​目睹​的​一切​让​我​别无选择​。​我们​必须​除掉​他​。\n"
"wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 ha1luo2 tao2zou3。jin1wan3 wo3 mu4du3 de5 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。wo3men5 bi4xu1 chu2diao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"We can't risk confronting her in that room. If the situation turns ugly, any"
" one of those kids will happily eat a bullet for her, and that's not what I "
"came here to do."
msgstr ""
"我们​不能​冒险​在​那个​房间​里​跟​她​发生冲突​。​要是​情况​失控​，​那群​孩子​里​的​任何​一个​人​都​会​乐意​为​她​挡​子弹​，​这​可不是​我来​这里​的​目的​。\n"
"wo3men5 bu4neng2 mao4xian3 zai4 na4ge5 fang2jian1 li3 gen1 ta1 fa1 sheng1 chong1 tu1。yao4shi5 qing2kuang4 shi1kong4，na4 qun2 hai2zi5 li3 de5 ren4he2 yi1ge5 ren2 dou1 hui4 le4yi4 wei2 ta1 dang3 zi3dan4，zhe4 ke3bu5shi4 wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid ""
"We can't touch Harrow while the shrine is intact. If we try, he'll siphon enough power from it to slaughter us where we stand.\n"
"\n"
"But if we confront the shrine and kill the spirit, the astral backlash from its death will cripple him. All we'll have to do is finish him off."
msgstr ""
"只要​神龛​完好无损​，​我们​就​无法​触碰​哈罗​。​如果​贸然​行动​的话​，​他会​从​神龛​汲取​足够​的​能量​，​当场​杀死​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​我们​先​对付​神龛​，​把​那个​精魂​杀掉​的话​，​就​会​触发​星界​反噬​，​从而​削弱​哈罗​的​力量​。​之后​我们​再要​杀​他​就​易如反掌​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 shen2kan1 wan2hao3wu2sun3，wo3men5 jiu4 wu2fa3 chu4peng4 ha1luo2。ru2guo3 mao4ran2 xing2dong4 de5hua4，ta1 hui4 cong2 shen2kan1 ji2qu3 zu2gou4 de5 neng2liang4，dang1chang3 sha1si3 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 xian1 dui4fu5 shen2kan1，ba3 na4ge5 jing1hun2 sha1diao4 de5hua4，jiu4 hui4 chu4fa1 xing1 jie4 fan3shi4，cong2er2 xue1ruo4 ha1luo2 de5 li4liang5。zhi1hou4 wo3men5 zai4 yao4 sha1 ta1 jiu4 yi4ru2fan3zhang3 le5。"

msgid ""
"We can’t turn back now. If APEX is standing between us and Vauclair, then we"
" need to find a way to kill APEX."
msgstr ""
"我们​现在​回​不了​头​了​。​如果​APEX​挡​在​我们​和沃​克莱尔​之间​，​那​我们​就​必须​想​办法​除掉​APEX​。\n"
"wo3men5 xian4zai4 hui2 bu4le5 tou2 le5。ru2guo3 APEX dang3 zai4 wo3men5 he4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 zhi1jian1，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 bi4xu1 xiang3 ban4fa3 chu2diao4 APEX。"

msgid ""
"We come from very different places, $(l.name). But we both call this "
"Kreuzbasar home, and I hope that you will consider me a friend."
msgstr ""
"我们​来自​截然不同​的​地方​，​$(l.name)​。​但​我们​都​把​克洛伊​茨​集市​当作​家园​，​我​也​希望​你​能​把​我​当作​朋友​。\n"
"wo3men5 lai2zi4 jie2ran2bu4tong2 de5 di4fang1，$(l.name)。dan4 wo3men5 dou1 ba3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 dang4zuo4 jia1yuan2，wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 ba3 wo3 dang4zuo4 peng2you5。"

msgid "We could all use a little sun down here."
msgstr ""
"这里​所有人​都​需要​点​阳光​。\n"
"zhe4li3 suo3you3ren2 dou1 xu1yao4 dian3 yang2guang1。"

msgid "We could fly kites. I should ask the Mother Superior."
msgstr ""
"我们​应该​能​放风筝​。​我​得​问问​院长​嬷嬷​。\n"
"wo3men5 ying1gai1 neng2 fang4 feng1 zheng1。wo3 de2 wen4 wen4 yuan4zhang3 mo2mo5。"

msgid ""
"We could never leave this place. We are as married to it as we are to each "
"other."
msgstr ""
"我们​舍不得​离开​这​地方​。​我们​与​这片​土地​的​羁绊​，​如同​彼此​相守​的​誓言​。\n"
"wo3men5 she3bu5de5 li2kai1 zhe4 di4fang1。wo3men5 yu4 zhe4 pian1 tu3di4 de5 ji1ban4，ru2tong2 bi3ci3 xiang1 shou3 de5 shi4yan2。"

msgid "We couldn't agree more."
msgstr ""
"我们​再​同意​不过​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 tong2yi4 bu4guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"We did a good thing back there, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"You just can't see that from where you're standing."
msgstr ""
"我们​做​了​件​大好事​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只是​从​你​的​立场​上​还​没有​明白​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zuo4 le5 jian4 dai4 hao3 shi4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3shi4 cong2 ni3 de5 li4chang3 shang4 hai2 mei2you3 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "We did last time."
msgstr ""
"我们​上次​就​进去​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 shang4ci4 jiu4 jin4qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"We didn't see Marta again after she ran off. Do you think that she's okay?"
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​逃走​之后​，​我们​没​再​见到​她​。​你​觉得​她​现在​还好​吗​？\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 tao2zou3 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 mei2 zai4 jian4dao4 ta1。ni3 jue2de5 ta1 xian4zai4 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"We do appreciate your efforts around here. You seem to be adapting to the "
"F-State rather well."
msgstr ""
"我们​很​感谢​你​为​这里​付出​的​努力​。​你​似乎​很快​就​适应​了​动荡​带​的​生活​。\n"
"wo3men5 hen3 gan3xie4 ni3 wei2 zhe4li3 fu4chu1 de5 nu3li4。ni3 si4hu1 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 shi4ying4 le5 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 sheng1huo2。"

msgid ""
"We don't *need* you. We can take care of *ourselves.*\n"
"\n"
"Danni will be back any minute. You'll see."
msgstr ""
"我们​不​*​需要​*​你​。​我们​能​照顾​好​*​自己​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​丹妮​随时​都​会​回来​。​你​瞧​好​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4*xu1yao4*ni3。wo3men5 neng2 zhao4gu5 hao3*zi4ji3*。\n"
"\n"
"dan1 ni1 sui2shi2 dou1 hui4 hui2lai5。ni3 qiao2 hao3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We don't get many visitors down here, these days. \n"
"\n"
"And you'll forgive me for saying, but... well, you don't really look like the type that usually comes through here."
msgstr ""
"我们​这里​一般​没有​什么​人来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​恕我直言​……​你​看起来​不​像是​平常​会​走​这里​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4li3 yi1ban1 mei2you3 shen2me5 ren2 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 shu4 wo3 zhi2 yan2……ni3 kan4qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 shi4 ping2chang2 hui4 zou3 zhe4li3 de5 ren2。"

msgid "We don't have time for this, Eiger. We have a job to do."
msgstr ""
"没​时间​扯​这个​了​，​艾格尔​。​还有​活等​着​我们​干​。\n"
"mei2 shi2jian1 che3 zhe4ge5 le5，Ai4ge2er3。hai2you3 huo2 deng3 zhao2 wo3men5 gan4。"

msgid ""
"We don't know that for certain. That video feed could have been faked. I "
"wouldn't call APEX trustworthy."
msgstr ""
"我们​目前​还​不能​确定​。​刚才​的​视频​画面​可能​是​伪造​的​。​我​不​认为​APEX​值得​信任​。\n"
"wo3men5 mu4qian2 hai2 bu4neng2 que4ding4。gang1cai2 de5 shi4pin2 hua4mian4 ke3neng2 shi4 wei3zao4 de5。wo3 bu4 ren4wei2 APEX zhi2de5 xin4ren4。"

msgid "We don't know that it was racially motivated, my dear. (h)"
msgstr ""
"我们​不​知道​这​是否​和​种族​冲突​有关​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"wo3men5 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4fou3 he4 zhong3zu2 chong1tu1 you3guan1，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"We don’t *need* rules and regulations to guide us. The same principles that "
"apply to the Flux State..."
msgstr ""
"我们​*​用不着​*​规矩​来教​我们​做事​。​动荡​带​也​是​同样​的​道理​……\n"
"wo3men5*yong4bu5zhao2*gui1ju5 lai2 jiao1 wo3men5 zuo4shi4。dong4dang4 dai4 ye3 shi4 tong2yang4 de5 dao4li5……"

msgid ""
"We don’t, per se. But Frau Müller *did* tell me what she’s offering for the work.\n"
"\n"
"Thirty-six thousand nuyen."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​不​知道​。​但​穆勒​女士​*​有​*​告诉​我​说​她​愿意​为​这项​工作​支付​多少​报酬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​三万​六千​新円​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 bu4 zhi1dao4。dan4 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4*you3*gao4su4 wo3 shuo1 ta1 yuan4yi4 wei2 zhe4 xiang4 gong1zuo4 zhi1fu4 duo1shao3 bao4chou5。\n"
"\n"
"san1 wan4 liu4 qian1 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid "We drop everything and head straight to the Rabbit Hole."
msgstr ""
"我们​放下​手头​的​一切​，​直奔​兔子​洞​。\n"
"wo3men5 fang4xia4 shou3tou2 de5 yi1qie4，zhi2ben4 tu4zi5 dong4。"

msgid ""
"We even dropped that pig Stahl. The perfect end to a perfect run.\n"
"\n"
"Again, boss - great work."
msgstr ""
"我们​甚至​还​干掉​了​斯塔尔​那个​狗​杂种​。​简直​是​完美​行动​的​完美​收尾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​我​得​再说​一次​。​干得​漂亮​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shen4zhi4 hai2 gan4diao4 le5 Si1ta3er3 na4ge5 gou3 za2zhong3。jian3zhi2 shi4 wan2mei3 xing2dong4 de5 wan2mei3 shou1wei3。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 de2 zai4shuo1 yi1ci4。gan4 de2 piao4liang5。"

msgid "We finished what Monika started, in more ways than one."
msgstr ""
"我们​完成​了​莫妮卡​的​遗志​，​从​各​方面​而言​都​是​如此​。\n"
"wo3men5 wan2cheng2 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yi2zhi4，cong2 ge4 fang1mian4 er2yan2 dou1 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"We found her alive, in a way.\n"
"\n"
"The dragon’s astral form - her spirit, you might say - had been ripped from her body by the weapon."
msgstr ""
"我们​发现​她​在​某种程度​上​确实​仍​活着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​的​灵体​受到​武器​轰击​后​被​扯​离​了​自身​的​肉体​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 fa1xian4 ta1 zai4 mou3 zhong3 cheng2 du4 shang4 que4shi2 reng2 huo2zhe5。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 de5 ling2ti3 shou4dao4 wu3qi4 hong1ji1 hou4 bei4 che3 li2 le5 zi4shen1 de5 rou4ti3。"

msgid ""
"We found out about you from your brother, Vauclair. He was trying to find "
"you. Right up to the end."
msgstr ""
"是​你​弟弟​把​你​的​事情​告诉​我们​的​，​沃​克莱尔​。​他​到​最后​都​一直​想要​找到​你​。\n"
"shi4 ni3 di4di5 ba3 ni3 de5 shi4qing5 gao4su4 wo3men5 de5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ta1 dao4 zui4hou4 dou1 yi1zhi2 xiang3yao4 zhao3dao4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"We found some evidence to suggest that it was the Lobatchevski Syndicate, "
"but nothing concrete. That worries me."
msgstr ""
"我们​发现​了​一些​证据​表明​是​洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​所​为​，​但​没有​确凿​的​证据​。​这​让​我​很​担心​。\n"
"wo3men5 fa1xian4 le5 yi1xie1 zheng4ju4 biao3ming2 shi4 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2 suo3 wei2，dan4 mei2you3 que4zao2 de5 zheng4ju4。zhe4 rang4 wo3 hen3 dan1xin1。"

msgid ""
"We go in prepared for an extended search, then. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger looks down, checking her gear.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ammo won't be a problem."
msgstr ""
"那么​我们​就​做好​准备​进行​长时间​的​搜索​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​低头​检查​装备​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​弹药​不成问题​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5 wo3men5 jiu4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4 jin4xing2 zhang3 shi2 jian1 de5 sou1suo3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 di1tou2 jian3cha2 zhuang1bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4yao4 bu4 cheng2 wen4 ti2。"

msgid ""
"We had a decent following in England, and we holed up in London from '31 to "
"'36. Spent most of our time slummin' it around the East End, and picked up "
"enough Cockney to irritate the folks back home."
msgstr ""
"我们​在​英格兰​颇​有​号召力​，​2031​至​2036​年​一直​待​在​在​伦敦​，​大部分​时间​都​在​东区​贫民窟​混迹​。​等​我们​回来​的​时候​，​一​张嘴​都​是​恼人​的​伦敦​腔​。\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 ying1ge2lan2 po1 you3 hao4zhao4li4，2031 zhi4 2036 nian2 yi1zhi2 dai1 zai4 zai4 lun2dun1，da4bu4fen5 shi2jian1 dou1 zai4 dong1qu1 pin2min2ku1 hun4ji4。deng3 wo3men5 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5，yi1 zhang1zui3 dou1 shi4 nao3ren2 de5 lun2dun1 qiang1。"

msgid ""
"We had a hellhound in the house, and Monika didn’t tell us? For MONTHS?"
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​居然​瞒​着​我们​偷偷​养​了​条​地狱​猎犬​？​而且​还养​了​好几个​月​？\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 ju1ran2 man2 zhao2 wo3men5 tou1tou1 yang3 le5 tiao2 di4yu4 lie4quan3？er2qie3 hai2 yang3 le5 hao3 ji1 ge4 yue4？"

msgid ""
"We had grown friendly with many of them. It was sad to see them go, "
"especially when so few of them returned."
msgstr ""
"我们​和​其中​许多​人​都​建立​了​深厚​的​友谊​。​目送​他们​离开​无疑​是​件​难过​的​事​，​尤其​他们​之中​还​鲜少​有人​归来​。\n"
"wo3men5 he4 qi2zhong1 xu3duo1 ren2 dou1 jian4li4 le5 shen1hou4 de5 you3yi4。mu4song4 ta1men5 li2kai1 wu2yi2 shi4 jian4 nan2guo4 de5 shi4，you2qi2 ta1men5 zhi1zhong1 hai2 xian3shao3 you3ren2 gui1lai2。"

msgid ""
"We had just moved back a few years prior. Karin and I met in the UCAS. Got "
"married there. But I had always promised to bring her home to Berlin "
"someday."
msgstr ""
"当时​我们​才刚​搬回来​没​几年​。​我​和​卡琳​是​在​加美​合众国​相遇​的​，​也​是​在​那里​结​的​婚​。​但​我​一直​承诺​，​总有一天​要​带​她​回​柏林​老家​。\n"
"dang1shi2 wo3men5 cai2 gang1 ban1 hui2 lai2 mei2 ji3nian2。wo3 he4 ka3 lin2 shi4 zai4 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 xiang1yu4 de5，ye3 shi4 zai4 na4li5 jie1 de5 hun1。dan4 wo3 yi1zhi2 cheng2nuo4，zong3 you3 yi1 tian1 yao4 dai4 ta1 hui2 bo2lin2 lao3jia1。"

msgid "We have mutual friends. They have a message for you."
msgstr ""
"我们​有​共同​的​朋友​。​他们​想​给​你​传个​话​。\n"
"wo3men5 you3 gong4tong2 de5 peng2you5。ta1men5 xiang3 gei3 ni3 chuan2 ge4 hua4。"

msgid ""
"We have no money. But he does not care.\n"
"\n"
"He tells us that we must find some, or that he will let us starve."
msgstr ""
"我们​没有​钱​，​但​他​对此​毫不关心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​要求​我们​必须​给​他​交钱​，​否则​他​就要​让​我们​活活​饿死​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 mei2you3 qian2，dan4 ta1 dui4 ci3 hao2 bu4 guan1 xin1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yao1qiu2 wo3men5 bi4xu1 gei3 ta1 jiao1qian2，fou3ze2 ta1 jiu4yao4 rang4 wo3men5 huo2huo2 e4si3。"

msgid ""
"We have only one thing to inform you of. You may do whatever you wish with "
"this information."
msgstr ""
"我们​只有​一件​事要​告知​你​。​你​可以​随心所欲​地​对待​这​条​信息​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 yao4 gao4zhi1 ni3。ni3 ke3yi3 sui2xin1suo3yu4 de5 dui4dai4 zhe4 tiao2 xin4xi1。"

msgid ""
"We have phone booths in strategic locations throughout the city. Within each one you may find a request posted for specific information. \n"
"\n"
"If you can obtain a copy of this information, return here and submit it via the port below the receiver. We will verify the authenticity of the information remotely, and post an undoctored copy of it onto the Matrix ourselves."
msgstr ""
"我们​在​城市​的​各个​战略​位置​均​设有​电话亭​，​其中​可能​张贴​着​特定​信息​的​征集​启事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​你​能​获取​对应​信息​，​请​返回​此处​通过​听筒​下方​的​端口​提交​。​我们​将​远程​验证​信息​真实性​，​并​亲自​将​未经​篡改​的​副本​发布​至​矩阵​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 cheng2shi4 de5 ge4ge4 zhan4lu:e4 wei4zhi5 jun1 she4you3 dian4hua4ting2，qi2zhong1 ke3neng2 zhang1tie1 zhao2 te4ding4 xin4xi1 de5 zheng1ji2 qi3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 ni3 neng2 huo4qu3 dui4ying4 xin4xi1，qing3 fan3hui2 ci3chu4 tong1guo4 ting1tong3 xia4fang1 de5 duan1kou3 ti2jiao1。wo3men5 jiang1 yuan3cheng2 yan4zheng4 xin4xi1 zhen1shi2xing4，bing4 qin1zi4 jiang1 wei4jing1 cuan4gai3 de5 fu4ben3 fa1bu4 zhi4 ju3zhen4。"

msgid ""
"We have weapons from all across Europe... Ares, Ceska, Fichetti, you name "
"it. If it can be found on the continent, it can be acquired by Mettbach "
"Arms."
msgstr ""
"我们​有​来自​欧洲​各地​的​武器​……​阿瑞斯​、​CZ​、​菲切​蒂​，​应有尽有​。​只要​在​欧洲​大陆​能​找到​的​，​梅特​巴赫​军火​店​都​能​买​到​。\n"
"wo3men5 you3 lai2zi4 ou1zhou1 ge4di4 de5 wu3qi4……a1rui4si1、CZ、fei1 qie1 di4，ying1you3jin4you3。zhi3yao4 zai4 ou1zhou1 da4lu4 neng2 zhao3dao4 de5，mei2 te4 ba1he4 jun1huo3 dian4 dou1 neng2 mai3 dao4。"

msgid ""
"We hit Humanis hard, we stopped 'em in their tracks, and we got my nephew "
"out of there. Fuckin' *great* work in there, boss."
msgstr ""
"我们​狠狠​教训​了​人类​至上​主义者​，​把​他们​打​得​落花流水​，​还​把​我​侄子​救​了​出来​。​干得​真他妈​*​漂亮​*​，​老大​。\n"
"wo3men5 hen3hen3 jiao4xun5 le5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3，ba3 ta1men5 da3 de2 luo4hua1liu2shui3，hai2 ba3 wo3 zhi2zi5 jiu4 le5 chu1lai2。gan4 de2 zhen1 ta1 ma1*piao4liang5*，lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"We hit the estate, find Vauclair, and extract whatever information we can. "
"Improvise from there."
msgstr ""
"我们​闯进​庄园​，​找到​沃​克莱尔​，​然后​拿到​我们​需要​的​情报​。​之后​的​部分​就​随机应变​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 chuang3jin4 zhuang1yuan2，zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3，ran2hou4 na2dao4 wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5 qing2bao4。zhi1hou4 de5 bu4fen5 jiu4 sui2ji1ying4bian4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We hit them by surprise, and we hit them hard. \n"
"\n"
"Fischer and Braun managed to take down the Banshee that they had patrolling the site. Wolff had reconnaissance drones overhead providing BattleTac feeds to the rest of us, and we picked off their gunmen one by one."
msgstr ""
"我们​出其不意​地向​对方​发动​了​猛烈​进攻​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​费舍尔​和​布朗​设法​干掉​了​他们​巡逻​的​报丧​女妖​。​沃尔夫​派出​无人机​在​空中​侦查​，​为​其他人​提供​战术情报​，​我们​则​趁机​逐个​消灭​了​他们​的​枪手​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 chu1qi2bu4yi4 de5 xiang4 dui4fang1 fa1dong4 le5 meng3lie4 jin4gong1。\n"
"\n"
"fei4she3er3 he4 bu4lang3 she4fa3 gan4diao4 le5 ta1men5 xun2luo2 de5 bao4sang1 nu:3 yao1。wo4er3fu1 pai4chu1 wu2ren2ji1 zai4 kong1zhong1 zhen1cha2，wei2 qi2 ta1 ren2 ti2gong1 zhan4 shu4 qing2 bao4，wo3men5 ze2 chen4ji1 zhu2ge4 xiao1mie4 le5 ta1men5 de5 qiang1shou3。"

msgid ""
"We just leveled a Aztechnology facility, Blitz. \"Intense\" barely begins to"
" cover it."
msgstr ""
"我们​刚刚​夷平​了​一座​阿兹特​科技​设施​，​布里​茨​。​“​激烈​”​都​算是​轻描淡写​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 gang1gang5 yi2ping2 le5 yi1 zuo4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1，Bu4li3ci2。“ji1lie4” dou1 suan4shi4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 le5。"

msgid "We just released a Great Dragon. An *insane* Great Dragon."
msgstr ""
"我们​刚刚​释放​了​一头​巨龙​。​*​发疯​*​的​巨龙​。\n"
"wo3men5 gang1gang5 shi4fang4 le5 yi1tou2 ju4long2。*fa1feng1*de5 ju4long2。"

msgid "We just saved your life. You owe us."
msgstr ""
"我们​刚刚​救​了​你​的​命​。​你​欠​我们​的​。\n"
"wo3men5 gang1gang5 jiu4 le5 ni3 de5 ming4。ni3 qian4 wo3men5 de5。"

msgid ""
"We just want to have a word with Marta. A *private* word between old friends.\n"
"\n"
"Understand?"
msgstr ""
"我们​只是​想​和​玛​尔塔​聊上​几句​。​这是​老朋友​之间​的​*​私下​*​谈话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​明白​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3shi4 xiang3 he4 Ma3er3ta3 liao2 shang4 ji1 ju4。zhe4 shi4 lao3peng2you5 zhi1jian1 de5*si1xia4*tan2hua4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ming2bai5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"We kept our heads down, worked our jobs, and waited for the day order would "
"be restored."
msgstr ""
"我们​只好​埋头苦干​，​做好​本职工作​，​等待​秩序​恢复​的​那​一天​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3hao3 mai2tou2ku3gan4，zuo4 hao3 ben3 zhi2 gong1 zuo4，deng3dai4 zhi4xu4 hui1fu4 de5 na4 yi1 tian1。"

msgid ""
"We kill Harrow, yeah. But I think that we should try to save the cultists "
"here, too."
msgstr ""
"我们​当然​要​杀​了​哈罗​。​但​我​觉得​我们​也​应该​试着​去​救出​那些​教徒​。\n"
"wo3men5 dang1ran2 yao4 sha1 le5 ha1luo2。dan4 wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 ye3 ying1gai1 shi4zhe5 qu4 jiu4chu1 na4xie1 jiao4tu2。"

msgid ""
"We killed Harrow, but we didn't manage to save any of the cultists - not a "
"single one of them. We didn't even try."
msgstr ""
"我们​杀​了​哈罗​，​但​我们​没能​救下​任何​邪教徒​—​—​一个​都​没有​。​我们​甚至​根本​没​尝试​过​。\n"
"wo3men5 sha1 le5 ha1luo2，dan4 wo3men5 mei2 neng2 jiu4 xia4 ren4he2 xie2 jiao1 tu2——yi1ge5 dou1 mei2you3。wo3men5 shen4zhi4 gen1ben3 mei2 chang2shi4 guo4。"

msgid ""
"We know what killed Monika. We have a name for it, an' we know how to kill it.\n"
"\n"
"That's good enough for me."
msgstr ""
"现在​我们​知道​是​什么​杀​了​莫妮卡​。​我们​知道​它​的​名字​，​还​知道​怎么​杀​了​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​我​来说​这​就​足够​了​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 zhi1dao4 shi4 shen2me5 sha1 le5 Mo4ni1ka3。wo3men5 zhi1dao4 ta1 de5 ming2zi5，hai2 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 sha1 le5 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 zhe4 jiu4 zu2gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"We know what we have to do.\n"
"\n"
"We can either stand around talking about it, or we can go do it."
msgstr ""
"我们​知道​自己​要​做​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​可以​继续​傻站​在​这​聊天​，​也​可以​立刻​动手​去​做​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ke3yi3 ji4xu4 sha3 zhan4 zai4 zhe4 liao2tian1，ye3 ke3yi3 li4ke4 dong4shou3 qu4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"We know, we know. You have a meeting.\n"
"\n"
"I can get us into Aleshire's apartment, but there are a few things that we'll need to do first."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​我们​知道​，​你​要​赶着​去​开会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​能带​我们​进入​阿利​希尔​的​公寓​，​但​有些​事​我们​需要​提前准备​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，wo3men5 zhi1dao4，ni3 yao4 gan3 zhao2 qu4 kai1hui4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 dai4 wo3men5 jin4ru4 e1 li4 xi1er3 de5 gong1yu4，dan4 you3xie1 shi4 wo3men5 xu1yao4 ti2 qian2 zhun3 bei4。"

msgid "We know. And we'll be all right, won't we, my love?"
msgstr ""
"我们​知道​。​我们​会​没事​的​。​是​吧​，​亲爱​的​？\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1dao4。wo3men5 hui4 mei2shi4 de5。shi4 ba1，qin1ai4 de5？"

msgid ""
"We left off in a bad place last time. I've been thinking about your story, "
"and I have a question for you."
msgstr ""
"上次​我们​结束​得​不​太​愉快​。​我​一直​在​思考​你​的​故事​，​现在​有个​问题​想​问​你​。\n"
"shang4ci4 wo3men5 jie2shu4 de2 bu4 tai4 yu2kuai4。wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 si1kao3 ni3 de5 gu4shi4，xian4zai4 you3 ge4 wen4ti2 xiang3 wen4 ni3。"

msgid "We lost her."
msgstr ""
"我们​失去​她​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 shi1qu4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"We lost him. Alexander... he's dead.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stares at his gnarled hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can't believe it. I... I failed him, boss."
msgstr ""
"我们​没能​救下​他​。​亚历山大​……​他​死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​盯​着​自己​粗糙​的​手掌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​简直​不敢相信​这是​真的​。​我​……​我​辜负​了​他​，​老大​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 mei2 neng2 jiu4 xia4 ta1。ya4li4shan1da4……ta1 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 zi4ji3 cu1cao1 de5 shou3zhang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian3zhi2 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 zhe4 shi4 zhen1de5。wo3……wo3 gu1fu4 le5 ta1，lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"We make our way across the grounds to the servants' entrance, taking down any security troops that threaten us along the way.\n"
"\n"
"Once we make it there, we'll take the freight elevator down to the lab."
msgstr ""
"我们​穿过​庭院​，​前往​仆人​入口​，​途中​清除​任何​威胁​我们​的​安保​人员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抵达​那里​之后​，​我们​将​乘坐​货梯​前往​实验室​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 chuan1guo4 ting2yuan4，qian2wang3 pu2ren2 ru4kou3，tu2zhong1 qing1chu2 ren4he2 wei1xie2 wo3men5 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"di3da2 na4li5 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 jiang1 cheng2zuo4 huo4ti1 qian2wang3 shi2yan4shi4。"

msgid ""
"We make our way inside and take out the shrine that Harrow uses as his power focus.\n"
"\n"
"We can't touch him while that thing is standing, but after we bring it down, he'll be vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​想​办法​进去​，​然后​摧毁​那个​被​哈罗​当做​法器​的​神龛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​那​东西​还​在​的话​，​我们​连碰​都​碰​不到​他​。​但​等​我们​毁掉​它​之后​，​他​就​会​变得​十分​脆弱​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 xiang3 ban4fa3 jin4qu4，ran2hou4 cui1hui3 na4ge5 bei4 ha1luo2 dang4zuo4 fa3 qi4 de5 shen2kan1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 na4 dong1xi1 hai2 zai4 de5hua4，wo3men5 lian2 peng4 dou1 peng4 bu4dao4 ta1。dan4 deng3 wo3men5 hui3diao4 ta1 zhi1hou4，ta1 jiu4 hui4 bian4de5 shi2fen1 cui4ruo4。"

msgid ""
"We managed to slip away and evade capture. It was no easy feat, $(l.name), but we did it.\n"
"\n"
"All the while, Hoffmann was apologizing for what he'd done. He knew how badly he'd screwed up."
msgstr ""
"我们​设法​溜走​了​，​躲过​了​追捕​。​这​绝非易事​，​$(l.name)​，​但​我们​做到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​整个​过程​中​，​霍夫曼​一直​在​为​自己​的​所作所为​道歉​。​他​深知​自己​搞砸​到​了​什么​程度​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 she4fa3 liu1zou3 le5，duo3 guo4 le5 zhui1bu3。zhe4 jue2 fei1 yi4 shi4，$(l.name)，dan4 wo3men5 zuo4dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zheng3ge4 guo4cheng2 zhong4，huo4fu1man4 yi1zhi2 zai4 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2 dao4qian4。ta1 shen1zhi1 zi4ji3 gao3za2 dao4 le5 shen2me5 cheng2du4。"

msgid ""
"We must act before that happens. But before we venture back to the Harfeld "
"Manor, we need to find Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"我们​必须​在​他们​成功​之前​采取行动​。​但​在​重返​哈​菲尔德​庄园​之前​，​我们​要​先​找到​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 zai4 ta1men5 cheng2gong1 zhi1qian2 cai3qu3xing2dong4。dan4 zai4 chong2fan3 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 zhi1qian2，wo3men5 yao4 xian1 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid "We need backup in the main lab, now!"
msgstr ""
"主​实验室​即刻​需要​支援​！\n"
"zhu3 shi2yan4shi4 ji2ke4 xu1yao4 zhi1yuan2！"

msgid ""
"We need my contact's resources more than we need Herr Schmidt to like us. "
"We're going to take the offer."
msgstr ""
"我​更​想要​结社​能​提供​的​资源​，​而​不是​施密特​先生​的​笑脸​。​我们​接受​提议​吧​。\n"
"wo3 geng1 xiang3yao4 jie2she4 neng2 ti2gong1 de5 zi1yuan2，er2 bu4shi4 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 de5 xiao4lian3。wo3men5 jie1shou4 ti2yi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We need some answers, and we need to get paid. I'm gonna go have a talk with"
" them."
msgstr ""
"我们​需要​答复​，​也​需要​拿到​报酬​。​我​去​和​他们​谈谈​。\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 da2fu4，ye3 xu1yao4 na2dao4 bao4chou5。wo3 qu4 he4 ta1men5 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"We need that juice, Heimer. Our solar collectors are *garbage.*\n"
"\n"
"If we can't keep the lights on after a few days of cloud cover, how do you think we're going to survive the winter?"
msgstr ""
"我们​需要​那些​电力​，​海默​。​我们​的​太阳能​板​就是​*​垃圾​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​连续​几天​阴云密布​都​无法​维持​供电​的话​，​你​觉得​我们​要​怎么​熬过​冬天​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 na4xie1 dian4li4，Hai3mo4。wo3men5 de5 tai4yang2neng2 ban3 jiu4shi4*la1ji1*。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 lian2xu4 ji3tian1 yin1 yun2 mi4 bu4 dou1 wu2fa3 wei2chi2 gong1dian4 de5hua4，ni3 jue2de5 wo3men5 yao4 zen3me5 ao1 guo4 dong1tian1？"

msgid ""
"We need to continue forward with our plan to hit the Harfeld Manor. Taking down the Firewing - and her lapdog - is the only way to guarantee that these attacks will cease.\n"
"\n"
"But before we do that, it is imperative that we find Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"我们​必须​继续​推进​突袭​哈​菲尔德​庄园​的​计划​。​唯有​除掉​火翼​以及​她​的​走狗​，​才能​确保​对​你​的​袭击​彻底​停止​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​在​那​之前​，​当务之急​是​找到​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 ji4xu4 tui1jin4 tu1xi2 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 de5 ji4hua4。wei2you3 chu2diao4 Huo3yi4 yi3ji2 ta1 de5 zou3gou3，cai2neng2 que4bao3 dui4 ni3 de5 xi2ji1 che4di3 ting2zhi3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zai4 na4 zhi1qian2，dang1wu4zhi1ji2 shi4 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"We need to find Vauclair, and we need to do it fast.\n"
"\n"
"All the more reason to gather Alice's fee as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""
"我们​必须​找到​沃​克莱尔​，​而且​要​快​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​更​有​理由​尽快​筹集​爱丽丝​要求​的​酬金​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3，er2qie3 yao4 kuai4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 geng1 you3 li3you2 jin3kuai4 chou2ji2 ai4li4si1 yao1qiu2 de5 chou2jin1 le5。"

msgid "We need to get downstairs. Into the basement."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​下楼​，​去​地下室​。\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 xia4lou2，qu4 di4xia4shi4。"

msgid "We need to keep moving! *GO!*"
msgstr ""
"我们​得​继续前进​！​快​走​！\n"
"wo3men5 de2 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4！kuai4 zou3！"

msgid "We need to kill it, $(l.name). You must be able to see that."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​杀​了​它​，​$(l.name)​。​你​一定​也​明白​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 sha1 le5 ta1，$(l.name)。ni3 yi1ding4 ye3 ming2bai5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We need to kill this thing, chief. We can't trust it, and it's too dangerous"
" to let live."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​杀​了​这​东西​，​头儿​。​它​不​值得​信任​，​而且​太过​危险​。​绝不能​让​它​活下去​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 sha1 le5 zhe4 dong1xi1，tou2r5。ta1 bu4 zhi2de5 xin4ren4，er2qie3 tai4guo4 wei1xian3。jue2 bu4 neng2 rang4 ta1 huo2xia4qu4。"

msgid "We need to leave. Now."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​赶紧​离开​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 li2kai1。"

msgid "We need to take care of his body. We can’t leave it there."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​处理​他​的​遗体​。​我们​不能​就​这么​把​它​留在​那儿​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 chu3li3 ta1 de5 yi2ti3。wo3men5 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4me5 ba3 ta1 liu2 zai4 na4r5。"

msgid ""
"We need to talk *action.* Our client sent you into something much bigger "
"than he'd led us to believe. I want to know why."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​谈谈​这次​*​行动​*​本身​。​客户​派​你们​去​处理​的​事情​远比​他​告诉​我们​的​要​复杂​得​多​。​我要​知道​原因​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2 zhe4 ci4*xing2dong4*ben3shen1。ke4hu4 pai4 ni3men5 qu4 chu3li3 de5 shi4qing5 yuan3 bi3 ta1 gao4su4 wo3men5 de5 yao4 fu4za2 de2 duo1。wo3 yao4 zhi1dao4 yuan2yin1。"

msgid "We need to talk about Monika, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​谈谈​有关​莫妮卡​的​事​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2 you3guan1 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "We need to talk about Monika."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​谈谈​有关​莫妮卡​的​事​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2 you3guan1 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4。"

msgid "We need to talk about what I saw in your aura."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​谈谈​我​在​你​的​灵光​中​看到​的​东西​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2 wo3 zai4 ni3 de5 ling2guang1 zhong4 kan4dao4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "We need to talk about what happened to you back there."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​谈谈​你​当时​发生​的​事情​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2 ni3 dang1shi2 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid "We need to track down Monika's client and press him for information."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​找到​莫妮卡​的​客户​，​让​他​把​事情​一五一十​地​吐出来​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 zhao3dao4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 ke4hu4，rang4 ta1 ba3 shi4qing5 yi1wu3yi1shi2 de5 tu3 chu1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"We need your full attention for what's coming. I can't have you beating "
"yourself up over the past."
msgstr ""
"我们​需要​全神贯注​地​应对​接下来​的​行动​。​我​不能​让​你​一直​为​过去​的​事​而​自责​。\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 quan2shen2guan4zhu4 de5 ying4dui4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 xing2dong4。wo3 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 yi1zhi2 wei2 guo4qu4 de5 shi4 er2 zi4ze2。"

msgid ""
"We never had children of our own, so we think of every child in the "
"Kreuzbasar as our grandkid. And it kills us to be so helpless to protect "
"them."
msgstr ""
"我们​自己​没有​孩子​，​所以​我们​把​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​每个​孩子​都​当成​自己​的​孙孩来​对待​。​眼睁睁​看着​他们​受苦​却​无能为力​，​这​让​我们​痛彻​心扉​。\n"
"wo3men5 zi4ji3 mei2you3 hai2zi5，suo3yi3 wo3men5 ba3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 mei3ge4 hai2zi5 dou1 dang4cheng2 zi4ji3 de5 sun1 hai2 lai2 dui4dai4。yan3zheng1zheng1 kan4 zhao2 ta1men5 shou4ku3 que4 wu2neng2wei2li4，zhe4 rang4 wo3men5 tong4 che4 xin1fei1。"

msgid ""
"We only have a limited time to spin on this rock. Spending it stoned is a "
"waste."
msgstr ""
"人​一辈子​也​就​活​这​几年​，​这点​时间​全拿去​嗑​药​也​太​浪费​了​。\n"
"ren2 yi1bei4zi5 ye3 jiu4 huo2 zhe4 ji3nian2，zhe4 dian3 shi2jian1 quan2 na2 qu4 ke4 yao4 ye3 tai4 lang4fei4 le5。"

msgid ""
"We owe you, $(l.name). More now than ever.\n"
"\n"
"You may not look upon yourself as a hero, but to the people of the Kreuzbasar, that is what you will always be."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我们​欠​你​的​救命之恩​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可能​不​认为​自己​是​英雄​，​但​对于​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人民​来说​，​你​将​永远​是​英雄​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3men5 qian4 ni3 de5 jiu4 ming4 zhi1 en1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3neng2 bu4 ren4wei2 zi4ji3 shi4 ying1xiong2，dan4 dui4yu2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2min2 lai2 shuo1，ni3 jiang1 yong3yuan3 shi4 ying1xiong2。"

msgid ""
"We released a great dragon. An *insane* great dragon.\n"
"\n"
"I don’t know, $(l.name). I’m not sure I would’ve made the same call."
msgstr ""
"我们​刚刚​释放​了​一头​巨龙​。​*​发疯​*​的​巨龙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不好​说​，​$(l.name)​。​我​不​确定​自己​是否​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gang1gang5 shi4fang4 le5 yi1tou2 ju4long2。*fa1feng1*de5 ju4long2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hao3 shuo1，$(l.name)。wo3 bu4 que4ding4 zi4ji3 shi4fou3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"We rescue the kids here, yeah. But I think that we should also try to kill "
"Harrow."
msgstr ""
"我们​当然​要​救出​那些​孩子​。​但​我​觉得​我们​也​应该​试着​去​干掉​哈罗​。\n"
"wo3men5 dang1ran2 yao4 jiu4chu1 na4Xie1hai2zi5。dan4 wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 ye3 ying1gai1 shi4zhe5 qu4 gan4diao4 ha1luo2。"

msgid ""
"We see them crying. We see them run to their parents. And we see the worry "
"in their parents' eyes, but what can we do?"
msgstr ""
"我们​看着​那些​孩子​哭​着​去​找​自己​的​父母​，​以及​家长​们​眼中​的​担忧​，​但​我们​又​能​做​什么​呢​？\n"
"wo3men5 kan4 zhao2 na4Xie1hai2zi5 ku1 zhao2 qu4 zhao3 zi4ji3 de5 fu4mu3，yi3ji2 jia1zhang3 men5 yan3zhong1 de5 dan1you1，dan4 wo3men5 you4 neng2 zuo4 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid "We should all be on guard."
msgstr ""
"我们​都​要​保持警惕​。\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 yao4 bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4。"

msgid ""
"We should keep moving. Whatever's going on in there, we don't want to get "
"involved."
msgstr ""
"我们​应该​继续前进​。​不管​里面​发生​了​什么​，​我们​都​不​应该​插手​。\n"
"wo3men5 ying1gai1 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。bu4guan3 li3mian4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5，wo3men5 dou1 bu4 ying1gai1 cha1shou3。"

msgid ""
"We should take him up on his offer. It was a stroke of luck that we found "
"this guy, and the team still needs a decker."
msgstr ""
"我们​应该​答应​他​的​请求​。​碰上​这个​人​算是​运气​好​，​而且​队里​确实​需要​一名​碟客​。\n"
"wo3men5 ying1gai1 da1ying5 ta1 de5 qing3qiu2。peng4shang4 zhe4ge5 ren2 suan4shi4 yun4qi5 hao3，er2qie3 dui4 li3 que4shi2 xu1yao4 yi1 ming2 die2 ke4。"

msgid "We should talk about what happened with the Engineer."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​谈谈​工程师​的​事​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 tan2tan2 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 shi4。"

msgid "We should try to find a fuse box."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​想​办法​找到​保险丝​盒​。\n"
"wo3men5 de2 xiang3 ban4fa3 zhao3dao4 bao3xian3si1 he2。"

msgid "We started this together. Don't finish it without me."
msgstr ""
"我们​共同​经历​了​这些​事​，​现在​你​不该​一个​人​逞强​。\n"
"wo3men5 gong4tong2 jing1li4 le5 zhe4xie1 shi4，xian4zai4 ni3 bu4gai1 yi1ge5 ren2 cheng3qiang2。"

msgid ""
"We still can't quite believe it. I don't know what the Kreuzbasar will be "
"without her."
msgstr ""
"我们​还是​有些​不敢​置信​。​我​不​知道​克洛伊​茨​集市​没​了​她​该​怎么办​。\n"
"wo3men5 hai2shi5 you3xie1 bu4 gan3 zhi4xin4。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 mei2 le5 ta1 gai1 zen3me5ban4。"

msgid ""
"We still have a dragon to deal with. We need resources more than we need Herr Schmidt to like us. And if this contact of yours has access to those resources, well...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You do the math."
msgstr ""
"我们​还有​一条​巨龙​要​对付​呢​。​比起​让​施密特​先生​高兴​，​还是​资源​更​重要​。​如果​你​的​这位​联络人​能​搞​来​资源​，​那​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看着办​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hai2you3 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yao4 dui4fu5 ni2。bi3qi3 rang4 shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 gao1xing4，hai2shi5 zi1yuan2 geng1 zhong4yao4。ru2guo3 ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 lian2luo4ren2 neng2 gao3 lai2 zi1yuan2，na4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4zhe5ban4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We still have a situation to deal with, remember? Vauclair and the Firewing?\n"
"\n"
"Stopping the Engineer was worth doing. It was a distraction from our mission, but these things happen. On the other hand, this... this personal history bullshit... it can wait."
msgstr ""
"我们​不是​还有​更​要紧​的​事要​处理​吗​？​沃​克莱尔​和​火翼​怎么​说​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​阻止​工程师​是​值得​的​。​虽然​这​有些​偏离​主要​任务​，​但​这种​事​难免会​发生​。​但是​……​关于​我​自己​的​这些​个人​恩怨​……​可以​稍后​再​处理​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4shi4 hai2you3 geng1 yao4jin3 de5 shi4 yao4 chu3li3 ma5？Wo4ke4lai2er3 he4 Huo3yi4 zen3me5 shuo1？\n"
"\n"
"zu3zhi3 gong1cheng2shi1 shi4 zhi2de5 de5。sui1ran2 zhe4 you3xie1 pian1li2 zhu3yao4 ren4wu5，dan4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 nan2 mian3 hui4 fa1sheng1。dan4shi4……guan1yu2 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 zhe4xie1 ge4ren2 en1yuan4……ke3yi3 shao1hou4 zai4 chu3li3。"

msgid ""
"We stop him. I can't think of any way around it.\n"
"\n"
"I don't like going off-mission, but if we don't, the Kreuzbasar is screwed. We can't afford to let that happen."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​阻止​他​。​我​想不出​其他​的​办法​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​喜欢​偏离​任务​，​但​如果​不​这么​做​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​就​完蛋​了​。​我们​绝不能​让​这种​事​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 zu3zhi3 ta1。wo3 xiang3 bu4 chu1 qi2ta1 de5 ban4fa3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 pian1li2 ren4wu5，dan4 ru2guo3 bu4 zhe4me5 zuo4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jiu4 wan2dan4 le5。wo3men5 jue2 bu4 neng2 rang4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"We stop him. Or rather, *I* stop him.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can't ask you to put off our mission for this. But the Engineer has to be stopped, so I'm gonna have to disappear for a run or two."
msgstr ""
"我们​得​阻止​他​。​或者说​，​*​我​*​来​阻止​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不能​为此​要求​你​推迟​任务​，​但​必须​得​有人​来​阻止​工程师​。​所以​我​得​缺席​接下来​的​一两次​任务​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de2 zu3zhi3 ta1。huo4 zhe3 shuo1，*wo3*lai2 zu3zhi3 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 wei4ci3 yao1qiu2 ni3 tui1chi2 ren4wu5，dan4 bi4xu1 de2 you3ren2 lai2 zu3zhi3 gong1cheng2shi1。suo3yi3 wo3 de2 que1xi2 jie1xia4lai2 de5 yi1 liang3 ci4 ren4wu5 le5。"

msgid ""
"We stop talking about this and go do it. We've hit the Harfeld Manor once "
"before. We already know what we need to know to do it again."
msgstr ""
"多说无益​，​直接​开干​吧​。​我们​之前​就​袭击​过哈​菲尔德​庄园​。​关于​这次​行动​需要​什么​，​我们​心里​都​很​清楚​了​。\n"
"duo1 shuo1 wu2 yi4，zhi2jie1 kai1 gan4 ba1。wo3men5 zhi1qian2 jiu4 xi2ji1 guo4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2。guan1yu2 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 xu1yao4 shen2me5，wo3men5 xin1li5 dou1 hen3 qing1chu5 le5。"

msgid ""
"We traced the signal to its source. The issue has been… resolved. \n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your help, efendim. The Kreuzbasar owes you. "
msgstr ""
"我们​追溯到​了​那个​信号​的​源头​。​问题​已经​被​……​解决​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​感谢​你​的​帮助​，​贵人​。​克洛伊​茨​集市​欠​你​一个​人情​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dui1 su4 dao4 le5 na4ge5 xin4hao4 de5 yuan2tou2。wen4ti2 yi3jing1 bei4……jie3jue2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4，gui4ren2。Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 qian4 ni3 yi1ge5 ren2qing2。"

msgid ""
"We tried to protect ourselves, but we were no match for them.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, a haunted look in his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We had no choice but to leave everything behind. We've been scraping by down here ever since."
msgstr ""
"我们​试图​保护​自己​，​但​根本​不是​它们​的​对手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​，​眼中​流露出​忧虑​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​别无选择​，​只能​弃家​逃生​。​从那时起​，​我们​就​一直​在​这里​勉强​度日​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4tu2 bao3hu4 zi4ji3，dan4 gen1ben3 bu4shi4 ta1men5 de5 dui4shou3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2，yan3zhong1 liu2 lou4 chu1 you1lu:4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2，zhi3neng2 qi4 jia1 tao2sheng1。cong2 na4 shi2 qi3，wo3men5 jiu4 yi1zhi2 zai4 zhe4li3 mian3qiang3 du4ri4。"

msgid ""
"We understand that you've decided to keep on. We wondered if you and the "
"others might leave us."
msgstr ""
"我们​理解​你​决定​继续​坚持下去​。​我们​曾​担心​你​和​同伴​们​可能​会​离开​我们​。\n"
"wo3men5 li3jie3 ni3 jue2ding4 ji4xu4 jian1chi2xia4qu4。wo3men5 ceng2 dan1xin1 ni3 he4 tong2ban4 men5 ke3neng2 hui4 li2kai1 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"We understand.\n"
"\n"
"Mira, stay here. I don't want you getting shot, too."
msgstr ""
"我们​明白​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​米拉​，​待​在​这里​。​我​不​希望​你​也​送命​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ming2bai5。\n"
"\n"
"mi3la1，dai1 zai4 zhe4li3。wo3 bu4 xi1wang4 ni3 ye3 song4ming4。"

msgid "We understand. (w)"
msgstr ""
"我们​理解​。\n"
"wo3men5 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"We were a good team. Experienced. We went through a lot together, and we chalked up a lot of kills.\n"
"\n"
"In our own way, I'd like to think that we did some good."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​一支​优秀​的​团队​。​经验丰富​，​经历​风雨​，​也​斩获​了​无数​战果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​我们​的​角度​出发​来看​，​我​想​我们​也​算​做​了​些​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 yi1 zhi1 you1xiu4 de5 tuan2dui4。jing1yan4feng1fu4，jing1li4 feng1yu3，ye3 zhan3huo4 le5 wu2shu4 zhan4 guo3。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 wo3men5 de5 jiao3du4 chu1fa1 lai2 kan4，wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 ye3 suan4 zuo4 le5 xie1 hao3shi4。"

msgid "We were all there with her, but we couldn't stop it."
msgstr ""
"我们​都​在​她​身边​，​但​我们​无法​阻止​一切​发生​。\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 zai4 ta1 shen1bian1，dan4 wo3men5 wu2fa3 zu3zhi3 yi1qie4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid "We were business associates. Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"就​生意​伙伴​，​没​别的​。\n"
"jiu4 sheng1yi4 huo3ban4，mei2 bie2de5。"

msgid ""
"We were double-crossed. The run went off without a hitch, but instead of "
"paying us, our client decided to set up an ambush."
msgstr ""
"我们​被​出卖​了​。​那次​行动​很​顺利​，​但​客户​不​打算​付钱​，​而是​设​了​埋伏​想要​我们​的​命​。\n"
"wo3men5 bei4 chu1mai4 le5。na4 ci4 xing2dong4 hen3 shun4li4，dan4 ke4hu4 bu4 da3suan4 fu4qian2，er2shi4 she4 le5 mai2fu2 xiang3yao4 wo3men5 de5 ming4。"

msgid "We were friends."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​朋友​。\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"We were in a place with different rules, remember? I'm already too far out of my comfort zone to offer you any real answers.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Maybe it reacted to the orichalcum in the balm that I was wearing. I don't know."
msgstr ""
"我们​身处​一个​规则​迥异​的​地方​，​记得​吗​？​这些​内容​远远​超出​了​我​的​舒适​区​，​所以​我​也​无法​给​你​任何​确切​的​答案​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​它​对​我​涂抹​的​软膏​里​的​奥利​哈钢​产生​了​反应​。​我​也​不​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shen1chu3 yi1ge5 gui1ze2 jiong3yi4 de5 di4fang1，ji4de5 ma5？zhe4xie1 nei4rong2 yuan3yuan3 chao1chu1 le5 wo3 de5 shu1shi4 qu1，suo3yi3 wo3 ye3 wu2fa3 gei3 ni3 ren4he2 que4qie4 de5 da2an4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1 dui4 wo3 tu2mo3 de5 ruan3gao1 li3 de5 ao4 li4 ha1 gang1 chan3sheng1 le5 fan3ying4。wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"We were sure it was only a matter of time before the government or the "
"corporations regained control. So we waited. (w)"
msgstr ""
"我们​确信​政府​或​各大​公司​重新​掌控​局面​只是​时间​问题​。​于是​我们​一直​在​等待​。\n"
"wo3men5 que4xin4 zheng4fu3 huo4 ge4 dai4 gong1si1 chong2xin1 zhang3kong4 ju2mian4 zhi3shi4 shi2jian1 wen4ti2。yu2shi4 wo3men5 yi1zhi2 zai4 deng3dai4。"

msgid ""
"We were the best of friends. Really! If I could just get back there to see "
"him, he'd be able to clear this up in a second."
msgstr ""
"我们​当时​可是​最好​的​朋友​，​真的​！​如果​我能​去​见到​他​的话​，​他​马上​就​能​把​事情​说​清楚​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 dang1shi2 ke3shi4 zui4hao3 de5 peng2you5，zhen1de5！ru2guo3 wo3 neng2 qu4 jian4dao4 ta1 de5hua4，ta1 ma3shang4 jiu4 neng2 ba3 shi4qing5 shuo1 qing1chu5 le5。"

msgid ""
"We were. No one gets on or off of that train without us knowing about it.\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry, all of the correct paperwork has already been filed. You and your crew are good for the next twelve hours."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​。​没有​我们​的​许可​，​任何人​都​无法​登上​或​离开​那列​火车​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​，​所有​必要​的​文件​手续​都​已​办妥​。​你​和​你​的​团队​在​接下来​的​十二​小时​内​都​不会​有事​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4。mei2you3 wo3men5 de5 xu3ke3，ren4 he2 ren2 dou1 wu2fa3 deng1shang4 huo4 li2kai1 na4 lie4 huo3che1。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，suo3you3 bi4yao4 de5 wen2jian4 shou3xu4 dou1 yi3 ban4tuo3。ni3 he4 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 shi2er4 xiao3shi2 nei4 dou1 bu4hui4 you3shi4。"

msgid ""
"We were... ah... um. Rever--\n"
"\n"
"Yes. We were reverse-engineering things. Making knockoffs.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He nods slowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Dangerous work. Illegal most places, but not here in Berlin. Our investor needed it that way."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​……​啊​……​呃​，​逆向​—​—​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​。​我们​在​进行​逆向​工程​，​制造​仿品​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​缓缓​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​门​危险​的​工作​，​在​大多数​地方​都​是​非法​的​，​但​在​柏林​不是​。​我们​的​投资人​就​需要​这个​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4……a1……e4，ni4xiang4——\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5。wo3men5 zai4 jin4xing2 ni4xiang4 gong1cheng2，zhi4zao4 fang3pin3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 men2 wei1xian3 de5 gong1zuo4，zai4 da4duo1shu4 di4fang1 dou1 shi4 fei1fa3 de5，dan4 zai4 bo2lin2 bu4shi4。wo3men5 de5 tou2zi1ren2 jiu4 xu1yao4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"We were... copying? Making copies. No, wait... just a second, it will come to me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He screws up his face, struggling to dredge up the memories.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我们​是​……​在​复制​？​制作​副本​。​不​，​等等​……​等​一下​，​我会​想​起来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​绷紧​脸​，​努力​回忆​着​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4……zai4 fu4zhi4？zhi4zuo4 fu4ben3。bu4，deng3deng3……deng3 yi1xia4，wo3 hui4 xiang3 qi3lai5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 beng1jin3 lian3，nu3li4 hui2yi4 zhao2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "We were... very close."
msgstr ""
"我们​……​非常​亲密​。\n"
"wo3men5……fei1chang2 qin1mi4。"

msgid ""
"We weren't in any immediate danger here, of course. But the soldiers who had"
" remained to restore order in Berlin were suddenly called away."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​我们​当时​并未​面临​任何​迫在眉睫​的​危险​。​但​那些​留守​柏林​维持秩序​的​士兵​突然​被​召走​了​。\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3men5 dang1shi2 bing4wei4 mian4lin2 ren4he2 po4zai4mei2jie2 de5 wei1xian3。dan4 na4xie1 liu2shou3 bo2lin2 wei2 chi2 zhi4 xu4 de5 shi4bing1 tu1ran2 bei4 zhao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "We will all pay. All of us."
msgstr ""
"我们​所有人​都​要​付出代价​。\n"
"wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 yao4 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。"

msgid ""
"We will be forced to discard that which is most precious to us, and act like what the world already thinks that we are.\n"
"\n"
"This is the price of survival for us. This is the deal that you brokered."
msgstr ""
"我们​将​被迫​丢弃​自己​最​珍视​的​东西​，​像​世人​所​认为​的​那样​行事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就是​我们​要​生存​的​代价​。​这​是​你​为​我们​谈下​的​条件​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jiang1 bei4po4 diu1qi4 zi4ji3 zui4 zhen1shi4 de5 dong1xi1，xiang4 shi4ren2 suo3 ren4wei2 de5 na4yang4 xing2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 yao4 sheng1cun2 de5 dai4jia4。zhe4 shi4 ni3 wei2 wo3men5 tan2 xia4 de5 tiao2jian4。"

msgid ""
"We wipe out the cult, starting with Harrow. As long as he's alive, he can "
"just start all of this over again. We'll save any cultists that we can, but "
"the ones that are too far gone will have to be put down."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​彻底​铲除​邪教​，​先​从​哈罗​开始​下手​。​只要​他​活着​，​就​能​让​这​一切​重演​。​我们​会​尽力​拯救​邪教徒​，​但​那些​堕落​太深​的​，​就​必须​予以​清除​。\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 che4di3 chan3chu2 xie2jiao4，xian1 cong2 ha1luo2 kai1shi3 xia4shou3。zhi3yao4 ta1 huo2zhe5，jiu4 neng2 rang4 zhe4 yi1qie4 chong2yan3。wo3men5 hui4 jin4li4 zheng3jiu4 xie2 jiao1 tu2，dan4 na4xie1 duo4luo4 tai4 shen1 de5，jiu4 bi4xu1 yu3yi3 qing1chu2。"

msgid "We won't start shooting until we run out of words."
msgstr ""
"不到​万不得已​，​我们​是​不会​开枪​的​。\n"
"bu4dao4 wan4bu4de2yi3，wo3men5 shi4 bu4hui4 kai1qiang1 de5。"

msgid "We won't. You two enjoy your day."
msgstr ""
"没事​没事​。​祝​二位​今天​愉快​。\n"
"mei2shi4 mei2shi4。zhu4 er4 wei4 jin1tian1 yu2kuai4。"

msgid ""
"We'd almost reached the Oder-Neisse Line when we were spotted. Not by border authorities, but by a farmer.\n"
"\n"
"He saw us, and we saw him. We all froze. "
msgstr ""
"就​在​我们​几乎​抵达​奥得河​-​尼斯河​线时​，​我们​被​发现​了​。​发现​我们​的​人​不是​边防​人员​，​而是​个​农民​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​看见​了​我们​，​我们​也​看见​了​他​。​所有人​顿时​僵住​了​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 wo3men5 ji1hu1 di3da2 ao4 de2 he2 -ni2 si1 he2 xian4 shi2，wo3men5 bei4 fa1xian4 le5。fa1xian4 wo3men5 de5 ren2 bu4shi4 bian1fang2 ren2yuan2，er2shi4 ge4 nong2min2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 kan4jian4 le5 wo3men5，wo3men5 ye3 kan4jian4 le5 ta1。suo3you3ren2 dun4shi2 jiang1zhu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"We'd be lucky to have you stay on. And, when the time comes, the Kreuzbasar "
"is a wonderful place for an old soldier to hang their hat. Take it from me."
msgstr ""
"能留​你​在​这里​是​我们​的​幸事​。​而且​到​了​那​时候​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​会​是​个​让​老兵​安享晚年​的​绝佳​去处​。​相信​我​。\n"
"neng2 liu2 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 shi4 wo3men5 de5 xing4shi4。er2qie3 dao4 le5 na4 shi2hou5，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 hui4 shi4 ge4 rang4 lao3bing1 an1 xiang3 wan3 nian2 de5 jue2jia1 qu4chu4。xiang1xin4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"We'd better keep moving, huh, Hasenkamp? Like you said, Grinder is waiting."
msgstr ""
"我们​继续​走​吧​，​哈森​坎普​？​你​不是​说​了​吗​，​“​绞肉机​”​还​等​着​呢​。\n"
"wo3men5 ji4xu4 zou3 ba1，Ha1sen1kan3pu3？ni3 bu4shi4 shuo1 le5 ma5，“jiao3rou4ji1” hai2 deng3 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"We'll be fine. I carried us through this attack, I'll carry us through the "
"next."
msgstr ""
"我们​没事​的​。​这​一次​我​能带​大家​突围​，​下​一次​也​能行​。\n"
"wo3men5 mei2shi4 de5。zhe4 yi1ci4 wo3 neng2 dai4 da4jia1 tu1wei2，xia4 yi1ci4 ye3 neng2 xing2。"

msgid ""
"We'll be out here as long as it takes.\n"
"\n"
"We're taking our building back, one way or another."
msgstr ""
"我们​会​一直​坚守​在​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​我们​都​要​夺回​属于​我们​自己​的​地盘​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 yi1zhi2 jian1shou3 zai4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3men5 dou1 yao4 duo2hui2 shu3yu2 wo3men5 zi4ji3 de5 di4pan2。"

msgid "We'll be waiting. Good hunting, Glory."
msgstr ""
"我们​会​一直​等​你​。​祝你好运​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 yi1zhi2 deng3 ni3。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid "We'll both just hang out here and see what happens."
msgstr ""
"我们​就​在​这里​等​着​看​好戏​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3 deng3 zhao2 kan4 hao3 xi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We'll get you your answers. But Eiger's right... we need to focus on "
"stopping Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"我们​会​找到​这个​答案​。​但​艾格尔​说得对​……​我们​的​优先​目标​是​阻止​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 zhao3dao4 zhe4ge5 da2an4。dan4 Ai4ge2er3 shuo1 de2 dui4……wo3men5 de5 you1xian1 mu4biao1 shi4 zu3zhi3 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid "We'll just have to wait and see, won't we?"
msgstr ""
"看来​我们​只能​走​一步​看​一步​了​？\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3men5 zhi3neng2 zou3 yi1 bu4 kan4 yi1 bu4 le5？"

msgid "We'll keep our eyes peeled."
msgstr ""
"我们​会​注意​的​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 zhu4yi4 de5。"

msgid "We'll miss you, Paul."
msgstr ""
"我们​会​想念​你​的​，​保罗​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 xiang3nian4 ni3 de5，bao3luo2。"

msgid "We'll never forget it."
msgstr ""
"我们​永远​都​不会​忘记​。\n"
"wo3men5 yong3yuan3 dou1 bu4hui4 wang4ji4。"

msgid ""
"We'll save any that we can. But the energy released when the spirit dies "
"will hurt them, too... anyone whose mind it touched will take a hit."
msgstr ""
"我们​会​尽力​去​拯救​他们​。​但​精魂​死亡​时​释放​的​能量​也​会​伤害​到​他们​……​任何​一个​被​精魂​触碰过​意识​的​人​都​会​受到冲击​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 jin4li4 qu4 zheng3jiu4 ta1men5。dan4 jing1hun2 si3wang2 shi2 shi4fang4 de5 neng2liang4 ye3 hui4 shang1hai4 dao4 ta1men5……ren4he2 yi1ge5 bei4 jing1hun2 chu4 peng4 guo4 yi4shi2 de5 ren2 dou1 hui4 shou4 dao4 chong1 ji1。"

msgid "We'll see."
msgstr ""
"看​情况​吧​。\n"
"kan4 qing2kuang4 ba1。"

msgid "We'll see. Now tell me about the others."
msgstr ""
"到时候​就​知道​了​。​现在​给​我​说​说​其他人​的​情况​吧​。\n"
"dao4shi2hou4 jiu4 zhi1dao4 le5。xian4zai4 gei3 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 qi2 ta1 ren2 de5 qing2kuang4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We'll take care of the AI, but Eiger and I have some business out in "
"Schattennest to take care of first."
msgstr ""
"我们​会​解决​掉​AI​的​，​但​我​和​艾格尔要​先去​影巢​解决​一些​事​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 jie3jue2 diao4 AI de5，dan4 wo3 he4 Ai4ge2er3 yao4 xian1 qu4 ying3 chao2 jie3jue2 yi1xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"We'll take your word for it.\n"
"\n"
"While you're at it, you should probably tackle any other outstanding business that you might have as well. Once we confront APEX, we'll be committed to seeing the rest of this through... no hesitation, and no turning back."
msgstr ""
"我们​就​相信​你​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然如此​，​你​最好​也​把​其他​未​完成​的​任务​一并处理​掉​。​一旦​我们​直面​APEX​，​就​得​全身心​投入​，​一条​路​走​到底​。​不能​迟疑​，​也​不能​回头​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jiu4 xiang1xin4 ni3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，ni3 zui4hao3 ye3 ba3 qi2ta1 wei4 wan2cheng2 de5 ren4wu5 yi1 bing4 chu3 li3 diao4。yi1dan4 wo3men5 zhi2mian4 APEX，jiu4 de2 quan2shen1xin1 tou2ru4，yi1 tiao2 lu4 zou3 dao4di3。bu4neng2 chi2yi2，ye3 bu4neng2 hui2tou2。"

msgid "We'll talk about this later. For now, get out of my hair."
msgstr ""
"这事​等​下​再说​。​现在​别来​烦​我​了​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 deng3 xia4 zai4shuo1。xian4zai4 bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3 le5。"

msgid "We'll want to stand back a bit."
msgstr ""
"我们​最好​往​后退​一点​。\n"
"wo3men5 zui4hao3 wang3 hou4tui4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "We'll worry about it later. For now, let's just get on with the run."
msgstr ""
"我们​稍后​再​担心​这个​。​现在​先​继续​工作​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 shao1hou4 zai4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5。xian4zai4 xian1 ji4xu4 gong1zuo4 ba1。"

msgid "We'll worry about that tomorrow. Tonight, we celebrate."
msgstr ""
"这种​事​明天​再说​，​今晚​先​好好​庆祝​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4 ming2tian1 zai4shuo1，jin1wan3 xian1 hao3hao3 qing4zhu4。"

msgid ""
"We're Knight Errant, fool. We don't \"talk things over\" with thief-scum like you.\n"
"\n"
"You will comply with my orders, or you will die. The choice is yours."
msgstr ""
"你​个​蠢货​，​我们​是​游侠​骑士​。​我们​不会​跟​像​你们​这种​不入流​的​小贼​“​谈谈​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​立刻​按​我​说​的​做​，​否则​就是​死路一条​。​你​自己​选​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ge4 chun3huo4，wo3men5 shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4。wo3men5 bu4hui4 gen1 xiang4 ni3men5 zhe4zhong3 bu4 ru4 liu2 de5 xiao3 zei2“tan2tan2”。\n"
"\n"
"li4ke4 an4 wo3 shuo1 de5 zuo4，fou3ze2 jiu4shi4 si3lu4yi1tiao2。ni3 zi4ji3 xuan3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We're Knight Errant. Of course we're on top of things.\n"
"\n"
"You get what you pay for, and the owners of this building paid for the best."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​游侠​骑士​。​我们​当然​尽职尽责​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一分钱一​份力​，​而​这栋​大楼​的​所有者​买下​了​最好​的​服务​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4。wo3men5 dang1ran2 jin4zhi2jin4ze2。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 fen4 qian2 yi1 fen4 li4，er2 zhe4 dong4 da4lou2 de5 suo3you3zhe3 mai3xia4 le5 zui4hao3 de5 fu2wu4。"

msgid "We're all scared, you idiot."
msgstr ""
"我们​都​很​害怕​，​蠢货​。\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 hen3 hai4pa4，chun3huo4。"

msgid "We're all stepping up to fill the void left by Monika."
msgstr ""
"我们​都​在​努力​填补​莫妮卡​留下​的​空白​。\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 zai4 nu3li4 tian2bu3 Mo4ni1ka3 liu2xia4 de5 kong4bai2。"

msgid ""
"We're already writing off the possibility of killing Harrow. Let's do the "
"world a favor and kill his second-in-command."
msgstr ""
"我们​已经​失去​了​击杀​哈罗​的​可能性​。​不如​做件​善事​，​干掉​他​的​二把手​。\n"
"wo3men5 yi3jing1 shi1qu4 le5 ji1sha1 ha1luo2 de5 ke3neng2xing4。bu4ru2 zuo4 jian4 shan4shi4，gan4diao4 ta1 de5 er4ba3shou3。"

msgid "We're dealing with a winner here."
msgstr ""
"真​厉害​啊​。\n"
"zhen1 li4hai5 a1。"

msgid ""
"We're doing a building-wide maintenance sweep of all major systems. Want us "
"to take a look at your terminal?"
msgstr ""
"我们​正在​对​整栋​楼​的​所有​主要​系统​进行​全面​检修​。​需要​我们​检查​你​的​终端​吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 zheng4zai4 dui4 zheng3 dong4 lou2 de5 suo3you3 zhu3yao4 xi4tong3 jin4xing2 quan2mian4 jian3xiu1。xu1yao4 wo3men5 jian3cha2 ni3 de5 zhong1duan1 ma5？"

msgid "We're doing a special right now. Yours for only ¥250."
msgstr ""
"我们​正在​做​活动​。​只要​¥​250​。\n"
"wo3men5 zheng4zai4 zuo4 huo2dong4。zhi3yao4 ¥ 250。"

msgid ""
"We're fine.\n"
"\n"
"An attacker did force his way in here. It didn't go well for him."
msgstr ""
"我们​没事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有个​袭击者​倒​是​闯​了​进来​。​他​的​下场​可惨​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 mei2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ge4 xi2ji1zhe3 dao3 shi4 chuang3 le5 jin4lai2。ta1 de5 xia4chang3 ke3 can3 le5。"

msgid ""
"We're friends of Harrow's. Don't bother calling Marta out here, we're just "
"going in there to have a word with her."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​哈罗​的​朋友​。​你​不用​专门​去​叫​玛​尔塔​出来​，​我们​只是​进去​跟​她​聊​上​几句​。\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 peng2you5。ni3 bu4yong4 zhuan1men2 qu4 jiao4 Ma3er3ta3 chu1lai2，wo3men5 zhi3shi4 jin4qu4 gen1 ta1 liao2 shang4 ji1 ju4。"

msgid ""
"We're going back to the Harfeld Manor. *Tonight.* And we're going to get "
"some answers."
msgstr ""
"我们​*​今晚​*​要​重返​哈​菲尔德​庄园​。​我们​要​把​这件​事查​个​水落石出​。\n"
"wo3men5*jin1wan3*yao4 chong2fan3 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2。wo3men5 yao4 ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 cha2 ge4 shui3luo4shi2chu1。"

msgid ""
"We're going to find out what's happening at that holdfast. And then we're "
"going to stop it."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​查明​那个​据点​之中​发生​了​什么​事​。​然后​我们​要​阻止​它​。\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 cha2ming2 na4ge5 ju4dian3 zhi1zhong1 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4。ran2hou4 wo3men5 yao4 zu3zhi3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"We're going to finish this mission and get you to your meeting. So shut up "
"and start walking."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​完成​任务​，​让​你​赶紧​去​开会​。​所以​把​嘴闭​上​，​继续前进​。\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 wan2cheng2 ren4wu5，rang4 ni3 gan3jin3 qu4 kai1hui4。suo3yi3 ba3 zui3 bi4 shang4，ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid ""
"We're going to kill you, Spirit. And once you're dead, Harrow will follow.\n"
"\n"
"We're burning this entire godforsaken place to the ground, and we're doing it tonight."
msgstr ""
"我们​要​杀​了​你​，​精魂​。​等​你​死​后​，​哈罗​就是​下​一个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​今晚​就要​把​这个​破​地方​烧成灰​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 sha1 le5 ni3，jing1hun2。deng3 ni3 si3 hou4，ha1luo2 jiu4shi4 xia4 yi1ge5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jin1wan3 jiu4yao4 ba3 zhe4ge5 po4 di4fang1 shao1 cheng2 hui1。"

msgid "We're going to stop you, Vauclair. We'll find a way. "
msgstr ""
"我们​会​阻止​你​的​，​沃​克莱尔​。​一定​会​的​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3 de5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。yi1ding4 hui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"We're going to stop you, Vauclair. We'll find a way. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger's lips curl into a snarl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And we'll make it *painful.*"
msgstr ""
"我们​会​阻止​你​的​，​沃​克莱尔​。​一定​会​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​嘴唇​勾出​一抹​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我们​绝不会​让​你​*​好过​*​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3 de5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。yi1ding4 hui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 zui3chun2 gou1chu1 yi1 ma1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3men5 jue2 bu4 hui4 rang4 ni3*hao3guo4*。"

msgid ""
"We're having some... trouble with a local mage gang. The Magnifikers.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The ork turns his head and spits.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They attacked us without warning, took up in our building, and kicked us onto the street."
msgstr ""
"我们​遇到​了​一些​……​麻烦​，​对方​是​个​自称​“​伟术​帮​”​的​本地​法师​帮派​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​兽​人​转过​头​吐​了​一口​唾沫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​毫无​预警​地​袭击​了​我们​，​占​了​我们​的​地盘​，​把​我们​赶到​了​大街​上​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yu4dao4 le5 yi1xie1……ma2fan5，dui4fang1 shi4 ge4 zi4cheng1“wei3 shu4 bang1” de5 ben3di4 fa3shi1 bang1pai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 tu3 le5 yi1kou3 tuo4mo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 hao2wu2 yu4jing3 de5 xi2ji1 le5 wo3men5，zhan1 le5 wo3men5 de5 di4pan2，ba3 wo3men5 gan3dao4 le5 da4jie1 shang4。"

msgid ""
"We're here to get Blitz back in Grinder's good graces. If he wants you to be"
" here, who am I to argue?"
msgstr ""
"我们​此行​的​目的​是​让​布里​茨​重新​获得​“​绞肉机​”​的​青睐​。​既然​他​希望​你​在​此​，​我​又​怎敢​多言​？\n"
"wo3men5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4 shi4 rang4 Bu4li3ci2 chong2xin1 huo4de2“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 qing1lai4。ji4ran2 ta1 xi1wang4 ni3 zai4 ci3，wo3 you4 zen3 gan3 duo1yan2？"

msgid ""
"We're here to rescue the cultists of Feuerstelle. The street kids whose minds you touched.\n"
"\n"
"We're getting them out of here, before the Adversary can do to them what it did to you."
msgstr ""
"我们​来​这里​是​为了​拯救​“​火坑​”​的​教徒​。​也​就是​那些​被​你​触​碰过​心灵​的​流浪儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​反叛者​像​扭曲​你​一样​扭曲​他们​之前​，​我们​要​带​他们​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 wei4le5 zheng3jiu4“huo3keng1” de5 jiao4tu2。ye3 jiu4shi4 na4xie1 bei4 ni3 chu4 peng4 guo4 xin1ling2 de5 liu2lang4er2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 xiang4 niu3qu1 ni3 yi1yang4 niu3qu1 ta1men5 zhi1qian2，wo3men5 yao4 dai4 ta1men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"We're in Berlin, Heiner. What \"they\"? Who do you think is coming?\n"
"\n"
"We need to be prepared to survive here for a long time. Maybe years. And that means making the most of the resources at our disposal."
msgstr ""
"我们​在​柏林​，​海纳​。​哪来​的​“​他们​”​？​你​觉得​谁​会​来​救​我们​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​做好​在​这里​长期​生存​的​准备​，​也许​是​几年​。​而​这​意味着​我们​必须​充分利用​手头​的​一切​资源​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 bo2lin2，hai3 na4。na3 lai2 de5“ta1men5”？ni3 jue2de5 shei2 hui4 lai2 jiu4 wo3men5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 zuo4 hao3 zai4 zhe4li3 chang2qi1 sheng1cun2 de5 zhun3bei4，ye3xu3 shi4 ji3nian2。er2 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 bi4xu1 chong1 fen4 li4 yong4 shou3tou2 de5 yi1qie4 zi1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"We're in Drogenkippe. You think I care about a few bugs? I need a room."
msgstr ""
"这​可是​毒坑区​，​你​觉得​我​还​在乎​几只​虫子​吗​？​给​我​来​个​房间​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3shi4 du2 keng1 qu1，ni3 jue2de5 wo3 hai2 zai4hu5 ji1 zhi3 chong2zi5 ma5？gei3 wo3 lai2 ge4 fang2jian1。"

msgid ""
"We're in over our heads. But whatever we stumbled into tonight, I'll see us "
"through it."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​处境​不容乐观​。​但​无论​我们​今晚​遭遇​了​什么​，​我​都​会​带​大家​渡过难关​。\n"
"wo3men5 de5 chu3jing4 bu4 rong2 le4 guan1。dan4 wu2lun4 wo3men5 jin1wan3 zao1yu4 le5 shen2me5，wo3 dou1 hui4 dai4 da4jia1 du4 guo4 nan2 guan1。"

msgid "We're in, people. Let's move."
msgstr ""
"接入​成功​，​各位​。​开始​行动​吧​。\n"
"jie1ru4 cheng2gong1，ge4wei4。kai1shi3 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid "We're just seeing to the vegetables. Doing our part."
msgstr ""
"我们​就是​在​这里​照看​蔬菜​。​做​我们​该​做​的​事​。\n"
"wo3men5 jiu4shi4 zai4 zhe4li3 zhao4kan4 shu1cai4。zuo4 wo3men5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"We're just, uh, improvising. Trying to stay in business.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gives Mira a significant glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The only way we can."
msgstr ""
"我们​只不过​是​，​呃​，​随机应变​，​努力​维持​营业​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​意味深长​地瞥​了​米拉​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​只有​这个​办法​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3bu5guo4 shi4，e4，sui2ji1ying4bian4，nu3li4 wei2chi2 ying2ye4 er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi4wei4shen1chang2 de5 pie1 le5 mi3la1 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3you3 zhe4ge5 ban4fa3 le5。"

msgid ""
"We're likely to run into other complications, as well. So I think that we need to make a decision here, up-front.\n"
"\n"
"What would you do in my place? Rescue the kids, or take down Harrow? I don't think that we can manage both."
msgstr ""
"我们​很​可能​还会​遇到​其他​麻烦​。​所以​我​认为​我们​需要​在​此事​上​提前​做出​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​换作​是​你​，​会​怎么​做​？​先救​孩子​，​还是​干掉​哈罗​？​我​认为​我们​无法​两者​兼顾​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hen3 ke3neng2 hai2 hui4 yu4dao4 qi2ta1 ma2fan5。suo3yi3 wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 xu1yao4 zai4 ci3shi4 shang4 ti2qian2 zuo4chu1 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 ni3，hui4 zen3me5 zuo4？xian1 jiu4 hai2zi5，hai2shi5 gan4diao4 ha1luo2？wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 wu2fa3 liang3zhe3 jian1gu4。"

msgid ""
"We're looking for a key to get past that warded door. Could the girl who has"
" it be in there?"
msgstr ""
"我们​要​找​一把​钥匙​来​打开​那扇​结界​保护​的​门​。​带​着​钥匙​的​女孩​会​不会​就​在​里面​？\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 zhao3 yi1 ba3 yao4shi5 lai2 da3kai1 na4 shan1 jie2jie4 bao3hu4 de5 men2。dai4 zhao2 yao4shi5 de5 nu:3hai2 hui4 bu4hui4 jiu4 zai4 li3mian4？"

msgid "We're maintenance. Look at the uniforms."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​检修​人员​。​看到​这​身​制服​了​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 jian3xiu1 ren2yuan2。kan4dao4 zhe4 shen1 zhi4fu2 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We're not \"going up against\" anything.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gestures broadly at her own body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do we *look* like shadowrunners to you?"
msgstr ""
"我们​没​打算​和​任何​东西​“​作对​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​自己​的​身体​大致​比划​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​*​看起来​*​像​暗影​狂奔​者​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 mei2 da3suan4 he4 ren4he2 dong1xi1“zuo4dui4”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 zi4ji3 de5 shen1ti3 da4zhi4 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5*kan4qi3lai5*xiang4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"We're not talking about a piece of merchandise here, boss. \n"
"\n"
"There's a living troll buried under all that chrome."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​我们​谈论​的​并​不是​什么​货物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3men5 tan2lun4 de5 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 huo4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。"

msgid ""
"We're not talking about a piece of merchandise, Blitz.\n"
"\n"
"There's a living troll buried under all that chrome."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​我们​谈论​的​并​不是​什么​货物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，wo3men5 tan2lun4 de5 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 huo4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。"

msgid ""
"We're not talking about a piece of merchandise.\n"
"\n"
"There's a living troll buried under all that chrome."
msgstr ""
"我们​谈论​的​并​不是​什么​货物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抛开​身上​的​铬​合金​来看​，​这​可是​个​活生生​的​巨魔​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 tan2lun4 de5 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 huo4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"pao1kai1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1 lai2 kan4，zhe4 ke3shi4 ge4 huo2sheng1sheng1 de5 ju4mo2 a1。"

msgid "We're on it."
msgstr ""
"我们​这​就​行动​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 xing2dong4。"

msgid ""
"We're on your dime, friend. \n"
"\n"
"Tell me what you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"钱​是​你​花​的​，​就别​浪费时间​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​吧​，​你​要​找​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"qian2 shi4 ni3 hua1 de5，jiu4 bie4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ba1，ni3 yao4 zhao3 shen2me5。"

msgid "We're ready! Force it!"
msgstr ""
"我们​准备​好​了​！​动手​！\n"
"wo3men5 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5！dong4shou3！"

msgid ""
"We're shadowrunners, not a charity. I won't lift a finger unless we're "
"getting paid."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​暗影​狂奔​者​，​不是​慈善机构​。​除非​有利可图​，​否则​我​才​懒得​帮忙​。\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，bu4shi4 ci2shan4ji1gou4。chu2fei1 you3li4ke3tu2，fou3ze2 wo3 cai2 lan3de5 bang1mang2。"

msgid ""
"We're shadowrunners. Nightmares are nothing new to me - they come with the "
"territory."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​暗影​狂奔​者​。​噩梦​对​我​来说​不是​什么​新鲜事​。​干​这​一行​的​，​本来​就​免不了​这个​。\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。e4meng4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 bu4shi4 shen2me5 xin1 xian1 shi4。gan4 zhe4 yi1xing2 de5，ben3lai2 jiu4 mian3bu4liao3 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"We're shoring up the fortifications, such as they are. Lots of damage during the attack. Plus, they exposed some holes in our defenses we really ought to plug up.\n"
"\n"
"Just in case."
msgstr ""
"我们​正在​加固​防线​，​尽管​它们​本​就​脆弱​。​攻击​过程​中​造成​了​大量​损毁​。​此外​，​这次​攻击​还​暴露​了​我们​防线​中​的​一些​漏洞​，​我们​必须​尽快​弥补​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​都​是​为了​以防万一​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zheng4zai4 jia1gu4 fang2xian4，jin3guan3 ta1men5 ben3 jiu4 cui4ruo4。gong1ji1 guo4cheng2 zhong4 zao4cheng2 le5 da4liang4 sun3hui3。ci3wai4，zhe4 ci4 gong1ji1 hai2 bao4lu4 le5 wo3men5 fang2xian4 zhong4 de5 yi1xie1 lou4dong4，wo3men5 bi4xu1 jin3kuai4 mi2bu3。\n"
"\n"
"dou1 shi4 wei4le5 yi3fang2wan4yi1。"

msgid ""
"We're talking about increased violence in the streets, the proliferation of the drug trade, and people pressed into sexual slavery.\n"
"\n"
"If the Engineer is working for Tamanous, we could even be looking at wide-scale organlegging and fetus farming. And that horrible shit won't stay confined to Schattennest - it'll bleed over into the Kruezbasar."
msgstr ""
"街头​暴力​加剧​、​毒品​交易​泛滥​，​以及​平民​沦为​性奴​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​工程师​在​为​塔玛​诺斯​做事​，​那么​甚至​可能​还​涉及​大规模​器官​贩卖​与​胎儿​养殖​。​而​这​等​骇人听闻​的​行径​绝不会​仅仅​局限于​影巢​，​最终​一定​会​蔓延到​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"\n"
"jie1tou2 bao4li4 jia1ju4、du2pin3 jiao1yi4 fan4lan4，yi3ji2 ping2min2 lun2wei2 xing4 nu2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 gong1cheng2shi1 zai4 wei2 ta3 ma3 nuo4 si1 zuo4shi4，na4me5 shen4zhi4 ke3neng2 hai2 she4ji2 da4gui1mo2 qi4guan1 fan4mai4 yu4 tai1er2 yang3zhi2。er2 zhe4 deng3 hai4ren2ting1wen2 de5 xing2jing4 jue2 bu4 hui4 jin3jin3 ju2xian4yu2 ying3 chao2，zui4zhong1 yi1ding4 hui4 man4 yan2 dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid "We're treading into dangerously personal territory here."
msgstr ""
"这​就​涉及​到​个人隐私​了​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4 she4ji2 dao4 ge4ren2yin3si1 le5。"

msgid ""
"We're your new security detail. Central sent us down here to familiarize "
"ourselves with the lab."
msgstr ""
"我们​是​你们​的​新​安保​团队​。​指挥部​派​我们​来​熟悉​一下​实验室​的​周边环境​。\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 ni3men5 de5 xin1 an1bao3 tuan2dui4。zhi3hui1bu4 pai4 wo3men5 lai2 shu2xi1 yi1xia4 shi2yan4shi4 de5 zhou1 bian1 huan2 jing4。"

msgid ""
"We've been making halfway decent time - not good, but not terrible. But I can't afford any more delays.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He cracks his knuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I hope that no one else gets in our way, for their own sake."
msgstr ""
"我们​的​行程​还​算​顺利​—​—​不算​快​，​但​也​算不上​慢​。​但​我​不想​再​承受​更​多​延误​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​掰​了​掰​指节​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但愿​别​再​有人​挡​我们​的​路​，​这是​为了​他们​自己​好​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 xing2cheng2 hai2 suan4 shun4li4——bu4suan4 kuai4，dan4 ye3 suan4 bu4 shang4 man4。dan4 wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 cheng2shou4 geng1 duo1 yan2wu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bai1 le5 bai1 zhi3jie2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4yuan4 bie4 zai4 you3ren2 dang3 wo3men5 de5 lu4，zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 ta1men5 zi4ji3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"We've been through this before, Eiger.\n"
"\n"
"You're not in the KSK anymore. And that \"chain of command\" nonsense doesn't fly in the shadows."
msgstr ""
"我们​以前​谈过​这个​了​，​艾格尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​已经​不​在​KSK​了​。​“​指挥​链​”​那套​鬼话​在​暗影​界​是​行不通​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi3qian2 tan2 guo4 zhe4ge5 le5，Ai4ge2er3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 bu4 zai4 KSK le5。“zhi3hui1 lian4” na4 tao4 gui3hua4 zai4 an4ying3 jie4 shi4 xing2bu5tong1 de5。"

msgid ""
"We've done it! We've *DONE* it, my friends!\n"
"\n"
"The Jubuthon Hordes have been defeated!"
msgstr ""
"我们​成功​了​！​我们​*​成功​了​*​，​我​的​朋友​们​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​朱布松​部落​被​击败​了​！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 cheng2gong1 le5！wo3men5*cheng2gong1 le5*，wo3 de5 peng2you5 men5！\n"
"\n"
"zhu1 bu4 song1 bu4luo4 bei4 ji1bai4 le5！"

msgid ""
"We've got Aden, the Great Sirrush... he's operating out of Turkey. By all accounts, he's not a fan of Lofwyr... they're actively competing for territory in the Middle East. \n"
"\n"
"So I suppose that could be considered motive... reviving the Firewing might cause problems for the Golden Wyrm.\n"
"\n"
"But would he risk a war with Saeder-Krupp by straying onto Lofwyr's territory? Again, I don't think it's likely."
msgstr ""
"“​怒蛇龙​”​亚丁​……​他​的​大本营​在​土耳其​之外​。​从​各​方面​来看​，​他​都​不​喜欢​洛夫​维尔​……​二者​在​积极​争夺​中东地区​的​领地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我​觉得​他​算是​有​动机​……​复活​火翼​也许​能​给​“​金龙​”​带来​一些​麻烦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他​会​愿意​冒​着​与​赛德​-​克虏伯​开战​的​风险​闯入​洛夫​维尔​的​地盘​吗​？​我​还是​觉得​这​不太可能​。\n"
"\n"
"“nu4 she2 long2” ya4ding1……ta1 de5 da4ben3ying2 zai4 tu3er3qi2 zhi1wai4。cong2 ge4 fang1mian4 lai2 kan4，ta1 dou1 bu4 xi3huan5 Luo4fu1wei2er3……er4zhe3 zai4 ji1ji2 zheng1duo2 zhong4 dong1 de5 qu1 de5 ling3di4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 jue2de5 ta1 suan4shi4 you3 dong4ji1……fu4huo2 Huo3yi4 ye3xu3 neng2 gei3“jin1 long2” dai4lai2 yi1xie1 ma2fan5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1 hui4 yuan4yi4 mao4 zhao2 yu4 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 kai1zhan4 de5 feng1xian3 chuang3ru4 Luo4fu1wei2er3 de5 di4pan2 ma5？wo3 hai2shi5 jue2de5 zhe4 bu4 tai4 ke3 neng2。"

msgid ""
"We've got a full plate. I know that. But $(l.name)... we can't afford to "
"ignore this. If we do, the Kreuzbasar that we know today will be gone within"
" a year. I promise you that."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​我们​手头​的​事情​已经​很多​了​，​但​$(l.name)​……​我们​不能​忽视​这件​事​。​如果​置之不理​的话​，​我们​熟知​的​克洛伊​茨​集市​将​在​一年​内​消失​殆尽​。​我​向​你​保证​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 shou3tou2 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 hen3 duo1 le5，dan4 $(l.name)……wo3men5 bu4neng2 hu1shi4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。ru2guo3 zhi4zhi1bu4li3 de5hua4，wo3men5 shu2zhi1 de5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jiang1 zai4 yi1 nian2 nei4 xiao1shi1 dai4jin4。wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"We've got a job to prepare for, $(l.name). I don't have any more time to talk.\n"
"\n"
"Hit me up after the run if you like. But for now, I need some space."
msgstr ""
"我们​还​得​做事​前​准备​，​$(l.name)​，​我​没​时间​陪​你​聊天​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​真想​聊​的话​，​就​等​跑​完​这趟​差事​再说​吧​。​但​现在​，​我​需要​一些​空间​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hai2 de2 zuo4shi4 qian2 zhun3bei4，$(l.name)，wo3 mei2 shi2jian1 pei2 ni3 liao2tian1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1 xiang3 liao2 de5hua4，jiu4 deng3 pao2 wan2 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 zai4shuo1 ba1。dan4 xian4zai4，wo3 xu1yao4 yi1xie1 kong1jian1。"

msgid ""
"We've got bigger things to worry about than APEX. We need to find out what "
"Vauclair is up to."
msgstr ""
"比起​APEX​的​事​，​我们​还有​更大​的​事情​要​考虑​。​我们​必须​查​清楚​沃​克莱尔​在​搞​什么​名堂​。\n"
"bi3qi3 APEX de5 shi4，wo3men5 hai2you3 geng1 dai4 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 kao3lu:4。wo3men5 bi4xu1 cha2 qing1chu5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 zai4 gao3 shen2me5 ming2tang5。"

msgid "We've got company! Blast 'em!"
msgstr ""
"发现​敌人​！​干掉​他们​！\n"
"fa1xian4 di2ren2！gan4diao4 ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"We've got hostiles! This clearly isn't a data vault... we need to get out of"
" here fast."
msgstr ""
"发现​敌人​！​这​显然​不是​什么​数据库​……​我们​得​赶紧​离开​这里​。\n"
"fa1xian4 di2ren2！zhe4 xian3ran2 bu4shi4 shen2me5 shu4ju4ku4……wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"We've got no choice.\n"
"\n"
"If we don’t stop Audran from releasing that dragon, everyone in the Kreuzbasar is dead. "
msgstr ""
"我们​别无选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​不能​阻止​奥​德兰​释放​巨龙​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​就​都​死定了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 Ao4de2lan2 shi4fang4 ju4long2 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 jiu4 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"We've got no choice.\n"
"\n"
"If we don’t stop Vauclair from releasing that dragon, everyone in the Kreuzbasar is dead."
msgstr ""
"我们​别无选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​不能​阻止​沃​克莱尔​释放​巨龙​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​就​都​死定了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 shi4fang4 ju4long2 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 jiu4 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"We've got no choice.\n"
"\n"
"If we don’t stop Vauclair from releasing that dragon, everyone in the Kreuzbasar is dead. "
msgstr ""
"我们​别无选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​不能​阻止​沃​克莱尔​释放​巨龙​的话​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​所有人​就​都​死定了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 shi4fang4 ju4long2 de5hua4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 suo3you3ren2 jiu4 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid "We've got some leads, yeah."
msgstr ""
"我们​有些​线索​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 you3xie1 xian4suo3 le5。"

msgid "We've got some questions for you. You'd better have answers."
msgstr ""
"我们​有些​问题​要​问​你​。​你​最好​老实​回答​。\n"
"wo3men5 you3xie1 wen4ti2 yao4 wen4 ni3。ni3 zui4hao3 lao3shi5 hui2da2。"

msgid "We've got the cheapest soykaf in Berlin, guaranteed!"
msgstr ""
"我们​这里​有全​柏林​最​便宜​的​豆​咖​！\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4li3 you3 quan2 bo2lin2 zui4 bian4yi2 de5 dou4 ka1！"

msgid ""
"We've heard Gunari grumbling, more than usual. We've seen worry creasing "
"Maliit's normally happy face. And there's already been violence in Zaak's "
"area of... interest."
msgstr ""
"我们​听到​古纳里​的​抱怨​比​往常​更​多​。​我们​看见​忧虑​在​玛丽​特​那​张常带​笑容​的​脸上​刻​出​皱纹​。​而​扎克​的​……​关注​区域​甚至​发生​了​暴力事件​。\n"
"wo3men5 ting1dao4 gu3 na4 li3 de5 bao4yuan4 bi3 wang3chang2 geng1 duo1。wo3men5 kan4jian4 you1lu:4 zai4 ma3li4 te4 na4 zhang1 chang2 dai4 xiao4rong2 de5 lian3 shang4 ke4 chu1 zhou4wen2。er2 Zha1ke4 de5……guan1zhu4 qu1yu4 shen4zhi4 fa1sheng1 le5 bao4 li4 shi4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"We've lived down here, under the Kreuzbasar, for years. For all that time, this place has provided refuge from the world above.\n"
"\n"
"We traded our labor for sustenance, both for ourselves and for our feral brothers. And we survived."
msgstr ""
"我们​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​下面​住​了​很多年​。​一直​以来​，​这里​都​是​我们​的​避风港​，​免遭​地表​世界​的​迫害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​用​劳动​换取​食物​，​既​是​为了​我们​自己​，​也​是​为了​那些​更​凶残​的​族裔​。​我们​就​这样​活​了​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 xia4mian4 zhu4 le5 hen3 duo1 nian2。yi1zhi2 yi3lai2，zhe4li3 dou1 shi4 wo3men5 de5 bi4feng1gang3，mian3zao1 di4biao3 shi4jie4 de5 po4hai4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yong4 lao2dong4 huan4qu3 shi2wu4，ji4 shi4 wei4le5 wo3men5 zi4ji3，ye3 shi4 wei4le5 na4xie1 geng1 xiong1can2 de5 zu2yi4。wo3men5 jiu4 zhe4yang4 huo2 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"We've reached out to our contacts within the UCAS government for comment on "
"these allegations, but as of the time of this report, they have not returned"
" our calls."
msgstr ""
"我们​已​联系​加​美​合众国​政府​内部​人士​就​这些​指控​发表​评论​，​但​截至​本报​道​发布​时​，​对方​尚未​回复​我们​的​电话​。\n"
"wo3men5 yi3 lian2xi4 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 zheng4fu3 nei4bu4 ren2shi4 jiu4 zhe4xie1 zhi3kong4 fa1biao3 ping2lun4，dan4 jie2zhi4 ben3bao4 dao4 fa1bu4 shi2，dui4fang1 shang4wei4 hui2fu4 wo3men5 de5 dian4hua4。"

msgid ""
"We've stopped you for now. The kids that you've lured here are going someplace safe. That isn't nothing, Harrow.\n"
"\n"
"It's everything."
msgstr ""
"我们​今天​阻止​了​你​。​你​引诱​来​的​孩子​们​会​去往​安全​之地​。​这​不​叫​“​一事无成​”​，​哈罗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就是​最​重要​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jin1tian1 zu3zhi3 le5 ni3。ni3 yin3you4 lai2 de5 hai2zi5 men5 hui4 qu4wang3 an1quan2 zhi1 de5。zhe4 bu4 jiao4“yi1shi4wu2cheng2”，ha1luo2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "We've worked together, but we've never had a chance to talk."
msgstr ""
"我们​以前​合作​过​，​但​我们​应该​没说​过话​。\n"
"wo3men5 yi3qian2 he2zuo4 guo4，dan4 wo3men5 ying1gai1 mei2 shuo1 guo4 hua4。"

msgid ""
"We... ah... we sent some volunteers. Brave chaps, you know - they walked into the rift itself, carrying food an' water and towing rope lines. My own cousin went in there.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He does his best to force a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Haven't seen any of 'em come back yet, but there's still hope."
msgstr ""
"我们​……​啊​……​我们​派​了​些​志愿者​进去​。​都​是​些​勇敢​的​家伙​—​—​他们​直接​走进​裂隙​里​，​带​着​食物​和​水​，​还​拖​着​绳索​。​我亲​表弟​也​去​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​勉强​挤出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​至今​还​没见​任何人​回来​，​但​希望​还​在​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5……a1……wo3men5 pai4 le5 xie1 zhi4yuan4zhe3 jin4qu4。dou1 shi4 xie1 yong3gan3 de5 jia1huo5——ta1men5 zhi2jie1 zou3jin4 lie4xi4 li3，dai4 zhao2 shi2wu4 he4 shui3，hai2 tuo1 zhao2 sheng2suo3。wo3 qin1 biao3di4 ye3 qu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mian3qiang3 ji3chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi4jin1 hai2 mei2 jian4 ren4 he2 ren2 hui2lai5，dan4 xi1wang4 hai2 zai4。"

msgid "Weak!"
msgstr ""
"虚弱​！\n"
"xu1ruo4！"

msgid ""
"Weakened, the Heart of Feuerstelle stumbles backward. The barn fire stench "
"of it intensifies, and its chorus of voices devolves into a cacophony of "
"animal shrieking. The fluttering butterflies in your chest become razor "
"blades, and every shriek is accompanied by a white-hot burst of pain."
msgstr ""
"火坑​之心​显露出​虚弱​之势​，​踉跄​后退​。​它​身上​那股​谷仓​焚烧​般的​恶臭​愈发​浓烈​，​它​宛如​合唱​般的​声音​也​变成​了​动物​的​嘶吼​。​你​胸中​翩跹​的​蝴蝶​化作​利刃​，​每​声尖叫​都​伴随​着​灼热​的​剧痛​爆发​。\n"
"huo3keng1 zhi1 xin1 xian3lu4chu1 xu1ruo4 zhi1 shi4，liang4qiang4 hou4tui4。ta1 shen1shang5 na4 gu3 gu3cang1 fen2shao1 ban1 de5 e4chou4 yu4fa1 nong2lie4，ta1 wan3ru2 he2chang4 ban1 de5 sheng1yin1 ye3 bian4cheng2 le5 dong4wu4 de5 si1hou3。ni3 xiong1zhong1 pian1xian1 de5 hu2die2 hua4zuo4 li4ren4，mei3 sheng1 jian1 jiao4 dou1 ban4sui2 zhao2 zhuo2re4 de5 ju4tong4 bao4fa1。"

msgid ""
"Weakened, the spirit's form flickers and sparks. The burning coals that cling to its body fall off in clumps, and its searing antlers begin to cool.\n"
"\n"
"The chorus of lilting voices warbles and shrieks as its body transmogrifies into something else."
msgstr ""
"精魂​显露出​虚弱​之势​，​迸射​出​微光​与​火花​。​附着​在​它​身上​的​灼热​炭块​成团​脱落​，​炽烈​的​鹿角​也​渐渐​冷却​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​的​躯体​蜕变​为​另​一种​形态​，​那​宛如​合唱​般的​声音​也​夹杂着​嘶鸣​与​尖叫​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1hun2 xian3lu4chu1 xu1ruo4 zhi1 shi4，beng4 she4 chu1 wei1guang1 yu4 huo3hua1。fu4zhuo2 zai4 ta1 shen1shang5 de5 zhuo2re4 tan4 kuai4 cheng2 tuan2 tuo1luo4，chi4lie4 de5 lu4jiao3 ye3 jian4jian4 leng3que4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 qu1ti3 tui4bian4 wei2 ling4 yi1zhong3 xing2tai4，na4 wan3ru2 he2chang4 ban1 de5 sheng1yin1 ye3 jia1 za2 zhao2 si1ming2 yu4 jian1jiao4。"

msgid "Weapon Rack"
msgstr ""
"武器​架\n"
"wu3qi4 jia4"

msgid "Weapons"
msgstr ""
"武器\n"
"wu3qi4"

msgid "Weapons Specialist"
msgstr ""
"武器专家\n"
"wu3 qi4 zhuan1 jia1"

msgid "Wednesday"
msgstr ""
"星期三\n"
"xing1qi1san1"

msgid "Welcome back!"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​！\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5！"

msgid "Welcome back! Can I getcha something else?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​！​要来点​别的​吗​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5！yao4 lai2 dian3 bie2de5 ma5？"

msgid "Welcome back! What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​！​我能​为​你​做​什么​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5！wo3 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Welcome back! What can I get for you?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​！​我能​为​你​做​什么​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5！wo3 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Welcome back, $(l.freund)! The new work center is in full swing, and those trode nets that we purchased with your donations have been in constant rotation.\n"
"\n"
"Now, what can I do for you today?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​$(l.freund)​！​新​的​工作​中心​正在​紧锣密鼓​地​建设​中​，​我们​用​你​的​捐款​购买​的​电极​网络​也​已​开始​轮换​使用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那么​，​我​有​什么​能​为​你​做​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，$(l.freund)！xin1 de5 gong1zuo4 zhong1xin1 zheng4zai4 jin3luo2mi4gu3 de5 jian4she4 zhong4，wo3men5 yong4 ni3 de5 juan1kuan3 gou4mai3 de5 dian4ji2 wang3luo4 ye3 yi3 kai1shi3 lun2huan4 shi3yong4。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，wo3 you3 shen2me5 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Welcome back, $(l.freund)! Your donations have been extremely helpful; thanks to your assistance, many of the Kreuzbasar's poorest residents will be able to ride out the winter in comfort.\n"
"\n"
"What can I do for you today?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​$(l.freund)​！​你​的​捐款​发挥​了​极大​作用​；​多亏​了​你​的​援助​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​许多​最​贫困​的​居民​才能​舒适​地​度过​这个​冬天​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​什么​能​为​你​做​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，$(l.freund)！ni3 de5 juan1kuan3 fa1hui1 le5 ji2da4 zuo4yong4 ； duo1kui1 le5 ni3 de5 yuan2zhu4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 xu3duo1 zui4 pin2kun4 de5 ju1min2 cai2neng2 shu1shi4 de5 du4guo4 zhe4ge5 dong1tian1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 shen2me5 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 de5 ma5？"

msgid "Welcome back, $(l.freund). What can ol' Zaak getcha?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​$(l.freund)​。​老​扎克​能​给​你​来​点​什么​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，$(l.freund)。lao3 Zha1ke4 neng2 gei3 ni3 lai2 dian3 shen2me5？"

msgid "Welcome back, $(l.name). How did the meeting with Frau Müller go?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​$(l.name)​。​和​穆勒​女士​的​会面​结果​如何​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，$(l.name)。he4 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 de5 hui4mian4 jie1guo3 ru2he2？"

msgid ""
"Welcome back, $(l.name). You are always welcome here.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's the funniest thing. When I look at you, do you know what I see?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​$(l.name)​。​这里​随时欢迎​你​光临​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是太​有趣​了​。​你​知道​在​我​看​你​时​，​我​眼中​看到​了​什么​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，$(l.name)。zhe4li3 sui2 shi2 huan1 ying2 ni3 guang1lin2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1 shi4 tai4 you3qu4 le5。ni3 zhi1dao4 zai4 wo3 kan4 ni3 shi2，wo3 yan3zhong1 kan4dao4 le5 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "Welcome back, dear. I trust all things are settled?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​亲爱​的​。​我​想​一切​都​处理​妥当​了​吧​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，qin1ai4 de5。wo3 xiang3 yi1qie4 dou1 chu3li3 tuo3dang5 le5 ba1？"

msgid "Welcome back, friend! Can I interest you in more weaponry?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​朋友​！​想​买点​武器​吗​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，peng2you5！xiang3 mai3 dian3 wu3qi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Welcome back, friend. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Aljernon extends a hand to help you to your feet. Absinthe shifts slightly to allow you to stand.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​伸手​扶​你​起身​。​苦艾​酒​微微​挪动​身子​，​让​你​得以​站稳​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 shen1shou3 fu2 ni3 qi3shen1。ku3ai4 jiu3 wei1wei1 nuo2dong4 shen1zi5，rang4 ni3 de2yi3 zhan4wen3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Welcome back, runner."
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​，​狂奔​者​。\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid "Welcome back."
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​。\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5。"

msgid "Welcome back. What can I do for you, my friend?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​。​我能​为​你​做​什么​，​朋友​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5。wo3 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5，peng2you5？"

msgid "Welcome back. You need some weapons? Some ammunition, perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回来​。​你​需要​武器​吗​？​还是​要​买点​弹药​？\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5。ni3 xu1yao4 wu3qi4 ma5？hai2shi5 yao4 mai3 dian3 dan4yao4？"

msgid "Welcome home, Glory."
msgstr ""
"欢迎​回家​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2jia1，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid ""
"Welcome to Gesundbrunnen Station. Please select an option from the menu below.\n"
"\n"
">>DATA CORRUPTED\n"
">>DATA CORRUPTED\n"
">>3. Station History\n"
">>4. Route Information\n"
">>DATA CORRUPTED\n"
">>6. Enter Custom Query"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​来到​健康​泉​车站​。​请​从​下方​菜单中选择​一项​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​>​数据​已损坏​\n"
"​>​>​数据​已损坏​\n"
"​>​>​3​.​ ​车站​历史​\n"
"​>​>​4​.​ ​路线​信息​\n"
"​>​>​数据​已损坏​\n"
"​>​>​6​.​ ​输入​自定义​查询\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 lai2dao4 jian4kang1 quan2 che1zhan4。qing3 cong2 xia4fang1 cai4 dan1 zhong4 xuan3 ze2 yi1 xiang4。\n"
"\n"
">>shu4ju4 yi3 sun3 huai4 \n"
">>shu4ju4 yi3 sun3 huai4 \n"
">>3. che1zhan4 li4shi3 \n"
">>4 . lu4xian4 xin4xi1 \n"
">>shu4ju4 yi3 sun3 huai4 \n"
">>6 . shu1ru4 zi4ding4yi4 cha2xun2"

msgid "Welcome to Karl's General Store. What can I do for ya?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎光临​卡尔​的​杂货店​。​需要​点​什么​？\n"
"huan1ying2guang1lin2 ka3er3 de5 za2huo4dian4。xu1yao4 dian3 shen2me5？"

msgid "Welcome to the Data Haven. Can I help you with something?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​来到​“​数据​港湾​”​。​有​什么​能​帮​你​的​吗​？\n"
"huan1ying2 lai2dao4“shu4ju4 gang3wan1”。you3 shen2me5 neng2 bang1 ni3 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Welcome to the Hub, brother.\n"
"\n"
"Are you here to share in the splendor of Communion? If so, I can show you to an empty terminal."
msgstr ""
"欢迎​来到​中枢​，​兄弟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​来​此​是​为了​分享​共融​的​荣光​吗​？​如果​是​的话​，​我​可以​帮​你​找​一台​空闲​的​终端​。\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 lai2dao4 zhong1shu1，xiong1di4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 lai2 ci3 shi4 wei4le5 fen1xiang3 gong4 rong2 de5 rong2guang1 ma5？ru2guo3 shi4 de5hua4，wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 zhao3 yi1 tai2 kong4xian2 de5 zhong1duan1。"

msgid ""
"Welcome to the Hub, sister.\n"
"\n"
"Are you here to share in the splendor of Communion? \n"
"\n"
"If so, I can show you to an empty terminal."
msgstr ""
"欢迎​来到​中枢​，​姐妹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​来​此​是​为了​分享​共融​的​荣光​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​是​的话​，​我​可以​帮​你​找​一台​空闲​的​终端​。\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 lai2dao4 zhong1shu1，jie3mei4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 lai2 ci3 shi4 wei4le5 fen1xiang3 gong4 rong2 de5 rong2guang1 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 shi4 de5hua4，wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 zhao3 yi1 tai2 kong4xian2 de5 zhong1duan1。"

msgid ""
"Welcome to the Triage Cyberclinic, my friend.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He extends his hand to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I am Dr. Xabier Ezkibel. And your name is...?"
msgstr ""
"欢迎​来到​“​分诊​”​义体​诊所​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向​你​伸出手​来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​沙​比尔​·​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​。​请问​阁下​是​……​？\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 lai2dao4“fen4 zhen3” yi4 ti3 zhen3suo3，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 shen1 chu1 shou3 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 sha1 bi3er3 · Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1。qing3wen4 ge2xia4 shi4……？"

msgid "Welcome to the club. I wouldnt' worry too much about it... I don't."
msgstr ""
"欢迎​加入​。​我​不会​太过​担心​这个​……​嗯​。\n"
"huan1ying2 jia1ru4。wo3 bu4hui4 tai4guo4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5……en1。"

msgid "Welcome to the team, Dante."
msgstr ""
"欢迎​入队​，​但丁​。\n"
"huan1ying2 ru4 dui4，dan4ding1。"

msgid "Well *that’s* clear as mud."
msgstr ""
"这​可​真是太​清楚​了​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3 zhen1 shi4 tai4 qing1chu5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well done, $(l.name). I'm not seeing any comm chatter to indicate that "
"Knight Errant is aware of your presence."
msgstr ""
"干得​漂亮​，​$(l.name)​。​从​通讯​频道​的​对话​来看​，​游侠​骑士​丝毫​没有​察觉​你​的​存在​。\n"
"gan4 de2 piao4liang5，$(l.name)。cong2 tong1xun4 pin2dao4 de5 dui4hua4 lai2 kan4，you2Xia2qi2shi4 si1hao2 mei2you3 cha2jue2 ni3 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"Well done, $(l.name). I'm not seeing any comm chatter to indicate that Knight Errant is aware of your presence.\n"
"\n"
"In addition, your manufactured power outage is causing ongoing problems for both Knight Errant and Aztechnology."
msgstr ""
"干得​漂亮​，​$(l.name)​。​从​通讯​频道​的​对话​来看​，​游侠​骑士​丝毫​没有​察觉​你​的​存在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此外​，​你​制造​的​断电​事件​正​持续​给​游侠​骑士​和​阿兹特​科技​带来​麻烦​。\n"
"\n"
"gan4 de2 piao4liang5，$(l.name)。cong2 tong1xun4 pin2dao4 de5 dui4hua4 lai2 kan4，you2Xia2qi2shi4 si1hao2 mei2you3 cha2jue2 ni3 de5 cun2zai4。\n"
"\n"
"ci3wai4，ni3 zhi4zao4 de5 duan4dian4 shi4jian4 zheng1 chi2xu4 gei3 you2Xia2qi2shi4 he4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 dai4lai2 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"Well done, noble stranger! Well done!\n"
"\n"
"You have *defended* this realm from the ravening Jubuthon Hordes, just as you vanquished the ravening Billy!"
msgstr ""
"干得​好​，​高贵​的​陌生人​！​干得​好​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​守护​*​了​这片​领域​，​抵御​了​贪婪​的​朱布松​部落​，​就​像​你​曾​击败​贪婪​的​比利​一样​！\n"
"\n"
"gan4 de2 hao3，gao1gui4 de5 mo4sheng1ren2！gan4 de2 hao3！\n"
"\n"
"ni3*shou3hu4*le5 zhe4 pian1 ling3yu4，di3yu4 le5 tan1lan2 de5 zhu1 bu4 song1 bu4luo4，jiu4 xiang4 ni3 ceng2 ji1bai4 tan1lan2 de5 bi3li4 yi1yang4！"

msgid ""
"Well enough, but it was a pretty heavy blow for me. The runner that died... "
"well, we were close."
msgstr ""
"他们​倒​还好​，​只是​这事​对​我​打击​挺大​的​。​那个​死去​的​狂奔​者​……​我们​关系​挺​亲密​的​。\n"
"ta1men5 dao3 hai2hao3，zhi3shi4 zhe4 shi4 dui4 wo3 da3ji1 ting3 dai4 de5。na4ge5 si3qu4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3……wo3men5 guan1xi5 ting3 qin1mi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Well enough. The Engineer is dead, and I found out who he was working for."
msgstr ""
"简直​不能​更棒​了​。​工程师​死​了​，​我​也​查出​了​他​背后​的​雇主​。\n"
"jian3zhi2 bu4neng2 geng1 bang4 le5。gong1cheng2shi1 si3 le5，wo3 ye3 cha2chu1 le5 ta1 bei4hou4 de5 gu4zhu3。"

msgid ""
"Well then, chief, it sounds like my job here is done! I'll just clear the "
"comms and let you finish up."
msgstr ""
"那好​吧​，​头儿​，​看来​我​的​任务​已经​完成​了​！​我​之后​就​不​说话​了​，​等​你​结束​收尾​工作​。\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1，tou2r5，kan4lai5 wo3 de5 ren4wu5 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2 le5！wo3 zhi1hou4 jiu4 bu4 shuo1hua4 le5，deng3 ni3 jie2shu4 shou1wei3 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Well then, our purposes run parallel. To reach the basement, you must use the elevator; the stairs will not reach it.\n"
"\n"
"There is no other way. \n"
"\n"
"When we took over from the Arbeiters, I removed the power coupling from the elevator controls. Had to keep Ullrich out of his primary armory."
msgstr ""
"那么​我们​的​目标​就是​一致​的​。​要​去往​地下室​，​你​必须​使用​电梯​；​楼梯​无法​到达​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​其他​办法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我们​从​工人​帮手​中​接管​这里​时​，​我移​除了​电梯​控制​的​电源​耦合​器​。​我​不能​让​乌尔里​希​进入​他​的​主​武器库​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5 wo3men5 de5 mu4biao1 jiu4shi4 yi1zhi4 de5。yao4 qu4wang3 di4xia4shi4，ni3 bi4xu1 shi3yong4 dian4ti1 ； lou2ti1 wu2fa3 dao4da2 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 qi2ta1 ban4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3men5 cong2 gong1ren2 bang1shou5 zhong4 jie1guan3 zhe4li3 shi2，wo3 yi2 chu2le5 dian4ti1 kong4zhi4 de5 dian4yuan2 ou3he2 qi4。wo3 bu4neng2 rang4 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 jin4ru4 ta1 de5 zhu3 wu3 qi4 ku4。"

msgid ""
"Well then, we have nothing further to discuss.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The mage dismisses you with a wave.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Return when he is dead."
msgstr ""
"那么​，​我们​就​没什么​好​说​的​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​法师​挥手​示意​你​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​他​死​了​再​来​找​我​。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，wo3men5 jiu4 mei2shen2me5 hao3 shuo1 de5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 hui1shou3 shi4yi4 ni3 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3 ta1 si3 le5 zai4 lai2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Well then... *why* did you let me *do it?*\n"
"\n"
"I thought that we were friends!"
msgstr ""
"那么​……​你​*​为什么​*​要​放任​我​*​这么​做​*​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以为​我们​是​朋友​！\n"
"\n"
"na4me5……ni3*wei4shen2me5*yao4 fang4ren4 wo3*zhe4me5 zuo4*？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3wei2 wo3men5 shi4 peng2you5！"

msgid ""
"Well, $(l.name), I *was* able to recover a file... but unfortunately, that's all that I'll ever be able to pull off of this thing.\n"
"\n"
"All that anyone will, truth be told."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​*​确实​*​成功​恢复​了​一份​文件​……​但​遗憾​的​是​，​我​也​只能​弄​到​这么​多​信息​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​恐怕​换​谁​来​都​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3*que4shi2*cheng2gong1 hui1fu4 le5 yi1 fen4 wen2jian4……dan4 yi2han4 de5 shi4，wo3 ye3 zhi3neng2 long4 dao4 zhe4me5 duo1 xin4xi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，kong3pa4 huan4 shei2 lai2 dou1 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"Well, $(l.name), I am *not* pleased to meet you! You stand as a trespasser in my sovereign territory, and you have *murdered* my citizens!\n"
"\n"
"You have invaded my home!"
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​我​可​一点​也​*​不​*​高兴​认识​你​！​你​擅闯​我​的​主权​领地​，​还​*​屠杀​*​了​我​的​臣民​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​侵入​了​我​的​家园​！\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 ke3 yi1dian3 ye3*bu4*gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3！ni3 shan4chuang3 wo3 de5 zhu3quan2 ling3di4，hai2*tu2sha1*le5 wo3 de5 chen2min2！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 qin1ru4 le5 wo3 de5 jia1yuan2！"

msgid ""
"Well, $(l.name). For once, you and I are in complete agreement.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We both knew what we were here to do. Good on you for stepping up and doing it."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​这次​总算​和​我​意见​完全一致​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​来​这里​就是​跑​差事​的​。​你​站​出来​完成​了​任务​，​这​是​件​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 zhe4 ci4 zong3suan4 he4 wo3 yi4jian4 wan2 quan2 yi1 zhi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 jiu4shi4 pao2 cha4shi4 de5。ni3 zhan4 chu1lai2 wan2cheng2 le5 ren4wu5，zhe4 shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Well, *whatever* it is, it isn't moving. I think that it's on standby.\n"
"\n"
"The lights are on, but nobody's home."
msgstr ""
"不管​它​是​*​什么​*​，​反正​它​没有​要动​的​意思​。​我​看​它​是​处于​某种​待机​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​好像​开着机​，​不过​程序​没跑​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ta1 shi4*shen2me5*，fan3zheng4 ta1 mei2you3 yao4 dong4 de5 yi4si5。wo3 kan4 ta1 shi4 chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 kai1 zhao2 ji1，bu4guo4 cheng2xu4 mei2 pao2 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"Well, He has seen fit to grant me a new ability.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gestures at the ground near his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Namely, this."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​祂​赐予​了​我​一项​新​能力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​指​了​指脚边​的​地面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​，​就​这个​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，ta1 ci4yu3 le5 wo3 yi1 xiang4 xin1 neng2li4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3 le5 zhi3 jiao3 bian1 de5 di4mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4，jiu4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"Well, I ain't that kind of rigger.\n"
"\n"
"Drones ain't my thing, so much."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​不是​那种​机师​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不是​很​喜欢​无人机​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 bu4shi4 na4zhong3 ji1shi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 hen3 xi3huan5 wu2ren2ji1。"

msgid ""
"Well, I am a businessman, and I suppose that you're a customer. Who am I to "
"say no?"
msgstr ""
"我​是​做买卖​的​，​你​又​是​我​的​顾客​，​我​怎么​能​拒绝​呢​？\n"
"wo3 shi4 zuo4mai3mai4 de5，ni3 you4 shi4 wo3 de5 gu4ke4，wo3 zen3me5 neng2 ju4jue2 ni2？"

msgid "Well, I am a fan of good stuff."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​是​喜欢​好​东西​。\n"
"en1，wo3 shi4 xi3huan5 hao3 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"Well, I couldn't really hear the whole conversation... it was all muffled. But what I could hear was kind of weird.\n"
"\n"
"Mr. Harrow said some stuff about a shrine, and then it sounded like he changed the subject, 'cause he started talking about dinner.\n"
"\n"
"Something about \"chopping up meat.\""
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​其实​没​能​听到​对话​的​全部内容​……​他们​的​声音​都​很​模糊​。​但​我​能​听到​的​部分​有点​奇怪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​先生​提到​了​一个​神龛​，​然后​好像​突然​转​了​话题​，​开始​聊起​晚餐​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​提到​什么​“​切肉​”​之类​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 qi2shi2 mei2 neng2 ting1dao4 dui4hua4 de5 quan2 bu4 nei4 rong2……ta1men5 de5 sheng1yin1 dou1 hen3 mo2hu5。dan4 wo3 neng2 ting1dao4 de5 bu4fen5 you3dian3 qi2guai4。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 xian1sheng5 ti2dao4 le5 yi1ge5 shen2kan1，ran2hou4 hao3xiang4 tu1ran2 zhuai3 le5 hua4ti2，kai1shi3 liao2 qi3 wan3can1。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 ti2dao4 shen2me5“qie1 rou4” zhi1lei4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Well, I don't know all that much, chief... I wasn't a member of gang leadership or anything. \n"
"\n"
"I'm not really sure why you care, either."
msgstr ""
"头儿​，​我​没​多少​了解​……​我​又​不是​帮派​首领​什么​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​觉得​你​也​不是​很​在乎​这个​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，wo3 mei2 duo1shao3 liao3jie3……wo3 you4 bu4shi4 bang1pai4 shou3ling3 shen2me5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 jue2de5 ni3 ye3 bu4shi4 hen3 zai4hu5 zhe4ge5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, I don't know. Why don't you tell me?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks you dead in the eye, his expression neutral.\n"
"\n"
"Then that sickly grin returns, and he starts to giggle again.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​不​知道​啊​。​你​觉得​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​直勾勾​地​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​。​有​那么​一会儿​，​他​的​表情​毫无​变化​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​那​病态​的​笑容​再次​回到​他​脸上​，​他​又​忍不住​笑了起来​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 a1。ni3 jue2de5 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2gou1gou1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。you3 na4me5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 de5 biao3qing2 hao2wu2 bian4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4 na4 bing4tai4 de5 xiao4rong2 zai4ci4 hui2dao4 ta1 lian3 shang4，ta1 you4 ren3bu5zhu4 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Well, I don't see any smoke pouring out of your ears, so it looks like you "
"made it out okay."
msgstr ""
"我​没​看到​你​的​耳朵​里​冒烟​，​所以​看起来​你​安然无恙​地​逃出来​了​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 kan4dao4 ni3 de5 er3duo5 li3 mao4yan1，suo3yi3 kan4qi3lai5 ni3 an1ran2wu2yang4 de5 tao2 chu1 lai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, I got that custom software off of Plotz, right?\n"
"\n"
"The next time that Grinder jacks into the Matrix, I'm gonna be there, waiting for him. And I'm gonna use that software to see to it that Grinder never jacks back out again."
msgstr ""
"我​弄​到​了​普​洛茨​的​自制​软件​，​记得​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​下次​“​绞肉机​”​进入​矩阵​的​时候​，​我会​在​那里​等​着​他​的​。​然后​我会​利用​这​软件​来​确保​“​绞肉机​”​永远​别想​再​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 long4 dao4 le5 Pu3luo4ci2 de5 zi4zhi4 ruan3jian4，ji4de5 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"xia4ci4“jiao3rou4ji1” jin4ru4 ju3zhen4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 hui4 zai4 na4li5 deng3 zhao2 ta1 de5。ran2hou4 wo3 hui4 li4yong4 zhe4 ruan3jian4 lai2 que4bao3“jiao3rou4ji1” yong3yuan3 bie4 xiang3 zai4 li2kai1。"

msgid "Well, I guess I can't fault their enthusiasm."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​有​热情​总​不是​坏事​。\n"
"en1，you3 re4qing2 zong3 bu4shi4 huai4shi4。"

msgid "Well, I guess that this is it for a while, then."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​我​想​是​时候​说​再见​了​。\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3 xiang3 shi4 shi2hou5 shuo1 zai4jian4 le5。"

msgid "Well, I guess that's a chance I'm going to have to take. Time to die!"
msgstr ""
"那​我​也​愿意​冒​这个​险​。​去死吧​！\n"
"na4 wo3 ye3 yuan4yi4 mao4 zhe4ge5 xian3。qu4 si3 ba1！"

msgid ""
"Well, I have good news for you, your highness. The door's open. You can "
"leave now."
msgstr ""
"我​有​个​好消息​告诉​你​，​陛下​。​门​已经​打开​了​，​你​可以​离开​了​。\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 hao3 xiao1 xi1 gao4su4 ni3，bi4xia4。men2 yi3jing1 da3kai1 le5，ni3 ke3yi3 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid "Well, I have to admit… your reaction does sound a bit extreme."
msgstr ""
"但​我​得​说​……​你​的​反应​确实​有点​极端​了​。\n"
"dan4 wo3 de2 shuo1……ni3 de5 fan3ying4 que4shi2 you3dian3 ji2duan1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, I know for a fact that he's worked for mafia groups operating inside and outside of Russia. And he put in a lot of time with the Lobatchevski Syndicate.\n"
"\n"
"He's taken contracts with the Triads as well. My contacts tell me that he's even done a few jobs for Tamanous."
msgstr ""
"仅​从​我​所​了解​的​来看​，​俄罗斯​内外​都​有​黑帮​团伙​和​他​合作​过​。​他​有​很长​一段时间​为洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​效力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​也​接过​三合会​的​活儿​。​我​的​线​人​说​，​他​甚至​还给​塔玛​诺斯​做过​几单​差事​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3 cong2 wo3 suo3 liao3jie3 de5 lai2 kan4，e2luo2si1 nei4wai4 dou1 you3 hei1bang1 tuan2huo3 he4 ta1 he2zuo4 guo4。ta1 you3 hen3 zhang3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 wei2 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2 xiao4li4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ye3 jie1guo4 san1he2hui4 de5 huo2r5。wo3 de5 xian4 ren2 shuo1，ta1 shen4zhi4 huan2gei3 ta3 ma3 nuo4 si1 zuo4 guo4 ji1 dan1 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"Well, I mean, it wasn't a *complete* disaster.\n"
"\n"
"I mean, we won, right? Nobody's going to cut my thumbs off, and that's what's important."
msgstr ""
"这个​，​也​不​*​完全​*​是​一场​灾难​嘛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​我们​赢​了​，​对​吧​？​没人会​切掉​我​的​拇指​，​这才​是​最​重要​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5，ye3 bu4*wan2quan2*shi4 yi1 chang2 zai1nan4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 wo3men5 ying2 le5，dui4 ba1？mei2 ren2 hui4 qie1 diao4 wo3 de5 mu3zhi3，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5。"

msgid "Well, I suppose that I can't fault their enthusiasm."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​有​热情​总​不是​坏事​。\n"
"en1，you3 re4qing2 zong3 bu4shi4 huai4shi4。"

msgid ""
"Well, I suppose that I could refuse. But that probably wouldn't be a good idea... especially not now.\n"
"\n"
"Remember, boss, the Dragonslayer is where my magic comes from. If I turn away from Him, you'd better believe that He'll turn away from me."
msgstr ""
"这么​说​吧​，​我​觉得​我​是​可以​拒绝​的​。​问题​是​这​可能​不是​什么​好​主意​……​尤其​是​现在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​我​的​魔法​可​全部​源于​屠龙​者​。​如果​我​背离​了​祂​，​祂​绝对​也​会​背弃​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，wo3 jue2de5 wo3 shi4 ke3yi3 ju4jue2 de5。wen4ti2 shi4 zhe4 ke3neng2 bu4shi4 shen2me5 hao3 zhu3yi5……you2qi2 shi4 xian4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 de5 mo2fa3 ke3 quan2bu4 yuan2yu2 tu2 long2 zhe3。ru2guo3 wo3 bei4li2 le5 ta1，ta1 jue2dui4 ye3 hui4 bei4qi4 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Well, I was always more of a kid than he was, of course. He's fifteen years older than me... in a way, he was more like a parent than a brother.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Winters pauses. His gaze drops to an invisible point on the table in front of him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So I was thinking about this time when we were on holiday. Our parents took us out the island of Poel to enjoy the beach."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​比起​他​来说​，​我​肯定​更​像​个​孩子​。​毕竟​他​比​我​年长​十五岁​……​他​对​我​而言​更​像是​父亲​而​非​长兄​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​温特斯​停​了​一下​。​他​的​目光​落​在​面前​桌子​上​一个​看不见​的​位置​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想起​了​我们​度假​时​的​情景​。​父母​带​我们​去​珀尔​岛​享受​海滩​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，bi3qi3 ta1 lai2 shuo1，wo3 ken3ding4 geng1 xiang4 ge4 hai2zi5。bi4jing4 ta1 bi3 wo3 nian2zhang3 shi2 wu3 sui4……ta1 dui4 wo3 er2yan2 geng1 xiang4 shi4 fu4qin1 er2 fei1 zhang3xiong1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 ting2 le5 yi1xia4。ta1 de5 mu4guang1 la4 zai4 mian4qian2 zhuo1zi5 shang4 yi1ge5 kan4bu5jian4 de5 wei4zhi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3qi3 le5 wo3men5 du4jia4 shi2 de5 qing2jing3。fu4mu3 dai4 wo3men5 qu4 po4 er3 dao3 xiang3shou4 hai3tan1。"

msgid "Well, I wasn't gonna say it."
msgstr ""
"你​把​我​想​说​的​都​给​说​了​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 wo3 xiang3 shuo1 de5 dou1 gei3 shuo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, I won't go down without a fight. I've still got my contacts... still "
"got my connections. And the Flux-State can be a hell of a weapon for the man"
" who knows how to manipulate it."
msgstr ""
"我​不会​坐以待毙​的​。​我​还有​我​的​人脉​……​还有​我​的​关系​。​而​对于​知道​如何​操纵​的​人​来说​，​动荡​带​绝对​是​出色​的​武器​。\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 zuo4yi3dai4bi4 de5。wo3 hai2you3 wo3 de5 ren2mai4……hai2you3 wo3 de5 guan1xi5。er2 dui4yu2 zhi1dao4 ru2he2 cao1zong4 de5 ren2 lai2 shuo1，dong4dang4 dai4 jue2dui4 shi4 chu1se4 de5 wu3qi4。"

msgid ""
"Well, I'd like to make you an offer. You help cover my escape, and I'll get "
"you into a secure vault on the top floor. Belonged to the leader of the gang"
" that used to run this place."
msgstr ""
"所以​呢​，​我​有​个​提议​。​你​掩护​我​逃出去​，​我​就​能​让​你​进到​顶层​的​保险库​。​里头​的​东西​都​属于​原本​掌管​这​地方​的​帮派​老大​。\n"
"suo3yi3 ni2，wo3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4。ni3 yan3hu4 wo3 tao2 chu1 qu4，wo3 jiu4 neng2 rang4 ni3 jin4 dao4 ding3ceng2 de5 bao3 xian3 ku4。li3tou5 de5 dong1xi1 dou1 shu3yu2 yuan2ben3 zhang3guan3 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 bang1pai4 lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"Well, I'll tell you the real story sometime, how about that?\n"
"\n"
"Right now though I have some errands to run - come over sometime and we can chat over hookah or something, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before turning her focus to a comm at her wrist..{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​等​我​改天​再​告诉​你​真相​，​怎么样​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​现在​我​得​去​办点​事​—​—​有空​过来​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转向​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"en1，deng3 wo3 gai3tian1 zai4 gao4su4 ni3 zhen1xiang4，zen3me5yang4？\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 xian4zai4 wo3 de2 qu4 ban4 dian3 shi4——you3kong4 guo4lai2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Well, I'll tell you the real story sometime, how about that?\n"
"\n"
"Right now though I have some errands to run - come over sometime and we can chat over hookah or something, ja?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lazily tips an invisible hat at you before turning her focus to a comm at her wrist.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​等​我​改天​再​告诉​你​真相​，​怎么样​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​现在​我​得​去​办点​事​—​—​有空​过来​，​我们​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​，​好​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​懒洋洋​地向​你​致意​一下​，​然后​把​注意力​转向​手腕​上​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"en1，deng3 wo3 gai3tian1 zai4 gao4su4 ni3 zhen1xiang4，zen3me5yang4？\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 xian4zai4 wo3 de2 qu4 ban4 dian3 shi4——you3kong4 guo4lai2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2，hao3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lan3yang1yang1 de5 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Well, I'll tell you, if only so it might teach you something about this "
"world we live in."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​告诉​你​，​或许​这样​能​让​你​对​我们​所​生活​的​这个​世界​有所​了解​。\n"
"en1，wo3 gao4su4 ni3，huo4xu3 zhe4yang4 neng2 rang4 ni3 dui4 wo3men5 suo3 sheng1huo2 de5 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 you3suo3 liao3jie3。"

msgid ""
"Well, I'll try to get you through this safely, but I can't make any "
"promises."
msgstr ""
"我会​尽量​保护​你​的​安全​，​但​我​不能​做​任何​保证​。\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin3liang4 bao3hu4 ni3 de5 an1quan2，dan4 wo3 bu4neng2 zuo4 ren4he2 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"Well, I'm a man of my word. Here's the control chip for the elevator. \n"
"\n"
"Just slot this into the elevator's terminal with the part you got off of Trithemius, and you should be good to go."
msgstr ""
"我​说话算话​。​这是​电梯​的​控制​芯片​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​从​特​里特​米​乌斯​那里​也​拿到​了​部件​吧​。​把​它们​一起​插进​电梯​终端​就行了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1hua4suan4hua4。zhe4 shi4 dian4ti1 de5 kong4zhi4 xin1pian4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cong2 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 na4li5 ye3 na2dao4 le5 bu4jian4 ba1。ba3 ta1men5 yi1qi3 cha1jin4 dian4ti1 zhong1duan1 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid "Well, I'm convinced. You're right, Vauclair - this is your fault."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我信​了​。​你​说得对​，​沃​克莱尔​—​—​这​都​怪​你​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 xin4 le5。ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，Wo4ke4lai2er3——zhe4 dou1 guai4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Well, I've got some hyper... got some nitro and some kamikaze somewhere "
"around here, too. But if you really want an edge, you need to get your hands"
" on some Flash."
msgstr ""
"我​这里​有​“​高能​”​……​有​“​氮冲​”​，​还有​“​神风​”​，​但​如果​你​真​想来​点​带劲​的​，​那​我​推荐​你​来​点​“​闪光​”​。\n"
"wo3 zhe4li3 you3“gao1neng2”……you3“dan4 chong1”，hai2you3“shen2 feng1”，dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1 xiang3lai2 dian3 dai4jin4 de5，na4 wo3 tui1jian4 ni3 lai2 dian3“shan3guang1”。"

msgid ""
"Well, I’m in. \n"
"\n"
"I’m getting kind of old for a shadowrunner, but I’d rather die in the shadows with you people than live… \n"
"\n"
"I don’t know…"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我会​留下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对于​暗影​狂奔​者​这行​来说​，​我​的​年纪​有点​太大​了​，​但​我​宁愿​和​你们​这些​人​一起​在​阴影​里​出生入死​，​也​不​愿意​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说不清楚​……\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 hui4 liu2xia4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yu2 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 zhe4 xing2 lai2 shuo1，wo3 de5 nian2ji4 you3dian3 tai4 dai4 le5，dan4 wo3 ning4yuan4 he4 ni3men5 zhe4xie1 ren2 yi1qi3 zai4 yin1ying3 li3 chu1sheng1ru4si3，ye3 bu4 yuan4yi4……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 bu4 qing1 chu3……"

msgid ""
"Well, I’m in. \n"
"\n"
"Losing Alexander was hard, no doubt about it. But it clarified something for me - something I’d thought of before but figured was just… wishful thinking or something.\n"
"\n"
"We can make a difference here. In people’s lives. I want to be a part of that."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我会​留下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毫无疑问​，​失去​亚历山大​确实​让​我​很​痛苦​。​但​这​也​让​我​想​明白​了​某些​事​—​—​那些​我​曾​想​过​，​却​以为​只是​……​一厢情愿​之类​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​这里​可以​有所作为​，​改变​人们​的​生活​。​而​我​想​成为​其中​的​一员​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 hui4 liu2xia4。\n"
"\n"
"hao2wu2yi2wen4，shi1qu4 ya4li4shan1da4 que4shi2 rang4 wo3 hen3 tong4ku3。dan4 zhe4 ye3 rang4 wo3 xiang3 ming2bai5 le5 mou3xie1 shi4——na4xie1 wo3 ceng2 xiang3 guo4，que4 yi3wei2 zhi3shi4……yi1xiang1qing2yuan4 zhi1lei4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 zhe4li3 ke3yi3 you3suo3zuo4wei2，gai3bian4 ren2men5 de5 sheng1huo2。er2 wo3 xiang3 cheng2wei2 qi2zhong1 de5 yi1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Well, Marta got real upset. Said, \"They're too new, they're not ready, make the older ones do it.\" Stuff like that.\n"
"\n"
"But then Mr. Harrow said some other things, and then she calmed down again. When she left, she was smiling."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​听​起来​很​不​高兴​，​说​什么​“​他们​太​年轻​了​，​还​没​准备​好​，​让​那些​年纪​大​的​去​做​吧​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​之后​哈罗​先生​说​了​些​其他​的话​，​她​又​平静下来​了​。​她​离开​的​时候​还​在​微笑​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 bu4 gao1xing4，shuo1 shen2me5“ta1men5 tai4 nian2qing1 le5，hai2 mei2 zhun3bei4 hao3，rang4 na4xie1 nian2ji4 dai4 de5 qu4 zuo4 ba1。” \n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 zhi1hou4 ha1luo2 xian1sheng5 shuo1 le5 xie1 qi2ta1 de5hua4，ta1 you4 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2 le5。ta1 li2kai1 de5 shi2hou5 hai2 zai4 wei1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"Well, Meat Grinder obviously wants that thing. And Hasenkamp isn't going to give it to you.\n"
"\n"
"If you steal it from him, I think he's going to figure out where it went. And if you kill him, Grinder takes my thumbs off.\n"
"\n"
"Damn it."
msgstr ""
"“​绞肉机​”​明显​想要​那​东西​。​哈森​坎普​是​不​可能​把​它​直接​交给​你​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​动手​偷​来​的话​，​我​想​他​会​知道​怎么回事​。​如果​你​杀​了​他​，​那​“​绞肉机​”​肯定​会​剁​了​我​的​拇指​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​的​。\n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” ming2xian3 xiang3yao4 na4 dong1xi1。Ha1sen1kan3pu3 shi4 bu4 ke3neng2 ba3 ta1 zhi2jie1 jiao1gei3 ni3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 dong4shou3 tou1 lai2 de5hua4，wo3 xiang3 ta1 hui4 zhi1dao4 zen3me5hui2shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 sha1 le5 ta1，na4“jiao3rou4ji1” ken3ding4 hui4 duo4 le5 wo3 de5 mu3zhi3。\n"
"\n"
"gai1si3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Well, Viktor went down into the sewers while I was gettin' stuff out of the truck.\n"
"\n"
"When I came back... well, I was about to climb down there, but I heard these awful screams. They went on and on. And then they just... stopped."
msgstr ""
"我​从​卡车​里​拿​东西​的​时候​，​维克多​去​了​下水道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​回来​的​时候​……​正​准备​爬下去​，​却​听到​了​可怕​的​尖叫声​一直​在​回荡​。​然后​又​突然​……​停​了​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2 ka3che1 li3 na2 dong1xi1 de5 shi2hou5，wei2 ke4 duo1 qu4 le5 xia4shui3dao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5……zheng1 zhun3bei4 pa2 xia4 qu4，que4 ting1dao4 le5 ke3pa4 de5 jian1 jiao4 sheng1 yi1zhi2 zai4 hui2dang4。ran2hou4 you4 tu1ran2……ting2 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"Well, about that... see, you've done me a favor. I recognize that. But - and this is a big \"but\" - you also know what happened here tonight.\n"
"\n"
"I can't have that getting out, for obvious reasons. Shooting one's own partner is frowned upon, even here in Drogenkippe."
msgstr ""
"这个​嘛​……​你​确实​帮​了​我​的​忙​。​我记​着​呢​。​但是​—​—​这​是​个​很​重要​的​“​但是​”​—​—​你​也​知道​了​今晚​在​这里​发生​的​所有​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​显然​，​我​绝不能​让​这些​信息​流露​出去​。​开枪​打死​自己​的​搭档​是​令人​不齿​的​行径​，​即便​在​毒​坑区​也​是​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 ma5……ni3 que4shi2 bang1 le5 wo3 de5 mang2。wo3 ji4 zhao2 ni2。dan4shi4——zhe4 shi4 ge4 hen3 zhong4yao4 de5“dan4shi4”——ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 le5 jin1wan3 zai4 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 de5 suo3you3 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，wo3 jue2 bu4 neng2 rang4 zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 liu2lu4 chu1qu4。kai1qiang1 da3si3 zi4ji3 de5 da1dang4 shi4 ling4ren2 bu4chi3 de5 xing2jing4，ji2bian4 zai4 du2 keng1 qu1 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"Well, all right, friend. What else would you like to talk about? Maybe you'd"
" like to make a purchase?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​朋友​。​你​想​聊点​别的​什么​？​也许​你​想要​买点​东西​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，peng2you5。ni3 xiang3 liao2 dian3 bie2de5 shen2me5？ye3xu3 ni3 xiang3yao4 mai3 dian3 dong1xi1？"

msgid ""
"Well, alright. I suppose I've heard a lot about you around the Kreuzbasar, "
"it's only fair you know a bit about me."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​听说​过​你​不少​事​，​那​你​也​该​了解​一下​我​才​公平​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ting1shuo1 guo4 ni3 bu4shao3 shi4，na4 ni3 ye3 gai1 liao3jie3 yi1xia4 wo3 cai2 gong1ping2。"

msgid ""
"Well, any ideas? Something tells me we're going to have more company soon..."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​想​出​什么​了​吗​？​我​总​觉得​马上​就要​有人​来​招呼​咱们​了​……\n"
"e4，xiang3 chu1 shen2me5 le5 ma5？wo3 zong3 jue2de5 ma3shang4 jiu4yao4 you3ren2 lai2 zhao1hu5 zan2men5 le5……"

msgid ""
"Well, anyway, good on you both.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises his bottle to you in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She was a wonderful woman, and I hope that your time together was happy."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​无论如何​，​恭喜​你​俩​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​举起​酒瓶​向​你​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​是​个​十分​优秀​的​女人​，​希望​你们​共度​的​那段​时光​充满​幸福​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wu2lun4ru2he2，gong1xi3 ni3 lia3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 shi2fen1 you1xiu4 de5 nu:3ren2，xi1wang4 ni3men5 gong4 du4 de5 na4 duan4 shi2guang1 chong1man3 xing4fu2。"

msgid ""
"Well, anyway, we *won,* chief. We kicked ass and took names, and saved a lot of lives to boot.\n"
"\n"
"Not bad for a day's work."
msgstr ""
"总之​我们​*​赢​了​*​，​头儿​。​我们​干掉​了​凶残​的​敌人​，​也​拯救​了​许多​生命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​一天​没​白干​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 wo3men5*ying2 le5*，tou2r5。wo3men5 gan4diao4 le5 xiong1can2 de5 di2ren2，ye3 zheng3jiu4 le5 xu3duo1 sheng1ming4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1 tian1 mei2 bai2 gan4。"

msgid ""
"Well, anyway. I'm glad that we were able to put those worries about the past"
" behind you."
msgstr ""
"总而言之​，​我​很​高兴​能​让​你​放下​这些​过去​的​忧虑​。\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 rang4 ni3 fang4xia4 zhe4xie1 guo4qu4 de5 you1lu:4。"

msgid ""
"Well, anyway. We did the job, Thorvald's dead, we got paid.\n"
"\n"
"I'm gonna go ahead and call it a win for the good guys."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我们​完成​了​工作​，​托​瓦尔德​死​了​，​我们​拿到​了​报酬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这样​吧​，​我​就​当​是​好人​有​好​报​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3men5 wan2cheng2 le5 gong1zuo4，tuo1 wa3er3de2 si3 le5，wo3men5 na2dao4 le5 bao4chou5。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4yang4 ba1，wo3 jiu4 dang1 shi4 hao3ren2 you3 hao3 bao4。"

msgid ""
"Well, anyway. We did the job, Thorvald's dead. But I kinda wish that you'd held off for a bit.\n"
"\n"
"At the very least, we could've milked some nuyen out of him before putting him down."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我们​完成​了​工作​，​托​瓦尔德​死​了​。​但​我​有点​希望​你​当时​能​高抬贵手​一下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最起码​，​我们​可以​在​杀​了​他​之前​从​他​身上​榨取​一些​新円​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3men5 wan2cheng2 le5 gong1zuo4，tuo1 wa3er3de2 si3 le5。dan4 wo3 you3dian3 xi1wang4 ni3 dang1shi2 neng2 gao1tai2gui4shou3 yi1xia4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4 qi3 ma3，wo3men5 ke3yi3 zai4 sha1 le5 ta1 zhi1qian2 cong2 ta1 shen1shang5 zha4qu3 yi1xie1 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Well, anyway. We did the job, and Thorvald's dead. But I kinda wish that you'd held off for a bit.\n"
"\n"
"At the very least, we could've milked some nuyen out of him before putting him down."
msgstr ""
"总之​，​我们​完成​了​工作​，​托​瓦尔德​死​了​。​但​我​有点​希望​你​当时​能​高抬贵手​一下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最起码​，​我们​可以​在​杀​了​他​之前​从​他​身上​榨取​一些​新円​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3men5 wan2cheng2 le5 gong1zuo4，tuo1 wa3er3de2 si3 le5。dan4 wo3 you3dian3 xi1wang4 ni3 dang1shi2 neng2 gao1tai2gui4shou3 yi1xia4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4 qi3 ma3，wo3men5 ke3yi3 zai4 sha1 le5 ta1 zhi1qian2 cong2 ta1 shen1shang5 zha4qu3 yi1xie1 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"Well, at least he let us know before we got out of the garage.\n"
"\n"
"The second van it is. Let's get moving."
msgstr ""
"至少​他​在​我们​离开​车库​之前​通知​了​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​第二辆​就​第二辆​吧​，​我们​出发​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3 ta1 zai4 wo3men5 li2kai1 che1ku4 zhi1qian2 tong1zhi1 le5 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"di4 er4 liang4 jiu4 di4 er4 liang4 ba1，wo3men5 chu1fa1。"

msgid ""
"Well, at least they don't look like they'll be causing us any problems."
msgstr ""
"至少​他们​不会​再​给​我们​带来​什么​麻烦​了​。\n"
"zhi4shao3 ta1men5 bu4hui4 zai4 gei3 wo3men5 dai4lai2 shen2me5 ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, at least you asked. Listen, call me Schrotty. Thanks for indulging this old dummkopf. I’ll let ya get back to your life now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}You can see something like a polite smile under the moustache as he nods goodbye and returns to his work.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"至少​你​问​了​。​听​着​，​叫​我​施罗蒂​就行了​。​谢谢​你​愿意​和​我​这​老糊涂​聊天​，​现在​继续​你​自己​的​生活​去​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​看到​他​胡须​下​的​嘴角​微微​扬起​一抹​似笑非笑​的​弧度​，​颔首​道别​后​便​重新​埋头工作​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3 ni3 wen4 le5。ting1 zhao2，jiao4 wo3 shi1 luo2 di4 jiu4 xing2 le5。xie4xie5 ni3 yuan4yi4 he4 wo3 zhe4 lao3hu2tu5 liao2tian1，xian4zai4 ji4xu4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 sheng1huo2 qu4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 hu2xu1 xia4 de5 zui3jiao3 wei1wei1 yang2qi3 yi1 ma1 si4xiao4fei1xiao4 de5 hu2du4，han4shou3 dao4bie2 hou4 bian4 chong2xin1 mai2 tou2 gong1 zuo4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Well, at least you know that she was working for the Schockwellenreiter."
msgstr ""
"至少​你​现在​知道​她​是​给​电波​骑士​做事​的​了​。\n"
"zhi4shao3 ni3 xian4zai4 zhi1dao4 ta1 shi4 gei3 dian4Bo1qi2shi4 zuo4shi4 de5 le5。"

msgid "Well, best of luck with that."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​那​祝你好运​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid ""
"Well, boss, if that's the way you wanna play it, I've got your back.\n"
"\n"
"Probably isn't the decision I'd have made, but I trust you not to lead us astray."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​老大​，​既然​你​想​这么​干​，​我​奉陪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​换​我​可能​不会​做​这个​决定​，​但​我​相信​你​不会​带​我们​走​歪路​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，lao3da4，ji4ran2 ni3 xiang3 zhe4me5 gan4，wo3 feng4pei2。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 wo3 ke3neng2 bu4hui4 zuo4 zhe4ge5 jue2ding4，dan4 wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 bu4hui4 dai4 wo3men5 zou3 wai1 lu4。"

msgid ""
"Well, boss, we went up against a dragon and lived.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pulls a flask from his jacket and raises it in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I guess that's a win in my book."
msgstr ""
"哈​，​老大​，​我们​跟​一条​巨龙​正面​干架​，​居然​还活​下来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​从​外套​里​掏出​酒壶​，​举杯​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这场​胜利​真​值得​大书特书​。\n"
"\n"
"ha1，lao3da4，wo3men5 gen1 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 zheng4mian4 gan4jia4，ju1ran2 hai2 huo2 xia4lai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 wai4tao4 li3 tao1chu1 jiu3hu2，ju3bei1 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 chang2 sheng4li4 zhen1 zhi2de5 dai4 shu1 te4 shu1。"

msgid ""
"Well, boss. The way I figure it, it'll end when I pick a fight that I can't win.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles sadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Might be this one. Maybe the next. It'll be hard to top a Great Dragon."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​在我看来​，​等​我​打​一场​赢​不了​的​架​时​就​到头​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​露出​悲伤​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​或许​是​这次​，​或许​是​下次​。​想​战胜​巨龙​可不是​什么​容易​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，zai4wo3kan4lai2，deng3 wo3 da3 yi1 chang2 ying2 bu4le5 de5 jia4 shi2 jiu4 dao4tou2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 bei1shang1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 shi4 zhe4 ci4，huo4xu3 shi4 xia4ci4。xiang3 zhan4sheng4 ju4long2 ke3bu5shi4 shen2me5 rong2yi4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "Well, clean yourself up. We have work to do."
msgstr ""
"收拾​一下​自己​。​我们​还有​工作​要​做​。\n"
"shou1shi5 yi1xia4 zi4ji3。wo3men5 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid "Well, come back when you do. Or not. All the same to me."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​那​等​你​有钱​了​再​来​吧​。​不来​也​行​。​对​我​来说​都​一样​。\n"
"en1，na4 deng3 ni3 you3qian2 le5 zai4 lai2 ba1。bu4 lai2 ye3 xing2。dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 dou1 yi1yang4。"

msgid "Well, don't keep us in suspense. Start the damned thing already."
msgstr ""
"那​就​别​吊​我们​胃口​了​，​赶紧​启动​这破​玩意儿​吧​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 bie4 diao4 wo3men5 wei4kou3 le5，gan3jin3 qi3dong4 zhe4 po4 wan2yi4r5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, feel free to look. {{GM}}He nods and returns to whatever his project "
"is at hand, all wires and broken plastic, giving you no more heed.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"行​，​随便​看吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​点点头​，​继续​鼓捣​自己​手头​的​各种​电线​和​烂​塑料​，​不再​理会​你​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"xing2，sui2bian4 kan4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，ji4xu4 gu3dao5 zi4ji3 shou3tou2 de5 ge4zhong3 dian4xian4 he4 lan4 su4liao4，bu4zai4 li3hui4 ni3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Well, first we search the body.\n"
"\n"
"Who knows? Maybe he has some additional evidence on him... or in him. Could be that he has headware storage.\n"
"\n"
"We won't know until we go digging."
msgstr ""
"我们​先​搜​搜​尸体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​万一​他​身上​还有​什么​额外​的​证据​呢​……​或者​在​体内​也​有​可能​。​没准​他​有​头部​储存​设备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​只有​检查​一番​才​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xian1 sou1 sou1 shi1ti3。\n"
"\n"
"wan4yi1 ta1 shen1shang5 hai2you3 shen2me5 e2wai4 de5 zheng4ju4 ni2……huo4zhe3 zai4 ti3nei4 ye3 you3 ke3neng2。mei2zhun3 ta1 you3 tou2bu4 chu3cun2 she4bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3you3 jian3cha2 yi1 fan1 cai2 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Well, for one, you can see the sun on a regular basis.\n"
"\n"
"I think I'm a plant, honestly, I need the sun to be happy and grow."
msgstr ""
"首先​，​你​可以​经常​看到​太阳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​觉得​自己​就​像​一棵​植物​，​我​需要​阳光​才能​快乐​地​成长​。\n"
"\n"
"shou3xian1，ni3 ke3yi3 jing1chang2 kan4dao4 tai4yang5。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 jue2de5 zi4ji3 jiu4 xiang4 yi1 ke1 zhi2wu4，wo3 xu1yao4 yang2guang1 cai2neng2 kuai4le4 de5 cheng2zhang3。"

msgid "Well, frag me. There IS a giant bug here."
msgstr ""
"啧​，​该死​。​这里​确实​有个​大​漏洞​。\n"
"ze2，gai1si3。zhe4li3 que4shi2 you3 ge4 dai4 lou4dong4。"

msgid ""
"Well, from what I've heard, the Adversary is essentially a devil-figure."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​据我所知​，​反叛者​本质​上​类似​于​某个​魔鬼​。\n"
"en1，ju4wo3suo3zhi1，fan3 pan4 zhe3 ben3zhi4 shang4 lei4si4 yu2 mou3 ge4 mo2gui3。"

msgid ""
"Well, get on it! What the hell are you bothering me for?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns her attention back to her PDA, ignoring you.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"那​就​赶紧​去​弄​吧​！​你​还​来​烦​我​干什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​注意力​转回​她​的​PDA​，​不再​理​你​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 gan3jin3 qu4 long4 ba1！ni3 hai2 lai2 fan2 wo3 gan4shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3hui2 ta1 de5 PDA，bu4zai4 li3 ni3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Well, get on with it. "
msgstr ""
"说​说​看吧​。\n"
"shuo1 shuo1 kan4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, get to it. We need to get this done and get out of here... preferably "
"before more gangers show up."
msgstr ""
"那​就​快点​吧​。​我们​得​赶紧​把​这事​办完​，​然后​赶紧​离开​这里​……​最好​是​在​更​多​帮派​成员​出现​之前​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 kuai4dian3 ba1。wo3men5 de2 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4 ban4 wan2，ran2hou4 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3……zui4hao3 shi4 zai4 geng1 duo1 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 chu1xian4 zhi1qian2。"

msgid ""
"Well, get your game face back on. We still have Harrow's shrine to deal "
"with."
msgstr ""
"打起精神​来​。​我们​还​得​对付​哈罗​的​神龛​呢​。\n"
"da3 qi3 jing1 shen2 lai2。wo3men5 hai2 de2 dui4fu5 ha1luo2 de5 shen2kan1 ni2。"

msgid "Well, go on. We're listening."
msgstr ""
"那​就​说​吧​，​我们​听​着​呢​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 shuo1 ba1，wo3men5 ting1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Well, good for you, I suppose. Too bad for your teammates, though."
msgstr ""
"也​算是​吉人自有天相​。​只是​可惜​了​你​那些​队友​。\n"
"ye3 suan4shi4 ji2ren2zi4you3tian1xiang4。zhi3shi4 ke3xi1 le5 ni3 na4xie1 dui4you3。"

msgid "Well, good luck with that."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​祝你好运​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4 le5。"

msgid "Well, good luck with that. I'll be going now."
msgstr ""
"祝你好运​吧​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4 ba1。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid "Well, haven't you?"
msgstr ""
"难道​不是​吗​？\n"
"nan2dao4 bu4shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Well, he's taken up residence as the official Turk, stereotypes and everything. \n"
"\n"
"Spymaster, coffee brewer, outsider."
msgstr ""
"他​毕竟​是​定居​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​官方​土耳其人​，​各种​刻板​印象​什么​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​间谍​大师​，​咖啡师​，​外来者​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bi4jing4 shi4 ding4ju1 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 guan1fang1 tu3er3qi2ren2，ge4zhong3 ke4ban3 yin4xiang4 shen2me5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"jian4die2 da4shi1，ka1fei1shi1，wai4 lai2 zhe3。"

msgid ""
"Well, if it's them - and whoever you're talkin' about, I ain't sayin' it is - then I'd advise you to stay away from 'em.\n"
"\n"
"Stay far, far away. And whatever you do, don't take their money.\n"
"\n"
"If you do, they'll own you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​虽然​目前​还​没法​肯定​，​但​如果​真是​他们​的话​，​那​我​建议​你​离​他们​远​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​越远​越​好​。​不管​你​要​干嘛​，​反正​别​从​他们​手里​拿​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​你​就要​成​他们​的​提线木偶​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，sui1ran2 mu4qian2 hai2 mei2fa3 ken3ding4，dan4 ru2guo3 zhen1shi5 ta1men5 de5hua4，na4 wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 li2 ta1men5 yuan3 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"yue4 yuan3 yue4 hao3。bu4guan3 ni3 yao4 gan4ma2，fan3zheng4 bie4 cong2 ta1men5 shou3li3 na2 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2 ni3 jiu4yao4 cheng2 ta1men5 de5 ti2xian4mu4ou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, if it's them - and whoever you're talkin' about, I ain't sayin' it is - then I'd advise you to stay away from 'em.\n"
"\n"
"Stay far, far away. And whatever you do, don't take their money. If you do, they'll own you."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​虽然​目前​还​没法​肯定​，​但​如果​真是​他们​的话​，​那​我​建议​你​离​他们​远​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​越远​越​好​。​不管​你​要​干嘛​，​反正​别​从​他们​手里​拿​钱​。​否则​你​就要​成​他们​的​提线木偶​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，sui1ran2 mu4qian2 hai2 mei2fa3 ken3ding4，dan4 ru2guo3 zhen1shi5 ta1men5 de5hua4，na4 wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 li2 ta1men5 yuan3 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"yue4 yuan3 yue4 hao3。bu4guan3 ni3 yao4 gan4ma2，fan3zheng4 bie4 cong2 ta1men5 shou3li3 na2 qian2。fou3ze2 ni3 jiu4yao4 cheng2 ta1men5 de5 ti2xian4mu4ou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, if your curiosity is assuaged, I'd suggest that you tell your pal to "
"work his magic. The sooner we get this done, the sooner we can get out of "
"this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​的​好奇心​已​得到​满足​，​我​建议​让​你​的​朋友​来​大显身手​吧​。​他​越​早​完事​的话​，​我们​就​能​越​早​离开​这鬼​地方​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 de5 hao4qi2xin1 yi3 de2dao4 man3zu2，wo3 jian4yi4 rang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 lai2 da4xian3shen1shou3 ba1。ta1 yue4 zao3 wan2shi4 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 yue4 zao3 li2kai1 zhe4 gui3 di4fang1。"

msgid "Well, in that case, keep packing."
msgstr ""
"你​要​这么​说​的话​，​那​你​还是​继续​收拾​吧​。\n"
"ni3 yao4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5hua4，na4 ni3 hai2shi5 ji4xu4 shou1shi5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, in that case, let's talk about the magic you've got in that bag there."
" What've you got?"
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​说​说​你​袋子​里​的​魔法​吧​。​你​都​有​什么​？\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 shuo1 shuo1 ni3 dai4zi5 li3 de5 mo2fa3 ba1。ni3 dou1 you3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Well, in that case, we don't really have a choice. This isn't about money any more.\n"
"\n"
"If the Black Lodge wants you to do a thing, you do that thing. That's all there is to it."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​我们​确实​没得选​。​这​已经​不是​钱​的​问题​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​黑​结社​要​你​做事​，​你​就​照办​吧​，​就​这么​简单​。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3men5 que4shi2 mei2 de2 xuan3。zhe4 yi3jing1 bu4shi4 qian2 de5 wen4ti2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hei1 jie2she4 yao4 ni3 zuo4shi4，ni3 jiu4 zhao4ban4 ba1，jiu4 zhe4me5 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"Well, introductions are in order, I suppose. Schrotty Buchman, at yer service.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The old man raises a grimy hand in salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Need somethin' salvaged? Some old components, vielleicht? I'm indeed yer man."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​我​想​还是​先​自我介绍​一下​。​我​是​施罗蒂​·​布克​曼​，​竭诚​为​你​服务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​老人​举起​满是​油污​的​手​向​你​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要修​什么​东西​？​还是​要​买​二手​零件​？​找​我准​没错​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，wo3 xiang3 hai2shi5 xian1 zi4wo3jie4shao4 yi1xia4。wo3 shi4 shi1 luo2 di4 · bu4 ke4 man4，jie2cheng2 wei2 ni3 fu2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 ju3qi3 man3 shi4 you2wu1 de5 shou3 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4 xiu1 shen2me5 dong1xi1？hai2shi5 yao4 mai3 er4shou3 ling2jian4？zhao3 wo3 zhun3 mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Well, isn't that nice for you? You had a *choice.*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice is full of venom.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What choice do I have now? The only reason I'm even *here* tonight is because I owe the Lodge a debt. This was my one chance to pay it off, and now I *can't,* and they won't forget that."
msgstr ""
"那​你​很​幸福​啊​？​起码​你​*​有​得​选​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​中满​是​讽刺​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​又​有​什么​选择​呢​？​我​今晚​之所以​出现​在​*​这里​*​，​纯粹​是因为​欠​了​“​结社​”​的​债​。​这本​是​我​唯一​能​还清​的​机会​，​如今​却​*​无法​*​偿还​，​而​他们​不会​就此​忘记​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 hen3 xing4fu2 a1？qi3ma3 ni3*you3 de2 xuan3*。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhong4 man3 shi4 feng3ci4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 you4 you3 shen2me5 xuan3ze2 ni2？wo3 jin1wan3 zhi1suo3yi3 chu1xian4 zai4*zhe4li3*，chun2cui4 shi4 yin1 wei2 qian4 le5“jie2she4” de5 zhai4。zhe4 ben3 shi4 wo3 wei2yi1 neng2 huan2qing1 de5 ji1hui4，ru2jin1 que4*wu2fa3*chang2huan2，er2 ta1men5 bu4hui4 jiu4ci3 wang4ji4。"

msgid ""
"Well, it ain't yours yet. But I've been keepin' it warm for ya.\n"
"\n"
"Now, did ya get me some coffee? Or do you have the 350 nuyen?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​它​还​不能​算是​你​的​呢​。​不过​我​一直​替​你​保管​着​……​你​就​放心​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​是​搞​到​我​的​咖啡​了​？​还是​搞​到​350​新円​了​？\n"
"\n"
"wei2，ta1 hai2 bu4neng2 suan4shi4 ni3 de5 ni2。bu4guo4 wo3 yi1zhi2 ti4 ni3 bao3guan3 zhao2……ni3 jiu4 fang4xin1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 gao3 dao4 wo3 de5 ka1fei1 le5？hai2shi5 gao3 dao4 350 xin1 yuan2 le5？"

msgid ""
"Well, it ain't yours yet. But I've got it right here... been keepin' it warm for ya.\n"
"\n"
"Now, you got my coffee? Or do you have the 500 nuyen?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​它​还​不能​算是​你​的​呢​。​不过​我​一直​替​你​保管​着​……​你​就​放心​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​是​搞​到​我​的​咖啡​了​？​还是​搞​到​500​新円​了​？\n"
"\n"
"wei2，ta1 hai2 bu4neng2 suan4shi4 ni3 de5 ni2。bu4guo4 wo3 yi1zhi2 ti4 ni3 bao3guan3 zhao2……ni3 jiu4 fang4xin1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 gao3 dao4 wo3 de5 ka1fei1 le5？hai2shi5 gao3 dao4 500 xin1 yuan2 le5？"

msgid ""
"Well, it ain't yours yet. But it's still right here... Ain't nobody else coming fer it.\n"
"\n"
"Now, did ya grab me a coffee? Or do you have the 175 nuyen?"
msgstr ""
"喂​，​它​还​不能​算是​你​的​呢​。​不过​我​一直​替​你​保管​着​……​你​就​放心​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​是​搞​到​我​的​咖啡​了​？​还是​搞​到​175​新円​了​？\n"
"\n"
"wei2，ta1 hai2 bu4neng2 suan4shi4 ni3 de5 ni2。bu4guo4 wo3 yi1zhi2 ti4 ni3 bao3guan3 zhao2……ni3 jiu4 fang4xin1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 gao3 dao4 wo3 de5 ka1fei1 le5？hai2shi5 gao3 dao4 175 xin1 yuan2 le5？"

msgid "Well, it couldn't hu--"
msgstr ""
"也​没​坏处​—​—\n"
"ye3 mei2 huai4chu5 — —"

msgid ""
"Well, it couldn't last forever. $(l.name), it looks as though the Azzies have sorted out that overload that you fed into their power grid.\n"
"\n"
"From the comm chatter I'm seeing, I think it's also safe to assume that your presence has been detected. The entire facility has been placed on high alert."
msgstr ""
"美好​的​时光​总是​短暂​的​，​$(l.name)​。​看来​阿兹佬​已经​解决​了​你​对​其​电网​造成​的​过载​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​我​监测​到​的​通讯​内容​来看​，​对方​已经​发现​了​你​的​行踪​。​整个​设施​已​进入​高度​戒备状态​。\n"
"\n"
"mei3hao3 de5 shi2guang1 zong3shi4 duan3zan4 de5，$(l.name)。kan4lai5 e1 zi1 lao3 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 le5 ni3 dui4 qi2 dian4wang3 zao4cheng2 de5 guo4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 wo3 jian1ce4 dao4 de5 tong1xun4 nei4rong2 lai2 kan4，dui4fang1 yi3jing1 fa1xian4 le5 ni3 de5 xing2zong1。zheng3ge4 she4shi1 yi3 jin4ru4 gao1du4 jie4 bei4 zhuang4 tai4。"

msgid ""
"Well, it couldn't last forever. $(l.name), it looks as though the Azzies have sorted out that overload that you fed into their power grid.\n"
"\n"
"Watch your step, my friend. The comm activity that I'm seeing is... intense.\n"
"\n"
"If you trip an alarm now, Knight Errant will be on you before you can blink."
msgstr ""
"美好​的​时光​总是​短暂​的​，​$(l.name)​。​看来​阿兹佬​已经​解决​了​你​对​其​电网​造成​的​过载​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当心​点​，​我​的​朋友​。​我​监测​到​的​通讯​活动​……​异常​密集​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​现在​触发​警报​，​游侠​骑士​会​在​眨眼​间​杀​到​你​面前​。\n"
"\n"
"mei3hao3 de5 shi2guang1 zong3shi4 duan3zan4 de5，$(l.name)。kan4lai5 e1 zi1 lao3 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 le5 ni3 dui4 qi2 dian4wang3 zao4cheng2 de5 guo4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1xin1 dian3，wo3 de5 peng2you5。wo3 jian1ce4 dao4 de5 tong1xun4 huo2dong4……yi4chang2 mi4ji2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xian4zai4 chu4fa1 jing3bao4，you2Xia2qi2shi4 hui4 zai4 zha3yan3 jian1 sha1 dao4 ni3 mian4qian2。"

msgid "Well, it looks like at this point we have to do it the hard way."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​看来​从现在起​，​我们​得来​硬​的​了​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，kan4lai5 cong2 xian4 zai4 qi3，wo3men5 de2lai2 ying4 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, it was no picnic, I'll tell you that much.\n"
"\n"
"Say, you wouldn't happen to need a nova-hot decker, would you? 'Cause I suddenly find myself unemployed."
msgstr ""
"反正​不是​来​休闲​玩耍​的​。​多​的​我​也​不​说​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​起来​，​你们​不会​正好​缺​一个​超棒​的​碟​客​吧​？​因为​我​突然​意识​到​，​我​现在​没​工作​了​。\n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 bu4shi4 lai2 xiu1xian2 wan2shua3 de5。duo1 de5 wo3 ye3 bu4 shuo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 qi3lai5，ni3men5 bu4hui4 zheng4hao3 que1 yi1ge5 chao1 bang4 de5 die2 ke4 ba1？yin1wei4 wo3 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4，wo3 xian4zai4 mei2 gong1zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, it wasn't like *that*... I mean, *yeah,* I ran the plan by Grinder, but I had to do that! I mean, it wouldn't have made sense to go on the run without making sure that it had his blessing, would it?\n"
"\n"
"How could I even be sure that this would get me off the hook if I didn't ask?"
msgstr ""
"事情​不是​那样​的​……​我​是​说​，​*​没错​*​，​我​确实​把​计划​告诉​了​“​绞肉机​”​，​但​我​必须​这么​做​！​毕竟​，​在​没​得到​他​首肯​的​情况​下​就​进行​差事​，​这​根本​说​不通​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我​不问​的话​，​我​怎么​知道​这样​能​不能​让​之前​的​事​一笔勾销​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 bu4shi4 na4yang4 de5……wo3 shi4 shuo1，*mei2cuo4*，wo3 que4shi2 ba3 ji4hua4 gao4su4 le5“jiao3rou4ji1”，dan4 wo3 bi4xu1 zhe4me5 zuo4！bi4jing4，zai4 mei2 de2dao4 ta1 shou3ken3 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 jiu4 jin4xing2 cha4shi4，zhe4 gen1ben3 shuo1 bu4tong1，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 bu4wen4 de5hua4，wo3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 zhe4yang4 neng2 bu4neng2 rang4 zhi1qian2 de5 shi4 yi1bi3gou1xiao1？"

msgid ""
"Well, it's been lean pickings lately around these parts. And on top of that, there's the militia. They need most of the best pieces to help keep us safe.\n"
"\n"
"Still, I've got some reliable weapons for home defense."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​最近​这​地方​的​货​越来越​难弄​了​。​除此之外​还有​民兵​，​他们​需要​最好​的​武器​来​保护​我们​的​安全​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​这里​还​有些​适合​自卫​的​可靠​武器​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1，zui4jin4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 huo4 yue4lai2yue4 nan2 long4 le5。chu2ci3zhi1wai4 hai2you3 min2bing1，ta1men5 xu1yao4 zui4hao3 de5 wu3qi4 lai2 bao3hu4 wo3men5 de5 an1quan2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 zhe4li3 hai2 you3xie1 shi4he2 zi4wei4 de5 ke3kao4 wu3qi4。"

msgid "Well, it's finished now."
msgstr ""
"不过​现在​都​结束​了​。\n"
"bu4guo4 xian4zai4 dou1 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, it's just that there's probably some stories that are hard to hear at "
"your age."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​只是​有些​故事​大概​不是​你​这个​年纪​能​听到​的​。\n"
"en1，zhi3shi4 you3xie1 gu4shi4 da4gai4 bu4shi4 ni3 zhe4ge5 nian2ji4 neng2 ting1dao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Well, it's not like I'm doin' much else.\n"
"\n"
"That whole Emilie thing still stings, chief. It sort of took the wind out of my sails."
msgstr ""
"毕竟​我​也​没​啥​好​忙​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾米莉​那​档子​事​让​我​太​纠结​了​，​头儿​，​搞​得​我​干​啥​都​没劲​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 wo3 ye3 mei2 sha2 hao3 mang2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ai4 mi3 li4 na4 dang4zi5 shi4 rang4 wo3 tai4 jiu1jie2 le5，tou2r5，gao3 de2 wo3 gan4 sha2 dou1 mei2jin4。"

msgid ""
"Well, it's not like we were planning on doing anything else with it anyway. "
"Keep going."
msgstr ""
"反正​我们​也​没​打算​用​它​干​别的​。​继续​说​吧​。\n"
"fan3zheng4 wo3men5 ye3 mei2 da3suan4 yong4 ta1 gan4 bie2de5。ji4xu4 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, it's pricey. And there are some minor side effects.... if you take more than five in a single sitting, you'll probably get a nosebleed. I don't think that anyone has ever tried drinking more than ten at once.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Yeah, I probably wouldn't recommend that."
msgstr ""
"这​玩意儿​挺贵​的​，​而且​还​有些​小​副作用​……​要是​单次​服用​超过​五份​，​你​很​可能​会​流鼻血​。​据我所知​，​从来​没​人​尝试​过​一次​喝​十份​以上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一下​，​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​嗯​，​我​也​不​推荐​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 wan2yi4r5 ting3 gui4 de5，er2qie3 hai2 you3xie1 xiao3 fu4zuo4yong4……yao4shi5 dan1 ci4 fu2yong4 chao1guo4 wu3 fen4，ni3 hen3 ke3neng2 hui4 liu2bi2xie3。ju4wo3suo3zhi1，cong2lai2 mei2 ren2 chang2shi4 guo4 yi1ci4 he4 shi2 fen4 yi3shang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……en1，wo3 ye3 bu4 tui1jian4 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Well, it's too late to worry about it now. What's done is done.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, boss. There's nothing else for us here. Let's go home."
msgstr ""
"事已至此​，​再​担心​什么​已经​太迟​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​老大​。​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​我们​回家​去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3，zai4 dan1xin1 shen2me5 yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1 lao3da4。wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。wo3men5 hui2jia1 qu4 ba1。"

msgid "Well, it's your call, boss. Can't say I envy you the decision."
msgstr ""
"听​你​的​，​老大​。​这​决定​可真​不好​做​。\n"
"ting1 ni3 de5，lao3da4。zhe4 jue2ding4 ke3 zhen1 bu4hao3 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Well, it's your call, chief.\n"
"\n"
"Can't say I envy you the decision."
msgstr ""
"听​你​的​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​决定​可真​不好​做​。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 ni3 de5，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jue2ding4 ke3 zhen1 bu4hao3 zuo4。"

msgid "Well, it's your call, chief. Can't say I envy you the decision."
msgstr ""
"听​你​的​，​头儿​。​这​决定​可真​不好​做​。\n"
"ting1 ni3 de5，tou2r5。zhe4 jue2ding4 ke3 zhen1 bu4hao3 zuo4。"

msgid "Well, keep up the good work, man."
msgstr ""
"那​你​继续​加油​吧​。\n"
"na4 ni3 ji4xu4 jia1you2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, kind of. I brought my taser, and I have a little hold-out pistol for self defense. I've done some shooting at the range.\n"
"\n"
"But I've never fired at a living thing before... certainly not a person. I'm hoping that we can get through this thing without me having to."
msgstr ""
"算是​吧​。​我​带来​了​我​的​泰瑟枪​，​还备​了​把​小​手枪​防身​。​我​在​靶场​练过​几次​枪法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​从未​对​活物​开过​枪​……​更​别说​人​了​。​但愿​这次​任务​能​平安​结束​，​别出​什么​岔子​。\n"
"\n"
"suan4shi4 ba1。wo3 dai4lai2 le5 wo3 de5 tai4se4qiang1，hai2 bei4 le5 ba3 xiao3 shou3qiang1 fang2shen1。wo3 zai4 ba3chang3 lian4 guo4 ji3ci4 qiang1fa3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 cong2wei4 dui4 huo2wu4 kai1 guo4 qiang1……geng1 bie2shuo1 ren2 le5。dan4yuan4 zhe4 ci4 ren4wu5 neng2 ping2an1 jie2shu4，bie4 chu1 shen2me5 cha4zi5。"

msgid ""
"Well, let me tell you what *I* think, dwarf.\n"
"\n"
"I think that you're a liar. I think that you've come here with hostile intent.\n"
"\n"
"And I think that makes you a special kind of fool."
msgstr ""
"那​我​来​告诉​你​*​我​*​是​怎么​想​的​，​矮人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​你​就是​个​骗子​，​想带​着​敌意​来​挑拨​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真是​个​纯种​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 lai2 gao4su4 ni3*wo3*shi4 zen3me5 xiang3 de5，ai3ren2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 jiu4shi4 ge4 pian4zi5，xiang3 dai4 zhao2 di2yi4 lai2 tiao3bo1 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 chun2zhong3 sha3gua1。"

msgid ""
"Well, let me tell you what *I* think, elf.\n"
"\n"
"I think that you're a liar. I think that you've come here with hostile intent.\n"
"\n"
"And I think that makes you a special kind of fool."
msgstr ""
"那​我​来​告诉​你​*​我​*​是​怎么​想​的​，​精灵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​你​就是​个​骗子​，​想带​着​敌意​来​挑拨​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真是​个​纯种​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 lai2 gao4su4 ni3*wo3*shi4 zen3me5 xiang3 de5，jing1ling2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 jiu4shi4 ge4 pian4zi5，xiang3 dai4 zhao2 di2yi4 lai2 tiao3bo1 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 chun2zhong3 sha3gua1。"

msgid ""
"Well, let me tell you what *I* think, trog.\n"
"\n"
"I think that you're a liar. I think that you've come here with hostile intent.\n"
"\n"
"And I think that makes you a special kind of fool."
msgstr ""
"那​我​来​告诉​你​*​我​*​是​怎么​想​的​，​穴居人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认为​你​就是​个​骗子​，​想带​着​敌意​来​挑拨​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真是​个​纯种​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 lai2 gao4su4 ni3*wo3*shi4 zen3me5 xiang3 de5，xue2ju1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 jiu4shi4 ge4 pian4zi5，xiang3 dai4 zhao2 di2yi4 lai2 tiao3bo1 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 chun2zhong3 sha3gua1。"

msgid ""
"Well, let's see. Apparently, a man named \"A\" scored some \"juice,\" and it was really \"unreal stuff.\"\n"
"\n"
"So what do I make of it? A couple of things: one, the Landenberg Ring has some real fuckups on its payroll, and two, you're wasting our time.\n"
"\n"
"Of the two, I'm more upset about the second, because it involves you keeping me here in this cesspool longer than I need to be. Does that answer your question?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​让​我​看看​。​显然​有个​叫​“​A​”​的​家伙​搞​到​了​些​“​货​”​，​而且​是​“​超​嗨​”​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​怎么​想​？​有​两点​：​其一​，​兰​登堡​帮雇​了​些​真正​的​废物​；​其二​，​你​在​浪费​我们​的​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​两者​之中​，​我​更​在意​后者​，​因为​这​意味着​你​让​我​在​这条​臭水沟​里​多​待​了​不该​有​的​时间​。​这样​回答​你​的​问题​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"en1，rang4 wo3 kan4kan5。xian3ran2 you3 ge4 jiao4“a” de5 jia1huo5 gao3 dao4 le5 xie1“huo4”，er2qie3 shi4“chao1 hai1” de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 xiang3？you3 liang3 dian3：qi2yi1，lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 gu4 le5 xie1 zhen1zheng4 de5 fei4wu4 ； qi2er4，ni3 zai4 lang4fei4 wo3men5 de5 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"liang3zhe3 zhi1zhong1，wo3 geng1 zai4yi4 hou4zhe3，yin1wei4 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 rang4 wo3 zai4 zhe4 tiao2 chou4 shui3 gou1 li3 duo1 dai1 le5 bu4gai1 you3 de5 shi2jian1。zhe4yang4 hui2da2 ni3 de5 wen4ti2 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Well, let's see... I think that I've got somethin' that'll work fer ya. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Schrotty rummmages through the junk heaped on the table behind him. A few second later, he snatches a battered plastic lozenge-shape from the pile.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"让​我​看看​……​我​觉得​这​玩意​应该​对​你​有用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​施罗蒂​在​身后​桌子​上​堆积如山​的​杂物​里​翻找​着​。​几秒​后​，​他​从中​拿出​一块​破旧​的​塑料​菱形​物​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 kan4kan5……wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 wan2yi4 ying1gai1 dui4 ni3 you3yong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 zai4 shen1hou4 zhuo1zi5 shang4 dui1ji1ru2shan1 de5 za2wu4 li3 fan1 zhao3 zhao2。ji1 miao3 hou4，ta1 cong2zhong1 na2chu1 yi1kuai4 po4jiu4 de5 su4liao4 ling2xing2 wu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Well, look harder. We need to figure this thing out."
msgstr ""
"再​努​努力​。​我们​得​搞清楚​真相​。\n"
"zai4 nu3 nu3li4。wo3men5 de2 gao3 qing1 chu3 zhen1xiang4。"

msgid ""
"Well, maybe they're rich, but small-time. They wouldn't be the only "
"organization like that I'd ever heard of."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​或许​他们​很​有钱​，​但​规模​不​大​？​我​倒​是​听说​过​类似​这样​的​组织​。\n"
"e4，huo4xu3 ta1men5 hen3 you3qian2，dan4 gui1mo2 bu4 dai4？wo3 dao3 shi4 ting1shuo1 guo4 lei4si4 zhe4yang4 de5 zu3zhi1。"

msgid "Well, maybe we can change that."
msgstr ""
"现在​培养​一下​感情​也​不​迟​。\n"
"xian4zai4 pei2yang3 yi1xia4 gan3qing2 ye3 bu4 chi2。"

msgid ""
"Well, maybe we could work out a trade.\n"
"\n"
"Cram for services."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我们​没准​可以​做笔​买卖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​爽​的话​，​就让​我先​爽爽​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3men5 mei2zhun3 ke3yi3 zuo4 bi3 mai3mai4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 shuang3 de5hua4，jiu4 rang4 wo3 xian1 shuang3 shuang3。"

msgid ""
"Well, me and my buddy Viktor got called in from the next kiez over.\n"
"\n"
"Somethin's wrong with the sewers around here."
msgstr ""
"我​和​我​哥们​维克多​是从​隔壁​街区​过来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​附近​的​下水道​出​了​点​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 wo3 ge1men5 wei2 ke4 duo1 shi4 cong2 ge2bi4 jie1qu1 guo4lai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 fu4jin4 de5 xia4shui3dao4 chu1 le5 dian3 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"Well, me, I'm just doing my thing, *not* casting spells. I'm *storing up* my energy, *saving* it. \n"
"\n"
"Can you *imagine* how much magic I have?"
msgstr ""
"而​我​呢​，​我​只是​在​忙​自己​的​事​，​而​*​不是​*​乱放​法术​。​我​是​在​*​积蓄​*​能量​，​善加​保存​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​*​想象​*​我​有​多少​魔力​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3 ni2，wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 mang2 zi4ji3 de5 shi4，er2*bu4shi4*luan4 fang4 fa3shu4。wo3 shi4 zai4*ji1xu4*neng2liang4，shan4 jia1 bao3cun2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2*xiang3xiang4*wo3 you3 duo1shao3 mo2li4 ma5？"

msgid "Well, n--"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这个​—​—\n"
"en1，zhe4ge5 — —"

msgid "Well, no, of course not... I'm just saying..."
msgstr ""
"不​不​，​当然​不​……​我​就是​随便​一说​……\n"
"bu4 bu4，dang1ran2 bu4……wo3 jiu4shi4 sui2bian4 yi1shuo1……"

msgid "Well, no... but I still want it."
msgstr ""
"不​知道​……​但​我​还是​想要​。\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4……dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 xiang3yao4。"

msgid ""
"Well, no... naturally, the inevitable results of such an incident followed the spill.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He blinks confusedly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do you want me to spell it out for you?"
msgstr ""
"并非如此​……​但​事件​发生​后​随之而来​的​便是​不可避免​的​后果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​疑惑​地​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​我​明明白白​说​给​你​听​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3……dan4 shi4jian4 fa1sheng1 hou4 sui2 zhi1 er2 lai2 de5 bian4shi4 bu4ke3bi4mian3 de5 hou4guo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi2huo4 de5 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4 wo3 ming2 ming2 bai2 bai2 shuo1 gei3 ni3 ting1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Well, now that you mention it, two hundred thousand doesn't sound bad..."
msgstr ""
"你​这么​一说​的话​，​二十万​也​不错​……\n"
"ni3 zhe4me5 yi1shuo1 de5hua4，er4 shi2 wan4 ye3 bu4cuo4……"

msgid "Well, now that you mention it..."
msgstr ""
"既然​你​说​到​这​了​……\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 shuo1 dao4 zhe4 le5……"

msgid "Well, now you know what's happening."
msgstr ""
"现在​你​知道​发生​的​事情​了​。\n"
"xian4zai4 ni3 zhi1dao4 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 le5。"

msgid "Well, on second thought..."
msgstr ""
"我​又​考虑​了​下​……\n"
"wo3 you4 kao3lu:4 le5 xia4……"

msgid ""
"Well, on to the business at hand. My employer wishes to secure your team’s "
"services for a series of operations that will likely require the remainder "
"of 2054."
msgstr ""
"好​了​，​言归正传​。​我​的​雇主​希望​聘请​你们​团队​执行​一系列​任务​，​这些​任务​很​可能​占用​你们​2054​年​剩下​的​全部​时间​。\n"
"hao3 le5，yan2gui1zheng4zhuan4。wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 xi1wang4 pin4qing3 ni3men5 tuan2dui4 zhi2xing2 yi1xi4lie4 ren4wu5，zhe4xie1 ren4wu5 hen3 ke3neng2 zhan4yong4 ni3men5 2054 nian2 sheng4xia4 de5 quan2bu4 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Well, right now I'm keeping about four different alarms from triggering. No big deal, I can handle it.\n"
"\n"
"But I won't lie... opening that door is gonna be tough. It'll take concentration. And I don't think I can keep all four alarms locked down while I'm doing it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​现在​我​正忙着​防止​四个​不同​的​警报器​触发​。​没什么​大不了​的​，​我能​应付​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​得​说实话​……​打开​那​扇门​可不​容易​。​得​全神贯注​才行​。​而且​我​觉得​我​操作​的​时候​没法​同时​盯住​所有​四个​警报器​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，xian4zai4 wo3 zheng1 mang2 zhao2 fang2zhi3 si4 ge4 bu4tong2 de5 jing3bao4qi4 chu4fa1。mei2shen2me5 da4bu5liao3 de5，wo3 neng2 ying4fu5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3 de2 shuo1shi2hua4……da3kai1 na4 shan1 men2 ke3bu5 rong2yi4。de2 quan2shen2guan4zhu4 cai2 xing2。er2qie3 wo3 jue2de5 wo3 cao1zuo4 de5 shi2hou5 mei2fa3 tong2shi2 ding1zhu4 suo3you3 si4 ge4 jing3bao4qi4。"

msgid ""
"Well, screw you, too, drekhead!\n"
"\n"
"Unless you have cram. Hey! Come back if you score some cram!"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​你​以为​我​瞧​得​上​你​啊​？​猪头​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​你​要是​有​“​超感​”​，​也​不是​不行​。​哎​！​搞​到​药​了​就​回来​啊​！\n"
"\n"
"e2，ni3 yi3wei2 wo3 qiao2 de2 shang4 ni3 a1？zhu1tou2！\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ni3 yao4shi5 you3“chao1 gan3”，ye3 bu4shi4 bu4xing2。ai1！gao3 dao4 yao4 le5 jiu4 hui2lai5 a1！"

msgid "Well, she's dead and gone now."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​她​现在​已经​死​了​。\n"
"en1，ta1 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, stranger, I'll give you this: you've got balls.\n"
"\n"
"Most new recruits apply at the front desk. They don't come waltzing into my private office.\n"
"\n"
"And they certainly don't come armed."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​陌生人​，​我​承认​你​胆子​不小​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大多数​新人​都​是​去​前台​申请​。​他们​可​不会​大摇大摆​地​闯进​我​的​私人​办公室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​更​不会​带​着​武器​进来​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，mo4sheng1ren2，wo3 cheng2ren4 ni3 dan3zi5 bu4 xiao3。\n"
"\n"
"da4duo1shu4 xin1ren2 dou1 shi4 qu4 qian2tai2 shen1qing3。ta1men5 ke3 bu4hui4 da4yao2da4bai3 de5 chuang3jin4 wo3 de5 si1ren2 ban4gong1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"geng1 bu4hui4 dai4 zhao2 wu3qi4 jin4lai2。"

msgid ""
"Well, sure, but what I'm seeing here... it looks neat. Professional.\n"
"\n"
"This isn't amateur work. Somebody went to a lot of trouble to write out projections for all of Mr. Grinder's future profits, and those projections are *way* outside the scope of what our organization brings in annually."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​当然​，​但​我​眼前​看到​的​这份​文件​……​看起来​很​专业​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​绝非​业余​之作​。​有人​费尽心思​为​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​未来​利润​做​了​详细​预测​，​而​这些​预测​数字​*​远远​*​超出​了​我们​组织​每年​实际收入​的​范围​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，dang1ran2，dan4 wo3 yan3qian2 kan4dao4 de5 zhe4 fen4 wen2jian4……kan4qi3lai5 hen3 zhuan1ye4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jue2fei1 ye4yu2 zhi1 zuo4。you3ren2 fei4jin4xin1si5 wei2“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 wei4lai2 li4run4 zuo4 le5 xiang2xi4 yu4ce4，er2 zhe4xie1 yu4ce4 shu4zi4*yuan3yuan3*chao1chu1 le5 wo3men5 zu3zhi1 mei3nian2 shi2 ji4 shou1 ru4 de5 fan4wei2。"

msgid ""
"Well, technically, *you* set off the alarm when you stepped into the vault. All I'm doing is keeping the signals locked down so that they can't get out.\n"
"\n"
"And I *might* be able to release the lock fast enough to to catch the alarms before they sound. But I can't guarantee it."
msgstr ""
"准确​来说​，​是​*​你们​*​进入​保险库​的​时候​就​已经​触发​警报​了​。​我​在​做​的​事情​是​封锁​信号​，​以免​敌人​发现​此事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此外​我​*​也许​*​可以​手速​够快​，​在​警报​响起​之前​就​把​锁​打开​。​但​我​没法​保证​。\n"
"\n"
"zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1，shi4*ni3men5*jin4ru4 bao3 xian3 ku4 de5 shi2hou5 jiu4 yi3jing1 chu4fa1 jing3bao4 le5。wo3 zai4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 shi4 feng1suo3 xin4hao4，yi3mian3 di2ren2 fa1xian4 ci3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ci3wai4 wo3*ye3xu3*ke3yi3 shou3su4 gou4 kuai4，zai4 jing3bao4 xiang3qi3 zhi1qian2 jiu4 ba3 suo3 da3kai1。dan4 wo3 mei2fa3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"Well, tell me what you've heard about this Black Lodge, then. I need to "
"know."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​那​就​给​我​讲讲​你​对​“​黑​结社​”​都​知道​些​什么​。​我​得​了解​一下​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 jiu4 gei3 wo3 jiang3 jiang3 ni3 dui4“hei1 jie2she4” dou1 zhi1dao4 xie1 shen2me5。wo3 de2 liao3jie3 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"Well, thank you again! And now, if you'll forgive me, I must get back to helping with the cleanup.\n"
"\n"
"All the best to you and yours, and please feel free to drop by any time!"
msgstr ""
"无论如何​，​再次​感谢​你​！​好​了​，​恕​我​失陪​，​我​得​回去​帮忙​清理​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝​你​和​你​的​朋友​们​一切顺利​，​随时欢迎​你​再​来​！\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，zai4ci4 gan3xie4 ni3！hao3 le5，shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 de2 hui2qu5 bang1mang2 qing1li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 he4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 yi1 qie1 shun4 li4，sui2 shi2 huan1 ying2 ni3 zai4 lai2！"

msgid "Well, that can't be good."
msgstr ""
"这​可不是​什么​好​兆头​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3bu5shi4 shen2me5 hao3 zhao4tou5。"

msgid "Well, that or an employee with OCD."
msgstr ""
"或者​是​某个​有​强迫症​的​员工​。\n"
"huo4zhe3 shi4 mou3 ge4 you3 qiang3po4zheng4 de5 yuan2gong1。"

msgid ""
"Well, that puts a different spin on things.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment to consider.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"那​就​另当别论​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​，​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 ling4dang1bie2lun4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Well, that puts a new spin on things."
msgstr ""
"那​就​另当别论​了​。\n"
"na4 jiu4 ling4dang1bie2lun4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, that settles it - I'll pack a bag. Where should we start looking?"
msgstr ""
"那​就​这么​定​了​，​我​去​收拾​行李​。​我们​从​哪里​开始​找​？\n"
"na4 jiu4 zhe4me5 ding4 le5，wo3 qu4 shou1shi5 xing2li5。wo3men5 cong2 na3li3 kai1shi3 zhao3？"

msgid "Well, that sounds... horrible."
msgstr ""
"这​听​起来​……​可太糟​了​。\n"
"zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5……ke3 tai4 zao1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, that was *very* enlightening. Thank you for your cooperation, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I'll be sure to tastefully memorialize you in my report."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这​真是​*​非常​*​有​启发性​。​感谢​你​的​配合​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一定​会​在​报告​中​着重​提到​你​的​贡献​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，zhe4 zhen1shi5*fei1chang2*you3 qi3 fa1 xing4。gan3xie4 ni3 de5 pei4he2，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 zai4 bao4gao4 zhong4 zhuo2zhong4 ti2dao4 ni3 de5 gong4xian4。"

msgid ""
"Well, that was a bust. Little progress on Feuerschwinge, either.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno. It's weird... the information is there, it's just... *wrong,* somehow. It's too well laid out, too simple. Real life is messy, and this feels just a little too... neat."
msgstr ""
"完全​失败​啊​。​火翼​那边​也​没什么​进展​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​明白​。​这​很​奇怪​……​信息​是​存在​的​，​只是​有​哪里​*​不​对​*​。​布局​太​合理​，​太​简单​了​。​现实生活​是​混乱​的​，​而​这​感觉​有点​太​……​整洁​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wan2quan2 shi1bai4 a1。Huo3yi4 na4bian5 ye3 mei2shen2me5 jin4zhan3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 ming2bai5。zhe4 hen3 qi2guai4……xin4xi1 shi4 cun2zai4 de5，zhi3shi4 you3 na3li3*bu4 dui4*。bu4ju2 tai4 he2li3，tai4 jian3dan1 le5。xian4 shi2 sheng1 huo2 shi4 hun4luan4 de5，er2 zhe4 gan3jue2 you3dian3 tai4……zheng3jie2 le5。"

msgid "Well, that was interesting. What now?"
msgstr ""
"这下​有意思​了​。​现在​怎么办​？\n"
"zhe4xia4 you3yi4si5 le5。xian4zai4 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid "Well, that was... special. Way to go, boss."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这​可​真是​……​特别​。​干得​漂亮​，​老大​。\n"
"en1，zhe4 ke3 zhen1shi5……te4bie2。gan4 de2 piao4liang5，lao3da4。"

msgid "Well, that was... special. Way to go, chief."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这​可​真是​……​特别​。​干得​漂亮​，​头儿​。\n"
"en1，zhe4 ke3 zhen1shi5……te4bie2。gan4 de2 piao4liang5，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"Well, that would be your problem, chummer. \n"
"\n"
"My problem is, I'm talking to you instead of watching Inga dance.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns back to the dancer.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"哦​，​那​是​你​自己​的​问题​，​伙计​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​我​来说​，​问题​是​得​在​这​跟​你​讲话​，​耽误​了​看​英嘉​跳舞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​转​回去​看​舞娘​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"e2，na4 shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 wen4ti2，huo3ji5。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1，wen4ti2 shi4 de2 zai4 zhe4 gen1 ni3 jiang3hua4，dan1wu5 le5 kan4 ying1 jia1 tiao4wu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 zhuai3 hui2qu5 kan4 wu3niang2 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Well, that'd be you jumping to conclusions, wouldn't it?"
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​这下成​了​你​在​擅自​下结论​吧​？\n"
"ai1ya1，zhe4 xia4 cheng2 le5 ni3 zai4 shan4zi4 xia4 jie1 lun2 ba1？"

msgid "Well, that's better than nothing, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​有​总比​没有​强​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，you3 zong3 bi3 mei2you3 jiang4。"

msgid "Well, that's certainly thinkin' big. Give me a second, I'll ask."
msgstr ""
"这​想法​确实​够​狂​的​。​稍等一下​，​我来​问问​。\n"
"zhe4 xiang3fa3 que4shi2 gou4 kuang2 de5。shao1 deng3 yi1 xia4，wo3 lai2 wen4 wen4。"

msgid ""
"Well, that's classified information, chummer.\n"
"\n"
"If you stick around here a while, you'll figure it out soon enough."
msgstr ""
"哎呀​，​这​可是​机密​情报​，​亲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​在​这​附近​待​一段时间​，​你​很快​就​能​自己​搞清楚​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1，zhe4 ke3shi4 ji1mi4 qing2bao4，qin1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 zhe4 fu4jin4 dai1 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1，ni3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 neng2 zi4ji3 gao3 qing1 chu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, that's comforting to hear. I'm glad to know that someone as competent as you could make as abysmal a mess of $(l.his) life as I did.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hang with me, $(l.name). Rough waters ahead."
msgstr ""
"像​你​这样​能干​的​人​，​也​会​像​我​一样​把​自己​的​人生​搞​得​一团糟​吗​……​听​着​真让人​宽慰​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​继续​听​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​接下来​才​是​最​黑暗​的​部分​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 neng2gan4 de5 ren2，ye3 hui4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 ren2sheng1 gao3 de2 yi1tuan2zao1 ma5……ting1 zhao2 zhen1 rang4 ren2 kuan1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4xu4 ting1 ba1，$(l.name)。jie1xia4lai2 cai2 shi4 zui4 hei1an4 de5 bu4fen5。"

msgid ""
"Well, that's handy. I'm all for avoiding a firefight if we can get away with it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He claps you on the shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good find, chief."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这可真​方便​。​我​完全同意​应该​尽可能​避免​交火​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这招​真不错​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，zhe4 ke3 zhen1 fang1bian4。wo3 wan2 quan2 tong2 yi4 ying1gai1 jin3ke3neng2 bi4mian3 jiao1huo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 zhen1 bu4 cuo4，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"Well, that's handy. I'm not much for sneaking around, but if we're gonna do it, we might as well go all the way.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He claps you on the shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good find, boss."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这可真​方便​。​我​并​不​热衷于​低调​行事​，​不过​既然​我们​打算​这么​做​的话​，​一步到位​是​再好不过​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这招​真不错​，​老大​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，zhe4 ke3 zhen1 fang1bian4。wo3 bing4 bu4 re4 zhong1 yu2 di1diao4 xing2shi4，bu4guo4 ji4ran2 wo3men5 da3suan4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5hua4，yi1bu4dao4wei4 shi4 zai4hao3bu4guo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 zhen1 bu4 cuo4，lao3da4。"

msgid "Well, that's how you should feel. You nearly got that girl killed."
msgstr ""
"那​不是​你​活该​吗​，​你​差点​害​她​送命​。\n"
"na4 bu4shi4 ni3 huo2gai1 ma5，ni3 cha4dian3 hai4 ta1 song4ming4。"

msgid "Well, that's nice of him."
msgstr ""
"他人​还​挺​好​的​。\n"
"ta1ren2 hai2 ting3 hao3 de5。"

msgid "Well, that's not my problem, is it? Come back when you do."
msgstr ""
"那​不是​我​的​问题​，​对​吧​？​等​你​有钱​了​再​来​。\n"
"na4 bu4shi4 wo3 de5 wen4ti2，dui4 ba1？deng3 ni3 you3qian2 le5 zai4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Well, that's rank.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever's in that pile, it's decomposing nicely."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​真​够呛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​这堆​垃圾​里​有​什么​，​反正​腐烂​得​挺​彻底​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，zhen1 gou4qiang4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 zhe4 dui1 la1ji1 li3 you3 shen2me5，fan3zheng4 fu3lan4 de2 ting3 che4di3。"

msgid "Well, that's rough, friend. How'd the rest of your team take it?"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​确实​挺​惨​的​，​朋友​。​那​你​的​其他​队友​怎么​说​？\n"
"hao3 ba1，que4shi2 ting3 can3 de5，peng2you5。na4 ni3 de5 qi2ta1 dui4you3 zen3me5 shuo1？"

msgid ""
"Well, that's that. Mission accomplished, dragon slain. We're heroes, chief."
msgstr ""
"总之​就​这样​了​。​任务​完成​，​巨龙​死​了​。​我们​是​英雄​啊​，​头儿​。\n"
"zong3zhi1 jiu4 zhe4yang4 le5。ren4wu5 wan2cheng2，ju4long2 si3 le5。wo3men5 shi4 ying1xiong2 a1，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"Well, that's tough for them.\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry, but this is *my* material that we're talking about. If they want to keep getting it, they need to provide something of value to *me.* And as you well know, they have nothing else of value to provide."
msgstr ""
"啧​，​它们​倒​是​挺​有种​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可惜​了​，​现在​我们​在​聊​的​是​*​我​*​手上​的​材料​。​如果​它们​还​想​继续​有​吃食​的话​，​就​得​拿出​对​*​我​*​有用​的​价值​来​。​你​也​知道​，​它们​并​没有​什么​别的​价值​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ze2，ta1men5 dao3 shi4 ting3 you3zhong3 a1。\n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1 le5，xian4zai4 wo3men5 zai4 liao2 de5 shi4*wo3*shou3 shang4 de5 cai2liao4。ru2guo3 ta1men5 hai2 xiang3 ji4xu4 you3 chi1shi2 de5hua4，jiu4 de2 na2chu1 dui4*wo3*you3yong4 de5 jia4zhi2 lai2。ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4，ta1men5 bing4 mei2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 jia4zhi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, that's your loss, chummer.\n"
"\n"
"She was one of the best women I've ever known."
msgstr ""
"啧​，​那​真是太​可惜​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​可是​我​认识​的​最​优秀​的​女性​之一​。\n"
"\n"
"ze2，na4 zhen1 shi4 tai4 ke3xi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ke3shi4 wo3 ren4shi5 de5 zui4 you1xiu4 de5 nu:3xing4 zhi1yi1。"

msgid "Well, that’s good to know."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​挺​好​的​。\n"
"en1，ting3 hao3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Well, the bastard forgot to mention that Pharma had a Knight Errant security contract for the place.\n"
"\n"
"*He* told *us* that there would be \"little, if any, resistance.\" So imagine our surprise when a KE response team kicked in the door and unloaded on us."
msgstr ""
"结果​，​那个​混蛋​有件事​忘​了​提​—​—​制药​公司​和​游侠​骑士​签了​安保​协议​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​他​*​告诉​*​我们​*​说​，​“​顶多​只会​有​零星​抵抗​”​。​所以​你​可以​想象​，​当​一支​游侠​骑士​应急​小组​破门而入​并​朝​我们​倾泻​弹药​的​时候​，​我们​有​多​震惊​。\n"
"\n"
"jie1guo3，na4ge5 hun2dan4 you3 jian4 shi4 wang4 le5 ti2——zhi4yao4 gong1si1 he4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 qian1 le5 an1bao3 xie2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"*ta1*gao4su4*wo3men5*shuo1，“ding3duo1 zhi3 hui4 you3 ling2xing1 di3kang4”。suo3yi3 ni3 ke3yi3 xiang3xiang4，dang1 yi1 zhi1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3 po4men2er2ru4 bing4 chao2 wo3men5 qing1xie4 dan4yao4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 you3 duo1 zhen4jing1。"

msgid ""
"Well, the body matches the description Burakgazi gave us... that's Green Winters.\n"
"\n"
"Make sure to get a holopic of the scene to show Eiger when we get back to the Kreuzbasar, yeah? She should see this."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​尸体​的​长相​跟​布拉加​齐​的​描述​对​得​上​……​这​就是​格林​·​温特斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别忘了​给​现场​拍​张照​，​等​咱们​回​了​集市​拿给​艾格尔看​。​这​情况​应该​让​她​看​一眼​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，shi1ti3 de5 zhang3xiang4 gen1 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 de5 miao2shu4 dui4 de2 shang4……zhe4 jiu4shi4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 wang4 le5 gei3 xian4chang3 pai1 zhang1 zhao4，deng3 zan2men5 hui2 le5 ji2shi4 na2 gei3 Ai4ge2er3 kan4。zhe4 qing2kuang4 ying1gai1 rang4 ta1 kan4 yi1yan3。"

msgid ""
"Well, the last thing *I* want is to talk about it, so we're even.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He offers you a lopsided grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now do me a favor and get out of here, okay? Let me smoke in peace."
msgstr ""
"*​我​*​最​不想​做​的​事​正好​也​是​聊​这个​，​所以​我们​算​扯平​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​冲​你​露出​一个​歪歪扭扭​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​行行好​，​别​在​这里​烦​我​了​好​吗​？​让​我​安静​地​抽​支烟​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"*wo3*zui4 bu4xiang3 zuo4 de5 shi4 zheng4hao3 ye3 shi4 liao2 zhe4ge5，suo3yi3 wo3men5 suan4 che3ping2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 wai1wai1niu3niu3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 xing2 xing2 hao3，bie4 zai4 zhe4li3 fan2 wo3 le5 hao3 ma5？rang4 wo3 an1jing4 de5 chou1 zhi1 yan1 ba1。"

msgid "Well, the more the merrier, I guess. Welcome aboard."
msgstr ""
"人多​了​挺​好​。​欢迎​加入​。\n"
"ren2 duo1 le5 ting3 hao3。huan1ying2 jia1ru4。"

msgid ""
"Well, the story is that the Black Lodge is the mother of all conspiracies.\n"
"\n"
"Supposedly, they've been around for hundreds of years, and they've been practicin' magic since well before the Awakening. Impossible, I know, but I believe it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​传说​“​黑​结社​”​是​所有​阴谋​的​源头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​据称​他们​存在​已有​数百年​之​久​，​并且​甚至​在​“​大​觉醒​”​之前​便​已​开始​修习​魔法​。​我​知道​这是​天方夜谭​，​但​我​对此​信之不疑​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，chuan2shuo1“hei1 jie2she4” shi4 suo3you3 yin1mou2 de5 yuan2tou2。\n"
"\n"
"ju4cheng1 ta1men5 cun2zai4 yi3 you3 shu3 bai3 nian2 zhi1 jiu3，bing4qie3 shen4zhi4 zai4“dai4 jue2xing3” zhi1qian2 bian4 yi3 kai1shi3 xiu1xi2 mo2fa3。wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 tian1fang1ye4tan2，dan4 wo3 dui4 ci3 xin4 zhi1 bu4 yi2。"

msgid "Well, the whole ears and hands thing, plus the barista junk."
msgstr ""
"就是​当​他​的​耳目​什么​的​，​外加​一些​服务员​的​杂活​。\n"
"jiu4shi4 dang1 ta1 de5 er3mu4 shen2me5 de5，wai4jia1 yi1xie1 fu2wu4yuan2 de5 za2huo2。"

msgid "Well, then, I'll just have to skin them first."
msgstr ""
"既然如此​，​我​就​先​扒​他们​的​皮​。\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 jiu4 xian1 ba1 ta1men5 de5 pi2。"

msgid ""
"Well, then, I'm sorry for your loss.\n"
"\n"
"Even sorrier, I mean. If a man can be such a thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A look of profound sadness crosses Dietrich's face, and he takes another long swig on his bottle.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​我​对​今晚​的​悲剧​遭遇​深表遗憾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​自己​也​难​受到​不​知道​该​说些​什么​好​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​的​脸上​掠过​深沉​的​悲伤​，​举起​酒瓶​又​猛​灌​了​一大口​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 dui4 jin1wan3 de5 bei1ju4 zao1yu4 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 nan2 shou4dao4 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 shuo1 xie1 shen2me5 hao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu:e4guo4 shen1chen2 de5 bei1shang1，ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2 you4 meng3 guan4 le5 yi1 dai4 kou3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Well, then, go get some, okay? At the bar!\n"
"\n"
"I'll be waiting!"
msgstr ""
"那​你​去​买点​，​好不好​？​在​吧台​就​能​买​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​等​你​哦​！\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 qu4 mai3 dian3，hao3bu5hao3？zai4 ba1tai2 jiu4 neng2 mai3！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 deng3 ni3 e2！"

msgid "Well, then, maybe I should go have a talk with them."
msgstr ""
"那好​吧​，​我​去​和​他们​谈谈​。\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1，wo3 qu4 he4 ta1men5 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"Well, then, we are at an impasse. Because I won't continue to feed these monsters for free.\n"
"\n"
"Our previous deal was brokered by your dear departed Monika. And without wanting to sound indelicate, it died with her."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​就​没得​聊​了​。​因为​我​不会​再​继续​免费​饲喂​那些​怪物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​之前​的​交易​是​你​那位​亲爱​的​莫妮卡​促成​的​。​恕我直言​，​这笔​交易​也​随​她​而​去​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3men5 jiu4 mei2 de2 liao2 le5。yin1wei4 wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 ji4xu4 mian3fei4 si4wei4 na4xie1 guai4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1qian2 de5 jiao1yi4 shi4 ni3 na4 wei4 qin1ai4 de5 Mo4ni1ka3 cu4cheng2 de5。shu4 wo3 zhi2 yan2，zhe4 bi3 jiao1yi4 ye3 sui2 ta1 er2 qu4 le5。"

msgid "Well, then, what are you going to do?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​要​怎么办​？\n"
"na4 ni3 yao4 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid ""
"Well, then, why the hell are you wasting our time?\n"
"\n"
"Fall back in line and get ready to fight. You *can* do that, can't you?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​他​妈​还​在​这​浪费​我们​的​时间​干什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​归队​，​准备​战斗​。​这个​你​总​*​能​行​*​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 ta1 ma1 hai2 zai4 zhe4 lang4fei4 wo3men5 de5 shi2jian1 gan4shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 gui1dui4，zhun3bei4 zhan4dou4。zhe4ge5 ni3 zong3*neng2 xing2*ba1？"

msgid ""
"Well, then, why the hell did you offer?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}From her body language, you can tell that Silke is agitated - she looks like she can't decide whether to slap you or break down crying.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If this is how it's gonna be, you can keep your favors to yourself."
msgstr ""
"那​你​一​开始​和​我​提​这个​做​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​从西​尔克​的​肢体​语言​可以​看出​，​她​目前​的​情绪​焦躁​不堪​—​—​她​看起来​既​想​扇​你​耳光​，​又​想​嚎啕大哭​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​这​就是​你​所谓​的​帮​我​，​那​我​用不着​，​你​还是​帮​自己​去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 yi1 kai1shi3 he4 wo3 ti2 zhe4ge5 zuo4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} cong2 Xi1er3ke4 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 ke3yi3 kan4chu1，ta1 mu4qian2 de5 qing2xu4 jiao1zao4 bu4kan1——ta1 kan4qi3lai5 ji4 xiang3 shan1 ni3 er3guang1，you4 xiang3 hao2tao2da4ku1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 jiu4shi4 ni3 suo3wei4 de5 bang1 wo3，na4 wo3 yong4bu5zhao2，ni3 hai2shi5 bang1 zi4ji3 qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, then, you can find yourself another partner. Nothing personal, but I "
"don't stick my neck out unless I'm getting paid."
msgstr ""
"那​你​还是​找​别人​帮​你​吧​。​不是​我​不​仗义​，​但​我​不​打算​在​没有​任何​收益​的​情况​下​替人​强​出头​。\n"
"na4 ni3 hai2shi5 zhao3 bie2ren5 bang1 ni3 ba1。bu4shi4 wo3 bu4 zhang4yi4，dan4 wo3 bu4 da3suan4 zai4 mei2you3 ren4he2 shou1yi4 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4 ti4 ren2 jiang4 chu1tou2。"

msgid ""
"Well, then, you'll just have to find the money or go without. I'm sorry, but"
" I have to go. I have a patient."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​你​要么​去​弄钱​，​要么​就别​买​。​我​得​走​了​，​还有​病人​等​着​呢​。\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 yao4me5 qu4 long4 qian2，yao4me5 jiu4 bie4 mai3。wo3 de2 zou3 le5，hai2you3 bing4ren2 deng3 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid "Well, then. Looks like we're doing this the hard way."
msgstr ""
"那好​吧​。​看来​我们​只能​掏​家伙​了​。\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1。kan4lai5 wo3men5 zhi3neng2 tao1 jia1huo5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, there are three names on this list that I recognize. One of 'em is mine, naturally... the Landenbergs and the Schwarze Herzen never did get along.\n"
"\n"
"Another is Hasenkamp's..."
msgstr ""
"我​认识​上面​的​三个​名字​。​其中​一个​自然​是​我​……​“​兰​登堡​”​和​“​黑心​”​向来​不​对付​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​一个​是​哈森​坎普​……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4shi5 shang4mian4 de5 san1 ge4 ming2zi5。qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 zi4ran2 shi4 wo3……“lan2 deng1 pu4” he4“hei1xin1” xiang4lai2 bu4 dui4fu5。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4 yi1ge5 shi4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3……"

msgid ""
"Well, there was an antiquated \"DVD\" storage device, a bunch of talk about "
"the \"Dragonfall\"... oh, and the bloody corpse of a guy named Green "
"Winters. Maybe you knew him?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​有​一台​过时​的​“​DVD​”​存储设备​，​一堆​关于​“​龙​陨​”​的​讨论​……​哦​，​还有​个​名叫​格林​·​温特斯​的​家伙​的​尸体​。​也许​你​认识​他​？\n"
"en1，you3 yi1 tai2 guo4shi2 de5“DVD” cun2 chu3 she4 bei4，yi1dui1 guan1yu2“long2 yun3” de5 tao3lun4……e2，hai2you3 ge4 ming2jiao4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 jia1huo5 de5 shi1ti3。ye3xu3 ni3 ren4shi5 ta1？"

msgid "Well, there was this dumpster..."
msgstr ""
"有​这么​一个​垃圾箱​……\n"
"you3 zhe4me5 yi1ge5 la1ji1xiang1……"

msgid ""
"Well, there was this truck, see, and it splashed up all this filthy water "
"from the gutter, and I got hosed."
msgstr ""
"是​这么回事​，​有辆​卡车​从​我​旁边​开​过去​，​结果​把​水沟​里面​的​脏水​溅​了​我​一身​。\n"
"shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4，you3 liang4 ka3che1 cong2 wo3 pang2bian1 kai1 guo4qu4，jie1guo3 ba3 shui3gou1 li3mian4 de5 zang1shui3 jian4 le5 wo3 yi1shen1。"

msgid ""
"Well, there were these feral ghouls in the sewers that were eating people "
"because you stopped feeding them medical waste, and-"
msgstr ""
"下水道​里​有​一些​食尸​鬼​在​吃​人​，​因为​你​不再​给​他们​投​喂​医疗​废物​了​，​还有​—​—\n"
"xia4shui3dao4 li3 you3 yi1xie1 shi2 shi1 gui3 zai4 chi1 ren2，yin1wei4 ni3 bu4zai4 gei3 ta1men5 tou2 wei2 yi1liao2 fei4wu4 le5，hai2you3 — —"

msgid ""
"Well, there's nothing that I can do about that. It's the plan that I was given, and we're stuck with it.\n"
"\n"
"Unless you have a better idea, we'll just have to follow our instructions and hope for the best."
msgstr ""
"我​对此​也​没什么​办法​。​我​拿到​的​计划​就是​这样​，​我们​只能​照办​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除非​你​有​更好​的​主意​，​否则​我们​只能​按​指示​行事​，​祈求​一切顺利​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 ye3 mei2shen2me5 ban4fa3。wo3 na2dao4 de5 ji4hua4 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4，wo3men5 zhi3neng2 zhao4ban4。\n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 ni3 you3 geng1 hao3 de5 zhu3yi5，fou3ze2 wo3men5 zhi3neng2 an4 zhi3shi4 xing2shi4，qi2qiu2 yi1 qie1 shun4 li4。"

msgid ""
"Well, there's only one doctor in the Kreuzbasar. I've never met the guy, but"
" I'm gonna have a word with him all the same."
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​里头​只有​一名​医生​。​我​没见​过​那么​家伙​，​但​我​还是​会​去​和​他​谈谈​的​。\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 li3tou5 zhi3you3 yi1 ming2 yi1sheng1。wo3 mei2 jian4 guo4 na4me5 jia1huo5，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 hui4 qu4 he4 ta1 tan2tan2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Well, there's this group out in Drogenkippe... they call themselves \"The "
"Landenberg Ring.\" They're a financial crime organization, and there's a lot"
" of bad blood between them and Meat Grinder's operation."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​毒坑区​有​这么​一个​组织​……​他们​自称​“​兰​登堡​帮​”​。​这​是​个​金融​犯罪​组织​，​而且​他们​和​“​绞肉机​”​的​行动​之间​有着​千丝万缕​的​联系​。\n"
"en1，du2 keng1 qu1 you3 zhe4me5 yi1ge5 zu3zhi1……ta1men5 zi4cheng1“lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1”。zhe4 shi4 ge4 jin1rong2 fan4zui4 zu3zhi1，er2qie3 ta1men5 he4“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 xing2dong4 zhi1jian1 you3zhe5 qian1si1wan4lu:3 de5 lian2xi4。"

msgid ""
"Well, they're definitely familiar with violence, if that's what you're asking. But, uh... I do have some bad news about them.\n"
"\n"
"They sort of jumped the gun a little. They're already inside."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​是​想​问​暴力​本领​的话​，​那​他们​绝对​不会​陌生​。​不过​……​我​有​个​坏消息​要​告诉​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​有点​操之过急​。​他们​已经​在​里面​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shi4 xiang3 wen4 bao4li4 ben3ling3 de5hua4，na4 ta1men5 jue2dui4 bu4hui4 mo4sheng1。bu4guo4……wo3 you3 ge4 huai4 xiao1 xi1 yao4 gao4su4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 you3dian3 cao1zhi1guo4ji2。ta1men5 yi3jing1 zai4 li3mian4 le5。"

msgid "Well, they're eager, I'll give them that much."
msgstr ""
"不得不​说​，​他们​还​挺起​劲儿​的​。\n"
"bu4de2bu4 shuo1，ta1men5 hai2 ting3 qi3 jin4r5 de5。"

msgid "Well, this is where I keep all my guns and stuff."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​毕竟​我​把​枪械​和​其他​东西​都​放在​这里​了​。\n"
"en1，bi4jing4 wo3 ba3 qiang1xie4 he4 qi2ta1 dong1xi1 dou1 fang4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, this new guy, he's a better fit for my organization than Hasenkamp was.\n"
"\n"
"On top of that, he's bringing a new revenue stream along with him... sort of a business partnership, like."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​比起​哈森​坎普​来说​，​这位​新人​更​适合​我​的​组织​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除此之外​，​他​还​带来​了​新​的​收入​来源​……​算是​种​商业​合作​关系​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，bi3qi3 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 lai2 shuo1，zhe4wei4 xin1ren2 geng1 shi4he2 wo3 de5 zu3zhi1。\n"
"\n"
"chu2ci3zhi1wai4，ta1 hai2 dai4lai2 le5 xin1 de5 shou1ru4 lai2yuan2……suan4shi4 zhong3 shang1ye4 he2zuo4 guan1xi5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, those burns sound like dragonfire. But if the Firewing burned Audran, "
"why would he be working for her now?"
msgstr ""
"他​的​烧伤​听​起来​像是​龙焰​导致​的​。​但​要是​火翼​烧伤​了​奥​德兰​，​他​现在​为何​还要​替​她​工作​？\n"
"ta1 de5 shao1shang1 ting1 qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 long2 yan4 dao3zhi4 de5。dan4 yao4shi5 Huo3yi4 shao1shang1 le5 Ao4de2lan2，ta1 xian4zai4 wei4he2 hai2 yao4 ti4 ta1 gong1zuo4？"

msgid ""
"Well, uh, I did some housekeeping, and I discovered something. \n"
"\n"
"On the morning that Emilie disappeared, some information vanished from my cyberdeck."
msgstr ""
"总之​我​收拾​了​一下​，​也​有​了​些​发现​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾米莉​消失​的​那天​早上​，​我​的​赛博碟板​里面​也​有些​情报​不见​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 wo3 shou1shi5 le5 yi1xia4，ye3 you3 le5 xie1 fa1xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ai4 mi3 li4 xiao1shi1 de5 na4tian1 zao3shang5，wo3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 li3mian4 ye3 you3xie1 qing2bao4 bu4jian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, uh...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There's a long pause, then a sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He'd take my thumbs off, wouldn't he?"
msgstr ""
"这个​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​停顿​良久​，​最后​他​长叹一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他会​把​我​的​拇指​剁​掉​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ting2dun4 liang2jiu3，zui4hou4 ta1 zhang3 tan4 yi1 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 hui4 ba3 wo3 de5 mu3zhi3 duo4 diao4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Well, uh... I didn't know Paul as well as the rest of you. But he seemed like a good guy.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shuffles his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't want to see this happen, at any rate."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​我​和保罗​不像​你们​那么​熟​。​但​他​看上去​是​个​好人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挪动​着​脚步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管怎样​，​我​不​希望​看到​这种​事​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"e4……wo3 he4 bao3 luo2 bu4 xiang4 ni3men5 na4me5 shu2。dan4 ta1 kan4shang5qu5 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nuo2dong4 zhao2 jiao3bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3zen3yang4，wo3 bu4 xi1wang4 kan4dao4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Well, uh... that's not exactly how I'd put it, but... yeah. I guess.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is an awkward pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In my own defense, I didn't expect him to send his accountant to shadow you, though! That's a new one on me."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​我​具体​不是​这么​说​的​，​但是​……​差不多​是​这么回事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一阵​尴尬​的​沉默​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​要​辩解​一下​，​我​没想到​他​会派​自己​的​会计​来​跟着​你​！​这事​我​也​不​知道​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"e4……wo3 ju4ti3 bu4shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5，dan4shi4……cha4bu5duo1 shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1zhen4 gan1ga4 de5 chen2mo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 yao4 bian4jie3 yi1xia4，wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 ta1 hui4 pai4 zi4ji3 de5 kuai4ji4 lai2 gen1zhe5 ni3！zhe4 shi4 wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 a1。"

msgid ""
"Well, uh... yeah. Meat Grinder hasn't gone away on his own, or anything."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​是​啊​。​“​绞肉机​”​也​不会​自己​突然​消失​什么​的​。\n"
"e4……shi4 a1。“jiao3rou4ji1” ye3 bu4hui4 zi4ji3 tu1ran2 xiao1shi1 shen2me5 de5。"

msgid ""
"Well, um. It's a nice enough place. Y'know, for a factory.\n"
"\n"
"Let's see... well, okay. The second floor is a security station. Lots of high-tech stuff up there."
msgstr ""
"那个​，​呃​。​这​地方​住​着​还行​。​就​，​至少​在​工厂​改建​的​房子​里​，​算​不错​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​想想​……​哦​，​对​。​二楼​有​监控室​。​一大堆​高科技​的​玩意​都​在​那​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5，e4。zhe4 di4fang1 zhu4 zhao2 hai2 xing2。jiu4，zhi4shao3 zai4 gong1chang3 gai3jian4 de5 fang2zi5 li3，suan4 bu4cuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 xiang3 xiang3……e2，dui4。er4 lou2 you3 jian1 kong4 shi4。yi1 dai4 dui1 gao1ke1ji4 de5 wan2yi4 dou1 zai4 na4。"

msgid ""
"Well, unfortunately for you, Mr. Grinder *does* trust me. That's why I'm here.\n"
"\n"
"Now, if you want Blitz off of his hit list, you'll step aside."
msgstr ""
"非常​遗憾​，​“​绞肉机​”​先生​信任​我​，​所以​我​才​会​在​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​让​布里​茨​脱离​他​的​暗杀​名单​，​就​不要​碍​我​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 yi2han4，“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 xin4ren4 wo3，suo3yi3 wo3 cai2 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 Bu4li3ci2 tuo1li2 ta1 de5 an4sha1 ming2dan1，jiu4 bu4yao4 ai4 wo3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Well, we are pleased to meet you, $(l.name). My name is Kristian Beck, and "
"this is my wife, Karin."
msgstr ""
"我们​很​高兴​认识​你​，​$(l.name)​。​我​是​克里斯蒂安​·​贝克​，​这位​是​我​的​妻子​卡琳​。\n"
"wo3men5 hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，$(l.name)。wo3 shi4 ke4li3si1di4an1 · bei4ke4，zhe4wei4 shi4 wo3 de5 qi1zi3 ka3 lin2。"

msgid ""
"Well, we found Winters. That's something, I guess.\n"
"\n"
"This whole thing has me feeling uneasy, boss. But at least we have a direction to look in."
msgstr ""
"至少​我们​找到​了​格林​·​温特斯​，​也​算​有所​收获​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​整件事​都​让​我​感觉​不安​，​老大​。​但​至少​我们​算是​有​头绪​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3 wo3men5 zhao3dao4 le5 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1，ye3 suan4 you3suo3 shou1huo4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 dou1 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2 bu4an1，lao3da4。dan4 zhi4shao3 wo3men5 suan4shi4 you3 tou2xu4 le5。"

msgid "Well, we'll be on our way, then."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​这​就​离开​。\n"
"na4 wo3men5 zhe4 jiu4 li2kai1。"

msgid "Well, we're out. No more James, and no more Lodge."
msgstr ""
"我们​出来​了​。​不再​有​詹姆斯​，​也​不再​有​“​结社​”​。\n"
"wo3men5 chu1lai2 le5。bu4zai4 you3 zhan1mu3si1，ye3 bu4zai4 you3“jie2she4”。"

msgid ""
"Well, well. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Quorin looks thoughtful.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Maybe things are looking up around here. I suppose friends and enemies both can be found in strange ways, here in the Flux."
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​奎林​若有所思​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​事情​真的​有​了​转机​。​看来​在​动荡​带​这里​，​认识​朋友​和​敌人​的​方式​都​挺​奇怪​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ai1 ya1 ya1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kui2 lin2 ruo4you3suo3si1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4qing5 zhen1de5 you3 le5 zhuan3ji1。kan4lai5 zai4 dong4dang4 dai4 zhe4li3，ren4shi5 peng2you5 he4 di2ren2 de5 fang1shi4 dou1 ting3 qi2guai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Well, well. If it isn't the muscle that Tuck promised us.\n"
"\n"
"Look who it is, everybody... the new hires have elected to grace us with their presence."
msgstr ""
"哟​，​这​不是​塔克​给​咱​找​的​打手​嘛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​各位​看看​是​谁​来​了​……​新人​决定​大驾光临​我们​的​场子​了​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"yo1，zhe4 bu4shi4 ta3 ke4 gei3 za2 zhao3 de5 da3shou5 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"ge4wei4 kan4kan5 shi4 shei2 lai2 le5……xin1ren2 jue2ding4 da4jia4guang1lin2 wo3men5 de5 chang3zi5 le5 a1。"

msgid ""
"Well, what are we waiting for?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger slings her rifle over her shoulder with a single, spare motion.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Gear up, people. We have a hotel to raid."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​还​等​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​干脆利落​地​将​步枪​斜​挎​在​肩上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​准备​抄​家伙​，​我们​去​突袭​那​家​旅馆​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3men5 hai2 deng3 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 gan1cui4li4luo5 de5 jiang1 bu4qiang1 xie2 kua4 zai4 jian1 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhun3bei4 chao1 jia1huo5，wo3men5 qu4 tu1xi2 na4 jia1 lu:3guan3。"

msgid "Well, what are we waiting for? I'll go get my things."
msgstr ""
"那​我们​还​等​什么​呢​？​我​这​就​去​收拾​东西​。\n"
"na4 wo3men5 hai2 deng3 shen2me5 ni2？wo3 zhe4 jiu4 qu4 shou1shi5 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Well, what do you know? Looks like this is my stop, too."
msgstr ""
"真巧​啊​，​我​也​到​站​了​。\n"
"zhen1 qiao3 a1，wo3 ye3 dao4 zhan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, what else can we do? Cut and run? \n"
"\n"
"The last time I checked, that wasn’t an option, either."
msgstr ""
"所以​呢​，​我们​又​能​怎么办​？​临阵脱逃​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​记错​的话​，​并​没有​逃跑​这个​选项​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni2，wo3men5 you4 neng2 zen3me5ban4？lin2zhen4tuo1tao2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 ji4cuo4 de5hua4，bing4 mei2you3 tao2pao3 zhe4ge5 xuan3xiang4。"

msgid "Well, what would you call $(l.him)?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​那​你​要​如何​称呼​$(l.he)​？\n"
"en1，na4 ni3 yao4 ru2he2 cheng1hu5 $(l.he)？"

msgid ""
"Well, whatever he is, I'm glad he's on our team.\n"
"\n"
"Let's find the others."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​不管​他​是​什么​，​我​很​高兴​他​在​我们​这边​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​去​找​其他人​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，bu4guan3 ta1 shi4 shen2me5，wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ta1 zai4 wo3men5 zhe4bian1。\n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 qu4 zhao3 qi2 ta1 ren2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well, when Emilie left me, she disappeared with a bunch of my decking gear, right?\n"
"\n"
"I just did some housekeeping, and I discovered something. She also hacked my old cyberdeck."
msgstr ""
"艾米莉​离开​我​的​时候​，​还​带走​了​我​的​一大堆​骇入​设备​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​收拾​了​一下​，​也​有​了​些​发现​。​她​还​骇入​了​我​的​旧赛​博碟板​。\n"
"\n"
"ai4 mi3 li4 li2kai1 wo3 de5 shi2hou5，hai2 dai4zou3 le5 wo3 de5 yi1 dai4 dui1 hai4 ru4 she4bei4，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shou1shi5 le5 yi1xia4，ye3 you3 le5 xie1 fa1xian4。ta1 hai2 hai4 ru4 le5 wo3 de5 jiu4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3。"

msgid ""
"Well, when you put it that way, it does sound like a net positive. Forget I "
"said anything."
msgstr ""
"你​这么​一说​，​好像​确实​没​坏处​。​当​我​刚才​什么​也​没​说​吧​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4me5 yi1shuo1，hao3xiang4 que4shi2 mei2 huai4chu5。dang1 wo3 gang1cai2 shen2me5 ye3 mei2 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid "Well, who you are, for one thing."
msgstr ""
"首先​，​你​是​干什么​的​。\n"
"shou3xian1，ni3 shi4 gan4shen2me5 de5。"

msgid "Well, yeah, but..."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​但是​……\n"
"shi4 a1，dan4shi4……"

msgid ""
"Well, yeah. Of course. But I don't see how you gettin' yourself killed is "
"gonna accomplish that."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​当然​要​。​但​我​实在​看不出来​，​你​就​这么​去​送死​的话​能​有​什么​帮助​。\n"
"e4，dang1ran2 yao4。dan4 wo3 shi2zai4 kan4 bu4 chu1 lai2，ni3 jiu4 zhe4me5 qu4 song4si3 de5hua4 neng2 you3 shen2me5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Well, yeah. Of course. But I don't see how you getting yourself killed is "
"gonna accomplish that."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​当然​要​。​但​我​实在​看不出来​，​你​就​这么​去​送死​的话​能​有​什么​帮助​。\n"
"e4，dang1ran2 yao4。dan4 wo3 shi2zai4 kan4 bu4 chu1 lai2，ni3 jiu4 zhe4me5 qu4 song4si3 de5hua4 neng2 you3 shen2me5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Well, yes, but I don't know why it's *my* responsibility to pay them for--"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​但​凭​什么​这份​责任​要​落到​*​我​的​*​头上​—​—\n"
"shi4 a1，dan4 ping2 shen2me5 zhe4 fen4 ze2ren4 yao4 la4 dao4*wo3 de5*tou2shang4 — —"

msgid "Well, yes, but--"
msgstr ""
"呃​，​是​的​，​但是​—​—\n"
"e4，shi4 de5，dan4shi4 — —"

msgid ""
"Well, yes. Yes, it is.\n"
"\n"
"...So if you agree with me, why did you call?"
msgstr ""
"可不是​嘛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​所以​如果​你​支持​我​的话​，​你​现在​联系​我​又​有​什么​事​？\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"……suo3yi3 ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1chi2 wo3 de5hua4，ni3 xian4zai4 lian2xi4 wo3 you4 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"Well, you already know how I feel, but you are the leader of this team.\n"
"\n"
"I guess it's up to you."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​我​怎么​想​你​是​知道​的​，​但​你​是​队长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还是​得​由​你​做​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，wo3 zen3me5 xiang3 ni3 shi4 zhi1dao4 de5，dan4 ni3 shi4 dui4zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 de2 you2 ni3 zuo4 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"Well, you know. Altuğ always says, \"If you do not spy, how will you know who's boss?\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She waves her hand as though to excuse her poor memory.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Or something like that. I'm just a kid, what do I know?"
msgstr ""
"你​懂​的​。​奥图​伊总说​，​“​如果​你​不​消息灵通​的话​，​你​怎么​知道​谁​才​是​老大​？​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​挥挥手​，​仿佛​在​为​自己​记忆力​差而​开脱​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​差不多​这个​意思​。​我​就是​个​孩子​嘛​，​我​知道​什么​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dong3 de5。ao4 tu2 yi1 zong3 shuo1，“ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 xiao1xi5ling2tong1 de5hua4，ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 shei2 cai2 shi4 lao3da4？” \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui1 hui1 shou3，fang3fu2 zai4 wei2 zi4ji3 ji4yi4li4 cha4 er2 kai1tuo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 cha4bu5duo1 zhe4ge5 yi4si5。wo3 jiu4shi4 ge4 hai2zi5 ma5，wo3 zhi1dao4 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Well, you know. Altuğ always says, \"if you do not spy, how will you know who's boss?\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She waves her hand as though to excuse her poor memory.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Or something like that. I'm just a kid, what do I know?"
msgstr ""
"你​懂​的​。​奥图​伊总说​，​“​如果​你​不​消息灵通​的话​，​你​怎么​知道​谁​才​是​老大​？​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​挥挥手​，​仿佛​在​为​自己​记忆力​差而​开脱​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​差不多​这个​意思​。​我​就是​个​孩子​嘛​，​我​知道​什么​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dong3 de5。ao4 tu2 yi1 zong3 shuo1，“ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 xiao1xi5ling2tong1 de5hua4，ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 shei2 cai2 shi4 lao3da4？” \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui1 hui1 shou3，fang3fu2 zai4 wei2 zi4ji3 ji4yi4li4 cha4 er2 kai1tuo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 cha4bu5duo1 zhe4ge5 yi4si5。wo3 jiu4shi4 ge4 hai2zi5 ma5，wo3 zhi1dao4 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Well, you really screwed us. I hope you're happy about that.\n"
"\n"
"An hour after your little party at the Azzie compound, the whole district was crawling with Knight Errant. And who do you think they came to see?"
msgstr ""
"你​真是​把​我们​害惨​了​。​你​现在​高兴​了​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​阿兹佬​园区​搞​出​事情​后​不到​一​小时​，​整个​片区​就​挤满​了​游侠​骑士​。​你​猜​他们​是​来​找​谁​的​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ba3 wo3men5 hai4 can3 le5。ni3 xian4zai4 gao1xing4 le5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 e1 zi1 lao3 yuan2qu1 gao3 chu1 shi4qing5 hou4 bu4dao4 yi1 xiao3shi2，zheng3ge4 pian1 qu1 jiu4 ji3man3 le5 you2Xia2qi2shi4。ni3 cai1 ta1men5 shi4 lai2 zhao3 shei2 de5？"

msgid ""
"Well, you remember those creditors I told you about? The ones who loaned me all of that money?\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, well... as it turns out, some of 'em are a little less forgiving than I thought they were."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​你​还​记得​我​跟​你​说​过​的​那些​债主​吗​？​就是​那些​借给​我​那么​多钱​的​人​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​……​原来​其中​有些​人​没有​我​想象​中​那么​宽宏大量​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，ni3 hai2 ji4de5 wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 guo4 de5 na4xie1 zhai4zhu3 ma5？jiu4shi4 na4xie1 jie4gei3 wo3 na4me5 duo1 qian2 de5 ren2？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5……yuan2lai2 qi2zhong1 you3xie1 ren2 mei2you3 wo3 xiang3xiang4 zhong4 na4me5 kuan1hong2da4liang4。"

msgid ""
"Well, you took care of 'em quick enough. Nice shooting, by the way... you saved me some real trouble there.\n"
"\n"
"The drones wouldn't've shot me, but I wasn't looking forward to spending the next week in an Azzie interrogation cell. I've heard stories."
msgstr ""
"你​确实​三下五除二​就​把​它们​解决​了​。​顺便​说句​，​枪法​不错​……​你​可​帮​我​摆脱​了​大​麻烦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​无人机​倒​不会​开枪​打​我​，​但​我​可​不想​接下来​一周​被关​在​阿兹佬​的​审讯​室​里​。​类似​的​传言​我​可​听​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4shi2 san1xia4wu3chu2er4 jiu4 ba3 ta1men5 jie3jue2 le5。shun4bian4 shuo1 ju4，qiang1fa3 bu4cuo4……ni3 ke3 bang1 wo3 bai3tuo1 le5 dai4 ma2fan5。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 wu2ren2ji1 dao3 bu4hui4 kai1qiang1 da3 wo3，dan4 wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 jie1xia4lai2 yi1zhou1 bei4 guan1 zai4 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 shen3xun4 shi4 li3。lei4si4 de5 chuan2yan2 wo3 ke3 ting1 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, you were finally reunited with your lost love. That's something, "
"right?"
msgstr ""
"你​总算​和​消失​的​爱人​重聚​了​。​这​也​算​有所​收获​吧​？\n"
"ni3 zong3suan4 he4 xiao1shi1 de5 ai4ren5 chong2ju4 le5。zhe4 ye3 suan4 you3suo3 shou1huo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Well, you won't have to worry about that any more. The door's open. You can "
"get out of here."
msgstr ""
"你​不用​再​担心​这个​了​。​门​已经​开​了​，​你​随时​可以​离开​。\n"
"ni3 bu4yong4 zai4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5 le5。men2 yi3jing1 kai1 le5，ni3 sui2shi2 ke3yi3 li2kai1。"

msgid "Well, you'd be the first. But I'll tell you anyway."
msgstr ""
"你​还是​第一个​这么​说​的​。​不过​告诉​你​也​没关系​。\n"
"ni3 hai2shi5 di4 yi1 ge4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5。bu4guo4 gao4su4 ni3 ye3 mei2guan1xi5。"

msgid "Well, you'd better have a look."
msgstr ""
"唔​，​你​最好​自己​看​一眼​。\n"
"wu2，ni3 zui4hao3 zi4ji3 kan4 yi1yan3。"

msgid ""
"Well, you'll most likely hear instead of see, if you haven't already.\n"
"\n"
"Or I guess you'll see if you're tripping on something wiggly."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​恐怕​你​更​多​得​用​耳朵​去​听​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者​等​你​被​什么​蠕动​的​东西​绊倒​之后​，​你​就​会​看到​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，kong3pa4 ni3 geng1 duo1 de2 yong4 er3duo5 qu4 ting1。\n"
"\n"
"huo4zhe3 deng3 ni3 bei4 shen2me5 ru2dong4 de5 dong1xi1 ban4dao3 zhi1hou4，ni3 jiu4 hui4 kan4dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, you're half right. *$(l.name)* is almost out.\n"
"\n"
"You, on the other hand, won't ever leave this building, you son of a bitch."
msgstr ""
"你​说​对​了​一半​。​是​*​$(l.name)​*​马上​就​能​离开​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​你​永远​别想​离开​这栋​大楼​了​，​你​个​王八蛋​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 dui4 le5 yi1ban4。shi4*$(l.name)*ma3shang4 jiu4 neng2 li2kai1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ni3 yong3yuan3 bie4 xiang3 li2kai1 zhe4 dong4 da4lou2 le5，ni3 ge4 wang2ba1dan4。"

msgid ""
"Well, you're here now.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He flashes you a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks. Gotta get home to the wife... she's going to give me hell enough as it is. I was *supposed* to be home an hour ago."
msgstr ""
"毕竟​你​还是​赶来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朝​你​笑​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​多谢​。​我​得​赶紧​回家​安抚​妻子​……​恐怕​她​已经​要​对​我​大发雷霆​了​。​我​一个​小时​前​*​就​该​*​到家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 ni3 hai2shi5 gan3lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 xiao4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"duo1xie4。wo3 de2 gan3jin3 hui2jia1 an1fu3 qi1zi3……kong3pa4 ta1 yi3jing1 yao4 dui4 wo3 da4fa1lei2ting2 le5。wo3 yi1ge5 xiao3shi2 qian2*jiu4 gai1*dao4jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well, you're the one who's gonna have to explain it to Audran if they get "
"past us."
msgstr ""
"如果​他们​跑掉​的话​，​你​到时候​去​和​奥​德兰​解释​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1men5 pao3diao4 de5hua4，ni3 dao4shi2hou4 qu4 he4 Ao4de2lan2 jie3shi4。"

msgid "Well, you've got what you wanted. Let's get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"你​拿到​了​你​想要​的​。​我们​离开​这里​吧​。\n"
"ni3 na2dao4 le5 ni3 xiang3yao4 de5。wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1。"

msgid "Well-connected and discreet are good. I'll be sure to look her up."
msgstr ""
"有人​脉​，​做事​谨慎​，​这​真是​太好了​。​我​一定​会​去​见见​她​。\n"
"you3ren2 mai4，zuo4shi4 jin3shen4，zhe4 zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5。wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 qu4 jian4 jian4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Well.\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that I must thank you."
msgstr ""
"啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​我​是​该​谢谢​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"a1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 shi4 gai1 xie4xie5 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances down at the plastic box cradled in his arms.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Son of a bitch."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​低头​看​向​自己​怀里​的​塑料盒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​王八蛋​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 kan4 xiang4 zi4ji3 huai2li3 de5 su4 liao4 he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wang2ba1dan4。"

msgid ""
"Well. As I was saying when you first approached, I was able to uncover some new evidence in your absence.\n"
"\n"
"And coincidentally enough, that evidence pertains to our scarred friend."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​你​刚回来​的​时候​我​就​想​说​，​我​这边​有​了​不少​收获​。​你​不​在​的​时候​，​我​发现​了​一些​新​的​证据​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巧合​的​是​，​这些​证据​与​我们​的​疤脸​朋友​有关​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，ni3 gang1 hui2 lai2 de5 shi2hou5 wo3 jiu4 xiang3 shuo1，wo3 zhe4bian1 you3 le5 bu4shao3 shou1huo4。ni3 bu4 zai4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1xie1 xin1 de5 zheng4ju4。\n"
"\n"
"qiao3he2 de5 shi4，zhe4xie1 zheng4ju4 yu4 wo3men5 de5 ba1 lian3 peng2you5 you3guan1。"

msgid ""
"Well. Considering your friend's upbringing, it's no surprise that she views "
"the Adversary as a devil-figure... she's interpreting her experiences "
"through the lens that she was given."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​考虑​到​你​朋友​的​成长​环境​，​她​将​反叛者​视为​恶魔​般的​存在​并​不​奇怪​……​她​不过​是​通过​被​灌输​的​视角​来​解读​自己​的​经历​罢了​。\n"
"en1。kao3lu:4 dao4 ni3 peng2you5 de5 cheng2zhang3 huan2jing4，ta1 jiang1 fan3 pan4 zhe3 shi4wei2 e4mo2 ban1 de5 cun2zai4 bing4 bu4 qi2guai4……ta1 bu4guo4 shi4 tong1guo4 bei4 guan4shu1 de5 shi4jiao3 lai2 jie3du2 zi4ji3 de5 jing1li4 ba4le5。"

msgid ""
"Well. Gee.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He scowls.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You just can't give it to me, can you, chief? You can't give me the satisfaction?"
msgstr ""
"老天​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​就​非得​找​我​的​茬​吗​，​头儿​？​就​不能​对​我​满意​一些​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 fei1dei3 zhao3 wo3 de5 cha2 ma5，tou2r5？jiu4 bu4neng2 dui4 wo3 man3yi4 yi1xie1 ma5？"

msgid "Well. I can't wait to see what you can do with it."
msgstr ""
"那​我​等不及​要​看看​你​能​用​它​做​什么​了​。\n"
"na4 wo3 deng3bu4ji2 yao4 kan4kan5 ni3 neng2 yong4 ta1 zuo4 shen2me5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well. I suppose that I wouldn't expect you to understand.\n"
"\n"
"And now, if you don't mind, I'll get back to shopping for my son. Go push your broom somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"我​也​没指望​你​能​理解​这种​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​如果​你​不介意​的话​，​我要​继续​给​我​儿子​买​东西​了​。​你​还是​去​别处​扫​你​的​地​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 mei2 zhi3 wang4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3 zhe4zhong3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4，wo3 yao4 ji4xu4 gei3 wo3 er2zi5 mai3 dong1xi1 le5。ni3 hai2shi5 qu4 bie2chu4 sao3 ni3 de5 de5 ba1。"

msgid "Well. I'm glad to hear that she's okay."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​很​高兴​知道​她​没事​。\n"
"en1，wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 zhi1dao4 ta1 mei2shi4。"

msgid ""
"Well. It doesn't make any difference to me, but you be careful out there.\n"
"\n"
"The people on the other side of that wall... well, they've got no respect. For anybody."
msgstr ""
"对​我​来说​倒​是​无所谓​，​但​你​可得​小心​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​墙​那边​的​那些​人​……​怎么​说​呢​，​他们​做事​根本​没有​什么​原则​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 dao3 shi4 wu2suo3wei4，dan4 ni3 ke3 de2 xiao3xin1 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"qiang2 na4bian5 de5 na4xie1 ren2……zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，ta1men5 zuo4shi4 gen1ben3 mei2you3 shen2me5 yuan2ze2。"

msgid ""
"Well. It took you long enough.\n"
"\n"
"To answer your question, $(l.name), I *wanted* to discuss business. Past tense. But I didn't hear back from you in a timely fashion, so I hired someone else for the job."
msgstr ""
"你​可​拖​了​够​久​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​我​这么​跟​你​说​吧​。​我​*​之前​*​是​想​聊​业务​的​事来​着​，​但​我​没有​及时​收到​你​的​回复​，​所以​我​雇​了​别人​来​做​这份​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3 tuo1 le5 gou4 jiu3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 zhe4me5 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ba1。wo3*zhi1qian2*shi4 xiang3 liao2 ye4wu4 de5 shi4 lai2 zhao2，dan4 wo3 mei2you3 ji2shi2 shou1dao4 ni3 de5 hui2fu4，suo3yi3 wo3 gu4 le5 bie2ren5 lai2 zuo4 zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Well. It's food for thought, anyway. I don't know whether the thought of some radioactive ghost-dragon-thing is any scarier than a genuine dragon is. But it's interesting, all the same.\n"
"\n"
"Now, the big question is, will any of this get me any closer to finding Adrian?"
msgstr ""
"不管怎么​说​，​这​是​个​值得​思考​的​问题​。​我​不​知道​放射性​幽灵​巨龙​的​想法​是否​比​真正​的​巨龙​更​可怕​，​但​还是​挺​有意思​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​最大​的​问题​是​，​这些​能​让​我​更​接近​阿德里安​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4 guan3 zen3 ma2 shuo1，zhe4 shi4 ge4 zhi2de5 si1kao3 de5 wen4ti2。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 fang4she4xing4 you1ling2 ju4long2 de5 xiang3fa3 shi4fou3 bi3 zhen1zheng4 de5 ju4long2 geng1 ke3pa4，dan4 hai2shi5 ting3 you3yi4si5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 zui4 dai4 de5 wen4ti2 shi4，zhe4xie1 neng2 rang4 wo3 geng1 jie1jin4 E1de2li3an1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Well. I’ve got a history with Humanis.\n"
"\n"
"I fought ‘em back in ’39, during the Night of Rage."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我​和​人类​至上​主义者​是​有些​恩怨​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​2039​年​的​“​愤怒​之夜​”​时​，​我​曾经​和​他们​大打出手​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 he4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 shi4 you3xie1 en1yuan4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"2039 nian2 de5“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” shi2，wo3 ceng2jing1 he4 ta1men5 da4da3chu1shou3。"

msgid ""
"Well. Our scarred friend makes an appearance.\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)... I suspect that Green Winters' predictions are coming true. I believe that Feuerschwinge is behind this."
msgstr ""
"啧​，​看来​我们​的​疤脸​朋友​浮出​水面​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​……​格林​·​温特斯​的​预测​似乎​成真​了​。​我​认为​火翼​就是​幕后​黑手​。\n"
"\n"
"ze2，kan4lai5 wo3men5 de5 ba1 lian3 peng2you5 fu2chu1 shui3mian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 yu4ce4 si4hu1 cheng2zhen1 le5。wo3 ren4wei2 Huo3yi4 jiu4shi4 mu4hou4 hei1shou3。"

msgid ""
"Well. Perhaps there was no other way. I applaud your dedication to completing the mission.\n"
"\n"
"But I would recommend subtlety where possible. Mass bloodshed is not always the best means to an end."
msgstr ""
"没​办法​就​没​办法​吧​。​我​只能​说​，​我​赞赏​你​完成​任务​的​决心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​建议​尽量​还是​低调​行事​。​大开杀戒​并​不​总是​解决问题​的​最佳​手段​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 ban4fa3 jiu4 mei2 ban4fa3 ba1。wo3 zhi3neng2 shuo1，wo3 zan4shang3 ni3 wan2cheng2 ren4wu5 de5 jue2xin1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 jian4yi4 jin3liang4 hai2shi5 di1diao4 xing2shi4。dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4 bing4 bu4 zong3shi4 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2 de5 zui4jia1 shou3duan4。"

msgid ""
"Well. That takes care of that.\n"
"\n"
"And now, if you'll excuse me, I'm going to go take care of Mr. Grinder."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​算是​完事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​恕​我​失陪​，​我要​回去​找​“​绞肉机​”​先生​算账​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，suan4shi4 wan2shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 yao4 hui2qu5 zhao3“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 suan4zhang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Well. That was very enlightening.\n"
"\n"
"Want me to delete the files, chief?"
msgstr ""
"真让人​豁然开朗​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​需要​我​删掉​文件​吗​，​头儿​？\n"
"\n"
"zhen1 rang4 ren2 huo4ran2kai1lang3 a1。\n"
"\n"
"xu1yao4 wo3 shan1diao4 wen2jian4 ma5，tou2r5？"

msgid ""
"Well. That was... enlightening. Assuming that any of it was true, that is."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​真是​……​深受​启发​。​前提​是​这些​消息​有​任何​一条​属实​的话​。\n"
"a1，zhen1shi5……shen1shou4 qi3fa1。qian2ti2 shi4 zhe4xie1 xiao1xi5 you3 ren4he2 yi1 tiao2 shu3shi2 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"Well. That's okay, then.\n"
"\n"
"But chie--"
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​那​还行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​，​头儿​—​—\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。na4 hai2 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4，tou2r5 — —"

msgid ""
"Well. They're rather light on identifying information... our friend's name is listed as \"Max Mustermann,\" the local equivalent of \"John Doe.\"\n"
"\n"
"But they do cover his injuries in great detail."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​病历​上​的​身份​信息​十分​简略​……​我们​这位​朋友​的​姓名​被​登记​为​“​马克斯​·​穆​斯特曼​”​，​相当于​德国​版本​的​“​无名氏​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​他​的​伤势​倒​是​记录​得​非常​详尽​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，bing4li4 shang4 de5 shen1fen4 xin4xi1 shi2fen1 jian3lu:e4……wo3men5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 de5 xing4ming2 bei4 deng1ji4 wei2“ma3 ke4 si1 · mu4 si1 te4 man4”，xiang1dang1yu2 de2guo2 ban3ben3 de5“wu2ming2shi4”。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ta1 de5 shang1shi4 dao3 shi4 ji4lu4 de2 fei1chang2 xiang2jin4。"

msgid ""
"Well. Um. Emilie found me. And, um...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns his head and looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She rescued me."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​艾米莉​找到​了​我​。​而且​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把头​扭向​一旁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​救​了​我​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，ai4 mi3 li4 zhao3dao4 le5 wo3。er2qie3……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3tou2 niu3 xiang4 yi1pang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiu4 le5 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Well. Um. In a manner of speaking.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She opens the box and shows you its contents. It's packed to the brim with an assortment of hand tools.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not like you... not like the others. You should probably know that."
msgstr ""
"呃​，​可以​这么​说​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​打开​箱子​，​向​你​展示​里面​的​物品​。​箱子​塞得​满满当当​，​装满​了​各式各样​的​手持​工具​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​不​一样​……​跟​其他人​也​不​一样​。​也许​该​让​你​知道​这件​事​。\n"
"\n"
"e4，ke3yi3 zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da3kai1 xiang1zi5，xiang4 ni3 zhan3shi4 li3mian4 de5 wu4pin3。xiang1zi5 se4 de2 man3man3dang1dang1，zhuang1man3 le5 ge4shi4ge4yang4 de5 shou3 chi2 gong1ju4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 bu4 yi1yang4……gen1 qi2 ta1 ren2 ye3 bu4 yi1yang4。ye3xu3 gai1 rang4 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Well. Um. One in particular seems to have taken things kind of personally."
msgstr ""
"这个​，​其中​有​一个​人​特别​斤斤计较​。\n"
"zhe4ge5，qi2zhong1 you3 yi1ge5 ren2 te4bie2 jin1jin1ji4jiao4。"

msgid ""
"Well. What do you want me to say? That I lied to you? That I killed a member of my own team?\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. I did both of those things. But I don't regret any of it."
msgstr ""
"你​指望​我​说些​什么​？​我​对​你​说谎​了​？​我​杀死​了​自己​的​队员​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​这​都​是​我​做​下​的​事​。​但​我​对此​毫不​后悔​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi3wang4 wo3 shuo1 xie1 shen2me5？wo3 dui4 ni3 shuo1huang3 le5？wo3 sha1si3 le5 zi4ji3 de5 dui4yuan2？\n"
"\n"
"en1，zhe4 dou1 shi4 wo3 zuo4 xia4 de5 shi4。dan4 wo3 dui4 ci3 hao2bu4 hou4hui3。"

msgid ""
"Well. Where to begin?\n"
"\n"
"When I first arrived at Drogenkippe, I spent some time taking in the lay of the land. The Schwarze Herzen were still a pretty small gang, strictly street-level, but I could see they were going places."
msgstr ""
"从​哪里​说起​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我刚​到​毒​坑区​的​时候​，​我花​了​一些​时间​熟悉​环境​。​“​黑心​”​当时​还​算是​个​小​帮派​，​纯粹​是​街头​混混​，​但​我​能​看出​他们​前途无量​。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 na3li3 shuo1qi3 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gang1 dao4 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 hua1 le5 yi1xie1 shi2jian1 shu2xi1 huan2jing4。“hei1xin1” dang1shi2 hai2 suan4shi4 ge4 xiao3 bang1pai4，chun2cui4 shi4 jie1tou2 hun4 hun4，dan4 wo3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1men5 qian2tu2wu2liang4。"

msgid ""
"Well... I overheard Marta talking with Mr. Harrow yesterday.\n"
"\n"
"I think that they were talking about our meeting with him - the one that Marta was just telling us about, where we'll learn to see the world in a different way?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​昨天​我​无意​中​听到​玛​尔塔​和​哈罗​先生​在​谈话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​他们​聊​的​是​我们​即将​与​他​见面​的​事​—​—​就是​玛​尔塔​刚才​告诉​我们​的​那个​，​说​我们​将​学会​用​不同​的​方式​看待​世界​？\n"
"\n"
"en1……zuo2tian1 wo3 wu2yi4 zhong4 ting1dao4 Ma3er3ta3 he4 ha1luo2 xian1sheng5 zai4 tan2hua4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ta1men5 liao2 de5 shi4 wo3men5 ji2jiang1 yu4 ta1 jian4mian4 de5 shi4——jiu4shi4 Ma3er3ta3 gang1cai2 gao4su4 wo3men5 de5 na4ge5，shuo1 wo3men5 jiang1 xue2hui4 yong4 bu4tong2 de5 fang1shi4 kan4dai4 shi4jie4？"

msgid ""
"Well... I... I mean, we... We were just...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The normally straightforward Kristian finds himself momentarily fumbling for words.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"这个​……​我​……​我们​刚刚​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​向来​直率​的​克里斯蒂安​竟​一时​语塞​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5……wo3……wo3men5 gang1gang5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xiang4lai2 zhi2shuai4 de5 ke4li3si1di4an1 jing4 yi1shi2 yu3se4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Well... about that. I sure hope you haven't been taking that stuff."
msgstr ""
"说​到​这个​……​希望​你​没有​嗑​过​那​玩意儿​吧​。\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5……xi1wang4 ni3 mei2you3 ke4 guo4 na4 wan2yi4r5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well... good. All right, then.\n"
"\n"
"So, do you want anything else? Or can I get on with my day?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​那好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​别的​事​吗​？​还是​说​我​可以​自己​忙​去​了​？\n"
"\n"
"en1……na4 hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 wo3 ke3yi3 zi4ji3 mang2 qu4 le5？"

msgid ""
"Well... maybe. I don't know. It's confusing.\n"
"\n"
"I was also able to track down some message fragments connecting her to the Schockwellenreiter."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​有​可能​。​我​也​不​知道​了​。​这​很​让​人​困惑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​发现​有​一些​信息​片段​能​把​她​和​电波​骑士​联系​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……you3 ke3neng2。wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 le5。zhe4 hen3 rang4 ren2 kun4huo4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 fa1xian4 you3 yi1xie1 xin4xi1 pian4duan4 neng2 ba3 ta1 he4 dian4Bo1qi2shi4 lian2xi4 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"Well... no. I mean, I've never actually *seen* what's in the vault. Not "
"personally."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​对​。​我​是​说​，​我​从来​没​*​看过​*​保险库​里​的​东西​。​没​亲眼看到​过​。\n"
"e4……dui4。wo3 shi4 shuo1，wo3 cong2lai2 mei2*kan4 guo4*bao3 xian3 ku4 li3 de5 dong1xi1。mei2 qin1 yan3 kan4 dao4 guo4。"

msgid ""
"Well... okay, yeah... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The need in Silke's eyes is palpable. As you watch, her newly reclaimed willpower crumbles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I can take one more hit. One more won't hurt."
msgstr ""
"呃​……​好​吧​，​也​对​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​西​尔克​眼神​里​的​渴望​清晰​可辨​。​她​刚刚​表露出​的​决心​就​这么​崩塌​掉​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​，​我​就​再​吸​一次​。​就​一次​应该​没关系​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"e4……hao3 ba1，ye3 dui4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Xi1er3ke4 yan3shen2 li3 de5 ke3wang4 qing1xi1 ke3 bian4。ta1 gang1gang5 biao3 lou4 chu1 de5 jue2xin1 jiu4 zhe4me5 beng1ta1 diao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4，wo3 jiu4 zai4 xi1 yi1ci4。jiu4 yi1ci4 ying1gai1 mei2guan1xi5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Well... thanks, pal! Thank you so much!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He rummages in the pocket of his filthy jacket, and fishes out a vial.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here. A dose of Flash, on the house."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​朋友​……​太​感谢​你​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把手​伸进​脏兮兮​的​外套​口袋​里​翻找​起来​，​然后​拿出​一个​小​药瓶​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​你​一份​“​闪光​”​，​算​我​请客​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5 peng2you5……tai4 gan3xie4 ni3 le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 zang1xi1xi1 de5 wai4tao4 kou3dai4 li3 fan1 zhao3 qi3lai5，ran2hou4 na2chu1 yi1ge5 xiao3 yao4ping2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3 yi1 fen4“shan3guang1”，suan4 wo3 qing3ke4。"

msgid "Well... yeah. That works, too."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​这样​也​行​。\n"
"en1……zhe4yang4 ye3 xing2。"

msgid "Well? Don't keep me in suspense."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​？​你​就​别跟我​卖关子​了​。\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1？ni3 jiu4 bie4 gen1 wo3 mai4guan1zi5 le5。"

msgid "Were you two close with her?"
msgstr ""
"你们​俩​和​她​很​亲近​吗​？\n"
"ni3men5 lia3 he4 ta1 hen3 qin1jin4 ma5？"

msgid "West Cell Door"
msgstr ""
"西侧​舱室​门\n"
"xi1ce4 cang1 shi4 men2"

msgid "West Cell Door Control"
msgstr ""
"西侧​舱室​门​控制\n"
"xi1ce4 cang1 shi4 men2 kong4zhi4"

msgid "West Door"
msgstr ""
"西门\n"
"xi1men2"

msgid "West Turret 1"
msgstr ""
"西侧​炮塔​1\n"
"xi1ce4 pao4ta3 1"

msgid "West Turret 2"
msgstr ""
"西侧​炮塔​2\n"
"xi1ce4 pao4ta3 2"

msgid "We’ll be here, Glory. There’ll always a spot for you on my team."
msgstr ""
"我们​会​等​你​的​，​格洛丽​。​我​的​团队​里​总有​一个​位置​会为​你​留​着​。\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 deng3 ni3 de5，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 li3 zong3you3 yi1ge5 wei4zhi5 hui4 wei2 ni3 liu2 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"We’ll want to get into the lab area as quickly as possible. So I'd suggest bypassing the main floor of the estate entirely.\n"
"\n"
"We can enter via the servants' entrance that you escaped through last time."
msgstr ""
"我们​需要​尽快​进入​实验室​区域​。​因此​我​建议​直接​绕过​庄园​的​主​楼层​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​可以​从​上次​你​逃脱​时​使用​的​佣人​入口​进去​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 jin3kuai4 jin4ru4 shi2yan4shi4 qu1yu4。yin1ci3 wo3 jian4yi4 zhi2jie1 rao4guo4 zhuang1yuan2 de5 zhu3 lou2ceng2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ke3yi3 cong2 shang4ci4 ni3 tao2tuo1 shi2 shi3yong4 de5 yong1ren2 ru4kou3 jin4qu4。"

msgid ""
"We’re all gonna be with Monika soon if we don’t do something. The Firewing "
"came after us once. She'll do it again."
msgstr ""
"要是​我们​不​做点​什么​的话​，​我们​很快​就​都​要​和​莫妮卡​在​一起​了​。​火翼​已经​找上门​一次​了​。​她​肯定​还会​再​来​的​。\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3men5 bu4 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5 de5hua4，wo3men5 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 dou1 yao4 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 zai4 yi1qi3 le5。Huo3yi4 yi3jing1 zhao3shang4men2 yi1ci4 le5。ta1 ken3ding4 hai2 hui4 zai4 lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"We’re in some sort of abandoned facility beneath the estate. It feels military to me... some kind of old missile base, maybe.\n"
"\n"
"That might explain why Vauclair chose this place for his operation. It can’t be easy to find a secret underground base big enough to house a dragon."
msgstr ""
"我们​似乎​身处​庄园​下方​的​一处​废弃​设施​中​。​这里​给​我​的​感觉​很​像​军事设施​……​或许​是​某个​废弃​的​导弹基地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​或许​能​解释​为何​沃​克莱尔​会​选择​此地​进行​他​的​实验​。​要​找到​一处​足够​容纳​一条​巨龙​的​秘密​地下​基地​，​想必​绝非易事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 si4hu1 shen1chu3 zhuang1yuan2 xia4fang1 de5 yi1 chu3 fei4qi4 she4shi1 zhong4。zhe4li3 gei3 wo3 de5 gan3jue2 hen3 xiang4 jun1shi4she4shi1……huo4xu3 shi4 mou3 ge4 fei4qi4 de5 dao3 dan4 ji1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 huo4xu3 neng2 jie3shi4 wei4he2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 hui4 xuan3ze2 ci3di4 jin4xing2 ta1 de5 shi2yan4。yao4 zhao3dao4 yi1 chu3 zu2gou4 rong2na4 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 mi4mi4 di4xia4 ji1di4，xiang3bi4 jue2 fei1 yi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"We’re in some sort of abandoned facility beneath the estate. It feels military to me... some kind of old missile base, maybe.\n"
"\n"
"That might explain why the late Doctor Vauclair chose this place for his operation. It can’t be easy to find a secret underground base big enough to house a dragon."
msgstr ""
"我们​似乎​身处​庄园​下方​的​一处​废弃​设施​中​。​这里​给​我​的​感觉​很​像​军事设施​……​或许​是​某个​废弃​的​导弹基地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​或许​能​解释​为何​已故​的​沃​克莱尔​博士​会​选择​此地​进行​他​的​实验​。​要​找到​一处​足够​容纳​一条​巨龙​的​秘密​地下​基地​，​想必​绝非易事​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 si4hu1 shen1chu3 zhuang1yuan2 xia4fang1 de5 yi1 chu3 fei4qi4 she4shi1 zhong4。zhe4li3 gei3 wo3 de5 gan3jue2 hen3 xiang4 jun1shi4she4shi1……huo4xu3 shi4 mou3 ge4 fei4qi4 de5 dao3 dan4 ji1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 huo4xu3 neng2 jie3shi4 wei4he2 yi3gu4 de5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 hui4 xuan3ze2 ci3di4 jin4xing2 ta1 de5 shi2yan4。yao4 zhao3dao4 yi1 chu3 zu2gou4 rong2na4 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 mi4mi4 di4xia4 ji1di4，xiang3bi4 jue2 fei1 yi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"We’re on a tight timetable. I want to enter the estate, find the basement, open the data vault, extract the files, and bolt. \n"
"\n"
"10 minutes, top-to-bottom."
msgstr ""
"我们​时间​很​紧​。​我​的​计划​是​：​进​宅子​，​找​地下室​，​开​数据库​，​拿​文件​，​然后​撤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​十分钟​，​快​进快​出​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi2jian1 hen3 jin3。wo3 de5 ji4hua4 shi4：jin4 zhai2zi5，zhao3 di4xia4shi4，kai1 shu4ju4ku4，na2 wen2jian4，ran2hou4 che4。\n"
"\n"
"shi2 fen4 zhong1，kuai4 jin4 kuai4 chu1。"

msgid "We’re ready. Let’s get this show on the road."
msgstr ""
"我们​准备​好​了​。​开始​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5。kai1shi3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"We’re street-level. We run the shadows. That's it.\n"
"\n"
"Worrying about these sorts of issues is beyond our pay-grade."
msgstr ""
"我们​只是​街头​平民​，​在​暗影​圈子里​厮混​打拼​，​仅此而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​事情​根本​就​不是​我们​这个​级别​的​人​该​考虑​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi3shi4 jie1tou2 ping2min2，zai4 an4ying3 juan1 zi3 li3 si1hun4 da3pin1，jin3ci3er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 gen1ben3 jiu4 bu4shi4 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 ji2bie2 de5 ren2 gai1 kao3lu:4 de5。"

msgid "Wha--"
msgstr ""
"什么​—​—\n"
"shen2me5 — —"

msgid "Wha... what?"
msgstr ""
"什​……​什么​？\n"
"shen2……shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What \"one more thing\"? The deal was that we'd get Grinder his money "
"transfer. We've done that."
msgstr ""
"还有​什么​？​我们​说好​的​事情​是​给​“​绞肉机​”​完成​转账​。​这​事​我们​已经​做到​了​。\n"
"hai2you3 shen2me5？wo3men5 shuo1hao3 de5 shi4qing5 shi4 gei3“jiao3rou4ji1” wan2cheng2 zhuan3zhang4。zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 yi3jing1 zuo4dao4 le5。"

msgid "What *are* you going to do, then?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​要​怎么办​？\n"
"na4 ni3 yao4 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid ""
"What I *can* do, though, is suppress them. This should buy you the time that you need to do what you need to do.\n"
"\n"
"For those of you on the outside, keep your eyes open... when my control subroutines figure out that they're under attack, they'll hit back with whatever's hooked up to their system. Drones, turrets, you name it."
msgstr ""
"不过​我​*​能​*​做到​的​是​压制​它们​。​这​应该​能​为​你​争取​到​完成​任务​所​需​的​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​在​外面​的​你们​，​要​保持警惕​……​当​我​的​控制​子程序​发现​受到​攻击​时​，​它们​会​调动​系统​中​所有​可用​的​武器​进行​反击​。​无人机​、​炮塔​，​应有尽有​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3*neng2*zuo4dao4 de5 shi4 ya1zhi4 ta1men5。zhe4 ying1gai1 neng2 wei2 ni3 zheng1qu3 dao4 wan2cheng2 ren4wu5 suo3 xu1 de5 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 zai4 wai4mian4 de5 ni3men5，yao4 bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4……dang1 wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 zi3cheng2xu4 fa1xian4 shou4dao4 gong1ji1 shi2，ta1men5 hui4 diao4dong4 xi4tong3 zhong4 suo3you3 ke3 yong4 de5 wu3qi4 jin4xing2 fan3ji1。wu2ren2ji1、pao4ta3，ying1you3jin4you3。"

msgid "What I came here to do."
msgstr ""
"做​我​来​这里​该​做​的​事​。\n"
"zuo4 wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"What I did to her isn't as important as what she did to me.\n"
"\n"
"Monika was special, ace. More so than you could ever know."
msgstr ""
"我​对​她​做​的​事​，​远不如​她​对​我​做​的​事​重要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​很​特别​，​王牌​。​比​你​所能​想象​的​还要​特别​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ta1 zuo4 de5 shi4，yuan3 bu4 ru2 ta1 dui4 wo3 zuo4 de5 shi4 zhong4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 hen3 te4bie2，wang2pai2。bi3 ni3 suo3neng2 xiang3xiang4 de5 hai2 yao4 te4bie2。"

msgid ""
"What I do remember is my father's response to the revelation that his little girl was a witch, a \"Hexe.\"\n"
"\n"
"He beat the living shit out of me with his fists. And then his belt. And then a claw hammer that he grabbed out of his toolbox."
msgstr ""
"我​只​记得​我​父亲​对​这​一切​的​反应​—​—​他​说​自己​的​女儿​是​个​女巫​，​是​个​“​妖婆​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​用​拳头​把​我​打了个​半死​。​然后​他​又​抄起​腰带​。​再​然后​他​从​工具箱​里​掏出​了​羊角​锤​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 ji4de5 wo3 fu4qin1 dui4 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 fan3ying4——ta1 shuo1 zi4ji3 de5 nu:3er2 shi4 ge4 nu:3wu1，shi4 ge4“yao1 po2”。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yong4 quan2tou5 ba3 wo3 da3 le5 ge4 ban4si3。ran2hou4 ta1 you4 chao1 qi3 yao1dai4。zai4 ran2hou4 ta1 cong2 gong1ju4xiang1 li3 tao1chu1 le5 yang2 jiao3 chui2。"

msgid ""
"What I had to do. I got *out,* Marta.\n"
"\n"
"This was the only way."
msgstr ""
"我​必须​这么​做​。​我​*​摆脱​*​了​这​一切​，​玛​尔塔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​唯一​的​办法​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 zhe4me5 zuo4。wo3*bai3tuo1*le5 zhe4 yi1qie4，Ma3er3ta3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wei2yi1 de5 ban4fa3。"

msgid "What I know is that I'm not doing this for free any more. Period."
msgstr ""
"我​只​想​说​，​我​不会​再​免费​做​这件​事​。​就​这样​。\n"
"wo3 zhi3 xiang3 shuo1，wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 mian3fei4 zuo4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。jiu4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"What I mean is that retrieving Alice's information will be your *only* priority. No more distractions, and no more side work.\n"
"\n"
"I will busy myself canceling your remaining jobs and smoothing any ruffled feathers."
msgstr ""
"我​的​意思​是​，​获取​爱丽丝​的​情报​将会​是​你​*​唯一​*​的​头等大事​。​不容​分心​，​也​顾不得​再​处理​其他​事务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​帮​你​取消​剩余​的​差事​，​以及​平息​客户​的​不满​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，huo4qu3 ai4li4si1 de5 qing2bao4 jiang1hui4 shi4 ni3*wei2yi1*de5 tou2 deng3 dai4 shi4。bu4rong2 fen1xin1，ye3 gu4bu5de5 zai4 chu3li3 qi2ta1 shi4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 bang1 ni3 qu3xiao1 sheng4yu2 de5 cha4shi4，yi3ji2 ping2xi1 ke4hu4 de5 bu4man3。"

msgid ""
"What I need to do is release that dragon. Time's a-ticking and all.\n"
"\n"
"Did the Doc tell you that you're standing in the animal research lab, by the way? It's overflowing with test subjects, and they don't play well with others... nasty, dangerous things. And it's well past their feeding time."
msgstr ""
"我​需要​的​是​释放​那头​巨龙​。​时间​不​等​人​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​博士​有没有​说​过​，​你们​待​的​地方​是​动物​研究​实验室​？​这里​到处​都​是​实验​体​，​而且​它们​彼此之间​相处​得​并​不​融洽​。​这些​东西​既​肮脏​又​危险​。​而且​，​它们​的​进食​时间​早就​过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 de5 shi4 shi4fang4 na4 tou2 ju4long2。shi2jian1 bu4 deng3 ren2 a1。\n"
"\n"
"bo2shi4 you3mei2you3 shuo1 guo4，ni3men5 dai1 de5 di4fang1 shi4 dong4wu4 yan2jiu1 shi2yan4shi4？zhe4li3 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 shi2yan4 ti3，er2qie3 ta1men5 bi3 ci3 zhi1 jian1 xiang1chu3 de2 bing4 bu4 rong2qia4。zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 ji4 ang1zang1 you4 wei1xian3。er2qie3，ta1men5 de5 jin4shi2 shi2jian1 zao3jiu4 guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"What I want is *change.*\n"
"\n"
"This world is sick. Anyone with half a brain can see that. So I'm gonna use the Doc's wonder bug to poison it back to health.\n"
"\n"
"It might get better, or it might die. Either would be better than it languishing like this."
msgstr ""
"我​想要​的​是​*​变革​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​世界​病​了​。​任何​有​脑子​的​人​都​能​看得出来​。​所以​我​打算​用​博士​的​这剂​猛​药治好​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​也许​会​恢复健康​，​也许​会​死​掉​。​但​无论如何​都​比​现在​这样​要​好​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3yao4 de5 shi4*bian4ge2*。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 bing4 le5。ren4he2 you3 nao3zi5 de5 ren2 dou1 neng2 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2。suo3yi3 wo3 da3suan4 yong4 bo2shi4 de5 zhe4 ji4 meng3 yao4 zhi4 hao3 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ye3xu3 hui4 hui1 fu4 jian4 kang1，ye3xu3 hui4 si3 diao4。dan4 wu2lun4ru2he2 dou1 bi3 xian4zai4 zhe4yang4 yao4 hao3。"

msgid "What Management doesn't know won't hurt them."
msgstr ""
"这事​瞒​着​管理处​也​不会​有​什么​关系​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 man2 zhao2 guan3 li3 chu3 ye3 bu4hui4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5。"

msgid "What a goddamned train wreck."
msgstr ""
"真他妈​是​灾难​现场​啊​。\n"
"zhen1 ta1 ma1 shi4 zai1nan4 xian4chang3 a1。"

msgid "What a remarkable coincidence."
msgstr ""
"这​可​真是​巧​了​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3 zhen1shi5 qiao3 le5。"

msgid "What a terrible shame. Now let's keep moving, if you please."
msgstr ""
"那可真​是​太​遗憾​了​。​现在​还​请​你​继续前进​吧​。\n"
"na4 ke3 zhen1 shi4 tai4 yi2han4 le5。xian4zai4 hai2 qing3 ni3 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。"

msgid "What about Dietrich?"
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​呢​？\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 ni2？"

msgid "What about Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​呢​？\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 ni2？"

msgid "What about Glory?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​呢​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 ni2？"

msgid "What about Plotz?"
msgstr ""
"普​洛茨​呢​？\n"
"Pu3luo4ci2 ni2？"

msgid "What about Viktor?"
msgstr ""
"维克多​呢​？\n"
"wei2 ke4 duo1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"What about a simsense chip? Could that drive someone to do something like "
"this?"
msgstr ""
"拟感​芯片​呢​？​它会​让​人​做出​这样​的​事情​来​吗​？\n"
"ni3 gan3 xin1pian4 ni2？ta1 hui4 rang4 ren2 zuo4chu1 zhe4yang4 de5 shi4qing5 lai2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"What about another mage or shaman? Could someone else benefit from one of "
"these channels, too?"
msgstr ""
"那​其他​法师​或萨满​呢​？​别人​也​能​借​由​这样​的​通道​获益​吗​？\n"
"na4 qi2ta1 fa3shi1 huo4 sa4 man3 ni2？bie2ren5 ye3 neng2 jie4 you2 zhe4yang4 de5 tong1dao4 huo4yi4 ma5？"

msgid "What about any innocent people in the building?"
msgstr ""
"大楼​里​的​无辜​人士​怎么办​？\n"
"da4lou2 li3 de5 wu2gu1 ren2shi4 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid ""
"What about germ warfare? You did it with Panacea; maybe you could do it "
"again?"
msgstr ""
"细菌战​怎么样​？​你​之前​已经​搞出​了​“​万能​药​”​，​或许​你​可以​再​来​一次​？\n"
"xi4jun1zhan4 zen3me5yang4？ni3 zhi1qian2 yi3jing1 gao3 chu1 le5“wan4neng2 yao4”，huo4xu3 ni3 ke3yi3 zai4 lai2 yi1ci4？"

msgid "What about me?"
msgstr ""
"那​我​呢​？\n"
"na4 wo3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"What about me? \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz’s expression is sober.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I mean sure… whatever… I got nowhere else to go and no one to give a shit about me. Why not hang out with insane dragons, assholes toting enormous machineguns, and devil dogs that hump my leg when no one’s looking?"
msgstr ""
"我​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​表情​很​严肃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​倒​也​没​意见​……​反正​……​我​无处可去​，​也​没人会​在乎​我​。​发疯​的​巨龙​，​扛着​巨型​机枪​的​混蛋​，​还有​趁人​不​注意​就​蹭​我​腿​的​地狱​犬​—​—​这样​的​日子​有​什么​不好​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 biao3qing2 hen3 yan2su4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dao3 ye3 mei2 yi4jian4……fan3zheng4……wo3 wu2 chu3 ke3 qu4，ye3 mei2 ren2 hui4 zai4hu5 wo3。fa1feng1 de5 ju4long2，gang1 zhao2 ju4xing2 ji1qiang1 de5 hun2dan4，hai2you3 chen4 ren2 bu4 zhu4yi4 jiu4 ceng4 wo3 tui3 de5 di4yu4 quan3——zhe4yang4 de5 ri4zi5 you3 shen2me5 bu4hao3？"

msgid "What about me? Do I get my money now, or--"
msgstr ""
"那​我​呢​？​我​现在​能​拿到​钱​吗​，​还是​说​—​—\n"
"na4 wo3 ni2？wo3 xian4zai4 neng2 na2dao4 qian2 ma5，hai2shi5 shuo1 — —"

msgid "What about the Great Jihad?"
msgstr ""
"伟大​圣战​的​事​呢​？\n"
"wei3da4 sheng4zhan4 de5 shi4 ni2？"

msgid "What about the children?"
msgstr ""
"孩子​们​怎么​了​？\n"
"hai2zi5 men5 zen3me5 le5？"

msgid "What about the kids that can't afford cybersurgery?"
msgstr ""
"那些​负担​不起​赛博​手术​的​孩子​怎么办​？\n"
"na4xie1 fu4dan1 bu4 qi3 sai4bo2 shou3shu4 de5 hai2zi5 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid ""
"What about the neighbors? Didn't anyone call the Polizei or ProSecuritas?"
msgstr ""
"邻居们​呢​？​没有​人​报警​吗​？\n"
"lin2 ju1 men5 ni2？mei2you3 ren2 bao4jing3 ma5？"

msgid "What about the other cultists?"
msgstr ""
"其他​教徒​怎么办​？\n"
"qi2ta1 jiao4tu2 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid "What about the upper levels?"
msgstr ""
"那​上面​的​楼层​呢​？\n"
"na4 shang4mian4 de5 lou2ceng2 ni2？"

msgid "What about you, APEX? What would the F-State say about you?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​呢​，​APEX​？​动荡​带​会​怎么​看待​你​？\n"
"na4 ni3 ni2，APEX？dong4dang4 dai4 hui4 zen3me5 kan4dai4 ni3？"

msgid "What about your sims?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​拟感​呢​？\n"
"ni3 de5 ni3 gan3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"What all of this tells me is that we need to shut Vauclair down. Whatever "
"he's planning on doing with this stuff, it isn't going to be good for us."
msgstr ""
"这​一切​让​我​明白​，​我们​必须​阻止​沃​克莱尔​。​无论​他​打算​用​这些​东西​搞​出​什么​把戏​，​对​我们​来说​都​不会​有​好​结果​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 ming2bai5，wo3men5 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 Wo4ke4lai2er3。wu2lun4 ta1 da3suan4 yong4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 gao3 chu1 shen2me5 ba3xi4，dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 dou1 bu4hui4 you3 hao3 jie1guo3。"

msgid ""
"What all of this tells me is that we need to shut Vauclair down. Whatever "
"mad-scientist bullshit he's plannin' on pulling with this stuff, it ain't "
"gonna to be good for us."
msgstr ""
"这​一切​让​我​明白​，​我们​必须​阻止​沃​克莱尔​。​无论​他​打算​用​这些​东西​搞​出​什么​疯狂​科学家​的​把戏​，​对​我们​来说​都​不会​有​好​结果​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 ming2bai5，wo3men5 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 Wo4ke4lai2er3。wu2lun4 ta1 da3suan4 yong4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 gao3 chu1 shen2me5 feng1kuang2 ke1xue2jia1 de5 ba3xi4，dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 dou1 bu4hui4 you3 hao3 jie1guo3。"

msgid ""
"What all of this tells me is that we need to shut Vauclair down. Whatever "
"mad-scientist bullshit he's planning on pulling with this stuff, it isn't "
"going to be good for us."
msgstr ""
"这​一切​让​我​明白​，​我们​必须​阻止​沃​克莱尔​。​无论​他​打算​用​这些​东西​搞​出​什么​疯狂​科学家​的​把戏​，​对​我们​来说​都​不会​有​好​结果​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 rang4 wo3 ming2bai5，wo3men5 bi4xu1 zu3zhi3 Wo4ke4lai2er3。wu2lun4 ta1 da3suan4 yong4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 gao3 chu1 shen2me5 feng1kuang2 ke1xue2jia1 de5 ba3xi4，dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 dou1 bu4hui4 you3 hao3 jie1guo3。"

msgid ""
"What are our employers *ever* thinking? Sometimes it seems like they're all "
"out to screw us."
msgstr ""
"谁​知道​我们​的​雇主​怎么​*​想​*​的​？​我​有时候​真心​觉得​他们​是​存心​要​坑​我们​。\n"
"shei2 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 de5 gu4zhu3 zen3me5*xiang3*de5？wo3 you3shi2hou5 zhen1xin1 jue2de5 ta1men5 shi4 cun2xin1 yao4 keng1 wo3men5。"

msgid "What are they shipping in? Weapons? Drugs? More of these BTLs?"
msgstr ""
"他们​要运​什么​货​？​武器​？​药物​？​还是​更​多​像​这样​的​BTL​？\n"
"ta1men5 yao4 yun4 shen2me5 huo4？wu3qi4？yao4wu4？hai2shi5 geng1 duo1 xiang4 zhe4yang4 de5 BTL？"

msgid "What are you basing this on?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​依据​是​？\n"
"ni3 de5 yi1ju4 shi4？"

msgid "What are you looking for exactly?"
msgstr ""
"你​具体​想​知道​什么​？\n"
"ni3 ju4ti3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What are you planning on doing?"
msgstr ""
"你​打算​做​什么​？\n"
"ni3 da3suan4 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What are you running from, Alice?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​躲避​什么​，​爱丽丝​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 duo3bi4 shen2me5，ai4li4si1？"

msgid "What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​说​什么​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What business of yours is any of this? You're a cleaning lady! Knock off the"
" twenty questions and let me in!"
msgstr ""
"这​跟​你​有​什么​关系​？​你​只是​个​清洁工​而已​！​收起​你​的​问题​，​赶紧​让​我​进去​！\n"
"zhe4 gen1 ni3 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？ni3 zhi3shi4 ge4 qing1jie2gong1 er2yi3！shou1 qi3 ni3 de5 wen4ti2，gan3jin3 rang4 wo3 jin4qu4！"

msgid "What can I do for ya, new $(l.guy)?"
msgstr ""
"你​想要​点​啥​啊​，​新来​的​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3yao4 dian3 sha2 a1，xin1 lai2 de5？"

msgid ""
"What can I say, chief?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He tries on a thoroughly unconvincing smile, but immediately seems to think better of it. The anxious look returns to his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have expensive tastes."
msgstr ""
"怎么​说​呢​，​头儿​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​勉强​挤出​一个​毫无​说服力​的​微笑​，​但​随即​似乎​又​改变​了​主意​。​焦虑​的​神情​重新​浮现​在​他​的​脸上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​生活​成本​挺​高​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，tou2r5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mian3qiang3 ji3chu1 yi1ge5 hao2wu2 shuo1fu2li4 de5 wei1xiao4，dan4 sui2ji2 si4hu1 you4 gai3bian4 le5 zhu3yi5。jiao1lu:4 de5 shen2qing2 chong2xin1 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 de5 lian3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 sheng1huo2 cheng2ben3 ting3 gao1 de5。"

msgid "What can you tell me about Dante? He’s not a normal dog."
msgstr ""
"你​对​但丁​有​什么​了解​？​他​绝对​不是​条​普通​的​狗​。\n"
"ni3 dui4 dan4ding1 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？ta1 jue2dui4 bu4shi4 tiao2 pu3tong1 de5 gou3。"

msgid "What can you tell me about Duerr?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​杜尔有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 du4 er3 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What can you tell me about building security?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​大楼​安保​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 da4lou2 an1bao3 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What can you tell me about him?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​这​人​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 zhe4 ren2 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What can you tell me about the Adversary?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​反叛者​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What can you tell me about the Arbeiters?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​工人​帮有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 gong1ren2 bang1 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What can you tell me about the Bloodline project?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​“​血脉​”​项目​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What can you tell me about the layout of the hotel?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​旅馆​的​布局​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 lu:3guan3 de5 bu4ju2 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What can you tell me about this place?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​这​地方​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 zhe4 di4fang1 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid ""
"What could I do? I faked my own death. It was the only way to save his "
"family's lives."
msgstr ""
"我能​怎么​做​？​假死​呗​。​只有​这样​才能救​他​家人​的​命​。\n"
"wo3 neng2 zen3me5 zuo4？jia3si3 bei5。zhi3you3 zhe4yang4 cai2 neng2 jiu4 ta1 jia1ren2 de5 ming4。"

msgid "What did he tell you?"
msgstr ""
"他​和​你​说​了​什么​？\n"
"ta1 he4 ni3 shuo1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What did she promise you? Gold? Jewels? Eternal life? She offered them to me, as well. \n"
"\n"
"For decades."
msgstr ""
"她​答应​你​什么​了​？​金钱​？​珠宝​？​永恒​的​生命​？​她​也​一直​在​对​我​说​同样​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​几十年​来​都​是​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 da1ying5 ni3 shen2me5 le5？jin1qian2？zhu1bao3？yong3heng2 de5 sheng1ming4？ta1 ye3 yi1zhi2 zai4 dui4 wo3 shuo1 tong2yang4 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ji1 shi2 nian2 lai2 dou1 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "What did the tattoos do before you broke them?"
msgstr ""
"这些​纹身​以前​有​什么​作用​？\n"
"zhe4xie1 wen2shen1 yi3qian2 you3 shen2me5 zuo4yong4？"

msgid "What did they want?"
msgstr ""
"他们​想要​什么​？\n"
"ta1men5 xiang3yao4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What did you do to her, APEX? To the others?\n"
"\n"
"How did you take their memories?"
msgstr ""
"APEX​，​你​到底​对​她​，​以及​其他人​做​了​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​如何​夺取​了​他们​的​记忆​？\n"
"\n"
"APEX，ni3 dao4di3 dui4 ta1，yi3ji2 qi2 ta1 ren2 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ru2he2 duo2qu3 le5 ta1men5 de5 ji4yi4？"

msgid "What did you do to him?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​他​做​了​什么​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 ta1 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "What did you do?"
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​什么​？\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "What did you manage to pull off of it?"
msgstr ""
"你​成功​恢复​了​什么​内容​？\n"
"ni3 cheng2gong1 hui1fu4 le5 shen2me5 nei4rong2？"

msgid ""
"What did you wind up doing with the cultists that we rescued? Did you send "
"them to Samuel...?"
msgstr ""
"你​最后​把​我们​救出​的​邪教徒​怎么​处置​了​？​是​送​去​塞缪尔​那里​了​吗​……​？\n"
"ni3 zui4hou4 ba3 wo3men5 jiu4chu1 de5 xie2 jiao1 tu2 zen3me5 chu3zhi4 le5？shi4 song4 qu4 sai4miu4er3 na4li5 le5 ma5……？"

msgid "What difference would that make?"
msgstr ""
"那​又​怎么样​？\n"
"na4 you4 zen3me5yang4？"

msgid "What do I get if I release you?"
msgstr ""
"如果​我放​了​你​，​我能​得到​什么​？\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 fang4 le5 ni3，wo3 neng2 de2dao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What do you do here, Mr. Laine?"
msgstr ""
"莱恩​先生​，​你​在​这里​是​做​什么​的​？\n"
"lai2en1 xian1sheng5，ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？"

msgid "What do you do here?"
msgstr ""
"你​这里​是​做​什么​的​？\n"
"ni3 zhe4li3 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？"

msgid "What do you have?"
msgstr ""
"你​这里​有​什么​？\n"
"ni3 zhe4li3 you3 shen2me5？"

msgid "What do you know about the Arbeiters?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​工人​帮有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 gong1ren2 bang1 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What do you know about the Laine incident?"
msgstr ""
"你们​对​莱恩​的​事情​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3men5 dui4 lai2en1 de5 shi4qing5 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What do you know about the Magnifikers?"
msgstr ""
"你​对伟术​帮有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 wei3 shu4 bang1 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What do you know about the Simmy Kim incident?"
msgstr ""
"你们​对金​阿吸​的​事情​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"ni3men5 dui4 jin1 e1 xi1 de5 shi4qing5 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid "What do you make of this, Hasenkamp?"
msgstr ""
"你​对此​有何​看法​，​哈森​坎普​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 he2 kan4fa3，Ha1sen1kan3pu3？"

msgid "What do you mean by \"toxic\" shaman? I'm unfamiliar with the term."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​“​毒​”​萨满​是​什么​意思​？​我​对​这个​词​不​熟悉​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5“du2” sa4man3 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？wo3 dui4 zhe4ge5 ci2 bu4 shu2xi1。"

msgid "What do you mean by that?"
msgstr ""
"你​这话​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"ni3 zhe4 hua4 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid "What do you need me to do?"
msgstr ""
"你​需要​我​做​什么​？\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What do you need us to do?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich's tone is jocular, his posture relaxed. But an uncanny feeling in the air tells you that magic has already started to well in the astral plane around him.\n"
"\n"
"Ullrich doesn't seem to notice.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​需要​我们​做​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​的​语气​平淡​，​姿态​放松​。​但​空中​弥漫着​一种​诡异​的​感觉​，​让​你​意识​到​魔法​已​在​他​周围​的​星界​中​悄然​涌动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​乌尔里​希​似乎​没有​注意​到​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 wo3men5 zuo4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 yu3qi4 ping2dan4，zi1tai4 fang4song1。dan4 kong1zhong1 mi2 man4 zhao2 yi1zhong3 gui3yi4 de5 gan3jue2，rang4 ni3 yi4shi2 dao4 mo2fa3 yi3 zai4 ta1 zhou1wei2 de5 xing1 jie4 zhong4 qiao3ran2 yong3dong4。\n"
"\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1 si4hu1 mei2you3 zhu4yi4 dao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"What do you propose that we do? *I* don't know how to reverse what's happened to me.\n"
"\n"
"To be frank, I don't even know why I'd *want* to change this."
msgstr ""
"你​说​我们​该​怎么​做​？​*​我​*​反正​不​知道​要​怎么​扭转​已经​发生​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老实​说​，​我​甚至​都​不​清楚​自己​是否​*​想要​*​变回去​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 wo3men5 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4？*wo3*fan3zheng4 bu4 zhi1dao4 yao4 zen3me5 niu3zhuan3 yi3jing1 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 qing1chu5 zi4ji3 shi4fou3*xiang3yao4*bian4 hui2 qu4。"

msgid "What do you see, Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"你​看到​了​什么​，​布里​茨​？\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 le5 shen2me5，Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid ""
"What do you suppose? Our people spend much of their time on the street, trying to coax the indigent into making use of our services.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His eyes well with tears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The attackers were indescriminate with their fire. It was a bloodbath."
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​呢​？​我们​的​人花​了​很多​时间​在​街上​，​试图​哄骗​穷人​使用​我们​的​服务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​眼中​饱含​泪水​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​袭击者​不分青红皂白​地​开火​。​简直​是​一场​屠杀​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 ni2？wo3men5 de5 ren2 hua1 le5 hen3 duo1 shi2jian1 zai4 jie1shang5，shi4tu2 hong3pian4 qiong2ren2 shi3yong4 wo3men5 de5 fu2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 bao3han2 lei4shui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xi2ji1zhe3 bu4fen1qing1hong2zao4bai2 de5 kai1huo3。jian3zhi2 shi4 yi1 chang2 tu2sha1。"

msgid "What do you think this all means, Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​你​觉得​这​一切​意味着​什么​？\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，ni3 jue2de5 zhe4 yi1qie4 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5？"

msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​呢​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 ni2？"

msgid "What do you think? I want to know what he told you."
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​呢​？​我​想​知道​他​跟​你​说​了​什么​。\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 ni2？wo3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 ta1 gen1 ni3 shuo1 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid "What do you want me to do about it?"
msgstr ""
"你​想​让​我​干什么​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 gan4shen2me5？"

msgid "What do you want to do?"
msgstr ""
"你​打算​怎么​做​？\n"
"ni3 da3suan4 zen3me5 zuo4？"

msgid ""
"What do you want us to do?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory's tone is neutral, her posture relaxed. But a glint of lamplight on steel tells you that the razors in her fingertips have slid from their housings.\n"
"\n"
"Ullrich doesn't seem to notice.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​需要​我们​做​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​的​语气​平淡​，​姿态​放松​。​但​街灯​映​在​钢刃​上​的​微光​提醒​你​，​她​指尖​的​刀刃​已然​出鞘​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​乌尔里​希​似乎​没有​注意​到​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 wo3men5 zuo4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 yu3qi4 ping2dan4，zi1tai4 fang4song1。dan4 jie1deng1 ying4 zai4 gang1 ren4 shang4 de5 wei1guang1 ti2xing3 ni3，ta1 zhi3jian1 de5 dao1ren4 yi3ran2 chu1qiao4。\n"
"\n"
"wu1 er3 li3 xi1 si4hu1 mei2you3 zhu4yi4 dao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "What do you want, APEX?"
msgstr ""
"你​想要​什么​，​APEX​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5，APEX？"

msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"你​想要​什么​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What does Aztechnology need with a bunch of clones?"
msgstr ""
"阿兹特​科技​要​一群​克隆人​做​什么​？\n"
"E1zi1te4ke1ji4 yao4 yi1 qun2 ke4long2ren2 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What does it do?"
msgstr ""
"它​有​什么​用​？\n"
"ta1 you3 shen2me5 yong4？"

msgid "What does it matter to you?"
msgstr ""
"这​和​你​有​什么​关系​？\n"
"zhe4 he4 ni3 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？"

msgid "What does that mean for me?"
msgstr ""
"那​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"na4 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid "What does the ointment do?"
msgstr ""
"这​药膏​有​什么​作用​？\n"
"zhe4 yao4gao1 you3 shen2me5 zuo4yong4？"

msgid "What does the old man have you doing in here?"
msgstr ""
"那​老头子​让你在​这​做​什么​？\n"
"na4 lao3tou2zi5 rang4 ni3 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What does this \"Pain Inducer\" do, exactly?"
msgstr ""
"这个​“​疼痛​诱发​器​”​具体​是​做​什么​的​？\n"
"zhe4ge5“teng2tong4 you4fa1 qi4” ju4ti3 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？"

msgid "What does this \"audition\" pay?"
msgstr ""
"这个​“​试镜​”​有​什么​报酬​吗​？\n"
"zhe4ge5“shi4jing4” you3 shen2me5 bao4chou5 ma5？"

msgid "What does this stuff do, exactly?"
msgstr ""
"它​具体​是​用来​干什么​的​？\n"
"ta1 ju4ti3 shi4 yong4lai2 gan4shen2me5 de5？"

msgid "What else did you turn up about the Harfeld Manor?"
msgstr ""
"关于​哈​菲尔德​庄园​，​你​还​知道​些​什么​？\n"
"guan1yu2 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2，ni3 hai2 zhi1dao4 xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What else were we supposed to do? That compound of theirs is lit up like a goddamned Christmas tree.\n"
"\n"
"They've got more power than they know what to do with."
msgstr ""
"我们​还​能​怎么办​？​他们​的​园区​天天​都​跟​圣诞节​似的​灯火通明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​的​电多得​都​不​知道​怎么​用​了​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hai2 neng2 zen3me5ban4？ta1men5 de5 yuan2qu1 tian1tian1 dou1 gen1 sheng4dan4jie2 shi4de5 deng1huo3tong1ming2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 de5 dian4 duo1 de2 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 zen3me5 yong4 le5。"

msgid "What exactly did you hear about me?"
msgstr ""
"你​到底​听说​了​关于​我​的​什么​事情​？\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 ting1shuo1 le5 guan1yu2 wo3 de5 shen2me5 shi4qing5？"

msgid "What favor?"
msgstr ""
"什么​忙​？\n"
"shen2me5 mang2？"

msgid "What happened here? What caused the lockdown?"
msgstr ""
"这里​发生​了​什么​？​是​什么​导致​了​封锁​？\n"
"zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？shi4 shen2me5 dao3zhi4 le5 feng1suo3？"

msgid "What happened to the team?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​小队​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"ni3 de5 xiao3 dui4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "What happened to them?"
msgstr ""
"他们​怎么样​了​？\n"
"ta1men5 zen3me5yang4 le5？"

msgid ""
"What happened to us was Hoffmann.\n"
"\n"
"He was a rookie... the kid of some big-money corporate exec. He looked good on paper, and he made it through KSK training, so he was technically qualified to join a team.\n"
"\n"
"But he was *way* too green to fit in with ours."
msgstr ""
"这事​还​得​从​霍夫曼​说起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​是​新​加入​的​队员​……​是​某个​财大气粗​的​企业​高管​的​儿子​。​他​的​简历​看上去​很​出色​，​再​加上​他​也​通过​了​KSK​的​训练​，​所以​理论​上​讲​，​他​加入​一支​小队​并​没什么​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​对于​我们​这支​小队​来说​，​他​*​极度​*​缺乏经验​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 hai2 de2 cong2 huo4fu1man4 shuo1qi3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 xin1 jia1ru4 de5 dui4yuan2……shi4 mou3 ge4 cai2da4qi4cu1 de5 qi3ye4 gao1guan3 de5 er2zi5。ta1 de5 jian3li4 kan4shang5qu5 hen3 chu1se4，zai4 jia1shang4 ta1 ye3 tong1guo4 le5 KSK de5 xun4lian4，suo3yi3 li3lun4 shang4 jiang3，ta1 jia1ru4 yi1 zhi1 xiao3 dui4 bing4 mei2shen2me5 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 dui4yu2 wo3men5 zhe4 zhi1 xiao3 dui4 lai2 shuo1，ta1*ji2du4*que1 fa2 jing1 yan4。"

msgid "What happened?"
msgstr ""
"发生​了​什么​？\n"
"fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "What happens in there?"
msgstr ""
"那​里面​会​发生​什么​事​？\n"
"na4 li3mian4 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "What happens now?"
msgstr ""
"所以​现在​要​如何​？\n"
"suo3yi3 xian4zai4 yao4 ru2he2？"

msgid "What has this man done?"
msgstr ""
"这​家伙​做​了​什么​？\n"
"zhe4 jia1huo5 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What have you done? Terrible things, Spirit. Loathsome, unforgivable things.\n"
"\n"
"You have corrupted children. Turned them into killers. You've been a party to violence, torture, and the desecration of corpses.\n"
"\n"
"You've created monsters."
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​什么​？​非常​可怕​的​事​，​精魂​。​令人厌恶​，​并且​不可​饶恕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​腐化​了​那些​孩子​，​将​他们​变成​杀人​凶手​。​你​参与​了​各种​暴力​、​酷刑​和​亵渎​尸体​的​行径​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​创造​了​一群​怪物​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？fei1chang2 ke3pa4 de5 shi4，jing1hun2。ling3 ren2 yan4 e4，bing4qie3 bu4ke3 rao2shu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fu3hua4 le5 na4Xie1hai2zi5，jiang1 ta1men5 bian4cheng2 sha1ren2 xiong1shou3。ni3 can1yu4 le5 ge4zhong3 bao4li4、ku4xing2 he4 xie4du2 shi1ti3 de5 xing2jing4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 chuang4zao4 le5 yi1 qun2 guai4wu5。"

msgid "What have you heard about the megacorps?"
msgstr ""
"关于​各大​超企​你​知道​什么​？\n"
"guan1yu2 ge4 dai4 chao1 qi3 ni3 zhi1dao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What history are you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​“​历史​”​是​指​什么​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5“li4shi3” shi4 zhi3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What if I could convince you that it *wouldn't* be wrong to question him?"
msgstr ""
"如果​我能​说服​你​，​质疑​他​*​并非​*​错误​之举​呢​？\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 neng2 shuo1fu2 ni3，zhi4yi2 ta1*bing4fei1*cuo4wu4 zhi1 ju3 ni2？"

msgid "What if I have questions about your findings?"
msgstr ""
"要是​我​对​你​的​调查结果​有​疑问​呢​？\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 diao4cha2jie2guo3 you3 yi2wen4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"What if I killed him for you instead? I was planning on doing that all "
"along."
msgstr ""
"要是​我​替​你​杀​了​他​呢​？​我​从​一​开始​就​打算​这么​做来​着​。\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3 ti4 ni3 sha1 le5 ta1 ni2？wo3 cong2 yi1 kai1shi3 jiu4 da3suan4 zhe4me5 zuo4 lai2 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"What if I offered to pay for their food? One lump sum, right now, and you go"
" back to honoring your contract."
msgstr ""
"如果​我来​为​他们​的​食物​支付​报酬​呢​？​一次性​当场​付清​，​然后​你​继续​履行合同​。\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 lai2 wei2 ta1men5 de5 shi2wu4 zhi1fu4 bao4chou5 ni2？yi1ci4xing4 dang1chang3 fu4qing1，ran2hou4 ni3 ji4xu4 lu:3 xing2 ge3 tong2。"

msgid "What if I were to take him out, here and now?"
msgstr ""
"要是​我​此时此地​就​把​他杀​了​呢​？\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3 ci3shi2ci3di4 jiu4 ba3 ta1sha1 le5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"What if you were to pick a fight with a different kind of \"dragon\"? Say, "
"maybe... a gang, or a corporation?"
msgstr ""
"要​不​你​再​考虑一下​别的​“​巨龙​”​呢​？​比方说​……​帮派​？​或者​超企​？\n"
"yao4 bu4 ni3 zai4 kao3 lu:4 yi1 xia4 bie2de5“ju4long2” ni2？bi3fang5shuo1……bang1pai4？huo4zhe3 chao1 qi3？"

msgid "What is he talking about?"
msgstr ""
"他​在​说​什么​？\n"
"ta1 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid "What is it now?"
msgstr ""
"现在​怎么​了​？\n"
"xian4zai4 zen3me5 le5？"

msgid "What is it that you do, really?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​到底​是​做​什么​的​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 dao4di3 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？"

msgid "What is it you wish, dragon?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​愿望​是​什么​，​巨龙​？\n"
"ni3 de5 yuan4wang4 shi4 shen2me5，ju4long2？"

msgid "What is it?"
msgstr ""
"怎么​了​？\n"
"zen3me5 le5？"

msgid "What is it? A dorm, or a lounge, or something...?"
msgstr ""
"这是​什么​地方​？​宿舍​？​休息室​？​还是​别的​什么​……​？\n"
"zhe4 shi4 shen2me5 di4fang1？su4she4？xiu1xi1shi4？hai2shi5 bie2de5 shen2me5……？"

msgid "What is it? What is the green?"
msgstr ""
"什么​？​什么​绿色​？\n"
"shen2me5？shen2me5 lu:4se4？"

msgid "What is on the floor above?"
msgstr ""
"楼上​有些​什么​？\n"
"lou2shang4 you3xie1 shen2me5？"

msgid "What is that smell?"
msgstr ""
"这是​什么​气味​？\n"
"zhe4 shi4 shen2me5 qi4wei4？"

msgid ""
"What is this all about for you, Audran? Why the hell are you doing this?"
msgstr ""
"这​一切​对​你​来说​意味着​什么​，​奥​德兰​？​你​到底​为什么​要​这样​做​？\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 yi4wei4zhe5 shen2me5，Ao4de2lan2？ni3 dao4di3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4？"

msgid "What is this trifle?"
msgstr ""
"这件​琐事​是​什么​？\n"
"zhe4 jian4 suo3shi4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What kind of communications?"
msgstr ""
"什么样​的​通讯​？\n"
"shen2me5yang4 de5 tong1xun4？"

msgid "What kind of concerns?"
msgstr ""
"什么​担忧​？\n"
"shen2me5 dan1you1？"

msgid "What kind of data are we talking about?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​是​什么​数据​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 shi4 shen2me5 shu4ju4？"

msgid "What kind of help do you need?"
msgstr ""
"你们​需要​什么​帮助​？\n"
"ni3men5 xu1yao4 shen2me5 bang1zhu4？"

msgid "What kind of magic do you practice? Shamanic? Hermetic?"
msgstr ""
"你​修习​的​是​哪种​魔法​？​萨满​派​？​赫尔墨斯​派​？\n"
"ni3 xiu1xi2 de5 shi4 na3 zhong3 mo2fa3？sa4man3 pai4？he4er3mo4si1 pai4？"

msgid "What kind of message are we talking about here?"
msgstr ""
"你​具体​想​表达​的​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"ni3 ju4ti3 xiang3 biao3da2 de5 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid "What kind of product were they moving in that warehouse?"
msgstr ""
"他们​往​那个​仓库​里​运送​什么​货物​？\n"
"ta1men5 wang3 na4ge5 cang1ku4 li3 yun4song4 shen2me5 huo4wu4？"

msgid "What kind of product?"
msgstr ""
"什么​货物​？\n"
"shen2me5 huo4wu4？"

msgid "What kind of rigger are you?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​是​哪种​机师​？\n"
"na4 ni3 shi4 na3 zhong3 ji1shi1？"

msgid "What larger receptacle?"
msgstr ""
"什么​更大​的​容器​？\n"
"shen2me5 geng1 dai4 de5 rong2qi4？"

msgid "What makes it that you need to survive working like this?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​要​靠​这种​手段​来​谋生​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 kao4 zhe4zhong3 shou3duan4 lai2 mou2sheng1？"

msgid ""
"What makes life worth living? What in life is truly valuable, and what is the dross that can be burned away?\n"
"\n"
"I spent weeks dissecting every aspect of my life to find the answers to these questions. Slowly, agonizingly, I pared down the list until only four items remained.\n"
"\n"
"These four items became the cornerstones of my new philosophy, and the basis for everything that Feuerstelle stands for."
msgstr ""
"是​什么​让​生命​值得​活下去​？​生活​中​的​什么​才​是​真正​有​价值​的​，​又​有​哪些​是​可以​烧掉​的​糟粕​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​耗费​数周​剖析​生活​的​方方面面​，​只为​寻得​这些​问题​的​答案​。​在​缓慢​而​痛苦​的​筛选​中​，​我​把​清单​里​的​内容​缩减到​了​仅​有​的​四项​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​四项​内容​成为​了​我​新​哲学​的​基石​，​也​奠定​了​“​火坑​”​所​代表​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shen2me5 rang4 sheng1ming4 zhi2de5 huo2xia4qu4？sheng1huo2 zhong4 de5 shen2me5 cai2 shi4 zhen1zheng4 you3 jia4zhi2 de5，you4 you3 na3xie1 shi4 ke3yi3 shao1 diao4 de5 zao1po4？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hao4fei4 shu4zhou1 pou1xi1 sheng1huo2 de5 fang1fang1mian4mian4，zhi3 wei2 xun2 de2 zhe4xie1 wen4ti2 de5 da2an4。zai4 huan3man4 er2 tong4ku3 de5 shai1xuan3 zhong4，wo3 ba3 qing1dan1 li3 de5 nei4rong2 suo1 jian3 dao4 le5 jin3 you3 de5 si4 xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 si4 xiang4 nei4rong2 cheng2wei2 le5 wo3 xin1 zhe2xue2 de5 ji1shi2，ye3 dian4ding4 le5“huo3keng1” suo3 dai4biao3 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid "What makes you think I’m going to make a deal with a dragon?"
msgstr ""
"你​凭​什么​觉得​我会​和​一条​巨龙​做​交易​？\n"
"ni3 ping2 shen2me5 jue2de5 wo3 hui4 he4 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 zuo4 jiao1yi4？"

msgid "What makes you think that he'll still be alive?"
msgstr ""
"你​凭​什么​认为​他​到时候​还​能​活着​？\n"
"ni3 ping2 shen2me5 ren4wei2 ta1 dao4shi2hou4 hai2 neng2 huo2zhe5？"

msgid "What multiplicity?"
msgstr ""
"什么​繁衍​？\n"
"shen2me5 fan2yan3？"

msgid ""
"What my husband is attempting to say is that we're fine, but we're trying to"
" decide what to do next."
msgstr ""
"我​丈夫​想​说​的​是​我们​没事​，​但​我们​正在​思考​接下来​该​怎么​做​。\n"
"wo3 zhang4fu5 xiang3 shuo1 de5 shi4 wo3men5 mei2shi4，dan4 wo3men5 zheng4zai4 si1kao3 jie1xia4lai2 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4。"

msgid "What political groups are involved?"
msgstr ""
"有​什么​政治​团体​涉及​其中​？\n"
"you3 shen2me5 zheng4zhi4 tuan2ti3 she4ji2 qi2zhong1？"

msgid "What purpose?"
msgstr ""
"什么​使命​？\n"
"shen2me5 shi3ming4？"

msgid "What sort of trouble?"
msgstr ""
"什么​麻烦​？\n"
"shen2me5 ma2fan5？"

msgid "What sort of tweaks are we talking about?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​小​调整​是​指​什么​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 xiao3 tiao2zheng3 shi4 zhi3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What stopped her? I can't imagine that a rampaging dragon would just go away"
" on its own."
msgstr ""
"是​什么​阻止​了​她​？​我​很​难​想象​一条​到处​肆虐​的​巨龙​会​自行​离开​。\n"
"shi4 shen2me5 zu3zhi3 le5 ta1？wo3 hen3 nan2 xiang3xiang4 yi1 tiao2 dao4chu4 si4nu:e4 de5 ju4long2 hui4 zi4xing2 li2kai1。"

msgid "What task? Tell me what you need."
msgstr ""
"什么​任务​？​告诉​我​具体​细节​。\n"
"shen2me5 ren4wu5？gao4su4 wo3 ju4ti3 xi4jie2。"

msgid ""
"What the hell are you, Absinthe? Because I'm pretty sure that you're not an "
"elf."
msgstr ""
"你​究竟​是​什么​，​苦艾​酒​？​我​可以​确定​的​是​，​你​绝非​精灵​。\n"
"ni3 jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5，ku3ai4 jiu3？wo3 ke3yi3 que4ding4 de5 shi4，ni3 jue2fei1 jing1ling2。"

msgid "What the hell are you?"
msgstr ""
"你​到底​是​什么​东西​？\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 dong1xi1？"

msgid "What the hell did we just watch? I mean... what does that *mean?*"
msgstr ""
"我们​刚刚​看到​了​什么​？​我​是​说​……​那​是​什么​*​意思​*​？\n"
"wo3men5 gang1gang5 kan4dao4 le5 shen2me5？wo3 shi4 shuo1……na4 shi4 shen2me5*yi4si5*？"

msgid "What the hell happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"真​见鬼​，​他​这​是​怎么​了​？\n"
"zhen1 jian4gui3，ta1 zhe4 shi4 zen3me5 le5？"

msgid "What the hell happened?"
msgstr ""
"这是​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"zhe4 shi4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What the hell is *wrong* with you, chief? I thought that we were friends!"
msgstr ""
"你​到底​有​什么​*​毛病​*​，​头儿​？​我​以为​我们​是​朋友​！\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 you3 shen2me5*mao2bing4*，tou2r5？wo3 yi3wei2 wo3men5 shi4 peng2you5！"

msgid "What the hell is going on in this place?"
msgstr ""
"这里​到底​发生​了​什么​事​？\n"
"zhe4li3 dao4di3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "What the hell is going on? Why are you leaving?"
msgstr ""
"到底​是​怎么回事​？​你们​为什么​要​走​？\n"
"dao4di3 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？ni3men5 wei4shen2me5 yao4 zou3？"

msgid "What the hell is that?"
msgstr ""
"那​是​什么​鬼​玩意儿​？\n"
"na4 shi4 shen2me5 gui3 wan2yi4r5？"

msgid "What the hell is this, Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​搞​什么​鬼​，​艾格尔​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 gao3 shen2me5 gui3，Ai4ge2er3？"

msgid "What the hell is this, Glory?"
msgstr ""
"这​他​妈​是​什么​情况​，​格洛丽​？\n"
"zhe4 ta1 ma1 shi4 shen2me5 qing2kuang4，Ge2luo4li2？"

msgid ""
"What the hell kind of place are you running here, lady? This thing is "
"terrible!"
msgstr ""
"女士​，​你​这开​的​是​什么​店​啊​？​这​东西​太​难吃​了​！\n"
"nu:3shi4，ni3 zhe4 kai1 de5 shi4 shen2me5 dian4 a1？zhe4 dong1xi1 tai4 nan2chi1 le5！"

msgid "What the hell was that?!"
msgstr ""
"那​到底​是​什么​鬼​东西​？​！\n"
"na4 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 gui3 dong1xi1？！"

msgid "What the hell, Eiger? We weren't done with him!"
msgstr ""
"你​在​搞​什么​鬼​，​艾格尔​？​我们​还​没​完事​呢​！\n"
"ni3 zai4 gao3 shen2me5 gui3，Ai4ge2er3？wo3men5 hai2 mei2 wan2shi4 ni2！"

msgid "What the hell?"
msgstr ""
"什么​鬼​？\n"
"shen2me5 gui3？"

msgid ""
"What the hell? This is my apartment! I own it! What are you doing in here?"
msgstr ""
"什么​鬼​？​这​是​我​的​公寓​！​我​是​户主​！​你们​在​这里​搞​什么​名堂​？\n"
"shen2me5 gui3？zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 gong1yu4！wo3 shi4 hu4zhu3！ni3men5 zai4 zhe4li3 gao3 shen2me5 ming2tang5？"

msgid "What the hell?!"
msgstr ""
"什么​鬼​？​！\n"
"shen2me5 gui3？！"

msgid "What the situation with Samuel's people?"
msgstr ""
"塞缪尔​的​手下​是​怎么回事​？\n"
"sai4miu4er3 de5 shou3xia4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "What the...?"
msgstr ""
"什么​鬼​……​？\n"
"shen2me5 gui3……？"

msgid ""
"What they were doing in there was wrong. More than that - it was terrible.\n"
"\n"
"They had to be stopped, and we stopped them. It's as simple as that."
msgstr ""
"他们​在​那里​做​的​事​是​不​对​的​。​甚至​可以​说​是​冒天下之大不韪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​必须​被​阻止​，​而​我们​阻止​了​他们​。​就​这么​简单​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 na4li5 zuo4 de5 shi4 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5。shen4zhi4 ke3yi3 shuo1 shi4 mao4tian1xia4zhi1da4bu4wei3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 bi4xu1 bei4 zu3zhi3，er2 wo3men5 zu3zhi3 le5 ta1men5。jiu4 zhe4me5 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"What this means for us is that we shouldn't have to kill Harrow to put an end to all of this. I don't think that he'll be much of a threat on his own... not anymore.\n"
"\n"
"If we can manage to purify the spirit rather than killing it, it'll withdraw from the cultists' minds willingly. We can save them."
msgstr ""
"这​意味着​我们​不必​非得​杀死​哈罗​才能​了结​这​一切​。​如果​仅凭​他​自己​的话​……​我​觉得​已经​构​不成​什么​威胁​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​选择​不​杀死​那个​精魂​而是​净化​它​，​它​就​可以​自愿​离开​教徒​们​的​脑海​。​这样一来​，​我们​便​可以​拯救​他们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 bu4bi4 fei1dei3 sha1si3 ha1luo2 cai2neng2 liao3jie2 zhe4 yi1qie4。ru2guo3 jin3 ping2 ta1 zi4ji3 de5hua4……wo3 jue2de5 yi3jing1 gou4 bu4cheng2 shen2me5 wei1xie2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 xuan3ze2 bu4 sha1si3 na4ge5 jing1hun2 er2shi4 jing4hua4 ta1，ta1 jiu4 ke3yi3 zi4yuan4 li2kai1 jiao4tu2 men5 de5 nao3hai3。zhe4yang4yi1lai2，wo3men5 bian4 ke3yi3 zheng3jiu4 ta1men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"What was disgusting was what the bastards here did to that troll.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shudders.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我​说​恶心​，​是​指​那些​混账​对​这个​巨魔​干出​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​哆嗦​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 e3xin1，shi4 zhi3 na4xie1 hun4zhang4 dui4 zhe4ge5 ju4mo2 gan4 chu1 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 duo1suo5 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "What was it doing in there?"
msgstr ""
"里面​为什么​会​有​这个​东西​？\n"
"li3mian4 wei4shen2me5 hui4 you3 zhe4ge5 dong1xi1？"

msgid ""
"What was the drone carrying, Yuli? Sounds like it was something important."
msgstr ""
"无人机​携带​的​东西​是​什么​，​尤里​？​听​起来​很​重要​啊​。\n"
"wu2ren2ji1 xie2dai4 de5 dong1xi1 shi4 shen2me5，You2li3？ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 zhong4yao4 a1。"

msgid "What was the point of any of this, Audran? Why kill Vauclair?"
msgstr ""
"这​一切​是​为了​什么​，​奥​德兰​？​为什么​要​杀​了​沃​克莱尔​？\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 shi4 wei4le5 shen2me5，Ao4de2lan2？wei4shen2me5 yao4 sha1 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3？"

msgid "What was your band called? Maybe I've heard of it."
msgstr ""
"你​的​乐队​叫​什么​来​着​？​说不定​我​听说​过​呢​。\n"
"ni3 de5 yue4dui4 jiao4 shen2me5 lai2 zhao2？shuo1bu5ding4 wo3 ting1shuo1 guo4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"What we need is information. I think that we should pick up where Winters left off.\n"
"\n"
"We need to find Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"我们​现在​需要​的​是​情报​。​我​想​我们​应该​继续​温特斯​的​调查​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​得​找到​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xian4zai4 xu1yao4 de5 shi4 qing2bao4。wo3 xiang3 wo3men5 ying1gai1 ji4xu4 Wen1te4si1 de5 diao4cha2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de2 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"What we need is to get back home to our apartment on the next floor. But we can't do that while those spirits that the Magnifikers summoned are terrorizing the place.\n"
"\n"
"If you take care of them... if you clear the path for us to return home... I'll give you the password that you'll need to speak with Janet."
msgstr ""
"我们​想要​回到​楼上​的​公寓​去​。​但伟术​帮​召唤​的​那些​精魂​还​在​那儿​肆虐​，​我们​根本​做​不到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​能​处理​掉​它们​……​如果​你​能​为​我们​清理​出​回家​的​路​……​我​就​把​你​找​珍妮特​需要​的​口令​告诉​你​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xiang3yao4 hui2dao4 lou2shang4 de5 gong1yu4 qu4。dan4 wei3 shu4 bang1 zhao4huan4 de5 na4xie1 jing1hun2 hai2 zai4 na4r5 si4nu:e4，wo3men5 gen1ben3 zuo4 bu4dao4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 chu3li3 diao4 ta1men5……ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 wei2 wo3men5 qing1li3 chu1 hui2jia1 de5 lu4……wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3 zhao3 zhen1 ni1 te4 xu1yao4 de5 kou3ling4 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"What we saw with the initiate, and the fridge.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She jerks a thumb at Marta.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Her general mindset, and what she said about the sacrifices. Lots of little things, but they add up."
msgstr ""
"那个​学徒​。​还有​那个​冰箱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝玛​尔塔​猛地​一指​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​思维​模式​，​以及​她​关于​牺牲​的​说法​。​都​是​些​小事​，​但​这种​巧合​太多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 xue2tu2。hai2you3 na4ge5 bing1xiang1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 Ma3er3ta3 meng3de5 yi1 zhi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 si1wei2 mo2shi4，yi3ji2 ta1 guan1yu2 xi1sheng1 de5 shuo1fa3。dou1 shi4 xie1 xiao3shi4，dan4 zhe4zhong3 qiao3he2 tai4 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"What we saw with the initiate, and the fridge. What we heard Marta say about the sacrifices.\n"
"\n"
"Lots of little things, but they add up."
msgstr ""
"那个​学徒​。​还有​那个​冰箱​。​以及​我们​听到​的​玛​尔塔​关于​牺牲​的​说法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​都​是​些​小事​，​但​这种​巧合​太多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 xue2tu2。hai2you3 na4ge5 bing1xiang1。yi3ji2 wo3men5 ting1dao4 de5 Ma3er3ta3 guan1yu2 xi1sheng1 de5 shuo1fa3。\n"
"\n"
"dou1 shi4 xie1 xiao3shi4，dan4 zhe4zhong3 qiao3he2 tai4 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"What we saw with the initiate, and the fridge. What we heard Marta say about the sacrifices. Lots of little things.\n"
"\n"
"I think that if we purify the spirit, Feuerstelle will die. We'll save all of the kids, and the nightmare will end."
msgstr ""
"那个​学徒​。​还有​那个​冰箱​。​以及​我们​听到​的​玛​尔塔​关于​牺牲​的​说法​。​很多​类似​的​小事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​净化​了​精魂​，​“​火坑​”​便会​随之​消亡​。​我们​会​救出​所有​的​孩子​，​这场​噩梦​也​将​结束​。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 xue2tu2。hai2you3 na4ge5 bing1xiang1。yi3ji2 wo3men5 ting1dao4 de5 Ma3er3ta3 guan1yu2 xi1sheng1 de5 shuo1fa3。hen3 duo1 lei4si4 de5 xiao3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 jing4hua4 le5 jing1hun2，“huo3keng1” bian4 hui4 sui2zhi1 xiao1wang2。wo3men5 hui4 jiu4chu1 suo3you3 de5 hai2zi5，zhe4 chang2 e4meng4 ye3 jiang1 jie2shu4。"

msgid "What were you doing for the Yakuza?"
msgstr ""
"你​给​极道​跑​过​什么​差事​？\n"
"ni3 gei3 ji2dao4 pao2 guo4 shen2me5 cha4shi4？"

msgid "What will you do if we let you go?"
msgstr ""
"如果​我放​了​你​，​你​打算​做​什么​？\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 fang4 le5 ni3，ni3 da3suan4 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What would it cost me to buy the ghouls' food for them?"
msgstr ""
"我要​花​多少​钱​才能​为​尸鬼们​购买​食物​？\n"
"wo3 yao4 hua1 duo1shao3 qian2 cai2neng2 wei2 shi1 gui3 men5 gou4mai3 shi2wu4？"

msgid "What would that do?"
msgstr ""
"这个​有​什么​用​？\n"
"zhe4ge5 you3 shen2me5 yong4？"

msgid "What would you like to do with this item?"
msgstr ""
"你​要​如何​处理​这件​物品​？\n"
"ni3 yao4 ru2he2 chu3li3 zhe4 jian4 wu4pin3？"

msgid "What would you need me to do?"
msgstr ""
"你​需要​我​做​什么​？\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What you're looking at is a cyberware deactivator. It's a one-shot tool that"
" can temporarily disable cybernetic devices."
msgstr ""
"你​看到​的​是​赛博​改造​失效​器​。​这是​一次性​工具​，​可以​暂时​使赛​博​控制​设备​失效​。\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 de5 shi4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 shi1xiao4 qi4。zhe4 shi4 yi1ci4xing4 gong1ju4，ke3yi3 zan4shi2 shi3 sai4 bo2 kong4zhi4 she4bei4 shi1xiao4。"

msgid ""
"What you're really saying is, you're going to trash our reputation for a few extra nuyen. Bad call, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Really bad call."
msgstr ""
"你​的​意思​是​，​为了​多​赚​一点​新円​，​不惜​毁掉​我们​的​名声​吗​。​这​可不​明智​啊​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常​不明智​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，wei4le5 duo1 zhuan4 yi1dian3 xin1 yuan2，bu4xi1 hui3diao4 wo3men5 de5 ming2sheng1 ma5。zhe4 ke3bu5 ming2zhi4 a1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 bu4 ming2 zhi4。"

msgid ""
"What you're saying makes sense to me. All right, we purify the spirit, "
"rescue the cultists, and bail. We can worry about Harrow later."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​有​道理​。​好​吧​，​我们​净化​精魂​，​救出​教徒​，​然后​撤退​。​至于​哈罗​的​事​，​我们​以后​再​操心​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 you3 dao4li5。hao3 ba1，wo3men5 jing4hua4 jing1hun2，jiu4chu1 jiao4tu2，ran2hou4 che4tui4。zhi4yu2 ha1luo2 de5 shi4，wo3men5 yi3hou4 zai4 cao1xin1。"

msgid ""
"What you're suggesting is beyond the scope of our capabilities.\n"
"\n"
"I don't have any contacts in Norway. We wouldn't even know where to begin looking for Winternight, and if we found them, what then? The two of us aren't going to stop an international conspiracy our own. We're good, but we're not *that* good."
msgstr ""
"你​的​提议​超出​了​我们​的​能力​范围​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​挪威​不​认识​什么​人​。​我们​甚至​不​知道​该​从​哪里​开始​寻找​“​冬夜​”​，​而且​就算​找到​了​，​接下来​又​该​怎么办​？​就​凭​我们​两个​人​可​没法​阻止​一个​国际​阴谋​。​我们​很​厉害​，​但​还​没到​那种​程度​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ti2yi4 chao1chu1 le5 wo3men5 de5 neng2li4 fan4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 nuo2wei1 bu4 ren4shi5 shen2me5 ren2。wo3men5 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 cong2 na3li3 kai1shi3 xun2zhao3“dong1 ye4”，er2qie3 jiu4suan4 zhao3dao4 le5，jie1xia4lai2 you4 gai1 zen3me5ban4？jiu4 ping2 wo3men5 liang3 ge4 ren2 ke3 mei2fa3 zu3zhi3 yi1ge5 guo2ji4 yin1mou2。wo3men5 hen3 li4hai5，dan4 hai2 mei2 dao4 na4zhong3 cheng2du4。"

msgid ""
"What you've said, it... it makes a lot of sense.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She blinks, steals a glance back at Kroner, and shudders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right. I need help."
msgstr ""
"你​刚刚​说​的​这些​……​真的​很​有​道理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​眨​眨眼​，​向​后​瞥​了​一眼​克​罗纳​，​颤抖​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​。​我​需要​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1gang5 shuo1 de5 zhe4xie1……zhen1de5 hen3 you3 dao4li5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 zha3yan3，xiang4 hou4 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 ke4 luo2na4，chan4dou3 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4。"

msgid "What'd you do?"
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​什么​？\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What're you gonna do, knock on the front door? What makes you think that "
"they'll even answer? They've done a pretty good job of avoiding us so far..."
msgstr ""
"你​打算​怎么​做​，​敲开​前门​？​你​觉得​会​有人​来​应门​吗​？​到​目前为止​，​他们​都​一直​在​躲​着​我们​……\n"
"ni3 da3suan4 zen3me5 zuo4，qiao1kai1 qian2men2？ni3 jue2de5 hui4 you3ren2 lai2 ying4men2 ma5？dao4 mu4 qian2 wei2 zhi3，ta1men5 dou1 yi1zhi2 zai4 duo3 zhao2 wo3men5……"

msgid "What're you so afraid of?"
msgstr ""
"是​什么​把​你​吓​成​这样​了​？\n"
"shi4 shen2me5 ba3 ni3 he4 cheng2 zhe4yang4 le5？"

msgid "What's better about the Kreuzbasar?"
msgstr ""
"克洛伊​茨​集市​有​哪里​更好​吗​？\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 you3 na3li3 geng1 hao3 ma5？"

msgid "What's brought you round?"
msgstr ""
"什么​风​把​你​吹​来​了​？\n"
"shen2me5 feng1 ba3 ni3 chui1 lai2 le5？"

msgid ""
"What's done is done now. There's nothing else for us here.\n"
"\n"
"Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"事已至此​，​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3，wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"What's done is done, and what APEX has planned is none of your concern. I "
"should go."
msgstr ""
"木已成舟​，​而且​APEX​有​什么​计划​也​与​你​无关​。​我​该​走​了​。\n"
"mu4yi3cheng2zhou1，er2qie3 APEX you3 shen2me5 ji4hua4 ye3 yu4 ni3 wu2guan1。wo3 gai1 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"What's done is done.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her tone is cool. Seemingly indifferent.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"事已至此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​语气​很淡​定​，​甚至​有些​冷漠​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 hen3 dan4 ding4，shen4zhi4 you3xie1 leng3mo4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr ""
"这里​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "What's going on with the vendors?"
msgstr ""
"小贩​们​出​什么​事​了​？\n"
"xiao3fan4 men5 chu1 shen2me5 shi4 le5？"

msgid "What's going on, Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"出​什么​事​了​，​布里​茨​？\n"
"chu1 shen2me5 shi4 le5，Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid "What's going on, buddy?"
msgstr ""
"怎么​了​，​伙计​？\n"
"zen3me5 le5，huo3ji5？"

msgid ""
"What's happening here in Berlin is special. I felt the need to be a part of "
"it."
msgstr ""
"有些​特别​的​事​在​柏林​发生​，​我​感觉​有​必要​掺和​一下​。\n"
"you3xie1 te4bie2 de5 shi4 zai4 bo2lin2 fa1sheng1，wo3 gan3jue2 you3 bi4yao4 chan1huo5 yi1xia4。"

msgid "What's happening on Wednesday, Yuli?"
msgstr ""
"尤里​，​星期三​会​发生​什么​？\n"
"You2li3，xing1qi1san1 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5？"

msgid "What's happening out there?"
msgstr ""
"那里​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"na4li5 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "What's his deal, anyway?"
msgstr ""
"他​到底​是​做​什么​的​？\n"
"ta1 dao4di3 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？"

msgid "What's in it for me?"
msgstr ""
"这​对​我​有​什么​好处​？\n"
"zhe4 dui4 wo3 you3 shen2me5 hao3chu3？"

msgid ""
"What's it for? Something tells me we're going to have more company soon..."
msgstr ""
"这​东西​有​什么​用​啊​？​我​总​觉得​马上​就要​有人​来​招呼​咱们​了​……\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 you3 shen2me5 yong4 a1？wo3 zong3 jue2de5 ma3shang4 jiu4yao4 you3ren2 lai2 zhao1hu5 zan2men5 le5……"

msgid ""
"What's it look like we're doing? Baking a pie?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The grizzled troll actually manages a short laugh before turning serious again.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​我们​在​做​什么​？​烤​馅饼​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​头发​灰白​的​巨魔​短促​地笑​了​一声​，​然后​又​严肃​起来​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3men5 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5？kao3 xian4bing3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tou2fa5 hui1bai2 de5 ju4mo2 duan3cu4 de5 xiao4 le5 yi1sheng1，ran2hou4 you4 yan2su4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"What's left of your sense of self rebels, and unconsciousness slams into you like a freight train.\n"
"\n"
"Suddenly, mercifully, everything goes black."
msgstr ""
"你​残存​的​感知​仍​在​奋力​反抗​，​而​彼方​的​重压​如同​货运​列车​般​猛然​撞击​而​来​，​让​你​要​失去​意识​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​突然​间​，​一切​都​陷入​了​黑暗​—​—​这倒​是​一种​解脱​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 can2cun2 de5 gan3zhi1 reng2 zai4 fen4li4 fan3kang4，er2 bi3 fang1 de5 zhong4ya1 ru2tong2 huo4yun4 lie4che1 ban1 meng3ran2 zhuang4ji1 er2 lai2，rang4 ni3 yao4 shi1qu4 yi4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2 jian1，yi1qie4 dou1 xian4ru4 le5 hei1an4——zhe4 dao3 shi4 yi1zhong3 jie3tuo1。"

msgid ""
"What's more unsettling is her chrome. Glory is rocking a heavy loadout of "
"cyberware; from head to toe, she looks to be composed more of plastic and "
"metal than she is of skin and bone."
msgstr ""
"而​更令​你​感到​不安​的​是​她​身上​的​铬​合金​。​格洛丽​从头到脚​都​进行​了​大量​的​赛博​改造​，​这​让​她​看起来​似乎​更​多​是​由​塑料​和​金属​构成​，​而​非​血肉之躯​。\n"
"er2 geng1 ling3 ni3 gan3dao4 bu4an1 de5 shi4 ta1 shen1shang5 de5 ge4 he2jin1。Ge2luo4li2 cong2tou2dao4jiao3 dou1 jin4xing2 le5 da4liang4 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4，zhe4 rang4 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 si4hu1 geng1 duo1 shi4 you2 su4liao4 he4 jin1shu3 gou4cheng2，er2 fei1 xie3 rou4 zhi1 qu1。"

msgid "What's she offering for this mystery job?"
msgstr ""
"她​愿意​给​这项​神秘​差事​出​什么​报价​？\n"
"ta1 yuan4yi4 gei3 zhe4 xiang4 shen2mi4 cha4shi4 chu1 shen2me5 bao4jia4？"

msgid "What's the catch?"
msgstr ""
"这​对​你​有​什么​好处​？\n"
"zhe4 dui4 ni3 you3 shen2me5 hao3chu3？"

msgid "What's the chatter on the radio?"
msgstr ""
"收音机​里​在​说​什么​呢​？\n"
"shou1yin1ji1 li3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid "What's the deal with the new gang?"
msgstr ""
"新​帮派​是​怎么回事​？\n"
"xin1 bang1pai4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "What's the deal with the special concoction?"
msgstr ""
"特殊​配方​是​什么​？\n"
"te4shu1 pei4fang1 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What's the deal with your assistant? There's something funny about her "
"eyes..."
msgstr ""
"你​那​助手​是​怎么回事​？​她​的​眼睛​有些​古怪​……\n"
"ni3 na4 zhu4shou3 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？ta1 de5 yan3jing5 you3xie1 gu3guai4……"

msgid "What's the layout of this place like? "
msgstr ""
"这​地方​的​布局​是​什么样​的​？\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 de5 bu4ju2 shi4 shen2me5yang4 de5？"

msgid "What's the mood around here?"
msgstr ""
"大家​的​情绪​怎么样​？\n"
"da4jia1 de5 qing2xu4 zen3me5yang4？"

msgid "What's the play, $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"我们​该​怎么办​，​$(l.name)​？\n"
"wo3men5 gai1 zen3me5ban4，$(l.name)？"

msgid "What's the takeaway?"
msgstr ""
"有些​什么​要点​？\n"
"you3xie1 shen2me5 yao4dian3？"

msgid "What's the word with the gangs?"
msgstr ""
"帮派​那边​怎么​说​？\n"
"bang1pai4 na4bian5 zen3me5 shuo1？"

msgid "What's this errand?"
msgstr ""
"什么​差事​？\n"
"shen2me5 cha4shi4？"

msgid "What's up with the bandages on your hands?"
msgstr ""
"你​手上​的​绷带​是​怎么回事​？\n"
"ni3 shou3 shang4 de5 beng1dai4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid "What's up with the clock? You waiting for something?"
msgstr ""
"那台​时钟​怎么​了​？​你​在​等待​什么​吗​？\n"
"na4 tai2 shi2zhong1 zen3me5 le5？ni3 zai4 deng3dai4 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "What's up with the shoddy-looking pistol?"
msgstr ""
"这​把​手枪​怎么​看起来​这么​破​？\n"
"zhe4 ba3 shou3qiang1 zen3me5 kan4qi3lai5 zhe4me5 po4？"

msgid "What's your place in the Kreuzbasar?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​是​什么​地位​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 shi4 shen2me5 di4wei4？"

msgid "What's your story? Have you been in the Kreuzbasar long?"
msgstr ""
"讲讲​你​自己​的​故事​吧​？​你​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​待​了​很​久​吗​？\n"
"jiang3 jiang3 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 gu4shi4 ba1？ni3 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 dai1 le5 hen3 jiu3 ma5？"

msgid "What's... what's happening?"
msgstr ""
"到底​……​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"dao4di3……fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"What, did you think it was gonna be free?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Silke's hands clench and unclench. She looks agitated.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If cram were *cheap,* I wouldn't BE in this mess."
msgstr ""
"怎么​，​你​以为​这药​不​花钱​的​啊​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​西​尔克​的​手握​成​拳头​又​松开​。​她​看起来​焦躁​不堪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​要是​卖得​*​便宜​*​，​我​就​不会​碰上​这么​多​麻烦​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5，ni3 yi3wei2 zhe4 yao4 bu4 hua1qian2 de5 a1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Xi1er3ke4 de5 shou3 wo4 cheng2 quan2tou5 you4 song1kai1。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 jiao1zao4 bu4kan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 yao4shi5 mai4 de2*bian4yi2*，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 peng4shang4 zhe4me5 duo1 ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid ""
"What, like the barter system? I don't think so... I can't imagine that a "
"bunch of sewer-dwelling monsters would have much of value to trade."
msgstr ""
"怎么​，​要​以货易货​吗​？​我​看​不太靠​谱​吧​……​这么​一群​住​在​下水道​里​的​怪物​能​有​什么​值得​交易​的​东西​？\n"
"zen3me5，yao4 yi3 huo4 yi4 huo4 ma5？wo3 kan4 bu4 tai4 kao4 pu3 ba1……zhe4me5 yi1 qun2 zhu4 zai4 xia4shui3dao4 li3 de5 guai4wu5 neng2 you3 shen2me5 zhi2de5 jiao1yi4 de5 dong1xi1？"

msgid ""
"What, you mean pick on a victim who could fight back?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory shakes her head.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"怎么​，​你​是​说​挑个​能​还手​的​受害者​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5，ni3 shi4 shuo1 tiao1 ge4 neng2 huan2shou3 de5 shou4hai4zhe3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "What, you think that I wouldn't understand?"
msgstr ""
"怎么​，​你​觉得​我​听不懂​吗​？\n"
"zen3me5，ni3 jue2de5 wo3 ting1bu5dong3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"What. The. Hell.\n"
"\n"
"Whoever you are, you'd better knock it off. I swear, something bad is gonna happen if you don't."
msgstr ""
"到底​什么​鬼​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​你​是​谁​，​最好​赶紧​给​我​滚蛋​。​否则​我​发誓​，​没​你好​果子吃​。\n"
"\n"
"dao4di3 shen2me5 gui3 a1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 shi4 shei2，zui4hao3 gan3jin3 gei3 wo3 gun3dan4。fou3ze2 wo3 fa1shi4，mei2 ni3hao3 guo3 zi3 chi1。"

msgid "What... what do you want me to say?"
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​想要​我​说​什么​？\n"
"ni3……ni3 xiang3yao4 wo3 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid "What... what was that? What happened?"
msgstr ""
"刚才​……​那​是​什么​？​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"gang1cai2……na4 shi4 shen2me5？fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""
"什么​鬼​……​？\n"
"shen2me5 gui3……？"

msgid ""
"What...?\n"
"\n"
"Who are you? How did you get in here?"
msgstr ""
"什么​……​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​谁​？​你​怎么​进来​的​？\n"
"\n"
"shen2me5……？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2？ni3 zen3me5 jin4lai2 de5？"

msgid "What?"
msgstr ""
"什么​？\n"
"shen2me5？"

msgid "What? No, of course not. Zaak wouldn't hurt a fly."
msgstr ""
"什么​？​不​，​当然​不是​。​扎克​甚至​都​不会​伤害​一只​苍蝇​。\n"
"shen2me5？bu4，dang1ran2 bu4shi4。Zha1ke4 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 yi1 zhi3 cang1ying5。"

msgid ""
"What? Nothing to say about that, rookie?\n"
"\n"
"If I'd been in your place, Monika would still be alive and with us. Instead, I left her with you, and now my friend is a corpse in a basement."
msgstr ""
"怎么​？​没话​可​说​了​吗​，​菜鸟​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​我​当时​在​的话​，​莫妮卡​现在​还​能​活蹦乱跳​地站​在​这​。​相反​，​我​把​她​交给​了​你​，​结果​现在​我​的​朋友​成​了​地下室​里​的​一具​尸体​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5？mei2 hua4 ke3 shuo1 le5 ma5，cai4niao3？\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3 dang1shi2 zai4 de5hua4，Mo4ni1ka3 xian4zai4 hai2 neng2 huo2beng4luan4tiao4 de5 zhan4 zai4 zhe4。xiang1fan3，wo3 ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 le5 ni3，jie1guo3 xian4zai4 wo3 de5 peng2you5 cheng2 le5 di4xia4shi4 li3 de5 yi1 ju4 shi1ti3。"

msgid "What? What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"怎么​？​你​有​什么​事​？\n"
"zen3me5？ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "What? Who the hell is this? And how did you get on this line?"
msgstr ""
"什么​？​你​到底​是​谁​？​你​怎么​知道​这​条​通讯​线路​的​？\n"
"shen2me5？ni3 dao4di3 shi4 shei2？ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 zhe4 tiao2 tong1xun4 xian4lu4 de5？"

msgid ""
"What? You want to *control* the F-State? That goes against everything that "
"Monika stood for!"
msgstr ""
"什么​？​你​想要​*​掌控​*​动荡​带​？​这​和​莫妮卡​代表​的​一切​都​背道而驰​！\n"
"shen2me5？ni3 xiang3yao4*zhang3kong4*dong4dang4 dai4？zhe4 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 dai4biao3 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 bei4dao4er2chi2！"

msgid "Whatcha need, boss?"
msgstr ""
"干​啥​啊​，​老大​？\n"
"gan4 sha2 a1，lao3da4？"

msgid ""
"Whatever Harrow's added to his manifesto, it could be important. I'm going "
"to take a look."
msgstr ""
"哈罗​在​宣言​里​添加​的​内容​可能​会​很​重要​。​我要​去​看看​。\n"
"ha1luo2 zai4 xuan1yan2 li3 tian1jia1 de5 nei4rong2 ke3neng2 hui4 hen3 zhong4yao4。wo3 yao4 qu4 kan4kan5。"

msgid "Whatever I have to do."
msgstr ""
"我​尽量​吧​。\n"
"wo3 jin3liang4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Whatever Vauclair is doing... whatever he might be planning... it's going to happen tonight.\n"
"\n"
"Unless you can find a way to stop it."
msgstr ""
"不管​沃​克莱尔​在​做​什么​……​不管​他​在​计划​什么​……​今晚​就​会​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除非​你​能​找到​阻止​它​的​办法​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5……bu4guan3 ta1 zai4 ji4hua4 shen2me5……jin1wan3 jiu4 hui4 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 zu3zhi3 ta1 de5 ban4fa3。"

msgid ""
"Whatever else you are, you're the thing that killed Monika. And for that, "
"you're going to die."
msgstr ""
"无论​你​是​什么​，​你​都​杀死​了​莫妮卡​。​为此​，​你​必须​死​。\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 shi4 shen2me5，ni3 dou1 sha1si3 le5 Mo4ni1ka3。wei4ci3，ni3 bi4xu1 si3。"

msgid ""
"Whatever gramps. We have learned from the past, that's why we're in the "
"future."
msgstr ""
"行​吧​，​老爷子​。​我们​从​过去​中​汲取​经验​，​因此​我们​才能​身处​未来​。\n"
"xing2 ba1，lao3ye2zi5。wo3men5 cong2 guo4qu4 zhong4 ji2qu3 jing1yan4，yin1ci3 wo3men5 cai2neng2 shen1chu3 wei4lai2。"

msgid ""
"Whatever it is. I’ll drink more to it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She downs her glass and slams it on the bar with a loud exhalation.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"随便​吧​，​反正​我​爱喝​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​一饮而尽​，​“​咣当​”​一声​把​杯子​砸​在​吧​台上​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ba1，fan3zheng4 wo3 ai4 he4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1yin3er2jin4，“guang1dang1” yi1sheng1 ba3 bei1zi5 za2 zai4 ba1 tai2shang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Whatever of you was trapped in there is free now, Monika. I'll see you on "
"the other side."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​，​你​被困​在​里面​的​那​部分​如今​终于​自由​了​。​我们​来世​再见​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3，ni3 bei4kun4 zai4 li3mian4 de5 na4 bu4fen5 ru2jin1 zhong1yu2 zi4you2 le5。wo3men5 lai2shi4 zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"Whatever the cause, the trend doesn't appear to be slowing down. Just this morning, a mass shooting in the CAS state of Arkansas left twenty-two dead and another fifteen wounded.\n"
"\n"
"We'll have more on that story when we come back."
msgstr ""
"无论​原因​如何​，​这一​趋势​似乎​并未​减缓​。​就​在​今天上午​，​美国​阿肯色州​发生​一起​大规模​枪击​事件​，​造成​二十二​人​死亡​，​另有​十五​人​受伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​稍后​我们​将​带来​更​多​相关​报道​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 yuan2yin1 ru2he2，zhe4 yi1 qu1shi4 si4hu1 bing4wei4 jian3huan3。jiu4 zai4 jin1 tian1 shang4 wu3，mei3guo2 e1 ken3 se4 zhou1 fa1sheng1 yi1qi3 da4gui1mo2 qiang1ji1 shi4jian4，zao4cheng2 er4 shi2 er4 ren2 si3wang2，ling4you3 shi2wu3 ren2 shou4shang1。\n"
"\n"
"shao1hou4 wo3men5 jiang1 dai4lai2 geng1 duo1 xiang1guan1 bao4dao4。"

msgid "Whatever you have planned, I'm going to put a stop to it."
msgstr ""
"无论​你​有​什么​计划​，​我​都​会​阻止​你​。\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 you3 shen2me5 ji4hua4，wo3 dou1 hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Whatever you just did, it got their attention. A Knight Errant High Threat Response Team is on its way.\n"
"\n"
"Good luck. You're about to need it."
msgstr ""
"你​刚才​做​的​事情​引起​了​他们​的​注意​。​一支​游侠​骑士​高危​应急​小组​已经​在​路上​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝你好运​。​前头​可是​一场​硬仗​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1cai2 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 yin3qi3 le5 ta1men5 de5 zhu4yi4。yi1 zhi1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3 yi3jing1 zai4 lu4shang5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。qian2tou5 ke3shi4 yi1 chang2 ying4zhang4。"

msgid ""
"Whatever you just did, it got their attention... a Knight Errant High Threat Response Team is on its way.\n"
"\n"
"Thankfully, with the power grid overloaded, I don't think that they know where you are. But it's only a matter of time before they find you."
msgstr ""
"你​刚才​做​的​事情​引起​了​他们​的​注意​。​一支​游侠​骑士​高危​应急​小组​已经​在​路上​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​万幸​的​是​，​由于​电网​过载​，​他们​应该​还​不​知道​你​的​位置​。​但​他们​找到​你​只是​时间​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1cai2 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 yin3qi3 le5 ta1men5 de5 zhu4yi4。yi1 zhi1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3 yi3jing1 zai4 lu4shang5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wan4xing4 de5 shi4，you2yu2 dian4wang3 guo4zai4，ta1men5 ying1gai1 hai2 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 de5 wei4zhi5。dan4 ta1men5 zhao3dao4 ni3 zhi3shi4 shi2jian1 wen4ti2。"

msgid "Whatever you like."
msgstr ""
"随你便​。\n"
"sui2 ni3 bian4。"

msgid "Whatever you say! Please don't hurt me!"
msgstr ""
"你​说​什么​都行​！​请别​伤害​我​！\n"
"ni3 shuo1 shen2me5 dou1 xing2！qing3 bie4 shang1hai4 wo3！"

msgid "Whatever you think is best. "
msgstr ""
"只要​你​觉得​合适​就行​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 jue2de5 he2shi4 jiu4 xing2。"

msgid ""
"Whatever you think of how he chose to go out, you've gotta hand it to the old man. He really did it.\n"
"\n"
"He changed the world."
msgstr ""
"不管​你​怎么​看待​他​的​做法​，​但​不得不​说​，​那​老头子​真的​做到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​改变​了​世界​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 zen3me5 kan4dai4 ta1 de5 zuo4fa3，dan4 bu4de2bu4 shuo1，na4 lao3tou2zi5 zhen1de5 zuo4dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 gai3bian4 le5 shi4jie4。"

msgid ""
"Whatever you use to get past the wards outside of Harrow's shrine.\n"
"\n"
"I need it. Don't ask why - just do this for me. You owe me that much."
msgstr ""
"就是​你​用来​穿过​哈罗​神龛​外​的​防护​结界​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​需要​它​。​别问​为什么​，​只要​照​做​就行了​。​这​是​你​欠​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 ni3 yong4lai2 chuan1guo4 ha1luo2 shen2kan1 wai4 de5 fang2hu4 jie2jie4 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ta1。bie4 wen4 wei4shen2me5，zhi3yao4 zhao4 zuo4 jiu4 xing2 le5。zhe4 shi4 ni3 qian4 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Whatever you want to. You're free now - you're not \"supposed\" to be "
"anything. Find yourselves a new purpose, and make it a good one."
msgstr ""
"想​做​什么​都​可以​。​你们​现在​自由​了​。​你们​没有​什么​“​使命​”​要​成为​任何​东西​。​给​自己​重新​找个​目标​，​好好​过​完​这辈子​吧​。\n"
"xiang3 zuo4 shen2me5 dou1 ke3yi3。ni3men5 xian4zai4 zi4you2 le5。ni3men5 mei2you3 shen2me5“shi3ming4” yao4 cheng2wei2 ren4he2 dong1xi1。gei3 zi4ji3 chong2xin1 zhao3 ge4 mu4biao1，hao3hao3 guo4 wan2 zhe4 bei4 zi3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Whatever your attackers have planned, you won't be able to do much about it from in here. The train is speeding toward the Kreuzbasar station - no more stops between you and the enemy. \n"
"\n"
"Nothing to do but prepare yourself, and wait."
msgstr ""
"无论​对方​有​什么​计划​，​目前​身处​车厢​内​的​你​都​无力​阻止​。​列车​正朝​克洛伊​茨​集市​站​飞驰而去​。​车门​下次​打开​，​便是​见​真章​的​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除了​做好​准备​与​等待​，​别无他法​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 dui4fang1 you3 shen2me5 ji4hua4，mu4qian2 shen1chu3 che1xiang1 nei4 de5 ni3 dou1 wu2li4 zu3zhi3。lie4che1 zheng1 chao2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhan4 fei1 chi2 er2 qu4。che1men2 xia4ci4 da3kai1，bian4shi4 jian4 zhen1 zhang1 de5 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"chu2le5 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4 yu4 deng3dai4，bie2wu2ta1fa3。"

msgid ""
"Whatever's going on here, we have more important things to do than stand "
"around talking about it. Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"不管​这里​发生​了​什么​，​我们​肯定​不能​只是​傻站​在​这里​说话​。​继续前进​吧​。\n"
"bu4guan3 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5，wo3men5 ken3ding4 bu4neng2 zhi3shi4 sha3 zhan4 zai4 zhe4li3 shuo1hua4。ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Whatever's on that chip, these bastards don't want us to read it.\n"
"\n"
"All the more reason to do exactly that. After we put the rest of them in the ground, that is."
msgstr ""
"无论​那​芯片​里​有​什么​，​这些​混蛋​都​不想​让​我们​读取​其​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然如此​，​我们​就​更​要​这么​做​了​。​当然​，​前提​是​先​把​剩下​的​喽啰​都​干掉​。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 na4 xin1pian4 li3 you3 shen2me5，zhe4xie1 hun2dan4 dou1 bu4xiang3 rang4 wo3men5 du2qu3 qi2 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3men5 jiu4 geng1 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5。dang1ran2，qian2ti2 shi4 xian1 ba3 sheng4xia4 de5 lou2luo5 dou1 gan4diao4。"

msgid "Whatever's waiting for us, we can handle it."
msgstr ""
"无论​等待​我们​的​是​什么​，​我们​都​能​应对​。\n"
"wu2lun4 deng3dai4 wo3men5 de5 shi4 shen2me5，wo3men5 dou1 neng2 ying4dui4。"

msgid "Whatever, just hurry your ass up."
msgstr ""
"随便​吧​。​总之​抓紧​点​时间​。\n"
"sui2bian4 ba1。zong3zhi1 zhua1jin3 dian3 shi2jian1。"

msgid "What’s $(l.he) doing?"
msgstr ""
"$(l.he)​在​做​什么​？\n"
"$(l.he) zai4 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid "What’s a forever task?"
msgstr ""
"什么​是​永恒​的​使命​？\n"
"shen2me5 shi4 yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4？"

msgid "What’s done is done."
msgstr ""
"事已至此​。\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3。"

msgid ""
"What’s done is done.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her tone is cool. Seemingly indifferent.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"事已至此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​语气​很淡​定​，​甚至​有些​冷漠​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 hen3 dan4 ding4，shen4zhi4 you3xie1 leng3mo4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "What’s the job?"
msgstr ""
"差事​内容​是​什么​？\n"
"cha4shi4 nei4rong2 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"When APEX went offline, it must have caused physical damage to the estate's "
"security systems.  "
msgstr ""
"APEX​离线​时​一定​对​庄园​的​安保​系统​造成​了​物理​损坏​。\n"
"APEX li2xian4 shi2 yi1ding4 dui4 zhuang1yuan2 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3 zao4cheng2 le5 wu4li3 sun3huai4。"

msgid ""
"When Glory lived here, he had her kill a man for his tri-vid player. How can"
" that be right?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​还​住​在​这里​时​，​哈罗​让​她​杀​了​一个​人​，​只​为​得到​对方​的​3D​影像​机​。​这​怎么​可能​是​正确​的​呢​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 hai2 zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3 shi2，ha1luo2 rang4 ta1 sha1 le5 yi1ge5 ren2，zhi3 wei2 de2dao4 dui4fang1 de5 3D ying3xiang4 ji1。zhe4 zen3me5 ke3neng2 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 ni2？"

msgid "When I do, you'll be the first to know it."
msgstr ""
"我​找到​后​会​立即​告诉​你​的​。\n"
"wo3 zhao3dao4 hou4 hui4 li4ji2 gao4su4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"When I first set out on the path to Free Living, I realized that I'd have to rethink all of my earlier assumptions about life. I'd have to question my own values and beliefs, and I'd need the strength to trust in the answers that came to me.\n"
"\n"
"The prospect was daunting, but it was also necessary. The road to true Freedom is paved with unanswered questions."
msgstr ""
"当​我​第一次​踏上​“​自由​生活​”​之路​时​，​便​意识​到​自己​必须​重新​思考​此前​对​生活​既有​的​全部​认知​。​我​需要​质疑​自身​的​价值观​与​信念​，​更​需要​足够​的​勇气​去​信任​内心​涌现​的​答案​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​前景​令人​望而生畏​，​却​又​势在必行​。​通往​真正​自由​的​道路​，​正是​由​未解​的​疑问​所​铺就​的​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 di4yi1ci4 ta4shang4“zi4you2 sheng1huo2” zhi1 lu4 shi2，bian4 yi4shi2 dao4 zi4ji3 bi4xu1 chong2xin1 si1kao3 ci3qian2 dui4 sheng1huo2 ji4you3 de5 quan2bu4 ren4zhi1。wo3 xu1yao4 zhi4yi2 zi4shen1 de5 jia4zhi2guan1 yu4 xin4nian4，geng1 xu1yao4 zu2gou4 de5 yong3qi4 qu4 xin4ren4 nei4xin1 yong3xian4 de5 da2an4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 qian2jing3 ling4ren2 wang4er2sheng1wei4，que4 you4 shi4zai4bi4xing2。tong1wang3 zhen1zheng4 zi4you2 de5 dao4lu4，zheng4shi4 you2 wei4jie3 de5 yi2wen4 suo3 pu1 jiu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"When I get home, we're going to have a talk about your planning abilities."
msgstr ""
"等​我​回去​之后​，​我们​得​好好​谈谈​你​的​计划​能力​问题​。\n"
"deng3 wo3 hui2qu5 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 de2 hao3hao3 tan2tan2 ni3 de5 ji4hua4 neng2li4 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"When I get my credstick, you get your information.\n"
"\n"
"This is the deal. Take it or leave it."
msgstr ""
"我​拿到​信用​棒​之后​，​你​会​拿到​你​要​的​情报​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这样​。​做​不​做​由​你​说了算​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 na2dao4 xin4yong4 bang4 zhi1hou4，ni3 hui4 na2dao4 ni3 yao4 de5 qing2bao4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4yang4。zuo4 bu4 zuo4 you2 ni3 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid ""
"When I have a run for you, I'll tell you. Until then, don't bug me about it."
msgstr ""
"我​有​差事​的话​会​告诉​你​的​。​在此之前​，​不要​拿​这事烦​我​。\n"
"wo3 you3 cha4shi4 de5hua4 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 de5。zai4ci3zhi1qian2，bu4yao4 na2 zhe4 shi4 fan2 wo3。"

msgid ""
"When I left that room to search for clues, the Engineer told you something. "
"Something that pushed you over the edge."
msgstr ""
"我​离开​房间​寻找​线索​的​时候​，​工程师​跟​你​说​了​点​什么​，​而​这​让​你​情绪​失控​了​。\n"
"wo3 li2kai1 fang2jian1 xun2zhao3 xian4suo3 de5 shi2hou5，gong1cheng2shi1 gen1 ni3 shuo1 le5 dian3 shen2me5，er2 zhe4 rang4 ni3 qing2xu4 shi1kong4 le5。"

msgid ""
"When I lived here, Harrow barely used the thing.\n"
"\n"
"To be honest, I think that he was afraid of it."
msgstr ""
"我​住​在​这里​的​时候​，​哈罗​几乎​不怎么​使用​这​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老实​说​，​我​觉得​他​在​害怕​它​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3 de5 shi2hou5，ha1luo2 ji1hu1 bu4zen3me5 shi3yong4 zhe4 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 jue2de5 ta1 zai4 hai4pa4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"When I took this step, I signed my own death warrant. My employers will bury me.\n"
"\n"
"Unless, of course, you change your mind and bury them first."
msgstr ""
"当​我​迈出​这​一步​时​，​就​等同于​签下​了​自己​的​死亡​判决书​。​我​的​雇主​们​会​活埋​了​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​除非​你​改变​主意​，​先​把​他们​埋​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 mai4chu1 zhe4 yi1 bu4 shi2，jiu4 deng3 tong2 yu2 qian1 xia4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 si3wang2 pan4 jue2 shu1。wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 men5 hui4 huo2mai2 le5 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，chu2fei1 ni3 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5，xian1 ba3 ta1men5 mai2 le5。"

msgid "When I want your opinion, I'll ask for it."
msgstr ""
"需要​你​说话​的​时候​，​我​自然​会​问​。\n"
"xu1yao4 ni3 shuo1hua4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 zi4ran2 hui4 wen4。"

msgid ""
"When I was tired, when I was sad, when I only wanted to sleep, she would "
"tell me that. She told me I would forget. That the pain would go away."
msgstr ""
"当​我​感觉​疲倦​悲伤​、​只想​睡​去​的​时候​，​她​就​会​这么​对​我​说​。​她​说​我​终会​遗忘​。​痛苦​会​消散​。\n"
"dang1 wo3 gan3jue2 pi2juan4 bei1shang1、zhi3 xiang3 shui4 qu4 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 jiu4 hui4 zhe4me5 dui4 wo3 shuo1。ta1 shuo1 wo3 zhong1 hui4 yi2wang4。tong4ku3 hui4 xiao1san4。"

msgid ""
"When I went to work for the Yaks, they offered - no, *insisted* - that I let them ink me. Said I'd need it for the job.\n"
"\n"
"Long story short, the tattoos did boost my abilities, but they also branded me. Marked me as Yakuza property, and gave them an easy way of tracking me from the astral plane."
msgstr ""
"我​当时​去​给​极道​干活​的​时候​，​他们​提出​，​或者说​是​*​坚持​*​要​给​我​纹身​，​说​这​是​差事​需要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​长话短说​，​纹身​确实​提高​了​我​的​能力​，​但​也​给​我​打​上​了​烙印​，​把​我​标记​为​极道​的​资产​，​让​他们​能​轻易​地​从​星界​追踪​到​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 qu4 gei3 ji2dao4 gan4huo2 de5 shi2hou5，ta1men5 ti2chu1，huo4 zhe3 shuo1 shi4*jian1chi2*yao4 gei3 wo3 wen2shen1，shuo1 zhe4 shi4 cha4shi4 xu1yao4。\n"
"\n"
"chang2hua4duan3shuo1，wen2shen1 que4shi2 ti2gao1 le5 wo3 de5 neng2li4，dan4 ye3 gei3 wo3 da3 shang4 le5 lao4yin4，ba3 wo3 biao1ji4 wei2 ji2dao4 de5 zi1chan3，rang4 ta1men5 neng2 qing1yi4 de5 cong2 xing1 jie4 zhui1zong1 dao4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"When I've opened my door, I'll need you to run in and release the lock, then get back out.\n"
"\n"
"Once we've released both locks, you need to get out of there as quickly as possible. I'll lock the place down behind you."
msgstr ""
"等​我​打开​我​负责​的​门​之后​，​你​就​跑​进去​把​锁​关掉​，​然后​再​跑​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​两道​锁​都​解除​之后​，​你们​需要​立刻​离开​那里​。​然后​我会​把​你们​背后​的​门​关上​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 da3kai1 wo3 fu4ze2 de5 men2 zhi1hou4，ni3 jiu4 pao2 jin4qu4 ba3 suo3 guan1diao4，ran2hou4 zai4 pao2 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 liang3 dao4 suo3 dou1 jie3chu2 zhi1hou4，ni3men5 xu1yao4 li4ke4 li2kai1 na4li5。ran2hou4 wo3 hui4 ba3 ni3men5 bei4hou4 de5 men2 guan1shang4。"

msgid ""
"When Monika died, I was pissed. That probably doesn't come as a huge "
"surprise. But I took that anger out on you, and I shouldn't have."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​死​的​时候​，​我​被​愤怒​冲昏​了​头脑​。​这件​事​本身​大概​不足为奇​，​但​我​最后​选择​迁怒于​你​，​我​不该​这么​做​的​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 si3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 bei4 fen4nu4 chong1 hun1 le5 tou2nao3。zhe4 jian4 shi4 ben3shen1 da4gai4 bu4zu2wei2qi2，dan4 wo3 zui4hou4 xuan3ze2 qian1 nu4 yu2 ni3，wo3 bu4gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"When Monika died, you blamed me because I was new to the team. But I'm not "
"Hoffmann, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"莫妮卡​死​的​时候​，​你​把​责任​归咎于​我​，​就​因为​我​是​团队​里​的​新人​。​但​艾格尔​，​我​不是​霍夫曼​。\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 si3 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 ba3 ze2ren4 gui1 jiu4 yu2 wo3，jiu4 yin1wei4 wo3 shi4 tuan2dui4 li3 de5 xin1ren2。dan4 Ai4ge2er3，wo3 bu4shi4 huo4fu1man4。"

msgid ""
"When OTK's next update goes live, our compromised version will be pushed out to Knight Errant.\n"
"\n"
"When you hit the Aztechnology facility, I'll be able to track Knight Errant via their commlinks. This should make the run much more manageable."
msgstr ""
"当​OTK​的​下次​更新​上线​时​，​这个​被​篡改​过​的​版本​就​会​被​推送​给​游侠​骑士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等到​你们​袭击​阿兹特​科技​设施​的​时候​，​我​就​可以​通过​游侠​骑士​的​通讯​链路​追踪​其​动向​。​这​应该​能​让​行动​顺利​得​多​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 OTK de5 xia4ci4 geng1xin1 shang4xian4 shi2，zhe4ge5 bei4 cuan4gai3 guo4 de5 ban3ben3 jiu4 hui4 bei4 tui1song4 gei3 you2Xia2qi2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"deng3dao4 ni3men5 xi2ji1 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 jiu4 ke3yi3 tong1guo4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4lu4 zhui1zong1 qi2 dong4xiang4。zhe4 ying1gai1 neng2 rang4 xing2dong4 shun4li4 de2 duo1。"

msgid "When a Great Dragon falls, the sound resonates across time and space."
msgstr ""
"一条​巨龙​陨落​之​时​，​那​声音​会​在​整个​时​空中​回荡​。\n"
"yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yun3luo4 zhi1 shi2，na4 sheng1yin1 hui4 zai4 zheng3ge4 shi2 kong1zhong1 hui2dang4。"

msgid ""
"When a critical mass of carriers is achieved, my Panacea will become unstoppable. It will spread across the globe in a relentless tide. \n"
"\n"
"However, if it does *not* reach this critical mass, it will fizzle. Die out. Become inert."
msgstr ""
"当​载体​数量​达到​临界值​时​，​我​的​“​万能​药​”​将​以​势不可挡​的​浪潮​席卷​全球​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然而​，​如果​它​*​未能​*​达到​这一​临界值​，​就​将​逐渐​消散​。​减退​。​变得​无害​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 zai4ti3 shu4liang4 da2dao4 lin2 jie4 zhi2 shi2，wo3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4” jiang1 yi3 shi4bu4ke3dang3 de5 lang4chao2 xi2juan3 quan2qiu2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2er2，ru2guo3 ta1*wei4neng2*da2dao4 zhe4 yi1 lin2 jie4 zhi2，jiu4 jiang1 zhu2jian4 xiao1san4。jian3tui4。bian4de5 wu2hai4。"

msgid ""
"When a dragon falls, the sound resonates across time and space.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her expression slackens, becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Within three cycles, what the world has lost, it shall rue. But the Ice Storm will come, the Codex will be broken, and woe to the Dancer.\n"
"\n"
"This I prophesy."
msgstr ""
"一条​巨龙​陨落​之​时​，​那​声音​会​在​整个​时​空中​回荡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​表情​松弛下来​，​变得​恍惚​不定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​三次​循环​之内​，​世间​所失​，​终将​悔恨​。​但​冰暴​将会​降临​、​法典​将​受​毁坏​、​舞者​将​遭​厄运​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此​乃​吾​之​预言​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yun3luo4 zhi1 shi2，na4 sheng1yin1 hui4 zai4 zheng3ge4 shi2 kong1zhong1 hui2dang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，bian4de5 huang3hu1 bu4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"san1ci4 xun2huan2 zhi1nei4，shi4jian1 suo3 shi1，zhong1 jiang1 hui3hen4。dan4 bing1 bao4 jiang1hui4 jiang4lin2、fa3dian3 jiang1 shou4 hui3huai4、wu3zhe3 jiang1 zao1 e4yun4。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 nai3 wu2 zhi1 yu4yan2。"

msgid "When a dragon falls, the sound resonates across time and space. "
msgstr ""
"一条​巨龙​陨落​之​时​，​那​声音​会​在​整个​时​空中​回荡​。\n"
"yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yun3luo4 zhi1 shi2，na4 sheng1yin1 hui4 zai4 zheng3ge4 shi2 kong1zhong1 hui2dang4。"

msgid ""
"When comparing the results of my own magical research to Dr. Okinyi's observations, an unsettling picture begins to emerge. As I reported in the last edition of SMQ, the magical background count of the world is rising. And the more mana that saturates our environment, the more of these strange creatures we see.\n"
"\n"
"These things - whatever they are - are multiplying. And they're getting bigger."
msgstr ""
"将​我​自己​的​魔法​研究成果​与​奥​基尼​博士​的​观察​数据​进行​比​对​时​，​一个​令人不安​的​景象​逐渐​浮现​。​正如​我​在​SMQ​上期​所述​，​世界​的​魔法​背景​数值​正在​攀升​。​而​当​环境​中​饱和​的​魔力​愈发​浓厚​，​我们​目睹​的​这些​奇异​生物​便​愈发​频繁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​东西​—​—​无论​它们​究竟​是​什么​—​—​正在​不断​繁殖​。​而且​体型​也​日益​庞大​。\n"
"\n"
"jiang1 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 mo2fa3 yan2 jiu1 cheng2 guo3 yu4 ao4 ji1 ni2 bo2shi4 de5 guan1cha2 shu4ju4 jin4xing2 bi3 dui4 shi2，yi1ge5 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 jing3xiang4 zhu2jian4 fu2xian4。zheng4ru2 wo3 zai4 SMQ shang4qi1 suo3 shu4，shi4jie4 de5 mo2fa3 bei4jing3 shu4zhi2 zheng4zai4 pan1sheng1。er2 dang1 huan2jing4 zhong4 bao3he2 de5 mo2li4 yu4fa1 nong2hou4，wo3men5 mu4du3 de5 zhe4xie1 qi2yi4 sheng1wu4 bian4 yu4fa1 pin2fan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 dong1xi1——wu2lun4 ta1men5 jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5——zheng4zai4 bu4duan4 fan2zhi2。er2qie3 ti3xing2 ye3 ri4yi4 pang2da4。"

msgid "When did you lose it? Before or after we killed the Spirit?"
msgstr ""
"你​什么​时候​把​它​弄​丢​的​？​是​在​我们​杀死​那个​精魂​之前​还是​之后​？\n"
"ni3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 ba3 ta1 long4 diu1 de5？shi4 zai4 wo3men5 sha1si3 na4ge5 jing1hun2 zhi1qian2 hai2shi5 zhi1hou4？"

msgid "When does she want to meet?"
msgstr ""
"她​想​什么​时候​见面​？\n"
"ta1 xiang3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 jian4mian4？"

msgid "When have I ever judged?"
msgstr ""
"我​什么​时候​评判​过​？\n"
"wo3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 ping2pan4 guo4？"

msgid ""
"When he finds out what happened on the run, he's probably gonna rabbit. We "
"need to chase him down before that happens."
msgstr ""
"等​他​知道​这次​行动​中​发生​的​事后​，​八成​会​溜之大吉​。​我们​必须​在​那​之前​抓住​他​。\n"
"deng3 ta1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 zhong4 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4hou4，ba1cheng2 hui4 liu1zhi1da4ji2。wo3men5 bi4xu1 zai4 na4 zhi1qian2 zhua1zhu4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"When he said that this was custom, he wasn't kidding.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Gingerly, she reaches into the bag and pulls out a sleek, angular shape.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"他​确实​没​开玩笑​，​这​绝对​是​自制​改装​的​好​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​小心翼翼​地​把手​伸进​袋子​，​掏出​一件​棱角分明​的​流线型​物品​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ta1 que4shi2 mei2 kai1wan2xiao4，zhe4 jue2dui4 shi4 zi4zhi4 gai3zhuang1 de5 hao3 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao3xin1yi4yi4 de5 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 dai4zi5，tao1chu1 yi1 jian4 leng2 jiao3 fen4 ming2 de5 liu2xian4xing2 wu4pin3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"When it was over - you know, when the air cooled down...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The reporter nods, and the man continues.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...We stepped outside."
msgstr ""
"事情​结束​之后​，​也​就是​高温​消散​之后​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​记者​点点头​，​男人​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​我们​出去​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 jie2shu4 zhi1hou4，ye3 jiu4shi4 gao1wen1 xiao1san4 zhi1hou4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ji4zhe3 dian3 dian3 tou2，nan2ren2 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……wo3men5 chu1qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"When she awoke from her long slumber in 2012 and saw what the world had become - what metahumanity had done to the garden she had tended for Great Ages - she struck.\n"
"\n"
"Struck with the rage, regret, frustration, and anguish of a mother whose children had played with fire and burned the house down, killing themselves in the blaze. \n"
"\n"
"She unleashed fire and death through her tears."
msgstr ""
"2012​年​，​她​从​长眠​中​苏醒​，​目睹​了​世界​沦为​何等​模样​—​—​泛​人类​正在​糟蹋​她​精心照料​了​数个​纪元​的​花园​。​于是​她​选择​出手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​带​着​一位​母亲​的​愤怒​、​悔恨​、​挫败​与​痛苦​。​她​的​孩子​们​玩火​，​焚毁​了​家园​，​最终​葬身火海​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​流着泪​降下​烈火​与​死亡​。\n"
"\n"
"2012 nian2，ta1 cong2 chang2mian2 zhong4 su1xing3，mu4du3 le5 shi4jie4 lun2wei2 he2deng3 mu2yang4——fan4 ren2lei4 zheng4zai4 zao1ta4 ta1 jing1 xin1 zhao4 liao4 le5 shu3 ge4 ji4yuan2 de5 hua1yuan2。yu2shi4 ta1 xuan3ze2 chu1shou3。\n"
"\n"
"dai4 zhao2 yi1 wei4 mu3qin1 de5 fen4nu4、hui3hen4、cuo4bai4 yu4 tong4ku3。ta1 de5 hai2zi5 men5 wan2huo3，fen2hui3 le5 jia1yuan2，zui4zhong1 zang4 shen1 huo3 hai3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 liu2 zhao2 lei4 jiang4xia4 lie4huo3 yu4 si3wang2。"

msgid "When she left, she said that she'd be back in ten minutes."
msgstr ""
"她​走​的​时候​说​自己​十分钟​之内​就​能​回来​。\n"
"ta1 zou3 de5 shi2hou5 shuo1 zi4ji3 shi2 fen4 zhong1 zhi1nei4 jiu4 neng2 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"When she was killed, it left an opening for others. It would have meant bloodshed and pain, if this “council” had been allowed to continue their plan. But they did not. \n"
"\n"
"We saw to it, you and I."
msgstr ""
"她​的​死​为​心怀​不轨之徒​留下​了​机会​。​倘若​任由​这个​“​委员会​”​继续​实施​计划​，​必将​引发​血腥​与​痛苦​。​但​他们​没有​得逞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​你​和​我​亲手​阻止​了​这​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 si3 wei2 xin1huai2 bu4 gui3 zhi1 tu2 liu2xia4 le5 ji1hui4。tang3ruo4 ren4you2 zhe4ge5“wei3yuan2hui4” ji4xu4 shi2shi1 ji4hua4，bi4jiang1 yin3fa1 xue4xing1 yu4 tong4ku3。dan4 ta1men5 mei2you3 de2cheng3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3 he4 wo3 qin1shou3 zu3zhi3 le5 zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"When the attackers came, we all took refuge in the $(l.name) Civic Center. Its strong walls and sturdy gate kept us all safe from harm.\n"
"\n"
"Had our people been on the street... had they been in our old building, which came under fire during the attack... none of them would be alive."
msgstr ""
"袭击者​到来​时​，​我们​都​躲​进​了​$(l.name)​市民​中心​。​它​坚固​的​墙壁​和​大门​保护​了​我们​所有人​的​安全​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​的​人​当时​在​街上​……​如果​他们​当时​在​我们​的​旧楼​里​遭到​袭击​……​他们​肯定​活​不​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"xi2ji1zhe3 dao4lai2 shi2，wo3men5 dou1 duo3 jin4 le5 $(l.name) shi4min2 zhong1xin1。ta1 jian1gu4 de5 qiang2bi4 he4 da4men2 bao3hu4 le5 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 de5 an1quan2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 de5 ren2 dang1shi2 zai4 jie1shang5……ru2guo3 ta1men5 dang1shi2 zai4 wo3men5 de5 jiu4 lou2 li3 zao1dao4 xi2ji1……ta1men5 ken3ding4 huo2 bu4 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"When the door locks disarm, we make a break for it. Until then, we make them"
" pay for Monika."
msgstr ""
"开门​之后​，​我们​就​立刻​撤退​。​在此之前​，​就​跟​他们​好好​算一算​莫妮卡​的​这笔​帐​吧​。\n"
"kai1men2 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 jiu4 li4ke4 che4tui4。zai4ci3zhi1qian2，jiu4 gen1 ta1men5 hao3hao3 suan4 yi1 suan4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 zhe4 bi3 zhang4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"When the job is done, I'll be back. That's a promise.\n"
"\n"
"I can't say how long it'll take, but you're going to see me again. I *will* come back to this team."
msgstr ""
"我​忙​完​就​会​回来​，​我​保证​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽然​说​不准​要​多久​，​但​我们​会​再见面​的​，​我​*​一定​*​会​回到​队伍​里​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mang2 wan2 jiu4 hui4 hui2lai5，wo3 bao3zheng4。\n"
"\n"
"sui1ran2 shuo1 bu4zhun3 yao4 duo1jiu3，dan4 wo3men5 hui4 zai4 jian4 mian4 de5，wo3*yi1ding4*hui4 hui2dao4 dui4wu3 li3。"

msgid ""
"When the most important thing is drones. Grants +1 Drone Control and +1 "
"Drone Combat."
msgstr ""
"当​无人机​是​重中之重​的​时候​。​提供​+​1​无人机​控制​和​+​1​无人机​战斗​。\n"
"dang1 wu2ren2ji1 shi4 zhong4zhong1zhi1zhong4 de5 shi2hou5。ti2gong1 +1 wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4 he4 +1 wu2ren2ji1 zhan4dou4。"

msgid ""
"When the shooting started, I shut myself in here. They - whoever they are - haven't figured out how to override my keys yet.\n"
"\n"
"It's been a day and a half... I don't know how much longer I can stay in here."
msgstr ""
"外头​有枪​声响​起来​的​时候​，​我​就​把​自己​关​在​这儿​了​。​我​不​知道​对方​是​谁​，​但​反正​他们​暂时​还​没​搞​明白​怎么​改掉​我​的​密码​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​已经​一天​半​了​……​我​不​知道​我​还​能​在​这儿​待​多久​。\n"
"\n"
"wai4tou5 you3 qiang1 sheng1xiang3 qi3lai5 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 jiu4 ba3 zi4ji3 guan1 zai4 zhe4r5 le5。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 dui4fang1 shi4 shei2，dan4 fan3zheng4 ta1men5 zan4shi2 hai2 mei2 gao3 ming2bai5 zen3me5 gai3diao4 wo3 de5 mi4ma3。\n"
"\n"
"yi3jing1 yi1 tian1 ban4 le5……wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 hai2 neng2 zai4 zhe4r5 dai1 duo1jiu3。"

msgid ""
"When they took me, they confiscated my gear. I saw them stash it behind a vent in the garage before they dragged me in here.\n"
"\n"
"I don't need it. It'd only slow me down."
msgstr ""
"他们​抓走​我时​没收​了​我​的​装备​。​我​看见​他们​把​装备​藏​在​车库​通风口​后面​，​然后​才​把​我​拖进​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​用不上​那些​东西​了​。​那​只会​拖慢​我​的​速度​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zhua1zou3 wo3 shi2 mo4shou1 le5 wo3 de5 zhuang1bei4。wo3 kan4jian4 ta1men5 ba3 zhuang1bei4 zang4 zai4 che1ku4 tong1feng1kou3 hou4mian5，ran2hou4 cai2 ba3 wo3 tuo1jin4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yong4 bu4 shang4 na4xie1 dong1xi1 le5。na4 zhi3 hui4 tuo1man4 wo3 de5 su4du4。"

msgid "When triggered the drone repairs it's most recent damage."
msgstr ""
"触发​后​修复​无人机​最近​一次​受到​的​伤害​。\n"
"chu4fa1 hou4 xiu1fu4 wu2ren2ji1 zui4jin4 yi1ci4 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"When triggered, Accuracy is increased by 6%, and incoming DMG is increased "
"by 3 for 3 RNDS of combat."
msgstr ""
"启动​后​，​命中率​提升​6​%​，​增加​3​点​受到​的​伤害​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"qi3dong4 hou4，ming4zhong4lu:4 ti2sheng1 6 %，zeng1jia1 3 dian3 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"When triggered, gain +1 AP but take an additional 2 DMG from attacks. Lasts "
"3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"触发​时​，​获得​+​1​行动​点​，​但​受到​攻击​时​额外​承受​2​点​伤害​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"chu4fa1 shi2，huo4de2 +1 xing2dong4 dian3，dan4 shou4dao4 gong1ji1 shi2 e2wai4 cheng2shou4 2 dian3 shang1hai4。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid "When triggered, gain +1 AP. Lasts 3 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"触发​时​，​获得​+​1​行动​点​。​持续​3​回合​。\n"
"chu4fa1 shi2，huo4de2 +1 xing2dong4 dian3。chi2xu4 3 hui2he2。"

msgid "When triggered, gain +1 AP. Lasts 4 RNDS."
msgstr ""
"触发​时​，​获得​+​1​行动​点​。​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"chu4fa1 shi2，huo4de2 +1 xing2dong4 dian3。chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"When triggered, incoming DMG reduced by 3 and Strength reduced by 1 for 4 "
"RNDS of combat."
msgstr ""
"启动​后​，​降低​1​点​力量​，​减少​3​点​受到​的​伤害​。​持续​4​回合​。\n"
"qi3dong4 hou4，jiang4di1 1 dian3 li4liang5，jian3shao3 3 dian3 shou4dao4 de5 shang1hai4。chi2xu4 4 hui2he2。"

msgid ""
"When we decided to sign on with Aztechnology, we talked this over. We knew the company's reputation, and I said that I could handle whatever came my way. But this...\n"
"\n"
"I don't know, Katja. This last order crossed a line.\n"
"\n"
"What would the research team need with a bulk order of gags, restraints, and five hundred liters of hydrochloric acid?"
msgstr ""
"当​我们​决定​为​阿兹特​科技​工作​的​时候​，​我们​就此​商量​过​。​我们​知道​这家​公司​的​名声​，​而​我​说​过​不管​发生​什么​事​我​都​能​应付​。​但​这个​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​，​卡特​亚​。​最近​这份​订单​跨过​底线​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​研究​团队​为何​需要​大批量​订购​塞口球​、​束缚​带​，​甚至​还有​500​升​的​盐酸​？\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3men5 jue2ding4 wei2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 gong1zuo4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 jiu4ci3 shang1liang5 guo4。wo3men5 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jia1 gong1si1 de5 ming2sheng1，er2 wo3 shuo1 guo4 bu4guan3 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 shi4 wo3 dou1 neng2 ying4fu5。dan4 zhe4ge5……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，ka3te4 ya4。zui4jin4 zhe4 fen4 ding4dan1 kua4guo4 di3xian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yan2jiu1 tuan2dui4 wei4he2 xu1yao4 dai4 pi1 liang2 ding4gou4 se4 kou3 qiu2、shu4fu4 dai4，shen4zhi4 hai2you3 500 sheng1 de5 yan2suan1？"

msgid "When we finally kill you, Vauclair, I'm going to *enjoy* it."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​，​等​我们​最终​弄死​你​的​时候​，​我会​*​好好​享受​*​的​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3，deng3 wo3men5 zui4zhong1 nong4si3 ni3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 hui4*hao3hao3 xiang3shou4*de5。"

msgid ""
"When we get through with this run, I'm gonna tell my handler all about you.\n"
"\n"
"You won't work for the Lodge again. Not because you're an incompetent leader, but because I have pull, and I don't like you very much.\n"
"\n"
"What do you have to say about that?"
msgstr ""
"等​这次​行动​结束​，​我要​把​我​对​你​的​所见所闻​全​告诉​我​的​上级​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​再也​别想​为​“​结社​”​工作​了​。​不是​因为​你​是​个​无能​的​领队​，​而是​因为​我​有人​脉​，​而且​我​实在​看不上​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​对此​有​什么​话​说​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"deng3 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 jie2shu4，wo3 yao4 ba3 wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 suo3jian4suo3wen2 quan2 gao4su4 wo3 de5 shang4ji2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4ye3 bie4 xiang3 wei2“jie2she4” gong1zuo4 le5。bu4shi4 yin1wei4 ni3 shi4 ge4 wu2neng2 de5 ling3dui4，er2shi4 yin1wei4 wo3 you3ren2 mai4，er2qie3 wo3 shi2zai4 kan4 bu4 shang4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 shen2me5 hua4 shuo1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"When we rallied to fight the racists, my followers came along for the ride. Bunch 'o young kids, all full of piss 'n' vinegar 'n' the immortality of youth.\n"
"\n"
"I was full of that good ol' Dragonslayer spirit, pissed off and itchin' for a fight. And so I led those kids into the fray. They waded into the riot right alongside me, yellin' and screamin' with their fists in the air."
msgstr ""
"当​我们​团结起来​对抗​种族主义者​时​，​我​的​追随者​们​也​跟着​来​了​。​一群​毛头小子​，​个个​满腔热血​，​洋溢着​青春活力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屠龙​者​的​精魄​在​我​胸腔​中​回荡​，​怒火中烧​，​渴望​战斗​。​我​就​这么​带​着​一帮​年轻人​突入​乱局​。​他们​与​我​并肩作战​，​一边​挥舞​着​拳头​，​一边​嘶吼​尖叫​着​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3men5 tuan2 jie1 qi3 lai2 dui4kang4 zhong3zu2zhu3yi4zhe3 shi2，wo3 de5 zhui1sui2zhe3 men5 ye3 gen1zhe5 lai2 le5。yi1 qun2 mao2 tou2 xiao3 zi3，ge4ge4 man3 qiang1 re4 xie3，yang2 yi4 zhao2 qing1 chun1 huo2 li4。\n"
"\n"
"tu2 long2 zhe3 de5 jing1 po4 zai4 wo3 xiong1qiang1 zhong4 hui2dang4，nu4 huo3 zhong4 shao1，ke3wang4 zhan4dou4。wo3 jiu4 zhe4me5 dai4 zhao2 yi1 bang1 nian2qing1ren2 tu1 ru4 luan4ju2。ta1men5 yu4 wo3 bing4jian1zuo4zhan4，yi1bian1 hui1wu3 zhao2 quan2tou5，yi1bian1 si1hou3 jian1jiao4 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"When we reach Vauclair, I'll keep his security off of you. The old man is "
"all yours."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​找到​沃​克莱尔​后​，​我会​负责​收拾​他​的​安保​部队​。​那个​老头​就​归​你​处置​了​。\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 hou4，wo3 hui4 fu4ze2 shou1shi5 ta1 de5 an1bao3 bu4dui4。na4ge5 lao3tou2 jiu4 gui1 ni3 chu3zhi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"When we reach Vauclair, I'll take him out. He'll never know what hit him."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​找到​沃​克莱尔​后​，​我会​干掉​他​。​最好​是​杀​他​一个​措手不及​。\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 hou4，wo3 hui4 gan4diao4 ta1。zui4hao3 shi4 sha1 ta1 yi1ge5 cuo4shou3bu4ji2。"

msgid ""
"When we roll up on the meeting site, be ready. We may need the element of "
"surprise if negotiations go south."
msgstr ""
"我们​到​约定​地点​之后​，​做好​准备​。​如果​谈判​破裂​的话​，​我们​得​提前​留好​后手​。\n"
"wo3men5 dao4 yue1ding4 di4dian3 zhi1hou4，zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。ru2guo3 tan2pan4 po4lie4 de5hua4，wo3men5 de2 ti2qian2 liu2 hao3 hou4shou3。"

msgid ""
"When we're talking about tech, it might as well. I'm sure that Maliit has a "
"whole warehouse full of drones that could outperform this thing."
msgstr ""
"说​到​科技​产品​，​这倒​也​说​得通​。​我​敢肯定​玛丽​特​的​仓库​里​堆满​了​性能​远超​这​玩意儿​的​无人机​。\n"
"shuo1 dao4 ke1ji4 chan3pin3，zhe4 dao3 ye3 shuo1 de2 tong1。wo3 gan3 ken3 ding4 ma3li4 te4 de5 cang1ku4 li3 dui1man3 le5 xing4neng2 yuan3chao1 zhe4 wan2yi4r5 de5 wu2ren2ji1。"

msgid "When were you in Tokyo?"
msgstr ""
"你​什么​时候​去过​东京​？\n"
"ni3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 qu4 guo4 dong1jing1？"

msgid ""
"When you are ready to start looking, you can call on me for help. I've got "
"your back, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"等​你​准备​开始​的​时候​，​可以​来​找​我​帮忙​。​我会​支持​你​的​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"deng3 ni3 zhun3bei4 kai1shi3 de5 shi2hou5，ke3yi3 lai2 zhao3 wo3 bang1mang2。wo3 hui4 zhi1chi2 ni3 de5，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid ""
"When you described this run to me, you left out the part where we planted a "
"bomb. That's a hell of an omission."
msgstr ""
"你​向​我​描述​这次​行动​时​，​漏掉​了​我们​要​安装​炸弹​的​部分​。​这​未免​差得​也​太​多​了​吧​。\n"
"ni3 xiang4 wo3 miao2shu4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 shi2，lou4diao4 le5 wo3men5 yao4 an1zhuang1 zha4dan4 de5 bu4fen5。zhe4 wei4mian3 cha4 de2 ye3 tai4 duo1 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"When you get back, you'll have to tell me about it over drinks. I'll buy."
msgstr ""
"等​你​回来​，​咱们​边​喝边​聊​，​我​请客​。\n"
"deng3 ni3 hui2lai5，zan2men5 bian1 he4 bian1 liao2，wo3 qing3ke4。"

msgid ""
"When you get to the hospital, people are going to have questions.\n"
"\n"
"What are you going to tell them?"
msgstr ""
"你​这个​样子​去​医院​，​别人​肯定​会​问​你​发生​了​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​打算​怎么​回答​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4ge5 yang4zi5 qu4 yi1yuan4，bie2ren5 ken3ding4 hui4 wen4 ni3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 da3suan4 zen3me5 hui2da2？"

msgid ""
"When you killed Harrow, your hand was on fire. Call me crazy, but I don't "
"think it's supposed to do that."
msgstr ""
"你​杀​了​哈罗​的​时候​，​你​的​手​在​着火​。​不管​你​怎么​想​，​但​我​觉得​这​不合​常理​。\n"
"ni3 sha1 le5 ha1luo2 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 de5 shou3 zai4 zhao2huo3。bu4guan3 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3，dan4 wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 bu4he2 chang2li3。"

msgid ""
"When you lived with us, you didn't think it was wrong. You *loved* it here. \n"
"\n"
"You can rewrite history to cast yourself as the victim if you want to. If demonizing me helps, you can do that, too. But nobody ever forced you to do anything, Glory."
msgstr ""
"当初​你​和​我们​生活​在​一起​时​，​你​并​不​觉得​这有​什么​不​对​。​你​*​爱​*​这个​地方​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​尽管​可以​改写​历史​，​把​自己​塑造成​受害者​。​如果​将​我​妖魔化​对此​有​帮助​的话​，​你​也​可以​这么​做​。​但格洛丽​，​从来​没有​人​强迫​你​做​任何​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1chu1 ni3 he4 wo3men5 sheng1huo2 zai4 yi1qi3 shi2，ni3 bing4 bu4 jue2de5 zhe4 you3 shen2me5 bu4 dui4。ni3*ai4*zhe4ge5 di4fang1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jin3guan3 ke3yi3 gai3xie3 li4shi3，ba3 zi4ji3 su4 zao4 cheng2 shou4hai4zhe3。ru2guo3 jiang1 wo3 yao1mo2hua4 dui4 ci3 you3 bang1zhu4 de5hua4，ni3 ye3 ke3yi3 zhe4me5 zuo4。dan4 Ge2luo4li2，cong2lai2 mei2you3 ren2 qiang3po4 ni3 zuo4 ren4he2 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"When you play the sixth track, a small video window appears. \n"
"\n"
"You recognize the scene in the window: you are looking at the tattered drapes and nicotine-stained wallpaper of Winters' hotel room at Das Kesselhaus.\n"
"\n"
"The timestamp on the video reads 2054-11-10."
msgstr ""
"你​开始​播放​第六卷​录像​时​，​出现​了​一个​小视频​窗口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​认出​了​其中​的​场景​：​这是​温特斯​在​“​锅炉房​”​旅馆​房间​里​破旧​的​窗帘​和​沾满​尼古丁​的​墙纸​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​视频​上​的​时间​戳​显示​为​2054​-​11​-​10​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kai1shi3 bo1fang4 di4 liu4 juan3 lu4xiang4 shi2，chu1xian4 le5 yi1ge5 xiao3 shi4 pin2 chuang1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ren4chu1 le5 qi2zhong1 de5 chang3jing3：zhe4 shi4 Wen1te4si1 zai4“Guo1lu2fang2” lu:3guan3 fang2jian1 li3 po4jiu4 de5 chuang1lian2 he4 zhan1man3 ni2gu3ding1 de5 qiang2zhi3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4pin2 shang4 de5 shi2jian1 chuo1 xian3shi4 wei2 2054-11-10。"

msgid ""
"When you produce the chip, the Engineer's eyes widen slightly. He turns his "
"head, and coughs wrack his body."
msgstr ""
"当​你​拿出​芯片​时​，​工程师​的​眼睛​微微​睁​大​。​他​转过​头​，​咳嗽​使​他​的​身体​剧烈​震动​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 na2chu1 xin1pian4 shi2，gong1cheng2shi1 de5 yan3jing5 wei1wei1 zheng1 dai4。ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2，ke2sou5 shi3 ta1 de5 shen1ti3 ju4lie4 zhen4dong4。"

msgid ""
"When you say \"the young,\" how young do you mean? I need to know what we're"
" walking into."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​“​年轻人​”​是​什么​意思​？​我​需要​知道​我们​要​对付​的​到底​是​什么​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5“nian2qing1ren2” shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？wo3 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"When you struggle your way back to consciousness, you find yourself lying in a heap on the ground.\n"
"\n"
"Absinthe offers a hand to help you to your feet."
msgstr ""
"当​你​挣扎​着​恢复​意识​时​，​发现自己​已经​瘫倒​在​地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​苦艾​酒​伸出手​来​扶​你​起身​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zheng1zha2 zhao2 hui1fu4 yi4shi2 shi2，fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 yi3jing1 tan1 dao3 zai4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ku3ai4 jiu3 shen1 chu1 shou3 lai2 fu2 ni3 qi3shen1。"

msgid ""
"When you walk through a dark alley on your way home from the market, what do you fear?\n"
"\n"
"The mongrel ORK and the savage TROLL, lying in wait to rob you of your hard-earned gains."
msgstr ""
"你​从​市场​回家​穿过​黑暗​的​小巷​，​你​最​害怕​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​那些​杂种​兽​人​和​野蛮​巨魔​！​他们​正​埋伏​着​要​抢走​你​的​血汗钱​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cong2 shi4chang3 hui2jia1 chuan1guo4 hei1an4 de5 xiao3xiang4，ni3 zui4 hai4pa4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 na4xie1 za2zhong3 shou4 ren2 he4 ye3man2 ju4mo2！ta1men5 zheng1 mai2fu2 zhao2 yao4 qiang3zou3 ni3 de5 xue4han4qian2。"

msgid ""
"When you’re finished reading it over, say “Alice, I’m done,” and we can "
"continue."
msgstr ""
"读完​之后​请​说​“​爱丽丝​，​我​读完​了​”​，​然后​我们​就​可以​继续​了​。\n"
"dou4 wan2 zhi1hou4 qing3 shuo1“ai4li4si1，wo3 dou4 wan2 le5”，ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 ji4xu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Whenever I hear, “the body was never recovered,” I immediately think, “faked"
" her own death.”"
msgstr ""
"每当​我​听到​“​尸体​未被发现​”​时​，​我​就​会​立即​联想​到​“​她​伪造​了​自己​的​死亡​”​。\n"
"mei3dang1 wo3 ting1dao4“shi1ti3 wei4 bei4 fa1 xian4” shi2，wo3 jiu4 hui4 li4ji2 lian2xiang3 dao4“ta1 wei3zao4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 si3wang2”。"

msgid ""
"Whenever we weren't playing, I was living up to our fans' expectations... spoutin' off, gettin' into fights, gettin' drunk, gettin' laid.\n"
"\n"
"Not a bad life, all things considered."
msgstr ""
"至于​不​演出​的​时候​，​我​也​算​没有​辜负​粉丝​的​期待​……​满嘴​跑​火车​，​惹是生非​，​酗酒​狂欢​，​寻欢作乐​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总的来看​，​生活​还​算是​不错​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 bu4 yan3chu1 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 ye3 suan4 mei2you3 gu1fu4 fen3si1 de5 qi1dai4……man3zui3 pao2 huo3che1，re3shi4sheng1fei1，xu4jiu3 kuang2huan1，xun2huan1zuo4le4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3 de5 lai2 kan4，sheng1huo2 hai2 suan4shi4 bu4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Where Glory's burning claw makes contact, Harrow's flesh bubbles and bursts. She rakes his chest, then plunges a pair of razor-tipped fingers into his eyes.\n"
" \n"
"His final screams are inhuman, like something out of a nightmare. Glory shakes her hand free, and his seared body tumbles to the floor."
msgstr ""
"当格洛丽​的​灼热​利爪​触​碰到​哈罗​的​皮肤​时​，​他​的​血肉​便​开始​翻腾​爆裂​。​她​先是​撕开​他​的​胸膛​，​然后​将​指尖​的​利刃​插进​他​的​双眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​最后​的​惨叫声​非人​非鬼​，​宛如​噩梦​中​的​呓语​。​格洛丽​将​手​一​甩​，​哈罗​被​烧焦​的​尸体​便​颓然​倒​在​地上​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 Ge2luo4li2 de5 zhuo2re4 li4zhao3 chu4 peng4dao4 ha1luo2 de5 pi2fu1 shi2，ta1 de5 xue4rou4 bian4 kai1shi3 fan1teng2 bao4lie4。ta1 xian1 shi4 si1 kai1 ta1 de5 xiong1tang2，ran2hou4 jiang1 zhi3jian1 de5 li4ren4 cha1jin4 ta1 de5 shuang1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zui4hou4 de5 can3 jiao4 sheng1 fei1ren2 fei1 gui3，wan3ru2 e4meng4 zhong4 de5 yi4yu3。Ge2luo4li2 jiang1 shou3 yi1 shuai3，ha1luo2 bei4 shao1jiao1 de5 shi1ti3 bian4 tui2ran2 dao3 zai4 di4shang5。"

msgid "Where am I?"
msgstr ""
"我​在​哪里​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 na3li3？"

msgid "Where are the remains of the parchment?"
msgstr ""
"那​残余​的​羊皮纸​在​哪​？\n"
"na4 can2yu2 de5 yang2pi2zhi3 zai4 na3？"

msgid "Where are you from?"
msgstr ""
"你​是从​哪来​的​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 cong2 na3 lai2 de5？"

msgid "Where are you hit?"
msgstr ""
"你​哪里​受伤​了​？\n"
"ni3 na3li3 shou4shang1 le5？"

msgid "Where can I find him?"
msgstr ""
"我​上​哪儿​能​找到​他​？\n"
"wo3 shang4 na3r5 neng2 zhao3dao4 ta1？"

msgid "Where can I sell paydata found on a run?"
msgstr ""
"我​在​差事​中​找到​的​值钱​数据​要​去​哪​卖​？\n"
"wo3 zai4 cha4shi4 zhong4 zhao3dao4 de5 zhi2qian2 shu4ju4 yao4 qu4 na3 mai4？"

msgid "Where do I need to go?"
msgstr ""
"我要​去​哪里​？\n"
"wo3 yao4 qu4 na3li3？"

msgid "Where does the woman sit?"
msgstr ""
"那​女人​坐在​哪里​？\n"
"na4 nu:3ren2 zuo4 zai4 na3li3？"

msgid "Where is Vauclair?"
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​在​哪​？\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 zai4 na3？"

msgid "Where is he? I don't see a body anywhere..."
msgstr ""
"他​在​哪里​？​我​没​看到​有​什么​尸体​……\n"
"ta1 zai4 na3li3？wo3 mei2 kan4dao4 you3 shen2me5 shi1ti3……"

msgid ""
"Where necessary, competitors' products have been incorporated into the platform (ARES DERMAL PLATING, UNIVERSAL OMNITECH MOVE-BY-WIRE, etc.).\n"
"\n"
"These systems should be considered PLACEHOLDERS for this proof-of-concept PROTOTYPE."
msgstr ""
"本​平台​在​必要​处​整合​了​部分​竞品​（​阿瑞斯​的​仿真​皮肤​镀层​，​环球​全能​科技​的​跳线​回路​等​）​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​系统​应​被​视为​该​概念​验证​原型机​的​临时​替代​内容​。\n"
"\n"
"ben3 ping2tai2 zai4 bi4yao4 chu3 zheng3he2 le5 bu4fen5 jing4pin3 （a1rui4si1 de5 fang3zhen1 pi2fu1 du4ceng2，huan2qiu2 quan2neng2 ke1ji4 de5 tiao4 xian4 hui2lu4 deng3）。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 xi4tong3 ying1 bei4 shi4wei2 gai1 gai4nian4 yan4zheng4 yuan2 xing2 ji1 de5 lin2shi2 ti4dai4 nei4rong2。"

msgid "Where the Half-Dream goes, you cannot follow, $(l.race)."
msgstr ""
"半梦者​去​的​地方​，​你​是​没​办法​跟着​的​，​$(l.race)​。\n"
"ban4 meng4 zhe3 qu4 de5 di4fang1，ni3 shi4 mei2 ban4fa3 gen1zhe5 de5，$(l.race)。"

msgid "Where the hell are we, boss? It looks abandoned."
msgstr ""
"我们​这​是​在​哪​啊​，​老大​？​看起来​像是​被​废弃​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4 shi4 zai4 na3 a1，lao3da4？kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 bei4 fei4qi4 le5。"

msgid "Where the hell are we, chief? It looks abandoned."
msgstr ""
"我们​这​是​在​哪​啊​，​头儿​？​看起来​像是​被​废弃​了​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4 shi4 zai4 na3 a1，tou2r5？kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 bei4 fei4qi4 le5。"

msgid "Where the hell are we?"
msgstr ""
"我们​在​什么​鬼​地方​？\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 shen2me5 gui3 di4fang1？"

msgid "Where the hell is Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​跑​哪儿​去​了​？\n"
"Bu4li3ci2 pao2 na3r5 qu4 le5？"

msgid "Where would you like to travel?"
msgstr ""
"你​想​前往​哪里​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3 qian2wang3 na3li3？"

msgid ""
"Wherever we are, the spirit that we're hunting is going to be here, right?"
msgstr ""
"不管​这是​什么​地方​，​我们​要​找​的​精魂​就​在​这里​，​对​吧​？\n"
"bu4guan3 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5 di4fang1，wo3men5 yao4 zhao3 de5 jing1hun2 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "Where’d you get a name like Goldfish?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​要​叫​“​金鱼​”​这个​名字​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 jiao4“jin1yu2” zhe4ge5 ming2zi5？"

msgid ""
"Whether we bring this thing along or not is up to you, $(l.name). I can see advantages either way.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whatever you decide, we'll go along with it."
msgstr ""
"带不带​这个​东西​随​你​决定​，​$(l.name)​。​两种​选择​各有​优劣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​你​作何​决定​，​我们​都​会​配合​。\n"
"\n"
"dai4 bu4 dai4 zhe4ge5 dong1xi1 sui2 ni3 jue2ding4，$(l.name)。liang3 zhong3 xuan3ze2 ge4 you3 you1lie4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 zuo4 he2 jue2ding4，wo3men5 dou1 hui4 pei4he2。"

msgid ""
"Which I *completely* understand, stranger. Believe me.\n"
"\n"
"But unfortunately... we need those supplies more than you do. So I will have to graciously decline your offer to relieve us of your property."
msgstr ""
"陌生人​，​我​对此​*​完全​*​理解​。​相信​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​很​遗憾​……​我们​更加​需要​这批​物资​。​所以​我​不得不​礼貌​拒绝​你​想要​帮​我们​减轻​这份​负担​的​好意​。\n"
"\n"
"mo4sheng1ren2，wo3 dui4 ci3*wan2quan2*li3jie3。xiang1xin4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hen3 yi2han4……wo3men5 geng4jia1 xu1yao4 zhe4 pi1 wu4zi1。suo3yi3 wo3 bu4de2bu4 li3mao4 ju4jue2 ni3 xiang3yao4 bang1 wo3men5 jian3qing1 zhe4 fen4 fu4dan1 de5 hao3yi4。"

msgid "Which gang are you in?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​哪个​帮派​的​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 na3ge5 bang1pai4 de5？"

msgid ""
"Which is why we're not gonna screw it up! Got it? \n"
"\n"
"As soon as any of these doors open, you shoot. Got it?"
msgstr ""
"所以​我们​绝对​不能​搞砸​！​明白​了​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​大门​一开​，​你​就​开火​。​懂​了​？\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 jue2dui4 bu4neng2 gao3za2！ming2bai5 le5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 da4men2 yi1 kai1，ni3 jiu4 kai1huo3。dong3 le5？"

msgid ""
"While Blitz is jacked in to the Matrix, attacks on his physical body are "
"reduced by 3 DMG."
msgstr ""
"当​布里​茨​接入​矩阵​时​，​其​现实​躯体​受到​的​攻击​伤害​减少​3​点​。\n"
"dang1 Bu4li3ci2 jie1ru4 ju3zhen4 shi2，qi2 xian4shi2 qu1ti3 shou4dao4 de5 gong1ji1 shang1hai4 jian3shao3 3 dian3。"

msgid ""
"While Glory holds Monika's head steady, you snatch the cord that connects "
"Monika's datajack to her cyberdeck. Without a moment's hesitation, you give "
"a solid yank and the cord comes free. A wisp of oily blue smoke traces its "
"way from her datajack to the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​扶稳​莫妮卡​的​头​，​而​你​抓起​线​。​它​从​莫妮卡​头上​的​数据​插口​伸出​，​连接​着​她​的​赛博碟板​。​你​没有​丝毫​犹豫​，​用力​一拔​，​线缆​断开​了​。​一股​油腻​的​蓝色​烟雾​从​接口处​升起​，​飘向​天花板​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 fu2 wen3 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 tou2，er2 ni3 zhua1 qi3 xian4。ta1 cong2 Mo4ni1ka3 tou2shang4 de5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 shen1chu1，lian2jie1 zhao2 ta1 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3。ni3 mei2you3 si1hao2 you2yu4，yong4li4 yi1 ba2，xian4lan3 duan4kai1 le5。yi1 gu3 you2ni4 de5 lan2se4 yan1wu4 cong2 jie1 kou3 chu3 sheng1qi3，piao1 xiang4 tian1hua1ban3。"

msgid ""
"While many developed nations have adopted spiritualism - some here might call it paganism - as their de facto belief systems, the Germany of 2054 remains a Christian nation.\n"
"\n"
"Whether that's a good thing or a bad one is open to interpretation. I take no stand on the matter either way."
msgstr ""
"尽管​许多​发达国家​已​将​灵性​主义​—​—​此处​有人​或许​称之为​异教​—​—​作为​其​事实上​的​信仰​体系​，​但​2054​年​的​德国​依然​是​一个​基督教​国家​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这件​事是​好​是​坏​可以​自由心证​。​我​哪边​都​不​站​。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 xu3duo1 fa1da2guo2jia1 yi3 jiang1 ling2xing4 zhu3yi4——ci3chu4 you3ren2 huo4xu3 cheng1zhi1wei2 yi4jiao4——zuo4wei2 qi2 shi4shi2shang4 de5 xin4yang3 ti3xi4，dan4 2054 nian2 de5 de2guo2 yi1ran2 shi4 yi1ge5 ji1du1jiao4 guo2jia1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian4 shi4 shi4 hao3 shi4 huai4 ke3yi3 zi4 you2 xin1 zheng4。wo3 na3 bian1 dou1 bu4 zhan4。"

msgid ""
"While the green still lives, the task remains. \n"
"\n"
"Until the last world ends.\n"
msgstr ""
"绿色​仍然​存在​，​使命​就要​继续​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​直到​世界​终结​。\n"
"\n"
"lu:4se4 reng2ran2 cun2zai4，shi3ming4 jiu4yao4 ji4xu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi2dao4 shi4jie4 zhong1jie2。"

msgid ""
"While the underlying structure is reinforced with steel support struts, you can see signs of rust and metal fatigue everywhere.\n"
"\n"
"The entire wall looks like it could give way if enough force were applied."
msgstr ""
"你​发现​，​尽管​墙体​内部​有着​金属​钢架​作为​支撑​，​生锈​和​变形​的​迹象​却​无处不在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​外力​够​大​的话​，​整面​墙​可能​都​会​塌​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fa1xian4，jin3guan3 qiang2 ti3 nei4bu4 you3zhe5 jin1shu3 gang1 jia4 zuo4wei2 zhi1cheng1，sheng1xiu4 he4 bian4xing2 de5 ji4xiang4 que4 wu2chu4bu4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wai4li4 gou4 dai4 de5hua4，zheng3 mian4 qiang2 ke3neng2 dou1 hui4 ta1 diao4。"

msgid ""
"While this track does load, it's clearly corrupted. The screen fills with a "
"meaningless stream of text."
msgstr ""
"虽然​这盘​录像​确实​能​载入​，​但​显然​内容​已经​损坏​。​屏幕​上​充斥​着​毫无意义​的​文字​流​。\n"
"sui1ran2 zhe4 pan2 lu4xiang4 que4shi2 neng2 zai3ru4，dan4 xian3ran2 nei4rong2 yi3jing1 sun3huai4。ping2mu4 shang4 chong1chi4 zhao2 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4 de5 wen2zi4 liu2。"

msgid ""
"While we wait, I wonder if you would be so kind as to run a small errand for me. A trifle, really. \n"
"\n"
"I hate to trouble you... I am embarrassed to even ask... but I would be most appreciative of your help."
msgstr ""
"在此期间​，​不知​你​能否​帮​我​办个​小忙​？​就是​件​微不足道​的​琐事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​实在​不愿​麻烦​你​……​哪怕​开口​请求​都​让​我​难为情​……​但​若​蒙​相助​，​我​将​感激不尽​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ci3 qi1 jian1，bu4zhi1 ni3 neng2fou3 bang1 wo3 ban4 ge4 xiao3 mang2？jiu4shi4 jian4 wei1bu4zu2dao4 de5 suo3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi2zai4 bu4yuan4 ma2fan5 ni3……na3pa4 kai1kou3 qing3qiu2 dou1 rang4 wo3 nan2wei2qing2……dan4 ruo4 meng2 xiang1zhu4，wo3 jiang1 gan3ji1bu4jin4。"

msgid "While working a job, yeah."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​接​活儿​的​时候​出​的​事​。\n"
"en1，jie1 huo2r5 de5 shi2hou5 chu1 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"While you remain in the Hub, you have nothing to fear. \n"
"\n"
"We pay well for the use of this place, and neither gang would risk driving us away."
msgstr ""
"只要​你​待​在​中枢​，​就​没有​什么​可怕​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​为​使用​此地​支付​了​高额​费用​，​两个​帮派​都​不会​冒险​把​我们​赶走​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 dai1 zai4 zhong1shu1，jiu4 mei2you3 shen2me5 ke3pa4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 wei2 shi3yong4 ci3di4 zhi1fu4 le5 gao1e2 fei4yong4，liang3 ge4 bang1pai4 dou1 bu4hui4 mao4xian3 ba3 wo3men5 gan3zou3 de5。"

msgid ""
"While you're working to earn Alice's fee, I will continue to dig for clues about Feuerschwinge. If she is, in fact, roosting under the Harfeld Manor, then there must be some evidence to support that fact.\n"
"\n"
"A dragon is a large thing to hide, after all."
msgstr ""
"在​你​努力​赚取​爱丽丝​的​酬金​期间​，​我会​继续​挖掘​关于​火翼​的​线索​。​如果​她​真的​栖息​在​哈​菲尔德​庄园​之下​，​那么​肯定​会​有​证据​来​证明​这​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​像​巨龙​这样​的​庞然大物​，​可不是​说​藏​就​能​藏​起来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 nu3li4 zhuan4qu3 ai4li4si1 de5 chou2jin1 qi1jian1，wo3 hui4 ji4xu4 wa1jue2 guan1yu2 Huo3yi4 de5 xian4suo3。ru2guo3 ta1 zhen1de5 qi1xi1 zai4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 zhi1xia4，na4me5 ken3ding4 hui4 you3 zheng4ju4 lai2 zheng4ming2 zhe4 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 xiang4 ju4long2 zhe4yang4 de5 pang2ran2da4wu4，ke3bu5shi4 shuo1 zang4 jiu4 neng2 zang4 qi3lai5 de5。"

msgid "Whirlwind"
msgstr ""
"旋风\n"
"xuan4feng1"

msgid "White IC"
msgstr ""
"白​IC\n"
"bai2 IC"

msgid "White Sentry IC"
msgstr ""
"白​IC​（​哨兵​）\n"
"bai2 IC （shao4bing1）"

msgid "White Sparky IC"
msgstr ""
"白​IC​（​斯帕基​）\n"
"bai2 IC （si1 pa4 ji1）"

msgid "Whiteboard"
msgstr ""
"白板\n"
"bai2ban3"

msgid "Who am I looking at?"
msgstr ""
"这人​是​谁​？\n"
"zhe4 ren2 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Who are the Schockwellenreiter?"
msgstr ""
"电波​骑士​是​什么​人​？\n"
"dian4Bo1qi2shi4 shi4 shen2me5 ren2？"

msgid "Who are you calling \"trog,\" runt?"
msgstr ""
"你​叫​谁​“​穴居人​”​呢​，​混蛋​？\n"
"ni3 jiao4 shei2“xue2ju1ren2” ni2，hun2dan4？"

msgid "Who are you, and how did you know I was in this room?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​谁​？​你​又​是​怎么​知道​我​在​这​屋里​的​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2？ni3 you4 shi4 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 wo3 zai4 zhe4 wu1 li3 de5？"

msgid "Who are you, and how do you know my name?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​谁​，​你​怎么​知道​我​名字​的​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2，ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 wo3 ming2zi5 de5？"

msgid ""
"Who are you, and why are you here?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice is slow and soft, with a slight Aztlaner accent.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Answer me. Now."
msgstr ""
"你​是​谁​，​为什么​在​这里​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​缓慢​而​轻柔​，​略微​有些​阿兹特​兰​口音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​立刻​回答​我​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2，wei4shen2me5 zai4 zhe4li3？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 huan3man4 er2 qing1rou2，lu:e4wei1 you3xie1 e1 zi1 te4 lan2 kou3yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"li4ke4 hui2da2 wo3。"

msgid "Who are you, exactly? And how did you get into this building?"
msgstr ""
"你​到底​是​谁​？​你​怎么​进来​这里​的​？\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 shi4 shei2？ni3 zen3me5 jin4lai2 zhe4li3 de5？"

msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​谁​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"Who are you? Are you part of the Communion? Have you come to take me back? Please, no, I don't wanna go back!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He spits and claws at the air in front of him, as if fighting off an invisible attacker. All the while, his eyes are locked on you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No! It isn't safe! The spirits! IT'S NOT SAFE!"
msgstr ""
"你​是​谁​？​你​是​共​融会​的​人​吗​？​你​是​来​带​我​回去​的​吗​？​求​你​别​这样​做​，​我​不想​回去​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他朝​面前​的​空气​吐口​水​、​双手​胡乱​挥舞​着​，​仿佛​在​对抗​一位​无形​的​攻击者​，​而​他​的​目光​始终​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​！​这里​不​安全​！​有​精魂​！​这里​不​安全​！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2？ni3 shi4 gong4 rong2hui4 de5 ren2 ma5？ni3 shi4 lai2 dai4 wo3 hui2qu5 de5 ma5？qiu2 ni3 bie4 zhe4yang4 zuo4，wo3 bu4xiang3 hui2qu5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 mian4qian2 de5 kong1qi4 tu3kou3 shui3、shuang1shou3 hu2luan4 hui1wu3 zhao2，fang3fu2 zai4 dui4kang4 yi1 wei4 wu2xing2 de5 gong1 ji1 zhe3，er2 ta1 de5 mu4guang1 shi3zhong1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4！zhe4li3 bu4 an1quan2！you3 jing1hun2！zhe4li3 bu4 an1quan2！"

msgid "Who are you? Can we talk about this?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​谁​？​我们​能​不能​谈谈​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2？wo3men5 neng2 bu4neng2 tan2tan2？"

msgid "Who are your employers?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​雇主​是​什么​人​？\n"
"ni3 de5 gu4zhu3 shi4 shen2me5 ren2？"

msgid "Who did you hire?"
msgstr ""
"你​雇​了​什么​人​？\n"
"ni3 gu4 le5 shen2me5 ren2？"

msgid "Who do I talk to about getting a room in the hotel?"
msgstr ""
"我​想​在​旅馆​开个​房间​，​应该​找​谁​？\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zai4 lu:3guan3 kai1 ge4 fang2jian1，ying1gai1 zhao3 shei2？"

msgid ""
"Who do you think? The late ruler of this little kiez of ours.\n"
"\n"
"The illustrious Monika Schäfer, Queen of the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​呢​？​当然​是​我们​这片​街区​的​已故​统治者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​了不起​的​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​女王​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 ni2？dang1ran2 shi4 wo3men5 zhe4 pian1 jie1qu1 de5 yi3gu4 tong3zhi4zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"liao3bu5qi3 de5 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 nu:3wang2。"

msgid "Who do you work for? How did you know where to find me?"
msgstr ""
"你​为​谁​工作​的​？​你​怎么​知道​来​这里​找​我​？\n"
"ni3 wei2 shei2 gong1zuo4 de5？ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 lai2 zhe4li3 zhao3 wo3？"

msgid "Who does it look like, Your Rotundity, the Pope from the Vatican?"
msgstr ""
"不然​呢​，​肥墩​阁下​？​难不成​还是​梵蒂冈​的​教皇​？\n"
"bu4ran2 ni2，fei2 dun1 ge2xia4？nan2bu4cheng2 hai2shi5 fan4di4gang1 de5 jiao4huang2？"

msgid "Who gave you the shiner?"
msgstr ""
"你​这​黑眼圈​是​被​谁​打​的​？\n"
"ni3 zhe4 hei1yan3quan1 shi4 bei4 shei2 da3 de5？"

msgid "Who goes there? What's the password?"
msgstr ""
"外面​是​谁​？​口令​是​什么​？\n"
"wai4mian4 shi4 shei2？kou3ling4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "Who is this \"Alice\"?"
msgstr ""
"这个​“​爱丽丝​”​是​什么​人​？\n"
"zhe4ge5“ai4li4si1” shi4 shen2me5 ren2？"

msgid "Who needs a full team of seasoned shadowrunners when we’ve got Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"有​布里​茨​在​，​完全​顶得​上​一​整队​经验老到​的​暗影​狂奔​者​。\n"
"you3 Bu4li3ci2 zai4，wan2quan2 ding3 de2 shang4 yi1 zheng3dui4 jing1 yan4 lao3 dao4 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid "Who needs sleeves when you've got cyberarms?"
msgstr ""
"当​你​拥有​两条​赛博​手臂​时​，​又​怎会​需要​袖子​呢​？\n"
"dang1 ni3 yong1you3 liang3 tiao2 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 shi2，you4 zen3 hui4 xu1yao4 xiu4zi5 ni2？"

msgid "Who says that I didn't?"
msgstr ""
"谁​说​我​没​去​找​了​？\n"
"shei2 shuo1 wo3 mei2 qu4 zhao3 le5？"

msgid ""
"Who the HELL are you, and why are you leaning on the GODDAMNED door buzzer?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The voice has a shrill, tremulous quality that you recognize instantly. This guy is riding a stim high - you're sure of it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​他​妈​是​谁​啊​？​为什么​按着​该死​的​门铃​不​放​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​这​声音​尖锐​颤抖​，​你​瞬间​就​认出来​了​。​这​家伙​目前​已经​嗑​嗨​了​—​—​你​确信无疑​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ta1 ma1 shi4 shei2 a1？wei4shen2me5 an4 zhao2 gai1si3 de5 men2ling2 bu4 fang4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4 sheng1yin1 jian1rui4 chan4dou3，ni3 shun4jian1 jiu4 ren4 chu1 lai2 le5。zhe4 jia1huo5 mu4qian2 yi3jing1 ke4 hai1 le5——ni3 que4 xin4 wu2 yi2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Who the hell *are* you, man?"
msgstr ""
"你​到底​是​谁​啊​？\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 shi4 shei2 a1？"

msgid "Who the hell are you calling a poser?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​谁​装模作样​呢​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 shei2 zhuang1mo2zuo4yang4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Who the hell are you to question Samuel? What have *you* done for the "
"Kreuzbasar?"
msgstr ""
"你​凭​什么​质疑​塞缪尔​？​*​你​*​又​为​克洛伊​茨​集市​做过​什么​？\n"
"ni3 ping2 shen2me5 zhi4yi2 sai4miu4er3？*ni3*you4 wei2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zuo4 guo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Who the hell are you to tell me what I can and can't do with my own body? Who are you to impose your ideology on me?\n"
"\n"
"I'll tell you what you are. You're the kind of person that Harrow has always warned us about. Your sense of moral outrage doesn't trump my right to be with whomever I choose, *whenever* I choose."
msgstr ""
"你​凭​什么​来​教我如何​处置​自己​的​身体​？​你​又​凭​什么​把​你​的​意识形态​强加​给​我​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​还是​我来​告诉​你​吧​。​你​正是​哈罗​一直​告诫​我们​要​提防​的​那种​人​。​你​那套​道德​义愤​的​论调​并​不能​凌驾于​我​选择​伴侣​的​权利​之上​，​无论​我​在​什么​*​年纪​*​选择​了​哪个​人​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ping2 shen2me5 lai2 jiao1 wo3 ru2 he2 chu3zhi4 zi4ji3 de5 shen1ti3？ni3 you4 ping2 shen2me5 ba3 ni3 de5 yi4shi2xing2tai4 qiang2jia1 gei3 wo3？\n"
"\n"
"hai2shi5 wo3 lai2 gao4su4 ni3 ba1。ni3 zheng4shi4 ha1luo2 yi1zhi2 gao4jie4 wo3men5 yao4 di1fang5 de5 na4zhong3 ren2。ni3 na4 tao4 dao4de2 yi4fen4 de5 lun4diao4 bing4 bu4neng2 ling2 jia4 yu2 wo3 xuan3ze2 ban4lu:3 de5 quan2li4 zhi1shang4，wu2lun4 wo3 zai4 shen2me5*nian2ji4*xuan3ze2 le5 na3ge5 ren2。"

msgid "Who the hell are you?"
msgstr ""
"你​他​妈​是​谁​？\n"
"ni3 ta1 ma1 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Who the hell are you? And how did you get the password?"
msgstr ""
"你​他​妈​是​谁​？​你​又​是​怎么​知道​口令​的​？\n"
"ni3 ta1 ma1 shi4 shei2？ni3 you4 shi4 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 kou3ling4 de5？"

msgid "Who the hell are you? And how did you get through the door?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​谁​？​你​怎么​进来​的​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2？ni3 zen3me5 jin4lai2 de5？"

msgid "Who the hell else would it have been?"
msgstr ""
"不然​还​能​有​谁​？\n"
"bu4ran2 hai2 neng2 you3 shei2？"

msgid "Who wants to know?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​谁​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Who was in command?"
msgstr ""
"当时​的​队长​是​谁​？\n"
"dang1shi2 de5 dui4zhang3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Who was it?"
msgstr ""
"是​什么​人​做​的​？\n"
"shi4 shen2me5 ren2 zuo4 de5？"

msgid "Who was this \"last one\"?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​“​上​一个​”​是​谁​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5“shang4 yi1ge5” shi4 shei2？"

msgid "Who's the stiff by the sink?"
msgstr ""
"水槽​边上​那具​尸体​是​谁​？\n"
"shui3cao2 bian1 shang4 na4 ju4 shi1ti3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"Who, like, said that I wanted to \"shake\" anything?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gives you a sour look.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look around you. Like what you see? Of course you don't. My life is better on cram. Why would I ever want to stop?"
msgstr ""
"谁​说​我​想​“​戒​”​什么​了​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​不耐烦​地​看​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​往​四下里​看看​。​你​看​这​是​个​好​地方​吗​？​当然​不是​了​。​我​嗑​上​“​超感​”​以后​日子​舒坦​多​了​。​我戒​它​干嘛​？\n"
"\n"
"shei2 shuo1 wo3 xiang3“jie4” shen2me5 le5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bu4nai4fan2 de5 kan4 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 wang3 si4xia4li5 kan4kan5。ni3 kan4 zhe4 shi4 ge4 hao3 di4fang1 ma5？dang1ran2 bu4shi4 le5。wo3 ke4 shang4“chao1 gan3” yi3hou4 ri4zi5 shu1tan5 duo1 le5。wo3 jie4 ta1 gan4ma2？"

msgid "Who.. where?"
msgstr ""
"谁​……​在​哪里​？\n"
"shei2……zai4 na3li3？"

msgid "Who... or what... are you?"
msgstr ""
"你​到底​是​谁​……​或者说​，​是​什么​东西​？\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 shi4 shei2……huo4 zhe3 shuo1，shi4 shen2me5 dong1xi1？"

msgid ""
"Who? WHO?\n"
"\n"
"JON BERGFALK, that's who! *I'm* the one who keeps these servers *protected.* And I *can't do it* if you *KEEP INTERRUPTING ME!*"
msgstr ""
"谁​？​你​说​是​谁​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​乔恩​·​伯格​法克​，​就是​老子​我​！​我​可是​在​*​保护​*​这些​服务器​，​如果​你​*​一直​打扰​我​*​，​那​我​就​*​做​不到​*​了​！\n"
"\n"
"shei2？ni3 shuo1 shi4 shei2？\n"
"\n"
"qiao2 en1 · bai3 ge2 fa3ke4，jiu4shi4 lao3zi3 wo3！wo3 ke3shi4 zai4*bao3hu4*zhe4xie1 fu2wu4qi4，ru2guo3 ni3*yi1zhi2 da3rao3 wo3*，na4 wo3 jiu4*zuo4 bu4dao4*le5！"

msgid "Whoa there... Monika didn't control the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"等​下​……​莫妮卡​可​没有​控制​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"deng3 xia4……Mo4ni1ka3 ke3 mei2you3 kong4zhi4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid "Whoa! Step back, $(l.name)... *way* back."
msgstr ""
"哇​！​快​退后​，​$(l.name)​……​*​多退​*​几步​。\n"
"wa1！kuai4 tui4hou4，$(l.name)……*duo1 tui4*ji1 bu4。"

msgid ""
"Whoa, whoa, whoa. No way. If you want my help, you have to come with me - "
"I'm not risking my neck for you on my own!"
msgstr ""
"喂喂​喂​，​不是​吧​。​如果​你​想​让​我​帮忙​的话​，​你​必须​得​跟​我​一起​—​—​凭​什么​让​我​自己​替​你​担​性命之忧​啊​！\n"
"wei2 wei2 wei2，bu4shi4 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 bang1mang2 de5hua4，ni3 bi4xu1 de2 gen1 wo3 yi1qi3——ping2 shen2me5 rang4 wo3 zi4ji3 ti4 ni3 dan1 xing4 ming4 zhi1 you1 a1！"

msgid ""
"Whoa, whoa. Back down, chief. Remember, *they* betrayed *me* first.\n"
"\n"
"I did the only thing I *could* do to keep myself alive."
msgstr ""
"喂喂​喂​，​冷静​点​，​头儿​。​记得​吗​，​是​*​他们​*​先​背叛​*​我​*​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​尽可能​想​活命​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"wei2 wei2 wei2，leng3jing4 dian3，tou2r5。ji4de5 ma5，shi4*ta1men5*xian1 bei4pan4*wo3*de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 jin3ke3neng2 xiang3 huo2ming4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"Whoa. That... that was cold, chief.\n"
"\n"
"At the very least, you could've talked to the guy. He was a shadowrunner.\n"
"\n"
"One of us."
msgstr ""
"哇​。​这​……​这可够​冷血​的​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至少​，​你​可以​先​和​他​谈谈​。​毕竟​他​也​是​暗影​狂奔​者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​都​是​同行​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"wa1。zhe4……zhe4 ke3 gou4 leng3xue4 de5，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3，ni3 ke3yi3 xian1 he4 ta1 tan2tan2。bi4jing4 ta1 ye3 shi4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 shi4 tong2hang2 a1。"

msgid "Whoa... What the...?"
msgstr ""
"哇​哦​……​什么​鬼​……​？\n"
"wa1 e2……shen2me5 gui3……？"

msgid ""
"Whoever put this thing together was good - surprisingly good. But not as good as you.\n"
"\n"
"You slip past the drone's safeguards, and within seconds, its functions are yours."
msgstr ""
"组装​这台​设备​的​人​是​名​好手​—​—​可以​说​相当​出色​。​但​你​还是​技高一筹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​绕过​了​无人机​的​安全措施​，​几秒​之内​便​掌控​了​它​的​所有​功能​。\n"
"\n"
"zu3zhuang1 zhe4 tai2 she4bei4 de5 ren2 shi4 ming2 hao3shou3——ke3yi3 shuo1 xiang1dang1 chu1se4。dan4 ni3 hai2shi5 ji4 gao1 yi1 chou2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 rao4guo4 le5 wu2ren2ji1 de5 an1quan2cuo4shi1，ji1 miao3 zhi1nei4 bian4 zhang3kong4 le5 ta1 de5 suo3you3 gong1neng2。"

msgid ""
"Whoever put this thing together was good - surprisingly good. You worm your "
"way past two of the safeguards, but you trip the third."
msgstr ""
"组装​这台​设备​的​人​是​名​好手​—​—​可以​说​相当​出色​。​你​绕过​了​前​两道​安全措施​，​却​在​第三道​栽​了​跟头​。\n"
"zu3zhuang1 zhe4 tai2 she4bei4 de5 ren2 shi4 ming2 hao3shou3——ke3yi3 shuo1 xiang1dang1 chu1se4。ni3 rao4guo4 le5 qian2 liang3 dao4 an1quan2cuo4shi1，que4 zai4 di4 san1 dao4 zai1 le5 gen1tou5。"

msgid "Whoever sent us knew what we were walking into. We were set up."
msgstr ""
"给​我们​派活​的​人​明显​知道​这件​事​的​内情​。​我们​被​坑​了​。\n"
"gei3 wo3men5 pai4 huo2 de5 ren2 ming2xian3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 de5 nei4qing2。wo3men5 bei4 keng1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Whoever this Winternight is, I don't want to leave them to the F-State. I "
"think that we should handle them ourselves."
msgstr ""
"不管​这个​“​冬夜​”​是​什么​来头​，​我​不想​把​他们​交给​动荡​带来​处理​。​我​觉得​我们​应该​自己​动手​。\n"
"bu4guan3 zhe4ge5“dong1 ye4” shi4 shen2me5 lai2tou2，wo3 bu4xiang3 ba3 ta1men5 jiao1gei3 dong4dang4 dai4lai2 chu3li3。wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 ying1gai1 zi4ji3 dong4shou3。"

msgid ""
"Whoever this Winternight is, I think that we should handle them ourselves. "
"It's the only way that we'll know this is finished."
msgstr ""
"不管​这个​“​冬夜​”​是​什么​来头​，​我​觉得​我们​应该​自己​动手​。​只有​这样​我们​才能​确定​这件​事​可以​彻底​了结​。\n"
"bu4guan3 zhe4ge5“dong1 ye4” shi4 shen2me5 lai2tou2，wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 ying1gai1 zi4ji3 dong4shou3。zhi3you3 zhe4yang4 wo3men5 cai2neng2 que4ding4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 ke3yi3 che4di3 liao3jie2。"

msgid ""
"Whoever was behind those bombers, they weren't aiming for us or the "
"Russians. They were aiming to end the war. They bombed everybody, on both "
"sides."
msgstr ""
"无论是​谁​策划​了​那次​轰炸​行动​，​他们​的​目标​都​不是​我们​或​俄罗斯​人​，​而是​要​结束​战争​。​他们​对​参战​双方​都​进行​了​轰炸​。\n"
"wu2 lun2 shi4 shei2 ce4hua4 le5 na4 ci4 hong1zha4 xing2dong4，ta1men5 de5 mu4biao1 dou1 bu4shi4 wo3men5 huo4 e2luo2si1 ren2，er2shi4 yao4 jie2shu4 zhan4zheng1。ta1men5 dui4 can1zhan4 shuang1fang1 dou1 jin4xing2 le5 hong1zha4。"

msgid ""
"Whoever you are, whatever you think you're after, you NEED TO FIND DR. ADRIAN VAUCLAIR.\n"
"\n"
"Not because he's my brother.\n"
"\n"
"Because if Feuerschwinge is rising again, he's the ONLY one who can stop her."
msgstr ""
"不管​你​是​谁​，​不管​你​以为​自己​在​找​什么​，​你​都​需要​找到​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​因为​他​是​我​哥哥​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而是​因为​如果​火翼​再次​崛起​，​只有​他​能够​阻止​她​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 shi4 shei2，bu4guan3 ni3 yi3wei2 zi4ji3 zai4 zhao3 shen2me5，ni3 dou1 xu1yao4 zhao3dao4 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 yin1wei4 ta1 shi4 wo3 ge1ge5。\n"
"\n"
"er2shi4 yin1wei4 ru2guo3 Huo3yi4 zai4ci4 jue2qi3，zhi3you3 ta1 neng2gou4 zu3zhi3 ta1。"

msgid "Whose leader?"
msgstr ""
"什么​首领​？\n"
"shen2me5 shou3ling3？"

msgid ""
"Why am I releasing the dragon? Spreading Vauclair's Panacea to infect the "
"world?"
msgstr ""
"我​为什么​要​释放​巨龙​？​让​沃​克莱尔​的​“​万能​药​”​感染​整个​世界​？\n"
"wo3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 shi4fang4 ju4long2？rang4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4” gan3ran3 zheng3ge4 shi4jie4？"

msgid ""
"Why are you asking me this, Glory? You already know the answers.\n"
"\n"
"The kids here, they aren't being *hurt.* They're walking the path to a free and pure life! Just like Harrow taught us."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​为何​要​问​我​这些​？​你​明明​已经​知道​答案​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​的​孩子​们​并未​受到​*​伤害​*​。​正如​哈罗​教导​我们​的​那样​，​他们​正​走​在​通往​自由​而​纯净​的​生命​的​道路​上​！\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 wei4he2 yao4 wen4 wo3 zhe4xie1？ni3 ming2ming2 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 da2an4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 hai2zi5 men5 bing4wei4 shou4dao4*shang1hai4*。zheng4ru2 ha1luo2 jiao4dao3 wo3men5 de5 na4yang4，ta1men5 zheng1 zou3 zai4 tong1wang3 zi4you2 er2 chun2jing4 de5 sheng1ming4 de5 dao4lu4 shang4！"

msgid ""
"Why are you in this hotel, and how do you have access to the security "
"system?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​会​在​这个​旅馆​里​，​还有​安保​系统​的​权限​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 hui4 zai4 zhe4ge5 lu:3guan3 li3，hai2you3 an1bao3 xi4tong3 de5 quan2xian4？"

msgid "Why are you locked in the kitchen?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​被​锁​在​厨房​里​了​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 bei4 suo3 zai4 chu2fang2 li3 le5？"

msgid ""
"Why are you so strapped for cash? With all the work we've been doing, you "
"should be rolling in nuyen."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​还​手头紧​呢​？​我们​干​了​这么​多​差事​，​你​早就​应该​生活​不愁​了​。\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 hai2 shou3tou2jin3 ni2？wo3men5 gan4 le5 zhe4me5 duo1 cha4shi4，ni3 zao3jiu4 ying1gai1 sheng1huo2 bu4 chou2 le5。"

msgid "Why are you telling me all of this?"
msgstr ""
"你​给​我​讲​这些​做​什么​？\n"
"ni3 gei3 wo3 jiang3 zhe4xie1 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Why are you telling me all of this? You must know that I'm going to try to "
"stop you."
msgstr ""
"给​我​讲​这些​做​什么​？​你​知道​我​肯定​会​尽力​阻止​你​。\n"
"gei3 wo3 jiang3 zhe4xie1 zuo4 shen2me5？ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 ken3ding4 hui4 jin4li4 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Why are you trying to talk yourself out of a job?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He rubs the bridge of his nose between his thumb and forefinger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can see that you still don't get it, so I'll be blunt. You're the best in town at what you do, full stop. And I need the best, even if that means hiring you."
msgstr ""
"你​就​这么​不想​接​差事​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​拇指​和​食指​揉​了​揉​鼻梁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​你​还是​没​明白​，​那​我​就​直说​吧​。​你​在​专业​方面​是​最强​的​，​而​我​需要​找​最强​的​帮手​，​即使​这​意味着​我要​雇​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 zhe4me5 bu4xiang3 jie1 cha4shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 mu3zhi3 he4 shi2zhi3 rou2 le5 rou2 bi2liang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 hai2shi5 mei2 ming2bai5，na4 wo3 jiu4 zhi2 shuo1 ba1。ni3 zai4 zhuan1ye4 fang1mian4 shi4 zui4 jiang4 de5，er2 wo3 xu1yao4 zhao3 zui4 jiang4 de5 bang1shou5，ji2shi3 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 yao4 gu4 ni3。"

msgid "Why attack the Kreuzbasar, Vauclair? Why kill Paul Amsel?"
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​，​你​为什么​要​袭击​克洛伊​茨​集市​？​为什么​要​杀死​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​？\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3，ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 xi2ji1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4？wei4shen2me5 yao4 sha1si3 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3？"

msgid "Why attempt to purify the spirit at all? Why not just kill it?"
msgstr ""
"为什么​非​要​净化​那个​精魂​？​直接​杀死​它​不​就行了​吗​？\n"
"wei4shen2me5 fei1 yao4 jing4hua4 na4ge5 jing1hun2？zhi2jie1 sha1si3 ta1 bu4 jiu4 xing2 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Why break the magic? Were the tattoos cursed, or something?"
msgstr ""
"为什么​要​解除​？​这些​纹身​是​被​诅咒​了​吗​？\n"
"wei4shen2me5 yao4 jie3chu2？zhe4xie1 wen2shen1 shi4 bei4 zu3zhou4 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Why did you ask me here?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​要​叫​我​过来​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 jiao4 wo3 guo4lai2？"

msgid "Why did you do it? Why kill all those people?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​要​做​那件事​？​为什么​杀害​那么​多人​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 zuo4 na4 jian4 shi4？wei4shen2me5 sha1hai4 na4me5 duo1 ren2？"

msgid "Why did you fall in with this line of work?"
msgstr ""
"你​从​什么​时候​开始​做​这​一行​的​？\n"
"ni3 cong2 shen2me5 shi2hou5 kai1shi3 zuo4 zhe4 yi1xing2 de5？"

msgid "Why did you put up with those insults? Don't you have any pride?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​能​忍受​这种​辱骂​？​难道​你​就​没有​一点​自尊心​吗​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 neng2 ren3shou4 zhe4zhong3 ru3ma4？nan2dao4 ni3 jiu4 mei2you3 yi1dian3 zi4zun1xin1 ma5？"

msgid "Why didn't you just do that in the first place?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​一​开始​不​这么​做​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 yi1 kai1shi3 bu4 zhe4me5 zuo4？"

msgid ""
"Why do you care?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is no hostility in her voice. If anything, she sounds suspicious.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​对​这件​事​这么​上​心​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​语气​中​没有​敌意​，​不如说​倒​更​像是​带​着​怀疑​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 zhe4me5 shang4 xin1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 zhong4 mei2you3 di2yi4，bu4 ru2 shuo1 dao3 geng1 xiang4 shi4 dai4 zhao2 huai2yi2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Why do you want to know?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​想​知道​这个​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 xiang3 zhi1dao4 zhe4ge5？"

msgid ""
"Why does any of this even matter? I don't understand what you're saying."
msgstr ""
"这​一切​又​有​什么​关系​呢​？​我​不​明白​你​在​说​什么​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 you4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5 ni2？wo3 bu4 ming2bai5 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。"

msgid "Why does it matter?"
msgstr ""
"这有​什么​关系​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5 ma5？"

msgid "Why don't I believe you?"
msgstr ""
"我​怎么​就​不信​你​呢​？\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 jiu4 bu4 xin4 ni3 ni2？"

msgid "Why don't you come out of your little fishbowl and play?"
msgstr ""
"不如​你​从​那个​小​鱼缸​里​出来​玩玩​？\n"
"bu4ru2 ni3 cong2 na4ge5 xiao3 yu2gang1 li3 chu1lai2 wan2 wan2？"

msgid ""
"Why don't you do it yourself? This might come as a shock, but I'm not your "
"errand boy."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​不​自己​去​？​你​可能​没​注意​到​，​但​我​并​不是​你​的​跑腿​。\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 bu4 zi4ji3 qu4？ni3 ke3neng2 mei2 zhu4yi4 dao4，dan4 wo3 bing4 bu4shi4 ni3 de5 pao3tui3。"

msgid ""
"Why don't you do it yourself? This might come as a shock, but I'm not your "
"errand girl."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​不​自己​去​？​你​可能​没​注意​到​，​但​我​并​不是​你​的​跑腿​。\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 bu4 zi4ji3 qu4？ni3 ke3neng2 mei2 zhu4yi4 dao4，dan4 wo3 bing4 bu4shi4 ni3 de5 pao3tui3。"

msgid "Why don't you educate us?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​说说看​？\n"
"na4 ni3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4？"

msgid "Why don't you let me take care of that?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​不让​我来​处理​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 bu4 rang4 wo3 lai2 chu3li3？"

msgid "Why don't you move? There are safer kiez not far from here."
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​不​搬走​呢​？​这​附近​不远​就​有​更​安全​的​街区​。\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 bu4 ban1zou3 ni2？zhe4 fu4jin4 bu4 yuan3 jiu4 you3 geng1 an1quan2 de5 jie1qu1。"

msgid "Why don’t you shut up and die already?"
msgstr ""
"你​还是​闭上嘴​赶紧​去死吧​？\n"
"ni3 hai2shi5 bi4 shang4 zui3 gan3jin3 qu4 si3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Why hold me to a higher standard than you do yourself?\n"
"\n"
"We're all killers, friends. Let's just accept that and move on."
msgstr ""
"你​为何​对​我​要求​比​对​自己​更高​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​都​是​杀手​，​朋友​们​。​接受​这​一点​，​别​再​纠结​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wei4he2 dui4 wo3 yao1qiu2 bi3 dui4 zi4ji3 geng1 gao1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 shi4 sha1shou3，peng2you5 men5。jie1shou4 zhe4 yi1dian3，bie4 zai4 jiu1jie2 le5。"

msgid "Why is that so strange to you?"
msgstr ""
"这​对​你​来说​有​什么​奇怪​的​吗​？\n"
"zhe4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 you3 shen2me5 qi2guai4 de5 ma5？"

msgid "Why is this important?"
msgstr ""
"然后​呢​？\n"
"ran2hou4 ni2？"

msgid "Why not?"
msgstr ""
"为什么​？\n"
"wei4shen2me5？"

msgid "Why not? Couldn't you have just called for help?"
msgstr ""
"为什么​？​你们​不能​呼救​吗​？\n"
"wei4shen2me5？ni3men5 bu4neng2 hu1jiu4 ma5？"

msgid "Why not? I don't have any particular love for that place."
msgstr ""
"关​我​什么​事​？​我​对​那​地方​并​没有​什么​特殊​感情​。\n"
"guan1 wo3 shen2me5 shi4？wo3 dui4 na4 di4fang1 bing4 mei2you3 shen2me5 te4shu1 gan3qing2。"

msgid "Why should I?"
msgstr ""
"我​为何​要​这么​做​？\n"
"wo3 wei4he2 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4？"

msgid "Why should we care? I've been to Schattennest. It's a dump."
msgstr ""
"这有​什么​关系​？​我​去过​影巢​，​那里​就是​个​垃圾场​而已​。\n"
"zhe4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？wo3 qu4 guo4 ying3 chao2，na4li5 jiu4shi4 ge4 la1 ji1 chang2 er2yi3。"

msgid "Why the attack? Think she was protecting her lair?"
msgstr ""
"她​为什么​要​发动​攻击​？​她​是​在​保护​自己​的​巢穴​吗​？\n"
"ta1 wei4shen2me5 yao4 fa1dong4 gong1ji1？ta1 shi4 zai4 bao3hu4 zi4ji3 de5 chao2xue2 ma5？"

msgid "Why the change?"
msgstr ""
"为什么​变​了​呢​？\n"
"wei4shen2me5 bian4 le5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Why the hell are you strapped for cash? With the amount of work we've been "
"doing, you should be rolling in nuyen."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​还​手头紧​呢​？​我们​干​了​这么​多​差事​，​你​早就​应该​生活​不愁​了​。\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 hai2 shou3tou2jin3 ni2？wo3men5 gan4 le5 zhe4me5 duo1 cha4shi4，ni3 zao3jiu4 ying1gai1 sheng1huo2 bu4 chou2 le5。"

msgid "Why the hell did our employers saddle me with you, then?"
msgstr ""
"那​我们​的​雇主​为什么​要​把​你​这个​累赘​塞​给​我​？\n"
"na4 wo3men5 de5 gu4zhu3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 ba3 ni3 zhe4ge5 lei2zhui4 se4 gei3 wo3？"

msgid "Why the hell not?"
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​？\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Why the lie, Doc? You saved her. If anything, I'd think that you'd brag "
"about it."
msgstr ""
"干嘛​说谎​呢​，​医生​？​你​救​了​她​。​我​还​以为​你​会​拿​这件​事大吹特​吹​呢​。\n"
"gan4ma2 shuo1huang3 ni2，yi1sheng1？ni3 jiu4 le5 ta1。wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 hui4 na2 zhe4 jian4 shi4 dai4 chui1 te4 chui1 ni2。"

msgid "Why the lie? Why tell me you're an accountant?"
msgstr ""
"为什么​要​说谎​？​为什么​骗​我​说​你​是​个​会计​？\n"
"wei4shen2me5 yao4 shuo1huang3？wei4shen2me5 pian4 wo3 shuo1 ni3 shi4 ge4 kuai4ji4？"

msgid "Why the wait? You could've broken into this place months ago!"
msgstr ""
"为什么​等到​现在​？​几个​月​前​你们​就​可以​闯进​这​地方​了​！\n"
"wei4shen2me5 deng3dao4 xian4zai4？ji3ge5 yue4 qian2 ni3men5 jiu4 ke3yi3 chuang3jin4 zhe4 di4fang1 le5！"

msgid ""
"Why tie yourself to a specific group? I say, keep it fluid. Stomp anyone "
"that threatens the Flux. Isn't that what Berlin is all about?"
msgstr ""
"干嘛​要​拘泥于​某个​特定​的​组织​呢​？​要​我​说​，​标准​放​灵活​点​，​谁​威胁​到​动荡​带​就​干掉​谁​。​按​你​的​说法​，​这​不​就是​柏林​之道​吗​？\n"
"gan4ma2 yao4 ju1 ni2 yu2 mou3 ge4 te4ding4 de5 zu3zhi1 ni2？yao4 wo3 shuo1，biao1zhun3 fang4 ling2huo2 dian3，shei2 wei1xie2 dao4 dong4dang4 dai4 jiu4 gan4diao4 shei2。an4 ni3 de5 shuo1fa3，zhe4 bu4 jiu4shi4 bo2lin2 zhi1 dao4 ma5？"

msgid "Why would Humanis deal with a metahuman-run operation?"
msgstr ""
"人类​至上​主义者​怎么​会​愿意​和​变​人类​走私者​打交道​？\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 zen3me5 hui4 yuan4yi4 he4 bian4 ren2lei4 zou3 si1 zhe3 da3jiao1dao4？"

msgid "Why would Meat Grinder's financial records be here?"
msgstr ""
"“​绞肉机​”​的​财务​记录​为什么​会​在​这里​？\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 cai2wu4 ji4lu4 wei4shen2me5 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3？"

msgid "Why would Plotz have Meat Grinder's financial records?"
msgstr ""
"普​洛茨​为什么​会​有​“​绞肉机​”​的​财务​记录​？\n"
"Pu3luo4ci2 wei4shen2me5 hui4 you3“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 cai2wu4 ji4lu4？"

msgid "Why would a dealer beat on a new customer?"
msgstr ""
"一个​小贩​为什么​会​打​自己​的​新​顾客​？\n"
"yi1ge5 xiao3fan4 wei4shen2me5 hui4 da3 zi4ji3 de5 xin1 gu4ke4？"

msgid "Why would he join a hate group if he isn't a racist?"
msgstr ""
"如果​他​不是​种族主义者​，​那​他​干嘛​要​加入​仇恨​团体​？\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 bu4shi4 zhong3zu2zhu3yi4zhe3，na4 ta1 gan4ma2 yao4 jia1ru4 chou2hen4 tuan2ti3？"

msgid "Why would his father do that?"
msgstr ""
"他​父亲​为什么​要​这么​做​？\n"
"ta1 fu4qin1 wei4shen2me5 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4？"

msgid ""
"Why would you want it to? If the Landenberg Ring has a file on Grinder, "
"isn't it better that it's wrong?"
msgstr ""
"这样​不​正好​吗​？​如果​兰​登堡​帮手​里​有​“​绞肉机​”​的​文件​，​里面​的​数字​肯定​越错​越​好​吧​？\n"
"zhe4yang4 bu4 zheng4hao3 ma5？ru2guo3 lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1shou5 li3 you3“jiao3rou4ji1” de5 wen2jian4，li3mian4 de5 shu4zi4 ken3ding4 yue4 cuo4 yue4 hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Why wouldn't I?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His grin widens, and the light plays sickeningly off of his scar tissue.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The world's never done shit for me. Everything I am, I had to take for myself. So I say, fuck the world."
msgstr ""
"那​又​如何​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​笑容​愈发​狰狞​，​光线​在​他​的​疤痕​组织​上​折射出​令人作呕​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​世界​从没​给​我​半点​好处​。​我​拥有​的​一切​，​都​是​靠​自己​抢来​的​。​所以​我​说​，​让​这​世界​玩蛋​去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 you4 ru2he2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 zheng1ning2，guang1xian4 zai4 ta1 de5 ba1hen2 zu3zhi1 shang4 zhe1 she4 chu1 ling3 ren2 zuo4 ou3 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4jie4 cong2mei2 gei3 wo3 ban4dian3 hao3chu3。wo3 yong1you3 de5 yi1qie4，dou1 shi4 kao4 zi4ji3 qiang3 lai2 de5。suo3yi3 wo3 shuo1，rang4 zhe4 shi4jie4 wan2 dan4 qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Why wouldn't you, chief? I mean... just look at me!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He does his best to give you a winning smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm a trustworthy guy."
msgstr ""
"怎么​了​，​头儿​？​……​你​看看​我​嘛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​竭尽全力​对​你​露出​一个​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​多​值得​信任​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 le5，tou2r5？……ni3 kan4kan5 wo3 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jie2jin4quan2li4 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 duo1 zhi2de5 xin4ren4 a1。"

msgid "Why'd you bring up Monika? Did you know her?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​要​提到​莫妮卡​？​你​认识​她​吗​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 ti2dao4 Mo4ni1ka3？ni3 ren4shi5 ta1 ma5？"

msgid "Why'd you keep them around at all, then?"
msgstr ""
"那​你们​为什么​还​让​他们​留下​？\n"
"na4 ni3men5 wei4shen2me5 hai2 rang4 ta1men5 liu2xia4？"

msgid "Why'd you run?"
msgstr ""
"你​为什么​要​逃​？\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 tao2？"

msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""
"为什么​？\n"
"wei4shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Why? Going in through the museum worked just fine last time. If anything, it"
" should be even less well defended now that we've taken care of APEX."
msgstr ""
"为什么​？​上次​从​博物馆​进去​不​就​很​顺利​吗​？​况且​既然​我们​已经​解决​了​APEX​，​那里​的​防守​现在​应该​更​松懈​才​对​。\n"
"wei4shen2me5？shang4ci4 cong2 bo2wu4guan3 jin4qu4 bu4 jiu4 hen3 shun4li4 ma5？kuang4qie3 ji4ran2 wo3men5 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 le5 APEX，na4li5 de5 fang2shou3 xian4zai4 ying1gai1 geng1 song1xie4 cai2 dui4。"

msgid ""
"Why? I may earn less than you do, but that doesn't mean that I arbitrarily "
"hate the rich, or that I think the world should change just to make things "
"easier for me."
msgstr ""
"为什么​？​我​的​收入​可能​不如​你​，​但​这​并​不​意味着​我会​无端​憎恨​富人​，​也​不​代表​我​认为​世界​应该​改变​，​仅仅​是​为了​让​我​过​得​更​轻松​。\n"
"wei4shen2me5？wo3 de5 shou1ru4 ke3neng2 bu4ru2 ni3，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 hui4 wu2duan1 zeng1hen4 fu4ren2，ye3 bu4 dai4biao3 wo3 ren4wei2 shi4jie4 ying1gai1 gai3bian4，jin3jin3 shi4 wei4le5 rang4 wo3 guo4 de2 geng1 qing1song1。"

msgid "Why? It's not his fault this happened."
msgstr ""
"为什么​？​这件​事​不是​他​的​错​。\n"
"wei4shen2me5？zhe4 jian4 shi4 bu4shi4 ta1 de5 cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Why? This has *helped* us. What does it matter where it's coming from?\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, I can control it. I can turn this thing off and on like a switch."
msgstr ""
"怎么​会​呢​？​这​可​*​帮​*​了​我们​大忙​，​它​从​哪来​重要​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​再说​了​，​我能​控制​它​，​就​跟​开关​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 hui4 ni2？zhe4 ke3*bang1*le5 wo3men5 dai4 mang2，ta1 cong2 na3 lai2 zhong4yao4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1 le5，wo3 neng2 kong4zhi4 ta1，jiu4 gen1 kai1guan1 yi1yang4。"

msgid "Wide Load: Wider than normal spread, reduced critical chance"
msgstr ""
"扫射​：​比​普通​范围​更大​，​降低​暴击​几率\n"
"sao3she4：bi3 pu3tong1 fan4wei2 geng1 dai4，jiang4di1 bao4ji1 ji1lu:4"

msgid "Wild Huntsman Idol"
msgstr ""
"荒野​猎人​精魂​导师\n"
"huang1ye3 lie4ren2 jing1hun2 dao3shi1"

msgid "Wild Huntsman: DMG +4, Accuracy -10%"
msgstr ""
"荒野​猎人​：​伤害​+​4​，​精准度​-​10​%\n"
"huang1ye3 lie4ren2：shang1hai4 +4，jing1 zhun3 du4-10 %"

msgid "Will do, sir. Is there anything else that I can do for you tonight?"
msgstr ""
"好​的​，​先生​。​您​今晚​还有​什么​需要​吗​？\n"
"hao3 de5，xian1sheng5。nin2 jin1wan3 hai2you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 ma5？"

msgid "Will do."
msgstr ""
"一定​。\n"
"yi1ding4。"

msgid ""
"Will do.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a beat before continuing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Uh, chief... don't you want to know how things went with Emilie? Going after her was your idea, after all."
msgstr ""
"我会​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​沉默​了​一下​，​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​头儿​……​你​不想​知道​艾米莉​的​事情​怎么样​了​吗​？​毕竟​是​你​说​让​我​去​找​她​的​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 yi1xia4，you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tou2r5……ni3 bu4xiang3 zhi1dao4 ai4 mi3 li4 de5 shi4qing5 zen3me5yang4 le5 ma5？bi4jing4 shi4 ni3 shuo1 rang4 wo3 qu4 zhao3 ta1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Will do. Kossmann is rigging up an ambush spot now.\n"
"\n"
"We'll try to make it quick."
msgstr ""
"收到​，​科斯​曼​正在​布置​伏击​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​会​尽量​速战速决​。\n"
"\n"
"shou1dao4，ke1 si1 man4 zheng4zai4 bu4zhi4 fu2ji1 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 jin3liang4 su4zhan4su4jue2。"

msgid "Will face justice. You have my word."
msgstr ""
"将​受到​正义​的​审判​。​我​向​你​保证​。\n"
"jiang1 shou4dao4 zheng4yi4 de5 shen3pan4。wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid "Will they be back?"
msgstr ""
"他们​还会​回来​吗​？\n"
"ta1men5 hai2 hui4 hui2lai5 ma5？"

msgid "Will you do it, then? Will you give me release?"
msgstr ""
"所以​你​会​这么​做​吗​？​你​会​释放​我​吗​？\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 ma5？ni3 hui4 shi4fang4 wo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Will you please tell him to concentrate on the job? We're here to settle his"
" debt, not to hunt for souvenirs."
msgstr ""
"你​能​不能​让​他​专注​于​任务​？​我们​此行​的​目的​是​了结​他​的​债务​，​不是​四处​搜刮​纪念品​。\n"
"ni3 neng2 bu4neng2 rang4 ta1 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 ren4wu5？wo3men5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4 shi4 liao3jie2 ta1 de5 zhai4wu4，bu4shi4 si4chu4 sou1gua1 ji4nian4pin3。"

msgid ""
"Will you release me now, $(l.race)?\n"
"\n"
"makemewholeagain\n"
"\n"
"Whole?"
msgstr ""
"你​现在​能放​了​我​吗​，​$(l.race)​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​重新​完整​\n"
"​\n"
"​完整​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xian4zai4 neng2 fang4 le5 wo3 ma5，$(l.race)？\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 chong2xin1 wan2zheng3 \n"
"\n"
"wan2zheng3？"

msgid "Willpower"
msgstr ""
"意志\n"
"yi4zhi4"

msgid "Wind Dancer"
msgstr ""
"风​舞者\n"
"feng1 wu3zhe3"

msgid "Winters disappears, and you find yourself back at the menu screen."
msgstr ""
"温特斯​消失​了​，​你​发现自己​回到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"Wen1te4si1 xiao1shi1 le5，ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 hui2dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"Winters leans forward and presses something off-screen. The display goes black.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, the main menu returns."
msgstr ""
"温特斯​向前​倾身​，​按下​屏幕​外​的​某个​按钮​。​显示屏​变黑​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​你​又​回到​了​主​菜单​。\n"
"\n"
"Wen1te4si1 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，an4xia4 ping2mu4 wai4 de5 mou3 ge4 an4niu3。xian3shi4ping2 bian4hei1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1。"

msgid ""
"Winters spent twenty years searching for Vauclair, and it got him nowhere. "
"How do you propose that we find him?"
msgstr ""
"温特斯​花​了​整整​二十年​的​时间​寻找​沃​克莱尔​，​最后​却​仍​一无所获​。​你​觉得​我们​怎么​才能​找到​他​？\n"
"Wen1te4si1 hua1 le5 zheng3zheng3 er4 shi2 nian2 de5 shi2jian1 xun2zhao3 Wo4ke4lai2er3，zui4hou4 que4 reng2 yi1wu2suo3huo4。ni3 jue2de5 wo3men5 zen3me5 cai2neng2 zhao3dao4 ta1？"

msgid ""
"Winters' image disappears. The display goes black.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, the main menu returns."
msgstr ""
"温特斯​的​图像​消失​了​。​显示屏​变黑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​你​又​回到​了​主​菜单​。\n"
"\n"
"Wen1te4si1 de5 tu2xiang4 xiao1shi1 le5。xian3shi4ping2 bian4hei1。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 zhu3 cai4dan1。"

msgid "Wired Reflexes With Reflex Trigger"
msgstr ""
"跳线​反射​触发器\n"
"tiao4 xian4 fan3she4 chu4fa1qi4"

msgid ""
"Wired Reflexes: Adds +1 Movement (passive). When triggered, user will dodge "
"the first attack against them each round. Cost: 1 AP. Duration: 3. Cooldown:"
" 4."
msgstr ""
"跳线​反射​：​增加​1​点​移动力​（​被动​）​。​触发​时​，​使用者​将​闪避​针对​他们​的​第一次​攻击​。​花费​：​1​点​行动​点​。​持续时间​：​3​回合​。​冷却​时间​：​4​回合​。\n"
"tiao4 xian4 fan3she4：zeng1jia1 1 dian3 yi2 dong4 li4 （bei4dong4）。chu4fa1 shi2，shi3yong4zhe3 jiang1 shan3bi4 zhen1dui4 ta1men5 de5 di4yi1ci4 gong1ji1。hua1fei4：1 dian3 xing2dong4 dian3。chi2xu4shi2jian1：3 hui2he2。leng3que4 shi2jian1：4 hui2he2。"

msgid "Wired Reflexes: Movement +1, Dodge Next Attack"
msgstr ""
"跳线​反射​：​移动力​+​1​，​闪避​下​一次​受到​的​攻击\n"
"tiao4 xian4 fan3she4：yi2 dong4 li4 +1，shan3bi4 xia4 yi1ci4 shou4dao4 de5 gong1ji1"

msgid "Wise decision."
msgstr ""
"明智​的​决定​。\n"
"ming2zhi4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid "With *your* world-class skills? However could that have happened?"
msgstr ""
"你​不是​有​一身​本领​吗​？​怎么​会​发生​这种​事​？\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 you3 yi1shen1 ben3ling3 ma5？zen3me5 hui4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4？"

msgid ""
"With 400 nuyen, we could make the purchase. Whatever you could spare would "
"be most appreciated."
msgstr ""
"有​400​新円​的话​，​我们​就​能​完成​购买​。​无论​你​能​拿出​多少​，​我们​都​将​不胜感激​。\n"
"you3 400 xin1 yuan2 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 wan2cheng2 gou4mai3。wu2lun4 ni3 neng2 na2chu1 duo1shao3，wo3men5 dou1 jiang1 bu4 sheng4 gan3 ji1。"

msgid ""
"With APEX down, the automated systems will be offline. We'll still have plenty of guards to deal with, though.\n"
"\n"
"Once we're in, we make our way across the grounds to the servants' entrance. From there, we use the freight elevator to make our way down the the lab."
msgstr ""
"APEX​已经​停摆​，​自动​防御​系统​也​会​随之​离线​。​不过​我们​仍然​要​对付​大量​守卫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​进去​之后​穿过​庭院​，​前往​仆人​入口​。​然后​我们​将​乘坐​货梯​前往​实验室​。\n"
"\n"
"APEX yi3jing1 ting2bai3，zi4dong4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 ye3 hui4 sui2zhi1 li2xian4。bu4guo4 wo3men5 reng2ran2 yao4 dui4fu5 da4liang4 shou3wei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jin4qu4 zhi1hou4 chuan1guo4 ting2yuan4，qian2wang3 pu2ren2 ru4kou3。ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiang1 cheng2zuo4 huo4ti1 qian2wang3 shi2yan4shi4。"

msgid ""
"With APEX down, the automated systems will be offline. We'll still have plenty of guards to deal with, though.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Lead the way, boss. We'll be right behind you."
msgstr ""
"APEX​已经​停摆​，​自动​防御​系统​也​会​随之​离线​。​不过​我们​仍然​要​对付​大量​守卫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​带路​吧​，​老大​。​我们​跟着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"APEX yi3jing1 ting2bai3，zi4dong4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 ye3 hui4 sui2zhi1 li2xian4。bu4guo4 wo3men5 reng2ran2 yao4 dui4fu5 da4liang4 shou3wei4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dai4lu4 ba1，lao3da4。wo3men5 gen1zhe5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"With APEX down, the automated systems will be offline. We'll still have plenty of guards to deal with, though.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good to go, $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"APEX​已经​停摆​，​自动​防御​系统​也​会​随之​离线​。​不过​我们​仍然​要​对付​大量​守卫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​准备​好了吗​，​$(l.name)​？\n"
"\n"
"APEX yi3jing1 ting2bai3，zi4dong4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 ye3 hui4 sui2zhi1 li2xian4。bu4guo4 wo3men5 reng2ran2 yao4 dui4fu5 da4liang4 shou3wei4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5，$(l.name)？"

msgid ""
"With APEX down, the automated systems will be offline. We'll still have plenty of guards to deal with, though.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Lead the way, $(l.name). We'll follow."
msgstr ""
"APEX​已经​停摆​，​自动​防御​系统​也​会​随之​离线​。​不过​我们​仍然​要​对付​大量​守卫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​带路​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​跟着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"APEX yi3jing1 ting2bai3，zi4dong4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 ye3 hui4 sui2zhi1 li2xian4。bu4guo4 wo3men5 reng2ran2 yao4 dui4fu5 da4liang4 shou3wei4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dai4lu4 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 gen1zhe5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"With APEX down, we have our opening. The estate's automated defenses will be offline.\n"
"\n"
"Attacking the holdfast should be doable now. Still risky, but doable."
msgstr ""
"随着​APEX​下线​，​我们​迎来​了​突破口​。​庄园​的​自动化​防御​系统​将​处于​离线​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​进攻​据点​应该​可行​。​风险​依然​存在​，​但​确实​可行​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 APEX xia4xian4，wo3men5 ying2lai2 le5 tu1po4kou3。zhuang1yuan2 de5 zi4dong4hua4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 jiang1 chu3yu2 li2xian4 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 jin4gong1 ju4dian3 ying1gai1 ke3xing2。feng1xian3 yi1ran2 cun2zai4，dan4 que4shi2 ke3xing2。"

msgid ""
"With APEX free, we shouldn't have to worry about the automated defenses "
"inside of the complex. Some of them might even give us a hand."
msgstr ""
"APEX​已经​自由​，​所以​我们​无需​担心​庄园​内​的​自动​防御​系统​。​其中​一些​系统​甚至​可能​还会​协助​我们​。\n"
"APEX yi3jing1 zi4you2，suo3yi3 wo3men5 wu2xu1 dan1xin1 zhuang1yuan2 nei4 de5 zi4dong4 fang2Yu4xi4tong3。qi2zhong1 yi1xie1 xi4tong3 shen4zhi4 ke3neng2 hai2 hui4 xie2zhu4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"With Harrow dead, all of this will stop.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away from you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"只要​哈罗​一死​，​这​一切​就​会​结束​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转身​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​继续前进​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ha1luo2 yi1 si3，zhe4 yi1qie4 jiu4 hui4 jie2shu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid "With a click, the line goes dead."
msgstr ""
"咔哒​一声​，​线路​被​挂断​了​。\n"
"ka3 da1 yi1sheng1，xian4lu4 bei4 gua4duan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"With a few keystrokes, you disable the safety overrides that keep APEX out of this system. The light in the containment chamber switches off and the woman looks up at it, surprised.\n"
"\n"
"In the dim light of the cell, you can still make out her yellow eyes dancing back and forth, back and forth, her hands clenching and unclenching again and again. "
msgstr ""
"你​几下​操作​便​禁用​了​阻止​APEX​进入​系统​的​安全​超控​。​收容​舱内​的​灯光​熄灭​，​女人​抬头​望​向​它​，​显得​十分​惊讶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​牢房​昏暗​的​光线​中​，​仍能​看见​她​那双​金黄色​的​眼睛​来回​闪烁​，​来回​闪烁​，​她​的​双手​不断​地​紧握​又​松开​，​反复​多次​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ji1 xia4 cao1zuo4 bian4 jin1yong4 le5 zu3zhi3 APEX jin4ru4 xi4tong3 de5 an1quan2 chao1 kong4。shou1rong2 cang1 nei4 de5 deng1guang1 xi1mie4，nu:3ren2 tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 ta1，xian3de5 shi2fen1 jing1ya4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 lao2fang2 hun1an4 de5 guang1xian4 zhong4，reng2 neng2 kan4jian4 ta1 na4 shuang1 jin1huang2se4 de5 yan3jing5 lai2hui2 shan3shuo4，lai2hui2 shan3shuo4，ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 bu4duan4 de5 jin3wo4 you4 song1kai1，fan3fu4 duo1ci4。"

msgid ""
"With a final burst of energy, she slams herself against the glass wall of "
"her cell over and over and over until she finally slides down to the floor."
msgstr ""
"最后​，​她​用​尽全力​，​一次​又​一次​地撞​向​牢房​的​玻璃墙​，​直到​最后​筋疲力尽​，​瘫倒​在​地​。\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 yong4 jin3 quan2 li4，yi1ci4 you4 yi1ci4 de5 zhuang4 xiang4 lao2fang2 de5 bo1 li2 qiang2，zhi2dao4 zui4hou4 jin1pi2li4jin4，tan1 dao3 zai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"With a final sigh of static, the tortured voice falls silent. APEX is gone."
msgstr ""
"伴随​着​最后​一声​杂音​般的​叹息​，​那​饱受​折磨​的​声音​终于​沉寂​。​APEX​消失​了​。\n"
"ban4sui2 zhao2 zui4hou4 yi1sheng1 za2yin1 ban1 de5 tan4xi1，na4 bao3shou4 zhe2mo2 de5 sheng1yin1 zhong1yu2 chen2ji4。APEX xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid "With a hollow splash, the contents of the fuel container are emptied."
msgstr ""
"随着​空洞​的​溅​水声​，​燃料​容器​内​已经​空无一物​。\n"
"sui2zhe5 kong1dong4 de5 jian4 shui3 sheng1，ran2liao4 rong2qi4 nei4 yi3jing1 kong1 wu2 yi1 wu4。"

msgid ""
"With a kick, he sends her tumbling to the ground, then turns back toward "
"James."
msgstr ""
"他​一脚​将​她​踹​倒​在​地​，​随即​转身​面对​詹姆斯​。\n"
"ta1 yi1 jiao3 jiang1 ta1 chuai4 dao3 zai4 de5，sui2ji2 zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 zhan1mu3si1。"

msgid ""
"With a mental command, you activate the MKVI. It takes a step forward, and you can hear the whir of actuators calibrating to adjust to its weight.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, the whirring sound dies down. It relaxes into a slight crouch."
msgstr ""
"你​用​意识​激活​了​MKVI​。​它​向前​迈出​一步​，​你​能​听见​执行器​嗡鸣​着​进行​校准​，​以​适应​它​的​体重​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒​后​，​嗡​鸣声​渐渐​平息​。​它​放松​身体​，​微微​蹲踞​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong4 yi4shi2 ji1huo2 le5 MKVI。ta1 xiang4qian2 mai4chu1 yi1 bu4，ni3 neng2 ting1jian4 zhi2 xing2 qi4 weng1 ming2 zhao2 jin4xing2 jiao4zhun3，yi3 shi4ying4 ta1 de5 ti3zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 hou4，weng1 ming2 sheng1 jian4jian4 ping2xi1。ta1 fang4song1 shen1ti3，wei1wei1 dun1ju4。"

msgid ""
"With a screech, Marta flings herself at Glory, all flailing fists and raking fingernails.\n"
"\n"
"Reflexively, Glory takes a half-step back. Her arms whip upward into a defensive posture."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​尖叫​着​扑​向​格洛丽​，​用​拳头​和​指甲​胡乱​挥舞​着​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​下意识​地​后退​半步​，​双臂​上扬​，​摆​出​防御​姿态​。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 jian1jiao4 zhao2 pu1 xiang4 Ge2luo4li2，yong4 quan2tou5 he4 zhi3jia5 hu2luan4 hui1wu3 zhao2。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2 xia4yi4shi2 de5 hou4tui4 ban4 bu4，shuang1bi4 shang4yang2，bai3 chu1 fang2yu4 zi1tai4。"

msgid ""
"With a series of deft motions, Blitz pop the plastic cover on an unused expansion slot in his cyberdeck and slides the Mystery Box home. A recessed LED light in the box goes from red to green.\n"
"\n"
"He boots up the deck, staring at the code that scrolls across its integrated display."
msgstr ""
"随着​一系列​熟练​的​动作​，​布里​茨​打开​了​赛博碟板​上​一个​未​使用​的​扩展​插槽​上​的​塑料盖​，​并​将​谜​匣​插入​到位​。​盒子​内嵌​的​LED​灯​从​红色​变为​绿色​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​启动​了​碟​板​，​凝视着​集成​显示屏​上​滚动​的​代码​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 yi1xi4lie4 shu2lian4 de5 dong4zuo4，Bu4li3ci2 da3kai1 le5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 shang4 yi1ge5 wei4 shi3yong4 de5 kuo4zhan3 cha1cao2 shang4 de5 su4 liao4 gai4，bing4 jiang1 mei4 xia2 cha1ru4 dao4wei4。he2zi5 nei4 kan3 de5 LED deng1 cong2 hong2se4 bian4wei2 lu:4se4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 qi3dong4 le5 die2 ban3，ning2 shi4 zhao2 ji2cheng2 xian3shi4ping2 shang4 gun3dong4 de5 dai4ma3。"

msgid ""
"With a series of deft motions, Blitz pops the plastic cover on an unused expansion slot in his cyberdeck and slides the Mystery Box home. A recessed LED light in the box goes from red to green.\n"
"\n"
"He boots up the deck, staring at the code that scrolls across its integrated display."
msgstr ""
"随着​一系列​熟练​的​动作​，​布里​茨​打开​了​赛博碟板​上​一个​未​使用​的​扩展​插槽​上​的​塑料盖​，​并​将​谜​匣​插入​到位​。​盒子​内嵌​的​LED​灯​从​红色​变为​绿色​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​启动​了​碟​板​，​凝视着​集成​显示屏​上​滚动​的​代码​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 yi1xi4lie4 shu2lian4 de5 dong4zuo4，Bu4li3ci2 da3kai1 le5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 shang4 yi1ge5 wei4 shi3yong4 de5 kuo4zhan3 cha1cao2 shang4 de5 su4 liao4 gai4，bing4 jiang1 mei4 xia2 cha1ru4 dao4wei4。he2zi5 nei4 kan3 de5 LED deng1 cong2 hong2se4 bian4wei2 lu:4se4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 qi3dong4 le5 die2 ban3，ning2 shi4 zhao2 ji2cheng2 xian3shi4ping2 shang4 gun3dong4 de5 dai4ma3。"

msgid ""
"With a sharp clicking sound, the maglock releases, and the drawer pops open."
msgstr ""
"只​听​咔哒​一声​，​磁力锁​松脱​开来​，​抽屉​应声​而开​。\n"
"zhi3 ting1 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1，ci2li4suo3 song1tuo1 kai1 lai2，chou1ti5 ying4sheng1 er2 kai1。"

msgid ""
"With a single motion, she snaps the chain. The pendant falls to the floor.\n"
"\n"
"The Heart of Feuerstelle lowers its eyeless head, then traces an elaborate gesture into the air. A warm glow envelops it, and a similar glow spills from Glory."
msgstr ""
"她​一把​拽​断​链子​，​吊坠​掉​在​地上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火坑​之心​垂下​没有​眼睛​的​头颅​，​随即​在​空气​中​划出​繁复​的​手势​。​温暖​的​光晕​将​其​笼罩​，​格洛丽​的​身上​也​发出​了​相似​的​辉光​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi1 ba3 zhuai1 duan4 lian4zi5，diao4zhui4 diao4 zai4 di4shang5。\n"
"\n"
"huo3keng1 zhi1 xin1 chui2xia4 mei2you3 yan3jing5 de5 tou2lu2，sui2ji2 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4 hua2 chu1 fan2fu4 de5 shou3shi4。wen1nuan3 de5 guang1yun4 jiang1 qi2 long3zhao4，Ge2luo4li2 de5 shen1shang5 ye3 fa1chu1 le5 xiang1si4 de5 hui1 guang1。"

msgid ""
"With a wet crunch, his body goes limp, and he falls to the floor.\n"
"\n"
"Blood immediately begins to pool beneath him from a large gash on his forehead."
msgstr ""
"随着​咣当​一声​，​他​的​身体​瘫软​下来​，​倒​在​地上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​前额​裂开​一道​大​口子​，​鲜血​开始​在​他​身下​汇集​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 guang1dang1 yi1sheng1，ta1 de5 shen1ti3 tan1ruan3 xia4lai5，dao3 zai4 di4shang5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 qian2e2 lie4kai1 yi1dao4 dai4 kou3zi5，xian1xue4 kai1shi3 zai4 ta1 shen1 xia4 hui4ji2。"

msgid ""
"With all due respect, Glory, I'm the leader of this team. *I'm* the one "
"who'll decide whether I can spare the time to help you or not."
msgstr ""
"恕我直言​，​格洛丽​，​我​可是​队长​。​*​我​*​有权​决定​抽出​时间​来​帮​你​。\n"
"shu4 wo3 zhi2 yan2，Ge2luo4li2，wo3 ke3shi4 dui4zhang3。*wo3*you3quan2 jue2ding4 chou1chu1 shi2jian1 lai2 bang1 ni3。"

msgid "With all due respect, that's none of your business, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"恕我直言​，​这​和​你​没​半点​关系​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"shu4 wo3 zhi2 yan2，zhe4 he4 ni3 mei2 ban4dian3 guan1xi5，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"With all due respect, you don't know what you're talking about. You haven't "
"seen what happens to the places that the Engineer goes to work on."
msgstr ""
"恕我直言​，​你​并不知道​自己​在​说​什么​。​你​没见​过​那些​被​工程师​荼毒​过​的​地方​都​成​了​什么​样子​。\n"
"shu4 wo3 zhi2 yan2，ni3 bing4 bu4 zhi1 dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。ni3 mei2 jian4 guo4 na4xie1 bei4 gong1cheng2shi1 tu2du2 guo4 de5 di4fang1 dou1 cheng2 le5 shen2me5 yang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"With an ear-splitting roar, the dragon's great bulk begins to rise. Waves of"
" hot, foetid breath wash over you as she struggles against her chains."
msgstr ""
"随着​一声​震耳欲聋​的​咆哮​，​巨龙​庞大​的​身躯​开始​缓缓​升起​。​她​挣扎​着​试图​挣脱​锁链​，​热浪​般的​臭气​扑面而来​。\n"
"sui2zhe5 yi1sheng1 zhen4er3yu4long2 de5 pao2xiao4，ju4long2 pang2da4 de5 shen1qu1 kai1shi3 huan3huan3 sheng1qi3。ta1 zheng1zha2 zhao2 shi4tu2 zheng4tuo1 suo3lian4，re4lang4 ban1 de5 chou4qi4 pu1mian4er2lai2。"

msgid ""
"With an ease born of endless repetition, you connect yourself to your cyberdeck, and your deck into the jackpoint.\n"
"\n"
"You body relaxes as the familiar sensation of sliding into the digital dream world of the Matrix overcomes you."
msgstr ""
"凭借​无数次​重复​的​熟练​操作​，​你​驾轻就熟​地连上​自己​的​赛博碟板​，​然后​插进​接入点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​熟悉​的​滑入​感​席卷​全身​，​你​开始​沉浸于​矩阵​的​数字​梦境​，​身体​随之​彻底​放松​。\n"
"\n"
"ping2jie4 wu2 shu3 ci4 chong2fu4 de5 shu2lian4 cao1zuo4，ni3 jia4qing1jiu4shu2 de5 lian2 shang4 zi4ji3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3，ran2hou4 cha1jin4 jie1ru4dian3。\n"
"\n"
"shu2xi1 de5 hua2 ru4 gan3 xi2juan3 quan2shen1，ni3 kai1shi3 chen2 jin4 yu2 ju3zhen4 de5 shu4zi4 meng4jing4，shen1ti3 sui2zhi1 che4di3 fang4song1。"

msgid ""
"With dawning horror, you realize what was bothering you before. Something is absent, and the realization makes your stomach churn.\n"
"\n"
"Her pendant. The protective charm that once glinted against her pale skin. It's gone."
msgstr ""
"随着​恐惧​逐渐​升腾​，​你​终于​明白​先前​困扰​自己​的​根源​。​你​意识​到​有​某样​东西​消失​了​，​这​让​你​胃里​一阵​翻江倒海​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​吊​坠​。​那个​曾​在​她​的​苍白​肌肤​上​熠熠生辉​的​护身符​。​它​不见​了​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 kong3ju4 zhu2jian4 sheng1teng2，ni3 zhong1yu2 ming2bai5 xian1qian2 kun4rao3 zi4ji3 de5 gen1yuan2。ni3 yi4shi2 dao4 you3 mou3 yang4 dong1xi1 xiao1shi1 le5，zhe4 rang4 ni3 wei4 li3 yi1zhen4 fan1jiang1dao3hai3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 diao4 zhui4。na4ge5 ceng2 zai4 ta1 de5 cang1bai2 ji1fu1 shang4 yi4 yi4 sheng1 hui1 de5 hu4shen1fu2。ta1 bu4jian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"With his attention focused on you, Hasenkamp doesn't see the pistol that "
"Meat Grinder pulls from his coat."
msgstr ""
"哈森​坎普​的​注意力​全都​放在​你​身上​，​并​没有​看到​“​绞肉机​”​从​外套​里​掏出​的​手枪​。\n"
"Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 zhu4yi4li4 quan2dou1 fang4 zai4 ni3 shen1shang5，bing4 mei2you3 kan4dao4“jiao3rou4ji1” cong2 wai4tao4 li3 tao1chu1 de5 shou3qiang1。"

msgid ""
"With luck? Enough money, resources, and influence to handle Feuerschwinge on"
" our own terms."
msgstr ""
"运气​好​的话​，​我们​能​弄​到​足够​用来​对付​火翼​的​金钱​、​权力​和​资源​。\n"
"yun4qi5 hao3 de5hua4，wo3men5 neng2 long4 dao4 zu2gou4 yong4lai2 dui4fu5 Huo3yi4 de5 jin1qian2、quan2li4 he4 zi1yuan2。"

msgid "With no more drones to control, the display goes dark."
msgstr ""
"没有​更​多​的​无人机​可以​控制​，​显示屏​随即​变黑​。\n"
"mei2you3 geng1 duo1 de5 wu2ren2ji1 ke3yi3 kong4zhi4，xian3shi4ping2 sui2ji2 bian4hei1。"

msgid "With nothing left to do here, you follow in his footsteps."
msgstr ""
"此间​事​已​了​，​于是​你​也​跟​在​他​后面​一同​上车​。\n"
"ci3jian1 shi4 yi3 le5，yu2shi4 ni3 ye3 gen1 zai4 ta1 hou4mian5 yi1tong2 shang4che1。"

msgid "With nothing left to do here, you follow them."
msgstr ""
"此间​事​已​了​，​于是​你​也​跟​在​他们​后面​一同​上车​。\n"
"ci3jian1 shi4 yi3 le5，yu2shi4 ni3 ye3 gen1 zai4 ta1men5 hou4mian5 yi1tong2 shang4che1。"

msgid "With nothing left to do here, you turn away and board the train."
msgstr ""
"此间​事​已​了​，​于是​你​转身​登上​了​火车​。\n"
"ci3jian1 shi4 yi3 le5，yu2shi4 ni3 zhuan3shen1 deng1shang4 le5 huo3che1。"

msgid "With pleasure."
msgstr ""
"乐意​之​至​。\n"
"le4yi4 zhi1 zhi4。"

msgid ""
"With practiced ease you call up a torrent of energy from the astral plane, shaping it with the force of your will. In a split second, a murderous bolt of raw power materializes and slams into the wageslave's chest.\n"
"\n"
"He's dead before he hits the floor."
msgstr ""
"你​轻而易举​地​从​星界​召唤​出​一股​能量​洪流​，​用​你​的​意志力​将​其​塑造​。​刹那间​，​一股​凶猛​的​原始​力量​喷涌​而出​，​狠狠​击中​那名​薪奴​的​胸膛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​还​没​倒地​就​已经​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 qing1er2yi4ju3 de5 cong2 xing1 jie4 zhao4huan4 chu1 yi1 gu3 neng2liang4 hong2liu2，yong4 ni3 de5 yi4zhi4li4 jiang1 qi2 su4zao4。cha4 na4 jian1，yi1 gu3 xiong1meng3 de5 yuan2shi3 li4liang5 pen1yong3 er2 chu1，hen3hen3 ji1zhong4 na4 ming2 xin1 nu2 de5 xiong1tang2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 hai2 mei2 dao3di4 jiu4 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"With practiced ease you call up a torrent of energy from the astral plane, shaping it with the force of your will. In a split second, a scintillating projectile materializes and slams into the wageslave, scattering his consciousness and sending him tumbling to the ground.\n"
"\n"
"Glancing at the wageslave's crumpled body, you can see that he's unconscious, but otherwise unharmed."
msgstr ""
"你​轻而易举​地​从​星界​召唤​出​一股​能量​洪流​，​用​你​的​意志力​将​其​塑造​。​刹那间​，​一股​凶猛​的​原始​力量​喷涌​而出​，​狠狠​击中​那名​薪奴​，​使​他​失去​意识​倒​在​地上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​瞥​了​一眼​那名​薪奴​软绵绵​的​身体​，​知道​他​昏​了​过去​，​但​并未​受到​伤害​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 qing1er2yi4ju3 de5 cong2 xing1 jie4 zhao4huan4 chu1 yi1 gu3 neng2liang4 hong2liu2，yong4 ni3 de5 yi4zhi4li4 jiang1 qi2 su4zao4。cha4 na4 jian1，yi1 gu3 xiong1meng3 de5 yuan2shi3 li4liang5 pen1yong3 er2 chu1，hen3hen3 ji1zhong4 na4 ming2 xin1 nu2，shi3 ta1 shi1qu4 yi4shi2 dao3 zai4 di4shang5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4 ming2 xin1 nu2 ruan3mian2mian2 de5 shen1ti3，zhi1dao4 ta1 hun1 le5 guo4qu4，dan4 bing4wei4 shou4dao4 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"With practiced ease, the girl snaps the cap off the ampoule and raises it to take a hit. With a practiced hand, she injects a squirt of orange liquid into the corner of each eye.\n"
"\n"
"Her whole body begins to shiver as the drug kicks in."
msgstr ""
"女孩​老练​地​把​安瓿瓶​的​瓶头​折断​，​然后​举​起来​上药​。​她​往​两只​眼​的​眼角​各​喷​了​一点​橙色​液体​，​手法​十分​熟练​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​药劲​一​上来​，​她​整个​身体​也​哆嗦​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"nu:3hai2 lao3lian4 de5 ba3 an1bu4ping2 de5 ping2 tou2 zhe2duan4，ran2hou4 ju3 qi3lai5 shang4 yao4。ta1 wang3 liang3 zhi3 yan3 de5 yan3jiao3 ge4 pen1 le5 yi1dian3 cheng2se4 ye4ti3，shou3fa3 shi2fen1 shu2lian4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 jin4 yi1 shang4lai2，ta1 zheng3ge4 shen1ti3 ye3 duo1suo5 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"With that kind of gear? Bullshit.\n"
"\n"
"If you're here for the Hub, then I'm a cross-dressing elf."
msgstr ""
"打扮​成​这样​？​别​扯淡​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​是​来​找​中枢​的​，​那​我​就是​个​女装​精灵​。\n"
"\n"
"da3ban5 cheng2 zhe4yang4？bie4 che3dan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shi4 lai2 zhao3 zhong1shu1 de5，na4 wo3 jiu4shi4 ge4 nu:3zhuang1 jing1ling2。"

msgid ""
"With that out of the way, let us return to our pressing business.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He barks a stream of rapid-fire Turkish, and the gum-chewing young woman comes hurrying out to the counter.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"既然​此事​已​了​，​我们​就​继续​处理​更​要紧​的​事务​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​连珠炮​般嚷​了​一串​土耳其语​，​那个​嚼​口香糖​的​年轻​女人​急忙​来到​柜台​前​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ci3shi4 yi3 le5，wo3men5 jiu4 ji4xu4 chu3li3 geng1 yao4jin3 de5 shi4wu4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian2zhu1pao4 ban1 rang3 le5 yi1 chuan4 tu3er3qi2yu3，na4ge5 jiao2 kou3xiang1tang2 de5 nian2qing1 nu:3ren2 ji2mang2 lai2dao4 gui4tai2 qian2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"With that, the video comes to an end. You find yourself dumped back to the "
"Menu screen."
msgstr ""
"视频​到​这里​就​结束​了​。​你​发现自己​又​回到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"shi4pin2 dao4 zhe4li3 jiu4 jie2shu4 le5。ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 you4 hui2dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"With the alarms already screaming from your encounter downstairs, all that you can hear is the meaty smack of the corporate man's palm against the button's plastic housing. But off in the distance, you can faintly make out the sound of rapid footsteps.\n"
"\n"
"Meanwhile, the homeowner backpedals, trying to put a wall between himself and James. He's moving too slowly - much too slowly."
msgstr ""
"楼下​遭遇​的​警报声​早已​尖锐​刺耳​，​此刻​你​听到​的​唯有​公司​职员​厚实​的​手掌​拍打​按钮​塑料​外壳​的​噗​噗声​。​但​远处​隐约​传来​急促​的​脚步声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​与此同时​，​房主​急忙​后退​，​试图​在​自己​和​詹姆斯​之间​筑起​一道​墙​。​他​的​动作​太慢​了​—​—​慢得​离谱​。\n"
"\n"
"lou2xia4 zao1yu4 de5 jing3 bao4 sheng1 zao3yi3 jian1rui4 ci4er3，ci3ke4 ni3 ting1dao4 de5 wei2you3 gong1si1 zhi2yuan2 hou4shi5 de5 shou3zhang3 pai1da5 an4niu3 su4liao4 wai4ke2 de5 pu1 pu1 sheng1。dan4 yuan3chu4 yin3yue1 chuan2lai2 ji2cu4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，fang2zhu3 ji2mang2 hou4tui4，shi4tu2 zai4 zi4ji3 he4 zhan1mu3si1 zhi1jian1 zhu4 qi3 yi1dao4 qiang2。ta1 de5 dong4zuo4 tai4 man4 le5——man4 de2 li2pu3。"

msgid "With the help of an information broker."
msgstr ""
"通过​情报​商​的​帮助​。\n"
"tong1guo4 qing2bao4 shang1 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"With the passing of Herr Amsel - may God bestow His mercy on him - you find yourself without a Fixer. \n"
"\n"
"I wish to offer my services to you in this regard. You will find that Altuğ Burakgazi is a most connected and business-savvy partner."
msgstr ""
"阿姆​泽尔​先生​如今​不幸​离世​，​愿​上帝​授与​他​慈悲​。​而​另一方面​，​你​也​失去​了​中间人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​到​这个​，​我​愿意​为​你​提供​服务​。​我​奥图​伊​·​布拉加​齐人脉​广泛​，​而且​精通业务​，​绝对​是​你​合作​的​好​伙伴​。\n"
"\n"
"E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 ru2jin1 bu4xing4 li2shi4，yuan4 shang4di4 shou4yu3 ta1 ci2bei1。er2 ling4yi1fang1mian4，ni3 ye3 shi1qu4 le5 zhong1jian1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5，wo3 yuan4yi4 wei2 ni3 ti2gong1 fu2wu4。wo3 ao4 tu2 yi1 · bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 ren2 mai4 guang3fan4，er2qie3 jing1 tong1 ye4 wu4，jue2dui4 shi4 ni3 he2zuo4 de5 hao3 huo3ban4。"

msgid ""
"With the shrine's power at his disposal, he doesn't have to do that any more. He just brings his new recruits back here, and it takes care of the rest.\n"
"\n"
"I think that he's let himself become dependent on the damned thing."
msgstr ""
"有​了​神龛​的​力量​傍身​，​他​再也​不用​做​那些​事​了​。​直接​把​新人​带到​这里​，​剩下​的​就​交给​神龛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在我看来​，​那鬼​东西​已经​反客为主​了​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 le5 shen2kan1 de5 li4liang5 bang4 shen1，ta1 zai4ye3 bu4yong4 zuo4 na4xie1 shi4 le5。zhi2jie1 ba3 xin1ren2 dai4 dao4 zhe4li3，sheng4xia4 de5 jiu4 jiao1gei3 shen2kan1。\n"
"\n"
"zai4wo3kan4lai2，na4 gui3 dong1xi1 yi3jing1 fan3ke4wei2zhu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"With the solar panels, you won't even need the tap. You can dismantle it "
"before they find it."
msgstr ""
"有​了​新​的​太阳能​板后​，​你们​甚至​都​不​需要​电力​接口​了​。​你​在​他们​发现​之前​把​它​拆下来​就​好​了​。\n"
"you3 le5 xin1 de5 tai4yang2neng2 ban3 hou4，ni3men5 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 xu1yao4 dian4li4 jie1kou3 le5。ni3 zai4 ta1men5 fa1xian4 zhi1qian2 ba3 ta1 chai1 xia4 lai2 jiu4 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"With the techniques described in this document, a spellcaster could use a person's blood as a magical conduit.\n"
"\n"
"In layman's terms, a spell could be channeled through a father to kill his son, through a niece to kill her aunt. Anyone with a hereditary connection to the original target, regardless of distance."
msgstr ""
"通过​这份​文件​中​所​描述​的​技术​，​施法​者​就​能够​将​人​的​血液​作为​魔法​的​传导​媒介​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​通俗​来说​，​可​对​父亲​施展​法术​来​杀害​其​儿子​，​或者​对​侄女​施展​法术​来​杀害​其​姑妈​。​任何​与​原始​目标​存在​血缘关系​的​人​皆​可​成为​目标​，​无论​亲疏​远近​。\n"
"\n"
"tong1guo4 zhe4 fen4 wen2jian4 zhong4 suo3 miao2shu4 de5 ji4shu4，shi1fa3 zhe3 jiu4 neng2gou4 jiang1 ren2 de5 xue4ye4 zuo4wei2 mo2fa3 de5 chuan2dao3 mei2jie4。\n"
"\n"
"tong1su2 lai2 shuo1，ke3 dui4 fu4qin1 shi1zhan3 fa3shu4 lai2 sha1hai4 qi2 er2zi5，huo4zhe3 dui4 zhi2nu:3 shi1zhan3 fa3shu4 lai2 sha1hai4 qi2 gu1ma1。ren4he2 yu4 yuan2shi3 mu4biao1 cun2zai4 xue4yuan2guan1xi4 de5 ren2 jie1 ke3 cheng2wei2 mu4biao1，wu2lun4 qin1shu1 yuan3jin4。"

msgid ""
"With this contribution, we now have ¥$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) "
"saved toward our ¥250 goal."
msgstr ""
"有​了​这笔​捐款​，​我们​已经​为​250​新円​的​目标​存下​了​$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations)​新円​。\n"
"you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 yi3jing1 wei2 250 xin1 yuan2 de5 mu4biao1 cun2 xia4 le5 $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"With this contribution, we now have ¥$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) "
"saved toward our ¥350 goal."
msgstr ""
"有​了​这笔​捐款​，​我们​已经​为​350​新円​的​目标​存下​了​$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations)​新円​。\n"
"you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 yi3jing1 wei2 350 xin1 yuan2 de5 mu4biao1 cun2 xia4 le5 $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"With this contribution, we now have ¥$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) "
"saved toward our ¥500 goal."
msgstr ""
"有​了​这笔​捐款​，​我们​已经​为​500​新円​的​目标​存下​了​$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations)​新円​。\n"
"you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 yi3jing1 wei2 500 xin1 yuan2 de5 mu4biao1 cun2 xia4 le5 $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"With this contribution,e now have ¥$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) "
"saved toward our ¥400 goal."
msgstr ""
"有​了​这笔​捐款​，​我们​已经​为​400​新円​的​目标​存下​了​$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations)​新円​。\n"
"you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 yi3jing1 wei2 400 xin1 yuan2 de5 mu4biao1 cun2 xia4 le5 $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"With this donation, we have reached our first goal. Thank you so much for your kind assistance!\n"
"\n"
"I will put your contribution to work stocking the shelter with blankets and heaters."
msgstr ""
"有​了​这笔​捐款​，​我们​就​实现​了​第一个​目标​。​非常感谢​你​的​善意​帮助​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​将​你​的​捐款​用于​为​避难所​添置​毛毯​和​取暖器​。\n"
"\n"
"you3 le5 zhe4 bi3 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 jiu4 shi2xian4 le5 di4 yi1 ge4 mu4biao1。fei1chang2gan3xie4 ni3 de5 shan4yi4 bang1zhu4！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jiang1 ni3 de5 juan1kuan3 yong4yu2 wei2 bi4nan4suo3 tian1zhi4 mao2tan3 he4 qu3 nuan3 qi4。"

msgid ""
"With this great victory, I declare a new age of exploration and commerce! My"
" peasants will form trade agreements with our neighboring kingdoms, for the "
"betterment of all!"
msgstr ""
"凭借​这场​伟大​的​胜利​，​我​宣布​开启​探索​与​贸易​的​新纪元​！​我​的​臣民​们​将​与​邻近​王国​缔结​贸易协定​，​以​造福​所有​生灵​！\n"
"ping2jie4 zhe4 chang2 wei3da4 de5 sheng4li4，wo3 xuan1bu4 kai1qi3 tan4suo3 yu4 mao4yi4 de5 xin1ji4yuan2！wo3 de5 chen2min2 men5 jiang1 yu4 lin2jin4 wang2guo2 di4jie2 mao4yi4xie2ding4，yi3 zao4fu2 suo3you3 sheng1ling2！"

msgid ""
"With those dainty little arms? I don't think so, elf.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, if you force me to have my men kill you now, you'll miss the big show."
msgstr ""
"就​凭​你​那细​胳膊​细腿​？​还是​算了吧​，​精灵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再说​了​，​如果​你​现在​逼​我​让​我​的​手下​干掉​你​，​你​可​就​错过​好戏​了​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 ping2 ni3 na4 xi4 ge1bo5 xi4 tui3？hai2shi5 suan4 le5 ba1，jing1ling2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1 le5，ru2guo3 ni3 xian4zai4 bi1 wo3 rang4 wo3 de5 shou3xia4 gan4diao4 ni3，ni3 ke3 jiu4 cuo4guo4 hao3 xi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"With you there, boss.\n"
"\n"
"Come on. Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"我​同意​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​我们​赶紧​把​这​事儿​解决​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 shi4r5 jie3jue2 diao4。"

msgid "With you? Not a chance."
msgstr ""
"跟​你​啊​？​拉倒​吧​。\n"
"gen1 ni3 a1？la1dao3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Within seconds, all that's left of the little drone is a molten wreck on the charging cradle. Foul-smelling smoke pours from the remains.\n"
"\n"
"You steal another glance at the chip that you recovered, and turn away."
msgstr ""
"几秒钟​内​，​这架​小型​无人机​只​剩下​充电​底座​上​的​一堆​熔化​残骸​。​刺鼻​的​烟雾​从​其中​冒​出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​又​瞥​了​一眼​那块​你​找回​的​芯片​，​然后​转身​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 nei4，zhe4 jia4 xiao3xing2 wu2ren2ji1 zhi3 sheng4xia4 chong1dian4 di3zuo4 shang4 de5 yi1dui1 rong2hua4 can2hai2。ci4bi2 de5 yan1wu4 cong2 qi2zhong1 mao4 chu1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4 kuai4 ni3 zhao3hui2 de5 xin1pian4，ran2hou4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"Without a word, Alexander wheels around and points the rifle at Stahl. The Humanis Leader recoils in alarm.\n"
"\n"
"Alexander levels the weapon, and all hell breaks loose."
msgstr ""
"亚历山大​二话不说​，​猛然​转身​将​步枪​对准​斯塔尔​。​人类​至上​主义者​的​首领​惊恐​地​后退​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​亚历山大​平举​武器​，​场面​顿时​陷入​一片​混乱​。\n"
"\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4 er4hua4bu4shuo1，meng3ran2 zhuan3shen1 jiang1 bu4qiang1 dui4zhun3 Si1ta3er3。ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 shou3ling3 jing1kong3 de5 hou4tui4。\n"
"\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4 ping2 ju3 wu3qi4，chang3mian4 dun4shi2 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 hun4luan4。"

msgid ""
"Without a word, the elf hitches his weapons over his shoulder.\n"
"\n"
"He steps past you and boards the train."
msgstr ""
"精灵​一言不发​地​把​武器​背​在​肩上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​大步​越过​你​，​登上​了​火车​。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 ba3 wu3qi4 bei1 zai4 jian1 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 da4bu4 yue4guo4 ni3，deng1shang4 le5 huo3che1。"

msgid "Without another word, he turns and exits the room."
msgstr ""
"说完​，​他​转身​离开​了​房间​。\n"
"shuo1 wan2，ta1 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 le5 fang2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Without another word, she turns back to the elf.\n"
"\n"
"Together, they board the train."
msgstr ""
"她​一言不发​，​又​转回​精灵​的​方向​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​二人​一起​登上​了​火车​。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1，you4 zhuan3hui2 jing1ling2 de5 fang1xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"er4 ren2 yi1qi3 deng1shang4 le5 huo3che1。"

msgid ""
"Without another word, the mage turns and stalks off in the direction of the "
"penthouse."
msgstr ""
"法师​不再​说话​，​转身​向着​顶层​公寓​走​去​。\n"
"fa3shi1 bu4zai4 shuo1hua4，zhuan3shen1 xiang4zhe5 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 zou3 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Without another word, the troll slides her shotgun into the sheath on her "
"back and turns to continue her pre-mission checklist."
msgstr ""
"巨魔​没有​再说​什么​，​将​霰弹枪​塞回​背后​的​枪套​中​，​转身​继续​核对​她​的​任务​清单​去​了​。\n"
"ju4mo2 mei2you3 zai4shuo1 shen2me5，jiang1 xian4dan4qiang1 se4 hui2 bei4hou4 de5 qiang1 tao4 zhong4，zhuan3shen1 ji4xu4 he2dui4 ta1 de5 ren4wu5 qing1dan1 qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Without disabling the generators' safety overrides, such a spike wouldn't "
"cause any permanent damage. But without power, Aztechnology's defenses would"
" be weakened, making your job that much easier."
msgstr ""
"只要​不​关闭​发电机​的​安全​超控​装置​，​就​不会​造成​永久性​损坏​。​但​一旦​断电​，​阿兹特​科技​的​防御​系统​就​会​被​削弱​，​这会​让​你​的​任务​轻松​许多​。\n"
"zhi3yao4 bu4 guan1bi4 fa1dian4ji1 de5 an1quan2 chao1 kong4 zhuang1zhi4，jiu4 bu4hui4 zao4cheng2 yong3jiu3xing4 sun3huai4。dan4 yi1dan4 duan4dian4，E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 fang2Yu4xi4tong3 jiu4 hui4 bei4 xue1ruo4，zhe4 hui4 rang4 ni3 de5 ren4wu5 qing1song1 xu3duo1。"

msgid ""
"Without shifting your attention away from Glory, you allow your "
"consciousness to partially slip into the astral plane."
msgstr ""
"你​继续​将​注意力​保持​在​格洛丽​身上​，​同时​又​让​部分​意识​渗透到​了​星界​中​。\n"
"ni3 ji4xu4 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 bao3chi2 zai4 Ge2luo4li2 shen1shang5，tong2shi2 you4 rang4 bu4fen5 yi4shi2 shen4 tou4 dao4 le5 xing1 jie4 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Without the food guaranteed by the contract, the feral ones have gone mad. "
"And in their madness, they have made it too dangerous for us to maintain the"
" pumps."
msgstr ""
"没有​了​合同​提供​的​食物​，​那些​凶猛​的​族裔​已经​日渐​疯狂​。​在​这种​情况​下​，​我们​要​维护​水泵​运转​就​太​危险​了​。\n"
"mei2you3 le5 he2tong5 ti2gong1 de5 shi2wu4，na4xie1 xiong1meng3 de5 zu2yi4 yi3jing1 ri4jian4 feng1kuang2。zai4 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 xia4，wo3men5 yao4 wei2hu4 shui3beng4 yun4zhuan3 jiu4 tai4 wei1xian3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Without waiting for a response, he taps a couple of keys on the console, and"
" your PDA starts recieving visuals from around the building."
msgstr ""
"不​等​你​回应​，​他​便​在​控制​台上​敲​了​几下​按键​，​你​的​PDA​随即​开始​接收​大楼​各处​的​监控​画面​。\n"
"bu4 deng3 ni3 hui2ying4，ta1 bian4 zai4 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 qiao1 le5 ji1 xia4 an4jian4，ni3 de5 PDA sui2ji2 kai1shi3 jie1shou1 da4lou2 ge4chu4 de5 jian1kong4 hua4mian4。"

msgid ""
"Without warning, Monika's back arches violently and her head jerks back, silencing her terrible screams. Muscle spasms ripple through her face, and her jaw snaps shut, sending a mist of blood spraying from between her teeth. You look down to see a nub of pink flesh hit the floor.\n"
"\n"
"The tip of her tongue."
msgstr ""
"事情​发生​得​毫无​预兆​。​莫妮卡​的​后背​猛地​弓起​，​头​向​后​坠下​，​她​骇人​的​惨叫​随即​戛然而止​。​她​面部​的​每​一块​肌肉​都​在​剧烈​痉挛​，​下颌​猛地​合拢​，​齿缝​间​顿时​喷出​一股​血雾​。​你​低头​看见​一块​粉红色​的​肉块​砸​落​在​地板​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​她​的​舌尖​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 fa1sheng1 de2 hao2wu2 yu4zhao4。Mo4ni1ka3 de5 hou4bei4 meng3de5 gong1 qi3，tou2 xiang4 hou4 zhui4 xia4，ta1 hai4ren2 de5 can3jiao4 sui2ji2 jia2ran2er2zhi3。ta1 mian4bu4 de5 mei3 yi1kuai4 ji1rou4 dou1 zai4 ju4lie4 jing4luan2，xia4he2 meng3de5 he2long3，chi3 feng2 jian1 dun4shi2 pen1chu1 yi1 gu3 xie3 wu4。ni3 di1tou2 kan4jian4 yi1kuai4 fen3hong2se4 de5 rou4 kuai4 za2 la4 zai4 di4ban3 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ta1 de5 she2jian1。"

msgid ""
"Without warning, the Engineer's cyberarms begin to twitch.\n"
"\n"
"His body bucks convulsively while his dead eyes stare straight ahead."
msgstr ""
"突然​，​工程师​的​赛博​手臂​毫无​预警​地​开始​抖动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​身体​剧烈​抽搐​着​，​死鱼​般的​双眼​直直地​盯​着​前方​。\n"
"\n"
"tu1ran2，gong1cheng2shi1 de5 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 hao2wu2 yu4jing3 de5 kai1shi3 dou3dong4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shen1ti3 ju4lie4 chou1chu4 zhao2，si3 yu2 ban1 de5 shuang1yan3 zhi2 zhi2 de5 ding1 zhao2 qian2fang1。"

msgid ""
"Without warning, the Monika-image begins to *change.* Her porcelain flesh begins to ripple and writhe, and the screen explodes into static.\n"
"\n"
"A moment later, the image clears. Something cold and mechanical fills your vision."
msgstr ""
"毫无​预兆​地​，​莫妮卡​的​影像​开始​*​变化​*​。​她​的​瓷白​皮肤​开始​波动​翻腾​，​使​屏幕​爆炸​成​一片​雪花​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​后​，​影像​恢复​清晰​。​一种​冷冽​机械​的​景象​填满​了​你​的​视野​。\n"
"\n"
"hao2wu2 yu4zhao4 de5，Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 kai1shi3*bian4hua4*。ta1 de5 ci2 bai2 pi2fu1 kai1shi3 bo1dong4 fan1teng2，shi3 ping2mu4 bao4zha4 cheng2 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 hou4，ying3xiang4 hui1fu4 qing1xi1。yi1zhong3 leng3lie4 ji1xie4 de5 jing3xiang4 tian2man3 le5 ni3 de5 shi4ye3。"

msgid ""
"Without warning, your commlink's screen bursts into static. You hear a telltale series of clicks: Someone has established an audio connection to your commlink.\n"
"\n"
"A moment later, a deep, sonorous voice speaks into your ear. You recognize it instantly: your Lodge contact, Luca Duerr."
msgstr ""
"你​的​通讯​链​毫无​征兆​地​发出​干扰​噪音​，​紧接着​又​响起​一连串​咔哒​声​：​有人​通过​音频​接入​了​你​的​通讯​链​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​出​片刻​，​一个​低沉​浑厚​的​嗓音​在​你​耳边​响起​。​你​立刻​认出​了​这个​声音​：​你​的​结社​联络人​卢卡​·​杜尔​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 hao2wu2 zheng1zhao4 de5 fa1chu1 gan1rao3 zao4yin1，jin3jie1zhe5 you4 xiang3qi3 yi1lian2chuan4 ka3 da1 sheng1：you3ren2 tong1guo4 yin1pin2 jie1ru4 le5 ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 chu1 pian4ke4，yi1ge5 di1chen2 hun2hou4 de5 sang3yin1 zai4 ni3 er3 bian1 xiang3qi3。ni3 li4ke4 ren4chu1 le5 zhe4ge5 sheng1yin1：ni3 de5 jie2she4 lian2luo4ren2 lu2ka3 · du4 er3。"

msgid ""
"Wolff went down first. The sound of it will haunt me for the rest of my days... an explosion, a choked scream, and then this long, drawn-out gurgling sound.\n"
"\n"
"When he died, his drones went down with him, and there were too many hostiles to track without them."
msgstr ""
"沃尔夫​第一个​倒下​。​那​声音​我​这辈子​都​忘不掉​……​一声​巨响​，​一声​哽咽​的​惨叫​，​然后​是​漫长​而​拖沓​的​咽气​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​死​后​，​他​的​无人机​也​随之​坠毁​，​我们​剩下​的​人​根本无法​应付​四面八方​涌来​的​敌人​。\n"
"\n"
"wo4er3fu1 di4 yi1 ge4 dao3xia4。na4 sheng1yin1 wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 dou1 wang4 bu4 diao4……yi1sheng1 ju4xiang3，yi1sheng1 geng3ye4 de5 can3jiao4，ran2hou4 shi4 man4chang2 er2 tuo1ta4 de5 yan4qi4 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 si3 hou4，ta1 de5 wu2ren2ji1 ye3 sui2zhi1 zhui4hui3，wo3men5 sheng4xia4 de5 ren2 gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 ying4fu5 si4mian4ba1fang1 yong3 lai2 de5 di2ren2。"

msgid "Wolfhound"
msgstr ""
"猎​狼犬\n"
"lie4 lang2 quan3"

msgid ""
"Women and girls from Eastern Europe were being housed there. When the convoys came, they'd be crammed into cargo containers and hauled across the border into Germany.\n"
"\n"
"Go to any brothel along the border, and have a look around. Chances are, you'll find at least a few girls who spent some time in those warehouses."
msgstr ""
"大批​来自​东欧​的​妇人​和​女孩​们​被​暂时​圈禁​在​此​。​等到​运输​车队​抵达​时​，​她们​就​会​被​塞进​货运​集装箱​，​通过​边境​进入​德国​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​去​边境​附近​的​任何​一家​妓院​转转​。​那里​起码​都​有​几个​姑娘​曾​在​那些​仓库​里​待​过​。\n"
"\n"
"da4pi1 lai2zi4 dong1ou1 de5 fu4ren2 he4 nu:3hai2 men5 bei4 zan4shi2 juan1 jin1 zai4 ci3。deng3dao4 yun4shu1 che1dui4 di3da2 shi2，ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 bei4 se4 jin4 huo4yun4 ji2zhuang1xiang1，tong1guo4 bian1jing4 jin4ru4 de2guo2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 qu4 bian1jing4 fu4jin4 de5 ren4he2 yi1jia1 ji4yuan4 zhuan4zhuan5。na4li5 qi3ma3 dou1 you3 ji3ge5 gu1niang5 ceng2 zai4 na4xie1 cang1ku4 li3 dai1 guo4。"

msgid "Wonderful man, lovely assistant, black curtains. Got it."
msgstr ""
"了不起​的​人物​，​漂亮​助手​，​黑色​门帘​。​明白​了​。\n"
"liao3bu5qi3 de5 ren2wu4，piao4liang5 zhu4shou3，hei1se4 men2 lian2。ming2bai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Wonderful! You may use any available terminal in the other room. Now, if we "
"may discuss your donatio--"
msgstr ""
"太好了​！​你​可以​随意​使用​另个​房间​里​任何​空闲​的​终端​。​现在​我们​能否​讨论一下​捐赠​的​事​—​—\n"
"tai4hao3le5！ni3 ke3yi3 sui2yi4 shi3yong4 ling4 ge4 fang2jian1 li3 ren4he2 kong4xian2 de5 zhong1duan1。xian4zai4 wo3men5 neng2fou3 tao3 lun2 yi1 xia4 juan1zeng4 de5 shi4 — —"

msgid ""
"Wonderful.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger exhales heavily.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If he's staying there, he must be arranging some sort of deal with them. "
msgstr ""
"太好了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​深吸​一口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​他​待​在​那里​的话​，​说明​他​肯定​是​和​他们​在​做​什么​交易​。\n"
"\n"
"tai4hao3le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 dai1 zai4 na4li5 de5hua4，shuo1ming2 ta1 ken3ding4 shi4 he4 ta1men5 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5 jiao1yi4。"

msgid "Wonderful. How about that DVD player?"
msgstr ""
"太好了​。​你​这​有​DVD​播放器​吗​？\n"
"tai4hao3le5。ni3 zhe4 you3 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Wonderful. Late, *and* a smartass.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances down at his chronometer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have a important meeting in a few hours, so let's get to the penthouse and plant the cameras. I'll mask them against detection, and then we can all go our separate ways."
msgstr ""
"太棒了​。​不仅​迟到​，​还​喜欢​耍​小聪明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​低头​瞥​了​眼​计时器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​几小时​后​有​个​重要​会议​。​我们​赶紧​去​顶层​公寓​安装​摄像头​吧​。​我会​屏蔽​它们​的​探测​信号​，​之后​咱们​就​能​各​走​各路​了​。\n"
"\n"
"tai4 bang4 le5。bu4jin3 chi2dao4，hai2 xi3huan5 shua3 xiao3cong1ming5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 pie1 le5 yan3 ji4shi2qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji1 xiao3 shi2 hou4 you3 ge4 zhong4yao4 hui4yi4。wo3men5 gan3jin3 qu4 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 an1zhuang1 she4xiang4tou2 ba1。wo3 hui4 ping2bi4 ta1men5 de5 tan4ce4 xin4hao4，zhi1hou4 zan2men5 jiu4 neng2 ge4 zou3 ge4 lu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Wonderful. More mock indignation from the professional killer.\n"
"\n"
"You should really take a step back and get a grip, ace. Hysteria doesn't become you."
msgstr ""
"啧​，​职业杀手​又​开始​假装​义愤填膺​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​退一步​海阔天空​，​好好​冷静​下​吧​，​王牌​。​歇斯底里​可不​适合​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ze2，zhi2 ye4 sha1 shou3 you4 kai1shi3 jia3zhuang1 yi4fen4tian2ying1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"tui4 yi1 bu4 hai3kuo4tian1kong1，hao3hao3 leng3jing4 xia4 ba1，wang2pai2。xie1si1di3li3 ke3bu5 shi4he2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Wonderful. We've got a job to do, and half of the team goes running off "
"before I even get here."
msgstr ""
"真​行​。​我们​是​来​做​差事​的​，​结果​我​还​没到​这里​，​半数​队员​就​已经​开始​瞎​跑​了​。\n"
"zhen1 xing2。wo3men5 shi4 lai2 zuo4 cha4shi4 de5，jie1guo3 wo3 hai2 mei2 dao4 zhe4li3，ban4shu4 dui4yuan2 jiu4 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 xia1 pao2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Wonderful. We've got a job to do, and half of the team goes running off "
"before I get here."
msgstr ""
"真​行​。​我们​是​来​做​差事​的​，​结果​我​还​没到​这里​，​半数​队员​就​已经​开始​瞎​跑​了​。\n"
"zhen1 xing2。wo3men5 shi4 lai2 zuo4 cha4shi4 de5，jie1guo3 wo3 hai2 mei2 dao4 zhe4li3，ban4shu4 dui4yuan2 jiu4 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 xia1 pao2 le5。"

msgid "Woof!"
msgstr ""
"汪​！\n"
"wang1！"

msgid "Word travels fast around here."
msgstr ""
"消息​传​得​挺快​啊​。\n"
"xiao1xi5 chuan2 de2 ting3 kuai4 a1。"

msgid ""
"Wordlessly, Jana pops an access panel at the base of the terminal and begins snipping wires.\n"
"\n"
"A few minutes later, she replaces the panel's cover and stands."
msgstr ""
"简娜​一言不发​地​撬开​终端​底部​的​检修​面板​，​开始​剪断​电线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几分钟​后​，​她​盖​上​板子​，​站​起身​来​。\n"
"\n"
"Jian3na4 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 qiao4kai1 zhong1duan1 di3bu4 de5 jian3xiu1 mian4ban3，kai1shi3 jian3duan4 dian4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 fen4 zhong1 hou4，ta1 gai4 shang4 ban3zi5，zhan4 qi3shen1 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Wordlessly, she turns the journal around. At the top of the page, written in"
" a different hand, is a single word. It's written in English, but you can "
"understand it all the same."
msgstr ""
"她​默默地​将​日志​翻转​过来​。​在​纸页​的​顶部​，​用​另​一种​笔迹​写​着​一个​单词​。​虽然​是​用​英语​写​的​，​但​你​仍然​能​理解​它​的​意思​。\n"
"ta1 mo4 mo4 de5 jiang1 ri4zhi4 fan1zhuan3 guo4lai2。zai4 zhi3 xie2 de5 ding3bu4，yong4 ling4 yi1zhong3 bi3ji4 xie3 zhao2 yi1ge5 dan1ci2。sui1ran2 shi4 yong4 ying1yu3 xie3 de5，dan4 ni3 reng2ran2 neng2 li3jie3 ta1 de5 yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"Words of wisdom from our new addition. I agree with $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory. Razor-clawed street samurai. Her voice is cold and neutral, her expression placid.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"我们​的​新​成员​说​得​有​道理​。​我​同意​$(l.name)​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​。​使​螳螂​刀​的​街头​武士​。​她面​无表情​，​声音​冷淡​而​平静​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 xin1 cheng2yuan2 shuo1 de2 you3 dao4li5。wo3 tong2yi4 $(l.name) de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2。shi3 tang2lang2 dao1 de5 jie1tou2 wu3shi4。ta1 mian4 wu2biao3qing2，sheng1yin1 leng3dan4 er2 ping2jing4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Work. The kind that you don't talk about afterward."
msgstr ""
"工作​呗​。​就是​事后​你​不会​想​再​提​的​那种​。\n"
"gong1zuo4 bei5。jiu4shi4 shi4hou4 ni3 bu4hui4 xiang3 zai4 ti2 de5 na4zhong3。"

msgid "Working "
msgstr ""
"工作​中\n"
"gong1zuo4 zhong4"

msgid "Works for me."
msgstr ""
"可以​接受​。\n"
"ke3yi3 jie1shou4。"

msgid "Works for me. Let's get paid."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​没​毛病​。​这​活儿​咱们​手到擒来​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 mei2 mao2bing4。zhe4 huo2r5 zan2men5 shou3dao4qin2lai2。"

msgid "Works for me. Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"我​没​意见​。​我们​继续前进​吧​。\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。wo3men5 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。"

msgid "Workstation"
msgstr ""
"工作站\n"
"gong1zuo4zhan4"

msgid "Worried Elf"
msgstr ""
"担忧​的​精灵\n"
"dan1you1 de5 jing1ling2"

msgid ""
"Worry all you want. This team is going to succeed, with or without you."
msgstr ""
"有​什么​好​担心​的​？​不管​有没有​你​，​我们​的​队伍​都​会​迈向​成功​。\n"
"you3 shen2me5 hao3 dan1xin1 de5？bu4guan3 you3mei2you3 ni3，wo3men5 de5 dui4wu3 dou1 hui4 mai4xiang4 cheng2gong1。"

msgid "Worse. I was the only survivor."
msgstr ""
"更惨​。​只有​我​一个​人​活着​回来​了​。\n"
"geng1 can3。zhi3you3 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2 huo2zhe5 hui2lai5 le5。"

msgid "Wou--"
msgstr ""
"如果​—​—\n"
"ru2guo3 — —"

msgid "Would I have killed my own teammates if I weren't sincere about this?"
msgstr ""
"如果​我​不​真心​的话​，​怎么​会​杀死​我​自己​的​队友​？\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 bu4 zhen1xin1 de5hua4，zen3me5 hui4 sha1si3 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 dui4you3？"

msgid "Would have saved me some running around if you had come clean."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​早些​坦白​，​就​能​省去​我​不少​麻烦​了​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zao3xie1 tan3bai2，jiu4 neng2 sheng3qu4 wo3 bu4shao3 ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid "Would you like to rotate the open Matrix ports?"
msgstr ""
"是否​要​旋转​打开​的​矩阵​端口​？\n"
"shi4fou3 yao4 xuan2zhuan3 da3kai1 de5 ju3zhen4 duan1kou3？"

msgid ""
"Would you rather I'd forced you out of town? Because the option is still "
"open."
msgstr ""
"或者​你​愿意​被​强行​赶​出​这里​？​这​倒也不是​不行​。\n"
"huo4zhe3 ni3 yuan4yi4 bei4 qiang2xing2 gan3 chu1 zhe4li3？zhe4 dao3 ye3 bu4 shi4 bu4xing2。"

msgid "Would you rather fight with this thing, or against it?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​想​和​这个​东西​并肩作战​，​还是​对抗​它​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 xiang3 he4 zhe4ge5 dong1xi1 bing4jian1zuo4zhan4，hai2shi5 dui4kang4 ta1？"

msgid "Wouldn't advise making that bet."
msgstr ""
"我​不​建议​你​下​这个​赌注​。\n"
"wo3 bu4 jian4yi4 ni3 xia4 zhe4ge5 du3zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Wouldn't be so sure about that if I were you. The guy that filled the power vacuum when their last leader bit it is a real piece of work. But hey, maybe you're right... I hope so, for your sake.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stabs a meaty finger down on the faded silhouette of a building.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This warehouse, right here, is Rammbock HQ. And that's where the Engineer is staying."
msgstr ""
"换作​是​我​的话​可​不会​这么​肯定​。​自打​他们​上任​首领​死​掉​之后​，​填补​权力​真空​的​那个​家伙​绝对​是​个​麻烦​人物​。​不过​，​也许​你​说​的​对​……​我​希望​你​不是​空口说白话​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​粗壮​的​手指​戳​向​一栋​褪色​的​建筑​轮廓​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这座​仓库​就是​撞锤​帮​的​总部​。​而​工程师​就​住​在​那儿​。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4 ke3 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 ken3ding4。zi4da3 ta1men5 shang4ren4 shou3ling3 si3 diao4 zhi1hou4，tian2bu3 quan2li4 zhen1kong1 de5 na4ge5 jia1huo5 jue2dui4 shi4 ge4 ma2fan5 ren2wu4。bu4guo4，ye3xu3 ni3 shuo1 de5 dui4……wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 bu4shi4 kong1kou3shuo1bai2hua4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 cu1zhuang4 de5 shou3zhi3 chuo1 xiang4 yi1 dong4 tui4se4 de5 jian4zhu4 lun2kuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zuo4 cang1ku4 jiu4shi4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 zong3bu4。er2 gong1cheng2shi1 jiu4 zhu4 zai4 na4r5。"

msgid ""
"Wouldn't it be easier to just hijack the shipment? Why allow it to get to "
"the Humanis compound at all?"
msgstr ""
"直接​劫走​货物​不是​更​容易​吗​？​为什么​非要​去​人类​至上​主义者​的​仓库​呢​？\n"
"zhi2jie1 jie2 zou3 huo4wu4 bu4shi4 geng1 rong2yi4 ma5？wei4shen2me5 fei1yao4 qu4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 cang1ku4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Wouldn't've been my choice, but good on you, I suppose. All the same, $(l.name)... saints don't tend to last very long in this line of work. \n"
"\n"
"Trust me, I've watched enough of 'em buy it to know."
msgstr ""
"换​我​肯定​不会​这么​做​，​但​你​也​算​做​了​件​善事​。​不过​话​又​说​回来​，​$(l.name)​……​干​咱们​这行​的​，​怀着​一颗​圣母​心可活​不长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​信​我​吧​。​我​这辈子​见过​无数​人​在​这​上面​栽​了​跟头​。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 wo3 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4，dan4 ni3 ye3 suan4 zuo4 le5 jian4 shan4shi4。bu4guo4 hua4 you4 shuo1 hui2lai5，$(l.name)……gan4 zan2men5 zhe4 xing2 de5，huai2 zhao2 yi1 ke1 sheng4mu3 xin1 ke3 huo2 bu4 zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"xin4 wo3 ba1。wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 jian4 guo4 wu2shu4 ren2 zai4 zhe4 shang4mian4 zai1 le5 gen1tou5。"

msgid "Wound: Increases Damage by 1"
msgstr ""
"致伤​：​增加​1​点​伤害\n"
"zhi4 shang1：zeng1jia1 1 dian3 shang1hai4"

msgid "Wounded"
msgstr ""
"负伤\n"
"fu4shang1"

msgid "Wow, I wasn't expecting to see anyone else here this late."
msgstr ""
"哇​，​都​这么晚​了​，​没想到​这里​居然​还有​其他人​。\n"
"wa1，dou1 zhe4 ma2 wan3 le5，mei2xiang3dao4 zhe4li3 ju1ran2 hai2you3 qi2 ta1 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Wow, chief. That was... intense.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing I couldn't handle, of course. But this was a little more dramatic than I was expecting."
msgstr ""
"哇​，​头儿​。​这​场面​……​真够​刺激​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​这点​事​我​能​应付​。​不过​这比​我​预想​的​还要​更​激烈​一些​。\n"
"\n"
"wa1，tou2r5。zhe4 chang3mian4……zhen1 gou4 ci4ji1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，zhe4 dian3 shi4 wo3 neng2 ying4fu5。bu4guo4 zhe4 bi3 wo3 yu4xiang3 de5 hai2 yao4 geng1 ji1lie4 yi1xie1。"

msgid "Wow, that got dark."
msgstr ""
"这可够​黑暗​的​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3 gou4 hei1an4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Wow, you guys are both *completely* crazy. \n"
"\n"
"Why do I always end up in this kind of mess?"
msgstr ""
"哇​，​你们​俩​都​*​完全​*​疯​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​怎么​总能​碰到​这种​糟​心事​？\n"
"\n"
"wa1，ni3men5 lia3 dou1*wan2quan2*feng1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zen3me5 zong3neng2 peng4dao4 zhe4zhong3 zao1 xin1shi4？"

msgid "Wow. Isn't he a little old for you?"
msgstr ""
"哇​。​他​对​你​来说​岁数​有点​大​了​吧​？\n"
"wa1。ta1 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 sui4shu5 you3dian3 dai4 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Wow. The Landenberg Ring really needs to start keeping a closer eye on its "
"employees."
msgstr ""
"哇​哦​。​兰​登堡​帮真得​好好​注意​下​自己​的​内部​雇员​了​。\n"
"wa1 e2。lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 zhen1 de2 hao3hao3 zhu4yi4 xia4 zi4ji3 de5 nei4bu4 gu4yuan2 le5。"

msgid "Wow. To be honest, I didn't think you'd find anything."
msgstr ""
"哇​。​说实话​，​我​真没想到​你​能​有​发现​。\n"
"wa1。shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 zhen1 mei2 xiang3 dao4 ni3 neng2 you3 fa1xian4。"

msgid ""
"Wow. Um, thank you. When you said that you were going up there, I didn't think... \n"
"\n"
"I just...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her lip starts to quiver.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you."
msgstr ""
"天​啊​。​呃​，​谢谢​你​。​你​说​你​要​上去​的​时候​，​我​没想到​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​嘴唇​开始​发抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​。\n"
"\n"
"tian1 a1。e4，xie4xie5 ni3。ni3 shuo1 ni3 yao4 shang4qu4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 mei2xiang3dao4……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3chun2 kai1shi3 fa1dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Wrapped in an old cotton shirt, you find a gadget about the size of a water "
"pistol. It has a rubberized grip and a hair trigger, and it looks something "
"like a futuristic Taser gun."
msgstr ""
"你​看到​一个​大约​和​水枪​大小​相当​的​装置​，​用​一件​旧棉​衬衫​包裹​着​。​它​有​橡胶​握把​和​灵敏​的​扳机​，​看起来​有点像​未来​风格​的​电击​枪​。\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 yi1ge5 da4yue1 he4 shui3qiang1 da4xiao3 xiang1dang1 de5 zhuang1zhi4，yong4 yi1 jian4 jiu4 mian2 chen4shan1 bao1guo3 zhao2。ta1 you3 xiang4jiao1 wo4 ba3 he4 ling2min3 de5 ban1ji1，kan4qi3lai5 you3 dian3 xiang4 wei4lai2 feng1ge2 de5 dian4ji1 qiang1。"

msgid "Wrong place, wrong time. Happens to the best of us."
msgstr ""
"要​怪​就​怪​你​选错​了​时间​和​地点​。​这样​对​我们​大家​都​好​。\n"
"yao4 guai4 jiu4 guai4 ni3 xuan3 cuo4 le5 shi2jian1 he4 di4dian3。zhe4yang4 dui4 wo3men5 da4jia1 dou1 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Wrong, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"When it comes to the team, I'll follow your orders. But this wasn't the team's job. This was *my* op, and *you* elected to tag along."
msgstr ""
"错​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​是​队里​的​事情​，​我会​听​你​指挥​。​但​这​并​不是​小队​差事​。​这是​*​我​的​*​行动​，​而​*​你​*​自愿​跟​来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"cuo4 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 shi4 dui4 li3 de5 shi4qing5，wo3 hui4 ting1 ni3 zhi3hui1。dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4shi4 xiao3 dui4 cha4shi4。zhe4 shi4*wo3 de5*xing2dong4，er2*ni3*zi4yuan4 gen1 lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"Wrong. What I saw in your aura looked dangerous, both to you and to me. That"
" makes it my business."
msgstr ""
"你​说错​了​。​我​在​你​的​灵光​中​看到​的​那​东西​，​对​我们​俩​来说​都​十分​危险​。​这​就​和​我​有​关系​了​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 cuo4 le5。wo3 zai4 ni3 de5 ling2guang1 zhong4 kan4dao4 de5 na4 dong1xi1，dui4 wo3men5 lia3 lai2 shuo1 dou1 shi2fen1 wei1xian3。zhe4 jiu4 he4 wo3 you3 guan1xi5 le5。"

msgid "XOLOTL"
msgstr ""
"修​洛特​尔\n"
"Xiu1luo4te4er3"

msgid "Xolotl"
msgstr ""
"修​洛特​尔\n"
"Xiu1luo4te4er3"

msgid ""
"Y'know what? I *do* deserve an efficiency bonus.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She snatches her PDA off of her belt and presses it to your credstick. Once the transfer is completed, she steps away from the panel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And now, I am going to go get plastered. Efficiently."
msgstr ""
"这么​说来​，​我​*​确实​*​值得​一份​效率​奖金​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​一把​将​PDA​从​腰带​上​拽​下来​，​然后​按​在​你​的​信用​棒​上​。​转账​完成​后​，​她​便​从​控制板​前​退开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​我要​去​“​高效​地​”​喝个​烂醉​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 lai2，wo3*que4shi2*zhi2de5 yi1 fen4 xiao4lu:4 jiang3jin1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 ba3 jiang1 PDA cong2 yao1dai4 shang4 zhuai1 xia4lai5，ran2hou4 an4 zai4 ni3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 shang4。zhuan3zhang4 wan2cheng2 hou4，ta1 bian4 cong2 kong4 zhi4 ban3 qian2 tui4 kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，wo3 yao4 qu4“gao1xiao4 de5” he4 ge4 lan4zui4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Y'know what? You deserve to feel good for a change. Let's drop this and move"
" on."
msgstr ""
"我​觉得​吧​，​你​是​该​让​自己​好受​些​了​，​咱​不​纠结​这个​。\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ba1，ni3 shi4 gai1 rang4 zi4ji3 hao3shou4 xie1 le5，za2 bu4 jiu1jie2 zhe4ge5。"

msgid "Y'know what? You're right, you do."
msgstr ""
"这么​一想​的话​，​你​还​真​没​说错​。\n"
"zhe4me5 yi1 xiang3 de5hua4，ni3 hai2 zhen1 mei2 shuo1 cuo4。"

msgid ""
"Y'know, Dietrich... now that you've got a handle on your connection with the"
" Dragonslayer, you could probably reach out to your old community again. "
"Berlin's punks could benefit from your experience."
msgstr ""
"迪​特里​希​……​既然​你​已经​搞定​了​自己​和​屠龙​者​之间​的​联系​，​或许​该​重新​联系​你​那些​老​伙伴​了​。​柏林​的​朋克​人士​或许​能​从​你​的​经验​中​受益​。\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1……ji4ran2 ni3 yi3jing1 gao3ding4 le5 zi4ji3 he4 tu2 long2 zhe3 zhi1jian1 de5 lian2xi4，huo4xu3 gai1 chong2xin1 lian2xi4 ni3 na4xie1 lao3 huo3ban4 le5。bo2lin2 de5 peng2ke4 ren2shi4 huo4xu3 neng2 cong2 ni3 de5 jing1yan4 zhong4 shou4yi4。"

msgid ""
"Y'know, Eiger... by that logic, I should've broken your ribs after Monika "
"died."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​……​按​你​这个​逻辑​，​在​莫妮卡​死后​，​我​也​该​把​你​的​肋骨​打断​了​？\n"
"Ai4ge2er3……an4 ni3 zhe4ge5 luo2ji5，zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 si3hou4，wo3 ye3 gai1 ba3 ni3 de5 lei4gu3 da3duan4 le5？"

msgid ""
"Y'know, boss... livin' in Berlin, I never thought I'd get the chance to go up against a blood mage.\n"
"\n"
"Guess today was my lucky day."
msgstr ""
"话​说​，​老大​……​在​柏林​生活​这么久​，​我​真没想到​有朝一日​还​能​和​血​法师​交手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今儿​真​走运​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1，lao3da4……zai4 bo2lin2 sheng1huo2 zhe4 ma2 jiu3，wo3 zhen1 mei2 xiang3 dao4 you3zhao1yi1ri4 hai2 neng2 he4 xie3 fa3shi1 jiao1shou3。\n"
"\n"
"jin1r5 zhen1 zou3yun4 a1。"

msgid ""
"Y'know, cosmetic otoplasty has come a long way in recent years. You could "
"probably stand to have those ears touched up. The surgical scars are hard to"
" miss."
msgstr ""
"话​说​，​近年来​耳部​整形手术​已经​取得​了​长足​的​进步​。​你​也许​可以​把​耳朵​修饰​一下​。​像​这样​的​手术​疤痕​很​难看​不​出来​。\n"
"hua4 shuo1，jin4nian2lai2 er3 bu4 zheng3 xing2 shou3 shu4 yi3jing1 qu3de2 le5 chang2zu2 de5 jin4bu4。ni3 ye3xu3 ke3yi3 ba3 er3duo5 xiu1shi4 yi1xia4。xiang4 zhe4yang4 de5 shou3shu4 ba1hen2 hen3 nan2kan4 bu4 chu1lai2。"

