"wo3men5 zhen1 mei2 shi2jian1 gan4 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Y-yes. Yes, of course.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The expression on his face is one of pure horror.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"P-please... please tell our \"friends\" that I hear them, loud and clear. And tell them that I'm making the call."
