"是​-​是​的​。​当然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​脸上​露出​了​纯粹​的​惊骇​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​求求​你​……​请​告诉​那些​“​朋友​”​，​我​听​得​清清楚楚​。​告诉​他们​，​我​正在​努力​推进​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 -shi4 de5。dang1ran2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 le5 chun2cui4 de5 jing1hai4 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiu2 qiu2 ni3……qing3 gao4su4 na4xie1“peng2you5”，wo3 ting1 de2 qing1 qing1 chu3 chu3。gao4su4 ta1men5，wo3 zheng4zai4 nu3li4 tui1jin4。"

