"​天​啊​！​那​是​什么​令人​反胃​的​*​恶臭​*​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3、shuo1 ni3 ni2！ni3 shi4 shei2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 bi1jin4，shuang1shou3 wei1wei1 chou1chu4。dang1 ta1 li2 ni3 zhi3you3 ji1 ying1chi3 yuan3 shi2，ta1 de5 bi2kong3 meng3de5 zhang1kai1，sui2ji2 kai1shi3 gan1ou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tian1 a1！na4 shi4 shen2me5 ling4ren2 fan3wei4 de5*e4chou4*？"

msgid ""
