"​\n"
"​现在​，​让​我们​回到​正题​上来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4bi4 hai4pa4，wo3 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 ni3 de5 die2 ke4。na4yang4 zuo4 hui4 wei2bei4 wo3 de5 zi4shen1 li4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，rang4 wo3men5 hui2dao4 zheng1 ti2 shang4lai2。"

msgid ""
"YOU WILL FIND DR. VAUCLAIR IN THE SUBSTRUCTURE BELOW THE HARFELD MANOR."
