"沃​克莱尔​博士​就​在​哈​菲尔德​庄园​的​地下​设施​中​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 jiu4 zai4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 de5 di4xia4 she4shi1 zhong4。"

