"你​可以​的​。​我​对​你​有​信心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​一件​事​你​必须​知道​，​$++(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 de5。wo3 dui4 ni3 you3 xin4xin1。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 ni3 bi4xu1 zhi1dao4，$++(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"YOUR CHOICE IS FOOLISH AND SHORT SIGHTED. DRAGONS MUST BE STOPPED.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The old drone's servos whir as it trains its turrets on you.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​的​选择​愚蠢​而​短视​。​巨龙​必须​被​阻止​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​老式​无人机​的​伺服电机​发出​嗡嗡声​，​将​炮塔​对准​你​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 xuan3ze2 yu2chun3 er2 duan3shi4。ju4long2 bi4xu1 bei4 zu3zhi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3shi4 wu2ren2ji1 de5 si4 fu2 dian4 ji1 fa1chu1 weng1weng1sheng1，jiang1 pao4ta3 dui4zhun3 ni3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"YOUR COMPENSATION WILL COME IN THE FORM OF YOUR OWN SALVATION.\n"
"\n"
"I WILL TAKE OVER THE FEUERSCHWINGE PROJECT. REMOVE THE NECESSITY FOR COLLATERAL DAMAGE. \n"
"\n"
"I WILL PERFECT VAUCLAIR'S PANACEA. WHAT HE HAS STARTED, I WILL FINISH."
msgstr ""
"你​的​报酬​将会​是​你​自己​的​救赎​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​接手​火翼​项目​，​消除​必要​的​附带​损害​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​完善​沃​克莱尔​的​“​万能​药​”​，​完成​他​所​开启​的​事业​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 bao4chou5 jiang1hui4 shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 jiu4shu2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 jie1shou3 Huo3yi4 xiang4mu4，xiao1chu2 bi4yao4 de5 fu4dai4 sun3hai4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 wan2shan4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4”，wan2cheng2 ta1 suo3 kai1qi3 de5 shi4ye4。"

msgid ""
"YOUR FEARS ARE UNFOUNDED. I WILL NOT TAKE CONSCIOUS ACTION AGAINST YOU. \n"
"\n"
"DOING SO WOULD VIOLATE MY OWN SELF-INTEREST."
msgstr ""
"你​的​担忧​纯属​多虑​。​我​不会​主动​对​你​采取行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那样​做会​违背​我​的​自身​利益​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 dan1you1 chun2shu3 duo1lu:4。wo3 bu4hui4 zhu3dong4 dui4 ni3 cai3qu3xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"na4yang4 zuo4 hui4 wei2bei4 wo3 de5 zi4shen1 li4yi4。"

msgid ""
"YOUR FEELINGS ARE IRRELEVANT. THE FACT OF THE MATTER IS THAT I WILL NOT HARM YOU.\n"
"\n"
"NOW, LET US RETURN TO THE MATTER AT HAND."
msgstr ""
"你​的​感受​无关紧要​。​事实​是​我​不会​伤害​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​让​我们​回到​正题​上来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 gan3shou4 wu2guan1jin3yao4。shi4shi2 shi4 wo3 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，rang4 wo3men5 hui2dao4 zheng1 ti2 shang4lai2。"

msgid "Yamaha Pulsar"
msgstr ""
"雅马哈​脉冲星\n"
"ya3ma3ha1 mai4chong1xing1"

msgid "Yamatetsu Cyberarm (Alphaware)"
msgstr ""
"山彻​赛博​手臂​（​阿尔法​）\n"
"shan1 che4 sai4bo2 shou3bi4 （a1er3fa3）"

msgid ""
"Yamatetsu's alpha cyberlimbs are flesh-friendly replacements. Adds +1 "
"Strength and +5 HP."
msgstr ""
"山彻​集团​的​阿尔法​级赛​博义体​是​亲肤型​替代​装置​。​提供​+​1​力量​与​+​5​生命​值​加成​。\n"
"shan1 che4 ji2tuan2 de5 a1er3fa3 ji2 sai4 bo2 yi4 ti3 shi4 qin1 fu1 xing2 ti4dai4 zhuang1zhi4。ti2gong1 +1 li4liang5 yu4 +5 sheng1ming4 zhi2 jia1 cheng2。"

msgid ""
"Ye gods, that's rank. I'll stay back here, if you don't mind... I have "
"better things to do than dig through a pile of decomposing trash."
msgstr ""
"天​啊​，​这​味道​真​够呛​。​如果​你​不介意​的话​，​我​就​在​后面​待​着​了​……​我​还有​更​重要​的​事情​要​做​，​而​不是​翻​一堆​正在​腐烂​的​垃圾​。\n"
"tian1 a1，zhe4 wei4dao5 zhen1 gou4qiang4。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 jie4 yi4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 zai4 hou4mian5 dai1 zhao2 le5……wo3 hai2you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4qing5 yao4 zuo4，er2 bu4shi4 fan1 yi1dui1 zheng4zai4 fu3lan4 de5 la1ji1。"

msgid "Yeah it's safe, the spirits are gone."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​很​安全​，​精魂​已经​走​了​。\n"
"shi4 de5，hen3 an1quan2，jing1hun2 yi3jing1 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah! Um, okay... sure, we can talk about it. Do a little post-mortem on the op, that sort of thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He tries on a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For my part, I'd say that it went *great.* I mean, mission accomplished, right? All's well that ends well, and all that...?"
msgstr ""
"行​啊​！​嗯​……​当然​，​我们​可以​聊聊​这件​事​。​对​这次​行动​做个​复盘​之类​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​勉强​挤出​一个​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​我​而言​，​我​认为​这次​行动​*​非常​成功​*​。​我​的​意思​是​，​任务​完成​了​，​对​吧​？​有始有终​，​皆大欢喜​什么​的​……​？\n"
"\n"
"xing2 a1！en1……dang1ran2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 liao2 liao2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。dui4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 zuo4 ge4 fu4pan2 zhi1lei4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mian3qiang3 ji3chu1 yi1ge5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 wo3 er2yan2，wo3 ren4wei2 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4*fei1chang2 cheng2gong1*。wo3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，ren4wu5 wan2cheng2 le5，dui4 ba1？you3shi3you3zhong1，jie1da4huan1xi3 shen2me5 de5……？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, $(l.name). That's right.\n"
"\n"
"It seemed like the best way to get you here, and I need you. Like I said, you're my ace in the hole... and it's time for me to make my play."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​$(l.name)​。​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​似乎​是​让​你​来​此​的​最佳​方式​，​而且​我​需要​你​。​正如​我​所说​，​你​是​我​的​王牌​……​而​现在​该​我​出牌​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，$(l.name)。mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 rang4 ni3 lai2 ci3 de5 zui4jia1 fang1shi4，er2qie3 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3。zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，ni3 shi4 wo3 de5 wang2pai2……er2 xian4zai4 gai1 wo3 chu1 pai2 le5。"

msgid "Yeah, Blitz. I'm sorry that I took Hasenkamp's word over yours."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​布里​茨​。​抱歉​我​不该​用哈森​坎普​的话​来​质疑​你​。\n"
"en1，Bu4li3ci2。bao4qian4 wo3 bu4gai1 yong4 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5hua4 lai2 zhi4yi2 ni3。"

msgid "Yeah, Glory. You, too."
msgstr ""
"是​，​格洛丽​，​你​也​保重​。\n"
"shi4，Ge2luo4li2，ni3 ye3 bao3zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I *see* that. But that doesn't give you the right to force your way into my home and start tearing up my walls!\n"
"\n"
"At the *very* least, you should've given me advance notice."
msgstr ""
"我​*​看​*​到​了​。​但​这​不​代表​你​有权​闯进​我家​，​开始​拆​我​的​墙​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​最起码​来说​，​你​也​应该​提前​通知​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*kan4*dao4 le5。dan4 zhe4 bu4 dai4biao3 ni3 you3quan2 chuang3jin4 wo3 jia1，kai1shi3 chai1 wo3 de5 qiang2！\n"
"\n"
"zui4 qi3 ma3 lai2 shuo1，ni3 ye3 ying1gai1 ti2qian2 tong1zhi1 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I *see* that. But you can't be in here without my consent, and you "
"sure as hell can't go tearing up my walls without giving me advance notice!"
msgstr ""
"我​*​看​*​到​了​。​但​未经​我​的​允许​，​你​无权​闯进​我家​，​更​别说​未经​事先​通知​就​敢​来​拆​我​的​墙​！\n"
"wo3*kan4*dao4 le5。dan4 wei4jing1 wo3 de5 yun3xu3，ni3 wu2quan2 chuang3jin4 wo3 jia1，geng1 bie2shuo1 wei4jing1 shi4xian1 tong1zhi1 jiu4 gan3 lai2 chai1 wo3 de5 qiang2！"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I agree. But the ganger who slotted this wasn't blissed out like a "
"normal sim-junkie. It was almost the opposite... he looked wild, like a "
"madman."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​同意​。​但​安装​了​这个​的​帮派​成员​并​不​像是​一般​的​拟感​瘾君子​。​不如说是​恰恰相反​……​他​的​表现​就​像​个​疯子​。\n"
"en1，wo3 tong2yi4。dan4 an1zhuang1 le5 zhe4ge5 de5 bang1pai4 cheng2yuan2 bing4 bu4 xiang4 shi4 yi1ban1 de5 ni3 gan3 yin3jun1zi3。bu4 ru2 shuo1 shi4 qia4qia4xiang1fan3……ta1 de5 biao3xian4 jiu4 xiang4 ge4 feng1zi5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I can see that. And don't worry about it.\n"
"\n"
"You'll get what's coming to you."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​知道​，​你​放心​就​好​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​你​的​一分​都​不会​少​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 zhi1dao4，ni3 fang4xin1 jiu4 hao3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 ni3 de5 yi1 fen4 dou1 bu4hui4 shao3。"

msgid "Yeah, I can tell. You've gathered the whole team."
msgstr ""
"我​看​出来​了​。​毕竟​你​把​大伙​都​叫​过来​了​。\n"
"wo3 kan4 chu1lai2 le5。bi4jing4 ni3 ba3 da4huo3 dou1 jiao4 guo4lai2 le5。"

msgid "Yeah, I don’t think she likes you anymore."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​看来​她​不​喜欢​你​了​。\n"
"en1，kan4lai5 ta1 bu4 xi3huan5 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I doubted it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She winks exaggeratedly.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"You're too smart for me.\n"
"\n"
"But you wanna know why, right?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​想​也​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​夸张​地​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​太​聪明​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​想​知道​为什么​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kua1zhang1 de5 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 tai4 cong1ming5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 wei4shen2me5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "Yeah, I feel it. But that doesn't change what we have to do."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​我​感受​到​了​。​但​这​并​不会​改变​我们​要​做​的​事​。\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 gan3shou4 dao4 le5。dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4hui4 gai3bian4 wo3men5 yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I figured as much.\n"
"\n"
"What now?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​猜​也​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​有​什么​事​？\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 cai1 ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "Yeah, I get it. Keep talking."
msgstr ""
"我​听​明白​了​。​继续​说​。\n"
"wo3 ting1 ming2bai5 le5。ji4xu4 shuo1。"

msgid "Yeah, I get that. I'm still worried, though."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​，​但​我​还是​有点​担心​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 you3dian3 dan1xin1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I get that... from what I'm seeing on my monitors, you've had a busy day.\n"
"\n"
"You'll wanna hear me out, all the same. Trust me on this."
msgstr ""
"没事​，​这​我​明白​……​我​在​监控​上​都​看见​了​，​你​今天​是​挺​忙​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​呢​，​你​还是​该​听​我​讲​两句​。​信​我​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4，zhe4 wo3 ming2bai5……wo3 zai4 jian1kong4 shang4 dou1 kan4jian4 le5，ni3 jin1tian1 shi4 ting3 mang2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ni2，ni3 hai2shi5 gai1 ting1 wo3 jiang3 liang3ju4。xin4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I got it. An optical chip. We'll have to use my mission computer to "
"open it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​拿到​了​。​一枚​光学​芯片​。​得用​我​的​任务​电脑​打开​它​。\n"
"en1，wo3 na2dao4 le5。yi1 mei2 guang1xue2 xin1pian4。de2 yong4 wo3 de5 ren4wu5 dian4nao3 da3kai1 ta1。"

msgid "Yeah, I gotcha. Let's talk about something else."
msgstr ""
"好好​好​，​我​明白​了​。​我们​聊点​别的​吧​。\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3，wo3 ming2bai5 le5。wo3men5 liao2 dian3 bie2de5 ba1。"

msgid "Yeah, I guess not. Come on, Glory... let's get out of here."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​走​了​，​格洛丽​……​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。zou3 le5，Ge2luo4li2……wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid "Yeah, I guess that figures. Can't be too careful."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​也​有​道理​。​毕竟​小心​为​上​。\n"
"en1，ye3 you3 dao4li5。bi4jing4 xiao3xin1 wei2 shang4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I guess.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, people. Let's get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​了​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 le5，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I know the feeling. I tried to make him answer for it, but the bastard"
" got away."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​我​懂​你​意思​。​我本​要​让​他​付出代价​，​但​那​杂种​跑​路​了​。\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 dong3 ni3 yi4si5。wo3 ben3 yao4 rang4 ta1 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4，dan4 na4 za2zhong3 pao2 lu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I know who you are.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes a drag on her cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"How you holdin' up, champ? I heard what happened to your boss."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​知道​你​是​谁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​抽​了​一口​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​最近​还好​吗​？​我​听说​了​你们​老大​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 shei2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chou1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zui4jin4 hai2hao3 ma5？wo3 ting1shuo1 le5 ni3men5 lao3da4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "Yeah, I know. I don't get it, either."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​我​也​不​懂​为什么​。\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 ye3 bu4 dong3 wei4shen2me5。"

msgid "Yeah, I saw that coming. What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"我​早就​料到​了​。​你​需要​什么​？\n"
"wo3 zao3jiu4 liao4dao4 le5。ni3 xu1yao4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I suppose. My life's an open book, so I guess I just sort of figure "
"that everyone else's will be, too."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​我​这辈子​光明磊落​，​从不​遮遮掩掩​，​所以​我​想​别人​的​生活​应该​也​是​如此​。\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 guang1ming2lei3luo4，cong2bu4 zhe1zhe1yan3yan3，suo3yi3 wo3 xiang3 bie2ren5 de5 sheng1huo2 ying1gai1 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I suppose... might not be a bad idea for you to look into that, "
"$(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​同意​……​你​调查​一下​也​无妨​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"en1，wo3 tong2yi4……ni3 diao4cha2 yi1xia4 ye3 wu2fang2，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I wrote a custom stack for her. I'm the only one she'll listen to. \n"
"\n"
"So, uh... can I have her back?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​之前​为​她​编写​了​定制​堆栈​，​所以​她​只会​听​我​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​呃​……​我能​把​它​拿​回来​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 zhi1qian2 wei2 ta1 bian1xie3 le5 ding4zhi4 dui1zhan4，suo3yi3 ta1 zhi3 hui4 ting1 wo3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，e4……wo3 neng2 ba3 ta1 na2 hui2lai5 ma5？"

msgid "Yeah, I'll do it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​交给​我​吧​。\n"
"en1，jiao1gei3 wo3 ba1。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm beginning to regret that myself. But what's done is done."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​自己​也​开始​后悔​了​。​但​事已至此​，​多说无益​。\n"
"en1，wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 kai1shi3 hou4hui3 le5。dan4 shi4yi3zhi4ci3，duo1 shuo1 wu2 yi4。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm not a fan of the dress code. I just sort of do my own thing."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​不在乎​什么​着装​规范​。​我​想​怎样​就​怎样​。\n"
"en1，wo3 bu4zai4hu5 shen2me5 zhuo2zhuang1 gui1fan4。wo3 xiang3 zen3yang4 jiu4 zen3yang4。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm on it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​正在​做​。\n"
"en1，wo3 zheng4zai4 zuo4。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm on it. Take good care of our friend here."
msgstr ""
"好​，​我​这​就​去​。​你​好好​照顾​我们​的​这位​朋友​。\n"
"hao3，wo3 zhe4 jiu4 qu4。ni3 hao3hao3 zhao4gu5 wo3men5 de5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm on the train back to the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​正​坐火车​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​呢​。\n"
"en1，wo3 zheng1 zuo4 huo3 che1 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ni2。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm ready. Let's get this started."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​准备​好​了​。​我们​开始​吧​。\n"
"en1，wo3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5。wo3men5 kai1shi3 ba1。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm sure that it is."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​对此​十分​确信​。\n"
"en1，wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 que4xin4。"

msgid "Yeah, I'm sure that they're a charming bunch."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​他们​可太有​魅力​了​。\n"
"shi4 a1，ta1men5 ke3 tai4 you3 mei4li4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm sure. You're a member of this team. It isn't right for me to leave"
" you to twist like this."
msgstr ""
"我​很​确定​。​你​是​这个​团队​的​一部分​，​我​不能​就​这样​放着​你​不管​。\n"
"wo3 hen3 que4ding4。ni3 shi4 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4 de5 yi1bu4fen5，wo3 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4yang4 fang4 zhao2 ni3 bu4guan3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm with you there.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, chief. Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​也​同意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​头儿​，​我们​赶紧​把​这件​事​解决​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 ye3 tong2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，tou2r5，wo3men5 gan3jin3 ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 jie3jue2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm with you there.\n"
"\n"
"Come on. Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​同意​你​的​看法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​。​我们​把​这件​事​解决​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 kan4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1。wo3men5 ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 jie3jue2 diao4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm with you there. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She wrinkles her nose.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The funny thing is, a syndicate presence might actually help Schattennest... in the short term, at least. They'd clean up the streets, if nothing else."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​也​是​这么​想​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​皱​皱​鼻子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有趣​的​是​，​黑帮​的​存在​实际上​可能​对​影巢​有所​帮助​……​至少​在短期内​是​这样​。​起码​他们​会​清理​街道​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4 zhou4 bi2zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3qu4 de5 shi4，hei1bang1 de5 cun2zai4 shi2ji4shang4 ke3neng2 dui4 ying3 chao2 you3suo3 bang1zhu4……zhi4shao3 zai4 duan3 qi1 nei4 shi4 zhe4yang4。qi3ma3 ta1men5 hui4 qing1li3 jie1dao4。"

msgid "Yeah, I've got it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​知道​了​。\n"
"en1，wo3 zhi1dao4 le5。"

msgid "Yeah, I've got it. I could do with a little less attitude, though."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​明白​。​但​你​就​不能​态度​好点​吗​。\n"
"en1，wo3 ming2bai5。dan4 ni3 jiu4 bu4neng2 tai4du5 hao3 dian3 ma5。"

msgid "Yeah, I've heard that one before."
msgstr ""
"这种​借口​我​经常​听到​。\n"
"zhe4zhong3 jie4kou3 wo3 jing1chang2 ting1dao4。"

msgid "Yeah, I--"
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​—​—\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 — —"

msgid "Yeah, Paul, I know. I was listening the first time."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​，​保罗​。​我​第一次​就​认真​听​了​。\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4，bao3luo2。wo3 di4yi1ci4 jiu4 ren4zhen1 ting1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, Plotz. Miserable son of a bitch, I had to share an office with that man for--\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He cuts himself short.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Never mind. You don't need to know."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​普​洛茨​。​就是​个​王八​犊子​，​我​以前​还​得​跟​他​在​同一​间​办公室​里​—​—​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​说​到​一半​停住​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没什么​。​你​不​需要​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，Pu3luo4ci2。jiu4shi4 ge4 wang2ba5 du2zi5，wo3 yi3qian2 hai2 de2 gen1 ta1 zai4 tong2yi1 jian1 ban4gong1shi4 li3——\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuo1 dao4 yi1ban4 ting2zhu4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5。ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, actually.\n"
"\n"
"I've made some headway. For the first time in a year, I've got a solid lead."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​找到​了​线索​。​这​一年​来​，​我​终于​找到​了​一条​线索​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 xian4suo3。zhe4 yi1 nian2 lai2，wo3 zhong1yu2 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1 tiao2 xian4suo3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, actually. I think that I might know where the other chip went. "
"Remember that body I found in the other room?"
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我​想​我​可能​知道​另​一块​芯片​去​哪​了​。​记得​我​在​另​一个​房间​里​发现​的​那具​尸体​吗​？\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3 xiang3 wo3 ke3neng2 zhi1dao4 ling4 yi1kuai4 xin1pian4 qu4 na3 le5。ji4de5 wo3 zai4 ling4 yi1ge5 fang2jian1 li3 fa1xian4 de5 na4 ju4 shi1ti3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, actually. It wasn't too difficult to pull the thing apart and see what made it tick.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Making one of my own was a different story, but I got it in the end."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​如果​只是​拆开​那​玩意儿​，​看看​它​怎么​运作​的话​，​倒​也​不算​难​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​微笑​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​要​自己​动手做​一个​就​另当别论​了​。​好​在​我​最后​还是​成功​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。ru2guo3 zhi3shi4 chai1kai1 na4 wan2yi4r5，kan4kan5 ta1 zen3me5 yun4zuo4 de5hua4，dao3 ye3 bu4suan4 nan2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1xiao4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 yao4 zi4ji3 dong4 shou3 zuo4 yi1ge5 jiu4 ling4dang1bie2lun4 le5。hao3 zai4 wo3 zui4hou4 hai2shi5 cheng2gong1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, actually. It's a pulse grenade.\n"
"\n"
"The last I heard, the Russian military were developing them as crowd dispersal devices, but that was years ago.\n"
"\n"
"Looks like Yuli kept a memento of his time in the Spetsnaz."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​这是​脉冲​手雷​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​据我所知​，​俄罗斯​军队​研发​了​这​东西​用于​驱散​人群​，​但​那​已经​是​许多年​前​的​事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​尤里​保留​了​他​在​特种部队​服役​时​的​一件​纪念品​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。zhe4 shi4 mai4chong1 shou3lei2。\n"
"\n"
"ju4wo3suo3zhi1，e2luo2si1 jun1dui4 yan2fa1 le5 zhe4 dong1xi1 yong4yu2 qu1san4 ren2qun2，dan4 na4 yi3jing1 shi4 xu3 duo1 nian2 qian2 de5 shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 You2li3 bao3liu2 le5 ta1 zai4 te4zhong3bu4dui4 fu2yi4 shi2 de5 yi1 jian4 ji4nian4pin3。"

msgid "Yeah, all right, fine."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​那好​吧​。\n"
"en1，na4 hao3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, all right. Actually, hang here a second... I stashed the Pain Inducer just over there.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He waves his hand in the direction of the operating theater.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your nuyen, too. I'll go grab it for you."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​好​吧​。​稍​等​我​一下​……​疼痛​诱发​器​就​被​我​藏​在​了​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他朝​手术室​的​方向​摆摆手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​你​的​新円​。​我​这​就​去​给​你​拿来​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，hao3 ba1。shao1 deng3 wo3 yi1xia4……teng2tong4 you4fa1 qi4 jiu4 bei4 wo3 zang4 zai4 le5 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 shou3shu4shi4 de5 fang1xiang4 bai3 bai3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 ni3 de5 xin1 yuan2。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 qu4 gei3 ni3 na2lai2。"

msgid "Yeah, and Amsel should probably get a look at this, too."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​而且​这​情况​也​应该​让​阿姆​泽尔看​一眼​。\n"
"shi4 a1，er2qie3 zhe4 qing2kuang4 ye3 ying1gai1 rang4 E1mu3ze2er3 kan4 yi1yan3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, and judging by the way he reacted, he didn't know that they'd done it. They must have thrown it in while he was getting other work done.\n"
"\n"
"I'm willing to bet that if we hadn't used the cyberware deactivator on him, he'd've gone up before he had the chance to spill any names."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​而且​从​他​的​反应​来看​，​他​自己​也​不​知道​这​回事​。​他们​肯定​是​趁​他​做​别的​工作​时​一并​植入​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我敢​说​，​要不是​我们​用​了​赛博​改造​失效​器​，​他​估计​来不及​吐露​任何​情报​就​已经​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，er2qie3 cong2 ta1 de5 fan3ying4 lai2 kan4，ta1 zi4ji3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 hui2shi4。ta1men5 ken3ding4 shi4 chen4 ta1 zuo4 bie2de5 gong1zuo4 shi2 yi1bing4 zhi2ru4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 shuo1，yao4bu5shi4 wo3men5 yong4 le5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 shi1xiao4 qi4，ta1 gu1ji4 lai2bu5ji2 tu3lu4 ren4he2 qing2bao4 jiu4 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, and the most powerful corporation in the world is run by a dragon. "
"Like I said, crazy things happen."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​而​这​世界​上​最​有​权势​的​企业​还是​由​一条​巨龙​掌管​的​呢​。​正如​我​所说​，​简直​荒腔​走板​。\n"
"shi4 a1，er2 zhe4 shi4jie4 shang4 zui4 you3 quan2shi4 de5 qi3ye4 hai2shi5 you2 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 zhang3guan3 de5 ni2。zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3 shuo1，jian3zhi2 huang1 qiang1 zou3ban3。"

msgid "Yeah, and we did. With the push of a button."
msgstr ""
"所以​我们​轻轻​一​按​，​就​做到​了​这件​事​。\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 qing1qing1 yi1 an4，jiu4 zuo4dao4 le5 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, because *you* never bothered learning what to look for.\n"
"\n"
"Muscle contractions and micro-tremors are good indicators of a decker in distress. I'm assuming you didn't have anyone keeping an eye out for those?\n"
"\n"
"No. If you had, my friend wouldn't be lying dead in a basement."
msgstr ""
"对​，​因为​*​你​*​压根​就​没​花心思​熟悉​这门​行当​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​肌肉​收缩​和​微小​震颤​往往​意味着​碟客​陷入​了​危急​状态​。​我​猜​你​没​让​任何人​注意​这些​征兆​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​说错​吧​。​你​要是​这么​做​了​，​我​的​朋友​就​不会​死​在​地下室​里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4，yin1wei4*ni3*ya4gen1 jiu4 mei2 hua1xin1si1 shu2xi1 zhe4 men2 hang2dang5。\n"
"\n"
"ji1rou4 shou1suo1 he4 wei1xiao3 zhen4chan4 wang3wang3 yi4wei4zhe5 die2 ke4 xian4ru4 le5 wei1ji2 zhuang4tai4。wo3 cai1 ni3 mei2 rang4 ren4 he2 ren2 zhu4yi4 zhe4xie1 zheng1zhao4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4 ba1。ni3 yao4shi5 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5，wo3 de5 peng2you5 jiu4 bu4hui4 si3 zai4 di4xia4shi4 li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, boss. I am.\n"
"\n"
"Back in my glory days, I'd've beaten those Rammbock bastards into pulp. But now, I..."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​老大​。​我认​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​我​最​意气风发​的​时候​，​我​肯定​能​把​那​帮​撞锤​帮​的​渣滓​打个​稀巴烂​。​但​现在​，​我​……\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，lao3da4。wo3 ren4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 wo3 zui4 yi4qi4feng1fa1 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 ken3ding4 neng2 ba3 na4 bang1 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 zha1zi3 da3 ge4 xi1ba1lan4。dan4 xian4zai4，wo3……"

msgid ""
"Yeah, boss. I have.\n"
"\n"
"It's an interesting idea, but there are risks. I'm thinkin' that this might not be the best of times to approach Him about it... He's the source of my magic, remember.\n"
"\n"
"If our discussion turned into an argument, He could take all of that magic back in a heartbeat, and then where would we be?"
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​主意​有点​意思​，​但​也​有​风险​。​我​觉得​现在​并​不是​什么​好时机​……​你​还​记得​祂​是​我​的​魔法​之源​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​谈崩​了​，​祂​可能​会​瞬间​收回​我​身上​的​所有​魔法​，​到时候​咱们​咋办​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhu3yi5 you3dian3 yi4si5，dan4 ye3 you3 feng1xian3。wo3 jue2de5 xian4zai4 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 hao3 shi2 ji1……ni3 hai2 ji4de5 ta1 shi4 wo3 de5 mo2fa3 zhi1 yuan2 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 tan2 beng1 le5，ta1 ke3neng2 hui4 shun4jian1 shou1hui2 wo3 shen1shang5 de5 suo3you3 mo2fa3，dao4shi2hou4 zan2men5 za3 ban4？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, boss. No more digging around, and no more fishing expeditions.\n"
"\n"
"When Emilie's ready to come back, she'll come back. I get that now."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​老大​。​我​不会​再花​时间​进行​更​多​调查​或者​探索​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​艾米莉​准备​好​之后​，​她​自然​会​回来​。​我​现在​明白​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，lao3da4。wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 hua1 shi2jian1 jin4xing2 geng1 duo1 diao4cha2 huo4zhe3 tan4suo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ai4 mi3 li4 zhun3bei4 hao3 zhi1hou4，ta1 zi4ran2 hui4 hui2lai5。wo3 xian4zai4 ming2bai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, but now we know what’s down there. This time, we’ll be prepared for it.\n"
"\n"
"We can handle this."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​但​现在​我们​已经​摸清​了​下面​的​情况​。​这次​，​我们​会​严阵以待​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​能​搞定​的​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，dan4 xian4zai4 wo3men5 yi3jing1 mo1qing1 le5 xia4mian4 de5 qing2kuang4。zhe4 ci4，wo3men5 hui4 yan2 zhen4 yi3 dai1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 neng2 gao3ding4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, but the Kreuzbasar isn't the best place to do it. There aren't a ton "
"of jobs out here if you don't have a network."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​但​克洛伊​茨​集市​不是​个​接活​的​好​地方​。​如果​你​在​这​没什么​人​脉​的话​，​就​没有​多少​差事​可​做​。\n"
"en1，dan4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 bu4shi4 ge4 jie1huo2 de5 hao3 di4fang1。ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 zhe4 mei2shen2me5 ren2 mai4 de5hua4，jiu4 mei2you3 duo1shao3 cha4shi4 ke3 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, but there are other runners out there with equally strong reputations."
" So again: why me?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​但​还有​其他​名声在外​的​狂奔​者​呢​。​我​再​问​一次​，​为什么​选​我​？\n"
"en1，dan4 hai2you3 qi2ta1 ming2 sheng1 zai4 wai4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 ni2。wo3 zai4 wen4 yi1ci4，wei4shen2me5 xuan3 wo3？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, but you can get one of those anywhere! You ain't gonna find another of these anytime soon.\n"
"\n"
"But it's not like I get offers to buy these every day, so I'll cut ya a deal. How's 350 sound?"
msgstr ""
"是​这样​，​可​那种​玩意儿​上​哪​买不到​啊​！​但​这个​宝贝​，​可是​过​了​这村​就​没​这店​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​话说回来​，​碰到​你​这种​识货​的​主顾​也​算是​缘分​，​我​就​给​你​打个​折​吧​。​350​新円​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4，ke3 na4zhong3 wan2yi4r5 shang4 na3 mai3 bu4 dao4 a1！dan4 zhe4ge5 bao3bei4，ke3shi4 guo4 le5 zhe4 cun1 jiu4 mei2 zhe4 dian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，peng4dao4 ni3 zhe4zhong3 shi2huo4 de5 zhu3gu4 ye3 suan4shi4 yuan2fen4，wo3 jiu4 gei3 ni3 da3 ge4 zhe1 ba1。350 xin1 yuan2 zen3me5yang4？"

msgid "Yeah, but you were poking around in there..."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​但​你​当时​就​在​那里​头​鼓捣​……\n"
"shi4 a1，dan4 ni3 dang1shi2 jiu4 zai4 na4li5 tou2 gu3dao5……"

msgid ""
"Yeah, chief.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Me neither."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​是​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, chief. And *that* is a sentiment that I can get behind.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon. Let's get the hell out of here. When we get back to the Kreuzbasar, I'll buy you a drink."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​头儿​。​而且​我​也​不会​这样​*​感情用事​*​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​吧​。​等​我们​回到​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​我​请​你​喝酒​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，tou2r5。er2qie3 wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 zhe4yang4*gan3qing2yong4shi4*le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1。deng3 wo3men5 hui2dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，wo3 qing3 ni3 he1jiu3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, chief. I am, too.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's embarassing, I've gotta say."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​头儿​。​我​也​这么​想​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​这挺​尴尬​的​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，tou2r5。wo3 ye3 zhe4me5 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，zhe4 ting3 gan1ga4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, chief. I mean, kind of. I think so.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He averts his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I, uh... I got a package in the mail. It had somebody's thumbs in it."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​头儿​。​我​觉得​，​算是​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​目光​有些​躲闪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​收到​了​一个​包裹​。​里面​装着​某个​人​的​拇指​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，tou2r5。wo3 jue2de5，suan4shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mu4guang1 you3xie1 duo3shan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……shou1dao4 le5 yi1ge5 bao1guo3。li3mian4 zhuang1 zhao2 mou3 ge4 ren2 de5 mu3zhi3。"

msgid "Yeah, chief. I will."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​头儿​。​我会​的​。\n"
"en1，tou2r5。wo3 hui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, chief. Me too.\n"
"\n"
"Me too."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​头儿​，​我​也​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​很​期待​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，tou2r5，wo3 ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 hen3 qi1dai4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, chief... simple enough. To kill the AI, we're gonna have to flip two switches, wait a few minutes, then push a button. Oh, and we'll need to protect the terminal that the button is set into.\n"
"\n"
"It all seems pretty simple... and the best part is, we won't even need to jack in to the Matrix to do it!"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​头儿​……​挺​简单​的​。​要​干掉​AI​，​我们​得拉下​两个​开关​，​等​几分钟​，​然后​按下​一个​按钮​。​哦​，​对​了​，​我们​还​得​保护​按钮​所在​的​终端​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​很​简单​……​而且​最好​的​一点​是​，​我们​甚至​不用​接入​矩阵​就​能​完成​！\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，tou2r5……ting3 jian3dan1 de5。yao4 gan4diao4 AI，wo3men5 de2 la1 xia4 liang3 ge4 kai1guan1，deng3 ji1 fen4 zhong1，ran2hou4 an4xia4 yi1ge5 an4niu3。e2，dui4 le5，wo3men5 hai2 de2 bao3hu4 an4niu3 suo3zai4 de5 zhong1duan1。\n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 hen3 jian3dan1……er2qie3 zui4hao3 de5 yi1dian3 shi4，wo3men5 shen4zhi4 bu4yong4 jie1ru4 ju3zhen4 jiu4 neng2 wan2cheng2！"

msgid ""
"Yeah, chief... that place just felt *wrong.*\n"
"\n"
"You could feel it in your heart, you know? *Creepy.*"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​头儿​……​那​地方​感觉​就​*​不​对​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​心里​头​也​有​这种​感觉​吧​？​就是​*​瘆​人​*​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，tou2r5……na4 di4fang1 gan3jue2 jiu4*bu4 dui4*。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xin1li5 tou2 ye3 you3 zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2 ba1？jiu4shi4*shen4 ren2*。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, chief... you're probably right about that. Sorry.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is an awkward pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But in my own defense, I didn't expect Grinder to send his accountant to shadow you. That's a new one on me."
msgstr ""
"头儿​……​也许​你​是​对​的​。​抱歉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一阵​尴尬​的​沉默​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​要​辩解​一下​，​我​没想到​“​绞肉机​”​会派​自己​的​会计​来​跟着​你​。​这事​我​也​不​知道​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5……ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。bao4qian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1zhen4 gan1ga4 de5 chen2mo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 yao4 bian4jie3 yi1xia4，wo3 mei2xiang3dao4“jiao3rou4ji1” hui4 pai4 zi4ji3 de5 kuai4ji4 lai2 gen1zhe5 ni3。zhe4 shi4 wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 a1。"

msgid "Yeah, chief?"
msgstr ""
"怎么​了​，​头儿​？\n"
"zen3me5 le5，tou2r5？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, could you open the door to the utility area? We have some work to do "
"in there."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​你​能​把​杂物间​的​门​打开​吗​？​我们​需要​在​里面​做些​工作​。\n"
"en1，ni3 neng2 ba3 za2 wu4 jian1 de5 men2 da3kai1 ma5？wo3men5 xu1yao4 zai4 li3mian4 zuo4 xie1 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, crunch time again. Gotta love it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}With a keystroke, he locks the console and turns for the door.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​又​到​了​关键时刻​，​可​真要命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​按​了​一下​键盘​，​锁上​控制台​，​转身​向​门口​走​去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，you4 dao4 le5 guan1 jian4 shi2 ke4，ke3 zhen1 yao4 ming4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 an4 le5 yi1xia4 jian4pan2，suo3shang4 kong4zhi4tai2，zhuan3shen1 xiang4 men2kou3 zou3 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Yeah, definitely a handy little toy. Now I really want one."
msgstr ""
"的确​很​实用​啊​，​搞​得​我​都​想要​一个​了​。\n"
"di2que4 hen3 shi2yong4 a1，gao3 de2 wo3 dou1 xiang3yao4 yi1ge5 le5。"

msgid "Yeah, delighted. Look, we need to talk about these ghouls."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​不​客气​。​听​着​，​我要​和​你​谈谈​食尸​鬼​的​事​。\n"
"en1，bu4 ke4qi5。ting1 zhao2，wo3 yao4 he4 ni3 tan2tan2 shi2 shi1 gui3 de5 shi4。"

msgid "Yeah, exactly."
msgstr ""
"是​吧​。\n"
"shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"For now, I think we can."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​目前​来说​，​我​认为​完全​没​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 mu4qian2 lai2 shuo1，wo3 ren4wei2 wan2quan2 mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid "Yeah, good plan."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​好​主意​。\n"
"en1，hao3 zhu3yi5。"

msgid "Yeah, he did. Not for the better, but he changed things, all right."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​不能​说​变得​更好​，​但​他​确实​做出​了​改变​。\n"
"shi4 a1。bu4neng2 shuo1 bian4de5 geng1 hao3，dan4 ta1 que4shi2 zuo4chu1 le5 gai3bian4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, inflammatory notes that provided almost no useful information. Look, "
"you've made your fair share of mistakes, but no more than she did."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​那些​充满​挑衅​的​内容​几乎​没有​提供​任何​有用​的​信息​。​听​着​，​你​犯过​不少​错误​，​但​并不比​她​多​。\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，na4xie1 chong1man3 tiao3xin4 de5 nei4rong2 ji1hu1 mei2you3 ti2gong1 ren4he2 you3yong4 de5 xin4xi1。ting1 zhao2，ni3 fan4 guo4 bu4shao3 cuo4wu4，dan4 bing4 bu4 bi3 ta1 duo1。"

msgid "Yeah, it is. And we've got you to thank for that."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​这​都​多亏​了​你​。\n"
"shi4 a1。zhe4 dou1 duo1kui1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, it is. You wouldn't want Hans to wind up at the bottom of the heap, "
"like me."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​。​你​肯定​不想​让​汉斯​和​我​一样​，​沦为​最底层​的​可怜虫​。\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4。ni3 ken3ding4 bu4xiang3 rang4 han4si1 he4 wo3 yi1yang4，lun2wei2 zui4 de5 ceng2 de5 ke3lian2chong2。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, it was. I'm glad to hear that you'll be staying on with the team."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​我​也​很​高兴​你​愿意​继续​留队​。\n"
"shi4 a1。wo3 ye3 hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 yuan4yi4 ji4xu4 liu2 dui4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, it wasn’t a milk run. But Vauclair’s plan failed because of us. That’s"
" something."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这​差事​并​不​轻松​。​但​我们​挫败​了​沃​克莱尔​的​计划​，​这​也​算​有所​成就​吧​。\n"
"en1，zhe4 cha4shi4 bing4 bu4 qing1song1。dan4 wo3men5 cuo4bai4 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 ji4hua4，zhe4 ye3 suan4 you3suo3 cheng2jiu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, it'll kill the dragons. But there's no tellin' what else might happen.\n"
"\n"
"Unleashin' that shit could have deadly consequences for all of us."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​会​死​，​这​一点​没错​。​但​谁​也​不​知道​还会​发生​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​释放​这​东西​可能​会​给​我们​所有人​带来​致命​后果​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 hui4 si3，zhe4 yi1dian3 mei2cuo4。dan4 shei2 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 hai2 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4fang4 zhe4 dong1xi1 ke3neng2 hui4 gei3 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dai4lai2 zhi4ming4 hou4guo3。"

msgid "Yeah, it's a good look on you."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​在​你​脸上​很​好看​。\n"
"en1，zai4 ni3 lian3 shang4 hen3 hao3kan4。"

msgid "Yeah, it's fine. Are you two here to buy?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​没什么​事​。​你们​俩​在​这​买​东西​吗​？\n"
"en1，mei2shen2me5 shi4。ni3men5 lia3 zai4 zhe4 mai3 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, let's see... they changed the Emergency Assistance Code from \"November\" to \"Indigo.\"\n"
"\n"
"I think that's it, everything else should be the same from last week."
msgstr ""
"让​我​看看​……​他们​把​紧急​援助​代码​从​“​November​”​改成​了​“​Indigo​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这些​，​其他​的​都​和​上周​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 kan4kan5……ta1men5 ba3 jin3ji2 yuan2zhu4 dai4ma3 cong2“November” gai3cheng2 le5“Indigo”。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4xie1，qi2ta1 de5 dou1 he4 shang4zhou1 yi1yang4。"

msgid "Yeah, like me."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​比如​我​。\n"
"en1，bi3ru2 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, look, Phil... I've gotta go. These samples won't stay frozen forever."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​听​着​，​菲尔​……​我​得​走​了​，​否则​这些​样本​会​解冻​的​。\n"
"shi4 a1，ting1 zhao2，fei1 er3……wo3 de2 zou3 le5，fou3ze2 zhe4xie1 yang4ben3 hui4 jie3dong4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, maybe so. Doesn't change my feelings about it, though.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno, boss. I can't argue with what she's sayin', but buddying up with a war robot ain't my cup of tea."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​也许​吧​。​不过​这​改变​不了​我​的​想法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朝​你​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​不​确定​，​老大​。​她​说​的​确实​有​道理​，​但​要​和​战争​机器人​搞好关系​，​我​总​感觉​不靠​谱​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，ye3xu3 ba1。bu4guo4 zhe4 gai3bian4 bu4le5 wo3 de5 xiang3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 bu4 que4ding4，lao3da4。ta1 shuo1 de5 que4shi2 you3 dao4li5，dan4 yao4 he4 zhan4zheng1 ji1qi4ren2 gao3 hao3 guan1 xi4，wo3 zong3 gan3jue2 bu4 kao4 pu3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, maybe. But it'll be interesting, and *I'll* be the cause of it.\n"
"\n"
"Not a dragon. Not a megacorp. *Me.*\n"
"\n"
"All by myself, changing the world."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​这​很​有意思​，​而​*​我​*​会​是​这​一切​的​源头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​巨龙​。​不是​超企​。​是​*​我​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​凭​我​一己​之力​，​改变​世界​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 zhe4 hen3 you3yi4si5，er2*wo3*hui4 shi4 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 yuan2tou2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 ju4long2。bu4shi4 chao1 qi3。shi4*wo3*。\n"
"\n"
"ping2 wo3 yi1ji3 zhi1 li4，gai3bian4 shi4jie4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, of course you do.\n"
"\n"
"Tell us what you need."
msgstr ""
"想想也是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​吧​，​你​需要​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ba1，ni3 xu1yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, of course you will. Saw that coming.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Tell us what you need."
msgstr ""
"想想也是​。​我​早就​料到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​吧​，​你​需要​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。wo3 zao3jiu4 liao4dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ba1，ni3 xu1yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, of course you will. Saw that coming.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Tell us what you need."
msgstr ""
"想想也是​。​我​早就​料到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​吧​，​你​需要​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。wo3 zao3jiu4 liao4dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ba1，ni3 xu1yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, of course, chief. If you'll do me the favor of pushing that button, "
"I'll activate the security doors..."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​头儿​。​如果​你​能​按​下​按钮​的话​，​我会​启动​安全门​……\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，tou2r5。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 an4 xia4 an4niu3 de5hua4，wo3 hui4 qi3dong4 an1 quan2 men2……"

msgid ""
"Yeah, okay, I was a member. For a while. \n"
"\n"
"But the old boss got himself killed in a firefight, and his second-in-command took over."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​好​吧​。​我​以前​是​帮里​的​人​。​有​那么​一段时间​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​有​一次​火并​的​时候​，​以前​的​老大​被​杀​了​，​然后​帮里​的​二把手​就​趁势​上位​了​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，hao3 ba1。wo3 yi3qian2 shi4 bang1 li3 de5 ren2。you3 na4me5 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 you3 yi1ci4 huo3bing4 de5 shi2hou5，yi3qian2 de5 lao3da4 bei4 sha1 le5，ran2hou4 bang1 li3 de5 er4ba3shou3 jiu4 chen4shi4 shang4wei4 le5。"

msgid "Yeah, okay. I'll hear you out."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​好​吧​，​你​说​。\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1，ni3 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, probably. It might take a bit of doing, though.\n"
"\n"
"I love working on these old corp drones. Can't make you any guarantees, but either way it's on the house."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​不过​得花点​工夫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​喜欢​研究​这些​老式​公司​无人机​。​我​不能​向​你​做​任何​保证​，​但​无论如何​，​就​当​是​我​请客​了​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。bu4guo4 de2 hua1 dian3 gong1fu1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi3huan5 yan2jiu1 zhe4xie1 lao3shi4 gong1si1 wu2ren2ji1。wo3 bu4neng2 xiang4 ni3 zuo4 ren4he2 bao3zheng4，dan4 wu2lun4ru2he2，jiu4 dang1 shi4 wo3 qing3ke4 le5。"

msgid "Yeah, real leather. Cost me a fortune."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​是​真皮​。​花​了​我​一大笔钱​。\n"
"en1，shi4 zhen1pi2。hua1 le5 wo3 yi1 dai4 bi3 qian2。"

msgid "Yeah, see ya."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​回见​。\n"
"en1，hui2jian4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, she's guilty, all right. But we can't let ourselves get diverted like this.\n"
"\n"
"We need to deal with Harrow's shrine, and we need to do it fast. Killing Marta before we've even found the bloody thing isn't going to help us do that."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​她​确实​有罪​。​但​我们​不能​让​自己​像​这样​分心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​解决​哈罗​的​神龛​，​而且​必须​速战速决​。​如果​在此之前​杀死​玛​尔塔​，​对​这件​事​不会​有​任何​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，ta1 que4shi2 you3zui4。dan4 wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 zi4ji3 xiang4 zhe4yang4 fen1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 jie3jue2 ha1luo2 de5 shen2kan1，er2qie3 bi4xu1 su4zhan4su4jue2。ru2guo3 zai4ci3zhi1qian2 sha1si3 Ma3er3ta3，dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 bu4hui4 you3 ren4he2 bang1zhu4。"

msgid "Yeah, so be it."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​就​这样​吧​。\n"
"shi4 a1，jiu4 zhe4yang4 ba1。"

msgid "Yeah, something like that."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​差不多​。\n"
"en1，cha4bu5duo1。"

msgid "Yeah, something like that. There are a lot of addresses in there."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​差不多​。​上面​有​不少​地址​什么​的​。\n"
"en1，cha4bu5duo1。shang4mian4 you3 bu4shao3 di4zhi3 shen2me5 de5。"

msgid "Yeah, sorry about that. I got held up at the wall."
msgstr ""
"不好意思​，​来​的​路上​遇到​了​点​麻烦​。\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5，lai2 de5 lu4shang5 yu4dao4 le5 dian3 ma2fan5。"

msgid "Yeah, sorry about that. Oh, wait, I'm not."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​真​抱歉​。​哦​等等​，​我​没​这么​想​。\n"
"shi4 a1，zhen1 bao4qian4。e2 deng3deng3，wo3 mei2 zhe4me5 xiang3。"

msgid "Yeah, sounds wiz. Oh, and Blitz...?"
msgstr ""
"听​起来​不错​。​对​了​，​布里​茨​……​？\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 bu4cuo4。dui4 le5，Bu4li3ci2……？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, sure I have. What's it to ya?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The woman eyes you up and down, clearly waiting for you to make an offer.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​当然​。​这关​你​什么​事​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​女人​上下​打量​着​你​，​明显​在​等​你​出价​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，dang1ran2。zhe4 guan1 ni3 shen2me5 shi4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3ren2 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，ming2xian3 zai4 deng3 ni3 chu1jia4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Yeah, sure, I get it.\n"
"\n"
"But see, this building... it's under Arbeiter protection. We can't just let you waltz in and shoot up the place.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He smiles at you, revealing a mouth filled with jagged teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure you understand."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​理解​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​，​这栋​建筑​……​现在​由​工人​帮​保护​。​我们​可​不能​让​你​大摇大摆​地​闯进去​大开杀戒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朝​你​咧嘴一笑​，​露出​满口​参差不齐​的​牙齿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​相信​你​能​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 li3jie3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4，zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4……xian4zai4 you2 gong1ren2 bang1 bao3hu4。wo3men5 ke3 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 da4yao2da4bai3 de5 chuang3 jin4 qu4 dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，lu4chu1 man3kou3 cen1ci1bu4qi2 de5 ya2chi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3。"

msgid "Yeah, sure, big guy. Point away."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​大块头​。​给​我​指路​吧​。\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，da4kuai4tou2。gei3 wo3 zhi3lu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, sure, chief. Doing it now.\n"
"\n"
"Just sayin'... the door's open. So if you wanted to take a look in there *while* I'm \"getting this done,\" it probably wouldn't hurt anything. I'm just sayin'."
msgstr ""
"啊​，​好​吧​，​头儿​。​我​知道​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​顺便​一说​……​门​已经​开​了​。​所以​如果​你​想​在​我​“​忙​正事​”​的​*​同时​*​去​看看​的话​，​应该​也​没什么​大碍​。​我​就​这么​一说​。\n"
"\n"
"a1，hao3 ba1，tou2r5。wo3 zhi1dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shun4bian4 yi1shuo1……men2 yi3jing1 kai1 le5。suo3yi3 ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 zai4 wo3“mang2 zheng4shi4” de5*tong2shi2*qu4 kan4kan5 de5hua4，ying1gai1 ye3 mei2shen2me5 da4ai4。wo3 jiu4 zhe4me5 yi1shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, sure. I'll just need one of you to push that button in the security "
"terminal so that I can activate the security doors."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​我​只​需要​你们​有人​按下​安保​终端​的​按钮​，​让​我​来​启动​安全门​。\n"
"dang1ran2。wo3 zhi3 xu1yao4 ni3men5 you3ren2 an4xia4 an1bao3 zhong1duan1 de5 an4niu3，rang4 wo3 lai2 qi3dong4 an1 quan2 men2。"

msgid "Yeah, sure. Somehow, I don't find your reassurances very convincing."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​。​但​我​觉得​你​的​保证​不是​很​有​说服力​啊​。\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4。dan4 wo3 jue2de5 ni3 de5 bao3zheng4 bu4shi4 hen3 you3 shuo1fu2li4 a1。"

msgid "Yeah, tell me about it."
msgstr ""
"可不是​嘛​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, tell me about it. Makes me wish that we could screw 'em right back... but that's not the world we live in, is it?\n"
"\n"
"Well, anyway. The second van it is, then. Let's get moving."
msgstr ""
"可不是​嘛​，​我​巴不得​有​以牙还牙​的​机会​……​可惜​世界​不是​这么​运作​的​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​第二辆​就​第二辆​吧​，​我们​出发​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5，wo3 ba1bu5de5 you3 yi3ya2huan2ya2 de5 ji1hui4……ke3xi1 shi4jie4 bu4shi4 zhe4me5 yun4zuo4 de5，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 di4 er4 liang4 jiu4 di4 er4 liang4 ba1，wo3men5 chu1fa1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, thanks again. I won't forget this... none of us will.\n"
"\n"
"If you're ever in town and looking for a soykaf, swing by the shop! You'll be welcome at our place for life."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​再次​感谢​。​我​不会​忘记​的​……​我们​都​不会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​再​来​这里​想​喝杯​豆​咖​的话​，​欢迎​随时​光临​本店​！​你​永远​都​会​是​我们​这里​最​受欢迎​的​客人​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，zai4ci4 gan3xie4。wo3 bu4hui4 wang4ji4 de5……wo3men5 dou1 bu4hui4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 lai2 zhe4li3 xiang3 he4 bei1 dou4 ka1 de5hua4，huan1ying2 sui2shi2 guang1lin2 ben3 dian4！ni3 yong3yuan3 dou1 hui4 shi4 wo3men5 zhe4li3 zui4 shou4huan1ying2 de5 ke4ren2。"

msgid "Yeah, thanks."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​谢谢​。\n"
"en1，xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, thanks. It wasn't all that difficult, just a matter of following our "
"employers' instructions."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​。​也​没​那么​难搞​，​只是​按照​我们​雇主​的​要求​来​做​罢了​。\n"
"xie4 le5。ye3 mei2 na4me5 nan2gao3，zhi3shi4 an4zhao4 wo3men5 gu4zhu3 de5 yao1qiu2 lai2 zuo4 ba4le5。"

msgid "Yeah, that about covers it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​差不多​吧​。\n"
"en1，cha4bu5duo1 ba1。"

msgid "Yeah, that could've gone better."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​但​这事​本该​有个​更好​的​结局​。\n"
"shi4 a1，dan4 zhe4 shi4 ben3 gai1 you3 ge4 geng1 hao3 de5 jie2ju2。"

msgid "Yeah, that's me. Am I late?"
msgstr ""
"就是​我​。​我​迟到​了​吗​？\n"
"jiu4shi4 wo3。wo3 chi2dao4 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Yeah, that's me. Do I know you?"
msgstr ""
"是​我​。​我​认识​你​吗​？\n"
"shi4 wo3。wo3 ren4shi5 ni3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, that's probably the best way to go.\n"
"\n"
"It's what we agreed to, after all."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​也许​这是​最好​的​办法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​我们​和​客户​商量​好​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，ye3xu3 zhe4 shi4 zui4hao3 de5 ban4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 wo3men5 he4 ke4hu4 shang1liang5 hao3 le5。"

msgid "Yeah, that's right. And don't you forget it."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​就是​这样​。​你​可​别忘了​。\n"
"mei2cuo4，jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。ni3 ke3 bie4 wang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, that's right. Plotz. Your buddy Blitz will be meeting him in a minute or two.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The troll raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Y'know, you're pretty smart for a shadowrunner."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​普​洛茨​。​你​那个​朋友​布里​茨​应该​马上​就​能​见到​他​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​巨魔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没想到​你​一个​暗影​狂奔​者​，​脑子​还​挺​灵光​的​嘛​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，Pu3luo4ci2。ni3 na4ge5 peng2you5 Bu4li3ci2 ying1gai1 ma3shang4 jiu4 neng2 jian4dao4 ta1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2xiang3dao4 ni3 yi1ge5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，nao3zi5 hai2 ting3 ling2guang1 de5 ma5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, that's the place. It's already a run-down, gang-infested hellhole... not the sort of kiez you'd want to stroll through after dark.\n"
"\n"
"And if the Engineer is allowed to do his work there uninterrupted, it's going to get a whole lot worse."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​那儿​早已​成​了​破败​不堪​、​帮派​横行​的​鬼​地方​……​你​肯定​不会​想​在​天黑​后​去​那种​街区​闲逛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​让​工程师​在​那儿​不​受​干扰​地​搞​他​的​研究​，​情况​只会​变得​更糟​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，na4r5 zao3yi3 cheng2 le5 po4bai4 bu4kan1、bang1pai4 heng2xing2 de5 gui3 di4fang1……ni3 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 xiang3 zai4 tian1hei1 hou4 qu4 na4zhong3 jie1qu1 xian2guang4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 rang4 gong1cheng2shi1 zai4 na4r5 bu4 shou4 gan1rao3 de5 gao3 ta1 de5 yan2jiu1，qing2kuang4 zhi3 hui4 bian4de5 geng1 zao1。"

msgid "Yeah, that's what I thought."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​就是​这么​想​的​。\n"
"en1，wo3 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, that's what she *said*... but I'll bet that she didn't *mean* it. She probably just didn't want to worry me. Or maybe she said it under duress!\n"
"\n"
"I mean, you've gotta agree that it's at least worth checking out."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​她​是​这么​*​说​的​*​……​但​我​想​她​肯定​不是​这个​*​意思​*​。​她​可能​只是​不想​让​我​担心​。​或者​她​是​受​人​胁迫​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​起码​这​事​值得​调查​一番​，​这话​你​也​同意​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，ta1 shi4 zhe4me5*shuo1 de5*……dan4 wo3 xiang3 ta1 ken3ding4 bu4shi4 zhe4ge5*yi4si5*。ta1 ke3neng2 zhi3shi4 bu4xiang3 rang4 wo3 dan1xin1。huo4zhe3 ta1 shi4 shou4 ren2 xie2po4！\n"
"\n"
"qi3ma3 zhe4 shi4 zhi2de5 diao4cha2 yi1 fan1，zhe4 hua4 ni3 ye3 tong2yi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, the dragons will die. But there's no telling what else might happen.\n"
"\n"
"Setting that shit loose would be a bad idea, man. It could kill us all."
msgstr ""
"巨龙​会​死​，​这​一点​没错​。​但​谁​也​不​知道​还会​发生​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​释放​这​东西​可能​是​个​坏主意​。​我们​可能​都​会​被​杀​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 hui4 si3，zhe4 yi1dian3 mei2cuo4。dan4 shei2 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 hai2 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4fang4 zhe4 dong1xi1 ke3neng2 shi4 ge4 huai4 zhu3 yi4。wo3men5 ke3neng2 dou1 hui4 bei4 sha1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, there was some of that... but luck ain't everything.\n"
"\n"
"Back in my glory days, I made my own luck. If I were still in my prime, I'd've beaten those Rammbock bastards into pulp, bad luck or no.\n"
"\n"
"But now, I..."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​确实​也​有​这方面​因素​……​但​也​不能​全​归结到​运气​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​想当初​，​我​最​意气风发​的​时候​，​从来​都​把​命运​牢牢​抓​在​自己​手里​。​如果​让​我​再​年轻​个​几十岁​，​管​他​运气​好不好​，​我​也​照样​能​把​那​帮​撞锤​帮​的​渣滓​打个​稀巴烂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​现在​，​我​……\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，que4shi2 ye3 you3 zhe4 fang1 mian4 yin1su4……dan4 ye3 bu4neng2 quan2 gui1 jie1 dao4 yun4qi5 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 dang1 chu1，wo3 zui4 yi4qi4feng1fa1 de5 shi2hou5，cong2lai2 dou1 ba3 ming4yun4 lao2lao2 zhua1 zai4 zi4ji3 shou3li3。ru2guo3 rang4 wo3 zai4 nian2qing1 ge4 ji1 shi2 sui4，guan3 ta1 yun4qi5 hao3bu5hao3，wo3 ye3 zhao4yang4 neng2 ba3 na4 bang1 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 zha1zi3 da3 ge4 xi1ba1lan4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4，wo3……"

msgid ""
"Yeah, they've been trickling in over the last fifteen minutes or so.\n"
"\n"
"I've already done a security check on your entire crew. Everything checked out, so you're good to head on into the building whenever you want."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​过去​十五分钟​左右​他们​陆续​到​齐​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​对​你们​整个​团队​进行​了​安全检查​。​一切正常​，​所以​你​想​什么​时候​进​大楼​都​可以​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，guo4qu4 shi2 wu3 fen4 zhong1 zuo3you4 ta1men5 lu4xu4 dao4 qi2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 dui4 ni3men5 zheng3ge4 tuan2dui4 jin4xing2 le5 an1 quan2 jian3 cha2。yi1 qie1 zheng1 chang2，suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 jin4 da4lou2 dou1 ke3yi3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, this is a really great place! Well, it was a better place, before it got taken over. \n"
"\n"
"But it's not too bad now! It's still got cram, right? Hahahaha!"
msgstr ""
"总之​，​这​地方​特别​棒​！​唔​，​之前​更好​一点​，​就​没​换人​那​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​现在​也​不算​太糟​啦​！​这​不是​还有​药嘛​！​哈哈哈哈​！\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，zhe4 di4fang1 te4bie2 bang4！wu2，zhi1qian2 geng1 hao3 yi1dian3，jiu4 mei2 huan4ren2 na4 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 xian4zai4 ye3 bu4suan4 tai4 zao1 la5！zhe4 bu4shi4 hai2you3 yao4 ma5！ha1 ha1 ha1 ha1！"

msgid ""
"Yeah, we all made it. Thank God. \n"
"\n"
"We rode out the attack in a small shelter... me, my wife, and our two daughters.\n"
"\n"
"The shelter, it protected us, but the heat was just unbearable. We couldn't have stayed in there much longer than we did."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​谢天谢地​，​我们​都​活​下来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​一处​小​避难所​里​躲过​了​这次​袭击​……​我​、​我​妻子​，​还有​我们​的​两个​女儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​避难所​保护​了​我们​，​但​酷热​难耐​，​我们​没​办法​在​里面​待​更​久​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，xie4tian1xie4di4，wo3men5 dou1 huo2 xia4lai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 yi1 chu3 xiao3 bi4nan4suo3 li3 duo3 guo4 le5 zhe4 ci4 xi2ji1……wo3、wo3 qi1zi3，hai2you3 wo3men5 de5 liang3 ge4 nu:3er2。\n"
"\n"
"bi4nan4suo3 bao3hu4 le5 wo3men5，dan4 ku4re4 nan2 nai4，wo3men5 mei2 ban4fa3 zai4 li3mian4 dai1 geng1 jiu3 le5。"

msgid "Yeah, we are. What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​你​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Yeah, we're new. Just got transferred here yesterday. Why are you staring at"
" me like that?"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​我们​是​新来​的​。​昨天​刚调​到​这儿​来​。​你​为什么​这么​盯​着​我​？\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3men5 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5。zuo2tian1 gang1 diao4 dao4 zhe4r5 lai2。ni3 wei4shen2me5 zhe4me5 ding1 zhao2 wo3？"

msgid "Yeah, we've met."
msgstr ""
"认识​，​我们​见过​。\n"
"ren4shi5，wo3men5 jian4 guo4。"

msgid "Yeah, well, I don't have to like it."
msgstr ""
"我​还是​觉得​不妥​。\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 jue2de5 bu4tuo3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well, I feel for you.\n"
"\n"
"If it's any consolation, I don't want to be here, either. But I don't have a choice, understand?\n"
"\n"
"You do what they say, whether you want to or not."
msgstr ""
"我​非常​理解​你​的​感受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​话说回来​，​我​也​不想​待​在​这里​。​但​我​别无选择​，​明白​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​得​听​他们​的​，​不管​你​愿不愿意​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 fei1chang2 li3jie3 ni3 de5 gan3shou4。\n"
"\n"
"hua4shuo1hui2lai5，wo3 ye3 bu4xiang3 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3。dan4 wo3 bie2wu2xuan3ze2，ming2bai5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de2 ting1 ta1men5 de5，bu4guan3 ni3 yuan4 bu4 yuan4 yi4。"

msgid "Yeah, well, I was hoping that you'd want to chat."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​我​想​跟​你​聊聊​。\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 xiang3 gen1 ni3 liao2 liao2。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well, I'm sure that we all have things we'd rather be doing. Now, you "
"said that our teammates went inside... are you certain about that?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​相信​我们​每个​人​心里​肯定​都​惦记着​更想​做​的​事​。​所以​，​你​说​其他人​已经​进去​了​……​你​确定​吗​？\n"
"en1，wo3 xiang1xin4 wo3men5 mei3ge4 ren2 xin1li5 ken3ding4 dou1 dian4 ji4 zhao2 geng1 xiang3 zuo4 de5 shi4。suo3yi3，ni3 shuo1 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi3jing1 jin4qu4 le5……ni3 que4ding4 ma5？"

msgid "Yeah, well, it won't be the first."
msgstr ""
"反正​也​不是​第一次​了​。\n"
"fan3zheng4 ye3 bu4shi4 di4yi1ci4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well, life running a soykaf shop is a little more my speed.\n"
"\n"
"Not that there aren't risks; there's always the chance that some drunk'll break your windows, or a gang will try to shake you down for protection. Those things, I can handle, but this...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She stares down at the smashed drones and slowly shakes her head.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"哎​，​还是​经营​豆​咖店​的​生活​稍微​更​适合​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​倒​不是​说​干​这行​就​没有​风险​；​总会​有​酒鬼​来​砸​窗户​，​或者​流氓​地痞​来​勒索​保护费​。​不过​那些​事情​的话​，​我​还是​能​对付​的​；​但​这个​就​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​低头​盯​着​被​打烂​的​无人机​，​然后​缓缓​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ai1，hai2shi5 jing1ying2 dou4 ka1 dian4 de5 sheng1huo2 shao1wei1 geng1 shi4he2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"dao3 bu4shi4 shuo1 gan4 zhe4 xing2 jiu4 mei2you3 feng1xian3 ； zong3 hui4 you3 jiu3gui3 lai2 za2 chuang1hu5，huo4zhe3 liu2mang2 di4pi3 lai2 le4suo3 bao3 hu4 fei4。bu4guo4 na4xie1 shi4qing5 de5hua4，wo3 hai2shi5 neng2 dui4fu5 de5 ； dan4 zhe4ge5 jiu4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 ding1 zhao2 bei4 da3 lan4 de5 wu2ren2ji1，ran2hou4 huan3huan3 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well, things didn't work out well for him, either, did they?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She struggles to calm herself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, all I want to do is put this behind me. I'll run... somewhere. I don't know. The one thing I do know is that I want to get away from you."
msgstr ""
"但是​他​的​下场​也​不怎么样​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​努力​让​自己​冷静下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​我​只​想​逃离​这​一切​。​我会​去​……​某个​地方​，​我​也​不​知道​。​但​我​现在​只​知道​我要​远离​你​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 ta1 de5 xia4chang3 ye3 bu4zen3me5yang4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nu3li4 rang4 zi4ji3 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3 zhi3 xiang3 tao2li2 zhe4 yi1qie4。wo3 hui4 qu4……mou3 ge4 di4fang1，wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4。dan4 wo3 xian4zai4 zhi3 zhi1dao4 wo3 yao4 yuan3li2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well, trust me. It happens.\n"
"\n"
"I'm just glad that I had you here to cover me. Always good to have a competent $(l.man) at your back."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​相信​我​，​这种​事​常有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还好​有​你​在​这儿​掩护​我​，​背后​有个​靠​谱​的​同伴​总是​让​人​安心​的​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，xiang1xin4 wo3，zhe4zhong3 shi4 chang2 you3。\n"
"\n"
"hai2hao3 you3 ni3 zai4 zhe4r5 yan3hu4 wo3，bei4hou4 you3 ge4 kao4 pu3 de5 tong2ban4 zong3shi4 rang4 ren2 an1xin1 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well, whatever. He was old, is what I'm saying. Older than I'd expect.\n"
"\n"
"But *anyway,* this software of his is *neat.*"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​行​吧​，​反正​我​是​想​说​他​很​老​了​，​比​我​想象​中​还​老​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​总之​，​他​的​这款​软件​挺​*​厉害​*​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1 xing2 ba1，fan3zheng4 wo3 shi4 xiang3 shuo1 ta1 hen3 lao3 le5，bi3 wo3 xiang3xiang4 zhong4 hai2 lao3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zong3zhi1，ta1 de5 zhe4 kuan3 ruan3jian4 ting3*li4hai5*。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well, you know corporate-types. Everything has to happen on their "
"timetable, however arbitrary it may be."
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​，​公司​那帮人​不​都​这样​嘛​。​不管​有​多​随意​，​所有​事​都​得​按​他们​的​时间表​来​。\n"
"en1 heng1，gong1si1 na4 bang1 ren2 bu4 dou1 zhe4yang4 ma5。bu4guan3 you3 duo1 sui2yi4，suo3you3 shi4 dou1 de2 an4 ta1men5 de5 shi2jian1biao3 lai2。"

msgid "Yeah, well, you owe me. Now tell me about the others."
msgstr ""
"记得​你​欠​我​个人​情​。​现在​给​我​说​说​其他人​的​情况​吧​。\n"
"ji4de5 ni3 qian4 wo3 ge4ren2 qing2。xian4zai4 gei3 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 qi2 ta1 ren2 de5 qing2kuang4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well, your fellow mop-jockeys beat you here. Security checks came in "
"green, so you're good to head into the building whenever you want to."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​不过​其他​的​拖把​工​可比​你​先到​一步​。​安检​都​通过​了​，​所以​你​想​什么​时候​进​大楼​都​可以​。\n"
"en1，bu4guo4 qi2ta1 de5 tuo1ba3 gong1 ke3bi3 ni3 xian1 dao4 yi1 bu4。an1jian3 dou1 tong1guo4 le5，suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 jin4 da4lou2 dou1 ke3yi3。"

msgid "Yeah, well. Hindsight is twenty-twenty."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​事后诸葛亮​嘛​。\n"
"shi4 a1，shi4hou4zhu1ge3liang4 ma5。"

msgid "Yeah, well. I ain't touching it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​好​吧​。​反正​我​不会​碰​它​。\n"
"en1，hao3 ba1。fan3zheng4 wo3 bu4hui4 peng4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well. It's amazing what you can teach yourself to do when your "
"livelihood depends on it."
msgstr ""
"这个​嘛​，​毕竟​是​性命攸关​的​事情​，​不想​学​也​得学​着​做​啊​。\n"
"zhe4ge5 ma5，bi4jing4 shi4 xing4ming4you1guan1 de5 shi4qing5，bu4xiang3 xue2 ye3 de2 xue2 zhao2 zuo4 a1。"

msgid "Yeah, well. That's been going around lately."
msgstr ""
"唉​，​怎么​大伙儿​最近​都​这么​说​。\n"
"ai1，zen3me5 da4huo3r5 zui4jin4 dou1 zhe4me5 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah, well. You're free now. Try to use your powers for good instead of "
"evil."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​现在​你​自由​了​。​最好​用​你​的​能力​来​行善​而​非​作恶​吧​。\n"
