"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。zui4 zao1gao1 de5 shi4 wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 tou1 zou3 de5 shu4ju4 dao4di3 shi4*shen2me5*。\n"
"\n"
"wen2jian4 she4 le5 chong2chong2 jia1mi4，wo3 yi1zhi2 mei2you3 da3kai1 guo4 ta1。"

msgid "Yeah."
