"​我​死不了​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 yi1jiu4 jin3jin3 ding1 zhao2 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 yi2ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 si3bu4liao3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know that."
