"好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​向​你​报以​感激​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​稍后​见​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 bao4yi3 gan3ji1 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shao1hou4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
