"是​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​那​就​第二辆​车​。​我们​动身​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 jiu4 di4 er4 liang4 che1。wo3men5 dong4shen1 ba1。"

