"​哈罗​会​逃走​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3ya2qie4chi3 de5 shuo1chu1 zhe4xie1 hua4，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 ku3se4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 hui4 tao2zou3。"

