"嗯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​又​转身​看​向​工程师​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​的​。​但​你​最好​快点​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 zhuan3shen1 kan4 xiang4 gong1cheng2shi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 kuai4dian3。"

