"\n"
"en1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 xian3de5 bi3 ni3 yi3wang3 jian4 guo4 de5 ren4he2 shi2hou5 dou1 geng4jia1 xin1fan2yi4luan4。ta1 nao3 hai3 zhong4 fan1yong3 de5 ji4yi4 xiang3bi4 ji2qi2 tong4ku3。{{/GM}} \n"
