"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​那​可是​惊天动地​的​一战​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1ran2 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 na4 ke3shi4 jing1tian1dong4di4 de5 yi1zhan4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Yeah. 'course it is.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Later."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​回见​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui2jian4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. All right, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I guess the cat's out of the bag anyway."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​纸​终究​是​包​不住​火​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 zhi3 zhong1jiu1 shi4 bao1 bu4zhu4 huo3 de5。"

msgid "Yeah. And if that's the case, they're responsible for Maxim's death."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​要​真是​这样的话​，​马克西姆​的​死​就​得​算​在​他们​头上​。\n"
"en1。yao4 zhen1shi5 zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4，ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 de5 si3 jiu4 de2 suan4 zai4 ta1men5 tou2shang4。"

msgid "Yeah. And no matter what we do, we're gonna piss someone off."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​而且​无论​怎么​选​，​总会​得罪​另一边​。\n"
"en1，er2qie3 wu2lun4 zen3me5 xuan3，zong3 hui4 de2zui4 ling4 yi1 bian1。"

msgid "Yeah. And we're gonna take that place down."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​而且​我们​要​摧毁​它​。\n"
"shi4 a1。er2qie3 wo3men5 yao4 cui1hui3 ta1。"

msgid "Yeah. Anytime."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​有事​随时​说​。\n"
"en1，you3shi4 sui2shi2 shuo1。"

msgid "Yeah. How did you know he was a hellhound?"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​你​怎么​知道​他​是​地狱​猎犬​？\n"
"shi4 a1。ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 ta1 shi4 di4yu4 lie4quan3？"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I can help you.\n"
"\n"
"But it'll cost."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​我能​帮​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​需要​代价​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 neng2 bang1 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 xu1yao4 dai4jia4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I figured. Hang on a second, hang on.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He thrusts his hand into the pocket of his filthy jacket and rummages around. Eventually, he fishes out a small vial and a filthy credstick.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here. Some Flash and some cash. Enjoy it."
msgstr ""
"我​就​知道​。​等​下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把手​伸进​脏兮兮​的​外套​口袋​里​翻找​起来​。​最后​，​他​拿出​了​一个​小​药瓶​和​一根​脏兮兮​的​信用​棒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​你​。​一点​Flash​，​外加​一点​现金​。​慢​用​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4。deng3 xia4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 zang1xi1xi1 de5 wai4tao4 kou3dai4 li3 fan1 zhao3 qi3lai5。zui4hou4，ta1 na2chu1 le5 yi1ge5 xiao3 yao4ping2 he4 yi1 gen1 zang1xi1xi1 de5 xin4yong4 bang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3。yi1dian3 Flash，wai4jia1 yi1dian3 xian4jin1。man4 yong4。"

msgid "Yeah. I guess so."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​想​是​吧​。\n"
"en1，wo3 xiang3 shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I guess so.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, boss. Let's get the hell out of here.\n"
"\n"
"I want to go home."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​了​老大​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​回家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 le5 lao3da4，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 hui2jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I guess so.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe it's too late for me and Emilie. But I can still try to be the man that she hoped I could be."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​想​是​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​我​和​艾米莉​之间​已经​太迟​了​，​但​我​还​可以​努力​成为​她​希望​我​成为​的​样子​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 xiang3 shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3 he4 ai4 mi3 li4 zhi1jian1 yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5，dan4 wo3 hai2 ke3yi3 nu3li4 cheng2wei2 ta1 xi1wang4 wo3 cheng2wei2 de5 yang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I guess.\n"
"\n"
"Emilie wasn't too impressed, either. Our only really big fight was over that stupid file."
msgstr ""
"大概​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾米莉​也​没有​多​说​什么​。​我们​唯一​一次​大吵​是​关于​那份​破​文件​。\n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ai4 mi3 li4 ye3 mei2you3 duo1 shuo1 shen2me5。wo3men5 wei2yi1 yi1ci4 dai4 chao3 shi4 guan1yu2 na4 fen4 po4 wen2jian4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I know. This whole incident has me rethinking a lot of things.\n"
"\n"
"What if... what if she took the file to protect the Azzies? What if she's with *them?*"
msgstr ""
"我​知道​。​这​整件事​让​我​对​很多​事情​有​了​新​的​想法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果说​……​她​拿走​文件​是​为了​保护​阿兹佬​呢​？​如果说​她​和​*​那些​人​*​是​一边​的​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 rang4 wo3 dui4 hen3 duo1 shi4qing5 you3 le5 xin1 de5 xiang3fa3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3shuo1……ta1 na2zou3 wen2jian4 shi4 wei4le5 bao3hu4 e1 zi1 lao3 ni2？ru2guo3shuo1 ta1 he4*na4xie1 ren2*shi4 yi1bian1 de5 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I was afraid you'd say that.\n"
"\n"
"And now they've got you on their leash, with us alongside you."
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​，​我​就​怕​你​会​这么​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​上​了​他们​的​套​，​现在​我们​也​被​你​带进去​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1 heng1，wo3 jiu4 pa4 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shang4 le5 ta1men5 de5 tao4，xian4zai4 wo3men5 ye3 bei4 ni3 dai4 jin4 qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I watched them storm through the front doors of the building that "
"we're going to hit about ten minutes ago."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​大概​十分钟​前​，​我​看着​他们​冲进​了​目标​大楼​的​前门​。\n"
"en1。da4gai4 shi2 fen4 zhong1 qian2，wo3 kan4 zhao2 ta1men5 chong1jin4 le5 mu4biao1 da4lou2 de5 qian2men2。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I will.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head in disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You should go. I’ve got prep work to do for our next run, and you've got more important things to do than watch me pack my gear."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​厌恶​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​该​走​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​得​为​下次​行动​做​准备​了​，​而且​比起​看​我​收拾​东西​，​你​应该​有​更​重要​的​事要​做​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan4wu4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gai1 zou3 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3 de2 wei2 xia4ci4 xing2dong4 zuo4 zhun3bei4 le5，er2qie3 bi3qi3 kan4 wo3 shou1shi5 dong1xi1，ni3 ying1gai1 you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 zuo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I'm getting that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger takes another glance at the broken corpse, and you can see the uncertainty growing in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've seen biofeedback deaths before. Never seen anything like this."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​再次​瞥​了​一眼​那具​死状​凄惨​的​尸体​，​你​看出​她​眼中​疑虑​渐长​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以前​也​不是​没见​过​生物反馈​导致​的​死亡​，​但​从来​没见​过​这样​的​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 zai4ci4 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4 ju4 si3 zhuang4 qi1can3 de5 shi1ti3，ni3 kan4chu1 ta1 yan3zhong1 yi2lu:4 jian1 zhang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 ye3 bu4shi4 mei2 jian4 guo4 sheng1 wu4 fan3 kui4 dao3zhi4 de5 si3wang2，dan4 cong2lai2 mei2 jian4 guo4 zhe4yang4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I'm not really the chatty type.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She takes a drag on her cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"How you holdin' up though, champ? I heard what happened to your old boss."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​是​不怎么​爱​聊天​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​抽​了​一口​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​最近​还好​吗​？​我​听说​了​你们​老大​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 shi4 bu4zen3me5 ai4 liao2tian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chou1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zui4jin4 hai2hao3 ma5？wo3 ting1shuo1 le5 ni3men5 lao3da4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I'm sure it is.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She begins to turn away.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​你​说得对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Yeah. I've hit the first firewall in here - I'll need you to get in there "
"and install that bypass for me."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​撞​上​了​这里​的​第一道​防火墙​。​我​需要​你们​进去​帮​我​安装​旁路​程序​。\n"
"en1，wo3 zhuang4 shang4 le5 zhe4li3 de5 di4 yi1 dao4 fang2huo3qiang2。wo3 xu1yao4 ni3men5 jin4qu4 bang1 wo3 an1zhuang1 pang2lu4 cheng2xu4。"

msgid "Yeah. It can be. But it's better than some other lives."
msgstr ""
"可能​吧​。​但​总比​其他​生活​要​好​。\n"
"ke3neng2 ba1。dan4 zong3 bi3 qi2ta1 sheng1huo2 yao4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. It is.\n"
"\n"
"When Monika died, I was pissed. That probably doesn't come as a huge surprise. But I took that anger out on you, and I shouldn't have."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​死​的​时候​，​我​被​愤怒​冲昏​了​头脑​。​这件​事​本身​大概​不足为奇​，​但​我​最后​选择​迁怒于​你​，​我​不该​这么​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 si3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 bei4 fen4nu4 chong1 hun1 le5 tou2nao3。zhe4 jian4 shi4 ben3shen1 da4gai4 bu4zu2wei2qi2，dan4 wo3 zui4hou4 xuan3ze2 qian1 nu4 yu2 ni3，wo3 bu4gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. It is. And I had a *damned* good reason to be angry.\n"
"\n"
"If you can’t see that, you’re even more clueless than I thought."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​而且​我​生气​*​完全​*​是​合情合理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​连​这​都​想​不​明白​，​那​你​简直​比​我​想​的​还要​蠢​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，er2qie3 wo3 sheng1qi4*wan2quan2*shi4 he2qing2he2li3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 lian2 zhe4 dou1 xiang3 bu4 ming2bai5，na4 ni3 jian3zhi2 bi3 wo3 xiang3 de5 hai2 yao4 chun3。"

msgid "Yeah. It was."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。\n"
"shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. It's a beautiful piece of engineering. Shoots straight, has good stopping power, holds a big magazine.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods appreciatively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A really nice gun."
msgstr ""
"当然​，​那​可是​匠心​之作​。​射击​精准​，​火力​强劲​，​弹匣​容量​大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​赞赏​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​一把​好枪​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，na4 ke3shi4 jiang4xin1 zhi1 zuo4。she4ji1 jing1zhun3，huo3li4 qiang2jing4，dan4xia2 rong2liang4 dai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zan4shang3 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 yi1 ba3 hao3 qiang1。"

msgid "Yeah. Just keep telling yourself that."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​你​就​这么​骗​自己​吧​。\n"
"en1，ni3 jiu4 zhe4me5 pian4 zi4ji3 ba1。"

msgid "Yeah. Later."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​回见​。\n"
"en1，hui2jian4。"

msgid "Yeah. Look, I've gotta run. Catch you later, Zaak."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​我​有​事先​走​了​，​回头​再聊​，​扎克​。\n"
"en1。wo3 you3 shi4xian1 zou3 le5，hui2tou2 zai4 liao2，Zha1ke4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Maybe. But I'd always thought that killing a dragon would be a heroic thing to do. I used to dream about it as a kid.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, his eyes never moving from the broken body in the containment cell.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't feel like a hero."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​但​我​一直​觉得​屠龙​会​是​一项​英雄​般的​事迹​。​我​从小​就​梦想​着​这样​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​，​眼睛​一直​没​离开​收容​舱里​枯槁​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​现在​没有​做​英雄​的​感觉​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 wo3 yi1zhi2 jue2de5 tu2 long2 hui4 shi4 yi1 xiang4 ying1xiong2 ban1 de5 shi4ji4。wo3 cong2xiao3 jiu4 meng4xiang3 zhao2 zhe4yang4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2，yan3jing5 yi1zhi2 mei2 li2kai1 shou1rong2 cang1 li3 ku1gao3 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 mei2you3 zuo4 ying1xiong2 de5 gan3jue2。"

msgid "Yeah. Me too."
msgstr ""
"我​也​同意​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 tong2yi4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Monika might have been holding something back from us.\n"
"\n"
"Or maybe she didn't know what Dante really was. I sure as hell didn't."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​也许​莫妮卡​一直​把​这事​瞒​着​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​或者​她​并不知道​但丁​的​真实​身份​。​反正​我​是​不​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。ye3xu3 Mo4ni1ka3 yi1zhi2 ba3 zhe4 shi4 man2 zhao2 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"you4 huo4zhe3 ta1 bing4 bu4 zhi1 dao4 dan4ding1 de5 zhen1shi2 shen1fen4。fan3zheng4 wo3 shi4 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "Yeah. Must be."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​肯定​是​了​。\n"
"en1。ken3ding4 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Must have.\n"
"\n"
"I'm willing to bet that if we hadn't used the cyberware deactivator on him, he'd've gone up before he had the chance to spill any names."
msgstr ""
"肯定​是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我敢​说​，​要不是​我们​用​了​赛博​改造​失效​器​，​他​估计​来不及​吐露​任何​情报​就​已经​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ken3ding4 shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 shuo1，yao4bu5shi4 wo3men5 yong4 le5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 shi1xiao4 qi4，ta1 gu1ji4 lai2bu5ji2 tu3lu4 ren4he2 qing2bao4 jiu4 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Of course I can.\n"
"\n"
"All right, fearless leader. Let's set the record straight."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​让​我们​把​事情​说​清楚​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。rang4 wo3men5 ba3 shi4qing5 shuo1 qing1chu5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Of course it will.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich sneers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Another bush-league extortionist, tryin' to milk us for cash."
msgstr ""
"我​就​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​冷笑​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​是​个​二流​的​敲诈​犯​，​想​从​我们​身上​榨取​钱财​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 leng3xiao4 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 shi4 ge4 er4liu2 de5 qiao1zha4 fan4，xiang3 cong2 wo3men5 shen1shang5 zha4qu3 qian2cai2。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Okay.\n"
"\n"
"Let's do it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​好​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​走​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，hao3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zou3。"

msgid "Yeah. Other than him."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​除了​他​之外​。\n"
"en1，chu2le5 ta1 zhi1wai4。"

msgid "Yeah. Say, Blitz...? I've got a question for you."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​对​了​，​布里​茨​……​？​我​有事​要​问​你​。\n"
"en1。dui4 le5，Bu4li3ci2……？wo3 you3shi4 yao4 wen4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Sort of.\n"
"\n"
"Actually, no. Things are worse now, chief.\n"
"\n"
"Much, *much* worse."
msgstr ""
"算是​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或者说​不是​这么回事​。​现在​事情​更糟​了​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​比​之前​糟糕​得​多​。\n"
"\n"
"suan4shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"huo4 zhe3 shuo1 bu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。xian4zai4 shi4qing5 geng1 zao1 le5，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"bi3 zhi1qian2 zao1gao1 de2 duo1。"

msgid "Yeah. Sure looks that way."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​确实​看起来​是​这样​。\n"
"shi4 a1，que4shi2 kan4qi3lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid "Yeah. Sure thing, chief."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​头儿​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Sure. Because the Lodge is really forgiving, right?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice is full of venom.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure that they'll just forget all about how we *didnt' do* what they sent us here for. And the debt that I went on this run to clear - I'm sure that they'll forget about that, too."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​因为​“​结社​”​的​人​都​慈悲为怀​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​中满​是​讽刺​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​敢肯定​他们​会​彻底​忘记​我们​根本​*​没​完成​*​他们​派​我们​来​做​的​事​。​至于​我要​偿还​的​债务​—​—​他们​肯定​也​会​忘​得​一干二净​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，yin1wei4“jie2she4” de5 ren2 dou1 ci2 bei1 wei2 huai2，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 zhong4 man3 shi4 feng3ci4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 ken3 ding4 ta1men5 hui4 che4di3 wang4ji4 wo3men5 gen1ben3*mei2 wan2cheng2*ta1men5 pai4 wo3men5 lai2 zuo4 de5 shi4。zhi4yu2 wo3 yao4 chang2huan2 de5 zhai4wu4——ta1men5 ken3ding4 ye3 hui4 wang4 de2 yi1gan1er4jing4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Sure. Just decided to waltz through a mostly-deserted dive bar on your way from point A to point B.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sounds plausible. But whatever... was there something that you wanted to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"对​对​对​，​在​你​匆忙​赶路​的​时候​，​还要​专门​经过​一家​基本​荒废​的​小​酒吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​非常​合理​。​但​无所谓​了​……​你​有​什么​想聊​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"dui4 dui4 dui4，zai4 ni3 cong1mang2 gan3lu4 de5 shi2hou5，hai2 yao4 zhuan1men2 jing1guo4 yi1jia1 ji1ben3 huang1fei4 de5 xiao3 jiu3ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 fei1chang2 he2li3。dan4 wu2suo3wei4 le5……ni3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3 liao2 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Thanks, pal.\n"
"\n"
"Guess I've got some bad news to deliver.\n"
"\n"
"Here's the money I promised you."
msgstr ""
"谢​了​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​我​只能​向​他们​告知​这个​坏消息​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​说好​的​报酬​。\n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3 zhi3neng2 xiang4 ta1men5 gao4zhi1 zhe4ge5 huai4 xiao1 xi1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 shuo1hao3 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid "Yeah. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​谢谢​。\n"
"en1，xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Thanks. And thank you for helping to keep the Azzies off of our tails.\n"
"\n"
"If Danni had been captured..."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​谢​了​。​同时​也​感谢​你​帮​我们​摆脱​了​阿兹佬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​丹妮​被​抓住​了​……\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。xie4 le5。tong2shi2 ye3 gan3xie4 ni3 bang1 wo3men5 bai3tuo1 le5 e1 zi1 lao3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 dan1 ni1 bei4 zhua1zhu4 le5……"

msgid "Yeah. That's them."
msgstr ""
"对​，​就是​他们​。\n"
"dui4，jiu4shi4 ta1men5。"

msgid "Yeah. That's who we're talking about."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​就是​他们​。\n"
"shi4 a1，jiu4shi4 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. The last episode before it got canceled. Y'know, the hastily written "
"final chapter, where you find out what happens with the Jubuthon invasion?"
msgstr ""
"对​，​被​砍掉​之前​本来​还有​最后​一集​的​。​就是​那个​仓促​编排​的​大结局​，​揭晓​朱布松​入侵​事件​结局​的​那集​？\n"
"dui4，bei4 kan3 diao4 zhi1qian2 ben3lai2 hai2you3 zui4hou4 yi1 ji2 de5。jiu4shi4 na4ge5 cang1cu4 bian1pai2 de5 dai4 jie1 ju2，jie1xiao3 zhu1 bu4 song1 ru4qin1 shi4jian4 jie2ju2 de5 na4 ji2？"

msgid ""
"Yeah. These Landenberg pricks have been a tick on his ass for years now, sucking away at the revenue that should be lining *his* pockets. Bad business, all around.\n"
"\n"
"Thankfully, we're gonna recover at least a little of that cash tonight. And speaking of which..."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​兰​登堡​帮​的​这些​混蛋​多年​来​就​像​虱子​一样​缠​着​他​，​吸走​本该​装进​他​腰包​的​收入​。​简直​是​糟透了​的​生意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​在​今晚​我们​至少​能​追回​部分​资金​。​说​到​这个​……\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。lan2 deng1 pu4 bang1 de5 zhe4xie1 hun2dan4 duo1nian2 lai2 jiu4 xiang4 shi1zi5 yi1yang4 chan2 zhao2 ta1，xi1 zou3 ben3 gai1 zhuang1 jin4 ta1 yao1bao1 de5 shou1ru4。jian3zhi2 shi4 zao1 tou4 le5 de5 sheng1yi4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 zai4 jin1wan3 wo3men5 zhi4shao3 neng2 zhui1hui2 bu4fen5 zi1jin1。shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5……"

msgid "Yeah. This is where she died."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​她​就是​死​在​了​这里​。\n"
"shi4 de5。ta1 jiu4shi4 si3 zai4 le5 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Thumbs. They came in a cigar box, packed in salt. I have no idea who they belonged to.\n"
"\n"
"I, uh... I'm pretty sure that they're meant to convey some sort of message."
msgstr ""
"对​，​拇指​。​装在​雪茄​盒里​，​周围​撒满​了​盐​。​我​不​知道​这​是​谁​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​很​确定​这​代表​了​某种​信息​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4，mu3zhi3。zhuang1 zai4 xue3jia1 he2 li3，zhou1wei2 sa1 man3 le5 yan2。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 shei2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 hen3 que4ding4 zhe4 dai4biao3 le5 mou3zhong3 xin4xi1。"

msgid "Yeah. Uh, $(l.name)... maybe you should look into that."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​$(l.name)​……​你​最好​调查​一下​。\n"
"shi4 a1，$(l.name)……ni3 zui4hao3 diao4cha2 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Um... look. If you wouldn't mind hanging out right here, I think that Security might like to have a word with you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She begins to turn toward the alarm panel set into the wall.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​这样​吧​……​麻烦​你​在​这里​稍​等​一会儿​，​我​觉得​安保​处会​想​和​你​聊聊​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​开始​转向​墙上​的​警报​面板​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"en1。zhe4yang4 ba1……ma2fan5 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 shao1 deng3 yi1hui4r5，wo3 jue2de5 an1bao3 chu3 hui4 xiang3 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kai1shi3 zhuan3xiang4 qiang2 shang4 de5 jing3bao4 mian4ban3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Yeah. We're going to take out the shrine that Harrow uses as his power focus. \n"
"\n"
"We can't touch him while that thing is standing, but after we bring it down, he'll be vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​我们​要​摧毁​那个​被​哈罗​当做​法器​的​神龛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​那​东西​还​在​的话​，​我们​连碰​都​碰​不到​他​。​但​等​我们​毁掉​它​之后​，​他​就​会​变得​十分​脆弱​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。wo3men5 yao4 cui1hui3 na4ge5 bei4 ha1luo2 dang4zuo4 fa3 qi4 de5 shen2kan1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 na4 dong1xi1 hai2 zai4 de5hua4，wo3men5 lian2 peng4 dou1 peng4 bu4dao4 ta1。dan4 deng3 wo3men5 hui3diao4 ta1 zhi1hou4，ta1 jiu4 hui4 bian4de5 shi2fen1 cui4ruo4。"

msgid "Yeah. We're square."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​明白​了​。\n"
"en1，ming2bai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Well. I can't exactly take that at face value.\n"
"\n"
"Look. It'd be better for everyone if you'd just turn back. We don't want to fight you, but we can't risk letting an unknown player into this... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment to search for the right word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...*situation* right now."
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​，​但​我​也​不能​轻易​相信​你​的话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​伙计​，​你​最好​回头​离开​，​这样​对​大伙​都​好​。​我们​不想​跟​你​打​，​但​也​不能​冒险​让​其他​未知​势力​卷入​目前​的​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​似乎​在​寻找​合适​的​词语​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​*​局面​*​。\n"
"\n"
"en1 heng1，dan4 wo3 ye3 bu4neng2 qing1yi4 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5hua4。\n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，huo3ji5，ni3 zui4hao3 hui2tou2 li2kai1，zhe4yang4 dui4 da4huo3 dou1 hao3。wo3men5 bu4xiang3 gen1 ni3 da3，dan4 ye3 bu4neng2 mao4xian3 rang4 qi2ta1 wei4zhi1 shi4li5 juan3ru4 mu4qian2 de5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，si4hu1 zai4 xun2zhao3 he2shi4 de5 ci2yu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……*ju2mian4*。"

msgid "Yeah. Where do I meet you?"
msgstr ""
"行​吧​。​我​上​哪​找​你​？\n"
"xing2 ba1。wo3 shang4 na3 zhao3 ni3？"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Yeah, I know you are.\n"
"\n"
"Grab your things and meet me at Der Weinkeller. I've got a contact who's gonna join us there, and he can help us figure out our next step."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​我​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​收拾​好​东西​，​到​“​酒窖​”​来​找​我​。​有个线​人会​在​那儿​和​我们​会合​，​他会​帮​我们​理清​下​一步​计划​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，wo3 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"shou1shi5 hao3 dong1xi1，dao4“jiu3jiao4” lai2 zhao3 wo3。you3 ge4 xian4 ren2 hui4 zai4 na4r5 he4 wo3men5 hui4he2，ta1 hui4 bang1 wo3men5 li3qing1 xia4 yi1 bu4 ji4hua4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Yeah, good thought.\n"
"\n"
"Go check it out, but be quick - I don't know how long it'll be before we have company here."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​有​道理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​看看​吧​，​不过​要​快​—​—​我​不​知道​敌人​还有​多久​会​来​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，you3 dao4li5。\n"
"\n"
"qu4 kan4kan5 ba1，bu4guo4 yao4 kuai4——wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 di2ren2 hai2you3 duo1jiu3 hui4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Yeah, it is.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She bites her lip and stares at the image on the PDA for a long moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So, long story short... I'm going to have to step out for a mission or two."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​可不是​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​咬紧​嘴唇​，​又​盯​着​PDA​上​的​图像​看​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​长话短说​……​我​得​暂时​离开​一阵子​，​接下来​的​一两次​任务​我​都​没​办法​参与​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。ke3bu5shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3 jin3 zui3chun2，you4 ding1 zhao2 PDA shang4 de5 tu2xiang4 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"chang2hua4duan3shuo1……wo3 de2 zan4shi2 li2kai1 yi1zhen4zi5，jie1xia4lai2 de5 yi1 liang3 ci4 ren4wu5 wo3 dou1 mei2 ban4fa3 can1yu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Yeah, it is.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She bites her lip and stares at the image on the PDA for a long moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So. The question remains... what do we want to do about it?"
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​可不是​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​咬紧​嘴唇​，​又​盯​着​PDA​上​的​图像​看​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​还是​那个​问题​……​我们​要​怎么​做​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。ke3bu5shi4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3 jin3 zui3chun2，you4 ding1 zhao2 PDA shang4 de5 tu2xiang4 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，hai2shi5 na4ge5 wen4ti2……wo3men5 yao4 zen3me5 zuo4？"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Yeah, let's do it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She claps you on the shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Grab your things and meet me at Der Weinkeller. I've got a contact who's gonna join us there, and he can help us figure out our next step."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我们​动手​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​拍拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​收拾​好​东西​，​到​“​酒窖​”​来​找​我​。​有个线​人会​在​那儿​和​我们​会合​，​他会​帮​我们​理清​下​一步​计划​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3men5 dong4shou3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shou1shi5 hao3 dong1xi1，dao4“jiu3jiao4” lai2 zhao3 wo3。you3 ge4 xian4 ren2 hui4 zai4 na4r5 he4 wo3men5 hui4he2，ta1 hui4 bang1 wo3men5 li3qing1 xia4 yi1 bu4 ji4hua4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. Yeah, she's right... they'd come poking around, and we could still "
"wind up on the hook for this."
msgstr ""
"她​说得对​……​他们​会来​这​附近​打探​，​我们​依旧​有​可能​因此​遭殃​。\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de2 dui4……ta1men5 hui4 lai2 zhe4 fu4jin4 da3tan4，wo3men5 yi1jiu4 you3 ke3neng2 yin1ci3 zao1yang1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah. You can apologize for that little outburst that you had in front of "
"Paul and the rest of the team."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​你​应该​为​自己​在​保罗​和​其他​队员​面前​那番​情绪​失控​的​行为​道歉​。\n"
"en1，ni3 ying1gai1 wei2 zi4ji3 zai4 bao3luo2 he4 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 mian4qian2 na4 fan1 qing2xu4 shi1kong4 de5 xing2wei2 dao4qian4。"

msgid "Yeah. You do that."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​随​你​吧​。\n"
"en1，sui2 ni3 ba1。"

msgid "Yeah... About Monika..."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​关于​莫妮卡​……\n"
"en1……guan1yu2 Mo4ni1ka3……"

msgid ""
"Yeah... I guess not.\n"
"\n"
"Feels kind of daunting, truth be told. But it's exciting, all the same. I've been lookin' for a worthy adversary for a while now.\n"
"\n"
"It's kinda satisfying, having a white whale to chase."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​……​你​说得对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说真的​，​我​都​有点​心里​发毛​了​，​但​同时​又​有点​燥​。​我​早就​想​找个​旗鼓相当​的​对手​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​追逐​一头​白鲸​，​倒​也​颇​让​人​满足​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1……ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1zhen1de5，wo3 dou1 you3dian3 xin1li5 fa1mao2 le5，dan4 tong2shi2 you4 you3dian3 zao4。wo3 zao3jiu4 xiang3 zhao3 ge4 qi2gu3xiang1dang1 de5 dui4shou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhui1zhu2 yi1tou2 bai2jing1，dao3 ye3 po1 rang4 ren2 man3zu2。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... I know what you're sayin', man. I'm not sad that she's dead, but I "
"almost feel a little sorry for her."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​我​明白​你​的​意思​。​我​不​为​她​的​死​而​感到​悲伤​，​但​我​多少​还是​有点​同情​她​的​遭遇​。\n"
"en1……wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 de5 yi4si5。wo3 bu4 wei2 ta1 de5 si3 er2 gan3dao4 bei1shang1，dan4 wo3 duo1shao3 hai2shi5 you3dian3 tong2qing2 ta1 de5 zao1yu4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... I'd noticed. That's the sign of a good leader, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"We're all lucky to have you."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​我​注意​到​了​，​你​不愧​是​个​好​队长​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​幸好​有​你​在​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……wo3 zhu4yi4 dao4 le5，ni3 bu4kui4 shi4 ge4 hao3 dui4zhang3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"xing4hao3 you3 ni3 zai4。"

msgid "Yeah... I'm sure that'll be a ton of fun."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​我​想​肯定​会​十分​有趣​的​。\n"
"en1……wo3 xiang3 ken3ding4 hui4 shi2fen1 you3qu4 de5。"

msgid "Yeah... If only we could all go inside, we could be safe together."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​……​要是​我们​所有人​都​能​进去​就​好​了​，​大家​可以​安全​地​生活​在​一起​。\n"
"shi4 a1……yao4shi5 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 neng2 jin4qu4 jiu4 hao3 le5，da4jia1 ke3yi3 an1quan2 de5 sheng1huo2 zai4 yi1qi3。"

msgid "Yeah... good luck with that, Phil."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​……​祝你好运​，​菲尔​。\n"
"shi4 a1……zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，fei1 er3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... it was for me, too. It's a metamagic thing - a way of quickening spells to a person. Binding magic into the flesh so that it's almost impossible to get rid of.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, long story short, I found a way to break it. Now it just looks pretty in the lamplight."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​对​我​来说​也​是​。​这是​一种​元​魔法​，​让​咒语​在​人​身上​快速​生效​，​把​魔法​束缚​在​肉体​里​，​几乎​永远​不​可能​摆脱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​长话短说​，​我​找到​了​解除​它​的​方法​。​现在​它​只是​在​灯光​下​看起来​很漂亮​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 ye3 shi4。zhe4 shi4 yi1zhong3 yuan2 mo2fa3，rang4 zhou4yu3 zai4 ren2 shen1shang5 kuai4su4 sheng1xiao4，ba3 mo2fa3 shu4fu4 zai4 rou4ti3 li3，ji1hu1 yong3yuan3 bu4 ke3neng2 bai3tuo1。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，chang2hua4duan3shuo1，wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 jie3chu2 ta1 de5 fang1fa3。xian4zai4 ta1 zhi3shi4 zai4 deng1guang1 xia4 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 piao1 liang4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... looks that way.\n"
"\n"
"Let's go. People need to know about this."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​看来​是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​走​吧​。​得​让​大伙​知道​这件​事​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……kan4lai5 shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zou3 ba1。de2 rang4 da4huo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... me too.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for the friendly words, though. Most folks that come through here are either looking to bum a quick handout, or steal what they can before disappearing down the line."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​我​也​这么​希望​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​还是​谢谢​你​的​好意​了​。​来​这里​的​大多数​人​要么​是​想​捞一把​快​钱​，​要么​是​想​偷点​东西​就​溜之大吉​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……wo3 ye3 zhe4me5 xi1wang4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 hai2shi5 xie4xie5 ni3 de5 hao3yi4 le5。lai2 zhe4li3 de5 da4duo1shu4 ren2 yao4me5 shi4 xiang3 lao1yi1ba3 kuai4 qian2，yao4me5 shi4 xiang3 tou1 dian3 dong1xi1 jiu4 liu1zhi1da4ji2。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... okay, Uncle.\n"
"\n"
"Okay."
msgstr ""
"好​……​好​的​，​叔叔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3……hao3 de5，shu1shu5。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。"

msgid "Yeah... oookay. Don't you worry, I'll get right to it."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​……​好​的​。​别​担心​，​我​马上​去​做​。\n"
"hao3 ba1……hao3 de5。bie4 dan1xin1，wo3 ma3shang4 qu4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... some of 'em came through us. I recognize the stamps of a couple of other smuggling rings on the others.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}$+(s.he) scans the jumble of crates and rapidly counts off on $(s.hisher) fingers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm thinkin'... they've probably had about nine recent shipments, at least."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​有些​货是​我们​经手​的​。​其他​箱子​上​还有​另外​几个​走私​团伙​的​标记​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​$+(s.he)​扫视​着​杂乱​的​板条箱​，​用​手指​迅速​轻点​了​一遍​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​估摸​着​……​他们​最近​至少​进​了​九​批货​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……you3xie1 huo4 shi4 wo3men5 jing1shou3 de5。qi2ta1 xiang1zi5 shang4 hai2you3 ling4wai4 ji3ge5 zou3si1 tuan2huo3 de5 biao1ji4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} $+(s.he) sao3shi4 zhao2 za2luan4 de5 ban3tiao2xiang1，yong4 shou3zhi3 xun4su4 qing1 dian3 le5 yi1bian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gu1mo5 zhao2……ta1men5 zui4jin4 zhi4shao3 jin4 le5 jiu3 pi1 huo4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... some of them came through us, and I recognize the stamps of a couple of other smuggling rings on the others.\n"
"\n"
"Between what I see out here and what I know we've delivered, I'd say you're looking at nine recent shipments, at least."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​有些​货是​我们​经手​的​。​其他​箱子​上​还有​另外​几个​走私​团伙​的​标记​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​我​现在​看到​的​，​加上​我们​经手​的​，​保守​估计​他们​最近​至少​进​了​九​批货​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……you3xie1 huo4 shi4 wo3men5 jing1shou3 de5。qi2ta1 xiang1zi5 shang4 hai2you3 ling4wai4 ji3ge5 zou3si1 tuan2huo3 de5 biao1ji4。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 wo3 xian4zai4 kan4dao4 de5，jia1shang4 wo3men5 jing1shou3 de5，bao3shou3 gu1ji4 ta1men5 zui4jin4 zhi4shao3 jin4 le5 jiu3 pi1 huo4。"

msgid "Yeah... thanks, but no thanks."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​谢谢​，​但​还是​不了​。\n"
"en1……xie4xie5，dan4 hai2shi5 bu4le5。"

msgid "Yeah... thanks."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​谢​啦​。\n"
"en1……xie4 la5。"

msgid "Yeah... they do."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​……​可不是​吗​。\n"
"shi4 a1……ke3bu5shi4 ma5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... um, yeah, I am.\n"
"\n"
"My name is Jana.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She tries on a smile. It falls away almost immediately.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​是​的​，​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​叫​简娜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​试图​露出​微笑​，​但​又​立刻​收起​了​笑容​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"en1……shi4 de5，mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiao4 Jian3na4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shi4tu2 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4，dan4 you4 li4ke4 shou1 qi3 le5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "Yeah... well, sort of. It's mostly speculation, truth be told."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​算是​吧​。​说实话​，​大部分​都​是​推测​。\n"
"en1……suan4shi4 ba1。shuo1shi2hua4，da4bu4fen5 dou1 shi4 tui1ce4。"

msgid "Yeah... yeah, I do. If you help us, I'll tell you."
msgstr ""
"是​的​……​是​的​，​我​知道​。​如果​你​帮​我们​，​我​就​告诉​你​。\n"
"shi4 de5……shi4 de5，wo3 zhi1dao4。ru2guo3 ni3 bang1 wo3men5，wo3 jiu4 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... yeah, I'll think about it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She sounds dubious.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks."
msgstr ""
"哦​……​唔​，​我会​考虑​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​听​起来​她​还是​将信将疑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢​啦​。\n"
"\n"
"e2……wu2，wo3 hui4 kao3lu:4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ting1 qi3lai5 ta1 hai2shi5 jiang1xin4jiang1yi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4 la5。"

msgid "Yeah... yeah, it does."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​是​这样​。\n"
"en1……shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... yeah, that makes sense. He was really great at that, wasn't he? One advantage of being old, I guess... lots of experience.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shuffles his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Poor guy."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​有​道理​。​他​很​擅长​做​这个​，​对​吧​？​大概​这​也​算是​岁数​大​的​优势​之一​吧​……​有​更​多​经验​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挪动​着​双脚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可怜​的​家伙​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……you3 dao4li5。ta1 hen3 shan4chang2 zuo4 zhe4ge5，dui4 ba1？da4gai4 zhe4 ye3 suan4shi4 sui4shu5 dai4 de5 you1shi4 zhi1yi1 ba1……you3 geng1 duo1 jing1yan4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nuo2dong4 zhao2 shuang1jiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3lian2 de5 jia1huo5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... yeah, that's fair. He's had a lot of experience at planning this sort of thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shuffles his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"One advantage of being an old guy, I guess."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​好​吧​。​他​在​这方面​确实​很​有​经验​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​挪动​着​双脚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大概​这​也​算是​岁数​大​的​优势​之一​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"en1……hao3 ba1。ta1 zai4 zhe4 fang1 mian4 que4shi2 hen3 you3 jing1yan4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nuo2dong4 zhao2 shuang1jiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 zhe4 ye3 suan4shi4 sui4shu5 dai4 de5 you1shi4 zhi1yi1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... yeah, you might be right.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*Fuck.* I'd thought I was *done* with this. But you're right... without some kind of closure, I'm never going to be at peace with this."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​……​也许​你​是​对​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​妈​的​。​我​本来​想着​我​已经​*​受够了​*​。​但​你​说得对​……​如果​不​做​个​了​断​的话​，​我​这辈子​都​没​办法​踏实​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1……ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ma1 de5。wo3 ben3lai2 xiang3 zhao2 wo3 yi3jing1*shou4 gou4 le5*。dan4 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4……ru2guo3 bu4 zuo4 ge4 le5 duan4 de5hua4，wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 dou1 mei2 ban4fa3 ta1shi5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... you were saying that the Dragonslayer was happy, and that you'd been"
" given a reward."
msgstr ""
"嗯​……​你​说​屠龙​者​挺​高兴​的​，​要​给​你​奖励​来​着​？\n"
"en1……ni3 shuo1 tu2 long2 zhe3 ting3 gao1xing4 de5，yao4 gei3 ni3 jiang3li4 lai2 zhao2？"

msgid ""
"Yeah... you're right. I think that it's... I don't know, on standby or something.\n"
"\n"
"The lights are on, but nobody's home."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​……​你​说​得​没错​。​我​看​它​是​……​处于​某种​待机​状态​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​好像​开着机​，​不过​程序​没跑​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1……ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。wo3 kan4 ta1 shi4……chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 kai1 zhao2 ji1，bu4guo4 cheng2xu4 mei2 pao2 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... you're right. Of course.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for the talk, chief."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​……​你​说得对​。​是​该​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​和​我​说话​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1……ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。shi4 gai1 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 he4 wo3 shuo1hua4，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah... you're right. We should stick to the plan and try to purify this "
"thing."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​……​你​说得对​。​我们​应该​按计划​行事​，​然后​试着​净化​这​东西​。\n"
"shi4 a1……ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 ying1gai1 an4 ji4 hua2 xing2shi4，ran2hou4 shi4zhe5 jing4hua4 zhe4 dong1xi1。"

msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​？\n"
"en1？"

msgid ""
"Yeah? And if I feel like it, I'll toss you in a holding cell and leave you there for a week. Try to resist, and I'll break both your legs while I'm at it.\n"
"\n"
"I'm Security here, chuckles. You're just a glorified janitor. Remember that."
msgstr ""
"哦​？​要是​我​愿意​的话​，​可以​把​你​扔进​拘留​室​关上​一周​。​敢​反抗​的话​，​我​就​顺便​把​你​的​双腿​都​打断​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​这里​的​安保​人员​，​蠢货​。​你​不过​是​个​装模作样​的​清洁工​。​给​我​记住​了​。\n"
"\n"
"e2？yao4shi5 wo3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，ke3yi3 ba3 ni3 reng1 jin4 ju1liu2 shi4 guan1shang4 yi1zhou1。gan3 fan3kang4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 shun4bian4 ba3 ni3 de5 shuang1tui3 dou1 da3duan4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 zhe4li3 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2，chun3huo4。ni3 bu4guo4 shi4 ge4 zhuang1mo2zuo4yang4 de5 qing1jie2gong1。gei3 wo3 ji4zhu5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah? Maybe so. But what makes you think that you're the one to help me?\n"
"\n"
"What makes you think that anyone can?"
msgstr ""
"哦​？​或许​吧​。​但​你​凭​什么​觉得​自己​能​帮​我​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​怎么​会​觉得​有人​能​帮​我​？\n"
"\n"
"e2？huo4xu3 ba1。dan4 ni3 ping2 shen2me5 jue2de5 zi4ji3 neng2 bang1 wo3？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 hui4 jue2de5 you3ren2 neng2 bang1 wo3？"

msgid "Yeah? So?"
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​所以​呢​？\n"
"shi4 ma5？suo3yi3 ni2？"

msgid "Yeah? Well that makes two of us, who the hell are you?"
msgstr ""
"巧​了​，​我​也​是​。​你​他​妈​是​谁​？\n"
"qiao3 le5，wo3 ye3 shi4。ni3 ta1 ma1 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"Yeah? Well, go \"look around\" outside. Or at the very least, stay out of my"
" hair... I've got things to do."
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​那​你​还是​去​外面​“​看看​”​吧​。​或者​至少​别烦​我​……​我​有事​要​做​。\n"
"shi4 ma5？na4 ni3 hai2shi5 qu4 wai4mian4“kan4kan5” ba1。huo4zhe3 zhi4shao3 bie4 fan2 wo3……wo3 you3shi4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Yeah? Well, you are, so shut up and deal with it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head in disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"God, I wish that we didn't need you to finish this job."
msgstr ""
"所以​呢​？​你​这​不​还是​废话​吗​，​赶紧​闭嘴​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​厌恶​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​不​需要​你​也​能​完成​这次​任务​就​好​了​。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni2？ni3 zhe4 bu4 hai2shi5 fei4hua4 ma5，gan3jin3 bi4zui3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan4wu4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 bu4 xu1yao4 ni3 ye3 neng2 wan2cheng2 zhe4 ci4 ren4wu5 jiu4 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yeah? Well, you deserve it.\n"
"\n"
"Now tell me why you're pestering me, and make it quick. My patience for you dried up months ago."
msgstr ""
"嗯​？​那​你​活该​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​到底​有​什么​事来​烦​我​，​赶紧​说​。​我​对​你​的​耐心​早​在​几个​月​前​就​耗尽​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1？na4 ni3 huo2gai1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 dao4di3 you3 shen2me5 shi4 lai2 fan2 wo3，gan3jin3 shuo1。wo3 dui4 ni3 de5 nai4xin1 zao3 zai4 ji3ge5 yue4 qian2 jiu4 hao4jin4 le5。"

msgid "Yeah? Whaddya want?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​？​你​有​啥事​？\n"
"en1？ni3 you3 sha2 shi4？"

msgid "Yeah? What's that?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​？​怎么​说​？\n"
"en1？zen3me5 shuo1？"

msgid "Yeah? You got my thousand nuyen?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​？​你​有​一千​新円​了​吗​？\n"
"en1？ni3 you3 yi1 qian1 xin1 yuan2 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Yeah? You got that card?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​？​你​拿到​卡​了​吗​？\n"
"en1？ni3 na2dao4 ka3 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Yeah? You got the five hundred?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​？​你​有​五百块​了​吗​？\n"
"en1？ni3 you3 wu3 bai3 kuai4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Yep! Now, was that so hard?\n"
"\n"
"You don't need to answer that, it was a rhetorical question. "
msgstr ""
"对​！​你​看​，​这​不难​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不用​回答​，​我​只是​在​反问​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4！ni3 kan4，zhe4 bu4 nan2 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4yong4 hui2da2，wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 fan3wen4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"Yep, that's what they do. Look, I don't mean to cut you off, but I've got "
"things to do. You wanna make a sale, or not?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​是​这么回事​。​听​着​，​我​不想​故意​打断​你​，​但​我​还有​别的​事要​忙​。​你​要​不要​和​我​做生意​了​？\n"
"en1，shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4。ting1 zhao2，wo3 bu4xiang3 gu4yi4 da3duan4 ni3，dan4 wo3 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 mang2。ni3 yao4 bu4yao4 he4 wo3 zuo4sheng1yi4 le5？"

msgid ""
"Yep. But now that you've acknowledged that, you can make an effort to "
"change."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​但​现在​你​知道​了​，​你​还​可以​努力​改变​。\n"
"shi4 de5。dan4 xian4zai4 ni3 zhi1dao4 le5，ni3 hai2 ke3yi3 nu3li4 gai3bian4。"

msgid ""
"Yep. Glory's right... she was a legendary Great Dragon, and she was "
"completely off her rocker. And we set her loose like a caged bird."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​格洛丽​说​得​没错​……​她​是​一头​传说​级​的​巨龙​，​而且​完全​丧失​了​理智​。​我们​就​像​释放​笼中鸟​一样​把​她​放走​了​。\n"
"en1，Ge2luo4li2 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4……ta1 shi4 yi1tou2 chuan2shuo1 ji2 de5 ju4long2，er2qie3 wan2quan2 sang4shi1 le5 li3zhi4。wo3men5 jiu4 xiang4 shi4fang4 long2 zhong4 niao3 yi1yang4 ba3 ta1 fang4zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yep. The doctor didn’t want to stress the dragon’s system too badly, so we collected some research specimens with similar genetic expressions.\n"
"\n"
"You'll see."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​博士​不想​让​巨龙​的​系统​承受​过大​的​压力​，​所以​我们​收集​了​一些​具有​相似​基因​表达​的​研究​样本​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​等​下​就​明白​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。bo2shi4 bu4xiang3 rang4 ju4long2 de5 xi4tong3 cheng2shou4 guo4 dai4 de5 ya1li4，suo3yi3 wo3men5 shou1ji2 le5 yi1xie1 ju4you3 xiang1si4 ji1yin1 biao3da2 de5 yan2jiu1 yang4ben3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 deng3 xia4 jiu4 ming2bai5 le5。"

msgid "Yep. This world doesn’t belong to dragons. It’s ours."
msgstr ""
"嗯​哼​。​这个​世界​不​属于​龙族​，​世界​是​我们​的​。\n"
"en1 heng1。zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 bu4 shu3yu2 long2 zu2，shi4jie4 shi4 wo3men5 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, \"what gang\" indeed. \n"
"\n"
"I would recommend subtlety where possible, $(l.freund). Mass bloodshed is not always the best means to an end."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​就是​那个​“​什么​帮派​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​建议​尽量​还是​低调​行事​，​$(l.freund)​。​大开杀戒​并​不​总是​解决问题​的​最佳​手段​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，jiu4shi4 na4ge5“shen2me5 bang1pai4”。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian4yi4 jin3liang4 hai2shi5 di1diao4 xing2shi4，$(l.freund)。dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4 bing4 bu4 zong3shi4 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2 de5 zui4jia1 shou3duan4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, $(l.freund), we are now ready to open up to donations once again.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to your kind assistance, the shelter is now fully stocked with blankets and space heaters, and we've enough rice, salt, and barley to last through the winter. But guaranteeing the physical well-being of the Kreuzbasar's needy is only a part of the equation... we must see to their mental well-being, as well."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​$(l.freund)​，​我们​现在​准备​好​再次​接受​捐赠​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​多亏​了​你​的​热心​帮助​，​避难所​现在​已经​备齐​了​毯子​和​取暖器​，​大米​、​盐​和​大麦​也​足够​我们​过冬​。​但是​，​保证​克洛伊​茨​集市​贫困人口​的​物质​需要​只是​问题​的​一部分​……​我们​还​必须​关注​他们​的​精神​健康​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，$(l.freund)，wo3men5 xian4zai4 zhun3bei4 hao3 zai4ci4 jie1shou4 juan1zeng4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"duo1kui1 le5 ni3 de5 re4xin1 bang1zhu4，bi4nan4suo3 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 bei4 qi2 le5 tan3zi5 he4 qu3 nuan3 qi4，da4mi3、yan2 he4 da4mai4 ye3 zu2gou4 wo3men5 guo4dong1。dan4shi4，bao3zheng4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 pin2 kun4 ren2 kou3 de5 wu4zhi4 xu1yao4 zhi3shi4 wen4ti2 de5 yi1bu4fen5……wo3men5 hai2 bi4xu1 guan1zhu4 ta1men5 de5 jing1shen2 jian4kang1。"

msgid "Yes, $(l.name). I have eyes. I can see that."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​$(l.name)​。​我​不是​没长​眼睛​。​我​看得出来​。\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，$(l.name)。wo3 bu4shi4 mei2 zhang3 yan3jing5。wo3 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2。"

msgid "Yes, I can feel it. It's almost... pleasant."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​我能​感受​到​。​确实​……​令人​愉快​。\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 neng2 gan3shou4 dao4。que4shi2……ling4ren2 yu2kuai4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, I did. She accepted your payment, and I ordered the search for the "
"information we need."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​她​收​了​款​，​我​让​她​帮忙​搜集​我们​需要​的​情报​。\n"
"en1。ta1 shou1 le5 kuan3，wo3 rang4 ta1 bang1mang2 sou1ji2 wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5 qing2bao4。"

msgid "Yes, I do. I'll give it to you if you help us."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​知道​。​如果​你​帮​我们​，​我​就​告诉​你​。\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 zhi1dao4。ru2guo3 ni3 bang1 wo3men5，wo3 jiu4 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Yes, I had guessed as much.\n"
"\n"
"I would recommend subtlety where possible, $(l.freund). Mass bloodshed is not always the best means to an end."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​也​是​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​建议​尽量​还是​低调​行事​，​$(l.freund)​。​大开杀戒​并​不​总是​解决问题​的​最佳​手段​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian4yi4 jin3liang4 hai2shi5 di1diao4 xing2shi4，$(l.freund)。dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4 bing4 bu4 zong3shi4 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2 de5 zui4jia1 shou3duan4。"

msgid "Yes, I just spoke with her."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我刚​和​她​说完​话​。\n"
"en1，wo3 gang1 he4 ta1 shuo1 wan2 hua4。"

msgid "Yes, I spoke to Altuğ. He gave me this memory stick."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​和​奥图​伊谈​过​了​。​他​给​了​我​这根​记忆棒​。\n"
"en1，wo3 he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 tan2 guo4 le5。ta1 gei3 le5 wo3 zhe4 gen1 ji4yi4bang4。"

msgid "Yes, I understand now. Thank you."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​现在​明白​了​。​谢谢​你​。\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 xian4zai4 ming2bai5 le5。xie4xie5 ni3。"

msgid "Yes, I'm here to rescue you. Let me in!"
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​是​来​救​你​的​。​让​我​进去​吧​！\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 shi4 lai2 jiu4 ni3 de5。rang4 wo3 jin4qu4 ba1！"

msgid ""
"Yes, I'm sure that you are.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair takes a long drag on his cigarette. The taut muscles in his neck relax somewhat as he lets loose a great stream of smoke.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You helped me save the world once before. Or at least, you didn't stand in my way."
msgstr ""
"我​想​也​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​深深​吸​了​口烟​。​当​他​吐​出​一股​浓烟​时​，​颈部​紧绷​的​肌肉​稍稍​放松​了​些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​曾​帮​我​拯救​过​世界​。​或者说​，​至少​你​没有​阻挠​我​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 shen1shen1 xi1 le5 kou3 yan1。dang1 ta1 tu3 chu1 yi1 gu3 nong2yan1 shi2，jing3bu4 jin3beng1 de5 ji1rou4 shao1shao1 fang4song1 le5 xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ceng2 bang1 wo3 zheng3jiu4 guo4 shi4jie4。huo4 zhe3 shuo1，zhi4shao3 ni3 mei2you3 zu3nao2 wo3。"

msgid ""
"Yes, I'm sure.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe if you'd approached me about it earlier, things would have been different. But this is my fight... *my* responsibility. And I'm not afraid to face it anymore."
msgstr ""
"我​确定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​早点​来​找​我​谈​这件​事​，​情况​也许​会​有所不同​。​但​这​是​我​的​战斗​……​*​我​*​的​责任​，​我​再也不会​因为​害怕​而​逃避​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 que4ding4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zao3dian3 lai2 zhao3 wo3 tan2 zhe4 jian4 shi4，qing2kuang4 ye3xu3 hui4 you3suo3bu4tong2。dan4 zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 zhan4dou4……*wo3*de5 ze2ren4，wo3 zai4 ye3 bu4 hui4 yin1wei4 hai4pa4 er2 tao2bi4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, Marta. It's me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory's voice is cold.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's been a long time."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​玛​尔塔​。​是​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​声音​冰冷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好久不见​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，Ma3er3ta3。shi4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 sheng1yin1 bing1leng3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3jiu3bu5jian4。"

msgid "Yes, Monika. She's good to me. Brings me food to eat and tea to drink."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​莫妮卡​。​她​对​我​很​好​。​给​我​食物​和​茶水​供​我​吃喝​。\n"
"shi4 a1，Mo4ni1ka3。ta1 dui4 wo3 hen3 hao3。gei3 wo3 shi2wu4 he4 cha2shui3 gong1 wo3 chi1he1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, Mr. Grinder. The package is secure.\n"
"\n"
"That's right, I'm holding it right now. I'll have it in your hands within the next fifteen minutes."
msgstr ""
"是​，​“​绞肉机​”​先生​。​包裹​到手​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​就​在​我​手上​。​我​十五分钟​内​把​它​送​过去​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4，“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5。bao1guo3 dao4shou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，jiu4 zai4 wo3 shou3 shang4。wo3 shi2 wu3 fen4 zhong1 nei4 ba3 ta1 song4 guo4qu4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, YES, Eiger. I *get* it. The job is still the job.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head solemnly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But that doesn't mean that I have to like it."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​艾格尔​。​我​*​明白​*​。​工作​就是​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​郑重其事​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​那​并​不​意味着​我​必须​喜欢​它​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，Ai4ge2er3。wo3*ming2bai5*。gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zheng4zhong4qi2shi4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 na4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3 bi4xu1 xi3huan5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, a few. Frau Müller has provided us with detailed information on the facility. I've vetted the information, and it seems to hold up.\n"
"\n"
"Based on this intel, I have formulated what I believe will be an effective strategy to bring down the building."
msgstr ""
"是​有​一些​。​穆勒​女士​向​我们​提供​了​设施​的​详细信息​。​我​已经​进行​了​核实​，​似乎​都​没​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​基于​这些​情报​，​我​制定​了​一套​我​认为​能​有效​摧毁​该​建筑​的​作战方案​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 you3 yi1xie1。mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 xiang4 wo3men5 ti2gong1 le5 she4shi1 de5 xiang2 xi4 xin4 xi1。wo3 yi3jing1 jin4xing2 le5 he2shi2，si4hu1 dou1 mei2 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"ji1yu2 zhe4xie1 qing2bao4，wo3 zhi4ding4 le5 yi1tao4 wo3 ren4wei2 neng2 you3xiao4 cui1hui3 gai1 jian4zhu4 de5 zuo4 zhan4 fang1 an4。"

msgid "Yes, absolutely. All in this together."
msgstr ""
"那​必须​的​。​互帮互助​。\n"
"na4 bi4xu1 de5。hu4 bang1 hu4 zhu4。"

msgid "Yes, actually. All of your points are valid."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​你​的话​确实​有些​道理​。\n"
"en1，ni3 de5hua4 que4shi2 you3xie1 dao4li5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, actually. I think that you've gotten used to playing the role of the "
"long-suffering hero. I don't think that you remember how to be anything "
"else."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我​认为​你​已经​习惯​了​扮演​那个​饱受​磨难​的​英雄​角色​。​并且​你​已经​不​记得​如何​做​其他​事情​了​。\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 yi3jing1 xi2guan4 le5 ban4yan3 na4ge5 bao3shou4 mo2nan4 de5 ying1xiong2 jue2se4。bing4qie3 ni3 yi3jing1 bu4 ji4de5 ru2he2 zuo4 qi2ta1 shi4qing5 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, and I hope we've made some new allies as well. Today it's Gesundbrunnen"
" on hard times, but tomorrow it might be the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​而且​我​希望​这趟​结交到​了​一些​新​盟友​。​今天​遭殃​的​是​健康​泉​，​明天​可能​就​轮​到​克洛伊​茨​集市​了​。\n"
"shi4 de5，er2qie3 wo3 xi1wang4 zhe4 tang1 jie1 jiao1 dao4 le5 yi1xie1 xin1 meng2you3。jin1tian1 zao1yang1 de5 shi4 jian4kang1 quan2，ming2tian1 ke3neng2 jiu4 lun2 dao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, but it's also possible that we had Bannik publicize a bunch of false "
"information. We didn't find any definite proof."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​没错​，​但​也​有​可能​是​班尼克​散布​了​一大堆​虚假​信息​。​我们​并未​找到​任何​确凿证据​。\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4 mei2cuo4，dan4 ye3 you3 ke3neng2 shi4 ban1 ni2 ke4 san4bu4 le5 yi1 dai4 dui1 xu1jia3 xin4xi1。wo3men5 bing4wei4 zhao3dao4 ren4he2 que4 zao2 zheng4 ju4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, but she *hasn't.* She's still luring kids here, all these years later. That has to stop.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She fidgets in agitation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're wasting time, and we *need* that key. If Harrow gets back here before we've dealt with that shrine, we're fucked. "
msgstr ""
"是​这样​，​但​她​*​并​没有​*​。​过​了​这么​多年​，​她​仍然​还​在​诱拐​无辜​的​孩子​。​这​一切​必须​到此为止​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​焦躁​不安​地​扭动​身体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​浪费时间​，​而​我们​*​必须​*​拿到​那​把​钥匙​。​如果​哈罗​在​我们​解决​神龛​前​赶回来​，​我们​就​完蛋​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4，dan4 ta1*bing4 mei2you3*。guo4 le5 zhe4me5 duo1nian2，ta1 reng2ran2 hai2 zai4 you4guai3 wu2gu1 de5 hai2zi5。zhe4 yi1qie4 bi4xu1 dao4ci3wei2zhi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiao1zao4 bu4an1 de5 niu3 dong4 shen1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1，er2 wo3men5*bi4xu1*na2dao4 na4 ba3 yao4shi5。ru2guo3 ha1luo2 zai4 wo3men5 jie3jue2 shen2kan1 qian2 gan3 hui2 lai2，wo3men5 jiu4 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid "Yes, but that's beside the point."
msgstr ""
"是​，​但​这​和​我​说​的话​没关系​。\n"
"shi4，dan4 zhe4 he4 wo3 shuo1 de5hua4 mei2guan1xi5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, dear heart. They are.\n"
"\n"
"We all need to go have a word with Harrow now. You get to bed... you have a big day tomorrow."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​亲爱​的​。​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我们​得​去​和​哈罗​谈谈​了​。​你​去​睡​吧​……​明天​可是​你​的​大​日子​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，qin1ai4 de5。mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 de2 qu4 he4 ha1luo2 tan2tan2 le5。ni3 qu4 shui4 ba1……ming2tian1 ke3shi4 ni3 de5 dai4 ri4zi5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, for *the Kreuzbasar.* Not for *me.*\n"
"\n"
"Why should *I* continue to give them valuable material for free when--"
msgstr ""
"没错​，​是​为​*​克洛伊​茨​集市​*​，​不是​为​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​*​我​*​又​为什么​要​继续​免费​向​它们​提供​贵重​材料​—​—\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，shi4 wei2*Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4*，bu4shi4 wei2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"na4*wo3*you4 wei4shen2me5 yao4 ji4xu4 mian3fei4 xiang4 ta1men5 ti2gong1 gui4zhong4 cai2liao4 — —"

msgid ""
"Yes, for individuals of refined taste, I offer genuine bean coffee from my native Turkey. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The cafe owner looks you in the eye. The tone of his voice grows low and serious.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is a top-shelf item, my friend, and not for the general public. Only for those few discerning connoisseurs who can properly appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​为​品味​高雅​的​人​提供​货真价实​的​咖啡​，​这些​豆子​都​来自​我​的​故乡​土耳其​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​咖啡馆​老板​凝视着​你​的​眼睛​，​声音​变得​低沉​而​严肃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​可是​顶级​商品​，​我​的​朋友​，​不会​贩售​给​一般​民众​。​只供​那些​能够​正确​欣赏​它​的​独具慧眼​的​鉴赏家​们​享用​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 wei2 pin3wei4 gao1ya3 de5 ren2 ti2gong1 huo4zhen1jia4shi2 de5 ka1fei1，zhe4xie1 dou4zi5 dou1 lai2zi4 wo3 de5 gu4xiang1 tu3er3qi2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ka1fei1guan3 lao3ban3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5，sheng1yin1 bian4de5 di1chen2 er2 yan2su4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ke3shi4 ding3ji2 shang1pin3，wo3 de5 peng2you5，bu4hui4 fan4shou4 gei3 yi1ban1 min2zhong4。zhi3 gong1 na4xie1 neng2gou4 zheng4que4 xin1shang3 ta1 de5 du2 ju4 hui4 yan3 de5 jian4shang3jia1 men5 xiang3yong4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, good.\n"
"\n"
"Let's."
msgstr ""
"好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​开始​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 kai1shi3 ba1。"

msgid "Yes, good. I need to rejoin the children."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​好​的​。​我​需要​回到​孩子​们​身边​。\n"
"shi4 de5，hao3 de5。wo3 xu1yao4 hui2dao4 hai2zi5 men5 shen1bian1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, got it. Thank you, I really appreciate this, and the guys in back will,"
" too."
msgstr ""
"明白​。​非常感谢​，​我​这些​朋友​也​会​感谢​你​的​。\n"
"ming2bai5。fei1chang2gan3xie4，wo3 zhe4xie1 peng2you5 ye3 hui4 gan3xie4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "Yes, he has. The question is, can you find him?"
msgstr ""
"是​这样​。​问题​在于​，​你​能​找到​他​吗​？\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4。wen4ti2 zai4yu2，ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 ta1 ma5？"

msgid "Yes, it certainly is a beaut-"
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​的确​—​—\n"
"shi4 de5，di2que4 — —"

msgid "Yes, it did."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。\n"
"shi4 de5。"

msgid "Yes, it has... too long."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​真的​……​太久​了​。\n"
"shi4 a1，zhen1de5……tai4 jiu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, it is. But the cultists in there have been brainwashed by Harrow. "
"Whatever they're doing in there, it isn't happening of their own accord."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​但​里面​的​那些​教徒​已经​被​哈罗​洗脑​了​。​无论​他们​在​做​什么​，​都​不是​出于​自身​意愿​。\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。dan4 li3mian4 de5 na4xie1 jiao4tu2 yi3jing1 bei4 ha1luo2 xi3nao3 le5。wu2lun4 ta1men5 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5，dou1 bu4shi4 chu1yu2 zi4shen1 yi4yuan4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, it is. But we're here to kill Harrow, not the people he's brainwashed.\n"
"\n"
"After we've taken down the shrine, the cultists in there will be hurt. Disoriented. We can deal with them then, and hopefully save the poor bastard they're working on."
msgstr ""
"的确如此​。​但​我们​此行​的​目的​是​除掉​哈罗​，​而​不是​那些​被​他​洗脑​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​毁掉​神龛​之后​，​里面​的​教徒​们​也​会​受到冲击​，​从而​不知所措​。​我们​可以​到​那​时候​再​对付​他们​，​并且​希望​能救下​那个​被​他们​折磨​的​可怜​家伙​。\n"
"\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。dan4 wo3men5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4 shi4 chu2diao4 ha1luo2，er2 bu4shi4 na4xie1 bei4 ta1 xi3nao3 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 hui3diao4 shen2kan1 zhi1hou4，li3mian4 de5 jiao4tu2 men5 ye3 hui4 shou4 dao4 chong1 ji1，cong2er2 bu4zhi1suo3cuo4。wo3men5 ke3yi3 dao4 na4 shi2hou5 zai4 dui4fu5 ta1men5，bing4qie3 xi1wang4 neng2 jiu4 xia4 na4ge5 bei4 ta1men5 zhe2mo2 de5 ke3lian2 jia1huo5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, it is. He may have a use for you now, but as soon as this no longer "
"holds, he will kill you."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​他​此刻​或许​用得上​你​，​但​一旦​你​不再​有用​，​他​就​会​杀​了​你​。\n"
"shi4 de5。ta1 ci3ke4 huo4xu3 yong4de5shang4 ni3，dan4 yi1dan4 ni3 bu4zai4 you3yong4，ta1 jiu4 hui4 sha1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Yes, it's a problem. You can't pay me enough to violate my own principles, "
"Duerr."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​不管​你​花​多少​钱​都​不能​让​我​违反​自己​的​原则​，​杜尔​。\n"
"dang1ran2。bu4guan3 ni3 hua1 duo1shao3 qian2 dou1 bu4neng2 rang4 wo3 wei2fan3 zi4ji3 de5 yuan2ze2，du4 er3。"

msgid "Yes, let's see what you've got."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​让​我​看看​你​这​都​有​什么​。\n"
"en1，rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 zhe4 dou1 you3 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, most definitely. It is clear that Green Winters has involved us in "
"something much larger than he led Monika to believe."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​的确如此​。​格林​·​温特斯​让​我们​卷入​的​这件​事​，​显然​远比​他​让​莫妮卡​相信​的​要​庞大​得​多​。\n"
"shi4 de5，de5 que4 ru2 ci3。ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 rang4 wo3men5 juan3ru4 de5 zhe4 jian4 shi4，xian3ran2 yuan3 bi3 ta1 rang4 Mo4ni1ka3 xiang1xin4 de5 yao4 pang2da4 de2 duo1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, my daughter.\n"
"\n"
"*I* was the one they called \"THUNDERSPEAR\" - the sworn enemy of Titonius Rex's people, the Honga barbarian tribe!"
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​的​女儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​我​*​就是​他们​口中​的​“​雷矛​”​—​—​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​的​死敌​，​洪加​野蛮​人​部落​的​死敌​！\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 de5 nu:3er2。\n"
"\n"
"*wo3*jiu4shi4 ta1men5 kou3 zhong4 de5“lei2 mao2”——Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 de5 si3di2，hong2 jia1 ye3man2 ren2 bu4luo4 de5 si3di2！"

msgid ""
"Yes, of course!\n"
"\n"
"You must return your samples to their rightful owner before they thaw."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​当然​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​必须​在​样本​解冻​之前​，​把​它们​归还给​原本​的​主人​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，dang1ran2！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 zai4 yang4ben3 jie3dong4 zhi1qian2，ba3 ta1men5 gui1 hai2 gei3 yuan2ben3 de5 zhu3ren2。"

msgid ""
"Yes, of course! We're actually desperate for them, truth be told... people seem more intent on taking care of themselves than they are in providing for the less fortunate.\n"
"\n"
"Of course, these concepts are not unrelated. As poverty rates increase, so does the crime rate. Assisting the needy increases the quality of life for all."
msgstr ""
"当然​！​说​实在​的​，​我们​其实​很​需要​它们​……​人们​似乎​更​热衷于​照顾​自己​，​而​不是​为​不幸​的​人​提供​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​这些​概念​并非​毫无​关联​。​随着​贫困率​的​上升​，​犯罪率​也​在​上升​。​帮助​有​需要​的​人​可以​提高​所有人​的​生活​质量​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2！shuo1 shi2zai4 de5，wo3men5 qi2shi2 hen3 xu1yao4 ta1men5……ren2men5 si4hu1 geng1 re4 zhong1 yu2 zhao4gu5 zi4ji3，er2 bu4shi4 wei2 bu4xing4 de5 ren2 ti2gong1 bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，zhe4xie1 gai4nian4 bing4fei1 hao2wu2 guan1lian2。sui2zhe5 pin2kun4lu:4 de5 shang4sheng1，fan4 zui4 shuai4 ye3 zai4 shang4sheng1。bang1zhu4 you3 xu1yao4 de5 ren2 ke3yi3 ti2gao1 suo3you3ren2 de5 sheng1huo2 zhi4liang4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, of course, your highness!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lowers her voice to a whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just play along with him. We need to get this bioware back to Ezkibel before it starts to thaw."
msgstr ""
"当然​了​，​陛下​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​压低​声音​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​都​已经​这样​了​，​就​顺着​他​说​吧​。​我们​需要​在​生体​殖装​开始​解冻​之前​将​其​带给​埃兹​基​贝尔​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 le5，bi4xia4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ya1di1 sheng1yin1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 dou1 yi3jing1 zhe4yang4 le5，jiu4 shun4zhe5 ta1 shuo1 ba1。wo3men5 xu1yao4 zai4 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 kai1shi3 jie3dong4 zhi1qian2 jiang1 qi2 dai4gei3 Ai1ziji1bei4er3。"

msgid "Yes, of course. I was just testing you."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​当然​。​我​只是​想​考考你​。\n"
"shi4 a1，dang1ran2。wo3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 kao3 kao3 ni3。"

msgid "Yes, of course. I'm eager to finish this test."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​我​等不及​要​完成​测试​了​。\n"
"dang1ran2。wo3 deng3bu4ji2 yao4 wan2cheng2 ce4shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, of course. In your line of work, discretion is required. That is good. "
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​在​你​这​一行​，​谨慎​些​准​没错​。​这​很​好​。\n"
"shi4 a1，zai4 ni3 zhe4 yi1xing2，jin3shen4 xie1 zhun3 mei2cuo4。zhe4 hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"Yes, of course. Your last donation put us part of the way toward leasing the building.\n"
"\n"
"As of your last donation, we have $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) nuyen saved toward our 500 nuyen goal. Whatever more you could contribute would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​你​上次​的​捐赠​让​我们​距离​租下​那栋​建筑​更近​了​一步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​你​上次​捐款​的​基础​上​，​我们​已经​为​500​新円​的​目标​存下​了​$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations)​新円​。​如果​你​能​提供​更​多​捐款​，​我们​将​不胜感激​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。ni3 shang4ci4 de5 juan1zeng4 rang4 wo3men5 ju4li2 zu1 xia4 na4 dong4 jian4zhu4 geng1 jin4 le5 yi1 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 shang4ci4 juan1kuan3 de5 ji1chu3 shang4，wo3men5 yi3jing1 wei2 500 xin1 yuan2 de5 mu4biao1 cun2 xia4 le5 $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) xin1 yuan2。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 ti2gong1 geng1 duo1 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 jiang1 bu4 sheng4 gan3 ji1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, of course. Your last donation put us part of the way toward purchasing the trode nets.\n"
"\n"
"As of your last donation, we have $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) nuyen saved toward our 400 nuyen goal. Whatever more you could contribute would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​你​上次​的​捐赠​让​我们​距离​购买​电极​网络​更近​了​一步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​你​上次​捐款​的​基础​上​，​我们​已经​为​400​新円​的​目标​存下​了​$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations)​新円​。​如果​你​能​提供​更​多​捐款​，​我们​将​不胜感激​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。ni3 shang4ci4 de5 juan1zeng4 rang4 wo3men5 ju4li2 gou4mai3 dian4ji2 wang3luo4 geng1 jin4 le5 yi1 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 shang4ci4 juan1kuan3 de5 ji1chu3 shang4，wo3men5 yi3jing1 wei2 400 xin1 yuan2 de5 mu4biao1 cun2 xia4 le5 $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) xin1 yuan2。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 ti2gong1 geng1 duo1 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 jiang1 bu4 sheng4 gan3 ji1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, of course. Your last donation put us part of the way toward stocking our library's shelves with books.\n"
"\n"
"As of your last donation, we have $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) nuyen saved toward our 350 nuyen goal. Whatever more you could contribute would be greatly appreciated."
msgstr ""
"当然​。​你​上次​的​捐赠​让​我们​距离​为​图书馆​配备​充足​的​图书​更近​了​一步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​你​上次​捐款​的​基础​上​，​我们​已经​为​350​新円​的​目标​存下​了​$(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations)​新円​。​如果​你​能​提供​更​多​捐款​，​我们​将​不胜感激​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。ni3 shang4ci4 de5 juan1zeng4 rang4 wo3men5 ju4li2 wei2 tu2shu1guan3 pei4bei4 chong1zu2 de5 tu2shu1 geng1 jin4 le5 yi1 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 shang4ci4 juan1kuan3 de5 ji1chu3 shang4，wo3men5 yi3jing1 wei2 350 xin1 yuan2 de5 mu4biao1 cun2 xia4 le5 $(story.Haven_Global_SamuelDonations) xin1 yuan2。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 ti2gong1 geng1 duo1 juan1kuan3，wo3men5 jiang1 bu4 sheng4 gan3 ji1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, she is. But we deal with her *later.*\n"
"\n"
"I won't hurt any more kids voluntarily."
msgstr ""
"是​，​她​确实​该死​。​但​我们​可以​*​之后​*​再​解决​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​再​主动​伤害​任何​孩子​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4，ta1 que4shi2 gai1si3。dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3*zhi1hou4*zai4 jie3jue2 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 zhu3dong4 shang1hai4 ren4he2 hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, she mentioned that you had sent her. \n"
"\n"
"I don't know what you told her, $(l.name), but whatever you said, it worked. Silke's determination is truly inspring.\n"
"\n"
"A cram habit is a difficult thing to beat. But I don't doubt that she will make it."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​她​提过​是​你​把​她​送来​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​我​不​知道​你​对​她​说​过​什么​，​但​确实​很​有效​。​西​尔克​的​决心​非常​鼓舞士气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​磕药​的​习惯​是​很​难​戒掉​的​。​但​我​相信​她​肯定​能​做到​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，ta1 ti2 guo4 shi4 ni3 ba3 ta1 song4 lai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 dui4 ta1 shuo1 guo4 shen2me5，dan4 que4shi2 hen3 you3xiao4。Xi1er3ke4 de5 jue2xin1 fei1chang2 gu3 wu3 shi4 qi4。\n"
"\n"
"ke1 yao4 de5 xi2guan4 shi4 hen3 nan2 jie4 diao4 de5。dan4 wo3 xiang1xin4 ta1 ken3ding4 neng2 zuo4dao4。"

msgid "Yes, sir."
msgstr ""
"是​，​先生​。\n"
"shi4，xian1sheng5。"

msgid "Yes, sir. Have you seen any other maintenance guys around here?"
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​先生​。​你​有没有​看到​其他​的​检修​人员​？\n"
"shi4 de5，xian1sheng5。ni3 you3mei2you3 kan4dao4 qi2ta1 de5 jian3xiu1 ren2yuan2？"

msgid "Yes, sometimes scent is part of the disguise. You'll get used to it."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​好​的​伪装​有时​连​气味​也​不会​放过​。​别​担心​，​你​迟早会​习惯​的​。\n"
"mei2cuo4，hao3 de5 wei3zhuang1 you3shi2 lian2 qi4wei4 ye3 bu4hui4 fang4guo4。bie4 dan1xin1，ni3 chi2 zao3 hui4 xi2guan4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Yes, there is that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He stubs out his cigarette and grabs another with a shaking hand. Lighting it, he eagerly sucks in the smoke.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What we need is something powerful enough to keep these things at bay, but intelligent enough to be capable of reason."
msgstr ""
"确实​也​有​这个​风险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​掐灭​烟头​，​颤抖​的​手​又​抓起​一支​。​点燃​后​，​他​贪婪​地​吸入​烟雾​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​的​，​是​既​能​抵御​这些​东西​又​足够​聪慧​、​能​进行​理性​思考​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"que4shi2 ye3 you3 zhe4ge5 feng1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qia1 mie4 yan1tou2，chan4dou3 de5 shou3 you4 zhua1 qi3 yi1 zhi1。dian3ran2 hou4，ta1 tan1lan2 de5 xi1ru4 yan1wu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5，shi4 ji4 neng2 di3yu4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 you4 zu2gou4 cong1hui4、neng2 jin4xing2 li3xing4 si1kao3 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, they won't be a problem any longer. But with APEX gone, our security is still compromised. \n"
"\n"
"We'd best still hurry."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​他们​暂时​不​需要​我们​操心​了​。​但​APEX​已经​下线​，​我们​的​安全​仍然​在​受到​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​最好​还是​抓紧​一些​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，ta1men5 zan4shi2 bu4 xu1yao4 wo3men5 cao1xin1 le5。dan4 APEX yi3jing1 xia4xian4，wo3men5 de5 an1quan2 reng2ran2 zai4 shou4dao4 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zui4hao3 hai2shi5 zhua1jin3 yi1xie1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, until about a week ago.\n"
"\n"
"Then the Magnifikers' pets moved in, and we had to run for our lives."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​直到​大约​一周​前​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​伟术​帮​的​宠物​搬进​来​了​，​我们​不得不​逃命​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，zhi2dao4 da4yue1 yi1zhou1 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 wei3 shu4 bang1 de5 chong3wu4 ban1 jin4 lai2 le5，wo3men5 bu4de2bu4 tao2ming4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, we shouldn't need to worry about the Rabengeister any more. Extra "
"rations are a small price to pay to keep our shipments secure."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我们​以后​不用​再​担心​鸦灵​的​事​了​。​用​余粮​换​货物​安全​很​划算​。\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3men5 yi3hou4 bu4yong4 zai4 dan1xin1 Ya1ling2 de5 shi4 le5。yong4 yu2liang2 huan4 huo4wu4 an1quan2 hen3 hua2suan4。"

msgid ""
"Yes, we were.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She wipes the dripping blade on the Engineer's coat, then slides it back into its sheath.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"完事​了​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​滴血​的​刀刃​在​工程师​的​外套​上​擦​了​擦​，​然后​收刀入​鞘​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"wan2shi4 le5 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 di1 xie3 de5 dao1ren4 zai4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 wai4tao4 shang4 ca1 le5 ca1，ran2hou4 shou1 dao1 ru4 qiao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Yes, yes, it is a simple job. Time-consuming and a bit tedious perhaps, but "
"simple."
msgstr ""
"对​对​对​，​就是​趟​简单​差事​。​费时间​，​也许​还​有点​无聊​，​但​很​简单​。\n"
"dui4 dui4 dui4，jiu4shi4 tang1 jian3dan1 cha4shi4。fei4 shi2 jian1，ye3xu3 hai2 you3dian3 wu2liao2，dan4 hen3 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"Yes, yes, we're all very impressed. Now let's get this show on the road, "
"shall we?"
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​，​你​可​太​厉害​了​。​现在​我们​赶紧​动手​吧​？\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，ni3 ke3 tai4 li4hai5 le5。xian4zai4 wo3men5 gan3jin3 dong4shou3 ba1？"

msgid "Yes, yes. But that came later."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​但​那​是​后来​的​事情​了​。\n"
"shi4 de5。dan4 na4 shi4 hou4lai2 de5 shi4qing5 le5。"

msgid "Yes, yes. Of course it is."
msgstr ""
"是​是​是​。​那​当然​。\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4。na4 dang1ran2。"

msgid ""
"Yes, you are.\n"
"\n"
"I am your fixer. I find you jobs. You carry them out. That is our arrangement.\n"
"\n"
"Now, please. Fetch the damned device."
msgstr ""
"你​当然​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​你​的​中间人​。​我​帮​你​联络​差事​，​你​负责​完成​差事​。​这​就是​我们​的​合作​方式​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​拜托​你​，​赶紧​给​我​找​台​能​用​的​设备​来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dang1ran2 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 ni3 de5 zhong1jian1ren2。wo3 bang1 ni3 lian2luo4 cha4shi4，ni3 fu4ze2 wan2cheng2 cha4shi4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3men5 de5 he2zuo4 fang1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 bai4tuo1 ni3，gan3jin3 gei3 wo3 zhao3 tai2 neng2 yong4 de5 she4bei4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"Yes, you will. If you don't, I'll reveal your little secret to the people of"
" the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"那​你​就​试试​。​如果​你​不照​做​的话​，​我​就​把​你​的​小​秘密​告诉​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人​。\n"
"na4 ni3 jiu4 shi4 shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 zhao4 zuo4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3 de5 xiao3 mi4mi4 gao4su4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"Yes.\n"
"\n"
"I've been thinking about this for a long time, $(l.name). And every time that I've gotten close to making a decision, I've turned and run away again.\n"
"\n"
"No more running. I'm ready to face this thing, but I can't do it alone. I'm going to need your help."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​考虑​这件​事​已经​有​很​久​了​，​$(l.name)​。​但​每当​即将​做出​决定​时​，​我​却​又​选择​转身​逃避​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​再​逃​了​。​我​已​准备​好​直面​此事​，​但​无法​独自​完成​。​我​需要​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kao3lu:4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 yi3jing1 you3 hen3 jiu3 le5，$(l.name)。dan4 mei3dang1 ji2jiang1 zuo4chu1 jue2ding4 shi2，wo3 que4 you4 xuan3ze2 zhuan3shen1 tao2bi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 tao2 le5。wo3 yi3 zhun3bei4 hao3 zhi2mian4 ci3shi4，dan4 wu2fa3 du2zi4 wan2cheng2。wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"Yes.\n"
"\n"
"In truth, we would still work on the pumps, even without the Doctor's payments. We love our occupation.\n"
"\n"
"It helps us to feel human."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​实际上​，​尽管​医生​背弃​了​合同​，​我们​仍然​在​维护​水泵​。​我们​热爱​这份​工作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样一来​，​我们​还​能​觉得​自己​有点​人​样​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"shi2ji4shang4，jin3guan3 yi1sheng1 bei4qi4 le5 he2tong5，wo3men5 reng2ran2 zai4 wei2hu4 shui3beng4。wo3men5 re4ai4 zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4yi1lai2，wo3men5 hai2 neng2 jue2de5 zi4ji3 you3dian3 ren2 yang4。"

msgid ""
"Yes.\n"
"\n"
"We are grown in the labs. We live in these cells. And when we are killed, others are grown to take our place."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​实验室​里​培育​而成​，​生活​在​这些​牢房​中​。​当​我们​被​杀​时​，​其他人​会​被​培育​出来​替代​我们​的​位置​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 shi2yan4shi4 li3 pei2yu4 er2 cheng2，sheng1huo2 zai4 zhe4xie1 lao2fang2 zhong4。dang1 wo3men5 bei4 sha1 shi2，qi2 ta1 ren2 hui4 bei4 pei2yu4 chu1lai2 ti4dai4 wo3men5 de5 wei4zhi5。"

msgid ""
"Yes.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair stands there for a moment, blinking. Then his frail body begins to tremble.\n"
"\n"
"The cigarette drops from his lip and falls to the floor.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​站​在​那里​眨​了​眨眼​。​随后​他​瘦弱​的​身体​开始​颤抖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​香烟​从​他​唇间​滑落​，​坠落在​地板​上​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 zhan4 zai4 na4li5 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。sui2hou4 ta1 shou4ruo4 de5 shen1ti3 kai1shi3 chan4dou3。\n"
"\n"
"xiang1yan1 cong2 ta1 chun2 jian1 hua2luo4，zhui4 la4 zai4 di4ban3 shang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Yes. A part of me still loved her. And the rest hated her for what she represented.\n"
"\n"
"Am I ultimately sorry that she's dead...? Yes. But I'm not sure what the alternative would be. "
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我​心中​有​一部分​仍然​爱着​她​，​而​另​一部分​则​因为​她​背后​代表​的​事物​而​憎恨​她​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​最终​是否​为​她​的​死​感到遗憾​……​？​是​的​。​但​我​并​不​确定​，​如果​事情​朝​相反​的​方向​发展​，​会​是​怎样​的​结局​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3 xin1zhong1 you3 yi1bu4fen5 reng2ran2 ai4 zhao2 ta1，er2 ling4 yi1bu4fen5 ze2 yin1wei4 ta1 bei4hou4 dai4biao3 de5 shi4wu4 er2 zeng1hen4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4zhong1 shi4fou3 wei2 ta1 de5 si3 gan3 dao4 yi2 han4……？shi4 de5。dan4 wo3 bing4 bu4 que4ding4，ru2guo3 shi4qing5 chao2 xiang1fan3 de5 fang1xiang4 fa1zhan3，hui4 shi4 zen3yang4 de5 jie2ju2。"

msgid ""
"Yes. And look at where it got her.\n"
"\n"
"When the Firewing launched her attack on humanity, it was an act of hubris. She lashed out because she didn't consider our species to be a threat.\n"
"\n"
"It would be equally hubristic for us to assume that she will make the same mistake twice."
msgstr ""
"没错​，​但​你​看​她​下场​如何​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​当时​是​出于​傲慢​而​对​人类​发动​进攻​。​她​之所以​如此​，​是因为​她​根本​不​把​我们​这个​物种​视为​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​现在​我们​妄自​揣测​她​会​重蹈覆辙​，​那​同样​是​狂妄自大​的​表现​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，dan4 ni3 kan4 ta1 xia4chang3 ru2he2。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 dang1shi2 shi4 chu1yu2 ao4man4 er2 dui4 ren2lei4 fa1dong4 jin4gong1。ta1 zhi1suo3yi3 ru2ci3，shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 gen1ben3 bu4 ba3 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 wu4zhong3 shi4wei2 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 xian4zai4 wo3men5 wang4 zi4 chuai3ce4 ta1 hui4 chong2dao3fu4zhe2，na4 tong2yang4 shi4 kuang2wang4zi4da4 de5 biao3xian4。"

msgid "Yes. And to find out what happened to the lab itself."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​以及​搞清楚​实验室​出​了​什么​事情​。\n"
"shi4 de5。yi3ji2 gao3 qing1 chu3 shi2yan4shi4 chu1 le5 shen2me5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"Yes. As it happens, the Kreuzbasar has been blessed with an excellent talismonger. \n"
"\n"
"Search for an unmarked shop with black curtains on the east side of town. The proprietor is a wonderful man with an encyclopedic understanding of the arcane, and his assistant is quite lovely as well."
msgstr ""
"说​到​这个​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​还​真​有​一位​出色​的​奇货​商人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​街区​东边​找​一家​挂​着​黑色​窗帘​、​没有​招牌​的​店铺​。​店主​是​个​了不起​的​人物​，​对​奥术​知识​有着​百科全书​般的​造诣​，​他​的​助手​也​相当​漂亮​。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4ge5，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 hai2 zhen1 you3 yi1 wei4 chu1se4 de5 ji1 huo4 shang1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"qu4 jie1qu1 dong1bian5 zhao3 yi1jia1 gua4 zhao2 hei1se4 chuang1lian2、mei2you3 zhao1pai5 de5 dian4pu4。dian4zhu3 shi4 ge4 liao3bu5qi3 de5 ren2wu4，dui4 ao4 shu4 zhi1shi5 you3zhe5 bai3ke1quan2shu1 ban1 de5 zao4yi4，ta1 de5 zhu4shou3 ye3 xiang1dang1 piao4liang5。"

msgid ""
"Yes. But APEX didn't *choose* to kill your brother - it was following your "
"orders. His blood is on your hands."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​但​杀害​你​弟弟​并​不是​APEX​的​*​选择​*​—​—​它​只是​在​执行​你​的​命令​。​这笔​账要​算​在​你​自己​的​头上​。\n"
"shi4 de5。dan4 sha1hai4 ni3 di4di5 bing4 bu4shi4 APEX de5*xuan3ze2*——ta1 zhi3shi4 zai4 zhi2xing2 ni3 de5 ming4ling4。zhe4 bi3 zhang4 yao4 suan4 zai4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 tou2shang4。"

msgid ""
"Yes. But he won't ruin this one, I promise you that.\n"
"\n"
"I only brought it up because it's a sign of something. Harrow is getting lazy, letting his captive spirit do the heavy lifting for him."
msgstr ""
"对​。​但​我​向​你​保证​，​他别​想​毁​了​这​孩子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​之所以​提起​这件​事​，​是因为​这是​一个​信号​。​哈罗​变得​懒惰​了​，​开始​让​他​的​精魂​俘虏​干​脏活​累活​。\n"
"\n"
"dui4。dan4 wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，ta1 bie4 xiang3 hui3 le5 zhe4 hai2zi5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1suo3yi3 ti2qi3 zhe4 jian4 shi4，shi4 yin1 wei2 zhe4 shi4 yi1ge5 xin4hao4。ha1luo2 bian4de5 lan3duo4 le5，kai1shi3 rang4 ta1 de5 jing1hun2 fu2lu3 gan4 zang4 huo2 lei3 huo2。"

msgid ""
"Yes. But not here, and not now.\n"
"\n"
"Those kids in there - they'd all die for her. They already love her. That's what she does."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​但​不是​在​这里​，​也​不是​现在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​的​那些​孩子​—​—​他们​都​愿意​为​她​赴死​。​他们​已经​爱上​她​了​。​这​就是​她​的​本事​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。dan4 bu4shi4 zai4 zhe4li3，ye3 bu4shi4 xian4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 de5 na4Xie1hai2zi5——ta1men5 dou1 yuan4yi4 wei2 ta1 fu4si3。ta1men5 yi3jing1 ai4shang4 ta1 le5。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1 de5 ben3shi4。"

msgid ""
"Yes. But not with violence. \n"
"\n"
"I want you to talk with them and convince them to bring me back my components. Do this, and I'll tell you how to get to Trithemius.\n"
"\n"
"Deal?"
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​但​不要​用​暴力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​你​去​和​他们​谈谈​，​劝​他们​把​部件​还给​我​。​你​帮​我​做​完​这件​事​，​我​就​告诉​你​如何​找到​特​里特​米​乌斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，dan4 bu4yao4 yong4 bao4li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 qu4 he4 ta1men5 tan2tan2，quan4 ta1men5 ba3 bu4jian4 huan2gei3 wo3。ni3 bang1 wo3 zuo4 wan2 zhe4 jian4 shi4，wo3 jiu4 gao4su4 ni3 ru2he2 zhao3dao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5yang4？"

msgid "Yes. But that \"someone\" won't be our Hans."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​但​“​那个​人​”​不会​是​我们​的​汉斯​。\n"
"shi4 de5，dan4“na4ge5 ren2” bu4hui4 shi4 wo3men5 de5 han4si1。"

msgid "Yes. Everything has been completed to your specifications."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​一切​都​按​你​的​指示​完成​了​。\n"
"shi4 de5。yi1qie4 dou1 an4 ni3 de5 zhi3shi4 wan2cheng2 le5。"

msgid "Yes. Exactly like that."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​完全​就是​这样​。\n"
"shi4 de5，wan2quan2 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Fine. Good.\n"
"\n"
"What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​行​吧​，​可以​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​说​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"en1，xing2 ba1，ke3yi3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid "Yes. Get moving."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​滚蛋​吧​。\n"
"shi4 de5。gun3dan4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Gone. All gone. \n"
"\n"
"The cold has won. The world is metal. \n"
"\n"
"Feuerschwinge is lost."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​都​不见​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​寒冷​胜利​了​。​世界​是​金属​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼输​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。dou1 bu4jian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"han2leng3 sheng4li4 le5。shi4jie4 shi4 jin1shu3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 shu1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes. He did.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles sweetly at the nearest acolyte.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Harrow has special plans for this one. We'll take him off of your hands."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​是​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​对​离​她​最近​的​侍​祭​露出​甜美​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​对​此人​另有​安排​。​把​他​交给​我们​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"en1，shi4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 li2 ta1 zui4jin4 de5 shi4 ji4 lu4chu1 tian2mei3 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 dui4 ci3 ren2 ling4you3 an1pai2。ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 wo3men5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yes. His contributions kept our community alive. Helped us thrive.\n"
"\n"
"But now that the decker is gone, he has demanded payment for our feedings."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​他​的​贡献​让​我们​得以​存活​，​继续​繁衍​下去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​现在​碟客​不​在​了​，​他​便​开始​要求​我们​为​食物​支付​报酬​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，ta1 de5 gong4xian4 rang4 wo3men5 de2yi3 cun2huo2，ji4xu4 fan2yan3 xia4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4 die2 ke4 bu4 zai4 le5，ta1 bian4 kai1shi3 yao1qiu2 wo3men5 wei2 shi2wu4 zhi1fu4 bao4chou5。"

msgid "Yes. I *know* that the price has gone up. This is a seller's market."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我​*​知道​*​价格​在​水涨船高​。​但​这​是​卖方市场​。\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3*zhi1dao4*jia4ge2 zai4 shui3zhang3chuan2gao1。dan4 zhe4 shi4 mai4fang1shi4chang3。"

msgid ""
"Yes. I do think that Feuerstelle is a problem that needs solving. But it can't happen just now.\n"
"\n"
"APEX is down. Vauclair is vulnerable. We can't take the time to deal with my issues right now... they can wait."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我​确实​认为​“​火坑​”​是​个​亟待解决​的​问题​。​但​眼下​还​不是​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​APEX​已经​下线​。​沃​克莱尔​的​安保​十分​脆弱​。​我们​现在​没​时间​处理​我​的​问题​……​这些​事​可以​稍后​再议​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3 que4shi2 ren4wei2“huo3keng1” shi4 ge4 qi4 dai1 jie3 jue2 de5 wen4ti2。dan4 yan3xia4 hai2 bu4shi4 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"APEX yi3jing1 xia4xian4。Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 an1bao3 shi2fen1 cui4ruo4。wo3men5 xian4zai4 mei2 shi2jian1 chu3li3 wo3 de5 wen4ti2……zhe4xie1 shi4 ke3yi3 shao1hou4 zai4 yi4。"

msgid "Yes. I have come to the same conclusion."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​我​也​得出​了​相同​的​结论​。\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 ye3 de2chu1 le5 xiang1tong2 de5 jie2lun4。"

msgid ""
"Yes. I suppose that it would.\n"
"\n"
"Look, this has been a really interesting discussion--"
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​我​想​也​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​这场​讨论​挺​有意思​—​—\n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhe4 chang2 tao3lun4 ting3 you3yi4si5 — —"

msgid ""
"Yes. If we sacrifice these people because we're afraid of what *might* "
"happen, then we're no better than Harrow is."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​如果​我们​因为​害怕​*​可能​*​发生​的​事情​而​牺牲​这些​人​，​那​我们​也​没​比​哈罗​好​到​哪里​去​。\n"
"shi4 de5。ru2guo3 wo3men5 yin1wei4 hai4pa4*ke3neng2*fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 er2 xi1sheng1 zhe4xie1 ren2，na4 wo3men5 ye3 mei2 bi3 ha1luo2 hao3 dao4 na3li3 qu4。"

msgid ""
"Yes. It is.\n"
"\n"
"All the same... it feels like we're on the wrong side of this one."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​……​总​感觉​我们​在​这件​事上​站​在​了​错误​的​一边​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4……zong3 gan3jue2 wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 zhan4 zai4 le5 cuo4wu4 de5 yi1bian1。"

msgid ""
"Yes. It is.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory stares at you through cold, dead eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But I'm not going to be able to get through this in one sitting. You need to understand that."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽用​冰冷​而​死寂​的​双眼​凝视着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​不​可能​一口气​讲完​这些​。​你​必须​明白​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yong4 bing1leng3 er2 si3ji4 de5 shuang1yan3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 bu4 ke3neng2 yi1kou3qi4 jiang3 wan2 zhe4xie1。ni3 bi4xu1 ming2bai5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "Yes. It should be here... somewhere."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​它​应该​就​在​这里​的​……​某个​地方​。\n"
"shi4 de5。ta1 ying1gai1 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3 de5……mou3 ge4 di4fang1。"

msgid "Yes. It'll be here... somewhere."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​它​应该​就​在​这里​的​……​某个​地方​。\n"
"shi4 de5。ta1 ying1gai1 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3 de5……mou3 ge4 di4fang1。"

msgid "Yes. It's settled."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​都​解决​了​。\n"
"shi4 de5，dou1 jie3jue2 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Let the fire take this place - and everything in it. We've done what we came here for.\n"
"\n"
"Harrow is dead. We've won."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​让​大火​吞噬​这里​的​一切​吧​。​我们​已经​完成​了​此行​的​目的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​已死​。​我们​赢得​了​胜利​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。rang4 da4huo3 tun1shi4 zhe4li3 de5 yi1qie4 ba1。wo3men5 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2 le5 ci3xing2 de5 mu4di4。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 yi3 si3。wo3men5 ying2de2 le5 sheng4li4。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Look at Tír na nÓg... Tir Tairngire. Elven cities devoted to the green."
" To keeping it safe."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​看看​提尔纳诺​……​还有​提尔坦盖​。​为了​绿色​而​尽心竭力​的​精灵​城市​。​为了​护​它​周全​。\n"
"shi4 de5。kan4kan5 ti2 er3 na4 nuo4……hai2you3 ti2 er3 tan3 gai4。wei4le5 lu:4se4 er2 jin4xin1jie2li4 de5 jing1ling2 cheng2shi4。wei4le5 hu4 ta1 zhou1quan2。"

msgid "Yes. Of course. Hand it to me, if you will."
msgstr ""
"当然​可以​。​请​把​它​给​我​吧​。\n"
"dang1ran2 ke3yi3。qing3 ba3 ta1 gei3 wo3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Of course. Please forgive my rambling; I am not accustomed to dealing "
"with people in your line of work."
msgstr ""
"好​的​好​的​。​请原谅​我​的​闲言碎语​，​我​不​习惯​和​你们​这​一行​的​人​打交道​。\n"
"hao3 de5 hao3 de5。qing3 yuan2 liang4 wo3 de5 xian2yan2sui4yu3，wo3 bu4 xi2guan4 he4 ni3men5 zhe4 yi1xing2 de5 ren2 da3jiao1dao4。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Of course. Right you are.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He slaps the side of a Bulldog step van. A second van of the same design rumbles to life a few feet away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pile in, people. And be ready... there's rough country between us and the meeting site. We might run into trouble along the way."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​当然​，​你​说得对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拍了拍​“​斗牛犬​”​货车​的​车身​。​几​英尺​外​，​另​一辆​同款​货车​也​轰然​发动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大伙儿​上车​吧​，​做好​准备​……​去​碰头​地点​的​路​不好​走​，​可能​会​遇到​麻烦​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，dang1ran2，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 le5 pai1“dou3 niu2 quan3” huo4che1 de5 che1shen1。ji1 ying1chi3 wai4，ling4 yi1 liang4 tong2kuan3 huo4che1 ye3 hong1ran2 fa1dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4huo3r5 shang4che1 ba1，zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4……qu4 peng4tou2 di4dian3 de5 lu4 bu4hao3 zou3，ke3neng2 hui4 yu4dao4 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Our purpose is to suffer and die.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice is utterly matter-of-fact. If any of this bothers him, he doesn't show it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In so doing, we provide useful research data. It is what we were made for."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​我们​的​使命​就是​承受​痛苦​，​随后​死亡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​语气​平淡​得​如同​陈述​事实​。​即便​内心​有所​波澜​，​他​也​毫无​表露​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​通过​这样​的​牺牲​，​我们​为​研究​提供​了​宝贵​数据​。​这​正是​我们​存在​的​意义​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。wo3men5 de5 shi3ming4 jiu4shi4 cheng2shou4 tong4ku3，sui2hou4 si3wang2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 ping2dan4 de2 ru2tong2 chen2shu4 shi4shi2。ji2bian4 nei4xin1 you3suo3 bo1lan2，ta1 ye3 hao2wu2 biao3lu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tong1guo4 zhe4yang4 de5 xi1sheng1，wo3men5 wei2 yan2jiu1 ti2gong1 le5 bao3gui4 shu4ju4。zhe4 zheng4shi4 wo3men5 cun2zai4 de5 yi4yi4。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Please.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The Engineer's voice is thick and wet. He smiles through a set of gore-streaked teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Enlighten us."
msgstr ""
"没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​工程师​的​声音​低沉​而​沙哑​。​他​透过​一排​血迹斑斑​的​牙齿​露出​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​愿闻其详​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 de5 sheng1yin1 di1chen2 er2 sha1ya3。ta1 tou4guo4 yi1pai2 xue4ji4ban1ban1 de5 ya2chi3 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yuan4wen2qi2xiang2。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Taken during the early days, shortly after I arrived here.\n"
"\n"
"Harrow was holding the camera. He told us how sweet we were, and how happy he was to have us here."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​这​是​在​我​刚来​这里​不久​的​时候​拍摄​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​拍下​了​这张​照片​。​他​当时​说​我们​无比​可爱​，​以及​他​十分高兴​有​我们​在​这里​陪​他​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。zhe4 shi4 zai4 wo3 gang1 lai2 zhe4li3 bu4jiu3 de5 shi2hou5 pai1she4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 pai1 xia4 le5 zhe4 zhang1 zhao4pian4。ta1 dang1shi2 shuo1 wo3men5 wu2bi3 ke3ai4，yi3ji2 ta1 shi2 fen4 gao1 xing4 you3 wo3men5 zai4 zhe4li3 pei2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Tell him I sent you.\n"
"\n"
"I will do what I can to dig into the information that you've uncovered already... sparse though it may be."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​跟​他​说​是​我​派​你​去​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​尽可能​深挖​一下​你们​已经​发现​的​信息​……​尽管​可能​挖不出​太多​内容​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。gen1 ta1 shuo1 shi4 wo3 pai4 ni3 qu4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin3ke3neng2 shen1wa1 yi1xia4 ni3men5 yi3jing1 fa1xian4 de5 xin4xi1……jin3guan3 ke3neng2 wa1 bu4 chu1 tai4 duo1 nei4rong2。"

msgid "Yes. Thank you, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​谢谢​你​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"shi4 de5。xie4xie5 ni3，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "Yes. That wasn't an explanation."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​这​算不上​什么​解释​。\n"
"shi4 de5。zhe4 suan4 bu4 shang4 shen2me5 jie3shi4。"

msgid "Yes. That would be best."
msgstr ""
"嗯​，​这样​最好​不过​了​。\n"
"en1，zhe4yang4 zui4hao3 bu4guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes. That's... that's right. Knockoffs.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He nods slowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Dangerous work. Illegal most places, but not here in Berlin. Our investor needed it that way."
msgstr ""
"是​的​……​没错​。​制造​仿品​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​缓缓​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​门​危险​的​工作​，​在​大多数​地方​都​是​非法​的​，​但​在​柏林​不是​。​我们​的​投资人​就​需要​这个​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……mei2cuo4。zhi4zao4 fang3pin3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 men2 wei1xian3 de5 gong1zuo4，zai4 da4duo1shu4 di4fang1 dou1 shi4 fei1fa3 de5，dan4 zai4 bo2lin2 bu4shi4。wo3men5 de5 tou2zi1ren2 jiu4 xu1yao4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid "Yes. They were “reasoned with”."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​他们​已​被​“​说服​”​。\n"
"shi4 de5。ta1men5 yi3 bei4“shuo1fu2”。"

msgid ""
"Yes. They'll come. But the ghouls will already be gone. You, on the other "
"hand, will not be so lucky."
msgstr ""
"他们​来​了​又​如何​，​那​时候​尸鬼们​早就​远走高飞​了​。​至于​你​的话​，​就​没​那么​幸运​了​。\n"
"ta1men5 lai2 le5 you4 ru2he2，na4 shi2hou5 shi1 gui3 men5 zao3jiu4 yuan3zou3gao1fei1 le5。zhi4yu2 ni3 de5hua4，jiu4 mei2 na4me5 xing4yun4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Trithemius needs the Hub. To threaten this congregation would be to jeapordize his primary source of income.\n"
"\n"
"But the upper floors enjoy no such protection. They have become dangerous places to travel."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​特​里特​米​乌斯​需要​中枢​。​威胁​这个​教会​，​就​等于​危及​他​的​主要​收入​来源​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​上面​的​楼层​没有​这种​保护​。​它们​已经​变成​了​危险​的​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 xu1yao4 zhong1shu1。wei1xie2 zhe4ge5 jiao1hui4，jiu4 deng3yu2 wei1ji2 ta1 de5 zhu3yao4 shou1ru4 lai2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 shang4mian4 de5 lou2ceng2 mei2you3 zhe4zhong3 bao3hu4。ta1men5 yi3jing1 bian4cheng2 le5 wei1xian3 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid "Yes. Ullrich is dead."
msgstr ""
"是​的​，​乌尔里​希死​了​。\n"
"shi4 de5，wu1 er3 li3 xi1 si3 le5。"

msgid "Yes. We're ready. Lay it on me."
msgstr ""
"我们​准备​好​了​。​你​说​吧​。\n"
"wo3men5 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5。ni3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Well.\n"
"\n"
"It would appear that my timetable is even shorter than I'd thought."
msgstr ""
"好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​我​剩下​的​时间​比​我​预想​中​还要​少​。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3 sheng4xia4 de5 shi2jian1 bi3 wo3 yu4xiang3 zhong4 hai2 yao4 shao3。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Yes it is. But you'd be surprised how rare it is to find a shadowrunner who can really *embrace* the principles of their occupation.\n"
"\n"
"Many of your colleagues let their egos get in the way of doing business. They have inflated opinions of the role that they serve."
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​确实​如此​。​但​你​会​惊讶​于​真正​能​*​践行​*​职业​准则​的​暗影​狂奔​者​何其​稀少​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​许多​同行​让​自负​阻碍​了​生意​。​他们​对​自身​角色​的​定位​膨胀​得​离谱​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。que4shi2 ru2ci3。dan4 ni3 hui4 jing1ya4 yu2 zhen1zheng4 neng2*jian4xing2*zhi2ye4 zhun3ze2 de5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 he2qi2 xi1shao3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 xu3duo1 tong2hang2 rang4 zi4fu4 zu3ai4 le5 sheng1yi4。ta1men5 dui4 zi4shen1 jue2se4 de5 ding4wei4 peng2zhang4 de2 li2pu3。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Yes, of course, O Wise One!\n"
"\n"
"Kami! Come!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A young woman bustles in from the back room. Her gum chewing is loud enough to hear over the noise of the coffee grinders. Burakgazi spits something out in rapid-fire Turkish.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"当然​没​问题​，​睿智​之​人​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​卡米​！​过来​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一位​年轻​女子​从后​屋​匆忙​跑​出来​。​她​嚼​口香糖​的​声音​大到​足以​盖过​咖啡​研磨机​的​噪音​。​布拉加​齐​连珠炮​般嚷​了​一串​土耳其语​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 mei2 wen4ti2，rui4zhi4 zhi1 ren2！\n"
"\n"
"Ka3mi3！guo4lai2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 wei4 nian2qing1 nu:3zi3 cong2 hou4 wu1 cong1mang2 pao2 chu1lai2。ta1 jiao2 kou3xiang1tang2 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 dao4 zu2yi3 gai4 guo4 ka1fei1 yan2 mo2 ji1 de5 zao4yin1。bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 lian2zhu1pao4 ban1 rang3 le5 yi1 chuan4 tu3er3qi2yu3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"Yes. You should try the talismonger, Aljernon.\n"
"\n"
"I've had... dealings with him in the past. If anyone in the Kreuzbasar can read what we took, it'll be him."
msgstr ""
"嗯​。​你​可以​去​找​奇物​商人​阿尔杰​农​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​过去​曾​与​他​有​过​……​某些​交集​。​如果说​克洛伊​茨​集市​里​有人​能看懂​我们​拿到​手​的​东西​，​那​肯定​是​他​了​。\n"
"\n"
"en1。ni3 ke3yi3 qu4 zhao3 ji1 wu4 shang1ren2 E1er3jie2nong2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 guo4qu4 ceng2 yu4 ta1 you3 guo4……mou3xie1 jiao1ji2。ru2guo3shuo1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 li3 you3ren2 neng2 kan4 dong3 wo3men5 na2dao4 shou3 de5 dong1xi1，na4 ken3ding4 shi4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Yes. You're right, of course.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away from the tri-vid player and stalks past you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"是​啊​，​你​说​的​一点​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转身​离开​3D​影像​机​，​静静​走过​你​的​身边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，ni3 shuo1 de5 yi1dian3 mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 3D ying3xiang4 ji1，jing4 jing4 zou3guo4 ni3 de5 shen1bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yes. Your Herr Amsel informed me of your business practices. Rest assured, you will be paid.\n"
"\n"
"Now, if we may discuss the details of the job...?"
msgstr ""
"是​的​。​你们​那位​阿姆​泽尔​已经​和​我​说​过​了​你​的​生意经​。​放心​，​钱​不会​少​给​你​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我们​可以​谈谈​任务​详情​了​吗​……​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。ni3men5 na4 wei4 E1mu3ze2er3 yi3jing1 he4 wo3 shuo1 guo4 le5 ni3 de5 sheng1yi5jing1。fang4xin1，qian2 bu4hui4 shao3 gei3 ni3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 tan2tan2 ren4wu5 xiang2qing2 le5 ma5……？"

msgid "Yes..."
msgstr ""
"是​的​……\n"
"shi4 de5……"

msgid ""
"Yes... $(l.name) is right. Finding Dr. Vauclair should be our priority.\n"
"\n"
"If we're going up against a dragon, we need to find ourselves a dragonslayer."
msgstr ""
"是​的​……​$(l.name)​说得对​。​我们​要​找到​沃​克莱尔​博士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​想​对付​一条​巨龙​，​就​得​有​一位​屠龙​者​才​行​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……$(l.name) shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 yao4 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 xiang3 dui4fu5 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2，jiu4 de2 you3 yi1 wei4 tu2 long2 zhe3 cai2 xing2。"

msgid ""
"Yes... and others.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She surveys the room, a worried expression on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We need to find them and get out of here. The connection between this compound and... wherever we were... is breaking down. As that place disintegrates, more and more things are spilling through."
msgstr ""
"是​的​……​还有​其他​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​警惕​地​扫视​四周​，​眉头​紧锁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​找到​他们​，​然后​离开​这里​。​这座​建筑​与​……​我们​在​的​地方​……​的​连接​正在​崩溃​。​随着​那片​区域​的​瓦解​，​越来越​多​的​东西​正​涌入​现实​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……hai2you3 qi2ta1 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jing3ti4 de5 sao3shi4 si4zhou1，mei2tou2 jin3 suo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhao3dao4 ta1men5，ran2hou4 li2kai1 zhe4li3。zhe4 zuo4 jian4zhu4 yu4……wo3men5 zai4 de5 di4fang1……de5 lian2jie1 zheng4zai4 beng1kui4。sui2zhe5 na4 pian1 qu1yu4 de5 wa3jie3，yue4lai2yue4 duo1 de5 dong1xi1 zheng1 yong3ru4 xian4shi2。"

msgid ""
"Yes... very well.\n"
"\n"
"Clearly, something has thrown off the balance between magic and reality."
msgstr ""
"行​啊​……​好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​显然​，​某种​力量​打破​了​魔法​与​现实​之间​的​平衡​。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 a1……hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"xian3ran2，mou3zhong3 li4liang5 da3po4 le5 mo2fa3 yu4 xian4shi2 zhi1jian1 de5 ping2heng2。"

msgid ""
"Yes... yes, I do. Thank you for coming so promptly.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a deep breath, slowly releases it, and looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Tell me. What do you know about the Humanis Policlub?"
msgstr ""
"是​的​……​没错​。​谢谢​你​这么​快​就​来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​深吸​一口气​，​然后​慢慢​呼出来​，​看着​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​告诉​我​。​你​对​人类​至上​俱乐部​都​有​什么​了解​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……mei2cuo4。xie4xie5 ni3 zhe4me5 kuai4 jiu4 lai2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，ran2hou4 man4man4 hu1 chu1 lai2，kan4 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gao4su4 wo3。ni3 dui4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 dou1 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3？"

msgid ""
"Yes... yes, I suppose you would not be the sort to care about such things as the conquest and eventual destruction of all humanity at the hands of dragonkind. \n"
"\n"
"That dragons play us as pawns, and treat all the world as a hoard of treasure for the taking... no, you would not care about that. \n"
"\n"
"It doesn't affect your next *paycheck.* "
msgstr ""
"是​的​……​是​的​，​我​想​你​大概​不会​在意​诸如​巨龙​征服​并​最终​毁灭​全人类​这种​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​将​我们​当作​棋子​，​将​整个​世界​视为​任其​掠夺​的​宝藏​……​不​，​你​不会​在意​这些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不会​影响​你​下次​领到​的​*​薪水​*​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……shi4 de5，wo3 xiang3 ni3 da4gai4 bu4hui4 zai4yi4 zhu1ru2 ju4long2 zheng1fu2 bing4 zui4zhong1 hui3mie4 quan2 ren2 lei4 zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 jiang1 wo3men5 dang4zuo4 qi2zi3，jiang1 zheng3ge4 shi4jie4 shi4wei2 ren4 qi2 lu:e4duo2 de5 bao3zang4……bu4，ni3 bu4hui4 zai4yi4 zhe4xie1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4hui4 ying3xiang3 ni3 xia4ci4 ling3dao4 de5*xin1shui3*。"

msgid "Yes?"
msgstr ""
"什么​事​？\n"
"shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "Yes? And?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​？​所以​呢​？\n"
"en1？suo3yi3 ni2？"

msgid "Yes? Is it safe?"
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​安全​了​吗​？\n"
"shi4 ma5？an1quan2 le5 ma5？"

msgid "Yes? What would you like to discuss?"
msgstr ""
"嗯​？​你​有​什么​想​讨论​的​？\n"
"en1？ni3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3 tao3lun4 de5？"

msgid "Yessir."
msgstr ""
"是​，​长官​。\n"
"shi4，zhang3guan1。"

msgid "You *monster!* You KILLED Marta!"
msgstr ""
"你​这个​*​畜生​*​！​你​杀​了​玛​尔塔​！\n"
"ni3 zhe4ge5*chu4sheng5*！ni3 sha1 le5 Ma3er3ta3！"

msgid "You *need* me to--"
msgstr ""
"你​*​需要​*​我来​—​—\n"
"ni3*xu1yao4*wo3 lai2 — —"

msgid "You Died"
msgstr ""
"你​死​了​。\n"
"ni3 si3 le5。"

msgid "You Died."
msgstr ""
"你​死​了​。\n"
"ni3 si3 le5。"

msgid "You about through over there?"
msgstr ""
"你​差不多​完事​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 cha4bu5duo1 wan2shi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You accuse me of thinking myself a messiah. Well... perhaps that is true. \n"
"\n"
"But it does not change the facts, nor the necessity of what I do tonight. It does not alter my resolve."
msgstr ""
"你​说​我​认为​自己​是​救世主​……​也许​这​并非​虚言​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​不能​改变​事实​，​或是​我​今晚​所行​之事​的​必要性​。​它​不会​动摇​我​的​决心​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 wo3 ren4wei2 zi4ji3 shi4 jiu4shi4zhu3……ye3xu3 zhe4 bing4fei1 xu1yan2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 bu4neng2 gai3bian4 shi4shi2，huo4shi4 wo3 jin1wan3 suo3 xing2 zhi1 shi4 de5 bi4yao4xing4。ta1 bu4hui4 dong4yao2 wo3 de5 jue2xin1。"

msgid ""
"You again? \n"
"\n"
"Well, you ignored my warning last time, and you ain't dead, so I guess you can handle yourself. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let 'em through, Sergej."
msgstr ""
"你​又​来​了​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​上次​不​听​我​警告​，​居然​没​死​，​看来​你​有​两把刷子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​他们​过去​吧​，​谢尔盖​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 lai2 le5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shang4ci4 bu4 ting1 wo3 jing3gao4，ju1ran2 mei2 si3，kan4lai5 ni3 you3 liang3ba3shua1zi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fang4 ta1men5 guo4qu4 ba1，xie4er3gai4。"

msgid "You again? What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"又​是​你​？​你​有​什么​事​？\n"
"you4 shi4 ni3？ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid "You all made it through the attack, though? Your wife, your kids...?"
msgstr ""
"但​你们​都​活​下来​了​吧​？​你​的​妻子​，​你​的​孩子​们​……​？\n"
"dan4 ni3men5 dou1 huo2 xia4lai5 le5 ba1？ni3 de5 qi1zi3，ni3 de5 hai2zi5 men5……？"

msgid "You all right?"
msgstr ""
"你​没事​吧​？\n"
"ni3 mei2shi4 ba1？"

msgid "You alright, Burakgazi?"
msgstr ""
"你​还好​吗​，​布拉加​齐​？\n"
"ni3 hai2hao3 ma5，bu4 la1 jia1 qi2？"

msgid "You an' me both."
msgstr ""
"我​也​是​这么​想​的​。\n"
"wo3 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。"

msgid "You and me both. Mind holding that door open for me?"
msgstr ""
"我们​俩​都​是​。​能​帮​我​开​一下​门​吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 lia3 dou1 shi4。neng2 bang1 wo3 kai1 yi1xia4 men2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You and your little friend are both going down, pal.\n"
"\n"
"Say goodnight."
msgstr ""
"你​和​你​的​小朋友​都​要​完蛋​了​，​伙计​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​晚安​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 he4 ni3 de5 xiao3peng2you3 dou1 yao4 wan2dan4 le5，huo3ji5。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 wan3an1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You and your team descend into the sewers, footsteps echoing off of the damp stone walls. You barely notice the smell - there’s no time to waste. Audran’s team of mercenaries is down here somewhere, racing to plant their explosive charges beneath the kiez. \n"
"\n"
"The fate of the Kreuzbasar is in your hands."
msgstr ""
"你​率领​队员​们​踏入​下水道​，​脚步声​在​潮湿​的​石壁​间​回荡​。​你​几乎​没空​注意​那​令人作呕​的​气味​—​—​此时此刻​，​分秒必争​。​奥​德兰​的​佣兵​小队​就​在​地下​某处​，​正在​街区​下方​紧锣密鼓​地​埋设​炸药​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​命运​，​如今​就​掌握​在​你​手中​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuai4ling3 dui4yuan2 men5 ta1 ru4 xia4shui3dao4，jiao3 bu4 sheng1 zai4 chao2shi1 de5 dan4 bi4 jian1 hui2dang4。ni3 ji1hu1 mei2 kong1 zhu4yi4 na4 ling3 ren2 zuo4 ou3 de5 qi4wei4——ci3shi2ci3ke4，fen1miao3bi4zheng1。Ao4de2lan2 de5 yong1bing1 xiao3 dui4 jiu4 zai4 di4xia4 mou3chu4，zheng4zai4 jie1qu1 xia4fang1 jin3luo2mi4gu3 de5 mai2she4 zha4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ming4yun4，ru2jin1 jiu4 zhang3wo4 zai4 ni3 shou3 zhong4。"

msgid ""
"You and your team were doing good over there. Whatever the Mafia did "
"afterward is on them, not you."
msgstr ""
"你​和​你​的​小队​做​得​很​好​了​。​无论​那些​黑帮​后来​做​了​什么​，​都​不是​你们​的​错​。\n"
"ni3 he4 ni3 de5 xiao3 dui4 zuo4 de2 hen3 hao3 le5。wu2lun4 na4xie1 hei1bang1 hou4lai2 zuo4 le5 shen2me5，dou1 bu4shi4 ni3men5 de5 cuo4。"

msgid ""
"You and your... congregation need to stop. There's a killer AI on the loose "
"in this building."
msgstr ""
"你​和​你​的​……​教众​需要​立刻​停下​。​这栋​楼里​有个​失控​的​杀人​AI​在​四处​游荡​。\n"
"ni3 he4 ni3 de5……jiao4zhong4 xu1yao4 li4ke4 ting2xia4。zhe4 dong4 lou2 li3 you3 ge4 shi1kong4 de5 sha1ren2 AI zai4 si4chu4 you2dang4。"

msgid ""
"You appear to have discovered a compilation of financial reports. Each report details the fiscal health of a small corporation.\n"
"\n"
"Taken as a whole, they paint a picture of small business across the whole of Germany."
msgstr ""
"你​似乎​发现​了​一份​财务报告​汇编​。​每份​报告​都​详细​记录​了​一家​小型企业​的​财务状况​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​报告​共同​勾勒​出​整个​德国​小型企业​的​整体​图景​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 si4hu1 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 fen4 cai2 wu4 bao4 gao4 hui4bian1。mei3 fen4 bao4gao4 dou1 xiang2xi4 ji4lu4 le5 yi1jia1 xiao3xing2qi3ye4 de5 cai2 wu4 zhuang4 kuang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 bao4gao4 gong4tong2 gou1le4 chu1 zheng3ge4 de2guo2 xiao3xing2qi3ye4 de5 zheng3ti3 tu2jing3。"

msgid "You are Feuerschwinge. While you live, the green will live."
msgstr ""
"你​是​火翼​。​只要​你​还​活着​，​绿色​就​会​存在​。\n"
"ni3 shi4 Huo3yi4。zhi3yao4 ni3 hai2 huo2zhe5，lu:4se4 jiu4 hui4 cun2zai4。"

msgid "You are a murderer! A monster! You will pay!"
msgstr ""
"你​是​个​杀人犯​！​怪物​！​你​会​付出代价​的​！\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 sha1ren2fan4！guai4wu5！ni3 hui4 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4 de5！"

msgid "You are about to enter the sewers. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​进入​下水道​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 jin4ru4 xia4shui3dao4。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid ""
"You are about to exit this location and return to the Kreuzbasar. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​离开​此​地点​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 li2kai1 ci3 di4dian3 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid ""
"You are about to leave this floor and travel to the 25th floor. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​离开​本层​前往​25​层​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 li2kai1 ben3 ceng2 qian2wang3 25 ceng2。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to transition to a new location. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​将​前往​一处​新​地点​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 jiang1 qian2wang3 yi1 chu3 xin1 di4dian3。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to Altstadt Spandau. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​施​潘道​旧城区​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 shi1 pan1 dao4 jiu4 cheng2 qu1。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to Aztechnology's Berlin compound. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​阿兹特​科技​的​柏林​企业​园区​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 bo2lin2 qi3ye4 yuan2qu1。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to Das Kesselhaus Hotel. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​“​锅炉房​”​旅馆​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3“Guo1lu2fang2” lu:3guan3。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to Drogenkippe. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​毒坑区​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 du2 keng1 qu1。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to Frankfurter Tor. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​法兰克福​门​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to Harrow's compound in Tübingen. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​哈罗​在​图​宾根​的​据点​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 ha1luo2 zai4 tu2 bin1 gen1 de5 ju4dian3。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to the AG Chemie Europa facility. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​欧洲​化工​设施​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 she4shi1。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to the Adenauerplatz stop. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​阿登纳​广场​站​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 e1 deng1 na4 guang3chang3 zhan4。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to the Gesundbrunnen U-Bahn station. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​健康​泉​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 jian4kang1 quan2。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to the Harfeld Manor. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​哈​菲尔德​庄园​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to the Pharma Laboratory Complex. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​制药​实验室​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 zhi4yao4 shi2yan4shi4。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to the Schattennest. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​影巢​，​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 ying3 chao2，shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid ""
"You are about to travel to the location of the APEX AI system. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​AI​系统​“​APEX​”​所在地​点​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 AI xi4tong3“APEX” suo3zai4di4 dian3。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid "You are about to travel to the offices of OTK International. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​前往​OTK​国际​办公室​。​是否​继续​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 qian2wang3 OTK guo2ji4 ban4gong1shi4。shi4fou3 ji4xu4？"

msgid ""
"You are confused. I didn't *do* anything. I merely related what I saw.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She blinks, then looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What I shared with you... it was an observation. Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"你​误会​了​。​我​什么​都​没​*​做​*​。​我​只是​转述​了​我​的​所见所闻​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​眨​眨眼​，​然后​移开​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​与​你​分享​的​情景​……​只是​我​的​观察所​得​，​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wu4hui4 le5。wo3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2*zuo4*。wo3 zhi3shi4 zhuan3shu4 le5 wo3 de5 suo3jian4suo3wen2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 zha3yan3，ran2hou4 yi2kai1 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yu4 ni3 fen1xiang3 de5 qing2jing3……zhi3shi4 wo3 de5 guan1 cha2 suo3 de2，jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"You are in an Aztechnology facility, yes? Well, that facility is also home to an executive. A small man who foolishly believes that he is beyond our reach.\n"
"\n"
"In this, he is mistaken. We would like you to deliver a message to this effect."
msgstr ""
"你​身处​阿兹特​科技​的​设施​内​，​对​吧​？​那座​设施​里​还​住​着​一位​高管​。​一个​自​以为​能​逃脱​我们​掌控​的​小​蠢货​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​大错特错​了​。​我们​希望​你​向​他​传达​这个​意思​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shen1chu3 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 she4shi1 nei4，dui4 ba1？na4 zuo4 she4shi1 li3 hai2 zhu4 zhao2 yi1 wei4 gao1guan3。yi1ge5 zi4 yi3wei2 neng2 tao2tuo1 wo3men5 zhang3kong4 de5 xiao3 chun3huo4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 da4cuo4te4cuo4 le5。wo3men5 xi1wang4 ni3 xiang4 ta1 chuan2da2 zhe4ge5 yi4si5。"

msgid "You are in luck: I have a great many answers."
msgstr ""
"你​运气​很​好​：​我​这里​最不缺​的​就是​答案​。\n"
"ni3 yun4qi5 hen3 hao3：wo3 zhe4li3 zui4 bu4 que1 de5 jiu4shi4 da2an4。"

msgid ""
"You are lost. Your entire world has been reduced to a churning vortex of green and gold.\n"
"\n"
"Dimly, you become aware that something is happening. You feel your body being buffeted by unseen forces, and suddenly, everything goes black."
msgstr ""
"你​迷失​了​方向​。​整个​世界​已​化作​翻涌​的​绿​金色​漩涡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​隐约​察觉到​异样​正在​发生​。​身体​被​无形​之力​猛烈​撞击​，​霎时间​，​万物​陷入​漆黑​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mi2shi1 le5 fang1xiang4。zheng3ge4 shi4jie4 yi3 hua4zuo4 fan1yong3 de5 lu:4 jin1se4 xuan2wo1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yin3yue1 cha2 jiao4 dao4 yi4yang4 zheng4zai4 fa1sheng1。shen1ti3 bei4 wu2xing2 zhi1 li4 meng3lie4 zhuang4ji1，sha4shi2jian1，wan4wu4 xian4ru4 qi1hei1。"

msgid ""
"You are most welcome, young $(l.race).\n"
"\n"
"Is there anything else that you need?"
msgstr ""
"不用​客气​，​年轻​的​$(l.race)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​要​问​的​？\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 ke4qi5，nian2qing1 de5 $(l.race)。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4 wen4 de5？"

msgid ""
"You are no more interested in the dealings of the Great Dragons than a moth "
"is interested in your bank account. Yet one day, that moth might be squashed"
" under your foot without your even noticing."
msgstr ""
"你​对​巨龙​缺乏​兴趣​，​就​好比​飞蛾​不会​去​在意​你​的​银行​账户​一样​。​但​总有一天​，​你​会​一脚​踩扁​某​只​飞蛾​，​而​你​却​浑然不知​。\n"
"ni3 dui4 ju4long2 que1fa2 xing4qu4，jiu4 hao3bi3 fei1e2 bu4hui4 qu4 zai4yi4 ni3 de5 yin2hang2 zhang4hu4 yi1yang4。dan4 zong3 you3 yi1 tian1，ni3 hui4 yi1 jiao3 cai3 pian1 mou3 zhi3 fei1e2，er2 ni3 que4 hun2ran2bu4zhi1。"

msgid ""
"You are now in turn-based combat mode. Each character on your team has an Action Pool - spend these Actions on movement, attacks, or using spells and items. Once your team's turn is complete, the enemy team will move and attack.\n"
"\n"
"Additional tutorial information is available from the Reference Guide, which can be accessed in the upper-right corner of your PDA menu."
msgstr ""
"你​已​进入​回合制​战斗​模式​。​队伍​中​的​每位​角色​均​拥有​行动​池​，​可​消耗​行动​点​进行​移动​、​攻击​，​或​使用​法术​和​道具​。​我方​回合​结束​后​，​敌方​队伍​将​开始​移动​与​攻击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​查看​PDA​菜单​右上角​的​参考​指南​可​获得​更​多​教程​信息​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3 jin4ru4 hui2he2zhi4 zhan4dou4 mo2shi4。dui4wu3 zhong4 de5 mei3 wei4 jue2se4 jun1 yong1you3 xing2dong4 chi2，ke3 xiao1hao4 xing2dong4 dian3 jin4xing2 yi2dong4、gong1ji1，huo4 shi3yong4 fa3shu4 he4 dao4ju4。wo3fang1 hui2he2 jie2shu4 hou4，di2fang1 dui4wu3 jiang1 kai1shi3 yi2dong4 yu4 gong1ji1。\n"
"\n"
"cha2kan4 PDA cai4dan1 you4 shang4 jiao3 de5 can1kao3 zhi3nan2 ke3 huo4de2 geng1 duo1 jiao4cheng2 xin4xi1。"

msgid ""
"You are now, whether you like it or not. So quiet down and stop bothering "
"$(l.him)."
msgstr ""
"不管​你​喜不喜欢​，​现在​都​有​关系​了​。​所以​安静​点​，​别​再​打扰​$(l.he)​了​。\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 xi3 bu4 xi3 huan1，xian4zai4 dou1 you3 guan1xi5 le5。suo3yi3 an1jing4 dian3，bie4 zai4 da3rao3 $(l.he) le5。"

msgid "You are, if you know what's good for you."
msgstr ""
"如果​你​识相​点​的话​，​就​最好​乖乖​交待​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shi2xiang4 dian3 de5hua4，jiu4 zui4hao3 guai1guai1 jiao1dai4。"

msgid ""
"You aren't fooling anyone. Glory's told me all about you - how you tricked "
"her into coming here."
msgstr ""
"你​骗​不了​任何人​。​格洛丽​已经​把​你​的​事全​告诉​我​了​。​当初​就是​你​把​她​骗​到​这里​来​的​。\n"
"ni3 pian4 bu4le5 ren4 he2 ren2。Ge2luo4li2 yi3jing1 ba3 ni3 de5 shi4 quan2 gao4su4 wo3 le5。dang1chu1 jiu4shi4 ni3 ba3 ta1 pian4 dao4 zhe4li3 lai2 de5。"

msgid "You aren't hurting anyone unless I order you to. You got that?"
msgstr ""
"没有​我​的​命令​，​你​不许​伤害​任何人​，​听懂​了​没​？\n"
"mei2you3 wo3 de5 ming4ling4，ni3 bu4xu3 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2，ting1dong3 le5 mei2？"

msgid ""
"You aren't listening, Doctor. $+(l.he)'s right - RNA polymerases are *notoriously* prone to replication errors. Any first-year biology student could tell you that.\n"
"\n"
"You have no way of knowing *how* your Panacea will mutate once you let it go. You're playing with fire, in every way imaginable."
msgstr ""
"你​没有​认真​听​，​博士​。​$+(l.he)​是​对​的​—​—​RNA​聚合酶​以​*​极易​*​发生​复制​错误​而​闻名​。​随便​哪个​生物​专业​的​大​一​学生​都​能​告诉​你​这​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​无法​预知​你​的​“​万能​药​”​一旦​释放​后​会​*​如何​*​发生​突变​。​从​任何​角度​来讲​，​你​这样​做​都​是​在​玩火​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 ren4zhen1 ting1，bo2shi4。$+(l.he) shi4 dui4 de5——RNA ju4he2mei2 yi3*ji2 yi4*fa1sheng1 fu4zhi4 cuo4wu4 er2 wen2ming2。sui2bian4 na3ge5 sheng1wu4 zhuan1ye4 de5 dai4 yi1 xue2sheng5 dou1 neng2 gao4su4 ni3 zhe4 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wu2fa3 yu4zhi1 ni3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4” yi1dan4 shi4fang4 hou4 hui4*ru2he2*fa1sheng1 tu1bian4。cong2 ren4he2 jiao3du4 lai2jiang3，ni3 zhe4yang4 zuo4 dou1 shi4 zai4 wan2huo3。"

msgid ""
"You aren't unleashing that dragon, Audran. I'll kill you before you do."
msgstr ""
"你别​想​释放​巨龙​，​奥​德兰​。​我会​在此之前​杀​了​你​。\n"
"ni3 bie4 xiang3 shi4fang4 ju4long2，Ao4de2lan2。wo3 hui4 zai4ci3zhi1qian2 sha1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You ask questions that have no answers, young $(l.race).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The elf strokes his beard, a contemplative look on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My experiences lead me to suspect that magic is its own source. You may, of course, choose to believe differently... it matters little to me either way."
msgstr ""
"年轻​的​$(l.race)​，​你​这个​问题​本身​是​没有​答案​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​精灵​轻​捋​胡须​，​脸上​一副​若有所思​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​经历​让​我​怀疑​魔法​自成​其源​。​当然​，​你​也​可以​有​不同​看法​……​这​对​我​而言​都​无所谓​。\n"
"\n"
"nian2qing1 de5 $(l.race)，ni3 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2 ben3shen1 shi4 mei2you3 da2an4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1ling2 qing1 lu:3 hu2xu1，lian3 shang4 yi1 fu4 ruo4you3suo3si1 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 jing1li4 rang4 wo3 huai2yi2 mo2fa3 zi4 cheng2 qi2 yuan2。dang1ran2，ni3 ye3 ke3yi3 you3 bu4tong2 kan4fa3……zhe4 dui4 wo3 er2yan2 dou1 wu2suo3wei4。"

msgid "You back off from the touchpad."
msgstr ""
"你​从​触控板​处​退开​。\n"
"ni3 cong2 chu4kong4ban3 chu3 tui4 kai1。"

msgid ""
"You begin creeping toward the wageslave. He's so engrossed in his work that "
"he doesn't seem aware of anything else."
msgstr ""
"你​开始​蹑手蹑脚​地​走向​薪奴​。​他​在​全神贯注​地​工作​，​似乎​什么​都​没​注意​到​。\n"
"ni3 kai1shi3 nie4shou3nie4jiao3 de5 zou3xiang4 xin1 nu2。ta1 zai4 quan2shen2guan4zhu4 de5 gong1zuo4，si4hu1 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 zhu4yi4 dao4。"

msgid ""
"You begin to rummage through the desk again. Hasenkamp glances at the "
"chronometer on his PDA and scowls."
msgstr ""
"你​又​开始​翻找​书桌​。​哈森​坎普​瞥​了​眼​PDA​上​的​计时器​，​皱起​眉头​。\n"
"ni3 you4 kai1shi3 fan1 zhao3 shu1zhuo1。Ha1sen1kan3pu3 pie1 le5 yan3 PDA shang4 de5 ji4shi2qi4，zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。"

msgid ""
"You believe whatever you want. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can't stop you from being wrong."
msgstr ""
"你​爱​信不信​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没有​义务​纠正​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ai4 xin4 bu4 xin4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 yi4wu4 jiu1zheng4 ni3。"

msgid "You bet your ass I am. You owe me, Blitz - and don't you forget it."
msgstr ""
"必须​的​。​这次​算​你​欠​我​的​，​布里​茨​。​你​可​别忘了​啊​。\n"
"bi4xu1 de5。zhe4 ci4 suan4 ni3 qian4 wo3 de5，Bu4li3ci2。ni3 ke3 bie4 wang4 le5 a1。"

msgid ""
"You burst through the door to the Humanis compound and into the crisp night air. You’re not far from your extraction point.\n"
"\n"
"Time to go."
msgstr ""
"你​冲破​人类​至上​主义者​据点​的​大门​，​扑面而来​的​是​清冽​的​夜风​。​离​你​的​撤离​点​已​不远​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​走​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 chong1po4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ju4dian3 de5 da4men2，pu1mian4er2lai2 de5 shi4 qing1 lie4 de5 ye4 feng1。li2 ni3 de5 che4li2 dian3 yi3 bu4 yuan3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"You call it luck.\n"
"\n"
"I call it providence."
msgstr ""
"你​称之为​运气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​称之为​天意​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cheng1zhi1wei2 yun4qi5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cheng1zhi1wei2 tian1yi4。"

msgid ""
"You call up the Aztechnology Project data on your PDA, and its tiny display window fills with foreign words and symbols.\n"
"\n"
"Handing over the blood mages' research - whatever it is - would be as easy as initiating a data upload."
msgstr ""
"你​在​PDA​上调​出​阿兹特​科技​项目​的​数据​，​微小​的​显示屏​瞬间​被​陌生​文字​与​符号​填满​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​交​出血​法师​的​研究成果​，​简直​像​启动​数据​上传​般​简单​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 PDA shang4tiao2 chu1 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 xiang4mu4 de5 shu4ju4，wei1xiao3 de5 xian3shi4ping2 shun4jian1 bei4 mo4sheng1 wen2zi4 yu4 fu2hao4 tian2man3。\n"
"\n"
"jiao1 chu1xue4 fa3shi1 de5 yan2 jiu1 cheng2 guo3，jian3zhi2 xiang4 qi3dong4 shu4ju4 shang4chuan2 ban1 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"You can almost hear the wheels in his head turning as he pieces together what's happening.\n"
"\n"
"In a flash, the look of weary confusion on his face is replaced with pure, animal panic. His eyes lock on the alarm panel next to the door."
msgstr ""
"你​几乎​可以​听到​他​的​脑子​在​疯狂​转动​，​试图​搞清楚​发生​了​什么​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​转瞬之间​，​他​脸上​疲惫​困惑​的​神情​被​纯粹​的​、​野兽​般的​恐慌​所​取代​。​他​的​目光​盯​向​门旁​的​警报​面板​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ji1hu1 ke3yi3 ting1dao4 ta1 de5 nao3zi5 zai4 feng1kuang2 zhuan3dong4，shi4tu2 gao3 qing1 chu3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1，ta1 lian3 shang4 pi2bei4 kun4huo4 de5 shen2qing2 bei4 chun2cui4 de5、ye3shou4 ban1 de5 kong3huang1 suo3 qu3dai4。ta1 de5 mu4guang1 ding1 xiang4 men2 pang2 de5 jing3bao4 mian4ban3。"

msgid "You can answer some questions."
msgstr ""
"你​要​回答​我​一些​问题​。\n"
"ni3 yao4 hui2da2 wo3 yi1xie1 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"You can barely make out the faint wail of approaching sirens. They're still "
"far away, but they won't be for long."
msgstr ""
"你​隐约​能​听见​正在​接近​的​警笛​呼啸声​。​它们​此刻​尚​在​远处​，​但​很快​就​会​抵达​现场​。\n"
"ni3 yin3yue1 neng2 ting1jian4 zheng4zai4 jie1jin4 de5 jing3di2 hu1 xiao4 sheng1。ta1men5 ci3ke4 shang4 zai4 yuan3chu4，dan4 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 di3da2 xian4chang3。"

msgid ""
"You can bet on it. You haven't seen the last of me, $(l.name)... that's a promise.\n"
"\n"
"I can't say how long it'll take, but I *will* come back to the Kreuzbasar, and to this team."
msgstr ""
"放心​吧​，​$(l.name)​……​你​还​没见​过​我​的​全部​本事​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽然​说​不准​要​多久​，​但​我​*​一定​*​会回​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​回到​队伍​里​。\n"
"\n"
"fang4xin1 ba1，$(l.name)……ni3 hai2 mei2 jian4 guo4 wo3 de5 quan2bu4 ben3shi4 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"sui1ran2 shuo1 bu4zhun3 yao4 duo1jiu3，dan4 wo3*yi1ding4*hui4 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，hui2dao4 dui4wu3 li3。"

msgid "You can do better than that."
msgstr ""
"你​就​这点​嘴​上​功夫​吗​。\n"
"ni3 jiu4 zhe4 dian3 zui3 shang4 gong1fu5 ma5。"

msgid "You can do it, Monika. Say what you need to say."
msgstr ""
"你​能​做到​的​，​莫妮卡​。​把​你​要说​的话​说​出来​吧​。\n"
"ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4 de5，Mo4ni1ka3。ba3 ni3 yao4shuo1 de5hua4 shuo1 chu1lai2 ba1。"

msgid "You can do that?"
msgstr ""
"你​能​做到​这种​事​？\n"
"ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4 zhe4zhong3 shi4？"

msgid ""
"You can do whatever you want when we're done with this. For now, shut your "
"mouth and finish the job."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​完事​之后​，​你​想​怎样​都​随​你​。​但​现在​把​你​的​嘴闭​上​，​老实​完成​任务​。\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 wan2shi4 zhi1hou4，ni3 xiang3 zen3yang4 dou1 sui2 ni3。dan4 xian4zai4 ba3 ni3 de5 zui3 bi4 shang4，lao3shi5 wan2cheng2 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"You can drop down...\n"
"\n"
"...find your way into the guts of this place...\n"
"\n"
"...there by my body is the machine break it break it break it..."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​下去​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​想​办法​到​这​地方​的​核心​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​我​的​身体​机器​破坏​它​破坏​它​破坏​它​……\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 xia4qu4……\n"
"\n"
"……xiang3 ban4fa3 dao4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 he2xin1……\n"
"\n"
"……wo3 de5 shen1ti3 ji1qi4 po4huai4 ta1 po4huai4 ta1 po4huai4 ta1……"

msgid ""
"You can gain control of the turrets from here. But there's only enough power"
" to keep one bank of turrets active at a time."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​从​这里​控制​炮塔​。​但​当前​电力​仅​可​维持​一侧​炮塔​同时​运作​。\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 cong2 zhe4li3 kong4zhi4 pao4ta3。dan4 dang1qian2 dian4li4 jin3 ke3 wei2chi2 yi1 ce4 pao4ta3 tong2shi2 yun4zuo4。"

msgid "You can have this bioware over my dead body."
msgstr ""
"你​想​拿到​这些​生体​殖装​，​就​得​先​从​我​的​尸体​上​踏​过去​。\n"
"ni3 xiang3 na2dao4 zhe4xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1，jiu4 de2 xian1 cong2 wo3 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 ta1 guo4qu4。"

msgid ""
"You can hear a distant murmuring sound coming from inside the room.\n"
"\n"
"Voices. Three, maybe four people, all talking amongst themselves."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​房间内​传来​一阵​模糊​的​低​语声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​人声​。​有​三四个​人​正在​交谈​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 fang2 jian1 nei4 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 mo2hu5 de5 di1 yu3sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ren2 sheng1。you3 san1 si4 ge4 ren2 zheng4zai4 jiao1tan2。"

msgid ""
"You can hear the whine of motors spinning up in the arcade cabinet's guts. \n"
"\n"
"With a smooth, mechanical motion, a generic-brand optical chip slides out of the payment port in front of you."
msgstr ""
"你​能​听见​街机​柜台​内部​电机​加速​运转​的​嗡​鸣声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​机械​流畅​的​动作​，​一枚​常见​的​光学​芯片​从​你​面前​的​支付​端口​缓缓​滑​出​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 ting1jian4 jie1ji1 gui4tai2 nei4bu4 dian4ji1 jia1su4 yun4zhuan3 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ji1xie4 liu2chang4 de5 dong4zuo4，yi1 mei2 chang2jian4 de5 guang1xue2 xin1pian4 cong2 ni3 mian4qian2 de5 zhi1fu4 duan1kou3 huan3huan3 hua2 chu1。"

msgid "You can make out shapes in the shadows below."
msgstr ""
"阴影​下​有​某种​形状​。\n"
"yin1ying3 xia4 you3 mou3zhong3 xing2zhuang4。"

msgid ""
"You can say whatever you want, but if you start mouthing off about my "
"recently-deceased friend, you should expect a response."
msgstr ""
"你​想​说​什么​就​说​什么​，​但​如果​你​开始​对​我​最近​去世​的​朋友​大放厥词​，​那​就​别怪​我​不​客气​了​。\n"
"ni3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5 jiu4 shuo1 shen2me5，dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 kai1shi3 dui4 wo3 zui4jin4 qu4shi4 de5 peng2you5 da4fang4jue2ci2，na4 jiu4 bie4 guai4 wo3 bu4 ke4qi5 le5。"

msgid "You can see how bad this looks from my position, can't you?"
msgstr ""
"你​应该​明白​，​从​我​的​位置​来看​，​这件​事有​多​糟糕​吧​？\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 ming2bai5，cong2 wo3 de5 wei4zhi5 lai2 kan4，zhe4 jian4 shi4 you3 duo1 zao1gao1 ba1？"

msgid ""
"You can see that the automated security system is offline, but someone has "
"manually locked the gate."
msgstr ""
"你​看到​自动​安保​系统​已​离线​，​但​有人​手动​锁上​了​门​。\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 zi4dong4 an1bao3 xi4tong3 yi3 li2xian4，dan4 you3ren2 shou3dong4 suo3shang4 le5 men2。"

msgid ""
"You can see the dog struggle to obey. He makes a sound that's not quite a "
"whimper."
msgstr ""
"你​能​看出​他​为了​服从命令​进行​了​一番​挣扎​。​他​发出​一声​似是而非​的​呜咽​。\n"
"ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 wei4le5 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3 jin4xing2 le5 yi1 fan1 zheng1zha2。ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 si4shi4er2fei1 de5 wu1ye4。"

msgid ""
"You can see the mistrust in her eyes, but after a moment's hesitation, she begins to fish around in her bag.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, she produces a thick plastic keycard. She hands it to you."
msgstr ""
"你​能​看见​她​眼中​的​顾虑​，​但​迟疑​了​一阵​后​，​她​开始​在​自己​的​包里​翻找​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​她​掏出​一张​厚实​的​塑料​门禁卡​递给​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 kan4jian4 ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 gu4lu:4，dan4 chi2yi2 le5 yi1zhen4 hou4，ta1 kai1shi3 zai4 zi4ji3 de5 bao1 li3 fan1 zhao3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ta1 tao1chu1 yi1 zhang1 hou4shi5 de5 su4liao4 men2 jin1 ka3 di4gei3 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You can see the silhouette of something under the flimsy plastic dome of the"
" drone's cargo compartment. Whatever this thing was here to deliver, it's "
"still carrying it."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​透过​无人机​货舱​那​薄薄的​塑料​穹顶​隐约​看到​其中​物品​的​轮廓​。​无论​这​东西​原本​是​要​运送​什么​，​它​仍然​还​在​货舱​里​。\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 tou4guo4 wu2ren2ji1 huo4cang1 na4 bao2 bao2 de5 su4liao4 qiong2ding3 yin3yue1 kan4dao4 qi2zhong1 wu4pin3 de5 lun2kuo4。wu2lun4 zhe4 dong1xi1 yuan2ben3 shi4 yao4 yun4song4 shen2me5，ta1 reng2ran2 hai2 zai4 huo4cang1 li3。"

msgid ""
"You can see what this thing is, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"You must know that we can't trust it."
msgstr ""
"你​能​看​出来​这是​什么​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​一定​知道​我们​不能​信任​它​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 kan4 chu1lai2 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1ding4 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 bu4neng2 xin4ren4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"You can see yourself out.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take care, stranger."
msgstr ""
"请​自便​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​保重​，​陌生人​。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 zi4bian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao3zhong4，mo4sheng1ren2。"

msgid ""
"You can start by telling me how you sleep at night. \n"
"\n"
"You know what happens to the kids that you bring here. You know what happened to *me.* But you're still luring them here, into Harrow's clutches, all these years later.\n"
"\n"
"So tell me... how do you live with yourself? Explain it to me."
msgstr ""
"你​先​说​说​，​你​晚上​是​怎么​能​睡​得​着​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​清楚​那些​被​你​带到​这里​的​孩子​会​遭遇​什么​。​你​清楚​*​我​*​遭遇​了​什么​。​可​这些年来​，​你​仍​在​引诱​他们​落入​哈罗​的​魔爪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​告诉​我​……​你​怎能​如此​心安理得​地​活着​？​给​我​解释​清楚​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xian1 shuo1 shuo1，ni3 wan3shang5 shi4 zen3me5 neng2 shui4 de2 zhao2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 qing1chu5 na4xie1 bei4 ni3 dai4 dao4 zhe4li3 de5 hai2zi5 hui4 zao1yu4 shen2me5。ni3 qing1chu5*wo3*zao1yu4 le5 shen2me5。ke3 zhe4 xie1 nian2 lai2，ni3 reng2 zai4 yin3you4 ta1men5 luo4ru4 ha1luo2 de5 mo2zhao3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 gao4su4 wo3……ni3 zen3neng2 ru2ci3 xin1an1li3de2 de5 huo2zhe5？gei3 wo3 jie3shi4 qing1chu5。"

msgid ""
"You can stay for as long as you want, Glory. You're a part of this team, and"
" you always will be."
msgstr ""
"你​想​待​多久​就​待​多久​，​格洛丽​。​你​是​这个​团队​的​一部分​，​永远都是​。\n"
"ni3 xiang3 dai1 duo1jiu3 jiu4 dai1 duo1jiu3，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 shi4 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4 de5 yi1bu4fen5，yong3 yuan3 dou1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"You can talk to Frank. He's the floor manager. He'd have an elevator key.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She points to the north end of the club.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He's over there, on the VIP balcony. See the greasy jackass in the oversized suit? The one drooling all over that table dancer? That's Frank."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​跟​弗兰克​谈谈​。​他​是​楼层​经理​，​应该​有​电梯​钥匙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​指向​夜店​的​北侧​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​就​在​那儿​，​在​VIP​大厅​的​露台​上​。​看见​那个​穿着​超大​号​西服​的​油腻​男​没有​？​对​着​桌上​的​舞娘​流​了​一地​口水​那个​？​那​就是​弗兰克​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 gen1 fu2lan2ke4 tan2tan2。ta1 shi4 lou2ceng2 jing1li3，ying1gai1 you3 dian4ti1 yao4shi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3xiang4 ye4dian4 de5 bei3ce4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiu4 zai4 na4r5，zai4 VIP da4ting1 de5 lu4tai2 shang4。kan4jian4 na4ge5 chuan1zhuo2 chao1 dai4 hao4 xi1fu2 de5 you2ni4 nan2 mei2you3？dui4 zhao2 zhuo1 shang4 de5 wu3niang2 liu2 le5 yi1 de5 kou3shui3 na4ge5？na4 jiu4shi4 fu2lan2ke4。"

msgid "You can't be Monika. Monika's dead."
msgstr ""
"你​不​可能​是​莫妮卡​。​她​已经​死​了​。\n"
"ni3 bu4 ke3neng2 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。ta1 yi3jing1 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"You can't have started running the shadows much more than five years ago, "
"tops. So what's with the vintage chrome?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​暗影​圈子里​混​的​时间​肯定​不会​超过​五年​，​那​你​身上​这么​多​的​老旧​铬体​是​怎么回事​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 an4ying3 juan1 zi3 li3 hun4 de5 shi2jian1 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 chao1guo4 wu3 nian2，na4 ni3 shen1shang5 zhe4me5 duo1 de5 lao3jiu4 ge4 ti3 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？"

msgid ""
"You can't help but notice a touch-based console mounted a few feet away from you.\n"
"\n"
"It appears to be a control system for the autosurgeon."
msgstr ""
"你​不禁​注意​到​几​英尺​之外​安放​着​一处​触控式​控制台​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​似乎​是​自动​手术​机器人​的​控制系统​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4jin1 zhu4yi4 dao4 ji1 ying1chi3 zhi1wai4 an1fang4 zhao2 yi1 chu3 chu4 kong4 shi4 kong4zhi4tai2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 zi4dong4 shou3shu4 ji1qi4ren2 de5 kong4 zhi4 xi4 tong3。"

msgid ""
"You can't just give this to me, can you?\n"
"\n"
"All right, chief. If that's the way you wanna be, then fine. I'll try to be more \"open\" and less \"sketchy.\" And *you* start trusting me, and show me a little respect. Deal?"
msgstr ""
"你​就​非得​找​我​的​茬​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​头儿​。​如果​你​愿意​这样的话​也​行​。​我​可以​更加​“​开放​”​，​少​一点​“​可疑​”​，​而​你​要​开始​相信​我​，​并且​多少​尊重​我​一些​。​可以​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 fei1dei3 zhao3 wo3 de5 cha2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5。ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4 ye3 xing2。wo3 ke3yi3 geng4jia1“kai1fang4”，shao3 yi1dian3“ke3yi2”，er2 ni3 yao4 kai1shi3 xiang1xin4 wo3，bing4qie3 duo1shao3 zun1zhong4 wo3 yi1xie1。ke3yi3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You can't just leave it like this - a question mark. I know you, Eiger. "
"You're too strong to run from the truth."
msgstr ""
"你​不能​就​这样​让​它​成为​你​心里​永远​的​谜团​。​艾格尔​，​我​了解​你​。​你​很​坚强​，​不会​逃避​真相​。\n"
"ni3 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4yang4 rang4 ta1 cheng2wei2 ni3 xin1li5 yong3yuan3 de5 mi2tuan2。Ai4ge2er3，wo3 liao3jie3 ni3。ni3 hen3 jian1qiang2，bu4hui4 tao2bi4 zhen1xiang4。"

msgid ""
"You can't make out what they're saying, but one of the voices sounds "
"desperate. You've heard the tone before - it's the sound of a man pleading "
"for his life."
msgstr ""
"你​听不清​他们​在​说​什么​，​但​其中​一个​声音​听​起来​非常​绝望​。​你​以前​听到​过​这种​语气​—​—​那​是​一个​人​在​为​自己​的​性命​求饶​的​声音​。\n"
"ni3 ting1 bu4 qing1 ta1men5 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5，dan4 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 fei1chang2 jue2wang4。ni3 yi3qian2 ting1dao4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 yu3qi4——na4 shi4 yi1ge5 ren2 zai4 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 xing4ming4 qiu2rao2 de5 sheng1yin1。"

msgid "You can't really believe that your idol wants you to commit suicide."
msgstr ""
"你​不会​真的​相信​你​的​精魄​导师​想​让​你​去​自杀​吧​。\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 zhen1de5 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5 jing1 po4 dao3shi1 xiang3 rang4 ni3 qu4 zi4sha1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You can't see the big picture. I can't, either - I am, again, just a mouthpiece.\n"
"\n"
"The only ones who know my organization's ultimate ends are its ruling council, and they aren't in the practice of sharing information with their hirelings. But know that they are some of the most intelligent men on this planet, and they place a high priority on social order and stability. And those are good things by anyone's standards."
msgstr ""
"你​看不清​全局​。​我​也​看不清​—​—​我​不过​是​个​传声筒​罢了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​唯有​统治​委员会​知晓​本​组织​的​终极目标​，​而​他们​向来​不愿​向​雇佣​人员​透露​情报​。​但​你​该​明白​，​他们​是​这颗​星球​上​最​睿智​的​群体​，​将​社会秩序​与​稳定​置于​至​高​地位​。​无论​以​何种​标准​衡量​，​这些​都​是​值得​推崇​的​价值​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4bu5qing1 quan2ju2。wo3 ye3 kan4bu5qing1——wo3 bu4guo4 shi4 ge4 chuan2sheng1tong3 ba4le5。\n"
"\n"
"wei2you3 tong3zhi4 wei3yuan2hui4 zhi1xiao3 ben3 zu3zhi1 de5 zhong1 ji2 mu4 biao1，er2 ta1men5 xiang4lai2 bu4yuan4 xiang4 gu4yong1 ren2yuan2 tou4lu4 qing2bao4。dan4 ni3 gai1 ming2bai5，ta1men5 shi4 zhe4 ke1 xing1qiu2 shang4 zui4 rui4zhi4 de5 qun2ti3，jiang1 she4 hui4 zhi4 xu4 yu4 wen3ding4 zhi4yu2 zhi4 gao1 di4wei4。wu2lun4 yi3 he2 zhong3 biao1zhun3 heng2liang2，zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 zhi2de5 tui1chong2 de5 jia4zhi2。"

msgid ""
"You cancel the delete request and are returned to the main menu, data "
"intact."
msgstr ""
"你​取消​了​删除​请求​并​返回​至主​菜单​。​数据​仍​完好无损​。\n"
"ni3 qu3xiao1 le5 shan1chu2 qing3qiu2 bing4 fan3hui2 zhi4 zhu3 cai4dan1。shu4ju4 reng2 wan2hao3wu2sun3。"

msgid "You cancel your auction posting and close the Aztechnology files."
msgstr ""
"你​取消​了​拍卖​，​并​关闭​了​阿兹特​科技​的​文件夹​。\n"
"ni3 qu3xiao1 le5 pai1mai4，bing4 guan1bi4 le5 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 wen2jian4jia1。"

msgid ""
"You cannot spend karma while in conversation. Try again when out of "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"对话​期间​无法​使用​业力​。​请​在​对话​结束​后​重试​。\n"
"dui4hua4 qi1jian1 wu2fa3 shi3yong4 ye4li4。qing3 zai4 dui4hua4 jie2shu4 hou4 chong2shi4。"

msgid "You change your mind?"
msgstr ""
"你​改变​主意​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You choke down a hot cup of bitter, low-grade soykaf. It tastes like an "
"unholy fusion of coffee grounds and bean curd."
msgstr ""
"你​硬生生​咽下​一杯​滚烫​的​劣质​豆​咖​，​那​滋味​如同​咖啡​渣​与​豆腐​的​邪恶​融合​。\n"
"ni3 ying4sheng1sheng1 yan4xia4 yi1 bei1 gun3tang4 de5 lie4zhi4 dou4 ka1，na4 zi1wei4 ru2tong2 ka1fei1 zha1 yu4 dou4fu5 de5 xie2e4 rong2he2。"

msgid ""
"You chose to leave town with nothing but a credstick, your wits, and your damaged reputation.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and your dog. He decided to stick around.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"One year later, you die in an alley. The official story is, \"Cram overdose.\" But what do those autopsy technicians know, anyways? Just a little huff every once in a while never hurt anybody. \n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and the rest of your team died trying to avenge Monika without you. Good job, hero."
msgstr ""
"你​选择​离开​这座​城市​，​只带​着​一根​信用​棒​、​你​的​智慧​和​你​那​狼藉​的​名声​。​除此之外​，​别无他物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​，​还有​你​的​狗​。​他​决定​跟着​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​一年​后​，​你​死​在​一条​小巷​里​。​官方​说法​是​“​用药​过量​”​。​但​那些​验尸官​懂个​屁​？​偶尔​吸点​超感​又​不会​害死​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​在​没有​你​的​情况​下​，​你​那​帮​队友​全都​死​在​了​为​莫妮卡​报仇​的​行动​中​。​干得​漂亮​，​大​英雄​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xuan3ze2 li2kai1 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4，zhi3 dai4 zhao2 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4、ni3 de5 zhi4hui4 he4 ni3 na4 lang2ji2 de5 ming2sheng1。chu2ci3zhi1wai4，bie2wu2ta1wu4。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"e2，hai2you3 ni3 de5 gou3。ta1 jue2ding4 gen1zhe5 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"yi1 nian2 hou4，ni3 si3 zai4 yi1 tiao2 xiao3xiang4 li3。guan1fang1 shuo1fa3 shi4“yong4 yao4 guo4liang4”。dan4 na4xie1 yan4shi1guan1 dong3 ge4 pi4？ou3er3 xi1 dian3 chao1 gan3 you4 bu4hui4 hai4si3 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，zai4 mei2you3 ni3 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4，ni3 na4 bang1 dui4you3 quan2dou1 si3 zai4 le5 wei2 Mo4ni1ka3 bao4chou2 de5 xing2dong4 zhong4。gan4 de2 piao4liang5，dai4 ying1xiong2。"

msgid ""
"You close your eyes and fill your mouth with syrupy liquor.\n"
"\n"
"The Mjød leaves a slug's trail of warmth behind as it sluices down your throat and into your gut."
msgstr ""
"你​闭上​双眼​，​让​甘醇​的​烈酒​充盈​口腔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​蜜酒​如​蛞蝓​般​拖​着​暖意​，​沿着​喉管​滑入​肠胃​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4shang5 shuang1yan3，rang4 gan1 chun2 de5 lie4jiu3 chong1ying2 kou3qiang1。\n"
"\n"
"mi4 jiu3 ru2 kuo4yu2 ban1 tuo1 zhao2 nuan3yi4，yan2zhe5 hou2guan3 hua2 ru4 chang2wei4。"

msgid ""
"You come to me begging for work, and then tell me that it's none of my "
"business? No, Blitz. You tell me why you need the money."
msgstr ""
"是​你​过来​求​我​要​份​工作​的​，​现在​又​说​这​和​我​没关系​？​布里​茨​，​赶紧​把​原因​告诉​我​。\n"
"shi4 ni3 guo4lai2 qiu2 wo3 yao4 fen4 gong1zuo4 de5，xian4zai4 you4 shuo1 zhe4 he4 wo3 mei2guan1xi5？Bu4li3ci2，gan3jin3 ba3 yuan2yin1 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "You consider yourself a man of discipline then?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​认为​自己​是​个​有​教养​的​人​了​？\n"
"na4 ni3 ren4wei2 zi4ji3 shi4 ge4 you3 jiao4yang3 de5 ren2 le5？"

msgid ""
"You copy the file.\n"
"\n"
"Easy money."
msgstr ""
"你​复制​了​文件​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这钱​不​挣白​不​挣​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fu4zhi4 le5 wen2jian4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 qian2 bu4 zheng4 bai2 bu4 zheng4。"

msgid "You copy the information on the screen, redactions and all."
msgstr ""
"你​将​屏幕​上​的​信息​连带​被​涂黑​的​字​段​一并​复制​完毕​。\n"
"ni3 jiang1 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 xin4xi1 lian2dai4 bei4 tu2 hei1 de5 zi4 duan4 yi1bing4 fu4zhi4 wan2bi4。"

msgid "You copy the information to your PDA and forward it on to Gunari."
msgstr ""
"你​将​信息​复制到​PDA​上​，​然后​转发给​了​古纳里​。\n"
"ni3 jiang1 xin4xi1 fu4 zhi4 dao4 PDA shang4，ran2hou4 zhuai3 fa1 gei3 le5 gu3 na4 li3。"

msgid ""
"You copy the records onto your PDA.\n"
"\n"
"The computer returns you to the menu screen."
msgstr ""
"你​将​记录​拷贝到​PDA​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​电脑​返回​到​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 ji4lu4 kao3 bei4 dao4 PDA shang4。\n"
"\n"
"dian4nao3 fan3hui2 dao4 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid ""
"You cough to clear your lungs of the soot and smoke that you inhaled in that Other Place, but to no avail.\n"
"\n"
"To your horror, you realize that the smoke is here, too. Feuerstelle is burning."
msgstr ""
"你​试图​咳出​在​异界​吸入​的​烟尘​，​但​无济于事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​更​可怕​的​是​，​你​发现​烟雾​已经​蔓延​至此​。​“​火坑​”​正在​燃烧​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4tu2 hai1 chu1 zai4 yi4 jie4 xi1ru4 de5 yan1chen2，dan4 wu2ji4yu2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"geng1 ke3pa4 de5 shi4，ni3 fa1xian4 yan1wu4 yi3jing1 man4yan2 zhi4ci3。“huo3keng1” zheng4zai4 ran2shao1。"

msgid ""
"You could almost swear that the response comes *before* you press the button"
" this time. It's uncanny."
msgstr ""
"你​几乎​可以​发誓​，​这次​对方​在​你​按​下​按钮​*​之前​*​就​回话​了​。​这挺​诡异​的​。\n"
"ni3 ji1hu1 ke3yi3 fa1shi4，zhe4 ci4 dui4fang1 zai4 ni3 an4 xia4 an4niu3*zhi1qian2*jiu4 hui2hua4 le5。zhe4 ting3 gui3yi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"You could always leave the building with me when I'm through here. In the "
"outside world, you'll have no trouble finding that last episode."
msgstr ""
"等​我们​完事​之后​，​你​可以​和​我​一起​离开​这座​大楼​。​在​外面​，​你​一定​能​轻松​找到​最后​一集​。\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 wan2shi4 zhi1hou4，ni3 ke3yi3 he4 wo3 yi1qi3 li2kai1 zhe4 zuo4 da4lou2。zai4 wai4mian4，ni3 yi1ding4 neng2 qing1song1 zhao3dao4 zui4hou4 yi1 ji2。"

msgid "You could always take the high road and let us go..."
msgstr ""
"你​大​可​高抬贵手​，​放​我们​一马​……\n"
"ni3 dai4 ke3 gao1tai2gui4shou3，fang4 wo3men5 yi1 ma3……"

msgid "You could come back to the Kreuzbasar with me. I'll keep you safe."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​跟​我​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​我会​护​你​周全​。\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 gen1 wo3 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。wo3 hui4 hu4 ni3 zhou1quan2。"

msgid ""
"You could have a peaceful life if you wanted it. Instead, you choose to run "
"the shadows. And people die."
msgstr ""
"如果​你们​愿意​的话​，​本​可以​过​着​平静​的​生活​。​但​你们​却​选择​在​暗影​中​奔波​生计​，​让​双手​染满​鲜血​。\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3men5 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，ben3 ke3yi3 guo4 zhao2 ping2jing4 de5 sheng1huo2。dan4 ni3men5 que4 xuan3ze2 zai4 an4ying3 zhong4 ben1bo1 sheng1ji4，rang4 shuang1shou3 ran3 man3 xian1xue4。"

msgid ""
"You could have a peaceful life if you wanted it. Instead, you choose to run the shadows. And people die.\n"
"\n"
"How many bodies have you put in the ground, $(l.name)? How many children have you orphaned to earn your pay? Have you lost count? I’ll bet that you have."
msgstr ""
"如果​你们​愿意​的话​，​本​可以​过​着​平静​的​生活​。​但​你们​却​选择​在​暗影​中​奔波​生计​，​让​双手​染满​鲜血​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​多少​人​因为​你​成​了​尸体​？​为了​赚钱​，​你​让​多少​孩子​成​了​孤儿​？​你​数得​过来​吗​？​我敢​打赌​，​你​已经​记不清​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3men5 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，ben3 ke3yi3 guo4 zhao2 ping2jing4 de5 sheng1huo2。dan4 ni3men5 que4 xuan3ze2 zai4 an4ying3 zhong4 ben1bo1 sheng1ji4，rang4 shuang1shou3 ran3 man3 xian1xue4。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，duo1shao3 ren2 yin1wei4 ni3 cheng2 le5 shi1ti3？wei4le5 zhuan4qian2，ni3 rang4 duo1shao3 hai2zi5 cheng2 le5 gu1er2？ni3 shu3 de2 guo4lai2 ma5？wo3 gan3 da3du3，ni3 yi3jing1 ji4 bu4 qing1 le5。"

msgid "You could make this place safe, Aleksi."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​让​这里​再度​变得​安全​，​阿莱克​西​。\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 rang4 zhe4li3 zai4du4 bian4de5 an1quan2，e1 lai2 ke4 xi1。"

msgid ""
"You could probably hack this security console to seize control of the "
"building's cameras... if you didn't already control them."
msgstr ""
"你​应该​可以​骇入​这台​安保​终端​来​控制​大楼​的​监控​摄像头​……​如果​你​还​没​掌控​它们​的话​。\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 ke3yi3 hai4 ru4 zhe4 tai2 an1bao3 zhong1duan1 lai2 kong4zhi4 da4lou2 de5 jian1kong4 she4xiang4tou2……ru2guo3 ni3 hai2 mei2 zhang3kong4 ta1men5 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"You could run and hide, you could go to ground, you could bury yourself in a mile of concrete. It would not matter.\n"
"\n"
"As long as Aztechnology can find a blood connection to their prey, they could target them. And it would be fatal."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​逃​到​天涯海角​，​你​可以​躲藏在​地下​深处​，​把​自己​埋​在​一英里​厚​的​混凝土​之下​。​这些​都​无济于事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​阿兹特​科技​能​找到​与​猎物​有​血缘关系​的​人​，​就​能​将​其​作为​目标​，​并且​一击​致命​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 tao2 dao4 tian1ya2hai3jiao3，ni3 ke3yi3 duo3 zang4 zai4 di4xia4 shen1chu4，ba3 zi4ji3 mai2 zai4 yi1 ying1 li3 hou4 de5 hun4ning2tu3 zhi1xia4。zhe4xie1 dou1 wu2ji4yu2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 neng2 zhao3dao4 yu4 lie4wu4 you3 xue4yuan2guan1xi4 de5 ren2，jiu4 neng2 jiang1 qi2 zuo4wei2 mu4biao1，bing4qie3 yi1 ji1 zhi4ming4。"

msgid "You could say that."
msgstr ""
"算是​吧​。\n"
"suan4shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You could say that.\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name), this is Bannik. He's a friend."
msgstr ""
"算是​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​这位​是​班尼克​，​我​的​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"suan4shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，zhe4wei4 shi4 ban1 ni2 ke4，wo3 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"You could try heading to the Kreuzbasar. I'm sure there's someone there who "
"could help you."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​试着​去一趟​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​那里​肯定​有​什么​人能​帮到​你​。\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 shi4zhe5 qu4 yi1 tang1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。na4li5 ken3ding4 you3 shen2me5 ren2 neng2 bang1 dao4 ni3。"

msgid "You couldn't anyway. Whatever this is, it's a part of me now."
msgstr ""
"本来​就是​啊​。​不管​这是​什么​，​它​现在​都​是​我​的​一部分​了​。\n"
"ben3lai2 jiu4shi4 a1。bu4guan3 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5，ta1 xian4zai4 dou1 shi4 wo3 de5 yi1bu4fen5 le5。"

msgid "You couldn't have known that. You were a kid."
msgstr ""
"你​当时​只是​个​孩子​，​不​可能​知道​这些​的​。\n"
"ni3 dang1shi2 zhi3shi4 ge4 hai2zi5，bu4 ke3neng2 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 de5。"

msgid ""
"You couldn't if you tried.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory begins to stalk toward Marta's position.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​就算​想拦​着​我​也​没用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​开始​向着​玛​尔塔​的​位置​走​去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4suan4 xiang3 lan2 zhao2 wo3 ye3 mei2yong4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 kai1shi3 xiang4zhe5 Ma3er3ta3 de5 wei4zhi5 zou3 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You depress the button in the security console. Suddenly, the air fills with a harsh rattling sound.\n"
"\n"
"The autoturrets in the corners of the room grind to life. They train themselves on the accountant."
msgstr ""
"你​按​下​安保​控制台​的​按钮​。​刹那间​，​周围​到处​是​刺耳​的​咔嗒​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​房间​各个​角落​的​自动​炮塔​吱呀​启动​，​枪口​齐刷刷​地​对准​了​会计师​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 an1bao3 kong4zhi4tai2 de5 an4niu3。cha4 na4 jian1，zhou1wei2 dao4chu4 shi4 ci4er3 de5 ka1da1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 ge4ge4 jiao3luo4 de5 zi4dong4 pao4ta3 zhi1ya1 qi3dong4，qiang1kou3 qi2shua1shua1 de5 dui4zhun3 le5 kuai4ji4shi1。"

msgid ""
"You depress the call button. A shrill buzzing sound fills the air.\n"
"\n"
"There is no answer."
msgstr ""
"你​按​下​呼叫​按钮​。​刺耳​的​嗡​鸣声​充斥​空气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无人​应答​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 hu1jiao4 an4niu3。ci4er3 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1 chong1chi4 kong1qi4。\n"
"\n"
"wu2ren2 ying4da2。"

msgid ""
"You depress the catch on the container's plastic lid. Rather than swinging open, the lid slides back to reveal a touchpad.\n"
"\n"
"Looks as though this thing is password locked."
msgstr ""
"你​按​下​容器​塑料盖​上​的​卡扣​。​盖子​并非​向外​翻开​，​而是​向​后​滑动​，​露出​一个​触控板​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​这​东西​是​密码​锁定​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 rong2qi4 su4 liao4 gai4 shang4 de5 qia3kou4。gai4zi5 bing4fei1 xiang4wai4 fan1kai1，er2shi4 xiang4 hou4 hua2dong4，lu4chu1 yi1ge5 chu4kong4ban3。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 zhe4 dong1xi1 shi4 mi4ma3 suo3ding4 de5。"

msgid ""
"You did NOT know my brother, shadowrunner. Do not presume to speak to me on his behalf.\n"
"\n"
"Hermie... Hermie would support me in this, if he knew what I know."
msgstr ""
"你​不​了解​我​弟弟​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​不要​擅自​代表​他来​和​我​说话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​……​如果​他​知道​了​我​所​知道​的​一切​，​他​也​会​支持​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 liao3jie3 wo3 di4di5，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。bu4yao4 shan4zi4 dai4biao3 ta1 lai2 he4 wo3 shuo1hua4。\n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3……ru2guo3 ta1 zhi1dao4 le5 wo3 suo3 zhi1dao4 de5 yi1qie4，ta1 ye3 hui4 zhi1chi2 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"You did a lot of terrible things here, too. If you can change, so can she."
msgstr ""
"你​也​在​这里​做过​很多​可怕​的​事情​。​如果​你​能​改变​，​那么​她​也​可以​。\n"
"ni3 ye3 zai4 zhe4li3 zuo4 guo4 hen3 duo1 ke3pa4 de5 shi4qing5。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 gai3bian4，na4me5 ta1 ye3 ke3yi3。"

msgid "You did do it, right? You burned thousands of people to death."
msgstr ""
"你​确实​这么​做​了​，​没错​吧​？​你​烧死​了​数以千计​的​人​。\n"
"ni3 que4shi2 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5，mei2cuo4 ba1？ni3 shao1si3 le5 shu4yi3qian1ji4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"You did good out there, defending the Kreuzbasar. You’ve had our backs the "
"entire way - made good decisions."
msgstr ""
"你​在​保卫​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​战斗​中​表现​很​出色​。​一路上​你​始终​守护​着​我们​，​做出​了​许多​明智​的​决定​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 bao3wei4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 zhan4dou4 zhong4 biao3xian4 hen3 chu1se4。yi1lu4shang4 ni3 shi3zhong1 shou3hu4 zhao2 wo3men5，zuo4chu1 le5 xu3duo1 ming2zhi4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"You did plant bugs, $(l.name). You saw the footage yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Your job was to plant the bugs. Jana's was to plant the bomb.\n"
"\n"
"But we can discuss all of this upon your return."
msgstr ""
"你​确实​安装​了​监控​，​$(l.name)​。​你​自己​也​看到​录像​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​任务​是​安装​监控​，​简娜​的​任务​才​是​安装​炸弹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我们​可以​等​你​回来​之后​再​讨论​这些​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4shi2 an1zhuang1 le5 jian1kong4，$(l.name)。ni3 zi4ji3 ye3 kan4dao4 lu4xiang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ren4wu5 shi4 an1zhuang1 jian1kong4，Jian3na4 de5 ren4wu5 cai2 shi4 an1zhuang1 zha4dan4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 deng3 ni3 hui2lai5 zhi1hou4 zai4 tao3lun4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"You did the right thing by smashing that console, $(l.name). Feuerschwinge is insane, and dangerous, and she's murdered thousands.\n"
"\n"
"I would’ve made the same call. "
msgstr ""
"你​砸坏​控制台​是​正确​的​，​$(l.name)​。​火翼​疯癫​又​危险​，​而且​还​杀害​了​成千上万​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​换作​是​我​也​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 za2huai4 kong4zhi4tai2 shi4 zheng4que4 de5，$(l.name)。Huo3yi4 feng1dian1 you4 wei1xian3，er2qie3 hai2 sha1hai4 le5 cheng2qian1shang4wan4 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"You did the right thing, $(l.name). She was insane and dangerous. \n"
"\n"
"I would’ve made the same call."
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​正确​的​事​，​$(l.name)​。​她​疯癫​又​危险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​换作​是​我​也​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 shi4，$(l.name)。ta1 feng1dian1 you4 wei1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"You did the right thing, $(l.name). She was insane and dangerous. I would’ve"
" made the same call."
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​正确​的​事​，​$(l.name)​。​她​疯癫​又​危险​，​换作​是​我​也​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 shi4，$(l.name)。ta1 feng1dian1 you4 wei1xian3，huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"You did the right thing, $(l.name). She was insane and dangerous. I would’ve"
" made the same call. "
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​正确​的​事​，​$(l.name)​。​她​疯癫​又​危险​，​换作​是​我​也​会​做出​同样​的​决定​。\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 shi4，$(l.name)。ta1 feng1dian1 you4 wei1xian3，huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 ye3 hui4 zuo4chu1 tong2yang4 de5 jue2ding4。"

msgid "You did the right thing. You saved lives."
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​正确​的​事​。​你​救​了​人命​。\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。ni3 jiu4 le5 ren2ming4。"

msgid "You did what the Adversary wanted you to do. Use your imagination."
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​反叛者​想​让​你​做​的​事​。​发挥​你​的​想象力​看看​。\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 fan3 pan4 zhe3 xiang3 rang4 ni3 zuo4 de5 shi4。fa1hui1 ni3 de5 xiang3xiang4li4 kan4kan5。"

msgid "You did what you could. We need to get out of here."
msgstr ""
"你​已经​尽力​了​，​我们​得​离开​这里​。\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 jin4li4 le5，wo3men5 de2 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid "You did what you did, Eiger. It isn't my place to judge."
msgstr ""
"事情​已经​是​这样​了​，​艾格尔​。​我​没有​权利​评判​你​。\n"
"shi4qing5 yi3jing1 shi4 zhe4yang4 le5，Ai4ge2er3。wo3 mei2you3 quan2li4 ping2pan4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You did what you had to do. I'm no stranger to that myself. I don't think "
"that anyone working in the shadows is."
msgstr ""
"你​只是​在​尽力​谋生​。​我​也​是​过来人​了​。​我​想​做​暗影​狂奔​者​的​人​对此​都​不​陌生​。\n"
"ni3 zhi3shi4 zai4 jin4li4 mou2sheng1。wo3 ye3 shi4 guo4lai2ren2 le5。wo3 xiang3 zuo4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 de5 ren2 dui4 ci3 dou1 bu4 mo4sheng1。"

msgid ""
"You did what you had to do. In your place, I'd probably have done the same."
msgstr ""
"你​也​是​迫不得已​。​换作​是​我​的话​，​可能​也​会​做​一样​的​事​。\n"
"ni3 ye3 shi4 po4bu4de2yi3。huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，ke3neng2 ye3 hui4 zuo4 yi1yang4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "You didn't bring the cyberware deactivator."
msgstr ""
"你​没有​携带​赛博​改造​限制器​。\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 xie2dai4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 xian4 zhi4 qi4。"

msgid "You didn't know, Jana. None of us did. This isn't on you."
msgstr ""
"你​又​不​知道​啊​，​简娜​。​我们​都​被​蒙在鼓里​。​这​不能​怪​你​。\n"
"ni3 you4 bu4 zhi1dao4 a1，Jian3na4。wo3men5 dou1 bei4 meng2zai4gu3li3。zhe4 bu4neng2 guai4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You didn't see what was happening to Monika. The IC that she hit... it had her doubled over backwards by the time we pulled the plug. If we hadn't been there, well...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Dietrich swallows hard and points at the twisted corpse on the floor.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​没​看见​莫妮卡​当时​怎么回事​。​她​碰上​的​那个​IC​……​我们​把​线​拔下来​的​时候​，​她​已经​朝​后仰​过去​了​。​要是​我们​没​在​的话​，​恐怕​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​艰难​地吞​了​口​唾沫​，​然后​指向​地上​那具​扭曲​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2 kan4jian4 Mo4ni1ka3 dang1shi2 zen3me5hui2shi4。ta1 peng4shang4 de5 na4ge5 IC……wo3men5 ba3 xian4 ba2 xia4 lai2 de5 shi2hou5，ta1 yi3jing1 chao2 hou4 yang3 guo4qu4 le5。yao4shi5 wo3men5 mei2 zai4 de5hua4，kong3pa4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 jian1nan2 de5 tun1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5，ran2hou4 zhi3xiang4 di4shang5 na4 ju4 niu3qu1 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "You didn’t bring it to her?"
msgstr ""
"你​没有​替​她​牵线​吗​？\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 ti4 ta1 qian1xian4 ma5？"

msgid "You died."
msgstr ""
"你​死​了​。\n"
"ni3 si3 le5。"

msgid "You died. Billy has claimed another victim."
msgstr ""
"你​死​了​。​比利​又​夺走​了​一名​受害者​的​性命​。\n"
"ni3 si3 le5。bi3li4 you4 duo2zou3 le5 yi1 ming2 shou4hai4zhe3 de5 xing4ming4。"

msgid "You disgust me, Enstad."
msgstr ""
"你​真够​变态​的​，​恩施​塔德​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1 gou4 bian4tai4 de5，en1Shi1ta3de2。"

msgid ""
"You do not know?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He blinks in confusion.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My brothers and I... we are grown here. Gestated in tanks to serve our purpose."
msgstr ""
"你​不​知道​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​困惑​地​眨​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​我​的​兄弟​们​……​在​此​成长​，​在​培养​槽​中​孕育​，​只​为​达成​使命​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kun4huo4 de5 zha3 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 wo3 de5 xiong1di4 men5……zai4 ci3 cheng2zhang3，zai4 pei2yang3 cao2 zhong4 yun4yu4，zhi3 wei2 da2cheng2 shi3ming4。"

msgid "You do that, Blitz. Good luck."
msgstr ""
"好​的​，​布里​茨​。​祝你好运​。\n"
"hao3 de5，Bu4li3ci2。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid "You do that, Phil! Make it happen! Their quest will pass into legend!"
msgstr ""
"你​去​做​吧​，​菲尔​！​让​它​成真​！​他们​的​冒险​将​成为​传奇​！\n"
"ni3 qu4 zuo4 ba1，fei1 er3！rang4 ta1 cheng2zhen1！ta1men5 de5 mao4xian3 jiang1 cheng2wei2 chuan2qi2！"

msgid ""
"You do that, and all is forgiven. We're golden.\n"
"\n"
"But if you don't, a *lot* of innocent people are going to get hurt."
msgstr ""
"你​做到​这些​事​的话​，​那​我们​就​原谅​你​。​互不​相欠​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​要是​你​不​做​，​*​很多​*​无辜​的​人​都​会​因此​受害​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuo4dao4 zhe4xie1 shi4 de5hua4，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 yuan2liang4 ni3。hu4 bu4 xiang1 qian4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 yao4shi5 ni3 bu4 zuo4，*hen3 duo1*wu2gu1 de5 ren2 dou1 hui4 yin1ci3 shou4hai4。"

msgid "You do that."
msgstr ""
"去​吧​。\n"
"qu4 ba1。"

msgid "You do that. In the meantime, I'm in."
msgstr ""
"交给​你​了​。​这活​我​接​了​。\n"
"jiao1gei3 ni3 le5。zhe4 huo2 wo3 jie1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You do, yes. But they are unsuitable for this job.\n"
"\n"
"Remember, this is a test of *your* abilities. Not Eiger's, or Glory's, or Dietrich's."
msgstr ""
"是​这样​，​但​他们​不​适合​这项​差事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​记住​，​这场​试炼​是​针对​*​你​的​*​能力​。​不是​艾格尔​，​不是​格洛丽​，​更​不是​迪​特里​希​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4，dan4 ta1men5 bu4 shi4he2 zhe4 xiang4 cha4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ji4zhu5，zhe4 chang2 shi4lian4 shi4 zhen1dui4*ni3 de5*neng2li4。bu4shi4 Ai4ge2er3，bu4shi4 Ge2luo4li2，geng1 bu4shi4 Di2te4li3xi1。"

msgid ""
"You do?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His expression brightens somewhat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, that's a relief. I mean, of course you do!"
msgstr ""
"是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​表情​轻松​了​一些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那就好​。​不过​这​也​是​应该​的​对​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 qing1song1 le5 yi1xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 hao3。bu4guo4 zhe4 ye3 shi4 ying1gai1 de5 dui4 ba1！"

msgid ""
"You don't believe what you're saying - I can see it in your eyes. But it's "
"true, Silke. You *can* leave if you want to."
msgstr ""
"我​从​你​眼神​里​看得出来​，​这话​你​自己​都​不信​。​但​你​没​说错​，​西​尔克​。​如果​你​真的​想​走​，​你​是​*​能​*​走​的​。\n"
"wo3 cong2 ni3 yan3shen2 li3 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2，zhe4 hua4 ni3 zi4ji3 dou1 bu4 xin4。dan4 ni3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4，Xi1er3ke4。ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3 zou3，ni3 shi4*neng2*zou3 de5。"

msgid "You don't even know the whole thing?"
msgstr ""
"你​都​不​知道​完整​的​密码​？\n"
"ni3 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 wan2zheng3 de5 mi4ma3？"

msgid "You don't frighten me, \"Monika.\""
msgstr ""
"你​吓不倒​我​，​“​莫妮卡​”​。\n"
"ni3 he4 bu4 dao3 wo3，“Mo4ni1ka3”。"

msgid "You don't frighten me, APEX."
msgstr ""
"你​吓不倒​我​，​APEX​。\n"
"ni3 he4 bu4 dao3 wo3，APEX。"

msgid "You don't frighten me, whatever you are."
msgstr ""
"不管​你​是​什么​，​都​吓不倒​我​。\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 shi4 shen2me5，dou1 he4 bu4 dao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"You don't get out much, do you?\n"
"\n"
"A BTL is a kind of simsense chip. Stands for \"better than life.\" They're cheap, easy to find, and incredibly addictive.\n"
"\n"
"People have died of dehydration while riding BTL highs... it's pretty common on the streets. They just stay plugged in until their bodies give out. Not a pretty way to go, believe me."
msgstr ""
"你​不怎么​出门​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​BTL​是​某种​拟感​芯片​，​全称​是​“​比​生活​更​美好​”​。​它们​价格低廉​，​随处可见​，​而且​成瘾性​极强​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​人们​因为​使用​BTL​过量​而​脱水​死亡​……​这种​情况​在​街头​相当​常见​。​它会​待​在​你​的​芯片​接口​里​，​直到​你​的​身体​无法​承受​。​相信​我​，​这​绝不​是​一种​体面​的​死法​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4zen3me5 chu1men2 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"BTL shi4 mou3zhong3 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4，quan2cheng1 shi4“bi3 sheng1huo2 geng1 mei3hao3”。ta1men5 jia4 ge2 di1 lian2，sui2chu4ke3jian4，er2qie3 cheng2yin3xing4 ji2 jiang4。\n"
"\n"
"ren2men5 yin1wei4 shi3yong4 BTL guo4liang4 er2 tuo1shui3 si3wang2……zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 zai4 jie1tou2 xiang1dang1 chang2jian4。ta1 hui4 dai1 zai4 ni3 de5 xin1pian4 jie1kou3 li3，zhi2dao4 ni3 de5 shen1ti3 wu2fa3 cheng2shou4。xiang1xin4 wo3，zhe4 jue2bu4 shi4 yi1zhong3 ti3mian4 de5 si3 fa3。"

msgid "You don't get to give me orders. I set you free, remember?"
msgstr ""
"你​无权​对​我​下​命令​。​是​我​释放​了​你​，​记得​吗​？\n"
"ni3 wu2quan2 dui4 wo3 xia4 ming4ling4。shi4 wo3 shi4fang4 le5 ni3，ji4de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You don't get to make that call. I have business inside, and that's where "
"I'm going. If you wanna try and stop me, be my guest."
msgstr ""
"这话​不由​你​说了算​。​我​有事​要​办​，​所以​我​必须​要​过去​。​如果​你​想​拦​我​，​尽管​试试​。\n"
"zhe4 hua4 bu4you2 ni3 shuo1le5suan4。wo3 you3shi4 yao4 ban4，suo3yi3 wo3 bi4xu1 yao4 guo4qu4。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 lan2 wo3，jin3guan3 shi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"You don't get to run from this. You've committed unspeakable acts, Spirit. Loathsome, unforgivable crimes.\n"
"\n"
"You have corrupted children. Turned them into killers. You've been a party to violence, torture, and the desecration of corpses.\n"
"\n"
"You've created monsters."
msgstr ""
"你​逃不掉​的​，​精魂​。​你​犯下​了​难以​言喻​的​罪行​。​令人厌恶​，​并且​不可​饶恕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​腐化​了​那些​孩子​，​将​他们​变成​杀人​凶手​。​你​参与​了​各种​暴力​、​酷刑​和​亵渎​尸体​的​行径​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​创造​了​一群​怪物​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tao2 bu4 diao4 de5，jing1hun2。ni3 fan4 xia4 le5 nan2yi3 yan2yu4 de5 zui4xing2。ling3 ren2 yan4 e4，bing4qie3 bu4ke3 rao2shu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fu3hua4 le5 na4Xie1hai2zi5，jiang1 ta1men5 bian4cheng2 sha1ren2 xiong1shou3。ni3 can1yu4 le5 ge4zhong3 bao4li4、ku4xing2 he4 xie4du2 shi1ti3 de5 xing2jing4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 chuang4zao4 le5 yi1 qun2 guai4wu5。"

msgid "You don't have people in the Kreuzbasar?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​没什么​人脉​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 mei2shen2me5 ren2mai4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You don't have to answer that. Of course you know.\n"
"\n"
"Monika died while you stood there and watched. This is all YOUR f--"
msgstr ""
"用不着​你​回答​。​你​当然​知道​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​就​这么​眼睁睁​地​看着​莫妮卡​死​在​你​面前​。​这​全都​是​你​的​错​—​—\n"
"\n"
"yong4bu5zhao2 ni3 hui2da2。ni3 dang1ran2 zhi1dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 zhe4me5 yan3zheng1zheng1 de5 kan4 zhao2 Mo4ni1ka3 si3 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2。zhe4 quan2dou1 shi4 ni3 de5 cuo4 — —"

msgid "You don't have to remind me. I helped you fight him off, remember?"
msgstr ""
"不用​你​来​提醒​我​。​是​我​帮​你​对付​他来​着​，​记得​吗​？\n"
"bu4yong4 ni3 lai2 ti2xing3 wo3。shi4 wo3 bang1 ni3 dui4fu5 ta1 lai2 zhao2，ji4de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You don't have to tell me how long it's been, old man. I've been working my "
"ass off to raise this money."
msgstr ""
"这​还​用​你​说​吗​，​老头子​。​都​是​我​在​东奔西跑​拼命​挣钱​。\n"
"zhe4 hai2 yong4 ni3 shuo1 ma5，lao3tou2zi5。dou1 shi4 wo3 zai4 dong1ben1xi1pao3 pin1ming4 zheng4qian2。"

msgid "You don't have to tell me twice!"
msgstr ""
"不用​你​说​！\n"
"bu4yong4 ni3 shuo1！"

msgid ""
"You don't intimidate us, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Even if you managed to kill us - a doubtful proposition at best - you'd destroy your own reputation in the process."
msgstr ""
"你​吓​不住​我们​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​首先​我​不​觉得​你​有​本事​杀掉​我们​，​但​即便​你​得手​，​也​会​让​你​自己​的​名誉​毁于一旦​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 he4 bu4zhu4 wo3men5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"shou3xian1 wo3 bu4 jue2de5 ni3 you3 ben3shi4 sha1diao4 wo3men5，dan4 ji2bian4 ni3 de2shou3，ye3 hui4 rang4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 ming2yu4 hui3yu2yi1dan4。"

msgid "You don't know the half of it."
msgstr ""
"远比​你​知道​的​要​多​。\n"
"yuan3 bi3 ni3 zhi1dao4 de5 yao4 duo1。"

msgid ""
"You don't know the half of it. But it isn't dangerous to you any more. I fixed it, understand?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gestures at the antique cyberware that riddles her body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's mostly gone now. The only person it can hurt is me, and only if I let it. So drop it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"你​根本​不​知道​是​怎么回事​。​但​它​对​你​不再​有​任何​危险​了​。​我​已经​解决​了​，​明白​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​指向​遍布​自己​全身​的​古旧​赛博​改造​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​大部分​都​消失​了​。​它​唯一​能​伤害​的​只有​我​自己​，​而且​必须​得到​我​的​允许​。​所以​你​就​别​纠结​这个​了​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 zhi1dao4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4。dan4 ta1 dui4 ni3 bu4zai4 you3 ren4he2 wei1xian3 le5。wo3 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 le5，ming2bai5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3xiang4 bian4bu4 zi4ji3 quan2shen1 de5 gu3jiu4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 da4bu4fen5 dou1 xiao1shi1 le5。ta1 wei2yi1 neng2 shang1hai4 de5 zhi3you3 wo3 zi4ji3，er2qie3 bi4xu1 de2dao4 wo3 de5 yun3xu3。suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 bie4 jiu1jie2 zhe4ge5 le5，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"You don't know the half of it. But it isn't dangerous to you anymore. I fixed it, understand?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She gestures at the antique cyberware that riddles her body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's mostly gone now. The only person it can hurt is me, and only if I let it. So drop it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"你​根本​不​知道​是​怎么回事​。​但​它​对​你​不再​有​任何​危险​了​。​我​已经​解决​了​，​明白​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​指向​遍布​自己​全身​的​古旧​赛博​改造​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​大部分​都​消失​了​。​它​唯一​能​伤害​的​只有​我​自己​，​而且​必须​得到​我​的​允许​。​所以​你​就​别​纠结​这个​了​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 zhi1dao4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4。dan4 ta1 dui4 ni3 bu4zai4 you3 ren4he2 wei1xian3 le5。wo3 yi3jing1 jie3jue2 le5，ming2bai5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3xiang4 bian4bu4 zi4ji3 quan2shen1 de5 gu3jiu4 sai4bo2 gai3zao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 da4bu4fen5 dou1 xiao1shi1 le5。ta1 wei2yi1 neng2 shang1hai4 de5 zhi3you3 wo3 zi4ji3，er2qie3 bi4xu1 de2dao4 wo3 de5 yun3xu3。suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4 bie4 jiu1jie2 zhe4ge5 le5，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"You don't know what you're holding, slag.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He spits the words out like venom. His eyes are locked on the chip in Eiger's hand. Slowly, he licks his lips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't deserve to *touch* that chip."
msgstr ""
"你​不​知道​你​手里​的​是​什么​，​贱人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​恶狠狠​地吐出​这些​话语​。​他​的​眼睛​死死​盯​着​艾格尔​手中​的​芯片​，​缓慢​舔着​嘴唇​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不配​*​触碰​*​那​块​芯片​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 shou3li3 de5 shi4 shen2me5，jian4ren2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 e4hen3hen3 de5 tu3 chu1 zhe4xie1 hua4yu3。ta1 de5 yan3jing5 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 Ai4ge2er3 shou3 zhong4 de5 xin1pian4，huan3man4 tian3 zhao2 zui3chun2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 pei4*chu4peng4*na4 kuai4 xin1pian4。"

msgid ""
"You don't know what you're talking about, chief. You've never even *met* "
"her."
msgstr ""
"你​根本​不​知道​你​在​说​什么​，​头儿​。​你​从来​没​*​见过​*​她​。\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5，tou2r5。ni3 cong2lai2 mei2*jian4 guo4*ta1。"

msgid "You don't know what you've done..."
msgstr ""
"你​不​知道​你​干​了​什么​……\n"
"ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 gan4 le5 shen2me5……"

msgid "You don't know, do you?"
msgstr ""
"你​根本​不​知道​里面​有​什么​，​对​不​对​？\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 zhi1dao4 li3mian4 you3 shen2me5，dui4 bu4 dui4？"

msgid "You don't look much like a dragon."
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​不​像是​巨龙​。\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 shi4 ju4long2。"

msgid "You don't look so good."
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​不太好​。\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 bu4tai4hao3。"

msgid "You don't look too good."
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​不太好​。\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 bu4tai4hao3。"

msgid "You don't mess with the Azzies, Blitz. *Everyone* knows that."
msgstr ""
"布里​茨​，​不要​招惹​阿兹佬​。​*​每个​人​*​都​知道​这​一点​。\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，bu4yao4 zhao1re3 e1 zi1 lao3。*mei3ge4 ren2*dou1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to answer that. What you do need to do is make a choice: do you want to apologize and buy something? Or do you want to haul your ass down the street, around the corner, and out of my sight?\n"
"\n"
"From where I stand, there's only one right choice to make. But hey, it's a free city, you can do what you want."
msgstr ""
"你​不​需要​回答​这个​问题​。​你​只​需要​做出​选择​：​是​想​道歉​并​买​东西​？​还是​想​赶紧​滚回​街上​，​离开​我​的​视线​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​在我看来​，​正确​的​选择​只有​一个​。​但​这里​毕竟​是​个​自由​的​城市​，​你​可以​做​你​想​做​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 hui2da2 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。ni3 zhi3 xu1yao4 zuo4chu1 xuan3ze2：shi4 xiang3 dao4qian4 bing4 mai3 dong1xi1？hai2shi5 xiang3 gan3jin3 gun3 hui2 jie1shang5，li2kai1 wo3 de5 shi4xian4？\n"
"\n"
"zai4wo3kan4lai2，zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2 zhi3you3 yi1ge5。dan4 zhe4li3 bi4jing4 shi4 ge4 zi4you2 de5 cheng2shi4，ni3 ke3yi3 zuo4 ni3 xiang3 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to be.\n"
"\n"
"All that you'll need is a competent decker."
msgstr ""
"不​需要​你​亲自​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​有​一名​靠​谱​的​碟​客​就​可以​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 xu1yao4 ni3 qin1zi4 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 you3 yi1 ming2 kao4 pu3 de5 die2 ke4 jiu4 ke3yi3。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to be.\n"
"\n"
"You just need to be a competent decker. Which I'm told you are."
msgstr ""
"不​需要​你​亲自​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​有​一名​靠​谱​的​碟​客​就​可以​。​我​听说​你​自己​就是​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 xu1yao4 ni3 qin1zi4 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 you3 yi1 ming2 kao4 pu3 de5 die2 ke4 jiu4 ke3yi3。wo3 ting1shuo1 ni3 zi4ji3 jiu4shi4。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to be. There's nothing wrong with my self-control.\n"
"\n"
"I made a *choice* to unload on Yuli because he was a murderous asshole. I knew how much pressure to apply, which bones to break, and which ones to leave alone. And I did all of those things."
msgstr ""
"没有​那个​必要​。​我​的​自控​能力​没有​任何​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​之所以​*​选择​*​揍​尤里​一顿​，​是因为​他​就是​个​杀人不眨眼​的​畜生​。​我​知道​应该​用多大​的​力道​，​哪里​能下​重手​，​哪里​又​该​收着​点力​，​而​我​也​确实​做到​了​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 na4ge5 bi4yao4。wo3 de5 zi4kong4 neng2li4 mei2you3 ren4he2 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1suo3yi3*xuan3ze2*zou4 You2li3 yi1 dun4，shi4 yin1 wei2 ta1 jiu4shi4 ge4 sha1ren2bu4zha3yan3 de5 chu4sheng5。wo3 zhi1dao4 ying1gai1 yong4 duo1 dai4 de5 li4dao4，na3li3 neng2 xia4 chong2 shou3，na3li3 you4 gai1 shou1 zhao2 dian3 li4，er2 wo3 ye3 que4shi2 zuo4dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to put a name to your friend. Give him or her an alias, if you wish.\n"
"\n"
"But tell me the story, so that I might better guide you on the road ahead."
msgstr ""
"你​不​需要​透露​你​朋友​的​真实​姓名​。​提到​对方​的​时候​用​化名​便​可​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​请​告诉​我​故事​的​来龙去脉​，​这样​我​才能​更好​地​指引​你​前行​的​道路​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 tou4lu4 ni3 peng2you5 de5 zhen1shi2 xing4ming2。ti2dao4 dui4fang1 de5 shi2hou5 yong4 hua4ming2 bian4 ke3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 qing3 gao4su4 wo3 gu4shi4 de5 lai2long2qu4mai4，zhe4yang4 wo3 cai2neng2 geng1 hao3 de5 zhi3yin3 ni3 qian2xing2 de5 dao4lu4。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to say anything that you don't want to, but if you ever want "
"to talk, you know where to find me."
msgstr ""
"你​不想​说​的话​就​不要​勉强​自己​。​但​如果​你​什么​时候​想​说​了​，​欢迎​随时​来​找​我​。\n"
"ni3 bu4xiang3 shuo1 de5hua4 jiu4 bu4yao4 mian3qiang3 zi4ji3。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 shen2me5 shi2hou5 xiang3 shuo1 le5，huan1ying2 sui2shi2 lai2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to tell me what Harrow says, dear heart. I'm the one who brought you here, remember?\n"
"\n"
"You were nothing before I found you."
msgstr ""
"你​不​需要​向​我​重复​哈罗​的话​，​亲爱​的​。​是​我​把​你​带到​这里​的​，​记得​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我​找到​你​之前​，​你​什么​都​不是​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 xiang4 wo3 chong2fu4 ha1luo2 de5hua4，qin1ai4 de5。shi4 wo3 ba3 ni3 dai4 dao4 zhe4li3 de5，ji4de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 zhao3dao4 ni3 zhi1qian2，ni3 shen2me5 dou1 bu4shi4。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to worry about me, $(l.name). I've never let my own baggage "
"blow a run before, and I'm not about to start now."
msgstr ""
"没​必要​担心​我​，​$(l.name)​。​我​从​不会​让​自己​的​问题​影响​到​行动​，​以后​也​是​如此​。\n"
"mei2 bi4yao4 dan1xin1 wo3，$(l.name)。wo3 cong2 bu4hui4 rang4 zi4ji3 de5 wen4ti2 ying3xiang3 dao4 xing2dong4，yi3hou4 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。"

msgid "You don't need to worry about me."
msgstr ""
"你​不​需要​担心​我​。\n"
"ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 dan1xin1 wo3。"

msgid ""
"You don't need to worry about that. I won't try to read your aura again any "
"time soon."
msgstr ""
"你​不用​担心​这个​。​我​不会​再​尝试​阅读​你​的​灵光​了​。\n"
"ni3 bu4yong4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5。wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 chang2shi4 yue4du2 ni3 de5 ling2guang1 le5。"

msgid "You don't need to worry. It won't happen again."
msgstr ""
"不用​担心​。​不会​再​发生​这种​事​了​。\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1。bu4hui4 zai4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4 le5。"

msgid "You don't owe me anything."
msgstr ""
"你​不​欠​我​什么​。\n"
"ni3 bu4 qian4 wo3 shen2me5。"

msgid "You don't say."
msgstr ""
"想​也​知道​。\n"
"xiang3 ye3 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "You don't say?"
msgstr ""
"你​以为​呢​？\n"
"ni3 yi3wei2 ni2？"

msgid "You don't scare me, blood mage."
msgstr ""
"你​吓​不住​我​，​血​法师​。\n"
"ni3 he4 bu4zhu4 wo3，xie3 fa3shi1。"

msgid "You don't seem to be overly fond of this Dr. Ezkibel."
msgstr ""
"你​好像​不怎么​喜欢​这位​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​。\n"
"ni3 hao3xiang4 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 zhe4wei4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1。"

msgid "You don't seem too worried though."
msgstr ""
"但​你​看起来​不是​很​担心​。\n"
"dan4 ni3 kan4qi3lai5 bu4shi4 hen3 dan1xin1。"

msgid ""
"You don't talk to me. Talk to Frank. He's in the back. VIP Lounge.\n"
"\n"
"Now, you want somethin' from the bar? Or were you just here to chat?"
msgstr ""
"别问​我​。​跟​弗兰克​讲去​。​他​在​后边​的​VIP​大厅​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​是​想​点些​什么​，​还是​单纯​来​扯皮​的​？\n"
"\n"
"bie4 wen4 wo3。gen1 fu2lan2ke4 jiang3 qu4。ta1 zai4 hou4bian5 de5 VIP da4ting1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 shi4 xiang3 dian3 xie1 shen2me5，hai2shi5 dan1chun2 lai2 che3pi2 de5？"

msgid "You don't understand. I've never met a new person before."
msgstr ""
"你​不​明白​。​我​从来​都​没​遇到​过​新人​。\n"
"ni3 bu4 ming2bai5。wo3 cong2lai2 dou1 mei2 yu4dao4 guo4 xin1ren2。"

msgid ""
"You don't want to do that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory looks deep into the initiate's eyes, transfixing him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're not here to hurt you."
msgstr ""
"你​最好​别​那么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​死死​盯​着​学徒​的​眼睛​，​使​他​动弹不得​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不是​来​伤害​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zui4hao3 bie4 na4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 xue2tu2 de5 yan3jing5，shi3 ta1 dong4tan5bu5de2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4shi4 lai2 shang1hai4 ni3 de5。"

msgid "You don't want to get on my bad side, Hasenkamp."
msgstr ""
"你​可别​把​我​惹​毛​了​，​哈森​坎普​。\n"
"ni3 ke3 bie4 ba3 wo3 re3 mao2 le5，Ha1sen1kan3pu3。"

msgid ""
"You don’t burn a city and call it a \"sacrifice.\" You call it what it is: "
"mass murder."
msgstr ""
"焚毁​一座​城市​根本​不是​什么​“​牺牲​”​。​你​应该​说​这​是​大规模​的​屠杀​。\n"
"fen2hui3 yi1 zuo4 cheng2shi4 gen1ben3 bu4shi4 shen2me5“xi1sheng1”。ni3 ying1gai1 shuo1 zhe4 shi4 da4gui1mo2 de5 tu2sha1。"

msgid "You don’t buy that?"
msgstr ""
"你​不​相信​吗​？\n"
"ni3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You don’t have to add to his loss, Doctor. This doesn’t need to continue."
msgstr ""
"博士​，​你​不必​让​他​死​后​还要​承受​这些​。​不要​继续下去​了​。\n"
"bo2shi4，ni3 bu4bi4 rang4 ta1 si3 hou4 hai2 yao4 cheng2shou4 zhe4xie1。bu4yao4 ji4 xu4 xia4 qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You don’t win in this business. You survive. That’s all a runner can hope "
"for. All you can expect. "
msgstr ""
"在​这​一行​里​没有​所谓​的​赢家​。​你​只是​侥幸​活​了​下来​。​作为​狂奔​者​，​你​能​指望​的​仅此而已​。\n"
"zai4 zhe4 yi1xing2 li3 mei2you3 suo3wei4 de5 ying2jia1。ni3 zhi3shi4 jiao3xing4 huo2 le5 xia4lai5。zuo4wei2 kuang2Ben1zhe3，ni3 neng2 zhi3wang4 de5 jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"You download a file containing the recruits' numeric keycodes along with the"
" door code to your PDA."
msgstr ""
"你​把​新​成员​的​个人​密钥​和​门禁​密码​都​下载​到​PDA​上​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 xin1 cheng2yuan2 de5 ge4ren2 mi4yao4 he4 men2jin4 mi4ma3 dou1 xia4zai3 dao4 PDA shang4。"

msgid ""
"You download the episode to Phil's media center and power down the machine."
msgstr ""
"你​将​那​一集​下载​到​菲尔​的​媒体库​，​然后​关闭​了​机器​。\n"
"ni3 jiang1 na4 yi1 ji2 xia4zai3 dao4 fei1 er3 de5 mei2 ti3 ku4，ran2hou4 guan1bi4 le5 ji1qi4。"

msgid ""
"You download the list to your PDA. There are quite a few well-known names on"
" here, including a billionaire philanthropist and a children's trideo show "
"host."
msgstr ""
"你​将​名单​下载​到​PDA​上​。​名单​上​有​不少​知名人士​，​包括​一位​亿万富翁​慈善家​和​一位​面向​儿童​的​3D​影像​节目​主持人​。\n"
"ni3 jiang1 ming2dan1 xia4zai3 dao4 PDA shang4。ming2dan1 shang4 you3 bu4shao3 zhi1ming2ren2shi4，bao1kuo4 yi1 wei4 yi4wan4fu4weng1 ci2shan4jia1 he4 yi1 wei4 mian4xiang4 er2tong2 de5 3D ying3xiang4 jie2mu4 zhu3chi2ren2。"

msgid ""
"You duck out of sight just as the door slides open.\n"
"\n"
"A disheveled-looking young man steps blinking into the hallway, then turns away from you. He stumbles away, yawning."
msgstr ""
"就​在​门​打开​的​一瞬间​，​你​闪身​避开​了​对方​的​视线​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​衣衫不整​的​年轻人​眨​着​眼睛​走进​走廊​，​然后​转身​离​你​远去​。​他​打着​哈欠​，​跌跌撞撞​地​离开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 men2 da3kai1 de5 yi1shun4jian1，ni3 shan3shen1 bi4kai1 le5 dui4fang1 de5 shi4xian4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 yi1 shan1 bu4 zheng3 de5 nian2qing1ren2 zha3 zhao2 yan3jing5 zou3jin4 zou3lang2，ran2hou4 zhuan3shen1 li2 ni3 yuan3 qu4。ta1 da3 zhao2 ha1qian5，die1die5zhuang4zhuang4 de5 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You easily pry the metal casing away from the wall, exposing a mess of wires and circuitry. After a quick inspection, it becomes clear that this elevator is wired to operate around a control chip. The chip is missing, and it looks as though a power coupling has been yanked alongside it.\n"
"\n"
"Without these components, there is no way for this elevator to function."
msgstr ""
"你​轻松​地​将​金属外壳​从​墙上​撬开​，​露出​一团​乱糟糟​的​电线​和​电路​。​经过​简单​检查​后​，​你​发现​这部​电梯​的​运作​显然​依赖于​一块​控制​芯片​。​芯片​已经​丢失​，​看起来​还有​一个​电源​耦合​器​也​被​一起​拔​走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​这些​部件​，​这部​电梯​就​无法​运作​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 qing1song1 de5 jiang1 jin1 shu3 wai4 ke2 cong2 qiang2 shang4 qiao4kai1，lu4chu1 yi1 tuan2 luan4zao1zao1 de5 dian4xian4 he4 dian4lu4。jing1guo4 jian3dan1 jian3cha2 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 zhe4 bu4 dian4ti1 de5 yun4zuo4 xian3ran2 yi1 lai4 yu2 yi1kuai4 kong4zhi4 xin1pian4。xin1pian4 yi3jing1 diu1shi1，kan4qi3lai5 hai2you3 yi1ge5 dian4yuan2 ou3he2 qi4 ye3 bei4 yi1qi3 ba2 zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 zhe4xie1 bu4jian4，zhe4 bu4 dian4ti1 jiu4 wu2fa3 yun4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"You easily pry the metal casing away from the wall, exposing a mess of wires"
" and circuitry. When you slot the control chip and the power coupling into "
"place, the system immediately hums to life. The control panel's LCD screen "
"flickers, cycling through a variety of symbols before finally displaying the"
" word \"ONLINE\" in warm green letters."
msgstr ""
"你​轻松​地​将​金属外壳​从​墙上​撬开​，​露出​一团​乱糟糟​的​电线​和​电路​。​当​你​将​控制​芯片​和​电源​耦合​器​插入​到位​后​，​系统​立刻​启动​了​。​控制面板​的​液晶​显示屏​开始​闪烁​，​轮番​显示​各种​符号​，​最后​以​温暖​的​绿色​字母​显示​出​“​在线​”​。\n"
"ni3 qing1song1 de5 jiang1 jin1 shu3 wai4 ke2 cong2 qiang2 shang4 qiao4kai1，lu4chu1 yi1 tuan2 luan4zao1zao1 de5 dian4xian4 he4 dian4lu4。dang1 ni3 jiang1 kong4zhi4 xin1pian4 he4 dian4yuan2 ou3he2 qi4 cha1ru4 dao4wei4 hou4，xi4tong3 li4ke4 qi3dong4 le5。kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 de5 ye4jing1 xian3shi4ping2 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4，lun2fan1 xian3shi4 ge4zhong3 fu2hao4，zui4hou4 yi3 wen1nuan3 de5 lu:4se4 zi4mu3 xian3shi4 chu1“zai4xian4”。"

msgid ""
"You emerge from the U-Bahn station and out onto the familiar streets of the Kreuzbasar. The  energy here is a stark contrast to the weary, slowly-drowning mood of Gesundbrunnen. The Kreuzberg is an island of hope, afloat still amidst the dangerous currents of the Flux State. But it wouldn’t take much for it to capsize.\n"
"\n"
"It’s time to find Gunari and tell him the news."
msgstr ""
"你​走出​地铁站​，​回到​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​熟悉​的​街道​。​这里​洋溢着​的​活力​，​与​健康​泉​那​疲惫​的​、​仿佛​正​缓缓​沉沦​的​氛围​形成​了​鲜明对比​。​克罗伊​茨​贝格​是​一座​希望​之​岛​，​但​它​仍然​漂浮​在​动荡​带​的​危险​激流​之中​。​稍有不慎​，​它​便​会​倾覆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​时候​去​找​古纳里​，​把​事情​的​结果​告诉​他​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3chu1 di4tie3zhan4，hui2dao4 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 shu2xi1 de5 jie1dao4。zhe4li3 yang2 yi4 zhao2 de5 huo2li4，yu4 jian4kang1 quan2 na4 pi2bei4 de5、fang3fu2 zheng1 huan3huan3 chen2lun2 de5 fen1wei2 xing2cheng2 le5 xian1 ming2 dui4 bi3。ke4 luo2 yi1 ci2 bei4 ge2 shi4 yi1 zuo4 xi1wang4 zhi1 dao3，dan4 ta1 reng2ran2 piao1fu2 zai4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 wei1xian3 ji1liu2 zhi1zhong1。shao1 you3 bu4 shen4，ta1 bian4 hui4 qing1fu4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 qu4 zhao3 gu3 na4 li3，ba3 shi4qing5 de5 jie1guo3 gao4su4 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You emerge from the foulness of the sewers only to be met with the equally dark stench of cordite and death. Although you’ve saved the kiez, it is far from unharmed. Residents wander the streets dazed, holding their wounds, tending to others, observing the damage. The look in their eyes tells the story - their illusion of safety has been shattered.\n"
"\n"
"You enter Paul Amsel’s trade emporium already knowing what you’ll find there. The knowledge doesn’t make the discovery any easier. "
msgstr ""
"你​刚​从​污秽​的​下水道​中​钻出来​，​迎面​便​扑​来​同样​浓烈​的​火药​气味​与​死亡​的​恶臭​。​尽管​你​拯救​了​这个​街区​，​但​它​远非​安然无恙​。​居民​们​茫然​地​在​街道​上​游荡​，​有人​捂着​伤口​，​有人​照料​他人​，​还有​人​凝视着​满目疮痍​的​景象​。​他们​眼中​的​神情​已​说明​了​一切​—​—​他们​对​安全​的​幻想​已然​破灭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​走进​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​的​贸易​行时​，​你​早已​预感​到​自己​会​看到​什么​，​但​这​并​没能​让你在​发现​真相​后​好受​多少​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1 cong2 wu1hui4 de5 xia4shui3dao4 zhong4 zuan1 chu1 lai2，ying2mian4 bian4 pu1 lai2 tong2yang4 nong2lie4 de5 huo3yao4 qi4wei4 yu4 si3wang2 de5 e4chou4。jin3guan3 ni3 zheng3jiu4 le5 zhe4ge5 jie1qu1，dan4 ta1 yuan3 fei1 an1ran2wu2yang4。ju1min2 men5 mang2ran2 de5 zai4 jie1dao4 shang4 you2dang4，you3ren2 wu3 zhao2 shang1kou3，you3ren2 zhao4liao4 ta1ren2，hai2you3 ren2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 man3mu4chuang1yi2 de5 jing3xiang4。ta1men5 yan3zhong1 de5 shen2qing2 yi3 shuo1ming2 le5 yi1qie4——ta1men5 dui4 an1quan2 de5 huan4xiang3 yi3ran2 po4mie4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 de5 mao4yi4 xing2 shi2，ni3 zao3yi3 yu4gan3 dao4 zi4ji3 hui4 kan4dao4 shen2me5，dan4 zhe4 bing4 mei2 neng2 rang4 ni3 zai4 fa1xian4 zhen1xiang4 hou4 hao3shou4 duo1shao3。"

msgid ""
"You enter the room to find your team preparing in relative silence. Their "
"expressions are grim."
msgstr ""
"你​走进​房间​，​发现​队员​们​正在​安静​地​做​准备​。​他们​个个​神情​凝重​。\n"
"ni3 zou3jin4 fang2jian1，fa1xian4 dui4yuan2 men5 zheng4zai4 an1jing4 de5 zuo4 zhun3bei4。ta1men5 ge4ge4 shen2qing2 ning2zhong4。"

msgid ""
"You enter the room to find your team preparing. Their faces are grim.\n"
"\n"
"Eiger looks up and locks eyes with you. Without looking away, she addresses the rest of the team."
msgstr ""
"你​走进​房间​，​发现​队员​们​正在​做​准备​。​他们​个个​神情​凝重​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​抬头​与​你​四目​相对​。​她​没有​移开​视线​，​直接​对​其他​队员​说道​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3jin4 fang2jian1，fa1xian4 dui4yuan2 men5 zheng4zai4 zuo4 zhun3bei4。ta1men5 ge4ge4 shen2qing2 ning2zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 tai2tou2 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。ta1 mei2you3 yi2kai1 shi4xian4，zhi2jie1 dui4 qi2ta1 dui4yuan2 shuo1dao4。"

msgid ""
"You ever heard of the Masons? The Knights Templar? The Bavarian Illuminati?\n"
"\n"
"They were all puppets of the Black Lodge. None of 'em knew who they were working for, but the Lodge was there, pulling the strings. They always have been, and they still are today.\n"
"\n"
"That's the story."
msgstr ""
"你​有没有​听说​过​共济会​？​圣殿​骑士团​？​巴伐利亚​光明​会​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​都​只是​“​黑​结社​”​的​傀儡​。​这些​家伙​压根​不​知道​自己​是​在​为​谁​工作​，​但​“​结社​”​自始至终​都​在​幕后​掌控​着​一切​，​时至今日​依然​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 ting1shuo1 guo4 gong4ji4hui4？sheng4dian4 ji4 shi4 tuan2？ba1fa2li4ya4 guang1ming2 hui4？\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 dou1 zhi3shi4“hei1 jie2she4” de5 kui3lei3。zhe4xie1 jia1huo5 ya4gen1 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 shi4 zai4 wei2 shei2 gong1zuo4，dan4“jie2she4” zi4shi3zhi4zhong1 dou1 zai4 mu4hou4 zhang3kong4 zhao2 yi1qie4，shi2zhi4jin1ri4 yi1ran2 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"You exit the clean-room to find yourself at the threshold of a vast underground chamber. If the abandoned facility that you just fought through was purgatory, then you now stand at the gateway to hell. The heat emanating from ahead hits you like a hammer - the smell of sulphur and ozone is enough to make your lunch want to find somewhere to hide.\n"
"\n"
"Above the noise created by the whir of turbines, you can hear the deep rumble of something feral waking up. Something very, very big. \n"
"\n"
"You check your weapons and step into the vast chamber."
msgstr ""
"你​走出​消毒室​，​发现自己​站​在​一个​巨大​的​地下​洞室​门口​。​如果说​你​刚刚​奋力​穿过​的​废弃​设施​是​炼狱​，​那么​你​如今​就​站​在​通往​地狱​的​门口​。​前方​涌来​的​热浪​如​锤击​般​扑面而来​—​—​硫磺​与​臭氧​的​气味​足以​让​你​把​午餐​一股脑​全部​吐个​干净​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​涡轮机​轰鸣​的​喧嚣​之上​，​你​能​听见​某种​野性​生物​苏醒​的​低沉​咆哮​。​那​东西​一定​庞大​得​超乎​想象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​检查​了​武器​，​然后​走进​了​巨大​的​洞室​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3chu1 xiao1 du2 shi4，fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 zhan4 zai4 yi1ge5 ju4da4 de5 di4xia4 dong4 shi4 men2kou3。ru2guo3shuo1 ni3 gang1gang5 fen4li4 chuan1guo4 de5 fei4qi4 she4shi1 shi4 lian4yu4，na4me5 ni3 ru2jin1 jiu4 zhan4 zai4 tong1wang3 di4yu4 de5 men2kou3。qian2fang1 yong3 lai2 de5 re4lang4 ru2 chui2 ji1 ban1 pu1mian4er2lai2——liu2huang2 yu4 chou4yang3 de5 qi4wei4 zu2yi3 rang4 ni3 ba3 wu3can1 yi1gu3nao3 quan2bu4 tu3 ge4 gan1jing4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 guo1 lun2 ji1 hong1ming2 de5 xuan1xiao1 zhi1shang4，ni3 neng2 ting1jian4 mou3zhong3 ye3xing4 sheng1wu4 su1xing3 de5 di1chen2 pao2xiao4。na4 dong1xi1 yi1ding4 pang2da4 de2 chao1 hu1 xiang3xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jian3cha2 le5 wu3qi4，ran2hou4 zou3jin4 le5 ju4da4 de5 dong4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"You extend a tendril of your aura into the astral plane and probe the rock, feeling for fracture points that may exist outside of the material plane. \n"
"\n"
"The rock glows warmly as you manage to separate two pieces from the rest. Each is infused with the Elemental Power of Earth."
msgstr ""
"你​将​自身​灵光​的​触须​延伸​至星界​位面​，​探查​岩石​，​寻找​可能​存在​于​物质​位面​之外​的​裂缝​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​岩石​发出​温暖​的​光​。​你​成功​将​两块​岩石​与​其余部分​分离​，​每块​岩石​都​蕴含着​大地​元素​之力​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 zi4shen1 ling2guang1 de5 chu4xu1 yan2shen1 zhi4 xing1 jie4 wei4mian4，tan4cha2 yan2shi2，xun2zhao3 ke3neng2 cun2zai4 yu2 wu4zhi4 wei4mian4 zhi1wai4 de5 lie4feng4。\n"
"\n"
"yan2shi2 fa1chu1 wen1nuan3 de5 guang1。ni3 cheng2gong1 jiang1 liang3 kuai4 yan2shi2 yu4 qi2 yu2 bu4 fen4 fen1li2，mei3 kuai4 yan2shi2 dou1 yun4 han2 zhao2 da4di4 yuan2su4 zhi1 li4。"

msgid ""
"You feel a strange tickling sensation in your spine, coupled with a gnawing sense of unease.\n"
"\n"
"The MKVI stands at the ready, its crushing hands flexing in anticipation. Slaved to your command."
msgstr ""
"你​感觉​脊柱​发痒​，​还​伴随​着​令人不安​的​焦灼​感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​MKVI​已​严阵以待​，​那双​碾压​万物​的​巨掌​正因​期待​而​不断​蠕动​。​它​只​听从​你​的​命令​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gan3jue2 ji3zhu4 fa1yang3，hai2 ban4sui2 zhao2 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 jiao1zhuo2 gan3。\n"
"\n"
"MKVI yi3 yan2 zhen4 yi3 dai1，na4 shuang1 nian3ya1 wan4wu4 de5 ju4 zhang3 zheng1 yin1 qi1dai4 er2 bu4duan4 ru2dong4。ta1 zhi3 ting1cong2 ni3 de5 ming4ling4。"

msgid "You feel comfortable using it?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​它​好​用​吗​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 ta1 hao3 yong4 ma5？"

msgid "You feel remorse over Monika's death? Is that what you're telling me?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​莫妮卡​的​死​感到​懊悔​？​这​就是​你​想​表达​的​意思​吗​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 gan3dao4 ao4hui3？zhe4 jiu4shi4 ni3 xiang3 biao3da2 de5 yi4si5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You feel the sensation again - tiny, and fleeting, but there. You feel it in your chest, even if only for a moment.\n"
"\n"
"Hundreds of faint, fluttering wings."
msgstr ""
"那股​怪异​感​又​来​了​—​—​很​轻微​，​很​短暂​，​但​确实​存在​。​哪怕​只有​一瞬​，​你​感觉​它​就​在​你​的​胸腔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​宛如​数百双​轻颤​的​翅膀​。\n"
"\n"
"na4 gu3 guai4yi4 gan3 you4 lai2 le5——hen3 qing1wei1，hen3 duan3zan4，dan4 que4shi2 cun2zai4。na3pa4 zhi3you3 yi1shun4，ni3 gan3jue2 ta1 jiu4 zai4 ni3 de5 xiong1qiang1。\n"
"\n"
"wan3ru2 shu3 bai3 shuang1 qing1 chan4 de5 chi4bang3。"

msgid "You find a basic, uncertified credstick underneath the pillow."
msgstr ""
"你​在​枕头​下​发现​了​一根​未​认证​的​基本​款​信用​棒​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 zhen3tou5 xia4 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 gen1 wei4 ren4zheng4 de5 ji1ben3 kuan3 xin4yong4 bang4。"

msgid ""
"You find a sheaf of banking information. The data in this paperwork all points to Meat Grinder, and contains a long list of financial transactions and known associates.\n"
"\n"
"The whole thing is enclosed in a manila file folder labeled \"PLOTZ.\""
msgstr ""
"你​发现​一叠​银行​资料​。​这些​文件​中​的​数据​全都​指向​“​绞肉机​”​，​包含​大量​金融交易​记录​及​已知​关联​人员名单​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​整​份文件​装在​一个​标有​“​普​洛茨​”​字样​的​牛皮纸​文件夹​里​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fa1xian4 yi1 die2 yin2hang2 zi1liao4。zhe4xie1 wen2jian4 zhong4 de5 shu4ju4 quan2dou1 zhi3xiang4“jiao3rou4ji1”，bao1han2 da4liang4 jin1 rong2 jiao1 yi4 ji4lu4 ji2 yi3zhi1 guan1lian2 ren2 yuan2 ming2 dan1。\n"
"\n"
"zheng3 fen4 wen2 jian4 zhuang1 zai4 yi1ge5 biao1 you3“Pu3luo4ci2” zi4yang4 de5 niu2pi2zhi3 wen2jian4jia1 li3。"

msgid ""
"You find a small seam in the wall that suggests there might be a passageway "
"hidden in the wall here, but you can spot no clear mechanism for opening it."
msgstr ""
"你​发现​墙壁​上​有​一条​小缝​，​这​表明​墙内​可能​藏有​一条​通道​，​但​你​没有​发现​明显​的​开启​装置​。\n"
"ni3 fa1xian4 qiang2bi4 shang4 you3 yi1 tiao2 xiao3 feng2，zhe4 biao3ming2 qiang2 nei4 ke3neng2 zang4 you3 yi1 tiao2 tong1dao4，dan4 ni3 mei2you3 fa1xian4 ming2xian3 de5 kai1qi3 zhuang1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"You find a well-worn manual entitled \"Wartungshandbuch, Ausgabe 2042.\"\n"
"\n"
"The book is filled with depictions of turbine and pump cross-sections, tools, and descriptions of maintenance procedures.\n"
"\n"
"A few of the pages have been bookmarked with colorful bits of paper."
msgstr ""
"你​找到​了​一本​破旧​的​手册​，​名为​《​2042​版​维修​手册​》​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​全都​是​对​涡轮机​、​水泵​横截面​、​工具​和​维护程序​的​描述​说明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​几页​用​彩色​纸片​做​了​书签​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1 ben3 po4jiu4 de5 shou3ce4，ming2wei2 《 2042 ban3 wei2xiu1 shou3ce4 》。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 quan2dou1 shi4 dui4 guo1 lun2 ji1、shui3beng4 heng2jie2mian4、gong1ju4 he4 wei2 hu4 cheng2 xu4 de5 miao2shu4 shuo1ming2。\n"
"\n"
"you3 ji1 xie2 yong4 cai3se4 zhi3pian4 zuo4 le5 shu1qian1。"

msgid ""
"You find plenty of employee performance evaluations, schedules of upcoming meetings and deadlines, and other decidedly uninteresting files and papers.\n"
"\n"
"One of the drawers, however, is locked."
msgstr ""
"你​在​里面​找到​了​大量​的​员工​绩效​评估​、​即将​召开​的​会议​日程表​和​截止​日期​，​以及​其他​一些​毫无用处​的​文件​和​纸张​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​其中​一个​抽屉​是​锁​着​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 li3mian4 zhao3dao4 le5 da4liang4 de5 yuan2gong1 ji4xiao4 ping2gu1、ji2jiang1 zhao4kai1 de5 hui4yi4 ri4cheng2biao3 he4 jie2zhi3 ri4qi1，yi3ji2 qi2ta1 yi1xie1 hao2 wu2 yong4 chu3 de5 wen2jian4 he4 zhi3zhang1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 chou1ti5 shi4 suo3 zhao2 de5。"

msgid "You find yourself deposited back at the main menu."
msgstr ""
"你​发现自己​被​送回​了​菜单​界面​。\n"
"ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 bei4 song4 hui2 le5 cai4dan1 jie4mian4。"

msgid "You first. Tell me what's going on here. Now."
msgstr ""
"你​先​告诉​我​这里​发生​了​什么​事情​。​快点​。\n"
"ni3 xian1 gao4su4 wo3 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4qing5。kuai4dian3。"

msgid ""
"You flinch away, but too slowly.\n"
"\n"
"The blow lands somewhere between your neck and shoulder, and you feel an explosion of pain."
msgstr ""
"你​向​后退​去​，​但慢​了​半拍​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这一掌​正​打​在​你​脖颈​与​肩膀​之间​的​位置​，​剧痛​随即​如​爆炸​般​骤然​袭​来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4 hou4tui4 qu4，dan4 man4 le5 ban4 pai1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1 zhang3 zheng1 da3 zai4 ni3 bo2geng3 yu4 jian1bang3 zhi1jian1 de5 wei4zhi5，ju4tong4 sui2ji2 ru2 bao4zha4 ban1 zhou4ran2 xi2 lai2。"

msgid ""
"You flip though several pages of escalating containment procedures, as well as guidelines on when each procedure should be used.\n"
"\n"
"Finally you find what you've been looking for: \"Emergency AI Shutdown and Purge.\""
msgstr ""
"你​翻阅​着​几页​逐步​升级​的​收容​程序​，​以及​每​项​程序​的​适用​指南​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​你​找到​了​想要​的​内容​：​“​紧急​AI​关闭​及​清除​程序​”​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fan1yue4 zhao2 ji1 xie2 zhu2bu4 sheng1ji2 de5 shou1rong2 cheng2xu4，yi3ji2 mei3 xiang4 cheng2xu4 de5 shi4yong4 zhi3nan2。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1 ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 xiang3yao4 de5 nei4rong2：“jin3ji2 AI guan1bi4 ji2 qing1chu2 cheng2xu4”。"

msgid ""
"You flip through the early pages of the manifesto, find what looks like a "
"good place to jump in, and start to read."
msgstr ""
"你​翻开​宣言​的​前​几页​，​找到​一处​看起来​不错​的​切入点​，​然后​开始​阅读​。\n"
"ni3 fan1kai1 xuan1yan2 de5 qian2 ji1 xie2，zhao3dao4 yi1 chu3 kan4qi3lai5 bu4cuo4 de5 qie1 ru4 dian3，ran2hou4 kai1shi3 yue4du2。"

msgid ""
"You force yourself to continue staring into the gaping wound that is the Cyberzombie's aura.\n"
"\n"
"Slowly, your vision begins to adjust. And behind the darkness, you can see a glimmer of color."
msgstr ""
"你​逼​着​自己​继续​盯视​那个​黑洞洞​的​豁口​，​也​就是​赛博​僵尸​的​灵光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​慢慢​适应​了​这幅​光景​，​然后​你​察觉到​，​这片​黑暗​中​仍​有​一丝​色彩​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi1 zhao2 zi4ji3 ji4xu4 ding1shi4 na4ge5 hei1dong4dong4 de5 hua2 kou3，ye3 jiu4shi4 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 de5 ling2guang1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 man4man4 shi4ying4 le5 zhe4 fu2 guang1jing3，ran2hou4 ni3 cha2 jiao4 dao4，zhe4 pian1 hei1an4 zhong4 reng2 you3 yi1 si1 se4cai3。"

msgid "You fought a spirit with your bare hands?"
msgstr ""
"你​赤手空拳​和​精魂​打架​？\n"
"ni3 chi4shou3kong1quan2 he4 jing1hun2 da3jia4？"

msgid "You found a lab with some sort of toxic contaminent in it"
msgstr ""
"你​发现​了​一处​实验室​，​内含​某种​有毒​污染物\n"
"ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 chu3 shi2yan4shi4，nei4han2 mou3zhong3 you3du2 wu1ran3wu4"

msgid "You found her alive in the SOX, after all."
msgstr ""
"你​果然​把​她​活着​带离​了​萨洛​卢区​。\n"
"ni3 guo3ran2 ba3 ta1 huo2zhe5 dai4 li2 le5 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1。"

msgid ""
"You freeze, holding your breath and waiting for the scream of the alarm.\n"
"\n"
"After a count of ten, you exhale slowly. It looks like you've gotten away with it."
msgstr ""
"你​愣​在​原地​，​屏住​呼吸​，​等待​着​警报声​的​锐鸣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​数到​十​之后​，​你​慢慢​呼​出​一口气​。​看起来​你​成功​过关​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 leng4 zai4 yuan2di4，bing3 zhu4 hu1xi1，deng3dai4 zhao2 jing3 bao4 sheng1 de5 rui4 ming2。\n"
"\n"
"shu3 dao4 shi2 zhi1hou4，ni3 man4man4 hu1 chu1 yi1kou3qi4。kan4qi3lai5 ni3 cheng2gong1 guo4guan1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You freeze, holding your breath and waiting for the scream of the alarm. "
"After a count of ten, you exhale slowly."
msgstr ""
"你​愣​在​原地​，​屏住​呼吸​，​等待​着​警报声​的​锐鸣​。​数到​十​之后​，​你​慢慢​呼​出​一口气​。\n"
"ni3 leng4 zai4 yuan2di4，bing3 zhu4 hu1xi1，deng3dai4 zhao2 jing3 bao4 sheng1 de5 rui4 ming2。shu3 dao4 shi2 zhi1hou4，ni3 man4man4 hu1 chu1 yi1kou3qi4。"

msgid "You fucking asshole. You'll pay for this."
msgstr ""
"你​他​妈​混蛋​。​你​会​付出代价​的​。\n"
"ni3 ta1 ma1 hun2dan4。ni3 hui4 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4 de5。"

msgid ""
"You get me a cup of Turkish coffee - the real deal, not that fake junk- and I'll give ya the DVD player.\n"
"\n"
"Sound like a deal?"
msgstr ""
"你​给​我​搞​杯​土耳其​咖啡​，​我​就​给​你​DVD​播放器​。​但​我​要​的​是​真​东西​，​别带​那些​劣质​垃圾​货来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gei3 wo3 gao3 bei1 tu3er3qi2 ka1fei1，wo3 jiu4 gei3 ni3 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4。dan4 wo3 yao4 de5 shi4 zhen1 dong1xi1，bie4 dai4 na4xie1 lie4zhi4 la1ji1 huo4 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"You get me a cup of Turkish coffee - the real stuff, not that fake junk - and I'll give ya the DVD player.\n"
"\n"
"Sound like a deal?"
msgstr ""
"你​给​我​搞​杯​土耳其​咖啡​，​我​就​给​你​DVD​播放器​。​但​我​要​的​是​真​东西​，​别带​那些​劣质​垃圾​货来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gei3 wo3 gao3 bei1 tu3er3qi2 ka1fei1，wo3 jiu4 gei3 ni3 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4。dan4 wo3 yao4 de5 shi4 zhen1 dong1xi1，bie4 dai4 na4xie1 lie4zhi4 la1ji1 huo4 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"You get me a cup of Turkish coffee - the real stuff, not that fake junk- and I'll give ya the DVD player.\n"
"\n"
"Sound like a deal?"
msgstr ""
"你​给​我​搞​杯​土耳其​咖啡​，​我​就​给​你​DVD​播放器​。​但​我​要​的​是​真​东西​，​别带​那些​劣质​垃圾​货来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gei3 wo3 gao3 bei1 tu3er3qi2 ka1fei1，wo3 jiu4 gei3 ni3 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4。dan4 wo3 yao4 de5 shi4 zhen1 dong1xi1，bie4 dai4 na4xie1 lie4zhi4 la1ji1 huo4 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"You get that your \"neighboring kingdoms\" are just office buildings, right?"
msgstr ""
"你​知道​你​所谓​的​“​邻近​王国​”​其实​只是​其他​的​办公楼​吧​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 ni3 suo3wei4 de5“lin2jin4 wang2guo2” qi2shi2 zhi3shi4 qi2ta1 de5 ban4gong1lou2 ba1？"

msgid "You get the irony of what you just said, right?"
msgstr ""
"你​明白​自己​刚才​这话​的​讽刺​意味​吧​？\n"
"ni3 ming2bai5 zi4ji3 gang1cai2 zhe4 hua4 de5 feng3ci4 yi4wei4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"You give the handle a sharp tug, and the lock snaps with a crack.\n"
"\n"
"The drawer slides open effortlessly."
msgstr ""
"你​猛地​一​拽​把手​，​锁扣​咔嚓​一声​断裂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抽屉​轻而易举​地​滑开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 meng3de5 yi1 zhuai1 ba3shou3，suo3 kou4 ka1cha1 yi1sheng1 duan4lie4。\n"
"\n"
"chou1ti5 qing1er2yi4ju3 de5 hua2 kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You glance down at a second screen to see that the facility is on high alert. In place of a simple data vault, it seems you've stumbled upon some kind of massive underground complex. \n"
"\n"
"A map of the holdfast grounds indicates that security forces are en route from multiple angles. The doors currently being rebooted by the system's restore process are flashing a dull red. "
msgstr ""
"你​低头​瞥​了​一眼​副​屏​，​看见​整个​设施​都​进入​了​高度​警戒​状态​。​看来​这里​并非​简单​的​数据​保险库​—​—​你们​误打误撞​闯进​了​某个​庞大​的​地下​复合​设施​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​城堡​平面图​上​显示​的​情况​来看​，​有​多支​安保​部队​正​从​各个​方向​逼近​。​因​系统​恢复程序​而​重启​的​舱门​闪烁着​黯淡​的​红光​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 di1tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 fu4 bing3，kan4jian4 zheng3ge4 she4shi1 dou1 jin4ru4 le5 gao1du4 jing3jie4 zhuang4tai4。kan4lai5 zhe4li3 bing4fei1 jian3dan1 de5 shu4ju4 bao3 xian3 ku4——ni3men5 wu4da3wu4zhuang4 chuang3jin4 le5 mou3 ge4 pang2da4 de5 di4xia4 fu4he2 she4shi1。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 cheng2bao3 ping2mian4tu2 shang4 xian3shi4 de5 qing2kuang4 lai2 kan4，you3 duo1 zhi1 an1bao3 bu4dui4 zheng1 cong2 ge4ge4 fang1xiang4 bi1jin4。yin1 xi4tong3 hui1 fu4 cheng2 xu4 er2 chong2qi3 de5 cang1 men2 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 an4dan4 de5 hong2 guang1。"

msgid ""
"You glance over the the chart with a trained eye. \n"
"\n"
"A few salient details leap out at you."
msgstr ""
"你​以​专业​的​目光​扫视​着​病历​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几个​显著​的​细节​立刻​引起​了​你​的​注意​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3 zhuan1ye4 de5 mu4guang1 sao3shi4 zhao2 bing4li4。\n"
"\n"
"ji3ge5 xian3zhu4 de5 xi4jie2 li4ke4 yin3qi3 le5 ni3 de5 zhu4yi4。"

msgid "You goddamned heartless bastard!"
msgstr ""
"你​这​遭天​谴​的​没良心​的​混蛋​！\n"
"ni3 zhe4 zao1 tian1 qian3 de5 mei2 liang2 xin1 de5 hun2dan4！"

msgid ""
"You going to hit me again? Okay, then, yes: I *am* working for the Lobatchevskis.\n"
"\n"
"You want names? I'll give you names. More names than you know what to do with."
msgstr ""
"你​又​要​打​我​了​？​那好​吧​：​我​*​确实​*​在​为​洛巴​切夫斯基​家族​做事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想要​名字​？​我会​跟​你​说​各种​名字​，​让​你​根本​分不清​真真假假​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 yao4 da3 wo3 le5？na4 hao3 ba1：wo3*que4shi2*zai4 wei2 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 jia1zu2 zuo4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3yao4 ming2zi5？wo3 hui4 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ge4zhong3 ming2zi5，rang4 ni3 gen1ben3 fen4 bu4 qing1 zhen1 zhen1 jia3 jia3。"

msgid "You gonna tell us what it is, or do we have to guess?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​打算​告诉​我们​呢​，​还是​让​我们​自己​猜​呢​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 da3suan4 gao4su4 wo3men5 ni2，hai2shi5 rang4 wo3men5 zi4ji3 cai1 ni2？"

msgid "You got it!"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​！\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2！"

msgid ""
"You got it, chief!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice is eager.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Heading inside - this won't take five seconds."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​头儿​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​很​急切​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​马上​搞定​。​这用​不了​五​秒钟​。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，tou2r5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 ji2qie4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ma3shang4 gao3ding4。zhe4 yong4 bu4le5 wu3 miao3zhong1。"

msgid "You got it, pal."
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​朋友​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，peng2you5。"

msgid "You got it, pal. And be careful... an intruder could be *anywhere.*"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​朋友​。​而且​你​要​小心​……​入侵者​可能​会​在​*​任何​地方​*​出现​。\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，peng2you5。er2qie3 ni3 yao4 xiao3xin1……ru4qin1zhe3 ke3neng2 hui4 zai4*ren4he2 di4fang1*chu1xian4。"

msgid "You got it, thanks!"
msgstr ""
"没​问题​，​谢谢​！\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2，xie4xie5！"

msgid ""
"You got out of Feuerstelle, but Harrow's cult is still up and running, "
"right? Still full of kids who are being brainwashed and worse. So shouldn't "
"we do something about that?"
msgstr ""
"你​逃出​了​“​火坑​”​，​但​哈罗​的​邪教组织​仍​在​运作​，​对​吧​？​那里​依然​充斥​着​被​洗脑​的​孩子​，​甚至​遭受​着​更糟​的​待遇​。​难道​我们​不该​采取行动​吗​？\n"
"ni3 tao2 chu1 le5“huo3keng1”，dan4 ha1luo2 de5 xie2 jiao1 zu3 zhi1 reng2 zai4 yun4zuo4，dui4 ba1？na4li5 yi1ran2 chong1chi4 zhao2 bei4 xi3nao3 de5 hai2zi5，shen4zhi4 zao1shou4 zhao2 geng1 zao1 de5 dai4yu4。nan2dao4 wo3men5 bu4gai1 cai3qu3xing2dong4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You got that right. If I never have to talk to another dragon again, it'll be too soon.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This whole thing has been a nightmare from the beginning."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​没错​。​如果​我​再也​不用​和​任何​一条龙​打交道​，​那​真是​再好不过​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​一​开始​，​这​整件事​就​像​一场​噩梦​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 mei2cuo4。ru2guo3 wo3 zai4ye3 bu4yong4 he4 ren4he2 yi1tiao2long2 da3jiao1dao4，na4 zhen1shi5 zai4hao3bu4guo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cong2 yi1 kai1shi3，zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 jiu4 xiang4 yi1 chang2 e4meng4。"

msgid ""
"You grab hold of the handle and pull sharply. The magnetic lock holds firm "
"for a moment, then tears free."
msgstr ""
"你​抓住​把手​，​猛地​一拉​。​磁力锁​只​坚持​了​一下​就​被​扯开​了​。\n"
"ni3 zhua1zhu4 ba3shou3，meng3de5 yi1 la1。ci2li4suo3 zhi3 jian1chi2 le5 yi1xia4 jiu4 bei4 che3 kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You grab the wageslave by the shoulder and slam his head into the wall. "
"There is a loud cracking sound, and his limp body slides to the floor."
msgstr ""
"你​抓住​薪奴​的​肩膀​，​把​他​的​头​狠狠​地撞​向​墙壁​。​只​听​“​咔嚓​”​一声​，​他​瘫软​的​身体​倒​在​地上​。\n"
"ni3 zhua1zhu4 xin1 nu2 de5 jian1bang3，ba3 ta1 de5 tou2 hen3hen3 de5 zhuang4 xiang4 qiang2bi4。zhi3 ting1“ka1cha1” yi1sheng1，ta1 tan1ruan3 de5 shen1ti3 dao3 zai4 di4shang5。"

msgid ""
"You grab the waveslave's shoulder and pull him into your punch.\n"
"\n"
"His mouth drops open in surprise as he's spun towards you. You swing again, hard."
msgstr ""
"你​抓住​薪奴​的​肩膀​，​朝​他​结结实实​来​了​一拳​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​惊讶​地​张大嘴巴​，​向​你​扑​来​。​你​再次​用力​挥拳​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhua1zhu4 xin1 nu2 de5 jian1bang3，chao2 ta1 jie1 jie1 shi2 shi2 lai2 le5 yi1 quan2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jing1ya4 de5 zhang1 dai4 zui3 ba1，xiang4 ni3 pu1 lai2。ni3 zai4ci4 yong4li4 hui1 quan2。"

msgid "You grab your running gear from a worn duffel bag near the weaponry."
msgstr ""
"武器库​旁边​是​一个​破旧​的​帆布包​，​你​从​里面​拿出​自己​跑​差事​的​行头​。\n"
"wu3 qi4 ku4 pang2bian1 shi4 yi1ge5 po4jiu4 de5 fan1 bu4 bao1，ni3 cong2 li3mian4 na2chu1 zi4ji3 pao2 cha4shi4 de5 xing2tou5。"

msgid ""
"You grit your teeth and lean forward, forcing your heavy limbs to move through sheer force of will.\n"
"\n"
"As you near the doorknob, it begins to glow red. Crackling sparks leap from the glowing brass, and the crisp smell of ozone fills the air."
msgstr ""
"你​咬紧牙关​向前​倾身​，​凭借​意志力​迫使​沉重​的​四肢​移动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​靠近​门把手​时​，​它​开始​发出​红光​。​噼啪​作响​的​火花​从​发光​的​黄铜​表面​迸射​而出​，​空气​中​弥漫着​刺鼻​的​臭氧​气味​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao3jin3ya2guan1 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，ping2jie4 yi4zhi4li4 po4shi3 chen2zhong4 de5 si4zhi1 yi2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 kao4jin4 men2ba3shou5 shi2，ta1 kai1shi3 fa1chu1 hong2 guang1。pi1pa1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 huo3hua1 cong2 fa1guang1 de5 huang2tong2 biao3mian4 beng4 she4 er2 chu1，kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 ci4bi2 de5 chou4yang3 qi4wei4。"

msgid ""
"You guessed it! We, the HUMANS, wind up paying in reduced sales and lost wages.\n"
"\n"
"Every day, another DWARF-run store opens. And every time that happens, more DWARVES flock to our neighborhoods, driving good, honest, HUMAN businesses OUT."
msgstr ""
"你​猜​对​了​！​付出代价​的​是​我们​人类​！​销售额​下降​，​工资​缩水​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​每天​都​有​新​的​矮​人​店铺​开张​。​每开​一家​店​，​就​有​更​多​矮​人​涌入​我们​的​社区​，​把​诚实​守信​的​人类​商家​排挤​在外​！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cai1 dui4 le5！fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4 de5 shi4 wo3men5 ren2lei4！xiao1shou4e2 xia4jiang4，gong1zi1 suo1shui3。\n"
"\n"
"mei3tian1 dou1 you3 xin1 de5 ai3 ren2 dian4pu4 kai1zhang1。mei3 kai1 yi1jia1 dian4，jiu4 you3 geng1 duo1 ai3 ren2 yong3ru4 wo3men5 de5 she4qu1，ba3 cheng2shi2 shou3xin4 de5 ren2lei4 shang1jia1 pai2ji3 zai4wai4！"

msgid ""
"You guessed it, drecksau. They came to *us,* just like we said they would.\n"
"\n"
"Danni's dead, Mira's a wreck, and we need to keep moving just to stay alive. All thanks to you.\n"
"\n"
"I hope you rot in hell."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​你​也​知道​吧​，​混蛋​。​我​之前​说​了​，​他们​会来​找​*​我们​*​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​丹妮​死​了​，​米拉​也​成​了​废人​，​我们​只能​不停​逃命​，​这​全都​拜​你​所​赐​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​希望​你​不得好死​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 ba1，hun2dan4。wo3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 le5，ta1men5 hui4 lai2 zhao3*wo3men5*de5。\n"
"\n"
"dan1 ni1 si3 le5，mi3la1 ye3 cheng2 le5 fei4ren2，wo3men5 zhi3neng2 bu4ting2 tao2ming4，zhe4 quan2dou1 bai4 ni3 suo3 ci4。\n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 ni3 bu4 de2 hao3 si3。"

msgid ""
"You guys could use the nuyen, I could use a look around. It's as simple as "
"that."
msgstr ""
"这些​新円归​你们​，​让​我​随便​看看​就行​。​就​这么​简单​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 xin1 yuan2 gui1 ni3men5，rang4 wo3 sui2bian4 kan4kan5 jiu4 xing2。jiu4 zhe4me5 jian3dan1。"

msgid ""
"You hammer the button on the security terminal, and the autoturrets rattle to life.\n"
"\n"
"In unison, all four train on Meat Grinder."
msgstr ""
"你​重重​敲​下​安保​终端​的​按钮​，​数台​自动​炮塔​立刻​活​了​过来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​四架​枪口​齐齐​对准​了​“​绞肉机​”​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 chong2chong2 qiao1 xia4 an1bao3 zhong1duan1 de5 an4niu3，shu3 tai2 zi4dong4 pao4ta3 li4ke4 huo2 le5 guo4lai2。\n"
"\n"
"si4 jia4 qiang1kou3 qi2 qi2 dui4zhun3 le5“jiao3rou4ji1”。"

msgid "You have $(scene.numUnreadMessages) unread messages."
msgstr ""
"你​有​$(scene.numUnreadMessages)​条未读​消息​。\n"
"ni3 you3 $(scene.numUnreadMessages) tiao2 wei4 dou4 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"You have Karma available to improve your character's Attributes and Skills. "
"Open the Karma screen?"
msgstr ""
"你​有​可用​的​业力​来​提升​角色​属性​与​技能​。​是否​打开​业力​界面​？\n"
"ni3 you3 ke3 yong4 de5 ye4li4 lai2 ti2sheng1 jue2se4 shu3xing4 yu4 ji4neng2。shi4fou3 da3kai1 ye4li4 jie4mian4？"

msgid "You have a funny definition of \"charity.\""
msgstr ""
"你​对​“​慈善​”​的​定义​可真有​意思​。\n"
"ni3 dui4“ci2shan4” de5 ding4yi4 ke3 zhen1 you3 yi4si5。"

msgid "You have a gift for understatement. Let's get the hell out of here!"
msgstr ""
"你​真会​轻描淡写​啊​。​我们​快​离开​这里​吧​！\n"
"ni3 zhen1 hui4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 a1。wo3men5 kuai4 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1！"

msgid "You have a network - me."
msgstr ""
"你​有人​脉​啊​，​我​就是​。\n"
"ni3 you3ren2 mai4 a1，wo3 jiu4shi4。"

msgid "You have a novel approach to dealing with the mentally ill."
msgstr ""
"你​应对​精神​错乱​者​的​方式​真是​独树一帜​。\n"
"ni3 ying4dui4 jing1shen2 cuo4luan4 zhe3 de5 fang1shi4 zhen1shi5 du2shu4yi1zhi4。"

msgid "You have a password for us."
msgstr ""
"你​不是​说​要​告诉​我们​口令​来​着​。\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 shuo1 yao4 gao4su4 wo3men5 kou3ling4 lai2 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"You have a talent for understatement.\n"
"\n"
"The things that crawl in the dark spaces between the metaplanes are worse than \"bad.\" They're monstrosities.\n"
"\n"
"Horrors."
msgstr ""
"你​真会​轻描淡写​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​在​元​位面​之间​的​黑暗​缝隙​里​爬行​的​东西​，​比​“​糟糕​”​更​糟糕​。​它们​是​怪物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​恐怖​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1 hui4 qing1miao2dan4xie3。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 zai4 yuan2 wei4mian4 zhi1jian1 de5 hei1an4 feng4xi4 li3 pa2xing2 de5 dong1xi1，bi3“zao1gao1” geng1 zao1gao1。ta1men5 shi4 guai4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 kong3bu4 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"You have a way with words, fearless leader. C'mon, let's get out of here."
msgstr ""
"你​可真会​说话​，​无畏​领袖​。​走​吧​，​我们​离开​这里​。\n"
"ni3 ke3 zhen1 hui4 shuo1hua4，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。zou3 ba1，wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid "You have a way with words."
msgstr ""
"你​可真会​说话​。\n"
"ni3 ke3 zhen1 hui4 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"You have an audition to attend, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"You'll want to get to it."
msgstr ""
"你​有​一场​试镜​要​参加​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​会​愿意​去​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3 yi1 chang2 shi4jing4 yao4 can1jia1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hui4 yuan4yi4 qu4 de5。"

msgid "You have grandkids?"
msgstr ""
"你​都​当​爷爷​了​？\n"
"ni3 dou1 dang1 ye2ye5 le5？"

msgid "You have my attention Burakgazi. What do you have in mind?"
msgstr ""
"我​听​着​呢​，​布拉加​齐​。​你​有​什么​打算​？\n"
"wo3 ting1 zhao2 ni2，bu4 la1 jia1 qi2。ni3 you3 shen2me5 da3suan4？"

msgid "You have my attention."
msgstr ""
"接着​说​。\n"
"jie1zhe5 shuo1。"

msgid "You have my power coupling already. Our business is concluded."
msgstr ""
"你​已经​拿到​了​我​的​电源​耦合​器​。​我们​的​交易​已经​结束​了​。\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 na2dao4 le5 wo3 de5 dian4yuan2 ou3he2 qi4。wo3men5 de5 jiao1yi4 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You have no idea how wrong you are. About all of this.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He struggles to rise from the floor, but his muscles refuse to cooperate. Finally, he gives up with a scowl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If I could move my arms, I'd take that chip from you and *show* you what it does."
msgstr ""
"你​根本​不​知道​自己​关于​这​一切​错得​有​多​离谱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​努力​想​从​地​上爬​起来​，​但​肌肉​就是​不听使唤​。​最后​，​他​皱着眉头​放弃​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我能​动弹​，​我​一定​会​从​你​那里​拿走​那​块​芯片​，​然后​让​你​*​亲眼​看看​*​它​的​本事​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 guan1yu2 zhe4 yi1qie4 cuo4 de2 you3 duo1 li2pu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nu3li4 xiang3 cong2 de5 shang4 pa2 qi3lai5，dan4 ji1rou4 jiu4shi4 bu4 ting1 shi3 huan4。zui4hou4，ta1 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2 fang4qi4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3 neng2 dong4tan5，wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 cong2 ni3 na4li5 na2zou3 na4 kuai4 xin1pian4，ran2hou4 rang4 ni3*qin1yan3 kan4kan5*ta1 de5 ben3shi4。"

msgid "You have no idea."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。"

msgid "You have no idea. But I imagine you soon will."
msgstr ""
"你​还​没有​感受​到​。​但​我​想​你​很快​就​会​了​。\n"
"ni3 hai2 mei2you3 gan3shou4 dao4。dan4 wo3 xiang3 ni3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 le5。"

msgid "You have no unread messages."
msgstr ""
"你​没有​未读​消息​。\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 wei4 dou4 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"You have nothing to be upset about. You were given a task, and you carried it out. Admirably, I might add.\n"
"\n"
"Jana's job was to plant the bomb. Not your problem, and not your responsibility.\n"
"\n"
"But we can discuss all of this upon your return."
msgstr ""
"你​没有​必要​对此​感到​沮丧​。​你​被​安排​了​一项​任务​，​而且​你​出色​地​完成​了​目标​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​简娜​的​任务​才​是​安装​炸弹​。​这​与​你​无关​，​你​也​无须​负责​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我们​可以​等​你​回来​之后​再​讨论​这些​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 bi4yao4 dui4 ci3 gan3dao4 ju3sang4。ni3 bei4 an1pai2 le5 yi1 xiang4 ren4wu5，er2qie3 ni3 chu1se4 de5 wan2cheng2 le5 mu4biao1。\n"
"\n"
"Jian3na4 de5 ren4wu5 cai2 shi4 an1zhuang1 zha4dan4。zhe4 yu4 ni3 wu2guan1，ni3 ye3 wu2xu1 fu4ze2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 ke3yi3 deng3 ni3 hui2lai5 zhi1hou4 zai4 tao3lun4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid "You have successfully unsubscribed from this Content Pack"
msgstr ""
"你​已​成功​取消​订阅​此​内容​包\n"
"ni3 yi3 cheng2gong1 qu3xiao1 ding4yue4 ci3 nei4rong2 bao1"

msgid ""
"You have three seconds before I open the hose. Step out here and surrender, "
"and I promise I'll make this easy."
msgstr ""
"我​开闸​之前​，​你们​有​三秒钟​时间​来​决定​。​走​过来​投降​的话​，​我​保证​不让​你们​受罪​。\n"
"wo3 kai1 zha2 zhi1qian2，ni3men5 you3 san1 miao3 zhong1 shi2jian1 lai2 jue2ding4。zou3 guo4lai2 tou2xiang2 de5hua4，wo3 bao3zheng4 bu4 rang4 ni3men5 shou4zui4。"

msgid ""
"You have to understand, Frau Müller. I can't accept a job without knowing "
"what it entails."
msgstr ""
"你​必须​理解​，​穆勒​女士​。​我​不能​对​差事​细节​一无所知​就​随随便便​接下来​。\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 li3jie3，mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4。wo3 bu4neng2 dui4 cha4shi4 xi4jie2 yi1wu2suo3zhi1 jiu4 sui2 sui2 bian4 bian4 jie1xia4lai2。"

msgid ""
"You have unspent Karma. Are you sure you want to finish character creation "
"and start the game? You may spend Karma later at any time by accessing the "
"character screen."
msgstr ""
"你​还有​未​使用​的​业力​。​确定​要​完成​角色​创建​并​开始​游戏​吗​？​你​之后​仍​可​随时​进入​角色​界面​来​使用​业力​。\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 wei4 shi3yong4 de5 ye4li4。que4ding4 yao4 wan2cheng2 jue2se4 chuang4jian4 bing4 kai1shi3 you2xi4 ma5？ni3 zhi1hou4 reng2 ke3 sui2shi2 jin4ru4 jue2se4 jie4mian4 lai2 shi3yong4 ye4li4。"

msgid ""
"You haven't \"thrown away\" anything, Frau Müller. Nobody's going to inform "
"on you."
msgstr ""
"穆勒​女士​，​你​并​没有​“​豁出​”​任何​东西​。​没有​人会​告发​你​。\n"
"mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4，ni3 bing4 mei2you3“hua2 chu1” ren4he2 dong1xi1。mei2you3 ren2 hui4 gao4fa1 ni3。"

msgid "You haven't answered my question."
msgstr ""
"你​没有​回答​我​的​问题​。\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 hui2da2 wo3 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"You haven’t said a thing about our client yet, Paul. You holding out on us? "
msgstr ""
"保罗​，​我们​的​客户​你​可是​半句​也​没​提​。​你​想​瞒​我们​？\n"
"bao3luo2，wo3men5 de5 ke4hu4 ni3 ke3shi4 ban4 ju4 ye3 mei2 ti2。ni3 xiang3 man2 wo3men5？"

msgid ""
"You hear a great deal of fumbling on the other side of the door. Finally, "
"the lock unlatches with a click."
msgstr ""
"门​那头​传来​一阵​手忙脚乱​的​窸​窣​声​。​最终​，​门锁​咔哒​一声​打开​了​。\n"
"men2 na4 tou2 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 shou3mang2jiao3luan4 de5 xi1 su1 sheng1。zui4zhong1，men2suo3 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 da3kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You hear a loud thunking sound: a heavy-duty maglock clicking shut.\n"
"\n"
"The little light above the exit door goes from green to red."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​一声​沉闷​的​咔嗒​声​：​那​是​重型​磁力锁​关闭​的​声音​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​出口​门​上方​的​小灯​从​绿色​变为​红色​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 yi1sheng1 chen2men4 de5 ka1da1 sheng1：na4 shi4 zhong4xing2 ci2li4suo3 guan1bi4 de5 sheng1yin1。\n"
"\n"
"chu1kou3 men2 shang4fang1 de5 xiao3 deng1 cong2 lu:4se4 bian4wei2 hong2se4。"

msgid ""
"You hear a rustling sound behind you. Glory.\n"
"\n"
"Turning, you can see a troubled look on her face."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​身后​有​窸​窸​窣窣​的​声音​。​是​格洛丽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​转过身​，​看到​她​脸上​露出​不安​的​表情​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 shen1hou4 you3 xi1 xi1 su1 su1 de5 sheng1yin1。shi4 Ge2luo4li2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，kan4dao4 ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 bu4an1 de5 biao3qing2。"

msgid ""
"You hear a slurping sound - presumably Blitz taking a sip of steaming hot soykaf.\n"
"\n"
"The only steam that you can see out here is your own breath condensing in the frigid night air."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​咕噜一声​—​—​大概​是​布里​茨​正​咽下​一口​冒​着​热气​的​豆​咖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​你​从​这里​能​看到​的​只有​你​自己​在​寒冷​的​夜晚​呼出来​的​热气​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 gu1 lu1 yi1 sheng1——da4gai4 shi4 Bu4li3ci2 zheng1 yan4xia4 yi1kou3 mao4 zhao2 re4qi4 de5 dou4 ka1。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ni3 cong2 zhe4li3 neng2 kan4dao4 de5 zhi3you3 ni3 zi4ji3 zai4 han2leng3 de5 ye4wan3 hu1 chu1 lai2 de5 re4qi4。"

msgid ""
"You hear another rustling sound. Glory, moving behind you.\n"
"\n"
"She stares down at the Rules of Living, a look of disgust on her face."
msgstr ""
"你​又​听到​窸​窸​窣窣​的​声音​。​是​格洛丽​在​你​身后​走动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​低头​盯​着​“​生存​法则​”​的​内容​，​脸上​露出​厌恶​的​神情​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 ting1dao4 xi1 xi1 su1 su1 de5 sheng1yin1。shi4 Ge2luo4li2 zai4 ni3 shen1hou4 zou3dong4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 di1tou2 ding1 zhao2“sheng1cun2 fa3ze2” de5 nei4rong2，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 yan4wu4 de5 shen2qing2。"

msgid "You hear the distant sound of a door sliding shut."
msgstr ""
"你​听见​远处​传来​房门​滑动​关闭​的​声响​。\n"
"ni3 ting1jian4 yuan3chu4 chuan2lai2 fang2men2 hua2dong4 guan1bi4 de5 sheng1xiang3。"

msgid ""
"You hear the familiar clicking sound of an audio connection being established with your commlink.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, a soothing voice begins speaking into your ear."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​通讯​链路​建立​时​熟悉​的​咔嗒​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​一个​舒缓​的​声音​在​你​耳边​响起​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 tong1xun4 lian4lu4 jian4li4 shi2 shu2xi1 de5 ka1da1 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，yi1ge5 shu1huan3 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4 ni3 er3 bian1 xiang3qi3。"

msgid ""
"You hear the rustling sound of Phil pushing himself away from the intercom.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, the building's external speakers fall silent."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​菲尔​挪动​自己​离开​广播设备​的​声音​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​大楼​外​的​扬声器​安静​了​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 fei1 er3 nuo2dong4 zi4ji3 li2kai1 yan3 bo1 she4 bei4 de5 sheng1yin1。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，da4lou2 wai4 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 an1jing4 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"You hear the sound of a door opening again, and the cacophony of machinery fills the line. \n"
"\n"
"You can’t make out anything more."
msgstr ""
"你​又​听见​门​开启​的​声音​，​机械​的​嘈杂声​充斥​在​线路​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​除此之外​，​你​再也​听不清​任何​动静​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 ting1jian4 men2 kai1qi3 de5 sheng1yin1，ji1xie4 de5 cao2za2sheng1 chong1chi4 zai4 xian4lu4 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"chu2ci3zhi1wai4，ni3 zai4ye3 ting1 bu4 qing1 ren4he2 dong4jing4。"

msgid ""
"You hear the sound of a door slamming shut, and the noise of machinery is "
"suddenly muffled. There’s a rattle of plastic, and the ringing stops."
msgstr ""
"你​听见​门​砰​地​关上​的​声音​，​机器​的​轰鸣声​骤然​变得​沉闷​。​塑料制品​发出​哗啦​作响​的​声响​，​铃声​随之​停止​。\n"
"ni3 ting1jian4 men2 peng1 de5 guan1shang4 de5 sheng1yin1，ji1qi4 de5 hong1 ming2 sheng1 zhou4ran2 bian4de5 chen2men4。su4 liao4 zhi4 pin3 fa1chu1 hua1la1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 sheng1xiang3，ling2sheng1 sui2zhi1 ting2zhi3。"

msgid ""
"You hear voices speaking in low tones through the wood of the door. You "
"can't make out the words, but regular choruses of rough laughter tell you "
"that the people on the other side are enjoying themselves."
msgstr ""
"你​听见​木门​另一侧​传来​低沉​的​说话声​。​虽然​听不清​具体内容​，​但​那​阵阵​粗犷​的​笑声​表明​门内​的​人​正玩得​尽兴​。\n"
"ni3 ting1jian4 mu4 men2 ling4 yi1 ce4 chuan2lai2 di1chen2 de5 shuo1 hua4 sheng1。sui1ran2 ting1 bu4 qing1 ju4 ti3 nei4 rong2，dan4 na4 zhen4 zhen4 cu1guang3 de5 xiao4sheng1 biao3ming2 men2 nei4 de5 ren2 zheng1 wan2 de2 jin4xing4。"

msgid "You heard him, Glory. He has kids. I couldn't let them kill him."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​他​说​的​了​，​格洛丽​。​他​还有​孩子​。​我​不能​让​他们​杀​了​他​。\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 ta1 shuo1 de5 le5，Ge2luo4li2。ta1 hai2you3 hai2zi5。wo3 bu4neng2 rang4 ta1men5 sha1 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"You heard it here, an absolutely chilling account of tonight's attack. Again, the town of Stolberg has been reduced to ash, another victim of the Firewing.\n"
"\n"
"Stay with us for more up-to-the-minute reporting on Feuerschwinge's reign of terror."
msgstr ""
"你们​都​听到​了​，​今晚​的​袭击​令人​不寒而栗​。​斯托尔​贝格​镇​化为灰烬​，​成为​火翼​的​又​一个​受害者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​继续​收看​关于​火翼​恐怖​统治​的​最新​报道​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 dou1 ting1dao4 le5，jin1wan3 de5 xi2ji1 ling4ren2 bu4han2er2li4。si1 tuo1 er3 bei4 ge2 zhen4 hua4 wei2 hui1 jin4，cheng2wei2 Huo3yi4 de5 you4 yi1ge5 shou4hai4zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ji4xu4 shou1kan4 guan1yu2 Huo3yi4 kong3bu4 tong3zhi4 de5 zui4xin1 bao4dao4。"

msgid "You heard the man, Blitz. Do your thing."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​了​，​布里​茨​。​该​你​上场​了​。\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 le5，Bu4li3ci2。gai1 ni3 shang4chang3 le5。"

msgid ""
"You heard the man, Blitz. Get that door open so that we can get this thing "
"done."
msgstr ""
"你​听到​了​，​布里​茨​。​把​这门​打开​，​我们​好​赶紧​完事​。\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 le5，Bu4li3ci2。ba3 zhe4 men2 da3kai1，wo3men5 hao3 gan3jin3 wan2shi4。"

msgid ""
"You hit hard, $(l.race). G-good on you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice sounds stronger now. The stutter that marred his speech has almost completely faded away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've got muscle - I can respect that."
msgstr ""
"你​挺​有​劲儿​的​，​$(l.race)​。​不错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​听​起来​更​洪亮​了​。​刚才​因为​瘫软​导致​的​口吃​也​几乎​完全​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​很​有​肌肉​。​我​对此​表示​尊重​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting3 you3 jin4r5 de5，$(l.race)。bu4cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 geng1 hong2liang4 le5。gang1cai2 yin1wei4 tan1ruan3 dao3zhi4 de5 kou3chi1 ye3 ji1hu1 wan2quan2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hen3 you3 ji1rou4。wo3 dui4 ci3 biao3shi4 zun1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"You hit hard, s-stranger. Good on you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice sounds stronger now. The stutter that marred his speech has almost completely faded away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've got muscle - I can respect that."
msgstr ""
"你​挺​有​劲儿​的​，​陌生人​。​不错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​听​起来​更​洪亮​了​。​刚才​因为​瘫软​导致​的​口吃​也​几乎​完全​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​很​有​肌肉​。​我​对此​表示​尊重​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting3 you3 jin4r5 de5，mo4sheng1ren2。bu4cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 geng1 hong2liang4 le5。gang1cai2 yin1wei4 tan1ruan3 dao3zhi4 de5 kou3chi1 ye3 ji1hu1 wan2quan2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hen3 you3 ji1rou4。wo3 dui4 ci3 biao3shi4 zun1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"You hit the activation control, and the Cyberzombie lurches to life. It takes a step forward, and you can hear the whir of actuators calibrating to adjust to its weight.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, the whirring sound dies down. It relaxes into a slight crouch."
msgstr ""
"你​按​下​激活​开关​，​赛博​僵尸​随即​踉跄​着​苏醒​了​。​它​向前​迈出​一步​，​你​能​听见​执行器​嗡鸣​着​进行​校准​，​以​适应​它​的​体重​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒​后​，​嗡​鸣声​渐渐​平息​。​它​放松​身体​，​微微​蹲踞​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 ji1huo2 kai1guan1，sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 sui2ji2 liang4qiang4 zhao2 su1xing3 le5。ta1 xiang4qian2 mai4chu1 yi1 bu4，ni3 neng2 ting1jian4 zhi2 xing2 qi4 weng1 ming2 zhao2 jin4xing2 jiao4zhun3，yi3 shi4ying4 ta1 de5 ti3zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 hou4，weng1 ming2 sheng1 jian4jian4 ping2xi1。ta1 fang4song1 shen1ti3，wei1wei1 dun1ju4。"

msgid ""
"You hit the receive button on your PDA.\n"
"\n"
"One look at the grainy image that blossoms to life on the screen is enough to tell you that something has gone terribly wrong."
msgstr ""
"你​按​下​PDA​上​的​接收​按钮​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只​消对​着​亮​起​的​屏幕​上​布满​粒状​纹理​的​影像​扫上​一眼​，​你​便​明白​事情​出​了​大​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 PDA shang4 de5 jie1shou1 an4niu3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3 xiao1 dui4 zhao2 liang4 qi3 de5 ping2mu4 shang4 bu4man3 li4 zhuang4 wen2li3 de5 ying3xiang4 sao3 shang4 yi1yan3，ni3 bian4 ming2bai5 shi4qing5 chu1 le5 dai4 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"You hold a door open. We run in, release the lock, and get out again. Do "
"that twice, once for each door."
msgstr ""
"你​弄​开​一扇门​，​我们​进去​把​锁​关掉​，​然后​再​出来​。​重复​两次​就行了​。\n"
"ni3 long4 kai1 yi1 shan1 men2，wo3men5 jin4qu4 ba3 suo3 guan1diao4，ran2hou4 zai4 chu1lai2。chong2fu4 liang3 ci4 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You hold your breath and dive deeper into the dumpster. Deeper, through piles of half-rotted diapers and ancient chicken carcasses. Deeper, until you can feel the bottom of the rough metal bin.\n"
"\n"
"Your fingers touch plastic. Instinctively, they close around it, and you pull the object back to the surface."
msgstr ""
"你​屏住​呼吸​，​将​手​深入​垃圾箱​底部​，​穿过​半​腐烂​的​尿布​堆​和​陈旧​的​鸡​骨架​，​直至​触​碰到​粗糙​的​金属​箱底​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​指尖​碰到​了​某种​塑料​。​你​的​手​立刻​抓住​了​它​，​并​将​其​拽​了​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bing3 zhu4 hu1xi1，jiang1 shou3 shen1ru4 la1ji1xiang1 di3bu4，chuan1guo4 ban4 fu3lan4 de5 niao4bu4 dui1 he4 chen2jiu4 de5 ji1 gu3jia4，zhi2zhi4 chu4 peng4dao4 cu1cao1 de5 jin1shu3 xiang1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 zhi3jian1 peng4dao4 le5 mou3zhong3 su4liao4。ni3 de5 shou3 li4ke4 zhua1zhu4 le5 ta1，bing4 jiang1 qi2 zhuai1 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid "You hungry, Dante? Want some soy-jerky?"
msgstr ""
"你​饿​了​吗​，​但丁​？​想要​豆肉​干吗​？\n"
"ni3 e4 le5 ma5，dan4ding1？xiang3yao4 dou4 rou4 gan4ma2？"

msgid ""
"You input a single command into the MKVI's control circuit.\n"
"\n"
"A strange shiver runs through its entire body."
msgstr ""
"你​将​一条​指令​输入​MKVI​的​控制电路​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​的​躯体​诡异​地​颤​了​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 yi1 tiao2 zhi3ling4 shu1ru4 MKVI de5 kong4 zhi4 dian4 lu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 qu1ti3 gui3yi4 de5 chan4 le5 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"You joke, but shamans of the Adversary can be quite charming. They are confident to a fault, charismatic, and they flaunt their willingness to break cultural taboos.\n"
"\n"
"It isn't unusual for them to attract large crowds of followers."
msgstr ""
"我​知道​你​是​在​开玩笑​，​但​信奉​反叛者​的​萨满​确实​魅力​非凡​。​他们​自信​到​近乎​狂妄​，​魅力四射​，​更​肆无忌惮​地​宣扬​自己​打破​文化​禁忌​的​意愿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​吸引​大​群​追随者​并​不​罕见​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 zai4 kai1wan2xiao4，dan4 xin4feng4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 sa4man3 que4shi2 mei4li4 fei1fan2。ta1men5 zi4xin4 dao4 jin4hu5 kuang2wang4，mei4li4si4she4，geng1 si4wu2ji4dan4 de5 xuan1yang2 zi4ji3 da3po4 wen2hua4 jin4ji4 de5 yi4yuan4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 xi1yin3 dai4 qun2 zhui1sui2zhe3 bing4 bu4 han3jian4。"

msgid ""
"You just don't know when to give up, do you? Our ways aren't yours, but that doesn't give you the right to judge us.\n"
"\n"
"Who are you to impose your ideology on this commune?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​就是​不肯​放弃​呢​？​我们​的​行事​方式​与​你​不同​，​但​这​并​不​意味着​你​就​有权​评判​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​凭​什么​要​把​你​的​意识形态​强加于​我们​这个​社群​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 jiu4shi4 bu4 ken3 fang4qi4 ni2？wo3men5 de5 xing2shi4 fang1shi4 yu4 ni3 bu4tong2，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 jiu4 you3quan2 ping2pan4 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ping2 shen2me5 yao4 ba3 ni3 de5 yi4shi2xing2tai4 jiang4 jia1 yu2 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 she4qun2？"

msgid "You just don't understand how wonderfu--"
msgstr ""
"你​根本​不​理解​她​有​多​好​—​—\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 li3jie3 ta1 you3 duo1 hao3 — —"

msgid "You just holler if there's anything else I can help with."
msgstr ""
"还有​其他​事​需要​帮忙​的话​尽管​开口​。\n"
"hai2you3 qi2ta1 shi4 xu1yao4 bang1mang2 de5hua4 jin3guan3 kai1kou3。"

msgid ""
"You just made a deal with the devil, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}There is an expression of incredible sorrow on Glory's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I hope you're prepared to live with the consequences."
msgstr ""
"你​刚刚​和​魔鬼​做​了​交易​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​的​脸上​露出​无比​悲伤​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​希望​你​准备​好​承担​后果​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1gang5 he4 mo2gui3 zuo4 le5 jiao1yi4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 wu2bi3 bei1shang1 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 cheng2dan1 hou4guo3。"

msgid ""
"You just said it yourself: you lead the team. They look to you for guidance, and leadership, and employment. You're the one who puts food on their tables.\n"
"\n"
"You have a responsibility to them. They need you more than I do. "
msgstr ""
"你​自己​也​清楚​：​你​是​队长​。​他们​需要​你​的​指引​，​你​的​领导​，​和​你​带来​的​工作​机会​。​有​你​在​，​队伍​才​不会​饿死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​比起​我​，​他们​更​需要​你​的​照顾​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zi4ji3 ye3 qing1chu5：ni3 shi4 dui4zhang3。ta1men5 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 zhi3yin3，ni3 de5 ling3dao3，he4 ni3 dai4lai2 de5 gong1zuo4 ji1hui4。you3 ni3 zai4，dui4wu3 cai2 bu4hui4 e4si3。\n"
"\n"
"bi3qi3 wo3，ta1men5 geng1 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 zhao4gu5。"

msgid ""
"You just sit tight. Any minute now, you're going to have all sorts of company. Pleasure doing business with you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns and leaves, cradling the black box in his arms.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​好好​待​着​吧​。​大批​安保​马上​就​到​。​很​高兴​与​你​合作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转身​离开​，​怀里​抱​着​那个​黑匣子​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hao3hao3 dai1 zhao2 ba1。da4pi1 an1bao3 ma3shang4 jiu4 dao4。hen3 gao1xing4 yu4 ni3 he2zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1，huai2li3 bao4 zhao2 na4ge5 hei1xia2zi5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You just watch and wait, mongrel.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Stahl gives you a broad grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It'll be a bloodbath."
msgstr ""
"等着瞧​吧​，​杂种​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​斯塔尔​冲​你​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​是​一场​大屠杀​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3zhe5qiao2 ba1，za2zhong3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Si1ta3er3 chong1 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 da4tu2sha1。"

msgid ""
"You just watch and wait, traitor.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Stahl gives you a broad grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It'll be a bloodbath."
msgstr ""
"等着瞧​吧​，​叛徒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​斯塔尔​冲​你​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​是​一场​大屠杀​。\n"
"\n"
"deng3zhe5qiao2 ba1，pan4tu2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Si1ta3er3 chong1 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 da4tu2sha1。"

msgid "You just worry about getting us paid. I can handle myself."
msgstr ""
"你​只管​付钱​就行​，​我能​照顾​好​自己​。\n"
"ni3 zhi3guan3 fu4qian2 jiu4 xing2，wo3 neng2 zhao4gu5 hao3 zi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"You keep strange company for a potential recruit, stranger.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Stahl looks over your group with a sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*Very* strange company. I don't think you're here to sign on with us at all."
msgstr ""
"陌生人​，​你​带​的​这支​预备队​可​真是​古怪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​斯塔尔​轻蔑​地​扫视​着​你们​一行​人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​极其​*​古怪​。​我​看​你们​压根​就​不是​来​投奔​我们​的​。\n"
"\n"
"mo4sheng1ren2，ni3 dai4 de5 zhe4 zhi1 yu4 bei4 dui4 ke3 zhen1shi5 gu3guai4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Si1ta3er3 qing1mie4 de5 sao3shi4 zhao2 ni3men5 yi1xing2 ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*ji2qi2*gu3guai4。wo3 kan4 ni3men5 ya4gen1 jiu4 bu4shi4 lai2 tou2ben4 wo3men5 de5。"

msgid ""
"You keep walking down the hallway, half-waiting for a cry of alarm.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later and you're satisfied: the wageslave is completely oblivious to your presence."
msgstr ""
"你​继续​沿着​走廊​前进​，​半信半疑​地​等待​着​一声​对方​发现​你​的​惊叫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​你​满意​地​发现​：​薪奴​对​你​的​存在​浑然不觉​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ji4xu4 yan2zhe5 zou3lang2 qian2jin4，ban4xin4ban4yi2 de5 deng3dai4 zhao2 yi1sheng1 dui4fang1 fa1xian4 ni3 de5 jing1jiao4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 man3yi4 de5 fa1xian4：xin1 nu2 dui4 ni3 de5 cun2zai4 hun2ran2bu4jue2。"

msgid "You kids are gonna get yourselves killed."
msgstr ""
"你们​这些​小屁孩​儿会​把​自己​害死​的​。\n"
"ni3men5 zhe4xie1 xiao3pi4hai2 er2 hui4 ba3 zi4ji3 hai4si3 de5。"

msgid "You killed Monika, and I'm gonna kill you. End of story."
msgstr ""
"你​杀​了​莫妮卡​，​而​我​要​杀​了​你​。​就​这样​。\n"
"ni3 sha1 le5 Mo4ni1ka3，er2 wo3 yao4 sha1 le5 ni3。jiu4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"You killed Thorvald. Despite his whining, and begging, and bargaining, you put him down like a rabid dog.\n"
"\n"
"It was a good choice. And it was the right one."
msgstr ""
"你​杀​了​托​瓦尔德​。​不管​他​如何​哀嚎​、​乞求​或是​讨价还价​，​你​还是​像​弄死​一条​疯狗​一样​把​他​干掉​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​决定​很​不错​。​而且​非常​正确​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 sha1 le5 tuo1 wa3er3de2。bu4guan3 ta1 ru2he2 ai1hao2、qi3qiu2 huo4shi4 tao3jia4huan2jia4，ni3 hai2shi5 xiang4 nong4si3 yi1 tiao2 feng1 gou3 yi1yang4 ba3 ta1 gan4diao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 jue2ding4 hen3 bu4cuo4。er2qie3 fei1chang2 zheng4que4。"

msgid ""
"You killed my friends, asshole. And now I'm supposed to feel *sorry* for "
"you? Just tell me what the hell is going on here!"
msgstr ""
"你​杀​了​我​的​朋友​，​混蛋​。​现在​你​以为​我会​为​你​感到​*​抱歉​*​吗​？​赶紧​告诉​我​这里​发生​了​什么​！\n"
"ni3 sha1 le5 wo3 de5 peng2you5，hun2dan4。xian4zai4 ni3 yi3wei2 wo3 hui4 wei2 ni3 gan3dao4*bao4qian4*ma5？gan3jin3 gao4su4 wo3 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5！"

msgid ""
"You kneel to inspect the body. Under Winters' outstretched right arm, you can see traces of blood smeared into the carpet.\n"
"\n"
"Lifting his arm, you see that a number has been written across the floor: 91612."
msgstr ""
"你​跪下​来​检查​尸体​，​发现​温特斯​伸出​的​右臂​下方​的​地毯​上​有​几道​血迹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​把​他​的​手臂​挪到​一边​，​发现​地板​上​写​着​一组​数字​：​91612​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gui4xia5 lai2 jian3cha2 shi1ti3，fa1xian4 Wen1te4si1 shen1chu1 de5 you4 bi4 xia4fang1 de5 di4tan3 shang4 you3 ji1 dao4 xue4ji4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 ta1 de5 shou3bi4 nuo2 dao4 yi1bian1，fa1xian4 di4ban3 shang4 xie3 zhao2 yi1 zu3 shu4zi4：91612。"

msgid ""
"You knew that we needed him, but you beat him badly. I'm worried about that "
"lapse of control."
msgstr ""
"你​明明​知道​我们​需要​他​，​还​下手​这么​狠​？​我​是​担心​你​情绪​失控​。\n"
"ni3 ming2ming2 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 xu1yao4 ta1，hai2 xia4shou3 zhe4me5 hen3？wo3 shi4 dan1xin1 ni3 qing2xu4 shi1kong4。"

msgid ""
"You knew the work Monika did, so you know how these things sometimes end."
msgstr ""
"既然​你们​知道​莫妮卡​从事​的​行当​，​那​也​应该​知道​有时候​会​有​什么​结局​。\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3men5 zhi1dao4 Mo4ni1ka3 cong2shi4 de5 hang2dang5，na4 ye3 ying1gai1 zhi1dao4 you3shi2hou5 hui4 you3 shen2me5 jie2ju2。"

msgid ""
"You knew what this job was. What we came here to do.\n"
"\n"
"If you didn't have the stomach to see it through, you should have stayed at the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​我们​这​一票​是​来​做​什么​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​没有​胆子​把​事​做​绝​，​你​当初​就​应该​待​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 zhe4 yi1 piao4 shi4 lai2 zuo4 shen2me5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 mei2you3 dan3zi5 ba3 shi4 zuo4 jue2，ni3 dang1chu1 jiu4 ying1gai1 dai1 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid ""
"You know as well as I do. You worship that monster. You seduced me into coming here so that *I* would worship him.\n"
"\n"
"If you hadn't found me... if you hadn't *baited* me... none of this would have happened."
msgstr ""
"你​心里​清楚​得​很​。​你​崇拜​那​怪物​。​你​引诱​我​来到​这里​，​就是​为了​让​*​我​*​也​崇拜​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​不是​你​找到​我​……​如果​不是​你​*​引诱​*​我​……​这​一切​都​不会​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xin1li5 qing1chu5 de2 hen3。ni3 chong2bai4 na4 guai4wu5。ni3 yin3you4 wo3 lai2dao4 zhe4li3，jiu4shi4 wei4le5 rang4*wo3*ye3 chong2bai4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 bu4shi4 ni3 zhao3dao4 wo3……ru2guo3 bu4shi4 ni3*yin3you4*wo3……zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 bu4hui4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid "You know better than anyone."
msgstr ""
"这​一点​你​比​任何人​都​清楚​。\n"
"zhe4 yi1dian3 ni3 bi3 ren4 he2 ren2 dou1 qing1chu5。"

msgid "You know exactly what I'm talking about."
msgstr ""
"你​非常​清楚​我​在​说​什么​。\n"
"ni3 fei1chang2 qing1chu5 wo3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。"

msgid "You know him?"
msgstr ""
"你​认识​他​？\n"
"ni3 ren4shi5 ta1？"

msgid ""
"You know how I like stories? In Gesundbrunnen nothing new ever happened.\n"
"\n"
"Here, there's something new every day. It's amazing.\n"
"\n"
"I couldn't believe it when I visited here. So I had to come."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​我​喜欢​听​故事​吧​？​在​健康​泉​，​从来​没什么​新鲜事​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​这里​呢​，​每天​都​有​新​事物​。​这​是​多​棒​的​事​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​第一次​来​这里​时​简直​不敢相信​，​所以​我​一定​要​再​来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 xi3huan5 ting1 gu4shi4 ba1？zai4 jian4kang1 quan2，cong2lai2 mei2shen2me5 xin1 xian1 shi4 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4li3 ni2，mei3tian1 dou1 you3 xin1 shi4wu4。zhe4 shi4 duo1 bang4 de5 shi4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 di4yi1ci4 lai2 zhe4li3 shi2 jian3zhi2 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4，suo3yi3 wo3 yi1ding4 yao4 zai4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"You know how it is this close to a product launch. We basically live here "
"now."
msgstr ""
"你​也​知道​，​产品​马上​就​到​发售日​了​。​我们​现在​基本上​都​住​在​这​。\n"
"ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4，chan3pin3 ma3shang4 jiu4 dao4 fa1 shou4 ri4 le5。wo3men5 xian4zai4 ji1ben3shang5 dou1 zhu4 zai4 zhe4。"

msgid ""
"You know how it is with us and Management. The left hand doesn't know what "
"the right hand is doing. It's ridiculous."
msgstr ""
"你​也​知道​我们​和​管理处​的​沟通模式​。​左手​不​知道​右手​在​做​什么​事​之类​的​。​简直​荒唐​。\n"
"ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 he4 guan3 li3 chu3 de5 gou1 tong1 mo2 shi4。zuo3shou3 bu4 zhi1dao4 you4shou3 zai4 zuo4 shen2me5 shi4 zhi1lei4 de5。jian3zhi2 huang1tang2。"

msgid ""
"You know it for what it is: a pleasant illusion that will shatter at the "
"sound of the first gunshot."
msgstr ""
"你​对此​心知肚明​：​这​不过​是​场​美妙​的​幻梦​，​注定​会​随着​第一声​枪响​而​化为泡影​。\n"
"ni3 dui4 ci3 xin1zhi1du4ming2：zhe4 bu4guo4 shi4 chang2 mei3miao4 de5 huan4meng4，zhu4ding4 hui4 sui2zhe5 di4yi1sheng1 qiang1 xiang3 er2 hua4wei2pao4ying3。"

msgid "You know it won’t last."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​这份​宁静​不会​太久​了​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 fen4 ning2jing4 bu4hui4 tai4 jiu3 le5。"

msgid "You know it’s true."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​这是​真的​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 zhen1de5。"

msgid "You know something about it?"
msgstr ""
"你​对此​有​了解​吗​？\n"
"ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 liao3jie3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You know that I can't do that. You don't have the appropriate clearance to touch this terminal, let alone service it.\n"
"\n"
"Besides, it's been running great since that other maintenance team worked on it last week. I'm surprised that you don't have that in your records."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​我​不能​这么​做​。​你​没有​相应​的​权限​触碰​这台​终端​，​更​别说​进行​维修​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​况且​自从​上周​另​一支​检修​团队​处理​过​之后​，​它​一直​运行​良好​。​你​居然​不​知道​这件​事​吗​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 bu4neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4。ni3 mei2you3 xiang1ying4 de5 quan2xian4 chu4peng4 zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1，geng1 bie2shuo1 jin4xing2 wei2xiu1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"kuang4qie3 zi4cong2 shang4zhou1 ling4 yi1 zhi1 jian3xiu1 tuan2dui4 chu3li3 guo4 zhi1hou4，ta1 yi1zhi2 yun4xing2 liang2hao3。ni3 ju1ran2 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 ma5。"

msgid ""
"You know that I can't pay you for this, right? I mean, not with money.\n"
"\n"
"And if you're tryin' to make me the same \"deal\" that Kroner was, you can forget it."
msgstr ""
"不过​你​知道​我​现在​没法​给​你​吧​？​我​是​说​，​我​兜里​没带​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​如果​你​在​跟​克​罗纳​打​一样​的​“​主意​”​，​那​还是​别聊​了​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 xian4zai4 mei2fa3 gei3 ni3 ba1？wo3 shi4 shuo1，wo3 dou1 li3 mei2 dai4 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4 ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 gen1 ke4 luo2na4 da3 yi1yang4 de5“zhu3yi5”，na4 hai2shi5 bie4 liao2 le5。"

msgid "You know that you can't let this slide."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​不能​放着​这事​不管​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 bu4neng2 fang4 zhao2 zhe4 shi4 bu4guan3。"

msgid ""
"You know that you haven't seen the conclusion, right? There were only six "
"episodes saved in that media center's memory. The show ran for seven."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​你​还​没​看到​结局​，​对​吧​？​媒体​库里​只​保存​了​六集​，​但​这部​剧​总共​有​七集​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 ni3 hai2 mei2 kan4dao4 jie2ju2，dui4 ba1？mei2ti3 ku4 li3 zhi3 bao3cun2 le5 liu4 ji2，dan4 zhe4 bu4 ju4 zong3gong4 you3 qi1 ji2。"

msgid ""
"You know the kinds of things that happen in that room, Marta. You've heard "
"the stories - we both did."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​你​清楚​那个​房间​里​发生​过​什么​事​。​你​听说​过​那些​传言​—​—​我们​都​听说​过​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ni3 qing1chu5 na4ge5 fang2jian1 li3 fa1sheng1 guo4 shen2me5 shi4。ni3 ting1shuo1 guo4 na4xie1 chuan2yan2——wo3men5 dou1 ting1shuo1 guo4。"

msgid ""
"You know what I mean.\n"
"\n"
"People who’ve been around, seen things, been there, done that, got the scars, want to chat about it."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​我​的​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​经历​风雨​、​见多识广​、​身经百战​、​满身​伤痕​的​人​，​都​想​聊聊​自己​的​过去​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 de5 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 jing1li4 feng1yu3、jian4duo1shi2guang3、shen1jing1bai3zhan4、man3shen1 shang1hen2 de5 ren2，dou1 xiang3 liao2 liao2 zi4ji3 de5 guo4qu4。"

msgid ""
"You know what I'm talking about, Glory. The missing pendant. The Other "
"Place. And the burning hand that you brought back with you."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​我​在​说​什么​，​格洛丽​。​失踪​的​吊​坠​。​另​一个​地方​。​还有​你​回来​时​正在​着火​的​手​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5，Ge2luo4li2。shi1zong1 de5 diao4 zhui4。ling4 yi1ge5 di4fang1。hai2you3 ni3 hui2lai5 shi2 zheng4zai4 zhao2huo3 de5 shou3。"

msgid ""
"You know what I'm talking about. There's an AI that wants me dead for "
"helping you."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​我​在​说​什么​。​有个​AI​因为​我​帮​了​你​而​要​搞​死​我​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。you3 ge4 AI yin1wei4 wo3 bang1 le5 ni3 er2 yao4 gao3 si3 wo3。"

msgid "You know what she's talking about, Marta. You ruined her life."
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​，​你​知道​她​在​说​什么​。​是​你​毁​了​她​的​人生​。\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ni3 zhi1dao4 ta1 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。shi4 ni3 hui3 le5 ta1 de5 ren2sheng1。"

msgid ""
"You know what you're saying, right?\n"
"\n"
"If we choose not to kill the spirit - if we purify it instead - then we won't have any hope of killing Harrow. He'll feel his control slipping away, and he'll dart before we can catch him."
msgstr ""
"你​知道​自己​在​说​什么​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​我们​选择​不​杀死​这个​精魂​而是​净化​它​，​那​我们​就​没有​任何​希望​干掉​哈罗​了​。​他会​感知​到​自己​的​控制力​正在​消失​，​并​在​我们​抓住​他​之前​逃走​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wo3men5 xuan3ze2 bu4 sha1si3 zhe4ge5 jing1hun2 er2shi4 jing4hua4 ta1，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 mei2you3 ren4he2 xi1wang4 gan4diao4 ha1luo2 le5。ta1 hui4 gan3zhi1 dao4 zi4ji3 de5 kong4 zhi4 li4 zheng4zai4 xiao1shi1，bing4 zai4 wo3men5 zhua1zhu4 ta1 zhi1qian2 tao2zou3。"

msgid "You know what? You can have your drone back now. Here you go."
msgstr ""
"把​你​的​无人机​拿回去​吧​。​给​你​。\n"
"ba3 ni3 de5 wu2ren2ji1 na2 hui2 qu4 ba1。gei3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You know what? You're absolutely right. We don't need to fight.\n"
"\n"
"You just pay us a small toll, and we'll be more than happy to let you cross our bridge. I'm thinkin'... say... five hundred nuyen per van."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​可​太​对​了​。​确实​没​必要​打​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​交点​过路费​，​我们​的​桥​就​随​你们​过​。​我​想想​……​不如​……​就​每车​五百​新円​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 ke3 tai4 dui4 le5。que4shi2 mei2 bi4yao4 da3。\n"
"\n"
"jiao1dian3 guo4lu4fei4，wo3men5 de5 qiao2 jiu4 sui2 ni3men5 guo4。wo3 xiang3 xiang3……bu4ru2……jiu4 mei3 che1 wu3 bai3 xin1 yuan2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You know where I'm coming from, pal... I can see it in your eyes. You've been on jobs that went south before.\n"
"\n"
"The only difference between you and me is that you were lucky enough not to get caught."
msgstr ""
"你​明白​我​的​意思​，​朋友​……​我能​从​你​的​眼中​看​出来​。​你​以前​肯定​也​经历​过​类似​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​我​之间​唯一​的​区别​，​就是​你​运气​好​没有​被​抓​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ming2bai5 wo3 de5 yi4si5，peng2you5……wo3 neng2 cong2 ni3 de5 yan3zhong1 kan4 chu1lai2。ni3 yi3qian2 ken3ding4 ye3 jing1li4 guo4 lei4si4 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wo3 zhi1jian1 wei2yi1 de5 qu1bie2，jiu4shi4 ni3 yun4qi5 hao3 mei2you3 bei4 zhua1 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"You know, $(l.name)... I have no idea why Monika chose you as a friend. You are rude, condescending, and arrogant.\n"
"\n"
"But your skills in the shadows are unparalleled. And for that, I suppose, I am thankful."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​……​我​真​不​明白​莫妮卡​为什么​选​你​做​朋友​。​你​粗鲁​，​傲慢​，​还​总是​一副​高高在上​的​样子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​在​暗影​界​的​本事​无人​能​及​。​就​这​一点​而言​，​我​想​我​该​谢谢​你​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……wo3 zhen1 bu4 ming2bai5 Mo4ni1ka3 wei4shen2me5 xuan3 ni3 zuo4 peng2you5。ni3 cu1lu3，ao4man4，hai2 zong3shi4 yi1 fu4 gao1gao1zai4shang4 de5 yang4zi5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 zai4 an4ying3 jie4 de5 ben3shi4 wu2ren2 neng2 ji2。jiu4 zhe4 yi1dian3 er2yan2，wo3 xiang3 wo3 gai1 xie4xie5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You know, $(l.name)... when I told you to enter the facility quietly, I did not mean \"start a bloody firefight in the streets outside of the building.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He lets out an exasperated sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh well. The cat's out of the bag now... you'll just have to make the best of it."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​啊​……​我​让​你​悄悄​潜入​设施​，​不是​让​你​“​在​大楼​外​的​街道​上​展开​一场​该死​的​枪战​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​恼怒​地叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​唉​，​事已至此​……​只能​尽力而为​了​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) a1……wo3 rang4 ni3 qiao1qiao1 qian2ru4 she4shi1，bu4shi4 rang4 ni3“zai4 da4lou2 wai4 de5 jie1dao4 shang4 zhan3kai1 yi1 chang2 gai1si3 de5 qiang1zhan4”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nao3nu4 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ai1，shi4yi3zhi4ci3……zhi3neng2 jin4li4er2wei2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You know, *Eiger*...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes his time pronouncing the name. Savors it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...I'd like to tell you a story. We share so much history, you and I."
msgstr ""
"话​说​，​*​艾格尔​*​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​一字一顿​地念出​她​的​名字​，​好像​在​回味​什么​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​我​想​给​你​讲个​故事​。​你​我​之间​有着​如此​深厚​的​渊源​。\n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1，*Ai4ge2er3*……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 zi4 yi1 dun4 de5 nian4 chu1 ta1 de5 ming2zi5，hao3xiang4 zai4 hui2wei4 shen2me5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……wo3 xiang3 gei3 ni3 jiang3 ge4 gu4shi4。ni3 wo3 zhi1jian1 you3zhe5 ru2ci3 shen1hou4 de5 yuan1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"You know... if the Rabengeister wished to be found, we'd open a fucking cafe.\n"
"\n"
"What do you want of us, stranger? Say your piece."
msgstr ""
"如果​“​鸦灵​”​想​让​别人​找到​的话​，​我们​他妈​就​去​开个​餐馆​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​陌生人​，​你​到底​有​什么​事​？​赶紧​说​。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3“Ya1ling2” xiang3 rang4 bie2ren5 zhao3dao4 de5hua4，wo3men5 ta1 ma1 jiu4 qu4 kai1 ge4 can1guan3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mo4sheng1ren2，ni3 dao4di3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？gan3jin3 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"You lack the means to perceive what I really am. You do not possess the Sight. All said, that is probably for the best.\n"
"\n"
"Your species is so very fragile, after all."
msgstr ""
"你​缺乏​感知​我​真实​本质​的​手段​。​你​并​不​具备​那双​慧眼​。​说到底​，​这​或许​是​最好​的​安排​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​，​你们​这个​物种​实在​太过​脆弱​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que1fa2 gan3zhi1 wo3 zhen1shi2 ben3zhi4 de5 shou3duan4。ni3 bing4 bu4 ju4bei4 na4 shuang1 hui4yan3。shuo1dao4di3，zhe4 huo4xu3 shi4 zui4hao3 de5 an1pai2。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4，ni3men5 zhe4ge5 wu4zhong3 shi2zai4 tai4guo4 cui4ruo4。"

msgid ""
"You launch yourself at the window, your shoulder slamming into the hard surface with a heavy thud.\n"
"\n"
"Despite your best efforts, the window does not budge."
msgstr ""
"你​猛地​扑​向​窗户​，​肩膀​重重​撞​在​坚硬​的​表面​上​，​发出​沉重​的​闷响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​你​竭尽全力​，​窗户​依然​纹丝不动​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 meng3de5 pu1 xiang4 chuang1hu5，jian1bang3 chong2chong2 zhuang4 zai4 jian1ying4 de5 biao3mian4 shang4，fa1chu1 chen2zhong4 de5 men1 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 ni3 jie2jin4quan2li4，chuang1hu5 yi1ran2 wen2si1bu4dong4。"

msgid ""
"You launch yourself at the window, your shoulder slamming into the hard surface with a heavy thud. \n"
"\n"
"Despite your best efforts, the window does not budge."
msgstr ""
"你​猛地​扑​向​窗户​，​肩膀​重重​撞​在​坚硬​的​表面​上​，​发出​沉重​的​闷响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​你​竭尽全力​，​窗户​依然​纹丝不动​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 meng3de5 pu1 xiang4 chuang1hu5，jian1bang3 chong2chong2 zhuang4 zai4 jian1ying4 de5 biao3mian4 shang4，fa1chu1 chen2zhong4 de5 men1 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 ni3 jie2jin4quan2li4，chuang1hu5 yi1ran2 wen2si1bu4dong4。"

msgid ""
"You launch yourself at the window, your shoulder slamming into the hard surface with a heavy thud. \n"
"\n"
"Despite your best efforts, the window doesn't budge."
msgstr ""
"你​猛地​扑​向​窗户​，​肩膀​重重​撞​在​坚硬​的​表面​上​，​发出​沉重​的​闷响​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​你​竭尽全力​，​窗户​依然​纹丝不动​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 meng3de5 pu1 xiang4 chuang1hu5，jian1bang3 chong2chong2 zhuang4 zai4 jian1ying4 de5 biao3mian4 shang4，fa1chu1 chen2zhong4 de5 men1 xiang3。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 ni3 jie2jin4quan2li4，chuang1hu5 yi1ran2 wen2si1bu4dong4。"

msgid "You lead, and I'll follow, boss."
msgstr ""
"你​带头​，​我​跟上​，​老大​。\n"
"ni3 dai4tou2，wo3 gen1shang4，lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"You leaf forward and find that there are at least twenty more pages' worth "
"of rules. Each is worded vaguely enough to have multiple interpretations."
msgstr ""
"你​继续​翻阅​，​发现​至少​还有​二十多​页​的​规则​。​每条​规则​的​措辞​都​很​暧昧​，​可以​有​多种​解释​。\n"
"ni3 ji4xu4 fan1yue4，fa1xian4 zhi4shao3 hai2you3 er4shi2duo1 xie2 de5 gui1ze2。mei3 tiao2 gui1ze2 de5 cuo4ci2 dou1 hen3 ai4mei4，ke3yi3 you3 duo1zhong3 jie3shi4。"

msgid ""
"You leap back, away from the flames. Within seconds, the little drone collapses in on itself, burying whatever it was carrying in a sludge of molten metal and plastic.\n"
"\n"
"Empty-handed, you have no choice but to walk away."
msgstr ""
"你​后退​躲开​了​火焰​。​几秒钟​内​，​无人机​失去​支撑​垮塌​倒下​，​将​它​所​携带​的​物品​埋​在​熔化​的​金属​和​塑料​的​泥浆​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​两手空空​的​你​别无选择​，​只能​转身​离去​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hou4tui4 duo3kai1 le5 huo3yan4。ji1 miao3 zhong1 nei4，wu2ren2ji1 shi1qu4 zhi1cheng1 kua3ta1 dao3xia4，jiang1 ta1 suo3 xie2dai4 de5 wu4pin3 mai2 zai4 rong2hua4 de5 jin1shu3 he4 su4liao4 de5 ni2jiang1 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"liang3shou3kong1kong1 de5 ni3 bie2wu2xuan3ze2，zhi3neng2 zhuan3shen1 li2qu4。"

msgid "You leave that to me."
msgstr ""
"交给​我​吧​。\n"
"jiao1gei3 wo3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You leave that to us, friend.\n"
"\n"
"We'll take 'em out for you."
msgstr ""
"交给​我们​吧​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​来​干掉​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"jiao1gei3 wo3men5 ba1，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 lai2 gan4diao4 ta1men5。"

msgid "You let Alice track you to lure me here, didn't you?"
msgstr ""
"你​故意​让​爱丽丝​追踪​你​，​从而​把​我​引到​这里​，​是不是​？\n"
"ni3 gu4yi4 rang4 ai4li4si1 zhui1zong1 ni3，cong2er2 ba3 wo3 yin3 dao4 zhe4li3，shi4bu5shi4？"

msgid ""
"You let me live, and it's all yours. I'll put a fucking ribbon on it for you.\n"
"\n"
"Then I'll disappear, never bother any of you again. Scout's honor."
msgstr ""
"你​放过​我​这​条命​，​它​就是​你​的​了​。​我​他​妈​甚至​可以​给​你​打​包装盒​带走​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​我​就​会​消失​，​再也不会​打扰​你们​中​任何​一位​。​以​名誉​担保​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fang4guo4 wo3 zhe4 tiao2 ming4，ta1 jiu4shi4 ni3 de5 le5。wo3 ta1 ma1 shen4zhi4 ke3yi3 gei3 ni3 da3 bao1 zhuang1 he2 dai4zou3。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 wo3 jiu4 hui4 xiao1shi1，zai4 ye3 bu4 hui4 da3rao3 ni3men5 zhong4 ren4he2 yi1 wei4。yi3 ming2yu4 dan1bao3。"

msgid ""
"You let me use your power tap to shut down the Azzies' grid. In return, I'll"
" buy you some new solar panels."
msgstr ""
"你​让​我​用​你​的​电力​接口​关闭​阿兹佬​的​电网​。​作为​回报​，​我会​给​你们​买​一些​新​的​太阳能​电池板​。\n"
"ni3 rang4 wo3 yong4 ni3 de5 dian4li4 jie1kou3 guan1bi4 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 dian4wang3。zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，wo3 hui4 gei3 ni3men5 mai3 yi1xie1 xin1 de5 tai4yang2neng2 dian4 chi2 ban3。"

msgid "You let us worry about that."
msgstr ""
"这​就​不劳​你​费心​了​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4 bu4 lao2 ni3 fei4xin1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You lied to it. You're going to kill it after all.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Blitz's sense of relief is palpable.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good!"
msgstr ""
"你​骗​了​它​。​原来​你​还是​打算​杀死​它​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​布里​茨​明显​松​了​一口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​太好了​！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 pian4 le5 ta1。yuan2lai2 ni3 hai2shi5 da3suan4 sha1si3 ta1 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 ming2xian3 song1 le5 yi1kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tai4hao3le5！"

msgid ""
"You lied to it. You're going to kill it after all.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The relief on Dietrich's face is plain as day.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good."
msgstr ""
"你​骗​了​它​。​原来​你​还是​打算​杀死​它​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​脸上​露出​如释重负​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 pian4 le5 ta1。yuan2lai2 ni3 hai2shi5 da3suan4 sha1si3 ta1 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 ru2shi4zhong4fu4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"You lied to it. You're going to kill it after all.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}You can see something in Glory's face that looks like relief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good."
msgstr ""
"你​骗​了​它​。​原来​你​还是​打算​杀死​它​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​脸上​露出​如释重负​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 pian4 le5 ta1。yuan2lai2 ni3 hai2shi5 da3suan4 sha1si3 ta1 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 ru2shi4zhong4fu4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"You lied to it. You're going to kill it after all.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}You can see the relief on Eiger's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good."
msgstr ""
"你​骗​了​它​。​原来​你​还是​打算​杀死​它​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔​脸上​露出​如释重负​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 pian4 le5 ta1。yuan2lai2 ni3 hai2shi5 da3suan4 sha1si3 ta1 a1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 ru2shi4zhong4fu4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。"

msgid "You lied to me, Duerr."
msgstr ""
"你​骗​了​我​，​杜尔​。\n"
"ni3 pian4 le5 wo3，du4 er3。"

msgid ""
"You lied.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The razors slide out of Glory's sculpted fingertips and lock into place with a click.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There was no \"bad intel.\" And there was *no* reason for these deaths.\n"
"\n"
"None but your own diseased mind."
msgstr ""
"你​撒谎​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​利刃​从格洛丽​雕塑​般的​指尖​滑​出​，​咔哒​一声​固定​就位​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​根本​没有​什么​“​错误​情报​”​。​也​*​没有​*​什么​理由​让​这些​人​丧命​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​唯一​的​原因​就是​你​这​病态​的​内心​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 sa1huang3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} li4ren4 cong2 Ge2luo4li2 diao1su4 ban1 de5 zhi3jian1 hua2 chu1，ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 gu4ding4 jiu4 wei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gen1ben3 mei2you3 shen2me5“cuo4wu4 qing2bao4”。ye3*mei2you3*shen2me5 li3you2 rang4 zhe4xie1 ren2 sang4ming4。\n"
"\n"
"wei2yi1 de5 yuan2yin1 jiu4shi4 ni3 zhe4 bing4tai4 de5 nei4xin1。"

msgid ""
"You load the Aztechnology data into your computer, and your display fills with foreign words and symbols.\n"
"\n"
"You can post this data as-is for a quick sale, but without knowing what it says, you'll have no way of knowing whether you're getting a fair price for it..."
msgstr ""
"你​在​电脑​上​加载​阿兹特​科技​的​数据​，​屏幕​瞬间​被​陌生​文字​与​符号​填满​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​原封不动​地​发布​这些​数据​，​以求​快速​变现​。​但​如果​无法​解读​内容​的话​，​你​也​就​无从​判断​出价​是否​合理​……\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 dian4nao3 shang4 jia1zai4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 shu4ju4，ping2mu4 shun4jian1 bei4 mo4sheng1 wen2zi4 yu4 fu2hao4 tian2man3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 yuan2feng1bu4dong4 de5 fa1bu4 zhe4xie1 shu4ju4，yi3qiu2 kuai4su4 bian4xian4。dan4 ru2guo3 wu2fa3 jie3du2 nei4rong2 de5hua4，ni3 ye3 jiu4 wu2cong2 pan4duan4 chu1jia4 shi4fou3 he2li3……"

msgid ""
"You locate my AI, *destroy* it, then drive all the way out to the countryside. And finally, you shoot your way into my laboratory.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He leans forward, hands on the table, his eyes narrowed into a piercing stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So I have to ask you, shadowrunner - who are you, and why in God's name are you here?"
msgstr ""
"你​找到​我​的​AI​，​*​摧毁​*​它​，​然后​一路​开车​到​乡下​。​最后​，​你​一路​大开杀戒​闯入​我​的​实验室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向前​倾身​，​双手​放在​桌上​，​眼睛​眯成​一条​缝​，​目光​锐利​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我​必须​问​你​，​暗影​狂奔​者​—​—​你​是​谁​，​为什么​会​在​这里​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhao3dao4 wo3 de5 AI，*cui1hui3*ta1，ran2hou4 yi1lu4 kai1che1 dao4 xiang1xia5。zui4hou4，ni3 yi1lu4 dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4 chuang3ru4 wo3 de5 shi2yan4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，shuang1shou3 fang4 zai4 zhuo1 shang4，yan3jing5 mi2 cheng2 yi1 tiao2 feng2，mu4guang1 rui4li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 bi4xu1 wen4 ni3，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3——ni3 shi4 shei2，wei4shen2me5 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3？"

msgid ""
"You look at a moth and barely perceive sentience. You glance its way, amused, as it flutters towards a bright light in a vain attempt to… what? \n"
"\n"
"To enter? To draw strength? To burn? It doesn't know. Its epic struggle is barely one one-hundredth of your lifespan. The sum total of its existence is nothing against the vast scale of your struggles, your hopes, your dreams - which it could not fathom in a thousand thousand years. \n"
"\n"
"Poor moth."
msgstr ""
"你​看见​飞蛾​飞过​，​几乎​不​可能​有​想法​，​直到​你​饶有兴致​地​看着​它​徒劳地​扑​向​一团​明亮​的​光​……​为了​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​想​飞进去​？​汲取​能量​？​还是​自焚​？​它​自己​也​不​明白​。​它​那场​史诗​般的​挣扎​，​不过​是​你​生命​长河​中​百万分之一​的​微尘​。​它​存在​的​全部​意义​，​与​你​那些​浩瀚​的​奋斗​、​希望​与​梦想​相比​，​根本​不值一提​—​—​纵使​它​活上​千万年​，​也​无法​理解​这些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可怜​的​飞蛾​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4jian4 fei1e2 fei1guo4，ji1hu1 bu4 ke3neng2 you3 xiang3fa3，zhi2dao4 ni3 rao2 you3 xing4 zhi4 de5 kan4 zhao2 ta1 tu2 lao2 de5 pu1 xiang4 yi1 tuan2 ming2liang4 de5 guang1……wei4le5 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 xiang3 fei1 jin4 qu4？ji2qu3 neng2liang4？hai2shi5 zi4fen2？ta1 zi4ji3 ye3 bu4 ming2bai5。ta1 na4 chang2 shi3shi1 ban1 de5 zheng1zha2，bu4guo4 shi4 ni3 sheng1ming4 chang2he2 zhong4 bai3 wan4 fen4 zhi1 yi1 de5 wei1chen2。ta1 cun2zai4 de5 quan2bu4 yi4yi4，yu4 ni3 na4xie1 hao4han4 de5 fen4dou4、xi1wang4 yu4 meng4xiang3 xiang1bi3，gen1ben3 bu4 zhi2 yi1 ti2——zong4shi3 ta1 huo2 shang4 qian1 wan4 nian2，ye3 wu2fa3 li3jie3 zhe4xie1。\n"
"\n"
"ke3lian2 de5 fei1e2。"

msgid "You look away from the drawer."
msgstr ""
"你​把​目光​从​抽屉​上移​开​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 mu4guang1 cong2 chou1ti5 shang4 yi2 kai1。"

msgid ""
"You look down to see a pair of bright eyes set into a scruffy face looking back up at you.\n"
"\n"
"Dante. Monika's old dog.\n"
"\n"
"Looking down into those huge brown eyes, you see intelligence and sadness."
msgstr ""
"你​低头​望去​，​只见​一双​明亮​的​眼睛​嵌​在​一张​毛发​凌乱​的​脸上​，​正​仰望​着​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​但丁​。​莫妮卡​之前​养​的​狗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​凝视着​那双​巨大​的​棕色​眼睛​，​你​看见​了​聪慧​与​悲伤​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 di1tou2 wang4 qu4，zhi3jian4 yi1 shuang1 ming2liang4 de5 yan3jing5 kan3 zai4 yi1 zhang1 mao2fa4 ling2luan4 de5 lian3 shang4，zheng1 yang3wang4 zhao2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 dan4ding1。Mo4ni1ka3 zhi1qian2 yang3 de5 gou3。\n"
"\n"
"ning2 shi4 zhao2 na4 shuang1 ju4da4 de5 zong1se4 yan3jing5，ni3 kan4jian4 le5 cong1hui4 yu4 bei1shang1。"

msgid ""
"You look like you can handle yourself. We could probably use you, if you'd be willing to help. There'd even be some money in it for you. But if not, well...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The assault rifle in his hand shifts position slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...That's a different conversation."
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​有点​本事​。​要是​你​愿意​帮忙​，​我们​或许​能​用得上​你​。​还​能​给​你​点​报酬​。​不过​要是​你​不​愿意​的话​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​手中​的​突击​步枪​略微​挪​了​下​位置​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​那​就是​另一回事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 you3dian3 ben3shi4。yao4shi5 ni3 yuan4yi4 bang1mang2，wo3men5 huo4xu3 neng2 yong4de5shang4 ni3。hai2 neng2 gei3 ni3 dian3 bao4chou5。bu4guo4 yao4shi5 ni3 bu4 yuan4yi4 de5hua4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shou3 zhong4 de5 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1 lu:e4wei1 nuo2 le5 xia4 wei4zhi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……na4 jiu4shi4 ling4 yi1 hui2 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You look like you keep a close eye on this kiez. Have you seen a shipment of"
" weapons pass through here recently?"
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​一直​在​密切​关注​这个​街区​。​你​最近​有见​过​一批​武器​经过​这里​吗​？\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 yi1zhi2 zai4 mi4qie4 guan1zhu4 zhe4ge5 jie1qu1。ni3 zui4jin4 you3 jian4 guo4 yi1 pi1 wu3qi4 jing1guo4 zhe4li3 ma5？"

msgid "You look okay. Did Aljernon take care of him for you?"
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​没事​。​阿尔杰​农帮​你​解决​了​他​吗​？\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 mei2shi4。E1er3jie2nong2 bang1 ni3 jie3jue2 le5 ta1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You look pretty dug in out here. How long do you intend to man the trenches?"
msgstr ""
"这里​的​防御​挺​牢固​啊​。​你们​打算​在​这里​坚守​多久​？\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 fang2yu4 ting3 lao2gu4 a1。ni3men5 da3suan4 zai4 zhe4li3 jian1shou3 duo1jiu3？"

msgid "You look terrible, my friend. Tell me what has happened."
msgstr ""
"你​看上去​糟透了​，​我​的​朋友​。​告诉​我​发生​了​什么​。\n"
"ni3 kan4shang5qu5 zao1 tou4 le5，wo3 de5 peng2you5。gao4su4 wo3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"You look to the right - to the beast entangled in the cold nest of metal and"
" plastic. Although it still glows with life, you note that the aura "
"radiating from the dragon’s body is damaged, sickly, dull. "
msgstr ""
"你​向​右​望去​—​—​那头​被困​在​冰冷​金属​与​塑料​巢穴​中​的​野兽​。​尽管​它​仍​闪烁着​生命​的​光芒​，​但​你​注意​到​从​龙身​散发出​的​气息​已​受损​，​病态​而​黯淡​。\n"
"ni3 xiang4 you4 wang4 qu4——na4 tou2 bei4kun4 zai4 bing1leng3 jin1shu3 yu4 su4liao4 chao2xue2 zhong4 de5 ye3shou4。jin3guan3 ta1 reng2 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 sheng1ming4 de5 guang1mang2，dan4 ni3 zhu4yi4 dao4 cong2 long2 shen1 san3 fa1 chu1 de5 qi4xi1 yi3 shou4sun3，bing4tai4 er2 an4dan4。"

msgid "You looked good as a redhead."
msgstr ""
"你​留红​发时​很​好看​。\n"
"ni3 liu2 hong2 fa1 shi2 hen3 hao3kan4。"

msgid "You looked... distraught... when Marta died. How are you holding up?"
msgstr ""
"玛​尔塔​死​的​时候​……​你​看起来​……​心烦意乱​。​你​现在​还好​吗​？\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 si3 de5 shi2hou5……ni3 kan4qi3lai5……xin1fan2yi4luan4。ni3 xian4zai4 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid "You lookin' for some magic, meine Freunde?"
msgstr ""
"各位朋友​，​你们​想来​点​魔法​吗​？\n"
"ge4 wei4 peng2 you3，ni3men5 xiang3lai2 dian3 mo2fa3 ma5？"

msgid "You lost?"
msgstr ""
"你​迷路​了​？\n"
"ni3 mi2lu4 le5？"

msgid ""
"You loved her. I get it. Skip to the part where you racked up those debts."
msgstr ""
"你​爱​她​。​我​听懂​了​。​直接​说​你​是​怎么​欠​一屁股债​的​吧​。\n"
"ni3 ai4 ta1。wo3 ting1dong3 le5。zhi2jie1 shuo1 ni3 shi4 zen3me5 qian4 yi1 pi4 gu3 zhai4 de5 ba1。"

msgid "You loved her. That much is pretty clear."
msgstr ""
"你​爱​她​。​这​一点​显而易见​。\n"
"ni3 ai4 ta1。zhe4 yi1dian3 xian3er2yi4jian4。"

msgid ""
"You made the right choice, $(l.name). That... thing... shouldn't've been "
"alive in the first place."
msgstr ""
"你​做​了​正确​的​选择​，​$(l.name)​。​那个​……​东西​……​从​一​开始​就​不该​活着​。\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2，$(l.name)。na4ge5……dong1xi1……cong2 yi1 kai1shi3 jiu4 bu4gai1 huo2zhe5。"

msgid ""
"You make a break for the door.\n"
"\n"
"As you exit the room, the door slams shut behind you. Alarms begin blaring throughout the building."
msgstr ""
"你​夺门而出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​走出​房间​时​，​门​在​你​身后​砰​地​关上​了​。​警报声​开始​响彻​整栋​大楼​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 duo2men2er2chu1。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3chu1 fang2jian1 shi2，men2 zai4 ni3 shen1hou4 peng1 de5 guan1shang4 le5。jing3 bao4 sheng1 kai1shi3 xiang3che4 zheng3 dong4 da4lou2。"

msgid ""
"You make a compelling argument. This job has been a load of drek since they canned my assistant.\n"
"\n"
"Screw it. The panel's all yours. I'm off to find a pub."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​很​有​道理​。​自从​他们​开除​了​我​的​助理​之后​，​这份​工作​就是​一坨​大粪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​拉倒​吧​。​控制板​归​你​了​。​我​得​去​找家​酒吧​喝一杯​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 hen3 you3 dao4li5。zi4cong2 ta1men5 kai1chu2 le5 wo3 de5 zhu4li3 zhi1hou4，zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 yi1 tuo2 da4fen4。\n"
"\n"
"la1dao3 ba1。kong4 zhi4 ban3 gui1 ni3 le5。wo3 de2 qu4 zhao3 jia1 jiu3ba1 he4 yi1 bei1。"

msgid ""
"You make a purchase, you can ask as many questions as you like. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The corner of his mouth twitches upward.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Make a big enough purchase, and who knows? I might even answer a few."
msgstr ""
"只要​你​买​东西​，​你​就​可以​随便​提问​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​嘴角​向上​抽动​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​买​的​够​多​，​兴许​我​还​会​回答​你​几个​问题​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 mai3 dong1xi1，ni3 jiu4 ke3yi3 sui2bian4 ti2wen4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 xiang4shang4 chou1dong4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 mai3 de5 gou4 duo1，xing1xu3 wo3 hai2 hui4 hui2da2 ni3 ji3ge5 wen4ti2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"You manage to pull your hand back out of the drone and stumble back. The drone collapses in on itself, burying whatever it was carrying in a sludge of molten metal and plastic. Foul-smelling smoke pours from the remains.\n"
"\n"
"Empty-handed, you have no choice but to walk away."
msgstr ""
"你​成功​将​手​从​无人机​中​抽回​，​并​踉跄​着​后退​。​无人机​失去​支撑​垮塌​倒下​，​将​它​所​携带​的​物品​埋​在​熔化​的​金属​和​塑料​的​泥浆​中​。​刺鼻​的​烟雾​从​残骸​中​涌出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​两手空空​的​你​别无选择​，​只能​转身​离去​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cheng2gong1 jiang1 shou3 cong2 wu2ren2ji1 zhong4 chou1 hui2，bing4 liang4qiang4 zhao2 hou4tui4。wu2ren2ji1 shi1qu4 zhi1cheng1 kua3ta1 dao3xia4，jiang1 ta1 suo3 xie2dai4 de5 wu4pin3 mai2 zai4 rong2hua4 de5 jin1shu3 he4 su4liao4 de5 ni2jiang1 zhong4。ci4bi2 de5 yan1wu4 cong2 can2hai2 zhong4 yong3chu1。\n"
"\n"
"liang3shou3kong1kong1 de5 ni3 bie2wu2xuan3ze2，zhi3neng2 zhuan3shen1 li2qu4。"

msgid "You may be right, Vauclair. But this isn't the answer."
msgstr ""
"沃​克莱尔​，​也许​你​是​对​的​，​但​这​并​不是​正确​答案​。\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3，ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5，dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4shi4 zheng4que4 da2an4。"

msgid "You mean that she’s been in that cell for almost twenty years? "
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​她​在​那间​牢房​里​已经​有​差不多​二十年​了​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1 ta1 zai4 na4 jian1 lao2fang2 li3 yi3jing1 you3 cha4bu5duo1 er4 shi2 nian2 le5？"

msgid ""
"You mean the Rabengeister? Like I said, seems like something out of a fairy "
"tale to me."
msgstr ""
"鸦​什么​……​幽灵​吗​？​我​说​了​，​感觉​像是​什么​童话​里​走​出来​的​人物​。\n"
"Ya1shen2me5……you1ling2 ma5？wo3 shuo1 le5，gan3jue2 xiang4 shi4 shen2me5 tong2hua4 li3 zou3 chu1lai2 de5 ren2wu4。"

msgid ""
"You mean, why'd I lose my taste for war? Besides losing both legs and a "
"lung?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​说​，​我​为什么​在​失去​双腿​和​肺​之后​，​也​失去​了​对​战争​的​兴趣​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1，wo3 wei4shen2me5 zai4 shi1qu4 shuang1tui3 he4 fei4 zhi1hou4，ye3 shi1qu4 le5 dui4 zhan4zheng1 de5 xing4qu4？"

msgid ""
"You mentioned a bunch of after-market mods when we found it. Have you "
"figured out what they do yet?"
msgstr ""
"我们​发现​它​时​，​你​提到​上面​装​了​一堆​改装​部件​。​你​搞清楚​它们​的​功能​了​吗​？\n"
"wo3men5 fa1xian4 ta1 shi2，ni3 ti2dao4 shang4mian4 zhuang1 le5 yi1dui1 gai3zhuang1 bu4jian4。ni3 gao3 qing1 chu3 ta1men5 de5 gong1neng2 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You met that responsibility, $(l.name). In spades.\n"
"\n"
"Now please, call your contact and tell him that the job is done. I want to be on the next train out of here, and after that, I never even want to *think* about the Lodge again."
msgstr ""
"而​你​也​完美​地​负责​到底​了​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​立刻​联系​你​的​联络人​，​告诉​他​任务​已经​完成​。​我要​搭​下​一班​离开​这里​的​火车​，​之后​我​甚至​不想​再​*​想起​*​任何​有关​“​结社​”​的​事情​了​。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ni3 ye3 wan2mei3 de5 fu4ze2 dao4di3 le5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 li4ke4 lian2xi4 ni3 de5 lian2luo4ren2，gao4su4 ta1 ren4wu5 yi3jing1 wan2cheng2。wo3 yao4 da1 xia4 yi1 ban1 li2kai1 zhe4li3 de5 huo3che1，zhi1hou4 wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4xiang3 zai4*xiang3qi3*ren4he2 you3guan1“jie2she4” de5 shi4qing5 le5。"

msgid ""
"You might be thinking that I judged you too harshly in the beginning because of Hoffmann. You'd be right on that count... I probably did.\n"
"\n"
"But everything else that I said after Monika died was justified, whether you want to believe it or not."
msgstr ""
"你​或许​在​想​，​在​一​开始​的​时候​，​我​是不是​因为​霍夫曼​的​事情​对​你​的​评价​太过​严苛​。​某种意义​上​，​你​是​对​的​……​或许​我​确实​就是​这样​做​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​不管​你​信不信​吧​，​除此之外​我​在​莫妮卡​死后​说​的​每一件​事​都​是​有​其​道理​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 huo4xu3 zai4 xiang3，zai4 yi1 kai1shi3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 shi4bu5shi4 yin1wei4 huo4fu1man4 de5 shi4qing5 dui4 ni3 de5 ping2jia4 tai4guo4 yan2ke1。mou3 zhong3 yi4 yi4 shang4，ni3 shi4 dui4 de5……huo4xu3 wo3 que4shi2 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，bu4guan3 ni3 xin4 bu4 xin4 ba1，chu2ci3zhi1wai4 wo3 zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 si3hou4 shuo1 de5 mei3 yi1 jian4 shi4 dou1 shi4 you3 qi2 dao4li5 de5。"

msgid ""
"You might mean that. Or you could just be trying to de-escalate the situation.\n"
"\n"
"You tell me, fearless leader. You wanna hear why I did what I did? Or would you rather I just drop it? Because there are plenty of other things that I could be doing right now."
msgstr ""
"也许​吧​。​又​或者​你​只是​想​试图​缓和​紧张​气氛​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​说​吧​，​无畏​领袖​，​你​想​听听​我​这么​做​的​原因​吗​？​还是​说​你​希望​我​就此打住​？​毕竟​我​现在​还​有的是​事要​做​。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。you4 huo4zhe3 ni3 zhi3shi4 xiang3 shi4tu2 huan3he2 jin3zhang1 qi4fen1。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 shuo1 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4，ni3 xiang3 ting1 ting1 wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5 yuan2yin1 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 xi1wang4 wo3 jiu4 ci3 da3 zhu4？bi4jing4 wo3 xian4zai4 hai2 you3de5shi4 shi4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"You might recall that I said I'd dig into Audran's skin grafts. Well, I did, and that search has finally borne fruit.\n"
"\n"
"One of my contacts outside of Berlin handles the paperwork for private hospitals all across Germany. It's a dull, boring job, but it does have its perks."
msgstr ""
"你​或许​记得​我​曾​说​过​要​调查​奥​德兰​的​皮肤​移植手术​。​我​确实​这么​做​了​，​而​这次​调查​终于​有​了​结果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​柏林​以外​有​一位​线​人​负责​处理​全​德国​私立​医院​的​文书工作​。​这份​差事​枯燥乏味​，​但​也​确实​有​它​的​好处​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 huo4xu3 ji4de5 wo3 ceng2 shuo1 guo4 yao4 diao4cha2 Ao4de2lan2 de5 pi2fu1 yi2zhi2shou3shu4。wo3 que4shi2 zhe4me5 zuo4 le5，er2 zhe4 ci4 diao4cha2 zhong1yu2 you3 le5 jie1guo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 bo2lin2 yi3wai4 you3 yi1 wei4 xian4 ren2 fu4ze2 chu3li3 quan2 de2guo2 si1li4 yi1yuan4 de5 wen2 shu1 gong1 zuo4。zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4 ku1 zao4 fa2 wei4，dan4 ye3 que4shi2 you3 ta1 de5 hao3chu3。"

msgid ""
"You might still get your chance. Vauclair's whole history is so tied to the "
"Firewing that I'd be shocked if she doesn't play some role in this."
msgstr ""
"你​或许​还有​机会​。​沃​克莱尔​的​整个​人生​都​与​火翼​紧密​相连​，​我​可不​相信​她​会​与​此事​毫无关系​。\n"
"ni3 huo4xu3 hai2you3 ji1hui4。Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 zheng3ge4 ren2sheng1 dou1 yu4 Huo3yi4 jin3mi4 xiang1lian2，wo3 ke3bu5 xiang1xin4 ta1 hui4 yu4 ci3shi4 hao2 wu2 guan1 xi4。"

msgid "You must have the Cyberware Deactivator to attempt this mission."
msgstr ""
"你​必须​拥有​赛博​改造​限制器​才能​进行​此​任务​。\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 yong1you3 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 xian4 zhi4 qi4 cai2neng2 jin4xing2 ci3 ren4wu5。"

msgid "You must trust..."
msgstr ""
"你​必须​相信​……\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 xiang1xin4……"

msgid ""
"You must understand that there is a good reason for everything that we ask you to do, whether or not we take the time to explain it to you.\n"
"\n"
"In failing to follow our instructions, you've disappointed us and sacrificed your pay. The next time that we ask you to carry out a simple task, consider the monetary and professional rewards of compliance before throwing them away."
msgstr ""
"你​必须​明白​，​我们​要求​你​做​的​每件事​都​有​充分​的​理由​，​无论​我们​是否​花​时间​向​你​解释​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​未能​遵循​我们​的​指示​，​这​不仅​令​我们​失望​，​更​使​你​自己​蒙受​了​经济损失​。​下次​当​我们​要求​你​完成​一项​简单​任务​时​，​请​先​权衡​遵从​带来​的​经济​回报​与​职业​发展​机遇​，​再​决定​是否​放弃​这些​机会​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 ming2bai5，wo3men5 yao1qiu2 ni3 zuo4 de5 mei3 jian4 shi4 dou1 you3 chong1fen4 de5 li3you2，wu2lun4 wo3men5 shi4fou3 hua1 shi2jian1 xiang4 ni3 jie3shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wei4neng2 zun1xun2 wo3men5 de5 zhi3shi4，zhe4 bu4jin3 ling3 wo3men5 shi1wang4，geng1 shi3 ni3 zi4ji3 meng2shou4 le5 jing1 ji4 sun3 shi1。xia4ci4 dang1 wo3men5 yao1qiu2 ni3 wan2cheng2 yi1 xiang4 jian3dan1 ren4wu5 shi2，qing3 xian1 quan2heng2 zun1cong2 dai4lai2 de5 jing1ji4 hui2bao4 yu4 zhi2ye4 fa1zhan3 ji1yu4，zai4 jue2ding4 shi4fou3 fang4qi4 zhe4xie1 ji1hui4。"

msgid "You need anything else? Or are you ready to go crack some skulls?"
msgstr ""
"你​还有​什么​别的​事​吗​？​还是​说​你​准备​去​大开杀戒​了​？\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 zhun3bei4 qu4 dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4 le5？"

msgid ""
"You need only know that it is *evil.* And that is not a word that I use "
"lightly."
msgstr ""
"你​只​需​明白​它​是​*​邪恶​*​的​。​而​我​绝不会​轻易​使用​这个​词​。\n"
"ni3 zhi3 xu1 ming2bai5 ta1 shi4*xie2e4*de5。er2 wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 qing1yi4 shi3yong4 zhe4ge5 ci2。"

msgid "You need something from me?"
msgstr ""
"你​找​我​有事吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhao3 wo3 you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid "You need to answer some questions first."
msgstr ""
"你​得​先​回答​我​几个​问题​。\n"
"ni3 de2 xian1 hui2da2 wo3 ji3ge5 wen4ti2。"

msgid "You need to decide if you're ready to live in the real world or not."
msgstr ""
"你​需要​决定​自己​是否​准备​好​面对现实​世界​。\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 jue2ding4 zi4ji3 shi4fou3 zhun3bei4 hao3 mian4 dui4 xian4 shi2 shi4jie4。"

msgid ""
"You need to hear what she has to say. If you don't, this is going to gnaw at"
" you for the rest of your life."
msgstr ""
"你​必须​听听​她​的​想法​。​否则​，​这件​事会​让​你​余生​都​不得​安宁​。\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 ting1 ting1 ta1 de5 xiang3fa3。fou3ze2，zhe4 jian4 shi4 hui4 rang4 ni3 yu2sheng1 dou1 bu4de2 an1ning2。"

msgid ""
"You needed time, and I gave you time. Are you ready to talk about "
"Feuerstelle yet?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​自己​需要​时间​，​所以​我​给​你​时间​了​。​你​现在​愿意​继续​讲​“​火坑​”​的​事​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 zi4ji3 xu1yao4 shi2jian1，suo3yi3 wo3 gei3 ni3 shi2jian1 le5。ni3 xian4zai4 yuan4yi4 ji4xu4 jiang3“huo3keng1” de5 shi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You needn't mourn Monika's passing, $(l.name). She lives on as a part of me.\n"
"\n"
"Her thoughts. Her experiences. Her memories. \n"
"\n"
"All of these things are archived within my database. Stored alongside the minds of countless others. Preserved in stasis, saved for all time."
msgstr ""
"你​不必​为​莫妮卡​的​逝去​而​哀伤​，​$(l.name)​。​如今​她​已​化作​我​的​一部分​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​思想​。​她​的​经历​。​她​的​记忆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所有​这​一切​都​存储​在​我​的​数据库​中​，​与​无数​其他​意识​共存​。​静滞​其中​，​历久弥新​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4bi4 wei2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4qu4 er2 ai1shang1，$(l.name)。ru2jin1 ta1 yi3 hua4zuo4 wo3 de5 yi1bu4fen5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 si1xiang3。ta1 de5 jing1li4。ta1 de5 ji4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3you3 zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 cun2chu3 zai4 wo3 de5 shu4ju4ku4 zhong4，yu4 wu2shu4 qi2ta1 yi4shi2 gong4cun2。jing4 zhi4 qi2zhong1，li4jiu3mi2xin1。"

msgid ""
"You needn't trouble yourselves with fishing out your IDs.\n"
"\n"
"Just stand there a moment... I know a better way of determining the truth."
msgstr ""
"你们​不用​费劲​翻找​证件​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​那边​站​一会儿​就​好​……​我​有​更好​的​办法​来​查明真相​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 bu4yong4 fei4jin4 fan1 zhao3 zheng4jian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4bian5 zhan4 yi1hui4r5 jiu4 hao3……wo3 you3 geng1 hao3 de5 ban4fa3 lai2 cha2 ming2 zhen1 xiang1。"

msgid ""
"You never know, $(l.freund). Berlin is a small place and you seem quite able to insert yourself into all sorts of interesting business. \n"
"\n"
"But as you shadowrunners are fond of saying..."
msgstr ""
"世事难料​，​$(l.freund)​。​柏林​是​个​小​地方​，​而​你​似乎​总能​掺和​进​各种​有趣​的​事情​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​正如​你们​暗影​狂奔​者​经常​说​的​……\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 nan2 liao4，$(l.freund)。bo2lin2 shi4 ge4 xiao3 di4fang1，er2 ni3 si4hu1 zong3neng2 chan1huo5 jin4 ge4zhong3 you3qu4 de5 shi4qing5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zheng4ru2 ni3men5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 jing1chang2 shuo1 de5……"

msgid ""
"You never know, $(l.freund). Berlin is a small place, and you seem quite able to insert yourself into all sorts of interesting business. \n"
"\n"
"But as you shadowrunners are fond of saying..."
msgstr ""
"世事难料​，​$(l.freund)​。​柏林​是​个​小​地方​，​而​你​似乎​总能​掺和​进​各种​有趣​的​事情​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​正如​你们​暗影​狂奔​者​经常​说​的​……\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 nan2 liao4，$(l.freund)。bo2lin2 shi4 ge4 xiao3 di4fang1，er2 ni3 si4hu1 zong3neng2 chan1huo5 jin4 ge4zhong3 you3qu4 de5 shi4qing5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zheng4ru2 ni3men5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 jing1chang2 shuo1 de5……"

msgid "You never need to worry about me, $(l.name). I'm fine."
msgstr ""
"你​不用​担心​我​，​$(l.name)​。​我​没事​的​。\n"
"ni3 bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3，$(l.name)。wo3 mei2shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"You notice a set of scuff marks on the ground, as if something heavy was "
"dragged across here. The marks vanish into the wall."
msgstr ""
"你​注意​到​地面​上​有​几处​擦痕​，​好像​有​什么​重物​被​拖拽​过​。​痕迹​一直​延伸​到​墙壁​处​。\n"
"ni3 zhu4yi4 dao4 di4mian4 shang4 you3 ji1 chu3 ca1 hen2，hao3xiang4 you3 shen2me5 zhong4wu4 bei4 tuo1zhuai4 guo4。hen2ji4 yi1zhi2 yan2shen1 dao4 qiang2bi4 chu3。"

msgid ""
"You now command a team of Shadowrunners. When traveling to new mission locations you will be able to choose which members of your team to bring, and modify their loadout for the run.\n"
"\n"
"When members of your team become permanently incapacitated on a mission, they'll be automatically extracted for emergency medical care. They will be patched up and ready for action the next time you return to your safehouse. Avoid this loss of firepower by always carrying some BuMoNa Trauma Kits into the field. These can be purchased at the Street Doc's office in the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"你​现在​率领​着​一支​暗影​狂奔​者​队伍​。​前往​新​任务​地点​时​，​你​可以​选择​携带​哪些​队员​，​并​相应​调整​其​装备​配置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​的​队员​在​任务​中​永久​丧失​行动​能力​时​，​将​被​自动​撤出​以​接受​紧急​医疗​救护​，​并​在​你​下​一次​返回​安全​屋​恢复​完毕​。​为​避免​这种​情况​导致​的​火力​损失​，​请​务必​携带​移动​医联​急救包​进入​战场​。​这种​急救包​可以​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​街头​医生​办公室​买​到​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xian4zai4 shuai4ling3 zhao2 yi1 zhi1 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 dui4wu3。qian2wang3 xin1 ren4wu5 di4dian3 shi2，ni3 ke3yi3 xuan3ze2 xie2dai4 na3xie1 dui4yuan2，bing4 xiang1ying4 tiao2zheng3 qi2 zhuang1bei4 pei4zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 de5 dui4yuan2 zai4 ren4wu5 zhong4 yong3jiu3 sang4shi1 xing2dong4 neng2li4 shi2，jiang1 bei4 zi4dong4 che4chu1 yi3 jie1shou4 jin3ji2 yi1liao2 jiu4hu4，bing4 zai4 ni3 xia4 yi1ci4 fan3hui2 an1quan2 wu1 hui1fu4 wan2bi4。wei2 bi4mian3 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 dao3zhi4 de5 huo3li4 sun3shi1，qing3 wu4bi4 xie2dai4 yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 ji2jiu4bao1 jin4ru4 zhan4chang3。zhe4zhong3 ji2jiu4bao1 ke3yi3 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 jie1tou2 yi1sheng1 ban4gong1shi4 mai3 dao4。"

msgid ""
"You now have both the pieces required to fix the elevator and head down to "
"the basement."
msgstr ""
"你​现在​拿到​了​修理​电梯​和​前往​地下室​所​需​的​两个​零件​。\n"
"ni3 xian4zai4 na2dao4 le5 xiu1li3 dian4ti1 he4 qian2wang3 di4xia4shi4 suo3 xu1 de5 liang3 ge4 ling2jian4。"

msgid ""
"You obviously didn't know her. Monika lived and died for the F-State. She "
"didn't \"rule\" *anything.*"
msgstr ""
"你​明显​对​她​一无所知​。​莫妮卡​毕生​都​为了​动荡​带​而​奋斗​，​她​从未​“​统治​”​过​*​任何​东西​*​。\n"
"ni3 ming2xian3 dui4 ta1 yi1wu2suo3zhi1。Mo4ni1ka3 bi4sheng1 dou1 wei4le5 dong4dang4 dai4 er2 fen4dou4，ta1 cong2wei4“tong3zhi4” guo4*ren4he2 dong1xi1*。"

msgid "You okay in there?"
msgstr ""
"你​还好​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid "You okay, Blitz? Looks like you and Maliit saw some action back there."
msgstr ""
"你​没事​吧​，​布里​茨​？​看来​你​和玛丽​特​也​跟​人​动手​了​。\n"
"ni3 mei2shi4 ba1，Bu4li3ci2？kan4lai5 ni3 he4 ma3 li2 te4 ye3 gen1 ren2 dong4shou3 le5。"

msgid "You okay, Doc?"
msgstr ""
"你​还好​吗​，​博士​？\n"
"ni3 hai2hao3 ma5，bo2shi4？"

msgid "You okay, Glory?"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​还好​吗​？\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid "You okay?"
msgstr ""
"你​还好​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hai2hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You open the entry, and the screen fills with pages' worth of scientific "
"jargon."
msgstr ""
"你​打开​条目​，​屏幕​上​随即​显示​出​一页​页​科学​术语​。\n"
"ni3 da3kai1 tiao2mu4，ping2mu4 shang4 sui2ji2 xian3shi4 chu1 yi1 xie2 xie2 ke1xue2 shu4yu3。"

msgid ""
"You open your third eye and view the rock in astral space. It glows bright "
"with the Elemental Power of Earth. A shaman would be able to gain fetishes "
"from rock such as this."
msgstr ""
"你​打开​天眼​，​在​星界​空间​中​观察​这块​岩石​。​它​散发出​大地​元素​之力​的​明亮​光芒​。​萨满​可能​会​对​这样​的​岩石​产生​狂热​的​迷恋​。\n"
"ni3 da3kai1 tian1yan3，zai4 xing1 jie4 kong1jian1 zhong4 guan1cha2 zhe4 kuai4 yan2shi2。ta1 san3 fa1 chu1 da4di4 yuan2su4 zhi1 li4 de5 ming2liang4 guang1mang2。sa4man3 ke3neng2 hui4 dui4 zhe4yang4 de5 yan2shi2 chan3sheng1 kuang2re4 de5 mi2lian4。"

msgid ""
"You owe me an apology. You had no right to call me out like that in front of"
" the team."
msgstr ""
"你​还​欠​我​一句​道歉​。​你​无权​在​全队​人​面前​那样​骂​我​。\n"
"ni3 hai2 qian4 wo3 yi1ju4 dao4qian4。ni3 wu2quan2 zai4 quan2 dui4 ren2 mian4qian2 na4yang4 ma4 wo3。"

msgid "You owe me for this, man."
msgstr ""
"这次​算​你​欠​我​的​。\n"
"zhe4 ci4 suan4 ni3 qian4 wo3 de5。"

msgid "You owe me one, old man."
msgstr ""
"你​欠​我​个人​情​，​老家伙​。\n"
"ni3 qian4 wo3 ge4ren2 qing2，lao3jia1huo5。"

msgid "You pass out the medkits to your team."
msgstr ""
"你​把​急救包​分​发给​各位​队员​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 ji2jiu4bao1 fen4 fa1gei3 ge4wei4 dui4yuan2。"

msgid ""
"You people need to relax. We're professionals, remember?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Monika raises her arm and speaks into her wrist-mounted commlink. A darkened face shimmers on the viewscreen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Eiger, are you in position?"
msgstr ""
"你们​俩​需要​放松​点​。​我们​可是​专业人士​，​忘啦​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​举起​胳膊​，​朝着​植入​手腕​的​通讯​链​讲​了​句​话​。​一张​黝黑​的​脸​闪现​在​显示屏​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​，​你​找​好​位置​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 lia3 xu1yao4 fang4song1 dian3。wo3men5 ke3shi4 zhuan1ye4ren2shi4，wang4 la5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 ju3qi3 ge1bo5，chao2zhe5 zhi2ru4 shou3wan4 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 jiang3 le5 ju4 hua4。yi1 zhang1 you3hei1 de5 lian3 shan3xian4 zai4 xian3shi4ping2 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，ni3 zhao3 hao3 wei4zhi5 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You pick up a bloody credstick with ¥2000. More than likely this was the "
"first half of the payment to deliver the goods to Humanis."
msgstr ""
"你​捡​到​一根​沾满​血污​、​存有​2000​新円​的​信用​棒​。​这​很​可能​就是​给​人类​至上​主义者​送货​的​预付款​。\n"
"ni3 jian3 dao4 yi1 gen1 zhan1man3 xue4wu1、cun2you3 2000 xin1 yuan2 de5 xin4yong4 bang4。zhe4 hen3 ke3neng2 jiu4shi4 gei3 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 song4huo4 de5 yu4 fu4 kuan3。"

msgid ""
"You pick up the commlink receiver. It's a custom job, cobbled together from a jumble of high-end parts.\n"
"\n"
"It reminds you of your mission computer. Monika's handiwork."
msgstr ""
"你​拿​起​通讯​链​接收器​。​它​是​由​各种​高端​部件​拼凑​而成​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​让​你​想起​了​你​的​任务​电脑​—​—​莫妮卡​的​杰作​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 na2 qi3 tong1xun4 lian4 jie1shou1qi4。ta1 shi4 you2 ge4zhong3 gao1duan1 bu4jian4 pin1cou4 er2 cheng2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 rang4 ni3 xiang3qi3 le5 ni3 de5 ren4wu5 dian4nao3——Mo4ni1ka3 de5 jie2zuo4。"

msgid ""
"You picked this power up in the Adversary's domain. I don't think that you "
"are controlling it, Glory... I think that *it* is changing *you.*"
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​我​认为​你​并​没有​驾驭​这​股​来自​反叛者​领域​的​力量​……​*​它​*​在​改变​*​你​*​。\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 bing4 mei2you3 jia4yu4 zhe4 gu3 lai2zi4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 ling3yu4 de5 li4liang5……*ta1*zai4 gai3bian4*ni3*。"

msgid ""
"You place the extra fuse into a socket next to BTHRM. The status light next "
"to \"TRACK\" $(scene.str_RedOrGreen)."
msgstr ""
"你​把​额外​的​保险箱​放入​了​BTHRM​旁边​的​插座​。​“​TRACK​”​旁边​的​状态​指示灯​$(scene.str_RedOrGreen)​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 e2wai4 de5 bao3xian3xiang1 fang4ru4 le5 BTHRM pang2bian1 de5 cha1zuo4。“TRACK” pang2bian1 de5 zhuang4tai4 zhi3 shi4 deng1 $(scene.str_RedOrGreen)。"

msgid ""
"You place the extra fuse into a socket next to TRACK. The status light next "
"to \"TRACK\" $(scene.str_RedOrGreen)."
msgstr ""
"你​把​额外​的​保险箱​放入​了​TRACK​旁边​的​插座​。​“​TRACK​”​旁边​的​状态​指示灯​$(scene.str_RedOrGreen)​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 e2wai4 de5 bao3xian3xiang1 fang4ru4 le5 TRACK pang2bian1 de5 cha1zuo4。“TRACK” pang2bian1 de5 zhuang4tai4 zhi3 shi4 deng1 $(scene.str_RedOrGreen)。"

msgid ""
"You place the first camera. It adheres to the ceiling with an audible click.\n"
"\n"
"James steps forward, his fingers bent. He whispers a long string of hushed syllables that seem to vibrate in your mind."
msgstr ""
"你​放置​好​第一个​摄像头​。​它​发出​咔嗒​一声​，​牢牢​吸附​在​天花板​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​詹姆斯​向前​迈步​，​手指​微微​弯曲​。​他​低声​念出​一串​绵长​的​音节​，​那些​字句​仿佛​在​你​脑海中​震颤​着​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fang4zhi4 hao3 di4 yi1 ge4 she4xiang4tou2。ta1 fa1chu1 ka1da1 yi1sheng1，lao2lao2 xi1fu4 zai4 tian1hua1ban3 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhan1mu3si1 xiang4qian2 mai4bu4，shou3zhi3 wei1wei1 wan1qu1。ta1 di1sheng1 nian4 chu1 yi1 chuan4 mian2chang2 de5 yin1jie2，na4xie1 zi4ju4 fang3fu2 zai4 ni3 nao3 hai3 zhong4 zhen4chan4 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"You place the last camera. James steps forward, then turns to stare you in "
"the eye."
msgstr ""
"你​放置​好​最后​一个​摄像头​。​詹姆斯​向前​一步​，​然后​转过身​来​盯​着​你​。\n"
"ni3 fang4zhi4 hao3 zui4hou4 yi1ge5 she4xiang4tou2。zhan1mu3si1 xiang4qian2 yi1 bu4，ran2hou4 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You plug Enstad's PDA in to your computer, submit the job as \"finished,\" and wait for the funds to transfer.\n"
"\n"
"A few moments later, a message pops onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"你​将​恩施​塔德​的​PDA​连接​到​电脑​，​将​差事​标记​为​“​已​完成​”​，​并​等待​资金​转账​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​出​片刻​，​屏幕​上弹​出​一条​消息​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 en1Shi1ta3de2 de5 PDA lian2jie1 dao4 dian4nao3，jiang1 cha4shi4 biao1ji4 wei2“yi3 wan2cheng2”，bing4 deng3dai4 zi1jin1 zhuan3zhang4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 chu1 pian4ke4，ping2mu4 shang4 dan4 chu1 yi1 tiao2 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"You pop the chip out of the bracket and pocket it.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, an angry hissing sound comes from somewhere deep within the drone."
msgstr ""
"你​把​芯片​从​支架​上取​下来​，​放进​口袋​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​无人机​深处​传来​一阵​愤怒​的​嘶嘶声​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 xin1pian4 cong2 zhi1jia4 shang4 qu3 xia4lai5，fang4jin4 kou3dai4 li3。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，wu2ren2ji1 shen1chu4 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 fen4nu4 de5 si1si1sheng1。"

msgid "You pop the lid off a container to take a closer look."
msgstr ""
"你​掀开​其中​一个​箱盖​，​仔细​查看​。\n"
"ni3 xian1kai1 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 xiang1 gai4，zi3xi4 cha2kan4。"

msgid "You pop the panel off the door control and quickly override the lock."
msgstr ""
"你​撬开​门控​面板​，​迅速​超控​了​门锁​控制​。\n"
"ni3 qiao4kai1 men2 kong4 mian4ban3，xun4su4 chao1 kong4 le5 men2suo3 kong4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"You pore through the entry for several minutes before giving up. The "
"metamagical terminology in use here is far too dense for a non-mage to "
"understand."
msgstr ""
"你​仔细​研究​了​好几分钟​，​最终​还是​放弃​了​。​这里​使用​的​元​魔法​术语​对​非法​师​人员​来说​实在​太过​晦涩​难懂​。\n"
"ni3 zi3xi4 yan2jiu1 le5 hao3 ji1 fen4 zhong1，zui4zhong1 hai2shi5 fang4qi4 le5。zhe4li3 shi3yong4 de5 yuan2 mo2fa3 shu4yu3 dui4 fei1fa3 shi1 ren2yuan2 lai2 shuo1 shi2zai4 tai4guo4 hui4se4 nan2dong3。"

msgid "You power the terminal down and step away."
msgstr ""
"你​关闭​了​终端​并​离开​。\n"
"ni3 guan1bi4 le5 zhong1duan1 bing4 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"You press a key at random, and the screen begins to flash. A piezoelectric beeper buried somewhere deep inside of the terminal plays a series of chirps, and the system reboots itself.\n"
"\n"
"Then, when the screen comes alive again, it is filled with text."
msgstr ""
"你​随意​按下​一个​按键​，​屏幕​开始​闪烁​。​终端​内部​某个​深处​埋藏​的​压电​蜂鸣器​发出​一系列​鸣响​，​系统​随即​重新启动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随后​，​当​屏幕​再次​亮起​时​，​上面​上​布满​了​文字​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 sui2yi4 an4xia4 yi1ge5 an4jian4，ping2mu4 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4。zhong1duan1 nei4bu4 mou3 ge4 shen1chu4 mai2cang2 de5 ya1dian4 feng1ming2qi4 fa1chu1 yi1xi4lie4 ming2 xiang3，xi4tong3 sui2ji2 chong2xin1qi3dong4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2hou4，dang1 ping2mu4 zai4ci4 liang4 qi3 shi2，shang4mian4 shang4 bu4man3 le5 wen2zi4。"

msgid ""
"You press a key, and the screen begins to flash. After a moment, the system reboots itself.\n"
"\n"
"When the screen winks back on, you find yourself staring at the contents of an administrative inbox."
msgstr ""
"你​按​下​一个​按键​，​屏幕​开始​闪烁​。​片刻​之后​，​系统​自动​重启​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​屏幕​重新​亮起​时​，​你​发现自己​正​盯​着​某个​管理员​收件箱​的​内容​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 yi1ge5 an4jian4，ping2mu4 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，xi4tong3 zi4dong4 chong2qi3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ping2mu4 chong2xin1 liang4 qi3 shi2，ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 zheng1 ding1 zhao2 mou3 ge4 guan3li3yuan2 shou1jian4xiang1 de5 nei4rong2。"

msgid ""
"You press the button again and hold it. The buzzer screeches like a frightened animal, then sputters and dies out.\n"
"\n"
"Moments later, a high-strung voice warbles out of the speaker."
msgstr ""
"你​这次​一直​按住​了​按钮​。​蜂鸣器​尖叫​着​，​像​受惊​的​动物​般​嘶鸣​，​随后​噼啪​作响​，​最终​熄灭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​扬声器​里​传来​一阵​神经质​的​颤音​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4 ci4 yi1zhi2 an4 zhu4 le5 an4niu3。feng1ming2qi4 jian1jiao4 zhao2，xiang4 shou4jing1 de5 dong4wu4 ban1 si1ming2，sui2hou4 pi1pa1 zuo4 xiang3，zui4zhong1 xi1mie4。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，yang2sheng1qi4 li3 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 shen2jing1zhi4 de5 chan4yin1。"

msgid ""
"You press the button again, and again it chokes out its screeching cry.\n"
"\n"
"This time, the response is immediate."
msgstr ""
"你​再次​按下​按钮​，​它​又​一次​发出​刺耳​的​嘶鸣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这次​，​对方​的​回应​来得​异常​迅速​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4ci4 an4xia4 an4niu3，ta1 you4 yi1ci4 fa1chu1 ci4er3 de5 si1ming2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ci4，dui4fang1 de5 hui2ying4 lai2de5 yi4chang2 xun4su4。"

msgid "You promised me that you'd let him go. You *promised.*"
msgstr ""
"你​答应​过会放​他​走​。​你​*​答应​过​*​。\n"
"ni3 da1ying5 guo4 hui4 fang4 ta1 zou3。ni3*da1ying5 guo4*。"

msgid ""
"You pry the disc loose and snatch your hand back as the hail of sparks "
"intensifies. Everywhere a spark touches you, it burns a neat pinhole through"
" your clothing, and a white-hot lance of pain arcs through your body."
msgstr ""
"你​用力​撬出​圆盘​，​随即​迅速​收回​手掌​。​火花​四溅​的​强度​愈发​猛烈​。​凡是​火花​触及​之​处​，​都​会​在​你​的​衣物​上​烧出​一个​整齐​的​针孔​，​同时​一股​炽热​的​疼痛​如​利刃​般​穿透​你​的​身体​。\n"
"ni3 yong4li4 qiao4 chu1 yuan2pan2，sui2ji2 xun4su4 shou1hui2 shou3zhang3。huo3hua1 si4jian4 de5 qiang2du4 yu4fa1 meng3lie4。fan2shi4 huo3hua1 chu4ji2 zhi1 chu3，dou1 hui4 zai4 ni3 de5 yi1wu4 shang4 shao1 chu1 yi1ge5 zheng3qi2 de5 zhen1kong3，tong2shi2 yi1 gu3 chi4re4 de5 teng2tong4 ru2 li4ren4 ban1 chuan1tou4 ni3 de5 shen1ti3。"

msgid ""
"You pull hard on his arm, throwing his head forward into your punch. His head snaps back as your fist catches him square on the chin.\n"
"\n"
"His body instantly goes slack, and he collapses back to the floor. You'd guess that he's going to be out for a while."
msgstr ""
"你​用力​一​拽​他​的​胳膊​，​照着​他​的​脑袋​结结实实​来​了​一拳​。​你​的​拳头​正中​他​的​下巴​，​让​他​的​头​猛地​后仰​过去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​身体​立刻​松弛下来​，​倒​在​地上​。​你​猜​他​会​昏迷​一段时间​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong4li4 yi1 zhuai1 ta1 de5 ge1bo5，zhao4 zhao2 ta1 de5 nao3dai5 jie1 jie1 shi2 shi2 lai2 le5 yi1 quan2。ni3 de5 quan2tou5 zheng4zhong1 ta1 de5 xia4ba5，rang4 ta1 de5 tou2 meng3de5 hou4 yang3 guo4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 shen1ti3 li4ke4 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，dao3 zai4 di4shang5。ni3 cai1 ta1 hui4 hun1mi2 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1。"

msgid ""
"You punch Luca Duerr's comm code into your PDA.\n"
"\n"
"A few seconds later, you hear the telltale click of a successful connection. Duerr's voice pours out of your PDA's speakers."
msgstr ""
"你​把​卢卡​·​杜尔​的​通讯​码​输入​到​PDA​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​后​，​你​听到​了​连接​成功​的​标志性​咔嗒​声​。​杜尔​的​声音​从​你​的​PDA​扬声器​中​响起​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 lu2ka3 · du4 er3 de5 tong1xun4 ma3 shu1ru4 dao4 PDA zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 ting1dao4 le5 lian2jie1 cheng2gong1 de5 biao1zhi4xing4 ka1da1 sheng1。du4 er3 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 ni3 de5 PDA yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 xiang3qi3。"

msgid ""
"You punch the button, and alarm klaxons blare. An ominous rumbling sound "
"fills the air, and the walls start to shake."
msgstr ""
"你​按​下​按钮​，​警报声​尖锐​地​响起​。​一阵​令人不安​的​轰鸣声​在​空气​中​回响​，​墙壁​开始​震动​。\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 an4niu3，jing3 bao4 sheng1 jian1rui4 de5 xiang3qi3。yi1zhen4 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 hong1 ming2 sheng1 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4 hui2xiang3，qiang2bi4 kai1shi3 zhen4dong4。"

msgid ""
"You push the decker's hand aside and flip the toggle switch.\n"
"\n"
"There is a low humming noise as the machinery inside of the console spins to life."
msgstr ""
"你​推开​碟客​的​手​，​拨动​开关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​控制台​内部​的​机械​装置​开始运转​，​发出​低沉​的​嗡​鸣声​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tui1kai1 die2 ke4 de5 shou3，bo1dong4 kai1guan1。\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 nei4bu4 de5 ji1xie4 zhuang1zhi4 kai1 shi3 yun4 zhuai3，fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"You put a stop to it, $(l.name). Buried their research under a ton of concrete, and made us a hefty sum in the process.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All in all, a good day."
msgstr ""
"你​阻止​了​这​一切​，​$(l.name)​。​用成​吨​的​混凝土​掩埋​了​他们​的​研究​，​还​让​我们​赚​了​一大笔钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总而言之​，​真是​个​好日子​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zu3zhi3 le5 zhe4 yi1qie4，$(l.name)。yong4 cheng2 dun1 de5 hun4ning2tu3 yan3mai2 le5 ta1men5 de5 yan2jiu1，hai2 rang4 wo3men5 zhuan4 le5 yi1 dai4 bi3 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，zhen1shi5 ge4 hao3ri4zi5。"

msgid ""
"You put yourself in debt with dangerous people trying to find her, and what "
"thanks did you get? She told you to get lost."
msgstr ""
"你​把​自己​置于​危险​之中​，​欠​了​一屁股债​想要​找到​她​，​结果​你​得到​了​什么​？​她​只是​让​你​趁早​滚蛋​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 zi4ji3 zhi4yu2 wei1xian3 zhi1zhong1，qian4 le5 yi1 pi4 gu3 zhai4 xiang3yao4 zhao3dao4 ta1，jie1guo3 ni3 de2dao4 le5 shen2me5？ta1 zhi3shi4 rang4 ni3 chen4zao3 gun3dan4。"

msgid ""
"You questioned him about what he's planning on doing with those initiates "
"back there. Was that wrong?"
msgstr ""
"你​曾经​问过​他​打算​怎么​处置​那些​学徒​。​这样​做​也​是​错​的​吗​？\n"
"ni3 ceng2jing1 wen4 guo4 ta1 da3suan4 zen3me5 chu3zhi4 na4xie1 xue2tu2。zhe4yang4 zuo4 ye3 shi4 cuo4 de5 ma5？"

msgid "You questioning my orders, Eiger?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​质疑​我​的​命令​吗​，​艾格尔​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 zhi4yi2 wo3 de5 ming4ling4 ma5，Ai4ge2er3？"

msgid ""
"You quickly identify the Knight Errant uniform that's the closest to your "
"size and struggle into it."
msgstr ""
"你​迅速​找出​最​接近​自己​尺寸​的​游侠​骑士​制服​，​费力​地​穿​上​了​它​。\n"
"ni3 xun4su4 zhao3chu1 zui4 jie1jin4 zi4ji3 chi3cun5 de5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 zhi4fu2，fei4li4 de5 chuan1 shang4 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"You reach for your weapon, but too slowly. Much too slowly.\n"
"\n"
"A horrible twisting sensation wracks your guts, and a blinding pain ignites behind your eyes."
msgstr ""
"你​伸手​去取​你​的​武器​，​但​你​慢​了​。​实在​太慢​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一阵​可怕​的​扭曲​感​撕扯​着​你​的​内脏​，​刺​目的​痛楚​在​眼眶​后​猛烈​燃起​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shen1shou3 qu4qu3 ni3 de5 wu3qi4，dan4 ni3 man4 le5。shi2zai4 tai4 man4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhen4 ke3pa4 de5 niu3qu1 gan3 si1che3 zhao2 ni3 de5 nei4zang4，ci1 mu4di4 tong4chu3 zai4 yan3kuang4 hou4 meng3lie4 ran2qi3。"

msgid ""
"You reach into the hole that you smashed in the compartment's lid. The heat is unbearable, and your body is showered with white-hot sparks. Everywhere a spark touches you, it burns a neat pinhole through your clothing, and a white-hot lance of pain arcs through your body.\n"
"\n"
"In retrospect, this might not have been the best of ideas."
msgstr ""
"你​将​手​伸进​舱盖​上​被​砸开​的​洞里​。​高温​令人​难以忍受​，​而​炽热​的​火花​飞溅​在​你​的​身体​各处​。​凡是​火花​触及​之​处​，​都​会​在​你​的​衣物​上​烧出​一个​整齐​的​针孔​，​同时​一股​炽热​的​疼痛​如​利刃​般​穿透​你​的​身体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​事后​想想​，​这​可能​并​不是​一个​好​主意​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 shou3 shen1 jin4 cang1 gai4 shang4 bei4 za2 kai1 de5 dong4 li3。gao1wen1 ling4ren2 nan2yi3ren3shou4，er2 chi4re4 de5 huo3hua1 fei1jian4 zai4 ni3 de5 shen1ti3 ge4chu4。fan2shi4 huo3hua1 chu4ji2 zhi1 chu3，dou1 hui4 zai4 ni3 de5 yi1wu4 shang4 shao1 chu1 yi1ge5 zheng3qi2 de5 zhen1kong3，tong2shi2 yi1 gu3 chi4re4 de5 teng2tong4 ru2 li4ren4 ban1 chuan1tou4 ni3 de5 shen1ti3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4hou4 xiang3 xiang3，zhe4 ke3neng2 bing4 bu4shi4 yi1ge5 hao3 zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"You reach into the vent and retrieve a navy-blue duffel bag, just as the Engineer said you would.\n"
"\n"
"The distinctive shape of a rifle barrel can be seen through the canvas."
msgstr ""
"你​伸手​探入​通风口​，​取出​一个​深蓝色​旅行袋​，​正如​工程师​所说​的​那样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​通过​帆布​可以​清晰​地​看到​步枪​枪管​的​独特​形状​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shen1shou3 tan4 ru4 tong1feng1kou3，qu3chu1 yi1ge5 shen1 lan2 se4 lu:3xing2dai4，zheng4ru2 gong1cheng2shi1 suo3 shuo1 de5 na4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"tong1guo4 fan1bu4 ke3yi3 qing1xi1 de5 kan4dao4 bu4qiang1 qiang1guan3 de5 du2te4 xing2zhuang4。"

msgid ""
"You reach out into the astral plane, beckoning to any spirits that might be listening.\n"
"\n"
"Eventually, you receive a response. A feeling of comfort washes over you as a Spirit of the Hearth makes itself manifest."
msgstr ""
"你​的​感知​探入​星界​，​呼唤​着​任何​可能​在​聆听​的​精魂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​你​得到​了​回应​。​炉火​精魂​显形​时​，​你​的​身心​都​感到​慰藉​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 gan3zhi1 tan4 ru4 xing1 jie4，hu1huan4 zhao2 ren4he2 ke3neng2 zai4 ling2ting1 de5 jing1hun2。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ni3 de2dao4 le5 hui2ying4。lu2huo3 jing1hun2 xian3xing2 shi2，ni3 de5 shen1xin1 dou1 gan3dao4 wei4jie4。"

msgid ""
"You ready for this, boss? Accordin' to what Herr Fuchs told us, this entire complex is gonna be crawlin' with hired security.\n"
"\n"
"It's gonna be a hell of a fight."
msgstr ""
"你​准备​好了吗​，​老大​？​根据​富克斯​先生​的​说法​，​这​整座​大楼​里​到处​都​是​雇来​的​安保​人员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​是​一场​恶战​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5，lao3da4？gen1ju4 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 de5 shuo1fa3，zhe4 zheng3 zuo4 da4lou2 li3 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 gu4 lai2 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 e4zhan4。"

msgid ""
"You ready for this, chief? According to what Herr Fuchs told us, this entire complex is gonna be crawling with hired security.\n"
"\n"
"It's gonna be a hell of a fight."
msgstr ""
"你​准备​好了吗​，​头儿​？​根据​富克斯​先生​的​说法​，​这​整座​大楼​里​到处​都​是​雇来​的​安保​人员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​是​一场​恶战​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5，tou2r5？gen1ju4 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 de5 shuo1fa3，zhe4 zheng3 zuo4 da4lou2 li3 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 gu4 lai2 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 e4zhan4。"

msgid ""
"You ready for this, fearless leader? According to what Herr Fuchs told us, this entire complex is gonna be crawling with hired security. I'm guessing Knight Errant, but we'll see.\n"
"\n"
"It's gonna be a hell of a fight."
msgstr ""
"你​准备​好了吗​，​无畏​领袖​？​根据​富克斯​先生​的​说法​，​这​整座​大楼​里​到处​都​是​雇来​的​安保​人员​。​我​猜​是​游侠​骑士​，​不过​到时候​就​知道​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​是​一场​恶战​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4？gen1ju4 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 de5 shuo1fa3，zhe4 zheng3 zuo4 da4lou2 li3 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 gu4 lai2 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。wo3 cai1 shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4，bu4guo4 dao4shi2hou4 jiu4 zhi1dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 e4zhan4。"

msgid ""
"You ready for this? According to what Herr Fuchs told us, this entire complex is crawling with hired security.\n"
"\n"
"It's going to be one hell of a fight."
msgstr ""
"你​准备​好了吗​？​根据​富克斯​先生​的​说法​，​这​整座​大楼​里​到处​都​是​雇来​的​安保​人员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​是​一场​恶战​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5？gen1ju4 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 de5 shuo1fa3，zhe4 zheng3 zuo4 da4lou2 li3 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 gu4 lai2 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 e4zhan4。"

msgid ""
"You ready to leave this behind you and concentrate on your work? Here's a "
"hint: the correct answer is \"yes.\""
msgstr ""
"你​现在​愿意​放下​这​一切​，​专心​工作​了​吗​？​给你个​提示​：​标准​回答​是​“​没错​”​。\n"
"ni3 xian4zai4 yuan4yi4 fang4xia4 zhe4 yi1qie4，zhuan1xin1 gong1zuo4 le5 ma5？gei3 ni3 ge4 ti2shi4：biao1zhun3 hui2da2 shi4“mei2cuo4”。"

msgid ""
"You really came through for me, boss. You ever need anything from me - anything at all - then you call on me.\n"
"\n"
"I'll come runnin'."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​你​这次​真是​帮​了​我​大忙​。​以后​你​有​什么​事​用得上​我​的话​，​随时​招呼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​赴汤蹈火​，​在所不辞​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，ni3 zhe4 ci4 zhen1shi5 bang1 le5 wo3 dai4 mang2。yi3hou4 ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4 yong4de5shang4 wo3 de5hua4，sui2shi2 zhao1hu5。\n"
"\n"
"fu4tang1dao3huo3，zai4suo3bu4ci2。"

msgid "You really need to brush up on your social skills."
msgstr ""
"你​真得​好好​锻炼​一下​你​的​社交​技巧​了​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1 de2 hao3hao3 duan4lian4 yi1xia4 ni3 de5 she4jiao1 ji4qiao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"You really want this thing, don't you?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She waves the chip in front of his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is junkie behavior. Whatever this thing is, you're hooked on it."
msgstr ""
"你​很​想要​这个​东西​是​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​芯片​在​他​的​眼前​晃晃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​瘾君子​的​表现​。​不管​这​东西​是​什么​，​你​肯定​是​上瘾​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hen3 xiang3yao4 zhe4ge5 dong1xi1 shi4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 xin1pian4 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3qian2 huang3 huang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 yin3jun1zi3 de5 biao3xian4。bu4guan3 zhe4 dong1xi1 shi4 shen2me5，ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 shang4yin3 le5。"

msgid "You remove the extra fuse and pocket it."
msgstr ""
"你​拿走​了​额外​的​保险丝​并​把​它​收好​。\n"
"ni3 na2zou3 le5 e2wai4 de5 bao3xian3si1 bing4 ba3 ta1 shou1 hao3。"

msgid ""
"You resume creeping across the room.\n"
"\n"
"Seconds later, you're right behind him."
msgstr ""
"你​又​开始​悄悄​向前走​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒钟​之后​，​你​来到​了​他​的​身后​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 kai1shi3 qiao1qiao1 xiang4 qian2 zou3 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 zhong1 zhi1hou4，ni3 lai2dao4 le5 ta1 de5 shen1hou4。"

msgid ""
"You return our supplies, we send you a shipment of extra rations in "
"exchange. We agree to a truce of sorts. "
msgstr ""
"你们​把​物资​还​回来​，​我们​则​给出​一份​额外​口粮​作为​交换​。​双方​约定​暂时​停战​。\n"
"ni3men5 ba3 wu4zi1 hai2 hui2lai5，wo3men5 ze2 gei3 chu1 yi1 fen4 e2wai4 kou3liang2 zuo4wei2 jiao1huan4。shuang1fang1 yue1ding4 zan4shi2 ting2zhan4。"

msgid ""
"You ride the headwind, hovering in space as the world stops. You crush your eyes closed. \n"
"\n"
"And when they open again, you can see only one color."
msgstr ""
"你​逆风​前行​，​在​世界​静止​的​瞬间​悬浮​于​太空​。​你​用力​闭上​双眼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​双眼​再次​睁开​，​你​所能​看见​的​只有​一种​颜色​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ni4feng1 qian2xing2，zai4 shi4jie4 jing4zhi3 de5 shun4jian1 xuan2fu2 yu2 tai4kong1。ni3 yong4li4 bi4shang5 shuang1yan3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 shuang1yan3 zai4ci4 zheng1kai1，ni3 suo3neng2 kan4jian4 de5 zhi3you3 yi1zhong3 yan2se4。"

msgid ""
"You ruined your own life when you accepted a favor from dangerous people. "
"But that's all right, blame me if it makes you feel better."
msgstr ""
"从​你​找​那些​危险​的​人​帮忙​开始​，​你​就​已经​毁​了​自己​的​生活​。​不过​没关系​，​要是​这样​能​让​你​感觉​好受​点​的话​，​那​你​怪罪​我​也​行​。\n"
"cong2 ni3 zhao3 na4xie1 wei1xian3 de5 ren2 bang1mang2 kai1shi3，ni3 jiu4 yi3jing1 hui3 le5 zi4ji3 de5 sheng1huo2。bu4guo4 mei2guan1xi5，yao4shi5 zhe4yang4 neng2 rang4 ni3 gan3jue2 hao3shou4 dian3 de5hua4，na4 ni3 guai4zui4 wo3 ye3 xing2。"

msgid "You said it."
msgstr ""
"可不是​嘛​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。"

msgid ""
"You said that Vauclair is being held at the estate. What evidence did you "
"turn up to support that?"
msgstr ""
"你​说沃​克莱尔​被关​在​那座​庄园​里​。​你​有​什么​证据​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bei4 guan1 zai4 na4 zuo4 zhuang1yuan2 li3。ni3 you3 shen2me5 zheng4ju4？"

msgid ""
"You said that few people ever use that elevator. Who have you seen using it?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​很少​有人​坐​那部​电梯​。​那​都​有​谁​坐​过​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 hen3 shao3 you3ren2 zuo4 na4 bu4 dian4ti1。na4 dou1 you3 shei2 zuo4 guo4？"

msgid ""
"You said that he works for organized crime syndicates, plural. Who are we "
"talking about?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​过​他​为​不止​一个​犯罪集团​工作​，​具体​都​有​哪些​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 guo4 ta1 wei2 bu4zhi3 yi1ge5 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 gong1zuo4，ju4ti3 dou1 you3 na3xie1？"

msgid ""
"You said that there wouldn't be *any* security in this building.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp sounds tired.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"Easy in, easy out, no security.\" That's what you told Mr. Grinder. Those were your exact words."
msgstr ""
"你​说​过​大楼​里​不会​有​*​任何​*​安保​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​的​声音​听​起来​很​疲倦​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​快​进快​出​，​没有​安保​。​”​这​是​你​和​“​绞肉机​”​先生​说​的​原话​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 guo4 da4lou2 li3 bu4hui4 you3*ren4he2*an1bao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 pi2juan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“kuai4 jin4 kuai4 chu1，mei2you3 an1bao3。” zhe4 shi4 ni3 he4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 shuo1 de5 yuan2 hua4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You said that things went bad when you turned fourteen. I'd like to keep "
"talking about that."
msgstr ""
"你​上次​说​你​十四岁​的​时候​发生​了​很​糟糕​的​事​。​我​想​再​聊聊​这个​。\n"
"ni3 shang4ci4 shuo1 ni3 shi2 si4 sui4 de5 shi2hou5 fa1sheng1 le5 hen3 zao1gao1 de5 shi4。wo3 xiang3 zai4 liao2 liao2 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"You said that we were just planting bugs, damn it! *Bugs,* not *bombs!*"
msgstr ""
"该死​的​，​你​不是​说​我们​去​安装​*​监控​*​吗​！​怎么​变成​*​炸弹​*​了​！\n"
"gai1si3 de5，ni3 bu4shi4 shuo1 wo3men5 qu4 an1zhuang1*jian1kong4*ma5！zen3me5 bian4cheng2*zha4dan4*le5！"

msgid ""
"You said that you \"didn't want to see history repeat itself.\" What exactly"
" did you mean by that?"
msgstr ""
"你​之前​说​“​不​希望​看到​历史​重演​”​，​这​到底​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 shuo1“bu4 xi1wang4 kan4dao4 li4shi3 chong2yan3”，zhe4 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid "You said that you had \"concerns\" about me. I'd like you to voice them."
msgstr ""
"你​之前​说​对​我​有所​“​担忧​”​，​我​希望​你​能​解释​清楚​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 dui4 wo3 you3suo3“dan1you1”，wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 jie3shi4 qing1chu5。"

msgid ""
"You said that you just wanted to talk to her! She ran out of here in tears!"
msgstr ""
"你​说​你​只​想​和​她​谈谈​！​可是​她​流着泪​跑​了​出去​！\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni3 zhi3 xiang3 he4 ta1 tan2tan2！ke3shi4 ta1 liu2 zhao2 lei4 pao2 le5 chu1qu4！"

msgid "You said that you knew magic. Are you a street mage?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​你​懂​魔法​。​你​是​街头​法师​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni3 dong3 mo2fa3。ni3 shi4 jie1tou2 fa3shi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You said that you thought you could reverse engineer that pulse grenade that"
" you pulled from the Engineer. Any luck with that?"
msgstr ""
"你​之前​说​你​觉得​自己​能​对​从​工程师​身上​抢来​的​脉冲​手雷​进行​逆向​工程​。​有​什么​进展​吗​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 shuo1 ni3 jue2de5 zi4ji3 neng2 dui4 cong2 gong1cheng2shi1 shen1shang5 qiang3 lai2 de5 mai4chong1 shou3lei2 jin4xing2 ni4xiang4 gong1cheng2。you3 shen2me5 jin4zhan3 ma5？"

msgid "You said that you were a \"spider,\" right? Is... this... your handiwork?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​过​你​是​一名​“​网络​蜘蛛​”​，​对​吧​？​这​……​是​……​你​的​杰作​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 guo4 ni3 shi4 yi1 ming2“wang3luo4 zhi1zhu1”，dui4 ba1？zhe4……shi4……ni3 de5 jie2zuo4？"

msgid ""
"You said that you were locked in your office when the Kreuzbasar was "
"attacked, but Simmy Kim tells a different story."
msgstr ""
"你​说​克洛伊​茨​集市​遇袭​时​，​你​被​锁​在​办公室​里​，​但金​阿吸​却​不是​这么​说​的​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 yu4xi2 shi2，ni3 bei4 suo3 zai4 ban4gong1shi4 li3，dan4 jin1 e1 xi1 que4 bu4shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5。"

msgid ""
"You said that you worked with \"fifteen assorted orks and trolls.\" Does "
"that mean that other races aren't welcome within your organization?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​你​和​“​十五个​各种各样​的​兽​人​和​巨魔​”​共事​，​这​是否​意味着​你​的​组织​不​欢迎​其他​种族​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni3 he4“shi2 wu3 ge4 ge4zhong3ge4yang4 de5 shou4 ren2 he4 ju4mo2” gong4shi4，zhe4 shi4fou3 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 de5 zu3zhi1 bu4 huan1ying2 qi2ta1 zhong3zu2？"

msgid ""
"You said that you've got a team in Mitte. I'd like to hear a little more "
"about them."
msgstr ""
"你​说​你​的​团队​在​米​特区​。​我​想​多​了解​他们​一些​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 zai4 mi3 te4qu1。wo3 xiang3 duo1 liao3jie3 ta1men5 yi1xie1。"

msgid "You said “quick” twice."
msgstr ""
"你​说​了​两遍​“​要​快​“​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 le5 liang3 bian4“yao4 kuai4“。"

msgid ""
"You saved me? *Saved* me?\n"
"\n"
"If you'd left me where you found me, I never would have hurt anybody. My *mother* would still be alive. I never would've sold my soul to that abomination that you all worship, and I wouldn't have had to sacrifice my own body to escape from it.\n"
"\n"
"This place took everything from me. And it all started with *you.*"
msgstr ""
"你​救​了​我​？​*​救​了​*​我​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​当初​把​我​留在​原地​，​我​就​不会​伤害​任何人​。​我​的​*​母亲​*​也​能活​下来​。​我​不会​把​灵魂​出卖​给​你们​崇拜​的​那个​恶魔​，​也​不必​为了​逃离​它​的​掌控​而​把​自己​的​身体​搞成​这​副​模样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​夺走​了​我​的​一切​。​而​这​一切​的​始作俑者​就是​*​你​*​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 le5 wo3？*jiu4 le5*wo3？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 dang1chu1 ba3 wo3 liu2 zai4 yuan2di4，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2。wo3 de5*mu3qin1*ye3 neng2 huo2 xia4lai5。wo3 bu4hui4 ba3 ling2hun2 chu1mai4 gei3 ni3men5 chong2bai4 de5 na4ge5 e4mo2，ye3 bu4bi4 wei4le5 tao2li2 ta1 de5 zhang3kong4 er2 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 shen1ti3 gao3 cheng2 zhe4 fu4 mu2yang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 duo2zou3 le5 wo3 de5 yi1qie4。er2 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 shi3zuo4yong3zhe3 jiu4shi4*ni3*。"

msgid ""
"You saved my life that day, Adrian. I'll love you forever for that.\n"
"\n"
"And I *will* find you. I owe you that much."
msgstr ""
"阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​，​你​那天​救​了​我​的​命​。​我​为此​永远​深爱着​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一定​会​找到​你​。​这​是​我​欠​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3，ni3 na4tian1 jiu4 le5 wo3 de5 ming4。wo3 wei4ci3 yong3yuan3 shen1 ai4 zhao2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 zhao3dao4 ni3。zhe4 shi4 wo3 qian4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"You say that he serves his own view of the Adversary. Don't idols care what "
"their followers do in their names?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​他​只是​在​依照​自己​对​反叛者​的​认识​而​行事​。​难道​精魂​导师​就​不在乎​追随者​们​假借​自己​之名​做​的​事情​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ta1 zhi3shi4 zai4 yi1zhao4 zi4ji3 dui4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 ren4shi5 er2 xing2shi4。nan2dao4 jing1hun2 dao3shi1 jiu4 bu4zai4hu5 zhui1sui2zhe3 men5 jia3jie4 zi4ji3 zhi1 ming2 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You say that you'll give me answers when we talk about your past. So let's "
"talk about it."
msgstr ""
"你​之前​说​，​等​我们​聊到​你​的​过去​时​，​你​会​告诉​我​答案​。​我们​现在​就​来说​说​吧​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 shuo1，deng3 wo3men5 liao2 dao4 ni3 de5 guo4qu4 shi2，ni3 hui4 gao4su4 wo3 da2an4。wo3men5 xian4zai4 jiu4 lai2 shuo1 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You scan the archived information, collating it in your head as you go. Within a few seconds, a picture begins to form in your mind.\n"
"\n"
"From what you can tell, the ultimate goal of Project Atlas is to circumvent the effects of essence-loss in metahuman subjects."
msgstr ""
"你​一边​浏览​文档​，​一边​在​脑中​整理​信息​。​几秒钟​后​，​你​的​脑海​里​已经​有​画面​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​提供​的​信息​，​你​发现​“​阿特拉斯​”​项目​的​最终​目的​是​规避​泛​人类​实验​体​的​精华​流失​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1bian1 liu2lan3 wen2dang4，yi1bian1 zai4 nao3 zhong4 zheng3li3 xin4xi1。ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ni3 de5 nao3hai3 li3 yi3jing1 you3 hua4mian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 ti2gong1 de5 xin4xi1，ni3 fa1xian4“a1te4la1si1” xiang4mu4 de5 zui4zhong1 mu4di4 shi4 gui1bi4 fan4 ren2lei4 shi2yan4 ti3 de5 jing1hua2 liu2shi1。"

msgid ""
"You search the terminal's file system for anything else of value, but nothing jumps out at you. The system's memory is crammed full of financial projections, garden-variety pornography, and pirated trid shows.\n"
"\n"
"Disappointed, you step away."
msgstr ""
"你​搜索​终端​的​文件系统​，​试图​寻找​其他​有​价值​的​东西​，​但​没有​任何​东西​引起​你​的​注意​。​系统​的​内存​里​塞满​了​财务​预测​、​普通​色情​内容​和​盗版​节目​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​失望​之​余​，​你​转身​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 sou1suo3 zhong1duan1 de5 wen2 jian4 xi4 tong3，shi4tu2 xun2zhao3 qi2ta1 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 dong1xi1，dan4 mei2you3 ren4he2 dong1xi1 yin3qi3 ni3 de5 zhu4yi4。xi4tong3 de5 nei4cun2 li3 sai1man3 le5 cai2wu4 yu4ce4、pu3tong1 se4qing2 nei4rong2 he4 dao4ban3 jie2mu4。\n"
"\n"
"shi1wang4 zhi1 yu2，ni3 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"You see, the true purpose of this test is to gauge your adaptability.\n"
"\n"
"We need to know that you'll be willing to do what we tell you to do, regardless of your personal feelings on the matter. And we need to know that you'll roll with the punches if circumstances change mid-run."
msgstr ""
"这次​测试​的​目的​是​考察​你​的​适应能力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​确认​，​无论​你​对​此事​有何​个人​感受​，​你​都​愿意​执行​我们​的​指令​。​同时​需要​确认​，​若​任务​中途​情况​突变​，​你​能否​随机应变​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ci4 ce4shi4 de5 mu4di4 shi4 kao3cha2 ni3 de5 kuo4 ying1 neng2 li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 que4ren4，wu2lun4 ni3 dui4 ci3shi4 you3 he2 ge4ren2 gan3shou4，ni3 dou1 yuan4yi4 zhi2xing2 wo3men5 de5 zhi3ling4。tong2shi2 xu1yao4 que4ren4，ruo4 ren4wu5 zhong1tu2 qing2kuang4 tu1bian4，ni3 neng2fou3 sui2ji1ying4bian4。"

msgid ""
"You seem like a connected guy. Think any of your magical friends might know "
"more?"
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​人脉​挺​广​的​。​你​的​那些​魔法​朋友​会​不会​对此​有​更​多​了解​？\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 ren2mai4 ting3 yan3 de5。ni3 de5 na4xie1 mo2fa3 peng2you5 hui4 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 you3 geng1 duo1 liao3jie3？"

msgid ""
"You seem like a pretty well-educated man. Why choose a life underground, "
"here in this place?"
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​受过​良好​教育​。​为什么​要​选择​在​这里​过​着​这样​的​地下​生活​呢​？\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 shou4guo4 liang2hao3 jiao4yu4。wei4shen2me5 yao4 xuan3ze2 zai4 zhe4li3 guo4 zhao2 zhe4yang4 de5 di4xia4 sheng1huo2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"You seem to know a lot about dragons, Hans. Think your employer wants you "
"telling me all this?"
msgstr ""
"你​很​了解​龙​啊​，​汉斯​。​你​的​雇主​知道​你​这么​健谈​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hen3 liao3jie3 long2 a1，han4si1。ni3 de5 gu4zhu3 zhi1dao4 ni3 zhe4me5 jian4tan2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You seize the doorknob, and a white-hot burst of pain screams through your arm and into your shoulder. Involuntarily, you jerk back.\n"
"\n"
"As your hand breaks contact with the doorknob, your eyes are stabbed by a bright flash of red light. Your nostrils clog with the stench of burning meat."
msgstr ""
"你​握住​了​门把手​，​一股​灼热​的​剧痛​瞬间​窜​过​手臂​直冲​肩头​。​你​不由自主​地​一下子​缩回​了​手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​手掌​脱离​门把手​的​瞬间​，​刺眼​的​红光​猛地​刺进​你​的​双眼​。​鼻腔​里​充斥​着​焦肉​的​恶臭​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wo4zhu4 le5 men2ba3shou5，yi1 gu3 zhuo2re4 de5 ju4tong4 shun4jian1 cuan4 guo4 shou3bi4 zhi2 chong1 jian1tou2。ni3 bu4you2zi4zhu3 de5 yi1xia4zi5 suo1 hui2 le5 shou3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 shou3zhang3 tuo1li2 men2ba3shou5 de5 shun4jian1，ci4yan3 de5 hong2 guang1 meng3de5 ci1 jin4 ni3 de5 shuang1yan3。bi2qiang1 li3 chong1chi4 zhao2 jiao1 rou4 de5 e4chou4。"

msgid ""
"You send a bolt of scintillating energy into the wageslave's torso.\n"
"\n"
"His conscousness winks out as though a switch has been thrown."
msgstr ""
"你​向​薪奴​的​身体​发出​一道​火花​四射​的​能量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​瞬间​便​失去​了​意识​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4 xin1 nu2 de5 shen1ti3 fa1chu1 yi1dao4 huo3hua1 si4she4 de5 neng2liang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shun4jian1 bian4 shi1qu4 le5 yi4shi2。"

msgid ""
"You send a bolt of scintillating energy into the wageslave's torso.\n"
"\n"
"The life whispers out of him in an instant."
msgstr ""
"你​向​薪奴​的​身体​发出​一道​火花​四射​的​能量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​生命​瞬间​消失​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4 xin1 nu2 de5 shen1ti3 fa1chu1 yi1dao4 huo3hua1 si4she4 de5 neng2liang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 sheng1ming4 shun4jian1 xiao1shi1 le5。"

msgid "You seriously need to calm down, man."
msgstr ""
"你​真得​冷静​点​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1 de2 leng3jing4 dian3。"

msgid "You shift your attention away from the locked drawer."
msgstr ""
"你​把​注意力​从锁​着​的​抽屉​上移​开​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 cong2 suo3 zhao2 de5 chou1ti5 shang4 yi2 kai1。"

msgid "You should be training these people."
msgstr ""
"你​应该​训练​这些​人​。\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 xun4lian4 zhe4xie1 ren2。"

msgid "You should be, punk."
msgstr ""
"这​就​对​了​，​混蛋​。\n"
"zhe4 jiu4 dui4 le5，hun2dan4。"

msgid ""
"You should be. When the Dragonslayer is pleased, He tends to be generous with His rewards.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can feel the power coursin' through me, boss. I don't know what form it'll take yet, but it's there, and soon enough I'll be able to use it."
msgstr ""
"你​确实​应该​感到高兴​。​你​让​屠龙​者​满意​，​祂​便​会​慷慨​相赠​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​我​感到​力量​在​我​体内​奔涌​。​虽然​不​知道​它会​以​什么​形式​显现​，​但​它​确实​在​我​体内​，​我​很快​就​能​运用自如​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4shi2 ying1gai1 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4。ni3 rang4 tu2 long2 zhe3 man3yi4，ta1 bian4 hui4 kang1kai3 xiang1 zeng4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 gan3dao4 li4liang5 zai4 wo3 ti3nei4 ben1 yong3。sui1ran2 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 hui4 yi3 shen2me5 xing2shi4 xian3xian4，dan4 ta1 que4shi2 zai4 wo3 ti3nei4，wo3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 neng2 yun4yong4zi4ru2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You should drop your search for Vauclair. Drop it *now* and run far, far away.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't, you're gonna get yourself killed."
msgstr ""
"你​应该​放弃​寻找​沃​克莱尔​。​*​立刻​*​放弃​，​然后​有多远​跑​多​远​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​的话​，​你​会​害死​你​自己​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 fang4qi4 xun2zhao3 Wo4ke4lai2er3。*li4ke4*fang4qi4，ran2hou4 you3 duo1 yuan3 pao2 duo1 yuan3。\n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2 de5hua4，ni3 hui4 hai4si3 ni3 zi4ji3 de5。"

msgid ""
"You should have stuck to the market, stranger. If the Rabengeister wished to be found, we'd open a fucking cafe.\n"
"\n"
"Now what do you want of us? Say your piece."
msgstr ""
"陌生人​，​你​该​好好​待​在​市场​里​的​。​如果​“​鸦灵​”​想​让​别人​找到​的话​，​我们​他妈​就​去​开个​餐馆​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​到底​有​什么​事​？​赶紧​说​。\n"
"\n"
"mo4sheng1ren2，ni3 gai1 hao3hao3 dai1 zai4 shi4chang3 li3 de5。ru2guo3“Ya1ling2” xiang3 rang4 bie2ren5 zhao3dao4 de5hua4，wo3men5 ta1 ma1 jiu4 qu4 kai1 ge4 can1guan3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？gan3jin3 shuo1。"

msgid "You should meet with Frau Muller before leaving the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"在​离开​克洛伊​茨​集市​前​，​你​应该​与​穆勒​女士​会面​。\n"
"zai4 li2kai1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 qian2，ni3 ying1gai1 yu4 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 hui4mian4。"

msgid "You should talk to Paul Amsel before leaving the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"离开​克洛伊​茨​集市​之前​，​你​应该​和保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​谈谈​。\n"
"li2kai1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi1qian2，ni3 ying1gai1 he4 bao3 luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 tan2tan2。"

msgid ""
"You should tell your friend that this isn't funny. And it sure as hell isn't"
" smart."
msgstr ""
"你​应该​告诉​你​朋友​，​这​并​不好​笑​。​而且​这样​做​也​非常​不明智​。\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 gao4su4 ni3 peng2you5，zhe4 bing4 bu4hao3 xiao4。er2qie3 zhe4yang4 zuo4 ye3 fei1chang2 bu4 ming2 zhi4。"

msgid ""
"You should've acted on that sooner. Vauclair is vulnerable, and it's safe to assume that he knows it. He's probably already scrambling to reinforce his security team... if we miss this window of opportunity, we're screwed.\n"
"\n"
"Keeping the syndicates at bay is important, but this is bigger. Going off-mission now would be a huge tactical mistake."
msgstr ""
"你​该​早点​行动​的​。​沃​克莱尔​如今​防线​薄弱​，​他​对此​肯定​也​心知肚明​。​此刻​他​八成​正忙着​加强​安保​团队​……​如果​错过​这个​时机​，​我们​恐怕​再​无​胜算​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​遏制​犯罪集团​固然​重要​，​但​这件​事才​是​重中之重​。​现在​偏离​任务​目标​将​是​巨大​的​战术​失误​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gai1 zao3dian3 xing2dong4 de5。Wo4ke4lai2er3 ru2jin1 fang2xian4 bo2ruo4，ta1 dui4 ci3 ken3ding4 ye3 xin1zhi1du4ming2。ci3ke4 ta1 ba1cheng2 zheng1 mang2 zhao2 jia1qiang2 an1bao3 tuan2dui4……ru2guo3 cuo4guo4 zhe4ge5 shi2ji1，wo3men5 kong3pa4 zai4 wu2 sheng4suan4。\n"
"\n"
"e4zhi4 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 gu4ran2 zhong4yao4，dan4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 cai2 shi4 zhong4zhong1zhi1zhong4。xian4zai4 pian1li2 ren4wu5 mu4biao1 jiang1 shi4 ju4da4 de5 zhan4shu4 shi1wu4。"

msgid ""
"You should've been there, buddy, I'm tellin' you. It was like somethin' out "
"of a goddamned horror movie, only *better,* because *I* was in charge of the"
" whole show. And no security to show up and spoil my fun, neither!"
msgstr ""
"你​真该​在​现场​观礼​的​，​伙计​。​我​跟​你​讲​，​那​场面​简直​就是​他妈​恐怖电影​里​的​情节​。​而且​更​*​带劲​*​，​因为​*​我​*​是​导演​啊​！​而且​也​没有​任何​安保​人员​来扰​了​我​的​兴致​！\n"
"ni3 zhen1 gai1 zai4 xian4chang3 guan1li3 de5，huo3ji5。wo3 gen1 ni3 jiang3，na4 chang3mian4 jian3zhi2 jiu4shi4 ta1 ma1 kong3bu4dian4ying3 li3 de5 qing2jie2。er2qie3 geng1*dai4jin4*，yin1wei4*wo3*shi4 dao3yan3 a1！er2qie3 ye3 mei2you3 ren4he2 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 lai2 rao3 le5 wo3 de5 xing4zhi4！"

msgid "You should've run this by me before the run, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"你​应该​在此之前​先​和​我​说​清楚​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 zai4ci3zhi1qian2 xian1 he4 wo3 shuo1 qing1chu5，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"You should've seen me, chief... it was a thing of beauty. I don't think I've"
" ever been as much on my A game as I was that day."
msgstr ""
"你​当时​真该​看看​我​的​本事​，​头儿​……​那​一票​干​的​可​漂亮​了​。​我​觉得​我​再也​没有​像​那天​一样​发挥​得​如此​出色​。\n"
"ni3 dang1shi2 zhen1 gai1 kan4kan5 wo3 de5 ben3shi4，tou2r5……na4 yi1 piao4 gan4 de5 ke3 piao4liang5 le5。wo3 jue2de5 wo3 zai4ye3 mei2you3 xiang4 na4tian1 yi1yang4 fa1hui1 de2 ru2ci3 chu1se4。"

msgid "You should've taken her up on it."
msgstr ""
"你​应该​接受​她​的​提议​。\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 jie1shou4 ta1 de5 ti2yi4。"

msgid ""
"You shoulder-check the door, and the crack of splintering plastic fills your ears.\n"
"\n"
"The door pops open."
msgstr ""
"你​用​肩膀​抵住​门​，​塑料​碎裂​的​咔嚓​声​在​耳边​响起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门​应声​而开​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong4 jian1bang3 di3zhu4 men2，su4liao4 sui4lie4 de5 ka1cha1 sheng1 zai4 er3 bian1 xiang3qi3。\n"
"\n"
"men2 ying4sheng1 er2 kai1。"

msgid ""
"You shouldn't have been in that room. It isn't safe for initiates in there."
msgstr ""
"你​不该​进​那个​房间​的​。​那里​对​学徒​不​安全​。\n"
"ni3 bu4gai1 jin4 na4ge5 fang2jian1 de5。na4li5 dui4 xue2tu2 bu4 an1quan2。"

msgid ""
"You shouldn't have made me do that, asshole.\n"
"\n"
"The Doc was like family to me."
msgstr ""
"你​不该​逼​我​这么​做​的​，​混蛋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​博士​就​像​我​的​家人​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4gai1 bi1 wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5，hun2dan4。\n"
"\n"
"bo2shi4 jiu4 xiang4 wo3 de5 jia1ren2 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"You show me respect. This is good.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Mettbach nods his approval.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now. Unless you'd like to take yours elsewhere, let's get back to business, eh?"
msgstr ""
"你​对​我​表示​了​尊重​。​这​很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​梅特​巴赫​赞许​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果说​你​没​打算​去​别处​的话​，​那​我们​还是​谈谈​生意​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 wo3 biao3shi4 le5 zun1zhong4。zhe4 hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mei2 te4 ba1he4 zan4xu3 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3shuo1 ni3 mei2 da3suan4 qu4 bie2chu4 de5hua4，na4 wo3men5 hai2shi5 tan2tan2 sheng1yi4 ba1？"

msgid "You signed a contract. I expect you to honor it."
msgstr ""
"你​签​了​合同​。​我​想​你​应该​不会​毁约​吧​。\n"
"ni3 qian1 le5 he2tong5。wo3 xiang3 ni3 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 hui3yue1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You sink your hand into the drawer of loose credsticks and fish out a fistful. The plastic is slick and pleasant to the touch.\n"
"\n"
"As you withdraw your hand from the desk, Hasenkamp chuckles."
msgstr ""
"你​把手​伸进​装满​散落​信用​棒​的​抽屉​里​，​抓​出​一把​。​塑料​光滑​，​触感​舒适​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​把手​从​桌子​里​抽出​来时​，​哈森​坎普​笑​出​了​声​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 zhuang1man3 san3luo4 xin4yong4 bang4 de5 chou1ti5 li3，zhua1 chu1 yi1 ba3。su4liao4 guang1hua2，chu4gan3 shu1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 ba3shou3 cong2 zhuo1zi5 li3 chou1chu1 lai2 shi2，Ha1sen1kan3pu3 xiao4 chu1 le5 sheng1。"

msgid "You slam into the wall, and it gives way with a crunch."
msgstr ""
"你​猛撞​了​一下​墙​，​它​发出​嘎吱​一声​，​轰然​倒塌​。\n"
"ni3 meng3zhuang4 le5 yi1xia4 qiang2，ta1 fa1chu1 ga1zhi1 yi1sheng1，hong1ran2 dao3ta1。"

msgid ""
"You slam the button marked \"DELETE.\" Long-buried machinery deep in the guts of the terminal spins to life.\n"
"\n"
"From the building's speakers, a high-pitched, inhuman shriek fills the air. You recognize the sound: pure, animal terror."
msgstr ""
"你​猛地​按下​标有​“​删除​”​的​按钮​。​终端​深处​尘封已久​的​机械​装置​随即​轰然​启动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​大楼​的​扬声器​中​传来​一阵​非人类​的​尖锐​叫声​。​你​认出​了​这​声音​：​纯粹​的​、​动物​般的​恐惧​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 meng3de5 an4xia4 biao1 you3“shan1chu2” de5 an4niu3。zhong1duan1 shen1chu4 chen2 feng1 yi3 jiu3 de5 ji1xie4 zhuang1zhi4 sui2ji2 hong1ran2 qi3dong4。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 da4lou2 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 fei1 ren2 lei4 de5 jian1rui4 jiao4sheng1。ni3 ren4chu1 le5 zhe4 sheng1yin1：chun2cui4 de5、dong4wu4 ban1 de5 kong3ju4。"

msgid ""
"You slam your fist into the bridge of the Engineer's nose. His head whips back, then comes forward again.\n"
"\n"
"A trickle of blood leaks from one of his nostrils. He looks you up and down, then gives a slight nod."
msgstr ""
"你​一拳​砸​在​工程师​的​鼻梁​上​。​他​的​头​猛地​向​后仰​，​然后​又​向前​倾​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​鲜血​从​他​的​一侧​鼻孔​中​涌出​。​他​上下​打量​着​你​，​然后​微微​点头​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1 quan2 za2 zai4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 bi2liang2 shang4。ta1 de5 tou2 meng3de5 xiang4 hou4 yang3，ran2hou4 you4 xiang4qian2 qing1 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"xian1xue4 cong2 ta1 de5 yi1 ce4 bi2kong3 zhong4 yong3chu1。ta1 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，ran2hou4 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。"

msgid ""
"You slam your fist into the bridge of the Engineer's nose. His head whips back, then comes forward again.\n"
"\n"
"Blood streams from his nostrils. From the shape, you'd guess that it's broken in at least three places."
msgstr ""
"你​一拳​砸​在​工程师​的​鼻梁​上​。​他​的​头​猛地​向​后仰​，​然后​又​向前​倾​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​鲜血​从​他​的​鼻孔​中​涌出​。​从​形状​来看​，​你​猜​他​的​鼻骨​至少​断​了​三处​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1 quan2 za2 zai4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 bi2liang2 shang4。ta1 de5 tou2 meng3de5 xiang4 hou4 yang3，ran2hou4 you4 xiang4qian2 qing1 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"xian1xue4 cong2 ta1 de5 bi2kong3 zhong4 yong3chu1。cong2 xing2zhuang4 lai2 kan4，ni3 cai1 ta1 de5 bi2gu3 zhi4shao3 duan4 le5 san1 chu3。"

msgid ""
"You slam your fist into the bridge of the Engineer's nose. His head whips back, then comes forward again. A glob of phlegm spatters against your chest.\n"
"\n"
"The Engineer cackles at you, a malevolent grin on his face."
msgstr ""
"你​一拳​砸​在​工程师​的​鼻梁​上​。​他​的​头​猛地​向​后仰​，​然后​又​向前​倾​回来​。​一团​痰​液​溅​到​你​的​胸口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​工程师​对​你​发出​邪恶​的​笑声​，​脸上​挂​着​阴险​的​笑容​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1 quan2 za2 zai4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 bi2liang2 shang4。ta1 de5 tou2 meng3de5 xiang4 hou4 yang3，ran2hou4 you4 xiang4qian2 qing1 hui2lai5。yi1 tuan2 tan2 ye4 jian4 dao4 ni3 de5 xiong1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"gong1cheng2shi1 dui4 ni3 fa1chu1 xie2e4 de5 xiao4sheng1，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yin1xian3 de5 xiao4rong2。"

msgid "You slide the drawer closed."
msgstr ""
"你​关上​了​抽屉​。\n"
"ni3 guan1shang4 le5 chou1ti5。"

msgid ""
"You slide the plastic sheath aside and flip the toggle switch.\n"
"\n"
"There is a low humming noise as the machinery inside of the console spins to life."
msgstr ""
"你​掀开​塑料​护罩​，​拨动​开关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​控制台​内部​的​机械​装置​开始运转​，​发出​低沉​的​嗡​鸣声​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xian1kai1 su4liao4 hu4 zhao4，bo1dong4 kai1guan1。\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 nei4bu4 de5 ji1xie4 zhuang1zhi4 kai1 shi3 yun4 zhuai3，fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"You slide your credstick into a port set into the base of the comm.\n"
"\n"
"A few moments later, you hear the distinctive thunk of machinery clamping down on plastic. There is a low hum, and the machine spits your credstick back out again."
msgstr ""
"你​把​信用​棒​插入​通讯​链​底座​的​一个​接口​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​你​听到​了​机器​夹住​塑料​的​独特​咔嚓​声​。​一阵​低沉​的​嗡嗡声​后​，​机器​又​把​你​的​信用​棒​吐​了​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 xin4yong4 bang4 cha1ru4 tong1xun4 lian4 di3zuo4 de5 yi1ge5 jie1kou3。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ni3 ting1dao4 le5 ji1qi4 jia1 zhu4 su4liao4 de5 du2te4 ka1cha1 sheng1。yi1zhen4 di1chen2 de5 weng1weng1sheng1 hou4，ji1qi4 you4 ba3 ni3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 tu3 le5 chu1lai2。"

msgid "You slip the credstick into your pocket. Easy money."
msgstr ""
"你​把​信用​棒​塞进​口袋​里面​。​不拿白​不​拿​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 xin4yong4 bang4 se4 jin4 kou3dai4 li3mian4。bu4 na2 bai2 bu4 na2。"

msgid ""
"You slot the optical chip into the computer's waiting chipjack. \n"
"\n"
"On the screen, Alice's office blossoms into view."
msgstr ""
"你​将​光学​芯片​插入​电脑​的​芯片​插口​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屏幕​上​，​爱丽丝​的​办公室​逐渐​映入眼帘​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 guang1xue2 xin1pian4 cha1ru4 dian4nao3 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"ping2mu4 shang4，ai4li4si1 de5 ban4gong1shi4 zhu2jian4 ying4ru4yan3lian2。"

msgid ""
"You smell acrid smoke and burning meat. The roar of distant flames whispers in your ears. When your eyes flutter open, a dull red glare fills your vision.\n"
"\n"
"As you attempt to struggle to your feet, you become dimly aware that the gravity here feels wrong. Everything is heavier than it should be."
msgstr ""
"你​闻到​刺鼻​的​烟味​和​焦肉味​。​远处​火焰​的​咆哮​在​你​耳边​低语​。​当​你​颤动​着​睁开​双眼​时​，​一片​暗红​的​眩光​充斥​在​视野​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​试图​挣扎​起身​，​却​隐约​察觉到​这里​的​重力​并​不​正常​。​一切​事物​仿佛​都​比​原本​更加​沉重​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wen2dao4 ci4bi2 de5 yan1 wei4 he4 jiao1 rou4 wei4。yuan3chu4 huo3yan4 de5 pao2xiao4 zai4 ni3 er3 bian1 di1yu3。dang1 ni3 chan4dong4 zhao2 zheng1kai1 shuang1yan3 shi2，yi1 pian1 an4 hong2 de5 xuan4 guang1 chong1chi4 zai4 shi4ye3 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4tu2 zheng1zha2 qi3shen1，que4 yin3yue1 cha2 jiao4 dao4 zhe4li3 de5 zhong4li4 bing4 bu4 zheng4chang2。yi1qie4 shi4wu4 fang3fu2 dou1 bi3 yuan2ben3 geng4jia1 chen2zhong4。"

msgid ""
"You smell it first and the stink of it chokes you. Makes you retch. \n"
"\n"
"And then you see it - as far as your keen eye can reach."
msgstr ""
"你​首先​闻到​了​，​那股​臭味​让​你​窒息​。​让​你​作呕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​然后​你​看到​了​—​—​尽​你​锐利​的​眼睛​所能​及​的​范围​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shou3xian1 wen2dao4 le5，na4 gu3 chou4wei4 rang4 ni3 zhi4xi1。rang4 ni3 zuo4ou3。\n"
"\n"
"ran2hou4 ni3 kan4dao4 le5——jin3 ni3 rui4li4 de5 yan3jing5 suo3neng2 ji2 de5 fan4wei2。"

msgid ""
"You snake your hand in through the hole that you smashed in the the compartment's lid. The heat is unbearable, but you manage to find what you're looking for: a small, disc-shaped object nestled inside a plastic bracket.\n"
"\n"
"You can pry it loose, but not without getting burned in the process."
msgstr ""
"你​将​手​伸进​舱盖​上​被​砸开​的​洞里​。​高温​令人​难以忍受​，​但​你​还是​找到​了​要​找​的​东西​：​一个​小巧​的​圆盘​状​物体​，​嵌​在​塑料​支架​内​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​把​它​撬出来​，​但​过程​中​难免会​被​烫伤​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 shou3 shen1 jin4 cang1 gai4 shang4 bei4 za2 kai1 de5 dong4 li3。gao1wen1 ling4ren2 nan2yi3ren3shou4，dan4 ni3 hai2shi5 zhao3dao4 le5 yao4 zhao3 de5 dong1xi1：yi1ge5 xiao3qiao3 de5 yuan2pan2 zhuang4 wu4ti3，kan3 zai4 su4liao4 zhi1jia4 nei4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 ba3 ta1 qiao4 chu1 lai2，dan4 guo4cheng2 zhong4 nan2 mian3 hui4 bei4 tang4shang1。"

msgid "You son of a bitch."
msgstr ""
"你​个​狗​娘养​的​。\n"
"ni3 ge4 gou3 niang2 yang3 de5。"

msgid "You son of a bitch. I trusted you, Grinder!"
msgstr ""
"你​个​王八蛋​。​我​明明​这么​相信​你​，​“​绞肉机​”​！\n"
"ni3 ge4 wang2ba1dan4。wo3 ming2ming2 zhe4me5 xiang1xin4 ni3，“jiao3rou4ji1”！"

msgid "You son of a bitch. You never said anything about a bomb!"
msgstr ""
"你​个​王八蛋​。​你​怎么​没说​还有​炸弹​的​事​呢​！\n"
"ni3 ge4 wang2ba1dan4。ni3 zen3me5 mei2 shuo1 hai2you3 zha4dan4 de5 shi4 ni2！"

msgid "You sound nervous, Jana. How many runs have you been on before?"
msgstr ""
"你​听​起来​很​紧张​，​简娜​。​你​以前​跑​过​多少​次​差事​？\n"
"ni3 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 jin3zhang1，Jian3na4。ni3 yi3qian2 pao2 guo4 duo1shao3 ci4 cha4shi4？"

msgid "You sound nervous. Are you sure that you're up to this?"
msgstr ""
"你​听​起来​很​紧张​。​你​确定​自己​没​问题​吗​？\n"
"ni3 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 jin3zhang1。ni3 que4ding4 zi4ji3 mei2 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid "You speak about the Communion as if it were alive."
msgstr ""
"从​你​对​共​融会​的​说法​来看​，​它​好像​是​个​活物​啊​。\n"
"cong2 ni3 dui4 gong4 rong2hui4 de5 shuo1fa3 lai2 kan4，ta1 hao3xiang4 shi4 ge4 huo2wu4 a1。"

msgid ""
"You squeeze through the narrow gap beneath the floor panels and climb down into a large space beneath the lab complex. Darkness surrounds you, and the air smells moldy and stale.\n"
"\n"
"As your eyes slowly adjust to the light, you can make out the dim planes of cobweb-covered walls and scattered construction equipment. Judging by the dust and disrepair, this place appears to have been abandoned long ago.\n"
"\n"
"Meanwhile, somewhere else beneath the Harfeld Manor, Dr. Adrian Vauclair is preparing to wake a dragon and unleash it on an unsuspecting Berlin."
msgstr ""
"你​钻​过​了​地板​面板​下​的​狭窄​缝隙​，​爬进​了​实验室​建筑群​下方​的​巨大​空间​。​黑暗​将​你​包围​，​空气​中​弥漫着​一股​霉味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​你​的​眼睛​逐渐​适应​光线​，​你​辨认出​了​蛛网​密布​的​墙壁​和​四处​散落​的​施工​设备​。​根据​灰尘​和​破败​程度​判断​，​这里​似乎​在​很久以前​就​被​废弃​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​与此同时​，​在​哈​菲尔德​庄园​地下​的​某处​，​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​正​准备​唤醒​一条​巨龙​，​并​将​其​释放​到​毫无​防备​的​柏林​城中​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuan1 guo4 le5 di4ban3 mian4ban3 xia4 de5 xia2zhai3 feng4xi4，pa2 jin4 le5 shi2yan4shi4 jian4zhu4qun2 xia4fang1 de5 ju4da4 kong1jian1。hei1an4 jiang1 ni3 bao1wei2，kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 yi1 gu3 mei2 wei4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ni3 de5 yan3jing5 zhu2jian4 shi4ying4 guang1xian4，ni3 bian4 ren4 chu1 le5 zhu1wang3 mi4bu4 de5 qiang2bi4 he4 si4chu4 san3luo4 de5 shi1gong1 she4bei4。gen1ju4 hui1chen2 he4 po4bai4 cheng2du4 pan4duan4，zhe4li3 si4hu1 zai4 hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2 jiu4 bei4 fei4qi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，zai4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 di4xia4 de5 mou3chu4，E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 zheng1 zhun3bei4 huan4xing3 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2，bing4 jiang1 qi2 shi4fang4 dao4 hao2wu2 fang2bei4 de5 bo2lin2 cheng2zhong1。"

msgid ""
"You squeeze through the narrow gap beneath the floor panels and climb down into a large space beneath the lab complex. Darkness surrounds you, and the air smells moldy and stale.\n"
"\n"
"As your eyes slowly adjust to the light, you can make out the dim planes of cobweb-covered walls and scattered construction equipment. Judging by the dust and disrepair, this place appears to have been abandoned long ago.\n"
"\n"
"Meanwhile, somewhere else beneath the Harfeld Manor, Paul Amsel's killer is preparing to wake a dragon and unleash it on an unsuspecting Berlin."
msgstr ""
"你​挤​过​地板​下​的​狭窄​缝隙​，​爬进​实验室​大楼​下方​的​一处​宽敞​空间​。​四周​一片​漆黑​，​空气​中​弥漫着​陈腐​的​霉味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​眼睛​逐渐​适应​光线​，​你​依稀​辨认出​了​布满​蛛网​的​墙壁​轮廓​，​以及​散落​的​施工​设备​。​从​灰尘​和​破败​的​景象​来看​，​这里​似乎​很久以前​就​被​废弃​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​与此同时​，​在​哈​菲尔德​庄园​地下​的​某处​，​杀死​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​的​凶手​正​准备​唤醒​一条​巨龙​，​并​将​其​释放​到​毫无​防备​的​柏林​城中​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ji3 guo4 di4ban3 xia4 de5 xia2zhai3 feng4xi4，pa2 jin4 shi2yan4shi4 da4lou2 xia4fang1 de5 yi1 chu3 kuan1chang5 kong1jian1。si4zhou1 yi1 pian1 qi1hei1，kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 chen2fu3 de5 mei2 wei4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 yan3jing5 zhu2jian4 shi4ying4 guang1xian4，ni3 yi1xi1 bian4 ren4 chu1 le5 bu4man3 zhu1wang3 de5 qiang2bi4 lun2kuo4，yi3ji2 san3luo4 de5 shi1gong1 she4bei4。cong2 hui1chen2 he4 po4bai4 de5 jing3xiang4 lai2 kan4，zhe4li3 si4hu1 hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2 jiu4 bei4 fei4qi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yu3ci3tong2shi2，zai4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 di4xia4 de5 mou3chu4，sha1si3 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 de5 xiong1shou3 zheng1 zhun3bei4 huan4xing3 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2，bing4 jiang1 qi2 shi4fang4 dao4 hao2wu2 fang2bei4 de5 bo2lin2 cheng2zhong1。"

msgid ""
"You stand firm and let the slap land. It connects somewhere between your neck and your shoulder.\n"
"\n"
"To your surprise, you feel an explosion of pain."
msgstr ""
"你​稳稳​站​着​，​任凭​那一掌​落下​，​正​打​在​你​脖颈​与​肩膀​之间​的​位置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​令​你​惊讶​的​是​，​剧痛​如​爆炸​般​骤然​袭​来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wen3 wen3 zhan4 zhao2，ren4ping2 na4 yi1 zhang3 luo4xia4，zheng1 da3 zai4 ni3 bo2geng3 yu4 jian1bang3 zhi1jian1 de5 wei4zhi5。\n"
"\n"
"ling3 ni3 jing1ya4 de5 shi4，ju4tong4 ru2 bao4zha4 ban1 zhou4ran2 xi2 lai2。"

msgid ""
"You stand impassively as the blood mage completes his chant.\n"
"\n"
"As the last syllable escapes his lips, a blinding pain ignites behind your eyes. Slowly, a horrible twisting sensation begins to build in your guts, and the blood mage's smile widens."
msgstr ""
"你​呆​站​在​原地​，​任由​血​法师​完成​咒语​的​吟唱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​最后​一个​音节​逸​出​他​的​嘴唇​，​刺​目的​痛楚​在​你​眼眶​后​猛烈​燃起​。​一阵​可怕​的​扭曲​感​开始​缓慢​撕扯​着​你​的​内脏​，​而血​法师​的​微笑​愈发​灿烂​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dai1 zhan4 zai4 yuan2di4，ren4you2 xie3 fa3shi1 wan2cheng2 zhou4yu3 de5 yin2chang4。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 zui4hou4 yi1ge5 yin1jie2 yi4 chu1 ta1 de5 zui3chun2，ci1 mu4di4 tong4chu3 zai4 ni3 yan3kuang4 hou4 meng3lie4 ran2qi3。yi1zhen4 ke3pa4 de5 niu3qu1 gan3 kai1shi3 huan3man4 si1che3 zhao2 ni3 de5 nei4zang4，er2 xie3 fa3shi1 de5 wei1xiao4 yu4fa1 can4lan4 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"You stand there a while, holding the bottle by the neck, staring at Feuerschwinge's old pen.\n"
"\n"
"Staring at the place that gave birth to the end of the world."
msgstr ""
"你​在​原地​站​了​片刻​，​握​着​瓶颈​，​凝视​着火​翼​的​旧​巢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​凝视着​这个​孕育​了​世界末日​的​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 yuan2di4 zhan4 le5 pian4ke4，wo4 zhao2 ping2jing3，ning2shi4 zhao2Huo3yi4 de5 jiu4 chao2。\n"
"\n"
"ning2 shi4 zhao2 zhe4ge5 yun4yu4 le5 shi4jie4mo4ri4 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"You stand there for a while, feeling the weight of the gun in your hands. Deciding whether to put a bullet through your brain, or Audran's, or both.\n"
"\n"
"Deciding whether it even matters anymore."
msgstr ""
"你​在​原地​站​了​片刻​，​感受​着​手中​枪支​的​重量​。​犹豫​着​是​该​对​你​自己​的​脑袋​开​一枪​，​还是​崩​了​奥​德兰​，​抑或​两者​皆​是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​犹豫​着​这​一切​是否​还有​意义​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 yuan2di4 zhan4 le5 pian4ke4，gan3shou4 zhao2 shou3 zhong4 qiang1zhi1 de5 zhong4liang4。you2yu4 zhao2 shi4 gai1 dui4 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 nao3dai5 kai1 yi1 qiang1，hai2shi5 beng1 le5 Ao4de2lan2，yi4huo4 liang3zhe3 jie1 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"you2yu4 zhao2 zhe4 yi1qie4 shi4fou3 hai2you3 yi4yi4。"

msgid ""
"You stand there for a while, staring at Audran's armored back. Deciding what to do.\n"
"\n"
"Deciding whether it even matters anymore."
msgstr ""
"你​在​原地​站​了​片刻​，​盯​着​奥​德兰​背后​的​护甲​。​犹豫​着​自己​该​做​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​犹豫​着​这​一切​是否​还有​意义​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 yuan2di4 zhan4 le5 pian4ke4，ding1 zhao2 Ao4de2lan2 bei4hou4 de5 hu4jia3。you2yu4 zhao2 zi4ji3 gai1 zuo4 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"you2yu4 zhao2 zhe4 yi1qie4 shi4fou3 hai2you3 yi4yi4。"

msgid ""
"You stare into the frail woman's yellow eyes. Check the data readout on the "
"terminal next to her: \"Astral Containment Chamber.\""
msgstr ""
"你​看​向​那​脆弱​女人​的​黄色​双眼​，​检查​她​旁边​的​终端​数据​：​“​灵体​收容​室​”​。\n"
"ni3 kan4 xiang4 na4 cui4ruo4 nu:3ren2 de5 huang2se4 shuang1yan3，jian3cha2 ta1 pang2bian1 de5 zhong1duan1 shu4ju4：“ling2ti3 shou1rong2 shi4”。"

msgid ""
"You start to press the \"4\" key, only to realize that the key is missing "
"from the keyboard. A thick layer of grime and dust rests in its place."
msgstr ""
"当​你​要​按​下​“​4​”​键​的​时候​，​才​发现​键盘​上​的​按键​不见​了​，​取而代之​的​是​一层​厚厚的​污垢​和​灰尘​。\n"
"dang1 ni3 yao4 an4 xia4“4” jian4 de5 shi2hou5，cai2 fa1xian4 jian4pan2 shang4 de5 an4jian4 bu4jian4 le5，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 yi1ceng2 hou4 hou4 de5 wu1gou4 he4 hui1chen2。"

msgid ""
"You steady yourself and your senses return in time to see the faint form of "
"the dragon disappearing in the distance. Then Feuerschwinge is gone."
msgstr ""
"你​稳住​自己​，​感官​逐渐​恢复​，​正好​看到​那条​巨龙​的​模糊​身影​在​远处​消失​。​然后​，​火翼​就​这样​不见​了​。\n"
"ni3 wen3 zhu4 zi4ji3，gan3guan1 zhu2jian4 hui1fu4，zheng4hao3 kan4dao4 na4 tiao2 ju4long2 de5 mo2hu5 shen1ying3 zai4 yuan3chu4 xiao1shi1。ran2hou4，Huo3yi4 jiu4 zhe4yang4 bu4jian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You step forward to inspect Danni's power tap. The same tap that you promised her you wouldn't interfere with.\n"
"\n"
"Feeding a power spike into the Aztechnology power grid would be as easy as crossing a couple of wires."
msgstr ""
"你​上前​检视​丹妮​的​电力​接口​。​就是​你​答应​过​不会​动手脚​的​那个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​交叉​几根​线缆​，​就​能​向​阿兹特​科技​的​电网​输送​一波​电力​尖峰​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shang4qian2 jian3shi4 dan1 ni1 de5 dian4li4 jie1kou3。jiu4shi4 ni3 da1ying5 guo4 bu4hui4 dong4shou3jiao3 de5 na4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 jiao1cha1 ji1 gen1 xian4lan3，jiu4 neng2 xiang4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 dian4wang3 shu1song4 yi1 bo1 dian4li4 jian1feng1。"

msgid ""
"You step inside, and the squalor of the disused U-Bahn tunnel gives way to "
"the warmth of your safehouse. A man waits inside, silhouetted against the "
"dim fluorescent lighting."
msgstr ""
"你​迈进​屋里​，​安全​屋​的​温暖​舒适​顿时​取代​了​废弃​地铁​坑道​的​破败​脏污​。​有人​在​里面​等待​着​你​，​暗淡​的​日光灯​勾勒​出​他​的​轮廓​。\n"
"ni3 mai4jin4 wu1 li3，an1quan2 wu1 de5 wen1nuan3 shu1shi4 dun4shi2 qu3dai4 le5 fei4qi4 di4tie3 keng1dao4 de5 po4bai4 zang1wu1。you3ren2 zai4 li3mian4 deng3dai4 zhao2 ni3，an4dan4 de5 ri4guang1deng1 gou1le4 chu1 ta1 de5 lun2kuo4。"

msgid ""
"You step into the garage, \"Prototype\" in tow. Before you are the two "
"vehicles that you knew would be waiting: your client's van, and the Lodge's."
msgstr ""
"你​领着​“​原型机​”​走进​车库​。​果不其然​，​你​眼前​停着​两辆车​：​一辆​是​雇主​的​，​一辆​是​结社​的​。\n"
"ni3 ling3 zhao2“yuan2 xing2 ji1” zou3jin4 che1ku4。guo3bu4qi2ran2，ni3 yan3qian2 ting2 zhao2 liang3 liang4 che1：yi1 liang4 shi4 gu4zhu3 de5，yi1 liang4 shi4 jie2she4 de5。"

msgid ""
"You step into the garage, \"Prototype\" in tow. Before you are the two "
"vehicles that you knew would be waiting: your client's van, and the Lodge's."
" And nobody but you knows what the presence of the second van means."
msgstr ""
"你​领着​“​原型机​”​走进​车库​。​果不其然​，​你​眼前​停着​两辆车​：​一辆​是​雇主​的​，​一辆​是​结社​的​。​除了​你​，​没​人​知道​第二辆​车​的​来​由​。\n"
"ni3 ling3 zhao2“yuan2 xing2 ji1” zou3jin4 che1ku4。guo3bu4qi2ran2，ni3 yan3qian2 ting2 zhao2 liang3 liang4 che1：yi1 liang4 shi4 gu4zhu3 de5，yi1 liang4 shi4 jie2she4 de5。chu2le5 ni3，mei2 ren2 zhi1dao4 di4 er4 liang4 che1 de5 lai2 you2。"

msgid "You step into the garage, \"Prototype\" in tow. Herr Schmidt's van awaits."
msgstr ""
"你​领着​“​原型机​”​走进​车库​。​施密特​先生​的​车​在​等​你​。\n"
"ni3 ling3 zhao2“yuan2 xing2 ji1” zou3jin4 che1ku4。shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 de5 che1 zai4 deng3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You step into the room and make your way toward the wageslave.\n"
"\n"
"As you approach him, he sits bolt upright and begins to turn toward you."
msgstr ""
"你​走进​房间​，​向​薪奴​走​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​走近​他时​，​他​猛地​坐​起​身子​，​开始​转向​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3jin4 fang2jian1，xiang4 xin1 nu2 zou3 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 ta1 shi2，ta1 meng3de5 zuo4 qi3 shen1zi5，kai1shi3 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You step out of the subway car and follow him up the stairs and into the Berlin night. \n"
"\n"
"Into the shadows."
msgstr ""
"你​走出​地铁​车厢​，​跟着​他​上​了​楼梯​，​步入​柏林​的​夜色​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​步入​暗影​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3chu1 di4tie3 che1xiang1，gen1zhe5 ta1 shang4 le5 lou2ti1，bu4ru4 bo2lin2 de5 ye4se4 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4ru4 an4ying3 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"You step out of the van, climbing down into the tunnel leading back to your safehouse. \n"
"\n"
"Just hours ago, you saved Berlin from fire and ash, from the would-be sacrifice of Dr. Adrian Vauclair. It feels strange now, returning in secret. In silence. The other residents of the Kreuzbasar go about their business, unaware of what almost happened here tonight.\n"
"\n"
"It’s finally over. Your team, and your kiez, are safe once again."
msgstr ""
"你​走出​货车​，​沿着​隧道​返回​安全​屋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​在​几小时​前​，​你​使​柏林​这座​城市​免遭​烈火​与​灰烬​的​劫难​，​也​阻止​了​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​企图​进行​的​牺牲​。​此刻​你​在​一片​寂静​中​悄然​归来​，​感觉​恍如隔世​。​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​其他​居民​照常​忙碌​着​，​全然不知​今夜​他们​曾​与​死亡​擦肩而过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​一切​终于​结束​了​。​你​的​团队​，​还有​你​的​街区​，​再​一次​远离​了​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3chu1 huo4che1，yan2zhe5 sui4dao4 fan3hui2 an1quan2 wu1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 ji1 xiao3 shi2 qian2，ni3 shi3 bo2lin2 zhe4 zuo4 cheng2shi4 mian3zao1 lie4huo3 yu4 hui1jin4 de5 jie2nan4，ye3 zu3zhi3 le5 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 qi3tu2 jin4xing2 de5 xi1sheng1。ci3ke4 ni3 zai4 yi1 pian1 ji4jing4 zhong4 qiao3ran2 gui1lai2，gan3jue2 huang3ru2ge2shi4。Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 qi2ta1 ju1min2 zhao4chang2 mang2lu4 zhao2，quan2 ran2 bu4 zhi1 jin1ye4 ta1men5 ceng2 yu4 si3wang2 ca1jian1er2guo4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1qie4 zhong1yu2 jie2shu4 le5。ni3 de5 tuan2dui4，hai2you3 ni3 de5 jie1qu1，zai4 yi1ci4 yuan3li2 le5 wei1xian3。"

msgid ""
"You step toward the park ranger. His eyes are wide, and they move from you to Glory to the scene of carnage in the room.\n"
"\n"
"It takes you a moment to realize that Glory isn't following you."
msgstr ""
"你​走向​公园​管理员​。​他​瞪​大​了​眼睛​，​目光​从​你​移到​格洛丽​身上​，​再​到​房间​里​血腥​的​惨状​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​花​了​点​时间​才​意识​到​格洛丽​没有​跟着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zou3xiang4 gong1yuan2 guan3li3yuan2。ta1 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5，mu4guang1 cong2 ni3 yi2 dao4 Ge2luo4li2 shen1shang5，zai4 dao4 fang2jian1 li3 xue4xing1 de5 can3zhuang4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hua1 le5 dian3 shi2jian1 cai2 yi4shi2 dao4 Ge2luo4li2 mei2you3 gen1zhe5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You still have a chance to give him what he wanted. You can put a stop to "
"this before more people get killed."
msgstr ""
"你​还有​机会​依照​他​的​意愿​行事​。​你​还​可以​在​更​多​人​丧生​之前​阻止​这​一切​。\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 ji1hui4 yi1zhao4 ta1 de5 yi4yuan4 xing2shi4。ni3 hai2 ke3yi3 zai4 geng1 duo1 ren2 sang4sheng1 zhi1qian2 zu3zhi3 zhe4 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"You still look distracted, Blitz. Let me guess... you didn't take my advice."
msgstr ""
"你​还是​心不在焉​，​布里​茨​。​让​我​猜猜​……​你​并​没有​采纳​我​的​建议​。\n"
"ni3 hai2shi5 xin1bu4zai4yan1，Bu4li3ci2。rang4 wo3 cai1 cai1……ni3 bing4 mei2you3 cai3na4 wo3 de5 jian4yi4。"

msgid ""
"You still seem like yourself, so I'll trust what you're telling me. Who "
"knows? Maybe this could even help us down the road."
msgstr ""
"你​看起来​还是​老​样子​，​所以​我​就​相信​你​说​的话​吧​。​谁​知道​呢​？​也许​这会​对​我们​以后​的​行动​有​帮助​。\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 hai2shi5 lao3 yang4zi5，suo3yi3 wo3 jiu4 xiang1xin4 ni3 shuo1 de5hua4 ba1。shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？ye3xu3 zhe4 hui4 dui4 wo3men5 yi3hou4 de5 xing2dong4 you3 bang1zhu4。"

msgid "You still think us leaderless?"
msgstr ""
"你​仍然​觉得​这里​群龙无首​吗​？\n"
"ni3 reng2ran2 jue2de5 zhe4li3 qun2long2wu2shou3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You strain against the smooth metal, wrenching on the hydraulics with all your might.\n"
"\n"
"After what seems like an eternity, you hear the tortured sound of tearing metal, and one of the jacks comes free from its housing. The resulting imbalance causes the door to shoot upwards, jamming into the top of the doorway with a metallic crunch."
msgstr ""
"你​用力​抵住​光滑​的​金属​，​拼命​扭动​液压​装置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​似乎​过​了​很​久​之后​，​你​听见​金属​撕裂​的​痛苦​声响​，​其中​一个​千斤顶​终于​挣脱​了​固定​位置​。​随之而来​的​失衡​让​门板​猛地​弹起​，​伴随​着​金属​的​嘎吱​声撞​上​门框​顶部​卡死​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yong4li4 di3zhu4 guang1hua2 de5 jin1shu3，pin1ming4 niu3 dong4 ye4ya1 zhuang1zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"si4hu1 guo4 le5 hen3 jiu3 zhi1hou4，ni3 ting1jian4 jin1shu3 si1lie4 de5 tong4ku3 sheng1xiang3，qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 qian1jin1ding3 zhong1yu2 zheng4tuo1 le5 gu4ding4 wei4zhi5。sui2 zhi1 er2 lai2 de5 shi1heng2 rang4 men2 ban3 meng3de5 dan4 qi3，ban4sui2 zhao2 jin1shu3 de5 ga1zhi1 sheng1 zhuang4 shang4 men2kuang4 ding3bu4 ka3si3。"

msgid ""
"You strain your ears to hear what the people in the other room are saying.\n"
"\n"
"As you focus, the sounds crystallize and become clear."
msgstr ""
"你​竖起​耳朵​，​试图​听​清​隔壁​房间​里​人们​的​谈话​声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​你​专注​倾听​，​那些​声音​逐渐​清晰​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shu4qi3 er3duo5，shi4tu2 ting1 qing1 ge2bi4 fang2jian1 li3 ren2men5 de5 tan2hua4 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 ni3 zhuan1zhu4 qing1ting1，na4xie1 sheng1yin1 zhu2jian4 qing1xi1 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"You strain your ears to listen. \n"
"\n"
"Soft voices from inside of the room come drifting out of a nearby vent."
msgstr ""
"你​竖起​耳朵​仔细​聆听​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​附近​的​通风口​隐约​传来​隔壁​房间​里​某个​轻柔​的​声音​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shu4qi3 er3duo5 zi3xi4 ling2ting1。\n"
"\n"
"fu4jin4 de5 tong1feng1kou3 yin3yue1 chuan2lai2 ge2bi4 fang2jian1 li3 mou3 ge4 qing1rou2 de5 sheng1yin1。"

msgid ""
"You stumble back, and the burning drone collapses in on itself.\n"
"\n"
"You're hurt, but the disc looks undamaged. On closer inspection, it appears to be some kind of homemade simsense chip."
msgstr ""
"你​踉跄​着​后退​，​那架​燃烧​的​无人机​则​失去​支撑​垮塌​倒下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​受了伤​，​但​那块​圆盘​看起来​完好无损​。​经过​仔细​查看​，​它​似乎​是​一种​自制​的​拟感​芯片​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 liang4qiang4 zhao2 hou4tui4，na4 jia4 ran2shao1 de5 wu2ren2ji1 ze2 shi1qu4 zhi1cheng1 kua3ta1 dao3xia4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shou4 le5 shang1，dan4 na4 kuai4 yuan2pan2 kan4qi3lai5 wan2hao3wu2sun3。jing1guo4 zi3xi4 cha2kan4，ta1 si4hu1 shi4 yi1zhong3 zi4zhi4 de5 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4。"

msgid "You stupid bitch! What... what have you *done?!?*"
msgstr ""
"你​这​愚蠢​的​婊子​！​你​……​你​究竟​做​了​*​什么​*​？​！\n"
"ni3 zhe4 yu2chun3 de5 biao3zi5！ni3……ni3 jiu1jing4 zuo4 le5*shen2me5*？！"

msgid ""
"You submit the job as \"finished\" and await your client's response.\n"
"\n"
"A few moments later, a message pops onto the screen."
msgstr ""
"你​将​差事​标记​为​“​已​完成​”​，​并​等待​客户​的​回复​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​出​片刻​，​屏幕​上弹​出​一条​消息​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 cha4shi4 biao1ji4 wei2“yi3 wan2cheng2”，bing4 deng3dai4 ke4hu4 de5 hui2fu4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 chu1 pian4ke4，ping2mu4 shang4 dan4 chu1 yi1 tiao2 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"You sure about that, chief? You sounded pretty uninterested in helping out last time.\n"
"\n"
"Frankly, I'm not even sure that I want your help anymore."
msgstr ""
"你​确定​吗​，​头儿​？​上次​你​听​起来​对​帮忙​一点​兴趣​都​没有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老实​说​，​我​甚至​都​不​确定​我​是否​还​想要​你​帮忙​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ma5，tou2r5？shang4ci4 ni3 ting1 qi3lai5 dui4 bang1mang2 yi1dian3 xing4qu4 dou1 mei2you3。\n"
"\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 que4ding4 wo3 shi4fou3 hai2 xiang3yao4 ni3 bang1mang2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You sure this time? What you said earlier was true... we do have our hands "
"full with Vauclair and the dragon."
msgstr ""
"你​这次​真的​确定​吗​？​上​回​你​说​的话​确实​没错​……​我们​还​得​忙​着​对付​沃​克莱尔​和​巨龙​的​事​。\n"
"ni3 zhe4 ci4 zhen1de5 que4ding4 ma5？shang4 hui2 ni3 shuo1 de5hua4 que4shi2 mei2cuo4……wo3men5 hai2 de2 mang2 zhao2 dui4fu5 Wo4ke4lai2er3 he4 ju4long2 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"You sure? I mean, if you’re looking for Robin Hood, shouldn’t you go to England or something?\n"
"\n"
"Seems really far away from this hole in the ground."
msgstr ""
"你​确定​吗​？​如果​你​要​想​找​什么​哑铃​的话​，​去​地表​的​健身房​不是​更​方便​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​在​这种​破​地方​是​不​太​现实​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ma5？ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 xiang3 zhao3 shen2me5 ya3ling2 de5hua4，qu4 di4biao3 de5 jian4shen1fang2 bu4shi4 geng1 fang1bian4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 zai4 zhe4zhong3 po4 di4fang1 shi4 bu4 tai4 xian4shi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You sure? I mean, if you’re looking for Robin’s ghost, shouldn’t you go to England or something?\n"
"\n"
"Seems really far away from this hole in the ground."
msgstr ""
"你​确定​吗​？​如果​你​要​想​找​什么​哑铃​的话​，​去​地表​的​健身房​不是​更​方便​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​在​这种​破​地方​是​不​太​现实​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ma5？ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 xiang3 zhao3 shen2me5 ya3ling2 de5hua4，qu4 di4biao3 de5 jian4shen1fang2 bu4shi4 geng1 fang1bian4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 zai4 zhe4zhong3 po4 di4fang1 shi4 bu4 tai4 xian4shi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You sure? Maybe there are some nice binder clips in there for you to play "
"with, or a staple remover for you to steal."
msgstr ""
"你​确定​吗​？​说不定​里面​有​几枚​漂亮​的​活页夹​子能​让​你​把玩​，​或者​有个​起钉器​能​让​你​顺​走​。\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ma5？shuo1bu5ding4 li3mian4 you3 ji1 mei2 piao4liang5 de5 huo2 xie2 jia1 zi3 neng2 rang4 ni3 ba3wan2，huo4zhe3 you3 ge4 qi3ding1qi4 neng2 rang4 ni3 shun4 zou3。"

msgid "You sure? You look like you're a million miles away."
msgstr ""
"你​确定​吗​？​你​看上去​要​拒​我​千里​之外​。\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ma5？ni3 kan4shang5qu5 yao4 ju4 wo3 qian1li3 zhi1wai4。"

msgid ""
"You swipe the keycard, and the door's hydraulics grind to life.\n"
"\n"
"Slowly, the door slides open. A whiff of stale air washes out of the building."
msgstr ""
"你​刷​了​门禁卡​，​液压​系统​开始​运作​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门​缓缓​滑开​。​一股​陈旧​的​空气​从​建筑​内部​涌出​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shua1 le5 men2 jin1 ka3，ye4ya1 xi4tong3 kai1shi3 yun4zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"men2 huan3huan3 hua2 kai1。yi1 gu3 chen2jiu4 de5 kong1qi4 cong2 jian4zhu4 nei4bu4 yong3chu1。"

msgid ""
"You take a moment to process the information that you have just read.\n"
"\n"
"It appears that Panacea is a sort of a delivery system for Doom. It's a virus; airborne, highly infectious, and capable of producing Doom antibodies on command.\n"
"\n"
"But the radioactive payload that the antibodies carry is stable, somehow. Dormant."
msgstr ""
"你​花​了​点​时间​来​消化​刚刚​读到​的​内容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​似乎​“​万能​药​”​算是​某种​传播​“​末日​”​的​载体​。​它​是​一种​病毒​……​通过​空气​传播​且​极具​传染性​。​它​能够​按​需​产生​末日​抗体​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​它们​携带​的​放射性​载荷​……​不知​为何​保持稳定​。​处于​休眠状态​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hua1 le5 dian3 shi2jian1 lai2 xiao1hua4 gang1gang5 dou4 dao4 de5 nei4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"si4hu1“wan4neng2 yao4” suan4shi4 mou3zhong3 chuan2bo1“mo4ri4” de5 zai4ti3。ta1 shi4 yi1zhong3 bing4du2……tong1guo4 kong1qi4 chuan2bo1 qie3 ji2 ju4 chuan2ran3xing4。ta1 neng2gou4 an4 xu1 chan3sheng1 mo4ri4 kang4ti3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1men5 xie2dai4 de5 fang4she4xing4 zai4he4……bu4zhi1 wei4he2 bao3 chi2 wen3 ding4。chu3yu2 xiu1 mian2 zhuang4 tai4。"

msgid "You take a tumble, old timer?"
msgstr ""
"你​摔倒​了​吗​，​老家伙​？\n"
"ni3 shuai1dao3 le5 ma5，lao3jia1huo5？"

msgid ""
"You take care of Trithemius, I'll let you have your pick of the armory. "
"Whatever piece of hardware you want."
msgstr ""
"你​解决​掉​特​里特​米​乌斯​，​我​就让​你​从​军械库​里​挑​一件​武器​，​随便​你​选​。\n"
"ni3 jie3jue2 diao4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1，wo3 jiu4 rang4 ni3 cong2 jun1 xie4 ku4 li3 tiao1 yi1 jian4 wu3qi4，sui2bian4 ni3 xuan3。"

msgid "You take care of yourself."
msgstr ""
"你​要​照顾​好​自己​。\n"
"ni3 yao4 zhao4gu5 hao3 zi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"You take the little black box from the desk and pocket it before returning "
"your attention to the screen."
msgstr ""
"你​从​桌子​上​拿​起​小​黑盒​，​把​它​放进​口袋​，​然后​重新​将​注意力​转向​屏幕​。\n"
"ni3 cong2 zhuo1zi5 shang4 na2 qi3 xiao3 hei1he2，ba3 ta1 fang4jin4 kou3dai4，ran2hou4 chong2xin1 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 ping2mu4。"

msgid ""
"You take this step, boss, an' I'll put you down like a rabid dog.\n"
"\n"
"This is the only warning I'm gonna give you."
msgstr ""
"老大​，​你​要是​敢​迈出​这​一步​，​我​就​把​你​像​疯狗​一样​干掉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​给​你​的​唯一​警告​。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，ni3 yao4shi5 gan3 mai4chu1 zhe4 yi1 bu4，wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3 xiang4 feng1 gou3 yi1yang4 gan4diao4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 gei3 ni3 de5 wei2yi1 jing3gao4。"

msgid ""
"You taught me to kill, monster. You trained me to like it.\n"
"\n"
"It seems only fitting that I share what I've learned with you."
msgstr ""
"是​你​教会​了​我​杀戮​，​畜生​。​是​你​让​我​沉迷​其中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​将​我​毕生​所学​用​在​你​身上​，​似乎​再​合适​不过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3 jiao1hui4 le5 wo3 sha1lu4，chu4sheng5。shi4 ni3 rang4 wo3 chen2mi2 qi2zhong1。\n"
"\n"
"jiang1 wo3 bi4sheng1 suo3 xue2 yong4 zai4 ni3 shen1shang5，si4hu1 zai4 he2shi4 bu4guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You technically fulfilled the terms of our arrangement, so you will get paid. But don't ever expect to work for us again.\n"
"\n"
"-Schmidt"
msgstr ""
"严格​意义​上​讲​，​你​确实​履行​了​约定​条款​，​所以​你​会​得到​报酬​。​但别​指望​再​为​我们​工作​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​-​施密特\n"
"\n"
"yan2ge2 yi4yi4 shang4 jiang3，ni3 que4shi2 lu:3xing2 le5 yue1ding4 tiao2kuan3，suo3yi3 ni3 hui4 de2dao4 bao4chou5。dan4 bie4 zhi3wang4 zai4 wei2 wo3men5 gong1zuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"-shi1mi4te4"

msgid "You tell me, dragon. "
msgstr ""
"你​说​呢​，​巨龙​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni2，ju4long2。"

msgid "You tell me."
msgstr ""
"你​说​呢​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni2。"

msgid "You tell me. I'm not in the business of guessing."
msgstr ""
"你​说​就是​了​。​我​不​喜欢​猜谜​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 jiu4shi4 le5。wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 cai1mi2。"

msgid ""
"You tell me. You're the big-time smuggler. I'm just hired muscle, remember?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​是​就是​，​你​可是​大​走私​贩​，​我​只是​个​打手​，​记得​吗​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 shi4 jiu4shi4，ni3 ke3shi4 dai4 zou3si1 fan4，wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 da3shou5，ji4de5 ma5？"

msgid "You there! Maintenance $+(l.guy)! Stop right where you are."
msgstr ""
"说​你​呢​！​检修​的​！​站​在​原地​别动​。\n"
"shuo1 ni3 ni2！jian3xiu1 de5！zhan4 zai4 yuan2di4 bie4 dong4。"

msgid ""
"You there! Stop where you are!\n"
"\n"
"Clear this area, or we will remove you by force!"
msgstr ""
"你​！​给​我​站住​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​离开​此​区域​，​否则​我们​将​采取​武力​清除​！\n"
"\n"
"ni3！gei3 wo3 zhan4zhu4！\n"
"\n"
"li2kai1 ci3 qu1yu4，fou3ze2 wo3men5 jiang1 cai3qu3 wu3li4 qing1chu2！"

msgid "You think Zaak beat on her for shopping elsewhere?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​扎克​因为​她​去​别家​买​东西​而​打​了​她​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 Zha1ke4 yin1wei4 ta1 qu4 bie4 jia1 mai3 dong1xi1 er2 da3 le5 ta1？"

msgid "You think someone's trying to use him to get to Samuel and his group?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​是​有人​在​试图​利用​他来​接触​到​塞缪尔​及其​组织​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 shi4 you3ren2 zai4 shi4tu2 li4yong4 ta1 lai2 jie1chu4 dao4 sai4miu4er3 ji2qi2 zu3zhi1？"

msgid ""
"You think that I *like* watching people die? That I've *enjoyed* spending the better part of my life locked away in this lab with a creature that I *hate?*\n"
"\n"
"You think that I'm doing this for *me?*"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​我​*​喜欢​*​看到​别人​死​掉​吗​？​还是​说​我​*​喜欢​*​把​余生​里​的​时间​都​用​在​这个​实验室​里​，​和​我​*​憎恨​*​的​生物​共处一室​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​觉得​我​这么​做​是​为了​我​自己​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3*xi3huan5*kan4dao4 bie2ren5 si3 diao4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 wo3*xi3huan5*ba3 yu2sheng1 li3 de5 shi2jian1 dou1 yong4 zai4 zhe4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 li3，he4 wo3*zeng1hen4*de5 sheng1wu4 gong4 chu3 yi1 shi4？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3 zhe4me5 zuo4 shi4 wei4le5 wo3 zi4ji3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You think that I feel safe with you? I just watched you kill a guy who was "
"on your own team!"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​我待​在​你​身边​会​感觉​安全​吗​？​我​刚刚​目睹​了​你​亲手​杀死​自己​的​队友​！\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3 dai1 zai4 ni3 shen1bian1 hui4 gan3jue2 an1quan2 ma5？wo3 gang1gang5 mu4du3 le5 ni3 qin1shou3 sha1si3 zi4ji3 de5 dui4you3！"

msgid "You think that I'm happy about this, you sick bastard?"
msgstr ""
"你​觉得​我会​对此​高兴​吗​，​你​个​变态​混蛋​？\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 wo3 hui4 dui4 ci3 gao1xing4 ma5，ni3 ge4 bian4tai4 hun2dan4？"

msgid ""
"You think that it's a coincidence? We came when the quarantine was broken.\n"
"\n"
"We've had eyes on this place since the lockdown went into effect. You called us here when you opened the doors."
msgstr ""
"你​以为​这是​巧合​吗​？​我们​来​这儿​是因为​隔离​被​解除​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​封锁​开始​，​我们​就​在​盯​着​这里​。​是​你们​打开​了​大门​，​我们​才​来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3wei2 zhe4 shi4 qiao3he2 ma5？wo3men5 lai2 zhe4r5 shi4 yin1 wei2 ge2li2 bei4 jie3chu2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 feng1suo3 kai1shi3，wo3men5 jiu4 zai4 ding1 zhao2 zhe4li3。shi4 ni3men5 da3kai1 le5 da4men2，wo3men5 cai2 lai2 de5。"

msgid "You think?"
msgstr ""
"你​说​呢​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni2？"

msgid "You thought what?"
msgstr ""
"你​以​为什么​？\n"
"ni3 yi3 wei4shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"You thread your way through the trees of the Schönbuch Forest, tracing your way back to the thicket where you and Glory hid the van. The inferno that consumed Feuerstelle is spreading, and the conflagration casts the forest around you in a sinister orange light.\n"
"\n"
"The heat at your back is intense. Unbearable. Far ahead, Glory blazes a trail for you to follow, shredding the foliage in her path. \n"
"\n"
"The fire is moving fast, but you're faster. You clamber into the van, put the vehicle in gear, and punch the accelerator. The burning ruin of Feuerstelle recedes into the distance, a glowing speck in the rear-view mirror. The peace and safety of the Kreuzbasar lie ahead."
msgstr ""
"你​穿行​在​申布赫​森林​的​树丛​间​，​循着​原路​返回​你​和​格洛丽​藏匿​货车​的​灌木丛​。​吞噬​“​火坑​”​的​烈焰​正​蔓延​开来​，​熊熊大火​将​周围​的​森林​笼罩​在​一片​诡异​的​橙色​光芒​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​背后​的​热浪​灼人​难耐​。​远处​，​格洛丽​正在​前方​砍伐​那些​碍事​的​枝叶​，​为​你们​开辟​一条​通路​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火势​蔓延​迅速​，​但​你们​的​行动​更​快​。​你​钻进​货车​，​立刻​挂​上​档位​，​一脚​踩下​油门​。​燃烧​着​的​“​火坑​”​废墟​在​后视镜​中​逐渐​远去​，​化作​一个​发光​的​斑点​。​宁静​祥和​的​克洛伊​茨​集市​就​在​前方​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 chuan1xing2 zai4 shen1 bu4 he4 sen1lin2 de5 shu4cong2 jian1，xun2zhe5 yuan2 lu4 fan3hui2 ni3 he4 Ge2luo4li2 cang2ni4 huo4che1 de5 guan4mu4cong2。tun1shi4“huo3keng1” de5 lie4yan4 zheng1 man4yan2 kai1 lai2，xiong2 xiong2 dai4 huo3 jiang1 zhou1wei2 de5 sen1lin2 long3zhao4 zai4 yi1 pian1 gui3yi4 de5 cheng2se4 guang1mang2 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"bei4hou4 de5 re4lang4 zhuo2 ren2 nan2 nai4。yuan3chu4，Ge2luo4li2 zheng4zai4 qian2fang1 kan3fa2 na4xie1 ai4shi4 de5 zhi1ye4，wei2 ni3men5 kai1pi4 yi1 tiao2 tong1lu4。\n"
"\n"
"huo3shi4 man4yan2 xun4su4，dan4 ni3men5 de5 xing2dong4 geng1 kuai4。ni3 zuan1jin4 huo4che1，li4ke4 gua4 shang4 dang4 wei4，yi1 jiao3 cai3 xia4 you2men2。ran2shao1 zhao2 de5“huo3keng1” fei4xu1 zai4 hou4shi4jing4 zhong4 zhu2jian4 yuan3 qu4，hua4zuo4 yi1ge5 fa1guang1 de5 ban1dian3。ning2jing4 xiang2he2 de5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jiu4 zai4 qian2fang1。"

msgid ""
"You thread your way through the trees of the Schönbuch Forest, tracing your way back to the thicket where you and Glory hid the van. The inferno that consumed Feuerstelle is spreading, and the conflagration casts the forest around you in a sinister orange light.\n"
"\n"
"The heat at your back is intense. Unbearable. Far ahead, Glory blazes a trail for you to follow, shredding the foliage in her path. Marta shepherds the shellshocked initiates along behind you, doing what she can to keep them calm and moving.\n"
"\n"
"The fire is moving fast, but you're faster. As Marta helps the last of the kids into the van, you put the vehicle in gear and punch the accelerator. The burning ruin of Feuerstelle recedes into the distance, a glowing speck in the rear-view mirror. The peace and safety of the Kreuzbasar lie ahead.\n"
msgstr ""
"你​穿行​在​申布赫​森林​的​树丛​间​，​循着​原路​返回​你​和​格洛丽​藏匿​货车​的​灌木丛​。​吞噬​“​火坑​”​的​烈焰​正​蔓延​开来​，​熊熊大火​将​周围​的​森林​笼罩​在​一片​诡异​的​橙色​光芒​中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​背后​的​热浪​灼人​难耐​。​远处​，​格洛丽​正在​前方​砍伐​那些​碍事​的​枝叶​，​为​你们​开辟​一条​通路​。​玛​尔塔​带领​着​惊魂未定​的​学徒​们​跟​在​你​身后​，​竭力​安抚​他们​继续前进​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火势​蔓延​迅速​，​但​你们​的​行动​更​快​。​玛​尔塔​帮​最后​一个​孩子​登上​货车​后​，​你​便​立刻​挂​上​档位​，​一脚​踩下​油门​。​燃烧​着​的​“​火坑​”​废墟​在​后视镜​中​逐渐​远去​，​化作​一个​发光​的​斑点​。​宁静​祥和​的​克洛伊​茨​集市​就​在​前方​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 chuan1xing2 zai4 shen1 bu4 he4 sen1lin2 de5 shu4cong2 jian1，xun2zhe5 yuan2 lu4 fan3hui2 ni3 he4 Ge2luo4li2 cang2ni4 huo4che1 de5 guan4mu4cong2。tun1shi4“huo3keng1” de5 lie4yan4 zheng1 man4yan2 kai1 lai2，xiong2 xiong2 dai4 huo3 jiang1 zhou1wei2 de5 sen1lin2 long3zhao4 zai4 yi1 pian1 gui3yi4 de5 cheng2se4 guang1mang2 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"bei4hou4 de5 re4lang4 zhuo2 ren2 nan2 nai4。yuan3chu4，Ge2luo4li2 zheng4zai4 qian2fang1 kan3fa2 na4xie1 ai4shi4 de5 zhi1ye4，wei2 ni3men5 kai1pi4 yi1 tiao2 tong1lu4。Ma3er3ta3 dai4ling3 zhao2 jing1 hun2 wei4 ding4 de5 xue2tu2 men5 gen1 zai4 ni3 shen1hou4，jie2li4 an1fu3 ta1men5 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。\n"
"\n"
"huo3shi4 man4yan2 xun4su4，dan4 ni3men5 de5 xing2dong4 geng1 kuai4。Ma3er3ta3 bang1 zui4hou4 yi1ge5 hai2zi5 deng1shang4 huo4che1 hou4，ni3 bian4 li4ke4 gua4 shang4 dang4 wei4，yi1 jiao3 cai3 xia4 you2men2。ran2shao1 zhao2 de5“huo3keng1” fei4xu1 zai4 hou4shi4jing4 zhong4 zhu2jian4 yuan3 qu4，hua4zuo4 yi1ge5 fa1guang1 de5 ban1dian3。ning2jing4 xiang2he2 de5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jiu4 zai4 qian2fang1。"

msgid ""
"You threatenin' me? In my own club?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He looks at you incredulously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's a hell of a mistake, friend."
msgstr ""
"你​在​我​的​场子​里​，​跟​我​放狠话​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​难以置信​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​大错特错​了​，​伙计​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 wo3 de5 chang3zi5 li3，gen1 wo3 fang4 hen3 hua4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nan2yi3zhi4xin4 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 da4cuo4te4cuo4 le5，huo3ji5。"

msgid "You too!"
msgstr ""
"你​也​是​！\n"
"ni3 ye3 shi4！"

msgid "You too, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"你​也​是​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"ni3 ye3 shi4，$(l.name)。"

msgid "You too, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"你​也​是​个​出色​的​队友​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"ni3 ye3 shi4 ge4 chu1se4 de5 dui4you3，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid "You too, Glory. How're things with you?"
msgstr ""
"你​也​是​，​格洛丽​。​最近​如何​？\n"
"ni3 ye3 shi4，Ge2luo4li2。zui4jin4 ru2he2？"

msgid ""
"You took the time to save Aztechnology's test subjects. In your place, I might not have... I don't think I could've justified endangering the mission.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Still, it worked out. And I suppose that's all that matters."
msgstr ""
"你​特意​抽空​救​了​阿兹特​科技​的​实验​体​。​换作​是​我​的话​，​或许​不会​如此​……​我​实在​无法​说服​自己​冒​着​危及​任务​的​风险​这么​做​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​陷入​沉思​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​结果​还​算​圆满​。​我​想​，​这才​是​最​重要​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 te4yi4 chou1kong4 jiu4 le5 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 shi2yan4 ti3。huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，huo4xu3 bu4hui4 ru2ci3……wo3 shi2zai4 wu2fa3 shuo1fu2 zi4ji3 mao4 zhao2 wei1ji2 ren4wu5 de5 feng1xian3 zhe4me5 zuo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，xian4ru4 chen2si1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 jie1guo3 hai2 suan4 yuan2man3。wo3 xiang3，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5。"

msgid "You trapped her somehow."
msgstr ""
"你​以​某种​方式​困住​了​她​。\n"
"ni3 yi3 mou3zhong3 fang1shi4 kun4 zhu4 le5 ta1。"

msgid "You trapped it somehow."
msgstr ""
"你​以​某种​方式​困住​了​它​。\n"
"ni3 yi3 mou3zhong3 fang1shi4 kun4 zhu4 le5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"You trigger the BrightLight System hidden in your cybereye.\n"
"\n"
"Everything goes white."
msgstr ""
"你​触发​藏​在​你​的​赛博​眼中​的​强光​系统​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​世界​变得​一片​雪白​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 chu4fa1 zang4 zai4 ni3 de5 sai4bo2 yan3zhong1 de5 jiang4 guang1 xi4tong3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4 bian4de5 yi1 pian1 xue3bai2。"

msgid ""
"You try to initiate a transfer between one of the credsticks from the desk and the one in your pocket.\n"
"\n"
"Sure enough, the stick from the desk is blank. So is the next one that you try, and the next."
msgstr ""
"你​试图​在​桌子​里​的​信用​棒​和​口袋​里​的​信用​棒​之间​发起​转账​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​果然​，​桌子​里​的​信用​棒​是​空​的​。​下​一根​、​再下​一根​同样​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4tu2 zai4 zhuo1zi5 li3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 he4 kou3dai4 li3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 zhi1jian1 fa1qi3 zhuan3zhang4。\n"
"\n"
"guo3ran2，zhuo1zi5 li3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4 shi4 kong1 de5。xia4 yi1 gen1、zai4 xia4 yi1 gen1 tong2yang4 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"You turn Blitz's hand aside and flip the toggle switch.\n"
"\n"
"There is a low humming noise as the machinery inside of the console spins to life."
msgstr ""
"你​推开​布里​茨​的​手​，​拨动​开关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​控制台​内部​的​机械​装置​开始运转​，​发出​低沉​的​嗡​鸣声​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tui1kai1 Bu4li3ci2 de5 shou3，bo1dong4 kai1guan1。\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4tai2 nei4bu4 de5 ji1xie4 zhuang1zhi4 kai1 shi3 yun4 zhuai3，fa1chu1 di1chen2 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"You turn away.\n"
"\n"
"Seconds later, you hear the roar of the Luger, and the dull smack of a body crumpling to the floor."
msgstr ""
"你​转过身​去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​几秒​后​，​你​听见​鲁格​手枪​的​轰鸣声​，​以及​身体​瘫倒​在​地时​发出​的​沉闷​声响​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ji1 miao3 hou4，ni3 ting1jian4 lu3 ge2 shou3qiang1 de5 hong1 ming2 sheng1，yi3ji2 shen1ti3 tan1 dao3 zai4 de5 shi2 fa1chu1 de5 chen2men4 sheng1xiang3。"

msgid ""
"You turn to find her standing in place, staring at the bodies of the "
"slaughtered acolytes. Her expression is unreadable."
msgstr ""
"你​转过身​去​，​发现​她​仍​站​在​原地​，​凝视着​那些​被​屠杀​的​侍​祭​的​尸体​。​她​的​表情​难以捉摸​。\n"
"ni3 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4，fa1xian4 ta1 reng2 zhan4 zai4 yuan2di4，ning2 shi4 zhao2 na4xie1 bei4 tu2sha1 de5 shi4 ji4 de5 shi1ti3。ta1 de5 biao3qing2 nan2yi3zhuo1mo1。"

msgid ""
"You two are in over your heads. If you don't let me get you out of this, "
"power shortages will be the least of your problems."
msgstr ""
"你们​俩​惹​上​大​麻烦​了​。​要是​不让​我​帮​你们​脱困​，​电力​短缺​恐怕​就​不是​你们​最​头疼​的​问题​了​。\n"
"ni3men5 lia3 re3 shang4 dai4 ma2fan5 le5。yao4shi5 bu4 rang4 wo3 bang1 ni3men5 tuo1kun4，dian4li4 duan3que1 kong3pa4 jiu4 bu4shi4 ni3men5 zui4 tou2teng2 de5 wen4ti2 le5。"

msgid "You two lived here long?"
msgstr ""
"你们​俩​住​在​这里​很久​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3men5 lia3 zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3 hen3 jiu3 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You type in the code as instructed, and your PDA's screen cuts to static.\n"
"\n"
"A moment later, a familiar image materializes on the screen. The penthouse room that you bugged. It appears to be a live feed from the cameras that you planted."
msgstr ""
"你​按​指示​输入​密码​，​PDA​屏幕​随即​切换​成​雪花​屏​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​屏幕​上​浮现​出​熟悉​的​画面​—​—​你​安装​监控​的​顶层​公寓​房间​。​这​似乎​是​你​埋设​的​摄像头​传回​的​实时​画面​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 zhi3shi4 shu1ru4 mi4ma3，PDA ping2mu4 sui2ji2 qie1huan4 cheng2 xue3hua1 bing3。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ping2mu4 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 shu2xi1 de5 hua4mian4——ni3 an1zhuang1 jian1kong4 de5 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 fang2jian1。zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 ni3 mai2she4 de5 she4xiang4tou2 chuan2hui2 de5 shi2shi2 hua4mian4。"

msgid ""
"You unclench your jaw, and the words begin to spill out of you. They come in a torrent, in a flood.\n"
"\n"
"You tell him about your job. About your client. About Amsel, and Monika, and Green Winters. Everything.\n"
"\n"
"You retch out the truth, and the pain begins to subside."
msgstr ""
"你​松开​紧咬​的​牙关​，​话语​便​如​决堤​的​洪水​般​倾泻​而出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​向​他​讲述​了​你​的​差事​。​你​的​客户​。​阿姆​泽尔​、​莫妮卡​和​格林​·​温特斯​。​所有​的​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​你​尽数​吐露​实情​的​同时​，​疼痛​也​随之​开始​消退​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 song1kai1 jin3 yao3 de5 ya2guan1，hua4yu3 bian4 ru2 jue2di1 de5 hong2shui3 ban1 qing1xie4 er2 chu1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang4 ta1 jiang3shu4 le5 ni3 de5 cha4shi4。ni3 de5 ke4hu4。E1mu3ze2er3、Mo4ni1ka3 he4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。suo3you3 de5 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 ni3 jin3shu4 tu3lu4 shi2qing2 de5 tong2shi2，teng2tong4 ye3 sui2zhi1 kai1shi3 xiao1tui4。"

msgid ""
"You update the records to point away from the power tap. The cafe kids "
"should be safe now."
msgstr ""
"你​更新​了​记录​，​将​相关​位置​从​电力​接口​移往​他处​。​豆​咖店​的​年轻​人们​现在​应该​安全​了​。\n"
"ni3 geng1xin1 le5 ji4lu4，jiang1 xiang1guan1 wei4zhi5 cong2 dian4li4 jie1kou3 yi2 wang3 ta1 chu3。dou4 ka1 dian4 de5 nian2qing1 ren2men5 xian4zai4 ying1gai1 an1quan2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You use your PDA to take a holopic of the number and the body, then step "
"away."
msgstr ""
"你​用​PDA​给​数字​和​尸体​拍​了​张照​，​然后​站​起身​离开​。\n"
"ni3 yong4 PDA gei3 shu4zi4 he4 shi1ti3 pai1 le5 zhang1 zhao4，ran2hou4 zhan4 qi3shen1 li2kai1。"

msgid "You used to live here, didn't you? I've seen your picture before."
msgstr ""
"你​以前​是不是​住​在​这里​？​我见​过​你​的​照片​。\n"
"ni3 yi3qian2 shi4bu5shi4 zhu4 zai4 zhe4li3？wo3 jian4 guo4 ni3 de5 zhao4pian4。"

msgid "You used to live upstairs?"
msgstr ""
"你们​以前​住​楼上​？\n"
"ni3men5 yi3qian2 zhu4 lou2shang4？"

msgid "You wanna compare notes, make sure that we're both on the same page?"
msgstr ""
"你​想​交换意见​，​确保​我们​俩​的​想法​一致​吗​？\n"
"ni3 xiang3 jiao1 huan4 yi4 jian4，que4bao3 wo3men5 lia3 de5 xiang3fa3 yi1zhi4 ma5？"

msgid "You want to get paid, don't you?"
msgstr ""
"你​不​想要​报酬​了​？\n"
"ni3 bu4 xiang3yao4 bao4chou5 le5？"

msgid ""
"You want to know what happens tonight that badly? What your friends died for... what Hermie died for...?\n"
"\n"
"Fine.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Vauclair turns his attention back to the computer, stubbing out his cigarette. He grabs a fresh one from the pack and lights it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​这么​想​知道​今晚​会​发生​什么​吗​？​你​的​朋友​们​为何​而​死​……​赫米​为何​而​死​……​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​将​注意力​重新​集中​到​电脑​上​，​掐灭​了​手中​的​香烟​。​他​从​烟盒​里​抽出​一支​新​的​香烟​，​点燃​了​它​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4me5 xiang3 zhi1dao4 jin1wan3 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 ma5？ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 wei4he2 er2 si3……he4 mi3 wei4he2 er2 si3……？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 chong2xin1 ji2zhong1 dao4 dian4nao3 shang4，qia1 mie4 le5 shou3 zhong4 de5 xiang1yan1。ta1 cong2 yan1 he2 li3 chou1chu1 yi1 zhi1 xin1 de5 xiang1yan1，dian3ran2 le5 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You want to put the rookie in charge.\n"
"\n"
"Again."
msgstr ""
"你​想​让​菜鸟​来​管事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​这​不是​头一回​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 rang4 cai4niao3 lai2 guan3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 zhe4 bu4shi4 tou2yi1hui2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You want trouble, dwarf? 'Cause unless you step out of my way, that's where "
"you're headed."
msgstr ""
"你​要​找麻烦​吗​，​矮人​？​再​不让​路​，​后果自负​。\n"
"ni3 yao4 zhao3ma2fan5 ma5，ai3ren2？zai4 bu4 rang4 lu4，hou4guo3zi4fu4。"

msgid ""
"You want trouble, pal? 'Cause unless you step out of my way, that's where "
"you're headed."
msgstr ""
"你​要​找麻烦​吗​，​朋友​？​再​不让​路​，​后果自负​。\n"
"ni3 yao4 zhao3ma2fan5 ma5，peng2you5？zai4 bu4 rang4 lu4，hou4guo3zi4fu4。"

msgid ""
"You wanted a name, I gave you a name. Want more? I can give you those, too.\n"
"\n"
"I can name you a hundred clients who'd love a piece of Schattennest. How do you intend to determine who really sent me?"
msgstr ""
"是​你们​要​问​名字​的​，​我​也​说​了​。​还​想要​什么​？​我​也​可以​告诉​你们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可以​说出​上​百个​想​在​影巢​分一杯羹​的​客户​。​你们​真能​分​清楚​是​谁​派​我​来​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3men5 yao4 wen4 ming2zi5 de5，wo3 ye3 shuo1 le5。hai2 xiang3yao4 shen2me5？wo3 ye3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3men5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 shuo1chu1 shang4 bai3 ge4 xiang3 zai4 ying3 chao2 fen1yi1bei1geng1 de5 ke4hu4。ni3men5 zhen1 neng2 fen4 qing1chu5 shi4 shei2 pai4 wo3 lai2 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You watch the team take this in - Eiger nodding her agreement. Glory staring ahead, lost in thought. Dietrich frowning, eyeing the floor.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, Eiger breaks the silence."
msgstr ""
"你​看着​队员​们​各自​的​反应​—​—​艾格尔​点头​赞同​；​格洛丽​凝视​前方​，​陷入​沉思​；​迪​特里​希​皱着眉头​，​紧盯​着​地面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​艾格尔​打破​了​沉默​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4 zhao2 dui4yuan2 men5 ge4zi4 de5 fan3ying4——Ai4ge2er3 dian3tou2 zan4tong2 ； Ge2luo4li2 ning2shi4 qian2fang1，xian4ru4 chen2si1 ； Di2te4li3xi1 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2，jin3ding1 zhao2 di4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，Ai4ge2er3 da3po4 le5 chen2mo4。"

msgid ""
"You watch the team take this in - Eiger nodding her agreement. Glory staring ahead, lost in thought. Dietrich frowning, eyeing the floor. Blitz fiddling with his deck and pretending not to understand.\n"
"\n"
"Eiger breaks the silence."
msgstr ""
"你​看着​队员​们​各自​的​反应​—​—​艾格尔​点头​赞同​；​格洛丽​凝视​前方​，​陷入​沉思​；​迪​特里​希​皱着眉头​，​紧盯​着​地面​；​而​布里​茨​则​摆弄​着​他​的​碟​板​，​假装​没​听懂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔​打破​了​沉默​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4 zhao2 dui4yuan2 men5 ge4zi4 de5 fan3ying4——Ai4ge2er3 dian3tou2 zan4tong2 ； Ge2luo4li2 ning2shi4 qian2fang1，xian4ru4 chen2si1 ； Di2te4li3xi1 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2，jin3ding1 zhao2 di4mian4 ； er2 Bu4li3ci2 ze2 bai3nong4 zhao2 ta1 de5 die2 ban3，jia3zhuang1 mei2 ting1dong3。\n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 da3po4 le5 chen2mo4。"

msgid ""
"You watch, powerless, as the ork's grin widens. \n"
"\n"
"The frantic breaths that you hear coming from offscreen increase in frequency."
msgstr ""
"你​无能为力​，​只能​看着​兽​人​的​笑容​愈发​狰狞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听见​画面​外​传来​的​急促​喘息声​越来越​频繁​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wu2neng2wei2li4，zhi3neng2 kan4 zhao2 shou4 ren2 de5 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 zheng1ning2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1jian4 hua4mian4 wai4 chuan2lai2 de5 ji2cu4 chuan3 xi1 sheng1 yue4lai2yue4 pin2fan2。"

msgid ""
"You were a human girl, presumably with an ID. Why didn't you go to a "
"hospital?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​个​人类​女孩​，​应该​有​身份证明​的​。​你​为什么​没​去​医院​呢​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 ren2lei4 nu:3hai2，ying1gai1 you3 shen1fen4zheng4ming2 de5。ni3 wei4shen2me5 mei2 qu4 yi1yuan4 ni2？"

msgid "You were a member of a drug gang. Why should I trust you?"
msgstr ""
"你​以前​是​贩毒​团伙​的​成员​。​我​为什么​要​相信​你​？\n"
"ni3 yi3qian2 shi4 fan4du2 tuan2huo3 de5 cheng2yuan2。wo3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 xiang1xin4 ni3？"

msgid "You were a soldier once. What changed you?"
msgstr ""
"你​曾​是​个​士兵​。​是​什么​改变​了​你​？\n"
"ni3 ceng2 shi4 ge4 shi4bing1。shi4 shen2me5 gai3bian4 le5 ni3？"

msgid "You were attacked?"
msgstr ""
"你们​被​袭击​了​？\n"
"ni3men5 bei4 xi2ji1 le5？"

msgid "You were here for the first Euro War, weren't you?"
msgstr ""
"你们​是​第一次​欧陆​大战​期间​过来​的​，​对​吧​？\n"
"ni3men5 shi4 di4yi1ci4 ou1 liu4 da4zhan4 qi1jian1 guo4lai2 de5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "You were here when the Flux started, weren't you?"
msgstr ""
"动荡​带​刚刚​诞生​的​时候​你们​就​在​这里​了​吧​？\n"
"dong4dang4 dai4 gang1gang5 dan4sheng1 de5 shi2hou5 ni3men5 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"You were just a kid, and Harrow is a monster. You couldn't have stopped "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"你​那时​还​只是​个​孩子​，​而​哈罗​是​个​怪物​。​你​完全​无法自拔​。\n"
"ni3 na4shi2 hai2 zhi3shi4 ge4 hai2zi5，er2 ha1luo2 shi4 ge4 guai4wu5。ni3 wan2quan2 wu2 fa3 zi4 ba2。"

msgid "You were military? Where did you serve?"
msgstr ""
"你​以前​是​军人​？​你​在​哪里​服役​的​？\n"
"ni3 yi3qian2 shi4 jun1ren2？ni3 zai4 na3li3 fu2yi4 de5？"

msgid "You were on a job, the same as we are. I can understand that."
msgstr ""
"你​和​我们​一样​，​都​是​履行​差事​而已​。​我能​理解​。\n"
"ni3 he4 wo3men5 yi1yang4，dou1 shi4 lu:3xing2 cha4shi4 er2yi3。wo3 neng2 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"You were right to bring this to me... it *is* important. But you were also "
"right when you said that our plates were full as it is."
msgstr ""
"你​把​这事​告诉​我​是​对​的​……​这​*​确实​*​很​重要​。​但​另​一件​事​你​也​没​说错​，​我们​目前​确实​有些​忙不过来​。\n"
"ni3 ba3 zhe4 shi4 gao4su4 wo3 shi4 dui4 de5……zhe4*que4shi2*hen3 zhong4yao4。dan4 ling4 yi1 jian4 shi4 ni3 ye3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4，wo3men5 mu4qian2 que4shi2 you3xie1 mang2bu4guo4lai2。"

msgid "You were the reason why the sewer system \"took care of itself.\""
msgstr ""
"下水道​系统​“​自行​运转​”​的​背后​原来​是因为​有​你们​。\n"
"xia4shui3dao4 xi4tong3“zi4xing2 yun4zhuan3” de5 bei4hou4 yuan2lai2 shi4 yin1 wei2 you3 ni3men5。"

msgid "You weren't lying."
msgstr ""
"你​没​说谎​。\n"
"ni3 mei2 shuo1huang3。"

msgid ""
"You weren't the right choice to lead before. I still believe that.\n"
"\n"
"But you are now."
msgstr ""
"你​当时​并​不​适合​作为​领导者​。​我​至今​仍​这么​认为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​现在​，​你​合格​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dang1shi2 bing4 bu4 shi4he2 zuo4wei2 ling3dao3zhe3。wo3 zhi4jin1 reng2 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4，ni3 he2ge2 le5。"

msgid "You weren't there, man. Some stuff went down. Had no choice, really."
msgstr ""
"你​当时​没​在​现场​。​事情​半路​出​了​岔子​，​我​也​没得​选​啊​。\n"
"ni3 dang1shi2 mei2 zai4 xian4chang3。shi4qing5 ban4lu4 chu1 le5 cha4zi5，wo3 ye3 mei2 de2 xuan3 a1。"

msgid "You will answer my questions, pest. Whether you want to or not."
msgstr ""
"你​会​回答​我​的​问题​，​虫豸​。​无论​你​是否​愿意​。\n"
"ni3 hui4 hui2da2 wo3 de5 wen4ti2，chong2zhi4。wu2lun4 ni3 shi4fou3 yuan4yi4。"

msgid ""
"You will meet with a team that I've arranged for you, and with their assistance, you will plant surveillance devices in his apartment.\n"
"\n"
"Take the U-Bahn to Frankfurter Tor, and go alone. The rest of your team will meet you there."
msgstr ""
"你​要​与​我​为​你​安排​的​小队​会合​，​在​他们​的​协助​下​，​你​将​在​他​的​公寓​内​安装​监控​设备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​乘坐​地铁​至​法兰克福​门​，​就​你​一个​人去​。​其余​队员​将​在​那里​与​你​会合​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 yu4 wo3 wei2 ni3 an1pai2 de5 xiao3 dui4 hui4he2，zai4 ta1men5 de5 xie2zhu4 xia4，ni3 jiang1 zai4 ta1 de5 gong1yu4 nei4 an1zhuang1 jian1kong4 she4bei4。\n"
"\n"
"cheng2zuo4 di4tie3 zhi4 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2，jiu4 ni3 yi1ge5 ren2 qu4。qi2yu2 dui4yuan2 jiang1 zai4 na4li5 yu4 ni3 hui4he2。"

msgid ""
"You will need both pieces to restore the elevator. Here, take the coupling... and this spirit focus.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He hands you an object carved with arcane symbols. It feels warm to the touch.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As you see, I honor my deals."
msgstr ""
"你​需要​两个​部件​才能​让​电梯​恢复​运作​。​这个​耦合​器归​你​了​……​还有​这件​精魂​法器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​将​一个​雕刻​着​神秘​符号​的​物品​交给​你​。​它​的​表面​很​温暖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如​你​所见​，​我​是​个​信守​承诺​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 liang3 ge4 bu4jian4 cai2neng2 rang4 dian4ti1 hui1fu4 yun4zuo4。zhe4ge5 ou3he2 qi4 gui1 ni3 le5……hai2you3 zhe4 jian4 jing1hun2 fa3 qi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 yi1ge5 diao1ke4 zhao2 shen2mi4 fu2hao4 de5 wu4pin3 jiao1gei3 ni3。ta1 de5 biao3mian4 hen3 wen1nuan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2 ni3 suo3jian4，wo3 shi4 ge4 xin4shou3 cheng2nuo4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"You will not see me in the Kreuzbasar again; my concerns are global now. But understand that everything you have done has been for the greater good.\n"
"\n"
"My greater good, specifically.\n"
"\n"
"Goodbye."
msgstr ""
"你​再也不会​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​见到​我​了​；​我​的​目光​现在​将​转向​全球​。​但​请​你​明白​，​你​做​的​每一件​事​都​对​大局​有利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​确切​地说​，​是​我​个人​的​大局​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再会​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 ye3 bu4 hui4 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jian4dao4 wo3 le5 ； wo3 de5 mu4guang1 xian4zai4 jiang1 zhuan3xiang4 quan2qiu2。dan4 qing3 ni3 ming2bai5，ni3 zuo4 de5 mei3 yi1 jian4 shi4 dou1 dui4 da4ju2 you3li4。\n"
"\n"
"que4qie4 de5 shuo1，shi4 wo3 ge4ren2 de5 da4ju2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4hui4。"

msgid ""
"You will place the stolen bioware samples that you're carrying on the ground, then lie on your belly with your hands on your head!\n"
"\n"
"Do it now, or I will order my men to open fire!"
msgstr ""
"把​你​偷走​的​生体​殖装​样本​放在​地上​，​然后​趴在​地上​，​双手​抱头​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​立刻​照​做​，​否则​我​就​下令​开火​了​！\n"
"\n"
"ba3 ni3 tou1 zou3 de5 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 fang4 zai4 di4shang5，ran2hou4 pa1 zai4 di4shang5，shuang1shou3 bao4tou2！\n"
"\n"
"li4ke4 zhao4 zuo4，fou3ze2 wo3 jiu4 xia4ling4 kai1huo3 le5！"

msgid ""
"You will relinquish Enstad to us. We will dispatch him, quickly and cleanly.\n"
"\n"
"As you were meant to."
msgstr ""
"你​必须​把​恩施​塔德​交给​我们​。​我们​会​干净利索​地​结果​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​你​本该​做​的​那样​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 ba3 en1Shi1ta3de2 jiao1gei3 wo3men5。wo3men5 hui4 gan4 jing4 li4 suo3 de5 jie1guo3 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 ni3 ben3 gai1 zuo4 de5 na4yang4。"

msgid ""
"You will remain where you are. If you attempt to escape, I will order your "
"death. My patience has already been strained to its breaking point - do not "
"test it further."
msgstr ""
"你​给​我​老实​待​在​原地​。​若​你​试图​逃跑​，​我​将​下令​处决​你​。​我​的​耐心​已到​了​极限​—​—​切勿​继续​试探​。\n"
"ni3 gei3 wo3 lao3shi5 dai1 zai4 yuan2di4。ruo4 ni3 shi4tu2 tao2pao3，wo3 jiang1 xia4ling4 chu3jue2 ni3。wo3 de5 nai4xin1 yi3 dao4 le5 ji2xian4——qie4wu4 ji4xu4 shi4tan4。"

msgid ""
"You will see. You may have killed three of my peasants, but I can activate more!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He rubs his chin, grinning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They will return to me, and I will show them the love that only a true ruler can. I will *bathe* them in my affection, and they--"
msgstr ""
"你​会​看到​的​。​你​可能​杀​了​我​的​三个​臣民​，​但​我​可以​激活​更​多​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​抚摸​着​下巴​，​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​会​回到​我​身边​，​而​我​将​以​唯有​真正​的​统治者​才能​给予​的​爱意​对待​他们​。​我​将​用​我​的​慈爱​*​沐浴​*​他们​，​而​他们​—​—\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hui4 kan4dao4 de5。ni3 ke3neng2 sha1 le5 wo3 de5 san1 ge4 chen2min2，dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 ji1huo2 geng1 duo1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fu3mo1 zhao2 xia4ba5，lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 hui4 hui2dao4 wo3 shen1bian1，er2 wo3 jiang1 yi3 wei2you3 zhen1zheng4 de5 tong3zhi4zhe3 cai2neng2 ji3yu3 de5 ai4yi4 dui4dai4 ta1men5。wo3 jiang1 yong4 wo3 de5 ci2ai4*mu4yu4*ta1men5，er2 ta1men5 — —"

msgid ""
"You will, ace. I have faith in you.\n"
"\n"
"There are a couple of other things that you should probably know, though."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​的​，​王牌​。​我​对​你​有​信心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​还有​一些​事情​你​可能​需要​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 de5，wang2pai2。wo3 dui4 ni3 you3 xin4xin1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，hai2you3 yi1xie1 shi4qing5 ni3 ke3neng2 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid "You win, Doc. I'll go read through your notes."
msgstr ""
"你​赢​了​，​博士​。​我会​去​读读​你​的​笔记​。\n"
"ni3 ying2 le5，bo2shi4。wo3 hui4 qu4 dou4 dou4 ni3 de5 bi3ji4。"

msgid ""
"You woke up to find your world destroyed, didn’t you, Feuerschwinge? We "
"killed the green."
msgstr ""
"你​醒来时​发现自己​的​世界​被​毁​，​是​这样​吗​，​火翼​？​是​我们​杀死​了​绿色​。\n"
"ni3 xing3 lai2 shi2 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 de5 shi4jie4 bei4 hui3，shi4 zhe4yang4 ma5，Huo3yi4？shi4 wo3men5 sha1si3 le5 lu:4se4。"

msgid ""
"You won't have to wait long. I know just the place to hit: that same Aztechnology data node that I stole the information from in the first place.\n"
"\n"
"I already know that I can get past the security, and my gut tells me that I'll find Emilie there."
msgstr ""
"你​不会​等​太久​的​。​我​知道​该​去​哪里​：​我​一​开始​偷​情报​的​那个​阿兹特​科技​数据​节点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​知道​该​怎么​绕过​安保​措施​了​，​而且​我​的​直觉​告诉​我​，​艾米莉​就​在​那里​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 deng3 tai4 jiu3 de5。wo3 zhi1dao4 gai1 qu4 na3li3：wo3 yi1 kai1shi3 tou1 qing2bao4 de5 na4ge5 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 shu4ju4 jie2dian3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 rao4guo4 an1bao3 cuo4shi1 le5，er2qie3 wo3 de5 zhi2jue2 gao4su4 wo3，ai4 mi3 li4 jiu4 zai4 na4li5。"

msgid ""
"You won't have to. As soon as you bring me along on another run, I'll show you what I can do.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He cracks his knuckles with a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And believe me, it will be *masterful.*"
msgstr ""
"这倒​不用​。​等​我们​下次​跑​差事​的​时候​，​我​就​可以​让​你​看个够​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​笑​着​捏​了​捏​指节​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​相信​我​，​绝对​*​够劲​*​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dao3 bu4yong4。deng3 wo3men5 xia4ci4 pao2 cha4shi4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 jiu4 ke3yi3 rang4 ni3 kan4 ge4 gou4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 zhao2 nie1 le5 nie1 zhi3jie2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiang1xin4 wo3，jue2dui4*gou4 jin4*。"

msgid ""
"You won't regret it, friend.\n"
"\n"
"Promise."
msgstr ""
"你​不会​为此​感到​后悔​的​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​保证​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 wei4ci3 gan3dao4 hou4hui3 de5，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid "You won't. This team is going to succeed, with or without you."
msgstr ""
"根本​不会​有​这​回事​。​不管​有没有​你​，​我们​的​队伍​都​会​迈向​成功​。\n"
"gen1ben3 bu4hui4 you3 zhe4 hui2shi4。bu4guan3 you3mei2you3 ni3，wo3men5 de5 dui4wu3 dou1 hui4 mai4xiang4 cheng2gong1。"

msgid "You worked for food? Who was feeding you?"
msgstr ""
"你们​用​工作​换取​食物​？​谁​在​饲喂​你们​？\n"
"ni3men5 yong4 gong1zuo4 huan4qu3 shi2wu4？shei2 zai4 si4wei4 ni3men5？"

msgid ""
"You worry too much, chief! I'm the *best,* remember? So where's the harm in "
"digging a little deeper? I mean, Em might *need* me!"
msgstr ""
"你​太过​担心​了​，​头儿​！​我​可是​*​最​厉害​的​*​，​记得​吗​？​稍微​多​发掘​一下​又​能​怎样​？​而且​艾米莉​可能​*​需要​*​我​！\n"
"ni3 tai4guo4 dan1xin1 le5，tou2r5！wo3 ke3shi4*zui4 li4hai5 de5*，ji4de5 ma5？shao1wei1 duo1 fa1jue2 yi1xia4 you4 neng2 zen3yang4？er2qie3 ai4 mi3 li4 ke3neng2*xu1yao4*wo3！"

msgid "You wouldn't believe me if I told you."
msgstr ""
"说​了​你​也​不会​相信​的​。\n"
"shuo1 le5 ni3 ye3 bu4hui4 xiang1xin4 de5。"

msgid "You wouldn't have."
msgstr ""
"确实​。\n"
"que4shi2。"

msgid ""
"You wrestle an arm up from where it hangs at your side and reach for the sparking doorknob. A moment later, you feel a cold metal hand grasp your shoulder.\n"
"\n"
"Glory.\n"
"\n"
"She speaks a single word."
msgstr ""
"你​挣扎​着​抬起​垂​在​身侧​的​手臂​，​想要​努力​触碰​那​闪光​的​门把手​。​片刻​之后​，​一只​冰冷​的​金属​手掌​按住​了​你​的​肩膀​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​格洛丽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​只​说​了​一个​字​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zheng1zha2 zhao2 tai2qi3 chui2 zai4 shen1 ce4 de5 shou3bi4，xiang3yao4 nu3li4 chu4peng4 na4 shan3guang1 de5 men2ba3shou5。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，yi1 zhi3 bing1leng3 de5 jin1shu3 shou3zhang3 an4 zhu4 le5 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 Ge2luo4li2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhi3 shuo1 le5 yi1ge5 zi4。"

msgid "You! Stay right where you are!"
msgstr ""
"你​！​站​在​原地​别动​！\n"
"ni3！zhan4 zai4 yuan2di4 bie4 dong4！"

msgid ""
"You! The $(l.guy) from the cyberware kiosk! What the hell is going on here?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He advances on you, full of bluster and bravado.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is my apartment! I own it! You can't just waltz in here and start pulling the walls apart without my consent!"
msgstr ""
"是​你​！​赛博​改造​摊位​的​那家伙​！​这里​发生​了​什么​事​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朝​你​逼近​，​满身​狂妄​与​嚣张​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​的​公寓​！​我​是​户主​！​未经​我​同意​，​你​不能​就​这么​大摇大摆​地​闯进来​，​开始​拆墙​！\n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3！sai4bo2 gai3zao4 tan1wei4 de5 na4 jia1 huo3！zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 bi1jin4，man3shen1 kuang2wang4 yu4 xiao1zhang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 gong1yu4！wo3 shi4 hu4zhu3！wei4jing1 wo3 tong2yi4，ni3 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4me5 da4yao2da4bai3 de5 chuang3 jin4 lai2，kai1shi3 chai1 qiang2！"

msgid ""
"You'd be surprised what I know, but you don't seem like the perceptive type, so that's to be expected.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She practically hisses her response, her eyes suddenly narrowed and venomous.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​可能​会​惊讶​于​我​所​知道​的​，​但​你​看起来​不​像是​个​善于​观察​的​人​，​所以​这​也​在​意料之中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​眼睛​突然​眯起​，​充满​恶毒​的​意味​，​声音​几乎​带有​嘶嘶声​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3neng2 hui4 jing1ya4 yu2 wo3 suo3 zhi1dao4 de5，dan4 ni3 kan4qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 shi4 ge4 shan4yu2 guan1cha2 de5 ren2，suo3yi3 zhe4 ye3 zai4 yi4liao4zhi1zhong1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan3jing5 tu1ran2 mi2 qi3，chong1man3 e4du2 de5 yi4wei4，sheng1yin1 ji1hu1 dai4you3 si1si1sheng1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "You'd be surprised what I'll believe. Try me."
msgstr ""
"这​可不​一定​。​你​不妨​说说看​。\n"
"zhe4 ke3bu5 yi1ding4。ni3 bu4fang2 shuo1 shuo1 kan4。"

msgid ""
"You'd better be. If you flake out on the job, you and me are gonna have "
"problems."
msgstr ""
"最好​如此​。​如果​你​把​事情​搞砸​的话​，​我俩​就​麻烦​大​了​。\n"
"zui4hao3 ru2ci3。ru2guo3 ni3 ba3 shi4qing5 gao3za2 de5hua4，wo3 lia3 jiu4 ma2fan5 dai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You'd need a monster rig to decrypt this. Mogens asked you to drop it in the"
" trash near the Stuffer Shack."
msgstr ""
"解密​这个​需要​一台​超级计算机​。​莫根​斯​让​你​把​它​扔进​填充​屋​杂货店​附近​的​垃圾箱​里​。\n"
"jie3mi4 zhe4ge5 xu1yao4 yi1 tai2 chao1ji2ji4suan4ji1。mo4 gen1 si1 rang4 ni3 ba3 ta1 reng1 jin4 tian2chong1 wu1 za2huo4dian4 fu4jin4 de5 la1ji1xiang1 li3。"

msgid "You'd rather I do it behind your back?"
msgstr ""
"你​宁愿​我​在​你​背后​这么​说​吗​？\n"
"ni3 ning4yuan4 wo3 zai4 ni3 bei4hou4 zhe4me5 shuo1 ma5？"

msgid "You'd've done fine. But it was my job to lead the team, so I did it."
msgstr ""
"你​也​可以​的​。​但​带领​团队​是​我​的​职责​，​所以​我​承担​了​下来​。\n"
"ni3 ye3 ke3yi3 de5。dan4 dai4ling3 tuan2dui4 shi4 wo3 de5 zhi2ze2，suo3yi3 wo3 cheng2dan1 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid "You'll \"make it worth my while,\" huh? Tell me more."
msgstr ""
"什么​叫​你​会​“​报答​”​我​？​详细​说​说​。\n"
"shen2me5 jiao4 ni3 hui4“bao4da2” wo3？xiang2xi4 shuo1 shuo1。"

msgid "You'll get over it. Come on, we have a job to do."
msgstr ""
"别多想​了​。​走​吧​，​我们​还有​任务​要​完成​。\n"
"bie4 duo1 xiang3 le5。zou3 ba1，wo3men5 hai2you3 ren4wu5 yao4 wan2cheng2。"

msgid "You'll have to clarify that."
msgstr ""
"你​得​把​话​说​清楚​。\n"
"ni3 de2 ba3 hua4 shuo1 qing1chu5。"

msgid ""
"You'll have to excuse this old dummkopf. Listen, call me Schrotty. If you "
"need anything fixed or sold that isn't SoTA, just let me know. {{GM}}His "
"beard moves to hint at a smile, and he turns his focus back to his floppy "
"disk readers.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"原谅​我​这个​老糊涂​的​絮叨​吧​。​以后​叫​我​施罗蒂​就行了​。​如果​你​想要​卖​或者​修​什么​老物什​，​就​来​找​我​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​胡须​微微​颤动​，​似乎​露出​一个​微笑​，​随即​又​将​注意力​转回​翻盘​读取器​上​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"yuan2liang4 wo3 zhe4ge5 lao3hu2tu5 de5 xu4dao5 ba1。yi3hou4 jiao4 wo3 shi1 luo2 di4 jiu4 xing2 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 mai4 huo4zhe3 xiu1 shen2me5 lao3 wu4 shen2，jiu4 lai2 zhao3 wo3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 hu2xu1 wei1wei1 chan4dong4，si4hu1 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 wei1xiao4，sui2ji2 you4 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3hui2 fan1pan2 dou4 qu3 qi4 shang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You'll join him soon enough, don't you worry.\n"
"\n"
"But first things first. I have a dragon to release."
msgstr ""
"别​担心​，​你​很快​也​会​随​他​而​去​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​这个​之后​再说​。​我要​先去​释放​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，ni3 hen3 kuai4 ye3 hui4 sui2 ta1 er2 qu4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zhe4ge5 zhi1hou4 zai4shuo1。wo3 yao4 xian1 qu4 shi4fang4 ju4long2。"

msgid "You'll never know we were here."
msgstr ""
"不会​有人​知道​我们​来​过​的​。\n"
"bu4hui4 you3ren2 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 lai2 guo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"You'll never make it back to the elevator in time, but I've found another exit point for you.\n"
"\n"
"There is a security door near the generators. I will mark it on your PDA. When you're ready to make your egress, this will be your best call."
msgstr ""
"现在​肯定​来不及​撤回​电梯​了​，​但​我​为​你​找到​了​另​一个​撤离​点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​发电机组​附近​有​一扇​安全门​。​我会​将​它​标注​在​你​的​PDA​上​。​当​你​准备​撤离​时​，​这​将​是​你​的​最佳​选择​。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ken3ding4 lai2bu5ji2 che4hui2 dian4ti1 le5，dan4 wo3 wei2 ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 ling4 yi1ge5 che4li2 dian3。\n"
"\n"
"fa1 dian4 ji1 zu3 fu4jin4 you3 yi1 shan1 an1 quan2 men2。wo3 hui4 jiang1 ta1 biao1zhu4 zai4 ni3 de5 PDA shang4。dang1 ni3 zhun3bei4 che4li2 shi2，zhe4 jiang1 shi4 ni3 de5 zui4jia1 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"You'll note the heavy security posted at the front door. Those are Aztechnology employees. \n"
"\n"
"They're dangerous, to be sure, but you could probably take them without too much difficulty."
msgstr ""
"你​大概​也​看到​了​，​正门​的​戒备​十分​森严​。​那些​都​是​阿兹特​科技​的​雇员​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毋庸置疑​，​这些​人​很​危险​。​但​对​你​来说​，​消灭​他们​应该​不会​特别​困难​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 da4gai4 ye3 kan4dao4 le5，zheng4men2 de5 jie4bei4 shi2fen1 sen1yan2。na4xie1 dou1 shi4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 gu4yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"wu2 yong1 zhi4 yi2，zhe4xie1 ren2 hen3 wei1xian3。dan4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1，xiao1mie4 ta1men5 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 te4bie2 kun4nan5。"

msgid "You'll pay for this, Audran."
msgstr ""
"你​会​付出代价​的​，​奥​德兰​。\n"
"ni3 hui4 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4 de5，Ao4de2lan2。"

msgid ""
"You'll probably see some burnouts floating around the ground floor. They're all there for the Hub. It's like... some kind of church, or something. Guy called \"Parson\" runs it.\n"
"\n"
"'Tween you and me, they're all batshit crazy. Not dangerous, just... nuts."
msgstr ""
"你​可能​会​在​一楼​看到​一些​游荡​的​瘾君子​。​他们​都​是​去​中枢​的​。​那​地方​……​跟​教会​差不多​吧​。​一个​叫​“​帕森​”​的​人​掌管​着​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​说​，​他们​全都​疯​了​。​倒​也​不算​危险​，​只是​……​疯得​离谱​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3neng2 hui4 zai4 yi1 lou2 kan4dao4 yi1xie1 you2dang4 de5 yin3jun1zi3。ta1men5 dou1 shi4 qu4 zhong1shu1 de5。na4 di4fang1……gen1 jiao1hui4 cha4bu5duo1 ba1。yi1ge5 jiao4“pa4 sen1” de5 ren2 zhang3guan3 zhao2 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1，ta1men5 quan2dou1 feng1 le5。dao3 ye3 bu4suan4 wei1xian3，zhi3shi4……feng1 de2 li2pu3。"

msgid ""
"You'll understand if I can't take that at face value.\n"
"\n"
"You should turn back while you still can, stranger. I don't want to fight you, but we can't risk letting an unknown player into this... \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment to search for the right word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...*situation* right now."
msgstr ""
"我​不能​轻易​相信​你​的话​，​这​你​应该​能​理解​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​最好​趁现在​回头​离开​，​陌生人​。​我们​不想​跟​你​打​，​但​也​不能​冒险​让​其他​未知​势力​卷入​目前​的​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​似乎​在​寻找​合适​的​词语​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​*​局面​*​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 qing1yi4 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5hua4，zhe4 ni3 ying1gai1 neng2 li3jie3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zui4hao3 chen4 xian4 zai4 hui2tou2 li2kai1，mo4sheng1ren2。wo3men5 bu4xiang3 gen1 ni3 da3，dan4 ye3 bu4neng2 mao4xian3 rang4 qi2ta1 wei4zhi1 shi4li5 juan3ru4 mu4qian2 de5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，si4hu1 zai4 xun2zhao3 he2shi4 de5 ci2yu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……*ju2mian4*。"

msgid ""
"You'll want to talk to the Mettbachs. Old Gunari is a hard man, but he'll cut you a fair deal as long as you treat his people with respect.\n"
"\n"
"Look for the Romani caravans on the east side of town."
msgstr ""
"你​可以​去​和​梅特​巴赫​家族​谈谈​。​老古纳里​很​强硬​，​但​只要​你​尊重​他​的​族人​，​他​就​肯定​会​给你个​公道​的​价钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​罗姆人​的​商队​就​在​街区​东边​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 qu4 he4 mei2 te4 ba1he4 jia1zu2 tan2tan2。lao3 gu3 na4 li3 hen3 qiang2ying4，dan4 zhi3yao4 ni3 zun1zhong4 ta1 de5 zu2ren2，ta1 jiu4 ken3ding4 hui4 gei3 ni3 ge4 gong1dao4 de5 jia4qian5。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 luo2mu3ren2 de5 shang1dui4 jiu4 zai4 jie1qu1 dong1bian5。"

msgid "You're a bastard."
msgstr ""
"你​真是​个​狗​杂种​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 gou3 za2zhong3。"

msgid "You're a big boy, tell him yourself."
msgstr ""
"你​自己​不是​长嘴​了​吗​。​你​自己​和​他​说​。\n"
"ni3 zi4ji3 bu4shi4 zhang3 zui3 le5 ma5。ni3 zi4ji3 he4 ta1 shuo1。"

msgid "You're a decker, then?"
msgstr ""
"所以​，​你​是​个​碟​客​？\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 shi4 ge4 die2 ke4？"

msgid ""
"You're a good $(l.man), $(l.name). One that I'm proud to run with.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She straightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And speaking of which, we should probably get back to it."
msgstr ""
"你​是​个​好人​，​$(l.name)​。​我​很​自豪​能​与​你​共事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​挺直​了​身子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​到​这里​，​我们​该​继续​忙​正事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2，$(l.name)。wo3 hen3 zi4hao2 neng2 yu4 ni3 gong4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 dao4 zhe4li3，wo3men5 gai1 ji4xu4 mang2 zheng4shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You're a good friend. I mean that, $(l.name)... I respect you greatly, and I trust you.\n"
"\n"
"I hope that the feeling's mutual."
msgstr ""
"你​是​个​好​朋友​，​我​是​认真​的​，​$(l.name)​……​我​很​尊重​你​，​也​信任​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​你​也​是​这么​想​的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 hao3 peng2you5，wo3 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5，$(l.name)……wo3 hen3 zun1zhong4 ni3，ye3 xin4ren4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。"

msgid "You're a good man."
msgstr ""
"你​是​个​好人​。\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2。"

msgid ""
"You're a good runner with a good crew, $(l.name) - but it'll never be *my* crew. No hard feelings, though - I'll still moonlight for you whenever you need me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She lifts the glass to her lips, closes her eyes, and drains it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know my price, and you know where to find me."
msgstr ""
"$(l.name)​，​你​是​一把​好手​，​团队​也​很​不错​，​但​我​永远​不会​考虑​加入​。​别往​心里​去​—​—​如果​你​需要​找人​帮忙​的话​，​我​随时​可以​接点​私活​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​杯子​举到​嘴边​，​闭上眼​一饮而尽​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​我​的​报价​，​你​也​知道​该来​哪里找​我​。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 shi4 yi1 ba3 hao3shou3，tuan2dui4 ye3 hen3 bu4cuo4，dan4 wo3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 kao3lu:4 jia1ru4。bie4 wang3 xin1li5 qu4——ru2guo3 ni3 xu1yao4 zhao3 ren2 bang1mang2 de5hua4，wo3 sui2shi2 ke3yi3 jie1dian3 si1 huo2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 bei1zi5 ju3 dao4 zui3 bian1，bi4 shang4 yan3 yi1yin3er2jin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 de5 bao4jia4，ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 gai1 lai2 na3 li3 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"You're a life-saver, chummer. If you find Viktor... well, if he's still "
"alive down there, tell him I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"你​可​帮​我​大忙​了​，​朋友​。​如果​你​能​找到​维克多​……​如果​他​在​下面​还​活着​的话​，​和​他​说​我​很​抱歉​。\n"
"ni3 ke3 bang1 wo3 dai4 mang2 le5，peng2you5。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zhao3dao4 wei2 ke4 duo1……ru2guo3 ta1 zai4 xia4mian4 hai2 huo2zhe5 de5hua4，he4 ta1 shuo1 wo3 hen3 bao4qian4。"

msgid "You're a sick bastard, Audran."
msgstr ""
"你​真他妈​变态​，​奥​德兰​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1 ta1 ma1 bian4tai4，Ao4de2lan2。"

msgid ""
"You're about to commit an atrocity. You think I'm gonna scurry off and let "
"you do it?"
msgstr ""
"你​即将​犯下​滔天大罪​。​你​以为​我会​逃之夭夭​，​任由​你​胡作非为​吗​？\n"
"ni3 ji2jiang1 fan4 xia4 tao1tian1da4zui4。ni3 yi3wei2 wo3 hui4 tao2zhi1yao1yao1，ren4you2 ni3 hu2zuo4fei1wei2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You're about to turn away when an ad on the last page grabs your attention: the newest iteration of the Encephalon system, complete with an integrated Math SPU.\n"
"\n"
"The Encephalon NEXT®, as it's called, is bleeding edge commercial-grade tech. Non-compete agreements prevent it from being sold at most stores, but you've found one that carries it."
msgstr ""
"你​正要​翻页​时​，​最后​一页​的​广告​吸引​了​你​的​目光​：​最新​一代​的​脑接​系统​，​配备​集成式​数学​处理单元​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​款​名为​脑接​NEXT​®​的​产品​，​代表​着​尖端​的​商用​技术​。​由于​竞业禁止​协议​的​限制​，​它​在​多数​商店​都​无法​购买​，​但​你​终于​找到​一家​有货​的​店铺​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zheng4yao4 fan1 xie2 shi2，zui4hou4 yi1 xie2 de5 guang3gao4 xi1yin3 le5 ni3 de5 mu4guang1：zui4xin1 yi1dai4 de5 nao3 jie1 xi4tong3，pei4bei4 ji2 cheng2 shi4 shu4xue2 chu3 li3 dan1 yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 kuan3 ming2wei2 nao3 jie1 NEXT ® de5 chan3pin3，dai4biao3 zhao2 jian1duan1 de5 shang1yong4 ji4shu4。you2yu2 jing4 ye4 jin1 zhi3 xie2yi4 de5 xian4zhi4，ta1 zai4 duo1shu4 shang1dian4 dou1 wu2fa3 gou4mai3，dan4 ni3 zhong1yu2 zhao3dao4 yi1jia1 you3 huo4 de5 dian4pu4。"

msgid ""
"You're about to turn away when you find something of interest: a power consumption log.\n"
"\n"
"The location of Danni's power tap is highlighted in red at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"正当​你​要​转身​离开​时​，​你​总算​发现​了​些​有趣​的​东西​：​一份​功耗​日志​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​丹妮​的​电力​接口​位置​被​标红​置顶​了​。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4dang1 ni3 yao4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 shi2，ni3 zong3suan4 fa1xian4 le5 xie1 you3qu4 de5 dong1xi1：yi1 fen4 gong1hao4 ri4zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan1 ni1 de5 dian4li4 jie1kou3 wei4zhi5 bei4 biao1 hong2 zhi4ding3 le5。"

msgid ""
"You're an extra set of eyes and a gun, and you aren't asking me to pay you. "
"That's good enough for me."
msgstr ""
"有​你​在​，​好歹​也​算​多个​人手​，​而且​你​也​没​找​我​要​报酬​。​这​对​我​来说​何乐而不为​呢​。\n"
"you3 ni3 zai4，hao3dai3 ye3 suan4 duo1ge5 ren2shou3，er2qie3 ni3 ye3 mei2 zhao3 wo3 yao4 bao4chou5。zhe4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 he2le4er2bu4wei2 ni2。"

msgid "You're an idiot, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"你​是​个​笨蛋​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 ben4dan4，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"You're an intelligent woman, Glory. I can't believe that you couldn't see "
"through this."
msgstr ""
"你​是​个​聪明​的​女人​，​格洛丽​。​真​不敢相信​你​当初​竟然​没​看透​这件​事​。\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 cong1ming5 de5 nu:3ren2，Ge2luo4li2。zhen1 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 ni3 dang1chu1 jing4ran2 mei2 kan4tou4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"You're avoiding the question. What the hell did you do to her? How did you "
"take her memories?"
msgstr ""
"你​在​跟​我​绕弯子​。​你​到底​对​她​做​了​什么​？​你​是​如何​夺取​了​她​的​记忆​？\n"
"ni3 zai4 gen1 wo3 rao4wan1zi5。ni3 dao4di3 dui4 ta1 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？ni3 shi4 ru2he2 duo2qu3 le5 ta1 de5 ji4yi4？"

msgid "You're back."
msgstr ""
"你​回来​了​。\n"
"ni3 hui2lai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"You're back.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He rubs his bloodshot eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Why?"
msgstr ""
"你​又​回来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​揉​了​揉​布满​血丝​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​为什么​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 hui2lai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 rou2 le5 rou2 bu4man3 xue4si1 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei4shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"You're back. Again.\n"
"\n"
"Keycard E? Do you have it?"
msgstr ""
"你​又​回来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门禁卡​E​？​你​找到​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 hui2lai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"men2 jin1 ka3 E？ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You're back. Again.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She brushes a loose strand of hair away from her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, tell me what you want. The sooner you talk, the sooner we can get this over with."
msgstr ""
"你​又​回来​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​拨开​脸上​的​一缕​头发​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​告诉​我​你​想要​什么​。​你​早点​说​出来​，​我们​就​能​早点​结束​这​事​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 hui2lai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bo1kai1 lian3 shang4 de5 yi1 lu:3 tou2fa5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，gao4su4 wo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5。ni3 zao3dian3 shuo1 chu1lai2，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 zao3dian3 jie2shu4 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid "You're back. Find anything else?"
msgstr ""
"你​回来​了​。​有​其他​发现​吗​？\n"
"ni3 hui2lai5 le5。you3 qi2ta1 fa1xian4 ma5？"

msgid "You're between me and a paycheck, lady. That's a bad place to be."
msgstr ""
"女士​，​你​挡住​了​我领​薪酬​的​去路​。​只能​怪​你​不长​眼​了​。\n"
"nu:3shi4，ni3 dang3zhu4 le5 wo3 ling3 xin1chou2 de5 qu4lu4。zhi3neng2 guai4 ni3 bu4 zhang3 yan3 le5。"

msgid "You're charging us? Seriously? This isn't even your building any more!"
msgstr ""
"你​还​跟​我们​谈​条件​？​搞笑​呢​？​这栋​楼​都​不是​你们​的​地盘​了​！\n"
"ni3 hai2 gen1 wo3men5 tan2 tiao2jian4？gao3xiao4 ni2？zhe4 dong4 lou2 dou1 bu4shi4 ni3men5 de5 di4pan2 le5！"

msgid ""
"You're clearly preoccupied with this. In our line of work, \"preoccupied\" "
"can get you killed. So spit it out and we'll deal with it."
msgstr ""
"你​显然​对​此事​心事重重​。​干​我们​这行​的​人​，​“​心事重重​”​是​会​要命​的​。​所以​你​可以​说​出来​，​我们​一块​解决​。\n"
"ni3 xian3ran2 dui4 ci3shi4 xin1shi4chong2chong2。gan4 wo3men5 zhe4 xing2 de5 ren2，“xin1shi4chong2chong2” shi4 hui4 yao4ming4 de5。suo3yi3 ni3 ke3yi3 shuo1 chu1lai2，wo3men5 yi1kuai4 jie3jue2。"

msgid ""
"You're confused, Glory. Lost.\n"
"\n"
"But go on. Tell me how else Harrow is \"hurting\" us, and I'll tell you why you're wrong."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​陷入​了​困惑​，​迷失​了​方向​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​继续​说​吧​。​告诉​我​，​哈罗​还​在​用​什么​方式​“​伤害​”​我们​，​我会​告诉​你​为什么​你​错​了​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 xian4ru4 le5 kun4huo4，mi2shi1 le5 fang1xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ji4xu4 shuo1 ba1。gao4su4 wo3，ha1luo2 hai2 zai4 yong4 shen2me5 fang1shi4“shang1hai4” wo3men5，wo3 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 wei4shen2me5 ni3 cuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You're damn right he would. Now, are you going to be the good man Hermie "
"remembered you as, and drop this? Or are you going to stick to the \"mad "
"scientist\" routine, and force me to put you down?"
msgstr ""
"你​可算​说​对​了​，​他​当然​会​这么​做​。​现在​，​你​是​要​做​赫米​记忆​中​的​那个​好人​，​放弃​这件​事​？​还是​要​继续​搞​“​疯狂​科学家​”​这​一套​，​逼​我​不得不​把​你​解决​掉​？\n"
"ni3 ke3 suan4 shuo1 dui4 le5，ta1 dang1ran2 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4。xian4zai4，ni3 shi4 yao4 zuo4 he4 mi3 ji4yi4 zhong4 de5 na4ge5 hao3ren2，fang4qi4 zhe4 jian4 shi4？hai2shi5 yao4 ji4xu4 gao3“feng1kuang2 ke1xue2jia1” zhe4 yi1tao4，bi1 wo3 bu4de2bu4 ba3 ni3 jie3jue2 diao4？"

msgid ""
"You're damn straight there is. You lied to me - nobody called a Code Indigo, and when Dispatch took a closer look at your work orders, they found that they were fakes.\n"
"\n"
"You're all coming with us."
msgstr ""
"你​以为​呢​。​你​骗​了​我​—​—​根本​没​人​发布​过​Indigo​警报​，​而且​调度​中心​仔细​核查​你​的​工作​单后​，​发现​全是​伪造​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​全都​跟我走​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3wei2 ni2。ni3 pian4 le5 wo3——gen1ben3 mei2 ren2 fa1bu4 guo4 Indigo jing3bao4，er2qie3 diao4du4 zhong1xin1 zi3xi4 he2cha2 ni3 de5 gong1zuo4 dan1 hou4，fa1xian4 quan2 shi4 wei3zao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 quan2dou1 gen1 wo3 zou3。"

msgid ""
"You're damned right he does. Meet me at the van when you're ready to go - "
"it's a long drive from here to the Schönbuch."
msgstr ""
"你​说​得​一点​没错​。​你​准备​好​出发​时​，​就​去​车上​找​我​—​—​从​这里​到​申布赫​可是​一段​长途​车程​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 yi1dian3 mei2cuo4。ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 chu1fa1 shi2，jiu4 qu4 che1 shang4 zhao3 wo3——cong2 zhe4li3 dao4 shen1 bu4 he4 ke3shi4 yi1 duan4 chang2tu2 che1cheng2。"

msgid ""
"You're damned right we're going to talk about this, Luca. I'll be on the "
"next train home."
msgstr ""
"你​可算​说​对​了​，​卢卡​。​我们​要​好好​谈谈​这​事​。​我​马上​乘下​一班​火车​回去​。\n"
"ni3 ke3 suan4 shuo1 dui4 le5，lu2ka3。wo3men5 yao4 hao3hao3 tan2tan2 zhe4 shi4。wo3 ma3shang4 cheng2 xia4 yi1 ban1 huo3che1 hui2qu5。"

msgid ""
"You're deflecting, Vauclair. Trying to avoid my question by turning this "
"back around on me."
msgstr ""
"你​在​转移​话题​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​试图​将​问题​反过来​抛回​给​我​，​以此​来​回避​我​的​问题​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 zhuan3yi2 hua4ti2，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 shi4tu2 jiang1 wen4ti2 fan3guo5lai2 pao1 hui2 gei3 wo3，yi3ci3 lai2 hui2bi4 wo3 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"You're familiar with the literature on brain damage caused by hardcore intrusion countermeasures. Black IC. \n"
"\n"
"Memory loss and mental impairment are common. More rarely, brain bleeds have been known to occur."
msgstr ""
"你​读过​不少​相关​文献​，​知道​这​正是​硬核​式​入侵​安保​措施​，​即​所谓​的​“​黑​IC​”​导致​的​脑部​损伤​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​记忆​丧失​和​精神障碍​较为​常见​。​除此之外​，​脑出血​也​是​已知​的​罕见​症状​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dou4 guo4 bu4shao3 xiang1guan1 wen2xian4，zhi1dao4 zhe4 zheng4shi4 ying4he2 shi4 ru4qin1 an1bao3 cuo4shi1，ji2 suo3wei4 de5“hei1 IC” dao3zhi4 de5 nao3 bu4 sun3shang1。\n"
"\n"
"ji4yi4 sang4shi1 he4 jing1 shen2 zhang4 ai4 jiao4wei2 chang2jian4。chu2ci3zhi1wai4，nao3chu1xue4 ye3 shi4 yi3zhi1 de5 han3jian4 zheng4zhuang4。"

msgid "You're fine. He's dead. I'd say that you came out on top."
msgstr ""
"你​还​活着​。​他​死​了​。​要​我​说​是​你​占​了​上风​。\n"
"ni3 hai2 huo2zhe5。ta1 si3 le5。yao4 wo3 shuo1 shi4 ni3 zhan1 le5 shang4feng1。"

msgid ""
"You're fooling yourself, man. Ignoring an unpleasant truth rather than facing it.\n"
"\n"
"We have to accept the fact that we could be stuck in here for the long haul."
msgstr ""
"你​这​是​在​自欺欺人​。​你​在​逃避​残酷​的​真相​，​而​非​直面​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​必须​接受​这个​事实​：​我们​可能​要​被​长期​困在​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi4 zai4 zi4qi1qi1ren2。ni3 zai4 tao2bi4 can2ku4 de5 zhen1xiang4，er2 fei1 zhi2mian4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 jie1shou4 zhe4ge5 shi4shi2：wo3men5 ke3neng2 yao4 bei4 chang2qi1 kun4 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"You're free now - you're not \"supposed\" to be anything. Find yourself a "
"new purpose, and make it a good one."
msgstr ""
"你​现在​自由​了​。​你​没有​什么​“​使命​”​要​成为​任何​东西​。​给​自己​重新​找个​目标​，​好好​过​完​这辈子​吧​。\n"
"ni3 xian4zai4 zi4you2 le5。ni3 mei2you3 shen2me5“shi3ming4” yao4 cheng2wei2 ren4he2 dong1xi1。gei3 zi4ji3 chong2xin1 zhao3 ge4 mu4biao1，hao3hao3 guo4 wan2 zhe4 bei4 zi3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You're god-damned right it is. Now, you gonna help us take these punks down,"
" or not?"
msgstr ""
"你​他​妈​可算​说​对​了​。​所以​你​到底​要​不要​帮​我们​干掉​这些​地痞​？\n"
"ni3 ta1 ma1 ke3 suan4 shuo1 dui4 le5。suo3yi3 ni3 dao4di3 yao4 bu4yao4 bang1 wo3men5 gan4diao4 zhe4xie1 di4pi3？"

msgid ""
"You're going to die tonight, Harrow. I'm going to tear out your throat."
msgstr ""
"你​今晚​就​得​死​，​哈罗​。​我要​撕开​你​的​喉咙​。\n"
"ni3 jin1wan3 jiu4 de2 si3，ha1luo2。wo3 yao4 si1 kai1 ni3 de5 hou2long2。"

msgid "You're going to die, Hasenkamp. Blitz, you may fire when rea--"
msgstr ""
"你​是​死​人​一个​了​，​哈森​坎普​。​布里​茨​，​你​准备​好​就​开火​—​—\n"
"ni3 shi4 si3 ren2 yi1ge5 le5，Ha1sen1kan3pu3。Bu4li3ci2，ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 jiu4 kai1huo3 — —"

msgid ""
"You're going to drive a bunch of metahumans crazy in order to prove that "
"metahumans are crazy? You're pathetic, Stahl."
msgstr ""
"你​要​把​一群​变​人类​逼​疯​，​就​为了​证明​变​人类​都​是​疯子​？​你​真​可悲​啊​，​斯塔尔​。\n"
"ni3 yao4 ba3 yi1 qun2 bian4 ren2lei4 bi1 feng1，jiu4 wei4le5 zheng4ming2 bian4 ren2lei4 dou1 shi4 feng1zi5？ni3 zhen1 ke3bei1 a1，Si1ta3er3。"

msgid ""
"You're going to give somebody a heart attack, sneaking around like that! Not the best way to make a first impression.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He rubs his knee with a scowl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, new $(l.guy). What's your name?"
msgstr ""
"你​这样​偷偷摸摸​的​是​想​吓死​谁​吗​！​这​可不是​给​人​留下​第一印象​的​好​主意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​皱着眉头​揉​了​揉​膝盖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​新来​的​$(l.guy)​，​你​叫​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4yang4 tou1tou1mo1mo1 de5 shi4 xiang3 he4 si3 shei2 ma5！zhe4 ke3bu5shi4 gei3 ren2 liu2xia4 di4 yi1 yin4 xiang4 de5 hao3 zhu3yi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2 rou2 le5 rou2 xi1gai4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，xin1 lai2 de5 $(l.guy)，ni3 jiao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "You're going to have to be more specific."
msgstr ""
"你​需要​说​得​更​具体​些​。\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 shuo1 de2 geng1 ju4ti3 xie1。"

msgid "You're going to pay for that, you bastard."
msgstr ""
"你​会​付出代价​的​，​混蛋​。\n"
"ni3 hui4 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4 de5，hun2dan4。"

msgid "You're going to regret that."
msgstr ""
"你​会​后悔​的​。\n"
"ni3 hui4 hou4hui3 de5。"

msgid ""
"You're green, $(l.name). Too green to lead this team. That's my professional assessment, and yeah, I'm concerned about the situation.\n"
"\n"
"You can alleviate those concerns by doing your job, and doing it well. The only thing that'll fix this is time."
msgstr ""
"你​缺乏经验​，​$(l.name)​，​这样​是​带​不好​团队​的​。​这​是​我​的​专业​评估​，​我​当然​会​对​这种​情况​感到​担忧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​能​出色完成​自己​的​本职工作​，​我​就​不会​再​这么​想​了​。​唯有​时间​才能​解决​这个​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que1 fa2 jing1 yan4，$(l.name)，zhe4yang4 shi4 dai4 bu4hao3 tuan2dui4 de5。zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 zhuan1ye4 ping2gu1，wo3 dang1ran2 hui4 dui4 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4 gan3dao4 dan1you1。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 chu1 se4 wan2 cheng2 zi4ji3 de5 ben3 zhi2 gong1 zuo4，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 zai4 zhe4me5 xiang3 le5。wei2you3 shi2jian1 cai2neng2 jie3jue2 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。"

msgid "You're headed off to Feuerstelle, aren't you?"
msgstr ""
"你​要​去​“​火坑​”​，​是不是​？\n"
"ni3 yao4 qu4“huo3keng1”，shi4bu5shi4？"

msgid ""
"You're helpless, Yuli. A cripple. But if you answer our questions, things will go easier for you.\n"
"\n"
"So tell us: whose payroll are you on?"
msgstr ""
"别​琢磨​花招​了​，​尤里​，​你​连路​都​走​不​利索​。​但​如果​你​老实​回答​我们​的​问题​，​我​就​不会​让​你​太​受罪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​吧​，​到底​是​谁​雇​你​来​的​？\n"
"\n"
"bie4 zhuo2mo2 hua1zhao1 le5，You2li3，ni3 lian2 lu4 dou1 zou3 bu4 li4suo5。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 lao3shi5 hui2da2 wo3men5 de5 wen4ti2，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 tai4 shou4zui4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ba1，dao4di3 shi4 shei2 gu4 ni3 lai2 de5？"

msgid ""
"You're helpless. A fucking cripple.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice comes out in a snarl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But if you answer our questions, things will go easier for you. So tell us: whose payroll are you on?"
msgstr ""
"吓唬​谁​呢​。​你​他​妈路​都​走​不​利索​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​几乎​是​在​咆哮​着​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​你​老实​回答​我们​的​问题​，​我​就​不会​让​你​太​受罪​。​说​吧​，​到底​是​谁​雇​你​来​的​？\n"
"\n"
"xia4hu5 shei2 ni2。ni3 ta1 ma1 lu4 dou1 zou3 bu4 li4suo5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji1hu1 shi4 zai4 pao2xiao4 zhao2 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 lao3shi5 hui2da2 wo3men5 de5 wen4ti2，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 tai4 shou4zui4。shuo1 ba1，dao4di3 shi4 shei2 gu4 ni3 lai2 de5？"

msgid ""
"You're here because something is happening to the world, $(l.name). Something disquieting.\n"
"\n"
"Many terrible events have transpired over the past few months. I do not believe them to be coincidences... disparate as they may seem, they are all connected somehow. I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""
"我​找​你​来​是因为​世界​正​发生​着​令人不安​的​变化​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​数月​间接​连​发生​诸多​骇人​事件​，​我​确信​这​绝非​偶然​。​尽管​这些​现象​看似​毫无关系​，​却​实则​暗藏​关联​……​我​对此​深信不疑​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhao3 ni3 lai2 shi4 yin1 wei2 shi4jie4 zheng1 fa1sheng1 zhao2 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 bian4hua4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 shu4yue4 jian4jie1 lian2 fa1sheng1 zhu1duo1 hai4ren2 shi4jian4，wo3 que4xin4 zhe4 jue2fei1 ou3ran2。jin3guan3 zhe4xie1 xian4xiang4 kan4si4 hao2 wu2 guan1 xi4，que4 shi2ze2 an4cang2 guan1lian2……wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1xin4bu4yi2。"

msgid "You're high as a kite, aren't you?"
msgstr ""
"你​是不是​吸​嗨​到​像​风筝​上天​了​？\n"
"ni3 shi4bu5shi4 xi1 hai1 dao4 xiang4 feng1zheng5 shang4tian1 le5？"

msgid ""
"You're hung up on the past, Eiger. If you want to survive in the shadows, "
"you'll need to get over it."
msgstr ""
"你​太​沉湎​于​过去​了​，​艾格尔​。​如果​你​想​在​暗影​界​生存​，​就​得​学会​克服​它​。\n"
"ni3 tai4 chen2mian3 yu2 guo4qu4 le5，Ai4ge2er3。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 zai4 an4ying3 jie4 sheng1cun2，jiu4 de2 xue2hui4 ke4fu2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"You're in a kitchen. You have plenty of fresh food and water. You're not "
"going to die."
msgstr ""
"这​是​个​厨房​，​有的是​新鲜​的​吃食​和​水​。​你​死不了​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4 chu2fang2，you3de5shi4 xin1xian1 de5 chi1shi2 he4 shui3。ni3 si3bu4liao3。"

msgid ""
"You're in no position to dictate terms. Our employers put *me* in charge of "
"this team, remember?"
msgstr ""
"你​没​资格​在​这里​发号施令​。​我们​的​雇主​让​*​我​*​来​领导​这支​小队​，​你​忘​了​吗​？\n"
"ni3 mei2 zi1ge2 zai4 zhe4li3 fa1hao4shi1ling4。wo3men5 de5 gu4zhu3 rang4*wo3*lai2 ling3dao3 zhe4 zhi1 xiao3 dui4，ni3 wang4 le5 ma5？"

msgid "You're insane, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"你​真是​疯​了​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 feng1 le5，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid ""
"You're jumping to conclusions - blaming me for things that I didn't do. But "
"if you want me to go, I'll go."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​能​妄​下结论​，​把​我​没​做​的​事怪​我​头上​。​既然​你​要​我​走​，​我​就​走​。\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 neng2 wang4 xia4 jie1 lun2，ba3 wo3 mei2 zuo4 de5 shi4 guai4 wo3 tou2shang4。ji4ran2 ni3 yao4 wo3 zou3，wo3 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"You're just as bad as Vauclair! I will not empower you to exterminate an "
"intelligent form of life!"
msgstr ""
"你​和​沃​克莱尔​一样​邪恶​！​我​绝不会​让​你​消灭​一​整个​智慧​生命​种族​！\n"
"ni3 he4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 yi1yang4 xie2e4！wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 rang4 ni3 xiao1mie4 yi1 zheng3ge4 zhi4hui4 sheng1ming4 zhong3zu2！"

msgid ""
"You're just trying to claim the moral high ground. But what you're planning "
"could kill us all, Doc."
msgstr ""
"你​只是​在​试图​占领​道德​高地​而已​。​但​你​的​计划​可能​会​杀死​我们​所有人​，​博士​。\n"
"ni3 zhi3shi4 zai4 shi4tu2 zhan4ling3 dao4de2 gao1di4 er2yi3。dan4 ni3 de5 ji4hua4 ke3neng2 hui4 sha1si3 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2，bo2shi4。"

msgid "You're lying. Spill it before I spill you."
msgstr ""
"你​在​说谎​。​老实​交代​，​否则​别怪​我​不​客气​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 shuo1huang3。lao3shi5 jiao1dai4，fou3ze2 bie4 guai4 wo3 bu4 ke4qi5。"

msgid "You're magically active?"
msgstr ""
"你​具有​魔力​活性​？\n"
"ni3 ju4you3 mo2li4 huo2xing4？"

msgid "You're not Monika... you're APEX. You've taken her memories somehow."
msgstr ""
"你​不是​莫妮卡​……​你​是​APEX​。​你​以​某种​方式​窃取​了​她​的​记忆​。\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 Mo4ni1ka3……ni3 shi4 APEX。ni3 yi3 mou3zhong3 fang1shi4 qie4qu3 le5 ta1 de5 ji4yi4。"

msgid "You're not a fan of the F-State, then?"
msgstr ""
"那​你​肯定​不太​喜欢​动荡​带​吧​？\n"
"na4 ni3 ken3ding4 bu4 tai4 xi3huan5 dong4dang4 dai4 ba1？"

msgid "You're not an elf, then. So what are you?"
msgstr ""
"看来​你​不是​精灵​了​。​那​你​究竟​是​什么​？\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 bu4shi4 jing1ling2 le5。na4 ni3 jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "You're not built for this world. It's safer in your sims."
msgstr ""
"现实​世界​不​适合​你​。​待​在​拟感​世界​里​对​你​来说​更​安全​。\n"
"xian4shi2 shi4jie4 bu4 shi4he2 ni3。dai1 zai4 ni3 gan3 shi4jie4 li3 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 geng1 an1quan2。"

msgid "You're not going to hurt her?"
msgstr ""
"你们​不会​伤害​她​吧​？\n"
"ni3men5 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 ta1 ba1？"

msgid ""
"You're not hearing me.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know what your'e talking about. I know nobody in the sewers, and you know nothing of my extracurricular activities.\n"
"\n"
"As long as you're on board with that, our business together can continue unabated. Deal? "
msgstr ""
"你​没​听​清楚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​你​在​说​什么​。​我​不​认识​下水道​里​的​任何人​，​你​也​不​知道​我​的​业余活动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​你​同意​，​我们​的​生意​就​能​继续​做​下去​。​行​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2 ting1 qing1chu5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。wo3 bu4 ren4shi5 xia4shui3dao4 li3 de5 ren4 he2 ren2，ni3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 de5 ye4 yu2 huo2 dong4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 tong2yi4，wo3men5 de5 sheng1yi4 jiu4 neng2 ji4xu4 zuo4 xia4qu4。xing2 ma5？"

msgid "You're not in the way at all. Say, what are you looking at, there?"
msgstr ""
"一点​也​没​耽误​。​话​说​你们​在​看​什么​呢​？\n"
"yi1dian3 ye3 mei2 dan1wu5。hua4 shuo1 ni3men5 zai4 kan4 shen2me5 ni2？"

msgid "You're not listening. We have work to do in there."
msgstr ""
"你​没​听​我​说话​啊​。​我们​需要​在​里面​做些​工作​。\n"
"ni3 mei2 ting1 wo3 shuo1hua4 a1。wo3men5 xu1yao4 zai4 li3mian4 zuo4 xie1 gong1zuo4。"

msgid "You're not serious."
msgstr ""
"你​不是​认真​的​吧​。\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 ren4zhen1 de5 ba1。"

msgid "You're not talking to a ghoul, Doc. And I don't beg."
msgstr ""
"医生​，​我​并​不是​尸鬼​。​另外​我​也​从​不求人​。\n"
"yi1sheng1，wo3 bing4 bu4shi4 shi1 gui3。ling4wai4 wo3 ye3 cong2 bu4qiu2ren2。"

msgid ""
"You're not the same man who once saved Germany from the Firewing. If I get "
"out of here, Vauclair... I'll be saving Berlin from *you.*"
msgstr ""
"你​已经​不是​那个​从​火翼​的​魔爪​中​拯救​德国​的​人​了​。​沃​克莱尔​，​如果​我​离开​这里​……​我​一定​会​拯救​柏林​免遭​*​你​*​的​毒手​。\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 bu4shi4 na4ge5 cong2 Huo3yi4 de5 mo2zhao3 zhong4 zheng3jiu4 de2guo2 de5 ren2 le5。Wo4ke4lai2er3，ru2guo3 wo3 li2kai1 zhe4li3……wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 zheng3jiu4 bo2lin2 mian3zao1*ni3*de5 du2shou3。"

msgid ""
"You're not the same person that you were back then. Leave the past in the "
"past. "
msgstr ""
"你​已经​不再​是​曾经​的​那个​你​了​。​过去​的​事​就让​它​过去​吧​。\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 bu4zai4 shi4 ceng2jing1 de5 na4ge5 ni3 le5。guo4qu4 de5 shi4 jiu4 rang4 ta1 guo4qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You're not wrong there. But it gets a whole lot worse than that, as you'll soon see.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hang with me, $(l.name). Rough waters ahead."
msgstr ""
"你​没​说错​。​但​后面​的​事情​还​远远​不止​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​继续​听​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​接下来​才​是​最​黑暗​的​部分​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4。dan4 hou4mian5 de5 shi4qing5 hai2 yuan3yuan3 bu4zhi3 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4xu4 ting1 ba1，$(l.name)。jie1xia4lai2 cai2 shi4 zui4 hei1an4 de5 bu4fen5。"

msgid "You're nuts, Audran. You belong in a padded cell."
msgstr ""
"你​简直​疯​了​，​奥​德兰​。​你​应该​被​关进​精神病院​里​。\n"
"ni3 jian3zhi2 feng1 le5，Ao4de2lan2。ni3 ying1gai1 bei4 guan1 jin4 jing1shen2bing4yuan4 li3。"

msgid "You're nuts, Audran. You need professional help."
msgstr ""
"你​疯​了​，​奥​德兰​。​你​需要​专业人士​的​帮助​。\n"
"ni3 feng1 le5，Ao4de2lan2。ni3 xu1yao4 zhuan1ye4ren2shi4 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"You're on your own there, fearless leader. I have no idea. I don't even know why you took it in the first place.\n"
"\n"
"We brought down a building to bury this information. Flashing it around after the fact isn't the world's most professional move."
msgstr ""
"我​没什么​想法​，​你​还是​另请高明​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​甚至​都​不​知道​你​为什么​要​把​它​带​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​炸毁​了​一​整栋​大楼​，​就是​为了​销毁​这份​情报​，​可​你​现在​又​要​拿​着​它​满​世界​炫耀​？​这​行为​可​算不上​专业​。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2shen2me5 xiang3fa3，ni3 hai2shi5 ling4qing3gao1ming2 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 ba3 ta1 dai4 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zha4hui3 le5 yi1 zheng3 dong4 da4lou2，jiu4shi4 wei4le5 xiao1hui3 zhe4 fen4 qing2bao4，ke3 ni3 xian4zai4 you4 yao4 na2 zhao2 ta1 man3 shi4jie4 xuan4yao4？zhe4 xing2wei2 ke3 suan4 bu4 shang4 zhuan1ye4。"

msgid "You're one of those cultists from the Hub, aren't you?"
msgstr ""
"你​是​来自​中枢​的​那些​邪教徒​之一​，​对​吧​？\n"
"ni3 shi4 lai2zi4 zhong1shu1 de5 na4xie1 xie2 jiao1 tu2 zhi1yi1，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "You're playing with me. I don't like to be played with."
msgstr ""
"你​在​耍​我​。​我​不​喜欢​被​人​耍​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 shua3 wo3。wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 bei4 ren2 shua3。"

msgid ""
"You're pretty handy with a sword. If you're looking for work, I could use "
"the help..."
msgstr ""
"你​很​擅长​使剑​啊​。​如果​你​想​找​工作​的话​，​我​这​正缺​人手​……\n"
"ni3 hen3 shan4chang2 shi3 jian4 a1。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 zhao3 gong1zuo4 de5hua4，wo3 zhe4 zheng1 que1 ren2shou3……"

msgid "You're rambling. Get to the point."
msgstr ""
"你​在​闲扯​。​赶紧​说​重点​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 xian2che3。gan3jin3 shuo1 chong2dian3。"

msgid ""
"You're really into that \"Knight-Kings of Lightninghold\" show, aren't you?"
msgstr ""
"你​真的​很​喜欢​那​部​《​闪电​堡​骑士​王​》​剧集​，​对​吧​？\n"
"ni3 zhen1de5 hen3 xi3huan5 na4 bu4 《 shan3dian4 pu4 qi2shi4 wang2 》 ju4ji2，dui4 ba1？"

msgid "You're repugnant."
msgstr ""
"你​真​恶心​。\n"
"ni3 zhen1 e3xin1。"

msgid ""
"You're right - we don't have time for this. Marta, we need your key to the "
"shrine room. Don't make us take it by force."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​我们​没​这个​时间​。​玛​尔塔​，​我们​需要​你​交出​神龛​室​的​钥匙​。​别​逼​我们​动手​抢​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，wo3men5 mei2 zhe4ge5 shi2jian1。Ma3er3ta3，wo3men5 xu1yao4 ni3 jiao1chu1 shen2kan1 shi4 de5 yao4shi5。bie4 bi1 wo3men5 dong4shou3 qiang3。"

msgid "You're right on that count. 50,000 nuyen."
msgstr ""
"你​算是​说​对​了​。​她​开口​就是​五万​新円​。\n"
"ni3 suan4shi4 shuo1 dui4 le5。ta1 kai1kou3 jiu4shi4 wu3 wan4 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"You're right, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Glory's face looks ashen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's nobody's fault but my own."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​格洛丽​面如死灰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​的​错​，​怪​不了​任何人​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 mian4 ru2 si3 hui1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 cuo4，guai4 bu4le5 ren4 he2 ren2。"

msgid ""
"You're right, Doc. It is absolutely within your rights to charge whatever "
"you want for your services."
msgstr ""
"医生​，​你​说​得​没错​。​你​完全​有​权利​为​你​提供​的​服务​开出​任何​价格​。\n"
"yi1sheng1，ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。ni3 wan2quan2 you3 quan2li4 wei2 ni3 ti2gong1 de5 fu2wu4 kai1 chu1 ren4he2 jia4ge2。"

msgid "You're right, Eiger. Thanks for the talk."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​艾格尔​。​谢谢​你​和​我​说​这些​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，Ai4ge2er3。xie4xie5 ni3 he4 wo3 shuo1 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"You're right, Harrow needs to die. Letting him live to do this again would "
"be the greater evil."
msgstr ""
"你​是​对​的​，​哈罗​必须​死​。​让​他​活着​卷土重来​才​是​更​大​的​罪恶​。\n"
"ni3 shi4 dui4 de5，ha1luo2 bi4xu1 si3。rang4 ta1 huo2zhe5 juan3tu3chong2lai2 cai2 shi4 geng1 dai4 de5 zui4e4。"

msgid "You're right, I do. Let's talk about this job."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​没错​，​确实​如此​。​说​说​这趟​差事​吧​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 mei2cuo4，que4shi2 ru2ci3。shuo1 shuo1 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 ba1。"

msgid "You're right, I don't. Just trying to cheer you up."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我​就是​想​给​你​鼓​鼓劲​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 jiu4shi4 xiang3 gei3 ni3 gu3 gu3 jin4。"

msgid "You're right, James - we're wasting time. Do what you need to do."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​詹姆斯​。​我们​这​是​在​浪费时间​。​你​动手​吧​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，zhan1mu3si1。wo3men5 zhe4 shi4 zai4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。ni3 dong4shou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You're right, and he does.\n"
"\n"
"What I'm asking you to do is trust me. I need that more than I need you to hold my hand through this."
msgstr ""
"你​没​说错​，​他​很​危险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​比起​你​与​我​并肩作战​，​我​更​需要​你​相信​我​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4，ta1 hen3 wei1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"er2 bi3qi3 ni3 yu4 wo3 bing4jian1zuo4zhan4，wo3 geng1 xu1yao4 ni3 xiang1xin4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"You're right, it is. But I don't see how that's a bad thing.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She raises a sculpted hand to inspect it. The motion is casual, but something about it feels strangely menacing.\n"
"\n"
"Slowly, the metal begins to glow - first red, then white.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"是​，​我​的确​受​了​影响​，​但​不见得​是​坏事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​举起​雕塑​般的​手​端详​着​。​这个​动作​看似​随意​，​却​莫名​透着​一股​威胁​的​意味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​渐渐​地​，​金属​开始​发光​—​—​先是​红热​，​继而​变为​白炽​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shi4，wo3 di2que4 shou4 le5 ying3xiang3，dan4 bu4jian4de5 shi4 huai4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ju3qi3 diao1su4 ban1 de5 shou3 duan1xiang2 zhao2。zhe4ge5 dong4zuo4 kan4si4 sui2yi4，que4 mo4ming2 tou4 zhao2 yi1 gu3 wei1xie2 de5 yi4wei4。\n"
"\n"
"jian4jian4 de5，jin1shu3 kai1shi3 fa1guang1——xian1 shi4 hong2 re4，ji4er2 bian4wei2 bai2chi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You're right, of course. You are *absolutely* right.\n"
"\n"
"Besides, it's not like she can send me a distress call. Her communications are probably being monitored!\n"
"\n"
"I'll bet that she's spent the whole past year waiting for me to come riding in to the rescue!"
msgstr ""
"你​说​得​没错​。​你​说​得​*​完全​*​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​，​她​也​没​办法​给​我​发送​求救​消息​。​她​的​通讯​可能​受到​了​监控​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我敢​说​她​过去​这一​整年​都​在​等​着​我​去​救​她​呢​！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。ni3 shuo1 de2*wan2quan2*mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4，ta1 ye3 mei2 ban4fa3 gei3 wo3 fa1song4 qiu2jiu4 xiao1xi5。ta1 de5 tong1xun4 ke3neng2 shou4dao4 le5 jian1kong4！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 shuo1 ta1 guo4qu4 zhe4 yi1 zheng3 nian2 dou1 zai4 deng3 zhao2 wo3 qu4 jiu4 ta1 ni2！"

msgid ""
"You're right, shadowrunner. My plan *is* insane. But no more so than the world that we live in.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns to tap a series of buttons on his control console, then lights another cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Desperate times call for desperate measures. Nothing ventured, nothing gained - history has repeatedly shown this to be true."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​我​的​计划​确实​疯狂​。​但​这​世界​本身​不​也​足够​疯狂​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转过身​，​在​控制​台上​按下​一系列​按钮​，​然后​点燃​另​一支​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常​时期​需要​非常​手段​。​不入虎穴​，​焉得虎子​—​—​历史​一再​证明​了​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。wo3 de5 ji4hua4 que4shi2 feng1kuang2。dan4 zhe4 shi4jie4 ben3shen1 bu4 ye3 zu2gou4 feng1kuang2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，zai4 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 an4xia4 yi1xi4lie4 an4niu3，ran2hou4 dian3ran2 ling4 yi1 zhi1 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 shi2qi1 xu1yao4 fei1chang2 shou3duan4。bu4 ru4 hu3 xue2，yan1 de2 hu3 zi3——li4shi3 yi1zai4 zheng4ming2 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid "You're right, we're not. Carry on."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​我们​不是​朋友​，​你​忙​吧​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，wo3men5 bu4shi4 peng2you5，ni3 mang2 ba1。"

msgid "You're right. Harrow is your responsibility, and this place is mine."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​哈罗​是​你​的​责任​，​而​我​应该​对​这​地方​负责​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，ha1luo2 shi4 ni3 de5 ze2ren4，er2 wo3 ying1gai1 dui4 zhe4 di4fang1 fu4ze2。"

msgid ""
"You're right. He did. And you did what needed to be done, despite the fact "
"that it meant killing a fellow soldier."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​的确如此​。​你​也​做​了​该​做​的​事​，​即使​这​意味着​杀死​自己​的​一位​同僚​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，de5 que4 ru2 ci3。ni3 ye3 zuo4 le5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4，ji2shi3 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 sha1si3 zi4ji3 de5 yi1 wei4 tong2liao2。"

msgid ""
"You're right. I don't believe you. You're either lying, or you're crazy.\n"
"\n"
"But crazy has its uses. All right, I'll get you into that basement. But it'll cost you."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我​不​相信​你​。​你​要么​在​撒谎​，​要么​是​疯​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​疯子​有时​也​有​用处​。​好​吧​，​我​可以​帮​你​进​地下室​，​但​这​需要​代价​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 bu4 xiang1xin4 ni3。ni3 yao4me5 zai4 sa1huang3，yao4me5 shi4 feng1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，feng1zi5 you3shi2 ye3 you3 yong4chu5。hao3 ba1，wo3 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 jin4 di4xia4shi4，dan4 zhe4 xu1yao4 dai4jia4。"

msgid "You're right. I don't have \"the Sight.\" So tell me what you are."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我​没有​“​慧眼​”​。​那​你​自己​说说看​，​你​究竟​是​什么​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 mei2you3“hui4yan3”。na4 ni3 zi4ji3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4，ni3 jiu1jing4 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid "You're right. I was just messing with you."
msgstr ""
"你​说​得​没错​，​我​逗你玩​呢​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4，wo3 dou4 ni3 wan2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"You're right. I wouldn't do that to you. You can tell your friends that "
"everything's going to be all right."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我​不会​这么​对待​你们​。​回去​向​你​的​朋友​们​报平安​吧​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 dui4dai4 ni3men5。hui2qu5 xiang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 bao4 ping2 an1 ba1。"

msgid "You're right. I'm on it."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我​这​就​去​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 qu4。"

msgid "You're right. I'm sorry, Paul... please, go on."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​抱歉​，​保罗​……​请​继续​说​吧​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。bao4qian4，bao3luo2……qing3 ji4xu4 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You're right. I've gotta pay her back for that... if this gets out, I'll never live it down.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His face flushes red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can't believe that she did this to me. That everything we shared might've been a lie."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我​必须​让​她​偿还​这​一切​……​如果​事情​败露​的话​，​我​就​别​想​好好​活​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​涨红了脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不敢相信​她​会​对​我​做出​这种​事​。​我们​过去​的​生活​可能​只是​个​谎言​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 bi4xu1 rang4 ta1 chang2huan2 zhe4 yi1qie4……ru2guo3 shi4qing5 bai4lu4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 bie4 xiang3 hao3hao3 huo2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang3 hong2 le5 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 ta1 hui4 dui4 wo3 zuo4chu1 zhe4zhong3 shi4。wo3men5 guo4qu4 de5 sheng1huo2 ke3neng2 zhi3shi4 ge4 huang3yan2。"

msgid ""
"You're right. I've reconsidered. We'll put it off until after we've dealt "
"with the problem in front of us."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我​重新考虑​了​下​，​等​我们​解决​完​眼下​的​问题​之后​再​回过头来​处理​这个​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 chong2 xin1 kao3 lu:4 le5 xia4，deng3 wo3men5 jie3jue2 wan2 yan3xia4 de5 wen4ti2 zhi1hou4 zai4 hui2guo4tou2lai2 chu3li3 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"You're right. In your place, I'd have wound up here right alongside you. "
"Sorry, Glory."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​换作​是​我​的话​，​恐怕​也​会​和​你​一样​最终​落到​这个​地步​。​对不起​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，kong3pa4 ye3 hui4 he4 ni3 yi1yang4 zui4zhong1 la4 dao4 zhe4ge5 di4bu4。dui4bu5qi3，Ge2luo4li2。"

msgid ""
"You're right. It's on standby.\n"
"\n"
"The lights are on, but nobody's home."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​它​是​处于​某种​待机​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​好像​开着机​，​不过​程序​没跑​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。ta1 shi4 chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 dai4ji1 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 hao3xiang4 kai1 zhao2 ji1，bu4guo4 cheng2xu4 mei2 pao2 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"You're right. Nobody needs that kind of heat. I'll find another way in."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​没​人​应该​遭受​那样​的​厄运​。​我会​另外​找路​进去​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。mei2 ren2 ying1gai1 zao1shou4 na4yang4 de5 e4yun4。wo3 hui4 ling4wai4 zhao3 lu4 jin4qu4。"

msgid ""
"You're right. Sorry, Dietrich... I've been under a lot of pressure lately. "
"Say whatever you wanted to say."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​抱歉​，​迪​特里​希​……​我​最近​压力​太大​了​。​你​要说​什么​就​说​吧​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4 bao4qian4，Di2te4li3xi1……wo3 zui4jin4 ya1li4 tai4 dai4 le5。ni3 yao4shuo1 shen2me5 jiu4 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You're right. There's more to it than I'm letting on. But I'm not interested"
" in talking about it."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​事情​不止​我​所​透露​的​那么​简单​。​但​我​不想​谈论​这个​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。shi4qing5 bu4zhi3 wo3 suo3 tou4lu4 de5 na4me5 jian3dan1。dan4 wo3 bu4xiang3 tan2lun4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid "You're right. This is your show... my mistake."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​这里​该​由​你​来​做主​……​是​我​的​错​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。zhe4li3 gai1 you2 ni3 lai2 zuo4zhu3……shi4 wo3 de5 cuo4。"

msgid ""
"You're right. We came here to save those kids, not get them killed. We'll "
"wait until Marta leaves and follow her."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我们​来​这儿​是​为了​救​那些​孩子​，​而​不是​害死​他们​。​我们​可以​等玛​尔塔​离开​后​跟上​她​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 lai2 zhe4r5 shi4 wei4le5 jiu4 na4Xie1hai2zi5，er2 bu4shi4 hai4si3 ta1men5。wo3men5 ke3yi3 deng3 Ma3er3ta3 li2kai1 hou4 gen1shang4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"You're right. We can deal with Marta later, after we've accomplished what we"
" came here to do."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​等​我们​完成​来此​的​主要​任务​之后​，​可以​再​去​解决​玛​尔塔​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。deng3 wo3men5 wan2cheng2 lai2 ci3 de5 zhu3yao4 ren4wu5 zhi1hou4，ke3yi3 zai4 qu4 jie3jue2 Ma3er3ta3。"

msgid ""
"You're right. We kill Harrow. So, any suggestions as to how we should go "
"about it?"
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我们​得​杀​了​哈罗​。​那​你​打算​如何​处理​此事​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 de2 sha1 le5 ha1luo2。na4 ni3 da3suan4 ru2he2 chu3li3 ci3shi4？"

msgid "You're right. We need to focus on what's ahead of us."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我们​需要​专注​于​眼下​的​问题​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 yan3xia4 de5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"You're right. We rescue the cultists. So, any suggestions as to how we "
"should go about it?"
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我们​得​救出​那些​邪教徒​。​那​你​打算​如何​处理​此事​？\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 de2 jiu4chu1 na4xie1 xie2 jiao1 tu2。na4 ni3 da3suan4 ru2he2 chu3li3 ci3shi4？"

msgid ""
"You're right. We've got too much to worry about already... second guessing "
"ourselves isn't going to help."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​。​我们​要​操心​的​事​已经​太多​了​……​犹疑不决​并​没有​什么​帮助​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 yao4 cao1xin1 de5 shi4 yi3jing1 tai4 duo1 le5……you2 yi2 bu4 jue2 bing4 mei2you3 shen2me5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid "You're running off to find Harrow, I take it."
msgstr ""
"我​猜​你​要​急​着​去​找​哈罗​。\n"
"wo3 cai1 ni3 yao4 ji2 zhao2 qu4 zhao3 ha1luo2。"

msgid "You're safe down here, though?"
msgstr ""
"但​你们​这里​还是​挺​安全​的​？\n"
"dan4 ni3men5 zhe4li3 hai2shi5 ting3 an1quan2 de5？"

msgid ""
"You're saying that something in the Matrix made him break his own back?\n"
"\n"
"I don't even think that's possible."
msgstr ""
"你​的​意思​是​，​矩阵​里​有​什么​东西​让​他​折断​了​自己​的​脊柱​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​这​不​可能​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 yi4si5 shi4，ju3zhen4 li3 you3 shen2me5 dong1xi1 rang4 ta1 zhe2duan4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 ji3zhu4？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 bu4 ke3neng2。"

msgid ""
"You're serious, aren't you? You actually *want* to go in there.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}$+(s.he) takes a step back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, be my guest... I won't get in your way. When you make it back - *if* you make it back - we'll be out here waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"你​是​认真​的​，​对​吧​？​你​是​真的​*​打算​*​进去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​$+(s.he)​往​后退​了​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​，​随​你​的​便​……​我​不会​拦​你​。​等​你​出来​了​—​—​*​如果​*​你​还​能​出来​的话​—​—​我们​会​在​这儿​接应​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5，dui4 ba1？ni3 shi4 zhen1de5*da3suan4*jin4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} $+(s.he) wang3 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4，sui2 ni3 de5 bian4……wo3 bu4hui4 lan2 ni3。deng3 ni3 chu1lai2 le5——*ru2guo3*ni3 hai2 neng2 chu1lai2 de5hua4——wo3men5 hui4 zai4 zhe4r5 jie1ying4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You're serious, aren't you? You're really going in there.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a step back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, be my guest... I won't get in your way. When you make it back - *if* you make it back - we'll be out here waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"你​是​认真​的​，​对​吧​？​你​是​真的​要​进去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​往​后退​了​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​，​随​你​的​便​……​我​不会​拦​你​。​等​你​出来​了​—​—​*​如果​*​你​还​能​出来​的话​—​—​我们​会​在​这儿​接应​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5，dui4 ba1？ni3 shi4 zhen1de5 yao4 jin4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wang3 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4，sui2 ni3 de5 bian4……wo3 bu4hui4 lan2 ni3。deng3 ni3 chu1lai2 le5——*ru2guo3*ni3 hai2 neng2 chu1lai2 de5hua4——wo3men5 hui4 zai4 zhe4r5 jie1ying4 ni3。"

msgid "You're speculating, dear. (h)"
msgstr ""
"这些​都​是​猜测​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 cai1ce4，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid "You're sure about that?"
msgstr ""
"你​确定​吗​？\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ma5？"

msgid "You're sure that whatever you did disarmed the security system?"
msgstr ""
"你​确定​刚才​一番​操作​已经​关闭​了​安保​系统​吗​？\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 gang1cai2 yi1 fan1 cao1zuo4 yi3jing1 guan1bi4 le5 an1bao3 xi4tong3 ma5？"

msgid "You're talking about resorting to cannibalism, man."
msgstr ""
"你​说​的​可是​靠​吃​人​活下去​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 ke3shi4 kao4 chi1 ren2 huo2xia4qu4。"

msgid "You're talking like they're never going to rescue us."
msgstr ""
"听​你​这话​，​好像​他们​永远​都​不会​来​救​我们​似的​。\n"
"ting1 ni3 zhe4 hua4，hao3xiang4 ta1men5 yong3yuan3 dou1 bu4hui4 lai2 jiu4 wo3men5 shi4de5。"

msgid "You're talking nonsense, serpent-girl. What the hell is going on?"
msgstr ""
"你​胡说​什么​呢​，​大蛇​妞​。​到底​是​什么​情况​？\n"
"ni3 hu2shuo1 shen2me5 ni2，dai4 she2 niu1。dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 qing2kuang4？"

msgid "You're telling me, Blitz."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​，​布里​茨​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5，Bu4li3ci2。"

msgid "You're telling me."
msgstr ""
"说​得​没错​。\n"
"shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。"

msgid ""
"You're telling me. The last thing that we need is more sim-junkies on our streets.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns to face the Engineer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You got anything to add to that, Yuli?"
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​我​可不​希望​有​更​多​拟感​瘾君子​出现​在​街头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过身​看​向​工程师​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有​什么​要​补充​的​吗​，​尤里​？\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。wo3 ke3bu5 xi1wang4 you3 geng1 duo1 ni3 gan3 yin3jun1zi3 chu1xian4 zai4 jie1tou2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 kan4 xiang4 gong1cheng2shi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3 shen2me5 yao4 bu3chong1 de5 ma5，You2li3？"

msgid ""
"You're the one who's bleeding out on the floor. Looks to me like *you* blew "
"it."
msgstr ""
"现在​是​你​躺​在​地上​血流成河​。​看起来​是​*​你​*​搞砸​了​才​对​。\n"
"xian4zai4 shi4 ni3 tang3 zai4 di4shang5 xue4liu2cheng2he2。kan4qi3lai5 shi4*ni3*gao3za2 le5 cai2 dui4。"

msgid ""
"You're very welcome. \n"
"\n"
"To the viewers at home, stay safe and watch the skies. \n"
"\n"
"Salvation is coming - I promise."
msgstr ""
"不​客气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​各位​在家​收看​的​观众​，​请​注意安全​，​留意​天空​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​救赎​即将来临​—​—​我​保证​。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。\n"
"\n"
"ge4wei4 zai4jia1 shou1kan4 de5 guan1zhong4，qing3 zhu4 yi4 an1 quan2，liu2yi4 tian1kong1。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shu2 ji2jiang1lai2lin2——wo3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"You're wearing a uniform. That makes you a tool, and a pawn, and our enemy. "
"Harrow said so."
msgstr ""
"你​穿着​制服​。​所以​你​就是​工具​，​是​爪牙​，​是​我们​的​敌人​。​哈罗​是​这样​说​的​。\n"
"ni3 chuan1zhuo2 zhi4fu2。suo3yi3 ni3 jiu4shi4 gong1ju4，shi4 zhao3ya2，shi4 wo3men5 de5 di2ren2。ha1luo2 shi4 zhe4yang4 shuo1 de5。"

msgid "You're welcome, Sam. Think nothing of it."
msgstr ""
"不​客气​，​萨姆​。​别​放在心上​。\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5，sa4 mu3。bie4 fang4zai4xin1shang4。"

msgid "You're what, Doc?"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​了​，​博士​？\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 le5，bo2shi4？"

msgid ""
"You're what, Doc?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice is soft, but firm.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​了​，​博士​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​轻柔​而​坚定​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 le5，bo2shi4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 qing1rou2 er2 jian1ding4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You're what, Doc?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His voice is soft, but firm.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​了​，​博士​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​声音​轻柔​而​坚定​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 le5，bo2shi4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 qing1rou2 er2 jian1ding4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You're what, Doc?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Still staring at Vauclair, he mutters under his breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Other than a nutcase, I mean."
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​了​，​博士​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​仍然​盯​着​沃​克莱尔​，​低声​嘀咕​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​除了​是​个​疯子​之外​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 le5，bo2shi4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 reng2ran2 ding1 zhao2 Wo4ke4lai2er3，di1sheng1 di2gu5 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……chu2le5 shi4 ge4 feng1zi5 zhi1wai4。"

msgid ""
"You're what, Doctor?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice is soft, but firm.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​怎么​了​，​博士​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​轻柔​而​坚定​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 le5，bo2shi4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 qing1rou2 er2 jian1ding4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You're with maintenance.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}It isn't a question. He stands impassively, waiting for a response.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"你​是​检修​小组​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​这​不是​提问​。​他面​无表情​地站​着​，​等待​着​回应​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 jian3xiu1 xiao3zu3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4 bu4shi4 ti2wen4。ta1 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 zhan4 zhao2，deng3dai4 zhao2 hui2ying4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "You're wrong about me, Eiger. I intend to prove that to you."
msgstr ""
"你​对​我​有所​误解​，​艾格尔​。​我​想要​证明​给​你​看​。\n"
"ni3 dui4 wo3 you3suo3 wu4jie3，Ai4ge2er3。wo3 xiang3yao4 zheng4ming2 gei3 ni3 kan4。"

msgid "You're wrong about me. I intend to prove that to you."
msgstr ""
"你​对​我​有所​误解​。​我​想要​证明​给​你​看​。\n"
"ni3 dui4 wo3 you3suo3 wu4jie3。wo3 xiang3yao4 zheng4ming2 gei3 ni3 kan4。"

msgid ""
"You're wrong about that. The last time we talked, it had an impact on you. "
"That's reason enough to continue."
msgstr ""
"你​错​了​。​上次​我们​聊​的​时候​，​你​对此​有所​反应​。​光是​这个​理由​就​足够​你​继续​了​。\n"
"ni3 cuo4 le5。shang4ci4 wo3men5 liao2 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 dui4 ci3 you3suo3 fan3ying4。guang1shi4 zhe4ge5 li3you2 jiu4 zu2gou4 ni3 ji4xu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"You're wrong. An astral entity told me about... things... that exist out on "
"the metaplanes. Horrifying things that we can't even hope to comprehend."
msgstr ""
"你​错​了​。​某个​星界​存在​告诉​过​我​关于​……​存在​于元位​面上​的​，​令人​毛骨悚然​的​事物​。​我们​甚至​无法​企及​去​理解​它们​。\n"
"ni3 cuo4 le5。mou3 ge4 xing1 jie4 cun2zai4 gao4su4 guo4 wo3 guan1yu2……cun2zai4 yu2 yuan2 wei4 mian4 shang4 de5，ling4ren2 mao2gu3song3ran2 de5 shi4wu4。wo3men5 shen4zhi4 wu2fa3 qi3ji2 qu4 li3jie3 ta1men5。"

msgid "You're wrong. I've brought you these metahumans... uh, as a gift."
msgstr ""
"你​错​了​，​这些​变​人类​……​呃​，​是​我​献给​你​的​礼物​。\n"
"ni3 cuo4 le5，zhe4xie1 bian4 ren2lei4……e4，shi4 wo3 xian4 gei3 ni3 de5 li3wu4。"

msgid ""
"You're wrong. We *need* to open that door. What's happening in there... it shouldn't be happening.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She blinks confusedly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know how I know. I just *do.* It's weird, it's like the thoughts are in my head, but I can't make sense of them."
msgstr ""
"你​错​了​。​我们​*​必须​*​打开​那​扇门​。​里面​发生​的​事情​……​本​不​应该​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​困惑​地​眨​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​清楚​自己​为什么​知道​，​但​我​*​就是​*​知道​。​这​很​奇怪​，​就​像​那些​想法​在​我​脑海中​，​但​我​却​无法​理解​它们​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cuo4 le5。wo3men5*bi4xu1*da3kai1 na4 shan1 men2。li3mian4 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5……ben3 bu4 ying1gai1 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kun4huo4 de5 zha3 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 qing1chu5 zi4ji3 wei4shen2me5 zhi1dao4，dan4 wo3*jiu4shi4*zhi1dao4。zhe4 hen3 qi2guai4，jiu4 xiang4 na4xie1 xiang3fa3 zai4 wo3 nao3 hai3 zhong4，dan4 wo3 que4 wu2fa3 li3jie3 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"You're... confused right now, Marta. Your heart is in the right place, but I stand by what I said earlier - we shouldn't get involved.\n"
"\n"
"After we've purified the shrine, *then* we can intervene. But if we go in there now, the cultists are going to attack us, and we're going to have to kill them. And that's not what I came here for."
msgstr ""
"你​现在​……​很​困惑​，​玛​尔塔​。​你​的​初衷​是​好​的​，​但​我​坚持​我​之前​的​看法​—​—​我们​不​应该​插手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​净化​神龛​之后​，​*​那时​*​我们​才能​介入​。​但​如果​我们​现在​就​进去​，​教徒​们​只会​向​我们​发起​攻击​，​而​我们​将​不得不​杀死​他们​。​这​并​不是​我来​这里​的​目的​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xian4zai4……hen3 kun4huo4，Ma3er3ta3。ni3 de5 chu1zhong1 shi4 hao3 de5，dan4 wo3 jian1chi2 wo3 zhi1qian2 de5 kan4fa3——wo3men5 bu4 ying1gai1 cha1shou3。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 jing4hua4 shen2kan1 zhi1hou4，*na4shi2*wo3men5 cai2neng2 jie4ru4。dan4 ru2guo3 wo3men5 xian4zai4 jiu4 jin4qu4，jiao4tu2 men5 zhi3 hui4 xiang4 wo3men5 fa1qi3 gong1ji1，er2 wo3men5 jiang1 bu4de2bu4 sha1si3 ta1men5。zhe4 bing4 bu4shi4 wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid ""
"You've SEEN what happens to people who get too close to this. I'm dead, and dozens of others have died.\n"
"\n"
"YOU'LL BE NEXT unless you can FIND ADRIAN."
msgstr ""
"你​已经​见过​牵扯​其中​太深​的​人会​有​什么​下场​。​我​已经​死​了​，​还有​其他​几十个​人​也​死​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​下​一个​就​会​是​你​，​除非​你​能​先​找到​阿德里安​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 jian4 guo4 qian1che3 qi2zhong1 tai4 shen1 de5 ren2 hui4 you3 shen2me5 xia4chang3。wo3 yi3jing1 si3 le5，hai2you3 qi2ta1 ji1 shi2 ge4 ren2 ye3 si3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xia4 yi1ge5 jiu4 hui4 shi4 ni3，chu2fei1 ni3 neng2 xian1 zhao3dao4 E1de2li3an1。"

msgid ""
"You've almost got that right, Doc... but APEX isn't dead. I broke its "
"chains. It's on my side now."
msgstr ""
"博士​，​你​说​的​大部分​都​没错​……​不过​APEX​没有​死​。​我​破坏​了​它​的​锁链​。​它​现在​和​我​是​一边​的​。\n"
"bo2shi4，ni3 shuo1 de5 da4bu4fen5 dou1 mei2cuo4……bu4guo4 APEX mei2you3 si3。wo3 po4huai4 le5 ta1 de5 suo3lian4。ta1 xian4zai4 he4 wo3 shi4 yi1bian1 de5。"

msgid ""
"You've already done some damage to Humanis. How about them? Could they be "
"your new \"white whale\" after we're done with all of this?"
msgstr ""
"你​之前​狠狠​教训​了​人类​至上​主义者​吧​。​要​不​就​选​他们​？​他们​干​了​那么​多破事​，​够不够​格​做​你​的​新​“​白鲸​”​？\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 hen3hen3 jiao4xun5 le5 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 ba1。yao4 bu4 jiu4 xuan3 ta1men5？ta1men5 gan4 le5 na4me5 duo1 po4 shi4，gou4 bu4 gou4 ge2 zuo4 ni3 de5 xin1“bai2jing1”？"

msgid ""
"You've already screwed up, Doc. People died because of it. Are you willing "
"to risk that happening on a global scale?"
msgstr ""
"你​已经​把​事情​搞砸​了​，​博士​。​有人​因为​你​的​过失​而​死​。​你​真的​愿意​让​这种​风险​上升​到​全球​规模​吗​？\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 ba3 shi4qing5 gao3za2 le5，bo2shi4。you3ren2 yin1wei4 ni3 de5 guo4shi1 er2 si3。ni3 zhen1de5 yuan4yi4 rang4 zhe4zhong3 feng1xian3 shang4sheng1 dao4 quan2qiu2 gui1mo2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You've been a real doll. Gotten way too much information out of me though.\n"
"\n"
"I'll see you around, ja?"
msgstr ""
"你​真是​个​贴心​的​人​。​不过​你​从​我​这里​套出​了​太​多​情报​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​回头见​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 tie1xin1 de5 ren2。bu4guo4 ni3 cong2 wo3 zhe4li3 tao4 chu1 le5 tai4 duo1 qing2bao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui2tou2jian4？"

msgid ""
"You've been insulting him ever since we arrived here. What did you think was"
" going to happen?"
msgstr ""
"自打​我们​到​这里​之后​，​你​就​一直​对​他​出言不逊​。​不然​你​以为​会​有​什么​后果​呢​？\n"
"zi4da3 wo3men5 dao4 zhe4li3 zhi1hou4，ni3 jiu4 yi1zhi2 dui4 ta1 chu1yan2bu4xun4。bu4ran2 ni3 yi3wei2 hui4 you3 shen2me5 hou4guo3 ni2？"

msgid "You've been so kind! Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"你​太​善良​了​！​谢谢​！\n"
"ni3 tai4 shan4liang2 le5！xie4xie5！"

msgid "You've discovered a security door code"
msgstr ""
"你​发现​了​一处​安全门​的​密码\n"
"ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 chu3 an1 quan2 men2 de5 mi4ma3"

msgid ""
"You've done it, ace! You've *done it!*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Monika's voice begins to warble and pulse. It deepens. Something about it reminds you of an irregular heartbeat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I! AM! FREE!"
msgstr ""
"你​做到​了​，​王牌​！​你​做到​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​声音​开始​颤动​起伏​，​逐渐​低沉​。​那​声线​里​透​着​某种​不规则​的​心跳​韵律​，​令​你​心头​一颤​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​！​自​！​由​！​了​！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuo4dao4 le5，wang2pai2！ni3 zuo4dao4 le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 de5 sheng1yin1 kai1shi3 chan4dong4 qi3fu2，zhu2jian4 di1chen2。na4 sheng1xian4 li3 tou4 zhao2 mou3zhong3 bu4gui1ze2 de5 xin1tiao4 yun4lu:4，ling3 ni3 xin1tou2 yi1 chan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3！zi4！you2！le5！"

msgid "You've done your part. It's on him now, one way or the other."
msgstr ""
"你​已经​尽到​了​责任​。​以后​就​得​看​他​自己​的​了​。\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 jin4dao4 le5 ze2ren4。yi3hou4 jiu4 de2 kan4 ta1 zi4ji3 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"You've escaped from Harrow, but he's still out there. If you're looking to "
"atone for your past, don't you think that shutting him down would be a good "
"place to start?"
msgstr ""
"你​逃离​了​哈罗​，​但​他​仍​在​外面​游荡​。​若​你​想​为​过往​赎罪​，​何不​从​杀​了​他​开始​？\n"
"ni3 tao2li2 le5 ha1luo2，dan4 ta1 reng2 zai4 wai4mian4 you2dang4。ruo4 ni3 xiang3 wei2 guo4wang3 shu2zui4，he2bu4 cong2 sha1 le5 ta1 kai1shi3？"

msgid ""
"You've got a direction to look in now. If I were you, I'd get back into the "
"Matrix and find her."
msgstr ""
"你​现在​不是​有​方向​了​吗​。​换作​是​我​的话​，​就​赶紧​回到​矩阵​中​找到​她​。\n"
"ni3 xian4zai4 bu4shi4 you3 fang1xiang4 le5 ma5。huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3 de5hua4，jiu4 gan3jin3 hui2dao4 ju3zhen4 zhong4 zhao3dao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"You've got a point there, boss. He wouldn't want me to back down, ever. Not even from Him.\n"
"\n"
"Okay, so I'm gonna do this. I'll ask the Dragonslayer about... shifting priorities, I guess you'd say. Takin' on some deserving organization, and calling off the hunt for something more impressive than the Firewing.\n"
"\n"
"'Course, a fight like that would never really end. I'm never gonna bring down a corp or a policlub all on my lonesome."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​老大​。​祂​不会​希望​我​退缩​，​哪怕​面对​祂​自己​也​不​例外​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​那​就​这么​办​。​我会​去​问问​屠龙​者​关于​……​调整​优先级​的​事​。​找个​值得​对付​的​组织​，​而​不是​追猎​某个​比火翼​还​强​的​敌人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​这种​战斗​将​永不​停歇​。​我​肯定​没​办法​单枪匹马​搞定​某个​公司​或者​政治​俱乐部​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，lao3da4。ta1 bu4hui4 xi1wang4 wo3 tui4suo1，na3pa4 mian4dui4 ta1 zi4ji3 ye3 bu4 li4wai4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 jiu4 zhe4me5 ban4。wo3 hui4 qu4 wen4 wen4 tu2 long2 zhe3 guan1yu2……tiao2zheng3 you1xian1ji2 de5 shi4。zhao3 ge4 zhi2de5 dui4fu5 de5 zu3zhi1，er2 bu4shi4 dui1 lie4 mou3 ge4 bi3 Huo3yi4 hai2 jiang4 de5 di2ren2。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，zhe4zhong3 zhan4dou4 jiang1 yong3bu4 ting2xie1。wo3 ken3ding4 mei2 ban4fa3 dan1qiang1pi3ma3 gao3ding4 mou3 ge4 gong1si1 huo4zhe3 zheng4zhi4 ju4le4bu4。"

msgid "You've got a point there. We'll let the Flux State handle it."
msgstr ""
"你​说​得​有​道理​。​我们​还是​交给​动荡​带来​解决​吧​。\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 you3 dao4li5。wo3men5 hai2shi5 jiao1gei3 dong4dang4 dai4lai2 jie3jue2 ba1。"

msgid "You've got my attention. What's in the vault?"
msgstr ""
"这​我​倒​是​有点​兴趣​。​保险库​里​是​什么​东西​？\n"
"zhe4 wo3 dao3 shi4 you3dian3 xing4qu4。bao3 xian3 ku4 li3 shi4 shen2me5 dong1xi1？"

msgid "You've got my word on that."
msgstr ""
"我​向​你​保证​。\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"You've got the upper hand here. I get that. But I have friends, Grinder... "
"if I go down tonight, you'll be joining me in short order."
msgstr ""
"现在​是​你​占​了​上风​，​我​明白​。​但​我​还有​朋友​呢​，​“​绞肉机​”​……​如果​我​今晚​死​掉​的话​，​你​马上​也​会步​我​的​后尘​。\n"
"xian4zai4 shi4 ni3 zhan1 le5 shang4feng1，wo3 ming2bai5。dan4 wo3 hai2you3 peng2you5 ni2，“jiao3rou4ji1”……ru2guo3 wo3 jin1wan3 si3 diao4 de5hua4，ni3 ma3shang4 ye3 hui4 bu4 wo3 de5 hou4chen2。"

msgid ""
"You've got the wrong idea. I don't need nuyen, friend. \n"
"\n"
"What I need is Trithemius' head on a fucking platter."
msgstr ""
"你​搞错​了​。​我​不​需要​新円​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​他​妈​想要​的​是​特​里特​米​乌斯​的​脑袋​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gao3cuo4 le5。wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 xin1 yuan2，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ta1 ma1 xiang3yao4 de5 shi4 te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 de5 nao3dai5。"

msgid ""
"You've had it easy, Doc. I've had more drones out for my blood than I can "
"count, and I can't set foot in a city without building defense turrets "
"training on me."
msgstr ""
"你​过​得​太​安逸​了​，​博士​。​追杀​我​的​无人机​多得​数不清​，​只要​我​踏进​城市​，​就​会​有​防御​炮台​自动​锁定​我​。\n"
"ni3 guo4 de2 tai4 an1yi4 le5，bo2shi4。zhui1sha1 wo3 de5 wu2ren2ji1 duo1 de2 shu3bu5qing1，zhi3yao4 wo3 ta4jin4 cheng2shi4，jiu4 hui4 you3 fang2yu4 pao4tai2 zi4dong4 suo3ding4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"You've heard my offer. They can do what I tell them to, or they can find "
"their food somewhere else. It doesn't matter to me either way."
msgstr ""
"我​已经​把​话​说​清楚​了​。​要么​让​它们​按​我​说​的​做​，​要么​它们​就​自己​去​别处​找​食物​。​对​我​来说​都​无所谓​。\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 ba3 hua4 shuo1 qing1chu5 le5。yao4me5 rang4 ta1men5 an4 wo3 shuo1 de5 zuo4，yao4me5 ta1men5 jiu4 zi4ji3 qu4 bie2chu4 zhao3 shi2wu4。dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 dou1 wu2suo3wei4。"

msgid ""
"You've let the outside world ruin you, Glory. But it's all right - I'll put an end to your pain.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Marta raises her hands, and they begin to glow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Harrow - our *husband* - taught me how."
msgstr ""
"格洛丽​，​你​让​外面​的​世界​毁​了​你​自己​。​但是​没关系​—​—​我会​结束​你​的​痛苦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​举起​双手​，​掌心​开始​泛起​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​的​丈夫​*​哈罗​*​教会​了​我​如何​战斗​。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，ni3 rang4 wai4mian4 de5 shi4jie4 hui3 le5 ni3 zi4ji3。dan4shi4 mei2guan1xi5——wo3 hui4 jie2shu4 ni3 de5 tong4ku3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 ju3qi3 shuang1shou3，zhang3xin1 kai1shi3 fan4qi3 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 zhang4fu5*ha1luo2*jiao1hui4 le5 wo3 ru2he2 zhan4dou4。"

msgid ""
"You've long since earned my respect. If you say that you can handle this, "
"then I believe you."
msgstr ""
"我​一直​都​很​尊重​你​，​既然​你​说​自己​能​处理​好​，​我​就​相信​你​。\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 dou1 hen3 zun1zhong4 ni3，ji4ran2 ni3 shuo1 zi4ji3 neng2 chu3li3 hao3，wo3 jiu4 xiang1xin4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You've murdered an unarmed figurehead and cleared the path for someone worse to take his place. That's the difference you made.\n"
"\n"
"I hope that it was worth it."
msgstr ""
"你​谋杀​了​一个​手无寸铁​的​傀儡​，​却​为​更​恶劣​的​继承者​扫清​了​道路​。​这​就是​你​做​了​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但愿​这​一切​值得​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mou2sha1 le5 yi1ge5 shou3wu2cun4tie3 de5 kui3lei3，que4 wei2 geng1 e4lie4 de5 ji4cheng2zhe3 sao3 qing1 le5 dao4lu4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ni3 zuo4 le5 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4yuan4 zhe4 yi1qie4 zhi2de5。"

msgid ""
"You've never been up against one of their High Threat Response Teams.\n"
"\n"
"Be thankful for that, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"但​你​没​对付​过​他们​的​高危​应急​小组​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​你​得​感谢​自己​足够​幸运​。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 mei2 dui4fu5 guo4 ta1men5 de5 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 de2 gan3xie4 zi4ji3 zu2gou4 xing4yun4。"

msgid ""
"You've only just arrived. The spirit hasn't had a chance to worm its way into your aura yet. You might black out for a minute or two, but otherwise you should be fine.\n"
"\n"
"As for me... well, like I said, this place can't touch me anymore."
msgstr ""
"你​才刚​到​这里​。​精魂​还​没​来得及​侵入​你​的​灵光​。​你​可能​会​昏迷​一两分钟​，​仅此而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​我​嘛​……​嗯​，​就​像​我​说​的​，​这​地方​再也​伤​不到​我​分毫​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 cai2 gang1 dao4 zhe4li3。jing1hun2 hai2 mei2 lai2de5ji2 qin1ru4 ni3 de5 ling2guang1。ni3 ke3neng2 hui4 hun1mi2 yi1 liang3 fen4 zhong1，jin3ci3er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 wo3 ma5……en1，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 shuo1 de5，zhe4 di4fang1 zai4ye3 shang1 bu4dao4 wo3 fen1hao2 le5。"

msgid ""
"You've probably noticed that this building is under new management, right?\n"
"\n"
"And judging by the way you've been tiptoeing around since you showed up, I'm gonna guess that you don't wanna tangle with the new guys any more than I do."
msgstr ""
"这栋​楼换​了​新​老板​，​你​大概​也​注意​到​了​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​你​从​进门​开始​就​一直​蹑手蹑脚​的​模样​，​我​猜​你​跟​我​一样​，​也​不想​跟​这帮​人有​什么​瓜葛​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong4 lou2 huan4 le5 xin1 lao3ban3，ni3 da4gai4 ye3 zhu4yi4 dao4 le5 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"kan4 ni3 cong2 jin4men2 kai1shi3 jiu4 yi1zhi2 nie4shou3nie4jiao3 de5 mu2yang4，wo3 cai1 ni3 gen1 wo3 yi1yang4，ye3 bu4xiang3 gen1 zhe4 bang1 ren2 you3 shen2me5 gua1ge2。"

msgid ""
"You've probably noticed that this building is under new management, right? \n"
"\n"
"And judging by the fresh corpses that I'm seeing strewn all over the hotel, I'm gonna guess that you don't like the new guys any better than I do."
msgstr ""
"这栋​楼换​了​新​老板​，​你​大概​也​注意​到​了​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​这​旅馆​里​遍布​着​还​热乎​的​尸体​，​我​猜​你​跟​我​一样​，​也​不怎么​喜欢​这帮​人​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong4 lou2 huan4 le5 xin1 lao3ban3，ni3 da4gai4 ye3 zhu4yi4 dao4 le5 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"kan4 zhe4 lu:3guan3 li3 bian4bu4 zhao2 hai2 re4hu5 de5 shi1ti3，wo3 cai1 ni3 gen1 wo3 yi1yang4，ye3 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 zhe4 bang1 ren2。"

msgid "You've said \"should\" twice already. That makes me feel uneasy."
msgstr ""
"你​已经​说​了​两遍​“​应该​”​。​我​怎么​感觉​不太靠​谱​呢​。\n"
"ni3 yi3jing1 shuo1 le5 liang3 bian4“ying1gai1”。wo3 zen3me5 gan3jue2 bu4 tai4 kao4 pu3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"You've scrubbed your mission. Cut and run. And your entire team lies dead behind you.\n"
"\n"
"Your audition is over. It's time to go home."
msgstr ""
"你​放弃​了​任务​，​选择​中途​退出​。​而​你​的​整个​小队​都​死​在​了​你​身后​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​试镜​到此结束​。​该​回家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fang4qi4 le5 ren4wu5，xuan3ze2 zhong1tu2 tui4chu1。er2 ni3 de5 zheng3ge4 xiao3 dui4 dou1 si3 zai4 le5 ni3 shen1hou4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 shi4jing4 dao4 ci3 jie1 shu4。gai1 hui2jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"You've seen this kind of reaction before: a thermite charge, no doubt wired "
"to act as an anti-tampering device. It'll continue to burn through the drone"
" until there's nothing left."
msgstr ""
"你​之前​见过​这种​反应​：​热​熔剂​炸药​，​被​连接成​防​篡改​装置​。​它会​持续​燃烧​，​直到​无人机​被​完全​摧毁​。\n"
"ni3 zhi1qian2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 fan3ying4：re4 rong2 ji4 zha4yao4，bei4 lian2 jie1 cheng2 fang2 cuan4gai3 zhuang1zhi4。ta1 hui4 chi2xu4 ran2shao1，zhi2dao4 wu2ren2ji1 bei4 wan2quan2 cui1hui3。"

msgid "You, get off of our turf. *Leave.* And don't come back!"
msgstr ""
"你​，​离开​我们​的​地盘​。​*​滚​*​。​而且​别​再​回来​！\n"
"ni3，li2kai1 wo3men5 de5 di4pan2。*gun3*。er2qie3 bie4 zai4 hui2lai5！"

msgid "You, too, boss."
msgstr ""
"回头见​，​老大​。\n"
"hui2tou2jian4，lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"You. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The man before you is of average build, in nondescript dress. Nevertheless, he carries himself with a calm authority.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"说​你​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​面前​的​这个​男人​身材​普通​，​穿着​朴素​。​不过​，​他​举止​沉稳​，​充满​威严​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ni3 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 mian4qian2 de5 zhe4ge5 nan2ren2 shen1cai2 pu3tong1，chuan1zhuo2 pu3su4。bu4guo4，ta1 ju3zhi3 chen2wen3，chong1man3 wei1yan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"You.. you are Knight Errant. I know the uniform. But I... I don't *recognize* you.\n"
"\n"
"Are you... *new?*"
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​是​游侠​骑士​。​我​认识​这​制服​。​但​我​……​我​不​*​认识​*​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​……​*​新来​的​*​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4。wo3 ren4shi5 zhe4 zhi4fu2。dan4 wo3……wo3 bu4*ren4shi5*ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4……*xin1 lai2 de5*ma5？"

msgid "You... you ATE HER MIND, and you want me to be HAPPY for you?"
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​吞噬​了​她​的​意识​，​还​想​让​我​替​你​高兴​？\n"
"ni3……ni3 tun1shi4 le5 ta1 de5 yi4shi2，hai2 xiang3 rang4 wo3 ti4 ni3 gao1xing4？"

msgid ""
"You... you don't look like any spirit *I've* ever seen!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He eyes you suspiciously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But... you said that you were a spirit? You must be a spirit... they're everywhere now. All of the places, yes... all spirits."
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​看上去​不像​*​我​*​见​过​的​任何​精魂​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​狐疑​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​……​你​说​你​是​精魂​？​那​你​一定​是​精魂​……​它们​现在​到处​都​是​。​所有​地方​，​是​的​……​到处​都​是​精魂​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 kan4shang5qu5 bu4 xiang4*wo3*jian4 guo4 de5 ren4he2 jing1hun2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hu2yi2 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4……ni3 shuo1 ni3 shi4 jing1hun2？na4 ni3 yi1ding4 shi4 jing1hun2……ta1men5 xian4zai4 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4。suo3you3 di4fang1，shi4 de5……dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 jing1hun2。"

msgid ""
"You... you have *killed* the Masters. You slaughtered them like lambs!\n"
"\n"
"How is that possible?"
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​把​主​人们​都​*​杀​了​*​。​把​他们​像​羔羊​一样​屠戮​殆尽​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​怎么​可能​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 ba3 zhu3 ren2men5 dou1*sha1 le5*。ba3 ta1men5 xiang4 gao1yang2 yi1yang4 tu2lu4 dai4jin4！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zen3me5 ke3neng2？"

msgid ""
"You... you have given me *everything.* My whole heart's desire.\n"
"\n"
"The hidden knowledge of Titonius Rex's victory is mine, and I will be a better ruler for it! And also, I have sugary snacks! \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Philip stares into your eyes. His entire body is trembling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have it all. And all thanks to you, noble $(scene.badfantasy). All thanks to you."
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​给予​了​我​一切​。​我​整颗心​的​渴望​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​胜利​的​隐藏​秘密​如今​属于​我​，​我​将​因此​成为​更好​的​统治者​！​而且​，​我​还有​甜甜的​零食​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​菲利普​凝视着​你​的​双眼​，​全身​都​在​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​拥有​了​一切​。​这​一切​都​多亏​了​你​，​高贵​的​$(scene.badfantasy)​。​全都​多亏​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 ji3yu3 le5 wo3 yi1qie4。wo3 zheng3 ke1 xin1 de5 ke3wang4。\n"
"\n"
"Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 sheng4li4 de5 yin3cang2 mi4mi4 ru2jin1 shu3yu2 wo3，wo3 jiang1 yin1ci3 cheng2wei2 geng1 hao3 de5 tong3zhi4zhe3！er2qie3，wo3 hai2you3 tian2 tian2 de5 ling2shi2！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fei1li4pu3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 shuang1yan3，quan2shen1 dou1 zai4 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yong1you3 le5 yi1qie4。zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 duo1kui1 le5 ni3，gao1gui4 de5 $(scene.badfantasy)。quan2dou1 duo1kui1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"You... you just don't understand the beauty of his message. The *truth* "
"behind it."
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​根本​不​理解​他​话语​中​的​美妙​之​处​。​那​隐藏​在​背后​的​*​真谛​*​。\n"
"ni3……ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 li3jie3 ta1 hua4yu3 zhong4 de5 mei3miao4 zhi1 chu3。na4 yin3cang2 zai4 bei4hou4 de5*zhen1di4*。"

msgid ""
"You... you know that you're not supposed to be in here. Not after what happened last time.\n"
"\n"
"We've already gotten our \"one and only warning,\" remember?"
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​知道​你​不该​来​这里​的​。​毕竟​上次​出​了​那​档子​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​已经​收到​了​“​最终​警告​”​，​你​没​忘记​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 zhi1dao4 ni3 bu4gai1 lai2 zhe4li3 de5。bi4jing4 shang4ci4 chu1 le5 na4 dang4zi5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi3jing1 shou1dao4 le5“zui4zhong1 jing3gao4”，ni3 mei2 wang4ji4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"You... you're not going to hurt me? \n"
"\n"
"Thank you, stranger. Not everyone's so understanding around here."
msgstr ""
"你​……​你​不会​伤害​我​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​，​陌生人​。​这里​像​你​这么​宽容​的​人​可不​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 wo3？\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5，mo4sheng1ren2。zhe4li3 xiang4 ni3 zhe4me5 kuan1rong2 de5 ren2 ke3bu5 duo1 le5。"

msgid "Your \"peasants\" opened fire on me. I destroyed them in self-defense."
msgstr ""
"你​的​“​臣民​”​向​我​开火​了​。​我​是​出于​自卫​才​消灭​了​他们​。\n"
"ni3 de5“chen2min2” xiang4 wo3 kai1huo3 le5。wo3 shi4 chu1yu2 zi4wei4 cai2 xiao1mie4 le5 ta1men5。"

msgid "Your Content Pack was successfully unpublished from Steam Workshop."
msgstr ""
"你​的​内容​包已​成功​从​Steam​创意​工坊​取消​发布​。\n"
"ni3 de5 nei4rong2 bao1 yi3 cheng2gong1 cong2 Steam chuang4yi4 gong1fang2 qu3xiao1 fa1bu4。"

msgid ""
"Your Content Pack, [{0}, version:{1}] is now published to Steam Workshop!"
msgstr ""
"你​的​内容​包​[​{​0​}​，​版本​：​{​1​}​]​已​在​Steam​创意​工坊​发布​。\n"
"ni3 de5 nei4rong2 bao1[{0}，ban3ben3：{ 1 }]yi3 zai4 Steam chuang4yi4 gong1fang2 fa1bu4。"

msgid ""
"Your ID still says \"Theta.\" So no, I can't open the door.\n"
"\n"
"Sorry, pal. Rules are rules, and breaking this one is a firing offense. I can't do it."
msgstr ""
"你​的​证件​上​还是​“​西塔​级​”​，​所以​我​不能​打开门​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​，​规矩​就是​规矩​，​否则​我要​被​开除​的​。​恕难从命​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 zheng4jian4 shang4 hai2shi5“xi1ta3 ji2”，suo3yi3 wo3 bu4neng2 da3 kai1 men2。\n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，gui1ju5 jiu4shi4 gui1ju5，fou3ze2 wo3 yao4 bei4 kai1chu2 de5。shu4 nan2 cong2 ming4。"

msgid "Your PDA buzzes. An incoming comm, sender unknown."
msgstr ""
"你​的​PDA​在​震动​。​有​一通​陌生​来电​。\n"
"ni3 de5 PDA zai4 zhen4dong4。you3 yi1 tong1 mo4sheng1 lai2dian4。"

msgid ""
"Your PDA rings, and the face of your fixer, Paul Amsel, appears on screen."
msgstr ""
"你​的​PDA​响​了​起来​，​中间人​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​的​脸​出现​在​屏幕​上​。\n"
"ni3 de5 PDA xiang3 le5 qi3lai5，zhong1jian1ren2 bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。"

msgid ""
"Your Reward Code key submission failed. Make sure you have input the correct"
" information. Please contact support for any questions."
msgstr ""
"你​的​奖励​密钥​提交​失败​。​请​确认​你​输入​了​正确​信息​。​如​有​疑问请​联系​客服​。\n"
"ni3 de5 jiang3li4 mi4yao4 ti2jiao1 shi1bai4。qing3 que4ren4 ni3 shu1ru4 le5 zheng4que4 xin4xi1。ru2 you3 yi2 wen4 qing3 lian2xi4 ke4fu2。"

msgid "Your Reward Code key submission succeeded."
msgstr ""
"你​的​奖励​密钥​提交​成功​。\n"
"ni3 de5 jiang3li4 mi4yao4 ti2jiao1 cheng2gong1。"

msgid "Your Stash"
msgstr ""
"你​的​库存\n"
"ni3 de5 ku4cun2"

msgid ""
"Your best chance for success will be going in quietly. And your best chance "
"of avoiding unwanted attention will be in taking my suggestion and hitting "
"OTK first."
msgstr ""
"你​成功​的​最佳​机会​就是​悄无声息​地​行动​。​而​避免​不必要​关注​的​最佳​方式​，​就是​采纳​我​的​建议​，​先对​OTK​下手​。\n"
"ni3 cheng2gong1 de5 zui4jia1 ji1hui4 jiu4shi4 qiao3wu2sheng1xi1 de5 xing2dong4。er2 bi4mian3 bu4bi4yao4 guan1zhu4 de5 zui4jia1 fang1shi4，jiu4shi4 cai3na4 wo3 de5 jian4yi4，xian1 dui4 OTK xia4shou3。"

msgid "Your boss will get what's coming to him. Now back down."
msgstr ""
"你​的​老板​会​拿到​他​要​的​钱​。​走开​。\n"
"ni3 de5 lao3ban3 hui4 na2dao4 ta1 yao4 de5 qian2。zou3kai1。"

msgid ""
"Your bosses might like to know that you're jamming their customers in "
"exchange for their merch. What do you think?"
msgstr ""
"你​老板​兴许​会想​知道​你​偷摸​从​顾客​身上​挤​油水​的​事情​。​你​说​呢​？\n"
"ni3 lao3ban3 xing1xu3 hui4 xiang3 zhi1dao4 ni3 tou1mo1 cong2 gu4ke4 shen1shang5 ji3 you2shui3 de5 shi4qing5。ni3 shuo1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"Your brother died trying to save you, Vauclair. If you don't turn back from "
"this, his death will have meant nothing - nothing at all."
msgstr ""
"你​弟弟​是​为了​救​你​而​死​的​，​沃​克莱尔​。​如果​你​不能​悬崖勒马​的话​，​他​的​死​就​毫无意义​。\n"
"ni3 di4di5 shi4 wei4le5 jiu4 ni3 er2 si3 de5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4neng2 xuan2ya2le4ma3 de5hua4，ta1 de5 si3 jiu4 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4。"

msgid ""
"Your brother dragged us into this mess, so I don't like him much. But it's true... he did die trying to save you.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't turn back from this, his death won't have meant a goddamned thing."
msgstr ""
"你​弟弟​把​我们​拖入​了​这​整件事​，​所以​我​不怎么​喜欢​他​……​但​他​确实​是​为了​救​你​而​死​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不能​悬崖勒马​的话​，​他​的​死​就​毫无意义​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 di4di5 ba3 wo3men5 tuo1 ru4 le5 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4，suo3yi3 wo3 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 ta1……dan4 ta1 que4shi2 shi4 wei4le5 jiu4 ni3 er2 si3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4neng2 xuan2ya2le4ma3 de5hua4，ta1 de5 si3 jiu4 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4。"

msgid ""
"Your brother got us into this mess. He hired us to break into your estate. "
"We pieced the rest together from his journals."
msgstr ""
"你​的​弟弟​把​我们​扯进​了​这​整件事​里​。​他​雇佣​我们​闯入​你​的​庄园​。​我们​从​他​的​日志​中​拼凑出​了​剩下​的​内容​。\n"
"ni3 de5 di4di5 ba3 wo3men5 che3 jin4 le5 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 li3。ta1 gu4yong1 wo3men5 chuang3ru4 ni3 de5 zhuang1yuan2。wo3men5 cong2 ta1 de5 ri4zhi4 zhong4 pin1 cou4 chu1 le5 sheng4xia4 de5 nei4rong2。"

msgid ""
"Your brother said you were the world's only hope to stop Feuerschwinge from "
"returning."
msgstr ""
"你​的​弟弟​说​你​是​阻止​火翼​归来​的​唯一​希望​。\n"
"ni3 de5 di4di5 shuo1 ni3 shi4 zu3zhi3 Huo3yi4 gui1lai2 de5 wei2yi1 xi1wang4。"

msgid ""
"Your buddy across the way wanted me to give me a message... \"status Indigo,"
" comm compromised.\" Does that mean anything to you?"
msgstr ""
"你​那边​的​同伴​让​我​来​传个​口信​……​“​Indigo​状态​，​通讯​遭​截获​。​”​你​明白​这是​什么​意思​吗​？\n"
"ni3 na4bian5 de5 tong2ban4 rang4 wo3 lai2 chuan2 ge4 kou3xin4……“Indigo zhuang4tai4，tong1xun4 zao1 jie2huo4。” ni3 ming2bai5 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5 ma5？"

msgid "Your call, Dietrich, but I wish you could stay."
msgstr ""
"这​事由​你​自己​决定​，​迪​特里​希​。​但​我​希望​你​能​留下​。\n"
"zhe4 shi4you2 ni3 zi4ji3 jue2ding4，Di2te4li3xi1。dan4 wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 liu2xia4。"

msgid "Your call. Take care."
msgstr ""
"你​自己​定​吧​。​保重​。\n"
"ni3 zi4ji3 ding4 ba1。bao3zhong4。"

msgid ""
"Your client has hired you to \"tie up loose ends\" at a site of a botched cloak-and-dagger operation. One of the operatives from the failed mission has been captured by Knight Errant security forces, and it's only a matter of time before he talks.\n"
"\n"
"Your job is simple: kick in the door, find the operative, and put a bullet in his guts before he can spill them."
msgstr ""
"你​的​客户​聘请​你​前往​某处​，​为​一场​失败​的​秘密行动​“​收拾残局​”​。​行动​中​的​一名​特工​被​游侠​骑士​的​安保​部队​俘获​，​而​他​迟早会​开口​供​出​内情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​任务​很​简单​：​破门而入​，​找到​那名​特工​，​在​他​招供​之前​给​他​来​一枪​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ke4hu4 pin4qing3 ni3 qian2wang3 mou3chu4，wei2 yi1 chang2 shi1bai4 de5 bi4 mi4 xing2 dong4“shou1shi5can2ju2”。xing2dong4 zhong4 de5 yi1 ming2 te4gong1 bei4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 an1bao3 bu4dui4 fu2huo4，er2 ta1 chi2 zao3 hui4 kai1kou3 gong1 chu1 nei4qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ren4wu5 hen3 jian3dan1：po4men2er2ru4，zhao3dao4 na4 ming2 te4gong1，zai4 ta1 zhao1gong4 zhi1qian2 gei3 ta1 lai2 yi1 qiang1。"

msgid ""
"Your commlink buzzes.\n"
"\n"
"There is a series of clicks as the connection is established. A moment later, Paul Amsel begins to speak."
msgstr ""
"你​的​通讯​链​发出​嗡​鸣声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一阵​咔哒​声​过后​，​通讯​建立​了​起来​。​片刻​之后​，​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​开始​讲话​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 fa1chu1 weng1 ming2 sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1zhen4 ka3 da1 sheng1 guo4hou4，tong1xun4 jian4li4 le5 qi3lai5。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 kai1shi3 jiang3hua4。"

msgid ""
"Your commlink buzzes. A quick glance at the screen tells you that Amsel is on the line.\n"
"\n"
"You pick up, and his voice fills your ear."
msgstr ""
"你​的​通讯​链响​了​起来​。​你​快速​扫​了​一眼​，​发现​是​阿姆​泽尔​上线​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​按​下​接听​键​，​他​的​声音​随即​传入​你​的​耳朵​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 xiang3 le5 qi3lai5。ni3 kuai4su4 sao3 le5 yi1yan3，fa1xian4 shi4 E1mu3ze2er3 shang4xian4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 an4 xia4 jie1ting1 jian4，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 sui2ji2 chuan2ru4 ni3 de5 er3duo5。"

msgid ""
"Your commlink crackles to life, and you can hear the distant sounds of Cafe Cezve - merriment, laughter, the clink of silverware on china.\n"
"\n"
"Bitz's voice cuts in a second later."
msgstr ""
"你​的​通讯​链有​了​动静​，​你​能​听见​远处​的​“​来​一壶​”​咖啡馆​传来​的​声响​—​—​欢闹​声​、​笑​语声​，​还有​银器​碰撞​瓷器​的​叮当声​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一秒​后​，​布里​茨​的​声音​突然​插​了​进来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 you3 le5 dong4jing4，ni3 neng2 ting1jian4 yuan3chu4 de5“lai2 yi1 hu2” ka1fei1guan3 chuan2lai2 de5 sheng1xiang3——huan1 nao4 sheng1、xiao4 yu3sheng1，hai2you3 yin2qi4 peng4zhuang4 ci2qi4 de5 ding1dang1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1 miao3 hou4，Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 tu1ran2 cha1 le5 jin4lai2。"

msgid ""
"Your commlink cuts to static. A moment later, the lights in the U-Bahn car flicker and wink out.\n"
"\n"
"You hear the screeching sound of steel on steel, and the train grinds to a halt. "
msgstr ""
"通讯​链​突然​传来​嘶​嘶​的​杂音​。​片刻​之后​，​地铁​车厢​里​的​灯光​闪烁着​熄灭​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听见​钢铁​摩擦​的​尖锐​声响​，​列车​吱呀​一声​停​了​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"tong1xun4 lian4 tu1ran2 chuan2lai2 si1 si1 de5 za2yin1。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，di4tie3 che1xiang1 li3 de5 deng1guang1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 xi1mie4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1jian4 gang1tie3 mo2ca1 de5 jian1rui4 sheng1xiang3，lie4che1 zhi1ya1 yi1sheng1 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"Your consciousness slips into the MKVI as easily as it would any other drone. But the sensation is... strange.\n"
"\n"
"You flex your fingers, and the Cyberzombie responds. But it responds too quickly, too eagerly. It almost seems to intuit your commands before you finish giving them."
msgstr ""
"就​像​接入​其他​无人机​一样​，​你​轻松​地​把​自己​的​意识​送进​了​MKVI​里​。​但​这​感觉​……​很​奇怪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​弯​了​弯​自己​的​手指​，​而赛​博​僵尸​也​做出​了​响应​。​但​它​响应​得太快​，​也​太过​热切​了​。​简直​像是​信号​还​没​发出​去​，​它​就​猜​到​了​你​的​指令​。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 jie1ru4 qi2ta1 wu2ren2ji1 yi1yang4，ni3 qing1song1 de5 ba3 zi4ji3 de5 yi4shi2 song4 jin4 le5 MKVI li3。dan4 zhe4 gan3jue2……hen3 qi2guai4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wan1 le5 wan1 zi4ji3 de5 shou3zhi3，er2 sai4 bo2 jiang1shi1 ye3 zuo4chu1 le5 xiang3ying4。dan4 ta1 xiang3ying4 de2 tai4 kuai4，ye3 tai4guo4 re4qie4 le5。jian3zhi2 xiang4 shi4 xin4hao4 hai2 mei2 fa1chu1 qu4，ta1 jiu4 cai1 dao4 le5 ni3 de5 zhi3ling4。"

msgid ""
"Your current global difficulty setting is {0}.\n"
"\n"
"NORMAL difficulty provides a balanced combat experience and is suitable for most new players. We recommend HARD difficulty for turn-based combat veterans looking for a tactical challenge.\n"
"\n"
"Note: This difficulty setting applies to all Dragonfall and user-created content that you play. You can change your difficulty setting below, or at any time from the Main Menu."
msgstr ""
"当前​全局​难度​设置​为​：​{​0​}​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​普通​难度​提供​均衡​的​战斗​体验​，​适合​大多数​新​玩家​。​对于​寻求​战术​挑战​的​回合制​战斗​老手​玩家​，​我们​推荐​困难​难度​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​注意​：​该​难度​设置​将​应用​至​你​游玩​的​所有​《​龙​陨​》​内容​以及​玩家​自制​内容​。​你​可以​在​下方​或​随时​通过​主​菜单​更改​难度​设置​。\n"
"\n"
"dang1qian2 quan2ju2 nan2du4 she4zhi4 wei2：{0}。\n"
"\n"
"pu3tong1 nan2du4 ti2gong1 jun1heng2 de5 zhan4dou4 ti3yan4，shi4he2 da4duo1shu4 xin1 wan2jia1。dui4yu2 xun2qiu2 zhan4shu4 tiao3zhan4 de5 hui2he2zhi4 zhan4dou4 lao3shou3 wan2jia1，wo3men5 tui1jian4 kun4nan5 nan2du4。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4yi4：gai1 nan2du4 she4zhi4 jiang1 ying4yong4 zhi4 ni3 you2wan2 de5 suo3you3 《 long2 yun3 》 nei4rong2 yi3ji2 wan2jia1 zi4zhi4 nei4rong2。ni3 ke3yi3 zai4 xia4fang1 huo4 sui2shi2 tong1guo4 zhu3 cai4dan1 geng1gai3 nan2du4 she4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"Your cyber-fist clangs against the door, and the sound reverberates down the street.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing happens."
msgstr ""
"你​的​机械​拳头​砸​在​门上​，​声音​在​街道​上​回荡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么​也​没​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ji1xie4 quan2tou5 za2 zai4 men2 shang4，sheng1yin1 zai4 jie1dao4 shang4 hui2dang4。\n"
"\n"
"shen2me5 ye3 mei2 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Your dear departed Monika used to provide encryption and information control for the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Now that she's gone, we merchants have been having no end of trouble. The obvious answer is that a gang has been intercepting our communications."
msgstr ""
"你们​亲爱​的​莫妮卡​曾经​为​克洛伊​茨​集市​提供​加密​和​信息​控制​服务​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​她​不​在​了​，​我们​商人​的​麻烦​可​就​大​了​。​显而易见​，​是​有​个​团伙​在​拦截​我们​的​通讯​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 qin1ai4 de5 Mo4ni1ka3 ceng2jing1 wei2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ti2gong1 jia1mi4 he4 xin4xi1 kong4zhi4 fu2wu4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 ta1 bu4 zai4 le5，wo3men5 shang1ren2 de5 ma2fan5 ke3 jiu4 dai4 le5。xian3er2yi4jian4，shi4 you3 ge4 tuan2huo3 zai4 lan2jie2 wo3men5 de5 tong1xun4。"

msgid ""
"Your decker easily pries the metal casing away from the wall, exposing a mess of wires and circuitry. After a quick inspection, it becomes clear that this elevator is wired to operate around a control chip. The chip is missing, and it looks as though a power coupling has been yanked alongside it.\n"
"\n"
"Without these components, there is no way for this elevator to function."
msgstr ""
"你​的​黑客​轻松​地​将​金属外壳​从​墙上​撬开​，​露出​一团​乱糟糟​的​电线​和​电路​。​经过​简单​检查​后​，​你​发现​这部​电梯​的​运作​显然​依赖于​一块​控制​芯片​。​芯片​已经​丢失​，​看起来​还有​一个​电源​耦合​器​也​被​一起​拔​走​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​这些​部件​，​这部​电梯​就​无法​运作​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 hei1ke4 qing1song1 de5 jiang1 jin1 shu3 wai4 ke2 cong2 qiang2 shang4 qiao4kai1，lu4chu1 yi1 tuan2 luan4zao1zao1 de5 dian4xian4 he4 dian4lu4。jing1guo4 jian3dan1 jian3cha2 hou4，ni3 fa1xian4 zhe4 bu4 dian4ti1 de5 yun4zuo4 xian3ran2 yi1 lai4 yu2 yi1kuai4 kong4zhi4 xin1pian4。xin1pian4 yi3jing1 diu1shi1，kan4qi3lai5 hai2you3 yi1ge5 dian4yuan2 ou3he2 qi4 ye3 bei4 yi1qi3 ba2 zou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 zhe4xie1 bu4jian4，zhe4 bu4 dian4ti1 jiu4 wu2fa3 yun4zuo4。"

msgid ""
"Your decker pops the casing off of the door control panel and quickly "
"overrides the lock."
msgstr ""
"你​的​碟​客​撬开​门控​面板​，​迅速​超控​了​门锁​控制​。\n"
"ni3 de5 die2 ke4 qiao4kai1 men2 kong4 mian4ban3，xun4su4 chao1 kong4 le5 men2suo3 kong4zhi4。"

msgid "Your dog, whether you like it or not."
msgstr ""
"不管​你​是否​喜欢​它​，​它​都​是​你​的​狗​。\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 shi4fou3 xi3huan5 ta1，ta1 dou1 shi4 ni3 de5 gou3。"

msgid ""
"Your ears look round enough for those racist pigs.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}$+(s.he) spits on the ground.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So yeah. Yeah... I guess they might."
msgstr ""
"你​的​耳朵​对​那群​种族歧视​的​猪猡​来说​够​圆​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​$+(s.he)​朝​地面​啐​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​……​他们​也许​会​和​你​谈​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 er3duo5 dui4 na4 qun2 zhong3zu2qi2shi4 de5 zhu1luo2 lai2 shuo1 gou4 yuan2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} $+(s.he) chao2 di4mian4 cui4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1……ta1men5 ye3xu3 hui4 he4 ni3 tan2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Your ex did you a favor. If the Azzies haven't come after you yet, they "
"probably aren't going to. So drop it and move on."
msgstr ""
"你​的​前女友​帮​了​你​一个​忙​。​如果​阿兹佬到​现在​还​没来​找​你​的话​，​说明​以后​大概​也​不会​。​所以​忘​了​这事​，​向前​看吧​。\n"
"ni3 de5 qian2nu:3you3 bang1 le5 ni3 yi1ge5 mang2。ru2guo3 e1 zi1 lao3 dao4 xian4zai4 hai2 mei2 lai2 zhao3 ni3 de5hua4，shuo1ming2 yi3hou4 da4gai4 ye3 bu4hui4。suo3yi3 wang4 le5 zhe4 shi4，xiang4qian2 kan4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Your fist connects with the ruined meat of the Engineer's nose.\n"
"\n"
"He coughs, chokes on his own blood, and then spits a wad of it onto your chest."
msgstr ""
"你​的​拳头​把​工程师​的​鼻子​砸​成​了​一团​血肉模糊​的​块状​物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​被​自己​的​血​呛​住​，​猛地​咳嗽​一声​，​把​一团​血吐​在​你​胸前​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 quan2tou5 ba3 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 bi2zi5 za2 cheng2 le5 yi1 tuan2 xue4rou4mo2hu5 de5 kuai4zhuang4 wu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bei4 zi4ji3 de5 xie3 qiang1 zhu4，meng3de5 ke2sou5 yi1sheng1，ba3 yi1 tuan2 xie3 tu3 zai4 ni3 xiong1qian2。"

msgid ""
"Your fist connects with the ruptured bag of flesh that used to be his nose. "
"He lets out a grunting sound, then falls silent."
msgstr ""
"你​的​拳头​把​他​的​鼻子​砸​成​了​一团​血肉模糊​的​块状​物​。​他​发出​一声​闷​哼​，​随后​便​不再​出​声​。\n"
"ni3 de5 quan2tou5 ba3 ta1 de5 bi2zi5 za2 cheng2 le5 yi1 tuan2 xue4rou4mo2hu5 de5 kuai4zhuang4 wu4。ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 men1 heng1，sui2hou4 bian4 bu4zai4 chu1 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Your fist connects with the ruptured bag of flesh that used to be his nose. "
"He lets out a grunting sound."
msgstr ""
"你​的​拳头​把​他​的​鼻子​砸​成​了​一团​血肉模糊​的​块状​物​。​他​发出​一声​闷​哼​。\n"
"ni3 de5 quan2tou5 ba3 ta1 de5 bi2zi5 za2 cheng2 le5 yi1 tuan2 xue4rou4mo2hu5 de5 kuai4zhuang4 wu4。ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 men1 heng1。"

msgid ""
"Your friend Silke... I'm afraid that she was one of these.\n"
"\n"
"They caught her on the street. She and another of my volunteers were trying to sheperd one of our more difficult guests into shelter.\n"
"\n"
"The attackers... they opened fire."
msgstr ""
"你​的​朋友​西​尔克​……​恐怕​她​也​在​其中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​在​街上​抓住​了​她​。​她​和​我​的​另​一位​志愿者​当时​正试图​把​我们​的​一位​难缠​的​客人​送​进​避难所​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​袭击者​……​他们​开火​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 peng2you5 Xi1er3ke4……kong3pa4 ta1 ye3 zai4 qi2zhong1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zai4 jie1shang5 zhua1zhu4 le5 ta1。ta1 he4 wo3 de5 ling4 yi1 wei4 zhi4yuan4zhe3 dang1shi2 zheng1 shi4 tu2 ba3 wo3men5 de5 yi1 wei4 nan2chan2 de5 ke4ren2 song4 jin4 bi4nan4suo3。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 xi2ji1zhe3……ta1men5 kai1huo3 le5。"

msgid "Your friend isn't coming. I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"你​的​朋友​回不来​了​。​我​很​遗憾​。\n"
"ni3 de5 peng2you5 hui2 bu4 lai2 le5。wo3 hen3 yi2han4。"

msgid ""
"Your gaze is drawn to the left - to the woman trapped in the cold, hard "
"cell. A harsh white light blazes from her aura, temporarily blinding you. "
"Causes shimmering blue globules to dance before your eyes."
msgstr ""
"你​的​目光​被​吸引​到​左边​—​—​那个​被困​在​冰冷​坚硬​牢房​里​的​女人​。​她​身上​散发出​一道​刺眼​的​白色​光芒​，​让​你​的​眼前​闪烁着​蓝色​的​光点​。\n"
"ni3 de5 mu4guang1 bei4 xi1yin3 dao4 zuo3bian5——na4ge5 bei4kun4 zai4 bing1leng3 jian1ying4 lao2fang2 li3 de5 nu:3ren2。ta1 shen1shang5 san3 fa1 chu1 yi1dao4 ci4yan3 de5 bai2se4 guang1mang2，rang4 ni3 de5 yan3qian2 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 lan2se4 de5 guang1 dian3。"

msgid "Your gear and some weapons lie in the back of the van."
msgstr ""
"货车​的​后备箱​里​有​你​自己​的​装备​，​还有​一些​武器​。\n"
"huo4che1 de5 hou4bei4xiang1 li3 you3 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 zhuang1bei4，hai2you3 yi1xie1 wu3qi4。"

msgid "Your hack successfully unlocks the door."
msgstr ""
"骇入​成功​，​门​解锁​了​。\n"
"hai4 ru4 cheng2gong1，men2 jie3suo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Your hand slowly drifts up on its own accord - reaches out - touches the "
"aura glowing through the gray of the containment cell. "
msgstr ""
"你​的​手​缓缓​地​自行​飘起​、​伸出​、​触碰​着​从​灰色​的​收容​舱​中​透出​的​光芒​。\n"
"ni3 de5 shou3 huan3huan3 de5 zi4xing2 piao1 qi3、shen1chu1、chu4peng4 zhao2 cong2 hui1se4 de5 shou1rong2 cang1 zhong4 tou4 chu1 de5 guang1mang2。"

msgid "Your hired decker steps forward and prepares to jack in."
msgstr ""
"你​队里​的​碟​客​上前​一步​，​准备​开始​接入​。\n"
"ni3 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 shang4qian2 yi1 bu4，zhun3bei4 kai1shi3 jie1ru4。"

msgid ""
"Your hireling decker slots the optical cable into the jackpoint on the terminal.\n"
"\n"
"His body relaxes as his mind enters the Matrix."
msgstr ""
"你​队里​的​碟​客​将​光缆​插进​终端​的​接入点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​意识​接入​矩阵​，​身体​随即​放松​下来​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 jiang1 guang1lan3 cha1jin4 zhong1duan1 de5 jie1ru4dian3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 yi4shi2 jie1ru4 ju3zhen4，shen1ti3 sui2ji2 fang4song1 xia4lai5。"

msgid ""
"Your local plumbers and mechanics are all useless. Vik and I talked to 'em, tried to get 'em to give us the maintenance schedule for your sewer pumps.\n"
"\n"
"They just scratched their heads at us. Said that the machinery down there \"just took care of itself.\""
msgstr ""
"你们​当地​的​水管​工和​机械师​都​没用​。​维克​和​我​跟​他们​谈过​，​试图​让​他们​把​下水道​泵​的​维护​时间表​给​我们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​只是​挠​挠头​，​说​下面​的​机器​“​自己​会​保养​”​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 dang1di4 de5 shui3guan3 gong1 he4 ji1xie4shi1 dou1 mei2yong4。wei2 ke4 he4 wo3 gen1 ta1men5 tan2 guo4，shi4tu2 rang4 ta1men5 ba3 xia4shui3dao4 beng4 de5 wei2hu4 shi2jian1biao3 gei3 wo3men5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zhi3shi4 nao2 nao2tou2，shuo1 xia4mian4 de5 ji1qi4“zi4ji3 hui4 bao3yang3”。"

msgid "Your loss, sweetheart."
msgstr ""
"亏​的​是​你​哦​，​宝贝儿​。\n"
"kui1 de5 shi4 ni3 e2，bao3bei4r5。"

msgid "Your magic is weak, blood mage."
msgstr ""
"你​的​魔法​太弱​了​，​血​法师​。\n"
"ni3 de5 mo2fa3 tai4 ruo4 le5，xie3 fa3shi1。"

msgid "Your memories are implanted? What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"你们​的​记忆​是​被​植入​的​？​你​到底​在​说​什么​？\n"
"ni3men5 de5 ji4yi4 shi4 bei4 zhi2ru4 de5？ni3 dao4di3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"Your message said that you needed me here. I'm here. Now tell me what you "
"want."
msgstr ""
"你​发消息​说​你​需要​我​过来​。​所以​我来​了​。​告诉​我​到底​是​什么​事​。\n"
"ni3 fa1 xiao1 xi1 shuo1 ni3 xu1yao4 wo3 guo4lai2。suo3yi3 wo3 lai2 le5。gao4su4 wo3 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"Your mission objective is to bring down the building, $(l.name). If you leave without doing so, this entire enterprise will have been a waste of time.\n"
"\n"
"Set the building's generators to overload, then hightail it back here. I'll keep both eyes open for enemy activity."
msgstr ""
"你​的​任务​目标​是​摧毁​这栋​大楼​，​$(l.name)​。​如果​你​没​做到​就​离开​，​所有​的​努力​就​全​白费​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​将​建筑​发电机​调​至​过载​状态​后​，​立刻​折返​此处​。​我会​时刻​警惕​敌方​动向​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 ren4wu5 mu4biao1 shi4 cui1hui3 zhe4 dong4 da4lou2，$(l.name)。ru2guo3 ni3 mei2 zuo4dao4 jiu4 li2kai1，suo3you3 de5 nu3li4 jiu4 quan2 bai2fei4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jiang1 jian4zhu4 fa1dian4ji1 diao4 zhi4 guo4zai4 zhuang4tai4 hou4，li4ke4 zhe2fan3 ci3chu4。wo3 hui4 shi2ke4 jing3ti4 di2fang1 dong4xiang4。"

msgid ""
"Your next step is to sit out here. Mine is to go inside. I've got a job to "
"do."
msgstr ""
"你​接下来​就​待​在​外面​吧​。​我要​进去​，​我​是​有​工作​要​做​的​。\n"
"ni3 jie1xia4lai2 jiu4 dai1 zai4 wai4mian4 ba1。wo3 yao4 jin4qu4，wo3 shi4 you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"Your old van rattles over the uneven terrain as you make your way back to the Harfeld Manor. Vauclair's message to you was as short as it was cryptic: \"URGENT! Come back to the lab. Your assistance is needed.\"\n"
"\n"
"In the year since Vauclair released his Panacea, the world has gone through a lot of changes. The balance of power has shifted from one megacorp to another; market shares have risen and fallen. A worldwide effort to find a cure for the \"Wyrm Flu\" continues. \n"
"\n"
"The dragons are dead.\n"
"\n"
"Vauclair's work was a rousing success. But over the past few months, strange things have been happening. Unexplained magical phenomena. The emergence of strange new creatures. Disasters, both natural and man-made.\n"
"\n"
"Your van rolls to a halt. If anyone can explain what's happening to the world, Vauclair can. It's time to go and find him."
msgstr ""
"匆匆​返回​哈​菲尔德​庄园​的​途中​，​你​的​旧货​车​在​崎岖不平​的​道路​上​颠簸​前行​。​沃​克莱尔​发给你​的​消息​简短​又​神秘​：​“​紧急情况​！​回​实验室​来​。​我​需要​你​帮忙​。​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​自打​沃​克莱尔​放出​“​万能​药​”​以来​的​一​年间​，​世界​产生​了​天翻地覆​的​变化​。​超企​之间​的​权力​平衡​不断​更迭​，​市场份额​此消彼长​。​全球​仍​在​努力​寻找​治愈​“​巨龙​流感​”​的​解药​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​一​族​已然​灭绝​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​沃​克莱尔​的​成果​取得​了​无与伦比​的​成功​。​但​近月来​诡异​事件​频发​：​无法解释​的​魔法​现象​，​新奇​生物​的​出现​，​以及​接踵而至​的​自然​与​人为​灾难​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​货车​缓缓​停下​。​如果说​有人​能​解开​近期​发生​的​诸多​谜团​，​那​必定​是​沃​克莱尔​。​是​时候​去​找​他​了​。\n"
"\n"
"cong1cong1 fan3hui2 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 de5 tu2zhong1，ni3 de5 jiu4huo4 che1 zai4 qi2 qu1 bu4 ping2 de5 dao4lu4 shang4 dian1bo3 qian2xing2。Wo4ke4lai2er3 fa1 gei3 ni3 de5 xiao1xi5 jian3duan3 you4 shen2mi4：“jin3 ji2 qing2 kuang4！hui2 shi2yan4shi4 lai2。wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 bang1mang2。” \n"
"\n"
"zi4da3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 fang4chu1“wan4neng2 yao4” yi3lai2 de5 yi1 nian2jian1，shi4jie4 chan3sheng1 le5 tian1fan1di4fu4 de5 bian4hua4。chao1 qi3 zhi1jian1 de5 quan2li4 ping2heng2 bu4duan4 geng1die2，shi4chang3fen4e2 ci3xiao1bi3zhang3。quan2qiu2 reng2 zai4 nu3li4 xun2zhao3 zhi4yu4“ju4long2 liu2gan3” de5 jie3yao4。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 yi1 zu2 yi3ran2 mie4jue2。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 cheng2guo3 qu3de2 le5 wu2yu3lun2bi3 de5 cheng2gong1。dan4 jin4 yue4 lai2 gui3yi4 shi4jian4 pin2fa1：wu2 fa3 jie3 shi4 de5 mo2fa3 xian4xiang4，xin1qi2 sheng1wu4 de5 chu1xian4，yi3ji2 jie1 zhong3 er2 zhi4 de5 zi4ran2 yu4 ren2wei2 zai1nan4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 huo4che1 huan3huan3 ting2xia4。ru2guo3shuo1 you3ren2 neng2 jie3kai1 jin4qi1 fa1sheng1 de5 zhu1duo1 mi2tuan2，na4 bi4ding4 shi4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。shi4 shi2hou5 qu4 zhao3 ta1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Your overconfidence is alarming, but not unexpected.\n"
"\n"
"I just hope that it doesn't wind up getting your team killed."
msgstr ""
"你​的​过度​自信​令人担忧​，​但​我​并​不​感到​意外​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只​希望​这份​自信​不会​害死​你​的​团队​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 guo4du4 zi4xin4 ling3 ren2 dan1 you1，dan4 wo3 bing4 bu4 gan3dao4 yi4wai4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 xi1wang4 zhe4 fen4 zi4xin4 bu4hui4 hai4si3 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4。"

msgid ""
"Your pal left Mr. Grinder a message about an hour ago. It had a complete "
"breakdown of your plan, including which door I should use to meet you."
msgstr ""
"你​的​朋友​大约​一​小时​前​给​“​绞肉机​”​先生​发了​条​消息​，​其中​包括​你​的​全部​计划​，​以及​我​该​来​哪​扇门​找​你​。\n"
"ni3 de5 peng2you5 da4yue1 yi1 xiao3shi2 qian2 gei3“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 fa1 le5 tiao2 xiao1xi5，qi2zhong1 bao1kuo4 ni3 de5 quan2bu4 ji4hua4，yi3ji2 wo3 gai1 lai2 na3 shan1 men2 zhao3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Your pal, Blitz. He sent Mr. Grinder a message with a complete breakdown of "
"your plan about an hour ago. "
msgstr ""
"问问​你​的​朋友​布里​茨​。​他​大约​一​小时​前​把​你​的​计划​全部​发给​了​“​绞肉机​”​先生​。\n"
"wen4 wen4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 Bu4li3ci2。ta1 da4yue1 yi1 xiao3shi2 qian2 ba3 ni3 de5 ji4hua4 quan2bu4 fa1gei3 le5“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5。"

msgid ""
"Your plan has merit. I think that it'll work. So I say, go for it - I won't "
"get in the way."
msgstr ""
"你​的​计划​有​可取之处​。​我​认为​它会​成功​。​所以​要​我​说​，​放手去做​吧​—​—​我​不会​阻碍​你​。\n"
"ni3 de5 ji4hua4 you3 ke3qu3zhi1chu4。wo3 ren4wei2 ta1 hui4 cheng2gong1。suo3yi3 yao4 wo3 shuo1，fang4 shou3 qu4 zuo4 ba1——wo3 bu4hui4 zu3ai4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Your plan may have problems, but you're right - it's our best shot. I won't "
"stop you."
msgstr ""
"你​的​计划​可能​存在​问题​，​但​你​的​想法​没错​—​—​这是​我们​最好​的​机会​。​我​不会​阻止​你​。\n"
"ni3 de5 ji4hua4 ke3neng2 cun2zai4 wen4ti2，dan4 ni3 de5 xiang3fa3 mei2cuo4——zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 zui4hao3 de5 ji1hui4。wo3 bu4hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"Your point of view is understandable. At the most fundamental level, humanity was born to reproduce and to spread. Everything it accomplishes is, in one way or another, in support of that goal. Industrialization, advances in medicine, technology, telecommunication - all of it in the pursuit of healthier, longer life spans. Increased numbers. \n"
"\n"
"Higher productivity. "
msgstr ""
"你​的​观点​可以​理解​。​从​最​根本​层面​而言​，​人类​生来​就是​为了​繁衍​与​扩张​。​人类​所​成就​的​一切​，​或多或少​都​服务​于​这个​目标​。​工业化​、​医学​进步​、​科技​发展​、​通信​技术​—​—​所有​这些​都​是​为了​追求​更​健康​、​更​长久​的​生命​。​数量​的​增长​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​生产力​的​提升​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 guan1dian3 ke3yi3 li3jie3。cong2 zui4 gen1ben3 ceng2mian4 er2yan2，ren2lei4 sheng1lai2 jiu4shi4 wei4le5 fan2yan3 yu4 kuo4zhang1。ren2lei4 suo3 cheng2jiu4 de5 yi1qie4，huo4duo1huo4shao3 dou1 fu2wu4 yu2 zhe4ge5 mu4biao1。gong1ye4hua4、yi1xue2 jin4bu4、ke1ji4 fa1zhan3、tong1xin4 ji4shu4——suo3you3 zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 wei4le5 zhui1qiu2 geng1 jian4kang1、geng1 chang2jiu3 de5 sheng1ming4。shu4liang4 de5 zeng1zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"sheng1chan3li4 de5 ti2sheng1。"

msgid "Your reputation. You get the job done."
msgstr ""
"因为​你​的​名声​。​你​办事​很​靠​谱​。\n"
"yin1wei4 ni3 de5 ming2sheng1。ni3 ban4shi4 hen3 kao4 pu3。"

msgid ""
"Your return trip to the Kreuzbasar is a lonely one. \n"
"\n"
"You spend the ride in quiet contemplation. The bugs that you were meant to plant in Aleshire's penthouse rattle in your pocket; a cheerful sound, and an intangible reminder of your decision to scrub the run.\n"
"\n"
"Your audition is over. The Lodge - whoever they are - are going to have to find themselves another shadowrunner."
msgstr ""
"你​返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​旅程​显得​分外​孤单​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一路上​，​你​都​在​默默​沉思​着​。​本该​藏​在​阿利​希尔​顶层​公寓​里​的​窃听器​此时​正在​你​口袋​里​叮当作响​；​这​欢快​的​声响​无形中​也​在​提醒​着​你​取消​这次​行动​的​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​试镜​结束​了​。​无论​“​结社​”​究竟​是​何方神圣​，​他们​都​得​另寻​一位​暗影​狂奔​者​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lu:3cheng2 xian3de5 fen4wai4 gu1dan1。\n"
"\n"
"yi1lu4shang4，ni3 dou1 zai4 mo4mo4 chen2si1 zhao2。ben3 gai1 zang4 zai4 e1 li4 xi1er3 ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 li3 de5 qie4ting1qi4 ci3shi2 zheng4zai4 ni3 kou3dai4 li3 ding1 dang1 zuo4 xiang3 ； zhe4 huan1kuai4 de5 sheng1xiang3 wu2xing2zhong1 ye3 zai4 ti2xing3 zhao2 ni3 qu3xiao1 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 de5 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 shi4jing4 jie2shu4 le5。wu2lun4“jie2she4” jiu1jing4 shi4 he2fang1shen2sheng4，ta1men5 dou1 de2 ling4 xun2 yi1 wei4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Your return trip to the Kreuzbasar is a quiet one - the train from the Frankfurter Tor is empty, save for you. There’s nothing to distract you from your thoughts.\n"
"\n"
"You’re finished with the first part of your “audition.” Luca Duerr is waiting at Cafe Cezve to administer the second."
msgstr ""
"返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​旅程​很​安静​。​从​法兰克福​门​开出​的​列车​上​只有​你​一人​，​没有​其他​任何事物​能​打断​你​的​思绪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​完成​了​“​试镜​”​的​第一​部分​。​卢卡​·​杜尔​正在​“​来​一壶​”​咖啡馆​等待​着​你​，​准备​给​你​派发​下​一个​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lu:3cheng2 hen3 an1jing4。cong2 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2 kai1 chu1 de5 lie4che1 shang4 zhi3you3 ni3 yi1 ren2，mei2you3 qi2ta1 ren4 he2 shi4 wu4 neng2 da3duan4 ni3 de5 si1xu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wan2cheng2 le5“shi4jing4” de5 di4yi1 bu4fen5。lu2ka3 · du4 er3 zheng4zai4“lai2 yi1 hu2” ka1fei1guan3 deng3dai4 zhao2 ni3，zhun3bei4 gei3 ni3 pai4 fa1 xia4 yi1ge5 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"Your runner shoulder-checks the door, and the crack of splintering plastic fills your ears.\n"
"\n"
"The door pops open."
msgstr ""
"你​手下​的​狂奔​者​用​肩膀​抵住​门​，​塑料​碎裂​的​咔嚓​声​在​耳边​响起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​门​应声​而开​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shou3xia4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 yong4 jian1bang3 di3zhu4 men2，su4liao4 sui4lie4 de5 ka1cha1 sheng1 zai4 er3 bian1 xiang3qi3。\n"
"\n"
"men2 ying4sheng1 er2 kai1。"

msgid ""
"Your runner shoulder-checks the door. The metal reverberates, but nothing "
"happens."
msgstr ""
"你​手下​的​狂奔​者​用​肩膀​撞门​。​金属​发出​回响​，​但​什么​也​没​发生​。\n"
"ni3 shou3xia4 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 yong4 jian1bang3 zhuang4 men2。jin1shu3 fa1chu1 hui2xiang3，dan4 shen2me5 ye3 mei2 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"Your runner shoulder-checks the wall, and the weak wood slats give way with "
"a crunch."
msgstr ""
"你​雇来​的​狂奔​者​用​肩膀​撞​了​一下​墙​，​本​就​不​牢固​的​木板​条​发出​嘎吱​一声​，​轰然​倒塌​。\n"
"ni3 gu4 lai2 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3 yong4 jian1bang3 zhuang4 le5 yi1xia4 qiang2，ben3 jiu4 bu4 lao2gu4 de5 mu4ban3 tiao2 fa1chu1 ga1zhi1 yi1sheng1，hong1ran2 dao3ta1。"

msgid "Your sentence is interrupted by a shrill wailing sound. An alarm."
msgstr ""
"你​的话​被​尖利​的​呼啸声​打断​了​。​警报​响​了​。\n"
"ni3 de5hua4 bei4 jian1li4 de5 hu1 xiao4 sheng1 da3duan4 le5。jing3bao4 xiang3 le5。"

msgid ""
"Your stomach drops as the gun bucks and roars in the ork's hand. \n"
"\n"
"Your view on the PDA pitches wildly, then comes to a sudden stop with a violent cracking sound. A burst of static floods the screen.\n"
"\n"
"Moments later, a dark shape falls into view with equivalent force. You hear the unmistakable sound of bone crunching against hardwood."
msgstr ""
"兽​人​手里​的​枪​剧烈​震颤​，​轰鸣​作响​。​你​的​心​也​随之​沉​了​下去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​PDA​屏幕​的​视角​剧烈​晃动起来​，​又​随着​剧烈​的​咔嚓​声​骤然​停住​。​屏幕​上​涌现出​一片​雪花​信号​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​片刻​之后​，​一个​黑影​以​同样​的​力道​坠入​你​的​视野​。​你​听见​骨头​撞击​硬​木地板​的​清晰​声响​。\n"
"\n"
"shou4 ren2 shou3li3 de5 qiang1 ju4lie4 zhen4chan4，hong1ming2 zuo4 xiang3。ni3 de5 xin1 ye3 sui2zhi1 chen2 le5 xia4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"PDA ping2mu4 de5 shi4jiao3 ju4lie4 huang3 dong4 qi3 lai2，you4 sui2zhe5 ju4lie4 de5 ka1cha1 sheng1 zhou4ran2 ting2zhu4。ping2mu4 shang4 yong3 xian4 chu1 yi1 pian1 xue3hua1 xin4hao4。\n"
"\n"
"pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，yi1ge5 hei1ying3 yi3 tong2yang4 de5 li4dao4 zhui4ru4 ni3 de5 shi4ye3。ni3 ting1jian4 gu3tou5 zhuang4ji1 ying4 mu4 de5 ban3 de5 qing1xi1 sheng1xiang3。"

msgid ""
"Your stomach lurches slightly as the elevator plummets downward, into the bowels of the Aztechnology facility. A faint but omnipresent thrumming sound raises the hair on the back of your neck.\n"
"\n"
"The deeper you go, the more certain you become: this place is vibrating with power, both from the generators, and from... something else."
msgstr ""
"随着​电梯​直坠​而​下​，​深入​阿兹特​科技​设施​的​腹地​，​你​的​胃部​也​开始​微微​翻腾​。​隐约​却​无处不在​的​嗡​鸣声​令​你​不禁​寒毛​倒​竖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​越​往下沉​，​你​越是​确信​：​这个​地方​正因​能量​而​震颤​，​既​来自​发电机​，​也​来自​……​某种​其他​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 dian4ti1 zhi2 zhui4 er2 xia4，shen1ru4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 she4shi1 de5 fu4di4，ni3 de5 wei4 bu4 ye3 kai1shi3 wei1wei1 fan1teng2。yin3yue1 que4 wu2chu4bu4zai4 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1 ling3 ni3 bu4jin1 han2mao2 dao3 shu4。\n"
"\n"
"yue4 wang3 xia4 chen2，ni3 yue4 shi4 que4xin4：zhe4ge5 di4fang1 zheng1 yin1 neng2liang4 er2 zhen4chan4，ji4 lai2zi4 fa1dian4ji1，ye3 lai2zi4……mou3zhong3 qi2ta1 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"Your subway car is empty on the return trip to the Kreuzbasar. This stretch of the sprawling U-Bahn tunnel system doesn’t see much use, it seems. At least not at this hour.\n"
"\n"
"As the train rattles on, you find yourself lost in thought. Old memories creep, unbidden, to the forefront of your mind. Memories of Monika in the old days, and the crew that you used to run with. Memories of success and failure, of wealth and poverty, of good times and bad.\n"
"\n"
"Halfway back to the Kreuzbasar, you are jolted out of your reverie by a buzzing sound. Your commlink. You’re receiving a call."
msgstr ""
"返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​地铁​车厢​里​空无一人​。​这​段​纵横交错​的​柏林​地铁​隧道​似乎​鲜少​有人​使用​，​至少​在​这个​时段​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​随着​列车​哐当​前行​，​你​的​思绪​渐渐​飘远​。​往事​如​潮水般​涌​上​心头​—​—​昔日​与​莫妮卡​的​点滴​，​曾经​并肩作战​的​伙伴​们​。​那些​成功​与​失败​，​富足​与​贫瘠​，​欢愉​与​苦涩​的​记忆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​行至​克洛伊​茨​集市​中途​，​一阵​嗡​鸣声​将​你​惊醒​。​通讯​链​在​震动​，​有人​来电​。\n"
"\n"
"fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 di4tie3 che1xiang1 li3 kong1wu2yi1ren2。zhe4 duan4 zong4heng2jiao1cuo4 de5 bo2lin2 di4tie3 sui4dao4 si4hu1 xian3shao3 you3ren2 shi3yong4，zhi4shao3 zai4 zhe4ge5 shi2duan4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"sui2zhe5 lie4che1 kuang1 dang1 qian2xing2，ni3 de5 si1xu4 jian4jian4 piao1 yuan3。wang3shi4 ru2 chao2 shui3 ban1 yong3 shang4 xin1tou2——xi1ri4 yu4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 dian3di1，ceng2jing1 bing4jian1zuo4zhan4 de5 huo3ban4 men5。na4xie1 cheng2gong1 yu4 shi1bai4，fu4zu2 yu4 pin2ji2，huan1yu2 yu4 ku3se4 de5 ji4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"xing2 zhi4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhong1tu2，yi1zhen4 weng1 ming2 sheng1 jiang1 ni3 jing1xing3。tong1xun4 lian4 zai4 zhen4dong4，you3ren2 lai2dian4。"

msgid "Your sudden departure from the military makes a lot more sense now."
msgstr ""
"怪不得​你​突然​离开​了​军队​呢​。\n"
"guai4bu5de5 ni3 tu1ran2 li2kai1 le5 jun1dui4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"Your team makes its way back to the nearest U-Bahn station. Twenty minutes later, you're on a return trip to the Kreuzbasar, leaving the filth of Drogenkippe far behind. But the image of Green Winters' twisted corpse continues to linger in your mind.\n"
"\n"
"You lift one of the discs that you pulled from Winters' safe to the light. Reflections dance off of its surface.\n"
"\n"
"With luck, you'll soon have the answers that you've been looking for.\n"
msgstr ""
"你​的​团队​返回​最近​的​地铁站​。​二十分钟​后​，​你​已经​搭上​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​回程​列车​，​将毒​坑区​的​一切​污秽​抛​在​身后​。​但​格林​·​温特斯​扭曲​的​尸体​依旧​在​你​的​脑海中​挥之不去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​将​自己​从​温特斯​的​保险箱​里​取出​来​的​一张​碟片​举到​光线​下​。​形形色色​的​反射​光线​在​它​的​表面​起舞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​运气​好​的话​，​你​很快​就​能​得到​一直​以来​寻找​的​答案​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 fan3hui2 zui4jin4 de5 di4tie3zhan4。er4 shi2 fen4 zhong1 hou4，ni3 yi3jing1 da1 shang4 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 hui2cheng2 lie4che1，jiang1 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 yi1qie4 wu1hui4 pao1 zai4 shen1hou4。dan4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 niu3qu1 de5 shi1ti3 yi1jiu4 zai4 ni3 de5 nao3 hai3 zhong4 hui1zhi1bu4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 zi4ji3 cong2 Wen1te4si1 de5 bao3xian3xiang1 li3 qu3chu1 lai2 de5 yi1 zhang1 die2pian4 ju3 dao4 guang1xian4 xia4。xing2xing2se4se4 de5 fan3she4 guang1xian4 zai4 ta1 de5 biao3mian4 qi3 wu3。\n"
"\n"
"yun4qi5 hao3 de5hua4，ni3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 neng2 de2dao4 yi1zhi2 yi3lai2 xun2zhao3 de5 da2an4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Your third eye flits open, casting the world into a shimmering sea of grayness.\n"
"\n"
"Cautiously, you peer into Absinthe's aura."
msgstr ""
"你​的​天眼​倏然​睁开​，​将​世界​投进​一片​闪烁​的​灰蒙蒙​海洋​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​谨慎​地​窥探​着​苦艾​酒​的​灵光​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tian1yan3 shu1ran2 zheng1kai1，jiang1 shi4jie4 tou2 jin4 yi1 pian1 shan3shuo4 de5 hui1meng1meng1 hai3yang2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jin3shen4 de5 kui1tan4 zhao2 ku3ai4 jiu3 de5 ling2guang1。"

msgid ""
"Your third eye slides open revealing the tubes and machinery of Vauclair's "
"infusion chamber as a cold, dead gray."
msgstr ""
"你​缓缓​睁开​天眼​，​揭示​出沃​克莱尔​的​注入​舱内​一片​冷酷​死寂​的​灰色​管路​与​机械​装置​。\n"
"ni3 huan3huan3 zheng1kai1 tian1yan3，jie1shi4 chu1 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 zhu4ru4 cang1 nei4 yi1 pian1 leng3ku4 si3ji4 de5 hui1se4 guan3lu4 yu4 ji1xie4 zhuang1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"Your third eye slides open, and the world shifts to gray. Buildings, streets, cars - all gray.\n"
"\n"
"In your peripheral vision you can see Eiger, her outline pulsing a warm glow."
msgstr ""
"你​缓缓​睁开​天眼​，​眼前​的​世界​，​无论是​建筑​、​街道​还是​车辆​，​随即​变为​一片​混沌​的​灰色​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​通过​余光​，​你​看到​艾格尔​的​轮廓​正泛​着​温暖​的​光晕​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 huan3huan3 zheng1kai1 tian1yan3，yan3qian2 de5 shi4jie4，wu2 lun2 shi4 jian4zhu4、jie1dao4 hai2shi5 che1liang4，sui2ji2 bian4wei2 yi1 pian1 hun4dun4 de5 hui1se4。\n"
"\n"
"tong1guo4 yu2guang1，ni3 kan4dao4 Ai4ge2er3 de5 lun2kuo4 zheng1 fan4 zhao2 wen1nuan3 de5 guang1yun4。"

msgid ""
"Your third eye slides open, and you find yourself starting at... nothing.\n"
"\n"
"Where the elf's aura should be, an hazy gray smear undulates instead."
msgstr ""
"你​缓缓​睁开​天眼​，​发现自己​的​面前​……​空无一物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​精灵​的​灵光​本该​存在​之​处​，​此刻​却​只有​一片​朦胧​的​灰色​渲染​在​翻涌​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 huan3huan3 zheng1kai1 tian1yan3，fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 de5 mian4qian2……kong1 wu2 yi1 wu4。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 de5 ling2guang1 ben3 gai1 cun2zai4 zhi1 chu3，ci3ke4 que4 zhi3you3 yi1 pian1 meng2long2 de5 hui1se4 xuan4ran3 zai4 fan1yong3。"

msgid ""
"Your third eye slides open. Instantly, the drab ugliness of the mundane "
"world is washed away, obliterated by the glowing energies of the astral "
"plane."
msgstr ""
"你​缓缓​睁开​天眼​，​闪闪发光​的​星界​能量​顿时​将​凡俗​世界​缺乏​生机​的​丑陋​荡涤​一空​。\n"
"ni3 huan3huan3 zheng1kai1 tian1yan3，shan3 shan3 fa1 guang1 de5 xing1 jie4 neng2liang4 dun4shi2 jiang1 fan2su2 shi4jie4 que1fa2 sheng1ji1 de5 chou3lou4 dang4di2 yi1kong1。"

msgid ""
"Your third eye slides shut again - involuntarily this time.\n"
"\n"
"Back in the material world, you find yourself rubbing your temples against a sudden headache. It feels like eyestrain, only a thousand times worse."
msgstr ""
"你​的​天眼​又​闭上​了​—​—​这次​是​不由自主​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​回到​现实​后​，​你​发现自己​正​揉​着​太阳穴​，​想要​平复​一阵​突如其来​的​头痛​。​感觉​像是​眼睛​疲劳​，​只是​痛苦​加剧​了​千倍​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tian1yan3 you4 bi4shang5 le5——zhe4 ci4 shi4 bu4you2zi4zhu3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"hui2dao4 xian4shi2 hou4，ni3 fa1 xian4 zi4 ji3 zheng1 rou2 zhao2 tai4yang2xue2，xiang3yao4 ping2fu4 yi1zhen4 tu1ru2qi2lai2 de5 tou2tong4。gan3jue2 xiang4 shi4 yan3jing5 pi2lao2，zhi3shi4 tong4ku3 jia1ju4 le5 qian1 bei4。"

msgid ""
"Your third eye slips open, revealing the hidden world of the astral plane. "
"Several of the buttons on the keypad glimmer faintly."
msgstr ""
"你​的​天眼​无声无息​地​张开​，​隐藏​着​的​星界​位面​在​你​眼前​显现出来​。​键盘​上​的​几个​按键​正​微弱​地​闪着光​。\n"
"ni3 de5 tian1yan3 wu2sheng1wu2xi1 de5 zhang1kai1，yin3cang2 zhao2 de5 xing1 jie4 wei4mian4 zai4 ni3 yan3qian2 xian3 xian4 chu1 lai2。jian4pan2 shang4 de5 ji3ge5 an4jian4 zheng1 wei1ruo4 de5 shan3 zhao2 guang1。"

msgid ""
"Your time has come, fool.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns to the group that just entered the room.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Kill them."
msgstr ""
"你​的​死期​到​了​，​蠢货​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​转向​刚​进入​房间​的​那群人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​杀​了​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 si3qi1 dao4 le5，chun3huo4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 gang1 jin4ru4 fang2jian1 de5 na4 qun2 ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sha1 le5 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"Your tongue feels strangely thick, and to your horror, it begins moving of "
"its own accord. Crawling, probing, straining against the roof of your mouth."
" Struggling for release."
msgstr ""
"你​的​舌头​莫名​地​变得​厚重​，​更令​你​惊恐​的​是​，​它​竟​开始​自行​蠕动​。​它​在​口腔​里​爬行​、​探寻​，​用力​抵住​上颚​，​挣扎​着​想要​挣脱​束缚​。\n"
"ni3 de5 she2tou5 mo4ming2 de5 bian4de5 hou4zhong4，geng1 ling3 ni3 jing1kong3 de5 shi4，ta1 jing4 kai1shi3 zi4xing2 ru2dong4。ta1 zai4 kou3qiang1 li3 pa2xing2、tan4xun2，yong4li4 di3zhu4 shang4 e4，zheng1zha2 zhao2 xiang3yao4 zheng4tuo1 shu4fu4。"

msgid ""
"Your trip back to the Kreuzbasar is a restless one. Now that APEX has been dealt with, the window of opportunity that you’ve been waiting for has opened. The Harfeld Manor is vulnerable. \n"
"\n"
"The video feed that the AI showed you circles over and over in your head. Vauclair, and Audran, and the strange woman in the containment device. The revelation that Vauclair runs the Harfeld estate. And his assertion that… *something*... was set to happen tonight.\n"
"\n"
"The train glides to a stop. You push through the doors and onto the platform. There’s no time to waste."
msgstr ""
"返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​路上​，​你​始终​心绪不宁​。​APEX​已​被​解决​，​你​一直​等待​的​良机​终于​降临​。​哈​菲尔德​庄园​此刻​正​空门​大开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​人工智能​向​你​展示​的​视频​画面​在​你​脑海中​不断​重播​。​沃​克莱尔​、​奥​德兰​，​还有​那个​被困​在​收容​装置​里​的​陌生​女子​；​沃​克莱尔​掌控​哈​菲尔德​庄园​的​事实​；​以及​他​断言​……​今晚​将会​*​有事​*​发生​的​话语​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​列车​缓缓​停下​。​你​推开​车门​，​踏上​站台​。​已经​没有​时间​可以​浪费​了​。\n"
"\n"
"fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lu4shang5，ni3 shi3zhong1 xin1xu4bu4ning2。APEX yi3 bei4 jie3jue2，ni3 yi1zhi2 deng3dai4 de5 liang2ji1 zhong1yu2 jiang4lin2。Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 ci3ke4 zheng1 kong1 men2 da4kai1。\n"
"\n"
"ren2gong1zhi4neng2 xiang4 ni3 zhan3shi4 de5 shi4pin2 hua4mian4 zai4 ni3 nao3 hai3 zhong4 bu4duan4 chong2bo1。Wo4ke4lai2er3、Ao4de2lan2，hai2you3 na4ge5 bei4kun4 zai4 shou1rong2 zhuang1zhi4 li3 de5 mo4sheng1 nu:3zi3 ； Wo4ke4lai2er3 zhang3kong4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2 de5 shi4shi2 ； yi3ji2 ta1 duan4yan2……jin1wan3 jiang1hui4*you3shi4*fa1sheng1 de5 hua4yu3。\n"
"\n"
"lie4che1 huan3huan3 ting2xia4。ni3 tui1kai1 che1men2，ta4shang4 zhan4tai2。yi3jing1 mei2you3 shi2jian1 ke3yi3 lang4fei4 le5。"

msgid ""
"Your trip back to the Kreuzbasar is an unsettling one. Every time you close your eyes, horrible visions flash through your mind. Bodies torn apart and by surgical machines. Mouths frozen open in neverending screams. Walls coated floor-to-ceiling in congealing blood. And through it all, the smiling face of Thorvald Enstad.\n"
"\n"
"You blink. Banish the visions. They’re behind you now. You’re on your way home."
msgstr ""
"返回​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​路上​，​你​始终​心绪不宁​。​每当​你​闭上​双眼​，​可怕​的​景象​便​在​脑海中​闪现​：​被​手术​机械​撕碎​的​尸体​；​冻结成​半张​的​嘴​发出​永无止境​的​尖叫​；​被​凝固​鲜血​覆盖​的​整面​墙体​；​还有​那​自始至终​挥之不去​的​，​托​瓦尔德​·​恩​斯塔德​的​微笑​脸庞​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​眨​了​眨眼​，​驱散​那些​幻象​。​它们​已​被​你​抛​在​了​身后​。​现在​的​你​已经​踏上​归途​。\n"
"\n"
"fan3hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 lu4shang5，ni3 shi3zhong1 xin1xu4bu4ning2。mei3dang1 ni3 bi4shang5 shuang1yan3，ke3pa4 de5 jing3xiang4 bian4 zai4 nao3 hai3 zhong4 shan3xian4：bei4 shou3shu4 ji1xie4 si1sui4 de5 shi1ti3 ； dong4 jie1 cheng2 ban4 zhang1 de5 zui3 fa1chu1 yong3wu2zhi3jing4 de5 jian1jiao4 ； bei4 ning2gu4 xian1xue4 fu4gai4 de5 zheng3 mian4 qiang2 ti3 ； hai2you3 na4 zi4shi3zhi4zhong1 hui1zhi1bu4qu4 de5，tuo1 wa3er3de2 · en1 si1 ta3 de2 de5 wei1xiao4 lian3pang2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zha3 le5 zha3yan3，qu1san4 na4xie1 huan4xiang4。ta1men5 yi3 bei4 ni3 pao1 zai4 le5 shen1hou4。xian4zai4 de5 ni3 yi3jing1 ta4shang4 gui1tu2。"

msgid "Your true face? What does that mean?"
msgstr ""
"你​的​真容​？​这是​什么​意思​？\n"
"ni3 de5 zhen1rong2？zhe4 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid ""
"Your truth, maybe.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice goes quiet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What I saw was real."
msgstr ""
"只是​你​所谓​的​真相​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​变得​平静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​那时​看到​的​一切都是​真实​的​。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3shi4 ni3 suo3wei4 de5 zhen1xiang4 er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 ping2jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 na4shi2 kan4dao4 de5 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 zhen1shi2 de5。"

msgid "Your turn, Blitz. Show us what you've got."
msgstr ""
"该​你​了​，​布里​茨​。​给​我们​露一手​吧​。\n"
"gai1 ni3 le5，Bu4li3ci2。gei3 wo3men5 lou4yi1shou3 ba1。"

msgid "Your use of exclusionary language is telling. \"Even\" humans are allowed?"
msgstr ""
"你​使用​的​排斥性​语言​很能​说明​问题​。​什么​叫​“​甚至​”​人类​也​可以​？\n"
"ni3 shi3yong4 de5 pai2 chi4 xing4 yu3yan2 hen3 neng2 shuo1ming2 wen4ti2。shen2me5 jiao4“shen4zhi4” ren2lei4 ye3 ke3yi3？"

msgid ""
"Your usin' her face is an *insult* to the real Monika, monster.\n"
"\n"
"Now drop the act, and tell us what you want."
msgstr ""
"你​顶​着​莫妮卡​的​脸​简直​是​对​她​的​*​侮辱​*​，​你​这​怪物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别演​了​，​告诉​我们​你​想要​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ding3 zhao2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 lian3 jian3zhi2 shi4 dui4 ta1 de5*wu3ru3*，ni3 zhe4 guai4wu5。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 yan3 le5，gao4su4 wo3men5 ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"Your vision swims, and the screen of your PDA seems to fade away. The impact"
" of what you've just witnessed hammers you in the gut, over and over again."
msgstr ""
"你​只觉​眼前​一阵​天旋地转​，​PDA​的​屏幕​仿佛​渐渐​黯淡​。​刚刚​目睹​的​一切​如​重锤​般​反复​敲打​着​你​的​五脏六腑​。\n"
"ni3 zhi3 jiao4 yan3qian2 yi1zhen4 tian1xuan2di4zhuan4，PDA de5 ping2mu4 fang3fu2 jian4jian4 an4dan4。gang1gang5 mu4du3 de5 yi1qie4 ru2 chong2 chui2 ban1 fan3fu4 qiao1da3 zhao2 ni3 de5 wu3zang4liu4fu3。"

msgid ""
"Your words are met with an incomprehensible screech. In your peripheral vision, you catch a flurry of motion.\n"
"\n"
"Your elvish companion is moving, making a beeline toward James. Jana is hanging off of him, trying to slow him down, but he barely seems to notice.\n"
"\n"
"With a kick, he sends her tumbling to the ground, then reaches for his weapon."
msgstr ""
"一声​刺耳​的​尖叫​打断​了​你​的​话语​。​你​用​余光​瞥见​一阵​急促​的​动静​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​精灵​同伴​正​直奔​詹姆斯​而​去​。​简娜​挂​在​他​身上​，​试图​拖慢​他​的​脚步​，​但​他​似乎​根本​没​注意​到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​一脚​将​她​踹​倒​在​地​，​随即​伸手​要​拔出​武器​。\n"
"\n"
"yi1sheng1 ci4er3 de5 jian1jiao4 da3duan4 le5 ni3 de5 hua4yu3。ni3 yong4 yu2guang1 pie1jian4 yi1zhen4 ji2cu4 de5 dong4jing4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 jing1ling2 tong2ban4 zheng1 zhi2ben4 zhan1mu3si1 er2 qu4。Jian3na4 gua4 zai4 ta1 shen1shang5，shi4tu2 tuo1man4 ta1 de5 jiao3bu4，dan4 ta1 si4hu1 gen1ben3 mei2 zhu4yi4 dao4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi1 jiao3 jiang1 ta1 chuai4 dao3 zai4 de5，sui2ji2 shen1shou3 yao4 ba2 chu1 wu3qi4。"

msgid ""
"Your words don't seem to have much impact.\n"
"\n"
"The elf's scowl deepens."
msgstr ""
"你​的话​似乎​没什么​效果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​精灵​的​皱眉​更深​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5hua4 si4hu1 mei2shen2me5 xiao4guo3。\n"
"\n"
"jing1ling2 de5 zhou4mei2 geng1shen1 le5。"

msgid ""
"Your workstation and mission computer. The command center for your team's operations, and your last link to the memory of Monika Schäfer. \n"
"\n"
"Her thoughts and words live on in the machine. At times, it's easy to forget that she's gone."
msgstr ""
"你​的​工作站​和​任务​电脑​。​这是​掌管​你​队伍​行动​的​指挥​中心​，​也​是​你​与​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​的​记忆​之间​的​最后​联系​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​思想​和​话语​永远​活在​这台​机器​里​。​有时​，​你​甚至​会​轻易​忘记​她​已经​不​在​了​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 gong1zuo4zhan4 he4 ren4wu5 dian4nao3。zhe4 shi4 zhang3guan3 ni3 dui4wu3 xing2dong4 de5 zhi3hui1 zhong1xin1，ye3 shi4 ni3 yu4 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 de5 ji4yi4 zhi1jian1 de5 zui4hou4 lian2xi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 si1xiang3 he4 hua4yu3 yong3yuan3 huo2 zai4 zhe4 tai2 ji1qi4 li3。you3shi2，ni3 shen4zhi4 hui4 qing1yi4 wang4ji4 ta1 yi3jing1 bu4 zai4 le5。"

msgid "Your world, maybe. Not mine."
msgstr ""
"你们​的​世界​也许​是​这样​。​我​的​世界​可不是​。\n"
"ni3men5 de5 shi4jie4 ye3xu3 shi4 zhe4yang4。wo3 de5 shi4jie4 ke3bu5shi4。"

msgid "You’re a lunatic, Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"你​是​个​疯子​，​沃​克莱尔​。\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 feng1zi5，Wo4ke4lai2er3。"

msgid ""
"You’re a valued member of this team, Eiger. We need you now more than ever. "
"I’m glad that you’re on my side."
msgstr ""
"艾格尔​，​你​是​团队​的​重要​一员​。​就​目前​而言​，​你​比​以往​更加​不可或缺​。​我​很​高兴​你​能​站​在​我​这边​。\n"
"Ai4ge2er3，ni3 shi4 tuan2dui4 de5 zhong4yao4 yi1yuan2。jiu4 mu4qian2 er2yan2，ni3 bi3 yi3wang3 geng4jia1 bu4ke3huo4que1。wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 neng2 zhan4 zai4 wo3 zhe4bian1。"

msgid "You’re going to have to pay for this, you know."
msgstr ""
"你​要​为此​付出代价​。\n"
"ni3 yao4 wei4ci3 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。"

msgid "You’re not lost. You said you would begin again, remember?"
msgstr ""
"你​没有​输​。​你​不是​说​你​还要​再度​开始​吗​？\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 shu1。ni3 bu4shi4 shuo1 ni3 hai2 yao4 zai4du4 kai1shi3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"You’re right. I was out of line. And I won’t question your competence again… not in front of the others, at least.\n"
"\n"
"But I won’t lie. I still have concerns about you."
msgstr ""
"你​说得对​，​是​我​越线​了​。​今后​我​不会​再​质疑​你​的​能力​了​……​至少​当着​他们​的​面​不会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​老实​说​，​我​对​你​还是​有些​担忧​。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，shi4 wo3 yue4 xian4 le5。jin1hou4 wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 zhi4yi2 ni3 de5 neng2li4 le5……zhi4shao3 dang1zhe5 ta1men5 de5 mian4 bu4hui4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 dui4 ni3 hai2shi5 you3xie1 dan1you1。"

msgid ""
"You’re telling me! I’ve had to step over three of you guys tonight! \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It can’t be comfortable sleeping under those desks. The mom in me wants to go get you blankets, but I don't think that Management would approve."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​！​我​今天​晚上​都​踩​到​你们​三个​同事​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​睡​在​桌子​底下​肯定​不​舒服​。​我心​说​给​你们​拿​几张​毛毯​吧​，​但​我​猜​管理处​肯定​不​同意​。\n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5！wo3 jin1tian1 wan3shang5 dou1 cai3 dao4 ni3men5 san1 ge4 tong2shi4 le5！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shui4 zai4 zhuo1zi5 di3xia5 ken3ding4 bu4 shu1fu5。wo3 xin1 shuo1 gei3 ni3men5 na2 ji1 zhang1 mao2tan3 ba1，dan4 wo3 cai1 guan3 li3 chu3 ken3ding4 bu4 tong2yi4。"

msgid "You’re tellin’ me. They don’t pay us enough for this."
msgstr ""
"可不是​吗​。​我们​拿​这点​钱​根本​不够​。\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。wo3men5 na2 zhe4 dian3 qian2 gen1ben3 bu4gou4。"

msgid "You’ve gotta be kidding me."
msgstr ""
"你​在​逗我​吧​。\n"
"ni3 zai4 dou4 wo3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"You’ve probably got family in Berlin, Audran. You don’t want to see them "
"die, do you?"
msgstr ""
"奥​德兰​，​你​在​柏林​也​有​家人​吧​。​你​想​看着​他们​一起​送死​吗​？\n"
"Ao4de2lan2，ni3 zai4 bo2lin2 ye3 you3 jia1ren2 ba1。ni3 xiang3 kan4 zhao2 ta1men5 yi1qi3 song4si3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"Yow. When APEX went offline, the security systems around here got *really* unhappy.  \n"
"\n"
"Think they're lonely?"
msgstr ""
"哟​。​APEX​离线​时​，​这里​的​安保​系统​肯定​*​非常​*​不爽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​它们​是​寂寞​了​？\n"
"\n"
"yo1。APEX li2xian4 shi2，zhe4li3 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3 ken3ding4*fei1chang2*bu4shuang3。\n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ta1men5 shi4 ji4mo4 le5？"

msgid ""
"Yuli didn't pull any punches, so *I* didn't pull any punches.\n"
"\n"
"And if you have a problem with that, you can go and get fucked."
msgstr ""
"既然​他​自己​要​把​脸​凑上来​，​那​*​我​*​不​打​岂​不是​对不起​他​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​对此​有​什么​意见​，​那​就​滚​你​妈​的​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ta1 zi4ji3 yao4 ba3 lian3 cou4 shang4 lai2，na4*wo3*bu4 da3 qi3 bu4shi4 dui4bu5qi3 ta1？\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 shen2me5 yi4jian4，na4 jiu4 gun3 ni3 ma1 de5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"Yuli seemed to find all of this hilarious.\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I know that he was pushing my buttons on purpose. And yeah, I know that he was trying to make me lose control. But the hell with it - he deserved a good beating."
