"尤里​似乎​觉得​这些​事​非常​滑稽​有趣​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​，​我​知道​他​是​故意​挑衅​我​，​想​让​我​情绪​失控​。​但​去​他妈的​，​不揍​他​一顿​我​就是​不爽​。\n"
"\n"
"You2li3 si4hu1 jue2de5 zhe4xie1 shi4 fei1chang2 hua2ji1 you3qu4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4，wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 shi4 gu4yi4 tiao3xin4 wo3，xiang3 rang4 wo3 qing2xu4 shi1kong4。dan4 qu4 ta1ma1de5，bu4 zou4 ta1 yi1 dun4 wo3 jiu4shi4 bu4shuang3。"

msgid ""
"Yuli.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Eiger leans back, shaking her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You wouldn't roll over on an employer this easily. Your rep tells me that much."
msgstr ""
"尤里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​艾格尔仰​回​身子​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​可能​这么​轻易​就​供出​自己​的​雇主​。​毕竟​你​也​是​个​有​名声​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"You2li3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yang3 hui2 shen1zi5，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 ke3neng2 zhe4me5 qing1yi4 jiu4 gong1 chu1 zi4ji3 de5 gu4zhu3。bi4jing4 ni3 ye3 shi4 ge4 you3 ming2sheng1 de5 ren2。"

