"Y’know, there’s nothing easier - or more hollow - than an empty compliment.\n"
"\n"
"It’s cheap manipulation, and I can always see right through it."
msgstr ""
"这种​空洞​的​吹捧​来得​最是​简单​，​也​最​是​虚伪​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不过​是​廉价​的​操纵​手段​，​我​一眼​就​能​看穿​。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 kong1dong4 de5 chui1peng3 lai2de5 zui4shi4 jian3dan1，ye3 zui4 shi4 xu1wei3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4guo4 shi4 lian2jia4 de5 cao1zong4 shou3duan4，wo3 yi1yan3 jiu4 neng2 kan4chuan1。"

