msgid ""
"{{CC}}Biotech: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} “Home remedies,” eh? "
"Those are some pretty fancy home remedies. {{GM}}You point to some milspec "
"medkits and drugs in the corner of the man's shop.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​“​家用​药物​”​是​吧​？​这些​东西​可够​高级​的​。​{{GM}}​你​指​了​指​那​人​商店​角落里​的​一些​军用​医疗​箱​和​药品​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}}“jia1yong4 yao4wu4” shi4 ba1？zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 ke3 gou4 gao1ji2 de5。{{GM}} ni3 zhi3 le5 zhi3 na4 ren2 shang1dian4 jiao3 la4 li3 de5 yi1xie1 jun1yong4 yi1liao2 xiang1 he4 yao4pin3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Biotech: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}}{{GM}}Read the "
"charts.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​阅读​病历​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} {{GM}} yue4du2 bing4li4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{CC}}Biotech: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} Study the entry."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​研究​条目​。\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} yan2jiu1 tiao2mu4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Biotech: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} Study the entry."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​研究​条目​。\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} yan2jiu1 tiao2mu4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Biotech: 1{{/CC}} Do you know what happens to long-term cram abusers?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​1​{{/CC}}​你​知道​长期​滥用​“​超感​”​的​人会​怎么样​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：1 {{/CC}} ni3 zhi1dao4 chang2qi1 lan4yong4“chao1 gan3” de5 ren2 hui4 zen3me5yang4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Biotech: 2{{/CC}} {{GM}}Examine the Cyberzombie's "
"augmentations.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​2​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​检查​赛博​僵尸​的​殖装​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：2 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jian3cha2 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 de5 zhi2 zhuang1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Biotech: 3{{/CC}} {{GM}}Evaluate the damage to see what you can do to "
"help.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​3​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​估量​她​的​伤势​，​看看​你​能​为​她​做点​什么​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} gu1liang5 ta1 de5 shang1shi4，kan4kan5 ni3 neng2 wei2 ta1 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{CC}}Biotech: 3{{/CC}} {{GM}}Examine his ears.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​3​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​检查​他​的​耳朵​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jian3cha2 ta1 de5 er3duo5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Biotech: 5{{/CC}} Your Panacea is built on the back of an RNA virus, "
"and yet you aren't worried about the possibility of mutation?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生物科技​：​5​{{/CC}}​你​的​“​万能​药​”​是​基于​RNA​病毒​开发​的​，​难道​你​不​担心​它​可能​发生​变异​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1wu4ke1ji4：5 {{/CC}} ni3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4” shi4 ji1yu2 RNA bing4du2 kai1fa1 de5，nan2dao4 ni3 bu4 dan1xin1 ta1 ke3neng2 fa1sheng1 bian4yi4 ma5？"

msgid "{{CC}}Bioware Samples{{/CC}} I do, in fact. It's right here."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​生体​改造​样本​{{/CC}}​是​的​。​就​在​这里​。\n"
"{{CC}} sheng1 ti3 gai3zao4 yang4ben3 {{/CC}} shi4 de5。jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Body: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} {{GM}}Suffer through "
"it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​体质​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​硬挺​过去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} ti3zhi4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} {{GM}} ying4ting3 guo4qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{CC}}BrightLight System Cybereye{{/CC}} {{GM}}Blind him.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​强光​系统​赛博眼​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​闪​瞎​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} jiang4 guang1 xi4tong3 sai4 bo2 yan3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} shan3 xia1 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}CSTDN Keycard{{/CC}} {{GM}}Swipe the keycard that you found in the "
"dumpster.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​CSTDN​门禁卡​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​刷​你​在​垃圾箱​里​找到​的​门禁卡​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} CSTDN men2 jin1 ka3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} shua1 ni3 zai4 la1ji1xiang1 li3 zhao3dao4 de5 men2 jin1 ka3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Afraid I can't help "
"you. They didn't tell me much... just that they were doubling patrols, and "
"that they wanted me out here."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​恐怕​我​帮不了​你​。​他们​没​告诉​我​多少​……​只​说​要​将​巡逻队​翻倍​，​以及​让​我​到​这来​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} kong3pa4 wo3 bang1 bu4 le5 ni3。ta1men5 mei2 gao4su4 wo3 duo1shao3……zhi3 shuo1 yao4 jiang1 xun2luo2dui4 fan1bei4，yi3ji2 rang4 wo3 dao4 zhe4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Cool down, we're on "
"the same side here. This is a Dispatch problem, I'm sure of it... I don't "
"envy you guys having to work with them every day. "
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​冷静​点​，​咱们​是​一边​的​。​这​肯定​是​调度​中心​出​了​问题​……​每天​和​那​帮​家伙​一起​工作​，​真是​难​为​你们​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} leng3jing4 dian3，zan2men5 shi4 yi1bian1 de5。zhe4 ken3ding4 shi4 diao4du4 zhong1xin1 chu1 le5 wen4ti2……mei3tian1 he4 na4 bang1 jia1huo5 yi1qi3 gong1zuo4，zhen1shi5 nan2 wei2 ni3men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Don't give in to "
"despair, Philip Rex! For this is *your* quest - to find the legendary "
"missing episode!"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​不要​向​绝望​屈服​，​菲利普​·​雷克斯​！​因为​这是​*​你​的​*​任务​—​—​找到​传说​中​的​失踪​剧集​！\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} bu4yao4 xiang4 jue2wang4 qu1fu2，fei1li4pu3 · lei2ke4si1！yin1wei4 zhe4 shi4*ni3 de5*ren4wu5——zhao3dao4 chuan2shuo1 zhong4 de5 shi1zong1 ju4ji2！"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Don't worry about the"
" scan, I have a friend in payroll. She'll take care of the record-keeping "
"for us."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​不用​担心​刷卡​的​事​，​我​在​薪资​部有​个​朋友​。​她​会​帮​我们​处理​打卡​记录​事宜​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} bu4yong4 dan1xin1 shua1ka3 de5 shi4，wo3 zai4 xin1zi1 bu4 you3 ge4 peng2you5。ta1 hui4 bang1 wo3men5 chu3li3 da3ka3 ji4lu4 shi4yi2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Hey, man. Relax. I'm "
"sure that it's all going to work itself out."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​哎呀​，​放松​点​。​事情​肯定​会​顺利​解决​的​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} ai1ya1，fang4song1 dian3。shi4qing5 ken3ding4 hui4 shun4li4 jie3jue2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} I think in the Flux, "
"folks like us need to stick together. Why stay strangers? Maybe we can come "
"to an arrangement that can benefit both of our kieze."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​在​动荡​带​，​像​我们​这种​人得​团结​在​一起​。​干嘛​这么​见外​呢​？​也许​我们​能为​彼此​的​街区​找出​互惠互利​的​解决方案​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} zai4 dong4dang4 dai4，xiang4 wo3men5 zhe4zhong3 ren2 de2 tuan2jie2 zai4 yi1qi3。gan4ma2 zhe4me5 jian4wai4 ni2？ye3xu3 wo3men5 neng2 wei2 bi3ci3 de5 jie1qu1 zhao3chu1 hu4 hui4 hu4 li4 de5 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Look, I'd love to "
"chat, but you should really get moving. I've seen Central come down on "
"people for insubordination. It isn't pretty."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​我​倒​是​乐意​继续​聊​会儿​，​但​你​真该​赶紧​走​了​。​我见​过​指挥部​如何​处置​不​服从命令​的​人​，​那​场面​可不​好看​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} wo3 dao3 shi4 le4yi4 ji4xu4 liao2 hui4r5，dan4 ni3 zhen1 gai1 gan3jin3 zou3 le5。wo3 jian4 guo4 zhi3hui1bu4 ru2he2 chu3zhi4 bu4 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3 de5 ren2，na4 chang3mian4 ke3bu5 hao3kan4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Not soykaf. I want "
"the good stuff... the stuff that you don't advertise."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​不要​豆​咖​。​我​想要​点好​东西​……​就是​你​不会​随便​给​人​推销​的​那种​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} bu4yao4 dou4 ka1。wo3 xiang3yao4 dian3 hao3 dong1xi1……jiu4shi4 ni3 bu4hui4 sui2bian4 gei3 ren2 tui1xiao1 de5 na4zhong3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Sorry to've startled "
"you! My name's $(scene.sFakeName). I'm the new contractor. Just wanted to "
"stop by and say hello."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​抱歉​吓​到​你​了​！​我​叫​$(scene.sFakeName)​。​我​是​新来​的​外​包工​，​想​过来​打声​招呼​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} bao4qian4 he4 dao4 ni3 le5！wo3 jiao4 $(scene.sFakeName)。wo3 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5 wai4 bao1gong1，xiang3 guo4lai2 da3 sheng1 zhao1hu5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Thanks to the power "
"overload, Central has me doing a sweep of this entire sector. See anything "
"unusual lately?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​还​不是​因为​电网​过载​的​事​，​指挥部​要​我​对​这​整片​区域​进行​巡视​。​最近​有​什么​异常情况​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} hai2 bu4shi4 yin1wei4 dian4wang3 guo4zai4 de5 shi4，zhi3hui1bu4 yao4 wo3 dui4 zhe4 zheng3 pian1 qu1yu4 jin4xing2 xun2shi4。zui4jin4 you3 shen2me5 yi4 chang2 qing2 kuang4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} The last thing I want"
" is to cause any trouble... You look like you have to deal with more than "
"enough of that. Do you mind if I just take a quick look around?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​我​并​不想​招惹​麻烦​……​你​看起来​要​处理​的​事情​已经​够​多​了​。​介意​让​我​随便​看看​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} wo3 bing4 bu4xiang3 zhao1re3 ma2fan5……ni3 kan4qi3lai5 yao4 chu3li3 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 gou4 duo1 le5。jie4yi4 rang4 wo3 sui2bian4 kan4kan5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} There's nothing I "
"love better than enhanced productivity. What are you offering?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​我​最​喜欢​的​就是​提升​效率​了​。​你​这里​都​有​什么​？\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} wo3 zui4 xi3huan5 de5 jiu4shi4 ti2sheng1 xiao4lu:4 le5。ni3 zhe4li3 dou1 you3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} {{GM}}Lie.{{/GM}} "
"We... are... your new... SECURITY DETAIL!"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​说谎​。​{{/GM}}​我们​……​是​你们​的​……​新​安保​团队​！\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} {{GM}} shuo1huang3。{{/GM}} wo3men5……shi4 ni3men5 de5……xin1 an1bao3 tuan2dui4！"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} {{GM}}Pretend to be "
"in pain.{{/GM}} Security! We're here with Security! Please, make it stop!"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​假装​痛苦​。​{{/GM}}​安保​人员​！​我们​是​安保​人员​！​求​你​快​住手​！\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} {{GM}} jia3zhuang1 tong4ku3。{{/GM}} an1bao3 ren2yuan2！wo3men5 shi4 an1bao3 ren2yuan2！qiu2 ni3 kuai4 zhu4shou3！"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} Do I have to spell it"
" out for you? Central wants to be sure that you're not sleeping on the job. "
"They sent me to check up on you."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​我​非得​一字一句​地​和​你们​说​清楚​吗​？​指挥部​要​确认​你们​没​在​偷懒​。​他们​派​我​来​检查​你们​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} wo3 fei1dei3 yi1 zi4 yi1 ju4 de5 he4 ni3men5 shuo1 qing1chu5 ma5？zhi3hui1bu4 yao4 que4ren4 ni3men5 mei2 zai4 tou1lan3。ta1men5 pai4 wo3 lai2 jian3cha2 ni3men5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} Look, I'd love to "
"chat, but you should really get moving. I've seen Central come down on "
"people for insubordination... it isn't pretty."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​我​倒​是​乐意​继续​聊​会儿​，​但​你​真该​赶紧​走​了​。​我见​过​指挥部​如何​处置​不​服从命令​的​人​，​那​场面​可不​好看​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} wo3 dao3 shi4 le4yi4 ji4xu4 liao2 hui4r5，dan4 ni3 zhen1 gai1 gan3jin3 zou3 le5。wo3 jian4 guo4 zhi3hui1bu4 ru2he2 chu3zhi4 bu4 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3 de5 ren2，na4 chang3mian4 ke3bu5 hao3kan4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} When did Aztechnology"
" ever do anything for you, aside from working you half to death? Let me take"
" care of the panel, and you can clock out early... I'll even spread a little"
" spending money your way."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​除了​让​你​当牛做马​以外​，​阿兹特​科技​还​为​你​做​过​什么​？​让​我​来​修好​这块​控制板​，​而​你​可以​早点​打卡​下班​……​我​甚至​会​给​你​点​零用钱​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} chu2le5 rang4 ni3 dang1 niu2 zuo4 ma3 yi3wai4，E1zi1te4ke1ji4 hai2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 guo4 shen2me5？rang4 wo3 lai2 xiu1hao3 zhe4 kuai4 kong4 zhi4 ban3，er2 ni3 ke3yi3 zao3dian3 da3ka3 xia4ban1……wo3 shen4zhi4 hui4 gei3 ni3 dian3 ling2yong4qian2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} You do that, and "
"you'll spend the rest of your short life wishing that you hadn't. My uncle "
"runs this facility."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​你​敢​动手​的话​，​这辈子​剩下​的​时间​你​就​后悔​去​吧​。​我​叔叔​可是​这所​设施​的​主管​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} ni3 gan3 dong4shou3 de5hua4，zhe4 bei4 zi3 sheng4xia4 de5 shi2jian1 ni3 jiu4 hou4hui3 qu4 ba1。wo3 shu1shu5 ke3shi4 zhe4 suo3 she4shi1 de5 zhu3guan3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} Here's the deal. "
"You let us cross for 750 nuyen. That includes the return trip. We "
"renegotiate for future crossings."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​这样​吧​。​我们​出​750​新円​，​返程​一并​算上​。​以后​再​过桥​的​时候​，​我们​重新​再谈​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} zhe4yang4 ba1。wo3men5 chu1 750 xin1 yuan2，fan3cheng2 yi1bing4 suan4 shang4。yi3hou4 zai4 guo4 qiao2 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 chong2xin1 zai4 tan2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} I left my work "
"clothes under my desk. I just needed to feel like a normal person again, "
"even if only for twenty minutes... there's only so long you can stew in your"
" work outfit. You know what I'm talking about, right?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​我​把​工作服​放在​桌子​底下​了​。​我​就​想​让​自己​像​个​正常人​一样​，​哪怕​只有​20​分钟​……​大部分​时间​我们​只能​穿着​工作服​闷​在​房间​里头​。​你​懂​我​意思​吧​？\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} wo3 ba3 gong1zuo4fu2 fang4 zai4 zhuo1zi5 di3xia5 le5。wo3 jiu4 xiang3 rang4 zi4ji3 xiang4 ge4 zheng1 chang2 ren2 yi1yang4，na3pa4 zhi3you3 20 fen1zhong1……da4bu4fen5 shi2jian1 wo3men5 zhi3neng2 chuan1zhuo2 gong1zuo4fu2 men1 zai4 fang2jian1 li3tou5。ni3 dong3 wo3 yi4si5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} I'm sorry I had to "
"drag you into this even deeper than you already were. But maybe I can make "
"it up to you."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​很​抱歉​把​你们​卷入​了​这场​纷争​更​深入​的​地步​，​但​也许​我能​补偿​你们​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} hen3 bao4qian4 ba3 ni3men5 juan3ru4 le5 zhe4 chang2 fen1zheng1 geng1 shen1ru4 de5 di4bu4，dan4 ye3xu3 wo3 neng2 bu3chang2 ni3men5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} Who the hell do you"
" think I am?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​你​觉得​我​是​谁​？\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} ni3 jue2de5 wo3 shi4 shei2？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} Y'know, if you're "
"that far behind, you could always go catch up on your other work... leave me"
" to work on the panel. It'd be no trouble."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​话​说​，​如果​已经​来不及​的话​，​不如​你​先​去​赶​其他​的​工作​……​控制板​的​事情​交给​我​。​不会​有​什么​问题​的​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} hua4 shuo1，ru2guo3 yi3jing1 lai2bu5ji2 de5hua4，bu4ru2 ni3 xian1 qu4 gan3 qi2ta1 de5 gong1zuo4……kong4 zhi4 ban3 de5 shi4qing5 jiao1gei3 wo3。bu4hui4 you3 shen2me5 wen4ti2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} Yeah, I was just "
"transferred from HQ. They have me walking the perimeter to familiarize "
"myself with the building."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​啊​，​我刚​从​总部​调过来​。​他们​让​我​沿​外围​巡视​一圈​，​尽快​熟悉​楼里​的​情况​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} a1，wo3 gang1 cong2 zong3bu4 diao4 guo4 lai2。ta1men5 rang4 wo3 yan2 wai4wei2 xun2shi4 yi1 juan1，jin3kuai4 shu2xi1 lou2 li3 de5 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} Yeah, I was just "
"transferred from HQ. They've got me walking the perimeter to familiarize "
"myself with the building."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​啊​，​我刚​从​总部​调过来​。​他们​让​我​沿​外围​巡视​一圈​，​尽快​熟悉​楼里​的​情况​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} a1，wo3 gang1 cong2 zong3bu4 diao4 guo4 lai2。ta1men5 rang4 wo3 yan2 wai4wei2 xun2shi4 yi1 juan1，jin3kuai4 shu2xi1 lou2 li3 de5 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} {{GM}}Lie{{/GM}} "
"I'm visiting from the Rhine-Ruhr-Megaplex, and my friend Hans said the "
"market here is second to none. I had to come see for myself!"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​说谎​{{/GM}}​我​是从​莱茵​-​鲁尔​大都会​区来​的​，​我​朋友​汉斯​说​这里​的​市场​相当​繁荣​，​所以​我​得​亲自​来​看看​！\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} {{GM}} shuo1huang3 {{/GM}} wo3 shi4 cong2 lai2 yin1 -lu3 er3 da4du1hui4 qu1 lai2 de5，wo3 peng2you5 han4si1 shuo1 zhe4li3 de5 shi4chang3 xiang1dang1 fan2rong2，suo3yi3 wo3 de2 qin1zi4 lai2 kan4kan5！"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}}Look, there's really"
" no need for that. My name's $(scene.sFakeName). I just got brought in on "
"contract."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​没​这个​必要​吧​。​我​叫​$(scene.sFakeName)​，​是​新来​的​外​包工​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} mei2 zhe4ge5 bi4yao4 ba1。wo3 jiao4 $(scene.sFakeName)，shi4 xin1 lai2 de5 wai4 bao1gong1。"

msgid "{{CC}}Charisma: 3{{/CC}} Halve that, and you've got yourself a deal."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​3​{{/CC}}​再​打个​对折​吧​，​你​同意​咱们​就​成交​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：3 {{/CC}} zai4 da3 ge4 dui4zhe2 ba1，ni3 tong2yi4 zan2men5 jiu4 cheng2jiao1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 3{{/CC}} I have it, but I think I deserve some credits for "
"my efforts."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​3​{{/CC}}​我​拿到​了​，​不过​我​觉得​费​了​这么​大劲​，​总该有​点​回报​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：3 {{/CC}} wo3 na2dao4 le5，bu4guo4 wo3 jue2de5 fei4 le5 zhe4me5 dai4 jin4，zong3 gai1 you3 dian3 hui2bao4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 3{{/CC}} My time is a valuable commodity, my friend. I'm "
"sure a businessman like you can understand that."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​3​{{/CC}}​我​的​时间​是​很​珍贵​的​商品​，​我​的​朋友​。​像​你​这样​的​生意人​肯定​能​明白​这点​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：3 {{/CC}} wo3 de5 shi2jian1 shi4 hen3 zhen1gui4 de5 shang1pin3，wo3 de5 peng2you5。xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 sheng1 yi4 ren2 ken3ding4 neng2 ming2bai5 zhe4 dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 3{{/CC}} Perhaps I am. And for 150 nuyen, I could be sure of"
" it."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​3​{{/CC}}​也许​是​我​错​了​。​如果​你​给​我​150​新円​，​那​就​肯定​是​我​错​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：3 {{/CC}} ye3xu3 shi4 wo3 cuo4 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 gei3 wo3 150 xin1 yuan2，na4 jiu4 ken3ding4 shi4 wo3 cuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 3{{/CC}} You're near rock bottom, Silke. When you hit it, "
"there'll be nowhere to go but up."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​3​{{/CC}}​你​快要​触底​了​，​西​尔克​。​到时候​你​也​没有​别的​路​可以​走​，​只能​回头​往​上​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：3 {{/CC}} ni3 kuai4yao4 chu4 de5 le5，Xi1er3ke4。dao4shi2hou4 ni3 ye3 mei2you3 bie2de5 lu4 ke3yi3 zou3，zhi3neng2 hui2tou2 wang3 shang4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 3{{/CC}} You're near rock bottom, Silke. When you hit it, "
"there'll be nowhere to go but up. "
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​3​{{/CC}}​你​快要​触底​了​，​西​尔克​。​到时候​你​也​没有​别的​路​可以​走​，​只能​回头​往​上​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：3 {{/CC}} ni3 kuai4yao4 chu4 de5 le5，Xi1er3ke4。dao4shi2hou4 ni3 ye3 mei2you3 bie2de5 lu4 ke3yi3 zou3，zhi3neng2 hui2tou2 wang3 shang4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 4{{/CC}} Gotta love crunch time, am I right? I've been here "
"for the past eighteen hours. How about you?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​4​{{/CC}}​关键时刻​就是​要命​啊​。​我​已经​在​这里​待​了​十八个​小时​了​。​你​呢​？\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：4 {{/CC}} guan1 jian4 shi2 ke4 jiu4shi4 yao4ming4 a1。wo3 yi3jing1 zai4 zhe4li3 dai1 le5 shi2 ba1 ge4 xiao3shi2 le5。ni3 ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 4{{/CC}} That part is pretty specialized and expensive. Who "
"else is gonna need it around here - or afford it? I'll give you five "
"hundred."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​4​{{/CC}}​那​东西​是​专业​设备​，​而且​价格昂贵​。​这​地方​还有​谁​会​需要​它​，​或者​买得起​？​我​就​给​你​五百块​拉倒​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：4 {{/CC}} na4 dong1xi1 shi4 zhuan1ye4 she4bei4，er2qie3 jia4 ge2 ang2 gui4。zhe4 di4fang1 hai2you3 shei2 hui4 xu1yao4 ta1，huo4zhe3 mai3 de2 qi3？wo3 jiu4 gei3 ni3 wu3 bai3 kuai4 la1dao3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 4{{/CC}} We did what we could, Mira. But by the time we got "
"there, it was already too late."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​4​{{/CC}}​我们​尽力​了​，​米拉​。​但​当​我们​到​那里​的​时候​，​已经​太晚​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：4 {{/CC}} wo3men5 jin4li4 le5，mi3la1。dan4 dang1 wo3men5 dao4 na4li5 de5 shi2hou5，yi3jing1 tai4 wan3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 5{{/CC}} 200 nuyen per head ain't bad. But from where I'm "
"standing, it looks like you need my help... and that tells me that you can "
"do better."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​5​{{/CC}}​杀​个人​就​有​200​新円​，​听​起来​还​可以​。​但​在我看来​，​现在​是​你​需要​我​的​帮助​……​所以​我​觉得​你​能​出​更​高​的​价​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：5 {{/CC}} sha1 ge4ren2 jiu4 you3 200 xin1 yuan2，ting1 qi3lai5 hai2 ke3yi3。dan4 zai4wo3kan4lai2，xian4zai4 shi4 ni3 xu1yao4 wo3 de5 bang1zhu4……suo3yi3 wo3 jue2de5 ni3 neng2 chu1 geng1 gao1 de5 jia4。"

msgid "{{CC}}Charisma: 5{{/CC}} For 200 nuyen I could."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​5​{{/CC}}​给​我​200​新円​，​我​就​替​你​干​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：5 {{/CC}} gei3 wo3 200 xin1 yuan2，wo3 jiu4 ti4 ni3 gan4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 5{{/CC}} Look, there is far more at stake here than your "
"little corner of the Matrix. But no one needs to get hurt - all I want is "
"the part."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​5​{{/CC}}​听​着​，​这件​事​关乎​的​远不止​你们​这个​小小的​矩阵​角落​。​但​没有​人​需要​受伤​—​—​我​只​想要​那个​零件​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：5 {{/CC}} ting1 zhao2，zhe4 jian4 shi4 guan1hu1 de5 yuan3 bu4 zhi3 ni3men5 zhe4ge5 xiao3 xiao3 de5 ju3zhen4 jiao3luo4。dan4 mei2you3 ren2 xu1yao4 shou4shang1——wo3 zhi3 xiang3yao4 na4ge5 ling2jian4。"

msgid "{{CC}}Charisma: 5{{/CC}} Why don't you go first, Doc?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​5​{{/CC}}​不如​你​先​说​吧​，​博士​？\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：5 {{/CC}} bu4ru2 ni3 xian1 shuo1 ba1，bo2shi4？"

msgid "{{CC}}Charisma: 5{{/CC}} ¥500, since I've got the only supply in town."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​5​{{/CC}}​¥​500​怎么样​，​毕竟​我​手上​这瓶​是​独​一份​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：5 {{/CC}} ¥ 500 zen3me5yang4，bi4jing4 wo3 shou3 shang4 zhe4 ping2 shi4 du2 yi1 fen4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Charisma: 6{{/CC}} Hey, I'm a pizza delivery $(s.guy). I ended up with"
" a few extra pizzas, and I thought you'd want one. No charge!"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​魅力​：​6​{{/CC}}​你好​，​我​是​送​披萨​的​。​我​这​刚好​多​了​几块​披萨​，​就​想着​你​可能​会​想要​一块​。​不​收费​！\n"
"{{CC}} mei4li4：6 {{/CC}} ni3hao3，wo3 shi4 song4 pi1sa4 de5。wo3 zhe4 gang1hao3 duo1 le5 ji1 kuai4 pi1sa4，jiu4 xiang3 zhao2 ni3 ke3neng2 hui4 xiang3yao4 yi1kuai4。bu4 shou1fei4！"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Cheap Booze{{/CC}} Found this liquor in my travels. Worth anything?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​廉价​酒​{{/CC}}​我​在​路上​找到​了​这瓶​酒​。​值钱​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} lian2jia4 jiu3 {{/CC}} wo3 zai4 lu4shang5 zhao3dao4 le5 zhe4 ping2 jiu3。zhi2qian2 ma5？"

msgid "{{CC}}Cheap Booze{{/CC}} I brought my own."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​廉价​酒​{{/CC}}​我​自己​带​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} lian2jia4 jiu3 {{/CC}} wo3 zi4ji3 dai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Close Combat: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} {{GM}}Choke him "
"unconscious.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​近战​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​勒晕​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} jin4 zhan4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} {{GM}} lei1 yun1 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Close Combat: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}}{{GM}}Knock him "
"unconscious.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​近战​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​击晕​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} jin4 zhan4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} {{GM}} ji1yun1 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Cold One{{/CC}} {{GM}}Raise your beer.{{/GM}} I'm a little less "
"refined than that."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​冰​啤酒​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​举起​你​的​啤酒​。​{{/GM}}​我​可​没​那么​文雅​。\n"
"{{CC}} bing1 pi2jiu3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} ju3qi3 ni3 de5 pi2jiu3。{{/GM}} wo3 ke3 mei2 na4me5 wen2ya3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Cram{{/CC}} {{GM}}Hook her up.{{/GM}} Screw Kroner. I've got my own "
"supply."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​超感​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​给​她​货​。​{{/GM}}​用不着​搭理​克​罗纳​。​我​有​自己​的​货​。\n"
"{{CC}} chao1 gan3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} gei3 ta1 huo4。{{/GM}} yong4bu5zhao2 da1li5 ke4 luo2na4。wo3 you3 zi4ji3 de5 huo4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Cyberdeck and Decking: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} Tether"
" your cyberdeck to the input port and deck into the system."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​赛博碟板​与​骇入​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​将​你​的​赛博碟板​连接​至​输入​端口​并​骇入​系统​。\n"
"{{CC}} sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 yu4 hai4 ru4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} jiang1 ni3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 lian2jie1 zhi4 shu1ru4 duan1kou3 bing4 hai4 ru4 xi4tong3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Decker with Cyberdeck{{/CC}} Hold up. You want me to jack in to a "
"terminal in THIS building? With YOU?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​携带​赛博碟板​的​碟​客​{{/CC}}​等等​。​你​想​让​我​在​这个​建筑​里​接入​终端​？​把​自己​送到​你​面前​？\n"
"{{CC}} xie2dai4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 de5 die2 ke4 {{/CC}} deng3deng3。ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 zai4 zhe4ge5 jian4zhu4 li3 jie1ru4 zhong1duan1？ba3 zi4ji3 song4 dao4 ni3 mian4qian2？"

msgid "{{CC}}Decker with Cyberdeck{{/CC}} No, Blitz. I'm going to do it."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​携带​赛博碟板​的​碟​客​{{/CC}}​不​，​布里​茨​。​我来​做​。\n"
"{{CC}} xie2dai4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 de5 die2 ke4 {{/CC}} bu4，Bu4li3ci2。wo3 lai2 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Decker with Cyberdeck{{/CC}} Whoa, hold up. You want me to jack into a"
" terminal in *this* building? With YOU?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​携带​赛博碟板​的​碟​客​{{/CC}}​等等​。​你​想​让​我​在​*​这个​*​建筑​里​接入​终端​？​把​自己​送到​你​面前​？\n"
"{{CC}} xie2dai4 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 de5 die2 ke4 {{/CC}} deng3deng3。ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 zai4*zhe4ge5*jian4zhu4 li3 jie1ru4 zhong1duan1？ba3 zi4ji3 song4 dao4 ni3 mian4qian2？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Decker{{/CC}} I'm a decker. So no, I'm afraid not... the position's "
"been filled."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​碟客​{{/CC}}​我​自己​就是​个​碟​客​。​所以​，​不好意思​……​这活​已经​有人​干​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} die2 ke4 {{/CC}} wo3 zi4ji3 jiu4shi4 ge4 die2 ke4。suo3yi3，bu4hao3yi4si5……zhe4 huo2 yi3jing1 you3ren2 gan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Decking: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Actually, I think that"
" I could help you... it looks like your problem is coming from somewhere "
"upstream. See those connectors, there?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​骇入​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​我​觉得​我​还​真能​帮​你​……​看起来​你​的​问题​出自​上游​的​某处​。​看见​那边​的​连接器​了​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} hai4 ru4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} wo3 jue2de5 wo3 hai2 zhen1 neng2 bang1 ni3……kan4qi3lai5 ni3 de5 wen4ti2 chu1zi4 shang4you2 de5 mou3chu4。kan4jian4 na4bian5 de5 lian2jie1qi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Decking: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} In the Kreuzbasar, my "
"friend Altuğ has a series of data taps established to... monitor nearby "
"communications. You return our shipment, we let you listen in on those taps."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​骇入​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​我​的​朋友​奥图​伊有​一批​数据​插口​，​用来​……​监视​附近​的​通讯​情况​。​你​把​货​还给​我们​，​我们​就让​你​监听​这些​接口​。\n"
"{{CC}} hai4 ru4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，wo3 de5 peng2you5 ao4 tu2 yi1 you3 yi1 pi1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3，yong4lai2……jian1shi4 fu4jin4 de5 tong1xun4 qing2kuang4。ni3 ba3 huo4 huan2gei3 wo3men5，wo3men5 jiu4 rang4 ni3 jian1ting1 zhe4xie1 jie1kou3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Decking: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} The hell with it. I'll"
" bring down the quarantine and download your show for you."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​骇入​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​管​他​呢​。​我会​解除​隔离​，​然后​把​你​要​的​剧集​弄​给​你​看​。\n"
"{{CC}} hai4 ru4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} guan3 ta1 ni2。wo3 hui4 jie3chu2 ge2li2，ran2hou4 ba3 ni3 yao4 de5 ju4ji2 long4 gei3 ni3 kan4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Decking: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Well, I guess that I "
"could disengage the quarantine. That'd reestablish the building's Matrix "
"link, and then I could download the show for you."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​骇入​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​我​想​我​可以​解除​隔离​。​那样​就​能​重新​建立​大楼​的​矩阵​链接​，​然后​我​就​能​为​你​下载​剧集​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} hai4 ru4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} wo3 xiang3 wo3 ke3yi3 jie3chu2 ge2li2。na4yang4 jiu4 neng2 chong2xin1 jian4li4 da4lou2 de5 ju3zhen4 lian4jie1，ran2hou4 wo3 jiu4 neng2 wei2 ni3 xia4zai3 ju4ji2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Decking: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} {{GM}}Bypass the "
"door.{{/GM}} Don't worry about it, Blitz. I've got this."
