msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​无人机​控制​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​骇入​无人机​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} {{GM}} hai4 ru4 wu2ren2ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Drone Control: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} {{GM}}Take a "
"closer look at the Cyberzombie's control system.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​无人机​控制​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​仔细​看看​赛博​僵尸​的​控制系统​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} {{GM}} zi3xi4 kan4kan5 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 de5 kong4 zhi4 xi4 tong3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Drone Control: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} {{GM}}Order the "
"drones to target security personnel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​无人机​控制​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​命令​无人机​攻击​安保​人员​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} {{GM}} ming4ling4 wu2ren2ji1 gong1ji1 an1bao3 ren2yuan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Drone Control: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} {{GM}}Power up"
" the turret and set it to attack your enemies.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​无人机​控制​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​启动​炮塔​，​使​其​攻击​你​的​敌人​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} {{GM}} qi3dong4 pao4ta3，shi3 qi2 gong1ji1 ni3 de5 di2ren2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Drone Control: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} "
"{{GM}}Reprogram the turrets to target Knight Errant personnel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​无人机​控制​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​重写​炮塔​程序​，​使​其以​游侠​骑士​人员​为​目标​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} {{GM}} chong2 xie3 pao4ta3 cheng2xu4，shi3 qi2 yi3 you2Xia2qi2shi4 ren2yuan2 wei2 mu4biao1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Drone Control: 3{{/CC}} Send self-destruct codes to the automated "
"security."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​无人机​控制​：​3​{{/CC}}​给​自动​安保​装置​发送​自毁​命令​。\n"
"{{CC}} wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4：3 {{/CC}} gei3 zi4dong4 an1bao3 zhuang1zhi4 fa1song4 zi4hui3 ming4ling4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Drone Control: 3{{/CC}}{{GM}}Rig into the building to call the "
"elevator.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​无人机​控制​：​3​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​接入​建筑​的​局域网​，​远程​启动​电梯​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4：3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jie1ru4 jian4zhu4 de5 ju2yu4wang3，yuan3cheng2 qi3dong4 dian4ti1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Drone Control: 5{{/CC}}{{GM}}Enable Drone Remote Control Box for "
"direct-rig.{{/GM}} "
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​无人机​控制​：​5​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​启用​无人机​遥控​箱​进行​直接​操作​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} wu2ren2ji1 kong4zhi4：5 {{/CC}} {{GM}} qi3yong4 wu2ren2ji1 yao2kong4 xiang1 jin4xing2 zhi2jie1 cao1zuo4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Encephalon NEXT® Purchase Order{{/CC}} I had a piece of headware "
"shipped here. Could you install it for me?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​脑接​NEXT​®​采购​单​{{/CC}}​我​有​一件​头戴​设备​运到​了​这里​。​你​能​帮​我​安装​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} nao3 jie1 NEXT ® cai3gou4 dan1 {{/CC}} wo3 you3 yi1 jian4 tou2 dai4 she4bei4 yun4 dao4 le5 zhe4li3。ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3 an1zhuang1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} Are your findings peer-reviewed, Vauclair? "
"Or are you so invested in this idea - of exterminating dragons - that you're"
" acting on faith?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​你​的​研究成果​经过​同行​评审​了​吗​，​沃​克莱尔​？​还是​说​你​对​消灭​巨龙​这个​想法​投入​了​太​多​，​以至于​纯粹​在​凭​信念​行事​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} ni3 de5 yan2 jiu1 cheng2 guo3 jing1guo4 tong2hang2 ping2shen3 le5 ma5，Wo4ke4lai2er3？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 dui4 xiao1mie4 ju4long2 zhe4ge5 xiang3fa3 tou2ru4 le5 tai4 duo1，yi3zhi4yu2 chun2cui4 zai4 ping2 xin4nian4 xing2shi4？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} Damuzid was a shepherd-god. Are you a "
"shepherd too, Feuerschwinge?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​塔木兹​是​牧羊人​之神​。​你​也​是​牧羊人​吗​，​火翼​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} ta3 mu4 zi1 shi4 mu4yang2ren2 zhi1 shen2。ni3 ye3 shi4 mu4yang2ren2 ma5，Huo3yi4？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} Dietrich... you do know that the white "
"whale killed Ahab, right?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​迪​特里​希​……​你​肯定​知道​白鲸​杀​了​亚哈​船长​，​对​吧​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} Di2te4li3xi1……ni3 ken3ding4 zhi1dao4 bai2jing1 sha1 le5 ya4ha1 chuan2zhang3，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} Don't you see anything ironic about a cult "
"devoted to freedom and rebellion with a totalitarian leader?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​难道​你​不​觉得​讽刺​吗​？​一个​崇尚​自由​与​叛逆​的​教派​，​竟​由​一个​极权主义​者​领导​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} nan2dao4 ni3 bu4 jue2de5 feng3ci4 ma5？yi1ge5 chong2shang4 zi4you2 yu4 pan4ni4 de5 jiao4pai4，jing4 you2 yi1ge5 ji2quan2zhu3yi4 zhe3 ling3dao3？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} Dr. Vauclair, I think your obsession with "
"dragons has progressed to the point that you are no longer in control of "
"your actions. "
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​沃​克莱尔​博士​，​我​认为​你​对​巨龙​的​痴迷​已经​到​了​无法控制​自己​行为​的​地步​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4，wo3 ren4wei2 ni3 dui4 ju4long2 de5 chi1mi2 yi3jing1 dao4 le5 wu2 fa3 kong4 zhi4 zi4ji3 xing2wei2 de5 di4bu4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} I'm getting the feeling that this entire "
"thing is written in doublespeak. I doubt if there's a single statement in "
"here that isn't contradicted somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​我​越来越​觉得​这​整篇文章​都​是​在​玩​文字游戏​。​我​怀疑​这​里面​的​每句​表述​都​在​别处​自相矛盾​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} wo3 yue4lai2yue4 jue2de5 zhe4 zheng3 pian1 wen2 zhang1 dou1 shi4 zai4 wan2 wen2 zi4 you2 xi4。wo3 huai2yi2 zhe4 li3mian4 de5 mei3 ju4 biao3shu4 dou1 zai4 bie2chu4 zi4xiang1mao2dun4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} I’ve heard something like this before. It "
"was in relation to the Sumerian shepherd-god, Dumuzi."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​我​以前​听过​类似​的​事情​。​这​和​苏美尔​神话​中​的​牧神​杜木兹​有关​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} wo3 yi3qian2 ting1 guo4 lei4si4 de5 shi4qing5。zhe4 he4 su1mei3er3 shen2hua4 zhong4 de5 mu4shen2 du4 mu4 zi1 you3guan1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} That's a false equivalence, Vauclair. "
"You're an intelligent man - you know the dangers of what you're proposing. "
"You just don't want to acknowledge them."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​这是​错误​的​类比​，​沃​克莱尔​。​你​是​个​聪明人​—​—​你​知道​自己​计划​的​危险性​。​你​只是​不​愿意​承认​而已​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} zhe4 shi4 cuo4wu4 de5 lei4bi3，Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 shi4 ge4 cong1 ming2 ren2——ni3 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 ji4hua4 de5 wei1 xian3 xing4。ni3 zhi3shi4 bu4 yuan4yi4 cheng2ren4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} They had it coming. If our actions altered "
"the balance of power in Drogenkippe, it was simply an example of the Flux in"
" action."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​他们​是​自作自受​。​如果​我们​的​行动​扰乱​了​毒​坑区​的​权力​平衡​，​这​不是​刚好​印证​了​动荡​带​的​法则​吗​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} ta1men5 shi4 zi4zuo4zi4shou4。ru2guo3 wo3men5 de5 xing2dong4 rao3luan4 le5 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 quan2li4 ping2heng2，zhe4 bu4shi4 gang1hao3 yin4zheng4 le5 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 fa3ze2 ma5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} You know that America was pretty divided on"
" the morality of that act, right? Some even considered it a crime against "
"humanity."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​你​知道​美国​人​自己​对​那件事​的​道德性​也​有​很大​分歧​吗​？​甚至​有人​认为​那​是​反​人类​罪行​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} ni3 zhi1dao4 mei3guo2 ren2 zi4ji3 dui4 na4 jian4 shi4 de5 dao4 de2 xing4 ye3 you3 hen3 dai4 fen1qi2 ma5？shen4zhi4 you3ren2 ren4wei2 na4 shi4 fan3 ren2lei4 zui4xing2。"

msgid "{{CC}}Etiquette: Academic{{/CC}} {{GM}}Analyze the language.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​学术​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​分析​语言​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：xue2shu4 {{/CC}} {{GM}} fen1xi1 yu3yan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{CC}}Etiquette: Corporate{{/CC}} Aztechnology, I’d assume."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​公司​{{/CC}}​我​猜​是​阿兹特​科技​吧​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：gong1si1 {{/CC}} wo3 cai1 shi4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Corporate{{/CC}} Frank. Look at us. We're here on "
"business... *corporate* business."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​公司​{{/CC}}​弗兰克​，​你​可​瞧​好​了​。​我们​是​来​谈​生意​的​……​*​公司​*​的​生意​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：gong1si1 {{/CC}} fu2lan2ke4，ni3 ke3 qiao2 hao3 le5。wo3men5 shi4 lai2 tan2 sheng1yi4 de5……*gong1si1*de5 sheng1yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Corporate{{/CC}} I'm new... they just brought me on as a QA"
" tester for the Ares project."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​公司​{{/CC}}​我​是​新来​的​……​他们​叫​我​来​为​阿瑞斯​项目​进行​测试​工作​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：gong1si1 {{/CC}} wo3 shi4 xin1 lai2 de5……ta1men5 jiao4 wo3 lai2 wei2 a1rui4si1 xiang4mu4 jin4xing2 ce4shi4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Corporate{{/CC}} Most of the local wageslaves live an "
"underground tram ride away from their office buildings. Nobody has much of "
"an excuse to go outside."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​公司​{{/CC}}​当地​绝大多数​薪奴​的​居住地​到​公司​都​有​地下​轻轨​联通​。​人们​几乎​没有​理由​外出​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：gong1si1 {{/CC}} dang1di4 jue2da4duo1shu4 xin1 nu2 de5 ju1zhu4di4 dao4 gong1si1 dou1 you3 di4xia4 qing1gui3 lian2tong1。ren2men5 ji1hu1 mei2you3 li3you2 wai4chu1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Corporate{{/CC}} You think that just because we're in "
"maintenance, we don't understand what you're going through? I have six "
"21-B's to file before the day is out, and if I don't, I can kiss my "
"efficiency bonus goodbye."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​企业​{{/CC}}​你​以为​我们​是​检修​人员​，​就​不​懂​你​在​经历​什么​吗​？​今天​我​得​处理​完​六份​21​-​B​表格​，​否则​绩效奖金​就别​想​拿到​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：qi3ye4 {{/CC}} ni3 yi3wei2 wo3men5 shi4 jian3xiu1 ren2yuan2，jiu4 bu4 dong3 ni3 zai4 jing1li4 shen2me5 ma5？jin1tian1 wo3 de2 chu3li3 wan2 liu4 fen4 21 -bi1 biao3ge2，fou3ze2 ji4 xiao4 jiang3 jin1 jiu4 bie4 xiang3 na2dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Corporate{{/CC}} {{GM}}Attempt to decipher the text.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​公司​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​尝试​解读​文本​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：gong1si1 {{/CC}} {{GM}} chang2shi4 jie3du2 wen2ben3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{CC}}Etiquette: Gang{{/CC}} Be cool, man. I can get us out of this."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​帮派​{{/CC}}​放松​点​，​哥们​。​我能​搞定​这​事​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：bang1pai4 {{/CC}} fang4song1 dian3，ge1men5。wo3 neng2 gao3ding4 zhe4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Gang{{/CC}} I can see that you're running an operation "
"here. I'll bet it's a pretty delicate one. It'd be a shame if something "
"happened to it."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​帮派​{{/CC}}​你们​是​在​这​做买卖​吧​。​我​赌​你​这​买卖​还是​个​精细​活​，​要是​出​了​事​可​就​不好​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：bang1pai4 {{/CC}} ni3men5 shi4 zai4 zhe4 zuo4mai3mai4 ba1。wo3 du3 ni3 zhe4 mai3mai4 hai2shi5 ge4 jing1xi4 huo2，yao4shi5 chu1 le5 shi4 ke3 jiu4 bu4hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Gang{{/CC}} I hear you, big man. But this is biz, you feel "
"me?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​帮派​{{/CC}}​我​明白​你​什么​意思​，​大块头​。​但​这​可是​生意​，​你​懂​吧​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：bang1pai4 {{/CC}} wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 shen2me5 yi4si5，da4kuai4tou2。dan4 zhe4 ke3shi4 sheng1yi4，ni3 dong3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Gang{{/CC}} I know how this works, friend. They drop off "
"the shipment, you move the goods, then you meet somewhere to hand over the "
"take. Tell me where to find the Rabengeister."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​帮派​{{/CC}}​朋友​，​我​知道​你们​之间​的​套路​。​他们​放下​物资​，​你​负责​运货​，​然后​你们​在​某个​地方​接头​。​告诉​我​去​哪里​找到​“​鸦灵​”​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：bang1pai4 {{/CC}} peng2you5，wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 tao4lu4。ta1men5 fang4xia4 wu4zi1，ni3 fu4ze2 yun4 huo4，ran2hou4 ni3men5 zai4 mou3 ge4 di4fang1 jie1tou2。gao4su4 wo3 qu4 na3li3 zhao3dao4“Ya1ling2”。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Gang{{/CC}} There's something about this that you're not "
"telling us."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​帮派​{{/CC}}​你​有事​瞒​着​我们​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：bang1pai4 {{/CC}} ni3 you3shi4 man2 zhao2 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Gang{{/CC}} This deal's coming out all in your favor. If "
"I'm going to hand your entire territory back, you'll have to sweeten the "
"pot."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​帮派​{{/CC}}​这笔​交易​完全​是​对​你们​有利​。​如果​要​我​帮​你们​夺回​整个​地盘​，​你​得​再​加点​好处​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：bang1pai4 {{/CC}} zhe4 bi3 jiao1yi4 wan2quan2 shi4 dui4 ni3men5 you3li4。ru2guo3 yao4 wo3 bang1 ni3men5 duo2hui2 zheng3ge4 di4pan2，ni3 de2 zai4 jia1dian3 hao3chu3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} Are you going to report to Central, or do I"
" need to go back there and tell them that you refused their order?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​所以​你​现在​是​去​指挥部​报​到​，​还是​等​我​回去​告诉​他们​说​你​拒绝​服从命令​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} suo3yi3 ni3 xian4zai4 shi4 qu4 zhi3hui1bu4 bao4 dao4，hai2shi5 deng3 wo3 hui2qu5 gao4su4 ta1men5 shuo1 ni3 ju4jue2 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} Don't worry about it, I've already scanned "
"in. And don't forget to clock out... you know Central gets about these "
"things."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​不用​担心​，​我​已经​刷过​卡​了​。​倒​是​你们​别忘了​打卡​下班​……​你们​知道​指挥部​多​在意​这种​事​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} bu4yong4 dan1xin1，wo3 yi3jing1 shua1 guo4 ka3 le5。dao3 shi4 ni3men5 bie4 wang4 le5 da3ka3 xia4ban1……ni3men5 zhi1dao4 zhi3hui1bu4 duo1 zai4yi4 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} I don't have a company ID. I was sent here "
"by Knight Errant Dispatch to check on the status of the patch."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​我​没有​公司​的​证件​。​是​游侠​骑士​特遣队​派​我​过来​检查​补丁​进度​的​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} wo3 mei2you3 gong1si1 de5 zheng4jian4。shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 te4 qian3 dui4 pai4 wo3 guo4lai2 jian3cha2 bu3ding5 jin4du4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} I just got the assignment myself. Central "
"wants a complete perimeter assessment."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​我​也​是​刚刚​才​收到​指令​。​指挥部​要求​对​周边​情况​进行​全面​评估​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} wo3 ye3 shi4 gang1gang5 cai2 shou1dao4 zhi3ling4。zhi3hui1bu4 yao1qiu2 dui4 zhou1bian1 qing2kuang4 jin4xing2 quan2mian4 ping2gu1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} I just got word from Central. Our comms "
"have been compromised, and all authorizations are being threat-stacked. My "
"orders are to proceed to a primary defense point and await further "
"instructions."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​我​刚刚​才​收到​指挥部​的​消息​。​我们​的​通讯​系统​遭到​入侵​，​所有​权限​都​受到​了​威胁​堆栈​攻击​。​我​接到​的​命令​是​前往​主要​防御​点​，​等待​进一步​指示​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} wo3 gang1gang5 cai2 shou1dao4 zhi3hui1bu4 de5 xiao1xi5。wo3men5 de5 tong1xun4 xi4tong3 zao1dao4 ru4qin1，suo3you3 quan2xian4 dou1 shou4dao4 le5 wei1xie2 dui1zhan4 gong1ji1。wo3 jie1dao4 de5 ming4ling4 shi4 qian2wang3 zhu3yao4 fang2yu4 dian3，deng3dai4 jin4yi1bu4 zhi3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} I'm here to conduct a spot inspection. Just"
" keep doing what you're doing, guardsmen."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​我​是​来​这里​进行​现场​检查​的​。​你们​继续执行​任务​即可​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} wo3 shi4 lai2 zhe4li3 jin4xing2 xian4chang3 jian3cha2 de5。ni3men5 ji4 xu4 zhi2 xing2 ren4wu5 ji2ke3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} Not much... just that Central wants a "
"complete perimeter assessment. I think the power outage has 'em spooked."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​没​怎么​说​……​只​说​指挥部​要求​对​周边​情况​进行​全面​评估​。​我​猜​是​断电​的​事​把​他们​吓​到​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} mei2 zen3me5 shuo1……zhi3 shuo1 zhi3hui1bu4 yao1qiu2 dui4 zhou1bian1 qing2kuang4 jin4xing2 quan2mian4 ping2gu1。wo3 cai1 shi4 duan4dian4 de5 shi4 ba3 ta1men5 he4 dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} Of course it does. Now are you going to "
"report to Central, or do I need to go back there and tell them that you "
"refused their order?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​当然​。​所以​你​现在​是​去​指挥部​报​到​，​还是​等​我​回去​告诉​他们​说​你​拒绝​服从命令​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} dang1ran2。suo3yi3 ni3 xian4zai4 shi4 qu4 zhi3hui1bu4 bao4 dao4，hai2shi5 deng3 wo3 hui2qu5 gao4su4 ta1men5 shuo1 ni3 ju4jue2 fu2 cong2 ming4 ling3？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} That sounds more like a police action than "
"a military operation. Wouldn't the GSG usually handle that kind of thing?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​这​听​起来​更​像是​警方​职权范围​，​而​非军事​行动​。​这种​事​不是​通常​该​由​GSG​来​处理​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 geng1 xiang4 shi4 jing3fang1 zhi2 quan2 fan4 wei2，er2 fei1 jun1 shi4 xing2dong4。zhe4zhong3 shi4 bu4shi4 tong1chang2 gai1 you2 GSG lai2 chu3li3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} Yeah, Central wants a complete perimeter "
"assessment. They sent me to see to it."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​是​啊​，​指挥部​要求​对​周边​情况​进行​全面​评估​。​他们​派​我​来​负责​行动​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} shi4 a1，zhi3hui1bu4 yao1qiu2 dui4 zhou1bian1 qing2kuang4 jin4xing2 quan2mian4 ping2gu1。ta1men5 pai4 wo3 lai2 fu4ze2 xing2dong4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Security{{/CC}} Yeah, I was in the same boat until a few "
"minutes ago. Just heard from Central, they want a complete perimeter "
"assessment."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​安保​{{/CC}}​我​也​和​你​一样​，​直到​几分钟​前​才刚​接到​指挥部​的​命令​，​他们​要求​对​周边​情况​进行​全面​评估​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an1bao3 {{/CC}} wo3 ye3 he4 ni3 yi1yang4，zhi2dao4 ji1 fen4 zhong1 qian2 cai2 gang1 jie1dao4 zhi3hui1bu4 de5 ming4ling4，ta1men5 yao1qiu2 dui4 zhou1bian1 qing2kuang4 jin4xing2 quan2mian4 ping2gu1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Shadowrunner{{/CC}} A security rigger, huh? Don't see too "
"many of those in the shadows. Lose your corporate job?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​暗影​狂奔​者​{{/CC}}​安保​机师​？​你​这种​人​在​暗影​圈子里​很少​见​。​你​是​被​公司​开除​了​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 {{/CC}} an1bao3 ji1shi1？ni3 zhe4zhong3 ren2 zai4 an4ying3 juan1 zi3 li3 hen3 shao3 jian4。ni3 shi4 bei4 gong1si1 kai1chu2 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Shadowrunner{{/CC}} I've dealt with a lot of street docs in"
" my time. Never heard of much demand for what you're selling. If you want me"
" to shell out, you'd better quote a lower price."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​暗影​狂奔​者​{{/CC}}​我​这辈子​和​许多​街头​医生​打​过​交道​，​从​没听说过​你​卖​的​东西​能值​这么​多钱​。​如果​你​想​让​我​掏钱​的话​，​最好​把​价格​报​低点​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 {{/CC}} wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 he4 xu3duo1 jie1tou2 yi1sheng1 da3 guo4 jiao1 dao4，cong2 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4 ni3 mai4 de5 dong1xi1 neng2 zhi2 zhe4me5 duo1 qian2。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 tao1qian2 de5hua4，zui4hao3 ba3 jia4ge2 bao4 di1 dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Shadowrunner{{/CC}} It isn't your place to judge my "
"integrity, lapdog. Leave that to Herr Fuchs."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​暗影​狂奔​者​{{/CC}}​你​没有​资格​评判​我​的​职业​操守​，​走狗​。​还是​把​这话​留给​富克斯​先生​说​吧​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 {{/CC}} ni3 mei2you3 zi1ge2 ping2pan4 wo3 de5 zhi2ye4 cao1shou3，zou3gou3。hai2shi5 ba3 zhe4 hua4 liu2gei3 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Shadowrunner{{/CC}} Quit trying to shift the blame. "
"Adapting to unanticipated situations is part of a shadowrunner's job "
"description."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​暗影​狂奔​者​{{/CC}}​少​在​这里​怪罪​别人​。​作为​暗影​狂奔​者​，​本来​就​应该​随机应变​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 {{/CC}} shao3 zai4 zhe4li3 guai4zui4 bie2ren5。zuo4wei2 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，ben3lai2 jiu4 ying1gai1 sui2ji1ying4bian4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Shadowrunner{{/CC}} {{GM}}Kill Enstad.{{/GM}} Betrayal? No."
" Enstad was never going to leave this building alive. Allow me to "
"demonstrate."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​暗影​狂奔​者​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​杀掉​恩施​塔德​。​{{/GM}}​背叛​？​不​。​恩施​塔德​就​不​可能​活着​离开​这栋​楼​。​容​我​证明​给​你​看​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} sha1diao4 en1Shi1ta3de2。{{/GM}} bei4pan4？bu4。en1Shi1ta3de2 jiu4 bu4 ke3neng2 huo2zhe5 li2kai1 zhe4 dong4 lou2。rong2 wo3 zheng4ming2 gei3 ni3 kan4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Socialite{{/CC}} Come now, doctor. You could resell this "
"material to a chop shop, yes, but that would take time and effort. The "
"ghouls, on the other hand, are right beneath your feet. Surely that merits a"
" discount?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​名流​{{/CC}}​拜托​，​医生​。​你​是​可以​把​这些​材料​转卖​给​器官​店​，​但​这​不得​花​时间​精力​嘛​。​而​尸鬼们​可​就​在​你​脚底​下​呢​。​这​难道​不​值得​打个​折​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：ming2liu2 {{/CC}} bai4tuo1，yi1sheng1。ni3 shi4 ke3yi3 ba3 zhe4xie1 cai2liao4 zhuan3mai4 gei3 qi4guan1 dian4，dan4 zhe4 bu4de2 hua1 shi2jian1 jing1li4 ma5。er2 shi1 gui3 men5 ke3 jiu4 zai4 ni3 jiao3di3 xia4 ni2。zhe4 nan2dao4 bu4 zhi2de5 da3 ge4 zhe1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Socialite{{/CC}} I know how much money you nonprofits keep "
"for yourselves. You can scrape together more cash than that, and you know "
"it."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​名流​{{/CC}}​我​知道​你们​这些​非营利​组织​往​自己​兜里​装​了​多少​钱​。​你们​能​凑出​更​多​现金​，​这​一点​你们​自己​也​清楚​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：ming2liu2 {{/CC}} wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 zhe4xie1 fei1ying2li4 zu3zhi1 wang3 zi4ji3 dou1 li3 zhuang1 le5 duo1shao3 qian2。ni3men5 neng2 cou4 chu1 geng1 duo1 xian4jin1，zhe4 yi1dian3 ni3men5 zi4ji3 ye3 qing1chu5。"

msgid "{{CC}}Etiquette: Socialite{{/CC}} {{GM}}Examine the bottles.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​名流​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​检查​酒瓶​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：ming2liu2 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jian3cha2 jiu3 ping2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} Apologies, Herr Mettbach... I didn't intend "
"any disrespect. Allow me to prove my sincerity with a purchase."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​抱歉​，​梅特​巴赫​先生​……​我​并​没有​任何​不敬​的​意思​。​请​允许​我​买点​东西​来​证明​我​的​真诚​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} bao4qian4，mei2 te4 ba1he4 xian1sheng5……wo3 bing4 mei2you3 ren4he2 bu4jing4 de5 yi4si5。qing3 yun3xu3 wo3 mai3 dian3 dong1xi1 lai2 zheng4ming2 wo3 de5 zhen1cheng2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} For the community. That terminal is helping "
"people. In a place like this, people need to help each other to get ahead, "
"or even just survive."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​为了​社区​。​这台​终端​在​帮助​人们​。​在​这样​的​地方​，​如果​人们​想要​继续​向前​，​或者​甚至​仅仅​是​生存​下去​，​那​就​得​相互​扶持​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} wei4le5 she4qu1。zhe4 tai2 zhong1duan1 zai4 bang1zhu4 ren2men5。zai4 zhe4yang4 de5 di4fang1，ru2guo3 ren2men5 xiang3yao4 ji4xu4 xiang4qian2，huo4zhe3 shen4zhi4 jin3jin3 shi4 sheng1cun2 xia4qu4，na4 jiu4 de2 xiang1hu4 fu2chi2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} I'll be doing you a favor once I get that "
"code, you know."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​你​让我拿​到​密码​，​就​当​我​欠​你​个人​情​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} ni3 rang4 wo3 na2 dao4 mi4ma3，jiu4 dang1 wo3 qian4 ni3 ge4ren2 qing2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} I'll make things very bad for the Rammbock "
"once I know where their friend is staying."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​等​我​查明​他们​朋友​的​住处​，​我​是​绝对​不会​让​撞锤​帮好​过​的​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} deng3 wo3 cha2ming2 ta1men5 peng2you5 de5 zhu4chu4，wo3 shi4 jue2dui4 bu4hui4 rang4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 hao3 guo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} I've spent enough time on the street to learn"
" how to read a person. And I'm telling you, Marta loves those kids."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​我​在​街头​混​了​这么久​，​自认​能​看透​一个​人​的​内心​。​我​可以​跟​你​说​，​玛​尔塔​是​真的​热爱​这些​孩子​们​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} wo3 zai4 jie1tou2 hun4 le5 zhe4 ma2 jiu3，zi4ren4 neng2 kan4tou4 yi1ge5 ren2 de5 nei4xin1。wo3 ke3yi3 gen1 ni3 shuo1，Ma3er3ta3 shi4 zhen1de5 re4ai4 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5 men5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} If we wanted to kill you, you'd already be "
"dead. You've lived on the street - you know how this works."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​如果​我们​想​杀​你​的话​，​你​早就​死​了​。​你​在​街头​混​了​这么久​，​心里​应该​有数​吧​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} ru2guo3 wo3men5 xiang3 sha1 ni3 de5hua4，ni3 zao3jiu4 si3 le5。ni3 zai4 jie1tou2 hun4 le5 zhe4 ma2 jiu3，xin1li5 ying1gai1 you3shu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} This wouldn't be the first time that "
"something like that hit the streets. Talk with enough sim-junkies and you'll"
" hear all about it."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​像​这样​的​东西​在​街头​流通​也​不是​头​一次​了​。​多​和​一些​拟感​瘾君子​聊聊​，​你​就​什么​都​知道​了​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} xiang4 zhe4yang4 de5 dong1xi1 zai4 jie1tou2 liu2tong1 ye3 bu4shi4 tou2 yi1ci4 le5。duo1 he4 yi1xie1 ni3 gan3 yin3jun1zi3 liao2 liao2，ni3 jiu4 shen2me5 dou1 zhi1dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} To get what you need, sometimes you have to "
"stray outside the lines. You know that as well as I do."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​想要​得偿​所愿​，​有时​就​必须​越界​行事​。​这点​你们​和​我​同样​清楚​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} xiang3yao4 de2 chang2 suo3yuan4，you3shi2 jiu4 bi4xu1 yue4jie4 xing2shi4。zhe4 dian3 ni3men5 he4 wo3 tong2yang4 qing1chu5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} Whoa, easy, man! I'm here to get rid of the "
"spirits. I've just gotta have a quick look around first."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​喂​，​放​轻松​，​伙计​！​我​是​来​清理​精魂​的​。​只不过​我​得​先​四处​检查一下​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} wei2，fang4 qing1song1，huo3ji5！wo3 shi4 lai2 qing1li3 jing1hun2 de5。zhi3bu5guo4 wo3 de2 xian1 si4chu4 jian3 cha2 yi1 xia4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} You don't need to speak in code, I'm not "
"gonna narc on you. Tell me about these \"other options.\""
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​你​不必​跟​我​说​黑话​，​我​不会​告密​的​。​说​说​这些​“​其他​选择​”​吧​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} ni3 bu4bi4 gen1 wo3 shuo1 hei1hua4，wo3 bu4hui4 gao4mi4 de5。shuo1 shuo1 zhe4xie1“qi2ta1 xuan3ze2” ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} You talked about \"productivity enhancers\" "
"earlier. I want to hear a bit more about that."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​你​上次​提到​“​效率​提升​剂​”​来​着​。​我​想​多​了解​一下​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} ni3 shang4ci4 ti2dao4“xiao4lu:4 ti2sheng1 ji4” lai2 zhao2。wo3 xiang3 duo1 liao3jie3 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}} You're not just hurting yourself. You're "
"giving power to *these* assholes."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​你​不​只是​在​伤害​自己​。​正是​你​的​态度​让​*​这些​*​混账​为所欲为​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} ni3 bu4 zhi3shi4 zai4 shang1hai4 zi4ji3。zheng4shi4 ni3 de5 tai4du5 rang4*zhe4xie1*hun4zhang4 wei2suo3yu4wei2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Etiquette: Street{{/CC}}That dumpster ain't yours, pal. It's mine. "
"Look at the gear I'm packing and tell me I'm wrong."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​礼仪​：​街头​{{/CC}}​朋友​，​这个​垃圾箱​不是​你​的​，​是​我​的​。​有种​对​着​我​手里​的​家伙​再说​一遍​。\n"
"{{CC}} li3yi2：jie1tou2 {{/CC}} peng2you5，zhe4ge5 la1ji1xiang1 bu4shi4 ni3 de5，shi4 wo3 de5。you3zhong3 dui4 zhao2 wo3 shou3li3 de5 jia1huo5 zai4shuo1 yi1bian4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Formula: Jazz{{/CC}} I've got a formula for a combat stim. Can you "
"produce something like that?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​配方​：​捷势​{{/CC}}​我​这里​有​份​战斗​兴奋剂​的​配方​。​能​帮​我​做​出来​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} pei4fang1：jie2 shi4 {{/CC}} wo3 zhe4li3 you3 fen4 zhan4dou4 xing1fen4ji4 de5 pei4fang1。neng2 bang1 wo3 zuo4 chu1lai2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Glory's Ring{{/CC}} Because of this, and the photo that it was nailed "
"to. If she were lying, she wouldn't have kept them all these years."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​格洛丽​的​戒指​{{/CC}}​因为​这个​，​以及​和​它​钉​在​一起​的​照片​。​如果​她​在​说谎​的话​，​这些年来​她​也​不会​一直​留着​它们​。\n"
"{{CC}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 jie4zhi5 {{/CC}} yin1wei4 zhe4ge5，yi3ji2 he4 ta1 ding4 zai4 yi1qi3 de5 zhao4pian4。ru2guo3 ta1 zai4 shuo1huang3 de5hua4，zhe4 xie1 nian2 lai2 ta1 ye3 bu4hui4 yi1zhi2 liu2 zhao2 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Impulse Transmitter{{/CC}} {{GM}}Modify the impulse transmitter and "
"replace the signal converter with it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​脉冲​发射器​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​改装​脉冲​发射器​，​用​它​替代​信号​转换器​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} mai4chong1 fa1she4qi4 {{/CC}} {{GM}} gai3zhuang1 mai4chong1 fa1she4qi4，yong4 ta1 ti4dai4 xin4hao4 zhuan3huan4qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} Don't you mean "
"Robin Hood?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​你​说​的​不是​罗宾汉​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} ni3 shuo1 de5 bu4shi4 luo2bin1han4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} It looks like "
"some of those parts are hot-glued together."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​看起来​有些​零件​是​拿​胶水​粘​起来​的​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 ling2jian4 shi4 na2 jiao1shui3 zhan1 qi3lai5 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} There isn't "
"enough information here to know what this \"Panacea\" is, but I can take a "
"guess."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​目前​没有​足够​的​情报​来​确认​这个​“​万能​药​”​是​什么​，​但​我​可以​猜猜​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} mu4qian2 mei2you3 zu2gou4 de5 qing2bao4 lai2 que4ren4 zhe4ge5“wan4neng2 yao4” shi4 shen2me5，dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 cai1 cai1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} {{GM}}Attempt to "
"decipher the language.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​尝试​破译​语言​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard) {{/CC}} {{GM}} chang2shi4 po4yi4 yu3yan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} What if this "
"virus mutates into a strain that can kill *us*, too?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​如果​这种​病毒​经过​变异​之后​也​能​杀死​*​我们​*​呢​？\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} ru2guo3 zhe4zhong3 bing4du2 jing1guo4 bian4yi4 zhi1hou4 ye3 neng2 sha1si3*wo3men5*ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium){{/CC}} You're vat-"
"grown, aren't you? You and your brothers are clones."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​你​是​罐生​的​，​对​吗​？​你​和​你​的​兄弟​们​都​是​克隆人​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} ni3 shi4 guan4 sheng1 de5，dui4 ma5？ni3 he4 ni3 de5 xiong1di4 men5 dou1 shi4 ke4long2ren2。"

msgid "{{CC}}Intelligence: 2{{/CC}} ...You're being sarcastic."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​2​{{/CC}}​……​你​这​是​在​讽刺​我​吧​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：2 {{/CC}}……ni3 zhe4 shi4 zai4 feng3ci4 wo3 ba1。"

msgid "{{CC}}Intelligence: 2{{/CC}} Examine the drone more closely."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​2​{{/CC}}​进一步​检查​无人机​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：2 {{/CC}} jin4yi1bu4 jian3cha2 wu2ren2ji1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 2{{/CC}} Wait a second. That isn't \"it.\" There are "
"some pretty big holes in that story."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​2​{{/CC}}​等​一下​。​并​不是​“​就​这些​”​。​你​这个​故事​里面​有​很大​的​漏洞​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：2 {{/CC}} deng3 yi1xia4。bing4 bu4shi4“jiu4 zhe4xie1”。ni3 zhe4ge5 gu4shi4 li3mian4 you3 hen3 dai4 de5 lou4dong4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 3{{/CC}} Look, those parts can't be irreplaceable. Let "
"me take a look at your terminal. Maybe we can figure something out?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​3​{{/CC}}​听​着​，​那些​零件​不​可能​是​不可​替代​的​。​让​我​看看​你​的​终端​。​也许​我们​可以​想想​办法​？\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：3 {{/CC}} ting1 zhao2，na4xie1 ling2jian4 bu4 ke3neng2 shi4 bu4ke3 ti4dai4 de5。rang4 wo3 kan4kan5 ni3 de5 zhong1duan1。ye3xu3 wo3men5 ke3yi3 xiang3 xiang3 ban4fa3？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 3{{/CC}} So the “forever task” is to protect the green. "
"What is the green, Feuerschwinge?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​3​{{/CC}}​所以​“​永恒​的​使命​”​就是​保护​绿色​。​绿色​是​什么​，​火翼​？\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：3 {{/CC}} suo3yi3“yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4” jiu4shi4 bao3hu4 lu:4se4。lu:4se4 shi4 shen2me5，Huo3yi4？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 3{{/CC}} The “forever task”… is to protect something. "
"Something important. Something sacred."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​3​{{/CC}}​“​永恒​的​使命​”​……​是​保护​某种​重要​而​神圣​的​东西​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：3 {{/CC}}“yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4”……shi4 bao3hu4 mou3zhong3 zhong4yao4 er2 shen2sheng4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 3{{/CC}} You're right next to a walk-in fridge. Don't "
"you think it'd make more sense to drag the body in there than to leave it "
"under the sink?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​3​{{/CC}}​你​就​在​冷藏室​旁边​。​把​尸体​拖进去​不是​比​留在​水槽​下​更​合理​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：3 {{/CC}} ni3 jiu4 zai4 leng3 zang4 shi4 pang2bian1。ba3 shi1ti3 tuo1 jin4 qu4 bu4shi4 bi3 liu2 zai4 shui3cao2 xia4 geng1 he2li3 ma5？"

msgid "{{CC}}Intelligence: 3{{/CC}} {{GM}}Examine the lock further.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​3​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​进一步​检查​锁​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jin4yi1bu4 jian3cha2 suo3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 3{{/CC}} {{GM}}Lie.{{/GM}} Sara needs your elevator key."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​3​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​说谎​。​{{/GM}}​莎拉​要用​你​的​电梯​钥匙​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} shuo1huang3。{{/GM}} sha1la1 yao4 yong4 ni3 de5 dian4ti1 yao4shi5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 3{{/CC}} {{GM}}Lie.{{/GM}} Sara needs your elevator key."
" She says it's important."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​3​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​说谎​。​{{/GM}}​莎拉​要用​你​的​电梯​钥匙​。​她​说​这事​很​重要​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} shuo1huang3。{{/GM}} sha1la1 yao4 yong4 ni3 de5 dian4ti1 yao4shi5。ta1 shuo1 zhe4 shi4 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 3{{/CC}} {{GM}}Point at Kroner.{{/GM}} Do you want to "
