msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​3​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​指指​克​罗纳​。​{{/GM}}​你​打算​沦落​到​给​他​“​干​”​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} zhi3 zhi3 ke4 luo2na4。{{/GM}} ni3 da3suan4 lun2luo4 dao4 gei3 ta1“gan4” ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 4{{/CC}} {{GM}}Recognize the significance of the "
