msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​4​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​识别​闪烁​指示灯​的​含义​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：4 {{/CC}} {{GM}} shi2bie2 shan3shuo4 zhi3 shi4 deng1 de5 han2yi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 5{{/CC}} I can't say for sure what's going on here, but "
