msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​5​{{/CC}}​我​不能​断言​这里​发生​的​事​，​但​我​大概​有​了​些​眉目​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：5 {{/CC}} wo3 bu4neng2 duan4yan2 zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4，dan4 wo3 da4gai4 you3 le5 xie1 mei2mu4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Intelligence: 5{{/CC}} Perhaps a more common part could be modified."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​智力​：​5​{{/CC}}​也许​可以​改装​更​常见​的​部件​。\n"
"{{CC}} zhi4li4：5 {{/CC}} ye3xu3 ke3yi3 gai3zhuang1 geng1 chang2jian4 de5 bu4jian4。"

msgid "{{CC}}Islay Scotch{{/CC}} I've been waiting to crack this bottle open."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​艾雷岛​威士忌​{{/CC}}​我​一直​等​着​开​这瓶​酒​。\n"
"{{CC}} ai4 lei2 dao3 wei1shi4ji4 {{/CC}} wo3 yi1zhi2 deng3 zhao2 kai1 zhe4 ping2 jiu3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Broken Drone{{/CC}} I, uh... \"acquired\" this drone. Can you "
"get it up and running again?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​损坏​的​无人机​{{/CC}}​我​……​“​弄​到​”​了​这架​无人机​。​你​能​让​它​重新​运作​起来​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：sun3huai4 de5 wu2ren2ji1 {{/CC}} wo3……“long4 dao4” le5 zhe4 jia4 wu2ren2ji1。ni3 neng2 rang4 ta1 chong2xin1 yun4zuo4 qi3lai5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Flash{{/CC}} This is being sold on the streets. Can you tell me "
"what's in it?"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​Flash​{{/CC}}​街上​有人​卖​这​东西​。​你​能​告诉​我​里面​有​什么​吗​？\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：Flash {{/CC}} jie1shang5 you3ren2 mai4 zhe4 dong1xi1。ni3 neng2 gao4su4 wo3 li3mian4 you3 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid "{{CC}}Item: Fuse{{/CC}} {{GM}}Add an extra fuse to BTHRM.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​保险丝​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​将​额外​的​保险丝​放入​BTHRM​内​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：bao3xian3si1 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jiang1 e2wai4 de5 bao3xian3si1 fang4ru4 BTHRM nei4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{CC}}Item: Fuse{{/CC}} {{GM}}Add an extra fuse to TRACK.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
