"{{CC}} wu4pin3：bao3xian3si1 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jiang1 e2wai4 de5 bao3xian3si1 fang4ru4 TRACK nei4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Jolt{{/CC}} About your board meeting... I've got something that "
"might help pick you up."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​嗨​翻天​{{/CC}}​关于​你​的​董事会​会议​……​我​有​个​东西​或许​能​帮​你​提提神​。\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：hai1 fan1 tian1 {{/CC}} guan1yu2 ni3 de5 dong3shi4hui4 hui4yi4……wo3 you3 ge4 dong1xi1 huo4xu3 neng2 bang1 ni3 ti2 ti2 shen2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Jolt{{/CC}} Hey, I've got a little something here. Sounds like "
"just what you need."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​嗨​翻天​{{/CC}}​我​这里​有点​东西​。​听​起来​正是​你​需要​的​。\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：hai1 fan1 tian1 {{/CC}} wo3 zhe4li3 you3dian3 dong1xi1。ting1 qi3lai5 zheng4shi4 ni3 xu1yao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Journal{{/CC}} I found this ledger... I don't recognize the "
"language, but it looks Scandinavian."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​日志​{{/CC}}​我​找到​了​这本​账簿​……​我​不​认得​上面​的​语言​，​但​看起来​像是​斯堪的纳维亚​语系​。\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：ri4zhi4 {{/CC}} wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 zhe4 ben3 zhang4bu4……wo3 bu4 ren4de5 shang4mian4 de5 yu3yan2，dan4 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 si1kan1di4na4wei2ya4 yu3xi4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Journal{{/CC}} Well, I found this ledger... I don't recognize "
"the language, but it looks Scandinavian."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​日志​{{/CC}}​我​找到​了​这本​账簿​……​我​不​认得​上面​的​语言​，​但​看起来​像是​斯堪的纳维亚​语系​。\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：ri4zhi4 {{/CC}} wo3 zhao3dao4 le5 zhe4 ben3 zhang4bu4……wo3 bu4 ren4de5 shang4mian4 de5 yu3yan2，dan4 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 si1kan1di4na4wei2ya4 yu3xi4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Maintenance Manual{{/CC}} I found this on his body. Maybe you "
"could give it to them."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​维护​手册​{{/CC}}​我​从​他​的​尸体​上​找到​了​这个​。​也许​你​能​转​交给​他​的​家人​。\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：wei2hu4 shou3ce4 {{/CC}} wo3 cong2 ta1 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 zhao3dao4 le5 zhe4ge5。ye3xu3 ni3 neng2 zhuai3 jiao1gei3 ta1 de5 jia1ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Melted Simsense Chip{{/CC}} Yeah. I pried his chipjack open and "
"found a blob of melted plastic inside. It was still warm to the touch."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​熔化​的​拟感​芯片​{{/CC}}​嗯​，​我​撬开​了​他​的​芯片​插口​，​在​里面​发现​了​一团​熔化​的​塑料​。​摸上去​还​有些​温度​。\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：rong2hua4 de5 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4 {{/CC}} en1，wo3 qiao4kai1 le5 ta1 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3，zai4 li3mian4 fa1xian4 le5 yi1 tuan2 rong2hua4 de5 su4liao4。mo1 shang4 qu4 hai2 you3xie1 wen1du4。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Item: Simsense Chip{{/CC}} There are a pair of courier drones in the "
"other room. No markings - they looked custom-built. One of them had been "
"slagged, but the other had this chip in its storage compartment."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​物品​：​拟感​芯片​{{/CC}}​另​一个​房间​里​有​两架​快递​无人机​。​没有​标记​，​看起来​是​自行​改装​的​。​其中​一架​已经​损坏​，​但​另​一架​的​货舱​里​有​块​芯片​。\n"
"{{CC}} wu4pin3：ni3 gan3 xin1pian4 {{/CC}} ling4 yi1ge5 fang2jian1 li3 you3 liang3 jia4 kuai4di4 wu2ren2ji1。mei2you3 biao1ji4，kan4qi3lai5 shi4 zi4xing2 gai3zhuang1 de5。qi2zhong1 yi1 jia4 yi3jing1 sun3huai4，dan4 ling4 yi1 jia4 de5 huo4cang1 li3 you3 kuai4 xin1pian4。"

msgid "{{CC}}Keycard E{{/CC}} All right, Phil. Here's the keycard."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​门禁卡​E​{{/CC}}​好​吧​，​菲尔​，​这是​门禁卡​。\n"
"{{CC}} men2 jin1 ka3 E {{/CC}} hao3 ba1，fei1 er3，zhe4 shi4 men2 jin1 ka3。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Keycard E{{/CC}} Yeah, I've got it, but there's something that I want "
"to talk with you about first."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​门禁卡​E​{{/CC}}​是​的​，​但​我​想​先​和​你​谈谈​。\n"
"{{CC}} men2 jin1 ka3 E {{/CC}} shi4 de5，dan4 wo3 xiang3 xian1 he4 ni3 tan2tan2。"

msgid "{{CC}}Keycard E{{/CC}} Yes, actually. I've got it right here."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​门禁卡​E​{{/CC}}​是​的​，​在​这​呢​。\n"
"{{CC}} men2 jin1 ka3 E {{/CC}} shi4 de5，zai4 zhe4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Keycard{{/CC}} {{GM}}Swipe your keycard through the reader.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​门禁卡​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​把​你​的​门禁卡​用​在​读卡器​上​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} men2 jin1 ka3 {{/CC}} {{GM}} ba3 ni3 de5 men2 jin1 ka3 yong4 zai4 du2ka3qi4 shang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Mystery Box{{/CC}} {{GM}}Give Blitz the box.{{/GM}} All right, Blitz. "
"I guess that you've earned this, whatever it is."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​谜​匣​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​交给​布里​茨​。​{{/GM}}​好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​我​想​你​为​自己​赢得​了​这​东西​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4 xia2 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jiao1gei3 Bu4li3ci2。{{/GM}} hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。wo3 xiang3 ni3 wei2 zi4ji3 ying2de2 le5 zhe4 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Mystery Box{{/CC}} {{GM}}Hand it to him.{{/GM}} Here's your Mystery "
"Box, Blitz. Enjoy."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​谜​匣​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​交给​他​。​{{/GM}}​这​是​你​要​的​谜​匣​，​布里​茨​。​不​客气​。\n"
"{{CC}} mei4 xia2 {{/CC}} {{GM}} jiao1gei3 ta1。{{/GM}} zhe4 shi4 ni3 yao4 de5 mei4 xia2，Bu4li3ci2。bu4 ke4qi5。"

msgid "{{CC}}Nod at her.{{/CC}} Thanks."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​朝​她​点头​。​{{/CC}}​谢谢​。\n"
"{{CC}} chao2 ta1 dian3tou2。{{/CC}} xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Quickness: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy){{/CC}} {{GM}}Duck and hide "
"behind the nearest desk.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​敏捷​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​躲​在​最近​的​桌子​后面​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} min3jie2：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Easy) {{/CC}} {{GM}} duo3 zai4 zui4jin4 de5 zhuo1zi5 hou4mian5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Quickness: $(story.Global_Skillcheck_Hard){{/CC}} {{GM}}Attack before "
