msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​敏捷​：​$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium)​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​先发制人​。​{{/GM}}​闭嘴​受死​吧​。\n"
"{{CC}} min3jie2：$(story.Global_Skillcheck_Medium) {{/CC}} {{GM}} xian1fa1zhi4ren2。{{/GM}} bi4zui3 shou4si3 ba1。"

