"{{CC}}​敏捷​：​4​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​避开​对方​视线​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} min3jie2：4 {{/CC}} {{GM}} bi4kai1 dui4fang1 shi4xian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{CC}}Quickness: 5{{/CC}} {{GM}}Attack before she can react.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​敏捷​：​5​{{/CC}}​{{GM}}​趁​她​不备​抢先​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{CC}} min3jie2：5 {{/CC}} {{GM}} chen4 ta1 bu4bei4 qiang3xian1 gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{CC}}Race: Elf{{/CC}} Oh, come off it. Elves are not, on the whole, any "
"more or less magical than anyone else. I'm in a position to know."
msgstr ""
"{{CC}}​种族​：​精灵​{{/CC}}​拉倒​吧​，​精灵​和​其他​种族​的​魔法​属性​没什么​高下​之分​。​你​骗​别人​还​能​骗​得​了​我​吗​。\n"
