msgid ""
"{{GM}} He blows a raspberry beneath his prodigious mustache, sounding more "
"like a revving motor than a bilabial trill.{{/GM}} I don't give two hoots "
"and a holler what Maliit thinks. She does respectable work. When I was her "
"age, I was into keeping up with the State of the Art myself. As I grow older"
" though, I find there's a bit of joy to be had fixing things older than I "
"am. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​吹​了​个​口哨​。​浓密​的​胡须​让​这​声音​比起​双唇​颤音​更​像是​发动机​的​轰鸣​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​才​不在乎​玛丽​特​怎么​想​。​她​确实​干得​不错​，​我​还​在​她​那个​年纪​的​时候​，​也​热衷于​紧跟​时代​潮流​。​不过​随着​年纪​渐长​，​我​发现​修理​比​我​还​老​的​东西​倒​也​有​几分​乐趣​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chui1 le5 ge4 kou3shao4。nong2mi4 de5 hu2xu1 rang4 zhe4 sheng1yin1 bi3qi3 shuang1 chun2 chan4yin1 geng1 xiang4 shi4 fa1dong4ji1 de5 hong1ming2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai2 bu4zai4hu5 ma3li4 te4 zen3me5 xiang3。ta1 que4shi2 gan4 de2 bu4cuo4，wo3 hai2 zai4 ta1 na4ge5 nian2ji4 de5 shi2hou5，ye3 re4 zhong1 yu2 jin3gen1 shi2dai4 chao2liu2。bu4guo4 sui2zhe5 nian2ji4 jian1 zhang3，wo3 fa1xian4 xiu1li3 bi3 wo3 hai2 lao3 de5 dong1xi1 dao3 ye3 you3 ji3fen1 le4qu4。"

