"​\n"
"​我​没​意见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} $+(s.he) ting2dun4 pian4ke4，yong4 tiao1ti5 de5 mu4guang1 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，ran2hou4 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
