msgid ""
"{{GM}}A bitter half-grin spreads across his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You still plan to kill me? Good.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}His hands curl into fists, and he slams one down on his control panel. A hollow ringing sound fills the air, and Vauclair winces in pain.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have nothing more to live for anyway. You'd be doing me a favor."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​脸上​浮现​出​一抹​苦涩​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​仍然​打算​杀​了​我​？​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​的​双手​紧握​成拳​，​重重​砸​在​控制面板​上​。​一阵​空洞​的​鸣响​声​在​空气​中​回荡​，​沃​克莱尔​因​疼痛​而​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我本​就​没什么​活下去​的​念​想​了​。​你​这样​也​算是​在​帮​我​解脱​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 ma1 ku3se4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 reng2ran2 da3suan4 sha1 le5 wo3？hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2，chong2chong2 za2 zai4 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 shang4。yi1zhen4 kong1dong4 de5 ming2 xiang3 sheng1 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4 hui2dang4，Wo4ke4lai2er3 yin1 teng2tong4 er2 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3 jiu4 mei2shen2me5 huo2xia4qu4 de5 nian4 xiang3 le5。ni3 zhe4yang4 ye3 suan4shi4 zai4 bang1 wo3 jie3tuo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A cold smile flickers across his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good. Sometimes a little mess is... necessary."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​脸上​划过​一丝​冰冷​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。​有时候​麻烦​一点​……​也​是​必要​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 hua2guo4 yi1 si1 bing1leng3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。you3shi2hou5 ma2fan5 yi1dian3……ye3 shi4 bi4yao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A cold smile flickers across his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good. That is good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​脸上​划过​一丝​冰冷​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​。​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 hua2guo4 yi1 si1 bing1leng3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3。hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A confused scowl crosses her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't even *know* you, buddy. Why in God's name would I leave you alone with a panel that *I'm* responsible for?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸上​露出​困惑​而​不耐烦​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​都​*​不​认识​*​你​，​伙计​。​我​凭​什么​要​让​你​来​单独​摆弄​一块​该​*​我​*​负责​的​控制板​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 kun4huo4 er2 bu4nai4fan2 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1*bu4 ren4shi5*ni3，huo3ji5。wo3 ping2 shen2me5 yao4 rang4 ni3 lai2 dan1du2 bai3nong4 yi1kuai4 gai1*wo3*fu4ze2 de5 kong4 zhi4 ban3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A curious expression flits across her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Let's.\n"
"\n"
"I've been waiting for this for a long time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​脸上​闪过​一丝​异样​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​。​走​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为​这​一刻​，​我​等​得​太久​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 yi4yang4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3。zou3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wei2 zhe4 yi1 ke4，wo3 deng3 de2 tai4 jiu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A deep, trollish voice rumbles out of the media center's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I, Titonius Rex, will DEFEND my REALM! I do so swear it before my MAGIC SWORD, *ARGO-NAR!*\n"
"\n"
"THIS, I DO SWEAR!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​媒体库​的​扬声器​中​传来​低沉​、​粗犷​的​巨魔般​嗓音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​，​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​，​将​誓死捍卫​我​的​王国​！​我​在​我​的​魔剑​*​阿尔​戈纳尔​*​面前​庄严​宣誓​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​的​誓言​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mei2 ti3 ku4 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2lai2 di1chen2、cu1guang3 de5 ju4 mo2 ban1 sang3yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3，Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1，jiang1 shi4 si3 han4 wei4 wo3 de5 wang2guo2！wo3 zai4 wo3 de5 mo2 jian4*e1 er3 ge1 na4 er3*mian4qian2 zhuang1yan2 xuan1shi4！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 shi4yan2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A downcast look crosses the ghoul's face. It looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ah. I... I am not surprised.\n"
"\n"
"He sees us as monsters, and he intends to force us into acting like monsters. His own pack of \"mindless creatures\" to command."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​食尸​鬼​的​脸上​露出​沮丧​的​神情​。​它​转过​头去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​。​我​……​对此​并​不​惊讶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​把​我们​视作​怪物​，​并且​想要​强迫​我们​像​怪物​一样​做事​。​做​他​手底下​的​“​无脑​怪物​”​，​是​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi2 shi1 gui3 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 ju3sang4 de5 shen2qing2。ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1。wo3……dui4 ci3 bing4 bu4 jing1ya4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 ba3 wo3men5 shi4zuo4 guai4wu5，bing4qie3 xiang3yao4 qiang3po4 wo3men5 xiang4 guai4wu5 yi1yang4 zuo4shi4。zuo4 ta1 shou3 de5 xia4 de5“wu2nao3 guai4wu5”，shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A dry chuckle turns into a rasping cough.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll take your opinions on what is right with a grain of salt, shadowrunner.\n"
"\n"
"When viewed through the lens of history, my Panacea will be remembered as the key to our species' salvation. I won't live to see it, but it will happen, regardless of your beliefs to the contrary."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​干涩​的​笑声​转为​沙哑​的​咳嗽​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对​你​所谓​的​“​正确​”​意见​持​保留​态度​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​历史​的​角度​来看​，​我​的​“​万能​药​”​将​被​视为​我们​物种​得救​的​关键​。​我​无法​亲眼​见证​这​一天​，​但​它​终将​发生​，​无论​你​是否​相信​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gan1se4 de5 xiao4sheng1 zhuai3 wei2 sha1ya3 de5 ke2sou5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ni3 suo3wei4 de5“zheng4que4” yi4jian4 chi2 bao3liu2 tai4du5，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 li4shi3 de5 jiao3du4 lai2 kan4，wo3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4” jiang1 bei4 shi4wei2 wo3men5 wu4zhong3 de2jiu4 de5 guan1jian4。wo3 wu2fa3 qin1yan3 jian4zheng4 zhe4 yi1 tian1，dan4 ta1 zhong1 jiang1 fa1sheng1，wu2lun4 ni3 shi4fou3 xiang1xin4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A faint smile plays across the normally taciturn merchant's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, and my people have already retreived the shipment - exactly where you said it would be. Good work.\n"
"\n"
"How were you able to manage that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一向​沉默寡言​的​商人​脸上​露出​了​淡淡的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我​的​人​已经​收回​了​货物​，​就​在​你​说​的​地方​。​干得​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​怎么​做到​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1xiang4 chen2mo4gua3yan2 de5 shang1ren2 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 le5 dan4 dan4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 de5 ren2 yi3jing1 shou1hui2 le5 huo4wu4，jiu4 zai4 ni3 shuo1 de5 di4fang1。gan4 de2 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zuo4dao4 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A faint smile plays across the normally taciturn merchant's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, this much I know already. The missing shipment arrived just before you did... though I barely caught a glimpse of those who delivered it.\n"
"\n"
"How were you able to manage that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一向​沉默寡言​的​商人​脸上​露出​了​淡淡的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​这​一点​我​已经​知道​了​。​那批​失踪​的​货物​就​在​你​来​之前​刚刚​到达​……​虽然​我​几乎​没​看到​送货​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​怎么​做到​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1xiang4 chen2mo4gua3yan2 de5 shang1ren2 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 le5 dan4 dan4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，zhe4 yi1dian3 wo3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 le5。na4 pi1 shi1zong1 de5 huo4wu4 jiu4 zai4 ni3 lai2 zhi1qian2 gang1gang5 dao4da2……sui1ran2 wo3 ji1hu1 mei2 kan4dao4 song4huo4 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 zen3me5 zuo4dao4 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A few minutes and a diagram scrawled on a napkin later, Burakgazi nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes... yes. This should be doable.\n"
"\n"
"I thank you for your expertise, and for your discretion. Don't tell your secret to your friend - he will tell it to his friend."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​抓​过​一张​餐巾纸​，​在​上面​潦草​地画​满​图解​。​几分钟​后​，​布拉加​齐朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​……​没错​。​这样​应该​能​行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​感谢​你​的​专业​意见​，​以及​你​的​谨慎​。​别​把​秘密​告诉​朋友​—​—​他会​转告​他​的​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 zhua1 guo4 yi1 zhang1 can1jin1zhi3，zai4 shang4mian4 liao2cao3 de5 hua4 man3 tu2jie3。ji1 fen4 zhong1 hou4，bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……mei2cuo4。zhe4yang4 ying1gai1 neng2 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 de5 zhuan1ye4 yi4jian4，yi3ji2 ni3 de5 jin3shen4。bie4 ba3 mi4mi4 gao4su4 peng2you5——ta1 hui4 zhuan3gao4 ta1 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A few seconds pass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Done and done. No need to worry about that anymore!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​过​了​几秒钟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​全部​搞定​。​不用​再​担心​这个​了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} guo4 le5 ji1 miao3 zhong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"quan2bu4 gao3ding4。bu4yong4 zai4 dan1xin1 zhe4ge5 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A flicker of irritation passes over his face. He reluctantly turns back to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, yes... I suppose that I do.\n"
"\n"
"Go ahead, tell me. I'm all ears."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​脸上​划过​一丝​恼火​。​他​不​情愿​地​转过身​来​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​是​是​……​我​是​得​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​吧​。​我​洗耳恭听​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 hua2guo4 yi1 si1 nao3huo3。ta1 bu4 qing2yuan4 de5 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4……wo3 shi4 de2 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ba1。wo3 xi3er3gong1ting1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A flicker of surprise crosses over Schrotty's face, but he keeps his composure.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You drive a hard bargain, friend. But it's not every day people ask to buy anything from me, so it's yours.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He swipes the ancient device from the table and presses it into your hands. The plastic is scuffed and worn, and it rattles a bit when you move it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​施罗蒂​的​脸上​闪过​一丝​惊讶​，​但​他​很快​恢复​了​镇定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​压价​够​狠​的​啊​，​朋友​。​不过​我​也​不是​每天​都​能​做成​生意​，​这​东西​就​归​你​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​从​桌上​抄起​那台​老旧​的​设备​，​递到​你​手中​。​播放器​的​塑料​外壳​布满​划痕​且​磨损​严重​，​轻轻​晃动​时​还​能​听见​咔嗒​作响​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 de5 lian3 shang4 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 jing1ya4，dan4 ta1 hen3 kuai4 hui1fu4 le5 zhen4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ya1jia4 gou4 hen3 de5 a1，peng2you5。bu4guo4 wo3 ye3 bu4shi4 mei3tian1 dou1 neng2 zuo4 cheng2 sheng1yi4，zhe4 dong1xi1 jiu4 gui1 ni3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 zhuo1 shang4 chao1 qi3 na4 tai2 lao3jiu4 de5 she4bei4，di4 dao4 ni3 shou3 zhong4。bo1 fang4 qi4 de5 su4liao4 wai4ke2 bu4man3 hua2hen2 qie3 mo2sun3 yan2zhong4，qing1qing1 huang4dong4 shi2 hai2 neng2 ting1jian4 ka1da1 zuo4 xiang3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A frown crosses her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Either you’re trying to be cute, or you’ve completely missed the point.\n"
"\n"
"Neither would surprise me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要么​你​是​在​耍​小聪明​，​要么​你​完全​没​明白​我​的​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对​两者​都​并​不​感到​奇怪​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4me5 ni3 shi4 zai4 shua3 xiao3cong1ming5，yao4me5 ni3 wan2quan2 mei2 ming2bai5 wo3 de5 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 liang3zhe3 dou1 bing4 bu4 gan3dao4 qi2guai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A frown crosses the Monika-image's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're being unreasonable, ace. Unreasonable and foolish.\n"
"\n"
"Is the death of Monika Schäfer coloring your judgment? If so, I am sorry."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​太​不讲道理​了​，​王牌​。​而且​还​十分​愚蠢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​的​死​影响​了​你​的​判断​吗​？​如果​是​这样​，​我​深表遗憾​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 tai4 bu4 jiang3 dao4 li3 le5，wang2pai2。er2qie3 hai2 shi2fen1 yu2chun3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 de5 si3 ying3xiang3 le5 ni3 de5 pan4duan4 ma5？ru2guo3 shi4 zhe4yang4，wo3 shen1 biao3 yi2 han4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A heavy sigh comes over the speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are we resorting to name-calling, $(l.name)? Truly?\n"
"\n"
"You are a thief, a murderer, and a criminal. You have no moral ground here. How many people did you and your team butcher to get here? Dozens, easily. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扬声器​中​传来​一声​沉重​的​叹息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​对​我​进行​人身攻击​吗​，​$(l.name)​？​真的​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​小偷​、​杀人犯​和​罪犯​。​你​在​这里​没有​道德​立场​。​你​和​你​的​团队​为了​来到​这里​杀害​了​多少​人​？​起码​随随便便​也​有​数十​人​了​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2lai2 yi1sheng1 chen2zhong4 de5 tan4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 dui4 wo3 jin4xing2 ren2shen1gong1ji1 ma5，$(l.name)？zhen1de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 xiao3tou1、sha1ren2fan4 he4 zui4fan4。ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 mei2you3 dao4de2 li4chang3。ni3 he4 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 wei4le5 lai2dao4 zhe4li3 sha1hai4 le5 duo1shao3 ren2？qi3ma3 sui2 sui2 bian4 bian4 ye3 you3 shu3 shi2 ren2 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A heavy sigh comes over the speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I must admit that I have thought that very thing in my weaker hours. In the morning, as my dreams recede and conscious thought returns. \n"
"\n"
"In that gray state, I’ve lain in my bed, alone, and wrestled with the thought."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扬声器​中​传来​一声​沉重​的​叹息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​承认​，​在​我​意志薄弱​的​时刻​，​我​也​曾​有​过​这样​的​想法​。​在​清晨​时分​，​当​我​的​梦境​消散​，​意识​逐渐​恢复​时​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​那种​模糊​的​状态​下​，​我​独自​躺​在​床上​，​与​这个​念头​搏斗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2lai2 yi1sheng1 chen2zhong4 de5 tan4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 cheng2ren4，zai4 wo3 yi4 zhi4 bao2 ruo4 de5 shi2ke4，wo3 ye3 ceng2 you3 guo4 zhe4yang4 de5 xiang3fa3。zai4 qing1chen2 shi2fen1，dang1 wo3 de5 meng4jing4 xiao1san4，yi4shi2 zhu2jian4 hui1fu4 shi2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 na4zhong3 mo2hu5 de5 zhuang4tai4 xia4，wo3 du2zi4 tang3 zai4 chuang2 shang4，yu4 zhe4ge5 nian4tou5 bo2dou4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A heavy sigh comes over the speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My place in history is of no concern to me, I assure you. My ego has no role in this. \n"
"\n"
"I am trying to do what is right. What will secure humanity’s future. That is all this has ever been about!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扬声器​中​传来​一声​沉重​的​叹息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你​保证​，​我​根本​不在乎​自己​在历史上​的​地位​。​我​的​自尊心​对此​毫不关心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​正在​努力​做​正确​的​事​。​确保​人类​的​未来​。​这​就是​这​一切​的​全部​意义​所在​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2lai2 yi1sheng1 chen2zhong4 de5 tan4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，wo3 gen1ben3 bu4zai4hu5 zi4ji3 zai4 li4 shi3 shang4 de5 di4wei4。wo3 de5 zi4zun1xin1 dui4 ci3 hao2 bu4 guan1 xin1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng4zai4 nu3li4 zuo4 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。que4bao3 ren2lei4 de5 wei4lai2。zhe4 jiu4shi4 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 quan2bu4 yi4yi4 suo3zai4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A high-pitched, creaky voice shrieks out from the intercom.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"GO AWAY! I won't let you let any spirits in here! You can't hurt me behind my door! No, you can't!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​对讲机​里​传来​尖锐​而​沙哑​的​嘶吼​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走开​！​我​不会​让​你​把​任何​精魂​带进来​的​！​我​躲​在​门​后​，​你​伤​不到​我​！​你​不能​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dui4jiang3ji1 li3 chuan2lai2 jian1rui4 er2 sha1ya3 de5 si1hou3 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3kai1！wo3 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 ba3 ren4he2 jing1hun2 dai4 jin4 lai2 de5！wo3 duo3 zai4 men2 hou4，ni3 shang1 bu4dao4 wo3！ni3 bu4neng2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A locked supply locker rests here on the ground, its combination pad "
"glowing faintly.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一个​上锁​的​物资​储物柜​静静地​躺​在​地上​，​密码锁​的​显示屏​微微​发光​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} yi1ge5 shang4suo3 de5 wu4zi1 chu3wu4gui4 jing4 jing4 de5 tang3 zai4 di4shang5，mi4ma3suo3 de5 xian3shi4ping2 wei1wei1 fa1guang1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A lovely, musical laugh pours through the vent.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You too, dear heart. All of you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一阵​优美​的​，​如​音乐​般​悦耳​的​笑声​从​通风口​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​也​是​，​亲爱​的​。​还有​大家​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1zhen4 you1mei3 de5，ru2 yin1yue4 ban1 yue4er3 de5 xiao4sheng1 cong2 tong1feng1kou3 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3 shi4，qin1ai4 de5。hai2you3 da4jia1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A low growl, amplified by the speakers in the guard's helmet, reverberates in your ears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Watch it. They might think you're hilarious back at the office, but there's nothing I hate more than a wiseass."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一声​低沉​的​咆哮​，​经由​守卫​头盔​内​的​扬声器​放大​，​在​你​的​耳畔​回荡​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说话​注意​点​。​办公室​里​的​人​或许​觉得​你​很​搞笑​，​但​我​最​讨厌​的​就是​这种​耍​小聪明​的​家伙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1sheng1 di1chen2 de5 pao2xiao4，jing1you2 shou3wei4 tou2kui1 nei4 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 fang4da4，zai4 ni3 de5 er3pan4 hui2dang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1hua4 zhu4yi4 dian3。ban4gong1shi4 li3 de5 ren2 huo4xu3 jue2de5 ni3 hen3 gao3xiao4，dan4 wo3 zui4 tao3yan4 de5 jiu4shi4 zhe4zhong3 shua3 xiao3cong1ming5 de5 jia1huo5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A matronly woman with a round face and kind eyes greets you. Her apron is caked with what looks like about a year's worth of grease.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Guten Tag! What can I get you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一位​面容​圆润​、​慈眉善目​的​妇人​向​你​打招呼​。​她​的​围裙​上​沾满​了​多年​的​油渍​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​！​想要​点​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 wei4 mian4rong2 yuan2run4、ci2mei2shan4mu4 de5 fu4ren2 xiang4 ni3 da3zhao1hu5。ta1 de5 wei2qun2 shang4 zhan1man3 le5 duo1nian2 de5 you2 zi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3！xiang3yao4 dian3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A mix of surprise and elation plays across Hasenkamp's face. If he knows why this is happening, he doesn't show it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Must be my lucky day."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​的​脸上​浮现​出​惊讶​与​欣喜​交织​的​神情​。​若​他​知晓​此事​缘由​，​此刻​也​未曾​流露​半分​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​今天​真是​走运​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 jing1ya4 yu4 xin1xi3 jiao1zhi1 de5 shen2qing2。ruo4 ta1 zhi1xiao3 ci3shi4 yuan2you2，ci3ke4 ye3 wei4ceng2 liu2lu4 ban4fen1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jin1tian1 zhen1shi5 zou3yun4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A moment later, the Watcher IC flickers apologetically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"SECONDARY SECURITY VERIFICATION :: APPROVED. SUPERUSER STATUS VERIFIED.\n"
"\n"
"QUERY: HOW MAY I HELP YOU TODAY?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​片刻​之后​，​观察者​IC​发出​歉意​的​闪光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​二次​安全​验证​ ​:​:​ ​已​通过​。​超级​用户​身份​已​验证​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​查询​：​今日​你​有何​需要​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，guan1cha2zhe3 IC fa1chu1 qian4yi4 de5 shan3guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er4ci4 an1quan2 yan4zheng4  :: yi3 tong1guo4。chao1ji2 yong4hu4 shen1fen4 yi3 yan4zheng4。\n"
"\n"
"cha2xun2：jin1ri4 ni3 you3 he2 xu1yao4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A moment later, the intercom system crackles to life again. The familiar synthetic voice of the facility's mainframe drones out of the speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Emergency system purge complete."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​片刻​之后​，​对​讲​系统​再次​噼啪​作响​。​扬声器​里​传来​设施​主机​那​熟悉​的​合成​音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​紧急​系统​清除​已​完成​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，dui4 jiang3 xi4tong3 zai4ci4 pi1pa1 zuo4 xiang3。yang2sheng1qi4 li3 chuan2lai2 she4shi1 zhu3ji1 na4 shu2xi1 de5 he2cheng2 yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin3ji2 xi4tong3 qing1chu2 yi3 wan2cheng2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A momentary expression of doubt flickers across her face, but she squashes it down. The frown that replaces it is hard and angry.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's put an end to all of this. First the Spirit, then Harrow - we'll make them *suffer* for what they've done.\n"
"\n"
"Feuerstelle dies *tonight.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​脸上​闪过​一丝​怀疑​，​随即​被​她​强行​压​了​下去​。​取而代之​的​是​冷​硬​而​愤怒​的​皱眉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​了结​这​一切​。​先​干掉​精魂​，​然后​是​哈罗​。​我们​要​让​他们​为​自己​的​所作所为​付出​*​代价​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​火坑​”​将​在​*​今晚​*​消亡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 huai2yi2，sui2ji2 bei4 ta1 qiang2xing2 ya1 le5 xia4qu4。qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 leng3 ying4 er2 fen4nu4 de5 zhou4mei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 liao3jie2 zhe4 yi1qie4。xian1 gan4diao4 jing1hun2，ran2hou4 shi4 ha1luo2。wo3men5 yao4 rang4 ta1men5 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 suo3zuo4suo3wei2 fu4chu1*dai4jia4*。\n"
"\n"
"“huo3keng1” jiang1 zai4*jin1wan3*xiao1wang2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A momentary look of confusion crosses the dwarf's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, hell, I'm sorry. I didn't mean nothin' by it.\n"
"\n"
"'Round these parts, \"trog\" is... well, I guess you'd call it a \"term of endearment.\" Sort of an ironic thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​脸上​闪过​一丝​疑惑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​，​不好意思​，​我​没有​恶意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​按​我们​的话​讲​，​“​穴居人​”​这个​词​……​你​可以​当成​是​一种​“​爱称​”​，​带有​一点点​调侃​的​意味​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 lian3 shang4 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 yi2huo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1，bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3 mei2you3 e4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"an4 wo3men5 de5hua4 jiang3，“xue2ju1ren2” zhe4ge5 ci2……ni3 ke3yi3 dang4cheng2 shi4 yi1zhong3“ai4cheng1”，dai4you3 yi1dian3dian3 tiao2kan3 de5 yi4wei4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A monotone, pitch-adjusted voice begins speaking almost immediately.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Schockwellenreiter's contact for this kiez is no more. $(l.name) is listed as a follow up contact.\n"
"\n"
"This is our only secured line to this kiez. Please listen to the following instructions carefully, if you are a supporter of our cause."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一个​单调​且​经过​变声​处理​的​声音​几乎​立即​响起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​电波​骑士​在​本​街区​的​联络人​已​不复存在​。​$(l.name)​被​列为​后续​联络人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​我们​对​该​街区​唯一​的​保密​线路​。​若​你​支持​我们​的​事业​，​请​仔细​聆听​以下​指示​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1ge5 dan1diao4 qie3 jing1guo4 bian4sheng1 chu3li3 de5 sheng1yin1 ji1hu1 li4ji2 xiang3qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
