"{{GM}}​他​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以前​没见​过​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不好意思​，​我​得​通知​安保​处​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3qian2 mei2 jian4 guo4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3 de2 tong1zhi1 an1bao3 chu3 le5。"

