"{{GM}}​一个套​着​破旧​外套​的​瘦弱​少年​直勾勾​地​盯​着​格洛丽​的​殖装​手臂​，​嘴巴​大张​。​他​开口​时​声音​嘶哑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​都​经历​了​什么​？​你​的​胳膊​……​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 ge4 tao4 zhao2 po4jiu4 wai4tao4 de5 shou4ruo4 shao4nian2 zhi2gou1gou1 de5 ding1 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 de5 zhi2 zhuang1 shou3bi4，zui3ba5 dai4 zhang1。ta1 kai1kou3 shi2 sheng1yin1 si1ya3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dou1 jing1li4 le5 shen2me5？ni3 de5 ge1bo5……？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A shrill voice crackles over the building's intercom system. It reverberates through the empty streets.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You will NOT threaten this $(l.man), Jubuthon dog!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一个​刺耳​的​声音​通过​大楼​的​广播系统​响起​，​在​空旷​的​街道​上​回荡​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不准​你们​威胁​这个​$(l.man)​，​朱布松​的​走狗​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1ge5 ci4er3 de5 sheng1yin1 tong1guo4 da4lou2 de5 yan3 bo1 xi4 tong3 xiang3qi3，zai4 kong1kuang4 de5 jie1dao4 shang4 hui2dang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4zhun3 ni3men5 wei1xie2 zhe4ge5 $(l.man)，zhu1 bu4 song1 de5 zou3gou3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A sob wracks her chest. She begins to hyperventilate.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can never get away from this. This is going to follow me for the rest of my life.\n"
"\n"
"I killed people. I'm a fucking *MURDERER!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一声​呜咽​从​她​的​胸中​传来​。​她​开始​急促​地​喘息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​永远​无法​摆脱​这个​。​它​将​伴随​我​余生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​杀了人​。​我​他​妈成​了​*​杀人犯​*​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1sheng1 wu1ye4 cong2 ta1 de5 xiong1zhong1 chuan2lai2。ta1 kai1shi3 ji2cu4 de5 chuan3xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 yong3yuan3 wu2fa3 bai3tuo1 zhe4ge5。ta1 jiang1 ban4sui2 wo3 yu2sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 sha1 le5 ren2。wo3 ta1 ma1 cheng2 le5*sha1ren2fan4*！"

