msgid ""
"{{GM}}A startled giggle pours out of Marta's mouth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hell is a myth, $(l.name). There's no such place... not really."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​口中​发出​惊恐​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​地狱​只是​个​神话​，​$(l.name)​。​没有​这样​的​地方​……​没有​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 kou3 zhong4 fa1chu1 jing1kong3 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"di4yu4 zhi3shi4 ge4 shen2hua4，$(l.name)。mei2you3 zhe4yang4 de5 di4fang1……mei2you3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A stout, old man looks up from whatever old tech he’s tinkering with to squint at you through thick, old-fashioned glasses. He pushes them up with an oil-stained finger as he straightens up to nod at you. He speaks with a gruff, but well-meaning tone, heavily accented with German tonality.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Guten Tag. What can I do fer ya?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一位​身材​健硕​的​老人​从​他​正在​摆弄​的​老旧​科技​产品​中​抬起​头​，​透过​厚重​的​老式​眼镜​眯眼​打量​着​你​。​他用​满​是​油污​的​手指​推​了​推​镜框​，​直​起​身子​朝​你​点头​致意​。​他​说话​带​着​浓重​的​德国​口音​，​有些​粗鲁​，​但​听得出​很​是​热心​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​有​啥事​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 wei4 shen1cai2 jian4shuo4 de5 lao3ren2 cong2 ta1 zheng4zai4 bai3nong4 de5 lao3jiu4 ke1ji4 chan3pin3 zhong4 tai2qi3 tou2，tou4guo4 hou4zhong4 de5 lao3shi4 yan3jing4 mi1yan3 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3。ta1yong4 man3 shi4 you2wu1 de5 shou3zhi3 tui1 le5 tui1 jing4kuang4，zhi2 qi3 shen1zi5 chao2 ni3 dian3tou2 zhi4yi4。ta1 shuo1hua4 dai4 zhao2 nong2zhong4 de5 de2guo2 kou3yin1，you3xie1 cu1lu3，dan4 ting1 de2 chu1 hen3 shi4 re4xin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，you3 sha2 shi4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A strange, cackling laugh rings out over the intercom.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You make me laugh, my friend. A pity that you must leave!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一个​怪异​的​咯咯​笑声​通过​广播​响​了​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真​让​我​开心​，​我​的​朋友​。​可惜​你​就要​离开​了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1ge5 guai4yi4 de5 ge1ge1 xiao4sheng1 tong1guo4 guang3bo1 xiang3 le5 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1 rang4 wo3 kai1xin1，wo3 de5 peng2you5。ke3xi1 ni3 jiu4yao4 li2kai1 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A sudden peal of laughter gusts out of her. The sound of it is lovely.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm glad that we're both on the same page. And I mean that - I'm really, genuinely glad.\n"
"\n"
"You get me, $(l.name). Your friendship... and your *trust*... well, they mean a lot to me."
