"{{GM}}​她​突然​发出​银铃​般的​可爱​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​高兴​我们​能​达成​共识​。​我​是​说真的​……​我​感到​很​高兴​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​你​懂​我​。​我们​的​友谊​……​你​的​*​信任​*​……​对​我​来说​意义​非凡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tu1ran2 fa1chu1 yin2 ling2 ban1 de5 ke3ai4 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 neng2 da2cheng2 gong4shi2。wo3 shi4 shuo1zhen1de5……wo3 gan3dao4 hen3 gao1xing4。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 dong3 wo3。wo3men5 de5 you3yi4……ni3 de5*xin4ren4*……dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 yi4yi4 fei1fan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A tear slides down Glory's cheek, as the razors slide out of her fingertips with a click.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't want things to end this way.\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye, $(l.name)."
