"{{GM}}​一滴​泪水​顺着​格洛丽​的​脸颊​滑落​。​剃刀​从​她​指尖​滑​出​，​发出​轻微​的​咔嗒​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没想到​事情​会​是​这个​结果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​永别​了​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 di1 lei4shui3 shun4zhe5 Ge2luo4li2 de5 lian3jia2 hua2luo4。ti4dao1 cong2 ta1 zhi3jian1 hua2 chu1，fa1chu1 qing1wei1 de5 ka1da1 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 shi4qing5 hui4 shi4 zhe4ge5 jie1guo3。\n"
"\n"
"yong3bie2 le5，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A thoughtful look crosses her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you were to plant false evidence that the surge came over the grid, though... that might do it.\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. You do that, and we'll be good."
