"{{GM}}​她​脸上​露出​沉思​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​你​能​植入​虚假​证据​，​显示​尖峰​是从​电网​那边​过来​的话​……​那样​也许​就​可以​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​你​能​做到​的话​，​我们​就​两清​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 chen2si1 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 ni3 neng2 zhi2ru4 xu1jia3 zheng4ju4，xian3shi4 jian1feng1 shi4 cong2 dian4wang3 na4bian5 guo4lai2 de5hua4……na4yang4 ye3xu3 jiu4 ke3yi3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"en1。ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 liang3qing1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A tinge of red crawls into Blitz's cheeks. He shuffles his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In hindsight, it might not've been the best of ideas."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​脸颊​有点​涨红​。​他​挪动​着​双脚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​事后​一想​，​可能​这​并​不是​什么​好​主意​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 lian3jia2 you3dian3 zhang4hong2。ta1 nuo2dong4 zhao2 shuang1jiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4hou4 yi1 xiang3，ke3neng2 zhe4 bing4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 hao3 zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A tinge of red crawls up Glory's neck.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). Look at me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She extends her sculpted metal arms. Chrome glints in the flickering light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm... I'm not far from being what that poor troll was. When I think of what they did to him..."
