"{{GM}}​一抹​红晕​爬​上​了​格洛丽​的​脖颈​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​看看​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​伸出​雕琢​过​的​金属​手臂​。​铬​合金​在​摇曳​的​灯影​下​闪​着​寒光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我离​那个​可怜​的​巨魔​的​下场​并​不远​。​每当​我​想起​他们​对​他​所​做​的​一切​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 ma1 hong2yun4 pa2 shang4 le5 Ge2luo4li2 de5 bo2geng3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。kan4kan5 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1chu1 diao1zhuo2 guo4 de5 jin1shu3 shou3bi4。ge4 he2jin1 zai4 yao2ye4 de5 deng1 ying3 xia4 shan3 zhao2 han2 guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 li2 na4ge5 ke3lian2 de5 ju4mo2 de5 xia4chang3 bing4 bu4 yuan3。mei3dang1 wo3 xiang3qi3 ta1men5 dui4 ta1 suo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}A violent bout of coughing nearly bends him over double. He clutches at his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, good God. You let it *free?*"
