"{{GM}}​一阵​剧烈​的​咳嗽​几乎​让​他​弯​下腰​。​他​捂住​胸口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老天​。​你​放​它​*​自由​*​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1zhen4 ju4lie4 de5 ke2sou5 ji1hu1 rang4 ta1 wan1 xia4yao1。ta1 wu3zhu4 xiong1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1。ni3 fang4 ta1*zi4you2*le5？"

