"fang4 wo3 zi4you2，fou3ze2 wo3 yao4 che3 ni3 de5 rou4 chai1 ni3 de5 gu3！\n"
"\n"
"shao1 cheng2 tan4，shao1 cheng2 hui1，shao1 jin3 yi1qie4！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 fa1shi4，bei1jian4 de5 $++(l.man)！"

