"FREE ME!\n"
"\n"
"FREE ME, OR THE FLESH WILL BE RAKED FROM YOUR BONES!\n"
"\n"
"BURN YOU TO CINDERS BURN YOU TO ASH BURN YOU TO NOTHING!!! \n"
"\n"
"THIS I SWEAR, LITTLE $++(l.man)! "
