"{{GM}}​一个​声音​从​这​瘦弱​的​女人​体内​深处​喷涌​而出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​我​自由​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​我​自由​，​否则​我要​扯​你​的​肉​拆​你​的​骨​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​烧成​炭​，​烧成灰​，​烧尽​一切​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你​发誓​，​卑贱​的​$++(l.man)​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1ge5 sheng1yin1 cong2 zhe4 shou4ruo4 de5 nu:3ren2 ti3nei4 shen1chu4 pen1yong3 er2 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fang4 wo3 zi4you2！\n"
"\n"
"fang4 wo3 zi4you2，fou3ze2 wo3 yao4 che3 ni3 de5 rou4 chai1 ni3 de5 gu3！\n"
"\n"
