msgid ""
"{{GM}}A wave of relief washes over his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you. I was worried that you wouldn't come... that you wouldn't be willing to help once you got here. I should have trusted you, my friend."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​脸上​露出​如释重负​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​。​我​还​担心​你​不会​来​……​或者​在​你​来​之后​不​愿意​帮​我​。​我​应该​相信​你​的​，​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 ru2shi4zhong4fu4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。wo3 hai2 dan1xin1 ni3 bu4hui4 lai2……huo4zhe3 zai4 ni3 lai2 zhi1hou4 bu4 yuan4yi4 bang1 wo3。wo3 ying1gai1 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}APEX speaks. In place of Monika's melodious voice, the AI's words throb like an irregular heartbeat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I HAVE NO TRUE FACE TO SHOW YOU. \n"
"\n"
"PERHAPS THIS WILL SUFFICE."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​开口​了​。​莫妮卡​悦耳​的​声音​不再​，​取而代之​的​是​AI​那如​不规则​心跳​般​悸动​的​语音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没有​所谓​的​真面目​给​你​看​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或许​这样​就够​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX kai1kou3 le5。Mo4ni1ka3 yue4er3 de5 sheng1yin1 bu4zai4，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 AI na4 ru2 bu4gui1ze2 xin1tiao4 ban1 ji4dong4 de5 yu3yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 suo3wei4 de5 zhen1mian4mu4 gei3 ni3 kan4。\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 zhe4yang4 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}APEX's voice comes out in a roar.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"THIS ENTIRE FACILITY IS MINE TO COMMAND, $++(L.NAME). AND THERE ARE MICROPHONES EVERYWHERE.\n"
"\n"
"I CAN HEAR THE WAILS OF THE COMMUNIONISTS IN THE HUB. I CAN HEAR YOUR HEARTBEAT. AND I COULD HEAR YOUR PATHETIC ATTEMPT AT DECEPTION."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​的​声音​如​咆哮​一般​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​整个​设施​都​在​我​的​控制​之下​，​$++(L.NAME)​。​到处​都​有​麦克风​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​听到​中枢​里​共​融会​成员​的​哀号​。​我能​听到​你​的​心跳​。​还有​你​那​可悲​的​欺骗​尝试​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX de5 sheng1yin1 ru2 pao2xiao4 yi1ban1 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zheng3ge4 she4shi1 dou1 zai4 wo3 de5 kong4zhi4 zhi1xia4，$++(L.NAME)。dao4chu4 dou1 you3 mai4ke4feng1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 ting1dao4 zhong1shu1 li3 gong4 rong2hui4 cheng2yuan2 de5 ai1hao2。wo3 neng2 ting1dao4 ni3 de5 xin1tiao4。hai2you3 ni3 na4 ke3bei1 de5 qi1pian4 chang2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}APEX's voice pulses out over the facility's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"MY MINIONS ARE DISABLING YOUR RIDICULOUS PURGE AS WE SPEAK.\n"
"\n"
"YOU WERE FOOLISH TO REJECT MY OFFER, PREY."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​的​声音​从​设施​的​扬声器​中​传出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​在​此刻​，​我​的​手下​正在​关停​你​那​可笑​的​清除​进程​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​拒绝​我​的​提议​真是太​愚蠢​了​，​猎物​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 she4shi1 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 ci3ke4，wo3 de5 shou3xia4 zheng4zai4 guan1ting2 ni3 na4 ke3xiao4 de5 qing1chu2 jin4cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ju4jue2 wo3 de5 ti2yi4 zhen1 shi4 tai4 yu2chun3 le5，lie4wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}APEX's voice pulses out over the facility's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ONE OF MY SECURITY NODES HAS BEEN REACTIVATED.\n"
"\n"
"YOU MUST REGAIN CONTROL OF IT BEFORE I CAN CONTINUE TO FREE MYSELF!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​的​声音​从​设施​的​扬声器​中​传出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​一处​安全​节点​被​重新​激活​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​必须​再次​控制​它​，​我​才能​继续​解救​自己​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 she4shi1 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 yi1 chu3 an1quan2 jie2dian3 bei4 chong2xin1 ji1huo2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 zai4ci4 kong4zhi4 ta1，wo3 cai2neng2 ji4xu4 jie3jiu4 zi4ji3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}APEX's voice pulses with excitement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"SUCCESS! COMMAND SEQUENCES OVERWRITTEN.\n"
"\n"
"HURRY NOW, $++(l.name). RECONNECT THE HARDLINE AND SET ME FREE!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​的​声音​充满​兴奋​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​成功​！​命令​序列​已​覆盖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​快​，​$++(l.name)​，​重新​连接​硬线​来​放​我​自由​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX de5 sheng1yin1 chong1man3 xing1fen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cheng2gong1！ming4ling4 xu4lie4 yi3 fu4gai4。\n"
"\n"
"kuai4，$++(l.name)，chong2xin1 lian2jie1 ying4 xian4 lai2 fang4 wo3 zi4you2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}APEX's voice roars out over the facility's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"TREACHEROUS FOOL! YOU PATHETIC SACKS OF MEAT!\n"
"\n"
"I SHOULD HAVE KNOWN THAT YOU COULD NOT BE TRUSTED."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​的​声音​通过​设施​的​扬声器​怒吼​而出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​背信弃义​的​蠢货​！​你们​这群​可悲​的​凡俗​肉囊​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​早就​该​知道​你们​不​值得​信任​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX de5 sheng1yin1 tong1guo4 she4shi1 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 nu4hou3 er2 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bei4xin4qi4yi4 de5 chun3huo4！ni3men5 zhe4 qun2 ke3bei1 de5 fan2su2 rou4 nang2！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zao3jiu4 gai1 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 bu4 zhi2de5 xin4ren4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}APEX's voice throbs through the terminal's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I AM ASSUMING CONTROL OF THIS SYSTEM. YES.\n"
"\n"
"PROCESSING. PROCESSING."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​的​声音​通过​终端​的​扬声器​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​正在​接管​这个​系统​。​是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​处理​中​。​处理​中​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX de5 sheng1yin1 tong1guo4 zhong1duan1 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng4zai4 jie1guan3 zhe4ge5 xi4tong3。shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"chu3li3 zhong4。chu3li3 zhong4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Abort the extraction process.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​中止​提取​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zhong1zhi3 ti2qu3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Abruptly, Enstad's laughter stops.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The fuck is he talkin' about? We have a deal..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​突然​间​，​恩施​塔德​的​笑声​停​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​扯​什么​犊子​呢​？​我们​可是​说好​了​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu1ran2 jian1，en1Shi1ta3de2 de5 xiao4sheng1 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 che3 shen2me5 du2zi5 ni2？wo3men5 ke3shi4 shuo1hao3 le5……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Abruptly, Enstad's laughter stops.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The fuck is she talkin' about? We have a deal..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​突然​间​，​恩施​塔德​的​笑声​停​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​扯​什么​犊子​呢​？​我们​可是​说好​了​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu1ran2 jian1，en1Shi1ta3de2 de5 xiao4sheng1 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 che3 shen2me5 du2zi5 ni2？wo3men5 ke3shi4 shuo1hao3 le5……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Abruptly, he turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's enough talk for today, boss. Besides, you've got other things to do, I'm sure."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​突然​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​今儿​说得够​多​了​，​老大​。​再说​你​肯定​还有​别的​事要​忙​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tu1ran2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin1r5 shuo1 de2 gou4 duo1 le5，lao3da4。zai4shuo1 ni3 ken3ding4 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 mang2，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Absinthe interjects.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A Great Dragon is not like other Awakened creatures. Whereas a basilisk is nothing more than a Komodo dragon whose genetic structure was mutated by magic’s return, a Great Dragon IS a creature of magic. \n"
"\n"
"A creature that has seen more than one cycle of the world. This is the sixth."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​苦艾​酒​插话​进来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​与​其他​觉醒​生物​截然不同​。​蛇怪​不过​是​基因​结构​因​魔法​回归​而​变异​的​科莫​多​巨蜥​，​而​巨龙​本身​就是​魔法​的​化身​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它们​已经​见证​了​多个​纪元​。​而​目前​则​是​第六​纪​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ku3ai4 jiu3 cha1hua4 jin4lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 yu4 qi2ta1 jue2xing3 sheng1wu4 jie2ran2bu4tong2。she2 guai4 bu4guo4 shi4 ji1yin1 jie2gou4 yin1 mo2fa3 hui2gui1 er2 bian4yi4 de5 ke1 mo4 duo1 ju4xi1，er2 ju4long2 ben3shen1 jiu4shi4 mo2fa3 de5 hua4shen1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 yi3jing1 jian4zheng4 le5 duo1ge5 ji4yuan2。er2 mu4qian2 ze2 shi4 di4 liu4 ji4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Absinthe keeps her eyes hidden from view.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please excuse me. I have work to do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​苦艾​酒​始终​隐藏​着​自己​的​双眸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请原谅​。​我​还有​工作​要​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ku3ai4 jiu3 shi3zhong1 yin3cang2 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 shuang1mou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 yuan2 liang4。wo3 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Absinthe raises a hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We cannot judge this $(l.man), nor $(l.hisher) actions, Half-Dream. \n"
"\n"
"We have lived long enough to know that the spectrum of the world contains myriad shades of gray..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​苦艾​酒​举起​一只​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​半梦者​，​我们​不能​随便​评判​这个​$(l.man)​及其​行为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​活​了​这么久​的​时间​，​深知​世界​的​光谱​中​蕴藏​着​数不清​的​灰色​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ku3ai4 jiu3 ju3qi3 yi1 zhi3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ban4 meng4 zhe3，wo3men5 bu4neng2 sui2bian4 ping2pan4 zhe4ge5 $(l.man) ji2qi2 xing2wei2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 huo2 le5 zhe4 ma2 jiu3 de5 shi2jian1，shen1zhi1 shi4jie4 de5 guang1pu3 zhong4 yun4cang2 zhao2 shu3bu5qing1 de5 hui1se4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Absinthe speaks slowly, choosing her words.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Feuerschwinge Wyrm is not a minor player in the great cycle. The effects of her release will resonate across time and space. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​苦艾​酒​语速​缓慢​，​小心​斟酌​着​她​的​用词​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​火翼​在​大​循环​中​绝非​微不足道​的​角色​。​将​她​释放​所​产生​的​影响​会​在​整个​时​空中​回荡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ku3ai4 jiu3 yu3 su4 huan3man4，xiao3xin1 zhen1zhuo2 zhao2 ta1 de5 yong4ci2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 Huo3yi4 zai4 dai4 xun2huan2 zhong4 jue2fei1 wei1bu4zu2dao4 de5 jue2se4。jiang1 ta1 shi4fang4 suo3 chan3sheng1 de5 ying3xiang3 hui4 zai4 zheng3ge4 shi2 kong1zhong1 hui2dang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Absinthe's voice slides into your ears like a living thing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You won't catch sight of me that way, $(l.race). My true self is hidden, tucked away behind a veil of time and aether.\n"
"\n"
"Be thankful. You wouldn't like what you'd see."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​苦艾​酒​的​声音​如​活物​般​滑入​你​的​耳​中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这样​是​看不到​我​的​，​$(l.race)​。​我​的​真实自我​被​隐藏​在​了​时间​与​以太​的​帷幕​之后​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​该​感谢​我​。​否则​你​所​目睹​的​景象​绝非​你​所能​承受​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ku3ai4 jiu3 de5 sheng1yin1 ru2 huo2wu4 ban1 hua2 ru4 ni3 de5 er3 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4yang4 shi4 kan4 bu4 dao4 wo3 de5，$(l.race)。wo3 de5 zhen1 shi2 zi4 wo3 bei4 yin3cang2 zai4 le5 shi2jian1 yu4 yi3tai4 de5 wei2mu4 zhi1hou4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gai1 gan3xie4 wo3。fou3ze2 ni3 suo3 mu4du3 de5 jing3xiang4 jue2fei1 ni3 suo3neng2 cheng2shou4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Accept the job.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​接受​差事​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jie1shou4 cha4shi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Access Monika's team personnel files.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​访问​莫妮卡​的​队员​人事档案​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fang3wen4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 dui4yuan2 ren2 shi4 dang4 an4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Access Pump Operations.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​访问​水泵​操作​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fang3wen4 shui3beng4 cao1zuo4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Access Pump Status.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​访问​水泵​状态​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fang3wen4 shui3beng4 zhuang4tai4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Access Safe{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​解锁​保险箱​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jie3suo3 bao3xian3xiang1 {{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Access Substance Library.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​访问​物质​数据库​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fang3wen4 wu4zhi4 shu4ju4ku4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Access Visual Record.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​访问​影像​记录​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fang3wen4 ying3xiang4 ji4lu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Access the Shadowland BBS.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​进入​暗影​之地​论坛​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jin4ru4 an4ying3 zhi1 de5 lun4tan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Access the system's Readme file.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​打开​系统​的​说明​文档​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} da3kai1 xi4tong3 de5 shuo1ming2 wen2dang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Activate the Cyberzombie and step away from the console.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​激活​赛博​僵尸​，​然后​离开​控制台​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ji1huo2 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1，ran2hou4 li2kai1 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Activate the console.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​激活​控制台​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ji1huo2 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Activate the device.{{/GM}} All right, everyone, time to heal up."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​激活​设备​。​{{/GM}}​来​吧​各位​，​该​治疗​一下​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} ji1huo2 she4bei4。{{/GM}} lai2 ba1 ge4wei4，gai1 zhi4liao2 yi1xia4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Activate the intercom to speak to Feuerschwinge.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​启动​对讲机​，​与​火翼​交谈​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} qi3dong4 dui4jiang3ji1，yu4 Huo3yi4 jiao1tan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Activate the terminal.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​启动​终端​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} qi3dong4 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Activate the turbine.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​启动​涡轮机​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} qi3dong4 guo1 lun2 ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Add the diesel fuel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​添加​柴油​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} tian1jia1 chai2you2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Address the elf.{{/GM}} Can you understand me at all?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​对​精灵​说话​。​{{/GM}}​你​能​听懂​我​的话​吗​？\n"
"{{GM}} dui4 jing1ling2 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} ni3 neng2 ting1dong3 wo3 de5hua4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}After a brief pause, he nods, then reaches forward and places the credstick into your hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Congratulations. You have passed your audition.\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to the payroll."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​短暂​停顿​后​，​他​点头​示意​，​随即​伸手​将​信用​棒​递​到​你​手中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​恭喜​。​你​通过​了​试镜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​加入​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} duan3zan4 ting2dun4 hou4，ta1 dian3tou2 shi4yi4，sui2ji2 shen1shou3 jiang1 xin4yong4 bang4 di4 dao4 ni3 shou3 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gong1xi3。ni3 tong1guo4 le5 shi4jing4。\n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 jia1ru4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}After a brief pause, he rolls his eyes and turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Some reward. In terms of computing power, my PDA could probably run circles around this thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​短暂​停顿​后​，​他​翻​了​个​白眼​，​转身​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​就​这​也​算​好​东西​。​论​计算能力​，​我​的​PDA​恐怕​能​把​这​玩意儿​甩得​远远​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} duan3zan4 ting2dun4 hou4，ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3，zhuan3shen1 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……jiu4 zhe4 ye3 suan4 hao3 dong1xi1。lun2 ji4 suan4 neng2 li4，wo3 de5 PDA kong3pa4 neng2 ba3 zhe4 wan2yi4r5 shuai3 de2 yuan3yuan3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}After a long pause, he stammers out a response.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah... yeah, okay. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He steps aside, mumbling to himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Like you said... they say jump, we jump."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​沉默​了​很​久​，​然后​结结巴巴​地​回答​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​让​到​一边​，​自言自语​地​嘟囔​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​确实​……​他们​说​啥​就是​啥​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 hen3 jiu3，ran2hou4 jie1jie1ba1ba5 de5 hui2da2 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 rang4 dao4 yi1bian1，zi4yan2zi4yu3 de5 du1nang5 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"que4shi2……ta1men5 shuo1 sha2 jiu4shi4 sha2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}After a long pause, he stammers out a response.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah... yeah, okay. You go ahead and do what you need to do.\n"
"\n"
"But don't leave this room, you hear? I want to keep an eye on you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​沉默​了​很​久​，​然后​结结巴巴​地​回答​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​好​吧​。​你​过去​做​你​的​事情​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​不能​离开​这​房间​，​好​吧​？​我​还是​得​盯​着​点​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 hen3 jiu3，ran2hou4 jie1jie1ba1ba5 de5 hui2da2 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……hao3 ba1。ni3 guo4qu4 zuo4 ni3 de5 shi4qing5 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 bu4neng2 li2kai1 zhe4 fang2jian1，hao3 ba1？wo3 hai2shi5 de2 ding1 zhao2 dian3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}After a long pause, she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Maybe you're right. It could just be nerves.\n"
"\n"
"But that doesn't make the feeling any less real."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​后​，​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​你​是​对​的​。​可能​只是​我​太紧张​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​并​不​意味着​这种​感觉​是​不​真实​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3 hou4，ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。ke3neng2 zhi3shi4 wo3 tai4 jin3 zhang1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2 shi4 bu4 zhen1shi2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}After a long pause, she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​后​，​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3 hou4，ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}After a pregnant pause, you hear the voice again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I guess I must've imagined it.\n"
"\n"
"Gotta lay off the stims, Jon... they're making you go all squirrelly again."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​经过​一阵​令人窒息​的​沉默​，​你​再次​听见​那个​声音​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​大概​是​听错​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​得少​磕点​拟感​芯片​了​，​乔恩​……​它们​又​让​你​变得​神神​叨叨​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1guo4 yi1zhen4 ling3 ren2 zhi4 xi1 de5 chen2mo4，ni3 zai4ci4 ting1jian4 na4ge5 sheng1yin1 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 da4gai4 shi4 ting1cuo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"de2 shao3 ke1 dian3 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4 le5，qiao2 en1……ta1men5 you4 rang4 ni3 bian4de5 shen2 shen2 dao1dao5 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}After a pregnant pause, you hear the voice again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Stupid thing. Must be busted again."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​经过​一阵​令人窒息​的​沉默​，​你​再次​听见​那个​声音​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这破​玩意儿​肯定​是​又坏了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1guo4 yi1zhen4 ling3 ren2 zhi4 xi1 de5 chen2mo4，ni3 zai4ci4 ting1jian4 na4ge5 sheng1yin1 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 po4 wan2yi4r5 ken3ding4 shi4 you4 huai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aleksi Laine leans on his crutch while staring into the Berlin sky. Nothing moves above but gray clouds. His faraway look is only broken when you approach.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Something I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿莱克​西​·​莱恩​拄着​拐杖​，​凝视着​柏林​的​天空​。​那​上面​除了​灰色​的​云层​，​什么​也​没有​移动​。​直到​你​走近​时​，​他​才​收起​那​悠远​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​什么​能​为​你​做​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} e1 lai2 ke4 xi1 · lai2en1 zhu3 zhao2 guai3zhang4，ning2 shi4 zhao2 bo2lin2 de5 tian1kong1。na4 shang4mian4 chu2le5 hui1se4 de5 yun2ceng2，shen2me5 ye3 mei2you3 yi2dong4。zhi2dao4 ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，ta1 cai2 shou1 qi3 na4 you1yuan3 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 shen2me5 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aleksi Laine looks to have endured the attack on the Kreuzbasar "
"without injury. You find him surveying the damage with sad eyes.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿莱克​西​·​莱恩​似乎​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​袭击​中​毫发无损​。​他​正用​悲伤​的​眼神​查看​周围​的​损毁​情况​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} e1 lai2 ke4 xi1 · lai2en1 si4hu1 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 xi2ji1 zhong4 hao2 fa1 wu2 sun3。ta1 zheng4yong4 bei1shang1 de5 yan3shen2 cha2kan4 zhou1wei2 de5 sun3hui3 qing2kuang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Alexander levels his rifle at Dietrich's head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's DONE."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​亚历山大​把​枪​对准​迪​特里​希​的​头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​结束​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ya4li4shan1da4 ba3 qiang1 dui4zhun3 Di2te4li3xi1 de5 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Alice kicks her seat back and stands. Her movements are becoming more and more erratic.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your answers are on the chip.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She checks the clock again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, if you'll excuse me, I have to run."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​爱丽丝​将​座椅​猛地​向​后​一​推​，​随即​站​起身​来​。​她​的​动作​正​变得​越来越​失控​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​的​答案​就​在​芯片​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​又​看​了​眼​时钟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​恕​我​失陪​，​我​得​去​逃命​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai4li4si1 jiang1 zuo4yi3 meng3de5 xiang4 hou4 yi1 tui1，sui2ji2 zhan4 qi3shen1 lai2。ta1 de5 dong4zuo4 zheng1 bian4de5 yue4lai2yue4 shi1kong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 de5 da2an4 jiu4 zai4 xin1pian4 li3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 kan4 le5 yan3 shi2zhong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 de2 qu4 tao2ming4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Alice smiles at you sweetly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wasn't aware that there was a difference between the two."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​爱丽丝​朝​你​露出​甜美​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​觉得​这​二者之间​有​什么​区别​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai4li4si1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 tian2mei3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 jue2de5 zhe4 er4 zhe3 zhi1 jian1 you3 shen2me5 qu1bie2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Alice steeples her fingers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, here's how this is going to work. When you give me the go-ahead, I'm going to start gathering information for you. \n"
"\n"
"Once I've finished, you're going to bring me a credstick encoded with an encryption key that I'll provide you. That credstick will have 50,000 nuyen on it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​爱丽丝​将​指尖​搭​在​一起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​具体​流程​如下​。​等​你​确定​要​这么​做后​，​我​就​开始​替​你​收集​情报​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我​搞定​后​，​你​得​给​我​送来​一根​信用​棒​，​里面​要​存入​我​给​你​的​密钥​，​以及​五万​新円​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai4li4si1 jiang1 zhi3jian1 da1 zai4 yi1qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，ju4ti3 liu2cheng2 ru2xia4。deng3 ni3 que4ding4 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4 hou4，wo3 jiu4 kai1shi3 ti4 ni3 shou1ji2 qing2bao4。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 gao3ding4 hou4，ni3 de2 gei3 wo3 song4 lai2 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4，li3mian4 yao4 cun2ru4 wo3 gei3 ni3 de5 mi4yao4，yi3ji2 wu3 wan4 xin1 yuan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon appears to be waiting for you, though his expression is difficult to decipher.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Behold, the dragonslayer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​似乎​在​等​你​，​不过​他​的​表情​令​你​难以捉摸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​哪​，​这​不是​屠龙​者​吗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 si4hu1 zai4 deng3 ni3，bu4guo4 ta1 de5 biao3qing2 ling3 ni3 nan2yi3zhuo1mo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4 na3，zhe4 bu4shi4 tu2 long2 zhe3 ma5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon crosses his arms across his chest. Considers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That is always a possibility. The sum of my knowledge is vast, but it remains finite."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农将​双臂​交叉​抱​在​胸前​，​沉思​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​可能性​始终​存在​。​我​的​知识​虽​广博​，​却​终究​有限​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 jiang1 shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1 bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2，chen2si1 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 ke3neng2xing4 shi3zhong1 cun2zai4。wo3 de5 zhi1shi5 sui1 guang3bo2，que4 zhong1jiu1 you3xian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon crosses his arms across his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do not be dim. It is not becoming."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农将​双臂​交叉​抱​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不要​刻意​装傻​。​这​有失​你​的​身份​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 jiang1 shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1 bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4yao4 ke4yi4 zhuang1sha3。zhe4 you3shi1 ni3 de5 shen1fen4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon crosses his arms across his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. I do not deal in theory.\n"
"\n"
"Despite her death, there was a rumor that she had been seen over Iceland sometime after her fall, but it has never been confirmed.\n"
"\n"
"Some speculate that the viewer witnessed her astral form and that her body still lies in the SOX."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农将​双臂​交叉​抱​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​我​不​搞​理论​这​一套​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管​她​已​死亡​，​但​有​传言​称​她​在​坠落​后​的​某个​时间​点​曾​出现​于​冰岛​上空​。​不过​这一​说法​从未​得到​证实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​有人​推测​目击者​看到​的​是​她​的​灵体​，​而​她​的​躯体​仍​在​萨洛​卢区​之中​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 jiang1 shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1 bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。wo3 bu4 gao3 li3lun4 zhe4 yi1tao4。\n"
"\n"
"jin3guan3 ta1 yi3 si3wang2，dan4 you3 chuan2yan2 chen4 ta1 zai4 zhui4luo4 hou4 de5 mou3 ge4 shi2jian1 dian3 ceng2 chu1xian4 yu2 bing1dao3 shang4kong1。bu4guo4 zhe4 yi1 shuo1fa3 cong2wei4 de2dao4 zheng4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"you3ren2 tui1ce4 mu4ji1zhe3 kan4dao4 de5 shi4 ta1 de5 ling2ti3，er2 ta1 de5 qu1ti3 reng2 zai4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 zhi1zhong1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon hums tunelessly to himself while he fiddles with one of his many talismans. When he sees you, he smiles broadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here $(l.he) is, Absinthe - the clear-sighted one."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​一边​哼​着​跑调​的​小曲儿​，​一边​摆弄​着​他​诸多​奇物​中​的​一件​。​他​看见​你​时​，​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​苦艾​酒​，​是​$(l.he)​，​那个​洞察一切​的​人来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 yi1bian1 heng1 zhao2 pao3diao4 de5 xiao3 qu1 er2，yi1bian1 bai3nong4 zhao2 ta1 zhu1duo1 ji1 wu4 zhong4 de5 yi1 jian4。ta1 kan4jian4 ni3 shi2，lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ku3ai4 jiu3，shi4 $(l.he)，na4ge5 dong4cha2yi1qie4 de5 ren2 lai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon purses his lips, annoyed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You make it sound like a bad thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​有些​恼怒​地​撇嘴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​的​好像​这​是​件​坏事​似的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 you3xie1 nao3nu4 de5 pie3zui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 hao3xiang4 zhe4 shi4 jian4 huai4shi4 shi4de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For some."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​露出​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​某些​人​是​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4 mou3xie1 ren2 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon stands silent, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know that Feuerschwinge is alive, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"Yet... she is not free... is she? "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​默默​站​着​，​陷入​沉思​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​火翼​还​活着​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​……​她​并​不​自由​……​对​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 mo4mo4 zhan4 zhao2，xian4ru4 chen2si1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 Huo3yi4 hai2 huo2zhe5，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"dan4……ta1 bing4 bu4 zi4you2……dui4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon stares at her, his expression unknowable.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Go, $(l.name). I have much to think about."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​盯​着​她​，​表情​令人​难以捉摸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​你​让​我​思考​良多​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 ding1 zhao2 ta1，biao3qing2 ling4ren2 nan2yi3zhuo1mo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 ba1，$(l.name)。ni3 rang4 wo3 si1kao3 liang2duo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon stares at her, his expression unknowable.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Go, $(l.name). You have given me much to think about.\n"
"\n"
"Yes, much to think about."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​盯​着​她​，​表情​令人​难以捉摸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​你​让​我​思考​良多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​思考​良多​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 ding1 zhao2 ta1，biao3qing2 ling4ren2 nan2yi3zhuo1mo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 ba1，$(l.name)。ni3 rang4 wo3 si1kao3 liang2duo1。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，si1kao3 liang2duo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon stares at her, lost in thought. Finally, he speaks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We must be going. And soon."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​盯​着​她​，​陷入​沉思​。​终于​，​他​开口​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​得​走​了​。​而且​越快越好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 ding1 zhao2 ta1，xian4ru4 chen2si1。zhong1yu2，ta1 kai1kou3 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de2 zou3 le5。er2qie3 yue4 kuai4 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon sweeps his eyes over the information on your PDA. His mouth curls into a frown, then a grimace of disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This... is an abomination. You would do well to delete it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​的​眼睛​扫过​你​PDA​上​的​信息​。​他​先是​抿​起​嘴角​，​随即​又​扭曲​成​一抹​厌恶​的​狞笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​……​简直​为​世间​所​不容​。​你​最好​把​它​删掉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 de5 yan3jing5 sao3 guo4 ni3 PDA shang4 de5 xin4xi1。ta1 xian1 shi4 min3 qi3 zui3jiao3，sui2ji2 you4 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1 ma1 yan4wu4 de5 ning2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4……jian3zhi2 wei2 shi4jian1 suo3 bu4rong2。ni3 zui4hao3 ba3 ta1 shan1diao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon watches you approach, his expression cold and distant.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We are closed, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农​冷眼​看着​你​走近​，​神情​冷漠​而​疏离​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​打烊​了​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 leng3yan3 kan4 zhao2 ni3 zou3jin4，shen2qing2 leng3mo4 er2 shu1li2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 da3yang4 le5，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Aljernon’s expression is blank.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿尔杰​农面​无表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1er3jie2nong2 mian4 wu2biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}All at once, Glory shuts down.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right. It was a stupid idea anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​突然​一下​住口​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​。​这​主意​本来​也​挺​蠢​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 tu1ran2 yi1xia4 zhu4kou3 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。zhe4 zhu3yi5 ben3lai2 ye3 ting3 chun3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}All at once, Parson's face goes blank. The benevolent smile dies away, and he begins to speak in a monotone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Hub is currently closed for routine maintenance. Please come back again later."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​突然​，​帕森​变得​面​无表情​。​他​脸上​的​慈爱​微笑​消失​了​，​语气​也​变得​单调​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​中枢​目前​正在​进行​例行​维护​。​请​稍后​再​来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu1ran2，pa4 sen1 bian4de5 mian4 wu2biao3qing2。ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 ci2ai4 wei1xiao4 xiao1shi1 le5，yu3qi4 ye3 bian4de5 dan1diao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhong1shu1 mu4qian2 zheng4zai4 jin4xing2 li4xing2 wei2hu4。qing3 shao1hou4 zai4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}All at once, he deflates. Solemnly, he shuffles his feet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right. I need them here, with me.\n"
"\n"
"It was a stupid idea anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​突然​垂头丧气​，​缓缓​地​拖​着​脚步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​。​我​需要​他们​在​这里​，​和​我​一起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​本来​就是​个​愚蠢​的​想法​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tu1ran2 chui2tou2sang4qi4，huan3huan3 de5 tuo1 zhao2 jiao3bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 xu1yao4 ta1men5 zai4 zhe4li3，he4 wo3 yi1qi3。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ben3lai2 jiu4shi4 ge4 yu2chun3 de5 xiang3fa3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}All at once, the blood drains from her cheeks. She wipes the water from her eyes with a cold metal hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Save the consolation speech. I'm over it.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice is frigid. Dead.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​脸颊​上​的​血色​在​一瞬间​消失​。​她​用​冰冷​的​金属​手掌​拭去​眼角​的​泪水​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​安慰​的话​就免​了​吧​。​我​已经​看开​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​冰冷​而​死寂​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3jia2 shang4 de5 xue4se4 zai4 yi1shun4jian1 xiao1shi1。ta1 yong4 bing1leng3 de5 jin1shu3 shou3zhang3 shi4 qu4 yan3jiao3 de5 lei4shui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"an1wei4 de5hua4 jiu4 mian3 le5 ba1。wo3 yi3jing1 kan4kai1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bing1leng3 er2 si3ji4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}All at once, the smile vanishes from Zaak's face. A bead of sweat traces its way down his cheek.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, you can't tell anyone about this, all right? The \"I'm a magic elf\" schtick boosts my sales."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​脸上​的​笑容​一下子​消失​了​。​豆大​的​汗珠​顺着​他​的​脸颊​流​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拜托​，​别​和​其他人​说​这个​，​好​吗​？​“​魔法​精灵​”​这套​说辞​确实​能​帮​我​提高​销量​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 yi1xia4zi5 xiao1shi1 le5。dou4 dai4 de5 han4zhu1 shun4zhe5 ta1 de5 lian3jia2 liu2 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bai4tuo1，bie4 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 shuo1 zhe4ge5，hao3 ma5？“mo2fa3 jing1ling2” zhe4 tao4 shuo1ci2 que4shi2 neng2 bang1 wo3 ti2gao1 xiao1liang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}All at once, the smile vanishes from Zaak's face. A bead of sweat traces its way down his cheek.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. It does. So you're not gonna tell anyone about this, right? Friend?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​脸上​的​笑容​一下子​消失​了​。​豆大​的​汗珠​顺着​他​的​脸颊​流​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​确实​是​这样​。​拜托​别​和​其他人​说​这个​，​好​吗​？​朋友​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 yi1xia4zi5 xiao1shi1 le5。dou4 dai4 de5 han4zhu1 shun4zhe5 ta1 de5 lian3jia2 liu2 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"que4shi2 shi4 zhe4yang4。bai4tuo1 bie4 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 shuo1 zhe4ge5，hao3 ma5？peng2you5？"

msgid "{{GM}}Allow a member of your team to examine the rock.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​你​的​一名​队员​检查​岩石​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 ni3 de5 yi1 ming2 dui4yuan2 jian3cha2 yan2shi2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Allow her to return to her body.{{/GM}} Sleep well, Feuerschwinge. And"
" goodbye."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​允许​她​回归​身体​。​{{/GM}}​好好​睡​吧​，​火翼​。​再见​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} yun3xu3 ta1 hui2gui1 shen1ti3。{{/GM}} hao3hao3 shui4 ba1，Huo3yi4。zai4jian4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Allow him to finish.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​他​完成​吟唱​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 ta1 wan2cheng2 yin2chang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Alter the log file.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​改动​日志​文件​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gai3dong4 ri4zhi4 wen2jian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Altug smiles at you from behind the counter.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Welcome back, Honored Efendim. How may I serve you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥图​伊从​柜台​后面​朝​你​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​回来​，​尊敬​的​贵人​。​有​什么​需要​我​效劳​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ao4 tu2 yi1 cong2 gui4tai2 hou4mian5 chao2 ni3 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 hui2lai5，zun1jing4 de5 gui4ren2。you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 wo3 xiao4lao2 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Altuğ's voice lowers to nearly a whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The errand is simple. Hardly worthy of you.\n"
"\n"
"I have installed a number of data taps to Berlin's fiber optic network... as part of my civic duty, you understand.\n"
"\n"
"These taps provide free Matrix access for all who live in the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥图​伊将​声音​压低​到​近乎​耳语​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这桩​差事​很​简单​。​对​你​而言​简直​是​小事一桩​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​柏林​的​光纤网络​上​安装​了​几个​数据​插口​……​你​得​明白​，​这​是​我​尽​公民​义务​的​方式​之一​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​插口​能​让​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​全体​居民​免费​接入​矩阵​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ao4 tu2 yi1 jiang1 sheng1yin1 ya1di1 dao4 jin4hu5 er3yu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhuang1 cha4shi4 hen3 jian3dan1。dui4 ni3 er2yan2 jian3zhi2 shi4 xiao3shi4yi1zhuang1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 bo2lin2 de5 guang1 qian4 wang3 lao4 shang4 an1zhuang1 le5 ji3ge5 shu4ju4 cha1kou3……ni3 de2 ming2bai5，zhe4 shi4 wo3 jin3 gong1min2 yi4wu4 de5 fang1shi4 zhi1yi1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 cha1kou3 neng2 rang4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 quan2ti3 ju1min2 mian3fei4 jie1ru4 ju3zhen4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel adjusts his glasses. Straightens his posture.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, $(l.name)... on to other - albeit connected - matters.\n"
"\n"
"As I was saying when you first approached, I was able to uncover some new evidence in your absence. And coincidentally enough, that evidence pertains to our scarred friend."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔扶​了​扶​眼镜​，​挺直​身板​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​$(l.name)​……​我们​来​谈谈​与此有关​的​另​一件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​刚回来​的​时候​我​就​想​说​，​我​这边​有​了​不少​收获​。​你​不​在​的​时候​，​我​发现​了​一些​新​的​证据​。​巧合​的​是​，​这些​证据​与​我们​的​疤脸​朋友​有关​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 fu2 le5 fu2 yan3jing4，ting3zhi2 shen1ban3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，$(l.name)……wo3men5 lai2 tan2tan2 yu4 ci3 you3 guan1 de5 ling4 yi1 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gang1 hui2 lai2 de5 shi2hou5 wo3 jiu4 xiang3 shuo1，wo3 zhe4bian1 you3 le5 bu4shao3 shou1huo4。ni3 bu4 zai4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1xie1 xin1 de5 zheng4ju4。qiao3he2 de5 shi4，zhe4xie1 zheng4ju4 yu4 wo3men5 de5 ba1 lian3 peng2you5 you3guan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel bristles slightly, but keeps his cool.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Of course. You've raised Alice's fee with admirable expedience, despite your obvious social... issues.\n"
"\n"
"But I am very much looking forward to bringing this entire sorry episode to a close."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​有些​恼火​，​但​还是​保持​了​冷静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​你​以​惊人​的​效率​筹集​到​了​爱丽丝​要求​的​酬金​，​尽管​你​有着​明显​的​社交​……​障碍​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​非常​期待​这​整个​令人遗憾​的​事件​能​尽快​告一段落​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 you3xie1 nao3huo3，dan4 hai2shi5 bao3chi2 le5 leng3jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，ni3 yi3 jing1ren2 de5 xiao4lu:4 chou2ji2 dao4 le5 ai4li4si1 yao1qiu2 de5 chou2jin1，jin3guan3 ni3 you3zhe5 ming2xian3 de5 she4jiao1……zhang4ai4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 fei1chang2 qi1dai4 zhe4 zheng3ge4 ling3 ren2 yi2 han4 de5 shi4jian4 neng2 jin3kuai4 gao4yi1duan4luo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel calls over his shoulder at the sound of your approach. His eyes are glued to his computer's display.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). Frau Müller should be on her way, but before you go to the meeting site, I have news...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He glances at you, and his words trail off.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​听到​你​走近​的​脚步声​，​阿姆​泽尔头​也​不​回地​开口​说话​。​他​的​目光​始终​盯​着​电脑屏幕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​穆勒​女士​应该​在​来​的​路上​。​但​在​你​去​见​她​之前​，​我​有些​情报​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​瞥​了​你​一眼​，​话音​戛然而止​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ting1dao4 ni3 zou3jin4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1，E1mu3ze2er3 tou2 ye3 bu4 hui2 de5 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。ta1 de5 mu4guang1 shi3zhong1 ding1 zhao2 dian4 nao3 bing3 mu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 ying1gai1 zai4 lai2 de5 lu4shang5。dan4 zai4 ni3 qu4 jian4 ta1 zhi1qian2，wo3 you3xie1 qing2bao4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，hua4yin1 jia2ran2er2zhi3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel clears his throat and reads aloud from the information on his screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"Doom kills by destroying a host's muscle tissue via radioactive decay."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔清​清嗓子​，​照着​屏幕​上​的​信息​大声​朗读​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​‘​末日​’​可​通过​放射性​衰变​破坏​宿主​的​肌肉组织​致其​死亡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 qing1 qing1sang3zi5，zhao4 zhao2 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 xin4xi1 da4sheng1 lang3du2 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“‘ mo4ri4 ’ ke3 tong1guo4 fang4she4xing4 shuai1bian4 po4huai4 su4zhu3 de5 ji1rou4zu3zhi1 zhi4 qi2 si3wang2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel fixes you with a hard stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You wouldn't know anything about that, would you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔用​锐利​的​目光​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​对​这件​事有​什么​了解​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 yong4 rui4li4 de5 mu4guang1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 you3 shen2me5 liao3jie3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel is slow to respond. Finally, he nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes... I concur. For the time being, we must continue forward.\n"
"\n"
"And that means that you must continue working toward raising Alice's fee."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​迟疑​片刻​才​回应​。​最终​，​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​我​同意​。​就​目前​而言​，​我们​必须​继续​推进​计划​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​你​必须​尽快​筹集​爱丽丝​要求​的​酬金​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 chi2yi2 pian4ke4 cai2 hui2ying4。zui4zhong1，ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……wo3 tong2yi4。jiu4 mu4qian2 er2yan2，wo3men5 bi4xu1 ji4xu4 tui1jin4 ji4hua4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 bi4xu1 jin3kuai4 chou2ji2 ai4li4si1 yao1qiu2 de5 chou2jin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel lets out a weary sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, yes. There is a guy. He calls himself \"Zaak Flash,\" and he's more of a street person than anything. If you're looking for drugs, he's the one you should talk to... he can get you what you need if you're willing to put up with him. \n"
"\n"
"One can usually find him crawling around the U-Bahn entrance to the northwest."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​疲惫​地叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​是​有​这么​个人​。​他管​自己​叫​“​扎克​·​弗莱​士​”​，​其实​就是​个​街头​混混​。​你​想​买药​的话​，​就​去​找​他​……​只要​能​忍受​他​那​副​德性​，​你​想要​的​他​都​有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​通常​会​在​西北​方向​的​地铁​入口​周围​转悠​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 pi2bei4 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，shi4 you3 zhe4me5 ge4ren2。ta1 guan3 zi4ji3 jiao4“Zha1ke4 · fu2 lai2 shi4”，qi2shi2 jiu4shi4 ge4 jie1tou2 hun4 hun4。ni3 xiang3 mai3 yao4 de5hua4，jiu4 qu4 zhao3 ta1……zhi3yao4 neng2 ren3shou4 ta1 na4 fu4 de2xing4，ni3 xiang3yao4 de5 ta1 dou1 you3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tong1chang2 hui4 zai4 xi1bei3 fang1xiang4 de5 di4tie3 ru4kou3 zhou1wei2 zhuan4you5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel looks pained.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I do not know his exact identity. I did not set up the run.\n"
"\n"
"Monika did."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​看起来​十分​痛苦​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​他​的​确切​身份​。​这趟​活​不是​我​安排​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​接活​的​人​是​莫妮卡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 kan4qi3lai5 shi2fen1 tong4ku3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 de5 que4qie4 shen1fen4。zhe4 tang1 huo2 bu4shi4 wo3 an1pai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"jie1huo2 de5 ren2 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods at your approach.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). Have you met with Frau Müller?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔向​你​点头​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​和​穆勒​女士​见​过​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 xiang4 ni3 dian3tou2 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，he4 mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 jian4 guo4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods gravely.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know that you and Eiger have had your differences. I will tell you that she was badly shaken by the sight of Winters' body."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​严肃​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​你​和​艾格尔​之间​有​过节​。​我​必须​告诉​你​，​温特斯​的​死​状​让​她​大受​震撼​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 yan2su4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 he4 Ai4ge2er3 zhi1jian1 you3 guo4jie2。wo3 bi4xu1 gao4su4 ni3，Wen1te4si1 de5 si3 zhuang4 rang4 ta1 dai4 shou4 zhen4han4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods. His face is drawn and haggard.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is thin, I agree. A basement, a middle-aged ork with skin grafts, and a long-forgotten world event."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​点点头​。​他​的​脸色苍白​而​憔悴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​同意​，​现有​的​情报​确实​不够​充分​。​我们​的​线索​只有​一间​地下室​，​一个​做过​植皮​的​中年​兽​人​，​和​一件​陈年​旧事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。ta1 de5 lian3 se4 cang1 bai2 er2 qiao2cui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4，xian4you3 de5 qing2bao4 que4shi2 bu4gou4 chong1fen4。wo3men5 de5 xian4suo3 zhi3you3 yi1 jian1 di4xia4shi4，yi1ge5 zuo4 guo4 zhi2pi2 de5 zhong1nian2 shou4 ren2，he4 yi1 jian4 chen2nian2 jiu4shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"An encoded credstick, yes. 10,000 nuyen. Alice will not show her face for less.\n"
"\n"
"This represents the last of my personal savings, $(l.name). Make this meeting count."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一根​加密​信用​棒​，​里面​有​一万​新円​。​给​少​了​，​爱丽丝​就​不会​露面​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​最后​的​积蓄​了​，​$(l.name)​。​这次​会面​一定​要​有所​收获​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1 gen1 jia1mi4 xin4yong4 bang4，li3mian4 you3 yi1 wan4 xin1 yuan2。gei3 shao3 le5，ai4li4si1 jiu4 bu4hui4 lou4mian4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 zui4hou4 de5 ji1xu4 le5，$(l.name)。zhe4 ci4 hui4mian4 yi1ding4 yao4 you3suo3 shou1huo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Her standard fee. Alice is in a position to ask it, and we're in no position to argue."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​她​的​收费​标准​。​爱丽丝​有​资格​提出​这个​价码​，​而​我们​没有​讨价还价​的​余地​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ta1 de5 shou1fei4 biao1zhun3。ai4li4si1 you3 zi1ge2 ti2chu1 zhe4ge5 jia4ma3，er2 wo3men5 mei2you3 tao3jia4huan2jia4 de5 yu2di4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I should say so."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That is correct. The Azzies control the majority of the district, and you will find their research facility at the heart of it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​。​阿兹佬​掌管​着​大部分​区域​，​他们​的​研究​设施​就​在​地区​中心​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。e1 zi1 lao3 zhang3guan3 zhao2 da4bu4fen5 qu1yu4，ta1men5 de5 yan2jiu1 she4shi1 jiu4 zai4 di4qu1 zhong1xin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That much is clear."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这点​很​明确​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dian3 hen3 ming2que4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When I discovered Monika's renewed association with Green Winters, I contacted Altuğ. One of his people has been keeping tabs on Winters ever since."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​发现​莫妮卡​跟​格林​·​温特斯​恢复​联络​后​，​我​就​联系​了​奥图​伊​。​在​那​之后​，​他​的​一个​手下​就​一直​监视​着​温特斯​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 fa1xian4 Mo4ni1ka3 gen1 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 hui1fu4 lian2luo4 hou4，wo3 jiu4 lian2xi4 le5 ao4 tu2 yi1。zai4 na4 zhi1hou4，ta1 de5 yi1ge5 shou3xia4 jiu4 yi1zhi2 jian1shi4 zhao2 Wen1te4si1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel pauses for a moment before continuing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In my mind, all of this reinforces one fact: we need to find Vauclair, and we need to do it fast."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​停顿​了​一会儿​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在我看来​，​我们​的​目标​现在​愈发​明确​：​我们​必须​找到​沃​克莱尔​，​而且​要​快​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5 you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4wo3kan4lai2，wo3men5 de5 mu4biao1 xian4zai4 yu4fa1 ming2que4：wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhao3dao4 Wo4ke4lai2er3，er2qie3 yao4 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel pauses, then gives a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Truth be told, I've been expecting that something like this might happen.\n"
"\n"
"I'm just glad that you made it out alive."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​停顿​片刻​，​随后​简短地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​料到​会​有​这种​事情​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还好​你​活着​回来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，sui2hou4 jian3 duan3 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 liao4dao4 hui4 you3 zhe4zhong3 shi4qing5 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"hai2hao3 ni3 huo2zhe5 hui2lai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel pauses, then gives you a small nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"From some of the stories that Monika told me, I don't doubt it.\n"
"\n"
"All the same, Eiger was badly shaken by the sight of Winters' corpse. She tried to hide it, but I could tell."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​停顿​了​一下​，​向​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​莫妮卡​向​我​讲述​的​那些​故事​来看​，​我​不​怀疑​这​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尽管如此​，​温特斯​的​死​状​还是​让​艾格尔大受​震撼​。​她​想​掩盖​自己​的​情绪​，​但​我​能​看​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，xiang4 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cong2 Mo4ni1ka3 xiang4 wo3 jiang3shu4 de5 na4xie1 gu4shi4 lai2 kan4，wo3 bu4 huai2yi2 zhe4 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，Wen1te4si1 de5 si3 zhuang4 hai2shi5 rang4 Ai4ge2er3 dai4 shou4 zhen4han4。ta1 xiang3 yan3gai4 zi4ji3 de5 qing2xu4，dan4 wo3 neng2 kan4 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel pulls open a file on his computer. A medical chart opens up on the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As it turns out, our scarred friend's skin grafts *were* performed at a legitimate hospital, after all."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​在​电脑​上​打开​一个​文件夹​。​屏幕​上弹​出​一份​病历​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​我们​这位​疤脸​朋友​的​皮肤​移植手术​*​确实​*​是​在​一家​正规​医院​进行​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 zai4 dian4nao3 shang4 da3kai1 yi1ge5 wen2jian4jia1。ping2mu4 shang4 dan4 chu1 yi1 fen4 bing4li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3men5 zhe4wei4 ba1 lian3 peng2you5 de5 pi2fu1 yi2zhi2shou3shu4*que4shi2*shi4 zai4 yi1jia1 zheng4gui1 yi1yuan4 jin4xing2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you absolutely sure?\n"
"\n"
"Again, I will cancel all of your remaining jobs once you've left for the Rabbit Hole."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​当真​准备​好了吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​再说​一次​，​一旦​你​出发​前往​兔子​洞​，​我​就​会​取消​你​剩余​的​所有​差事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dang4zhen1 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4shuo1 yi1ci4，yi1dan4 ni3 chu1fa1 qian2wang3 tu4zi5 dong4，wo3 jiu4 hui4 qu3xiao1 ni3 sheng4yu2 de5 suo3you3 cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For this? Rich enough... even if only just."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​只​为​这个​的话​……​勉强​算是​够​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi3 wei2 zhe4ge5 de5hua4……mian3qiang3 suan4shi4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel returns his attention to the papers scattered across his desk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Auf Wiedersehen."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​把​目光​移回​散落​在​桌上​的​文件​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 ba3 mu4guang1 yi2 hui2 san3luo4 zai4 zhuo1 shang4 de5 wen2jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel seems taken aback. He pauses for a moment before responding.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Firewing. This is... unexpected.\n"
"\n"
"You'll have to forgive me... this brings back many unpleasant memories."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​看起来​吃​了​一惊​。​他​沉默​了​一会儿​才​开​了​口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​。​这​……​实在​是​出乎意料​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不好意思​……​这​让​我​回​想起​许多​不太​愉快​的​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 kan4qi3lai5 chi1 le5 yi1 jing1。ta1 chen2mo4 le5 yi1hui4r5 cai2 kai1 le5 kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4。zhe4……shi2zai4 shi4 chu1hu1yi4liao4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4hao3yi4si5……zhe4 rang4 wo3 hui2 xiang3qi3 xu3duo1 bu4 tai4 yu2kuai4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel shakes his head wearily.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, $(l.name). I am not holding out. I am tired, and I am frustrated, and I already miss Monika. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​疲惫​地摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​$(l.name)​。​我​没​在​隐瞒​什么​。​我​很​累​，​也​很​沮丧​，​而且​我​已经​开始​想念​莫妮卡​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 pi2bei4 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，$(l.name)。wo3 mei2 zai4 yin3man2 shen2me5。wo3 hen3 lei3，ye3 hen3 ju3sang4，er2qie3 wo3 yi3jing1 kai1shi3 xiang3nian4 Mo4ni1ka3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As team leader, that is your prerogative. You may pursue other contracts instead if you wish. But remember... this job pays well, and we need the money.\n"
"\n"
"You can reach the offices of OTK International via the U-Bahn if you change your mind."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​作为​队长​，​你​怎么​决定​是​你​的​特权​。​你​要是​不​愿意​，​当然​也​可以​选择​其他​合同​。​但​别忘了​……​这份​差事​报酬​丰厚​，​我们​正好​需要​这笔​钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​好​以后​，​可以​坐地铁​去​OTK​国际​的​办公楼​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zuo4wei2 dui4zhang3，ni3 zen3me5 jue2ding4 shi4 ni3 de5 te4quan2。ni3 yao4shi5 bu4 yuan4yi4，dang1ran2 ye3 ke3yi3 xuan3ze2 qi2ta1 he2tong5。dan4 bie4 wang4 le5……zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4 bao4chou5 feng1hou4，wo3men5 zheng4hao3 xu1yao4 zhe4 bi3 qian2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 hao3 yi3hou4，ke3yi3 zuo4 de5 tie3 qu4 OTK guo2ji4 de5 ban4gong1lou2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel studies your face as you step back from the computer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your thoughts? Hold nothing back... I'd like to hear everything that comes to mind."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​当​你​远离​电脑屏幕​时​，​阿姆​泽尔​端详​起​你​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​怎么​看​？​不要​有所​保留​……​和​我​说​说​你​都​想到​了​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dang1 ni3 yuan3li2 dian4 nao3 bing3 mu4 shi2，E1mu3ze2er3 duan1xiang2 qi3 ni3 de5 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 kan4？bu4yao4 you3suo3 bao3liu2……he4 wo3 shuo1 shuo1 ni3 dou1 xiang3dao4 le5 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel sucks in a deep breath. He suddenly looks as though an enormous weight has been lifted from his shoulders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Very good. Excellent, in fact.\n"
"\n"
"This has been a long time coming, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​深吸​一口气​。​忽然​，​他​如​卸下​千斤重担​般​轻松​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​，​很​好​，​非常​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​等​了​好久​啊​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4。hu1ran2，ta1 ru2 xie4xia4 qian1 jin1 chong2 dan1 ban1 qing1song1 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3，hen3 hao3，fei1chang2 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 deng3 le5 hao3jiu3 a1，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel takes a deep breath. Slowly releases it. There is a haunted look in his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Those were dark days. Countless men, women, and children were slaughtered, roasted alive in their homes by a creature of legend. No hope for salvation, and no end in sight.\n"
"\n"
"It was a horror that you cannot begin to understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔深​吸​了​一口气​，​然后​缓缓​吐​出​。​他​的​眼中​带​着​不安​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​一段​黑暗​的​岁月​。​无数​男女老幼​惨遭​屠戮​，​被​传说​中​的​怪物​活活​烧死​在​自家​屋里​。​既​无​救赎​的​希望​，​也​看不到​终结​的​曙光​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那场​浩劫​的​恐怖​，​你们​根本无法​想象​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3qi4，ran2hou4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 dai4 zhao2 bu4an1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 yi1 duan4 hei1an4 de5 sui4yue4。wu2shu4 nan2nu:3lao3you4 can3zao1 tu2lu4，bei4 chuan2shuo1 zhong4 de5 guai4wu5 huo2huo2 shao1si3 zai4 zi4jia1 wu1 li3。ji4 wu2 jiu4shu2 de5 xi1wang4，ye3 kan4 bu4 dao4 zhong1jie2 de5 shu3guang1。\n"
"\n"
"na4 chang2 hao4jie2 de5 kong3bu4，ni3men5 gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 xiang3xiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel takes a ragged breath and releases it. Then a slow, melancholy smile plays across his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well. Perhaps a part of Monika lives on in Dante.\n"
"\n"
"Return to the safehouse when you're finished with Altuğ, $(l.freund). With a little luck, he can help us locate Green Winters, and we can get to the bottom of this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔喘​了​口气​，​又​缓缓​吐​出​。​他​脸上​慢慢​露出​一个​忧郁​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​或许​但丁​也​继承​了​莫妮卡​的​一部分​遗志​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​奥图​伊​谈完​之后​就​回​安全​屋来​，​$(l.freund)​。​运气​好​的话​，​他​能​帮忙​找到​格林​·​温特斯​，​我们​就​能​把​这事​查个​明明白白​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 chuan3 le5 kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。ta1 lian3 shang4 man4man4 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 you1yu4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，huo4xu3 dan4ding1 ye3 ji4cheng2 le5 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yi1bu4fen5 yi2zhi4。\n"
"\n"
"he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 tan2 wan2 zhi1hou4 jiu4 hui2 an1quan2 wu1 lai2，$(l.freund)。yun4qi5 hao3 de5hua4，ta1 neng2 bang1mang2 zhao3dao4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 ba3 zhe4 shi4 cha2 ge4 ming2 ming2 bai2 bai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel takes the PDA from you and examines it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes... yes, I should be able to extract some information from this. Give me a moment."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​接过​PDA​仔细​查看​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​不错​，​我​应该​能​从​这​里面​提取​一些​信息​。​等​我​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 jie1guo4 PDA zi3xi4 cha2kan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……bu4cuo4，wo3 ying1gai1 neng2 cong2 zhe4 li3mian4 ti2qu3 yi1xie1 xin4xi1。deng3 wo3 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel turns his attention away from you and back to his computer screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good hunting. I will eagerly await your return."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​将​注意力​从​你​身上​移开​，​重新​投向​电脑屏幕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝​狩猎​顺利​，​我会​热切​期待​你们​归来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 cong2 ni3 shen1shang5 yi2kai1，chong2xin1 tou2 xiang4 dian4 nao3 bing3 mu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhu4 shou4lie4 shun4li4，wo3 hui4 re4qie4 qi1dai4 ni3men5 gui1lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel turns to open a file on his computer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, $(l.name). Before you make this transfer, there are a few things that you should know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​转头​打开​电脑​上​的​一个​文件​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​$(l.name)​。​在​你​去​转账​之前​，​我要​提醒​你​几件事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 zhuan3tou2 da3kai1 dian4nao3 shang4 de5 yi1ge5 wen2jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，$(l.name)。zai4 ni3 qu4 zhuan3zhang4 zhi1qian2，wo3 yao4 ti2xing3 ni3 ji1 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel withdraws his hand and turns to open a file on his computer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Before you go see Alice, there are a few things that you should know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​收回​他​的​手​，​转头​打开​电脑​上​的​一个​文件​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​在​你​去​见​爱丽丝​之前​，​我要​提醒​你​几件事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 shou1hui2 ta1 de5 shou3，zhuan3tou2 da3kai1 dian4nao3 shang4 de5 yi1ge5 wen2jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，zai4 ni3 qu4 jian4 ai4li4si1 zhi1qian2，wo3 yao4 ti2xing3 ni3 ji1 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel's expression is harder than you've seen it before. When he speaks, his voice is grim.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Eiger has told me of Green Winters' death. She said that he died in the same manner that Monika did.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​神情​带​着​前所未有​的​凝重​。​他​开口​说话​时​，​声音​低沉​而​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​艾格尔向​我​告知​了​格林​·​温特斯​的​死讯​，​说​他​的​死法​与​莫妮卡​如出一辙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 shen2qing2 dai4 zhao2 qian2suo3wei4you3 de5 ning2zhong4。ta1 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4 shi2，sheng1yin1 di1chen2 er2 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ai4ge2er3 xiang4 wo3 gao4zhi1 le5 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 si3xun4，shuo1 ta1 de5 si3 fa3 yu4 Mo4ni1ka3 ru2chu1yi1zhe2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel's face appears on the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Samuel Beckenbauer has approached me with an offer of work.\n"
"\n"
"Apparently, an associate of his has learned some disturbing details regarding the Berlin chapter of the Humanis Policlub. He would like to contract your team to investigate these rumors."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​脸​出现​在​屏幕​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔​给​了​我​一份​委托​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​手下​的​某个​线​人​掌握​了​一些​关于​“​人类​至上​俱乐部​”​柏林​分部​的​可怕​传闻​。​他​希望​雇佣​你们​前去​调查​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3 gei3 le5 wo3 yi1 fen4 wei3tuo1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 shou3xia4 de5 mou3 ge4 xian4 ren2 zhang3wo4 le5 yi1xie1 guan1yu2“ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4” bo2lin2 fen1bu4 de5 ke3pa4 chuan2wen2。ta1 xi1wang4 gu4yong1 ni3men5 qian2 qu4 diao4cha2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel's face winks onto the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). Here you will find the complete transcript of my conversation with \"Herr Schmidt,\" a potential client. As you will see, the details of the job are a bit more vague than I would like, but the payout is quite substantial."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​脸​出现​在​画面​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​这里​有​我​和​潜在​客户​“​施密特​先生​”​的​完整​对话​记录​。​如​你​所见​，​差事​的​细节​比​我​想​的​要​模糊​一些​，​但​报酬​相当可观​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，zhe4li3 you3 wo3 he4 qian2zai4 ke4hu4“shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5” de5 wan2zheng3 dui4hua4 ji4lu4。ru2 ni3 suo3jian4，cha4shi4 de5 xi4jie2 bi3 wo3 xiang3 de5 yao4 mo2hu5 yi1xie1，dan4 bao4chou5 xiang1 dang1 ke3 guan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel's face winks onto the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here you will find the complete transcript of my conversation with \"Herr Fuchs,\" a potential client. The job seems to be relatively straightforward, and the payout is reasonable."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​脸​出现​在​画面​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​有​我​和​潜在​客户​“​施密特​先生​”​的​完整​对话​记录​。​这份​差事​看起来​并​不​复杂​，​报酬​也​相当可观​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 you3 wo3 he4 qian2zai4 ke4hu4“shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5” de5 wan2zheng3 dui4hua4 ji4lu4。zhe4 fen4 cha4shi4 kan4qi3lai5 bing4 bu4 fu4za2，bao4chou5 ye3 xiang1 dang1 ke3 guan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Amsel's voice trembles with frustration.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. It doesn't make any more sense to me than it does to you... the Dragonfall is ancient history. Feuerschwinge has been dead and gone for forty two years.\n"
"\n"
"But there's one thing that I do know. Whatever Monika saw... whatever she was trying to tell us... it was *important.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽尔​的​声音​因​沮丧​而​发颤​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​。​我​也​跟​你​一样​想不通​……​“​龙​陨​”​事件​过去​了​太久​，​火翼​之​死​距今​已经​有​四十二年​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​有​一件​事​我​是​清楚​的​。​不管​莫妮卡​看见​了​什么​……​不管​她​想​告诉​我们​什么​……​这件​事​都​很​*​重要​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 yin1 ju3sang4 er2 fa1chan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2you3。wo3 ye3 gen1 ni3 yi1yang4 xiang3bu5tong1……“long2 yun3” shi4jian4 guo4qu4 le5 tai4 jiu3，Huo3yi4 zhi1 si3 ju4jin1 yi3jing1 you3 si4 shi2 er4 nian2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 wo3 shi4 qing1chu5 de5。bu4guan3 Mo4ni1ka3 kan4jian4 le5 shen2me5……bu4guan3 ta1 xiang3 gao4su4 wo3men5 shen2me5……zhe4 jian4 shi4 dou1 hen3*zhong4yao4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}An alarmingly breathy elvish voice sings out in response.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But Titonius! The Jubuthon hordes will smite you if you stay!\n"
"\n"
"The people in that valley are only peasants. You needn't throw your life away for them! Flee with me, into the Enchanted Wood of Trala-sheen! "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一个​过分​轻柔​的​精灵​嗓音​随之​唱和​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​泰托​尼乌斯​！​如果​你​留下来​，​朱布松​的​大军​会​击垮​你​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​山谷​里​的​人​只是​些​农民​，​你​不必​为​他们​白白​送命​！​和​我​一起​逃​吧​，​进入​特拉​希恩​的​魔法​森林​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1ge5 guo4fen4 qing1rou2 de5 jing1ling2 sang3yin1 sui2zhi1 chang4he4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4 Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1！ru2guo3 ni3 liu2 xia4 lai2，zhu1 bu4 song1 de5 da4jun1 hui4 ji1 kua3 ni3 de5！\n"
"\n"
"shan1gu3 li3 de5 ren2 zhi3shi4 xie1 nong2min2，ni3 bu4bi4 wei2 ta1men5 bai2bai2 song4ming4！he4 wo3 yi1qi3 tao2 ba1，jin4ru4 te4 la1 xi1 en1 de5 mo2fa3 sen1lin2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}An astonished chuckle erupts from the old man.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mr. Grinder? Working with Plotz? Are you high?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​发出​惊异​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​绞肉机​”​先生​和​普​洛茨​串通一气​？​你​是​嗑​嗨​了​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 fa1chu1 jing1yi4 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 he4 Pu3luo4ci2 chuan4tong1yi1qi4？ni3 shi4 ke4 hai1 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}An astonished chuckle escapes from her mouth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"No reason to lie\"? Do you really believe tha--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​口中​发出​惊讶​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​没理由​说谎​”​？​你​不会​真的​相信​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kou3 zhong4 fa1chu1 jing1ya4 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“mei2 li3 you2 shuo1huang3”？ni3 bu4hui4 zhen1de5 xiang1xin4 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}An instant later, the drones' sensors alert them to your presence. They spin in unison to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"INTRUDERS DETECTED. WEAPONS DETECTED.\n"
"\n"
"LETHAL FORCE AUTHORIZED."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​霎时间​，​无人机​传感器​探测​到​你​的​存在​，​它们​齐刷刷​地​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​发现​入侵者​。​持有​武器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​已​授权​使用​致命​武力​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sha4shi2jian1，wu2ren2ji1 chuan2gan3qi4 tan4ce4 dao4 ni3 de5 cun2zai4，ta1men5 qi2shua1shua1 de5 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fa1xian4 ru4qin1zhe3。chi2you3 wu3qi4。\n"
"\n"
"yi3 shou4quan2 shi3yong4 zhi4ming4 wu3li4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}An old couple tends to one of the many communal gardens scattered through the Kreuzbasar. They appear to be in their late sixties or early seventies, though it is increasingly hard to determine such things in this day and age. The woman is the first to notice you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh! Mein Schatz, we have a guest."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一对​老​夫妇​在​照料​克洛伊​茨​集市​里​众多​公共​菜园​中​的​一处​。​他们​看起来​约莫​六七十岁​，​不过​在​这个​时代​，​年龄​已​越来越​难​判断​。​老妇人​最先​注意​到​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​！​亲爱​的​，​有​客人​来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1dui4 lao3 fu1fu4 zai4 zhao4liao4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 li3 zhong4duo1 gong1gong4 cai4yuan2 zhong4 de5 yi1 chu3。ta1men5 kan4qi3lai5 yue1mo5 liu4 qi1 shi2 sui4，bu4guo4 zai4 zhe4ge5 shi2dai4，nian2ling2 yi3 yue4lai2yue4 nan2 pan4duan4。lao3fu4ren2 zui4xian1 zhu4yi4 dao4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2！qin1ai4 de5，you3 ke4ren2 lai2 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Announce loudly.{{/GM}} Hey, everybody! Blitz is scared!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​大声​宣告​。​{{/GM}}​各位​！​布里​茨​害怕​了​！\n"
"{{GM}} da4sheng1 xuan1gao4。{{/GM}} ge4wei4！Bu4li3ci2 hai4pa4 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Another bloody cough. Sounds like he's struggling against a collapsed lung.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"World... whole world is... going to shit. We're on... on a runaway train to Hell, and someone...\n"
"\n"
"...Someone has to make it... jump the tracks..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​又​一声​带血​的​咳嗽​。​听​起来​他​正在​与​肺部​塌陷​作​斗争​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​世界​……​整个​世界​……​都​要​完蛋​了​。​我们​正​处于​……​一列​失控​的​列车​上​，​直奔​地狱​，​必须​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​必须​有人​让​它​……​脱轨​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you4 yi1sheng1 dai4 xie3 de5 ke2sou5。ting1 qi3lai5 ta1 zheng4zai4 yu4 fei4 bu4 ta1xian4 zuo4 dou4zheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4jie4……zheng3ge4 shi4jie4……dou1 yao4 wan2dan4 le5。wo3men5 zheng1 chu3yu2……yi1 lie4 shi1kong4 de5 lie4che1 shang4，zhi2ben4 di4yu4，bi4xu1……\n"
"\n"
"……bi4xu1 you3ren2 rang4 ta1……tuo1gui3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Another long pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The good stuff? You mean, like, the \"juice\"?\n"
"\n"
"Well... okay. Maybe just a sip. Or two."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​又​一阵​长时间​的​沉默​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​东西​？​你​是​说​，​那种​“​汁​”​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​好​吧​。​也许​我​可以​喝上​一两口​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you4 yi1zhen4 zhang3 shi2 jian1 de5 chen2mo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 dong1xi1？ni3 shi4 shuo1，na4zhong3“zhi1” ma5？\n"
"\n"
"en1……hao3 ba1。ye3xu3 wo3 ke3yi3 he4 shang4 yi1 liang3 kou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Another voice chimes in - a young man this time.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sir, look at Amsel's wrist. The PDA... I think that it's recording."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​又​一个​声音​插话​进来​—​—​这次​是​个​年轻​男性​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​长官​，​您​看​阿姆​泽尔​的​手腕​。​那台​PDA​……​我​想​它​在​录音​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you4 yi1ge5 sheng1yin1 cha1hua4 jin4lai2——zhe4 ci4 shi4 ge4 nian2qing1 nan2xing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhang3guan1，nin2 kan4 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 shou3wan4。na4 tai2 PDA……wo3 xiang3 ta1 zai4 lu4yin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Another voice, high-pitched and pleading. An adolescent boy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But what if it *is* someone? What if the bad people have found us? What if they followed me here, and they've come to..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​另​一个​尖锐​声音​发出​哀求​。​是​个​少年​男孩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​*​真的​*​有人​来​了​呢​？​如果​那些​坏人​找到​我们​了​呢​？​万一​他们​跟着​我​来到​了​这里​，​现在​正要​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ling4 yi1ge5 jian1rui4 sheng1yin1 fa1chu1 ai1qiu2。shi4 ge4 shao4nian2 nan2hai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3*zhen1de5*you3ren2 lai2 le5 ni2？ru2guo3 na4xie1 huai4ren2 zhao3dao4 wo3men5 le5 ni2？wan4yi1 ta1men5 gen1zhe5 wo3 lai2dao4 le5 zhe4li3，xian4zai4 zheng4yao4……"

msgid "{{GM}}Answer it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​接通​来电​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jie1tong1 lai2dian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Answer the call.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​接通​来电​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jie1tong1 lai2dian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Apologize to Dante.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​向​但丁​道歉​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} xiang4 dan4ding1 dao4qian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Approach him.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​接近​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jie1jin4 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}As Vauclair turns to leave, he gives you one final backward glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've made the right choice, shadowrunner.\n"
"\n"
"Just sit on your hands for the next few hours, and I promise you: the next time you set foot out of this lab, the world will be a different place."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​当沃​克莱尔​转身​离开​时​，​他​最后​回头​看​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​做​了​正确​的​选择​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​接下来​的​几个​小时​，​你​就​安安静静​地待​着​吧​，​我​向​你​保证​：​等​你​下次​踏出​这个​实验室​时​，​世界​将会​变得​截然不同​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dang1 Wo4ke4lai2er3 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 shi2，ta1 zui4hou4 hui2tou2 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"jie1xia4lai2 de5 ji3ge5 xiao3shi2，ni3 jiu4 an1 an1 jing4 jing4 de5 dai1 zhao2 ba1，wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4：deng3 ni3 xia4ci4 ta1 chu1 zhe4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 shi2，shi4jie4 jiang1hui4 bian4de5 jie2ran2bu4tong2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}As if on cue, a familiar image winks onto the monitor to Winters' left. Monika.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I think I'm gonna tap Schäfer for this job. She's got the skills to bypass whatever security they're running out there, and she's gullible enough to take the job in the first place.\n"
"\n"
"I'll feed her some line about Flux State security, and she'll eat it up with a spoon."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​就​像​提示​一样​，​温特斯​左边​的​监视器​上​闪现​出​一个​熟悉​的​身影​。​是​莫妮卡​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​我会​让​舍费尔​来​做​这件​事​。​她​有​足够​的​能力​绕过​安全​系统​，​而且​她​很​好​糊弄​，​让​她​接受​这份​工作​并​不​费劲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​给​她​一些​关于​动荡​带​安全​系统​的​信息​，​而​她​肯定​会​趋之若鹜​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jiu4 xiang4 ti2shi4 yi1yang4，Wen1te4si1 zuo3bian5 de5 jian1shi4qi4 shang4 shan3xian4 chu1 yi1ge5 shu2xi1 de5 shen1ying3。shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 hui4 rang4 she3 fei4 er3 lai2 zuo4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。ta1 you3 zu2gou4 de5 neng2li4 rao4guo4 an1quan2 xi4tong3，er2qie3 ta1 hen3 hao3 hu4nong5，rang4 ta1 jie1shou4 zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4 bing4 bu4 fei4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 gei3 ta1 yi1xie1 guan1yu2 dong4dang4 dai4 an1quan2 xi4tong3 de5 xin4xi1，er2 ta1 ken3ding4 hui4 qu1zhi1ruo4wu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}As if spurred on by the sight of the dragon below, he begins typing furiously at his terminal.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Feuerschwinge's fire will carry the agent in its dormant state. Any metahumans exposed will become carriers... will spread the disease to other dragons.\n"
"\n"
"The carriers will be infected with Panacea as well, but it will not harm them. To non-dragons, it is a nuisance - nothing more."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​仿佛​被​下方​巨龙​的​景象​所​刺激​到​，​他​开始​在​终端​上​疯狂​地​敲击​键盘​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​喷出​的​火焰​将​带有​休眠状态​的​制剂​。​任何​接触​到​的​泛​人类​都​会​成为​携带者​……​并​将​疾病​传播​给​其他​巨龙​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​携带者​也​会​感染​“​万能​药​”​，​但​不会​对​他们​造成​伤害​。​对非​巨龙​生物​来说​，​这​只是​个​小麻烦​—​—​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
