msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​集结​队伍​，​前往​影巢​，​潜入​人类​至上​俱乐部​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ji2jie2 dui4wu3，qian2wang3 ying3 chao2，qian2ru4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Assemble the team, and travel to the coordinates that Alice provided "
"to find a backdoor access point and shut down the APEX AI.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​集结​队伍​，​前往​爱丽丝​提供​的​坐标​点​，​寻找​后门​入口​并​关闭​APEX​人工智能​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ji2jie2 dui4wu3，qian2wang3 ai4li4si1 ti2gong1 de5 zuo4biao1 dian3，xun2zhao3 hou4men2 ru4kou3 bing4 guan1bi4 APEX ren2gong1zhi4neng2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}At that moment, Eiger's image winks onto your commlink with a crackling sound. The image is grainy, flickering in and out.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What's going on down there, rookie? Talk to me!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​就​在​这时​，​伴随​着​一阵​噼啪​声​，​艾格尔​的​头像​闪现​在​你​的​通讯​链上​。​传来​的​图像​上​布满​噪点​，​忽明忽暗​地​闪烁着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​那边​怎么回事​，​菜鸟​？​说话​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jiu4 zai4 zhe4shi2，ban4sui2 zhao2 yi1zhen4 pi1pa1 sheng1，Ai4ge2er3 de5 tou2xiang4 shan3xian4 zai4 ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 shang4。chuan2lai2 de5 tu2xiang4 shang4 bu4man3 zao4dian3，hu1 ming2 hu1 an4 de5 shan3 shuo4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 na4bian5 zen3me5hui2shi4，cai4niao3？shuo1hua4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}At the lightest touch, the papers crumble to dust. You can make out one small scrap that still contains legible writing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, Jörg, I don't care what you heard down there! Just because you heard something and a few people got sick from some \"weird disease\" doesn't mean that there are monsters wandering around. We've got to finish our blasting, or we won't get paid - no amount of weirdness is going to change that. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​轻轻​一碰​，​纸张​便​化为​尘埃​。​你​能​辨认出​一小片​仍​保留​着​可辨认​字迹​的​碎片​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​约​尔格​，​我​不在乎​你​下面​听到​了​什么​！​仅仅​因为​一些​风言风语​，​加上​有​几个​人得​了​某种​“​怪病​”​，​也​并​不​意味着​有​怪物​在​四处​游荡​。​我们​必须​完成​爆破​工作​，​否则​就​拿​不到​报酬​—​—​再​多​的​怪事​也​改变​不了​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1qing1 yi1 peng4，zhi3zhang1 bian4 hua4 wei2 chen2ai1。ni3 neng2 bian4 ren4 chu1 yi1 xiao3 pian1 reng2 bao3liu2 zhao2 ke3 bian4 ren4 zi4ji4 de5 sui4pian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，yao1 er3ge2，wo3 bu4zai4hu5 ni3 xia4mian4 ting1dao4 le5 shen2me5！jin3jin3 yin1wei4 yi1xie1 feng1 yan2 feng1 yu3，jia1shang4 you3 ji3ge5 ren2 de2 le5 mou3zhong3“guai4 bing4”，ye3 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 you3 guai4wu5 zai4 si4chu4 you2dang4。wo3men5 bi4xu1 wan2cheng2 bao4po4 gong1zuo4，fou3ze2 jiu4 na2 bu4dao4 bao4chou5——zai4 duo1 de5 guai4shi4 ye3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}At the sight of Monika’s dog, Amsel’s eyes well up. He inhales but can’t quite catch his breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He started whimpering about an hour ago. Turned into a full blown howl… wouldn’t stop... kept…"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​看到​莫妮卡​的​狗​，​阿姆​泽尔​的​眼眶​也​湿润​了​。​他​深吸​一口气​，​却​始终​无法​平复​呼吸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​大概​一个​小时​前​就​开始​呜咽​，​后来​变成​一阵阵​嚎叫​……​就​这么​一直​持续​着​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kan4dao4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 gou3，E1mu3ze2er3 de5 yan3kuang4 ye3 shi1run4 le5。ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，que4 shi3zhong1 wu2fa3 ping2fu4 hu1xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 da4gai4 yi1ge5 xiao3shi2 qian2 jiu4 kai1shi3 wu1ye4，hou4lai2 bian4cheng2 yi1 zhen4 zhen4 hao2jiao4……jiu4 zhe4me5 yi1zhi2 chi2xu4 zhao2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}At the sound of the word \"free,\" the woman's eyes open wide, and she presses her hands to the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Free yes free FREE!\n"
"\n"
"FREE ME AND I WILL RETURN TO THE MOUNTAIN.\n"
"\n"
"AND I WILL SLEEP UNTIL THE NEXT AGE OF THIS WORLD.\n"
"\n"
"AND I WILL NOT HARM ANOTHER SOUL JUST FREE ME FREE ME FREEEEE"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一​听到​“​自由​”​两个​字​，​女人​的​眼睛​突然​张大​，​双手​紧紧​按​在​玻璃​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​自由​，​是​的​，​自由​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​我​自由​，​我​就​会​回到​山中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​一直​沉睡​到​这​世界​的​下个​时代​来临​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​绝不会​再​伤害​任何人​，​只要​放​我​自由​，​自由​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 ting1dao4“zi4you2” liang3 ge4 zi4，nu:3ren2 de5 yan3jing5 tu1ran2 zhang1 dai4，shuang1shou3 jin3jin3 an4 zai4 bo1li5 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zi4you2，shi4 de5，zi4you2！\n"
"\n"
"fang4 wo3 zi4you2，wo3 jiu4 hui4 hui2dao4 shan1 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 yi1zhi2 chen2shui4 dao4 zhe4 shi4jie4 de5 xia4ge5 shi2dai4 lai2lin2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 zai4 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2，zhi3yao4 fang4 wo3 zi4you2，zi4you2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}At the sound of your approach, Blitz stubs out his cigarette. He gives you a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). I'd offer you a smoke, but that was my last one."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​看到​你​过来​，​掐灭​了​手里​的​烟头​。​他​向​你​略略​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​我本​想​给​你​递​支烟​，​但​我​已经​全​抽光​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 kan4dao4 ni3 guo4lai2，qia1 mie4 le5 shou3li3 de5 yan1tou2。ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu:e4lu:e4 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。wo3 ben3 xiang3 gei3 ni3 di4 zhi1 yan1，dan4 wo3 yi3jing1 quan2 chou1 guang1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}At the sound of your approach, he stops what he's doing and shifts his gaze to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name), right?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​注意​到​你​接近​后​，​他​停下​手里​的​活计​，​目光​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​$(l.name)​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhu4yi4 dao4 ni3 jie1jin4 hou4，ta1 ting2xia4 shou3li3 de5 huo2ji4，mu4guang1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 $(l.name) ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}At the sound of your words, the Engineer goes berserk. His eyes bulge, and he thrashes his head back and forth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You FUCKING IMBECILE! What have you DONE?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​听到​你​的话​，​工程师​突然​暴走​了​。​他​的​眼球​凸出​，​头部​左右​剧烈​摇晃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​他​妈​混蛋​！​你​都​做​了​些​什么​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ting1dao4 ni3 de5hua4，gong1cheng2shi1 tu1ran2 bao4zou3 le5。ta1 de5 yan3qiu2 tu1chu1，tou2bu4 zuo3you4 ju4lie4 yao2huang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ta1 ma1 hun2dan4！ni3 dou1 zuo4 le5 xie1 shen2me5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}At your approach, a disheveled-looking middle-aged man steps forward, placing himself between you and the main group. His gray hair is badly matted, and a pair of battered reading glasses hang from the bridge of his nose.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Who are you, may I ask? And what are you doing here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​当​你​靠近​时​，​一个​衣衫不整​的​中年男人​走上​前来​，​拦​在​你​和​人群​之间​。​他​的​灰白​头发​乱糟糟​的​，​一副​破旧​的​老花眼镜​挂​在​鼻梁​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请问​你​是​谁​？​你​来​这里​干什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dang1 ni3 kao4jin4 shi2，yi1ge5 yi1 shan1 bu4 zheng3 de5 zhong4 nian2 nan2 ren2 zou3 shang4 qian2lai2，lan2 zai4 ni3 he4 ren2qun2 zhi1jian1。ta1 de5 hui1bai2 tou2fa5 luan4zao1zao1 de5，yi1 fu4 po4jiu4 de5 lao3 hua1 yan3 jing4 gua4 zai4 bi2liang2 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3wen4 ni3 shi4 shei2？ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 gan4shen2me5？"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack Alexander.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​亚历山大​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ya4li4shan1da4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack everyone.{{/GM}} Change of plans. I'll be taking the shipment, "
"the cash for the delivery, and all of your lives."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​所有人​。​{{/GM}}​计划​有变​。​钱​也好​，​货​也好​，​还有​你们​所有人​的​命​，​都​归​我​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 suo3you3ren2。{{/GM}} ji4hua4 you3 bian4。qian2 ye3hao3，huo4 ye3hao3，hai2you3 ni3men5 suo3you3ren2 de5 ming4，dou1 gui1 wo3 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} Changed my mind, I'm just taking the parts!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​我​改​主意​了​，​我要​直接​拿走​零件​！\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5 le5，wo3 yao4 zhi2jie1 na2zou3 ling2jian4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} I can't waste any more time on this. You should've "
"just let us through."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​我​不能​继续​浪费时间​了​。​你​真不该​拦着​我们​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 bu4neng2 ji4xu4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1 le5。ni3 zhen1 bu4 gai1 lan2 zhao2 wo3men5 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} I don't care if you're under some spirit's "
"influence. You're a sick woman, and I'm going to put you down for everyone's"
" good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​我​才​不管​你​是不是​被​什么​精魂​控制​了​。​你​就是​个​疯女人​，​为了​大家​好​，​你​还是​去死吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 cai2 bu4guan3 ni3 shi4bu5shi4 bei4 shen2me5 jing1hun2 kong4zhi4 le5。ni3 jiu4shi4 ge4 feng1 nu:3 ren2，wei4le5 da4jia1 hao3，ni3 hai2shi5 qu4 si3 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} I'm done with this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​我编​不​下去​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 bian1 bu4 xia4qu4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} Oh, screw it. I'm done with this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​算了​，​我编​不​下去​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} suan4le5，wo3 bian1 bu4 xia4qu4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} Screw it, I don't have time for this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​算了​，​我​不想​浪费时间​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} suan4le5，wo3 bu4xiang3 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} Screw it, I'm done with this. You should've just "
"let us in the door."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​算了​，​我编​不​下去​了​。​谁​让​你​这么​多疑​呢​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} suan4le5，wo3 bian1 bu4 xia4qu4 le5。shei2 rang4 ni3 zhe4me5 duo1yi2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} Sorry about this, but we can’t chance you raising "
"an alarm."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​抱歉​，​但​我们​不能​冒​着​让​你​触发​警报​的​风险​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} bao4qian4，dan4 wo3men5 bu4neng2 mao4 zhao2 rang4 ni3 chu4fa1 jing3bao4 de5 feng1xian3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} That was a mistake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​你​做​了​错误​的​选择​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} ni3 zuo4 le5 cuo4wu4 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} The hell with this, I've got a schedule to keep."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​我​赶时间​呢​，​没​这​工夫​扯淡​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 gan3shi2jian1 ni2，mei2 zhe4 gong1fu1 che3dan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} They're, um... oh, screw it. I'm done with this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​他们​是​，​呃​……​算了​，​我编​不​下去​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} ta1men5 shi4，e4……suan4le5，wo3 bian1 bu4 xia4qu4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack her.{{/GM}} Too bad. I need those parts."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​她​。​{{/GM}}​真​不巧​，​我​需要​那些​零件​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} zhen1 bu4qiao3，wo3 xu1yao4 na4xie1 ling2jian4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} All right, Your Majesty. Consider this a "
"declaration of war."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​好​吧​，​陛下​。​那​我​就​向​你​宣战​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} hao3 ba1，bi4xia4。na4 wo3 jiu4 xiang4 ni3 xuan1zhan4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} Don't thank me too quickly. You're next!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​别急​着​谢​我​。​接下来​死​的​就是​你​！\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} bie4 ji2 zhao2 xie4 wo3。jie1xia4lai2 si3 de5 jiu4shi4 ni3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} I think I'd rather just put a bullet in your head."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​我​看​还是​直接​给​你​头上​来​一​梭子​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 kan4 hai2shi5 zhi2jie1 gei3 ni3 tou2shang4 lai2 yi1 suo1zi5 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} I think I'll just take the key instead."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​我​看​还是​直接​拿​钥匙​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 kan4 hai2shi5 zhi2jie1 na2 yao4shi5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} I've got a better idea. I think I'll just take the "
"chip off of your corpse."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​我​有​个​更好​的​主意​。​我​直接​从​你​的​尸体​上​拿走​芯片​不​就行了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 you3 ge4 geng1 hao3 de5 zhu3yi5。wo3 zhi2jie1 cong2 ni3 de5 shi1ti3 shang4 na2zou3 xin1pian4 bu4 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} I've heard enough. I'm putting you out of your "
"misery."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​我​已经​听够​了​。​我​这​就​帮​你​解脱​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 yi3jing1 ting1 gou4 le5。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 bang1 ni3 jie3tuo1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} Neither can you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​你​也​一样​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} ni3 ye3 yi1yang4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} Sorry, but we're on a tight schedule."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​不好意思​，​我们​赶时间​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3men5 gan3shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} Trithemius is dead, and you're going to join him."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​特​里特​米​乌斯​已经​死​了​，​你​也​下去​陪​他​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 yi3jing1 si3 le5，ni3 ye3 xia4qu4 pei2 ta1 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} Trithemius sends his regards."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​特​里特​米​乌斯​向​你​问好​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 xiang4 ni3 wen4hao3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} Warned you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​别说​我​没​警告​过​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} bie2shuo1 wo3 mei2 jing3gao4 guo4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack him.{{/GM}} Your elevator key. I'll take it from your corpse."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他​。​{{/GM}}​我要​你​的​电梯​钥匙​。​不过​我​打算​自己​从​你​尸体​上​拿​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1。{{/GM}} wo3 yao4 ni3 de5 dian4ti1 yao4shi5。bu4guo4 wo3 da3suan4 zi4ji3 cong2 ni3 shi1ti3 shang4 na2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack the Company Man to free Enstad.{{/GM}} I've come this far. "
"Might as well finish it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​袭击​公司​佬​以​解救​恩施​塔德​。​{{/GM}}​既然​走到​这​一步​了​，​就​干脆​好人​做​到底​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} xi2ji1 gong1si1 lao3 yi3 jie3jiu4 en1Shi1ta3de2。{{/GM}} ji4ran2 zou3 dao4 zhe4 yi1 bu4 le5，jiu4 gan1cui4 hao3ren2 zuo4 dao4di3 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack the acolytes.{{/GM}} Time to die, cultist scum!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​侍祭​。​{{/GM}}​去死吧​，​邪教徒​人渣​！\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 shi4 ji4。{{/GM}} qu4 si3 ba1，xie2 jiao1 tu2 ren2zha1！"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack the drones.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​无人机​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 wu2ren2ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack the ghoul.{{/GM}} It's a monster! Kill it!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​食尸​鬼​。​{{/GM}}​是​怪物​！​杀​了​它​！\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 shi2 shi1 gui3。{{/GM}} shi4 guai4wu5！sha1 le5 ta1！"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack the ghoul.{{/GM}} No. I don't think so."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​食尸​鬼​。​{{/GM}}​还是​别说​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 shi2 shi1 gui3。{{/GM}} hai2shi5 bie2shuo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack the ghoul.{{/GM}} On second thought, why don't I just shoot you"
" all?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​食尸​鬼​。​{{/GM}}​搞​这么​麻烦​，​不如​我​直接​开枪​算了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 shi2 shi1 gui3。{{/GM}} gao3 zhe4me5 ma2fan5，bu4ru2 wo3 zhi2jie1 kai1qiang1 suan4le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack the ghouls.{{/GM}} I'm going to put you out of your misery."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​食尸​鬼​。​{{/GM}}​我​还是​早早​送​你​解脱​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 shi2 shi1 gui3。{{/GM}} wo3 hai2shi5 zao3 zao3 song4 ni3 jie3tuo1 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack the guard.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​警卫​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 jing3wei4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack the guard.{{/GM}} I've got all the ID that I need right here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​警卫​。​{{/GM}}​这​就是​我​的​证件​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 jing3wei4。{{/GM}} zhe4 jiu4shi4 wo3 de5 zheng4jian4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack the guards.{{/GM}} Not if I remove you first."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​警卫​。​{{/GM}}​我先​清除​你们​不​就​得​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 jing3wei4。{{/GM}} wo3 xian1 qing1chu2 ni3men5 bu4 jiu4 de2 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack the guards.{{/GM}} Shut up already."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​警卫​。​{{/GM}}​赶紧​闭嘴​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 jing3wei4。{{/GM}} gan3jin3 bi4zui3 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack the guards.{{/GM}} Something like that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​警卫​。​{{/GM}}​差不多​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 jing3wei4。{{/GM}} cha4bu5duo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack the guards.{{/GM}} You should've left when you had the chance."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​警卫​。​{{/GM}}​磨磨蹭蹭​可​没​好​果子吃​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 jing3wei4。{{/GM}} mo2mo2ceng4ceng4 ke3 mei2 hao3 guo3 zi3 chi1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack them.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​他们​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1 ta1men5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack!{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​！​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1！{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack, taking the blood mage by surprise.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​向​血​法师​发动​奇袭​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} xiang4 xie3 fa3shi1 fa1dong4 qi2xi2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} About time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​进攻​。​{{/GM}}​是​时候​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} jin4gong1。{{/GM}} shi4 shi2hou5 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} Cyberzombie! Kill 'em all!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​赛博​僵尸​，​把​他们​都​杀​了​！\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} sai4bo2 jiang1shi1，ba3 ta1men5 dou1 sha1 le5！"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} Don't mind if I do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​那​我​可​就​不​客气​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} na4 wo3 ke3 jiu4 bu4 ke4qi5 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} Here's your answer, swine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​这​就是​给​你​的​答案​，​猪猡​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} zhe4 jiu4shi4 gei3 ni3 de5 da2an4，zhu1luo2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} I need to use that terminal. Nothing personal."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​我​需要​使用​那台​终端​。​别见怪​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} wo3 xu1yao4 shi3yong4 na4 tai2 zhong1duan1。bie4 jian4 guai4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} Take 'em out!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​干掉​他们​！\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} gan4diao4 ta1men5！"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} The hell with that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​去​你​的​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} qu4 ni3 de5 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} The hell with this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​去​你​的​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} qu4 ni3 de5 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} We could have done this the easy way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​敬酒不吃吃罚酒​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} jing4jiu3bu4chi1chi1fa2jiu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Attack.{{/GM}} You can't order him to do anything if you're dead."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​攻击​。​{{/GM}}​你​死​了​就​没法​命令​他​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gong1ji1。{{/GM}} ni3 si3 le5 jiu4 mei2fa3 ming4ling4 ta1 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Attempt to knock the gun out of his hand.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​尝试​打掉​他​手里​的​枪​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} chang2shi4 da3diao4 ta1 shou3li3 de5 qiang1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Attempt to log in.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​尝试​登录​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} chang2shi4 deng1lu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Attempt to push your way past the safeguards.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​尝试​绕过​安全措施​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} chang2shi4 rao4guo4 an1quan2cuo4shi1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Attempt to wrestle him to the ground.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​尝试​将​他​摔倒​在​地​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} chang2shi4 jiang1 ta1 shuai1dao3 zai4 de5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran chuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Really? That's what you've saved for the occasion? Well, it's your poison."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​笑​出​了​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​吧​？​你​就​给​自己​准备​了​这个​？​行​吧​，​你​说了算​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 xiao4 chu1 le5 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 ba1？ni3 jiu4 gei3 zi4ji3 zhun3bei4 le5 zhe4ge5？xing2 ba1，ni3 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran looks surprised.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm guessing you lifted that from someone with much better taste."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​看起来​有些​惊讶​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​你​是从​某个​有​品位​的​人​那里​弄​来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 jing1ya4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 ni3 shi4 cong2 mou3 ge4 you3 pin3wei4 de5 ren2 na4li5 long4 lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Understood, Doctor Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​明白​，​沃​克莱尔​博士​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ming2bai5，Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran returns, his Vindicator minigun spinning up with a distinctive whir.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Didn’t I tell you that we’re on a timetable here? Now I'm gonna have to kill you myself."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​回来​了​，​他​的​“​辩护人​”​加特林​发出​独特​的​嗡​鸣声​，​开始​旋转​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不是​告诉​过​你​，​我们​在​赶时间​吗​？​现在​我​不得不​亲自​干掉​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 hui2lai5 le5，ta1 de5“bian4hu4ren2” jia1te4lin2 fa1chu1 du2te4 de5 weng1 ming2 sheng1，kai1shi3 xuan2zhuan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 gao4su4 guo4 ni3，wo3men5 zai4 gan3shi2jian1 ma5？xian4zai4 wo3 bu4de2bu4 qin1zi4 gan4diao4 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran shrugs, then accepts the bottle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In my experience, everything's worth drinking to. But it's your call."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​耸耸肩​，​接过​了​酒瓶​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​我​的​经验​来看​，​任何​事​都​值得​你​喝一杯​。​但​这事​你​自己​说了算​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 song3 song3 jian1，jie1guo4 le5 jiu3 ping2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cong2 wo3 de5 jing1yan4 lai2 kan4，ren4he2 shi4 dou1 zhi2de5 ni3 he4 yi1 bei1。dan4 zhe4 shi4 ni3 zi4ji3 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran steps toward a console and taps in a series of commands. An ominous rumbling sound fills the room.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Some company for you while I'm gone. I trained them myself."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​走向​控制台​，​输入​了​一系列​指令​。​房间​里​传来​一阵​令人不安​的​轰鸣声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​在​的​时候​，​这些​家伙​会​陪​着​你​。​我​亲自​训练​过​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 zou3xiang4 kong4zhi4tai2，shu1ru4 le5 yi1xi4lie4 zhi3ling4。fang2jian1 li3 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 hong1 ming2 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zai4 de5 shi2hou5，zhe4xie1 jia1huo5 hui4 pei2 zhao2 ni3。wo3 qin1zi4 xun4lian4 guo4 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran turns his back on you to stare through the window into Feuerschwinge's pen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Go on hating my guts if it makes you happy. Hatred is good. Keeps the blood pumping.\n"
"\n"
"If you grow a pair, go ahead and take a swing at me. See what happens. Or you could let bygones be bygones and enjoy this nice liquor I'm offering you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​转身​回去​隔​着​窗户​看向​火翼​的​巢穴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随便​你​怎么​想​吧​，​你​高兴​就​好​。​仇恨​是​件​好事​。​能​让​你​保持​热血沸腾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​手里​有​家伙​，​就​干脆​给​我​一下子​，​看看​会​如何​。​或者​你​也​可以​选择​放下​过去​，​尝尝​我​这​的​好​酒​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 zhuan3shen1 hui2qu5 ge2 zhao2 chuang1hu5 kan4 xiang4 Huo3yi4 de5 chao2xue2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3 ba1，ni3 gao1xing4 jiu4 hao3。chou2hen4 shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。neng2 rang4 ni3 bao3chi2 re4xue4fei4teng2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 shou3li3 you3 jia1huo5，jiu4 gan1cui4 gei3 wo3 yi1xia4zi5，kan4kan5 hui4 ru2he2。huo4zhe3 ni3 ye3 ke3yi3 xuan3ze2 fang4xia4 guo4qu4，chang2 chang2 wo3 zhe4 de5 hao3 jiu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran turns to stare at you through the glass. His lips curl into an insolent smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hi again. Long time. How’s Amsel doing? \n"
"\n"
"That hole in his brainpan heal up okay?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​转过身​来​，​透过​玻璃​盯​着​你​。​他​的​嘴唇​翘起​，​露出​一个​傲慢​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​见面​了​。​好久不见​。​阿姆​泽尔​最近​怎么样​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​脑壳​上​的​那个​洞好​点​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2，tou4guo4 bo1li5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 zui3chun2 qiao4qi3，lu4chu1 yi1ge5 ao4man4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5。hao3jiu3bu5jian4。E1mu3ze2er3 zui4jin4 zen3me5yang4？\n"
"\n"
"ta1 nao3ke2 shang4 de5 na4ge5 dong4 hao3 dian3 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran turns to stare at you through the glass. His lips curl into an insolent smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now. What to do with you...?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​转过身​来​，​透过​玻璃​凝视着​你​。​他​的​嘴唇​翘起​，​露出​嚣张​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​要​拿​你​怎么办​呢​……​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2，tou4guo4 bo1li5 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 zui3chun2 qiao4qi3，lu4chu1 xiao1zhang1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 yao4 na2 ni3 zen3me5ban4 ni2……？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Audran twists suddenly towards the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"QUIET!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​奥​德兰​突然转向​玻璃​这边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​安静​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ao4de2lan2 tu1 ran2 zhuai3 xiang4 bo1li5 zhe4bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"an1jing4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Bachmeier's image is garbled, but his voice sounds young and eager.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Target acquired, sir. You were right... we spotted $(l.him) on the U-Bahn, just like you said. Probably on $(l.hisher) way to a job."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​巴赫​迈尔​的​图像​是​乱码​，​但​他​的​声音​很​年轻​，​充满​干劲​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​目标​已​锁定​，​长官​。​你​是​对​的​……​正如​你​所说​，​我们​在​地铁​发现​了​$(l.he)​，​其​可能​正在​前往​工作​地点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ba1he4 mai4 er3 de5 tu2xiang4 shi4 luan4ma3，dan4 ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 nian2qing1，chong1man3 gan4jin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mu4biao1 yi3 suo3ding4，zhang3guan1。ni3 shi4 dui4 de5……zheng4ru2 ni3 suo3 shuo1，wo3men5 zai4 di4tie3 fa1xian4 le5 $(l.he)，qi2 ke3neng2 zheng4zai4 qian2wang3 gong1zuo4 di4dian3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Back away.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​退后​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} tui4hou4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Back away.{{/GM}} No need to get testy. I'm going."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​退后​。​{{/GM}}​不用​这么​暴躁​。​我​这​就​走​。\n"
"{{GM}} tui4hou4。{{/GM}} bu4yong4 zhe4me5 bao4zao4。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 zou3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Back down.{{/GM}} All right, Glory. You win."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​好​吧​，​格洛丽​。​你​赢​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} hao3 ba1，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 ying2 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Back to root.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​返回​根目录​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fan3hui2 gen1mu4lu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Beckenbauer eyes the plans on the datapad, then nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This fits with Humanis' established pattern of behavior. Horrific and vile."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​贝肯鲍尔​盯​着​数据​板上​的​内容​，​然后​面​无表情​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​符合​人类​至上​主义者​的​既定​行为​模式​。​可怕​而​卑鄙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bei4ken3bao4er3 ding1 zhao2 shu4ju4 ban3 shang4 de5 nei4rong2，ran2hou4 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 fu2he2 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 ji4ding4 xing2wei2 mo2shi4。ke3pa4 er2 bei1bi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Before you stands a troll, though it is a stretch to say he is standing at all. His great mass is barely held upright by two vintage prosthetic legs, along with a crutch under one arm. His body clicks and hums with every shift of his weight. Despite these disabilities, his eyes are sharp and calculating.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​面前​站​着​一个​巨魔​，​虽然​说​他​站​着​还​有些​牵强​。​他​巨大​的​身躯​靠​两条​老式​假腿​和​一只​胳膊​下​的​拐杖​勉强​支撑​着​。​他​的​身体​随着​重心​的​移动​而​发出​咔​咔​的​嗡嗡声​。​尽管​有​这些​残疾​，​他​的​眼神​却​锐利​而​工于心计​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认识​你​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 mian4qian2 zhan4 zhao2 yi1ge5 ju4mo2，sui1ran2 shuo1 ta1 zhan4 zhao2 hai2 you3xie1 qian1qiang3。ta1 ju4da4 de5 shen1qu1 kao4 liang3 tiao2 lao3shi4 jia3tui3 he4 yi1 zhi3 ge1bo5 xia4 de5 guai3zhang4 mian3qiang3 zhi1cheng1 zhao2。ta1 de5 shen1ti3 sui2zhe5 zhong4xin1 de5 yi2dong4 er2 fa1chu1 ka3 ka3 de5 weng1weng1sheng1。jin3guan3 you3 zhe4xie1 can2ji2，ta1 de5 yan3shen2 que4 rui4li4 er2 gong1yu2xin1ji4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4shi5 ni3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Behind your eyes, your vision starts to twist. It feels as though you're being turned inside out.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Time to go. With the spirit's link to the Adversary severed, this entire reality is falling apart."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​视线​开始​扭曲​，​仿佛​被​从里到外​翻转​过来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​走​了​。​随着​精魂​与​反叛者​的​联系​被​切断​，​这片​现实​正在​分崩离析​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 shi4xian4 kai1shi3 niu3qu1，fang3fu2 bei4 cong2li3dao4wai4 fan1zhuan3 guo4lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1 zou3 le5。sui2zhe5 jing1hun2 yu4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 de5 lian2xi4 bei4 qie1duan4，zhe4 pian1 xian4shi2 zheng4zai4 fen1beng1li2xi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Bitterness creeps into the old man's voice. He sounds hollowed-out. Gutted.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For over forty years, I ignored the rest of the world. I ignored the media and the military, the Board of Directors at Diehl and my little brother. \n"
"\n"
"No - *especially* my little brother. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​苦涩​的​情绪​逐渐​渗入​老人​的​声音​中​。​他​的​声音​听​起来​空洞​无力​，​仿佛​被​掏空​了​一般​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​四十多年​来​，​我​一直​无视​外界​的​一切​。​我​无视​了​媒体​和​军队​，​无视​了​迪尔​防务​的​董事会​，​也​无视​了​我​的​弟弟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​—​—​*​尤其​*​是​我​的​弟弟​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ku3se4 de5 qing2xu4 zhu2jian4 shen4ru4 lao3ren2 de5 sheng1yin1 zhong4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 kong1dong4 wu2li4，fang3fu2 bei4 tao1kong1 le5 yi1ban1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"si4 shi2 duo1 nian2 lai2，wo3 yi1zhi2 wu2shi4 wai4jie4 de5 yi1qie4。wo3 wu2shi4 le5 mei2ti3 he4 jun1dui4，wu2shi4 le5 Di2er3fang2wu4 de5 dong3shi4hui4，ye3 wu2shi4 le5 wo3 de5 di4di5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4——*you2qi2*shi4 wo3 de5 di4di5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, thank Christ."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​，​谢天谢地​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2，xie4tian1xie4di4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz calls out, his voice wavering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Uh-oh. Not sure I like the looks of this, chief."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​失声​叫​道​，​他​的​声音​有些​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​哦​。​我​感觉​情况​不​对​啊​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 shi1sheng1 jiao4 dao4，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 you3xie1 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1 e2。wo3 gan3jue2 qing2kuang4 bu4 dui4 a1，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz chokes out a startled chuckle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's pretty vile, chief. I mean, seriously."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​忍不住​发出​惊愕​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​也​太​恶心​了​，​头儿​。​讲真​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 ren3bu5zhu4 fa1chu1 jing1e4 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ye3 tai4 e3xin1 le5，tou2r5。jiang3 zhen1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz claps his hands, then rubs them together in excitement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Get set, chief. You're about to witness an *event.*\n"
"\n"
"When my *gung-ho personality* and *legendary skills* come together, the whole *world* stops and takes notice!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​拍拍​双手​，​然后​激动​地​攥​在​一起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​做好​准备​，​头儿​。​你​就​等​着​看​*​好戏​*​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我​的​*​古道热肠​*​和​*​一身​本领​*​结合​到​一起​的​时候​，​整个​*​世界​*​都​要​为​之​侧目​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 pai1 pai1 shuang1shou3，ran2hou4 ji1dong4 de5 zuan4 zai4 yi1qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4，tou2r5。ni3 jiu4 deng3 zhao2 kan4*hao3 xi4*ba1。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 de5*gu3 dao4 re4 chang2*he4*yi1shen1 ben3ling3*jie2he2 dao4 yi1qi3 de5 shi2hou5，zheng3ge4*shi4jie4*dou1 yao4 wei2 zhi1 ce4mu4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz deflates before your eyes. He looks down at his shoes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah... yeah. I guess you're right.\n"
"\n"
"Okay, boss. You win. I'll let it go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​在​你​面前​泄​了​气​。​他​低头​看着​自己​的​鞋子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​是​啊​。​也许​你​说得对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​老大​。​你​赢​了​。​我会​放下​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2 xie4 le5 qi4。ta1 di1tou2 kan4 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 xie2zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……shi4 a1。ye3xu3 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，lao3da4。ni3 ying2 le5。wo3 hui4 fang4xia4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz eyes the smashed console.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Did we do the right thing, leaving her like that? "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​盯​着​被​砸坏​的​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​这样​放着​她​不管​，​真的​好​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 ding1 zhao2 bei4 za2huai4 de5 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4yang4 fang4 zhao2 ta1 bu4guan3，zhen1de5 hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz glances at you. The worry is painted all over his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can't believe I'm saying this, but you'd better bring me along.\n"
"\n"
"You try going up against an AI without a novahot decker at your side, and you're probably going to regret it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​瞥​了​你​一眼​。​他​的​脸上​写满​了​忧虑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不敢相信​我会​这么​说​，​但​你​最好​带上​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不​带上​一个​最​顶尖​的​碟​客​就​去​对付​AI​的话​，​那​你​大概​是​要​后悔​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 xie3 man3 le5 you1lu:4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 wo3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 dai4shang4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 dai4shang4 yi1ge5 zui4 ding3jian1 de5 die2 ke4 jiu4 qu4 dui4fu5 AI de5hua4，na4 ni3 da4gai4 shi4 yao4 hou4hui3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz glances up from a jumble of wires and electronics, a preoccupied look on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can't really chat right now, chief. I've still gotta gear up for the hit on Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​从​一堆​杂乱​的​电线​和​电子设备​中​抬起头来​，​脸上​带​着​心事重重​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​没空​聊天​，​头儿​。​我​还​得​为沃​克莱尔​的​差事​赶紧​做好​准备​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 cong2 yi1dui1 za2luan4 de5 dian4xian4 he4 dian4 zi3 she4 bei4 zhong4 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 xin1shi4chong2chong2 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 mei2 kong1 liao2tian1，tou2r5。wo3 hai2 de2 wei2 Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 cha4shi4 gan3jin3 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz glances wistfully back at the terminal on the table, then turns back with a sigh of resignation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose. But try to keep it short, okay, chief? I've got things to do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​怀念​地瞥​了​一眼​桌上​的​终端​，​然后​叹​了​口气​，​无奈​地​转过身​来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那好​吧​。​但​头儿​，​尽量​长话短说​好​吗​？​我​还有​事要​忙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 huai2nian4 de5 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 zhuo1 shang4 de5 zhong1duan1，ran2hou4 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，wu2nai4 de5 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1。dan4 tou2r5，jin3liang4 chang2hua4duan3shuo1 hao3 ma5？wo3 hai2you3 shi4 yao4 mang2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz groans.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That was a mistake, chief. I mean, seriously."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​嘟囔​了​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​犯​了​个​错误​，​头儿​。​我​认真​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 du1nang5 le5 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 fan4 le5 ge4 cuo4wu4，tou2r5。wo3 ren4zhen1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz holds your gaze for a moment, defiant. Then he looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...I guess there isn't a third option, is there?\n"
"\n"
"This sucks, chief."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​倔强地​与​你​对视​片刻​，​随后​又​移开​了​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​看来​没有​第三种​选择​，​对​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这事​太​恶心​了​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 jue4 jiang4 de5 yu4 ni3 dui4shi4 pian4ke4，sui2hou4 you4 yi2kai1 le5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……kan4lai5 mei2you3 di4 san1 zhong3 xuan3ze2，dui4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 tai4 e3xin1 le5，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz holds your gaze for a moment, defiant. Then he looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, chief, calm down. I'll do it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​倔强地​与​你​对视​片刻​，​随后​又​移开​了​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​头儿​，​冷静​点​。​我会​去​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 jue4 jiang4 de5 yu4 ni3 dui4shi4 pian4ke4，sui2hou4 you4 yi2kai1 le5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5，leng3jing4 dian3。wo3 hui4 qu4 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz is clearly still as tense as ever. The table in front of him is littered with cigarette butts, and there's an enormous mug of soykaf cradled in his hands.\n"
"\n"
"He looks up at you with a tortured grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey, chief! What... uh... what can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​明显​还是​十分​紧张​。​他​面前​的​桌子​上​散落​着​烟头​，​而​他​手里​拿​着​一大​杯豆​咖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​抬头​看向​你​，​露出​勉强​的​笑容​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​头儿​！​呃​……​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 ming2xian3 hai2shi5 shi2fen1 jin3zhang1。ta1 mian4qian2 de5 zhuo1zi5 shang4 san3luo4 zhao2 yan1tou2，er2 ta1 shou3li3 na2 zhao2 yi1 dai4 bei1 dou4 ka1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，lu4chu1 mian3qiang3 de5 xiao4rong2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，tou2r5！e4……you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz leans in to inspect her work.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah... yeah, that looks like a pretty solid connection. Nice soldering job on those contacts, there.\n"
"\n"
"I'd say that you're good to go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​倾身​过去​检视​她​的​成果​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​连接​部分​看起来​相当​牢固​。​触点​的​焊接​做​得​不错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看​这样​确实​可以​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 qing1 shen1 guo4qu4 jian3shi4 ta1 de5 cheng2guo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……lian2jie1 bu4fen5 kan4qi3lai5 xiang1dang1 lao2gu4。chu4 dian3 de5 han4jie1 zuo4 de2 bu4cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4 zhe4yang4 que4shi2 ke3yi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz leans in to whisper to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know the stories he's talkin' about, chief. Never really put much stock 'em... not until now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​凑近​向​你​低语​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​他​说​的​是​什么​事​，​头儿​。​我​从来​没​怎么​相信​过​……​直到现在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 cou4jin4 xiang4 ni3 di1yu3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ta1 shuo1 de5 shi4 shen2me5 shi4，tou2r5。wo3 cong2lai2 mei2 zen3me5 xiang1xin4 guo4……zhi2dao4xian4zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz lets out a sigh of relief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks, chief. I knew you'd understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​长出​了​一口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​，​头儿​。​我​就​知道​你​能​理解​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zhang3chu1 le5 yi1kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5，tou2r5。wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz looks grim. His customary table is littered with cigarette butts, and the heavy bags under his eyes tell you that he hasn't slept in a while.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​看起来​很​沮丧​。​他​惯常​坐​的​桌子​上​散落​着​烟头​，​两个​黑眼圈​表明​他​已经​好​几天​没​睡觉​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 ju3sang4。ta1 guan4chang2 zuo4 de5 zhuo1zi5 shang4 san3luo4 zhao2 yan1tou2，liang3 ge4 hei1yan3quan1 biao3ming2 ta1 yi3jing1 hao3 ji3tian1 mei2 shui4jiao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz looks sullen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, well, screw you, too."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​面色​愠怒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啧​，​算了​。​去​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 mian4se4 yun4nu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ze2，suan4le5。qu4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz looks up at your approach. The table beside him is littered with cigarette butts, and a datajack cable dangles from a portable terminal set up by his side.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Heyya, chief. You need somethin'?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​抬头​看着​你​走近​。​他​身旁​的​桌子​上​散落​着​烟头​，​一根​数据​插口​线​从​他​身边​摆放​的​便携式​终端​上​垂下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​头儿​。​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 tai2tou2 kan4 zhao2 ni3 zou3jin4。ta1 shen1 pang2 de5 zhuo1zi5 shang4 san3luo4 zhao2 yan1tou2，yi1 gen1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 xian4 cong2 ta1 shen1bian1 bai3fang4 de5 bian4xie2shi4 zhong1duan1 shang4 chui2 xia4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，tou2r5。you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz meets your gaze for a moment, then looks away and sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Where to begin?\n"
"\n"
"I met Emilie in Drogenkippe. She was the first person who was ever more important to me than myself."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​与​你​的​目光​对视​片刻​，​随后​移开​视线​并​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​从何说起​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​毒​坑区​遇见​了​艾米莉​。​她​是​第一个​让​我​感觉​比​自己​还​重要​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 yu4 ni3 de5 mu4guang1 dui4shi4 pian4ke4，sui2hou4 yi2kai1 shi4xian4 bing4 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。cong2 he2 shuo1 qi3 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 du2 keng1 qu1 yu4jian4 le5 ai4 mi3 li4。ta1 shi4 di4 yi1 ge4 rang4 wo3 gan3jue2 bi3 zi4ji3 hai2 zhong4yao4 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz mutters under his breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Join the club."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​低声​嘀咕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​加入​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 di1sheng1 di2gu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 jia1ru4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz mutters under his breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We've got a live one here, chief."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​低声​嘀咕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​头儿​，​突发​情况​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 di1sheng1 di2gu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，tu1fa1 qing2kuang4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz mutters under his breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, setting this thing free was a *great* idea."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​低声​嘀咕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​放​这​东西​自由​真是​个​*​好​*​主意​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 di1sheng1 di2gu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，fang4 zhe4 dong1xi1 zi4you2 zhen1shi5 ge4*hao3*zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz nods at you, then abruptly changes the subject.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Say, you wouldn't happen to need a nova-hot decker, would you? 'Cause I suddenly find myself unemployed."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​朝​你​点​了​点头​，​突然​换​了​话题​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​起来​，​你们​不会​正好​缺​一个​超棒​的​碟​客​吧​？​因为​我​突然​意识​到​，​我​现在​没​工作​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 chao2 ni3 dian3 le5 dian3tou2，tu1ran2 huan4 le5 hua4ti2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 qi3lai5，ni3men5 bu4hui4 zheng4hao3 que1 yi1ge5 chao1 bang4 de5 die2 ke4 ba1？yin1wei4 wo3 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4，wo3 xian4zai4 mei2 gong1zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz offers her an easy smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sure, I’ll stick around. \n"
"\n"
"I’ve learned something here. I think we all have."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​向​她​露出​一个​轻松​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​我会​留在​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​这里​学到​了​一些​东西​。​我​想​我们​都​是​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 xiang4 ta1 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 qing1song1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
