"​你​问​这个​做​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 shuo1hua4 de5 shi2hou5 kan4 xiang4 yuan3fang1，bi4kai1 le5 yu4 ni3 de5 shi4xian4 jie1chu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4……mei2shen2me5。wo3 ting3 hao3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wen4 zhe4ge5 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz stops short.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What's going on, chief?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​随即​停下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​了​，​头儿​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 sui2ji2 ting2xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 le5，tou2r5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz stops what he's doing and shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, we'll have an opening, sure. But to do what? I mean... with everything we just learned, what's our new plan?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​停下​手里​的​活计​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​是​有​突破口​没错​，​但​要​怎么​做​呢​？​我​是​说​……​根据​我们​刚刚​了解​到​的​一切​，​我们​要​制定​什么​新​计划​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 ting2xia4 shou3li3 de5 huo2ji4，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，shi4 you3 tu1po4kou3 mei2cuo4，dan4 yao4 zen3me5 zuo4 ni2？wo3 shi4 shuo1……gen1ju4 wo3men5 gang1gang5 liao3jie3 dao4 de5 yi1qie4，wo3men5 yao4 zhi4ding4 shen2me5 xin1 ji4hua4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz stubs out his cigarette at your approach.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). I was hoping I'd see you.\n"
"\n"
"Do you have another run lined up for us yet? I'm strapped for cash."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​看到​你​过来​，​掐灭​了​手里​的​烟头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​我​正​想着​要​找​你​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有没有​什么​差事​安排​给​我们​做​啊​？​我​最近​手头​有点​紧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 kan4dao4 ni3 guo4lai2，qia1 mie4 le5 shou3li3 de5 yan1tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。wo3 zheng1 xiang3 zhao2 yao4 zhao3 ni3 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3mei2you3 shen2me5 cha4shi4 an1pai2 gei3 wo3men5 zuo4 a1？wo3 zui4jin4 shou3tou2 you3dian3 jin3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz studies the woman for a minute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look at her eyes, $(l.name). I think this is Feuerschwinge. Vauclair must've trapped her astral form in that woman."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​端详​了​一会儿​那个​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​她​的​眼睛​，​$(l.name)​。​我​想​那​是​火翼​。​沃​克莱尔​肯定​是​把​她​的​灵体​困​在​了​那个​女人​体内​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 duan1xiang2 le5 yi1hui4r5 na4ge5 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang3 na4 shi4 Huo3yi4。Wo4ke4lai2er3 ken3ding4 shi4 ba3 ta1 de5 ling2ti3 kun4 zai4 le5 na4ge5 nu:3ren2 ti3nei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz surveys the rest of the group. Sees the determination in their faces. Finally, he sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...But if you're really doing this, you'll want the best decker you can find along for the ride. And I guess that nominates... me. \n"
"\n"
"Woo."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​扫视​着​其余​队员​，​从​他们​脸上​只​看到​了​坚定​的​神情​。​最后​，​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​但​如果​你们​真​要​这么​干​，​就​得​找个​顶尖​的​碟​客当​队友​。​我​想​这个​人选​……​就是​我​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哎呀​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 sao3shi4 zhao2 qi2yu2 dui4yuan2，cong2 ta1men5 lian3 shang4 zhi3 kan4dao4 le5 jian1ding4 de5 shen2qing2。zui4hou4，ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……dan4 ru2guo3 ni3men5 zhen1 yao4 zhe4me5 gan4，jiu4 de2 zhao3 ge4 ding3jian1 de5 die2 ke4 dang1 dui4you3。wo3 xiang3 zhe4ge5 ren2xuan3……jiu4shi4 wo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz takes a deep breath. Shifts his weight from one foot to another.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not exactly."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​深吸​一口气​，​把​重心​移​到​另一只​脚​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​并非如此​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，ba3 zhong4xin1 yi2 dao4 ling4 yi1 zhi3 jiao3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz taps the plastic of his datajack.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What I had to. Luster had declared war on me, so I retaliated. And I won.\n"
"\n"
"All without ever firing a shot."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​敲​了​敲​数据​插口​的​塑料​壳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​先下手为强​。​拉斯特​既然​要​跟​我​死战​，​我​就​率先​发起​反击​。​最后​我​赢​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​甚至​兵不血刃​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 qiao1 le5 qiao1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 de5 su4liao4 ke2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian1xia4shou3wei2qiang2。la1 si1 te4 ji4ran2 yao4 gen1 wo3 si3zhan4，wo3 jiu4 shuai4xian1 fa1qi3 fan3ji1。zui4hou4 wo3 ying2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shen4zhi4 bing1bu4xue4ren4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Later, chief."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​回见​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui2jian4，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz turns to you, and he cracks a wide grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That was a badass play, chief. Ten points for style, no question about it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​转向​你​，​露出​一个​大大的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这招​玩​得​太狠​了​，​头儿​。​我​必须​得​给​你​这​一手​打​满分​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，lu4chu1 yi1ge5 dai4 dai4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhao1 wan2 de2 tai4 hen3 le5，tou2r5。wo3 bi4xu1 de2 gei3 ni3 zhe4 yi1shou3 da3 man3fen1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz whispers into your ear again, more harshly this time.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What the hell is this? Why didn't you warn me about this before I came here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​再次​在​你​耳边​低语​，​这次​更加​严厉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​到底​是​怎么回事​？​我来​之前​你​为什么​不​提醒​我​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zai4ci4 zai4 ni3 er3 bian1 di1yu3，zhe4 ci4 geng4jia1 yan2li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dao4di3 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4？wo3 lai2 zhi1qian2 ni3 wei4shen2me5 bu4 ti2xing3 wo3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz whispers through your commlink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The plot thickens..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​从​你​的​通讯​链​悄悄​对​你​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​情况​愈发​复杂​了​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 cong2 ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 qiao1qiao1 dui4 ni3 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing2kuang4 yu4fa1 fu4za2 le5……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz whispers to you via your commlink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ask a silly question..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​从​你​的​通讯​链​悄悄​对​你​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​问个​蠢​问题​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 cong2 ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 qiao1qiao1 dui4 ni3 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 wen4 ge4 chun3 wen4ti2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz whispers under his breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fuck me. What have we *done?*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​喃喃自语​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​。​我们​做​了​*​什么​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 nan2nan2zi4yu3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3。wo3men5 zuo4 le5*shen2me5*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's eyes are locked on one of the splayed-open corpses. He swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Looks that way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​眼睛​死死​盯​着​其中​一具​张开​四肢​的​尸体​。​他​吞​了​口​唾沫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​看来​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 yan3jing5 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 qi2zhong1 yi1 ju4 zhang1kai1 si4zhi1 de5 shi1ti3。ta1 tun1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，kan4lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Chief. Did you just read that?\n"
"\n"
"I am going to drive the *hell* out of this thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​头儿​，​你​瞧见​那个​没有​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​把​这​玩意​开​到​*​天上​*​去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，ni3 qiao2jian4 na4ge5 mei2you3？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ba3 zhe4 wan2yi4 kai1 dao4*tian1shang4*qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whoa there! Hold up, chief! You want me to jack in to a terminal in THIS building? With THAT?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​喂​！​等​一下​，​头儿​！​你​要​我​在​这栋​建筑​里​接入​终端​？​把​自己​送到​那​东西​面前​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei2！deng3 yi1xia4，tou2r5！ni3 yao4 wo3 zai4 zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4 li3 jie1ru4 zhong1duan1？ba3 zi4ji3 song4 dao4 na4 dong1xi1 mian4qian2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's eyes widen when he sees the drone that you're carrying. He looks anxious.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, uh, hey, chief... how's it going?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​看到​你​携带​的​无人机​时​，​眼睛​睁​得​大大的​。​他​看起来​很​焦虑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​，​呃​，​你好​，​头儿​……​最近​如何​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 kan4dao4 ni3 xie2dai4 de5 wu2ren2ji1 shi2，yan3jing5 zheng1 de2 dai4 dai4 de5。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 jiao1lu:4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2，e4，ni3hao3，tou2r5……zui4jin4 ru2he2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's smile dies away. He turns his eyes down to the floor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can, uh... I can tell you what her note said, if you want.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He presses forward without waiting for a response.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It said, and I quote:"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​笑容​消失​了​。​他​低头​看​向​地板​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​的话​……​我​可以​告诉​你​上面​说​了​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​不​等​你​回答​便​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​上面​是​这么​说​的​：\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 xiao4rong2 xiao1shi1 le5。ta1 di1tou2 kan4 xiang4 di4ban3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 de5hua4……wo3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3 shang4mian4 shuo1 le5 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bu4 deng3 ni3 hui2da2 bian4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shang4mian4 shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5："

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's voice comes out in a low whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, fuck.\n"
"\n"
"Vauclair isn't being held prisoner at Harfeld..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​声音​低沉​地​响起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我操​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​沃​克莱尔​并​没有​被​关押​在​哈​菲尔德​庄园​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 di1chen2 de5 xiang3qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3cao4。\n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 bing4 mei2you3 bei4 guan1ya1 zai4 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's voice crackles in over your commlink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Uh, chief, there’s somebody in here with me… hey! Get away from that!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​声音​从​通讯​链里​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​，​头儿​，​我​这里​还有​别人​……​喂​！​别碰​那个​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 tong1xun4 lian4 li3 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4，tou2r5，wo3 zhe4li3 hai2you3 bie2ren5……wei2！bie4 peng4 na4ge5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's voice crackles in over your commlink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Uh, chief? There’s somebody in here with me… hey! Get away from that!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​声音​从​通讯​链里​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​，​头儿​？​我​这里​还有​别人​……​喂​！​别碰​那个​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 tong1xun4 lian4 li3 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4，tou2r5？wo3 zhe4li3 hai2you3 bie2ren5……wei2！bie4 peng4 na4ge5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Blitz's voice crackles in over your commlink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What the hell is this? Grinder didn't say anything about his accountant tagging along!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​的​声音​从​通讯​链里​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​什么​情况​？​“​绞肉机​”​可​没​说​过​他​的​会计​也​要​跟​过来​啊​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 tong1xun4 lian4 li3 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shen2me5 qing2kuang4？“jiao3rou4ji1” ke3 mei2 shuo1 guo4 ta1 de5 kuai4ji4 ye3 yao4 gen1 guo4lai2 a1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Bltiz steps up to a console built into the wall beside the elevator.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is it, chief. All the camera feeds are right here. Shall I?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​走向​电梯​旁​墙壁​内嵌​的​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就是​这个​，​头儿​。​所有​监控​画面​都​在​这里​。​我来​搞定​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zou3xiang4 dian4ti1 pang2 qiang2bi4 nei4 kan3 de5 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5，tou2r5。suo3you3 jian1kong4 hua4mian4 dou1 zai4 zhe4li3。wo3 lai2 gao3ding4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Both Kristian and Karin grow pensive, and ultimately share a secret smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, I suppose it always has been."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克里斯蒂安​和​卡琳​都​陷入​了​沉思​，​并​最终​对​你​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​我​想​一直​以来​都​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ke4li3si1di4an1 he4 ka3 lin2 dou1 xian4ru4 le5 chen2si1，bing4 zui4zhong1 dui4 ni3 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 xiang3 yi1zhi2 yi3lai2 dou1 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Brackhaus continues.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My employer also wishes to hear about the Lady Feuerschwinge. A fascinating creature - so unlike her brothers and sisters. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布拉克​豪斯​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​雇主​还​想​了解​火翼​女士​。​她​真是​一位​令人​着迷​的​生灵​，​和​她​的​兄弟姐妹​们​完全​不同​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 hai2 xiang3 liao3jie3 Huo3yi4 nu:3shi4。ta1 zhen1shi5 yi1 wei4 ling4ren2 zhao2mi2 de5 sheng1ling2，he4 ta1 de5 xiong1di4jie3mei4 men5 wan2quan2 bu4tong2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Brackhaus studies your face closely.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"How disappointing.\n"
"\n"
"We have been following your… work for some time now and were under the impression that you possessed a faint spark of perspicacity."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布拉克​豪斯​仔细​端详​着​你​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真让人​失望​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​关注​你​……​工作​已经​很​长时间​了​，​还​以为​你​会​有点​洞察力​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1 zi3xi4 duan1xiang2 zhao2 ni3 de5 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1 rang4 ren2 shi1wang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 guan1zhu4 ni3……gong1zuo4 yi3jing1 hen3 zhang3 shi2 jian1 le5，hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 hui4 you3dian3 dong4cha2li4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Brackhaus studies your face closely.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Indeed she was. \n"
"\n"
"Indeed. She. Was."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布拉克​豪斯​仔细​端详​着​你​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​的确​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​的​、​的​、​确​、​确​。\n"
