"{{GM}}​为​电波​骑士​拷贝​影像​记录​数据​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} wei2 dian4Bo1qi2shi4 kao3bei4 ying3xiang4 ji4lu4 shu4ju4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Copy the visual records for the Schockwellenreiter.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​为​电波​骑士​拷贝​影像​记录​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} wei2 dian4Bo1qi2shi4 kao3bei4 ying3xiang4 ji4lu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Danni looks up at you with a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There $(l.he) is. Our hero."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​丹妮​抬起头来​微笑​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.he)​来​了​。​我们​的​英雄​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dan1 ni1 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2 wei1xiao4 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.he) lai2 le5。wo3men5 de5 ying1xiong2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Danni raises a hand and cuts in.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Wait! Tossing the logs won't be enough.\n"
"\n"
"They may not know where the power spike came from, but they'll still have questions."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​丹妮​举起​一只​手​打断​了​对话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​下​！​删除​日志​还​不够​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​也许​不​清楚​电力​尖峰​是从​哪儿​来​的​，​但​他们​还是​会心​存​疑虑​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dan1 ni1 ju3qi3 yi1 zhi3 shou3 da3duan4 le5 dui4hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3 xia4！shan1chu2 ri4zhi4 hai2 bu4gou4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 ye3xu3 bu4 qing1chu5 dian4li4 jian1feng1 shi4 cong2 na3r5 lai2 de5，dan4 ta1men5 hai2shi5 hui4xin1 cun2 yi2lu:4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Danni wheels on you, her cheeks streaked with tears. She points a delicate finger at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There $(l.he) is!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​丹妮​猛地​转向​你​，​她​的​面颊​上​挂​着​道​道​泪痕​。​她​用​纤细​的​手指​指向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.he)​在​那儿​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dan1 ni1 meng3de5 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，ta1 de5 mian4jia2 shang4 gua4 zhao2 dao4 dao4 lei4hen2。ta1 yong4 xian1xi4 de5 shou3zhi3 zhi3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.he) zai4 na4r5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Danni's eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whoa. Hold up! If you do that, they'll trace it!\n"
"\n"
"Aztechnology will find the power tap, and they'll come down on us!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​丹妮​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​喂喂​，​等​下​！​如果​你​这么​做​的话​，​他们​肯定​会​溯源​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​到时候​阿兹特​科技​就​会​找到​这个​电力​接口​，​然后​来​找​我们​的​麻烦​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dan1 ni1 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei2 wei2，deng3 xia4！ru2guo3 ni3 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5hua4，ta1men5 ken3ding4 hui4 su4yuan2 de5！\n"
"\n"
"dao4shi2hou4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 jiu4 hui4 zhao3dao4 zhe4ge5 dian4li4 jie1kou3，ran2hou4 lai2 zhao3 wo3men5 de5 ma2fan5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Danni's eyes widen, and she hits the deck. The panic spills out of her in a scream.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*LOOK OUT!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​丹妮​瞪​大​双眼​，​立刻​卧倒在地​。​她​的​惊恐​倾泻​而出​，​化作​一声​尖叫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​当心​！​*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dan1 ni1 deng4 dai4 shuang1yan3，li4ke4 wo4 dao3 zai4 de5。ta1 de5 jing1kong3 qing1xie4 er2 chu1，hua4zuo4 yi1sheng1 jian1jiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*dang1xin1！*"

msgid "{{GM}}Decline for now.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​暂时​拒绝​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zan4shi2 ju4jue2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Delete the Bloodline project data.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​删除​“​血脉​”​项目​数据​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shan1chu2“xue4mai4” xiang4mu4 shu4ju4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Delete the data.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​删除​数据​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shan1chu2 shu4ju4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Delete the file.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​删除​文件​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shan1chu2 wen2jian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Delete the mysterious Aztechnology data.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​删除​神秘​的​阿兹特​科技​数据​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shan1chu2 shen2mi4 de5 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 shu4ju4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Deliver the AG Chemie Project Data, Drug Formula, and Visual "
"Records.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​交付​欧洲​化工​项目​数据​、​药物​配方​及​影像​记录​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jiao1fu4 ou1zhou1 hua4gong1 xiang4mu4 shu4ju4、yao4wu4 pei4fang1 ji2 ying3xiang4 ji4lu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Deliver the Aztechnology Project data.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​交付​阿兹特​科技​项目​数据​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jiao1fu4 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 xiang4mu4 shu4ju4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Deliver the Humanis Donor List.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​交付​人类​至上​主义者​捐赠​名单​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jiao1fu4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 juan1zeng4 ming2dan1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Deploy drones to general storage.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​部署​无人机​至​综合​仓库​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} bu4shu3 wu2ren2ji1 zhi4 zong1he2 cang1ku4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Deploy drones to the mixing lab.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​部署​无人机​至​混合​实验室​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} bu4shu3 wu2ren2ji1 zhi4 hun4he2 shi2yan4shi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Deploy drones to weapons storage.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​部署​无人机​至​武器​仓库​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} bu4shu3 wu2ren2ji1 zhi4 wu3qi4 cang1ku4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Deposit ¥5,000 from your wallet into the Alice Fund.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​从​你​的​余额​存入​¥​5​,​000​至​爱丽丝​酬金​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} cong2 ni3 de5 yu2e2 cun2ru4 ¥ 5,000 zhi4 ai4li4si1 chou2jin1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Despite all of this, there is still an aura of power surrounding the man. He raises his bottle, offering it to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name), welcome. I've got a bottle of schnaps that needs sharing, and we've got a fallen comrade to drink to."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​尽管如此​，​这个​男人​身上​仍​笼罩着​某种​能量​灵光​。​他​举起​酒瓶​递向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​你​，​$(l.name)​。​我​这​有​瓶​杜松子酒​要​分享​，​而且​我们​要敬​某位​牺牲​的​战友​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin3 guan3 ru2 ci3，zhe4ge5 nan2ren2 shen1shang5 reng2 long2 zhao4 zhao2 mou3zhong3 neng2liang4 ling2guang1。ta1 ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2 di4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 ni3，$(l.name)。wo3 zhe4 you3 ping2 du4song1zi3jiu3 yao4 fen1xiang3，er2qie3 wo3men5 yao4 jing4 mou3 wei4 xi1sheng1 de5 zhan4you3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Despite the woman's persistent dilerium, she seems to glean meaning from your tone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She died?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​尽管​女人​仍​有些​神志不清​，​但​她​似乎​也​听​出​了​这​话语​背后​的​潜台词​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​死​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin3guan3 nu:3ren2 reng2 you3xie1 shen2zhi4bu4qing1，dan4 ta1 si4hu1 ye3 ting1 chu1 le5 zhe4 hua4yu3 bei4hou4 de5 qian2tai2ci2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 si3 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Destroy the control console.{{/GM}} What Vauclair did to you is "
"horrible, but you’re too dangerous to let free. I’m sorry."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​破坏​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​沃​克莱尔​对​你​做​的​事情​很​可怕​，​但​你​太​危险​了​，​不能​把​你​放​出来​。​我​很​抱歉​。\n"
"{{GM}} po4huai4 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 dui4 ni3 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5 hen3 ke3pa4，dan4 ni3 tai4 wei1xian3 le5，bu4neng2 ba3 ni3 fang4 chu1lai2。wo3 hen3 bao4qian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Destroy the control console.{{/GM}} You’re gonna rot here forever for "
"your crimes. Goodbye, dragon."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​破坏​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​你​就​在​这里​忏悔​自己​的​罪行​到​死​吧​。​永别​了​，​巨龙​。\n"
"{{GM}} po4huai4 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} ni3 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3 chan4hui3 zi4ji3 de5 zui4xing2 dao4 si3 ba1。yong3bie2 le5，ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich breaks into a wide grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can't fault you there, chummer... I'd have to turn in my punk credentials if I did.\n"
"\n"
"Berlin *is* special. What we've got going here in the F-State... this is anarchy done *right.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这点​我​完全​赞同​……​否则​的话​，​我​的​朋克​身份​可​就​名不副实​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​柏林​*​确实​*​有​其​特别之处​。​我们​在​动荡​带​搞​的​这套​……​才​是​*​真正​的​*​无政府主义​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dian3 wo3 wan2quan2 zan4tong2……fou3ze2 de5hua4，wo3 de5 peng2ke4 shen1fen4 ke3 jiu4 ming2bu4fu4shi2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bo2lin2*que4shi2*you3 qi2 te4 bie4 zhi1 chu3。wo3men5 zai4 dong4dang4 dai4 gao3 de5 zhe4 tao4……cai2 shi4*zhen1zheng4 de5*wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich claps you on the shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're a good $(l.man), boss.\n"
"\n"
"On to other things... remember what I was tellin' you, back before we climbed into the van?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​拍拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​好人​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​还有​个事​……​还​记得​我们​上车​前​我​跟​你​说​的话​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 pai1 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 hao3ren2，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，hai2you3 ge4 shi4……hai2 ji4de5 wo3men5 shang4che1 qian2 wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 de5hua4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich closes his eyes. Shakes his head, steadfast.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There is more to this than a mercenary’s paycheck, my friend. There has to be.\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye, Paul. Gott sei mit Dir."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希闭​上​双眼​，​表情​坚毅​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​远远​不止​雇佣兵​那点​薪水​所​能​衡量​，​朋友​。​我​真心​如此​认为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​，​保罗​。​愿​上帝​与你同在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 bi4 shang4 shuang1yan3，biao3qing2 jian1yi4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yuan3yuan3 bu4zhi3 gu4yong1bing1 na4 dian3 xin1shui3 suo3 neng2 heng2liang2，peng2you5。wo3 zhen1xin1 ru2ci3 ren4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4，bao3luo2。yuan4 shang4di4 yu4 ni3 tong2 zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich coughs and chokes on the stench that's wafting out of the dumpster.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's pretty vile, boss."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​被​垃圾箱​散发​的​臭味​呛得​咳嗽​不止​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真够​恶心​的​，​老大​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 bei4 la1ji1xiang1 san4fa1 de5 chou4wei4 qiang1 de2 ke2sou5 bu4zhi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1 gou4 e3xin1 de5，lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich cracks his knuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Works for me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​叩响​指节​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​意见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 kou4 xiang3 zhi3jie2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich eyes the door, then turns to Monika.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That’s a big freaking vault, Liebchen. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​瞄​了​一眼​门​，​然后​转向​莫妮卡​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​数据库​也​太大​了​吧​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 miao2 le5 yi1yan3 men2，ran2hou4 zhuan3xiang4 Mo4ni1ka3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shu4ju4ku4 ye3 tai4 dai4 le5 ba1，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich eyes you appreciatively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ja, that’s right. There is more to this than a mercenary’s paycheck. There has to be.\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye, Paul. Gott sei mit Dir."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​赞许​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​没错​。​这​远远​不止​雇佣兵​那点​薪水​所​能​衡量​。​我​真心​如此​认为​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​，​保罗​。​愿​上帝​与你同在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 zan4xu3 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，mei2cuo4。zhe4 yuan3yuan3 bu4zhi3 gu4yong1bing1 na4 dian3 xin1shui3 suo3 neng2 heng2liang2。wo3 zhen1xin1 ru2ci3 ren4wei2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4，bao3luo2。yuan4 shang4di4 yu4 ni3 tong2 zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich flashes a grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Neither do we."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​也​不想​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ye3 bu4xiang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich glances over his shoulder. Locks eyes with you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for this, boss. My nephew is safe, and I owe you.\n"
"\n"
"One other thing - the Dragonslayer is happy, too. We just did a ballsy thing, protected my family, and gave a monster a bloody nose in the process."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​回头​，​与​你​四目​相对​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢​了​老大​，​我​侄子​平安无事​，​我​欠​你​个人​情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​，​屠龙​者​也​很​满意​。​咱们​刚干​了​票​狠活​，​既​保护​了​我​的​家人​，​又​顺带​让​那群​畜生​吃​了​苦头​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 hui2tou2，yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5 lao3da4，wo3 zhi2zi5 ping2an1wu2shi4，wo3 qian4 ni3 ge4ren2 qing2。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3，tu2 long2 zhe3 ye3 hen3 man3yi4。zan2men5 gang1 gan4 le5 piao4 hen3 huo2，ji4 bao3hu4 le5 wo3 de5 jia1ren2，you4 shun4dai4 rang4 na4 qun2 chu4sheng5 chi1 le5 ku3tou5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich greets you with his familiar wry smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). What's new?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希朝​你​露出​熟悉​的​古怪​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​有​什么​新鲜事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 shu2xi1 de5 gu3guai4 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。you3 shen2me5 xin1 xian1 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich lays a hand on Eiger's shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The evidence seemed pretty convincing to me, love.\n"
"\n"
"I'll even take it a step further... I think that secret facility that we stumbled into was her lair."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​把手​搭​在​艾格尔​的​肩膀​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​亲爱​的​，​依我看​，​这​证据​相当​有​说服力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​可以​进一步​推测​……​我们​之前​闯入​的​那处​秘密​设施​就是​她​的​巢穴​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ba3shou3 da1 zai4 Ai4ge2er3 de5 jian1bang3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qin1ai4 de5，yi1wo3kan4，zhe4 zheng4ju4 xiang1dang1 you3 shuo1fu2li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 ke3yi3 jin4yi1bu4 tui1ce4……wo3men5 zhi1qian2 chuang3ru4 de5 na4 chu3 mi4mi4 she4shi1 jiu4shi4 ta1 de5 chao2xue2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich lays a hand on the bare metal of Glory's shoulder. She flinches, but only barely.\n"
"\n"
"When he speaks, his voice is soft.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"There but for the grace of God,\" eh, love?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希将​一只​手​搭​在​格洛丽​肩膀​处​裸露​的​金属​部位​上​。​她​退缩​了​一下​，​不过​幅度​几乎​无法​察觉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​用​轻柔​的​声音​开口​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​多亏​老天​开恩​，​让​我​逃过一劫​”​，​是​吧​，​亲爱​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 jiang1 yi1 zhi3 shou3 da1 zai4 Ge2luo4li2 jian1bang3 chu3 luo3lu4 de5 jin1shu3 bu4wei4 shang4。ta1 tui4suo1 le5 yi1xia4，bu4guo4 fu2du4 ji1hu1 wu2fa3 cha2jue2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yong4 qing1rou2 de5 sheng1yin1 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“duo1kui1 lao3tian1 kai1en1，rang4 wo3 tao2guo4yi1jie2”，shi4 ba1，qin1ai4 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich leans forward to whisper into your ear. His ubiquitous smile has disappeared.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is a waste of time, boss. Let me fry these sons of bitches so that we can get back on task."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​身子​前倾​，​凑到​你​耳边​低语​。​他​一向​挂​在​脸上​的​笑容​已然​消失​无踪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​这是​浪费时间​。​让​我​把​这些​混蛋​做​掉​，​然后​继续​按计划​行事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 shen1zi5 qian2qing1，cou4 dao4 ni3 er3 bian1 di1yu3。ta1 yi1xiang4 gua4 zai4 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 yi3ran2 xiao1shi1 wu2zong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，zhe4 shi4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。rang4 wo3 ba3 zhe4xie1 hun2dan4 zuo4 diao4，ran2hou4 ji4xu4 an4 ji4 hua2 xing2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich leans in to whisper into your ear.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She's right, friend. Driving in Berlin is generally a bad idea."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​附身​向​你​耳边​低声​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​说得对​，​朋友​。​在​柏林​开车​不是​什么​好​主意​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 fu4shen1 xiang4 ni3 er3 bian1 di1sheng1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 de2 dui4，peng2you5。zai4 bo2lin2 kai1che1 bu4shi4 shen2me5 hao3 zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich lets out a sigh of relief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks, boss. You don't know how much this means to me.\n"
"\n"
"You won't regret it. Promise."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希松​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢​了​，​老大​。​你​不​知道​这事​对​我​有​多​重要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​肯定​不会​为此​后悔​的​，​我​保证​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 song1 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5，lao3da4。ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4 dui4 wo3 you3 duo1 zhong4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 wei4ci3 hou4hui3 de5，wo3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich locks eyes with his nephew. His voice is low and soft.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do what you have to do, Alex. It's your choice."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​凝视着​侄子​，​嗓音​低沉​而​温柔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​做​你​该​做​的​，​亚历克斯​，​这​是​你​的​选择​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 zhi2zi5，sang3yin1 di1chen2 er2 wen1rou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zuo4 ni3 gai1 zuo4 de5，ya4 li4 ke4 si1，zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich looks up at Maxim, then turns his attention to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... yeah, boss.\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. You're right. Let's go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希看​向​马克西姆​，​随后​把​目光​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​好​的​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​，​你​是​对​的​。​我们​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 kan4 xiang4 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3，sui2hou4 ba3 mu4guang1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……hao3 de5，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"shi4，ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。wo3men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey again, boss. You ready to talk about that Humanis gig?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​来​了​啊​，​老大​。​要​聊聊​那帮​人类​至上​主义者​的​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lai2 le5 a1，lao3da4。yao4 liao2 liao2 na4 bang1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've gotta get Alexander out of there, $(l.name). Before it’s too late.\n"
"\n"
"Those monsters are experts at warping young minds. It’s how their disgusting ideology propagates."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​我​必须​赶​在​一切​无可挽回​之前​把​亚历山大​救​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​怪物​最​擅长​的​就是​扭曲​年轻人​的​思想​，​他们​正是​通过​这种​方式​传播​自己​那​可憎​的​意识形态​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 bi4xu1 gan3 zai4 yi1qie4 wu2ke3wan3hui2 zhi1qian2 ba3 ya4li4shan1da4 jiu4 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 guai4wu5 zui4 shan4chang2 de5 jiu4shi4 niu3qu1 nian2qing1ren2 de5 si1xiang3，ta1men5 zheng4shi4 tong1guo4 zhe4zhong3 fang1shi4 chuan2bo1 zi4ji3 na4 ke3zeng1 de5 yi4shi2xing2tai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich manages a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What can I say? We’re German.\n"
"\n"
"We have a history of strong political views."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​挤出​一个​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​？​毕竟​我们​是​德国人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​历来​持有​鲜明​的​政治立场​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ji3chu1 yi1ge5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2？bi4jing4 wo3men5 shi4 de2guo2ren2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 li4lai2 chi2you3 xian1ming2 de5 zheng4zhi4li4chang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich mutters under his breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We've got a live one here, boss."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​低声​嘀咕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​突发​情况​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 di1sheng1 di2gu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，tu1fa1 qing2kuang4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich nods in agreement and crosses himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ja, he was. Good-bye, Paul. Gott sei mit Dir."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​赞同​地​点点头​，​在​自己​胸前​画​了​个​十字​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​的确如此​。​再见​，​保罗​。​愿​上帝​与你同在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 zan4tong2 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2，zai4 zi4ji3 xiong1qian2 hua4 le5 ge4 shi2zi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3。zai4jian4，bao3luo2。yuan4 shang4di4 yu4 ni3 tong2 zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Figured as much. Not from anything you or Monika said, I just had a suspicion."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​果然如此​。​虽然​你​俩​没​说​过​，​但​我​早就​有些​怀疑​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"guo3 ran2 ru2 ci3。sui1ran2 ni3 lia3 mei2 shuo1 guo4，dan4 wo3 zao3jiu4 you3xie1 huai2yi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks like it. I don’t think we’re gonna get much more outta her, though.  It sounds like she thinks she’s on some sort of eternal quest. Like some sort of guardian or something."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​是​这样​。​不过​我​认为​我们​从​她​那里​再也​得不到​更​多​信息​了​。​听​起来​她​认为​自己​正​处于​某种​永恒​的​使命​之中​。​就​像​某种​守护者​之类​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。bu4guo4 wo3 ren4wei2 wo3men5 cong2 ta1 na4li5 zai4ye3 de2bu4dao4 geng1 duo1 xin4xi1 le5。ting1 qi3lai5 ta1 ren4wei2 zi4ji3 zheng1 chu3yu2 mou3zhong3 yong3heng2 de5 shi3ming4 zhi1zhong1。jiu4 xiang4 mou3zhong3 shou3 hu4 zhe3 zhi1lei4 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're gonna have to fight our way out of here, Alex. And I don't want to fight you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​会​从​这里​杀出​一条​血路​。​亚历克斯​，​我​不想​和​你​动手​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 cong2 zhe4li3 sha1 chu1 yi1 tiao2 xue4lu4。ya4 li4 ke4 si1，wo3 bu4xiang3 he4 ni3 dong4shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich offers you a halfhearted smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've always wanted a castle."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希朝​你​露出​敷衍​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​想要​一座​城堡​来​着​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 fu1yan3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 xiang3yao4 yi1 zuo4 cheng2bao3 lai2 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich offers you a halfhearted smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Like ridin' a bike. You never forget."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希朝​你​露出​敷衍​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​骑​自行车​一样​。​这种​事​你​永远​不会​忘​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 fu1yan3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 ji4 zi4xing2che1 yi1yang4。zhe4zhong3 shi4 ni3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 wang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich offers you a toothy grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Unless the vase figured into your plans to complete the mission somehow? Did you have a vase-oriented strategy that I was unaware of?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希朝​你​龇牙​一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​除非​这​花瓶​是​你​计划​的​一部分​？​你​有​什么​我​没​料到​的​“​花瓶​妙计​“​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 chao2 ni3 zi1 ya2 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 zhe4 hua1ping2 shi4 ni3 ji4hua4 de5 yi1bu4fen5？ni3 you3 shen2me5 wo3 mei2 liao4dao4 de5“hua1ping2 miao4ji4“？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich opens his eyes and turns to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, I think that He'd like this plan just fine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​睁开眼睛​，​转头​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​，​我​觉得​祂​喜欢​这个​计划​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 zheng1 kai1 yan3 jing1，zhuan3tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3，wo3 jue2de5 ta1 xi3huan5 zhe4ge5 ji4hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich puts a hand on her shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's load the body into the van, Glory love. Herr Schmidt won't be happy, but the hell with 'im... he never said that the MKVI had to be returned alive."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​把手​搭​在​她​的​肩膀​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​亲爱​的​格洛丽​，​咱们​也​只能​把​这具​尸体​塞进​车里​了​。​施密特​先生​肯定​不会​对此​感到高兴​，​但是​管​他​呢​……​反正​他​也​没​说​要​把​MKVI​活着​带回去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ba3shou3 da1 zai4 ta1 de5 jian1bang3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qin1ai4 de5 Ge2luo4li2，zan2men5 ye3 zhi3neng2 ba3 zhe4 ju4 shi1ti3 se4 jin4 che1 li3 le5。shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，dan4shi4 guan3 ta1 ni2……fan3zheng4 ta1 ye3 mei2 shuo1 yao4 ba3 MKVI huo2zhe5 dai4 hui2 qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises a bottle at your approach.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey again, boss. You need somethin'?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希见​你​靠近​，​举起​酒瓶​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​又​过来​了​，​老大​。​有事吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 jian4 ni3 kao4jin4，ju3qi3 jiu3 ping2 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 you4 guo4lai2 le5，lao3da4。you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Something's different about you, love. You seem... I don't know, more *vibrant* than usual. Warmer.\n"
"\n"
"It's quite a change."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​亲爱​的​，​你​似乎​有些​不同​啊​……​怎么​说​呢​，​你​好像​变得​比​平时​更​*​有​活力​*​，​更​温暖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​变化​确实​很大​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qin1ai4 de5，ni3 si4hu1 you3xie1 bu4tong2 a1……zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，ni3 hao3xiang4 bian4de5 bi3 ping2shi2 geng1*you3 huo2li4*，geng1 wen1nuan3。\n"
"\n"
"bian4hua4 que4shi2 hen3 dai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, that's convenient."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​还​真​方便​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 zhen1 fang1bian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your call, boss. You know the timetable we're working on."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​决定​吧​，​老大​。​你​知道​我们​当下​的​任务​安排​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2ding4 ba1，lao3da4。ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 dang1xia4 de5 ren4wu5 an1pai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Went bad, huh? Like the run we just came back from went bad?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​搞砸​了​？​就​跟​我们​上次​差事​的​情况​那样​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gao3za2 le5？jiu4 gen1 wo3men5 shang4ci4 cha4shi4 de5 qing2kuang4 na4yang4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich raises the bottle in salute, then takes another swig of schnaps.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"The bastard deserved no less. If he was a member of your team, he should've come to you for help.\n"
"\n"
"Instead, he dug his own grave. Only proper that he lie in it. \n"
"\n"
"Pity about the family, but again, he should've been more careful."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希举​瓶​致意​，​随后​又​喝​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​杂种​罪有应得​。​如果​他​自认是​你​团队​的​一员​，​那​怎么​不来​找​你​帮忙​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这下​倒好​，​自掘坟墓​，​把​自个儿​埋​进去​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只是​可怜​他​的​家人​呐​，​不过​话​又​说​回来​了​，​还​不是​他​自己​不够​谨慎​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ju3 ping2 zhi4yi4，sui2hou4 you4 he4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 za2zhong3 zui4you3ying1de2。ru2guo3 ta1 zi4 ren4 shi4 ni3 tuan2dui4 de5 yi1yuan2，na4 zen3me5 bu4 lai2 zhao3 ni3 bang1mang2 ni2？\n"
"\n"
