"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​想​多​了解​莫妮卡​一些​，​可惜​现在​斯人​已逝​，​我​也​没法​当面​和​她​说​这些​话​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 xiang3 duo1 liao3jie3 Mo4ni1ka3 yi1xie1，ke3xi1 xian4zai4 si1 ren2 yi3 shi4，wo3 ye3 mei2fa3 dang1mian4 he4 ta1 shuo1 zhe4xie1 hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
