"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​一把​从​你​手中​夺​过​便条​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​知道​！​我​*​就​知道​*​亚历山大​不会​听​他们​的​鬼话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​读​了​一遍​纸条​，​嘴唇​随着​音节​翕动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​快点​，​老大​。​他​肯定​就​在​附近​，​还​来得及​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 yi1 ba3 cong2 ni3 shou3 zhong4 duo2 guo4 bian4tiao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4！wo3*jiu4 zhi1dao4*ya4li4shan1da4 bu4hui4 ting1 ta1men5 de5 gui3hua4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 dou4 le5 yi1bian4 zhi3tiao2，zui3chun2 sui2zhe5 yin1jie2 xi1dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kuai4dian3，lao3da4。ta1 ken3ding4 jiu4 zai4 fu4jin4，hai2 lai2de5ji2。"

