"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 kan4 zhao2 zi4ji3 cu1cao1 de5 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 si3 le5。wo3 de5 zhi2zi5。wo3 sha1 le5 zi4ji3 de5 xue4qin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Dietrich stares at the crumpled form of the woman in the glass cage.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Such a small, fragile thing.\n"
"\n"
