"​\n"
"​不过​我们​该​走​了​。​可​不能​让​其他人​干​等​着​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 ren3 zhu4 le5 zui3jiao3 de5 xiao4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ge4 hao3 fa3zi5，$(l.name)。wo3 ju3 shuang1 shou3 zan4 cheng2。\n"
