"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​随即​停下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​了​，​老大​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 sui2ji2 ting2xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 le5，lao3da4？"

