"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 duan1xiang2 le5 yi1hui4r5 na4ge5 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3……wo3 xiang3 na4 shi4 Huo3yi4。Wo4ke4lai2er3 ken3ding4 shi4 ba3 ta1 de5 ling2ti3 kun4 zai4 le5 na4ge5 nu:3ren2 ti3nei4。"

