"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 can4lan4。ci3ke4 de5 ta1 xian3de5 yi3wang3 ren4he2 shi2hou5 dou1 geng4jia1 cong2rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
