"xing2 la5，lao3da4。wo3 xian4zai4 you3 le5 ge4 ji4hua4，ye3 you3 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1。dang1ran2，qian2ti2 shi4 zan2men5 neng2 cong2 yan3xia4 de5 kun4jing4 zhong4 huo2 xia4lai5。"

