"​\n"
"​老大​，​我​有种​不好​的​感觉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 hei1an4 zhong4 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 you3zhong3 bu4hao3 de5 gan3jue2。"

