"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​的​声音​低沉​而​安静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​肯定​有​更好​的​办法​，​沃​克莱尔​。​*​肯定​*​有​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 sheng1yin1 di1chen2 er2 an1jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ken3ding4 you3 geng1 hao3 de5 ban4fa3，Wo4ke4lai2er3。*ken3ding4*you3 de5。"

