"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​痛苦​的​表情​扭曲​成​了​憎恨​的​面具​。​他​的​双手​开始​泛起​原始​能量​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​啊​。​我​同意​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 tong4ku3 de5 biao3qing2 niu3qu1 cheng2 le5 zeng1hen4 de5 mian4ju4。ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 kai1shi3 fan4qi3 yuan2shi3 neng2liang4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 a1。wo3 tong2yi4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Dig through the garbage.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​翻找​垃圾​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fan1 zhao3 la1ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Dig through the trash.{{/GM}}"
