"{{GM}}​杜尔瞥​了​眼​他​的​PDA​，​这是​一款​刻有​铂金​的​高端​机型​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​目前​而言​，​恐怕​我​必须​与​你​道别​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​。​我​回头​会​联系​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} du4 er3 pie1 le5 yan3 ta1 de5 PDA，zhe4 shi4 yi1 kuan3 ke4 you3 bo2jin1 de5 gao1duan1 ji1xing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……mu4qian2 er2yan2，kong3pa4 wo3 bi4xu1 yu4 ni3 dao4bie2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1。wo3 hui2tou2 hui4 lian2xi4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger begins her weapons check.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Improvise, adapt, overcome. Whatever's there, we’ll deal with it.\n"
"\n"
"First, we find our way into the basement..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​开始​检查​武器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随机应变​，​灵活​应对​，​克服困难​。​无论​遇到​什么​情况​，​我们​都​能​搞定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​首先​，​我们​找​条路​进入​地下室​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 kai1shi3 jian3cha2 wu3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2ji1ying4bian4，ling2huo2 ying4dui4，ke4 fu2 kun4 nan2。wu2lun4 yu4dao4 shen2me5 qing2kuang4，wo3men5 dou1 neng2 gao3ding4。\n"
"\n"
"shou3xian1，wo3men5 zhao3 tiao2 lu4 jin4ru4 di4xia4shi4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger brings herself to attention. Stares straight ahead.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Paul Amsel was an important member of this team, and he supported us well. He said what he was going to do, and he did it.\n"
"\n"
"That’s rare. That’s worthy of respect."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​挺直​身子​，​目光​直视​前方​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​保罗​·​阿姆​泽尔​曾​是​这个​团队​的​重要​成员​，​他​给予​了​我们​有力​支持​。​他​说到做到​，​言出必行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​在​如今​的​世道​实属​不易​。​仅凭​这​一点​，​他​便​值得尊重​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ting3zhi2 shen1zi5，mu4guang1 zhi2shi4 qian2fang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao3luo2 · E1mu3ze2er3 ceng2 shi4 zhe4ge5 tuan2dui4 de5 zhong4yao4 cheng2yuan2，ta1 ji3yu3 le5 wo3men5 you3li4 zhi1chi2。ta1 shuo1dao4zuo4dao4，yan2 chu1 bi4 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zai4 ru2jin1 de5 shi4dao4 shi2shu3 bu4yi4。jin3 ping2 zhe4 yi1dian3，ta1 bian4 zhi2 de2 zun1 chong2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger bristles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Even the best shooters have to reload sometime.\n"
"\n"
"Did you meet with Alice? Do you have our information?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​勃然大怒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​难道​最好​的​射手​就​不用​装弹​了​吗​？​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​和​爱丽丝​见面​了​吗​？​你​拿到​了​我们​需要​的​情报​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 bo2ran2da4nu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"nan2dao4 zui4hao3 de5 she4shou3 jiu4 bu4yong4 zhuang1dan4 le5 ma5？！\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 he4 ai4li4si1 jian4mian4 le5 ma5？ni3 na2dao4 le5 wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5 qing2bao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger bristles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Tell me you're not listening to it, $(l.name). This... *thing*... is APEX. That's the only thing it can be."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​怒不可遏​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​别​告诉​我​你​真的​要​听​它​的话​。​这个​……​*​东西​*​……​就是​APEX​。​这是​唯一​的​可能性​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 nu4bu4ke3e4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，bie4 gao4su4 wo3 ni3 zhen1de5 yao4 ting1 ta1 de5hua4。zhe4ge5……*dong1xi1*……jiu4shi4 APEX。zhe4 shi4 wei2yi1 de5 ke3neng2xing4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger cuts in. Her voice is soft.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Samuel Beckenbauer. He's a community organizer in the Kreuzbasar. He can get you the help that you need."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​插​了​句​话​，​语调​温和​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​找​塞缪尔​·​贝肯鲍尔​吧​。​他​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​负责​社区​组织​，​可以​联系​上能​帮到​你​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 cha1 le5 ju4 hua4，yu3diao4 wen1he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 zhao3 sai4miu4er3 · Bei4ken3bao4er3 ba1。ta1 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 fu4ze2 she4qu1 zu3zhi1，ke3yi3 lian2xi4 shang4 neng2 bang1 dao4 ni3 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger cuts in. Her voice trembles with barely suppressed rage.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Bullshit. This thing is lying to us, $(l.name). And it's wearing Monika's face to do it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​插话​道​。​她​的​声音​因​强忍​的​怒火​而​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​胡说八道​。​这​东西​在​骗​我们​，​$(l.name)​。​它​居然​敢​顶​着​莫妮卡​的​脸​做出​这种​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 cha1hua4 dao4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 yin1 qiang3ren3 de5 nu4huo3 er2 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hu2shuo1ba1dao4。zhe4 dong1xi1 zai4 pian4 wo3men5，$(l.name)。ta1 ju1ran2 gan3 ding3 zhao2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 lian3 zuo4chu1 zhe4zhong3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger cuts in. Her voice trembles with barely suppressed rage.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is all bullshit. This thing is *lying* to us, $(l.name). It's just telling you what you want to hear."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​插话​道​。​她​的​声音​因​强忍​的​怒火​而​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​简直​是​扯淡​。​$(l.name)​，​这​东西​在​*​欺骗​*​我们​。​它​只是​说​了​你​想​听​的话​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 cha1hua4 dao4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 yin1 qiang3ren3 de5 nu4huo3 er2 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jian3zhi2 shi4 che3dan4。$(l.name)，zhe4 dong1xi1 zai4*qi1pian4*wo3men5。ta1 zhi3shi4 shuo1 le5 ni3 xiang3 ting1 de5hua4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger cuts in.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's a bit of a leap."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​插话​进来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​有点​太​夸张​了​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 cha1hua4 jin4lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 you3dian3 tai4 kua1zhang1 le5 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger examines the remnants of the chip in your fingers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've heard of things like this before. Single-use sims, designed to self-destruct after they're slotted. Keeps the customers from reusing the same BTL over and over again.\n"
"\n"
"I'd say that you found our missing chip."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​审视​着​你​指间​的​芯片​残骸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​之前​听说​过​类似​的​东西​。​一次性​拟感​芯片​，​设计​成在​插入​后​自动​销毁​。​这样​可以​防止​客户​反复​使用​同​一块​BTL​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​你​找到​了​失踪​的​芯片​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 shen3shi4 zhao2 ni3 zhi3 jian1 de5 xin1pian4 can2hai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 ting1shuo1 guo4 lei4si4 de5 dong1xi1。yi1ci4xing4 ni3 gan3 xin1pian4，she4ji4 cheng2 zai4 cha1ru4 hou4 zi4dong4 xiao1hui3。zhe4yang4 ke3yi3 fang2zhi3 ke4hu4 fan3fu4 shi3yong4 tong2 yi1kuai4 BTL。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 shi1zong1 de5 xin1pian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger eyes him narrowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We have to kill him, Dietrich. It's the job."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​仔细​端详​着​他​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​必须​杀​了​他​，​迪​特里​希​。​这是​我们​的​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 zi3xi4 duan1xiang2 zhao2 ta1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 sha1 le5 ta1，Di2te4li3xi1。zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 de5 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger eyes one of the ruined corpses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, boss. Looks that way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​打量​着​其中​一具​残破​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​老大​。​看来​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 da3liang5 zhao2 qi2zhong1 yi1 ju4 can2po4 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，lao3da4。kan4lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger eyes one of the ruined corpses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Looks that way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​打量​着​其中​一具​残破​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​看来​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 da3liang5 zhao2 qi2zhong1 yi1 ju4 can2po4 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，kan4lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger eyes the smashed console.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's not the call that I would’ve made, but..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​盯​着​被​砸坏​的​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不是​我会​做​的​决定​，​但是​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ding1 zhao2 bei4 za2huai4 de5 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 hui4 zuo4 de5 jue2ding4，dan4shi4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger eyes you warily. Her expression is guarded.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). You need something?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​警惕​地​看着​你​，​神色​满是​戒备​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​你​有事吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 jing3ti4 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3，shen2se4 man3 shi4 jie4bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger gestures at your mission computer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Alice said that the kill switch is located in some old S-K facility. Assuming that the site was shut down sometime after the APEX project \"disappeared,\" it could have stood empty for years. Maybe decades."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔朝​你​的​任务​电脑​比划​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​爱丽丝​说​紧急​开关​位于​一处​老旧​的​赛德​-​克虏伯​设施​中​。​如果说​它​是​在​APEX​项目​“​消失​”​一段时间​之后​关闭​的​，​那么​它​可能​已经​空置​了​数年​，​乃至​数十年​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 chao2 ni3 de5 ren4wu5 dian4nao3 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ai4li4si1 shuo1 jin3ji2 kai1guan1 wei4yu2 yi1 chu3 lao3jiu4 de5 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 she4shi1 zhong4。ru2guo3shuo1 ta1 shi4 zai4 APEX xiang4mu4“xiao1shi1” yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 zhi1hou4 guan1bi4 de5，na4me5 ta1 ke3neng2 yi3jing1 kong1zhi4 le5 shu4nian2，nai3zhi4 shu3 shi2 nian2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger gives you a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar and gear up.\n"
"\n"
"We've got a castle to raid."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔朝​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​做好​准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​去​攻占​一座​城堡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 chao2 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 qu4 gong1zhan4 yi1 zuo4 cheng2bao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger gives you a small nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's big of you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔向​你​微微​点头​示意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还​挺​大方​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 xiang4 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2 shi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2 ting3 da4fang1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger glances at you and cocks her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks like the team’s good to go. What’s our next move?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​歪头​瞥​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​队伍​准备就绪​了​。​接下来​我们​该​怎么​做​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 wai1 tou2 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 dui4wu3 zhun3 bei4 jiu4 xu4 le5。jie1xia4lai2 wo3men5 gai1 zen3me5 zuo4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger glances at you. Her voice is calm, but you can see the unease on her face.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"I forgot to mention, fearless leader... your dog’s acting funny."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔瞥​了​你​一眼​。​她​的​声音​很​平静​，​但​你​能​看出​她​脸上​带​着​不安​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无畏​领袖​，​我​忘​提​这事​了​……​你​的​狗​有些​不对劲​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 ping2jing4，dan4 ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 bu4an1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4，wo3 wang4 ti2 zhe4 shi4 le5……ni3 de5 gou3 you3xie1 bu4dui4jin4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger glances down at him. Shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, shut up, Yuli."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​低头​看​了​他​一眼​，​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可​闭嘴​吧​，​尤里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 di1tou2 kan4 le5 ta1 yi1yan3，yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3 bi4zui3 ba1，You2li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger glances up from her PDA at the sound of your approach.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). This... this isn't the best of times.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her body language is self-assured, but you can hear the anxiety in her voice. Something has her worried, and in a big way.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​听见​你​走近​的​脚步声​，​从​PDA​前​抬起​头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​现在​……​现在​可不是​好​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​肢体​语言​显得​自信​从容​，​但​你​听得出​她​声音​里​的​焦虑​。​有件事​让​她​忧心忡忡​，​而且​事态​相当严重​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ting1jian4 ni3 zou3jin4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1，cong2 PDA qian2 tai2qi3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。xian4zai4……xian4zai4 ke3bu5shi4 hao3 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 xian3de5 zi4xin4 cong2rong2，dan4 ni3 ting1 de2 chu1 ta1 sheng1yin1 li3 de5 jiao1lu:4。you3 jian4 shi4 rang4 ta1 you1xin1chong1chong1，er2qie3 shi4tai4 xiang1 dang1 yan2 chong2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger glances up from your manic captive and looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Find what you were looking for?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​眼神​从​狂躁​的​俘虏​身上​抬起​，​与​你​四目​相对​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​找到​你​要​找​的​东西​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 yan3shen2 cong2 kuang2zao4 de5 fu2lu3 shen1shang5 tai2qi3，yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhao3dao4 ni3 yao4 zhao3 de5 dong1xi1 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger glares at you, and you can taste the bile in her stare. She clearly still blames you for Monika's death.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Something I can do for you, fearless leader?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​怒视​着​你​，​眼神​中带​着​毫不掩饰​的​怨恨​。​她​显然​仍​在​怪罪​你​害死​了​莫妮卡​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有事吗​，​无畏​领袖​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3，yan3shen2 zhong4 dai4 zhao2 hao2 bu4 yan3 shi4 de5 yuan4hen4。ta1 xian3ran2 reng2 zai4 guai4zui4 ni3 hai4si3 le5 Mo4ni1ka3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3 shi4 ma5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger glares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What the hell do you want?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​恶狠狠​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​干嘛​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 e4hen3hen3 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 gan4ma2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger ignores him. Her gaze remains fixed on the book.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It might be nothing. Or it could mean that he's back in bed with the Lobatchevski Syndicate."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​没有​搭理​他​。​她​的​目光​仍​牢牢​锁定​在​纸页​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​可能​不​代表​什么​。​也​可能​意味着​他​又​和​洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​勾结​在​一起​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 mei2you3 da1li5 ta1。ta1 de5 mu4guang1 reng2 lao2lao2 suo3ding4 zai4 zhi3 xie2 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ke3neng2 bu4 dai4biao3 shen2me5。ye3 ke3neng2 yi4wei4zhe5 ta1 you4 he4 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2 gou1jie2 zai4 yi1qi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger ignores him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Wait a second. We don't know for certain..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​没​搭理​他​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​先​别急​。​我们​还​不​确定​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 mei2 da1li5 ta1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian1 bie4 ji2。wo3men5 hai2 bu4 que4ding4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger inclines her head in your direction.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) doesn't talk much. But $(l.he)'s a great listener.\n"
"\n"
"Of course, if you don't tell $(l.him) what $(l.he) wants to hear, $(l.he) might lose $(l.his) patience. And then... well, then things are gonna get loud."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔朝​你​的​方向​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$+(l.he)​不怎么​爱​说话​，​但​$(l.he)​很​擅长​倾听​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​如果​你​不​把​$(l.he)​想​听​的​告诉​$(l.he)​的话​，​$(l.he)​可能​就要​失去​耐心​了​。​到​那​时候​……​你​可​就​有罪​受​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 chao2 ni3 de5 fang1xiang4 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) bu4zen3me5 ai4 shuo1hua4，dan4 $(l.he) hen3 shan4chang2 qing1ting1。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 ba3 $(l.he) xiang3 ting1 de5 gao4su4 $(l.he) de5hua4，$(l.he) ke3neng2 jiu4yao4 shi1qu4 nai4xin1 le5。dao4 na4 shi2hou5……ni3 ke3 jiu4 you3zui4 shou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger indicates a console built into the wall beside the elevator.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This looks like the elevator console. The camera feeds should have been routed here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​指向​电梯​旁​墙壁​内嵌​的​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​看起来​是​电梯​的​控制台​，​监控​画面​应该​都​传到​这里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 zhi3xiang4 dian4ti1 pang2 qiang2bi4 nei4 kan3 de5 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 kan4qi3lai5 shi4 dian4ti1 de5 kong4zhi4tai2，jian1kong4 hua4mian4 ying1gai1 dou1 chuan2 dao4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger interposes herself between you and the doorway.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hang on a second, $(l.name). We're just... leaving? We're not going to kill Feuerschwinge, or set her free, or anything?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔拦​在​你​和​门口​之间​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​一下​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​就​这么​……​走​了​？​我们​不杀​火翼​，​也​不放​了​她​，​什么​都​不​做​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 lan2 zai4 ni3 he4 men2kou3 zhi1jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，$(l.name)。wo3men5 jiu4 zhe4me5……zou3 le5？wo3men5 bu4 sha1 Huo3yi4，ye3 bu4 fang4 le5 ta1，shen2me5 dou1 bu4 zuo4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger kneels beside the corpse, bending to peer at his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Matches the description Altuğ gave us. It's Green Winters.\n"
"\n"
"I don't see any signs of a struggle. If somebody did this to him while he was jacked in, they were quiet about it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔半​跪​在​尸体​旁​，​弯​下腰​，​仔细​打量​着​他​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​奥图​伊​描述​的​一样​。​这​就是​格林​·​温特斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​看到​有​挣扎​的​痕迹​。​如果​是​什么​人​趁着​他​接入​时下​了​手​，​这​手法​肯定​相当​专业​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ban4 gui4 zai4 shi1ti3 pang2，wan1 xia4yao1，zi3xi4 da3liang5 zhao2 ta1 de5 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 miao2shu4 de5 yi1yang4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 kan4dao4 you3 zheng1zha2 de5 hen2ji4。ru2guo3 shi4 shen2me5 ren2 chen4 zhao2 ta1 jie1ru4 shi2xia4 le5 shou3，zhe4 shou3fa3 ken3ding4 xiang1dang1 zhuan1ye4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger kneels beside the corpse, bending to peer at his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Matches the description Altuğ gave us. It's Green Winters.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She straightens, glancing back over at the body before returning her attention to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This what happened to Monika?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔半​跪​在​尸体​旁​，​弯​下腰​，​仔细​打量​着​他​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​奥图​伊​描述​的​一样​。​这​就是​格林​·​温特斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​站​起身​，​又​看​了​一眼​尸体​，​然后​重新​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​当时​就是​这样​出事​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ban4 gui4 zai4 shi1ti3 pang2，wan1 xia4yao1，zi3xi4 da3liang5 zhao2 ta1 de5 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 miao2shu4 de5 yi1yang4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhan4 qi3shen1，you4 kan4 le5 yi1yan3 shi1ti3，ran2hou4 chong2xin1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 dang1shi2 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4 chu1shi4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger kneels beside the corpse, bending to peer at his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Matches the description that Altuğ gave us. It's Green Winters.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She straightens, glancing back over at the body before returning her attention to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This what happened to Monika?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔半​跪​在​尸体​旁​，​弯​下腰​，​仔细​打量​着​他​的​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​和​奥图​伊​描述​的​一样​。​这​就是​格林​·​温特斯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​站​起身​，​又​看​了​一眼​尸体​，​然后​重新​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​当时​就是​这样​出事​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ban4 gui4 zai4 shi1ti3 pang2，wan1 xia4yao1，zi3xi4 da3liang5 zhao2 ta1 de5 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 ao4 tu2 yi1 miao2shu4 de5 yi1yang4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhan4 qi3shen1，you4 kan4 le5 yi1yan3 shi1ti3，ran2hou4 chong2xin1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 dang1shi2 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4 chu1shi4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger leafs through the journal, quickly flipping the soykaf-stained pages.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Norwegian, maybe... I'm thinking that this is written in Bokmål.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can't read it, but it looks like a shipping manifest."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔扫​了​一下​日志​，​迅速​翻动​着​被​豆​咖​沾染​的​纸页​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​是​挪威语​……​我​猜​这​是​用​书面​挪威语​写​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看不懂​，​但​这​似乎​是​一份​货运单​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 sao3 le5 yi1xia4 ri4zhi4，xun4su4 fan1dong4 zhao2 bei4 dou4 ka1 zhan1ran3 de5 zhi3 xie2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 shi4 nuo2 wei1 yu3……wo3 cai1 zhe4 shi4 yong4 shu1mian4 nuo2 wei1 yu3 xie3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4bu5dong3，dan4 zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 yi1 fen4 huo4 yun4 dan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger leans in to inspect her work.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks like a pretty solid connection. Nothing's jumping out at me as being obviously wrong.\n"
"\n"
"I'd say that you're probably good to go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​倾身​过去​检视​她​的​成果​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​焊接​部分​看起来​相当​牢固​。​我​没​看出​有​哪里​不对劲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看​这样​应该​就​可以​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 qing1 shen1 guo4qu4 jian3shi4 ta1 de5 cheng2guo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"han4jie1 bu4fen5 kan4qi3lai5 xiang1dang1 lao2gu4。wo3 mei2 kan4chu1 you3 na3li3 bu4dui4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4 zhe4yang4 ying1gai1 jiu4 ke3yi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger leans in to look the Engineer in the eye. She grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Goodbye, Yuli."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​凑​上​前去​，​盯​着​工程师​的​眼睛​。​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​，​尤里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 cou4 shang4 qian2 qu4，ding1 zhao2 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 yan3jing5。ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4，You2li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger looks around. Realizes that she forgot Blitz.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"What about you, Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​环顾四周​，​意识​到​她​忘记​了​布里​茨​还​在​旁边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​呢​，​布里​茨​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 huan2gu4si4zhou1，yi4shi2 dao4 ta1 wang4ji4 le5 Bu4li3ci2 hai2 zai4 pang2bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ni2，Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger looks back over to you and raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I could use a new rifle. What do you think, fearless leader?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​回头​看向​你​，​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​正好​需要​一把​新​步枪​。​你​说​呢​，​无畏​领袖​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 hui2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng4hao3 xu1yao4 yi1 ba3 xin1 bu4qiang1。ni3 shuo1 ni2，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger looks tense, but she's keeping it together. For now.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Find anything, fearless leader?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​看起来​很​紧张​，​但​她​暂时​还​在​努力​保持​镇定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​发现​吗​，​无畏​领袖​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 jin3zhang1，dan4 ta1 zan4shi2 hai2 zai4 nu3li4 bao3chi2 zhen4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 fa1xian4 ma5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger looks you in the eye. Desperation hangs over her like a wet blanket.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Was there anything else out there, $(l.name)? Any other clues at all?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​与​你​四目​相对​。​她​身上​散发出​一股​绝望​的​气息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​什么​别的​发现​吗​，​$(l.name)​？​什么​线索​都行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。ta1 shen1shang5 san3 fa1 chu1 yi1 gu3 jue2wang4 de5 qi4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 fa1xian4 ma5，$(l.name)？shen2me5 xian4suo3 dou1 xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger mutters under her breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, this is interesting."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​低声​嘀咕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​这​很​有趣​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 di1sheng1 di2gu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，zhe4 hen3 you3qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've heard that Doom was deployed in a couple of border skirmishes back in '41. After seeing what it did to people up-close, the UCAS passed a unilateral ban on the stuff.\n"
"\n"
"If that doesn't tell you how bad it is, nothing will."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​神色​凝重​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​听说​早​在​2041​年​，​“​末日​”​就​曾​在​几次​边境​冲突​中​被​投入使用​。​近距离​见识​过​它​对​人​的​影响​后​，​加​美​合众国​单方面​通过​了​这​玩意儿​的​禁令​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​这​还​不能​说明​它​的​可怕​程度​，​那​我​真​想不到​别的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 shen2se4 ning2zhong4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 zao3 zai4 2041 nian2，“mo4ri4” jiu4 ceng2 zai4 ji3ci4 bian1jing4 chong1tu1 zhong4 bei4 tou2 ru4 shi3 yong4。jin4ju4li2 jian4shi5 guo4 ta1 dui4 ren2 de5 ying3xiang3 hou4，jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2 dan1fang1mian4 tong1guo4 le5 zhe4 wan2yi4r5 de5 jin4ling4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhe4 hai2 bu4neng2 shuo1ming2 ta1 de5 ke3pa4 cheng2du4，na4 wo3 zhen1 xiang3bu5dao4 bie2de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good. If you need me, I'll be getting prepped for the next run."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​。​我​先​去​为​下趟​差事​做​准备​，​有​需要​随时​来​找​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。wo3 xian1 qu4 wei2 xia4 tang1 cha4shi4 zuo4 zhun3bei4，you3 xu1yao4 sui2shi2 lai2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sounds that way. Thanks, Bannik. We'll let you know how things work out."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​问题​。​谢​了​，​班尼克​。​事成之后​我们​会​告诉​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。xie4 le5，ban1 ni2 ke4。shi4 cheng2 zhi1 hou4 wo3men5 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger offers you a shallow nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔朝​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 chao2 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger pauses a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Either way, the AI was right about one thing. We need to press our advantage while we can.\n"
"\n"
"We need to hit the Harfeld Manor *tonight.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​停顿​片刻​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​那​AI​有​一点​说​得​没错​。​我们​必须​趁现在​有​优势​时​采取行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​在​*​今晚​*​袭击​哈​菲尔德​庄园​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，na4 AI you3 yi1dian3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。wo3men5 bi4xu1 chen4 xian4 zai4 you3 you1shi4 shi2 cai3qu3xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 zai4*jin1wan3*xi2ji1 Ha1fei1er3de2zhuang1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger pauses for a moment, then looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A word of advice to you, $(l.name). If anyone ever puts you in the position that he put me in - if he demeans you in front of your unit, *whatever* his intent - the appropriate response is to put that person down. \n"
"\n"
"Hard."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​停顿​片刻​，​然后​直视​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给你个​建议​，​$(l.name)​。​如果​有人​将​你​置于​我刚​说​的​情境​之下​—​—​无论​对方​怀着​*​何等​*​企图​要​在​你​的​团队​面前​贬低​你​—​—​最好​的​回应​就是​直接​动手​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​朝死里​打​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，ran2hou4 zhi2shi4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3 ni3 ge4 jian4yi4，$(l.name)。ru2guo3 you3ren2 jiang1 ni3 zhi4yu2 wo3 gang1 shuo1 de5 qing2jing4 zhi1xia4——wu2lun4 dui4fang1 huai2 zhao2*he2deng3*qi3tu2 yao4 zai4 ni3 de5 tuan2dui4 mian4qian2 bian3di1 ni3——zui4hao3 de5 hui2ying4 jiu4shi4 zhi2jie1 dong4shou3。\n"
"\n"
"chao2 si3 li3 da3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger pushes ahead, heedless of the interruption. Her voice remains measured, but there's fire in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"How many seconds passed between Monika's first convulsion and her plug getting pulled? Four? Five?\n"
"\n"
"Do you know how much damage biofeedback can do to a decker's brain in five seconds?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔向​你​逼近​，​毫不​理睬​试图​打断​她​的​阿姆​泽尔​。​她​的​声音​依然​平静​，​眼底​却​燃烧​着​怒火​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​莫妮卡​抽搐​第一​下​，​到​她​的​插头​被​拔下来​，​一共​过​了​几秒​？​四秒​？​五秒​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​五​秒钟​的​生物反馈​能​给​碟​客​的​大脑​造成​多少​损伤​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 xiang4 ni3 bi1jin4，hao2bu4 li3cai3 shi4tu2 da3duan4 ta1 de5 E1mu3ze2er3。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 yi1ran2 ping2jing4，yan3di3 que4 ran2shao1 zhao2 nu4huo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cong2 Mo4ni1ka3 chou1chu4 di4yi1 xia4，dao4 ta1 de5 cha1tou2 bei4 ba2 xia4 lai2，yi1gong4 guo4 le5 ji1 miao3？si4 miao3？wu3 miao3？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 wu3 miao3zhong1 de5 sheng1 wu4 fan3 kui4 neng2 gei3 die2 ke4 de5 da4nao3 zao4cheng2 duo1shao3 sun3shang1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger raises a hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Word of caution, $(l.name). Our objective may be simple, but taking the same approach that we took last time would be a mistake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​举起​一只​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​用词​要​严谨​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​的​目标​也许​很​简单​，​但​如果​采取​和​上次​一样​的​方式​，​毫无疑问​会​是​个​错误​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ju3qi3 yi1 zhi3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yong4ci2 yao4 yan2jin3，$(l.name)。wo3men5 de5 mu4biao1 ye3xu3 hen3 jian3dan1，dan4 ru2guo3 cai3qu3 he4 shang4ci4 yi1yang4 de5 fang1shi4，hao2wu2yi2wen4 hui4 shi4 ge4 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nope. But considering the circumstances, I’m good with it.\n"
"\n"
"...You *can* control him, right, $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​知道​。​但​考虑​到​目前​的​情况​，​我​对此​没​啥​意见​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​你​*​能​*​控制​住​他​吧​，​$(l.name)​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4。dan4 kao3lu:4 dao4 mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4，wo3 dui4 ci3 mei2 sha2 yi4jian4。\n"
"\n"
"……ni3*neng2*kong4zhi4 zhu4 ta1 ba1，$(l.name)？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See? He's talking already."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看吧​？​他​已经​能​开口​说话​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4 ba1？ta1 yi3jing1 neng2 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Smack him for me, will you? I'm busy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​能​帮​我​给​他​一拳​吗​？​我​忙​着​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"neng2 bang1 wo3 gei3 ta1 yi1 quan2 ma5？wo3 mang2 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, that's convenient."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​还​真​方便​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 zhen1 fang1bian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your call, fearless leader. You know the timetable we're working on."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​决定​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​你​知道​我们​当下​的​任务​安排​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2ding4 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 dang1xia4 de5 ren4wu5 an1pai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger recoils in surprise, then breaks into a feral grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're threatening me? Seriously?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her hands bunch into fists.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take a swing, please. I'd *love* an excuse to cave your face in."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​惊愕​地​退后​一步​，​随即​露出​野兽​般的​狞笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​威胁​我​？​认真​的​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​双手​攥​成​拳头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​就​动手​啊​。​我​很​*​乐意​*​借​这个​由头​把​你​的​脸​打个​稀烂​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 jing1e4 de5 tui4hou4 yi1 bu4，sui2ji2 lu4chu1 ye3shou4 ban1 de5 ning2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 wei1xie2 wo3？ren4zhen1 de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shuang1shou3 zuan4 cheng2 quan2tou5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 jiu4 dong4shou3 a1。wo3 hen3*le4yi4*jie4 zhe4ge5 you2tou5 ba3 ni3 de5 lian3 da3 ge4 xi1lan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger regards you with a critical eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You might actually mean that. But then, you may just be trying to get on my good side."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔用​审视​的​眼神​打量​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​或许​你​真是​这么​想​的​。​不过​，​你​也​可能​只是​在​尝试​讨好​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yong4 shen3shi4 de5 yan3shen2 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 ni3 zhen1shi5 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。bu4guo4，ni3 ye3 ke3neng2 zhi3shi4 zai4 chang2shi4 tao3hao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger rises from her corpse-strewn perch at your approach. From the look on her face, it's obvious that she's already sized up the situation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I knew this was going to happen. I fucking knew it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你们​跑​向​艾格尔​。​她​从​制高点​站​起身​，​脚下​是​堆积成山​的​尸体​。​从​她​的​表情​来看​，​她​显然​已经​明白​发生​了​什么​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​知道​要​出事​。​我​他​妈​就​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3men5 pao2 xiang4 Ai4ge2er3。ta1 cong2 zhi4gao1dian3 zhan4 qi3shen1，jiao3xia4 shi4 dui1 ji1 cheng2 shan1 de5 shi1ti3。cong2 ta1 de5 biao3qing2 lai2 kan4，ta1 xian3ran2 yi3jing1 ming2bai5 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 yao4 chu1shi4。wo3 ta1 ma1 jiu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger scowls at the floor. Nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"True. You're right... again."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​看着​地板​，​眉头​紧蹙​，​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​。​这次​……​你​又​说​对​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 kan4 zhao2 di4ban3，mei2tou2 jin3 cu4，wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。zhe4 ci4……ni3 you4 shuo1 dui4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger scowls at the floor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks. Can’t do it. \n"
"\n"
"But thanks."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​看着​地板​，​眉头​紧蹙​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢​了​。​这​我​做​不到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​还是​谢​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 kan4 zhao2 di4ban3，mei2tou2 jin3 cu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5。zhe4 wo3 zuo4 bu4dao4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hai2shi5 xie4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shakes her head incredulously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What are you telling us, APEX? That you feel remorse over Monika's death? That you're *sorry* for what you did to her?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​难以置信​地摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​表达​什么​意思​，​APEX​？​你​对​莫妮卡​的​死​感到​懊悔​？​你​为​自己​对​她​做​的​事​感到​*​抱歉​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 nan2yi3zhi4xin4 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 biao3da2 shen2me5 yi4si5，APEX？ni3 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 gan3dao4 ao4hui3？ni3 wei2 zi4ji3 dui4 ta1 zuo4 de5 shi4 gan3dao4*bao4qian4*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know. I've seen them use cortex bombs and exotic poisons, but never a device like that. Doesn't mean that it *isn't* them, though.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, $(l.name). Let's get the hell out of here. We need to tell people about this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​我见​过​他们​使用​皮下​炸弹​和​进口​毒药​，​但​从未见过​那种​装置​。​不过​这​并​不​意味着​就​*​不是​*​他们​干​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​离开​这里​。​得​把​这件​事​告诉​大伙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。wo3 jian4 guo4 ta1men5 shi3yong4 pi2xia4 zha4dan4 he4 jin4kou3 du2yao4，dan4 cong2 wei4 jian4 guo4 na4zhong3 zhuang1zhi4。bu4guo4 zhe4 bing4 bu4 yi4wei4zhe5 jiu4*bu4shi4*ta1men5 gan4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3。de2 ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 gao4su4 da4huo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's just get out of here. Pack up your toy, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I hope it was worth our reputation."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​还是​赶紧​离开​这里​吧​。​把​你​的​玩具​装​好​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​希望​它​值得​我们​如此​牺牲​自己​的​声誉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 hai2shi5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3 ba1。ba3 ni3 de5 wan2ju4 zhuang1 hao3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 ta1 zhi2de5 wo3men5 ru2ci3 xi1sheng1 zi4ji3 de5 sheng1yu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. It'll be even worse this time. \n"
"\n"
"The first time we went in, we had the element of surprise on our side. But now, they'll be expecting us. They're hunting us, remember?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​这次​只会​更糟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​第一次​进去​，​还​能​打​他们​一个​措手不及​，​而​现在​他们​肯定​做足​了​准备​。​别忘了​，​他们​还​在​追杀​我们​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，zhe4 ci4 zhi3 hui4 geng1 zao1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 di4yi1ci4 jin4qu4，hai2 neng2 da3 ta1men5 yi1ge5 cuo4shou3bu4ji2，er2 xian4zai4 ta1men5 ken3ding4 zuo4 ju4 le5 zhun3bei4。bie4 wang4 le5，ta1men5 hai2 zai4 zhui1sha1 wo3men5 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pack up your toy, $(l.name). I hope it was worth our reputation."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​把​你​的​玩具​装​好​，​$(l.name)​。​希望​它​值得​我们​如此​牺牲​自己​的​声誉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ba3 ni3 de5 wan2ju4 zhuang1 hao3，$(l.name)。xi1wang4 ta1 zhi2de5 wo3men5 ru2ci3 xi1sheng1 zi4ji3 de5 sheng1yu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shoots a backward glance at the wretched woman, still silently raging in her glass prison.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Forever may not be long enough."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​回头​瞥​了​一眼​那个​仍​在​玻璃​牢笼​中​默默​哀号​的​可怜​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​多久​都​不够​她​赎罪​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 hui2tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4ge5 reng2 zai4 bo1li5 lao2long2 zhong4 mo4mo4 ai1hao2 de5 ke3lian2 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 duo1jiu3 dou1 bu4gou4 ta1 shu2zui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shoulder-checks the door. Nothing. Tries to force the hydraulics - nothing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's secure, all right. We're going to have to find an alternate entry point."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔用​肩膀​撞门​。​没用​。​试图​强行​打开​液压​装置​—​—​没用​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​门​的确​锁得​很​牢​。​我们​得​找​别的​入口​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yong4 jian1bang3 zhuang4 men2。mei2yong4。shi4tu2 qiang2xing2 da3kai1 ye4ya1 zhuang1zhi4——mei2yong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"men2 di2que4 suo3 de2 hen3 lao2。wo3men5 de2 zhao3 bie2de5 ru4kou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, you know what they say. \"Any weapon at your disposal.\"\n"
"\n"
"Did you meet up with Alice? Do you have the information?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​俗话说得好​，​“​有​啥​用​啥​”​，​是​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​和​爱丽丝​见面​了​吗​？​你​拿到​了​我们​需要​的​情报​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"su2 hua4 shuo1 de2 hao3，“you3 sha2 yong4 sha2”，shi4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 he4 ai4li4si1 jian4mian4 le5 ma5？ni3 na2dao4 le5 wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5 qing2bao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well... I guess we might as well load the body into the van.\n"
"\n"
"Herr Schmidt won't be happy, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​……​我​看​咱们​也​只能​把​这具​尸体​塞进​车里​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​施密特​先生​肯定​不会​对此​感到高兴​，​不过​总​比​什么​都​没有​强​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1……wo3 kan4 zan2men5 ye3 zhi3neng2 ba3 zhe4 ju4 shi1ti3 se4 jin4 che1 li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，bu4guo4 zong3 bi3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3 jiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger sighs. The tone of resignation returns to her voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Screw it. Let’s put an end to this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔叹​了​口气​，​听​起来​是​认命​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​算了​，​我们​不要​争​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，ting1 qi3lai5 shi4 ren4ming4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suan4le5，wo3men5 bu4yao4 zheng1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on, you two. There's nothing else for us here.\n"
"\n"
"Let's go home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​你​俩​。​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​回家吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5 ni3 lia3。wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui2 jia1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I always hate having to kill one of our own. Still... the job's the job."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向来​不​喜欢​对​同行​下​杀手​。​但是​……​工作​就是​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4lai2 bu4 xi3huan5 dui4 tong2hang2 xia4 sha1shou3。dan4shi4……gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, Blitz. Heroes is what we are.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, $(l.name). There's nothing else for us here. Let's get back home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​是​是​，​布里​茨​。​我们​就是​英雄​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​我们​回家吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，Bu4li3ci2。wo3men5 jiu4shi4 ying1xiong2。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。wo3men5 hui2 jia1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, Blitz. It's too bad.\n"
"\n"
"Come on, $(l.name). There's nothing else for us here. Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​是​是​，​布里​茨​。​真​可惜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​我们​回家吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，Bu4li3ci2。zhen1 ke3xi1。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。wo3men5 hui2 jia1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he)'s right, you know. You're completely at our mercy.\n"
"\n"
"So, tell us, Yuli. Whose payroll are you on?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$+(l.he)​说​得​没错​。​你​现在​任凭​我们​摆布​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​说​吧​。​是​谁​花钱​雇​你​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$+(l.he) shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。ni3 xian4zai4 ren4ping2 wo3men5 bai3bu4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 shuo1 ba1。shi4 shei2 hua1qian2 gu4 ni3 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger snatches her hand back and steps backward.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What the he--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​猛地​抽​回手​，​向​后退​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么​鬼​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 meng3de5 chou1 hui2 shou3，xiang4 hou4tui4 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shen2me5 gui3 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don’t think so. Don’t want to hurt you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​算了吧​。​我​不想​伤到​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suan4 le5 ba1。wo3 bu4xiang3 shang1 dao4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, you want some of this? \n"
"\n"
"At least you can take it. I’d probably break the others."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啧​，​你​想​试试​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​至少​你​能​受得住​。​换​了​别人​可能​就​被​我​捏碎​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ze2，ni3 xiang3 shi4 shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3 ni3 neng2 shou4 de2 zhu4。huan4 le5 bie2ren5 ke3neng2 jiu4 bei4 wo3 nie1sui4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger speaks through clenched teeth. Her words are measured, but her expression is livid.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is unbelievable."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​咬牙切齿​地​说道​。​她​的​言语​还​算​克制​，​但​神情​却​怒不可遏​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​不敢相信​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yao3ya2qie4chi3 de5 shuo1dao4。ta1 de5 yan2yu3 hai2 suan4 ke4zhi4，dan4 shen2qing2 que4 nu4bu4ke3e4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger stares at you. Her face has gone white.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You can't be considering this. Not after what he did to Monika, and to Paul, and to everyone else who died in the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Not after everything we've been through together."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​凝视着​你​。​她​的​脸​变得​苍白​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不会​真的​打算​这么​做​吧​。​想想​莫妮卡​，​想想​保罗​，​还有​克洛伊​茨​集市​那么​多​死去​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​想想​我们​一起​经历​的​所有​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 lian3 bian4de5 cang1bai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 zhen1de5 da3suan4 zhe4me5 zuo4 ba1。xiang3 xiang3 Mo4ni1ka3，xiang3 xiang3 bao3luo2，hai2you3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 na4me5 duo1 si3qu4 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 xiang3 wo3men5 yi1qi3 jing1li4 de5 suo3you3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger stares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not on your life. A syndicate  - *any* syndicate - in Schattennest would be a disaster for the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Let the people on the other side of the gate deal with their own problems. I won't allow my home to be endangered for their sake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​开玩笑​了​。​只要​影巢​有​黑帮​存在​，​无论如何​都​会​对​克洛伊​茨​集市​产生​威胁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​大门​另一边​的​人​自己​去​解决问题​吧​。​我​绝不会​为了​他们​而​让​我​的​家园​陷入​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 kai1wan2xiao4 le5。zhi3yao4 ying3 chao2 you3 hei1bang1 cun2zai4，wu2lun4ru2he2 dou1 hui4 dui4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 chan3sheng1 wei1xie2。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 da4men2 ling4 yi1 bian1 de5 ren2 zi4ji3 qu4 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2 ba1。wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 wei4le5 ta1men5 er2 rang4 wo3 de5 jia1yuan2 xian4ru4 wei1xian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger stares down at the MKVI's mangled corpse.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well... I guess we might as well load the body into the van.\n"
"\n"
"Herr Schmidt won't be happy, but it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​凝视着​MKVI​的​残破​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​……​我​看​咱们​也​只能​把​这具​尸体​塞进​车里​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​施密特​先生​肯定​不会​对此​感到高兴​，​不过​总​比​什么​都​没有​强​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ning2 shi4 zhao2 MKVI de5 can2po4 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1……wo3 kan4 zan2men5 ye3 zhi3neng2 ba3 zhe4 ju4 shi1ti3 se4 jin4 che1 li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，bu4guo4 zong3 bi3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3 jiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger steps forward, a cruel smile on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're going to want to start talking, Yuli. I promise you that.\n"
"\n"
"You can start by telling us whose payroll you're on."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​向前​一步​，​脸上​挂​着​残酷​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​最好​还是​乖乖​开口​交待​，​尤里​。​否则​别怪​我​不​客气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​先说​说到底​是​谁​雇​你​来​这​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 xiang4qian2 yi1 bu4，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 can2ku4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zui4hao3 hai2shi5 guai1guai1 kai1kou3 jiao1dai4，You2li3。fou3ze2 bie4 guai4 wo3 bu4 ke4qi5。\n"
"\n"
"xian1 shuo1 shuo1dao4di3 shi4 shei2 gu4 ni3 lai2 zhe4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger stops short.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What's going on?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​随即​停下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 sui2ji2 ting2xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger studies the woman for a minute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look at her, boss. I think this is Feuerschwinge. Vauclair must've trapped her astral form in that woman."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​端详​了​一会儿​那个​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看​，​老大​。​我​想​那​是​火翼​。​沃​克莱尔​肯定​是​把​她​的​灵体​困​在​了​那个​女人​体内​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 duan1xiang2 le5 yi1hui4r5 na4ge5 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4，lao3da4。wo3 xiang3 na4 shi4 Huo3yi4。Wo4ke4lai2er3 ken3ding4 shi4 ba3 ta1 de5 ling2ti3 kun4 zai4 le5 na4ge5 nu:3ren2 ti3nei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger takes a step back. Her knife lowers slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Something's wrong. Look at his hands."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​后退​了​一步​，​微微​放下​刀子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​哪里​不对劲​。​看看​他​的​手​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4，wei1wei1 fang4xia4 dao1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 na3li3 bu4dui4jin4。kan4kan5 ta1 de5 shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger takes a step back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Something's wrong. Look at his hands."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​后退​了​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​哪里​不对劲​。​看看​他​的​手​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 na3li3 bu4dui4jin4。kan4kan5 ta1 de5 shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger turns her focus back to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you'd been paying attention, you'd have figured all of this out on your own by now. You'd've known that Monika needed watching as much as that door."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​把​注意力​转回​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​但凡​留​点心​，​这​一切​你​早就​能​自己​搞​明白​。​你​就​该​知道​莫妮卡​跟​那​扇门​一样​，​需要​人​看着​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3hui2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dan4fan2 liu2 dian3xin5，zhe4 yi1qie4 ni3 zao3jiu4 neng2 zi4ji3 gao3 ming2bai5。ni3 jiu4 gai1 zhi1dao4 Mo4ni1ka3 gen1 na4 shan1 men2 yi1yang4，xu1yao4 ren2 kan4 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger turns to face you. There is a pained look on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look... I owe you an apology."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​转身​看向​你​，​脸上​带​着​痛苦​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​……​我​欠​你​一个​道歉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 zhuan3shen1 kan4 xiang4 ni3，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 tong4ku3 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4ge5……wo3 qian4 ni3 yi1ge5 dao4qian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger turns to you. She doesn't look happy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've already told you what my plans are. I'm going off on my own."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​看​向​你​。​她​看起来​并​不​高兴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​告诉​过​你​我​的​计划​了​。​我​打算​独自​行动​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 kan4 xiang4 ni3。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 bing4 bu4 gao1xing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 gao4su4 guo4 ni3 wo3 de5 ji4hua4 le5。wo3 da3suan4 du2zi4 xing2dong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger turns to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So, $(l.name)... you gonna stick around the Kreuzbasar and keep running the shadows with me? \n"
"\n"
"You’ve done a hell of a job. I’d be happy to follow your lead."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​$(l.name)​……​你​打算​留在​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​继续​和​我​一起​组队​接​活儿​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​干​得​很​出色​。​我​很​乐意​听从​你​的​领导​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，$(l.name)……ni3 da3suan4 liu2 zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，ji4xu4 he4 wo3 yi1qi3 zu3dui4 jie1 huo2r5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gan4 de2 hen3 chu1se4。wo3 hen3 le4yi4 ting1cong2 ni3 de5 ling3dao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger welcomes you with a nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​点头​向​你​表示​欢迎​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 dian3tou2 xiang4 ni3 biao3shi4 huan1ying2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger whispers under her breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Scheisse. What have we *done?*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​喃喃自语​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​。​我们​做​了​*​什么​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 nan2nan2zi4yu3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3。wo3men5 zuo4 le5*shen2me5*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger whistles appreciatively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very nice, Bannik. That should make this easy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​赞许​地​吹​了​声​口哨​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真不错​，​班尼克​。​这样​事情​就​简单​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 zan4xu3 de5 chui1 le5 sheng1 kou3shao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1 bu4 cuo4，ban1 ni2 ke4。zhe4yang4 shi4qing5 jiu4 jian3dan1 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger wipes her hands clean and looks up, an expression of grim satisfaction on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well. That takes care of that. Thanks for the assist, fearless leader."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​擦​了​擦​手​，​抬头​望​向​你​，​脸上​露出​一种​阴沉​的​满足​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​这样一来​就​完事​了​。​感谢​援助​，​无畏​领袖​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 ca1 le5 ca1 shou3，tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 ni3，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 yi1zhong3 yin1chen2 de5 man3zu2 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，zhe4yang4yi1lai2 jiu4 wan2shi4 le5。gan3xie4 yuan2zhu4，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger wrinkles her nose.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The funny thing is, a syndicate presence might actually help Schattennest... in the short term, at least. They'd clean up the streets, if nothing else."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔皱​皱​鼻子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有趣​的​是​，​黑帮​的​存在​实际上​可能​对​影巢​有所​帮助​……​至少​在短期内​是​这样​。​起码​他们​会​清理​街道​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 zhou4 zhou4 bi2zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3qu4 de5 shi4，hei1bang1 de5 cun2zai4 shi2ji4shang4 ke3neng2 dui4 ying3 chao2 you3suo3 bang1zhu4……zhi4shao3 zai4 duan3 qi1 nei4 shi4 zhe4yang4。qi3ma3 ta1men5 hui4 qing1li3 jie1dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger's expression hardens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I know. He had us all patched in on that call. \n"
"\n"
"We all saw what happened."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​表情​变得​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​。​他​把​我们​所有人​都​接入​了​通讯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​都​看见​发生​了​什么​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 biao3qing2 bian4de5 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。ta1 ba3 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 jie1ru4 le5 tong1xun4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 kan4jian4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger's expression remains stony, but she gives you a small nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Okay."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​表情​依旧​冷峻​，​但​她​向​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 biao3qing2 yi1jiu4 leng3jun4，dan4 ta1 xiang4 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger's eyes narrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do *not* fuck with me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​眼露​凶光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​*​他妈​*​惹​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 yan3 lou4 xiong1guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4*ta1 ma1*re3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger's eyes widen in surprise.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, Glory. Yeah, it is."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​惊讶​地​张大​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​格洛丽​。​的确如此​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 jing1ya4 de5 zhang1 dai4 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，Ge2luo4li2。de5 que4 ru2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger's face twists into a mask of grief and rage. She reaches for her shotgun.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"God *DAMN* it, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​脸​扭曲​成​一副​愤怒​与​悲痛​的​面具​。​她​伸手​去​拿​她​的​霰弹枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​的​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 lian3 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1 fu4 fen4nu4 yu4 bei1tong4 de5 mian4ju4。ta1 shen1shou3 qu4 na2 ta1 de5 xian4dan4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3 de5，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger's grip tightens on the butt of her rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't listen to it, $(l.name). That isn't Monika.\n"
"\n"
"It can't be."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​握紧​了​步枪​的​枪托​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​听​它​的​，​$(l.name)​。​那​不是​莫妮卡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​可能​是​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 wo4 jin3 le5 bu4qiang1 de5 qiang1tuo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 ting1 ta1 de5，$(l.name)。na4 bu4shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 ke3neng2 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger's hands bunch into fists. She's still smiling, but you can feel the heat of the hatred behind her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you don't start telling me what I want to hear in the next thirty seconds, this is going to get messy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​双手​紧握​成拳​。​她​仍​在​微笑​，​但​你​能​感受​到​她​眼中​隐藏​的​仇恨​之火​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​在​接下来​的​三十秒​内​不​说出​我​想​听​的话​，​恐怕​场面​就要​变得​很​难看​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。ta1 reng2 zai4 wei1xiao4，dan4 ni3 neng2 gan3shou4 dao4 ta1 yan3zhong1 yin3cang2 de5 chou2hen4 zhi1 huo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 san1 shi2 miao3 nei4 bu4 shuo1chu1 wo3 xiang3 ting1 de5hua4，kong3pa4 chang3mian4 jiu4yao4 bian4de5 hen3 nan2kan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Eiger's hands bunch into fists. She's still smiling, but you can feel the heat of the hatred behind her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've got bigger issues to worry about than my face, Yuli. If you don't start telling me what I want to hear in the next thirty seconds, this is going to get messy."
msgstr ""
