"mei2cuo4，que4shi2 you3 yi1 ming2 xi2ji1zhe3 zai4 shou3shu4 zhong1tu2 chuang3 le5 jin4lai2。ta1 yong4 wu3qi4 xiang4 qiang2bi4 she4ji1，da3sui4 le5 yi1xie1 fei1chang2 jing1mi4 de5 she4bei4。"

