"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai1ziji1bei4er3 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 bing1leng3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wei1xie2 yi1sheng1 ke3bu5shi4 shen2me5 hao3 zhu3yi5。ni3 ye3 bu4 xi1wang4 xia4ci4 deng3 ni3 tang3 zai4 shou3shu4tai2 de5 shi2hou5 hui4 chu1 shen2me5 cha4zi5 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Finish the sentence.{{/GM}} ...He's in charge there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​把​这句​话​说完​。​{{/GM}}​……​他​是​那里​的​负责人​。\n"
"{{GM}} ba3 zhe4 ju4 hua4 shuo1 wan2。{{/GM}}……ta1 shi4 na4li5 de5 fu4ze2ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Fire flashes in Vauclair’s eyes. His back straightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And what do you presume to know of dragons? I have spent my *entire life* studying them."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​眼中​闪着​火焰​。​他​挺直​了​后背​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​又​对​巨龙​了解​些​什么​？​我​可是​花费​了​*​毕生​时间​*​来​研究​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 yan3zhong1 shan3 zhao2 huo3yan4。ta1 ting3zhi2 le5 hou4bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 you4 dui4 ju4long2 liao3jie3 xie1 shen2me5？wo3 ke3shi4 hua1fei4 le5*bi4sheng1 shi2jian1*lai2 yan2jiu1 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Fire flashes in Vauclair’s eyes. His back straightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You do NOT know me, shadowrunner, nor can you possibly understand me. What I've been through. What I know with *absolute certainty.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​眼中​闪着​火焰​。​他​挺直​了​后背​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​并​不​了解​我​，​暗影​狂奔​者​，​你​也​不​可能​理解​我​。​我​经历​的​一切​。​我​对​*​绝对真理​*​的​认知​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 yan3zhong1 shan3 zhao2 huo3yan4。ta1 ting3zhi2 le5 hou4bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bing4 bu4 liao3jie3 wo3，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，ni3 ye3 bu4 ke3neng2 li3jie3 wo3。wo3 jing1li4 de5 yi1qie4。wo3 dui4*jue2 dui4 zhen1 li3*de5 ren4zhi1。"

msgid "{{GM}}First floor: Hotel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一层​：​旅馆​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} yi1ceng2：lu:3guan3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Flash lowers his voice to a conspiratorial whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Between you and me, my mojo is stronger than any corp wagemage's. Take those rat-scum bastards at Aztechnology. They cast spells all day and all night, right? *Fire* this and *lightning* that, just tossin' 'em around like candy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗莱​士​压低​了​声音​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​偷偷​跟​你​说​，​我​的​魔力​比​那些​公司​的​坐班​法师​强多​了​。​就​拿​阿兹特​科技​的​那些​狗东西​来说​吧​。​他们​没日没夜​地​施放​法术​，​对​不​对​？​这边​丢个​*​火​*​，​那边​丢个​*​雷​*​的​，​只会​到处​瞎放​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2 lai2 shi4 ya1di1 le5 sheng1yin1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 tou1tou1 gen1 ni3 shuo1，wo3 de5 mo2li4 bi3 na4xie1 gong1si1 de5 zuo4ban1 fa3shi1 jiang4 duo1 le5。jiu4 na2 E1zi1te4ke1ji4 de5 na4xie1 gou3dong1xi5 lai2 shuo1 ba1。ta1men5 mei2ri4mei2ye4 de5 shi1fang4 fa3shu4，dui4 bu4 dui4？zhe4bian1 diu1 ge4*huo3*，na4bian5 diu1 ge4*lei2*de5，zhi3 hui4 dao4chu4 xia1 fang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Flash's grin broadens even further. His mouth is disturbingly large, and there's something menacing about the sight of those too-white teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is the real deal, chummer. A proprietary blend, designed and delivered by yours truly. Pharmaceutical-grade kamikaze cut with genuine spirit residue from the Tir and then mixed with my secret blend of herbs and spices."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗莱​士​脸上​的​笑容​更​灿烂​了​。​他​的​嘴巴​几乎​要​咧​到​耳朵​根​，​一口​洁白​的​牙齿​总​感觉​暗含​着​恶意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​亲​，​这才​是​真正​的​好​东西​。​这​是​由​我​亲自​设计​和​提供​的​专有​配方​。​药用​级​的​“​神风​”​兑上​真正​的​提尔​精魂​残渣​，​然后​与​我​秘制​的​草药​和​香料​混合​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2 lai2 shi4 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 geng1 can4lan4 le5。ta1 de5 zui3ba5 ji1hu1 yao4 lie3 dao4 er3duo5 gen1，yi1kou3 jie2bai2 de5 ya2chi3 zong3 gan3jue2 an4han2 zhao2 e4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qin1，zhe4 cai2 shi4 zhen1zheng4 de5 hao3 dong1xi1。zhe4 shi4 you2 wo3 qin1zi4 she4ji4 he4 ti2gong1 de5 zhuan1you3 pei4fang1。yao4yong4 ji2 de5“shen2 feng1” dui4 shang4 zhen1zheng4 de5 ti2er3 jing1hun2 can2zha1，ran2hou4 yu4 wo3 mi4zhi4 de5 cao3yao4 he4 xiang1liao4 hun4he2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Flip the bit.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​改变​位元​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gai3bian4 wei4yuan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Flip the switch, initiating the process to delete APEX.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拨动​开关​，​启动​APEX​删除​进程​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} bo1dong4 kai1guan1，qi3dong4 APEX shan1chu2 jin4cheng2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Flip to the green bookmark.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​翻​到​绿色​书签​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fan1 dao4 lu:4se4 shu1qian1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Flip to the yellow bookmark.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​翻​到​黄色​书签​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fan1 dao4 huang2se4 shu1qian1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}For a second, Dietrich’s pained expression twists into a mask of hatred, but he regains his composure.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Don't worry, I've got your back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​有​那么​一瞬间​，​迪​特里​希​痛苦​的​表情​扭曲​成​了​憎恨​的​面具​，​但​他​又​重新​镇定​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​。​别​担心​，​有​我​在​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you3 na4me5 yi1shun4jian1，Di2te4li3xi1 tong4ku3 de5 biao3qing2 niu3qu1 cheng2 le5 zeng1hen4 de5 mian4ju4，dan4 ta1 you4 chong2xin1 zhen4ding4 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3。bie4 dan1xin1，you3 wo3 zai4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}For the first time since you met her, Glory's expression seems to brighten. It's subtle, but it's there... you're sure of it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). A pleasure, as always.\n"
"\n"
"Need anything from me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​自从​你​认识​她​以来​，​格洛丽​的​神情​似乎​首次​轻快​了​些​。​变化​虽​细微​，​却​真实​存在​……​你​确信无疑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​一如既往​，​很​高兴​见到​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​需要​我​帮忙​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zi4cong2 ni3 ren4shi5 ta1 yi3lai2，Ge2luo4li2 de5 shen2qing2 si4hu1 shou3ci4 qing1kuai4 le5 xie1。bian4hua4 sui1 xi4wei1，que4 zhen1shi2 cun2zai4……ni3 que4 xin4 wu2 yi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。yi1ru2ji4wang3，hen3 gao1xing4 jian4dao4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"xu1yao4 wo3 bang1mang2 ma5？"

msgid "{{GM}}Fourth floor: Hotel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​四层​：​旅馆​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} si4 ceng2：lu:3guan3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Frank eyes the credstick in your hand, then glances back at the dancing girl. Slowly, he reaches over and palms it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A'ight, you can go up. The elevator's open.\n"
"\n"
"Make it quick before I change my mind."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗兰克​瞟​了​一眼​你​手里​的​信用​棒​，​又​瞟​了​一眼​那个​舞娘​。​他​慢吞吞​地​伸出手​，​把​它​藏​进​了​自己​的​掌​心里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​了​，​你​上去​吧​。​电梯​已经​开​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​动作​快点​，​省得​我​改​主意​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2lan2ke4 piao3 le5 yi1yan3 ni3 shou3li3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4，you4 piao3 le5 yi1yan3 na4ge5 wu3niang2。ta1 man4tun1tun1 de5 shen1 chu1 shou3，ba3 ta1 zang4 jin4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 zhang3 xin1li5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，ni3 shang4qu4 ba1。dian4ti1 yi3jing1 kai1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dong4zuo4 kuai4dian3，sheng3de5 wo3 gai3 zhu3yi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Frank looks from you to Dietrich, to Eiger, to Glory, and back to you. Then he fumbles in his pocket for something.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay, okay. It's open now. No need for trouble."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗兰克​瞅​瞅​你​，​又​看看​迪​特里​希​，​然后​是​艾格尔​，​格洛丽​，​又​重新​看向​你​。​他​在​口袋​里​摸索​了​一会​，​按​了​一下​什么​东西​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好好​好​。​电梯​已经​开​了​。​不用​搞​出​什么​麻烦​来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2lan2ke4 chou3 chou3 ni3，you4 kan4kan5 Di2te4li3xi1，ran2hou4 shi4 Ai4ge2er3，Ge2luo4li2，you4 chong2xin1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。ta1 zai4 kou3dai4 li3 mo1suo5 le5 yi1hui4，an4 le5 yi1xia4 shen2me5 dong1xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3hao3 hao3。dian4ti1 yi3jing1 kai1 le5。bu4yong4 gao3 chu1 shen2me5 ma2fan5 lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Frank looks from you to Dietrich, to Eiger, to Glory, and back to you. Then he fumbles in his pocket for something.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay. Right. The elevator's open. Just... try to keep things quiet up there, okay?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗兰克​瞅​瞅​你​，​又​看看​迪​特里​希​，​然后​是​艾格尔​，​格洛丽​，​最后​又​看​向​你​。​然后​他​在​口袋​里​摸索​着​按​了​什么​东西​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​，​好​。​电梯​已经​开​了​。​就​一个​事​……​尽量​别​在​楼上​搞​出​什么​大​动静​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2lan2ke4 chou3 chou3 ni3，you4 kan4kan5 Di2te4li3xi1，ran2hou4 shi4 Ai4ge2er3，Ge2luo4li2，zui4hou4 you4 kan4 xiang4 ni3。ran2hou4 ta1 zai4 kou3dai4 li3 mo1suo5 zhao2 an4 le5 shen2me5 dong1xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2，hao3。dian4ti1 yi3jing1 kai1 le5。jiu4 yi1ge5 shi4……jin3liang4 bie4 zai4 lou2shang4 gao3 chu1 shen2me5 dai4 dong4jing4，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Frank peels his eyes off of the shimmying elf and stares at you, an irritated expression on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*What?*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗兰克​老大​不​情愿​地​将​目光​从​摇曳生姿​的​精灵​舞娘​身上​移开​，​脸上​露出​不耐烦​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​干什么​？​*\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2lan2ke4 lao3da4 bu4 qing2yuan4 de5 jiang1 mu4guang1 cong2 yao2 ye4 sheng1 zi1 de5 jing1ling2 wu3niang2 shen1shang5 yi2kai1，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 bu4nai4fan2 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*gan4shen2me5？*"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Frank's eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sara? She needs something from ME?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗兰克​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​莎拉​？​她​居然​要​我​帮忙​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2lan2ke4 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sha1la1？ta1 ju1ran2 yao4 wo3 bang1mang2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Franz leans back in surprise.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Parson is always after Janet, but that doesn't sound like him. Not even a little bit."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗朗兹​吃惊​地向​后​一仰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​帕森​一直​针对​珍妮特​，​但​这​听​起来​不像​他​的​风格​。​一点​也​不​像​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2 lang3 zi1 chi1jing1 de5 xiang4 hou4 yi1 yang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"pa4 sen1 yi1zhi2 zhen1dui4 zhen1 ni1 te4，dan4 zhe4 ting1 qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 ta1 de5 feng1ge2。yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 xiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Franz takes a moment to collect himself. When he speaks again, he sounds more composed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"At least Janet is letting us use her Matrix uplink. We can still afford to feed ourselves, thanks to her."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗朗兹​停顿​了​片刻​整理​思绪​。​当​他​再次​开口​时​，​语气​显得​更​平静​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​至少​珍妮特​愿意​让​我们​使用​她​的​矩阵​连接​。​多亏​了​她​，​我们​还​能​养活​自己​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2 lang3 zi1 ting2dun4 le5 pian4ke4 zheng3li3 si1xu4。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，yu3qi4 xian3de5 geng1 ping2jing4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3 zhen1 ni1 te4 yuan4yi4 rang4 wo3men5 shi3yong4 ta1 de5 ju3zhen4 lian2jie1。duo1kui1 le5 ta1，wo3men5 hai2 neng2 yang3huo5 zi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Franz's face lights up at the sight of you. He steps toward you with open arms, a huge smile plastered across his grubby face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hello again, my friend! I can't thank you enough for helping us return home.\n"
"\n"
"The spirits did quite a number on this place, but that doesn't matter. Thanks to you, we're back, and we'll have it shipshape again in no time!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗朗兹​看到​你​时​，​脸上​立刻​露出​了​光芒​。​他​张开​双臂​朝​你​走来​，​脏兮兮​的​脸上​挂满​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​见面​了​，​我​的​朋友​！​我​真是​感激不尽​，​感谢​你​帮助​我们​回到​了​家​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​精魂​确实​把​这里​弄​得​一团糟​，​但​那​都​不​重要​。​多亏​了​你​，​我们​回来​了​，​用​不了​多久​这里​就​会​恢复​如初​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2 lang3 zi1 kan4dao4 ni3 shi2，lian3 shang4 li4ke4 lu4chu1 le5 guang1mang2。ta1 zhang1kai1 shuang1bi4 chao2 ni3 zou3 lai2，zang1xi1xi1 de5 lian3 shang4 gua4 man3 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5，wo3 de5 peng2you5！wo3 zhen1shi5 gan3ji1bu4jin4，gan3xie4 ni3 bang1zhu4 wo3men5 hui2dao4 le5 jia1。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 jing1hun2 que4shi2 ba3 zhe4li3 long4 de2 yi1tuan2zao1，dan4 na4 dou1 bu4 zhong4yao4。duo1kui1 le5 ni3，wo3men5 hui2lai5 le5，yong4 bu4le5 duo1jiu3 zhe4li3 jiu4 hui4 hui1fu4 ru2chu1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Franz's face lights up in excitement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, thank you, thank you! Please let us know when it's safe to return home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​弗朗兹​的​脸上​露出​了​激动​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​，​谢谢​你​，​谢谢​你​！​如果​楼上​安全​了​，​就​请​告诉​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fu2 lang3 zi1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 le5 ji1dong4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2，xie4xie5 ni3，xie4xie5 ni3！ru2guo3 lou2shang4 an1quan2 le5，jiu4 qing3 gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Free the MKVI.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​解放​MKVI​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jie3fang4 MKVI。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Free{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​释放​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shi4fang4 {{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}From offscreen, you hear Amsel's frantic voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Audran... please... tell me what this is all about. What are the Firewing's plans? You're going to kill me anyway, don't send me to the grave witho--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​听到​阿姆​泽尔​狂乱​的​声音​从​画面​外​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​奥​德兰​……​求求​你​……​告诉​我​这​一切​究竟​是​怎么回事​。​火翼​的​计划​到底​是​什么​？​反正​你​要​杀​了​我​，​别​让​我​死​的​不明​不​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ting1dao4 E1mu3ze2er3 kuang2luan4 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 hua4mian4 wai4 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ao4de2lan2……qiu2 qiu2 ni3……gao4su4 wo3 zhe4 yi1qie4 jiu1jing4 shi4 zen3me5hui2shi4。Huo3yi4 de5 ji4hua4 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5？fan3zheng4 ni3 yao4 sha1 le5 wo3，bie4 rang4 wo3 si3 de5 bu4ming2 bu4 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}From out of frame, far away, you can hear another voice. A woman, young, from the sound of it, with a military cadence.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What now, sir?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​从​画面​之外​的​远处​传来​另​一个​声音​。​是​一名​年轻​女性​，​听​口吻​是​名​军人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​该​做​什么​，​长官​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} cong2 hua4mian4 zhi1wai4 de5 yuan3chu4 chuan2lai2 ling4 yi1ge5 sheng1yin1。shi4 yi1 ming2 nian2qing1 nu:3xing4，ting1 kou3wen3 shi4 ming2 jun1ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 gai1 zuo4 shen2me5，zhang3guan1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}From the back of the store, the voice of the shopkeep cuts you off.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't mind the fool in the chair. He roars like a traumatized walrus, stewing all day in his own sweat.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The man behind the bar glares at Goldschmidt, his upper lip curled in disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I tolerate him only because he takes his soykaf by the bucket."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​店主​的​声音​从​商店​后面​传来​打断​了​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别管​椅子​上​那个​笨蛋​。​他​的​声音​就​跟​受伤​的​海象​一样​轰隆轰隆​的​，​整天​就​会​出汗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​吧台​后面​的​男人​瞪​着​戈德​施密特​，​上唇​因​厌恶​而​微微​翘起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​之所以​容忍​他​，​只是​因为​他​一桶​一桶​买豆​咖​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dian4zhu3 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 shang1dian4 hou4mian5 chuan2lai2 da3duan4 le5 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie2guan3 yi3zi5 shang4 na4ge5 ben4dan4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 jiu4 gen1 shou4shang1 de5 hai3xiang4 yi1yang4 hong1 long1 hong1 long1 de5，zheng3tian1 jiu4 hui4 chu1han4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ba1tai2 hou4mian5 de5 nan2ren2 deng4 zhao2 Ge1de2shi1mi4te4，shang4chun2 yin1 yan4wu4 er2 wei1wei1 qiao4qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1suo3yi3 rong2ren3 ta1，zhi3shi4 yin1wei4 ta1 yi1 tong3 yi1 tong3 mai3 dou4 ka1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}From the pause on the other end of the line, you can tell that you've caught Blitz off guard.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Yeah? What's that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​布里​茨​在​电话​那​头顿​了​一下​，​你​意识​到​他​被​你​问​了​个​措手不及​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​？​你​指​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Bu4li3ci2 zai4 dian4hua4 na4 tou2 dun4 le5 yi1xia4，ni3 yi4shi2 dao4 ta1 bei4 ni3 wen4 le5 ge4 cuo4shou3bu4ji2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4？ni3 zhi3 shen2me5？"

msgid "{{GM}}Get the drop on the guards by firing first.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​抢先​开火​，​先发制人​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} qiang3xian1 kai1huo3，xian1fa1zhi4ren2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Get your decker to bypass the safety protocols.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客​绕过​安全​协议​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 rao4guo4 an1quan2 xie2yi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Get your decker to hack the panel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客骇入​面板​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 hai4 ru4 mian4ban3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Get your decker to hack the terminal.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客骇入​终端​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 hai4 ru4 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Get your muscle to force the door.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​打手​来​强行​开门​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 da3shou5 lai2 qiang2xing2 kai1men2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Get your muscle to slam on the wall.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​打手​来​撞墙​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 da3shou5 lai2 zhuang4 qiang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Get your teammate to force open the wall.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​你​的​队友​来​强行​破墙​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 ni3 de5 dui4you3 lai2 qiang2xing2 po4 qiang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Gingerly, she reaches up and wraps a hand around the protective ward that hangs around her neck.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. I think that I do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​小心翼翼​地​伸出手​，​将​缠绕​在​颈间​的​护身符​握​在​掌心​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我​想​我​这里​有​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao3xin1yi4yi4 de5 shen1 chu1 shou3，jiang1 chan2rao4 zai4 jing3 jian1 de5 hu4shen1fu2 wo4 zai4 zhang3xin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 xiang3 wo3 zhe4li3 you3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Give her a bottle of cram.{{/GM}} Sure, why not? The cram's on me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​给​她​一瓶​超感​。​{{/GM}}​行​啊​，​没​问题​。​这药​我​请​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} gei3 ta1 yi1 ping2 chao1 gan3。{{/GM}} xing2 a1，mei2 wen4ti2。zhe4 yao4 wo3 qing3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Give her to APEX.{{/GM}} I've decided to make you a pet for a computer"
" program. Goodbye, dragon."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​把​她​交给​APEX​。​{{/GM}}​我​已经​决定​让​你​做​某个​计算机程序​的​宠物​了​。​永别​了​，​巨龙​。\n"
"{{GM}} ba3 ta1 jiao1gei3 APEX。{{/GM}} wo3 yi3jing1 jue2ding4 rang4 ni3 zuo4 mou3 ge4 ji4 suan4 ji1 cheng2 xu4 de5 chong3wu4 le5。yong3bie2 le5，ju4long2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Give in and speak the truth.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​屈从​并​和盘托出​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} qu1cong2 bing4 he2pan2tuo1chu1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Give in and tell the truth.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​屈从​并​和盘托出​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} qu1cong2 bing4 he2pan2tuo1chu1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Give up.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​放弃​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fang4qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory calmly inspects the body. She shakes her head slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pity.\n"
"\n"
"I'd have liked to hear what he had to say."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​冷静​地​检视​着​尸体​。​她​轻轻​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可惜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​本来​还​打算​听听​他​要说​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 leng3jing4 de5 jian3shi4 zhao2 shi1ti3。ta1 qing1qing1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3lai2 hai2 da3suan4 ting1 ting1 ta1 yao4shuo1 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory coolly eyes one of the ruined corpses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks that way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​冷冷地​打量​着​其中​一具​残破​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 leng3 leng3 de5 da3liang5 zhao2 qi2zhong1 yi1 ju4 can2po4 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory cuts in. Her voice is gentle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wouldn't worry about it, sweetie. We'll make sure that Marta is okay."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​插话​进来​。​她​的​声音​很​温柔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​，​亲爱​的​。​我们​会​确保​玛​尔塔​没事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 cha1hua4 jin4lai2。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 wen1rou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，qin1ai4 de5。wo3men5 hui4 que4bao3 Ma3er3ta3 mei2shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory cuts in. Her voice is gentle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wouldn't worry about it. We'll make sure that Marta is okay."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​插话​进来​。​她​的​声音​很​温柔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​，​我们​会​确保​玛​尔塔​没事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 cha1hua4 jin4lai2。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 hen3 wen1rou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1，wo3men5 hui4 que4bao3 Ma3er3ta3 mei2shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory eyes the smashed console.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're leaving her trapped here. Interesting choice.\n"
"\n"
"I wonder if it was the right one?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​盯​着​被​砸坏​的​控制台​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​把​她​丢​在​这里​不管​。​有趣​的​选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​知道​这样​做​是否是​正确​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ding1 zhao2 bei4 za2huai4 de5 kong4zhi4tai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 ba3 ta1 diu1 zai4 zhe4li3 bu4guan3。you3qu4 de5 xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 fou3 shi4 zheng4que4 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory favors you with a weak smile, her expression cautious. You're suddenly aware of how very small she is.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hoi, $(l.name). I've gotta admit, I've been dreading this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​对​你​露出​浅浅的​微笑​，​神情​却​带​着​几分​戒备​。​你​突然​意识​到​她​竟是​如此​娇小​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嘿​，​$(l.name)​。​老实​说​，​我​一直​很​害怕​这​一刻​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 jian1 jian1 de5 wei1xiao4，shen2qing2 que4 dai4 zhao2 ji3fen1 jie4bei4。ni3 tu1ran2 yi4shi2 dao4 ta1 jing4 shi4 ru2ci3 jiao1xiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hei1，$(l.name)。lao3shi5 shuo1，wo3 yi1zhi2 hen3 hai4pa4 zhe4 yi1 ke4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory fixes the ork with a cold stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Taunt all you want. If we get out of here... you'll wish you'd never set foot in the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​向​兽​人​投去​冰冷​的​眼神​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随便​你​怎么​挑衅​吧​。​等​我们​离开​这里​之后​……​你​会​后悔​自己​曾经​踏足​过​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 xiang4 shou4 ren2 tou2 qu4 bing1leng3 de5 yan3shen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 tiao3xin4 ba1。deng3 wo3men5 li2kai1 zhe4li3 zhi1hou4……ni3 hui4 hou4hui3 zi4ji3 ceng2jing1 ta4zu2 guo4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory flicks her wrists, sending the wicked blades that extend from her fingertips sliding back into their housings.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). Listen to me.\n"
"\n"
"We have a problem."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽轻​甩​手腕​，​指尖​伸出​的​利刃​随即​滑回​鞘​中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​听​我​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​有​麻烦​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 qing1 shuai3 shou3wan4，zhi3jian1 shen1chu1 de5 li4ren4 sui2ji2 hua2 hui2 qiao4 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。ting1 wo3 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 you3 ma2fan5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory freezes up. Her shoulders hunch, and her eyes narrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). That ominous feeling... it's getting closer.\n"
"\n"
"There's something in the room with us. I'm sure of it. We need to get out of here, *now.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​僵住​了​。​她​的​肩膀​蜷缩​起来​，​双眼​眯成​一条​缝​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​那种​不祥​的​感觉​……​越来越近​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​房间​里​还有​其他​东西​，​我​对此​十分​确定​。​我们​必须​*​立刻​*​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 jiang1zhu4 le5。ta1 de5 jian1bang3 quan2suo1 qi3lai5，shuang1yan3 mi2 cheng2 yi1 tiao2 feng2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。na4zhong3 bu4xiang2 de5 gan3jue2……yue4 lai2 yue4 jin4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"fang2jian1 li3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 dong1xi1，wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 que4ding4。wo3men5 bi4xu1*li4ke4*li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory gestures at the smoldering, twisted form on the carpet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You tell me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​指​了​指​地毯​上​那具​还​在​冒烟​的​扭曲​实体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别问​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zhi3 le5 zhi3 di4tan3 shang4 na4 ju4 hai2 zai4 mao4yan1 de5 niu3qu1 shi2ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 wen4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory gestures at the twisted form on the carpet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You tell me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​指​了​指​地毯​上​那具​扭曲​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别问​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zhi3 le5 zhi3 di4tan3 shang4 na4 ju4 niu3qu1 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 wen4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory gives you a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar and gear up.\n"
"\n"
"We've got a castle to raid."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽朝​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​做好​准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​去​攻占​一座​城堡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 chao2 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 qu4 gong1zhan4 yi1 zuo4 cheng2bao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory grits her teeth but gives you a small nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, you're right.\n"
"\n"
"After so many years living here, I don't know if she even knows what \"normal\" feels like anymore."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​咬紧牙关​，​但​还是​向​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​你​说得对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这里​生活​了​这么​多年​之后​，​我​都​不​确定​她​是否​还​记得​“​正常​”​的​感觉​是​什么样​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yao3jin3ya2guan1，dan4 hai2shi5 xiang4 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4li3 sheng1huo2 le5 zhe4me5 duo1nian2 zhi1hou4，wo3 dou1 bu4 que4ding4 ta1 shi4fou3 hai2 ji4de5“zheng4chang2” de5 gan3jue2 shi4 shen2me5yang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory interposes herself between you and the doorway.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just a moment, $(l.name). We're just leaving? We're not going to kill the Firewing, or set her free, or anything?\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure about this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽拦​在​你​和​门口​之间​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​一下​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​就​这么​走​了​？​我们​不杀​火翼​，​也​不放​了​她​，​什么​都​不​做​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​确定​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 lan2 zai4 ni3 he4 men2kou3 zhi1jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3 yi1xia4，$(l.name)。wo3men5 jiu4 zhe4me5 zou3 le5？wo3men5 bu4 sha1 Huo3yi4，ye3 bu4 fang4 le5 ta1，shen2me5 dou1 bu4 zuo4？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory lets out a weary sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ask your questions, but do it quickly. I have things to do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​发出​一声​沉重​的​叹息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​问​吧​，​但​麻烦​你​搞​快点​。​我​还有​事要​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 chen2zhong4 de5 tan4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wen4 ba1，dan4 ma2fan5 ni3 gao3 kuai4dian3。wo3 hai2you3 shi4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory looks into your eyes, and you can see a flicker of warmth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That was the right choice, $(l.name). He clearly wanted to die."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​凝视着​你​的​双眼​，​而​你​从​她​眼中​看出​了​一抹​温情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​做出​了​正确​的​决定​，​$(l.name)​。​他​显然​一心​求死​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 shuang1yan3，er2 ni3 cong2 ta1 yan3zhong1 kan4chu1 le5 yi1 ma1 wen1qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuo4chu1 le5 zheng4que4 de5 jue2ding4，$(l.name)。ta1 xian3ran2 yi1xin1 qiu2 si3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory looks you in the eye, and her expression hardens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Then I'll find her and correct our mistake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​，​她​的​表情​变得​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我会​亲自​找到​她​，​纠正​我们​犯下​的​错误​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5，ta1 de5 biao3qing2 bian4de5 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 hui4 qin1zi4 zhao3dao4 ta1，jiu1zheng4 wo3men5 fan4 xia4 de5 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory mutters under her breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, this is interesting."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​低声​嘀咕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​这​很​有趣​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 di1sheng1 di2gu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，zhe4 hen3 you3qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory nods, a grim expression on her delicate face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In hindsight, yes. You're right. It was inevitable that this would happen; I was a fool and a puppet, and any power that I thought that I'd had was on loan from a being that craved my own misery."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​点点头​，​精致​的​面容​上​浮现​出​阴郁​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​事后​看来​，​确实​如此​。​你​说得对​。​这​一切​的​发生​是​必然​的​；​我​不过​是​个​愚者​与​傀儡​，​而​我​自​以为​拥有​的​任何​力量​，​不过​是​借自​那个​渴求​我​痛苦​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dian3 dian3 tou2，jing1zhi4 de5 mian4rong2 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yin1yu4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4hou4 kan4lai5，que4shi2 ru2ci3。ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 fa1sheng1 shi4 bi4ran2 de5 ； wo3 bu4guo4 shi4 ge4 yu2 zhe3 yu4 kui3lei3，er2 wo3 zi4 yi3wei2 yong1you3 de5 ren4he2 li4liang5，bu4guo4 shi4 jie4 zi4 na4ge5 ke3qiu2 wo3 tong4ku3 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory nods, a grim expression on her delicate face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks. We're almost to the end, now.\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for sticking with me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​点点头​，​精致​的​面容​上​浮现​出​阴郁​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​。​我​马上​就要​讲完​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​一直​听​我​说​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dian3 dian3 tou2，jing1zhi4 de5 mian4rong2 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yin1yu4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。wo3 ma3shang4 jiu4yao4 jiang3 wan2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 yi1zhi2 ting1 wo3 shuo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory nods, her motions robotic and spare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Monika died of a biofeedback-induced stroke."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​点点头​，​动作​僵硬​而​节制​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​莫妮卡​死​于​生物反馈​引发​的​中风​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dian3 dian3 tou2，dong4zuo4 jiang1ying4 er2 jie2zhi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Mo4ni1ka3 si3 yu2 sheng1 wu4 fan3 kui4 yin3fa1 de5 zhong4feng1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I will. And $(l.name)... thank you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​的​。​还有​，​$(l.name)​……​谢谢​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。hai2you3，$(l.name)……xie4xie5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See you around."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Understood. See you around."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​明白​。​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5。zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory pauses again, and you recognize the distinctive flush in her cheeks. She seems to have come out of her reverie once again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's enough for now. I need to process all of this, and I don't want to continue forward until I've had the chance to do that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​再次​停顿​，​你​注意​到​她​脸颊​泛起​的​那​抹​独特​的​红晕​。​她​似乎​又​一次​从​沉思​中​回过​神来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​先到​这里​吧​。​我​需要​消化​一下​目前​说​的​这些​，​在此之前​我​不想​继续​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zai4ci4 ting2dun4，ni3 zhu4yi4 dao4 ta1 lian3jia2 fan4qi3 de5 na4 ma1 du2te4 de5 hong2yun4。ta1 si4hu1 you4 yi1ci4 cong2 chen2si1 zhong4 hui2 guo4 shen2 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xian1 dao4 zhe4li3 ba1。wo3 xu1yao4 xiao1hua4 yi1xia4 mu4qian2 shuo1 de5 zhe4xie1，zai4ci3zhi1qian2 wo3 bu4xiang3 ji4xu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory pauses for a moment and looks down at the floor, then fixes her eyes on you. She is visibly tense.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're gonna fast forward through the next few years. I was a kid on the street. I got by as best I could, doing whatever I had to do. The rest we can leave up to your imagination. Good?\n"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​停顿​了​片刻​，​低头​望​着​地板​，​然后​又​看​向​你​。​她​明显​有些​紧张​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​接下来​几年​我​就​快​进着​说​了​。​我​当时​是​个​街头​混混​，​靠着​能干​就​干​的​活儿​勉强​糊口​。​其余​的​就​留给​你​想象​吧​。​行​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ting2dun4 le5 pian4ke4，di1tou2 wang4 zhao2 di4ban3，ran2hou4 you4 kan4 xiang4 ni3。ta1 ming2xian3 you3xie1 jin3zhang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jie1xia4lai2 ji3nian2 wo3 jiu4 kuai4 jin4 zhao2 shuo1 le5。wo3 dang1shi2 shi4 ge4 jie1tou2 hun4 hun4，kao4 zhao2 neng2gan4 jiu4 gan4 de5 huo2r5 mian3qiang3 hu2kou3。qi2yu2 de5 jiu4 liu2gei3 ni3 xiang3xiang4 ba1。xing2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory pauses, considering, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fair point."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​停下​思索​着​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​道理​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ting2xia4 si1suo3 zhao2，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 dao4li5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory pauses, then swallows hard. Ever so slightly, her cheeks flush red. Suddenly she looks self-conscious, as if she's just snapped out of a trance.\n"
"\n"
"As quickly as it came, the flush of emotion disappears. Her voice frosts over.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't want to talk about this any more."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​停顿​了​一下​，​猛地​咽​了​口​唾沫​。​她​的​脸颊​微微​泛起​红晕​，​突然​显得​局促不安​，​仿佛​刚​从​恍惚​中​惊醒​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​抹​情绪​的​红晕​转瞬即逝​，​她​的​声音​也​变得​冰冷​刺骨​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​再谈​这个​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，meng3de5 yan1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。ta1 de5 lian3jia2 wei1wei1 fan4qi3 hong2yun4，tu1ran2 xian3de5 ju2cu4bu4an1，fang3fu2 gang1 cong2 huang3hu1 zhong4 jing1xing3。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ma1 qing2xu4 de5 hong2yun4 zhuan3shun4ji2shi4，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ye3 bian4de5 bing1leng3 ci4gu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 zai4 tan2 zhe4ge5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory pauses. Grits her teeth. Finally, she spits out an answer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know.\n"
"\n"
"If she's still here, she'll be Harrow's number one... my old position. He had his way with all of us, but he was always sweet on Marta."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​顿住​了​。​片刻​后​，​她​从​牙缝里​挤出​了​回答​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​她​还​在​这里​，​那​她​一定​是​哈罗​的​头号​心腹​……​就​像​我​当年​一样​。​他​对​我们​所有人​都​为所欲为​，​却​唯独​对玛​尔塔​总有​几分​偏爱​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dun4 zhu4 le5。pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 cong2 ya2 feng2 li3 ji3chu1 le5 hui2da2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 hai2 zai4 zhe4li3，na4 ta1 yi1ding4 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 tou2hao4 xin1fu4……jiu4 xiang4 wo3 dang1nian2 yi1yang4。ta1 dui4 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 wei2suo3yu4wei2，que4 wei2du2 dui4 Ma3er3ta3 zong3you3 ji3fen1 pian1ai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory pauses. Grits her teeth. Finally, she spits out an answer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If she's still here, she'll be Harrow's number one... my old position. He had his way with all of us, but he was always sweet on Marta.\n"
"\n"
"That means that she'll have a key to the shrine room."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​顿住​了​。​片刻​后​，​她​从​牙缝里​挤出​了​回答​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​她​还​在​这里​，​那​她​一定​是​哈罗​的​头号​心腹​……​就​像​我​当年​一样​。​他​对​我们​所有人​都​为所欲为​，​却​唯独​对玛​尔塔​总有​几分​偏爱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​意味着​她​会​有​神龛​室​的​钥匙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 dun4 zhu4 le5。pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 cong2 ya2 feng2 li3 ji3chu1 le5 hui2da2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 hai2 zai4 zhe4li3，na4 ta1 yi1ding4 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 tou2hao4 xin1fu4……jiu4 xiang4 wo3 dang1nian2 yi1yang4。ta1 dui4 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 wei2suo3yu4wei2，que4 wei2du2 dui4 Ma3er3ta3 zong3you3 ji3fen1 pian1ai4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ta1 hui4 you3 shen2kan1 shi4 de5 yao4shi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory puts on her own pendant. The necklace glitters slightly against her pale skin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know what's going to happen when we step into that room, $(l.name). We're playing with forces outside of our control.\n"
"\n"
"Are you ready to do this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​自己​也​戴​上吊​坠​。​项链​在​她​苍白​的​皮肤​上​微微​闪烁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​我​不​知道​当​我们​进入​那个​房间​时会​发生​什么​。​我们​要​对付​的​是​超出​我们​控制​的​力量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​准备​好了吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zi4ji3 ye3 dai4 shang4diao4 zhui4。xiang4lian4 zai4 ta1 cang1bai2 de5 pi2fu1 shang4 wei1wei1 shan3shuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 dang1 wo3men5 jin4ru4 na4ge5 fang2jian1 shi2 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5。wo3men5 yao4 dui4fu5 de5 shi4 chao1chu1 wo3men5 kong4zhi4 de5 li4liang5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory raises a hand, suddenly alert.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Wait, listen. Movement in the other room."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​突然​警觉地​抬起​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等等​，​你​听​。​隔壁​房间​有​动静​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 tu1ran2 jing3 jiao4 de5 tai2qi3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3deng3，ni3 ting1。ge2bi4 fang2jian1 you3 dong4jing4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Firewing?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, that's convenient."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​还​真​方便​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 zhen1 fang1bian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your call, $(l.name). You know the timetable we're working on."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​决定​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​你​知道​我们​当下​的​任务​安排​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2ding4 ba1，$(l.name)。ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 dang1xia4 de5 ren4wu5 an1pai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory says nothing. She just studies the photograph and nods.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​一言不发​。​她​只是​凝视着​照片​，​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yi1yan2bu4fa1。ta1 zhi3shi4 ning2 shi4 zhao2 zhao4pian4，wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory shakes her head incredulously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What are you telling us, APEX? That you feel remorse over Monika's death? That you're *sorry* for what you did to her?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​难以置信​地摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​表达​什么​意思​，​APEX​？​你​对​莫妮卡​的​死​感到​懊悔​？​你​为​自己​对​她​做​的​事​感到​*​抱歉​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 nan2yi3zhi4xin4 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 biao3da2 shen2me5 yi4si5，APEX？ni3 dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 gan3dao4 ao4hui3？ni3 wei2 zi4ji3 dui4 ta1 zuo4 de5 shi4 gan3dao4*bao4qian4*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is a waste of time. Marta, if what you're saying is true - if you ever really did care for me - then give me your key."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​纯属​浪费时间​。​玛​尔塔​，​如果​你​说​的​是​真的​，​如果​你​真的​曾经​在乎​过​我​，​那​就​把​钥匙​交​出来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 chun2shu3 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。Ma3er3ta3，ru2guo3 ni3 shuo1 de5 shi4 zhen1de5，ru2guo3 ni3 zhen1de5 ceng2jing1 zai4hu5 guo4 wo3，na4 jiu4 ba3 yao4shi5 jiao1 chu1lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory shifts into an attack posture. When she speaks, her voice is unsteady.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry that it came to this, Marta... but $(l.he)'s right. You're too far gone to save."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​切换​到​了​攻击​姿态​。​她​开口​时​，​声音​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​，​事情​发展​到​这​一步​我​也​很​遗憾​……​但​$(l.he)​说得对​。​你​已经​堕落​到​了​无可救药​的​地步​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 qie1huan4 dao4 le5 gong1ji1 zi1tai4。ta1 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，shi4qing5 fa1zhan3 dao4 zhe4 yi1 bu4 wo3 ye3 hen3 yi2han4……dan4 $(l.he) shuo1 de2 dui4。ni3 yi3jing1 duo4luo4 dao4 le5 wu2ke3jiu4yao4 de5 di4bu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory shifts into an attack posture. When she speaks, her voice is unsteady.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry that it came to this, Marta... but you're too far gone to save.\n"
"\n"
"If what you want is a fight, we'll give you one."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​切换​到​了​攻击​姿态​。​她​开口​时​，​声音​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​，​事情​发展​到​这​一步​我​也​很​遗憾​……​但​你​已经​堕落​到​了​无可救药​的​地步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​要​战斗​的话​，​那​我们​就​动手​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 qie1huan4 dao4 le5 gong1ji1 zi1tai4。ta1 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，shi4qing5 fa1zhan3 dao4 zhe4 yi1 bu4 wo3 ye3 hen3 yi2han4……dan4 ni3 yi3jing1 duo4luo4 dao4 le5 wu2ke3jiu4yao4 de5 di4bu4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 zhan4dou4 de5hua4，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 dong4shou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory shoots you a sidelong glance. She mouths out a word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽瞥​了​你​一眼​，​无声​地吐出​某个​字眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别说​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，wu2sheng1 de5 tu3 chu1 mou3 ge4 zi4yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie2shuo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory shoots you an uneasy glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You understand what you're saying... what that *means*..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​向​你​投来​不安​的​一瞥​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​明白​你​在​说​什么​吗​……​你​知道​这​*​意味​*​着​什么​吗​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 xiang4 ni3 tou2 lai2 bu4an1 de5 yi1pie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ming2bai5 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 ma5……ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4*yi4wei4*zhao2 shen2me5 ma5……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Couldn't hurt to hear what he has to say."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听听​他​怎么​说​也​没​坏处​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 ting1 ta1 zen3me5 shuo1 ye3 mei2 huai4chu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's her decision now... the ball is in her court.\n"
"\n"
"But for what it's worth, so do I."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​轮到​她​了​……​决定权​在​她​手里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​话虽如此​，​我​也​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 lun2dao4 ta1 le5……jue2 ding4 quan2 zai4 ta1 shou3li3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 hua4sui1ru2ci3，wo3 ye3 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory stares at the old tri-vid player. When she speaks, her voice is flat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's unbelievable how little things have changed. I remember stealing this for Harrow. The owner... well, he didn't need it anymore.\n"
"\n"
"I remember how proud Harrow was. How loved I felt."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​盯​着​那台​老旧​的​3D​影像​机​。​她​开口​说话​时​，​声音​毫无​起伏​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没想到​这里​居然​没什么​变化​。​我​记得​这​是​我​为​哈罗​偷来​的​。​它​之前​的​主人​……​嗯​，​已经​不​需要​它​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​记得​当时​哈罗​自豪​的​样子​，​以及​我​自己​被​深爱着​的​感受​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ding1 zhao2 na4 tai2 lao3jiu4 de5 3D ying3xiang4 ji1。ta1 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4 shi2，sheng1yin1 hao2wu2 qi3fu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2xiang3dao4 zhe4li3 ju1ran2 mei2shen2me5 bian4hua4。wo3 ji4de5 zhe4 shi4 wo3 wei2 ha1luo2 tou1 lai2 de5。ta1 zhi1qian2 de5 zhu3ren2……en1，yi3jing1 bu4 xu1yao4 ta1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 ji4de5 dang1shi2 ha1luo2 zi4hao2 de5 yang4zi5，yi3ji2 wo3 zi4ji3 bei4 shen1 ai4 zhao2 de5 gan3shou4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory stares at you for a moment, naked hostility on her face. Then the razors slide back into their housings with a click.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, Marta.\n"
"\n"
"Convince me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​盯​着​你​看​了​一会儿​，​脸上​毫不​遮掩​地写​满​了​敌意​。​随后​，​她​的​利刃​咔哒​一声​滑回​鞘​中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​玛​尔塔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​就​说说看​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5，lian3 shang4 hao2bu4 zhe1yan3 de5 xie3 man3 le5 di2yi4。sui2hou4，ta1 de5 li4ren4 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1 hua2 hui2 qiao4 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ma3er3ta3。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 jiu4 shuo1 shuo1 kan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory stares at you for a moment, naked hostility on her face. Then the razors slide back into their housings with a click.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, Marta. Start talking."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​凝视着​你​片刻​，​脸上​写满​了​赤裸裸​的​敌意​。​随后​她​的​利刃​咔嗒​一声​滑回​刀鞘​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​玛​尔塔​。​你​说​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3 pian4ke4，lian3 shang4 xie3 man3 le5 chi4luo3luo3 de5 di2yi4。sui2hou4 ta1 de5 li4ren4 ka1da1 yi1sheng1 hua2 hui2 dao1qiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ma3er3ta3。ni3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory stares at you. Her face has gone white.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You can't be thinking of doing this. Not after what he did to Monika, and to Paul, and everyone else who died in the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"Not after everything we've been through together."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​凝视着​你​。​她​的​脸​变得​苍白​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不会​真的​打算​这么​做​吧​。​想想​莫妮卡​，​想想​保罗​，​还有​克洛伊​茨​集市​那么​多​死去​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​想想​我们​一起​经历​的​所有​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 lian3 bian4de5 cang1bai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 zhen1de5 da3suan4 zhe4me5 zuo4 ba1。xiang3 xiang3 Mo4ni1ka3，xiang3 xiang3 bao3luo2，hai2you3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 na4me5 duo1 si3qu4 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"xiang3 xiang3 wo3men5 yi1qi3 jing1li4 de5 suo3you3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory stares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But Harrow--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​哈罗​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ha1luo2 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory stares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But Harrow..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​哈罗​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ha1luo2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory stares into the light, frowning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The shrine room is through there, but this barrier wasn't here before. Harrow must have warded the doorway after I ran."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​凝视着​那道​光芒​，​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​神龛​室​就​在​另一侧​，​但​之前​这里​并​没有​屏障​。​哈罗​一定​是​在​我​逃跑​之后​在​门口​设下​了​结界​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 na4 dao4 guang1mang2，zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shen2kan1 shi4 jiu4 zai4 ling4 yi1 ce4，dan4 zhi1qian2 zhe4li3 bing4 mei2you3 ping2zhang4。ha1luo2 yi1ding4 shi4 zai4 wo3 tao2pao3 zhi1hou4 zai4 men2kou3 she4 xia4 le5 jie2jie4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory steps forward, an easy smile on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm in. In fact, you couldn't make me leave if you tried."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​向前走​了​几步​，​露出​轻松​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​算​我​一个​。​说实话​，​你​就算​赶​也​别​想​赶走​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 xiang4 qian2 zou3 le5 ji1 bu4，lu4chu1 qing1song1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suan4 wo3 yi1ge5。shuo1shi2hua4，ni3 jiu4suan4 gan3 ye3 bie4 xiang3 gan3zou3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory steps forward. Her expression is troubled.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm afraid that I'm out... for a while, at least."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​向前走​了​几步​，​神色​忧虑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​恐怕​要​离开​一阵子​，​至少​暂时​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 xiang4 qian2 zou3 le5 ji1 bu4，shen2se4 you1lu:4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 kong3pa4 yao4 li2kai1 yi1zhen4zi5，zhi4shao3 zan4shi2 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory steps forward. When she speaks, her voice is gentle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on, all of you. We're taking you to safety... someplace far away from here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​向前走​了​几步​，​温柔​地​开口​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​所有人​，​和​我们​一起​走​吧​。​我们​会带​你们​去​安全​处​……​离​这里​很远​的​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 xiang4 qian2 zou3 le5 ji1 bu4，wen1rou2 de5 kai1kou3 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 suo3you3ren2，he4 wo3men5 yi1qi3 zou3 ba1。wo3men5 hui4 dai4 ni3men5 qu4 an1quan2 chu3……li2 zhe4li3 hen3 yuan3 de5 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory stops short.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What's going on?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​随即​停下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 sui2ji2 ting2xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory studies the woman for a minute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look at her eyes, $(l.name). I think this is Feuerschwinge. Vauclair must've trapped her astral form in that woman."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​端详​了​一会儿​那个​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​她​的​眼睛​，​$(l.name)​。​我​想​那​是​火翼​。​沃​克莱尔​肯定​是​把​她​的​灵体​困​在​了​那个​女人​体内​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 duan1xiang2 le5 yi1hui4r5 na4ge5 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang3 na4 shi4 Huo3yi4。Wo4ke4lai2er3 ken3ding4 shi4 ba3 ta1 de5 ling2ti3 kun4 zai4 le5 na4ge5 nu:3ren2 ti3nei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory takes a closer look at the Cyberzombie's control module. A moment later, she takes a sudden half-step back.\n"
"\n"
"She turns to look at you, a disgusted look on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). Listen to me. We have to kill this thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​仔细​研究​着​赛博​僵尸​的​中控​模块​。​过​了​一会儿​，​她​突然​后退​了​半步​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​转头​看向​你​，​脸上​带​着​一副​厌恶​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​这事​你​得​听​我​的​。​我们​得​杀​了​这​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zi3xi4 yan2jiu1 zhao2 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 de5 zhong4 kong4 mo2kuai4。guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 tu1ran2 hou4tui4 le5 ban4 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zhuan3tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 yi1 fu4 yan4wu4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，zhe4 shi4 ni3 de2 ting1 wo3 de5。wo3men5 de2 sha1 le5 zhe4 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory takes a deep breath, then releases it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's go, $(l.name). We need to deal with that shrine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​深吸​一口气​，​又​缓缓​呼​出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​走​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​需要​解决​掉​那座​神龛​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 hu1 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zou3，$(l.name)。wo3men5 xu1yao4 jie3jue2 diao4 na4 zuo4 shen2kan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory takes a deep breath, then releases it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The coast is clear. We can handle the initiates... they're just a bunch of scared kids. Without Marta there to egg them on, they won't try anything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​深吸​一口气​，​又​缓缓​呼​出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​安全​了​。​我们​能​应付​那些​学徒​……​他们​不过​是​一群​被​吓坏​的​孩子​罢了​。​只要​玛​尔塔​不​在场​煽风点火​，​他们​掀不起​什么​风浪​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 hu1 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 an1quan2 le5。wo3men5 neng2 ying4fu5 na4xie1 xue2tu2……ta1men5 bu4guo4 shi4 yi1 qun2 bei4 xia4huai4 de5 hai2zi5 ba4le5。zhi3yao4 Ma3er3ta3 bu4 zai4chang3 shan1feng1dian3huo3，ta1men5 xian1 bu4 qi3 shen2me5 feng1lang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory takes a deep breath. Releases it. Finally, she gives you a slow nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't want to admit it to myself... but I agree with you.\n"
"\n"
"I want to save these kids. I do. But even if we do, they'll come out of this damaged, like I am."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​深吸​一口气​，​又​缓缓​吐​出​。​最后​，​她​慢慢​对​你​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​承认​……​但​我​同意​你​的​看法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想要​拯救​这些​孩子​。​真的​。​但​即使​我们​成功​了​，​他们​受过​的​创伤​也​不会​消失​，​就​像​我​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。zui4hou4，ta1 man4man4 dui4 ni3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 cheng2ren4……dan4 wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 kan4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3yao4 zheng3jiu4 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5。zhen1de5。dan4 ji2shi3 wo3men5 cheng2gong1 le5，ta1men5 shou4guo4 de5 chuang1shang1 ye3 bu4hui4 xiao1shi1，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory takes a deep breath. Releases it. Finally, she gives you a slow nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't want to admit it to myself... but I agree with you.\n"
"\n"
"I'm here to make amends for my misdeeds. I can't do that by committing another."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​深吸​一口气​，​又​缓缓​吐​出​。​最后​，​她​慢慢​对​你​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​承认​……​但​我​同意​你​的​看法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我来​这里​是​为了​弥补​我​从前​的​过错​。​我​不能​为了​赎罪​而​再犯​下新错​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。zui4hou4，ta1 man4man4 dui4 ni3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 cheng2ren4……dan4 wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 kan4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 wei4le5 mi2bu3 wo3 cong2qian2 de5 guo4cuo4。wo3 bu4neng2 wei4le5 shu2zui4 er2 zai4fan4 xia4 xin1 cuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory takes a step toward the giant creature.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Listen to me, Spirit. I need your help."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​向​巨型​生物​迈出​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​我​说​，​精魂​。​我​需要​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 xiang4 ju4xing2 sheng1wu4 mai4chu1 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 wo3 shuo1，jing1hun2。wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory takes you by the shoulders and pulls you close. Your entire body trembles in agony.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I told you not to touch that. The door is warded.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Next time, you should listen to me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​抓住​你​的​双肩​，​一把​将​你​拉​回​她​身边​。​你​的​全身​都​在​痛苦​中​剧烈​颤抖​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​都​说​让​你​别碰​了​。​门上​有​防护​结界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​下次​你​最好​还是​听​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zhua1zhu4 ni3 de5 shuang1 jian1，yi1 ba3 jiang1 ni3 la1 hui2 ta1 shen1bian1。ni3 de5 quan2shen1 dou1 zai4 tong4ku3 zhong4 ju4lie4 chan4dou3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dou1 shuo1 rang4 ni3 bie4 peng4 le5。men2 shang4 you3 fang2hu4 jie2jie4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xia4ci4 ni3 zui4hao3 hai2shi5 ting1 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory turns to face you, her movements smooth and robotic. Her voice comes out in a frosty monotone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What’s the play, $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​转向​你​，​动作​流畅​而​机械​。​她​开口​时​的​声音​冷若冰霜​，​毫无​起伏​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​接下来​怎么办​，​$(l.name)​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，dong4zuo4 liu2chang4 er2 ji1xie4。ta1 kai1kou3 shi2 de5 sheng1yin1 leng3ruo4bing1shuang1，hao2wu2 qi3fu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jie1xia4lai2 zen3me5ban4，$(l.name)？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory turns to you, a conflicted expression on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure that you want to do this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​转向​你​，​脸上​带​着​矛盾​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​确定​要​这样​做​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 mao2dun4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 yao4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory turns to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's nothing more for us here, $(l.name). Let's get back home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​我们​回家吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。wo3men5 hui2 jia1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory whispers under her breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, no.\n"
"\n"
"What have we *done?*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​喃喃自语​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​不​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​做​了​*​什么​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 nan2nan2zi4yu3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2 bu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zuo4 le5*shen2me5*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory's expression remains distant, but her lips curl upward into a hint of a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). Need something?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​的​表情​依然​冷漠​，​但​嘴角​微微​上扬​，​浮现​出​一丝​笑意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​需要​帮忙​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 biao3qing2 yi1ran2 leng3mo4，dan4 zui3jiao3 wei1wei1 shang4yang2，fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 si1 xiao4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，xu1yao4 bang1mang2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory's expression remains neutral, but she grants you a barely "
"perceptible nod.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​的​表情​依旧​淡漠​，​但​她​朝​你​微​不可​查​地点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 de5 biao3qing2 yi1jiu4 dan4mo4，dan4 ta1 chao2 ni3 wei1 bu4ke3 cha2 di4dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Glory's expression remains neutral.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Really?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​仍然​面​无表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真的​吗​？\n"
