msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格林​·​温特斯​的​脸​再次出现​在​屏幕​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​是​时候​换个​新​方法​了​。​阿德里安​这边​完全​是​个​死胡同​……​这​一点​现在​已经​很​清楚​了​。​所以​我要​改为​挖掘​火翼​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看看​会​有​什么​进展​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 de5 lian3 zai4 ci4 chu1 xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，shi4 shi2hou5 huan4 ge4 xin1 fang1fa3 le5。E1de2li3an1 zhe4bian1 wan2quan2 shi4 ge4 si3hu2tong4……zhe4 yi1dian3 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 hen3 qing1chu5 le5。suo3yi3 wo3 yao4 gai3wei2 wa1jue2 Huo3yi4 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"kan4kan5 hui4 you3 shen2me5 jin4zhan3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Grinder shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Didn't, particularly. But I found myself a new second-in-command who didn't like Hasenkamp much.\n"
"\n"
"His name is Plotz, and he runs this building. Your pal Blitz is gonna meet him any second, by the way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​“​绞肉机​”​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​其实​我​没​这么​想​。​不过​我​的​新​副手​不怎么​喜欢​哈森​坎普​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​叫​普​洛茨​。​这栋​楼​就是​他​名下​的​。​你​那个​朋友​布里​茨​应该​马上​就​能​见到​他​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}“jiao3rou4ji1” song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qi2shi2 wo3 mei2 zhe4me5 xiang3。bu4guo4 wo3 de5 xin1 fu4shou3 bu4zen3me5 xi3huan5 Ha1sen1kan3pu3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiao4 Pu3luo4ci2。zhe4 dong4 lou2 jiu4shi4 ta1 ming2xia4 de5。ni3 na4ge5 peng2you5 Bu4li3ci2 ying1gai1 ma3shang4 jiu4 neng2 jian4dao4 ta1 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Ground floor: Club.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​地面​层​：​夜店​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} di4mian4 ceng2：ye4dian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Hand Amsel the DVD Player.{{/GM}} I have, it's right here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​把​DVD​播放器​交给​阿姆​泽尔​。​{{/GM}}​拿到​了​，​给​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} ba3 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4 jiao1gei3 E1mu3ze2er3。{{/GM}} na2dao4 le5，gei3 ni3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Hand back the grenade.{{/GM}} Sounds nasty."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​将​手雷​递回去​。​{{/GM}}​听​起来​够​狠​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} jiang1 shou3lei2 di4 hui2 qu4。{{/GM}} ting1 qi3lai5 gou4 hen3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hand back the money.{{/GM}} All right, easy there. Can we talk about "
"this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​还​钱​。​{{/GM}}​好好​好​，​别​冲动​。​我们​能​谈谈​吗​？\n"
"{{GM}} hai2 qian2。{{/GM}} hao3hao3 hao3，bie4 chong1dong4。wo3men5 neng2 tan2tan2 ma5？"

msgid "{{GM}}Hand her belongings over.{{/GM}} Here you go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​把​东西​给​她​。​{{/GM}}​给​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} ba3 dong1xi1 gei3 ta1。{{/GM}} gei3 ni3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Hand him the Jolt.{{/GM}} Here you go, man. It's all yours."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​把​“​嗨​翻天​”​给​他​。​{{/GM}}​拿​着​吧​，​都​归​你​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} ba3“hai1 fan1 tian1” gei3 ta1。{{/GM}} na2 zhao2 ba1，dou1 gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hand him the beer.{{/GM}} Yeah, brought this up for you. Keep up the "
"good work, buddy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​把​啤酒​递给​他​。​{{/GM}}​嗯​，​我​带来​给​你​的​。​继续​努力​，​伙计​。\n"
"{{GM}} ba3 pi2jiu3 di4gei3 ta1。{{/GM}} en1，wo3 dai4lai2 gei3 ni3 de5。ji4xu4 nu3li4，huo3ji5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hand over the Encrypted PDA.{{/GM}} One of the attackers dropped this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​交出​加密​PDA​。​{{/GM}}​这是​其中​一个​袭击者​掉落​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} jiao1chu1 jia1mi4 PDA。{{/GM}} zhe4 shi4 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 xi2ji1zhe3 diao4luo4 de5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Hand over the Encrypted PDA.{{/GM}} One of them dropped this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​交出​加密​PDA​。​{{/GM}}​这是​其中​一人​掉落​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} jiao1chu1 jia1mi4 PDA。{{/GM}} zhe4 shi4 qi2zhong1 yi1 ren2 diao4luo4 de5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Hand over the discs.{{/GM}} Of course."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​交出​碟片​。​{{/GM}}​当然​。\n"
"{{GM}} jiao1chu1 die2pian4。{{/GM}} dang1ran2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Hang up the receiver.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​挂​起​听筒​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} gua4 qi3 ting1tong3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Explain."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​解释一下​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jie3 shi4 yi1 xia4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp hands the box to the troll. He turns back to glance at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Like I said. Nothing personal."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​把​盒子​交给​了​巨魔​。​他​转过身​来看​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说​了​。​别往​心里​去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 ba3 he2zi5 jiao1gei3 le5 ju4mo2。ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5。bie4 wang3 xin1li5 qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp ignores him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just wait here for a minute. I'll be right back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​没理​他​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这里​等​一下​。​我​去​去​就​回​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 mei2 li3 ta1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4li3 deng3 yi1xia4。wo3 qu4 qu4 jiu4 hui2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp nods. His expression is deadpan.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mr. Grinder sent me to ensure that the money transfer goes according to plan. When you enter the building, I'm going in with you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​点点头​。​他​脸上​没有​任何​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​绞肉机​”​先生​派​我​来​是​为了​确保​转账​一切顺利​。​你​进去​的​时候​，​我会​和​你​一起​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 dian3 dian3 tou2。ta1 lian3 shang4 mei2you3 ren4he2 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 pai4 wo3 lai2 shi4 wei4le5 que4bao3 zhuan3zhang4 yi1 qie1 shun4 li4。ni3 jin4qu4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 hui4 he4 ni3 yi1qi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Huh. This desk is actually... organized. Must belong to somebody in Management."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呵​。​这张​桌子​还​挺​……​整洁​。​肯定​是​管理处​的​某个​人​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he1。zhe4 zhang1 zhuo1zi5 hai2 ting3……zheng3jie2。ken3ding4 shi4 guan3 li3 chu3 de5 mou3 ge4 ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp rubs his temples with his free hand; the other cradles the plastic box like a piece of fine china.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I knew that something like this was going to happen. When Mr. Grinder told me who I'd be checking up on, I just knew it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​空闲​的​手​揉​着​太阳穴​；​另一只​手捧着​塑料盒​，​仿佛​捧​着​一件​精美​的​瓷器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​知道​会​发生​这种​事​。​当​“​绞肉机​”​先生​告诉​我​需要​调查​的​对象​时​，​我​就​预感​到​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 kong4xian2 de5 shou3 rou2 zhao2 tai4yang2xue2 ； ling4 yi1 zhi3 shou3 peng3 zhao2 su4 liao4 he2，fang3fu2 peng3 zhao2 yi1 jian4 jing1mei3 de5 ci2qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 hui4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4。dang1“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 gao4su4 wo3 xu1yao4 diao4cha2 de5 dui4xiang4 shi2，wo3 jiu4 yu4gan3 dao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp sneers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Says the man who ratted out his own gang.\n"
"\n"
"To hell with this. I'm leaving."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​冷笑​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​背叛​自己​帮派​的​人​还有​脸说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​拉倒​吧​。​我要​走​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 leng3xiao4 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bei4pan4 zi4ji3 bang1pai4 de5 ren2 hai2you3 lian3 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"la1dao3 ba1。wo3 yao4 zou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp steps forward.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mr. Grinder. I have the box."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​向前​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​绞肉机​”​先生​。​我​拿到​盒子​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 xiang4qian2 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5。wo3 na2dao4 he2zi5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp stops. Looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But $(l.he) wouldn't do that, would $(l.he)?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​停下​脚步​，​死死​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​$(l.he)​不会​这么​做​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 ting2xia4 jiao3bu4，si3si3 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 $(l.he) bu4hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp's eyes widen, and he drops into a crouch. He pulls his pistol from its holster in a single, fluid motion.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Great. Now I've got to kill you *and* Grinder. What a god damned waste of time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​的​眼睛​瞪​得​老大​，​随即​蹲下​身子​，​以​一气呵成​的​动作​从​枪套​中​拔出​手枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​。​现在​我​只能​把​你​和​“​绞肉机​”​一起​干掉​了​。​真是​浪费​我​的​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 yan3jing5 deng4 de2 lao3da4，sui2ji2 dun1xia4 shen1zi5，yi3 yi1qi4he1cheng2 de5 dong4zuo4 cong2 qiang1 tao4 zhong4 ba2 chu1 shou3qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。xian4zai4 wo3 zhi3neng2 ba3 ni3 he4“jiao3rou4ji1” yi1qi3 gan4diao4 le5。zhen1shi5 lang4fei4 wo3 de5 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp's eyes widen, and he drops into a crouch. He pulls his pistol from its holster in a single, fluid motion.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You should've listened to me, $(l.name). It would've been quick and clean. Two shots to the back of the head and done.\n"
"\n"
"Now we're gonna have to get messy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​的​眼睛​瞪​得​老大​，​随即​蹲下​身子​，​以​一气呵成​的​动作​从​枪套​中​拔出​手枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​本该​听​我​的话​，​$(l.name)​。​这样​过程​可以​干脆利落​，​只​需​在​你​的​后脑​开​两个​枪眼​儿​就​完事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​场面​就​只能​很​难看​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 yan3jing5 deng4 de2 lao3da4，sui2ji2 dun1xia4 shen1zi5，yi3 yi1qi4he1cheng2 de5 dong4zuo4 cong2 qiang1 tao4 zhong4 ba2 chu1 shou3qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ben3 gai1 ting1 wo3 de5hua4，$(l.name)。zhe4yang4 guo4cheng2 ke3yi3 gan1cui4li4luo5，zhi3 xu1 zai4 ni3 de5 hou4nao3 kai1 liang3 ge4 qiang1yan3 er2 jiu4 wan2shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 chang3mian4 jiu4 zhi3neng2 hen3 nan2kan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp's face has gone ashen. He nods dumbly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, there is."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​面如死灰​。​他​呆板​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​是​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 mian4 ru2 si3 hui1。ta1 dai1ban3 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1。shi4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Hasenkamp's lip curls into a wry grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mr. Grinder doesn't have to explain himself to you. You're in his pocket, remember? If you want back out of it, you'll do what he says."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​哈森​坎普​的​嘴角​抿​成​一个​讥讽​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​绞肉机​”​先生​无需​向​你​解释​。​你​现在​还​任由​他​宰割​，​记得​吗​？​若想​抽身​而出​，​就​得​听​他​的话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ha1sen1kan3pu3 de5 zui3jiao3 min3 cheng2 yi1ge5 ji1feng3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 wu2xu1 xiang4 ni3 jie3shi4。ni3 xian4zai4 hai2 ren4you2 ta1 zai3ge1，ji4de5 ma5？ruo4 xiang3 chou1shen1 er2 chu1，jiu4 de2 ting1 ta1 de5hua4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Have Blitz disable the MKVI's control circuits.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​布里​茨​关停​MKVI​的​控制电路​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 Bu4li3ci2 guan1ting2 MKVI de5 kong4 zhi4 dian4 lu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have Blitz disengage the building's quarantine protocols.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​布里​茨​解除​建筑物​的​隔离​协议​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 Bu4li3ci2 jie3chu2 jian4zhu4wu4 de5 ge2li2 xie2yi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have Blitz take a look at the panel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​布里​茨​查看​控制板​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 Bu4li3ci2 cha2kan4 kong4 zhi4 ban3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have Glory disable the MKVI's control circuits.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​格洛丽​关停​MKVI​的​控制电路​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 Ge2luo4li2 guan1ting2 MKVI de5 kong4 zhi4 dian4 lu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have Glory examine the Cyberzombie's augmentations.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​格洛丽​检查​赛博​僵尸​的​殖装​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 Ge2luo4li2 jian3cha2 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 de5 zhi2 zhuang1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have your decker bypass the lock and open the door.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客​绕过​锁​打开门​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 rao4guo4 suo3 da3 kai1 men2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have your decker crack the password.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客​破解​密码​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 po4jie3 mi4ma3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have your decker forge a Level 5 Authorization.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客​伪造​一份​等级​5​权限​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 wei3zao4 yi1 fen4 deng3ji2 5 quan2xian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have your decker hack the terminal and scan its contents.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客骇入​终端​并​扫描​其​内容​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 hai4 ru4 zhong1duan1 bing4 sao3miao2 qi2 nei4rong2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Have your decker override the controls for the loading dock "
"door.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客​超控​装卸区​大门​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 chao1 kong4 zhuang1 xie4 qu1 da4men2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have your decker take a look at the panel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​队里​的​碟​客​查看​控制板​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 dui4 li3 de5 die2 ke4 cha2kan4 kong4 zhi4 ban3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Have your rigger power up the turret and set it to attack your "
"enemies.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​你​的​机师​启动​炮塔​，​使​其​攻击​你​的​敌人​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 ni3 de5 ji1shi1 qi3dong4 pao4ta3，shi3 qi2 gong1ji1 ni3 de5 di2ren2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Have your team dress up in the uniforms.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​你​的​队伍​穿​上​制服​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 ni3 de5 dui4wu3 chuan1 shang4 zhi4fu2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Have your teammate examine the terminal to see if the parts can be "
"replaced.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​你​的​队友​检查​终端​，​看看​是否​可以​替换​部件​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 ni3 de5 dui4you3 jian3cha2 zhong1duan1，kan4kan5 shi4fou3 ke3yi3 ti4huan4 bu4jian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He appears to look through you. Past you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When a dragon falls, the sound resonates across time and space."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​目光​仿佛​穿透​了​你​，​看​向​遥远​的​彼方​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一条​巨龙​陨落​之​时​，​那​声音​会​在​整个​时​空中​回荡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mu4guang1 fang3fu2 chuan1tou4 le5 ni3，kan4 xiang4 yao2yuan3 de5 bi3 fang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yun3luo4 zhi1 shi2，na4 sheng1yin1 hui4 zai4 zheng3ge4 shi2 kong1zhong1 hui2dang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks at you through red-rimmed eyes, and an expression of pure hate twists his weathered features. His voice goes cold.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh no, shadowrunner. You will *not* use my brother's death as tool against me.\n"
"\n"
"You've cast your lot with that... *thing.* You set it loose to kill with impunity. You are a moral leper, and I am finished with you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​用​布满​血丝​的​眼睛​盯​着​你​，​布满​皱纹​的​脸上​扭曲​着​纯粹​的​仇恨​。​他​的​声音​变得​冰冷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​不​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​我​*​不准​*​你​利用​我​弟弟​的​死​来​针对​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​选择​与​那个​……​*​东西​*​为伍​。​你​放任​它​肆意​杀戮​。​你​是​个​践踏​道德​的​败类​，​我​与​你​无话可说​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 bu4man3 xue4si1 de5 yan3jing5 ding1 zhao2 ni3，bu4man3 zhou4wen2 de5 lian3 shang4 niu3qu1 zhao2 chun2cui4 de5 chou2hen4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 bing1leng3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2 bu4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。wo3*bu4zhun3*ni3 li4yong4 wo3 di4di5 de5 si3 lai2 zhen1dui4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 xuan3ze2 yu4 na4ge5……*dong1xi1*wei2wu3。ni3 fang4ren4 ta1 si4yi4 sha1lu4。ni3 shi4 ge4 jian4ta4 dao4de2 de5 bai4lei4，wo3 yu4 ni3 wu2hua4ke3shuo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks confusedly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You want more?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​疑惑​地​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想​听​更​多​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi2huo4 de5 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 ting1 geng1 duo1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks up at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It would, wouldn't it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眨​着​眼睛​望​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​这样​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 zhao2 yan3jing5 wang4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno, $(l.name)... I really *did* look everywhere, and at great personal cost..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眨​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​，​$(l.name)​……​我​*​确实​*​找过​了​所有​地方​，​而且​付出​了​极大​的​代价​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4，$(l.name)……wo3*que4shi2*zhao3 guo4 le5 suo3you3 di4fang1，er2qie3 fu4chu1 le5 ji2da4 de5 dai4jia4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that you have that right."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​你​有​这个​权利​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ni3 you3 zhe4ge5 quan2li4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mine? But I... I cannot leave... I can't abandon my kingdom! Not even for my heart's greatest desire!\n"
"\n"
"Responsibility is what being a Knight-King is all about!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​？​可是​我​……​我​不能​离开​……​我​不能​抛弃​我​的​王国​！​即便​是​为了​我​内心​最大​的​渴望​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​责任​才​是​成为​骑士​之王​的​真正​意义​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5？ke3shi4 wo3……wo3 bu4neng2 li2kai1……wo3 bu4neng2 pao1qi4 wo3 de5 wang2guo2！ji2bian4 shi4 wei4le5 wo3 nei4xin1 zui4 dai4 de5 ke3wang4！\n"
"\n"
"ze2ren4 cai2 shi4 cheng2wei2 qi2shi4 zhi1 wang2 de5 zhen1zheng4 yi4yi4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, of course not.\n"
"\n"
"They're private."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​是​私人​事务​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 shi4 si1ren2 shi4wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course. What do you need?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​。​你​想​聊​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。ni3 xiang3 liao2 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He blinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well. Um. Let's hear it!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眨​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​来​告诉​我​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zha3 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 lai2 gao4su4 wo3 ba1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He breaks into a broad smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Deal."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He breathes a sigh of relief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Excellent. The password is \"VOLKLINGEN.\"'"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他松​了​一口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。​密码​是​“​弗尔​克林根​”​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song1 le5 yi1kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。mi4ma3 shi4“fu2 er3 ke4 lin2 gen1”。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He brightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"An F-State activist? Why didn't you say so?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眼神​一​亮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​动荡​带​的​活动分子​？​你​怎么​不早​说​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan3shen2 yi1 liang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dong4dang4 dai4 de5 huo2 dong4 fen4 zi3？ni3 zen3me5 bu4 zao3 shuo1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He bristles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Talk this out? The hell with that, we have a job to do and he's in the way. Deal with him, and do it fast so that we can get back on track!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​顿时​怒不可遏​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​好​说​的​？​拉倒​吧​，​我们​有​任务​要​完成​，​而​他​正​挡​在​路上​。​解决​掉​他​，​动作​要​快​，​好​让​我们​能​继续前进​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dun4shi2 nu4bu4ke3e4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 hao3 shuo1 de5？la1dao3 ba1，wo3men5 you3 ren4wu5 yao4 wan2cheng2，er2 ta1 zheng1 dang3 zai4 lu4shang5。jie3jue2 diao4 ta1，dong4zuo4 yao4 kuai4，hao3 rang4 wo3men5 neng2 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He checks the monitor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Listen, I gotta go. Have fun with the test subjects while I’m gone.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grins and flips a switch on the console. You hear the hiss of doors sliding open nearby.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看​了​看​显示屏​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​得​走​了​。​祝​你​和​那些​实验​体玩​的​开心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​，​按下​控制​台上​的​开关​。​你​听到​附近​传来​门​滑开​的​嘶嘶声​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 le5 kan4 xian3shi4ping2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de2 zou3 le5。zhu4 ni3 he4 na4xie1 shi2yan4 ti3 wan2 de5 kai1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，an4xia4 kong4zhi4 tai2shang4 de5 kai1guan1。ni3 ting1dao4 fu4jin4 chuan2lai2 men2 hua2 kai1 de5 si1si1sheng1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He chuckles softly to himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Killing me will only allow me to join forever with the Communion, and you will have destroyed the only source of the information you require. Get me my parts, and you'll have your information."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​轻声​笑了笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​杀​了​我​只会​让​我​永远​与​共融​结合​，​而​你​也​会​毁掉​所​需​情报​的​唯一​来源​。​把​部件​带给​我​，​我​自然​会​把​情报​告诉​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qing1sheng1 xiao4 le5 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sha1 le5 wo3 zhi3 hui4 rang4 wo3 yong3yuan3 yu4 gong4 rong2 jie2he2，er2 ni3 ye3 hui4 hui3diao4 suo3 xu1 qing2bao4 de5 wei2yi1 lai2yuan2。ba3 bu4jian4 dai4gei3 wo3，wo3 zi4ran2 hui4 ba3 qing2bao4 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He chuckles, the cold stare evaporating.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You think a gang like us, we've only got one secret passage? There's all *kinds* of fun hidden passages down here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑​出声​来​，​冰冷​的​目光​也​不见踪影​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​觉得​像​我们​这样​的​帮派​，​会​只有​一条​密道​嘛​？​这​底下​可​有着​*​各种各样​*​的​密道​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 chu1sheng1 lai2，bing1leng3 de5 mu4guang1 ye3 bu4 jian4 zong1 ying3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 xiang4 wo3men5 zhe4yang4 de5 bang1pai4，hui4 zhi3you3 yi1 tiao2 mi4dao4 ma5？zhe4 di3xia5 ke3 you3zhe5*ge4zhong3ge4yang4*de5 mi4dao4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He chuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, chief. No more relationship talk.\n"
"\n"
"Go on, get out of here. If you need me later, you know where to find me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑了起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​头儿​。​不聊​感情​的​事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​忙​你​的​去​吧​，​有​需要​就​尽管​来​找​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5。bu4 liao2 gan3qing2 de5 shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 mang2 ni3 de5 qu4 ba1，you3 xu1yao4 jiu4 jin3guan3 lai2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He chuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I like your initiative, but no. Nothing so crude as that.\n"
"\n"
"You will meet with a team that I've arranged for you, and with their assistance, you will plant surveillance devices in his apartment."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑​出​了​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​欣赏​你​的​主动​，​但​不行​。​不能​用​这么​粗暴​的​手段​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​与​我​为​你​安排​的​小队​会合​，​在​他们​的​协助​下​，​你​将​在​他​的​公寓​内​安装​监控​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 chu1 le5 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xin1shang3 ni3 de5 zhu3dong4，dan4 bu4xing2。bu4neng2 yong4 zhe4me5 cu1bao4 de5 shou3duan4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 yu4 wo3 wei2 ni3 an1pai2 de5 xiao3 dui4 hui4he2，zai4 ta1men5 de5 xie2zhu4 xia4，ni3 jiang1 zai4 ta1 de5 gong1yu4 nei4 an1zhuang1 jian1kong4 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He chuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. I don't think so."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑​出​了​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​这么​认为​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 chu1 le5 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhe4me5 ren4wei2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He chuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. Of course they don't.\n"
"\n"
"Well, best of luck. Let me know if anything's out of order... it is my sector, after all."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑​出​了​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​确实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​那​祝你好运​。​发现​任何​异常情况​就​通知​我​……​毕竟​这​是​我​的​辖区​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 chu1 le5 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"que4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"en1，na4 zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。fa1xian4 ren4he2 yi4 chang2 qing2 kuang4 jiu4 tong1zhi1 wo3……bi4jing4 zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 xia2qu1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He chuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sutterlin BioScience wasn't \"developing\" anything.\n"
"\n"
"Well, nothing other than Billy, I guess. We \"developed\" him all too well."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑了笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​苏​特林​生物科学​并​没有​“​研发​”​任何​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​大概​除了​比利​。​我们​对​他​的​“​研发​”​实在​是​太过​成功​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 bing4 mei2you3“yan2fa1” ren4he2 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，da4gai4 chu2le5 bi3li4。wo3men5 dui4 ta1 de5“yan2fa1” shi2zai4 shi4 tai4guo4 cheng2gong1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He chuckles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, they often do. They don't do it *well,* mind you. But they do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑了起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​通常​是​这样​。​我​得​说​，​他们​的​水平​*​不​太行​*​，​但​一般​都​是​他们​来​搞​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，tong1chang2 shi4 zhe4yang4。wo3 de2 shuo1，ta1men5 de5 shui3ping2*bu4 tai4 xing2*，dan4 yi1ban1 dou1 shi4 ta1men5 lai2 gao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He claps a hand on your shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, my friend. The wait is over now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​拍拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​我​的​朋友​。​漫长​的​等待​终于​要​结束​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，wo3 de5 peng2you5。man4chang2 de5 deng3dai4 zhong1yu2 yao4 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He clasps his hands in front of him, pleading.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I must return, I must rejoin! But it's not *safe!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​双手​合十​，​恳求​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​回去​，​我​必须​重新加入​！​但是​这里​不​*​安全​*​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang1shou3 he2shi2，ken3qiu2 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 hui2qu5，wo3 bi4xu1 chong2 xin1 jia1 ru4！dan4shi4 zhe4li3 bu4*an1quan2*！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He clasps your shoulder, his eyes welling with tears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She took five rounds, $(l.name). Doctor Ezkibel tells me that she felt no pain."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​攥​住​你​的​双肩​，​眼中​饱含​泪水​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​她​挨​了​整整​五发​子弹​啊​。​埃兹​基​贝尔​医生​和​我​说​她​没有​太​受罪​就​死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zuan4 zhu4 ni3 de5 shuang1 jian1，yan3zhong1 bao3han2 lei4shui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ta1 ai1 le5 zheng3zheng3 wu3 fa1 zi3dan4 a1。Ai1ziji1bei4er3 yi1sheng1 he4 wo3 shuo1 ta1 mei2you3 tai4 shou4zui4 jiu4 si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He clears his throat, then begins to count off on his fingers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In the past several years I have established a shelter where the dispossessed can sleep, a soup kitchen to feed the hungry, and a library for the people of the Kreuzbasar to better themselves.\n"
"\n"
"It isn't much, I admit. But it's a start."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​清清​喉咙​，​然后​开始​掰​着手​指数​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​过去​的​几年​里​，​我​建立​了​一个​避难所​，​让​一无所有​的​人​可以​安睡​；​建立​了​一个​赈济​所​，​为​饥饿​的​人​提供​食物​；​还​建立​了​一个​图书馆​，​让​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​人们​可以​更好​地​学习​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​承认​这​不算什么​，​但​这​起码​是​个​开始​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qing1 qing1 hou2long2，ran2hou4 kai1shi3 bai1 zhuo2shou3 zhi3shu4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 guo4qu4 de5 ji3nian2 li3，wo3 jian4li4 le5 yi1ge5 bi4nan4suo3，rang4 yi1wu2suo3you3 de5 ren2 ke3yi3 an1 shui4 ； jian4li4 le5 yi1ge5 zhen4ji4 suo3，wei2 ji1e4 de5 ren2 ti2gong1 shi2wu4 ； hai2 jian4li4 le5 yi1ge5 tu2shu1guan3，rang4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 ren2men5 ke3yi3 geng1 hao3 de5 xue2xi2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cheng2ren4 zhe4 bu4 suan4 shen2 ma2，dan4 zhe4 qi3ma3 shi4 ge4 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He closes his eyes and takes another long drink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm looking forward to watching it die."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​闭上眼睛​，​又​猛​喝​了​一口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​正​期待​着​看​它​彻底​完蛋​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1，you4 meng3 he4 le5 yi1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng1 qi1dai4 zhao2 kan4 ta1 che4di3 wan2dan4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He closes his eyes, and a tear traces its way down the gaunt hollow of his cheek.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, Hermie... the things I've sacrificed... \n"
"\n"
"All for this...  all for Panacea.\n"
"\n"
"All for tonight."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​闭上眼睛​，​一滴​泪水​顺着​他​消瘦​的​脸颊​流下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​……​我​所​牺牲​的​一切​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切都是​为了​这个​……​为了​“​万能​药​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​今晚​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1，yi1 di1 lei4shui3 shun4zhe5 ta1 xiao1shou4 de5 lian3jia2 liu2 xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3……wo3 suo3 xi1sheng1 de5 yi1qie4……\n"
"\n"
"yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 wei4le5 zhe4ge5……wei4le5“wan4neng2 yao4”。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 jin1wan3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He closes his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That’s when I realized something bad had happened."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​闭上眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​在​那时​，​我​意识​到​出事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bi4 shang4 yan3 jing1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zai4 na4shi2，wo3 yi4shi2 dao4 chu1shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He clucks his tongue softly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Interesting."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​轻声​咋舌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有意思​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qing1sheng1 ze2she2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He clucks to himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not smart enough to keep from getting caught, mind you. And you run with the Red-Haired Disaster... that's another two strikes against you, at least."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​自言自语​地​咕哝​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​还​没​聪明​到​让​自己​不​被​抓​。​而且​你​和​红发​灾星​为伍​……​这​就​怨不得​别人​针对​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zi4yan2zi4yu3 de5 gu1nong5 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 hai2 mei2 cong1ming5 dao4 rang4 zi4ji3 bu4 bei4 zhua1。er2qie3 ni3 he4 hong2 fa1 zai1xing1 wei2wu3……zhe4 jiu4 yuan4bu5de5 bie2ren5 zhen1dui4 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He cocks his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Interesting. That's a different approach, but I like it. Hang on a second, I'll ask."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​歪​了​歪头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有意思​，​是​个​与众不同​的​法子​，​但​我​喜欢​。​稍等一下​，​我来​问问​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wai1 le5 wai1 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3yi4si5，shi4 ge4 yu3zhong4bu4tong2 de5 fa3zi5，dan4 wo3 xi3huan5。shao1 deng3 yi1 xia4，wo3 lai2 wen4 wen4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He collects himself. Continues.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't expect you to understand. Nor do I have time to explain it to you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​整理​了​一下​思绪​，​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​指望​你​能​理解​。​我​也​没​时间​给​你​解释​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zheng3li3 le5 yi1xia4 si1xu4，you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi3wang4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3。wo3 ye3 mei2 shi2jian1 gei3 ni3 jie3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He continues his rant without pausing for breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are a murderer! A monster! You will pay!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​滔滔不绝​地​抱怨​，​甚至​没​停下​喘​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​杀人犯​！​怪物​！​你​会​付出代价​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 tao1tao1bu4jue2 de5 bao4yuan4，shen4zhi4 mei2 ting2xia4 chuan3 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 sha1ren2fan4！guai4wu5！ni3 hui4 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He continues his work, filled with a feverish energy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sadly, there is not. If there were, I would gladly take it.\n"
"\n"
"For Panacea to work, Berlin must burn. A tragic sacrifice, but one made for the greater good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​着​工作​，​浑身上下​充满​了​狂热​的​能量​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​遗憾​，​并​没有​。​否则​的话​，​我会​很​愿意​接受​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​让​“​万能​药​”​起效​，​柏林​必须​被​焚毁​。​这是​必要​的​牺牲​。​都​是​为了​大局​着想​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 zhao2 gong1zuo4，hun2shen1shang4xia4 chong1man3 le5 kuang2re4 de5 neng2liang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 yi2han4，bing4 mei2you3。fou3ze2 de5hua4，wo3 hui4 hen3 yuan4yi4 jie1shou4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 rang4“wan4neng2 yao4” qi3xiao4，bo2lin2 bi4xu1 bei4 fen2hui3。zhe4 shi4 bi4yao4 de5 xi1sheng1。dou1 shi4 wei4le5 da4ju2 zhuo2xiang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He continues his work, filled with a feverish energy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"To save the world, yes. For Panacea to work, Berlin must burn. \n"
"\n"
"A sacrifice. One for the greater good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​着​工作​，​浑身上下​充满​了​狂热​的​能量​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​是​拯救​世界​。​为了​让​“​万能​药​”​起效​，​柏林​必须​被​焚毁​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​必要​的​牺牲​。​都​是​为了​大局​着想​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 zhao2 gong1zuo4，hun2shen1shang4xia4 chong1man3 le5 kuang2re4 de5 neng2liang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 shi4 zheng3jiu4 shi4jie4。wei4le5 rang4“wan4neng2 yao4” qi3xiao4，bo2lin2 bi4xu1 bei4 fen2hui3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 bi4yao4 de5 xi1sheng1。dou1 shi4 wei4le5 da4ju2 zhuo2xiang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He continues staring, bug-eyed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll... I'll do my best.\n"
"\n"
"Now, you want that part, or not?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​瞪​大​眼睛​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我会​尽力​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​还要​不要​那个​零件​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 deng4 dai4 yan3jing5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 hui4 jin4li4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hai2 yao4 bu4yao4 na4ge5 ling2jian4 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He continues to stare at you, bug-eyed and unblinking, his mouth agape.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Me? I... I have no name. I have no need of one.\n"
"\n"
"But you! You killed the Masters! It is *our* place to die, not theirs!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​目瞪口呆​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​？​我​……​我​没有​名字​。​我​不​需要​名字​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​！​你​杀​了​主​人们​！​该死​的​是​*​我们​*​，​不是​他们​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 mu4deng4kou3dai1 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3？wo3……wo3 mei2you3 ming2zi5。wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 ming2zi5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3！ni3 sha1 le5 zhu3 ren2men5！gai1si3 de5 shi4*wo3men5*，bu4shi4 ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He continues to stare at you, bug-eyed and unblinking, his mouth agape.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Me? Out? How could I go out? It is my place to be in this cage."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​目瞪口呆​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​？​出去​？​我​怎么​可能​出去​？​待​在​这​牢笼​里​才​是​我​的​归宿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 mu4deng4kou3dai1 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3？chu1qu4？wo3 zen3me5 ke3neng2 chu1qu4？dai1 zai4 zhe4 lao2long2 li3 cai2 shi4 wo3 de5 gui1su4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He continues to stare at you, bug-eyed and unblinking, his mouth agape.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Me? Out? How could I go out? It is my place to be in this cage... it is what we were bred for!\n"
"\n"
"But you... you *killed* the Masters! It is *our* place to die, not theirs!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​目瞪口呆​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​？​出去​？​我​怎么​可能​出去​？​待​在​这​牢笼​里​才​是​我​的​归宿​……​这​正是​我们​被​培育​的​目的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​！​你​杀​了​主​人们​！​该死​的​是​*​我们​*​，​不是​他们​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 mu4deng4kou3dai1 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3？chu1qu4？wo3 zen3me5 ke3neng2 chu1qu4？dai1 zai4 zhe4 lao2long2 li3 cai2 shi4 wo3 de5 gui1su4……zhe4 zheng4shi4 wo3men5 bei4 pei2yu4 de5 mu4di4！\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3！ni3 sha1 le5 zhu3 ren2men5！gai1si3 de5 shi4*wo3men5*，bu4shi4 ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He continues to stare at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...And?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​然后​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ran2hou4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He coughs again, writhing in agony on the floor. Then his eyes focus again, and he speaks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Vauclair was right… the wyrms... taking over the world. But they're just the latest... latest in a long line to fuck us over.\n"
"\n"
"Corporations... politicians... dragons... all a big joke, with the rest of us... the punchline."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​再次​咳嗽​，​痛苦​地​扭动​着​身体​躺​在​地上​。​然后​他​的​眼睛​再次​聚焦​，​开口​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​沃​克莱尔​说得对​……​那些​巨龙​……​正在​接管​世界​。​但​它们​只是​这么​多​上位​者​中​……​最新​一批​来害​我们​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​企业​……​政客​……​巨龙​……​这​一切​不过​就是​个​天大​的​笑话​，​而​我们​其他人​……​就是​笑话​的​注脚​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zai4ci4 ke2sou5，tong4ku3 de5 niu3 dong4 zhao2 shen1ti3 tang3 zai4 di4shang5。ran2hou4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 zai4ci4 ju4jiao1，kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Wo4ke4lai2er3 shuo1 de2 dui4……na4xie1 ju4long2……zheng4zai4 jie1guan3 shi4jie4。dan4 ta1men5 zhi3shi4 zhe4me5 duo1 shang4wei4 zhe3 zhong4……zui4xin1 yi1 pi1 lai2 hai4 wo3men5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"qi3ye4……zheng4ke4……ju4long2……zhe4 yi1qie4 bu4guo4 jiu4shi4 ge4 tian1da4 de5 xiao4hua5，er2 wo3men5 qi2 ta1 ren2……jiu4shi4 xiao4hua5 de5 zhu4jiao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He covers his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No... no. I'm afraid it does. I loved my brother, more than you can know, but..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​捂住​双眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​……​不​。​我​不得不​如此​。​我​比​你​想象​的​更​爱​我​弟弟​，​但是​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wu3zhu4 shuang1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4……bu4。wo3 bu4de2bu4 ru2ci3。wo3 bi3 ni3 xiang3xiang4 de5 geng1 ai4 wo3 di4di5，dan4shi4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He cracks a grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Then, I give you the control chip that I pulled when we had to fall back. Slot them both back into the elevator, and it'll take you straight to the basement."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​撤退​的​时候​，​我​拔掉​了​电梯​的​控制​芯片​，​到时候​我​可以​把​它​给​你​。​你​把​两个​部件​都​装回​电梯​里​，​就​能​去​地下室​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 che4tui4 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 ba2diao4 le5 dian4ti1 de5 kong4zhi4 xin1pian4，dao4shi2hou4 wo3 ke3yi3 ba3 ta1 gei3 ni3。ni3 ba3 liang3 ge4 bu4jian4 dou1 zhuang1 hui2 dian4ti1 li3，jiu4 neng2 qu4 di4xia4shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He cracks his knuckles, and you can feel the magic swelling around him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's do this!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​捏​捏​指节​，​你​能​感受​到​他​周身​环绕着​的​魔法​波动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​动手​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nie1 nie1 zhi3jie2，ni3 neng2 gan3shou4 dao4 ta1 zhou1shen1 huan2 rao4 zhao2 de5 mo2fa3 bo1dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dong4shou3 ba1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He crosses his arms over his barrel chest and cranes his neck to look you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, we're not trying to be hardasses here. Our job is to keep the folks on *that* side of the wall *out.*\n"
"\n"
"If you really want to head out there, we're not gonna stop you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​双臂​交叉​，​抱​在​宽广​的​胸前​，​怼​着​脖子​与​你​对视​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​我们​不是​存心​刁难​你​。​我们​的​职责​就是​不让​墙​*​那边​*​的​人​*​出去​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​你​执意​要​过去​，​我们​也​不会​拦着​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1，bao4 zai4 kuan1guang3 de5 xiong1qian2，dui3 zhao2 bo2zi5 yu4 ni3 dui4shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3men5 bu4shi4 cun2xin1 diao1nan4 ni3。wo3men5 de5 zhi2ze2 jiu4shi4 bu4 rang4 qiang2*na4bian5*de5 ren2*chu1qu4*。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 zhi2yi4 yao4 guo4qu4，wo3men5 ye3 bu4hui4 lan2 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He crosses his arms over his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not bad, huh?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​双手​抱​胸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​，​还​不赖​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang1shou3 bao4 xiong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1，hai2 bu4lai4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He crosses his arms.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Fine. Search away. But Mr. Grinder is waiting for my call, and believe me: it isn't wise to keep that man waiting long."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抱​起​双臂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​随你便​。​但​“​绞肉机​”​先生​还​在​等​我​回话​。​相信​我​：​让​那位​先生​久等​绝不​是​一件​明智​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bao4 qi3 shuang1bi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，sui2 ni3 bian4。dan4“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 hai2 zai4 deng3 wo3 hui2hua4。xiang1xin4 wo3：rang4 na4 wei4 xian1sheng5 jiu3deng3 jue2bu4 shi4 yi1 jian4 ming2zhi4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He does a double take.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You have it! The keycard! My ticket back into the hallowed halls of the Executive Wing, with its expansive supply of nonperishable treats!\n"
"\n"
"Hurry, noble stranger! Use it to unlock the door, and make all of our dreams come true!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​看​了​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​找到​了​！​门禁卡​！​这张​门禁卡​是​我​回到​行政区域​的​神圣​殿堂​的​门票​，​那里​有​无穷无尽​的​非​易腐​食品​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​快点​，​高贵​的​陌生人​！​用​它​打开​大门​，​让​我们​所有​的​梦想成真​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 kan4 le5 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhao3dao4 le5！men2 jin1 ka3！zhe4 zhang1 men2 jin1 ka3 shi4 wo3 hui2dao4 xing2zheng4qu1yu4 de5 shen2sheng4 dian4tang2 de5 men2piao4，na4li5 you3 wu2qiong2wu2jin4 de5 fei1 yi4 fu3 shi2pin3！\n"
"\n"
"kuai4dian3，gao1gui4 de5 mo4sheng1ren2！yong4 ta1 da3kai1 da4men2，rang4 wo3men5 suo3you3 de5 meng4 xiang3 cheng2 zhen1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He doesn't bother glancing back at you as he stumbles toward the door. From the way that he's weaving, you'd guess that he's at least half-asleep already.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"'Night."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​晃晃悠悠​地朝门​走​去​，​甚至​没有​再​多​看​你​一眼​。​从​他​的​样子​来看​，​你​估计​他​已经​在​半梦半醒​之间​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​晚安​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huang4huang5you1you1 de5 chao2 men2 zou3 qu4，shen4zhi4 mei2you3 zai4 duo1 kan4 ni3 yi1yan3。cong2 ta1 de5 yang4zi5 lai2 kan4，ni3 gu1ji4 ta1 yi3jing1 zai4 ban4meng4ban4xing3 zhi1jian1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wan3an1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He doesn't meet your eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The... the dragons. Don't you *see?*\n"
"\n"
"The dragons... they must have been keeping these things in check! And I *killed* them!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​避开​了​你​的​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​的​事情​。​你​难道​不​明白​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​……​他们​一定​是​在​制约​着​这些​东西​！​而​我​却​*​杀​了​*​他们​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bi4kai1 le5 ni3 de5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 de5 shi4qing5。ni3 nan2dao4 bu4 ming2bai5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2……ta1men5 yi1ding4 shi4 zai4 zhi4yue1 zhao2 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1！er2 wo3 que4*sha1 le5*ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He exhales hard in exasperation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Forget about it. The job is off the table.\n"
"\n"
"So do you want something else, or are you leaving?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​很​不爽​地​深呼​一口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​那就算了​，​当​我​没​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​还​有事吗​，​还是​说​你​要​走​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hen3 bu4shuang3 de5 shen1 hu1 yi1kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
