"{{GM}}​他朝迪​特里​希​郑重其事​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可不是​嘛​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 Di2te4li3xi1 zheng4zhong4qi2shi4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He gives you a momentary scowl, then turns away.\n"
"\n"
"Without a word, he slaps the side of a Bulldog step van. A second van of the same design rumbles to life a few feet away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pile in, people. $(l.name) is right... let's get to it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​冲​你​皱​了​皱眉​，​随即​转身​离开​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​一言不发​地​转身​拍了拍​“​斗牛犬​”​货车​的​车身​。​几​英尺​外​，​另​一辆​同款​货车​也​轰然​发动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大伙儿​上车​吧​，​$(l.name)​说得对​……​我们​抓紧​行动​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2，sui2ji2 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 zhuan3shen1 pai1 le5 pai1“dou3 niu2 quan3” huo4che1 de5 che1shen1。ji1 ying1chi3 wai4，ling4 yi1 liang4 tong2kuan3 huo4che1 ye3 hong1ran2 fa1dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4huo3r5 shang4che1 ba1，$(l.name) shuo1 de2 dui4……wo3men5 zhua1jin3 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He gives you a slow nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's what we do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​慢慢​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​我们​该​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man4man4 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 gai1 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He glances at a chronometer mounted to his wrist.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It shouldn't take long now. The Doc is probably already pumping the dragon's body full of live virus."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞥​了​一眼​手腕​上​的​计时器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​应该​不用​多久​了​。​博士​大概​已经​将​活体​病毒​注入​了​巨龙​的​全身​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 ji4shi2qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ying1gai1 bu4yong4 duo1jiu3 le5。bo2shi4 da4gai4 yi3jing1 jiang1 huo2ti3 bing4du2 zhu4ru4 le5 ju4long2 de5 quan2shen1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He glances at his PDA.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good God, I could've clocked out an hour ago. Well, pleasure meeting you, $(scene.sFakeName)... and good night."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞥​了​一眼​PDA​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老天​，​原来​我​一​小时​前​就​可以​走​了​。​很​高兴​认识​你​，​$(scene.sFakeName)​……​晚安​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 PDA。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1，yuan2lai2 wo3 yi1 xiao3shi2 qian2 jiu4 ke3yi3 zou3 le5。hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，$(scene.sFakeName)……wan3an1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He glances at the chronometer on his PDA.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Time's wasting. Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞥​了​一眼​PDA​上​的​计时器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​浪费时间​了​。​我们​继续​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 PDA shang4 de5 ji4shi2qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1 le5。wo3men5 ji4xu4 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He glances down at the plastic box in his arm, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can do that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞥​了​一眼​自己​怀里​的​塑料盒​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​做到​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 zi4ji3 huai2li3 de5 su4 liao4 he2，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 zuo4dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He glances over to his fallen friend.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you, Liebchen."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他望​向​倒下​的​友人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wang4 xiang4 dao3xia4 de5 you3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He glances up at the U-Bahn map on the wall and smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ah, this is my stop. \n"
"\n"
"Auf Wiedersehen."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抬头​看​向​墙上​的​地铁​线路图​，​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​，​我​到​站​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 qiang2 shang4 de5 di4tie3 xian4 lu4 tu2，wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1，wo3 dao4 zhan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He glances up at the U-Bahn map on the wall and smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ah, this is my stop. \n"
"\n"
"Coming?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抬头​看​向​墙上​的​地铁​线路图​，​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​，​我​到​站​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一起​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 qiang2 shang4 de5 di4tie3 xian4 lu4 tu2，wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1，wo3 dao4 zhan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yi1qi3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He glares at you through the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Is there some point that you're trying to make? Or are you just trying to anger me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​通过​玻璃​怒视​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​到底​想​说​什么​？​还是​说​你​只是​为了​激怒​我​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tong1guo4 bo1li5 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 xiang3 shuo1 shen2me5？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 zhi3shi4 wei4le5 ji1nu4 wo3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grabs your wrist and pulls it toward himself, angling his head to read the screen of your PDA. A few seconds later, he looks up at you with a grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, you were right."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​一把​抓住​你​的​手腕​拽​过去​，​歪​着​脑袋​阅读​PDA​屏幕​上面​的​内容​。​几秒钟​之后​，​他​露出​笑容​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​你​没​说错​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 ba3 zhua1zhu4 ni3 de5 shou3wan4 zhuai1 guo4qu4，wai1 zhao2 nao3dai5 yue4du2 PDA ping2mu4 shang4mian4 de5 nei4rong2。ji1 miao3 zhong1 zhi1hou4，ta1 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 mei2 shuo1 cuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He greedily snatches the samples from your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It took you long enough... yes, this is *exactly* what I've been waiting for.\n"
"\n"
"Good work, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​贪婪​地​从​你​手中​一把​拿走​样本​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可​拖​了​够​久​的​……​没错​，​这​*​正是​*​我​一直​在​找​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​做得好​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1lan2 de5 cong2 ni3 shou3 zhong4 yi1 ba3 na2zou3 yang4ben3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3 tuo1 le5 gou4 jiu3 de5……mei2cuo4，zhe4*zheng4shi4*wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 zhao3 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4 de2 hao3，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He greedily snatches the samples from your hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So you do! Yes... yes, this is *exactly* what I've been waiting for.\n"
"\n"
"Good work, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​贪婪​地​从​你​手中​一把​拿走​样本​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常​好​！​没错​……​没错​，​这​*​正是​*​我​一直​在​找​的​东西​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​做得好​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1lan2 de5 cong2 ni3 shou3 zhong4 yi1 ba3 na2zou3 yang4ben3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 hao3！mei2cuo4……mei2cuo4，zhe4*zheng4shi4*wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 zhao3 de5 dong1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"zuo4 de2 hao3，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grimaces.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for reminding me.\n"
"\n"
"No offense, chief, but maybe you could talk to one of the others. I don't feel much like celebrating anymore."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​露出​苦笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​谢谢​你​的​提醒​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​头儿​，​别见怪​，​你​还是​去​和​其他人​聊​吧​。​我​现在​实在​没​心情​庆祝​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 ku3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 xie4xie5 ni3 de5 ti2xing3 a1。\n"
"\n"
"tou2r5，bie4 jian4 guai4，ni3 hai2shi5 qu4 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 liao2 ba1。wo3 xian4zai4 shi2zai4 mei2 xin1qing2 qing4zhu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grinds his teeth in exasperation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Another pearl of wisdom from the shadowrunner. The Great Dragons represent an incalculable threat to our survival as a species. To spare them for fear of some unknown, nebulous danger would be absurd.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, there is *nothing* that is worse than a dragon. I am in a position to know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他气​得​咬牙切齿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​是​来自​暗影​狂奔​者​的​智慧​箴言​。​巨龙​对​我们​这个​物种​的​生存​构成​了​无法估量​的​威胁​。​为了​避免​某种​未知​且​模糊​的​危险​而​放过​他们​，​这​简直​太​荒谬​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​况且​，​没有​什么​比​巨龙​更​可怕​了​。​我​对此​深有体会​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qi4 de2 yao3ya2qie4chi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 shi4 lai2zi4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 de5 zhi4hui4 zhen1yan2。ju4long2 dui4 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 wu4zhong3 de5 sheng1cun2 gou4cheng2 le5 wu2 fa3 gu1 liang2 de5 wei1xie2。wei4le5 bi4mian3 mou3zhong3 wei4zhi1 qie3 mo2hu5 de5 wei1xian3 er2 fang4guo4 ta1men5，zhe4 jian3zhi2 tai4 huang1miu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"kuang4qie3，mei2you3 shen2me5 bi3 ju4long2 geng1 ke3pa4 le5。wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 you3 ti3 hui4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grinds his teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was MINE. But as for *what* it was... you'll never know, slag."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咬紧牙关​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​我​的​东西​。​但​至于​那​是​*​什么​*​……​你​永远​都​别​想​知道​了​，​贱人​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 wo3 de5 dong1xi1。dan4 zhi4yu2 na4 shi4*shen2me5*……ni3 yong3yuan3 dou1 bie4 xiang3 zhi1dao4 le5，jian4ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grins at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't you worry about me, boss. I've known that this was comin' for my entire life. And when it happens, I'll go down in a blaze of glory the likes of which you can't even imagine.\n"
"\n"
"That's a promise."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​朝​你​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​我​，​老大​。​我​知道​这​一天​迟早会​到来​。​等到​那​时候​，​我会​献上​一场​你​绝对​想象​不到​的​辉煌​谢幕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​的​承诺​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1 wo3，lao3da4。wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1 tian1 chi2 zao3 hui4 dao4lai2。deng3dao4 na4 shi2hou5，wo3 hui4 xian4shang4 yi1 chang2 ni3 jue2dui4 xiang3xiang4 bu4dao4 de5 hui1huang2 xie4mu4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 cheng2nuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grins conspiratorially.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Lucky him, you mean. Poor old guy had the bladder capacity of a pygmy shrew. He was in desperate need of my help.\n"
"\n"
"But on to more important things, eh? What can TRIAGE do for you today?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​阴险​地​笑了笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​应该​说算​他​走运​。​那​可怜​的​老家伙​，​他​的​膀胱​容量​跟​侏儒​鼩​鼱​差不多​。​他​急需​我​的​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​说​更​重要​的​事​吧​。​“​分诊​”​今天​能​为​你​做​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yin1xian3 de5 xiao4 le5 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ying1gai1 shuo1 suan4 ta1 zou3yun4。na4 ke3lian2 de5 lao3jia1huo5，ta1 de5 pang2guang1 rong2liang4 gen1 zhu1ru2 qu2 jing1 cha4bu5duo1。ta1 ji2xu1 wo3 de5 bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 shuo1 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 ba1。“fen4 zhen3” jin1tian1 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grins, revealing a mouth filled with jagged teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This building is under Arbeiter protection. Can't let anyone by who's packing that kind of heat... we don't want the building getting shot up, after all."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​，​露出​满口​参差不齐​的​牙齿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这栋​建筑​现在​由​工人​帮​保护​。​我们​不能​让​像​你​这样​全副武装​的​人​进入​……​毕竟​我们​可​不想​让​整栋​楼​变成​靶场​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，lu4chu1 man3kou3 cen1ci1bu4qi2 de5 ya2chi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4 xian4zai4 you2 gong1ren2 bang1 bao3hu4。wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 quan2fu4wu3zhuang1 de5 ren2 jin4ru4……bi4jing4 wo3men5 ke3 bu4xiang3 rang4 zheng3 dong4 lou2 bian4cheng2 ba3chang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But I wasn't half bad at riling up a crowd."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​很​擅长​让​观众们​燥​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 hen3 shan4chang2 rang4 guan1 zhong4 men5 zao4 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh ye of little faith! Word to the wise, chief... when Blitz is on the job, you should always expect *results.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑了起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​怎么​没​一点​信心​呢​！​听​我​一句​话​，​头儿​……​事情​交给​布里​茨​，​你​就​永远​等​着​*​好消息​*​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 mei2 yi1dian3 xin4xin1 ni2！ting1 wo3 yi1ju4 hua4，tou2r5……shi4qing5 jiao1gei3 Bu4li3ci2，ni3 jiu4 yong3yuan3 deng3 zhao2*hao3 xiao1 xi1*ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Wouldn't doubt it. I'd take a bullet for you, boss... I owe it to you. For Alexander's sake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​必须​的​。​老大​，​我​这​条命​现在​归​你​了​……​你​救​了​亚历山大​，​这​是​我​欠​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 de5。lao3da4，wo3 zhe4 tiao2 ming4 xian4zai4 gui1 ni3 le5……ni3 jiu4 le5 ya4li4shan1da4，zhe4 shi4 wo3 qian4 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grits his tar-stained teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't be petty, $(l.name). My team is smaller than it once was. I *need* Audran, just as I need you.\n"
"\n"
"I have to set things right. To save the world, once again. And I need you to help me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咬紧​焦油​染黑​的​牙齿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​这么​说话​，​$(l.name)​。​我​的​队伍​规模​比​从前​更​小​了​。​我​*​需要​*​奥​德兰​，​就​像​我​需要​你​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​让​一切​重回​正轨​。​再次​拯救​世界​。​而​我​需要​你​相助​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3 jin3 jiao1you2 ran3 hei1 de5 ya2chi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 zhe4me5 shuo1hua4，$(l.name)。wo3 de5 dui4wu3 gui1mo2 bi3 cong2qian2 geng1 xiao3 le5。wo3*xu1yao4*Ao4de2lan2，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 rang4 yi1qie4 chong2hui2 zheng4gui3。zai4ci4 zheng3jiu4 shi4jie4。er2 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 xiang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He grits his teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you insist."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咬紧牙关​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随你便​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2 ni3 bian4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He gulps in another deep, rattling breath. Calms himself. When he speaks again, his voice comes out in a wooden monotone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are quite right, though. I acted without considering all of the variables... didn't even consider that such variables could exist!\n"
"\n"
"I was *blind!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​猛地​吸​了​口​粗气​，​喉咙​咯咯​作响​。​强迫​自己​平静下来​。​当​他​再次​开口​时​，​声音​变得​僵硬​而​单调​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​你​说得对​。​我​行事​时​未曾​权衡​所有​变量​……​甚至​从未​想过​这些​变量​可能​存在​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​简直​是​*​瞎了眼​*​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 meng3de5 xi1 le5 kou3 cu1 qi4，hou2long2 ge1ge1 zuo4 xiang3。qiang3po4 zi4ji3 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 bian4de5 jiang1ying4 er2 dan1diao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 xing2shi4 shi2 wei4ceng2 quan2heng2 suo3you3 bian4liang4……shen4zhi4 cong2wei4 xiang3 guo4 zhe4xie1 bian4liang4 ke3neng2 cun2zai4！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian3zhi2 shi4*xia1 le5 yan3*！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He hands back your PDA, information intact.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is yours, $(l.name). You have heard my counsel. I will leave the rest to you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​将​你​的​PDA​递回来​。​上面​的​信息​仍然​完好无损​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​信息​属于​你​，​$(l.name)​。​你​已经​听到​了​我​的​忠告​，​剩下​的​就​由​你​自己​决定​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 ni3 de5 PDA di4 hui2 lai2。shang4mian4 de5 xin4xi1 reng2ran2 wan2hao3wu2sun3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 shu3yu2 ni3，$(l.name)。ni3 yi3jing1 ting1dao4 le5 wo3 de5 zhong1gao4，sheng4xia4 de5 jiu4 you2 ni3 zi4ji3 jue2ding4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He hands you the bottle with a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's the spirit! Drink up, and don't be bashful - I've got a crate of the stuff.\n"
"\n"
"The end is nigh, after all. Wouldn't want to reach it sober."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑​着​把​酒瓶​递给​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这才​对​嘛​！​一口​闷​好​了​，​不用​担心​—​—​我​还有​整整​一箱​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​末日​就要​来​了​。​何必​活在​清醒​的​痛苦​之中​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 zhao2 ba3 jiu3 ping2 di4gei3 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 cai2 dui4 ma5！yi1kou3 men1 hao3 le5，bu4yong4 dan1xin1——wo3 hai2you3 zheng3zheng3 yi1 xiang1 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4 mo4ri4 jiu4yao4 lai2 le5。he2bi4 huo2 zai4 qing1xing3 de5 tong4ku3 zhi1zhong1 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He hangs his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno. Maybe. I still love her, though."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​垂下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​也许​吧​。​可​我​还​爱​着​她​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chui2 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。ye3xu3 ba1。ke3 wo3 hai2 ai4 zhao2 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He hesitates before responding. When he does, his voice carries an edge of annoyance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No offense, but this is getting a little too personal, chief. My debts are none of your business."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​犹豫​了​一下​才​回答​。​当​他​开口​时​，​语气​中带​着​一丝​不耐烦​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无意​冒犯​，​但​这​是​我​的​私事​，​头儿​。​我​欠​的​债​和​你​没有​关系​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you2yu4 le5 yi1xia4 cai2 hui2da2。dang1 ta1 kai1kou3 shi2，yu3qi4 zhong4 dai4 zhao2 yi1 si1 bu4nai4fan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2yi4 mao4fan4，dan4 zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 si1shi4，tou2r5。wo3 qian4 de5 zhai4 he4 ni3 mei2you3 guan1xi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He holds his silence for a long while, struggling with himself.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, a quiet voice crawls out of him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I was a fool."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​沉默​良久​，​内心​挣扎​不已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​低沉​的​声音​从​他​喉间​缓缓​溢出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真是​个​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 liang2jiu3，nei4xin1 zheng1zha2 bu4yi3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，di1chen2 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 ta1 hou2 jian1 huan3huan3 yi4chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1shi5 ge4 sha3gua1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He holds out his hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I need to see your ID, then. You know how Omega-level clearance works.\n"
"\n"
"So hand it over. NOW."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​伸出​一只​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​得​看看​你​的​证件​。​你​也​知道​欧米茄​级​安全​许可​的​流程​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​赶紧​交​出来​。​快点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1chu1 yi1 zhi3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 de2 kan4kan5 ni3 de5 zheng4jian4。ni3 ye3 zhi1dao4 ou1 mi3 qie2 ji2 an1quan2 xu3ke3 de5 liu2cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 gan3jin3 jiao1 chu1lai2。kuai4dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He holds up his hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Save your sympathy. Dieter didn't mean drek to me... he, and the rest of the gang, were a convenient revenue stream.\n"
"\n"
"Considering what went down next, I wish I'd never met the little butterball."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​举起​一只​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不必​浪费​你​的​同情心​。​迪特尔​对​我​来说​毫无意义​……​他​和​帮派​里​的​其他人​对​我​来说​不过​是​方便​的​收入​来源​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​考虑​到​接下来​发生​的​事​，​我​真​希望​从未​遇见​过​那个​小​胖子​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ju3qi3 yi1 zhi3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4bi4 lang4fei4 ni3 de5 tong2 qing2 xin1。di2 te4 er3 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4……ta1 he4 bang1pai4 li3 de5 qi2 ta1 ren2 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 bu4guo4 shi4 fang1bian4 de5 shou1ru4 lai2yuan2。\n"
"\n"
"kao3lu:4 dao4 jie1xia4lai2 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4，wo3 zhen1 xi1wang4 cong2wei4 yu4jian4 guo4 na4ge5 xiao3 pang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He huffs at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And so I shall! Let us speak of this no longer.\n"
"\n"
"I will banish the final episode from my mind, and in so doing, heal my tortured soul."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​你​哼​了​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​这样​吧​！​我们​不要​再谈​这件​事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​将​最后​一集​从​我​的​脑海中​驱逐​，​并​以此​治愈​我​痛苦​的​灵魂​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 heng1 le5 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 zhe4yang4 ba1！wo3men5 bu4yao4 zai4 tan2 zhe4 jian4 shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jiang1 zui4hou4 yi1 ji2 cong2 wo3 de5 nao3 hai3 zhong4 qu1zhu2，bing4 yi3ci3 zhi4yu4 wo3 tong4ku3 de5 ling2hun2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He inclines his head, and the corner of his mouth curls into a bit of a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course it is. It contains the consciousness of your dead friend, Monika. I am certain that the combined wisdom of a twenty-four-year-old software engineer and a sentient security system are completely capable of guiding a Great Dragon.\n"
"\n"
"How wise you must be. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微​颔首​，​嘴角​勾起​一抹​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​。​它​包含​有​你​的​故人​莫妮卡​的​意识​。​二十四岁​软件​工程师​的​智慧​加上​刚​觉醒​的​智能​安保​系统​，​驾驭​巨龙​堪称​绰绰有余​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​太​有远见​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 han4shou3，zui3jiao3 gou1qi3 yi1 ma1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。ta1 bao1han2 you3 ni3 de5 gu4ren2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 yi4shi2。er4 shi2 si4 sui4 ruan3jian4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 zhi4hui4 jia1shang4 gang1 jue2xing3 de5 zhi4neng2 an1bao3 xi4tong3，jia4yu4 ju4long2 kan1cheng1 chuo4chuo4you3yu2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 tai4 you3 yuan3 jian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He inclines his head, and the corner of his mouth curls into a bit of a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course not. You have your own important business to consider. Who to rob, who to kill, where to get your next packet of soy-jerky. That sort of thing. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微​颔首​，​嘴角​勾起​一抹​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​当然​不在乎​，​你​要​忙​的​事情​可多​了​。​该​去​抢​谁​，​该​去​杀​谁​，​该​去​哪里找​下​一包​豆​肉干​，​太多要​忙​的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 han4shou3，zui3jiao3 gou1qi3 yi1 ma1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dang1ran2 bu4zai4hu5，ni3 yao4 mang2 de5 shi4qing5 ke3 duo1 le5。gai1 qu4 qiang3 shei2，gai1 qu4 sha1 shei2，gai1 qu4 na3 li3 zhao3 xia4 yi1 bao1 dou4 rou4gan1，tai4 duo1 yao4 mang2 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He inclines his head, and the corner of his mouth curls into a bit of a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is true. As it always has been. As is anything that metahumanity does not understand. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微​颔首​，​嘴角​勾起​一抹​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​。​泛​人类​对于​自己​不​了解​的​对象​向来如此​认为​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 han4shou3，zui3jiao3 gou1qi3 yi1 ma1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。fan4 ren2lei4 dui4yu2 zi4ji3 bu4 liao3jie3 de5 dui4xiang4 xiang4 lai2 ru2 ci3 ren4wei2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He inclines his head, and the corner of his mouth curls into a bit of a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very true. As we have seen, there is quite the difference between a caregiver and a jailer. Knowledge of dragon physiology is no substitute for knowledge of dragonkind. \n"
"\n"
"Dragons are not moths, to be pinned to a board and studied."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微​颔首​，​嘴角​勾起​一抹​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​的确如此​，​照料​与​看守​之间​存在​着​天壤之别​。​只​了解​龙​的​生理​构造​，​可​算不上​对龙族​了如指掌​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​怎么​能​像​飞蛾​一样​，​被​钉​在​板​上供​人​研究​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 han4shou3，zui3jiao3 gou1qi3 yi1 ma1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"de5 que4 ru2 ci3，zhao4liao4 yu4 kan1shou3 zhi1jian1 cun2zai4 zhao2 tian1rang3zhi1bie2。zhi3 liao3jie3 long2 de5 sheng1li3 gou4zao4，ke3 suan4 bu4 shang4 dui4 long2 zu2 liao3ru2zhi3zhang3。\n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 zen3me5 neng2 xiang4 fei1e2 yi1yang4，bei4 ding4 zai4 ban3 shang4gong4 ren2 yan2jiu1 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He inclines his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come back any time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​低下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​你​随时​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 ni3 sui2shi2 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He inclines his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come back anytime."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​低下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​你​随时​回来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 ni3 sui2shi2 hui2lai5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He is wracked again by violent coughing. Allows it to subside. Takes another long drag on his cigarette, the ash creeping closer and closer towards his mouth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have leukemia. Cancer of the blood. No doubt brought on by the radiation of the SOX. \n"
"\n"
"It was when I heard my doctor's diagnosis that I realized what I had to do. What my life’s work would be in the time I had left."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​一次​被​剧烈​的​咳嗽​折磨​得​喘​不过​气来​。​他​喘息​了​片刻​。​又​深深​吸​了​一口​烟​，​烟灰​一点点​地向​他​的​嘴唇​靠近​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​患​了​白血病​。​也​就是​血癌​。​毫无疑问​，​这是​由萨洛​卢区​的​辐射​引发​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​听到​医生​的​诊断​时​，​我​意识​到​我​必须​做​什么​。​在​我​剩下​的​时间​里​，​我​的​人生​使命​将会​是​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 yi1ci4 bei4 ju4lie4 de5 ke2sou5 zhe2mo2 de2 chuan3 bu4guo4 qi4 lai2。ta1 chuan3xi1 le5 pian4ke4。you4 shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1，yan1hui1 yi1dian3dian3 de5 xiang4 ta1 de5 zui3chun2 kao4jin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 huan4 le5 bai2xue4bing4。ye3 jiu4shi4 xue4ai2。hao2wu2yi2wen4，zhe4 shi4 you2 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 de5 fu2she4 yin3fa1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 ting1dao4 yi1sheng1 de5 zhen3duan4 shi2，wo3 yi4shi2 dao4 wo3 bi4xu1 zuo4 shen2me5。zai4 wo3 sheng4xia4 de5 shi2jian1 li3，wo3 de5 ren2sheng1 shi3ming4 jiang1hui4 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He is wracked again by violent coughing. Allows it to subside. Takes another long drag on his cigarette, the ash creeping closer and closer towards his mouth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your friend is correct. I suffer from cancer of the blood... brought on by the radiation of the SOX, no doubt. \n"
"\n"
"It was when I heard my doctor's diagnosis that I realized what I had to do. What my life’s work would be in the time that I had left."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​一次​被​剧烈​的​咳嗽​折磨​得​喘​不过​气来​。​他​喘息​了​片刻​。​又​深深​吸​了​一口​烟​，​烟灰​一点点​地向​他​的​嘴唇​靠近​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​朋友​说​得​没错​。​我​患​了​血癌​……​毫无疑问​是​由萨洛​卢区​的​辐射​引发​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​听到​医生​的​诊断​时​，​我​意识​到​我​必须​做​什么​。​在​我​剩下​的​时间​里​，​我​的​人生​使命​将会​是​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 yi1ci4 bei4 ju4lie4 de5 ke2sou5 zhe2mo2 de2 chuan3 bu4guo4 qi4 lai2。ta1 chuan3xi1 le5 pian4ke4。you4 shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1，yan1hui1 yi1dian3dian3 de5 xiang4 ta1 de5 zui3chun2 kao4jin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 peng2you5 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。wo3 huan4 le5 xue4ai2……hao2wu2yi2wen4 shi4 you2 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 de5 fu2she4 yin3fa1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 ting1dao4 yi1sheng1 de5 zhen3duan4 shi2，wo3 yi4shi2 dao4 wo3 bi4xu1 zuo4 shen2me5。zai4 wo3 sheng4xia4 de5 shi2jian1 li3，wo3 de5 ren2sheng1 shi3ming4 jiang1hui4 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He jerks his head in the direction of the doorway.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now tell your pal to work his magic. The sooner we get this done, the sooner we can get out of this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看​向​门口​的​方向​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​让​你​的​朋友​来​大显身手​吧​。​他​越​早​完事​的话​，​我们​就​能​越​早​离开​这鬼​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 men2kou3 de5 fang1xiang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 rang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 lai2 da4xian3shen1shou3 ba1。ta1 yue4 zao3 wan2shi4 de5hua4，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 yue4 zao3 li2kai1 zhe4 gui3 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He jerks his thumb at the elf standing beside him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll leave it to you to keep our pack mule in line."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他朝​身旁​的​精灵​竖起​拇指​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​靠​你​来​管好​我们​队里​的​牲口​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 shen1 pang2 de5 jing1ling2 shu4qi3 mu3zhi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kao4 ni3 lai2 guan3 hao3 wo3men5 dui4 li3 de5 sheng1kou5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He keeps his nose in his comic book.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I doubt it. \n"
"\n"
"This place is filled with interesting people just dying to meet you. So go meet 'em."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​继续​埋头​看着​漫画​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看​未必​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​有​好些​有意思​的​人​，​个个​想见​你​想​疯​了​。​你​找​他们​去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji4xu4 mai2tou2 kan4 zhao2 man4hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4 wei4bi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 you3 hao3xie1 you3yi4si5 de5 ren2，ge4ge4 xiang3jian4 ni3 xiang3 feng1 le5。ni3 zhao3 ta1men5 qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He knocks twice on the transplast window.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck with that. You're not going *anywhere,* slag."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​敲​了​两下​透塑​窗户​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝你好运​。​你​*​哪儿​*​也​去​不了​，​混蛋​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qiao1 le5 liang3xia4 tou4 su4 chuang1hu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。ni3*na3r5*ye3 qu4 bu4le5，hun2dan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He knocks twice on the transplast window.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck with that. You're not going *anywhere.* "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​敲​了​两下​透塑​窗户​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝你好运​。​你​*​哪儿​*​也​去​不了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qiao1 le5 liang3xia4 tou4 su4 chuang1hu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。ni3*na3r5*ye3 qu4 bu4le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He laughs bitterly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My investors. A consortium of economic and political interests from around the globe.\n"
"\n"
"They bankrolled the project after my own fortune was depleted."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​苦笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​投资者​。​一个​由​全球​各地​的​经济​和​政治​利益集团​组成​的​联盟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​我​自己​的​财富​耗尽​后​，​他们​为​这个​项目​提供​了​资金​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ku3xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 tou2zi1zhe3。yi1ge5 you2 quan2qiu2 ge4di4 de5 jing1ji4 he4 zheng4zhi4 li4yi4ji2tuan2 zu3cheng2 de5 lian2meng2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 cai2fu4 hao4jin4 hou4，ta1men5 wei2 zhe4ge5 xiang4mu4 ti2gong1 le5 zi1jin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He laughs softly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Then you truly *don't* know what we are doing here?\n"
"\n"
"Interesting.\n"
"\n"
"If that's the case, it must be vengeance that you are here for. Vengeance for your friends and the attack on your home. You believe I've been hunting you, and now you're bringing the fight to me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​虚弱​地笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​你​真的​*​不​*​知道​我们​在​这里​做​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​有意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​来​这里​一定​是​为了​复仇​吧​。​为了​你​死去​的​朋友​和​遇袭​的​家园​而​向​我​复仇​。​你​认为​是​我​一直​在​追杀​你​，​而​现在​你​要​来​和​我​当面​战斗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xu1ruo4 de5 xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 zhen1de5*bu4*zhi1dao4 wo3men5 zai4 zhe4li3 zuo4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"you3yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 yi1ding4 shi4 wei4le5 fu4chou2 ba1。wei4le5 ni3 si3qu4 de5 peng2you5 he4 yu4xi2 de5 jia1yuan2 er2 xiang4 wo3 fu4chou2。ni3 ren4wei2 shi4 wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 zhui1sha1 ni3，er2 xian4zai4 ni3 yao4 lai2 he4 wo3 dang1mian4 zhan4dou4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He laughs softly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are exactly right, shadowrunner. There is too much at stake. Too much at stake to not *act*."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​虚弱​地笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​的​完全​没错​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​风险​太高​了​。​正因如此​，​才​要​做出​*​行动​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xu1ruo4 de5 xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 wan2quan2 mei2cuo4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。feng1xian3 tai4 gao1 le5。zheng1 yin1 ru2 ci3，cai2 yao4 zuo4chu1*xing2dong4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He laughs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A pointless argument. Any power vacuum created through dragonkind’s extermination will be filled by metahumanity.\n"
"\n"
"Any backlash will right itself over time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​笑​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​毫无意义​的​论据​。​通过​消灭​巨龙​所​造成​的​权力​真空​，​最终​将​被​泛​人类​所​填补​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​任何​反噬​效应​都​将​在​时间​的​流逝​中​自行​消解​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4 de5 lun4ju4。tong1guo4 xiao1mie4 ju4long2 suo3 zao4cheng2 de5 quan2li4 zhen1kong1，zui4zhong1 jiang1 bei4 fan4 ren2lei4 suo3 tian2bu3。\n"
"\n"
"ren4he2 fan3shi4 xiao4ying4 dou1 jiang1 zai4 shi2jian1 de5 liu2shi4 zhong4 zi4xing2 xiao1jie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He laughs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course they were! I would be surprised they weren't! This is Berlin, after all. In the Flux, everyone spies! If you do not spy, how will you know who is in power and who will be in power next?\n"
"\n"
"If you are to stay here, efendim, you must get used to it. \"Who enters the Turkish bath, will sweat,\" as my Uncle Taydemer always says."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​大笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就​对​了​！​要是​它们​没​被​改造​的话​，​我​才​会​奇怪​呢​！​毕竟​这里​是​柏林​。​在​动荡​带​，​每个​人​都​在​从事​间谍活动​！​否则​的话​，​你​怎么​知道​谁​在​掌权​，​继任​的​又​会​是​谁​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​贵人​，​要是​你​打算​留在​这里​，​你​就​必须​习惯​这点​。​就​像​我​泰德​米尔​叔叔​经常​说​的​那样​：​“​进​了​土耳其​桑拿房​，​你​就​得​流点​汗​”​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da4xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4 dui4 le5！yao4shi5 ta1men5 mei2 bei4 gai3zao4 de5hua4，wo3 cai2 hui4 qi2guai4 ni2！bi4jing4 zhe4li3 shi4 bo2lin2。zai4 dong4dang4 dai4，mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 zai4 cong2shi4 jian4die2huo2dong4！fou3ze2 de5hua4，ni3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 shei2 zai4 zhang3quan2，ji4ren4 de5 you4 hui4 shi4 shei2？\n"
"\n"
"gui4ren2，yao4shi5 ni3 da3suan4 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3，ni3 jiu4 bi4xu1 xi2guan4 zhe4 dian3。jiu4 xiang4 wo3 tai4 de2 mi3 er3 shu1shu5 jing1chang2 shuo1 de5 na4yang4：“jin4 le5 tu3er3qi2 sang1 na2 fang2，ni3 jiu4 de2 liu2 dian3 han2”。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He leans back again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do not choose ignorance, shadowrunner; it does not become you. Nor does sarcasm.\n"
"\n"
"The Lady Feuerschwinge was fascinating because she was different."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​靠​回​座位​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​暗影​狂奔​者​，​不要​选择​无视​，​这​不​适合​你​；​同样​也​不要​讽刺​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​女士​之所以​迷人​，​正是​因为​她​与众不同​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kao4 hui2 zuo4wei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，bu4yao4 xuan3ze2 wu2shi4，zhe4 bu4 shi4he2 ni3 ； tong2yang4 ye3 bu4yao4 feng3ci4。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 nu:3shi4 zhi1suo3yi3 mi2ren2，zheng4shi4 yin1wei4 ta1 yu3zhong4bu4tong2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He leans back again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Perhaps you would be, too, if you saw the world through her eyes."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​靠​回​座位​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​你​从​她​的​眼睛​去​看​世界​，​也许​你​能​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kao4 hui2 zuo4wei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 ni3 cong2 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 qu4 kan4 shi4jie4，ye3xu3 ni3 neng2 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He leans forward and locks eyes with Eiger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There. You've got your intel. Now set me free or kill me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​向前​倾身​，​与​艾格尔​四目​相对​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​了​吧​。​你们​要​的​情报​已经​拿到​手​了​。​现在​要么​放​了​我​，​要么​杀​了​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，yu4 Ai4ge2er3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5 ba1。ni3men5 yao4 de5 qing2bao4 yi3jing1 na2dao4 shou3 le5。xian4zai4 yao4me5 fang4 le5 wo3，yao4me5 sha1 le5 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He leans forward.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You will live and die between the beats of a dragon’s heart, $(l.freund). \n"
"\n"
"What hope do you have of understanding them?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​倾身​向前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​巨龙​在​瞬息之间​就​能​决定​你​的​生死​，​$(l.freund)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​怎能​指望​理解​它们​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qing1 shen1 xiang4qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ju4long2 zai4 shun4xi1zhi1jian1 jiu4 neng2 jue2ding4 ni3 de5 sheng1si3，$(l.freund)。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3neng2 zhi3wang4 li3jie3 ta1men5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He leans toward you and lowers his voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"By the way, friend... you don't want to plug in with those Communion drones.\n"
"\n"
"I've seen it too many times. People jack into the Hub, and when they come back out, they're... different.\n"
"\n"
"It's creepy, and it's wrong."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​靠近​你​，​压低​声音​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​顺便​说​一句​，​朋友​……​你​最好​不要​接入​那些​共​融会​无人机​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我见​过​太​多次​了​。​人们​接入​那个​中枢​之后​，​再​回来​的​时候​……​就​变得​不​一样​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​太​诡异​，​也​太​不对劲​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kao4jin4 ni3，ya1di1 sheng1yin1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shun4bian4 shuo1 yi1ju4，peng2you5……ni3 zui4hao3 bu4yao4 jie1ru4 na4xie1 gong4 rong2hui4 wu2ren2ji1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jian4 guo4 tai4 duo1ci4 le5。ren2men5 jie1ru4 na4ge5 zhong1shu1 zhi1hou4，zai4 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5……jiu4 bian4de5 bu4 yi1yang4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"tai4 gui3yi4，ye3 tai4 bu4dui4jin4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He leers at you through the security grate.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you had that kind of muscle, you should've used it to take me out from the get-go.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, well. Live and learn."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​透过​安保​格栅​猥琐​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​要​有​那个​本事​的话​，​当初​就​该​直接​干掉​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​。​吃一堑长一智​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tou4guo4 an1bao3 ge2shan1 wei3suo3 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yao4 you3 na4ge5 ben3shi4 de5hua4，dang1chu1 jiu4 gai1 zhi2jie1 gan4diao4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2。chi1 yi1 qian4 zhang3 yi1 zhi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lets out a deep sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're wrong about my organization. I keep nothing for myself... nothing.\n"
"\n"
"But I will see what I can do. I might be able to call in some favors and raise you another five hundred."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​深深​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​误会​我们​组织​了​。​我​对​自己​毫无保留​……​什么​都​没有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我会​再​尽力​试试​，​找​找​其他人​脉​，​再​筹集​个​五百​左右​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1shen1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 wu4hui4 wo3men5 zu3zhi1 le5。wo3 dui4 zi4ji3 hao2wu2bao3liu2……shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 hui4 zai4 jin4li4 shi4 shi4，zhao3 zhao3 qi2 ta1 ren2 mai4，zai4 chou2ji2 ge4 wu3 bai3 zuo3you4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lets out a heavy sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank God.\n"
"\n"
"Call downstairs and let my wife and kid know that it's safe to come up."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​长叹一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢天谢地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​跟​楼下​说​，​让​我​的​妻子​和​孩子​上来​吧​，​这里​安全​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang3 tan4 yi1 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。\n"
"\n"
"gen1 lou2xia4 shuo1，rang4 wo3 de5 qi1zi3 he4 hai2zi5 shang4lai2 ba1，zhe4li3 an1quan2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lets out a low chuckle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No loss, believe me. I hated those pricks."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​低声​笑​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一点儿​也​不​难过​。​我​讨厌​那些​蠢货​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1sheng1 xiao4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1dian3r5 ye3 bu4 nan2guo4。wo3 tao3yan4 na4xie1 chun3huo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lets out a snort of derisive laughter.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, not really. You dense?\n"
"\n"
"This building's under Arbeiter protection. We can't just let a stranger go waltzing on in... you might shoot up the place."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​发出​一声​轻蔑​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​我​逗​你​呢​。​你​傻​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这栋​建筑​现在​由​工人​帮​保护​。​我们​可​不能​让​你​大摇大摆​地​闯进去​……​大开杀戒​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 qing1mie4 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 dou4 ni3 ni2。ni3 sha3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong4 jian4zhu4 xian4zai4 you2 gong1ren2 bang1 bao3hu4。wo3men5 ke3 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 da4yao2da4bai3 de5 chuang3 jin4 qu4……dai4 kai1 sha1 jie4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lets out a startled chuckle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What does that matter? Even if your spirit's stories are true, the *dragons* are what threaten us now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​发出​一声​惊诧​的​轻笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​又​有​什么​关系​？​就算​这​所谓​灵体​的​故事​是​真的​，​但​*​巨龙​*​才​是​我们​眼下​的​威胁​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 jing1cha4 de5 qing1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 you4 you3 shen2me5 guan1xi5？jiu4suan4 zhe4 suo3wei4 ling2ti3 de5 gu4shi4 shi4 zhen1de5，dan4*ju4long2*cai2 shi4 wo3men5 yan3xia4 de5 wei1xie2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lets out a theatrical sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well. You come highly recommended, so I suppose I'll overlook it.\n"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​夸张​地叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啧​，​既然​你​是​被​强烈推荐​来​的​，​这次​我​就​不​计较​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kua1zhang1 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ze2，ji4ran2 ni3 shi4 bei4 jiang4 lie4 tui1 jian4 lai2 de5，zhe4 ci4 wo3 jiu4 bu4 ji4jiao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He licks his lips and nods feverishly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I have a stash, here in this warehouse. A custom rifle. It's all yours if you give me what is mine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​舔​舔​嘴唇​，​狂热​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​在​这​仓库​里存​了​东西​。​一把​自制​的​步枪​。​如果​你​把​芯片​给​我​的话​，​它​就​归​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tian3 tian3 zui3chun2，kuang2re4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 zai4 zhe4 cang1ku4 li3 cun2 le5 dong1xi1。yi1 ba3 zi4zhi4 de5 bu4qiang1。ru2guo3 ni3 ba3 xin1pian4 gei3 wo3 de5hua4，ta1 jiu4 gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He licks his lips and turns his attention back to the dancer. She maintains her thousand-meter stare over his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now take your business to the bar, or take it outside."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​舔​舔​嘴唇​，​又​转​回去​看​舞娘​。​她​的​视线​依然​恍惚​地​游荡​在​他​头顶​上方​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​了​，​你​要点​东西​就​去​吧台​，​要​不​就​出去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tian3 tian3 zui3chun2，you4 zhuai3 hui2qu5 kan4 wu3niang2。ta1 de5 shi4xian4 yi1ran2 huang3hu1 de5 you2dang4 zai4 ta1 tou2ding3 shang4fang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，ni3 yao4dian3 dong1xi1 jiu4 qu4 ba1tai2，yao4 bu4 jiu4 chu1qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lights another cigarette, musing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Maybe a biological control could work? Perhaps a natural enemy could be found to fight these things... or, at the very least, to buy us some time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点燃​另​一支​烟​，​若有所思​地​沉吟​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​或许​生物防治​能​奏效​？​说不定​能​找到​天敌​来​对抗​这些​东西​……​至少​能为​我们​争取​些​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3ran2 ling4 yi1 zhi1 yan1，ruo4you3suo3si1 de5 chen2yin2 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 sheng1 wu4 fang2 zhi4 neng2 zou4xiao4？shuo1bu5ding4 neng2 zhao3dao4 tian1di2 lai2 dui4kang4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1……zhi4shao3 neng2 wei2 wo3men5 zheng1qu3 xie1 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He limps a few steps forward, then looks back at Glory.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I owe you my life, Fräulein. I owe you both."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​蹒跚​着​向前走​了​几步​，​然后​回头​看向​格洛丽​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​多谢​救命之恩​，​女士​。​这条​命算​我​欠​你们​俩​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pan2shan1 zhao2 xiang4 qian2 zou3 le5 ji1 bu4，ran2hou4 hui2tou2 kan4 xiang4 Ge2luo4li2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"duo1xie4 jiu4 ming4 zhi1 en1，nu:3shi4。zhe4 tiao2 ming4 suan4 wo3 qian4 ni3men5 lia3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He limps a few steps forward, then looks back at Marta.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I owe you my life, Fräulein. I owe you all."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​蹒跚​着​向前走​了​几步​，​然后​回头​看向玛​尔塔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​多谢​救命之恩​，​女士​。​这条​命算​我​欠​你们​所有人​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pan2shan1 zhao2 xiang4 qian2 zou3 le5 ji1 bu4，ran2hou4 hui2tou2 kan4 xiang4 Ma3er3ta3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"duo1xie4 jiu4 ming4 zhi1 en1，nu:3shi4。zhe4 tiao2 ming4 suan4 wo3 qian4 ni3men5 suo3you3ren2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks at you suspiciously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Think so. Might be staying upstairs."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​满腹狐疑​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​算是​吧​。​大概​在​楼上​待​着​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man3 fu4 hu2 yi2 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suan4shi4 ba1。da4gai4 zai4 lou2shang4 dai1 zhao2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks at you, hard, and you can see the age around his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That’s you. \n"
"\n"
"I asked you to take me on that Humanis run. It was important. It was family. \n"
"\n"
"And you didn’t."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​凝视着​你​，​眼神​锐利​，​眼角​的​岁月​痕迹​清晰可见​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就是​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当时​请求​你​带​我​参加​人类​至上​主义者​的​那次​差事​。​它​涉及​我​的​家人​，​对​我​很​重要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​你​却​置之不理​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3，yan3shen2 rui4li4，yan3jiao3 de5 sui4yue4 hen2ji4 qing1 xi1 ke3 jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4shi4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 qing3qiu2 ni3 dai4 wo3 can1jia1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 na4 ci4 cha4shi4。ta1 she4ji2 wo3 de5 jia1ren2，dui4 wo3 hen3 zhong4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ni3 que4 zhi4zhi1bu4li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks baffled.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Why would I do that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看起来​很​困惑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​为什么​要​那样​做​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 kun4huo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 na4yang4 zuo4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks confused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"How... how could it not be? I don't understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看起来​很​困惑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎​……​怎么​会​不​奇怪​呢​？​我​不​明白​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 kun4huo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3……zen3me5 hui4 bu4 qi2guai4 ni2？wo3 bu4 ming2bai5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks crestfallen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay. Yeah... okay. Just, uh... try to be quick about it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​显得​垂头丧气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那好​吧​……​只是​……​尽量​快点​好​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xian3de5 chui2tou2sang4qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1……zhi3shi4……jin3liang4 kuai4dian3 hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks down at Mira and shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry, Mira, but I can't afford to be optimistic. And to be honest, you can't, either.\n"
"\n"
"Danni needs help, whether you want to admit it or not."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​低头​看​向​米拉​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​抱歉​，​米拉​，​但​我​现在​承受​不起​盲目乐观​的​代价​。​老实​说​，​你​也​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​你​是否​想​承认​，​丹妮​现在​都​需要​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 kan4 xiang4 mi3la1，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，mi3la1，dan4 wo3 xian4zai4 cheng2shou4 bu4 qi3 mang2 mu4 le4 guan1 de5 dai4jia4。lao3shi5 shuo1，ni3 ye3 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 ni3 shi4fou3 xiang3 cheng2ren4，dan1 ni1 xian4zai4 dou1 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks irritated, then grows serious again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fine. You're from the Kreuzbasar. We stole your supplies, and now you want them back. That about right?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看起来​有些​不耐烦​，​然后​又​恢复​了​严肃​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​。​你​是从​克洛伊​茨​集市​来​的​。​我们​偷​了​你们​的​物资​，​所以​你​想​把​货​拿回去​。​是不是​这么回事​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 bu4nai4fan2，ran2hou4 you4 hui1fu4 le5 yan2su4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。ni3 shi4 cong2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 lai2 de5。wo3men5 tou1 le5 ni3men5 de5 wu4zi1，suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 ba3 huo4 na2 hui2 qu4。shi4bu5shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks relieved.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right... well, I won't keep you. But it makes me feel safer, knowing that you guys are around."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看起来​松​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​……​那​我​就​不​耽误​你们​了​。​不过​知道​你们​在​附近​，​我​心里​踏实​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 song1 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1……na4 wo3 jiu4 bu4 dan1wu5 ni3men5 le5。bu4guo4 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 zai4 fu4jin4，wo3 xin1li5 ta1shi5 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks skeptical.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're wearing the uniform, but *I've* never seen you before. Identify yourself!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看起来​很​怀疑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的确​穿着​制服​，​但​*​我​*​从来​没见​过​你​。​表明​你​的​身份​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 huai2yi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 di2que4 chuan1zhuo2 zhi4fu2，dan4*wo3*cong2lai2 mei2 jian4 guo4 ni3。biao3ming2 ni3 de5 shen1fen4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks suprised to see you, but not alarmed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, hey... I don't usually see Knight Errant personnel wandering around this part of the building. What's up?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​见到​你​时​显得​惊讶​，​但​并未​惊慌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​……​我​平时​很少​见到​游侠​骑士​在​这栋​楼​的​这​一​区域​晃悠​。​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jian4dao4 ni3 shi2 xian3de5 jing1ya4，dan4 bing4wei4 jing1huang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3……wo3 ping2shi2 hen3 shao3 jian4dao4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 zai4 zhe4 dong4 lou2 de5 zhe4 yi1 qu1yu4 huang4you5。you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks to the ceiling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is time, Hermie... let's do some good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看​向​天花板​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​时候​了​，​赫米​……​我们​来​做点​好事​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 tian1hua1ban3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 le5，he4 mi3……wo3men5 lai2 zuo4 dian3 hao3shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks up, dazed. His eyes unfocused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Panacea is my life's work. A permanent solution to an age-old problem. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抬起头来​，​神情恍惚​，​目光​有些​涣散​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​万能​药​”​是​我​毕生​的​心血​。​是​某个​陈年​旧疾​的​永久性​解决方案​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2，shen2 qing2 huang3 hu1，mu4guang1 you3xie1 huan4san4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“wan4neng2 yao4” shi4 wo3 bi4sheng1 de5 xin1xue4。shi4 mou3 ge4 chen2nian2 jiu4ji2 de5 yong3jiu3xing4 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks up, dazed. His eyes unfocused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What’s going to happen? Oh... yes... tonight.\n"
"\n"
"Tonight will be the end of the dragons.\n"
"\n"
"Not just Feuerschwinge. \n"
"\n"
"*All* dragons."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抬起头来​，​神情恍惚​，​目光​有些​涣散​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​会​发生​什么​？​哦​对​……​今晚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今晚​会​是​巨龙​时代​的​终结​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​只是​火翼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而是​*​所有​*​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2，shen2 qing2 huang3 hu1，mu4guang1 you3xie1 huan4san4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5？e2 dui4……jin1wan3。\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 hui4 shi4 ju4long2 shi2dai4 de5 zhong1jie2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi3shi4 Huo3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"er2shi4*suo3you3*ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks up, dazed. His eyes unfocused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes... yes, you know about it then. \n"
"\n"
"Panacea... is my life's work. A permanent solution to an age-old problem. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抬起头来​，​神情恍惚​，​目光​有些​涣散​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​……​你​已经​知道​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​万能​药​”​……​是​我​毕生​的​心血​。​是​某个​陈年​旧疾​的​永久性​解决方案​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2，shen2 qing2 huang3 hu1，mu4guang1 you3xie1 huan4san4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……ni3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"“wan4neng2 yao4”……shi4 wo3 bi4sheng1 de5 xin1xue4。shi4 mou3 ge4 chen2nian2 jiu4ji2 de5 yong3jiu3xing4 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks up, gives you a cursory once-over, and sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to Das Kesselhaus, now under new management. Again.\n"
"\n"
"There's no cover. Just go on in and get your fix."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抬起​头​瞟​了​你​一眼​，​然后​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​来到​“​锅炉房​”​，​这​两天​管事​的​换人​了​。​又​换​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​进门​不要​钱​。​自己​进去​爽​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2qi3 tou2 piao3 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，ran2hou4 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2 lai2dao4“Guo1lu2fang2”，zhe4 liang3 tian1 guan3 shi4 de5 huan4ren2 le5。you4 huan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jin4men2 bu4yao4 qian2。zi4ji3 jin4qu4 shuang3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He looks you over, paying special attention to your gear. Finally, he nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Tell you what. If you take care of those rogue spirits... if you clear the path for us to return home... I'll give you the password you'll need to speak with Janet."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​上下​打量​了​你​一番​，​特别​注意​了​你​的​装备​。​最终​，​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​吧​。​如果​你​能​处理​掉​那些​失控​的​精魂​……​如果​你​能​为​我们​清理​出​回家​的​路​……​我​就​把​你​找​珍妮特​需要​的​口令​告诉​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shang4xia4 da3liang5 le5 ni3 yi1 fan1，te4bie2 zhu4yi4 le5 ni3 de5 zhuang1bei4。zui4zhong1，ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 chu3li3 diao4 na4xie1 shi1kong4 de5 jing1hun2……ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 wei2 wo3men5 qing1li3 chu1 hui2jia1 de5 lu4……wo3 jiu4 ba3 ni3 zhao3 zhen1 ni1 te4 xu1yao4 de5 kou3ling4 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lowers his voice to a soft whisper. You have to lean in to hear him clearly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What you're gonna find in there is a gadget about the size of a water pistol. It has a rubberized grip and a hair trigger, and it's good for one shot."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​压低​声音​，​轻声细语​。​你​得​凑近​才能​听​清楚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​有个​大约​和​水枪​大小​相当​的​装置​，​有​橡胶​握把​和​灵敏​的​扳机​，​只能​发射​一发​子弹​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ya1di1 sheng1yin1，qing1sheng1xi4yu3。ni3 de2 cou4jin4 cai2neng2 ting1 qing1chu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 you3 ge4 da4yue1 he4 shui3qiang1 da4xiao3 xiang1dang1 de5 zhuang1zhi4，you3 xiang4jiao1 wo4 ba3 he4 ling2min3 de5 ban1ji1，zhi3neng2 fa1she4 yi1 fa1 zi3dan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lurches forward, his hands clasped in supplication.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You must help me! You must find a way to show me the final episode! I *need* it!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​猛地​向前​扑​来​，​双手​合十​祈求​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​必须​帮助​我​！​你​必须​想​办法​让​我​看到​最后​一集​！​我​*​需要​*​它​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 meng3de5 xiang4qian2 pu1 lai2，shuang1shou3 he2shi2 qi2qiu2 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 bang1zhu4 wo3！ni3 bi4xu1 xiang3 ban4fa3 rang4 wo3 kan4dao4 zui4hou4 yi1 ji2！wo3*xu1yao4*ta1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He lurches toward you with a start.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're back. Is Billy dead? Have you retrieved the long-lost Keycard E?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​猛地​向​你​冲过来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​回来​了​。​比利​死​了​吗​？​你​找到​丢失​的​门禁卡​E​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 meng3de5 xiang4 ni3 chong1 guo4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hui2lai5 le5。bi3li4 si3 le5 ma5？ni3 zhao3dao4 diu1shi1 de5 men2 jin1 ka3 E le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He makes a sweeping gesture, a look of contempt on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You see this lab? The complex you're standing in, and the plan that it was built to serve?\n"
"\n"
"I sacrificed *everything* for this. My job, my health, my family... I was prepared to sacrifice *Berlin.* To feed those people to the same fires that I spent my youth trying to extinguish."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他朝​周围​挥挥手​，​脸上​带​着​轻蔑​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看到​这个​实验室​了​吗​？​你​所处​的​这​一整片​建筑​，​以及​它​所​服务​的​计划​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​为了​这个​牺牲​了​*​一切​*​。​我​的​工作​、​我​的​健康​、​我​的​家庭​……​我​甚至​准备​牺牲​*​柏林​*​。​将​那些​人​喂给​那些​我​年轻​时​试图​扑灭​的​火焰​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 zhou1wei2 hui1 hui1 shou3，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 qing1mie4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4dao4 zhe4ge5 shi2yan4shi4 le5 ma5？ni3 suo3 chu3 de5 zhe4 yi1 zheng3 pian1 jian4zhu4，yi3ji2 ta1 suo3 fu2wu4 de5 ji4hua4？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei4le5 zhe4ge5 xi1sheng1 le5*yi1qie4*。wo3 de5 gong1zuo4、wo3 de5 jian4kang1、wo3 de5 jia1ting2……wo3 shen4zhi4 zhun3bei4 xi1sheng1*bo2lin2*。jiang1 na4xie1 ren2 wei2 gei3 na4xie1 wo3 nian2qing1 shi2 shi4tu2 pu1mie4 de5 huo3yan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He meets your eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing that should exist. But you are looking for specifics, and you will continue asking until you have them. The impetuousness of youth.\n"
"\n"
"Very well, then. I will try to provide the knowledge that you seek."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​上​你​的​视线​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​不该​存在​的​东西​。​但​你​执意​追问​细节​，​非​要​得到​答案​不可​。​年轻人​就是​这么​鲁莽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然如此​，​我会​尽量​尝试​揭示​你​所​渴求​的​真相​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 shang4 ni3 de5 shi4xian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 bu4gai1 cun2zai4 de5 dong1xi1。dan4 ni3 zhi2yi4 zhui1wen4 xi4jie2，fei1 yao4 de2dao4 da2an4 bu4ke3。nian2qing1ren2 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 lu3mang3。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 hui4 jin3liang4 chang2shi4 jie1shi4 ni3 suo3 ke3qiu2 de5 zhen1xiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He meets your eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is a special case. What you have shown me... this should not exist."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​上​你​的​视线​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这次​情况​不同​。​你​向​我​展示​的​……​是​不该​存在​的​东西​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 shang4 ni3 de5 shi4xian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ci4 qing2kuang4 bu4tong2。ni3 xiang4 wo3 zhan3shi4 de5……shi4 bu4gai1 cun2zai4 de5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He mutters, his voice growing more detached.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, yes, Hermie... Berlin is the perfect flash point. \n"
"\n"
"It wasn't supposed to happen tonight, no. But this little \"intervention\" of yours leaves us no choice. So let us see... "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​低声​念叨​着​，​声音​愈发​冷漠​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​赫米​……​柏林​正是​完美​的​导火索​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​本​不该​今晚​发生​的​。​但​你​这次​小小的​“​干预​”​让​我们​别无选择​。​那么​，​让​我们​看看​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1sheng1 nian4dao5 zhao2，sheng1yin1 yu4fa1 leng3mo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，he4 mi3……bo2lin2 zheng4shi4 wan2mei3 de5 dao3huo3suo3。\n"
"\n"
"ben3 bu4gai1 jin1wan3 fa1sheng1 de5。dan4 ni3 zhe4 ci4 xiao3 xiao3 de5“gan1yu4” rang4 wo3men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。na4me5，rang4 wo3men5 kan4kan5……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, that's right.\n"
"\n"
"And as a show of good faith, I'll tell you: your pal was right. Grinder sent me here to see that the transaction went through smoothly, yes... but he also wanted me to kill you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​表明​诚意​，​我​告诉​你​：​你​那​朋友​说得对​。​“​绞肉机​”​派​我​来​确实​是​为了​确保​交易​顺利进行​……​但​他​也​想​让​我​杀​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1。mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 biao3ming2 cheng2yi4，wo3 gao4su4 ni3：ni3 na4 peng2you5 shuo1 de2 dui4。“jiao3rou4ji1” pai4 wo3 lai2 que4shi2 shi4 wei4le5 que4bao3 jiao1yi4 shun4 li4 jin4 xing2……dan4 ta1 ye3 xiang3 rang4 wo3 sha1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods and draws his weapon.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​，​拔出​他​的​武器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不错​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，ba2 chu1 ta1 de5 wu3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods appreciatively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pragmatic. I like that. And I have to admit, $(l.name), this is a pleasant surprise.\n"
"\n"
"You shadowrunners have a reputation, you know... amateurish, headstrong, unwilling to listen to reason--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​赞许​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​务实​。​我​喜欢​这样​。​而且​我​得​承认​，​$(l.name)​，​这倒​真是​个​意外​之喜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​暗影​狂奔​者​可是​出了名​的​……​业余​、​固执​、​不​听​劝​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zan4xu3 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu4shi2。wo3 xi3huan5 zhe4yang4。er2qie3 wo3 de2 cheng2ren4，$(l.name)，zhe4 dao3 zhen1shi5 ge4 yi4wai4 zhi1 xi3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 ke3shi4 chu1 le5 ming2 de5……ye4yu2、gu4zhi2、bu4 ting1 quan4 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods appreciatively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks, chief. I knew that I could count on you.\n"
"\n"
"Now, if you'll excuse me, I've got some last-minute stuff to take care of before we get started."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​表示感谢​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢​了​，​头儿​。​我​就​知道​你​最​靠​谱​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​请​恕​我​失陪​一下​，​在​我们​出发​之前​，​我​还​有些​最后​的​准备​工作​要​处理​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2 biao3 shi4 gan3 xie4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4 le5，tou2r5。wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zui4 kao4 pu3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 qing3 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2 yi1xia4，zai4 wo3men5 chu1fa1 zhi1qian2，wo3 hai2 you3xie1 zui4hou4 de5 zhun3bei4 gong1zuo4 yao4 chu3li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Be careful out there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​路上​小心​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lu4shang5 xiao3xin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Have a good one."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take it easy, boss."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​轻松​，​老大​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fang4 qing1song1，lao3da4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are a true friend of the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​向​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​克洛伊​茨​集市​真正​的​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhen1zheng4 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"An outsider. We found him poking around the garden, so we were punishing him.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He offers you his knife.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You want to join in, *friend?* Help us to protect ourselves from the outsider?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​兴奋​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​外来者​。​我们​发现​他​在​花园里​四处​打探​，​所以​我们​要​惩罚​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​手里​的​刀​递给​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​朋友​*​，​你​想​加入​我们​吗​？​帮助​我们​抵御​外来者​的​侵害​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xing1fen4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 wai4 lai2 zhe3。wo3men5 fa1xian4 ta1 zai4 hua1 yuan2 li3 si4chu4 da3tan4，suo3yi3 wo3men5 yao4 cheng2fa2 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shou3li3 de5 dao1 di4gei3 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*peng2you5*，ni3 xiang3 jia1ru4 wo3men5 ma5？bang1zhu4 wo3men5 di3yu4 wai4 lai2 zhe3 de5 qin1hai4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, yeah, chief - it's wiz. I mean, like, *really* wiz.\n"
"\n"
"Old Plotz must've been a fair hand at programming, because this didn't come off of any store shelf. Y'know, he was pretty savvy for a dinosaur."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​急切​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​头儿​—​—​它​很​好​用​。​我​是​说真的​*​相当​*​好用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老普​洛茨​在​编程​方面​肯定​有​一手​，​因为​这​东西​可不是​能​买​到​的​。​作为​一个​老古董​而言​，​他​还​算​挺​厉害​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，tou2r5——ta1 hen3 hao3 yong4。wo3 shi4 shuo1zhen1de5*xiang1dang1*hao3yong4。\n"
"\n"
"lao3 Pu3luo4ci2 zai4 bian1cheng2 fang1mian4 ken3ding4 you3 yi1shou3，yin1wei4 zhe4 dong1xi1 ke3bu5shi4 neng2 mai3 dao4 de5。zuo4wei2 yi1ge5 lao3gu3dong3 er2yan2，ta1 hai2 suan4 ting3 li4hai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes! Too risky. Here in Berlin, no problems with the law, because there is no law. Just have to be careful.\n"
"\n"
"All for naught now, though. Our copies were good - just like the real thing - but who cares? It's all just meat in the end."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​急切​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​！​太​冒险​了​。​柏林​没有​相关​法律​规定​，​所以​没什么​问题​。​我们​只​需要​小心​行事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​现在​一切​都​白费​了​。​我们​的​仿制品​质量​很​好​，​就​像​真的​一样​，​但​谁​在乎​呢​？​到头来​，​它们​都​只是​肉​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4！tai4 mao4xian3 le5。bo2lin2 mei2you3 xiang1guan1 fa3lu:4 gui1ding4，suo3yi3 mei2shen2me5 wen4ti2。wo3men5 zhi3 xu1yao4 xiao3xin1 xing2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，xian4zai4 yi1qie4 dou1 bai2fei4 le5。wo3men5 de5 fang3zhi4pin3 zhi4liang4 hen3 hao3，jiu4 xiang4 zhen1de5 yi1yang4，dan4 shei2 zai4hu5 ni2？dao4tou2lai2，ta1men5 dou1 zhi3shi4 rou4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods enthusiasctically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This was a *fun* one. Little prick couldn't believe it when I set the autosurgeon on him.\n"
"\n"
"He kept tryin' to get away, but wherever he went, one of my arms was there. Rrrrrrrrip. Rrrrrrrrip."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​热切地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​可​*​好玩​*​了​。​那​蠢货​根本​不敢相信​，​自己​会​遭到​自动​手术​机器人​的​攻击​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​不断​试图​逃跑​，​但​无论​他​跑​到​哪儿​，​我​的​机械​臂​都​在​等​着​他​，​扯掉​胳膊​啊​腿​啥​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 re4 qie1 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 ke3*hao3wan2*le5。na4 chun3huo4 gen1ben3 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4，zi4ji3 hui4 zao1dao4 zi4dong4 shou3shu4 ji1qi4ren2 de5 gong1ji1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bu4duan4 shi4tu2 tao2pao3，dan4 wu2lun4 ta1 pao2 dao4 na3r5，wo3 de5 ji1xie4 bi4 dou1 zai4 deng3 zhao2 ta1，che3 diao4 ge1bo5 a1 tui3 sha2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods gravely.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. I'm almost certain of it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​急切​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我​非常​确定​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 fei1chang2 que4ding4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Most excellent. It is indeed fortuitous that you discovered this information, though it is not unexpected. \n"
"\n"
"I will have one of my people “attend” this council meeting and report back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​面色​冷峻​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好极了​。​你​能​发现​这​条​信息​实属​幸运​，​不过​倒​也​不出所料​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​让​我​的​手下​“​出席​”​这场​委员会​会议​，​然后​向​我​回报​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mian4se4 leng3jun4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ji2 le5。ni3 neng2 fa1xian4 zhe4 tiao2 xin4xi1 shi2shu3 xing4yun4，bu4guo4 dao3 ye3 bu4chu1suo3liao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 rang4 wo3 de5 shou3xia4“chu1xi2” zhe4 chang2 wei3yuan2hui4 hui4yi4，ran2hou4 xiang4 wo3 hui2bao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She's good, $(l.name). Better than I ever thought she was. I couldn't trace the damned thing.\n"
"\n"
"I *could* keep digging, though. I mean, if she noticed me doing it before, I must've been close."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​坚定​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​很​厉害​，​$(l.name)​。​比​我​想象​的​还要​厉害​。​我​什么​都​没有​追踪​到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​我​*​可以​*​继续​追查​。​如果说​她​注意​到​我​的话​，​说明​我​肯定​已经​十分​接近​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jian1ding4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 hen3 li4hai5，$(l.name)。bi3 wo3 xiang3xiang4 de5 hai2 yao4 li4hai5。wo3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2you3 zhui1zong1 dao4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wo3*ke3yi3*ji4xu4 zhui1cha2。ru2guo3shuo1 ta1 zhu4yi4 dao4 wo3 de5hua4，shuo1ming2 wo3 ken3ding4 yi3jing1 shi2fen1 jie1jin4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, boss. My thoughts exactly. Let's just worry about the task in front of us for now... you don't need to concern yourself about me, anyhow. I'll be fine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​严肃​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​老大​。​我​也​这么​想​。​我们​还是​先​专注​于​眼下​的​任务​……​无论如何​，​不用​担心​我​，​我​没事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan2su4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，lao3da4。wo3 ye3 zhe4me5 xiang3。wo3men5 hai2shi5 xian1 zhuan1zhu4 yu2 yan3xia4 de5 ren4wu5……wu2lun4ru2he2，bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3，wo3 mei2shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. That's right, it is.\n"
"\n"
"And when push comes to shove, he'll do the right thing, just like he did with Stahl."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​严肃​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​是​这样​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​到​了​紧要关头​，​他会​做出​正确​的​选择​，​就​像​他​当时​对​斯塔尔​那样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan2su4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，shi4 zhe4yang4 mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"dao4 le5 jin3yao4guan1tou2，ta1 hui4 zuo4chu1 zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2，jiu4 xiang4 ta1 dang1shi2 dui4 Si1ta3er3 na4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"That gunshot I heard... was that the Doc?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​听到​的​那声​枪响​……​是​博士​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2 {{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1dao4 de5 na4 sheng1 qiang1 xiang3……shi4 bo2shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods sagely.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck, pal. Do us all a favor and call out those idiots at Dispatch... not that it'll do any good.\n"
"\n"
"On second thought, don't bother saying anything. They'd just wind up getting another raise."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​若有所思​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝你好运​，​伙计​。​你​愿意​的话​，​把​调度​中心​那群​蠢货​训​一顿​……​虽然​也​没什么​用​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​算了​，​还是​别说​了​。​他们​最后​只会​再​涨​一次​工资​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ruo4you3suo3si1 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，huo3ji5。ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，ba3 diao4du4 zhong1xin1 na4 qun2 chun3huo4 xun4 yi1 dun4……sui1ran2 ye3 mei2shen2me5 yong4。\n"
"\n"
"suan4le5，hai2shi5 bie2shuo1 le5。ta1men5 zui4hou4 zhi3 hui4 zai4 zhang3 yi1ci4 gong1zi1。"

msgid "{{GM}}He nods silently.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​默默​点头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mo4mo4 dian3tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good of you to understand. Now, is there something else that you'd like to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​理解​就​好​。​好​了​，​你​还有​什么​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 li3jie3 jiu4 hao3。hao3 le5，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for saying so. Now, is there something else that you'd like to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​能​这么​说​。​好​了​，​你​还有​什么​别的​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 neng2 zhe4me5 shuo1。hao3 le5，ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods slowly, his face beaming with pride.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Maybe you're right. I am already a Knight-King; perhaps this is *your* time to shine.\n"
"\n"
"I will not rob you of this moment of glory. I will allow you your moment in the sun! And when you return victorious, I will grant you lands and titles to reward your heroism."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​缓缓​点头​，​脸上​洋溢着​自豪​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​你​是​对​的​。​我​已经​是​一位​骑士​之王​，​也许​现在​是​你​的​时刻​来​大放异彩​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​剥夺​你​这​荣耀​的​瞬间​。​我会​让​你​享受​这​属于​你​的​辉煌​！​当​你​凯旋​之​时​，​我​将​授予​你​封地​和​头衔​，​以​嘉奖​你​的​英勇​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2，lian3 shang4 yang2 yi4 zhao2 zi4hao2 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。wo3 yi3jing1 shi4 yi1 wei4 qi2shi4 zhi1 wang2，ye3xu3 xian4zai4 shi4 ni3 de5 shi2ke4 lai2 da4fang4yi4cai3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 bo1duo2 ni3 zhe4 rong2yao4 de5 shun4jian1。wo3 hui4 rang4 ni3 xiang3shou4 zhe4 shu3yu2 ni3 de5 hui1huang2！dang1 ni3 kai3xuan2 zhi1 shi2，wo3 jiang1 shou4yu3 ni3 feng1di4 he4 tou2xian2，yi3 jia1jiang3 ni3 de5 ying1yong3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods slowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fifteen, huh? I... I can match that. You let me live, and I'll pay your wage. *Plus* the inducer.\n"
"\n"
"Hell, you could even tell your client I'm dead and bill him, too. *Double* your earnings. Whaddaya think about that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​缓缓​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一万五千​对​吧​？​我​……​我​也​能​拿​得出​那么​多钱​。​你​放过​我​这​条命​，​我​就​付​你​这笔​钱​，​*​加上​*​刚才​说​的​诱发​器​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​甚至​可以​告诉​你​的​客户​说​我​死​了​，​让​他​也​给​你​打​钱​，​这样​你​的​收入​就​*​翻倍​*​了​。​你​觉得​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1 wan4 wu3 qian1 dui4 ba1？wo3……wo3 ye3 neng2 na2 de2chu1 na4me5 duo1 qian2。ni3 fang4guo4 wo3 zhe4 tiao2 ming4，wo3 jiu4 fu4 ni3 zhe4 bi3 qian2，*jia1shang4*gang1cai2 shuo1 de5 you4fa1 qi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shen4zhi4 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3 de5 ke4hu4 shuo1 wo3 si3 le5，rang4 ta1 ye3 gei3 ni3 da3 qian2，zhe4yang4 ni3 de5 shou1ru4 jiu4*fan1bei4*le5。ni3 jue2de5 zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods slowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The nether realm that lies beneath the hallowed halls of Sutterlin BioScience. A nightmarish labyrinth of dripping pipes and filthy brickwork.\n"
"\n"
"Billy rules supreme down there now. To set foot into the underworld means certain death."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​缓缓​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那片​幽冥​区域​位于​苏​特林​生物科学​的​神圣​殿堂​之下​。​一个​噩梦般​的​迷宫​，​由​滴水​的​管道​和​肮脏​的​砖墙​组成​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​比利​现在​统治​着​那里​。​踏入​冥界​意味着​必死无疑​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 pian1 you1ming2 qu1yu4 wei4yu2 su1 te4 lin2 sheng1 wu4 ke1 xue2 de5 shen2sheng4 dian4tang2 zhi1xia4。yi1ge5 e4 meng4 ban1 de5 mi2gong1，you2 di1shui3 de5 guan3dao4 he4 ang1zang1 de5 zhuan1 qiang2 zu3cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"bi3li4 xian4zai4 tong3zhi4 zhao2 na4li5。ta1 ru4 ming2jie4 yi4wei4zhe5 bi4si3wu2yi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods thoughtfully.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good to know. But the purpose of this test is to gauge your adaptability.\n"
"\n"
"We need to know that you'll be willing to do what we tell you to do, regardless of your personal feelings on the matter. And we need to know that you'll roll with the punches if circumstances change mid-run."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​若有所思​地点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​明白​了​。​但​这次​测试​的​目的​是​考察​你​的​适应能力​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​确认​，​无论​你​对​此事​有何​个人​感受​，​你​都​愿意​执行​我们​的​指令​。​同时​需要​确认​，​若​任务​中途​情况​突变​，​你​能否​随机应变​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ruo4you3suo3si1 di4dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ming2bai5 le5。dan4 zhe4 ci4 ce4shi4 de5 mu4di4 shi4 kao3cha2 ni3 de5 kuo4 ying1 neng2 li4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 que4ren4，wu2lun4 ni3 dui4 ci3shi4 you3 he2 ge4ren2 gan3shou4，ni3 dou1 yuan4yi4 zhi2xing2 wo3men5 de5 zhi3ling4。tong2shi2 xu1yao4 que4ren4，ruo4 ren4wu5 zhong1tu2 qing2kuang4 tu1bian4，ni3 neng2fou3 sui2ji1ying4bian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods vigorously, beaming.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I will, my friend! I will!\n"
"\n"
"But first, I will indulge in sugary snacks!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​用力​点头​，​笑容​灿烂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​的​，​我​的​朋友​！​我会​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​首先​，​我要​享受​甜美​的​零食​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4li4 dian3tou2，xiao4rong2 can4lan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5，wo3 de5 peng2you5！wo3 hui4 de5！\n"
"\n"
"dan4 shou3xian1，wo3 yao4 xiang3shou4 tian2mei3 de5 ling2shi2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods vigorously, patches of beard wobbling with the motion.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes! Please! Do it... do it for me!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​用力​点​了​点头​，​胡须​上​的​几块​小​胡茬​随之​晃动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​！​拜托​了​！​为了​我​……​请​你​这么​做​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4li4 dian3 le5 dian3tou2，hu2xu1 shang4 de5 ji1 kuai4 xiao3 hu2cha2 sui2zhi1 huang4dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5！bai4tuo1 le5！wei4le5 wo3……qing3 ni3 zhe4me5 zuo4 ba1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods vigorously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Listen to your friend! Seriously, I'm pretty great!\n"
"\n"
"I promise that if you let me sign on with you, you won't regret it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​拼命​点着头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听听​你​朋友​的​建议​吧​！​说真的​，​我​技术​可好​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要是​让​我​入伙​，​我​保证​你​不会​后悔​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pin1ming4 dian3 zhao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 ting1 ni3 peng2you5 de5 jian4yi4 ba1！shuo1zhen1de5，wo3 ji4shu4 ke3hao3 le5！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 rang4 wo3 ru4huo3，wo3 bao3zheng4 ni3 bu4hui4 hou4hui3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods, a contented expression on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're welcome."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​，​脸上​露出​满意​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​客气​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 man3yi4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods, a look of pure misery on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They're always summoning the damned things, but last week they lost control of a handful. Before we knew what was happening, they were running wild in our living room!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​，​脸上​满是​痛苦​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​总是​在​召唤​那些​该死​的​东西​，​但​上周​有​一些​召唤​物​失控​了​。​我们​还​来不及​反应​，​它们​就​已经​在​我们​的​客厅​里​乱窜​了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 man3 shi4 tong4ku3 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zong3shi4 zai4 zhao4huan4 na4xie1 gai1si3 de5 dong1xi1，dan4 shang4zhou1 you3 yi1xie1 zhao4huan4 wu4 shi1kong4 le5。wo3men5 hai2 lai2bu5ji2 fan3ying4，ta1men5 jiu4 yi3jing1 zai4 wo3men5 de5 ke4ting1 li3 luan4cuan4 le5！"

msgid "{{GM}}He nods, a look of satisfaction on his face.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​，​脸上​带​着​满意​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 man3yi4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods, chuckling darkly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"APEX. It's a testament to your fortitude that you've survived this long.\n"
"\n"
"That thing - that *monster* - does not forget. It has made several attempts on my own life as well."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​暗自​发笑​，​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​APEX​。​你​能​活到​今天​，​正是​你​坚韧​意志​的​证明​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​东西​—​—​那​*​怪物​*​—​—​不会​忘记​。​它​也​曾多次​试图​取​我​性命​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 an4zi4 fa1xiao4，dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"APEX。ni3 neng2 huo2 dao4 jin1tian1，zheng4shi4 ni3 jian1ren4 yi4zhi4 de5 zheng4ming2。\n"
"\n"
"na4 dong1xi1——na4*guai4wu5*——bu4hui4 wang4ji4。ta1 ye3 ceng2 duo1 ci4 shi4tu2 qu3 wo3 xing4ming4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods, chuckling darkly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, yes. Over the past few months it has made several attempts on my life.\n"
"\n"
"Thankfully, I am rather well protected down here. Living in a contained environment has its advantages."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​暗自​发笑​，​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​。​过去​几个​月​里​，​它​多次​企图​置​我​于​死地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​值得​庆幸​的​是​，​我​在​这儿​相当​安全​。​生活​在​封闭​环境​中有​其​优势​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 an4zi4 fa1xiao4，dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。guo4qu4 ji3ge5 yue4 li3，ta1 duo1ci4 qi3tu2 zhi4 wo3 yu2 si3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi2de5 qing4xing4 de5 shi4，wo3 zai4 zhe4r5 xiang1dang1 an1quan2。sheng1huo2 zai4 feng1bi4 huan2jing4 zhong4 you3 qi2 you1shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods, then fishes in his jacket pocket for his flask.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, boss. We can talk about it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​，​从​夹克​中​掏出​他​的​小​酒壶​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​，​老大​，​我们​聊聊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，cong2 jia1ke4 zhong4 tao1chu1 ta1 de5 xiao3 jiu3hu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2，lao3da4，wo3men5 liao2 liao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods, then looks to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Lead the way, $(l.name). Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​，​然后​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​带路​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​速战速决​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，ran2hou4 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dai4lu4 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 su4zhan4su4jue2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods, wide-eyed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Yes, we will run... all of us.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞪​大​眼睛​，​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​。​是​的​，​我们​会​逃跑​……​所有人​都​会​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 deng4 dai4 yan3jing5，dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。shi4 de5，wo3men5 hui4 tao2pao3……suo3you3ren2 dou1 hui4。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods. There's a dangerous glimmer in his eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Understatement of the year, $(l.name). Someone's gonna pay, and pay hard."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​，​眼中​闪过​一丝​杀气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这话​太​轻描淡写​了​，​$(l.name)​。​我要​让​做出​这事​的​人​死无全尸​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，yan3zhong1 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 sha1qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4 hua4 tai4 qing1miao2dan4xie3 le5，$(l.name)。wo3 yao4 rang4 zuo4chu1 zhe4 shi4 de5 ren2 si3 wu2 quan2 shi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"'Sokay, boss... I understand. It can't be easy tryin' to lead us through everything that's been happening.\n"
"\n"
"I'll do my best to make this quick."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没事​，​老大​……​我能​理解​。​你​领导​我们​这​一路​走来​有​多​不​容易​，​我们​都​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​尽量​长话短说​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2shi4，lao3da4……wo3 neng2 li3jie3。ni3 ling3dao3 wo3men5 zhe4 yi1lu4 zou3 lai2 you3 duo1 bu4 rong2yi4，wo3men5 dou1 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 jin3liang4 chang2hua4duan3shuo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A label that I would not apply to many people... but the leadership of Humanis are deserving of the title."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一般​不会​用​这个​词​形容​别人​……​但用​在​人类​至上​主义者​的​领导人​身上​再​合适​不过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1ban1 bu4hui4 yong4 zhe4ge5 ci2 xing2rong2 bie2ren5……dan4 yong4 zai4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 ling3dao3ren2 shen1shang5 zai4 he2shi4 bu4guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Alexander... he's a good kid, y'know? \n"
"\n"
"If I'd been there for him... if I hadn't run off to Berlin, left him with his worthless sack of a dad... he'd never have fallen in with those Humanis pigs in the first place."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​亚历山大​……​他​其实​是​个​好孩子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​当初​我能​陪​在​他​身边​……​如果​我​没有​跑​来​柏林​，​把​他​留给​他​那个​一无是处​的​老爹​……​他​也​不会​堕落​到​跟​人类​至上​主义者​那些​狗东西​混在​一起​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ya4li4shan1da4……ta1 qi2shi2 shi4 ge4 hao3 hai2 zi3。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 dang1chu1 wo3 neng2 pei2 zai4 ta1 shen1bian1……ru2guo3 wo3 mei2you3 pao2 lai2 bo2lin2，ba3 ta1 liu2gei3 ta1 na4ge5 yi1wu2shi4chu4 de5 lao3die1……ta1 ye3 bu4hui4 duo4luo4 dao4 gen1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 na4xie1 gou3dong1xi5 hun4 zai4 yi1qi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, chief. Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar and gear up.\n"
"\n"
"I guess we've got a castle to raid."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​，​头儿​。​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​做好​准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​去​攻占​一座​城堡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5，tou2r5。wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 qu4 gong1zhan4 yi1 zuo4 cheng2bao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar and gear up.\n"
"\n"
"We've got a castle to raid."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​做好​准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​去​攻占​一座​城堡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 qu4 gong1zhan4 yi1 zuo4 cheng2bao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. There is one thing you can do for us. The only thing that can make this right.\n"
"\n"
"I need you to toss the Azzies' utility logs."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​有​一件​事是​你​能​帮​我们​做​的​。​唯一​能​让​你​弥补​过错​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​需要​你​删掉​阿兹佬​的​维护​日志​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。you3 yi1 jian4 shi4 shi4 ni3 neng2 bang1 wo3men5 zuo4 de5。wei2yi1 neng2 rang4 ni3 mi2bu3 guo4cuo4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 shan1diao4 e1 zi1 lao3 de5 wei2hu4 ri4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Well. There's a bit of history between me and Humanis.\n"
"\n"
"I fought ‘em back in ’39, during the Night of Rage."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​我​和​人类​至上​主义者​是​有些​恩怨​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​2039​年​的​“​愤怒​之夜​”​时​，​我​曾经​和​他们​大打出手​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 he4 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 shi4 you3xie1 en1yuan4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"2039 nian2 de5“fen4nu4 zhi1 ye4” shi2，wo3 ceng2jing1 he4 ta1men5 da4da3chu1shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Aye. A gang from a nearby kiez has been hijacking shipments bound for the Kreuzbasar, takin' money out of *our* pockets.\n"
"\n"
"I could use your help to stop this from happening."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​。​附近​街区​的​一个​团伙​一直​在​劫持​运往​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​货物​，​从​*​我们​*​的​口袋​里​掏钱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​需要​你​帮忙​阻止​这种​事​再次发生​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4。fu4jin4 jie1qu1 de5 yi1ge5 tuan2huo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 jie2chi2 yun4 wang3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 huo4wu4，cong2*wo3men5*de5 kou3dai4 li3 tao1qian2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 bang1mang2 zu3zhi3 zhe4zhong3 shi4 zai4 ci4 fa1 sheng1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Couldn't have said it better myself."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​得​太​对​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 de2 tai4 dui4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Excellent. I am relieved.\n"
"\n"
"I will make the arrangements for your meeting with the smugglers. Their leader is a elf who calls himself \"Maxim.\" Take the U-Bahn to Schattennest and you will find him waiting there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​太好了​。​我​总算​松​了​口气​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​安排​你​和​走私者​见面​。​他们​的​首领​是​个​自称​“​马克西姆​”​的​精灵​。​坐地铁​到​影巢​去​，​他会​在​那里​等​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tai4hao3le5。wo3 zong3suan4 song1 le5 kou3qi4。\n"
"\n"
