"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4。zhe4 fen4 qing2bao4 guan1xi5 dao4 mei3 yi1ge5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yesterday, I overheard one of my assistants talking on his comm. He was yelling, clearly agitated.\n"
"\n"
"I questioned him, and he confided in me. What he told me made my blood run cold."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​昨天​，​我​无意​中​听到​我​的​一位​助手​在​他​的​通讯​链上​说话​。​他​大喊大叫​，​显然​很​激动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​质问​他​，​他​向​我​吐露​了​实情​。​他​说​的话​让​我​不寒而栗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zuo2tian1，wo3 wu2yi4 zhong4 ting1dao4 wo3 de5 yi1 wei4 zhu4shou3 zai4 ta1 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 shang4 shuo1hua4。ta1 da4han3da4jiao4，xian3ran2 hen3 ji1dong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi4wen4 ta1，ta1 xiang4 wo3 tu3lu4 le5 shi2qing2。ta1 shuo1 de5hua4 rang4 wo3 bu4han2er2li4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He offers you a broad smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is going to be *glorious,* $(l.race). That gas that you hauled in for us... it's gonna prove every word that we've been saying. The trogs, the halfers, the goddamned dandelion-eaters... one whiff of this stuff, and they're gonna tear each other apart. And then they'll spill into the good, *human* neighborhoods, where we'll be waiting to stop them."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​朝​你​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​是​一场​*​辉煌​*​的​胜利​，​$(l.race)​。​你​运来​的​气体​……​它​将​兑现​我们​说​过​的​一切​。​穴居人​、​半截​人​、​那些​该死​的​素食​精​……​只要​闻到​这​玩意​，​他们​就​会​自相残杀​。​然后​他们​就​会​涌入​美好​的​、​真正​的​*​人类​*​居住​的​社区​，​而​我们​会​在​那儿​等​着​阻止​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2*hui1huang2*de5 sheng4li4，$(l.race)。ni3 yun4 lai2 de5 qi4ti3……ta1 jiang1 dui4xian4 wo3men5 shuo1 guo4 de5 yi1qie4。xue2ju1ren2、ban4jie2 ren2、na4xie1 gai1si3 de5 su4shi2 jing1……zhi3yao4 wen2dao4 zhe4 wan2yi4，ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 zi4xiang1can2sha1。ran2hou4 ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 yong3ru4 mei3hao3 de5、zhen1zheng4 de5*ren2lei4*ju1zhu4 de5 she4qu1，er2 wo3men5 hui4 zai4 na4r5 deng3 zhao2 zu3zhi3 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He offers you a broad smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is going to be *glorious.* That gas that you hauled in for us... it's gonna prove every word that we've been saying. The trogs, the halfers, the goddamned dandelion-eaters... one whiff of this stuff, and they're gonna tear each other apart. And then they'll spill into the good, *human* neighborhoods, where we'll be waiting to stop them."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​朝​你​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​将​是​一场​*​辉煌​*​的​胜利​。​你​运来​的​气体​……​它​将​兑现​我们​说​过​的​一切​。​穴居人​、​半截​人​、​那些​该死​的​素食​精​……​只要​闻到​这​玩意​，​他们​就​会​自相残杀​。​然后​他们​就​会​涌入​美好​的​、​真正​的​*​人类​*​居住​的​社区​，​而​我们​会​在​那儿​等​着​阻止​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2*hui1huang2*de5 sheng4li4。ni3 yun4 lai2 de5 qi4ti3……ta1 jiang1 dui4xian4 wo3men5 shuo1 guo4 de5 yi1qie4。xue2ju1ren2、ban4jie2 ren2、na4xie1 gai1si3 de5 su4shi2 jing1……zhi3yao4 wen2dao4 zhe4 wan2yi4，ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 zi4xiang1can2sha1。ran2hou4 ta1men5 jiu4 hui4 yong3ru4 mei3hao3 de5、zhen1zheng4 de5*ren2lei4*ju1zhu4 de5 she4qu1，er2 wo3men5 hui4 zai4 na4r5 deng3 zhao2 zu3zhi3 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He offers you a sickly grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is, isn't it? I get everything I want, and you take the fall for it.\n"
"\n"
"That's what's happening here, by the way. In case you hadn't guessed."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​朝​你​露出​一个​恶心​的​狞笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​吧​？​我​得到​想要​的​一切​，​而​你​却​要​为此​背锅​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​顺便​说​一句​，​这​就是​现在​的​情况​。​如果说​你​到​现在​还​没​开窍​的话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 e3xin1 de5 ning2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ba1？wo3 de2dao4 xiang3yao4 de5 yi1qie4，er2 ni3 que4 yao4 wei4ci3 bei1guo1。\n"
"\n"
"shun4bian4 shuo1 yi1ju4，zhe4 jiu4shi4 xian4zai4 de5 qing2kuang4。ru2guo3shuo1 ni3 dao4 xian4zai4 hai2 mei2 kai1qiao4 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He offers you a slight smile and nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's gratifying to hear you say it. I am glad to have you on our side.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else that I can help you with?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​向​你​微微一笑​，​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听到​你​这么​说​真​好​。​我​很​高兴​你​能​站​在​我们​这边​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​还有​什么​需要​我​帮忙​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4，dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1dao4 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1 zhen1 hao3。wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 neng2 zhan4 zai4 wo3men5 zhe4bian1。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，hai2you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 wo3 bang1mang2 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He offers you a tenative smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Maybe, chief. But not right now.\n"
"\n"
"For the time being, I think that I need some \"me\" time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​你​露出​似笑非笑​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​吧​，​头儿​，​但​不是​现在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​眼下​我​需要​点​“​个人​时间​”​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 si4xiao4fei1xiao4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，tou2r5，dan4 bu4shi4 xian4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"yan3xia4 wo3 xu1yao4 dian3“ge4ren2 shi2jian1”。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He opens his hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I am merely suggesting that the story is incomplete. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摊开​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​说​，​目前​流传​的​说法​并​不​完备​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1kai1 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 shuo1，mu4qian2 liu2chuan2 de5 shuo1fa3 bing4 bu4 wan2bei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses a moment before croaking out an answer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Maybe. Who's to say?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一会儿​，​才​含混不清​地​回答​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​吧​。​谁​知道​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，cai2 han2 hun4 bu4 qing1 de5 hui2da2 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1。shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a long moment, then cracks a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well, I suppose that's worth the price of a crate of guns. \n"
"\n"
"Your medical supplies are already mostly gone, I'm afraid. But the weapons shipment is still being held in a locker at Frankfurter Tor. I'll have it sent back to the Kreuzbasar immediately."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​好​一会儿​，​然后​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​我​觉得​这笔​交易​值得​一箱​武器​的​价值​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​的​医疗​物资​恐怕​基本​都​没​了​，​但​那批​武器​还​在​法兰克福​门​的​一处​储物柜​里​。​我会​立刻​把​它们​送回​克洛伊​茨​集市​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 hao3 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 bi3 jiao1yi4 zhi2de5 yi1 xiang1 wu3qi4 de5 jia4zhi2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 de5 yi1liao2 wu4zi1 kong3pa4 ji1ben3 dou1 mei2 le5，dan4 na4 pi1 wu3qi4 hai2 zai4 fa3lan2ke4fu2 men2 de5 yi1 chu3 chu3wu4gui4 li3。wo3 hui4 li4ke4 ba3 ta1men5 song4 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment to consider, a thoughtful look on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You look like you can handle yourself. We might actually be able to use you... easy money, if you're interested. If not, well...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The assault rifle in his hand shifts position slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...That's a different conversation."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​，​脸上​露出​思索​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看起来​有点​本事​。​要是​你​愿意​帮忙​，​我们​或许​能​用得上​你​。​还​能​给​你​点​报酬​。​不过​要是​你​不​愿意​的话​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​手中​的​突击​步枪​略微​挪​了​下​位置​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​那​就是​另一回事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 si1suo3 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 you3dian3 ben3shi4。yao4shi5 ni3 yuan4yi4 bang1mang2，wo3men5 huo4xu3 neng2 yong4de5shang4 ni3。hai2 neng2 gei3 ni3 dian3 bao4chou5。bu4guo4 yao4shi5 ni3 bu4 yuan4yi4 de5hua4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shou3 zhong4 de5 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1 lu:e4wei1 nuo2 le5 xia4 wei4zhi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……na4 jiu4shi4 ling4 yi1 hui2 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment to consider, then cranes his neck to look you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Y'know, if you're looking for work, we could use a troll like you. Get you some spare cash and a free pass into our building all at once.\n"
"\n"
"How does that sound?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​思索​着​，​然后​抬头​对​你​对视​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​，​如果​你​在​找​活干​，​我们​正好​能​用到​像​你​这样​的​巨魔​。​既能​让​你​赚点​零花钱​，​还​能​让​你​自由​进入​我们​的​建筑​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 si1suo3 zhao2，ran2hou4 tai2tou2 dui4 ni3 dui4shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1，ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 zhao3 huo2 gan4，wo3men5 zheng4hao3 neng2 yong4 dao4 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ju4mo2。ji4 neng2 rang4 ni3 zhuan4 dian3 ling2hua1qian2，hai2 neng2 rang4 ni3 zi4you2 jin4ru4 wo3men5 de5 jian4zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, considering. Eventually, he shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fine. Five hundred it is."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​思索​着​。​最终​，​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​五百​就​五百​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 si1suo3 zhao2。zui4zhong1，ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wu3 bai3 jiu4 wu3 bai3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I believe that they suit her personality."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​，​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​它们​很​适合​她​的​性格​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ta1men5 hen3 shi4he2 ta1 de5 xing4ge2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You probably shouldn't count on that, though."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一会儿​，​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​你​最好​也​别​抱​太大​指望​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ni3 zui4hao3 ye3 bie4 bao4 tai4 dai4 zhi3wang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, gathering his thoughts. When the words come, they're slow as molasses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well... You're on the first floor. That's the Hub... and my shop."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​，​整理​思绪​。​当​他​终于​开口​时​，​话语​如同​糖浆​一般​黏稠​缓慢​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​你​现在​在​一楼​。​这里​是​中枢​……​我​的​店​也​在​这​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，zheng3li3 si1xu4。dang1 ta1 zhong1yu2 kai1kou3 shi2，hua4yu3 ru2tong2 tang2jiang1 yi1ban1 nian2 chou2 huan3man4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……ni3 xian4zai4 zai4 yi1 lou2。zhe4li3 shi4 zhong1shu1……wo3 de5 dian4 ye3 zai4 zhe4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, inspecting you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, you certainly look the part, and more security is always welcome.\n"
"\n"
"But you understand, of course, that I can't just take your word for it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一会儿​，​检视​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​你​确实​看着​像​那么回事​，​安保​人数​总是​多多益善​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​你​肯定​也​明白​，​我​不能​就​这么​信​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，jian3shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，ni3 que4shi2 kan4 zhao2 xiang4 na4 ma2 hui2 shi4，an1bao3 ren2shu4 zong3shi4 duo1duo1yi4shan4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ni3 ken3ding4 ye3 ming2bai5，wo3 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4me5 xin4 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, regarding you with a critical eye. Then he shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Works for me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​，​用​挑剔​的​目光​打量​着​你​，​然后​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​意见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，yong4 tiao1ti5 de5 mu4guang1 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，ran2hou4 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 yi4jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, then checks himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Then again, with the power overload, nobody knows what the hell is going on. I haven't heard from Central in a half an hour.\n"
"\n"
"Why are you here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他顿​了​一下​，​而后​收敛​了​戒心​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​话说回来​，​由于​电网​过载​，​没有​人​知道​现在​情况​到底​如何​。​我​和​指挥部​失去​联系​已经​有​半个​小时​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​为什么​出现​在​这里​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dun4 le5 yi1xia4，er2hou4 shou1lian3 le5 jie4xin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，you2yu2 dian4wang3 guo4zai4，mei2you3 ren2 zhi1dao4 xian4zai4 qing2kuang4 dao4di3 ru2he2。wo3 he4 zhi3hui1bu4 shi1qu4 lian2xi4 yi3jing1 you3 ban4ge5 xiao3shi2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wei4shen2me5 chu1xian4 zai4 zhe4li3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, then continues.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I trust that James suffered his \"accident\" on the way out of the building. Very convenient, and very much as we expected.\n"
"\n"
"You are performing exactly as we'd hoped that you would."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​片刻​，​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​确信​詹姆斯​是​在​离开​大楼​途中​遭遇​了​那场​“​意外​”​。​这样​方便​的​结果​可以​说​完全符合​我们​的​预期​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​表现​得​完全符合​我们​的​期望​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 pian4ke4，you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 que4xin4 zhan1mu3si1 shi4 zai4 li2kai1 da4lou2 tu2zhong1 zao1yu4 le5 na4 chang2“yi4wai4”。zhe4yang4 fang1bian4 de5 jie1guo3 ke3yi3 shuo1 wan2 quan2 fu2 ge3 wo3men5 de5 yu4qi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 biao3xian4 de2 wan2 quan2 fu2 ge3 wo3men5 de5 qi1wang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, then continues.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I trust that Jana suffered her \"accident\" on the way out of the building.\n"
"\n"
"I am surprised, truth be told. I had anticipated that you would place a premium on protecting the dwarf."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​片刻​，​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​确信​简娜​是​在​离开​大楼​途中​遭遇​了​那场​“​意外​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​还​挺​惊讶​的​。​我​原以为​你​会​格外​重视​保护​那个​矮人​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 pian4ke4，you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 que4xin4 Jian3na4 shi4 zai4 li2kai1 da4lou2 tu2zhong1 zao1yu4 le5 na4 chang2“yi4wai4”。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 hai2 ting3 jing1ya4 de5。wo3 yuan2 yi3 wei2 ni3 hui4 ge2wai4 zhong4shi4 bao3hu4 na4ge5 ai3ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, then looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wasn't a big fan of your letting Thorvald go, boss. The man was obviously a psychopath... he did some sick shit in there, and he *loved* it.\n"
"\n"
"If I'd been in your place, I'd've taken him out. It was what we were there to do, and it would've been the right thing to do. Just my opinion."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停​了​一下​，​看向​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​我​觉得​咱们​不该​把​托​瓦尔德​放走​。​那货​就是​个​疯子​……​他​在​这​做​了​好些​恶心​事​，​而且​*​乐此不疲​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​换作​是​我​，​早就​干掉​他​了​。​我们​来​就是​干​这个​的​，​而且​这​也​是​正确​的​事​。​反正​我​是​这么​想​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2 le5 yi1xia4，kan4 xiang4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 jue2de5 zan2men5 bu4gai1 ba3 tuo1 wa3er3de2 fang4zou3。na4 huo4 jiu4shi4 ge4 feng1zi5……ta1 zai4 zhe4 zuo4 le5 hao3xie1 e3xin1 shi4，er2qie3*le4ci3bu4pi2*。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 huan4 zuo4 shi4 wo3，zao3jiu4 gan4diao4 ta1 le5。wo3men5 lai2 jiu4shi4 gan4 zhe4ge5 de5，er2qie3 zhe4 ye3 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 shi4。fan3zheng4 wo3 shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment, then looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Kind of a pity, puttin' that rigger on ice like that. Least we could've done was heard him out.\n"
"\n"
"I get that the job is the job, and all... but if our client really did screw him over, he deserved better than to get buried for it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停​了​一下​，​看向​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可惜​那个​机师​就​这么​死​了​。​至少​我们​可以​听听​他​要说​什么​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​工作​就是​工作​……​但​就算​我们​的​客户​确实​想​收拾​他​，​也​不​应该​这么​草草了事​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2 le5 yi1xia4，kan4 xiang4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1 na4ge5 ji1shi1 jiu4 zhe4me5 si3 le5。zhi4shao3 wo3men5 ke3yi3 ting1 ting1 ta1 yao4shuo1 shen2me5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 gong1zuo4 jiu4shi4 gong1zuo4……dan4 jiu4suan4 wo3men5 de5 ke4hu4 que4shi2 xiang3 shou1shi5 ta1，ye3 bu4 ying1gai1 zhe4me5 cao3cao3liao3shi4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"200 nuyen. Right here, right now. Give me that, and I'll tell you how you can get access to the hotel.\n"
"\n"
"Or don't, and get lost. Your choice."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​想​了​想​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​200​新円​。​现在​立马​给​我​现钱​，​我​就​告诉​你​怎么​进​旅馆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不想​给​，​就​滚​。​你​自己​选​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang3 le5 xiang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"200 xin1 yuan2。xian4zai4 li4ma3 gei3 wo3 xian4qian2，wo3 jiu4 gao4su4 ni3 zen3me5 jin4 lu:3guan3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4xiang3 gei3，jiu4 gun3。ni3 zi4ji3 xuan3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's... that's an interesting idea.\n"
"\n"
"If it were big enough, and heinous enough, He might be satisfied."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​主意​……​有点儿​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​对手​够​大​，​够​坏​，​祂​或许​会​满意​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhu3yi5……you3dian3r5 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 dui4shou3 gou4 dai4，gou4 huai4，ta1 huo4xu3 hui4 man3yi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses, then reaches back into his pocket.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And he's the key to our little armory down in the basement. Help yourself. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​然后​从​口袋​里​又​掏出​一样​东西​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​我们​地下室​军械库​的​钥匙​。​想​拿​什么​随便​挑​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 cong2 kou3dai4 li3 you4 tao1chu1 yi1yang4 dong1xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 di4xia4shi4 jun1 xie4 ku4 de5 yao4shi5。xiang3 na2 shen2me5 sui2bian4 tiao1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses. Rubs his temples.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Agreed. And to neutralize that danger, we need to know who we are dealing with."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​片刻​，​揉​了​揉​太阳穴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​同意​。​为了​脱离险境​，​我们​需要​知道​自己​在​跟​什么​人​打交道​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，rou2 le5 rou2 tai4yang2xue2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。wei4le5 tuo1 li2 xian3 jing4，wo3men5 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 gen1 shen2me5 ren2 da3jiao1dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses. Shakes his head. Then he slams the tome shut.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...No. This is a waste of time.\n"
"\n"
"The more I think about it, the more convinced I am: the Firewing is acting alone. Dragons don't cooperate unless they absolutely have to."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停​了​一下​，​摇​了​摇头​，​然后​猛地​合​上书​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​不行​。​这​纯粹​是​浪费时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​越​想​越​确信​：​火翼​是​单独​行动​的​。​除非​万不得已​，​巨龙​之间​是​不会​合作​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2 le5 yi1xia4，yao2 le5 yao2tou2，ran2hou4 meng3de5 ge3 shang4shu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……bu4xing2。zhe4 chun2cui4 shi4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yue4 xiang3 yue4 que4xin4：Huo3yi4 shi4 dan1du2 xing2dong4 de5。chu2fei1 wan4bu4de2yi3，ju4long2 zhi1jian1 shi4 bu4hui4 he2zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses. Stubs out his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The dragon is still alive, Hermie. Of that, I am certain.\n"
"\n"
"One day, I will find her. And then, perhaps, I'll be able to sleep through the night."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停​了​一下​，​把​烟​一口​吸尽​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​巨龙​还​活着​，​赫米​。​我​对此​十分​肯定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总有一天​，​我会​找到​她​。​也许​到​那时​，​我​就​终于​能​睡个​好觉​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2 le5 yi1xia4，ba3 yan1 yi1kou3 xi1jin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 ju4long2 hai2 huo2zhe5，he4 mi3。wo3 dui4 ci3 shi2fen1 ken3ding4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3 you3 yi1 tian1，wo3 hui4 zhao3dao4 ta1。ye3xu3 dao4 na4shi2，wo3 jiu4 zhong1yu2 neng2 shui4 ge4 hao3 jiao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh? And tell me, why the sudden change of heart?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​？​告诉​我​，​你​为什么​突然​改变​主意​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2？gao4su4 wo3，ni3 wei4shen2me5 tu1ran2 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We have suffered losses, yes. They were tragic. But the people here accepted that there would be risks.\n"
"\n"
"They made their own choices. I won't take the blame for that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​确实​遭受​过​人员​损失​。​那些​都​是​悲剧​。​但​这里​的​人们​都​明白​会​冒​怎样​的​风险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​自己​做出​了​决定​。​我​不会​揽​下​这些​罪责​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 que4shi2 zao1shou4 guo4 ren2yuan2 sun3shi1。na4xie1 dou1 shi4 bei1ju4。dan4 zhe4li3 de5 ren2men5 dou1 ming2bai5 hui4 mao4 zen3yang4 de5 feng1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 zi4ji3 zuo4chu1 le5 jue2ding4。wo3 bu4hui4 lan3 xia4 zhe4xie1 zui4ze2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He presses a button on his commlink and looks up at you, a million-dollar smile on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry about the wait, my friend. Welcome to the TRIAGE Cyberclinic."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​按​下​通讯​链​的​一个​按钮​，​然后​看向​你​，​脸上​堆满​了​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​让​你​久等​了​，​朋友​。​欢迎​来到​“​分诊​”​义体​诊所​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 an4 xia4 tong1xun4 lian4 de5 yi1ge5 an4niu3，ran2hou4 kan4 xiang4 ni3，lian3 shang4 dui1man3 le5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 rang4 ni3 jiu3deng3 le5，peng2you5。huan1ying2 lai2dao4“fen4 zhen3” yi4 ti3 zhen3suo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He produces a small packet filled with iridescent purple granules from the pocket of his dirty jeans.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You wanna get high? Buy some novacoke and throw yourself a party. But if you wanna *soar,* you get yourself some Flash."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​从​脏兮兮​的​牛仔裤​口袋​里​拿出​一个​小包​，​里面​装满​了​荧​紫色​颗粒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​想来​点​嗨​的​？​那​就​买点​“​新星​可乐​”​然后​走​起​。​但​你​如果​想​*​起飞​*​的话​，​就​必须​来​点​“​闪光​”​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 zang1xi1xi1 de5 niu2zai3ku4 kou3dai4 li3 na2chu1 yi1ge5 xiao3bao1，li3mian4 zhuang1man3 le5 ying2 zi3se4 ke1li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiang3lai2 dian3 hai1 de5？na4 jiu4 mai3 dian3“xin1xing1 ke3le4” ran2hou4 zou3 qi3。dan4 ni3 ru2guo3 xiang3*qi3fei1*de5hua4，jiu4 bi4xu1 lai2 dian3“shan3guang1”。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pulls something long and slender out of his jacket pocket. A knitting needle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You will not listen, so I will put out your ears! Now *hold still!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​从​外套​口袋​里​掏出​一件​细长​物体​。​一根​织衣​针​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不肯​聆听​，​那​我​就要​刺穿​你​的​耳朵​！​现在​*​别动​*​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 wai4tao4 kou3dai4 li3 tao1chu1 yi1 jian4 xi4chang2 wu4ti3。yi1 gen1 zhi1 yi1 zhen1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 ken3 ling2ting1，na4 wo3 jiu4yao4 ci4chuan1 ni3 de5 er3duo5！xian4zai4*bie4 dong4*！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He purses his lips. Considers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is undeniable… and as it should be. The Great Dragons are very old and very powerful and very, very cunning. A cunning unknowable to you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​撅​起​嘴唇​，​陷入​思考​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​一点​不容置疑​……​它们​向来如此​。​巨龙​古老​而​强大​，​狡诈​程度​超乎​你​的​想象​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jue1 qi3 zui3chun2，xian4ru4 si1kao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 yi1dian3 bu4rong2zhi4yi2……ta1men5 xiang4 lai2 ru2 ci3。ju4long2 gu3lao3 er2 qiang2da4，jiao3zha4 cheng2du4 chao1 hu1 ni3 de5 xiang3xiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He purses his lips. Considers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"“Just another taker.” Interesting. \n"
"\n"
"Dragons take, this is undeniable, but they cannot be considered “just another taker,” as you put it. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​撅​起​嘴唇​，​陷入​思考​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​一种​掠夺者​”​吗​，​有意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​龙族​掠夺​是​不假​，​但​不能​被​简单​归为​“​一种​掠夺者​”​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jue1 qi3 zui3chun2，xian4ru4 si1kao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“yi1zhong3 lu:e4duo2zhe3” ma5，you3yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"long2 zu2 lu:e4duo2 shi4 bu4 jia3，dan4 bu4neng2 bei4 jian3dan1 gui1 wei2“yi1zhong3 lu:e4duo2zhe3”。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He pushes the button.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, Blitz. I'm trusting you here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​按​下​按钮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​布里​茨​。​我​可是​相信​你​的​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 an4 xia4 an4niu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，Bu4li3ci2。wo3 ke3shi4 xiang1xin4 ni3 de5 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He puts down the DVD in his hands and quickly inspects the others.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The first disc that I looked at might be readable. The others are damaged... some severely so.\n"
"\n"
"I have my doubts about them."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​放下​手中​的​DV​D盘​，​扫视​着​其他​光碟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​刚才​我​手里​的​第一张​碟片​或许​还​能​播放​。​其余​的​都​受损​了​……​有些​还​很​严重​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不好​说​能​不能​读取​全部内容​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fang4xia4 shou3 zhong4 de5 DV D盘，sao3shi4 zhao2 qi2ta1 guang1die2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gang1cai2 wo3 shou3li3 de5 di4 yi1 zhang1 die2pian4 huo4xu3 hai2 neng2 bo1fang4。qi2yu2 de5 dou1 shou4sun3 le5……you3Xie1hai2 hen3 yan2zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4hao3 shuo1 neng2 bu4neng2 du2qu3 quan2 bu4 nei4 rong2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He puts on a lazy smile and shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"'Course I'm staying. The team would fall apart without me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​露出​慵懒​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当然​要​留下​。​这​队伍​没​我​不行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 yong1lan3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1ran2 yao4 liu2xia4。zhe4 dui4wu3 mei2 wo3 bu4xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He puts on a lazy smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Couldn't keep me away."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​露出​慵懒​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可别​想​甩掉​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 yong1lan3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3 bie4 xiang3 shuai3diao4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an armored hand, then turns to you with a smile. You can see what he's holding - a bottle made of thick green glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, here's to you, Doc.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He raises the bottle to his lips and takes a swig. Then he passes it to you.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抬起​戴着​护甲​的​手​，​转过身​来​对​你​微笑​。​你​能​看见​他握​着​的​东西​—​—​厚实​的​绿色​酒瓶​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​敬​你​的​，​博士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​将​酒瓶​凑到​唇​边​啜​了​一口​，​随即​递给​你​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2qi3 dai4 zhao2 hu4jia3 de5 shou3，zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 dui4 ni3 wei1xiao4。ni3 neng2 kan4jian4 ta1 wo4 zhao2 de5 dong1xi1——hou4shi5 de5 lu:4se4 jiu3 ping2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 jing4 ni3 de5，bo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 jiu3 ping2 cou4 dao4 chun2 bian1 chuo4 le5 yi1kou3，sui2ji2 di4gei3 ni3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow in a look of mock astonishment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​扬起​一条​眉毛​，​露出​一副​故作​惊讶​的​样子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5，lu4chu1 yi1 fu4 gu4zuo4 jing1ya4 de5 yang4zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow, his jowls quivering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh? And what might that be?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​扬起​一条​眉毛​，​下巴​上​的​肉​抖动着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​？​是​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5，xia4ba5 shang4 de5 rou4 dou3 dong4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2？shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm fine in here, thank you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​这​挺​好​的​，​谢谢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 zhe4 ting3 hao3 de5，xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Indeed? That is good news.\n"
"\n"
"Were you able to retreive the shipment of weapons they stole as well?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​吗​？​这​真是​好消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​把​他们​偷走​的​货物​也​取回来​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？zhe4 zhen1shi5 hao3 xiao1 xi1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 ta1men5 tou1 zou3 de5 huo4wu4 ye3 qu3 hui2 lai2 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The shamanic idol, you mean?\n"
"\n"
"An... unusual request. Why do you wish to know?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​说​，​那个​萨满​精魂​导师​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​请求​……​倒​是​非同寻常​。​你​为什么​想​知道​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1，na4ge5 sa4man3 jing1hun2 dao3shi1？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 qing3qiu2……dao3 shi4 fei1tong2xun2chang2。ni3 wei4shen2me5 xiang3 zhi1dao4 ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What did it feel like?\n"
"\n"
"An explosion, of course."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​感觉​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​是​一场​爆炸​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gan3jue2 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 shi4 yi1 chang2 bao4zha4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes? Have you reconsidered working for us?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​？​你​重新​愿意​为​我们​工作​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1？ni3 chong2xin1 yuan4yi4 wei2 wo3men5 gong1zuo4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He raises his voice and gestures theatrically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Doors locked and shutters slammed closed! We were all trapped like rats inside, but we were not afraid. We were sure that the malfunction would be fixed within the hour.\n"
"\n"
"We did not know what was coming for us!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抬高​声音​，​做出​戏剧性​的​手势​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大门​锁上​，​百叶窗​关闭​！​我们​都​像​老鼠​一样​被困​在​里面​，​但​我们​并​不​害怕​。​我们​确信​故障​会​在​一​小时​内​修复​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​当时​不​知道​事情​会​发展​成​什么​样子​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2gao1 sheng1yin1，zuo4chu1 xi4ju4xing4 de5 shou3shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4men2 suo3shang4，bai3ye4chuang1 guan1bi4！wo3men5 dou1 xiang4 lao3shu3 yi1yang4 bei4kun4 zai4 li3mian4，dan4 wo3men5 bing4 bu4 hai4pa4。wo3men5 que4xin4 gu4zhang4 hui4 zai4 yi1 xiao3shi2 nei4 xiu1fu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dang1shi2 bu4 zhi1dao4 shi4qing5 hui4 fa1zhan3 cheng2 shen2me5 yang4zi5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He reaches down, flips a switch. You hear a loud thud and a click behind you as the door locks shut.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You'll find that the blast door behind you is sealed, and that the laboratory you occupy is fully secured. An important precaution... we keep our test subjects in there, and they are far more dangerous than you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​伸手​向下​拨动​了​一个​开关​。​你​听到​身后​传来​一声​巨响​和​咔哒​一声​，​门​随即​关上​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​身后​的​防爆​门​已​被​密封​，​而​你​所在​的​实验室​也​已​完全​封锁​。​这​是​个​重要​的​安全措施​……​我们​把​实验​对象​关​在​里面​，​而​他们​比​你​危险​得​多​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1shou3 xiang4xia4 bo1dong4 le5 yi1ge5 kai1guan1。ni3 ting1dao4 shen1hou4 chuan2lai2 yi1sheng1 ju4xiang3 he4 ka3 da1 yi1sheng1，men2 sui2ji2 guan1shang4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shen1hou4 de5 fang2 bao4 men2 yi3 bei4 mi4feng1，er2 ni3 suo3zai4 de5 shi2yan4shi4 ye3 yi3 wan2quan2 feng1suo3。zhe4 shi4 ge4 zhong4yao4 de5 an1quan2cuo4shi1……wo3men5 ba3 shi2yan4 dui4xiang4 guan1 zai4 li3mian4，er2 ta1men5 bi3 ni3 wei1xian3 de2 duo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He reaches into his grubby pocket and pulls out an object. Shoves it into your hands. A jazz inhaler.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take it, take it! For clearing the spirits. To help return us to Communion!\n"
"\n"
"We must again listen, we must!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​从​肮脏​的​口袋​里​掏出​一样​东西​塞到​你​手里​。​一个​捷势​吸入​器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拿​去​，​拿​去​！​用来​清理​精魂​。​帮助​我们​回归​共融​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​必须​再次​倾听​，​我们​必须​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 ang1zang1 de5 kou3dai4 li3 tao1chu1 yi1yang4 dong1xi1 se4 dao4 ni3 shou3li3。yi1ge5 jie2 shi4 xi1ru4 qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na2 qu4，na2 qu4！yong4lai2 qing1li3 jing1hun2。bang1zhu4 wo3men5 hui2gui1 gong4 rong2！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bi4xu1 zai4ci4 qing1ting1，wo3men5 bi4xu1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He reaches into his pocket, puts on a pair of round sunglasses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, it was good to meet you, $(l.name). That business with Dr. Vauclair could have gotten… disorderly… and my employer wishes to express his gratitude. \n"
"\n"
"You are a most remarkable $(l.man)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​将​手​伸进​口袋​，​掏出​一副​圆框​墨镜​戴上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​很​高兴​认识​你​，​$(l.name)​。​沃​克莱尔​博士​那件事​本来​会​变得​十分​……​混乱​……​我​的​雇主​想​表达​他​的​谢意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真是​个​了不起​的​人​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 shou3 shen1 jin4 kou3dai4，tao1chu1 yi1 fu4 yuan2 kuang4 mo4jing4 dai4shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，$(l.name)。Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 na4 jian4 shi4 ben3lai2 hui4 bian4de5 shi2fen1……hun4luan4……wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 xiang3 biao3da2 ta1 de5 xie4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 liao3bu5qi3 de5 ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He reaches into his pocket, puts on a pair of round sunglasses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, it was good to meet you, $(l.name). That business with Dr. Vauclair could have gotten… disorderly… and my employer wishes to express his gratitude. \n"
"\n"
"You are a most remarkable $(l.race)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​将​手​伸进​口袋​，​掏出​一副​圆框​墨镜​戴上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​很​高兴​认识​你​，​$(l.name)​。​沃​克莱尔​博士​那件事​本来​会​变得​十分​……​混乱​……​我​的​雇主​想​表达​他​的​谢意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真是​个​了不起​的​$(l.race)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 shou3 shen1 jin4 kou3dai4，tao1chu1 yi1 fu4 yuan2 kuang4 mo4jing4 dai4shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 hen3 gao1xing4 ren4shi5 ni3，$(l.name)。Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 na4 jian4 shi4 ben3lai2 hui4 bian4de5 shi2fen1……hun4luan4……wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 xiang3 biao3da2 ta1 de5 xie4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1shi5 ge4 liao3bu5qi3 de5 $(l.race)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He readies his weapon.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Wonderful."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他端​起​武器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真行​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 duan1 qi3 wu3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1 xing2 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He recoils as if you'd punched him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whoa. That was a pretty messed up thing to say, chief."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​猛地​退回去​，​像是​被​你​打​了​一拳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​喂喂​，​这话​可​不能​这么​说​啊​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 meng3de5 tui4 hui2 qu4，xiang4 shi4 bei4 ni3 da3 le5 yi1 quan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei2 wei2，zhe4 hua4 ke3 bu4neng2 zhe4me5 shuo1 a1，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He recoils as though he's been struck.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You... you're not gonna try to extort money out of me? Or blackmail me for nitro? Or anything?\n"
"\n"
"That doesn't make sense."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​猛地​一退​，​好像​被​人​打​了​一拳​似的​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​……​你​不会​是​要​向​我​勒索钱财​吧​？​还是​说​你​想要​“​氮冲​”​？​还是​别的​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​没道理​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 meng3de5 yi1 tui4，hao3xiang4 bei4 ren2 da3 le5 yi1 quan2 shi4de5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 bu4hui4 shi4 yao4 xiang4 wo3 lei1 suo3 qian2 cai2 ba1？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 xiang3yao4“dan4 chong1”？hai2shi5 bie2de5 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 mei2 dao4 li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He recoils in horror.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My peasants?! Sent against that *monster?* Never!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​满脸​惊恐​地​退后​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​臣民​？​！​派​他们​去​对抗​那个​*​怪物​*​？​绝不​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man3lian3 jing1kong3 de5 tui4hou4 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 chen2min2？！pai4 ta1men5 qu4 dui4kang4 na4ge5*guai4wu5*？jue2bu4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He reels as though he's been struck.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're saying that there's more?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​踉跄​了​一下​，​仿佛​被​雷劈​了​似的​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​说​，​还有​更​多​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 liang4qiang4 le5 yi1xia4，fang3fu2 bei4 lei2 pi1 le5 shi4de5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 shuo1，hai2you3 geng1 duo1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He regards you with a critical eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I was the front man for a punk band, boss.\n"
"\n"
"Fuck no, I can't sing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​以​挑剔​的​目光​打量​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​我​是​*​朋克​乐队​*​的​主唱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​那​可不​叫​唱歌​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi3 tiao1ti5 de5 mu4guang1 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 shi4*peng2ke4 yue4dui4*de5 zhu3chang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 na4 ke3bu5 jiao4 chang4ge1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He rolls his bugged-out eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, sure. That's what it looks like to *you.* If you had the Sight, you'd know better.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. What can ol' Zaak get for you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​翻​了​个​巨大​的​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​是​是​，​对​*​你​*​来说​是​这样​的​。​如果​你​有​灵视​的话​，​你​就​明白​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​老​扎克​能​为​你​做点​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 ju4da4 de5 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，dui4*ni3*lai2 shuo1 shi4 zhe4yang4 de5。ru2guo3 ni3 you3 ling2 shi4 de5hua4，ni3 jiu4 ming2bai5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，lao3 Zha1ke4 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He rolls his eyes and points a bony finger at the elf.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, it's trying to speak."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​翻​了​个​白眼​，​用​骨瘦如柴​的​手指​指着​精灵​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​，​它​还​想​说话​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3，yong4 gu3shou4ru2chai2 de5 shou3zhi3 zhi3 zhao2 jing1ling2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4，ta1 hai2 xiang3 shuo1hua4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He rolls his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fine. Whatever. Just make it quick."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​。​总之​抓紧时间​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。zong3zhi1 zhua1jin3shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He rolls his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If that's what it'll take for you to trust me, fine.\n"
"\n"
"Anything for you, chief."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​只有​这样​你​才能​信任​我​的话​，​那好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​什么​都行​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhi3you3 zhe4yang4 ni3 cai2neng2 xin4ren4 wo3 de5hua4，na4 hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 shen2me5 dou1 xing2，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He rolls his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Typical. \"Hey, go do this, and follow my instructions to the letter. You doing it yet? Okay, plan's changed.\""
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​太​典型​了​。​“​严格​按照​我​的​指示​去​做​。​在​做​了​吗​？​好​，​计划​有变​。​”\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tai4 dian3xing2 le5。“yan2ge2 an4zhao4 wo3 de5 zhi3shi4 qu4 zuo4。zai4 zuo4 le5 ma5？hao3，ji4hua4 you3 bian4。”"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He rolls his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I will. And don't worry... I'll be gone by the time you're back from your next run."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​的​。​别​担心​……​等​你​下次​差事​回来​的​时候​，​我​已经​离开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。bie4 dan1xin1……deng3 ni3 xia4ci4 cha4shi4 hui2lai5 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 yi3jing1 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He rubs his eyes and does his best to shake himself awake.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. A'ight. Whaddaya want to know?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​揉​了​揉​眼睛​，​努力​让​自己​清醒过来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​你​想​知道​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 rou2 le5 rou2 yan3jing5，nu3li4 rang4 zi4ji3 qing1 xing3 guo4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 xiang3 zhi1dao4 shen2me5？"

msgid "{{GM}}He rubs his hand across his mouth.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他用​手​抹​了​下​嘴角​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ta1yong4 shou3 ma1 le5 xia4 zui3jiao3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He rubs his temples.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Again, all of this happened decades ago. To the best of my knowledge, the story of Feuerschwinge is a bit of historical trivia, and nothing more."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​揉​了​揉​太阳穴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​重申​一遍​，​这​都​是​几十年​前​的​事​。​据我所知​，​火翼​的​故事​只是​一段​冷门​历史​，​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 rou2 le5 rou2 tai4yang2xue2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 chong2shen1 yi1bian4，zhe4 dou1 shi4 ji1 shi2 nian2 qian2 de5 shi4。ju4wo3suo3zhi1，Huo3yi4 de5 gu4shi4 zhi3shi4 yi1 duan4 leng3men2 li4shi3，jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He runs a hand through his unkempt hair, blinking through a haze of sudden tears. His voice comes out in a gasping sob.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Damn it, Hermie... why couldn't you just let me go?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他用​手​梳理​着​凌乱​的​头发​，​突然​间​泪水​模糊​了​他​的​视线​。​他​的​声音​带​着​哽咽​的​抽泣​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​的​，​赫米​……​你​为什么​就是​不肯​放过​我​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1yong4 shou3 shu1li3 zhao2 ling2luan4 de5 tou2fa5，tu1ran2 jian1 lei4shui3 mo2hu5 le5 ta1 de5 shi4xian4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 geng3ye4 de5 chou1qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3 de5，he4 mi3……ni3 wei4shen2me5 jiu4shi4 bu4 ken3 fang4guo4 wo3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He runs a hand through his unkempt hair, blinking through a haze of sudden tears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Damn it, Hermie... why couldn't you just let me go?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他用​手​梳理​着​凌乱​的​头发​，​突然​间​泪水​模糊​了​他​的​视线​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​的​，​赫米​……​你​为什么​就是​不肯​放过​我​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1yong4 shou3 shu1li3 zhao2 ling2luan4 de5 tou2fa5，tu1ran2 jian1 lei4shui3 mo2hu5 le5 ta1 de5 shi4xian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3 de5，he4 mi3……ni3 wei4shen2me5 jiu4shi4 bu4 ken3 fang4guo4 wo3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He scoffs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"'Course I am! I've had this run planned out for years, like I said."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咳嗽​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​必须​的​！​我​不是​说​了​吗​，​我​已经​计划​这票​好些​年​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ke2sou5 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 de5！wo3 bu4shi4 shuo1 le5 ma5，wo3 yi3jing1 ji4hua4 zhe4 piao4 hao3xie1 nian2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He scoffs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not surprised. These bastards would just love my head on a plate."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​嗤之以鼻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​毫不​意外​。​那些​家伙​肯定​很​想要​我​的​脑袋​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chi1zhi1yi3bi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao2bu4 yi4wai4。na4xie1 jia1huo5 ken3ding4 hen3 xiang3yao4 wo3 de5 nao3dai5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He scoffs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Stubborn as an ox, just like Audran.\n"
"\n"
"I will give you an alternative theory to entertain."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​嗤之以鼻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​倔得​像​头牛​，​和​奥​德兰​一模一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​给你个​替代​理论​用来​消遣​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chi1zhi1yi3bi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 jue4 de2 xiang4 tou2 niu2，he4 Ao4de2lan2 yi1mu2yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gei3 ni3 ge4 ti4dai4 li3lun4 yong4lai2 xiao1qian3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He scoffs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Use your imagination, chief! Just about every security goon in Berlin is wired to a comm system of some kind or another. If I can hijack those comms, then I can cause all sorts of confusion in the ranks on our runs.\n"
"\n"
"This is one hell of a toy. I can see why Grinder wanted it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​哼​了​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​发挥​你​的​想象力​，​头儿​！​柏林​几乎​所有​的​安保​人员​都​连接​到​某种​通信​系统​。​如果​我能​劫持​这些​通信​系统​，​就​能​在​我们​的​行动​中​制造​各种​混乱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​玩意儿​可太​好使​了​。​怪不得​“​绞肉机​”​会​想要​它​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 heng1 le5 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fa1hui1 ni3 de5 xiang3xiang4li4，tou2r5！bo2lin2 ji1hu1 suo3you3 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 dou1 lian2jie1 dao4 mou3zhong3 tong1xin4 xi4tong3。ru2guo3 wo3 neng2 jie2chi2 zhe4xie1 tong1xin4 xi4tong3，jiu4 neng2 zai4 wo3men5 de5 xing2dong4 zhong4 zhi4zao4 ge4zhong3 hun4luan4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 wan2yi4r5 ke3 tai4 hao3shi3 le5。guai4bu5de5“jiao3rou4ji1” hui4 xiang3yao4 ta1 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He scowls.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know why you insist on interfering with my work, but I assure you - that's over now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​你​为什么​坚持​要​干扰​我​工作​，​但​我​向​你​保证​—​—​到此为止​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 wei4shen2me5 jian1chi2 yao4 gan1rao3 wo3 gong1zuo4，dan4 wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4——dao4ci3wei2zhi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He searches his pockets, growing increasingly frantic.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"God *damn* it. I left my credstick at home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​翻遍​了​口袋​，​显得​有些​焦躁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​的​。​我​把​信用​棒​落​在​家里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1bian4 le5 kou3dai4，xian3de5 you3xie1 jiao1zao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3 de5。wo3 ba3 xin4yong4 bang4 la4 zai4 jia1li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head at you, then shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Be my guest, go on inside. I won't try to stop you.\n"
"\n"
"When you make it back - *if* you make it back - we'll be out here waiting for you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​向​你​摇摇头​，​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随​你​的​便​，​我​不会​拦​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​你​出来​了​—​—​*​如果​*​你​还​能​出来​的话​—​—​我们​会​在​这儿​接应​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 yao2 yao2 tou2，song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2 ni3 de5 bian4，wo3 bu4hui4 lan2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ni3 chu1lai2 le5——*ru2guo3*ni3 hai2 neng2 chu1lai2 de5hua4——wo3men5 hui4 zai4 zhe4r5 jie1ying4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You wanna pay them, that's your business. I still think you're crazy, but I won't say no."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​你​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想付​他们​钱​，​那​是​你​的​事​。​我​还是​觉得​你​疯​了​，​但​我​不会​阻止​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 fu4 ta1men5 qian2，na4 shi4 ni3 de5 shi4。wo3 hai2shi5 jue2de5 ni3 feng1 le5，dan4 wo3 bu4hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You want to pay them, that's your business. But that money ain't coming out of our cut."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​你​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想付​他们​钱​，​那​是​你​的​事​。​但​这​钱​可​不能​从​我们​的​分成​里​出​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3 fu4 ta1men5 qian2，na4 shi4 ni3 de5 shi4。dan4 zhe4 qian2 ke3 bu4neng2 cong2 wo3men5 de5 fen1cheng2 li3 chu1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head decisively, his arms crossed over his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, I say. I will not do it, not even for you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​果断​地摇​了​摇头​，​双臂​交叉​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​我​不会​这么​做​，​哪怕​是​为了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 guo3duan4 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2，shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4，na3pa4 shi4 wei4le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head from side to side.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nuh-uh. No *way,* chief.\n"
"\n"
"I am *not* doing this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​反复​摇着头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​不行​。​绝对​*​不行​*​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​不会​*​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan3fu4 yao2 zhao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，bu4xing2。jue2dui4*bu4xing2*，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*bu4hui4*zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head in disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Idiot shadowrunner. You people don't know when to keep your mouths shut.\n"
"\n"
"Men, OPEN FI--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​发言人​摇摇头​，​满脸​厌恶​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​愚蠢​的​狂奔​者​。​你们​这些​人​永远​不​知道​闭嘴​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​各位​，​准备​开火​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa1yan2ren2 yao2 yao2 tou2，man3lian3 yan4wu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yu2chun3 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3。ni3men5 zhe4xie1 ren2 yong3yuan3 bu4 zhi1dao4 bi4zui3。\n"
"\n"
"ge4wei4，zhun3bei4 kai1huo3 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head in disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're not worth the effort. So I'll tell you what's gonna happen now: I'm gonna point you to one of your little mop-jockey friends, and you're gonna go running off to meet her. And you're gonna do it before I do something that we both wind up regretting.\n"
"\n"
"Got it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​厌恶​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​值得​我费​这个​劲​。​现在​我​告诉​你​接下来​会​发生​什么​：​我​告诉​你​其中​一个​拖把​工在​什么​地方​，​然后​你​赶紧​去​见​她​。​而且​你​最好​动作​快点​，​免得​我​做些​让​我们​俩​都​后悔​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​明白​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan4wu4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 zhi2de5 wo3 fei4 zhe4ge5 jin4。xian4zai4 wo3 gao4su4 ni3 jie1xia4lai2 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5：wo3 gao4su4 ni3 qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 tuo1ba3 gong1 zai4 shen2me5 di4fang1，ran2hou4 ni3 gan3jin3 qu4 jian4 ta1。er2qie3 ni3 zui4hao3 dong4zuo4 kuai4dian3，mian3de5 wo3 zuo4 xie1 rang4 wo3men5 lia3 dou1 hou4hui3 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ming2bai5 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head in exasperation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your attitude is trying, $(l.name). This is *serious.* I'd expect that you'd treat it as such."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​无奈​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​态度​真让人​头疼​，​$(l.name)​。​这件​事​很​*​严肃​*​，​我​希望​你​能​认真对待​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wu2nai4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 tai4du5 zhen1 rang4 ren2 tou2teng2，$(l.name)。zhe4 jian4 shi4 hen3*yan2su4*，wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 ren4 zhen1 dui4 dai1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head miserably.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm going to botch this. And the worst part is, most of those bastards will assume that it's because I'm an ork. They already make jokes behind my back.\n"
"\n"
"After this, it's gonna get a lot worse."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​痛苦​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​肯定​会​搞砸​的​。​最糟​的​是​，​那些​混蛋​多半会​认为​这​是因为​我​是​兽​人​。​他们​早就​在​背后​嘲笑​我​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​之后​情况​只会​更糟​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tong4ku3 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ken3ding4 hui4 gao3za2 de5。zui4 zao1 de5 shi4，na4xie1 hun2dan4 duo1 ban4 hui4 ren4wei2 zhe4 shi4 yin1 wei2 wo3 shi4 shou4 ren2。ta1men5 zao3jiu4 zai4 bei4hou4 chao2xiao4 wo3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhi1hou4 qing2kuang4 zhi3 hui4 geng1 zao1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head sadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing can make this right. Nothing at all.\n"
"\n"
"There is no \"fixing\" this. I can only atone for it. And so I shall."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​悲伤地​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​任何​事能​弥补​这个​过错​。​已经​无济于事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​“​挽回​”​的​办法​了​。​我​只能​为此​赎罪​。​而​我​也​将​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bei1 shang1 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ren4he2 shi4 neng2 mi2bu3 zhe4ge5 guo4cuo4。yi3jing1 wu2ji4yu2shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3“wan3hui2” de5 ban4fa3 le5。wo3 zhi3neng2 wei4ci3 shu2zui4。er2 wo3 ye3 jiang1 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head with amusement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's the Flux State for you though, full of the strange and unexpected."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​戏谑​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​欢迎​来到​动荡​带​。​这​地方​从不​缺​奇人​怪事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xi4xue4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1 huan1ying2 lai2dao4 dong4dang4 dai4。zhe4 di4fang1 cong2bu4 que1 qi2ren2 guai4shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, a miserable expression on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was all going so *well!* But I guess I must've tripped something... in the blink of an eye, there were alarms going off. Then I had black IC bearing down on me from all directions.\n"
"\n"
"I thought I was a dead man."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​，​露出​苦涩​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​本来​非常​*​顺利​*​的​！​但​我​想​肯定​是​我​触发​了​什么​……​一瞬间​到处​都​是​警报声​。​接着​，​黑​IC​从​四面八方​朝​我​扑​来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以为​我​死定了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2，lu4chu1 ku3se4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ben3lai2 fei1chang2*shun4li4*de5！dan4 wo3 xiang3 ken3ding4 shi4 wo3 chu4fa1 le5 shen2me5……yi1shun4jian1 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 jing3 bao4 sheng1。jie1zhe5，hei1 IC cong2 si4mian4ba1fang1 chao2 wo3 pu1 lai2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3wei2 wo3 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, and returns his attention to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But you didn't come here to listen to me rage. You're after a bit of payback yourself, I'll wager.\n"
"\n"
"So what can I do to help you get it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​，​然后​又​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​来​这里​肯定​不是​听​我​发脾气​的​。​我敢​说​你​也​是​想​回来​报仇​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我能​为​你​帮上​什么​忙​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2，ran2hou4 you4 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 ken3ding4 bu4shi4 ting1 wo3 fa1pi2qi4 de5。wo3 gan3 shuo1 ni3 ye3 shi4 xiang3 hui2lai5 bao4chou2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3 neng2 wei2 ni3 bang1 shang4 shen2me5 mang2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, wide-eyed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. No, we will take you up on your offer. If you open the doors, we will run... all of us."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞪​大​眼睛​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​我们​会​接受​你​的​提议​。​如果​你​将门​打开​，​我们​会​逃跑​的​……​所有人​都​会​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 deng4 dai4 yan3jing5，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。wo3men5 hui4 jie1shou4 ni3 de5 ti2yi4。ru2guo3 ni3 jiang1 men2 da3kai1，wo3men5 hui4 tao2pao3 de5……suo3you3ren2 dou1 hui4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, wide-eyed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. No, we will take you up on your offer. We will run."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞪​大​眼睛​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​我们​会​接受​你​的​提议​。​我们​会​逃跑​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 deng4 dai4 yan3jing5，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。wo3men5 hui4 jie1shou4 ni3 de5 ti2yi4。wo3men5 hui4 tao2pao3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head. A palpable aura of bitterness surrounds him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Our cause is just. I’d thought that our supporters were just as well. \n"
"\n"
"I was a *fool.* These people don't care about the *human* cost of their actions. All that they see is the power vacuum that the death of the dragons will create, and their only care is in how they'll exploit it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​一股​浓重​的​苦涩​气息​笼罩着​他​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​的​事业​是​正义​的​。​我​以为​我们​的​支持者​也​是​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真是​个​*​傻瓜​*​。​这些​人​根本​不在乎​他们​行为​会​造成​什么​*​人类​*​代价​。​他们​看到​的​只是​巨龙​的​死亡​将​造成​的​权力​真空​，​而​他们​唯一​关心​的​是​如何​利用​它​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。yi1 gu3 nong2zhong4 de5 ku3se4 qi4xi1 long2 zhao4 zhao2 ta1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 de5 shi4ye4 shi4 zheng4yi4 de5。wo3 yi3wei2 wo3men5 de5 zhi1chi2zhe3 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1shi5 ge4*sha3gua1*。zhe4xie1 ren2 gen1ben3 bu4zai4hu5 ta1men5 xing2wei2 hui4 zao4cheng2 shen2me5*ren2lei4*dai4jia4。ta1men5 kan4dao4 de5 zhi3shi4 ju4long2 de5 si3wang2 jiang1 zao4cheng2 de5 quan2li4 zhen1kong1，er2 ta1men5 wei2yi1 guan1xin1 de5 shi4 ru2he2 li4yong4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...No. You will not."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​不​。​休想​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……bu4。xiu1xiang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Fine. If that's really what you want, we won't try to stop you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He gestures to the troll standing behind him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let 'em by, Sergej."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​好​吧​，​你​要​真想​进去​，​我​也​拦不住​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​向​身后​的​巨魔​示意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​他们​过去​吧​，​谢尔盖​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，hao3 ba1，ni3 yao4 zhen1 xiang3 jin4qu4，wo3 ye3 lan2 bu4 zhu4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 shen1hou4 de5 ju4mo2 shi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fang4 ta1men5 guo4qu4 ba1，xie4er3gai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can see that you don't understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看得出来​你​不​明白​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2 ni3 bu4 ming2bai5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can't imagine a much worse way to live, chief.\n"
"\n"
"Makes my skin crawl just thinking about it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​难​想象​还有​什么​生活​方式​比​这​更惨​，​头儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​光是​想想​就让​我​毛骨悚然​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 nan2 xiang3xiang4 hai2you3 shen2me5 sheng1huo2 fang1shi4 bi3 zhe4 geng1 can3，tou2r5。\n"
"\n"
"guang1shi4 xiang3 xiang3 jiu4 rang4 wo3 mao2gu3song3ran2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm tellin' you, one dwarf to another, the people out there are bad news. That's why we're stationed here... to keep *those* people *out.*\n"
"\n"
"There are gangs on the other side of this barricade who'd skin you alive as soon as look at you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大家​都​是​矮​人​，​我​就​跟​你​实话实说​吧​。​那边​的​人​不是​善茬​，​所以​我们​才​要​在​这儿​站岗​……​不让​墙​*​那边​*​的​人​*​出去​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过​了​路障​，​有些​帮派​只要​见到​你​就要​扒​你​的​皮​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4jia1 dou1 shi4 ai3 ren2，wo3 jiu4 gen1 ni3 shi2hua4shi2shuo1 ba1。na4bian5 de5 ren2 bu4shi4 shan4 cha2，suo3yi3 wo3men5 cai2 yao4 zai4 zhe4r5 zhan4gang3……bu4 rang4 qiang2*na4bian5*de5 ren2*chu1qu4*。\n"
"\n"
"guo4 le5 lu4zhang4，you3xie1 bang1pai4 zhi3yao4 jian4dao4 ni3 jiu4yao4 ba1 ni3 de5 pi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Misplaced empathy.\n"
"\n"
"That beast blazed a path of fiery destruction across Germany. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你共情​错​了​对象​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那头​畜生​的​火焰​在​德国​境内​造成​了​多少​破坏​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gong4 qing2 cuo4 le5 dui4xiang4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 tou2 chu4sheng5 de5 huo3yan4 zai4 de2guo2 jing4nei4 zao4cheng2 le5 duo1shao3 po4huai4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, $(l.name). No donations. Not any more.\n"
"\n"
"With the losses that we took in the attack, I have decided to close the doors on the charity. Perhaps they will open again some day... but now, it is time to grieve."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​不再​接受​捐赠​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​鉴于​我们​在​袭击​中​遭受​的​损失​，​我​决定​关闭​慈善机构​的​渠道​。​也许​有​一天​它们​会​再次​打开​……​但​现在​，​让​我们​先​哀悼​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，$(l.name)。wo3men5 bu4zai4 jie1shou4 juan1zeng4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jian4yu2 wo3men5 zai4 xi2ji1 zhong4 zao1shou4 de5 sun3shi1，wo3 jue2ding4 guan1bi4 ci2shan4ji1gou4 de5 qu2dao4。ye3xu3 you3 yi1 tian1 ta1men5 hui4 zai4ci4 da3kai1……dan4 xian4zai4，rang4 wo3men5 xian1 ai1dao4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. It took me over forty years to develop Panacea, and I'll be lucky to live another six months.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, the physiology of these creatures is so alien that I wouldn't know where to begin."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不行​。​我花​了​四十多年​才​研制​出​“​万能​药​”​，​而​现在​我能​再活​半年​就算​走运​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​更何况​这些​生物​的​生理​结构​如此​不同​，​我​根本​无从下手​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2。wo3 hua1 le5 si4 shi2 duo1 nian2 cai2 yan2zhi4 chu1“wan4neng2 yao4”，er2 xian4zai4 wo3 neng2 zai4 huo2 ban4nian2 jiu4suan4 zou3yun4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"geng1 he2 kuang4 zhe4xie1 sheng1wu4 de5 sheng1li3 jie2gou4 ru2ci3 bu4tong2，wo3 gen1ben3 wu2cong2xia4shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. No therapy for me, and certainly no medication.\n"
"\n"
"I have a reputation to live up to... however poorly deserved it is, and however little I want it.\n"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​我​不​需要​什么​治疗​或者​药物​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​不负众望​……​无论​这有​多么​名不副实​，​也​无论​我​有​多么​不想​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。wo3 bu4 xu1yao4 shen2me5 zhi4liao2 huo4zhe3 yao4wu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 bu4fu4zhong4wang4……wu2lun4 zhe4 you3 duo1me5 ming2bu4fu4shi2，ye3 wu2lun4 wo3 you3 duo1me5 bu4xiang3 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. Stopping the shipment would not stop Humanis. They would merely acquire another.\n"
"\n"
"For a pack of snarling racists, they are extremely well-funded."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​仅仅​拦截​一批​货​并​不能​阻止​人类​至上​主义者​。​他们​还会​再运​更​多货​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对于​一群​喜欢​叫嚣​的​种族主义者​而言​，​他们​的​资金​非常​充足​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。jin3jin3 lan2jie2 yi1 pi1 huo4 bing4 bu4neng2 zu3zhi3 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3。ta1men5 hai2 hui4 zai4 yun4 geng1 duo1 huo4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4yu2 yi1 qun2 xi3huan5 jiao4xiao1 de5 zhong3zu2zhu3yi4zhe3 er2yan2，ta1men5 de5 zi1jin1 fei1chang2 chong1zu2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That ain't livin', love. It's a slow death.\n"
"\n"
"Makes my skin crawl just thinking about it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​算不上​是​活着​，​亲爱​的​。​不如说是​慢性​死亡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​光是​想想​就让​我​毛骨悚然​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 suan4 bu4 shang4 shi4 huo2zhe5，qin1ai4 de5。bu4 ru2 shuo1 shi4 man4xing4 si3wang2。\n"
"\n"
"guang1shi4 xiang3 xiang3 jiu4 rang4 wo3 mao2gu3song3ran2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Truth be told, that whole chapter of my life is a bit of a blur.\n"
"\n"
"We didn't do it for the fans, or the fame... and we sure as shit didn't care about money. All that mattered to us was stayin' young, and drunk, and angry."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​现在​回想起来​，​那段​日子​的​回忆​早就​模糊不清​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​当时​不是​为了​粉丝​，​也​不是​为了​出名​……​更​他​妈​不是​为了​钱​。​对​我们​而言​，​唯一​重要​的​就是​永远​年轻​、​永远​烂醉​、​永远​愤怒​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，xian4zai4 hui2 xiang3 qi3 lai2，na4 duan4 ri4zi5 de5 hui2yi4 zao3jiu4 mo2hu5bu4qing1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dang1shi2 bu4shi4 wei4le5 fen3si1，ye3 bu4shi4 wei4le5 chu1ming2……geng1 ta1 ma1 bu4shi4 wei4le5 qian2。dui4 wo3men5 er2yan2，wei2yi1 zhong4yao4 de5 jiu4shi4 yong3yuan3 nian2qing1、yong3yuan3 lan4zui4、yong3yuan3 fen4nu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Unbelievable. Y'know, it makes my blood boil to think of how much money they make... it's people like you and me that actually keep this place *running.* And yet, the idiots at Dispatch pull in triple what we do for sitting on their asses and fouling everything up."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​简直​难以置信​。​想到​他们​赚​了​多少​钱​，​我​就​气得​浑身发抖​……​真正​让​这​地方​*​运转​起来​*​的​，​是​像​你​我​这样​的​人​。​可​那些​调度​中心​的​蠢货​，​光是​坐在​那里​搞砸​一切​，​收入​就​比​我们​高出​三倍​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jian3zhi2 nan2yi3zhi4xin4。xiang3dao4 ta1men5 zhuan4 le5 duo1shao3 qian2，wo3 jiu4 qi4 de2 hun2 shen1 fa1 dou3……zhen1zheng4 rang4 zhe4 di4fang1*yun4zhuan3 qi3lai5*de5，shi4 xiang4 ni3 wo3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2。ke3 na4xie1 diao4du4 zhong1xin1 de5 chun3huo4，guang1shi4 zuo4 zai4 na4li5 gao3za2 yi1qie4，shou1ru4 jiu4 bi3 wo3men5 gao1chu1 san1bei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, it's your call, boss. Can't say I envy you the decision."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​你​的​，​老大​。​这​决定​可真​不好​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 ni3 de5，lao3da4。zhe4 jue2ding4 ke3 zhen1 bu4hao3 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You poor fool. You don't even realize what a pawn you are."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这​傻瓜​。​你​甚至​不​知道​自己​成​了​别人​的​棋子​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4 sha3gua1。ni3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 cheng2 le5 bie2ren5 de5 qi2zi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're wearing the uniform, but you don't sound like Knight Errant. Identify yourself!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的确​穿着​制服​，​但​你​听​起来​可不​像​游侠​骑士​。​表明​你​的​身份​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 di2que4 chuan1zhuo2 zhi4fu2，dan4 ni3 ting1 qi3lai5 ke3bu5 xiang4 you2Xia2qi2shi4。biao3ming2 ni3 de5 shen1fen4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shoots you an icy stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Say what you like - it matters little to me.\n"
"\n"
"My Panacea will change the world. In the end, you will thank me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​向​你​投来​冰冷​的​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随便​你​怎么​说​吧​—​—​对​我​而言​这​无关紧要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​“​万能​药​”​会​改变​世界​。​到​最后​，​你​会​感谢​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 tou2 lai2 bing1leng3 de5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1 ba1——dui4 wo3 er2yan2 zhe4 wu2guan1jin3yao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5“wan4neng2 yao4” hui4 gai3bian4 shi4jie4。dao4 zui4hou4，ni3 hui4 gan3xie4 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shoots you an irritable glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry about me, I won't be keeling over anytime today. Now read up so that we can move on to talking about solutions."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​朝​你​投来​恼怒​的​一瞥​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​担心​我​，​今天​我​不会​突然​倒下​的​。​现在​去​把​内容​读​清楚​，​这样​我们​才能​继续​讨论​解决方案​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 tou2 lai2 nao3nu4 de5 yi1pie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 dan1xin1 wo3，jin1tian1 wo3 bu4hui4 tu1ran2 dao3xia4 de5。xian4zai4 qu4 ba3 nei4rong2 dou4 qing1chu5，zhe4yang4 wo3men5 cai2neng2 ji4xu4 tao3lun4 jie3 jue2 fang1 an4。"

msgid "{{GM}}He shoulders his weapon.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​将​武器​抵肩​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 wu3qi4 di3 jian1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs his broad shoulders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We live in a complicated world. The Christian tradition that much of Germany adheres to would argue that the Adversary *is* Lucifer, yes. But many other traditions would disagree."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸​宽阔​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​生活​在​一个​复杂​的​世界​中​。​德国​多数​人​信奉​的​基督教​传统​认为​反叛者​*​正是​*​路西​法​。​但​许多​其他​传统​则​持​不同​见解​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 kuan1kuo4 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 sheng1huo2 zai4 yi1ge5 fu4za2 de5 shi4jie4 zhong4。de2guo2 duo1shu4 ren2 xin4feng4 de5 ji1du1jiao4 chuan2tong3 ren4wei2 fan3 pan4 zhe3*zheng4shi4*lu4 xi1 fa3。dan4 xu3duo1 qi2ta1 chuan2tong3 ze2 chi2 bu4tong2 jian4jie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs his massive shoulders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Better. Worse. Who the fuck cares? The world was going to hell anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸​宽大​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​更好​，​更坏​，​谁他妈​在乎​呢​？​反正​这个​世界​注定​要​完蛋​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 kuan1da4 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"geng1 hao3，geng1 huai4，shei2 ta1 ma1 zai4hu5 ni2？fan3zheng4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 zhu4ding4 yao4 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs his massive shoulders.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Changed. Doomed. Who the fuck cares? The world was going to hell anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸​宽大​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​改变​也好​，​毁灭​也罢​，​谁他妈​在乎​呢​？​反正​这个​世界​注定​要​完蛋​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 kuan1da4 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai3bian4 ye3hao3，hui3mie4 ye3ba4，shei2 ta1 ma1 zai4hu5 ni2？fan3zheng4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 zhu4ding4 yao4 wan2dan4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs, then nods toward the building entrance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No help, no access. And I can't guarantee your safety out here on the street.\n"
"\n"
"It's your choice."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​，​然后​朝​建筑​入口处​努了​努嘴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​帮忙​，​就​没法​进​。​别​指望​我们​能​保证​你​在​街上​的​安全​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​自己​选​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1，ran2hou4 chao2 jian4zhu4 ru4 kou3 chu3 nu3 le5 nu3zui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 bang1mang2，jiu4 mei2fa3 jin4。bie4 zhi3wang4 wo3men5 neng2 bao3zheng4 ni3 zai4 jie1shang5 de5 an1quan2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zi4ji3 xuan3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A drink's a drink. Enjoy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​酒​没什么​高下​之分​。​喝​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu3 mei2shen2me5 gao1xia4 zhi1 fen4。he4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Be my guest. Go play with the torture-gangs.\n"
"\n"
"Something tells me you'd be a better fit out there anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​啊​，​随你便​。​和​虐待狂​玩儿​去​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这种​人​还是​去​那​一边​更​合适​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 a1，sui2 ni3 bian4。he4 nu:e4dai4kuang2 wan2r5 qu4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4zhong3 ren2 hai2shi5 qu4 na4 yi1bian1 geng1 he2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. That sick bastard of a rigger is dead, and we got paid.\n"
"\n"
"Feels like a win to me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​那个​变态​机师​死​了​，​我们​的​钱​也​到手​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​这趟​差事​挺​成功​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，na4ge5 bian4tai4 ji1shi1 si3 le5，wo3men5 de5 qian2 ye3 dao4shou3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 ting3 cheng2gong1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Besides, what other choice do we have? We cannot run, and money will do us little good if we're dead."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再说​了​，​我们​有​得​选​吗​？​反正​我们​是​逃不掉​的​。​而​要是​我们​死​了​，​钱​还有​什么​用​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1 le5，wo3men5 you3 de2 xuan3 ma5？fan3zheng4 wo3men5 shi4 tao2 bu4 diao4 de5。er2 yao4shi5 wo3men5 si3 le5，qian2 hai2you3 shen2me5 yong4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But maybe that's not a bad thing. It'd take a lot of the guesswork out of life.\n"
"\n"
"I dunno, boss. If you have any thoughts about this, I'd love to hear 'em."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​说不定​也​不是​什么​坏事​。​能​免去​我​人生​中​的​许多​纠结​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​如果​你​对此​有​什么​想法​，​我​洗耳恭听​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 shuo1bu5ding4 ye3 bu4shi4 shen2me5 huai4shi4。neng2 mian3 qu4 wo3 ren2sheng1 zhong4 de5 xu3duo1 jiu1jie2。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，ru2guo3 ni3 dui4 ci3 you3 shen2me5 xiang3fa3，wo3 xi3er3gong1ting1。"

