"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​没​问题​啊​。​就​像​我​刚​说​的​，​它​和​地脉​基本​就是​一​回事​……​只要​你​不​去​惹恼​屠龙​者​的话​，​我​不​觉得​会​有​任何​问题​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​精魂​导师​，​祂​从​不吝​于​赐予​恩典​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 mei2 wen4ti2 a1。jiu4 xiang4 wo3 gang1 shuo1 de5，ta1 he4 di4mai4 ji1ben3 jiu4shi4 yi1 hui2shi4……zhi3yao4 ni3 bu4 qu4 re3nao3 tu2 long2 zhe3 de5hua4，wo3 bu4 jue2de5 hui4 you3 ren4he2 wen4ti2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 jing1hun2 dao3shi1，ta1 cong2 bu4lin4 yu2 ci4yu3 en1dian3。"

