"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey, if you wanna be paranoid, you go ahead and knock yourself out.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else? Go ahead, get it out in the open... better that than letting it fester."
