"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​一定​要​这么​偏执​的话​，​那​就​随​你​的​便​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​事​吗​？​有话​尽管​说​吧​……​说​出来​总比藏​着​掖​着​要​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yi1ding4 yao4 zhe4me5 pian1zhi2 de5hua4，na4 jiu4 sui2 ni3 de5 bian4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？you3 hua4 jin3guan3 shuo1 ba1……shuo1 chu1lai2 zong3 bi3 zang4 zhao2 ye1 zhao2 yao4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I guess we'll never know."
