"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​我们​永远​也​不会​知道​真相​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 wo3men5 yong3yuan3 ye3 bu4hui4 zhi1dao4 zhen1xiang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you knew 'em, you'd do the same.\n"
"\n"
"Miserable bastards, the lot of 'em... no appreciation for creativity."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​你​认识​他们​，​你​也​会​做​同样​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这帮​人​都​是​些​悲​催​的​混蛋​……​不​懂​欣赏​创造力​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 ni3 ren4shi5 ta1men5，ni3 ye3 hui4 zuo4 tong2yang4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bang1 ren2 dou1 shi4 xie1 bei1 cui1 de5 hun2dan4……bu4 dong3 xin1shang3 chuang4zao4li4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is about as I had expected. Thankfully, we are prepared for this.\n"
"\n"
"I have established contact with a number of new clients. You can find information on the jobs logged on your mission computer. One job's file is on there already."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​差不多​是​这个​价​。​好​在​我们​有所准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​联系​上​了​几位​新​客户​。​你​可以​登录​任务​电脑​，​查看​其中​的​差事​情报​。​目前​正有​一份​差事​等​你​接手​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cha4bu5duo1 shi4 zhe4ge5 jia4。hao3 zai4 wo3men5 you3 suo3 zhun3 bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 lian2xi4 shang4 le5 ji1 wei4 xin1 ke4hu4。ni3 ke3yi3 deng1lu4 ren4wu5 dian4nao3，cha2kan4 qi2zhong1 de5 cha4shi4 qing2bao4。mu4qian2 zheng1 you3 yi1 fen4 cha4shi4 deng3 ni3 jie1shou3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
