"{{GM}}​他​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就是​生体​殖装​。​很​普通​的​东西​。​痛觉​编辑器​、​创伤​减震器​、​矫形​皮肤​之类​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1。hen3 pu3tong1 de5 dong1xi1。tong4jue2 bian1ji2qi4、chuang1shang1 jian3zhen4qi4、jiao3xing2 pi2fu1 zhi1lei4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's bound to happen eventually. Probably sooner rather than later."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​迟早​的​事​，​而且​很​可能​不会​太久​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 chi2zao3 de5 shi4，er2qie3 hen3 ke3neng2 bu4hui4 tai4 jiu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
