"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​没什么​所谓​了​。​我​这辈子​已经​花太多​时间​在​人前​装模作样​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 mei2shen2me5 suo3wei4 le5。wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 yi3jing1 hua1 tai4 duo1 shi2jian1 zai4 ren2 qian2 zhuang1mo2zuo4yang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
