msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​可能​吧​。​毕竟​我​也​不​确定​你​说​的​具体​是​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 ke3neng2 ba1。bi4jing4 wo3 ye3 bu4 que4ding4 ni3 shuo1 de5 ju4ti3 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My daughter married young. You got a problem with that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​女儿​结婚​比较​早​。​你​有​什么​意见​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 nu:3er2 jie2hun1 bi3jiao4 zao3。ni3 you3 shen2me5 yi4jian4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not much to tell. He chose me when I was just a kid... I could always feel Him in my heart, goadin' me to laugh louder, hit harder, and get rowdier than the rest.\n"
"\n"
"'Course, my family didn't understand... but \"the hell with 'em,\" I thought. I knew that I was destined for greater things."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没太多​可​说​的​，​当​我​还是​个​孩子​的​时候​祂​就​选中​了​我​……​我​总能​感受​到​祂​在​我​心底​催促​着​我​：​笑​得​更​大声​些​，​打得​更​狠些​，​比​谁​都​更​闹腾​些​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​我​的​家人​对此​并​不​理解​……​但是​我​想着​“​去​他妈的​吧​”​，​老子​这辈子​命中注定​要​做出​一番​大​事业​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 tai4 duo1 ke3 shuo1 de5，dang1 wo3 hai2shi5 ge4 hai2zi5 de5 shi2hou5 ta1 jiu4 xuan3zhong4 le5 wo3……wo3 zong3neng2 gan3shou4 dao4 ta1 zai4 wo3 xin1di3 cui1cu4 zhao2 wo3：xiao4 de2 geng1 da4sheng1 xie1，da3 de2 geng1 hen3 xie1，bi3 shei2 dou1 geng1 nao4teng5 xie1。\n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 de5 jia1ren2 dui4 ci3 bing4 bu4 li3jie3……dan4shi4 wo3 xiang3 zhao2“qu4 ta1ma1de5 ba1”，lao3zi3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 ming4zhong1zhu4ding4 yao4 zuo4chu1 yi1 fan1 dai4 shi4ye4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not too long. Ever since I took down the last one."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也​没多久​吧​，​从​我​干掉​上​一个​开始​算​的话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3 mei2duo1jiu3 ba1，cong2 wo3 gan4diao4 shang4 yi1ge5 kai1shi3 suan4 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
