"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​说​呢​。​这​就是​命​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 shuo1 ni2。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ming4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Only until he gets the thing up and running again. \"Deactivated\" isn't the same thing as \"broken.\""
