"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​只是​到​他​的​设备​重新​恢复​功能​而已​。​“​失效​”​并不等于​“​损坏​”​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi3shi4 dao4 ta1 de5 she4bei4 chong2xin1 hui1fu4 gong1neng2 er2yi3。“shi1xiao4” bing4 bu4 deng3 yu2“sun3huai4”。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Probably not. But it's the little touches that make this job worth doing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​没有​。​但​就是​这种​小​细节​才​让​差事​值得​一做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 mei2you3。dan4 jiu4shi4 zhe4zhong3 xiao3 xi4jie2 cai2 rang4 cha4shi4 zhi2de5 yi1 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Summarize as you wish. History will prove me right. Nevertheless, I am done discussing this with you. \n"
"\n"
"Feuerschwinge must fly, Berlin must be sacrificed, and it must be tonight.\n"
"\n"
"Now... where is that damned Audran?"
