"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随便​你​怎么​总结​。​历史​会​证明​我​是​对​的​。​总之​我​不会​再​继续​讨论​下去​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​必须​再度​翱翔​，​柏林​必须​被​牺牲​，​就​在​今晚​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​……​那个​该死​的​奥​德兰​去​哪​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 zong3jie2。li4shi3 hui4 zheng4ming2 wo3 shi4 dui4 de5。zong3zhi1 wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 ji4xu4 tao3lun4 xia4qu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4 bi4xu1 zai4du4 ao2xiang2，bo2lin2 bi4xu1 bei4 xi1sheng1，jiu4 zai4 jin1wan3。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4……na4ge5 gai1si3 de5 Ao4de2lan2 qu4 na3 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sure, that too. Either way, we should keep moving - time's a-wasting."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​是​是​，​也​有​可能​。​总之​我们​还是​走​吧​，​别​浪费时间​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，ye3 you3 ke3neng2。zong3zhi1 wo3men5 hai2shi5 zou3 ba1，bie4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well. Perhaps another time.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else that you could use from me...?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​下次​再说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那么​，​我​还有​其他​可以​效劳​的​吗​……​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，xia4ci4 zai4shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，wo3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 ke3yi3 xiao4lao2 de5 ma5……？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, you've got a point there. \n"
"\n"
"Tell you what. Like I said, we had a bunch of weapons stashed in the basement before the Magnifikers showed up. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​你​说​得​也​有​道理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​吧​。​我​刚才​说​了​，​在​伟术​帮​出现​之前​，​我们​在​地下室​藏​了​一批​武器​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，ni3 shuo1 de2 ye3 you3 dao4li5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1。wo3 gang1cai2 shuo1 le5，zai4 wei3 shu4 bang1 chu1xian4 zhi1qian2，wo3men5 zai4 di4xia4shi4 zang4 le5 yi1 pi1 wu3qi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't question the Dragonslayer, boss. It's never a good idea.\n"
"\n"
"Besides, if you can't see the utility of a thing like this, I don't know what to tell you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​永远​不要​质疑​屠龙​者​。​这​可不是​什么​好​主意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​，​如果​你​连​它​的​作用​都​看不出来​，​那​我​也​不​知道​该​怎么​和​你​说​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，yong3yuan3 bu4yao4 zhi4yi2 tu2 long2 zhe3。zhe4 ke3bu5shi4 shen2me5 hao3 zhu3yi5。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4，ru2guo3 ni3 lian2 ta1 de5 zuo4yong4 dou1 kan4 bu4 chu1 lai2，na4 wo3 ye3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 he4 ni3 shuo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your call, of course. Just thought I should bring it up."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​决定权​在​你​。​我​就是​觉得​应该​提​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，jue2 ding4 quan2 zai4 ni3。wo3 jiu4shi4 jue2de5 ying1gai1 ti2 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He shuffles uncomfortably.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, we've got aid stations set up for anyone who comes back through the rift... if anyone comes back through. They've got food, water, blankets... that kind of thing.\n"
"\n"
"I also sent in a few drones, but I lost contact with 'em as soon as they went in."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​不安​地​挪动​着​身子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​我们​在​裂隙​入口处​设置​了​援助​站​，​供​任何​穿越​裂隙​返回​的​人​使用​……​如果​真​有人​能​活着​回来​的话​。​那里​备有​食物​、​饮水​、​毛毯​……​这​类​必需品​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​派​了​几架​无人机​进去​，​但​它们​刚​进入​裂隙​就​失去​了​联系​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bu4an1 de5 nuo2dong4 zhao2 shen1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3men5 zai4 lie4xi4 ru4 kou3 chu3 she4zhi4 le5 yuan2zhu4 zhan4，gong1 ren4he2 chuan1yue4 lie4xi4 fan3hui2 de5 ren2 shi3yong4……ru2guo3 zhen1 you3ren2 neng2 huo2zhe5 hui2lai5 de5hua4。na4li5 bei4 you3 shi2wu4、yin3shui3、mao2tan3……zhe4 lei4 bi4xu1pin3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 pai4 le5 ji1 jia4 wu2ren2ji1 jin4qu4，dan4 ta1men5 gang1 jin4ru4 lie4xi4 jiu4 shi1qu4 le5 lian2xi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A crude analogy... but yes. All things being equal, a careful approach would be best.\n"
"\n"
"Unfortunately, all things are *not* equal. We don't have time to deal with each dragon on an individual basis. We must wipe them out in a single stroke, and *that* is what Panacea will do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​个​粗糙​的​比喻​……​但​确实​如此​。​在​其他​条件​相同​的​情况​下​，​谨慎​行事​是​最佳​选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​遗憾​的​是​，​其他​条件​*​并​不​*​相同​。​我们​没有​时间​逐一​应对​每头​巨龙​。​我们​必须​一举​消灭​他们​，​而​*​这​*​就是​“​万能​药​”​将要​做​的​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ge4 cu1cao1 de5 bi3yu4……dan4 que4shi2 ru2ci3。zai4 qi2ta1 tiao2jian4 xiang1tong2 de5 qing2kuang4 xia4，jin3shen4 xing2shi4 shi4 zui4jia1 xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"yi2han4 de5 shi4，qi2ta1 tiao2jian4*bing4 bu4*xiang1tong2。wo3men5 mei2you3 shi2jian1 zhu2yi1 ying4dui4 mei3 tou2 ju4long2。wo3men5 bi4xu1 yi1ju3 xiao1mie4 ta1men5，er2*zhe4*jiu4shi4“wan4neng2 yao4” jiang1yao4 zuo4 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But you are looking for specifics, and you will continue asking until you have them. The impetuousness of youth.\n"
"\n"
"Very well, then. I will attempt to provide the clarity that you seek."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​执意​追问​细节​，​非​要​得到​答案​不可​。​年轻人​就是​这么​鲁莽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然如此​，​我会​尽量​尝试​揭示​你​所​渴求​的​真相​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 zhi2yi4 zhui1wen4 xi4jie2，fei1 yao4 de2dao4 da2an4 bu4ke3。nian2qing1ren2 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 lu3mang3。\n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 hui4 jin3liang4 chang2shi4 jie1shi4 ni3 suo3 ke3qiu2 de5 zhen1xiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Could be fun, right? So count me in, I guess."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​起来​挺​有意思​吧​？​所以​算​我​一个​好​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 ting3 you3yi4si5 ba1？suo3yi3 suan4 wo3 yi1ge5 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If the draconic threat could be stopped by the \"scientific community\", we wouldn't be having this conversation. \n"
"\n"
"I won't deny the risks. But this..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​巨龙​的​威胁​能​通过​“​科学​社区​”​加以​阻止​的话​，​我们​也​就​不​需要​进行​这​段​对话​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​否认​其中​的​风险​。​但​这个​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ju4long2 de5 wei1xie2 neng2 tong1guo4“ke1xue2 she4qu1” jia1yi3 zu3zhi3 de5hua4，wo3men5 ye3 jiu4 bu4 xu1yao4 jin4xing2 zhe4 duan4 dui4hua4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 fou3ren4 qi2zhong1 de5 feng1xian3。dan4 zhe4ge5……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's your call, $(l.name). But I'd at least recommend finding an alternative path into the building... something out of sight.\n"
"\n"
"Once the facility calls for help, you're going to be on a tight timetable."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​决定权​在​你​，​$(l.name)​。​但​我​至少​建议​先​另寻​他路​进入​大楼​……​不​引人注目​的​那种​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一旦​设施​人员​请求​增援​的话​，​你们​的​时间​就​很​紧迫​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jue2 ding4 quan2 zai4 ni3，$(l.name)。dan4 wo3 zhi4shao3 jian4yi4 xian1 ling4 xun2 ta1 lu4 jin4ru4 da4lou2……bu4 yin3ren2zhu4mu4 de5 na4zhong3。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dan4 she4shi1 ren2yuan2 qing3qiu2 zeng1yuan2 de5hua4，ni3men5 de5 shi2jian1 jiu4 hen3 jin3po4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"More than you could know.\n"
"\n"
"Most folks don't even believe that they exist, but bein' a shaman in Berlin has its perks. I've seen enough evidence to believe."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​比​你​想​的​还要​危险​得​多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​大多数​人​甚至​不​相信​他们​真的​存在​，​但​在​柏林​干萨满​这行​，​自然​是​有​渠道​的​。​我​见得多了​，​不得不​信​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi3 ni3 xiang3 de5 hai2 yao4 wei1xian3 de2 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"da4duo1shu4 ren2 shen4zhi4 bu4 xiang1xin4 ta1men5 zhen1de5 cun2zai4，dan4 zai4 bo2lin2 gan4 sa4 man3 zhe4 xing2，zi4ran2 shi4 you3 qu2dao4 de5。wo3 jian4 de2 duo1 le5，bu4de2bu4 xin4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Then you shall have one.\n"
"\n"
"Where to begin...? "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​就​告诉​你​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​哪里​开始​呢​……​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 jiu4 gao4su4 ni3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 na3li3 kai1shi3 ni2……？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What didn't they?\n"
"\n"
"Theft, medical malpractice, the sale of stolen goods. Other, more colorful accusations that do not bear repeating."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么样​的​说辞​都​有​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​盗窃​、​医疗事故​、​销售​赃物​。​其他​更​多​不胜枚举​的​指控​就​不​一一​赘述​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shen2me5yang4 de5 shuo1ci2 dou1 you3。\n"
"\n"
"dao4qie4、yi1 liao2 shi4 gu4、xiao1shou4 zang1wu4。qi2ta1 geng1 duo1 bu4sheng4mei2ju3 de5 zhi3kong4 jiu4 bu4 yi1yi1 zhui4shu4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}He sighs.{{/GM}} Fine, sure, whatever. You can have the parts."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​行​吧​，​随便​了​。​零件​归​你​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} xing2 ba1，sui2bian4 le5。ling2jian4 gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He slams his fists against the glass, his face contorted into a mask of rage and grief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"HOW *DARE* YOU PRESUME TO SPEAK FOR MY BROTHER! To hell with letting you live - you're going to have *front and center* seats for Feuerschwinge's return! I will see to it MYSELF!\n"
"\n"
"I'm... I..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​用​拳头​猛击​玻璃​，​脸上​扭曲​成​一副​愤怒​与​悲痛​的​扭曲​面具​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​怎么​敢​*​擅自​代表​我​弟弟​说话​！​这下​你​别​想​活命​了​—​—​等到​火翼​归来​的​时候​，​你​会​坐在​距离​*​最近​*​的​观景​席​！​我​说到做到​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 quan2tou5 meng3ji1 bo1li5，lian3 shang4 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1 fu4 fen4nu4 yu4 bei1tong4 de5 niu3qu1 mian4ju4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*zen3me5 gan3*shan4zi4 dai4biao3 wo3 di4di5 shuo1hua4！zhe4xia4 ni3 bie4 xiang3 huo2ming4 le5——deng3dao4 Huo3yi4 gui1lai2 de5 shi2hou5，ni3 hui4 zuo4 zai4 ju4li2*zui4jin4*de5 guan1 jing3 xi2！wo3 shuo1dao4zuo4dao4！\n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He slumps into the chair next to him, his whole body shaking.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... \n"
"\n"
"I didn't..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瘫坐​在​旁边​的​椅子​上​，​全身​都​在​发抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没有​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1 zuo4 zai4 pang2bian1 de5 yi3zi5 shang4，quan2shen1 dou1 zai4 fa1dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smiles big. The Turkish vendor again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are already being compensated, Most Masterful of Mercenaries! Do you not recall? Kami is fetching your information for you.\n"
"\n"
"Returning the favor would be the courteous thing to do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​重新​露出​土耳其​小贩​式​的​招牌​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​付给​你​报酬​了​啊​，​佣兵​大师​！​难道​你​这​就​忘​了​？​卡米​不是​正替​你​去​收集​情报​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​礼尚往来​，​这才​是​礼貌​的​做法​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 chong2xin1 lu4chu1 tu3er3qi2 xiao3fan4 shi4 de5 zhao1pai5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 fu4gei3 ni3 bao4chou5 le5 a1，yong1bing1 da4shi1！nan2dao4 ni3 zhe4 jiu4 wang4 le5？Ka3mi3 bu4shi4 zheng1 ti4 ni3 qu4 shou1ji2 qing2bao4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"li3shang4wang3lai2，zhe4 cai2 shi4 li3mao4 de5 zuo4fa3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smiles broadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Excellent work. Perhaps you do have a future in this town.\n"
"\n"
"Here is your pay."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​做得好​。​也许​你​在​这里​真能​混出​一番​名堂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​你​的​报酬​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zuo4 de2 hao3。ye3xu3 ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 zhen1 neng2 hun4 chu1 yi1 fan1 ming2tang5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 bao4chou5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smiles thinly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very good. I like a $(l.man) who knows what $(l.he) is, and what $(l.he) wants.\n"
"\n"
"So. What is your takeaway from this discussion? I would like to hear your thoughts."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​淡淡​一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常​好​，​我​喜欢​了解​自己​的​本质​，​以及​了解​自己​想要​什么​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​你​对​这次​谈话​有​什么​感想​？​我​想​听听​你​的​说法​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dan4dan4 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fei1chang2 hao3，wo3 xi3huan5 liao3jie3 zi4ji3 de5 ben3zhi4，yi3ji2 liao3jie3 zi4ji3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 dui4 zhe4 ci4 tan2hua4 you3 shen2me5 gan3xiang3？wo3 xiang3 ting1 ting1 ni3 de5 shuo1fa3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As luck would have it, I have nothing but time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还好​，​我​最不缺​的​就是​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2hao3，wo3 zui4 bu4 que1 de5 jiu4shi4 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know what you mean.\n"
"\n"
"Well, enjoy the rest of your patrol. Don't get your hopes up, though... it's dead in here tonight."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​懂​你​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​祝​你​巡逻​愉快​吧​。​不过​，​别抱​什么​期望​……​今晚​这里​可​冷清​得​很​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dong3 ni3 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 zhu4 ni3 xun2luo2 yu2kuai4 ba1。bu4guo4，bie4 bao4 shen2me5 qi1wang4……jin1wan3 zhe4li3 ke3 leng3qing1 de2 hen3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nice try. But no."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​态度​不错​。​但​还是​没门儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tai4du5 bu4cuo4。dan4 hai2shi5 mei2men2r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks at you, but his hands are still trembling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're trying to get under my skin. To rub my nose in this, yes?\n"
"\n"
"Well, the joke is on you. I've already accepted the consequences of my actions. I own them; they are mine to atone for, and mine alone."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​冲​你​冷笑​，​但​双手​仍​在​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这​是​想​激怒​我​吧​？​想​让​我​难堪​，​是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这样​做​才​是​可笑​的​。​我​早已​接受​自己​行为​的​后果​。​这些​罪过​由​我​承担​，​唯有​我​独自​赎罪​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 leng3xiao4，dan4 shuang1shou3 reng2 zai4 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi4 xiang3 ji1nu4 wo3 ba1？xiang3 rang4 wo3 nan2kan1，shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4yang4 zuo4 cai2 shi4 ke3xiao4 de5。wo3 zao3yi3 jie1shou4 zi4ji3 xing2wei2 de5 hou4guo3。zhe4xie1 zui4guo5 you2 wo3 cheng2dan1，wei2you3 wo3 du2zi4 shu2zui4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks through the pain, then coughs up a great wad of bloody phlegm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You looking for my secret motivation? Like, maybe... I was burned by a dragon as a kid... and now I want them all dead?\n"
"\n"
"Gonna have to... disappoint you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​忍​着​疼痛​冷​哼​一声​，​随后​咳出​一大口​带血​的​痰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​找​我​的​秘密​动机​吗​？​比如说​……​我​小时候​被​巨龙​烧伤​了​……​现在​我​想要​它们​全部​死​掉​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​……​要​让​你​失望​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ren3 zhao2 teng2tong4 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1，sui2hou4 hai1 chu1 yi1 dai4 kou3 dai4 xie3 de5 tan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 zhao3 wo3 de5 mi4mi4 dong4ji1 ma5？bi3ru2shuo1……wo3 xiao3shi2hou5 bei4 ju4long2 shao1shang1 le5……xian4zai4 wo3 xiang3yao4 ta1men5 quan2bu4 si3 diao4？\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4……yao4 rang4 ni3 shi1wang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks through the pain.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Guess so."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​忍​着​痛​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ren3 zhao2 tong4 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks through the pain.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My party... I’ll die when I’m ready."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​忍​着​痛​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​小队​……​轮到​我​的​时候​，​我会​死​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ren3 zhao2 tong4 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 xiao3 dui4……lun2dao4 wo3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 hui4 si3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks, his jowls quivering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nice try, but I doubt that's true."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​，​下巴​上​的​肉​抖动着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​态度​不错​，​但​我​不​太​相信​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，xia4ba5 shang4 de5 rou4 dou3 dong4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tai4du5 bu4cuo4，dan4 wo3 bu4 tai4 xiang1xin4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll do my best to remember that from now on."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以后​一定​会​记得​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3hou4 yi1ding4 hui4 ji4de5 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If that was supposed to wound me, well... it didn't."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​以为​这样​会​让​我​失望​吗​？​很​可惜​，​并​没有​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3wei2 zhe4yang4 hui4 rang4 wo3 shi1wang4 ma5？hen3 ke3xi1，bing4 mei2you3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See that, girls? That's your typical trog, right there. Great big fists and a brain the size of a walnut.\n"
"\n"
"You calm down, trog, or my girls will shoot you dead. It'd be tragic if you missed the big show."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​轻蔑地笑​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看见​了​吗​，​姑娘​们​？​典型​的​穴居人​就长​这样​。​拳头​大得​像​砂锅​，​脑子​小得​像​核桃​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​给​我​冷静​点​，​猿人​，​不然​我​的​姑娘​们​就​把​你​射成​筛子​。​你​要是​错过​接下来​的​好戏​可​就​太​遗憾​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qing1 mie4 de5 xiao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4jian4 le5 ma5，gu1niang5 men5？dian3xing2 de5 xue2ju1ren2 jiu4 zhang3 zhe4yang4。quan2tou5 dai4 de2 xiang4 sha1guo1，nao3zi5 xiao3 de2 xiang4 he2tao5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gei3 wo3 leng3jing4 dian3，yuan2ren2，bu4ran2 wo3 de5 gu1niang5 men5 jiu4 ba3 ni3 she4 cheng2 shai1zi5。ni3 yao4shi5 cuo4guo4 jie1xia4lai2 de5 hao3 xi4 ke3 jiu4 tai4 yi2han4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sure! Wouldn't be a big deal. I used to do it all the time back in Drogenkippe.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He raises an eyebrow at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your call, though, chief. Obviously."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​！​小事一桩​而已​。​以前​在​毒​坑区​的​时候​，​我​成天​干​这种​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​朝​你​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​决定权​当然​在​你​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2！xiao3shi4yi1zhuang1 er2yi3。yi3qian2 zai4 du2 keng1 qu1 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 cheng2tian1 gan4 zhe4zhong3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，jue2 ding4 quan2 dang1ran2 zai4 ni3，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, enjoy the walk. And get used to it... they'll have you walking perimeter for the next few months at least."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​可​有​得​享受​了​。​习惯​就​好​……​至少​未来​几个​月​里​你​都​得​做​这个​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 ke3 you3 de2 xiang3shou4 le5。xi2guan4 jiu4 hao3……zhi4shao3 wei4lai2 ji3ge5 yue4 li3 ni3 dou1 de2 zuo4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You got it, pal."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​得意​地​笑了起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​必须​的​，​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de2yi4 de5 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 de5，peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He snarls up at Eiger, his face screwed into a look of pure hatred.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The chip is everything. EVERYTHING! It's worth DYING FOR!\n"
"\n"
"I was ignorant once, like you. But then my EYES WERE OPENED, and I SAW! The chip... slot one, and you become a *GOD!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​怒视​着​艾格尔​，​脸上​扭曲​着​纯粹​的​仇恨​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​芯片​就是​一切​。​一切​！​我​就是​死​了​也​值得​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​曾经​和​你们​一样​无知​。​但​后来​我​开辟​了​视界​，​我​看到​了​！​这​芯片​……​装​上​一块​，​你​就​会​成为​*​神​*​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nu4shi4 zhao2 Ai4ge2er3，lian3 shang4 niu3qu1 zhao2 chun2cui4 de5 chou2hen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xin1pian4 jiu4shi4 yi1qie4。yi1qie4！wo3 jiu4shi4 si3 le5 ye3 zhi2de5！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ceng2jing1 he4 ni3men5 yi1yang4 wu2zhi1。dan4 hou4lai2 wo3 kai1pi4 le5 shi4jie4，wo3 kan4dao4 le5！zhe4 xin1pian4……zhuang1 shang4 yi1kuai4，ni3 jiu4 hui4 cheng2wei2*shen2*！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sneers at you through the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"Wrong.\" An interesting choice of words.\n"
"\n"
"I'd wager almost anything that over the next five years, your new friend will kill and absorb hundreds of deckers. That's what it was designed to do. Murder is in its *nature*."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​从​玻璃​那头​向​你​嗤之以鼻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​错误​”​的​事​。​这个​说法​可真有​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我敢​打赌​，​在​未来​五年​内​，​你​的​这位​新​朋友​将​杀死​并​吸收​数百名​碟客​。​这​就是​它​被​设计​出来​的​目的​。​杀戮​是​它​的​*​天性​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 bo1li5 na4 tou2 xiang4 ni3 chi1zhi1yi3bi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“cuo4wu4” de5 shi4。zhe4ge5 shuo1fa3 ke3 zhen1 you3 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 da3du3，zai4 wei4lai2 wu3 nian2 nei4，ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 xin1 peng2you5 jiang1 sha1si3 bing4 xi1shou1 shu3 bai3 ming2 die2 ke4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1 bei4 she4ji4 chu1lai2 de5 mu4di4。sha1lu4 shi4 ta1 de5*tian1xing4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sneers at you through the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Idle curiosity. That's your rationale. You were *curious.*\n"
"\n"
"I'd wager almost anything that over the next five years, your new friend will kill and absorb hundreds of deckers. That's what it was designed to do. Murder is in its *nature*."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​从​玻璃​那头​向​你​嗤之以鼻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​闲来无事​的​好奇心​。​这​就是​你​的​理由​吗​。​只是​*​好奇​*​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我敢​打赌​，​在​未来​五年​内​，​你​的​这位​新​朋友​将​杀死​并​吸收​数百名​碟客​。​这​就是​它​被​设计​出来​的​目的​。​杀戮​是​它​的​*​天性​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 bo1li5 na4 tou2 xiang4 ni3 chi1zhi1yi3bi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian2lai2wu2shi4 de5 hao4qi2xin1。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ni3 de5 li3you2 ma5。zhi3shi4*hao4qi2*er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 da3du3，zai4 wei4lai2 wu3 nian2 nei4，ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 xin1 peng2you5 jiang1 sha1si3 bing4 xi1shou1 shu3 bai3 ming2 die2 ke4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1 bei4 she4ji4 chu1lai2 de5 mu4di4。sha1lu4 shi4 ta1 de5*tian1xing4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sneers at you through the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The \"right\" thing. An interesting choice of words.\n"
"\n"
"I'd wager almost anything that over the next five years, your new friend will kill and absorb hundreds of deckers. That's what it was designed to do. Murder is in its *nature*."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​从​玻璃​那头​向​你​嗤之以鼻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​正确​”​的​事​。​这个​说法​可真有​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我敢​打赌​，​在​未来​五年​内​，​你​的​这位​新​朋友​将​杀死​并​吸收​数百名​碟客​。​这​就是​它​被​设计​出来​的​目的​。​杀戮​是​它​的​*​天性​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 bo1li5 na4 tou2 xiang4 ni3 chi1zhi1yi3bi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“zheng4que4” de5 shi4。zhe4ge5 shuo1fa3 ke3 zhen1 you3 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gan3 da3du3，zai4 wei4lai2 wu3 nian2 nei4，ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 xin1 peng2you5 jiang1 sha1si3 bing4 xi1shou1 shu3 bai3 ming2 die2 ke4。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1 bei4 she4ji4 chu1lai2 de5 mu4di4。sha1lu4 shi4 ta1 de5*tian1xing4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sneers at you, parchment-thin skin sliding over his bony face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, in that case, perhaps I should get back to work. I wouldn't want to *bore* you.\n"
"\n"
"It's past time that this conversation came to an end."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​你​轻蔑​一笑​，​纸​一样​薄​的​皮肤​覆盖​在​他​骨瘦如柴​的​脸上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然如此​，​我​还是​回去​工作​吧​。​我​可​不想​让​你​觉得​*​无聊​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​时候​结束​这场​对话​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 qing1mie4 yi1 xiao4，zhi3 yi1yang4 bao2 de5 pi2fu1 fu4gai4 zai4 ta1 gu3shou4ru2chai2 de5 lian3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，wo3 hai2shi5 hui2qu5 gong1zuo4 ba1。wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 rang4 ni3 jue2de5*wu2liao2*。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi2hou5 jie2shu4 zhe4 chang2 dui4hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He sneers at you, parchment-thin skin sliding over his bony face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've succeeded. I think that I'm just about done with you.\n"
"\n"
"And besides, why am I talking to you? You're trapped in there, and I've still got work to do. Audran will be here for you soon enough."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​你​轻蔑​一笑​，​纸​一样​薄​的​皮肤​覆盖​在​他​骨瘦如柴​的​脸上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​成功​了​。​我​不​打算​再​继续​纠缠​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再说​，​我​为什么​要​跟​你​说话​？​你​被困​在​这里​，​而​我​还有​工作​要​做​。​奥​德兰​很快​就​会​来​收拾​你们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 qing1mie4 yi1 xiao4，zhi3 yi1yang4 bao2 de5 pi2fu1 fu4gai4 zai4 ta1 gu3shou4ru2chai2 de5 lian3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 cheng2gong1 le5。wo3 bu4 da3suan4 zai4 ji4xu4 jiu1chan2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1，wo3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 gen1 ni3 shuo1hua4？ni3 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3，er2 wo3 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。Ao4de2lan2 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 lai2 shou1shi5 ni3men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He snorts a brief assent.{{/GM}}\n"
"Anything in particular you looking for?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​轻​哼​一声​作为​答复​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​什么​想​买​的​东西​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qing1 heng1 yi1sheng1 zuo4wei2 da2fu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shen2me5 xiang3 mai3 de5 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A fool's errand. Heiner tried to kill Billy once... he thought that by eating the beast, we could steal its power.\n"
"\n"
"Hubris. Billy devoured my friend for his insolence, and the last remaining copy of Keycard E was lost."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​嗤笑​了​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​愚蠢​的​使命​。​海纳​曾经​试图​杀死​比利​……​他​认为​通过​吃掉​这头​野兽​，​就​可以​窃取​它​的​力量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​狂妄​。​我​的​朋友​因为​自己​的​傲慢​而​被​比利​吞噬​，​最后​一张​门禁卡​E​也​随之​丢失​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chi1xiao4 le5 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yu2chun3 de5 shi3ming4。hai3 na4 ceng2jing1 shi4tu2 sha1si3 bi3li4……ta1 ren4wei2 tong1guo4 chi1diao4 zhe4 tou2 ye3shou4，jiu4 ke3yi3 qie4qu3 ta1 de5 li4liang5。\n"
"\n"
"kuang2wang4。wo3 de5 peng2you5 yin1wei4 zi4ji3 de5 ao4man4 er2 bei4 bi3li4 tun1shi4，zui4hou4 yi1 zhang1 men2 jin1 ka3 E ye3 sui2zhi1 diu1shi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I won't give your she-troll the satisfaction. She wants it - that's why she won't get it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​让​这个​女​巨魔​如愿以偿​的​。​她​想要​答案​—​—​所以​她​就​别​想得到​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 rang4 zhe4ge5 nu:3 ju4mo2 ru2yuan4yi3chang2 de5。ta1 xiang3yao4 da2an4——suo3yi3 ta1 jiu4 bie4 xiang3 de2 dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You cling to that high horse, pal. It'll do you a lot of good when everything starts falling apart around you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​就​继续​端​着​架子​吧​。​等​你​周围​的​一切​分崩离析​的​时候​，​这样​肯定​对​你​有​好处​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 ji4xu4 duan1 zhao2 jia4zi5 ba1。deng3 ni3 zhou1wei2 de5 yi1qie4 fen1beng1li2xi1 de5 shi2hou5，zhe4yang4 ken3ding4 dui4 ni3 you3 hao3chu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You think I'm delusional, $(l.man)? I'm *already* dead. The she-troll beside you is going to put a bullet in my brain as soon as she gets what she wants.\n"
"\n"
"Just look at her - take a long look at that ugly troll face. She's just *aching* to put me in the ground."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​以为​我​傻​吗​？​我​已经​是​个​死​人​了​。​你​旁边​那个​女​巨魔​就​等​着​从​我​嘴里​撬出​情报​，​然后​照着​我​脑袋​来​一枪​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看看​她​吧​—​—​好好​看看​这张​巨魔​的​丑脸​。​她​已经​*​等不及​*​要​弄死​我​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi3wei2 wo3 sha3 ma5？wo3 yi3jing1 shi4 ge4 si3 ren2 le5。ni3 pang2bian1 na4ge5 nu:3 ju4mo2 jiu4 deng3 zhao2 cong2 wo3 zui3li3 qiao4 chu1 qing2bao4，ran2hou4 zhao4 zhao2 wo3 nao3dai5 lai2 yi1 qiang1 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"kan4kan5 ta1 ba1——hao3hao3 kan4kan5 zhe4 zhang1 ju4mo2 de5 chou3 lian3。ta1 yi3jing1*deng3bu4ji2*yao4 nong4si3 wo3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He spears a hunk of pie with his fork, crams it into his mouth, and starts to chew. A moment later, he shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've had worse. And of course - I'll give you what I can. But I don't know much.\n"
"\n"
"I can point you in the right direction. That's all."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​用​叉子​戳​起​一块​馅饼​，​塞进​嘴里​，​开始​咀嚼​。​片刻​后​，​他​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​味道​不算​太糟​。​好​吧​—​—​我会​尽我所能​帮​你​。​但​我​知道​的​不​多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可以​指点​你​正确​的​方向​。​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 cha1zi5 chuo1 qi3 yi1kuai4 xian4bing3，se4 jin4 zui3li3，kai1shi3 ju3jue2。pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei4dao5 bu4suan4 tai4 zao1。hao3 ba1——wo3 hui4 jin3 wo3 suo3 neng2 bang1 ni3。dan4 wo3 zhi1dao4 de5 bu4 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 zhi3dian3 ni3 zheng4que4 de5 fang1xiang4。jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He spits his response out at you, his eyes burning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Lay blame if you like. You were *with* me on this, shadowrunner."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​怒目​瞪视​着​你​，​咆哮​着​甩出​回应​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随便​你​怎么​说​吧​。​当初​这件​事​也​有​*​你​*​一份​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nu4mu4 deng4 shi4 zhao2 ni3，pao2xiao4 zhao2 shuai3 chu1 hui2ying4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 shuo1 ba1。dang1chu1 zhe4 jian4 shi4 ye3 you3*ni3*yi1 fen4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He spreads his arms wide, a knowing smile on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In the time that Heiner and I were trapped here, we vowed to make the best of our situation. We persevered, and eventually transformed this husk of a building into the glorious kingdom that you find yourself standing in today.\n"
"\n"
"It was all for the best, in the end! I tamed this land, and I have grown to love it. I will never live anywhere else!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​张开​双臂​，​脸上​带​着​自信​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​海纳​和​我​被困​的​这​段时间​里​，​我们​发誓​要​尽力​改善​我们​的​处境​。​我们​坚持​了​下来​，​并​最终​将​这栋​废弃​的​建筑​改造​成​了​如今​你​站立​其中​的​辉煌​王国​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​结果​一切​都​变得​美好​！​我​驯服​了​这片​土地​，​并​爱​上​了​它​。​我​永远​不会​离开​这里​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang1kai1 shuang1bi4，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 zi4xin4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 hai3 na4 he4 wo3 bei4kun4 de5 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3，wo3men5 fa1shi4 yao4 jin4li4 gai3shan4 wo3men5 de5 chu3jing4。wo3men5 jian1chi2 le5 xia4lai5，bing4 zui4zhong1 jiang1 zhe4 dong4 fei4qi4 de5 jian4zhu4 gai3zao4 cheng2 le5 ru2jin1 ni3 zhan4li4 qi2zhong1 de5 hui1huang2 wang2guo2。\n"
"\n"
"jie1guo3 yi1qie4 dou1 bian4de5 mei3hao3！wo3 xun4fu2 le5 zhe4 pian1 tu3di4，bing4 ai4 shang4 le5 ta1。wo3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 li2kai1 zhe4li3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He spreads his arms, a helpless look on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But at least they kept some form of law. Mugging and assaults were rare, and they didn't let murderous spirits run loose on the upper floors.\n"
"\n"
"So, you know. You take the good with the bad."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摊开​双手​，​脸上​带​着​无奈​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​至少​他们​还​维持​着​某种​秩序​。​抢劫​和​袭击​事件​很少​发生​，​他们​也​不让​凶残​的​精魂​在​楼上​肆意​游荡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​怎么​说​呢​，​有好有坏​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1kai1 shuang1shou3，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 wu2nai4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhi4shao3 ta1men5 hai2 wei2chi2 zhao2 mou3zhong3 zhi4xu4。qiang3jie2 he4 xi2ji1 shi4jian4 hen3 shao3 fa1sheng1，ta1men5 ye3 bu4 rang4 xiong1can2 de5 jing1hun2 zai4 lou2shang4 si4yi4 you2dang4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，zen3me5 shuo1 ni2，you3 hao3 you3 huai4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He spreads his arms.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It isn't my problem. The people who care aren't here, $(l.name)... I am a mouthpiece, nothing more.\n"
"\n"
"Now, do we have any other business to discuss?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摊开​双臂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​和​我​没关系​。​在乎​的​人​不​在​这里​，​$(l.name)​……​我​只是​个​传话​的​，​仅此而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​我们​还有​别的​事要​谈​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1kai1 shuang1bi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 he4 wo3 mei2guan1xi5。zai4hu5 de5 ren2 bu4 zai4 zhe4li3，$(l.name)……wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 chuan2hua4 de5，jin3ci3er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 wo3men5 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 tan2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He spreads his hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you choose to go exploring, I can't guarantee your safety."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摊开​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​选择​去​探索​外面​，​我​不能​保证​你​的​安全​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1kai1 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xuan3ze2 qu4 tan4suo3 wai4mian4，wo3 bu4neng2 bao3zheng4 ni3 de5 an1quan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He spreads his hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In that case, I can be of no further help to you in this matter.\n"
"\n"
"Is there anything else that you need?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摊开​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然如此​，​恐怕​在​这件​事上​我​就​无法​向​你​提供​更​多​帮助​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​其他​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1kai1 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4 ran2 ru2 ci3，kong3pa4 zai4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shang4 wo3 jiu4 wu2fa3 xiang4 ni3 ti2gong1 geng1 duo1 bang1zhu4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 qi2ta1 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He spreads his hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your loss."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​摊开​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​你​不​识相​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan1kai1 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3 bu4 shi2xiang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He squints at his screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Tonight’s wind patterns dictate that ground zero be Tempelhof-Schöneberg. \n"
"\n"
"Highly populated... the virus will spread quickly enough from there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眯起​眼睛​看着​屏幕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​今晚​的​风向​决定​了​原​爆点​位置​应​设在​藤​珀尔​霍夫​-​舍内​贝格​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​人口​高度​密集​……​病毒​从​那里​扩散​的​速度​会​非常​快​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5 kan4 zhao2 ping2mu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 de5 feng1xiang4 jue2ding4 le5 yuan2 bao4 dian3 wei4zhi5 ying1 she4 zai4 teng2 po4 er3 huo4 fu1 -she3 nei4 bei4 ge2。\n"
"\n"
"ren2kou3 gao1du4 mi4ji2……bing4du2 cong2 na4li5 kuo4san4 de5 su4du4 hui4 fei1chang2 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He squints at your badge, scowling. After a few seconds, he lowers his weapon.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry to have bothered you, $(l.sir). You're cleared to be here, but stay where I can see you, and don't leave this room."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​皱起​眉头​，​眯​眼看​向​你​的​徽章​。​过​了​几秒钟​，​他​放下​了​武器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​打扰​你​，​$(l.sir)​。​工作​的​事​请​自便​，​但​我​还是​得​请​你​留在​我​的​视线​范围​内​，​并且​不要​离开​这个​房间​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2，mi2 yan3kan4 xiang4 ni3 de5 hui1zhang1。guo4 le5 ji1 miao3 zhong1，ta1 fang4xia4 le5 wu3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 da3rao3 ni3，$(l.sir)。gong1zuo4 de5 shi4 qing3 zi4bian4，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 de2 qing3 ni3 liu2 zai4 wo3 de5 shi4xian4 fan4wei2 nei4，bing4qie3 bu4yao4 li2kai1 zhe4ge5 fang2jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stabs a meaty finger down on the faded silhouette of a building.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This warehouse, right here, is Rammbock HQ. And that's where the Engineer is staying."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​用​粗壮​的​手指​戳​向​一栋​褪色​的​建筑​轮廓​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这座​仓库​就是​撞锤​帮​的​总部​。​而​工程师​就​住​在​那儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 cu1zhuang4 de5 shou3zhi3 chuo1 xiang4 yi1 dong4 tui4se4 de5 jian4zhu4 lun2kuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zuo4 cang1ku4 jiu4shi4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 zong3bu4。er2 gong1cheng2shi1 jiu4 zhu4 zai4 na4r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stabs a meaty pointer finger down on the faded silhouette of a building.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. This warehouse, right here, is Rammbock HQ. That's where the Engineer is staying."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​用​粗壮​的​手指​戳​向​一栋​褪色​的​建筑​轮廓​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​这座​仓库​就是​撞锤​帮​的​总部​。​而​工程师​就​住​在​那儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 cu1zhuang4 de5 shou3zhi3 chuo1 xiang4 yi1 dong4 tui4se4 de5 jian4zhu4 lun2kuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，zhe4 zuo4 cang1ku4 jiu4shi4 zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 zong3bu4。er2 gong1cheng2shi1 jiu4 zhu4 zai4 na4r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stands bolt upright.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Doktor Huitzilin is your *uncle?* I... I had no idea.\n"
"\n"
"Please, carry on. $+(l.sir)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​霎时间​站​得​笔直​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​魏茨​林博士​是​你​*​叔叔​*​？​我​……​我​不​知道​这​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请过​吧​，​$+(l.sir)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sha4shi2jian1 zhan4 de2 bi3zhi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei4 ci2 lin2 bo2 shi4 shi4 ni3*shu1shu5*？wo3……wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 guo4 ba1，$+(l.sir)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stands up straight. For the first time, you have his full attention.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whoa, there... whoa. I'm sorry, I didn't know.\n"
"\n"
"We don't want any shaman trouble."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​一下子站​直​了​。​这​是​他​头​一次​把​注意力​完全​放在​你​身上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​，​这个​……​噢​。​不好意思​，​我​不​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​可​不想​惹​到​萨满​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 xia4 zi3 zhan4 zhi2 le5。zhe4 shi4 ta1 tou2 yi1ci4 ba3 zhu4yi4li4 wan2quan2 fang4 zai4 ni3 shen1shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1，zhe4ge5……o1。bu4hao3yi4si5，wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ke3 bu4xiang3 re3 dao4 sa4man3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at Glory for a moment. Then his eyes flit to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What do you want me to say?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​格洛丽​看​了​一会儿​，​然后​他​的​目光​又​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​希望​我​怎么​说​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 ta1 de5 mu4guang1 you4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xi1wang4 wo3 zen3me5 shuo1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at his hands, trembling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I must admit, your arguments have been... quite compelling. Enough to make me question my own conclusions.\n"
"\n"
"So why the sudden change of heart?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​凝视着​自己​的​双手​，​浑身​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​必须​承认​，​你​的​论点​确实​……​相当​有​说服力​。​足以​让​我​开始​质疑​自己​的​结论​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那么​，​你​为什么​突然​改变​主意​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 shuang1shou3，hun2shen1 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bi4xu1 cheng2ren4，ni3 de5 lun4dian3 que4shi2……xiang1dang1 you3 shuo1fu2li4。zu2yi3 rang4 wo3 kai1shi3 zhi4yi2 zi4ji3 de5 jie2lun4。\n"
"\n"
"na4me5，ni3 wei4shen2me5 tu1ran2 gai3bian4 zhu3yi5 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at his trembling hands, a sad smile on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"More than four decades of planning, all undone in the span of a single conversation. My brother's words, delivered through the mouth of a criminal.\n"
"\n"
"I finally listened, Hermie. Forty-two years too late."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​凝视着​自己​颤抖​的​双手​，​脸上​挂​着​悲伤​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​四十多年​的​规划​，​在​一场​对话​中​化为乌有​。​我​弟弟​的​话语​，​竟是​由​一个​罪犯​之口​说出​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​终于​听​进去​了​，​赫米​。​尽管​已经​迟​了​四十二年​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 zi4ji3 chan4dou3 de5 shuang1shou3，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 bei1shang1 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"si4 shi2 duo1 nian2 de5 gui1hua4，zai4 yi1 chang2 dui4hua4 zhong4 hua4wei2wu1you3。wo3 di4di5 de5 hua4yu3，jing4 shi4 you2 yi1ge5 zui4fan4 zhi1 kou3 shuo1chu1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhong1yu2 ting1 jin4qu4 le5，he4 mi3。jin3guan3 yi3jing1 chi2 le5 si4 shi2 er4 nian2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at the body for a long while. Finally, he shakes his head and turns to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on, boss. Let's get the hell out of here.\n"
"\n"
"I want to go home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​尸体​看​了​很​久​。​最终​，​他​摇摇头​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​了​老大​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​回家​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 shi1ti3 kan4 le5 hen3 jiu3。zui4zhong1，ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3 le5 lao3da4，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 hui2jia1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at the floor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And now, I think we should all take a moment."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看​向​地板​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​就让​我们​先​各自​缓一缓​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 di4ban3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，jiu4 rang4 wo3men5 xian1 ge4zi4 huan3 yi1 huan3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you for a long moment, then shakes his head in resignation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Why am I even talking to you? What do I hope to accomplish? You will never understand.\n"
"\n"
"Besides which, I have work to do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​你​许久​，​然后​无奈​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​为什么​要​跟​你​说话​？​我​指望​能​有​什么​结果​？​你​永远​不会​明白​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​况且​，​我​还有​工作​要​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 xu3jiu3，ran2hou4 wu2nai4 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 gen1 ni3 shuo1hua4？wo3 zhi3wang4 neng2 you3 shen2me5 jie1guo3？ni3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 ming2bai5 de5。\n"
"\n"
"kuang4qie3，wo3 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you for a moment before speaking.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look... you're obviously a professional. We work at a soykaf shop. We don't know what the hell we're doing.\n"
"\n"
"Mira likes to talk tough..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​仔细​端详​了​你​一阵​，​然后​开口​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​依我看​……​你​显然​是​专业人士​。​我们​就是​开豆​咖店​的​，​不​知道​这种​事会​惹出​多大​乱子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​米拉​虽然​嘴硬​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zi3xi4 duan1xiang2 le5 ni3 yi1zhen4，ran2hou4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1wo3kan4……ni3 xian3ran2 shi4 zhuan1ye4ren2shi4。wo3men5 jiu4shi4 kai1 dou4 ka1 dian4 de5，bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 hui4 re3 chu1 duo1da4 luan4zi5。\n"
"\n"
"mi3la1 sui1ran2 zui3ying4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you incredulously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You forgot? You *forgot?*\n"
"\n"
"I *told* you how important this was. I *begged* you to bring me on that run. What else did you need, a fucking diagram?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​不敢​置信​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​你​忘​了​？​你​*​忘​了​*​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​告诉​*​过​你​这事​有​多​重要​。​我​*​恳求​*​你​带​我​一起​去​参加​行动​。​你​他​妈​还​想​怎样​？​要​不要​我​给​你​做​个​示意图​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bu4 gan3 zhi4xin4 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ni3 wang4 le5？ni3*wang4 le5*？\n"
"\n"
"wo3*gao4su4*guo4 ni3 zhe4 shi4 you3 duo1 zhong4yao4。wo3*ken3qiu2*ni3 dai4 wo3 yi1qi3 qu4 can1jia1 xing2dong4。ni3 ta1 ma1 hai2 xiang3 zen3yang4？yao4 bu4yao4 wo3 gei3 ni3 zuo4 ge4 shi4yi4tu2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you petulantly through red-rimmed eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry about me, chief. I'll be just *fine.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​用​布满​血丝​的​眼睛​怒视​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​担心​我​，​头儿​。​我​*​没事​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 bu4man3 xue4si1 de5 yan3jing5 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3，tou2r5。wo3*mei2shi4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you, an appraising look in his eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, you look like you can handle yourself... but still, I'm tellin' you, the people out there are bad news.\n"
"\n"
"There are gangs on the other side of this barricade who'd skin you alive as soon as look at you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​你​，​眼中​流露出​一丝​欣赏​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​好像​有​两把刷子​……​但​我​还是​要​提醒​你​，​那​一头​的​人​也​不是​善茬​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过​了​路障​，​有些​帮派​只要​见到​你​就要​扒​你​的​皮​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3，yan3zhong1 liu2 lou4 chu1 yi1 si1 xin1shang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hao3xiang4 you3 liang3ba3shua1zi5……dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 yao4 ti2xing3 ni3，na4 yi1tou2 de5 ren2 ye3 bu4shi4 shan4 cha2。\n"
"\n"
"guo4 le5 lu4zhang4，you3xie1 bang1pai4 zhi3yao4 jian4dao4 ni3 jiu4yao4 ba1 ni3 de5 pi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you, then blinks. Stumbles over his words as he attempts to explain himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You... you don't know what I'm talking about. I can see it in your eyes.\n"
"\n"
"I will try to explain."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​你​，​然后​眨​了​眨眼​，​想要​磕磕绊绊​地​试图​解释​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​……​你​根本​不​懂​我​在​说​什么​。​我能​从​你​的​眼中​看​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​会试​着​解释​清楚​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3，ran2hou4 zha3 le5 zha3yan3，xiang3yao4 ke1ke5ban4ban4 de5 shi4tu2 jie3shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 dong3 wo3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5。wo3 neng2 cong2 ni3 de5 yan3zhong1 kan4 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4shi4 zhao2 jie3shi4 qing1chu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you. His face may look haggard, but his eyes are as sharp as ever.\n"
"\n"
"Abruptly, he nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​你​。​面容​或许​憔悴​，​但​目光​依旧​锐利​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​突然​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。mian4rong2 huo4xu3 qiao2cui4，dan4 mu4guang1 yi1jiu4 rui4li4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 tu1ran2 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My entire job here revolves around my making this transfer. That's why Mr. Grinder sent me.\n"
"\n"
"If you want Blitz off of his hit list, you'll step aside."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​凝视着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​在​此​的​全部​工作​都​围绕​着​完成​这次​转账​展开​。​正因如此​，​“​绞肉机​”​先生​才​派​我​前来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​让​布里​茨​脱离​他​的​暗杀​名单​，​就​不要​碍​我​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zai4 ci3 de5 quan2bu4 gong1zuo4 dou1 wei2rao4 zhao2 wan2cheng2 zhe4 ci4 zhuan3zhang4 zhan3kai1。zheng1 yin1 ru2 ci3，“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 cai2 pai4 wo3 qian2lai2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 Bu4li3ci2 tuo1li2 ta1 de5 an4sha1 ming2dan1，jiu4 bu4yao4 ai4 wo3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's great. Really.\n"
"\n"
"Anything else?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​紧盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​可​太好了​。​真​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​有事吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jin3ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 ke3 tai4hao3le5。zhen1 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You didn't read my research, did you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​紧盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​没有​读​我​的​研究​结果​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jin3ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 dou4 wo3 de5 yan2jiu1 jie1guo3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares down at his trembling hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I acted without considering all of the variables... didn't even consider that such variables could exist! I was *blind!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​低头​凝视着​自己​颤抖​的​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​行事​时​未曾​权衡​所有​变量​……​甚至​从未​想过​这些​变量​可能​存在​！​我​简直​是​*​瞎了眼​*​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 zi4ji3 chan4dou3 de5 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xing2shi4 shi2 wei4ceng2 quan2heng2 suo3you3 bian4liang4……shen4zhi4 cong2wei4 xiang3 guo4 zhe4xie1 bian4liang4 ke3neng2 cun2zai4！wo3 jian3zhi2 shi4*xia1 le5 yan3*！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares into the crater, trembling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I will try."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​浑身​颤抖​着​看​向​大坑​深处​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我会​试试​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hun2shen1 chan4dou3 zhao2 kan4 xiang4 da4keng1 shen1chu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 hui4 shi4 shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares into the crater, trembling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... no. I will live."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​浑身​颤抖​着​看​向​大坑​深处​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​不​。​我会​活下去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hun2shen1 chan4dou3 zhao2 kan4 xiang4 da4keng1 shen1chu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……bu4。wo3 hui4 huo2xia4qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares you down for a long moment, then breaks into a chuckle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Aye, I'll grant you we've been a little careless. I guess we figured with Monika Schäfer out of the picture, the Kreuzbasar would be an easy score.\n"
"\n"
"That's why you're here, right? We stole your supplies, now you want 'em back?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​你​看​了​好长​一会儿​，​然后​突然​笑​出声​来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​我们​最近​确实​是​有些​疏忽​了​。​本来​我们​觉得​既然​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​不​在​了​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​应该​不会​有​多​难搞​才​对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​就是​为​这事来​的​吧​？​我们​偷​了​你们​的​物资​，​所以​你​想​把​货​拿回去​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 hao3 zhang3 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 tu1ran2 xiao4 chu1sheng1 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，wo3men5 zui4jin4 que4shi2 shi4 you3xie1 shu1hu5 le5。ben3lai2 wo3men5 jue2de5 ji4ran2 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 bu4 zai4 le5，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 you3 duo1 nan2gao3 cai2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4shi4 wei2 zhe4 shi4 lai2 de5 ba1？wo3men5 tou1 le5 ni3men5 de5 wu4zi1，suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 ba3 huo4 na2 hui2 qu4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares you down for a long moment, then breaks into a chuckle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Guess we were a little careless on that one. I figured with Monika Schäfer gone, the Kreuzbasar would be an easy score.\n"
"\n"
"So that's why you're here? We stole your supplies, now you want 'em back?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​你​看​了​好长​一会儿​，​然后​突然​笑​出声​来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​我们​确实​是​有些​疏忽​了​。​本来​我们​觉得​既然​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​不​在​了​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​应该​不会​有​多​难搞​才​对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​就是​为​这事来​的​吧​？​我们​偷​了​你们​的​物资​，​所以​你​想​把​货​拿回去​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 hao3 zhang3 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 tu1ran2 xiao4 chu1sheng1 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3men5 que4shi2 shi4 you3xie1 shu1hu5 le5。ben3lai2 wo3men5 jue2de5 ji4ran2 Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 bu4 zai4 le5，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ying1gai1 bu4hui4 you3 duo1 nan2gao3 cai2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4shi4 wei2 zhe4 shi4 lai2 de5 ba1？wo3men5 tou1 le5 ni3men5 de5 wu4zi1，suo3yi3 ni3 xiang3 ba3 huo4 na2 hui2 qu4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares you down for a long moment, then breaks into a chuckle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not bad, right? We've been running jobs for this kiez for years, but we just started using this bunker as a permanent base. Nice and secure, easy place to hole up in."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​你​看​了​好长​一会儿​，​然后​突然​笑​出声​来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​不错​吧​？​我们​为​这个​街区​跑​了​很多年​的​差事​，​但​最近​才​开始​把​这个​地堡​作为​永久​基地​。​这里​安全​又​舒适​，​便于​藏身​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 hao3 zhang3 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 tu1ran2 xiao4 chu1sheng1 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2 bu4cuo4 ba1？wo3men5 wei2 zhe4ge5 jie1qu1 pao2 le5 hen3 duo1 nian2 de5 cha4shi4，dan4 zui4jin4 cai2 kai1shi3 ba3 zhe4ge5 di4bao3 zuo4wei2 yong3jiu3 ji1di4。zhe4li3 an1quan2 you4 shu1shi4，bian4yu2 cang2shen1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stares you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Unless you want our blood on your hands, you *do* this. You hear me?\n"
"\n"
"For the love of God, please, just do it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞪​大​眼睛​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要是​不想​害死​我们​的话​，​就​去​*​做​*​这件​事​。​你​听见​没​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​老天​在​上​，​求求​你​这么​做​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 deng4 dai4 yan3jing5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4shi5 bu4xiang3 hai4si3 wo3men5 de5hua4，jiu4 qu4*zuo4*zhe4 jian4 shi4。ni3 ting1jian4 mei2？\n"
"\n"
"lao3tian1 zai4 shang4，qiu2 qiu2 ni3 zhe4me5 zuo4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He steeples his fingers, looking for all the world like a kid in a Halloween costume.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I would offer you an alternative. What is it that he has offered you for your assistance? I'm sure we can reach an equally beneficial arrangement."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​十指​交叉​，​看上去​活像​个​穿着​万圣节​服装​的​小孩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​愿意​提供​另​一种​选择​。​他​答应​给​你​什么​作为​帮助​他​的​报酬​？​我​相信​我们​也​可以​达成​同样​互惠互利​的​协议​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shi2 zhi3 jiao1cha1，kan4shang5qu5 huo2xiang4 ge4 chuan1zhuo2 wan4sheng4jie2 fu2zhuang1 de5 xiao3hai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yuan4yi4 ti2gong1 ling4 yi1zhong3 xuan3ze2。ta1 da1ying5 gei3 ni3 shen2me5 zuo4wei2 bang1zhu4 ta1 de5 bao4chou5？wo3 xiang1xin4 wo3men5 ye3 ke3yi3 da2cheng2 tong2yang4 hu4 hui4 hu4 li4 de5 xie2yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He steps back, an exasperated expression on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Fine. Do your thing. But make it quick."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​后退​一步​，​脸上​露出​恼怒​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​。​随你便​。​但​动作​快点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hou4tui4 yi1 bu4，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 nao3nu4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。sui2 ni3 bian4。dan4 dong4zuo4 kuai4dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stoops. Sighs. Leans heavily against the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"“What’s going on” is that I am about to see the end of the dragons.\n"
"\n"
"Not just Feuerschwinge.\n"
"\n"
"*All* dragons."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​弯​下腰​，​叹​了​口气​，​重重​靠​在​玻璃​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​发生​的​事情​”​就是​我要​亲自​见证​巨龙​时代​的​终结​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​只是​火翼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而是​*​所有​*​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wan1 xia4yao1，tan4 le5 kou3qi4，chong2chong2 kao4 zai4 bo1li5 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5” jiu4shi4 wo3 yao4 qin1zi4 jian4zheng4 ju4long2 shi2dai4 de5 zhong1jie2。\n"
"\n"
"bu4 zhi3shi4 Huo3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"er2shi4*suo3you3*ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stops.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"An artificial intelligence controls a Great Dragon."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​人工智能​控制​着​一条​巨龙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 ren2gong1zhi4neng2 kong4zhi4 zhao2 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He straightens his collar.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, if you are quite finished..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他整​了​整​领口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那么​，​如果​你​已经​完事​的话​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zheng3 le5 zheng3 ling3kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4me5，ru2guo3 ni3 yi3jing1 wan2shi4 de5hua4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He straightens, glances back at the screen to his side, and nods curtly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, I must know - how did you learn that I was still alive? How did you even know to look for me? \n"
"\n"
"Did someone send you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​站​直​身子​，​瞥​了​一眼​身旁​的​屏幕​，​然后​冷淡​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​我​必须​知道​—​—​你​是​如何​得知​我​还​活着​的​？​你​又​是​如何​知道​要来​找​我​的​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​有人​派​你​来​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhan4 zhi2 shen1zi5，pie1 le5 yi1yan3 shen1 pang2 de5 ping2mu4，ran2hou4 leng3dan4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，wo3 bi4xu1 zhi1dao4——ni3 shi4 ru2he2 de2zhi1 wo3 hai2 huo2zhe5 de5？ni3 you4 shi4 ru2he2 zhi1dao4 yao4 lai2 zhao3 wo3 de5？\n"
"\n"
"shi4 you3ren2 pai4 ni3 lai2 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He straightens. Adjusts his collar.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No matter - for the moment, it's as incapable of harming me as you are. And after tonight, it won't matter.\n"
"\n"
"Now answer my question, and be quick about it. Why are you here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​站​直​身体​，​调整​一下​领口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无所谓​了​。​目前​而言​，​它​和​你​一样​对​我​造成​的​威胁​都​微不足道​。​而​到​了​今晚​之后​，​这​一切​都​将​不再​重要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​回答​我​的​问题​，​而且​要​快​。​你​为什么​在​这里​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhan4 zhi2 shen1ti3，tiao2zheng3 yi1xia4 ling3kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2suo3wei4 le5。mu4qian2 er2yan2，ta1 he4 ni3 yi1yang4 dui4 wo3 zao4cheng2 de5 wei1xie2 dou1 wei1bu4zu2dao4。er2 dao4 le5 jin1wan3 zhi1hou4，zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 jiang1 bu4zai4 zhong4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 hui2da2 wo3 de5 wen4ti2，er2qie3 yao4 kuai4。ni3 wei4shen2me5 zai4 zhe4li3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He straightens. Casts a glance back at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know, chief... we *could* use this setup to our advantage."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​挺直​了​身子​。​回身​向​你​一瞥​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​，​头儿​……​我们​*​可以​*​利用​这套​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。hui2 shen1 xiang4 ni3 yi1pie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1，tou2r5……wo3men5*ke3yi3*li4yong4 zhe4 tao4 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He stubs out his cigarette and grabs another with a shaking hand. Lighting it, he eagerly sucks in the smoke.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What we need is something powerful enough to keep these things at bay, but intelligent enough to be capable of reason."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​掐灭​烟头​，​颤抖​的​手​又​抓起​一支​。​点燃​后​，​他​贪婪​地​吸入​烟雾​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​需要​的​，​是​既​能​抵御​这些​东西​又​足够​聪慧​、​能​进行​理性​思考​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 qia1 mie4 yan1tou2，chan4dou3 de5 shou3 you4 zhua1 qi3 yi1 zhi1。dian3ran2 hou4，ta1 tan1lan2 de5 xi1ru4 yan1wu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 xu1yao4 de5，shi4 ji4 neng2 di3yu4 zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 you4 zu2gou4 cong1hui4、neng2 jin4xing2 li3xing4 si1kao3 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He studies your face for a moment, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fair enough."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​对​着​你​的​脸​端详​片刻​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 zhao2 ni3 de5 lian3 duan1xiang2 pian4ke4，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He swallows. Hard.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Who... who was this message from?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​重重​咽​了​一下​唾沫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​……​这​是​谁​发来​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong2chong2 yan1 le5 yi1xia4 tuo4mo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4……zhe4 shi4 shei2 fa1 lai2 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a deep breath, and stands up straight. Does his best to put a brave face on.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We've got two vans here... no sense in leaving one behind. You all pile into that one, and I'll take the other.\n"
"\n"
"I'll meet you back at the Kreuzbasar."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​深吸​一口气​，​挺直​腰板​，​尽力​让​自己​看起来​精神​些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这儿​有​两辆车​……​没理由​留下​一辆​。​你们​都​挤​那辆车​吧​，​我开​这​一辆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​克洛伊​茨​集市​见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，ting3zhi2 yao1ban3，jin4li4 rang4 zi4ji3 kan4qi3lai5 jing1shen2 xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4r5 you3 liang3 liang4 che1……mei2 li3 you2 liu2xia4 yi1 liang4。ni3men5 dou1 ji3 na4 liang4 che1 ba1，wo3 kai1 zhe4 yi1 liang4。\n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a deep breath, then slowly releases it. Looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)… we need to have a talk about this Humanis gig."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​深吸​一口气​，​又​缓缓​吐​出​，​随后​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​……​我们​得​聊聊​那帮​人类​至上​主义者​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1，sui2hou4 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……wo3men5 de2 liao2 liao2 na4 bang1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a drag on his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I won't permit you to cause any further harm, shadowrunner. You will remain trapped where you are for your own good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​吸​了​一口​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​允许​你​继续​造成​任何​伤害​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​你​将​被困​在​此处​，​这是​为了​你好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 yun3xu3 ni3 ji4xu4 zao4cheng2 ren4he2 shang1hai4，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。ni3 jiang1 bei4kun4 zai4 ci3chu4，zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 ni3hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a drag on his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sounds like you've made a hard life for yourself. My condolences."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​吸​了​一口​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​起来​你​过​得​挺​不​容易​的​。​我​深表同情​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 qi3lai5 ni3 guo4 de2 ting3 bu4 rong2yi4 de5。wo3 shen1 biao3 tong2 qing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a moment to calm himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay. So these notes... they pretty much confirm something that I'd always suspected.\n"
"\n"
"The Luftwaffe didn't shoot down Feuerschwinge."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他花​了​点​时间​让​自己​冷静下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​这些​笔记​……​几乎​证实​了​我​一直​怀疑​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​德国​空军​没有​击落​火翼​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hua1 le5 dian3 shi2jian1 rang4 zi4ji3 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，zhe4xie1 bi3ji4……ji1hu1 zheng4shi2 le5 wo3 yi1zhi2 huai2yi2 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"de2guo2 kong1jun1 mei2you3 ji1luo4 Huo3yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a moment to examine his gnarled hands, a sad smile on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We managed the second two. Good God, where has the time gone?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看看​自己​粗糙​的​手​，​一抹​苦笑​浮上​脸庞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​后​两条​我们​倒​是​做到​了​。​老天爷​啊​，​时间​都​去​哪儿​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4kan5 zi4ji3 cu1cao1 de5 shou3，yi1 ma1 ku3xiao4 fu2shang4 lian3pang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hou4 liang3 tiao2 wo3men5 dao3 shi4 zuo4dao4 le5。lao3tian1ye2 a1，shi2jian1 dou1 qu4 na3r5 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I did not think to mention our employer because I did not set up the job. \n"
"\n"
"Monika did."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​沉默​片刻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没想​起来​提​雇主​的​事​，​是因为​这趟​活​不是​我​安排​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​接活​的​人​是​莫妮卡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 pian4ke4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 xiang3 qi3lai5 ti2 gu4zhu3 de5 shi4，shi4 yin1 wei2 zhe4 tang1 huo2 bu4shi4 wo3 an1pai2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"jie1huo2 de5 ren2 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a step back, managing to appear small despite his hulking troll frame.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay, okay, fine! Here's the money. Just take it, and leave me alone!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​向​后退​了​一步​，​假装​让​自己​天生​魁梧​的​巨魔​体格​看起来​渺小​一些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​好​吧​！​钱​给​你​，​赶紧​拿走​，​别​再​打扰​我​了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4，jia3zhuang1 rang4 zi4ji3 tian1sheng1 kui2wu2 de5 ju4mo2 ti3ge2 kan4qi3lai5 miao3xiao3 yi1xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1 hao3 ba1！qian2 gei3 ni3，gan3jin3 na2zou3，bie4 zai4 da3rao3 wo3 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a step back, managing to appear small despite his hulking troll frame.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please, no! Don't hurt me. I'm sorry. I just... "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​向​后退​了​一步​，​假装​让​自己​天生​魁梧​的​巨魔​体格​看起来​渺小​一些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​求​你​不要​！​别​伤害​我​。​对不起​，​我​只是​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4，jia3zhuang1 rang4 zi4ji3 tian1sheng1 kui2wu2 de5 ju4mo2 ti3ge2 kan4qi3lai5 miao3xiao3 yi1xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiu2 ni3 bu4yao4！bie4 shang1hai4 wo3。dui4bu5qi3，wo3 zhi3shi4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a step back, then turns his head to shout at the toughs behind him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"C'MON, BOYS! Let's show this PARASITE who's boss."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​后退​一步​，​转身​朝​身后​的​打手​们​吼道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​兄弟​们​给​我​上​！​让​这个​寄生虫​知道​谁​才​是​老大​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hou4tui4 yi1 bu4，zhuan3shen1 chao2 shen1hou4 de5 da3shou5 men5 hou3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiong1di4 men5 gei3 wo3 shang4！rang4 zhe4ge5 ji4sheng1chong2 zhi1dao4 shei2 cai2 shi4 lao3da4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a step back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, chief... if that's what you want. It's your funera--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​向​后退​了​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​头儿​……​如果​你​非要​这么​做​的话​，​我​也​拦不住​你​送死​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，tou2r5……ru2guo3 ni3 fei1yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5hua4，wo3 ye3 lan2 bu4 zhu4 ni3 song4si3 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes a swig from the flask.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right, boss. 'Course you're right.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and $(l.name)... I meant what I said earlier. From this point on, wherever this team goes, I'll follow."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​仰头​灌​了​一口​酒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​，​老大​，​说​得​太​对​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​，​$(l.name)​……​我​先前​说​的话​可是​认真​的​，​以后​队伍​去​哪​，​我​跟​到​哪​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang3tou2 guan4 le5 yi1kou3 jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，lao3da4，shuo1 de2 tai4 dui4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3，$(l.name)……wo3 xian1qian2 shuo1 de5hua4 ke3shi4 ren4zhen1 de5，yi3hou4 dui4wu3 qu4 na3，wo3 gen1 dao4 na3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He takes another drag on his cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"After all, science has always attracted its share of doomsayers. During the development of the atomic bomb, Compton and Oppenheimer expressed concern that a fission explosion could ignite the Earth's atmosphere. Fermi even took bets on it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​吸​了​一口​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​毕竟​，​科学​领域​一直​不乏​末日​论者​。​在​原子弹​研发​过程​中​，​康普顿​和​奥本海默​曾​担心​裂变​爆炸​可能​引燃​地球​大气层​。​费米​甚至​为此​打过​赌​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi4jing4，ke1xue2 ling3yu4 yi1zhi2 bu4fa2 mo4ri4 lun2 zhe3。zai4 yuan2zi3dan4 yan2fa1 guo4cheng2 zhong4，kang1 pu3 dun4 he4 ao4 ben3 Hai3mo4 ceng2 dan1xin1 lie4bian4 bao4zha4 ke3neng2 yin3ran2 di4qiu2 da4qi4ceng2。fei4mi3 shen4zhi4 wei4ci3 da3 guo4 du3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He throws back his head and barks out a laugh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Spoken like a true hero!\n"
"\n"
"Farewell, my friend. Perhaps one day I will be able to come to your aid in return."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​仰起​头​，​放声​大笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这话​才​像​个​真正​的​英雄​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​了​，​我​的​朋友​。​也许​有​一天​，​我​也​能​回报​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang3 qi3 tou2，fang4sheng1 da4xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hua4 cai2 xiang4 ge4 zhen1zheng4 de5 ying1xiong2！\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4 le5，wo3 de5 peng2you5。ye3xu3 you3 yi1 tian1，wo3 ye3 neng2 hui2bao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He tilts his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Catch you later."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​微微​颔首​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​回头见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1wei1 han4shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He trembles, his voice dropping to a whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That I will *not* allow."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​颤抖​着​，​声音​逐渐​低落​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​绝对​*​不会​*​允许​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chan4dou3 zhao2，sheng1yin1 zhu2jian4 di1luo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2dui4*bu4hui4*yun3xu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He trembles, wracked again by violent coughing. As the coughing "
"subsides, he takes another long drag on his cigarette, the ash creeping "
"closer and closer towards his mouth.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​一次​被​剧烈​的​咳嗽​折磨​得​喘​不过​气来​。​他​喘息​了​片刻​。​又​深深​吸​了​一口​烟​，​烟灰​一点点​地向​他​的​嘴唇​靠近​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 yi1ci4 bei4 ju4lie4 de5 ke2sou5 zhe2mo2 de2 chuan3 bu4guo4 qi4 lai2。ta1 chuan3xi1 le5 pian4ke4。you4 shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3 yan1，yan1hui1 yi1dian3dian3 de5 xiang4 ta1 de5 zui3chun2 kao4jin4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns another page.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's Celedyr, out in Wales... he's pretty heavily invested in Transys Neuronet, so he's got the money. But he's too busy dealing with the \"BTL Killer\" scandal that Transys is going through out in London to get his claws dirty in the SOX.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Flip.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Dunkelzahn, out in the UCAS..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​又​翻​了​一页​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​远​在​威尔士​的​塞勒​迪尔​……​他​对​“​暂态​系统​神经网​”​投入​了​巨额​资金​，​所以​他​有​这个​财力​。​但​他​正​忙于​处理​暂态​系统​在​伦敦​的​“​BTL​杀手​”​丑闻​，​无暇顾及​萨洛​卢区​这边​的​事情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​翻页​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​邓​凯尔​赞​，​活动​范围​在​加美​合众国​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 fan1 le5 yi1 xie2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 yuan3 zai4 wei1er3shi4 de5 se4 lei1 di2 er3……ta1 dui4“zan4tai4 xi4tong3 shen2jing1wang3” tou2ru4 le5 ju4e2 zi1jin1，suo3yi3 ta1 you3 zhe4ge5 cai2li4。dan4 ta1 zheng1 mang2yu2 chu3li3 zan4tai4 xi4tong3 zai4 lun2dun1 de5“BTL sha1shou3” chou3wen2，wu2 xia2 gu4 ji2 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 zhe4bian1 de5 shi4qing5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fan1 xie2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng4 kai3 er3 zan4，huo2dong4 fan4wei2 zai4 jia1 mei3 he2zhong4guo2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns back to face you, reaching for the sidearm on his hip.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And as for *you*--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​发言人​又​转向​你​，​同时​伸手​去​拿​腰间​的​手枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​*​你​*​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa1yan2ren2 you4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3，tong2shi2 shen1shou3 qu4 na2 yao1jian1 de5 shou3qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2*ni3*— —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns back to the observation window.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do what you need to do, buddy. Or don't.\n"
"\n"
"You take whatever time you need to make up your mind."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​转身​回去​盯​着​窗户​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​想​动手​就​做​吧​，​朋友​。​或者​现在​反悔​也​行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有​一辈子​的​时间​来​下定决心​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 hui2qu5 ding1 zhao2 chuang1hu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiang3 dong4shou3 jiu4 zuo4 ba1，peng2you5。huo4zhe3 xian4zai4 fan3hui3 ye3 xing2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3 yi1bei4zi5 de5 shi2jian1 lai2 xia4ding4jue2xin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns to face his huffing security captain.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're late, Audran. And there have been some... unexpected developments in your absence."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​转过身​看​向​匆忙​赶来​的​安保​负责人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​迟到​了​，​奥​德兰​。​在​这​段时间​内​，​出现​了​一些​……​意想不到​的​变故​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 kan4 xiang4 cong1mang2 gan3lai2 de5 an1bao3 fu4ze2ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 chi2dao4 le5，Ao4de2lan2。zai4 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1 nei4，chu1xian4 le5 yi1xie1……yi4xiang3bu4dao4 de5 bian4gu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns to face the hulking drone APEX has provided.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And any security patrols in the courtyard, we've got this massive hunk of junk backing us up. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​转向​APEX​提供​的​巨大​无人机​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​庭院​里​有​安保​巡逻​人员​，​我们​可以​用​这​一大​坨​垃圾​作为​支援​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 APEX ti2gong1 de5 ju4da4 wu2ren2ji1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ting2yuan4 li3 you3 an1bao3 xun2luo2 ren2yuan2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 yong4 zhe4 yi1 dai4 tuo2 la1ji1 zuo4wei2 zhi1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns to face the hulking drone APEX has provided.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And any security patrols in the courtyard, we've got this thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​转向​APEX​提供​的​巨大​无人机​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​庭院​里​有​安保​巡逻​人员​，​我们​可以​用​这​东西​来​对付​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 APEX ti2gong1 de5 ju4da4 wu2ren2ji1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ting2yuan4 li3 you3 an1bao3 xun2luo2 ren2yuan2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 yong4 zhe4 dong1xi1 lai2 dui4fu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns to stare at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're confusing correlation with causation, $(l.name). A childish mistake... motivated, no doubt, by latent feelings of guilt over the deaths of your friends.\n"
"\n"
"A great many tragic events have transpired in the past year, yes. But to pin them all on *our* actions without a shred of supporting evidence is both narcissistic and ridiculous."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​转过身​来​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​把​相关性​和​因果关系​混为一谈​了​，​$(l.name)​。​这​是​个​幼稚​的​错误​……​无疑​是​源于​你​对​朋友​们​死亡​的​潜在​愧疚​感​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​过去​一年​确实​发生​了​诸多​悲剧​事件​。​但​若​毫无​证据​地​将​所有​责任​都​归咎于​*​我们​的​*​行动​，​既​是​自恋​的​妄想​，​更是​荒谬​的​指控​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 xiang1guan1xing4 he4 yin1 guo3 guan1 xi4 hun4wei2yi1tan2 le5，$(l.name)。zhe4 shi4 ge4 you4zhi4 de5 cuo4wu4……wu2yi2 shi4 yuan2yu2 ni3 dui4 peng2you5 men5 si3wang2 de5 qian2zai4 kui4jiu4 gan3。\n"
"\n"
"guo4qu4 yi1 nian2 que4shi2 fa1sheng1 le5 zhu1duo1 bei1ju4 shi4jian4。dan4 ruo4 hao2wu2 zheng4ju4 de5 jiang1 suo3you3 ze2ren4 dou1 gui1 jiu4 yu2*wo3men5 de5*xing2dong4，ji4 shi4 zi4lian4 de5 wang4xiang3，geng4shi4 huang1miu4 de5 zhi3kong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns to study his terminal, frowning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Get your head in the game, $(l.name), and drop the notion that what's happening is all about you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​转头​盯​着​终端​屏幕​，​眉头​紧锁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​专心​点​，​$(l.name)​，​别​再​想着​眼前​发生​的​一切​都​与​你​有关​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3tou2 ding1 zhao2 zhong1duan1 ping2mu4，mei2tou2 jin3 suo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhuan1xin1 dian3，$(l.name)，bie4 zai4 xiang3 zhao2 yan3qian2 fa1sheng1 de5 yi1qie4 dou1 yu4 ni3 you3guan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns to you and smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Not a bad start, though.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, chief. Let's get the hell out of here. I've had enough of dragons... I just want to go home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​转过身​看着​你​，​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​起码​是​个​好的开始​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​头儿​，​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。​我​已经​受够了​巨龙​的​事​……​我​只​想​回家​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 kan4 zhao2 ni3，lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……qi3ma3 shi4 ge4 hao3 de5 kai1 shi3。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1 tou2r5，wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。wo3 yi3jing1 shou4 gou4 le5 ju4long2 de5 shi4……wo3 zhi3 xiang3 hui2jia1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns to you, conflicted.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing deserves this, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"But all the same... we can't just set her free."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​满脸​纠结​地​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没人​该​受​这样​的​罪​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​话说回来​……​我们​也​不能​直接​放​她​自由​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man3lian3 jiu1jie2 de5 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 gai1 shou4 zhe4yang4 de5 zui4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5……wo3men5 ye3 bu4neng2 zhi2jie1 fang4 ta1 zi4you2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He turns to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing deserves that, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"But we can't just let her free. She's a dragon. And she's nuts."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没人​该​受​这样​的​罪​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我们​也​不能​放​她​自由​。​她​是​一头​巨龙​，​而且​已经​疯癫​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 gai1 shou4 zhe4yang4 de5 zui4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 ye3 bu4neng2 fang4 ta1 zi4you2。ta1 shi4 yi1tou2 ju4long2，er2qie3 yi3jing1 feng1dian1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}He upends the bottle. Drains it. Slams it back down to the table. His eyes are rimmed with red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not much of a rumor, considering. I already *know* that you're gone, big brother.\n"
"\n"
"I live with that every day."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​把​瓶子​倒​过来​，​一饮而尽​，​然后​重重​摔回​桌上​。​他​的​眼圈​红​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不算什么​传言​。​我​已经​*​知道​*​你​不​在​了​，​哥哥​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​每天​都​活​在​这样​的​想法​中​。\n"
"\n"
