"​丛林​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mei2tou2 jin3 cu4，yi1tou2 ling2luan4 de5 tou2fa5 wei1wei1 di1chui2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cong2lin2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her brow furrows and her head of stringy hair inclines.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
