"{{GM}}​她​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​起码​理论​上​是​这个​意思​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……qi3ma3 li3lun4 shang4 shi4 zhe4ge5 yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her brow furrows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, I'm sorry. I'm afraid that you don't understand.\n"
"\n"
"We're a boutique shop, not a cybersurgery clinic. We can sell you the device and have it sent to the clinic of your choice for installation, but we don't do the surgery here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​蹙​起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​，​抱歉​。​恐怕​你​误会​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​这里​是​精品店​，​不是​赛博​诊所​。​我们​可以​为​你​销售​设备​，​并​将​其​寄​送到​你​指定​的​诊所​进行​安装​，​但​我们​这里​不​提供​手术​服务​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cu4 qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1，bao4qian4。kong3pa4 ni3 wu4hui4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4li3 shi4 jing1pin3dian4，bu4shi4 sai4bo2 zhen3suo3。wo3men5 ke3yi3 wei2 ni3 xiao1shou4 she4bei4，bing4 jiang1 qi2 ji4 song4 dao4 ni3 zhi3ding4 de5 zhen3suo3 jin4xing2 an1zhuang1，dan4 wo3men5 zhe4li3 bu4 ti2gong1 shou3shu4 fu2wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her brow suddenly tightens with concern.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh. What was going on there?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​眉毛​突然​拧紧​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​。​那里​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mei2mao5 tu1ran2 ning2 jin3 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1。na4li5 you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her composure cracks. Trembling, she raises her hands to hide her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, God. I'm fucking *dead.* They're going to kill me, and I can't...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She doubles over, sobbing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
