"{{GM}}​她​镇定​的​样子​还是​崩溃​了​。​她​颤抖​着​，​双手​掩面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​天​啊​。​我​他​妈​死定了​。​他们​要​杀​了​我​，​而​我​无能为力​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​蜷缩​着​身子​，​啜泣​不止​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我该​怎么办​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhen4ding4 de5 yang4zi5 hai2shi5 beng1kui4 le5。ta1 chan4dou3 zhao2，shuang1shou3 yan3 mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tian1 a1。wo3 ta1 ma1 si3 ding4 le5。ta1men5 yao4 sha1 le5 wo3，er2 wo3 wu2neng2wei2li4……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 quan2suo1 zhao2 shen1zi5，chuo4qi4 bu4zhi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gai1 zen3me5ban4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression clouds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As well as can be expected. My feelings on this are... complicated."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸上​阴云密布​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​在​尽力​控制​了​。​我​对此​的​感受​……​很​复杂​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 yin1 yun2 mi4 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 zai4 jin4li4 kong4zhi4 le5。wo3 dui4 ci3 de5 gan3shou4……hen3 fu4za2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression clouds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know.\n"
"\n"
"I don't even know if I want her to be."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸上​阴云密布​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​不​知道​我​是否​希望​她​一切​安好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 yin1 yun2 mi4 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 shi4fou3 xi1wang4 ta1 yi1qie4 an1hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression grows stern for a moment as she stares into her empty gin and tonic.{{/GM}}\n"
" \n"
"This place is like a grave. Maybe I’ve been down here long enough, and now I’m a ghost."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​盯​着​空空如也​的​金汤​力​杯子​，​表情​变得​有些​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​地方​就​像​座​坟场​。​也许​我​在​这​下面​待​了​太久​，​自己​也​变成​幽灵​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 kong1kong1ru2ye3 de5 jin1tang1 li4 bei1zi5，biao3qing2 bian4de5 you3xie1 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 di4fang1 jiu4 xiang4 zuo4 fen2chang3。ye3xu3 wo3 zai4 zhe4 xia4mian4 dai1 le5 tai4 jiu3，zi4ji3 ye3 bian4cheng2 you1ling2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression grows stern for a moment as she stares into her gin and tonic.{{/GM}}\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"Maybe I’ve been down here long enough. Maybe I’m a ghost too."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​盯​着​空空如也​的​金汤​力​杯子​，​表情​变得​有些​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​我​在​这​下面​待​了​太久​。​也许​我​自己​也​变成​幽灵​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 kong1kong1ru2ye3 de5 jin1tang1 li4 bei1zi5，biao3qing2 bian4de5 you3xie1 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3 zai4 zhe4 xia4mian4 dai1 le5 tai4 jiu3。ye3xu3 wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 bian4cheng2 you1ling2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression grows stern for a moment as she stares into her gin and tonic.{{/GM}}\n"
"\t\t\t\n"
"Maybe I’ve been down here long enough. Maybe I’m a ghost, too."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​盯​着​空空如也​的​金汤​力​杯子​，​表情​变得​有些​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​我​在​这​下面​待​了​太久​。​也许​我​自己​也​变成​幽灵​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 kong1kong1ru2ye3 de5 jin1tang1 li4 bei1zi5，biao3qing2 bian4de5 you3xie1 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 wo3 zai4 zhe4 xia4mian4 dai1 le5 tai4 jiu3。ye3xu3 wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 bian4cheng2 you1ling2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression hardens, and you can see fire in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's put an end to all of this. First the Spirit, then Harrow.\n"
"\n"
"It all ends tonight."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​表情​变得​冷峻​，​你​能​从​她​眼中​看到​怒火​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​了结​这​一切​。​先​干掉​精魂​，​然后​是​哈罗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切​都​将​在​今晚​结束​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 bian4de5 leng3jun4，ni3 neng2 cong2 ta1 yan3zhong1 kan4dao4 nu4huo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 liao3jie2 zhe4 yi1qie4。xian1 gan4diao4 jing1hun2，ran2hou4 shi4 ha1luo2。\n"
"\n"
"yi1qie4 dou1 jiang1 zai4 jin1wan3 jie2shu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression is guarded.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah...? What's that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​表情​很​警惕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​……​？​是​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 hen3 jing3ti4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2……？shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression slackens, becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Before the next cycle’s end, the Feuerschwinge Wyrm will speak again with the voice of the Maiden. The Dancer will spin, the Seal will melt, and the Calm Lake will burn again.\n"
"\n"
"This I prophesy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​表情​松弛下来​，​变得​恍惚​不定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​下个​循环​终结​之前​，​巨龙​火翼​将​会​用​少女​的​声音​再次​发话​。​舞者​将会​起舞​、​封印​将会​融化​、​静湖​将​会​燃烧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此​乃​吾​之​预言​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，bian4de5 huang3hu1 bu4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 xia4ge5 xun2huan2 zhong1jie2 zhi1qian2，ju4long2 Huo3yi4 jiang1 hui4 yong4 shao4nu:3 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4ci4 fa1 hua4。wu3zhe3 jiang1hui4 qi3 wu3、feng1yin4 jiang1hui4 rong2hua4、jing4 hu2 jiang1 hui4 ran2shao1。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 nai3 wu2 zhi1 yu4yan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression slackens, becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But hear me: \n"
"\n"
"Within this cycle, the world will rue this event, though for reasons none can guess. The Feuerschwinge Wyrm will speak again with the voice of a Stranger. The Dancer will falter, the Seal will remain fixed, and the Calm Lake will boil.\n"
"\n"
"This I prophesy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​表情​松弛下来​，​变得​恍惚​不定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​听​我​一言​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​循环​之内​，​世人​将​为此​叹息​，​原因​则​无人知晓​。​巨龙​火翼​将​会​用​陌者​的​声音​再次​发话​。​舞者​将会​踌躇​、​封印​将会​维持​、​静湖​将​会​沸腾​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此​乃​吾​之​预言​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，bian4de5 huang3hu1 bu4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ting1 wo3 yi1yan2：\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 xun2huan2 zhi1nei4，shi4ren2 jiang1 wei4ci3 tan4xi1，yuan2yin1 ze2 wu2 ren2 zhi1 xiao3。ju4long2 Huo3yi4 jiang1 hui4 yong4 mo4 zhe3 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4ci4 fa1 hua4。wu3zhe3 jiang1hui4 chou2chu2、feng1yin4 jiang1hui4 wei2chi2、jing4 hu2 jiang1 hui4 fei4teng2。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 nai3 wu2 zhi1 yu4yan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression slackens, becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Within this cycle, the world will rue this event, yet celebrate it nonetheless. The Feuerschwinge Wyrm will speak again with the voice of the Hunter. The Dancer will stumble, the Golden Man will eat 9 and 30, and the Scales will clatter to the ground.\n"
"\n"
"This I prophesy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​表情​松弛下来​，​变得​恍惚​不定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​循环​之内​，​世人​将​为此​叹息​，​却​仍​随之​欢庆​。​巨龙​火翼​将​会​用​猎人​的​声音​再次​发话​。​舞者​将会​翻覆​、​金人​将​会​吞噬​9​与​30​、​鳞片​将会​散落​于​地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此​乃​吾​之​预言​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，bian4de5 huang3hu1 bu4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 xun2huan2 zhi1nei4，shi4ren2 jiang1 wei4ci3 tan4xi1，que4 reng2 sui2zhi1 huan1qing4。ju4long2 Huo3yi4 jiang1 hui4 yong4 lie4ren2 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4ci4 fa1 hua4。wu3zhe3 jiang1hui4 fan1fu4、jin1 ren2 jiang1 hui4 tun1shi4 9 yu4 30、lin2pian4 jiang1hui4 san3luo4 yu2 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ci3 nai3 wu2 zhi1 yu4yan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression softens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry, $(l.name). I know that you're concerned. But really, there's no need to be.\n"
"\n"
"I'm going to be just fine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​表情​柔和​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​道歉​，​$(l.name)​，​我​知道​你​很​担心​，​但​不用​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​没事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 rou2he2 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dao4qian4，$(l.name)，wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 hen3 dan1xin1，dan4 bu4yong4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 mei2shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her expression softens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're sweet, $(l.name). But don't worry.\n"
"\n"
"I'm going to be just fine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​表情​柔和​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​人​很​好​，​$(l.name)​。​不过​别​担心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​没事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 rou2he2 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ren2 hen3 hao3，$(l.name)。bu4guo4 bie4 dan1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 mei2shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*Kill* him? *No.* I won't let that happen.\n"
"\n"
"You need to make a choice. If you want to help the children here, I'll help you. But I won't let you raise a hand to Harrow, and if you try, I'll stop you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​杀​了​*​他​？​*​不​*​。​我​绝不会​让​这种​事​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​必须​做出​选择​。​如果​你​想​帮助​这里​的​孩子​，​我会​协助​你​。​但​我​绝不允许​你​对​哈罗​动手​，​如果​你​敢​尝试​，​我会​亲手​阻止​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*sha1 le5*ta1？*bu4*。wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 rang4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bi4xu1 zuo4chu1 xuan3ze2。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 bang1zhu4 zhe4li3 de5 hai2zi5，wo3 hui4 xie2zhu4 ni3。dan4 wo3 jue2 bu4 yun3 xu3 ni3 dui4 ha1luo2 dong4shou3，ru2guo3 ni3 gan3 chang2shi4，wo3 hui4 qin1shou3 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*What?* We've never done a THING to--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​睁​大​双眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​什么​*​？​我们​从未​做过​任何​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zheng1 dai4 shuang1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*shen2me5*？wo3men5 cong2wei4 zuo4 guo4 ren4he2 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes narrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That son of a bitch said a lot of things. What of it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​眯起​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​王八蛋​是​说​了​不少​话​。​有​什么​问题​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 wang2ba1dan4 shi4 shuo1 le5 bu4shao3 hua4。you3 shen2me5 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes pass from you to your teammate, then lock on yours.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Who's your friend, by the way?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​眼睛​看看​你​和​你​的​队员​，​最后​锁定​在​你​身上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​你​的​这位​朋友​是​做​什么​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3jing5 kan4kan5 ni3 he4 ni3 de5 dui4yuan2，zui4hou4 suo3ding4 zai4 ni3 shen1shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1 ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes pass from you to your teammates, then lock on yours.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Who are your friends, by the way? They don't look like employees."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​眼睛​看看​你​和​你​的​队员​，​最后​锁定​在​你​身上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​你​的​这些​朋友​是​做​什么​的​？​他们​看起来​不像​这里​的​雇员​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3jing5 kan4kan5 ni3 he4 ni3 de5 dui4yuan2，zui4hou4 suo3ding4 zai4 ni3 shen1shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1 ni3 de5 zhe4xie1 peng2you5 shi4 zuo4 shen2me5 de5？ta1men5 kan4qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 zhe4li3 de5 gu4yuan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes widen as the memories return.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mujaji has awakened? It must be she. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​张大​眼睛​，​仿佛​记忆​随之​回归​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​穆加​吉​觉醒​了​？​一定​是​她​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang1 dai4 yan3jing5，fang3fu2 ji4yi4 sui2zhi1 hui2gui1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mu4 jia1 ji2 jue2xing3 le5？yi1ding4 shi4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes widen as the memories return.{{/GM}}\n"
" \n"
"They would build walls around it… as before."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​张大​眼睛​，​仿佛​记忆​随之​回归​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​会造​起​高墙​……​就​像​从前​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang1 dai4 yan3jing5，fang3fu2 ji4yi4 sui2zhi1 hui2gui1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 hui4 zao4 qi3 gao1 qiang2……jiu4 xiang4 cong2qian2 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes widen, and she puts up her hands as though to push away her statements.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whoa there, I didn’t mean to strike a nerve! It’s just the things like the turf wars and the racists and junk. Like those Humanis assholes, you know? Unnnn-pleasant. \n"
"\n"
"But that shit aside, I like the idea of a state without the Man."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​张大​眼睛​，​举起​双手​，​好像​要​收回​此前​的​发言​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​喂喂​喂​，​我​不是故意​要​冒犯​你​的​！​无非​是​争夺​地盘​啊​、​种族歧视​以及​瘾君子​什么​的​。​比如​那些​人类​至上​主义者​混蛋​们​？​可​太烦人​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​抛开​这些​不说​，​我​还​挺​喜欢​“​无男州​”​的​概念​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang1 dai4 yan3jing5，ju3qi3 shuang1shou3，hao3xiang4 yao4 shou1hui2 ci3qian2 de5 fa1yan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei2 wei2 wei2，wo3 bu4 shi4 gu4 yi4 yao4 mao4fan4 ni3 de5！wu2fei1 shi4 zheng1duo2 di4pan2 a1、zhong3zu2qi2shi4 yi3ji2 yin3jun1zi3 shen2me5 de5。bi3ru2 na4xie1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 hun2dan4 men5？ke3 tai4 fan2 ren2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 pao1kai1 zhe4xie1 bu4 shuo1，wo3 hai2 ting3 xi3huan5“wu2 nan2 zhou1” de5 gai4nian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her eyes widen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You could do that? Jury-rig one for us? That'd be amazing!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​做到​？​能​给​我们​拼​一个​？​那​真是​太棒了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4？neng2 gei3 wo3men5 pin1 yi1ge5？na4 zhen1shi5 tai4 bang4 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her face clouds with despair.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Then I've thrown away my life for nothing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸上​笼罩着​绝望​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​豁出​性命​的​一搏​便​毫无意义​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 long2 zhao4 zhao2 jue2wang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 hua2 chu1 xing4ming4 de5 yi1 bo2 bian4 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her face crumples, and she begins to sob.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Get the hell out of here. I never want to see your face on our property again."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸​垮​了​下来​，​开始​低声​啜泣​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​这里​滚出去​。​我​再也​不想​在​我们​的​地盘​上​看见​你​这​张脸​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 kua3 le5 xia4lai5，kai1shi3 di1sheng1 chuo4qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cong2 zhe4li3 gun3 chu1 qu4。wo3 zai4ye3 bu4xiang3 zai4 wo3men5 de5 di4pan2 shang4 kan4jian4 ni3 zhe4 zhang1 lian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her face flushes red, and she breaks eye contact with you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wish that were true.\n"
"\n"
"But it isn't."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸颊​一下子​泛起​红晕​，​避开​了​你​的​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​希望​是​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​事实​并非如此​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3jia2 yi1xia4zi5 fan4qi3 hong2yun4，bi4kai1 le5 ni3 de5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 shi4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 shi4shi2 bing4 fei1 ru2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her face flushes red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'd rather not talk about it.\n"
"\n"
"Let's just say that someone did me a favor once, and that coming along on this thing is how I have to pay it back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​涨红了脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​谈论​这个​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这么​说​吧​，​有人​之前​帮​了​我​，​而​作为​回报​，​我要​跟着​完成​这次​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang3 hong2 le5 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 tan2lun4 zhe4ge5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1，you3ren2 zhi1qian2 bang1 le5 wo3，er2 zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，wo3 yao4 gen1zhe5 wan2cheng2 zhe4 ci4 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her face flushes. She's clearly upset, but she keeps her cool.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right. We don't go off-mission. Not even for this.\n"
"\n"
"I just hope that by the time we *do* get around to it, it isn't too late."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸​有些​涨红​。​她​显然​对此​有所​不满​，​但​还是​保持​了​克制​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​。​我们​不能​偏离​任务​，​哪怕​是​这件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只​希望​等​我们​*​有​*​时间​回头​处理​的​时候​，​还​不会​太迟​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 you3xie1 zhang4hong2。ta1 xian3ran2 dui4 ci3 you3suo3 bu4man3，dan4 hai2shi5 bao3chi2 le5 ke4zhi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 bu4neng2 pian1li2 ren4wu5，na3pa4 shi4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3 xi1wang4 deng3 wo3men5*you3*shi2jian1 hui2tou2 chu3li3 de5 shi2hou5，hai2 bu4hui4 tai4 chi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her face is breaking apart. Rupturing at the seams. Blue-white light floods out through the lesions. When she speaks, her voice is hollow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's what you're up against. That's what you need to stop. And if you don't, the F-State will fall."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​面容​正在​崩解​。​皮肤​沿着​接缝处​裂开​，​蓝白色​的​光芒​从中​涌出​。​当​她​开口​时​，​声音​空洞​无力​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就是​你​要​面对​的​敌人​。​这​就是​你​要​阻止​的​一切​。​否则​，​动荡​带​将​不复存在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mian4rong2 zheng4zai4 beng1 jie3。pi2fu1 yan2zhe5 jie1 feng2 chu3 lie4kai1，lan2 bai2 se4 de5 guang1mang2 cong2zhong1 yong3chu1。dang1 ta1 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 kong1dong4 wu2li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4shi4 ni3 yao4 mian4dui4 de5 di2ren2。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ni3 yao4 zu3zhi3 de5 yi1qie4。fou3ze2，dong4dang4 dai4 jiang1 bu4 fu4 cun2 zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her face lights up.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A wonderful device - simply wonderful! And we're doing a special on it right now!\n"
"\n"
"All yours for only ¥250."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸庞​顿时​亮​了​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​绝妙​的​装置​—​—​简直​妙不可言​！​我们​现在​正在​进行​特别​促销​活动​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​仅​需​¥​250​，​你​就​能​拥有​它​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3pang2 dun4shi2 liang4 le5 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jue2miao4 de5 zhuang1zhi4——jian3zhi2 miao4bu4ke3yan2！wo3men5 xian4zai4 zheng4zai4 jin4xing2 te4bie2 cu4xiao1 huo2dong4！\n"
"\n"
"jin3 xu1 ¥ 250，ni3 jiu4 neng2 yong1you3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her face visibly brightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In that case, it's a deal!\n"
"\n"
"I can't tell you how relieved I am, $(l.name)... thank you for helping me to bring this nightmare to an end."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​脸色​明显​轻快​了​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样一来​，​我们​就​说定了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​知道​这​让​我​有​多​轻松​，​$(l.name)​……​谢谢​你​帮助​我​结束​这场​噩梦​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3se4 ming2xian3 qing1kuai4 le5 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4yi1lai2，wo3men5 jiu4 shuo1 ding4 le5！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 zhi1dao4 zhe4 rang4 wo3 you3 duo1 qing1song1，$(l.name)……xie4xie5 ni3 bang1zhu4 wo3 jie2shu4 zhe4 chang2 e4meng4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her finger tightens on the trigger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Slot off, drekhead!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​手指​扣紧​了​扳机​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​滚开​，​傻​逼​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shou3zhi3 kou4 jin3 le5 ban1ji1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gun3kai1，sha3 bi1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her frown inverts into a cruel smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Big mistake, bitch. *Big* mistake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​皱眉​变为​一个​残忍​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​错​了​，​贱人​。​*​大错特错​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zhou4mei2 bian4wei2 yi1ge5 can2ren3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 cuo4 le5，jian4ren2。*da4cuo4te4cuo4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her gaze shifts to Marta, and her lips curl into a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry about misleading you before. I was just telling you what you wanted to hear... but you're no stranger to that, are you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​目光​转向​玛​尔塔​，​嘴角​露出​一抹​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​之前​误导​了​你​。​我​只是​说​了​些​你​想​听​的话​……​但​你​对此​并​不​陌生​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 mu4guang1 zhuan3xiang4 Ma3er3ta3，zui3jiao3 lu4chu1 yi1 ma1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 zhi1qian2 wu4dao3 le5 ni3。wo3 zhi3shi4 shuo1 le5 xie1 ni3 xiang3 ting1 de5hua4……dan4 ni3 dui4 ci3 bing4 bu4 mo4sheng1，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her grin widens, and she nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks, $(l.name). For everything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​笑容​更加​灿烂​，​向​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​谢谢​你​做​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 geng4jia1 can4lan4，xiang4 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，xie4xie5 ni3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her hands tighten on her rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What we saw doesn't change anything. It only means that we have a new target."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​手​握紧​了​步枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​所​看到​的​并​不会​改变​什么​。​这​仅仅​意味着​我们​有​了​新​的​目标​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shou3 wo4 jin3 le5 bu4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 suo3 kan4dao4 de5 bing4 bu4hui4 gai3bian4 shen2me5。zhe4 jin3jin3 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 you3 le5 xin1 de5 mu4biao1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her jaw drops open in shock, and her cheeks blush red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Her father ruined her life years before we even met! I... I didn't *do* anything!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​惊讶​得​合不拢嘴​，​涨红了脸​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​早​在​我们​相识​的​多年​前​，​她​的​生活​就​已经​被​她​父亲​毁​了​！​我​……​我​什么​都​没​做​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jing1ya4 de2 he2bu4long3zui3，zhang3 hong2 le5 lian3 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zao3 zai4 wo3men5 xiang1shi2 de5 duo1nian2 qian2，ta1 de5 sheng1huo2 jiu4 yi3jing1 bei4 ta1 fu4qin1 hui3 le5！wo3……wo3 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 zuo4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her lip curls into a derisive sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I heard you the first time. And I suppose you're sellin' those fancy new *invisible* pizzas, huh?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​嘴角​翘起​一抹​讥讽​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​第一次​就​听到​了​。​我​猜​你​卖​的​是​那种​*​隐形​*​的​新​披萨​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 qiao4qi3 yi1 ma1 ji1feng3 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 di4yi1ci4 jiu4 ting1dao4 le5。wo3 cai1 ni3 mai4 de5 shi4 na4zhong3*yin3xing2*de5 xin1 pi1sa4，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her lip curls into a smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He did need it, didn't he?\n"
"\n"
"You're welcome, fearless leader. It was my pleasure."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​客气​，​无畏​领袖​。​这​是​我​应该​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 ke4qi5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。zhe4 shi4 wo3 ying1gai1 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her lip curls into a sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Harrow warned us about this kind of backward thinking, but I wasn't expecting to hear it from you.\n"
"\n"
"I'd always assumed that you shadowrunners were savvy enough to know that good and evil don't exist."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​嘴角​翘起​一抹​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​早就​警告​过​我们​这种​陈腐​的​思想​，​但​我​没想到​会​从​你​的​口中​说​出来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​以为​你们​暗影​狂奔​者​都​精明​得​很​，​早该​明白​世上​根本​不​存在​什么​善恶​之分​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 qiao4qi3 yi1 ma1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 zao3jiu4 jing3gao4 guo4 wo3men5 zhe4zhong3 chen2fu3 de5 si1xiang3，dan4 wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 hui4 cong2 ni3 de5 kou3 zhong4 shuo1 chu1lai2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 yi3wei2 ni3men5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 dou1 jing1ming2 de2 hen3，zao3 gai1 ming2bai5 shi4shang4 gen1ben3 bu4 cun2zai4 shen2me5 shan4e4 zhi1 fen4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her lip curls, and she shakes her head at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, fearless leader. You win. I'll stay here - for the team. But when we're done with this Feuerschwinge situation, I'm gone, you hear me?\n"
"\n"
"I won't hang around here to watch Schattennest fall, and I won't watch it drag the Kreuzbasar down with it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​撇​了​下​嘴​，​冲着​你​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​你​赢​了​，​我​不​去​了​—​—​这​都​是​为了​团队​。​但是​等到​火翼​的​事​结束​后​，​我​就​会​离开​，​听​明白​没​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​就​这么​眼睁睁​看着​影巢​陷落​，​更​不会​让​他们​把​克洛伊​茨​集市​也​拖下水​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 xia4 zui3，chong1 zhao2 ni3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。ni3 ying2 le5，wo3 bu4 qu4 le5——zhe4 dou1 shi4 wei4le5 tuan2dui4。dan4shi4 deng3dao4 Huo3yi4 de5 shi4 jie2shu4 hou4，wo3 jiu4 hui4 li2kai1，ting1 ming2bai5 mei2？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 jiu4 zhe4me5 yan3zheng1zheng1 kan4 zhao2 ying3 chao2 xian4luo4，geng1 bu4hui4 rang4 ta1men5 ba3 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 ye3 tuo1xia4shui3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her lips lift into something approaching a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You too, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​嘴角​浮现​出​一丝​笑意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​也​是​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 si1 xiao4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3 shi4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her mouth curls into a frown.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pretty amateur hour of him to change things up at the last second like this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​嘴角​耷拉​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​竟然​会​在​最后​一刻​改​主意​，​真是太​业余​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 da1la5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 jing4ran2 hui4 zai4 zui4hou4 yi1 ke4 gai3 zhu3yi5，zhen1 shi4 tai4 ye4yu2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her mouth tightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a sort of... lounge... for Harrow's inner circle. The acolytes, and the bait girls, and Harrow's wives.\n"
"\n"
"Marta and I used to spend a lot of time in there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​嘴唇​紧绷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​……​休息室​……​仅限​哈罗​的​内部​圈子​使用​。​包括​侍祭​、​用作​诱饵​的​女孩​，​以及​哈罗​的​妻子​们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​和​我​曾​在​那里​待过​很多​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3chun2 jin3beng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5……xiu1xi1shi4……jin3 xian4 ha1luo2 de5 nei4bu4 quan1zi5 shi3yong4。bao1kuo4 shi4 ji4、yong4zuo4 you4er3 de5 nu:3hai2，yi3ji2 ha1luo2 de5 qi1zi3 men5。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 he4 wo3 ceng2 zai4 na4li5 dai1 guo4 hen3 duo1 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her mouth tightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes... you could call it that. A special place for Harrow's inner circle. The acolytes, and the bait girls, and Harrow's wives.\n"
"\n"
"Marta and I used to spend a lot of time in there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​嘴唇​紧绷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​……​你​可以​这么​说​。​这里​仅限​哈罗​的​内部​圈子​使用​。​包括​侍祭​、​用作​诱饵​的​女孩​，​以及​哈罗​的​妻子​们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​和​我​曾​在​那里​待过​很多​时间​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3chun2 jin3beng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……ni3 ke3yi3 zhe4me5 shuo1。zhe4li3 jin3 xian4 ha1luo2 de5 nei4bu4 quan1zi5 shi3yong4。bao1kuo4 shi4 ji4、yong4zuo4 you4er3 de5 nu:3hai2，yi3ji2 ha1luo2 de5 qi1zi3 men5。\n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 he4 wo3 ceng2 zai4 na4li5 dai1 guo4 hen3 duo1 shi2jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her mouth twists into a joyless smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Harrow certainly thought so. I did it for him, you know... a sign of devotion. All that I wanted was to please him."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​嘴角​露出​一抹​苦涩​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​肯定​是​这样​想​的​。​我​是​为​他​而​这么​做​的​……​为了​表达​我​的​忠诚​。​我​唯一​想要​的​就是​取悦​他​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 lu4chu1 yi1 ma1 ku3se4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 ken3ding4 shi4 zhe4yang4 xiang3 de5。wo3 shi4 wei2 ta1 er2 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5……wei4le5 biao3da2 wo3 de5 zhong1cheng2。wo3 wei2yi1 xiang3yao4 de5 jiu4shi4 qu3yue4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her pixie grin softens into a concerned frown.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I understand your reaction, Dietrich. I really do.\n"
"\n"
"This must be difficult for you to understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那​精灵​般的​笑容​渐渐​褪去​，​化作​忧虑​的​愁容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​理解​你​的​反应​，​迪​特里​希​。​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​对​你​来说​一定​很难​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 jing1ling2 ban1 de5 xiao4rong2 jian4jian4 tui4qu4，hua4zuo4 you1lu:4 de5 chou2 rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 li3jie3 ni3 de5 fan3ying4，Di2te4li3xi1。zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 yi1ding4 hen3 nan2 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her rifle remains steady.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look. I don't want to do this any more than you do. But we're not going to let you keep sniffing around here. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​仍然​稳稳​举着​步枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​我​和​你​一样​都​不想​事情​变成​这样​，​但​我们​不能​让​你​继续​这样​四处​窥探​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 reng2ran2 wen3 wen3 ju3 zhao2 bu4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3 he4 ni3 yi1yang4 dou1 bu4xiang3 shi4qing5 bian4cheng2 zhe4yang4，dan4 wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 ni3 ji4xu4 zhe4yang4 si4chu4 kui1tan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her small voice is barely audible.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll be waiting."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​微弱​的​声音​几不​可辨​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​等​着​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1ruo4 de5 sheng1yin1 ji1 bu4 ke3 bian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 deng3 zhao2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her smile dips, but only for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fair enough. Take care of yourself, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​有​那么​一瞬间​，​她​的​笑容​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​那​你​照顾​好​自己​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you3 na4me5 yi1shun4jian1，ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 ni3 zhao4gu5 hao3 zi4ji3，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her smile drops, but only slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, be my guest. Be sure to come back to me if you need any help!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​笑容​略微​收敛​了​一点​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​，​请​自便​。​如​有​需要​，​欢迎​随时​来​找​我​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 lu:e4wei1 shou1lian3 le5 yi1dian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1，qing3 zi4bian4。ru2 you3 xu1yao4，huan1ying2 sui2shi2 lai2 zhao3 wo3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her smile shifts into an expression of mock concern.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hurting? How so?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​笑容​变成​一副​假惺惺​的​关切​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​伤害​？​怎么​会​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 bian4cheng2 yi1 fu4 jia3xing1xing1 de5 guan1qie4 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shang1hai4？zen3me5 hui4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her smile slowly fades.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That girl. Such a sweet young thing.\n"
"\n"
"I rescued her from a bad place, Glory... her, and the boys in that dorm as well. But they're all safe now, and isn't that what's important?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​笑容​渐渐​褪去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​姑娘​真是​个​可爱​的​年轻人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​，​我​把​她​从​某个​鬼​地方​救​了​出来​……​不仅​是​她​，​还有​宿舍​里​的​那些​男孩​们​。​但​他们​现在​都​安全​了​，​这​不​就是​最​重要​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 jian4jian4 tui4qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 gu1niang5 zhen1shi5 ge4 ke3ai4 de5 nian2qing1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，wo3 ba3 ta1 cong2 mou3 ge4 gui3 di4fang1 jiu4 le5 chu1lai2……bu4jin3 shi4 ta1，hai2you3 su4she4 li3 de5 na4xie1 nan2hai2 men5。dan4 ta1men5 xian4zai4 dou1 an1quan2 le5，zhe4 bu4 jiu4shi4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her smile widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's right, ace. It's me.\n"
"\n"
"I'm back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​笑容​更​甚​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​王牌​。​是​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​回来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 geng1 shen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，wang2pai2。shi4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui2lai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her spray-tanned husband chimes in.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Right. The last thing we'd want is to come between you people and... whatever it is that you do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​那​肤色​黝黑​的​丈夫​插话​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​。​我们​可​不想​耽误​你们​的​事情​……​无论​你们​在​搞​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 na4 fu1se4 you3hei1 de5 zhang4fu5 cha1hua4 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4。wo3men5 ke3 bu4xiang3 dan1wu5 ni3men5 de5 shi4qing5……wu2lun4 ni3men5 zai4 gao3 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her tone changes, becomes more businesslike.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I heard.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Silence.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, he knows. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​语气​变得​更​像​在​谈​公事​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​听说​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一片​寂静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​他​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 bian4de5 geng1 xiang4 zai4 tan2 gong1shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，ta1 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her tone is sharp.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We'll be *fine.* What we don't need is a *stranger* butting into our business.\n"
"\n"
"So just go away, all right? Have a nice day."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​语气​很​刺耳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​*​没事​*​。​我们​不​需要​的​是​一个​*​陌生人​*​来​说三道四​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​请​你​走开​，​好​吗​？​祝​你​今天​愉快​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 hen3 ci4er3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5*mei2shi4*。wo3men5 bu4 xu1yao4 de5 shi4 yi1ge5*mo4sheng1ren2*lai2 shuo1san1dao4si4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 qing3 ni3 zou3kai1，hao3 ma5？zhu4 ni3 jin1tian1 yu2kuai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her tone softens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure that you have unanswered questions. I'm not in the habit of dealing with shadowrunners.\n"
"\n"
"In truth, I've spent the majority of my career living in fear of you people.\n"
"\n"
"But I do know that you're the only ones who can get this done."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​语气​缓和​了​一些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​明白​你​心中​肯定​仍​有​疑惑​。​我​向来​不愿​与​暗影​狂奔​者​打交道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说实话​，​我​的​职业生涯​中​大半​时间​都​在​畏惧​你们​这​类人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​也​清楚​，​唯有​你们​能​完成​这项​任务​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 huan3he2 le5 yi1xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 xin1zhong1 ken3ding4 reng2 you3 yi2huo4。wo3 xiang4lai2 bu4yuan4 yu4 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 da3jiao1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1shi2hua4，wo3 de5 zhi2 ye4 sheng1 ya2 zhong4 da4ban4 shi2jian1 dou1 zai4 wei4ju4 ni3men5 zhe4 lei4 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 ye3 qing1chu5，wei2you3 ni3men5 neng2 wan2cheng2 zhe4 xiang4 ren4wu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her voice frosts over with cold rage.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't. You. Touch. Me.\n"
"\n"
"You're one of Harrow's creatures. You always were."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​声音​带​着​冷冽​的​怒火​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​。​碰​。​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​哈罗​的​造物​。​你​一直​都​是​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 leng3lie4 de5 nu4huo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4。peng4。wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 zao4wu4。ni3 yi1zhi2 dou1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her voice goes quiet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Marta gave it to me on the day that this photo was taken. She said that she made it for me.\n"
"\n"
"I left it behind when I left this place behind."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​声音​渐渐​变得​微​不可​察​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​在​拍​下​这张​照片​的​当天​把​它​送给​了​我​。​她​说​这​是​自己​亲手​为​我​做​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​离开​这​地方​时​，​把​它​留在​了​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 jian4jian4 bian4de5 wei1 bu4ke3 cha2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 zai4 pai1 xia4 zhe4 zhang1 zhao4pian4 de5 dang1tian1 ba3 ta1 song4gei3 le5 wo3。ta1 shuo1 zhe4 shi4 zi4ji3 qin1shou3 wei2 wo3 zuo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 li2kai1 zhe4 di4fang1 shi2，ba3 ta1 liu2 zai4 le5 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her voice is calm. Placid.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He's a great man. A prophet.\n"
"\n"
"True, sacrifices have to be made, but what he brings in return... it's so much *love,* Glory! You remember!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​声音​平静​而​安详​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​是​伟人​。​是​先知​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​诚然​，​启蒙​必然​伴随​着​牺牲​。​但​作为​回报​，​他​带来​的​……​是​如此​丰厚​的​*​爱​*​啊​，​格洛丽​！​你​记得​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ping2jing4 er2 an1xiang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 wei3ren2。shi4 xian1zhi1。\n"
"\n"
"cheng2ran2，qi3meng2 bi4ran2 ban4sui2 zhao2 xi1sheng1。dan4 zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，ta1 dai4lai2 de5……shi4 ru2ci3 feng1hou4 de5*ai4*a1，Ge2luo4li2！ni3 ji4de5 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her voice turns cold.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Otherwise, you'd better find another way to get where you're goin'. 'Cause this bridge is ours, and nobody crosses without paying the toll.\n"
"\n"
"Nobody."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​语气​变得​冰冷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​否则​的话​，​你们​最好​另​找​别路​。​这桥​是​我们​的​，​没人能​不​给钱​就​过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谁​都​不行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 bian4de5 bing1leng3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fou3ze2 de5hua4，ni3men5 zui4hao3 ling4 zhao3 bie4 lu4。zhe4 qiao2 shi4 wo3men5 de5，mei2 ren2 neng2 bu4 gei3 qian2 jiu4 guo4。\n"
"\n"
"shei2 dou1 bu4xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Her yellow eyes lock on yours. Focus hard.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"FREE ME, VAUCLAIR. FREE ME OR BURN."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​黄色​的​双眼​死死​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​放​了​我​，​沃​克莱尔​。​否则​化为​焦炭​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huang2se4 de5 shuang1yan3 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fang4 le5 wo3，Wo4ke4lai2er3。fou3ze2 hua4 wei2 jiao1tan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His body begins to tremble. It looks like the drugs are wearing off.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"T-they have money, she-troll. M-money and influence enough to put the syndicates to shame. Even I cannot say how much, but I d-do know that what I've seen is just the tip of the s-s-spear."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​身体​开始​发抖​。​好像​是​药物​的​效力​消退​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​-​他们​有钱​，​女​巨魔​。​他们​的​钱​和​影响力​足以​让​黑帮​集团​汗颜​。​就​连​我​也​无法​说出​具体​数额​，​但​我​-​我​确实​知道​，​我​所​见到​的​只是​冰山一角​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shen1ti3 kai1shi3 fa1dou3。hao3xiang4 shi4 yao4wu4 de5 xiao4li4 xiao1tui4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 -ta1men5 you3qian2，nu:3 ju4mo2。ta1men5 de5 qian2 he4 ying3xiang3li4 zu2yi3 rang4 hei1bang1 ji2tuan2 han4yan2。jiu4 lian2 wo3 ye3 wu2fa3 shuo1chu1 ju4ti3 shu4e2，dan4 wo3 -wo3 que4shi2 zhi1dao4，wo3 suo3 jian4dao4 de5 zhi3shi4 bing1shan1yi1jiao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His brow furrows in concentration. Finally, he gives you a slow nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I do, my friend.\n"
"\n"
"I do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​皱起​眉头​，​努力​思索​。​最终​，​他​缓缓​地点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我​的​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2，nu3li4 si1suo3。zui4zhong1，ta1 huan3huan3 di4dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 de5 peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His brow furrows. He takes a step towards you impatiently.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Well?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​蹙​起​眉头​，​不耐烦​地向​你​走近​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​嗯​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cu4 qi3 mei2tou2，bu4nai4fan2 de5 xiang4 ni3 zou3jin4 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……en1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His brow furrows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I dunno, boss. I don't like lettin' anyone tell me what to do... I wanna say to hell with 'em, and leave it at that.\n"
"\n"
"But this is the Black Lodge we're talkin' about. If they want somethin' from us, it might be best to just give it to 'em."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眉头​紧皱​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不好​说​啊​，​老大​。​我​不​喜欢​听人​使唤​……​我本​想​说​让​他们​滚蛋​，​别理​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​可是​黑​结社​。​他们​要​我们​干什么​，​我们​最好​照​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mei2tou2 jin3 zhou4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hao3 shuo1 a1，lao3da4。wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 ting1 ren2 shi3huan5……wo3 ben3 xiang3 shuo1 rang4 ta1men5 gun3dan4，bie2li3 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 ke3shi4 hei1 jie2she4。ta1men5 yao4 wo3men5 gan4shen2me5，wo3men5 zui4hao3 zhao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His deformed face twists into a vicious smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Doesn’t matter. With that monster's help, I'm gonna change the world.\n"
"\n"
"At the very least, the dragons will die, and at most, who knows? We'll just have to wait and see."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​可怖​的​脸庞​扭曲​成​一个​狰狞​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无所谓​。​有​了​那头​怪物​的​帮助​，​我​一定​会​改变​世界​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至少​，​巨龙​会​死去​，​至于​最多能​做到​什么​程度​，​谁​知道​呢​？​我们​只能​拭目以待​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ke3 bu4 de5 lian3pang2 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1ge5 zheng1ning2 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2suo3wei4。you3 le5 na4 tou2 guai4wu5 de5 bang1zhu4，wo3 yi1ding4 hui4 gai3bian4 shi4jie4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4shao3，ju4long2 hui4 si3qu4，zhi4yu2 zui4 duo1 neng2 zuo4dao4 shen2me5 cheng2du4，shei2 zhi1dao4 ni2？wo3men5 zhi3neng2 shi4mu4yi3dai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His deformed face twists into a vicious smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Best of luck with that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​可怖​的​脸庞​扭曲​成​一个​狰狞​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​祝你好运​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ke3 bu4 de5 lian3pang2 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1ge5 zheng1ning2 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1。zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His expression falls flat again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He puts down his comic, and his voice slows to a crawl. He makes a point of enunciating each word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I point people to the bar. If someone starts trouble, I give them a taste of Herr Zapp. \n"
"\n"
"That's it. That's all I do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​表情​再次​冷淡​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​漫画​放下​，​语速​也​变得​极其​缓慢​，​一字一顿​地​说​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​负责​告诉​客人​吧台​在​哪儿​。​要是​有人​闹事​，​我​就让​他们​尝尝​霹雳​老大哥​的​滋味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这些​。​我​只​干​这些​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 zai4ci4 leng3dan4 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 man4hua4 fang4xia4，yu3 su4 ye3 bian4de5 ji2qi2 huan3man4，yi1 zi4 yi1 dun4 de5 shuo1 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 fu4ze2 gao4su4 ke4ren2 ba1tai2 zai4 na3r5。yao4shi5 you3ren2 nao4shi4，wo3 jiu4 rang4 ta1men5 chang2 chang2 pi1li4 lao3da4ge1 de5 zi1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4xie1。wo3 zhi3 gan4 zhe4xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His expression hardens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your loss."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​表情​变得​冷峻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​你​不​识相​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 bian4de5 leng3jun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ni3 bu4 shi2xiang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His eyes bulge.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*EVERYBODY!*\n"
"\n"
"Everyone but me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​眼睛​突了​出来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​所有人​*​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​只​剩​我​一个​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3jing5 tu1 le5 chu1lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*suo3you3ren2*！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 zhi3 sheng4 wo3 yi1ge5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His eyes flash.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is not MURDER, shadowrunner. It is *sacrifice.* \n"
"\n"
"Murder is selfish. But sacrifice... to sacrifice is to do that which is *necessary.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​眼睛​闪着光​彩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不是​屠杀​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​这是​*​牺牲​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​屠杀​是​自私​的​。​但​牺牲​……​是​成​大事​的​*​必要​*​条件​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3jing5 shan3 zhao2 guang1 cai3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4shi4 tu2sha1，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。zhe4 shi4*xi1sheng1*。\n"
"\n"
"tu2sha1 shi4 zi4si1 de5。dan4 xi1sheng1……shi4 cheng2 da4shi4 de5*bi4yao4*tiao2jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His eyes glint.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Because you have already been working for him for some time now, mein Herr. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​眼里​闪着​精光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​你​已经​为​他​工作​好​一段时间​了​，​先生​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3 li3 shan3 zhao2 jing1guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 ni3 yi3jing1 wei2 ta1 gong1zuo4 hao3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 le5，xian1sheng5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His eyes glint.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Because you have already been working for him for some time now, meine Dame."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​眼里​闪着​精光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​你​已经​为​他​工作​好​一段时间​了​，​女士​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3 li3 shan3 zhao2 jing1guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 ni3 yi3jing1 wei2 ta1 gong1zuo4 hao3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 le5，nu:3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His eyes go wide, and his voice becomes shrill.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, but... did he tell you that we did exactly what he told us to?\n"
"\n"
"Did he tell you that it was *his* bad intel that got me hung out to dry like this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞪​大​了​眼睛​，​声音​变得​尖锐​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​……​他​难道​没有​说​，​我们​完全​是​奉命行事​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​怎么​不说​，​是​*​他​的​*​错误​情报​才​导致​我​陷入​了​如此​境地​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5，sheng1yin1 bian4de5 jian1rui4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4……ta1 nan2dao4 mei2you3 shuo1，wo3men5 wan2quan2 shi4 feng4 ming4 xing2 shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zen3me5 bu4 shuo1，shi4*ta1 de5*cuo4wu4 qing2bao4 cai2 dao3zhi4 wo3 xian4ru4 le5 ru2ci3 jing4di4？"

