"{{GM}}​他​的​眼睛​瞪​得​老大​。​看起来​他​很​难​消化​你​刚刚​告诉​他​的​消息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​出去​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​可是​……​我们​的​使命​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3jing5 deng4 de2 lao3da4。kan4qi3lai5 ta1 hen3 nan2 xiao1hua4 ni3 gang1gang5 gao4su4 ta1 de5 xiao1xi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"chu1qu4？\n"
"\n"
"ke3shi4……wo3men5 de5 shi3ming4……"

