msgid ""
"{{GM}}His eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Executive Wing?! Madness!\n"
"\n"
"Take this as a warning, noble stranger: if you intend to forge your way into that land of milk and honey, you do so at your own peril! The underworld stands between you and your goal, and the underworld is home to the murderous Billy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​眼睛​骤然​瞪​大​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行政部​？​！​简直​是​疯​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​把​这​当成​一个​警告​，​高贵​的​陌生人​：​如果​你​打算​闯入​那片​充满​牛奶​与​蜂蜜​的​乐土​，​你​将​面临​巨大​的​危险​！​冥界​横亘​在​你​与​目标​之间​，​而​冥界​正是​凶残​的​比利​盘踞​之地​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3jing5 zhou4ran2 deng4 dai4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 zheng4 bu4？！jian3zhi2 shi4 feng1 le5！\n"
"\n"
"qing3 ba3 zhe4 dang4cheng2 yi1ge5 jing3gao4，gao1gui4 de5 mo4sheng1ren2：ru2guo3 ni3 da3suan4 chuang3ru4 na4 pian1 chong1man3 niu2nai3 yu4 feng1mi4 de5 le4tu3，ni3 jiang1 mian4lin2 ju4da4 de5 wei1xian3！ming2jie4 heng2 gen4 zai4 ni3 yu4 mu4biao1 zhi1jian1，er2 ming2jie4 zheng4shi4 xiong1can2 de5 bi3li4 pan2ju4 zhi1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
