msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​张大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​-​好​的​$(l.sir)​！​我​……​我​知道​是​谁​派​你​来​的​。​请​告诉​你​的​主顾​，​我​不会​和​*​任何人​*​说​你​来​过​这里​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang1 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 -hao3 de5 $(l.sir)！wo3……wo3 zhi1dao4 shi4 shei2 pai4 ni3 lai2 de5。qing3 gao4su4 ni3 de5 zhu3gu4，wo3 bu4hui4 he4*ren4 he2 ren2*shuo1 ni3 lai2 guo4 zhe4li3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His eyes light up in excitement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
