"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xing1fen4 de5 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"MKVI shi4 yi1 xiang4 gong1cheng2*jie2zuo4*，tou2r5。wo3 cong2 wei4 jian4 guo4 ru2ci3 jing1ren2 de5 dong1xi1。er2qie3 ta1 zhi1chi2 ji1shi1 cao1zuo4……tian1 a1。zhe4 xiang4 ji4shu4 de5 qian2zai4 ying3xiang3*wu2 ke3 xian4 liang2*。"

