"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yan3shen2 ru2 dao1 ban1 ci1 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiang1 shi4 ge4 cuo4wu4。bu4guo4 jue2 ding4 quan2 zai4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，ni3 dao4di3 yao4 bu4yao4 ting1 wo3 cong2 PDA zhong4 ti2qu3 de5 nei4rong2？"

