"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 kai1wan2xiao4 ba1，huo3ji5。na4 ke3shi4*ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3*de5 di4pan2 a1……ni3 jin4qu4 ke3neng2 jiu4 chu1 bu4 lai2 le5。"

