"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 la1xia4lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3 shi4。wo3 jia1 jing1xuan3 de5 ka1fei1dou4 bing4fei1 shi4he2 suo3you3ren2。shu4 wo3 wei4neng2 cha2jue2 ta1 bing4 bu4 shi4he2 ni3。"

