"​但​现在​……​恐怕​什么​都​别​想​从​这​过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 da1la5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 xiang3 a1，peng2you5。hen3 yi2han4，zhe4 di4fang1 de5 sheng1yi4 yuan2ben3 hen3*xing1long2*de5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 xian4zai4……kong3pa4 shen2me5 dou1 bie4 xiang3 cong2 zhe4 guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His face flushes red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you'd been a better group leader, you wouldn't have let that happen. You'd have--"
