"​{{GM}}​他​伸出​右臂​给​你​看​。​手臂​上​有​十余​处长​而​浅​的​伤口​，​正​不断​渗出​鲜血​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​怪物​差点​把​我​的​血放干​。​他们​轮流​用​刀割​我​的​手臂​，​就​好像​我​是​他们​桌上​的​美餐​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4tian1xie4di4。duo1kui1 ni3 ji2shi2 chu1xian4……ni3 jiu4 le5 wo3 de5 ming4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1chu1 you4 bi4 gei3 ni3 kan4。shou3bi4 shang4 you3 shi2 yu2 chu4zhang3 er2 jian1 de5 shang1kou3，zheng1 bu4duan4 shen4chu1 xian1xue4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 guai4wu5 cha4dian3 ba3 wo3 de5 xie3 fang4 gan4。ta1men5 lun2liu2 yong4 dao1 ge1 wo3 de5 shou3bi4，jiu4 hao3xiang4 wo3 shi4 ta1men5 zhuo1 shang4 de5 mei3can1 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His face reddens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
