msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​脸​涨红​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​警告​过​她​。​我​叫​她​不要​接​这​一单​。​可​她​向​我​保证​这​只是​个小活​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 zhang4hong2 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 jing3gao4 guo4 ta1。wo3 jiao4 ta1 bu4yao4 jie1 zhe4 yi1 dan1。ke3 ta1 xiang4 wo3 bao3zheng4 zhe4 zhi3shi4 ge4 xiao3 huo2。"

msgid ""
