"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 zhang4hong2 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 jing3gao4 guo4 ta1。wo3 jiao4 ta1 bu4yao4 jie1 zhe4 yi1 dan1。ke3 ta1 xiang4 wo3 bao3zheng4 zhe4 zhi3shi4 ge4 xiao3 huo2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His face screws up with a look of disgust.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yep. Sad old bastard with a datajack that oozes somethin' nasty. Wears cheap glasses and drinks like a fish. What about him?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​脸​因为​厌恶​而​拧成​一团​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​是​个​悲​催​的​老​混蛋​，​数据​插口​一直​往外​冒​着​什么​恶心​玩意儿​。​戴​一副​廉价​眼镜​，​喝酒​跟​不要命​似的​。​他​怎么​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 yin1wei4 yan4wu4 er2 ning2 cheng2 yi1 tuan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1。shi4 ge4 bei1 cui1 de5 lao3 hun2dan4，shu4ju4 cha1kou3 yi1zhi2 wang3wai4 mao4 zhao2 shen2me5 e3xin1 wan2yi4r5。dai4 yi1 fu4 lian2jia4 yan3jing4，he1jiu3 gen1 bu4 yao4 ming4 shi4de5。ta1 zen3me5 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His face twists into an ugly sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've watched *footage.* And that makes you think that you *know* the man.\n"
"\n"
"You know *nothing.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​脸​扭曲​出​一抹​丑陋​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​只是​看​了​*​录像​*​。​你​仅凭​这个​就​觉得​你​足够​*​了解​*​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​根本​*​一无所知​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 niu3qu1 chu1 yi1 ma1 chou3lou4 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi3shi4 kan4 le5*lu4xiang4*。ni3 jin3 ping2 zhe4ge5 jiu4 jue2de5 ni3 zu2gou4*liao3jie3*ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3*yi1wu2suo3zhi1*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His fingers hover over the grip of his sidearm, but only for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If I hurt you, I'll have to fill out a lot of paperwork.\n"
"\n"
"I hate paperwork."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​手指​悬在​配枪​的​握把​上​，​但​只是​片刻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​伤​了​你​，​我​得​填​一堆​表格​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​最​讨厌​填表格​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shou3zhi3 xuan2 zai4 pei4 qiang1 de5 wo4 ba3 shang4，dan4 zhi3shi4 pian4ke4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 shang1 le5 ni3，wo3 de2 tian2 yi1dui1 biao3ge2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4 tao3yan4 tian2 biao3 ge2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His lip curls into a bemused smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As you wish. \n"
"\n"
"Auf Wiedersehen."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​嘴角​扬起​一抹​惊异​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如你所愿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zui3jiao3 yang2qi3 yi1 ma1 jing1yi4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2 ni3 suo3 yuan4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His lip curls into a sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sadly for all of us, you do need me. Believe me, I wouldn't be here if you didn't.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and by the way... we're going to have words when this run is over, mouse."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​嘴角​露出​一抹​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​还​真是​遗憾​啊​。​你们​确实​需要​我​，​否则​我​也​不会​来​这里​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​对​了​……​等​这趟​差事​结束​之后​，​我们​得​好好​聊聊​，​老鼠​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 lu4chu1 yi1 ma1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hai2 zhen1shi5 yi2han4 a1。ni3men5 que4shi2 xu1yao4 wo3，fou3ze2 wo3 ye3 bu4hui4 lai2 zhe4li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"e2 dui4 le5……deng3 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 jie2shu4 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 de2 hao3hao3 liao2 liao2，lao3shu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His lip curls into a sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sadly for all of us, you do.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and by the way... we're going to have words when this run is over, mouse."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​嘴角​露出​一抹​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​还​真是​遗憾​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​对​了​……​等​这趟​差事​结束​之后​，​我们​得​好好​聊聊​，​老鼠​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 lu4chu1 yi1 ma1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hai2 zhen1shi5 yi2han4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"e2 dui4 le5……deng3 zhe4 tang1 cha4shi4 jie2shu4 zhi1hou4，wo3men5 de2 hao3hao3 liao2 liao2，lao3shu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His lip curls into a sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Somehow, I doubt that. And speaking of which, did the Doc tell you that you're standing in the animal research lab?\n"
"\n"
"It's overflowing with test subjects, and they don't play well with others. Nasty, dangerous things. And it's well past their feeding time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​嘴唇​扭曲​成​一抹​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对此​深表​怀疑​。​说​起来​，​博士​有没有​说​过​，​你们​待​的​地方​是​动物​研究​实验室​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​到处​都​是​实验​体​，​而且​它们​彼此之间​相处​得​并​不​融洽​。​这些​东西​既​肮脏​又​危险​。​而且​，​它们​的​进食​时间​早就​过​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3chun2 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1 ma1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 shen1 biao3 huai2yi2。shuo1 qi3lai5，bo2shi4 you3mei2you3 shuo1 guo4，ni3men5 dai1 de5 di4fang1 shi4 dong4wu4 yan2jiu1 shi2yan4shi4？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 dao4chu4 dou1 shi4 shi2yan4 ti3，er2qie3 ta1men5 bi3 ci3 zhi1 jian1 xiang1chu3 de2 bing4 bu4 rong2qia4。zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 ji4 ang1zang1 you4 wei1xian3。er2qie3，ta1men5 de5 jin4shi2 shi2jian1 zao3jiu4 guo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His lip curls.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My brother is *dead,* and you make light of it. I suppose that I shouldn't be surprised.\n"
"\n"
"Rest assured, Berlin will burn tonight. And my brother - wherever he is - will understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抿​起​嘴唇​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​弟弟​*​死​了​*​，​而​你​却​如此​轻描淡写​。​我​想​我​不该​对此​感到​惊讶​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​放心​吧​，​今晚​的​柏林​必将​陷入​一片​火海​。​不管​我​弟弟​在​哪里​，​他​一定​会​理解​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 min3 qi3 zui3chun2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 di4di5*si3 le5*，er2 ni3 que4 ru2ci3 qing1miao2dan4xie3。wo3 xiang3 wo3 bu4gai1 dui4 ci3 gan3dao4 jing1ya4。\n"
"\n"
"fang4xin1 ba1，jin1wan3 de5 bo2lin2 bi4jiang1 xian4ru4 yi1 pian1 huo3hai3。bu4guan3 wo3 di4di5 zai4 na3li3，ta1 yi1ding4 hui4 li3jie3 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His lips curl into a disdainful sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You sure you wanna go down this road, friend? We've got you outgunned, and we're in no mood to be screwed with."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​嘴角​露出​一丝​轻蔑​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​确定​要​这么​做​吗​，​朋友​？​我们​火力​比​你​强得​多​，​而且​现在​可​没​心情​和​你​玩​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 lu4chu1 yi1 si1 qing1mie4 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 yao4 zhe4me5 zuo4 ma5，peng2you5？wo3men5 huo3li4 bi3 ni3 jiang4 de2 duo1，er2qie3 xian4zai4 ke3 mei2 xin1qing2 he4 ni3 wan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His lips part into a wolfish grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You got it, boss. I'll just count it against the heap of favors that you owe me.\n"
"\n"
"How many times have I saved your ass since we started down this road? I've lost count."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​咧开​嘴​，​露出​狼​一般​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​啊​，​老大​。​我​就​把​这算​在​你​欠​我​的​那​一大堆​人情​里​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自从​我们​走上​这条​路​，​我​都​数不清​救过​你​多少​次​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 kai1 zui3，lu4chu1 lang2 yi1ban1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 a1，lao3da4。wo3 jiu4 ba3 zhe4 suan4 zai4 ni3 qian4 wo3 de5 na4 yi1 dai4 dui1 ren2qing2 li3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zi4cong2 wo3men5 zou3 shang4 zhe4 tiao2 lu4，wo3 dou1 shu3bu5qing1 jiu4 guo4 ni3 duo1shao3 ci4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His lips tighten.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For Monika."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​抿​起​嘴唇​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​莫妮卡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 min3 qi3 zui3chun2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 Mo4ni1ka3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His mouth drops open.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"'Course it was, chief! I'm shocked that you'd even ask!\n"
"\n"
"What'd you think, that I'd purposefully strand you in a bank vault? I mean, what kind of asshole would I have to be to do that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​瞠目结舌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​了​，​头儿​！​你​怎么​会​问​这种​问题​呢​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​，​你​以为​是​我​故意​把​你​留在​银行​保险库​的​吗​？​那​我​不成​了​天底下​最​没谱​的​混蛋​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cheng1mu4jie2she2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2 le5，tou2r5！ni3 zen3me5 hui4 wen4 zhe4zhong3 wen4ti2 ni2！\n"
"\n"
"zen3me5，ni3 yi3wei2 shi4 wo3 gu4yi4 ba3 ni3 liu2 zai4 yin2hang2 bao3 xian3 ku4 de5 ma5？na4 wo3 bu4cheng2 le5 tian1di3xia5 zui4 mei2pu3 de5 hun2dan4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His mouth twists into a bloody grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This Wednesday? I'll be putting your mother to work on the street corner. And when she's all worn out, I'll give your father a shot at the job."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​嘴角​扭曲​成​一个​血淋淋​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​星期三​吗​？​我会​让​你​母亲​去​站​街​。​等​她​精疲力尽​之后​，​我会​让​你​父亲​也​来​试试​这份​工作​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1ge5 xie3lin2lin2 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 xing1qi1san1 ma5？wo3 hui4 rang4 ni3 mu3qin1 qu4 zhan4 jie1。deng3 ta1 jing1pi2li4jin4 zhi1hou4，wo3 hui4 rang4 ni3 fu4qin1 ye3 lai2 shi4 shi4 zhe4 fen4 gong1zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His mouth twists into a bloody grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. That's what I thought."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​嘴角​扭曲​成​一个​血淋淋​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​我​就是​这么​想​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1ge5 xie3lin2lin2 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1。wo3 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 xiang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His mouth twists up into a smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I certainly hope so. For your sake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​嘴角​扬起​一抹​讥笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​希望​如此​。​不然​你​就​等着瞧​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zui3jiao3 yang2qi3 yi1 ma1 ji1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xi1wang4 ru2ci3。bu4ran2 ni3 jiu4 deng3zhe5qiao2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His panicked voice punches through your commlink's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's somebody in here with me, chief! Another decker! And you've got incoming at your loca--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​慌乱​的​声音​从​你​的​通讯​链​扬声器​中传​出来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​还有​别人​，​头儿​！​另​一个​碟客​！​你们​的​位置​有人​来​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huang1luan4 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2 chu1lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 hai2you3 bie2ren5，tou2r5！ling4 yi1ge5 die2 ke4！ni3men5 de5 wei4zhi5 you3ren2 lai2 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His reply is dull and flat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Somehow, that's not a consolation."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​回答​不带​一丝​感情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这话​并​不能​让​我​感到​安慰​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 hui2da2 bu4dai4 yi1 si1 gan3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4 hua4 bing4 bu4neng2 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 an1wei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His response is flat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course. Better to wipe out a species older than humanity, yes? A creature that has seen the cycle of magic rise and fall time and again could be of no use, surely. \n"
"\n"
"Still, you are correct. In the world of power, fewer players make the game clearer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​反应​很​平淡​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​最好​消灭​比​人类​更​古老​的​种族​，​是​吗​？​一个​见证​了​魔法​纪元​兴衰​的​种族​肯定​毫无用处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​你​说得对​。​在​权力​的​世界​里​，​玩家​越​少​，​游戏​越​清晰​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 fan3ying4 hen3 ping2dan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 zui4hao3 xiao1mie4 bi3 ren2lei4 geng1 gu3lao3 de5 zhong3zu2，shi4 ma5？yi1ge5 jian4zheng4 le5 mo2fa3 ji4yuan2 xing1shuai1 de5 zhong3zu2 ken3ding4 hao2 wu2 yong4 chu3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。zai4 quan2li4 de5 shi4jie4 li3，wan2jia1 yue4 shao3，you2xi4 yue4 qing1xi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His smile widens, and he taps his chest. You can see the outline of a machine pistol through the leather of his jacket.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You underestimate me, chief. I *never* let my guard down. Not even here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​笑容​愈发​灿烂​，​轻轻​拍了拍​胸口​。​透过​外套​的​皮革​，​依稀可见​一把​机械​手枪​的​轮廓​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​低估​了​我​，​头儿​。​我​*​从不​*​放松​警惕​，​即使​是​在​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 can4lan4，qing1qing1 pai1 le5 pai1 xiong1kou3。tou4guo4 wai4tao4 de5 pi2ge2，yi1 xi1 ke3 jian4 yi1 ba3 ji1xie4 shou3qiang1 de5 lun2kuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 di1gu1 le5 wo3，tou2r5。wo3*cong2bu4*fang4song1 jing3ti4，ji2shi3 shi4 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His smile widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Great, chief. I'm doin' just great."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​笑容​愈发​灿烂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​挺​好​的​，​头儿​。​我​一切​都​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 can4lan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting3 hao3 de5，tou2r5。wo3 yi1qie4 dou1 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His smile widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"One of these days, $(l.freund). Absolutely.\n"
"\n"
"But today, you're here for a reason. What can ol' Zaak get for you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​笑容​更盛​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总有一天​，​$(l.freund)​。​必须​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​今天​，​你​肯定​是​有事​才​来​的​。​老​扎克​能​为​你​做点​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 geng1 cheng2 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3 you3 yi1 tian1，$(l.freund)。bi4xu1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 jin1tian1，ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 you3shi4 cai2 lai2 de5。lao3 Zha1ke4 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His tone is incredulous.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do that, and you'll be getting your ghoul friends killed! The Mettbachs will storm down there with their arsenal and wipe them out!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​语气​充满​了​难以置信​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​敢​这么​做​的话​，​你​那些​尸鬼​朋友​就​等​死​吧​！​梅特​巴赫​家族​会带​着​武器​过去​，​把​它们​全​杀光​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 chong1man3 le5 nan2yi3zhi4xin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gan3 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5hua4，ni3 na4xie1 shi1 gui3 peng2you5 jiu4 deng3 si3 ba1！mei2 te4 ba1he4 jia1zu2 hui4 dai4 zhao2 wu3qi4 guo4qu4，ba3 ta1men5 quan2 sha1 guang1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice climbs to a roar.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Within a half hour of the spill, Billy had slaughtered everyone who could have disengaged the lockdown! Executives were torn limb from limb; their business attire was shredded, their expenditure reports bathed in blood! And the rest of us were trapped inside with the savage beast!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​变​大成​了​怒吼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​事情​发生​后​不到​半小时​，​比利​就​屠杀​了​所有​可能​解除​封锁​的​人​！​高管们​被​撕成​碎片​；​他们​的​商务​西装​支离破碎​，​支出​报告​浸满​鲜血​！​而​我们​其余​的​人​则​和​这头​凶残​的​野兽​被关​在​同​一座​笼中​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4 dai4 cheng2 le5 nu4hou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 fa1sheng1 hou4 bu4dao4 ban4xiao3shi2，bi3li4 jiu4 tu2sha1 le5 suo3you3 ke3neng2 jie3chu2 feng1suo3 de5 ren2！gao1 guan3 men5 bei4 si1 cheng2 sui4pian4 ； ta1men5 de5 shang1wu4 xi1zhuang1 zhi1li2po4sui4，zhi1chu1 bao4gao4 jin4 man3 xian1xue4！er2 wo3men5 qi2yu2 de5 ren2 ze2 he4 zhe4 tou2 xiong1can2 de5 ye3shou4 bei4 guan1 zai4 tong2 yi1 zuo4 long2 zhong4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice comes out flat. Disbelieving.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Those were fake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​平淡​却​充满​怀疑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​是​伪造​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ping2dan4 que4 chong1man3 huai2yi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 shi4 wei3zao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice comes out in a growl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, I do. Trust me on that, boss.\n"
"\n"
"The next one of those bastards I meet is gonna wish he was never born."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​近乎​咆哮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​。​你​放心​吧​，​老大​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​让​我​再​碰到​这帮​杂种​，​否则​我​一定​要​让​他们​求死不能​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 jin4hu5 pao2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。ni3 fang4xin1 ba1，lao3da4。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 rang4 wo3 zai4 peng4dao4 zhe4 bang1 za2zhong3，fou3ze2 wo3 yi1ding4 yao4 rang4 ta1men5 qiu2 si3 bu4 neng2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice goes cold.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've heard enough of your accusations. You've cast your lot with that... *thing.* You set it loose to kill with impunity.\n"
"\n"
"You are a moral leper, and I am finished with you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​变得​冰冷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​听够​了​你​的​指控​。​你​选择​与​那个​……​*​东西​*​为伍​。​你​放任​它​肆意​杀戮​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​践踏​道德​的​败类​，​我​与​你​无话可说​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 bing1leng3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 ting1 gou4 le5 ni3 de5 zhi3kong4。ni3 xuan3ze2 yu4 na4ge5……*dong1xi1*wei2wu3。ni3 fang4ren4 ta1 si4yi4 sha1lu4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 jian4ta4 dao4de2 de5 bai4lei4，wo3 yu4 ni3 wu2hua4ke3shuo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice goes cold.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. He did not. And in setting that... *thing* loose, you have ensured that countless other innocents will suffer the same fate.\n"
"\n"
"You are a moral leper, and I am finished with you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​变得​冰冷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​。​但​你​却​放任​那个​……​*​东西​*​肆虐​，​使得​无数​无辜者​将​遭受​同样​的​命运​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​践踏​道德​的​败类​，​我​与​你​无话可说​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 bing1leng3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2。dan4 ni3 que4 fang4ren4 na4ge5……*dong1xi1*si4nu:e4，shi3de5 wu2shu4 wu2 gu1 zhe3 jiang1 zao1shou4 tong2yang4 de5 ming4yun4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 jian4ta4 dao4de2 de5 bai4lei4，wo3 yu4 ni3 wu2hua4ke3shuo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice lowers again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now then, as I was saying, we were fortunate that you happened upon that surveillance tap when you did. The people on the other end were planning a very bad thing, to be sure."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​紧接着​他​又​低声​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那么​，​正如​我​刚才​所说​，​还好​你​当时​发现​了​那个​监听​设备​。​对方​确实​正在​策划​一件​很​糟糕​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin3jie1zhe5 ta1 you4 di1sheng1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4me5，zheng4ru2 wo3 gang1cai2 suo3 shuo1，hai2hao3 ni3 dang1shi2 fa1xian4 le5 na4ge5 jian1ting1 she4bei4。dui4fang1 que4shi2 zheng4zai4 ce4hua4 yi1 jian4 hen3 zao1gao1 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice lowers to an ominous whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But it is *also* a nightmarish labyrinth of--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​变得​低沉​，​带​着​一种​不祥​的​语气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​它​*​也​*​是​一个​噩梦般​的​迷宫​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 di1chen2，dai4 zhao2 yi1zhong3 bu4xiang2 de5 yu3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1*ye3*shi4 yi1ge5 e4 meng4 ban1 de5 mi2gong1 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice quivers with grief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm so sorry, Mira."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​因​悲痛​而​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真的​很​抱歉​，​米拉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 yin1 bei1tong4 er2 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1de5 hen3 bao4qian4，mi3la1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice slows to a crawl. He makes a point of enunciating each word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I point people to the bar. If someone starts trouble, I give them a taste of Herr Zapp. \n"
"\n"
"That's it. That's all I do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​语速​变得​极其​缓慢​，​一字一顿​地​说​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​负责​告诉​客人​吧台​在​哪儿​。​要是​有人​闹事​，​我​就让​他们​尝尝​霹雳​老大哥​的​滋味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​这些​。​我​只​干​这些​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3 su4 bian4de5 ji2qi2 huan3man4，yi1 zi4 yi1 dun4 de5 shuo1 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 fu4ze2 gao4su4 ke4ren2 ba1tai2 zai4 na3r5。yao4shi5 you3ren2 nao4shi4，wo3 jiu4 rang4 ta1men5 chang2 chang2 pi1li4 lao3da4ge1 de5 zi1wei4。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4 zhe4xie1。wo3 zhi3 gan4 zhe4xie1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice thunders through the intercom, cutting you off.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But *this* solution is *here.* Now. In my hands. \n"
"\n"
"And I choose to take it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​通过​对讲机​响彻​整个​房间​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​*​如今​*​的​解决之道​就​在​*​这里​*​。​掌握​在​我​的​手中​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​我​选择​行使​这项​权力​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 tong1guo4 dui4jiang3ji1 xiang3che4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4*ru2jin1*de5 jie3 jue2 zhi1 dao4 jiu4 zai4*zhe4li3*。zhang3wo4 zai4 wo3 de5 shou3 zhong4。\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3 xuan3ze2 xing2shi3 zhe4 xiang4 quan2li4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice thunders through the intercom, cutting you off.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of *course* I wish that there were a better way to save us. One without such a high human cost.\n"
"\n"
"I wish that Hermie hadn't had to die."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​通过​对讲机​响彻​整个​房间​，​打断​了​你​的话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当然​希望​能​有​更好​的​办法​来​拯救​我们​。​某个​不必​牺牲​这么​多人​的​办法​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​赫米​不必​因此​而​死去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 tong1guo4 dui4jiang3ji1 xiang3che4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1，da3duan4 le5 ni3 de5hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1ran2 xi1wang4 neng2 you3 geng1 hao3 de5 ban4fa3 lai2 zheng3jiu4 wo3men5。mou3 ge4 bu4bi4 xi1sheng1 zhe4me5 duo1 ren2 de5 ban4fa3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 he4 mi3 bu4bi4 yin1ci3 er2 si3qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}His voice thunders through the intercom.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I hold in my hands the power to end draconic life. To lift our species from the brink of disaster. To save everybody - even short-sighted fools such as yourself - from extinction.\n"
"\n"
"And I choose to exercise that power."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​声音​通过​对讲机​响彻​整个​房间​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​手中​握有​终结​巨龙​生命​的​权力​。​我能​将​我们​的​物种​从​灭绝​的​边缘​拯救​出来​。​我能​拯救​所有人​—​—​甚至​像​你​这样​目光短浅​的​愚蠢​之​辈​—​—​免于​灭绝​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​我​选择​行使​这种​权力​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 tong1guo4 dui4jiang3ji1 xiang3che4 zheng3ge4 fang2jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 shou3 zhong4 wo4you3 zhong1jie2 ju4long2 sheng1ming4 de5 quan2li4。wo3 neng2 jiang1 wo3men5 de5 wu4zhong3 cong2 mie4jue2 de5 bian1yuan2 zheng3jiu4 chu1lai2。wo3 neng2 zheng3jiu4 suo3you3ren2——shen4zhi4 xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 mu4guang1duan3qian3 de5 yu2chun3 zhi1 bei4——mian3yu2 mie4jue2。\n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3 xuan3ze2 xing2shi3 zhe4zhong3 quan2li4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Hit him again.{{/GM}} Language."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​再次​打​他​。​{{/GM}}​注意​言辞​。\n"
"{{GM}} zai4ci4 da3 ta1。{{/GM}} zhu4yi4 yan2ci2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Hit him.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​打​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} da3 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Hit the \"N\" key.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拍​下​“​N​”​键​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} pai1 xia4“N” jian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Hit the \"Y\" key.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拍​下​“​Y​”​键​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} pai1 xia4“Y” jian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Hold on to it for now.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​暂时​不​喝​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zan4shi2 bu4 he4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Holster your weapon.{{/GM}} Deal. Let's get you out of here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​收起​你​的​武器​。​{{/GM}}​成交​。​我​这​就​把​你​从​这里​弄出去​。\n"
"{{GM}} shou1 qi3 ni3 de5 wu3qi4。{{/GM}} cheng2jiao1。wo3 zhe4 jiu4 ba3 ni3 cong2 zhe4li3 long4 chu1 qu4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Hop in.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​钻进去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zuan1 jin4 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Ignore him and keep going.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​无视​他​并​继续前进​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} wu2shi4 ta1 bing4 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Ignore him.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​无视​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} wu2shi4 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Ignore him.{{/GM}} Let's go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​不理​他​。​{{/GM}}​走​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} bu4li3 ta1。{{/GM}} zou3 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Ignore it and keep going.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​无视​它​并​继续前进​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} wu2shi4 ta1 bing4 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Ignore it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​无视​它​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} wu2shi4 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Ignore it.{{/GM}} \"Let it happen\"? She jacked in, she screamed, and "
"she seized. By the time we saw she was in trouble, it was already too late."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​无视​她​。​{{/GM}}​“​任由​她​出事​”​？​她​刚刚​接入​，​惨叫​一声​就​癫痫​发作​了​。​等​我们​看出​她​情况​不​对​的​时候​，​已经​太迟​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} wu2shi4 ta1。{{/GM}}“ren4you2 ta1 chu1shi4”？ta1 gang1gang5 jie1ru4，can3jiao4 yi1sheng1 jiu4 dian1xian2 fa1zuo4 le5。deng3 wo3men5 kan4chu1 ta1 qing2kuang4 bu4 dui4 de5 shi2hou5，yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Ignore them.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​不管​它们​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} bu4guan3 ta1men5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}In a flash, her hand darts out to smack the panel set into the wall behind her. The shrill wail of an alarm klaxon fills the air.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You can discuss my \"attitude\" with Security. I'm sure they'd love to hear all about it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​手​一瞬间​伸向​身后​的​墙壁​，​敲碎​了​墙壁​上​的​面板​。​警报器​的​锐鸣​回荡​在​空气​中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​跟​安保​处聊​你​的​“​态度​”​吧​。​他们​肯定​愿意​听​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 shou3 yi1shun4jian1 shen1 xiang4 shen1hou4 de5 qiang2bi4，qiao1 sui4 le5 qiang2bi4 shang4 de5 mian4ban3。jing3bao4qi4 de5 rui4 ming2 hui2dang4 zai4 kong1qi4 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 gen1 an1bao3 chu3 liao2 ni3 de5“tai4du5” ba1。ta1men5 ken3ding4 yuan4yi4 ting1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}In an instant, Zaak's disturbingly white smile returns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I just can't stay mad at you. All right, chummer, you get that one for free.\n"
"\n"
"So where was I? Oh, right, the spirits."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​瞬间​又​露出​了​令人不安​的​洁白​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就是​没法​对​你​生气​。​好​了​亲​，​就​当​刚才​什么​都​没​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​刚才​说​到​哪​了​？​哦​对​，​精魂​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 shun4jian1 you4 lu4chu1 le5 ling3 ren2 bu4 an1 de5 jie2bai2 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4shi4 mei2fa3 dui4 ni3 sheng1qi4。hao3 le5 qin1，jiu4 dang1 gang1cai2 shen2me5 dou1 mei2 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gang1cai2 shuo1 dao4 na3 le5？e2 dui4，jing1hun2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}In the aftermath of the attack, you are surprised to see Simmy Kim has survived, with only a few scrapes and bruises.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You saved us..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​袭击​过后​，​你​惊讶​地​发现​金阿吸​竟然​活​了​下来​，​身上​只有​几处​擦伤​和​瘀​青​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​救​了​我们​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xi2ji1 guo4hou4，ni3 jing1ya4 de5 fa1xian4 jin1 e1 xi1 jing4ran2 huo2 le5 xia4lai5，shen1shang5 zhi3you3 ji1 chu3 ca1shang1 he4 yu1 qing1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiu4 le5 wo3men5……"

msgid "{{GM}}Insert Alice's payment into the machine.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​将​爱丽丝​的​报酬​插入​机器​中​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jiang1 ai4li4si1 de5 bao4chou5 cha1ru4 ji1qi4 zhong4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Insert keycard.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​插入​门禁卡​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} cha1ru4 men2 jin1 ka3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Insert your keycard.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​插入​门禁卡​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} cha1ru4 men2 jin1 ka3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Inspect the body.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​检查​尸体​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jian3cha2 shi1ti3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Inspect the containers.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​调查​容器​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} diao4cha2 rong2qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Inspect the discs.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​检查​光盘​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jian3cha2 guang1pan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Inspect the nearby wall more closely.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​仔细检查​附近​的​墙壁​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zi3 xi4 jian3 cha2 fu4jin4 de5 qiang2bi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Inspect the power tap.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​检视​电力​接口​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jian3shi4 dian4li4 jie1kou3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Inspect the terminal.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​调查​终端​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} diao4cha2 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Introduce Gaseous Agent to Laboratory Atmosphere.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​向​实验室​释放​气态​制剂​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} xiang4 shi2yan4shi4 shi4fang4 qi4tai4 zhi4ji4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Investigate the locked drawer.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​调查​锁​着​的​抽屉​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} diao4cha2 suo3 zhao2 de5 chou1ti5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Investigate the machine.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​调查​机器​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} diao4cha2 ji1qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}It nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of HMHVV. The virus that has infected us... that has *twisted* us... into *this.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​它​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​来自​HMHVV​。​那​感染​我们​的​病毒​……​把​我们​*​转变​*​成​了​……​*​这​副​*​样子​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lai2zi4 HMHVV。na4 gan3ran3 wo3men5 de5 bing4du2……ba3 wo3men5*zhuan3bian4*cheng2 le5……*zhe4 fu4*yang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}It nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Yes, that was her name."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​它​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​没错​，​就是​这个​名字​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4 mei2cuo4，jiu4shi4 zhe4ge5 ming2zi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}It spreads its arms in supplication.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"<Prosper or perish - the choice is yours. Embrace His love and have all of your wishes granted, or turn away from it and be destroyed.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​它​张开​双臂​，​发出​哀求​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​繁荣​或​毁灭​，​均​在于​你​的​选择​。​拥抱​祂​的​爱​，​所有​心愿​必​得​应验​；​背弃​这份​爱​，​便​注定​毁灭​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhang1kai1 shuang1bi4，fa1chu1 ai1qiu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< fan2rong2 huo4 hui3mie4，jun1 zai4yu2 ni3 de5 xuan3ze2。yong1bao4 ta1 de5 ai4，suo3you3 xin1yuan4 bi4 de2 ying4yan4 ； bei4qi4 zhe4 fen4 ai4，bian4 zhu4ding4 hui3mie4。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}It stares straight ahead. Its eyes are dead.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I’m afraid that the answer to that question falls outside of the scope of my written parameters."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​它​直视​前方​，​眼神​空洞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​这个​问题​的​答案​超出​了​我​的​预设​变量​范围​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2shi4 qian2fang1，yan3shen2 kong1dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2 de5 da2an4 chao1chu1 le5 wo3 de5 yu4she4 bian4liang4 fan4wei2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}It takes her a long time to respond. Her voice is choked with long-dormant emotion.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​迟迟​没有​回应​。​尘封已久​的​情绪​哽在​喉间​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chi2chi2 mei2you3 hui2ying4。chen2 feng1 yi3 jiu3 de5 qing2xu4 geng3 zai4 hou2 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}It takes her a long time to respond. When she does, her voice carries a tone of resignation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You really want to know?\n"
"\n"
"All right, fine. I'll tell you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​沉默​了​许久​才​开口​，​声音​里​带​着​几分​无奈​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真想​知道​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​那​我​给​你​讲讲​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 xu3jiu3 cai2 kai1kou3，sheng1yin1 li3 dai4 zhao2 ji3fen1 wu2nai4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1 xiang3 zhi1dao4？\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，na4 wo3 gei3 ni3 jiang3 jiang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Its milky eyes widen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, please! Whatever you can do.\n"
"\n"
"Our situation is desperate."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​它​浑浊​的​眼睛​张大​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真的​吗​！​无论怎样​都​可以​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​已经​走投无路​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hun2zhuo2 de5 yan3jing5 zhang1 dai4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1de5 ma5！wu2 lun2 zen3 yang4 dou1 ke3yi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi3jing1 zou3tou2wu2lu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Jack in to the jackpoint, initiating the process to free APEX.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​接入​矩阵​，​启动​APEX​释放​进程​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jie1ru4 ju3zhen4，qi3dong4 APEX shi4fang4 jin4cheng2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}James cuts her off.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We've already wasted too much time. If we don't pick up the pace, I'm going to be late to my meeting, and I can NOT afford that.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He points at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're gonna have to get us moving faster, jackass. No more unnecessary delays, and no more long speeches."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​詹姆斯​打断​了​她​的话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​已经​浪费​太​多​时间​了​。​如果​不​加快​节奏​的话​，​我​就​赶不上​去​开会​了​，​我​绝对​不能​接受​这种​事​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​指向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​给​我​再​加快​点​速度​，​混蛋​。​别​再​磨磨蹭蹭​的​，​也​别说​什么​长篇大论​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhan1mu3si1 da3duan4 le5 ta1 de5hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yi3jing1 lang4fei4 tai4 duo1 shi2jian1 le5。ru2guo3 bu4 jia1kuai4 jie2zou4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 gan3bu4shang4 qu4 kai1hui4 le5，wo3 jue2dui4 bu4neng2 jie1shou4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gei3 wo3 zai4 jia1kuai4 dian3 su4du4，hun2dan4。bie4 zai4 mo2mo2ceng4ceng4 de5，ye3 bie2shuo1 shen2me5 zhang3 pian1 dai4 lun2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}James shoots you an irritated glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is a waste of time, and I'm already running late. If you don't take care of this idiot, I will."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​詹姆斯​向​你​投来​恼怒​的​眼神​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​简直​是​浪费时间​，​我​已经​要​迟到​了​。​如果​你​不​收拾​这个​蠢货​的话​，​那​我​就​出手​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhan1mu3si1 xiang4 ni3 tou2 lai2 nao3nu4 de5 yan3shen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jian3zhi2 shi4 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1，wo3 yi3jing1 yao4 chi2dao4 le5。ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 shou1shi5 zhe4ge5 chun3huo4 de5hua4，na4 wo3 jiu4 chu1shou3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}James' cheeks flush red. He takes a step forward.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Watch it. You don't get to talk down to me like--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​詹姆斯​涨红了脸​。​他​向前​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说话​注意​点​。​你​居然​敢​把​我​当成​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhan1mu3si1 zhang3 hong2 le5 lian3。ta1 xiang4qian2 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1hua4 zhu4yi4 dian3。ni3 ju1ran2 gan3 ba3 wo3 dang4cheng2 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Jana begins to stammer out an agreement, her eyes wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah! W-we don't want any troub--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​简娜​瞪​大​眼睛​，​结结巴巴​地​表示同意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​！​我​-​我们​不想​惹麻烦​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Jian3na4 deng4 dai4 yan3jing5，jie1jie1ba1ba5 de5 biao3 shi4 tong2 yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4！wo3 -wo3men5 bu4xiang3 re3ma2fan5 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Jana covers her mouth with her hand, a horrified expression on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh God. I killed someone. That man is dead because of me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​简娜​用手​捂住​嘴​，​脸上​露出​惊恐​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​天​啊​，​我​杀了人​。​那个​人​是​因​我​而​死​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Jian3na4 yong4 shou3 wu3zhu4 zui3，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 jing1kong3 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tian1 a1，wo3 sha1 le5 ren2。na4ge5 ren2 shi4 yin1 wo3 er2 si3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Jana cuts in, her eyes wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Both of you, shut up! Somebody's coming!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​简娜​打断​了​你们​的话​，​她​张大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​俩​都​闭嘴​！​有人​来​了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Jian3na4 da3duan4 le5 ni3men5 de5hua4，ta1 zhang1 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 lia3 dou1 bi4zui3！you3ren2 lai2 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Jana stares at you through red-rimmed eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You killed him. James. He was a prick, but we *needed* him. And by scrubbing the mission, you've probably killed me, too."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​简娜​红​着​眼眶​直直地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​杀​了​詹姆斯​。​他​是​个​混蛋​，​但​我们​*​需要​*​他​。​现在​任务​完蛋​了​，​我​大概​也​要​被​你​害死​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Jian3na4 hong2 zhao2 yan3kuang4 zhi2 zhi2 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 sha1 le5 zhan1mu3si1。ta1 shi4 ge4 hun2dan4，dan4 wo3men5*xu1yao4*ta1。xian4zai4 ren4wu5 wan2dan4 le5，wo3 da4gai4 ye3 yao4 bei4 ni3 hai4si3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Jana studies the junction box for a moment, then turns to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See that guard in the hallway? Well, he was standing next to a junction box just like this one. Looks like they're both on the same circuit, too."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​简娜​研究​了​一会儿​接线盒​，​随即​转过身​面对​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看见​走廊​里​的​那个​守卫​了​吗​？​他​当时​就​站​在​和​这个​一模一样​的​接线盒​旁边​。​看起来​是​同一个​电路​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Jian3na4 yan2jiu1 le5 yi1hui4r5 jie1xian4he2，sui2ji2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 mian4dui4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4jian4 zou3lang2 li3 de5 na4ge5 shou3wei4 le5 ma5？ta1 dang1shi2 jiu4 zhan4 zai4 he4 zhe4ge5 yi1mu2yi1yang4 de5 jie1xian4he2 pang2bian1。kan4qi3lai5 shi4 tong2 yi1 ge4 dian4lu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Janet eyes you warily.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So... what did you find?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​珍妮特​警惕​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​……​你​有​什么​发现​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhen1 ni1 te4 jing3ti4 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……ni3 you3 shen2me5 fa1xian4？"

msgid "{{GM}}Jump down the hole.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​顺着​洞​跳下去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shun4zhe5 dong4 tiao4 xia4 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Jump down to the lower level.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​跳​向​低处​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} tiao4 xiang4 di1 chu3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kami brightens up as you approach her, grinning widely.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey there! Altuğ was just telling me you were around.\n"
"\n"
"I was wondering if you might be willing to trade a story or two.\n"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​当​你​走近​卡米​时​，​她​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​！​奥图​伊​刚刚​才​和​我​说​你​在​附近​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​正想​你​也许​会​愿意​来​给​我​讲​几个​故事​什么​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 Ka3mi3 shi2，ta1 lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3！ao4 tu2 yi1 gang1gang5 cai2 he4 wo3 shuo1 ni3 zai4 fu4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zheng1 xiang3 ni3 ye3xu3 hui4 yuan4yi4 lai2 gei3 wo3 jiang3 ji3ge5 gu4shi4 shen2me5 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kami purses her lips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not a lot I can tell you that you haven't already guessed."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​卡米​抿​起​嘴唇​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​告诉​你​的​基本​都​是​你​已经​知道​的​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ka3mi3 min3 qi3 zui3chun2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 gao4su4 ni3 de5 ji1ben3 dou1 shi4 ni3 yi3jing1 zhi1dao4 de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kami puts away her comm and grins at you, a puckish gleam in her eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey pal, I missed you! Got any new stories for me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​卡米​收起​通讯​链​，​冲​你​咧嘴一笑​，​眼中​闪烁着​狡黠​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​朋友​，​我​都​想​你​啦​！​有​什么​新​故事​要​告诉​我​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ka3mi3 shou1 qi3 tong1xun4 lian4，chong1 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，yan3zhong1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 jiao3xia2 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"peng2you5，wo3 dou1 xiang3 ni3 la5！you3 shen2me5 xin1 gu4shi4 yao4 gao4su4 wo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Karin looks ready to make a quick reply, but Kristian places a hand on her shoulder and gives her a look that says they should not dismiss the question lightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Since you ask, we do have some concerns."
