"{{GM}}​卡琳​似乎​准备​立刻​回应​，​但​克里斯蒂安​伸手​搭上​她​的​肩膀​，​眼神​示意​他们​不该​轻率地​回避​这个​问题​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然​你​问​这个​，​我们​确实​有​一些​担心​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ka3 lin2 si4hu1 zhun3bei4 li4ke4 hui2ying4，dan4 ke4li3si1di4an1 shen1shou3 da1 shang4 ta1 de5 jian1bang3，yan3shen2 shi4yi4 ta1men5 bu4gai1 qing1 shuai4 de5 hui2bi4 zhe4ge5 wen4ti2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 wen4 zhe4ge5，wo3men5 que4shi2 you3 yi1xie1 dan1xin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Karin turns red in the face, positively fuming.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We know she was beaten. Assaulted by some cowardly drug dealer. (w)"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​卡琳​顿时​涨红了脸​，​像​要​大发雷霆​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​知道​她​挨​了​打​。​被​某个​懦弱​的​毒贩​袭击​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ka3 lin2 dun4shi2 zhang3 hong2 le5 lian3，xiang4 yao4 da4fa1lei2ting2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1dao4 ta1 ai1 le5 da3。bei4 mou3 ge4 nuo4ruo4 de5 du2fan4 xi2ji1 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Keep digging for an intact card.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​继续​寻找​一张​完整​的​门禁卡​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ji4xu4 xun2zhao3 yi1 zhang1 wan2zheng3 de5 men2 jin1 ka3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Keep moving.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​继续前进​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Keep walking.{{/GM}} The sooner we get you out of here, the sooner we "
"can put this behind us."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​继续​走​。​{{/GM}}​早点​出去​，​这样​就​能​把​这事​忘​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} ji4xu4 zou3。{{/GM}} zao3dian3 chu1qu4，zhe4yang4 jiu4 neng2 ba3 zhe4 shi4 wang4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kick in the door.{{/GM}} We're going in."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​踢​开门​。​{{/GM}}​我们​要​进去​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} ti1 kai1men2。{{/GM}} wo3men5 yao4 jin4qu4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kick open the door.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​踢​开门​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ti1 kai1men2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kick open the door.{{/GM}} Sorry, Glory. We can't let this happen."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​踢​开门​。​{{/GM}}​对不起​，​格洛丽​。​我们​不能​让​这种​事​发生​。\n"
"{{GM}} ti1 kai1men2。{{/GM}} dui4bu5qi3，Ge2luo4li2。wo3men5 bu4neng2 rang4 zhe4zhong3 shi4 fa1sheng1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill Enstad.{{/GM}} I honor my contracts. Here is the proof."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀​了​恩施​塔德​。​{{/GM}}​我​当然​会​忠于​契约​。​这​就是​证据​。\n"
"{{GM}} sha1 le5 en1Shi1ta3de2。{{/GM}} wo3 dang1ran2 hui4 zhong1yu2 qi4yue1。zhe4 jiu4shi4 zheng4ju4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kill Enstad.{{/GM}} We were just stringing him along. I'll prove it to"
" you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀​了​恩施​塔德​。​{{/GM}}​我们​只是​在​敷衍​他​而已​。​容​我​证明​给​你​看​。\n"
"{{GM}} sha1 le5 en1Shi1ta3de2。{{/GM}} wo3men5 zhi3shi4 zai4 fu1yan3 ta1 er2yi3。rong2 wo3 zheng4ming2 gei3 ni3 kan4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill him.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀死​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} sha1si3 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill him.{{/GM}} No deal. You've had this coming."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀​了​他​。​{{/GM}}​没门儿​。​你​这​是​自找​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} sha1 le5 ta1。{{/GM}} mei2men2r5。ni3 zhe4 shi4 zi4zhao3 de5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill him.{{/GM}} No dice. Time to die."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀死​他​。​{{/GM}}​不行​。​你​可以​去​死​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} sha1si3 ta1。{{/GM}} bu4xing2。ni3 ke3yi3 qu4 si3 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill him.{{/GM}} No negotiations. He dies."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀​了​他​。​{{/GM}}​没有​谈判​的​余地​。​他​得​死​。\n"
"{{GM}} sha1 le5 ta1。{{/GM}} mei2you3 tan2pan4 de5 yu2di4。ta1 de2 si3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill him.{{/GM}} No negotiations. Nothing personal."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀​了​他​。​{{/GM}}​没有​谈判​的​余地​。​这​不是​针对​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} sha1 le5 ta1。{{/GM}} mei2you3 tan2pan4 de5 yu2di4。zhe4 bu4shi4 zhen1dui4 ni3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill him.{{/GM}} Say good night."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀​了​他​。​{{/GM}}​道​晚安​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} sha1 le5 ta1。{{/GM}} dao4 wan3an1 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill him.{{/GM}} Wrong place, wrong time, buddy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀死​他​。​{{/GM}}​伙计​，​要​怪​就​怪​你​选错​了​时间​和​地点​。\n"
"{{GM}} sha1si3 ta1。{{/GM}} huo3ji5，yao4 guai4 jiu4 guai4 ni3 xuan3 cuo4 le5 shi2jian1 he4 di4dian3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Kill{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​杀死​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} sha1si3 {{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Kim doesn't seem to understand, but she nods anyway.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金​似乎​并​不​明白​你​在​说​什么​，​但​她​还是​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 si4hu1 bing4 bu4 ming2bai5 ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5，dan4 ta1 hai2shi5 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kim glances across the way, where two of the Kreuzbasar's littlest ones peek out of an upper story window.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Some of them lost their parents. I never knew mine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金瞥​了​眼街​对面​，​克洛伊​茨​集市​最小​的​两个​孩子​正​从​楼上​的​窗户​探头​张望​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有些​孩子​失去​了​父母​。​我​也​从来​没见​过​自己​父母​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 pie1 le5 yan3 jie1 dui4mian4，Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zui4 xiao3 de5 liang3 ge4 hai2zi5 zheng1 cong2 lou2shang4 de5 chuang1hu5 tan4tou2 zhang1wang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3Xie1hai2zi5 shi1qu4 le5 fu4mu3。wo3 ye3 cong2lai2 mei2 jian4 guo4 zi4ji3 fu4mu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kim hugs her arms close to her body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sad. She never got to have a family. She'll never get married. Never be a mother."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金将​双臂​紧紧​抱​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​难过​。​她​没能​组建​家庭​。​以后​永远​也​无法​结婚​，​成为​母亲​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 jiang1 shuang1bi4 jin3jin3 bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"nan2guo4。ta1 mei2 neng2 zu3jian4 jia1ting2。yi3hou4 yong3yuan3 ye3 wu2fa3 jie2hun1，cheng2wei2 mu3qin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kim hugs herself tightly around her midsection, drawing herself in and doing the impossible of making herself even thinner.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not sure I want to talk about it. I only ever talked about it with Monika."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金​紧紧​环抱​自己​的​腰身​，​将​身体​往​里​蜷缩​，​竟然​让​她​看起来​更加​瘦弱​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​确定​是否​愿意​谈​这个​。​我​只​和​莫妮卡​聊过​这件​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 jin3jin3 huan2bao4 zi4ji3 de5 yao1shen1，jiang1 shen1ti3 wang3 li3 quan2suo1，jing4ran2 rang4 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 geng4jia1 shou4ruo4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 que4ding4 shi4fou3 yuan4yi4 tan2 zhe4ge5。wo3 zhi3 he4 Mo4ni1ka3 liao2 guo4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kim nods her head almost dumbly, her eyes unfocused on the "
"ground.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金​近乎​呆滞​地​点点头​，​目光​涣散​地​盯​着​地面​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 jin4hu5 dai1zhi4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2，mu4guang1 huan4san4 de5 ding1 zhao2 di4mian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kim nods her head mournfully.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And they will never forget, no matter how much they try."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金​悲恸​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​他们​无论​怎么​努力​，​都​无法​忘掉​这些​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 bei1tong4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2 ta1men5 wu2lun4 zen3me5 nu3li4，dou1 wu2fa3 wang4diao4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kim turns her head so as not to look you in the eyes. Her posture is that of someone who fears the possible repercussions of her answer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金​转过​头去​，​避免​与​你​目光​相接​，​仿佛​在​害怕​自己​的​回答​可能​引发​的​后果​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 qu4，bi4mian3 yu4 ni3 mu4guang1 xiang1jie1，fang3fu2 zai4 hai4pa4 zi4ji3 de5 hui2da2 ke3neng2 yin3fa1 de5 hou4guo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kristian and Karin Beck walk arm in arm, enjoying a stroll in the unseasonably warm air.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look who's back, mein Schatz."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克里斯蒂安​和​卡琳​·​贝克​手挽手​在​漫步​，​享受​着​这​反常​温暖​的​空气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看看​是​谁​回来​了​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ke4li3si1di4an1 he4 ka3 lin2 · bei4ke4 shou3 wan3 shou3 zai4 man4bu4，xiang3shou4 zhao2 zhe4 fan3chang2 wen1nuan3 de5 kong1qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4kan5 shi4 shei2 hui2lai5 le5，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kristian and Karin exchange a look.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For you, I suppose that is what it must be. Not so for us, of course."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克里斯蒂安​和​卡琳​对视​了​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​你​来说​肯定​是​这样​。​当然​对​我们​而言​就​不是​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ke4li3si1di4an1 he4 ka3 lin2 dui4shi4 le5 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 ken3ding4 shi4 zhe4yang4。dang1ran2 dui4 wo3men5 er2yan2 jiu4 bu4shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kristian and Karin look at each other, sharing a thought in the way old couples do.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you, $(l.name). Once again, you have helped more than you can know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克里斯蒂安​和​卡琳​对视​一眼​，​像​老夫妻​那样​心照不宣​地​交换​着​想法​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​，​$(l.name)​。​你​这次​所​给予​的​帮助​，​又​一次​超乎​你​的​想象​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ke4li3si1di4an1 he4 ka3 lin2 dui4shi4 yi1yan3，xiang4 lao3 fu1 qi4 na4yang4 xin1zhao4bu4xuan1 de5 jiao1huan4 zhao2 xiang3fa3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5，$(l.name)。ni3 zhe4 ci4 suo3 ji3yu3 de5 bang1zhu4，you4 yi1ci4 chao1 hu1 ni3 de5 xiang3xiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kristian gives his wife a look that must have been in his eyes on their wedding day. He then composes himself and turns back to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And what about you, $(l.name)? What does the future hold now that your work here is done?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克里斯蒂安​此刻​投向​妻子​的​目光​，​想必​与​婚礼​当日​如出一辙​。​他​随即​镇定​神色​，​转而​面向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​呢​，​$(l.name)​？​既然​此间​事情​已​了​，​你​对​未来​又​有​什么​打算​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ke4li3si1di4an1 ci3ke4 tou2 xiang4 qi1zi3 de5 mu4guang1，xiang3bi4 yu4 hun1li3 dang1ri4 ru2chu1yi1zhe2。ta1 sui2ji2 zhen4ding4 shen2se4，zhuan3er2 mian4xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 ni2，$(l.name)？ji4ran2 ci3jian1 shi4qing5 yi3 le5，ni3 dui4 wei4lai2 you4 you3 shen2me5 da3suan4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kristian nods along with her, as if being convinced of something in this very moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. The truth is, we were discussing whether we should stay or go. Things are changing..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克里斯蒂安​跟着​她​点头​，​仿佛​此刻​才​被​说服​了​似的​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​。​说实话​，​我们​正在​讨论​是​该​留下​还是​离开​。​这里​的​一切​已经​今非昔比​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ke4li3si1di4an1 gen1zhe5 ta1 dian3tou2，fang3fu2 ci3ke4 cai2 bei4 shuo1fu2 le5 shi4de5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。shuo1shi2hua4，wo3men5 zheng4zai4 tao3lun4 shi4 gai1 liu2xia4 hai2shi5 li2kai1。zhe4li3 de5 yi1qie4 yi3jing1 jin1fei1xi1bi3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kristian nods somewhat somberly, but Karin stays more upbeat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We'll take whatever we can get. Thank you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克里斯蒂安​略显​沉重​地​点点头​，​但​卡琳​依然​保持​着​乐观​的​态度​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​很​知足​的​。​谢谢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ke4li3si1di4an1 lu:e4 xian3 chen2zhong4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2，dan4 ka3 lin2 yi1ran2 bao3chi2 zhao2 le4guan1 de5 tai4du5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hen3 zhi1zu2 de5。xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kristian regards you more seriously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Is this true? Will you be staying?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克里斯蒂安​看向​你​的​目光​严肃​了​些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​这样​吗​？​你​会​留下来​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ke4li3si1di4an1 kan4 xiang4 ni3 de5 mu4guang1 yan2su4 le5 xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4 ma5？ni3 hui4 liu2 xia4 lai2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Kristian takes his wife around the shoulders and hugs her close as she begins to tear up.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Neither can we. Thank you. Thank you for everything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​见​妻子​眼眶​渐渐​泛红​，​克里斯蒂安​赶紧​搂住​她​的​肩膀​，​将​她​紧紧​拥入​怀中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​也​一样​。​谢谢​。​谢谢​你​做​的​一切​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jian4 qi1zi3 yan3kuang4 jian4jian4 fan4hong2，ke4li3si1di4an1 gan3jin3 lou3zhu4 ta1 de5 jian1bang3，jiang1 ta1 jin3jin3 yong1 ru4 huai2 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ye3 yi1yang4。xie4xie5。xie4xie5 ni3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Laine clenches and unclenches a fist, either out of repressed anger or more phantom pain. His weathered face betrays nothing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Russians thought to come at us from the north as well as the west. Through the Lapland. Thinking us weaker there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莱恩​握紧拳头​又​松开​，​可能​是​出于​压抑​的​愤怒​，​也​可能​是​更​多​的​幻痛​。​他​饱经风霜​的​脸庞​没有​透露​任何​内容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当时​俄国​佬​想​从​北面​和​西面​进攻​我们​。​穿过​拉普兰​区​。​认为​我们​在​那里​比较​薄弱​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 wo4 jin3 quan2 tou2 you4 song1kai1，ke3neng2 shi4 chu1yu2 ya1yi4 de5 fen4nu4，ye3 ke3neng2 shi4 geng1 duo1 de5 huan4 tong4。ta1 bao3jing1feng1shuang1 de5 lian3pang2 mei2you3 tou4lu4 ren4he2 nei4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1shi2 e2guo2 lao3 xiang3 cong2 bei3mian4 he4 xi1mian4 jin4gong1 wo3men5。chuan1guo4 la1pu3lan2 qu1。ren4wei2 wo3men5 zai4 na4li5 bi3jiao4 bo2ruo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Laine gives you a dark look.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I taught hundreds of men and women to fight, and most of them are dead now. I won't put anyone on that same path again. I can't."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莱恩​阴沉​地​看​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​曾​教导​过​数百名​男女​如何​战斗​，​而​如今​他们​中​的​大多数​都​已​不​在​人世​。​我​不会​再​让​任何人​走上​那条​道路​。​我​做​不到​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 yin1chen2 de5 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ceng2 jiao4dao3 guo4 shu3 bai3 ming2 nan2nu:3 ru2he2 zhan4dou4，er2 ru2jin1 ta1men5 zhong4 de5 da4duo1shu4 dou1 yi3 bu4 zai4 ren2shi4。wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 rang4 ren4 he2 ren2 zou3 shang4 na4 tiao2 dao4lu4。wo3 zuo4 bu4dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Laine grumbles and massages phantom pain in his synthetic legs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Damn it, why won't the world just let an old soldier fade away, like MacArthur promised?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莱恩​嘟囔​着​按摩​义肢​假腿​的​幻痛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该死​的​，​为什么​这​世界​就​不能​像​麦克阿瑟​当年​说​过​的​，​让​老兵​默默​凋零​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 du1nang5 zhao2 an4mo2 yi4zhi1 jia3tui3 de5 huan4 tong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1si3 de5，wei4shen2me5 zhe4 shi4jie4 jiu4 bu4neng2 xiang4 mai4ke4a1se4 dang1nian2 shuo1 guo4 de5，rang4 lao3bing1 mo4mo4 diao1ling2 ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Laine looks to have mostly recovered from whatever happened the other day. A few butterfly stitches keep closed the lacerations on his face, and his damaged prosthetic looks to be functioning normally once again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And what brings you around today?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莱恩​似乎​已经​从前​几天​发生​的​事情​中​基本​恢复过来​。​他​脸上​的​一些​裂伤​已经​缝好​了​线​，​而​他​受损​的​义肢​似乎​也​恢复​了​正常​功能​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​今天​来​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 si4hu1 yi3jing1 cong2qian2 ji3tian1 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5 zhong4 ji1ben3 hui1 fu4 guo4 lai2。ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 yi1xie1 lie4 shang1 yi3jing1 feng2 hao3 le5 xian4，er2 ta1 shou4sun3 de5 yi4zhi1 si4hu1 ye3 hui1fu4 le5 zheng4chang2 gong1neng2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jin1tian1 lai2 you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Laine oversees the repair of one of the Kreuzbasar's buildings. The old troll seems to be standing taller, barely needing the crutch. His face is as grim as always, but there is less weariness in his eyes than before.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莱恩​负责​监督​克洛伊​茨​集市​其中​一栋​建筑​的​修复​工作​。​这位​老巨魔​似乎​站​得​更​直​了​，​几乎​不再​需要​拄​拐杖​。​他​的​面容​一如既往​地​严肃​，​但​眼中​的​疲惫感​比​以往​减轻​了​不少​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 fu4ze2 jian1du1 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 qi2zhong1 yi1 dong4 jian4zhu4 de5 xiu1fu4 gong1zuo4。zhe4wei4 lao3 ju4 mo2 si4hu1 zhan4 de2 geng1 zhi2 le5，ji1hu1 bu4zai4 xu1yao4 zhu3 guai3zhang4。ta1 de5 mian4rong2 yi1ru2ji4wang3 de5 yan2su4，dan4 yan3zhong1 de5 pi2 bei4 gan3 bi3 yi3wang3 jian3qing1 le5 bu4shao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Laine shuffles forward, coming so close that the smell of leather and machine oil are almost overpowering. He lowers his voice, marking his words for you alone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I had my doubts about you. As I'm sure a lot of people had. But you did right by this place. And by her."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莱恩​缓缓​凑过​身来​，​一直​到​皮革​与​机油​的​气味​几乎​令人窒息​。​他​压低​声音​，​只​对​你​一人​低语​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对​你​曾​抱​有​怀疑​。​我​想​很多​人​也​是​如此​。​但​你​对​这里​尽心尽力​。​对​她​也​同样​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 huan3huan3 cou4 guo4 shen1 lai2，yi1zhi2 dao4 pi2ge2 yu4 ji1you2 de5 qi4wei4 ji1hu1 ling3 ren2 zhi4 xi1。ta1 ya1di1 sheng1yin1，zhi3 dui4 ni3 yi1 ren2 di1yu3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ni3 ceng2 bao4 you3 huai2yi2。wo3 xiang3 hen3 duo1 ren2 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。dan4 ni3 dui4 zhe4li3 jin4xin1jin4li4。dui4 ta1 ye3 tong2yang4 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Laine sighs, his weight settling on creaking legs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Problem with a tightknit community like the Kreuzbasar is that you can't escape who you are. Fine. You want to hear it, I'll tell it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莱恩​叹​了​口气​，​把​重量​压在​吱呀​作响​的​双腿​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​像​克洛伊​茨​集市​这样​紧密团结​的​社区​的​问题​在于​，​你​无法​逃避​自己​的​身份​。​好​吧​。​你​想​听​，​我​就​告诉​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lai2en1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，ba3 zhong4liang4 ya1 zai4 zhi1ya1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 shuang1tui3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiang4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhe4yang4 jin3 mi4 tuan2 jie1 de5 she4qu1 de5 wen4ti2 zai4yu2，ni3 wu2fa3 tao2bi4 zi4ji3 de5 shen1fen4。hao3 ba1。ni3 xiang3 ting1，wo3 jiu4 gao4su4 ni3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Launch yourself at him as he turns his back.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​趁​他​转身​时​扑​向​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} chen4 ta1 zhuan3shen1 shi2 pu1 xiang4 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Launch yourself at him.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扑​向​他​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} pu1 xiang4 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Leaf through the beginning of the manifesto.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阅读​宣言​的​开头​部分​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} yue4du2 xuan1yan2 de5 kai1tou2 bu4fen5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Leaf through the pages.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​翻阅​纸页​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} fan1yue4 zhi3 xie2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Lean on the comm button again.{{/GM}} No particular reason. I'm just "
"having fun driving you nuts."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​再次​靠​在​通讯​按钮​上​。​{{/GM}}​没什么​理由​。​我​就是​觉得​折腾​你​很​好玩​。\n"
"{{GM}} zai4ci4 kao4 zai4 tong1xun4 an4niu3 shang4。{{/GM}} mei2shen2me5 li3you2。wo3 jiu4shi4 jue2de5 zhe1teng5 ni3 hen3 hao3wan2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Leap back.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​退后​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} tui4hou4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Leave Them Alone{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1 {{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Leave him be.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Leave it alone.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}}"

