msgid ""
"{{GM}}Lucky Strike taps out her cigarette and leans toward you, a predatory grin on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You and your friends, you followed Monika, too. Obeyed her orders without question. Right?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​“​幸运星​”​掐灭​手里​的​香烟​，​朝​你​凑近​了​些​，​脸上​挂​着​阴险​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​跟​你​的​朋友​们​也​是​追随​莫妮卡​的​。​只要​是​她​的​命令​统统​照​做​。​是​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}“Xing4yun4xing1” qia1 mie4 shou3li3 de5 xiang1yan1，chao2 ni3 cou4jin4 le5 xie1，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yin1xian3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1 ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 ye3 shi4 zhui1sui2 Mo4ni1ka3 de5。zhi3yao4 shi4 ta1 de5 ming4ling4 tong3tong3 zhao4 zuo4。shi4 ba1？"

msgid ""
