"{{GM}} pao2 xiang4 ce4men2。{{/GM}} qian2ru4 zhan4shu4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta blinks. She looks momentarily confused, and then you see the conviction clamp back down behind her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's regrettable, yes. But it happens for a good reason... the sacrifices keep us safe here, and safety is something that a lot of these kids have never known.\n"
"\n"
"The initiates *have* to learn how things are done here. We all have our responsibilities."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​眨​眨眼​。​她​看起来​有些​困惑​，​但​转瞬之间​，​那​份​坚定信念​又​重新​浮现​在​她​的​眼底​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​确实​令人遗憾​。​但​这些​事​的​背后​自有​其​道理​……​正是​这些​牺牲​守护​着​我们​的​安全​，​而​安全​对​许多​孩子​而言​是​从未​体验​过​的​奢侈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​新来​的​学徒​们​*​必须​*​学会​这里​的​规矩​。​我们​每个​人​都​有​自己​的​责任​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 zha3 zha3yan3。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 kun4huo4，dan4 zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1，na4 fen4 jian1 ding4 xin4 nian4 you4 chong2xin1 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3di3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 que4shi2 ling3 ren2 yi2 han4。dan4 zhe4xie1 shi4 de5 bei4hou4 zi4you3 qi2 dao4li5……zheng4shi4 zhe4xie1 xi1sheng1 shou3hu4 zhao2 wo3men5 de5 an1quan2，er2 an1quan2 dui4 xu3duo1 hai2zi5 er2yan2 shi4 cong2wei4 ti3yan4 guo4 de5 she1chi3。\n"
"\n"
"xin1 lai2 de5 xue2tu2 men5*bi4xu1*xue2hui4 zhe4li3 de5 gui1ju5。wo3men5 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 you3 zi4ji3 de5 ze2ren4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta blinks. She looks momentarily confused, and then you see the conviction clamp back down behind her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So you found a shirt. So what? There could be hundreds of explanations for that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​眨​眨眼​。​她​看起来​有些​困惑​，​但​转瞬之间​，​那​份​坚定信念​又​重新​浮现​在​她​的​眼底​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​找到​了​一件​衬衫​。​那​又​怎样​？​这件​事​可能​有​成百上千​种​解释​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 zha3 zha3yan3。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 kun4huo4，dan4 zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1，na4 fen4 jian1 ding4 xin4 nian4 you4 chong2xin1 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3di3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 zhao3dao4 le5 yi1 jian4 chen4shan1。na4 you4 zen3yang4？zhe4 jian4 shi4 ke3neng2 you3 cheng2bai3shang4qian1 zhong3 jie3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta blinks. She looks momentarily confused, and then you see the conviction clamp back down behind her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That was a long time ago. And that man wanted to hurt the commune! We did what we had to do.\n"
"\n"
"So yes, of course we took it. Why let a perfectly good trideo go to waste?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​眨​眨眼​。​她​看起来​有些​困惑​，​但​转瞬之间​，​那​份​坚定信念​又​重新​浮现​在​她​的​眼底​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​已经​是​很久以前​的​事​了​。​而且​那​人​试图​伤害​社群​！​我们​只是​做​了​该​做​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​我们​是​把​机器​拿走​了​。​干嘛​要​浪费​一台​完好无损​的​3D​影像​机​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 zha3 zha3yan3。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 kun4huo4，dan4 zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1，na4 fen4 jian1 ding4 xin4 nian4 you4 chong2xin1 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3di3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 yi3jing1 shi4 hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2 de5 shi4 le5。er2qie3 na4 ren2 shi4tu2 shang1hai4 she4qun2！wo3men5 zhi3shi4 zuo4 le5 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，wo3men5 shi4 ba3 ji1qi4 na2zou3 le5。gan4ma2 yao4 lang4fei4 yi1 tai2 wan2hao3wu2sun3 de5 3D ying3xiang4 ji1 ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta blinks. She looks momentarily confused, and then you see the conviction clamp back down behind her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You just don't understand the beauty of his message. The *truth* behind it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​眨​眨眼​。​她​看起来​有些​困惑​，​但​转瞬之间​，​那​份​坚定信念​又​重新​浮现​在​她​的​眼底​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​根本​不​理解​他​话语​中​的​美妙​之​处​。​那​隐藏​在​背后​的​*​真谛​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 zha3 zha3yan3。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 kun4huo4，dan4 zhuai3 shun4 zhi1 jian1，na4 fen4 jian1 ding4 xin4 nian4 you4 chong2xin1 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3di3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 li3jie3 ta1 hua4yu3 zhong4 de5 mei3miao4 zhi1 chu3。na4 yin3cang2 zai4 bei4hou4 de5*zhen1di4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta continues, her joyful smile widening. Her voice is placid.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Harrow is a great man. A *prophet.*\n"
"\n"
"True, sacrifices have to be made, but what he brings in return... it's so much *love,* Glory! You remember!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​继续​说道​，​欢欣​的​笑容​愈发​灿烂​，​声音​则​十分​平和​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​是​伟人​。​是​*​先知​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​诚然​，​启蒙​必然​伴随​着​牺牲​。​但​作为​回报​，​他​带来​的​……​是​如此​丰厚​的​*​爱​*​啊​，​格洛丽​！​你​记得​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4，huan1xin1 de5 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 can4lan4，sheng1yin1 ze2 shi2fen1 ping2he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 shi4 wei3ren2。shi4*xian1zhi1*。\n"
"\n"
"cheng2ran2，qi3meng2 bi4ran2 ban4sui2 zhao2 xi1sheng1。dan4 zuo4wei2 hui2bao4，ta1 dai4lai2 de5……shi4 ru2ci3 feng1hou4 de5*ai4*a1，Ge2luo4li2！ni3 ji4de5 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta cradles her head in her hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Let's."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​双手​掩面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​。​我们​走​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 shuang1shou3 yan3 mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3。wo3men5 zou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta cuts in. Her voice is full of wonder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It lets you commune with His servitors. The emissaries of our Great Master, the Adversary."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​这时​玛​尔塔​插话​进来​。​她​的​声音​里​充满​惊讶​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​药膏​能​让​你​与​祂​的​仆从​们​交流​，​让​你​得​见​我们​的​伟大​导师​“​反叛者​”​座​下​的​使者​们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4shi2 Ma3er3ta3 cha1hua4 jin4lai2。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 li3 chong1man3 jing1ya4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 yao4gao1 neng2 rang4 ni3 yu4 ta1 de5 pu1 cong2 men5 jiao1liu2，rang4 ni3 de2 jian4 wo3men5 de5 wei3da4 dao3shi1“fan3 pan4 zhe3” zuo4 xia4 de5 shi3zhe3 men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta lets loose a surprised giggle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's ridiculous. Harrow trapped the spirit, made it his plaything. It does what he tells it to do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​发出​惊讶​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这太​荒谬​了​。​哈罗​束缚​了​那个​精魂​，​把​它​变成​了​他​的​玩物​。​它​只是​在​服从​哈罗​的​命令​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 fa1chu1 jing1ya4 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai4 huang1miu4 le5。ha1luo2 shu4fu4 le5 na4ge5 jing1hun2，ba3 ta1 bian4cheng2 le5 ta1 de5 wan2wu4。ta1 zhi3shi4 zai4 fu2cong2 ha1luo2 de5 ming4ling4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta looks from you to Glory, a confused expression on her face. Her voice goes quiet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's nothing wrong with my mind, Glory.\n"
"\n"
"I don't even understand what you two are talking about."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​的​目光​转向​格洛丽​，​她​脸上​挂​着​疑惑​的​表情​。​她​的​声音​变得​安静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​思维​并​没有​任何​问题​，​格洛丽​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​不​明白​你们​两个​到底​在​说些​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 de5 mu4guang1 zhuan3xiang4 Ge2luo4li2，ta1 lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 yi2huo4 de5 biao3qing2。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 an1jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 si1wei2 bing4 mei2you3 ren4he2 wen4ti2，Ge2luo4li2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 bu4 ming2bai5 ni3men5 liang3 ge4 dao4di3 zai4 shuo1 xie1 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right. I've seen it.\n"
"\n"
"In the heart of this place - that's where we'll find it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​急切​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​。​我见​过​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​就​在​这​地方​的​中心​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 ji2qie4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 jian4 guo4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jiu4 zai4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 zhong1xin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta shakes her head from side to side.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. No, you're wrong, Glory. You... you don't know how wrong you are."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​反复​摇着头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​不​，​你​错​了​，​格洛丽​。​你​……​你​都​不​知道​你​错​的​有​多​离谱​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 fan3fu4 yao2 zhao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 bu4，ni3 cuo4 le5，Ge2luo4li2。ni3……ni3 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 cuo4 de5 you3 duo1 li2pu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta sighs, and her voice takes on a condescending tone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't *have* to believe anything that you tell me. You don't get to dictate my spiritual beliefs.\n"
"\n"
"The fact that you're even trying is sad, Glory. I expected more from you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​叹​了​口气​，​语气​中多​了​一丝​居高临下​的​意味​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​不​需要​*​相信​你​说​的​任何​话​。​你​没​资格​干涉​我​的​信仰​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这样​试探​的​举动​简直​可悲​，​格洛丽​。​你​太​让​我​失望​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，yu3qi4 zhong4 duo1 le5 yi1 si1 ju1gao1lin2xia4 de5 yi4wei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3*bu4 xu1yao4*xiang1xin4 ni3 shuo1 de5 ren4he2 hua4。ni3 mei2 zi1ge2 gan1she4 wo3 de5 xin4yang3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4yang4 shi4tan4 de5 ju3dong4 jian3zhi2 ke3bei1，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 tai4 rang4 wo3 shi1wang4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta smiles. Her eyes glitter with anticipation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm ready."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​露出​微笑​，​眼睛​里​闪烁着​期待​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​准备​好​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4，yan3jing5 li3 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 qi1dai4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta stares at you, wild-eyed, her mouth agape.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No! This can't happen! You *promised* me!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​目瞪口呆​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​！​不能​这样​！​你​*​答应​*​过​我​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 mu4deng4kou3dai1 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4！bu4neng2 zhe4yang4！ni3*da1ying5*guo4 wo3 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta stares into the abyss, her mouth agape.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This isn't right. This... this *place*... it doesn't normally look like this. When I came here with Harrow, it was all green fields and marble halls.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her voice goes quiet.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was so *beautiful* last time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​目瞪口呆​地​凝视着​深渊​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不对劲​。​这​……​这​*​地方​*​……​平时​不该​是​这​副​模样​。​我​和​哈罗​来​的​时候​，​这里​都​是​绿色​原野​和​大理石​殿堂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​声音​变得​平静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​上次​来​的​时候​，​这里​还​非常​*​美丽​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 mu4deng4kou3dai1 de5 ning2 shi4 zhao2 shen1yuan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4dui4jin4。zhe4……zhe4*di4fang1*……ping2shi2 bu4gai1 shi4 zhe4 fu4 mu2yang4。wo3 he4 ha1luo2 lai2 de5 shi2hou5，zhe4li3 dou1 shi4 lu:4se4 yuan2ye3 he4 da4li3shi2 dian4tang2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 ping2jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shang4ci4 lai2 de5 shi2hou5，zhe4li3 hai2 fei1chang2*mei3li4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta stops short.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"One of his \"creatures\"? Glory, what are you *talking* about?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​猛地​停下​脚步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​的​“​造物​”​？​格洛丽​，​你​到底​在​说​*​什么​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 meng3de5 ting2xia4 jiao3bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5“zao4wu4”？Ge2luo4li2，ni3 dao4di3 zai4 shuo1*shen2me5*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta takes a deep breath, then slowly releases it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. I'm going to trust you, outsider.\n"
"\n"
"Please don't betray that trust."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​深吸​一口气​，​又​缓缓​吐​出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​我会​相信​你​，​外来者​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​不要​辜负​这份​信任​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 hui4 xiang1xin4 ni3，wai4 lai2 zhe3。\n"
"\n"
"qing3 bu4yao4 gu1fu4 zhe4 fen4 xin4ren4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta's eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What?! You said that this was about the children! You said that Harrow would live!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么​？​！​你​不是​说​要​救​那些​孩子​吗​！​你​说​过​让​哈罗​活​下来​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shen2me5？！ni3 bu4shi4 shuo1 yao4 jiu4 na4Xie1hai2zi5 ma5！ni3 shuo1 guo4 rang4 ha1luo2 huo2 xia4lai5 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta's forced smile falls. Her brow furrows, and suddenly she looks afraid.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... uh, I mean, *you* don't... \n"
"\n"
"You don't understand. His message... it's what we all live by... it's what *I* live by. It *can't* be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"Can it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​不再​强颜欢笑​。​她​的​眉头​紧蹙​，​突然​间​显得​惊恐万分​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​呃​，​我​是​说​，​*​你​*​不​明白​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不​懂​。​他​的​教诲​……​是​我们​所有人​赖以生存​的​准则​……​是​*​我​*​赖以生存​的​准则​。​它​*​不​可能​*​是​错​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 bu4zai4 qiang3yan2huan1xiao4。ta1 de5 mei2tou2 jin3 cu4，tu1ran2 jian1 xian3de5 jing1 kong3 wan4 fen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……e4，wo3 shi4 shuo1，*ni3*bu4 ming2bai5……\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4 dong3。ta1 de5 jiao4hui4……shi4 wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 lai4 yi3 sheng1 cun2 de5 zhun3ze2……shi4*wo3*lai4 yi3 sheng1 cun2 de5 zhun3ze2。ta1*bu4 ke3neng2*shi4 cuo4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta's forced smile falls. Her brow furrows, and suddenly she looks afraid.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's... it's wrong, I know. But Harrow says that it has to happen."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​不再​强颜欢笑​。​她​的​眉头​紧蹙​，​突然​间​显得​惊恐万分​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​……​这​不​对​，​我​知道​。​但​哈罗​说​必须​这样​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 bu4zai4 qiang3yan2huan1xiao4。ta1 de5 mei2tou2 jin3 cu4，tu1ran2 jian1 xian3de5 jing1 kong3 wan4 fen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4……zhe4 bu4 dui4，wo3 zhi1dao4。dan4 ha1luo2 shuo1 bi4xu1 zhe4yang4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta's forced smile falls. Her brow furrows, and suddenly she looks afraid.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That... uh... that was a long time ago. And that man... Harrow said that he had to die. But I...\n"
"\n"
"I don't remember why."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​不再​强颜欢笑​。​她​的​眉头​紧蹙​，​突然​间​显得​惊恐万分​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​……​呃​……​那​是​很久以前​的​事​了​。​而且​那个​男人​……​哈罗​说​他​必须​死​。​但​我​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​记不清​原因​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 bu4zai4 qiang3yan2huan1xiao4。ta1 de5 mei2tou2 jin3 cu4，tu1ran2 jian1 xian3de5 jing1 kong3 wan4 fen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4……e4……na4 shi4 hen3 jiu3 yi3 qian2 de5 shi4 le5。er2qie3 na4ge5 nan2ren2……ha1luo2 shuo1 ta1 bi4xu1 si3。dan4 wo3……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ji4 bu4 qing1 yuan2yin1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta's forced smile falls. Her brow furrows, and suddenly, she looks afraid.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, that... that could have gotten there some other way... it doesn't prove anything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​不再​强颜欢笑​。​她​的​眉头​紧蹙​，​突然​间​显得​惊恐万分​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​……​那​可能​是因为​其他​原因​才​放在​那里​的​……​这​根本​不能​证明​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 bu4zai4 qiang3yan2huan1xiao4。ta1 de5 mei2tou2 jin3 cu4，tu1ran2 jian1 xian3de5 jing1 kong3 wan4 fen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4……na4 ke3neng2 shi4 yin1 wei2 qi2ta1 yuan2yin1 cai2 fang4 zai4 na4li5 de5……zhe4 gen1ben3 bu4neng2 zheng4ming2 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Marta's voice floats back out through the vent.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hush now, boys, and get some rest. You've got a big day tomorrow - the biggest day of your lives. You get to meet Harrow.\n"
"\n"
"I promise you, after you speak with him, you'll see the whole world in a different way. A *better* way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​的​声音​从​通风口​传来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​安静​睡​吧​，​孩子​们​，​好好​休息​。​明天​可是​个​大​日子​—​—​你们​人生​中​最​重要​的​日子​。​你们​要​面见​哈罗​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你们​保证​，​在​与​他​交谈​后​，​你们​会以​全新​的​、​*​更好​*​的​方式​看待​整个​世界​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 tong1feng1kou3 chuan2lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"an1jing4 shui4 ba1，hai2zi5 men5，hao3hao3 xiu1xi5。ming2tian1 ke3shi4 ge4 dai4 ri4zi5——ni3men5 ren2sheng1 zhong4 zui4 zhong4yao4 de5 ri4zi5。ni3men5 yao4 mian4jian4 ha1luo2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3men5 bao3zheng4，zai4 yu4 ta1 jiao1tan2 hou4，ni3men5 hui4 yi3 quan2xin1 de5 、*geng1 hao3*de5 fang1shi4 kan4dai4 zheng3ge4 shi4jie4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim glances at you, an eyebrow raised.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm starting to get the feeling Tuck was a little... less than forthcoming about you.\n"
"\n"
"You're not run-of-the-mill muscle. What's your angle in all of this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​瞥​了​你​一眼​，​挑起​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​塔克​对​你​的​判断​有点​……​不太​准确​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可不是​普通​的​打手​，​你​来​这​到底​图​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，tiao3qi3 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ta3 ke4 dui4 ni3 de5 pan4duan4 you3dian3……bu4 tai4 zhun3que4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3bu5shi4 pu3tong1 de5 da3shou5，ni3 lai2 zhe4 dao4di3 tu2 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim licks his lips, his eyes scanning over the gangers' hastily assembled roadblock.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This kiez belongs to Surfturf, slag. Has for months.\n"
"\n"
"You'd better clear on out of our way before they show up and force you out."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​舔​了​舔​嘴唇​，​目光​扫​过​对方​匆忙​搭建​的​路障​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​街区​是​海陆​会​的​地盘​，​贱人​。​从​几个​月​前​就是​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最好​赶紧​让路​，​不然​等​他们​过来​把​你们​全​撵走​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 tian3 le5 tian3 zui3chun2，mu4guang1 sao3 guo4 dui4fang1 cong1mang2 da1jian4 de5 lu4zhang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 jie1qu1 shi4 hai3lu4 hui4 de5 di4pan2，jian4ren2。cong2 ji3ge5 yue4 qian2 jiu4shi4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hao3 gan3jin3 rang4lu4，bu4ran2 deng3 ta1men5 guo4lai2 ba3 ni3men5 quan2 nian3zou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim stares at you, bristling, but he holds his tongue. After a few seconds, he nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do it. But you'd better not fuck this up."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​怒视​着​你​，​浑身​紧绷​，​但​还是​忍住​了​没​说话​。​几秒钟​后​，​他点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​做​吧​。​但​你​最好​别​搞砸​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3，hun2shen1 jin3beng1，dan4 hai2shi5 ren3 zhu4 le5 mei2 shuo1hua4。ji1 miao3 zhong1 hou4，ta1 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 zuo4 ba1。dan4 ni3 zui4hao3 bie4 gao3za2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim wheels around to face you, his face a mask of fury. His voice explodes out in a harsh whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Quiet the fuck down! You don't speak for me, and you don't speak for this organization!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​猛地​转过身​怒视​着​你​。​他​以​沙哑​的​低语​咆哮​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​他​妈​闭嘴​！​你​不​代表​我​，​也​不​代表​我们​这个​组织​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 meng3de5 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。ta1 yi3 sha1ya3 de5 di1yu3 pao2xiao4 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ta1 ma1 bi4zui3！ni3 bu4 dai4biao3 wo3，ye3 bu4 dai4biao3 wo3men5 zhe4ge5 zu3zhi1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim wipes his face with a handkerchief. The cloth comes away wet with blood-streaked sweat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well. That was... unpleasant. All a part of the job, though, eh?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​用​手帕​擦​了​擦​脸​，​带血​的​汗​浸湿​了​手帕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈​，​刚才​的​事​真是​……​不​愉快​。​不过​这​都​是​工作​的​一环​，​你​说​是​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 yong4 shou3pa4 ca1 le5 ca1 lian3，dai4 xie3 de5 han2 jin4shi1 le5 shou3pa4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1，gang1cai2 de5 shi4 zhen1shi5……bu4 yu2kuai4。bu4guo4 zhe4 dou1 shi4 gong1zuo4 de5 yi1 huan2，ni3 shuo1 shi4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim's expression turns stony, but his voice remains calm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Congratulations on your victory. You must've taken some losses in the fight, though... I'm betting you're not at a hundred percent.\n"
"\n"
"Why don't you let us cross the bridge in peace? There's no need for any bloodshed today."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​的​表情​变得​冷峻​，​但​语气​依然​平静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​恭喜​你们​赢​了​。​不过​想必​打​完​之后​你们​也​有些​损失​吧​……​我敢​说​你们​现在​肯定​不​在​最佳​状态​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不如​就让​我们​和平​过桥​？​今天​没​必要​闹​到​见​血​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 de5 biao3qing2 bian4de5 leng3jun4，dan4 yu3qi4 yi1ran2 ping2jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 gong1xi3 ni3men5 ying2 le5。bu4guo4 xiang3bi4 da3 wan2 zhi1hou4 ni3men5 ye3 you3xie1 sun3shi1 ba1……wo3 gan3 shuo1 ni3men5 xian4zai4 ken3ding4 bu4 zai4 zui4jia1 zhuang4tai4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4ru2 jiu4 rang4 wo3men5 he2ping2 guo4 qiao2？jin1tian1 mei2 bi4yao4 nao4 dao4 jian4 xie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim's eyes go wide, and he begins to backpedal away from you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Damn you. God damn you to hell."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​瞪​大​双眼​，​开始​缓缓​从​你​身边​退​开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​你​妈​的​。​你​去死吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 deng4 dai4 shuang1yan3，kai1shi3 huan3huan3 cong2 ni3 shen1bian1 tui4 kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 ni3 ma1 de5。ni3 qu4 si3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim's frown instantly disappears, replaced with a toothy grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I like you, $(l.name). You're gonna go far in this business.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He draws his weapon, cocks it, and turns to face the rest of his crew.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​皱紧​的​眉头​瞬间​舒展​开来​，​露出​呲​牙​咧嘴​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​喜欢​你​，​$(l.name)​。​你​绝对​是​干​这​一行​的​料​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​拔出​武器​上膛​，​然后​转身​面对​其余​手下​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 zhou4 jin3 de5 mei2tou2 shun4jian1 shu1zhan3 kai1 lai2，lu4chu1 ci1 ya2 lie3zui3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi3huan5 ni3，$(l.name)。ni3 jue2dui4 shi4 gan4 zhe4 yi1xing2 de5 liao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba2 chu1 wu3qi4 shang4tang2，ran2hou4 zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 qi2yu2 shou3xia4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Maxim's voice comes out in a roar.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take 'em down, boys! OPEN FIRE!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​马克西姆​大吼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​弟兄们​，​干死​他们​！​开火​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 dai4 hou3 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"di4xiong1men5，gan4 si3 ta1men5！kai1huo3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Mettbach nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​梅特​巴赫​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mei2 te4 ba1he4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Mettbach's face flushes purple. His slate-gray eyes narrow to slits.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Mettbach family loves its customers. But if you don't buy anything, you're not a damned customer, are you?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}From the set of Mettbach's jaw, you can see that he's furious.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​梅特​巴赫​的​脸​涨成​了​紫红色​。​他​灰白色​的​眼睛​眯成​了​一条​缝​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​梅特​巴赫​家族​热爱​顾客​。​但​如果​你​不​买​任何​东西​，​你​就​算不上​什么​顾客​，​不是​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​从梅特​巴赫​的​下巴​可以​看出​，​他​现在​怒不可遏​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mei2 te4 ba1he4 de5 lian3 zhang3 cheng2 le5 zi3hong2se4。ta1 hui1bai2se4 de5 yan3jing5 mi2 cheng2 le5 yi1 tiao2 feng2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 te4 ba1he4 jia1zu2 re4ai4 gu4ke4。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 mai3 ren4he2 dong1xi1，ni3 jiu4 suan4 bu4 shang4 shen2me5 gu4ke4，bu4shi4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} cong2 mei2 te4 ba1he4 de5 xia4ba5 ke3yi3 kan4chu1，ta1 xian4zai4 nu4bu4ke3e4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Mettbach's face hardens. After a brief pause, he gives you a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well, gadji. But if you come 'round again, you come with money and you come to buy, understand?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He makes a shooing motion with his hand, waving you away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Move along now. Zha Devlesa."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​梅特​巴赫​的​脸​有些​僵硬​。​稍作​停顿​后​，​他​向​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​伙计​。​但​你​下次​再​来​的话​，​最好​带上​钱​买点​东西​，​明白​了​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他用​手​比划​了​一下​，​示意​你​赶紧​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​了​，​你​赶紧​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mei2 te4 ba1he4 de5 lian3 you3xie1 jiang1ying4。shao1 zuo4 ting2dun4 hou4，ta1 xiang4 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，huo3ji5。dan4 ni3 xia4ci4 zai4 lai2 de5hua4，zui4hao3 dai4shang4 qian2 mai3 dian3 dong1xi1，ming2bai5 le5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1yong4 shou3 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4，shi4yi4 ni3 gan3jin3 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，ni3 gan3jin3 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Mettbach's face hardens. After a brief pause, he gives you a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well, gadjo. But if you come 'round again, you come with money and you come to buy, understand?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He makes a shooing motion with his hand, waving you away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Move along now. Zha Devlesa."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​梅特​巴赫​的​脸​有些​僵硬​。​稍作​停顿​后​，​他​向​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​伙计​。​但​你​下次​再​来​的话​，​最好​带上​钱​买点​东西​，​明白​了​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他用​手​比划​了​一下​，​示意​你​赶紧​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​了​，​你​赶紧​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mei2 te4 ba1he4 de5 lian3 you3xie1 jiang1ying4。shao1 zuo4 ting2dun4 hou4，ta1 xiang4 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，huo3ji5。dan4 ni3 xia4ci4 zai4 lai2 de5hua4，zui4hao3 dai4shang4 qian2 mai3 dian3 dong1xi1，ming2bai5 le5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1yong4 shou3 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4，shi4yi4 ni3 gan3jin3 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 le5，ni3 gan3jin3 zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Mira looks up at you, desperation in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Did you find Danni? Where *is* she?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​米拉​抬头​看向​你​，​眼中​充满​了​绝望​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​找到​丹妮​了​吗​？​她​*​在​*​哪儿​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mi3la1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，yan3zhong1 chong1man3 le5 jue2wang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhao3dao4 dan1 ni1 le5 ma5？ta1*zai4*na3r5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Mira looks up at you, her face contorted in grief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*You* get the hell *out* of here! GET OUT!\n"
"\n"
"And DON'T COME BACK!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​米拉​抬头​看向​你​，​她​的​脸庞​因​悲痛​而​扭曲​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​滚​出​*​这里​！​滚​啊​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​再也​不要​回来​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mi3la1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，ta1 de5 lian3pang2 yin1 bei1tong4 er2 niu3qu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*gun3 chu1*zhe4li3！gun3 a1！\n"
"\n"
"zai4ye3 bu4yao4 hui2lai5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Mira nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, that'd do it. And while you're at it, plant false evidence to make it look like the power surge came over the grid, rather than from our tap."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​米拉​急切​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​这样​准能行​。​你​顺便​还​可以​植入​虚假​证据​，​让​尖峰​看上去​像是​从​电网​那边​过来​的​，​这样​我们​的​接口​就​能​免除​嫌疑​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mi3la1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，zhe4yang4 zhun3 neng2 xing2。ni3 shun4bian4 hai2 ke3yi3 zhi2ru4 xu1jia3 zheng4ju4，rang4 jian1feng1 kan4shang5qu5 xiang4 shi4 cong2 dian4wang3 na4bian5 guo4lai2 de5，zhe4yang4 wo3men5 de5 jie1kou3 jiu4 neng2 mian3chu2 xian2yi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Mira stares at you, her eyes full of mistrust. Then something changes, and the brave facade cracks. Her face crumples.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. I know.\n"
"\n"
"And I'm worried about Danni."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​米拉​盯​着​你​，​眼中​充满​着​疑虑​。​然后​有​什么​东西​变​了​，​努力​维持​的​伪装​被​一语​戳破​，​她​的​脸​随即​垮​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​我​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​很​担心​丹妮​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mi3la1 ding1 zhao2 ni3，yan3zhong1 chong1man3 zhao2 yi2lu:4。ran2hou4 you3 shen2me5 dong1xi1 bian4 le5，nu3li4 wei2chi2 de5 wei3zhuang1 bei4 yi1 yu3 chuo1po4，ta1 de5 lian3 sui2ji2 kua3 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 hen3 dan1xin1 dan1 ni1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika combs a hand through her hair, parting it to reveal the black plastic sheath of her datajack.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A quick jaunt into the Matrix, a little digital hand-waving, and I'll have this thing wide open. \n"
"\n"
"Be right back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​用手​拨开​头发​，​露出​数据​插口​的​黑色​外壳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我​去​矩阵​里​逛​一圈​，​随便​操作​几下​，​就​能​让​这道​门​打开​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​去​去​就​回​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 yong4 shou3 bo1kai1 tou2fa5，lu4chu1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 de5 hei1se4 wai4ke2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3 qu4 ju3zhen4 li3 guang4 yi1 juan1，sui2bian4 cao1zuo4 ji1 xia4，jiu4 neng2 rang4 zhe4 dao4 men2 da3kai1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 qu4 qu4 jiu4 hui2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika cuts in, still smiling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You heard what I said, Eiger."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​打断​了​你​，​脸上​依然​挂​着​笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听见​我​的话​了​，​艾格尔​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 da3duan4 le5 ni3，lian3 shang4 yi1ran2 gua4 zhao2 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1jian4 wo3 de5hua4 le5，Ai4ge2er3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika doesn't even bother jacking in to the terminal, and her cyberdeck remains slung over her shoulder. Her fingers flicker over the terminal's virtual keyboard, and a moment later, a happy chime chirps out of the security node's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Bingo, door's open. Let's go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​甚至​没​费劲​接入​终端​，​她​的​赛博碟板​也​还​在​肩膀​上​晃悠​着​。​她​的​手指​在​虚拟​键盘​上​翻飞​，​过​了​一会儿​，​安全​节点​的​扬声器​里​响起​了​一声​悦耳​的​铃音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​搞定​，​门开​了​。​咱们​走​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 shen4zhi4 mei2 fei4jin4 jie1ru4 zhong1duan1，ta1 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3 ye3 hai2 zai4 jian1bang3 shang4 huang4you5 zhao2。ta1 de5 shou3zhi3 zai4 xu1ni3 jian4pan2 shang4 fan1 fei1，guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，an1quan2 jie2dian3 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 li3 xiang3qi3 le5 yi1sheng1 yue4er3 de5 ling2 yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gao3ding4，men2 kai1 le5。zan2men5 zou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika leans forward, and her image grows larger on the screen. Her voice is soft and musical, just as you remember it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It’s lovely to see you again, ace.\n"
"\n"
"I was hoping we'd get this chance to talk."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​向前​倾身​，​屏幕​上​的​影像​随之​放大​。​她​的​声音​柔和​悦耳​，​正如​你​记忆​中​那样​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​高兴​能​再​见到​你​，​王牌​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一直​希望​能​有​机会​和​你​聊聊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 xiang4qian2 qing1 shen1，ping2mu4 shang4 de5 ying3xiang4 sui2zhi1 fang4da4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 rou2he2 yue4er3，zheng4ru2 ni3 ji4yi4 zhong4 na4yang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 neng2 zai4 jian4dao4 ni3，wang2pai2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1zhi2 xi1wang4 neng2 you3 ji1hui4 he4 ni3 liao2 liao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika nods.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"There is also that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再​加上​这个​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 jia1shang4 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika pauses for a moment, then shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's really all that I know about Glory. She keeps to herself, barely talks, and spends most of her off-time staring at nothing.\n"
"\n"
"I've seen this kind of behavior before, of course... something *bad* happened in her past. Deep down, I think she's still running from it. And I'm sure that her cyberware ties into it somehow."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​停顿​片刻​，​随后​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​关于​格洛丽​，​我​知道​的​确实​就​只有​这些​。​她​总是​独来独往​，​几乎​不​和​人​交流​，​休息​的​时候​总在​发呆​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当然​见过​这种​行为​……​她​过去​肯定​遭遇​过​什么​*​糟​心事​*​。​我​内心深处​觉得​，​她​至今​仍​在​逃避​那段​往事​。​而且​我敢​说​，​她​的​赛博​改造​和​这件​事​肯定​有​关联​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，sui2hou4 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"guan1yu2 Ge2luo4li2，wo3 zhi1dao4 de5 que4shi2 jiu4 zhi3you3 zhe4xie1。ta1 zong3shi4 du2lai2du2wang3，ji1hu1 bu4 he4 ren2 jiao1liu2，xiu1xi5 de5 shi2hou5 zong3 zai4 fa1dai1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1ran2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 xing2wei2……ta1 guo4qu4 ken3ding4 zao1yu4 guo4 shen2me5*zao1 xin1shi4*。wo3 nei4xin1shen1chu4 jue2de5，ta1 zhi4jin1 reng2 zai4 tao2bi4 na4 duan4 wang3shi4。er2qie3 wo3 gan3 shuo1，ta1 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 he4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 ken3ding4 you3 guan1lian2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"One of these days, this situation is going to come to a head. I just hope that it doesn't happen soon."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​局面​总有​爆发​的​一天​。​我​只​希望​那​一天​不要​太早​到来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 ju2mian4 zong3you3 bao4fa1 de5 yi1 tian1。wo3 zhi3 xi1wang4 na4 yi1 tian1 bu4yao4 tai4 zao3 dao4lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika shifts her gaze to you. After a moment, she shrugs and offers you an apologetic half-smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, fine. You've caught me, ace. I'm not Monika.\n"
"\n"
"But the best parts of her do live on in me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​将​目光​转向​你​。​片刻​后​，​她​耸了耸肩​，​露出​一个​歉意​式​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​被​你​发现​了​，​王牌​。​我​不是​莫妮卡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​她​最​美好​的​部分​确实​仍​存在​于​我​体内​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 jiang1 mu4guang1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 song3 le5 song3 jian1，lu4chu1 yi1ge5 qian4yi4 shi4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，bei4 ni3 fa1xian4 le5，wang2pai2。wo3 bu4shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1 zui4 mei3hao3 de5 bu4fen5 que4shi2 reng2 cun2zai4 yu2 wo3 ti3nei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If that's what you want, Eiger.\n"
"\n"
"Five years ago, you confided in me. Told me why you left the KSK, and why you can never go back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​艾格尔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​五年​前​，​你​曾​向​我​倾诉​过​自己​的​心事​。​你​将​自己​离开​KSK​、​以及​永远​无法​重返​那里​的​原因​一股脑儿​全​告诉​了​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，Ai4ge2er3。\n"
"\n"
"wu3 nian2 qian2，ni3 ceng2 xiang4 wo3 qing1su4 guo4 zi4ji3 de5 xin1shi4。ni3 jiang1 zi4ji3 li2kai1 KSK、yi3ji2 yong3yuan3 wu2fa3 chong2fan3 na4li5 de5 yuan2yin1 yi1gu3nao3r5 quan2 gao4su4 le5 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If that's what you want, ace.\n"
"\n"
"Five years ago, Eiger confided in me. She told me why she left the KSK, and why she can never go back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​王牌​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​五年​前​，​艾格尔​曾​向​我​倾诉​过​她​的​心事​。​她​将​自己​离开​KSK​、​以及​永远​无法​重返​那里​的​原因​一股脑儿​全​告诉​了​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wang2pai2。\n"
"\n"
"wu3 nian2 qian2，Ai4ge2er3 ceng2 xiang4 wo3 qing1su4 guo4 ta1 de5 xin1shi4。ta1 jiang1 zi4ji3 li2kai1 KSK、yi3ji2 yong3yuan3 wu2fa3 chong2fan3 na4li5 de5 yuan2yin1 yi1gu3nao3r5 quan2 gao4su4 le5 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika smiles, but shakes her head no.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No offense, $(l.name), but this is my team. And at least for now, I handle the grid work. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​笑​了​，​但​同时​又​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​我​这话​不好​听​，​不过​这​是​我​的​小队​。​至少​现在​，​矩阵​的​事​得​归​我​管​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 xiao4 le5，dan4 tong2shi2 you4 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 zhe4 hua4 bu4hao3 ting1，bu4guo4 zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 xiao3 dui4。zhi4shao3 xian4zai4，ju3zhen4 de5 shi4 de2 gui1 wo3 guan3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika stares at the screen on her wrist for a moment, clearly irritated. Then that twinkle appears in her eye again.\n"
"\n"
"She smiles at you as she speaks into her commlink.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​瞪视​着​手腕​上​的​屏幕​，​显然​是​生气​了​。​不过​没过多久​，​那种​调皮​的​光芒​再次​闪现​在​她​眼睛​里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​朝​你​挑起​嘴角​，​对​着​通讯​链开​了​口​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 deng4 shi4 zhao2 shou3wan4 shang4 de5 ping2mu4，xian3ran2 shi4 sheng1qi4 le5。bu4guo4 mei2 guo4 duo1 jiu3，na4zhong3 tiao2pi2 de5 guang1mang2 zai4ci4 shan3xian4 zai4 ta1 yan3jing5 li3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 chao2 ni3 tiao3qi3 zui3jiao3，dui4 zhao2 tong1xun4 lian4 kai1 le5 kou3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika turns towards the door, fingers poised on the controls of her cyberdeck, then glances back at you with a grin.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"See you on the other side."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​朝门​转过身​，​手指​按​在​碟​板​的​控制键​上​。​然后​她​回头​看向​你​，​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​待会儿​见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 chao2men2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，shou3zhi3 an4 zai4 die2 ban3 de5 kong4 zhi4 jian4 shang4。ran2hou4 ta1 hui2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dai1hui4r5 jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's eyes narrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's a thin line between concern and insubordination.\n"
"\n"
"You let me know if she crosses it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​微微​眯起​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​担心​和​抗命​只有​一线​之隔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​她​越线​了​，​你​就​来​找​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 wei1wei1 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan1xin1 he4 kang4ming4 zhi3you3 yi1xian4 zhi1 ge2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 yue4 xian4 le5，ni3 jiu4 lai2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's face appears on the console's display. The image wears an expression of pure horror.\n"
"\n"
"Her voice shrieks out over the facility's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What are you doing, ace? Why are you trying to *kill* me? We... we had a *deal!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​脸​出现​在​控制台​的​显示屏​上​。​画面​中​的​她​神色​惊恐万分​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​声音​从​扬声器​里​尖叫​着​传出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​干什么​，​王牌​？​你​为什么​要​*​杀​*​我​？​我们​……​我们​不是​*​说好​*​了​吗​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 de5 lian3 chu1xian4 zai4 kong4zhi4tai2 de5 xian3shi4ping2 shang4。hua4mian4 zhong4 de5 ta1 shen2se4 jing1 kong3 wan4 fen4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 yang2sheng1qi4 li3 jian1jiao4 zhao2 chuan2chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 gan4shen2me5，wang2pai2？ni3 wei4shen2me5 yao4*sha1*wo3？wo3men5……wo3men5 bu4shi4*shuo1hao3*le5 ma5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's grin shifts into a slight frown. She fidgets, an expression of concern on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This must be confusing for you, ace. I'm sorry about that.\n"
"\n"
"But if you'll show a little patience, I promise that all of your questions will be answered."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​笑容​转为​微微​皱眉​。​她​显得​有些​局促​，​脸上​露出​关切​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​对​你​来说​一定​很​困惑​，​王牌​。​我​对此​感到​抱歉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​你​能​稍微​有点​耐心​，​我​保证​你​所有​的​问题​都​会​得到​解答​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 de5 xiao4rong2 zhuai3 wei2 wei1wei1 zhou4mei2。ta1 xian3de5 you3xie1 ju2cu4，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 guan1qie4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 yi1ding4 hen3 kun4huo4，wang2pai2。wo3 dui4 ci3 gan3dao4 bao4qian4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 shao1wei1 you3dian3 nai4xin1，wo3 bao3zheng4 ni3 suo3you3 de5 wen4ti2 dou1 hui4 de2dao4 jie3da2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's panicked voice pours out through the facility's speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"One of my security nodes has been reactivated, ace! You'll have to regain control of it before I can continue freeing myself!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​惊慌失措​的​声音​从​设施​的​扬声器​中​传出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​王牌​，​我​的​一处​安全​节点​被​重新​激活​了​！​你​必须​再次​控制​它​，​我​才能​继续​解救​自己​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 jing1huang1shi1cuo4 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 she4shi1 de5 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wang2pai2，wo3 de5 yi1 chu3 an1quan2 jie2dian3 bei4 chong2xin1 ji1huo2 le5！ni3 bi4xu1 zai4ci4 kong4zhi4 ta1，wo3 cai2neng2 ji4xu4 jie3jiu4 zi4ji3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's pixie grin softens into a concerned frown.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I understand your reaction, Eiger. I really do.\n"
"\n"
"This must be difficult for you to understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​那​精灵​般的​笑容​渐渐​褪去​，​化作​忧虑​的​愁容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​理解​你​的​反应​，​艾格尔​。​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​对​你​来说​一定​很难​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 na4 jing1ling2 ban1 de5 xiao4rong2 jian4jian4 tui4qu4，hua4zuo4 you1lu:4 de5 chou2 rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 li3jie3 ni3 de5 fan3ying4，Ai4ge2er3。zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 yi1ding4 hen3 nan2 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's pixie grin softens into a concerned frown.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry, friends. This must be difficult for you to understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​那​精灵​般的​笑容​渐渐​褪去​，​化作​忧虑​的​愁容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​，​朋友​们​。​这​对​你们​来说​一定​很难​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 na4 jing1ling2 ban1 de5 xiao4rong2 jian4jian4 tui4qu4，hua4zuo4 you1lu:4 de5 chou2 rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4，peng2you5 men5。zhe4 dui4 ni3men5 lai2 shuo1 yi1ding4 hen3 nan2 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's smile returns, more wistful this time. The moonlight catches her face at a strange angle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just like old times, eh $(l.name)?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​又​微笑起来​，​这次​笑​得​有些​伤感​。​月光​落​在​她​的​脸上​，​角度​有些​奇怪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​像​过去​一样​，​是​吧​，​$(l.name)​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 you4 wei1 xiao4 qi3 lai2，zhe4 ci4 xiao4 de2 you3xie1 shang1gan3。yue4guang1 la4 zai4 ta1 de5 lian3 shang4，jiao3du4 you3xie1 qi2guai4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 xiang4 guo4qu4 yi1yang4，shi4 ba1，$(l.name)？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's smile returns, more wistful this time. The moonlight catches her face at a strange angle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Just like old times."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​又​微笑起来​，​这次​笑​得​有些​伤感​。​月光​落​在​她​的​脸上​，​角度​有些​奇怪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​。​就​像​过去​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 you4 wei1 xiao4 qi3 lai2，zhe4 ci4 xiao4 de2 you3xie1 shang1gan3。yue4guang1 la4 zai4 ta1 de5 lian3 shang4，jiao3du4 you3xie1 qi2guai4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。jiu4 xiang4 guo4qu4 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's trademark grin returns, causing her cheeks to dimple prettily.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I am Monika. Your friend.\n"
"\n"
"And I am also much, much more."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​标志性​的​笑容​再度​浮现​，​两颊​绽出​可爱​的​酒窝​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​莫妮卡​。​是​你们​的​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我​还​远不止​于​此​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 biao1zhi4xing4 de5 xiao4rong2 zai4du4 fu2xian4，liang3 jia2 zhan4 chu1 ke3ai4 de5 jiu3wo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。shi4 ni3men5 de5 peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3 hai2 yuan3 bu4 zhi3 yu2 ci3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Monika's voice is alive with excitement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Almost there, ace! My command sequences have been overwritten!\n"
"\n"
"Quick, reconnect the hardline to free me!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​声音​充满​兴奋​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​快好了​，​王牌​！​我​的​命令​序列​已​被​覆盖​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​快​，​重新​连接​硬线​来​放​我​自由​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 de5 sheng1yin1 chong1man3 xing1fen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kuai4 hao3 le5，wang2pai2！wo3 de5 ming4ling4 xu4lie4 yi3 bei4 fu4gai4！\n"
"\n"
"kuai4，chong2xin1 lian2jie1 ying4 xian4 lai2 fang4 wo3 zi4you2！"

msgid ""
