"{{GM}}​施罗蒂​惊讶​地​眨​眨眼​，​但​胡须​却​未曾​透露​出​他​面部​的​任何​变化​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这么​爽快​……​那好​吧​，​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​小心翼翼​地​从​桌上​拿起​那台​老旧​的​设备​，​递到​你​手中​。​播放器​的​塑料​外壳​布满​划痕​且​磨损​严重​，​轻轻​晃动​时​还​能​听见​咔嗒​作响​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可​让​你​赚​到​喽​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 jing1ya4 de5 zha3 zha3yan3，dan4 hu2xu1 que4 wei4ceng2 tou4lu4 chu1 ta1 mian4bu4 de5 ren4he2 bian4hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuang3kuai5……na4 hao3 ba1，peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao3xin1yi4yi4 de5 cong2 zhuo1 shang4 na2qi3 na4 tai2 lao3jiu4 de5 she4bei4，di4 dao4 ni3 shou3 zhong4。bo1 fang4 qi4 de5 su4liao4 wai4ke2 bu4man3 hua2hen2 qie3 mo2sun3 yan2zhong4，qing1qing1 huang4dong4 shi2 hai2 neng2 ting1jian4 ka1da1 zuo4 xiang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3 rang4 ni3 zhuan4 dao4 lou5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Schrotty gingerly picks up the ancient device from the table and presses it into your hands. The plastic is scuffed and worn, and it rattles a bit when you move it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Give 'er some good use, okay?"
