"{{GM}}​施罗蒂​回头​看向​DVD​播放器​，​脸上​露出​一丝​肉痛​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​老实​说​，​真​有点​舍不得​出手​……​有​老多人​就​喜欢​这种​老物什​，​而且​我​也​拿不准​你​要​拿​它​来​干​啥​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 hui2tou2 kan4 xiang4 DVD bo1 fang4 qi4，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 yi1 si1 rou4 tong4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"lao3shi5 shuo1，zhen1 you3dian3 she3bu5de5 chu1shou3……you3 lao3 duo1 ren2 jiu4 xi3huan5 zhe4zhong3 lao3 wu4 shen2，er2qie3 wo3 ye3 na2bu4zhun3 ni3 yao4 na2 ta1 lai2 gan4 sha2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Schrotty looks up at you from his work and nods.{{/GM}} Hello again, "
"mein Frau. I'm a bit busy, but what can I do fer ya?"
