"{{GM}}​施罗蒂自​手头​的​工作​中​抬起​头​，​微微​颔首​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​见面​了​，​女士​。​我​现在​有点​忙​，​你​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 zi4 shou3tou2 de5 gong1zuo4 zhong4 tai2qi3 tou2，wei1wei1 han4shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5，nu:3shi4。wo3 xian4zai4 you3dian3 mang2，ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Schrotty looks up at you from his work and nods.{{/GM}} Hello again, "
"mein Herr. I'm a bit busy, but what can I do fer ya?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​施罗蒂自​手头​的​工作​中​抬起​头​，​微微​颔首​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​见面​了​，​先生​。​我​现在​有点​忙​，​你​有​什么​事​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi1 luo2 di4 zi4 shou3tou2 de5 gong1zuo4 zhong4 tai2qi3 tou2，wei1wei1 han4shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5，xian1sheng5。wo3 xian4zai4 you3dian3 mang2，ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4 ma5？"

