"{{GM}}​她​把​手指​重新​蘸​入​药膏​，​沿着​你​的​额头​划过​。​药膏​在​你​皮肤​上​的​触感​清凉​而​油腻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没有​。​但​说到底​，​这​并​不​重要​……​无论如何​，​我们​都​要​杀​到​那个​神龛​精魂​的​面前​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shou3zhi3 chong2xin1 zhan4 ru4 yao4gao1，yan2zhe5 ni3 de5 e2tou2 hua2guo4。yao4gao1 zai4 ni3 pi2fu1 shang4 de5 chu4gan3 qing1liang2 er2 you2ni4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3。dan4 shuo1dao4di3，zhe4 bing4 bu4 zhong4yao4……wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3men5 dou1 yao4 sha1 dao4 na4ge5 shen2kan1 jing1hun2 de5 mian4qian2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She dips her finger back into the balm and traces it down your forehead. The ointment feels cool and oily on your skin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you're feeling nervous, deal with it. We have to face what's ahead of us, whether we want to or not."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​把​手指​重新​蘸​入​药膏​，​沿着​你​的​额头​划过​。​药膏​在​你​皮肤​上​的​触感​清凉​而​油腻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​感到​紧张​，​就​自己​想​办法​消化​掉​。​无论​是否​愿意​，​我们​总归​要​面对​前方​的​挑战​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shou3zhi3 chong2xin1 zhan4 ru4 yao4gao1，yan2zhe5 ni3 de5 e2tou2 hua2guo4。yao4gao1 zai4 ni3 pi2fu1 shang4 de5 chu4gan3 qing1liang2 er2 you2ni4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 gan3dao4 jin3zhang1，jiu4 zi4ji3 xiang3 ban4fa3 xiao1hua4 diao4。wu2lun4 shi4fou3 yuan4yi4，wo3men5 zong3gui1 yao4 mian4dui4 qian2fang1 de5 tiao3zhan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She dips her finger back into the balm and traces it down your forehead. The ointment feels cool and oily on your skin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Probably not. But it's what we're here for. \n"
"\n"
"Harrow's shrine, and the spirit trapped inside of it, are standing between us and what we're trying to do. So we deal with them, whether we want to or not."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​把​手指​重新​蘸​入​药膏​，​沿着​你​的​额头​划过​。​药膏​在​你​皮肤​上​的​触感​清凉​而​油腻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大概​不会​。​但​这​正是​我们​来此​的​目的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​的​神龛​，​以及​被困​其中​的​精魂​，​正​拦住​了​我们​完成​目标​的​前路​。​所以​无论​是否​愿意​，​我们​总归​要​对付​它们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shou3zhi3 chong2xin1 zhan4 ru4 yao4gao1，yan2zhe5 ni3 de5 e2tou2 hua2guo4。yao4gao1 zai4 ni3 pi2fu1 shang4 de5 chu4gan3 qing1liang2 er2 you2ni4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 bu4hui4。dan4 zhe4 zheng4shi4 wo3men5 lai2 ci3 de5 mu4di4。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 de5 shen2kan1，yi3ji2 bei4kun4 qi2zhong1 de5 jing1hun2，zheng1 lan2zhu4 le5 wo3men5 wan2cheng2 mu4biao1 de5 qian2lu4。suo3yi3 wu2lun4 shi4fou3 yuan4yi4，wo3men5 zong3gui1 yao4 dui4fu5 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She dips her finger back into the balm and traces it down your forehead. The ointment feels cool and oily on your skin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's good, because we don't have another one."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​把​手指​重新​蘸​入​药膏​，​沿着​你​的​额头​划过​。​药膏​在​你​皮肤​上​的​触感​清凉​而​油腻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那就好​，​因为​我们​也​没有​其他​计划​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shou3zhi3 chong2xin1 zhan4 ru4 yao4gao1，yan2zhe5 ni3 de5 e2tou2 hua2guo4。yao4gao1 zai4 ni3 pi2fu1 shang4 de5 chu4gan3 qing1liang2 er2 you2ni4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 hao3，yin1wei4 wo3men5 ye3 mei2you3 qi2ta1 ji4hua4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She dips her hand into the secret compartment one more time.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just a second, I think that there might be--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​一次​把手​伸进​秘密​隔段​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​稍​等​，​我​觉得​可能​还有​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 yi1ci4 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 mi4mi4 ge2 duan4 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shao1 deng3，wo3 jue2de5 ke3neng2 hai2you3 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She dips her hand into the secret compartment one more time.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, not that I can--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​一次​把手​伸进​秘密​隔段​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​应该​没​了​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 yi1ci4 ba3shou3 shen1 jin4 mi4mi4 ge2 duan4 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 ying1gai1 mei2 le5 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She does not look amused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for wasting my time.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Without another word, she turns back to her work, ignoring you.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看起来​很​不​高兴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​感谢​你​浪费​我​的​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​一言不发​地转​回身​继续​工作​，​不再​搭理​你​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 bu4 gao1xing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 lang4fei4 wo3 de5 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 zhuai3 hui2 shen1 ji4xu4 gong1zuo4，bu4zai4 da1li5 ni3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She doesn't even bother looking over this time.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Seriously. I'm on a tight schedule here.\n"
"\n"
"Leave me alone, or I'm calling security."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​这次​她​甚至​都​懒得​抬​眼看​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说真的​。​我​在​赶时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别来​烦​我​，​不然​我​就​叫​人来​抓​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4 ci4 ta1 shen4zhi4 dou1 lan3de5 tai2 yan3kan4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1zhen1de5。wo3 zai4 gan3shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3，bu4ran2 wo3 jiu4 jiao4 ren2 lai2 zhua1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She drops a hand to the satchel at her side.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can help you to be that again. All that you need to do is let me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​将​一只​手​按​在​身侧​的​挎包​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可以​帮助​你​再​一次​变​回​原样​。​只要​你​愿意​让​我​施以援​手​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 yi1 zhi3 shou3 an4 zai4 shen1 ce4 de5 kua4bao1 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 bang1zhu4 ni3 zai4 yi1ci4 bian4 hui2 yuan2yang4。zhi3yao4 ni3 yuan4yi4 rang4 wo3 shi1 yi3 yuan2 shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She examines her fingernails.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I lifted the veil.\n"
"\n"
"I showed him my true face, and destroyed his mind."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​端详​着​自己​的​指甲​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​掀起​了​面纱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​他​展示​了​自己​的​真容​，​从而​摧毁​了​他​的​心智​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 duan1xiang2 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 zhi3jia5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian1qi3 le5 mian4sha1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ta1 zhan3shi4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 zhen1rong2，cong2er2 cui1hui3 le5 ta1 de5 xin1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She examines the grenade with a critical eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks like typical Russian engineering... clunky, but functional. If I took this thing apart, I bet that I could figure out how they made it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​仔细检查​着​手雷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​像是​典型​的​俄罗斯​工程设计​……​笨重​，​但​实用​。​如果​我​拆开​这个​东西​，​我​肯定​能​弄清楚​他们​是​怎么​做​出来​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zi3 xi4 jian3 cha2 zhao2 shou3lei2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 dian3xing2 de5 e2luo2si1 gong1 cheng2 she4 ji4……ben4zhong4，dan4 shi2yong4。ru2guo3 wo3 chai1kai1 zhe4ge5 dong1xi1，wo3 ken3ding4 neng2 long4 qing1 chu3 ta1men5 shi4 zen3me5 zuo4 chu1lai2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She exhales like the wind just got knocked out of her.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm glad that worked out okay. \n"
"\n"
"That's my home kiez, you know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​深吸​一口气​，​仿佛​刚刚​要​窒息​一样​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​高兴​是​这个​结果​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那里​是​我​的​故乡​街区​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，fang3fu2 gang1gang5 yao4 zhi4xi1 yi1yang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 shi4 zhe4ge5 jie1guo3。\n"
"\n"
"na4li5 shi4 wo3 de5 gu4xiang1 jie1qu1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She eyes you coolly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​冷冷地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 leng3 leng3 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She favors you with a motherly smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sure thing, honey."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​向​你​露出​母亲​一样​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​客气​，​亲爱​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 mu3qin1 yi1yang4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 ke4qi5，qin1ai4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She fishes in her bag a second time and pulls out a pair of silver necklaces. A rune-inscribed pendant dangles from each.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This will protect your astral self from spiritual possession. Don't take it off while we're dealing with the shrine, whatever you do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​再次​将​手​伸进​挎包​里​。​这次​她​掏出​了​一对​银色​项链​，​并且​各​带有​一个​刻有​符文​的​吊​坠​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这能​保护​你​的​灵体​免受​精魂​附身​。​等​我们​面对​神龛​的​时候​，​无论​发生​什么​都​不要​摘下来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zai4ci4 jiang1 shou3 shen1 jin4 kua4bao1 li3。zhe4 ci4 ta1 tao1chu1 le5 yi1dui4 yin2se4 xiang4lian4，bing4qie3 ge4 dai4you3 yi1ge5 ke4 you3 fu2wen2 de5 diao4 zhui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 neng2 bao3hu4 ni3 de5 ling2ti3 mian3shou4 jing1hun2 fu4shen1。deng3 wo3men5 mian4dui4 shen2kan1 de5 shi2hou5，wu2lun4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 dou1 bu4yao4 zhai1 xia4 lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She fishes in her bag for a moment, then produces a thick plastic keycard. She hands it to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This'll get you into the utility tunnel. Danni went down there about a half an hour ago."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​在​自己​的​包里​翻找​了​一阵​，​然后​掏出​一张​厚实​的​塑料​门禁卡​递给​了​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​用​这个​进入​综合​管廊​。​丹妮​大概​是​在​半小时​前​下去​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zai4 zi4ji3 de5 bao1 li3 fan1 zhao3 le5 yi1zhen4，ran2hou4 tao1chu1 yi1 zhang1 hou4shi5 de5 su4liao4 men2 jin1 ka3 di4gei3 le5 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 yong4 zhe4ge5 jin4ru4 zong1he2 guan3 lang2。dan1 ni1 da4gai4 shi4 zai4 ban4xiao3shi2 qian2 xia4qu4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She fishes the amulet out of her blouse. It dangles on a golden chain, glinting in the firelight.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here. It's all yours."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​从​衬衫​里​掏出​护身符​。​它​悬挂​在​金链​上​，​在​炉火​的​映照​下​闪闪发亮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​。​归​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 chen4shan1 li3 tao1chu1 hu4shen1fu2。ta1 xuan2gua4 zai4 jin1 lian4 shang4，zai4 lu2huo3 de5 ying4zhao4 xia4 shan3 shan3 fa1 liang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3。gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She fixes you with an emotionless stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I was Harrow's right hand, remember?\n"
"\n"
"What do you think?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她面​无表情​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当时​是​哈罗​的​左右手​，​你​忘​了​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​觉得​答案​能​是​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 shi4 ha1luo2 de5 zuo3you4shou3，ni3 wang4 le5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 da2an4 neng2 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She flinches in agitation, but you hear the whispering again, and she calms herself. Her joyful smile widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing that happens here is without reason. Harrow is a great man - a *prophet.*\n"
"\n"
"When you meet him for yourself, you'll understand. He'll make you see."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​因​焦躁​而​有些​畏缩​，​但​当​你​再次​听见​低语​时​，​她​便​镇定​下来​。​那​欢欣​的​笑容​愈发​灿烂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​发生​的​一切​皆​有​缘由​。​哈罗​是​一位​伟人​，​一位​*​先知​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​你​亲眼见到​他​，​你​自然​会​明白​。​他会​让​你​看清​真相​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yin1 jiao1zao4 er2 you3xie1 wei4suo1，dan4 dang1 ni3 zai4ci4 ting1jian4 di1yu3 shi2，ta1 bian4 zhen4ding4 xia4lai5。na4 huan1xin1 de5 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 can4lan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 fa1sheng1 de5 yi1qie4 jie1 you3 yuan2you2。ha1luo2 shi4 yi1 wei4 wei3ren2，yi1 wei4*xian1zhi1*。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 ni3 qin1 yan3 jian4 dao4 ta1，ni3 zi4ran2 hui4 ming2bai5。ta1 hui4 rang4 ni3 kan4qing1 zhen1xiang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's possible, I suppose, but I doubt it. Yuli was a bastard, but he was a careful bastard.\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, we stopped them, whatever they're up to."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​吧​，​但​我​觉得​可能性​不​大​。​尤里​是​个​杂种​没错​，​但​他​同样​十分​谨慎​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​不管​他们​要​做​什么​，​我们​都​阻止​了​他们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 wo3 jue2de5 ke3neng2xing4 bu4 dai4。You2li3 shi4 ge4 za2zhong3 mei2cuo4，dan4 ta1 tong2yang4 shi2fen1 jin3shen4。\n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，bu4guan3 ta1men5 yao4 zuo4 shen2me5，wo3men5 dou1 zu3zhi3 le5 ta1men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So you keep saying. But I'll tell you again - nothing is wrong here. Whatever this is, wherever this power is coming from, I can control it.\n"
"\n"
"Look. I can turn this thing off and on like a switch."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​怎么​还​在​念叨​，​我​再​告诉​你​一遍​—​—​没有​不对劲​。​无论​这​股​力量​是​什么​，​来自​哪里​，​我​都​能​驾驭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​，​就​跟​开关​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zen3me5 hai2 zai4 nian4dao5，wo3 zai4 gao4su4 ni3 yi1bian4——mei2you3 bu4dui4jin4。wu2lun4 zhe4 gu3 li4liang5 shi4 shen2me5，lai2zi4 na3li3，wo3 dou1 neng2 jia4yu4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4，jiu4 gen1 kai1guan1 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. And he's already putting distance between himself and the Schönbuch Forest."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​蹙​起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​。​而且​他​已经​在​和​申布赫​森林​保持​距离​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cu4 qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。er2qie3 ta1 yi3jing1 zai4 he4 shen1 bu4 he4 sen1lin2 bao3chi2 ju4li2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She fumes at you, but only for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...You might be right."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​怒气冲冲​地瞪着​你​，​但​转瞬即逝​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​也许​你​是​对​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nu4qi4chong1chong1 de5 deng4 zhao2 ni3，dan4 zhuan3shun4ji2shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ye3xu3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gestures down at the dead body on the floor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Case in point. I figured they'd try to ambush you at the platform, so I high-tailed it out here and set up an ambush of my own."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​地上​的​尸体​比划​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就​比如​这​家伙​。​我​料想​他们​会​在​月台​伏击​你​，​所以​我​赶紧​跑​到​这里​，​设下​了​反​埋伏​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 di4shang5 de5 shi1ti3 bi3hua5 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4 bi3ru2 zhe4 jia1huo5。wo3 liao4xiang3 ta1men5 hui4 zai4 yue4tai2 fu2ji1 ni3，suo3yi3 wo3 gan3jin3 pao2 dao4 zhe4li3，she4 xia4 le5 fan3 mai2fu2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gestures toward the open door.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, step right on in and head to Mandy in reception. She'll get you logged in to the system so that you can clock in and out.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The janitor smiles at you warmly.{{/GM}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​指​了​指​打开​的​门​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​进去​之后​找​前台​的​曼迪​。​她​会​帮​你们​登录​系统​，​这样​你们​之后​就​能​打卡​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​向​你​露出​和煦​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi3 le5 zhi3 da3kai1 de5 men2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin4qu4 zhi1hou4 zhao3 qian2tai2 de5 man4 di2。ta1 hui4 bang1 ni3men5 deng1lu4 xi4tong3，zhe4yang4 ni3men5 zhi1hou4 jiu4 neng2 da3ka3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 he2xu4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gestures with her cigarette, the tip glowing red in the gloom.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I mostly visit your lovely little kiez between runs to restock and relax. It's a good place for that, nice and slow-paced. It's...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment to search for a word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Quaint."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​用​香烟​比​了​个​手势​，​烟头​在​阴暗​中闪​着​红光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​主要​是​在​每趟​差事​的​间隙​来​这片​可爱​的​小​街区​补给​和​放松​。​这​是​个​好​地方​，​环境优美​，​节奏​缓慢​。​可以​说​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​片刻​，​寻找​着​一个​合适​的​字眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​很​古朴​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 xiang1yan1 bi3 le5 ge4 shou3shi4，yan1tou2 zai4 yin1an4 zhong4 shan3 zhao2 hong2 guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhu3yao4 shi4 zai4 mei3 tang1 cha4shi4 de5 jian4xi4 lai2 zhe4 pian1 ke3ai4 de5 xiao3 jie1qu1 bu3ji3 he4 fang4song1。zhe4 shi4 ge4 hao3 di4fang1，huan2 jing4 you1 mei3，jie2zou4 huan3man4。ke3yi3 shuo1……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 pian4ke4，xun2zhao3 zhao2 yi1ge5 he2shi4 de5 zi4yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……hen3 gu3pu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gestures with her rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Cut the shit and start talking. What do you want, and why are you here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​用​步枪​指​了​指​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​废话​了​，​说​正题​。​你​想干什么​？​来​这里​有​什么​事​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 bu4qiang1 zhi3 le5 zhi3 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 fei4hua4 le5，shuo1 zheng1 ti2。ni3 xiang3 gan4 shen2 ma2？lai2 zhe4li3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gives a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It should. Marta was the bait that Harrow used to lure me here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​生硬​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​对​了​。​玛​尔塔​曾​是​哈罗​用来​引诱​我​到​这里​的​诱饵​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sheng1ying4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 dui4 le5。Ma3er3ta3 ceng2 shi4 ha1luo2 yong4lai2 yin3you4 wo3 dao4 zhe4li3 de5 you4er3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gives a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not mine. Harrow's. But she's the Marta from my story, yes."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​生硬​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​我​的​。​是​哈罗​的​。​不过​她​确实​是​我​故事​中​的​那个​玛​尔塔​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sheng1ying4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 wo3 de5。shi4 ha1luo2 de5。bu4guo4 ta1 que4shi2 shi4 wo3 gu4shi4 zhong4 de5 na4ge5 Ma3er3ta3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gives a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's right. Marta.\n"
"\n"
"The bait that Harrow used to draw me to this place."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​生硬​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​。​玛​尔塔​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​曾​用来​引诱​我​到​这里​的​诱饵​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sheng1ying4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4。Ma3er3ta3。\n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 ceng2 yong4lai2 yin3you4 wo3 dao4 zhe4li3 de5 you4er3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gives you a brusque nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right. It isn't. No more moping about - I promise. And I *will* look into this, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Wherever this trail leads me, I'll follow it, and I won't stop until I find the truth."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​生硬​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​。​我​不会​再​为此​唉声叹气​了​，​我​发誓​。​我​*​必将​*​追查​下去​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论​结果​如何​，​我​都​会​追查​下去​，​直到​找出​真相​为止​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sheng1ying4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 wei4ci3 ai1sheng1tan4qi4 le5，wo3 fa1shi4。wo3*bi4jiang1*zhui1cha2 xia4qu4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4 jie1guo3 ru2he2，wo3 dou1 hui4 zhui1cha2 xia4qu4，zhi2dao4 zhao3chu1 zhen1xiang4 wei2zhi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gives you a curt nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar and gear up.\n"
"\n"
"We've got a castle to raid."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​微微​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​做好​准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​去​攻占​一座​城堡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 wei1wei1 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 qu4 gong1zhan4 yi1 zuo4 cheng2bao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gives you a sidelong glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm fine, $(l.name). But we need to get moving... things are spilling through from the other side, like rats fleeing a sinking ship.\n"
"\n"
"And besides, we still have Harrow - the *real* Harrow - to kill."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​侧目​瞥​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没事​，​$(l.name)​。​但​我们​得​赶快​行动​了​……​异界​的​造物​正像​沉船​上​慌不择路​的​老鼠​一样​疯狂​地​涌入​现实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再说​了​，​我们​还​得​解决​哈罗​—​—​那个​*​真正​*​的​哈罗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ce4mu4 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2shi4，$(l.name)。dan4 wo3men5 de2 gan3kuai4 xing2dong4 le5……yi4 jie4 de5 zao4wu4 zheng1 xiang4 chen2chuan2 shang4 huang1 bu4 ze2 lu4 de5 lao3shu3 yi1yang4 feng1kuang2 de5 yong3ru4 xian4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"zai4shuo1 le5，wo3men5 hai2 de2 jie3jue2 ha1luo2——na4ge5*zhen1zheng4*de5 ha1luo2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gives you a sidelong glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're getting what we wanted. Harrow - the real Harrow - isn't far from here, and he isn't in shape to put up much of a fight. But we need to get moving... things are spilling through from the other side, like rats fleeing a sinking ship."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​侧目​瞥​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​目标​近在咫尺​。​哈罗​—​—​那个​真正​的​哈罗​—​—​就​在​附近​，​而且​已经​无力​反抗​。​但​我们​得​立即行动​……​异界​的​造物​正像​沉船​上​慌不择路​的​老鼠​一样​疯狂​地​涌入​现实​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ce4mu4 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mu4biao1 jin4zai4zhi3chi3。ha1luo2——na4ge5 zhen1zheng4 de5 ha1luo2——jiu4 zai4 fu4jin4，er2qie3 yi3jing1 wu2li4 fan3kang4。dan4 wo3men5 de2 li4 ji2 xing2 dong4……yi4 jie4 de5 zao4wu4 zheng1 xiang4 chen2chuan2 shang4 huang1 bu4 ze2 lu4 de5 lao3shu3 yi1yang4 feng1kuang2 de5 yong3ru4 xian4shi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She gives you a withering look.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You really have no idea what it's like out there for people like us, do you?\n"
"\n"
"You have the luxury of remaining unenhanced. Dull. Slow."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​投来​一个​鄙夷​的​眼神​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​根本​不​懂​我们​这样​的​人​在​外面​的​处境​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​像​你​这样​的​人​倒也不​需要​什么​增强​。​迟钝​。​迟缓​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tou2 lai2 yi1ge5 bi3yi2 de5 yan3shen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1ben3 bu4 dong3 wo3men5 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2 zai4 wai4mian4 de5 chu3jing4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"xiang4 ni3 zhe4yang4 de5 ren2 dao3 ye3 bu4 xu1yao4 shen2me5 zeng1qiang2。chi2dun4。chi2huan3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She glances around the facility before looking you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't think there's anything else for us here. Let's go home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​环顾​设施​四周​，​然后​又​对​上​你​的​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​在​这​的​事情​已经​结束​了​。​我们​回家吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan2gu4 she4shi1 si4zhou1，ran2hou4 you4 dui4 shang4 ni3 de5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zai4 zhe4 de5 shi4qing5 yi3jing1 jie2shu4 le5。wo3men5 hui2 jia1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She glances at the encoded credstick in her hand again, checking the balance. Her smile broadens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You helped me when no one else would. That means a lot.\n"
"\n"
"Enjoy the money... you earned it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​瞟​了​一眼​手里​的​加密​信用​棒​，​查​了​下​里面​的​余额​。​这下​她​笑​得​更加​灿烂​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别人​都​在​看笑话​，​你​却​帮​了​我​的​忙​。​我​真的​很​感激​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这笔​钱​，​你​尽管​拿​去​花​……​这​是​你​应得​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 piao3 le5 yi1yan3 shou3li3 de5 jia1mi4 xin4yong4 bang4，cha2 le5 xia4 li3mian4 de5 yu2e2。zhe4xia4 ta1 xiao4 de2 geng4jia1 can4lan4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie2ren5 dou1 zai4 kan4xiao4hua5，ni3 que4 bang1 le5 wo3 de5 mang2。wo3 zhen1de5 hen3 gan3ji1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bi3 qian2，ni3 jin3guan3 na2 qu4 hua1……zhe4 shi4 ni3 ying1de2 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She glances at the item on the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looking at the new Encephalon, huh? Good choice. Our regional supervisor has one, and it is *amazing.* Totally worth the price!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​瞥​了​一眼​屏幕​上​的​商品​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​想要​新款​脑接​吗​？​有​眼光​。​我们​的​区域​主管​有​一台​，​效果​简直​*​惊艳​*​。​绝对​物有所值​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 ping2mu4 shang4 de5 shang1pin3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiang3yao4 xin1kuan3 nao3 jie1 ma5？you3 yan3guang1。wo3men5 de5 qu1yu4 zhu3guan3 you3 yi1 tai2，xiao4guo3 jian3zhi2*jing1yan4*。jue2dui4 wu4 you3 suo3 zhi2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She glances at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"An aerosol BZD, to help treat the seizures. Bannik was kind enough to include it in his goody bag.\n"
"\n"
"It won't last long, but it should give Yuli here enough muscular control to answer a few questions."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​瞥​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一种​气溶胶​镇静剂​，​用于​帮助​治疗​癫痫​发作​。​班尼克​塞​在​包​里面​当作​随礼​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​效力​不会​持续​太久​，​但​应该​能​让​这位​尤里​获得​足够​的​肌肉​控制力​，​来​回答​我们​几个​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1zhong3 qi4rong2jiao1 zhen4jing4ji4，yong4yu2 bang1zhu4 zhi4liao2 dian1xian2 fa1zuo4。ban1 ni2 ke4 se4 zai4 bao1 li3mian4 dang4zuo4 sui2 li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"xiao4li4 bu4hui4 chi2xu4 tai4 jiu3，dan4 ying1gai1 neng2 rang4 zhe4wei4 You2li3 huo4de2 zu2gou4 de5 ji1rou4 kong4 zhi4 li4，lai2 hui2da2 wo3men5 ji3ge5 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She glances away briefly before returning her gaze to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose I can tell you. If the Monika thing was a secret of yours, it's only fair I share one of my own."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​短暂​地​移开​视线​，​随后​又​将​目光​投向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​我​可以​告诉​你​。​如果​莫妮卡​的​事​是​你​的​秘密​，​那​公平​起​见​，​我​也​应该​进行​交换​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 duan3zan4 de5 yi2kai1 shi4xian4，sui2hou4 you4 jiang1 mu4guang1 tou2 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 wo3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3。ru2guo3 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 shi4 shi4 ni3 de5 mi4mi4，na4 gong1ping2 qi3 jian4，wo3 ye3 ying1gai1 jin4xing2 jiao1huan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She glances away furtively, apparently remembering something, before beaming back at you.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"You'd be surprised what I've seen, even before I started being an intel hound."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​偷偷​移开​视线​，​似乎​想起​了​什么​，​然后​又​开心​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可能​会​惊讶​于​我​所​见​过​的​，​即使​是​那些​在​我​成为​情报​专家​之前​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tou1tou1 yi2kai1 shi4xian4，si4hu1 xiang3qi3 le5 shen2me5，ran2hou4 you4 kai1xin1 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3neng2 hui4 jing1ya4 yu2 wo3 suo3 jian4 guo4 de5，ji2shi3 shi4 na4xie1 zai4 wo3 cheng2wei2 qing2bao4 zhuan1jia1 zhi1qian2 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She glances back up at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes? Go on, then, I'm listening."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​抬头​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​？​那​你​说​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1？na4 ni3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She glances down at the MKVI's body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's load the body into the van. Herr Schmidt won't be happy, but the hell with him... he never said that the MKVI had to be returned alive."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​低头​瞥​了​一眼​MKVI​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​把​这具​尸体​塞进​车里​吧​。​施密特​先生​肯定​不会​对此​感到高兴​，​但是​管​他​呢​……​反正​他​也​没​说​要​把​MKVI​活着​带回去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 MKVI de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 ba3 zhe4 ju4 shi1ti3 se4 jin4 che1 li3 ba1。shi1mi4Te4xian1sheng5 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 dui4 ci3 gan3 dao4 gao1 xing4，dan4shi4 guan3 ta1 ni2……fan3zheng4 ta1 ye3 mei2 shuo1 yao4 ba3 MKVI huo2zhe5 dai4 hui2 qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She goes from looking shocked to aghast. Then her cheeks flush red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Feuerstelle belongs to Harrow, Glory. You know that.\n"
"\n"
"Everything here is *his.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​表情​从​震惊​转为​目瞪口呆​，​随后​立刻​涨红​了​双颊​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​火坑​”​属于​哈罗​，​格洛丽​。​你​知道​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​的​一切都是​*​他​的​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 cong2 zhen4jing1 zhuai3 wei2 mu4deng4kou3dai1，sui2hou4 li4ke4 zhang4hong2 le5 shuang1 jia2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“huo3keng1” shu3yu2 ha1luo2，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 zhi1dao4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 de5 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4*ta1 de5*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grinds her teeth, but says nothing. Eventually, she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right, of course. It was my choice.\n"
"\n"
"But that doesn't change what *she* is, or what she did to me. If she hadn't found me - hadn't *baited* me here - none of this would have happened."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咬紧牙关​，​却​一言不发​。​最终​，​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​。​这​当然​是​我​自己​的​选择​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​并​不会​改变​*​她​*​的​身份​，​以及​她​对​我​做​过​的​事情​。​如果​不是​她​找到​我​……​如果​不是​她​*​引诱​*​我​……​这​一切​都​不会​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1，que4 yi1yan2bu4fa1。zui4zhong1，ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。zhe4 dang1ran2 shi4 wo3 zi4ji3 de5 xuan3ze2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 bing4 bu4hui4 gai3bian4*ta1*de5 shen1fen4，yi3ji2 ta1 dui4 wo3 zuo4 guo4 de5 shi4qing5。ru2guo3 bu4shi4 ta1 zhao3dao4 wo3……ru2guo3 bu4shi4 ta1*yin3you4*wo3……zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 bu4hui4 fa1sheng1。"

