"​噢​，​你​肯定​猜出来​了​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 jiao3xia2 de5 yi1 xiao4，bing4 pao1 le5 ge4 mei4yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1，ni3 ken3ding4 cai1 chu1 lai2 le5 ba1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grins and winks lasciviously at you.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Oh, surely you've guessed!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​冲​你​狡黠​地一笑​，​并​抛​了​个​媚眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​，​你​肯定​猜出来​了​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 jiao3xia2 de5 yi1 xiao4，bing4 pao1 le5 ge4 mei4yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1，ni3 ken3ding4 cai1 chu1 lai2 le5 ba1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grins and winks lasciviously at you.{{/GM}} Oh, surely you've "
"guessed!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​冲​你​狡黠​地一笑​，​并​抛​了​个​媚眼​。​{{/GM}}​噢​，​你​肯定​猜出来​了​吧​！\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 jiao3xia2 de5 yi1 xiao4，bing4 pao1 le5 ge4 mei4yan3。{{/GM}} o1，ni3 ken3ding4 cai1 chu1 lai2 le5 ba1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grins at you, all spark and mischief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey there! How've ya been?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​冲​你​咧嘴一笑​，​满是​灵动​与​俏皮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​！​最近​如何​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，man3 shi4 ling2dong4 yu4 qiao4pi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3！zui4jin4 ru2he2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grins at you, all spark and mischief.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey there, love! I'm real busy right now - but we should definitely go out for hookah later. Call me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​冲​你​咧嘴一笑​，​满是​灵动​与​俏皮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​宝贝儿​！​我​现在​正忙着​呢​，​不过​我们​回头​可以​边​抽水​烟边​聊聊​。​有空​联系​我​哦​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，man3 shi4 ling2dong4 yu4 qiao4pi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，bao3bei4r5！wo3 xian4zai4 zheng1 mang2 zhao2 ni2，bu4guo4 wo3men5 hui2tou2 ke3yi3 bian1 chou1shui3 yan1 bian1 liao2 liao2。you3kong4 lian2xi4 wo3 e2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm glad that we're both on the same page. And I mean that... I'm really, genuinely glad.\n"
"\n"
"You get me, $(l.name). More than anyone else on the team, you understand what makes me tick. I hope that you know how much that means to me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​高兴​我们​能​达成​共识​，​我​是​说真的​……​我​感到​很​高兴​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​你​是​队伍​里​最​懂​我​的​，​你​知道​该​怎么​给​我​鼓劲​，​这​对​我​来说​很​重要​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 wo3men5 neng2 da2cheng2 gong4shi2，wo3 shi4 shuo1zhen1de5……wo3 gan3dao4 hen3 gao1xing4。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，ni3 shi4 dui4wu3 li3 zui4 dong3 wo3 de5，ni3 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5 gei3 wo3 gu3 jin4，zhe4 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It’s educational."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​能​学到​东西​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"neng2 xue2dao4 dong1xi1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"“Wyrm Talk” is on tonight."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​今晚​不是​有​《​巨龙​夜话​》​嘛​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 bu4shi4 you3 《 ju4long2 ye4 hua4 》 ma5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grits her teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I hate being in this position."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咬咬牙​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真​讨厌​面对​这种​情况​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3 yao3 ya2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1 tao3yan4 mian4dui4 zhe4zhong3 qing2kuang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She grits her teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right, I was out of line. I shouldn't be taking this out on you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咬紧牙关​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​，​我​确实​过分​了​。​我​不该​把​气​撒​在​你​身上​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，wo3 que4shi2 guo4fen4 le5。wo3 bu4gai1 ba3 qi4 sa1 zai4 ni3 shen1shang5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She half-turns away from the camera, then returns her attention to you. The image is uncannily lifelike.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and by the way, ace... if you botch this, I'm coming back and haunting your ass. I mean that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​正​欲​转身​离开​镜头​，​突然​又​将​注意力​集中​回​你​身上​。​这​幅​画面​逼真​到​令人​毛骨悚然​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​王牌​……​你​要是​把​事情​搞砸​了​，​那​我​做鬼​也​不放过​你​。​我​说到做到​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zheng1 yu4 zhuan3shen1 li2kai1 jing4tou2，tu1ran2 you4 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 ji2zhong1 hui2 ni3 shen1shang5。zhe4 fu2 hua4mian4 bi1zhen1 dao4 ling4ren2 mao2gu3song3ran2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，wang2pai2……ni3 yao4shi5 ba3 shi4qing5 gao3za2 le5，na4 wo3 zuo4gui3 ye3 bu4 fang4 guo4 ni3。wo3 shuo1dao4zuo4dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She heaves a sigh, and the corners of her mouth dip down.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've been fighting that conclusion for a long time. But you're right, of course.\n"
"\n"
"I haven't been a soldier for a long time. I'm a murderer for hire. It's time that I accepted it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​叹​了​口气​，​嘴角​微微​下垂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​抗拒​这个​结论​很久​了​。​但​你​说​得​也​确实​没错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​早已​不是​士兵​。​我​只是​个​佣兵​杀手​。​是​时候​接受​这个​事实​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，zui3jiao3 wei1wei1 xia4chui2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 kang4ju4 zhe4ge5 jie2lun4 hen3 jiu3 le5。dan4 ni3 shuo1 de2 ye3 que4shi2 mei2cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zao3yi3 bu4shi4 shi4bing1。wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 yong1bing1 sha1shou3。shi4 shi2hou5 jie1shou4 zhe4ge5 shi4shi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She holds her head clasped in both hands. A tortured expression has overtaken her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please. Just go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​双手​抱头​，​脸上​尽​是​痛苦​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​求​你​了​。​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang1shou3 bao4tou2，lian3 shang4 jin3 shi4 tong4ku3 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiu2 ni3 le5。zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She holds her head in her hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​双手​掩面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang1shou3 yan3 mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She holds her head in her hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It lives?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​双手​掩面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​在​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang1shou3 yan3 mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2 zai4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She holds her head in her hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is over?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​双手​掩面​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一切​尚未​结束​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shuang1shou3 yan3 mian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1qie4 shang4wei4 jie2shu4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She holds her silence for a moment, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Yes, I do.\n"
"\n"
"In truth, I'm in desperate need of your help."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​沉默​了​一会儿​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​准确​来说​，​我​目前​正​急需​你​的​帮助​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"zhun3que4 lai2 shuo1，wo3 mu4qian2 zheng1 ji2xu1 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She holds the object up for your inspection.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This, my friend, is a pulse grenade. The last I heard, the Russian military were developing them as crowd dispersal devices, but that was years ago.\n"
"\n"
"Looks like Yuli kept a memento of his time in the Spetsnaz."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​把​那​东西​举​起来​给​你​看​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​朋友​，​这是​脉冲​手雷​。​据我所知​，​俄罗斯​军队​研发​了​这​东西​用于​驱散​人群​，​但​那​已经​是​许多年​前​的​事​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​尤里​保留​了​他​在​特种部队​服役​时​的​一件​纪念品​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 na4 dong1xi1 ju3 qi3lai5 gei3 ni3 kan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"peng2you5，zhe4 shi4 mai4chong1 shou3lei2。ju4wo3suo3zhi1，e2luo2si1 jun1dui4 yan2fa1 le5 zhe4 dong1xi1 yong4yu2 qu1san4 ren2qun2，dan4 na4 yi3jing1 shi4 xu3 duo1 nian2 qian2 de5 shi4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 You2li3 bao3liu2 le5 ta1 zai4 te4zhong3bu4dui4 fu2yi4 shi2 de5 yi1 jian4 ji4nian4pin3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She jerks her head in the direction of a biometric fingerprint scanner set into the door frame.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you want in this door, you're going to have to clock in like everyone else."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​把头​转向​门框​上​的​生物​指纹​扫描仪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​进门​的话​，​就​得​和​其他人​一样​打卡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3tou2 zhuan3xiang4 men2kuang4 shang4 de5 sheng1wu4 zhi3wen2 sao3miao2yi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 jin4men2 de5hua4，jiu4 de2 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 yi1yang4 da3ka3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She kneels beside him to inspect the damage.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can fix this. He'll need a trip to the hospital, but I can get him on his feet."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​跪​在​他​的​身边​检查​伤势​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​交给​我​吧​。​他​还是​得​去​趟​医院​，​但​我​起码​能​让​他​先站​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 gui4 zai4 ta1 de5 shen1bian1 jian3cha2 shang1shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiao1gei3 wo3 ba1。ta1 hai2shi5 de2 qu4 tang1 yi1yuan4，dan4 wo3 qi3ma3 neng2 rang4 ta1 xian1 zhan4 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She laughs a little and takes a swig.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not to say you're rich! But, if that’s who’s got your stuff, this is as far away from medieval England as you’re gonna get."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​笑了笑​，​又​喝​了​口​酒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​你​要​找​什么​飞贼​的话​，​在​这​下面​的​破​地方​可​逮​不到​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 xiao4，you4 he4 le5 kou3 jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ni3 yao4 zhao3 shen2me5 fei1zei2 de5hua4，zai4 zhe4 xia4mian4 de5 po4 di4fang1 ke3 dai3 bu4dao4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She laughs a little and takes a swig.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, if that’s who’s got your stuff, this is as far away from medieval England as you’re gonna get."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​笑了笑​，​又​喝​了​口​酒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​乌鸦​可​都​在​天上飞​呢​，​在​这​下面​的​破​地方​可​逮​不到​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5 xiao4，you4 he4 le5 kou3 jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 wu1ya1 ke3 dou1 zai4 tian1 shang4 fei1 ni2，zai4 zhe4 xia4mian4 de5 po4 di4fang1 ke3 dai3 bu4dao4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She laughs.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"I can't pull a fast one on you can I? "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​我​还是​骗​不过​你​啊​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 wo3 hai2shi5 pian4 bu4guo4 ni3 a1？"

msgid "{{GM}}She laughs.{{/GM}} I can't pull a fast one on you can I? "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​看来​我​还是​骗​不过​你​啊​？\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} kan4lai5 wo3 hai2shi5 pian4 bu4guo4 ni3 a1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She leafs through the pages with an articulated finger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks like he's expanded it over the last few years. It's at least twice as thick as it was when I lived here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​用​铰接​的​手指​翻阅​着​书页​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​他​在​过去​的​几年​里​给​这​本书​增加​了​不少​段落​。​现在​它​的​厚度​至少​是​我​那​时候​的​两倍​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 jiao3 jie1 de5 shou3zhi3 fan1yue4 zhao2 shu1ye4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 ta1 zai4 guo4qu4 de5 ji3nian2 li3 gei3 zhe4 ben3 shu1 zeng1jia1 le5 bu4shao3 duan4luo4。xian4zai4 ta1 de5 hou4du4 zhi4shao3 shi4 wo3 na4 shi2hou5 de5 liang3bei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She leans in and looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I want you to bring the building down."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​凑近​过来​，​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​你​炸掉​整座​大楼​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cou4jin4 guo4lai2，ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ni3 zha4diao4 zheng3 zuo4 da4lou2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She leans in for a whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They're just down the street, in the warehouse with the grass in front. New guy showed up a few days ago, seems like a bigwig. They've been moving product through there ever since. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​凑近​低声​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​就​在​街角​的​仓库​里​，​前面​有片​草地​的​那个​。​几天​前来​了​个​新面孔​，​看起来​像是​大人物​。​从那以后​，​他们​一直​通过​那里​运输​货物​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cou4jin4 di1sheng1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 jiu4 zai4 jie1 jiao3 de5 cang1ku4 li3，qian2mian4 you3 pian1 cao3di4 de5 na4ge5。ji3tian1 qian2lai2 le5 ge4 xin1 mian4 kong3，kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 dai4 ren2 wu4。cong2 na4 yi3 hou4，ta1men5 yi1zhi2 tong1guo4 na4li5 yun4shu1 huo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She leans in to stare into the camera. On the screen, you can see that her eyes are badly bloodshot.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And stay out of the Matrix, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"It isn't safe."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​凑近​身子​盯​着​镜头​。​透过​屏幕​，​你​能​看到​她​的​双眼​布满​血丝​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​一定​不要​靠近​矩阵​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​并​不​安全​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cou4jin4 shen1zi5 ding1 zhao2 jing4tou2。tou4guo4 ping2mu4，ni3 neng2 kan4dao4 ta1 de5 shuang1yan3 bu4man3 xue4si1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 yi1ding4 bu4yao4 kao4jin4 ju3zhen4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 bing4 bu4 an1quan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She lets loose a short, musical laugh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, maybe not *exactly* like this, but... you get the idea."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​发出​一阵​短促​而​悦耳​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​也许​不​*​完全​*​是​像​现在​这样​，​但​……​你​明白​我​的​意思​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 yi1zhen4 duan3cu4 er2 yue4er3 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，ye3xu3 bu4*wan2quan2*shi4 xiang4 xian4zai4 zhe4yang4，dan4……ni3 ming2bai5 wo3 de5 yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She locks eyes with you. Her expression is blank.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't want to mislead you, $(l.name). I still don't feel anything... not warmth, or friendship, or even trust."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​与​你​四目​相对​。​她​的​表情​一片空白​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​误导​你​，​$(l.name)​。​我​依然​毫无​感觉​……​没有​温暖​，​没有​友谊​，​甚至​没有​信任​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yu4 ni3 si4 mu4 xiang1dui4。ta1 de5 biao3qing2 yi1 pian1 kong1 bai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 wu4dao3 ni3，$(l.name)。wo3 yi1ran2 hao2wu2 gan3jue2……mei2you3 wen1nuan3，mei2you3 you3yi4，shen4zhi4 mei2you3 xin4ren4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks at the chip in her fingers, then down at the Engineer's trembling body. Slowly, a smile spreads across her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not unless he sweetens the deal.\n"
"\n"
"You hear that, Yuli? I'll give you what you want, but you need to make it worth my while."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看着​自己​指间​的​芯片​，​然后​又​低头​看看​工程师​颤抖​的​身体​。​一抹​笑容​慢慢​浮现​在​她​的​脸上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​除非​他​再​加点​码​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​听到​没​，​尤里​？​我​可以​把​这个​给​你​，​但​你​总​不能​让​我​吃亏​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 zhao2 zi4ji3 zhi3 jian1 de5 xin1pian4，ran2hou4 you4 di1tou2 kan4kan5 gong1cheng2shi1 chan4dou3 de5 shen1ti3。yi1 ma1 xiao4rong2 man4man4 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 de5 lian3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"chu2fei1 ta1 zai4 jia1dian3 ma3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ting1dao4 mei2，You2li3？wo3 ke3yi3 ba3 zhe4ge5 gei3 ni3，dan4 ni3 zong3 bu4neng2 rang4 wo3 chi1kui1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks at you expectantly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"... So?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​满怀​期待​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​所以​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man3huai2 qi1dai4 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……suo3yi3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks at you sadly. Longingly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Will you finish it, little $(l.race)? Will you end Feuerschwinge?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​悲伤​而​渴望​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​能​动手​吗​，​小​$(l.race)​？​你​能​结束​火翼​的​生命​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 bei1shang1 er2 ke3wang4 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 neng2 dong4shou3 ma5，xiao3 $(l.race)？ni3 neng2 jie2shu4 Huo3yi4 de5 sheng1ming4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks at you sharply.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"takecare, little $(l.name)\n"
"\n"
"take care"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​直勾勾​地​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​保重​小​$(l.name)​\n"
"​\n"
"​保重\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2gou1gou1 de5 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao3zhong4 xiao3 $(l.name) \n"
"\n"
"bao3zhong4"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks at you, and her eyes are dark. When she speaks again, her voice is quiet but steady.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're going to see some terrible things here, $(l.name). Feuerstelle exists to prey on the young, and we're going to have to come face to face with that.\n"
"\n"
"Are you sure that you're prepared for this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​凝视着​你​，​目光​暗沉​。​当​她​再次​开口​时​，​声音​平静​却​坚定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​将​在​这里​目睹​可怕​的​景象​，​$(l.name)​。​“​火坑​”​就是​以​年轻人​为​猎物​而​存在​的​，​而​我们​必须​直面​这个​残酷​现实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​确定​准备​好​面对​这​一切​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3，mu4guang1 an4 chen2。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 ping2jing4 que4 jian1ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jiang1 zai4 zhe4li3 mu4du3 ke3pa4 de5 jing3xiang4，$(l.name)。“huo3keng1” jiu4shi4 yi3 nian2qing1ren2 wei2 lie4wu4 er2 cun2zai4 de5，er2 wo3men5 bi4xu1 zhi2mian4 zhe4ge5 can2ku4 xian4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 que4ding4 zhun3bei4 hao3 mian4dui4 zhe4 yi1qie4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's talk about something else, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"I'd rather not dwell on this if I don't have to."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​移开​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​说些​别的​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​可能​的话​，​我​尽量​不想​聊​这个​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi2kai1 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shuo1 xie1 bie2de5 ba1，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ke3neng2 de5hua4，wo3 jin3liang4 bu4xiang3 liao2 zhe4ge5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks conflicted, but she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, I can't deny that.\n"
"\n"
"So what do you propose?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看起来​有些​矛盾​，​但​最后​还是​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​这​一点​我​不能​否认​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​打算​怎么​做​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 mao2dun4，dan4 zui4hou4 hai2shi5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，zhe4 yi1dian3 wo3 bu4neng2 fou3ren4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 da3suan4 zen3me5 zuo4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks confused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...No? But then, what were they talking about...?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看起来​很​困惑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​不是​吗​？​那​他们​到底​在​说​什么​呢​……​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hen3 kun4huo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……bu4shi4 ma5？na4 ta1men5 dao4di3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 ni2……？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks down and exhales, then the clouds leave her bright face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Listen, I have better things to do right now than get ticked. We'll chat later, okay?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​低下头​深吸​一口气​，​然后​阴云​又​离开​了​她​明媚​的​脸庞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​我​现在​还有​别的​事要​去​忙​。​回头​再聊​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1 xia4 tou2 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，ran2hou4 yin1yun2 you4 li2kai1 le5 ta1 ming2mei4 de5 lian3pang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3 xian4zai4 hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 qu4 mang2。hui2tou2 zai4 liao2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks down at Mira and smiles. Squeezes her hand tight.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. Thanks again for the rescue. We all owe you a lot.\n"
"\n"
"If there's ever anything that any of us can do for you, you just let us know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​低头​看​向​米拉​，​露出​微笑​，​也​紧​紧握着​她​的​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​再次​感谢​援助​。​我们​都​欠​你​个​大​人情​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​有​任何​事​需要​我们​当中​的​任何人​帮忙​的话​，​你​尽管​开口​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 di1tou2 kan4 xiang4 mi3la1，lu4chu1 wei1xiao4，ye3 jin3 jin3 wo4 zhao2 ta1 de5 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，zai4ci4 gan3xie4 yuan2zhu4。wo3men5 dou1 qian4 ni3 ge4 dai4 ren2qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 you3 ren4he2 shi4 xu1yao4 wo3men5 dang1zhong1 de5 ren4 he2 ren2 bang1mang2 de5hua4，ni3 jin3guan3 kai1kou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks from Dietrich, to Glory, to Amsel. Finally, down at Dante. Then she sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't agree with this decision. But I *will* respect it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​目光​从迪​特里​希​转向​格洛丽​，​再​到​阿姆​泽尔​。​最后​，​她​低头​看​向​但丁​，​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​同意​这个​决定​，​但​我​*​会​*​对此​表示​尊重​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 mu4guang1 cong2 Di2te4li3xi1 zhuan3xiang4 Ge2luo4li2，zai4 dao4 E1mu3ze2er3。zui4hou4，ta1 di1tou2 kan4 xiang4 dan4ding1，tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 tong2yi4 zhe4ge5 jue2ding4，dan4 wo3*hui4*dui4 ci3 biao3shi4 zun1zhong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks from Dietrich, to Glory, to Amsel. Finally, down at "
"Dante.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​的​目光​从迪​特里​希​转向​格洛丽​，​再​到​阿姆​泽尔​。​最后​，​她​低头​看​向​但丁​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 de5 mu4guang1 cong2 Di2te4li3xi1 zhuan3xiang4 Ge2luo4li2，zai4 dao4 E1mu3ze2er3。zui4hou4，ta1 di1tou2 kan4 xiang4 dan4ding1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks genuinely hurt.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Harrow and I rescued you from a life on the street!\n"
"\n"
"A beautiful girl, homeless, penniless, living in a gutter... I pulled you *away* from all of that! I *saved* you!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看起来​十分​伤心​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​和​我​把​你​从​风餐露宿​的​街头​生活​中救​了​出来​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​美丽​的​女孩​，​无家可归​，​身无分文​，​住​在​下水道​里​……​我​带​你​*​逃离​*​了​这​一切​！​我​*​救​了​*​你​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 shi2fen1 shang1xin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 he4 wo3 ba3 ni3 cong2 feng1can1lu4su4 de5 jie1tou2 sheng1huo2 zhong4 jiu4 le5 chu1lai2！\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 mei3li4 de5 nu:3hai2，wu2jia1ke3gui1，shen1wu2fen1wen2，zhu4 zai4 xia4shui3dao4 li3……wo3 dai4 ni3*tao2li2*le5 zhe4 yi1qie4！wo3*jiu4 le5*ni3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks genuinely hurt.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't \"trick\" anyone. Harrow and I rescued her from a life on the street!\n"
"\n"
"A beautiful girl, homeless, penniless, living in a gutter... I pulled her *away* from all of that! I *saved* her!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看起来​十分​伤心​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没有​“​欺骗​”​任何人​。​哈罗​和​我​把​她​从​风餐露宿​的​街头​生活​中救​了​出来​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​美丽​的​女孩​，​无家可归​，​身无分文​，​住​在​下水道​里​……​我​带​她​*​逃离​*​了​这​一切​！​我​*​救​了​*​她​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 shi2fen1 shang1xin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3“qi1pian4” ren4 he2 ren2。ha1luo2 he4 wo3 ba3 ta1 cong2 feng1can1lu4su4 de5 jie1tou2 sheng1huo2 zhong4 jiu4 le5 chu1lai2！\n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 mei3li4 de5 nu:3hai2，wu2jia1ke3gui1，shen1wu2fen1wen2，zhu4 zai4 xia4shui3dao4 li3……wo3 dai4 ta1*tao2li2*le5 zhe4 yi1qie4！wo3*jiu4 le5*ta1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks into your eyes, and you can feel your head swimming.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your kind fears what it can see. Corporations. Dragons. Violence, and poverty, and the random cruelty of fate.\n"
"\n"
"If you could perceive reality the way that I do, you would know that there are much greater things to fear."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​凝视着​你​的​双眼​，​让​你​感到​一阵​头晕目眩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​人类​只​畏惧​自己​所​能​看见​的​事物​。​公司​。​巨龙​。​暴力​、​贫困​，​以及​命运​的​无情​残酷​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​若​你​能​像​我​这般​感知​现实​，​便会​明白​世间​有着​更​值得​畏惧​的​存在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 shuang1yan3，rang4 ni3 gan3dao4 yi1zhen4 tou2yun1mu4xuan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 ren2lei4 zhi3 wei4ju4 zi4ji3 suo3 neng2 kan4jian4 de5 shi4wu4。gong1si1。ju4long2。bao4li4、pin2kun4，yi3ji2 ming4yun4 de5 wu2qing2 can2ku4。\n"
"\n"
"ruo4 ni3 neng2 xiang4 wo3 zhe4ban1 gan3zhi1 xian4shi2，bian4 hui4 ming2bai5 shi4jian1 you3zhe5 geng1 zhi2de5 wei4ju4 de5 cun2zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks momentarily conflicted. Then the moment passes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...No. Harrow said that I had to guard this. He told me that I could never take it off.\n"
"\n"
"I can't question one of Harrow's orders. It would be wrong."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​显得​有些​犹豫不决​，​但​又​转瞬即逝​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​不行​。​哈罗​说​我​必须​守​着​这个​。​他​告诉​我​永远​不能​摘下​它​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不能​质疑​哈罗​的​命令​。​那​是​不​对​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xian3de5 you3xie1 you2yu4bu4jue2，dan4 you4 zhuan3shun4ji2shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……bu4xing2。ha1luo2 shuo1 wo3 bi4xu1 shou3 zhao2 zhe4ge5。ta1 gao4su4 wo3 yong3yuan3 bu4neng2 zhai1xia4 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 zhi4yi2 ha1luo2 de5 ming4ling4。na4 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks up at you, desperate, pleading.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The sacrifices keep us safe here! That's what Harrow says! We *have* to do it!\n"
"\n"
"These kids... they deserve to be safe. Most of them have never been safe."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​抬头​望​着​你​，​眼神​里​充满​了​绝望​的​哀求​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​正是​这些​牺牲​守护​着​我们​的​安全​！​哈罗​就是​这么​说​的​！​我们​*​必须​*​这么​做​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​孩子​……​他们​值得​拥有​安全​。​这是​他们​中​的​大多数​人​从未​体验​过​的​奢侈​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2tou2 wang4 zhao2 ni3，yan3shen2 li3 chong1man3 le5 jue2wang4 de5 ai1qiu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zheng4shi4 zhe4xie1 xi1sheng1 shou3hu4 zhao2 wo3men5 de5 an1quan2！ha1luo2 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5！wo3men5*bi4xu1*zhe4me5 zuo4！\n"
"\n"
"zhe4Xie1hai2zi5……ta1men5 zhi2de5 yong1you3 an1quan2。zhe4 shi4 ta1men5 zhong4 de5 da4duo1shu4 ren2 cong2wei4 ti3yan4 guo4 de5 she1chi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks up at you, her expression guarded.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah? What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​抬头​看向​你​，​表情​戒备​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​？​你​想​干嘛​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，biao3qing2 jie4bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1？ni3 xiang3 gan4ma2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks up at you, with eyes too young for everything she's been through.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do you think they'd want to talk with me? The way Monika would."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​抬头​看向​你​，​仍然​稚嫩​的​双眼​中​却​已经​包含​沧桑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​觉得​他们​会​愿意​和​我​聊聊​吗​？​就​像​莫妮卡​曾​做​的​那样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，reng2ran2 zhi4nen4 de5 shuang1yan3 zhong4 que4 yi3jing1 bao1han2 cang1sang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jue2de5 ta1men5 hui4 yuan4yi4 he4 wo3 liao2 liao2 ma5？jiu4 xiang4 Mo4ni1ka3 ceng2 zuo4 de5 na4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks up from her comm, idly blowing a gum bubble and quickly popping it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hello again. I hear you've been busy."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​从​通讯​链上​抬起​头​，​漫不经心​地吹起​一个​口香糖​泡泡​，​然后​迅速​把​它​吹破​掉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​见面​了​。​听说​你​最近​很忙​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 tong1xun4 lian4 shang4 tai2qi3 tou2，man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 chui1 qi3 yi1ge5 kou3xiang1tang2 pao4pao5，ran2hou4 xun4su4 ba3 ta1 chui1 po4 diao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5。ting1shuo1 ni3 zui4jin4 hen3 mang2 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you dead in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You really wanna tell me that we can't spare the time to stop all of that? That you don't think it's *important* enough?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​直勾勾​地​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真想​说​，​我们​不能​抽出​一丁点儿​时间​阻止​这​一切​吗​？​你​觉得​这事​还​不够​*​重要​*​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2gou1gou1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1 xiang3 shuo1，wo3men5 bu4neng2 chou1chu1 yi1 zheng1 dian3 er2 shi2jian1 zu3zhi3 zhe4 yi1qie4 ma5？ni3 jue2de5 zhe4 shi4 hai2 bu4gou4*zhong4yao4*ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye for a moment, evaluating. Finally, she shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, $(l.name). You win."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​凝视着​你​，​似乎​在​思索​着​什么​。​最终​，​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​$(l.name)​，​你​赢​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3，si4hu1 zai4 si1suo3 zhao2 shen2me5。zui4zhong1，ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，$(l.name)，ni3 ying2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye, and the smile disappears. Her voice is all business.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If he's out there somewhere, I'll find him for you. He could be living under an assumed name in California Free State, and I'd still track him down.\n"
"\n"
"And if he's not alive, I'll tell you where you can find his corpse."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​直视​你​的​眼睛​，​笑容​瞬间​消失​，​语气​变得​严肃​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​他​还​在​这个​世界​上​，​我​就​能​为​你​找到​他​。​即便​他​隐姓埋名​潜居​在​加利福尼亚​自由​州​，​我​也​能​追查​到​他​的​踪迹​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​他​已​不​在​人世​，​我​也​会​告诉​你​他​的​遗体​所在之处​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2shi4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5，xiao4rong2 shun4jian1 xiao1shi1，yu3qi4 bian4de5 yan2su4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ta1 hai2 zai4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 shang4，wo3 jiu4 neng2 wei2 ni3 zhao3dao4 ta1。ji2bian4 ta1 yin3xing4mai2ming2 qian2 ju1 zai4 jia1li4fu2ni2ya4 zi4you2 zhou1，wo3 ye3 neng2 zhui1cha2 dao4 ta1 de5 zong1ji4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 yi3 bu4 zai4 ren2shi4，wo3 ye3 hui4 gao4su4 ni3 ta1 de5 yi2ti3 suo3 zai4 zhi1 chu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye, her expression grim.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So tell me. Are you sure that you want to keep pushing forward with this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​，​脸上​露出​阴郁​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​告诉​我​，​你​真的​想要​刨根问底​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 yin1yu4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gao4su4 wo3，ni3 zhen1de5 xiang3yao4 pao2gen1wen4di3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye. Her expression remains neutral, but that slight blush has spread from her neck to her cheeks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...It wasn't right. And you did the only thing that you could to make it better. You knew that it would cost you, and you did it anyway, because it was *right.*\n"
"\n"
"I won't forget that, $(l.name). Not ever."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​直视​着​你​的​眼睛​。​她​的​表情​依然​平静​，​但​那​抹​微红​已​从​颈间​蔓延​至​双颊​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​那些​事是​不​对​的​。​而​你​做​了​唯一​能​弥补​的​事​。​明知​代价​高昂​，​你​依然​坚持​，​只​因​这​是​*​正确​*​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​永远​不会​忘记​，​$(l.name)​。​永远​不会​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2shi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。ta1 de5 biao3qing2 yi1ran2 ping2jing4，dan4 na4 ma1 wei1 hong2 yi3 cong2 jing3 jian1 man4yan2 zhi4 shuang1 jia2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……na4xie1 shi4 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5。er2 ni3 zuo4 le5 wei2yi1 neng2 mi2bu3 de5 shi4。ming2zhi1 dai4jia4 gao1ang2，ni3 yi1ran2 jian1chi2，zhi3 yin1 zhe4 shi4*zheng4que4*de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 wang4ji4，$(l.name)。yong3yuan3 bu4hui4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye. Her expression remains neutral, but that slight blush has spread from her neck to her cheeks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...it wasn't right. And you did the only thing that you could to make it better. You knew that it would cost you, and you did it anyway, because it was *right.*\n"
"\n"
"I won't forget that, $(l.name). Not ever."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​直视​着​你​的​眼睛​。​她​的​表情​依然​平静​，​但​那​抹​微红​已​从​颈间​蔓延​至​双颊​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​那些​事是​不​对​的​。​而​你​做​了​唯一​能​弥补​的​事​。​明知​代价​高昂​，​你​依然​坚持​，​只​因​这​是​*​正确​*​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​永远​不会​忘记​，​$(l.name)​。​永远​不会​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2shi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。ta1 de5 biao3qing2 yi1ran2 ping2jing4，dan4 na4 ma1 wei1 hong2 yi3 cong2 jing3 jian1 man4yan2 zhi4 shuang1 jia2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……na4xie1 shi4 shi4 bu4 dui4 de5。er2 ni3 zuo4 le5 wei2yi1 neng2 mi2bu3 de5 shi4。ming2zhi1 dai4jia4 gao1ang2，ni3 yi1ran2 jian1chi2，zhi3 yin1 zhe4 shi4*zheng4que4*de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 wang4ji4，$(l.name)。yong3yuan3 bu4hui4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye. Her tone is impassive.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Did that tell you everything you wanted to know, fearless leader? Are you satisfied now?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​盯​着​你​的​眼睛​，​语气​冷漠​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这下​你​都​清楚​了​吧​，​无畏​领袖​？​现在​满意​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5，yu3qi4 leng3mo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4xia4 ni3 dou1 qing1chu5 le5 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4？xian4zai4 man3yi4 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you in the eye. Transfixes you with her gaze.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You handed him over, $(l.name). Like a piece of merchandise. Like a *thing.*\n"
"\n"
"We shouldn't have done that. I should have *stopped* you. But I didn't. And I don't like what that says about me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​直视​着​你​的​眼睛​，​目光如炬​，​令​你​动弹不得​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​把​他​交​了​出去​，​$(l.name)​。​像件​货物​。​像​个​*​东西​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不该​那样​做​。​我​本该​*​阻止​*​你​，​但​我​没有​。​而​我​讨厌​这​背后​的​意味​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2shi4 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5，mu4 guang1 ru2 ju4，ling3 ni3 dong4tan5bu5de2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 ta1 jiao1 le5 chu1qu4，$(l.name)。xiang4 jian4 huo4wu4。xiang4 ge4*dong1xi1*。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4gai1 na4yang4 zuo4。wo3 ben3 gai1*zu3zhi3*ni3，dan4 wo3 mei2you3。er2 wo3 tao3yan4 zhe4 bei4hou4 de5 yi4wei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She looks you up and down, appraising you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not that you’d’ve succeeded if you tried. But in terms of saving face, it would’ve done wonders."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​上下​打量​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​不是​说​你​这样​做​了​就​一定​能​打赢​我​，​但​至少​能​维护​你​的​尊严​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，bu4shi4 shuo1 ni3 zhe4yang4 zuo4 le5 jiu4 yi1ding4 neng2 da3ying2 wo3，dan4 zhi4shao3 neng2 wei2hu4 ni3 de5 zun1yan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods again, her face expressionless.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I couldn't go back. Not after I did what I did. But I don't regret it, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Not for a second."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​点点头​，​脸上​毫无​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​已经​回不去​了​。​毕竟​我​做​了​那些​事情​。​但​我​不​后悔​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一点​也​不​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 hao2wu2 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3jing1 hui2 bu4 qu4 le5。bi4jing4 wo3 zuo4 le5 na4xie1 shi4qing5。dan4 wo3 bu4 hou4hui3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dian3 ye3 bu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods again, her face expressionless.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was a dark time. It has been ever since.\n"
"\n"
"But I don't regret what I did, $(l.name). Not for a second."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​点点头​，​脸上​毫无​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​段​黑暗​的​岁月​。​到​今天​依旧​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​不​后悔​，​$(l.name)​。​一点​也​不​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 hao2wu2 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4 duan4 hei1an4 de5 sui4yue4。dao4 jin1tian1 yi1jiu4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 bu4 hou4hui3，$(l.name)。yi1dian3 ye3 bu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods again, her face expressionless.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There was nowhere else for me to go. Not after I did what I did. But I don't regret it, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Not for a second."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​点点头​，​脸上​毫无​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没有​别的​地方​可去​了​。​毕竟​我​做​了​那些​事情​。​但​我​不​后悔​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一点​也​不​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 hao2wu2 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 bie2de5 di4fang1 ke3 qu4 le5。bi4jing4 wo3 zuo4 le5 na4xie1 shi4qing5。dan4 wo3 bu4 hou4hui3，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dian3 ye3 bu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods again, more decisively this time.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) takes the lead, then. Conversation closed."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​再次​点头​，​这次​更​果断​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就让​$(l.name)​当​队长​吧​。​讨论​到此为止​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zai4ci4 dian3tou2，zhe4 ci4 geng1 guo3duan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 rang4 $(l.name) dang1 dui4zhang3 ba1。tao3lun4 dao4ci3wei2zhi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods appreciatively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Some backbone. That’s good to see."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​赞同​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​挺​好​。​这话​听​起来​还算​有​骨气​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zan4tong2 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting3 hao3。zhe4 hua4 ting1 qi3lai5 hai2 suan4 you3 gu3qi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods appreciatively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you, $(l.name). Your friendship... and your *trust*... well, they mean a lot to me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​赞许​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​的​友谊​……​还有​你​的​*​信任​*​……​对​我​来说​意义​重大​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zan4xu3 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，$(l.name)。wo3men5 de5 you3yi4……hai2you3 ni3 de5*xin4ren4*……dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 yi4yi4 zhong4da4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods appreciatively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's the right attitude."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​赞许​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​正确​的​态度​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zan4xu3 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 tai4du5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good. And thank you, $(l.name). Know that I wouldn't be doing this if it wasn't important."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​。​谢​了​，​$(l.name)​。​我​相信​你​也​明白​，​如果​不是​十万火急​，​我​是​不会​这样​做​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。xie4 le5，$(l.name)。wo3 xiang1xin4 ni3 ye3 ming2bai5，ru2guo3 bu4shi4 shi2wan4huo3ji2，wo3 shi4 bu4hui4 zhe4yang4 zuo4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for your help at Feuerstelle. I couldn't have done it without you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​在​“​火坑​”​的​帮忙​。​没有​你​的话​我​肯定​不行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3 zai4“huo3keng1” de5 bang1mang2。mei2you3 ni3 de5hua4 wo3 ken3ding4 bu4xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods brusquely.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Let's do a sweep, but we should do it quickly. Every moment that we delay, we give them more time to muster reinforcements."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​猛地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​我们​来​搜查​一下​，​但​要​快点​。​我们​每​拖延​一分钟​，​就​给​他们​更​多​时间​集结​增援​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 meng3de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3men5 lai2 sou1cha2 yi1xia4，dan4 yao4 kuai4dian3。wo3men5 mei3 tuo1yan2 yi1 fen4 zhong1，jiu4 gei3 ta1men5 geng1 duo1 shi2jian1 ji2jie2 zeng1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods dumbly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It... it was the right thing to do. So I did it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​机械​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​是​……​正确​的​事​。​所以​我​就​那么​做​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji1xie4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 shi4……zheng4que4 de5 shi4。suo3yi3 wo3 jiu4 na4me5 zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods eagerly, her eyes fixed on Glory's razors.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I'll prove it to you. Ask me anything you want. I'll show you that I'm telling the truth.\n"
"\n"
"I never wanted anything bad to happen to you, Glory. Not ever."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​急切​地​点点头​，​双眼​仍然​死死​盯​着​格洛丽​指尖​的​利刃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​可以​证明​给​你​看​。​你​可以​尽管​问​我​任何​问题​。​我会​证明​我​说​的​是​实话​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​格洛丽​，​我​从来​没想​过​要害​你​—​—​从来​没有​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2，shuang1yan3 reng2ran2 si3si3 ding1 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 zhi3jian1 de5 li4ren4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 ke3yi3 zheng4ming2 gei3 ni3 kan4。ni3 ke3yi3 jin3guan3 wen4 wo3 ren4he2 wen4ti2。wo3 hui4 zheng4ming2 wo3 shuo1 de5 shi4 shi2hua4。\n"
"\n"
"Ge2luo4li2，wo3 cong2lai2 mei2 xiang3 guo4 yao4hai4 ni3——cong2lai2 mei2you3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods eagerly, her eyes full of gratitude.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll do that. I will. \n"
"\n"
"Thank you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​热切地​点点头​，​眼中​满是​感激​之情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​去​的​。​我会​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 re4 qie1 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2，yan3zhong1 man3 shi4 gan3ji1 zhi1 qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 qu4 de5。wo3 hui4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Gladly. I don't want anything to do with that.\n"
"\n"
"I don't even want to be here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​急切​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​必须​的​。​我​可​不想​参与​任何​战斗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​甚至​都​不想​待​在​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi4xu1 de5。wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 can1yu4 ren4he2 zhan4dou4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4xiang3 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you. I really, really mean that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​急切​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​。​我​是​非常​认真​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。wo3 shi4 fei1chang2 ren4zhen1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, yes! Please, go on and ask your questions. I'll explain everything, and you'll see for yourself how *perfect* and *right* our way really is. How beautiful it can be!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​急切​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​是​的​！​请​尽管​提问​吧​。​我会​解释​一切​，​你​会​亲眼看到​我们​的​方式​是​多么​*​完美​*​而​*​正确​*​，​有着​多么​美好​的​未来​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，shi4 de5！qing3 jin3guan3 ti2wen4 ba1。wo3 hui4 jie3shi4 yi1qie4，ni3 hui4 qin1 yan3 kan4 dao4 wo3men5 de5 fang1shi4 shi4 duo1me5*wan2mei3*er2*zheng4que4*，you3zhe5 duo1me5 mei3hao3 de5 wei4lai2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Of course. Charity.\n"
"\n"
"The kind that I practice when I rescue young people from the streets."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​急切​地点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​。​当然​。​慈善​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从​街头​把​那些​年轻人​救回来​，​就是​在​践行​这份​慈善事业​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2qie4 di4dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。dang1ran2。ci2shan4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2 jie1tou2 ba3 na4xie1 nian2qing1ren2 jiu4 hui2 lai2，jiu4shi4 zai4 jian4xing2 zhe4 fen4 ci2 shan4 shi4 ye4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods gratefully.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you. I... I never thought that I'd be in a situation like this.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not a criminal. I'm just an electrician."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​感激​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​。​我​……​我​从​没想到​自己​会​落入​这种​境地​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不是​罪犯​。​我​只是​个​电工​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 gan3ji1 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。wo3……wo3 cong2 mei2xiang3dao4 zi4ji3 hui4 luo4ru4 zhe4zhong3 jing4di4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 zui4fan4。wo3 zhi3shi4 ge4 dian4gong1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I think that you're right. And that means that things have changed around here over the past few years."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​阴沉​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​你​是​对​的​。​这​意味着​过去​几年​里​，​这里​的​规矩​已经​变​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yin1chen2 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ni3 shi4 dui4 de5。zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 guo4qu4 ji3nian2 li3，zhe4li3 de5 gui1ju5 yi3jing1 bian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. I figured as much."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​阴沉​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​我​想​也​是​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yin1chen2 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods grimly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're telling me. My husband has been unemployed for over a year now. He takes care of the kids, so that's something, but money is pretty tight."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​郁闷​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可不是​吗​。​我​丈夫​已经​失业​一年​多​了​。​他​负责​照顾​孩子​，​也​算​替​我​分忧​了​，​但​我们​的​手头​还是​很​紧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yu4men4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3bu5shi4 ma5。wo3 zhang4fu5 yi3jing1 shi1ye4 yi1 nian2 duo1 le5。ta1 fu4ze2 zhao4gu5 hai2zi5，ye3 suan4 ti4 wo3 fen1you1 le5，dan4 wo3men5 de5 shou3tou2 hai2shi5 hen3 jin3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods in the direction of the shrine room door.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We got what we came here for. Let's go finish this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝着​神龛​室​大门​的​方向​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​该​拿​的​东西​已经​拿到​了​。​让​我们​结束​这​一切​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2zhe5 shen2kan1 shi4 da4men2 de5 fang1xiang4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 gai1 na2 de5 dong1xi1 yi3jing1 na2dao4 le5。rang4 wo3men5 jie2shu4 zhe4 yi1qie4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods slowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah.\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, that'd be best."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​这样​最好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，zhe4yang4 zui4hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods slowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, there are, and no, it doesn't. But this... this is just too far out for me to accept.\n"
"\n"
"It's far more likely that they released these stories themselves to throw people off of whatever they're really doing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​的​也​有​道理​，​但是​这个​……​这个​对​我​来说​实在​太​离谱​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​更​可能​是​在​主动​散布​这些​消息​，​以此​混淆视听​，​掩盖​自己​真正​的​目的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de5 ye3 you3 dao4li5，dan4shi4 zhe4ge5……zhe4ge5 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 shi2zai4 tai4 li2pu3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 geng1 ke3neng2 shi4 zai4 zhu3dong4 san4bu4 zhe4xie1 xiao1xi5，yi3ci3 hun4xiao2shi4ting1，yan3gai4 zi4ji3 zhen1zheng4 de5 mu4di4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, a fierce look in her eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"On that, we are agreed."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​眼中​闪过​凶狠​的​精光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​这​一点​上​，​我们​意见​一致​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，yan3zhong1 shan3guo4 xiong1hen3 de5 jing1guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 zhe4 yi1dian3 shang4，wo3men5 yi4jian4 yi1zhi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, a humorless expression on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anytime."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​脸上​毫无​笑意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​客气​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，lian3 shang4 hao2wu2 xiao4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, and her expression softens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For what it's worth, we *did* save a lot of people back there. Harrow is dead, and Feuerstelle is gone.\n"
"\n"
"Nobody will ever be corrupted by that place again. For that, you should feel proud."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​表情​松弛下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总而言之​，​我们​*​确实​*​救​了​很多​人​。​哈罗​死​了​。​“​火坑​”​完蛋​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​人会​再​被​那个​地方​腐蚀​。​你​应该​为此​感到​骄傲​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3er2yan2zhi1，wo3men5*que4shi2*jiu4 le5 hen3 duo1 ren2。ha1luo2 si3 le5。“huo3keng1” wan2dan4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ren2 hui4 zai4 bei4 na4ge5 di4fang1 fu3shi2。ni3 ying1gai1 wei4ci3 gan3dao4 jiao1ao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, and pulls her knife from his throat. She wipes the dripping blade on the Engineer's coat, then slides it back into its sheath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You said it. May he burn in hell."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​把​刀子​从​他​的​喉咙​间​抽​回来​。​她​把​滴血​的​刀刃​在​工程师​的​外套​上​擦​了​擦​，​然后​收刀入​鞘​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​了​，​希望​他​下​地狱​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，ba3 dao1zi5 cong2 ta1 de5 hou2long2 jian1 chou1 hui2lai5。ta1 ba3 di1 xie3 de5 dao1ren4 zai4 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 wai4tao4 shang4 ca1 le5 ca1，ran2hou4 shou1 dao1 ru4 qiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 le5，xi1wang4 ta1 xia4 di4yu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, and raises the knife.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Far past time. Let's do it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​举起​匕首​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​时间​不​等​人​。​动手​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，ju3qi3 bi3shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi2jian1 bu4 deng3 ren2。dong4shou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, and the frown slowly falls off of her face. Her voice becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Red splattered like paint across great metal arms. Small rooms drenched in it, with droplets oozing down from the ceiling.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She offers you a cautious smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pretty."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​皱起​的​眉头​渐渐​舒展​。​她​的​声音​变得​恍惚​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如​颜料​般的​红色​，​溅​满​巨大​的​金属​臂架​。​狭小​的​房间​浸染​其中​，​血珠​从​天花板​上​滴答​渗落​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​向​你​露出​试探性​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​美​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，zhou4qi3 de5 mei2tou2 jian4jian4 shu1zhan3。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 huang3hu1 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2 yan2liao4 ban1 de5 hong2se4，jian4 man3 ju4da4 de5 jin1shu3 bi4 jia4。xia2xiao3 de5 fang2jian1 jin4ran3 qi2zhong1，xie3 zhu1 cong2 tian1hua1ban3 shang4 di1da1 shen4 la4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 shi4tan4xing4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 mei3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, and the razors flick out of her fingertips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm with you. Let's do it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​利刃​从​她​的​指尖​滑​出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​一起​。​我们​出发​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，li4ren4 cong2 ta1 de5 zhi3jian1 hua2 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 yi1qi3。wo3men5 chu1fa1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, and tucks the weapon back into her desk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is. You wouldn't want to be on the wrong end of one of these."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​然后​把​武器​塞回​桌子​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​确实​。​你​肯定​不会​想​吃​一发​这​玩意儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，ran2hou4 ba3 wu3qi4 se4 hui2 zhuo1zi5 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"que4shi2。ni3 ken3ding4 bu4hui4 xiang3 chi1 yi1 fa1 zhe4 wan2yi4r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, taking care to avert her gaze.\n"
"\n"
"Very well. I have work to do anyway.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​刻意​避开​了​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​。​反正​我​也​有​工作​要​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。ke4yi4 bi4kai1 le5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。fan3zheng4 wo3 ye3 you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, taking care to avert her gaze.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You'll want to talk with Aljernon. This is his establishment. He can help you.\n"
"\n"
"Now, if you'll excuse me, I have work to do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​刻意​避开​了​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​得​去​和​阿尔杰​农说​。​这里​是​他​的​店​，​他​能​帮​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​恕​我​失陪​，​我​还有​工作​要​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。ke4yi4 bi4kai1 le5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de2 qu4 he4 E1er3jie2nong2 shuo1。zhe4li3 shi4 ta1 de5 dian4，ta1 neng2 bang1 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 shu4 wo3 shi1pei2，wo3 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, then casts a final glance at the charred remains of the Engineer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. We know who to warn the Flux State about. \n"
"\n"
"Let's grab the rifle and go. We're done here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​最后​看​了​一眼​工程师​已​被​烧焦​的​残骸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​我们​知道​该​向​动荡​带​警告​什么​人​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​拿​上​步枪​就​走​吧​。​这里​的​事情​了结​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，zui4hou4 kan4 le5 yi1yan3 gong1cheng2shi1 yi3 bei4 shao1jiao1 de5 can2hai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3men5 zhi1dao4 gai1 xiang4 dong4dang4 dai4 jing3gao4 shen2me5 ren2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 na2 shang4 bu4qiang1 jiu4 zou3 ba1。zhe4li3 de5 shi4qing5 liao3jie2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, then looks to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Lead the way, $(l.name). We'll follow."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​然后​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​带路​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​跟着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，ran2hou4 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dai4lu4 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 gen1zhe5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods, then turns back to the Engineer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Be quick."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​，​然后​又​转身​看​向​工程师​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​最好​快点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2，ran2hou4 you4 zhuan3shen1 kan4 xiang4 gong1cheng2shi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zui4hao3 kuai4dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A fact that Harrow and I used to our own advantage. We could justify just about anything by pointing to that manifesto.\n"
"\n"
"If an act is forbidden in one place, it's permitted somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈罗​和​我​正是​利用​了​这​一点​。​只要​援引​这份​宣言​，​我们​几乎​能为​任何​行为​辩护​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​某种​行为​在​宣言​中​的​某处​被​禁止​，​那么​在​另​一处​则​会​得到​允许​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1luo2 he4 wo3 zheng4shi4 li4yong4 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。zhi3yao4 yuan2yin3 zhe4 fen4 xuan1yan2，wo3men5 ji1hu1 neng2 wei2 ren4he2 xing2wei2 bian4hu4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 mou3zhong3 xing2wei2 zai4 xuan1yan2 zhong4 de5 mou3chu4 bei4 jin4zhi3，na4me5 zai4 ling4 yi1 chu3 ze2 hui4 de2dao4 yun3xu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Agreed.\n"
"\n"
"All right, $(l.name). Let's get back to the Kreuzbasar and gear up.\n"
"\n"
"We've got a castle to raid."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​同意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​回​克洛伊​茨​集市​做好​准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​要​去​攻占​一座​城堡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tong2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yao4 qu4 gong1zhan4 yi1 zuo4 cheng2bao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Agreed. I'm ready to go over it if you are."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​同意​。​如果​你​准备​好​了​，​我们​随时​可以​开始​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tong2yi4。ru2guo3 ni3 zhun3bei4 hao3 le5，wo3men5 sui2shi2 ke3yi3 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. But we shouldn't take too much time... we need to get that key before Harrow returns."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​但​我们​不能​耽误​太​多​时间​……​我们​得​在​哈罗​回来​之前​拿到​钥匙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。dan4 wo3men5 bu4neng2 dan1wu5 tai4 duo1 shi2jian1……wo3men5 de2 zai4 ha1luo2 hui2lai5 zhi1qian2 na2dao4 yao4shi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Fair enough.\n"
"\n"
"Judging by what you *did* find, the most likely bet is that Yuli here is working for the Lobatchevski Syndicate. So I guess we'll have to go with that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​你​*​找到​*​的​线索​来看​，​最有​可能​的​结论​就是​尤里​来​这里​是​为​洛巴​切夫斯基​集团​做事​的​。​我们​就​按​这个​思路​来​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"cong2 ni3*zhao3dao4*de5 xian4suo3 lai2 kan4，zui4 you3 ke3neng2 de5 jie2lun4 jiu4shi4 You2li3 lai2 zhe4li3 shi4 wei2 luo4 ba1 qie1 fu1 si1 ji1 ji2tuan2 zuo4shi4 de5。wo3men5 jiu4 an4 zhe4ge5 si1lu4 lai2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And we know who his employer was. \"Winternight.\"\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know. Somehow, I have a hard time believing in a Norwegian secret society that's more dangerous than the Russian mob."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​我们​还​打探​到​了​他​的​雇主​。​“​冬夜​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​清楚​。​很难​相信​会​有​一个​比​俄罗斯​黑帮​更​危险​的​挪威​秘密组织​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 wo3men5 hai2 da3tan4 dao4 le5 ta1 de5 gu4zhu3。“dong1 ye4”。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 qing1chu5。hen3 nan2 xiang1xin4 hui4 you3 yi1ge5 bi3 e2luo2si1 hei1bang1 geng1 wei1xian3 de5 nuo2wei1 bi4 mi4 zu3 zhi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Believe me. It is for the best."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​相信​我​，​这样​对​大家​都​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiang1xin4 wo3，zhe4yang4 dui4 da4jia1 dou1 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She nods.{{/GM}}\n"
