"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ye3 ting1 chu1lai2 zhe4 shi4 hua4ming2 le5。dan4 wo3 ting1shuo1 ni3men5 zhe4 xing2 de5 ren2 jiu4shi4 zhe4me5 zuo4sheng1yi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She offers you an apologetic grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Little busy right now, chum. Places to be, things to do, and all that. But if you come by later, maybe I'll have time to chat."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​向​你​露出​一个​歉意​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​目前​有点​忙​，​亲​。​得​去​的​地方​，​得​做​的​事​，​一堆​呢​。​不过​如果​你​晚点​再​来​，​说不定​我​有​时间​聊聊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 qian4yi4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mu4qian2 you3dian3 mang2，qin1。de2 qu4 de5 di4fang1，de2 zuo4 de5 shi4，yi1dui1 ni2。bu4guo4 ru2guo3 ni3 wan3dian3 zai4 lai2，shuo1bu5ding4 wo3 you3 shi2jian1 liao2 liao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pats the Engineer's rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This thing, though... this adds enough utility that I think it's worth the extra weight. I'll find a way to make it work."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​拍了拍​工程师​的​步枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​这​东西​……​它​带来​的​实用性​值得​让​我​多​背点​重量​。​我会​想​办法​让​它​派上用场​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 pai1 le5 pai1 gong1cheng2shi1 de5 bu4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 zhe4 dong1xi1……ta1 dai4lai2 de5 shi2 yong4 xing4 zhi2de5 rang4 wo3 duo1 bei1 dian3 zhong4liang4。wo3 hui4 xiang3 ban4fa3 rang4 ta1 pai4shang4yong4chang3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses a moment to consider your words, a troubled look on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that's true. Feeling discomfort is better than feeling nothing at all."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​思索​着​你​的​话语​，​脸上​浮现​出​忧虑​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​你​说得对​。​感觉​不​舒服​总​比​毫无​感觉​要强​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，si1suo3 zhao2 ni3 de5 hua4yu3，lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 you1lu:4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。gan3jue2 bu4 shu1fu5 zong3 bi3 hao2wu2 gan3jue2 yao4qiang2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses a moment, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, you're right.\n"
"\n"
"Besides, I think that we're getting closer. Look at his temples - see the sweat beading up? I'd say that Yuli's developed himself a habit."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一会儿​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​你​说得对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​另外​，​我​觉得​我们​已经​很​接近​了​。​看看​他​的​太阳穴​。​看到​那里​的​汗珠​了​吗​？​看来​尤里​平时​有点​小​爱好​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"ling4wai4，wo3 jue2de5 wo3men5 yi3jing1 hen3 jie1jin4 le5。kan4kan5 ta1 de5 tai4yang2xue2。kan4dao4 na4li5 de5 han4zhu1 le5 ma5？kan4lai5 You2li3 ping2shi2 you3dian3 xiao3 ai4hao4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a long moment, considering. Finally, her shoulders slump.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right, $(l.name). About everything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​很​长时间​，​思索​着​。​最后​，​她​的​肩膀​垮​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说得对​，​$(l.name)​。​每句​都​对​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 hen3 zhang3 shi2 jian1，si1suo3 zhao2。zui4hou4，ta1 de5 jian1bang3 kua3 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4，$(l.name)。mei3 ju4 dou1 dui4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment before continuing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"By the way, $(l.name)... I am aware that it's more than a little ironic for me to be telling you this.\n"
"\n"
"After Monika's death, if you were the one who was dressing me down in front of Amsel and the rest..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​起来​，​$(l.name)​……​我​很​清楚​，​由​我​来说​这话​多少​有些​讽刺​意味​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​莫妮卡​死后​，​如果​换成​是​你​在​阿姆​泽尔​和​其他人​面前​指责​我​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 qi3lai5，$(l.name)……wo3 hen3 qing1chu5，you2 wo3 lai2 shuo1 zhe4 hua4 duo1shao3 you3xie1 feng3ci4 yi4wei4。\n"
"\n"
"zai4 Mo4ni1ka3 si3hou4，ru2guo3 huan4cheng2 shi4 ni3 zai4 E1mu3ze2er3 he4 qi2 ta1 ren2 mian4qian2 zhi3ze2 wo3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment to consider.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that it would have been nice to see Stahl die. But his days are numbered anyway. \n"
"\n"
"When the F-State discovers what he was planning, he's going to wish that he had never been born."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​思考​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我本​以为​看着​斯塔尔​死​掉​会​很​痛快​。​不过​他​本来​也​时日无多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​动荡​带​发现​他​的​阴谋​时​，​他会​恨不得​自己​从没​来到​这个​世上​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，si1kao3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3 yi3wei2 kan4 zhao2 Si1ta3er3 si3 diao4 hui4 hen3 tong4kuai4。bu4guo4 ta1 ben3lai2 ye3 shi2ri4wu2duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 dong4dang4 dai4 fa1xian4 ta1 de5 yin1mou2 shi2，ta1 hui4 hen4bu5de5 zi4ji3 cong2mei2 lai2dao4 zhe4ge5 shi4shang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment to consider.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that it would have been nice to see Stahl die. But his days are numbered anyway. \n"
"\n"
"When the F-State discovers what he was planning, he's going to wish that he was never born."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​思考​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我本​以为​看着​斯塔尔​死​掉​会​很​痛快​。​不过​他​本来​也​时日无多​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​动荡​带​发现​他​的​阴谋​时​，​他会​恨不得​自己​从没​来到​这个​世上​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，si1kao3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ben3 yi3wei2 kan4 zhao2 Si1ta3er3 si3 diao4 hui4 hen3 tong4kuai4。bu4guo4 ta1 ben3lai2 ye3 shi2ri4wu2duo1 le5。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 dong4dang4 dai4 fa1xian4 ta1 de5 yin1mou2 shi2，ta1 hui4 hen4bu5de5 zi4ji3 cong2mei2 lai2dao4 zhe4ge5 shi4shang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment to consider.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That said... I'll admit that I do enjoy a certain sense of satisfaction thinking about Stahl's head breaking apart. So there's that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​思考​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话虽如此​……​我​得​承认​，​想象​施​塔尔​的​脑袋​被​砸碎​时​，​我​确实​有​一种​奇特​的​快感​。​就是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，si1kao3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4sui1ru2ci3……wo3 de2 cheng2ren4，xiang3xiang4 shi1 ta3 er3 de5 nao3dai5 bei4 za2sui4 shi2，wo3 que4shi2 you3 yi1zhong3 qi2te4 de5 kuai4gan3。jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, and the hard expression on her face softens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, I understand that you're trying to help me, and I appreciate it. I do. But I'm not ready to talk about this yet.\n"
"\n"
"Maybe when we know one another a little better, okay? Until then, just give me my space."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​脸上​坚硬​的​表情​逐渐​柔和​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​听​着​，​我​明白​你​是​在​帮​我​，​我​也​感激​你​的​好意​，​真的​。​但​我​还​没​准备​好​谈论​这件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​彼此​更​熟悉​些​再说​，​好​吗​？​在​那​之前​，​请​给​我点​空间​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，lian3 shang4 jian1ying4 de5 biao3qing2 zhu2jian4 rou2he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ting1 zhao2，wo3 ming2bai5 ni3 shi4 zai4 bang1 wo3，wo3 ye3 gan3ji1 ni3 de5 hao3yi4，zhen1de5。dan4 wo3 hai2 mei2 zhun3bei4 hao3 tan2lun4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 bi3ci3 geng1 shu2xi1 xie1 zai4shuo1，hao3 ma5？zai4 na4 zhi1qian2，qing3 gei3 wo3 dian3 kong1jian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering, and you can see her body relax as she finally lets her guard down.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay, you're cool, you can head on in. I won't rat you out to Security or Management if you won't tell anyone that I held the door for you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She smiles at you warmly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're all in this together, right?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​思考​了​一会儿​，​然后​终于​放松​了​警惕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​你们​进去​吧​。​只要​你​不​和​别人​说​是​我​给​你​开​的​门​，​我​就​不会​把​你​告发​给​安保​处​或​管理处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​向​你​露出​和煦​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​互帮互助​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 si1kao3 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 zhong1yu2 fang4song1 le5 jing3ti4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，ni3men5 jin4qu4 ba1。zhi3yao4 ni3 bu4 he4 bie2ren5 shuo1 shi4 wo3 gei3 ni3 kai1 de5 men2，wo3 jiu4 bu4hui4 ba3 ni3 gao4fa1 gei3 an1bao3 chu3 huo4 guan3 li3 chu3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 he2xu4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hu4 bang1 hu4 zhu4，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering. Finally, she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, I do.\n"
"\n"
"You've earned that much."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​思索​着​。​最终​，​她​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​证明​了​自己​值得​信任​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 si1suo3 zhao2。zui4zhong1，ta1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zheng4ming2 le5 zi4ji3 zhi2de5 xin4ren4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering. Finally, she shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is coming to me, sorry.\n"
"\n"
"Dietrich might be able to help - he's been in Berlin longer than any of us, and if this \"Lodge\" does have shamanic connections, he'd be the most likely one to know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​思索​着​。​最终​，​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​实在​想不出​什么​，​抱歉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​迪​特里​希​或许​能​帮​上​忙​—​—​他​在​柏林​待​的​时间​比​我们​任何人​都​久​，​如果​这个​“​结社​”​真有​萨满教​背景​，​他​最​有​可能​知道​内情​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，si1suo3 zhao2。zui4zhong1，ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi2zai4 xiang3 bu4 chu1 shen2me5，bao4qian4。\n"
"\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 huo4xu3 neng2 bang1 shang4 mang2——ta1 zai4 bo2lin2 dai1 de5 shi2jian1 bi3 wo3men5 ren4 he2 ren2 dou1 jiu3，ru2guo3 zhe4ge5“jie2she4” zhen1 you3 sa4man3jiao4 bei4jing3，ta1 zui4 you3 ke3neng2 zhi1dao4 nei4qing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering. Finally, she shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sure, I'll tell you. Why not? Maybe knowing will keep you from making the same mistake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​思索​了​一会儿​，​最后​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​告诉​你​也​无妨​。​也许​这样​还​能​让​你​避免​犯下​同样​的​错误​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 si1suo3 le5 yi1hui4r5，zui4hou4 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，gao4su4 ni3 ye3 wu2fang2。ye3xu3 zhe4yang4 hai2 neng2 rang4 ni3 bi4mian3 fan4 xia4 tong2yang4 de5 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering. Then she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Fine. We can talk.\n"
"\n"
"But we're doing it on my terms."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​思考​了​一会儿​，​最终​还是​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​那​我们​就​聊聊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这事​得​按​我​说​的​来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 si1kao3 le5 yi1hui4r5，zui4zhong1 hai2shi5 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，na4 wo3men5 jiu4 liao2 liao2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 shi4 de2 an4 wo3 shuo1 de5 lai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't see why not. It's worth checking out, at any rate."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一会儿​，​思考​着​你​的话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不能​说​没有​可能​。​总之​这​值得​调查​一下​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，si1kao3 zhao2 ni3 de5hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4neng2 shuo1 mei2you3 ke3neng2。zong3zhi1 zhe4 zhi2de5 diao4cha2 yi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Or am I speaking with another's voice...? Sometimes it's difficult to tell where I end and the dreams begin."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​陷入​沉思​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抑或​我​正​借​他人​之声​说话​？​……​有时​实在​分不清​，​究竟​是​我​结束​了​，​还是​梦境​开始​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，xian4ru4 chen2si1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi4huo4 wo3 zheng1 jie4 ta1ren2 zhi1 sheng1 shuo1hua4？……you3shi2 shi2zai4 fen4 bu4 qing1，jiu1jing4 shi4 wo3 jie2shu4 le5，hai2shi5 meng4jing4 kai1shi3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Y'know what? I'm happy, actually. For the first time in a long time. \n"
"\n"
"I have you to thank for that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这么​说​吧​？​我​现在​挺​开心​的​。​我​已经​很久没​有​这种​感觉​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​这​都​是​多亏​了​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ba1？wo3 xian4zai4 ting3 kai1xin1 de5。wo3 yi3jing1 hen3 jiu3 mei2 you3 zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4 dou1 shi4 duo1kui1 le5 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, examining you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know, $(l.name), it's wonderful to see how you've grown in my absence.\n"
"\n"
"I knew that you could handle yourself in a crisis... in fact, I originally brought you on board as a contingency plan. Did you know that?\n"
"\n"
"You were my ace in the hole, just in case something like this happened."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一会儿​，​仔细​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​能​看到​你​在​我​离开​的​这​段时间​里​成长​得​如此​出色​，​真是​太好了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​你​能​在​危机​中​独当一面​……​事实上​，​我​当初​招​你​进来​就是​作为​应急​领袖​的​人选​。​你​知道​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​我​的​王牌​，​就是​以防万一​这样​的​事情​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，zi3xi4 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，neng2 kan4dao4 ni3 zai4 wo3 li2kai1 de5 zhe4 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3 cheng2zhang3 de2 ru2ci3 chu1se4，zhen1shi5 tai4hao3le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 neng2 zai4 wei1ji1 zhong4 du2dang1yi1mian4……shi4shi2shang4，wo3 dang1chu1 zhao1 ni3 jin4lai2 jiu4shi4 zuo4wei2 ying4ji2 ling3xiu4 de5 ren2xuan3。ni3 zhi1dao4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 wo3 de5 wang2pai2，jiu4shi4 yi3fang2wan4yi1 zhe4yang4 de5 shi4qing5 fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Agreed. But let's move quickly.\n"
"\n"
"I'd rather not get locked in here again."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一下​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​同意​。​但​我们​要​快点​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可​不想​再​被困​在​这里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 tong2yi4。dan4 wo3men5 yao4 kuai4dian3 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 zai4 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, then shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's possible, I suppose. But we can worry about it later.\n"
"\n"
"For now, let's keep moving. The spirit will be around here... somewhere."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​然后​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有​这个​可能​。​不过​等​我们​回头​再​考虑​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​，​我们​得​继续前进​。​精魂​应该​就​在​附近​的​……​某个​地方​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，ran2hou4 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 zhe4ge5 ke3neng2。bu4guo4 deng3 wo3men5 hui2tou2 zai4 kao3lu:4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4，wo3men5 de2 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。jing1hun2 ying1gai1 jiu4 zai4 fu4jin4 de5……mou3 ge4 di4fang1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses for a moment, weighing her options, and then her shoulders relax. She has evidently come to a decision.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay, fine. You can head on in, I won't rat you out to Security.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She makes a faint waving gesture in the direction of the door.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But just this once, understand? I can't go making a habit of this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​思考​了​一会儿​，​然后​肩膀​放松​下来​。​显然​她​心里​已经​有​了​决定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​你们​进去​吧​，​我​不会​向​安保​处​告密​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​朝门​的​方向​微微​挥​了​挥手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​就​这​一次​，​明白​吗​？​我​不能​总惯​着​这种​行为​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 si1kao3 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 jian1bang3 fang4song1 xia4lai5。xian3ran2 ta1 xin1li5 yi3jing1 you3 le5 jue2ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，ni3men5 jin4qu4 ba1，wo3 bu4hui4 xiang4 an1bao3 chu3 gao4mi4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2men2 de5 fang1xiang4 wei1wei1 hui1 le5 hui1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 jiu4 zhe4 yi1ci4，ming2bai5 ma5？wo3 bu4neng2 zong3 guan4 zhao2 zhe4zhong3 xing2wei2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses to consider.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Interesting. And probably fair, at least in part.\n"
"\n"
"But you don't need to worry about my continued survival. I'll get along just fine, in the shadows or anywhere else."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​思考​了​一阵​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有趣​，​或许​还​挺​合理​，​至少​有​一部分​说​得​在​理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​你​也​不用​担心​我​往后​的​日子​。​无论是​在​暗影​中​还是​别的​哪里​，​我​都​能​过​得​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 si1kao3 le5 yi1zhen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3qu4，huo4xu3 hai2 ting3 he2li3，zhi4shao3 you3 yi1bu4fen5 shuo1 de2 zai4 li3。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4 ni3 ye3 bu4yong4 dan1xin1 wo3 wang3hou4 de5 ri4zi5。wu2 lun2 shi4 zai4 an4ying3 zhong4 hai2shi5 bie2de5 na3li3，wo3 dou1 neng2 guo4 de2 hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses to consider.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Normally, I'd call that a cop-out answer. But I guess that there's some truth to it.\n"
"\n"
"In any case, you don't need to worry about me, fearless leader. My baggage isn't gonna hurt my job performance or anything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​思考​了​一阵​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一般来说​，​我会​觉得​这是​假大空​的​废话​……​但​我​猜​或许​还​能​从中​咂摸​出​几分​道理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​你​没​必要​担心​我​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​的​精神​包袱​不会​影响​我​的​工作​表现​，​或者说​，​不会​对​我​造成​任何​影响​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 si1kao3 le5 yi1zhen4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1ban1lai2shuo1，wo3 hui4 jue2de5 zhe4 shi4 jia3da4kong1 de5 fei4hua4……dan4 wo3 cai1 huo4xu3 hai2 neng2 cong2zhong1 za1mo5 chu1 ji3fen1 dao4li5。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，ni3 mei2 bi4yao4 dan1xin1 wo3，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3 de5 jing1shen2 bao1fu5 bu4hui4 ying3xiang3 wo3 de5 gong1zuo4 biao3xian4，huo4 zhe3 shuo1，bu4hui4 dui4 wo3 zao4cheng2 ren4he2 ying3xiang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses, a look of uncertainty on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come to think of it, I haven't heard any comm chatter in a while. So I guess that makes sense..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一下​，​脸上​挂​着​犹豫​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​起来​，​我​已经​好久没​听到​通讯​频道​的​对话​了​。​这么​说​也​有​道理​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 you2yu4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 qi3lai5，wo3 yi3jing1 hao3 jiu3 mei2 ting1dao4 tong1xun4 pin2dao4 de5 dui4hua4 le5。zhe4me5 shuo1 ye3 you3 dao4li5……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses, then slowly lets the smoke escape through her nostrils.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can't say that I was a fan."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一下​，​让​烟雾​慢慢​从​鼻孔​中​散开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​倒​谈不上​喜欢​她​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，rang4 yan1wu4 man4man4 cong2 bi2kong3 zhong4 san4kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dao3 tan2bu5shang4 xi3huan5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses, then takes a deep breath and exhales it slowly. Tries to calm herself. But the panic wins out, and she begins to tremble.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, $(l.name). I'm going to give you the most valuable piece of advice I've ever given anyone, free of charge."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​深吸​一口气​缓缓​吐​出​。​试图​让​自己​平静下来​。​但​惊恐​的​情绪​最终​还是​占据​上风​，​她​开始​浑身​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我要​免费​给​你​一条​我​这辈子​给​过​任何人​的​最​有​价值​的​建议​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。shi4tu2 rang4 zi4ji3 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。dan4 jing1kong3 de5 qing2xu4 zui4zhong1 hai2shi5 zhan4ju4 shang4feng1，ta1 kai1shi3 hun2shen1 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3 yao4 mian3fei4 gei3 ni3 yi1 tiao2 wo3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 gei3 guo4 ren4 he2 ren2 de5 zui4 you3 jia4zhi2 de5 jian4yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses, then takes a deep breath and exhales it slowly. Tries to calm herself. But the panic wins out, and she begins to tremble.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You'll find out. And $(l.name)... a free piece of advice."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​片刻​，​深吸​一口气​缓缓​吐​出​。​试图​让​自己​平静下来​。​但​惊恐​的​情绪​最终​还是​占据​上风​，​她​开始​浑身​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​很快​就​知道​了​。​另外​，​$(l.name)​……​给​你​条​免费​建议​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 pian4ke4，shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。shi4tu2 rang4 zi4ji3 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。dan4 jing1kong3 de5 qing2xu4 zui4zhong1 hai2shi5 zhan4ju4 shang4feng1，ta1 kai1shi3 hun2shen1 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 zhi1dao4 le5。ling4wai4，$(l.name)……gei3 ni3 tiao2 mian3fei4 jian4yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses, then turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Just tell me what you found."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停​了​一下​，​然后​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​只​说​有​什么​发现​就行了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2 le5 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi3 shuo1 you3 shen2me5 fa1xian4 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses. Tilts her head. Finally, she answers her own question.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It doesn't matter. What's done is done."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​一下​，​歪头​思考​着​。​最终​，​她​自己​回答​了​自己​的​问题​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​事已至此​，​现在​大概​都​不​重要​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，wai1 tou2 si1kao3 zhao2。zui4zhong1，ta1 zi4ji3 hui2da2 le5 zi4ji3 de5 wen4ti2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4yi3zhi4ci3，xian4zai4 da4gai4 dou1 bu4 zhong4yao4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That isn't protocol. This entire story is suspe--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停顿​了​下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​不​符合​流程​。​你​说​的​这​一切​都​很​可疑​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 bu4 fu2he2 liu2cheng2。ni3 shuo1 de5 zhe4 yi1qie4 dou1 hen3 ke3yi2 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. If we're going to take care of that, we should do it now... and you should probably tackle any other outstanding tasks that you might have as well.\n"
"\n"
"Once we confront APEX, we'll be committed to seeing the rest of this through. No hesitation, and no turning back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​。​如果​我们​要​处理​这件​事​，​就​该​现在​出发​……​同时​你​最好​也​把​其他​未​完成​的​任务​一并处理​掉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​一旦​我们​直面​APEX​，​就​得​全身心​投入​，​一条​路​走​到底​。​不能​迟疑​，​也​不能​回头​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5。ru2guo3 wo3men5 yao4 chu3li3 zhe4 jian4 shi4，jiu4 gai1 xian4zai4 chu1fa1……tong2shi2 ni3 zui4hao3 ye3 ba3 qi2ta1 wei4 wan2cheng2 de5 ren4wu5 yi1 bing4 chu3 li3 diao4。\n"
"\n"
"yi1dan4 wo3men5 zhi2mian4 APEX，jiu4 de2 quan2shen1xin1 tou2ru4，yi1 tiao2 lu4 zou3 dao4di3。bu4neng2 chi2yi2，ye3 bu4neng2 hui2tou2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know what you're saying, right? If we focus on killing Harrow, a lot of runaways are going to die here tonight. I'm almost certain of it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​自己​在​说​什么​吗​？​如果​我们​只顾​着​干掉​哈罗​，​今晚​就​会​有​很多​教徒​死​在​这里​。​我​对此​确信无疑​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 ma5？ru2guo3 wo3men5 zhi3gu4 zhao2 gan4diao4 ha1luo2，jin1wan3 jiu4 hui4 you3 hen3 duo1 jiao4tu2 si3 zai4 zhe4li3。wo3 dui4 ci3 que4 xin4 wu2 yi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know what you're saying, right? If we focus on saving these runaways, Harrow is going to escape. I'm almost certain of it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​自己​在​说​什么​吗​？​如果​我们​只顾​着​救出​这些​教徒​，​哈罗​肯定​会​趁机​逃走​。​我​对此​确信无疑​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5 ma5？ru2guo3 wo3men5 zhi3gu4 zhao2 jiu4chu1 zhe4xie1 jiao4tu2，ha1luo2 ken3ding4 hui4 chen4ji1 tao2zou3。wo3 dui4 ci3 que4 xin4 wu2 yi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She peers through the scope on her sniper rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...And then we kill the AI that killed Monika."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​透过​狙击枪​的​瞄镜​凝视着​前方​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​然后​我们​就​把​杀死​莫妮卡​的​AI​彻底​干掉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tou4guo4 ju1 ji1 qiang1 de5 miao2 jing4 ning2 shi4 zhao2 qian2fang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ran2hou4 wo3men5 jiu4 ba3 sha1si3 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 AI che4di3 gan4diao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She picks up her things to leave.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"When this job is done, I'll be back. You haven't seen the last of me, $(l.name)... that's a promise.\n"
"\n"
"I can't say how long it'll take, but I *will* come back to the Kreuzbasar, and to this team."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​收拾​好​东西​准备​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​忙​完​就​会​回来​。​$(l.name)​……​你​还​没见​过​我​的​全部​本事​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​虽然​说​不准​要​多久​，​但​我​*​一定​*​会回​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​回到​队伍​里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shou1shi5 hao3 dong1xi1 zhun3bei4 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mang2 wan2 jiu4 hui4 hui2lai5。$(l.name)……ni3 hai2 mei2 jian4 guo4 wo3 de5 quan2bu4 ben3shi4 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"sui1ran2 shuo1 bu4zhun3 yao4 duo1jiu3，dan4 wo3*yi1ding4*hui4 hui2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，hui2dao4 dui4wu3 li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She pulls absentmindedly at some hair in her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry about the inteldump. It's not really useful information.\n"
"\n"
"And you'd probably guessed anyway, at this point. But you asked, so."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​漫不经心​地​拨弄​着​脸上​的​几缕​头发​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​我话​有点​多​了​。​这些​信息​没什么​用处​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而且​你​现在​估计​也​已经​猜到​了​。​但​你​问​了​，​所以​我​说​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 bo1nong4 zhao2 lian3 shang4 de5 ji1 lu:3 tou2fa5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 wo3 hua4 you3dian3 duo1 le5。zhe4xie1 xin4xi1 mei2shen2me5 yong4chu5。\n"
"\n"
"er2qie3 ni3 xian4zai4 gu1ji4 ye3 yi3jing1 cai1 dao4 le5。dan4 ni3 wen4 le5，suo3yi3 wo3 shuo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She puts a hand on your shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on, $(l.name). Let's get back home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​将​一只​手​放在​你​的​肩上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​回家​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 yi1 zhi3 shou3 fang4 zai4 ni3 de5 jian1 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，$(l.name)。wo3men5 hui2jia1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She puts a hand up to her mouth, stifling a small cry, then shakes her head and pulls herself back together.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that's to be expected."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​用​手​捂住​嘴​，​强忍​住​一声​轻微​的​哽咽​，​然后​摇摇头​，​强迫​自己​镇定​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​也​是​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 shou3 wu3zhu4 zui3，qiang3ren3 zhu4 yi1sheng1 qing1wei1 de5 geng3ye4，ran2hou4 yao2 yao2 tou2，qiang3po4 zi4ji3 zhen4ding4 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She raises a hand in mock-salute.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here's to your old boss, the least anarchistic \"anarchist\" I've ever met."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​嘲讽​般​举手​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​敬​你​的​前任​老大​，​我见​过​最​不​无政府主义​的​“​无政府主义​者​”​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2feng3 ban1 ju3shou3 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jing4 ni3 de5 qian2ren4 lao3da4，wo3 jian4 guo4 zui4 bu4 wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 de5“wu2zheng4fu3zhu3yi4 zhe3”。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She raises a hand to stop you. The expression on her face has gone from cautious to annoyed.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Cut the bullshit, fearless leader. I don’t respond well to flattery."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​举起​手​阻止​你​继续​说​下去​。​她​脸上​的​表情​已​从​谨慎​转为​恼怒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别跟我​扯淡​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​听​不来​这些​拍马屁​的话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ju3qi3 shou3 zu3zhi3 ni3 ji4xu4 shuo1 xia4qu4。ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 biao3qing2 yi3 cong2 jin3shen4 zhuai3 wei2 nao3nu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 gen1 wo3 che3dan4 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3 ting1 bu4 lai2 zhe4xie1 pai1ma3pi4 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She raises an arm, and you feel a burst of warmth and comfort in your chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It wants to help people - to heal them. It wants redemption, just like I do.\n"
"\n"
"Together, maybe we'll find it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​抬起​手臂​，​你​胸口​顿时​涌起​一阵​温暖​与​慰藉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​想要​帮助​人们​—​—​治愈​他们​。​它​想要​得到​救赎​，​就​像​我​一样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或许​，​我们​将​携手​找到​答案​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tai2qi3 shou3bi4，ni3 xiong1kou3 dun4shi2 yong3qi3 yi1zhen4 wen1nuan3 yu4 wei4jie4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang3yao4 bang1zhu4 ren2men5——zhi4yu4 ta1men5。ta1 xiang3yao4 de2dao4 jiu4shu2，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4。\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3，wo3men5 jiang1 xie2shou3 zhao3dao4 da2an4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She raises an eyebrow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The dragonslayer? Interesting.\n"
"\n"
"He's been missing for a long time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​扬起​一条​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​屠龙​者​？​有意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​已经​失踪​很久​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 tu2 long2 zhe3？you3yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 yi3jing1 shi1zong1 hen3 jiu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She reaches for her shotgun.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Longer than this. I'm going to kill Bannik when--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​伸手​去​掏​霰弹枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​比​这个​时间​长​。​回去​之后​我​一定​要​杀​了​班尼克​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1shou3 qu4 tao1 xian4dan4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 bi3 zhe4ge5 shi2jian1 zhang3。hui2qu5 zhi1hou4 wo3 yi1ding4 yao4 sha1 le5 ban1 ni2 ke4 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She reaches up. Grabs Danni's hand. Clutches it tight.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Worse than \"bad,\" babe. A lot worse."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​将​手​抬起​。​抓住​丹妮​的​手​。​紧紧​握住​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​比​“​糟糕​”​要​严重​，​宝贝儿​。​严重​得​多​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 shou3 tai2qi3。zhua1zhu4 dan1 ni1 de5 shou3。jin3jin3 wo4zhu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bi3“zao1gao1” yao4 yan2zhong4，bao3bei4r5。yan2zhong4 de2 duo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She remains silent for a time before replying.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Say whatever else you wanted to say."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​沉默​了​一阵子​才​回答​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​要说​的​就​赶紧​说​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 yi1zhen4zi5 cai2 hui2da2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4shuo1 de5 jiu4 gan3jin3 shuo1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She replies through clenched teeth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You want to step away from me, $(l.name). Right now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​从​牙缝里​挤出​一句​回复​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​我​身边​滚蛋​，​$(l.name)​。​赶紧​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 cong2 ya2 feng2 li3 ji3chu1 yi1ju4 hui2fu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cong2 wo3 shen1bian1 gun3dan4，$(l.name)。gan3jin3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She riffles through the pages, flipping the cheap paper with her thumbnail.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks like addresses, all the way through. Some are annotated, but I can't see any names.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Two-thirds of the way through the book, she stops short.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​扫过​书页​，​用​指甲​翻动​着​廉价​的​纸张​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看起来​从头到尾​都​是​地址​。​其中​一些​有​注释​，​但​我​没​看到​任何​名字​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​翻​到​三分之二​的​位置​时​，​她​突然​停​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sao3 guo4 shu1ye4，yong4 zhi3jia5 fan1dong4 zhao2 lian2jia4 de5 zhi3zhang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4qi3lai5 cong2tou2dao4wei3 dou1 shi4 di4zhi3。qi2zhong1 yi1xie1 you3 zhu4shi4，dan4 wo3 mei2 kan4dao4 ren4he2 ming2zi5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fan1 dao4 san1 fen4 zhi1 er4 de5 wei4zhi5 shi2，ta1 tu1ran2 ting2 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A lesson in Puritan values from a shadowrunner. How quaint."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​对​你​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一个​暗影​狂奔​者​竟然​在​宣传​清教徒​的​价值观​。​真够​奇葩​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1ge5 an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3 jing4ran2 zai4 xuan1chuan2 qing1jiao4tu2 de5 jia4zhi2guan1。zhen1 gou4 qi2pa1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please. Look, I'm sure you're just trying to help, but you're gettin' on my nerves here. \n"
"\n"
"It's not your business anyway. I don't even KNOW you! So just leave me alone, okay?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行行好​，​饶​了​我​吧​。​我​知道​你​想​帮忙​，​但​你​现在​只是​在​给​我​添堵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​事​本来​也​跟​你​没关系​。​我​都​不​认识​你​啊​！​让​我​一个​人​清静​清静​，​行​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 xing2 hao3，rao2 le5 wo3 ba1。wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 xiang3 bang1mang2，dan4 ni3 xian4zai4 zhi3shi4 zai4 gei3 wo3 tian1du3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ben3lai2 ye3 gen1 ni3 mei2guan1xi5。wo3 dou1 bu4 ren4shi5 ni3 a1！rang4 wo3 yi1ge5 ren2 qing1jing4 qing1jing4，xing2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, fine, whatever. I didn't see you. Go ahead and do your thing. But if you get caught, it's on you, got that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​行​吧​。​就​当​我​没​看见​你们​。​你​该​干嘛​就​干嘛​吧​。​但​如果​你​被​抓​的话​，​可别​把​我​供​出去​，​好​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1 xing2 ba1。jiu4 dang1 wo3 mei2 kan4jian4 ni3men5。ni3 gai1 gan4ma2 jiu4 gan4ma2 ba1。dan4 ru2guo3 ni3 bei4 zhua1 de5hua4，ke3 bie4 ba3 wo3 gong1 chu1qu4，hao3 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, one-$(l.man)-army, believe what you want. But even if you *could* take them down on your own, you don't have time. We've still got a dragon to deal with, remember?\n"
"\n"
"We can't take the time to go scouring the Norwegian countryside looking for a secret society. Let the F-State worry about protecting Berlin's borders - that's what it's there for."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​独行侠​，​随便​你​怎么​想​。​但​就算​你​*​真能​*​独自​击败​他们​，​你​也​没​这个​时间​。​我们​还有​一条​巨龙​要​对付​，​记得​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​没​时间​去​挪威​乡下​到处​搜寻​秘密组织​。​让​动荡​带​去​负责​保护​柏林​的​边境​吧​—​—​那才​是​它​的​职责所在​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，du2xing2xia2，sui2bian4 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3。dan4 jiu4suan4 ni3*zhen1 neng2*du2zi4 ji1bai4 ta1men5，ni3 ye3 mei2 zhe4ge5 shi2jian1。wo3men5 hai2you3 yi1 tiao2 ju4long2 yao4 dui4fu5，ji4de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 mei2 shi2jian1 qu4 nuo2wei1 xiang1xia5 dao4chu4 sou1xun2 bi4 mi4 zu3 zhi1。rang4 dong4dang4 dai4 qu4 fu4ze2 bao3hu4 bo2lin2 de5 bian1jing4 ba1——na4 cai2 shi4 ta1 de5 zhi2 ze2 suo3 zai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Well, was there anything else? Or are you just here to waste my time?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​都行​，​还​有事吗​？​还是​说​你​就是​来​浪费​我​的​时间​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dou1 xing2，hai2 you3 shi4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 jiu4shi4 lai2 lang4fei4 wo3 de5 shi2jian1 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And I'm the one who knew better than to touch a warded door."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​我​知道​不要​随便​乱​碰​一扇​有​防护​结界​的​门​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2 wo3 zhi1dao4 bu4yao4 sui2bian4 luan4 peng4 yi1 shan1 you3 fang2hu4 jie2jie4 de5 men2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"C'mon. Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​我们​继续前进​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3men5 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Gee. Thanks."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真是​谢谢​你​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1shi5 xie4xie5 ni3 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rolls her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your honesty is appreciated, fearless leader. Your tact could use some work, though.\n"
"\n"
"Now, is there anything else that you want to talk about?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​翻​了​个​白眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​感谢​你​的​诚实​，​无畏​领袖​。​不过​你​的​表达​技巧​还有​待​改进​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​什么​别的​事要​聊​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fan1 le5 ge4 bai2yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ni3 de5 cheng2shi2，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。bu4guo4 ni3 de5 biao3da2 ji4qiao3 hai2you3 dai1 gai3jin4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 bie2de5 shi4 yao4 liao2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She rubs her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Right. I'm sure that they'll be very understanding."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​揉​揉​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​是​是​，​他们​一定​会​理解​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 rou2 rou2 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，ta1men5 yi1ding4 hui4 li3jie3 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She scoffs at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Me? Go soft? Not on your life, fearless leader.\n"
"\n"
"After we've dealt with our current predicament, I'll dig as deep as I need to to get to the bottom of this. For now, though, we should get back on task."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​对​你​嗤之以鼻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​？​妥协​？​你​这辈子​是​看不到​了​，​无畏​领袖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​搞定​了​目前​的​麻烦​，​我​肯定​会​把​这​整件事​查个​水落石出​。​不过​眼下​，​我们​还是​该​先​解决​手头​的​正事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 chi1zhi1yi3bi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3？tuo3xie2？ni3 zhe4 bei4 zi3 shi4 kan4 bu4 dao4 le5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 gao3ding4 le5 mu4qian2 de5 ma2fan5，wo3 ken3ding4 hui4 ba3 zhe4 zheng3 jian4 shi4 cha2 ge4 shui3luo4shi2chu1。bu4guo4 yan3xia4，wo3men5 hai2shi5 gai1 xian1 jie3jue2 shou3tou2 de5 zheng4shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She screams at you. Her cheeks are streaked with tears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Screw you!\n"
"\n"
"I hope that you all burn in hell!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​对​着​你​破口大骂​。​她​的​面颊​上​挂​着​道​道​泪痕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​去死吧​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​你们​所有人​都​不得好死​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 zhao2 ni3 po4kou3da4ma4。ta1 de5 mian4jia2 shang4 gua4 zhao2 dao4 dao4 lei4hen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 qu4 si3 ba1！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 ni3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 bu4 de2 hao3 si3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She screams at you. Her cheeks are streaked with tears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Screw you! The Azzies are going to tie *us* to this! They'll kill *everybody!*\n"
"\n"
"I hope that you burn in hell!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​对​着​你​破口大骂​。​她​的​面颊​上​挂​着​道​道​泪痕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​去死吧​！​阿兹佬​肯定​会​以为​这件​事是​*​我们​*​做​的​！​他们​会​杀​了​*​所有人​*​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​你​不得好死​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 zhao2 ni3 po4kou3da4ma4。ta1 de5 mian4jia2 shang4 gua4 zhao2 dao4 dao4 lei4hen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 qu4 si3 ba1！e1 zi1 lao3 ken3ding4 hui4 yi3wei2 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shi4*wo3men5*zuo4 de5！ta1men5 hui4 sha1 le5*suo3you3ren2*！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 ni3 bu4 de2 hao3 si3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She sets her jaw, a look of disgust on her pallid face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That ain't gonna happen, chummer. Not now. Not ever."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咬紧牙关​，​苍白​的​脸上​显露出​厌恶​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​可能​，​老兄​。​不行​。​这辈子​都​不​可能​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1，cang1bai2 de5 lian3 shang4 xian3lu4chu1 yan4wu4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 ke3neng2，lao3xiong1。bu4xing2。zhe4 bei4 zi3 dou1 bu4 ke3neng2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's about how I expected you to respond. But it's disappointing, all the same.\n"
"\n"
"I didn't overreact, fearless leader. What I did was *necessary.* That's true, whether you can see it or not."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​对​你​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​知道​你​会​这么​说​，​但​我​还是​对此​感到​失望​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没有​反应​过火​，​无畏​领袖​。​我​*​必须​*​那样​做​。​不管​你​有没有​听懂​，​反正​就是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1，dan4 wo3 hai2shi5 dui4 ci3 gan3dao4 shi1wang4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2you3 fan3ying4 guo4huo3，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3*bi4xu1*na4yang4 zuo4。bu4guan3 ni3 you3mei2you3 ting1dong3，fan3zheng4 jiu4shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head in shock and horror.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, God. Oh *no.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​惊恐​地​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​老天​，​*​不要​*​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jing1kong3 de5 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，lao3tian1，*bu4yao4*。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head violently.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No way! Those parts are keeping us online! And not just us, but everyone worth a nuyen in this hole!\n"
"\n"
"Parson can keep running his ridiculous little cult just *fine* with what he's got. But us... we're the only Matrix connection that these people have!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​猛烈地​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没门儿​！​我们​全靠​那些​零件​才能​接入​网络​！​不仅​是​我们​，​还有​这破​地方​每个​要​维持​生计​的​人​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​帕森靠​他​手上​现有​的​东西​，​照样​能​把​他​那个​荒唐​的​邪教​搞​得​*​有声有色​*​。​但​我们​……​我们​可是​这些​人能​连接​到​矩阵​的​唯一​途径​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 meng3 lie4 de5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2men2r5！wo3men5 quan2 kao4 na4xie1 ling2jian4 cai2neng2 jie1ru4 wang3luo4！bu4jin3 shi4 wo3men5，hai2you3 zhe4 po4 di4fang1 mei3ge4 yao4 wei2chi2 sheng1ji4 de5 ren2！\n"
"\n"
"pa4 sen1 kao4 ta1 shou3 shang4 xian4you3 de5 dong1xi1，zhao4yang4 neng2 ba3 ta1 na4ge5 huang1tang2 de5 xie2jiao4 gao3 de2*you3sheng1you3se4*。dan4 wo3men5……wo3men5 ke3shi4 zhe4xie1 ren2 neng2 lian2jie1 dao4 ju3zhen4 de5 wei2yi1 tu2jing4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head, her eyes still focused on Dante's broken body.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry, Monika. Wherever you are."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​，​双眼​依旧​盯​着​但丁​残破​的​尸体​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​抱歉​，​莫妮卡​。​无论​你​在​哪儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2，shuang1yan3 yi1jiu4 ding1 zhao2 dan4ding1 can2po4 de5 shi1ti3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4，Mo4ni1ka3。wu2lun4 ni3 zai4 na3r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don’t you people *learn* from your mistakes?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​怎么​就是​不会​吸取​*​教训​*​呢​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 zen3me5 jiu4shi4 bu4hui4 xi1qu3*jiao4xun5*ni2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know. Have I ever been, when I'm me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​现实​中​的​我​有​过​好​时候​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。xian4shi2 zhong4 de5 wo3 you3 guo4 hao3 shi2hou5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've never seen an initiate harmed in that room. Not once. And as for the rumors... well, they're just that. Rumors.\n"
"\n"
"I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从没​在​那个​房间​里​见​过​任何​学徒​受到​伤害​。​一次​都​没有​。​至于​那些​传言​……​嗯​，​不过​是​传言​罢了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​对此​确信无疑​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2mei2 zai4 na4ge5 fang2jian1 li3 jian4 guo4 ren4he2 xue2tu2 shou4dao4 shang1hai4。yi1ci4 dou1 mei2you3。zhi4yu2 na4xie1 chuan2yan2……en1，bu4guo4 shi4 chuan2yan2 ba4le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 dui4 ci3 que4 xin4 wu2 yi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've never seen an initiate harmed in that room. Not once. And as for the rumors... well, they're just that. Rumors.\n"
"\n"
"They have to be."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​从没​在​那个​房间​里​见​过​任何​学徒​受到​伤害​。​一次​都​没有​。​至于​那些​传言​……​嗯​，​不过​是​传言​罢了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​肯定​是​这样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cong2mei2 zai4 na4ge5 fang2jian1 li3 jian4 guo4 ren4he2 xue2tu2 shou4dao4 shang1hai4。yi1ci4 dou1 mei2you3。zhi4yu2 na4xie1 chuan2yan2……en1，bu4guo4 shi4 chuan2yan2 ba4le5。\n"
"\n"
"ken3ding4 shi4 zhe4yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've... I've never seen it. Not myself.\n"
"\n"
"The stories are just stories. Silly rumors. They have to be... don't they?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​从未​亲眼​见过​那些​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那些​故事​不过​是​故事​罢了​。​荒唐​的​传言​。​肯定​是​这样​……​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 cong2wei4 qin1yan3 jian4 guo4 na4xie1 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"na4xie1 gu4shi4 bu4guo4 shi4 gu4shi4 ba4le5。huang1tang2 de5 chuan2yan2。ken3ding4 shi4 zhe4yang4……dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If what you're saying is true, why haven't we heard anything over the comms about it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​真有​这事​的话​，​为什么​我们​还​没收​到​任何​通讯​消息​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhen1 you3 zhe4 shi4 de5hua4，wei4shen2me5 wo3men5 hai2 mo4shou1 dao4 ren4he2 tong1xun4 xiao1xi5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's a pity that you completely botched it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可惜​你​把​一切​都​搞砸​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3xi1 ni3 ba3 yi1qie4 dou1 gao3za2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's get this over with."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​完事​走人​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 wan2shi4 zou3ren2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My reaction wasn't \"extreme.\" It was *necessary.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​反应​并​不​“​极端​”​，​我​*​必须​*​那样​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 fan3ying4 bing4 bu4“ji2duan1”，wo3*bi4xu1*na4yang4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, $(l.name). Harrow certainly deserves some of the blame for what I became. Maybe even most of it. But personal responsibility has to come into the equation somewhere.\n"
"\n"
"I made my own choices, and they were horrible ones. I've accepted that. You should, too."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​$(l.name)​。​哈罗​确实​该​为​我​变成​这样​承担​部分​责任​。​或许​甚至​该​承担​主要​责任​。​但​个人​责任​终究​也​该​算在内​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​做出​了​自己​的​选择​，​而​那些​选择​糟透了​。​我​已经​接受​了​这个​事实​。​你​也​该​如此​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，$(l.name)。ha1luo2 que4shi2 gai1 wei2 wo3 bian4cheng2 zhe4yang4 cheng2dan1 bu4fen5 ze2ren4。huo4xu3 shen4zhi4 gai1 cheng2dan1 zhu3yao4 ze2ren4。dan4 ge4ren2 ze2ren4 zhong1jiu1 ye3 gai1 suan4 zai4 nei4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zuo4chu1 le5 zi4ji3 de5 xuan3ze2，er2 na4xie1 xuan3ze2 zao1 tou4 le5。wo3 yi3jing1 jie1shou4 le5 zhe4ge5 shi4shi2。ni3 ye3 gai1 ru2ci3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. I'm not in the habit of sharing war stories, $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Not with people who've never served."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​$(l.name)​，​我​向来​不爱​讲​什么​战争​故事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尤其​是​跟​那些​从没​当过兵​的​人​讲​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。$(l.name)，wo3 xiang4lai2 bu4 ai4 jiang3 shen2me5 zhan4zheng1 gu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"you2qi2 shi4 gen1 na4xie1 cong2mei2 dang1 guo4 bing1 de5 ren2 jiang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. No, that's one story that I won't be telling.\n"
"\n"
"They died. That's all that you need to know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​我​不想​讲​这件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​死​了​，​你​知道​这些​就够​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，wo3 bu4xiang3 jiang3 zhe4 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 si3 le5，ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1 jiu4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. Not here, and not now.\n"
"\n"
"Those kids in there - they'd all die for her. They already love her. That's what she does."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​不是​在​这里​，​也​不是​现在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​里面​的​那些​孩子​—​—​他们​都​愿意​为​她​赴死​。​他们​已经​爱上​她​了​。​这​就是​她​的​本事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。bu4shi4 zai4 zhe4li3，ye3 bu4shi4 xian4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"li3mian4 de5 na4Xie1hai2zi5——ta1men5 dou1 yuan4yi4 wei2 ta1 fu4si3。ta1men5 yi3jing1 ai4shang4 ta1 le5。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1 de5 ben3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks, but no. Not now, at least.\n"
"\n"
"At some point, after we're done with what we're doing, I'll look into this. I'll get to the truth, whatever it might be. But I'm not going to do it today."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​，​但​不用​了​。​至少​不是​现在​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​手头​的​事​处理​完​，​我会​查​清楚​这件​事​。​无论​真相​是​什么​，​我​都​会​查个​水落石出​。​但​不是​在​今天​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5，dan4 bu4yong4 le5。zhi4shao3 bu4shi4 xian4zai4。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 shou3tou2 de5 shi4 chu3li3 wan2，wo3 hui4 cha2 qing1chu5 zhe4 jian4 shi4。wu2lun4 zhen1xiang4 shi4 shen2me5，wo3 dou1 hui4 cha2 ge4 shui3luo4shi2chu1。dan4 bu4shi4 zai4 jin1tian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The less that you know, the better. For both of us.\n"
"\n"
"You'll just have to trust me on that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​的​越少​越​好​。​这样​对​我们​俩​都​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​你​相信​我​就行了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 de5 yue4 shao3 yue4 hao3。zhe4yang4 dui4 wo3men5 lia3 dou1 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 ni3 xiang1xin4 wo3 jiu4 xing2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They won't have to. My employers have a way of seeing the truth of things. Of reading the intent behind a person's eyes.\n"
"\n"
"When I took this step, I signed my own death warrant."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​这个​必要​。​我​的​雇主​们​总能​洞悉​事物​的​本质​，​能​从​人​的​眼神​中​读出​真实​意图​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​我​迈出​这​一步​时​，​就​等同于​签下​了​自己​的​死亡​判决书​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 zhe4ge5 bi4yao4。wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 men5 zong3neng2 dong4xi1 shi4wu4 de5 ben3zhi4，neng2 cong2 ren2 de5 yan3shen2 zhong4 du2chu1 zhen1shi2 yi4tu2。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 wo3 mai4chu1 zhe4 yi1 bu4 shi2，jiu4 deng3 tong2 yu2 qian1 xia4 le5 zi4ji3 de5 si3wang2 pan4 jue2 shu1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This place... these people... I loved them so, so much.\n"
"\n"
"What a goddamned fool I was."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​地方​……​这些​人​……​我​如此​深爱着​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​真是​个​该死​的​傻瓜​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 di4fang1……zhe4xie1 ren2……wo3 ru2ci3 shen1 ai4 zhao2 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhen1shi5 ge4 gai1si3 de5 sha3gua1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Too late for that - we'd never get them out in time.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}A curious expression flits across her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And even if we could, it wouldn't matter. I still have a score to settle."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​已经​太迟​了​—​—​我们​根本​来不及​救出​他们​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​脸上​闪过​一丝​异样​的​神色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​就算​来得及​，​也​改变​不了​什么​。​我​还有​笔账​要​算​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi3jing1 tai4 chi2 le5——wo3men5 gen1ben3 lai2bu5ji2 jiu4chu1 ta1men5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 yi4yang4 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jiu4suan4 lai2de5ji2，ye3 gai3bian4 bu4le5 shen2me5。wo3 hai2you3 bi3 zhang4 yao4 suan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You have nothing to fear from me. None of you do.\n"
"\n"
"In fact, I have a proposal to offer you. A mutually beneficial arrangement."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​无需​害怕​我​。​你们​中​的​任何人​都​无需​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​事实上​，​我​有​个​提议​，​能​对​我们​双方​都​有​好处​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 wu2xu1 hai4pa4 wo3。ni3men5 zhong4 de5 ren4 he2 ren2 dou1 wu2xu1 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4shi2shang4，wo3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4，neng2 dui4 wo3men5 shuang1fang1 dou1 you3 hao3chu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shakes her head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're not Knight Errant. I don't know who you are, but you've just made a huge mistake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不是​游侠​骑士​。​我​不​知道​你​是​谁​，​但​你​刚刚​犯​了​个​大错​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4。wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 shei2，dan4 ni3 gang1gang5 fan4 le5 ge4 da4cuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shoots a backward glance at the wretched woman, still silently wailing in her glass prison.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I guess.\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, people. Let's get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​回头​瞥​了​一眼​那个​仍​在​玻璃​牢笼​中​默默​哀号​的​可怜​女人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大概​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​我们​走​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui2tou2 pie1 le5 yi1yan3 na4ge5 reng2 zai4 bo1li5 lao2long2 zhong4 mo4mo4 ai1hao2 de5 ke3lian2 nu:3ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4gai4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3men5 zou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shoots a disgusted glance at your captive.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, don't worry.\n"
"\n"
"I will."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你们​的​俘虏​投​去​厌恶​的​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​别​担心​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3men5 de5 fu2lu3 tou2 qu4 yan4wu4 de5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，bie4 dan1xin1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shoots you a cautionary glance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't engage with him. Just let him hang onto his little fantasy... we need to get out of here before those bioware samples start to thaw."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​投来​一个​警示​的​眼神​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​再​搭​茬​了​。​就让​他​继续​沉浸​在​幻想​中​吧​……​我们​得​在​这些​生体​殖装​样本​解冻​之前​赶紧​离开​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 tou2 lai2 yi1ge5 jing3shi4 de5 yan3shen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 zai4 da1 cha2 le5。jiu4 rang4 ta1 ji4xu4 chen2jin4 zai4 huan4xiang3 zhong4 ba1……wo3men5 de2 zai4 zhe4xie1 sheng1 ti3 zhi2 zhuang1 yang4ben3 jie3dong4 zhi1qian2 gan3jin3 li2kai1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shoulders the rifle and peers through its scope. A grin grows on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It looks like these after-market mods have more or less locked it into in an assault rifle configuration. But that's all right... I've been looking for a worthy midrange weapon, and this'll do nicely."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​扛起​步枪​，​通过​瞄准镜​观察​。​她​的​脸上​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​这些​自制​配件​基本上​已经​将​它​改装成​了​突击​步枪​的​配置​。​不过​没关系​……​我​一直​在​寻找​一款​合适​的​中程​武器​，​这​把​枪​正合我意​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 gang1 qi3 bu4qiang1，tong1guo4 miao2 zhun3 jing4 guan1cha2。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 zhe4xie1 zi4zhi4 pei4jian4 ji1ben3shang5 yi3jing1 jiang1 ta1 gai3 zhuang1 cheng2 le5 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1 de5 pei4zhi4。bu4guo4 mei2guan1xi5……wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 xun2zhao3 yi1 kuan3 he2shi4 de5 zhong1cheng2 wu3qi4，zhe4 ba3 qiang1 zheng1 ge3 wo3 yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shoulders the rifle and peers through its scope. A grin grows on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Yes, I do.\n"
"\n"
"It looks like these after-market mods have more or less locked it into in an assault rifle configuration. But that's all right... I've been looking for a worthy midrange weapon, and this'll do nicely."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​扛起​步枪​，​通过​瞄准镜​观察​。​她​的​脸上​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​很​不错​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​这些​自制​配件​基本上​已经​将​它​改装成​了​突击​步枪​的​配置​。​不过​没关系​……​我​一直​在​寻找​一款​合适​的​中程​武器​，​这​把​枪​正合我意​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 gang1 qi3 bu4qiang1，tong1guo4 miao2 zhun3 jing4 guan1cha2。ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，hen3 bu4cuo4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 zhe4xie1 zi4zhi4 pei4jian4 ji1ben3shang5 yi3jing1 jiang1 ta1 gai3 zhuang1 cheng2 le5 tu1ji1 bu4qiang1 de5 pei4zhi4。bu4guo4 mei2guan1xi5……wo3 yi1zhi2 zai4 xun2zhao3 yi1 kuan3 he2shi4 de5 zhong1cheng2 wu3qi4，zhe4 ba3 qiang1 zheng1 ge3 wo3 yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She shrugs helplessly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I guess because they need something rewired?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​无助​地​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​猜​大概​是​他们​需要​某些​接线​工作​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wu2zhu4 de5 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 cai1 da4gai4 shi4 ta1men5 xu1yao4 mou3xie1 jie1xian4 gong1zuo4？"

msgid ""
