"​重点​不是​我​需要​什么​，​而且​我们​的​对话​也​变得​和​我​的​需求​无关​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​一直​在​谈​*​你​*​需要​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"chong2dian3 bu4shi4 wo3 xu1yao4 shen2me5，er2qie3 wo3men5 de5 dui4hua4 ye3 bian4de5 he4 wo3 de5 xu1qiu2 wu2guan1。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yi1zhi2 zai4 tan2*ni3*xu1yao4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We could have, sure. Before Danni spent our last handful of nuyen on those forged keycards."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​本来​是​可以​的​。​然而​丹妮​把​我们​最后​的​一点​新円​都​拿​去​仿造​门禁卡​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ben3lai2 shi4 ke3yi3 de5。ran2er2 dan1 ni1 ba3 wo3men5 zui4hou4 de5 yi1dian3 xin1 yuan2 dou1 na2 qu4 fang3zao4 men2 jin1 ka3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She sighs.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Look, it’s a simple question. Years of experience tell me that it needs an answer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​又​不是​什么​难题​。​按​我​这么​多年​的​经验​来看​，​这​事​总得​有个​答案​才​是​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 you4 bu4shi4 shen2me5 nan2ti2。an4 wo3 zhe4me5 duo1nian2 de5 jing1yan4 lai2 kan4，zhe4 shi4 zong3dei3 you3 ge4 da2an4 cai2 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She slings her rifle over her shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That just means that we'll be fighting in a target-rich environment."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​将​步枪​斜​挎​在​肩上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​只不过​意味着​我们​将​置身于​目标​密集​的​战场​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 bu4qiang1 xie2 kua4 zai4 jian1 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 zhi3bu5guo4 yi4wei4zhe5 wo3men5 jiang1 zhi4 shen1 yu2 mu4biao1 mi4ji2 de5 zhan4chang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She slings the rifle, then claps you on the shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Come on, fearless leader. Let's get back home."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​将​步枪​甩​到​背后​，​然后​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​，​无畏​领袖​。​我们​回家​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiang1 bu4qiang1 shuai3 dao4 bei4hou4，ran2hou4 pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。wo3men5 hui2jia1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She slowly nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. I'll tell you.\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that you deserve to know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​我​告诉​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​你​有​资格​知道​这些​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 gao4su4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ni3 you3 zi1ge2 zhi1dao4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She slowly nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're right. I am. On some level, I think that I've known that for a long time now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​你​说​得​没错​。​某种程度​上​而言​，​我​知道​这件​事​已经​很​长时间​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。mou3 zhong3 cheng2 du4 shang4 er2yan2，wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 yi3jing1 hen3 zhang3 shi2 jian1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles apologetically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All out of the good stuff, I'm afraid. How about a nice cup of soykaf?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​露出​歉意​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哎呀​，​我​这​的​好​东西​都​卖完​了​。​要​不来​一杯​豆​咖​如何​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 qian4yi4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ai1ya1，wo3 zhe4 de5 hao3 dong1xi1 dou1 mai4wan2 le5。yao4 bu4 lai2 yi1 bei1 dou4 ka1 ru2he2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles at you. Her eyes are sad.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"We\" shouldn't."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​冲​你​微笑​，​眼中​带​着​忧伤​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​“​我们​”​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chong1 ni3 wei1xiao4，yan3zhong1 dai4 zhao2 you1shang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4“wo3men5”。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's an old family recipe.\n"
"\n"
"Can I getcha anything else?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​对​你​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​我家​祖传​的​食谱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要来点​别的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 jia1 zu3chuan2 de5 shi2pu3。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 lai2 dian3 bie2de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles brightly at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Glad you like it! It's a big hit with the street people around here, and the price is right."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​高兴​你​喜欢​！​它​在​附近​的​街坊邻居​中​很​受欢迎​，​而且​价格公道​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 gao1xing4 ni3 xi3huan5！ta1 zai4 fu4jin4 de5 jie1 fang1 lin2 ju1 zhong4 hen3 shou4huan1ying2，er2qie3 jia4 ge2 gong1 dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles sadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They aren't."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​露出​悲伤​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​怎么样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 bei1shang1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 zen3me5yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles slyly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've got just thing for that big presentation, or that make-or-break annual report! It's called \"Jolt,\" and it's AMAZING.\n"
"\n"
"Imagine a great, big cup of 'kaf, only without the nasty crash or the jittery stomach. You can take as many as you need without winding up in the hospital, and each one will keep you up for a couple of hours!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​狡黠​地一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这里​有份​好​东西​，​能​帮​你​轻松​搞定​重要​演示​或​决定​成败​的​年度报告​！​它​叫​“​嗨​翻天​”​，​而且​效果​简直​惊人​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​想象​一杯​浓郁​的​豆​咖​，​却​没有​难受​的​崩溃​感​或​胃部不适​。​你​可以​按​需​服用​，​完全​不必​担心​送医急救​，​每次​服用​都​能​让​你​保持​清醒​好几个​小时​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 jiao3xia2 de5 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4li3 you3fen4 hao3 dong1xi1，neng2 bang1 ni3 qing1song1 gao3ding4 zhong4yao4 yan3shi4 huo4 jue2ding4 cheng2bai4 de5 nian2du4bao4gao4！ta1 jiao4“hai1 fan1 tian1”，er2qie3 xiao4guo3 jian3zhi2 jing1ren2！\n"
"\n"
"xiang3xiang4 yi1 bei1 nong2yu4 de5 dou4 ka1，que4 mei2you3 nan2shou4 de5 beng1kui4 gan3 huo4 wei4 bu4 bu4 kuo4。ni3 ke3yi3 an4 xu1 fu2yong4，wan2quan2 bu4bi4 dan1xin1 song4 yi1 ji2 jiu4，mei3ci4 fu2yong4 dou1 neng2 rang4 ni3 bao3chi2 qing1xing3 hao3 ji1 ge4 xiao3shi2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles. Claps you on the shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know you do. And I've got yours.\n"
"\n"
"You've more than earned it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​微微一笑​，​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​。​我​也​会​全心全意​守护​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​完全​配得​上​领袖​之职​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4，pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4。wo3 ye3 hui4 quan2xin1quan2yi4 shou3hu4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 wan2quan2 pei4 de2 shang4 ling3xiu4 zhi1 zhi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"Professional acquaintance,\" then."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​露出​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就算​“​有​业务​往来​”​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4suan4“you3 ye4wu4 wang3lai2” ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good decision."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It has, hasn't it? After a lifetime of poor decisions and worse consequences, it's a nice change of pace."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​露出​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​难道​不是​吗​？​经历​了​一辈子​糟糕​的​选择​与​后果​，​也​该​迎来​转机​了​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"nan2dao4 bu4shi4 ma5？jing1li4 le5 yi1bei4zi5 zao1gao1 de5 xuan3ze2 yu4 hou4guo3，ye3 gai1 ying2lai2 zhuan3ji1 le5 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was a hell of a day, wasn't it? I was thinking of stepping out and grabbing a drink to wind down... you'd be welcome to join me if you like."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​今天​真是​够呛​呀​？​我​在​想​出去​喝一杯​放松​一下​……​如果​你​愿意​的话​，​欢迎​一​起来​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin1tian1 zhen1shi5 gou4qiang4 ya1？wo3 zai4 xiang3 chu1qu4 he4 yi1 bei1 fang4song1 yi1xia4……ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4，huan1ying2 yi1 qi3lai5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smiles.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"In a high wind. Guaranteed."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​笑​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​风雨无阻​。​我​保证​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"feng1yu3wu2zu3。wo3 bao3zheng4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smirks as she slides the shotgun into its sheath on her back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have that effect on people sometimes. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​，​将​霰弹枪​塞回​背后​的​枪套​中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有时候​确实​有​这个​本事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，jiang1 xian4dan4qiang1 se4 hui2 bei4hou4 de5 qiang1 tao4 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3shi2hou5 que4shi2 you3 zhe4ge5 ben3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smirks at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ooh, touché. All right, let's assume that there *are* a bunch of different things going on."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​的​是​哦​。​好​吧​，​让​我们​假设​*​确实​*​发生​了​很多​不同​的​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 de5 shi4 e2。hao3 ba1，rang4 wo3men5 jia3she4*que4shi2*fa1sheng1 le5 hen3 duo1 bu4tong2 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smirks at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Save it. I'm here to protect the optical chip.\n"
"\n"
"That thing cost us fifty grand, after all."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​得意​地朝​你​笑了笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​省省​吧​。​我​是​来​保护​光学​芯片​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​东西​毕竟​花​了​我们​五万块​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de2yi4 de5 chao2 ni3 xiao4 le5 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sheng3 sheng3 ba1。wo3 shi4 lai2 bao3hu4 guang1xue2 xin1pian4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"na4 dong1xi1 bi4jing4 hua1 le5 wo3men5 wu3 wan4 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smirks playfully.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Remember, I'm Altuğ's ears and hands outside of the cafe.\n"
"\n"
"We share a lot of intel, he and I."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​调皮​地笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​记得​吗​，​我​是​奥图​伊在​咖啡馆​之外​的​耳目​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​之间​会​分享​很多​情报​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tiao2pi2 de5 xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4de5 ma5，wo3 shi4 ao4 tu2 yi1 zai4 ka1fei1guan3 zhi1wai4 de5 er3mu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1jian1 hui4 fen1xiang3 hen3 duo1 qing2bao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smirks, then lets the smoke escape from the corner of her mouth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't I know it.\n"
"\n"
"So... you need something? Or are you just going to stand there staring?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​，​让​烟雾​从​嘴角​逸​出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​能​不​知道​吗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​有事吗​？​还是​说​你​要​站​这​傻​看着​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，rang4 yan1wu4 cong2 zui3jiao3 yi4 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 neng2 bu4 zhi1dao4 ma5。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 you3 shi4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 yao4 zhan4 zhe4 sha3 kan4 zhao2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smirks, then lets the smoke escape from the corner of her mouth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, well. Sorry for your loss, and all that. A lot of people are still torn up about it.\n"
"\n"
"So... you need something? Or are you just going to stand there staring?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​，​让​烟雾​从​嘴角​逸​出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​是​是​，​节哀顺变​。​很多​人​还​在​为​这件​事​难受​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​有事吗​？​还是​说​你​要​站​这​傻​看着​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，rang4 yan1wu4 cong2 zui3jiao3 yi4 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，jie2ai1shun4bian4。hen3 duo1 ren2 hai2 zai4 wei2 zhe4 jian4 shi4 nan2shou4 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 you3 shi4 ma5？hai2shi5 shuo1 ni3 yao4 zhan4 zhe4 sha3 kan4 zhao2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Glad to be of service. Now, do you have another question, or...?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​客气​。​好​了​，​你​还有​其他​问题​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。hao3 le5，ni3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not quite. You're a client, not a friend.\n"
"\n"
"No offense, mind you. But my crew is back in Mitte, and we're doing just fine on the job front."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​算不上​。​你​是​客户​，​不是​朋友​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无意​冒犯​。​但​我​的​团队​在​米​特区​，​我们​的​工作​也​很​顺利​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suan4 bu4 shang4。ni3 shi4 ke4hu4，bu4shi4 peng2you5。\n"
"\n"
"wu2yi4 mao4fan4。dan4 wo3 de5 tuan2dui4 zai4 mi3 te4qu1，wo3men5 de5 gong1zuo4 ye3 hen3 shun4li4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She snaps at you, her voice overflowing with irritation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Think what you like. I *like* this change, and I don't want it to go away.\n"
"\n"
"You, on the other hand, can go whenever you please."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​急​冲冲​地​呛​了​你​一句​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​随​你​怎么​想​，​我​*​喜欢​*​这种​变化​，​我​不要​放弃​这​股​力量​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​看见​你​，​你​给​我​爱​去​哪​去​哪​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ji2 chong1chong1 de5 qiang1 le5 ni3 yi1ju4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"sui2 ni3 zen3me5 xiang3，wo3*xi3huan5*zhe4zhong3 bian4hua4，wo3 bu4yao4 fang4qi4 zhe4 gu3 li4liang5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3 kan4jian4 ni3，ni3 gei3 wo3 ai4 qu4 na3 qu4 na3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She snarls out an answer. Her face has flushed red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I *know.* I haven't *forgotten* anything.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}To your astonishment, you see that her eyes are welling with tears.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​发出​一声​怒吼​。​她​的​脸涨​得​通红​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​知道​*​。​我​没有​*​忘记​*​任何​一件​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​惊讶​地​发现​，​她​的​眼中​噙​满​了​泪水​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 nu4hou3。ta1 de5 lian3 zhang3 de2 tong1hong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3*zhi1dao4*。wo3 mei2you3*wang4ji4*ren4he2 yi1 jian4 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 jing1ya4 de5 fa1xian4，ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 qin2 man3 le5 lei4shui3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She snarls out an answer. Her face has flushed red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, I *did.* She was just as bad as Harrow.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}To your astonishment, you see that her eyes are welling with tears.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​发出​一声​怒吼​。​她​的​脸涨​得​通红​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我​想​*​清楚​*​了​。​她​和​哈罗​一样​恶贯满盈​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​惊讶​地​发现​，​她​的​眼中​噙​满​了​泪水​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 nu4hou3。ta1 de5 lian3 zhang3 de2 tong1hong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3 xiang3*qing1chu5*le5。ta1 he4 ha1luo2 yi1yang4 e4guan4man3ying2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 jing1ya4 de5 fa1xian4，ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 qin2 man3 le5 lei4shui3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She snarls out an answer. Her face has flushed red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, I *know.* Back down and give me a moment.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}To your astonishment, you see that her eyes are welling with tears.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​发出​一声​怒吼​。​她​的​脸涨​得​通红​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我​*​知道​*​。​退后​，​给​我​一点​时间​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​惊讶​地​发现​，​她​的​眼中​噙​满​了​泪水​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 nu4hou3。ta1 de5 lian3 zhang3 de2 tong1hong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3*zhi1dao4*。tui4hou4，gei3 wo3 yi1dian3 shi2jian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 jing1ya4 de5 fa1xian4，ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 qin2 man3 le5 lei4shui3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She snarls out an answer. Her face has flushed red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, I *know.* She was just as bad as Harrow. Killing her was the *right* thing to do.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}To your astonishment, you see that her eyes are welling with tears.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​发出​一声​怒吼​。​她​的​脸涨​得​通红​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​我​*​知道​*​。​她​和​哈罗​一样​恶贯满盈​。​杀​她​是​*​天经地义​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​你​惊讶​地​发现​，​她​的​眼中​噙​满​了​泪水​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 nu4hou3。ta1 de5 lian3 zhang3 de2 tong1hong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，wo3*zhi1dao4*。ta1 he4 ha1luo2 yi1yang4 e4guan4man3ying2。sha1 ta1 shi4*tian1jing1di4yi4*。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 jing1ya4 de5 fa1xian4，ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 qin2 man3 le5 lei4shui3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She snatches the credstick from your hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fine. We'll take that. But if you come around here again, bring more cash, or you're gonna have trouble."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​一把​抢过​你​手里​的​信用​棒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​我们​就​收下​了​。​但​下次​你​再​来​这里​的话​，​记得​多带​点​钱​，​否则​你​会​有​麻烦​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 ba3 qiang3 guo4 ni3 shou3li3 de5 xin4yong4 bang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3men5 jiu4 shou1xia4 le5。dan4 xia4ci4 ni3 zai4 lai2 zhe4li3 de5hua4，ji4de5 duo1 dai4 dian3 qian2，fou3ze2 ni3 hui4 you3 ma2fan5 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"Cursed.\" Huh. Funny choice of words, but I guess that it applies."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​诅咒​”​吗​？​这个​词挺​有意思​的​，​但​算是​这么回事​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“zu3zhou4” ma5？zhe4ge5 ci2 ting3 you3yi4si5 de5，dan4 suan4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She sounds suspicious. On edge.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let me see some ID."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​声音​透露​出​怀疑​与​紧张​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​我​看​身份证件​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 tou4lu4 chu1 huai2yi2 yu4 jin3zhang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3 wo3 kan4 shen1 fen4 zheng4 jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She sounds suspicious. On edge.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, yeah... I can see that. But this is a rest--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​声音​透露​出​怀疑​与​紧张​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​我​看得出来​。​但​这里​是​禁​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 tou4lu4 chu1 huai2yi2 yu4 jin3zhang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……wo3 kan4 de2 chu1 lai2。dan4 zhe4li3 shi4 jin1 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She stands and brushes the hair out of her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. Job's done. Just need to do a bit of cleanup, and we can get out of here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​站​起身​来​，​把​头发​从​眼前​拨弄​开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​搞定​。​最后​再​清理​一下​，​我们​就​能​离开​这里​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhan4 qi3shen1 lai2，ba3 tou2fa5 cong2 yan3qian2 bo1nong4 kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，gao3ding4。zui4hou4 zai4 qing1li3 yi1xia4，wo3men5 jiu4 neng2 li2kai1 zhe4li3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She stares at the scorch marks that blacken the access panel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Poor Monika.\n"
"\n"
"I still can't believe that she's gone."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​凝视着​使​接入​面板​变黑​的​烧焦​痕迹​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可怜​的​莫妮卡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还是​不敢相信​她​已经​不​在​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 shi3 jie1ru4 mian4ban3 bian4hei1 de5 shao1jiao1 hen2ji4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3lian2 de5 Mo4ni1ka3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 bu4 gan3 xiang1 xin4 ta1 yi3jing1 bu4 zai4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She stares at you for a beat, then nods. A few ragged breaths later, she continues.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Marta told me about a place where she'd been hanging out. She invited me to join her there.\n"
"\n"
"It was called Feuerstelle, the \"Fire Place,\" and it was sort of a commune for dispossessed youth."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看​了​你​一眼​，​然后​点点头​。​几次​粗重​的​呼吸​后​，​她​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​告诉​我​她​常去​的​一个​地方​，​并​邀请​我​一同​前往​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​地方​叫​“​火坑​”​，​是​个​收容​无家可归​青年​的​聚居地​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。ji3ci4 cu1 chong2 de5 hu1xi1 hou4，ta1 you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3 gao4su4 wo3 ta1 chang2 qu4 de5 yi1ge5 di4fang1，bing4 yao1qing3 wo3 yi1tong2 qian2wang3。\n"
"\n"
"na4 di4fang1 jiao4“huo3keng1”，shi4 ge4 shou1rong2 wu2jia1ke3gui1 qing1nian2 de5 ju4ju1di4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She stares at you for a moment, then looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck with that, $(l.name). Now, please...\n"
"\n"
"Leave me alone."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​盯​着​你​看​了​一会儿​，​然后​移开​视线​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝你好运​，​$(l.name)​。​现在​请​你​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​别来​烦​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 yi2kai1 shi4xian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4，$(l.name)。xian4zai4 qing3 ni3……\n"
"\n"
"bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She stares at you for a moment, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well. The choice is yours."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​盯​着​你​看​了​一会儿​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​你​说了算​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She stares at you, her face expressionless.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No. I'd rather not."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​凝视着​你​，​脸上​毫无​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​。​还是​算了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 hao2wu2 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4。hai2shi5 suan4le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She stares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Haven't you been paying attention? Marta *never* cared about me. She was *bait.*\n"
"\n"
"It was her job to lure me here - me, and a hundred other kids like me. The ring doesn't mean anything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​到底​有没有​听​我​说话​？​玛​尔塔​*​从没​*​在乎​过​我​。​她​只是​个​*​诱饵​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​任务​是​把​我​，​还有​像​我​一样​的​其他​孩子​引诱​到​这里​。​这​戒指​根本​毫无意义​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dao4di3 you3mei2you3 ting1 wo3 shuo1hua4？Ma3er3ta3*cong2mei2*zai4hu5 guo4 wo3。ta1 zhi3shi4 ge4*you4er3*。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 ren4wu5 shi4 ba3 wo3，hai2you3 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4 de5 qi2ta1 hai2zi5 yin3you4 dao4 zhe4li3。zhe4 jie4zhi5 gen1ben3 hao2 wu2 yi4 yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She steps forward and grabs Marta by the shoulders. It's a curiously soft gesture.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Marta, if what you're saying is true - if you ever really did care for me - then please, give me your key. It's important."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​向前​一步​，​轻轻​抓住​玛​尔塔​的​双肩​。​这个​动作​带​着​奇异​的​温柔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​，​如果​你​说​的​是​真的​，​如果​你​曾经​真心​在乎​过​我​，​那么​请​把​钥匙​交给​我​。​这件​事​很​重要​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4qian2 yi1 bu4，qing1qing1 zhua1zhu4 Ma3er3ta3 de5 shuang1 jian1。zhe4ge5 dong4zuo4 dai4 zhao2 qi2yi4 de5 wen1rou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ru2guo3 ni3 shuo1 de5 shi4 zhen1de5，ru2guo3 ni3 ceng2jing1 zhen1xin1 zai4hu5 guo4 wo3，na4me5 qing3 ba3 yao4shi5 jiao1gei3 wo3。zhe4 jian4 shi4 hen3 zhong4yao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She stops, and turns back to face you. You can see the wariness behind her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Go ahead. Nobody’s stopping you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​停下​身​，​又​转​回来​面对​你​。​你​看见​她​眼中​闪过​一丝​戒备​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​吧​，​没人拦​着​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2xia4 shen1，you4 zhuai3 hui2lai5 mian4dui4 ni3。ni3 kan4jian4 ta1 yan3zhong1 shan3guo4 yi1 si1 jie4bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 ba1，mei2 ren2 lan2 zhao2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She straightens in her seat and tries on a smile. It hangs there for a second, then fades away. She sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"From my accent, you’ve no doubt inferred that I’m an Aztlaner.\n"
"\n"
"Further, you may have guessed who I work for."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​坐直​了​身子​，​勉强​挤出​一个​微笑​，​但​它​在​脸上​停留​片刻​又​随即​消失​。​她​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​从​我​的​口音​，​你​无疑​已经​猜到​我​是​阿兹特​兰人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​此外​，​你​或许​也​猜​到​了​我​的​雇主​是​谁​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zuo4 zhi2 le5 shen1zi5，mian3qiang3 ji3chu1 yi1ge5 wei1xiao4，dan4 ta1 zai4 lian3 shang4 ting2liu2 pian4ke4 you4 sui2ji2 xiao1shi1。ta1 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cong2 wo3 de5 kou3yin1，ni3 wu2yi2 yi3jing1 cai1 dao4 wo3 shi4 e1 zi1 te4 lan2 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ci3wai4，ni3 huo4xu3 ye3 cai1 dao4 le5 wo3 de5 gu4zhu3 shi4 shei2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She straightens to her full height.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let me give you a piece of advice. In the field, only two things matter: the mission, and survival. Everything else is a distraction.\n"
"\n"
"Your ridiculous politics have no place on a shadowrun."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​重新​挺直​身子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​奉劝​你​一句​。​战场​上​，​只有​两件事​最为​重要​：​任务​和​生存​。​其他​一切都是​干扰​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​那套​可笑​的​政治​把戏​在​暗影​狂奔​中​毫无用处​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 chong2xin1 ting3zhi2 shen1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 feng4quan4 ni3 yi1ju4。zhan4chang3 shang4，zhi3you3 liang3 jian4 shi4 zui4wei2 zhong4yao4：ren4wu5 he4 sheng1cun2。qi2ta1 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 gan1rao3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 na4 tao4 ke3xiao4 de5 zheng4zhi4 ba3xi4 zai4 an4Ying3kuang2ben1 zhong4 hao2 wu2 yong4 chu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She straightens up. Puts on a brave face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She'll be fine. She'll be back any second now.\n"
"\n"
"Just you wait."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​挺直​身子​。​脸上​努力​做出​一副​勇敢​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​会​没事​的​。​她​现在​随时​都​会​回来​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​等着瞧​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3zhi2 shen1zi5。lian3 shang4 nu3li4 zuo4chu1 yi1 fu4 yong3gan3 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 hui4 mei2shi4 de5。ta1 xian4zai4 sui2shi2 dou1 hui4 hui2lai5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 deng3zhe5qiao2 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She straightens. Casts a glance back at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know, $(l.name)... we *could* use this setup to our advantage."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​挺直​了​身子​。​回身​向​你​一瞥​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​，​$(l.name)​……​我们​*​可以​*​利用​这套​设备​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。hui2 shen1 xiang4 ni3 yi1pie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1，$(l.name)……wo3men5*ke3yi3*li4yong4 zhe4 tao4 she4bei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She straightens. Clears her throat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. You need anything else? Or can I get back to prepping for our next run?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​直​起身​来​，​清​清嗓子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​还有​别的​事​吗​？​没事​的话​，​我​就​继续​为​下次​行动​做​准备​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2 qi3shen1 lai2，qing1 qing1sang3zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？mei2shi4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 ji4xu4 wei2 xia4ci4 xing2dong4 zuo4 zhun3bei4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She straightens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Need anything else? Or can I get back to prepping for our next run?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​直​起身​来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​别的​事​吗​？​没事​的话​，​我​就​继续​为​下次​行动​做​准备​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhi2 qi3shen1 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 bie2de5 shi4 ma5？mei2shi4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 ji4xu4 wei2 xia4ci4 xing2dong4 zuo4 zhun3bei4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She struggles to calm herself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have to deal with irritating, insulting people every day at work. I don't like it, but I don't *murder* them! Sane people don't *do* that!\n"
"\n"
"I'm not going anywhere with you, $(l.name). I'll figure something out on my own."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​努力​让​自己​冷静下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​每天​上班​都​要​应付​那些​出言不逊​的​讨厌​家伙​。​我​不​喜欢​这样​，​但​我​可​不会​*​杀掉​*​他们​！​正常人​不会​*​干​*​那种​事​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不会​跟你走​，​$(l.name)​。​我会​自己​想​办法​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 nu3li4 rang4 zi4ji3 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei3tian1 shang4ban1 dou1 yao4 ying4fu5 na4xie1 chu1yan2bu4xun4 de5 tao3yan4 jia1huo5。wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 zhe4yang4，dan4 wo3 ke3 bu4hui4*sha1diao4*ta1men5！zheng1 chang2 ren2 bu4hui4*gan4*na4zhong3 shi4！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4hui4 gen1 ni3 zou3，$(l.name)。wo3 hui4 zi4ji3 xiang3 ban4fa3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She studies your face for a moment before responding.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that you might say that. \n"
"\n"
"I don't talk to many people, $(l.name). It just doesn't seem to be worth the effort."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​对​着​你​的​脸​端详​了​一会儿​之后​才​回话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​知道​你​也许​会​这么​说​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很少​和​人​交谈​，​$(l.name)​。​感觉​不​值得​我费​那个​劲​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dui4 zhao2 ni3 de5 lian3 duan1xiang2 le5 yi1hui4r5 zhi1hou4 cai2 hui2hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 ye3xu3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 shao3 he4 ren2 jiao1tan2，$(l.name)。gan3jue2 bu4 zhi2de5 wo3 fei4 na4ge5 jin4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She studies your face for a moment longer, then looks away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​盯​着​你​的​脸​看​了​一会儿​，​然后​移开​了​视线​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 lian3 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 yi2kai1 le5 shi4xian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She studies your face for a moment longer, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's true, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​盯​着​你​的​脸​看​了​一会儿​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​也​是​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 ding1 zhao2 ni3 de5 lian3 kan4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 ye3 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She swallows, then steps away from the panel.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm a big fan of my kneecaps.\n"
"\n"
"Tell you what... I'm going to climb back in my van and drive them somewhere far, far away."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​吞​了​下​口水​，​然后​离开​了​控制板​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​非常​珍惜​我​的​膝盖骨​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要​不​这样​吧​……​我​现在​就​钻​回​车里​去​，​然后​离​这里​远远​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 tun1 le5 xia4 kou3shui3，ran2hou4 li2kai1 le5 kong4 zhi4 ban3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 fei1chang2 zhen1xi1 wo3 de5 xi1gai4gu3。\n"
"\n"
"yao4 bu4 zhe4yang4 ba1……wo3 xian4zai4 jiu4 zuan1 hui2 che1 li3 qu4，ran2hou4 li2 zhe4li3 yuan3yuan3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... no, I haven't. I'm an electrician, not a criminal.\n"
"\n"
"I've never broken into anything, or shot at anyone in my *life.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​喉头​蠕动​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​没有​。​我​是​个​电工​，​不是​罪犯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​这辈子​*​从来​没有​过​入室​抢劫​，​或者​朝​谁​开枪​什么​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hou2tou2 ru2dong4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 mei2you3。wo3 shi4 ge4 dian4gong1，bu4shi4 zui4fan4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*zhe4 bei4 zi3*cong2lai2 mei2you3 guo4 ru4 shi4 qiang3jie2，huo4zhe3 chao2 shei2 kai1qiang1 shen2me5 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Um. My name is Jana.\n"
"\n"
"I was told to wait for you... that we'd be going into the building as a team?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​喉头​蠕动​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​。​我​叫​简娜​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​雇主​让​我​等​着​你​……​说​我们​要​作为​一个​团队​进入​大楼​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 hou2tou2 ru2dong4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4。wo3 jiao4 Jian3na4。\n"
"\n"
"gu4zhu3 rang4 wo3 deng3 zhao2 ni3……shuo1 wo3men5 yao4 zuo4wei2 yi1ge5 tuan2dui4 jin4ru4 da4lou2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well. Um. No.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not like you... not like the others. You should probably know that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​喉头​蠕动​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​，​不是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​不​一样​……​跟​其他人​也​不​一样​。​也许​该​让​你​知道​这件​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 hou2tou2 ru2dong4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4，bu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 bu4 yi1yang4……gen1 qi2 ta1 ren2 ye3 bu4 yi1yang4。ye3xu3 gai1 rang4 ni3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She swivels her head to look you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want to kill him, step aside. *I* will do it for you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​转过​头​看着​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不想​杀​了​他​，​就​上​一边​去​。​*​我​*​会替​你​动手​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 kan4 zhao2 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4xiang3 sha1 le5 ta1，jiu4 shang4 yi1bian1 qu4。*wo3*hui4 ti4 ni3 dong4shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes a deep breath and smiles up at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But you are not here for gossip. Shall we conclude our business? I could give you the display for... say... 200 nuyen?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​深吸​一口气​，​冲​你​露出​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​来​这里​肯定​不是​听​闲话​的​。​还是​聊​生意​吧​？​这个​破​显示器​……​你​就​给​……​200​新円好​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，chong1 ni3 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 lai2 zhe4li3 ken3ding4 bu4shi4 ting1 xian2hua4 de5。hai2shi5 liao2 sheng1yi4 ba1？zhe4ge5 po4 xian3shi4qi4……ni3 jiu4 gei3……200 xin1 yuan2 hao3 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes a deep breath, then lets it out slowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Seeing such things… it changes you. Makes you numb. But what I found when I arrived here was worse.\n"
"\n"
"This project… it horrifies me, $(l.name). And it must be stopped."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​深吸​了​一口气​，​然后​又​缓缓​吐出来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这种​事见​多​了​之后​……​会​改变​你​。​让​你​变得​麻木​。​但​当​我​来到​这里​时​，​发现​的​真相​更​令人发指​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​项目​……​它令​我​毛骨悚然​，​$(l.name)​。​我们​必须​想​办法​阻止​它​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3qi4，ran2hou4 you4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4zhong3 shi4 jian4 duo1 le5 zhi1hou4……hui4 gai3bian4 ni3。rang4 ni3 bian4de5 ma2mu4。dan4 dang1 wo3 lai2dao4 zhe4li3 shi2，fa1xian4 de5 zhen1xiang4 geng1 ling4ren2fa4zhi3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 xiang4mu4……ta1 ling3 wo3 mao2gu3song3ran2，$(l.name)。wo3men5 bi4xu1 xiang3 ban4fa3 zu3zhi3 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes a deep breath, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Okay."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​深吸​了​一口气​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​好​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3qi4，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，hao3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes a deep breath, then releases it slowly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's all right. I forgive you.\n"
"\n"
"You're an outsider... I shouldn't have expected you to understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​深吸​一口气​，​又​缓缓​吐​出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没关系​。​我​原谅​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​个​外来者​……​我​不该​指望​你​能​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2guan1xi5。wo3 yuan2liang4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 ge4 wai4 lai2 zhe3……wo3 bu4gai1 zhi3wang4 ni3 neng2 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes a deep breath, then shakes her head with a sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"God, that was sappy. Mental note: re-record this before $(l.name) gets a chance to see it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​深吸​一口气​，​随后​摇头​轻叹​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啧​，​刚才​那段​太​肉麻​了​。​提醒​自己​：​得​在​$(l.name)​看到​之前​重录​一遍​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，sui2hou4 yao2tou2 qing1 tan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ze2，gang1cai2 na4 duan4 tai4 rou4ma2 le5。ti2xing3 zi4ji3：de2 zai4 $(l.name) kan4dao4 zhi1qian2 chong2 lu4 yi1bian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes a deep breath, then slowly releases it. When she speaks, her voice comes out in a cool monotone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My family lived in Stuttgart.\n"
"\n"
"It was a nice enough place, I suppose. My parents worked as wageslaves for IFMU."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​深吸​一口气​，​又​缓缓​吐出来​。​随后​她​开口​说话​，​声音​中带​着​冰冷​的​单调​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​家人​住​在​斯图加特​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​地方​还​算​不错​吧​。​我​父母​在​IFMU​当着​薪奴​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，you4 huan3huan3 tu3 chu1 lai2。sui2hou4 ta1 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4，sheng1yin1 zhong4 dai4 zhao2 bing1leng3 de5 dan1diao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 jia1ren2 zhu4 zai4 si1tu2jia1te4。\n"
"\n"
"na4 di4fang1 hai2 suan4 bu4cuo4 ba1。wo3 fu4mu3 zai4 IFMU dang1zhe5 xin1 nu2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes a deep breath. Struggles to calm herself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you have more accusations to hurl at my husband, go ahead and do it - I'll tell you how wrong you are.\n"
"\n"
"I'd prefer to keep this conversation civil, but that's up to you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​深吸​一口气​，​努力​让​自己​平静下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​还有​更​多​指控​要加​在​我​丈夫​头上​，​尽管​说​—​—​我会​让​你​明白​自己​错得​有​多​离谱​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​更​希望​这场​对话​能​尽量​保持​文明​沟通​，​但​这​取决于​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shen1 xi1 yi1kou3qi4，nu3li4 rang4 zi4ji3 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 hai2you3 geng1 duo1 zhi3kong4 yao4 jia1 zai4 wo3 zhang4fu5 tou2shang4，jin3guan3 shuo1——wo3 hui4 rang4 ni3 ming2bai5 zi4ji3 cuo4 de2 you3 duo1 li2pu3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 geng1 xi1wang4 zhe4 chang2 dui4hua4 neng2 jin3liang4 bao3chi2 wen2ming2 gou1tong1，dan4 zhe4 qu3jue2yu2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes a swig from her glass, then eyes it suspiciously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\t\n"
"There’s *got* to be better boozeahol in Madrid."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​拿​起​杯子​喝​了​一口​，​然后​狐疑​地​盯​着​它​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​马德里​*​肯定​*​有​比​这​更好​的​酒​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 na2 qi3 bei1zi5 he4 le5 yi1kou3，ran2hou4 hu2yi2 de5 ding1 zhao2 ta1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ma3de2li3*ken3ding4*you3 bi3 zhe4 geng1 hao3 de5 jiu3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes another drag on her cigarette. The smoke spills out of her mouth as she speaks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Either Monika controlled the Kreuzbasar, or she had her fingers in so many pies that she might as well have. Comes out to the same thing either way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​抽​了​一口​香烟​，​一边​吐​着​烟气​一边​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要么​是​莫妮卡​控制​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​，​要么​就是​她​在​很多​业务​中​都​有​插手​。​无论​哪​种​情况​，​结果​都​是​一样​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 chou1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1，yi1bian1 tu3 zhao2 yan1qi4 yi1bian1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4me5 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3 kong4zhi4 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4，yao4me5 jiu4shi4 ta1 zai4 hen3 duo1 ye4wu4 zhong4 dou1 you3 cha1shou3。wu2lun4 na3 zhong3 qing2kuang4，jie1guo3 dou1 shi4 yi1yang4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes another drag, the light dancing in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, was that insensitive of me? Sorry.\n"
"\n"
"Guess I thought you'd have thicker skin."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​抽​了​一口​香烟​，​眼睛​里​闪烁着​精光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​，​我​是不是​太​迟钝​了​？​不好意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还​以为​你​没​这么​容易​破防​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 chou1 le5 yi1kou3 xiang1yan1，yan3jing5 li3 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 jing1guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1，wo3 shi4bu5shi4 tai4 chi2dun4 le5？bu4hao3yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2 yi3wei2 ni3 mei2 zhe4me5 rong2yi4 po4fang2 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes another look at the control module, scowling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No promises... but I can try."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​看​了​一眼​中控​模块​，​眉头​紧锁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没法​保证​什么​……​但​我​可以​试试​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 kan4 le5 yi1yan3 zhong4 kong4 mo2kuai4，mei2tou2 jin3 suo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2fa3 bao3zheng4 shen2me5……dan4 wo3 ke3yi3 shi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She takes another sip of scotch.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Better that it stay like this. If you need me for a run, I'm available - you just need to pay me first. Keeps things clean and simple."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​喝​了​一口​威士忌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​最好​还是​保持​现状​。​如果​你​需要​我​帮​你​跑​差事​，​这倒​没​问题​—​—​只要​你​先​付钱​给​我​。​咱们​明人​不说​暗话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 he4 le5 yi1kou3 wei1shi4ji4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zui4hao3 hai2shi5 bao3chi2 xian4zhuang4。ru2guo3 ni3 xu1yao4 wo3 bang1 ni3 pao2 cha4shi4，zhe4 dao3 mei2 wen4ti2——zhi3yao4 ni3 xian1 fu4qian2 gei3 wo3。zan2men5 ming2 ren2 bu4 shuo1 an4 hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She taps the screen of her PDA.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"According to this, yes. The penthouse's security system should be inactive."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​点​了​下​PDA​的​屏幕​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​根据​图纸​来看​，​是​这样​没错​。​顶层​公寓​的​安保​系统​应该​已经​下线​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 dian3 le5 xia4 PDA de5 ping2mu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gen1ju4 tu2zhi3 lai2 kan4，shi4 zhe4yang4 mei2cuo4。ding3ceng2 gong1yu4 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3 ying1gai1 yi3jing1 xia4xian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She then lowers her gaze from the heavens and regards you, her eyes showing slightly more clarity than before.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Been thinking. Remembering. Wondering."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​随后​将​视线​从​上方​收回​，​转而​盯​着​你​，​眼眸​中​的​神采​比​先前​清晰​了​些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​最近​在​思考​。​回忆​。​好奇​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 sui2hou4 jiang1 shi4xian4 cong2 shang4fang1 shou1hui2，zhuan3er2 ding1 zhao2 ni3，yan3mou2 zhong4 de5 shen2cai3 bi3 xian1qian2 qing1xi1 le5 xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zui4jin4 zai4 si1kao3。hui2yi4。hao4qi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She thinks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You will trust because I will lay my oath..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​想​了​想​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​相信​，​因为​我会​遵守​诺言​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang3 le5 xiang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 xiang1xin4，yin1wei4 wo3 hui4 zun1shou3 nuo4yan2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She tips an invisible hat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey there. Remember me from the cafe? Name’s Kami.\n"
"\n"
"Are you looking for something?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​扶​了​下​不​存在​的​帽子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​还​记得​我​吗​？​在​咖啡馆​的​那个​。​我​叫​卡米​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​找​什么​东西​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fu2 le5 xia4 bu4 cun2zai4 de5 mao4zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，hai2 ji4de5 wo3 ma5？zai4 ka1fei1guan3 de5 na4ge5。wo3 jiao4 Ka3mi3。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 zhao3 shen2me5 dong1xi1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She titters.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Volunteering information? That's bad for business!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​咯咯​地笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​我​主动​告诉​你​情报​？​生意​可不是​这么​做​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ge1ge1 de5 xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"rang4 wo3 zhu3dong4 gao4su4 ni3 qing2bao4？sheng1yi4 ke3bu5shi4 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She touches a commlink stud on her collar. You hear a burst of static.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Security! I've got intruders at the south gate!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​按​下​衣领​上​的​纽扣​式​通讯​链​。​你​听到​一阵​噼啪​杂音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​警卫​！​我​在​南门​发现​入侵者​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 an4 xia4 yi1ling3 shang4 de5 niu3kou4 shi4 tong1xun4 lian4。ni3 ting1dao4 yi1zhen4 pi1pa1 za2yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jing3wei4！wo3 zai4 nan2 men2 fa1xian4 ru4qin1zhe3！"

