"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"di4yi1lun2 jiu3 wo3 qing3ke4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1jian1 ken3ding4 you3 bu4shao3 hua4ti2。"

