"{{GM}}​她​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​吧​，​$(l.name)​。​去​找​阿尔杰​农​谈谈​。​在​这​一切​发生​后​，​我​相信​他​见到​你​会​很​高兴​。​但​记住​我​告诉​过​你​的话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 ba1，$(l.name)。qu4 zhao3 E1er3jie2nong2 tan2tan2。zai4 zhe4 yi1qie4 fa1sheng1 hou4，wo3 xiang1xin4 ta1 jian4dao4 ni3 hui4 hen3 gao1xing4。dan4 ji4zhu5 wo3 gao4su4 guo4 ni3 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
