"{{GM}}​她​转过​脸去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没什么​。​但​在​这种​地方​，​单人​独揽大权​是​十分​危险​的​。​不是​针对​某个​人​，​而是​每个​人​都​是​如此​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​最​不​希望​看到​的​就是​你​突然​暴毙​，​然后​这​地方​再次​分崩离析​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 lian3 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5。dan4 zai4 zhe4zhong3 di4fang1，dan1ren2 du2 lan3 dai4 quan2 shi4 shi2fen1 wei1xian3 de5。bu4shi4 zhen1dui4 mou3 ge4 ren2，er2shi4 mei3ge4 ren2 dou1 shi4 ru2ci3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zui4 bu4 xi1wang4 kan4dao4 de5 jiu4shi4 ni3 tu1ran2 bao4bi4，ran2hou4 zhe4 di4fang1 zai4ci4 fen1beng1li2xi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
