"{{GM}}​她​转过​脸去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​最​不​希望​看到​的​就是​你​突然​暴毙​，​然后​这​地方​再次​分崩离析​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 lian3 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zui4 bu4 xi1wang4 kan4dao4 de5 jiu4shi4 ni3 tu1ran2 bao4bi4，ran2hou4 zhe4 di4fang1 zai4ci4 fen1beng1li2xi1。"

