"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gai1 zou3 le5。wo3 de2 wei2 xia4ci4 xing2dong4 zuo4 zhun3bei4 le5，er2qie3 bi3qi3 kan4 wo3 shou1shi5 dong1xi1，ni3 ying1gai1 you3 geng1 zhong4yao4 de5 shi4 yao4 zuo4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You should go. I’ve got prep work to do for our next run."
