"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gai1 zou3 le5。wo3 ye3 de2 wei2 xia4ci4 xing2dong4 zuo4 zhun3bei4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns back to Enstad, staring him down.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
