"{{GM}}​她​转身​面对​恩施​塔德​，​目光如炬​地​盯​着​他​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​你​真​以为​我们​会为​一个​不值钱​的​小玩意儿​牺牲​我们​的​职业​操守​和​一万五千​新円​的​报酬​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 en1Shi1ta3de2，mu4 guang1 ru2 ju4 de5 ding1 zhao2 ta1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ni3 zhen1 yi3wei2 wo3men5 hui4 wei2 yi1ge5 bu4zhi2qian2 de5 xiao3 wan2 yi4 er2 xi1sheng1 wo3men5 de5 zhi2ye4 cao1shou3 he4 yi1 wan4 wu3 qian1 xin1 yuan2 de5 bao4chou5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns back to the disassembled components of her rifle.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
