"{{GM}}​她​的​语气​一下子​激烈​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​明知​*​我们​没有​钱​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​你​本​就​打算​拒绝​的话​，​为什么​还要​戏弄​我们​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 yu3qi4 yi1xia4zi5 ji1lie4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*ming2zhi1*wo3men5 mei2you3 qian2！\n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 ni3 ben3 jiu4 da3suan4 ju4jue2 de5hua4，wei4shen2me5 hai2 yao4 xi4nong4 wo3men5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to face the Engineer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You got anything to add to that, Yuli?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​转过身​看​向​工程师​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有​什么​要​补充​的​吗​，​尤里​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 kan4 xiang4 gong1cheng2shi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3 shen2me5 yao4 bu3chong1 de5 ma5，You2li3？"

