msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​转向​APEX​提供​的​巨大​无人机​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​庭院​里​有​安保​巡逻​人员​，​我们​可以​用​这​东西​来​对付​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 APEX ti2gong1 de5 ju4da4 wu2ren2ji1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ting2yuan4 li3 you3 an1bao3 xun2luo2 ren2yuan2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 yong4 zhe4 dong1xi1 lai2 dui4fu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Get me to a building access terminal on this floor, and I can rewire the elevator. That's the first thing that we need to do.\n"
"\n"
"Once we're upstairs, we use the code I was given, I rewire Aleshire's security system, and we hide the cameras in his apartment."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​转过​来​面对​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​带我去​本​楼层​的​检修​口​，​我​就​能​重接​电梯​控制​。​这是​我们​首先​要​完成​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​我们​上楼​后​，​用​我​得到​的​密码​，​然后​我会​重接​阿利​希尔​的​安保​系统​，​把​摄像头​藏进​他​的​公寓​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 lai2 mian4dui4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dai4 wo3 qu4 ben3 lou2ceng2 de5 jian3xiu1 kou3，wo3 jiu4 neng2 chong2 jie1 dian4ti1 kong4zhi4。zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 shou3xian1 yao4 wan2cheng2 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"deng3 wo3men5 shang4lou2 hou4，yong4 wo3 de2dao4 de5 mi4ma3，ran2hou4 wo3 hui4 chong2 jie1 e1 li4 xi1er3 de5 an1bao3 xi4tong3，ba3 she4xiang4tou2 zang4 jin4 ta1 de5 gong1yu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to stare at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)... just what have you gotten us into?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​转过​来​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​……​你​到底​把​我们​卷进​什么​麻烦​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 lai2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……ni3 dao4di3 ba3 wo3men5 juan3 jin4 shen2me5 ma2fan5 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to stare at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What have you gotten us into, fearless leader?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​转过​来​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无畏​领袖​，​你​把​我们​卷进​什么​麻烦​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 lai2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4，ni3 ba3 wo3men5 juan3 jin4 shen2me5 ma2fan5 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to stare at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're not suggesting that we let this monster live, are you?\n"
"\n"
"Do you know what's going to happen when his cyberware powers back up?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​转过​来​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不会​是​想​说​我们​要放​这个​畜生​一条​活路​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​等到​他​的​赛博​改造​恢复​动力​之后​会​发生​什么​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 lai2 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 shi4 xiang3 shuo1 wo3men5 yao4 fang4 zhe4ge5 chu4sheng5 yi1 tiao2 huo2lu4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 deng3dao4 ta1 de5 sai4bo2 gai3zao4 hui1fu4 dong4li4 zhi1hou4 hui4 fa1sheng1 shen2me5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to you, conflicted.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm not sure anything deserves this, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"All the same... we can't just set her free."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​满脸​纠结​地​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没人​该​受​这样​的​罪​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​话说回来​……​我们​也​不能​直接​放​她​自由​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man3lian3 jiu1jie2 de5 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 gai1 shou4 zhe4yang4 de5 zui4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5……wo3men5 ye3 bu4neng2 zhi2jie1 fang4 ta1 zi4you2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to you, conflicted.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nothing deserves this, $(l.name). \n"
"\n"
"But all the same... we can't just set her free."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​满脸​纠结​地​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没人​该​受​这样​的​罪​，​$(l.name)​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​话说回来​……​我们​也​不能​直接​放​她​自由​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man3lian3 jiu1jie2 de5 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2 ren2 gai1 shou4 zhe4yang4 de5 zui4，$(l.name)。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5……wo3men5 ye3 bu4neng2 zhi2jie1 fang4 ta1 zi4you2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It was the right choice to make. The Firewing was insane and dangerous. She had to be put down."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​正确​的​选择​。​火翼​疯癫​而​危险​。​必须​要​干掉​她​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 zheng4que4 de5 xuan3ze2。Huo3yi4 feng1dian1 er2 wei1xian3。bi4xu1 yao4 gan4diao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She turns to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nevertheless... we can't just set her free."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​……​我们​不能​直接​放​她​自由​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2……wo3men5 bu4neng2 zhi2jie1 fang4 ta1 zi4you2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She unscrews the cap from the jar, revealing a pale white ointment. The surface glitters strangely in the dim light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you ever wondered where my share of the take from our jobs has gone, this is the answer.\n"
"\n"
"Powdered orichalcum isn't cheap."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​拧开​盖子​，​露出​一罐​淡​白色​的​药膏​。​在​昏暗​的​光线​下​，​药膏​表面​泛着​诡异​的​微光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​曾​好奇​过​我​的​那​一份​钱​到底​用到​哪儿​了​，​答案​就​在​这里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​奥利​哈钢​粉末​可不​便宜​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ning3kai1 gai4zi5，lu4chu1 yi1 guan4 dan4 bai2se4 de5 yao4gao1。zai4 hun1an4 de5 guang1xian4 xia4，yao4gao1 biao3mian4 fan4 zhao2 gui3yi4 de5 wei1guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 ceng2 hao4qi2 guo4 wo3 de5 na4 yi1 fen4 qian2 dao4di3 yong4 dao4 na3r5 le5，da2an4 jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3。\n"
"\n"
"ao4 li4 ha1 gang1 fen3mo4 ke3bu5 bian4yi2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She visibly relaxes just a little.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"'Bout time someone had some good new around here! Go ahead and install it right away."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​明显​放松​了​一点​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总算​有人​带来​些​好消息​了​！​赶紧​安装​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ming2xian3 fang4song1 le5 yi1dian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3suan4 you3ren2 dai4lai2 xie1 hao3 xiao1 xi1 le5！gan3jin3 an1zhuang1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She waves at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Another time, then. Have a great day!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​摆摆手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​下次​吧​。​祝​你​今天​愉快​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 bai3 bai3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 xia4ci4 ba1。zhu4 ni3 jin1tian1 yu2kuai4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She waves her arms in exasperation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wasn't even working on the power system, you dolt! How could I have done ANYTHING to the power grid?\n"
"\n"
"It DOESN'T WORK LIKE THAT!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​愤怒​地​挥舞​着​双臂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当时​甚至​都​没有​碰​电力系统​，​你​这​白痴​！​我​怎么​可能​会​影响​到​电网​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​根本​就​不是​这么回事​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 fen4nu4 de5 hui1wu3 zhao2 shuang1bi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1shi2 shen4zhi4 dou1 mei2you3 peng4 dian4 li4 xi4 tong3，ni3 zhe4 bai2chi1！wo3 zen3me5 ke3neng2 hui4 ying3xiang3 dao4 dian4wang3？\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 gen1ben3 jiu4 bu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She waves to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Goodbye, now!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​朝​你​摆摆手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chao2 ni3 bai3 bai3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She wheels to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Why are you listening to her? She's just telling you what you want to hear. That's her whole purpose here, remember? She's *bait!*\n"
"\n"
"Why should we listen to *anything* that she has to say?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​猛地​转身​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​为何​要​听​她​的​？​她​不过​是​在​说​你​想​听​的话​罢了​。​这​就是​她​存在​的​全部​意义​，​记得​吗​？​她​就是​个​*​诱饵​*​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​凭​什么​要​听​她​说​的​*​任何​*​一句​话​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 meng3de5 zhuan3shen1 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 wei4he2 yao4 ting1 ta1 de5？ta1 bu4guo4 shi4 zai4 shuo1 ni3 xiang3 ting1 de5hua4 ba4le5。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1 cun2zai4 de5 quan2bu4 yi4yi4，ji4de5 ma5？ta1 jiu4shi4 ge4*you4er3*！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 ping2 shen2me5 yao4 ting1 ta1 shuo1 de5*ren4he2*yi1ju4 hua4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}She whoops loudly and pats you on the shoulder.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Oh goodness no! Listen, it's not like that. I'll tell you all about it sometime, but there's no need to worry about the nature of our relationship."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​大笑​出​声​，​并​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​不​不​！​不是​你​想​的​那样​。​我​改天​会​详细​告诉​你​，​但​你​不必​担心​我们​之间​有​什么​猫腻​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 da4xiao4 chu1 sheng1，bing4 pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 bu4 bu4！bu4shi4 ni3 xiang3 de5 na4yang4。wo3 gai3tian1 hui4 xiang2xi4 gao4su4 ni3，dan4 ni3 bu4bi4 dan1xin1 wo3men5 zhi1jian1 you3 shen2me5 mao1ni4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Short-circuit the front door lock.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​使​正门​的​锁​短路​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shi3 zheng4men2 de5 suo3 duan3lu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Shove her hand away.{{/GM}} Poke me again. I dare you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​甩开​她​的​手​。​{{/GM}}​再​戳​我​一次​试试​。\n"
"{{GM}} shuai3kai1 ta1 de5 shou3。{{/GM}} zai4 chuo1 wo3 yi1ci4 shi4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Shrug.{{/GM}} Fair enough. I'm not questioning your professionalism, "
"Eiger... as your team leader, I was concerned. If you say that I have no "
"reason to worry, then I won't."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​行​吧​。​我​不是​在​质疑​你​的​专业​能力​，​艾格尔​……​我​只是​作为​队长​表示​关心​。​不过​既然​你​都​这么​说​了​，​那​我​愿意​相信​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} song3jian1。{{/GM}} xing2 ba1。wo3 bu4shi4 zai4 zhi4yi2 ni3 de5 zhuan1ye4 neng2li4，Ai4ge2er3……wo3 zhi3shi4 zuo4wei2 dui4zhang3 biao3shi4 guan1xin1。bu4guo4 ji4ran2 ni3 dou1 zhe4me5 shuo1 le5，na4 wo3 yuan4yi4 xiang1xin4 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Shrug.{{/GM}} Hey, man, it's not my call. I just do what they tell me "
"to."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​兄弟​，​这​事儿​又​不是​我​决定​的​。​我​只是​在​执行命令​。\n"
"{{GM}} song3jian1。{{/GM}} xiong1di4，zhe4 shi4r5 you4 bu4shi4 wo3 jue2ding4 de5。wo3 zhi3shi4 zai4 zhi2 xing2 ming4 ling3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Shrug.{{/GM}} I'd kill them first."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​那​我会​先下手为强​。\n"
"{{GM}} song3jian1。{{/GM}} na4 wo3 hui4 xian1xia4shou3wei2qiang2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Shrug.{{/GM}} No. That kind of thing is a part of the job."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​没什么​。​都​是​差事​的​一部分​。\n"
"{{GM}} song3jian1。{{/GM}} mei2shen2me5。dou1 shi4 cha4shi4 de5 yi1bu4fen5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Shrug.{{/GM}} Probably. But they couldn't hurt."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​也许​吧​。​但​这样​总​没什么​坏处​。\n"
"{{GM}} song3jian1。{{/GM}} ye3xu3 ba1。dan4 zhe4yang4 zong3 mei2shen2me5 huai4chu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Shut down the cell and kill her.{{/GM}} No. You’re going to die for "
"your crimes, monster. See you in hell."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​关闭​舱室​并​杀死​她​。​{{/GM}}​你​要​为​自己​的​罪行​偿命​，​怪物​。​下​地狱​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} guan1bi4 cang1 shi4 bing4 sha1si3 ta1。{{/GM}} ni3 yao4 wei2 zi4ji3 de5 zui4xing2 chang2ming4，guai4wu5。xia4 di4yu4 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Shut the terminal down.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​关闭​终端​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} guan1bi4 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Silke looks up at you, a look of abject misery plastered across her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Leave me alone, okay?\n"
"\n"
"I've got problems to deal with."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​西​尔克​抬头​看着​你​，​脸上​写满​了​沮丧​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别来​烦​我​，​行​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还有​一大堆​麻烦事​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Xi1er3ke4 tai2tou2 kan4 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 xie3 man3 le5 ju3sang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3，xing2 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2you3 yi1 dai4 dui1 ma2 fan2 shi4 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Silke looks up at you. Where you used to see only pain, now there's something else visible in her face. Determination.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm really going to do it. I'm taking the next train to the Kreuzbasar. \n"
"\n"
"Wish I could get my stuff back from my room first, though. Stupid gang, closing the whole hotel."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​西​尔克​抬头​注视​着​你​。​你​之前​看时​，​她​的​脸上​只有​痛苦​，​现在​却​多​了​一份​决心​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​决定​了​。​我会​乘下​一班​地铁​去​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不过​，​我​还是​很​想​先​从​房间​里​把​东西​拿​回来​。​这​帮派​真​弱智​，​关​旅馆​干什么​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Xi1er3ke4 tai2tou2 zhu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。ni3 zhi1qian2 kan4 shi2，ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 zhi3you3 tong4ku3，xian4zai4 que4 duo1 le5 yi1 fen4 jue2xin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2ding4 le5。wo3 hui4 cheng2 xia4 yi1 ban1 di4tie3 qu4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guo4，wo3 hai2shi5 hen3 xiang3 xian1 cong2 fang2jian1 li3 ba3 dong1xi1 na2 hui2lai5。zhe4 bang1pai4 zhen1 ruo4zhi4，guan1 lu:3guan3 gan4shen2me5 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Simmy Kim is still here, looking more alert than ever. Her chipjack is conspicuously empty for a change. She even smiles when she sees you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're back!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金阿吸​依旧​在​这里​，​而且​神志​看起来​比​以往​清楚​多​了​。​令​你​没想到​的​是​，​这次​她​的​芯片​插口​居然​空空如也​。​她​见到​你​的​时候​甚至​露出​了​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​回来​了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 e1 xi1 yi1jiu4 zai4 zhe4li3，er2qie3 shen2zhi4 kan4qi3lai5 bi3 yi3wang3 qing1chu5 duo1 le5。ling3 ni3 mei2xiang3dao4 de5 shi4，zhe4 ci4 ta1 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3 ju1ran2 kong1kong1ru2ye3。ta1 jian4dao4 ni3 de5 shi2hou5 shen4zhi4 lu4chu1 le5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hui2lai5 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Simmy Kim leans against a wall, her head downcast and her face lost in shadow. Sensing your presence, she looks up, revealing a black eye poorly covered by concealer. And still she smiles at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hello, $(l.name). How are you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金阿吸​倚​在​墙壁​上​，​垂首​低头​，​面容​隐没​在​阴影​中​。​察觉到​你​的​存在​，​她​抬起头来​，​露出​一只​被​遮瑕膏​勉强​掩盖​的​黑眼圈​。​即便如此​，​她​仍​对​你​展露​笑颜​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​$(l.name)​。​最近​过​的​怎么样​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 e1 xi1 yi3 zai4 qiang2bi4 shang4，chui2 shou3 di1tou2，mian4rong2 yin3mo4 zai4 yin1ying3 zhong4。cha2 jiao4 dao4 ni3 de5 cun2zai4，ta1 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2，lu4chu1 yi1 zhi3 bei4 zhe1xia2gao1 mian3qiang3 yan3gai4 de5 hei1yan3quan1。ji2 bian4 ru2 ci3，ta1 reng2 dui4 ni3 zhan3lu4 xiao4yan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，$(l.name)。zui4jin4 guo4 de5 zen3me5yang4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Simmy Kim plays with her hair, trying to pull it down to hide her black eye, to no real effect.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You again?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金阿吸​拨弄​着​头发​，​试图​将​它​垂下来​遮住​黑眼圈​，​但​并​没什么​效果​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​是​你​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 e1 xi1 bo1nong4 zhao2 tou2fa5，shi4tu2 jiang1 ta1 chui2 xia4 lai2 zhe1zhu4 hei1yan3quan1，dan4 bing4 mei2shen2me5 xiao4guo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 shi4 ni3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Simmy Kim seems as lost as ever, standing in the middle of the Kreuzbasar, observing all the activity around her. To her credit, she has not retreated into one of her sims today.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So much is happening."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金阿吸​仍​像​往常​一样​，​迷茫​地站​在​克罗伊​茨​集市​中​，​望​着​周围​熙熙攘攘​的​人群​。​值得​称道​的​是​，​她​今天​没有​躲进​自己​的​拟感​世界​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​发生​了​好多​事情​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 e1 xi1 reng2 xiang4 wang3chang2 yi1yang4，mi2mang2 de5 zhan4 zai4 ke4 luo2 yi1 ci2 ji2shi4 zhong4，wang4 zhao2 zhou1wei2 xi1xi1rang3rang3 de5 ren2qun2。zhi2de5 cheng1dao4 de5 shi4，ta1 jin1tian1 mei2you3 duo3 jin4 zi4ji3 de5 ni3 gan3 shi4jie4 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fa1sheng1 le5 hao3duo1 shi4qing5 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Simmy Kim weaves an akward dance through scattered refuse. Her too-thin legs wobble, but she keeps her footing throughout.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The sun will come out, tomorrow. Bet your bottom dollar that tomorrow, there'll be sun..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​金阿吸​在​散落​的​垃圾​间​笨拙​地​穿行​。​她​纤细​得​过分​的​双腿​不断​摇晃​，​却​始终​稳稳​站​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​太阳​明天​会​升​起来​。​我敢​打赌​，​明天​一定​会​有​太阳​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jin1 e1 xi1 zai4 san3luo4 de5 la1ji1 jian1 ben4zhuo1 de5 chuan1xing2。ta1 xian1xi4 de2 guo4fen4 de5 shuang1tui3 bu4duan4 yao2huang4，que4 shi3zhong1 wen3 wen3 zhan4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"tai4yang5 ming2tian1 hui4 sheng1 qi3lai5。wo3 gan3 da3du3，ming2tian1 yi1ding4 hui4 you3 tai4yang5……"

msgid "{{GM}}Skip it.{{/GM}} Alice, I'm done."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​跳过​。​{{/GM}}​爱丽丝​，​我​读完​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} tiao4guo4。{{/GM}} ai4li4si1，wo3 dou4 wan2 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Slave the Cyberzombie to your commlink and activate it.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​将​赛博​僵尸​关联​到​你​的​通讯​链​并​激活​它​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jiang1 sai4bo2 jiang1shi1 guan1lian2 dao4 ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 bing4 ji1huo2 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slot a credstick.{{/GM}} You're probably right, but it couldn't hurt "
"to check."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​插入​一根​信用​棒​。​{{/GM}}​也许​吧​，​但​检查一下​也​没什么​坏处​。\n"
"{{GM}} cha1ru4 yi1 gen1 xin4yong4 bang4。{{/GM}} ye3xu3 ba1，dan4 jian3 cha2 yi1 xia4 ye3 mei2shen2me5 huai4chu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, a smile spreads across his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This thing is like a master key for communications systems. With this box plugged into my deck, I could hack the commlink of just about anyone in the same room as me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​脸上​慢慢​绽开​一抹​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​东西​好比​是​通信​系统​的​万能钥匙​。​只要​把​它​插入​我​的​碟​板​，​我​就​能​破解​同处​一室​的​任何人​的​通讯​链​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 man4man4 zhan4kai1 yi1 ma1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 hao3bi3 shi4 tong1xin4 xi4tong3 de5 wan4neng2yao4shi5。zhi3yao4 ba3 ta1 cha1ru4 wo3 de5 die2 ban3，wo3 jiu4 neng2 po4jie3 tong2 chu3 yi1 shi4 de5 ren4 he2 ren2 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, a smile spreads across his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This thing is like a master key for communications systems. With this thing plugged into my deck, I could hack the commlink of just about anyone in the same room as me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​的​脸上​慢慢​绽开​一抹​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​东西​好比​是​通信​系统​的​万能钥匙​。​只要​把​它​插入​我​的​碟​板​，​我​就​能​破解​同处​一室​的​任何人​的​通讯​链​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 lian3 shang4 man4man4 zhan4kai1 yi1 ma1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dong1xi1 hao3bi3 shi4 tong1xin4 xi4tong3 de5 wan4neng2yao4shi5。zhi3yao4 ba3 ta1 cha1ru4 wo3 de5 die2 ban3，wo3 jiu4 neng2 po4jie3 tong2 chu3 yi1 shi4 de5 ren4 he2 ren2 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. I'll admit, I was torn about this myself. As much as I want Harrow dead, I don't want any other street kids to have to go through what I experienced here.\n"
"\n"
"If we can spare even one of them that horror, all of this will be worth it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​我​承认​，​我​自己​也​为此​纠结​过​。​尽管​我​恨不得​哈罗​死​掉​，​但​我​不想​让​其他​街头​孩子​再​经历​我​在​这里​遭遇​的​那些​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​只要​能​让​其中​哪怕​一个​孩子​免受​那种​恐怖​，​这​一切​就​都​值得​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 cheng2ren4，wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 wei4ci3 jiu1jie2 guo4。jin3guan3 wo3 hen4bu5de5 ha1luo2 si3 diao4，dan4 wo3 bu4xiang3 rang4 qi2ta1 jie1tou2 hai2zi5 zai4 jing1li4 wo3 zai4 zhe4li3 zao1yu4 de5 na4xie1 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhi3yao4 neng2 rang4 qi2zhong1 na3pa4 yi1ge5 hai2zi5 mian3shou4 na4zhong3 kong3bu4，zhe4 yi1qie4 jiu4 dou1 zhi2de5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right. I'll admit, I was torn about this myself. As much as I want to rescue these kids, Harrow has to be stopped - permanently.\n"
"\n"
"If some cultists have to die in order for that to happen, then so be it. It's a sacrifice that we'll have to make."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​我​承认​，​我​自己​也​为此​纠结​过​。​尽管​我​无比​渴望​拯救​这些​孩子​，​但​我们​必须​彻底​阻止​哈罗​的​暴行​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​为此​需要​牺牲​一部分​教徒​，​那​就​这样​吧​。​这是​我们​必须​付出​的​代价​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。wo3 cheng2ren4，wo3 zi4ji3 ye3 wei4ci3 jiu1jie2 guo4。jin3guan3 wo3 wu2bi3 ke3wang4 zheng3jiu4 zhe4Xie1hai2zi5，dan4 wo3men5 bi4xu1 che4di3 zu3zhi3 ha1luo2 de5 bao4xing2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 wei4ci3 xu1yao4 xi1sheng1 yi1bu4fen5 jiao4tu2，na4 jiu4 zhe4yang4 ba1。zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 bi4xu1 fu4chu1 de5 dai4jia4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, she nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We make life and death calls all the time in the shadows. This is no different.\n"
"\n"
"Letting Harrow live would be the greater evil. Let's destroy this thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​暗影​圈​，​我们​时刻​都​要​作出​生死​抉择​。​这次​也​不​例外​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​哈罗​活下去​才​是​更​大​的​罪恶​。​我们​干掉​这​东西​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 an4ying3 juan1，wo3men5 shi2ke4 dou1 yao4 zuo4chu1 sheng1si3 jue2ze2。zhe4 ci4 ye3 bu4 li4wai4。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 ha1luo2 huo2xia4qu4 cai2 shi4 geng1 dai4 de5 zui4e4。wo3men5 gan4diao4 zhe4 dong1xi1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, she rises. She looks you in the eye, a quizzical expression on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I can feel it. The spirit.\n"
"\n"
"It's bound to me now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​起身​，​目光​直视​着​你​，​脸上​带​着​疑惑​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我能​感受​到​它​。​那个​精魂​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​它​现在​与​我​紧密​相连​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 qi3shen1，mu4guang1 zhi2shi4 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 yi2huo4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 neng2 gan3shou4 dao4 ta1。na4ge5 jing1hun2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 xian4zai4 yu4 wo3 jin3mi4 xiang1lian2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, she turns to face the flickering projection. Flames continue to lick up from the chrome of her hand, and the metal glows like molten glass. When she speaks, her voice is strangely calm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What needed to be done.\n"
"\n"
"See you in the real world, Harrow."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​缓缓​转身​，​面对​闪烁​的​投影​。​火焰​仍​在​她​金属​手掌​的​镀铬​表面​翻卷​，​金属​如​熔融​玻璃​般​炽热​发光​。​她​开口​说话​时​，​声音​却​异常​平静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​做​我​该​做​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现实​世界​见​，​哈罗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 huan3huan3 zhuan3shen1，mian4dui4 shan3shuo4 de5 tou2ying3。huo3yan4 reng2 zai4 ta1 jin1shu3 shou3zhang3 de5 du4 ge4 biao3mian4 fan1juan3，jin1shu3 ru2 rong2rong2 bo1li5 ban1 chi4re4 fa1guang1。ta1 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4 shi2，sheng1yin1 que4 yi4chang2 ping2jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zuo4 wo3 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"xian4shi2 shi4jie4 jian4，ha1luo2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, the initiate seems to calm down.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, you're right.\n"
"\n"
"But if you don't want to hurt anyone, why are you here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​学徒​似乎​慢慢​冷静​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​你​说得对​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​如果​你们​不想​伤害​任何人​，​那​你们​来​这里​做​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xue2tu2 si4hu1 man4man4 leng3jing4 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ru2guo3 ni3men5 bu4xiang3 shang1hai4 ren4 he2 ren2，na4 ni3men5 lai2 zhe4li3 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Slowly, the ork's eyes shift from Eiger to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know the t-t-troll-bitch. W-we have history. But y-you - you are a s-stranger to m-m-me.\n"
"\n"
"Are y-you sure th-th-that you have the s-stomach for this, s-stranger? N-not many do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​的​眼神​慢慢​从​艾格尔​转到​你​身上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​-​我​认识​这个​巨魔​贱人​。​我​-​我们​有些​恩怨​。​但​你​-​你​对​我​来说​是​-​是​个​陌生人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​-​你​有​-​有​这个​胆子​吗​？​一般​人​做​-​做​不到​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 de5 yan3shen2 man4man4 cong2 Ai4ge2er3 zhuai3 dao4 ni3 shen1shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 -wo3 ren4shi5 zhe4ge5 ju4mo2 jian4ren2。wo3 -wo3men5 you3xie1 en1yuan4。dan4 ni3 -ni3 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 shi4 -shi4 ge4 mo4sheng1ren2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 -ni3 you3 -you3 zhe4ge5 dan3zi5 ma5？yi1ban1 ren2 zuo4 -zuo4 bu4dao4 de5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Smash Monika's cyberdeck.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​砸毁​莫妮卡​的​赛博碟板​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} za2hui3 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 sai4 bo2 die2 ban3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Smash the boards and jump down.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​砸碎​地板​并​跳下去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} za2sui4 di4ban3 bing4 tiao4 xia4 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Smash the glass.{{/GM}} Okay, vase, you're coming with me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​砸碎​玻璃​。​{{/GM}}​好​了​，​小​花瓶​，​跟我走​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} za2sui4 bo1li5。{{/GM}} hao3 le5，xiao3 hua1ping2，gen1 wo3 zou3 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Smash the plastic.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​砸坏​塑料​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} za2huai4 su4liao4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Sneak up behind him.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​悄悄​走到​他​背后​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} qiao1qiao1 zou3 dao4 ta1 bei4hou4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Something changes in Marta's face. It twists. Becomes ugly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're both liars. You're both MONSTERS! I WON'T LET YOU DO THIS!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​玛​尔塔​的​脸变​了​模样​。​她​面色​扭曲​。​形容​丑陋​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​都​是​骗子​。​你们​都​是​怪物​！​我​不会​让​你们​得逞​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ma3er3ta3 de5 lian3 bian4 le5 mu2yang4。ta1 mian4se4 niu3qu1。xing2rong2 chou3lou4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 dou1 shi4 pian4zi5。ni3men5 dou1 shi4 guai4wu5！wo3 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3men5 de2cheng3 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Spittle flies as Vauclair's hoarse voice turns into a desperate shriek.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I. AM. *NOT.* A. *MONSTER!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​沙哑​的​声音​突然​变成​绝望​的​尖叫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​。​不​。​是​。​禽​。​兽​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 sha1ya3 de5 sheng1yin1 tu1ran2 bian4cheng2 jue2wang4 de5 jian1jiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3。bu4。shi4。qin2。shou4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Stahl fixes Alexander with a stern gaze.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"YOU swore an OATH to us, Alexander! You will BE A MAN and KEEP IT!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​斯塔尔​用​严厉​的​目光​盯​着​亚历山大​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​对​组织​发过​誓​，​亚历山大​！​给​我​像​个​男人​一样​遵守​誓言​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Si1ta3er3 yong4 yan2li4 de5 mu4guang1 ding1 zhao2 ya4li4shan1da4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dui4 zu3zhi1 fa1 guo4 shi4，ya4li4shan1da4！gei3 wo3 xiang4 ge4 nan2ren2 yi1yang4 zun1shou3 shi4yan2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Stand down.{{/GM}} Fair enough. This is between you and her - if you "
"want to end it this way, don't let me stop you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​退​下​。​{{/GM}}​好​吧​。​这​是​你​和​她​之间​的​事​。​如果​你​想要​用​这种​方式​结束​，​我​不会​阻拦​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} tui4 xia4。{{/GM}} hao3 ba1。zhe4 shi4 ni3 he4 ta1 zhi1jian1 de5 shi4。ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3yao4 yong4 zhe4zhong3 fang1shi4 jie2shu4，wo3 bu4hui4 zu3lan2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Stand down.{{/GM}} On second thought, maybe you're right. Go ahead and"
" do what you need to do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​退​开​。​{{/GM}}​我​又​想​了​想​，​也许​你​说得对​。​去​吧​，​做​你​该​做​的​事​。\n"
"{{GM}} tui4 kai1。{{/GM}} wo3 you4 xiang3 le5 xiang3，ye3xu3 ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。qu4 ba1，zuo4 ni3 gai1 zuo4 de5 shi4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Stand.{{/GM}} What... what the hell are you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​起身​。​{{/GM}}​你​……​你​到底​是​什么​？\n"
"{{GM}} qi3shen1。{{/GM}} ni3……ni3 dao4di3 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Staring at you, he slowly nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It is my life. My *entire* life. My reason for being."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​盯​着​你​，​缓缓​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​我​的​生命​。​我​的​*​整个​*​生命​。​我​存在​的​意义​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ding1 zhao2 ni3，huan3huan3 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 wo3 de5 sheng1ming4。wo3 de5*zheng3ge4*sheng1ming4。wo3 cun2zai4 de5 yi4yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Start walking.{{/GM}} Let's get moving before Knight Errant sends "
"reinforcements."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​继续前进​。​{{/GM}}​赶紧​走​吧​，​免得​游侠​骑士​再​派​增援​过来​。\n"
"{{GM}} ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。{{/GM}} gan3jin3 zou3 ba1，mian3de5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 zai4 pai4 zeng1yuan2 guo4lai2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Stay here for now.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​暂时​留在​这里​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zan4shi2 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Stay here.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​留在​这里​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} liu2 zai4 zhe4li3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Stay on this floor.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​留在​这​一层​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} liu2 zai4 zhe4 yi1ceng2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Stay quiet.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​保持​安静​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} bao3chi2 an1jing4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Step Away.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step aside.{{/GM}} Go to it, Glory - don't let me stand in your way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让开​。​{{/GM}}​动手​吧​，​格洛丽​。​我​不会​碍​你​的​事​。\n"
"{{GM}} rang4kai1。{{/GM}} dong4shou3 ba1，Ge2luo4li2。wo3 bu4hui4 ai4 ni3 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step aside.{{/GM}} I've heard enough of this. Glory, if you still want"
" to kill her, go to it... I won't stop you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让开​。​{{/GM}}​我​听够​了​。​格洛丽​，​如果​你​还是​想​杀​了​她​，​尽管​动手​……​我​不会​阻止​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} rang4kai1。{{/GM}} wo3 ting1 gou4 le5。Ge2luo4li2，ru2guo3 ni3 hai2shi5 xiang3 sha1 le5 ta1，jin3guan3 dong4shou3……wo3 bu4hui4 zu3zhi3 ni3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away and wait for him to finish.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​走​到​一旁​等​他​说完​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zou3 dao4 yi1pang2 deng3 ta1 shuo1 wan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away from the containment chamber.{{/GM}} I need a minute."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​收容​舱​。​{{/GM}}​我​需要​想想​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1 shou1rong2 cang1。{{/GM}} wo3 xu1yao4 xiang3 xiang3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away from the hatch.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​舱门​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1 cang1 men2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away from the statue.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​雕像​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1 diao1xiang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} All right, Glory. You win."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​好​吧​，​格洛丽​。​你​赢​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} hao3 ba1，Ge2luo4li2。ni3 ying2 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} As you wish."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​如你所愿​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} ru2 ni3 suo3 yuan4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} I need a minute."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​我​需要​想想​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} wo3 xu1yao4 xiang3 xiang3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} I was just finishing up anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​反正​我​也​完事​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} fan3zheng4 wo3 ye3 wan2shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} I'm with you there. We can't afford to waste time "
"here, anyway... we should keep moving."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​我​支持​你​。​无论如何​，​我们​不能​在​这里​浪费时间​了​……​我们​应该​继续前进​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} wo3 zhi1chi2 ni3。wu2lun4ru2he2，wo3men5 bu4neng2 zai4 zhe4li3 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1 le5……wo3men5 ying1gai1 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} Let's do it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​我们​行动​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} wo3men5 xing2dong4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} Nah... but I figure I'll just wing it. We'll be "
"fine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​没​懂​……​不过​我​觉得​我能​应付​。​没​问题​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} mei2 dong3……bu4guo4 wo3 jue2de5 wo3 neng2 ying4fu5。mei2 wen4ti2 de5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} Okay, okay. I'm done here anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​好好​好​。​反正​我​也​完事​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} hao3hao3 hao3。fan3zheng4 wo3 ye3 wan2shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} Sorry, Marta. Glory's right. We shouldn't try this "
"until after we've purified the shrine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​抱歉​，​玛​尔塔​。​格洛丽​是​对​的​。​在​净化​神龛​之前​，​我们​不能​轻举妄动​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} bao4qian4，Ma3er3ta3。Ge2luo4li2 shi4 dui4 de5。zai4 jing4hua4 shen2kan1 zhi1qian2，wo3men5 bu4neng2 qing1ju3wang4dong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} We don't have time to screw around with this. Let's "
"keep moving."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​我们​没​时间​在​这​上面​浪费​了​。​我们​走​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} wo3men5 mei2 shi2jian1 zai4 zhe4 shang4mian4 lang4fei4 le5。wo3men5 zou3 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} Yeah, I've got it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​嗯​，​我​懂​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} en1，wo3 dong3 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} Yeah, that follows."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​嗯​，​有​道理​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} en1，you3 dao4li5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} Yeah, you're probably right."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​嗯​，​你​说得对​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} en1，ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} You should be fine now. I'd get out of here if I "
"were you... the others are waiting."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​你​现在​应该​安全​了​。​我​建议​你​赶紧​离开​这​……​其他人​还​在​等​你​呢​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} ni3 xian4zai4 ying1gai1 an1quan2 le5。wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4……qi2 ta1 ren2 hai2 zai4 deng3 ni3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step away.{{/GM}} You're right. I wouldn't do that to you. You can "
"tell your friends that everything's going to be all right."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​你​说得对​。​我​不会​这么​对待​你们​。​回去​向​你​的​朋友​们​报平安​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3 bu4hui4 zhe4me5 dui4dai4 ni3men5。hui2qu5 xiang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 men5 bao4 ping2 an1 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Step back from the crack.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​从​裂缝​处​返回​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} cong2 lie4feng4 chu3 fan3hui2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Step back from the door.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​从​门边​退​开​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} cong2 men2 bian1 tui4 kai1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Step back from the door.{{/GM}} You're right. We can't afford to help "
"this man."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​从​门边​退​开​。​{{/GM}}​你​说得对​。​我们​不能​为了​帮​这个​人​而​搭​上​更​多​风险​。\n"
"{{GM}} cong2 men2 bian1 tui4 kai1。{{/GM}} ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。wo3men5 bu4neng2 wei4le5 bang1 zhe4ge5 ren2 er2 da1 shang4 geng1 duo1 feng1xian3。"

