"{{GM}} na2 qi3 men2 jin1 ka3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Take the signal converter anyway.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​仍然​取​下​信号​转换器​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} reng2ran2 qu3 xia4 xin4hao4 zhuan3huan4qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Take the signal converter.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​取​下​信号​转换器​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} qu3 xia4 xin4hao4 zhuan3huan4qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Tap him on the shoulder.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拍拍​他​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} pai1 pai1 ta1 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Tears stream down her cheeks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We're dead. All of us."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​泪珠​从​她​的​脸颊​滑落​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​所有人​都​死定了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lei4zhu1 cong2 ta1 de5 lian3jia2 hua2luo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 suo3you3ren2 dou1 si3 ding4 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Tell him Glory's story.{{/GM}} All right, then, strap in..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​将格洛丽​的​故事​告诉​他​。​{{/GM}}​好​吧​，​且​听​我​慢慢​道​来​……\n"
"{{GM}} jiang1 Ge2luo4li2 de5 gu4shi4 gao4su4 ta1。{{/GM}} hao3 ba1，qie3 ting1 wo3 man4man4 dao4 lai2……"

msgid "{{GM}}Tell him to stay put.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​让​他​老实​待​着​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} rang4 ta1 lao3shi5 dai1 zhao2。{{/GM}}"

