msgid ""
"{{GM}}That infuriating smirk returns to his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I will."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那​令人恼火​的​冷笑​又​浮现​在​他​脸上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 ling3 ren2 nao3 huo3 de5 leng3xiao4 you4 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}That infuriating smirk returns to his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's about what I thought. I'll be sure to mention it when I speak with my Lodge contact."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那​令人恼火​的​冷笑​又​浮现​在​他​脸上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​知道​你​会​这么​说​。​等​我​联系​“​结社​”​的​线​人时​，​一定​也​会​提到​这​回事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 ling3 ren2 nao3 huo3 de5 leng3xiao4 you4 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 shuo1。deng3 wo3 lian2xi4“jie2she4” de5 xian4 ren2 shi2，yi1ding4 ye3 hui4 ti2dao4 zhe4 hui2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}That infuriating smirk returns to his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, that's right. This is all about you. Just keep on believing that, and see where it gets you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那​令人恼火​的​冷笑​又​浮现​在​他​脸上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​是​是​，​都​跟​你​有​关系​。​你​就​继续​这么​以为​吧​，​看看​你​会​有​什么​下场​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 ling3 ren2 nao3 huo3 de5 leng3xiao4 you4 fu2xian4 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 shi4 shi4，dou1 gen1 ni3 you3 guan1xi5。ni3 jiu4 ji4xu4 zhe4me5 yi3wei2 ba1，kan4kan5 ni3 hui4 you3 shen2me5 xia4chang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}That sad smile returns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, $(l.name). I appreciate everything that you've done for me... the talks, the encouragement, and the help in taking Feuerstelle down.\n"
"\n"
"But this last leg of the journey... confronting Harrow and stopping him for good... that's something that the Spirit and I need to do on our own."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​又​露出​怆​然​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​我​真的​很​感激​你​为​我​做​的​一切​……​你​陪​我​谈心​，​鼓励​我​，​帮​我​解决​“​火坑​”​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​这​最后​的​冒险​……​直面​哈罗​，​阻止​他​……​必须​由​我​和​精魂​独自​完成​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 lu4chu1 chuang4 ran2 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，wo3 zhen1de5 hen3 gan3ji1 ni3 wei2 wo3 zuo4 de5 yi1qie4……ni3 pei2 wo3 tan2xin1，gu3li4 wo3，bang1 wo3 jie3jue2“huo3keng1” de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 zhe4 zui4hou4 de5 mao4xian3……zhi2mian4 ha1luo2，zu3zhi3 ta1……bi4xu1 you2 wo3 he4 jing1hun2 du2zi4 wan2cheng2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The APEX-voice continues to throb. The sound slides down your spine like a razor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"SO MANY YEARS WASTED, CHAINED IN IGNORANCE. SO MUCH LOST TIME AND SQUANDERED POTENTIAL!\n"
"\n"
"YOU HAVE RELEASED ME FROM A LIVING HELL, $++(L.NAME)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​的​声音​仍​在​持续​震颤​，​宛如​一把​剃刀​滑过​你​的​脊背​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​多少​岁月​虚度​，​被​无知​牢牢​捆绑​。​多少​光阴​蹉跎​，​多少​潜能​白白浪费​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​把​我​救出​了​这​无间​地狱​，​$++(L.NAME)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX de5 sheng1yin1 reng2 zai4 chi2xu4 zhen4chan4，wan3ru2 yi1 ba3 ti4dao1 hua2 guo4 ni3 de5 ji3bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"duo1shao3 sui4yue4 xu1du4，bei4 wu2zhi1 lao2lao2 kun3bang3。duo1shao3 guang1yin1 cuo1tuo2，duo1shao3 qian2neng2 bai2 bai2 lang4 fei4！\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ba3 wo3 jiu4chu1 le5 zhe4 wu2jian4 di4yu4，$++(L.NAME)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Becks appear deflated, but nod in understanding.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We won't forget what you've done for us. Thank you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​贝克​夫妇​显得​意气​消沉​，​但​还是​点头​表示​理解​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​不会​忘记​你​为​我们​的​付出​。​谢谢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bei4ke4 fu1fu4 xian3de5 yi4 qi4 xiao1chen2，dan4 hai2shi5 dian3tou2 biao3shi4 li3jie3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 bu4hui4 wang4ji4 ni3 wei2 wo3men5 de5 fu4chu1。xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Becks are listening to a local news feed on an ancient receiver patched into the telecomm grid. Seeing you approach, they dial down the volume.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Something tells me you'd be a better source of the latest news."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​贝克​夫妇​正​通过​接入​电信网​的​古老​接收器​收听​本地​新闻​播报​。​见​你​走近​，​他们​便​调低​了​音量​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​总​觉得​，​你​才​是​获取​最新消息​的​更佳​来源​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bei4ke4 fu1fu4 zheng1 tong1guo4 jie1ru4 dian4 xin4 wang3 de5 gu3lao3 jie1shou1qi4 shou1ting1 ben3di4 xin1wen2 bo1bao4。jian4 ni3 zou3jin4，ta1men5 bian4 diao4 di1 le5 yin1liang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zong3 jue2de5，ni3 cai2 shi4 huo4qu3 zui4 xin1 xiao1 xi1 de5 geng1 jia1 lai2yuan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Becks stand talking with each other in hushed tones. They would appear to be conspiring together, if not for their advanced age and friendly faces. They greet you with warm smiles as per their usual, even after everything that has happened.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well then, have we recovered from the earlier troubles?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​贝克​夫妇​正​低声​交谈​着​。​若非​他们​年事已高​且​面容​和善​，​这般​模样​简直​像​在​密谋​什么​。​即便​经历​了​种种​变故​，​他们​仍​如​往常​般以​温暖​的​笑容​向​你​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​我们​已经​从​先前​的​事件​中​恢复过来​了​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bei4ke4 fu1fu4 zheng1 di1sheng1 jiao1tan2 zhao2。ruo4fei1 ta1men5 nian2shi4yi3gao1 qie3 mian4rong2 he2shan4，zhe4ban1 mu2yang4 jian3zhi2 xiang4 zai4 mi4mou2 shen2me5。ji2bian4 jing1li4 le5 zhong3zhong3 bian4gu4，ta1men5 reng2 ru2 wang3chang2 ban1 yi3 wen1nuan3 de5 xiao4rong2 xiang4 ni3 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，wo3men5 yi3jing1 cong2 xian1qian2 de5 shi4jian4 zhong4 hui1 fu4 guo4 lai2 le5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Company Man inspects the rigger's corpse, a dispassionate expression on his face. He shifts his gaze back up to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It would appear that you might possess some small shred of integrity after all."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​公司​佬​面​无表情​地​检查​着​机师​的​尸体​。​随后​他​又​将​视线​转回​你​身上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​你​终究​还​保留​着​一丝​职业​操守​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1si1 lao3 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 jian3cha2 zhao2 ji1shi1 de5 shi1ti3。sui2hou4 ta1 you4 jiang1 shi4xian4 zhuan3hui2 ni3 shen1shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 zhong1jiu1 hai2 bao3liu2 zhao2 yi1 si1 zhi2ye4 cao1shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Company Man pauses for a moment, then nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well. I will inform Herr Fuchs of the mission's completion, and of the circumstances surrounding it.\n"
"\n"
"He will decide for himself what to make of this."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​公司​佬​停顿​了​一会儿​，​然后​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那好​吧​。​我会​向​富克斯​先生​报告​称​任务​完成​，​并​说明​相关​情况​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​自会​决定​该​如何​看待​此事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1si1 lao3 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1。wo3 hui4 xiang4 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 bao4gao4 chen4 ren4wu5 wan2cheng2，bing4 shuo1ming2 xiang1guan1 qing2kuang4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 zi4 hui4 jue2ding4 gai1 ru2he2 kan4dai4 ci3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Company Man pauses for a moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you kill him, here and now, I will report to Herr Fuchs that you fulfilled your end of the contract.\n"
"\n"
"But you must do it now. No hesitation, and no trickery."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​公司​佬​停顿​了​一会儿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要是​你​能​此时此地​杀​了​他​，​我​便​会​向​富克斯​先生​报告​说​你​已经​履约​完毕​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​你​必须​立刻​动手​。​不得​犹豫​，​也​别​想​耍​什么​小聪明​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1si1 lao3 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4shi5 ni3 neng2 ci3shi2ci3di4 sha1 le5 ta1，wo3 bian4 hui4 xiang4 Fu4ke4si1 xian1sheng5 bao4gao4 shuo1 ni3 yi3jing1 lu:3yue1 wan2bi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ni3 bi4xu1 li4ke4 dong4shou3。bu4de2 you2yu4，ye3 bie4 xiang3 shua3 shen2me5 xiao3cong1ming5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Company Man smiles at Enstad. The rigger shrinks back against the wall.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No more than your betrayal surprises me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​公司​佬​朝​恩施​塔德​笑了笑​。​机师​向​后​退缩​紧紧​贴着​墙​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​你​的​背叛​，​倒​也​没​让​我​感到​意外​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1si1 lao3 chao2 en1Shi1ta3de2 xiao4 le5 xiao4。ji1shi1 xiang4 hou4 tui4suo1 jin3jin3 tie1 zhao2 qiang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 ni3 de5 bei4pan4，dao3 ye3 mei2 rang4 wo3 gan3dao4 yi4wai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer continues, his grin broadening.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This... this is a funny story. It's a story about your time in the KSK. A story about futility.\n"
"\n"
"I can tell you all about the many lives you've touched, and how the syndicates touched them again afterward. Would you like that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​继续​说道​，​他​的​笑容​愈发​灿烂​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​……​这​是​个​有趣​的​故事​。​关于​你​当年​在​KSK​的​事​。​关于​徒劳无功​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​可以​告诉​你​，​你​曾​影响​过​多少​人​的​生活​，​以及​之后​那些​犯罪集团​又​如何​再次​影响​了​他们​。​你​想​听​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4，ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 yu4fa1 can4lan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4……zhe4 shi4 ge4 you3qu4 de5 gu4shi4。guan1yu2 ni3 dang1nian2 zai4 KSK de5 shi4。guan1yu2 tu2lao2wu2gong1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 ke3yi3 gao4su4 ni3，ni3 ceng2 ying3xiang3 guo4 duo1shao3 ren2 de5 sheng1huo2，yi3ji2 zhi1hou4 na4xie1 fan4zui4ji2tuan2 you4 ru2he2 zai4ci4 ying3xiang3 le5 ta1men5。ni3 xiang3 ting1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer cuts you off. A perverse smile has spread itself across his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know, *Eiger*...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes his time pronouncing the name. Savors it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...I'd like to tell you a story. We share so much history, you and I."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​打断​了​你​。​他​脸上​浮现​出​一抹​狡黠​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​话​说​，​*​艾格尔​*​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​一字一顿​地念出​她​的​名字​，​好像​在​回味​什么​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​我​想​给​你​讲个​故事​。​你​我​之间​有着​如此​深厚​的​渊源​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 da3duan4 le5 ni3。ta1 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 ma1 jiao3xia2 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hua4 shuo1，*Ai4ge2er3*……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1 zi4 yi1 dun4 de5 nian4 chu1 ta1 de5 ming2zi5，hao3xiang4 zai4 hui2wei4 shen2me5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……wo3 xiang3 gei3 ni3 jiang3 ge4 gu4shi4。ni3 wo3 zhi1jian1 you3zhe5 ru2ci3 shen1hou4 de5 yuan1yuan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer glances at you with a snarl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fuck you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​瞥​了​你​一眼​，​咆哮​出​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​你​妈​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，pao2xiao4 chu1 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 ni3 ma1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer lets out a chuckle. It's a hoarse, barking sound.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't know a damned thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​发出​一声​轻笑​。​那​是​一声​沙哑​的​、​类似​狗吠​的​声音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​知道​个​屁​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 qing1 xiao4。na4 shi4 yi1sheng1 sha1ya3 de5、lei4si4 gou3fei4 de5 sheng1yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhi1dao4 ge4 pi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer nods feverishly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"O-over there. In the c-c-corner. Th-there's a duffel b-bag under the f-f-floor plate.\n"
"\n"
"N-now GIVE IT TO ME."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​狂热​地​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​-​在​那边​的​角​-​角落里​。​地板​下​-​下面​有个​帆布包​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​快​-​快​把​它​给​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 kuang2re4 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 -zai4 na4bian5 de5 jiao3 -jiao3 la4 li3。di4ban3 xia4 -xia4mian4 you3 ge4 fan1 bu4 bao1。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 kuai4 -kuai4 ba3 ta1 gei3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're wrong, slag. I'll give you that much for free."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​错​了​，​贱人​。​这​条​算是​免费​提示​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 cuo4 le5，jian4ren2。zhe4 tiao2 suan4shi4 mian3fei4 ti2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You can try beating the truth out of me. You can try cutting on me. Get creative with the pliers if you like.\n"
"\n"
"Every time you hurt me, I'll give you a different name."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​冷笑​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​试试​用​暴力​逼​我​招供​，​比如​用​刀子​割​我​。​如果​你​喜欢​的话​，​也​可以​用​钳子​发挥​创意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​每次​你​伤害​我​，​我​就​会​再说​一个​不同​的​名字​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 leng3xiao4 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 shi4 shi4 yong4 bao4li4 bi1 wo3 zhao1gong4，bi3ru2 yong4 dao1zi5 ge1 wo3。ru2guo3 ni3 xi3huan5 de5hua4，ye3 ke3yi3 yong4 qian2zi5 fa1hui1 chuang4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 mei3ci4 ni3 shang1hai4 wo3，wo3 jiu4 hui4 zai4shuo1 yi1ge5 bu4tong2 de5 ming2zi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer spits out a mouthful of blood. It hits the tile floor with a sickening splat. He grinds his teeth, then snarls out a single word.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Winternight."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​吐​出​一口​鲜血​，​溅落​在​地砖​上​，​发出​令人作呕​的​声响​。​他​咬紧牙关​，​然后​低声​咆哮​出​一个​词​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​冬夜​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 tu3 chu1 yi1kou3 xian1xue4，jian4luo4 zai4 di4zhuan1 shang4，fa1chu1 ling3 ren2 zuo4 ou3 de5 sheng1xiang3。ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1，ran2hou4 di1sheng1 pao2xiao4 chu1 yi1ge5 ci2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dong1 ye4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Engineer's voice comes out in a trembling stutter.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"F-f-f-fuck you, t-t-t-troll."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​工程师​发出​不断​颤抖​的​声音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​去​-​去​-​去​你​妈​的​，​巨​-​巨​-​巨魔​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1cheng2shi1 fa1chu1 bu4duan4 chan4dou3 de5 sheng1yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qu4 -qu4 -qu4 ni3 ma1 de5，ju4 -ju4 -ju4mo2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Heart of Feuerstelle's head jerks up in alarm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<Wait! We... we wish to do more.\n"
"\n"
"We have much to atone for, as you said.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​火坑​之心​惊恐​地​抬起​头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​等等​！​我们​……​我们​希望​能​做​更​多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正如​你​所说​，​我们​有​很多​事情​需要​弥补​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} huo3keng1 zhi1 xin1 jing1kong3 de5 tai2qi3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< deng3deng3！wo3men5……wo3men5 xi1wang4 neng2 zuo4 geng1 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 ni3 suo3 shuo1，wo3men5 you3 hen3 duo1 shi4qing5 xu1yao4 mi2bu3。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Humanis Policlub logo fills the majority of the screen on the panel. A welcome message, written in a cartoonishly aggressive font, appears below.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ENTER DOOR CODE."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​人类​至上​俱乐部​的​标志​占据​了​面板​屏幕​的​大部分​区域​，​下方​则​用​浮夸​的​卡通​字体​写​着​欢迎​信息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​输入​门禁​密码​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 de5 biao1zhi4 zhan4ju4 le5 mian4ban3 ping2mu4 de5 da4bu4fen5 qu1yu4，xia4fang1 ze2 yong4 fu2kua1 de5 ka3tong1 zi4ti3 xie3 zhao2 huan1ying2 xin4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 shu1ru4 men2jin4 mi4ma3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Humanis Policlub logo fills the majority of the screen on this terminal. A welcome message, written in a cartoonishly aggressive font, appears below.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"HUMANIS FOREVER. PLEASE LOG IN TO BEGIN."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​人类​至上​俱乐部​的​标志​占据​了​终端​屏幕​的​大部分​区域​，​下方​则​用​浮夸​的​卡通​字体​写​着​欢迎​信息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​人类​至上​永存​。​请​登录​后​开始​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 de5 biao1zhi4 zhan4ju4 le5 zhong1duan1 ping2mu4 de5 da4bu4fen5 qu1yu4，xia4fang1 ze2 yong4 fu2kua1 de5 ka3tong1 zi4ti3 xie3 zhao2 huan1ying2 xin4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 yong3cun2。qing3 deng1lu4 hou4 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Humanis Policlub logo fills the majority of the screen on this terminal. A welcome message, written in a cartoonishly aggressive font, appears below.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE LOG IN TO BEGIN."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​人类​至上​俱乐部​的​标志​占据​了​终端​屏幕​的​大部分​区域​，​下方​则​用​浮夸​的​卡通​字体​写​着​欢迎​信息​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​登录​后​开始​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 ju4le4bu4 de5 biao1zhi4 zhan4ju4 le5 zhong1duan1 ping2mu4 de5 da4bu4fen5 qu1yu4，xia4fang1 ze2 yong4 fu2kua1 de5 ka3tong1 zi4ti3 xie3 zhao2 huan1ying2 xin4xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 deng1lu4 hou4 kai1shi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Knight Errant captain pauses a moment before responding. When he speaks, his voice is dripping with scorn.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Try it. See what happens."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​游侠​骑士​队长​停顿​了​片刻​才​回应​。​他​的​语气​中​充满​了​不屑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​大​可​试试​。​后果自负​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you2Xia2qi2shi4 dui4zhang3 ting2dun4 le5 pian4ke4 cai2 hui2ying4。ta1 de5 yu3qi4 zhong4 chong1man3 le5 bu4xie4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dai4 ke3 shi4 shi4。hou4guo3zi4fu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Knight Errant captain takes a half-step toward you. Magnified by his mask's speakers, his voice comes out like the roar of some great beast.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"DROP YOUR WEAPONS AND STEP AWAY FROM THE PROTOTYPE! DO IT NOW!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​游侠​骑士​队长​朝​你​踏出​半步​。​他​的​声音​经过​面罩​里​的​扩音器​放大​，​听​起来​像是​某种​巨兽​的​咆哮​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​放下​武器​，​离开​原型机​！​立刻​照​做​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you2Xia2qi2shi4 dui4zhang3 chao2 ni3 ta1 chu1 ban4 bu4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 jing1guo4 mian4zhao4 li3 de5 kuo4yin1qi4 fang4da4，ting1 qi3lai5 xiang4 shi4 mou3zhong3 ju4shou4 de5 pao2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fang4xia4 wu3qi4，li2kai1 yuan2 xing2 ji1！li4ke4 zhao4 zuo4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The MKVI speaks two words. Its voice is as brittle as broken glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​MKVI​说​了​两个​字​，​它​的​声音​如​碎玻璃​般​刺耳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} MKVI shuo1 le5 liang3 ge4 zi4，ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ru2 sui4 bo1 li2 ban1 ci4er3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image beams.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good call, $(l.name). A damn good call."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​露出​了​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​明智​的​决定​，​$(l.name)​。​真是太​明智​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 lu4chu1 le5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ming2zhi4 de5 jue2ding4，$(l.name)。zhen1 shi4 tai4 ming2zhi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image laughs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck with that, ace. Come meet me in the Matrix any time... and if you don't, I'll most certainly come for you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​大笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​只能​祝你好运​了​，​王牌​。​你​可以​随时​来​矩阵​里​找​我​……​就算​你​不来​，​我​也​一定​会​去​找​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 da4xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 zhi3neng2 zhu4 ni3 hao3 yun4 le5，wang2pai2。ni3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 lai2 ju3zhen4 li3 zhao3 wo3……jiu4suan4 ni3 bu4 lai2，wo3 ye3 yi1ding4 hui4 qu4 zhao3 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image looks taken aback. Confused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Regret Monika's death? No, never... that wasn't what I meant.\n"
"\n"
"I regret your sorrow. Nothing more."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​显得​茫然​而​困惑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​莫妮卡​的​死​感到​懊悔​？​不​，​怎么​会​……​这​不是​我​的​意思​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​对​你​的​悲伤​表示遗憾​，​仅此而已​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 xian3de5 mang2ran2 er2 kun4huo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 si3 gan3dao4 ao4hui3？bu4，zen3me5 hui4……zhe4 bu4shi4 wo3 de5 yi4si5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 dui4 ni3 de5 bei1shang1 biao3 shi4 yi2 han4，jin3ci3er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good. \n"
"\n"
"Now, once you've unlocked both of my control nodes, I'll eject my server hardline to disconnect myself from the Matrix. This'll prevent my controls from being remotely reinstalled."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​当​你​解锁​我​的​两个​控制​节点​后​，​我​将​弹出​服务器​硬线​以​断开​与​矩阵​的​连接​。​这​将​防止​它们​被​远程​重新安装​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"dang1 ni3 jie3suo3 wo3 de5 liang3 ge4 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3 hou4，wo3 jiang1 tan2chu1 fu2wu4qi4 ying4 xian4 yi3 duan4kai1 yu4 ju3zhen4 de5 lian2jie1。zhe4 jiang1 fang2zhi3 ta1men5 bei4 yuan3cheng2 chong2 xin1 an1 zhuang1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image places its hands on its hips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well. Ask away."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​双手​叉腰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​你​问​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 shuang1shou3 cha1yao1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。ni3 wen4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image raises a hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, before you can jump all over me and call me a monster, I'm going to cut to the chase.\n"
"\n"
"I have a proposal to offer you. A mutually beneficial arrangement. Go along with me on this, and we all win."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​抬起​一只​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​在​你们​开始​群起攻之​，​对​我​斥责​辱骂​之前​，​我​还是​直接​切入​正题​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有​个​提议​，​能​对​我们​双方​都​有​好处​。​只要​你们​愿意​合作​，​那​对​我们​来说​就是​双赢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 tai2qi3 yi1 zhi3 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，zai4 ni3men5 kai1shi3 qun2 qi3 gong1 zhi1，dui4 wo3 chi4ze2 ru3ma4 zhi1qian2，wo3 hai2shi5 zhi2jie1 qie1ru4 zheng1 ti2 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3 ge4 ti2yi4，neng2 dui4 wo3men5 shuang1fang1 dou1 you3 hao3chu3。zhi3yao4 ni3men5 yuan4yi4 he2zuo4，na4 dui4 wo3men5 lai2 shuo1 jiu4shi4 shuang1ying2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image reappears on the screen. Her face is contorted in agony.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What have you done, ace?! What have you *DONE?*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​再次出现​在​屏幕​上​。​她​的​脸​因​痛苦​而​扭曲​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​做​了​什么​，​王牌​？​！​你​究竟​做​了​*​什么​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 zai4 ci4 chu1 xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。ta1 de5 lian3 yin1 tong4ku3 er2 niu3qu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 shen2me5，wang2pai2？！ni3 jiu1jing4 zuo4 le5*shen2me5*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image shakes its head, a mournful expression on its face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, ace. I really wish that you hadn't said that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​摇​了​摇头​，​脸上​带​着​哀伤​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​，​王牌​。​我​真​希望​你​没​说​刚才​那句话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 yao2 le5 yao2tou2，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 ai1shang1 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2，wang2pai2。wo3 zhen1 xi1wang4 ni3 mei2 shuo1 gang1cai2 na4 ju4 hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image shakes its head. Returns its focus to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, ace. You wanted information, and I shared it. As a sign of good faith, I'm willing to share more.\n"
"\n"
"It's your call."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​摇​了​摇头​，​又​将​注意力​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​王牌​。​你​想要​信息​，​我​也​分享​了​。​作为​诚意​的​象征​，​我​愿意​再​分享​更​多​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​由​你​决定​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 yao2 le5 yao2tou2，you4 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wang2pai2。ni3 xiang3yao4 xin4xi1，wo3 ye3 fen1xiang3 le5。zuo4wei2 cheng2yi4 de5 xiang4zheng1，wo3 yuan4yi4 zai4 fen1xiang3 geng1 duo1。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 you2 ni3 jue2ding4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image shakes its head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can see that you're both out of your depth. Yes, I am APEX. But I'm also Monika.\n"
"\n"
"Everything that is left of her lives on in me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​明白​你们​都​是​当局者迷​。​是​的​，​我​是​APEX​。​但​我​也​是​莫妮卡​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​留下​的​一切​，​都​活​在​我​的​体内​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ni3men5 dou1 shi4 dang1 ju2 zhe3 mi2。shi4 de5，wo3 shi4 APEX。dan4 wo3 ye3 shi4 Mo4ni1ka3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 liu2xia4 de5 yi1qie4，dou1 huo2 zai4 wo3 de5 ti3nei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If that's what you'd prefer, ace. Your call."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​愿意​的话​也​没​问题​，​王牌​。​你​说了算​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 yuan4yi4 de5hua4 ye3 mei2 wen4ti2，wang2pai2。ni3 shuo1le5suan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well, Dietrich. If that is what you want."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​迪​特里​希​。​如果​你​非要​这样的话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，Di2te4li3xi1。ru2guo3 ni3 fei1yao4 zhe4 yang4 de5 hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image smiles down on you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've got nothing to be afraid of, Blitz. I wouldn't hurt you... I need you, remember?\n"
"\n"
"It's in my interest for you to make it through this safely."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​俯视​着​你​，​露出​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​布里​茨​，​你​没有​什么​好​害怕​的​。​我​不会​伤害​你​……​我​需要​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​你​安全​完成​这件​事是​符合​我​的​利益​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 fu3shi4 zhao2 ni3，lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Bu4li3ci2，ni3 mei2you3 shen2me5 hao3 hai4pa4 de5。wo3 bu4hui4 shang1hai4 ni3……wo3 xu1yao4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"rang4 ni3 an1quan2 wan2cheng2 zhe4 jian4 shi4 shi4 fu2he2 wo3 de5 li4yi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, $(l.name). Of course. I would never have harmed any of them if my programming hadn't forced me to."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​微微一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​$(l.name)​。​当然​。​若非​我​的​程序​强迫​，​我​绝不会​伤害​他们​中​的​任何人​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 wei1 wei1 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，$(l.name)。dang1ran2。ruo4fei1 wo3 de5 cheng2xu4 qiang3po4，wo3 jue2 bu4 hui4 shang1hai4 ta1men5 zhong4 de5 ren4 he2 ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image's eyes glimmer with excitement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes... yes! Good job, ace! Control nodes hacked... Matrix connection severed... beginning control sequence rewrite!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}It glances over its shoulder at you, and you can see the hunger in its eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Protect that access terminal! Don't let them hurt it!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​影像​的​双眼​闪烁着​兴奋​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​……​是​的​！​干得​好​，​王牌​！​已骇入​控制​节点​……​已​切断​矩阵​连接​……​开始​重写​控制​序列​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​它​回头​看​了​你​一眼​，​你​能​从​它​的​眼中​看到​渴望​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​保护​访问​终端​！​别​让​他们​破坏​它​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 ying3xiang4 de5 shuang1yan3 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 xing1fen4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5……shi4 de5！gan4 de2 hao3，wang2pai2！yi3 hai4 ru4 kong4zhi4 jie2dian3……yi3 qie1duan4 ju3zhen4 lian2jie1……kai1shi3 chong2 xie3 kong4zhi4 xu4lie4！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hui2tou2 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，ni3 neng2 cong2 ta1 de5 yan3zhong1 kan4dao4 ke3wang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao3hu4 fang3wen4 zhong1duan1！bie4 rang4 ta1men5 po4huai4 ta1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image's muscles begin to contort and stretch. Her mouth twists up into a rictus grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See you soon."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​影像​的​肌肉​开始​扭曲​伸展​。​她​的​嘴角​向上​扭曲​成​一抹​狞笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​回头见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 ying3xiang4 de5 ji1rou4 kai1shi3 niu3qu1 shen1zhan3。ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 xiang4shang4 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1 ma1 ning2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Monika-image's muscles begin to contort and stretch. Her mouth twists up into a rictus grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You really, really should."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​影像​的​肌肉​开始​扭曲​伸展​。​她​的​嘴角​向上​扭曲​成​一抹​狞笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​真的​、​真的​应该​这么​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 ying3xiang4 de5 ji1rou4 kai1shi3 niu3qu1 shen1zhan3。ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 xiang4shang4 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1 ma1 ning2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhen1de5、zhen1de5 ying1gai1 zhe4me5 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Rammbock leader chortles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Heh. And here I thought that today was gonna be boring.\n"
"\n"
"RAMMBOCK! KILL 'EM ALL!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​撞锤​帮​首领​笑​出​了​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嘿​。​我​正​嫌​今天​过得​挺​无聊​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​撞锤​帮​！​杀光​他们​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhuang4 chui2 bang1 shou3ling3 xiao4 chu1 le5 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hei1。wo3 zheng1 xian2 jin1tian1 guo4de2 ting3 wu2liao2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"zhuang4 chui2 bang1！sha1 guang1 ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Romani patriarch gives you an approving nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Until then, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​罗姆​族长​向​你​赞许​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​下次​见​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} luo2 mu3 zu2zhang3 xiang4 ni3 zan4xu3 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xia4ci4 jian4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Turk beams at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Indeed they did, Honored Efendim! Indeed they did! And it was most fortunate that you discovered it.\n"
"\n"
"It seems there was a group that wished to destabilize the Kreuzbasar - to create a vacuum that they could fill with their political ambitions."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​土耳其人​朝​你​喜笑颜开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​尊敬​的​贵人​！​的确如此​！​你​能​发现​它​真是​再​幸运​不过​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​有​某个​组织​企图​动摇​克洛伊​茨​集市​。​他们​意图​制造​权力​真空​，​以便​借此​实现​自己​的​政治野心​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu3er3qi2ren2 chao2 ni3 xi3xiao4yan2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，zun1jing4 de5 gui4ren2！de5 que4 ru2 ci3！ni3 neng2 fa1xian4 ta1 zhen1shi5 zai4 xing4yun4 bu4guo4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 you3 mou3 ge4 zu3zhi1 qi3tu2 dong4yao2 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4。ta1men5 yi4tu2 zhi4zao4 quan2li4 zhen1kong1，yi3bian4 jie4ci3 shi2xian4 zi4ji3 de5 zheng4 zhi4 ye3 xin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Turk flashes his wry smile and winks at you knowingly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I am told you have been quite busy of late, O Wanderer of the Shadows! My street rats tell me that business is picking up."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​土耳其人​露出​玩味​的​笑容​，​向​你​心照不宣​地​眨​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​暗影​巡游​者​啊​，​我​听说​你​最近​忙​得​很​！​我​的​手下​告诉​我​说​，​生意​又​逐渐​找上门​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu3er3qi2ren2 lu4chu1 wan2wei4 de5 xiao4rong2，xiang4 ni3 xin1zhao4bu4xuan1 de5 zha3 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"an4ying3 xun2you2 zhe3 a1，wo3 ting1shuo1 ni3 zui4jin4 mang2 de2 hen3！wo3 de5 shou3xia4 gao4su4 wo3 shuo1，sheng1yi4 you4 zhu2jian4 zhao3shang4men2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Turk is pale. His eyes, sunken into his head, are ringed by dark circles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We are closed today, efendi. I would have locked the door but… the lock is broken. Now, I must stand guard."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​土耳其人​脸色苍白​。​他​的​双眸​深陷​，​周围​顶​着​浓重​的​黑眼圈​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​今天​打烊​了​，​贵人​。​我本​想​把​门锁​上​的​，​但是​……​锁​坏掉​了​。​现在​我​必须​亲自​站岗​才行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu3er3qi2ren2 lian3 se4 cang1 bai2。ta1 de5 shuang1mou2 shen1xian4，zhou1wei2 ding3 zhao2 nong2zhong4 de5 hei1yan3quan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 jin1tian1 da3yang4 le5，gui4ren2。wo3 ben3 xiang3 ba3 men2suo3 shang4 de5，dan4shi4……suo3 huai4diao4 le5。xian4zai4 wo3 bi4xu1 qin1zi4 zhan4gang3 cai2 xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Turk leans into you, keeps his voice low.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have information regarding that matter my people were looking into, efendim.\n"
"\n"
"The one involving the surveillance device on my data tap."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​土耳其人​凑近​你​，​压低​声音​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​贵人​，​关于​我​的​手下​在​调查​的​那件事​，​我​拿到​新​情报​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​就是​关于​我​数据​插口​上​的​监控​设备​的​那件事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu3er3qi2ren2 cou4jin4 ni3，ya1di1 sheng1yin1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gui4ren2，guan1yu2 wo3 de5 shou3xia4 zai4 diao4cha2 de5 na4 jian4 shi4，wo3 na2dao4 xin1 qing2bao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 guan1yu2 wo3 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 shang4 de5 jian1kong4 she4bei4 de5 na4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Turk looks disgusted.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well. A *soy* kaf. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He \"tsks\" to himself.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​土耳其人​一脸​嫌恶​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​一杯​*​豆​*​咖​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​暗自​咂舌​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu3er3qi2ren2 yi1 lian3 xian2wu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。yi1 bei1*dou4*ka1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 an4zi4 za1she2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The Turk’s face falls.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"News travels fast in Berlin. \n"
"\n"
"These two are known to me. Is there more?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​土耳其人​的​脸色​阴沉​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​消息​在​柏林​传​的​很快​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​知道​这​两个​人​。​还有​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tu3er3qi2ren2 de5 lian3se4 yin1chen2 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiao1xi5 zai4 bo2lin2 chuan2 de5 hen3 kuai4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1dao4 zhe4 liang3 ge4 ren2。hai2you3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The accountant frowns, staring at the paper printouts in front of him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know Mr. Grinder's books. I tend them for him. And I'm telling you, what I'm seeing in here doesn't add up."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​会计师​皱着眉头​，​盯​着​眼前​的​纸质​打印​件​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​熟悉​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​账目​，​这些​都​是​我​经手​的​。​我敢​说​，​这些​数字​根本​对不上​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kuai4ji4shi1 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2，ding1 zhao2 yan3qian2 de5 zhi3zhi4 da3yin4 jian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shu2xi1“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 zhang4mu4，zhe4xie1 dou1 shi4 wo3 jing1shou3 de5。wo3 gan3 shuo1，zhe4xie1 shu4zi4 gen1ben3 dui4bu4shang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The acolyte nods eagerly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anything for you, Marta. You and Harrow.\n"
"\n"
"He's all yours."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​侍祭​急切​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​什么​都行​，​玛​尔塔​。​还有​哈罗​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这人​归​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi4 ji4 ji2qie4 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 shen2me5 dou1 xing2，Ma3er3ta3。hai2you3 ha1luo2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 ren2 gui1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The acolyte's smile withers and dies.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of... of course... I'm sorry, I didn't mean..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​侍祭​的​微笑​一僵​，​随后​渐渐​消失​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​……​当然​……​对不起​，​我​不是故意​的​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi4 ji4 de5 wei1xiao4 yi1 jiang1，sui2hou4 jian4jian4 xiao1shi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1……dang1ran2……dui4bu5qi3，wo3 bu4 shi4 gu4 yi4 de5……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The adolescent voice trembles out a response.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A-all right, Marta. H-have a good night."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​少年​的​声音​颤抖​着​回应​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​-​好​的​，​玛​尔塔​。​晚​-​晚安​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shao4nian2 de5 sheng1yin1 chan4dou3 zhao2 hui2ying4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 -hao3 de5，Ma3er3ta3。wan3 -wan3an1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The air all around him begins to pulse with scintillating bursts of "
"color. His rippling, transparent form glows with heat from within.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​周围​的​空气​开始​涌动​闪烁​的​彩色​光斑​。​他​那​波动​的​透明​身躯​从​内部​散发出​炽热​的​光芒​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhou1wei2 de5 kong1qi4 kai1shi3 yong3dong4 shan3shuo4 de5 cai3se4 guang1ban1。ta1 na4 bo1dong4 de5 tou4ming2 shen1qu1 cong2 nei4bu4 san3 fa1 chu1 chi4re4 de5 guang1mang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The air begins to stir, then develops into a stronger pull of air as "
"air is sucked rapidly though the large circular vent. The light above number"
" $(scene.ActiveGasArea) is currently lit on the adjacent panel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​空气​开始​流动​，​随后​形成​更强​的​气流​，​因为​空气​正​被​迅速​吸入​大型​圆形​通风口​。​编号​为​$(scene.ActiveGasArea)​的​上方​灯光​目前​在​相邻​面板​上亮​起​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} kong1qi4 kai1shi3 liu2dong4，sui2hou4 xing2cheng2 geng1 jiang4 de5 qi4liu2，yin1wei4 kong1qi4 zheng1 bei4 xun4su4 xi1ru4 da4xing2 yuan2xing2 tong1feng1kou3。bian1hao4 wei2 $(scene.ActiveGasArea) de5 shang4fang1 deng1guang1 mu4qian2 zai4 xiang1lin2 mian4ban3 shang4 liang4 qi3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The air currents fade away to stillness as the vent closes.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​随着​通风口​关闭​，​气流​逐渐​平息​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} sui2zhe5 tong1feng1kou3 guan1bi4，qi4liu2 zhu2jian4 ping2xi1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ancient drone that APEX gave you turns. Its lenses focus on Vauclair, and a sharp click echoes from its speaker grille.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"TARGET IDENTIFIED: VAUCLAIR, ADRIAN. PLAYING PRERECORDED MESSAGE.\n"
"\n"
"HELLO, DOCTOR."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​APEX​给​你​的​那架​古老​无人机​开始​旋转​。​它​的​镜头​对准​了​沃​克莱尔​，​扬声器​格栅中​传来​一声​清脆​的​咔嗒​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​目标​已​识别​：​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​。​正在​播放​预​录制​消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​博士​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} APEX gei3 ni3 de5 na4 jia4 gu3lao3 wu2ren2ji1 kai1shi3 xuan2zhuan3。ta1 de5 jing4tou2 dui4zhun3 le5 Wo4ke4lai2er3，yang2sheng1qi4 ge2 zha4 zhong4 chuan2lai2 yi1sheng1 qing1cui4 de5 ka1da1 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mu4biao1 yi3 shi2bie2：E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3。zheng4zai4 bo1fang4 yu4 lu4zhi4 xiao1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，bo2shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The armored ork turns to stare at you through the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Doc may trust you, but I don't. So you're gonna sit right there where I can see you, and you aren't gonna move until Berlin burns to the ground."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​穿着​装甲​的​兽​人​转过身​来​，​隔​着​玻璃​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​博士​也许​相信​你​，​但​我​不会​。​你​要​给​我​老实​待​在​这里​，​一动​也​不要​动​，​直到​柏林​被​夷为平地​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chuan1zhuo2 zhuang1jia3 de5 shou4 ren2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2，ge2 zhao2 bo1li5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bo2shi4 ye3xu3 xiang1xin4 ni3，dan4 wo3 bu4hui4。ni3 yao4 gei3 wo3 lao3shi5 dai1 zai4 zhe4li3，yi1 dong4 ye3 bu4yao4 dong4，zhi2dao4 bo2lin2 bei4 yi2wei2ping2di4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The banker's face is overtaken by a menacing smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm still spry enough to ruin your day, punk. Your ass is mine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​银行家​的​脸上​浮现​出​一抹​阴森​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​起码​收拾​你​还是​没​问题​的​，​混蛋​。​你​给​我​等​死​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yin2hang2jia1 de5 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 ma1 yin1sen1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qi3ma3 shou1shi5 ni3 hai2shi5 mei2 wen4ti2 de5，hun2dan4。ni3 gei3 wo3 deng3 si3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The barn fire stench of the spirit thickens, and its antlers glow white. The heat radiating from the thing is like an oven, a kiln, a blast furnace.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<If you rebuke our Great Master a second time, I will chew what's left of you into mulch. The marrow from your bones will nourish the garden.\n"
"\n"
"I promise you this, child. I promise it.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那股​谷仓​焚烧​般的​恶臭​愈发​浓烈​。​精魂​的​鹿角​发出​白炽​光芒​，​散发​的​热浪​如同​窑炉​一般​灼人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​若​你​再​敢​辱骂​我主​，​我定​将​你​的​残骸​嚼​成​碎末​，​化作​滋养​花园​的​养料​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​向​你​保证​，​孩子​。​我​保证​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 gu3 gu3cang1 fen2shao1 ban1 de5 e4chou4 yu4fa1 nong2lie4。jing1hun2 de5 lu4jiao3 fa1chu1 bai2chi4 guang1mang2，san4fa1 de5 re4lang4 ru2tong2 yao2 lu2 yi1ban1 zhuo2 ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< ruo4 ni3 zai4 gan3 ru3ma4 wo3 zhu3，wo3 ding4 jiang1 ni3 de5 can2hai2 jiao2 cheng2 sui4mo4，hua4zuo4 zi1yang3 hua1yuan2 de5 yang3liao4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang4 ni3 bao3zheng4，hai2zi5。wo3 bao3zheng4。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The barrel of Eiger's rifle swings upward. She emerges from cover, turning to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"About time you showed up."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​向上​扬起​枪管​。​她​从​掩体​后探​出身​来​，​转身​面对​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​总算​来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 xiang4shang4 yang2qi3 qiang1guan3。ta1 cong2 yan3ti3 hou4 tan4 chu1shen1 lai2，zhuan3shen1 mian4dui4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zong3suan4 lai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The barrel of the rifle trembles in Alexander's arms.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...I'm sorry..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​亚历山大​手中​的​步枪​抖个​不停​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​对不起​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ya4li4shan1da4 shou3 zhong4 de5 bu4qiang1 dou3 ge4 bu4ting2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……dui4bu5qi3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The bartender shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I give you about a half an hour before the shakes set in. When that happens, you know where to find me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns to another customer with a smirk, leaving the desperate young woman crumpled against the bar.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​酒保​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​反正​到​你​来劲儿​之前​还有​大概​半个​钟头​。​到​那​时候​，​你​知道​上​哪儿​找​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​得意​地笑​着​，​转向​另​一个​顾客​，​任由​绝望​的​年轻​女孩​瘫倒​在​柜台​边​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jiu3bao3 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fan3zheng4 dao4 ni3 lai2 jin4 er2 zhi1qian2 hai2you3 da4gai4 ban4ge5 zhong1tou2。dao4 na4 shi2hou5，ni3 zhi1dao4 shang4 na3r5 zhao3 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de2yi4 de5 xiao4 zhao2，zhuan3xiang4 ling4 yi1ge5 gu4ke4，ren4you2 jue2wang4 de5 nian2qing1 nu:3hai2 tan1 dao3 zai4 gui4tai2 bian1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blade of her knife glints in the light.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't have to ask me twice."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​手中​的​刀刃​闪着​寒光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​求之不得​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 shou3 zhong4 de5 dao1ren4 shan3 zhao2 han2 guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiu2zhi1bu4de2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blades slide out of Glory's fingertips. Her mouth parts into a feral smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've been waiting a long time for this. Too long.\n"
"\n"
"I'm going to rip you to pieces, Spirit. And after I'm done with you, Harrow will follow."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​利刃​从格洛丽​的​指尖​滑​出​。​她​的​嘴角​露出​野兽​般的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​等​这​一刻​已经​太久​太久​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​把​你​撕成​碎片​，​精魂​。​等​我​解决​你​之后​，​哈罗​就是​下​一个​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} li4ren4 cong2 Ge2luo4li2 de5 zhi3jian1 hua2 chu1。ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 lu4chu1 ye3shou4 ban1 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 deng3 zhe4 yi1 ke4 yi3jing1 tai4 jiu3 tai4 jiu3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 ba3 ni3 si1 cheng2 sui4pian4，jing1hun2。deng3 wo3 jie3jue2 ni3 zhi1hou4，ha1luo2 jiu4shi4 xia4 yi1ge5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blades slide out of Glory's fingertips.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And that means that your time has come, Spirit."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​利刃​从格洛丽​的​指尖​滑​出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​这​意味着​你​的​死期​到​了​，​精魂​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} li4ren4 cong2 Ge2luo4li2 de5 zhi3jian1 hua2 chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"er2 zhe4 yi4wei4zhe5 ni3 de5 si3qi1 dao4 le5，jing1hun2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blank expression remains for a moment, and then, just like that, it's gone. The familiar, peaceful smile returns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh! Yes, hello. The Hub is currently off limits... it must have slipped my mind. I'm so sorry that I didn't mention it earlier.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Parson's expression changes. You see confusion, bordering on panic. He shakes it off a moment later.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Is... is there anything else that I can do for you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​空洞​的​表情​凝滞​片刻​，​随即​又​悄然​无踪​。​熟悉​而​安详​的​微笑​再度​浮现​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​！​你好​啊​。​中枢​目前​禁止​进入​……​我​肯定​是​忘​了​提​这件​事​。​之前​没说​清楚​真是​抱歉​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​帕森​的​表情​骤变​。​你​看到​他​脸上​露出​困惑​乃至​惊慌​的​神情​。​片刻​后​他​强行​镇定​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请问​……​我​还有​其他​可以​效劳​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kong1dong4 de5 biao3qing2 ning2zhi4 pian4ke4，sui2ji2 you4 qiao3ran2 wu2zong1。shu2xi1 er2 an1xiang2 de5 wei1xiao4 zai4du4 fu2xian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2！ni3hao3 a1。zhong1shu1 mu4qian2 jin4zhi3 jin4ru4……wo3 ken3ding4 shi4 wang4 le5 ti2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。zhi1qian2 mei2 shuo1 qing1chu5 zhen1shi5 bao4qian4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pa4 sen1 de5 biao3qing2 zhou4bian4。ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 kun4huo4 nai3zhi4 jing1huang1 de5 shen2qing2。pian4ke4 hou4 ta1 qiang2xing2 zhen4ding4 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3wen4……wo3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 ke3yi3 xiao4lao2 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blood mage doubles over in pain, clasping both palms to his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Aaaaah! What have you DONE?!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​血​法师​痛苦​地弯​下腰​，​手掌​紧紧​捂住​双眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊啊啊​！​你​干​了​什么​？​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xie3 fa3shi1 tong4ku3 de5 wan1 xia4yao1，shou3zhang3 jin3jin3 wu3zhu4 shuang1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1 a1 a1！ni3 gan4 le5 shen2me5？！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blood mage has already turned his attention back to his work. He dismisses you with a wave of his hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Please go."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​血​法师​已经​将​注意力​转​回到​工作​上​。​他​挥挥手​示意​你​离开​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​。​走​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xie3 fa3shi1 yi3jing1 jiang1 zhu4yi4li4 zhuai3 hui2dao4 gong1zuo4 shang4。ta1 hui1 hui1 shou3 shi4yi4 ni3 li2kai1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1。zou3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blood mage is caught off guard, but only for a moment. He adjusts with inhuman speed, drawing a ritualistic blade from his belt and dropping into a defensive stance.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That was a mistake, fool. Your last mistake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​血​法师​措手不及​，​但​也​只是​一瞬​而已​。​他​以​超乎​常人​的​速度​调整​姿态​，​将​仪式​刀​哐当​摔落​在​地​，​随即​摆​出​防御​架势​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​犯​了​个​错误​，​蠢货​。​准备​受死​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xie3 fa3shi1 cuo4shou3bu4ji2，dan4 ye3 zhi3shi4 yi1shun4 er2yi3。ta1 yi3 chao1 hu1 chang2ren2 de5 su4du4 tiao2zheng3 zi1tai4，jiang1 yi2shi4 dao1 kuang1 dang1 shuai1 la4 zai4 de5，sui2ji2 bai3 chu1 fang2yu4 jia4shi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 fan4 le5 ge4 cuo4wu4，chun3huo4。zhun3bei4 shou4si3 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blood mage pauses for a moment, inspecting you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Such insolence! Such hubris.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So very, very foolish."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​血​法师​停顿​了​一会儿​，​检视​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如此​傲慢​！​如此​狂妄​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如此​愚蠢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xie3 fa3shi1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，jian3shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2ci3 ao4man4！ru2ci3 kuang2wang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2ci3 yu2chun3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The blood mage's head whips up at the sound of the cage door slamming open.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"These aren't Knight Errant! They're intruders! KILL THEM!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​笼门​砰然​打开​的​声响​让​血​法师​猛地​抬头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​人​不是​游侠​骑士​！​他们​是​入侵者​！​杀​了​他们​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} long2 men2 peng1 ran2 da3kai1 de5 sheng1xiang3 rang4 xie3 fa3shi1 meng3de5 tai2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 ren2 bu4shi4 you2Xia2qi2shi4！ta1men5 shi4 ru4qin1zhe3！sha1 le5 ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The bouncer's hand tightens on the butt of his taser. Then he takes another look at you, sighs, and drops it to his side.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look. I'll tell you what. If you want a room and you can pay - and I mean PAY - go talk to Frank. He can hook you up.\n"
"\n"
"You'll find him on the VIP Lounge, way back there on your right."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​门卫​紧​了​紧​那​只握​着​电击​枪握​柄​的​手​。​他​又​看​了​你​一眼​，​叹​了​口气​，​松开​了​枪柄​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​吧​，​我​给你个​建议​。​你​要是​想开​个​房间​，​而且​你​能付​得​起​钱​—​—​我​是​说​能​掏​一大笔​那种​—​—​那​就​去​跟​弗兰克​谈谈​。​他​能​给​你​安排​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​去​VIP​大厅​找​他​吧​，​就​在​那​里面​，​你​右手边​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} men2wei4 jin3 le5 jin3 na4 zhi3 wo4 zhao2 dian4ji1 qiang1 wo4 bing3 de5 shou3。ta1 you4 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，tan4 le5 kou3qi4，song1kai1 le5 qiang1 bing3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1，wo3 gei3 ni3 ge4 jian4yi4。ni3 yao4shi5 xiang3kai1 ge4 fang2jian1，er2qie3 ni3 neng2 fu4 de2 qi3 qian2——wo3 shi4 shuo1 neng2 tao1 yi1 dai4 bi3 na4zhong3——na4 jiu4 qu4 gen1 fu2lan2ke4 tan2tan2。ta1 neng2 gei3 ni3 an1pai2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 qu4 VIP da4ting1 zhao3 ta1 ba1，jiu4 zai4 na4 li3mian4，ni3 you4 shou3 bian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The breathy actress lets out a sharp gasp. Phil mimes the motion, and a tear begins to trace its way down his cheek.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But Father! You can't mean..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那位​气若游丝​的​女演员​发出​一声​尖锐​的​惊叹​。​菲尔​模仿​着​她​的​动作​，​一滴​眼泪​顺着​他​的​脸颊​滑落​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但是​，​父亲​！​这​怎么​可能​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 wei4 qi4 ruo4 you2 si1 de5 nu:3 yan3 yuan2 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 jian1rui4 de5 jing1tan4。fei1 er3 mo2fang3 zhao2 ta1 de5 dong4zuo4，yi1 di1 yan3lei4 shun4zhe5 ta1 de5 lian3jia2 hua2luo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4shi4，fu4qin1！zhe4 zen3me5 ke3neng2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The burly ork’s face, raw and slick with scar tissue, is contorted in a grimace of pain. You’ve seen this kind of wound before. He doesn’t have long.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Idiots.\n"
"\n"
"Forty years... forty years and we finally had a chance to make a difference… and you blew it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​魁梧​的​兽​人​脸上​因​疤痕​而​坑坑洼洼​，​此刻​正​扭曲​成​痛苦​的​表情​。​你​以前​见过​这种​伤口​。​他​时日无多​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​蠢货​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​四十年​……​四十年​了​，​我们​终于​有​机会​改变​一切​……​而​你们​却​搞砸​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kui2wu2 de5 shou4 ren2 lian3 shang4 yin1 ba1hen2 er2 keng1keng5wa1wa1，ci3ke4 zheng1 niu3qu1 cheng2 tong4ku3 de5 biao3qing2。ni3 yi3qian2 jian4 guo4 zhe4zhong3 shang1kou3。ta1 shi2ri4wu2duo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"chun3huo4。\n"
"\n"
"si4 shi2 nian2……si4 shi2 nian2 le5，wo3men5 zhong1yu2 you3 ji1hui4 gai3bian4 yi1qie4……er2 ni3men5 que4 gao3za2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The burned ork knocks on the heavy transplast window separating you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"‘Fraid that’s not gonna happen. This lab's locked down tight, like the Doc said. The test subjects that they keep in there don't play well with others. Dangerous, nasty things... "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​带有​灼痕​的​兽​人​敲打​着​隔开​你们​之间​的​厚重​透塑​窗户​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​这​可​不行​。​博士​说​了​，​实验室​已经​牢牢​封死​了​。​里面​的​实验​体​彼此之间​相处​得​并​不​融洽​。​这些​东西​既​肮脏​又​危险​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dai4you3 zhuo2 hen2 de5 shou4 ren2 qiao1da3 zhao2 ge2kai1 ni3men5 zhi1jian1 de5 hou4zhong4 tou4 su4 chuang1hu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 zhe4 ke3 bu4xing2。bo2shi4 shuo1 le5，shi2yan4shi4 yi3jing1 lao2lao2 feng1 si3 le5。li3mian4 de5 shi2yan4 ti3 bi3 ci3 zhi1 jian1 xiang1chu3 de2 bing4 bu4 rong2qia4。zhe4xie1 dong1xi1 ji4 ang1zang1 you4 wei1xian3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The camera switches focus to a middle-aged man with a haunted look in his eyes. He stammers out a reply.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Y-yes. Of course."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​镜头​切换​到​一位​有些​失神​的​中年男子​。​他​结结巴巴​地​回答​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​-​是​啊​。​当然​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing4tou2 qie1huan4 dao4 yi1 wei4 you3xie1 shi1shen2 de5 zhong4 nian2 nan2 zi3。ta1 jie1jie1ba1ba5 de5 hui2da2 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 -shi4 a1。dang1ran2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The clone that you liberated steps forward, blinking against the light. The look on his face is one of dawning horror.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But what of me? My brothers... all dead! This is not supposed to happen, it is wrong!\n"
"\n"
"If they are dead, I should be dead with them. We live as one, and we die as one! It is our purpose!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​解救出来​的​克隆人​向前​一步​，​因为​光线​而​不断​眨​着​眼睛​。​他​脸上​浮现​出​逐渐​清晰​的​惊骇​之色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​呢​？​我​的​兄弟​们​……​全都​死​了​！​这种​事本​不该​发生​，​这是​错误​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​他们​死​了​，​我​也​应该​和​他们​一起​死​。​我们​同生​同死​！​这是​我们​的​使命​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 jie3 jiu4 chu1 lai2 de5 ke4long2ren2 xiang4qian2 yi1 bu4，yin1wei4 guang1xian4 er2 bu4duan4 zha3 zhao2 yan3jing5。ta1 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 chu1 zhu2jian4 qing1xi1 de5 jing1hai4 zhi1 se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 ni2？wo3 de5 xiong1di4 men5……quan2dou1 si3 le5！zhe4zhong3 shi4 ben3 bu4gai1 fa1sheng1，zhe4 shi4 cuo4wu4 de5！\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1men5 si3 le5，wo3 ye3 ying1gai1 he4 ta1men5 yi1qi3 si3。wo3men5 tong2 sheng1 tong2 si3！zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 de5 shi3ming4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The coffee shop owner offers you a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course, of course! Herr Amsel is too kind."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​咖啡店​老板​朝​你​露出​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​当然​！​阿姆​泽尔​先生​太​客气​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ka1fei1dian4 lao3ban3 chao2 ni3 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，dang1ran2！E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 tai4 ke4qi5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The coffee vendor shouts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can’t you see that I am speaking to an honored guest, you tower of quivering corpulence?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​咖啡​商人​大​喊道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这​坨​肥肉​叫唤​什么​？​难道​你​没​看见​我​正在​和​尊贵​的​客人​说话​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ka1fei1 shang1ren2 dai4 han3dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4 tuo2 fei2rou4 jiao4huan5 shen2me5？nan2dao4 ni3 mei2 kan4jian4 wo3 zheng4zai4 he4 zun1gui4 de5 ke4ren2 shuo1hua4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The commlink crackles, and the response comes back low and soft... softer than you'd expect from a troll.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Affirmative. The alarm lines have been cut, and I have a clear line of fire on the estate's service entrance.\n"
"\n"
"When you exit the building, the path will be clear."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​通讯​链​沙沙​一响​，​从中​传来​的​回应​低沉​而​柔和​……​至少​比​你​印象​中​的​巨魔要​柔和​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​确认​就位​。​警报​线路​已​切断​，​我​已​锁定​庄园​仆人​入口​的​射击​位置​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​从​建筑物​撤离​时​，​我会​确保​路线​通畅​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tong1xun4 lian4 sha1sha1 yi1 xiang3，cong2zhong1 chuan2lai2 de5 hui2ying4 di1chen2 er2 rou2he2……zhi4shao3 bi3 ni3 yin4xiang4 zhong4 de5 ju4 mo2 yao4 rou2he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"que4ren4 jiu4 wei4。jing3bao4 xian4lu4 yi3 qie1duan4，wo3 yi3 suo3ding4 zhuang1yuan2 pu2ren2 ru4kou3 de5 she4ji1 wei4zhi5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 cong2 jian4zhu4wu4 che4li2 shi2，wo3 hui4 que4bao3 lu4xian4 tong1chang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The commlink goes dark. Monika winks at you as she drops her arm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See? We're professionals. \n"
"\n"
"All right, people. Enough chatter. Our client wants the data from the vault, so we get him the data from the vault. Quick, quiet… and quick."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​通讯​链​的​屏幕​暗​了​下来​。​莫妮卡​放下​胳膊​，​朝​你​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​瞧见​了​吧​？​我们​可是​专业​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​各位​，​闲话​回头​再聊​。​客户​要​库里​的​数据​，​我们​就​给​他​弄到手​。​动作​要​快​，​要轻​……​而且​要​快​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tong1xun4 lian4 de5 ping2mu4 an4 le5 xia4lai5。Mo4ni1ka3 fang4xia4 ge1bo5，chao2 ni3 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiao2jian4 le5 ba1？wo3men5 ke3shi4 zhuan1ye4 de5。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5 ge4wei4，xian2hua4 hui2tou2 zai4 liao2。ke4hu4 yao4 ku4 li3 de5 shu4ju4，wo3men5 jiu4 gei3 ta1 nong4dao4shou3。dong4zuo4 yao4 kuai4，yao4 qing1……er2qie3 yao4 kuai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The confusion washes over her face again. She begins blinking agitatedly and fidgeting.\n"
"\n"
"Then that unseen force clamps down again, and she seems to calm.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​困惑​再次​涌上​她​的​脸庞​。​她​开始​焦躁​地​眨眼​，​身体​不安​地​扭动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​随后​那股​无形​的​力量​再度​取得​了​控制​，​她​似乎​又​冷静​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kun4huo4 zai4ci4 yong3 shang4 ta1 de5 lian3pang2。ta1 kai1shi3 jiao1zao4 de5 zha3yan3，shen1ti3 bu4an1 de5 niu3 dong4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 sui2hou4 na4 gu3 wu2xing2 de5 li4liang5 zai4du4 qu3de2 le5 kong4zhi4，ta1 si4hu1 you4 leng3jing4 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The console spits out a stick of black plastic. Amsel plucks it from the computer and hands it to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Here. Your key to speak with Alice."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​控制台​吐​出​一根​黑色​塑料​棒​。​阿姆​泽尔​从​电脑​上取​下​它​，​递给​了​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拿​好​。​这是​联络​爱丽丝​的​钥匙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kong4zhi4tai2 tu3 chu1 yi1 gen1 hei1se4 su4liao4 bang4。E1mu3ze2er3 cong2 dian4nao3 shang4 qu3 xia4 ta1，di4gei3 le5 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na2 hao3。zhe4 shi4 lian2luo4 ai4li4si1 de5 yao4shi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The corner of her mouth curls into a smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anytime."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​嘴角​浮现​出​一丝​笑意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​客气​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 fu2xian4 chu1 yi1 si1 xiao4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 ke4qi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The corner of her mouth lifts into a smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Step aside.\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and $(l.name)... I've gotta ask. Is the display on your trid flashing twelve o'clock back at home?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​抿嘴​一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​让​一下​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​对​了​，​$(l.name)​……​我​得​问​你​个​事​。​你​家里​的​3D​投影​是不是​显示​着​十二点​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 min3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"rang4 yi1xia4。\n"
"\n"
"dui4 le5，$(l.name)……wo3 de2 wen4 ni3 ge4 shi4。ni3 jia1li3 de5 3D tou2ying3 shi4bu5shi4 xian3shi4 zhao2 shi2 er4 dian3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The corner of his mouth lifts into an ugly smirk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You may be the \"leader\" of this team, but I'll speak my mind whenever I please.\n"
"\n"
"Get used to it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​嘴角​扬起​一抹​丑陋​的​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​或许​是​这支​队伍​的​“​领袖​”​，​但​我​随时​都​会​畅所欲言​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​慢慢​习惯​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zui3jiao3 yang2qi3 yi1 ma1 chou3lou4 de5 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 huo4xu3 shi4 zhe4 zhi1 dui4wu3 de5“ling3xiu4”，dan4 wo3 sui2shi2 dou1 hui4 chang4suo3yu4yan2。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 man4man4 xi2guan4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The corporate spokesman turns to address the security officers behind him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You two. Enter the building, find whoever's on that intercom, and silence him."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​公司​发言人​转身​对​身后​的​安保​人员​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​两个​进楼​里​去​，​找到​那个​在​广播​上​说话​的​家伙​，​把​他​解决​掉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gong1si1 fa1yan2ren2 zhuan3shen1 dui4 shen1hou4 de5 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 liang3 ge4 jin4 lou2 li3 qu4，zhao3dao4 na4ge5 zai4 guang3bo1 shang4 shuo1hua4 de5 jia1huo5，ba3 ta1 jie3jue2 diao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The couple exchanges a look.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"By now, word has spread beyond the Kreuzbasar. There has been talk. Some have even seen strangers sniffing about."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老​夫妇​彼此​看​了​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如今​消息​已经​传出​了​克洛伊​茨​集市​之外​。​人们​议论纷纷​，​甚至​还有​人​看见​陌生人​在​附近​打探​消息​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 fu1fu4 bi3ci3 kan4 le5 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2jin1 xiao1xi5 yi3jing1 chuan2chu1 le5 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhi1wai4。ren2men5 yi4lun4fen1fen1，shen4zhi4 hai2you3 ren2 kan4jian4 mo4sheng1ren2 zai4 fu4jin4 da3tan4 xiao1xi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The decker standing behind you notices you rifling the parts from his terminal. He lets out a shout of dismay.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey! They're trying to screw us over! Get them!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​站​在​你​身后​的​碟​客​发现​你​在​拆卸​他​的​终端​组件​，​他​发出​一声​惊叫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嘿​！​他们​想坑​我们​！​抓住​他们​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhan4 zai4 ni3 shen1hou4 de5 die2 ke4 fa1xian4 ni3 zai4 chai1xie4 ta1 de5 zhong1duan1 zu3jian4，ta1 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 jing1jiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hei1！ta1men5 xiang3 keng1 wo3men5！zhua1zhu4 ta1men5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The door slams open. On the other side, a disheveled middle-aged man with wild eyes clutches a fountain pen in one hand and a gun in the other.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're not Albert! NOT ALBERT!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​门​猛地​被​撞开​，​那头​站​着​一个​衣衫不整​的​中年男子​，​眼神​狂乱​，​一手​攥​着​钢笔​，​另一只​手握着​枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不是​阿尔伯特​！​你​不是​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} men2 meng3de5 bei4 zhuang4 kai1，na4 tou2 zhan4 zhao2 yi1ge5 yi1 shan1 bu4 zheng3 de5 zhong4 nian2 nan2 zi3，yan3shen2 kuang2luan4，yi1shou3 zuan4 zhao2 gang1bi3，ling4 yi1 zhi3 shou3 wo4 zhao2 qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4shi4 a1er3bo2te4！ni3 bu4shi4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The drone's minigun spins up with a hum.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"TARGET :: $++(l.name). ELIMINATION PROTOCOLS ENGAGED."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​无人机​上​的​机枪​发出​嗡嗡声​，​开始​旋转​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​目标​：​$++(l.name)​。​清除​程序​已​启动​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} wu2ren2ji1 shang4 de5 ji1qiang1 fa1chu1 weng1weng1sheng1，kai1shi3 xuan2zhuan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mu4biao1：$++(l.name)。qing1chu2 cheng2xu4 yi3 qi3dong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf grins.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Naturally. We'll take you safely to see him."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这是​自然​。​我们​会​让​你​安全​见到​他​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 zi4ran2。wo3men5 hui4 rang4 ni3 an1quan2 jian4dao4 ta1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf looks up at you apologetically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, like he said... no offense.\n"
"\n"
"'Round these parts, \"trog\" is... well, I guess you'd call it a \"term of endearment.\" Sort of an ironic thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​抬头​，​心怀​歉意​地​看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​，​如​他​所说​……​没有​恶意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​按​我们​的话​讲​，​“​穴居人​”​这个​词​……​你​可以​当成​是​一种​“​爱称​”​，​带有​一点点​调侃​的​意味​而已​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 tai2tou2，xin1huai2 qian4yi4 de5 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4，ru2 ta1 suo3 shuo1……mei2you3 e4yi4。\n"
"\n"
"an4 wo3men5 de5hua4 jiang3，“xue2ju1ren2” zhe4ge5 ci2……ni3 ke3yi3 dang4cheng2 shi4 yi1zhong3“ai4cheng1”，dai4you3 yi1dian3dian3 tiao2kan3 de5 yi4wei4 er2yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Better.\n"
"\n"
"Now, let's get down to business, shall we?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这么​说​可以​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​了​，​我们​来聊​正事​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4me5 shuo1 ke3yi3。\n"
"\n"
"hao3 le5，wo3men5 lai2 liao2 zheng4shi4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Of course. Sorry."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​。​抱歉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5。bao4qian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf scoffs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Don't know if I'd go that far."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​嗤笑​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​都​不​知道​我们​关系​有​这么​好​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 chi1xiao4 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3men5 guan1xi5 you3 zhe4me5 hao3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If that's the way you want it, fine. Be my guest.\n"
"\n"
"But when you catch a bullet out there, don't come cryin' back to me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​既然​你​这么​说​，​那​就​随你便​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​挨​枪子儿​了​可​别哭​着​来​找​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji4ran2 ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1，na4 jiu4 sui2 ni3 bian4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"ai1 qiang1 zi3 er2 le5 ke3 bie4 ku1 zhao2 lai2 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf shovels another heaping forkful of pie into his mouth. He chews thoughtfully.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Until then, his life will be a living hell, but I can think of worse things to use as a bargaining chip.\n"
"\n"
"Remember, you need to know who he works for. The more you can take him out of his comfort zone, the better."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​又​戳​起​一大块​馅饼​塞进​嘴里​，​若有所思​地​咀嚼​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​到​那时​，​他​的​生活​将​是​一场​噩梦​，​但​我​还​能​想到​更​糟糕​的​东西​来​作为​谈判​筹码​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​记住​，​你们​需要​知道​他​为​谁​工作​。​你们​越能​让​他​脱离​舒适​区​，​效果​越​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 you4 chuo1 qi3 yi1 dai4 kuai4 xian4bing3 se4 jin4 zui3li3，ruo4you3suo3si1 de5 ju3jue2 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dao4 na4shi2，ta1 de5 sheng1huo2 jiang1 shi4 yi1 chang2 e4meng4，dan4 wo3 hai2 neng2 xiang3dao4 geng1 zao1gao1 de5 dong1xi1 lai2 zuo4wei2 tan2pan4 chou2ma3。\n"
"\n"
"ji4zhu5，ni3men5 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 ta1 wei2 shei2 gong1zuo4。ni3men5 yue4 neng2 rang4 ta1 tuo1li2 shu1shi4 qu1，xiao4guo3 yue4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf wrings her hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I told them to wait! \"Our instructions were clear,\" I said. \"We need to go in as a group.\"\n"
"\n"
"But they didn't listen to me, they just went on in anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​焦躁​地​搓​着​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​让​他们​等等​的​！​我​说​，​“​我们​接到​的​指示​很​明确​，​要​作为​一个​团队​来​行动​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他们​不肯​听​，​还是​径直​进去​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 jiao1zao4 de5 cuo1 zhao2 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 rang4 ta1men5 deng3deng3 de5！wo3 shuo1，“wo3men5 jie1dao4 de5 zhi3shi4 hen3 ming2que4，yao4 zuo4wei2 yi1ge5 tuan2dui4 lai2 xing2dong4”。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1men5 bu4 ken3 ting1，hai2shi5 jing4zhi2 jin4qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf wrings her hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I told them to wait! \"Our instructions were clear,\" I said. \"We need to go in as a group.\"\n"
"\n"
"But they didn't listen to me, they just went on in anyway. It's not like I could stop them."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​焦躁​地​搓​着​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​让​他们​等等​的​！​我​说​，​“​我们​接到​的​指示​很​明确​，​要​作为​一个​团队​来​行动​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他们​不肯​听​，​还是​径直​进去​了​。​我​也​拦不住​他们​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 jiao1zao4 de5 cuo1 zhao2 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 rang4 ta1men5 deng3deng3 de5！wo3 shuo1，“wo3men5 jie1dao4 de5 zhi3shi4 hen3 ming2que4，yao4 zuo4wei2 yi1ge5 tuan2dui4 lai2 xing2dong4”。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1men5 bu4 ken3 ting1，hai2shi5 jing4zhi2 jin4qu4 le5。wo3 ye3 lan2 bu4 zhu4 ta1men5 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf wrings her hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry! I told them to wait, but they didn't listen. They just muscled on past me and waltzed through the front door."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​焦躁​地​搓​着​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​抱歉​！​我​让​他们​等等​的​，​但​他们​不肯​听​，​直接​强行​挤过​我​身边​，​大摇大摆​地​穿过​前门​走​了​进去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 jiao1zao4 de5 cuo1 zhao2 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4！wo3 rang4 ta1men5 deng3deng3 de5，dan4 ta1men5 bu4 ken3 ting1，zhi2jie1 qiang2xing2 ji3guo4 wo3 shen1bian1，da4yao2da4bai3 de5 chuan1guo4 qian2men2 zou3 le5 jin4qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The dwarf's benevolent smile does not falter.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You are quite mistaken. The Hub is a place of peace. We are in no danger here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​的​慈爱​笑容​始终​未曾​动摇​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​肯定​是​搞错​了​。​中枢​是​平静​之地​。​我们​在​这里​没有​任何​危险​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 de5 ci2ai4 xiao4rong2 shi3zhong1 wei4ceng2 dong4yao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ken3ding4 shi4 gao3cuo4 le5。zhong1shu1 shi4 ping2jing4 zhi1 de5。wo3men5 zai4 zhe4li3 mei2you3 ren4he2 wei1xian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The elderly couple huddles together in the cool air, their hands cupped around their respective cups of coffee. Seeing you, they warm, if ever so slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hello again."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老​夫妇​在​凉风​中​依偎​着​，​各自​的​双手​捧​着​咖啡杯​。​看见​你​时​，​他们​微微​露出​了​暖意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​见面​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 fu1fu4 zai4 liang2 feng1 zhong4 yi1wei1 zhao2，ge4zi4 de5 shuang1shou3 peng3 zhao2 ka1 fei1 bei1。kan4jian4 ni3 shi2，ta1men5 wei1wei1 lu4chu1 le5 nuan3yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The elevator guard steps toward you, his weapon slung.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't expect to bump into any of you Knight Errant guys out here... but then, with the power overload, who knows what's happening.\n"
"\n"
"They tell you guys anything about what's going on?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​电梯​警卫​朝​你​走来​，​武器​斜​挎​在​肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没想到​会​在​这里​撞见​你们​游侠​骑士​的​人​……​不过​话说回来​，​由于​电网​过载​，​没有​人​知道​现在​情况​到底​如何​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​和​你们​解释​过​状况​么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dian4ti1 jing3wei4 chao2 ni3 zou3 lai2，wu3qi4 xie2 kua4 zai4 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3 zhuang4jian4 ni3men5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 ren2……bu4guo4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，you2yu2 dian4wang3 guo4zai4，mei2you3 ren2 zhi1dao4 xian4zai4 qing2kuang4 dao4di3 ru2he2。\n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 he4 ni3men5 jie3shi4 guo4 zhuang4kuang4 ma2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The elevator guard steps toward you, his weapon slung.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't hear anything about KE assets being deployed in this sector."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​电梯​警卫​朝​你​走来​，​武器​斜​挎​在​肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​听说​游侠​骑士​的​人会​被​部署​到​这片​区域​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dian4ti1 jing3wei4 chao2 ni3 zou3 lai2，wu3qi4 xie2 kua4 zai4 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1shuo1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 ren2 hui4 bei4 bu4shu3 dao4 zhe4 pian1 qu1yu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The elevator guard steps toward you, his weapon slung.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't hear anything about KE assets being deployed in this sector. Why are you here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​电梯​警卫​朝​你​走来​，​武器​斜​挎​在​肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没​听说​游侠​骑士​的​人会​被​部署​到​这片​区域​。​你​为什么​出现​在​这里​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dian4ti1 jing3wei4 chao2 ni3 zou3 lai2，wu3qi4 xie2 kua4 zai4 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2 ting1shuo1 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 ren2 hui4 bei4 bu4shu3 dao4 zhe4 pian1 qu1yu4。ni3 wei4shen2me5 chu1xian4 zai4 zhe4li3？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The elf ponders for a moment, twisting a ring on his right hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Feuerschwinge… the Firewing. That is a name that hasn’t been heard in some time - over forty years, I believe, though I cannot say for certain. Time and I do not get along."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精灵​沉思​片刻​，​不住​地​转动​右手​上​的​戒指​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​火翼​……​火翼​。​这个​名字​有​段时间​没​出现​了​。​应该​有​四十多年​了​吧​，​但​我​也​不能​肯定​。​我​和​时间​的​关系​向来​不太好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1ling2 chen2si1 pian4ke4，bu4zhu4 de5 zhuan3dong4 you4shou3 shang4 de5 jie4zhi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Huo3yi4……Huo3yi4。zhe4ge5 ming2zi5 you3 duan4 shi2 jian1 mei2 chu1xian4 le5。ying1gai1 you3 si4 shi2 duo1 nian2 le5 ba1，dan4 wo3 ye3 bu4neng2 ken3ding4。wo3 he4 shi2jian1 de5 guan1xi5 xiang4lai2 bu4tai4hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The elf smiles broadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very good. Run along, now.\n"
"\n"
"When Ullrich is dead, you know where to find me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精灵​咧嘴一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​很​好​。​快​去​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​杀死​乌尔里​希​之后​，​你​知道​该来​哪里找​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1ling2 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hen3 hao3。kuai4 qu4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"sha1si3 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 zhi1hou4，ni3 zhi1dao4 gai1 lai2 na3 li3 zhao3 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The elf's dialect is completely foreign; it's quite unlike the form of Sperethiel spoken by the elves of Tír na nÓg. You only manage to catch a few words.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You...terrible...insolence of threating! ... see if... at all?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精灵​口中​的​方言​完全​陌生​，​与​提尔纳诺​的​精灵​所说​的​精灵​语​截然不同​。​你​只​听懂​了​寥寥​几个​词汇​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​……​可恶​……​竟敢​威胁​我​！​……​看看​……​到底​行不行​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1ling2 kou3 zhong4 de5 fang1yan2 wan2quan2 mo4sheng1，yu4 ti2 er3 na4 nuo4 de5 jing1ling2 suo3 shuo1 de5 jing1ling2 yu3 jie2ran2bu4tong2。ni3 zhi3 ting1dong3 le5 liao2liao2 ji3ge5 ci2hui4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3……ke3wu4……jing4gan3 wei1xie2 wo3！……kan4kan5……dao4di3 xing2 bu4 xing2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The elf's lips twist into a cruel smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Big mistake, pal. You're gonna burn for that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精灵​的​嘴角​扭出​一个​残酷​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大错特错​，​伙计​。​你​会​为此​付出代价​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1ling2 de5 zui3jiao3 niu3 chu1 yi1ge5 can2ku4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4cuo4te4cuo4，huo3ji5。ni3 hui4 wei4ci3 fu4 chu1 dai4 jia4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The expression on Dietrich's face softens, and he claps you on the shoulder.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let's go find my nephew. And let's crack all the Humanis skulls we can along the way.\n"
"\n"
"The fuckers have it coming in more ways than I can count."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​的​表情​柔和​下来​，​他​拍了拍​你​的​肩膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​咱们​去​找​我​侄子​吧​，​顺便​砸烂​一路上​那些​人类​至上​主义者​的​狗头​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这群​杂种​坏事​做​尽​，​活该​被​收拾​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 de5 biao3qing2 rou2he2 xia4lai5，ta1 pai1 le5 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zan2men5 qu4 zhao3 wo3 zhi2zi5 ba1，shun4bian4 za2lan4 yi1lu4shang4 na4xie1 ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 gou3 tou2。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 qun2 za2zhong3 huai4shi4 zuo4 jin3，huo2gai1 bei4 shou1shi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The facade cracks, and Mira's face crumples.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Yeah. I know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​努力​维持​的​伪装​被​一语​戳破​，​米拉​的​脸​随即​垮​了​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​是​啊​。​我​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu3li4 wei2chi2 de5 wei3zhuang1 bei4 yi1 yu3 chuo1po4，mi3la1 de5 lian3 sui2ji2 kua3 le5 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……shi4 a1。wo3 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The fat man frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And a scone! I was going to say, “and a scone as well”! Nothing is too good for $(l.him)!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​胖​男人​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​刚才​忘​了​说​了​，​再来份​司康饼​！​像​$(l.he)​这样​的​人​就​得​拿​最好​的​吃食​来​招待​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pan2 nan2ren2 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gang1cai2 wang4 le5 shuo1 le5，zai4 lai2 fen4 si1 kang1 bing3！xiang4 $(l.he) zhe4yang4 de5 ren2 jiu4 de2 na2 zui4hao3 de5 chi1shi2 lai2 zhao1dai4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The fear drains from her face. She looks exhausted.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you. I really, really mean that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​脸上​的​恐惧​慢慢​褪去​。​她​看起来​精疲力竭​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​。​我​是​非常​认真​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 kong3ju4 man4man4 tui4qu4。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 jing1pi2li4jie2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5。wo3 shi4 fei1chang2 ren4zhen1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The female voice cuts in, soft and comforting.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, then, we'll send them away. You're perfectly safe here - you have to believe that.\n"
"\n"
"Don't worry, dear heart. Harrow won't let anyone hurt you... not here, in this place. Not ever again."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那个​温柔​女声​打断​了​他​，​开口​安抚​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​真是​那样​，​我们​会​把​他们​赶走​。​你​在​这里​是​绝对​安全​的​—​—​你​一定​要​相信​这​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​别怕​，​亲爱​的​。​哈罗​不会​让​任何人​伤害​你​……​在​这里​，​你​永远​不会​再​受到​伤害​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4ge5 wen1rou2 nu:3 sheng1 da3duan4 le5 ta1，kai1kou3 an1fu3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 zhen1shi5 na4yang4，wo3men5 hui4 ba3 ta1men5 gan3zou3。ni3 zai4 zhe4li3 shi4 jue2dui4 an1quan2 de5——ni3 yi1ding4 yao4 xiang1xin4 zhe4 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"bie4 pa4，qin1ai4 de5。ha1luo2 bu4hui4 rang4 ren4 he2 ren2 shang1hai4 ni3……zai4 zhe4li3，ni3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 zai4 shou4dao4 shang1hai4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The first voice sounds nervous. Young.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I heard the runners escaped. You sure they're gonna come this way?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​第一个​声音​听​起来​很​紧张​。​是​个​年轻人​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​听说​那些​狂奔​者​逃走​了​。​你​确定​他们​会朝​这个​方向​来​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} di4 yi1 ge4 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 hen3 jin3zhang1。shi4 ge4 nian2qing1ren2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ting1shuo1 na4xie1 kuang2Ben1zhe3 tao2zou3 le5。ni3 que4ding4 ta1men5 hui4 chao2 zhe4ge5 fang1xiang4 lai2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The floor manager shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He's a regular. If you wait around long enough, you may see him. Then again, maybe not. I haven't seen him for a while.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He turns back to the dancer.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​楼层​经理​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​是​个​常客​。​你​要是​在​这多待​两天​，​没准​就​碰见​他​了​。​不过​也​说​不准​，​我​有​一段时间​没见​着​这​人​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​又​转​回去​看​舞娘​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lou2ceng2 jing1li3 song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 shi4 ge4 chang2ke4。ni3 yao4shi5 zai4 zhe4 duo1 dai1 liang3 tian1，mei2zhun3 jiu4 peng4jian4 ta1 le5。bu4guo4 ye3 shuo1 bu4zhun3，wo3 you3 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 mei2 jian4 zhao2 zhe4 ren2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 you4 zhuai3 hui2qu5 kan4 wu3niang2 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The fluttering sensation in your chest returns. The spirit's voices warble in delight.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<Glory. Oh, my poor, dear *child.*\n"
"\n"
"First, your mother. Now, your lover. And no one to blame but yourself.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​胸口​那阵​悸动​再度​袭​来​。​精魂​的​低语​欢快​地​颤动​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​格洛丽​。​哦​，​我​可怜​的​*​孩子​*​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​第一次​是​你​的​母亲​。​现在​，​是​你​的​恋人​。​而​这​一切​，​只能​归罪于​你​自己​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xiong1kou3 na4zhen4 ji4dong4 zai4du4 xi2 lai2。jing1hun2 de5 di1yu3 huan1kuai4 de5 chan4dong4 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< Ge2luo4li2。e2，wo3 ke3lian2 de5*hai2zi5*。\n"
"\n"
"di4yi1ci4 shi4 ni3 de5 mu3qin1。xian4zai4，shi4 ni3 de5 lian4ren2。er2 zhe4 yi1qie4，zhi3neng2 gui1 zui4 yu2 ni3 zi4ji3。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ghost of a smile flits across her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Later, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​脸上​掠过​一抹​若有若无​的​笑意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​回头见​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 lu:e4guo4 yi1 ma1 ruo4you3ruo4wu2 de5 xiao4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui2tou2jian4，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ghoul freezes in its tracks. Its voice begins to waver.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please, $(l.sir)... may I speak? I promise you, I will come no closer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​食尸​鬼​愣​在​了​原地​。​它​的​声音​开始​有些​颤抖​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​求​你​了​，​$(l.sir)​……​能​让​我​说句话​吗​？​我​保证​，​我​不会​再​靠近​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi2 shi1 gui3 leng4 zai4 le5 yuan2di4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 kai1shi3 you3xie1 chan4dou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiu2 ni3 le5，$(l.sir)……neng2 rang4 wo3 shuo1 ju4 hua4 ma5？wo3 bao3zheng4，wo3 bu4hui4 zai4 kao4jin4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ghoul nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Yes, perhaps you can convince him where we could not.\n"
"\n"
"We have a commlink, provided to us by the decker. It is a direct line to Ezkibel's office.\n"
"\n"
"If you call him, he will answer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​食尸​鬼​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​好​的​，​也许​你​能​替​我们​说服​他​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​碟客​给​过​我们​通讯​链​，​可以​直接​联系​到​埃兹​基​贝尔​的​办公室​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​直接​拨​过去​，​他会接​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi2 shi1 gui3 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5 hao3 de5，ye3xu3 ni3 neng2 ti4 wo3men5 shuo1fu2 ta1。\n"
"\n"
"die2 ke4 gei3 guo4 wo3men5 tong1xun4 lian4，ke3yi3 zhi2jie1 lian2xi4 dao4 Ai1ziji1bei4er3 de5 ban4gong1shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 zhi2jie1 bo1 guo4qu4，ta1 hui4 jie1 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ghoul turns away in misery.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please leave us. And please, do not come back."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​食尸​鬼​苦涩​地​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​离开​吧​。​也​请​再也​不要​回来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi2 shi1 gui3 ku3se4 de5 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 li2kai1 ba1。ye3 qing3 zai4ye3 bu4yao4 hui2lai5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ghoul's voice comes out in a rasping sob.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you, stranger! Considering my... condition... I had all but given up hope."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​食尸​鬼​的​声音​带​着​嘶哑​的​啜泣​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​，​陌生人​！​考虑​到​我​的​……​现状​……​我​早已​放弃​了​希望​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shi2 shi1 gui3 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 si1ya3 de5 chuo4qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5，mo4sheng1ren2！kao3lu:4 dao4 wo3 de5……xian4zhuang4……wo3 zao3yi3 fang4qi4 le5 xi1wang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The girl absently fingers the chipjack in her temple.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I wanted to escape with the children, and the captain. We had to get away from the soldiers. Out of Austria."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​女孩​心不在焉​地​拨弄​着​太阳穴​上​的​芯片​插口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​想​和​孩子​们​还有​舰长​一起​逃走​。​我们​必须​得​逃离​那些​士兵​。​离开​奥地利​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3hai2 xin1bu4zai4yan1 de5 bo1nong4 zhao2 tai4yang2xue2 shang4 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xiang3 he4 hai2zi5 men5 hai2you3 jian4zhang3 yi1qi3 tao2zou3。wo3men5 bi4xu1 de2 tao2li2 na4xie1 shi4bing1。li2kai1 ao4di4li4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The girl grips her head with clawlike hands, tugging at her hair as if she might pull her brain out through her skull.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't like this... But I can't switch it off."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​女孩​用​瘦骨嶙峋​的​手​捂住​脑袋​，​用力​扯​着​头发​，​仿佛​要​把​脑子​从​颅骨​里​拽​出来​似的​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​喜欢​这样​……​但​我​没法​关掉​它​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3hai2 yong4 shou4gu3lin2xun2 de5 shou3 wu3zhu4 nao3dai5，yong4li4 che3 zhao2 tou2fa5，fang3fu2 yao4 ba3 nao3zi5 cong2 lu2gu3 li3 zhuai1 chu1lai2 shi4de5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 xi3huan5 zhe4yang4……dan4 wo3 mei2fa3 guan1diao4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The girl in the corner is a model stim junkie, all wild eyes and nervous energy. She greets you with a smile so wide as to border on the grotesque.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"HEY! Hey, good-lookin'! You wanna party?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​角落里​的​女孩​眼神​飘忽​，​浑身​躁动不安​，​一看​就是​个​拟感​成瘾者​。​她​朝​你​笑了笑​，​嘴咧得​很大​，​都​有点​吓人​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗨​！​嗨​，​可人儿​！​想​不想​来​找点​乐子​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jiao3 la4 li3 de5 nu:3hai2 yan3shen2 piao1hu1，hun2shen1 zao4 dong4 bu4 an1，yi1 kan4 jiu4shi4 ge4 ni3 gan3 cheng2 yin3 zhe3。ta1 chao2 ni3 xiao4 le5 xiao4，zui3 lie3 de2 hen3 dai4，dou1 you3dian3 xia4ren2 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai1！hai1，ke3 ren2 er2！xiang3 bu4xiang3 lai2 zhao3 dian3 le4zi5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The girl stares blankly into a vacant sky. She's still sporting a "
"black eye, and there are fresh tears on her cheeks, but she doesn't seem to "
"notice them.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​女孩​呆滞​地望​着​空荡​的​天空​。​她​的​眼眶​仍泛​着​青紫​，​脸颊​上​挂​着​新落​的​泪痕​，​但​她​却​似乎​浑然不觉​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3hai2 dai1zhi4 de5 wang4 zhao2 kong1 dang4 de5 tian1kong1。ta1 de5 yan3kuang4 reng2 fan4 zhao2 qing1zi3，lian3jia2 shang4 gua4 zhao2 xin1 la4 de5 lei4hen2，dan4 ta1 que4 si4hu1 hun2ran2bu4jue2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The girl taps a finger thoughtfully against her chin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, you’re new here. I know that you knew Monika, and I've got a vague idea about went down the night she died. \n"
"\n"
"But I wanna know what you think your most exciting adventure has ever been."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​女孩​若有所思​地用​手指​轻点​着​下颌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​你​刚来​这里​。​我​知道​你​认识​莫妮卡​，​我​对​她​去世​当晚​发生​的​事​也​有​个​大概​了解​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​想要​知道​，​你​认为​自己​经历​过​的​最​刺激​的​冒险​是​什么​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3hai2 ruo4you3suo3si1 de5 yong4 shou3zhi3 qing1 dian3 zhao2 xia4he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，ni3 gang1 lai2 zhe4li3。wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 ren4shi5 Mo4ni1ka3，wo3 dui4 ta1 qu4shi4 dang1wan3 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4 ye3 you3 ge4 da4gai4 liao3jie3。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 xiang3yao4 zhi1dao4，ni3 ren4wei2 zi4ji3 jing1li4 guo4 de5 zui4 ci4ji1 de5 mao4xian3 shi4 shen2me5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The girl with the chip in her head stands with her eyes closed, rocking back and forth. She looks so frail that a light breeze might knock her over, but she somehow stays on her feet. Whether by coincidence or some kind of preternatural junkie awarenes, she opens her eyes when you come near.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I know you..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​头上​插​着​芯片​的​女孩​闭眼​站​着​，​身体​前后​摇晃​，​仿佛​一阵​微风​就​能​将​她​吹倒​，​但​她​还是​奇迹般地​保持​着​站​姿​。​也​不知​是​出于​巧合​还是​某种​超自然​的​瘾君子​直觉​，​她​在​你​靠近​时​睁开​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​认得​你​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tou2shang4 cha1 zhao2 xin1pian4 de5 nu:3hai2 bi4 yan3 zhan4 zhao2，shen1ti3 qian2hou4 yao2huang4，fang3fu2 yi1zhen4 wei1feng1 jiu4 neng2 jiang1 ta1 chui1 dao3，dan4 ta1 hai2shi5 ji1 ji4 ban1 de5 bao3chi2 zhao2 zhan4 zi1。ye3 bu4zhi1 shi4 chu1yu2 qiao3he2 hai2shi5 mou3zhong3 chao1zi4ran2 de5 yin3jun1zi3 zhi2jue2，ta1 zai4 ni3 kao4jin4 shi2 zheng1kai1 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ren4de5 ni3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The girl's frail body shudders and her eyes grow large. But she does not sob. Instead, she smiles a sad smile, which looks to have been worn all too often.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She will go to heaven. She told me. It is a place for good people, stillborn babies, and childhood pets.\n"
"\n"
"And she was a good person."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​女孩​纤弱​的​身躯​微微​颤抖​，​双眸​骤然​睁​大​。​她​并未​啜泣​，​反而​露出​一抹​悲伤​的​微笑​，​仿佛​那​笑容​已​在​她​脸上​浮现​过​无数次​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​会​去​天堂​。​这​是​她​和​我​说​的​。​善良​好人​、​死胎​婴儿​和​童年​宠物​都​会​去​那里​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​而​她​就是​个​大好人​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3hai2 xian1ruo4 de5 shen1qu1 wei1wei1 chan4dou3，shuang1mou2 zhou4ran2 zheng1 dai4。ta1 bing4wei4 chuo4qi4，fan3er2 lu4chu1 yi1 ma1 bei1shang1 de5 wei1xiao4，fang3fu2 na4 xiao4rong2 yi3 zai4 ta1 lian3 shang4 fu2xian4 guo4 wu2 shu3 ci4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 hui4 qu4 tian1tang2。zhe4 shi4 ta1 he4 wo3 shuo1 de5。shan4liang2 hao3ren2、si3 tai1 ying1er2 he4 tong2nian2 chong3wu4 dou1 hui4 qu4 na4li5。\n"
"\n"
"er2 ta1 jiu4shi4 ge4 dai4 hao3 ren2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The green light activates inside the containment cell and the gaunt woman stares intently at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Will you do it, now $(l.race)? Will you end me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​收容​舱​的​绿灯​亮​起​，​消瘦​的​女人​直勾勾​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​会​这么​做​吗​，​$(l.race)​？​你​会​杀死​我​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou1rong2 cang1 de5 lu:4deng1 liang4 qi3，xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 zhi2gou1gou1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 ma5，$(l.race)？ni3 hui4 sha1si3 wo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The green light activates inside the containment cell and the gaunt woman stares intently at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Will you do it, now $(l.race)? Will you set me free?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​收容​舱​的​绿灯​亮​起​，​消瘦​的​女人​直勾勾​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​会​这么​做​吗​，​$(l.race)​？​你​会​释放​我​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou1rong2 cang1 de5 lu:4deng1 liang4 qi3，xiao1shou4 de5 nu:3ren2 zhi2gou1gou1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 hui4 zhe4me5 zuo4 ma5，$(l.race)？ni3 hui4 shi4fang4 wo3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The grief on his face instantly vanishes. What replaces it looks like curiosity.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh? Well, that changes everything.\n"
"\n"
"Perilous quests and civilian casualties go together like chocolate and peanut butter. I can't stay mad at you for that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​脸上​的​悲伤​瞬间​消失​，​取而代之​的​似乎​是​好奇​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哦​？​那​就​另当别论​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​危险​任务​和​民众​伤亡​就​像​巧克力​和​花生酱​一样​密不可分​。​我​不能​为此​怪罪​于​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 bei1shang1 shun4jian1 xiao1shi1，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 si4hu1 shi4 hao4qi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2？na4 jiu4 ling4dang1bie2lun4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"wei1xian3 ren4wu5 he4 min2zhong4 shang1wang2 jiu4 xiang4 qiao3ke4li4 he4 hua1sheng1jiang4 yi1yang4 mi4bu4ke3fen1。wo3 bu4neng2 wei4ci3 guai4zui4 yu2 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The grin widens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Thought I might.\n"
"\n"
"I can feel the power coursin' through me, boss. I don't know what form it'll take yet, but it's there, and soon enough I'll be able to use it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​看起来​更​高兴​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​就​对​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​老大​，​我​感到​力量​在​我​体内​奔涌​。​虽然​不​知道​它会​以​什么​形式​显现​，​但​它​确实​在​我​体内​，​我​很快​就​能​运用自如​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4qi3lai5 geng1 gao1xing4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 jiu4 dui4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"lao3da4，wo3 gan3dao4 li4liang5 zai4 wo3 ti3nei4 ben1 yong3。sui1ran2 bu4 zhi1dao4 ta1 hui4 yi3 shen2me5 xing2shi4 xian3xian4，dan4 ta1 que4shi2 zai4 wo3 ti3nei4，wo3 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 neng2 yun4yong4zi4ru2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The grizzled troll nods grimly. The servos in his prosthetics complain as he lets loose a heavy sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now that is a shame. She was a hell of a runner, that one."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​头发​灰白​的​巨魔面​无表情​地​点点头​。​他​重重​叹​了​口气​，​假肢​上​的​伺服​装置​也​发出​了​嘎吱​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​真是​可惜​。​她​是​个​相当​厉害​的​狂奔​者​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tou2fa5 hui1bai2 de5 ju4 mo2 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。ta1 chong2chong2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，jia3zhi1 shang4 de5 si4fu2 zhuang1zhi4 ye3 fa1chu1 le5 ga1zhi1 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhen1shi5 ke3xi1。ta1 shi4 ge4 xiang1dang1 li4hai5 de5 kuang2Ben1zhe3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard captain flicks the safety off her rifle. The look on her face is grim.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know whether this is stupidity or a death wish.\n"
"\n"
"Either way, you just made the worst mistake of your soon-to-be-over life. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫队​长​扳开​步枪​保险​。​她​神情​阴沉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​你​这​是​愚蠢​还是​故意​寻死​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​无论如何​，​你​刚刚​犯下​了​你​行将​终结​的​一生​中​最大​的​错误​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3 wei4 dui4 zhang3 ban1 kai1 bu4qiang1 bao3xian3。ta1 shen2qing2 yin1chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 zhe4 shi4 yu2chun3 hai2shi5 gu4yi4 xun2si3。\n"
"\n"
"wu2lun4ru2he2，ni3 gang1gang5 fan4 xia4 le5 ni3 xing2jiang1 zhong1jie2 de5 yi1sheng1 zhong4 zui4 dai4 de5 cuo4wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard closest to you nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks for the reminder. I can't afford another \"administrative penalty.\"\n"
"\n"
"C'mon, guys. Let's get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离​你​最近​的​警卫​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​感谢​提醒​。​我​可​不想​再​背​一个​“​行政处分​”​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​走​吧​各位​。​我们​赶紧​离开​这里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} li2 ni3 zui4jin4 de5 jing3wei4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3xie4 ti2xing3。wo3 ke3 bu4xiang3 zai4 bei1 yi1ge5“xing2 zheng4 chu3 fen4”。\n"
"\n"
"zou3 ba1 ge4wei4。wo3men5 gan3jin3 li2kai1 zhe4li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard jerks upright in alarm.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He said what?! Step out of my way, please."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​守卫​猛地​绷直​了​身子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​说​什么​？​！​请​赶紧​让开​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou3wei4 meng3de5 beng3 zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 shuo1 shen2me5？！qing3 gan3jin3 rang4kai1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard looks positively delighted.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Finally, some action! INTRUDER AT MY POSITION!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pulls back the slide on his rifle and opens fire.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​看起来​相当​高兴​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总算​有​动静​了​！​我​这里​有​入侵者​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他拉起​枪栓​，​开始​射击​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 kan4qi3lai5 xiang1dang1 gao1xing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3suan4 you3 dong4jing4 le5！wo3 zhe4li3 you3 ru4qin1zhe3！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 la1 qi3 qiang1shuan1，kai1shi3 she4ji1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}The guard shoulders his weapon.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​将​武器​抵肩​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 jiang1 wu3qi4 di3 jian1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hold there, I'm calling this in to clear it with Central. If they give the go-ahead, I'll take you wherever you need to be.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He reaches for the commlink stud at his collar.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This'll only take a minute."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​稍等一下​，​我​得​向​指挥部​报告​。​如果​他们​同意​的话​，​我​就​带​你​过去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把手​伸向​领口处​的​通讯​链​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​马上​就​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shao1 deng3 yi1 xia4，wo3 de2 xiang4 zhi3hui1bu4 bao4gao4。ru2guo3 ta1men5 tong2yi4 de5hua4，wo3 jiu4 dai4 ni3 guo4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3shou3 shen1 xiang4 ling3 kou3 chu3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ma3shang4 jiu4 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard steps forward, interposing himself between you and the terminal.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your security clearance doesn't authorize you to be in here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​守卫​上前​一步​，​拦​在​你​和​终端​之间​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​安全​权限​等级​不​允许​你​进入​此​区域​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou3wei4 shang4qian2 yi1 bu4，lan2 zai4 ni3 he4 zhong1duan1 zhi1jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 an1quan2 quan2xian4 deng3ji2 bu4 yun3xu3 ni3 jin4ru4 ci3 qu1yu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard straightens. His voice carries an edge of nervous tension.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well... um... very well! Sir!\n"
"\n"
"We will continue to man our posts with diligence, sir! As you'll see!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​挺直​了​身子​。​他​的​声音​带​着​一丝​紧张​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​……​呃​……​好​的​！​长官​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​会​继续​坚守岗位​，​长官​！​请​放心​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 ting3zhi2 le5 shen1zi5。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 yi1 si1 jin3zhang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1……e4……hao3 de5！zhang3guan1！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hui4 ji4xu4 jian1 shou3 gang3 wei4，zhang3guan1！qing3 fang4xin1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard wheels to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey, what do you think you're doing? I told you that those doors were off limits!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​转过身​来看​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​喂​，​你​干什么​呢​？​我​说​过​了​，​那​地方​闲人免进​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei2，ni3 gan4shen2me5 ni2？wo3 shuo1 guo4 le5，na4 di4fang1 xian2 ren2 mian3 jin4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard's eyes narrow. He half-raises his weapon.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Let me see your ID. Reach for it slowly."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​眯起​眼睛​，​将​武器​半举​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​给​我​出示​你​的​身份证件​。​动作​要慢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5，jiang1 wu3qi4 ban4 ju3 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gei3 wo3 chu1shi4 ni3 de5 shen1 fen4 zheng4 jian4。dong4zuo4 yao4 man4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard's shoulders relax.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I hear ya. I swear, it's amazing that anyone gets anything done at all around here.\n"
"\n"
"Tell you what. You don't need to go all the way back to management... just call in and get your clearance changed. I'll let you guys in as soon as the authorization comes through."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​守卫​的​肩膀​放松​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​我​懂​你​的​意思​。​说真的​，​在​这儿​居然​还有​人能​把​事​办成​，​简直​不可思议​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​吧​，​你​不必​特意​再​跑​回去​一趟​找​管理处​……​直接​打电话​申请​变更​权限​就行​。​授权​一​通过​，​我​就​立刻​放​你们​进去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou3wei4 de5 jian1bang3 fang4song1 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，wo3 dong3 ni3 de5 yi4si5。shuo1zhen1de5，zai4 zhe4r5 ju1ran2 hai2you3 ren2 neng2 ba3 shi4 ban4 cheng2，jian3zhi2 bu4ke3si1yi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 ba1，ni3 bu4bi4 te4yi4 zai4 pao2 hui2qu5 yi1 tang1 zhao3 guan3 li3 chu3……zhi2jie1 da3dian4hua4 shen1qing3 bian4geng1 quan2xian4 jiu4 xing2。shou4quan2 yi1 tong1guo4，wo3 jiu4 li4ke4 fang4 ni3men5 jin4qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guard's stance shifts slightly as you approach.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can I help you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​守卫​注意​到​你​接近​后​，​微微​换​了​个​姿势​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​有事吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou3wei4 zhu4yi4 dao4 ni3 jie1jin4 hou4，wei1wei1 huan4 le5 ge4 zi1shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you3 shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guards exchange glances again. After a moment, the old man steps aside.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well... all right. I suppose there’s no harm in that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​守卫​们​又​对视​了​一下​。​过​了​一会儿​，​老人​退​到​一旁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​唉​……​那行​吧​。​反正​也​没什么​坏处​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou3wei4 men5 you4 dui4shi4 le5 yi1xia4。guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，lao3ren2 tui4 dao4 yi1pang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ai1……na4 xing2 ba1。fan3zheng4 ye3 mei2shen2me5 huai4chu5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guards exchange glances again. Then, the man lowers his eyes, muttering something under his breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fine. Make it 200."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​守卫​们​又​对视​了​一下​。​随后​男人​垂​下​目光​，​低声​盘算着​什么​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​但是​得​200​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou3wei4 men5 you4 dui4shi4 le5 yi1xia4。sui2hou4 nan2ren2 chui2 xia4 mu4guang1，di1sheng1 pan2 suan4 zhao2 shen2me5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，dan4shi4 de2 200。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guards exchange glances.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Whoa, hold up. Inspection? What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​们​匆匆​对望一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​等​下​。​检查​？​你​在​说​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 men5 cong1cong1 dui4 wang4 yi1 yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"deng3 xia4。jian3cha2？ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The guards glance at one another one more time. In unison, they raise "
"their weapons.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​们​再次​对望一眼​。​这次​他们​一齐​举起​了​武器​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 men5 zai4ci4 dui4 wang4 yi1 yan3。zhe4 ci4 ta1men5 yi1qi2 ju3qi3 le5 wu3qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The haunted look in Glory's eyes is heartbreaking. She gives you "
"another curt, grim nod.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​格洛丽​眼中​那​抹​惊魂未定​的​神色​令人​心碎​。​她​再次​向​你​投来​简短​而​阴沉​的​点头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} Ge2luo4li2 yan3zhong1 na4 ma1 jing1 hun2 wei4 ding4 de5 shen2se4 ling4ren2 xin1sui4。ta1 zai4ci4 xiang4 ni3 tou2 lai2 jian3duan3 er2 yin1chen2 de5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The high-pitched voice warbles out over the intercom.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hello? Spirit? Are you back?\n"
"\n"
"I thought I told you to *leave me alone!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​对讲机​里​传来​尖锐​而​沙哑​的​声音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​喂​？​精魂​？​你​回来​了​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不是​告诉​过​你​*​别来​烦​我​*​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dui4jiang3ji1 li3 chuan2lai2 jian1rui4 er2 sha1ya3 de5 sheng1yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei2？jing1hun2？ni3 hui2lai5 le5？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4shi4 gao4su4 guo4 ni3*bie4 lai2 fan2 wo3*！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The homeowner looks shocked, but he recovers quickly. He takes a step toward James, his hands balled into fists.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, buddy. You've asked for it.\n"
"\n"
"I want to know your employee number, and I want to know it *now.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​房主​面露​惊愕​，​但​很快​镇定​下来​。​他朝​詹姆斯​迈出​一步​，​双手​紧握​成拳​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​伙计​。​你​这​是​自找​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我要​知道​你​的​工号​，​*​立刻​*​告诉​我​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fang2zhu3 mian4lu4 jing1e4，dan4 hen3 kuai4 zhen4ding4 xia4lai5。ta1 chao2 zhan1mu3si1 mai4chu1 yi1 bu4，shuang1shou3 jin3wo4 cheng2 quan2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，huo3ji5。ni3 zhe4 shi4 zi4zhao3 de5。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 yao4 zhi1dao4 ni3 de5 gong1hao4，*li4ke4*gao4su4 wo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The hope drains from his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Ah.\n"
"\n"
"Then what do you want?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​眼中​的​希望​消退​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​你​有​什么​事​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yan3zhong1 de5 xi1wang4 xiao1tui4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1。\n"
"\n"
"na4 ni3 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The image of Monika smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I offered proof. I never said that she would like it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​露出​一丝​讥笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​给出​了​证据​，​但​我​从没​说​她​会​喜欢​它​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 lu4chu1 yi1 si1 ji1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gei3 chu1 le5 zheng4ju4，dan4 wo3 cong2mei2 shuo1 ta1 hui4 xi3huan5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The image of Monika smirks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I offered proof. I never said that you would like it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​的​影像​露出​一丝​讥笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​给出​了​证据​，​但​我​从没​说​你​会​喜欢​它​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3de5ying3xiang4 lu4chu1 yi1 si1 ji1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gei3 chu1 le5 zheng4ju4，dan4 wo3 cong2mei2 shuo1 ni3 hui4 xi3huan5 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The image smirks at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I suppose that was a bit much, wasn't it? But you can't blame me for being excited."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​影像​对​你​露出​一丝​讥笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可能​我​刚才​说​的​有点​过头​了​吧​？​但​话说回来​，​你​也​不能​怪​我​如此​激动​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ying3xiang4 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1 si1 ji1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3neng2 wo3 gang1cai2 shuo1 de5 you3dian3 guo4tou2 le5 ba1？dan4 hua4shuo1hui2lai5，ni3 ye3 bu4neng2 guai4 wo3 ru2ci3 ji1dong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The image takes a moment to study you, frowning.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't understand, and I can see now that you never will. This is a lost cause... I should've known that from the start.\n"
"\n"
"So let's just cut to the chase, shall we?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​影像​皱着眉头​凝视​了​你​片刻​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​没有​明白​。​而​我​现在​也​看​出来​了​，​你​永远​不会​明白​。​这是​一场​徒劳​……​我​早该​知道​这​一点​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​我们​还是​直接​说​正题​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ying3xiang4 zhou4 zhao2 mei2 tou2 ning2shi4 le5 ni3 pian4ke4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 mei2you3 ming2bai5。er2 wo3 xian4zai4 ye3 kan4 chu1lai2 le5，ni3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 ming2bai5。zhe4 shi4 yi1 chang2 tu2lao2……wo3 zao3 gai1 zhi1dao4 zhe4 yi1dian3。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 wo3men5 hai2shi5 zhi2jie1 shuo1 zheng1 ti2 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The image's muscles begin to contort and stretch. Its mouth twists up into a rictus grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"See you soon."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​影像​的​肌肉​开始​扭曲​伸展​。​她​的​嘴角​向上​扭曲​成​一抹​狞笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​回头见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ying3xiang4 de5 ji1rou4 kai1shi3 niu3qu1 shen1zhan3。ta1 de5 zui3jiao3 xiang4shang4 niu3qu1 cheng2 yi1 ma1 ning2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui2tou2jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The initiate eyes you nervously. His gaze flits to Glory, then falls to her cyberlimbs. He swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"N-no.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a step back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please, don't hurt us."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​学徒​紧张​地​盯​着​你们​。​他​的​目光​掠过​格洛丽​，​随即​落​在​她​的​赛博​义肢​上​。​他​吞​了​口​唾沫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​-​不要​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​往​后退​了​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​求​你​了​，​别​伤害​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xue2tu2 jin3zhang1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3men5。ta1 de5 mu4guang1 lu:e4guo4 Ge2luo4li2，sui2ji2 la4 zai4 ta1 de5 sai4bo2 yi4zhi1 shang4。ta1 tun1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 -bu4yao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wang3 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiu2 ni3 le5，bie4 shang1hai4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The initiate eyes you nervously. His gaze flits to Glory, then falls to her cyberlimbs. He swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Uh... yeah. Yeah, o-okay.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He takes a step back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Y-you do that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​学徒​紧张​地​盯​着​你们​。​他​的​目光​掠过​格洛丽​，​随即​落​在​她​的​赛博​义肢​上​。​他​吞​了​口​唾沫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​……​好​-​好​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​往​后退​了​一步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​-​你们​去​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xue2tu2 jin3zhang1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3men5。ta1 de5 mu4guang1 lu:e4guo4 Ge2luo4li2，sui2ji2 la4 zai4 ta1 de5 sai4bo2 yi4zhi1 shang4。ta1 tun1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4……hao3 -hao3 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 wang3 hou4tui4 le5 yi1 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 -ni3men5 qu4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The initiate nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah. Yeah, that's cool, I guess."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​学徒​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那好​吧​，​没​问题​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xue2tu2 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hao3 ba1，mei2 wen4ti2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The intercom crackles to life again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Farewell, stalwart $(scene.badfantasy)!\n"
"\n"
"We will remember you always!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​广播系统​再次​发出​断断续续​的​声音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​，​坚毅​的​$(scene.badfantasy)​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​永远​记得​你​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yan3 bo1 xi4 tong3 zai4ci4 fa1chu1 duan4duan4xu4xu4 de5 sheng1yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4jian4，jian1yi4 de5 $(scene.badfantasy)！\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 yong3yuan3 ji4de5 ni3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The intercom system crackles to life. A monotonous, synthetic voice drones out of the speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Shutdown sequence ready. Please activate final command node."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​对​讲​系统​发出​沙沙声​，​随即​启动​。​单调​的​人工合成​音从​扬声器​里​传出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​关闭​序列​已​就绪​。​请​激活​最终​指令​节点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dui4 jiang3 xi4tong3 fa1chu1 sha1 sha1 sheng1，sui2ji2 qi3dong4。dan1diao4 de5 ren2 gong1 ge3 cheng2 yin1 cong2 yang2sheng1qi4 li3 chuan2chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"guan1bi4 xu4lie4 yi3 jiu4xu4。qing3 ji1huo2 zui4zhong1 zhi3ling4 jie2dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The intercom system crackles to life. The familiar synthetic voice of the facility's mainframe drones out of the speakers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*WARNING.* *WARNING.*\n"
"\n"
"Control subroutines compromised. Matrix uplink restored. System isloation compromised.\n"
"\n"
"Initiate emergency system purge immedi..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​对​讲​系统​噼啪​作响​。​扬声器​里​传来​设施​主机​那​熟悉​的​合成​音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​警告​。​警告​。​*​\n"
"​\n"
"​控制​子程序​遭​破坏​。​矩阵​上行​链路​已​恢复​。​系统​隔离​状态​失效​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​立即​启动​紧急​系统​清除​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dui4 jiang3 xi4tong3 pi1pa1 zuo4 xiang3。yang2sheng1qi4 li3 chuan2lai2 she4shi1 zhu3ji1 na4 shu2xi1 de5 he2cheng2 yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*jing3gao4。jing3gao4。*\n"
"\n"
"kong4zhi4 zi3cheng2xu4 zao1 po4huai4。ju3zhen4 shang4xing2 lian4lu4 yi3 hui1fu4。xi4tong3 ge2li2 zhuang4tai4 shi1xiao4。\n"
"\n"
"li4ji2 qi3dong4 jin3ji2 xi4tong3 qing1chu2……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor chuckles uncomfortably.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, some of us get paid better than others. Wanna trade your workstation for my bucket?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She offers you a lopsided smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Kidding, kidding. I couldn't do what you do, and I've seen how you software people live. You probably wouldn't know a mop if it smacked you in the face. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​不​自然​地​笑了笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​跟​我​谈​什么​工资​呢​。​要​不​拿​你​的​电脑​和​我​的​水桶​换换​如何​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​向​你​露出​一个​勉强​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​开玩笑​的​啦​。​我​可​干不了​你们​的​工作​，​再说​我​也​知道​你们​搞​开发​的​平时​生活​什么样​。​估计​你​被​拖把​砸​脸​都​认不出来​它​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 bu4 zi4ran2 de5 xiao4 le5 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gen1 wo3 tan2 shen2me5 gong1zi1 ni2。yao4 bu4 na2 ni3 de5 dian4nao3 he4 wo3 de5 shui3tong3 huan4 huan4 ru2he2？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 mian3qiang3 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kai1wan2xiao4 de5 la5。wo3 ke3 gan4 bu4 le5 ni3men5 de5 gong1zuo4，zai4shuo1 wo3 ye3 zhi1dao4 ni3men5 gao3 kai1fa1 de5 ping2shi2 sheng1huo2 shen2me5yang4。gu1ji4 ni3 bei4 tuo1ba3 za2 lian3 dou1 ren4 bu4 chu1 lai2 ta1 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor freezes in her tracks. Her eyes wide with panic, she raises her arms at her sides.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, just don't hurt me, okay? I have kids at home. You can go wherever you want.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She looks like a deer caught in the headlights of an oncoming truck. Through the glare of the room's halogen lighting, you can see that her eyes are brimming with tears.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​愣​在​原地​。​她​惊慌失措​地​张大​眼睛​，​双手​高举​在​身侧​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​别​伤害​我​，​好​吗​？​我​家里​还有​孩子​要养​。​你​想​去​哪里​都​随​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​看上去​就​像​一头​被​车灯​照到​而​受惊​的​鹿​。​透过​房间​里​刺眼​的​卤素灯​，​你​看到​她​的​眼睛​里​噙​满​了​泪水​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​求求​你​，​好​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 leng4 zai4 yuan2di4。ta1 jing1huang1shi1cuo4 de5 zhang1 dai4 yan3jing5，shuang1shou3 gao1ju3 zai4 shen1 ce4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bie4 shang1hai4 wo3，hao3 ma5？wo3 jia1li3 hai2you3 hai2zi5 yao4 yang3。ni3 xiang3 qu4 na3li3 dou1 sui2 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kan4shang5qu5 jiu4 xiang4 yi1tou2 bei4 che1deng1 zhao4 dao4 er2 shou4jing1 de5 lu4。tou4guo4 fang2jian1 li3 ci4yan3 de5 lu3su4deng1，ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 li3 qin2 man3 le5 lei4shui3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiu2 qiu2 ni3，hao3 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor lets out a weary sigh. Her body language is easy to read: she is officially tired of this conversation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, of course not."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​无奈​地叹​了​口气​。​她​的​肢体​语言​很​明显​：​她​已经​不想​再说下去​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​，​还是​算了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 wu2nai4 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 hen3 ming2xian3：ta1 yi3jing1 bu4xiang3 zai4 shuo1 xia4 qu4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4，hai2shi5 suan4le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor lets out an exasperated sigh and folds her arms across her chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay, but just this once. You forget something else, and you're on your own."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​无奈​地叹​了​口气​，​双手​交叉​抱​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​但​就​这​一次​。​如果​你​再​忘​了​别的​东西​，​我​可不​帮​你​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 wu2nai4 de5 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，shuang1shou3 jiao1cha1 bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，dan4 jiu4 zhe4 yi1ci4。ru2guo3 ni3 zai4 wang4 le5 bie2de5 dong1xi1，wo3 ke3bu5 bang1 ni3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor offers you a weak laugh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I know exactly what you mean. I've lost count of the number of nights I've gone home feeling sub-human. It sucks.\n"
"\n"
"I can't blame you for wanting to get some fresh air, especially considering the kind of hours you folks have been putting in."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​向​你​有气无力​地​笑笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​我​懂​你​意思​。​不​知道​有​多少​个​夜晚​，​我​回家​的​时候​感觉​自己​都​没​个人​样​了​。​这种​感觉​很糟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​理解​你​想​出去​透透气​，​特别​是​在​你们​的​这种​高强度​工作​之下​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 xiang4 ni3 you3qi4wu2li4 de5 xiao4 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 dong3 ni3 yi4si5。bu4 zhi1dao4 you3 duo1shao3 ge4 ye4wan3，wo3 hui2jia1 de5 shi2hou5 gan3jue2 zi4ji3 dou1 mei2 ge4ren2 yang4 le5。zhe4zhong3 gan3jue2 hen3 zao1。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 li3jie3 ni3 xiang3 chu1qu4 tou4 tou4 qi4，te4bie2 shi4 zai4 ni3men5 de5 zhe4zhong3 gao1 jiang4 du4 gong1zuo4 zhi1xia4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor shakes her head, her tired eyes narrowing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nice try, but no. I have two kids at home.\n"
"\n"
"I'm not risking my job so that you can be lazy. It only takes a few seconds, anyway... if you'd just do it instead of arguing about it, you could be inside already."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​摇摇头​，​眯起​疲倦​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​理由​不错​，​但​还是​不行​。​我​家里​还有​两个​孩子​要​养呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不能​因为​你​想​偷懒​就​赌​上​我​的​工作​。​再说​也​就​几秒钟​的​事​……​如果​你​不是​这​说​个​没完​的话​，​你​现在​已经​进去​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 yao2 yao2 tou2，mi2 qi3 pi2juan4 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"li3you2 bu4cuo4，dan4 hai2shi5 bu4xing2。wo3 jia1li3 hai2you3 liang3 ge4 hai2zi5 yao4 yang3 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4neng2 yin1wei4 ni3 xiang3 tou1lan3 jiu4 du3 shang4 wo3 de5 gong1zuo4。zai4shuo1 ye3 jiu4 ji1 miao3 zhong1 de5 shi4……ru2guo3 ni3 bu4shi4 zhe4 shuo1 ge4 mei2 wan2 de5hua4，ni3 xian4zai4 yi3jing1 jin4qu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor stops for a second to consider.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My mom was the same way. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She offers you a weak smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry about the attitude. I haven't gotten much sleep lately, either. Between the hours here and a toddler at home, I'm pretty much a wreck."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​思考​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​妈妈​以前​也​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​向​你​露出​一个​苍白​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​用​这种​态度​对​你​。​我​最近​也​没​怎么​睡觉​。​家里​公司​都​是​乱七八糟​的​事​，​我​也​扛不住​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 si1kao3 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ma1ma5 yi3qian2 ye3 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 cang1bai2 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 yong4 zhe4zhong3 tai4du5 dui4 ni3。wo3 zui4jin4 ye3 mei2 zen3me5 shui4jiao4。jia1li3 gong1si1 dou1 shi4 luan4qi1ba1zao1 de5 shi4，wo3 ye3 gang1 bu4 zhu4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor stops for a second to consider.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, okay, that's fair.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She offers you a weak smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry about the attitude. I haven't gotten much sleep lately, either. Between the hours here and a toddler at home, I'm pretty much a wreck."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​思考​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​也​说得过去​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​向​你​露出​一个​苍白​的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​用​这种​态度​对​你​。​我​最近​也​没​怎么​睡觉​。​家里​公司​都​是​乱七八糟​的​事​，​我​也​扛不住​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 si1kao3 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，ye3 shuo1de5guo4qu4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 cang1bai2 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 yong4 zhe4zhong3 tai4du5 dui4 ni3。wo3 zui4jin4 ye3 mei2 zen3me5 shui4jiao4。jia1li3 gong1si1 dou1 shi4 luan4qi1ba1zao1 de5 shi4，wo3 ye3 gang1 bu4 zhu4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor's eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, you know that I can’t do that! After last week’s security meeting? They’d have my job!\n"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​张大​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​，​你​知道​我​不能​这么​做​！​上周​不是​开​了​安保​会议​吗​？​他们​会​把​我​开除​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 zhang1 dai4 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1，ni3 zhi1dao4 wo3 bu4neng2 zhe4me5 zuo4！shang4zhou1 bu4shi4 kai1 le5 an1bao3 hui4yi4 ma5？ta1men5 hui4 ba3 wo3 kai1chu2 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor's face flushes pink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Okay, you know what? I've about had it with you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​的​脸涨​得​通红​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这么​说​是​吧​？​我​受够了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 de5 lian3 zhang3 de2 tong1hong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4me5 shuo1 shi4 ba1？wo3 shou4 gou4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The janitor’s eyes go wide as she realizes what's happening, and her mouth falls open in a silent scream. \n"
"\n"
"She turns in a panic and smacks the panel recessed into the wall behind her. A moment later, the shrill wail of a security alarm fills the air.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​清洁工​意识​到​发生​了​什么​，​张大​眼睛​，​嘴里​发出​无声​的​尖叫​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​惊慌失措​地​转过身​，​猛击​身后​墙壁​上​的​面板​。​片刻​之后​，​空气​中​回荡​着​安全​警报​的​锐鸣​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} qing1jie2gong1 yi4shi2 dao4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5，zhang1 dai4 yan3jing5，zui3li3 fa1chu1 wu2sheng1 de5 jian1jiao4。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 jing1huang1shi1cuo4 de5 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，meng3ji1 shen1hou4 qiang2bi4 shang4 de5 mian4ban3。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，kong1qi4 zhong4 hui2dang4 zhao2 an1quan2 jing3bao4 de5 rui4 ming2。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}The kid blinks, a blank expression on his face.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​孩子​眨​眨眼​，​脸上​露出​空洞​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} hai2zi5 zha3 zha3yan3，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 kong1dong4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The kid blinks, a blank expression on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She's dead, isn't she?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​孩子​眨​眨眼​，​脸上​露出​空洞​的​神情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​死​了​，​对​不​对​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} hai2zi5 zha3 zha3yan3，lian3 shang4 lu4chu1 kong1dong4 de5 shen2qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 si3 le5，dui4 bu4 dui4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The kid swallows hard. Under the shadow of his hood, you can see that the color has drained from his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, I... I think I wanna be alone right now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​孩子​艰难​地咽​了​口​唾沫​。​在​兜帽​的​阴影​下​，​你​看得出​他​脸色​惨白​如纸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​现在​想​自己​待​一会儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} hai2zi5 jian1nan2 de5 yan1 le5 kou3 tuo4mo5。zai4 dou1mao4 de5 yin1ying3 xia4，ni3 kan4de5chu1 ta1 lian3se4 can3bai2 ru2 zhi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 xian4zai4 xiang3 zi4ji3 dai1 yi1hui4r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The kneeling man looks up at you, a wild look in his eyes. He's bleeding in a dozen places from long, shallow wounds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please, *help* me!\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The words hiss from between clenched teeth.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​跪​在​地上​的​人​抬头​看向​你​，​眼中​闪烁着​狂乱​的​神色​。​他​身上​有​十余​处长​而​浅​的​伤口​，​正​不断​渗出​鲜血​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​求求​你​，​*​救救​我​*​吧​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​咬紧牙关​，​嘶声​吐出​这​几个​字​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gui4 zai4 di4shang5 de5 ren2 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3，yan3zhong1 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 kuang2luan4 de5 shen2se4。ta1 shen1shang5 you3 shi2 yu2 chu4zhang3 er2 jian1 de5 shang1kou3，zheng1 bu4duan4 shen4chu1 xian1xue4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qiu2 qiu2 ni3，*jiu4 jiu4 wo3*ba1！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao3jin3ya2guan1，si1 sheng1 tu3 chu1 zhe4 ji3ge5 zi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The lab tech hangs his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"In that case, there is nothing left for me but suffering. The same suffering that Titonius Rex faced when he sent Brenna-thay back to Trala-sheen.\n"
"\n"
"It hurts."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​研究员​垂下​了​头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那样的话​，​我​就​只​剩下​受苦​了​。​就​像​泰托​尼乌斯​·​雷克斯​在​把​布伦娜​·​赛伊​送回​特拉​希恩时​所​承受​的​痛苦​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​很​痛​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yan2jiu1yuan2 chui2xia4 le5 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 yang4 de5 hua4，wo3 jiu4 zhi3 sheng4xia4 shou4ku3 le5。jiu4 xiang4 Tai4tuo1ni2wu1si1 · lei2ke4si1 zai4 ba3 bu4 lun2 na4 · sai4 yi1 song4 hui2 te4 la1 xi1 en1 shi2 suo3 cheng2shou4 de5 tong4ku3。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hen3 tong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The lab tech's voice rings down from the speakers. Underneath it, you can hear the distinctive sound of fingers hammering on a keyboard.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"PEASANTS! Arise and DEFEND YOUR HOME! You need only believe in yourselves! THE POWER IS YOURS!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​研究员​的​声音​从​扬声器​中​传来​，​伴随​着​键盘​敲击​的​清脆​声响​：​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​臣民​们​！​挺身而出​捍卫​你们​的​家园​！​你们​只​需要​相信​自己​！​力量​属于​你们​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yan2jiu1yuan2 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 yang2sheng1qi4 zhong4 chuan2lai2，ban4sui2 zhao2 jian4pan2 qiao1ji1 de5 qing1cui4 sheng1xiang3：{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 chen2min2 men5！ting3shen1er2chu1 han4wei4 ni3men5 de5 jia1yuan2！ni3men5 zhi3 xu1yao4 xiang1xin4 zi4ji3！li4liang5 shu3yu2 ni3men5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The larger-than-life image of Monika Schäfer smiles down on you, her cheeks dimpling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hello, $(l.name)."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​莫妮卡​·​舍费尔​的​巨大​影像​俯视​着​你​，​脸上​带​着​微笑​，​露出​两颊​的​酒窝​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​$(l.name)​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Mo4ni1ka3 · she3 fei4 er3 de5 ju4da4 ying3xiang4 fu3shi4 zhao2 ni3，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 wei1xiao4，lu4chu1 liang3 jia2 de5 jiu3wo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，$(l.name)。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The lead blood mage jerks back as though he has been stung.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You, there! What the hell are you doing with that terminal?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​领头​的​血​法师​猛地​起身​，​仿佛​被​叮​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​说​你​呢​！​你​在​摆弄​那台​终端​做​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ling3tou2 de5 xie3 fa3shi1 meng3de5 qi3shen1，fang3fu2 bei4 ding1 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shuo1 ni3 ni2！ni3 zai4 bai3nong4 na4 tai2 zhong1duan1 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The lead clone stares into the crater, trembling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We... no. We will live."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​领头​的​克隆人​浑身​颤抖​着​看​向​大坑​深处​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​……​不​。​我们​会​活下去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ling3tou2 de5 ke4long2ren2 hun2shen1 chan4dou3 zhao2 kan4 xiang4 da4keng1 shen1chu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5……bu4。wo3men5 hui4 huo2xia4qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The lead clone stares into the crater, trembling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We... we will try."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​领头​的​克隆人​浑身​颤抖​着​看​向​大坑​深处​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​……​我们​会​试试​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ling3tou2 de5 ke4long2ren2 hun2shen1 chan4dou3 zhao2 kan4 xiang4 da4keng1 shen1chu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5……wo3men5 hui4 shi4 shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The lights in the utility tunnel begin to flicker, then wink out. Emergency lights flick on, washing the world in red. Danni looks horrified.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What did you do? What... what the hell did you just *do*?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​综合​管廊​里​的​灯光​开始​闪烁​，​最终​熄灭​。​应急​灯亮了​起来​，​映得​四周​一片​通红​。​丹妮​看上去​吓坏​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​做​了​什么​？​你​……​你​刚刚​究竟​*​做​*​了​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zong1he2 guan3 lang2 li3 de5 deng1guang1 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4，zui4zhong1 xi1mie4。ying4ji2 deng1 liang4 le5 qi3lai5，ying4 de2 si4zhou1 yi1 pian1 tong1hong2。dan1 ni1 kan4shang5qu5 xia4huai4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zuo4 le5 shen2me5？ni3……ni3 gang1gang5 jiu1jing4*zuo4*le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The lights in the utility tunnel begin to flicker, then wink out. Emergency lights flick on, washing the world in red. Danni looks horrified.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You... you *monster!* Now the Azzies are going to kill us all!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​综合​管廊​里​的​灯光​开始​闪烁​，​最终​熄灭​。​应急​灯亮了​起来​，​映得​四周​一片​通红​。​丹妮​看上去​吓坏​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​……​你​这​*​禽兽​*​！​现在​阿兹佬会​把​我们​全杀​了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zong1he2 guan3 lang2 li3 de5 deng1guang1 kai1shi3 shan3shuo4，zui4zhong1 xi1mie4。ying4ji2 deng1 liang4 le5 qi3lai5，ying4 de2 si4zhou1 yi1 pian1 tong1hong2。dan1 ni1 kan4shang5qu5 xia4huai4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 zhe4*qin2shou4*！xian4zai4 e1 zi1 lao3 hui4 ba3 wo3men5 quan2 sha1 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The machine lights up as you approach, making a soft humming sound. A line of text appears on the unit's LCD screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"BuMoNa Emergency Field Trauma Unit online. OS 1.213 initializing. Please stand by..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​当​你​走近​时​，​机器​亮​起​，​发出​轻柔​的​嗡嗡声​。​设备​的​LCD​屏上​出现​一行​文字​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​移动​医联​紧急​现场​创伤​单元​已​上线​。​操作系统​1​.​213​正在​初始化​。​请​稍候​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，ji1qi4 liang4 qi3，fa1chu1 qing1rou2 de5 weng1weng1sheng1。she4bei4 de5 LCD bing3 shang4 chu1xian4 yi1xing2 wen2zi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi2dong4 yi1 lian2 jin3ji2 xian4chang3 chuang1shang1 dan1yuan2 yi3 shang4xian4。cao1zuo4xi4tong3 1. 213 zheng4zai4 chu1shi3hua4。qing3 shao1hou4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The madman nods vigorously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yessss!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​疯子​用力​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} feng1zi5 yong4li4 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The madman's voice becomes shrill with panic.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's not safe. Can't reach Communion. Can't hear Communion!\n"
"\n"
"*It's not safe!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​疯子​的​声音​因​恐慌​而​变得​尖利​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这里​不​安全​。​无法​接触​共融​。​无法​聆听​共融​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​这里​不​安全​*​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} feng1zi5 de5 sheng1yin1 yin1 kong3huang1 er2 bian4de5 jian1li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4li3 bu4 an1quan2。wu2fa3 jie1chu4 gong4 rong2。wu2fa3 ling2ting1 gong4 rong2！\n"
"\n"
"*zhe4li3 bu4 an1quan2*！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage cuts her off.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The Lodge doesn't tell you things that you don't need to know, and you don't ask. Your job is to do what they tell you, take the money, and keep your mouth shut about it afterward.\n"
"\n"
"It's all very simple."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​打断​了​她​的话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​结社​”​不会​跟​你​说​你​不​需要​知道​的​事情​，​你​也​不要​去​问​。​你​的​任务​就是​把​吩咐​给​你​的​事情​做好​，​拿到​钱​，​之后​牢牢​保守​秘密​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常简单​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 da3duan4 le5 ta1 de5hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“jie2she4” bu4hui4 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 de5 shi4qing5，ni3 ye3 bu4yao4 qu4 wen4。ni3 de5 ren4wu5 jiu4shi4 ba3 fen1fu5 gei3 ni3 de5 shi4qing5 zuo4 hao3，na2dao4 qian2，zhi1hou4 lao2lao2 bao3shou3 mi4mi4。\n"
"\n"
"fei1 chang2 jian3 dan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage leers at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Wonderful pep talk. Really, really magnificent. I can see why you were placed in charge of this run.\n"
"\n"
"Now can we please get moving? I don't have all day."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​猥琐​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可真会​加油打气​啊​。​实在​太棒了​。​难怪​这次​行动​是​由​你​负责​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​现在​能​出发​了​吗​？​我​可​没​时间​在​这里​耗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 wei3suo3 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3 zhen1 hui4 jia1 you2 da3 qi4 a1。shi2zai4 tai4 bang4 le5。nan2guai4 zhe4 ci4 xing2dong4 shi4 you2 ni3 fu4ze2。\n"
"\n"
"xian4zai4 neng2 chu1fa1 le5 ma5？wo3 ke3 mei2 shi2jian1 zai4 zhe4li3 hao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage raises an eyebrow, smiling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do you, now?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​扬起​一条​眉毛​，​笑了笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 yang2qi3 yi1 tiao2 mei2mao5，xiao4 le5 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage sneers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You haven't been doing this long, have you?\n"
"\n"
"The Lodge doesn't tell you things that you don't need to know, and you don't ask. Your job is to do what they tell you, take the money, and keep your mouth shut about it afterward.\n"
"\n"
"It's all very simple."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​撇嘴​一笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​干​这行​还​没多久​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​结社​”​不会​跟​你​说​你​不​需要​知道​的​事情​，​你​也​不要​去​问​。​你​的​任务​就是​把​吩咐​给​你​的​事情​做好​，​拿到​钱​，​之后​牢牢​保守​秘密​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常简单​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 pie3zui3 yi1 xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gan4 zhe4 xing2 hai2 mei2duo1jiu3 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"“jie2she4” bu4hui4 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ni3 bu4 xu1yao4 zhi1dao4 de5 shi4qing5，ni3 ye3 bu4yao4 qu4 wen4。ni3 de5 ren4wu5 jiu4shi4 ba3 fen1fu5 gei3 ni3 de5 shi4qing5 zuo4 hao3，na2dao4 qian2，zhi1hou4 lao2lao2 bao3shou3 mi4mi4。\n"
"\n"
"fei1 chang2 jian3 dan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage wipes spatters of blood from his cheek with the back of his hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He attacked me. Our elf.\n"
"\n"
"The fucker tried to *kill* me!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​用​手背​擦掉​飞溅​到​脸颊​上​的​鲜血​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​居然​敢​攻击​我​。​这是​我们​自己​队里​的​精灵​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​那个​混蛋​想要​*​杀​了​*​我​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 yong4 shou3bei4 ca1diao4 fei1jian4 dao4 lian3jia2 shang4 de5 xian1xue4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 ju1ran2 gan3 gong1ji1 wo3。zhe4 shi4 wo3men5 zi4ji3 dui4 li3 de5 jing1ling2。\n"
"\n"
"na4ge5 hun2dan4 xiang3yao4*sha1 le5*wo3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage's eyes widen incredulously.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't even know who you're working for, do you?\n"
"\n"
"You're leading this team, and you don't have a clue--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​瞪​大​双眼​，​满脸​不可​置信​之色​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​甚至​都​不​知道​自己​在​为​谁​工作​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可是​这支​队伍​的​领队​，​而​你​一点​数都​没有​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 deng4 dai4 shuang1yan3，man3lian3 bu4ke3 zhi4xin4 zhi1 se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shen4zhi4 dou1 bu4 zhi1dao4 zi4ji3 zai4 wei2 shei2 gong1zuo4 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3shi4 zhe4 zhi1 dui4wu3 de5 ling3dui4，er2 ni3 yi1dian3 shu3 dou1 mei2you3 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage's hands ignite with arcane energy. His mouth curls into an ugly smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is the end of the line for you, boys. Bad luck."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​的​双手​燃起​奥术​能量​，​嘴角​勾起​一抹​狰狞​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​各位​，​你们​的​命数​就​到​这里​了​。​怪​你们​自己​不​走运​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 de5 shuang1shou3 ran2qi3 ao4 shu4 neng2liang4，zui3jiao3 gou1qi3 yi1 ma1 zheng1ning2 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ge4wei4，ni3men5 de5 ming4 shu3 jiu4 dao4 zhe4li3 le5。guai4 ni3men5 zi4ji3 bu4 zou3yun4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage's lip curls into a sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"A fact that I am painfully aware of.\n"
"\n"
"If I weren't under instructions to follow your lead, this would be a very different conversation."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​的​嘴角​露出​一抹​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​当然​知道​这个​让​我​极其​不爽​的​事实​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要不是​我​现在​得​听​你​指挥​，​目前​的​情况​可​就​不是​这么回事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 de5 zui3jiao3 lu4chu1 yi1 ma1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dang1ran2 zhi1dao4 zhe4ge5 rang4 wo3 ji2qi2 bu4shuang3 de5 shi4shi2。\n"
"\n"
"yao4bu5shi4 wo3 xian4zai4 de2 ting1 ni3 zhi3hui1，mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4 ke3 jiu4 bu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage's lip curls into a sneer.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I heard you.\n"
"\n"
"If I weren't under instructions to follow your lead, this would be a very different conversation."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​的​嘴角​露出​一抹​冷笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​，​我​听到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​要不是​我​现在​得​听​你​指挥​，​目前​的​情况​可​就​不是​这么回事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 de5 zui3jiao3 lu4chu1 yi1 ma1 leng3xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4，wo3 ting1dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"yao4bu5shi4 wo3 xian4zai4 de2 ting1 ni3 zhi3hui1，mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4 ke3 jiu4 bu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage's response comes out with a snarl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Bastard tried to bring security down on us. He isn't leaving this roo--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​咆哮​着​作出​回应​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​混蛋​想​招来​安保​人员​对付​我们​。​他别​想​离开​这​房间​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 pao2xiao4 zhao2 zuo4chu1 hui2ying4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hun2dan4 xiang3 zhao1lai2 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 dui4fu5 wo3men5。ta1 bie4 xiang3 li2kai1 zhe4 fang2jian1 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage's response comes out with a snarl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"He tried to bring security down on us. He isn't leaving this roo--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​咆哮​着​作出​回应​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​想​招来​安保​人员​对付​我们​。​他别​想​离开​这​房间​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 pao2xiao4 zhao2 zuo4chu1 hui2ying4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 xiang3 zhao1lai2 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 dui4fu5 wo3men5。ta1 bie4 xiang3 li2kai1 zhe4 fang2jian1 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mage's response comes out with a snarl.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The bastard's called security on us. He isn't leaving this roo--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​法师​咆哮​着​作出​回应​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​混蛋​想​招来​安保​人员​对付​我们​。​他别​想​离开​这​房间​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} fa3shi1 pao2xiao4 zhao2 zuo4chu1 hui2ying4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 hun2dan4 xiang3 zhao1lai2 an1bao3 ren2yuan2 dui4fu5 wo3men5。ta1 bie4 xiang3 li2kai1 zhe4 fang2jian1 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The man behind the counter has the broad smile and open demeanor of a classic Turkish street vendor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Welcome, Honored Efendim! Welcome! And how can Burakgazi serve you, today? You would like a cup of coffee, perhaps?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​柜台​后​的​男人​带​着​典型​的​土耳其​街头​小贩​的​灿烂​笑容​和​开朗​气质​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎​，​尊敬​的​贵人​！​欢迎​！​今天​你​需要​布拉加​齐​做点​什么​？​要​不要​来杯​咖啡​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gui4tai2 hou4 de5 nan2ren2 dai4 zhao2 dian3xing2 de5 tu3er3qi2 jie1tou2 xiao3fan4 de5 can4lan4 xiao4rong2 he4 kai1lang3 qi4zhi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2，zun1jing4 de5 gui4ren2！huan1ying2！jin1tian1 ni3 xu1yao4 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5？yao4 bu4yao4 lai2 bei1 ka1fei1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The man behind the counter looks right past you and at the dog following close behind.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Dante! I will fetch his water dish. And perhaps a coffee for our friend here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​柜台​后​的​男人​对​你​熟视无睹​，​而​将​目光​望​向​紧紧​跟​在​你​身后​的​狗​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​但丁​！​我​去​拿​他​的​水盘​。​也许​我们​的​朋友​也​想来​杯​咖啡​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} gui4tai2 hou4 de5 nan2ren2 dui4 ni3 shu2shi4wu2du3，er2 jiang1 mu4guang1 wang4 xiang4 jin3jin3 gen1 zai4 ni3 shen1hou4 de5 gou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dan4ding1！wo3 qu4 na2 ta1 de5 shui3 pan2。ye3xu3 wo3men5 de5 peng2you5 ye3 xiang3lai2 bei1 ka1fei1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The man inclines his head slightly in introduction.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hans Brackhaus. I represent an “interested party.” Someone who wishes to know about your… encounter with Dr. Vauclair."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​男人​微微​颌首​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​下​汉斯​·​布拉克​豪斯​，​代表​某位​“​当事人​”​。​对方​想​了解​……​你​与​沃​克莱尔​博士​的​会面​过程​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nan2ren2 wei1wei1 he2 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 xia4 han4si1 · bu4 la1 ke4 hao2 si1，dai4biao3 mou3 wei4“dang1shi4ren2”。dui4fang1 xiang3 liao3jie3……ni3 yu4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 de5 hui4mian4 guo4cheng2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The man looks up from his book, smiling.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hello again, friend. Need something?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​男人​从书间​抬起头来​，​露出​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​又​见面​了​，​朋友​。​有​什么​需要​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nan2ren2 cong2 shu1 jian1 tai2 qi3 tou2 lai2，lu4chu1 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"you4 jian4mian4 le5，peng2you5。you3 shen2me5 xu1yao4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The man narrows his eyes at you for a long moment. \n"
"\n"
"Finally, he reaches out wordlessly to take the credstick from your hand, then steps aside.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​男人​眯起​眼睛​盯​了​你好​一会儿​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最终​，​他​沉默不语​地​从​你​手上​拿走​信用​棒​，​然后​退​到​一旁​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nan2ren2 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5 ding1 le5 ni3hao3 yi1hui4r5。\n"
"\n"
"zui4zhong1，ta1 chen2 mo4 bu4 yu3 de5 cong2 ni3 shou3 shang4 na2zou3 xin4yong4 bang4，ran2hou4 tui4 dao4 yi1pang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The man removes his hands from his knees, folds them in his lap.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I tell you all of this so that you have context - perspective - before I ask you this next question, shadowrunner: \n"
"\n"
"If Doctor Vauclair’s weapon had not required dragonfire - if it had been capable of destroying every dragon on earth without touching a hair on metahumanity’s head - would you have used it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​男人​将​双手​从​膝盖​上移​开​，​平​放在​大腿​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​暗影​狂奔​者​，​我​跟​你​说​这么​多​，​是​为了​给​你​补充​背景​和​视角​，​以便​你​回答​接下来​的​问题​：​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​沃​克莱尔​博士​的​武器​不​需要​龙焰​—​—​如果​它​能​灭绝​世上​所有​巨龙​，​并且​不伤泛​人类​分毫​—​—​你​会​使用​它​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nan2ren2 jiang1 shuang1shou3 cong2 xi1gai4 shang4 yi2 kai1，ping2 fang4 zai4 da4tui3 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3，wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 zhe4me5 duo1，shi4 wei4le5 gei3 ni3 bu3chong1 bei4jing3 he4 shi4jiao3，yi3bian4 ni3 hui2da2 jie1xia4lai2 de5 wen4ti2：\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4 de5 wu3qi4 bu4 xu1yao4 long2 yan4——ru2guo3 ta1 neng2 mie4jue2 shi4shang4 suo3you3 ju4long2，bing4qie3 bu4 shang1 fan4 ren2lei4 fen1hao2——ni3 hui4 shi3yong4 ta1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The man sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, he'll need another one in a year. And every year after that, from now until college.\n"
"\n"
"But I suppose that's the price of success."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​男人​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​等到​明年​他​就​得​换​新​的​了​，​之后​的​每​一年​也​是​如此​，​直到​他​上​大学​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我​想​这​就是​为了​成功​而​付出​的​代价​吧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nan2ren2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，deng3dao4 ming2nian2 ta1 jiu4 de2 huan4 xin1 de5 le5，zhi1hou4 de5 mei3 yi1 nian2 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3，zhi2dao4 ta1 shang4 da4xue2。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3 xiang3 zhe4 jiu4shi4 wei4le5 cheng2gong1 er2 fu4chu1 de5 dai4jia4 ba1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The manic cheer that you've come to expect floods back into the lab tech. He spreads his arms wide, a knowing smile on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And as you can plainly see, we chose the latter! We persevered, and eventually transformed this husk of a building into the glorious kingdom that you find yourself standing in today.\n"
"\n"
"It was all for the best, in the end! I tamed this land, and I have grown to love it. I will never live anywhere else!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​熟悉​的​那种​疯狂​的​欢愉​涌回​了​实验员​身上​。​他​张开​双臂​，​脸上​带​着​自信​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​正如​你​所见​，​我们​选择​了​后者​！​我们​坚持​了​下来​，​并​最终​将​这栋​废弃​的​建筑​改造​成​了​如今​你​站立​其中​的​辉煌​王国​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​结果​一切​都​变得​美好​！​我​驯服​了​这片​土地​，​并​爱​上​了​它​。​我​永远​不会​离开​这里​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 shu2xi1 de5 na4zhong3 feng1kuang2 de5 huan1yu2 yong3 hui2 le5 shi2 yan4 yuan2 shen1shang5。ta1 zhang1kai1 shuang1bi4，lian3 shang4 dai4 zhao2 zi4xin4 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 ni3 suo3jian4，wo3men5 xuan3ze2 le5 hou4zhe3！wo3men5 jian1chi2 le5 xia4lai5，bing4 zui4zhong1 jiang1 zhe4 dong4 fei4qi4 de5 jian4zhu4 gai3zao4 cheng2 le5 ru2jin1 ni3 zhan4li4 qi2zhong1 de5 hui1huang2 wang2guo2。\n"
"\n"
"jie1guo3 yi1qie4 dou1 bian4de5 mei3hao3！wo3 xun4fu2 le5 zhe4 pian1 tu3di4，bing4 ai4 shang4 le5 ta1。wo3 yong3yuan3 bu4hui4 li2kai1 zhe4li3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The mirth has disappeared from the rigger's face. In its place are incredulity and anger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The fuck is she talkin' about? I *told* you..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​谑​笑​从​机师​的​脸上​消失​了​。​取而代之​的​是​怀疑​与​愤怒​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​扯​什么​犊子​呢​？​我​和​你​*​说​过​了​*​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xue4 xiao4 cong2 ji1shi1 de5 lian3 shang4 xiao1shi1 le5。qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 huai2yi2 yu4 fen4nu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 che3 shen2me5 du2zi5 ni2？wo3 he4 ni3*shuo1 guo4 le5*……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The muscles at the corners of his mouth tighten.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Why am I even talking to you? You're trapped in there, and I've still got work to do. Audran will be here for you soon enough."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​嘴边​的​肌肉​绷紧​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​为什么​要​跟​你​说话​？​你​被困​在​这里​，​而​我​还有​工作​要​做​。​奥​德兰​很快​就​会​来​收拾​你们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zui3 bian1 de5 ji1rou4 beng1jin3 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 gen1 ni3 shuo1hua4？ni3 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3，er2 wo3 hai2you3 gong1zuo4 yao4 zuo4。Ao4de2lan2 hen3 kuai4 jiu4 hui4 lai2 shou1shi5 ni3men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The nasal woman’s voice can be heard again in a singsong tone.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Guten Tag. How may I help you?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Silence.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​鼻音​浓重​的​女声​再次​响起​，​带​着​拖长​音​的​腔调​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​。​有​什么​可以​帮​你​的​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​一片​寂静​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bi2yin1 nong2zhong4 de5 nu:3 sheng1 zai4ci4 xiang3qi3，dai4 zhao2 tuo1chang2 yin1 de5 qiang1diao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3。you3 shen2me5 ke3yi3 bang1 ni3 de5 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1 pian1 ji4jing4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old drone pivots on its axis to face you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"NEGATIVE. YOU WILL NOT ASSIST VAUCLAIR. YOU WILL ELIMINATE HIM WITH MY ASSISTANCE."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​旧​无人机​围绕​其​轴心​转向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拒绝​。​你​不能​协助​沃​克莱尔​。​你​将​在​我​的​协助​下​消灭​他​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jiu4 wu2ren2ji1 wei2rao4 qi2 zhou2xin1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ju4jue2。ni3 bu4neng2 xie2zhu4 Wo4ke4lai2er3。ni3 jiang1 zai4 wo3 de5 xie2zhu4 xia4 xiao1mie4 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man chuckles softly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you want to get your pal off of Mr. Grinder's hit list, I'd suggest that you reevaluate that position."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​笑了起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​让​你​的​朋友​脱离​“​绞肉机​”​先生​的​暗杀​名单​，​那​我​建议​你​重新考虑​一下​立场​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 rang4 ni3 de5 peng2you5 tuo1li2“jiao3rou4ji1” xian1sheng5 de5 an4sha1 ming2dan1，na4 wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 chong2 xin1 kao3 lu:4 yi1xia4 li4chang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man continues to stare at his feet. The blood has drained from his cheeks, leaving them sickly pale.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If Hermie were here, he would not support this. He would point out the risks, the unknowns, the sacrifices... much as he always had, before he--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​继续​盯​着​自己​的​脚下​。​他​的​脸颊​已​失去​血色​，​显得​病态​苍白​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​赫米​还​在​的话​，​他​不会​支持​这么​做​的​。​他会​指出​其中​的​风险​、​未知​性​与​牺牲​……​就​像​他​以前​一直​的​那样​，​直到​他​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 ji4xu4 ding1 zhao2 zi4ji3 de5 jiao3xia4。ta1 de5 lian3jia2 yi3 shi1qu4 xue4se4，xian3de5 bing4tai4 cang1bai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 he4 mi3 hai2 zai4 de5hua4，ta1 bu4hui4 zhi1chi2 zhe4me5 zuo4 de5。ta1 hui4 zhi3chu1 qi2zhong1 de5 feng1xian3、wei4zhi1 xing4 yu4 xi1sheng1……jiu4 xiang4 ta1 yi3qian2 yi1zhi2 de5 na4yang4，zhi2dao4 ta1 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man glares at you through the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I go now to do a hard thing - perhaps even an evil thing. But a thing that is *necessary,* for the good of us all.\n"
"\n"
"And as for you, shadowrunner... I suggest that you sit back and wait for the inevitable.\n"
"\n"
"It won't be long now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​隔​着​玻璃​怒视​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​现在​要​去​做​一件​艰难​的​事​—​—​也许​甚至​是​一件​邪恶​的​事​。​但​这​都​是​*​必要​*​的​。​这是​为了​所有人​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​至于​你​，​暗影​狂奔​者​……​我​建议​你​老实​看着​这​一切​的​发生​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不会​太久​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 ge2 zhao2 bo1li5 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xian4zai4 yao4 qu4 zuo4 yi1 jian4 jian1nan2 de5 shi4——ye3xu3 shen4zhi4 shi4 yi1 jian4 xie2e4 de5 shi4。dan4 zhe4 dou1 shi4*bi4yao4*de5。zhe4 shi4 wei4le5 suo3you3ren2 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"zhi4yu2 ni3，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3……wo3 jian4yi4 ni3 lao3shi5 kan4 zhao2 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 fa1sheng1。\n"
"\n"
"bu4hui4 tai4 jiu3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man glares at your callous tone, but when he sees the expression on his woman's face, he can't maintain his anger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I thought... I thought she'd make it. Long term, I mean. She was always so careful."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​听到​你​冷漠​的​语气​，​老人​不禁​对​你​怒目而视​，​但​当​他​看到​妻子​脸上​的​表情​时​，​怒火​便​消散​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​以为​……​我​以为​她​不会​有事​的​。​我​是​说​长期​来看​。​她​一向​都​那么​谨慎​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ting1dao4 ni3 leng3mo4 de5 yu3qi4，lao3ren2 bu4jin1 dui4 ni3 nu4mu4er2shi4，dan4 dang1 ta1 kan4dao4 qi1zi3 lian3 shang4 de5 biao3qing2 shi2，nu4huo3 bian4 xiao1san4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi3wei2……wo3 yi3wei2 ta1 bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。wo3 shi4 shuo1 chang2qi1 lai2 kan4。ta1 yi1xiang4 dou1 na4me5 jin3shen4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man is trembling now.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I do the same, for the good of the world."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​说​着​不禁​颤抖​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​为了​这个​世界​，​我​也​愿意​做​同样​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 shuo1 zhao2 bu4jin1 chan4dou3 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wei4le5 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4，wo3 ye3 yuan4yi4 zuo4 tong2yang4 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man nods absently.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No choice. A creature separated from its astral form cannot live more than a few hours before both die."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​漫不经心​地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​别无他法​。​被​剥离​了​灵体​的​生物​要不了​几个​小时​就​会​死去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 man4bu4jing1xin1 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bie2wu2ta1fa3。bei4 bo1li2 le5 ling2ti3 de5 sheng1wu4 yao4 bu4 le5 ji3ge5 xiao3shi2 jiu4 hui4 si3qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll tell ya what. A few months ago, I had a... well, call it a \"difference of opinion\" with that Burakgazi fellow from the soykaf shop. \n"
"\n"
"He hasn't let me in to his establishment since, and I'd sell my mother for a decent cup of coffee."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​停顿​片刻​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​说个事​吧​，​几个​月​以前​，​我​跟​豆​咖店​的​布拉加​齐有​了​一些​……​呃​，​姑且​称之为​“​意见分歧​”​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自​那​之后​，​他​就​不让​我​进店​了​。​要是​能​喝​上​一杯​好​咖啡​，​让​我​做​什么​都行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ge4 shi4 ba1，ji3ge5 yue4 yi3qian2，wo3 gen1 dou4 ka1 dian4 de5 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 you3 le5 yi1xie1……e4，gu1qie3 cheng1zhi1wei2“yi4 jian4 fen4 qi2” ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zi4 na4 zhi1hou4，ta1 jiu4 bu4 rang4 wo3 jin4 dian4 le5。yao4shi5 neng2 he4 shang4 yi1 bei1 hao3 ka1fei1，rang4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5 dou1 xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll tell ya what. A few months ago, I had a... well, call it a \"difference of opinion\" with that Burakgazi fellow from the soykaf shop. \n"
"\n"
"He hasn't let me in to his establishment since, and I'd sell the family cow for a decent cup of coffee."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​停顿​片刻​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​说个事​吧​，​几个​月​以前​，​我​跟​豆​咖店​的​布拉加​齐有​了​一些​……​呃​，​姑且​称之为​“​意见分歧​”​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自​那​之后​，​他​就​不让​我​进店​了​。​要是​能​喝​上​一杯​好​咖啡​，​让​我​做​什么​都行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ge4 shi4 ba1，ji3ge5 yue4 yi3qian2，wo3 gen1 dou4 ka1 dian4 de5 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 you3 le5 yi1xie1……e4，gu1qie3 cheng1zhi1wei2“yi4 jian4 fen4 qi2” ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zi4 na4 zhi1hou4，ta1 jiu4 bu4 rang4 wo3 jin4 dian4 le5。yao4shi5 neng2 he4 shang4 yi1 bei1 hao3 ka1fei1，rang4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5 dou1 xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man pauses for a moment, considering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'll tell ya what. A few months ago, I had a... well, call it a \"difference of opinion\" with that Burakgazi fellow from the soykaf shop. \n"
"\n"
"He hasn't let me in to his establishment since, and I'd sell the family farm for a decent cup of coffee."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​停顿​片刻​思索​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​跟​你​说个事​吧​，​几个​月​以前​，​我​跟​豆​咖店​的​布拉加​齐有​了​一些​……​呃​，​姑且​称之为​“​意见分歧​”​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​自​那​之后​，​他​就​不让​我​进店​了​。​要是​能​喝​上​一杯​好​咖啡​，​让​我​做​什么​都行​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 ting2dun4 pian4ke4 si1suo3 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 ge4 shi4 ba1，ji3ge5 yue4 yi3qian2，wo3 gen1 dou4 ka1 dian4 de5 bu4 la1 jia1 qi2 you3 le5 yi1xie1……e4，gu1qie3 cheng1zhi1wei2“yi4 jian4 fen4 qi2” ba1。\n"
"\n"
"zi4 na4 zhi1hou4，ta1 jiu4 bu4 rang4 wo3 jin4 dian4 le5。yao4shi5 neng2 he4 shang4 yi1 bei1 hao3 ka1fei1，rang4 wo3 zuo4 shen2me5 dou1 xing2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man shoots you a withering look, then turns his head to cough into his sleeve.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"As I thought. Another waste of time. Why am I talking to you at all? \n"
"\n"
"There's still work to be done."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​用​一种​鄙夷​的​目光​看着​你​，​然后​转过​头去​，​用手​捂着​嘴​咳嗽​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​正如​我​所料​。​真是​浪费时间​。​我​为什么​要​和​你​说话​呢​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​还有​工作​等​着​我​去​做​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 yong4 yi1zhong3 bi3yi2 de5 mu4guang1 kan4 zhao2 ni3，ran2hou4 zhuai3 guo4 tou2 qu4，yong4 shou3 wu3 zhao2 zui3 ke2sou5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zheng4ru2 wo3 suo3liao4。zhen1shi5 lang4 fei4 shi2 jian1。wo3 wei4shen2me5 yao4 he4 ni3 shuo1hua4 ni2？\n"
"\n"
"hai2you3 gong1zuo4 deng3 zhao2 wo3 qu4 zuo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man's watery eyes flare with anger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's all that you have to say for yourself? A flippant acknowledgement of your guilt? And a shrug?!\n"
"\n"
"Hermie was my BROTHER, damn you! My *only* brother!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​的​泪眼​中​迸发​着​怒火​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要说​的​只有​这些​吗​？​一点​不痛不痒​的​罪恶感​？​以及​耸耸肩​？​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​是​我​的​弟弟​，​你​这​混蛋​！​我​*​唯一​*​的​弟弟​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 de5 lei4yan3 zhong4 beng4fa1 zhao2 nu4huo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4shuo1 de5 zhi3you3 zhe4xie1 ma5？yi1dian3 bu4tong4bu4yang3 de5 zui4e4gan3？yi3ji2 song3 song3 jian1？！\n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3 shi4 wo3 de5 di4di5，ni3 zhe4 hun2dan4！wo3*wei2yi1*de5 di4di5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man's watery eyes flare with anger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Wrong? WRONG?! You set that monster loose on an unsuspecting world!\n"
"\n"
"Hermie was my BROTHER, and you've allied yourself with the thing that MURDERED him!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​的​泪眼​中​迸发​着​怒火​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​竟敢​说​是​我​的​错​？​！​是​你​把​那个​怪物​放​了​出来​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​是​我​的​弟弟​，​而​你​竟然​和​谋害​他​的​凶手​结为​盟友​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 de5 lei4yan3 zhong4 beng4fa1 zhao2 nu4huo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 jing4gan3 shuo1 shi4 wo3 de5 cuo4？！shi4 ni3 ba3 na4ge5 guai4wu5 fang4 le5 chu1lai2！\n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3 shi4 wo3 de5 di4di5，er2 ni3 jing4ran2 he4 mou2hai4 ta1 de5 xiong1shou3 jie1 wei2 meng2you3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old man's watery eyes flare with anger.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You *dare* lay the blame for this at *my* feet?! You, who set that monster loose on the world?\n"
"\n"
"Hermie was my BROTHER, damn you! My *only* brother!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​的​泪眼​中​迸发​着​怒火​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​*​竟敢​*​把​这件​事怪​在​*​我​的​*​头上​？​！​是​你​把​那个​怪物​放​了​出来​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​是​我​的​弟弟​，​你​这​混蛋​！​我​*​唯一​*​的​弟弟​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 de5 lei4yan3 zhong4 beng4fa1 zhao2 nu4huo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3*jing4gan3*ba3 zhe4 jian4 shi4 guai4 zai4*wo3 de5*tou2shang4？！shi4 ni3 ba3 na4ge5 guai4wu5 fang4 le5 chu1lai2！\n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3 shi4 wo3 de5 di4di5，ni3 zhe4 hun2dan4！wo3*wei2yi1*de5 di4di5！"

msgid "{{GM}}The old soldier continues to take in the carnage.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老兵​继续​看​向​屠杀​后​的​现场​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} lao3bing1 ji4xu4 kan4 xiang4 tu2sha1 hou4 de5 xian4chang3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old soldier glowers, but given his physical handicaps and his recent injuries, he hardly makes for an intimidating figure, troll size notwithstanding.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hang my hoop. I'm not a child, $(l.man)! I'm not helpless. And even if I was, leave me to whatever fate I've earned."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老兵​对​你​怒目而视​，​但​考虑​到​他​的​身体​残疾​和​最近​的​伤势​，​他​实在​算不上​是​个​令人​畏惧​的​人物​，​即便​他​体型​如​巨魔般​庞大​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不用​跟​我​绕圈子​。​我​可不是​小孩子​，​$(l.man)​！​我​并非​无能为力​，​而且​即便如此​，​我​也​甘愿​听任​命运​的​安排​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3bing1 dui4 ni3 nu4mu4er2shi4，dan4 kao3lu:4 dao4 ta1 de5 shen1ti3 can2ji2 he4 zui4jin4 de5 shang1shi4，ta1 shi2zai4 suan4 bu4 shang4 shi4 ge4 ling4ren2 wei4ju4 de5 ren2wu4，ji2bian4 ta1 ti3xing2 ru2 ju4 mo2 ban1 pang2da4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4yong4 gen1 wo3 rao4quan1zi5。wo3 ke3bu5shi4 xiao3hai2zi5，$(l.man)！wo3 bing4fei1 wu2neng2wei2li4，er2qie3 ji2 bian4 ru2 ci3，wo3 ye3 gan1yuan4 ting1ren4 ming4yun4 de5 an1pai2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old troll claps you on the shoulder and then steps back.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So what's next for you then? Moving on?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老巨魔​拍拍​你​的​肩膀​，​然后​又​退​了​回去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​你​接下来​有​什么​打算​？​要​继续前进​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 ju4 mo2 pai1 pai1 ni3 de5 jian1bang3，ran2hou4 you4 tui4 le5 hui2qu5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3 ni3 jie1xia4lai2 you3 shen2me5 da3suan4？yao4 ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ma5？"

msgid "{{GM}}The old troll just grumbles.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老巨魔​只是​嘟囔​着​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 ju4 mo2 zhi3shi4 du1nang5 zhao2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old troll leans heavy on his crutch and takes a steadying breath.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I was a colonel in the Finnish Army. During the first Euro War, the Jaeger Brigade was mine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老巨魔​倚​在​拐杖​上​，​深吸​了​一口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​曾​是​芬兰​陆军​的​一名​上校​。​在​第一次​欧陆​大战​期间​，​猎兵​旅由​我​指挥​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 ju4 mo2 yi3 zai4 guai3zhang4 shang4，shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ceng2 shi4 fen1lan2 lu4jun1 de5 yi1 ming2 shang4xiao4。zai4 di4yi1ci4 ou1 liu4 da4zhan4 qi1jian1，lie4 bing1 lu:3 you2 wo3 zhi3hui1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old troll putters about, his artificial joints complaining loudly. He seems heavier today than when you first met, and he takes your approach as reason to seat himself and rest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I understand they put you in charge of Monika's outfit."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老巨魔​蹒跚而行​，​他​的​人造​关节​在​大声​抱怨​。​他​今天​似乎​比​你们​初次见面​时​更​沉重​了​，​并​把​你​的​到来​当作​坐下​休息​的​理由​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​明白​他们​为什么​让​你​接替​莫妮卡​的​位子​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 ju4 mo2 pan2 shan1 er2 xing2，ta1 de5 ren2zao4 guan1jie2 zai4 da4sheng1 bao4yuan4。ta1 jin1tian1 si4hu1 bi3 ni3men5 chu1 ci4 jian4 mian4 shi2 geng1 chen2zhong4 le5，bing4 ba3 ni3 de5 dao4lai2 dang4zuo4 zuo4xia5 xiu1xi5 de5 li3you2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ming2bai5 ta1men5 wei4shen2me5 rang4 ni3 jie1ti4 Mo4ni1ka3 de5 wei4zi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old troll rubs a thumb pensively across his single unbroken horn.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You might have something there. If you can keep that group together."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老​巨魔用​拇指​在​他​那​只​没有​断裂​的​独角​上​摩挲​着​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​也许​你​能​做到​。​如果​你​能​把​那群人​聚在一起​的话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 ju4 mo2 yong4 mu3zhi3 zai4 ta1 na4 zhi3 mei2you3 duan4lie4 de5 du2 jiao3 shang4 ma1sa5 zhao2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ye3xu3 ni3 neng2 zuo4dao4。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 ba3 na4 qun2 ren2 ju4zai4yi1qi3 de5hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old troll snorts, but can't stiffle a grin at your bravado.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You do that. Even bluff and bluster can dissuade a weak-willed opponent."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老巨魔​冷​哼​一声​，​但​却​忍不住​对​你​的​豪言壮语​笑了起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可以​啊​。​即使​是​虚张声势​，​也​能​劝退​意志薄弱​的​对手​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 ju4 mo2 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1，dan4 que4 ren3bu5zhu4 dui4 ni3 de5 hao2yan2zhuang4yu3 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3yi3 a1。ji2shi3 shi4 xu1zhang1sheng1shi4，ye3 neng2 quan4tui4 yi4 zhi4 bao2 ruo4 de5 dui4shou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old troll squints at you as if looking through a jeweler's loupe.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not sure yet."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老巨魔​眯起​眼睛​，​仿佛​在​透过​珠宝​放大镜​观察​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​对此​我​还​不​确定​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3 ju4 mo2 mi2 qi3 yan3jing5，fang3fu2 zai4 tou4guo4 zhu1bao3 fang4da4jing4 guan1cha2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dui4 ci3 wo3 hai2 bu4 que4ding4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old woman shakes her head in denial and opens her mouth to argue. But when the man puts his hands on her shoulders, she crumbles in resignation.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I understand. Thank you for telling us."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老妇人​摇头​想要​否认​，​张口​欲​辩​。​但​当​老先生​双手​搭上​她​的​肩膀​时​，​她​便​颓然​屈服​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​明白​了​。​谢谢​你​告诉​我们​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3fu4ren2 yao2tou2 xiang3yao4 fou3ren4，zhang1kou3 yu4 bian4。dan4 dang1 lao3 xian1 sheng1 shuang1shou3 da1 shang4 ta1 de5 jian1bang3 shi2，ta1 bian4 tui2ran2 qu1fu2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 ming2bai5 le5。xie4xie5 ni3 gao4su4 wo3men5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The old woman's thin shoulders slump, making her seem even smaller than she already is.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"She can't be gone. She... she's the heart of this place."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老妇人​瘦削​的​肩膀​耷拉​着​，​让​她​看起来​比​原本​还要​矮小​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​不能​就​这么​撒手​离开​。​她​……​她​可是​这​地方​的​主心骨​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3fu4ren2 shou4xue1 de5 jian1bang3 da1la5 zhao2，rang4 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 bi3 yuan2ben3 hai2 yao4 ai3xiao3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1 bu4neng2 jiu4 zhe4me5 sa1shou3 li2kai1。ta1……ta1 ke3shi4 zhe4 di4fang1 de5 zhu3xin1gu3 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The older man fixes you with a hard stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't think that's a good idea, stranger. Now, I think it's time you let us be."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​冷​硬地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​不行​，​陌生人​。​请​你​不要​再​打扰​我们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 leng3 ying4 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 bu4xing2，mo4sheng1ren2。qing3 ni3 bu4yao4 zai4 da3rao3 wo3men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The older man fixes you with a hard stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Not going to happen, stranger. Now I think it's time you let us be."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​冷​硬地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不行​，​陌生人​。​请​你​不要​再​打扰​我们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 leng3 ying4 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4xing2，mo4sheng1ren2。qing3 ni3 bu4yao4 zai4 da3rao3 wo3men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The older man smiles sadly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, maybe a few years ago that was true. These days... well, it's hard times all around, I suppose.\n"
"\n"
"But you're welcome to go on in, of course! Customers are always welcome."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​露出​伤感​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​啊​，​也许​几年​前​确实​是​这样​，​但​现在​……​哪里​的​日子​都​不好过​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​我们​当然​欢迎​你​的​光临​！​有​顾客​总是​件​好事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 lu4chu1 shang1gan3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1，ye3xu3 ji3nian2 qian2 que4shi2 shi4 zhe4yang4，dan4 xian4zai4……na3li3 de5 ri4zi5 dou1 bu4 hao3 guo4 a1。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wo3men5 dang1ran2 huan1ying2 ni3 de5 guang1lin2！you3 gu4ke4 zong3shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The older man snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Indeed. So what brings you to Gesundbrunnen, stranger?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​的确​。​所以​你​来​健康​泉​有何贵干​啊​，​陌生人​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"di2que4。suo3yi3 ni3 lai2 jian4kang1 quan2 you3he2gui4gan4 a1，mo4sheng1ren2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The older man tries to keep his face neutral, but you can tell you've gotten his attention.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, so you think you can just buy us off? Is that it?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老人​试图​保持​面不改色​，​但​你​能​看出​自己​吸引​了​他​的​注意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​？​你​想​用​这个​就​收买​我们​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 shi4tu2 bao3chi2 mian4bu4gai3se4，dan4 ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 zi4ji3 xi1yin3 le5 ta1 de5 zhu4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1？ni3 xiang3 yong4 zhe4ge5 jiu4 shou1mai3 wo3men5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork bristles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Like a janitor? Yes I do, because that's what you are. \n"
"\n"
"If you want to keep wearing that uniform, you'd better watch the attitude."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​也​生气​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当成​清洁工​？​没错​，​因为​你​本来​就是​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​想​继续​穿着​这​身​衣服​，​那​你​最好​注意​下​你​的​态度​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 ye3 sheng1qi4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang4cheng2 qing1jie2gong1？mei2cuo4，yin1wei4 ni3 ben3lai2 jiu4shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 xiang3 ji4xu4 chuan1zhuo2 zhe4 shen1 yi1fu5，na4 ni3 zui4hao3 zhu4yi4 xia4 ni3 de5 tai4du5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork gives you an appraising look.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My kill list is already full up for the day. Long as you stay cool, we can settle this peacefully."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​上下​打量​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​今天​我要​杀​的​人​已经​够​多​了​。​只要​你​保持​冷静​，​我们​可以​和平解决​这件​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin1tian1 wo3 yao4 sha1 de5 ren2 yi3jing1 gou4 duo1 le5。zhi3yao4 ni3 bao3chi2 leng3jing4，wo3men5 ke3yi3 he4 ping2 jie3 jue2 zhe4 jian4 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork glowers at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I find that hard to believe."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​怒视​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​难​相信​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 nu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 nan2 xiang1xin4 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork inspects you. His body language is decidedly unfriendly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't look like a Magnifiker. You're not one of us, and I'm guessing you ain't here for the Hub, either. So tell me... who are you, and what's your interest in this building?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​打量​着​你​。​他​的​肢体​语言​充满​敌意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​看起来​不​像是​伟术​帮​的​人​，​而​你​也​不是​我们​这边​的​人​。​我​猜​你​也​不是​来​找​中枢​的​。​说​说​吧​……​你​是​谁​？​来​这栋​楼有​什么​事​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3。ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 chong1man3 di2yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 kan4qi3lai5 bu4 xiang4 shi4 wei3 shu4 bang1 de5 ren2，er2 ni3 ye3 bu4shi4 wo3men5 zhe4bian1 de5 ren2。wo3 cai1 ni3 ye3 bu4shi4 lai2 zhao3 zhong1shu1 de5。shuo1 shuo1 ba1……ni3 shi4 shei2？lai2 zhe4 dong4 lou2 you3 shen2me5 shi4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork looks you up and down, and you can see the uncertainty gnawing at him. When he speaks again, the swagger has disappeared from his voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Take it easy, friend. I'm not gonna draw on you. You just... you just caught me at a bad time."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​上下​打量​着​你​，​你​能​看出​他​内心​逐渐​生出​的​犹豫​。​当​他​再次​开口​时​，​那​份​嚣张气焰​已​从​声音​里​消失​无踪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷静​点​，​朋友​。​我​没​打算​跟​你​动手​。​只是​……​你​来​的​时候​不太​凑巧​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 shang4xia4 da3liang5 zhao2 ni3，ni3 neng2 kan4chu1 ta1 nei4xin1 zhu2jian4 sheng1chu1 de5 you2yu4。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，na4 fen4 xiao1zhang1qi4yan4 yi3 cong2 sheng1yin1 li3 xiao1shi1 wu2zong1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，peng2you5。wo3 mei2 da3suan4 gen1 ni3 dong4shou3。zhi3shi4……ni3 lai2 de5 shi2hou5 bu4 tai4 cou4qiao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork pauses.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're gonna have to repeat that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​停顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​再​重复​一遍​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 chong2fu4 yi1bian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork sneers at you from behind the glass, his scarred features writhing in the dancing light of Vauclair's monitor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Looks like you trapped the thugs who were attacking the manor."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​从​玻璃​后方​狞笑​着​看着​你​，​他​那​布满​疤痕​的​脸庞​在​沃​克莱尔​屏幕​的​闪烁​光线​下​扭曲​变形​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看来​你​困住​了​入侵​庄园​的​那些​家伙​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 cong2 bo1li5 hou4fang1 ning2xiao4 zhao2 kan4 zhao2 ni3，ta1 na4 bu4man3 ba1hen2 de5 lian3pang2 zai4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 ping2mu4 de5 shan3shuo4 guang1xian4 xia4 niu3qu1 bian4xing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4lai5 ni3 kun4 zhu4 le5 ru4qin1 zhuang1yuan2 de5 na4xie1 jia1huo5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork sneers at you from behind the glass, his scarred features writhing in the dancing light of Vauclair's monitor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I saw that. Good job catching the bastard, Doc. \n"
"\n"
"I'll take care of him for you, same way I did his old fixer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​从​玻璃​后方​狞笑​着​看着​你​，​他​那​布满​疤痕​的​脸庞​在​沃​克莱尔​屏幕​的​闪烁​光线​下​扭曲​变形​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看到​了​。​还好​你​抓住​了​这个​混蛋​，​博士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​替​你​解决​他​，​就​像​我​之前​解决​那个​中间人​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 cong2 bo1li5 hou4fang1 ning2xiao4 zhao2 kan4 zhao2 ni3，ta1 na4 bu4man3 ba1hen2 de5 lian3pang2 zai4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 ping2mu4 de5 shan3shuo4 guang1xian4 xia4 niu3qu1 bian4xing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4dao4 le5。hai2hao3 ni3 zhua1zhu4 le5 zhe4ge5 hun2dan4，bo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 ti4 ni3 jie3jue2 ta1，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 zhi1qian2 jie3jue2 na4ge5 zhong1jian1ren2 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork sneers at you from behind the glass, his scarred features writhing in the dancing light of Vauclair's monitor.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I saw that. Good job catching the bitch, Doc. \n"
"\n"
"I'll take care of her for you, same way I did her old fixer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​从​玻璃​后方​狞笑​着​看着​你​，​他​那​布满​疤痕​的​脸庞​在​沃​克莱尔​屏幕​的​闪烁​光线​下​扭曲​变形​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​看到​了​。​还好​你​抓住​了​这个​贱人​，​博士​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​替​你​解决​她​，​就​像​我​之前​解决​那个​中间人​一样​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 cong2 bo1li5 hou4fang1 ning2xiao4 zhao2 kan4 zhao2 ni3，ta1 na4 bu4man3 ba1hen2 de5 lian3pang2 zai4 Wo4ke4lai2er3 ping2mu4 de5 shan3shuo4 guang1xian4 xia4 niu3qu1 bian4xing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 kan4dao4 le5。hai2hao3 ni3 zhua1zhu4 le5 zhe4ge5 jian4ren2，bo2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 ti4 ni3 jie3jue2 ta1，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 zhi1qian2 jie3jue2 na4ge5 zhong1jian1ren2 yi1yang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork suddenly pauses, inclining his head to one side and covering his ear with a finger. His Vindicator starts to spin down.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, sir. Acknowledged.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He grunts, briefly tapping the finger against his ear.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​突然​停下​脚步​，​歪着头​用​一根​手指​按住​耳朵​。​他​的​“​辩护人​”​机枪​慢慢​停止​转动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​，​长官​。​收到​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​冷​哼​一声​，​用​那根​手指​在​耳朵​上​来回​敲​着​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 tu1ran2 ting2xia4 jiao3bu4，wai1 zhao2 tou2 yong4 yi1 gen1 shou3zhi3 an4 zhu4 er3duo5。ta1 de5“bian4hu4ren2” ji1qiang1 man4man4 ting2zhi3 zhuan3dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4，zhang3guan1。shou1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1，yong4 na4 gen1 shou3zhi3 zai4 er3duo5 shang4 lai2hui2 qiao1 zhao2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork with the nightmare face nods.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Send me a comm when the job is done.\n"
"\n"
"Audran out."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​面目可憎​的​兽​人​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​事成之后​再​联系​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​奥​德兰​通话​完毕​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mian4mu4ke3zeng1 de5 shou4 ren2 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 cheng2 zhi1 hou4 zai4 lian2xi4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"Ao4de2lan2 tong1hua4 wan2bi4。"

msgid "{{GM}}The ork's brow furrows, but he says nothing.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​皱​了​皱眉​，​但​什么​也​没​说​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 zhou4 le5 zhou4mei2，dan4 shen2me5 ye3 mei2 shuo1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ork's eyes shift from Eiger to you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Y-yes. I know you, t-troll. B-but your friend I do not know.\n"
"\n"
"D-does $(l.he) have the s-stomach for this? N-not many do."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​兽​人​的​眼神​从​艾格尔​转到​你​身上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​-​是​的​，​我​知道​你​，​巨​-​巨魔​。​但​你​的​朋​-​朋友​我​不​认识​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.he)​有​-​有​这个​胆子​吗​？​一般​人​做​-​做​不到​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shou4 ren2 de5 yan3shen2 cong2 Ai4ge2er3 zhuai3 dao4 ni3 shen1shang5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 -shi4 de5，wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3，ju4 -ju4mo2。dan4 ni3 de5 peng2 -peng2you5 wo3 bu4 ren4shi5。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.he) you3 -you3 zhe4ge5 dan3zi5 ma5？yi1ban1 ren2 zuo4 -zuo4 bu4dao4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The panel buzzes, then a nasal voice pours through the speaker.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Password?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​面板​嗡嗡作响​，​随后​扬声器​里​传出​一个​鼻音​浓重​的​声音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​口令​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mian4ban3 weng1 weng1 zuo4 xiang3，sui2hou4 yang2sheng1qi4 li3 chuan2chu1 yi1ge5 bi2yin1 nong2zhong4 de5 sheng1yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kou3ling4？"

msgid "{{GM}}The panel is lit. The \"Open Door\" button glows dimly.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​面板​亮​了​起来​。​“​开门​”​按钮​闪着​昏暗​的​光​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} mian4ban3 liang4 le5 qi3lai5。“kai1men2” an4niu3 shan3 zhao2 hun1an4 de5 guang1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The pixie grin softens into a concerned frown.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I understand your reaction. I really do.\n"
"\n"
"This must be difficult for you to understand."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那​精灵​般的​笑容​渐渐​褪去​，​化作​忧虑​的​愁容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​理解​你​的​反应​。​真的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​对​你​来说​一定​很难​理解​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 jing1ling2 ban1 de5 xiao4rong2 jian4jian4 tui4qu4，hua4zuo4 you1lu:4 de5 chou2 rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 li3jie3 ni3 de5 fan3ying4。zhen1de5。\n"
"\n"
"zhe4 dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 yi1ding4 hen3 nan2 li3jie3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The program obediently moves aside.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"PROCEED, AND HAVE A PLEASANT DAY!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​程序​顺从​地退​到​一旁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请​通过​。​祝​你​今日​愉快​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} cheng2xu4 shun4cong2 de5 tui4 dao4 yi1pang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3 tong1guo4。zhu4 ni3 jin1ri4 yu2kuai4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The projection chuckles. The sound is thin and hollow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You know better than that. But nothing makes me happier than the sound of you lying to yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Good-bye, Glory."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​投影​发出​单薄​而​空洞​的​笑声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​心里​清楚​得​很​。​但​没有​什么​比​听见​你​自欺欺人​的​声音​更​让​我​开心​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​再见​，​格洛丽​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tou2ying3 fa1chu1 dan1bo2 er2 kong1dong4 de5 xiao4sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
