"​>​>​>​请​联系​466​辅助​通风管道​以​获取​主要​炮塔​控制​通知​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​>​>​请​前往​东侧​楼梯间​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dian4ti1 kong4 zhi4 mian4 ban3 shang4 de5 bing3 mu4 xian3 shi4 zhao2 sui2ji1 shan3shuo4 de5 zi4fu2 he4 cuo4 wu4 xin4 xi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
">>># cuo4wu4 4ac43bc6 \n"
">>>zhu3yao4 an1bao3 xi4tong3 wei2 yan2chi2 shu1san3 shi2yan4shi4 fang3wen4 ji2bie2 \n"
">>>qing3 lian2xi4 466 fu3zhu4 tong1 feng1 guan3 dao4 yi3 huo4qu3 zhu3yao4 pao4ta3 kong4zhi4 tong1zhi1 \n"
"\n"
">>>qing3 qian2wang3 dong1ce4 lou2ti1jian1……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The screen on the terminal flickers off and on and displays a flashing error code.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
">>>#ERROR | 4ac43bc6 |\n"
">>>Primary security offline\n"
">>>#ERROR! Excess doors are floodlights please engage LTG your designated air duct. \n"
"\n"
">>>Admin Access Granted! Press Any Key to Continue."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​终端​屏幕​闪烁​，​显示​着​一行​错误代码​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​>​>​#​错误​ ​|​ ​4ac43bc6​ ​|​\n"
"​>​>​>​主​安保​已​离线​\n"
"​>​>​>​#​错误​！​多余​的​门​是​探照灯​，​请​启动​LTG​并​连接​到​指定​的​通风管道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​>​>​>​已​准许​管理员​权限​！​按​任意键​继续​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhong1duan1 ping2mu4 shan3shuo4，xian3shi4 zhao2 yi1xing2 cuo4 wu4 dai4 ma3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
">>># cuo4wu4 | 4ac43bc6 | \n"
">>>zhu3 an1bao3 yi3 li2xian4 \n"
">>># cuo4wu4！duo1yu2 de5 men2 shi4 tan4zhao4deng1，qing3 qi3dong4 LTG bing4 lian2jie1 dao4 zhi3ding4 de5 tong1 feng1 guan3 dao4。\n"
"\n"
">>>yi3 zhun3xu3 guan3li3yuan2 quan2xian4！an4 ren4 yi4 jian4 ji4xu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The second voice is dismissive.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"With two whole strike teams already set in ambush? I don't see what chance they have."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​第二个​声音​不屑一顾​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不是​已经​有​两支​突击队​埋伏​好了吗​？​我​看不出来​他们​有​什么​胜算​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} di4 er4 ge4 sheng1yin1 bu4xie4yi1gu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4shi4 yi3jing1 you3 liang3 zhi1 tu1ji1dui4 mai2fu2 hao3 le5 ma5？wo3 kan4 bu4 chu1 lai2 ta1men5 you3 shen2me5 sheng4suan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The second voice is older, confident.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"They have no choice. It's the only route they have access through."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​第二个​声音​更​年长​，​更​自信​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​他们​别无选择​。​这是​他们​唯一​能​通行​的​路线​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} di4 er4 ge4 sheng1yin1 geng1 nian2zhang3，geng1 zi4xin4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ta1men5 bie2wu2xuan3ze2。zhe4 shi4 ta1men5 wei2yi1 neng2 tong1xing2 de5 lu4xian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The security guard steps toward you, his weapon slung.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I didn't expect to bump into any of you Knight Errant guys out here. You on patrol?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​朝​你​走来​，​武器​斜​挎​在​肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没想到​会​在​这里​撞见​你们​游侠​骑士​的​人​。​你​是​在​巡逻​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 chao2 ni3 zou3 lai2，wu3qi4 xie2 kua4 zai4 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2xiang3dao4 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3 zhuang4jian4 ni3men5 you2Xia2qi2shi4 de5 ren2。ni3 shi4 zai4 xun2luo2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The security officer takes a step toward you, his rifle raised. His posture bristles with aggression.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"INTRUDER! SHOW ME YOUR ID! NOW!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​警卫​朝​你​迈出​一步​，​端起​步枪​。​他​的​姿态​充满​了​敌意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​入侵者​！​出示​身份证件​！​快​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing3wei4 chao2 ni3 mai4chu1 yi1 bu4，duan1 qi3 bu4qiang1。ta1 de5 zi1tai4 chong1man3 le5 di2yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru4qin1zhe3！chu1shi4 shen1 fen4 zheng4 jian4！kuai4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The shaman peers warily at the machine, his arms crossed over his chest.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"\"Old\" doesn't mean \"harmless,\" kid."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​萨满​警惕​地​打量​着​机器​，​双臂​交叉​抱​在​胸前​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​老旧​”​不​代表​“​无害​”​，​孩子​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sa4man3 jing3ti4 de5 da3liang5 zhao2 ji1qi4，shuang1bi4 jiao1cha1 bao4 zai4 xiong1qian2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"“lao3jiu4” bu4 dai4biao3“wu2hai4”，hai2zi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The shambling figure eagerly clasps its hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, please. Tell me of these conditions.\n"
"\n"
"We are willing to be reasonable."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​蹒跚​的​身影​急切​地​握紧​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​好​的​。​但​说​无妨​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​很​愿意​听听看​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pan2shan1 de5 shen1ying3 ji2qie4 de5 wo4 jin3 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5 hao3 de5。dan4 shuo1 wu2fang2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 hen3 yuan4yi4 ting1 ting1 kan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The shopkeeper's neck flushes red.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Huh? What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​店主​的​脖子​涨得​通红​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哈​？​你​在​说​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dian4zhu3 de5 bo2zi5 zhang3 de2 tong1hong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ha1？ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The shorter of the two, a human with arcane symbols tastefully embossed into his belt, glares at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're here. Finally. And you've brought our little mouse of an electrician with you.\n"
"\n"
"Better late than never - but not much better. You're tardy enough as it is."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​两人​中​较​矮​的​男子​是​个​腰带​上​镌刻​着​雅致​的​秘法​符文​的​人类​。​此刻​他​正​瞪​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​终于​来​了​。​还​带​着​我们​那位​小老鼠​似的​电工​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​迟到​总​比​不到​强​—​—​但​也好​不​到哪去​。​你​已经​够​迟​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} liang3 ren2 zhong4 jiao4 ai3 de5 nan2zi3 shi4 ge4 yao1dai4 shang4 juan1ke4 zhao2 ya3zhi4 de5 bi4 fa3 fu2wen2 de5 ren2lei4。ci3ke4 ta1 zheng1 deng4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhong1yu2 lai2 le5。hai2 dai4 zhao2 wo3men5 na4 wei4 xiao3lao3shu3 shi4de5 dian4gong1。\n"
"\n"
"chi2dao4 zong3 bi3 bu4dao4 jiang4——dan4 ye3hao3 bu4 dao4 na3 qu4。ni3 yi3jing1 gou4 chi2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The silence stretches. Finally, the Engineer speaks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"T-tell me what you w-want from me, s-so I c-c-can t-tell you to go s-screw yourselves."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​片刻​沉默​。​最后​，​工程师​终于​开口​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​-​你们​有话​就​-​就​赶紧​问​，​反​-​反正​我​的​回答​就​-​就是​滚​-​滚蛋​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pian4ke4 chen2mo4。zui4hou4，gong1cheng2shi1 zhong1yu2 kai1kou3 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 -ni3men5 you3 hua4 jiu4 -jiu4 gan3jin3 wen4，fan3 -fan3zheng4 wo3 de5 hui2da2 jiu4 -jiu4shi4 gun3 -gun3dan4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum hitches again, and you can feel the life drain out of it. It looks up at you robotically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You have a question. All right. Please, make your inquiry now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟像​再次​微微​停顿​，​你​能​感觉​到​它​的​生命力​骤然​消退​。​它​机械​地​抬头​望​向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​有​个​问题​。​好​的​。​现在​请​你​询问​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 zai4ci4 wei1wei1 ting2dun4，ni3 neng2 gan3jue2 dao4 ta1 de5 sheng1ming4li4 zhou4ran2 xiao1tui4。ta1 ji1xie4 de5 tai2tou2 wang4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 you3 ge4 wen4ti2。hao3 de5。xian4zai4 qing3 ni3 xun2wen4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum hitches again. The pause stretches. Finally, it comes back to life.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The AI has a kill switch. But Alice deemed any additional contact with APEX to be an unjustifiable risk.\n"
"\n"
"Attempting to reach the kill switch would be inadvisable."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟像​再次​停顿​，​这次​时间​更久​。​最终​，​它​总算​又动​了​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​AI​配有​紧急​开关​，​但​爱丽丝​认为​与​APEX​的​任何​额外​接触​都​属于​不可​接受​的​风险​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​尝试​启动​紧急​开关​绝非​明智之举​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 zai4ci4 ting2dun4，zhe4 ci4 shi2jian1 geng1 jiu3。zui4zhong1，ta1 zong3suan4 you4 dong4 le5 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 AI pei4you3 jin3ji2 kai1guan1，dan4 ai4li4si1 ren4wei2 yu4 APEX de5 ren4he2 e2wai4 jie1chu4 dou1 shu3yu2 bu4ke3 jie1shou4 de5 feng1xian3。\n"
"\n"
"chang2shi4 qi3dong4 jin3ji2 kai1guan1 jue2fei1 ming2zhi4zhi1ju3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum hitches again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. Very well. Recap: the discussion in question relates to a rumored artificial intelligence project called APEX. Saeder-Krupp was rumored to have been developing the AI for Matrix Warfare purposes.\n"
"\n"
"The project was abandoned in 2036 when the entire development team died under mysterious circumstances."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟像​再次​停顿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​的​，​我​知道​了​。​概括​：​当前​讨论​涉及​一个​名为​APEX​的​人工智能​项目​传闻​。​据称​赛德​-​克虏伯​正为​矩阵​战而​开发​该​AI​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​项目​于​2036​年​终止​，​开发​团队​全员​离奇​死亡​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 zai4ci4 ting2dun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 de5，wo3 zhi1dao4 le5。gai4kuo4：dang1qian2 tao3lun4 she4ji2 yi1ge5 ming2wei2 APEX de5 ren2gong1zhi4neng2 xiang4mu4 chuan2wen2。ju4cheng1 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 zheng1 wei2 ju3zhen4 zhan4 er2 kai1fa1 gai1 AI。\n"
"\n"
"gai1 xiang4mu4 yu2 2036 nian2 zhong1zhi3，kai1fa1 tuan2dui4 quan2yuan2 li2qi2 si3wang2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum hitches slightly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You may interrupt this presentation at any point by saying “Alice, I have a question.”"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟像​微微​停顿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可以​随时​说​“​爱丽丝​，​我​有​个​问题​”​来​打断​演示​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 wei1wei1 ting2dun4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3yi3 sui2shi2 shuo1“ai4li4si1，wo3 you3 ge4 wen4ti2” lai2 da3duan4 yan3shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum jerks back to life, then settles into a neutral pose.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There are no official records in the Saeder-Krupp database to support the existence of the APEX project. But the thing that I encountered *was* APEX. Of that, I am certain."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟像​突然​又动​了​起来​，​随后​恢复​普通​坐姿​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赛德​-​克虏伯​的​官方​数据库​里​没有​任何​能​证明​APEX​项目​存在​的​记录​。​但​我​遭遇​的​那个​东西​*​就是​*​APEX​，​我​百分百​确定​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 tu1ran2 you4 dong4 le5 qi3lai5，sui2hou4 hui1fu4 pu3tong1 zuo4zi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 de5 guan1fang1 shu4ju4ku4 li3 mei2you3 ren4he2 neng2 zheng4ming2 APEX xiang4mu4 cun2zai4 de5 ji4lu4。dan4 wo3 zao1yu4 de5 na4ge5 dong1xi1*jiu4shi4*APEX，wo3 bai3fen1bai3 que4ding4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum stares at you impassively.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Do you have another question?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟像面​无表情​地​注视​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​还有​其他​问题​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 mian4 wu2biao3qing2 de5 zhu4shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 hai2you3 qi2ta1 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum stares at you with dead eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thanks to my close encounter with the AI, I was able to run a trace on it.\n"
"\n"
"Through this trace, I discovered the physical address of a backdoor access point for APEX's programming. An old Saeder-Krupp research lab, long since abandoned and fallen into disrepair. The facility is now hotly-contested gang territory."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟​像​用​空洞​的​眼神​凝视着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​拜​当时​与​AI​的​近距离​接触​所赐​，​我​得以​对​其​进行​追踪​分析​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​通过​追踪​，​我​发现​了​APEX​程序​后门​接入点​的​物理地址​。​那​是​一处​废弃​已​久​、​破败​不堪​的​赛德​-​克虏伯​研究​实验室​，​如今​已​成为​帮派​激烈​争夺​的​势力范围​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 yong4 kong1dong4 de5 yan3shen2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bai4 dang1shi2 yu4 AI de5 jin4ju4li2 jie1chu4 suo3 ci4，wo3 de2yi3 dui4 qi2 jin4xing2 zhui1zong1 fen1xi1。\n"
"\n"
"tong1guo4 zhui1zong1，wo3 fa1xian4 le5 APEX cheng2xu4 hou4men2 jie1ru4dian3 de5 wu4 li3 de5 zhi3。na4 shi4 yi1 chu3 fei4qi4 yi3 jiu3、po4bai4 bu4kan1 de5 Sai4de2-ke4lu3bo2 yan2jiu1 shi2yan4shi4，ru2jin1 yi3 cheng2wei2 bang1pai4 ji1lie4 zheng1duo2 de5 shi4 li4 fan4 wei2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum stutters one final time, then looks up at you with an apologetic smile.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You have now reached the end of this presentation. I have been encoded with a final message from Alice to $(l.name).\n"
"\n"
"Playback commencing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟像​最后​停顿​了​一下​，​然后​带​着​歉意​的​微笑​抬头​看向​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​本次​演示​已​结束​。​我​的​编码​里​有​一条​爱丽丝​留给​$(l.name)​的​最终​消息​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​正在​开始​回放​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 zui4hou4 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 dai4 zhao2 qian4yi4 de5 wei1xiao4 tai2tou2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ben3 ci4 yan3shi4 yi3 jie2shu4。wo3 de5 bian1ma3 li3 you3 yi1 tiao2 ai4li4si1 liu2gei3 $(l.name) de5 zui4zhong1 xiao1xi5。\n"
"\n"
"zheng4zai4 kai1shi3 hui2fang4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The simulacrum’s eyes go wide, and the life floods back into it. It stares directly at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name). If you didn’t listen to me before, listen to me now. DROP THIS. Stop going after Vauclair, GET OUT of Berlin, and stay out of the Matrix. I’m telling you this for your own good."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​拟​像​的​双眼​骤然​睁​大​，​顿时​又​充满​了​生命力​。​它​直勾勾​地​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​。​如果​你​之前​没​听​进​我​的话​，​那​你​现在​给​我​听​好​。​*​立刻​*​收手​。​不要​追查​沃​克莱尔​，​*​马上​*​离开​柏林​，​永远​别​再​踏入​矩阵​。​我​这​是​为​你好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 xiang4 de5 shuang1yan3 zhou4ran2 zheng1 dai4，dun4shi2 you4 chong1man3 le5 sheng1ming4li4。ta1 zhi2gou1gou1 de5 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)。ru2guo3 ni3 zhi1qian2 mei2 ting1 jin4 wo3 de5hua4，na4 ni3 xian4zai4 gei3 wo3 ting1 hao3。*li4ke4*shou1shou3。bu4yao4 zhui1cha2 Wo4ke4lai2er3，*ma3shang4*li2kai1 bo2lin2，yong3yuan3 bie4 zai4 ta1 ru4 ju3zhen4。wo3 zhe4 shi4 wei2 ni3hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The slack-jawed man looks genuinely confused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Disappointment? No. It is not our place to feel such things.\n"
"\n"
"My brothers and I are grown here, gestated in tanks to serve our purpose. The Masters will it to be so."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​目瞪口呆​的​男人​看起来​十分​困惑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​失望​？​不​。​我们​不配​拥有​这样​的​感受​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​和​我​的​兄弟​们​在​此​成长​，​在​培养​槽​中​孕育​，​只​为​达成​使命​。​这​是​主​人们​的​意志​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mu4deng4kou3dai1 de5 nan2ren2 kan4qi3lai5 shi2fen1 kun4huo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi1wang4？bu4。wo3men5 bu4 pei4 yong1you3 zhe4yang4 de5 gan3shou4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 he4 wo3 de5 xiong1di4 men5 zai4 ci3 cheng2zhang3，zai4 pei2yang3 cao2 zhong4 yun4yu4，zhi3 wei2 da2cheng2 shi3ming4。zhe4 shi4 zhu3 ren2men5 de5 yi4zhi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smile dies on Marta's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't know what Glory told you, but the Adversary isn't the \"devil.\" Calling Him that - reducing him to a cartoonish embodiment of evil - is an insult.\n"
"\n"
"The Adversary that *I* revere is the personification of rebellion, conflict, and change. Of *anarchy.*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​微笑​从玛​尔塔​的​脸上​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​格洛丽​告诉​过​你​什么​，​但​反叛者​并非​所谓​的​“​魔鬼​”​。​使用​这种​称呼​将​他​贬低​成​卡通化​的​邪恶​化身​实属​亵渎​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​我​*​所​敬仰​的​反叛者​，​是​叛逆​、​冲突​与​变革​的​化身​。​是​*​无政府​状态​*​的​化身​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} wei1xiao4 cong2 Ma3er3ta3 de5 lian3 shang4 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 Ge2luo4li2 gao4su4 guo4 ni3 shen2me5，dan4 fan3 pan4 zhe3 bing4fei1 suo3wei4 de5“mo2gui3”。shi3yong4 zhe4zhong3 cheng1hu5 jiang1 ta1 bian3di1 cheng2 ka3 tong1 hua4 de5 xie2e4 hua4shen1 shi2shu3 xie4du2。\n"
"\n"
"*wo3*suo3 jing4yang3 de5 fan3 pan4 zhe3，shi4 pan4ni4、chong1tu1 yu4 bian4ge2 de5 hua4shen1。shi4*wu2 zheng4 fu3 zhuang4tai4*de5 hua4shen1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smile dies on his face. He lowers his hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I was just being polite, $(l.name). I know who you are... word travels fast in the Kreuzbasar.\n"
"\n"
"So tell me. What do you want?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​脸上​的​笑容​消失​了​。​他​放下​手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​只是​礼貌​一下​而已​，​$(l.name)​。​我​知道​你​是​谁​……​在​克洛伊​茨​集市​这种​地方​，​消息​传得​快​着​呢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​告诉​我​，​你​想​怎样​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 xiao1shi1 le5。ta1 fang4xia4 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi3shi4 li3mao4 yi1xia4 er2yi3，$(l.name)。wo3 zhi1dao4 ni3 shi4 shei2……zai4 Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 zhe4zhong3 di4fang1，xiao1xi5 chuan2 de2 kuai4 zhao2 ni2。\n"
"\n"
"gao4su4 wo3，ni3 xiang3 zen3yang4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smile fades from Parson's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Trithemius is a dangerous man... why do you ask?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​帕森​脸上​的​微笑​渐渐​消失​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​特​里特​米​乌斯​是​个​危险​的​人​……​你​为什么​问​这个​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pa4 sen1 lian3 shang4 de5 wei1xiao4 jian4jian4 xiao1shi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"te4 li3 te4 mi3 wu1 si1 shi4 ge4 wei1xian3 de5 ren2……ni3 wei4shen2me5 wen4 zhe4ge5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smile fades from his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I've heard just about enough insolence from you.\n"
"\n"
"I might just have my men teach you some manners."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​脸上​的​笑容​逐渐​消失​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​受够​你​的​无礼​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​或许​该​让​我​的​人​教教​你​什么​叫​礼数​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 zhu2jian4 xiao1shi1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shou4gou4 ni3 de5 wu2li3 le5。\n"
"\n"
"huo4xu3 gai1 rang4 wo3 de5 ren2 jiao1 jiao1 ni3 shen2me5 jiao4 li3shu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smile on her face is not reflected in her eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good day to you, then! Come back any time!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​脸上​的​笑容​并未​映​在​她​的​眼睛​里​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​回见​了​！​欢迎​随时​再​来​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 xiao4rong2 bing4wei4 ying4 zai4 ta1 de5 yan3jing5 li3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 hui2jian4 le5！huan1ying2 sui2shi2 zai4 lai2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smile remains on her face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I can control it. Like I said.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She turns away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Everything is going to be just fine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​还​在​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​说​了​，​我​驾驭​得​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​转过身​去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不会​有事​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hai2 zai4 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shuo1 le5，wo3 jia4yu4 de2 le5。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhuai3 guo4 shen1 qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4hui4 you3shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smirk falls away from her face. She sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yeah, I saw that coming. But with all due respect, it's none of your business, fearless leader."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​慢慢​收起​笑容​，​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​唉​，​我​就​知道​你​要​问​这个​。​但​恕我直言​，​这​和​你​没​半点​关系​，​无畏​领袖​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 man4man4 shou1 qi3 xiao4rong2，tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ai1，wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4 ni3 yao4 wen4 zhe4ge5。dan4 shu4 wo3 zhi2 yan2，zhe4 he4 ni3 mei2 ban4dian3 guan1xi5，wu2 wei4 ling3xiu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smooth-looking young newscaster to his left jumps in.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That's right, John. According to one user - he went by the name of \"RollinTHUNDER\" - the attacks are being caused by alien rays.\n"
"\n"
"\"They're driving us crazy,\" he wrote. \"Getting us to kill each other before they invade.\""
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​左侧​那位​外表​光鲜​的​年轻​主播​插话​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​，​约翰​。​据​一位​用户​—​—​他​自称​“​RollinTHUNDER​”​—​—​透露​，​这些​攻击​是​由​外星​射线​引发​的​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​“​它们​正在​让​我们​发疯​，​”​他​写道​，​“​在​入侵​前先​挑拨​我们​互相残杀​。​”\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zuo3ce4 na4 wei4 wai4biao3 guang1xian1 de5 nian2qing1 zhu3bo1 cha1hua4 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4，yue1han4。ju4 yi1 wei4 yong4hu4——ta1 zi4cheng1“RollinTHUNDER”——tou4lu4，zhe4xie1 gong1ji1 shi4 you2 wai4xing1 she4xian4 yin3fa1 de5。\n"
"\n"
"“ta1men5 zheng4zai4 rang4 wo3men5 fa1feng1，” ta1 xie3dao4，“zai4 ru4qin1 qian2 xian1 tiao3bo1 wo3men5 hu4 xiang1 can2 sha1。”"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smuggler glances at you, an eyebrow raised.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm gettin' the feelin' Maxim was a little... uh... wrong about you.\n"
"\n"
"You're not run-of-the-mill muscle. What's your angle in all of this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​走私者​瞥​了​你​一眼​，​挑起​眉毛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​觉得​马克西姆​对​你​的​判断​有点​……​不太​准确​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​可不是​普通​的​打手​，​你​来​这​到底​图​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zou3 si1 zhe3 pie1 le5 ni3 yi1yan3，tiao3qi3 mei2mao5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jue2de5 ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 dui4 ni3 de5 pan4duan4 you3dian3……bu4 tai4 zhun3que4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 ke3bu5shi4 pu3tong1 de5 da3shou5，ni3 lai2 zhe4 dao4di3 tu2 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The smuggler's eyes go wide.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What're you talkin' about, $(l.man)? We ain't gonna finish nothin'.\n"
"\n"
"Those Humanis pukes won't even talk to us without Maxim there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​走私者​瞪​大​了​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​在​说​什么​？​我们​已经​失败​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​马克西姆​不​在​，​人类​至上​主义者​那些​狗​杂种​根本​不会​和​我们​碰面​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zou3 si1 zhe3 deng4 dai4 le5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zai4 shuo1 shen2me5？wo3men5 yi3jing1 shi1bai4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"ma3 ke4 xi1 mu3 bu4 zai4，ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 na4xie1 gou3 za2zhong3 gen1ben3 bu4hui4 he4 wo3men5 peng4mian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The sounds of hurried footsteps echo down the hallway behind you. The Humanis leader smiles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...And as luck would have it, here they come now."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​身后​的​走廊​传来​急促​的​脚步声​。​人类​至上​主义者​的​首领​露出​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​太巧​了​，​他们​这​就​来​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 shen1hou4 de5 zou3lang2 chuan2lai2 ji2cu4 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1。ren2lei4 zhi4shang4 zhu3 yi4 zhe3 de5 shou3ling3 lu4chu1 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……tai4 qiao3 le5，ta1men5 zhe4 jiu4 lai2 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit bows its head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<We have withdrawn ourselves from the minds of the people here. They are themselves again.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​低下头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​我们​已经​离开​了​那些​人​的​心灵​。​他们​已经​恢复​了​自我意识​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 di1 xia4 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< wo3men5 yi3jing1 li2kai1 le5 na4xie1 ren2 de5 xin1ling2。ta1men5 yi3jing1 hui1fu4 le5 zi4wo3yi4shi2。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit cackles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<Very well, child. If pain is what you seek, we will bring it to you.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Beneath its leathery skin, the thing's bones begin to shift, straining against the ligaments and tendons that bind them. A hideous cracking sound fills the air as its skeleton splinters and pops.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​嗤笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​好​吧​，​孩子​。​既然​你​执意​要​追寻​痛苦​，​我们​就让​你​如愿以偿​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​在​它​坚韧​的​皮肤​下​，​这​东西​的​骨头​开始​移位​，​奋力​对抗​着​束缚​住​它们​的​韧带​和​肌腱​。​空气​中​弥漫着​狰狞​的​爆裂声​，​它​的​骨架​四分五裂​，​发出​噼啪​声响​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 chi1xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< hao3 ba1，hai2zi5。ji4ran2 ni3 zhi2yi4 yao4 zhui1xun2 tong4ku3，wo3men5 jiu4 rang4 ni3 ru2yuan4yi3chang2。>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zai4 ta1 jian1ren4 de5 pi2fu1 xia4，zhe4 dong1xi1 de5 gu3tou5 kai1shi3 yi2wei4，fen4li4 dui4kang4 zhao2 shu4fu4 zhu4 ta1men5 de5 ren4dai4 he4 ji1jian4。kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 zheng1ning2 de5 bao4 lie4 sheng1，ta1 de5 gu3jia4 si4fen1wu3lie4，fa1chu1 pi1pa1 sheng1xiang3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit cackles.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<Your suffering has only just begun. We will grind your body to dust.>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Beneath its leathery skin, its bones begin to shift, straining against the ligaments and tendons that bind them. A hideous cracking sound fills the air as its skeleton splinters and pops.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​嗤笑​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​你​的​痛苦​才​刚刚开始​。​我们​会​把​你​的​躯体​碾作​尘埃​。​>​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​在​它​坚韧​的​皮肤​下​，​这​东西​的​骨头​开始​移位​，​奋力​对抗​着​束缚​住​它们​的​韧带​和​肌腱​。​空气​中​弥漫着​狰狞​的​爆裂声​，​它​的​骨架​四分五裂​，​发出​噼啪​声响​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 chi1xiao4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< ni3 de5 tong4ku3 cai2 gang1 gang1 kai1 shi3。wo3men5 hui4 ba3 ni3 de5 qu1ti3 nian3 zuo4 chen2ai1。>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zai4 ta1 jian1ren4 de5 pi2fu1 xia4，zhe4 dong1xi1 de5 gu3tou5 kai1shi3 yi2wei4，fen4li4 dui4kang4 zhao2 shu4fu4 zhu4 ta1men5 de5 ren4dai4 he4 ji1jian4。kong1qi4 zhong4 mi2 man4 zhao2 zheng1ning2 de5 bao4 lie4 sheng1，ta1 de5 gu3jia4 si4fen1wu3lie4，fa1chu1 pi1pa1 sheng1xiang3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit chuckles - a strange, warbling sound that sends a shiver down your spine.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<We are not in need of help.\n"
"\n"
"We are our Great Master's servant, just as Harrow is. Just as you are, despite your misguided attempt to cut away His love from your heart.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​发出​轻笑​—​—​那​是​种​诡异​的​颤鸣​之声​，​让​你​不寒而栗​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​我们​不​需要​帮助​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​是​伟大​主人​的​仆从​，​就​像​哈罗​和​你​一样​。​尽管​你​误入歧途​，​试图​将​祂​的​爱​从​你​的​心中​抹​去​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 fa1chu1 qing1 xiao4——na4 shi4 zhong3 gui3yi4 de5 chan4 ming2 zhi1 sheng1，rang4 ni3 bu4han2er2li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< wo3men5 bu4 xu1yao4 bang1zhu4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 shi4 wei3da4 zhu3ren2 de5 pu1 cong2，jiu4 xiang4 ha1luo2 he4 ni3 yi1yang4。jin3guan3 ni3 wu4ru4qi2tu2，shi4tu2 jiang1 ta1 de5 ai4 cong2 ni3 de5 xin1zhong1 ma1 qu4。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit chuckles - a strange, warbling sound that sends a shiver down your spine.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<We knew why you had come, child. When you mutilated yourself - when you *cut away* your connection to Him - all became clear to us.\n"
"\n"
"We knew that one day you'd be back, and that you would lash out against our Great Master. It was inevitable.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​发出​轻笑​—​—​那​是​种​诡异​的​颤鸣​之声​，​让​你​不寒而栗​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​我们​知道​你​为何​而​来​，​孩子​。​当​你​选择​*​切断​*​与​祂​的​联系​而​自残​时​，​我们​就​明白​了​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​知道​总有一天​你​会​回来​，​向​我们​的​伟大​主人​发难​。​这本​就是​命中注定​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 fa1chu1 qing1 xiao4——na4 shi4 zhong3 gui3yi4 de5 chan4 ming2 zhi1 sheng1，rang4 ni3 bu4han2er2li4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< wo3men5 zhi1dao4 ni3 wei4he2 er2 lai2，hai2zi5。dang1 ni3 xuan3ze2*qie1duan4*yu4 ta1 de5 lian2xi4 er2 zi4can2 shi2，wo3men5 jiu4 ming2bai5 le5 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhi1dao4 zong3 you3 yi1 tian1 ni3 hui4 hui2lai5，xiang4 wo3men5 de5 wei3da4 zhu3ren2 fa1nan4。zhe4 ben3 jiu4shi4 ming4zhong1zhu4ding4。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit keeps its attention fixed on Glory. It clasps its hands and leans forward, bowing its head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<All that He requires of you is a show of good faith.\n"
"\n"
"Remove the protective ward from your neck, and His gift is yours for the taking. Yours forevermore.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​的​注意力​仍然​集中​在​格洛丽​身上​。​它​双手​合十​，​倾身​俯首​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​祂​只​需要​你​展现出​你​的​诚意​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​摘下​你​脖子​上​的​护身符​，​祂​的​馈赠​便任​你​取用​。​永世​相伴​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 de5 zhu4yi4li4 reng2ran2 ji2zhong1 zai4 Ge2luo4li2 shen1shang5。ta1 shuang1shou3 he2shi2，qing1 shen1 fu3shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< ta1 zhi3 xu1yao4 ni3 zhan3 xian4 chu1 ni3 de5 cheng2yi4。\n"
"\n"
"zhai1xia4 ni3 bo2zi5 shang4 de5 hu4shen1fu2，ta1 de5 kui4zeng4 bian4 ren4 ni3 qu3yong4。yong3shi4 xiang1ban4。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit leans toward her, clasping its hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<This will cost you nothing. A simple gesture, a trifle... a show of good faith. If you demonstrate your love for Him, He will reward you beyond your wildest dreams.\n"
"\n"
"Remove the protective ward from your neck, and His gift is yours for the taking. Yours forevermore.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​向​她​倾身​，​双手​合十​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​这​不会​让​你​付出​任何​代价​。​只​需​一个​简单​的​举动​，​一件​微不足道​的​小事​……​展现出​你​的​诚意​。​如果​你​能​证明​你​对​祂​的​爱​，​祂​会​给​你​超乎​想象​的​回报​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​摘下​你​脖子​上​的​护身符​，​祂​的​馈赠​便任​你​取用​。​永世​相伴​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 xiang4 ta1 qing1 shen1，shuang1shou3 he2shi2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< zhe4 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 fu4chu1 ren4he2 dai4jia4。zhi3 xu1 yi1ge5 jian3dan1 de5 ju3dong4，yi1 jian4 wei1bu4zu2dao4 de5 xiao3shi4……zhan3 xian4 chu1 ni3 de5 cheng2yi4。ru2guo3 ni3 neng2 zheng4ming2 ni3 dui4 ta1 de5 ai4，ta1 hui4 gei3 ni3 chao1 hu1 xiang3xiang4 de5 hui2bao4。\n"
"\n"
"zhai1xia4 ni3 bo2zi5 shang4 de5 hu4shen1fu2，ta1 de5 kui4zeng4 bian4 ren4 ni3 qu3yong4。yong3shi4 xiang1ban4。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit shifts its gaze to you. It braids its taloned fingers together.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"<Your friend will remain here, I think. With me.\n"
"\n"
"I can find all manner of uses for such a succulent morsel.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​将​目光​转向​你​。​它​将​利爪​般的​手指​交缠​在​一起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​你​的​这位​朋友​要​留在​这里​。​和​我​在​一起​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我能​为​如此​鲜美​的​肉体​想到​各种​享用​的​方式​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 jiang1 mu4guang1 zhuan3xiang4 ni3。ta1 jiang1 li4zhao3 ban1 de5 shou3zhi3 jiao1chan2 zai4 yi1qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< ni3 de5 zhe4wei4 peng2you5 yao4 liu2 zai4 zhe4li3。he4 wo3 zai4 yi1qi3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 neng2 wei2 ru2ci3 xian1mei3 de5 rou4ti3 xiang3dao4 ge4zhong3 xiang3yong4 de5 fang1shi4。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The spirit stares at Glory for a long moment. Finally, it dips its head in a nod.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<Yes. We will help you.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​精魂​盯​着​格洛丽​看​了​许久​，​最终​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​是​的​。​我们​会​帮助​你​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} jing1hun2 ding1 zhao2 Ge2luo4li2 kan4 le5 xu3jiu3，zui4zhong1 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< shi4 de5。wo3men5 hui4 bang1zhu4 ni3。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The stranger offers you a broad smile and a shrug.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Because I don't know."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​陌生人​朝​你​咧嘴一笑​，​耸了耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​因为​我​不​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mo4sheng1ren2 chao2 ni3 lie3 zui3 yi1 xiao4，song3 le5 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yin1wei4 wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The tallest of the acolytes turns to you. When he sees Marta, his expression softens.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Marta! Who are your... friends?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​个子​最高​的​侍​祭​看​向​你们​。​当​看到​玛​尔塔​时​，​他​的​表情​变得​柔和​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​！​这些​是​你​的​……​朋友​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ge4zi5 zui4gao1 de5 shi4 ji4 kan4 xiang4 ni3men5。dang1 kan4dao4 Ma3er3ta3 shi2，ta1 de5 biao3qing2 bian4de5 rou2he2 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3！zhe4xie1 shi4 ni3 de5……peng2you5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The test subjects that you liberated mill about aimlessly, blinking against the light. The foremost clone takes a half-step forward.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"But what of us? We have no purpose now. This is not supposed to happen, it is wrong!\n"
"\n"
"Without our Masters to guide us, what will we do?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​解救出来​的​实验​体们​茫然​地​来回​踱步​，​因为​光线​而​不断​眨​着​眼睛​。​领头​的​克隆人​朝前​走​了​半步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我们​呢​？​我们​没有​使命​了​。​这种​事本​不该​发生​，​这是​错误​的​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​了​主​人们​的​指引​，​我们​要​做​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 jie3 jiu4 chu1 lai2 de5 shi2yan4 ti3 men5 mang2ran2 de5 lai2hui2 duo2bu4，yin1wei4 guang1xian4 er2 bu4duan4 zha3 zhao2 yan3jing5。ling3tou2 de5 ke4long2ren2 chao2qian2 zou3 le5 ban4 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3men5 ni2？wo3men5 mei2you3 shi3ming4 le5。zhe4zhong3 shi4 ben3 bu4gai1 fa1sheng1，zhe4 shi4 cuo4wu4 de5！\n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 le5 zhu3 ren2men5 de5 zhi3yin3，wo3men5 yao4 zuo4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The text field disappears. A single line of text pops onto the center of the screen, taking its place.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ACCEPT JOB? Y/N"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​文本框​消失​了​，​取而代之​的​是​屏幕​中央​弹出​的​一行​文字​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​接受​差事​？​是​/​否\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} wen2ben3kuang4 xiao1shi1 le5，qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 ping2mu4 zhong1yang1 tan2chu1 de5 yi1xing2 wen2zi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jie1shou4 cha4shi4？shi4/fou3"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll looks around nervously.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"...No? \n"
"\n"
"I don't know anything about crates."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​巨魔​紧张​地​环顾四周​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​啊​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​什么​箱子​的​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 jin3zhang1 de5 huan2gu4si4zhou1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……a1？\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 shen2me5 xiang1zi5 de5 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll looks around nervously.{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Well… I, uh... sometimes I get a lucky salvage."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​巨魔​紧张​地​环顾四周​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​……​我​……​有时候​比较​走运​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 jin3zhang1 de5 huan2gu4si4zhou1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4……wo3……you3shi2hou5 bi3jiao4 zou3yun4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll pulls nervously at his collar.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No worries. I, uh... should get back to work here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​巨魔​紧张​地扯​了​下​领口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没什么​。​我​……​该​继续​工作​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 jin3zhang1 de5 che3 le5 xia4 ling3kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5。wo3……gai1 ji4xu4 gong1zuo4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll shakes a heavy head, showing more weariness than wound.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This should have never happened. Not here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​巨魔​摇​了​摇​沉重​的​头颅​，​显得​比​受伤​更​疲惫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​会​发生​这种​事​。​不该​在​这里​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 yao2 le5 yao2 chen2zhong4 de5 tou2lu2，xian3de5 bi3 shou4shang1 geng1 pi2bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 hui4 fa1sheng1 zhe4zhong3 shi4。bu4gai1 zai4 zhe4li3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have no idea. \n"
"\n"
"Frank's watching the floor tonight. Ask him. Just don't expect an answer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​巨魔​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​今晚​是​弗兰克​当班​，​问​他​去​。​别​期待​有​答案​就是​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。\n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 shi4 fu2lan2ke4 dang1ban1，wen4 ta1 qu4。bie4 qi1dai4 you3 da2an4 jiu4shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll standing behind him cuts in.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you our relief? We've already been here well past the end of our shift."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​站​在​他​身后​的​巨魔​打断​了​对话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​是​来​换班​的​吗​？​我们​的​班次​早就​结束​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhan4 zai4 ta1 shen1hou4 de5 ju4mo2 da3duan4 le5 dui4hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shi4 lai2 huan4ban1 de5 ma5？wo3men5 de5 ban1ci4 zao3jiu4 jie2shu4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll standing behind the dwarf takes a half-step forward.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Stay cool. He didn't mean nothin' by it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​矮人​身后​的​巨魔​向前​半步​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​冷静​点​，​他​不是​那个​意思​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ai3ren2 shen1hou4 de5 ju4mo2 xiang4qian2 ban4 bu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"leng3jing4 dian3，ta1 bu4shi4 na4ge5 yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll's eyes flicker back and forth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I don’t know anything about weapons. I just sell scraps of salvage and home remedies. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​巨魔​的​目光​来回​闪烁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​不​知道​什么​武器​的​事​。​我​这里​只卖​回收​品​和​家用​药物​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 de5 mu4guang1 lai2hui2 shan3shuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 shen2me5 wu3qi4 de5 shi4。wo3 zhe4li3 zhi3 mai4 hui2shou1 pin3 he4 jia1yong4 yao4wu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The troll's eyes flicker back and forth.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"N... no… can't say that I have."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​巨魔​的​目光​来回​闪烁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​……​我​不​知道​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ju4mo2 de5 mu4guang1 lai2hui2 shan3shuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4……wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The two guards exchange glances.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course, of course. Customers are always welcome. Head on in.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}The older man steps aside.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​两名​守卫​对视​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​原来如此​。​有​顾客​总是​件​好事​。​请进​吧​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​老人​退​到​一旁​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} liang3 ming2 shou3wei4 dui4shi4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yuan2lai2ru2ci3。you3 gu4ke4 zong3shi4 jian4 hao3shi4。qing3jin4 ba1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3ren2 tui4 dao4 yi1pang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The ugly smile falls away from his face. What replaces it is uglier.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If I weren't under instructions to follow your lead, this would be a very different conversation."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​脸上​的​丑陋​笑容​不见​了​。​取而代之​的​是​更​丑陋​的​表情​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​要不是​我​现在​得​听​你​指挥​，​目前​的​情况​可​就​不是​这么回事​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lian3 shang4 de5 chou3lou4 xiao4rong2 bu4jian4 le5。qu3er2dai4zhi1 de5 shi4 geng1 chou3lou4 de5 biao3qing2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yao4bu5shi4 wo3 xian4zai4 de2 ting1 ni3 zhi3hui1，mu4qian2 de5 qing2kuang4 ke3 jiu4 bu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The unofficial grandparents of the Kreuzbasar greet you warmly on your return, with a hug from Karin and a firm handshake from Kristian.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I had a feeling we'd be seeing you again."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​克洛伊​茨​集市​的​非官方​祖父母​热情​迎接​你​归来​，​卡琳​给​你​一个​拥抱​，​克里斯蒂安​则​与​你​握手​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​就​知道​，​我们​还会​再见面​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ke4luo4yi1ci2ji2shi4 de5 fei1guan1fang1 zu3fu4mu3 re4qing2 ying2jie1 ni3 gui1lai2，ka3 lin2 gei3 ni3 yi1ge5 yong1bao4，ke4li3si1di4an1 ze2 yu4 ni3 wo4shou3 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiu4 zhi1dao4，wo3men5 hai2 hui4 zai4 jian4 mian4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The vendor pauses a moment, then steeples her pudgy fingers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We don't see many strangers down at this end of the line. In case you hadn't noticed, things are a little run-down out here.\n"
"\n"
"You weren't thinking of heading out past the wall, were you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​摊主​停顿​了​一会儿​，​然后​将​胖乎乎​的​手指​搭​在​一起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​这里​来​的​陌生人​不​多​。​想必​你​也​注意​到​了​，​这​附近​的​日子​不怎么​好过​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​不会​打算​去​墙​外面​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tan1 zhu3 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ran2hou4 jiang1 pang4hu1hu1 de5 shou3zhi3 da1 zai4 yi1qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 zhe4li3 lai2 de5 mo4sheng1ren2 bu4 duo1。xiang3bi4 ni3 ye3 zhu4yi4 dao4 le5，zhe4 fu4jin4 de5 ri4zi5 bu4zen3me5 hao3guo4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3 bu4hui4 da3suan4 qu4 qiang2 wai4mian4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The voice becomes calmer, and lowers in pitch.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Huh. I guess I've never heard of a spirit using an intercom before. That's a really good point.\n"
"\n"
"Are... are you here to save me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​声音​逐渐​平静​，​音调​也​降低​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​我​确实​没听说过​精魂​会​用​对讲机​。​你​说​得​有​道理​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​……​你​是​来​救​我​的​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sheng1yin1 zhu2jian4 ping2jing4，yin1diao4 ye3 jiang4di1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 que4shi2 mei2 ting1 shuo1 guo4 jing1hun2 hui4 yong4 dui4jiang3ji1。ni3 shuo1 de2 you3 dao4li5。\n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 shi4 lai2 jiu4 wo3 de5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The voice calms. Goes soft. Somehow, it isn't an improvement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now, you tell me who you are.\n"
"\n"
"Answer up. Chop-chop."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​声音​渐趋​平静​。​变得​柔和​。​但​这​似乎​也​不是​什么​好事​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​报出​你​的​身份​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说话​啊​。​赶紧​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sheng1yin1 jian4qu1 ping2jing4。bian4de5 rou2he2。dan4 zhe4 si4hu1 ye3 bu4shi4 shen2me5 hao3shi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4 chu1 ni3 de5 shen1fen4。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1hua4 a1。gan3jin3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The voice is drowned out by a flurry of static. Monika's voice shrieks out of the speakers, pleading.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No! Please, ace, don't do it! I never wanted to hurt you... please, don't kill me!\n"
"\n"
"I don't want to die *again!*"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​声音​被​一阵​静电​干扰​淹没​。​莫妮卡​的​声音​从​扬声器​里​尖叫​着​传出​，​向​你​哀求​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​！​拜托​，​王牌​，​别​这么​做​！​我​从没​想​伤害​你​……​求求​你​，​别杀​我​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不想​*​再​*​死​一次​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} sheng1yin1 bei4 yi1zhen4 jing4dian4 gan1rao3 yan1mo4。Mo4ni1ka3 de5 sheng1yin1 cong2 yang2sheng1qi4 li3 jian1jiao4 zhao2 chuan2chu1，xiang4 ni3 ai1qiu2 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4！bai4tuo1，wang2pai2，bie4 zhe4me5 zuo4！wo3 cong2mei2 xiang3 shang1hai4 ni3……qiu2 qiu2 ni3，bie4 sha1 wo3！\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4xiang3*zai4*si3 yi1ci4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The voices in your head soften. Become sad. But the fluttering in your chest turns ugly, like the buzzing wings of a swarm of blowflies.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"<You have mangled yourself beyond repair, and you did it to spite Him. He, who was your greatest benefactor... you betrayed Him, child.\n"
"\n"
"But He loves you, all the same.>"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​脑海中​的​声音​变得​柔和​而​悲伤​。​但​你​胸中​的​悸动​却​变得​令人​不快​，​就​像​一群​苍蝇​嗡嗡作响​的​翅膀​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​<​你​把​自己​弄​得​体无完肤​，​而​这​一切都是​为了​报复​祂​。​祂​是​你​最大​的​恩人​……​而​你​却​背叛​了​祂​，​孩子​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​无论如何​，​祂​仍然​爱着​你​。​>\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 nao3 hai3 zhong4 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 rou2he2 er2 bei1shang1。dan4 ni3 xiong1zhong1 de5 ji4dong4 que4 bian4de5 ling4ren2 bu4kuai4，jiu4 xiang4 yi1 qun2 cang1ying5 weng1 weng1 zuo4 xiang3 de5 chi4bang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"< ni3 ba3 zi4ji3 long4 de2 ti3wu2wan2fu1，er2 zhe4 yi1 qie1 dou1 shi4 wei4le5 bao4fu4 ta1。ta1 shi4 ni3 zui4 dai4 de5 en1ren2……er2 ni3 que4 bei4pan4 le5 ta1，hai2zi5。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 wu2lun4ru2he2，ta1 reng2ran2 ai4 zhao2 ni3。>"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The wageslave blinks at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Who... who are you? How the hell did you get in here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​薪奴​朝​你​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​……​你​是​谁​？​你​是​怎么​进来​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xin1 nu2 chao2 ni3 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 shi4 shei2？ni3 shi4 zen3me5 jin4lai2 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The wageslave rubs his eyes and nods his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, I think that I got a memo about some contractors coming in. Well, welcome aboard... we can definitely use the help."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​薪奴​揉​揉​眼睛​，​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​，​我​确实​收到​过​备忘​，​说会​有​新​的​外​包工​来​帮忙​。​欢迎​你​的​到来​……​我们​正​需要​人手​呢​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xin1 nu2 rou2 rou2 yan3jing5，dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1，wo3 que4shi2 shou1dao4 guo4 bei4 wang4，shuo1 hui4 you3 xin1 de5 wai4 bao1gong1 lai2 bang1mang2。huan1ying2 ni3 de5 dao4lai2……wo3men5 zheng1 xu1yao4 ren2shou3 ni2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The wageslave turns and blinks at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Who... who are you? How the hell did you get in here?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​薪奴​转过身​，​朝​你​眨​了​眨眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​……​你​是​谁​？​你​是​怎么​进来​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} xin1 nu2 zhuai3 guo4 shen1，chao2 ni3 zha3 le5 zha3yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 shi4 shei2？ni3 shi4 zen3me5 jin4lai2 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The waitress steps forward to greet you, a drink menu in her hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to KafShack, home of the budget-friendly caffeine fix. May I help you?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​女​侍应生​上前​迎接​你​，​手中​拿​着​饮品​菜单​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​欢迎光临​“​咖屋​”​，​这里​是​平价​咖啡​的​天堂​。​需要​帮忙​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3 shi4ying4sheng1 shang4qian2 ying2jie1 ni3，shou3 zhong4 na2 zhao2 yin3pin3 cai4dan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huan1ying2guang1lin2“ka1 wu1”，zhe4li3 shi4 ping2jia4 ka1fei1 de5 tian1tang2。xu1yao4 bang1mang2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The woman nods enthusiastically.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I will help you...\n"
"\n"
"...grant you release...\n"
"\n"
"...and you will repay me in kind yes yes you can escape from this room there is a panel in the floor there is..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​女人​热切地​点点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我会​帮​你​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​让​你​解放​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​而​你​也​会​回报​，​是​的​是​的​是​的​，​你​可以​离开​这​房间​，​地板​上​有​个​面板​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nu:3ren2 re4 qie1 de5 dian3 dian3 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hui4 bang1 ni3……\n"
"\n"
"……rang4 ni3 jie3fang4……\n"
"\n"
"……er2 ni3 ye3 hui4 hui2bao4，shi4 de5 shi4 de5 shi4 de5，ni3 ke3yi3 li2kai1 zhe4 fang2jian1，di4ban3 shang4 you3 ge4 mian4ban3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The woman starts a little at your approach, but she recovers quickly and beams brightly at you. The fox face on her headdress seems to grin as well. Her classically nasal American accent is obvious.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey kiddo. Share a drink with me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​当​你​走近​时​，​女人​吓了一跳​，​但​她​很快​恢复过来​，​并​对​你​露出​灿烂​的​笑容​。​她​头饰​上​的​狐狸​脸​似乎​也​在​咧嘴​笑​。​她​有着​明显​的​经典​式​美国​鼻音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你好​，​孩子​。​要​和​我​喝一杯​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dang1 ni3 zou3jin4 shi2，nu:3ren2 he4 le5 yi1 tiao4，dan4 ta1 hen3 kuai4 hui1 fu4 guo4 lai2，bing4 dui4 ni3 lu4chu1 can4lan4 de5 xiao4rong2。ta1 tou2shi4 shang4 de5 hu2li5 lian3 si4hu1 ye3 zai4 lie3zui3 xiao4。ta1 you3zhe5 ming2xian3 de5 jing1dian3 shi4 mei3guo2 bi2yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3hao3，hai2zi5。yao4 he4 wo3 he4 yi1 bei1 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The woman's warm smile fades as she reads the tone in your voice. The old man frowns.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What happened?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​老妇人​听出​了​你​语气​中​潜藏​的​意味​，​温暖​的​笑容​渐渐​褪去​。​老先生​皱起​眉头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​发生​了​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} lao3fu4ren2 ting1 chu1 le5 ni3 yu3qi4 zhong4 qian2cang2 de5 yi4wei4，wen1nuan3 de5 xiao4rong2 jian4jian4 tui4qu4。lao3 xian1 sheng1 zhou4qi3 mei2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The young man looks shell-shocked. He holds his rifle clenched tight in his trembling hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm... yeah, Uncle Dietrich. Yeah, I'm okay.\n"
"\n"
"But I... those guys, I knew them... one of them was my bunkmate. I killed him..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​这个​年轻人​看起来​惊魂未定​，​他​颤抖​的​双手​死死地​攥​着​步枪​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​没事​……​迪​特里​希​叔叔​，​我​没事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​可是​我​……​那些​人​，​我​认识​他们​，​其中​一个​是​我​的​舍友​……​我​杀​了​他​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4ge5 nian2qing1ren2 kan4qi3lai5 jing1 hun2 wei4 ding4，ta1 chan4dou3 de5 shuang1shou3 si3 si3 de5 zuan4 zhao2 bu4qiang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 mei2shi4……Di2te4li3xi1 shu1shu5，wo3 mei2shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ke3shi4 wo3……na4xie1 ren2，wo3 ren4shi5 ta1men5，qi2zhong1 yi1ge5 shi4 wo3 de5 she4you3……wo3 sha1 le5 ta1……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The young woman gives you a wary look.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What's the catch?\n"
"\n"
"...'Cause if you're tryin' to make the same offer that HE just did...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She shudders.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​年轻​女孩​警惕​地​看​了​你​一眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​想要​什么​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​你​要是​在​跟​他​打​一样​的​主意​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​哆嗦​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} nian2qing1 nu:3hai2 jing3ti4 de5 kan4 le5 ni3 yi1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xiang3yao4 shen2me5？\n"
"\n"
"……ni3 yao4shi5 zai4 gen1 ta1 da3 yi1yang4 de5 zhu3yi5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 duo1suo5 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The younger ork eagerly snatches the credstick from your hand. The "
"older man sighs, then steps aside.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​年轻​的​兽​人​热切地​从​你​手上​一把​拿走​信用​棒​。​老人​叹​了​口气​，​退​到​一旁​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} nian2qing1 de5 shou4 ren2 re4 qie1 de5 cong2 ni3 shou3 shang4 yi1 ba3 na2zou3 xin4yong4 bang4。lao3ren2 tan4 le5 kou3qi4，tui4 dao4 yi1pang2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}The youth blinks in surprise. He half-lowers his weapon.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Uncle Dietrich?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​那​年轻人​惊讶​地​眨​眨眼​，​半​放下​武器​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​迪​特里​希​叔叔​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} na4 nian2qing1ren2 jing1ya4 de5 zha3 zha3yan3，ban4 fang4xia4 wu3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Di2te4li3xi1 shu1shu5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There are a few lines of text stenciled onto the hatch in blocky red lettering.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"[ACCESS TO UTILITY JUNCTION J4]\n"
"[ACCESS TO UTILITY JUNCTION J8 : CAUTION! ACTIVE U-BAHN LINE. NOTIFY U-BAHN OPS BEFORE ACCESS.]\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}It looks like a direct route to the underground U-Bahn station... one that completely bypasses the route that you took in."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​舱门​上用​粗犷​的​红色​字体​喷涂​着​几行​文字​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​[​通往​J4​设备​交汇点​通道​]​\n"
"​[​通往​J8​设备​交汇点​通道​：​注意​！​地下​轨道​线路​运行​中​。​进入​前须​通知​轨道交通​运营​中心​。​]​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​这​似乎​是​通往​地下​轨道​车站​的​捷径​……​完全​绕开​了​你们​进来​的​路线​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} cang1 men2 shang4 yong4 cu1guang3 de5 hong2se4 zi4ti3 pen1 tu2 zhao2 ji1 xing2 wen2zi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"[tong1wang3 J4 she4bei4 jiao1 hui4 dian3 tong1dao4]\n"
"[tong1wang3 J8 she4bei4 jiao1 hui4 dian3 tong1dao4：zhu4yi4！di4xia4 gui3dao4 xian4lu4 yun4xing2 zhong4。jin4ru4 qian2 xu1 tong1zhi1 gui3dao4jiao1tong1 yun4ying2 zhong1xin1。]\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4 si4hu1 shi4 tong1wang3 di4xia4 gui3dao4 che1zhan4 de5 jie2jing4……wan2quan2 rao4 kai1 le5 ni3men5 jin4lai2 de5 lu4xian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a blur of motion, and the haggard form of Green Winters lumbers into frame.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Suspicions confirmed. Schäfer dead. Christ.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Winters reaches a shaking hand off-camera. A moment later, it returns clutching a cheap plastic drinking glass. \n"
"\n"
"He gulps something down, wipes his mouth with the back of his hand, and takes a deep breath.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​屏幕​模糊​了​一下​，​随后​格林​·​温特斯​憔悴​的​身影​出现​在​画面​中​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怀疑​得到​了​证实​。​舍费尔​死​了​。​老天​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​温特斯​颤抖​着​把手​伸向​镜头​外​。​过​了​一会儿​，​他​的​手​又​伸​了​回来​，​还​攥​着​一个​廉价​的​塑料​酒杯​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​他大口​喝​着​东西​，​用​手背​擦​了​擦​嘴​，​深吸​了​一口气​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ping2mu4 mo2hu5 le5 yi1xia4，sui2hou4 ge2lin2 · Wen1te4si1 qiao2cui4 de5 shen1ying3 chu1xian4 zai4 hua4mian4 zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"huai2yi2 de2dao4 le5 zheng4shi2。she3 fei4 er3 si3 le5。lao3tian1。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 chan4dou3 zhao2 ba3shou3 shen1 xiang4 jing4tou2 wai4。guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，ta1 de5 shou3 you4 shen1 le5 hui2lai5，hai2 zuan4 zhao2 yi1ge5 lian2jia4 de5 su4liao4 jiu3bei1。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 dai4 kou3 he4 zhao2 dong1xi1，yong4 shou3bei4 ca1 le5 ca1 zui3，shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a brief pause as Mettbach considers your request. Finally he nods with a grunt.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Better."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​梅特​巴赫​停顿​了​一会儿​，​考虑​着​你​的​请求​。​最后​，​他​咕哝​着​点​了​点头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​还​差不多​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mei2 te4 ba1he4 ting2dun4 le5 yi1hui4r5，kao3lu:4 zhao2 ni3 de5 qing3qiu2。zui4hou4，ta1 gu1nong5 zhao2 dian3 le5 dian3tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 hai2 cha4bu5duo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a brief pause, then the IC flashes twice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"ACCESS GRANTED."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​短暂​沉默​后​，​IC​程序​闪烁​了​两次​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​准许​通过​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} duan3zan4 chen2mo4 hou4，IC cheng2xu4 shan3shuo4 le5 liang3 ci4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhun3xu3 tong1guo4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a brief pause, then the Rammbock boss yells out a response.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You've got yourselves a deal!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​稍作​停顿​后​，​撞锤​帮​的​老大​喊叫​着​回应​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​成交​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} shao1 zuo4 ting2dun4 hou4，zhuang4 chui2 bang1 de5 lao3da4 han3jiao4 zhao2 hui2ying4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cheng2jiao1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a brief pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Who the hell is this?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​对话​那头​停顿​了​一下​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​谁​啊​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} dui4hua4 na4 tou2 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shei2 a1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a brief pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yep, it's all looking good on my end... nicely done, chief!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​片刻​沉默​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​我​这边​看起来​都​没​问题​……​干得​漂亮​，​头儿​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pian4ke4 chen2mo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，wo3 zhe4bian1 kan4qi3lai5 dou1 mei2 wen4ti2……gan4 de2 piao4liang5，tou2r5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a buzzing sound from Paul's wrist. He lifts his hand to look at his PDA.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...And, as luck would have it, Frau Müller has arrived.\n"
"\n"
"Best of luck at the meeting, $(l.name). Remember... this is urgent. We *need* that money."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​保罗​的​手腕​传来​一阵​嗡嗡声​，​他​抬起​手看​了​看​他​的​PDA​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​正好​，​穆勒​女士​也​到​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​祝​你​会面​愉快​，​$(l.name)​。​记住​……​事态​紧急​，​我们​*​急需​*​那笔​钱​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} bao3luo2 de5 shou3wan4 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 weng1weng1sheng1，ta1 tai2qi3 shou3 kan4 le5 kan4 ta1 de5 PDA。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……zheng4hao3，mu4 lei1 nu:3shi4 ye3 dao4 le5。\n"
"\n"
"zhu4 ni3 hui4mian4 yu2kuai4，$(l.name)。ji4zhu5……shi4tai4 jin3ji2，wo3men5*ji2xu1*na4 bi3 qian2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a calmness to her voice, a softness to her expression that you haven't seen before.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I have some business to take care of. A responsibility that I've been ignoring. \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) helped me to see that."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​的​声音​带​着​平静​，​神情​间​透​着​一种​你​从未见过​的​温柔​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​有些​事情​要​处理​。​一份​我​一直​忽视​的​责任​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​帮助​我​意识​到​了​这​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 ping2jing4，shen2qing2 jian1 tou4 zhao2 yi1zhong3 ni3 cong2 wei4 jian4 guo4 de5 wen1rou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 you3xie1 shi4qing5 yao4 chu3li3。yi1 fen4 wo3 yi1zhi2 hu1shi4 de5 ze2ren4。\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name) bang1zhu4 wo3 yi4shi2 dao4 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a camera cut, and you find yourself looking at a young, handsome Dr. Adrian Vauclair. He wears a slight smile on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh. They're talking, are they? What a terrible shame."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​画面​一转​，​屏幕​上​出现​了​年轻​帅气​的​阿德里安​·​沃​克莱尔​博士​。​他​脸上​挂​着​淡淡的​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​噢​，​他们​开始​说闲话​了​？​那可真​是​遗憾​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} hua4mian4 yi1 zhuai3，ping2mu4 shang4 chu1xian4 le5 nian2qing1 shuai4qi5 de5 E1de2li3an1 · Wo4ke4lai2er3 bo2shi4。ta1 lian3 shang4 gua4 zhao2 dan4 dan4 de5 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"o1，ta1men5 kai1shi3 shuo1xian2hua4 le5？na4 ke3 zhen1 shi4 yi2han4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause before Eiger speaks. When she does, her voice comes out dull and flat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​艾格尔​沉默​良久​才​开口​。​她​的​声音​沉闷​而​平淡​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么​意思​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Ai4ge2er3 chen2mo4 liang2jiu3 cai2 kai1kou3。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 chen2men4 er2 ping2dan4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shen2me5 yi4si5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause before he responds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, um, you recognized the fact that I needed your help... and then you, uh... volunteered... because you're a good leader?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​停顿​良久​，​他​才​终于​回话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​，​你​意识​到​我​需要​你​的​帮助​……​然后​你​……​自愿​帮忙​……​因为​你​是​个​出色​的​领袖​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ting2dun4 liang2jiu3，ta1 cai2 zhong1yu2 hui2hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4，ni3 yi4shi2 dao4 wo3 xu1yao4 ni3 de5 bang1zhu4……ran2hou4 ni3……zi4yuan4 bang1mang2……yin1wei4 ni3 shi4 ge4 chu1se4 de5 ling3xiu4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause before she replies.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nobody wants to see that man rotting in the ground more than I do. But from what we've seen here tonight, I suspect that Harrow isn't the real power here any more."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​之后​，​她​才​终于​开口​回答​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没有​人比​我​更​希望​看到​那个​男人​不得好死​。​但​从​我们​今晚​所​见​而言​，​我​怀疑​哈罗​已经​不再​是​这里​的​主宰者​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3 zhi1hou4，ta1 cai2 zhong1yu2 kai1kou3 hui2da2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2you3 ren2 bi3 wo3 geng1 xi1wang4 kan4dao4 na4ge5 nan2ren2 bu4 de2 hao3 si3。dan4 cong2 wo3men5 jin1wan3 suo3 jian4 er2yan2，wo3 huai2yi2 ha1luo2 yi3jing1 bu4zai4 shi4 zhe4li3 de5 zhu3zai3zhe3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause before she responds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You'll need to be more specific."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​，​随后​她​终于​说话​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​需要​更​具体​一点​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3，sui2hou4 ta1 zhong1yu2 shuo1hua4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xu1yao4 geng1 ju4ti3 yi1dian3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause before she speaks again. When she does, her voice sounds strained.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"At the very beginning of this thing, $(l.name) agreed that Harrow needed to die."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​，​随后​她​再次​开口​说话​。​她​的​声音​带​着​几分​勉强​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​事情​一​开始​的​时候​，​$(l.name)​就​同意​除掉​哈罗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3，sui2hou4 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 ji3fen1 mian3qiang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 yi1 kai1shi3 de5 shi2hou5，$(l.name) jiu4 tong2yi4 chu2diao4 ha1luo2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause before she speaks again. When she does, her voice sounds strained.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"At the very beginning of this thing, we both agreed that Harrow needs to die. I still want that... I want to bury my claws in his belly and pull his entrails out for what he did to me, and to all of the other kids like me.\n"
"\n"
"But from what we've seen here tonight, I suspect that Harrow isn't the real power here any more."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​，​随后​她​再次​开口​说话​。​她​的​声音​带​着​几分​勉强​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​事情​一​开始​的​时候​，​我们​都​同意​哈罗​必须​去​死​。​我​仍然​有​这个​想法​……​我​想​用​利爪​捅进​他​的​肚子​，​掏出​他​的​五脏六腑​—​—​为​他​当年​对​我​所​做​的​事​，​以及​对​所有​像​我​这样​的​孩子​所​做​的​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​从​我们​今晚​所​见​而言​，​我​怀疑​哈罗​已经​不再​是​这里​的​主宰者​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3，sui2hou4 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 dai4 zhao2 ji3fen1 mian3qiang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4qing5 yi1 kai1shi3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3men5 dou1 tong2yi4 ha1luo2 bi4xu1 qu4 si3。wo3 reng2ran2 you3 zhe4ge5 xiang3fa3……wo3 xiang3 yong4 li4zhao3 tong3 jin4 ta1 de5 du4zi5，tao1chu1 ta1 de5 wu3zang4liu4fu3——wei2 ta1 dang1nian2 dui4 wo3 suo3 zuo4 de5 shi4，yi3ji2 dui4 suo3you3 xiang4 wo3 zhe4yang4 de5 hai2zi5 suo3 zuo4 de5 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 cong2 wo3men5 jin1wan3 suo3 jian4 er2yan2，wo3 huai2yi2 ha1luo2 yi3jing1 bu4zai4 shi4 zhe4li3 de5 zhu3zai3zhe3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause, and then the initiate looks to you. Screwing up her courage, she speaks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Can... can I ask you a question?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​后​，​学徒​看向​你​。​她​鼓起勇气​，​开口​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​可以​问​你​一个​问题​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3 hou4，xue2tu2 kan4 xiang4 ni3。ta1 gu3qi3yong3qi4，kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 ke3yi3 wen4 ni3 yi1ge5 wen4ti2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause, punctuated only by the muffled sound of Jana weeping into her hands. Then Duerr speaks.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your audition is only halfway finished, $(l.name). I'll expect to see you directly, unless you object...?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​长时间​的​沉默​，​唯有​简娜​埋​在​掌心​抽泣​的​闷响​。​随后​杜尔​开口​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​的​试镜​只​完成​了​一半​，​$(l.name)​。​我​期待​着​与​你​本人​见面​，​除非​你​决定​拒绝​……​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} zhang3 shi2 jian1 de5 chen2mo4，wei2you3 Jian3na4 mai2 zai4 zhang3xin1 chou1qi4 de5 men1 xiang3。sui2hou4 du4 er3 kai1kou3 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 de5 shi4jing4 zhi3 wan2cheng2 le5 yi1ban4，$(l.name)。wo3 qi1dai4 zhao2 yu4 ni3 ben3ren2 jian4mian4，chu2fei1 ni3 jue2ding4 ju4jue2……？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause, then the voice warbles out again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Albert?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​，​然后​声音​又​传​了​过来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​阿尔伯特​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3，ran2hou4 sheng1yin1 you4 chuan2 le5 guo4lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……a1er3bo2te4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, she shrugs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Fair enough, I suppose. But a word of advice: don't take too much on yourself. Spread the responsibility around."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​最后​，​她​耸耸肩​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​。​但​听​我​一句​忠告​：​不要​独揽大权​，​也​让​别人​分担​一些​责任​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。\n"
"\n"
"zui4hou4，ta1 song3 song3 jian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1。dan4 ting1 wo3 yi1ju4 zhong1gao4：bu4yao4 du2 lan3 dai4 quan2，ye3 rang4 bie2ren5 fen1dan1 yi1xie1 ze2ren4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause. Glory stares into Marta's eyes, her expression unreadable.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't feel much any more, Marta. Most of the time, I'm completely numb. But for you, I can make an exception.\n"
"\n"
"I *hate* you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​格洛丽​凝视着​玛​尔塔​的​双眼​，​神情​难以捉摸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​，​我​的​内心​已经​没什么​感觉​了​。​大多数​时候​，​我​都​处于​完全​麻木​的​状态​。​但​你​对​我​而言​是​个​例外​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​*​恨​*​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。Ge2luo4li2 ning2 shi4 zhao2 Ma3er3ta3 de5 shuang1yan3，shen2qing2 nan2yi3zhuo1mo1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，wo3 de5 nei4xin1 yi3jing1 mei2shen2me5 gan3jue2 le5。da4duo1shu4 shi2hou5，wo3 dou1 chu3yu2 wan2quan2 ma2mu4 de5 zhuang4tai4。dan4 ni3 dui4 wo3 er2yan2 shi4 ge4 li4wai4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3*hen4*ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, I'm going to let you in. But be cool, okay? I mean that! No funny stuff!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​我​让​你​进来​。​但​你​不准​搞​事情​，​好​吧​？​我​是​认真​的​！​别来​什么​花样​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 rang4 ni3 jin4lai2。dan4 ni3 bu4zhun3 gao3 shi4qing5，hao3 ba1？wo3 shi4 ren4zhen1 de5！bie4 lai2 shen2me5 hua1yang4！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I don't like anything about this. But at the end of the day, I guess that it's your call.\n"
"\n"
"Make the right one, for all of our sakes."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​一点​也​不​喜欢​这样​。​但​说到底​，​这​是​你​的​决定​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​看​在​大家​的​份​上​，​希望​你​能​慎之又慎​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 yi1dian3 ye3 bu4 xi3huan5 zhe4yang4。dan4 shuo1dao4di3，zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 jue2ding4。\n"
"\n"
"kan4 zai4 da4jia1 de5 fen4 shang4，xi1wang4 ni3 neng2 shen4 zhi1 you4 shen4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's clear that there's more going on here than we know. But we're on a run - this isn't the right time to argue about it.\n"
"\n"
"Whatever decision you make, we'll back you. I just hope that we don't come to regret it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​情况​显然​比​我们​知道​的​要​复杂​。​但​我们​在​出​任务​，​现在​不是​争论​的​时候​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不管​你​做​什么​决定​，​我们​都​支持​你​，​只​希望​你​不要​让​我们​后悔​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing2kuang4 xian3ran2 bi3 wo3men5 zhi1dao4 de5 yao4 fu4za2。dan4 wo3men5 zai4 chu1 ren4wu5，xian4zai4 bu4shi4 zheng1lun4 de5 shi2hou5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4guan3 ni3 zuo4 shen2me5 jue2ding4，wo3men5 dou1 zhi1chi2 ni3，zhi3 xi1wang4 ni3 bu4yao4 rang4 wo3men5 hou4hui3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a long pause.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You don't mean...?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沉默​良久​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​该​不会​是​说​……​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} chen2mo4 liang2jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 gai1 bu4hui4 shi4 shuo1……？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a loud burst of static from your commlink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"That takes care of that! All locked up tight, and you should be clear to make your exit."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​通讯​链里​突然​传来​一阵​刺耳​的​杂音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这样​就​搞定​了​！​周围​封锁​完毕​，​你们​可以​安全​离开​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 li3 tu1ran2 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 ci4er3 de5 za2yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4yang4 jiu4 gao3ding4 le5！zhou1wei2 feng1suo3 wan2bi4，ni3men5 ke3yi3 an1quan2 li2kai1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a moment of silence. Then Dietrich speaks up.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, in my book, this doesn't change anything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​片刻​沉默​。​随后​迪​特里​希​开口​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​依我看​，​该​干嘛​干嘛​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pian4ke4 chen2mo4。sui2hou4 Di2te4li3xi1 kai1kou3 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1wo3kan4，gai1 gan4ma2 gan4ma2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a pause before she responds.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Yes. It's a definite possibility.\n"
"\n"
"When I was Harrow's second, I practically lived in that room."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​沉默​了​一会儿​才​开口​回答​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​是​的​。​很​有​可能​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​还是​哈罗​的​副手​时​，​其实​就​住​在​这个​房间​里​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 chen2mo4 le5 yi1hui4r5 cai2 kai1kou3 hui2da2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……shi4 de5。hen3 you3 ke3neng2。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 hai2shi5 ha1luo2 de5 fu4shou3 shi2，qi2shi2 jiu4 zhu4 zai4 zhe4ge5 fang2jian1 li3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a pause, then Amsel continues.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)... there's no easy way to say this.\n"
"\n"
"I'm afraid that the Knight Errant High Threat Response Team is on its way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​阿姆​泽​尔顿​了​一下​，​然后​接着​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​……​你​要​做好​心理准备​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​恐怕​游侠​骑士​高危​应急​小组​已经​在​路上​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} E1mu3ze2er3 dun4 le5 yi1xia4，ran2hou4 jie1zhe5 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)……ni3 yao4 zuo4 hao3 xin1 li3 zhun3 bei4。\n"
"\n"
"kong3pa4 you2Xia2qi2shi4 gao1wei1 ying4ji2 xiao3zu3 yi3jing1 zai4 lu4shang5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a pause, then Blitz looks you in the eye.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, and, uh, chief... do you have anything that you want to say to me? Maybe a little something about trusting my word over that of a gangland stooge? That kind of thing?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​片刻​沉默​。​随后​布里​茨​看​向​你​的​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​呃​，​头儿​……​你​还有​什么​要​和​我​说​的​吗​？​比如​相信​我​而​不是​相信​那个​混蛋​黑帮​走狗​？​之类​的​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pian4ke4 chen2mo4。sui2hou4 Bu4li3ci2 kan4 xiang4 ni3 de5 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e4，tou2r5……ni3 hai2you3 shen2me5 yao4 he4 wo3 shuo1 de5 ma5？bi3ru2 xiang1xin4 wo3 er2 bu4shi4 xiang1xin4 na4ge5 hun2dan4 hei1bang1 zou3gou3？zhi1lei4 de5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a pause, then Eiger's voice crackles out of the commlink again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)? Did I hear you right?\n"
"\n"
"You’re putting the *rookie* in command? "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​过​了​一会儿​，​艾格尔​的​声音​才​从​通讯​链中​断断续续​地​传出​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​？​我​没​听错​吧​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​要​把​指挥权​交给​这个​*​菜鸟​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} guo4 le5 yi1hui4r5，Ai4ge2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 cai2 cong2 tong1xun4 lian4 zhong4 duan4duan4xu4xu4 de5 chuan2chu1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)？wo3 mei2 ting1cuo4 ba1？\n"
"\n"
"ni3 yao4 ba3 zhi3 hui1 quan2 jiao1gei3 zhe4ge5*cai4niao3*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a pause. When he speaks again, his tone is guarded.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"What do you mean by that?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​片刻​沉默​。​当​他​再次​开口​时​，​语气​中​充满​了​戒备​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​这​是​什么​意思​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} pian4ke4 chen2mo4。dang1 ta1 zai4ci4 kai1kou3 shi2，yu3qi4 zhong4 chong1man3 le5 jie4bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 zhe4 shi4 shen2me5 yi4si5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is a short pause, then he replies in a bemused voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, you've piqued my curiosity. I'm not an unreasonable man.\n"
"\n"
"So go ahead. Make your pitch."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​停​了​一下​，​随后​用​戏谑​的​语气​回答​道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​行​吧​，​你​勾起​了​我​的​好奇心​。​我​也​不是​不讲理​的​人​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​说说看​，​你​有​什么​提议​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2 le5 yi1xia4，sui2hou4 yong4 xi4xue4 de5 yu3qi4 hui2da2 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xing2 ba1，ni3 gou1qi3 le5 wo3 de5 hao4qi2xin1。wo3 ye3 bu4shi4 bu4 jiang3 li3 de5 ren2。\n"
"\n"
"shuo1 shuo1 kan4，ni3 you3 shen2me5 ti2yi4？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is an awkward pause, then Blitz plows on ahead.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, um. You remember those creditors I told you about? \n"
"\n"
"The ones who loaned me all of that money?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​一阵​尴尬​的​沉默​，​然后​布里​茨​又​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗯​，​你​还​记得​我​跟​你​说​过​的​那些​债主​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​就是​那些​借给​我​那么​多钱​的​人​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} yi1zhen4 gan1ga4 de5 chen2mo4，ran2hou4 Bu4li3ci2 you4 ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"en1，ni3 hai2 ji4de5 wo3 gen1 ni3 shuo1 guo4 de5 na4xie1 zhai4zhu3 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"jiu4shi4 na4xie1 jie4gei3 wo3 na4me5 duo1 qian2 de5 ren2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is another burst of static from your commlink. Blitz's panicked voice shouts into your ear.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"There's someone in here with me, chief! He's messing with the turret controls... hey! Get away from that!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​通讯器​里​又​传来​一阵​杂音​。​布里​茨​惊慌失措​的​声音​在​你​耳边​嘶吼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​这里​还有​别人​，​头儿​！​他​想​夺取​炮塔​控制权​……​喂​！​别碰​那个​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} tong1 xun4 qi4 li3 you4 chuan2lai2 yi1zhen4 za2yin1。Bu4li3ci2 jing1huang1shi1cuo4 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4 ni3 er3 bian1 si1hou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhe4li3 hai2you3 bie2ren5，tou2r5！ta1 xiang3 duo2qu3 pao4ta3 kong4zhi4quan2……wei2！bie4 peng4 na4ge5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There is another long pause, and Glory becomes more animated.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Anyway. I turned fourteen. I Awakened."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​又​是​一段​漫长​的​沉默​，​随后​格洛丽​变得​活跃​了​些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​总之​，​我​十四岁​的​时候​觉醒​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you4 shi4 yi1 duan4 man4chang2 de5 chen2mo4，sui2hou4 Ge2luo4li2 bian4de5 huo2yue4 le5 xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zong3zhi1，wo3 shi2 si4 sui4 de5 shi2hou5 jue2xing3 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There's a pause, and you hear the sound of a throat clearing.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So... uh... think we can stop them?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​有​一段​停顿​，​接着​传来​一声​清嗓子​的​声音​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​……​嗯​……​我们​能​阻止​他们​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you3 yi1 duan4 ting2dun4，jie1zhe5 chuan2lai2 yi1sheng1 qing1sang3zi5 de5 sheng1yin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3……en1……wo3men5 neng2 zu3zhi3 ta1men5 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}There’s another moment of silence, then Eiger speaks up.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I’ll go. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​又​是​一阵​沉默​，​然后​艾格尔开​了​口​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我来​起头​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} you4 shi4 yi1zhen4 chen2mo4，ran2hou4 Ai4ge2er3 kai1 le5 kou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 lai2 qi3tou2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Third floor: Hotel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​三层​：​旅馆​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} san1 ceng2：lu:3guan3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}This door is locked by old RFID-style reader and displays the text, "
"\"Level 3 Access Only\". It appears to still be functional.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​这​扇门​由​旧式​射频​读卡器​锁定​，​并​显示​文字​“​仅限​3​级​权限​进入​”​。​该​读卡器​似乎​仍​可​正常​使用​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zhe4 shan1 men2 you2 jiu4shi4 she4pin2 du2ka3qi4 suo3ding4，bing4 xian3shi4 wen2zi4“jin3 xian4 3 ji2 quan2xian4 jin4ru4”。gai1 du2ka3qi4 si4hu1 reng2 ke3 zheng4chang2 shi3yong4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}This elf has clearly seen better days. His skin is weathered and emaciated, as though it has been stretched too tightly over his frame. Track marks line the crooks of his arms, and dirty bandages wrap his knuckles.\n"
"\n"
"Despite all of this, he seems cheerful enough. The elf fixes his twinkling, bugged-out eyes on yours and offers you a broad smile, displaying a set of impossibly white teeth. When he speaks to you, his voice is surprisingly deep.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
