"{{GM}} zhe4ge5 jing1ling2 xian3ran2 jing1li4 le5 bu4shao3 cang1sang1。ta1 de5 pi2fu1 zhou4suo1 qiao2cui4，jiu4 xiang4 bei4 jin3jin3 beng3 zai4 zhe4 ju4 pi2nang2 zhi1shang4。ta1 de5 bi4wan1 shang4 you3 yi1 dao4 dao4 shang1hen2，zhi3guan1jie2 shang4 chan2 zhao2 zang1xi1xi1 de5 beng1dai4。\n"
