"​哦​，​你好​。​我们​是不是​挡路​了​……​？​可​不能​耽误​你​工作​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} kan4dao4 ni3 de5 zhi4fu2，ta1 zhou4 le5 zhou4 bi2zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"e2，ni3hao3。wo3men5 shi4bu5shi4 dang3lu4 le5……？ke3 bu4neng2 dan1wu5 ni3 gong1zuo4 a1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Use Ullrich's key.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​使用​乌尔里​希​的​钥匙​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shi3yong4 wu1 er3 li3 xi1 de5 yao4shi5。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Use a Level 3 Access card.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​使用​3​级​门禁卡​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shi3yong4 3 ji2 men2 jin1 ka3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Use a keycard.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​使用​门禁卡​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shi3yong4 men2 jin1 ka3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Use his leverage against him and pull him into your punch.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​借机​把​他​的​身体​拽​向​你​，​同时​挥拳​打​去​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} jie4ji1 ba3 ta1 de5 shen1ti3 zhuai1 xiang4 ni3，tong2shi2 hui1 quan2 da3 qu4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Use the comm panel again.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​再次​使用​通讯​面板​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} zai4ci4 shi3yong4 tong1xun4 mian4ban3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Use the comm panel.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​使用​通讯​面板​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shi3yong4 tong1xun4 mian4ban3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Use the keypad.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​使用​小键盘​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shi3yong4 xiao3 jian4 pan2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair brings his cigarette to his mouth and inhales sharply, holding it for a long moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, my friend. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​将​香烟​送到​嘴边​，​深深​吸​了​一口​，​然后​屏息​良久​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​我​的​朋友​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 jiang1 xiang1yan1 song4 dao4 zui3 bian1，shen1shen1 xi1 le5 yi1kou3，ran2hou4 bing3xi1 liang2jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3 de5 peng2you5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair clenches his jaw.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Good or bad is immaterial. I do what is *necessary.* "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​咬紧​下颌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​与​坏​无关紧要​。​我​做​的​是​*​必要​*​之​事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 yao3 jin3 xia4he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 yu4 huai4 wu2guan1jin3yao4。wo3 zuo4 de5 shi4*bi4yao4*zhi1 shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair clenches his jaw.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I am doing what is *necessary.* And in case you've forgotten, *you* are trapped and powerless to do anything."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​咬紧​下颌​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​做​的​是​*​必要​*​之​事​。​而且​我要​提醒​一下​，​你们​现在​被关​了​起来​，​根本无法​做​任何​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 yao3 jin3 xia4he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zuo4 de5 shi4*bi4yao4*zhi1 shi4。er2qie3 wo3 yao4 ti2xing3 yi1xia4，ni3men5 xian4zai4 bei4 guan1 le5 qi3lai5，gen1 ben3 wu2 fa3 zuo4 ren4he2 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair continues his work.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, that. \n"
"\n"
"That's simple enough..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​没有​停下​手中​的​工作​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这个​啊​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​非常简单​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 mei2you3 ting2xia4 shou3 zhong4 de5 gong1zuo4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4ge5 a1。\n"
"\n"
"fei1 chang2 jian3 dan1……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair covers his face with his pale, nicotine-stained hands. Groans.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...You are correct. I was the one who sent APEX and Audran after you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​用​他​沾满​尼古丁​的​苍白​双手​捂住​脸​，​发出​呻吟声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​你​说​得​没错​。​是​我​派​APEX​和​奥​德兰​去​找​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 yong4 ta1 zhan1man3 ni2gu3ding1 de5 cang1bai2 shuang1shou3 wu3zhu4 lian3，fa1chu1 shen1 yin2 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4。shi4 wo3 pai4 APEX he4 Ao4de2lan2 qu4 zhao3 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair covers his face with his pale, nicotine-stained hands. Groans.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes. That was me.\n"
"\n"
"I was the one who sent APEX and Audran after you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​用​他​沾满​尼古丁​的​苍白​双手​捂住​脸​，​发出​呻吟声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​说​得​没错​，​就是​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​我​派​APEX​和​奥​德兰​去​找​你​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 yong4 ta1 zhan1man3 ni2gu3ding1 de5 cang1bai2 shuang1shou3 wu3zhu4 lian3，fa1chu1 shen1 yin2 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 shuo1 de2 mei2cuo4，jiu4shi4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"shi4 wo3 pai4 APEX he4 Ao4de2lan2 qu4 zhao3 ni3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair fixes the ork with a hateful stare.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Never, Audran. I will *not* be a part of this!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​向​兽​人​投去​怨恨​的​目光​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​绝不​，​奥​德兰​。​我​*​不会​*​做​这​一切​的​帮凶​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 xiang4 shou4 ren2 tou2 qu4 yuan4hen4 de5 mu4guang1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jue2bu4，Ao4de2lan2。wo3*bu4hui4*zuo4 zhe4 yi1qie4 de5 bang1xiong1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair looks amused.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Mistakes?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He uses the tip of his cigarette to gesture at the glass.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So says the career criminal trapped in the containment room."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​看起来​有些​忍俊不禁​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​错误​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​用​烟头​指​了​指​玻璃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​被关​在​收容​室里​的​职业​罪犯​也​好意思​这么​和​我​说话​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 kan4qi3lai5 you3xie1 ren3jun4bu4jin1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"cuo4wu4？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yong4 yan1tou2 zhi3 le5 zhi3 bo1li5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bei4 guan1 zai4 shou1rong2 shi4 li3 de5 zhi2ye4 zui4fan4 ye3 hao3yi4si5 zhe4me5 he4 wo3 shuo1hua4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair looks haggard. His eyes are heavily bagged and bloodshot, and his hair is mussed. He holds a cigarette in an unsteady hand.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hermie. It's me.\n"
"\n"
"I can't sleep."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​面容​憔悴​。​他​的​眼睛​布满​血丝​，​头发​蓬乱​，​颤抖​的​手指​夹​着​一根​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​，​是​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​睡不着​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 mian4rong2 qiao2cui4。ta1 de5 yan3jing5 bu4man3 xue4si1，tou2fa5 peng2luan4，chan4dou3 de5 shou3zhi3 jia1 zhao2 yi1 gen1 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3，shi4 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shui4 bu4 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair nods, then looks away from the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, Hermie. I'll try."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​点点头​，​目光​移​向​一边​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​赫米​。​我会​试试​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 dian3 dian3 tou2，mu4guang1 yi2 xiang4 yi1bian1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，he4 mi3。wo3 hui4 shi4 shi4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair remains silent for some time. Finally, the old man begins to speak. He sounds hollowed-out. Gutted.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"For over forty years, I ignored the rest of the world. I ignored the media and the military, the Board of Directors at Diehl and my little brother. \n"
"\n"
"No - *especially* my little brother. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​沉默​了​许久​。​终于​，​这位​老人​开口​了​。​他​的​声音​听​起来​空洞​无力​，​仿佛​被​掏空​了​一般​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​四十多年​来​，​我​一直​无视​外界​的​一切​。​我​无视​了​媒体​和​军队​，​无视​了​迪尔​防务​的​董事会​，​也​无视​了​我​的​弟弟​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​—​—​*​尤其​*​是​我​的​弟弟​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 chen2mo4 le5 xu3jiu3。zhong1yu2，zhe4wei4 lao3ren2 kai1kou3 le5。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 ting1 qi3lai5 kong1dong4 wu2li4，fang3fu2 bei4 tao1kong1 le5 yi1ban1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"si4 shi2 duo1 nian2 lai2，wo3 yi1zhi2 wu2shi4 wai4jie4 de5 yi1qie4。wo3 wu2shi4 le5 mei2ti3 he4 jun1dui4，wu2shi4 le5 Di2er3fang2wu4 de5 dong3shi4hui4，ye3 wu2shi4 le5 wo3 de5 di4di5。\n"
"\n"
"bu4——*you2qi2*shi4 wo3 de5 di4di5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair rubs his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I can still smell the smoke, Hermie. It's almost a year later, and I can still taste the stench of burning corpses.\n"
"\n"
"When I sleep, I can hear the sirens and the screams. There is no sound in this world as horrible as a burn victim's screams."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​揉​揉​眼睛​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​还​能​闻到​烟味​，​赫米​。​已经​差不多​一年​了​，​可​我​还​能​闻到​那些​烧焦​尸体​的​恶臭​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​睡觉时​还​能​听到​警笛声​和​尖叫声​。​在​这个​世界​上​，​没有​什么​声音​能比​烧伤​者​的​尖叫声​更​可怕​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 rou2 rou2 yan3jing5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……hai2 neng2 wen2dao4 yan1 wei4，he4 mi3。yi3jing1 cha4bu5duo1 yi1 nian2 le5，ke3 wo3 hai2 neng2 wen2dao4 na4xie1 shao1jiao1 shi1ti3 de5 e4chou4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 shui4 jiao4 shi2 hai2 neng2 ting1dao4 jing3 di2 sheng1 he4 jian1 jiao4 sheng1。zai4 zhe4ge5 shi4jie4 shang4，mei2you3 shen2me5 sheng1yin1 neng2 bi3 shao1shang1 zhe3 de5 jian1 jiao4 sheng1 geng1 ke3pa4 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair shakes his head in exasperation. He looks very, very tired.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Very well. Fine. Money holds no value for me anymore... and it won't for you, either, unless we can find a way to stop what is happening."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​无奈​地摇​了​摇头​。​他​看起来​非常​、​非常​疲惫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​。​钱​对​我​来说​也​没有​什么​价值​了​……​对​你​来说​也​是​如此​，​除非​我们​能​有​办法​阻止​即将​发生​的​事情​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 wu2nai4 de5 yao2 le5 yao2tou2。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 fei1chang2、fei1chang2 pi2bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1。qian2 dui4 wo3 lai2 shuo1 ye3 mei2you3 shen2me5 jia4zhi2 le5……dui4 ni3 lai2 shuo1 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3，chu2fei1 wo3men5 neng2 you3 ban4fa3 zu3zhi3 ji2jiang1 fa1sheng1 de5 shi4qing5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair shakes his head. His smile has disappeared.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You mark my words, Hermie. Within five years, corporations... even *countries*... will fall to these creatures. And the worst part is, nobody will care."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​摇摇头​。​他​的​笑容​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​，​记住​我​的话​。​最多​不​超过​五年​，​各大​公司​……​乃至​各个​*​国家​*​……​都​会​沦为​这些​怪物​的​掌中​之物​。​而​最​糟糕​的​是​，​没人会​在意​这些​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 yao2 yao2 tou2。ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3，ji4zhu5 wo3 de5hua4。zui4duo1 bu4 chao1guo4 wu3 nian2，ge4 dai4 gong1si1……nai3zhi4 ge4ge4*guo2jia1*……dou1 hui4 lun2wei2 zhe4xie1 guai4wu5 de5 zhang3 zhong4 zhi1 wu4。er2 zui4 zao1gao1 de5 shi4，mei2 ren2 hui4 zai4yi4 zhe4xie1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair sighs. Covers his face with his pale, nicotine-stained hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"To help you stop Feuerschwinge.\n"
"\n"
"That is... ironic."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​笑了起来​，​用​他​沾满​尼古丁​的​苍白​双手​捂住​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​帮​你​阻止​火翼​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​还​真是​……​讽刺​啊​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 xiao4 le5 qi3 lai2，yong4 ta1 zhan1man3 ni2gu3ding1 de5 cang1bai2 shuang1shou3 wu3zhu4 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bang1 ni3 zu3zhi3 Huo3yi4。\n"
"\n"
"hai2 zhen1shi5……feng3ci4 a1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair sighs. He looks incredibly tired.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Yes, Hermie. You're right, of course... I mustn't jeopardize my credibility with the masses."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​叹​了​口气​。​他​看起来​十分​疲惫​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​的​，​赫米​。​你​当然​是​对​的​……​我​不能​损害​我​在群众中​的​声誉​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。ta1 kan4qi3lai5 shi2fen1 pi2bei4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 de5，he4 mi3。ni3 dang1ran2 shi4 dui4 de5……wo3 bu4neng2 sun3hai4 wo3 zai4 qun2 zhong4 zhong4 de5 sheng1yu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair sighs. Shuts his eyes tight, brings a shaking hand to his temple.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I'm so sorry. But this sacrifice cannot be helped."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​叹​了​口气​。​他​紧闭​双眼​，​颤抖​着​将​手​按​在​太阳穴​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​很​抱歉​。​但​这项​牺牲​是​不可避免​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。ta1 jin3bi4 shuang1yan3，chan4dou3 zhao2 jiang1 shou3 an4 zai4 tai4yang2xue2 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 hen3 bao4qian4。dan4 zhe4 xiang4 xi1sheng1 shi4 bu4ke3bi4mian3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair sighs. Shuts his eyes tight, brings a shaking hand to his temple.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We all know that is not going to happen.\n"
"\n"
"You are trapped here, impotent to stop this from happening. And it *will* happen."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​叹​了​口气​。​他​紧闭​双眼​，​颤抖​着​将​手​按​在​太阳穴​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我们​都​知道​不会​有​这种​事​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​你们​被困​在​这里​，​无力​阻止​这​一切​发生​。​而​它​*​一定​会​*​发生​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。ta1 jin3bi4 shuang1yan3，chan4dou3 zhao2 jiang1 shou3 an4 zai4 tai4yang2xue2 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3men5 dou1 zhi1dao4 bu4hui4 you3 zhe4zhong3 shi4。\n"
"\n"
"ni3men5 bei4kun4 zai4 zhe4li3，wu2li4 zu3zhi3 zhe4 yi1qie4 fa1sheng1。er2 ta1*yi1ding4 hui4*fa1sheng1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair sighs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Nevertheless, a life is still a life.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He covers his face with his pale, nicotine-stained hands.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sending APEX and Audran after you was my doing, and I accept responsibility for that. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​叹​了​口气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​算了​，​生命​没有​高低贵贱之分​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​沾满​尼古丁​的​苍白​双手​捂住​脸​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​我​派​APEX​和​奥​德兰​去​找​你​的​。​我​对此​愿意​承担​所有​责任​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 tan4 le5 kou3qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"suan4le5，sheng1ming4 mei2you3 gao1 di1 gui4 jian4 zhi1 fen4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 zhan1man3 ni2gu3ding1 de5 cang1bai2 shuang1shou3 wu3zhu4 lian3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 wo3 pai4 APEX he4 Ao4de2lan2 qu4 zhao3 ni3 de5。wo3 dui4 ci3 yuan4yi4 cheng2dan1 suo3you3 ze2ren4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair smiles weakly.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"The honor has been mi--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​虚弱​地笑​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​也​深感​荣幸​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 xu1ruo4 de5 xiao4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 ye3 shen1gan3 rong2xing4 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair stares at you through red-rimmed eyes for a long moment.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"And acting on faith makes for bad science. That is your point, yes?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​用​布满​血丝​的​眼睛​盯​了​你​很​久​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​基于​信仰​行事​不​符合​科学​观​。​这​就是​你​的​观点​，​对​吧​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 yong4 bu4man3 xue4si1 de5 yan3jing5 ding1 le5 ni3 hen3 jiu3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ji1yu2 xin4yang3 xing2shi4 bu4 fu2he2 ke1xue2 guan1。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ni3 de5 guan1dian3，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair starts, and the sudden movement of his arm sends his overflowing ashtray flying from the table in a cloud of ash. A look of dread fills his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Blood... bloody corpse? \n"
"\n"
"What do you mean? \n"
"\n"
"Where is Hermie? Explain yourself!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​猛地​起身​，​这​突如其来​的​动作​让​桌上​的​烟灰缸​飞​了​出去​，​摔​在​地上​扬起​一阵​灰尘​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​血腥​……​尸体​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​什么​意思​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​在​哪里​？​给​我​解释​清楚​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 meng3de5 qi3shen1，zhe4 tu1ru2qi2lai2 de5 dong4zuo4 rang4 zhuo1 shang4 de5 yan1hui1gang1 fei1 le5 chu1qu4，shuai1 zai4 di4shang5 yang2qi3 yi1zhen4 hui1chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xue4xing1……shi1ti3？\n"
"\n"
"shen2me5 yi4si5？\n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3 zai4 na3li3？gei3 wo3 jie3shi4 qing1chu5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair starts, and the sudden movement of his arm sends his overflowing ashtray flying from the table in a cloud of ash. A look of dread fills his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Up until... the end? What do you mean? \n"
"\n"
"Where is Hermie? Explain yourself!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​猛地​起身​，​这​突如其来​的​动作​让​桌上​的​烟灰缸​飞​了​出去​，​摔​在​地上​扬起​一阵​灰尘​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​直到​……​最后​？​什么​意思​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​在​哪里​？​给​我​解释​清楚​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 meng3de5 qi3shen1，zhe4 tu1ru2qi2lai2 de5 dong4zuo4 rang4 zhuo1 shang4 de5 yan1hui1gang1 fei1 le5 chu1qu4，shuai1 zai4 di4shang5 yang2qi3 yi1zhen4 hui1chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhi2dao4……zui4hou4？shen2me5 yi4si5？\n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3 zai4 na3li3？gei3 wo3 jie3shi4 qing1chu5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair starts, and the sudden movement of his arm sends his overflowing ashtray flying from the table in a cloud of ash.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"My brother? Hermie? \n"
"\n"
"It's been years... \n"
"\n"
"Have you seen him? How is he?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​猛地​起身​，​这​突如其来​的​动作​让​桌上​的​烟灰缸​飞​了​出去​，​摔​在​地上​扬起​一阵​灰尘​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​弟弟​？​赫米​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​已经​这么​多年​了​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​见​过​他​吗​？​他​怎么样​了​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 meng3de5 qi3shen1，zhe4 tu1ru2qi2lai2 de5 dong4zuo4 rang4 zhuo1 shang4 de5 yan1hui1gang1 fei1 le5 chu1qu4，shuai1 zai4 di4shang5 yang2qi3 yi1zhen4 hui1chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 di4di5？he4 mi3？\n"
"\n"
"yi3jing1 zhe4me5 duo1nian2 le5……\n"
"\n"
"ni3 jian4 guo4 ta1 ma5？ta1 zen3me5yang4 le5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair stiffens, turning to face you. Anger washes across his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Was it mass murder when America dropped the atomic bomb on Japan? The myopic would say “yes,” just as you are now. \n"
"\n"
"But they did it for a *cause* - to shorten the agony of war. To save the lives of thousands upon thousands of soldiers. "
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​身体​一僵​，​转过身​来​面对​你​。​愤怒​之情​涌​上​他​的​脸庞​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​美国​向​日本​投​下​原子弹​算不算​是​大规模​屠杀​？​目光短浅​的​人会​说​“​是​”​，​就​像​你​现在​这样​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​但​他们​这样​做​是​有​*​原因​*​的​—​—​为了​缩短​战争​的​痛苦​。​为了​拯救​成千上万​士兵​的​生命​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 shen1ti3 yi1 jiang1，zhuai3 guo4 shen1 lai2 mian4dui4 ni3。fen4nu4 zhi1 qing2 yong3 shang4 ta1 de5 lian3pang2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei3guo2 xiang4 ri4ben3 tou2 xia4 yuan2zi3dan4 suan4 bu4 suan4 shi4 da4gui1mo2 tu2sha1？mu4guang1duan3qian3 de5 ren2 hui4 shuo1“shi4”，jiu4 xiang4 ni3 xian4zai4 zhe4yang4。\n"
"\n"
"dan4 ta1men5 zhe4yang4 zuo4 shi4 you3*yuan2yin1*de5——wei4le5 suo1duan3 zhan4zheng1 de5 tong4ku3。wei4le5 zheng3jiu4 cheng2qian1shang4wan4 shi4bing1 de5 sheng1ming4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair stops. Bows his head, and closes his eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I am a man of science, shadowrunner. A better path may exist, but I do not know what it is. I wish that I didn’t have to sacrifice so many. I wish...\n"
"\n"
"I wish that Hermie hadn't had to die."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​停下​脚步​，​低头​闭上​双眼​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​是​个​科学家​，​暗影​狂奔​者​。​或许​存在​更好​的​办法​，​但​我​并​不​知晓​。​我​也​希望​不必​牺牲​这么​多人​。​我​希望​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​希望​赫米​不必​因此​而​死去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 ting2xia4 jiao3bu4，di1tou2 bi4shang5 shuang1yan3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 shi4 ge4 ke1xue2jia1，an4Ying3kuang2Ben1zhe3。huo4xu3 cun2zai4 geng1 hao3 de5 ban4fa3，dan4 wo3 bing4 bu4 zhi1xiao3。wo3 ye3 xi1wang4 bu4bi4 xi1sheng1 zhe4me5 duo1 ren2。wo3 xi1wang4……\n"
"\n"
"wo3 xi1wang4 he4 mi3 bu4bi4 yin1ci3 er2 si3qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair stubs out his last cigarette with a heavy sigh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I will begin the infusion process. \n"
"\n"
"Audran, please make sure our guests here are securely locked away before you come down."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​长叹一声​，​掐灭​了​最后​一支​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​将​正式​开始​注入​流程​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​奥​德兰​，​请​确保​我们​的​客人​会​在​这里​老实​待​着​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 zhang3 tan4 yi1 sheng1，qia1 mie4 le5 zui4hou4 yi1 zhi1 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 jiang1 zheng4shi4 kai1shi3 zhu4ru4 liu2cheng2。\n"
"\n"
"Ao4de2lan2，qing3 que4bao3 wo3men5 de5 ke4ren2 hui4 zai4 zhe4li3 lao3shi5 dai1 zhao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair takes a long drag on his cigarette. The taut muscles in his neck relax somewhat as he lets loose a great stream of smoke.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You helped me save the world once before. Or at least, you didn't stand in my way.\n"
"\n"
"The plan worked. The dragons are dead. But the world is still in trouble... it still needs saving."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​深深​吸​了​口烟​。​当​他​吐​出​一股​浓烟​时​，​颈部​紧绷​的​肌肉​稍稍​放松​了​些​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​曾​帮​我​拯救​过​世界​。​或者说​，​至少​你​没有​阻挠​我​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​计划​成功​了​。​巨龙​已死​。​但​世界​仍处​险境​……​它​依然​需要​拯救​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 shen1shen1 xi1 le5 kou3 yan1。dang1 ta1 tu3 chu1 yi1 gu3 nong2yan1 shi2，jing3bu4 jin3beng1 de5 ji1rou4 shao1shao1 fang4song1 le5 xie1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 ceng2 bang1 wo3 zheng3jiu4 guo4 shi4jie4。huo4 zhe3 shuo1，zhi4shao3 ni3 mei2you3 zu3nao2 wo3。\n"
"\n"
"ji4hua4 cheng2gong1 le5。ju4long2 yi3 si3。dan4 shi4jie4 reng2 chu3 xian3jing4……ta1 yi1ran2 xu1yao4 zheng3jiu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair talks over his brother's interruption.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"We could solve the problem, of course. But we, as a species, are unwilling to invest our energy into problems that aren't staring us right in the face.\n"
"\n"
"As it was with climate change, so it is with dragons. I've accepted that. But you can't ask me to stop caring about it."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​无视​自己​弟弟​的​打断​，​继续​说道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​我们​可以​解决问题​。​但是​，​作为​一个​物种​，​我们​不​愿意​把​精力​投入​到​那些​没有​迫在眉睫​的​问题​上​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​气候变化​是​如此​，​巨龙​也​是​如此​。​我​已经​接受​了​这​一点​。​但​你​不能​要求​我​不再​关心​它​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 wu2shi4 zi4ji3 di4di5 de5 da3duan4，ji4xu4 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，wo3men5 ke3yi3 jie3 jue2 wen4 ti2。dan4shi4，zuo4wei2 yi1ge5 wu4zhong3，wo3men5 bu4 yuan4yi4 ba3 jing1li4 tou2ru4 dao4 na4xie1 mei2you3 po4zai4mei2jie2 de5 wen4ti2 shang4。\n"
"\n"
"qi4hou4bian4hua4 shi4 ru2ci3，ju4long2 ye3 shi4 ru2ci3。wo3 yi3jing1 jie1shou4 le5 zhe4 yi1dian3。dan4 ni3 bu4neng2 yao1qiu2 wo3 bu4zai4 guan1xin1 ta1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair's eyes flare with anger. He lunges towards the glass with surprising speed, despite his age and fragile frame.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hermie was my BROTHER, damn you! My *only* brother!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​眼中​迸发​着​怒火​。​他​以​令人​惊讶​的​速度​朝​玻璃​冲​来​，​尽管​他​年事已高​且​体弱多病​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​是​我​的​弟弟​，​你​这​混蛋​！​我​*​唯一​*​的​弟弟​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 yan3zhong1 beng4fa1 zhao2 nu4huo3。ta1 yi3 ling4ren2 jing1ya4 de5 su4du4 chao2 bo1li5 chong1 lai2，jin3guan3 ta1 nian2shi4yi3gao1 qie3 ti3ruo4duo1bing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3 shi4 wo3 de5 di4di5，ni3 zhe4 hun2dan4！wo3*wei2yi1*de5 di4di5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair's eyes glitter as he stares at the drone. Still clutching his chest, he struggles to speak.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"If you set that thing loose... if you think that it's your *friend*... then you're a bigger fool than I could have imagined.\n"
"\n"
"I... I just don't have the words."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​眼睛​闪烁着​光芒​，​凝视着​那架​无人机​。​他​仍旧​捂着​胸口​，​努力​开口​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​放任​那​东西​自由行动​……​如果​你​认为​它​是​你​的​*​朋友​*​……​那么​你​比​我​想象​中​还要​愚蠢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​实在​无话可说​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 yan3jing5 shan3 shuo4 zhao2 guang1mang2，ning2 shi4 zhao2 na4 jia4 wu2ren2ji1。ta1 reng2jiu4 wu3 zhao2 xiong1kou3，nu3li4 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 fang4ren4 na4 dong1xi1 zi4 you2 xing2 dong4……ru2guo3 ni3 ren4wei2 ta1 shi4 ni3 de5*peng2you5*……na4me5 ni3 bi3 wo3 xiang3xiang4 zhong4 hai2 yao4 yu2chun3。\n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 shi2zai4 wu2hua4ke3shuo1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair's fist slams into the table, sending his cigarette flying in a cascade of sparks and ash.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"NO! \n"
"\n"
"*Nothing* can make that right. \n"
"\n"
"Nothing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​拳头​重重​砸​在​桌子​上​，​香烟​被​震​得​飞​了​出去​，​伴随​着​一串​火花​和​烟灰​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​没什么​*​能​弥补​这​一切​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没什么​可以​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 quan2tou5 chong2chong2 za2 zai4 zhuo1zi5 shang4，xiang1yan1 bei4 zhen4 de2 fei1 le5 chu1qu4，ban4sui2 zhao2 yi1 chuan4 huo3hua1 he4 yan1hui1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4！\n"
"\n"
"*mei2shen2me5*neng2 mi2bu3 zhe4 yi1qie4。\n"
"\n"
"mei2shen2me5 ke3yi3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair's jaw clenches. The muscles of his throat tighten as he forces himself to swallow.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...He would try to stop me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​咬紧​下颌​。​他​强迫​自己​吞咽​时​，​喉咙​的​肌肉​也​随之​紧绷​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​他会​尝试​阻止​我​的​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 yao3 jin3 xia4he2。ta1 qiang3po4 zi4ji3 tun1yan4 shi2，hou2long2 de5 ji1rou4 ye3 sui2zhi1 jin3beng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ta1 hui4 chang2shi4 zu3zhi3 wo3 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair's tone softens again.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hermie, I--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​语气​又​柔和​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赫米​，​我​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 yu3qi4 you4 rou2he2 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"he4 mi3，wo3 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Vauclair's voice is quiet. Soft.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Such is the cry of the cancer patient, unaware of what's killing him. \"I'm fine, not to worry! I'll smoke another cigarette, what's the harm?\"\n"
"\n"
"He doesn't see what's happening. But he winds up dead, all the same."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​沃​克莱尔​的​声音​安静​而​柔和​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​不​了解​自己​病情​的​癌症​患者​通常​也​是​这么​说​的​：​“​我​好​得​很​！​我​就​再​抽​一支​烟​而已​，​能出​什么​事​呢​？​”​\n"
"​\n"
"​他​不​知道​发生​了​什么​，​但​他​还是​会​因此​而​死​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wo4ke4lai2er3 de5 sheng1yin1 an1jing4 er2 rou2he2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bu4 liao3jie3 zi4ji3 bing4qing2 de5 ai2zheng4 huan4zhe3 tong1chang2 ye3 shi4 zhe4me5 shuo1 de5：“wo3 hao3 de2 hen3！wo3 jiu4 zai4 chou1 yi1 zhi1 yan1 er2yi3，neng2 chu1 shen2me5 shi4 ni2？” \n"
"\n"
"ta1 bu4 zhi1dao4 fa1sheng1 le5 shen2me5，dan4 ta1 hai2shi5 hui4 yin1ci3 er2 si3。"

msgid "{{GM}}View all pending and active jobs.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​查看​所有​待处理​和​进行​中​的​差事​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} cha2kan4 suo3you3 dai1 chu3 li3 he4 jin4xing2 zhong4 de5 cha4shi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}View treatment history.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​查看​治疗​历史​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} cha2kan4 zhi4liao2 li4shi3。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Wait for Alexander to act.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​等待​亚历山大​行动​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} deng3dai4 ya4li4shan1da4 xing2dong4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Wait for him to turn around.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​等​他​转身​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} deng3 ta1 zhuan3shen1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Wait.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​等待​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} deng3dai4。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Walk away from the terminal.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​操作​终端​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1 cao1zuo4 zhong1duan1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}}"

msgid "{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}} All right, Dietrich. If that's what you want."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​好​吧​，​迪​特里​希​。​既然​这​是​你​的​选择​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} hao3 ba1，Di2te4li3xi1。ji4ran2 zhe4 shi4 ni3 de5 xuan3ze2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}} Good man."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​好样​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} hao3 yang4 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}} I don't want to announce our presence here unless I "
"have to. Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​不到​万不得已​，​我​不想​暴露​我们​的​存在​。​继续前进​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} bu4dao4 wan4bu4de2yi3，wo3 bu4xiang3 bao4lu4 wo3men5 de5 cun2zai4。ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}} Let's keep moving."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​继续前进​吧​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} ji4 xu4 qian2 jin4 ba1。"

msgid "{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}} Maybe I'll come back for you later."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​我​晚点​回来​找​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} wo3 wan3dian3 hui2lai5 zhao3 ni3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}} Sorry to bother you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​抱歉​打扰​你​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} bao4qian4 da3rao3 ni3。"

msgid "{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}} Yeah, sorry. It was nothing anyway."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​离开​。​{{/GM}}​抱歉​。​本来​也​没什么​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} li2kai1。{{/GM}} bao4qian4。ben3lai2 ye3 mei2shen2me5 de5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Walk away.{{/GM}} You will be mine, vase. It's just a matter of time."
msgstr ""
