"​\n"
"​如果​他​今后​还​需要​处理​任何​“​餐饮​承办​工作​”​，​我​随时​乐意效劳​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ting1dao4 E1mu3ze2er3 de5 ming2zi5 shi2，tu3er3qi2ren2 de5 sheng1yin1 di1 le5 xia4lai5，kou3yin1 ye3 bian4de5 bu4 na4me5 kua1zhang1。ta1 de5 yan3shen2 liu2 lou4 chu1 xin1zhao4bu4xuan1 de5 shen2se4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"a1，hen3 hao3。qing3 xiang4 E1mu3ze2er3 xian1sheng5 biao3da2 wo3 dui4 ta1 hui4gu4 de5 gan3ji1 zhi1 qing2。\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ta1 jin1hou4 hai2 xu1yao4 chu3li3 ren4he2“can1yin3 cheng2ban4 gong1zuo4”，wo3 sui2shi2 le4 yi4 xiao4 lao2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}When he turns to address you again, his voice is level. The shaking in his hands seems to have subsided.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Security will be here soon, and they will take care of you. Do not worry - you will not be harmed.\n"
"\n"
