"least intimidating troll I've ever seen."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​*​那个​*​就是​“​绞肉机​”​？​布里​茨​，​这​算是​我见​过​最​不​吓人​的​巨魔​了​。\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}}*na4ge5*jiu4shi4“jiao3rou4ji1”？Bu4li3ci2，zhe4 suan4shi4 wo3 jian4 guo4 zui4 bu4 xia4ren2 de5 ju4mo2 le5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} And Meat Grinder wants the box, right?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​“​绞肉机​”​想要​这个​盒子​，​对​吧​？\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}}“jiao3rou4ji1” xiang3yao4 zhe4ge5 he2zi5，dui4 ba1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} But nothing. I came out here to bail you out, not to "
"get you a Mystery Box."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​别​但是​了​。​我来​这​是​给​你​擦屁股​的​，​不是​帮​你​弄​什么​谜​匣​的​。\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} bie4 dan4shi4 le5。wo3 lai2 zhe4 shi4 gei3 ni3 ca1pi4gu5 de5，bu4shi4 bang1 ni3 long4 shen2me5 mei4 xia2 de5。"

msgid "{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} Do you even know what the box is, Blitz?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​你​知道​那​盒子​里面​是​什么​吗​，​布里​茨​？\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} ni3 zhi1dao4 na4 he2zi5 li3mian4 shi4 shen2me5 ma5，Bu4li3ci2？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} Don't worry. I won't make you. We're going to kill "
"this thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低声​说道​。​{{/GM}}​别​担心​。​我​不会​让​你​去​做​的​。​我们​会​干掉​这个​东西​。\n"
"{{GM}} di1sheng1 shuo1dao4。{{/GM}} bie4 dan1xin1。wo3 bu4hui4 rang4 ni3 qu4 zuo4 de5。wo3men5 hui4 gan4diao4 zhe4ge5 dong1xi1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} I'm with you there, man. But from the way he's "
"cradling that thing, I don't think he's gonna let go of it willingly."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​我​同意​你​的​说法​。​但​从​他​小心翼翼​的​样子​来看​，​我​不​觉得​他会​自愿​把​它​交​出来​。\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} wo3 tong2yi4 ni3 de5 shuo1fa3。dan4 cong2 ta1 xiao3xin1yi4yi4 de5 yang4zi5 lai2 kan4，wo3 bu4 jue2de5 ta1 hui4 zi4yuan4 ba3 ta1 jiao1 chu1lai2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} It's all right. We're getting you out of here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​没事​了​。​我们​会​把​你​从​这里​弄出去​。\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} mei2shi4 le5。wo3men5 hui4 ba3 ni3 cong2 zhe4li3 long4 chu1 qu4。"

msgid "{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} Okay. I'll give you the \"thumbs\" thing."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​好​吧​，​你​说​的​这个​我​也​同意​。\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} hao3 ba1，ni3 shuo1 de5 zhe4ge5 wo3 ye3 tong2yi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} Remind me, Blitz: what was the purpose of this run?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​布里​茨​，​你​说说看​，​这次​差事​的​目标​是​什么​？\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} Bu4li3ci2，ni3 shuo1 shuo1 kan4，zhe4 ci4 cha4shi4 de5 mu4biao1 shi4 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} That doesn't change the fact that he looks like he's "
"about to keel over right here in the lobby."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​但​他​看起来​还是​像​随时​会​摔倒​的​样子​。\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} dan4 ta1 kan4qi3lai5 hai2shi5 xiang4 sui2shi2 hui4 shuai1dao3 de5 yang4zi5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} Well, I like a mystery as much as the next $(l.guy). "
"Maybe I can find a way to get it away from him."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​我​对​这种​谜团​也​很感兴趣​。​也许​我能​找到​办法​把​它​从​他​手里​弄​走​。\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} wo3 dui4 zhe4zhong3 mi2tuan2 ye3 hen3 gan3 xing4 qu4。ye3xu3 wo3 neng2 zhao3dao4 ban4fa3 ba3 ta1 cong2 ta1 shou3li3 long4 zou3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} What do you think Grinder would do if we took the box "
"from Hasenkamp?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低语​。​{{/GM}}​你​说​如果​我们​从哈森​坎普​手里​把​盒子​抢过来​，​“​绞肉机​”​会​怎么​做​？\n"
"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} ni3 shuo1 ru2guo3 wo3men5 cong2 Ha1sen1kan3pu3 shou3li3 ba3 he2zi5 qiang3 guo4 lai2，“jiao3rou4ji1” hui4 zen3me5 zuo4？"

msgid "{{GM}}Whisper.{{/GM}} What do you want me to do, steal it from him?"
msgstr ""
