"{{GM}} di1yu3。{{/GM}} ni3 xiang3yao4 wo3 zen3me5 zuo4，ba3 ta1 tou1 guo4 lai2 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters cuts his brother off. A new intensity burns in his voice.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Please, big brother. Just drop all of this. Stop hunting the Firewing, and start living your life again!\n"
"\n"
"If you won't do it for yourself, then for Christ's sake, do it for me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​打断​了​哥哥​的​话语​。​他​的​声音​又​紧张​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​哥哥​，​求​你​了​，​放下​这​一切​吧​。​不要​再​执着​于​火翼​，​开始​你​自己​的​生活​吧​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​如果​你​不​愿意​为了​自己​这样​，​那​就​当​是​为了​我​，​好​吗​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 da3duan4 le5 ge1ge5 de5 hua4yu3。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 you4 jin3zhang1 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ge1ge5，qiu2 ni3 le5，fang4xia4 zhe4 yi1qie4 ba1。bu4yao4 zai4 zhi2zhuo2 yu2 Huo3yi4，kai1shi3 ni3 zi4ji3 de5 sheng1huo2 ba1！\n"
"\n"
"ru2guo3 ni3 bu4 yuan4yi4 wei4le5 zi4ji3 zhe4yang4，na4 jiu4 dang1 shi4 wei4le5 wo3，hao3 ma5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters drains the rest of the glass, then tosses it back over his shoulder. A moment later you hear the dull clattering sound of hard plastic on linoleum.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Schäfer's death was tragic. She was a staunch supporter of the F-State. But still, all things considered..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​喝​干杯​中​剩余​的​酒​，​然后​朝​身后​一​丢​。​片刻​之后​，​你​听到​硬​塑料​砸​在​油毡​上​发出​的​沉闷​碰撞​声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​舍费尔​的​死​是​个​悲剧​。​她​是​动荡​带​的​坚定​支持者​。​但是​，​考虑​到​所有​因素​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 he4 gan1bei1 zhong4 sheng4yu2 de5 jiu3，ran2hou4 chao2 shen1hou4 yi1 diu1。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ni3 ting1dao4 ying4 su4liao4 za2 zai4 you2 zhan1 shang4 fa1chu1 de5 chen2men4 peng4zhuang4 sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"she3 fei4 er3 de5 si3 shi4 ge4 bei1ju4。ta1 shi4 dong4dang4 dai4 de5 jian1ding4 zhi1chi2zhe3。dan4shi4，kao3lu:4 dao4 suo3you3 yin1su4……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters fishes for something off-screen. A moment later, his hand reappears clutching a datajack cable.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Better her than me."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​在​屏幕​外​寻找​着​什么​。​片刻​之后​，​他​的​手​再次出现​，​手里​攥​着​一根​数据​插口​线​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​她​死​总比​我​死​了​好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 zai4 ping2mu4 wai4 xun2zhao3 zhao2 shen2me5。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ta1 de5 shou3 zai4 ci4 chu1 xian4，shou3li3 zuan4 zhao2 yi1 gen1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 xian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ta1 si3 zong3 bi3 wo3 si3 le5 hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters fishes for something off-screen. A moment later, his hand reappears clutching a datajack cable.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Better her than me.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He plugs the cable into his head and the screen cuts to static.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​在​屏幕​外​寻找​着​什么​。​片刻​之后​，​他​的​手​再次出现​，​手里​攥​着​一根​数据​插口​线​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​她​死​总比​我​死​了​好​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​把​数据线​插入​自己​的​脑袋​，​屏幕​随即​变回​了​雪花​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 zai4 ping2mu4 wai4 xun2zhao3 zhao2 shen2me5。pian4ke4 zhi1hou4，ta1 de5 shou3 zai4 ci4 chu1 xian4，shou3li3 zuan4 zhao2 yi1 gen1 shu4ju4 cha1kou3 xian4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……ta1 si3 zong3 bi3 wo3 si3 le5 hao3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 shu4ju4xian4 cha1ru4 zi4ji3 de5 nao3dai5，ping2mu4 sui2ji2 bian4hui2 le5 xue3hua1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters grabs a thick, leather-bound tome from a shelf behind him, licks a finger, and begins to leaf through it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"All right, so let's run down the list of major dragons that *could* be helping her."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​从​身后​的​书架上​拿​起​一本​厚厚的​皮封书​，​舔​了​舔​手指​，​开始​翻阅​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​好​吧​，​我要​列出​*​可能​*​会​帮助​她​的​巨龙​名单​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 cong2 shen1hou4 de5 shu1 jia4 shang4 na2 qi3 yi1 ben3 hou4 hou4 de5 pi2 feng1 shu1，tian3 le5 tian3 shou3zhi3，kai1shi3 fan1yue4 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hao3 ba1，wo3 yao4 lie4chu1*ke3neng2*hui4 bang1zhu4 ta1 de5 ju4long2 ming2dan1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters pushes his chair back and slaps the table in front of him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"*This* is why Adrian was always so cagey about the subject of Feuerschwinge after the Dragonfall! He knew for a *fact* that she was alive, even if only technically.\n"
"\n"
"Her body crashed down into the SOX, sure, but she wasn't dead!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​把​椅子​往后​一推​，​拍了拍​面前​的​桌子​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​*​这​*​就是​为什么​阿德里安​在​龙​陨​事件​后​对​有关​火翼​的​话题​总是​讳莫如深​！​他​*​确切​*​地​知道​她​还​活着​，​尽管​只是​理论​上​而已​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​她​的​肉体​确实​坠入​了​萨洛​卢区​，​但​她​并​没有​死​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 ba3 yi3zi5 wang3hou4 yi1 tui1，pai1 le5 pai1 mian4qian2 de5 zhuo1zi5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"*zhe4*jiu4shi4 wei4shen2me5 E1de2li3an1 zai4 long2 yun3 shi4jian4 hou4 dui4 you3guan1 Huo3yi4 de5 hua4ti2 zong3shi4 hui4mo4ru2shen1！ta1*que4qie4*de5 zhi1dao4 ta1 hai2 huo2zhe5，jin3guan3 zhi3shi4 li3lun4 shang4 er2yi3。\n"
"\n"
"ta1 de5 rou4ti3 que4shi2 zhui4ru4 le5 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1，dan4 ta1 bing4 mei2you3 si3！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're hopeless, Adrian. Fine, by all means, keep caring... just keep your conspiracy theories to *yourself.* I'm telling you this for your own sake."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​摇摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​阿德里安​，​你​真是​没救​了​。​行​吧​，​随​你​怎么​关心​去​吧​……​只要​把​你​那些​理论​留在​*​你​自己​*​心里​就行​。​我​说​这些​是​为了​你好​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 yao2 yao2 tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"E1de2li3an1，ni3 zhen1shi5 mei2jiu4 le5。xing2 ba1，sui2 ni3 zen3me5 guan1xin1 qu4 ba1……zhi3yao4 ba3 ni3 na4xie1 li3lun4 liu2 zai4*ni3 zi4ji3*xin1li5 jiu4 xing2。wo3 shuo1 zhe4xie1 shi4 wei4le5 ni3hao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters snorts.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Now you're just being maudlin. Look, Adrian--"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​冷​哼​一声​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​现在​怎么​这么​婆婆妈妈​的​。​听​着​，​阿德里安​—​—\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 leng3 heng1 yi1sheng1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 xian4zai4 zen3me5 zhe4me5 po2po5ma1ma1 de5。ting1 zhao2，E1de2li3an1 — —"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters takes another long pull from his glass, grimaces, and swallows.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Time for me to make my play. Ghost stories or no, missing deckers or no, I've gotta jack into the Matrix and start pulling strings.\n"
"\n"
"The countermeasures that I installed earlier should be more than enough to keep me safe for the twenty minutes I'll be in there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​又​从​酒杯​里​喝​了​一大口​，​苦笑​了​下​，​然后​咽​了​下去​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​该​我​登场​了​。​不管​有没有​鬼故事​，​也​不管​有没有​失踪​的​碟​客​，​我​都​要​骇入​矩阵​，​开始​行动​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​之前​安装​的​反制​措施​应该​足以​保证​我​在​里面​二十分钟​的​安全​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 you4 cong2 jiu3bei1 li3 he4 le5 yi1 dai4 kou3，ku3xiao4 le5 xia4，ran2hou4 yan1 le5 xia4qu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gai1 wo3 deng1chang3 le5。bu4guan3 you3mei2you3 gui3gu4shi5，ye3 bu4guan3 you3mei2you3 shi1zong1 de5 die2 ke4，wo3 dou1 yao4 hai4 ru4 ju3zhen4，kai1shi3 xing2dong4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhi1qian2 an1zhuang1 de5 fan3zhi4 cuo4shi1 ying1gai1 zu2yi3 bao3zheng4 wo3 zai4 li3mian4 er4 shi2 fen4 zhong1 de5 an1quan2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters' expression turns serious. His voice lowers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"It's not just your credibility that I'm worried about. Talk is talk, but sometimes...\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He pauses. Shakes his head.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Sometimes I worry that you're really gonna go back to the SOX.\n"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​的​表情​严肃​起来​。​他​的​声音​变得​低沉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​担心​的​不是​什么​声誉​。​虽说​你​现在​只是​说​说​而已​，​但​有时候​……​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​停顿​了​一下​，​摇​了​摇头​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​有时候​我​真​担心​你​会​回到​萨洛​卢区​那里​去​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 de5 biao3qing2 yan2su4 qi3lai5。ta1 de5 sheng1yin1 bian4de5 di1chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 dan1xin1 de5 bu4shi4 shen2me5 sheng1yu4。sui1shuo1 ni3 xian4zai4 zhi3shi4 shuo1 shuo1 er2yi3，dan4 you3shi2hou5……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ting2dun4 le5 yi1xia4，yao2 le5 yao2tou2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……you3shi2hou5 wo3 zhen1 dan1xin1 ni3 hui4 hui2dao4 Sa4luo4lu2 qu1 na4li5 qu4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Winters' face winks back onto the screen.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"So there you have it. That's what they had to say about Adrian a mere two years after his disappearance.\n"
"\n"
"My brother, the footnote."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​温特斯​的​脸​又​出现​在​屏幕​上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​看到​了​吧​。​这​就是​他们​在​阿德里安​失踪​两年​后​对​他​的​评价​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​的​哥哥​成​了​别人​的​注脚​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Wen1te4si1 de5 lian3 you4 chu1xian4 zai4 ping2mu4 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"kan4dao4 le5 ba1。zhe4 jiu4shi4 ta1men5 zai4 E1de2li3an1 shi1zong1 liang3 nian2 hou4 dui4 ta1 de5 ping2jia4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 de5 ge1ge5 cheng2 le5 bie2ren5 de5 zhu4jiao3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}With a shudder and a plume of black smoke, the generator comes to "
"life.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​随着​一阵​颤动​和​一缕​黑烟​，​发电机​启动​了​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} sui2zhe5 yi1zhen4 chan4dong4 he4 yi1 lu:3 hei1 yan1，fa1dian4ji1 qi3dong4 le5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}With a visible effort, he calms himself.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Look, sorry. I'm not trying to be unpleasant. Its just that I have a huge presentation to give to the board in twenty minutes... I stayed up all night practicing it. And now, I'm so tired that I can't even remember my own name."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​明显​在​努力​让​自己​平静下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​。​我​不是故意​要​表现​得​难​相处​。​只是​二十分钟​后​我​得​向​董事会​做​一场​重要​的​演讲​……​我​熬​了​一整夜​练习​。​现在​累得​连​自己​名字​都​记不清​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ming2xian3 zai4 nu3li4 rang4 zi4ji3 ping2 jing4 xia4 lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4。wo3 bu4 shi4 gu4 yi4 yao4 biao3xian4 de2 nan2 xiang1chu3。zhi3shi4 er4 shi2 fen4 zhong1 hou4 wo3 de2 xiang4 dong3shi4hui4 zuo4 yi1 chang2 zhong4yao4 de5 yan3jiang3……wo3 ao1 le5 yi1 zheng3 ye4 lian4xi2。xian4zai4 lei3 de2 lian2 zi4ji3 ming2zi5 dou1 ji4 bu4 qing1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}With a visible effort, she clamps down on her emotions and calms herself. When she speaks again, her voice is flat.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I took three rounds myself. Had to drag myself back across the Oder-Neisse line into Germany.\n"
"\n"
"I almost died."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​明显​看出​她​在​努力​抑制​自己​的​情绪​，​让​自己​冷静下来​。​当​她​再​开口​时​，​声音​又​变得​单调​平静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​中​了​三枪​，​拖​着​遍体鳞伤​的​身躯​勉强​越过​奥德河​-​尼斯河​线​回到​德国​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​死里逃生​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ming2xian3 kan4chu1 ta1 zai4 nu3li4 yi4zhi4 zi4ji3 de5 qing2xu4，rang4 zi4ji3 leng3 jing4 xia4 lai2。dang1 ta1 zai4 kai1kou3 shi2，sheng1yin1 you4 bian4de5 dan1diao4 ping2jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 zhong4 le5 san1 qiang1，tuo1 zhao2 bian4ti3lin2shang1 de5 shen1qu1 mian3qiang3 yue4guo4 ao4 de2 he2 -ni2 si1 he2 xian4 hui2dao4 de2guo2。\n"
"\n"
"si3li3tao2sheng1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}With a visible effort, she smiles and attempts to regain her composure.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Working a late night, huh?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​露出​微笑​，​明显​在​努力​试图​恢复​平静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​今晚​加班​了​啊​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 lu4chu1 wei1xiao4，ming2xian3 zai4 nu3li4 shi4tu2 hui1fu4 ping2jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jin1wan3 jia1ban1 le5 a1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Without a second's hesitation, he turns his head to shout into his commlink.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"REQUESTING BACKUP! INTRUDERS AT MY POSITION!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​毫不迟疑​地​转过​头​，​对​着​通讯​链​大声​喊道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​请求​支援​！​我​的​位置​有​入侵者​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 hao2bu4chi2yi2 de5 zhuai3 guo4 tou2，dui4 zhao2 tong1xun4 lian4 da4sheng1 han3dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qing3qiu2 zhi1yuan2！wo3 de5 wei4zhi5 you3 ru4qin1zhe3！"

msgid "{{GM}}Without a word, he raises his weapon.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​一言不发​地​举起​武器​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 ju3qi3 wu3qi4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Without a word, she bends to grab something from under her desk. A moment later, she lifts an aluminum briefcase onto the desk.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Your information.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}She flips the case onto the desk, then shoves it toward the camera.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​她​一言不发​地弯​下腰​，​伸手​去​拿​桌子​下​的​某样​东西​。​片刻​后​，​她​举起​一个​铝制​公文箱​放在​桌上​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​是​你​要​的​情报​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​把​箱子​翻倒​在​桌上​，​然后​推向​镜头​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 wan1 xia4yao1，shen1shou3 qu4 na2 zhuo1zi5 xia4 de5 mou3 yang4 dong1xi1。pian4ke4 hou4，ta1 ju3qi3 yi1ge5 lu:3 zhi4 gong1 wen2 xiang1 fang4 zai4 zhuo1 shang4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shi4 ni3 yao4 de5 qing2bao4。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 ba3 xiang1zi5 fan1dao3 zai4 zhuo1 shang4，ran2hou4 tui1 xiang4 jing4tou2。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Without another word, he turns and slaps the side of a Bulldog step van. A second van of the same design rumbles to life a few feet away.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Pile in, people. And be ready... there's rough country between us and the meeting site. We might run into trouble along the way."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​一言不发​地​转身​拍了拍​“​斗牛犬​”​货车​的​车身​。​几​英尺​外​，​另​一辆​同款​货车​也​轰然​发动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​大伙儿​上车​吧​，​做好​准备​……​去​碰头​地点​的​路​不好​走​，​可能​会​遇到​麻烦​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yi1yan2bu4fa1 de5 zhuan3shen1 pai1 le5 pai1“dou3 niu2 quan3” huo4che1 de5 che1shen1。ji1 ying1chi3 wai4，ling4 yi1 liang4 tong2kuan3 huo4che1 ye3 hong1ran2 fa1dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"da4huo3r5 shang4che1 ba1，zuo4 hao3 zhun3bei4……qu4 peng4tou2 di4dian3 de5 lu4 bu4hao3 zou3，ke3neng2 hui4 yu4dao4 ma2fan5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Without waiting for a response, Ullrich takes a step back, then turns his head to shout at the toughs behind him.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"LISTEN UP, BOYS!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​没有​等​你​回应​，​乌尔里​希便​后退​一步​，​转身​朝​身后​的​打手​们​吼道​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​兄弟​们​听​着​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} mei2you3 deng3 ni3 hui2ying4，wu1 er3 li3 xi1 bian4 hou4tui4 yi1 bu4，zhuan3shen1 chao2 shen1hou4 de5 da3shou5 men5 hou3 dao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xiong1di4 men5 ting1 zhao2！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Without waiting for a response, he stubs out his last cigarette.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Audran, watch over our guest, if you will. See to it that $(l.he)'s well treated - $(l.he)'s a friend now. I will begin the Panacea infusion process."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​他​没有​等待​你​的​回答​，​随即​掐灭​了​最后​一支​香烟​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​奥​德兰​，​请​你​代为​照顾​我们​的​客人​。​好生​对待​$(l.he)​—​—​现在​$(l.he)​是​我们​的​朋友​了​。​我​将​正式​开始​“​万能​药​”​的​注入​流程​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 mei2you3 deng3dai4 ni3 de5 hui2da2，sui2ji2 qia1 mie4 le5 zui4hou4 yi1 zhi1 xiang1yan1。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ao4de2lan2，qing3 ni3 dai4wei2 zhao4gu5 wo3men5 de5 ke4ren2。hao3sheng1 dui4dai4 $(l.he)——xian4zai4 $(l.he) shi4 wo3men5 de5 peng2you5 le5。wo3 jiang1 zheng4shi4 kai1shi3“wan4neng2 yao4” de5 zhu4ru4 liu2cheng2。"

msgid "{{GM}}Yes{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​是​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} shi4 {{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You can feel the magic swelling around Dietrich as he stares at Audran through the glass. His tattoos seem to come alive under the force of it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Start running, pig. When I catch up to you, I'm gonna burn a hole right through that fat face of yours."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​透过​玻璃​凝视着​奥​德兰​。​你​能​感受​到​魔法​在​他​周围​逐渐​增强​。​在​他​的​纹身​似乎​在​这种​力量​的​作用​下活​了​过来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​跑​吧​，​猪猡​。​等​我​抓​到​你​的​时候​，​我要​在​你​脸上​活活​烧​出​一个​洞​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 tou4guo4 bo1li5 ning2 shi4 zhao2 Ao4de2lan2。ni3 neng2 gan3shou4 dao4 mo2fa3 zai4 ta1 zhou1wei2 zhu2jian4 zeng1qiang2。zai4 ta1 de5 wen2shen1 si4hu1 zai4 zhe4zhong3 li4liang5 de5 zuo4yong4 xia4 huo2 le5 guo4lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 pao2 ba1，zhu1luo2。deng3 wo3 zhua1 dao4 ni3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 yao4 zai4 ni3 lian3 shang4 huo2huo2 shao1 chu1 yi1ge5 dong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You can feel the magic swelling around Dietrich as he stares at Audran through the glass. His tattoos seem to come alive under the force of it.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Start running, pig. When I catch up to you, I'm gonna burn a hole right through that nasty face of yours."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​迪​特里​希​透过​玻璃​凝视着​奥​德兰​。​你​能​感受​到​魔法​在​他​周围​逐渐​增强​。​在​他​的​纹身​似乎​在​这种​力量​的​作用​下活​了​过来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​赶紧​跑​吧​，​猪猡​。​等​我​抓​到​你​的​时候​，​我要​在​你​脸上​活活​烧​出​一个​洞​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Di2te4li3xi1 tou4guo4 bo1li5 ning2 shi4 zhao2 Ao4de2lan2。ni3 neng2 gan3shou4 dao4 mo2fa3 zai4 ta1 zhou1wei2 zhu2jian4 zeng1qiang2。zai4 ta1 de5 wen2shen1 si4hu1 zai4 zhe4zhong3 li4liang5 de5 zuo4yong4 xia4 huo2 le5 guo4lai2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"gan3jin3 pao2 ba1，zhu1luo2。deng3 wo3 zhua1 dao4 ni3 de5 shi2hou5，wo3 yao4 zai4 ni3 lian3 shang4 huo2huo2 shao1 chu1 yi1ge5 dong4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You can't make heads or tails of the inner workings of the terminal. "
"Let it alone.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​无法​理解​终端​的​内部​工作​原理​。​不再​摆弄​它​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 wu2fa3 li3jie3 zhong1duan1 de5 nei4bu4 gong1zuo4 yuan2li3。bu4zai4 bai3nong4 ta1。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You can't read the guard's expression through his mirrored face mask, but his body language makes it clear that he's staring at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This door is security coded, Delta-grade. Your ID says that you're just a Theta. So no, I can't open the door."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​无法​透过​守卫​的​镜像​面罩​看清​他​的​表情​，​但​他​的​肢体​语言​清楚​地​表明​他​正​盯​着​你​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这​扇门​的​安保​密码​为​德尔塔​级​，​而​你​的​证件​上​说​你​只是​西塔​级​人员​。​所以​我​不能​给​你​开门​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 wu2fa3 tou4guo4 shou3wei4 de5 jing4xiang4 mian4zhao4 kan4qing1 ta1 de5 biao3qing2，dan4 ta1 de5 zhi1ti3 yu3yan2 qing1chu5 de5 biao3ming2 ta1 zheng1 ding1 zhao2 ni3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 shan1 men2 de5 an1bao3 mi4ma3 wei2 de2er3ta3 ji2，er2 ni3 de5 zheng4jian4 shang4 shuo1 ni3 zhi3shi4 xi1ta3 ji2 ren2yuan2。suo3yi3 wo3 bu4neng2 gei3 ni3 kai1men2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You feel the whispering again, and the look of confusion intensifies on Marta's face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I... I don't know what to do. What you say makes sense, but it feels *wrong* somehow, and I just can't... I..."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低​语声​再次​传来​，​玛​尔塔​脸上​的​困惑​神情​愈发​浓重​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​……​我​不​知道​该​怎么办​。​你​说​得​有​道理​，​但​我​总​觉得​有​哪里​*​不对劲​*​。​我​实在​……​我​……\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} di1 yu3sheng1 zai4ci4 chuan2lai2，Ma3er3ta3 lian3 shang4 de5 kun4huo4 shen2qing2 yu4fa1 nong2zhong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3……wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 gai1 zen3me5ban4。ni3 shuo1 de2 you3 dao4li5，dan4 wo3 zong3 jue2de5 you3 na3li3*bu4dui4jin4*。wo3 shi2zai4……wo3……"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You feel the whispering again. Marta shakes her head to clear away the fog.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You... you're right. Something strange is going on here... things don't add up.\n"
"\n"
"I don't know why I'd never seen it before. What is *wrong* with me?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​低​语声​再次​传来​。​玛​尔塔​摇摇头​，​驱散​脑海中​的​迷雾​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​……​你​说得对​。​这里​确实​有​古怪​……​事情​不对劲​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​不​知道​我​以前​为什么​从来​没有​察觉到​。​我​到底​*​怎么​了​*​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} di1 yu3sheng1 zai4ci4 chuan2lai2。Ma3er3ta3 yao2 yao2 tou2，qu1san4 nao3 hai3 zhong4 de5 mi2wu4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3……ni3 shuo1 de2 dui4。zhe4li3 que4shi2 you3 gu3guai4……shi4qing5 bu4dui4jin4。\n"
"\n"
"wo3 bu4 zhi1dao4 wo3 yi3qian2 wei4shen2me5 cong2lai2 mei2you3 cha2 jiao4 dao4。wo3 dao4di3*zen3me5 le5*？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You find a selection of email files from various staff members.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​发现​了​一些​来自​不同​员工​的​电子邮件​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 fa1xian4 le5 yi1xie1 lai2zi4 bu4tong2 yuan2gong1 de5 dian4zi3you2jian4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You hear a woman's voice. The sound is crisp and smooth and sweet, and it instantly puts you at ease.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"...Calm now, dear. It's probably nothing - no need to worry yourself. We're so far off the beaten track, we don't get a lot of visitors."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​听到​一个​女人​的​声音​。​那​声音​清脆​、​柔和​而​甜美​，​瞬间​令​你​放松​下来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​……​冷静​点​，​亲爱​的​。​多半​是​虚惊一场​，​不必​担心​。​我们​这​地方​偏僻​得​很​，​鲜少​有人​造访​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ting1dao4 yi1ge5 nu:3ren2 de5 sheng1yin1。na4 sheng1yin1 qing1cui4、rou2he2 er2 tian2mei3，shun4jian1 ling3 ni3 fang4song1 xia4lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"……leng3jing4 dian3，qin1ai4 de5。duo1ban4 shi4 xu1jing1yi1chang3，bu4bi4 dan1xin1。wo3men5 zhe4 di4fang1 pian1pi4 de2 hen3，xian3shao3 you3ren2 zao4fang3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You hear an electric motor come to life somewhere, then quickly fall "
"silent. The display flickers, and the number $(scene.ActiveGasArea) lights "
"up.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​听到​某个​地方​的​电动机​突然​启动​，​然后​迅速​停止​。​显示屏​闪烁​了​一下​，​数字​$(scene.ActiveGasArea)​亮​了​起来​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ting1dao4 mou3 ge4 di4fang1 de5 dian4dong4ji1 tu1ran2 qi3dong4，ran2hou4 xun4su4 ting2zhi3。xian3shi4ping2 shan3shuo4 le5 yi1xia4，shu4zi4 $(scene.ActiveGasArea) liang4 le5 qi3lai5。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You hear another boy's voice. This one is deeper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Are you certain, Marta?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​听到​另​一个男孩​的​声音​。​他​的​嗓音​更为​低沉​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​玛​尔塔​，​你​确定​吗​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ting1dao4 ling4 yi1 ge4 nan2 hai2 de5 sheng1yin1。ta1 de5 sang3yin1 geng4wei2 di1chen2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"Ma3er3ta3，ni3 que4ding4 ma5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You hear the sounds of movement, quiet footsteps on the tile. Eiger's voice comes out in a soft whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Could be nothing. Or it might mean that APEX knows we're here.\n"
"\n"
"Stay alert, people."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​听见​地砖​上​传来​轻盈​的​脚步声​。​艾格尔​低声​开口​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​可能​没什么​事​，​也​可能​是​APEX​发现​我们​了​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​保持警惕​，​各位​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ting1jian4 di4zhuan1 shang4 chuan2lai2 qing1ying2 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1。Ai4ge2er3 di1sheng1 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ke3neng2 mei2shen2me5 shi4，ye3 ke3neng2 shi4 APEX fa1xian4 wo3men5 le5。\n"
"\n"
"bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4，ge4wei4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You hear the sounds of movement, quiet footsteps on the tile. Eiger's voice comes out in a soft whisper.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Stay alert, $(l.name). This could be nothing... but it might mean that APEX knows we're here."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​听见​地砖​上​传来​轻盈​的​脚步声​。​艾格尔​低声​开口​说话​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​保持警惕​，​$(l.name)​。​可能​没什么​事​……​也​可能​是​APEX​发现​我们​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 ting1jian4 di4zhuan1 shang4 chuan2lai2 qing1ying2 de5 jiao3 bu4 sheng1。Ai4ge2er3 di1sheng1 kai1kou3 shuo1hua4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao3 chi2 jing3 ti4，$(l.name)。ke3neng2 mei2shen2me5 shi4……ye3 ke3neng2 shi4 APEX fa1xian4 wo3men5 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You notice a chipjack poking out beneath the young woman's unruly hair. The vacant look in her eyes marks her as a likely BTL junkie, lost between reality and any number of Better Than Life virtual constructs.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"I need money to get back to them."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​注意​到​年轻​女子​凌乱​的​头发​下面​露出​的​芯片​插口​。​她​茫然​的​眼神​表明​她​很​可能​是​一名​BTL​瘾君子​，​在​现实​与​无数​“​比​生活​更​美好​”​的​虚拟​幻境​之间​迷失​了​自我​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​我​需要​钱​才能​回到​他们​身边​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 zhu4yi4 dao4 nian2qing1 nu:3zi3 ling2luan4 de5 tou2fa5 xia4mian4 lu4chu1 de5 xin1pian4 cha1kou3。ta1 mang2ran2 de5 yan3shen2 biao3ming2 ta1 hen3 ke3neng2 shi4 yi1 ming2 BTL yin3jun1zi3，zai4 xian4shi2 yu4 wu2shu4“bi3 sheng1huo2 geng1 mei3hao3” de5 xu1ni3 huan4jing4 zhi1jian1 mi2shi1 le5 zi4wo3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"wo3 xu1yao4 qian2 cai2neng2 hui2dao4 ta1men5 shen1bian1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You see the tension drain out of her.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you, I'm glad this could end without bloodshed. There's been enough of that around here recently."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​看到​她​的​紧张感​消散​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​，​我​很​高兴​这件​事能​和平解决​。​最近​一段时间​里​这​附近​的​流血事件​已经​够​多​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 kan4dao4 ta1 de5 jin3 zhang1 gan3 xiao1san4 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5，wo3 hen3 gao1xing4 zhe4 jian4 shi4 neng2 he4 ping2 jie3 jue2。zui4jin4 yi1 duan4 shi2 jian1 li3 zhe4 fu4jin4 de5 liu2 xie3 shi4 jian4 yi3jing1 gou4 duo1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You step away from the doctor and wait for him to finish.\n"
"\n"
"Soon enough, he presses a button on his commlink and looks up at you, a million-dollar smile on his face.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sorry about the wait, my friend. Welcome to the Triage Cyberclinic."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​从​医生​身边​走开​，​等​他​说完​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​没​过​一会儿​，​他​按​下​通讯​链​的​一个​按钮​，​然后​看向​你​，​脸上​堆满​了​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​抱歉​让​你​久等​了​，​朋友​。​欢迎​来到​“​分诊​”​义体​诊所​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 cong2 yi1sheng1 shen1bian1 zou3kai1，deng3 ta1 shuo1 wan2。\n"
"\n"
"mei2 guo4 yi1hui4r5，ta1 an4 xia4 tong1xun4 lian4 de5 yi1ge5 an4niu3，ran2hou4 kan4 xiang4 ni3，lian3 shang4 dui1man3 le5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"bao4qian4 rang4 ni3 jiu3deng3 le5，peng2you5。huan1ying2 lai2dao4“fen4 zhen3” yi4 ti3 zhen3suo3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You turn back to see Glory smiling at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Of course. Come by any time, $(l.name)... and try not to worry so much."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​转身​看到​格洛丽​正朝​你​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​当然​，​欢迎​你​随时​来​，​$(l.name)​……​别太​担心​了​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 zhuan3shen1 kan4dao4 Ge2luo4li2 zheng1 chao2 ni3 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"dang1ran2，huan1ying2 ni3 sui2shi2 lai2，$(l.name)……bie4 tai4 dan1xin1 le5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You turn back to see Glory smiling at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Sounds like a plan. I'll see you there."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​转身​看到​格洛丽​正朝​你​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​就​这么​定​了​，​那里​见​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 zhuan3shen1 kan4dao4 Ge2luo4li2 zheng1 chao2 ni3 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 jiu4 zhe4me5 ding4 le5，na4li5 jian4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}You turn back to see Glory smiling at you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You take *good* care."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​转身​看到​格洛丽​正朝​你​微笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​一定​要​*​照顾​好​*​自己​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 zhuan3shen1 kan4dao4 Ge2luo4li2 zheng1 chao2 ni3 wei1xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"yi1ding4 yao4*zhao4gu5 hao3*zi4ji3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Your comm crackles to life.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, chief! If I did, I'd've told you!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​通讯​链有​了​动静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​怎么​会​呢​，​头儿​！​如果​是​的话​，​我​早​告诉​你​了​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 you3 le5 dong4jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zen3me5 hui4 ni2，tou2r5！ru2guo3 shi4 de5hua4，wo3 zao3 gao4su4 ni3 le5！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Your comm crackles to life.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, of course I did, chief... how could I be sure that this would get me off the hook if I didn't ask?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​通讯​链有​了​动静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​是​啊​，​头儿​……​如果​我​不问​的话​，​我​怎么​知道​这样​能​不能​让​之前​的​事​一笔勾销​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 you3 le5 dong4jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"shi4 a1，tou2r5……ru2guo3 wo3 bu4wen4 de5hua4，wo3 zen3me5 zhi1dao4 zhe4yang4 neng2 bu4neng2 rang4 zhi1qian2 de5 shi4 yi1bi3gou1xiao1？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Your commlink begins to buzz, then connects of its own accord. A cold,"
" mechanical voice begins to speak into your ear.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​通讯​链​开始​震动​，​随后​自动​连接​。​一个​冷漠​的​机械​声音​开始​在​你​耳边​响起​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 kai1shi3 zhen4dong4，sui2hou4 zi4dong4 lian2jie1。yi1ge5 leng3mo4 de5 ji1xie4 sheng1yin1 kai1shi3 zai4 ni3 er3 bian1 xiang3qi3。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Your commlink crackles to life.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hey, chief! I just cracked open a security door somewhere in your area... it might be worth checking out."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​通讯​链有​了​动静​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​嗨​，​头儿​！​我​刚刚​弄开​了​你们​附近​的​一扇​安保​门​……​也许​值得​去​看看​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 you3 le5 dong4jing4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hai1，tou2r5！wo3 gang1gang5 long4 kai1 le5 ni3men5 fu4jin4 de5 yi1 shan1 an1bao3 men2……ye3xu3 zhi2de5 qu4 kan4kan5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Your commlink crackles with static. A moment later, the sonorous voice of Luca Duerr begins speaking into your ear.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Hello again, $(l.name). I have an opportunity for you."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​通讯​链里​传来​噼啪​的​杂音​。​片刻​后​，​卢卡​·​杜尔​浑厚​的​声音​开始​在​你​耳边​响起​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​$(l.name)​，​又​见面​了​。​我​有​个​好​差事​要​交给​你​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 li3 chuan2lai2 pi1pa1 de5 za2yin1。pian4ke4 hou4，lu2ka3 · du4 er3 hun2hou4 de5 sheng1yin1 kai1shi3 zai4 ni3 er3 bian1 xiang3qi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"$(l.name)，you4 jian4mian4 le5。wo3 you3 ge4 hao3 cha4shi4 yao4 jiao1gei3 ni3。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Your commlink crackles, and Blitz whispers into your ear.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"This is bullshit, chief. By all rights, that box should be ours... this was *our* run."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​通讯​链有​了​动静​。​布里​茨​的​声音​响​了​起来​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这太​扯淡​了​，​头儿​。​不管怎么​说​，​那​东西​都​应该​是​我们​的​……​这​可是​*​我们​的​*​差事​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 you3 le5 dong4jing4。Bu4li3ci2 de5 sheng1yin1 xiang3 le5 qi3lai5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4 tai4 che3dan4 le5，tou2r5。bu4 guan3 zen3 ma2 shuo1，na4 dong1xi1 dou1 ying1gai1 shi4 wo3men5 de5……zhe4 ke3shi4*wo3men5 de5*cha4shi4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Your commlink crackles. Blitz exhales heavily.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Two things, chief."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​你​的​通讯​链有​了​动静​。​布里​茨​大口​喘​着​气​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​两句话​，​头儿​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ni3 de5 tong1xun4 lian4 you3 le5 dong4jing4。Bu4li3ci2 da4kou3 chuan3 zhao2 qi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"liang3 ju4 hua4，tou2r5。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak bows down with a flourish.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Thank you, friend. Thank you.\n"
"\n"
"So, what can ol' Zaak getcha?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​满面春风​地​鞠躬​致意​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​谢谢​你​，​朋友​。​万分​感谢​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​所以​，​老​扎克​能​为​你​做点​什么​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 man3mian4chun1feng1 de5 ju1gong1 zhi4yi4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"xie4xie5 ni3，peng2you5。wan4fen1 gan3xie4。\n"
"\n"
"suo3yi3，lao3 Zha1ke4 neng2 wei2 ni3 zuo4 dian3 shen2me5？"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak cocks his head and offers you a lopsided grin.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Well, then, I might be able to help you.\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He begins to twist a strand of his long, stringy hair around one of his spidery fingers. His smile remains fixed, a pearly crescent set into a face caked with grime.{{/GM}}"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​扭过头来​，​向​你​露出​一个​歪歪扭扭​的​笑容​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​那​我​也许​就​能​帮到​你​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​开始​用​灵活​的​手指​捻起​一​绺​凌乱​的​长发​。​他​的​笑容​始终如一​，​像​珍珠​般的​月牙​镶嵌​在​布满​污垢​的​脸上​。​{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 niu3 guo4 tou2 lai2，xiang4 ni3 lu4chu1 yi1ge5 wai1wai1niu3niu3 de5 xiao4rong2。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"na4 wo3 ye3xu3 jiu4 neng2 bang1 dao4 ni3。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 kai1shi3 yong4 ling2huo2 de5 shou3zhi3 nian3 qi3 yi1 liu3 ling2luan4 de5 chang2fa4。ta1 de5 xiao4rong2 shi3zhong1ru2yi1，xiang4 zhen1zhu1 ban1 de5 yue4ya2 xiang1qian4 zai4 bu4man3 wu1gou4 de5 lian3 shang4。{{/GM}}"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak lets out a short, barking laugh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, come on! Stop denying yourself! \n"
"\n"
"Embrace the power inside of you! You've got the mojo, just like me! Accept it!"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​发出​一阵​短促​的​狂笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​得了吧​！​别​再​否定​自己​了​！​\n"
"​\n"
"​拥抱​你​内心​的​力量​！​你​有​魔力​，​就​像​我​一样​！​接受​它​吧​！\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 fa1chu1 yi1zhen4 duan3cu4 de5 kuang2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"de2 le5 ba1！bie4 zai4 fou3ding4 zi4ji3 le5！\n"
"\n"
"yong1bao4 ni3 nei4xin1 de5 li4liang5！ni3 you3 mo2li4，jiu4 xiang4 wo3 yi1yang4！jie1shou4 ta1 ba1！"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak lets out a throaty, barking laugh.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Street mage? Me? Do I look like a street mage to you?\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}He shakes his head, but his smile doesn't waver. He fishes a small bag of pills out of his back pocket and dangles it before your eyes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"No, chummer, I'm not a \"street mage.\" I've got the magic in my blood and the magic in these bags, but you won't catch ol' Zaak studying any spellbooks."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​从​喉咙​里​发出​一声​狂笑​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​街头​法师​？​我​看起来​像​街头​法师​吗​？​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​他​摇摇头​，​但​笑容​不改​。​他​从​后​口袋​里​掏出​一​小袋​药丸​，​在​你​眼前​晃​了​晃​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​亲​，​我​可不是​什么​“​街头​法师​”​。​我​的​血液​里​有​魔法​，​这些​袋子​里​也​有​魔法​，​但​你​可​抓​不到​老​扎克​在​研究​魔法书​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 cong2 hou2long2 li3 fa1chu1 yi1sheng1 kuang2xiao4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"jie1tou2 fa3shi1？wo3 kan4qi3lai5 xiang4 jie1tou2 fa3shi1 ma5？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 yao2 yao2 tou2，dan4 xiao4rong2 bu4 gai3。ta1 cong2 hou4 kou3dai4 li3 tao1chu1 yi1 xiao3dai4 yao4wan2，zai4 ni3 yan3qian2 huang3 le5 huang3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"qin1，wo3 ke3bu5shi4 shen2me5“jie1tou2 fa3shi1”。wo3 de5 xue4ye4 li3 you3 mo2fa3，zhe4xie1 dai4zi5 li3 ye3 you3 mo2fa3，dan4 ni3 ke3 zhua1 bu4dao4 lao3 Zha1ke4 zai4 yan2jiu1 mo2 fa3 shu1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak offers you a broad, exaggerated wave.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Later on there, chum of mine."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​向​你​夸张​地​挥挥手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​回头见​，​亲​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 xiang4 ni3 kua1zhang1 de5 hui1 hui1 shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui2tou2jian4，qin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak shrugs, then slowly raises his right hand and waggles his fingers.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Toodles."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​耸耸肩​，​然后​慢慢​举起​右手​，​摆​了​摆​手指​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​回见​了​您​呐​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 song3 song3 jian1，ran2hou4 man4man4 ju3qi3 you4shou3，bai3 le5 bai3 shou3zhi3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"hui2jian4 le5 nin2 na4。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak snorts out a short burst of laughter. He waggles his bandaged hands in front of you.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Oh, these? Nothin' much, chummer, nothin' much. Tussled with a spirit back in Amsterdam. Y'know, we elves are a very spiritual people."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​发出​一阵​短促​的​笑声​。​他​在​你​面前​晃动​着​缠​满​绷带​的​双手​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​这些​吗​？​没什么​的​，​亲​。​在​阿姆斯特丹​和​一个​精魂​干​了​一次​。​你​懂​的​，​我们​精灵​是​很​有​灵性​的​种族​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 fa1chu1 yi1zhen4 duan3cu4 de5 xiao4sheng1。ta1 zai4 ni3 mian4qian2 huang4dong4 zhao2 chan2 man3 beng1dai4 de5 shuang1shou3。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zhe4xie1 ma5？mei2shen2me5 de5，qin1。zai4 a1mu3si1te4dan1 he4 yi1ge5 jing1hun2 gan4 le5 yi1ci4。ni3 dong3 de5，wo3men5 jing1ling2 shi4 hen3 you3 ling2xing4 de5 zhong3zu2。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak's bug eyes light up with excitement.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You heard right! Damn right, chummer."
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​的​大​眼睛​里​充满​了​激动​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​没错​！​就是​这么回事​，​亲​。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 de5 dai4 yan3jing5 li3 chong1man3 le5 ji1dong4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"mei2cuo4！jiu4shi4 zhe4 ma2 hui2 shi4，qin1。"

msgid ""
"{{GM}}Zaak's smile vanishes.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"You're calling me a liar? To my face?"
msgstr ""
"{{GM}}​扎克​的​笑容​消失​了​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​你​当着​我​的​面​说​我​是​骗子​？\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} Zha1ke4 de5 xiao4rong2 xiao1shi1 le5。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"ni3 dang1zhe5 wo3 de5 mian4 shuo1 wo3 shi4 pian4zi5？"

