msgid ""
"“Good” is a children’s term in a world without connections. Without nuance. \n"
"\n"
"{{GM}}Her expression slackens, becomes dreamy.{{/GM}}\n"
"\n"
"Before the next cycle’s end, the Feuerschwinge Wyrm will speak again with the voice of the Maiden. The Dancer will spin, the Seal will melt, and the Calm Lake will burn."
msgstr ""
"“​好​”​是​孩童​才​会​使用​的​字眼​。​他们​的​世界​没有​关联​，​也​没有​差别​。​\n"
"​\n"
"​{{GM}}​她​的​表情​松弛下来​，​变得​恍惚​不定​。​{{/GM}}​\n"
"​\n"
"​在​下个​循环​终结​之前​，​巨龙​火翼​将​会​用​少女​的​声音​再次​发话​。​舞者​将会​起舞​、​封印​将会​融化​、​静湖​将​会​燃烧​。\n"
"\n"
"“hao3” shi4 hai2tong2 cai2 hui4 shi3yong4 de5 zi4yan3。ta1men5 de5 shi4jie4 mei2you3 guan1lian2，ye3 mei2you3 cha1bie2。\n"
"\n"
"{{GM}} ta1 de5 biao3qing2 song1 chi2 xia4 lai2，bian4de5 huang3hu1 bu4ding4。{{/GM}} \n"
"\n"
"zai4 xia4ge5 xun2huan2 zhong1jie2 zhi1qian2，ju4long2 Huo3yi4 jiang1 hui4 yong4 shao4nu:3 de5 sheng1yin1 zai4ci4 fa1 hua4。wu3zhe3 jiang1hui4 qi3 wu3、feng1yin4 jiang1hui4 rong2hua4、jing4 hu2 jiang1 hui4 ran2shao1。"

msgid "…She has no choice."
msgstr ""
"……​她​没得选​。\n"
"……ta1 mei2 de2 xuan3。"
